window.BST_BROWSER_DATA={"format":"mao-bst-steam-script-browser-data-v1","sourceAuthority":"Steam Build 13300478","release":"v1.2.1","rowCount":29753,"scenarioCount":63,"speakerRows":5995,"scenarios":[{"position":1,"code":"X1","unitId":"x1","rows":[{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r1","rowIndex":1,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<speed=0.01>――この物語を、私の愛しき人々、憎らしき人々、そして、今は亡き全ての人々に捧げる。</speed>","en":"<speed=0.01>—I dedicate this story to those I loved, those I hated, and all those now dead.</speed>","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r2","rowIndex":2,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　いつからだろうか？","en":"When had it begun?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r3","rowIndex":3,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　空を見上げればいつもどんより曇った灰色が覆い、今日のようにすっきりと晴れ渡った青空が珍しくなってしまったのは。","en":"Whenever I looked skyward, the same dreary gray covered everything; blue skies as clear and open as today’s had become a rarity.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r4","rowIndex":4,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　太陽光線とオゾンが作り出す、沁み入るようなブルーの下、チャペルの尖った天井にかかげられた十字架が輝き、足元に青々と茂った高麗芝の弾力が踏むたびにみずみずしい感触を足の裏に残す。","en":"Under that deep, penetrating blue, wrought by sunlight and ozone, the cross atop the chapel’s peaked roof shone. Beneath it, the lush Korean grass gave softly with every step, leaving a fresh sensation against the soles of one’s feet.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r5","rowIndex":5,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　白いクロスのかけられたテーブルには、<ruby=子豚の丸焼き>金猪耀紅袍</ruby>、<ruby=えびと野菜のＸＯ醤炒め>金醤碧綠炒鳳尾蝦</ruby>、<ruby=蟹卵入りフカヒレスープ>蟹黄魚翅湯</ruby>、エトセトラ、エトセトラ。色とりどりの高級中華料理が所狭しと並べられ、白衣のスタッフが額に汗を浮かべながら礼服の紳士淑女の小皿に取り分けている。","en":"The tables, draped in white, were laden with dish after dish: Golden Pig in a Shining Red Robe—a whole roast suckling pig; Phoenix-Tail Prawns with Jade Greens in Golden XO Sauce—prawns and vegetables stir-fried in XO sauce; and Crab-Roe Shark-Fin Broth—a shark-fin soup with crab roe; et cetera, et cetera. Fine Chinese dishes in every color crowded the tables, while white-coated staff, sweat beading on their brows, portioned them onto small plates for the ladies and gentlemen in formal dress.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r6","rowIndex":6,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そこでは結婚披露宴が行われていた。","en":"A wedding reception was under way.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r7","rowIndex":7,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　この希有な天候に祝福された幸福な花嫁は、純白のドレスに身を包み、膨らみが目立ち始めた腹をさすりながら、ついさっき永遠の誓いを交わしたばかりの新郎と共に、来客たちにあいさつをしている。","en":"Blessed by this rare weather, the happy bride was dressed in pure white. Stroking the curve of a belly that had begun to show, she greeted the guests beside the groom with whom she had exchanged vows of eternal love only moments before.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r8","rowIndex":8,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　はちきれんばかりの笑顔を浮かべて。","en":"With a smile fit to burst.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r9","rowIndex":9,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　これから繰り広げられるのは血と暴力で彩られた物語であるが、筆者はどうしてもこの平和な披露宴の、この満ち足りた花嫁の笑顔から、稿を始めたかった。","en":"The story about to unfold is painted in blood and violence. Even so, the author was determined to begin this account here: at this peaceful reception, with the bride’s smile so full of contentment.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r10","rowIndex":10,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ああ！　こんな日が本当に来るだなんて！　……どうも、まだ納得がいかないような気がするよ」","en":"“Ah! To think this day has really come! ... Somehow, I still can’t seem to accept it.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬明","displayName":"Ma Ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r11","rowIndex":11,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　毛のなくなった頭のてっぺんまでアルコールで赤く染めたこの巨漢の紳士は、花嫁の父親である<ruby=マー・ミン><tips=4>馬明</tips></ruby>その人だった。","en":"The enormous gentleman, flushed with drink all the way to the top of his bald head, was none other than the bride’s father, <tips=4>Ma Ming</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r12","rowIndex":12,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「もう、ここまで来て何言ってるの」","en":"“Oh, come on. How can you still say that after we’ve come this far?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬美美","displayName":"Ma Meimei","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r13","rowIndex":13,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　娘が幸福感にあふれた苦笑をし、彼は苦い顔をする。","en":"His daughter gave a wry smile brimming with happiness, and he made a sour face.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r14","rowIndex":14,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そりゃ、言うさ。いや言わせてくれなきゃ困る。咳を一つすれば風邪かと大騒ぎをし、小さな擦り傷一つ作れば痕が残らぬだろうかと心配し、大事に大事に育ててきた愛娘が、こんなつまらん男に引っかかってしまうなんて！」","en":"“Of course I’m going to say it. You’ve got to let me have my say! One cough, and I’d make a huge fuss thinking she had a cold; one little scrape, and I’d worry it might leave a scar. I raised my precious girl so carefully, so very carefully—and now she’s gone and fallen for a worthless man like this!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬明","displayName":"Ma Ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r15","rowIndex":15,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　娘と話すときは広東語を使う。","en":"When speaking with his daughter, he used Cantonese.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r16","rowIndex":16,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼はこの街では一般的には香港出身者として知られていたが、生まれは広東省の田舎町であるらしい。","en":"In this city, he was generally known as a Hong Konger, though he had apparently been born in a country town in Guangdong Province.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r17","rowIndex":17,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　といっても、<tips=4>馬明</tips>本人からしても記憶も定かではない幼い頃の話であるから、どちらでもいいことだ。","en":"Then again, even <tips=4>Ma Ming</tips> himself could barely remember those early years, so the distinction hardly mattered.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r18","rowIndex":18,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そんなひどい言い方しなくたっていいじゃない」","en":"“You don’t have to say it so cruelly!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬美美","displayName":"Ma Meimei","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r19","rowIndex":19,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　娘は不快げに顔を顰め、隣の新郎はこわばった顔に冷や汗を浮かべている。","en":"His daughter frowned in displeasure, while the groom beside her wore a rigid expression, cold sweat beading on his face.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r20","rowIndex":20,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そんなこと言うなら、もうお父さんのことなんか知りませんからね！」","en":"“If you’re going to talk like that, I’m not speaking to you anymore, Dad!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬美美","displayName":"Ma Meimei","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r21","rowIndex":21,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「わかった。わかった」","en":"“All right, all right.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬明","displayName":"Ma Ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r22","rowIndex":22,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　娘の剣幕に彼は肩をすくめると、","en":"He shrugged in the face of his daughter’s fury, then said,","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r23","rowIndex":23,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「おれも男だ。愚痴るのはもうこれでおわりだ！　これからは祖父として、新しく生まれてくる孫をかわいがることにしよう」","en":"“I’ll be a man about it. No more grumbling! From now on, I’ll be a grandfather and dote on the grandchild we’ve got coming.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬明","displayName":"Ma Ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r24","rowIndex":24,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　でっぷりと太り情けない表情をしている彼の正体は、泣く子も黙るギャング組織『<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>』の最高幹部であった。","en":"Despite his great bulk and woebegone expression, he was a top-ranking officer of the dreaded criminal organization <tips=7>YS</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r25","rowIndex":25,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その顔の傷や、盛りあがった肩の筋肉を見れば、武闘派として恐れられていた若かりし日の姿を思い浮かべることも出来るだろう。","en":"His facial scars and the muscles bulging across his shoulders still offered a glimpse of his younger self, once feared for his violence.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r26","rowIndex":26,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>という名は、そのまま「ワイエス」と読ませたり、「イーシェン」と中国風に読んだりする。","en":"The name <tips=7>YS</tips> was pronounced either as the English letters—“Why-Ess”—or in the Chinese fashion, “Yisheng.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r27","rowIndex":27,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　何か事件を起こしてニュースになるなど、地域外の人々が呼ぶ時は「ワイエス」の方が使われるため、そちらが正式名称と思われがちだが、地域の人間や組織内の人間が「イーシェン」としか呼ばないのを思うと、こちらを正しい呼称とすべきなのだろう。","en":"When people from outside the district refer to it—for instance, when an incident lands it in the news—they use “Why-Ess,” which is therefore often mistaken for the official name. But locals and members of the organization itself call it only “Yisheng,” so perhaps that should be considered the proper pronunciation.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r28","rowIndex":28,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　このような読み方をさせるのには、この街特有のいきさつがある。","en":"The existence of these two readings is a product of this city’s peculiar history.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r29","rowIndex":29,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　今から何十年も時代を遡った香港返還時のことである。","en":"The story goes back several decades, to the Handover of Hong Kong.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r30","rowIndex":30,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　イギリス領であった香港には、その複雑な政治事情の隙間に数多くのギャング組織が存在していたのだが、中国に返還され大陸の法律が適用されると、活動を制限され、生き残りをかけて別の地へ活動の場を移す組織がいくつかあった。","en":"As a British territory, Hong Kong had harbored numerous gangs in the cracks of its complicated political situation. Once the territory was returned to China and mainland law came into force, however, their activities were curtailed, and several moved their operations elsewhere in a bid to survive.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r31","rowIndex":31,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　当時香港で有数の巨大組織であった「<tips=69>義勝</tips>」も、そのゴタゴタによって壊滅的なダメージを受け、その残党がはるばる海を渡って、この街を根城にした。","en":"<tips=69>Yisheng</tips>, then one of Hong Kong’s largest organizations, suffered a devastating blow in the turmoil. Its remnants crossed the sea and made this city their stronghold.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r32","rowIndex":32,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　このグループが「<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>」の前身だという。","en":"That group is said to have been the precursor of <tips=7>YS</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r33","rowIndex":33,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　「<tips=69>義勝</tips>」は、広東語で「イーシェン」と読み、あとになって香港人だけでなく様々な言語を使う人々を吸収するに従い、アルファベットを当てて「<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>」と表記するようになったのだ。","en":"<tips=69>Yisheng</tips> is the Cantonese reading of its Chinese name. Later, as the group absorbed not only Hong Kongers but speakers of various languages, it adopted the Latin letters <tips=7>YS</tips> as its written name.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r34","rowIndex":34,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　この時文字だけを見た人間が「ワイエス」と呼び、そちらの読み方も生まれた。","en":"People who saw only the letters read them as “Why-Ess,” giving rise to the second pronunciation.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r35","rowIndex":35,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　これが複数の呼称が存在する理由だ。","en":"That is why the organization has more than one pronunciation.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r36","rowIndex":36,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しかし、彼らが本当に香港の「<tips=69>義勝</tips>」と繋がりがあるかどうかについては、疑う声もある。","en":"Some, however, doubt that the group truly has any connection to Hong Kong’s <tips=69>Yisheng</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r37","rowIndex":37,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　この街には海外から素性の知らない若者たちが数多くやって来ていた。","en":"Large numbers of young people of unknown background had come to this city from abroad.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r38","rowIndex":38,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼らは出身地ごとにグループを作り、お互い争っていたのだが、そこで少しでも優位に立つために、香港出身者のグループが勝手に「<tips=69>義勝</tips>」の名声を借りるべくその名を借用したのではないかという説がある。","en":"They formed groups according to their places of origin and fought one another. One theory holds that, to gain even the slightest advantage, the Hong Kong group simply appropriated the prestigious name <tips=69>Yisheng</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r39","rowIndex":39,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　実際香港の「<tips=69>義勝</tips>」から生まれた組織は世界の各地に存在するのだが、この街の「<tips=69>義勝</tips>」は、そのいずれとも明確な関係性を見つけ出すことが出来ない。","en":"Organizations descended from the Hong Kong <tips=69>Yisheng</tips> do exist throughout the world, but no clear connection has been found between the city’s <tips=69>Yisheng</tips> and any of them.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r40","rowIndex":40,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　真相は定かではないが、どんな素性であったとしても、初めは数人しかいなかった「<tips=69>義勝</tips>」と名乗る小さな組織が、二世である<tips=4>馬明</tips>たちの世代になって「<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>」という地域最大の組織になったことは間違いがなく、そして力があるということは、誰も疑念を向けることなど出来ないということだ。","en":"The truth is uncertain. Whatever its origins, however, one fact is beyond dispute: the tiny organization that began with only a handful of people calling themselves <tips=69>Yisheng</tips> had, by the second generation—that of <tips=4>Ma Ming</tips> and his peers—grown into <tips=7>YS</tips>, the largest organization in the district. And to possess power is to place oneself beyond question.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r41","rowIndex":41,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　さて、そういうわけで<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>はこの街では何よりも力がある組織であった。","en":"And so <tips=7>YS</tips> was the most powerful organization in the city.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r42","rowIndex":42,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>で大幹部をつとめる<tips=4>馬明</tips>の娘の結婚式となれば、当然、礼服の参列者にも組織の大物たちが混じっている。","en":"At the wedding of the daughter of <tips=4>Ma Ming</tips>, one of <tips=7>YS’s</tips> senior officers, it was only natural that the formally dressed guests should include some of the organization’s leading figures.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r43","rowIndex":43,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　例えば、端の方で料理に手をつけることもなく黙々と一人酒を飲んでいる褐色の肌をした初老の紳士は、ブラジル系移民のリーダー<tips=35>ジョゼ・フェルナンデス</tips>であったし、中央のテーブルを東洋人ばかりで占領して仲間内だけで談笑しているのは客家系華僑たちのリーダー<ruby=リャオ・チミン><tips=27>廖志明</tips></ruby>と、その部下たちである。","en":"For instance, the older, dark-skinned gentleman drinking alone in silence at the edge of the reception, without touching the food, was <tips=35>José Fernandes</tips>, leader of the Brazilian immigrant community. The group of Asian men who had commandeered a central table and were chatting and laughing among themselves, meanwhile, were <tips=27>Liao Chi-ming</tips>, leader of the Hakka Chinese community, and his men.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r44","rowIndex":44,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼らとは少し離れた場所で、すぱすぱと煙草をふかし、仲間とニヤニヤ笑いながら語らっている白人の男性は、<tips=27>廖</tips>のボディーガードの<tips=23>エリオット</tips>。<tips=17>タイプB</tips>で、凄腕の殺し屋だと評判の男だ。","en":"A little way apart from them, a white man smoked cigarette after cigarette, grinning as he chatted with his companions. This was <tips=23>Elliott</tips>, bodyguard to <tips=27>Liao</tips>: a <tips=17>Type B</tips> reputed to be a formidable killer.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r45","rowIndex":45,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その他、名前のある人物だけを数え上げたとしてもキリがない。","en":"One could go on forever merely listing the people of note in attendance.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r46","rowIndex":46,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>内外の名だたるボスが集合しており、例えば<tips=57>滑走路通り</tips>のクリーニング店にワイシャツを出し、その隣の料理店で香辛料の効いたどこの国の料理かわからない食事をとり、裏通りに足を踏み入れてカジノで遊んだ後、儲けた金で女を買う、というような行動をしたとして、利用したすべての施設のボスがここにいるメンバーの誰かであった、なんてことも充分にあり得るほどだ。","en":"The leading bosses from within and outside <tips=7>YS</tips> were all assembled here. You might leave a dress shirt at the cleaner’s on <tips=57>Runway Street</tips>, eat some heavily spiced dish of indeterminate nationality at the restaurant next door, then turn down a back street to gamble at a casino and use your winnings to buy yourself a woman—and find that the boss of every establishment you had visited was among the people gathered here.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r47","rowIndex":47,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　街の支配層の全てがここに集結していると言っても過言ではない。","en":"It would be no exaggeration to say that the city’s entire ruling class was gathered here.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r48","rowIndex":48,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして、こうした数多くの有名ギャングたちのなかでも飛び抜けて強大な力を持っているのが、会場の奥に居る車椅子の人物であった。","en":"Yet even among these many prominent gangsters, one figure possessed power that dwarfed all the rest: the person in the wheelchair at the back of the reception.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r49","rowIndex":49,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼は黒い帽子を目深に被っていたが、その下の顔は無惨に皮膚が破れ、赤黒いかさぶたがいくつも張り付いている。","en":"He wore a black hat pulled low, but beneath it the skin of his face was hideously torn, with dark red scabs clinging here and there.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r50","rowIndex":50,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　明らかに何かの疾患に冒されている様子だが、彼はその自分の姿を気にするそぶりも見せず、周りに集まる人々とにこやかに談笑をしていた。","en":"He plainly appeared to be suffering from some illness. Yet he showed no concern for his appearance, smiling and conversing amiably with the people gathered around him.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r51","rowIndex":51,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ツェーおじさん！」","en":"“Uncle Tse!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬美美","displayName":"Ma Meimei","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r52","rowIndex":52,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　父親との痴話げんかを終えた花嫁がその人物に向かって声をかけると、彼は手をあげて目の前の人間との会話を打ち切り、","en":"Her squabble with her father concluded, the bride called out to the man. He raised a hand, cutting short the conversation he had been having, then said,","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r53","rowIndex":53,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「おお、今日の主役じゃないか」","en":"“Oh, if it isn’t the star of the day.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー","displayName":"Chris Tse","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r54","rowIndex":54,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しわがれた声でいった。","en":"He spoke in a hoarse voice.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r55","rowIndex":55,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして花嫁の顔をじっと見つめると、","en":"Then, fixing his gaze on the bride’s face,","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r56","rowIndex":56,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いやあ随分綺麗になったもんだ。見違えたよ。本当にあのブサイクな父親に似なくて良かった。……おや、そっちの若者がご主人だな？　いやあ、はじめましてどうも。おれが<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>だ。<tips=4>馬明</tips>とは古いつき合いでね。あんたの花嫁のことは生まれた時から知っている」","en":"“Well, look how beautiful you’ve gotten. I hardly recognized you. Good thing you didn’t take after that ugly father of yours. ... Oh, this young fellow must be your husband, huh? Well, good to meet you. I’m <tips=3>Chris Tse</tips>. <tips=4>Ma Ming</tips> and I go way back. I’ve known your bride since the day she was born.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー","displayName":"Chris Tse","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r57","rowIndex":57,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「は、は、はじめまして。<ruby=ロンタオ><tips=81>龍頭</tips></ruby>さま……。お名前は、かねがねうかがっております」","en":"“P-p-pleased to meet you, Lord <tips=81>Longtou</tips>... I’ve heard so much about you.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r58","rowIndex":58,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　花婿は緊張で裏返りそうな声でそう答えた。","en":"The groom answered in a voice on the verge of cracking with nerves.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r59","rowIndex":59,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「上手な広東語だが日本語訛りがあるな。日本人か？」","en":"“Your Cantonese is good, but I hear a Japanese accent. Are you Japanese?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー","displayName":"Chris Tse","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r60","rowIndex":60,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そ、そのとおりです」","en":"“Th-that’s right, sir.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r61","rowIndex":61,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　こわばりきった花婿とは対照的に、<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>と名乗った男はゆったりとした笑みを口元に浮かべながら、","en":"In contrast to the utterly rigid groom, the man who had introduced himself as <tips=3>Chris Tse</tips> wore an easy smile as he said,","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r62","rowIndex":62,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうか。しかし、いやあ、男前じゃねえか。しかも泣く子も黙る<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>の<tips=85><ruby=イーローユンシー>二路元帥</ruby></tips>の娘を、こっそり盗んではらませたと言うんだから度胸もある」","en":"“I see. Well, now—you’re a handsome fellow, aren’t you? And you’ve got nerve, secretly stealing away the daughter of <tips=7>YS’s</tips> dreaded <tips=85>Second Route Marshal</tips> and getting her pregnant.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー","displayName":"Chris Tse","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r63","rowIndex":63,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あ、あ、ありがとうございます！」","en":"“Th-th-thank you very much!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r64","rowIndex":64,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「褒められてるわけじゃないぞ」","en":"“That wasn’t a compliment.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r65","rowIndex":65,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　後ろで娘を妊娠させられた父親である<tips=4>馬明</tips>が苦い顔で呟くと、花婿は顔を真っ赤にする。","en":"Behind them, <tips=4>Ma Ming</tips>—the father whose daughter had been impregnated—muttered sourly, and the groom’s face turned scarlet.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r66","rowIndex":66,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「皮肉で言ってるわけじゃないさ。実際褒めてるんだよ。若者はこうでなくちゃいけない」","en":"“I’m not being sarcastic. I really am complimenting you. That’s how a young man ought to be.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー","displayName":"Chris Tse","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r67","rowIndex":67,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　男はそう言って、乾いた声で笑うと、すぐに咳き込んだ。","en":"The man said this with a dry laugh, then immediately began to cough.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r68","rowIndex":68,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=81>龍頭</tips>に薬を」","en":"“Bring the <tips=81>Longtou</tips> his medicine.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r69","rowIndex":69,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　男のすぐ脇に立っていたやせぎすの男が、傍らの従者にそう命じる。","en":"The lean man standing immediately beside him gave the order to one of the attendants nearby.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r70","rowIndex":70,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いや、いいんだよ。必要ない」","en":"“No, it’s fine. I don’t need it.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー","displayName":"Chris Tse","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r71","rowIndex":71,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　手を振って、立ち去ろうとする従者を引き留める。","en":"He waved the departing attendant back.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r72","rowIndex":72,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「しかし」","en":"“But, sir—”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r73","rowIndex":73,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あの薬は好きじゃないんだよ」","en":"“I don’t like that medicine.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー","displayName":"Chris Tse","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r74","rowIndex":74,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　苦く呟くその顔は青ざめている。","en":"He muttered bitterly, his face deathly pale.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r75","rowIndex":75,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　この男が名乗った「<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>」という名は、香港風に英語名が混じったもので、中国名は「<ruby=ツェー・タイフェイ>謝大輝</ruby>」という。","en":"The name the man had given—<tips=3>Chris Tse</tips>—followed Hong Kong custom in combining an English given name with a Chinese surname. His Chinese name was Tse Tai-fai.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r76","rowIndex":76,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　正式な書類に名を書くときは、こちらの中国名が使われるのだろうが、この稿では<tips=3>クリス</tips>と呼ぶ。","en":"That Chinese name was presumably the one he used on official documents, but in this account we shall call him <tips=3>Chris</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r77","rowIndex":77,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　この<tips=3>クリス</tips>という男こそが<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>の頂点に立つ人物であった。","en":"This <tips=3>Chris</tips> was the man at the very top of <tips=7>YS</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r78","rowIndex":78,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼はこの<tips=9>Y地区</tips>では比類なき英雄である。長らくこの街では複数の移民組織が小競り合いを繰り返していたのを、彼がリーダーとなった<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>が初めて統一したのだ。","en":"Within <tips=9>Y District</tips>, he was a hero without equal. For years, several immigrant organizations had fought one petty skirmish after another. <tips=7>YS</tips>, under his leadership, was the first to unite them.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r79","rowIndex":79,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　移民と犯罪者ばかりのこの街で、彼の影響力は極めて大きい。","en":"In this city of immigrants and criminals, his influence was immense.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r80","rowIndex":80,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼の発想はすぐに形となって住民の生活に影響を与え、彼らを喜ばせ、或いは苦しめる。この街では市長や知事といった制度上の権力者の力がほとんど及ばず、彼一人にのみ王と呼ぶべき権力が与えられていた。","en":"His ideas swiftly took form and affected the residents’ lives, bringing them joy—or misery. Institutional authorities such as mayors and governors held almost no sway in this city. He alone possessed power fit for a king.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r81","rowIndex":81,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しかし、未だ四十代の若き犯罪王は、病に冒され、いまや自分の力で立ち上がることさえ出来ぬほどに衰弱していた。","en":"But the young crime king, still only in his forties, had been ravaged by illness and was now so weak he could not even stand up under his own power.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r82","rowIndex":82,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　今も笑って何事もないように振る舞おうとはしているが、やはり衰えは隠しきれず、力なく咳込んでいる。","en":"Even now he tried to smile and carry on as though nothing were wrong, but he could not hide his decline; he coughed feebly.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r83","rowIndex":83,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ただ、このように衰えていても依然としてこの街のナンバーワンであることは変わらなかった。","en":"Yet even in his present decline, he remained this city’s undisputed number one.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r84","rowIndex":84,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　およそ<tips=9>Y地区</tips>に住む者で、彼を恐れぬものはいないだろう。","en":"There was scarcely a soul in <tips=9>Y District</tips> who did not fear him.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r85","rowIndex":85,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ほとんどの者は、実際その目の前に立てば、この花婿のように冷や汗をかきながら硬直した愛想笑いを顔に貼り付けることしか出来なくなるはずだ。","en":"Most people, if they actually stood before him, would surely be reduced to plastering on the same stiff, ingratiating smile as the groom while cold sweat beaded on their skin.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r86","rowIndex":86,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ただ、その魔法のような威圧感も身内の前では大分減じるようである。","en":"Yet even that almost magical aura of intimidation seemed to diminish considerably among his own.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r87","rowIndex":87,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ツェーおじさん、わがままを言ったら駄目ですよ。嫌いだから飲まないだなんて子供じゃないんですから。それで具合を悪くされてはみんな困ってしまいます。大体おじさんは……」","en":"“Uncle Tse, you mustn’t be so stubborn. Refusing to take it just because you don’t like it is childish. If that makes you worse, you’ll only make everyone worry. Besides, you always...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬美美","displayName":"Ma Meimei","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r88","rowIndex":88,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　花嫁の言葉を、<tips=3>クリス</tips>はほんの少し手を上げてやめさせると、","en":"With the slightest lift of one hand, <tips=3>Chris</tips> cut the bride off and said,","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r89","rowIndex":89,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ふん、わかったよ。うるさくてかなわん。おい、若いの。悪いが、やっぱり水と薬を持って来てくれないか？」","en":"“Hmph, all right. I can’t take all this nagging. Hey, kid—sorry, but bring me that water and medicine after all, would you?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー","displayName":"Chris Tse","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r90","rowIndex":90,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　笑いながら、従者に声をかけて呼び戻す。","en":"Laughing, he called the attendant back.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r91","rowIndex":91,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まったく……」","en":"“Honestly...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ジェフリー・ウォン","displayName":"Jeffrey Wong","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r92","rowIndex":92,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　傍らで溜息をついたそのやせぎすの男の名前は<tips=39>ジェフリー・ウォン</tips>。","en":"The lean man who sighed beside him was <tips=39>Jeffrey Wong</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r93","rowIndex":93,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　中国名は「<ruby=ウォン・シューヤン>黄樹人</ruby>」と書く。彼もまた<tips=4>馬明</tips>と同格の幹部であり、<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>では重きを成す存在である。","en":"His Chinese name was Wong Shu-yan. He too was an officer of the same rank as <tips=4>Ma Ming</tips>, and a figure of great importance within <tips=7>YS</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r94","rowIndex":94,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　この、<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>、<tips=4>馬明</tips>、<tips=39>ジェフリー・ウォン</tips>の三人が、<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>の主流である香港グループのトップであり、そして彼らは子供の頃からの幼なじみでもあった。","en":"<tips=3>Chris Tse</tips>, <tips=4>Ma Ming</tips>, and <tips=39>Jeffrey Wong</tips> were the leaders of <tips=7>YS’s</tips> central Hong Kong faction. They had also been friends since childhood.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r95","rowIndex":95,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そういえば<ruby=ミンチェイ>明仔</ruby>」","en":"“That reminds me, Ming-jai.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー","displayName":"Chris Tse","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r96","rowIndex":96,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=3>クリス</tips>は子供時代の呼び名そのままで<tips=4>馬明</tips>を呼ぶ。","en":"<tips=3>Chris</tips> called <tips=4>Ma Ming</tips> by the familiar name he had used in childhood.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r97","rowIndex":97,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「お前のところの長男はどうした？　姿が見えないようだが」","en":"“Where’s your eldest boy? I don’t see him around.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r98","rowIndex":98,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<ruby=サイキ><tips=25>世傑</tips></ruby>の奴にも連絡はしたんですがね。返事もよこさない有様で……」","en":"“I did get in touch with <tips=25>Sai-kit</tips> too, but he couldn’t even be bothered to reply...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬明","displayName":"Ma Ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r99","rowIndex":99,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=4>馬明</tips>は触れられたくない話題に触れられたような、苦い顔をして肩をすくめる。","en":"<tips=4>Ma Ming</tips> shrugged with the pained expression of a man whose least favorite subject had just been raised.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r100","rowIndex":100,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「兄さんが私の結婚式なんかに来るわけがないわ。あの人は自分のことばっかりで、家族の情なんてものはちっともないんですもの」","en":"“As if my brother would ever come to my wedding. He only ever thinks about himself. He doesn’t care about his family one bit.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬美美","displayName":"Ma Meimei","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r101","rowIndex":101,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　花嫁はそう言って童女めかしく頬を膨らませた。","en":"The bride puffed out her cheeks like a little girl.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r102","rowIndex":102,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「家族に情がない人間なんかいないさ。……あいつは今、どこかの料理屋にいるのだっけ？　このままコックになるようなヤツじゃねえだろう。そろそろ呼び寄せて後を継がせる準備でもさせたらどうだ？　自分の身体が動かなくなってからでは難しいぞ。これは体験から言っているんだ」","en":"“Everyone cares about their family. ... He’s at some restaurant now, isn’t he? He’s not the kind of guy who’ll stay a cook forever. Why not call him home soon and start getting him ready to take over? It’ll be hard once you can’t get around anymore. Take it from me.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー","displayName":"Chris Tse","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r103","rowIndex":103,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=3>クリス</tips>は笑うが、<tips=4>馬明</tips>の表情は冴えない。","en":"<tips=3>Chris</tips> laughed, but <tips=4>Ma Ming’s</tips> expression remained clouded.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r104","rowIndex":104,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あんなボンクラに、仕事を継がせるつもりはありませんな。コックでもなんでも、好きなようにしたらいいのです。どうせ私の言うことなど聞きゃしません。そのときになったら、優秀な部下から選びますわ」","en":"“I have no intention of letting that useless fool take over my work. He may be a cook or anything else he pleases. He never listens to a word I say anyway. When the time comes, I’ll choose one of my best men.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬明","displayName":"Ma Ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r105","rowIndex":105,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ここの婿殿もその候補のうちか？」","en":"“Is your new son-in-law here one of the candidates?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー","displayName":"Chris Tse","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r106","rowIndex":106,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「とてもとても。そもそも、こいつは実家の家業を継ぐそうです。親はフカヒレだのホタテ貝だの、乾物の輸入をしとるんですわ。ほら、向こうで居心地悪そうに食事をつついている夫婦が両親です」","en":"“Not a chance. Besides, he plans to take over his own family business. His parents import dried goods—shark fin, scallops, that sort of thing. See that uncomfortable-looking couple picking at their food over there? That’s them.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬明","displayName":"Ma Ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r107","rowIndex":107,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あはは、つまり、店に業者として出入りしていた御曹司が、ギャングの娘をはらませたってわけか。見れば真面目そうなご両親じゃないか。気の毒なもんだ。こりゃあ、この先苦労が絶えねえな」","en":"“Ahaha! So a supplier’s young heir who used to do business with the shop wound up getting a gangster’s daughter pregnant. His parents look like respectable people, too. Poor things. They’ll have no end of trouble from here on out.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー","displayName":"Chris Tse","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r108","rowIndex":108,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=3>クリス</tips>はかすれ声で一頻り笑ってから、","en":"After a spell of raspy laughter, <tips=3>Chris</tips> said,","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r109","rowIndex":109,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「しかし、お互い息子では苦労するなあ。おい」","en":"“Still, sons give us both no end of trouble, eh?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー","displayName":"Chris Tse","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r110","rowIndex":110,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　と、<tips=4>馬明</tips>の腹をつついた。","en":"And he prodded <tips=4>Ma Ming</tips> in the belly.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r111","rowIndex":111,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=4>馬明</tips>が苦い顔をして、そして<tips=3>クリス</tips>はそれを肴にグラスを傾ける。ヴェネツィアン・グラスで作られたその器には、酒のかわりに取り寄せた健康茶が入っている。","en":"<tips=4>Ma Ming</tips> pulled a face, and <tips=3>Chris</tips> savored the sight as he took a drink. His Venetian glass held a specially ordered health tea in place of liquor.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r112","rowIndex":112,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=3>クリス</tips>が飲み干した器を従者に手渡すと、花嫁が前に進み出た。","en":"<tips=3>Chris</tips> handed the empty glass to an attendant, and the bride stepped forward.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r113","rowIndex":113,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それで、実はお願いがあるんです。ツェーおじさ……いや、<tips=81>龍頭</tips>さま」","en":"“Actually, I have a favor to ask. Uncle Tse—no, Lord <tips=81>Longtou</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬美美","displayName":"Ma Meimei","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r114","rowIndex":114,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「急にあらたまってどうした？」","en":"“Why so formal all of a sudden?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー","displayName":"Chris Tse","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r115","rowIndex":115,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「このお腹の子の名付け親になって頂きたいんです」","en":"“We’d like you to do us the honor of naming the baby.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r116","rowIndex":116,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「わ、私からもお願いします」","en":"“I-I’d like to ask you as well, sir.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r117","rowIndex":117,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　新郎があたふたと頭を下げる。","en":"The flustered groom bowed his head.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r118","rowIndex":118,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それは構わないが、男女どちらかわかっているのか？」","en":"“I don’t mind, but do you know whether it’s a boy or a girl?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー","displayName":"Chris Tse","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r119","rowIndex":119,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ええ、お医者様からうかがいました。でも……」","en":"“Yes, the doctor told us. But...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬美美","displayName":"Ma Meimei","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r120","rowIndex":120,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　花嫁はいたずらっぽく笑うと、","en":"The bride gave a mischievous smile.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r121","rowIndex":121,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=81>龍頭</tips>さまに、お当てしてもらおうかなって」","en":"“I thought I might let Lord <tips=81>Longtou</tips> guess.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬美美","displayName":"Ma Meimei","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r122","rowIndex":122,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「こら、何を言っている」","en":"“Now, don’t be ridiculous.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬明","displayName":"Ma Ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r123","rowIndex":123,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=4>馬明</tips>が止めようとするが、","en":"<tips=4>Ma Ming</tips> tried to stop her, but Chris asked,","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r124","rowIndex":124,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それはつまり、『見て』くれということか？」","en":"“In other words, you’re asking me to ‘look’?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー","displayName":"Chris Tse","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r125","rowIndex":125,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうです。お腹のなかの赤ちゃんの姿を、誰よりも先に見て欲しいんです」","en":"“Yes. I want you to be the very first to see the baby inside me.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬美美","displayName":"Ma Meimei","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r126","rowIndex":126,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それは光栄だな」","en":"“I’m honored.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー","displayName":"Chris Tse","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r127","rowIndex":127,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　言うと、<tips=3>クリス</tips>は帽子を脱いだ。","en":"With that, <tips=3>Chris</tips> removed his hat.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r128","rowIndex":128,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして露わになった彼の額には一筋の溝がある。","en":"A single groove was visible in his newly bared forehead.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r129","rowIndex":129,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　いやそれはただの溝ではなかった、みるみるうちに溝は左右に開き、その下からは茶色がかった瞳を持つ第三の目が現れたのである。","en":"No—it was no mere groove. Even as they watched, its sides drew apart, and beneath them appeared a third eye with a brownish iris.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r130","rowIndex":130,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=3>クリス</tips>は『<tips=16>タイプA</tips>』として優れた力を持つことで知られていた。","en":"<tips=3>Chris</tips> was known to possess exceptional powers as a <tips=16>Type A</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r131","rowIndex":131,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして、彼の場合この第三の目こそが、『<tips=16>タイプA</tips>』……つまりサイキックであることの証であった。","en":"In his case, this third eye was the mark of a <tips=16>Type A</tips>—a psychic.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r132","rowIndex":132,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ふむ」","en":"“Hmm.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー","displayName":"Chris Tse","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r133","rowIndex":133,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=3>クリス</tips>は第三の目をぎょろりと動かして、新婦の腹部を凝視する。","en":"<tips=3>Chris</tips> swiveled his third eye and fixed it on the bride’s abdomen.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r134","rowIndex":134,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「すこやかに眠っている。元気そうな赤ちゃんじゃないか……」","en":"“Sleeping soundly. A healthy-looking baby...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー","displayName":"Chris Tse","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r135","rowIndex":135,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼の能力は『透視』だと、巷では言われている。","en":"His power was popularly known as “clairvoyance.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r136","rowIndex":136,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　第三の目を持つことからそう連想されるのだろうが、厳密には少し違う。","en":"His third eye naturally suggested as much, but strictly speaking, his power was something slightly different.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r137","rowIndex":137,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ドアを開けずして壁の向こうの様子を知ることが出来る。手を触れずして箱の中の品物を当てることが出来る。……こういった様子だけ見ていると確かに透視の力があるとしか思えないが、実際の彼の能力は「空間把握」とでも言うべきものだ。","en":"Without opening a door, he could know what lay beyond a wall. Without touching a box, he could identify its contents. ... Judging by feats like these alone, one could hardly think him anything but clairvoyant, yet his actual ability was better described as “spatial perception.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r138","rowIndex":138,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　自分を中心にした周囲の空間を、障害物の有無にかかわらず、直感的に知覚するのである。透視というよりも、X線やレーダーに例えた方が適切だろう。","en":"He intuitively perceived the surrounding space with himself at its center, regardless of any obstacles in the way. X-rays or radar would be more apt comparisons than clairvoyance.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r139","rowIndex":139,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=9>Y地区</tips>には多く<tips=16>タイプA</tips>が住んでいるが、そのほとんどは<tips=16>タイプA</tips>特有の異形を持ちながらも、能力自体はほんのささやかなものだ。","en":"<tips=9>Y District</tips> was home to many <tips=16>Type As</tips>, but although almost all bore the physical abnormalities peculiar to <tips=16>Type As</tips>, their actual abilities were generally modest.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r140","rowIndex":140,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　五センチ以内の、コイン程度の重さのモノを汗だくになりながらやっと浮かせる。あるいは、半日の間、じっと見つめて、やっとコップ一杯の水を沸騰させる——。","en":"One might work up a drenching sweat merely to raise a coin-weight object less than two inches. Another might stare fixedly for half a day before finally bringing a single glass of water to a boil—","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r141","rowIndex":141,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　読者諸君の周囲で暮らす<tips=16>タイプA</tips>は、おおよそこの程度の能力しかないのではないか？","en":"Surely the <tips=16>Type As</tips> living around you, dear readers, can do little more than this?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r142","rowIndex":142,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しかし、この<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>の能力はそんなささやかなものではない。","en":"But <tips=3>Chris Tse’s</tips> ability was anything but modest.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r143","rowIndex":143,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼がこの地位に上り詰めるまで生き延びられたのは、この能力があってのことだ。","en":"It was this ability that had allowed him to survive his ascent to this position.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r144","rowIndex":144,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　襲撃者の不意打ちを事前に察知し、逆に彼自身が襲撃者となるときはどんな暗闇のなかでも、多くの壁に取り囲まれていても、標的を逃さない目となった。","en":"It warned him in advance of an attacker’s ambush; when he became the attacker, it served as an eye that never lost its target, no matter how deep the darkness or how many walls stood in the way.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r145","rowIndex":145,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　いまは衰弱によってかつてほど絶大な力を発揮することは出来なくなっているとは言え、目の前の妊婦の腹の中身を覗き見ることくらいは何ということもない。","en":"Weakness might now prevent him from exercising the tremendous force he once had, but peering into the belly of the pregnant woman before him posed no great difficulty.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r146","rowIndex":146,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「これは……男の子だな」","en":"“This is... a boy.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー","displayName":"Chris Tse","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r147","rowIndex":147,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ご名答です」","en":"“Exactly right.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬美美","displayName":"Ma Meimei","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r148","rowIndex":148,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　花嫁は笑い、<tips=3>クリス</tips>は再び帽子をかぶって第三の目を隠す。","en":"The bride smiled. <tips=3>Chris</tips> put his hat back on, concealing his third eye once more.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r149","rowIndex":149,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「男の子なら名前は……そうだな。<ruby=ゆう>勇</ruby>と言うのはどうだ？　父親が蛮勇をふるって母親を妊娠したことに敬意を表してな……。そういやな顔をするな。冗談だ。冗談。そんな由来ではない」","en":"“For a boy... let me see. How about Yuu, written with the character for courage? In honor of the reckless courage his father showed in getting his mother pregnant... Don’t look so disgusted. It’s a joke. A joke. That’s not really where the name comes from.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー","displayName":"Chris Tse","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r150","rowIndex":150,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=3>クリス</tips>は肩をすくめる。","en":"<tips=3>Chris</tips> shrugged.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r151","rowIndex":151,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「昔、亡き妻が考えてくれた名前でな。日本名としても香港人の名前としても使える名前だろう？　一人目は結局今の名を選んだが、二人目の男子が生まれたらこれをつけようととっておいたんだ。……おれが<tips=4>馬明</tips>の初孫に名前をつけるんだったら、これしかない。この子もうちのやつと同じで、日本人と香港人の間の子だし、悪くないだろう？」","en":"“It’s an old name my late wife thought up. It works as either a Japanese name or a Hong Kong name, doesn’t it? We ended up choosing a different name for our first child, but saved this one in case a second boy came along. ... If I’m to name <tips=4>Ma Ming’s</tips> first grandchild, it has to be this. This baby, like ours, has one Japanese parent and one Hong Kong parent. Not bad, is it?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー","displayName":"Chris Tse","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r152","rowIndex":152,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ありがとうございます！　光栄です！」","en":"“Thank you very much! It’s an honor!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r153","rowIndex":153,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　新郎は恐縮して頭を下げる。","en":"The groom bowed deeply, overwhelmed by the distinction.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r154","rowIndex":154,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……そういう経緯なら、私も嬉しいです」","en":"“...If that’s the story behind it, I’m happy too.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬美美","displayName":"Ma Meimei","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r155","rowIndex":155,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　花嫁は微笑むと、","en":"The bride smiled and said,","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r156","rowIndex":156,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「でも、そうなると第一候補の名前を貰った人にもあいさつをしないと。……今日はまだ見かけていないんですけれど、彼、来てくれているんですよね？」","en":"“But in that case, I must also greet the person who received the first-choice name. ... I haven’t seen him today, but he did come, didn’t he?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬美美","displayName":"Ma Meimei","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r157","rowIndex":157,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そのはずだがなあ。ここにはまだあいさつに来てねえんだが、お前にも、祝福の言葉一つかけていないのかい？　幼なじみの結婚だってのに。……まったく、あいつはこういう場所での振る舞いかたをまったく知らない。困ったやつだ」","en":"“He should be here. He still hasn’t come over to say hello—but he hasn’t even said a word of congratulations to you? His childhood friend’s getting married. ... Honestly, that boy has no idea how to behave at a thing like this. He’s hopeless.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー","displayName":"Chris Tse","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r158","rowIndex":158,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=3>クリス</tips>は溜息をつく。","en":"<tips=3>Chris</tips> sighed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r159","rowIndex":159,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その時、会場の端、ちょうど<tips=3>クリス</tips>たちと離れたテーブルに一人の青年がいた。","en":"At that moment, at the edge of the reception, a young man sat alone at a table some distance from <tips=3>Chris</tips> and the others.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r160","rowIndex":160,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　名を<ruby=ツェー・ルォン><tips=1>謝亮</tips></ruby>と言う。","en":"His name was <tips=1>Tse Leung</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r161","rowIndex":161,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　この暗い顔をした美しい青年こそが、この物語の中心となる人物であった。","en":"This beautiful young man with the gloomy expression was the figure at the center of this story.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r162","rowIndex":162,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　主人公、とは少し違う。いやあるいは主人公なのかもしれぬ。","en":"Not quite its protagonist. Or perhaps he was.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r163","rowIndex":163,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　もしこの壮大な物語に、主人公と呼べる一個人が存在すればという話だが。","en":"That is, if this grand tale can be said to have any single protagonist.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r164","rowIndex":164,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　とにかく、これからはじまる血なまぐさい一連の事件に、彼の行動が大きく関わってくるのは、この私が保証しよう。","en":"In any case, I can assure you that his actions will play a major part in the bloody chain of events about to begin.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r165","rowIndex":165,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しかし、彼はこの時点ではまだ何の力も持っていなかった。","en":"At this point, however, he possessed no power at all.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r166","rowIndex":166,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼の姿は、一見するとこの場に似つかわしくないように見えた。","en":"At first glance, he seemed out of place here.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r167","rowIndex":167,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　黒い豊かな髪の毛はぼさぼさで寝癖がついてはいるが、その色白の顔はいくらか幼さが残しつつも美しく整い、周囲を取り囲む貫禄充分の男達と比べると、あまりにも若く、か弱げであった。","en":"His thick black hair was tousled with sleep, but his pale face—still bearing a trace of youth—was finely formed. Beside the imposing men who surrounded him, he looked far too young, too delicate.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r168","rowIndex":168,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しかし、注意深くその要素を観察すると、女性のような容姿に似つかわしくない鋭い光が目のなかにあることに気がつくだろう。","en":"Yet a careful observer would notice a sharp glint in his eyes, ill suited to those feminine features.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r169","rowIndex":169,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　実際彼は大人しい性格というわけではなかった。むしろ激しい人物と言っていいだろう。しかし、この時はよほどつまらないのか、周囲の明るい雰囲気などお構いなしに、むっつりと黙り込んでいた。","en":"He was not, in fact, mild-mannered—if anything, he was fierce. But perhaps because he found the occasion intolerably dull, he sat in sullen silence, heedless of the bright mood around him.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r170","rowIndex":170,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして、影のように一人でひっそりとテーブルの上の料理を口に運んでいる。","en":"Alone and quiet as a shadow, he ate from the dishes on the table.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r171","rowIndex":171,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　この賑やかなパーティにおいて、彼に積極的に話しかけるものは現れない。","en":"Amid this lively party, no one came forward to speak to him.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r172","rowIndex":172,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　かといって彼がこの場でまったく立場を持たない人間だったというわけではない。","en":"That did not mean he was a man of no standing here.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r173","rowIndex":173,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　むしろ、彼ほど重要な立場の人間は、ここでもほとんどいなかったろう。","en":"On the contrary, there were few people present whose position was more important than his.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r174","rowIndex":174,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼は先ほど紹介した<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>の息子なのである。","en":"He was the son of <tips=3>Chris Tse</tips>, whom I introduced a moment ago.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r175","rowIndex":175,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　けれど、彼は組織ではあまりその顔を知られていなかった。","en":"Within the organization, however, few people knew his face.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r176","rowIndex":176,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼は父の組織には所属しておらず、距離をおいた生活をしていたため、彼が表立ってボスの息子として振る舞う機会は非常に限られている。","en":"He did not belong to his father’s organization and kept his distance from it, so the occasions on which he appeared publicly as the boss’s son were exceedingly rare.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r177","rowIndex":177,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　もちろん古くからの幹部などは彼のことを知らないはずもないが、ボスの息子でありながら組織の外で暮らしているというややこしい状況の彼に、気軽に話しかけるのは簡単ではない。","en":"The old guard and other senior officers naturally knew who he was. But his awkward position—the boss’s son, yet living outside the organization—made him no easy man to approach casually.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r178","rowIndex":178,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　本人が不機嫌そうにしていればなおさらだ。","en":"All the less so when he looked displeased.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r179","rowIndex":179,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>謝亮</tips>は慣れないネクタイを締めた首元を気にして人差し指を何度も差し込んで緩めている。","en":"<tips=1>Tse Leung</tips> was preoccupied with the unfamiliar tie at his throat, repeatedly slipping a forefinger beneath it to loosen it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r180","rowIndex":180,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　さきほどおろして袖を通したばかりのスーツは着心地が悪い。","en":"The new suit he had only just put on was uncomfortable.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r181","rowIndex":181,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして、ちいさく溜息をつく。","en":"He gave a small sigh.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r182","rowIndex":182,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"（来なきゃ良かったな）","en":"(I wish I hadn’t come.)","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r183","rowIndex":183,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　内心でそう呟きながら、料理名のなんだかわからない、鳥肉の炒めたものを口に含むと思わぬ酸味が広がる。","en":"With that thought, he put a bite of some stir-fried chicken dish whose name he did not know into his mouth, and an unexpected tartness spread across his tongue.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r184","rowIndex":184,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　慌ててグラスに手をつけて、中の液体で口の中を洗うと、アルコールの刺激でうっとむせ返る。","en":"He hurriedly seized his glass and rinsed his mouth with the liquid inside—only to choke at the burn of alcohol.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r185","rowIndex":185,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼は普段は酒をほとんど飲まないのだが、今日はなんだかやけのような、馬鹿馬鹿しいような気持ちで、許容量をこえたアルコールを摂取していた。","en":"He ordinarily drank very little, but today, in a mood at once reckless and fed up with the absurdity of it all, he had consumed more alcohol than he could handle.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r186","rowIndex":186,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まあ<tips=2>阿亮</tips>！」","en":"“Oh, <tips=2>Ah Leung</tips>!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アウロラ・フェルナンデス","displayName":"Aurora Fernandes","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r187","rowIndex":187,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ふと女の声で呼ばれて振り返った。そこに立っていたのは褐色の肌を持つ二人の若く美しい女たちで、<tips=1>亮</tips>もよく知っている。","en":"A woman’s voice called to him. He turned and found two beautiful young women with brown skin, both of whom <tips=1>Leung</tips> knew well.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r188","rowIndex":188,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「お久しぶりね。どうしてこんなところに一人でいるの？」","en":"“It’s been ages. Why are you sitting all alone over here?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アウロラ・フェルナンデス","displayName":"Aurora Fernandes","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r189","rowIndex":189,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　と明るく微笑みかけたのは<tips=36>アウロラ・フェルナンデス</tips>。","en":"The one who greeted him with a bright smile was <tips=36>Aurora Fernandes</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r190","rowIndex":190,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>に気軽に話しかけるということは、それなりの立場にあるということだ。","en":"The very fact that she could speak so casually to <tips=1>Leung</tips> testified to her own standing.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r191","rowIndex":191,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女は<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>幹部の一人である<tips=35>ジョゼ・フェルナンデス</tips>の美人三姉妹の長女である。","en":"She was the eldest of the three beautiful daughters of <tips=35>José Fernandes</tips>, one of <tips=7>YS’s</tips> officers.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r192","rowIndex":192,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　の横でおどおどとして何も話さないのが三女の<tips=38>リタ</tips>。","en":"Beside her stood the youngest, <tips=38>Rita</tips>, too nervous to say a word.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r193","rowIndex":193,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　いずれも幼い頃からの知人だ。","en":"He had known both of them since childhood.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r194","rowIndex":194,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そんなにつまらなそうな顔して。みんなとお喋りでもして来たらどう？」","en":"“Why do you look so bored? Why don’t you go talk to everyone?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アウロラ・フェルナンデス","displayName":"Aurora Fernandes","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r195","rowIndex":195,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=36>アウロラ</tips>の言葉には答えず、<tips=1>亮</tips>はひたすら食べ続ける。","en":"Without answering <tips=36>Aurora</tips>, <tips=1>Leung</tips> devoted himself to eating.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r196","rowIndex":196,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まったく、へそまがりなんだから」","en":"“You really do have to be contrary, don’t you?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アウロラ・フェルナンデス","displayName":"Aurora Fernandes","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r197","rowIndex":197,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=36>アウロラ</tips>はあきれて笑う。","en":"<tips=36>Aurora</tips> laughed in exasperation.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r198","rowIndex":198,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　三姉妹は、末っ子の<tips=38>リタ</tips>と<tips=1>亮</tips>が同い年で、ここにはいない次女の<tips=37>アナ・クララ</tips>は二つ上、そしてこの長女は三つほど年上だった。","en":"Of the three sisters, the youngest, <tips=38>Rita</tips>, was <tips=1>Leung’s</tips> age. The absent middle sister, <tips=37>Ana Clara</tips>, was two years older than he was, and the eldest, Aurora, about three.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r199","rowIndex":199,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　昔から子供扱いをされており、今となってもそれが抜けない。","en":"They had treated him like a child for as long as he could remember, and even now had not broken the habit.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r200","rowIndex":200,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あの、大学生活は楽しいですか？」","en":"“Um... are you enjoying college?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"リタ・フェルナンデス","displayName":"Rita Fernandes","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r201","rowIndex":201,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=38>リタ</tips>はおずおずと尋ねる。","en":"<tips=38>Rita</tips> asked the question hesitantly.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r202","rowIndex":202,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「楽しいよ」","en":"“It’s fun.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r203","rowIndex":203,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>は一言だけそう答える。","en":"That was <tips=1>Leung’s</tips> entire answer.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r204","rowIndex":204,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それは、とてもいいですね。何か偉い先生について研究をなさってるんでしょう？　すごいです」","en":"“That’s... very good. You’re doing research under some distinguished professor, aren’t you? That’s amazing.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"リタ・フェルナンデス","displayName":"Rita Fernandes","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r205","rowIndex":205,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=38>リタ</tips>は遠慮がちに笑顔を浮かべた。","en":"<tips=38>Rita</tips> offered a timid smile.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r206","rowIndex":206,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「こき使われてるだけさ」","en":"“They’re just working me to the bone.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r207","rowIndex":207,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　苦い顔で肩をすくめると、","en":"He shrugged with a sour look, then said,","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r208","rowIndex":208,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=38>リタ</tips>も街を出るべきだったんだ。成績だって悪くなかったんだろ？　もっと選択肢があったろうに」","en":"“<tips=38>Rita</tips>, you should have left this city too. Your grades weren’t bad either, were they? You could have had more choices.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r209","rowIndex":209,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あ、あの、私は、お家から離れたくないから……。それに、あなたみたいにうまく外でやってゆく自信はないです」","en":"“I—I didn’t want to leave my family... And I don’t have the confidence to make my way outside the city as well as you have.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"リタ・フェルナンデス","displayName":"Rita Fernandes","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r210","rowIndex":210,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「やってみれば簡単なもんだよ。この街より暮らしにくい場所なんかないんだからね。僕は離れてせいせいした。まったく、ここは本当に薄汚い、不快な……」","en":"“You’d find it easy if you tried. Nowhere could be harder to live than this city. I was relieved to get away. Honestly, this place is so filthy, so repulsive...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r211","rowIndex":211,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「このまま戻ってこないってわけじゃないでしょう？」","en":"“It’s not as if you’re never coming back, is it?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アウロラ・フェルナンデス","displayName":"Aurora Fernandes","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r212","rowIndex":212,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=38>リタ</tips>と<tips=1>亮</tips>の会話に、<tips=36>アウロラ</tips>が口を挟んだ。","en":"<tips=36>Aurora</tips> cut into the conversation between <tips=38>Rita</tips> and <tips=1>Leung</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r213","rowIndex":213,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それとも、まさか本当に学者にでもなるつもり？　そんな仕事につけるわけないじゃない。あなたはここで<tips=81>龍頭</tips>になるんでしょうに」","en":"“Or don’t tell me you seriously intend to become a scholar? You could never get a job like that. You’re supposed to come back here and become the <tips=81>Longtou</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アウロラ・フェルナンデス","displayName":"Aurora Fernandes","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r214","rowIndex":214,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それに対して<tips=1>亮</tips>が返事をしないでいると、","en":"When <tips=1>Leung</tips> made no reply,","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r215","rowIndex":215,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=2>阿亮</tips>、わかってる？」","en":"“<tips=2>Ah Leung</tips>, do you understand?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アウロラ・フェルナンデス","displayName":"Aurora Fernandes","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r216","rowIndex":216,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=36>アウロラ</tips>は念を押した。","en":"<tips=36>Aurora</tips> pressed him.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r217","rowIndex":217,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「その<tips=2>阿亮</tips>って言い方好きじゃないんだ。みんな意味を知らずに使ってるが、本当は随分馴れ馴れしい呼び方なんだぜ」","en":"“I don’t like being called <tips=2>Ah Leung</tips>. Everyone uses it without knowing what it means, but it’s actually a pretty overfamiliar way to address someone.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r218","rowIndex":218,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　やっと口を開いたかと思えば問いかけと無関係なことを言う<tips=1>亮</tips>に、<tips=36>アウロラ</tips>は溜息をつき、","en":"When <tips=1>Leung</tips> finally opened his mouth only to say something wholly unrelated to her question, <tips=36>Aurora</tips> sighed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r219","rowIndex":219,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あのねえ、とにかく、こんなところで一人で食べているなんて、さみしいったらないって話よ。そんなにお腹が減っているの？」","en":"“Listen. My point is that there’s nothing lonelier than sitting here eating all by yourself. Are you really that hungry?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アウロラ・フェルナンデス","displayName":"Aurora Fernandes","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r220","rowIndex":220,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そういうわけじゃないけどさ、これ、放っておいたらそのまま捨てちゃうんでしょ？　こんなに美味しいのに……きみらはまったく素晴らしいね！　贅沢に生まれ育ったから、美味しいものを作るのにどれだけ労力や技術が必要なのかちっとも知らないんだ。だから簡単に捨てる。僕は定食屋のせがれだから、そういう傲慢が気になってしかたないんだよ」","en":"“That’s not why, but if we leave all this here, they’ll just throw it away, won’t they? When it’s this good... You people really are something! You grew up in luxury, so you don’t know the first thing about how much work and skill it takes to make good food. That’s why you can throw it away without a thought. I’m a diner owner’s son. That kind of arrogance drives me crazy.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r221","rowIndex":221,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まあ、誰が定食屋の子なのよ」","en":"“Oh? And who are you calling a diner kid?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アウロラ・フェルナンデス","displayName":"Aurora Fernandes","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r222","rowIndex":222,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「僕だよ。血はどうあれ、生活が人間を作るんだ。毎日葱を刻んだり、唐揚げが揚がるのを見張ってたんだぞ。だから僕は定食屋のせがれなんだよ。きみらとは違うんだ」","en":"“Me. Whatever’s in my blood, it’s the life you live that makes you who you are. I spent every day chopping scallions and minding the fried chicken. That makes me the son of a diner owner. I’m not like you.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r223","rowIndex":223,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「何を言ってるの？」","en":"“What are you talking about?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アウロラ・フェルナンデス","displayName":"Aurora Fernandes","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r224","rowIndex":224,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=36>アウロラ</tips>が首をひねると、<tips=1>亮</tips>は溜息をつき、","en":"<tips=36>Aurora</tips> tipped her head. <tips=1>Leung</tips> sighed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r225","rowIndex":225,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「もう、話が通じないやつだなあ。馬鹿なんじゃないの？」","en":"“You really are impossible to get through to, aren’t you? Are you stupid?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r226","rowIndex":226,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼はそこではじめてまっすぐ相手の顔をみて、呆れたように言う。","en":"For the first time, he looked her squarely in the face and spoke in exasperation.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r227","rowIndex":227,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……とにかく、何もかもうんざりなんだよ。こんな田舎ギャングの集会で、田舎ボスの息子が、御曹司でございって顔で存在しているってこと自体が、あまりにも馬鹿馬鹿しくて、喰わずにはやってられない。まったく素晴らしい結婚式だ！　なんで僕はこんなくだらない会合に来てしまったのか。情に負けたんだ。それを考えると腹が立って仕方ない」","en":"“...Anyway, I’m sick of everything. The very fact that the son of some backwater boss is sitting at a gathering of backwater gangsters with ‘pampered young master’ written all over his face is so ridiculous, I have to keep eating just to stand it. What a magnificent wedding! Why did I come to this idiotic little gathering? Sentiment got the better of me. Just thinking about it makes me furious.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r228","rowIndex":228,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あはは、相変わらずだ！　相変わらずの生意気な<tips=2>阿亮</tips>だ！」","en":"“Ahaha! You haven’t changed! Still the same cheeky <tips=2>Ah Leung</tips>!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アウロラ・フェルナンデス","displayName":"Aurora Fernandes","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r229","rowIndex":229,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そう言って<tips=36>アウロラ</tips>がその豊かな胸を押しつけるようにして抱きしめる。","en":"<tips=36>Aurora</tips> said this as she embraced him, pressing her ample breasts against him.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r230","rowIndex":230,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「もう、お姉ちゃんたら」","en":"“Honestly, Sis.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"リタ・フェルナンデス","displayName":"Rita Fernandes","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r231","rowIndex":231,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=38>リタ</tips>は顔を顰めるが、当の本人である<tips=1>亮</tips>は何も言わず、無理に振り払おうともせず、ただ顔を顰めて嫌な顔をして次の料理を口に運んだ。","en":"<tips=38>Rita</tips> frowned, but <tips=1>Leung</tips> said nothing and made no effort to shake Aurora off. He merely pulled a face and put another bite of food into his mouth.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r232","rowIndex":232,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=36>アウロラ</tips>たちが去ってすぐ、新郎新婦とその父が<tips=1>亮</tips>の姿を見つけてやって来た。","en":"Soon after <tips=36>Aurora</tips> and the others left, the bride, groom, and bride’s father spotted <tips=1>Leung</tips> and came over.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r233","rowIndex":233,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　既に満腹になって食べるのをやめていた<tips=1>亮</tips>は、人ごみをかき分けて近づく彼らを見て苦い顔をしたが、逃げるでもなく座ったまま三人を迎え入れた。","en":"Already full and no longer eating, <tips=1>Leung</tips> scowled when he saw the three of them parting the crowd on their way toward him. But rather than flee, he remained seated and waited for them.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r234","rowIndex":234,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ありがとう<tips=2>阿亮</tips>。私たちのためにわざわざ来てくれたのね」","en":"“Thank you, <tips=2>Ah Leung</tips>. You went out of your way to come for us.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬美美","displayName":"Ma Meimei","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r235","rowIndex":235,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どういたしまして。おめでとう」","en":"“You’re welcome. Congratulations.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r236","rowIndex":236,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　腹が満ち、飲み慣れない酒を飲み、襲う睡魔で閉じようとするまぶたをどうにかこじ開けながら、花嫁にそう返した。","en":"His stomach full and his body unused to the liquor, he forced open eyelids that drowsiness kept dragging shut and gave the bride his answer.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r237","rowIndex":237,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=2>阿亮</tips>、どうして父親に挨拶に行かないんだ。待ってるぞ」","en":"“<tips=2>Ah Leung</tips>, why haven’t you gone to greet your father? He’s waiting for you.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬明","displayName":"Ma Ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r238","rowIndex":238,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　と声をかけたのは花嫁の父である<tips=4>馬明</tips>。","en":"It was the bride’s father, <tips=4>Ma Ming</tips>, who called out to him.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r239","rowIndex":239,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「僕は別に<tips=81>龍頭</tips>に会うために帰って来たわけじゃないんだ。……あ、そちらが新郎さんですか？　はじめまして、僕は<tips=1>謝亮</tips>といいます。新婦やその父とは昔からの知り合いです。ご結婚おめでとうございます」","en":"“I didn’t come back here to see the <tips=81>Longtou</tips>. ... Oh, is this the groom? It’s a pleasure to meet you. My name is <tips=1>Tse Leung</tips>. I’ve known the bride and her father for many years. Congratulations on your marriage.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r240","rowIndex":240,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あ、ありがとうございます」","en":"“Th-thank you very much.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r241","rowIndex":241,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　花嫁や<tips=4>馬明</tips>への態度とはあきらかに違う<tips=1>亮</tips>の言葉に、花婿はたじろぎながら頭を下げる。","en":"The groom faltered at <tips=1>Leung’s</tips> words, so unlike the way he had addressed the bride or <tips=4>Ma Ming</tips>, and bowed his head.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r242","rowIndex":242,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しかし、彼が礼儀正しかったのはそこまでで、挨拶が済むとさっと立ち上がり、","en":"But that was as far as his courtesy went. Once the greetings were over, he sprang to his feet and said,","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r243","rowIndex":243,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「じゃあそういうことで」","en":"“Well, that’s that.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r244","rowIndex":244,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「こら<tips=2>阿亮</tips>！」","en":"“Hold it, <tips=2>Ah Leung</tips>!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r245","rowIndex":245,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　立ち去ろうとした<tips=1>亮</tips>を、<tips=4>馬明</tips>は苦い顔で呼び止める。","en":"<tips=4>Ma Ming</tips> called <tips=1>Leung</tips> back with a sour expression as the young man made to leave.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r246","rowIndex":246,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どこへ行こうとしている」","en":"“Where do you think you’re going?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬明","displayName":"Ma Ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r247","rowIndex":247,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=4>馬明</tips>は酒で赤くなった顔に怒気を浮かべていた。","en":"<tips=4>Ma Ming’s</tips> drink-flushed face darkened with anger.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r248","rowIndex":248,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「帰るんだよ」","en":"“Home.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r249","rowIndex":249,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>は、気怠げにそう答える。","en":"<tips=1>Leung</tips> answered listlessly.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r250","rowIndex":250,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どこへ帰る？」","en":"“Home where?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬明","displayName":"Ma Ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r251","rowIndex":251,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「アパートだよ。新郎新婦への挨拶も終わったじゃないか。遠いし、眠いからもう帰りたいんだ」","en":"“My apartment. I’ve greeted the bride and groom, haven’t I? It’s a long way, and I’m sleepy. I just want to go home.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r252","rowIndex":252,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうはいかんぞ。今日はこっちでホテルをとってあるから、お前はそこへ泊まるんだ。そして明日はおれと二人で兄貴に会う」","en":"“Nothing doing. We’ve booked you a hotel for tonight, and that’s where you’ll stay. Tomorrow, you and I are going to see Big Brother together.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬明","displayName":"Ma Ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r253","rowIndex":253,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「やっぱりそう来たか。<tips=81>龍頭</tips>の差し金か？」","en":"“So that’s it. Did the <tips=81>Longtou</tips> put you up to this?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r254","rowIndex":254,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>は苦々しく唇を歪める。","en":"<tips=1>Leung</tips> twisted his lips bitterly.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r255","rowIndex":255,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「違う」","en":"“No.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬明","displayName":"Ma Ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r256","rowIndex":256,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「違わないでしょ」","en":"“It is, though.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r257","rowIndex":257,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そこで<tips=4>馬明</tips>がむっとして大きな口を真一文字に結ぶと、その表情を見た<tips=1>亮</tips>は眠気で淀んでいた目をにわかにギラギラと輝かせる。","en":"<tips=4>Ma Ming</tips> took offense and pressed his wide mouth into a hard line. At the sight, <tips=1>Leung’s</tips> eyes, dull with sleep a moment before, suddenly flashed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r258","rowIndex":258,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あはは！　何も言わなくたって、顔を見れば全部わかるぞ！　僕にウソは通用しないって、昔から何度言えばわかるんだ。この間抜けめ！」","en":"“Ahaha! You don’t have to say a word—one look at your face tells me everything! How many times do I have to tell you? You’ve never been able to lie to me, you idiot!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r259","rowIndex":259,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なんだと！　この小僧！」","en":"“What’d you say, you little brat?!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬明","displayName":"Ma Ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r260","rowIndex":260,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「もう、お父さん、やめてって」","en":"“Dad, please, stop it.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r261","rowIndex":261,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　花嫁が苦い顔でいさめようとしても父はきかない。","en":"The bride grimaced and tried to talk him down, but her father refused to listen.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r262","rowIndex":262,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　アルコールに怒りが加わって、文字通りゆでだこのようにはげた頭のてっぺんまで真っ赤に染めた<tips=4>馬明</tips>は、皿の上にあった叫化鶏を<tips=1>亮</tips>に投げつける。","en":"Fueled by drink and fury, <tips=4>Ma Ming</tips> turned literally as red as a boiled octopus, right to the crown of his bald head. He hurled the Beggar’s Chicken from a plate at <tips=1>Leung</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r263","rowIndex":263,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　亮が首をすくめると、その柔らかく蒸し焼きにされた丸のままの鶏は回転しながら空中で分解して、その油と肉片は談笑していた婦人の頭髪やドレスを汚し、悲鳴があがる。","en":"Leung ducked. The tender, steam-roasted whole chicken spun through the air and broke apart. Grease and chunks of meat spattered the hair and dress of a woman who had been chatting nearby, and a scream went up.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r264","rowIndex":264,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「もったいないなぁ！」","en":"“What a waste!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r265","rowIndex":265,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　亮は笑みを浮かべたまま叫ぶと、手元にあった銀のトレイから最後に残った一切れのパイナップルを口に放り込み、そして残った液体を<tips=4>馬明</tips>にぶちまける。","en":"Still smiling, Leung shouted, tossed the last slice of pineapple from the silver tray at his elbow into his mouth, then flung the remaining liquid over <tips=4>Ma Ming</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r266","rowIndex":266,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　これは見事命中し、<tips=4>馬明</tips>の真っ赤になった頭のてっぺんから着飾ったタキシードの胸元まで、ココナッツミルクの入った白いシロップでぐっしょりと濡れる。","en":"The shot landed perfectly, drenching <tips=4>Ma Ming</tips> in white coconut-milk syrup from the crown of his scarlet head to the front of his tuxedo.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r267","rowIndex":267,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=4>馬明</tips>は掴みかかるが、酔いでふらついて動作が緩慢としている。","en":"<tips=4>Ma Ming</tips> lunged at him, but drink left him unsteady and slow.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r268","rowIndex":268,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　一方<tips=1>亮</tips>は酔っているとは思えない素早い動作でそれを避けるのだ。","en":"<tips=1>Leung</tips>, meanwhile, dodged with movements so quick that no one would have guessed he was drunk.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r269","rowIndex":269,"pageCtrl":"","jp":" 「こ、これは……」","en":"“Wh-what...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r270","rowIndex":270,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　動揺する花婿の隣で、","en":"Beside the shaken groom,","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r271","rowIndex":271,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いつものことだから。この人たち、仲はいいのよ」","en":"“It’s what they always do. Those two are good friends.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r272","rowIndex":272,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　花嫁はあきれながら呟く。","en":"the bride muttered in exasperation.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r273","rowIndex":273,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「この！」","en":"“You—!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬明","displayName":"Ma Ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r274","rowIndex":274,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　再度つかみかかろうとした<tips=4>馬明</tips>は、酒のふらつきと、足元に散らばった料理で体勢を崩し、彼の部下たちが慌ててそれを助け起こす。すると、この太った<tips=85>二路元帥</tips>の無様な姿に、騒ぎによって注目していたギャラリーたちからどっと笑い声がわき起こった。","en":"<tips=4>Ma Ming</tips> tried to lunge again, but his drunken legs and the food scattered underfoot threw him off balance, and his men hurried to prop him up. The humiliating spectacle of the fat <tips=85>Second Route Marshal</tips> drew a great burst of laughter from everyone who had turned to watch.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r275","rowIndex":275,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして<tips=1>亮</tips>もギャラリーと同様、<tips=4>馬明</tips>の姿にくすくす笑いながら、軽快な足取りでその場を離れてゆく。","en":"Like the rest of the onlookers, <tips=1>Leung</tips> chuckled at <tips=4>Ma Ming</tips> as he made his escape with a jaunty step.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r276","rowIndex":276,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　するすると人の間を縫うようにして逃げてゆく相手を見て、<tips=4>馬明</tips>は追うのを諦めると、まだこちらに視線を向けるギャラリーを振り返って、おどけたように肩をすくめる。","en":"Seeing Leung slip away, weaving nimbly through the crowd, <tips=4>Ma Ming</tips> gave up the chase. He turned to the spectators who were still watching and shrugged theatrically.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r277","rowIndex":277,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いやあ、みなさん！　花嫁の父と、<tips=81>龍頭</tips>の息子の余興を楽しんでいただけたかな！　ちと荒っぽかったが、農家あがりの我が家の結婚式にはふさわしかろう」","en":"“Well, ladies and gentlemen! Did you enjoy that little entertainment, courtesy of the bride’s father and the <tips=81>Longtou’s</tips> son? A touch rough, perhaps, but surely fitting for a wedding in a family that started out as farmers!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r278","rowIndex":278,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　シロップまみれのまま言うその姿に、見守る人々はまた笑声を上げた。","en":"The sight of him saying so while drenched in syrup drew another burst of laughter from the onlookers.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r279","rowIndex":279,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そのあとは、衣服を汚した婦人のところへ行って平身低頭謝り、それが終わってからようやく汚れた衣服を着替え、花嫁のところへ戻って来たのである。","en":"Afterward, he went to the lady whose clothing he had ruined and apologized with repeated, abject bows. Only when that was done did he change out of his filthy clothes and return to the bride.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r280","rowIndex":280,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まったくもう。じきにお祖父ちゃんになるって言うのに、情けないったらありゃしない。ほら、まだ鼻の横が汚れてる」","en":"“Honestly! You’re about to become a grandfather, and you’re still this hopeless. Here—you’ve still got something beside your nose.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬美美","displayName":"Ma Meimei","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r281","rowIndex":281,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　父親にハンカチを差し出しながら、花嫁は溜息をつく。","en":"The bride sighed as she offered her father a handkerchief.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r282","rowIndex":282,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あの馬鹿が悪いんだ」","en":"“That idiot started it.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬明","displayName":"Ma Ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r283","rowIndex":283,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=4>馬明</tips>は鼻息荒くハンカチを受け取って乱暴に言われた箇所を拭う。","en":"<tips=4>Ma Ming</tips> snorted, took the handkerchief, and roughly scrubbed the spot she had indicated.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r284","rowIndex":284,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「悪いのはお父さんだわ。先に手を出したのはお父さんでしょ？」","en":"“You’re the one in the wrong, Dad. You started it, didn’t you?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬美美","displayName":"Ma Meimei","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r285","rowIndex":285,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まあ、それはそうだが」","en":"“Well... that is true.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬明","displayName":"Ma Ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r286","rowIndex":286,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　娘が味方になってくれないばつの悪さを表情に浮かべながら、<tips=4>馬明</tips>は部下の差し出すグラスを手に取り、水を一息に飲み干した。","en":"Embarrassed that his daughter would not take his side, <tips=4>Ma Ming</tips> accepted a glass from one of his men and drained the water in a single breath.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r287","rowIndex":287,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「しかし、あいつはまったく若い頃の父親とそっくりだよ」","en":"“Still, that boy is exactly like his father was at his age.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬明","displayName":"Ma Ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r288","rowIndex":288,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そう言って、深々と息をつく。","en":"With that, he breathed a deep sigh.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r289","rowIndex":289,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あの騒ぎはなんだい？」","en":"“What was all that?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー","displayName":"Chris Tse","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r290","rowIndex":290,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　会場の向こう側で不意にわき起こった笑い声について、<tips=3>クリス</tips>は怪訝な面持ちで傍らに侍す<tips=39>ジェフリー・ウォン</tips>に尋ねる。","en":"Puzzled by the laughter that had suddenly risen on the other side of the reception, <tips=3>Chris</tips> put the question to <tips=39>Jeffrey Wong</tips>, who stood in attendance beside him.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r291","rowIndex":291,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どうも、<tips=4>馬明</tips>と<tips=1>謝亮</tips>が揉めたようですな」","en":"“It appears <tips=4>Ma Ming</tips> and <tips=1>Tse Leung</tips> had a disagreement.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ジェフリー・ウォン","displayName":"Jeffrey Wong","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r292","rowIndex":292,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「しようのない連中だ……」","en":"“Those hopeless fools...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー","displayName":"Chris Tse","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r293","rowIndex":293,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=3>クリス</tips>は笑ったようだったが、喉の奥からはかすれた音が出るだけだった。","en":"<tips=3>Chris</tips> seemed to laugh, but all that emerged from his throat was a rasp.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r294","rowIndex":294,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いつまで経っても成長というものをしない」","en":"“They never do grow up.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー","displayName":"Chris Tse","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r295","rowIndex":295,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼はこうして車椅子の上で座っているだけでも消耗しているらしい。背筋を伸ばしていられず、右の肘掛けにもたれるような姿勢をとると、<tips=39>ジェフリー</tips>は無言で気遣うような視線を向けた。","en":"Even sitting in the wheelchair seemed to drain him. Unable to keep his back straight, he slumped against the right armrest. <tips=39>Jeffrey</tips> gave him a silent look of concern.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r296","rowIndex":296,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=1>亮</tips>のやつは？」","en":"“Where is <tips=1>Leung</tips>?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー","displayName":"Chris Tse","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r297","rowIndex":297,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「姿が見えません。帰ったのかもしれませんな」","en":"“I don’t see him. He may have gone home.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ジェフリー・ウォン","displayName":"Jeffrey Wong","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r298","rowIndex":298,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「おれには挨拶もなしか。ふん、何から何まで勝手なやつだ……」","en":"“Didn’t even bother to come say hello to me? Hmph. Everything has to be on his terms...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー","displayName":"Chris Tse","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r299","rowIndex":299,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=3>クリス</tips>はまた笑いにならない呼吸音を口元から発した。","en":"Another breath that never quite became a laugh escaped <tips=3>Chris’s</tips> lips.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r300","rowIndex":300,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「立派に育ちました」","en":"“He grew into a fine man.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ジェフリー・ウォン","displayName":"Jeffrey Wong","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r301","rowIndex":301,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　クスリともせずに言う<tips=39>ジェフリー</tips>の顔を横目に、<tips=3>クリス</tips>は溜息をついてから、","en":"Glancing sidelong at <tips=39>Jeffrey</tips>, who had said it without the slightest smile, <tips=3>Chris</tips> sighed, then asked,","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r302","rowIndex":302,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……そういえば、お前の娘たちはどうした？」","en":"“...Come to think of it, where are your daughters?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー","displayName":"Chris Tse","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r303","rowIndex":303,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<ruby=ティンミン><tips=40>天明</tips></ruby>と<ruby=ティンチェン><tips=40>天祥</tips></ruby>ならば、会場の入り口で監視にあたっています」","en":"“<tips=40>Tin-ming</tips> and <tips=40>Tin-cheung</tips> are keeping watch at the reception entrance.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ジェフリー・ウォン","displayName":"Jeffrey Wong","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r304","rowIndex":304,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「もういいから呼んで来い」","en":"“They’ve done enough. Go get them.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー","displayName":"Chris Tse","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r305","rowIndex":305,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「はい」","en":"“Yes, sir.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ジェフリー・ウォン","displayName":"Jeffrey Wong","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r306","rowIndex":306,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ウォンが目配せをすると、彼の従者は主人の意を察して早足で去っていった。","en":"Wong signaled to an attendant with a glance. The man understood his master’s intent and hurried away.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r307","rowIndex":307,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そろそろお疲れになったのではありませんか？」","en":"“You must be getting tired by now.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ジェフリー・ウォン","displayName":"Jeffrey Wong","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r308","rowIndex":308,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まだ大丈夫だ。薬が効いているのかもしれないな。それに、おれは体調のことばかり考えているわけにはいかないんだよ」","en":"“I’m all right yet. Perhaps the medicine is working. Besides, I can’t spend all my time thinking about my health.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー","displayName":"Chris Tse","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r309","rowIndex":309,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　背を曲げて肘掛けに寄りかかる姿勢にも疲れた<tips=3>クリス</tips>は、背もたれの角度を変え、そこに仰向けに背を預け、","en":"Tired of hunching over the armrest, <tips=3>Chris</tips> adjusted the angle of the backrest and lay back against it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r310","rowIndex":310,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なあ、おれが死ねば<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>はどうなる？　そしてこの街はどうなる？」","en":"“Tell me, what will become of <tips=7>YS</tips> when I die? And what will become of this city?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー","displayName":"Chris Tse","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r311","rowIndex":311,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=3>クリス</tips>の問いかけに、<tips=39>ジェフリー</tips>は何も答えない。","en":"<tips=39>Jeffrey</tips> gave no answer to <tips=3>Chris’s</tips> question.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r312","rowIndex":312,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「病に冒されていると知った時から、いずれこうなるのはわかっていたんだ。もっと早く準備をするべきだったのだろうな。……ふん、愚痴だなこれは」","en":"“Ever since I learned I had this disease, I knew it would come to this eventually. I suppose I should have prepared sooner. ... Hmph. There I go complaining.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー","displayName":"Chris Tse","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r313","rowIndex":313,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=3>クリス</tips>は肩をすくめて、","en":"<tips=3>Chris</tips> shrugged.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r314","rowIndex":314,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「病気というのはいやなもんだ。まだ生きているにもかかわらず、出会うやつ出会うやつ、みんな、おれの死んだ後の振る舞い方を計算しながら接して来やがる。あいつらの目に映ったおれはもう死体同然なんだ。思い知らされるぜ。連中の汚ねえ笑顔とおべんちゃらでよ。……これは病人特有の卑屈さかい？　いや違うな。確かに、今日は自分の威厳が失われているのを実感させられる一日だった。まるで幽霊になったかのような、妙な気分だったぜ。……人間が無力になるというのはこういうことだ。おれもこれまで逆の立場だったからよくわかる。傑作だな」","en":"“Being sick is a rotten business. I’m still alive, but every damn person I meet comes at me calculating how they’ll act once I’m dead. In their eyes, I’m as good as a corpse already. Their filthy smiles and flattery make damn sure I know it. ... Maybe that’s just a sick man’s bitterness talking? No. It’s not. Today really has been one long lesson in how much authority I’ve lost. It’s a strange feeling, like I’ve become a ghost. ... So this is what it means to be powerless. I know it well enough; until now, I was always the one on the other side. What a joke.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー","displayName":"Chris Tse","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r315","rowIndex":315,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=39>ジェフリー</tips>はボソボソと喋る<tips=3>クリス</tips>をじっと見つめていた。","en":"<tips=39>Jeffrey</tips> watched <tips=3>Chris</tips> intently as he muttered.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r316","rowIndex":316,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして、何も言わない。","en":"He said nothing.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r317","rowIndex":317,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　風が吹き、その前髪が揺れると、顔をあげて風上の方を向いてから、ようやく口を開いた。","en":"A wind stirred his bangs. He lifted his face, turned into it, and at last spoke.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r318","rowIndex":318,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……<tips=81>龍頭</tips>、風が強くなって来たようですな」","en":"“...<tips=81>Longtou</tips>, the wind seems to be rising.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ジェフリー・ウォン","displayName":"Jeffrey Wong","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r319","rowIndex":319,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「へっ」","en":"“Heh.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー","displayName":"Chris Tse","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r320","rowIndex":320,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=3>クリス</tips>はその<tips=39>ジェフリー</tips>の慎重な態度を可笑しがってから、","en":"Amused by <tips=39>Jeffrey’s</tips> cautious manner, <tips=3>Chris</tips> said,","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r321","rowIndex":321,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「風なんかどうだっていいだろう。お前は……ああ、<tips=40>天明、天祥</tips>やっと来たか」","en":"“Who cares about the wind? You... Ah, <tips=40>Tin-ming, Tin-cheung</tips>, there you are at last.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー","displayName":"Chris Tse","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r322","rowIndex":322,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　言いかけた彼の目の前に、異様な姿をした二人組がやって来た。","en":"Before he could finish, the strange-looking pair approached him.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r323","rowIndex":323,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　頭髪が一本もなく、顔には布が巻き付いており、両目の部分を覆い隠している。そして<tips=3>クリス</tips>の目の前に立つと、深々と頭を下げた。","en":"Neither had a single hair on her head. Cloth had been wound around their faces to cover both eyes. When they stood before <tips=3>Chris</tips>, they bowed deeply.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r324","rowIndex":324,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=40>黄天明と、黄天祥</tips>。","en":"<tips=40>Wong Tin-ming and Wong Tin-cheung</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r325","rowIndex":325,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　男のような名をしているがこの二人は正真正銘の女性であり、姉妹である。","en":"Despite their masculine names, both were unquestionably women—and sisters.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r326","rowIndex":326,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　この二人が、先ほど<tips=3>クリス</tips>が呼ばせた、<tips=39>ジェフリー・ウォン</tips>の二人の娘であった。","en":"These were the two daughters of <tips=39>Jeffrey Wong</tips> whom <tips=3>Chris</tips> had just summoned.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r327","rowIndex":327,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　頭髪や眉毛がないのは剃っているからではなく、全身に体毛というものが一本も存在しないのだ。そして何よりも、顔の正面、本来なら目のあるべきところに何もない。それを覆い隠すためにこのように布を巻き付けている。","en":"Their lack of hair and eyebrows was not the result of shaving: not a single hair grew anywhere on either body. Most striking of all, there was nothing where their eyes should have been. They wrapped their faces in cloth to conceal that absence.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r328","rowIndex":328,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=3>クリス</tips>同様、この身体の変異は先天的なものであり、それはすなわち<tips=16>タイプA</tips>として彼女らが特殊な能力を与えられた証しでもあった。","en":"Like <tips=3>Chris’s</tips>, these mutations had been present from birth. That, in turn, was proof that they had been granted special powers as <tips=16>Type As</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r329","rowIndex":329,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「今日は結婚式からパーティまで、一日中見張りをしていて、飯を喰う暇だってなかったろう。おれはもう帰るから、お前等はここに残って好きなだけ酒や飯を楽しんで行け」","en":"“You’ve been on guard all day, from the wedding through the reception, without even time to eat. I’m going home now. You two stay here and eat and drink your fill.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー","displayName":"Chris Tse","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r330","rowIndex":330,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いえ、それは出来ません。<tips=81>龍頭</tips>にご一緒します。それに私たちはお酒を嗜みませんので」","en":"“No, we cannot do that. We will accompany the <tips=81>Longtou</tips>. Besides, we do not drink.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"黄天明","displayName":"Wong Tin-ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r331","rowIndex":331,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　天明は父親譲りの静かな口調で否定する。","en":"Tin-ming declined in the same quiet tone as her father.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r332","rowIndex":332,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いいんだ。今日のお前たちの仕事は終わりだ。明日の午前十一時まで休暇を命じる」","en":"“It’s fine. Your work is done for today. You’re off duty until eleven tomorrow morning. That’s an order.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー","displayName":"Chris Tse","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r333","rowIndex":333,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「しかしそれは……」","en":"“But...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"黄天祥","displayName":"Wong Tin-cheung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r334","rowIndex":334,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　天祥が食い下がろうとすると、<tips=3>クリス</tips>は怒気を露わにしてじろりと睨みつける。","en":"When Tin-cheung tried to protest, <tips=3>Chris</tips> let his anger show and fixed her with a glare.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r335","rowIndex":335,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「この<tips=81>龍頭</tips>の命令が聞けないか？」","en":"“Do you mean to disobey an order from the <tips=81>Longtou</tips>?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー","displayName":"Chris Tse","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r336","rowIndex":336,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　姉妹は<tips=81>龍頭</tips>の声に狼狽を見せ、お互いの手に触れ合って彼女たちにしかわからないコミュニケーションを交わしてから、","en":"The sisters flinched at the <tips=81>Longtou’s</tips> tone. They touched hands, exchanging a message only they could understand, then replied,","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r337","rowIndex":337,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それでは、お言葉に甘えさせていただきます」","en":"“Then we shall gratefully accept your kindness.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"黄天明","displayName":"Wong Tin-ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r338","rowIndex":338,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それでいい」","en":"“Good.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー","displayName":"Chris Tse","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r339","rowIndex":339,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=3>クリス</tips>は満足げに頷く。","en":"<tips=3>Chris</tips> nodded in satisfaction.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r340","rowIndex":340,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「お前たちは今後も長く働くんだ。休める時は休んだ方が良い」","en":"“You’re going to be working for many years yet. Better rest when you have the chance.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー","displayName":"Chris Tse","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r341","rowIndex":341,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「はい、ありがとうございます」","en":"“Yes, sir. Thank you.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"黄天祥","displayName":"Wong Tin-cheung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r342","rowIndex":342,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「おれが死んだ後も、息子を守って貰わなくてはならんのだからな。そう先のことじゃない」","en":"“After I die, you’ll still have to protect my son. And that day isn’t far off.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー","displayName":"Chris Tse","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r343","rowIndex":343,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=81>龍頭</tips>」","en":"“<tips=81>Longtou</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ジェフリー・ウォン","displayName":"Jeffrey Wong","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r344","rowIndex":344,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=39>ジェフリー</tips>が眉をひそめて言うと、","en":"<tips=39>Jeffrey</tips> frowned as he spoke.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r345","rowIndex":345,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「悪い悪い。こんなめでたい席で言うことじゃなかったな。状況をわきまえないのはおれのよくない癖だ。死んだ女房にもよく窘められたものだよ。口が軽いんだ」","en":"“Sorry, sorry. Not the sort of thing to say at a celebration like this. I’ve got a bad habit of not reading the room. My late wife used to scold me for it all the time. I’ve got a big mouth.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー","displayName":"Chris Tse","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r346","rowIndex":346,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして今度はかすれ音にはならない笑い声をたてると、","en":"Then he laughed, this time without the sound dissolving into a rasp,","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r347","rowIndex":347,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「よし、帰ろう。明日は感動の親子の対面が待っているんだろう？」","en":"“Good. Let’s go. Tomorrow’s the touching reunion between father and son, isn’t it?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー","displayName":"Chris Tse","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x1:r348","rowIndex":348,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そう言って<tips=3>クリス</tips>は、従者に車椅子を押すよう合図した。","en":"With that, <tips=3>Chris</tips> signaled an attendant to push his wheelchair.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}}]},{"position":2,"code":"A1","unitId":"A1","rows":[{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r1","rowIndex":1,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　目の前がグルグルとして仕方がない。","en":"The world before my eyes won’t stop spinning.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r2","rowIndex":2,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　まだ吐きたいというほど気持ちが悪いわけではなく、むしろ面白いような違和感だけれど、時間が経てばそのうち不快感となり、吐き気となり、そして吐いても吐いても収まらない死んでしまおうかと思うほどの苦しみとなるんだろう。","en":"I don’t feel sick enough to vomit yet. If anything, the strange sensation is almost amusing. Given time, though, it will become discomfort, then nausea, then an agony so relentless that no amount of vomiting will ease it, until I start thinking I’d be better off dead.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r3","rowIndex":3,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　いま僕の身体のなかには、内臓の処理能力を明らかに超えたアルコールが入っている。","en":"Right now, my body contains far more alcohol than my internal organs can possibly process.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r4","rowIndex":4,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　いくら馬鹿馬鹿しくて仕方がなかったとしても、自分でさらに馬鹿馬鹿しい状態にしてどうする？　こんなに飲むべきじゃなかった。予期出来た失敗をするのは愚かしい。","en":"No matter how ridiculous the whole thing was, what did I think I’d accomplish by making myself even more ridiculous? I shouldn’t have drunk this much. It’s idiotic to make a mistake you could see coming.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r5","rowIndex":5,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　あまりにもつまらない集まりだった。<tips=4>馬明</tips>をからかっている時は少し楽しかったけれど、教会を出て車を拾おうと探し始めたところで、ちょっと怪しくなった。","en":"It had been an unbearably dull gathering. Teasing <tips=4>Ma Ming</tips> had been a little fun, but I started to feel unsteady as soon as I left the church and went looking for a cab.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r6","rowIndex":6,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そしてタクシーに乗り込み揺られているうちに、ほら、予想した通りになったぞ。","en":"Then, as the taxi jostled me along, sure enough, it happened exactly as I’d expected.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r7","rowIndex":7,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　身体のなかのアルコールが毒になって、もうたまらない。アセトアルデヒドが悪さをする。","en":"The alcohol in my body had turned to poison. It was unbearable. Acetaldehyde at work.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r8","rowIndex":8,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　このまま駅までもたせるのはとても不可能だ。","en":"There was no way I could hold out all the way to the station like this.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r9","rowIndex":9,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕はその場でタクシーを降り、身体を休める場所を探すため、繁華街の方へさまよい出た。","en":"I got out of the taxi on the spot and wandered toward the entertainment district in search of somewhere to rest.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r10","rowIndex":10,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　平日の昼間にもかかわらず<tips=57>滑走路通り</tips>は活気で満ちている。","en":"Despite the weekday hour, <tips=57>Runway Street</tips> was bustling.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r11","rowIndex":11,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　調理用に改造したワゴンの中から、肌の浅黒い夫婦がポルトガル語訛りの売り声を上げながら、キーベやコシーニャを揚げていた。普段なら香ばしく食欲を刺激するはずの香りが今は吐き気を誘う。","en":"From a van converted into a kitchen, a dark-skinned couple fried kibbeh and coxinha while calling out their wares in Portuguese-accented voices. Ordinarily, their savory aroma would have whetted my appetite; now it made me nauseous.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r12","rowIndex":12,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　歩道にまで陳列棚を並べた輸入雑貨店には、学生らしい若い男女が物色する姿が見える。","en":"At an imported-goods shop whose display racks spilled onto the sidewalk, young men and women who looked like students browsed the merchandise.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r13","rowIndex":13,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そのすぐ隣には青果店があり、国籍不明のコーカソイドの若者が流暢な関西弁で、飲食店の制服を着た黒人女性に冬瓜を勧めている。","en":"Immediately beside it was a produce shop, where a Caucasian young man of indeterminate nationality, speaking fluent Kansai dialect, was recommending winter melon to a Black woman in a restaurant uniform.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r14","rowIndex":14,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　若者の顔の目や鼻が斜めに曲がってついているのを見ると彼は<tips=16>タイプA</tips>なのかもしれないが、あれくらいだと<tips=16>タイプA</tips>特有の<tips=77>特質変異</tips>なのか、喧嘩で殴られでもして歪んでしまっただけなのかは区別が付きにくい。","en":"The young man’s eyes and nose sat crookedly on his face, so he might have been a <tips=16>Type A</tips>. With a case that mild, though, it was hard to tell whether this was a <tips=77>trait mutation</tips> peculiar to <tips=16>Type As</tips> or his face had simply been knocked crooked in a fight.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r15","rowIndex":15,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　隅の方で電柱に抱きつくようにして震えている男がいる。その目が金色に輝いている。","en":"In one corner, a man was clinging to a utility pole and trembling. His eyes shone gold.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r16","rowIndex":16,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　あれははっきりと<tips=17>タイプB</tips>の発作が起きているとわかる。","en":"That was unmistakably a <tips=17>Type B</tips> episode.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r17","rowIndex":17,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　みな気にせず通り過ぎてゆく。","en":"Everyone passed by without paying him any mind.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r18","rowIndex":18,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　遠くの方からブザー音が聞こえる。","en":"A buzzer sounded in the distance.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r19","rowIndex":19,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　あれは「<tips=42>タキノ式UB波感知器</tips>」――いわゆる「サイキック探知機」の警報音だ。","en":"It was the alarm of a “<tips=42>Takino-model UB-wave detector</tips>”—what people commonly called a “psychic detector.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r20","rowIndex":20,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=16>タイプA</tips>が能力を使うために集中すると周囲に発生する特殊な波長を感知し、ブザー音で報せるその装置は、すべてのサイキックを感知出来るわけではない。","en":"The device detects the special wavelength produced around a <tips=16>Type A</tips> when they concentrate on using their power, then sounds a buzzer—but it cannot detect every psychic.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r21","rowIndex":21,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　集中しなくとも常に能力が働いているようなサイキックや、集中を必要としてもなぜか波長の変化が起きないサイキックもいる。","en":"Some psychics' powers are always active without concentration; others require concentration but, for some reason, produce no change in wavelength.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r22","rowIndex":22,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　きわめて不確かな検出力だが、サイキックを検知する道具はこの装置しか存在しないため、あちこちで使用されている。","en":"It is an extremely unreliable detector, but because no other device can detect psychics at all, it is used everywhere.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r23","rowIndex":23,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　どこの街角にもあるあの消火栓に似た装置がこんな音を立てるということを知っているのは、<tips=9>Y地区</tips>の住人以外にはそう多くはないだろう。ほとんどの人は、自分の街にそんな装置が設置されていることさえ忘れているに違いない。","en":"Few people outside <tips=9>Y District</tips> would know that those fire-hydrant-like devices found on every street corner could make such a sound. Most must have forgotten the devices were ever installed in their own towns.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r24","rowIndex":24,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　外の社会にはそうそうサイキックはおらず、滅多に鳴らないものなのだ。","en":"There simply aren’t many psychics in the world outside, so the alarms almost never sound.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r25","rowIndex":25,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しかし、この街では週に一度か二度は鳴る。そして警察はいちいちやってこない。","en":"In this city, however, they sounded once or twice a week. The police did not come running every time.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r26","rowIndex":26,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　サイキック能力の不正使用は犯罪だけれども、この街ではこんなことは日常茶飯事で、なかったことにして済まさなければ生活は送れない。","en":"The illegal use of psychic powers is a crime, but here it is an everyday occurrence. No one could live in this city without learning to pretend it never happened and move on.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r27","rowIndex":27,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　もし、この街で、ただ能力を使っただけの<tips=16>タイプＡ</tips>を一人残さず取り締まるなどという愚行に本腰を入れて取り組んだら、一体どれだけの警察官の命が失われることやら。","en":"If the police seriously committed themselves to the idiocy of cracking down on every last <tips=16>Type A</tips> in this city merely for using their powers, how many officers’ lives would it cost?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r28","rowIndex":28,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして、やったところでどれほど街が良くなることやら。","en":"And how much better would the city be even if they did?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r29","rowIndex":29,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　もちろん、そんな意味のない取り締まりよりも警察官の命の方が価値があるのだから、やらないのは正解だ。これ以上ないほどの大正解だ。","en":"Of course, police officers’ lives are worth more than such pointless enforcement, so leaving it alone is the right decision. As right as a decision can possibly be.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r30","rowIndex":30,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　こういった話は地区の外の人には感覚としてわかりにくいだろう。","en":"People outside the district would find this sort of thing hard to grasp intuitively.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r31","rowIndex":31,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　この街の内側と外側では、まったく別の世界なのだ。","en":"The world inside this city and the world outside are utterly different.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r32","rowIndex":32,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それでは、『<tips=9>Y地区</tips>』といった言葉に、外の世界の人間は何を思い浮かべるのだろうか？","en":"Then what do people in the outside world picture when they hear the words “<tips=9>Y District</tips>”?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r33","rowIndex":33,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　大通りを飾る多国籍なネオン。住民たちのバラエティに富んだ髪や肌の色。若者がもてはやす独特なファッションとカルチャー。他の地域では提供されない特別なモノや快楽。ありとあらゆる人種の男女を破格で買える日本最大の売春地帯に、裏通りの工場で大量生産されるドラッグ、そして犯人も理由も明らかになることのない遺体。","en":"Cosmopolitan neon lining the avenues. The astonishing variety of the residents’ hair and skin. Distinctive fashions and cultures celebrated by the young. Special goods and pleasures unavailable anywhere else. Japan’s largest red-light district, where men and women of every conceivable race can be bought for next to nothing; drugs mass-produced in back-alley factories; and bodies whose killers and motives never come to light.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r34","rowIndex":34,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　最近では<tips=9>Y地区</tips>出身の女性歌手がデビューし、あちこちのメディアに出てこの街について語ったりするらしい。そのせいで、多少は以前よりは身近な印象になったのかもしれないが、その基調にあるのは、やはりこうしたどぎついイメージだろう。","en":"A female singer from <tips=9>Y District</tips> recently made her debut and now, apparently, turns up throughout the media talking about the city. That may have made the place feel a little more familiar than before, but these lurid images surely remain its dominant note.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r35","rowIndex":35,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　みな世界の混沌を煮詰めたような場所だと思っている。","en":"Everyone imagines it as a place where the whole world’s chaos has been boiled down and concentrated.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r36","rowIndex":36,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして、そうしたパブリックイメージは完全な間違いでもない。","en":"Nor is that public image wholly mistaken.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r37","rowIndex":37,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　世界に七つしかない<tips=8>グレートホール</tips>。","en":"There are only seven <tips=8>Great Holes</tips> in the world.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r38","rowIndex":38,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その巨大な穴が汚染する周辺地域は立ち入り禁止の国立自然公園となっているが、その自然公園にべたりと張り付くように広がっているのがこの街だ。","en":"The region surrounding that gigantic chasm, contaminated by it, has been designated a national park closed to all entry; this city spreads alongside it as though plastered to the park's edge.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r39","rowIndex":39,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　かつては基地があったらしい。<tips=8>グレートホール</tips>の発生によって軍隊が撤退したあと、誰も住まない空き地に移民やら犯罪者やら<tips=16>タイプA</tips>やら<tips=17>タイプB</tips>やらが集まって、こんなにわけのわからない街を作り出した。","en":"There was once a military base here, apparently. After the appearance of the <tips=8>Great Hole</tips> forced the troops to withdraw, immigrants, criminals, <tips=16>Type As</tips>, and <tips=17>Type Bs</tips> gathered on the abandoned land where no one lived and created this incomprehensible city.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r40","rowIndex":40,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そしてそのわけのわからない街に、住民はわけのわからないルールで生きている。ように見える。","en":"And in that incomprehensible city, its residents live by incomprehensible rules. Or so it appears.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r41","rowIndex":41,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　実際ひとつひとつを取り出してみれば実にシンプルで簡単でごくあたりまえのものだ。あたりまえのものが組み合わさると複雑でわけがわからなくなるというのが、この街の真実なのである。","en":"Take them one at a time, and every one is simple, plain, perfectly ordinary. The truth of this city is that ordinary things become complicated and incomprehensible when combined.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r42","rowIndex":42,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しかし、我ながらうんざりするが、こうして<tips=57>滑走路通り</tips>を歩いていると、不覚にも懐かしさを感じてしまう。懐かしさを感じるということは、僕の心のどこかに、この街ならではの何かが、『わけの分からない』などという言葉ではあらわされない、もっと具体的な何かが、しっかりと食い込んでいるということだ。全く、いやになる。","en":"Much as it disgusts me to admit it, walking down <tips=57>Runway Street</tips> like this makes me nostalgic. If I can feel nostalgia, then somewhere in my heart something unique to this city—something concrete, beyond a word like “incomprehensible”—must be lodged deep inside me. God, I hate that.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r43","rowIndex":43,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　かつて少年だった僕は何度も何度もこの<tips=57>滑走路通り</tips>を行き来した。その時僕は、いつも街そのものを踏みつけるような気持ちで、一歩ごとに靴底をアスファルトに叩き付けるような気持ちで、負けてなるものかと歩いたものだ。","en":"When I was a boy, I walked up and down this <tips=57>Runway Street</tips> countless times. Back then, I always walked as if trampling the city itself, as if hammering my soles against the asphalt with every step, thinking, I won't let you beat me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r44","rowIndex":44,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　やっと逃げ出したこの街に、なぜか僕は舞い戻ってしまった。","en":"I had finally escaped this city, only to find myself back here for some reason.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r45","rowIndex":45,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　戻るつもりなどなかったというのに。","en":"Even though I had never meant to return.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r46","rowIndex":46,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　いよいよ嘔気がたまらないものとなってきた。","en":"By now, the nausea was unbearable.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r47","rowIndex":47,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　かつてこの街に住んでいた時には存在しなかった、まだ新しい喫茶店を見つけるとそこに足を踏み入れる。","en":"I spotted a relatively new café that had not existed when I lived here and went inside.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r48","rowIndex":48,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　東南アジア風の内装をほどこした小綺麗な店で、店内は若者たちで混雑している。僕はトイレに直行して汚さぬように吐いた。あまりこういった状況は慣れていないのだが、思いの外上手に吐けて気分が良かった。","en":"It was a neat little place decorated in a Southeast Asian style and crowded with young people. I went straight to the restroom and vomited without making a mess. I wasn’t used to situations like this, but to my surprise I managed it neatly and felt better for it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r49","rowIndex":49,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　戻って店員に話しかけると、店内の席が満席だったのでテラス席に案内された。","en":"When I came back out and spoke to a server, I was shown to the terrace because every seat inside was taken.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r50","rowIndex":50,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　渡されたメニューを見て、そこではじめてベトナム茶を看板商品としてうたっている店だと理解した。","en":"Only after looking at the menu did I realize the place specialized in Vietnamese tea.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r51","rowIndex":51,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　聞いたことのないハーブティーの名前が並び、添えられた説明文には簡単な味の説明と、それよりも何倍も長い効能の紹介文があり、そこに美容や不眠という言葉がならんでいる。普段なら僕が入るような店じゃあない。","en":"It listed herbal teas I had never heard of. Each brief description of the flavor was followed by an account of the supposed benefits many times longer, full of words like beauty and insomnia. Ordinarily, this was not the sort of place I would ever enter.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r52","rowIndex":52,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　店員に尋ねながら、一番人気だというロータスティーを注文する。","en":"I asked the waiter for a recommendation and ordered the lotus tea he said was most popular.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r53","rowIndex":53,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　もっと閑静な場所なら風情もあるのだろうが、こんな人の行き交うほこりっぽい路上に向かって作られたテラス席は、ただ落ち着かないだけだ。","en":"In quieter surroundings, the terrace might have possessed some charm. Facing a dusty roadside packed with passersby, it was simply impossible to relax there.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r54","rowIndex":54,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　溜息をつくと、自分の息はまだアルコール臭い。","en":"I sighed. My breath still smelled of alcohol.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r55","rowIndex":55,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　一度吐いたくらいではまだ不快感はおさまらないようだ。","en":"Apparently, one trip had not been enough to make me feel better.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r56","rowIndex":56,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　座ってじっとしていると、視界が定まらずにひどく揺れ、回転し、とてもそのままではいられなかったので思わず机の上に伏せる。","en":"Sitting still only left my vision unfocused; the world pitched and spun so badly that I could not stay upright, and I found myself slumped forward over the table.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r57","rowIndex":57,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「お客様、ご注文の品をお持ちしました」","en":"“Your order, sir.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r58","rowIndex":58,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ウェイターの声で顔をあげる。","en":"The waiter’s voice made me lift my head.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r59","rowIndex":59,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あっ……<tips=2>阿亮</tips>様、じゃないですか！」","en":"“Ah... Master <tips=2>Ah Leung</tips>! Is that you?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r60","rowIndex":60,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そこに立っていた青年の顔は、僕の知っているものだった。小綺麗な店の制服を着て、髪の毛に櫛目をつけて小綺麗に整えているために大分印象が変わっているが、間違いない。確か塗装工の息子で、やたらと喧嘩っぱやいことで有名だった。","en":"I knew the young man standing there. The neat café uniform and his carefully combed hair had changed his appearance considerably, but there was no mistake. He was a house painter’s son, if memory served, and notorious for picking fights at every opportunity.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r61","rowIndex":61,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　同じグループではなかったのでそう親しくはないが、僕も何度か彼に挑戦されたり、一緒に悪さを働いたことがあるので覚えている。","en":"We had not belonged to the same crowd and were never close. But he had challenged me to fights several times, and we had gotten into trouble together, so I remembered him.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r62","rowIndex":62,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しかし、不思議な呼び方をするものだ。","en":"Yet it was a strange way to address me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r63","rowIndex":63,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=2>阿亮</tips>というのは、広東省などの中国南部で使われている言葉で、「○○ちゃん」とか「○○君」というような意味を含む。だからあとに「様」をつけたりはしない。","en":"<tips=2>Ah Leung</tips> is a form used in Guangdong and other parts of southern China, carrying the same familiar, diminutive sense as “little Ryo” or “young Ryo.” That is why it is not normally paired with an honorific such as “Master.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r64","rowIndex":64,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　もっとも、これを守るのは言葉の意味を理解している人間だけで、<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>の連中の多くは勝手に敬称を付け足したりするのだが。","en":"Of course, the only people who follow that convention are the ones who understand what the name means. Most of the men in <tips=7>YS</tips> tack honorifics onto it however they please.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r65","rowIndex":65,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　いずれにしろ、これは<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>の関係者が僕を呼ぶ言葉なのだ。それを、彼はどこで知ったのだろう？　どこかで聞きかじって、無理矢理使っているのだろうか。","en":"In any case, this was what people connected to <tips=7>YS</tips> called me. Where had he learned it? Had he heard it somewhere and started forcing it into his speech?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r66","rowIndex":66,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　以前は「<tips=1>リョウ</tips>」と呼び捨てにしたり、「お前」とぞんざいに話しかけていたじゃないか。この通りの連中にとって僕は「定食屋のせがれの<tips=1>菅原亮</tips>」として知られているはずで、ごくわずかしか本当の名前や、素性を知る者はいない。彼も知らなかったはずだ。","en":"Before, he had simply called me “<tips=1>Ryo</tips>,” or spoken to me as bluntly as “you.” To the people on this street, I was supposed to be “<tips=1>Ryo Sugawara</tips>, the diner owner’s son,” and only a very few knew my real name or background. He should not have known, either.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r67","rowIndex":67,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　なのにこんな呼び方をするということは、<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>に入ったということか？","en":"If he was calling me that, had he joined <tips=7>YS</tips>?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r68","rowIndex":68,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そうだとしても、末端の構成員になったくらいじゃ、そう簡単には知ることが出来ないはずなのだけれど。","en":"Even if he had, a mere low-ranking member should not have been able to find that out so easily.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r69","rowIndex":69,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　なんらかの形で、かつての仲間たちに、僕の素性が知れ渡ってしまったんだろうか？","en":"Had word of my background somehow spread among my old companions?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r70","rowIndex":70,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そう考えてしまうと、さきほどうっすらと感じた微かな郷愁が薄れてゆくのを感じた。","en":"At the thought, I felt the faint nostalgia of a moment before begin to fade.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r71","rowIndex":71,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いやあ、久しぶりですねえ。大学生活はどうですか？　なんでも、すごい難しいことをしてるんでしょう？　この街で生まれ育った人間が、まっとうな場所でやっていけてるなんて、普通じゃ考えられない。昔から、他の連中とはモノが違いましたからねえ。あなたは、俺たちみんなの誇りですよ」","en":"“It’s certainly been a long time. How is college? I hear you’re doing some incredibly difficult work. You’d never expect someone born and raised in this city to make it in a respectable place. You were always made of different stuff from the rest of us. We’re all so proud of you.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r72","rowIndex":72,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼は笑顔を作ってそう話しかける。","en":"He addressed me with a smile pasted on his face.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r73","rowIndex":73,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「今回帰って来るのも、噂になっていましたよ。本格的に<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>の後継者としての道を歩まれるんですか？　そしたら、この<tips=57>滑走路通り</tips>も……」","en":"“Your return was the talk of the street, too. Are you beginning your path in earnest as the successor to <tips=7>YS</tips>? If so, <tips=57>Runway Street</tips> will...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r74","rowIndex":74,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　旧知の人物のはずが、まったく別人になっておべんちゃらを使っている姿に興ざめしてしまう。","en":"Seeing someone I had once known transformed into a complete stranger, fawning over me like this, killed whatever pleasure the reunion might have held.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r75","rowIndex":75,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　もっとも、彼からしてみれば、この僕の方が、ずっと知っていた<tips=1>菅原亮</tips>ではなくなってしまったということなのだろうが。","en":"Then again, from his perspective, perhaps I was the one who was no longer the <tips=1>Ryo Sugawara</tips> he had always known.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r76","rowIndex":76,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「すまないけれど、僕は冷めないうちにお茶を飲みたいんだ」","en":"“Sorry, but I want to drink my tea before it gets cold.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r77","rowIndex":77,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕が遮ると、","en":"I cut him off.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r78","rowIndex":78,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あ、これは失礼しました」","en":"“Ah, forgive me.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r79","rowIndex":79,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして彼はテーブルの上にガラス製のティーポットを置いた。透明の器のなかにはお湯が注がれ、その中では花のようなものがたゆたっている。","en":"He set a glass teapot on the table. Hot water filled the clear pot, and something like a flower drifted inside.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r80","rowIndex":80,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「とても綺麗でしょう？　見た目だけじゃなくて、味も香りもとっても素晴らしいんです。こういうお茶が苦手なお客様にも好評を頂いています」","en":"“Beautiful, isn't it? And it isn't just the appearance—the taste and fragrance are both wonderful. Even customers who ordinarily dislike this kind of tea have been very pleased with it.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r81","rowIndex":81,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ありがとう。おいしそうだ。きみも仕事を頑張ってね」","en":"“Thank you. It looks delicious. Keep up the good work.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r82","rowIndex":82,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕が愛想良く言うと、","en":"I replied pleasantly.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r83","rowIndex":83,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ありがとうございます」","en":"“Thank you very much.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r84","rowIndex":84,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼は笑顔で頭を下げて去って、そこで僕はようやく溜息をついた。","en":"He smiled, bowed, and left. Only then did I finally let out a sigh.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r85","rowIndex":85,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　なんだか急に居心地が悪くなってしまった。","en":"All at once, I felt ill at ease.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r86","rowIndex":86,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　お茶を口に含んだが、それがうまいのかまずいのか僕の舌では判断をしかねた。","en":"I took a mouthful of tea, but I couldn’t tell whether it tasted good or bad.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r87","rowIndex":87,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　子供の頃に同じ名前の茶を飲まされた記憶がある。その時はこんな花など咲いていなかったが、もっとうまかったような気がする。主観的な味覚の記憶など、なんのたよりにもならないのだけれど。","en":"I remembered being made to drink tea by the same name as a child. It had not contained a flower like this, but I felt it had tasted better. Subjective memories of taste are no basis for judgment, of course.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r88","rowIndex":88,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ともあれ、温かい水分を腹に入れて、いくらか酔いの不快感は緩和されたようだ。","en":"In any event, putting some warm liquid in my stomach seemed to ease the discomfort of drunkenness a little.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r89","rowIndex":89,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ただ、それだけで軽快に動けるというわけでもない。身体にはまだ疲労感に似た気だるさが残り、今日これから<tips=9>Y地区</tips>を出て電車に乗って一人暮らしのアパートまで帰るというのは途方もない難事業に思えた。","en":"Still, that did not mean I was suddenly light on my feet. My body remained heavy with something like fatigue, and the thought of leaving <tips=9>Y District</tips>, catching a train, and making it all the way back to the apartment where I lived alone felt like a monumental undertaking.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r90","rowIndex":90,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=4>馬明</tips>に言われたとおり、ここに一泊くらいしてゆくか。それに、明日に父親と会うという話も、多少気にはなっている。","en":"Perhaps I should do as <tips=4>Ma Ming</tips> had said and stay here for a night. Besides, I was somewhat curious about seeing my father tomorrow.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r91","rowIndex":91,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕は父の詳しい病状を知らされてはいないが、けして治癒することがなく、そして死に至る病であることは知っている。","en":"I had not been told the details of my father's condition, but I knew that the disease could never be cured and would ultimately kill him.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r92","rowIndex":92,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　もう先が長くないというのなら、ここで帰ってしまうのはあまりにも非人情だろう。僕はどちらかと言えば情の薄い人間だが、これが言葉を交わす最後の機会になるのかもしれないと思えば、義理のような感情もわいてくる。","en":"If he truly had little time left, leaving now would be far too heartless. I’m not exactly sentimental, but if this might be our last chance to speak, even I could feel something like a sense of duty stirring in me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r93","rowIndex":93,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　いきさつはどうあれ他人ではないのだから、最後の言葉くらいは聞かなくてはいけない。","en":"Whatever our history, he was still family. I had to hear his final words, at least.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r94","rowIndex":94,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　どうあっても会いたくないという程強い拒絶があるわけじゃない。","en":"It wasn’t as though I felt so strongly that I would refuse to see him under any circumstances.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r95","rowIndex":95,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ただ、同じ街にいながらずっと疎遠だった肉親に会うというのは、なんとも気まずいものだ。","en":"Meeting a blood relative who had lived in the same city all along, yet from whom one had remained estranged, was simply awkward.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r96","rowIndex":96,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕はそれなりに独力で生きて来たつもりだけれど、彼と面会すれば否応なく偉大なボスの息子という従属的な立場に押し込められてしまう。","en":"I liked to think I had lived by my own strength, but the moment I met him, I would inevitably be forced into the subordinate role of the great boss’s son.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r97","rowIndex":97,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　どうにもしゃらくさい。","en":"The whole arrangement was intolerable.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r98","rowIndex":98,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それに、これは感情だけの問題でもない。","en":"Nor was this merely a matter of emotion.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r99","rowIndex":99,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　百歩譲って会うのは良いとしても、その傍らでは<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>の誰かがその場面を見守っているのだ。","en":"Even if I conceded that I should see him, someone from <tips=7>YS</tips> would be standing beside us, watching.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r100","rowIndex":100,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ということはつまり、これはただの親子の再会ではなく、<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>のボスとその御曹司の再会という形式的な意味を持ってしまうということになる。","en":"That meant this would not be a simple reunion between father and son. It would acquire the formal significance of a reunion between the boss of <tips=7>YS</tips> and its young master.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r101","rowIndex":101,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　何しろ、ボスの方は死を目前に控え、後継者問題が取り沙汰されている微妙な時期だ。","en":"The boss, after all, was on the brink of death, at the delicate moment when the question of his succession was on everyone’s lips.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r102","rowIndex":102,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　これでは、僕らが単に日常会話しかしなかったとしても、ただ出会ったというだけの情報でも、様々な憶測を呼んでしまうだろう。","en":"Under those circumstances, even if all we did was make ordinary small talk, the mere fact that we had met would invite all manner of speculation.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r103","rowIndex":103,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕は、もうギャングと関わりを持ちたくないっていうのに。","en":"When I wanted nothing more to do with the gangs.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r104","rowIndex":104,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それに、正直言って、弱った父親を見るのもいやなんだ。","en":"And to be honest, I didn’t want to see my father weakened.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r105","rowIndex":105,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そういったあれこれを考えると、このまま彼を見ないまま終わるという選択にも、一定の正しさがあるように思える。","en":"Considering all that, the choice to let things end without ever seeing him again seemed defensible in its own right.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r106","rowIndex":106,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　――しかし、そうした諸々の事情を考慮しても、やはり会うべきなんだろう。","en":"—And yet, even taking all those circumstances into account, I probably ought to see him.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r107","rowIndex":107,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　お茶を半分ほど飲んだところで、人混みの向こうから、一人の少女がやってくるのが目にはいる。","en":"I was halfway through the tea when I noticed a girl approaching from beyond the crowd.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r108","rowIndex":108,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女の埃だらけの頭髪はぼさぼさで、皮膚は生気のない青白い色で、痩せた身体には垢じみたブラウスを着、腰にはファッションと言いつくろえないくらいダメージを受けたデニムのスカートを穿き、汚れた足には底のすり減ったサンダルを履いている。","en":"Her dust-caked hair hung in tangles. Her skin was a lifeless bluish white. A grimy blouse covered her thin body, and at her waist she wore a denim skirt too badly damaged to pass off as fashion. On her dirty feet were sandals whose soles had worn thin.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r109","rowIndex":109,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　肩には大きなプラカードを担ぎ、そこには「神はすべてを愛している」という言葉が、下手くそな手書きの日本語と英語の両方で書かれている。","en":"A large placard rested on her shoulder. In clumsy handwritten Japanese and English, it declared: GOD LOVES ALL.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r110","rowIndex":110,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　少女の顔には笑顔が浮かんでいる。それも、小さな微笑みというようなものではなく、クスクスと肩を揺らして笑うのだ。","en":"The girl was smiling—not with any small, quiet smile, but with giggles that shook her shoulders.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r111","rowIndex":111,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ひとりぼっちで笑う彼女との関わりを避けるため、モーセが海を割るように周囲の人混みは割れる。","en":"To avoid any involvement with the girl laughing all by herself, the crowd parted around her as the sea had before Moses.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r112","rowIndex":112,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　少女は自分のために出来た道を、見て見ぬフリをする人々とすれ違いながら歩いて行く。肩のプラカードがいかにも重そうで、うつむき加減の彼女の顔は前髪で隠されて、笑う口元だけが見えている。","en":"The girl walked along the path made for her, passing people who pretended not to see. The placard on her shoulder looked terribly heavy, and her bowed face was hidden behind her bangs, leaving only her laughing mouth visible.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r113","rowIndex":113,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕が眺めていると、彼女は貴金属店の閉まったシャッターにプラカードを立てかけ、地べたの上に腰をおろした。","en":"As I watched, she leaned the placard against the closed shutter of a jewelry store and sat down on the ground.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r114","rowIndex":114,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そうしてこちらに体の前面を向けたので、僕ははじめてその胸にもメッセージの書かれた板きれがぶら下がっていることに気がついた。","en":"When she turned to face me, I noticed for the first time that another board bearing a message hung from her chest.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r115","rowIndex":115,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そこにはかすれかけた油性ペンの黒い文字でこう書かれている。","en":"Written on it in fading black permanent marker were the words:","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r116","rowIndex":116,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"『この子は身よりのない不幸な孤児で、<tips=17>タイプB</tips>の発症をし、さらに薬物中毒の治療中です。どうか、お恵みください』","en":"‘THIS GIRL IS AN UNFORTUNATE ORPHAN WITH NO FAMILY. SHE HAS DEVELOPED <tips=17>TYPE B</tips> AND IS ALSO UNDERGOING TREATMENT FOR DRUG ADDICTION. PLEASE GIVE WHAT YOU CAN.’","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r117","rowIndex":117,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　年の頃は、１３か、１４あたりか。中学生くらいに見える。","en":"She appeared to be thirteen or fourteen—about middle-school age.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r118","rowIndex":118,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　長い前髪の間から露わになった顔には、確かに<tips=17>タイプB</tips>発作時の特徴である金色の瞳が輝いている。笑いは先ほどよりも激しく、おかしくてたまらないといった具合に、大きな口を開けて笑っている。","en":"Through a gap in her long bangs, I could see that her eyes did indeed shine gold, the hallmark of a <tips=17>Type B</tips> episode. Her laughter had grown more violent, her mouth stretched wide as though nothing in the world could be funnier.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r119","rowIndex":119,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その合間に口元を動かして何か呟いているのは、幻聴や幻覚と会話をしているのかもしれない。","en":"Between bursts, her lips moved in a mutter. Perhaps she was conversing with auditory or visual hallucinations.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r120","rowIndex":120,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　この笑いも、幻覚も、<tips=17>タイプB</tips>特有の症状だ。特に理由のない笑いは最も特徴的で、<tips=17>タイプB</tips>発作が時に「笑い病」と呼ばれるのもここから来ている。","en":"Both the laughter and the hallucinations were symptoms peculiar to <tips=17>Type B</tips>. Laughter without any particular cause was the most characteristic of all; hence a <tips=17>Type B</tips> episode was sometimes called the “laughing sickness.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r121","rowIndex":121,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その腰に下げたヒモつきの缶カラは、本来は路上に置いて通行人から貰った金を入れるものだろうに、彼女はそれを設置することも忘れてうつろに中空を眺めている。","en":"The tin can hanging from her waist on a string was presumably meant to be set on the street for passersby to drop money into. She had forgotten even to put it out and stared vacantly into space.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r122","rowIndex":122,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　これが発作の影響か、薬物中毒の影響なのかはわからないが、重度の症状が顕れているのは間違いなさそうだ。この若さであそこまで進行してしまっては治療を受けたとしても長く生きるのは難しいし、たとえ長生き出来たとしてもその人生のほとんどを廃人として過ごすことになるだろう。","en":"I couldn’t tell whether her condition came from the episode or the drug addiction, but her symptoms were plainly severe. With the disease already this advanced at her age, even treatment was unlikely to buy her a long life. Even if she did live, she would spend most of it little more than a human wreck.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r123","rowIndex":123,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　せめて、あの缶カラを立てられればいいのに。","en":"If only she could at least put the can out.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r124","rowIndex":124,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そうすれば、あの重い発作も、幾ばくかの金銭をもたらして、彼女の手助けになってくれるかもしれないのだから。","en":"Then even that severe episode might bring in a little money and be of some help to her.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r125","rowIndex":125,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　普通あれくらいの状態になればどこかの病院に収容されるものだが、ここには逃げ場がなく、どんな状態でも働いて生きて行くことになる。","en":"Ordinarily, someone in that condition would be confined to a hospital. Here, however, there was nowhere to retreat to; whatever their condition, people had to work to survive.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r126","rowIndex":126,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　もちろん一人で働くことは出来ない。あのプラカードも、メッセージボードも、彼女が自分で制作したものではないだろう。あのみじめったらしい服だって、あるいは用意された衣装なのかもしれない。","en":"Naturally, she could not work alone. She was unlikely to have made either the placard or the message board herself. Even those wretched clothes might have been a costume prepared for her.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r127","rowIndex":127,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕は小さいときからこの街の裏通りにいたから、その辺りの事情はよく知っている。","en":"I had lived in this city’s back alleys from early childhood. I knew how these things worked.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r128","rowIndex":128,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　どこかに元締めがいて、それが彼女の仕事のためにこれらを持たせたのだ。彼女は一日の売り上げから決められた何割を差し出すかわりに、細々とした生活の世話をしてもらう。","en":"Somewhere there was a handler who had equipped her with these things for her work. She surrendered an agreed share of each day’s earnings, and in return the handler saw to her day-to-day needs.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r129","rowIndex":129,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　元締めはどこかのろくでなしであったり、病身の親であったり、さまざまだ。","en":"The handler might be some worthless brute, or an ailing parent, or any number of other people.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r130","rowIndex":130,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　だが、そのすべてが悪意によるものではなく、さしせまった家庭の必要性がそうさせている場合も多い。それが家庭の唯一の収入源だったりもする。","en":"Yet not every such arrangement arose from malice; often, an urgent household need compelled it. The child's earnings might be the family's only source of income.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r131","rowIndex":131,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　子供たちも、無理矢理やらされるものばかりではなく、自分の役割を自覚していることも多い。","en":"Nor were all the children simply forced into the work. Often, they understood the role they played.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r132","rowIndex":132,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　不思議なもので、どんなに症状が進んでも、人間にはまともな部分がいくらか残るものだ。","en":"Strangely, no matter how far the symptoms advance, some lucid part of a person remains.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r133","rowIndex":133,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ああして四六時中笑っている様子などを見ると、もはや感情が壊れているように見えるが、その奥には、ごく普通の感情があったりする。","en":"To see her laughing around the clock like that, one might think her emotions had broken beyond repair. Yet ordinary feelings could still lie beneath it all.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r134","rowIndex":134,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして、その残された部分で、己に出来る最後の稼ぎの手段として、こうした仕事を選ぶことだってある。","en":"And with that remaining part, a person might choose work like this as the last means of earning a living still open to them.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r135","rowIndex":135,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　かつてこの少女と同じような境遇であった、僕の友人たちの名誉のために言うが、彼らのすべてがただの可哀想な被害者というわけはなく、そのなかには自分の意志で勇気ある決断をした者だっている。","en":"I say this in defense of friends of mine who once lived in circumstances like this girl’s: not all of them were merely pitiful victims. Some made courageous choices of their own free will.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r136","rowIndex":136,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そこには人間の誇りがあり、僕はそれをとても美しいものだと思う。","en":"There was human pride in that, and I found it profoundly beautiful.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r137","rowIndex":137,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その誇りや美しさが、結局のところ、不幸に押し潰された諦めから生まれたのだとしてもだ。","en":"Even if, in the end, that pride and beauty were born from the resignation of people crushed by misery.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r138","rowIndex":138,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　けれど僕は、そうした美しさが大嫌いだ。そんな勇気は、本当ならば発揮されない方が良い。たとえ美しくなくとも、彼らが普通に生きていけるのならば、そちらの方がどれだけ素晴らしいことだろう？","en":"But I despise beauty of that sort. Courage like that should never have had to be exercised in the first place. Even without such beauty, if they could simply live ordinary lives, how much more wonderful would that be?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r139","rowIndex":139,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　この街には、この類の美しさがひしめいている。献身的に助け合う貧民の親子。騙され搾取され続けても誰も憎まない哀れな娼婦。路地で寝起きする子供たちに無償で食事を振る舞い続ける老人。これらを指摘して、無責任な連中が<tips=9>Y地区</tips>は人間らしい素晴らしい街だと賞賛する。","en":"This city is packed tight with beauty of that sort. Destitute parents and children devotedly helping one another. A wretched prostitute who hates no one though she is endlessly deceived and exploited. An old man who goes on feeding the children sleeping in the alleys without asking payment. Irresponsible people point to such things and praise <tips=9>Y District</tips> as a wonderful city, full of humanity.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r140","rowIndex":140,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　だが、何も知らないからそんなことが言えるんだ。","en":"But they can say that only because they know nothing.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r141","rowIndex":141,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　不意にくらくらと目眩がしたのは、依然として存在感を主張する体内のアルコールのせいではないだろう。","en":"The sudden wave of dizziness was probably not caused by the alcohol in my body that continued to assert its presence.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r142","rowIndex":142,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　あの少女がどういうつもりであの仕事をしているのかは知らないが、その姿を見ていると、この街に住んでいた頃にいつも胸の中にうずまいていた感情が、光景が、目の前に蘇ってくる。","en":"I didn’t know what the girl herself thought she was doing there. But as I watched her, the feelings that had always churned in my chest when I lived in this city—and all the sights bound up with them—rose again before my eyes.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r143","rowIndex":143,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　黄昏時にサッカーボールを蹴りながら歩いた帰り道。","en":"The road home at dusk, walking along and kicking a soccer ball.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r144","rowIndex":144,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ごめんなさい、ごめんなさい」と声が聞こえて掘っ立て小屋のなかを覗くと、やせ細った母親が、あの少女と同じようにメッセージボードをつけた子供を抱いて泣いていた。","en":"I heard a voice saying, “I'm sorry, I'm sorry.” When I peered into a shack, I saw an emaciated mother weeping as she held a child wearing a message board like the girl's.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r145","rowIndex":145,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　友だちと虫取りをしていた草むらで見つけた男女の死体。","en":"The bodies of a man and woman I found in the weeds while hunting insects with friends.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r146","rowIndex":146,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　二人とも拳銃で頭を撃ち抜かれながらも、固く抱きしめ合っていた。","en":"Both had been shot through the head, yet still clung tightly to one another.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r147","rowIndex":147,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そのまわりを、死臭にひかれた蝿がブンブンと舞っている。","en":"Flies drawn by the smell of death buzzed around them.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r148","rowIndex":148,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その年はカメムシの大量発生した年で、そこらじゅうにあの緑の昆虫が張り付いていた。","en":"That was also the year of a mass outbreak of stinkbugs, and the little green insects clung everywhere.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r149","rowIndex":149,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　たくさんの、たくさんのカメムシが。","en":"So many, so many stinkbugs.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r150","rowIndex":150,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　一匹は女の耳たぶの上を這い回り、別の一匹は男の眼窩からこぼれて乾きかけた眼球に張り付き、さらに頭にぽっかりあいた傷口の上まで歩いていた。","en":"One crawled over the woman's earlobe. Another clung to the half-dried eyeball spilled from the man's socket, then walked all the way to the gaping wound in his head.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r151","rowIndex":151,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　見ているこちらの顔や身体にもたかり、ポケットのハンカチで払おうとすると、酷い悪臭がした。","en":"They landed on my face and body too, and when I tried to brush them away with the handkerchief in my pocket, they gave off a terrible stench.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r152","rowIndex":152,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　用水路の向こうには地区で最も悲惨な連中が住んでいた。","en":"Beyond the irrigation canal lived the most wretched people in the district.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r153","rowIndex":153,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　昼間っからヤク中が路上に座り込んでいて、よそ者がうっかり足を踏み入れようものなら、連中は目の色を変えて取り囲み、財布や時計を奪う。","en":"Drug addicts sat in the street in broad daylight. If an outsider wandered in by mistake, their whole demeanor would change; they would surround the intruder and take his wallet and watch.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r154","rowIndex":154,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　アパートは住人によって勝手な増築改築が繰り返され、貼り付けられたトタン、飛び出たクギの頭、瓦礫をセメントで固めた壁——いびつなオブジェのようなシルエットを闇の中に作り出している。","en":"The apartment buildings had been extended and remodeled at whim by their residents: sheets of metal slapped into place, nailheads jutting out, walls made of rubble fixed in cement—their warped, sculptural silhouettes rising in the darkness.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r155","rowIndex":155,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕はある夜野良猫を追いかけてその地区に足を踏み入れてしまい、家と家の隙間に入り込んだところで猫を見失った。","en":"One night, chasing a stray cat, I strayed into that part of the city and lost it after squeezing into a gap between two houses.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r156","rowIndex":156,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　途方にくれて見上げたところで、換気扇から子供の笑い声と肉の焼ける音、それからスパイスの良い香りがして、僕の口の中には唾液が湧き、ぐうと腹が鳴る。","en":"At a loss, I looked up. From a ventilation fan came children's laughter, the sound of meat cooking, and the savory fragrance of spices. Saliva flooded my mouth, and my stomach growled.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r157","rowIndex":157,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　通りの方から銃声が聞こえる。痛みに苦しむうめき声のようなものも聞こえる。すぐ近くの家のなかの子供と母親は僕の知らない言語で話し合い、笑い合っている。","en":"Gunshots sounded from the street. I heard something like a groan of pain. In the house close beside me, a mother and child spoke and laughed together in a language I did not know.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r158","rowIndex":158,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　換気扇は平和な良い匂いを吐き出し続ける。","en":"The ventilation fan went on breathing out its peaceful, lovely smell.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r159","rowIndex":159,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕はお腹がすいてたまらない。","en":"I was unbearably hungry.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r160","rowIndex":160,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　あれは何という料理を作っていたんだろう？","en":"I wonder what they were cooking.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r161","rowIndex":161,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　――いつの間にか僕は目を閉じていたらしい。ハッとして、すぐに時計を見る。","en":"—At some point, it seemed, I had closed my eyes. I came to with a start and immediately checked the time.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r162","rowIndex":162,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そう長い時間は過ぎていない。ということは、この眠りはいつもの『あれ』ではなかったのだろう。一瞬ひやりとしたが、僕はほっと溜息をつく。","en":"Not much time had passed. So this could not have been the usual “thing.” My blood ran cold for an instant, but then I sighed with relief.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r163","rowIndex":163,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　これはアルコールのせいで、ほんの一瞬うたた寝をしただけに違いない。それだけのことだ。","en":"It had to be the alcohol—a momentary doze, nothing more. That was all.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r164","rowIndex":164,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　嘔気はだいぶ収まっている。僕はそろそろ行こうと立ち上がる。","en":"The nausea had mostly subsided. It was about time to go, so I stood.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r165","rowIndex":165,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　会計を済ませ、路上に戻ったところで<tips=4>馬明</tips>に電話をかけた。","en":"I paid, returned to the street, and called <tips=4>Ma Ming</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r166","rowIndex":166,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「やあ調子はどうだい？」","en":"“Hey. How are you doing?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r167","rowIndex":167,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"『いいとも、おかげさまでな！　会場のみんなも、大笑いしてくれたものさ』","en":"‘Great, thanks to you! Everyone at the reception got a good laugh out of it.’","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r168","rowIndex":168,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=4>馬明</tips>は腹立ちをまぎらわせるように電話口で笑った。僕は素知らぬ態度で言葉を返す。","en":"<tips=4>Ma Ming</tips> laughed into the phone as though trying to work off his irritation. I answered with perfect innocence.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r169","rowIndex":169,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それは良かったね。それで、ちょっと気が変わったんだけど、帰る前にあの人に会って行こうと思うんだ」","en":"“Glad to hear it. Anyway, I’ve changed my mind. I think I’ll see him before I leave.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r170","rowIndex":170,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"『ふん、そう言うと思っていたぞ。ホテルに居てくれれば使いを出す。午前１１時前には迎えが到着するだろう』","en":"‘Hmph. I knew you would. Stay at the hotel and I’ll send someone. Your ride should arrive before eleven in the morning.’","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r171","rowIndex":171,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「わかった。ホテルの場所は？」","en":"“All right. Where’s the hotel?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r172","rowIndex":172,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"『Ｂ−３通りのホテルだ。名前はなんだっけな……あとで部下にメールをさせる。ああ、それとも、<tips=41>グランドタワー</tips>に泊まるか？　兄貴は今日はもう休むが、<tips=44><ruby=シウキウ>筱喬</ruby></tips>と積もる話もあるだろう？』","en":"‘On B-3 Street. What was the name...? I'll have one of my men text you later. Or would you rather stay at the <tips=41>Grand Tower</tips>? Big Brother is turning in for the day, but surely you and <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> have plenty to catch up on.’","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r173","rowIndex":173,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「冗談じゃない。ホテルの名前を教えてくれ」","en":"“Not a chance. Just tell me the name of the hotel.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r174","rowIndex":174,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"『そうか、相変わらずあそこが嫌いなんだな。まあ、いずれ好きになるさ』","en":"‘I see. You still hate the place, then. Well, you'll come to like it eventually.’","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r175","rowIndex":175,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうは思えないね。……あとそうだ。さっき言い忘れていたんだけれど」","en":"“I doubt that. ... Ah, one more thing. I forgot to say it earlier.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r176","rowIndex":176,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"『なんだ？』","en":"‘What?’","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r177","rowIndex":177,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「お孫さんの誕生おめでとう。お祖父ちゃんになるんだね」","en":"“Congratulations on the grandchild. You’re going to be a grandfather.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r178","rowIndex":178,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"『お祖父ちゃん！　まったく、ロクなもんじゃない。時が過ぎるというのはいやなもんだな。すっかり年寄りになったみたいな気分だ』","en":"‘A grandpa! God, what a miserable business. Time is a terrible thing. Makes me feel ancient.’","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r179","rowIndex":179,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　電話の向こうで<tips=4>馬明</tips>が苦い顔をしているのが想像出来た。","en":"I could picture the sour look on <tips=4>Ma Ming’s</tips> face at the other end of the line.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r180","rowIndex":180,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しかし、こんなことを言いながらも本心では喜んでいるのだろう。僕は彼のことはよく知っている。","en":"For all his words, however, he was surely delighted at heart. I knew him well.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r181","rowIndex":181,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　電話を切ってホテルの場所を報せるメールが届くのを待っていると、","en":"I ended the call and waited for the message giving me the hotel’s location.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r182","rowIndex":182,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あ－、<tips=1>亮</tips>！　<tips=1>亮</tips>じゃないか」","en":"“Ah—<tips=1>Ryo</tips>! Is that you, <tips=1>Ryo</tips>?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r183","rowIndex":183,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　良く通る声で名を呼ばれた。","en":"Someone called my name in a voice that carried over the street.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r184","rowIndex":184,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　振り返ると、そこにいたのは思った通りの人物――<tips=10>見土道夫</tips>だった。","en":"I turned, and found exactly the man I expected: <tips=10>Michio Mido</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r185","rowIndex":185,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いやあ、久しぶりだなあ。少し痩せたんじゃないかい？　ちっとも連絡しないから、どうしてるかなっていつも心配していたんだ」","en":"“It’s been ages! Haven’t you lost some weight? You never get in touch, so I’ve been worried about how you’re doing.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫","displayName":"Michio Mido","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r186","rowIndex":186,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「お前に心配される筋合いはないだろう」","en":"“Why is that any concern of yours?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r187","rowIndex":187,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうか？　ちゃんとバランス良く食事を食べてるかとか、学校で新しい友だちは作れたのかとか、気になって仕方ないことはたくさんある」","en":"“Really? I can’t help worrying about all sorts of things. Are you eating a balanced diet? Have you made any new friends at school?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫","displayName":"Michio Mido","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r188","rowIndex":188,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……なんでそんなことを心配されなきゃいけないんだ」","en":"“...Why should you be worrying about any of that?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r189","rowIndex":189,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そりゃ、お前はしっかりしているようで抜けてるからな」","en":"“Because you look like you have everything together, but you’re surprisingly scatterbrained.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫","displayName":"Michio Mido","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r190","rowIndex":190,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕は黙ってしまうが、彼は僕の沈黙の理由などまったく興味がない。","en":"I fell silent. Michio took no interest whatever in the reason.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r191","rowIndex":191,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ちょうど最近、お前のことをよく話していたところなんだよ。思えば今日出会う予感があったのかもね。いやあ、会えて良かった」","en":"“We've been talking about you a lot lately, as it happens. Maybe some part of me knew I'd meet you today. I'm certainly glad I did.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫","displayName":"Michio Mido","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r192","rowIndex":192,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　荷台に大きな荷物をくくりつけたシティサイクルにまたがった<tips=10>道夫</tips>は、のどかな笑顔で僕の肩を叩く。","en":"<tips=10>Michio</tips> sat astride a city bike with a great load tied over the rear wheel and patted my shoulder with an easy smile.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r193","rowIndex":193,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼はかつてこの街の少年たちのリーダーで、そして僕にとっては親しい友人だ。","en":"He had once been the leader of the boys in this city, and he was a close friend of mine.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r194","rowIndex":194,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「やっぱり故郷が懐かしくて帰って来たのか？　学校で勉強なんかしてたって面白くないもんなあ」","en":"“So you came back because you missed your old home after all? Studying away at school can't be any fun.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫","displayName":"Michio Mido","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r195","rowIndex":195,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「結婚式に呼ばれたから、ちょっと来ただけだ」","en":"“I was invited to a wedding, so I only came for a short visit.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r196","rowIndex":196,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうか、それはめでたい。で、誰の結婚式なの？　おれが知らないってことは、お前の家の関係か？」","en":"“A wedding! That’s happy news. Whose was it? If I don’t know about it, it must have been one of your family’s people.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫","displayName":"Michio Mido","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r197","rowIndex":197,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ああ」","en":"“Yeah.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r198","rowIndex":198,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕は頷いた。<tips=10>道夫</tips>は、僕が自分から素性を明かした、この街では数少ない相手の一人である。","en":"I nodded. <tips=10>Michio</tips> was one of the few people in this city I had chosen to tell the truth about myself.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r199","rowIndex":199,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「へー。お前、そういう集まりに顔出すの大嫌いだったのに、大人になったもんだなあ」","en":"“Huh. You used to hate showing your face at those gatherings. Look at you, all grown up.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫","displayName":"Michio Mido","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r200","rowIndex":200,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=10>道夫</tips>は感心したように頷いている。","en":"<tips=10>Michio</tips> nodded, apparently impressed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r201","rowIndex":201,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……まあ、そんな話はどうだっていいんだよ。それより、その荷物はなんだ？　識らない間に配達屋にでもなったんだろうか」","en":"“...Well, never mind all that. What's that package? Did you become a deliveryman when I wasn't looking?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r202","rowIndex":202,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ああ、これか」","en":"“Oh, this?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫","displayName":"Michio Mido","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r203","rowIndex":203,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=10>道夫</tips>ははにかんで荷台のダンボール箱を叩くと、紐をといて中身を見せてくれた。","en":"<tips=10>Michio</tips> smiled shyly and slapped the cardboard box on the bicycle’s rear rack. Then he undid the cord and showed me the contents.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r204","rowIndex":204,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そこには黒ごまをまぶした菓子のようなものが、一つ一つ透明なフィルムで包装した形で並べられている。","en":"Inside were rows of what looked like black-sesame sweets, each one wrapped in clear plastic.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r205","rowIndex":205,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なんだコレ？　<ruby=チーマーカオ>芝麻球</ruby>か？」","en":"“What are these? Sesame balls?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r206","rowIndex":206,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ほら」","en":"“Here.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫","displayName":"Michio Mido","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r207","rowIndex":207,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=10>道夫</tips>は一つ放り投げる。僕はそれをキャッチして、彼に言われるまま一口囓った。ゴマに包まれていたのは黒い餡を包んだ白いもっちりとした生地で、口のなかいっぱいに甘味がし、鼻先に香ばしいにおいがする。","en":"<tips=10>Michio</tips> tossed me one. I caught it and, at his prompting, bit into it. Beneath the sesame coating was a chewy white dough wrapped around a dark filling. Sweetness filled my mouth, and a toasted fragrance rose to my nose.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r208","rowIndex":208,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「うまい」","en":"“This is good.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r209","rowIndex":209,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうだろう？」","en":"“Right?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫","displayName":"Michio Mido","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r210","rowIndex":210,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「でもこれ、やっぱり芝麻球のアレンジじゃないの？」","en":"“But isn't this still just a variation on a sesame ball?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r211","rowIndex":211,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いやあ、それがちがうんだな。まったく、食い物にうるさいわりには、意外と味がわからないんだな。あの中華ごま団子とは、見た目は似てるが使ってる材料も製法も全然違うのだよ。揚げてもいないし、生地は饅頭に近い。これはおれと仲間で独自に開発した新製法の菓子、『<tips=71>グレートホール饅頭</tips>』っていうんだ」","en":"“Ah, but that's where you're wrong. For someone so fussy about food, you have a surprisingly poor palate. It may look like a Chinese sesame ball, but the ingredients and preparation are entirely different. It isn't fried, and the dough is closer to a steamed bun. This is an original sweet my partners and I developed with a new process: the <tips=71>Great Hole Bun</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫","displayName":"Michio Mido","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r212","rowIndex":212,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「おい、そうやって人の肩を気軽に叩くのやめてくれよ。頭に響く。酒を飲み過ぎて、頭蓋骨のなかでオーケストラが騒いでるみたいにガンガンとするんだ」","en":"“Would you stop patting me on the shoulder like that? It goes straight to my head. I drank too much, and my skull is pounding like there’s an orchestra making a racket inside it.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r213","rowIndex":213,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「アハハ、そんなのおれは知らないよ！　それよりも、聞いてくれよ<tips=1>亮</tips>。これはとても重要なビジネスなんだよ。おれの人生を賭けてるんだ」","en":"“Ahaha! How was I supposed to know? Never mind that—listen to me, <tips=1>Ryo</tips>. This is a very important business. I'm staking my life on it.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫","displayName":"Michio Mido","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r214","rowIndex":214,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「お前はしょっちゅう人生を賭けてるな」","en":"“You stake your life on something every other week.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r215","rowIndex":215,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうさ。なんだって、全力を尽くさなきゃ気持ちが悪いからな」","en":"“I do. Whatever I’m doing, I feel wrong unless I give it everything I’ve got.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫","displayName":"Michio Mido","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r216","rowIndex":216,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=10>道夫</tips>は白い歯を見せてさわやかに笑い、","en":"<tips=10>Michio</tips> showed his white teeth in a bright smile.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r217","rowIndex":217,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なあ<tips=1>亮</tips>。この街には、いい年をしてるのにまともに働きもしないでぶらぶらしてる若者やおっさんが多すぎると思わんか？　そういう人らがね、くだらない犯罪をおかしたり、お前のおやじさんの組織に入ったりしてる。その一方で、働きたくたって働けない<tips=17>タイプB</tips>やら<tips=16>タイプA</tips>やらもたくさんいる。そいつらもお前のおやじさんの組織に入る。つまり、社会に行き場がないやつは大体お前のおやじさんの組織に入るんだ。これじゃいかんと思わないか？」","en":"“Listen, <tips=1>Ryo</tips>. Don’t you think this city has far too many young people and middle-aged men who are old enough to know better but drift around without proper jobs? They end up committing some stupid crime or joining your father’s organization. Meanwhile, there are plenty of <tips=17>Type Bs</tips> and <tips=16>Type As</tips> who want to work but can’t. They join your father’s organization too. In other words, most people with nowhere else to go in society end up in your father’s organization. Don’t you think something’s wrong with that?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫","displayName":"Michio Mido","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r218","rowIndex":218,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　往来でそんなに大きな声で話すものではないだろう。","en":"He really should not have been talking that loudly in the middle of the street.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r219","rowIndex":219,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まあ、よくないな。あの組織に入るようじゃ。そりゃあよくない」","en":"“Well, that's not good. If they're joining that organization, that's definitely not good.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r220","rowIndex":220,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうだろう？　おれはこれを<tips=9>Y地区</tips>の新しい名産品にしてな、じゃんじゃん売って、そいつらみんなに仕事を与えてやろうと思ってる。饅頭ってのもいいだろ？　甘い物って、食べるとなんだか平和な気持ちになるからな。この街も、いや、世界というものはあまりにも殺伐としすぎていると思うんさ。そこに、この平和な食べ物を売ることで、みんな幸せになる。それが今のおれの人生の目標だ」","en":"“Exactly! I mean to make these a new specialty of <tips=9>Y District</tips>, sell them hand over fist, and give all those people jobs. Buns are perfect, don't you think? Sweets make you feel peaceful when you eat them. This city—no, the world itself—is much too brutal. We'll sell this peaceful food in the middle of it and make everyone happy. That is the purpose of my life now.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫","displayName":"Michio Mido","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r221","rowIndex":221,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=10>道夫</tips>は目をきらきらと輝かせて大いに語る。","en":"<tips=10>Michio</tips> held forth, his eyes shining.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r222","rowIndex":222,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　あまりにも自信に満ちあふれているので、もう一口『<tips=71>グレートホール饅頭</tips>』を食べてみる。","en":"His confidence was so complete that I took another bite of the <tips=71>Great Hole Bun</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r223","rowIndex":223,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　なかの餡は、こしあんに干し柿と、ごま油かなにかを混ぜ込んでいるのだろうか？　これが<tips=10>道夫</tips>の言う工夫なのだろうか？　そんな感じがする。","en":"Had the smooth bean paste been mixed with dried persimmon and sesame oil, or something of that sort? Was this what <tips=10>Michio</tips> meant by his innovation? It seemed so.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r224","rowIndex":224,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　旨いことは旨い。他の甘い物と比較して特別旨いのかどうかは僕にはわからない。","en":"It was certainly good. Whether it was exceptionally good compared with other sweets, I could not say.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r225","rowIndex":225,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=10>道夫</tips>の人生だから好きにすればいいさ。だけれど『<tips=71>グレートホール饅頭</tips>』というネーミングはどうなんだ」","en":"“It’s your life, <tips=10>Michio</tips>, so do as you like. But what kind of name is <tips=71>Great Hole Bun</tips>?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r226","rowIndex":226,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「この街にふさわしいし、インパクトもあるだろ？　世界でも数少ない謎の大穴<tips=8>グレートホール</tips>がすぐ近くにあるんだから、これを名前に使わない手がない。むしろ、この名前をはじめに思いついて、そのあとでふさわしい商品を開発したくらいなんよ。なあ、おれってアイデアマンじゃないか？　お前のやたらと厳しい目で見ても、思わず褒めたくなるでしょう？」","en":"“It suits this city, and it has impact. One of the world's few mysterious chasms, the <tips=8>Great Hole</tips>, is right beside us. We'd be fools not to use it in the name. In fact, I thought of the name first and developed a suitable product afterward. Aren't I a man of ideas? Even through that absurdly critical eye of yours, you must feel the urge to praise me.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫","displayName":"Michio Mido","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r227","rowIndex":227,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ふーん」","en":"“Hmm.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r228","rowIndex":228,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それだけか」","en":"“Is that all?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫","displayName":"Michio Mido","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r229","rowIndex":229,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ああ」","en":"“Yeah.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r230","rowIndex":230,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「素っ気ないなあ」","en":"“Cold as ever.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫","displayName":"Michio Mido","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r231","rowIndex":231,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=10>道夫</tips>は不満げに顔を顰める。","en":"<tips=10>Michio</tips> frowned, plainly disgruntled.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r232","rowIndex":232,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なあ<tips=1>亮</tips>。おれはなあ、この街を変えたいんだよ。この<tips=9>Y地区</tips>は、確かに自由があって、いろんな素晴らしい人間が住んでいる良い街だけど、その反面あまりにも悲惨なことが多すぎる。お前が昔からこの街に対してイライラしてたのが理解出来なかったけれど、最近は少しわかるところもあるんだ。それをなんとかしたいと思ってさ」","en":"“Listen, <tips=1>Ryo</tips>. I want to change this city. <tips=9>Y District</tips> is a good place. There’s freedom here, and all kinds of wonderful people live here. But at the same time, far too many terrible things happen. I never understood why this city always made you so angry, but lately I’ve begun to see some of what you meant. I want to do something about it.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫","displayName":"Michio Mido","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r233","rowIndex":233,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そう言って何か訴えかけるように僕を見るが、僕は返事をしないで黙っている。すると彼はまた口を開き、","en":"He looked at me as though trying to appeal to me, but I said nothing. After a moment, he spoke again:","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r234","rowIndex":234,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……あのさあ、だから、お前も手伝ってくれないか？　この仕事をさ」","en":"“...So, look, would you help me with this?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫","displayName":"Michio Mido","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r235","rowIndex":235,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いやだよ」","en":"“No.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r236","rowIndex":236,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　と僕はきっぱりと言った。","en":"I said it flatly.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r237","rowIndex":237,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そう言わないでさ。大学ってのはあとでもまた続けられるんだろ？　まず、ここを変えるのが、この街で生まれたおれたちのやることなんじゃないか？」","en":"“Come on. You can always go back to college later, can't you? Shouldn't changing this place come first for those of us born here?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫","displayName":"Michio Mido","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r238","rowIndex":238,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「冗談じゃない。僕は全然興味がない」","en":"“Not a chance. I have no interest at all.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r239","rowIndex":239,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「冷たいなあ」","en":"“That's cold.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫","displayName":"Michio Mido","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r240","rowIndex":240,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=10>道夫</tips>はがっくりと肩を落とす。","en":"<tips=10>Michio's</tips> shoulders slumped.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r241","rowIndex":241,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　いや、当たり前じゃないか。何が悲しくてまんじゅう売りなんかしなくてはいけないんだ。","en":"No, of course not. Why on earth should I have to sell buns?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r242","rowIndex":242,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そんなものをいくら売ったって街が変わるはずもないじゃないか。","en":"Selling any number of those things could never change the city.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r243","rowIndex":243,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=10>道夫</tips>はこのやり方で他のヤツを魔法に掛けたように味方にするけれども、僕には通用しない。","en":"<tips=10>Michio</tips> uses this approach to bring other people over to his side as though casting a spell, but it does not work on me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r244","rowIndex":244,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まあ、今はそういう時期なんだろう。でもそのうち気がつくはずさ。学校で学問だとかなんだとか、でかくて小難しいことを考えるよりも、自分を生んだ街の方が大事だってな。気が変わったらいつでも言ってくれよ。そうしたら仲間に入れてやるからな」","en":"“Well, maybe you’re just going through a phase. Sooner or later you’ll realize that the city you were born in matters more than studying at school and filling your head with grand, complicated ideas. Whenever you change your mind, let me know. I’ll let you join us.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫","displayName":"Michio Mido","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r245","rowIndex":245,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=10>道夫</tips>は悠然と笑っている。どうせ、どう話したって僕の考えなんかわかりゃしないんだ。","en":"<tips=10>Michio</tips> smiled serenely. No matter how I explained myself, he would never understand what I thought.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r246","rowIndex":246,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕は溜息をつき、そして気がつくと、携帯電話にメールが届いていた。","en":"I sighed. At that moment, I noticed that a message had arrived on my phone.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r247","rowIndex":247,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「やっと今日の宿のアドレスが届いた」","en":"“At last. The address for tonight’s hotel.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r248","rowIndex":248,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どこに泊まるんだ？」","en":"“Where are you staying?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫","displayName":"Michio Mido","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r249","rowIndex":249,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「言わないよ。のんきに訪ねられても困るからね。まあ、久しぶりに近況を聞けて良かった。またね」","en":"“I'm not telling you. I don't want you dropping in without a care in the world. Still, I'm glad I heard what you've been doing. See you.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r250","rowIndex":250,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕がそう言って話を打ち切ろうとすると、","en":"I tried to end the conversation there.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r251","rowIndex":251,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なあ、本当にこの街に戻るつもりはないのか？」","en":"“Do you truly have no intention of coming back?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫","displayName":"Michio Mido","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r252","rowIndex":252,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼は真顔で僕を見つめる。","en":"He stared at me, suddenly serious.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r253","rowIndex":253,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ないよ」","en":"“No.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r254","rowIndex":254,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「戻ってくれよ。そして一緒にやろう。きっと楽しいぜ」","en":"“Come back. We’ll do it together. It will be fun, I promise.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫","displayName":"Michio Mido","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r255","rowIndex":255,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「もしかしたら楽しいかもしれない。でも、もう僕は、そういう時代は終わったんだよ」","en":"“Perhaps it would be. But that part of my life is over.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r256","rowIndex":256,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕はきっぱりと言ってから、","en":"I said it firmly, then added,","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r257","rowIndex":257,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「今の僕の心はこの街のごちゃごちゃしたものに対してあまりにも冷淡だ。たとえば今目の前でヤク中が現れて、<tips=57>滑走路通り</tips>の通行人を片っ端からナイフで襲ったとしても、ふんと頷いて通り過ぎるだけだろう」","en":"“My heart is far too cold now toward all the mess in this city. If a drug addict appeared right in front of me and started stabbing every passerby on <tips=57>Runway Street</tips>, I’d probably just grunt, nod, and walk on.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r258","rowIndex":258,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いやあ、それは嘘だろうさ」","en":"“Come on. You know that isn’t true.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫","displayName":"Michio Mido","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r259","rowIndex":259,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「嘘じゃないさ。僕も大人になったんだよ」","en":"“It isn’t. I grew up too.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r260","rowIndex":260,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕はそれだけ言うと、彼に背を向けて歩き始めた。<tips=10>道夫</tips>は僕の背後で溜息をつき、そして自転車で去ってゆく音が聞こえる。","en":"With that, I turned my back and walked away. Behind me, <tips=10>Michio</tips> sighed. Then I heard his bicycle receding.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r261","rowIndex":261,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　身体はまだ重かった。頭のなかにどんよりとした不快感がある。","en":"My body remained heavy, and a dull discomfort hung inside my head.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r262","rowIndex":262,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　時間があればデータ整理をしようとバッグの中にパソコンを持参していたが、この分だと今夜のホテルで作業を行うのは難しそうだ。明日朝早く起きてやるしかないだろう。","en":"I had brought my computer in my bag, intending to organize data if I found time. In this condition, working at the hotel tonight looked unlikely. I would have to rise early and do it tomorrow.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r263","rowIndex":263,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　酒など飲むから一日を無駄にしてしまったのだ。自己嫌悪の気持ちは確かにあるけれども、責めていても仕方がないので、こんな日があってもいいだろうと開き直ることにした。","en":"Drinking had wasted an entire day. I certainly felt some self-loathing, but blaming myself would do no good, so I decided to shrug off the guilt and tell myself that one such day was acceptable.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r264","rowIndex":264,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　こういった機会がなければ、あまりのんびりすることも出来ないのだから。","en":"Without an occasion like this, I would rarely have the chance to take things slowly.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r265","rowIndex":265,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ふと見ると、さっきのプラカードを持った<tips=17>タイプB</tips>の少女のところに身なりの良い老紳士が立ち止まっている。","en":"I happened to glance over and saw a well-dressed elderly gentleman standing before the placard-carrying <tips=17>Type B</tips> girl from earlier.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r266","rowIndex":266,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　紳士は笑顔を作って座り込んだ少女に話しかけるが、彼女はぽかんと口を開けたままその顔を見上げるだけで言葉への反応を見せない。","en":"The gentleman put on a smile and tried talking to the girl on the ground. She merely stared up at his face, mouth hanging open, and showed no response to his words.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r267","rowIndex":267,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　紳士は言い聞かせるのをやめて、その手を取る。少女は振り払う。そして笑う。","en":"He stopped trying to reason with her and took her hand. The girl pulled it free. Then she laughed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r268","rowIndex":268,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　次に紳士は少女の腰の缶カラに、折りたたんだ紙幣を入れてから手を取る。今度は、少女は手を引かれるまま立ち上がった。顔には笑顔が張り付いている。","en":"Next, the gentleman placed a folded banknote in the can at her waist and took her hand. This time, the girl let him draw her to her feet. The smile remained plastered on her face.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r269","rowIndex":269,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　二人は通りの向こうへ消えて行き、少女の居た場所には「神はすべてを愛している」と書かれたプラカードが残される。","en":"The two disappeared down the street. Where the girl had been, the placard declaring GOD LOVES ALL remained behind.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r270","rowIndex":270,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=4>馬明</tips>の使いは見たことのないブラジル人だった。","en":"The man <tips=4>Ma Ming</tips> sent for me was a Brazilian I had never seen before.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r271","rowIndex":271,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　他の幹部が自分と同じ出自の者で部下を固めるのが多いのに比べて<tips=4>馬明</tips>は全くこだわりというものがなかったから、どんな肌の色でも宗教でも国籍でも気にせず採用するのだが、それでもブラジル人の場合は<tips=35>ジョゼ・フェルナンデス</tips>のところに行くのが普通だから珍しい。","en":"Unlike other officers, many of whom filled their ranks with people of their own background, <tips=4>Ma Ming</tips> cared nothing for such things. He hired without regard to skin color, religion, or nationality. Even so, a Brazilian in his service was unusual, since Brazilians ordinarily went to <tips=35>José Fernandes</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r272","rowIndex":272,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　車を運転する彼に尋ねてみると、案の定最初は<tips=35>フェルナンデス</tips>のところに居たのだと語った。","en":"I asked him as he drove, and, sure enough, he told me he had originally been with <tips=35>Fernandes</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r273","rowIndex":273,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　２年ほど前に仲間たちとうまくいかなくなってそこを辞め、その後<tips=4>馬明</tips>に拾われたのだと言う。","en":"He had fallen out with his companions about two years earlier and left; <tips=4>Ma Ming</tips> had taken him in afterward.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r274","rowIndex":274,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あそこは、娘しかいないっすからねえ」","en":"“There are only daughters over there, you see.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r275","rowIndex":275,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=35>フェルナンデス</tips>にはあのやかましい三人の娘がいるが、息子はいない。将来の後継者はおそらく三人娘の誰かの結婚相手になるのだろうと目されていた。","en":"<tips=35>Fernandes</tips> had those three noisy daughters, but no sons. His eventual successor was expected to be the man who married one of the three.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r276","rowIndex":276,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　で、最近その三人娘が年頃になったということで、どうも<tips=75>フェルナンデス・ファミリー</tips>の内部は派閥なども出来てややこしいことになっているようだ。","en":"And now that the three girls had recently come of age, factions had apparently formed within the <tips=75>Fernandes Family</tips>, making things rather complicated.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r277","rowIndex":277,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そこで、頭の悪いおれは、どうもうまくやれなくて」","en":"“And me being none too bright, I couldn’t make it work.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r278","rowIndex":278,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そのブラジル人は笑いながらそう言った。","en":"The Brazilian laughed as he said it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r279","rowIndex":279,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「偉大なボスがいても、こういうのはごちゃごちゃとしてしまうものなんですな」","en":"“Even with a great boss in charge, matters like this always seem to turn into a tangle.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r280","rowIndex":280,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼の言葉に僕は自分の父のことを思い出したが、この陽気なギャングにはそうした意図はないようだった。","en":"His words made me think of my father, though the cheerful gangster seemed to have intended no such reference.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r281","rowIndex":281,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕が返事をしなくとも、彼は一人で勝手に話し続ける。","en":"He went on talking by himself, despite receiving no answer from me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r282","rowIndex":282,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　こういう鈍いところが、<tips=35>フェルナンデス</tips>のところにいた彼を苦しくしたのだろう。","en":"It was probably this obtuseness of his that had made life so difficult for him while he was with <tips=35>Fernandes</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r283","rowIndex":283,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まだジョゼさんが元気だからいいものの、急に病気にでもなったらどうなるか。娘さんはまだ全員独身で相手がいない。さっさと決めちゃえばいいような気がしますが、ただの結婚じゃないから難しいんでしょうねえ」","en":"“José is still healthy, so they’re fine for now, but what happens if he suddenly falls ill? All three daughters are still unmarried, and none of them has anyone lined up. You’d think they should hurry up and settle it, but I suppose it’s complicated when it isn’t just a marriage.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r284","rowIndex":284,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうだろうね」","en":"“I suppose so.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r285","rowIndex":285,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　話題に深入りしたくない僕は適当に相槌を打つ。","en":"Not wishing to get drawn any deeper into the subject, I offered a noncommittal response.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r286","rowIndex":286,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それで、実はおれはね、<tips=2>阿亮</tips>が三人のうち誰かと結婚すれば、すっきりすると思ってるんですよ」","en":"“And honestly, I think everything would sort itself out if <tips=2>Ah Leung</tips> married one of the three.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r287","rowIndex":287,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　と彼が言うのは、別に目新しいことではない。ずっと昔から、将来僕が彼女たちの誰かと結ばれれば組織のためになると言われたものだ。<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>の主流派である元<tips=69>義勝</tips>の<tips=76>香港派</tips>と、多くの南米人を束ねる<tips=75>フェルナンデス・ファミリー</tips>が血縁になれば確かにこれほど組織にとって有意義なことはないだろう。","en":"What he was saying was nothing new. For years, people had told me that the organization would benefit if I eventually married one of those women. If the <tips=76>Hong Kong faction</tips>—the former <tips=69>Yisheng</tips>, now the mainstream of <tips=7>YS</tips>—became kin to the <tips=75>Fernandes Family</tips>, which united many South Americans, nothing could be more advantageous to the organization.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r288","rowIndex":288,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼の言葉に何も返さずに黙っていると、そのまま話を続ける。","en":"When I remained silent and gave him no answer, he simply continued.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r289","rowIndex":289,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ねえ、いいアイデアじゃないっすか？　もしそうなるとしたら、<tips=2>阿亮</tips>は誰がいいですか？　おれは、次女の<tips=37>アナ・クララ</tips>なんかが知的な感じがして……あっ、この野郎！　割り込みするんじゃねえ！」","en":"“Come on, isn't it a good idea? If it did happen, which one would you choose, <tips=2>Ah Leung</tips>? I think the second daughter, <tips=37>Ana Clara</tips>, has an intelligent air— Hey, bastard! Don't cut me off!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r290","rowIndex":290,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼は舌打ちをしてクラクションを鳴らすと、それまでの話は忘れたかのように、教会通りに新しく出来た旨いアイスクリーム屋の話をはじめた。","en":"He clicked his tongue and sounded the horn. Then, as if he had forgotten the entire conversation, he began telling me about an excellent new ice-cream shop on Church Street.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r291","rowIndex":291,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして車は目的の場所へ辿り着いた。","en":"Then we reached our destination.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r292","rowIndex":292,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"『<tips=41>グランドタワー</tips>』と呼ばれるその建物は３５階建てであり、特別高層というわけでもないが、<tips=9>Y地区</tips>には他に巨大なビルがないのでよく目立つ。","en":"The building known as the <tips=41>Grand Tower</tips> stood thirty-five stories tall. It was not exceptionally tall as buildings went, but <tips=9>Y District</tips> had no other enormous buildings, so it stood out.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r293","rowIndex":293,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　この地域で最も大きな建物は、わかりやすいランドマークであるというだけでなく、<tips=9>Y地区</tips>で最も恐れられている場所でもある。","en":"The largest building in the district was not only an obvious landmark but also the most feared place in <tips=9>Y District</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r294","rowIndex":294,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　というのは、この建物こそが地域最大のマフィア組織<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>の根城であったからだ。","en":"That was because this very building was the stronghold of <tips=7>YS</tips>, the region's largest mafia organization.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r295","rowIndex":295,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ここには組織の本部事務所があり、さらに<tips=81>龍頭</tips>である<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>及びその家族、そして部下の<tips=76>香港派</tips>のメンバーが暮らしている。また彼らを相手にする飲食店や雑貨屋などの業者も入っており、さながらこのビル自体が一つの街のようだった。","en":"The organization's headquarters were here, and the <tips=81>Longtou</tips>, <tips=3>Chris Tse</tips>, lived here with his family and members of the <tips=76>Hong Kong faction</tips> under him. Restaurants, general stores, and other businesses catering to them also occupied the building, making it almost a city unto itself.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r296","rowIndex":296,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　壁の向こうが見える<tips=81>龍頭</tips>と同じビルで暮らすなど、プライバシーもなにもあったものじゃなく、僕なら到底我慢がならないけれども、みなはあまりそういうことを考えないのだろうか？","en":"Living in the same building as the <tips=81>Longtou</tips>, who could see through walls, left a person without the slightest privacy. I could never endure it, but did no one here give such things much thought?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r297","rowIndex":297,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　まあ、側近からすれば、ボスに隠し事などなく、何を見られてもかまわないという忠誠心を示す意味で都合がいいのかもしれないが、たとえば業者などはどんな気持ちなのだろう？","en":"Perhaps his close aides found it convenient as a declaration of loyalty: they hid nothing from the boss and cared nothing for what he saw. But how did the shopkeepers, for example, feel about it?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r298","rowIndex":298,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　組織と関わりが薄いのに、喜んでここに暮らす者もいるのだから、まったく不可解だ。","en":"Some people with scarcely any connection to the organization are happy to live here. It is utterly incomprehensible.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r299","rowIndex":299,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　とまれ、その『<tips=41>グランドタワー</tips>』。ギャングの本拠地だけあって、その内部には徹底した監視システムが配備されており、さらに出入り口にはつねに厳ついガードマンが立って、その鋭い視線で周囲を無駄に威嚇している。","en":"In any case, this was the <tips=41>Grand Tower</tips>. Befitting a gang headquarters, its interior was covered by a comprehensive surveillance system. Burly guards stood watch at every entrance, needlessly intimidating everyone around them with their hard stares.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r300","rowIndex":300,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　世間的には特別大きくはないとしても、地方の一ギャングの所有物としては大きなビルだ。","en":"Even if it was not especially large by ordinary standards, it was a large building for a single provincial gang to own.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r301","rowIndex":301,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　この建物は、もともとはどこかの企業がこの街で一儲けするために複合商業施設として作ったものらしい。","en":"Apparently, some company had originally constructed it as a commercial complex in hopes of making a fortune in this city.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r302","rowIndex":302,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それをどういう手を使ったのか<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>が乗っ取り、こうして自分の根城として使っている。そして、幹部や、希望する何人かの部下と共に暮らしている。","en":"Whatever means he had used, <tips=3>Chris Tse</tips> had taken it over and made it his stronghold. He lived there with the officers and a number of subordinates who chose to join them.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r303","rowIndex":303,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　部屋の数に比べて住人が少なすぎるから、ビル内のほとんどの区域は誰の手も入らない廃墟になっていた。","en":"There were far too few residents for the number of rooms, so most of the building had been left to fall into ruin.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r304","rowIndex":304,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　組織の規模に見合わないこのビルは、世間では『<tips=9>Y地区</tips>の王』を自認する<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>の大げさで趣味の悪い装飾的な施設であるととらえられているらしい。","en":"Because the building was out of all proportion to the organization, the public apparently regarded it as an ostentatious monument to the bad taste of <tips=3>Chris Tse</tips>, the self-styled “King of <tips=9>Y District</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r305","rowIndex":305,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕もそう思う。","en":"I thought so too.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r306","rowIndex":306,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　こんな巨大な要塞のような建物に住むよりも、他の組織のボスのように、どこかの地区にまとまって住む方が、よほど実用的かつ経済的だ。","en":"Living together in a single neighborhood, as the bosses of other organizations did, would be far more practical and economical than occupying this gigantic, fortress-like building.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r307","rowIndex":307,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>だって、そんなことは承知で住んでいる。","en":"<tips=3>Chris Tse</tips> lived there knowing that perfectly well.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r308","rowIndex":308,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　全ては、自分の権力を誇示するためだ。","en":"It was all to flaunt his power.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r309","rowIndex":309,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　つまり、これは結局彼のオベリスクであり、ピラミッドなのである。","en":"In short, this was his obelisk and his pyramid.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r310","rowIndex":310,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　実際シンボルとしてはよく機能している。","en":"As a symbol, it is in fact remarkably effective.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r311","rowIndex":311,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　このビルは<tips=57>滑走路通り</tips>のどこからでも見ることが出来るのだが、<tips=9>Y地区</tips>に足を運ぶ人々は、この余りにも有名なビルを見て「あそこには<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>のボスが住んでいる」と意識させられることだろう。こうした個人の体験の積み重ねは、知らぬうちに「<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>の<tips=81>龍頭</tips>」の虚像を大きくしているに違いない。","en":"The building could be seen from anywhere on <tips=57>Runway Street</tips>, and anyone who visited <tips=9>Y District</tips> and saw that famous tower would be reminded: “The boss of <tips=7>YS</tips> lives there.” The accumulation of those individual impressions must, without anyone realizing it, have magnified the myth of the “<tips=81>Longtou</tips> of <tips=7>YS</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r312","rowIndex":312,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それが<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>のやり方なのだ。","en":"That was <tips=3>Chris Tse's</tips> way.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r313","rowIndex":313,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕はあまり好きではない。","en":"I did not much care for it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r314","rowIndex":314,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　車が門を通過して地下の駐車場に滑り込んでゆく。","en":"The car passed through the gate and glided into the underground garage.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r315","rowIndex":315,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そしてエレベーターの前で停車し、降りた僕を出迎えてくれたのは五人のボディーガードだった。","en":"It stopped before the elevators, and when I stepped out, five bodyguards were waiting to receive me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r316","rowIndex":316,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼らは僕を取り囲むようにして護衛をしてくれる。","en":"They guarded me by forming a ring around me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r317","rowIndex":317,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　いわゆるVIP待遇というやつなのだろうが、歩きにくくて仕方がない。","en":"This was presumably what people called VIP treatment, but it made it almost impossible to walk.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r318","rowIndex":318,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「もうちょっと離れてくれますか？　これじゃあまるで恋人同士みたいだ」","en":"“Could you give me a little more room? At this rate, we look like lovers.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r319","rowIndex":319,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　苛々としてつい言ってしまうと、","en":"Irritation made the words slip out.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r320","rowIndex":320,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「はっ、失礼しました」","en":"“Yes, sir. My apologies.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r321","rowIndex":321,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その中でもリーダーらしい、ひときわ大きな男が想像以上に恐縮してしまう。","en":"The largest of them, apparently the leader, looked far more mortified than I had expected.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r322","rowIndex":322,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その顔を見る限り僕と年の近いような子供もいそうだが、その子供は、こんなところで何の地位にあるわけでもないただボスの息子であるだけの若造に叱責されている父の姿を知ったら悲しむに違いない。","en":"Judging by his face, he might have a child near my age. That child would surely be saddened to see his father rebuked by a young man who held no position here and happened merely to be the boss's son.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r323","rowIndex":323,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　想像すると気まずくなった。","en":"The thought made me uncomfortable.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r324","rowIndex":324,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　苦い思いのままエレベーターでロビーに上がると、そこで<tips=4>馬明</tips>が待っていて、僕が姿を現すと先日のことなどすっかり忘れて鷹揚な笑顔で迎えた。","en":"Still bitter, I rode the elevator up to the lobby, where <tips=4>Ma Ming</tips> was waiting. The moment I appeared, he greeted me with a magnanimous smile, having completely forgotten what happened the other day.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r325","rowIndex":325,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しかし、せっかくやって来たものの医者の診察が予定より長くなってしまっており、まだ父との面会の時間がとれないとのこと。","en":"Yet although I had come all this way, the doctor's examination had run longer than expected, and there was still no time for me to see my father.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r326","rowIndex":326,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それならばと、僕はこの時間に妹と会っておくことにした。","en":"I decided to see my sister while I waited.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r327","rowIndex":327,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕はまたエレベーターに乗って少し階を下りる。","en":"I took the elevator again and went down a few floors.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r328","rowIndex":328,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　妹の<tips=44>筱喬</tips>も、昔はこんなビルではなく、<tips=9>Y地区</tips>の住宅地に暮らしていた。","en":"My sister <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> had once lived not in a building like this, but in a residential part of <tips=9>Y District</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r329","rowIndex":329,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　と言っても、僕の様に親戚の家に預けられていたわけではなく、父の別宅に母と二人で住んでいたのである。そして母が死ぬと、父に引き取られてこの<tips=41>グランドタワー</tips>の奥深くで静かに暮らすこととなった。","en":"That said, unlike me, she had not been placed in a relative's home; she and our mother had lived together in a separate house Father owned. When Mother died, Father took her in, and she came to live quietly deep inside the <tips=41>Grand Tower</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r330","rowIndex":330,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　我が家はバラエティ豊かな家庭だ。","en":"We were quite the varied family.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r331","rowIndex":331,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　父は<tips=16>タイプA</tips>のサイキックで、母は<tips=17>タイプB</tips>だった。そして兄の僕は両親のどちらとも違ってノーマルとして生まれ、妹の<tips=44>筱喬</tips>は生まれた時から<tips=17>タイプB</tips>だった。","en":"Father was a <tips=16>Type A</tips> psychic, and Mother had been a <tips=17>Type B</tips>. I was born a Normal, unlike either of them, while my younger sister <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> had been a <tips=17>Type B</tips> from birth.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r332","rowIndex":332,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=17>タイプB</tips>というものは、肉体的にはノーマルより強く、優れていると相場が決まっているのだけれども、何事にも例外というものはあるようだ。","en":"As a rule, <tips=17>Type Bs</tips> are physically stronger and more capable than Normals. There are exceptions to everything, it seems.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r333","rowIndex":333,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　妹は幼い頃から病弱だったので、割れ物を扱うように細心の注意を払われていた。","en":"My sister had been frail from early childhood, so everyone handled her with the utmost care, as though she were made of glass.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r334","rowIndex":334,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕にとっても、妹はいつも心配をさせられる存在だった。","en":"My sister had always been someone I could not help worrying about.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r335","rowIndex":335,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　住む家が違ったとは言え、僕は母と妹のいる屋敷を頻繁に訪ねて、それなりに親しく付き合っていた。家族のなかで、苦手なのは父だけだったのだ。","en":"Though we lived in different houses, I often visited the home where Mother and my sister lived, and we were reasonably close. Father was the only member of the family I had trouble with.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r336","rowIndex":336,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　妹の方もよく懐いていて、一緒に暮らしている兄妹とほとんど変わりがない関係だったと思う。","en":"My sister was attached to me as well, and I think our relationship was little different from that of siblings raised under the same roof.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r337","rowIndex":337,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　だけれど、この<tips=41>グランドタワー</tips>に引っ越してからはすっかり縁が遠くなっている。","en":"But after she moved into the <tips=41>Grand Tower</tips>, we had seen very little of each other.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r338","rowIndex":338,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　こうして彼女の部屋を訪れるのは、これが初めてだ。","en":"This was my first visit to her room.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r339","rowIndex":339,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女の住まいとなった部屋はちょっとした家のリビングルームくらい広く、向こうにはベランダへ続くガラス戸も見られる。","en":"The room that had become her home was as large as the living room of a good-sized house, and glass doors opening onto a balcony stood at the far end.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r340","rowIndex":340,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　絨毯やカーテン、家具の一つ一つ、どれをとっても一目でそうとわかる高級品が揃えられている。チープなものや、見当外れのものは何一つ置かれていない。","en":"The carpet, the curtains, every piece of furniture—each was recognizably expensive at a glance. Not one object was cheap or ill chosen.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r341","rowIndex":341,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それはつまり、この部屋の主人である<tips=44>筱喬</tips>の意図は何も反映されていないということだ。ホテルの一室のように豪華ではあるが、年頃の少女が暮らす部屋だという前提を踏まえるとあまりにも非人間的だ。","en":"Which meant that nothing in the room reflected the wishes of its occupant, <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips>. It was as luxurious as a hotel room, but as a place for a girl her age to live, it was far too impersonal.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r342","rowIndex":342,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　どういう理由でこんな部屋が生まれたのか知らないが、その殺伐とした光景に辟易している僕に、妹は目を輝かせて声をかける。","en":"I did not know how such a room had come into being. As I recoiled from its bleakness, my sister addressed me with shining eyes.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r343","rowIndex":343,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「お兄ちゃん！」","en":"“Big Brother!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r344","rowIndex":344,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女は顔立ち自体は幼いというわけでもなかったが、世間と隔離された生活を送って来たせいか喋り方も表情も実年齢よりずっと幼い。","en":"Her features were not especially childish, but perhaps because she had lived in isolation from the world, her speech and expressions seemed far younger than she really was.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r345","rowIndex":345,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「今日来るって聞いてたから、楽しみにしてたんだ。久しぶりだね！　学校は楽しい？」","en":"“I heard you were coming today, so I’ve been looking forward to it. It’s been so long! Are you enjoying school?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r346","rowIndex":346,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そう言うと、童女のように首をかしげた。","en":"With that, she tilted her head like a little girl.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r347","rowIndex":347,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「楽しいよ。<tips=44>シウ</tips>は元気だった？」","en":"“Yeah, it’s fun. Have you been well, <tips=44>Siu</tips>?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r348","rowIndex":348,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「元気だよ！　……ねえ、昨日は<ruby=メイメイ><tips=24>美美</tips></ruby>ちゃんの結婚式行って来たんでしょ？　<tips=44>シウ</tips>も行きたかったな……。お父さんもお兄ちゃんも行ったのに、<tips=44>シウ</tips>だけいけないだなんてつまんないよ」","en":"“I’m fine! ... You went to <tips=24>Meimei’s</tips> wedding yesterday, didn’t you? <tips=44>Siu</tips> wanted to go too... Father went, and you went, and only <tips=44>Siu</tips> couldn’t. That’s no fun.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r349","rowIndex":349,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女はそう言って唇をとがらせる。","en":"She said this with a pout.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r350","rowIndex":350,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「行ったって面白いことなんか何もないよ」","en":"“There was nothing enjoyable about it.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r351","rowIndex":351,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=24>美美</tips>ちゃんの花嫁姿見たかったの。……それに、この部屋にいるよりは楽しいでしょう？　私、久しぶりに<tips=36>アウロラ</tips>ちゃんとかと会ってお話したかった。教会も見たい。もうずっとこの家から見える風景しか見てないし……」","en":"“I wanted to see <tips=24>Meimei</tips> in her wedding dress. ... Besides, it would have been more fun than staying in this room, wouldn't it? I wanted to see <tips=36>Aurora</tips> and the others again and talk with them. I want to see the church. For so long, all I've seen is the view from this house...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r352","rowIndex":352,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そんなに外に出して貰っていないのか？」","en":"“Do they keep you inside that much?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r353","rowIndex":353,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「う、うん……」","en":"“Y-yes...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r354","rowIndex":354,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そう頷く<tips=44>筱喬</tips>の態度に動揺が垣間見える。僕はおやと思ったが、あえて何も聞かず、気がつかないフリをした。","en":"A trace of agitation showed in the way <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> nodded. I found it curious, but deliberately asked nothing and pretended not to notice.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r355","rowIndex":355,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「僕から<tips=81>龍頭</tips>に、もっと外に出すように言っておくよ」","en":"“I'll tell the <tips=81>Longtou</tips> to let you out more often.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r356","rowIndex":356,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「い、いいよ！　お父さんが<tips=44>シウ</tips>のことを心配してくれてるのはわかってるから！　わがままはいいたくないの」","en":"“N-no! It’s all right! I know Father worries about <tips=44>Siu</tips>! I don’t want to be selfish.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r357","rowIndex":357,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「じゃあ言わないでおく」","en":"“Then I won’t say anything.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r358","rowIndex":358,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕がそう言うと、<tips=44>筱喬</tips>は安堵の溜息をついた。","en":"At my answer, <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> gave a sigh of relief.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r359","rowIndex":359,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ありがとう。……ねえ、それでお兄ちゃん、聞きたいことがあるんだけどいい？」","en":"“Thank you. ... Big Brother, there’s something I want to ask. Is that all right?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r360","rowIndex":360,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=44>筱喬</tips>は上目遣いで、僕の表情をうかがうようにしながらそう尋ねる。","en":"<tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> looked up at me as she asked, searching my face.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r361","rowIndex":361,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なに？」","en":"“What is it?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r362","rowIndex":362,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕は若干緊張して身構える。<tips=44>筱喬</tips>は、変に鋭いというか、勘が良いところがあって、変な誤魔化しをするとすぐに見抜いてしまう。","en":"I tensed slightly. <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> could be strangely perceptive, or perhaps simply intuitive. Any clumsy attempt at evasion was immediately obvious to her.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r363","rowIndex":363,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「今日お兄ちゃんは、お父さんに呼ばれてここに来たんでしょ」","en":"“Father called you here today, didn’t he?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r364","rowIndex":364,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「うん」","en":"“Yeah.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r365","rowIndex":365,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そんなの、初めてだよね」","en":"“That’s never happened before.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r366","rowIndex":366,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうだったかな。結婚式のついでだよ」","en":"“Was it? I only came because of the wedding.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r367","rowIndex":367,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　いま妹の頭の中にある疑問をなんとなく察した僕は、わざととぼけてみせた。","en":"I had a general sense of the question in my sister’s mind and deliberately played innocent.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r368","rowIndex":368,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうだよ。それに、こんなに素直にお兄ちゃんが、お父さんの言うことを聞くのも滅多にないよね。普通だったら、絶対にありえない……」","en":"“It has. And you almost never do what Father says so obediently. Ordinarily, it would be absolutely unthinkable...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r369","rowIndex":369,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=44>筱喬</tips>は確信があるようだ。","en":"<tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> seemed certain of it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r370","rowIndex":370,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そんなことないさ。気が向くときだってあるよ」","en":"“That's not true. Sometimes I simply feel like it.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r371","rowIndex":371,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　このくらいの誤魔化し方じゃ、<tips=44>筱喬</tips>に悟られてしまうな。","en":"With an evasion that feeble, <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> would see through me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r372","rowIndex":372,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その予感はすぐに現実のものとなり、","en":"That suspicion was immediately confirmed:","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r373","rowIndex":373,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ねえ、お父さんはもうすぐ死んじゃうの？」","en":"“Tell me—is Father going to die soon?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r374","rowIndex":374,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=44>筱喬</tips>は真剣な目でそう尋ねる。","en":"<tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> asked with a grave look in her eyes.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r375","rowIndex":375,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「お父さんの体調の話って、誰に聞いても全然教えてくれないけど、いつもとあまりにも違うもの。いくらばかな私だって気がつくよ……」","en":"“No one tells me anything about Father’s health, no matter whom I ask. But everything is too different from usual. Even I’m not too stupid to notice...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r376","rowIndex":376,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「うーん、じゃあ、はっきり言うよ。いい？」","en":"“All right. I’ll tell you plainly. Are you sure?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r377","rowIndex":377,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「う、うん……」","en":"“Y-yes...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r378","rowIndex":378,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まず、僕も父さんの詳しい病状なんか知らない。でも、今<tips=44>筱喬</tips>が想像したことと同じような事態を予測している。……そうだな。結婚式に来いって連絡が来た時くらいからかな。違和感があったんだ」","en":"“First, I don’t know the details of Father’s condition either. But I suspect the same thing you do, <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips>. ... Let me think. I suppose I first felt something was wrong when they contacted me about coming to the wedding.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r379","rowIndex":379,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「やっぱり……」","en":"“I knew it...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r380","rowIndex":380,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=44>筱喬</tips>は糸の切れた操り人形のように全身を脱力させて、床にぺたりと座り込む。そして急に大粒の涙をボロボロとこぼして泣き始めた。","en":"All strength left <tips=44>Siu-kiu’s</tips> body, as though the strings of a puppet had been cut, and she sank down onto the floor. Then great tears began pouring down her face.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r381","rowIndex":381,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そんなにショックだったか」","en":"“Was it that much of a shock?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r382","rowIndex":382,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「当たり前だよ……」","en":"“Of course it was...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r383","rowIndex":383,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「でも、近くにいる<tips=44>筱喬</tips>だって薄々はそういうことを考えていたんだろう？」","en":"“But even you, living so close to him, had already begun to suspect as much, hadn't you, <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips>?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r384","rowIndex":384,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「自分一人で考えているだけなのと、人が同じことを考えているのを知っちゃうのは違うよ……」","en":"“It's different, just thinking it on your own and finding out someone else thinks the same thing...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r385","rowIndex":385,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕には彼女の情緒はよくわからないが、一般的には彼女の方が多数なのなのかもしれない。","en":"I do not really understand her emotions, but perhaps hers is the more common response.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r386","rowIndex":386,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=44>筱喬</tips>は流れる涙をそのままにして、顔を上げて僕を見る。","en":"<tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> let the tears run unchecked and raised her face to look at me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r387","rowIndex":387,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ねえ、なんで<tips=44>シウ</tips>のまわりの人はすぐ死んじゃうの……？　お母さんも、そしてお父さんも……。こんなのあんまりだよ……」","en":"“Why does everyone around <tips=44>Siu</tips> die so soon...? Mother, and now Father... This is too cruel...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r388","rowIndex":388,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ただの偶然だよ。<tips=44>シウ</tips>の近くにいるからって早く死ぬというような因果関係は考えられない」","en":"“It’s only coincidence. There is no conceivable causal relationship by which being near <tips=44>Siu</tips> makes people die young.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r389","rowIndex":389,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕は床に膝をつき、彼女と目線の高さをあわせてそう語りかけた。","en":"I knelt on the floor to bring my eyes level with hers as I spoke.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r390","rowIndex":390,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「だいたい４０そこらで死んだって、この街の人間としては驚くほど短い寿命ってわけじゃない。むしろ僕ら家族の立場と状況を考えれば長生きしたほうだ」","en":"“Even dying around forty wouldn’t count as an astonishingly short life for someone in this city. Given our family’s position and circumstances, he’d have done well to live that long.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r391","rowIndex":391,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=44>筱喬</tips>はうつむいたままだが、僕は言葉を続ける。","en":"<tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> kept her head bowed, but I continued.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r392","rowIndex":392,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それに、あの人は充分幸せじゃないか。人生を意味づけるのは難しいし、本当のところは本人の気持ちを聞いてみないとわからないけど、僕が見る限りあの人はいまここで死んでもまあまあ満足のいく人生を送って来たと思う。あれだけのことをした人間が、誰かに殺されるでもなく、病で死ねるのならば、それだけで幸運じゃないか。それならば、家族としてはただ悲劇だと泣くよりも、別のかたちで送り出すのがふさわしいんじゃないか？　そう、この街の王にふさわしく、誇り高いかたちで。僕はあの人が好きってわけじゃないけれどね」","en":"“Besides, hasn’t he been happy enough? It’s hard to judge a life, and the truth depends on how he himself feels. But from where I stand, if he died here and now, I’d say he had lived a reasonably satisfying life. After all he’s done, dying of illness instead of at someone’s hands would be good fortune in itself. So rather than weep as though it were nothing but a tragedy, shouldn’t we, his family, send him off another way? Proudly, as befits the king of this city. Not that I like him.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r393","rowIndex":393,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女は微動だにせず、ただ無言でうつむいている。","en":"She remained perfectly still, head lowered in silence.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r394","rowIndex":394,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=44>シウ</tips>、涙を拭いて顔をあげよう。そもそも、あの人はまだ生きている。悲しむのはちょっと早いんじゃないか？」","en":"“<tips=44>Siu</tips>, wipe your tears and look up. Besides, he’s still alive. Isn’t it a little early to grieve?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r395","rowIndex":395,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　腕を取って立ち上がらせようとすると、彼女はそれを振り払い、そこでようやく唇を開いた。","en":"I took her arm to help her stand. She shook me off and finally spoke.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r396","rowIndex":396,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「お兄ちゃんは悲しくないの？」","en":"“Aren’t you sad, Big Brother?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r397","rowIndex":397,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「正直言って悲しくない。いなくなると思うと多少は寂しいけどね。それは彼の死に対する特別な思いというより、一般的な死に対する悲しみだろう。何であれ、生命が喪失するというのは悲しいものさ」","en":"“Honestly, no. I feel a little lonely at the thought that he will be gone. But that is less a special feeling about his death than the ordinary sadness of death itself. It is sad whenever any life is lost.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r398","rowIndex":398,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そう……。お兄ちゃんは冷静だね。でも、私は無理だよ。だってお父さんだもの。本当に胸が張り裂けそうだよ……」","en":"“I see... You're so calm, Big Brother. But I can't be. He's my father. It truly feels as though my heart will break...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r399","rowIndex":399,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=44>シウ</tips>はそれでいいんだろう。それが普通だ。親子なんだからね」","en":"“For you, that’s as it should be, <tips=44>Siu</tips>. It’s normal. You’re his daughter.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r400","rowIndex":400,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕が考えを口にすると、<tips=44>筱喬</tips>は表情を固くこわばらせる。","en":"When I put my thought into words, <tips=44>Siu-kiu’s</tips> face went rigid.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r401","rowIndex":401,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「やっぱりお兄ちゃんはノーマルだから、<tips=44>シウ</tips>やお母さんとは違うから、感情が違うのかな……」","en":"“Maybe it’s because you’re a Normal, Big Brother. You’re different from <tips=44>Siu</tips> and Mother, so maybe you feel things differently...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r402","rowIndex":402,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=44>シウ</tips>は小さく呟いた。僕は答えず溜息をつく。","en":"<tips=44>Siu</tips> murmured. I said nothing, only sighed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r403","rowIndex":403,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ご、ごめんなさいっ。でも、こわいの。本当に……」","en":"“I-I’m sorry. But I’m scared. I really am...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r404","rowIndex":404,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あやまることはないよ。<tips=44>シウ</tips>は何もおかしくない。僕もその通りだと思うよ。普通は悲しいんだ。親が死ぬんだからね」","en":"“You don’t have to apologize. There’s nothing wrong with you, <tips=44>Siu</tips>. I think you’re right. It’s only natural to be sad when a parent is dying.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r405","rowIndex":405,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕が言っても、<tips=44>筱喬</tips>は難しい顔をして考え込んでいる。","en":"Even after I said that, <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> frowned and sank into thought.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r406","rowIndex":406,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……こんなのいやだよ。だって、死んでいなくなることがみなはじめから決まっているのだから、生き物はどんな風に生きようが、みんな不幸で可哀想だってことでしょ。だったら、世界なんて、狂ったピエロが作った出来損ないのおもちゃみたいに最初から壊れているんだわ」","en":"“...I hate this. If every living thing is doomed from the start to die and disappear, then no matter what kind of life it leads, every one of them is miserable and pitiful, isn’t it? If that’s true, then the world was broken from the beginning, like a defective toy made by a mad clown.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r407","rowIndex":407,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「随分詩的な表現だな。賢くなったもんだ」","en":"“That’s quite poetic. You’ve gotten clever.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r408","rowIndex":408,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　困って肩をすくめると、彼女は涙ぐむ目で僕の顔を見つめ、","en":"I shrugged helplessly. She looked at me through tear-filled eyes and—","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r409","rowIndex":409,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=44>シウ</tips>を子供だと思って、適当に誤魔化そうとしないで。<tips=44>シウ</tips>だって、いつも、私なりに、自分が生きているこの世界がどんな場所なのか考えている！」","en":"“Don’t treat <tips=44>Siu</tips> like a child and try to brush her off! <tips=44>Siu</tips> thinks about it too, all the time, in her own way—about what kind of place this world she lives in really is!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r410","rowIndex":410,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　と、大きな声で宣言をする。","en":"she declared at the top of her voice.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r411","rowIndex":411,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕は溜息をつき、","en":"I sighed, and—","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r412","rowIndex":412,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「世界のことって、<tips=44>シウ</tips>はほとんど自分の部屋から出たことがないのに？」","en":"“The world? You’ve hardly ever left your own room, <tips=44>Siu</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r413","rowIndex":413,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そう！」","en":"“Yes!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r414","rowIndex":414,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「しかも勉強しないで、小説や映画みたいなフィクションばかりにのめり込んでるのに？」","en":"“And you don’t study—you do nothing but bury yourself in fiction, in novels and movies.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r415","rowIndex":415,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そう！」","en":"“Yes!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r416","rowIndex":416,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「な、なんにも知らないし、当たり前のことも全部周りの人間にやらせてるのに……せ、世界のことを……？」","en":"“Y-you don’t know anything, and you leave even the simplest things to everyone around you... yet you think about the w-world...?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r417","rowIndex":417,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そう！　……笑わないで！」","en":"“Yes! ...Don’t laugh!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r418","rowIndex":418,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕は口元を押さえて、笑いの形に歪んでしまう唇を隠し、どうにか可笑しくなってしまった気持ちを落ち着けながら、","en":"I covered my mouth to hide the grin twisting my lips and somehow managed to get my amusement under control before I said,","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r419","rowIndex":419,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……わかった……。うん。でも、<tips=44>シウ</tips>、それは僕の考えとは大分違うな」","en":"“...All right... Yeah. But <tips=44>Siu</tips>, that’s pretty different from how I see things.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r420","rowIndex":420,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「何が違うの？」","en":"“What is different?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r421","rowIndex":421,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まず前提として、僕らは生きてるだけで大分トクをしている」","en":"“For starters, we’ve already come out way ahead just by being alive.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r422","rowIndex":422,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なんで？」","en":"“Why?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r423","rowIndex":423,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「だって、この世界では無生物でいることのほうが当たり前で、生物としていまここに存在して、こうやって自我を持っているということの方がずっと不思議なことなんだ。僕たちは存在している時点で奇跡みたいなものなんだ。この無数の星が散らばる広大無辺な宇宙に、生物が存在する場所がどれだけあるか……。僕は、僕という存在として何かを考えたり、意志を持ってる時点で、悲劇だろうがなんだろうが、充分モトがとれていて、いつか死ぬ定めだとしても、この偉大な奇跡の前では全てどうでもいいことのような気がするんだよ」","en":"“Because in this world, being inanimate is the norm. That we exist here and now as living things, possessing selves as we do, is far more extraordinary. The mere fact that we exist makes us something like miracles. In this vast, boundless universe strewn with countless stars, how many places are there where life exists? ...The moment I exist as myself—able to think and have a will of my own—I’ve already gotten more than my money’s worth, tragedy or no tragedy. Even if I’m destined to die someday, everything else seems insignificant beside this great miracle.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r424","rowIndex":424,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ひたすら不幸で、一生苦しみしかなくても？」","en":"“Even if all you ever know is misery—if your whole life is nothing but suffering?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r425","rowIndex":425,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女は苦い顔をする。それと向かい合う僕も、同じような苦い顔をしているだろう。","en":"She grimaced. Facing her, I was probably wearing much the same expression.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r426","rowIndex":426,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「たとえそうだとしても、いないよりいるほうがずっといいことだと思う。全ての生き物がそうさ。ミジンコやミドリムシみたいなプランクトンだって、僕が思うに、充分トクをしているんだ」","en":"“Even so, I think it’s much better to exist than not. That goes for every living thing. Even plankton like water fleas and euglena come out well ahead, if you ask me.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r427","rowIndex":427,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「何がトクなのよ。そんな悲惨な一生のどこに救いがあるの？」","en":"“How is that coming out ahead? Where’s the salvation in a miserable life like that?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r428","rowIndex":428,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「救いなんか、何にだって、誰にだって、どこにだってあるさ」","en":"“There’s salvation in anything, in anyone, anywhere.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r429","rowIndex":429,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「私は、楽しいことなんかないっ！」","en":"“I never have any fun!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r430","rowIndex":430,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そんなはずない。例えば、美味しい物を食べたときは？　暖かい場所でうたた寝をしたときは？　便秘が治ったときは？　少しも良い気分にならなかった？」","en":"“That can’t be true. What about eating something delicious? Dozing off somewhere warm? Finally getting over your constipation? Didn’t any of that feel even a little good?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r431","rowIndex":431,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「うっ」","en":"“Ugh.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r432","rowIndex":432,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=44>筱喬</tips>はうめいてからうつむき、","en":"<tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> groaned and bowed her head.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r433","rowIndex":433,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……それくらいじゃ、とても、わりにあわないよ」","en":"“...That’s nowhere near enough to make life worth it.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r434","rowIndex":434,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=44>シウ</tips>、よく考えるんだ。死というのはいつだって僕らに重要な示唆を与えてくれる。普段僕らはいろんなまやかしに誤魔化されているけれど、死に触れた瞬間、はっと気がつく。世界に切れ目が入って、そこからドクドクと血液が流れ、ここが生やさしいだけの場所じゃないってまざまざと思い知らされるんだ。それは過酷な現実かもしれないけれど、でもそういう場所だからこそ輝いて見えるものもある」","en":"“<tips=44>Siu</tips>, think about it. Death always has something important to teach us. Most of the time we let all sorts of illusions deceive us, but the moment we come face-to-face with death, we wake up. A gash opens in the world, blood comes pumping out, and we’re forced to see that this is not a gentle place. That may be a brutal reality—but because the world is like that, some things shine all the brighter.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r435","rowIndex":435,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女は唇をきっと真一文字に結んで、もう僕の言葉に耳を貸そうとはしなかった。","en":"She pressed her lips into a taut, straight line and refused to listen to another word I said.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r436","rowIndex":436,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まあ、そのうち落ち着くさ」","en":"“Well, she’ll settle down eventually.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r437","rowIndex":437,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕は立ち上がり、","en":"I stood up, and—","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r438","rowIndex":438,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「とにかく、母さんにしても<tips=81>龍頭</tips>にしても親が子より先に死ぬというのは、順番から言えばむしろ順当なんだ。そもそも、こんな日本の片隅のギャングが一人くらい死んだからって、それくらいでこの広大な世界全部を否定する絶望というにはとてもとても……」","en":"“Anyway, whether it’s Mother or <tips=81>Longtou</tips>, a parent dying before their child is only the natural order. And all this amounts to is one gangster dying in one corner of Japan. That hardly warrants the kind of despair that condemns this entire vast world...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r439","rowIndex":439,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「聞きたくないわ！」","en":"“I don’t want to hear it!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r440","rowIndex":440,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　耳を塞ぎそっぽを向いて目をそらすが、僕は続ける。","en":"She clapped her hands over her ears and turned away, but I kept going.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r441","rowIndex":441,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=44>シウ</tips>、お前はあまりにも視野が狭い。もっと視野を広げて、いろんなことをよく理解するんだ。それは、この部屋にいたって出来る。例えば、こんなふうに……」","en":"“<tips=44>Siu</tips>, your field of vision is far too narrow. Broaden it. Learn to understand more of the world. You can do that without leaving this room. Like this, for example...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r442","rowIndex":442,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして僕は<tips=44>筱喬</tips>の顎を掴んでこちらを振り向かせると、両手の指で自分の両方のまぶたを大きく開いて見せる。","en":"Then I took <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> by the chin and turned her to face me, then used both hands to pull my eyelids wide open.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r443","rowIndex":443,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「うっ」","en":"“Urgh.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r444","rowIndex":444,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=44>筱喬</tips>の口元が、妙な形に歪む。","en":"<tips=44>Siu-kiu’s</tips> mouth twisted into a peculiar shape.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r445","rowIndex":445,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ほら、視野を広げるんだよ……こんなふうに、視野を……」","en":"“See? Broaden your field of vision... Like this. Broaden it...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r446","rowIndex":446,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ばかっ！」","en":"“Idiot!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r447","rowIndex":447,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=44>筱喬</tips>はベッドに倒れ込むと顔を埋め、もう振り返ろうとしない。その肩が細かく震えている。","en":"<tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> collapsed onto the bed and buried her face. She refused to look back. Her shoulders quivered.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r448","rowIndex":448,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「や、やめてよ！　真顔で、変なことして笑わせるのはっ！」","en":"“S-stop it! Don’t do something weird with a straight face just to make me laugh!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r449","rowIndex":449,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　震える声で彼女はそう訴える。","en":"Her voice shook as she protested.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r450","rowIndex":450,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「僕は真面目な話をしているんだよ」","en":"“I’m being serious.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r451","rowIndex":451,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「知らないっ！　もう向こうへ行ってっ！」","en":"“I don’t care! Go away!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r452","rowIndex":452,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕は溜息をつき、さらに別の言葉を投げかけようとしたところで扉がノックされた。","en":"I sighed, and just as I was about to say something else, someone knocked at the door.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r453","rowIndex":453,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ドアを開けると、<tips=4>馬明</tips>からの使者がそこに立っており、父と面会する準備が整ったことが告げられた。","en":"One of <tips=4>Ma Ming’s</tips> messengers stood outside. He told me they were ready for me to see my father.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r454","rowIndex":454,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　最上階に向かう直通エレベーターはないため、１５階で一度乗り換える。","en":"No elevator ran directly to the top floor, so I had to change elevators on the fifteenth.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r455","rowIndex":455,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　やっと辿り着いたそのフロアは、エレベーターのドアが開いた時点ですでに雰囲気が違った。","en":"When I finally reached the floor, I could tell the atmosphere was different the moment the doors opened.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r456","rowIndex":456,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　他の階は良くも悪くもオフィスビルを思わせる近代的でシンプルな内装であったけれど、<tips=81>龍頭</tips>の居住となるその場所は、それに相応しい装飾があしらわれ、絢爛と言うべきだろう。","en":"For better or worse, the other floors had simple, modern interiors reminiscent of an office building. The <tips=81>Longtou’s</tips> residence, however, was decorated to suit its occupant and could only be called resplendent.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r457","rowIndex":457,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　白を基調とした壁面のあちこちに華美になりすぎぬ程度に金をあしらい、足元に敷き詰められた赤い絨毯には生地の品質の高さを示す光沢がある。","en":"Gold ornamented the predominantly white walls without becoming too ostentatious, and the red carpet underfoot had the sheen of the finest fabric.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r458","rowIndex":458,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その過度に贅沢なつくりはお世辞にも趣味がいいとは言えないが、下品と蔑むほどでもなく、所有者の社会的地位を示すという点においては充分な役割を果たしている。","en":"Its design was too lavish to be called tasteful even out of politeness, yet not so vulgar as to merit contempt. As an advertisement of its owner’s social standing, it did its job perfectly well.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r459","rowIndex":459,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「兄貴は相変わらず冗談ばかりを言っているが、あれは空元気だろう。非常に状態が悪い」","en":"“Big Brother is joking as usual, but it’s all bravado. He’s in very bad shape.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬明","displayName":"Ma Ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r460","rowIndex":460,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　隣に並んで歩く<tips=4>馬明</tips>のいつにない深刻な口調が反響する。","en":"<tips=4>Ma Ming’s</tips> uncharacteristically grave voice echoed through the hall as he walked beside me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r461","rowIndex":461,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕は、扉を開けるその最初の瞬間を、まずどういう態度で迎えるかについて考えていた。","en":"I was considering how I ought to present myself in that first moment when the door opened.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r462","rowIndex":462,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「医者の見解は、明日や明後日にどうにかなるという可能性は少ないにしろ、もっと先、たとえば１０日後となると難しいということだ」","en":"“The doctor believes he’s unlikely to die tomorrow or the day after. Farther out, though—ten days from now, say—he may not make it.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬明","displayName":"Ma Ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r463","rowIndex":463,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　思ったよりも事態は切迫しているようだ。昨日遠目に見たときは、車椅子ではあったが会話などをして元気そうだったのに。","en":"The situation seemed more urgent than I had realized. When I saw him from a distance yesterday, he had been in a wheelchair, but he had seemed well enough, talking and everything.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r464","rowIndex":464,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　困ったな。","en":"This was awkward.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r465","rowIndex":465,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　事情を知る周囲の人間は、僕が父のことを嫌っていると思っているだろう。","en":"Everyone around us who knew the circumstances probably thought I hated my father.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r466","rowIndex":466,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　確かに僕と<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>は長らく疎遠でほとんど接点というものがなかったし、お互いのお互いに対する接し方も打ち解けたものではなかった。","en":"It was true that <tips=3>Chris Tse</tips> and I had long been estranged and barely saw each other, and that neither of us was ever at ease in the other’s company.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r467","rowIndex":467,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　だけれど、それだけじゃない。","en":"But that was not all.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r468","rowIndex":468,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なあ<tips=2>阿亮</tips>、いろいろわだかまりはあるだろう。しかし、今日は素直に兄貴の言葉を聞いてやって欲しいんだ」","en":"“Look, <tips=2>Ah Leung</tips>. I know there’s a lot between you. But today, I want you to set it aside and just hear Big Brother out.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬明","displayName":"Ma Ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r469","rowIndex":469,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　確かに今でも他人行儀になってしまう程度の距離の隔たりはあるし、事実少年時代はどうしても馴染めないものを感じていた。","en":"Even now there was enough distance between us that I could not help treating him like a stranger, and as a boy I had never been able to feel at ease with him.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r470","rowIndex":470,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　父側の理由を全く理解出来なかったわけではなかったけれど、まるっきり放置された状況では、自分たちの家庭は彼に捨てられていたのではという疑惑はいつもつきまとう。","en":"It wasn’t that I couldn’t understand my father’s reasons at all. But after he had left us entirely to ourselves, I could never shake the suspicion that he had abandoned our family.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r471","rowIndex":471,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　世間が<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>に対して賞賛したり恐れたりする様子も、僕にすれば尊敬心よりも、距離の遠さを感じさせた。破れたボールを直したり、ほどけにくい靴紐の結び方を教えてくれるような友人の父親が羨ましかった。","en":"The way people praised and feared <tips=3>Chris Tse</tips>, rather than inspiring respect, only made him feel more distant. I envied friends whose fathers patched torn balls and taught them how to tie knots that would not come undone.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r472","rowIndex":472,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　だから、少年時代の僕は<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>を憎むとはいかないまでも、その存在を思うと非常に冷淡な感情が心を支配するのを咎めようがなかった。","en":"So while I never quite hated <tips=3>Chris Tse</tips>, as a boy I could hardly fault myself for the cold detachment that took hold of me whenever I thought of him.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r473","rowIndex":473,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「このドアの向こうだ。……心の準備はいいか？」","en":"“He’s beyond this door. ...Are you ready?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬明","displayName":"Ma Ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r474","rowIndex":474,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それが変わったのは、母が死んだ時だ。","en":"That changed when my mother died.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r475","rowIndex":475,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　たまにやって来ても、いつも本音を隠して、やくたいもない冗談ばかり口にし、僕らに対して涼しいニヤケ顔しか見せなかった<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>だったけれど、その日ばかりは汗だくになってやって来た。","en":"Whenever <tips=3>Chris Tse</tips> did visit, he hid his true feelings, did nothing but crack inane jokes, and showed us only the same unruffled smirk. On that day alone, he arrived drenched in sweat.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r476","rowIndex":476,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　一日中母のそばで励まし、そして医師によって死を告げられると、母の遺骸にすがりついて獣の咆哮のような、人の泣き声とは思われぬような泣き声を上げはじめたのである。","en":"He spent all day at Mother’s side, encouraging her. When the doctor pronounced her dead, he threw himself over her body and began to wail—a beast’s roar, a sound one could scarcely believe was a human being’s cry.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r477","rowIndex":477,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　誰かが愛する人を亡くす瞬間を何度か目撃した僕でもちょっと驚いてしまうような、見たことのない慟哭だった。","en":"Even though I had seen people lose loved ones several times before, I had never witnessed grief like his. It startled even me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r478","rowIndex":478,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕はそれ以来、彼を見直して、そしていくらかの引け目も感じている。僕は母の死を前にしても泣くことなど出来ず、ただ心の奥のどこかがシンと静まりかえるような、不思議な感覚に囚われただけだったからだ。","en":"After that, I saw him in a new light, and felt somewhat ashamed by comparison. Even in the face of Mother’s death, I had been unable to cry. I had felt only a strange sensation, as though somewhere deep inside my heart had fallen perfectly still.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r479","rowIndex":479,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕よりはよほど、父の方がまっとうな人間なのだろうと思った。","en":"I thought that my father was probably far more of a decent human being than I was.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r480","rowIndex":480,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　嫌悪感がなくなれば、彼に尊敬すべき点があることも理解出来るようになったし、接触が少ないながらも自分に対する愛情があったのも理解出来た。","en":"Once my aversion was gone, I could see that there were things about him worthy of respect. I also came to understand that, little as we saw of each other, he had cared for me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r481","rowIndex":481,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　父親が街のボスであるという事実は僕のこの街での生活にポジティブな影響をもたらしたのは間違いないし、それに対する感謝もしている。","en":"There was no denying that being the son of the city’s boss had benefited my life here, and I was grateful for it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r482","rowIndex":482,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ただ、尊敬と感謝があっても、親しみを持つことだけは相変わらずまったく出来ないが。","en":"Even with that respect and gratitude, I still couldn’t feel the slightest closeness to him.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r483","rowIndex":483,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それが両親を共に溺愛している妹との違いであり、人に嫌っていると勘違いされがちな理由なのかもしれない。","en":"That was the difference between me and my sister, who adored both our parents, and perhaps why people so often mistook my distance for hatred.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r484","rowIndex":484,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=4>馬明</tips>がノックをすると、音もなくドアは開いた。","en":"<tips=4>Ma Ming</tips> knocked, and the door opened without a sound.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r485","rowIndex":485,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　広い部屋の中央にベッドが設置され、その脇に<tips=39>ジェフリー・ウォン</tips>と、父の身のまわりの世話をする役目であろう女の従者が立っている。","en":"A bed had been placed in the center of the spacious room. <tips=39>Jeffrey Wong</tips> stood beside it with a female attendant whose role was presumably to care for my father’s needs.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r486","rowIndex":486,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=1>謝亮</tips>、こちらへ」","en":"“<tips=1>Tse Leung</tips>, come here.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r487","rowIndex":487,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=39>ジェフリー</tips>に促され、僕はベッドのすぐ目の前、病人に一番近い場所を与えられた。","en":"<tips=39>Jeffrey</tips> motioned me forward, and I took the place directly before the bed, closer to the sick man than anyone else.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r488","rowIndex":488,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「よう」","en":"“Hey.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r489","rowIndex":489,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　上半身が持ち上がったギャッジベッドの上で、<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>はかすかに笑う。","en":"On an adjustable bed with his upper body raised, <tips=3>Chris Tse</tips> gave a faint smile.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r490","rowIndex":490,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　結婚式の時に遠くから垣間見た姿とはすっかり印象が違う。","en":"He looked utterly different from the figure I had glimpsed at a distance during the wedding.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r491","rowIndex":491,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ベッドの上で佇む彼は、死体のように生気がなく、静かだった。その腕に取り付けられた電極は、近くの医療機器に繋がっている。","en":"He lay motionless on the bed, lifeless and silent as a corpse. Electrodes attached to his arm ran to the medical equipment nearby.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r492","rowIndex":492,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　こう間近でじっと見つめると、その顔はあまりにも無惨だ。","en":"Seen this close, his face was ghastly.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r493","rowIndex":493,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　何かに似ていると思ったら、そうだ、子供の頃に見たゾンビ映画だ。","en":"He reminded me of something. Yes—a zombie film I had seen as a child.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r494","rowIndex":494,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　この街の盟主たる人物も、ゾンビになってしまうと随分威厳のないものだ。","en":"Even the lord of this city looked remarkably undignified once he had become a zombie.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r495","rowIndex":495,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「随分面食らってるじゃねえか」","en":"“Pretty taken aback, aren’t you?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r496","rowIndex":496,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕が黙っていると、彼はかすれ声で笑う。","en":"When I said nothing, he laughed in a hoarse voice.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r497","rowIndex":497,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ここにいるときは、もっぱらこの格好よ。もう執務室の椅子に座っちゃいられねえんだ」","en":"“This is how I spend all my time in here. I can’t sit in the chair in my office anymore.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r498","rowIndex":498,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「別に驚いちゃいません。ただ、一瞬誰なのかわからなかっただけですよ」","en":"“It’s not that I was surprised. I just didn’t recognize you for a second.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r499","rowIndex":499,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕は苦笑して首を横に振り、","en":"I gave a wry smile and shook my head.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r500","rowIndex":500,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「身体は弱っていても、気持ちは相変わらずのようで何よりです。<tips=81>龍頭</tips>」","en":"“Though your body may be weak, I’m glad to see your spirit is as strong as ever, <tips=81>Longtou</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r501","rowIndex":501,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「お前こそ、相変わらず嫌な口の利き方をしやがる」","en":"“And you’re still as nasty as ever when you open your mouth.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r502","rowIndex":502,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼が手を上げると、近くに控えていた若い女の従者が白い布を差し出す。彼は大儀そうに身体をよじると、そこに血の混じった痰を吐く。","en":"He raised a hand, and the young female attendant waiting nearby offered him a white cloth. He twisted his body with obvious effort and spat bloody phlegm into it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r503","rowIndex":503,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　表皮同様、内臓組織も病によって崩壊が進んでいるのだ。","en":"The disease was destroying the tissues of his internal organs just as it had his skin.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r504","rowIndex":504,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　血のように見えたものは、あるいは血ではなく崩れ落ちた組織そのものかもしれない。","en":"What looked like blood might not have been blood at all, but the disintegrated tissue itself.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r505","rowIndex":505,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　やはり、１０日も経てばもうわからないという医者の診断は間違いではないのだ。","en":"The doctor’s diagnosis—that there was no telling whether he would still be alive in ten days—was right after all.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r506","rowIndex":506,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「遠いところをわざわざご苦労」","en":"“Much obliged. You came a long way.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r507","rowIndex":507,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「別に<tips=81>龍頭</tips>に会うために来たわけじゃありませんよ。結婚式に呼ばれたから来たんです。しつこく言われたから仕方なくです」","en":"“I didn’t come to see you, <tips=81>Longtou</tips>. I came because I was invited to the wedding. They kept pestering me, so I had no choice.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r508","rowIndex":508,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうか。まあなんでもいいさ。こうして来たんだからな」","en":"“I see. Well, it doesn’t matter. You came, and that’s what counts.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r509","rowIndex":509,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……体調はいかがですか？」","en":"“...How are you feeling?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r510","rowIndex":510,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「この姿を見て、『いかがですか？』もないもんだ。……まったく、よかァねえよ。体全体が、熟し切ってそろそろ腐ろうかっていう柿みたいにぐずぐずと崩れ落ちてやがるんだ。痛み止めの麻薬が切れれば地獄のような苦しみだ。ただし、効いている限りは夢見心地で良い気分だ。部下どもに散々ヤクを禁止してきたおれ自身がジャブジャブのヤク漬けだよ」","en":"“Look at me, and you still ask how I’m feeling? ... Not good. Not a damned bit good. My whole body is falling apart like a persimmon gone soft with ripeness and just beginning to rot. When the narcotic painkillers wear off, the agony is hell. While they’re working, though, I float in a lovely dream. After all the times I’ve forbidden my men to touch the stuff, now I’m the one swimming in it.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r511","rowIndex":511,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「治療のためだから仕方ないでしょう」","en":"“It’s for treatment. What else can you do?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r512","rowIndex":512,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうかね？　そんな単純な話じゃないぞ？　お前ならわかるだろう。このおれが、　”必要だから”　という理由でいとも容易くヤク漬けになっているんだ。これはあらゆる意味で気の利いたジョークじゃないか」","en":"“Is that so? It’s not as simple as all that, you know. You of all people ought to understand. Here I am, soaked in drugs as easily as you please, all because they’re ‘necessary.’ That’s one hell of a clever joke from every angle, don’t you think?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r513","rowIndex":513,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ちっともわかりませんけど。どういう意味ですか？」","en":"“I don’t get it at all. What do you mean?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r514","rowIndex":514,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>はこたえない。ただ薄く笑っている。","en":"<tips=3>Chris Tse</tips> did not answer. He only smiled faintly.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r515","rowIndex":515,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「時間がそうあるわけでもない。本題に入ろうか」","en":"“We don’t have much time. Let’s get down to business.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r516","rowIndex":516,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして彼は身体を動かして、姿勢を変えた。薬が効いているとは言え、同じ体勢でいると下になった部分に違和感があるのだろう。","en":"He shifted position. Even with the drugs working, staying in one position must have made the side beneath him uncomfortable.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r517","rowIndex":517,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ご覧のとおり、おれはもうすぐ死ぬ。すっかり弱っちまった。仕事はほとんどしなくなって、たまに会議に出たり、指示を出すだけだ。あとの時間はずっと寝ているだけさ。で、こう、ぐったりと死の床につきながらね、随分退屈を持てあましていたんだ。こんなにのんびり出来たのは、いつ以来かわからん。それで、まあ、色々考えた」","en":"“As you can see, I’ll be dead soon. I’ve gotten weak. I barely work anymore—just sit in on a meeting now and then or give an order. The rest of the time, I sleep. Lying around limp on my deathbed like this, I’ve been bored out of my skull. I can’t remember the last time I had this much time on my hands. So, well, I got to thinking.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r518","rowIndex":518,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼は僕の顔から視線を外し、天井を見つめた。","en":"He looked away from my face and stared at the ceiling.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r519","rowIndex":519,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「お前のことも考えた。……おれとしてはお前の安全のために一時的に距離を置いただけのつもりだったんだが、呼び戻すタイミングがないまま時間が過ぎて、気がつけばほとんど縁のない親子になっちまったな」","en":"“I thought about you, too. ...For my part, I meant only to keep my distance temporarily, for your safety. But the right moment to bring you back never came, and the years passed. Before I knew it, we’d become father and son in scarcely anything but blood.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r520","rowIndex":520,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼は随分遠いところから話をはじめたが、最終的に何を言い出すのかは、おおよそ見当がついていた。","en":"He had begun a long way from the point, but I could more or less guess what he was eventually going to say.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r521","rowIndex":521,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それは特別な予想ではない。","en":"It took no special insight to predict.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r522","rowIndex":522,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　今ここにいる<tips=39>ジェフリー・ウォン</tips>と<tips=4>馬明</tips>はもちろん、この若い娘だって同じ想像をしているだろう。","en":"<tips=39>Jeffrey Wong</tips> and <tips=4>Ma Ming</tips>, standing here now, must be thinking the same thing. Even the young attendant probably was.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r523","rowIndex":523,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>の他の幹部たちも、僕が結婚式に顔を出した時点で気がついたはずだ。","en":"The other officers of <tips=7>YS</tips> must have realized it the moment I appeared at the wedding.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r524","rowIndex":524,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　いや、それどころか、街のあちこちでもすでに噂されているようだ。","en":"No—not just them. Apparently people all over the city had already started talking about it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r525","rowIndex":525,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「だが、お前が息子であることには変わらない。そしておれも人並みの父親だ……そう気づいたのは、死を目の前にしたせいかもしれねえが……しかし、紛れもなく今のおれには、人並みの父親と同じ望みがあるんだよ。お前には何もして来なかったのに、むしの良い願いだとはわかっちゃいるんだが……」","en":"“But that doesn’t change the fact that you’re my son. And I’m a father like any other... Maybe it took death staring me in the face to make me realize that... But there’s no question that now I want the same thing any ordinary father would. I know I’ve got a damned nerve, after doing nothing for you all these years, but...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r526","rowIndex":526,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼はそこで言葉を切った。","en":"He broke off there.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r527","rowIndex":527,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その声には、今までけしてあらわれたことのない哀切の響きがあり、それに心打たれたのか、従者の娘が俯いた。","en":"His voice held a note of sorrow I had never heard in it before. Perhaps moved by it, the young attendant lowered her head.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r528","rowIndex":528,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なあ、一つだけでいいんだ。願いを一つだけきいてくれないか？　おれのたった一つの望みというのは……」","en":"“Listen, just one thing. That’s all. Can’t you grant me one request? My one and only wish is...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r529","rowIndex":529,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いやです」","en":"“No.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r530","rowIndex":530,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まあ聞けよ」","en":"“Come on, hear me out.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r531","rowIndex":531,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「聞きたくありません。<tips=81>龍頭</tips>も、言わない方が良いでしょう」","en":"“I don’t want to. You would be better off not saying it, <tips=81>Longtou</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r532","rowIndex":532,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「おいおい、随分と冷たいもんだな。話くらい聞いたっていいだろうに」","en":"“Come on, now. That’s cold. You can at least hear me out.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r533","rowIndex":533,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「聞きたかないですよ。病人の頼み事を断るのは気が重い。それならはじめから聞かないのが一番じゃないですか」","en":"“I don’t want to. I’d hate to turn down a sick man’s request. So it’s best if I never hear it in the first place, isn’t it?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r534","rowIndex":534,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「聞く前から断ると決めつけるもんじゃねえさ。とにかく聞くんだ」","en":"“Don’t decide you’ll refuse before you’ve even heard it. Just listen.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r535","rowIndex":535,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いやです。なんと頼まれようと、僕は<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>には入らない。……人にああだこうだ言われて自分のやることを決めるのはいやなんだ。そりゃ、あなたは病人ですし、他の頼み事だったら、なんだって叶えたいところですが、それは……」","en":"“No. Whatever you ask, I’m not joining <tips=7>YS</tips>. ...I don’t want other people telling me this and that and deciding what I do with my life. You’re ill, and if it were any other request, I’d do whatever I could to grant it. But that...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r536","rowIndex":536,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「言ったな？」","en":"“You said it, didn’t you?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r537","rowIndex":537,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼は僕の声を遮った。","en":"He cut across my words.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r538","rowIndex":538,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「今、確かに言ったな？」","en":"“You definitely said that just now, didn’t you?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r539","rowIndex":539,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　今度は口元に露骨な笑みを浮かべて、繰り返す。","en":"He repeated himself with an undisguised grin.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r540","rowIndex":540,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「え、どういうことですか？」","en":"“Huh? What do you mean?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r541","rowIndex":541,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>に入る以外の望みならなんでも叶えると」","en":"“You said you would grant any wish other than joining <tips=7>YS</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r542","rowIndex":542,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>は勝ち誇るかのように言った。","en":"<tips=3>Chris Tse</tips> spoke as though declaring victory.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r543","rowIndex":543,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「確かに言いましたが……」","en":"“I did say that, but...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r544","rowIndex":544,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「お前の考えは間違いだ。おれは、お前に後を継がせるつもりはない」","en":"“You’re mistaken. I have no intention of making you my successor.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r545","rowIndex":545,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「え！」","en":"“What?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r546","rowIndex":546,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　と大声を出したのはこれまで無言で見守っていた<tips=4>馬明</tips>。","en":"That shout came from <tips=4>Ma Ming</tips>, who had watched in silence until now.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r547","rowIndex":547,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　皆の注目を集めてしまうと、咄嗟に両手で口を押さえる。","en":"When every eye turned to him, he clapped both hands over his mouth.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r548","rowIndex":548,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「お前みたいなど素人を組織に入れたって仕方ないだろう。ましてや<tips=81>龍頭</tips>だと？　馬鹿馬鹿しい。お前におれの後釜が務まるわけがない。ちょっと餓鬼の世界でちやほやされたからって、勘違いしているのか？」","en":"“What good would it do to bring a rank amateur like you into the organization? And make you <tips=81>Longtou</tips>? Don’t make me laugh. There’s no way you could take my place. Has being fawned over a little in the kiddie world gone to your head?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r549","rowIndex":549,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　あざ笑うような態度である。","en":"His manner was openly mocking.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r550","rowIndex":550,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　言われた内容はともかく、馬鹿にされるのは面白くはない。","en":"Whatever he had actually said, I didn’t enjoy being mocked.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r551","rowIndex":551,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そりゃ、こんな形で呼びつけられたら誰だってそう考えますよ。そんな言われ方をする筋合いはない。まあ、もうすぐ死ぬ病人のたわごとだと思って聞き流しますが」","en":"“Anyone summoned this way would think the same thing. I don’t deserve to be talked to like that. But fine—I’ll let it pass as the ravings of a sick man who’ll be dead soon.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r552","rowIndex":552,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうよ。もうすぐ死ぬ病人のたわごとだ」","en":"“That’s right. The ravings of a sick man who’ll be dead soon.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r553","rowIndex":553,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼はクククと笑い、","en":"He chuckled.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r554","rowIndex":554,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「お前も一人前のつもりなら、病んだ父のたわごとくらい、しっかり聞け」","en":"“If you think you’re a grown man, you can at least listen properly to your sick father’s ravings.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r555","rowIndex":555,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「突然の泣き落としとは恐れ入りますが、わかりましたよ。しかし、それならば、<tips=81>龍頭</tips>は……」","en":"“That’s quite the sudden appeal to pity. Fine, I’ll listen. But in that case, <tips=81>Longtou</tips>, you...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r556","rowIndex":556,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それだ」","en":"“That’s it.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r557","rowIndex":557,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼は鋭く言う。","en":"He said it sharply.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r558","rowIndex":558,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どれですか」","en":"“What is?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r559","rowIndex":559,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕が仏頂面で問い返すと、","en":"I shot back with a scowl.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r560","rowIndex":560,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「自分の父親を、<tips=81>龍頭</tips>と呼ぶ息子があるか」","en":"“What kind of son calls his own father <tips=81>Longtou</tips>?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r561","rowIndex":561,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「しかし、これは昔から……」　","en":"“But I’ve called you that since...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r562","rowIndex":562,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうだ、お前は小さな頃からずっとおれのことを<tips=81>龍頭</tips>と呼んでいた。賢いお前は、まわりの大人と同じように呼ぶのが正しいと考えていたんだ。おれへの当てつけもあったろう。でもそれじゃあ、あまりに寂しいじゃねえか？」","en":"“That’s right. You’ve called me <tips=81>Longtou</tips> ever since you were little. Smart boy that you were, you decided the proper thing was to call me what all the grown-ups did. There was probably some spite in it, too. But that’s a damned lonely thing, don’t you think?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r563","rowIndex":563,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>の目の端に、うっすらと涙が浮かぶ。それを見て僕は動揺する。","en":"A faint glimmer of tears appeared at the corners of <tips=3>Chris Tse’s</tips> eyes. The sight unsettled me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r564","rowIndex":564,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「おれは餓鬼の頃からろくでもないチンピラだったが、本当はね、アメリカのホームドラマみたいな生活に憧れていたんだ。しばらく忘れていたが、死の床で思い出したのさ。おれの本当の望みは、あんな平和な家庭を築くことだったんだって。……どういうわけか、こんな血なまぐさい人生を送ってしまったが……」","en":"“I was a worthless little hoodlum from childhood, but the truth is, I dreamed of a life like the ones in American family dramas. I’d forgotten for a while, but I remembered here on my deathbed. What I truly wanted was to build a peaceful home like that. ...Somehow, I ended up living this blood-soaked life instead...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r565","rowIndex":565,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼は目を閉じる。","en":"He closed his eyes.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r566","rowIndex":566,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なあ<tips=1>亮</tips>よ。……おれはせめて、最後に一度くらい、息子に父と呼ばれたいのだ」","en":"“Listen, <tips=1>Leung</tips>... Just once, before I go, I want my son to call me Father.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r567","rowIndex":567,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「からかっているんですか？」","en":"“Are you making fun of me?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r568","rowIndex":568,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうじゃない。わかるだろう？」","en":"“No. You understand, don’t you?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r569","rowIndex":569,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　なぜ急にこんなことを言い出すのだろう？　まったく不可解な要望だ。いくら衰えたとは言え、あの<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>が口にするような言葉ではない。何か別の謀略が隠されているのだろうか？","en":"Why was he saying this all of a sudden? It was a completely inexplicable request. Even in his weakened state, these were not words one expected from <tips=3>Chris Tse</tips>. Was some other scheme hidden beneath them?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r570","rowIndex":570,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　とにかく、到底こんな茶番には付き合えない。付き合えるはずがない。","en":"In any case, I couldn’t possibly go along with this farce. There was no way.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r571","rowIndex":571,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　帰るぞ、と言うつもりで僕は<tips=4>馬明</tips>を振り返る。","en":"I turned to <tips=4>Ma Ming</tips>, ready to tell him I was leaving.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r572","rowIndex":572,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しかしこの馬鹿は、どういう頭の構造をしているのか、<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>の三文芝居にすっかり騙されたようで、感極まって顔を真っ赤に染めている。打ち震えている。そして、振り返った僕にこっくりと頷きをよこす。","en":"But whatever passed for a brain in that idiot’s head, he seemed to have fallen completely for <tips=3>Chris Tse’s</tips> cheap little act. Overcome with emotion, his face had gone scarlet. He was trembling. When I turned to him, he gave me an emphatic nod.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r573","rowIndex":573,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"（さあ、言ってやりなさい）","en":"(Go on. Say it.)","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r574","rowIndex":574,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　と、無言の言葉が伝わって来る。","en":"His silent message came through loud and clear.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r575","rowIndex":575,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　まったく、単純なやつだ！","en":"God, what a simpleton!","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r576","rowIndex":576,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　次に<tips=39>ジェフリー・ウォン</tips>の方を見ると、彼は冷静な面持ちであったが、やはり<tips=4>馬明</tips>と同じように頷いた。","en":"Next I looked at <tips=39>Jeffrey Wong</tips>. His expression was calm, but he nodded just as <tips=4>Ma Ming</tips> had.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r577","rowIndex":577,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ついでに従者の娘の方に目をやってみると、いつの間にか涙で顔をぐしゃぐしゃにしている彼女も頷き、","en":"For good measure, I glanced at the young attendant. At some point, her face had become a tear-streaked mess. She nodded too.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r578","rowIndex":578,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=1>謝亮</tips>さま、はやく、言ってあげてください」","en":"“Master <tips=1>Tse Leung</tips>, please. Hurry and say it to him.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r579","rowIndex":579,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　と小声で命じる。","en":"She issued the command in a whisper.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r580","rowIndex":580,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　文字通り四面楚歌というやつだ。","en":"I was, quite literally, beset on all sides.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r581","rowIndex":581,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕は言うしかないのだろうか？","en":"Was I going to have to say it?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r582","rowIndex":582,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　たった一言口にするだけで、それだけでこの瀕死の病人は満足すると言っている。それで僕の息子としての仕事が終わるのなら安いものだ。","en":"He said that a single word—nothing more—would satisfy him. If that was all it took to discharge my duty as a son, it was a small price to pay.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r583","rowIndex":583,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ただの言葉だ。言うだけなら簡単なはずだが、しかし、なぜだか心臓が胸の内側でバクバクと早鐘をつき、脇にうっすらと汗をかき始めている。","en":"It was only a word. Saying it should have been easy. Yet for some reason, my heart was pounding against the inside of my chest like an alarm bell, and a faint sweat had begun beneath my arms.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r584","rowIndex":584,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　口の中がすっかり乾いて、唇を開くとねちゃりと音がした。","en":"My mouth had gone entirely dry. My lips made a sticky sound when I opened them.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r585","rowIndex":585,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「と、とう……」","en":"“F-fa...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r586","rowIndex":586,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「違う」","en":"“Wrong.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r587","rowIndex":587,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　言いかけた僕を、目をつぶったままの父は遮る。","en":"Without opening his eyes, my father cut me off.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r588","rowIndex":588,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「おれの見ていたドラマでは、『パパ』と呼んでいたんだがなあ」","en":"“In the shows I watched, the children called their fathers ‘Papa,’ you know.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r589","rowIndex":589,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　目の前がクラクラとした。","en":"The room swam before me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r590","rowIndex":590,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　部屋は蟻の這う足音さえ聞こえそうなくらい静まりかえっている。","en":"The room fell so silent that you could have heard an ant crawl.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r591","rowIndex":591,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　みな、僕が口を開くのを待っているのだ。僕が、この父に向かって『パパ』と言うのを待っているのだ。","en":"Everyone was waiting for me to open my mouth. Waiting for me to face this man—my father—and call him ‘Papa.’","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r592","rowIndex":592,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　どうしてこうなった？　こんな、ありえない状況になった？　僕は物事がはじまる前に、いつもいくつかのパターンを想定する。だけど、これは想像していなかった。想像出来るやつがいるだろうか？","en":"How had it come to this? How had I ended up in such an impossible situation? Before anything happens, I always imagine several ways it might play out. I had not imagined this one. Could anyone have?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r593","rowIndex":593,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ひどく混乱している。何か色々とつじつまがあっていないような気もするが、とてもまともに考えられない。","en":"I was utterly confused. Something about this did not seem to add up, but I was in no condition to think straight.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r594","rowIndex":594,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その言葉を思い浮かべるだけで、顔が熱くなる。おそらく、僕は今トマトのように真っ赤になっているだろう。","en":"The mere thought of the word heated my face. I was probably as red as a tomato.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r595","rowIndex":595,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　自分の顔を想像すると、ますます混乱してしまう。僕がこれほどあからさまに動揺するだなんて、あってはいけないことだ。","en":"Imagining my own face only confused me further. It was unacceptable for me to be this visibly shaken.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r596","rowIndex":596,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しかし、いま僕はそれを言わなければこの場面を脱することは出来ないらしい。それに、ここで言えなくてうつむいてしまうのは、それこそ真の敗北のような気がする。","en":"Yet it seemed I could not escape the scene without saying it. Worse, falling silent and hanging my head now felt like a true defeat.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r597","rowIndex":597,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕は目をつぶり、乾いた唇の間から一音ずつどうにか押し出した。","en":"I shut my eyes and somehow forced the word out through my dry lips, one sound at a time.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r598","rowIndex":598,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「パ……パパ」","en":"“Pa... Papa.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r599","rowIndex":599,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……聞こえない」","en":"“...I can’t hear you.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r600","rowIndex":600,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「聞こえているだろうが、この嘘つきめ……」","en":"“You heard me, you damned liar...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r601","rowIndex":601,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=2>阿亮</tips>」","en":"“<tips=2>Ah Leung</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r602","rowIndex":602,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=4>馬明</tips>が窘めるように催促する。あの単純な男には僕の気持ちなど、ちっともわからぬのだろう。","en":"<tips=4>Ma Ming</tips> prompted me again, his tone chiding. That simple-minded man surely understood nothing of how I felt.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r603","rowIndex":603,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　とにかく僕はこの場面を早く終わらせたかった。","en":"I just wanted to get this over with.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r604","rowIndex":604,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……パパ」","en":"“...Papa.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r605","rowIndex":605,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　どうにか言うと、僕は父の顔を睨み付けた。彼は案の定、ニヤニヤと笑っている。","en":"After somehow forcing the word out, I glared at my father. Sure enough, he was grinning.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r606","rowIndex":606,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「言ったぞ！　これでいいですね！」","en":"“I said it! There, that’s what you wanted, isn’t it?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r607","rowIndex":607,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ふむ、ドラマの子役ほど上手ではなかったが、なかなか良かったぞ。我が息子よ」","en":"“Hmm. Not as good as the child actors in the shows, but not bad at all, my son.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r608","rowIndex":608,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「これであんたの願いは叶えましたよ。満足して、さっさとくたばってください！」","en":"“There, I granted your wish. Now be satisfied and please hurry up and drop dead!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r609","rowIndex":609,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕はそれだけ言うと、さっと踵を返し、早足で出口へと向かった。","en":"With that, I spun on my heel and hurried toward the exit.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r610","rowIndex":610,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　もう二度と振り返りたくはない。誰にも今の顔を見せたくはない。","en":"I never wanted to look back. I did not want anyone to see my face as it was now.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r611","rowIndex":611,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　地下の駐車場までやって来ると、くつろいで煙草を吸っていたブラジル人運転手を促し、ドアを開けさせた。","en":"When I reached the underground garage, I found the Brazilian driver relaxing over a cigarette and had him open the door.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r612","rowIndex":612,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕はその後部座席に、身を投げ出すように腰をおろす。","en":"I threw myself into the rear seat.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r613","rowIndex":613,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どうしました？　なんだかひどくお疲れじゃないっすか」","en":"“What’s wrong? You look beat.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r614","rowIndex":614,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どうってことない。ホテルへやってくれ」","en":"“Nothing. Take me to the hotel.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r615","rowIndex":615,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そうは言ったが、実際僕は疲労していた。これほど疲労することが、最近の僕にあっただろうか？","en":"That was what I said. In truth, I was exhausted. When had I last been this tired?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r616","rowIndex":616,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　研究室で徹夜をし、食事もろくにとらないまま作業を続けても、こんなに全身が脱力するほど疲れ果てたことはなかった。","en":"I had worked through nights in the laboratory without eating proper meals and still never felt so drained that every muscle in my body went slack.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r617","rowIndex":617,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　後部座席に身体を預けたまま、もう指一本動かす気にはなれない。","en":"I sank into the back seat and lost all desire to move so much as one finger.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r618","rowIndex":618,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　あの父の態度に対して、何かもっとうまい対応の仕方があった気がする。僕も感情に支配されてしまったんだ。こんなに未熟なようでは、いよいよ先が思いやられるぞ。","en":"There must have been a more skillful way to respond to my father. I, too, had let my emotions rule me. If I was still this immature, the future looked bleak indeed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r619","rowIndex":619,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ブラジル人が運転席に座り、エンジンをかけたところで<tips=4>馬明</tips>が駆け足でやって来て、ドアを開けた。","en":"The Brazilian had taken the driver’s seat and started the engine when <tips=4>Ma Ming</tips> came running. He opened the door.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r620","rowIndex":620,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして断りもなく僕の隣に腰をおろすと、ハンカチで額に浮き出た汗を拭う。","en":"Without asking permission, he sat beside me and wiped the sweat from his forehead with a handkerchief.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r621","rowIndex":621,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……おい、おれの事務所に寄ってくれ」","en":"“...Hey, swing by my office.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬明","displayName":"Ma Ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r622","rowIndex":622,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あっ、<tips=4>馬明</tips>様」","en":"“Oh, Master <tips=4>Ma Ming</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r623","rowIndex":623,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　突然乗り込んで来た<tips=4>馬明</tips>の言葉に、運転手が戸惑いを浮かべる。","en":"The driver looked bewildered when <tips=4>Ma Ming</tips> suddenly climbed in and spoke.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r624","rowIndex":624,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「他の車で帰れよ。僕は一人になりたいんだ」","en":"“Take another car back. I want to be alone.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r625","rowIndex":625,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まあまあ、そう言うな。大事な話があるんだ。……おい、事務所まで頼むぞ」","en":"“Come on, don’t say that. I need to talk to you about something important. ...Hey, take us to my office.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬明","displayName":"Ma Ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r626","rowIndex":626,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼は僕に有無を言わさず、運転手にもう一度行き先を指示する。","en":"Ignoring my objections, he repeated the destination to the driver.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r627","rowIndex":627,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いやあ、しかし、なんだな、あれは……」","en":"“Well, I must say, that was...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬明","displayName":"Ma Ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r628","rowIndex":628,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　車が走り出すと、<tips=4>馬明</tips>はクックッと笑いを堪えている。","en":"As the car started moving, <tips=4>Ma Ming</tips> struggled to stifle a chuckle.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r629","rowIndex":629,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「笑いたいなら素直に笑えばいいさ」","en":"“If you want to laugh, just laugh.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r630","rowIndex":630,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕は苛々しながらそう言う。","en":"I said it irritably.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r631","rowIndex":631,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いやあ、すまん！　しかし、兄貴があんなことを言い出すとは、おれもちっとも想像していなかった。おれもな、てっきり<tips=2>阿亮</tips>に組織に入れって話をするもんだと思っていたんだよ。あれが一番の望みだったとはなあ。いやあ、やっぱり親心というやつだな」","en":"“Ah, sorry! But I never imagined Big Brother would come out with something like that. I was sure he meant to tell <tips=2>Ah Leung</tips> to join the organization. To think that was what he wanted most. Ah, that’s a father’s love for you.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬明","displayName":"Ma Ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r632","rowIndex":632,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そんなわけないだろう。最初は今後の組織の話をするつもりだったのは間違いない。ただ、部屋に来た僕の様子を見て、どうしても説得出来そうになかったから、僕をからかうために、その場であんなことを思い付いたんだよ」","en":"“Of course not. There’s no question he originally meant to discuss the organization’s future. But once he saw me in the room and realized he would never persuade me, he thought that up on the spot just to toy with me.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r633","rowIndex":633,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いくら兄貴でも、そこまで人が悪くはないだろう」","en":"“Even Big Brother isn’t that mean-spirited.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬明","displayName":"Ma Ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r634","rowIndex":634,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いいや、瀕死でもやる人だね。彼は」","en":"“Oh, yes he is. He’d do it with one foot in the grave.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r635","rowIndex":635,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ううむ」","en":"“Hmm...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬明","displayName":"Ma Ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r636","rowIndex":636,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=4>馬明</tips>は腕組みをすると、","en":"<tips=4>Ma Ming</tips> folded his arms.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r637","rowIndex":637,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「兄貴の本心はわからんが、おれは、いまの<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>の状況を考えれば後継者としてふさわしいのは<tips=2>阿亮</tips>しかいないと思っている。血の繋がった長男が継承する以外に兄貴亡きあとの組織をまとめる方法はない」","en":"“I don’t know what Big Brother truly intends. But looking at <tips=7>YS</tips> as it is now, I think no one but <tips=2>Ah Leung</tips> is fit to succeed him. Unless his eldest son—his own flesh and blood—inherits, there’s no other way to hold the organization together after he dies.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬明","displayName":"Ma Ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r638","rowIndex":638,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「他にいないわけないだろう。いくらでも有能なやつがいるんだから、そこから誰か昇格させるのが穏当だ」","en":"“Of course there are other candidates. There are any number of capable men. The sensible thing would be to promote one of them.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r639","rowIndex":639,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=81>龍頭</tips>の地位は血族が継ぐ。それが伝統だ」","en":"“The position of <tips=81>Longtou</tips> passes to a blood relative. That is our tradition.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬明","displayName":"Ma Ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r640","rowIndex":640,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それは<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>じゃなくて、<tips=69>義勝</tips>の伝統じゃないか」","en":"“That’s a tradition of <tips=69>Yisheng</tips>, not <tips=7>YS</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r641","rowIndex":641,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「同じことだ。<tips=69>義勝</tips>時代の掟は今も生きている。それに、この世界には血よりも濃いものはない」","en":"“Same thing. The old rules from the <tips=69>Yisheng</tips> days still stand. Besides, in this world, nothing is thicker than blood.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬明","displayName":"Ma Ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r642","rowIndex":642,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「前時代的だな。そんな考えでいるのは<tips=76>香港派</tips>の連中だけだよ。他の幹部が納得すると思えない。<tips=81>龍頭</tips>自身そう言ってたじゃないか」","en":"“How backward. Only the <tips=76>Hong Kong faction</tips> still thinks that way. I can’t imagine the other officers agreeing. <tips=81>Longtou</tips> himself said as much.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r643","rowIndex":643,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あれは本心なのかな？　まあ、何にしろ、<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>と関わりが強い人間が跡を継ぐ以外、方法はないのさ」","en":"“Is that really how he feels? Well, either way, the only choice is for someone closely connected to <tips=3>Chris Tse</tips> to succeed him.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬明","displayName":"Ma Ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r644","rowIndex":644,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そこで<tips=4>馬明</tips>は声のトーンを落とし、","en":"<tips=4>Ma Ming</tips> lowered his voice.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r645","rowIndex":645,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「兄貴が弱り、死が近づくにつれて、この街には昔の雰囲気が戻りつつある」","en":"“As Big Brother grows weaker and death draws closer, this city is starting to feel like it did in the old days.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬明","displayName":"Ma Ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r646","rowIndex":646,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「昔？」","en":"“The old days?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r647","rowIndex":647,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうとも。<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>が生まれる前の、組織同士で対立していた時代さ。今は大人しくしている連中が、みな兄貴の死後の勢力図について考えはじめ、その時少しでも有利になるように動いている。そこらじゅうに、きなくさいにおいが漂ってやがるんだ。昨日の結婚式で気がつかなかったか？　あちこちに固まって、身内だけで話していやがる。あからさまじゃねえか」","en":"“Exactly. The age before <tips=7>YS</tips> was founded, when the organizations were at war. The men keeping quiet for now are all beginning to think about the balance of power after Big Brother’s death and maneuvering to gain even the slightest advantage when the time comes. The smell of gunpowder is everywhere. Didn’t you notice it at yesterday’s wedding? They clustered into little groups and spoke only among their own. It couldn’t have been more obvious.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬明","displayName":"Ma Ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r648","rowIndex":648,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「少し気になっていた。<tips=81>龍頭</tips>の影響力があそこまで弱まっているとは」","en":"“It had caught my attention. I didn’t realize <tips=81>Longtou’s</tips> influence had weakened that badly.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r649","rowIndex":649,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうだろう？　だから<tips=2>阿亮</tips>はあんなにイライラしていたんだな」","en":"“Exactly. So that was why <tips=2>Ah Leung</tips> was so irritable.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬明","displayName":"Ma Ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r650","rowIndex":650,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それは全然違う」","en":"“That’s completely wrong.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r651","rowIndex":651,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕がむすっとして言うと、彼は笑い、","en":"I said it sullenly, and he laughed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r652","rowIndex":652,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「とにかく、こんな状態で、よその派閥のボスをスライドさせて<tips=81>龍頭</tips>にしたら、組織が割れて元の戦国時代に逆戻りするのは火を見るより明らかだ。<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>は元々結びつきの強い組織じゃない。街の英雄<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>がボスとして仕切っていたから、どの派閥にも利益があって、それでまとまっていただけの話だ。だから、その名声を引き継げる後継者が必要なんだよ」","en":"“Anyway, in the present situation, if we simply put the boss of some other faction in as <tips=81>Longtou</tips>, it’s plain as day that the organization will split and we’ll go straight back to the old age of warring factions. <tips=7>YS</tips> was never a tightly knit organization. It held together only because the city’s hero, <tips=3>Chris Tse</tips>, ran it as boss and every faction benefited. That’s why we need a successor who can inherit his prestige.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬明","displayName":"Ma Ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r653","rowIndex":653,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どうしても血の繋がりが必要なら<tips=76>旧義勝</tips>にいる親戚連中の誰かから選べばいい。いくらでもいるじゃないか。まあ、僕は血族の掟なんか捨てて、<tips=39>ジェフリー</tips>や<tips=4>馬明</tips>がやるのが一番いいんじゃないかと思っているけれどね」","en":"“If blood is absolutely necessary, choose one of the relatives in <tips=76>old Yisheng</tips>. There are plenty. Personally, though, I think the best thing would be to discard the rule of blood and let <tips=39>Jeffrey</tips> or <tips=4>Ma Ming</tips> take over.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r654","rowIndex":654,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「おれや<tips=39>ジェフリー</tips>じゃ、<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>全体どころか、身内も納得しないよ。……しかし、お前は全くわかっていないな。ただ血が繋がってるってだけじゃ駄目なのさ。組織にいる親戚なんか、兄貴よりお年を召してらっしゃる方ばかりだ。失礼ながら、兄貴が頭角を現すまで何も出来なかった人たちだ。誰も彼らには期待しないよ。……だから、若くて活きのいい、可能性に満ちあふれた御曹司がどうしても必要なんだよ」","en":"“Neither <tips=39>Jeffrey</tips> nor I could win over our own people, much less all of <tips=7>YS</tips>. ...You really don’t understand. Blood alone isn’t enough. All our relatives in the organization are older than Big Brother. With all due respect, they’re people who accomplished nothing until Big Brother rose to prominence. No one expects anything of them. ...That’s why what we absolutely need is a young, vigorous heir bursting with promise.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬明","displayName":"Ma Ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r655","rowIndex":655,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「僕からすればいい面の皮だ」","en":"“And I’m the one left holding the bag.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r656","rowIndex":656,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どうしてそんなにいやがる？　やりがいのある仕事じゃないか」","en":"“Why are you so against it? It’s rewarding work, isn’t it?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬明","displayName":"Ma Ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r657","rowIndex":657,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「冗談じゃない。伝統芸能じゃないんだから、子が親の仕事を継ぐのが当たり前って考え方はナンセンスだ。そっちの世界から見れば僕は<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>の息子でしかないんだろうけれども、僕には僕の考えがある。自分を後継者だなんて考えたこともない。だから、苦労して学生になったんだよ。何でここまで来て、犯罪組織と関わらなきゃならないのか」","en":"“Don’t be absurd. This isn’t a traditional art; the idea that children should naturally inherit their parents’ work is nonsense. From your side of the world, I may be nothing but <tips=3>Chris Tse’s</tips> son, but I have ideas of my own. I’ve never thought of myself as his successor. That’s why I worked so hard to become a student. Why should I have to involve myself with a criminal organization after coming this far?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r658","rowIndex":658,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「その考えは改めてもらう。そりゃお前にも考えがあるのだろうが、この街の人間にとって、<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>の血を継いでいるというのはそれくらい特別なことなんだ。無視して生きてゆくことは出来ないんだよ。……なあ、もしお前が後継者となることを拒否したとしても、同じ血を引く別の者が継ぐことになるんだぞ？　そのことはわかってるのか？」","en":"“You’ll have to rethink that. I’m sure you have ideas of your own, but to the people of this city, carrying <tips=3>Chris Tse’s</tips> blood means more than you realize. You can’t live as though it doesn’t matter. ...Listen. Even if you refuse to become his successor, someone else with the same blood will take his place. Do you understand that?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬明","displayName":"Ma Ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r659","rowIndex":659,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「もしかして」","en":"“You don’t mean...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r660","rowIndex":660,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　いやな予感がして、僕は顔を顰める。","en":"A bad feeling came over me, and I frowned.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r661","rowIndex":661,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=44>シウ</tips>のことを言っているのか？」","en":"“Do you mean <tips=44>Siu</tips>?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r662","rowIndex":662,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=4>馬明</tips>は黙って僕を見ている。","en":"<tips=4>Ma Ming</tips> said nothing, only looked at me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r663","rowIndex":663,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=4>馬明</tips>、それはありえないよ。お前が言うとおり、<tips=76>旧義勝</tips>の連中はおそろしく保守的なんだぜ。<tips=44>シウ</tips>みたいな子供で、しかも<tips=17>タイプB</tips>の<tips=81>龍頭</tips>を認めるわけがない。そもそも、僕だって、半分日本人の血が入っているから、受け入れられるかどうか。母さんと<tips=81>龍頭</tips>が結婚するときも、散々反対されたんだろう？」","en":"“<tips=4>Ma Ming</tips>, that’s impossible. As you said, the men of <tips=76>old Yisheng</tips> are frighteningly conservative. They would never accept a child like <tips=44>Siu</tips>—and a <tips=17>Type B</tips> at that—as <tips=81>Longtou</tips>. I’m not even sure they’d accept me, with half Japanese blood. They bitterly opposed Mother’s marriage to <tips=81>Longtou</tips>, didn’t they?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r664","rowIndex":664,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>の血を継いでいるという事実はお前が思っている以上に重い。兄貴が<tips=69>義勝</tips>のなかでどれだけ特別な存在なのか、お前は全くわかっていない」","en":"“The fact that you carry <tips=3>Chris Tse’s</tips> blood has more weight than you realize. You have no idea how extraordinary Big Brother is within <tips=69>Yisheng</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬明","displayName":"Ma Ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r665","rowIndex":665,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=4>馬明</tips>は真顔で断言する。","en":"<tips=4>Ma Ming</tips> stated it flatly, his face grave.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r666","rowIndex":666,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「もしお前が降りれば、<tips=44>シウ</tips>を担ぎ出す者は必ず現れる。女子供だなんてことは問題にはならん。その方が利用しやすいと考えるやつもいるだろう。もし<tips=81>龍頭</tips>に出来なかったとしても、自分の陣営に引き込めばどれだけ有利になるか」","en":"“If you step aside, someone will certainly put <tips=44>Siu</tips> forward. That she’s a girl and a child will not matter. Some may even think that makes her easier to use. Even if they cannot make her <tips=81>Longtou</tips>, imagine the advantage of drawing her into their own camp.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬明","displayName":"Ma Ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r667","rowIndex":667,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=44>シウ</tips>を持ち出すなんて卑怯だな」","en":"“Dragging <tips=44>Siu</tips> into this is underhanded.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r668","rowIndex":668,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「事実を言っているだけだ」","en":"“I’m only stating the facts.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬明","displayName":"Ma Ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r669","rowIndex":669,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼の表情は嘘をついているようには見えない。いや、もともと嘘が苦手な男である。","en":"His expression did not look like that of a man lying. Then again, he had always been a poor liar.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r670","rowIndex":670,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「妹のために犠牲になれってのか？」","en":"“Are you telling me to sacrifice myself for my sister?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r671","rowIndex":671,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そんなことを言っているわけじゃない。お前には<tips=81>龍頭</tips>としての器がある。それを無駄にして欲しくないだけだ。……大体、学生生活なんてものがそんなに楽しいのか？　お前が大人しく机でお勉強しているなんて想像も出来ない」","en":"“That’s not what I’m saying. You have what it takes to be <tips=81>Longtou</tips>. I just don’t want to see that go to waste. ...Besides, is student life really that much fun? I can’t picture you sitting quietly at a desk doing your schoolwork.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬明","displayName":"Ma Ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r672","rowIndex":672,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「楽しいよ」","en":"“It’s fun.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r673","rowIndex":673,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いやいや、そんな筈ないだろう？　そろそろ飽きているはずさ。なあ、よく考えろよ。お前にはありふれた人間とは違う特別な道が用意されているんだ。組織内にもお前が入って来るのを期待してる人間は少なくない。特に女どもに人気があるな。うちの娘もフェルナンデス家の三姉妹もお前のファンだそうじゃないか。まったく、美男子は得だ。おれもそんな顔に生まれたかったぞ」","en":"“No, no. That can’t be true. You must be growing bored by now. Think carefully. A special path, different from the lives of ordinary men, is waiting for you. More than a few people in the organization hope you’ll join. You’re especially popular with the women. My daughter and all three Fernandes sisters are admirers of yours, I hear. A handsome face certainly pays. I wish I’d been born with one.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬明","displayName":"Ma Ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r674","rowIndex":674,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=4>馬明</tips>だって味のある顔をしているよ」","en":"“Your face has character, <tips=4>Ma Ming</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r675","rowIndex":675,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それで褒めているつもりかよ」","en":"“You call that praise?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬明","displayName":"Ma Ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r676","rowIndex":676,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=4>馬明</tips>は苦々しく言って、僕の肩を叩く。","en":"<tips=4>Ma Ming</tips> said bitterly and slapped me on the shoulder.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r677","rowIndex":677,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なあ<tips=2>阿亮</tips>。兄貴は今日あんなことを言ったが、本心はおれと同じなのは間違いない。もし兄貴がいなくなったら、お前以外に我々の組織をまとめられる人間はいないんだ。そのことを少し考えてくれないか？　もう少し、この街にいてくれ。兄貴が言い出さない以上、おれからは継ぐ継がないの話は出来ないが、もし仮に<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>の<tips=81>龍頭</tips>にならなくとも、お前が謝家の跡取りであることはかわらない。最後まで見届ける義務がある」","en":"“Listen, <tips=2>Ah Leung</tips>. Whatever Big Brother said today, I’m certain his true wish is the same as mine. Once he is gone, no one but you can hold our organization together. Will you give that some thought? Stay in the city a little longer. Since Big Brother didn’t raise the subject himself, it’s not my place to talk about whether you’ll succeed him. But even if you never become <tips=81>Longtou</tips> of <tips=7>YS</tips>, you’re still the heir to the Tse family. You have a duty to see this through to the end.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬明","displayName":"Ma Ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r678","rowIndex":678,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕は黙っていた。","en":"I said nothing.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r679","rowIndex":679,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そうしてなかなか話しだそうとしないので、<tips=4>馬明</tips>がまた口を開いた。","en":"When I continued to show no sign of answering, <tips=4>Ma Ming</tips> spoke again.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r680","rowIndex":680,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「話は変わるが、今度うちのやつが、披露パーティを考えているらしい。おれは参加しないが、今言った<tips=35>フェルナンデス</tips>の娘たちや、<tips=28>トミー</tips>なんかも来るそうだ。きっと<tips=2>阿亮</tips>も誘われるだろう。そこで幼なじみと旧交を温めるのもいいんじゃないか？」","en":"“On another subject, my wife is apparently planning a little celebration. I won’t attend, but those <tips=35>Fernandes</tips> daughters I just mentioned and <tips=28>Tommy</tips> will be there. I’m sure <tips=2>Ah Leung</tips> will be invited too. Why not renew old friendships with your childhood companions?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬明","displayName":"Ma Ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r681","rowIndex":681,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あまり気の進む集まりじゃないな」","en":"“It doesn’t sound like a gathering I’d enjoy.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r682","rowIndex":682,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「幼なじみは大事にした方が良いぞ。おれだって、兄貴と幼なじみでなかったら、こんな人生は送れなかった。くだらないチンピラのままだったろう」","en":"“Childhood friends should be treasured. Had Big Brother and I not grown up together, I could never have lived a life like this. I’d probably still be some worthless hoodlum.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬明","displayName":"Ma Ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r683","rowIndex":683,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そんなに卑下する必要もないと思うけれどね」","en":"“There is no need to think so little of yourself.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r684","rowIndex":684,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=4>馬明</tips>は、リーダーとしての素質に恵まれた父や、冷静で知恵のある<tips=39>ジェフリー</tips>に対し、腕っ節しかない自分を低く見るきらいがある。","en":"Beside my father, a born leader, and the calm, astute <tips=39>Jeffrey</tips>, <tips=4>Ma Ming</tips> tended to think little of himself as a man with nothing but muscle.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r685","rowIndex":685,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　昔からそういった傾向はあったが、幹部として年を経てその自慢の腕っ節も衰えたいま、より強く感じているのだろう。","en":"He had always been inclined that way, but perhaps it had grown more pronounced as his years as an officer passed and even that vaunted strength began to fade.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r686","rowIndex":686,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まあ、少し考えてみるさ。さすがに余命僅かとあっちゃね」","en":"“I’ll give it some thought. Given how little time he has left, I suppose I should.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r687","rowIndex":687,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それがいい。暇なら街を歩いてみたらどうだ？　ここが今どういう状況になっているか、その目で確かめるんだ」","en":"“Good. If you have time, why not walk around the city? See for yourself what has become of this place.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬明","displayName":"Ma Ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r688","rowIndex":688,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　やがて車は<tips=57>滑走路通り</tips>から一つ奥に入った通りにある雑居ビルの前に止まる。","en":"In time, the car stopped before a mixed-use building one street back from <tips=57>Runway Street</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r689","rowIndex":689,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　薄汚い建物で、およそ<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>の大幹部の事務所には相応しくないが、そこは<tips=4>馬明</tips>のまだ若い頃からの思い出深い本拠地であった。僕にも、幼い頃にその建物の中で彼に遊んで貰った記憶がある。","en":"The grimy building hardly suited the office of one of <tips=7>YS’s</tips> highest officers, but it was <tips=4>Ma Ming’s</tips> old base of operations, full of memories dating back to his youth. I remembered him playing with me there when I was a child, too.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r690","rowIndex":690,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=4>馬明</tips>を降ろし、車が走り出してすぐに僕は運転手に声をかけた。","en":"We let <tips=4>Ma Ming</tips> out. The car had barely started again when I addressed the driver.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r691","rowIndex":691,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「気が変わった。ホテルじゃなくて<tips=57>滑走路通り</tips>で降ろしてくれる？」","en":"“I changed my mind. Would you drop me on <tips=57>Runway Street</tips> instead of at the hotel?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r692","rowIndex":692,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=4>馬明</tips>の言葉に感化された訳じゃない。ふと、昨日歩いている時に嗅いだコシーニャを揚げるにおいを思い出しただけだ。","en":"It was not that <tips=4>Ma Ming’s</tips> words had swayed me. I had simply remembered the smell of frying coxinha that I had noticed while walking the day before.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r693","rowIndex":693,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　コシーニャは<tips=57>滑走路通り</tips>のブラジル人が扱う定番商品で、ゆでた鳥肉をじゃがいもで包んで揚げたコロッケに似た料理だ。","en":"Coxinha was a standard offering among the Brazilians of <tips=57>Runway Street</tips>: a croquette-like food made by wrapping boiled chicken in potato dough and frying it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r694","rowIndex":694,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　最近はよそから来た客向けにやたらと高い値をつけるようになったが、僕が小さい頃は地元の住民向けの食べ物だった。とにかく安くて、親が露店で大量に購入して新聞紙に包んで持って来たものを食卓の上に山盛りに置いて、遊びに来た子供たちが遊びの合間に食べるというのがよくある風景だった。","en":"They had lately begun charging outrageous prices to visitors, but when I was small, it was food for the locals. It was incredibly cheap, and it was a common sight for parents to buy heaps of it from a street stall, bring it home wrapped in newspaper, and pile it on the table for children to eat between bouts of play.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r695","rowIndex":695,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕はなかでもチーズが入っているやつが好きで、自分のわずかな小遣いのなかから、よく買って食べたものだ。あのホクホクとした感じが絶妙なんだ。","en":"I especially liked the ones filled with cheese and often bought them with my meager allowance. Their hot, fluffy texture was exquisite.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r696","rowIndex":696,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　昨日のブラジル人夫婦から買いたかったので、<tips=57>滑走路通り</tips>でそのワゴンを探したが見つからない。","en":"I wanted to buy from the Brazilian couple I had seen the day before, so I searched <tips=57>Runway Street</tips> for their van, but could not find it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r697","rowIndex":697,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　仕方なく諦め、他の食べ物屋を探し始めた時、","en":"I gave up and had just begun looking for another place to eat when—","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r698","rowIndex":698,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「きゃあ！」","en":"“Aaaah!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r699","rowIndex":699,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　通りの向こうから、空気をつんざくような女の悲鳴が響き渡る。そしてすぐ、それに続いて無数の男女の、叫びや怒号がわき起こる。","en":"A woman’s scream split the air from the far side of the street. It was immediately followed by countless shouts and angry bellows from men and women alike.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r700","rowIndex":700,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　異常を察知して人混みがざわめくが、こう混雑してしまっては少し離れた人間は事態を把握することは出来ない。僕も、何かしら起きたことは察知したものの、具体的に何が起こったのかはまったくわからなかった。","en":"The crowd stirred at the sign of trouble. In such congestion, however, anyone even a short distance away had no way to grasp what was happening. I knew something had happened, but had no idea what.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r701","rowIndex":701,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ただ、悲鳴や叫びが収まらないことと、その声の切迫した様子から、ただごとでないということだけは把握した。","en":"Only the unending screams and shouts, and the desperation in those voices, made it plain that this was no ordinary disturbance.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r702","rowIndex":702,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「化け物だ！」","en":"“A monster!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r703","rowIndex":703,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　という一声が、折り重なってざわめきとなる声のなかから明瞭に耳に届く。","en":"That single cry reached me clearly amid the overlapping voices merging into one great roar.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r704","rowIndex":704,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　目をこらすと、確かに揺れる人混みの向こうに、白く大きな何かがいるようだった。そして、鮮やかな赤も垣間見えた。あれは、どうも血液の赤のように思える。","en":"I strained my eyes. Beyond the shifting crowd, something large and white did seem to be there. I caught flashes of vivid red as well. The color looked very much like blood.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r705","rowIndex":705,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ここで<tips=57>滑走路通り</tips>に混乱が訪れた。","en":"Then chaos came to <tips=57>Runway Street</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r706","rowIndex":706,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　現場のすぐ近くで状況に直面したものは逃げようとする。しかし後ろのほうで状況が理解出来ないものは現場を良く見ようと立ち止まる。この温度差によって人混みはもみくちゃになり、焦りと怒りのこもった声があちこちでわき起こる。","en":"Those close enough to see what was happening tried to flee. Those farther back, unable to understand it, stopped for a better look. That difference in urgency churned the crowd into a crush, and voices full of panic and anger rose on every side.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r707","rowIndex":707,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「おい、やめろ！　押すな！　馬鹿野郎！」","en":"“Hey, stop! Don’t push, you bastards!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r708","rowIndex":708,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ほとんどパニック状態となった群衆に向かって誰かが叫んでいるが、他の誰の声にも届かない。","en":"Someone shouted at the near-panicked crowd, but his voice reached no one.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r709","rowIndex":709,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　群衆は雪崩が細かい障害物を破壊しながら流れ落ちてゆくように、倒れた誰かを踏みつけ、路上の看板などをなぎ倒しながら現場から逃げようとする。","en":"Like an avalanche smashing through small obstacles as it poured downhill, the crowd trampled anyone who fell and knocked down signs along the street in its effort to escape.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r710","rowIndex":710,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕は人混みに押し流されないよう標識の柱につかまった。","en":"I seized the post of a road sign to keep from being swept away.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r711","rowIndex":711,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして、騒動の中心、潮が引くように人が逃げてぽっかりとうまれた空間にいる、その獣を見た。","en":"At the center of the disturbance, in a space left suddenly empty as the people receded like a tide, I saw the beast.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r712","rowIndex":712,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それは、白く巨大な獣で、制服を着た少年の腹を巨大な牙の生えた口で囓っていた。","en":"It was a gigantic white beast. Its enormous fangs were sunk into the belly of a boy in uniform.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A1:r713","rowIndex":713,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　児童はすでにぴくりとも動かず、猛獣のナイフのような牙に内臓を食いちぎられるままにしている。","en":"The child no longer twitched as the beast’s knife-like fangs tore out and devoured his entrails.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}}]},{"position":3,"code":"B1","unitId":"B1","rows":[{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r1","rowIndex":1,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「今日も売れないねえ」","en":"“They’re not selling today either, huh?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"田中紺太","displayName":"Konta Tanaka","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r2","rowIndex":2,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=66>コンタ</tips>は『<tips=71>グレートホール饅頭</tips>』の山を前に言う。うんざりとした顔をしている。まあ、仕方が無い。売り物が売れないでぼんやり何もせずにすごすというのは、なんとも言えず虚しいものだからね。","en":"<tips=66>Konta</tips> said it before a mountain of “<tips=71>Great Hole Buns</tips>,” looking thoroughly fed up. Well, who could blame him? Sitting around in a daze with nothing to do while your wares would not sell left you feeling empty in a way that was hard to describe.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r3","rowIndex":3,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「やっぱり、商品名を変えたほうがいいんじゃない？　だって、この<tips=57>滑走路通り</tips>に来るヤツラが、どういうものを買いに来てるか考えてみなよ。みんなさー、外国の珍しいものや、見たことのないものを買いに来てるんでしょ。だからこんな野暮ったい名前じゃなくて、広東語風にするとか、ポルトガル語風にするとか、タイとかアジアンな感じにするとか、とにかくもっとポップな方がよくない？」","en":"“Maybe we ought to change the product name after all. Think about what people come to <tips=57>Runway Street</tips> to buy. They’re here for unusual things from foreign countries, things they’ve never seen before. So instead of a stodgy name like this, wouldn’t something Cantonese-sounding, Portuguese-sounding, Thai, or vaguely Asian—anything more pop—be better?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"田中紺太","displayName":"Konta Tanaka","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r4","rowIndex":4,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いやあ、このままで行こうじゃないの」","en":"“Nah, let’s stick with it.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r5","rowIndex":5,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼の言うことも分かるが、おれには信念がある。","en":"I understood his point, but I had my principles.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r6","rowIndex":6,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「だってこれは、日本で生まれた日本のお菓子なんだよ？　この街にはいろんな国の人間が住んでるけど、紛れもない日本の街なんだ。それを、売らんがためにとってつけたような言葉を使うなんて出来るわけないでしょう。客に申し訳ないもんよ」","en":"“But these are Japanese sweets, born right here in Japan. People from all kinds of countries live in this city, but it’s still unmistakably a Japanese city. We can’t slap on some foreign-sounding word just to make them sell. I’d feel like we were cheating the customers.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r7","rowIndex":7,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「これ、日本のお菓子って言えるの？　作ってるのは、年取ってリタイアした中華料理シェフとか、ネパール人の主婦とか、どこの国籍かわからない捨て子とかじゃん。何語だっていいと思うよ？」","en":"“Can you really call these Japanese sweets? The people making them are a retired old chef who used to cook Chinese food, a Nepali housewife, and a foundling whose nationality no one knows. I think any language would be fine.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"田中紺太","displayName":"Konta Tanaka","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r8","rowIndex":8,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「その言い分はわかるけどね、みんな普段は日本語で喋ってるだろ。人種や国籍が異なる人々が、この日本のこの街で、日本語で生活してるってのがまさに<tips=9>Y地区</tips>的だと思うし、この街の素晴らしさだと思うんだよ。だから日本語で名前を付けたいのさ」","en":"“I see your point, but they all usually speak Japanese, don’t they? People of different races and nationalities living here in this Japanese city, going about their lives in Japanese—that’s exactly what <tips=9>Y District</tips> is about, and it’s what makes this city so wonderful. That’s why I want a Japanese name.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r9","rowIndex":9,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「うーん、北京語とか広東語とか英語とかスペイン語も、日本語と同じくらい話されてるような気もするけど……」","en":"“Hmm. Mandarin, Cantonese, English, and Spanish all seem about as common as Japanese...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"田中紺太","displayName":"Konta Tanaka","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r10","rowIndex":10,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「共通語は日本語でしょう？　それがいいんだよ」","en":"“But Japanese is the common language, isn’t it? That’s what I like.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r11","rowIndex":11,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=66>コンタ</tips>はもやもやした顔でおれを見ながら、","en":"<tips=66>Konta</tips> gave me a doubtful look and said,","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r12","rowIndex":12,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=10>道夫</tips>君のこだわりがあるのはわかった。共感するのはちょっと難しいけど……とにかく、そこまで言うなら日本語でもいい。そのかわり、もっとキャッチーな感じの……」","en":"“I get that you’ve got your heart set on this, <tips=10>Michio</tips>. I can’t really relate to it, but... if you feel that strongly, Japanese is fine. Just make it something catchier...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"田中紺太","displayName":"Konta Tanaka","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r13","rowIndex":13,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「悪いなあ。<tips=66>コンタ</tips>の言いたいこともわかるけど、おれはこのネーミングは絶対将来定着すると確信してるんよ」","en":"“Sorry. I get what you’re saying, <tips=66>Konta</tips>, but I’m absolutely convinced this name will catch on eventually.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r14","rowIndex":14,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おれはもう一度首を横に振る。","en":"I shook my head once more.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r15","rowIndex":15,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「とにかくさ、まだ売り出しはじめたばかりなんだから、そう焦らなくてもいいじゃんか。確かに多少見込みとは違うけれど、全然売れないってわけでもない。味は間違いないんだから、そのうち評判が評判を呼んで<tips=9>Y地区</tips>の定番商品となる」","en":"“Anyway, we only just started selling them, so there’s no need to rush. Sure, sales are a little below what I expected, but it’s not like no one’s buying. We know they taste good. Word will spread, and sooner or later they’ll become a <tips=9>Y District</tips> staple.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r16","rowIndex":16,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうかなあ」","en":"“You think so?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"田中紺太","displayName":"Konta Tanaka","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r17","rowIndex":17,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そう言ってから、<tips=66>コンタ</tips>はあくびをする。","en":"After saying that, <tips=66>Konta</tips> yawned.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r18","rowIndex":18,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　あまりにも緊張感のないことだが、しかしこのあくびを責めることは出来ない。","en":"It showed an almost absurd lack of urgency, but I could hardly blame him for yawning.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r19","rowIndex":19,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼は早朝から包装作業をしてくれていて、そしてずっと座りっぱなしで販売を行っているのだもの。","en":"He had been packaging the buns since early morning, then sitting here selling them all this time.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r20","rowIndex":20,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　まったく有り難いし、それに彼がこんな風に頑張ってくれるのはなんとも嬉しいことなのだ。ちょっと前なら、想像も出来ない。","en":"I was truly grateful. More than that, seeing him work so hard like this made me incredibly happy. Not long ago, I could never have imagined it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r21","rowIndex":21,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=66>コンタ</tips>の家庭環境は悲惨だ。","en":"<tips=66>Konta’s</tips> home life had been awful.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r22","rowIndex":22,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=9>Y地区</tips>随一の貧民地域で<tips=17>タイプB</tips>として生まれた彼は、娼婦の息子だった。小さい頃から街角に立って客に声をかけ、ポン引きみたいなことをしてお母さんの商売を手伝っていたんだ。","en":"Born a <tips=17>Type B</tips> in the poorest part of <tips=9>Y District</tips>, he was the son of a prostitute. From the time he was small, he stood on street corners calling to customers and worked as a kind of tout to help his mother’s business.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r23","rowIndex":23,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そうして、お母さんの体調が悪くなると、お母さん専用のポン引きだった<tips=66>コンタ</tips>は売春宿の従業員となり、プロのポン引きになった。それだけでなく、金に困った娘を娼館に紹介するなどという女衒まがいの仕事にも手を染めて、この街の裏通りにはいくらでもいるチンピラの一人になってしまったのだ。","en":"When his mother’s health deteriorated, <tips=66>Konta</tips>, once her personal tout, went to work at a brothel and became a professional pimp. He even dirtied his hands with work little better than procuring—referring girls in need of money to brothels—and ended up one of the countless young hoodlums in the city’s back streets.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r24","rowIndex":24,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そうして、病気のお母さんの面倒を見る傍らで、夢も希望もなく日々を暮らしていた。","en":"While caring for his sick mother, he lived from day to day without dreams or hope.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r25","rowIndex":25,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それが、今は足を洗ってこうしておれと一緒に仕事を手伝ってくれている。","en":"And now he had left that life behind and was here, helping me with our business.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r26","rowIndex":26,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おれから誘ったんだ。<tips=66>コンタ</tips>は子供の頃のいたずら仲間だからね。このままじゃ破滅するのはわかりきっていたし、たとえそれが本人の望みだとしてもおれはいやだったんだ。","en":"I was the one who invited him. <tips=66>Konta</tips> and I used to get into trouble together as kids. It was obvious he would destroy himself if he kept going like that, and even if that was what he wanted, I couldn’t bear the thought.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r27","rowIndex":27,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　思ったよりあっさりと承諾してくれたのは、やっぱり本人も、何か夢を見たかったんだと思う。","en":"He agreed more readily than I expected. I think that, deep down, he wanted something to dream about too.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r28","rowIndex":28,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　悲しいことだけれども、<tips=9>Y地区</tips>の裏通りには彼のような境遇の若者が多い。希望を抱くことを諦めて、犯罪まがい、あるいは犯罪そのものに手を出し、ただその瞬間だけの刹那的な快楽を繋ぎあわせて、どうにか一日を消費して、人生を低空飛行させている。","en":"Sad as it is, the back streets of <tips=9>Y District</tips> hold many young people in circumstances like his. They have given up on hope. They turn to things bordering on crime, or to crime itself, piecing together momentary pleasures just long enough to use up another day and keep their lives flying close to the ground.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r29","rowIndex":29,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　いまこの仕事をしているおれの仲間はこんなやつばっかりだ。","en":"Everyone working with me now has a story like that.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r30","rowIndex":30,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　こういう苦しい境遇の人々が協力してくれているわけだから、なんとしてもこの企画を成功させなければならないと、おれは毎日考えている。","en":"With people who have lived through so much hardship helping me, I tell myself every day that I have to make this venture succeed, whatever it takes.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r31","rowIndex":31,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　人生というものは、明日に期待を抱けるからこそ意義も感じられ、そして人生に意義があるからこそ幸せを感じることが出来るんじゃないか？","en":"Isn’t it because we can look forward to tomorrow that we find meaning in life—and because life has meaning that we can feel happy?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r32","rowIndex":32,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　まず彼らに希望に向かってまっすぐ努力する機会を与えたい。そしてその結果として、『<tips=71>グレートホール饅頭</tips>』が売れて、希望というものは実現することもあるのだという体験をさせたい。","en":"First, I want to give them a chance to work straight toward something they hope for. Then I want the <tips=71>Great Hole Buns</tips> to sell, so they can learn for themselves that sometimes hope really does come true.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r33","rowIndex":33,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼らは希望や願望がむごいやりかたで潰され続け、子供の頃から踏みにじられたものばっかりだから、その喜びを知らないのだ。","en":"These are people whose hopes and wishes have been brutally crushed over and over, who have themselves been trampled down since childhood. They’ve never known that joy.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r34","rowIndex":34,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そうしておれは今日も饅頭を売っている。","en":"And so today, too, I sell buns.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r35","rowIndex":35,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おれたちの商売の場所は、知り合いの花屋の店先だ。何日か前からここを使わせてもらっているんだけど、今日もいつもと同じように机を置き、お手製のノボリを立て、朝から売り声を上げていた。","en":"We did business on the sidewalk outside a flower shop owned by an acquaintance. He had been letting us use the space for the past few days. That day, as usual, we set out a table, raised our handmade banner, and called to customers from morning onward.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r36","rowIndex":36,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　この商品のメインターゲットはやっぱり女性だ。","en":"Our main customers were women.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r37","rowIndex":37,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　いくら男女の差がなくなって来たといっても、やはり女性の方が甘いものをよく買うだろうし、新しいものにも理解があるはずだからね。","en":"The gap between men and women might be narrowing, but women still bought more sweets and ought to be more open to something new.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r38","rowIndex":38,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　声をかければ彼女たちは立ち止まってくれる。そして試食させれば美味しいとは言ってくれる。しかし、困ったことになかなか買ってはくれない。","en":"When we called to them, they stopped. When we offered samples, they said the buns were delicious. The trouble was that they rarely bought one.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r39","rowIndex":39,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　口先で女性を騙すことを生業としていた<tips=66>コンタ</tips>でも、それとは勝手が違うのか、なかなか思うようには売れない。","en":"Even <tips=66>Konta</tips>, who had once made a living sweet-talking women, could not get the buns to sell the way he wanted. Maybe this was simply a different game.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r40","rowIndex":40,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　思うに、あと一歩なのだ。あと一歩、何かが足りないのだろう。","en":"We were one step short, I thought. Something was missing—just one thing.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r41","rowIndex":41,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その一歩とは、知名度じゃないか？","en":"Could the missing piece be name recognition?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r42","rowIndex":42,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　やっぱりわざわざこの<tips=9>Y地区</tips>に足を運ぶってのは、何かしら特別な体験をしたいって気持ちがあるからでしょう。この界隈には有名なお店や食べ物が沢山あるし、そのなかで、全く有名じゃないこの饅頭を買おうって気にはならない。","en":"People who go out of their way to visit <tips=9>Y District</tips> are surely seeking some special experience. The neighborhood has many famous shops and foods. Faced with those, no one feels inclined to buy a completely unknown bun.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r43","rowIndex":43,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　とにかく食べれば美味しいのだから、そして、これはもう、地道に評判を積み重ねてゆくしかない。そうして少しずつ知名度をあげていけば、いつか労力に見合う売り上げを達成出来ればというのがおれの考えだ。","en":"The buns were delicious if people tried them; that much was certain. All we could do was build a reputation honestly, one customer at a time. If we raised our profile little by little, perhaps one day our sales would justify the labor. That was my view.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r44","rowIndex":44,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　何事だって、地道が一番なんだよ。","en":"Slow and steady wins every time.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r45","rowIndex":45,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そもそも、今だってそこまで悲観するほどじゃないんだ。","en":"Besides, things weren’t bad enough to be pessimistic about.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r46","rowIndex":46,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　今日は朝から商売をしているんだけど、昼にさしかかろうというこの時刻、用意したうちの四分の一くらいは売れている。","en":"We had been selling since morning, and now, with noon approaching, about one quarter of what we had prepared was gone.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r47","rowIndex":47,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　午後も同程度は売れてくれるだろうし、最終的に七割くらいさばければまあまあ順調。悲観するような事態ではないんじゃないかな？　","en":"We would probably sell about as many that afternoon. If we ultimately moved around seventy percent, business would be going reasonably well. Surely the situation was not so bleak?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r48","rowIndex":48,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　だけど、どうも<tips=66>コンタ</tips>はその考えに賛同してくれない。","en":"<tips=66>Konta</tips>, however, did not seem to agree.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r49","rowIndex":49,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　もっと目に見える成果が早く出ないと、仲間たちのモチベーションが維持出来ない。みんなそんなに気が長くはないんだ。成功体験がないから根気強く頑張ることが苦手だ。このままではいけないと、それが<tips=66>コンタ</tips>の主張だった。","en":"Unless we produced more visible results soon, the others would lose their motivation. None of them was very patient. They had never known success, so persistence did not come easily. We could not go on like this—that was <tips=66>Konta’s</tips> argument.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r50","rowIndex":50,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まあまあ、焦らないことだよ」","en":"“Come on. Don’t rush.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r51","rowIndex":51,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おれは試食用として小さく切り分けた一つを、爪楊枝で突き刺して口に入れる。","en":"I speared one of the sample pieces with a toothpick and put it into my mouth.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r52","rowIndex":52,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ほら、やっぱり、間違いなく旨いじゃないか！　すぐに売れるようになるって。世の中、いいものは必ず売れるようになってるんだからねえ」","en":"“See? I knew it—they’re definitely good! They’ll start selling in no time. Good things always find a market sooner or later.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r53","rowIndex":53,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=10>道夫</tips>君のその楽天的なところは好きだけれども……」","en":"“I do like that optimism of yours, <tips=10>Michio</tips>...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"田中紺太","displayName":"Konta Tanaka","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r54","rowIndex":54,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=66>コンタ</tips>は溜息をつく。","en":"<tips=66>Konta</tips> sighed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r55","rowIndex":55,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「例えばさあ、もっとあちこちに配布をして、とにかく誰でもいいからたくさんの人に食べて貰うなんてどうかなあ？　そんなに自信があるなら、ばらまいてでも味を知ってもらわないと」","en":"“What if we handed them out all over and got as many people as possible—anyone and everyone—to try them? If you’re that confident, we ought to give them away if that’s what it takes to let people discover how they taste.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"田中紺太","displayName":"Konta Tanaka","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r56","rowIndex":56,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それは悪いアイデアじゃないけど、みんなが一生懸命作ってくれたのを無償で配ってしまうってのは気が咎めるんだよなあ……」","en":"“It isn’t a bad idea. But giving away what everyone worked so hard to make for nothing makes me feel guilty...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r57","rowIndex":57,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そういう問題じゃないでしょ。最初はただで配っても、最終的に売れればいいんだからさ。色々してみようよ」","en":"“That isn’t the point. Even if we give them away at first, all that matters is that they sell in the end. Let’s try different things.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"田中紺太","displayName":"Konta Tanaka","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r58","rowIndex":58,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「色々ねえ」","en":"“Different things, huh...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r59","rowIndex":59,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=66>コンタ</tips>の言い分にも一理あるのはわかっている。ただ、そういう売り方に力を入れるより、品質の向上とか、そういった部分に労力を割きたいという気持ちもある。","en":"I knew <tips=66>Konta</tips> had a point. Still, rather than put our energy into selling them that way, part of me wanted to devote the effort to improving their quality and things of that sort.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r60","rowIndex":60,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「こういうときに、<tips=1>亮</tips>がいればなあ……」","en":"“If only <tips=1>Ryo</tips> were here at a time like this...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"田中紺太","displayName":"Konta Tanaka","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r61","rowIndex":61,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　考え込んでいると、<tips=66>コンタ</tips>は溜息をつく。","en":"As I pondered the matter, <tips=66>Konta</tips> sighed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r62","rowIndex":62,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なんだ<tips=66>コンタ</tips>、おれじゃ頼りないって言うのか？」","en":"“What’s this, <tips=66>Konta</tips>? Am I not dependable enough for you?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r63","rowIndex":63,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おれは苦笑しながら言う。","en":"I said it with a wry smile.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r64","rowIndex":64,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そんなことはないけど、<tips=10>道夫</tips>君はこういう細かいことを考えるの向いてないからなあ。<tips=1>亮</tips>は<tips=10>道夫</tips>君の苦手なことは大体得意なんだよ。あの、学校のお金だって、家の金じゃなくて自分で稼いだんでしょ？」","en":"“That’s not it, but working through little details like this isn’t your strong suit, <tips=10>Michio</tips>. <tips=1>Ryo</tips> is good at nearly everything <tips=10>you</tips> struggle with. He even earned his own tuition instead of using his family’s money, right?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"田中紺太","displayName":"Konta Tanaka","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r65","rowIndex":65,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「知ってる。あれすごいよなあ」","en":"“I know. Pretty amazing, isn’t it?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r66","rowIndex":66,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「おれ、詳しくは知らないんだけど、どうやったの？」","en":"“I don’t know the details. How did he do it?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"田中紺太","displayName":"Konta Tanaka","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r67","rowIndex":67,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=1>亮</tips>はなんかごちゃごちゃ言ってたけど、めんどくさい話で、よく覚えてないな」","en":"“<tips=1>Ryo</tips> rambled on about a bunch of things, but it was complicated, and I don’t really remember.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r68","rowIndex":68,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「最初から覚える気なかったでしょ？」","en":"“You never intended to remember it in the first place, did you?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"田中紺太","displayName":"Konta Tanaka","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r69","rowIndex":69,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あはは、そうかもね。まあ、大丈夫、大丈夫。そんなに不安そうにするなって。確かにあいつがいてくれた方が有り難いけれど、これだけの商品が出来たんだから何も心配してくれることないさ。角のフランクリンさんのところでも売ってくれるって決まったばかりだろ？」","en":"“Ahaha, maybe not. It’s fine, it’s fine. Don’t look so worried. Sure, having him here would help, but we’ve made a product this good, so there’s nothing to worry about. Mr. Franklin on the corner just agreed to carry them, didn’t he?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r70","rowIndex":70,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おれが笑って背中を叩くと、<tips=66>コンタ</tips>は冴えない顔で、","en":"I laughed and slapped him on the back, but <tips=66>Konta</tips> still looked glum.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r71","rowIndex":71,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「本当に、そういう明るいところはいいんだけどねえ」","en":"“I really do like how positive you are...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"田中紺太","displayName":"Konta Tanaka","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r72","rowIndex":72,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　また溜息をついた。","en":"He sighed again.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r73","rowIndex":73,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　まったく、心配性な男である。","en":"He really was a worrier.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r74","rowIndex":74,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ともあれ、おれたちは『<tips=71>グレートホール饅頭</tips>』を売り続け、そして<tips=66>コンタ</tips>が二人分の飲み物を買いに出た時のことだ、道の向こうから制服を着た小学生の行列がやって来た。","en":"In any case, we went on selling <tips=71>Great Hole Buns</tips>. Then, while <tips=66>Konta</tips> was away buying drinks for the two of us, a line of uniformed elementary-school children approached from across the road.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r75","rowIndex":75,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　あれは、北通りの方に最近出来たインターナショナルスクールの児童だろうかなあ？　これまでまっとうな教育を受ける機会が少なかった貧しい移民の子たちのために、安い学費で通えるように作られたと聞いている。","en":"Were they pupils from the international school that had recently opened over by North Street? I had heard it was founded so that poor immigrant children, who had rarely had the chance to receive a proper education, could attend at an affordable price.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r76","rowIndex":76,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おれもその話は知っていて、なかなか好ましい施設だなあと思っていたんだ。こういう施設がもっと増えてくれれば、この<tips=9>Y地区</tips>も少しずつ良くなって行くのだろうとも思うよ。","en":"I had heard about the school and thought it sounded like a wonderful place. If more places like it opened, I thought, <tips=9>Y District</tips> would get better little by little.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r77","rowIndex":77,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ものを知らないってのは、その不便さ以上に、コンプレックスを作るのがよくない。","en":"The worst thing about ignorance is not the inconvenience, but the inferiority complex it breeds.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r78","rowIndex":78,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　まともな学校を出てないって思うだけで、とても学校に行ける状況じゃなかった自分の家庭環境を思い出したり、まともな子供が学校で級友と仲良くやっているはずの時間に自分がしていたことを思い出したりして、自分を劣った人間だと最初から思い込ませてしまうのさ。","en":"Just knowing that you never finished a proper school makes you think back to the home that kept you from attending, and to what you were doing during the hours when ordinary children were at school with their friends. From the beginning, it teaches you to think of yourself as inferior.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r79","rowIndex":79,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そういうものに囚われない心を持った人間もいるけど、なかなかそうはいかない。","en":"Some people can keep from getting trapped by feelings like that, but it isn’t easy.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r80","rowIndex":80,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おれは行けるものならみんな学校に行くべきだと思う。その結果として得られる学歴も含めてね。","en":"I think everyone who can go to school should, including for the qualifications it gives them.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r81","rowIndex":81,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　まあ、まともな教育をまったく受けていないおれが言うのも何だけれども。","en":"Not that someone like me, who never had a proper education, has much room to talk.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r82","rowIndex":82,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おれも一応名ばかりは学校とついた施設に通ったこともあるけれども、生徒は気まぐれにしか登校せず、来ても肌の色や出身国の近い友人と話したり何か食ったりゲームをやったりで前なんか見ちゃいない。","en":"I did go to a place with “school” in its name, at least. But the students only showed up when they felt like it, and even then they just talked to friends with similar skin and national backgrounds, ate something, or played games. They never paid any attention to the front of the room.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r83","rowIndex":83,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　教師は一人で黒板に向かって喋りつつ何かを書いて消して、授業の時間が終わればいなくなる。生徒はその教師の出入りにさえも気づかないほどだ。","en":"The teacher would stand alone at the blackboard, talking as he wrote something and erased it, then leave when the lesson was over. The students barely even noticed him come or go.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r84","rowIndex":84,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そこには教育なんてものはなく、そもそも言葉が通じない生徒も多い。","en":"There was no education going on there at all, and plenty of the students could not even communicate with one another.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r85","rowIndex":85,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　話に聞くインターナショナルスクールでは、そんなふざけた光景はなく、みな適切な教育を受けているのだという。学校行事なども盛んだそうだ。しかも学費が安価だというからまさに夢のような施設だ。","en":"From what I’d heard, nothing that ridiculous went on at an international school. Every child received a proper education, and they held all sorts of school events too. The tuition was cheap on top of that. It sounded like a dream come true.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r86","rowIndex":86,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼らのなかから、将来<tips=9>Y地区</tips>を変えてゆくものが現れるのだろう。","en":"Maybe one of those children would grow up to change <tips=9>Y District</tips> someday.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r87","rowIndex":87,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　で、その幸福な児童たち。","en":"And as for those fortunate children...","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r88","rowIndex":88,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼らは保護者なのか学校職員なのかわからないが、数名の大人に引率されている。学校の先生たちかな？","en":"Several adults were leading them along, though I could not tell whether they were parents or school staff. Maybe they were teachers?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r89","rowIndex":89,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しかし、先生ってのも大変な仕事だね。これくらいの年頃の子供は当然素直には言うことをきかないもので、隣や後ろの子にちょっかいを出し、すぐに列を乱してしまうんだけど、それをいちいち注意しながら、汗だくになって列を進ませている。","en":"Being a teacher has got to be hard. Kids that age are not about to do as they’re told: they pester the child beside them or behind them and fall out of line every chance they get. The adults were drenched in sweat from correcting them one by one and keeping the line moving.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r90","rowIndex":90,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ああいう仕事って、根気があって、子供が好きでなきゃ出来ないと思うよ。","en":"You couldn’t do a job like that unless you were patient and loved children.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r91","rowIndex":91,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　……それにしても、肌や髪の色が違う子供たちが、ああやって一緒に歩きながら平和にじゃれあっているのは良い光景だなあ。おれの理想の風景の一つだよ。","en":"...Still, it was wonderful to see children with different skin and hair colors walking together and playing so peacefully. That was one of the scenes I dreamed of.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r92","rowIndex":92,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　制服を着せるってのも、なかなかいいな。","en":"Uniforms were a pretty good idea too.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r93","rowIndex":93,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　同じ服なら、人種の違いや、貧富の差なんかもわかりにくいし、仲間って気がする。あ、おれたちも制服作ろうかな？　まあ、商売が軌道に乗ったら、それも考えるとするか……。","en":"When everyone wears the same clothes, differences in race and wealth are harder to see, and you get the feeling they all belong together. Hey, maybe we should get uniforms too. Well, I can think about that once the business is on its feet...","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r94","rowIndex":94,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しかし、どうせ売れないのなら、<tips=66>コンタ</tips>の言うとおり、あの児童たちにただで配ってやろうかな？　さっき提案されたときは断っちゃったけど、子供たちの笑顔を想像していたら、あげたくなった。","en":"But if the buns were not going to sell anyway, maybe I should take <tips=66>Konta’s</tips> advice and hand them out to those kids for free. I had turned him down when he suggested it, but once I pictured their smiles, I wanted to do it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r95","rowIndex":95,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　断ったばかりでなんだか<tips=66>コンタ</tips>に悪いような気もするけど、反対はしないだろう。","en":"I had only just said no, which made me feel kind of bad for <tips=66>Konta</tips>, but surely he would not mind.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r96","rowIndex":96,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=10>道夫</tips>さん、売れてますか？」","en":"“Mr. <tips=10>Michio</tips>, are they selling?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r97","rowIndex":97,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そうして微笑ましく眺めていると、間借りさせて貰っている花屋の店員であるバーバラに声をかけられた。","en":"As I watched the children with a smile, Barbara, who worked at the flower shop that was letting us borrow the space outside, spoke to me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r98","rowIndex":98,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女は顔の大部分を前髪で隠す特有の髪型で、その隙間から覗くようにおれを見ている。","en":"Her distinctive hairstyle hid most of her face, and she peered out at me through a gap in her bangs.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r99","rowIndex":99,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女の髪で隠された部分には、普通の人間とは全く違う彼女特有の形状がある。女性で顔に変異が表れてしまうのは不幸なもんだけれども、彼女はそれを感じさせない明るくて健気な女性だから、とても素晴らしい。","en":"The part hidden beneath her hair had a shape all her own, nothing like an ordinary person’s face. It was unfortunate for a woman to have a mutation show up on her face, but Barbara was so cheerful and brave that she never made you think of her as unfortunate. She was wonderful.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r100","rowIndex":100,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女も<tips=16>タイプA</tips>なんだよね。といっても、能力はささやかなものしかない。なのに、<tips=77>特質変異</tips>だけが強く顕れてしまっている。なんだか不公平な話だけど、そういうことはままあるんだ。","en":"She was a <tips=16>Type A</tips> too. Her ability was nothing much, yet her <tips=77>trait mutation</tips> had come through strongly. It seemed awfully unfair, but that kind of thing happened all the time.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r101","rowIndex":101,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「バッチリだよ」","en":"“Couldn’t be better.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r102","rowIndex":102,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おれはそう言って胸を張ったけれど、彼女は無言だ。","en":"I puffed out my chest as I said it. She remained silent.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r103","rowIndex":103,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その視線は机の上に積み上げられたままの商品をとらえている。","en":"Her eyes rested on the products still piled on the table.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r104","rowIndex":104,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それを見られちゃ、売れてないってのがバレバレだ。","en":"Once she had seen those, there was no disguising that sales were poor.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r105","rowIndex":105,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あはははは」","en":"“Ahahahaha!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r106","rowIndex":106,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　バツが悪くてしかたないので、おれは笑って誤魔化した。","en":"I felt so awkward that all I could do was laugh it off.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r107","rowIndex":107,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まあ、今日はきっとこういう運命だったんだよ。ほら見なよ。向こうにかわいい子供たちが歩いている。今日売れなかったのはさ、あいつらにおやつを食べさせてやれという天からの指令なんだなきっと」","en":"“Well, I guess this was just meant to happen today. Look over there. See those cute kids walking by? The buns didn’t sell because Heaven was ordering us to give them a snack. That’s got to be it.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r108","rowIndex":108,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まあ」","en":"“Oh my.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r109","rowIndex":109,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　バーバラは一旦驚いて、それから指先を口元にあてて笑う。","en":"Barbara looked surprised, then touched her fingers to her mouth and laughed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r110","rowIndex":110,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　水仕事で真っ赤になった指先だ。その労働者の証である指を微笑ましく眺めながら、おれは子供たちに配るべくまんじゅうの箱を開けはじめたんだ。","en":"Her fingertips were bright red from washing. As I looked fondly at those working hands, I began opening the boxes of buns to hand them out to the children.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r111","rowIndex":111,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そこで、異変が起きた。","en":"That was when the disturbance began.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r112","rowIndex":112,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それを見た時、思わず「あっ」と声が出た。","en":"The moment I saw it, an “Ah!” escaped me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r113","rowIndex":113,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　裏道から飛び出した白い何かが、児童の一人をさらってそのまま<tips=57>滑走路通り</tips>の中央に躍り出たんだ。目の前でばっちり見ていたおれだって、何が起きたのか瞬時には理解出来なかった。だって、こんなの想像の範囲をまったく超えているんだもの。","en":"Something white came flying out of a side street, snatched up one of the children, and leapt into the middle of <tips=57>Runway Street</tips>. Even though I had seen it happen right in front of me, I could not immediately understand what was going on. It was completely beyond anything I could have imagined.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r114","rowIndex":114,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　やがてその正体が明らかになっても、自分の目が信じられないという思いの方が強いくらいだ。","en":"Even after I finally saw what it was, I still found it harder to believe my own eyes.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r115","rowIndex":115,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そこにあらわれたのは白い虎だった。","en":"It was a white tiger.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r116","rowIndex":116,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　こんなものを街中で見かけたら、誰だっておれみたいに目を疑うだろう。ここはジャングルじゃない。そりゃ、コンクリートジャングルって言葉はあるけれど、それはあくまでも比喩であって、虎が住んだりはしないだろう。","en":"Anyone who saw something like that in the middle of a city would have doubted their eyes just as I did. This was no jungle. Sure, people talk about a “concrete jungle,” but that was only a metaphor. Tigers were not supposed to live here.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r117","rowIndex":117,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そいつはさきほど列からさらった金髪の少年の首のあたりを咥えている。","en":"It held the blond boy it had snatched from the line by the neck in its jaws.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r118","rowIndex":118,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　少年の首は出来の悪い人形みたいにねじれて折れ曲がり、手足をひくひくと痙攣させている。","en":"The boy’s neck twisted and bent like that of a badly made doll, while his arms and legs twitched.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r119","rowIndex":119,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それはとても、さっきまで友だちとじゃれあっていた子供だと信じられるような光景じゃない。","en":"It was impossible to believe that this was the same child who had been playing with his friends only moments ago.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r120","rowIndex":120,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　虎が咥え直すと、おびただしい血液が動脈から流れ出してその服とアスファルトを赤く染める。その血液の赤が、おれにも、これが現実の出来事なのだと再認識させた。","en":"When the tiger shifted its jaws, blood gushed from an artery, staining the boy’s uniform and the asphalt red. The red of that blood drove home to me all over again that this was really happening.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r121","rowIndex":121,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　この惨劇に、<tips=57>滑走路通り</tips>のあちこちから悲鳴が上がり、子供たちは泣く。","en":"At the sight of the carnage, screams rose all along <tips=57>Runway Street</tips>, and the children began to wail.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r122","rowIndex":122,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　通行人たちは虎から離れようと駆け出す。もちろん全ての人がすぐに事態を把握出来るわけでもないから、立ち止まってしまう人も多い。","en":"Passersby took off running, trying to put distance between themselves and the tiger. Of course, not everyone grasped what was happening right away, and many simply froze where they stood.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r123","rowIndex":123,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　逃げ出す人と立ち止まる人が、もみ合いへしあいするようになると、自然と群衆はパニックとなってしまう。","en":"Those trying to flee collided with those frozen in place. As they began shoving and jostling one another, the whole crowd fell into a panic.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r124","rowIndex":124,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　看板や露店の机は人混みに飲み込まれると並べられた商品を盛大にまき散らしながら倒される。そのどさくさに紛れて商品を懐に失敬する不届きものもいる。","en":"Signs and market-stall tables were swallowed by the crush and knocked over, sending their wares flying. There were even shameless thieves taking advantage of the confusion to stuff goods into their clothes.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r125","rowIndex":125,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　もちろんおれの『<tips=71>グレートホール饅頭</tips>』の机も倒され、路上に散らばった商品は人々の靴に踏み荒らされる。","en":"Of course, the table where we sold our <tips=71>Great Hole Buns</tips> was knocked over too, and the buns scattered across the road were trampled underfoot.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r126","rowIndex":126,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「バーバラ。慌てちゃだめだよ。店のなかに隠れて鍵を閉めるんだ。それで大丈夫だからね」","en":"“Barbara, don’t panic. Get inside the shop and lock the door. You’ll be safe in there, okay?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r127","rowIndex":127,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おれは彼女にそう微笑みかけてから、逃げようとする群衆をかき分けながら、どうにか虎に近づく。","en":"I gave her a reassuring smile, then pushed through the fleeing crowd and managed to make my way toward the tiger.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r128","rowIndex":128,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　みなと一緒に逃げるわけにはいかない。","en":"I could not run with everyone else.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r129","rowIndex":129,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おれには、みなと違う能力があるんだ。","en":"I had an ability they didn’t.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r130","rowIndex":130,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おれは群衆から飛び出て、虎と対峙した。","en":"I broke free of the crowd and faced the tiger.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r131","rowIndex":131,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　虎は、もう動かなくなった子供の首から牙を離し、その腹部に噛みつこうとしているところだった。","en":"The tiger had released the motionless child’s neck and was about to bite into his abdomen.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r132","rowIndex":132,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「おい、やめないか！」","en":"“Hey! Stop that!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r133","rowIndex":133,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　叫んでも虎がやめるはずもない。","en":"Of course the tiger was not going to stop just because I shouted at it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r134","rowIndex":134,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　こちらを警戒するうなり声を上げつつ、食事を続ける。","en":"It kept eating, growling a warning in my direction.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r135","rowIndex":135,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　せっかく学校が用意してくれている制服はその鋭い牙によって容易く切り裂かれ、腹は割ける。そして虎は、その血みどろの内臓から食べ始めた。","en":"Its sharp fangs easily tore through the uniform the school had so carefully provided. They ripped open the boy’s belly, and the tiger began with his blood-soaked entrails.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r136","rowIndex":136,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「動けますか？　動けるんなら、他の子供たちを逃がしてもらいたいんだけど」","en":"“Can you move? If you can, could you get the other children out of here?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r137","rowIndex":137,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おれはとりあえず、引きつった顔で立ちすくんでいる先生たちに、残った児童を避難させるよう伝えることにした。","en":"I decided to start by telling the teachers, who stood frozen with their faces drawn tight, to get the remaining children to safety.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r138","rowIndex":138,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ほら、早く！　早く！　ぼうっとしてちゃだめだってば！　動転してるのはわかるけど、先生なんだからがんばろ」","en":"“Come on, hurry! Hurry! Don’t just stand there! I know you’re in shock, but you’re the teachers. You’ve got to pull yourselves together!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r139","rowIndex":139,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　何度か声をかけると、ようやく我を取り戻したのか、先生たちは泣き出した児童たちを引きずるようにして現場を離れるが、とても素早いとは言えない動きだ。虎が追いかける気になれば追いつかれていた。","en":"After I shouted at them several more times, the teachers finally seemed to come to their senses. They practically dragged the crying children away, though they were anything but quick about it. If the tiger had decided to chase them, it would have caught them.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r140","rowIndex":140,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しかし、虎は目の前の獲物に夢中で逃げ去る者たちを追おうとはしなかった。","en":"The tiger, however, was absorbed in the prey before it and made no attempt to chase those fleeing.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r141","rowIndex":141,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ひとまず安堵して、そして気がつくと、あれだけ人の多かった<tips=57>滑走路通り</tips>から人の姿が消えている。","en":"For the moment, I was relieved. Then I looked around and realized that every trace of the crowd had vanished from <tips=57>Runway Street</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r142","rowIndex":142,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　パニックを起こしながらもなんとか避難が出来たんだね。でも、全員ってわけでもない。","en":"Even in their panic, people had somehow managed to get away. Not everyone, though.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r143","rowIndex":143,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　路上のあちこちに、群衆に踏みつぶされたと思われる人々が身体を押さえて転がっている。","en":"People lay here and there in the road, clutching themselves and rolling in pain after apparently being trampled by the crowd.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r144","rowIndex":144,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　かわいそうだけれども、今のおれはその一人一人を助けている暇はない。何しろ、目の前にその虎がいるのだ。","en":"I pitied them, but I had no time to help each one. There was, after all, a tiger before me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r145","rowIndex":145,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　逃げたといっても、群衆は地の果てまで逃げたわけでもない。その何割かの人々は距離をとって遠巻きに事態の成り行きを眺めている。","en":"The crowd had fled, but it was not as if they had run to the ends of the earth. Some of them were still gathered at a distance, watching to see how this would play out.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r146","rowIndex":146,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　建物の二階などには、携帯電話を構えてこの惨事を録画している人の姿も見える。","en":"I could see people on the upper floors of buildings holding up their phones to record the carnage.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r147","rowIndex":147,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　まあ安全圏から見物するにはワクワクドキドキのドキュメンタリーではあるだろうさ。","en":"From somewhere safe, I suppose it looked like one thrilling, pulse-pounding documentary.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r148","rowIndex":148,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　さて、人のことよりも自分のことである。","en":"But enough about everyone else. I had my own situation to worry about.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r149","rowIndex":149,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おれと虎との距離は、そのくちゃくちゃとした虎の咀嚼音が聞こえる程度には近かった。","en":"I stood close enough to the tiger to hear the wet sounds of its chewing.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r150","rowIndex":150,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　あの哀れな少年の肉体が今は虎を足止め出来ている。","en":"For the moment, that poor boy’s body was keeping the tiger occupied.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r151","rowIndex":151,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　何と言ったら良いのか――とにかくあの哀れな子を食べている間は、他に手を出す気配がない。","en":"I hardly know how to put it—but as long as it was eating that poor child, it showed no sign of attacking anyone else.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r152","rowIndex":152,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　けれど、食べ終わった虎は、すぐに次の獲物に凶暴な牙を剥くだろう。","en":"Once it finished, however, the tiger would immediately bare its savage fangs at its next prey.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r153","rowIndex":153,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　誰かが警察に通報してくれているとは思うけれど、さらなる大惨事が発生する前に到着してくれるなんて保証はない。","en":"I was sure someone had called the police, but there was no guarantee they would arrive before something even worse happened.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r154","rowIndex":154,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　警察よりは、騒ぎを聞きつけたどこかのギャングが武器を持って助けに来てくれる方が早いかもしれないが、それだってアテに出来るというものでもない。","en":"A gang that heard the commotion might come with weapons sooner than the police, but that was hardly something we could count on either.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r155","rowIndex":155,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　となれば、待つのは得策じゃないな。","en":"That meant waiting around was a bad idea.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r156","rowIndex":156,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おれは右手の手袋を脱ぎ、袖を肘までまくった。","en":"I removed the glove from my right hand and rolled my sleeve to the elbow.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r157","rowIndex":157,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おれの右腕は黒い。","en":"My right arm is black.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r158","rowIndex":158,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　いや、でもね、日焼けや、しみといったようなものでもないのさ。まったく自分で見てもほれぼれとするほどの漆黒で、肘から先が、まるで光を反射しない、立体感を失うほどの黒色をしている。","en":"No, listen—it was not a tan or some kind of stain. Even I could not help admiring how perfectly jet-black it was. From the elbow down, it reflected no light at all; the black was so absolute that the arm seemed to lose all depth.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r159","rowIndex":159,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　この黒い右腕こそが、おれの『<tips=77>特質変異</tips>』だった。","en":"This black right arm was my <tips=77>trait mutation</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r160","rowIndex":160,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　柵なしで虎を見たのは初めてだけれど、なんだか子供の頃に見たイメージよりも大きく感じる。","en":"I had never seen a tiger with no fence between us before, but it somehow looked bigger than the one I remembered from childhood.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r161","rowIndex":161,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　先ほど子供を軽々とさらった身のこなしからするに、パワーだけでなく俊敏性も備えている。","en":"Judging by how easily it had snatched the child, it had speed and agility as well as raw power.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r162","rowIndex":162,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おれは喧嘩の類は子供の頃から何度もしたけれど、そのどの相手と比べても、ちょっと比較にならないくらいパワフルな外見をしている。","en":"I had fought countless times since childhood, but this animal looked so much more powerful than any opponent I had faced that comparison was meaningless.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r163","rowIndex":163,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　だからといって怯んでなどいられない。","en":"But that was no reason to shrink back.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r164","rowIndex":164,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　やるぞ、とおれは自分にスイッチを入れる。緊張と興奮で、血が逆流するような感覚を覚える。これは、おれの<tips=17>タイプB</tips>の血が活性化した証拠だ。きっと、今のおれの目は、らんらんと金色に輝いているんだろう。","en":"Let’s do this, I told myself, flipping the switch inside me. Tension and excitement made it feel as if my blood were flowing backward. That was proof that my <tips=17>Type B</tips> blood had come alive. My eyes must have been blazing gold by then.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r165","rowIndex":165,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　この街には、他の地域よりも<tips=16>タイプA</tips>や<tips=17>タイプB</tips>は多いけれど、両方の特徴を備えたのはおれの他にはそうはいないだろう。世間では安直にハイブリッドと呼ばれている。<tips=16>タイプA</tips>のサイキック能力と、<tips=17>タイプB</tips>の優れた身体能力。この恵まれた力を使えば、こんな化け物みたいな猛獣にだって、勝つチャンスはきっとある。","en":"This city had more <tips=16>Type As</tips> and <tips=17>Type Bs</tips> than most places, but there could not have been many people besides me who had the traits of both. People just called us hybrids. A <tips=16>Type A’s</tips> psychic power and a <tips=17>Type B’s</tips> exceptional physical ability—with powers like these on my side, I had to stand some chance even against a monster like this.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r166","rowIndex":166,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　さて、虎よ。悪いがお前はここまでだ。","en":"All right, tiger. Sorry, but this is as far as you go.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r167","rowIndex":167,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　お前にしてみれば、こんなものは悪行でもなんでもない。自分と異なる生命を襲って食べるのは、生物の当たり前な行動で、人間だっていくらでもやっている。だから、この虎が間違ったことをしているというわけではないし、罪というほどのものでもない。","en":"From your point of view, none of this is evil. Attacking and eating a different living creature is perfectly natural behavior, and humans do it all the time. So the tiger had not done anything wrong, exactly, and this could hardly be called a sin.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r168","rowIndex":168,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しかし、だからといって仲間を殺されたこちらが黙っているわけにはいかない。仲間を害したこの虎を速やかに排除するのもまた生物としての必然的行動だ。つまりこれは必然同士の衝突であり、誇り高い生物の宿命的戦闘である。まあ、この場所にさえあらわれなければと、多少気の毒には思うが。","en":"Even so, those of us who had lost one of our own could not simply stand by. Swiftly eliminating the tiger that had harmed our kind was every bit as inevitable an act of nature. In other words, this was a collision between two inevitabilities: a fated battle between proud living creatures. I did feel a little sorry for it. If only it had not appeared here.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r169","rowIndex":169,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おれは一歩踏み出す。虎は顔を上げてこちらを警戒する。目が合うと、相手の瞳も金色だった。","en":"I stepped forward. The tiger raised its head and eyed me warily. When our gazes met, I saw that its eyes were gold too.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r170","rowIndex":170,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　この虎も<tips=17>タイプB</tips>なのだろうか？　それとも、虎というのは元々こういう目の色をしているのだっけ。","en":"Was this tiger a <tips=17>Type B</tips> too? Or were tigers’ eyes naturally this color?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r171","rowIndex":171,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そうなんだろう。元々、<tips=17>タイプB</tips>の<tips=78>金目</tips>は虎目とも言うもんな。","en":"That must be it. People called a <tips=17>Type B’s</tips> <tips=78>golden eyes</tips> tiger eyes, after all.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r172","rowIndex":172,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　でも、どうも<tips=17>タイプB</tips>のような気がする。いくら腹が減っているからって、人間の集団に向かって突入し、獲物を狙うなんて、発症した<tips=17>タイプB</tips>でもなければやらないだろう。","en":"Yet something about it felt like a <tips=17>Type B</tips>. However hungry it was, an animal would not ordinarily charge into a crowd of humans and seize prey. Only an animal in the throes of <tips=17>Type B</tips> onset would do such a thing.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r173","rowIndex":173,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　動物は本来もっと臆病なはずだ。それにさっきの尋常じゃない素早さも、そう理解すればすんなり納得出来る。","en":"Animals are naturally more timid. That would also neatly explain the abnormal speed it displayed earlier.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r174","rowIndex":174,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そうだとしたら非常に厄介だ。","en":"If that was true, I was in serious trouble.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r175","rowIndex":175,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　猛獣というのは本来人間では歯が立たない身体能力を持っているのだが、それがさらにパワーアップしているなんて。","en":"A wild beast already had physical abilities no human could hope to match. And now those abilities might have been enhanced even further...","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r176","rowIndex":176,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　が、ここで考えていても仕方ない。おれにはもう逃げるつもりはない。","en":"But there was no point standing here thinking about it. I had no intention of running now.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r177","rowIndex":177,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　だから、相手がノーマルだろうと<tips=17>タイプB</tips>だろうと、やることは同じだ。","en":"So whether I was facing a Normal or a <tips=17>Type B</tips>, what I had to do stayed the same.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r178","rowIndex":178,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　周囲の群衆の視線がおれと虎に集まっているのを感じる。","en":"I could feel every eye in the surrounding crowd turn toward the tiger and me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r179","rowIndex":179,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おれとあいつの対決に注目しているんだ。","en":"They were watching the showdown between us.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r180","rowIndex":180,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その視線のなか、さらなる一歩を踏み出したそのとき、","en":"Under their gaze, just as I took another step—","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r181","rowIndex":181,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=10>道夫</tips>！　やめろ！」","en":"“<tips=10>Michio</tips>! Stop!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r182","rowIndex":182,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　横合いから鋭い声がした。","en":"A sharp voice rang out from the side.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r183","rowIndex":183,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　振り返ると、いつのまにか<tips=1>亮</tips>がいる。","en":"I turned around, and there was <tips=1>Ryo</tips>. I had not even noticed him arrive.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r184","rowIndex":184,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　これからおれの見せ場だってのに。","en":"Just when I was about to have my moment.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r185","rowIndex":185,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　――あいつはいつでも良い場面にやって来るんだ。","en":"—He always showed up for the best part.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r186","rowIndex":186,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　遠くに立ち、こちらに鋭い視線を送っている。","en":"He stood at a distance, fixing me with a sharp gaze.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r187","rowIndex":187,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「待つんだ！　無謀だ！　これを見ろ！」","en":"“Wait! That’s reckless! Look at this!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r188","rowIndex":188,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　目が合うと、彼はそう言った。","en":"He said it the moment our eyes met.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r189","rowIndex":189,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　手には何かキラキラ光るものが握られているが、なんだかよくわからない。","en":"Something glittered in his hand, though I could not make out what it was.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r190","rowIndex":190,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「無謀なのは分かってるんだよね。でもだからといって待ってなんかいられ……」","en":"“I know it’s reckless. But that doesn’t mean I can just stand here waiting—”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r191","rowIndex":191,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おれが言おうとしたのを遮るように、銃声が鳴る。","en":"A gunshot interrupted me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r192","rowIndex":192,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　見ると、別の方向から飛び出した制服の警官が拳銃を構えていた。","en":"A uniformed police officer had emerged from another direction with his pistol raised.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r193","rowIndex":193,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　虎の方は、その肩口から出血している。","en":"Blood now flowed from the tiger’s shoulder.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r194","rowIndex":194,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　通報で駆けつけたにしてはあまりに早すぎるから、その警察官はたまたま近くにいたのだろうね。","en":"He had arrived far too quickly to be answering the call, so the officer must have happened to be nearby.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r195","rowIndex":195,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　緊張で蒼白にした顔に怒りのようなものをにじませている。","en":"His face was pale with tension, with something like anger smoldering beneath it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r196","rowIndex":196,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「クソが……」","en":"“Shit...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r197","rowIndex":197,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼は小さく口元でつぶやいた。","en":"He muttered the words under his breath.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r198","rowIndex":198,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　多分、子供の死に憤慨した、正義感と勇気あふれる素晴らしい警察官なのだ。","en":"He was probably a fine police officer, full of courage and a sense of justice, enraged by the death of a child.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r199","rowIndex":199,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　だけれど支給の拳銃一丁でこの猛獣に立ち向かうのはあまりに無謀だ。","en":"Facing this beast with a single service pistol was still desperately reckless.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r200","rowIndex":200,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ハイブリッドであるおれが虎に立ち向かうよりも、ずっと。","en":"Far more reckless than me, a hybrid, taking on the tiger.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r201","rowIndex":201,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　あきらかに冷静さを欠いている。正義感はあっても経験は少し足りないのかもしれない。","en":"He had clearly lost his cool. He had a strong sense of justice, but perhaps what he lacked was experience.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r202","rowIndex":202,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「やめろ！　逃げるんだ！」","en":"“Stop! Get away!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r203","rowIndex":203,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　今度は<tips=1>亮</tips>にかわっておれがその言葉を口にする番だったが、間に合わない。","en":"This time it was my turn to shout the same words <tips=1>Ryo</tips> had shouted at me, but I was too late.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r204","rowIndex":204,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　警官は二発目を発砲し、それは確かに虎に命中した。しかし、既に攻撃動作に入っていた虎の足止めをするほどの効果もない。","en":"The officer fired a second shot, and it certainly struck the tiger. But the animal had already begun its attack, and the bullet did not check it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r205","rowIndex":205,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　虎は猫科特有のしなやかな背中を縮め、そして伸ばすと同時に跳躍する。","en":"The tiger coiled its supple feline spine, then uncoiled it in a leap.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r206","rowIndex":206,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　巨体がすさまじい早さで空を飛び、そのたったひと飛びで発砲者の目前に迫った。","en":"Its enormous body flew through the air at terrifying speed, closing the distance to the shooter in a single bound.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r207","rowIndex":207,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　警官は慌てて三発目を発砲するが、それは素早く動く虎を捉えきれず、足元のアスファルトの上で弾けるだけだ。","en":"The officer fired a third shot in panic, but it could not catch the fast-moving tiger and merely sparked off the asphalt at its feet.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r208","rowIndex":208,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　虎は目の前で火を吹く銃に怯えも見せず、のっそりと身体を起こすと両前足の爪で警官の身体を押し倒し、そしてその首元にかじりついた。","en":"The tiger showed no fear of the gun spitting fire in its face. It rose heavily onto its hind legs, knocked the officer down with both clawed forepaws, then sank its teeth into his neck.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r209","rowIndex":209,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そうして、警官は二人目の犠牲者となった。なってしまった。","en":"The officer became its second victim. Just like that.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r210","rowIndex":210,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　手傷を負った虎は、食欲よりも怒りや興奮が上回っているように見える。","en":"Now that it was wounded, the tiger’s rage and excitement seemed to have overtaken its hunger.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r211","rowIndex":211,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　警官の頭にかじりつきながら、エンジン音のような唸り声を立てて周囲を見渡している。","en":"With its jaws clamped around the officer’s head, it looked around, growling like an engine.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r212","rowIndex":212,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おー、ずいぶんと怒り狂っていらっしゃる。","en":"Oh, somebody was very angry.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r213","rowIndex":213,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　けれど、こっちだって目の前で二人も殺されて、穏やかではいられないのさ。","en":"But after watching it kill two people right in front of me, I was not exactly feeling calm either.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r214","rowIndex":214,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おれはさらに一歩前に出る。","en":"I took another step forward.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r215","rowIndex":215,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ほら、食うのをやめてこっちを向いたぞ。まったく、なんたる気迫に満ちた目つきをしているのだろう。動物にも、憎悪って感情はあるのかな？　人間そのものを憎んでいるように見える目つきだ。","en":"There—it stopped eating and turned toward me. What a ferocious look in its eyes. Could animals feel hatred too? It looked as if it hated the entire human race.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r216","rowIndex":216,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ほれ、次の獲物は一番近い場所にいる、このおれがいいんじゃないか？","en":"Come on, how about me for your next meal? I’m the closest one here.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r217","rowIndex":217,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それならば上等。お前の憎む人間代表選手たるこのおれは、もうこれ以上人間様を食わせたりはしない。","en":"Fine by me. As the official representative of the human race you hate so much, I’m not letting you eat another one of us.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r218","rowIndex":218,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　勝負の瞬間が近づいている。","en":"The moment of our showdown was drawing near.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r219","rowIndex":219,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おれの力は接触しないと使えない。おそらく飛びかかってくるであろうこの虎の、牙と爪をかわしながら、この右手で相手に触れる。","en":"My power only worked through physical contact. The tiger would probably pounce, and I would have to dodge its fangs and claws while touching it with my right hand.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r220","rowIndex":220,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そうすればまあおれの勝ちだろう。おれの右手より一瞬でも早く牙か爪がおれに触れたら虎の勝ちだ。","en":"If I could do that, I would probably win. If its fangs or claws touched me even an instant before my right hand touched it, the tiger would win.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r221","rowIndex":221,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　お互い一撃必殺だから、とてもシンプルな勝負になるだろう。","en":"Either one of us could end it with a single blow, so it would be a very simple fight.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r222","rowIndex":222,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ともすれば脳裏に浮かぶ、自分の体がその牙と爪に引き裂かれるイメージを打ち消しながら、おれは呼吸を整えた。","en":"Each time I pictured those fangs and claws tearing my body apart, I forced the image away and steadied my breathing.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r223","rowIndex":223,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　こういったときに一番いけないのは、恐怖や緊張のあまり本来の動きが出来なくなることだ。","en":"The worst thing I could do now was let fear or tension keep me from moving the way I normally could.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r224","rowIndex":224,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ネガティブな感情は自分でも知らぬうちに、全身を蜘蛛の糸のようにからめとってしまう。","en":"Before you even knew it, negative emotions could wind around your entire body like spider silk.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r225","rowIndex":225,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おれの身体はいまこわばっていないだろうか？","en":"Was my body tensing up right now?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r226","rowIndex":226,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　……いや、大丈夫。心臓も不必要に鼓動を早めてはいない。汗のかき方も正常だ。","en":"...No, I was fine. My heart was not racing more than it needed to, and I was sweating a normal amount.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r227","rowIndex":227,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして、ほどよい緊張感が集中力を高めている。おれは万全の状態でその瞬間を迎えることが出来るだろう。","en":"Just enough tension was sharpening my concentration. I would be able to meet that moment in top form.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r228","rowIndex":228,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>が無謀だと言ったのはその通りだけれど、警察の豆鉄砲と違って、おれの能力は当てさえすれば決定的な結果を生むんだよね。相手が虎だろうが象だろうが、先に触れさえすればこちらの勝ちだ。","en":"<tips=1>Ryo</tips> was right that this was reckless. But unlike the police officer’s peashooter, my power would settle things as long as I landed it. Tiger or elephant, if I touched it first, I won.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r229","rowIndex":229,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　さあ、虎ちゃんよ、いつでもかかって来たまえ。","en":"Come on, kitty. Any time you’re ready.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r230","rowIndex":230,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　備えていたが、虎はなかなか飛びかかろうとしない。","en":"I braced myself, but the tiger showed no sign of pouncing.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r231","rowIndex":231,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　まさか虎がこの腕を見ておれが<tips=16>タイプA</tips>だと見抜くはずもなく、新たな獲物に見えてもおかしくないのだけれど、おれの怯えのない態度が何か気づかせてしまったのだろうか？　だとすれば賢明なことだ。","en":"There was no way a tiger could look at this arm and realize I was a <tips=16>Type A</tips>, and there was no reason I should not have looked like fresh prey. Had my complete lack of fear tipped it off somehow? If so, it was a clever animal.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r232","rowIndex":232,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　虎はおれに注意を向けながら、身を低くして、猫科特有のあの警戒姿勢を取る。","en":"Keeping its attention on me, the tiger lowered itself into the wary crouch peculiar to cats.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r233","rowIndex":233,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おれは相手の攻撃意欲を刺激すべく、さらに近づいた。","en":"I stepped closer to goad it into attacking.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r234","rowIndex":234,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　こちらからは手を出さない。リーチに差がある以上、相手に先に攻撃をさせるのが一番だ。","en":"I would not attack first. Given the difference in our reach, the best course was to make my opponent strike before I did.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r235","rowIndex":235,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そこで三度目の横やりが入ってしまう。","en":"And then came the third interruption.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r236","rowIndex":236,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それは文字通り横合いから巨大な槍のように突き出された。","en":"This one came thrusting in quite literally from the side, like an enormous spear.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r237","rowIndex":237,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　どういうことかというと、エンジン音と共に猛スピードでゴミ収集のトラックが突っ込んで来たのである。","en":"What I mean is, a garbage truck came charging in at tremendous speed, its engine roaring.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r238","rowIndex":238,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あっ」","en":"“Ah!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r239","rowIndex":239,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　と、おれが思わず声をあげた直後、その狂った象のように飛び込んで来たトラックが虎を横合いからはね飛ばす。","en":"The cry had barely escaped me when the truck, hurtling in like a crazed elephant, struck the tiger from the side and sent it flying.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r240","rowIndex":240,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　とっさに避けようとした虎の尻のあたりに直撃したようだ。","en":"It seemed to strike the tiger near the hindquarters as the animal tried to dodge at the last instant.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r241","rowIndex":241,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　体の端にぶつけられた虎は回転しながらはじき飛ばされたが、しかしすさまじく頑丈だ。電柱にぶつかってアスファルトの上で倒れていたのは一瞬で、震えながらもすぐさま立ち上がろうとする。","en":"The truck had clipped the rear of the tiger’s body and sent it spinning through the air. Yet the animal was fearsomely tough. It slammed into a utility pole and collapsed on the asphalt, but only for an instant; trembling, it immediately tried to rise again.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r242","rowIndex":242,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　が、収集車はそれを許さない。バックで戻って来ると、そのままもう一度突撃する。","en":"The garbage truck gave it no chance. It reversed, then charged again.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r243","rowIndex":243,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その車体のカドのところが、えぐい角度で虎の横っ面に直撃した。","en":"A corner of the truck’s body struck the side of the tiger’s head at a vicious angle.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r244","rowIndex":244,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　血が舞って、鈍い音がしたが、しかし、それでも虎は死なない。","en":"Blood flew, and there was a dull thud. Even then, the tiger did not die.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r245","rowIndex":245,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ただ、さすがに強烈なダメージを受けたようだ。先ほどのように、即座には立ち上がれず、地面の上でだらしなく横たわっている。","en":"The damage did appear severe, however. It could no longer spring immediately to its feet and lay sprawled on the ground.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r246","rowIndex":246,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　収集車は三度戻って来て今度はゆっくりと虎の上にタイヤを乗り上げた。虎は身をよじるが、その力も弱々しく、逃れることが出来ない。","en":"The truck backed away a third time, then slowly drove a tire onto the tiger. The animal writhed, but its struggles were feeble and it could not escape.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r247","rowIndex":247,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　タイヤに踏まれた身体の中からバキバキと骨が折れる音がして、虎は血を吐いた。","en":"Bones cracked within the body beneath the tire, and the tiger vomited blood.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r248","rowIndex":248,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　一対一の真剣勝負をしようと備えていたおれはぽかんと口を開けてそれを見ている。","en":"I had braced myself for a serious one-on-one duel, and now all I could do was stare with my mouth hanging open.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r249","rowIndex":249,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　今の盛りあがったおれの気持ちはなんだったんだ？","en":"What had all that excitement I had worked up been for?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r250","rowIndex":250,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　まるっきり馬鹿みたいだ。おれのスポーツマンシップというか、正々堂々の肉体勝負を挑もうとしていた気持ちをすべてあざ笑うように、トラックは一方的に虎を打ちのめしてしまった。","en":"I looked an utter fool. As if mocking my sportsmanship—my wish for a fair contest of bodies—the truck simply beat the tiger into the ground.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r251","rowIndex":251,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そしてトラックは無情にも虎の上にタイヤを置いたままの状態で停止する。","en":"Then the heartless truck stopped with its tire still planted on the animal.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r252","rowIndex":252,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ドアが開くと、そこから涼しい顔で降りて来たのはやっぱり<tips=1>亮</tips>だった。","en":"The door opened, and sure enough, <tips=1>Ryo</tips> climbed out looking perfectly composed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r253","rowIndex":253,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「お前、無茶苦茶なことするな」","en":"“That was completely insane.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r254","rowIndex":254,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おれが呆れて声をかけると、","en":"When I called out to him in disbelief,","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r255","rowIndex":255,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「無茶苦茶なのは<tips=10>道夫</tips>だよ。何かっこつけてわけのわからん怪物と戦おうとしてるんだ。ギリシャ神話の主人公のつもりかよ」","en":"“You’re the one doing insane things, <tips=10>Michio</tips>. What the hell were you trying to look cool for, fighting some freakish monster? Think you’re a hero out of Greek mythology?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r256","rowIndex":256,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>はチラとおれの方を見るとすぐに虎に視線を戻す。","en":"<tips=1>Ryo</tips> flicked me a glance, then immediately turned his eyes back to the tiger.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r257","rowIndex":257,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まあ、うまいことお前が囮になってくれたのはよかったけれど」","en":"“Still, it worked out nicely having you there as bait.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r258","rowIndex":258,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　タイヤの下敷きになった虎は四肢を痙攣させている。","en":"Beneath the tire, the tiger’s limbs were twitching.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r259","rowIndex":259,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いやあ、しかし、なんだか後味悪いなあ。こんなやり方」","en":"“Man, though... I don’t feel great about doing it this way.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r260","rowIndex":260,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そりゃ動物を殺すのは後味が悪いが、害獣駆除だからな」","en":"“Sure, killing an animal leaves a bad taste, but this is pest control.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r261","rowIndex":261,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そういう意味ではなかったけれども、おれの今の気持ちを言葉にすると「正々堂々生物としての誇りを賭けて一対一で決闘すべきだった」となってしまうので、それ以上は言えなかった。","en":"That was not what I meant. Yet if I put my present feelings into words, they would come out as, “We should have dueled one-on-one, fair and square, with our pride as living creatures at stake,” so I could say no more.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r262","rowIndex":262,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　たしかにおれの言っていることは不合理で、こいつの言う通りではあるのだ。","en":"What I was saying was certainly irrational, and he was right.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r263","rowIndex":263,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼は苦い顔で言いながら車の下の虎を一瞥すると、路上に落ちた何かを拾う。","en":"Ryo said it with a bitter expression, glanced at the tiger beneath the truck, and picked something up from the road.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r264","rowIndex":264,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それは警察官が落とした拳銃だ。","en":"It was the pistol the officer had dropped.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r265","rowIndex":265,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「念のため」","en":"“Just to be safe.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r266","rowIndex":266,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>は両手で構えて狙いを付け、まったく躊躇のない、まるで熟練したパートタイマーがレジに金額を打ち込むようなスムーズな動作で虎の頭に三発の銃弾を瞬く間に撃ち込んだ。それで拳銃の弾丸は撃ち尽くしたようだった。","en":"<tips=1>Ryo</tips> took aim with both hands and, without the slightest hesitation, put three bullets into the tiger’s head in the blink of an eye, moving as smoothly as an experienced part-time cashier ringing up a sale. That seemed to empty the pistol.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r267","rowIndex":267,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　この銃声は勝利を告げる合図となったようで、それまで固唾を飲んで見守っていたギャラリーにざわざわとどよめきが生まれる。","en":"The gunshots seemed to announce our victory. A murmur spread through the spectators, who until then had watched in breathless silence.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r268","rowIndex":268,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　これでとりあえず一件落着か。","en":"That had settled things for the moment—or so I thought.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r269","rowIndex":269,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　戦闘に対する緊張感を解き、ほっと溜息をついたところで、","en":"I finally let the tension drain out of me and was breathing a sigh of relief when—","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r270","rowIndex":270,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なあ、<tips=10>道夫</tips>」","en":"“Hey, <tips=10>Michio</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r271","rowIndex":271,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　向こうで<tips=1>亮</tips>がおれを呼ぶ。見ると彼は思わぬかたい表情で虎を見つめているんだ。","en":"<tips=1>Ryo</tips> called to me from across the way. When I looked, he was staring at the tiger with an unexpectedly grave expression.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r272","rowIndex":272,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どうしたんだ？」","en":"“What is it?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r273","rowIndex":273,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼に近づいてそう尋ねると、彼は虎の方を見たまま、","en":"When I went over and asked him that, he kept his eyes on the tiger and said,","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r274","rowIndex":274,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まったく驚きだよ。見てごらん。こいつ、どういうわけか死なないんだよね」","en":"“This is unbelievable. Look at it. For some reason, the thing won’t die.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r275","rowIndex":275,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　言われて虎を見ると、あっ、こいつ、まだ息絶えていないじゃないか。それどころか、自分を撃った<tips=1>亮</tips>に対して怒りの視線を向け、彼に襲い掛かろうともがくように手足を動かし、威嚇の声をあげつつ、タイヤの下から逃れようとしている。","en":"I looked at the tiger, and—oh, he was right. The thing was not dead yet. Far from it: it glared furiously at <tips=1>Ryo</tips>, the man who had shot it, thrashing its limbs as if trying to attack him. Growling a warning, it fought to pull itself free from beneath the tire.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r276","rowIndex":276,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　三発の弾丸を額に受け、胴体はほとんどぺしゃんこになっているというのに、なんという生命力だろう！","en":"Three bullets had struck it in the forehead and its torso was almost entirely crushed. What astonishing vitality!","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r277","rowIndex":277,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「うわあ、なんだこれ？　不死身ってやつなのか？」","en":"“Whoa, what the hell is this? Is it immortal or something?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r278","rowIndex":278,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おれがびっくりしてそう尋ねると、","en":"When I asked in amazement,","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r279","rowIndex":279,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=10>道夫</tips>、サイコソードで頼む」","en":"“<tips=10>Michio</tips>, use the Psycho-Sword.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r280","rowIndex":280,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>は短くそう答えた。","en":"<tips=1>Ryo</tips> replied curtly.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r281","rowIndex":281,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「え？」","en":"“What?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r282","rowIndex":282,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「その右腕で首を切断してくれよ。肩じゃなくて頭側の付け根のあたりを狙うんだ」","en":"“Sever its neck with your right arm. Aim for the base of the neck just below the head, not the shoulders.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r283","rowIndex":283,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「しかしそれは……」","en":"“But that would...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r284","rowIndex":284,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「頼む」","en":"“Please.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r285","rowIndex":285,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「わ、わかった」","en":"“A-all right.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r286","rowIndex":286,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　とにかく異常事態なのは間違いない。","en":"Whatever was going on, there was no question that this was not normal.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r287","rowIndex":287,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おれは虎の後ろ側に回り込み、首筋に黒い右手を添える。","en":"I went around behind the tiger and laid my black right hand against the back of its neck.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r288","rowIndex":288,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そしてその手のひらから見えない刃物が射出される映像を思い浮かべると、その映像通り、虎の巨大な頭部はごろりと地面に転がって、断面が大量の血を吐き出した。それは返り血となり、生暖かくおれを濡らす。","en":"Then I pictured an invisible blade shooting from my palm. Just as I imagined, the tiger’s enormous head rolled to the ground, and blood poured from the severed neck. The warm spray drenched me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r289","rowIndex":289,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それと同時におれの能力に一番近くの<tips=42>サイキック発見器</tips>が反応し、けたたましい警報音が鳴る。","en":"At that same instant, the nearest <tips=42>psychic detector</tips> reacted to my power, and a shrill alarm began to blare.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r290","rowIndex":290,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ふう」","en":"“Whew.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r291","rowIndex":291,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おれは溜息をついたが、しかし安堵するのはまだ早かったようだ。その直後、我が目を疑うような光景があらわれたのだ。","en":"I sighed, but apparently it was still too soon for relief. The next moment brought a sight I could scarcely believe.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r292","rowIndex":292,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　地面に転がった頭が、さかんに顎を動かして、おれの足に食いつこうとするのである。","en":"The head lying on the ground was snapping its jaws again and again, trying to bite down on my leg.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r293","rowIndex":293,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「うわっ」","en":"“Whoa!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r294","rowIndex":294,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おれは慌てて足を上げて避けた。","en":"I hastily lifted my foot out of the way.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r295","rowIndex":295,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「こいつはとんでもないね……。すごいぞ、再生している……」","en":"“This thing is incredible... Amazing—it’s regenerating...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r296","rowIndex":296,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　なんで楽しそうに目をきらきらさせているのか知らないが、確かに<tips=1>亮</tips>の言う通りだった。","en":"I had no idea why his eyes were sparkling with such delight, but <tips=1>Ryo</tips> was right.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r297","rowIndex":297,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　切り離された虎の頭は衰弱するどころか、さらに猛り狂い、憎しみを浮かべた金色の目はおれたちの動きを追いかける。そして、その額の銃創は、みるみるうちにふさがろうとしていた。","en":"Rather than weakening, the severed tiger’s head grew even more frenzied. Its hate-filled golden eyes followed our every movement, while the bullet wounds in its forehead closed before our eyes.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r298","rowIndex":298,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=1>亮</tips>、一体全体こいつはどうなってるんだ？　このまま復活するのか？」","en":"“<tips=1>Ryo</tips>, what in the world is going on with this thing? Is it going to come back to life?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r299","rowIndex":299,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どうかな……」","en":"“Hard to say...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r300","rowIndex":300,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>は腕組みをして考えてから、","en":"<tips=1>Ryo</tips> folded his arms and thought for a moment. Then he said,","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r301","rowIndex":301,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=10>道夫</tips>、すまないけれど、そいつをもうちょっと切断してくれない？」","en":"“Sorry, <tips=10>Michio</tips>, but could you cut it up a little more?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r302","rowIndex":302,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「えっ」","en":"“What?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r303","rowIndex":303,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「サイコソードでもっと細かく切り刻むんだ。このままじゃ危険だ」","en":"“Use the Psycho-Sword to cut it into smaller pieces. It’s dangerous as it is.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r304","rowIndex":304,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あ、ああ。そうだな……」","en":"“Y-yeah. You’re right...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r305","rowIndex":305,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　もう蘇りようがないくらい切り刻めってことなのだろうが、この必死で再生しようとしている生命力を見ると、どうもいじましいような気もしてしまう。","en":"I assumed he wanted me to cut it up so thoroughly that it could never come back to life. But watching it struggle so desperately to regenerate, I could not help feeling a little sorry for it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r306","rowIndex":306,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　必死で生きている、頑張っている何かを、殺してしまうというのはいやなもんだ。","en":"I hated the thought of killing something that was fighting so hard, doing everything it could to stay alive.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r307","rowIndex":307,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それに、そもそもおれは血が苦手なんだ。この時点でもすでに目の前がクラクラとしていたのだよね。","en":"Besides, I could not stand blood to begin with. By then, my vision was already swimming.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r308","rowIndex":308,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ただわかる。わかるんだ。そんなことを言っている状況ではないと。","en":"But I knew. I knew that this was no time to say such things.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r309","rowIndex":309,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おれは噛まれないよう気をつけながら、虎の頭を真ん中で切断した。","en":"Taking care not to be bitten, I sliced the tiger’s severed head straight down the middle.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r310","rowIndex":310,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どっちの破片が動いてる？」","en":"“Which piece is moving?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r311","rowIndex":311,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……右側がまだ動いてるように見えるな」","en":"“...The right one still seems to be moving.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r312","rowIndex":312,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「すばらしい生命力だ。こいつぁ間違いない、本物だよ」","en":"“What extraordinary vitality. There’s no question—this is the genuine article.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r313","rowIndex":313,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なんでお前がそんな喜んでるんだかわかんねえよ……」","en":"“I don’t get why you’re so happy about this...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r314","rowIndex":314,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おれは気分が悪かったが、彼はますます目の輝きを強くする。","en":"I felt sick, but the light in his eyes only grew brighter.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r315","rowIndex":315,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「よし、じゃそっちもう一度半分にしてくれ。牙とかがうまく壊れるような……そう、その角度で」","en":"“All right, split that one in half again. Angle it so you break the fangs too... Yes, just like that.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r316","rowIndex":316,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……」","en":"“...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r317","rowIndex":317,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おれは<tips=1>亮</tips>の指示に従いながら、何度か切断をする。","en":"Following <tips=1>Ryo’s</tips> instructions, I made several more cuts.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r318","rowIndex":318,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　もう気持ち悪くて吐き出してしまいそうだ。","en":"I was so nauseated I thought I might throw up.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r319","rowIndex":319,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「今度はどっちが動いている？」","en":"“Which one is moving now?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r320","rowIndex":320,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そりゃ、こっちが……」","en":"“Well, this one is...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r321","rowIndex":321,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼に言われて確認してみると、","en":"At his prompting, I checked.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r322","rowIndex":322,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あれ？　どっちも動いていない」","en":"“What? Neither of them is moving.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r323","rowIndex":323,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なんてこった！　じゃあ、どこかで生きている方と死んだ方を間違えたんだな」","en":"“Damn it! Then somewhere along the way, we must have confused the living piece with the dead one.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r324","rowIndex":324,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「うわあ、面目ない。なんだか意識がもうろうとして」","en":"“Whoa, sorry. My head’s gotten pretty foggy.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r325","rowIndex":325,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いや、仕方ないよ。どの部分が動いているか、ちょっと調べる」","en":"“No, it can’t be helped. I’ll see which part is still moving.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r326","rowIndex":326,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そう言いながら、<tips=1>亮</tips>は肉の塊の上にしゃがみ込み、その血みどろのなかに手を突っ込む。","en":"As he spoke, <tips=1>Ryo</tips> crouched over the chunks of flesh and thrust a hand into the bloody mass.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r327","rowIndex":327,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「うはあ」","en":"“Ugh.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r328","rowIndex":328,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おもわず、おれはうめいてしまう。","en":"I could not keep myself from groaning.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r329","rowIndex":329,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして、ふらりとよろけてしまう。","en":"Then I swayed on my feet.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r330","rowIndex":330,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おれの能力は体力を消耗しにくいのだけれど、これだけ連続して使えばさすがにこたえる。","en":"My power did not drain much stamina, but using it this many times in a row was finally taking its toll.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r331","rowIndex":331,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　全身に力が入らないほどふらふらになっていた。","en":"I was so weak and unsteady that I could hardly put any strength into my limbs.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r332","rowIndex":332,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　倒れそうになると、ギャラリーから誰かが飛び出て、その見知らぬ人が支えてくれた。","en":"When I nearly fell, someone darted out of the crowd of spectators and caught me. The stranger held me upright.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r333","rowIndex":333,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ありがとうね」","en":"“Thanks.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r334","rowIndex":334,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　と、おれは支えてくれた男に言うが、彼はひきつった笑顔を浮かべる。","en":"I thanked the man who had caught me, but his smile was badly strained.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r335","rowIndex":335,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　まあ、素手で切り刻む人間を見たら、誰だってこんな表情になるってもんだ。むしろ、こうして支えてくれていることに感謝しよう。","en":"Well, anyone would make such a face after watching a man cut something apart with his bare hand. I ought to be grateful that he was supporting me at all.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r336","rowIndex":336,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おれは一息ついて辺りを見回した。遠巻きに見守っていた人々は、いつの間にか近づいて、おれが死なない虎を切り刻むところを見物していたようだ。","en":"Once I had caught my breath, I looked around. The people who had watched from a distance had drawn near without my noticing and had apparently been watching the spectacle of me cutting apart a tiger that would not die.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r337","rowIndex":337,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして……ああ、向こうには、食べ残しとなった児童の身体があり、それに、引率していた女性がすがりついて泣いている。そしてその近くでは、勇気ある警官が倒れている。","en":"And... yes. Beyond them lay what remained of the child’s body, and the woman who had been supervising the children clung to it and wept. The courageous officer lay fallen nearby.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r338","rowIndex":338,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　二人とも、こんなところで命を落とすとは思わなかったろう。彼らの気持ちや、まだその死を知らないであろう家族のことを考えてしまうと、どうにもやりきれない。子供が殺されるところは何度も見たことがあるが、慣れるものでもない。","en":"Neither of them could have imagined that they would die in a place like this. When I thought about what they must have felt, and about the families who probably did not even know they were dead yet, it was almost too much to bear. I had seen children killed many times before, but it was not something I could ever get used to.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r339","rowIndex":339,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おれはどういった宗教も信じてはいないけれども、心の中で手を合わせた。","en":"I did not believe in any religion, but in my heart, I pressed my palms together in prayer for them.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r340","rowIndex":340,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ふと気がつくと、そんなおれを<tips=1>亮</tips>が見つめている。","en":"Then I noticed that <tips=1>Ryo</tips> was watching me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r341","rowIndex":341,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なんだい？」","en":"“What is it?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r342","rowIndex":342,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おれは恥ずかしかったので顔を拭った。","en":"Embarrassed, I wiped my face.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r343","rowIndex":343,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いや、何でもない」","en":"“Nothing.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r344","rowIndex":344,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>は何故か微笑んで、","en":"For some reason, <tips=1>Ryo</tips> smiled and said,","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r345","rowIndex":345,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「でも、やっぱり<tips=10>道夫</tips>はすごいなあ。なんの道具も使わずに、こんなに上手に虎の頭を切り刻める人間、世の中に二人といないよ」","en":"“Still, you really are amazing, <tips=10>Michio</tips>. There can’t be another person in the world who could cut up a tiger’s head this neatly without a single tool.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r346","rowIndex":346,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ありがとう……と言いたいが、別に嬉しかないよ。褒めてるつもりなのか？」","en":"“I would say thank you... but I’m not happy about it. Is that supposed to be a compliment?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r347","rowIndex":347,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まあまあ。それより見なよ」","en":"“Come on. More importantly, look at this.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r348","rowIndex":348,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして彼は、血みどろの手のひらに何かを乗せておれに差し出した。","en":"He held something out to me on his blood-soaked palm.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r349","rowIndex":349,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　一体これはなんだろう？　その小さな肉片は、ぴょこぴょこと踊るように身をくねらせている。","en":"What in the world was it? The small scrap of flesh squirmed in little hops, almost as if it were dancing.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r350","rowIndex":350,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その大きさといい、形といい、まるでヒルのようだった。","en":"In both size and shape, it looked like a leech.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r351","rowIndex":351,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「こんなになっても死にやしないんだよ。まだ生きてる。……だけど、ちょっと小さすぎたな。もう少し大きく切り取った方がよかったんだけど……まあ、採取出来ただけよしとするか……」","en":"“Even in this state, it won’t die. It’s still alive. ...This piece is a little too small, though. I should have cut off a larger one... Well, I guess I should be glad I managed to collect a sample at all...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r352","rowIndex":352,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>はそれをハンカチに包んでポケットに入れた。","en":"<tips=1>Ryo</tips> wrapped it in a handkerchief and put it in his pocket.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r353","rowIndex":353,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　子供の頃とちっとも変わらず、よく分からないものを持ち帰ろうとする男である。","en":"He had not changed at all since childhood. He still wanted to take home anything he could not make heads or tails of.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r354","rowIndex":354,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それはなんですか？」","en":"“What is that?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r355","rowIndex":355,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　見守っていた一人が<tips=1>亮</tips>に尋ねるけれど、彼はそれを無視して、虎の死体からもう少し大きめな、グレープフルーツほどの肉塊を取り上げると、それを自分の上着で包む。","en":"One of the people watching asked <tips=1>Ryo</tips>. He ignored the question, picked a somewhat larger lump of flesh—about the size of a grapefruit—from the tiger’s carcass, and wrapped it in his jacket.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r356","rowIndex":356,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それも持ち帰るのか？」","en":"“You’re taking that home too?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r357","rowIndex":357,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「一応ね。おい、歩けるか？」","en":"“For now, yeah. Hey, can you walk?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r358","rowIndex":358,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「もう少しだけ待ってくれよ」","en":"“Just give me another minute.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r359","rowIndex":359,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうはいかない」","en":"“That’s not an option.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r360","rowIndex":360,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして、座り込んでいたおれの腕を掴んだ。","en":"He grabbed me by the arm as I sat there.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r361","rowIndex":361,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「行こう。警察のお仲間が来たら面倒だ」","en":"“Let’s go. It’ll be trouble if the other cops get here.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r362","rowIndex":362,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「わかったよ」","en":"“All right.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r363","rowIndex":363,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>に支えられて立ち上がったところで、遠くからサイレンの音が聞こえる。通報を受けたパトカーがやっと来たのだろう。","en":"With <tips=1>Ryo</tips> supporting me, I got to my feet. Then I heard sirens in the distance. The patrol cars responding to the call must finally have been arriving.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r364","rowIndex":364,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「さっさと行こう」","en":"“Let’s hurry.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r365","rowIndex":365,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>はそう言って、おれをゴミ収集車の助手席に押し込んだ。","en":"With that, <tips=1>Ryo</tips> pushed me into the passenger seat of the garbage truck.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r366","rowIndex":366,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして彼が運転席側のドアに周り、乗り込もうとしたところで、","en":"He went around to the driver’s door and was about to climb in when—","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r367","rowIndex":367,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ねえあんた！」","en":"“Hey! You!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r368","rowIndex":368,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　この<tips=57>滑走路通り</tips>で働いているのか、エプロンをつけた初老の婦人が駆け寄って、<tips=1>亮</tips>に声をかける。","en":"An older woman in an apron, perhaps employed somewhere on <tips=57>Runway Street</tips>, hurried over and called to <tips=1>Ryo</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r369","rowIndex":369,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あんた、<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>の息子だろう？」","en":"“You’re <tips=3>Chris Tse’s</tips> son, aren’t you?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r370","rowIndex":370,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>は表情をこわばらせて婦人の顔を見つめ返す。","en":"<tips=1>Ryo’s</tips> face stiffened as he looked back at the woman.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r371","rowIndex":371,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なあ、あんたのお父さん、なんとかしてくれよ！　<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>ってのは、最近ちょっとおかしくなっちゃってるんじゃないの？　昔はこういうとき、すぐ来てくれたじゃない。なのに、今は全然来てくれなくって……」","en":"“Listen, can’t you get your father to do something? Don’t you think <tips=7>YS</tips> has been acting a little strange lately? In the old days, they came right away at times like this. But now they never come at all...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r372","rowIndex":372,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「人違いだよ」","en":"“You have the wrong person.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r373","rowIndex":373,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>は相手の言葉を最後まで聞かずにそう返すと、車に乗り込んだ。","en":"Without letting her finish, <tips=1>Ryo</tips> gave that reply and climbed into the truck.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r374","rowIndex":374,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　車は走り出す。","en":"We drove away.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r375","rowIndex":375,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なあ、さっきのアレ、放っておいても蘇ったりしないんかねえ？」","en":"“Hey, you don’t think that thing we left back there could come back to life, do you?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r376","rowIndex":376,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ハンドルを握る<tips=1>亮</tips>におれはそう尋ねた。","en":"I asked <tips=1>Ryo</tips>, who was at the wheel.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r377","rowIndex":377,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「大丈夫」","en":"“It’ll be fine.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r378","rowIndex":378,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どうしてそう言える？」","en":"“How do you know?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r379","rowIndex":379,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あっちは死んだままだよ。それは間違いない」","en":"“The pieces we left behind are dead, and they’ll stay that way. I’m sure of it.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r380","rowIndex":380,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「動いてる方を回収したからか？」","en":"“Because you collected the part that was moving?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r381","rowIndex":381,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうだね」","en":"“That’s right.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r382","rowIndex":382,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうか。それはなんで？」","en":"“I see. Why is that?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r383","rowIndex":383,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「話せば長くなる」","en":"“That would take a while to explain.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r384","rowIndex":384,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>はあまり話をしたくないようだったが、しかしこいつが一人で理解していたって、おれは一体全体何が起こったのかさっぱりわからないのだ。","en":"<tips=1>Ryo</tips> did not seem eager to talk, but it did me no good for him to understand everything by himself. I still had no idea what in the world had happened.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r385","rowIndex":385,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「じゃあ、その動いてる方はどうするんだよ？　そっちが本体ってことは、また復活したりするんじゃないか？　気持ち悪いから、ちゃんと処分してくんなきゃ困るよ」","en":"“Then what are you going to do with the part that’s still moving? If that’s the real body, couldn’t it come back to life again? The thing makes my skin crawl, so you’d better get rid of it properly.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r386","rowIndex":386,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「処分はするよ。ただ、その前にいろいろ使わせて貰う」","en":"“I’ll get rid of it. I have a few uses for it first, though.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r387","rowIndex":387,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「使うって、そんなものどうするんだよ？」","en":"“Use it? What are you going to do with a thing like that?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r388","rowIndex":388,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そんなものって言うけど、これは大変なものなんだ。しかも、虎なんだぜ？　わかるか<tips=10>道夫</tips>。虎なんだよ」","en":"“You say ‘a thing like that,’ but this is a big deal. And it’s a tiger. Do you get it, <tips=10>Michio</tips>? A tiger.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r389","rowIndex":389,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「虎は珍しいな」","en":"“Tigers are rare.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r390","rowIndex":390,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうじゃなくてさ。……まあ、ピンとこないならいいけれど」","en":"“That isn’t what I mean. ...Well, if it doesn’t click for you, never mind.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r391","rowIndex":391,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>が言いたいことはやっぱりよくわからない。","en":"I still did not understand what <tips=1>Ryo</tips> was trying to say.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r392","rowIndex":392,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……しかし、昔っから、そういうおかしな物集めるの好きだよな」","en":"“...Still, you’ve always liked collecting strange things like that.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r393","rowIndex":393,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうかな」","en":"“Really?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r394","rowIndex":394,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうとも。<tips=15>ボーダー</tips>のあたりで良く見つかる、頭が二つあるバッタとか、<tips=17>タイプB</tips>のカエルとか、集めてたじゃんかあ」","en":"“Of course you did. Those two-headed grasshoppers people often find near the <tips=15>Border</tips>, those <tips=17>Type B</tips> frogs—you used to collect things like that.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r395","rowIndex":395,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうだっけ」","en":"“Did I?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r396","rowIndex":396,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうだよ。それさあ、何か使い道があるのかもしれないけど、変ないたずらに使わないでくれよう」","en":"“You did. Maybe you can find some use for it, but don’t go pulling any weird pranks with it, okay?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r397","rowIndex":397,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いたずらなんかしないよ。子供じゃあるまいし」","en":"“I’m not going to play pranks. I’m not a child.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r398","rowIndex":398,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>は肩をすくめる。","en":"<tips=1>Ryo</tips> shrugged.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r399","rowIndex":399,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「正面から向かい合ってたお前にちょっと聞きたいんだが、あの虎、ただ興奮していたのか？　それとも、<tips=17>タイプＢ</tips>の症状が出ているように見えたか？」","en":"“I want to ask you something, since you were facing it head-on. Was that tiger just worked up, or did it look like it was showing <tips=17>Type B</tips> symptoms?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r400","rowIndex":400,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「えっ、それは」","en":"“Huh? Well...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r401","rowIndex":401,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おれは首を捻り、","en":"I tilted my head and said,","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r402","rowIndex":402,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「目がキンキンだから、やっぱおかしくなってたんじゃないのかな？」","en":"“Its eyes were practically shining gold, so I guess there really was something wrong with it?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r403","rowIndex":403,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いや、目が金色でもが症状が出ているとは限らないだろう。他になにか特徴が出ていなかったか？」","en":"“No. Golden eyes alone don’t necessarily mean it was symptomatic. Did you notice anything else unusual?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r404","rowIndex":404,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……ちょっとわかんないな。人間ならともかく、虎が正気がどうかなんて」","en":"“...I’m not sure. With a person, maybe—but how am I supposed to tell whether a tiger is sane?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r405","rowIndex":405,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうか、それもそうだな……」","en":"“I see. Fair point...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r406","rowIndex":406,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>は考え込んでしまう。こいつは一度思考を始めるとこっちの言葉が聞こえなくなるので、おれは発言を控えた。","en":"<tips=1>Ryo</tips> fell deep in thought. Once he began thinking, he could no longer hear anything I said, so I held my tongue.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r407","rowIndex":407,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そしてお互い沈黙してしまい、おれはさっきの光景を思い出す。","en":"We both fell silent, and my mind returned to the scene we had left.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r408","rowIndex":408,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　子供の死体、警察官の死体、それを悲しむ女の姿。ひきつった顔でそれらを眺めるギャラリー。路上に散らばった、売店の残骸。","en":"The bodies of the child and the police officer. The woman grieving over them. The spectators staring at it all with drawn faces. The remains of the stall scattered across the road.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r409","rowIndex":409,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=57>滑走路通り</tips>で人が死ぬのは久しぶりだな」","en":"“It’s been a long time since anyone died on <tips=57>Runway Street</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r410","rowIndex":410,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　溜息と共にその言葉を吐き出してから、","en":"The words came out with a sigh. Then I said,","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r411","rowIndex":411,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「さっきの虎は<tips=17>タイプB</tips>だったみたいだけど、あんな怪物誰が飼ってたんだろうな。どこかの馬鹿が突然変異の虎を密輸入したんかな」","en":"“It looks as though that tiger was a <tips=17>Type B</tips>, but I wonder who was keeping a monster like that. Did some fool smuggle in a mutant tiger?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r412","rowIndex":412,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「さあ」","en":"“No idea.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r413","rowIndex":413,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>はやはり上の空のようだ。","en":"<tips=1>Ryo</tips> still seemed distracted.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r414","rowIndex":414,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あの調子じゃ、飼い主も襲われてるかもしれないなあ。まったく、おかしなものを持ち込むのは勘弁してほしいもんだよ。この街ってさ、こうやって世界中のへんなものがしょっちゅう集まってくるから、わけのわからないことばっかり起こるんだ。退屈はしないが、勘弁してほしいよな」","en":"“At this rate, it may have attacked its owner as well. Honestly, I wish people would stop bringing such strange things into the city. Oddities from all over the world are forever gathering here, and that’s why incomprehensible things keep happening. It’s never boring, but I wish they would give us a break.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r415","rowIndex":415,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おれは溜息をついて、自分の腕を上げて疲労を確認してみた。いつもより重い感じがする。まだ全然ダメだな。ちっとも回復していない。","en":"I sighed and raised my arm to see how tired I still was. It felt heavier than usual. No good. I was nowhere near recovered yet.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r416","rowIndex":416,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　能力を使うのは久しぶりだったけれど、いつ使っても、この気怠い感覚に慣れることが出来ない。","en":"It had been a long time since I used my power, but no matter how often I did, I could never get used to this sluggish feeling.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r417","rowIndex":417,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>はポーカーフェイスでハンドルを握っている。こんなでかい車を普段運転しているはずもないだろうけれど、それを気にするそぶりもなく、車の挙動も安心して乗っていられるものだった。相変わらず器用なやつだ。","en":"<tips=1>Ryo</tips> sat at the wheel with a perfect poker face. There was no way he drove a vehicle this big on a regular basis, yet he showed no sign of caring, and the truck handled smoothly enough that I could relax. He really could handle anything.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r418","rowIndex":418,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そういえば<tips=1>亮</tips>。この車、どこに向かってるんだ？」","en":"“By the way, <tips=1>Ryo</tips>, where are we going in this thing?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r419","rowIndex":419,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=70>シオクリーン</tips>の本社だよ。車を返しに行くんだ。ついでに<tips=54>汐さん</tips>に挨拶してくる。<tips=10>道夫</tips>もそこまでついて来るかい？　用事があったらそのあたりで降ろすけど」","en":"“<tips=70>Shio Clean</tips> headquarters. I’m taking the truck back. While I’m there, I’ll say hello to <tips=54>Mr. Shio</tips>. Want to come along, <tips=10>Michio</tips>? If you’ve got somewhere else to be, I can drop you off nearby.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r420","rowIndex":420,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いや、ここで降ろされても困るって。見てくれよこの血だらけの姿を。ついたらシャワー借りられっかな？」","en":"“Come on, you can’t just drop me off here. Look at me—I’m covered in blood. Think they’ll let me use a shower when we get there?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r421","rowIndex":421,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「事務所で借りられると思うよ」","en":"“I think they’ll let you use the shower in the office.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r422","rowIndex":422,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「じゃあそうさせてもらうかあ。社長のところにも顔を出すよ。久しぶりに<tips=55>松坊</tips>も見てみたいし……そう言えばお前、<tips=55>松坊</tips>とは会ってるのか？」","en":"“Guess I’ll take them up on that, then. I’ll stop in and see the boss too. I haven’t seen <tips=55>Matsu</tips> in ages... Come to think of it, have you been seeing <tips=55>Matsu</tips>?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r423","rowIndex":423,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「会ってないな」","en":"“I haven’t seen her.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r424","rowIndex":424,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「じゃあきっとあいつ喜ぶぞ」","en":"“Then I bet she’ll be happy to see you.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r425","rowIndex":425,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どうだろう。彼女は忙しいようだし、今日は家にいないかもしれない」","en":"“I wonder. She seems busy, and she may not be home today.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r426","rowIndex":426,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「随分あっさりしてるなあ」","en":"“You’re awfully nonchalant about it.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r427","rowIndex":427,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうでもないよ。まあタイミングってのがあるからね」","en":"“Not particularly. These things depend on timing.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r428","rowIndex":428,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そういうものなんかねえ」","en":"“Is that how it is?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r429","rowIndex":429,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おれは溜息をつく。","en":"I sighed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r430","rowIndex":430,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　車は<tips=57>滑走路通り</tips>を抜けると、細い裏道に入ってゆく。","en":"After leaving <tips=57>Runway Street</tips>, the truck entered a narrow back road.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r431","rowIndex":431,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　この車の所有者である『<tips=70>シオクリーン</tips>』という会社は、この先の<tips=58>パラシュート通り</tips>の一角にあるゴミ収集業者の名前だ。","en":"The truck belonged to a company called <tips=70>Shio Clean</tips>, a waste-collection business located up ahead on one corner of <tips=58>Parachute Street</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r432","rowIndex":432,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　たびたびのトラブルによって市のゴミ収集車が撤退した代わりに、<tips=9>Y地区</tips>のゴミ処理を一手に請け負っている。家庭のゴミも、企業のゴミも、取り扱いの難しい各種廃棄物、そして誰にも頼めないような処分の難しい秘密のゴミも、いらなくなったものは電話一本ですべて廃棄してくれるという、なんというか夢のような業者で、おそらくこの<tips=9>Y地区</tips>でも有数の売上高を誇っている企業なんじゃないかな？　活動地域も、最近では<tips=9>Y地区</tips>だけでなく、近隣の市町村をどんどん開拓して広げているらしい。まさに順風満帆といったところだ。","en":"After one problem after another drove the city’s garbage trucks out, Shio Clean took over all waste disposal in <tips=9>Y District</tips>. Household trash, company trash, all kinds of difficult waste that needed special handling—even secret trash too troublesome to trust to anyone else. Whatever you needed gone, one phone call and they would dispose of it all. It was practically a dream service, and I imagined it had some of the highest sales in <tips=9>Y District</tips>. Lately, it had also been expanding beyond <tips=9>Y District</tips>, opening up more and more neighboring towns and cities. Business could hardly have been better.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r433","rowIndex":433,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その創業者であり現社長でもあるのが<tips=54>汐健慈朗</tips>って人なのである。","en":"Its founder and current president was a man named <tips=54>Kenjiro Shio</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r434","rowIndex":434,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　この人物と<tips=1>亮</tips>は昔っからとんでもなく親しく、おれからすると実の父親以上に慕っているようにさえ見える。<tips=1>亮</tips>の性格や考え方の、かなり多くの部分がこの<tips=54>汐さん</tips>の影響を受けているよ。だから大学になんか行ったんだろう。本当にそっくりで……つまりどういうことかっていうと、汐という人物も相当の変人なのだ。","en":"<tips=1>Ryo</tips> had been ridiculously close to this man for as long as I could remember. To me, he even seemed to look up to <tips=54>Mr. Shio</tips> more than his own father. A lot of <tips=1>Ryo’s</tips> personality and his way of thinking had come from Mr. Shio. That was probably why he had gone off to university in the first place. The two of them really were alike... In other words, Shio was a serious eccentric too.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r435","rowIndex":435,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=58>パラシュート通り</tips>は<tips=9>Y地区</tips>でも地味な地域で、地元の住民が利用するこぢんまりとした総菜屋や、食料品店、生活雑貨店など、家族総出で涙が出るほど細々と営業を続けるいじましい店が建ち並んでいる。","en":"<tips=58>Parachute Street</tips> was one of the plainer areas of <tips=9>Y District</tips>. It was lined with small prepared-food shops, groceries, and household-goods stores used by local residents: brave little establishments whose entire families labored together to keep them alive by the narrowest of margins.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r436","rowIndex":436,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　観光客はほとんど訪れないが、変化が少なく、昔の<tips=9>Y地区</tips>らしい通りで、かつて<tips=1>亮</tips>が居候していた定食屋もこの通りにあった。","en":"Few tourists ever came, but the street had changed little and retained the character of the old <tips=9>Y District</tips>. The diner where <tips=1>Ryo</tips> had once boarded was located here as well.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r437","rowIndex":437,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　多分、<tips=1>亮</tips>にとっては最も懐かしい場所だろう。しかし、ハンドルを握るその横顔は相変わらずの無表情だ。","en":"For <tips=1>Ryo</tips>, it was probably the most nostalgic place of all. Yet his profile behind the wheel remained as expressionless as ever.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r438","rowIndex":438,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　普通の人間なら冷たいやつだと思うだろうけれど、長いつき合いになるおれの目からすると、その内心では光景に感じ入っているのが手にとるようにわかるぜ。","en":"An ordinary observer would have thought him cold. But after knowing him for so many years, I could tell as plainly as if he had said it aloud that the sights around us were moving him deeply.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r439","rowIndex":439,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　こいつは、そういうところでいつも損をしているんだよなあ。もっと素直に生きるよう昔から忠告しているのだけれど、なかなか聞き入れないのだ。","en":"This side of him always worked against him. I had been telling him for years to live a little more openly, but he never listened.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r440","rowIndex":440,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　何十年も補修されていないアスファルトはところどころが剥げ、スピードを落としているにもかかわらず、シートに接した尻が痛くなるほどガタガタと揺れた。","en":"The asphalt had gone unrepaired for decades and was worn away in places. Even though we had slowed down, the ride was so rough that my backside hurt against the seat.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r441","rowIndex":441,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　やがて車は<tips=70>シオクリーン</tips>本社に到着する。","en":"Before long, the truck arrived at <tips=70>Shio Clean</tips> headquarters.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r442","rowIndex":442,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　本社と言えばご大層な感じがするけれど、それを実際みるとショボい。数台の作業車を置ける程度の駐車場と、プレハブの事務所が一つあるだけの小さな施設だ。","en":"The word headquarters suggested something grand. The reality was shabby: a small facility with a parking lot large enough for several work vehicles and a single prefabricated office.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r443","rowIndex":443,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　郊外の作業所にはもっと大きな駐車場と、立派な社屋があって、あっちは企業の規模に対して恥ずかしくないんだけれど、それとは全然ちがう。こちらはほぼ創業当時のままの姿をしているらしい。いつだったか、<tips=58>パラシュート通り</tips>一帯を映した古い航空写真を見たことがあるんだけれど、まったくそっくり同じ建物が映っていてたまげたもんだ。","en":"The suburban worksite had a much bigger parking lot and a proper office building—one that was not embarrassing for a company of this size. This place was nothing like it. Apparently, it looked almost exactly as it had when the business was founded. I once saw an old aerial photograph of the whole <tips=58>Parachute Street</tips> area, and there was the exact same building. I could not believe it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r444","rowIndex":444,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>は空いていたスペースに車を停めると、一人で事務所へ行き、そしてすぐに戻って来た。","en":"<tips=1>Ryo</tips> parked the truck in an open space, went into the office alone, and returned almost immediately.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r445","rowIndex":445,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ここでシャワーを借りてから、社長宅に行こう」","en":"“Let’s use the shower here, then go over to the boss’s house.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r446","rowIndex":446,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　車を降りてから振り返ると、おれたちの座っていたところは血みどろになっていて、これはちょっと、たまらないなと思った。","en":"When I climbed down and looked back, I saw that the place where we had been sitting was drenched in blood. It was almost too much to look at.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r447","rowIndex":447,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おれたちは職員用の簡易シャワー室で汚れを落とし、乾燥機から出したばかりのホカホカの作業着に着替え、本社のすぐ目の前にある社長宅に向かった。","en":"We washed ourselves in the employees’ modest shower room, changed into work clothes still warm from the dryer, and headed for the president’s house directly across from headquarters.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r448","rowIndex":448,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　社長宅もやっぱり、本社同様名前負けしたボロい建物だった。","en":"Like the headquarters, the president’s house was a shabby building that hardly lived up to the title.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r449","rowIndex":449,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>がインターフォンを鳴らすと、汐社長本人が玄関のドアを開く。","en":"When <tips=1>Ryo</tips> rang the intercom, President Shio himself opened the front door.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r450","rowIndex":450,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なんだお前ら。またつるみ始めたのか？」","en":"“What are you two up to? Started hanging around together again?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐健慈朗","displayName":"Kenjiro Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r451","rowIndex":451,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=54>汐さん</tips>は挨拶もしないで開口一番そう言った。","en":"That was the first thing <tips=54>Mr. Shio</tips> said, without so much as a greeting.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r452","rowIndex":452,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼はそんなに暑い時期でもないのに、ポロシャツにハーフパンツという、きわめてラフな格好をしている。この人は年間を通じてこの私服だ。おれはいくら思い出そうとしても、この服装と、作業時のつなぎ姿でしか<tips=54>汐健慈朗</tips>という人物を思い浮かべることが出来ないんだよね。","en":"Though the weather was not particularly warm, he wore a polo shirt and shorts: an extremely casual outfit he wore at home throughout the year. Try as I might, I cannot picture <tips=54>Kenjiro Shio</tips> in anything but those clothes or the coveralls he wore for work.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r453","rowIndex":453,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　身なり全般がいいかげんで、ぼさぼさの頭にはいつも寝癖がついているし、ヒゲは伸び放題で顔中を毛むくじゃらにしている。","en":"He was careless about his appearance in every respect. His shaggy hair always had a bad case of bed head, and he let his beard grow wild until his whole face was buried in hair.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r454","rowIndex":454,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ただ、不潔というわけではないんじゃないかな。むしろ髪も肌も艶がよく、近くに行くと良いにおいさえする。これは本人の性格か、一緒に暮らす一人娘の影響によるものなのか、ちょっとわからないけれども。","en":"Still, I did not think he was actually dirty. If anything, his hair and skin had a healthy sheen, and up close he even smelled good. I could not tell whether that was his own doing or the influence of the daughter who lived with him.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r455","rowIndex":455,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうだよ。名コンビの復活だ。よろしく頼むよ<tips=54>汐さん</tips>」","en":"“That’s right. The old dream team is back. Good to see you, <tips=54>Mr. Shio</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r456","rowIndex":456,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　と、おれが返事をする横で、","en":"As I answered, beside me Ryo said,","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r457","rowIndex":457,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「今日はたまたまだよ」","en":"“We just happened to be together today.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r458","rowIndex":458,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>は仏頂面でそう言って、相手の許可も得ずに勝手に玄関を上がる。","en":"<tips=1>Ryo</tips> spoke with a sullen face, then stepped inside without waiting for permission.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r459","rowIndex":459,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=9>Y地区</tips>には靴のまま入っていくような家が多いけれど、ここは主人が日本人だけあって、玄関で靴を脱いで上がる構造になっている。","en":"Many homes in <tips=9>Y District</tips> allowed visitors to enter in their shoes, but Mr. Shio was Japanese, and this entrance was designed for people to remove their footwear before stepping up.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r460","rowIndex":460,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「つれないねえ」","en":"“Aw, don’t be so cold.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r461","rowIndex":461,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おれはそう言って、<tips=1>亮</tips>のあとに続いた。","en":"With that remark, I followed <tips=1>Ryo</tips> inside.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r462","rowIndex":462,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=54>汐さん</tips>は別段何も言わず、くるりと背を向けて廊下を行く。","en":"<tips=54>Mr. Shio</tips> said nothing in particular. He simply turned around and went down the hall.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r463","rowIndex":463,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=55>松坊</tips>は？」","en":"“Is <tips=55>Matsu</tips> here?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r464","rowIndex":464,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おれがその背に尋ねても、返事もしない。","en":"I called the question after him, but he did not answer.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r465","rowIndex":465,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　悪意があるわけではないんだよね。この汐という人物は普段からこうで、非常に無口で扱いにくい人間だと知られている。まあ、ゴミというものには人の秘密がつまっているもんだし、それを受け取って処分する仕事をする人間としては、それくらいの方が信頼出来るような気もするよ。","en":"There was no malice in it. Shio was always like this and was known as an extremely taciturn, difficult man. Well, garbage is full of people’s secrets. In a man whose work was to receive and dispose of it, such reserve almost seemed grounds for trust.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r466","rowIndex":466,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　板張りの廊下も清掃が行き届いていて清潔だった。けれど、続くリビングルームは若干散らかっている。近くの総菜屋の包み紙がテーブルの上でくしゃくしゃになり、その脇には空になったポリケースに割り箸が突っ込まれている。朝食か何かを食べ終わったそのままに放置したのだろう。間違いなくこれは<tips=54>汐さん</tips>の無頓着さの仕業だ。","en":"The wooden hallway was spotless and thoroughly cleaned, but the living room beyond was somewhat untidy. Wrapping paper from a nearby deli lay crumpled on the table, and disposable chopsticks had been thrust into an empty plastic container beside it. He had evidently finished breakfast or something and simply left everything there. Clearly, <tips=54>Mr. Shio’s</tips> carelessness was to blame.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r467","rowIndex":467,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「電話で話したとおり、見せたいものがあるんです」","en":"“As I said on the telephone, there is something I want to show you.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r468","rowIndex":468,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>は部屋に入ると、さっそくテーブルの上に上着で包んだ虎の肉塊をどさりと置き、そして次にポケットからハンカチを取り出した。","en":"The moment he entered the room, <tips=1>Ryo</tips> dropped the jacket-wrapped lump of tiger flesh onto the table, then took the handkerchief from his pocket.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r469","rowIndex":469,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「こっちの小さいのがコア組織。でかいのがそれ以外の体組織です」","en":"“The small piece is core tissue. The larger one is non-core body tissue.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r470","rowIndex":470,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>にとっては、これを<tips=54>汐さん</tips>に見せるってのが、ここを訪ねた本当の趣旨らしい。てっきりおれは車を拝借した説明をするためにここへやって来たものと思っていたので、なんだか意外だった。","en":"It seemed that showing this to <tips=54>Mr. Shio</tips> was <tips=1>Ryo’s</tips> real reason for coming here. I had assumed we were here so that he could explain borrowing the truck, and found the revelation rather surprising.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r471","rowIndex":471,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「虎が再生するのを見た時はまさかと思ったけど、やっぱりビンゴでした」","en":"“When I saw the tiger regenerate, I thought it couldn’t be, but sure enough—bingo.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r472","rowIndex":472,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　言いながらハンカチを開くと、先ほど虎の死骸からつまみ出した肉片があらわれる。……えっ、これって本当にさっきの肉片と同じものなのか？","en":"As he spoke, he opened the handkerchief, revealing the scrap of flesh he had plucked from the tiger’s carcass earlier. ...Wait, was this really the same scrap of flesh as before?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r473","rowIndex":473,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「これ……」","en":"“This...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r474","rowIndex":474,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おれは<tips=1>亮</tips>の方を見るけれど、彼の視線は<tips=54>汐さん</tips>の表情に注がれている。そして<tips=54>汐さん</tips>も、眉間にしわを寄せて難しい顔をしている。","en":"I looked at <tips=1>Ryo</tips>, but his eyes were fixed on <tips=54>Mr. Shio’s</tips> face. <tips=54>Mr. Shio</tips>, in turn, wore a troubled frown.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r475","rowIndex":475,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その物体は、赤色こそさきほどの肉片のままなんだけれど、その質感は肉と呼べるようなものではなく、幾分透明感を持っていて、ゲル状というのか？　クラゲみたいなゼリーみたいな、よくわからないものに変化しているのだ。","en":"The thing was still the same red as the scrap of flesh, but its texture was no longer anything I could call meat. It had grown somewhat translucent and—gelatinous, maybe? It had turned into something I could not identify, like a cross between a jellyfish and a lump of jelly.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r476","rowIndex":476,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しかもそれはグニャグニャと動き、まるでハンカチの上から逃れようとしているように見えた。","en":"What was more, it writhed and squirmed, looking as though it were trying to escape from the handkerchief.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r477","rowIndex":477,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「おい。なんだこれ。こんなもの見たことがないぞ」","en":"“Hey. What is this? I’ve never seen anything like it.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r478","rowIndex":478,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>はおれの言葉には反応せず、真剣な顔で<tips=54>汐さん</tips>の方を見ながら、","en":"<tips=1>Ryo</tips> did not respond to me. His expression serious, he kept his eyes on <tips=54>Mr. Shio</tips> and said,","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r479","rowIndex":479,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=54>汐さん</tips>、見てくださいよこれ。虎から採取したんです。『虎』ですよ？」","en":"“<tips=54>Mr. Shio</tips>, look at this. I collected it from a tiger. A ‘tiger,’ you understand?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r480","rowIndex":480,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　さっきからやたらと虎だってことを強調しているが、どういう意味があるのだろう？　<tips=54>汐さん</tips>は黙って頷いているが、二人には通じるのだろうか？","en":"He kept going out of his way to stress that it was a tiger, but why? <tips=54>Mr. Shio</tips> nodded silently. Did it mean something to the two of them?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r481","rowIndex":481,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　はてなマークばかりが浮かぶおれをよそに、<tips=1>亮</tips>は先ほど<tips=57>滑走路通り</tips>で起きた出来事を話した。","en":"Oblivious to the question marks multiplying in my head, <tips=1>Ryo</tips> recounted what had happened earlier on <tips=57>Runway Street</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r482","rowIndex":482,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=54>汐さん</tips>は一言も口をきかずに静かに話を聞いた。そして聞き終わると、大きく溜息をつく。","en":"<tips=54>Mr. Shio</tips> listened quietly without saying a word. When the account was over, he let out a long sigh.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r483","rowIndex":483,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まったく一緒ですよね。そして、虎ってのはそういうことなんじゃないですか？」","en":"“It’s exactly the same, isn’t it? And the tiger—that has to mean what we think it means, doesn’t it?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r484","rowIndex":484,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>が勢い込んで言うと、","en":"<tips=1>Ryo</tips> said eagerly,","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r485","rowIndex":485,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なんとも言えんな」","en":"“Hard to say.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐健慈朗","displayName":"Kenjiro Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r486","rowIndex":486,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして二人とも黙り込んでしまう。","en":"Then both men fell silent.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r487","rowIndex":487,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　二人の頭のなかには、これだけの言葉で通じる共通の知識があるかもしれないけれど、おれはまったく理解出来ず、ただただ驚くばっかりだ。そして黙っていれば二人がおれにもわかるような話をしてくれるかと思って待ってみても、いつまでも二人は沈黙している。","en":"The two of them might share enough background knowledge that this handful of words was all they needed, but I could not understand a thing; I could only stare in amazement. I waited, thinking that if I kept quiet they might explain it in terms even I could understand, but they simply went on sitting in silence.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r488","rowIndex":488,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なあ、こいつ、まだ生きてるのかねえ？」","en":"“Say, is this thing still alive?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r489","rowIndex":489,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　耐えられなくなっておれはそう尋ねた。<tips=1>亮</tips>は顔を上げる。","en":"Unable to stand the silence any longer, I asked. <tips=1>Ryo</tips> raised his head.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r490","rowIndex":490,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうだよ。といっても、生物の細胞は生体から切り裂かれてもある程度は生きるものだけどね。ただ、こいつは、それとは全く別のレベルで『生きている』。……見なよ、さっきと形ちがうでしょ？　切り離された途端、単体で生存出来るかたちに自分から変化したんだよ。これって結構すごいことなんだよ。わかりやすく詳細を説明するのはちょっと難しいけど……」","en":"“It is. Of course, cells will stay alive for a while even after they’re cut away from a living body. But this thing is ‘alive’ on a completely different level. ...Look—it’s a different shape now, isn’t it? The moment it was separated, it transformed itself into a form that could survive on its own. That’s pretty incredible. It’s a little hard to explain all the details in plain language, though...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r491","rowIndex":491,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　早口で言うけれど、おれにはさっぱりだ。","en":"He rattled it all off, but I could not follow a word.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r492","rowIndex":492,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ありがとう。よくわからんけれど、まあとにかく生きているんだな。でもさあ、なんで虎がこんな風になるんだろう。やっぱり<tips=17>タイプB</tips>なのかい？　再生しているときはなんとなくそう思ったけど……でも、<tips=17>タイプB</tips>だからってこんなにならないだろうし……それとも、濃ければなるのか？」","en":"“Thanks. I don’t really understand, but anyway, it’s alive. Still, why would a tiger turn into something like this? Is it a <tips=17>Type B</tips> after all? That was sort of what I thought when it was regenerating... But just being a <tips=17>Type B</tips> shouldn’t make it turn into this... Or does it, if the Type B runs strong enough?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r493","rowIndex":493,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まあ、それは、何と言ったらいいか……」","en":"“Well, that is... How should I put it?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r494","rowIndex":494,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>は言葉を濁しながら、","en":"<tips=1>Ryo</tips> hedged and said,","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r495","rowIndex":495,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「とりあえず、<tips=17>タイプB</tips>ではあると思う」","en":"“At any rate, I think it is a <tips=17>Type B</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r496","rowIndex":496,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうか。<tips=17>タイプB</tips>ってのは謎の多い存在だなあ！　まあ、<tips=17>タイプB</tips>の上にAまでくっついてるおれが言うことでもないんだけどさ。まったく、この地上の生物っていうものはどうなろうとしているのかねえ」","en":"“I see. <tips=17>Type Bs</tips> certainly are mysterious creatures! Though perhaps that’s rich coming from me, when I’ve even got A stuck on top of <tips=17>Type B</tips> myself. Honestly, what is all life on Earth trying to become?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r497","rowIndex":497,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おれはまじまじと、元は虎の一部であった物体を見つめた。","en":"I stared fixedly at the object that had once been part of a tiger.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r498","rowIndex":498,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「地下室へ行くか……」","en":"“Let’s go down to the basement...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐健慈朗","displayName":"Kenjiro Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r499","rowIndex":499,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=54>汐さん</tips>が重い口を開く。","en":"<tips=54>Mr. Shio</tips> finally broke his heavy silence.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r500","rowIndex":500,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それがいいと思う」","en":"“I think that would be best.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r501","rowIndex":501,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>は頷き、テーブルにぽとりと落ちたゲルをつまみ上げ、またハンカチのなかに包み込む。","en":"<tips=1>Ryo</tips> nodded, picked up the gel that had dropped onto the table, and wrapped it in the handkerchief once more.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r502","rowIndex":502,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=54>汐健慈朗</tips>の自宅の地下にこんな部屋があるとは知らなかった。","en":"I had not known that such a room existed beneath <tips=54>Kenjiro Shio’s</tips> home.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r503","rowIndex":503,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　いや、おれだけでなく、<tips=9>Y地区</tips>中の誰もが想像もしないだろう。ゴミ処理会社社長宅の地下に、こんなに不思議な機材に満ちあふれたSFチックな部屋があるだなんて。","en":"No—not just me. No one in all of <tips=9>Y District</tips> would ever imagine that the basement of a waste-company president’s house contained a room straight out of science fiction, overflowing with such strange equipment.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r504","rowIndex":504,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　何かの実験室？　あるいは研究室というやつなのだろうか？　そういう場所に足を踏み入れたことがないからちょっと断定は出来ないけれど、なんだかそんな雰囲気だ。","en":"Was it some kind of experimental laboratory? Or maybe what people called a research lab? I had never set foot in a place like this, so I could not say for sure, but that was the impression it gave me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r505","rowIndex":505,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　棚には薬品の入った瓶が並び、スポイトやビーカーの姿も目に付く。そして何を測定するのかはわからないけれども何かを測定するらしい、メーターのついた機械があり、さらに用途を想像することも出来ない様々な機械が所狭しと並んでいる。","en":"The shelves held rows of chemical bottles, and pipettes and beakers caught the eye. There were machines fitted with gauges, apparently intended to measure something—though I could not imagine what—and still more devices of utterly unknowable purpose crowded every available space.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r506","rowIndex":506,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　全体的にひどく雑然としていて、最小限の機能性をたもつ整理整頓しかなされていない。中央の大きな机の上にはガラス製の機具や、ノートが散乱している。ここばかりは確実に一人娘の手が入っていないなと、おれにも断言出来る。","en":"The whole room was in terrible disorder, with only enough organization to keep it minimally functional. Glass instruments and notebooks lay scattered across the large table in the center. Here, at least, even I could say with certainty that his daughter had never done the tidying.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r507","rowIndex":507,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　こんなわけのわからない施設を、どうして自宅に持っているのか？　何に使っているのか？　彼は何者なのか？","en":"Why did he have a place like this in his own home? What did he use it for? Who was this man?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r508","rowIndex":508,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　この街には何をしているのか得体の知れない人間が多いが、汐社長もその一人というわけか。","en":"This town has plenty of inscrutable people whose work is a mystery, and apparently President Shio is one of them.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r509","rowIndex":509,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その一方、<tips=1>亮</tips>は勝手知ったる人の家とばかりに部屋の奥へ進んでゆく。","en":"Meanwhile, <tips=1>Ryo</tips> proceeded deeper into the room with the ease of a man who knew another’s home as well as his own.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r510","rowIndex":510,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして、まず冷蔵庫らしき装置に上着で包んだままの肉塊を無造作に入れると、次に部屋の中央にあるテーブルの上の紙くずを手で払って、どこからか取り出したシャーレを置き、その中に件のゲルを入れた。","en":"First he carelessly placed the jacket-wrapped lump of flesh inside a device resembling a refrigerator. Then he swept the scraps of paper from the table in the center of the room with one hand, produced a petri dish from somewhere, and put the gel inside it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r511","rowIndex":511,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>と<tips=54>汐さん</tips>はよほど通じ合っているらしく、お互い短い単語を口にし、アイコンタクトをとり、それで充分コミュニケーションがとれているようだがおれにはちっともわからん。","en":"<tips=1>Ryo</tips> and <tips=54>Mr. Shio</tips> seemed to understand one another extraordinarily well. A few brief words and exchanges of glances appeared sufficient for them to communicate, but I understood none of it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r512","rowIndex":512,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ゲルはシャーレの中で伸びたり縮んだりを繰り返し、時々突起のようなものを作って中空にさしのべては、また本体に吸収させている。","en":"Inside the petri dish, the gel repeatedly stretched and contracted. From time to time it formed something like a projection, extended it into the air, and then absorbed it back into the main body.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r513","rowIndex":513,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　確かにこれは生きている。おれもへんてこな生き物は沢山見てきたからそこまでは驚きはしないけれど、それでも、見たことがない。","en":"There could be no doubt that it was alive. I had seen plenty of bizarre creatures, so that alone did not astonish me, but even so, I had never seen anything like it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r514","rowIndex":514,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=8>グレートホール</tips>の近くでは、<tips=16>タイプA</tips>や<tips=17>タイプB</tips>といったミュータントが生まれやすいという話がある。それと関係してか、この<tips=9>Y地区</tips>では小動物や植物にも突然変異をした奇妙な形状や能力を持つ生き物が多い。子供たちはよくそういった珍しい生き物を見つけるとおもちゃにして遊び、大抵その結果殺してしまう。","en":"People say mutants of <tips=16>Type A</tips> and <tips=17>Type B</tips> are more likely to be born near the <tips=8>Great Hole</tips>. Perhaps for that reason, <tips=9>Y District</tips> also abounds in small animals and plants with strange mutant forms and abilities. When children discover one of these rare creatures, they often make a toy of it and, in most cases, kill it in the process.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r515","rowIndex":515,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>はちょっと違って、生きたまま持ち帰ることを重要視して、ポケットやらカゴやらに片っ端から突っ込んでいたが、当時からこんな風に<tips=54>汐さん</tips>のところに持ち込んで二人で話していたんだろうか？","en":"<tips=1>Ryo</tips> was a little different. He considered it important to bring them home alive and stuffed every creature he found into a pocket or basket. Had he been taking them to <tips=54>Mr. Shio</tips> even back then, so that the two of them could discuss them like this?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r516","rowIndex":516,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　二人の口ぶりから察するに、どうもそんな気がする。","en":"Judging from the way they spoke, it certainly seemed that way.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r517","rowIndex":517,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おれはずっと<tips=1>亮</tips>とは親友だと思っていたけれど、ちっとも知らなかったなあ。","en":"I had always considered <tips=1>Ryo</tips> my closest friend, yet I had known nothing about it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r518","rowIndex":518,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　驚きつつ感心していると、<tips=54>汐さん</tips>はいつの間にか透明なプラスチックの容器を手にしていて、そこから赤っぽい液体をゲルの入ったシャーレに注ぎ込む。","en":"While I stood there astonished and impressed, I noticed that <tips=54>Mr. Shio</tips> was holding a transparent plastic container. He poured a reddish liquid from it into the petri dish holding the gel.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r519","rowIndex":519,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「これは何ですか？」","en":"“What is that?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r520","rowIndex":520,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「基礎培地だよ」","en":"“Basal medium.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r521","rowIndex":521,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=54>汐さん</tips>のかわりに<tips=1>亮</tips>が答える。","en":"<tips=1>Ryo</tips> answered in <tips=54>Mr. Shio’s</tips> place.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r522","rowIndex":522,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「キソバイチ？」","en":"“Bay-sull meedyum?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r523","rowIndex":523,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「水に、ちょっとした栄養が混ざっているんだ。これで細胞を培養する」","en":"“It’s water with a few nutrients mixed into it. We use it to culture cells.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r524","rowIndex":524,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「つまり、こいつに餌を与えているわけか？」","en":"“So basically, you’re feeding it?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r525","rowIndex":525,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まあそうだね」","en":"“More or less.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r526","rowIndex":526,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ゲルが浸る程度に液体が行き渡ると、<tips=54>汐さん</tips>はガラスのふたをシャーレに被せて、重しのつもりか、何冊かの本を上に置いた。一番上になった本には、アルファベットでタイトルが書かれている。","en":"Once there was enough liquid to immerse the gel, <tips=54>Mr. Shio</tips> placed a glass lid over the petri dish, then stacked several books on top, apparently to weigh it down. The title of the uppermost book was written in the Roman alphabet.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r527","rowIndex":527,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「これ何語だ？　ら……るみえれ……そーたんと……」","en":"“What language is this? La... loo-mee-air... soh-tant...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r528","rowIndex":528,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おれが首をひねっていると、<tips=54>汐さん</tips>は立ち上がる。","en":"As I puzzled over it, <tips=54>Mr. Shio</tips> stood.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r529","rowIndex":529,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「こいつはあとで洗浄して無菌室に保管しておく。今日はもうしまいにしよう。もうすぐ松が帰って来る」","en":"“I’ll clean this later and keep it in the sterile room. We are finished for today. Matsu will be home soon.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r530","rowIndex":530,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼は一方的にそう言い放ち、返事も待たずに地下室を出る階段へ向かう。おれと<tips=1>亮</tips>はその背中を追う格好になる。","en":"He made the announcement unilaterally and headed for the stairs without waiting for a response. <tips=1>Ryo</tips> and I had little choice but to follow.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r531","rowIndex":531,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なあ、アレを飼うのか？」","en":"“Are you going to keep that thing?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r532","rowIndex":532,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おれが小声で尋ねるが、<tips=1>亮</tips>はそれには答えず、","en":"I asked quietly, but <tips=1>Ryo</tips> did not answer the question. Instead, he said,","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r533","rowIndex":533,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「このことは、絶対に<tips=55>松子</tips>には内緒にしてよ」","en":"“Whatever you do, don’t tell <tips=55>Matsuko</tips> about this.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r534","rowIndex":534,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　とだけ言った。","en":"That was all he said.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r535","rowIndex":535,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　どういう事情があるのかよくわからないが、ちょっと驚いてしまうくらい真剣な表情で、ただならぬ事情を感じさせる。","en":"I did not know what was going on, but the startling seriousness of his expression made it clear that this was no ordinary matter.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r536","rowIndex":536,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　気になったが、おれは何も聞かずにとにかく頷いた。","en":"I was curious, but I nodded without asking anything.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r537","rowIndex":537,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　リビングに戻ると、今さっきのことなどなかったかのように<tips=1>亮</tips>と<tips=54>汐さん</tips>は世間話を始めた。","en":"Back in the living room, <tips=1>Ryo</tips> and <tips=54>Mr. Shio</tips> began making small talk as though nothing had happened.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r538","rowIndex":538,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>の大学生活についてや、師事している教授のこと。話の内容を聞いていると、<tips=54>汐さん</tips>は一人暮らしになってからの<tips=1>亮</tips>の状況をそれほど詳しく知っているわけではないようだった。","en":"They talked about <tips=1>Ryo’s</tips> life at university and the professor under whom he studied. From their conversation, <tips=54>Mr. Shio</tips> did not seem to know much about <tips=1>Ryo’s</tips> circumstances since he began living alone.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r539","rowIndex":539,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そしてもう一つ気がついたのは、<tips=54>汐さん</tips>が大学やら学問やらの世界に詳しいような物言いをしているところ。","en":"Another thing I noticed was the familiarity with which <tips=54>Mr. Shio</tips> spoke about universities and the academic world.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r540","rowIndex":540,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　実験室などを地下に作っているのは、やはりそういうことなのか。","en":"Was that, then, why he had built a laboratory in his basement?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r541","rowIndex":541,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=54>汐さん</tips>って、昔そういう関係の仕事か何かしていたの？　学者か何かだったのかい？」","en":"“<tips=54>Mr. Shio</tips>, did you once work in that field or something? Were you some kind of scholar?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r542","rowIndex":542,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　やたらと人の素性を尋ねるのは失礼だとは承知の上だけれど、おれはたまらなくなって疑問を素直にぶつけてみた。しかし、<tips=54>汐さん</tips>は自分のことは話したくないらしく、「ああ」と、肯定とも否定ともつかない声をあげるだけだった。","en":"I knew it was rude to pry into someone’s background, but I could no longer contain myself and put the question to him outright. <tips=54>Mr. Shio</tips> apparently had no wish to discuss himself. He merely grunted, “Ah,” in a way that conveyed neither assent nor denial.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r543","rowIndex":543,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おれはなるべく黙って二人の話を聞いたのだけれど、話しているのはほとんど<tips=1>亮</tips>で、<tips=54>汐さん</tips>は黙って頷きながら、時々質問をするだけだった。","en":"I tried to remain silent and listen to the two of them. <tips=1>Ryo</tips>, however, did almost all the talking. <tips=54>Mr. Shio</tips> nodded without speaking and only occasionally asked a question.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r544","rowIndex":544,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>は学校での生活に充実感を持っているというようなことを語る。生物系の勉強をしているらしいが、よほど性にあっているらしい。一方、最近<tips=9>Y地区</tips>では話題となっている父の<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>の病気の話などはまず口にしなかった。","en":"<tips=1>Ryo</tips> talked about how fulfilling he found university life. Apparently, he was studying some branch of biology, and it seemed to suit him perfectly. On the other hand, he said almost nothing about the illness of his father, <tips=3>Chris Tse</tips>, even though it had recently become the talk of <tips=9>Y District</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r545","rowIndex":545,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おれからすると、わざと話題を避けているように見える。","en":"To me, it looked like he was deliberately avoiding the subject.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r546","rowIndex":546,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ということはつまり、意識はしてるってことだ。案外、こいつは本当にこの街に戻って来るのかもしれないな。","en":"That would mean it was on his mind. Perhaps, against all expectation, he truly would return to this city.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r547","rowIndex":547,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そんなことを考えているうちに、<tips=54>汐健慈朗</tips>の一人娘が買い物籠を提げて帰って来た。","en":"While I was thinking about all that, <tips=54>Kenjiro Shio’s</tips> only daughter came home carrying a shopping basket.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r548","rowIndex":548,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あっ……」","en":"“Ah...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐松子","displayName":"Matsuko Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r549","rowIndex":549,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　入り口のところで目を丸くするその子が<tips=54>汐健慈朗</tips>の娘、<tips=55>汐松子</tips>。おれは親しみを込めて<tips=55>松坊</tips>と呼んでいる。","en":"The girl staring wide-eyed from the entrance was <tips=54>Kenjiro Shio’s</tips> daughter, <tips=55>Matsuko Shio</tips>. I affectionately called her <tips=55>Matsu</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r550","rowIndex":550,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「よう、久しぶりじゃないかあ。なあ、今日はいい日だろ？　お前の王子様と一緒に来たんだぞ」","en":"“Hey, long time no see! Today’s your lucky day, huh? I brought your prince along.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r551","rowIndex":551,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「な、な、何をっ……そんなっ……」","en":"“W-w-what are you...? You can’t just...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐松子","displayName":"Matsuko Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r552","rowIndex":552,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=55>松坊</tips>は何度同じネタでからかっても同じように照れて赤面するあたりに、からかい甲斐がある。","en":"No matter how many times I used the same joke on <tips=55>Matsu</tips>, she turned red with embarrassment in exactly the same way. That was what made her so much fun to tease.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r553","rowIndex":553,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なあ<tips=1>亮</tips>よ、<tips=55>松坊</tips>は一段と美人になったように思えるんだけど、これっておれの気のせいかな？」","en":"“Hey, <tips=1>Ryo</tips>, doesn’t <tips=55>Matsu</tips> look even prettier than before? Or is it just me?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r554","rowIndex":554,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「気のせいだろう」","en":"“You probably are.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r555","rowIndex":555,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　一方、<tips=1>亮</tips>は自分の興味のある話題にはやたらと興奮するくせに、それ以外にはまったく乗ってこないで眠そうにしているだけだから、からかい甲斐というものがない。","en":"For his part, <tips=1>Ryo</tips> grew absurdly excited over subjects that interested him, but responded to everything else by looking sleepy and refusing to engage. There was no pleasure in teasing him.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r556","rowIndex":556,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ど、どうして連絡くれなかったんですか？　こっちに帰って来てる時は連絡をくださいって言っていたじゃないですか」","en":"“W-why didn’t you contact me? I asked you to let me know whenever you came back here.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐松子","displayName":"Matsuko Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r557","rowIndex":557,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=55>松坊</tips>は赤い顔のままむきになって<tips=1>亮</tips>に抗議をする。","en":"Still red in the face, <tips=55>Matsu</tips> protested heatedly to <tips=1>Ryo</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r558","rowIndex":558,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「さっさとアパートに戻るつもりだったんだ。だからここに来るのは予定外だったんだよ」","en":"“I was planning to go straight back to my apartment. I wasn’t expecting to come here.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r559","rowIndex":559,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「うちに寄るのが急だったとしても、<tips=9>Y地区</tips>に戻ってくるのも急だったんですか？　事前に連絡も出来ないくらい？　それはちょっと無理のある言い訳だと思うんですけど」","en":"“Even if stopping by here was last-minute, was coming back to <tips=9>Y District</tips> last-minute too? So last-minute that you couldn’t contact me beforehand? I think that excuse is a bit of a stretch.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐松子","displayName":"Matsuko Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r560","rowIndex":560,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=55>松坊</tips>は頬をふくらませて<tips=1>亮</tips>を睨み付ける。","en":"<tips=55>Matsu</tips> puffed out her cheeks and glared at <tips=1>Ryo</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r561","rowIndex":561,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　確かにもっともだ。<tips=1>亮</tips>はどうやって答えるつもりかと見守っていると、","en":"She had a point. I watched to see how <tips=1>Ryo</tips> would answer.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r562","rowIndex":562,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「他に考えることが一杯あって、連絡をするのがめんどくさかったんだよ」","en":"“I had too many other things to think about. Getting in touch was a hassle.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r563","rowIndex":563,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　言い訳するつもりもないらしい。それに、責められているわりに<tips=1>亮</tips>は横柄な態度だ。こいつは昔からそういうやつなんだ。やたらと尊大で、いかなるときも下手に出るということがない。<tips=55>松坊</tips>も<tips=55>松坊</tips>で、","en":"Apparently, he was not even trying to make excuses. And for someone being taken to task, <tips=1>Ryo</tips> was awfully arrogant about it. He had always been that way—ridiculously full of himself, never willing to humble himself before anyone under any circumstances. But <tips=55>Matsu</tips> was still <tips=55>Matsu</tips>...","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r564","rowIndex":564,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「めんどくさいなんて、困ります。これじゃあ、あり合わせのものでしかご飯が作れません……」","en":"“You can’t just say you couldn’t be bothered. Now I’ll only be able to make dinner with whatever we have on hand...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐松子","displayName":"Matsuko Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r565","rowIndex":565,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　と、かなり酷いことを言われているにもかかわらず、ただ困っている。","en":"Even after he had been that rude to her, she only looked troubled.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r566","rowIndex":566,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まあいいよ。普通のでいいんだ」","en":"“That’s fine. The usual will do.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r567","rowIndex":567,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>はあくまで上からものを言う。別に相手が女性だからというわけじゃない。男でも、大人でも、こいつはいつもこうだ。","en":"<tips=1>Ryo</tips> continued to talk down to her. It was not because she was a woman. He was always like this with men, with adults—with everyone.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r568","rowIndex":568,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　本人たちがそれで納得しているのならいいが、相変わらずよくわからん関係性の二人だ。","en":"If the two of them were both fine with it, then I supposed it was fine. But theirs was still a relationship I could not make head or tail of.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r569","rowIndex":569,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　昔から<tips=54>汐さん</tips>を父のように慕っている<tips=1>亮</tips>は、勿論<tips=55>松坊</tips>とは兄妹のように親しい関係で……いや、むしろそれ以上に親密だ。少なくともおれは、<tips=1>亮</tips>に<tips=55>松坊</tips>よりも親しくしている異性がいるなんて聞いたこともない。","en":"<tips=1>Ryo</tips> had looked up to <tips=54>Mr. Shio</tips> like a father ever since he was little, so naturally he and <tips=55>Matsu</tips> were as close as brother and sister... No, closer than that. At least, I had never heard of <tips=1>Ryo</tips> being closer to any other woman than he was to <tips=55>Matsu</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r570","rowIndex":570,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　が、その接し方はいつも<tips=1>亮</tips>の方が一方的に何かを言い、<tips=55>松坊</tips>はそれに従順に従っている。そういう力関係が出来てしまってるんだろうか？","en":"Yet whenever they were together, <tips=1>Ryo</tips> did all the talking and <tips=55>Matsu</tips> meekly went along with whatever he said. Had that simply become the balance of power between them?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r571","rowIndex":571,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=55>松坊</tips>は優良企業<tips=70>シオクリーン</tips>の令嬢で、この辺りではなかなか尊重される立場なんだけれども、そういったプライドを見せることはない。いつも素直で、本気で怒ったところはおれも見たことがない。","en":"As the daughter of the owner of the successful <tips=70>Shio Clean</tips>, <tips=55>Matsu</tips> had a fair amount of standing around here. Yet she never showed any pride about it. She was always sweet and straightforward, and I had never once seen her truly angry.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r572","rowIndex":572,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それじゃあ、出来る限りがんばって、なんとか作ります」","en":"“Then I’ll do the best I can and see what I can put together.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐松子","displayName":"Matsuko Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r573","rowIndex":573,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=55>松坊</tips>は自信なさげに言う。","en":"<tips=55>Matsu</tips> said it without much confidence.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r574","rowIndex":574,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なあ、今日の飯はなんだ？」","en":"“So, what are we having today?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r575","rowIndex":575,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そこへ<tips=54>汐さん</tips>が空気を読まないマイペースな言葉を投げかけると、<tips=55>松坊</tips>は、","en":"Then <tips=54>Mr. Shio</tips>, oblivious to the mood as ever, asked in his own unhurried way. <tips=55>Matsu</tips> answered,","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r576","rowIndex":576,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ハンバーグと、きんぴらごぼうとひややっこです……」","en":"“Hamburger steak, kinpira burdock, and chilled tofu...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐松子","displayName":"Matsuko Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r577","rowIndex":577,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　恥ずかしそうにうつむいた。","en":"She lowered her head in embarrassment.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r578","rowIndex":578,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「こんなにお客さんがいると知っていたら、もっと贅沢なものを用意したのに……」","en":"“If I had known we would have so many guests, I would have prepared something more extravagant...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐松子","displayName":"Matsuko Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r579","rowIndex":579,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おれはハンバーグと聞いてさっきの虎を切り刻んだシーンを思い出し、内心穏やかではなかったが、","en":"The mention of hamburger steak brought back the sight of the tiger being chopped to pieces, which made me more than a little queasy. Even so,","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r580","rowIndex":580,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いいじゃないか。そういう家庭料理が一番なんだよ」","en":"“Sounds great to me. Home cooking like that is the best!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r581","rowIndex":581,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　と胸を張って言った。","en":"I declared, puffing out my chest.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r582","rowIndex":582,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして<tips=55>松坊</tips>がキッチンへ去ってから、","en":"After <tips=55>Matsu</tips> went into the kitchen,","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r583","rowIndex":583,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なあ、やっぱり<tips=55>松坊</tips>、本当に可愛くなってないか？　こんな感じの子だったっけ」","en":"“Hey, don’t you think <tips=55>Matsu</tips> really has gotten prettier? Was she always like this?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r584","rowIndex":584,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そう<tips=1>亮</tips>に耳打ちしたが、彼は、","en":"I whispered to <tips=1>Ryo</tips>, but all he said was,","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r585","rowIndex":585,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうかなあ」","en":"“Has she?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r586","rowIndex":586,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　と気のない返事をするばかりだった。","en":"He sounded utterly uninterested.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r587","rowIndex":587,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おれと<tips=1>亮</tips>は、そこで遅めの昼食を頂いてから社長宅を出た。","en":"<tips=1>Ryo</tips> and I ate a late lunch there, then left the president’s house.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r588","rowIndex":588,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おれたちは並んで<tips=57>滑走路通り</tips>の方へ歩き始めた。","en":"We began walking side by side toward <tips=57>Runway Street</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r589","rowIndex":589,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=55>松坊</tips>が作ったハンバーグは絶品だった。","en":"The hamburger steak <tips=55>Matsu</tips> had made was exquisite.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r590","rowIndex":590,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　つなぎを使わない挽肉だけで作った本格的な製法は、<tips=54>汐さん</tips>の趣味か、<tips=1>亮</tips>の趣味か。ニンジンや玉ねぎが入っていたり、豆腐やおからがはいっているやつとは趣が違う、いかにも肉料理を食ったという食べ応えがあるハンバーグで、火加減も絶妙で噛むと肉汁があふれ出た。","en":"Was the authentic recipe—pure ground meat, with no binder—<tips=54>Mr. Shio’s</tips> preference, or <tips=1>Ryo’s</tips>? It was a world away from hamburger steaks padded with carrots and onions or mixed with tofu and okara. This one had the hearty, unmistakably meaty substance of a proper meat dish. It was cooked to perfection, and every bite released a flood of juices.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r591","rowIndex":591,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　別の時に喰ったなら大変満足がいったのだろうけれど、あいにくその時おれは、どうにもあのスプラッターシーンが脳裏にちらついて、そのいかにも肉々しい食感は気色悪いものとしか感じられず、非常にもったいなかった。","en":"At any other time, I would have loved it. Unfortunately, that splatter scene kept flashing through my mind, and its intensely meaty texture only made me feel sick. What a waste.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r592","rowIndex":592,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　食べた後でもまだ吐き気のような胸のむかつきが収まらない。<tips=1>亮</tips>にはそんな感性はないらしく、しれっとした顔をしている。おれが不必要に繊細なのかもしれないけれど、やっぱりこいつもちょっとおかしいと思う。","en":"Even after eating, the nausea churning in my stomach would not go away. <tips=1>Ryo</tips> apparently had no such sensitivity; he looked completely unfazed. Maybe I was just being oversensitive, but I still could not help thinking there was something a little wrong with him.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r593","rowIndex":593,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なんだ気分が悪いのか。気分が悪いのに無理して食べるからだ」","en":"“What, you feel sick? That’s what you get for forcing yourself to eat when you’re not feeling well.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r594","rowIndex":594,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　隣を歩く<tips=1>亮</tips>は冷たく言う。内心納得は出来ないが、反論したところで無駄だ。そんなのはおれもよく分かっている。","en":"<tips=1>Ryo</tips> said coldly as he walked beside me. I was not convinced, but I knew there was no point arguing.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r595","rowIndex":595,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「人が出してくれた料理を残すなんて、おれには出来ない相談だな。……なあ、それよりもさ、<tips=1>亮</tips>ってさ、子供の時から<tips=54>汐さん</tips>とあんなふうに拾った生物のこととか調べたりしてたのか？」","en":"“Leaving food someone made for me just isn’t something I can do. ...Anyway, <tips=1>Ryo</tips>, have you and <tips=54>Mr. Shio</tips> been investigating creatures you found like that ever since you were a kid?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r596","rowIndex":596,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「うん」","en":"“Yes.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r597","rowIndex":597,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「お前が大学に行ったのって、<tips=54>汐さん</tips>の影響があるんかねえ？」","en":"“Do you think <tips=54>Mr. Shio</tips> had something to do with why you went to university?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r598","rowIndex":598,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なくはないだろう。子供の頃から仲が良かったし。……というか、僕は子供の頃からこういう風に生きたかったんだぜ？　進学したときみんなびっくりしたけれど、なんで驚いたのかわからない。何も隠してなんかいなかったろう？　常に、この広大無辺の世界の不思議や奥深さに対する賞賛を口にしていたじゃないか。そしてこの街はクソだって」","en":"“I suppose he did. We’ve been close since I was a kid. ...But really, I’ve wanted to live this way ever since I was a kid. Everyone was so surprised when I went on to university, and I never understood why. It’s not as though I kept it a secret, is it? I was always going on about the wonders and unfathomable depths of this vast, boundless world—and about how this town was shit.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r599","rowIndex":599,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうかなあ。でもお前の言うことってホントだか嘘だかわからないからな。お前、人をからかうために変なことを言いすぎなんだよ」","en":"“Maybe, but with you, nobody can ever tell what’s true and what’s a lie. You say way too much weird stuff just to mess with people.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r600","rowIndex":600,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おれが事実を指摘してやると、<tips=1>亮</tips>は不本意だという風に眉間にしわをよせ、","en":"When I pointed out that simple fact, <tips=1>Ryo</tips> furrowed his brow as though he did not much care to hear it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r601","rowIndex":601,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「やっぱり、この街の連中とは話があわない」","en":"“I knew it. I just can’t see eye to eye with the people in this town.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r602","rowIndex":602,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そう言うなよ。だってさ、みんな<tips=1>菅原亮</tips>は街の住人の一人として生きてゆくと信じてたんよ。クソだクソだ言いながらも、ここで一緒にさ。本当にぷいっと出て行ってそれっきりだなんて思わないじゃないか」","en":"“Don’t say that. Everyone thought <tips=1>Ryo Sugawara</tips> would go on living here as one of us. You kept calling the place shit, sure, but we thought you’d stay here with us. Nobody expected you to just up and leave and never come back.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r603","rowIndex":603,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「僕はそんなふうに思ったことはないな」","en":"“I never thought of it that way.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝<tips=1>亮</tips>","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r604","rowIndex":604,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>は顔を顰めて、","en":"With a grimace, <tips=1>Ryo</tips> said,","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r605","rowIndex":605,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「みんなと肌が合うなんて一度も思ったことはない。みんなも僕のことを信頼なんかしてなかったろう」","en":"“I never once felt like I fit in with any of them. And none of them ever trusted me, did they?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r606","rowIndex":606,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「またそんなこと言って」","en":"“There you go again, talking like that.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r607","rowIndex":607,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おれも顔を顰めて、","en":"I grimaced too and said,","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r608","rowIndex":608,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「今日も<tips=66>コンタ</tips>が、もしお前がいればなあって言ってたところだぞ。またさあ、おれとお前で組んで、何かやろうぜ」","en":"“<tips=66>Konta</tips> was just saying today how he wished you were here. Come on—let’s you and me team up again and do something.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r609","rowIndex":609,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ごめんだね。<tips=71>グレートホール饅頭</tips>売りとかいうよくわからない仕事なんかしたくない。大体、僕は人の上に立つ役割は向いていないんだ。自分でもわかってる。好きなことを勝手に考えて、勝手に行動をするほうが向いてる」","en":"“No thanks. I don’t want some weird job I don’t understand selling <tips=71>Great Hole Buns</tips>. Besides, I’m not cut out to be in charge of people. I know that. I’m better off thinking whatever I like and doing whatever I like, on my own.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r610","rowIndex":610,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=71>グレートホール饅頭</tips>はかなり重要な仕事なんだぞ？　よくわからないってのは失礼だな」","en":"“Selling <tips=71>Great Hole Buns</tips> is pretty important work, you know. Calling it something you don’t understand is rude.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r611","rowIndex":611,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうか。それはごめん」","en":"“Oh. Sorry.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r612","rowIndex":612,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　素直に謝られるとおれも調子が狂う。","en":"When he apologized so readily, it threw me off my stride.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r613","rowIndex":613,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……まあいいや、<tips=1>亮</tips>。とりあえず、今の生活は楽しいかい？」","en":"“...Well, never mind, <tips=1>Ryo</tips>. Are you happy with your life now?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r614","rowIndex":614,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「楽しいよ」","en":"“Yeah.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r615","rowIndex":615,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>はこくりと頷く。","en":"<tips=1>Ryo</tips> gave a small nod.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r616","rowIndex":616,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まあ、それならいいさ。ただ、この街に存在する何かから逃げてその道を選んだってのなら、絶対後悔するだろうけどね」","en":"“Well, then that’s all right. But if you chose that path because you were running away from something in this town, you’re going to regret it for sure.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r617","rowIndex":617,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いやなことを言う」","en":"“What a nasty thing to say.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r618","rowIndex":618,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>はしかめっつらを作って言う。","en":"<tips=1>Ryo</tips> spoke with a scowl.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r619","rowIndex":619,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「言われなくたって、僕は一番やりたいことだけをやるさ。一度きりの人生なんだからね」","en":"“You don’t have to tell me. I’m going to do the one thing I want to do more than anything else. You only get one life.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r620","rowIndex":620,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうだな。それは同感だ。だからおれはこの街を良くしたいと思って……いや、その話はもうやめよう」","en":"“Right. I agree. That’s why I want to make this town a better place... No, let’s drop it.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r621","rowIndex":621,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おれは肩をすくめた。","en":"I shrugged.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r622","rowIndex":622,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「お前は今日これからどうするんだ？」","en":"“What are you going to do for the rest of today?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r623","rowIndex":623,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おれたちは並んで歩いていた。","en":"We walked side by side.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r624","rowIndex":624,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>はこれからホテルに帰るらしい。おれはバーバラの店先の饅頭売り場に戻らないといけない。<tips=66>コンタ</tips>からメールが何通も届いてた。売り物の<tips=71>グレートホール饅頭</tips>をほったらかしにしてたのをすっかり忘れていたんだ。あれを片付けなければ。","en":"Apparently, <tips=1>Ryo</tips> was heading back to his hotel. I needed to get back to the bun stand outside Barbara’s shop. <tips=66>Konta</tips> had sent me message after message. I had completely forgotten I had abandoned the <tips=71>Great Hole Buns</tips> we were supposed to be selling. I had to go pack everything up.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r625","rowIndex":625,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=57>滑走路通り</tips>はもう落ち着いているかな？　虎のせいで滅茶苦茶になっていたけれど。","en":"Had <tips=57>Runway Street</tips> settled down by now? The tiger had left it in chaos.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r626","rowIndex":626,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しかし、もし<tips=1>亮</tips>が来ないであの虎とおれが戦っていたらどうなっていたんだろう。","en":"But what would have happened if <tips=1>Ryo</tips> had not shown up and I had had to fight that tiger myself?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r627","rowIndex":627,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　勝てたかな？　それとも、負けておれが食われていたんだろうか。もし食われていたら、今こうして歩いていることもなかったということか。まあそう考えれば、<tips=1>亮</tips>のやり方が良かったんだろうな。釈然とはしないけれども。","en":"Could I have won? Or would I have lost and been eaten? If it had eaten me, I would not be walking here now. Put that way, I suppose <tips=1>Ryo’s</tips> approach was the right one. It still did not sit right with me, though.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r628","rowIndex":628,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そういえば、<tips=1>亮</tips>、ふと思い出したんだけれどさ」","en":"“Oh, that reminds me, <tips=1>Ryo</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r629","rowIndex":629,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なに？」","en":"“What?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r630","rowIndex":630,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あのさあ、おれの能力のこと『サイコソード』と呼ぶの、もう二度としないでくれないかなあ」","en":"“Listen, could you do me a favor and never call my power ‘Psycho-Sword’ again?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r631","rowIndex":631,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なんで？」","en":"“Why not?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r632","rowIndex":632,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「だって恥ずかしいだろ」","en":"“Because it’s embarrassing.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r633","rowIndex":633,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「じゃあ、『エクスカリバー』か？　それとも、『ファイナルエアカッター』と言えばいいのか？」","en":"“Then what about ‘Excalibur’? Or should I call it ‘Final Air Cutter’?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r634","rowIndex":634,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そ、それもやめろ」","en":"“D-don’t call it those, either.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r635","rowIndex":635,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なんだよ。お前がそう呼べって言ったんじゃないか」","en":"“What are you talking about? You told me to call it that.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r636","rowIndex":636,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「十四とか十五くらいの時だろ。もういい加減やめてくれよ……。あの時のおれは途方もなく恥ずかしい存在だったんだ。反省しているんだから、いい加減勘弁してくれないか」","en":"“I was fourteen or fifteen, okay? Let it go already... I was a walking embarrassment back then. I’ve learned my lesson, so can’t you please give me a break?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r637","rowIndex":637,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「仕方ないな。……じゃあ、今はその能力をなんて呼べばいいんだ？」","en":"“Fine... So what do I call it now?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r638","rowIndex":638,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「特に名前はないよ」","en":"“It doesn’t have a name.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r639","rowIndex":639,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……なんだかつまらないな」","en":"“...That’s boring.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r640","rowIndex":640,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>はどこまで本当なのか、残念そうに溜息をつく。","en":"<tips=1>Ryo</tips> sighed in disappointment, though how much of it was sincere I could not tell.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r641","rowIndex":641,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そしてまた沈黙が生まれた。","en":"Silence fell between us once more.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r642","rowIndex":642,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　こうしてこいつと並んで歩くのは久しぶりだったし、今日はいろいろなことがあった。彼に聞かなくてはいけないことや、話さなくてはいけないことは沢山あるはずなんだ。","en":"It had been a long time since we had walked side by side like this, and so much had happened that day. There ought to have been so much I needed to ask him, and so much I needed to tell him.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r643","rowIndex":643,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　だけど、おれは話すためにそれらにうまく順番をつけることが出来なかった。","en":"But I could not figure out how to put any of it in order well enough to talk about it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r644","rowIndex":644,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それに、余計なことは何も話さない方がいいような気もした。","en":"Besides, part of me felt it would be better not to say anything more than I had to.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r645","rowIndex":645,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　話さなくても、同じ少年時代を過ごしたおれたちは、きっと大事なことは共有出来ている。","en":"Even without talking, after spending our boyhood together, surely we still shared the things that mattered.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r646","rowIndex":646,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　気づけば無言のまま<tips=57>滑走路通り</tips>にさしかかろうとしていた。数年前は何もいわなくともまた明日顔を合わせるのがわかっていたけれど今は違う。ここから先には、それぞれに違った『戻るべき場所』が待っている。","en":"Before I knew it, we had almost reached <tips=57>Runway Street</tips> without another word. A few years ago, neither of us had needed to say that we would see each other again tomorrow. Now things were different. From here on, a different ‘place to go back to’ waited for each of us.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r647","rowIndex":647,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　少し寂しいが、それはおれたちが自分の道を見つけたということで、それは素晴らしいことなんだろう。","en":"It was a little sad, but it meant that we had each found our own path. And that was probably something wonderful.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r648","rowIndex":648,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「じゃあな。何か困ったことがあれば連絡しろよ」","en":"“See you. Call me if you need anything.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r649","rowIndex":649,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　別れ際、<tips=57>滑走路通り</tips>の喧噪のなかでおれはそう言った。","en":"I said it as we parted amid the noise of <tips=57>Runway Street</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r650","rowIndex":650,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「わかった。またな」","en":"“All right. See you.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r651","rowIndex":651,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>はそう言ってはにかんだ。","en":"<tips=1>Ryo</tips> said with a shy smile.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r652","rowIndex":652,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして、おれはバーバラの店の方向へ。","en":"And I went toward Barbara’s shop.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r653","rowIndex":653,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>はホテルの方向へ。","en":"<tips=1>Ryo</tips>, toward his hotel.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B1:r654","rowIndex":654,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それぞれ別の道へと別れていった。","en":"We parted, each heading down a different road.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}}]},{"position":4,"code":"A2-1","unitId":"A2-1","rows":[{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r1","rowIndex":1,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　昼頃に僕は連絡をした。相手は研究室のボスだ。","en":"Around noon, I called the head of my lab.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r2","rowIndex":2,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"『どういうことだい？　知り合いの結婚式に行ったんじゃなかったのか？』","en":"“What do you mean? Weren’t you supposed to be attending an acquaintance’s wedding?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r3","rowIndex":3,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　携帯電話の向こうの不機嫌な顔が思い浮かぶような声だった。","en":"His voice was enough to make me picture the displeased face on the other end of the phone.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r4","rowIndex":4,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「父があまりよくない状態でして……」","en":"“My father isn’t doing very well...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r5","rowIndex":5,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"『なるほど、それは大変だな。わかった、落ち着くまでそちらにいると良い。……しかし、残念だな。せっかく、新しい定石を覚えたから試したかったのに』","en":"“I see. That sounds serious. All right, stay there until things settle down. ...Still, that’s a shame. I’d just learned a new joseki and wanted to try it out on you.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r6","rowIndex":6,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「僕は先生と囲碁を打つために研究室に通っているわけじゃないんですけどね」","en":"“I don’t come to the lab just to play Go with you, Professor.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r7","rowIndex":7,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それから彼の研究室で僕がやるはずだったことの引き継ぎなどについて説明をし、電話を切ると、僕は溜息をつく。","en":"I went on to explain the handover of the work I had been due to do in his lab. When I hung up, I sighed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r8","rowIndex":8,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　昨夜ベッドのなかで考えた結果、僕は予定を変更し、この街での滞在時間を伸ばすことにした。","en":"After thinking it over in bed last night, I changed my plans and decided to extend my stay in town.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r9","rowIndex":9,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　まったく、大学では広大な学問の世界が待っているというのに、なぜ僕はこんな小さな街のくだらない問題に頭を悩ませなくてはいけないのか？　こんなつもりではなかったのに。","en":"Honestly. A vast world of scholarship was waiting for me at the university, so why did I have to waste my time worrying over the petty problems of this tiny town? This was not what I had had in mind.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r10","rowIndex":10,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　率直に言って、父の病状は思った以上に悪かった。","en":"Frankly, my father’s condition was worse than I had expected.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r11","rowIndex":11,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　医師の診断がどの程度正確なものかは知るよしもないが、面と向かって話した印象としては今にも死んでしまいそうに感じられた。","en":"I had no way of knowing how accurate the doctor’s diagnosis was, but after speaking with my father face-to-face, I felt he might die at any moment.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r12","rowIndex":12,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　いや、これは僕の感傷の話ではない。独裁者の死は権力の移動を意味するし、その過程において、何かゴタゴタが起こらないともかぎらない。むしろ何も起こらないと考えるほうが不自然だろう。","en":"No, this was not a matter of sentiment on my part. A dictator’s death means a transfer of power, and some kind of trouble could easily arise in the process. In fact, it would be stranger to assume that nothing would happen.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r13","rowIndex":13,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その時重要な当事者の一人であるこの僕が遠く離れているというのは、やはりその後のことを考えると不利になりそうじゃないか。","en":"If I, one of the important parties involved, were far away when that happened, wouldn’t that put me at a disadvantage afterward?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r14","rowIndex":14,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　逆に、巻き込まれるのを恐れてさっさと離れ、この機会に街や血族との繋がりを完全に絶ってしまうという手もなくはないが、妹はこの街に残るのだ。それは出来ない。","en":"On the other hand, I could leave now before I got dragged in and use this chance to sever every tie to the town and my blood relatives for good. But my sister was staying here. I could not do that.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r15","rowIndex":15,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　まあ、ここに居たって、まるきり無為というわけでもない。","en":"Still, it was not as though staying here would be a complete waste.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r16","rowIndex":16,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　何と言っても、あの不死身の虎と出会えたのが良かった。あの肉片を回収しただけでも、この街にいるという不快感が帳消しになる。","en":"Above all, encountering that indestructible tiger had been a stroke of good fortune. Recovering that scrap of flesh alone was enough to cancel out all the unpleasantness of being in this town.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r17","rowIndex":17,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕が大学で手伝っているのも<tips=17>タイプB</tips>に関する研究だ。あの肉片は僕がやりたい研究にとってとても大事な——というより、もしかしたら、僕が大学で<tips=17>タイプB</tips>を研究しようと思った理由の全てが、あの肉片のなかにあるかもしれない。","en":"The research I assist with at the university also concerns <tips=17>Type B</tips>. That scrap of flesh was extremely important to the research I wanted to pursue—or rather, perhaps everything that had led me to study <tips=17>Type B</tips> at the university lay within it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r18","rowIndex":18,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　もしあの組織を大学に持ち帰ったら、みな驚き、喜ぶだろう。そして大学には設備があり、肉片に対して精密な検査が出来るだろう。","en":"If I took the tissue back to the university, everyone would be astonished and delighted. The university also had the equipment to examine it in detail.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r19","rowIndex":19,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　けれど、僕にはそのつもりはなかった。","en":"But I had no intention of doing that.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r20","rowIndex":20,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=54>汐さん</tips>は優秀な科学者だ。","en":"<tips=54>Mr. Shio</tips> is an excellent scientist.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r21","rowIndex":21,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　街の人間のどの程度が覚えているのか知らないが、このゴミ会社の社長は、元々は<tips=8>グレートホール</tips>周辺の生態系を調査するために国立機関から派遣された専門家だったんだ。","en":"I do not know how many people in town remember this, but the president of that waste company had originally been a specialist sent by a national agency to study the ecosystem around the <tips=8>Great Hole</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r22","rowIndex":22,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=9>Y地区</tips>のゴミ処理状況の劣悪さに目を付けて事業で一発当てたけれども、今も彼の本質は研究者だ。事業での膨大な利益を投資して自分のための実験室を用意し、研究に没頭している。","en":"He had recognized the abysmal state of waste disposal in <tips=9>Y District</tips> and made a fortune from it, but at heart he was still a researcher. He poured the immense profits from his business into a private laboratory and immersed himself in his research.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r23","rowIndex":23,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そもそも、研究を独力でおこなうために会社を起こしたような人物なのである。","en":"After all, he was the sort of man who had founded a company so that he could conduct research on his own.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r24","rowIndex":24,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　だが、僕が<tips=54>汐さん</tips>とやりたいのは、彼の科学者としての能力を期待しているからというだけじゃない。言うなればあの肉片は、僕と<tips=54>汐さん</tips>がずっと追い求めてきた疑問を解く鍵なのだ。彼とやる以外の選択肢なんか、はじめから僕には存在しない。","en":"But I wanted to work with <tips=54>Mr. Shio</tips> for more than just his ability as a scientist. That scrap of flesh was, so to speak, the key to a question <tips=54>Mr. Shio</tips> and I had been pursuing all along. Working with anyone else had never even been an option.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r25","rowIndex":25,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"『君の家は、たしか自営業だとか言っていたな。どういう商売なんだ？』","en":"“You said your family ran a business, if I remember correctly. What kind of business is it?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r26","rowIndex":26,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　帰れなくなった事情を重要な部分を隠しながら説明すると、ボスは厄介な好奇心を発揮して来た。","en":"When I explained why I could not return, leaving out the important parts, my boss’s troublesome curiosity reared its head.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r27","rowIndex":27,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ひとくちでは説明出来ませんが……細々としたものを売ったり、ちょっとした手数料を取ったり、まあ地方でなければ成り立たない仕事ですよ……」","en":"“It’s hard to sum up... We sell odds and ends, take small commissions—well, it’s the sort of business that could only survive out in the provinces...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r28","rowIndex":28,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"『ふうん、昔ながらの地域密着型のお店なんだねえ』","en":"“Hmm. An old-fashioned shop rooted in the local community, then.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r29","rowIndex":29,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　我ながらひどい誤魔化しだったが、世事に疎い研究者はそれで納得してくれたらしく、それ以上は追及して来なかった。","en":"It was a terrible evasion even by my standards, but the researcher knew so little of worldly affairs that he seemed satisfied and did not press me any further.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r30","rowIndex":30,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"『とにかく、一通り済んだら学校には戻って来てくれよ。囲碁だって、このまま勝ち逃げされたらたまらんからな』","en":"“Anyway, come back once everything’s settled. I can’t have you walking away while you’re ahead at Go.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r31","rowIndex":31,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　電話を切った後、僕は溜息をついた。","en":"After ending the call, I sighed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r32","rowIndex":32,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　街に戻ると決めた時点では、このような成り行きは想像していなかった。","en":"When I decided to come back to town, I had never imagined things would turn out like this.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r33","rowIndex":33,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　何を言われても、式が終わったらさっさと帰るつもりだったんだ。たとえ、父親が瀕死だろうとも、振り切るつもりだったんだ。","en":"No matter what anyone said, I had intended to leave as soon as the ceremony was over. Even if my father was dying, I had meant to tear myself away.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r34","rowIndex":34,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しかし、まさか妹の話まで持ち出されるとは思わなかった。いや、少し考えれば予測し得たのかもしれないが、あまりこの街のことについて考えたくはなかったんだ。せっかく離れられたのに、煩わされたくなかった。","en":"But I had never imagined they would bring up my sister. No—if I had given it a little thought, perhaps I could have foreseen it, but I had not wanted to think about this town at all. After finally getting away, I did not want it bothering me again.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r35","rowIndex":35,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しかし、そのせいで気持ちの準備が出来なかったのを思うと、少し後悔をした。","en":"But now that my refusal to think about it had left me so unprepared, I regretted that decision a little.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r36","rowIndex":36,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　重苦しい溜息をついて、僕は<tips=54>汐さん</tips>に電話をかけた。","en":"With a heavy sigh, I called <tips=54>Mr. Shio</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r37","rowIndex":37,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　今僕の心を浮き立たせるのは、あの不思議な肉片だけだ。","en":"The only thing that lifted my spirits now was that mysterious scrap of flesh.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r38","rowIndex":38,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しかし電話は繋がらない。本業に出ているのかもしれないし、充電が切れているのかもしれない。虎の出所について調べてくれるとも言ってくれたが、その調査を行っているのかもしれない。","en":"But the call would not go through. He might have been out attending to his regular work, or his battery might have died. He had also said he would investigate where the tiger came from; perhaps that was what he was doing.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r39","rowIndex":39,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　メールで折り返しの連絡を催促する文章を送ると、当面僕のすることはなくなった。","en":"I sent him a message asking him to call me back. For the moment, that left me with nothing to do.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r40","rowIndex":40,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そこで少し外に出て街でも見ようかと思ったところで、『あれ』の来る前兆が訪れた。","en":"I was just thinking I might go outside and look around town when the first warning that ‘it’ was coming arrived.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r41","rowIndex":41,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　外出を取りやめ、ソファーにもたれてじっとしていると、案の定『あれ』がやって来る。","en":"I gave up on going out and sat motionless against the sofa. Sure enough, ‘that’ came.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r42","rowIndex":42,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　抗いようのない闇が僕の意識を覆い、強制切断させる。","en":"An irresistible darkness covered my consciousness and shut it down by force.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r43","rowIndex":43,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ここ数ヶ月、僕は数日に一度くらいのペースで、どうしようもない睡魔に襲われて眠りに落ちてしまう。それは普通の眠りとは違って、揺すっても水をかけてもちっとも目を覚まさない、ほとんど昏睡と言って良いような深い深い眠りだった。","en":"For the past several months, once every few days, I had been overcome by an irresistible drowsiness and fallen asleep. It was nothing like ordinary sleep. No amount of shaking or dousing with water would wake me; it was a deep, deep sleep that could almost be called a coma.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r44","rowIndex":44,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　寝起きがやたらと悪いやつというのはよく居て、自分はかねがねそういう連中をなんて意志の弱いやつだと軽んじていたのだけれども、あれは僕が悪かった。いつのまにか、僕の方がひどいねぼすけになってしまっている。","en":"There are plenty of people who are terribly difficult to wake, and I had always looked down on them as weak-willed. I was wrong about that. Before I knew it, I had become a worse sleepyhead than any of them.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r45","rowIndex":45,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　一時間もしないで自然と目を覚ますほんの短い眠りなのだが、何しろその睡魔は突然やって来て、暴力的に僕の意識を落としてしまう。","en":"It was only a short sleep—I always woke on my own within an hour—but the drowsiness came without warning and knocked me unconscious with brute force.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r46","rowIndex":46,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして眠っている間は全くの無抵抗となってしまうわけで、なんというか、生き物として酷い欠陥だ。","en":"And while I slept, I was utterly defenseless. However I tried to put it, that was a terrible defect in a living creature.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r47","rowIndex":47,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　サバンナの野生動物ならばすぐに命を落としてしまうだろう。","en":"Any wild animal on the savanna would be dead in no time.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r48","rowIndex":48,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　サバンナの野生動物でなくて良かった。けれども、現代社会で暮らすホモサピエンスでも、これはこれで不便だ。","en":"It was a good thing I was not a wild animal on the savanna. Still, even for a Homo sapiens living in modern society, it was inconvenient in its own way.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r49","rowIndex":49,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　医者に言わせるとナルコレプシーでもないらしい。かといって原因もわからない。どんな検査をしても何の異常も見つからないのだ。","en":"The doctor said it did not seem to be narcolepsy. But no one knew the cause, either. Every test came back normal.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r50","rowIndex":50,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　原因ははっきりしない。心因性かもしれないが、そうでもないような気もする。——何しろ、<tips=16>タイプA</tips>とかいうどう考えてもこれまでの科学では説明のつかない能力者がやたらと増えて、同時に原因不明の奇病も大量に発生した。医学の定説は至る所で崩壊してしまっており、医者もわけがわからなくなっている。","en":"The cause remained unclear. It might have been psychogenic, but I had a feeling it was not. After all, people known as <tips=16>Type A</tips>—ability users whose powers plainly defied explanation by existing science—had proliferated wildly, while mysterious new diseases had broken out in great numbers. Accepted medical wisdom was collapsing everywhere, and doctors no longer knew what to make of any of it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r51","rowIndex":51,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　何でもなければいいが、新手の難病なのかもしれない。別に特別なことではない。いまこの社会には、新手の難病はあまりにもありふれている。","en":"I hoped it was nothing, but it might be some new intractable disease. That was nothing extraordinary. New intractable diseases had become all too common in society today.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r52","rowIndex":52,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　これだけの症状で終わるのか、それとももっと重篤な何かに変わるのか、そんなものは神にしかわからない。心配をしていても無駄なのだ。","en":"Whether the symptoms would end there or develop into something far more serious—only God knew. Worrying was pointless.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r53","rowIndex":53,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　とにかく、その特別な睡魔からはどうやっても逃れることが出来ない。","en":"In any case, no matter what I did, there was no escaping that peculiar drowsiness.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r54","rowIndex":54,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　強制的に意識をオフにされてしまう前に、僕が出来るのはベッドに潜り込むことだけだ。","en":"All I could do before my consciousness was forcibly switched off was crawl into bed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r55","rowIndex":55,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして眠りにつくと、目が覚めるまで現実だと信じて疑わないような、やけにリアルな夢を見た。","en":"And once I fell asleep, I would have an uncannily realistic dream—one I never doubted was real until I woke.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r56","rowIndex":56,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それから目を醒ますと部屋は暗く、時計を見るともう夜になっている。","en":"When I woke again, the room was dark. I looked at the clock: it was already night.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r57","rowIndex":57,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　寝起き時はいつも体がひどく重いが、眠気が残っていてまた眠りたくなるというようなことはない。","en":"On waking, my body was always terribly heavy, but no drowsiness lingered to make me want to go back to sleep.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r58","rowIndex":58,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=4>馬明</tips>が手配してくれたこのホテルは街の一等地にある小綺麗なホテルで、<tips=9>Y地区</tips>特有のトラブルに巻き込まれたくないビジネスマンや観光客がよく利用するらしい。","en":"The hotel <tips=4>Ma Ming</tips> had arranged for me was a neat little place in one of the best parts of town. Apparently, business travelers and tourists who wanted no part of the troubles peculiar to <tips=9>Y District</tips> often stayed there.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r59","rowIndex":59,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　店員はみなノーマルで、日本語の他に、英語と北京語が通じると公式にうたっている。料理は中華、フレンチ、和食から選べ、アレルギーや宗教上の禁忌にも幅広く対応してくれるそうだ。","en":"Every member of the staff was a Normal, and the hotel officially advertised service in Japanese, English, and Mandarin. Guests could choose Chinese, French, or Japanese cuisine, and the kitchen would reportedly accommodate a wide range of allergies and religious dietary restrictions.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r60","rowIndex":60,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　部屋は狭めだが、家具や内装は悪くはない。","en":"The room was rather small, but the furniture and decor were not bad.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r61","rowIndex":61,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕の部屋は最上階の一つ下で、窓からは<tips=9>Y地区</tips>の夜景が見える。","en":"My room was one floor below the top, and its window offered a nighttime view of <tips=9>Y District</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r62","rowIndex":62,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　夜に外に出るのは正直気が進まないのだが、ずっとホテルに籠もりきりも気分が悪い。夕食は外に出ようか？　そして、昨日泣かしてしまって、今も落ち込んでいるに違いない妹のためにプレゼントでも探してやるのがいいだろう。","en":"To be honest, I did not relish going out at night, but being cooped up in the hotel indefinitely felt unpleasant too. Perhaps I should go out for dinner—and find a present for my sister, whom I had made cry yesterday and who was surely still upset.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r63","rowIndex":63,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　外出の準備をしていたところで電話があった。","en":"Just as I was getting ready to go out, the phone rang.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r64","rowIndex":64,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　今日は出かけようとすると何かと邪魔が入る日だ。","en":"Today seemed determined to put something in my way every time I tried to leave.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r65","rowIndex":65,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"『これから出られないか？』","en":"“Can you come out now?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r66","rowIndex":66,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　かけてきたのは案の定<tips=4>馬明</tips>だった。","en":"As expected, the caller was <tips=4>Ma Ming</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r67","rowIndex":67,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　今から<tips=41>グランドタワー</tips>で<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>幹部による会議を兼ねた定例会食が行われるらしい。そこに参加をしないか、というのだ。","en":"Apparently, a regular dinner for senior <tips=7>YS</tips> officers—part social meal, part meeting—was about to begin at the <tips=41>Grand Tower</tips>. He wanted me to attend.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r68","rowIndex":68,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その重い口調からすると、どうも気軽に挨拶をしてみたらというような安易なものではなく、何か切実な理由があるように察せられた。","en":"From the gravity of his tone, I gathered that this was no casual suggestion that I drop by and introduce myself. There seemed to be some urgent reason behind it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r69","rowIndex":69,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どうして僕が？」","en":"“Why me?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r70","rowIndex":70,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>に介入するのはあまり気は進まない。","en":"I had little desire to involve myself in <tips=7>YS</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r71","rowIndex":71,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"『まあ、来ればわかる』","en":"“Come and you’ll see.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r72","rowIndex":72,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　いやな言い方だ。どういうつもりか想像がついて、ほとんど断りの言葉が喉元まで浮かんだが、すんでのところで飲み込んだ。","en":"I hated the way he put that. I could guess what he was up to, and a refusal rose almost to my lips, but at the last second I swallowed it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r73","rowIndex":73,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その会食には<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>の有力な幹部が全て集まる。","en":"All of <tips=7>YS’s</tips> most powerful officers would be at that dinner.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r74","rowIndex":74,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　瀕死の<tips=81>龍頭</tips>を前に、彼らがどんな雰囲気でいるのか、それを見ておくのは僕や妹の将来のためには必要なことだろう。この会食に参加することによって、さらに状況から抜け出せなくなるような気もしたが、どうせ僕がこの血を継いでいる以上完全に無関係というわけにはいかないのだ。","en":"With the <tips=81>Longtou</tips> at death’s door, I needed to see what the mood among them was like for the sake of my sister’s future and mine. I had a feeling attending would only entangle me more deeply, but as long as this blood ran in my veins, I could never be entirely uninvolved.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r75","rowIndex":75,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　会食の開始まであまり時間がないということで、<tips=4>馬明</tips>に車を差し向けてもらうのではなく、ホテルの前でタクシーを拾った。","en":"There was little time before the dinner began, so rather than have <tips=4>Ma Ming</tips> send a car, I hailed a taxi in front of the hotel.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r76","rowIndex":76,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　走り出してから行き先を<tips=41>グランドタワー</tips>と言うと、それまで陽気に軽口などを叩いていたタクシー運転手がそれ以降ぎこちない表情と口調で対応するようになり、僕は複雑な気分になってしまう。","en":"Once the taxi was underway, I told the driver my destination was the <tips=41>Grand Tower</tips>. Until then he had been making cheerful small talk, but from that point on his expression and tone turned stiff, leaving me with mixed feelings.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r77","rowIndex":77,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　会食は<tips=41>グランドタワー</tips>の中層にある会食室で行われる。","en":"The dinner was to be held in a dining room on one of the middle floors of the <tips=41>Grand Tower</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r78","rowIndex":78,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そこは文字通り来客などを食事でもてなすための部屋だが、父は重要な会談も食事や酒を楽しみながら行うことを好むため、実際には会議室や応接室と似たような使われ方をしているのだと<tips=4>馬明</tips>が説明する。","en":"As its name suggested, it was a room for entertaining guests over a meal. But my father liked to conduct important discussions while enjoying food and drink, so in practice it served much the same purpose as a conference room or reception room, <tips=4>Ma Ming</tips> explained.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r79","rowIndex":79,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　まだ出席者は誰も来ていなかった。テーブルにはナプキンや食器が一人ごとに並べられている。","en":"None of the attendees had arrived yet. Napkins and tableware had been arranged around the table, one setting for each person.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r80","rowIndex":80,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕はそうした会食の席に着かず、壁際に置いてあった予備の椅子に腰掛けた。","en":"Rather than take one of those places, I sat in a spare chair against the wall.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r81","rowIndex":81,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どうしてそんな端っこに座るんだよ」","en":"“Why are you sitting way over there?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r82","rowIndex":82,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=4>馬明</tips>が怪訝そうに顔を顰めたが、","en":"<tips=4>Ma Ming</tips> frowned in puzzlement, but...","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r83","rowIndex":83,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「僕はここでいいんだよ」","en":"“I’m fine here.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r84","rowIndex":84,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　と一言返しただけで理由は口にしなかった。","en":"I gave no reason beyond that brief reply.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r85","rowIndex":85,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕としてはこうして同じ席につかないことで、会議の参加者と同格の立場でここにいるのではなく、あくまでも組織の外の人間としてここに来ているのだという意志表示のつもりだった。","en":"By refusing to sit at the same table, I meant to signal that I was not there as an equal participant in the meeting, but strictly as someone from outside the organization.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r86","rowIndex":86,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　変に刺激したくなかったのである。","en":"I did not want to provoke them unnecessarily.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r87","rowIndex":87,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　もっとも、今この場に僕が現れたというだけで、どんな態度をとろうと色々と想像させてしまうだろうが、それは致し方ないことだ。","en":"Of course, my mere appearance here would invite all manner of speculation no matter how I behaved, but that could not be helped.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r88","rowIndex":88,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　開始の時間が近づくと、参加者たちが続々と集まってくる。","en":"As the starting time drew near, the participants began arriving one after another.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r89","rowIndex":89,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　最初に姿を現したのは<tips=35>ジョゼ・フェルナンデス</tips>。","en":"The first to appear was <tips=35>José Fernandes</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r90","rowIndex":90,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=36>アウロラ</tips>をはじめとする美人三姉妹の父だが、娘たちの年齢のわりには随分と年を取っており、褐色の肌には樹皮のようなしわがきざまれ、髪の毛は白いものが目立つ。","en":"He was the father of the three beautiful sisters, <tips=36>Aurora</tips> among them, but he seemed remarkably old for a man with daughters their age. His brown skin was scored with wrinkles like tree bark, and the white in his hair stood out prominently.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r91","rowIndex":91,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼はブラジルを中心とした南米からの移民を一手に引き受けるリーダーだ。","en":"He was the leader who single-handedly looked after the town’s immigrants from South America, chiefly Brazil.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r92","rowIndex":92,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　この街の南米移民はそれなりに規模の大きい集団だが、長期定住者はさほどではない。一時的に本国から<tips=9>Y地区</tips>にやって来て、ある程度稼いだら帰ってゆくような若者が多いのだ。そういう人々に、この地での仕事を紹介するのが彼がこの街で昔から担っている役割である。","en":"The town’s South American immigrants formed a sizable community, but relatively few settled for the long term. Many were young people who came from their home countries to <tips=9>Y District</tips>, earned some money, then went home again. His long-standing role in town was to find work for people like them.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r93","rowIndex":93,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　わずかに売春の斡旋を行っているが、それ以外は、いわゆる非合法的な活動はほとんど行っていない。<tips=57>滑走路通り</tips>やその北側の地域で飲食店、クリーニング店などを多数経営していて、そちらが主な収入源だった。彼のグループは元々同国人の互助会的なものであったが、今もその方針がそのまま継続している。<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>のなかでおよそもっともギャングらしくない一派である。","en":"He did broker prostitution on a small scale, but otherwise engaged in virtually nothing that could be called illegal. He operated numerous restaurants, dry cleaners, and other businesses on <tips=57>Runway Street</tips> and to its north, and those were his main source of income. His group had begun as a mutual-aid association for his countrymen, and it still followed the same principles. It was probably the least gang-like faction in <tips=7>YS</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r94","rowIndex":94,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ほぼ同国人だけでまとまっているために結束が強く、個人の気性も荒いものが多いが、他のグループとの対立は少ない。","en":"Because it was composed almost entirely of his fellow countrymen, the group was tightly knit, and many of its members were hot-tempered. Even so, it seldom came into conflict with other groups.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r95","rowIndex":95,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=81>龍頭</tips>である<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>が頭角をあらわすよりも古くから<tips=9>Y地区</tips>の顔役の一人であり、温厚で誠実な人柄から、同国人以外からも尊敬をあつめる存在だ。","en":"He had been one of the prominent figures in <tips=9>Y District</tips> since before <tips=81>Longtou</tips> <tips=3>Chris Tse</tips> rose to power. His mild and sincere character won him respect even among people who were not his countrymen.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r96","rowIndex":96,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕も昔から知っているが親しいというわけでもなく、さほど会話をしたことがない。南米の人間は陽気なイメージがあるが、彼は寡黙で厳格であり、時間にも正確で、今日もこうして最初にやって来た。","en":"I had known him for years, but we were not close and had barely spoken. I tended to picture South Americans as cheerful, but he was taciturn and stern. He was punctual, too, and today he had once again arrived first.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r97","rowIndex":97,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　普段はいつもTシャツに動きやすそうなズボンをあわせたラフな格好だが、こうした場では清潔なスーツを身につけて来るようだ。年齢と経験に裏打ちされた重厚な雰囲気があり、こうして正装をしているといかにも重鎮といった風格がある。","en":"He ordinarily dressed casually in a T-shirt and trousers that looked easy to move in, but for an occasion like this, he apparently wore a neat suit. He possessed the gravity born of age and experience, and in formal dress looked every inch an elder statesman.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r98","rowIndex":98,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　部下も連れずに単身であらわれた彼は、僕の方をじろりと見たが何も言わなかった。","en":"He had appeared alone, without any subordinates. He gave me a hard look but said nothing.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r99","rowIndex":99,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「社会見学をしに来ました」","en":"“I’m here on a field trip.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r100","rowIndex":100,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕の方から説明しても、小さく頷いただけで、すぐに中央の席についた。","en":"When I explained myself, he merely gave a small nod, then promptly took a seat near the center.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r101","rowIndex":101,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　次にあらわれたのは、髪の毛を長く伸ばした色白の男である。目が血走って、唇が赤い。","en":"The next arrival was a pale man who wore his hair long. His eyes were bloodshot, his lips red.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r102","rowIndex":102,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　この人物は<tips=33>壬生屋タカシ</tips>だろう。","en":"This was probably <tips=33>Takashi Mibuya</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r103","rowIndex":103,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=59>暗闇通り</tips>をはじめとする、裏路地——最近は『裏Y地区』などという言い方もされるらしい地域には多くの売春宿が建ち並んでいるが、それらの総元締めをやっているのが壬生屋家である。","en":"The back alleys, including <tips=59>Darkness Street</tips>—an area apparently also known these days as ‘Back Y District’—were lined with brothels, all of them controlled by the Mibuya family.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r104","rowIndex":104,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　この立場は先代が築き上げたもので、<tips=33>タカシ</tips>は数年前にその後を継いだ。","en":"The previous head had established that position, and <tips=33>Takashi</tips> had succeeded him several years ago.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r105","rowIndex":105,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕は父の方とは子供の頃に面識があったが、この<tips=33>タカシ</tips>の方は直接会った記憶がない。","en":"I had known his father in my childhood, but I had no memory of ever meeting <tips=33>Takashi</tips> himself.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r106","rowIndex":106,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　が、その噂は耳にしている。","en":"But I had heard the rumors about him.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r107","rowIndex":107,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　もっとも、僕でなくとも<tips=9>Y地区</tips>に住むものでこの売春王の一族を知らないものはいないだろう。","en":"Then again, I was hardly unique. No one who lived in <tips=9>Y District</tips> could have been unaware of the family of its king of prostitution.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r108","rowIndex":108,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その財力を隠そうともせずに一族そろって派手な暮らしぶりを送っている様はあまりも目立つし、貧しくて娘や妻を売らなくてはならないような家庭では否応なくつき合いを持つことになる。僕の少年時代の仲間にも、この壬生屋家を憎む子供が何人かいた。","en":"The whole clan’s ostentatious lifestyle, with no attempt to hide its wealth, made them impossible to overlook. And any family poor enough to have to sell a daughter or wife inevitably found itself dealing with them. Even among my boyhood companions, several children hated the Mibuya family.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r109","rowIndex":109,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　先代は<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>加入後も組織とは距離を置いて独自の活動を行っていたが、代替わりしたこの<tips=33>タカシ</tips>は積極的に<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>に関わっている。","en":"Even after joining <tips=7>YS</tips>, the previous head had kept his distance from the organization and operated independently. But <tips=33>Takashi</tips>, who had succeeded him, took an active role in <tips=7>YS</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r110","rowIndex":110,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>内のなかでもっとも新しい派閥だ。","en":"His was the newest faction within <tips=7>YS</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r111","rowIndex":111,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼はこんな場に二人の女を連れて来ている。","en":"He had brought two women with him even to a gathering like this.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r112","rowIndex":112,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　女は二人とも厚化粧をして、じゃらじゃらと装飾品を身につけていた。","en":"Both women wore heavy makeup and enough jewelry to jangle as they moved.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r113","rowIndex":113,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そうは見えないが、秘書かなにかなのだろうか？","en":"They hardly looked it, but were they secretaries or something?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r114","rowIndex":114,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　何にしろ、このような人間も同席する会なのかと意外に思っていたところ、女たちは<tips=33>壬生屋</tips>が椅子にかけると愛想笑いをしながら部屋を出て行った。","en":"In any event, I had just begun to wonder whether people like them were really meant to sit in on the meeting when <tips=33>Mibuya</tips> took his seat and the women left the room with ingratiating smiles.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r115","rowIndex":115,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それから後は続々と参加者が入って来る。","en":"After that, the remaining participants entered in rapid succession.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r116","rowIndex":116,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=58>パラシュート通り</tips>に香港系の勢力を持つ、<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>の父方の親戚に当たる<tips=84>マイケル・ツェー</tips>。","en":"<tips=84>Michael Tse</tips>, a relative on <tips=3>Chris Tse’s</tips> paternal side, commanded a Hong Kong faction on <tips=58>Parachute Street</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r117","rowIndex":117,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　口元だけが覗いて顔の上半分を隠す仮面をしているのは、血の気の多い荒くれ者を部下として多数抱える武闘派グループのボスにして、<tips=16>タイプA</tips>である異形の<tips=26>劉建志</tips>。","en":"The man in a mask that concealed the upper half of his face, leaving only his mouth visible, was <tips=26>Ryu Kenshi</tips>: a misshapen <tips=16>Type A</tips> and the boss of a militant faction with many hot-blooded ruffians under his command.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r118","rowIndex":118,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　カジノを多数経営する、太っちょのイタリア人<tips=34>ダリオ・ボネット</tips>はいつも気の弱そうな態度をしているが、大変な食わせ者で、かつては暗殺や誘拐事件に多く関わった冷酷非道な陰謀家である。","en":"The fat Italian <tips=34>Dario Bonetto</tips>, who ran numerous casinos, always acted timid, but he was a formidable operator—an utterly ruthless conspirator once involved in many assassinations and kidnappings.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r119","rowIndex":119,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　国籍不明の女、<tips=31>エリー・ホワイト</tips>。彼女はギャングではなく商売人である。様々な密輸組織との繋がりを持ち、彼女に頼めば手に入らぬものはないと言われている。","en":"<tips=31>Ellie White</tips>, a woman of unknown nationality. She was no gangster, but a businesswoman. She had connections to all manner of smuggling rings, and it was said there was nothing she could not get hold of for you.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r120","rowIndex":120,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　名前とは裏腹にいつも真っ黒な喪服を身につけている。","en":"Despite her name, she always dressed in black mourning clothes.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r121","rowIndex":121,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして最後に部屋に入ってきたのが、<ruby=リャオ・チミン><tips=27>廖志明</tips></ruby>であった。","en":"The last person to enter the room was <tips=27>Liao Chi-ming</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r122","rowIndex":122,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼は息子の、<tips=28>トーマス・リャオ</tips>を伴っている。","en":"He was accompanied by his son, <tips=28>Thomas Liao</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r123","rowIndex":123,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=27>廖</tips>は僕の姿を見ても一瞥して通り過ぎただけだったが、息子の<tips=28>トーマス</tips>は、","en":"<tips=27>Liao</tips> merely glanced at me and walked past, but his son <tips=28>Thomas</tips> said,","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r124","rowIndex":124,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あ、<tips=2>阿亮</tips>？　どうしてここにいるの？」","en":"“Oh, <tips=2>Ah Leung</tips>? What are you doing here?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r125","rowIndex":125,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕の姿にそう驚いた。","en":"He exclaimed in surprise when he saw me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r126","rowIndex":126,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼は僕と同い年で、みなには<tips=28>トミー</tips>と親しげに呼ばれている。","en":"He was my age, and everyone affectionately called him <tips=28>Tommy</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r127","rowIndex":127,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=27>廖志明</tips>は何度も結婚し、しかもそのすべてがブロンドの美女であるという実にわかりやすい性癖を持っているのだが、<tips=28>トミー</tips>はその最初の妻であるアメリカ人に生ませた長男だ。","en":"<tips=27>Liao Chi-ming</tips> had married several times, and every one of his wives had been a beautiful blonde—a sexual preference almost comical in its transparency. <tips=28>Tommy</tips> was his eldest son, born to his first wife, an American.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r128","rowIndex":128,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=28>トミー</tips>こそ、いつこっちに帰って来たんだ？」","en":"“When did you get back here, <tips=28>Tommy</tips>?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r129","rowIndex":129,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　幼い頃こそこちらにいたものの、数年前に母が故郷に戻る時に行動を共にし、アメリカで暮らしていたはずだ。","en":"He had lived here in early childhood, but several years ago, he had accompanied his mother when she returned home and was supposed to have been living in America.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r130","rowIndex":130,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「もう、２、３年はこっちにいるよ……。急に呼び戻されたんだ。母さんといっしょに。父さんと再婚したんだよ。……あいかわらず、愛人はたくさんいるみたいだけど、今回は母さんも納得済みなんだ」","en":"“I’ve been back for two or three years now... He suddenly called us back—Mom and me. They got remarried. ...He still seems to have plenty of mistresses, but this time Mom knew what she was agreeing to.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r131","rowIndex":131,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=28>トミー</tips>は困ったように言う。","en":"<tips=28>Tommy</tips> said uneasily.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r132","rowIndex":132,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　少しふっくらした体型の<tips=28>トーマス</tips>は、母親譲りの色素の薄い髪と瞳を持ち、笑うと愛嬌のある顔立ちになる。","en":"<tips=28>Thomas</tips> was somewhat plump, with the light-colored hair and eyes he had inherited from his mother. When he smiled, his face had an amiable charm.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r133","rowIndex":133,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おっとりとした性格で、父親のもとでギャングの息子をやるよりも、母親と共にアメリカの片田舎でのんびりとした生活をしていたほうが本人に似合った幸福な人生だと思うが、そうはいかなかったらしい。","en":"With his gentle nature, it seemed to me that a quiet life in some corner of America with his mother would have suited him better—and made him happier—than playing the gangster’s son under his father. Apparently, it was not to be.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r134","rowIndex":134,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼自身もこの環境に慣れないようで、幹部たちの集まるこの場の雰囲気に完全に圧倒されているようだった。","en":"He did not seem comfortable in this world himself, and the atmosphere in a room full of senior officers had utterly overwhelmed him.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r135","rowIndex":135,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ああ、<tips=2>阿亮</tips>がいてよかった。どうしても緊張しちゃって……」","en":"“Oh, <tips=2>Ah Leung</tips>, I’m so glad you’re here. I just get so nervous...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r136","rowIndex":136,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「おい<tips=28>トーマス</tips>」","en":"“<tips=28>Thomas</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r137","rowIndex":137,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=28>トミー</tips>は、僕の側にもう少し居たいようだったが、父に呼ばれると渋々その隣の席についた。","en":"<tips=28>Tommy</tips> seemed to want to stay beside me a little longer, but when his father called him over, he reluctantly took the seat next to him.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r138","rowIndex":138,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=27>廖</tips>は我が息子にしかめっ面で何か言っている。","en":"<tips=27>Liao</tips> was saying something to his son with a scowl.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r139","rowIndex":139,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おおよそ、僕とあまり馴れ馴れしく関わるなとか、そういった類の話であろう。","en":"He was probably telling him not to get too friendly with me, or something along those lines.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r140","rowIndex":140,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その、<tips=27>廖志明</tips>。","en":"And then there was <tips=27>Liao Chi-ming</tips> himself.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r141","rowIndex":141,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　やせぎすの体を包むのはうっすらラメの入った黒いスーツで、胸元には派手なシャツが覗いている。全体として、亜熱帯の密林の毒蛇を思わせるような、毒々しい配色である。","en":"His gaunt body was wrapped in a black suit faintly dusted with glitter, a gaudy shirt showing at the chest. Taken together, the poisonous colors brought to mind a venomous snake in a subtropical jungle.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r142","rowIndex":142,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　口ひげとあごひげの形も、あまり現代風とは言えない。不健康な土気色の肌をして、黒目の小さい三白眼を持ち、まあ魅力的と呼ぶにはほど遠い容貌であるが、<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>のなかでは<tips=81>龍頭</tips>の次に力のある実力者である。","en":"Neither his mustache nor his goatee could remotely be called fashionable. His skin had an unhealthy, sallow cast, and his sanpaku eyes held tiny black pupils. He was, in short, about as far from attractive as a man could be, but within <tips=7>YS</tips> he was the most powerful figure after the <tips=81>Longtou</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r143","rowIndex":143,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=9>Y地区</tips>に存在する様々な集団のなかで、おそらくもっとも経済力があるのは客家系の華僑たちだろう。","en":"Of the various communities in <tips=9>Y District</tips>, the overseas Chinese of Hakka descent probably possessed the greatest economic power.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r144","rowIndex":144,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼らは食い詰め移民とアウトローの寄せ集めしかいなかった<tips=9>Y地区</tips>が現在のような一大歓楽街に成長するのに重要な役割を果たし、<tips=9>Y地区</tips>の地名などに中国由来のものが多いのは彼らの影響による。","en":"They had played a crucial role in transforming <tips=9>Y District</tips>, once nothing but a motley collection of destitute immigrants and outlaws, into the great entertainment quarter it was today. Their influence accounted for the many Chinese-derived place-names in <tips=9>Y District</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r145","rowIndex":145,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>が発足するまではこの地域の最大勢力であった。現在は<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>の香港グループが中心的な存在になったとは言え、その経済力は圧倒的だ。","en":"Until <tips=7>YS</tips> was founded, they had been the most powerful force in the region. Though the Hong Kong group led by <tips=3>Chris Tse</tips> now stood at the organization’s center, the Hakka community’s economic power remained overwhelming.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r146","rowIndex":146,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　このように、彼らは<tips=9>Y地区</tips>黎明期の頃から続く一大勢力で、同じく<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>以前の旧世代の有力組織である<tips=75>フェルナンデス・ファミリー</tips>とはあまり仲が良くないが、お互いの影響力を考慮して表面上ではほとんど争いごとは起こさない。お互い不干渉を貫いている。","en":"Thus, they were a major power dating back to the dawn of <tips=9>Y District</tips>. They were not on good terms with the <tips=75>Fernandes Family</tips>, another influential old-guard organization predating <tips=7>YS</tips>, but in deference to each other’s influence, they almost never came into open conflict. Both sides maintained a policy of noninterference.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r147","rowIndex":147,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その客家系華僑のリーダーがこの<tips=27>廖志明</tips>なのである。","en":"The leader of those Hakka overseas Chinese was <tips=27>Liao Chi-ming</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r148","rowIndex":148,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼もまた<tips=33>壬生屋タカシ</tips>と同じく父から財産と地位を受け継いだ二代目であったが、ぼんくらというわけでもなく、その抜け目のないやり口が恐れられている。むしろ、その能力に関しては<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>幹部たちのなかでもかなり優れた部類に入るのではないだろうか。","en":"Like <tips=33>Takashi Mibuya</tips>, he was a second-generation heir who had inherited wealth and position from his father, but he was no fool. His shrewdness had made him feared. In fact, judged purely on ability, he might rank near the top even among the officers of <tips=7>YS</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r149","rowIndex":149,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ただ、人格に関してはほとんどいい噂を聞かない。倨傲で、人を露骨に見下し、欲しいものを得るためには手段を選ばない。好色で自制心がなく、その種のトラブルには事欠かない。財力と暴力の使い方をよく知っており、自分より立場の弱い者から搾取するのが上手い——と書くと良いところが全くないようだが、部下や身内からの信頼は厚いようだから、僕らの知らない人徳があるのだろう。","en":"Still, one heard almost no favorable rumors about his character. He was arrogant, openly contemptuous of others, and stopped at nothing to obtain what he wanted. He was lustful and devoid of self-control, and trouble of that sort followed him endlessly. He knew how to wield wealth and violence and excelled at exploiting those weaker than himself—which, written that way, makes it sound as though he had no virtues at all. Yet he apparently enjoyed the profound trust of his subordinates and kin, so perhaps he possessed some quality that inspired loyalty, unknown to us.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r150","rowIndex":150,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　とまれ、街の人間にいくら嫌われても実力者であることは紛れもなく、この<tips=27>廖</tips>こそが、<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>亡き後の<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>の運命を握っている。今日僕が一番注目している人物である。","en":"At any rate, however much the people of the town disliked him, there was no denying his power. It was <tips=27>Liao</tips> who held the fate of <tips=7>YS</tips> after <tips=3>Chris Tse’s</tips> death. He was the man I would be watching most closely today.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r151","rowIndex":151,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　世間もおそらく同じ見方をするだろう。","en":"The public would probably see it the same way.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r152","rowIndex":152,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼のファミリーが<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>を離脱するのではないかという噂はこれまで何度も囁かれ、本人は明確にそれを否定したことがない。","en":"Rumors that his Family might break away from <tips=7>YS</tips> had circulated time and again, and he himself had never explicitly denied them.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r153","rowIndex":153,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　野心もあり、<tips=9>Y地区</tips>、及び近隣地域でも様々な事業を展開している。街を離れてあちこちを飛び回り、様々な人々との交流も持っているため、組織にこだわる必要がない。","en":"He was ambitious, too, and pursued various businesses throughout <tips=9>Y District</tips> and the neighboring regions. Because he frequently left town and traveled from place to place, maintaining ties with all kinds of people, he had no need to cling to the organization.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r154","rowIndex":154,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕は最近この街を離れてしまっていたので、情報が古く、現在の状況を詳しくは知らないが、この<tips=27>廖</tips>が<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>の次の<tips=81>龍頭</tips>の座を狙っているのか、それとも<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>を抜けて独自のやり方で地域を支配しようと考えているのか、どちらの目的を持っているかというのが、今後のこの街の裏社会の勢力争いにとって非常に重要になってくるのは間違いがない。","en":"I had been away from town lately, so my information was out of date and I did not know the current situation in detail. Even so, there was no question that the future struggle for power in the town’s underworld would depend greatly on which course <tips=27>Liao</tips> intended to pursue: whether he sought <tips=3>Chris Tse’s</tips> seat as the next <tips=81>Longtou</tips>, or meant to leave <tips=7>YS</tips> and dominate the region by his own methods.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r155","rowIndex":155,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ゲストが全員揃うと、<tips=39>ジェフリー・ウォン</tips>に伴われて車椅子の人物が入って来た。","en":"Once all the guests had assembled, a figure in a wheelchair entered, attended by <tips=39>Jeffrey Wong</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r156","rowIndex":156,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そう、<tips=81>龍頭</tips><tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>その人である。","en":"Yes—the <tips=81>Longtou</tips>, <tips=3>Chris Tse</tips> himself.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r157","rowIndex":157,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「みな勢揃いで、ご苦労」","en":"“Everyone’s here. Thank you for coming.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r158","rowIndex":158,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼は不敵な笑みを浮かべて言った。","en":"He said it with a bold, defiant smile.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r159","rowIndex":159,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　先日ベッドの上でチューブに繋がれていた人物にしては随分と張りのある声だ。本当に調子がいいのか、それとも気を張っているのか。おそらく、後者だろうな。","en":"For a man who had been lying in bed connected to tubes the other day, his voice had remarkable vigor. Was he truly feeling well, or was he holding himself together by force of will? Probably the latter.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r160","rowIndex":160,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　声を張っているとは言えやはり病人の声は遠くまでは届きにくい。話が聞こえなければここにいる意味がないので、僕もテーブルの端の方に座った。隣には<tips=4>馬明</tips>がいる。","en":"Even projected, a sick man’s voice did not carry far. There was no point in being here if I could not hear him, so I took a seat near one end of the table. <tips=4>Ma Ming</tips> was beside me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r161","rowIndex":161,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　やがて給仕が何人か入って来て、それぞれの手元のグラスにシャンパンが注がれた。","en":"Before long, several servers entered and poured champagne into the glasses before us.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r162","rowIndex":162,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=81>龍頭</tips>がグラスを掲げ、胸を張り、病によって枯れてはいるが朗々とした声で言う。","en":"The <tips=81>Longtou</tips> raised his glass and drew himself up. Though illness had left his voice thin and dry, it still rang out richly:","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r163","rowIndex":163,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「我々<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>のさらなる発展と、永遠の固い結束に捧げる」","en":"“To the continued growth of <tips=7>YS</tips>, and to our eternal, unbreakable unity.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r164","rowIndex":164,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　グラスに口をつけ、飲み干してテーブルに置いた。","en":"He put the glass to his lips, drained it, and set it on the table.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r165","rowIndex":165,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　すると、すべての参加者は同じようにグラスを掲げ、飲み干し、そしてテーブルに置く。","en":"Every participant followed suit: raising a glass, draining it, and setting it down.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r166","rowIndex":166,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　どうしてなのか、何が起源なのか、よく分からないが、「乾杯」などのかけ声をかけず、こうした流れをすべて無言のうちに行うのが<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>流の作法らしい。","en":"I did not know why or where the custom had originated, but apparently the <tips=7>YS</tips> way was to perform this entire sequence in silence, without anyone calling out a toast such as ‘Cheers.’","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r167","rowIndex":167,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　こうして会食が始まった。","en":"Thus the dinner began.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r168","rowIndex":168,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　隣の席になった者や、連れ合いと雑談を始めるものも居れば、ただ黙々と目の前の料理を食べる者もいる。何か大事な話をするという雰囲気ではなく、ごく当たり前の会食にしか見えないが、これがどういう流れで幹部同士の話し合いになるのか。","en":"Some began chatting with the people seated beside them or with their companions, while others silently ate the food before them. There was no sense that anything important was about to be discussed. It looked like an entirely ordinary dinner, and I could not imagine how it was supposed to turn into a discussion among the senior officers.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r169","rowIndex":169,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ねえ<tips=4>馬明</tips>。もしかして、これは、ただ食べるだけなのかい？」","en":"“Hey, <tips=4>Ma Ming</tips>—are we really just here to eat?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r170","rowIndex":170,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　拍子抜けした僕は小声で隣の<tips=4>馬明</tips>に尋ねた。","en":"Feeling rather let down, I whispered the question to <tips=4>Ma Ming</tips> beside me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r171","rowIndex":171,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「食事の間は雑談などをしてお互いの気持ちをほぐし、食後のお茶の時間に大事な会議を行うというのが、いつもの流れだな」","en":"“The usual routine is to loosen everyone up with small talk during the meal, then hold the important meeting over tea afterward.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r172","rowIndex":172,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕に説明したあと、彼はオードブルの牡蠣のコンフィをもう一皿注文した。","en":"After explaining this to me, he ordered another plate of the oyster confit served as an hors d’oeuvre.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r173","rowIndex":173,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　コース料理でオードブルを追加注文するやつなんかいるのだろうかと思いながら、食欲のない僕は自分の牡蠣も彼に差し出した。今日はフレンチのようだ。","en":"I wondered what sort of person ordered another appetizer in the middle of a set course. With no appetite myself, I offered him my oyster too. Apparently, dinner that evening was French.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r174","rowIndex":174,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　料理が一皿一皿運ばれて来る。食事で気持ちをほぐしながら、と言ったけれども、こうして見る限りではそんな和気藹々とした雰囲気でもない。あちこちでひそひそと囁くような話し合いがなされてはいるが、食器のカチャカチャとなる音の方が大きいくらいだ。","en":"The dishes arrived one by one. Ma Ming had spoken of relaxing over the meal, but judging by what I saw, the atmosphere was hardly convivial. Quiet, whispered discussions were taking place here and there, yet even the clatter of cutlery was louder.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r175","rowIndex":175,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=81>龍頭</tips>は食事に手を付けず、左右に座った<tips=31>エリー・ホワイト</tips>や<tips=84>マイケル・ツェー</tips>と談笑をしている。内臓が弱っていて、もう人並みの食事に耐えられる体ではないのかもしれない。","en":"The <tips=81>Longtou</tips> did not touch his food. He chatted amiably with <tips=31>Ellie White</tips> and <tips=84>Michael Tse</tips>, seated to either side. His internal organs might have weakened to the point that his body could no longer tolerate an ordinary meal.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r176","rowIndex":176,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　売春王の<tips=33>壬生屋</tips>は、ふとっちょイタリア人の<tips=34>ダリオ</tips>と何やら真顔で囁き合っている。","en":"<tips=33>Mibuya</tips>, the prostitution king, was whispering about something with the fat Italian <tips=34>Dario</tips>, both men wearing grave expressions.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r177","rowIndex":177,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　同じ<tips=59>暗闇通り</tips>を根城とする彼らは、以前は何かとやりあっていたはずだが、僕の知らないうちに和解したのだろうか。","en":"The two men, both based on <tips=59>Darkness Street</tips>, had once clashed at every opportunity. Had they reconciled without my knowledge?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r178","rowIndex":178,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=35>フェルナンデス</tips>や<tips=26>劉建志</tips>は誰とも喋らずに黙々と食べている。","en":"<tips=35>Fernandes</tips> and <tips=26>Ryu Kenshi</tips> spoke to no one and ate steadily in silence.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r179","rowIndex":179,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして問題の<tips=27>廖</tips>は他の参加者ではなく、我が子の<tips=28>トミー</tips>にばかりを相手ににやにやと笑いながら何かを囁き、<tips=28>トミー</tips>は眉間にしわを浮かべながら頷くばかりだ。","en":"And as for <tips=27>Liao</tips>, the man I was most concerned about, he ignored the other participants and devoted his attention solely to his son <tips=28>Tommy</tips>, whispering something with a smirk. <tips=28>Tommy</tips> merely nodded, his brow furrowed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r180","rowIndex":180,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　一通りのコースが終わり、それぞれに紅茶やら珈琲やら、リクエストした飲み物が運ばれてくる。","en":"When the entire course had ended, tea, coffee, and the other requested drinks were brought to each guest.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r181","rowIndex":181,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「さて」","en":"“Now, then.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー","displayName":"Chris Tse","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r182","rowIndex":182,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=81>龍頭</tips>がそう言って居住まいを正す。どうやらここから本題にはいるらしい。","en":"The <tips=81>Longtou</tips> straightened in his seat as he said it. Apparently, it was time to get down to business.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r183","rowIndex":183,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「今日は大事な話がいくつかある」","en":"“We have several important matters to discuss today.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー","displayName":"Chris Tse","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r184","rowIndex":184,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「その前に、いいかな？」","en":"“Before that, may I?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"廖志明","displayName":"Liao Chi-ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r185","rowIndex":185,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=81>龍頭</tips>の言葉を遮るように、<tips=27>廖</tips>がうすら笑いを浮かべながら言った。","en":"Seeming to cut off the <tips=81>Longtou</tips>, <tips=27>Liao</tips> spoke with a faint smile.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r186","rowIndex":186,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なんだ」","en":"“What is it?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー","displayName":"Chris Tse","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r187","rowIndex":187,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=81>龍頭</tips>、それからみなさんに、一つ提案がある」","en":"“<tips=81>Longtou</tips>—and all of you—I have a proposal.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"廖志明","displayName":"Liao Chi-ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r188","rowIndex":188,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=27>廖</tips>は立ち上がって一同を見回すと、","en":"<tips=27>Liao</tips> rose and surveyed the room.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r189","rowIndex":189,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ヤクのことだ」","en":"“It’s about the dope.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"廖志明","displayName":"Liao Chi-ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r190","rowIndex":190,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「またその話か」","en":"“That again?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー","displayName":"Chris Tse","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r191","rowIndex":191,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=81>龍頭</tips>は露骨に顔を顰める。","en":"The <tips=81>Longtou</tips> frowned openly.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r192","rowIndex":192,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「うんざりさせて申し訳ないが、仕方がない。今状況は非常に深刻なのだ。ここで改めて、判断をしていただきたい」","en":"“I apologize for bringing it up again, but it cannot be helped. The situation is extremely serious. I ask you to reconsider the matter here and now.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"廖志明","displayName":"Liao Chi-ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r193","rowIndex":193,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=27>廖</tips>は咳払いをして、","en":"<tips=27>Liao</tips> cleared his throat.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r194","rowIndex":194,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「知っての通り、我々<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>は薬物の取引を行っておらず、<tips=9>Y地区</tips>での薬物利権は　”<tips=22>老人たち</tips>”　が独り占めしている。これはあまりにも馬鹿げているし、非常に問題のある状態だ。彼らばかりに甘い汁を吸わせていていいのか？」","en":"“As you know, we in <tips=7>YS</tips> do not traffic drugs, and the drug trade in <tips=9>Y District</tips> is monopolized by the ‘<tips=22>Elders</tips>.’ This is an utterly absurd and deeply problematic state of affairs. Are we really going to let them keep all the easy money for themselves?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"廖志明","displayName":"Liao Chi-ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r195","rowIndex":195,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=27>廖</tips>さん、彼らとは協定があります」","en":"“Mr. <tips=27>Liao</tips>, we have an agreement with them.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ジェフリー・ウォン","displayName":"Jeffrey Wong","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r196","rowIndex":196,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　執事のように<tips=81>龍頭</tips>の側に立つ<tips=39>ジェフリー・ウォン</tips>が冷静に諫める。","en":"<tips=39>Jeffrey Wong</tips>, standing beside the <tips=81>Longtou</tips> like a butler, calmly cautioned him.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r197","rowIndex":197,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そんなことは知っている。だが、その協定が時代遅れだと言うんだよ。<tips=22>老人たち</tips>がこのまま太り続けていけば、いずれ我々の脅威になる。それを手をこまねいて見ているというのは、私には理解出来ないね」","en":"“I know that. But I am saying the agreement is obsolete. If the <tips=22>Elders</tips> are allowed to go on fattening themselves, they will eventually become a threat to us. I cannot understand why we should sit on our hands and watch that happen.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"廖志明","displayName":"Liao Chi-ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r198","rowIndex":198,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「麻薬は<tips=22>老人たち</tips>が扱い、<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>では麻薬は扱わないというのは、この街で我々が共存するためのルールですから」","en":"“The <tips=22>Elders</tips> handle the drugs, and <tips=7>YS</tips> does not. That is the rule that allows us to coexist in this town.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ジェフリー・ウォン","displayName":"Jeffrey Wong","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r199","rowIndex":199,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=39>ウォン</tips>君。きみには聞いていない。……<tips=81>龍頭</tips>どのはどうお考えか？　今この状態で薬物取引に参入しても<tips=22>老人たち</tips>は文句は言わないだろう。言える立場でもない。刃向かうなら戦えばいい」","en":"“Mr. <tips=39>Wong</tips>, I was not asking you. ...What do you think, Lord <tips=81>Longtou</tips>? As things stand, the <tips=22>Elders</tips> would have no grounds to complain if we entered the drug trade. They are in no position to object. If they defy us, then we fight.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"廖志明","displayName":"Liao Chi-ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r200","rowIndex":200,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=27>廖</tips>は言って、じっと<tips=81>龍頭</tips>を見つめる。","en":"<tips=27>Liao</tips> finished and stared fixedly at the <tips=81>Longtou</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r201","rowIndex":201,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　龍頭は溜息をつき、","en":"The Longtou sighed, then said,","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r202","rowIndex":202,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「私の考えは変わらない。その意見には乗らんよ。……<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>が薬物を売らないのは、協定があるからというだけではないんだ」","en":"“My mind has not changed. I will not go along with that proposal. ...The agreement is not the only reason <tips=7>YS</tips> does not sell drugs.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー","displayName":"Chris Tse","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r203","rowIndex":203,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「では何故かな？　きみの個人的な信念かね？　きみがヤクを嫌っているのは知っているが、我々が売らなくとも街には麻薬があふれており、中毒者が路上でへたばっている。何も変わりゃしないんだ。なのに、目の前に落ちている金を拾わないというのは、ただの怠慢だよ。そうだろう、みんな？」","en":"“Then why? A personal conviction of yours? I know you hate dope, but whether or not we sell it, the town is flooded with drugs and addicts lie sprawled in the streets. Nothing changes either way. Refusing to pick up money lying right in front of us is sheer negligence. Don’t you all agree?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"廖志明","displayName":"Liao Chi-ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r204","rowIndex":204,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして<tips=27>廖</tips>は仲間たちを振り返るが、彼らは何も言わずに他のメンバーの出方をうかがっている。","en":"Then <tips=27>Liao</tips> turned to his fellows. They said nothing, waiting instead to see how the other members would respond.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r205","rowIndex":205,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=35>ミスター・フェルナンデス</tips>、あなたはどうお考えで？　あなただって金は必要だろう？」","en":"“<tips=35>Mr. Fernandes</tips>, what do you think? You need money too, don’t you?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"廖志明","displayName":"Liao Chi-ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r206","rowIndex":206,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「興味のない話だ。君たちが売りたいのなら好きにすればいい。うちは今まで通りやるだけだ」","en":"“I’m not interested. If you want to sell it, do as you please. My people will keep doing what we have always done.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ジョゼ・フェルナンデス","displayName":"José Fernandes","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r207","rowIndex":207,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=35>フェルナンデス</tips>は肩をすくめてそう言った。","en":"<tips=35>Fernandes</tips> said it with a shrug.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r208","rowIndex":208,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=27>廖</tips>さん」","en":"“Mr. <tips=27>Liao</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー","displayName":"Chris Tse","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r209","rowIndex":209,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=81>龍頭</tips>はまだ何か言いたげな<tips=27>廖</tips>を鋭い目で見つめながら言う。","en":"Fixing a sharp gaze on <tips=27>Liao</tips>, who still seemed to have more to say, the <tips=81>Longtou</tips> continued:","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r210","rowIndex":210,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「悪いが、あなたが何を言おうとこのルールを変えるつもりはない。協定も維持する。<tips=22>老人たち</tips>に街の<tips=17>タイプB</tips>たちを管理させていた方が組織にとっても都合がいいんだ。面倒ごとを押しつけているんだから、多少儲けさせたって別に構わないさ」","en":"“Sorry, but nothing you say is going to make me change this rule. The agreement stays. It suits the organization better to let the <tips=22>Elders</tips> manage the town’s <tips=17>Type Bs</tips>. We are dumping the troublesome work on them, so I do not care if we let them make a little money.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー","displayName":"Chris Tse","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r211","rowIndex":211,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=81>龍頭</tips>、<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>をもっと強大な組織にしようとは思わないのか？　きみのその弱気が組織の停滞を招いている。昔のきみだったら、そのようなつまらぬ意見は言わなかったはずだ」","en":"“<tips=81>Longtou</tips>, do you not want to make <tips=7>YS</tips> a still mightier organization? This timidity of yours is bringing the organization to a standstill. You would never have voiced such a petty opinion in the old days.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"廖志明","displayName":"Liao Chi-ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r212","rowIndex":212,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=27>廖</tips>は捨て台詞を吐いて着席する。<tips=81>龍頭</tips>は表情を変えずにそれを受け流し、","en":"After flinging out that parting shot, <tips=27>Liao</tips> sat down. The <tips=81>Longtou</tips> let it pass without changing his expression, then","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r213","rowIndex":213,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「他に、何か意見を言いたいものはあるかね？」","en":"“Does anyone else have something to say?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー","displayName":"Chris Tse","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r214","rowIndex":214,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　一同を見回すが、そこで口を開くものはいなかった。","en":"He surveyed the room, but no one spoke.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r215","rowIndex":215,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「よし、それでは話させて頂こう」","en":"“All right, then. Let me speak.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー","displayName":"Chris Tse","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r216","rowIndex":216,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ナプキンを口元に当て、痰を吐くような動作をしてから言った。","en":"The Longtou pressed his napkin to his mouth and made a motion as though spitting out phlegm before he continued.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r217","rowIndex":217,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「今日集まって貰った一番の理由は、他でもない、私の死後の人事についてだ」","en":"“The main reason I called you here today is to discuss the appointments that will be made after my death.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r218","rowIndex":218,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　誰も露骨に声や態度に出したりはしないが、その一言で場の空気が張り詰めたものに変わった。","en":"No one showed it openly in voice or manner, but at that single sentence, the atmosphere in the room grew taut.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r219","rowIndex":219,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　無理もない。","en":"It was only natural.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r220","rowIndex":220,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　あの<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>の象徴である<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>が、ついに自分の死を公式に認め、己の口でその後の処置について発表するというのだ。歴史的瞬間と言っていいだろう。","en":"That <tips=3>Chris Tse</tips>, the very symbol of <tips=7>YS</tips>, was at last officially acknowledging his own impending death and announcing, in his own words, what would follow. It could fairly be called a historic moment.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r221","rowIndex":221,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして注目のなか<tips=81>龍頭</tips>は口を開く。","en":"And under every eye, the <tips=81>Longtou</tips> began to speak.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r222","rowIndex":222,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「私の死後は、我が叔父である<tips=84>マイケル・ツェー</tips>が<tips=81>龍頭</tips>となる」","en":"“After my death, my uncle, <tips=84>Michael Tse</tips>, will become <tips=81>Longtou</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー","displayName":"Chris Tse","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r223","rowIndex":223,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その言葉に、誰ともなく溜息が漏れた。","en":"A sigh escaped from somewhere in the room.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r224","rowIndex":224,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　まあ妥当、というか無難な人選だろう。","en":"It was a reasonable choice—or at least a safe one.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r225","rowIndex":225,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=84>マイケル・ツェー</tips>は人物としては特別なところのない凡庸な人間だが、<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>と同族かつ彼より年上であることから、<tips=76>香港グループ</tips>のなかの序列としては<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>よりも上に来る。","en":"<tips=84>Michael Tse</tips> was an unremarkable, thoroughly ordinary man. But he belonged to the same clan as <tips=3>Chris Tse</tips> and was older, which placed him above <tips=3>Chris Tse</tips> in the hierarchy of the <tips=76>Hong Kong group</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r226","rowIndex":226,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　このメンバーのなかでは年長者の部類だし、人柄にも角がなく、<tips=76>香港派</tips>の支配が続くことに批判的な者でも比較的受け入れやすいだろう。","en":"He was among the older men present, and his mild character would make him relatively acceptable even to those critical of the continued rule of the <tips=76>Hong Kong faction</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r227","rowIndex":227,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ちらと<tips=27>廖</tips>を見ると、腕組みをしたまま難しい顔をしている。","en":"I glanced at <tips=27>Liao</tips>. He sat with his arms folded, wearing a grim expression.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r228","rowIndex":228,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼にとっても予想内ではあったが、諸手を挙げて歓迎するほどの人選でもないといったところか。さすがに自分が後継者に指名されるとは考えていないだろうが。","en":"The choice was likely within his expectations, though hardly one he could welcome with open arms. Surely he had not imagined that he himself would be named successor.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r229","rowIndex":229,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　一方僕は内心で安堵の溜息をついた。","en":"Meanwhile, I breathed an inward sigh of relief.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r230","rowIndex":230,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　この間父は否定していたが、しかしこの人のことだから、突然この場で僕を指名する、なんていうこともありうるのではないかと、危惧していたのだ。","en":"My father had denied it the other day, but knowing him, I had feared he might suddenly name me here in front of everyone.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r231","rowIndex":231,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「その補佐官として、<tips=85>二路元帥</tips>の<tips=39>ジェフリー・ウォン</tips>」","en":"“The <tips=85>Second Route Marshal</tips>, <tips=39>Jeffrey Wong</tips>, will serve as his adviser.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー","displayName":"Chris Tse","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r232","rowIndex":232,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その言葉にあわせて、<tips=39>ジェフリー・ウォン</tips>は礼をする。","en":"At those words, <tips=39>Jeffrey Wong</tips> bowed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r233","rowIndex":233,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　これも驚くような発表ではない。現状の役割をそのままスライドするということだ。","en":"This announcement was not surprising either. The existing division of roles was simply being carried forward.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r234","rowIndex":234,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　どうやら穏当な人事が行われているようだ。","en":"Apparently, the appointments were being kept safely conventional.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r235","rowIndex":235,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　安心しつつ、僕がテーブルの上の飲み物に手を伸ばしたところで、いやな言葉がきこえた。","en":"Relieved, I reached for my drink—and heard something I did not want to hear.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r236","rowIndex":236,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そしてもう一人、そこに居る<tips=1>謝亮</tips>にも補佐を行ってもらう」","en":"“And I want one other person to assist him: <tips=1>Tse Leung</tips>, sitting over there.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー","displayName":"Chris Tse","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r237","rowIndex":237,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　と、間違いなくそう言ったのである。","en":"That was what he said, unmistakably.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r238","rowIndex":238,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　一同の視線が一斉に僕の顔に集中する。その表情はいずれも驚きに満ちていた。","en":"Every eye in the room snapped toward me at once. Every face was filled with surprise.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r239","rowIndex":239,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それはそうだろう。僕だってさすがに驚く。","en":"Naturally. Even I was surprised.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r240","rowIndex":240,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いいな、<tips=2>阿亮</tips>」","en":"“Understood, <tips=2>Ah Leung</tips>?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー","displayName":"Chris Tse","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r241","rowIndex":241,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「聞いていませんよ」","en":"“You never told me about any of this.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r242","rowIndex":242,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　念を押す<tips=81>龍頭</tips>に、僕は怪訝に問い返す。","en":"Puzzled by the <tips=81>Longtou’s</tips> insistence, I answered with a question of my own.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r243","rowIndex":243,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そりゃ、私の考えを口にしたのはこの瞬間が初めてなのだから当たり前だ。くだらない学校なんかやめて、今後は<tips=39>ジェフリー</tips>と共に叔父どのの補佐をしながら仕事を覚えるんだ。そして、ゆくゆくはお前が<tips=81>龍頭</tips>となれ」","en":"“Of course you haven’t. This is the first time I’ve said a word about it. Quit that worthless school. From now on, you’ll learn the business while helping your uncle alongside <tips=39>Jeffrey</tips>. And one day, you will become <tips=81>Longtou</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー","displayName":"Chris Tse","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r244","rowIndex":244,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=81>龍頭</tips>は、口元に笑みさえ浮かべながらそう言った。","en":"The <tips=81>Longtou</tips> actually smiled as he said it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r245","rowIndex":245,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕は不快だった。","en":"I was furious.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r246","rowIndex":246,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　大学に入るのにどれだけ苦労したのか彼は知らないだろう。それをやめろ、そして組織に入れと、なんの相談もなく一方的に言うだなんて、まったく人を馬鹿にするにもほどがある。","en":"He had no idea how hard I had worked to get into university. And now, without so much as consulting me, he was ordering me to quit and join the organization instead. There were limits to how little respect one man could show another.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r247","rowIndex":247,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　今この場で病人の顔に手元のコーヒーカップの中身をぶちまけてやったらさぞかし痛快だろうが、すんでのところでこらえた。","en":"How satisfying it would have been to fling my coffee into the sick man’s face then and there. But I managed to stop myself just in time.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r248","rowIndex":248,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まったく心外だ！」","en":"“This is outrageous!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"廖志明","displayName":"Liao Chi-ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r249","rowIndex":249,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=27>廖志明</tips>が大声で怒るのは、無理もない話だ。","en":"No wonder <tips=27>Liao Chi-ming</tips> shouted in outrage.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r250","rowIndex":250,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=84>マイケル</tips>どのはまだわかる。古くからこの地で一家を構える功労者だ。しかし、その話だと、要するに息子どのが就任するまでの繋ぎではないか！　世襲制とは、中世の貴族にでもなったつもりかね？　我らは同志であって、きみの家来ではない。きみの派閥の相続だけなら勝手にやればいいが、我らの連合である<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>の<tips=81>龍頭</tips>にするというのは感心しない。そんなやり方にはついていけない」","en":"“I can understand Mr. <tips=84>Michael</tips>. His family has been established here for generations, and he has done us great service. But from what you’ve said, he would merely be keeping the seat warm until your son takes over! A hereditary succession—do you imagine yourself some medieval nobleman? We are your comrades, not your retainers. Hand your own faction down however you please, but I cannot approve of making your son <tips=81>Longtou</tips> of <tips=7>YS</tips>, an alliance that belongs to us all. I will not go along with this.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"廖志明","displayName":"Liao Chi-ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r251","rowIndex":251,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ついていけないとは？　じゃあ、<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>から抜けるとでも言うのかい？」","en":"“You won’t go along with it? What, are you saying you’ll leave <tips=7>YS</tips>?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー","displayName":"Chris Tse","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r252","rowIndex":252,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=81>龍頭</tips>はジロリと<tips=27>廖</tips>を睨み付ける。","en":"The <tips=81>Longtou</tips> fixed <tips=27>Liao</tips> with a glare.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r253","rowIndex":253,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それは往年の迫力に満ちたもので、<tips=27>廖</tips>も気圧されたのか、言いよどむ。","en":"The glare held all the force of his prime. Perhaps cowed by it, <tips=27>Liao</tips> faltered.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r254","rowIndex":254,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=27>廖</tips>さん、そりゃあ得策じゃないな。確かにあんたは私の部下ではなく同志だ。反対したっていいし、やり方が気にいらないなら<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>から抜ける権利もあるが、抜けたらもう同志でさえもなくなるってことだぜ。これがどういう意味かわかるかい？」","en":"“Mr. <tips=27>Liao</tips>, that wouldn’t be smart. You’re right—you’re my comrade, not my subordinate. You have every right to oppose me, and if you don’t like the way I do things, you have every right to leave <tips=7>YS</tips>. But once you leave, we won’t even be comrades anymore. You know what that means, don’t you?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー","displayName":"Chris Tse","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r255","rowIndex":255,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その言葉に<tips=27>廖</tips>は表情を固くして鋭い視線を龍頭に送る。一方<tips=81>龍頭</tips>も冷笑を顔に貼り付けたまま黙って相手の顔を見つめている。","en":"At those words, <tips=27>Liao’s</tips> face went rigid, and he shot the Longtou a piercing look. The <tips=81>Longtou</tips> stared silently back, the sneer still fixed on his face.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r256","rowIndex":256,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　睨み合いは暫く続いたが、結局根負けして<tips=27>廖</tips>が先に口を開いた。","en":"They stared each other down for a while. In the end, <tips=27>Liao</tips> was the first to give in and speak.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r257","rowIndex":257,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ふん、私が言っているのはね、抜ける抜けないなんていう話ではないんだ。ただ冷静な意見ってやつを言っただけだよ。きみは病で少し疲れているんだろう。それを指摘させて貰ったのさ」","en":"“Hmph. I wasn’t talking about leaving or staying. I merely offered a calm, objective opinion. Your illness must have left you a little tired. I was only pointing that out.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"廖志明","displayName":"Liao Chi-ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r258","rowIndex":258,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうかそうか。なら、心配はいらないよ。……ただのちょっとした提案というのなら結構。良かったよ。あんたが血迷ったわけじゃなくて」","en":"“Good, good. Then there’s nothing to worry about. ...A little suggestion is perfectly fine. I’m glad you haven’t lost your senses.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー","displayName":"Chris Tse","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r259","rowIndex":259,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=27>廖</tips>はむっとしたようだが、<tips=81>龍頭</tips>は笑い、","en":"<tips=27>Liao</tips> looked annoyed, but the <tips=81>Longtou</tips> laughed and said,","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r260","rowIndex":260,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「じゃあ、他に、誰か意見があるものはいるか？　これは組織にとって極めて重大な話だ。<tips=27>廖</tips>さんのように忌憚のない意見を述べて貰ってかまわない」","en":"“Well, does anyone else have something to say? This is an extremely important matter for the organization. Feel free to be every bit as candid as Mr. <tips=27>Liao</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー","displayName":"Chris Tse","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r261","rowIndex":261,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　このようなやりとりを見せられて、あえて口を開くものは存在しないかと思われたが、","en":"After witnessing that exchange, I thought no one would dare open his mouth, but—","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r262","rowIndex":262,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それでは、この話は……」","en":"“In that case, the matter is—”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー","displayName":"Chris Tse","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r263","rowIndex":263,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=81>龍頭</tips>がそうまとめかけたところで、意外にも<tips=35>フェルナンデス</tips>が口を開いた。","en":"Just as the <tips=81>Longtou</tips> was about to wrap matters up, <tips=35>Fernandes</tips> unexpectedly spoke.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r264","rowIndex":264,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=81>龍頭</tips>、それはいかがなものだろう？」","en":"“<tips=81>Longtou</tips>, is this really wise?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ジョゼ・フェルナンデス","displayName":"José Fernandes","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r265","rowIndex":265,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼は普段からしわだらけの顔に、さらに深いしわを作りつつ、","en":"The furrows in his already wrinkled face deepened as he continued,","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r266","rowIndex":266,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「盟主であり、最大の功労者である貴方には確かに後継者の指名権がある。しかし、組織で働いたこともない青年を後継者に指名するというのは、あまりにもあやうい」","en":"“You are our leader and our greatest contributor, so yes, you have the right to name your successor. But naming a young man who has never worked for the organization is much too risky.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ジョゼ・フェルナンデス","displayName":"José Fernandes","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r267","rowIndex":267,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「反対かい？」","en":"“Are you opposed?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー","displayName":"Chris Tse","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r268","rowIndex":268,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうではないが、彼を後継者とするのならば、しっかりと……」","en":"“Not exactly. But if he is to be your successor, we must properly—”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ジョゼ・フェルナンデス","displayName":"José Fernandes","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r269","rowIndex":269,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「反対でないのならば、是非ともあやうくならないよう盛り立てて欲しいものだね」","en":"“If you’re not opposed, then I hope you’ll stand behind him and make certain there is no danger.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー","displayName":"Chris Tse","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r270","rowIndex":270,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=81>龍頭</tips>が話を遮ると、<tips=35>フェルナンデス</tips>は肩をすくめた。","en":"When the <tips=81>Longtou</tips> cut him off, <tips=35>Fernandes</tips> shrugged.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r271","rowIndex":271,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　すこしやり方が強引だな。<tips=81>龍頭</tips>にも余裕がないように見える。","en":"This was rather heavy-handed. The <tips=81>Longtou</tips> himself seemed to feel he had no time to spare.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r272","rowIndex":272,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　——まあ、当然か。","en":"—Well, no wonder.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r273","rowIndex":273,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　この会議では背筋を伸ばしているが、本来はもうベッドから出られないような重病人なのである。","en":"He might have been sitting straight-backed through this meeting, but by rights he was already too ill even to leave his bed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r274","rowIndex":274,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　残された時間は僅かだ。その間に、全てを決定したいという焦りが彼にあるのは間違いない。","en":"He had little time left. There was no doubt that he was desperate to settle everything before it ran out.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r275","rowIndex":275,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ただ、そうだとしても、こんな性急な進め方では良い形ではまとまらないだろう。","en":"Even so, forcing matters through this quickly was unlikely to produce a sound settlement.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r276","rowIndex":276,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なあみんな、不満があるのはわかる。だが、思い出して欲しい。私が今まで間違った判断をしたことがあるか？　諸君らを誤った方向へ導いたことがあるか？」","en":"“Listen. I know you’re unhappy. But I want you to remember: have I ever made the wrong decision? Have I ever led any of you in the wrong direction?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー","displayName":"Chris Tse","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r277","rowIndex":277,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そう言って一同を見回すが、これに異議を唱えるものはいなかった。みな黙って病人を見つめているが、その心の内はいかなるものか。","en":"He looked around at them, but no one objected. They all stared silently at the sick man. What might have been passing through their minds, I could not say.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r278","rowIndex":278,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「私を信じてくれ。言った通りにしてくれれば、今後４０年は組織の安泰を保証する。この<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>の決定なんだ。後悔させはしない」","en":"“Trust me. Do as I say, and I promise you forty years of security for this organization. This is <tips=3>Chris Tse’s</tips> decision. You won’t regret it.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー","displayName":"Chris Tse","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r279","rowIndex":279,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そしてゴホゴホと咳込むと、そのまま<tips=39>ジェフリー・ウォン</tips>に車椅子を押されて部屋を出て行った。","en":"Then he broke into a fit of coughing and was wheeled from the room by <tips=39>Jeffrey Wong</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r280","rowIndex":280,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「この素晴らしい提案を知っていたのか？」","en":"“Did you know about this marvelous proposal?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r281","rowIndex":281,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　部屋を出てから、僕は<tips=4>馬明</tips>にそう訊ねた。","en":"Once we had left the room, I put the question to <tips=4>Ma Ming</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r282","rowIndex":282,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いや、寝耳に水だよ。おれから提案はしたことはあったがね。その時は兄貴はうんともすんとも言わなかったんだ。てっきりその気はないんだと思ってたんだが……まったく驚いた」","en":"“No. Hit me out of nowhere. I did suggest it myself once, mind you, but Big Brother never gave me an answer one way or the other. I figured he wasn’t interested... Damn, that surprised me.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬明","displayName":"Ma Ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r283","rowIndex":283,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=4>馬明</tips>は大げさにかぶりを振る。嘘をついているような態度ではない。","en":"<tips=4>Ma Ming</tips> shook his head extravagantly. He did not look as if he were lying.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r284","rowIndex":284,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「しかし、意見としては大賛成だ。兄貴の後継者としての器があるのは<tips=2>阿亮</tips>しかいない。それに、言ったろう？　兄貴は本心ではお前に継いで欲しいんだって」","en":"“But as an idea, I’m all for it. <tips=2>Ah Leung</tips> is the only man who has what it takes to succeed Big Brother. And didn’t I tell you? Deep down, Big Brother wants you to take over.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬明","displayName":"Ma Ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r285","rowIndex":285,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そう言って大きな手のひらで僕の背中をバンバンと叩く。あんな場でも酒を飲みまくっていた酔っ払いのひどい馬鹿力で、僕はむせながらそれを振り払い、","en":"With that, he thumped me on the back again and again with his enormous palm. The drunk had kept guzzling liquor even through the meeting, and his brute strength was absurd. Coughing, I shook off his hand and said,","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r286","rowIndex":286,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「冗談じゃない。あんな不意打ちを食らって、これじゃピエロだ」","en":"“You’ve got to be kidding. Blindsiding me like that made me look like a complete clown.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r287","rowIndex":287,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ははは、それが面白くて兄貴も前もって言わなかったのかもな」","en":"“Ha ha! Maybe Big Brother kept quiet precisely because he thought that would be funny.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬明","displayName":"Ma Ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r288","rowIndex":288,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>や<tips=4>馬明</tips>のこういった感覚に僕はついていけない。","en":"I could not begin to understand the sensibility <tips=3>Chris Tse</tips> and <tips=4>Ma Ming</tips> shared.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r289","rowIndex":289,"pageCtrl":"","jp":" <tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>幹部と言えばなんだか重厚なマフィアのように思っている人もいるのかもしれないが、実体はこんなにいい加減なものなんだ。","en":"Some people might hear ‘the leaders of <tips=7>YS</tips>’ and picture a grave, imposing Mafia outfit. In reality, this was how slapdash it all was.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r290","rowIndex":290,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それに、案の定みんな大反対じゃないか。僕の言ったとおりだ。誰もこんな相続受け容れやしない」","en":"“And just as expected, everyone was against it. I told you so. Nobody’s going to accept a succession like this.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r291","rowIndex":291,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「みな恐れているだけさ。正当後継者であるお前が継ぐとなれば、いくら不満があったって、表立ったことは出来なくなるからな」","en":"“They’re just scared. If you—the rightful heir—take over, then no matter how much they hate it, they won’t be able to make a move in the open.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬明","displayName":"Ma Ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r292","rowIndex":292,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=4>馬明</tips>は都合のいい解釈しかしない。","en":"<tips=4>Ma Ming</tips> only ever saw what suited him.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r293","rowIndex":293,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「真面目に話すのが馬鹿馬鹿しくなるよ」","en":"“You make me feel like an idiot for even trying to have a serious conversation.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r294","rowIndex":294,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕は溜息をつく。","en":"I sighed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r295","rowIndex":295,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　このことについては<tips=81>龍頭</tips>と直接話すことにしよう。今は、他にも気になることがあった。","en":"I would discuss that directly with the <tips=81>Longtou</tips>. For now, something else was bothering me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r296","rowIndex":296,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>と言えば<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>の絶対的な独裁者だったはずなのだ。しかし、今の会食でのみなの態度はどうだろう？　<tips=35>フェルナンデス</tips>は昔からあんな調子だが、少なくとも、僕の記憶では、<tips=27>廖</tips>や他の幹部たちはもっと<tips=81>龍頭</tips>を恐れていたはずだ。","en":"<tips=3>Chris Tse</tips> was supposed to be the absolute dictator of <tips=7>YS</tips>. But look at how everyone had behaved over dinner. <tips=35>Fernandes</tips> had always been like that, but as I remembered it, <tips=27>Liao</tips> and the other senior officers had once feared the <tips=81>Longtou</tips> far more.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r297","rowIndex":297,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「無様だ」","en":"“Pathetic.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r298","rowIndex":298,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　思わず口にしてしまうと、","en":"I said it aloud without meaning to.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r299","rowIndex":299,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「何がだ？」","en":"“What is?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬明","displayName":"Ma Ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r300","rowIndex":300,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=4>馬明</tips>が反応をした。","en":"<tips=4>Ma Ming</tips> looked at me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r301","rowIndex":301,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　影響力が落ちたとは思っていたが、ここまでとは思わなかった。","en":"I had thought his influence had declined, but I never imagined it had gone this far.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r302","rowIndex":302,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そりゃ、まあ、そういうものなのだろう。","en":"Then again, perhaps that was simply how these things went.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r303","rowIndex":303,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=76>旧義勝</tips>は大した組織ではなく、ほとんど英雄<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>個人の名声が<tips=76>香港派</tips>の勢力を支えていた。ならば、彼が健康を損ない余命僅かとなった今急速に力を失いつつあるのも当然かもしれない。","en":"The <tips=76>old Yisheng</tips> had never amounted to much as an organization. The power of the <tips=76>Hong Kong faction</tips> had rested almost entirely on the personal fame of its hero, <tips=3>Chris Tse</tips>. With his health ruined and little time left to live, perhaps it was only natural that their power was now draining away so quickly.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r304","rowIndex":304,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「しかし、あまりにもあからさまだろう」","en":"“Even so, surely it shouldn’t be this blatant.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r305","rowIndex":305,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕がそのことについて話すと、","en":"When I raised the subject,","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r306","rowIndex":306,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「兄貴が寝込むようになってから、ずっとあんな調子だよ」","en":"“They’ve been like that ever since Big Brother became bedridden.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬明","displayName":"Ma Ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r307","rowIndex":307,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=4>馬明</tips>も、やるせないといった表情で溜息をついた。","en":"<tips=4>Ma Ming</tips> gave a helpless, frustrated sigh.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r308","rowIndex":308,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　なるほど、この<tips=4>馬明</tips>も危機感を覚えているという訳か。","en":"So even <tips=4>Ma Ming</tips> sensed the danger.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r309","rowIndex":309,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なあ<tips=4>馬明</tips>」","en":"“Hey, <tips=4>Ma Ming</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r310","rowIndex":310,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕はふと訊ねてみた。","en":"I asked him on impulse.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r311","rowIndex":311,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なんだ」","en":"“What?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬明","displayName":"Ma Ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r312","rowIndex":312,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「本当に、僕に<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>亡き後の<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>を指揮する能力があると思うかい？」","en":"“Do you honestly think I can lead <tips=7>YS</tips> after <tips=3>Chris Tse</tips> is gone?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r313","rowIndex":313,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「もちろんだとも」","en":"“Of course.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬明","displayName":"Ma Ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r314","rowIndex":314,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=4>馬明</tips>は頼もしく胸を張る。","en":"<tips=4>Ma Ming</tips> puffed out his chest, radiating confidence.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r315","rowIndex":315,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「この<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>に、<tips=2>阿亮</tips>以上の適任者はいない」","en":"“There is no one in <tips=7>YS</tips> better suited than <tips=2>Ah Leung</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬明","displayName":"Ma Ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r316","rowIndex":316,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　簡単に断言しすぎじゃないだろうか。","en":"He said that much too easily.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r317","rowIndex":317,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　とにかく、危惧していた状況が現実のものとなってしまった。","en":"At any rate, the situation I had feared was now real.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r318","rowIndex":318,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　突然の宣告はまったく不快だが、怒ってばかりもいられない。自分を制しようとするけれど、やっぱりむかつくな。僕は短気なのがいけない。しかもただ腹が立つだけでなく、胸の辺りがもやもやとする。リーダーシップを失いかけている父の姿への動揺がまだ残っている。あの<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>が侮られているんだ。","en":"The sudden pronouncement infuriated me, but I could not stay angry forever. I tried to get a grip on myself, but damn it, I was still furious. That temper of mine was a real problem. Worse, anger was not all I felt; something murky sat in my chest. I was still shaken by the sight of my father losing his hold over the organization. <tips=3>Chris Tse</tips>—that Chris Tse—was being treated with contempt.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r319","rowIndex":319,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ああ、なんだか腹が立つな。――こんな具合で心が千々に乱れたままでは考えもまとまらない。","en":"God, I was angry. —With my mind in this much turmoil, I could not think straight.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r320","rowIndex":320,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　もちろん僕はあの男の突然の指名を受けて<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>に入るつもりなんかこれっぽっちもない。せっかく念願の学生生活を手に入れ、子供の頃から好きだった科学の道へ進もうとしているというのに、ここでマフィアになんかなってたまるか。犯罪組織の一員として、くだらない利権争いや犯罪行為の指示をするなんてまっぴらごめんだ。","en":"Of course, I had not the slightest intention of joining <tips=7>YS</tips> simply because that man had suddenly named me. I had finally won the student life I had always dreamed of, and I was about to pursue the science I had loved since childhood. I would be damned if I became a mafioso now. I wanted no part of joining a criminal organization, squabbling over petty interests, and ordering other people to commit crimes.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r321","rowIndex":321,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　いかに後腐れなく自分と<tips=44>筱喬</tips>をこの面倒なしがらみから解放するか。","en":"How was I to free myself and <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> from these troublesome entanglements without leaving any loose ends?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r322","rowIndex":322,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕は歩くことで思考を整理するタイプだった。途中で車を降りると、<tips=57>滑走路通り</tips>のネオンに濡れながらあてもなく行ったり来たりする。","en":"I was the sort of person who thought things through by walking. I got out of the car partway there and wandered aimlessly up and down <tips=57>Runway Street</tips>, drenched in neon.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r323","rowIndex":323,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　先日猛獣の凄惨な狩り場となったこの通りは、何もなかったかのような活況を呈している。<tips=9>Y地区</tips>で起きた事件は基本的に報道されることはないが、やはり今回もそうだったようだ。","en":"The street, so recently the site of a beast’s grisly hunt, bustled as though nothing had happened. Incidents in <tips=9>Y District</tips> were almost never reported, and apparently this one had been no exception.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r324","rowIndex":324,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　通行するほとんどの客たちはそんな事件があったことさえ知らないだろうし、この通りでものを売る人々はどんな事件があっても何食わぬ顔をして営業することに慣れている。","en":"Most of the customers passing through probably did not even know anything had happened, while the people selling their wares here were used to keeping a straight face and carrying on no matter what occurred.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r325","rowIndex":325,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　この街に満ちた混沌とした生命力は、どんな出来事も飲み込んでしまう。やがて父が死んで、街のギャングたちに混乱が訪れたとしても、変わらないでいられるのだろうか？","en":"The chaotic vitality that filled this town swallowed every event whole. But could the town remain unchanged even after my father died and its gangs were thrown into turmoil?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r326","rowIndex":326,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　結局それも<tips=81>龍頭</tips>死後の<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>の状況次第だ。","en":"In the end, that too depended on what became of <tips=7>YS</tips> after the <tips=81>Longtou’s</tips> death.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r327","rowIndex":327,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　遺言通りにことが進めば<tips=84>マイケル・ツェー</tips>が<tips=81>龍頭</tips>になる。<tips=4>馬明</tips>や<tips=39>ジェフリー</tips>は彼を補佐するだろうが、果たして<tips=27>廖志明</tips>や他の幹部たちを御しきれるだろうか？　何か間違えれば、最悪<tips=76>旧義勝</tips>の<tips=69>香港グループ</tips>が街を追いやられる結果になってもおかしくはない。そうすれば、僕や、<tips=44>筱喬</tips>の立場はどうなるのか。","en":"If matters proceeded according to the will, <tips=84>Michael Tse</tips> would become <tips=81>Longtou</tips>. <tips=4>Ma Ming</tips> and <tips=39>Jeffrey</tips> would support him, but could they truly keep <tips=27>Liao Chi-ming</tips> and the other senior officers under control? One wrong move, and the <tips=69>Hong Kong group</tips> of the <tips=76>old Yisheng</tips> might, in the worst case, be driven out of town. If that happened, what would become of <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> and me?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r328","rowIndex":328,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しかし、こういうごちゃごちゃしたものから抜け出したくて街を出たはずなのに。","en":"And yet I had left town precisely because I wanted to escape this kind of tangled mess.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r329","rowIndex":329,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　馬鹿らしさに溜息をついていると、ポケット越しに携帯電話の振動が伝わった。","en":"As I sighed at the absurdity of it all, I felt my phone vibrate through my pocket.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r330","rowIndex":330,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"『<tips=1>リョウ</tips>さん？』","en":"“<tips=1>Ryo</tips>?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r331","rowIndex":331,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　汐家の自宅からかかってきた電話の声は、<tips=55>汐松子</tips>のものだった。","en":"The call was from the Shio residence, and the voice belonged to <tips=55>Matsuko Shio</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r332","rowIndex":332,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どうしたの？」","en":"“What is it?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r333","rowIndex":333,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"『お父さんから連絡があって、今夜<tips=1>リョウ</tips>さんに会いたいから、うちに来て欲しいということです』","en":"“Father called. He says he’d like to see <tips=1>you</tips> tonight, so he asked you to come over.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r334","rowIndex":334,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　あのサンプルについて何か変化があったのだろうか？","en":"Had something changed with that sample?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r335","rowIndex":335,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「わかったよ。今から行く」","en":"“All right. I’ll head over now.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r336","rowIndex":336,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"『今からですか？　お父さんの帰りは遅くなりますから、あんまり早いと待つことになってしまいますが……』","en":"“Right now? Father won’t be home until late, so if you come too early, you’ll only have to wait...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r337","rowIndex":337,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そこでゆっくり待たせて貰ってもいいだろう？」","en":"“You don’t mind if I come over and wait, do you?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r338","rowIndex":338,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"『あ、そういうことなら、勿論！』","en":"“Oh! In that case, of course!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r339","rowIndex":339,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=55>松子</tips>は電話の向こうではしゃいで、","en":"<tips=55>Matsuko’s</tips> voice brightened with excitement on the other end of the phone:","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r340","rowIndex":340,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"『料理を用意して待ってますからね！』","en":"“I’ll have dinner waiting for you!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r341","rowIndex":341,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「うん。じゃあ」","en":"“Yeah. See you then.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r342","rowIndex":342,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕はそう返し、通話を切った。","en":"I said goodbye and ended the call.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r343","rowIndex":343,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「今さっきお父さんから電話があって……」","en":"“Father just called...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐松子","displayName":"Matsuko Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r344","rowIndex":344,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　勝手知ったる汐家に上がり込み、差し出す手に上着を手渡したところで<tips=55>松子</tips>はそう切り出した。","en":"Once inside the Shio house, where I knew my way around, I handed my coat to <tips=55>Matsuko’s</tips> outstretched hand. Then she began:","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r345","rowIndex":345,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「急に仕事がたてこんで、今日は泊まり込みになってしまったそうです」","en":"“Work suddenly got hectic, and apparently he has to stay there overnight tonight.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐松子","displayName":"Matsuko Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r346","rowIndex":346,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「へえ、まだ泊まりの仕事とかしてるんだね。随分偉くなったはずなのに」","en":"“Huh. He still works overnight shifts? I thought he was pretty high up by now.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r347","rowIndex":347,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ええ、最近ちょっと忙しいみたいで……せっかく来て頂いたのにすみません。今日はどうしますか？」","en":"“Yes. Things seem to have been a little busy lately... I’m sorry you came all this way for nothing. What will you do now?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐松子","displayName":"Matsuko Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r348","rowIndex":348,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女は上目遣いで僕を見る。","en":"She looked up at me from beneath her lashes.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r349","rowIndex":349,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「明日にでも<tips=54>汐さん</tips>がいるときに出直すよ。でも、いま食事だけいただいてもいいかい？　会食だったんだけど、全然食った気がしなくてさ」","en":"“I’ll come back another day, maybe tomorrow, when <tips=54>Mr. Shio</tips> is here. But mind if I stay for dinner? I was at a dinner meeting, but I barely ate a thing.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r350","rowIndex":350,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「もちろんです！　それがいいです。久しぶりですし、つもる話でもしながら」","en":"“Of course! Please do. It’s been so long—we can finally catch up.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐松子","displayName":"Matsuko Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r351","rowIndex":351,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女は表情をキラキラとさせて一人で何度も頷くと、","en":"Her face lit up. She nodded eagerly several times, then said,","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r352","rowIndex":352,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「じゃあ、用意していた料理を持って来ます」","en":"“Then I’ll bring out everything I made.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐松子","displayName":"Matsuko Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r353","rowIndex":353,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　キッチンへ小走りで向かった。","en":"She trotted off to the kitchen.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r354","rowIndex":354,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その日の料理はポークソテー、八宝菜、厚揚げの甘辛く煮たやつ、納豆、なめこの味噌汁、そしてバジルとトマトのサラダ。","en":"That evening’s meal was sautéed pork, Chinese-style mixed stir-fry, thick fried tofu simmered in a sweet-and-savory sauce, natto, miso soup with nameko mushrooms, and a tomato-and-basil salad.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r355","rowIndex":355,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　メニューとしてはまとまりがないが、僕の好きな惣菜が勢揃いしている。そして細かい所もよく覚えていてくれて、ちゃんと納豆の薬味はネギでなくてミョウガだ。","en":"The menu made little sense as a whole, but all my favorite dishes were there. She remembered every last detail, too: the natto was garnished with myoga rather than green onion, just as it should be.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r356","rowIndex":356,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ありがとう。こんなに作るのは大変だったろうに」","en":"“Thanks. It must’ve been a lot of work to make all this.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r357","rowIndex":357,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　箸を手に取りそう言った。我ながらぶっきらぼうな言い方だ。ここまでしてくれたのだからもう少し嬉しそうに笑いながらでも言ったら良かったのかもしれない。","en":"I said it as I picked up my chopsticks. Even to my own ears, I sounded brusque. After everything she had done for me, perhaps I should at least have smiled and made myself look pleased.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r358","rowIndex":358,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　が、彼女は少しも意に介さず、","en":"But she paid it no mind at all:","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r359","rowIndex":359,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ごめんなさい。せっかく来て頂いたのに、普通の家庭料理ばかりで」","en":"“I’m sorry. You’ve taken the trouble to come, and all I’ve made is ordinary home cooking.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐松子","displayName":"Matsuko Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r360","rowIndex":360,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　向かいの席に座って照れくさそうにしている。","en":"She took the seat across from me, looking a little embarrassed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r361","rowIndex":361,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「こういうのでいいんだよ」","en":"“This is exactly the kind of food I like.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r362","rowIndex":362,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして僕はさっそくポークソテーを一切れ箸でつまみ、口に放り込んだ。美味い。","en":"Then I immediately picked up a slice of the sautéed pork with my chopsticks and popped it into my mouth. Delicious.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r363","rowIndex":363,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　咀嚼しながら、先日<tips=10>道夫</tips>が彼女を「変わった」と言ったのを思い出した。","en":"As I chewed, I remembered <tips=10>Michio</tips> saying the other day that she had “changed.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r364","rowIndex":364,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　確かに<tips=55>松子</tips>が変わったのは間違いない。例えば子供の頃だったら、こんな風に楽しそうに食事を作る姿なんか想像出来なかったろう。","en":"There was no doubt that <tips=55>Matsuko</tips> had changed. When we were children, for instance, I could never have imagined her looking so happy as she cooked a meal like this.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r365","rowIndex":365,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　もちろん、<tips=10>道夫</tips>が言ったのはそんな昔との比較ではなく、もっと最近のことだろうけれど。","en":"Of course, <tips=10>Michio</tips> was probably comparing her to the more recent past, not to the girl she had been in childhood.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r366","rowIndex":366,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「料理を作るのは好き？」","en":"“Do you like cooking?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r367","rowIndex":367,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ふと思い立ってそう質問をしてみると、","en":"I asked her on a sudden whim. She answered,","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r368","rowIndex":368,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「楽しいですよ。でも、食べてくれる人がいるからでしょうね。多分一人暮らしだったら作らないと思います」","en":"“It’s fun. Though I suppose that’s because there’s someone here to eat what I make. If I lived alone, I probably wouldn’t cook at all.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐松子","displayName":"Matsuko Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r369","rowIndex":369,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=55>松子</tips>はそう言って苦笑する。","en":"<tips=55>Matsuko</tips> gave a rueful smile as she said it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r370","rowIndex":370,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ここで僕は父がもうすぐ亡くなることについて話そうかとも思ったが、結局口にはしなかった。","en":"I considered telling her that my father would soon die, but in the end I said nothing.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r371","rowIndex":371,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=55>松子</tips>も街の噂である程度の状況は知っている筈だし、この急遽の滞在の延長から何事か察してはいるとは思うのだが、その件には触れないで、最近この家庭の周りで起きた細々とした日常のなかの話を、楽しそうに報告してくれる。","en":"<tips=55>Matsuko</tips> must have known something of the situation from rumors around town, and my sudden decision to extend my stay had probably told her that something was happening. Yet she never touched on the subject. Instead, she cheerfully told me about all the small, ordinary things that had happened around the household lately.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r372","rowIndex":372,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そうして食事が終わるが、僕はすぐに帰る気にならなかった。","en":"By the time dinner was over, I did not feel like leaving right away.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r373","rowIndex":373,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　リビングルームで<tips=54>汐さん</tips>がコレクションしているクラシックのアナログレコードを流し、<tips=54>汐さん</tips>のとっておきのワインを勝手に開け、僕と<tips=55>松子</tips>は久しぶりに語らった。","en":"In the living room, I put on one of the classical records from <tips=54>Mr. Shio’s</tips> collection and, without permission, opened one of <tips=54>Mr. Shio’s</tips> best bottles of wine. Then <tips=55>Matsuko</tips> and I talked for the first time in ages.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r374","rowIndex":374,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕は学校でのエピソードをいくつか話して、教授たちは変人ばかりだと言ったり、実験での自分の失敗談などを面白おかしく脚色して話すと彼女はそのたびにころころと笑った。","en":"I told her stories about school—about how every professor there was an eccentric, and comic, embellished versions of my own failures in the laboratory. Each story set her laughing all over again.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r375","rowIndex":375,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女の方は、今働いている児童養護施設での子供とのやりとりを話してくれた。","en":"For her part, she told me about the children at the children’s home where she now worked and the things that passed between them.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r376","rowIndex":376,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「楽しくって、楽しくって、仕方がないんです。今が一番人生で充実しているかもしれません」","en":"“I love it so much I can hardly stand it. I may be more fulfilled now than at any other time in my life.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐松子","displayName":"Matsuko Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r377","rowIndex":377,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　興奮気味にそう語る。","en":"She told me this in a rush of excitement.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r378","rowIndex":378,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「へえ、子供の世話がそんなに楽しいんだ。その仕事をすると聞いた時は、あまり向いてるとは思わなかったから、悩んでしまうんじゃないかと想像していたけれど」","en":"“Huh. You really enjoy looking after children that much? When I heard you were taking that job, I didn’t think you were very suited to it. I thought you might have a hard time.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r379","rowIndex":379,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「私も成長したんですよ。ご心配なく」","en":"“I’ve grown up too, you know. Don’t worry.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐松子","displayName":"Matsuko Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r380","rowIndex":380,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕が昔どれだけきみを楽しませようと苦労したか、もう覚えていないだろう？","en":"You probably don’t remember how hard I used to work to make you happy, do you?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r381","rowIndex":381,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　内心でそう思いながら、グラスを傾ける。","en":"Thinking this, I took a sip of wine.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r382","rowIndex":382,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕たちは二人並んでソファに腰をおろしていた。","en":"We sat side by side on the sofa.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r383","rowIndex":383,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　間接照明の淡い光が、すべてのものをぼんやりと夜の闇のなかに生き物のように浮かび上がらせている。","en":"In the pale indirect light, everything emerged dimly from the darkness of night, as if alive.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r384","rowIndex":384,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　窓の外からは、時々トラックが通るゴトゴトという音がきこえる。","en":"From beyond the window came the occasional rattling rumble of a passing truck.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r385","rowIndex":385,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=70>シオクリーン</tips>は深夜も営業している。","en":"<tips=70>Shio Clean</tips> operated through the night.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r386","rowIndex":386,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　髪から彼女の匂いがした。","en":"I could smell her hair.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r387","rowIndex":387,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　触れてはいないけれども、すぐそばにいるから体温を感じる。その手にしたグラスのワインはあまり減っていないが、その元々は白い頬は、首筋は、パジャマの襟から覗く胸元はピンク色に染まっている。","en":"Although we were not touching, she was near enough that I could feel her warmth. The wine in her glass had scarcely gone down, yet her naturally pale cheeks, the line of her neck, and the upper chest visible at the collar of her pajamas were all flushed pink.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r388","rowIndex":388,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おそらく僕も赤くなっているのだろう。","en":"I was probably flushed as well.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r389","rowIndex":389,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　酔いが、疲れていた脳を適度にほぐしてくれている。","en":"The pleasant buzz was loosening my tired mind just enough.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r390","rowIndex":390,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「私の勤めているところの子供って、みんなつらい体験をして来ているから、ひねくれていたり、とても卑屈だったりするんですよ。だけど、私はそういうところにすごく共感出来て」","en":"“The children where I work have all been through painful things, so some of them can be bitter and defensive, or terribly down on themselves. But those are the parts of them I understand so well.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐松子","displayName":"Matsuko Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r391","rowIndex":391,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=55>松子</tips>は苦笑して、","en":"With a rueful smile, <tips=55>Matsuko</tips> went on,","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r392","rowIndex":392,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それに、同僚の人たちもみんな素敵で……」","en":"“And besides, all my coworkers are wonderful…”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐松子","displayName":"Matsuko Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r393","rowIndex":393,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それは良かった」","en":"“I’m glad.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r394","rowIndex":394,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕が返事をすると、彼女は急に僕を見つめ、","en":"At my answer, she suddenly looked straight at me:","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r395","rowIndex":395,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あの、<tips=1>リョウ</tips>さん、そう言えば……私……この間、同僚の家を訪ねて……」","en":"“Um, <tips=1>Ryo</tips>... Speaking of that... The other day, I... went to a coworker’s house...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐松子","displayName":"Matsuko Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r396","rowIndex":396,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その真剣な表情に僕は戸惑いをおぼえつつ、次の言葉を待った。","en":"Her earnest expression left me bewildered, but I waited for what she would say next.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r397","rowIndex":397,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　けれど、結局彼女は何も言わずに溜息をつき、","en":"But in the end, she left the thought unfinished, sighed, and said,","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r398","rowIndex":398,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……とにかく、いまの職場は、色んなことを学ばせてくれます。お給料貰っているのが申し訳ないくらい」","en":"“...Anyway, I learn so much at the place where I work now. I almost feel guilty that they’re paying me.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐松子","displayName":"Matsuko Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r399","rowIndex":399,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕は何を言いかけたのか少し気になったが、それには触れず、","en":"I was curious about what she had begun to say, but I let it pass and replied,","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r400","rowIndex":400,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうか。……まあ、楽しいならなんだっていいんだよ。この世界で、何かを楽しく思えるってことは何よりも大切な奇跡だからね」","en":"“I see. ...Well, anything is fine if it makes you happy. In this world, finding joy in anything at all is the most precious miracle of all.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r401","rowIndex":401,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いつもそんなことばっかり」","en":"“That’s the sort of thing you always say.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐松子","displayName":"Matsuko Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r402","rowIndex":402,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=55>松子</tips>はおかしそうに笑う。","en":"<tips=55>Matsuko</tips> gave an amused laugh.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r403","rowIndex":403,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あのさ、<tips=55>松子</tips>は、まだこの街を出る気にはならない？」","en":"“Hey, <tips=55>Matsuko</tips>... do you still not want to leave this town?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r404","rowIndex":404,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕はほどよい疲労と安らぎで、うとうとしながらそう尋ねた。","en":"Pleasantly tired and relaxed, I asked as I began to doze.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r405","rowIndex":405,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「このろくでもない街のあれこれを全部捨ててさ、外で平和に暮らすんだ。今と同じような仕事は街の外にもあるだろう。もし仕事が見つからなくても僕が面倒を見る」","en":"“Leave everything in this miserable town behind and live peacefully outside it. There must be work like yours beyond the town too. Even if you couldn’t find a job, I’d look after you.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r406","rowIndex":406,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どうして急にそんなことを」","en":"“Why this all of a sudden?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐松子","displayName":"Matsuko Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r407","rowIndex":407,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「この街に久しぶりに戻って来たんだけど、やっぱり気持ちが重苦しくなるんだ。この街は正常じゃない。ずっと昔から思っていたけれど、外に出てはっきりとそう感じたよ。街の外は、空だって、もっと晴れていて気持ちがいいしね」","en":"“Being back in this town after so long has brought that oppressive feeling right back. This place isn’t normal. I’d thought so for years, but leaving made it perfectly clear. Beyond the town, even the sky is clearer and more pleasant.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r408","rowIndex":408,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女が困っているのが雰囲気で伝わる。","en":"I could sense her discomfort in the air between us.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r409","rowIndex":409,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「僕はいまやっとやりたいことが出来ている。これを続けたいんだ。そのためには完全にこの街と縁を切らなくちゃいけない」","en":"“I finally get to do what I’ve always wanted. I want to keep doing it. And for that, I have to sever every tie I have to this town.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r410","rowIndex":410,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しばしの沈黙のあと、僕の手に温かいものが触れた。","en":"After a moment of silence, something warm touched my hand.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r411","rowIndex":411,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女が僕の手を握っている。","en":"She was holding my hand.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r412","rowIndex":412,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そう言ってくれるのはとても嬉しいです。出来ればそうしたいです。でも……」","en":"“I’m so happy to hear you say that. If I could, I would. But...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐松子","displayName":"Matsuko Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r413","rowIndex":413,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女はじっと僕の目を見つめる。でも、の続きはなかなか口に出せないようだが言いたいことはわかった。","en":"She looked steadily into my eyes. She could not seem to bring herself to finish the sentence, but I knew what she meant.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r414","rowIndex":414,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「僕らはここで今までいやなものを沢山見てきたじゃないか。そりゃ街の外が楽園ってわけじゃない。でも、ここにいるとみんなおかしくなってしまう。それがいやなんだ」","en":"“We’ve seen so many terrible things here over the years, haven’t we? I’m not saying the world outside is paradise. But this place twists everyone who stays. I can’t stand that.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r415","rowIndex":415,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「確かにここは普通じゃないかもしれない。……でも、ごめんなさい。私、今はこの街から出ることは出来ません」","en":"“You’re right. This place may not be normal. ...But I’m sorry. I can’t leave this town. Not yet.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐松子","displayName":"Matsuko Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r416","rowIndex":416,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女は迷いなくそう言った。","en":"There was no hesitation in her answer.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r417","rowIndex":417,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……まだここに、やりのこしたことがあるんです。それは、私にとって、とても大事なことなんです」","en":"“...There’s still something here I have left undone. Something very important to me.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐松子","displayName":"Matsuko Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r418","rowIndex":418,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その返事はわかっていた。でも落胆したのも事実だ。","en":"I had known what her answer would be. But I was disappointed all the same.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r419","rowIndex":419,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうか」","en":"“I see.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r420","rowIndex":420,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕はこれ以上言うのはやめ、代わりに彼女の手を強く握り返して、","en":"I stopped there. Instead, I squeezed her hand firmly in return and said,","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r421","rowIndex":421,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「変なことを訊いて悪かったね」","en":"“Sorry. That was a strange thing to ask.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r422","rowIndex":422,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いえ、本当にごめんなさい」","en":"“No. I’m truly sorry.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐松子","displayName":"Matsuko Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r423","rowIndex":423,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女は僕の手を握り返しながら、","en":"She squeezed my hand back and said,","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r424","rowIndex":424,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「でも、ずっとじゃないんです。いつかは私もそうしたいです。色んなことがはっきりして、全部が終わったら、そうしたら。……だから、ちょっとだけ待ってくださいね」","en":"“But it won’t be forever. Someday, I want that too. Once everything is clear and it’s all over, then... So please, just wait a little longer.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐松子","displayName":"Matsuko Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r425","rowIndex":425,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「わかった」","en":"“Okay.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-1:r426","rowIndex":426,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕は言って、それ以上その話題を続けるのをやめた。","en":"With that, I let the subject drop.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}}]},{"position":5,"code":"X2-1","unitId":"X2-1","rows":[{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r1","rowIndex":1,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=9>Y地区</tips>の西側には朽ちかけたトタンやシミのついた板キレなど、あり合わせのもので作り上げた粗末な簡易住宅が並ぶ地域がある。","en":"On the western side of <tips=9>Y District</tips> lay a neighborhood of wretched makeshift homes cobbled together from whatever came to hand: rotting sheets of tin, stained scraps of wood, and the like.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r2","rowIndex":2,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そこに住む人は貧しくはあるが賑やかで、路上では子供たちが声をあげながらボール遊びに興じていたり、生きた鶏をしめる老人の周りには少しでも肉を安く買おうと人が集まり、太った女たちは煙草を吸いながら立ち話をしている。また別の片隅では中年の男たちが輪になって座り込み、大麻を回して吸っている。","en":"The people who lived there were poor but lively. Children shouted as they played ball in the streets; people hoping to buy meat a little cheaper gathered around an old man slaughtering live chickens; heavyset women stood smoking and talking; and elsewhere, circles of middle-aged men sat in the street passing marijuana around.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r3","rowIndex":3,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼らが貧しいのは仕事にありつけないからではなく、働く意欲が低いのだ。","en":"They were poor not because they could not find work, but because they had little inclination to work.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r4","rowIndex":4,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　金がなくなれば<tips=57>滑走路通り</tips>だの繁華街の方へ行ってアルバイトをしたり、もう少し度胸のあるものはひったくりや万引きなどをするのだが、多少でも小金があれば何もせずにだらだらと路上で時間を過ごしている。","en":"When they ran out of money, they went to <tips=57>Runway Street</tips> or the entertainment district and picked up odd jobs; the slightly bolder among them turned to purse-snatching or shoplifting. But as long as they had a little cash in hand, they did nothing and idled away the hours in the street.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r5","rowIndex":5,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　肌の色も顔立ちもまちまちで、混血児も多く、国籍も定かではないが、路上の人々はみな明るく陽気で、その日を楽しんで暮らしていた。","en":"Their skin colors and features varied widely, many were of mixed descent, and their nationalities were uncertain. Yet the people in the streets were all bright and cheerful, enjoying each day as it came.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r6","rowIndex":6,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　もちろん、表情が明るいからといって彼らの心が満たされているというわけでもなく、希望から見放された者たち特有のある種軽薄な明るさと、人間が本質的にもつ楽観的な明るさの両方が複雑に入り交じったものではあったが。","en":"Of course, their bright expressions did not mean they felt fulfilled. Their cheer was a complex mixture: the peculiar frivolity of people abandoned by hope, mingled with the optimism inherent in human nature.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r7","rowIndex":7,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　いかにも<tips=9>Y地区</tips>らしいこの地域の一角、雑木林に隔てられたところに、周囲の住宅とは一線を画す堅牢なコンクリートの壁で囲まれた城のように巨大な建築物があった。","en":"Beyond a thicket in one corner of this quintessentially <tips=9>Y District</tips> neighborhood stood an enormous, castle-like building. Stout concrete walls set it sharply apart from the homes around it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r8","rowIndex":8,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　出入り口は正門と裏の通用門の二つがあり、いずれの門にも警備員が張り付き、入ろうとする者だけでなく、出ようとするものに対しても厳しい選別を行っている。彼らの態度をつぶさに観察すると、むしろ塀の内側、中から外に出ようとするものに対する警戒の方が強いと感じられるかもしれない。","en":"It had two entrances, a main gate and a service gate at the rear. Guards stood watch at both, subjecting those who tried to leave to the same strict scrutiny as those who sought to enter. Anyone who watched them closely might even conclude that they were more wary of people trying to pass from inside the walls to the world beyond.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r9","rowIndex":9,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　門に掛かる表札には、<tips=6>国立巻河原病院</tips>とある。しかし、世間ではあまりそうは呼ばれない。","en":"The plaque on the gate bore the name <tips=6>National Makigawara Hospital</tips>. But that was rarely what people called it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r10","rowIndex":10,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"『<tips=6>タイプＢ収容所</tips>』","en":"‘The <tips=6>Type B Internment Center</tips>.’","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r11","rowIndex":11,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そんなおどろおどろしい通称で呼ばれることが、ほとんどであろう。","en":"It was almost always known by that ominous nickname.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r12","rowIndex":12,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その歴史は古い。","en":"It had a long history.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r13","rowIndex":13,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　基地が取り壊された直後の、更地のなかに置き捨てられた廃墟がぽつりぽつりと目に付くような、まるで人気のない土地にこの病院は建設された。","en":"The hospital had been built just after the base was demolished, on virtually deserted land where abandoned ruins still dotted the cleared lots.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r14","rowIndex":14,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　つまり、この病院は街が出来るよりも前に建設されたということだ。","en":"In other words, the hospital had been built before the town itself.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r15","rowIndex":15,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　雑然としたスラム街に病院を建設したのではなく、先に病院が出来てから、まわりの空き地に勝手にうろんな人々が住み着いたのである。","en":"The hospital had not been built in the middle of a ramshackle slum. It came first; only afterward had dubious characters simply moved onto the vacant land around it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r16","rowIndex":16,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　塀の中には五つの建物があった。","en":"There were five buildings inside the walls.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r17","rowIndex":17,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そのうち三つは患者たちが暮らす病棟。","en":"Three of them were wards where the patients lived.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r18","rowIndex":18,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　もう一つはOT棟と呼ばれており、作業療法室、図書室、ビデオ視聴室などがある。","en":"Another was called the OT Building and contained an occupational-therapy room, a library, a video room, and other facilities.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r19","rowIndex":19,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして、最後の一つは医局や事務室などがある管理棟となっていた。","en":"The fifth was the Administration Building, which housed the physicians’ offices, administrative offices, and other departments.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r20","rowIndex":20,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　建物の間の空間は運動場となっており、雨に打たれて錆だらけになったバスケットボールのゴールが見える。","en":"The spaces between the buildings served as exercise yards. Basketball hoops stood there, eaten through with rust from years in the rain.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r21","rowIndex":21,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　この病院は、<tips=17>タイプB</tips>専門病院である。","en":"This hospital specialized exclusively in <tips=17>Type B</tips> patients.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r22","rowIndex":22,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　患者たちはその症状の内容や性別によって、それぞれの病棟に振り分けられている。","en":"Patients were assigned to the various wards according to the nature of their symptoms and their sex.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r23","rowIndex":23,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　たとえば比較的症状の軽い女性患者はB病棟の一階で暮らし、病院内の施設を自由に利用することが出来る。急性期で症状が安定しないが集団生活を営める状態である男性患者はA病棟の二階で暮らし、棟の外に出る扉には鍵がかけられている。","en":"Female patients with comparatively mild symptoms, for example, lived on the first floor of Ward B and could use the hospital’s facilities freely. Male patients in the acute phase whose symptoms remained unstable, but who could still tolerate communal living, lived on the second floor of Ward A. The door leading out of that building was kept locked.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r24","rowIndex":24,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=83>能見美紗</tips>が勤務しているのは、B病棟の三階だ。","en":"<tips=83>Misa Nomi</tips> worked on the third floor of Ward B.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r25","rowIndex":25,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　症状が慢性化し、状態が安定しているものの軽度とは言えない女性患者たちが暮らす閉鎖病棟であった。","en":"It was a locked ward for female patients whose conditions, though chronic and stable, could not be described as mild.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r26","rowIndex":26,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=83>美紗</tips>は二十六才のまだ若い看護師だが、なぜこんな施設で働くことになってしまったのかと、時に自分の人生を不思議に思う。","en":"At twenty-six, <tips=83>Misa</tips> was still a young nurse. Sometimes she found herself wondering how on earth her life had brought her to work in a place like this.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r27","rowIndex":27,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　親の入院を見舞いに行った時、看護師の優しい振る舞いと、てきぱきと働くさまにいたく感動した、というエピソードは少女が看護師になる理由としてはごく平凡なものだろう。","en":"A girl visits a hospitalized parent and is deeply moved by the nurses’ kindness and brisk competence: as reasons for becoming a nurse went, it was an utterly ordinary story.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r28","rowIndex":28,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　だが実際看護師になって、就職先を探す時、必ずしも希望通りの診療科に配属されるとは限らないものだ。","en":"But even after becoming a nurse and finding a job, there was no guarantee that she would be assigned to the department she wanted.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r29","rowIndex":29,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しかし、あまりにも<tips=97>特殊なタイプＢ</tips>専用病棟――しかも悪名高い『<tips=6>タイプＢ収容所</tips>』に勤務することになるというのは、看護学生であった頃の<tips=83>美紗</tips>の想像のなかにはまったく存在しなかった。","en":"Yet the idea that she would end up working in a ward exclusively for <tips=97>special Type Bs</tips>—and at the infamous ‘<tips=6>Type B Internment Center</tips>,’ no less—had never once entered <tips=83>Misa’s</tips> imagination when she was a nursing student.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r30","rowIndex":30,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　この病院は、よその病院で面倒を見切れなくなった患者や、社会で問題を起こして行政によって強制的に入院させられた患者などを積極的に受け入れている。","en":"The hospital actively took in patients other hospitals had given up trying to manage, along with people who had caused trouble in society and been committed by the authorities.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r31","rowIndex":31,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=17>タイプB</tips>は基本的に一度精神症状が出てしまったら完治することはない。しかも、彼らはその異常な身体能力のために、収容する病棟には特別な設備が必要となる。","en":"As a rule, once psychiatric symptoms appeared in a <tips=17>Type B</tips>, full recovery was impossible. Their extraordinary physical abilities also meant that any ward housing them required special equipment.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r32","rowIndex":32,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　社会復帰のためのトレーニングも行われるが、職員の努力の甲斐なく、ほとんどの場合生活能力は回復しない。","en":"Training for reintegration into society was provided, but despite the staff’s efforts, patients almost never recovered the ability to manage daily life.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r33","rowIndex":33,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ルール的には家族が望めば退院は可能だが、症状の重い患者を家庭で暮らさせるのは不可能だ。家族にいくら深い愛情があってもだ。そして、すぐに病院に舞い戻るか、何か不幸な事件を起こしてしまうのが現実だった。","en":"Under the rules, a patient could be discharged if the family wished. In reality, a severely ill patient could not live at home, no matter how deeply the family loved them. They would soon return to the hospital—or else some tragedy would occur.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r34","rowIndex":34,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　つまり、この病院に送られた患者は、そのほとんどが一生病院の敷地から一歩も出ることがなく生涯を終える。症状を改善させることも出来ぬまま。","en":"In other words, most patients sent to this hospital would live out their lives without ever setting foot beyond its grounds. Their symptoms never improving.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r35","rowIndex":35,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　これが、この病院が収容所と呼ばれる所以であった。","en":"That was why the hospital was called an internment center.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r36","rowIndex":36,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　このような施設は日本に何カ所かあり、いずれもなんらかの隠語で呼称されている。","en":"There were several such facilities in Japan, and every one of them was known by some euphemism or code name.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r37","rowIndex":37,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=9>Y地区</tips>では発症後も街で生活するケースは少なくないが、それ以外の一般的な地域では、発症した<tips=17>タイプB</tips>のほとんどがどこかの施設に収容され、そこで一生を過ごすことになる。","en":"In <tips=9>Y District</tips>, it was not uncommon for people to remain in the town even after symptoms appeared. In more ordinary parts of the country, however, nearly every <tips=17>Type B</tips> who developed symptoms was confined to an institution and spent the rest of their life there.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r38","rowIndex":38,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　どこも病床は余っており、軽度の患者でも預かり先に困ることはない。","en":"All of these hospitals had beds to spare, so even patients with mild symptoms had no trouble finding somewhere to take them.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r39","rowIndex":39,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　日本には病院が多すぎるのではないかと批判されている。","en":"Japan was criticized for having too many hospitals.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r40","rowIndex":40,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　これらの病院は、<tips=17>タイプB</tips>自体の世間での悪いイメージと相まって、とてつもなく非人間的な施設だとイメージされている。","en":"Coupled with the public’s prejudice against <tips=17>Type Bs</tips> themselves, these hospitals were widely imagined to be places of monstrous inhumanity.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r41","rowIndex":41,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　看護師としての教育を受けた<tips=83>美紗</tips>でさえも、そのような偏見がなかったとは言えない。","en":"Even <tips=83>Misa</tips>, with her training as a nurse, could not claim to have been free of such prejudice.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r42","rowIndex":42,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　看護学校は、<tips=17>タイプB</tips>についてそこまで詳しく教えてはくれなかったし、最初に就職した病院では<tips=17>タイプB</tips>の患者を扱うことがなかった。","en":"Nursing school had not taught her much about <tips=17>Type B</tips>, and at her first hospital she had never treated a <tips=17>Type B</tips> patient.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r43","rowIndex":43,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そもそも普通に暮らしていて、AだろうがBだろうが、ミュータント自体と出会うという場面に遭遇することは滅多にない。そこらじゅうにミュータントがいる<tips=9>Y地区</tips>は特別なのだ。","en":"In ordinary life, one rarely encountered a mutant at all, whether A or B. <tips=9>Y District</tips>, where mutants were everywhere, was exceptional.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r44","rowIndex":44,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　だから、<tips=17>タイプB</tips>しかいないこの病院に勤務し、さらにBだけでなくAまでも街を闊歩している場所に暮らすというのは、全く<tips=83>美紗</tips>にとっては考えられないことで、それまで働いていた救急病院から異動を命じられた時には母の前でうっすら涙を見せたものだった。","en":"For <tips=83>Misa</tips>, the thought of working at a hospital populated entirely by <tips=17>Type Bs</tips>—and living in a place where not only Bs but even As walked openly through the streets—had once been inconceivable. When she received orders transferring her from the emergency hospital where she had worked, she had teared up in front of her mother.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r45","rowIndex":45,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それは、彼女が特別に弱かったのではなく、ごく当然の反応なのである。","en":"That was not because she was unusually weak. It was an entirely natural reaction.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r46","rowIndex":46,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その日、<tips=83>美紗</tips>は夜勤明けの朝を迎えていた。","en":"That morning, <tips=83>Misa</tips> was finishing a night shift.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r47","rowIndex":47,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　何年やっても夜勤というものに慣れることが出来ない。日勤のスタッフに夜の間の出来事を伝える「申し送り」の時間はいつも、うつらうつら、その精神は半ば夢の世界にある。","en":"No matter how many years she worked them, she could never grow used to night shifts. During handover, when the night staff briefed the day shift on everything that had happened overnight, she was always nodding off, her mind already halfway into a dream.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r48","rowIndex":48,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　この病院はとにかく申し送りが長い。今時、カーデックスなんて骨董品、他のどこの病院が使っているのだろう？　いくら建物が古いからって、設備やシステムは新しいものに変えていけるはずなのに。","en":"Handover at this hospital was interminable. What other hospital still used an antique like a Kardex these days? The building might be old, but surely the equipment and systems could still be replaced.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r49","rowIndex":49,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　どうやらこの塀のなかにあるものはすべて時が止まってしまうらしい。道具だけでなくスタッフも患者も、いつまでも古い時間のなかにいる。これは、公立病院だから？","en":"Apparently, time stopped for everything inside these walls. Tools, staff, patients—everything remained forever trapped in an earlier age. Was it because this was a public hospital?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r50","rowIndex":50,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　前の病院だったら数分で終わった申し送りが、ここではとてつもなく長く、眠気と戦う<tips=83>美紗</tips>の精神にとっては永劫とも思える時間だった。","en":"At her previous hospital, handover had taken only a few minutes. Here, it dragged on absurdly long—an eternity to <tips=83>Misa</tips> as she fought to stay awake.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r51","rowIndex":51,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……藤田真由美さん。<ruby=コート>kot</ruby>マイナス三日で昨日<ruby=ジーイー>GE</ruby>施行。反応便多量。日中はおかわりなく過ごされています。夜間良眠。……本田晃子さん。昨日の十一時にヘッドガードをつけずに転倒しています。腫脹や発赤はなく、バイタル正常。現在は観察室で一般状態観察中です。本日の午前にドクターが来て、それで問題がなければ拘束解除になる見通しです。夜間良眠。……古川保美さん。この方は現在拘束中ですが、体動が激しく、昨日日勤帯の十三時三十分にバルーンが抜けていたのでさしなおそうとしたのですが、拒否が激しく職員を怒鳴りつけ……」","en":"“...Mayumi Fujita. No bowel movement for three days; glycerin enema given yesterday. A large amount of stool was passed in response. No changes during the day. Slept well overnight. ...Akiko Honda. Fell at eleven yesterday without her head guard. No swelling or redness; vital signs normal. She is currently in the observation room under general observation. The doctor will examine her this morning, and if there is no problem, we expect to discontinue restraints. Slept well overnight. ...Yasumi Furukawa. She is presently under restraint, but has been moving violently. At thirteen thirty during yesterday’s day shift, we found that her balloon catheter had come out. When we attempted to reinsert it, she resisted fiercely and shouted at the staff...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r52","rowIndex":52,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　日勤者たちの前で、昨夜一緒に夜勤をつとめた同僚が看護記録を読み上げる。その声を、注意して聞こうとすればするほど、眠気が意識を現実から遠ざける。","en":"Before the day staff, the colleague who had worked the night shift with her read aloud from the nursing record. The more carefully Misa tried to listen, the farther sleep carried her consciousness from reality.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r53","rowIndex":53,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　これなら自分の申し送りを後にすればよかった。先に済ませてしまったものだから、完全に緊張感がなくなってしまって、睡魔に抵抗することが難しい。","en":"She should have saved her own handover report for later. Going first had taken away the last thing keeping her alert, and now she could barely resist sleep.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r54","rowIndex":54,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ねえ、この人はもうツナギを外してもいいんじゃないかしら？　<tips=95>金眼現象</tips>も出なくなったし、もともとはちゃんと出来る人じゃない。なんだか、ツナギを着せてから甘えちゃって、どんどんADLが低下している気がするの」","en":"“Don’t you think we could take her out of the coverall now? The <tips=95>golden-eye phenomenon</tips> has stopped, and she used to be capable of doing things for herself. Since we put her in the coverall, she seems to have started relying on us, and her ADLs keep declining.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r55","rowIndex":55,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　Ｔという患者のところで、申し送りを遮って、前島ナースが提案する。","en":"When the report reached a patient identified as T, Nurse Maejima interrupted with that proposal.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r56","rowIndex":56,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　この病棟でも有数のベテラン看護師は、いつもこうして他人の申し送りに口を挟む。熱心なのはいいのだが、ここで即席のカンファレンスが始まってしまうと、申し送りが長引き、夜勤者の帰宅が遅れる原因となってしまう。","en":"One of the most experienced nurses on the ward, Maejima was forever interrupting other people’s reports this way. Her dedication was admirable. But once an impromptu conference began, handover ran long and the night staff got home late.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r57","rowIndex":57,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"（また始まっちゃった）","en":"(Here we go again.)","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r58","rowIndex":58,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=83>美紗</tips>が内心でうんざりしつつ、うっかりあくびをしてしまうと、隣の<tips=94>吉田主任</tips>がキッと睨む。","en":"<tips=83>Misa</tips>, inwardly exasperated, accidentally yawned. <tips=94>Chief Yoshida</tips>, sitting beside her, fixed her with a glare.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r59","rowIndex":59,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　この病棟の看護師の年齢は幅広く、<tips=83>美紗</tips>のような二十代の若いものもいれば、前島ナースのような五十代もおり、もっと年配の、七十代の看護師なども活躍している。","en":"The nurses on this ward varied widely in age. Some, like <tips=83>Misa</tips>, were in their twenties; Nurse Maejima was in her fifties; and older nurses in their seventies were still on staff.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r60","rowIndex":60,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　男女の比率は男性四割、女性六割といった具合で、看護スタッフの比率としては男性が少ないわけではないが、この病院の業務内容を考えるとまだ足りない。","en":"The nursing staff was roughly forty percent male and sixty percent female—not an unusually low proportion of men for the profession. But given the nature of the work at this hospital, it was still not enough.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r61","rowIndex":61,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しかもこれは病院全体の話で、このB棟三階には男性看護師は一人しかおらず、看護助手も男性は二人しかいない。","en":"Those figures applied to the hospital as a whole. On the third floor of Ward B, there was only one male nurse, and only two of the nursing assistants were men.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r62","rowIndex":62,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　男性スタッフの多くはもっと乱暴な患者を扱う病棟に配属されており、慢性期の女性患者を扱うこの病棟は後回しにされている。","en":"Most male staff were assigned to wards with more violent patients. This chronic-care ward for women was given lower priority.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r63","rowIndex":63,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　どうしても男手が足りない時は他の病棟から応援を頼むことになるが、この病棟では患者が不穏になって手を付けられない、などということは希である。","en":"When they absolutely needed more male staff, they called another ward for help. But on this ward it was rare for a patient to become so agitated that no one could handle her.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r64","rowIndex":64,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ほとんどは、横になったまま動かない患者を車椅子に乗せたり、書類の詰まった段ボールを棚から下ろしたりといった力仕事のために男性が必要になるといった程度だ。実際のところ、女性だけでもほとんどの業務は間に合う。","en":"Men were generally needed only for physical tasks: lifting a patient who remained lying down without moving into a wheelchair, or taking a carton full of documents down from a shelf. In practice, the women could handle almost every duty on their own.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r65","rowIndex":65,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"（人手不足の愚痴を言うなら、こういう時間のロスを減らすよう努力すればいいのになあ……）","en":"(If they’re going to complain about being short-staffed, they could at least try not to waste time like this...)","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r66","rowIndex":66,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=83>美紗</tips>はあくびをかみ殺しながら、Ｔのツナギを外すかどうかで議論する先輩たちの話を聞いた。","en":"Suppressing another yawn, <tips=83>Misa</tips> listened to her seniors debate whether to remove T’s coverall.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r67","rowIndex":67,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　Tは季節の変化に呼応するように定期的に症状が悪化し、そしてすぐ収まるのだが、今回は一ヶ月ほど前に発作が出てからずっと調子が良くない。","en":"T’s symptoms worsened periodically as though in response to the changing seasons, and ordinarily subsided just as quickly. This time, however, an episode had begun about a month earlier, and she had remained unwell ever since.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r68","rowIndex":68,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=17>タイプＢ</tips>発作は、多くの場合幻聴や幻覚を伴うもので、Ｔの症状もまたそのようなものだ。","en":"<tips=17>Type B</tips> episodes were often accompanied by auditory and visual hallucinations, and T experienced both.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r69","rowIndex":69,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　元々自分でトイレに行って大便をするという能力に難のある患者だったのだが、それでも出来なくはなかった。しかし、今回のように具合が悪くなるとほとんど垂れ流し状態となり、しかも幻聴に指示されたと言って大便のついた下着で顔を拭いたりもする。","en":"She had always had difficulty using the toilet to defecate, though she was not entirely incapable of it. When her condition worsened as it had now, she became almost completely incontinent. She would also say that a voice had ordered her to wipe her face with feces-soiled underwear, and then do it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r70","rowIndex":70,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　だから、彼女は調子が悪くなるとこのような不潔行為を防ぐため、ツナギを着せられることになる。","en":"That was why, whenever her condition worsened, she was put in a coverall to prevent such unsanitary acts.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r71","rowIndex":71,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　こうした現場で扱われるツナギというのは、見た目は工務員などが着る上下が繋がったあの衣服と変わらない。違っているのは、ファスナーを開くには専用の金具が必要で、患者は自分で脱ぐことが出来ないという点だ。","en":"The coveralls used in places like this looked no different from the one-piece work clothes worn by tradesmen. The difference was that opening the zipper required a special tool, so patients could not take them off by themselves.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r72","rowIndex":72,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　身体をかきむしってしまう癖のある患者や、おむつを穿かせても汚れると勝手に自分で外して病棟を汚してしまうＴのような患者に着せる、一種の拘束衣である。","en":"It was a kind of restraint garment used for patients who habitually scratched at their bodies and for patients like T, who removed a diaper herself once it was soiled and fouled the ward.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r73","rowIndex":73,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　着せてから時間が過ぎ、今はＴは落ち着きを取り戻し、幻聴を訴えることも減った。","en":"Some time had passed since T was put in the coverall. She had settled down again and was complaining of auditory hallucinations less often.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r74","rowIndex":74,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　このままツナギとおむつの生活を続けていると、今まで不完全ながらもある程度は自分でトイレに行けていたのが、完全に行けなくなってしまうかもしれない。だから、そろそろ外した方がいいのではないか、というのが前島ナースの提案だった。","en":"If she remained in a coverall and diaper, she might completely lose what imperfect ability she had retained to use the toilet herself. Nurse Maejima was therefore proposing that it might be time to remove the coverall.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r75","rowIndex":75,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それに対して、Ｔの担当である<tips=92>水村ナース</tips>はまだ早いのではないかと慎重な意見を口にし、また別のナースは、Ｔは何度も不潔行為を繰り返すのだから、もう諦めて、このままおむつで生活をさせるべきだと言う。","en":"<tips=92>Nurse Mizumura</tips>, who was responsible for T, cautiously argued that it might still be too early. Another nurse said that T had repeated these unsanitary acts too many times: they should give up on preserving that ability and keep her in diapers.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r76","rowIndex":76,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　こうした意見の対立はくだらないように思われるかもしれないが、この病棟では重要なやりとりとされていた。","en":"The disagreement might sound trivial, but on this ward it was an important discussion.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r77","rowIndex":77,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　一度レベルが落ちた<tips=17>タイプＢ</tips>というものはもう回復しない。だから、B棟三階の入院患者の多くは退院を目的とはしていない。残された能力を、少しでも長く維持することが目的となっている。","en":"Once a <tips=17>Type B’s</tips> level of functioning declined, it never recovered. Most patients on the third floor of Ward B were therefore not working toward discharge. The objective was to preserve their remaining abilities for as long as possible.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r78","rowIndex":78,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　このTの場合はトイレで排便出来る状態を保つのが目的だが、他の患者だと、入浴時に自分で体を洗うのを目的にしたり、与薬時にコップ一杯の水で薬を飲めるようになることを目指したりしている。","en":"For T, the objective was to preserve her ability to defecate in the toilet. With other patients, the goal might be washing themselves at bath time or becoming able to take their medicine with a glass of water when it was dispensed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r79","rowIndex":79,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　急性病棟は少し事情が違う。人によっては退院を目指せる場合もあるし、暴力や危険行為といった抜き差しならない話題が主になったりするのだが、この慢性病棟では、こうした日々の細々としたことが話題の中心となる。そして、こういった話題に真剣になるのはスタッフの熱意の表れでもある。","en":"An acute ward was somewhat different. Some patients there could work toward discharge, and discussion often centered on urgent matters such as violence or dangerous behavior. On this chronic ward, the small details of daily life took center stage. The staff’s willingness to treat those details seriously was itself a sign of their dedication.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r80","rowIndex":80,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それは<tips=83>美紗</tips>だってわかってはいるが、何も朝の申し送り時にはやらなくても、というのが正直なところであった。","en":"<tips=83>Misa</tips> understood that too. Honestly, though, did they really have to do it during morning handover?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r81","rowIndex":81,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女の見るところ、この病棟のベテラン看護師たちは患者に対する愛着があり過ぎる。それはまるで我が子に対するかのような態度なのだ。","en":"As Misa saw it, the veteran nurses on this ward were much too attached to their patients. They treated them almost as if they were their own children.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r82","rowIndex":82,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　今年で四十五才になる藤原ナースは自分の受け持ち患者のことをよく「ウチの子」と呼ぶ。なかでも、Ｒという患者に対しては特別な愛着を持っている。","en":"Nurse Fujiwara, who turned forty-five that year, often called the patients in her care “my girls.” She was especially attached to a patient identified as R.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r83","rowIndex":83,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　十五才の時に最初の発作が起き、十八才で最初の病院で入院したＲは、十年前にこの病院へ転院して以来、藤原ナースがずっと受け持っている。","en":"R had suffered her first episode at fifteen and been hospitalized for the first time at eighteen. Nurse Fujiwara had been responsible for her ever since R was transferred here ten years earlier.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r84","rowIndex":84,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　症状が進行しているＲは、知能レベルがすっかり退行してしまって、妄想による迷惑行為も多く、病棟でもしばしばトラブルメーカーとなったが、問題のある患者ほど可愛いものらしい。また、独特の愛嬌もある。","en":"R’s condition had progressed far. Her intellect had severely deteriorated, and her delusions often led to disruptive behavior, making her a regular source of trouble on the ward. But perhaps the troublesome patients were the ones a nurse grew fondest of. R had her own peculiar charm as well.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r85","rowIndex":85,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　藤原ナースはＲが問題を起こすたびに、他の職員に「うちの子がすみません」と謝り、Ｒを厳しくしかる。Ｒはそのたびにしゅんとするが、病によって学習能力というものが失われてしまっているために結局また繰り返す。","en":"Whenever R caused trouble, Nurse Fujiwara apologized to the other staff—“I’m sorry about my girl”—and gave R a stern scolding. R wilted every time. But her illness had robbed her of the ability to learn, and in the end she always did it again.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r86","rowIndex":86,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　Ｒは今年でもう五十九才になり、藤原ナースよりも年上だが、彼女のことを「お母さん」と呼んでいる。","en":"R was now fifty-nine, older than Nurse Fujiwara, but called her ‘Mother.’","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r87","rowIndex":87,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　実際、度重なる発作によって記憶が壊れている彼女は本当の母親と区別がついていないのかもしれない。母親だとすれば、そうとう口うるさい母親だと感じているだろう。が、体調が悪いときや、妄想に混乱させられているときは、誰よりも早く気がついて手助けをしてくれる。患者にとっては、最も頼りになる人間だろう。","en":"Repeated episodes had damaged R’s memory, and perhaps she could no longer tell the nurse apart from her real mother. If she did think of Fujiwara as her mother, she must have found her terribly nagging. Yet whenever R’s health declined or her delusions left her confused, Fujiwara noticed before anyone else and came to her aid. For a patient, she was probably the most dependable person in the world.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r88","rowIndex":88,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　若い<tips=83>美紗</tips>は、こうした患者と看護師の関係を初めて知った時、医療現場としては行き過ぎたものだと感じた。","en":"When the young <tips=83>Misa</tips> first encountered relationships like this between patients and nurses, she thought they went too far for a medical setting.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r89","rowIndex":89,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　けれど、自分も現場で働くようになって印象がやや変わった。ほとんど回復の見込みがない、悪くなってゆくだけの患者たちが、残された人生のすべてを『暮らしてゆく』この場所は、いわゆる一般的な医療現場とは違うのかもしれない。","en":"Once she began working on the ward herself, however, her view shifted. The patients here had almost no hope of recovery; they would only continue to decline, and they would spend every day remaining to them “living” in this place. Perhaps it was not an ordinary medical setting at all.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r90","rowIndex":90,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おむつの件が結局現状維持のまま保留しようという話でまとまりつつあるその時、デイルームから激しい物音がした。","en":"Just as the discussion was settling on leaving the diaper arrangement unchanged for the time being, a violent crash came from the dayroom.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r91","rowIndex":91,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「何？」","en":"“What was that?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r92","rowIndex":92,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　看護師たちは驚き、立ち上がる。","en":"The nurses jumped to their feet.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r93","rowIndex":93,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　看護師たちが業務を執り行う看護室は透明で丈夫なアクリルボードによって患者たちの生活空間と仕切られ、デイルームの様子が一望出来るようになっている。","en":"The nurses’ station where they performed their duties was separated from the patients’ living space by a transparent sheet of durable acrylic, allowing an unobstructed view of the dayroom.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r94","rowIndex":94,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=83>美紗</tips>も立ち上がって眺めると、患者のＦが尻餅をつき、その前に<tips=82>Ｕ</tips>が仁王立ちをして、顔を真っ赤にしているのが見えた。Ｆの側には空になったマグカップがあり、水が飛び散っている。そして椅子がひっくり返っているところなどを見ると、二人の間で何かあって、席に着いていたＦが椅子ごと倒れたという状況がうかがえる。","en":"<tips=83>Misa</tips> rose and looked. Patient F had landed hard on her backside, while <tips=82>U</tips> stood over her, feet planted wide and face crimson. An empty mug lay beside F, water splashed around it, and a chair had overturned. Something had clearly happened between them, sending F over backward with her chair.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r95","rowIndex":95,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　暴力行為が行われたのだろうか？　男子病棟では多いが、この病棟ではそこまで頻繁には発生しないトラブルである。発生するとしても、患者同士ではなく、興奮状態でも対処しなければいけないスタッフに対するものが主だ。","en":"Had one patient attacked another? Violence was common on the men’s wards, but far less frequent here. When it did occur, it was usually directed not at other patients but at the staff who had to intervene during an episode of agitation.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r96","rowIndex":96,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　看護助手の<tips=93>林田</tips>がベルトからチェーンで繋がれた鍵でドアを開けてデイルームに出ると、看護師たちもそれに続く。","en":"Nursing assistant <tips=93>Hayashida</tips> opened the door with a key chained to his belt and stepped into the dayroom. The nurses followed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r97","rowIndex":97,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=82>ヒロちゃん</tips>、どうしたんだい？」","en":"“<tips=82>Hiro</tips>, what happened?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"林田雄一","displayName":"Yuichi Hayashida","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r98","rowIndex":98,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=93>林田</tips>が興奮する<tips=82>Ｕ</tips>にニックネームで呼びかける。","en":"<tips=93>Hayashida</tips> addressed the agitated <tips=82>U</tips> by her nickname.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r99","rowIndex":99,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=82>Ｕ</tips>は十代のまだ若い患者で、青白く痩せている。薬の副作用によって足元がおぼつかずによく転ぶため、頭にはボクシングで使うようなヘッドガードを装着している。顔立ちは整っており、本来ならかわいげのある少女なのだろうが、身だしなみは全く整えられておらず、髪の毛はぼさぼさにはね、口もとは産毛がちょろちょろと伸びており、そして、その目は金色に輝いていた。","en":"<tips=82>U</tips> was a young patient in her teens, thin and deathly pale. Side effects from her medication left her unsteady and prone to falls, so she wore a padded head guard like a boxer’s. Her features were fine; under other circumstances, she might have been a pretty, endearing girl. But no care had been given to her appearance. Her hair stuck out in wild tufts, wisps of fine hair straggled around her mouth, and her eyes shone gold.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r100","rowIndex":100,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「おいおい、目が金色になってるぞ」","en":"“Whoa. Your eyes have gone gold.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"林田雄一","displayName":"Yuichi Hayashida","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r101","rowIndex":101,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=93>林田</tips>は<tips=82>Ｕ</tips>を落ち着かせるような笑顔を浮かべつつ、Fとの間に自分の身体を入れた。","en":"<tips=93>Hayashida</tips> stepped between <tips=82>U</tips> and F, wearing a smile meant to calm her.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r102","rowIndex":102,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ねえ<tips=82>ヒロミ</tips>ちゃん落ち着いて。フクちゃんに何かしたの？」","en":"“Hey, <tips=82>Hiromi</tips>, calm down. Did you do something to Fuku?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"能見美紗","displayName":"Misa Nomi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r103","rowIndex":103,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=83>美紗</tips>は<tips=93>林田</tips>を睨み付けて威嚇的な態度をとる<tips=82>Ｕ</tips>に近づき、そう言った。","en":"<tips=83>Misa</tips> approached <tips=82>U</tips>, who was glaring threateningly at <tips=93>Hayashida</tips>, and spoke to her.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r104","rowIndex":104,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女は<tips=83>美紗</tips>の担当する患者であった。","en":"She was one of <tips=83>Misa’s</tips> assigned patients.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r105","rowIndex":105,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=83>美紗</tips>は三人の患者を担当しているが、<tips=82>Ｕ</tips>はその中で最も若く、最も難しい患者である。","en":"<tips=83>Misa</tips> was responsible for three patients. <tips=82>U</tips> was both the youngest and the most difficult.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r106","rowIndex":106,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　被毒妄想があり、しばしば食事に毒が入っていると訴えて手を付けずに捨ててしまう。それが続くとすぐに栄養失調寸前にまで陥り、仕方なくベッドに拘束して点滴をすることになる。","en":"She experienced delusions of poisoning and frequently insisted that her food contained poison, throwing it away untouched. When that continued, she soon came to the brink of malnutrition, leaving the staff no choice but to restrain her in bed and administer an intravenous drip.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r107","rowIndex":107,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　また、夜は眠らず、病棟内を徘徊して、他の患者の私物を漁る。","en":"She also stayed awake at night, wandering the ward and searching through the other patients’ belongings.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r108","rowIndex":108,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　トイレットペーパーを適切な量使うことが出来ず、他の患者のようにロールを持たせると丸ごと流してつまらせてしまう。そのくせロールを与えないと不穏になって、幻聴が活発化する。","en":"She could not use an appropriate amount of toilet paper. If given a roll like the other patients, she flushed the whole thing and clogged the toilet. Yet withholding the roll made her agitated and intensified her auditory hallucinations.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r109","rowIndex":109,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　普段から落ち着きがなく、他患に同じ質問をしつこく何度も繰り返し、怒らせてしまうことも多い。","en":"She was habitually restless and often pestered other patients with the same question over and over until they grew angry.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r110","rowIndex":110,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しかし、こんな風に興奮して他人に危害を加えるということはなかったので、<tips=83>美紗</tips>としても意外な思いであった。他のスタッフにとっても同様だろう。迷惑行為が頻回なわりには愛嬌があり、病棟最年少ということもあって職員にも他の患者にも可愛がられている少女なのである。","en":"Yet she had never grown agitated like this and harmed another person, so the incident took <tips=83>Misa</tips> by surprise. The other staff probably felt the same. For all the trouble U caused, she had a winning charm, and as the youngest patient on the ward she was doted on by staff and patients alike.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r111","rowIndex":111,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「大丈夫？　もしかして、何かきこえてるの？」","en":"“Are you all right? Can you hear something?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"能見美紗","displayName":"Misa Nomi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r112","rowIndex":112,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=82>Ｕ</tips>の目はうつろで、<tips=83>美紗</tips>の方に視線をやりはするが、問いかけに対する返事はない。","en":"<tips=82>U’s</tips> eyes were vacant. She looked toward <tips=83>Misa</tips>, but gave no answer to the questions.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r113","rowIndex":113,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　元々意思の疎通がはかりにくいタイプで言葉に対する反応が薄いのだが、今はさらに一段と鈍いようだ。","en":"She had always been difficult to communicate with and slow to respond to speech, but now she seemed even less responsive than usual.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r114","rowIndex":114,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「とりあえず、向こうの椅子に腰掛けようか」","en":"“Why don’t we go sit down over there for now?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"林田雄一","displayName":"Yuichi Hayashida","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r115","rowIndex":115,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=93>林田</tips>が手を引こうとするのを、<tips=82>Ｕ</tips>は乱暴にふりほどく。","en":"When <tips=93>Hayashida</tips> tried to take her hand, <tips=82>U</tips> shook him off violently.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r116","rowIndex":116,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=83>能見</tips>さん、こりゃダメだ。頓服使ったほうがいいんじゃない？」","en":"“Ms. <tips=83>Nomi</tips>, this isn’t working. Maybe we should give her a PRN?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"林田雄一","displayName":"Yuichi Hayashida","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r117","rowIndex":117,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=93>林田</tips>は<tips=83>美紗</tips>を振り返って苦笑する。","en":"<tips=93>Hayashida</tips> looked back at <tips=83>Misa</tips> with a wry smile.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r118","rowIndex":118,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「この子、今は何も出てないんです」","en":"“She doesn’t have anything prescribed right now.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"能見美紗","displayName":"Misa Nomi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r119","rowIndex":119,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=83>美紗</tips>は首を横に振る。","en":"<tips=83>Misa</tips> shook her head.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r120","rowIndex":120,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ああそうか。主治医が安田先生にかわったんだっけ」","en":"“Oh, right. Dr. Yasuda took over as her attending physician, didn’t he?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"林田雄一","displayName":"Yuichi Hayashida","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r121","rowIndex":121,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=93>林田</tips>は納得したように頷く。安田医師は、スタッフの間ではなかなか薬を出さない医者として有名であった。","en":"<tips=93>Hayashida</tips> nodded in understanding. Dr. Yasuda was famous among the staff for his reluctance to prescribe medication.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r122","rowIndex":122,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その背後では看護師たちが、倒れたFの身体を調べている。","en":"Behind him, the nurses were examining F where she had fallen.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r123","rowIndex":123,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「出血も腫脹もないようですねえ」","en":"“I don’t see any bleeding or swelling.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"古川","displayName":"Furukawa","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r124","rowIndex":124,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　服をめくって肌の外傷を調べていた古川ナースがのんびりした口調でそう報告する。","en":"Nurse Furukawa had lifted F’s clothes to inspect her skin for injuries. She delivered the report in an unhurried tone.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r125","rowIndex":125,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「血圧もプルスも正常です」","en":"“Blood pressure and pulse are both normal.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"水村","displayName":"Mizumura","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r126","rowIndex":126,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=92>水村ナース</tips>が落ち着いた声でそう伝える。","en":"<tips=92>Nurse Mizumura</tips> reported calmly.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r127","rowIndex":127,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どこか痛いところはありませんか？」","en":"“Does it hurt anywhere?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"吉田主任","displayName":"Chief Yoshida","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r128","rowIndex":128,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=94>主任</tips>がそう尋ねても、Fは反応をせず呆然と目を見開いている。Fは四十を越えた背の低い女で、こちらは<tips=82>Ｕ</tips>と違っておしゃべりで、他人の言葉にはいつも機敏に反応するのだが、どうやらショックから抜け出せないでいるらしい。","en":"Even when the <tips=94>chief</tips> asked, F did not respond. She stared blankly with her eyes wide open. F was a short woman over forty. Unlike <tips=82>U</tips>, she was talkative and ordinarily responded quickly to the words of others, but she apparently had not yet recovered from the shock.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r129","rowIndex":129,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「フクちゃん。一体何があったんですか？　すごい音がしたからみんなびっくりしちゃってますよ」","en":"“Fuku, what on earth happened? That was such a loud noise—you’ve startled everyone.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"吉田主任","displayName":"Chief Yoshida","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r130","rowIndex":130,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=94>主任</tips>はFの前にしゃがみ込んで優しくそう問いかけると、Fは堰が切れたように早口で喋り出した。","en":"The <tips=94>chief</tips> crouched down in front of F and asked her gently. Then, as if a dam had burst, F began talking in a rapid torrent.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r131","rowIndex":131,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「こ、こいつがよう！　この馬鹿女が急に近づいて来て、アタシを突き飛ばしたんだよ。ほら、目がキンキラになってるじゃないの？　前も、アタシのことやたらとつけ回してよ。こわくてしかたねえよ。こいつ、人殺したことあるんだろう？　それでここに入ってるんだろ。ねえ<tips=94>主任</tips>さん、保護室に入れてくれよ」","en":"“I-it was her! This stupid bitch came right up to me and shoved me. Look at her—her eyes are glittering gold! She’s followed me around before, too. She scares the hell out of me. She’s killed somebody, hasn’t she? That’s why she’s in here. <tips=94>Chief</tips>, put her in the seclusion room.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r132","rowIndex":132,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「フクちゃん、どこで聞いたのか知らないけれど、そんなのただの噂話ですよ。それに、人のことをそんな風に言っちゃダメだって、いつも言ってるでしょう」","en":"“Fuku, I don’t know where you heard that, but it’s only a rumor. And I’m always telling you not to talk about people that way.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"吉田主任","displayName":"Chief Yoshida","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r133","rowIndex":133,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「でもよう、本当のことじゃねえか。……あー、やだやだ。こんなおかしい病院、やだねえ！　<tips=94>主任</tips>さん、いつになったら私は退院出来るんだい？　いい加減、アタシをここに閉じ込めるのは勘弁してほしいよ。せめてよその病院で受診させてくれないかねえ？　ここは藪医者ばかりだから、私を病人にするのさ。そうして、アタシをここで死なせて財産を奪おうとしている……」","en":"“But it’s true, isn’t it? ...Ah, no, no. I hate this lunatic hospital! <tips=94>Chief</tips>, when are you going to let me out? I’ve had enough of you locking me in here. Couldn’t you at least have me examined at another hospital? This place is full of quacks. They’re the ones making me sick. They mean to let me die here and steal my fortune...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r134","rowIndex":134,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　Fは病識がない——つまり、自分が病気であるという自覚が全くない患者で、ことあるごとに職員に騙されて入院しているのだと訴える。もちろん、狙われていると本人が主張している財産など世界のどこにも存在しない。","en":"F lacked insight into her illness: she had no awareness whatsoever that she was sick. At every opportunity, she claimed that the staff had tricked her into the hospital. Of course, the fortune she said they wanted did not exist anywhere in the world.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r135","rowIndex":135,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「その話は後にしてくださいね」","en":"“Let’s talk about that later, please.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"吉田主任","displayName":"Chief Yoshida","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r136","rowIndex":136,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=94>主任</tips>は困ったような顔でそう言うと、","en":"The <tips=94>chief</tips> said this with a troubled look, then continued:","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r137","rowIndex":137,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「フクちゃん、立てますか？　立てるなら、ちょっとお部屋に戻ってて。あ、その前に、お薬飲んでくださいね。あなたもちょっと興奮してる。このままじゃ、また具合が悪くなっちゃいますよ」","en":"“Fuku, can you stand? If you can, go back to your room for a while. Oh, but take your medicine first. You’re a little worked up yourself. If this keeps up, you’ll start feeling unwell again.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"吉田主任","displayName":"Chief Yoshida","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r138","rowIndex":138,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「薬なんかいらねえよ」","en":"“I don’t need any medicine.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r139","rowIndex":139,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　Fは一旦は断ったが、<tips=92>水村ナース</tips>が頓服薬とコップを差し出すと、渋々それを服用した。","en":"F refused at first, but when <tips=92>Nurse Mizumura</tips> held out a PRN dose and a glass of water, she reluctantly took the medicine.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r140","rowIndex":140,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして、<tips=82>Ｕ</tips>に向かってわざと舌打ちをしてからデイルームを出て行く。","en":"Then she deliberately clicked her tongue at <tips=82>U</tips> and left the dayroom.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r141","rowIndex":141,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「本当に、福沢さんを突き飛ばしたりしたの？」","en":"“Did you really push Ms. Fukuzawa?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"能見美紗","displayName":"Misa Nomi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r142","rowIndex":142,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　Fが出て行ってから、<tips=83>美紗</tips>は相変わらずその場に立ち尽くす<tips=82>Ｕ</tips>にそう尋ねる。<tips=82>Ｕ</tips>の唇は震え、何か言おうと一旦は開くが、結局声を発することなくまた閉じた。その端から、唾液がこぼれて顎を伝う。","en":"After F left, <tips=83>Misa</tips> put the question to <tips=82>U</tips>, who still stood rooted to the spot. <tips=82>U’s</tips> lips trembled. She opened them once as if trying to speak, but closed them again without producing a sound. Saliva spilled from one corner of her mouth and ran down her chin.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r143","rowIndex":143,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ねえ、どうしてそんなことをしたの？　押されたら、福沢さんもびっくりしちゃうでしょう。理由を教えてくれない？」","en":"“Why did you do that? You must have frightened Ms. Fukuzawa when you pushed her. Won’t you tell me why?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"能見美紗","displayName":"Misa Nomi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r144","rowIndex":144,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=82>Ｕ</tips>の唇は再び震え、そして今度はやっと言葉が出た。","en":"<tips=82>U’s</tips> lips trembled again. This time, she finally managed to force out the words.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r145","rowIndex":145,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……だ、だまれ」","en":"“...S-shut up.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"内田広美（入院金目）","displayName":"Hiromi Uchida (Hospitalized, Golden-Eyed)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r146","rowIndex":146,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まあ」","en":"“Oh.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"能見美紗","displayName":"Misa Nomi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r147","rowIndex":147,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=83>美紗</tips>が言葉を失って固まってしまうと、<tips=93>林田</tips>がなれなれしく<tips=82>Ｕ</tips>の肩に腕を回し、","en":"<tips=83>Misa</tips> froze, at a loss for words. With easy, almost presumptuous familiarity, <tips=93>Hayashida</tips> slipped an arm around <tips=82>U’s</tips> shoulders.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r148","rowIndex":148,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=82>ヒロちゃん</tips>、きみはちょっと興奮しすぎているなあ。それとも若い看護師さん相手だとテレちゃうのかな？　向こうでこの<tips=93>林田</tips>さんと、ちょっと落ち着いて話をしない？」","en":"“<tips=82>Hiro</tips>, you’re much too worked up. Or are you shy around a young nurse? Why don’t you go over there and have a quiet talk with yours truly, <tips=93>Hayashida</tips>?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"林田雄一","displayName":"Yuichi Hayashida","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r149","rowIndex":149,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　すると、<tips=83>美紗</tips>に対してあれだけ頑なだった<tips=82>Ｕ</tips>は、あっさりと頷く。","en":"<tips=82>U</tips>, who had been so closed off with <tips=83>Misa</tips>, nodded readily.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r150","rowIndex":150,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「よし、じゃあ行こう」","en":"“Good. Let’s go.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"林田雄一","displayName":"Yuichi Hayashida","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r151","rowIndex":151,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=93>林田</tips>は<tips=83>美紗</tips>に目配せをしてから、肩を組んだまま<tips=82>Ｕ</tips>と並んでデイルームの向こうの長椅子に腰をかける。","en":"<tips=93>Hayashida</tips> gave <tips=83>Misa</tips> a knowing glance, then walked <tips=82>U</tips> across the dayroom with his arm still around her shoulders. They sat down together on a bench.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r152","rowIndex":152,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ふう……」","en":"“Whew...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r153","rowIndex":153,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　看護室に戻ってから、<tips=83>美紗</tips>は大きく溜息をつく。","en":"Back in the nurses’ station, <tips=83>Misa</tips> heaved a long sigh.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r154","rowIndex":154,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　どうにもやりきれない思いであった。","en":"She felt utterly defeated.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r155","rowIndex":155,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　理由は二つあって、まず第一は、<tips=82>Ｕ</tips>に「だまれ」と言われたこと。","en":"There were two reasons. The first was that <tips=82>U</tips> had told her to shut up.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r156","rowIndex":156,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女は普段そんな暴言を口にする人物ではない。それなりにうまくやっており、担当看護師として信頼関係を築けたと思っていたのだ。","en":"U was not ordinarily someone who said such vicious things. Misa had thought they got along reasonably well, and that as U’s primary nurse she had built a relationship of trust with her.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r157","rowIndex":157,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そしてもう一つ。自分はあんな態度を取られた一方で、看護助手の<tips=93>林田</tips>はあんなに興奮した状況でも意思の疎通が出来ている。","en":"The second was that, even after U had treated Misa that way, nursing assistant <tips=93>Hayashida</tips> had managed to reach her in the very height of her agitation.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r158","rowIndex":158,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=93>林田</tips>は看護助手ではあるが自分よりベテランであるし、患者との接し方には定評があり、この病棟の誰よりも不穏になった患者を落ち着かせるのがうまく、困ったときは<tips=94>主任</tips>や他のベテラン看護師でも彼を頼りにする。","en":"Although <tips=93>Hayashida</tips> was a nursing assistant, he had more experience than Misa and an excellent reputation for his manner with patients. No one on the ward was better at calming an agitated patient. When trouble arose, even <tips=94>the chief</tips> and the other veteran nurses relied on him.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r159","rowIndex":159,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そういった人物と比べるのは間違いなのかもしれないが、やはりこうして差をつけられてしまうと、やはり自分は足りないのではないかと<tips=83>美紗</tips>は無力感を覚える。","en":"Perhaps it was wrong to compare herself with someone like him. Even so, when the difference between them was made so stark, <tips=83>Misa</tips> felt helpless and wondered whether she was simply inadequate.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r160","rowIndex":160,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　人は気まぐれなものだし、患者といっても女性だから、単純に異性である男性の方が素直に聞きやすいのかもしれないが、そう簡単に片付けたくはない。","en":"People were fickle, and patients or not, these were women. Perhaps it was simply easier for them to listen to a man. But Misa did not want to explain the difference away so easily.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r161","rowIndex":161,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　若くして症状の重い<tips=82>Ｕ</tips>は<tips=83>美紗</tips>が最も力を入れている患者で、その人物との間にこんなことがあると、自分は向いていないのではないかと、溜息ばかりが出るのである。","en":"Young and severely ill, <tips=82>U</tips> was the patient to whom <tips=83>Misa</tips> devoted the most attention. When something like this happened between them, Misa could only sigh and wonder whether she was cut out for the work.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r162","rowIndex":162,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　落ち込む<tips=83>美紗</tips>の目の前では<tips=94>主任</tips>が主治医に報告の電話をし、古川ナースと<tips=92>水村ナース</tips>が今起きたことについて話し合っている。","en":"As <tips=83>Misa</tips> stood there crestfallen, <tips=94>the chief</tips> phoned the attending physician to report the incident, while Nurse Furukawa and <tips=92>Nurse Mizumura</tips> discussed what had just happened.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r163","rowIndex":163,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まったく、フクちゃんのあの態度を見た？　最後にわざとらしく舌打ちなんかしちゃってさ。ああいうことばっかりしてるから、色んな人のトラブルに巻き込まれるのよ。今回も、本当に何もしなかったのかしらねえ。この間吉田さんに頭をはたかれたのも、あの人が嫌味みたいなこと言ったからでしょ。まったく、イジワルババアなんだから」","en":"“Honestly, did you see the way Fuku acted? Clicking her tongue like that at the end, just to make a show of it. She keeps pulling that kind of thing, then gets herself dragged into trouble with everyone. I wonder if she really did nothing this time. Remember when Ms. Yoshida smacked her on the head? That was because Fuku said something nasty to her, wasn’t it? Honestly, she’s such a nasty old hag.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"古川","displayName":"Furukawa","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r164","rowIndex":164,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　Fはこの病棟のなかでは会話が普通に出来、知能も正常に近いまま残されている、いわゆる「出来る」グループに属するが、だからといって面倒のない患者というわけではない。","en":"F belonged to what the ward called the “capable” group: patients who could carry on an ordinary conversation and retained nearly normal intelligence. That did not make her an easy patient.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r165","rowIndex":165,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　知能のレベルが下がり、人格が荒廃し、身のまわりのことが出来なくなってしまった患者は手間がかかるが、知能が残ったままの患者はそれはそれで別の苦労がある。","en":"Patients whose intelligence had declined, whose personalities had deteriorated, and who could no longer look after themselves required a great deal of care. Patients who retained their intelligence brought difficulties of their own.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r166","rowIndex":166,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　Fの場合、口が達者で屁理屈ばかりを言い、普段から女性看護師に対しても暴言が多い。そして具合が悪くなると、「自分は神だ」というような妄想に取り憑かれ、普段よりも一層他人に非常に尊大に振る舞ったり、命令をするようになる。受け入れられないと、金切り声で暴言を吐く。","en":"F had a ready tongue and an endless supply of specious arguments; even in her ordinary condition, she was often abusive toward the women on staff. When her condition worsened, she became consumed by delusions that she was a god, grew still more imperious, and began ordering people around. If they refused, she would scream abuse at them in a shrill voice.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r167","rowIndex":167,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　こうなってしまうと誰も手が付けられず、隔離部屋に閉じ込めなくてはならない。そのため、彼女は昔から保護室の常連であった。","en":"Once she reached that state, no one could handle her, and she had to be placed in seclusion. That was why she had long been a regular in the seclusion rooms.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r168","rowIndex":168,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「声が大きいから、他の患者さんを刺激しやすいのかもしれませんね。でも、<tips=82>内田</tips>さんにはちょっとびっくりしましたね。最近ちょっと具合が悪かったけど、突き飛ばすなんて……」","en":"“Maybe her loud voice makes it especially easy for her to set off the other patients. Still, Ms. <tips=82>Uchida</tips> surprised me. She’s been a little unwell lately, but I never expected her to shove someone...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"水村","displayName":"Mizumura","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r169","rowIndex":169,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「彼女も保護室になっちゃうのかねえ」","en":"“Think they’ll put her in seclusion too?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"古川","displayName":"Furukawa","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r170","rowIndex":170,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　この病棟は暴力行為がない、と言ってもあくまでも比較の話であって、やはり人が共同生活すればたまには発生することもある。","en":"The claim that this ward had no violence was only true by comparison. Put any group of people under one roof and something was bound to happen now and then.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r171","rowIndex":171,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=82>Ｕ</tips>は問題行動も多く手間のかかる患者であるが、性格的には素直で大人しい少女で、そのために患者間のもめ事では被害者になりやすく、今回のように加害側の立場になった場合でも職員は同情的だ。","en":"<tips=82>U</tips> was a demanding patient with plenty of behavioral problems, but by nature she was a docile, quiet girl. She was usually more likely to be the victim when patients quarreled, and even now, when she was the aggressor, the staff were inclined to sympathize with her.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r172","rowIndex":172,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　建前上はあってはならないことだし、それで対応が変わるということも基本的にはないのだが、人情として職員にも患者に対する好悪というものはある。","en":"In principle, such favoritism should not have existed, and as a rule it did not change the way anyone was treated. But the staff were only human: they liked some patients and disliked others.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r173","rowIndex":173,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　家族には見捨てられ、財産もなく、生活保護で暮らすような何も持たない患者ばかりだが、人柄が素直ならば、こんな場所でも人に愛されるし、周りの人と関係が良好なら楽しく毎日を送ることも出来る。","en":"The patients here had nothing: their families had abandoned them, they owned no property, and they lived on public assistance. Yet an open, agreeable nature could make someone loved even in a place like this, and good relations with the people around them could make each day a happy one.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r174","rowIndex":174,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=83>美紗</tips>はここに来てから、最終的な人間の武器というものは、この人間性ではないかと思うようになった。いつか自分が老人になり、どこかの施設に入った時に、周りの人間に愛されるような性格になれれば幸福に過ごせるだろう。","en":"Since coming here, <tips=83>Misa</tips> had begun to think that a person’s last and greatest asset might be their character. If someday she grew old and entered a care home, she could still live happily so long as she had become the kind of person those around her could love.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r175","rowIndex":175,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「私は、将来かわいいお祖母ちゃんにならなくちゃいけない！」","en":"“I have to make sure I turn into an adorable old lady someday!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r176","rowIndex":176,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　というのが、最近<tips=83>美紗</tips>がよく口にするフレーズである。","en":"This had lately become one of <tips=83>Misa’s</tips> favorite sayings.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r177","rowIndex":177,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　さて、<tips=82>Ｕ</tips>が加害者になることが珍しいとは言え、看護師の日常は忙しい。これくらいのトラブルでいちいち業務を滞らせてなどいられないのだ。<tips=94>主任</tips>がドクターへの電話を終えると、すぐに雑談は打ち切られ、申し送りが再開される。","en":"Unusual though it was for <tips=82>U</tips> to be the aggressor, nurses had busy days. They could not let an incident like this bring the work to a halt. The moment <tips=94>the chief</tips> ended her call with the doctor, the chatter stopped and handover resumed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r178","rowIndex":178,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして申し送りが終わる頃、<tips=93>林田</tips>が鍵を開けて戻ってきた。","en":"Toward the end of handover, <tips=93>Hayashida</tips> unlocked the door and came back in.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r179","rowIndex":179,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いやー、あの子、妄想バリバリだよ。困っちゃったなあ」","en":"“Man, her delusions are in full swing. What are we going to do with her?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"林田雄一","displayName":"Yuichi Hayashida","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r180","rowIndex":180,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼は困ったようには見えない笑顔を浮かべながら言った。彼の笑顔は、他の棟を歩くと女性患者たちが騒ぐほどさわやかなもので、女性職員の間にも密かな人気がある。","en":"He said it with a smile that betrayed no concern at all. It was such a bright, winning smile that female patients made a fuss whenever he passed through another ward. He had a quiet following among the women on staff as well.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r181","rowIndex":181,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　かつては東京のマリンスポーツのグッズを売る店で従業員をしていたらしい。それがどうしてこんな街のこんな施設で働くようになったのかは誰も知らないが、今はみなに頼りにされている。","en":"He had apparently once worked at a marine-sports shop in Tokyo. No one knew what had brought him from there to a facility like this, in a town like this. But now everyone relied on him.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r182","rowIndex":182,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「例の『<tips=8>グレートホール</tips>』が始まってますねえ。『<tips=8>グレートホール</tips>が私を呼んでる』とか『<tips=8>グレートホール</tips>に帰らなきゃいけない』とか、そればっかり言ってる。それで、福沢さんは、<tips=8>グレートホール</tips>から出て来た悪魔の化身なんだって。とりあえずいつもの絵本を渡したらそれを読んでくれたけど、あの調子じゃまた繰り返すんじゃないですかね」","en":"“Her usual <tips=8>Great Hole</tips> business is starting again. It’s all ‘The <tips=8>Great Hole</tips> is calling me’ and ‘I have to go back to the <tips=8>Great Hole</tips>.’ And she says Ms. Fukuzawa is a demon incarnate who came out of the <tips=8>Great Hole</tips>. I gave her the usual picture book for now, and that got her reading, but the way she is, I bet it’ll happen again.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"林田雄一","displayName":"Yuichi Hayashida","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r183","rowIndex":183,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうですか。いつもありがとうね<tips=93>林田</tips>さん」","en":"“I see. Thank you as always, Mr. <tips=93>Hayashida</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"吉田主任","displayName":"Chief Yoshida","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r184","rowIndex":184,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ドクターとの電話を終えた<tips=94>主任</tips>はそうねぎらう。","en":"Now off the phone with the doctor, <tips=94>the chief</tips> spoke appreciatively.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r185","rowIndex":185,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「もうすぐ先生が来て<tips=82>内田</tips>さんを診てくださるけど、多分保護室に隔離することになると思うわ」","en":"“The doctor will be here soon to see Ms. <tips=82>Uchida</tips>, but I imagine she’ll have to go into seclusion.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"吉田主任","displayName":"Chief Yoshida","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r186","rowIndex":186,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ああ、それがいいですねえ。私は賛成です。……じゃあちょっくら保護室の準備をしてきます」","en":"“Yeah, that would be best. I agree. I’ll just pop over and get a seclusion room ready.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"林田雄一","displayName":"Yuichi Hayashida","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r187","rowIndex":187,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「お願いね」","en":"“Please do.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"吉田主任","displayName":"Chief Yoshida","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r188","rowIndex":188,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それから申し送りが終わり、朝の与薬も終わって夜勤者が帰り支度を始める頃、<tips=82>Ｕ</tips>の主治医である安田医師がやって来て、<tips=94>主任</tips>が言ったとおり<tips=82>Ｕ</tips>を保護室に隔離するよう指示を出した。","en":"After handover and the morning medication round were over, and just as the night shift began preparing to leave, Dr. Yasuda, <tips=82>U’s</tips> attending physician, arrived and—just as the <tips=94>chief</tips> had predicted—ordered <tips=82>U</tips> placed in seclusion.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r189","rowIndex":189,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして<tips=83>美紗</tips>は今日最後の仕事として<tips=82>Ｕ</tips>を保護室に連れて行く。","en":"For her last task of the day, <tips=83>Misa</tips> took <tips=82>U</tips> to the seclusion room.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r190","rowIndex":190,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　保護室とは別名Zルームとも言い、患者を隔離するための鍵のついた個室である。妄想が活発化して落ち着きがなくなった患者や、他の患者とトラブルを起こして集団のなかに居づらくなった患者などをこの部屋で一時的に保護し、状態の安定をはかる。","en":"A seclusion room, also called a Z-room, was a locked private room used to isolate a patient. Someone whose delusions had intensified and left them restless, or who could no longer remain among the other patients after a conflict, would be kept there temporarily until their condition stabilized.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r191","rowIndex":191,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　部屋には毛布とマットレスが一枚ずつと、洋式便器、そしてそれを隠す衝立があるだけで、他には何もない。枕さえないのだ。","en":"Each room contained only one blanket, one mattress, a Western-style toilet, and a screen to conceal it. There was nothing else—not even a pillow.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r192","rowIndex":192,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　窓は二重になっていて、磨りガラスに手が届いて割ったりしないように手前には鉄格子がはまっている。天井には監視カメラが設置され、部屋の様子は看護室のモニターから２４時間確認出来るようになっており、また録画もされている。","en":"The windows were double-paned, with iron bars on the room side to keep patients from reaching and breaking the frosted glass. A surveillance camera mounted in the ceiling allowed staff to monitor the room from the nurses’ station around the clock; its footage was recorded as well.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r193","rowIndex":193,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　A棟三階には六室設置されており、現在はそのうち三室が使用されていた。<tips=83>美紗</tips>が鍵を開けて廊下に足を踏み入れると、その扉が開く音に一番奥の部屋の患者が反応した。","en":"Ward A had six such rooms on the third floor, three of them currently occupied. When <tips=83>Misa</tips> unlocked the door and stepped into the corridor, the patient in the room at the far end reacted to the sound.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r194","rowIndex":194,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「水ぅう！　水を頂戴よお！」","en":"“Waaater! Give me some waaater!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r195","rowIndex":195,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　多飲水で保護室に隔離されたその患者がドアをドンドンと叩く。その音は廊下に響き、顔を顰めたくなるほどだ。","en":"The patient, who had been secluded for compulsive water drinking, hammered on the door. The blows echoed down the corridor, loud enough to make anyone wince.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r196","rowIndex":196,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「おい、うるせえな。黙ってろよ！」","en":"“Hey, shut up! You’re too damn loud!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r197","rowIndex":197,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　音に耐えかねたその隣の、暴力行為が原因で隔離されている患者が怒鳴り返す。","en":"The patient in the next room, secluded after an act of violence and unable to bear the racket, shouted back.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r198","rowIndex":198,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=83>美紗</tips>も初めて入った頃は、この空間の雰囲気に圧倒されたものだが、今は入っている患者たちのこともよく知っており、普段は雑談などもし、無用に恐れるような必要がないことを理解している。","en":"When <tips=83>Misa</tips> had first started going in there, the atmosphere of the place overwhelmed her. Now she knew the patients inside well, often stopped to chat with them, and understood that there was no need to fear them simply because they were in seclusion.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r199","rowIndex":199,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「飛川さん、そんな乱暴な口きかないでね。そんな物言いしてるとまた出られなくなっちゃうわよ。牛野さん、あなたはちょっと水を飲み過ぎ。ちゃんと量計って出してるんだよ。今日の受け持ちの人に伝えておくけど、くれなくても怒っちゃだめよ」","en":"“Ms. Hikawa, don’t use that kind of language. Keep talking like that and they won’t let you out. Ms. Ushino, you’ve been drinking too much water. We measure out exactly how much you’re allowed. I’ll mention it to whoever’s looking after you today, but don’t get angry if they won’t give you any.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"能見美紗","displayName":"Misa Nomi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r200","rowIndex":200,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=83>美紗</tips>は廊下の奥に向かって大きな声でそう呼びかける。","en":"<tips=83>Misa</tips> called down the corridor in a loud voice.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r201","rowIndex":201,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いやだよ、今日は藤田が担当でしょ？　あいつ、くれないんだよ。ねえ喉が乾いたんだよう。あんたがこそっと持って来ればいいんだから、今すぐ飲ませてくれよう」","en":"“No! Fujita’s on today, right? She never gives me any. I’m thirsty! Come on, you can sneak me some. Give me a drink right now.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r202","rowIndex":202,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「可哀想な声出したってそんなこと出来ないよ。なんでそこに入ったか覚えてるでしょう？　お水を我慢出来るようにならないと、出られないんだよ。……さあ、<tips=82>ヒロミ</tips>ちゃん、入って」","en":"“You can put on that poor little voice all you like, but I still can’t do that. You remember why you’re in there, don’t you? You won’t get out until you learn to go without water. ...All right, <tips=82>Hiromi</tips>. In you go.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"林田雄一","displayName":"Yuichi Hayashida","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r203","rowIndex":203,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　促されて、<tips=82>Ｕ</tips>が廊下に足を踏み入れる。続いて<tips=93>林田</tips>が入り、廊下とデイルームを繋ぐ扉の鍵を閉める。","en":"At her prompting, <tips=82>U</tips> entered the corridor. <tips=93>Hayashida</tips> followed and locked the door connecting the corridor to the dayroom.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r204","rowIndex":204,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　保護室に入ると伝えても<tips=82>Ｕ</tips>は別段騒ぐこともなく、素直だった。相変わらず目は金色ではあったが、先ほどのような興奮や緊張は見られず、かわりに理由のない笑いが顔に浮かんでいる。","en":"<tips=82>U</tips> made no fuss when told she was being put in seclusion and went along obediently. Her eyes were still gold, but the agitation and tension she had shown before were gone. Instead, an unaccountable smile played across her face.","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"内田広美（入院金目）","displayName":"Hiromi Uchida (Hospitalized, Golden-Eyed)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r205","rowIndex":205,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ここで靴と靴下を脱いで……。そうそう、言わなくても自分から脱ぐなんて、すっかり慣れちゃったね」","en":"“Take off your shoes and socks here... There you go—you took them off yourself before I even had to tell you. You’ve really gotten used to this.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"能見美紗","displayName":"Misa Nomi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r206","rowIndex":206,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして<tips=83>美紗</tips>は<tips=82>Ｕ</tips>のズボンのポケットに手を突っ込んで、保護室持ち込み禁止のものがないかボディチェックをする。その間も<tips=82>Ｕ</tips>は身体を揺すり、クスクスと空笑している。","en":"<tips=83>Misa</tips> slipped a hand into the pockets of <tips=82>U’s</tips> trousers and searched her for anything prohibited in seclusion. All the while, <tips=82>U</tips> rocked back and forth, giggling at nothing.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r207","rowIndex":207,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「よしOK。じゃあ、<tips=82>ヒロミ</tips>ちゃん、この部屋でゆっくり休んで心を落ち着けるんだよ」","en":"“Okay, all clear. Now, <tips=82>Hiromi</tips>, have a good rest in here and calm yourself down.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"能見美紗","displayName":"Misa Nomi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r208","rowIndex":208,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=83>美紗</tips>の言葉に、のっそりとした動作で従おうとする<tips=82>Ｕ</tips>の肩を<tips=93>林田</tips>が軽く叩いた。","en":"As <tips=82>U</tips> began lumbering toward the room at <tips=83>Misa’s</tips> instruction, <tips=93>Hayashida</tips> gave her a light tap on the shoulder.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r209","rowIndex":209,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=82>ヒロミ</tips>ちゃん、さっき言ってたこと、直接伝えなよ」","en":"“<tips=82>Hiromi</tips>, tell her yourself what you told me earlier.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"林田雄一","displayName":"Yuichi Hayashida","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r210","rowIndex":210,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　すると<tips=82>Ｕ</tips>は笑いをやめる。","en":"<tips=82>U</tips> stopped laughing.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r211","rowIndex":211,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=93>林田</tips>はもう一度同じ言葉を繰り返す。すると、彼女はしばらく<tips=93>林田</tips>の顔を見つめてから、<tips=83>美紗</tips>の方を振り返り、","en":"<tips=93>Hayashida</tips> repeated himself. U stared at <tips=93>Hayashida’s</tips> face for a while, then turned to <tips=83>Misa</tips>:","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r212","rowIndex":212,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ノミさん。さっきは、ゴメンナサイ」","en":"“Ms. Nomi. I’m sorry... about before.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"内田広美（入院金目）","displayName":"Hiromi Uchida (Hospitalized, Golden-Eyed)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r213","rowIndex":213,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ぺこりと頭を下げた。","en":"She bowed her head.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r214","rowIndex":214,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=82>ヒロミ</tips>ちゃん……」","en":"“<tips=82>Hiromi</tips>...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"能見美紗","displayName":"Misa Nomi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r215","rowIndex":215,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=83>美紗</tips>が目を丸くして絶句するのをよそに、<tips=82>Ｕ</tips>は自分から部屋のなかに入り、マットレスの上にごろりと横になってそのやせ細った背を向ける。背中は時々小刻みに揺れる。笑っているのだ。","en":"Leaving <tips=83>Misa</tips> wide-eyed and speechless, <tips=82>U</tips> went into the room on her own, flopped down on the mattress, and lay with her emaciated back toward them. Every so often, it trembled in little bursts. She was laughing.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r216","rowIndex":216,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=93>林田</tips>は扉を閉め、鍵をかけると、ガチャリと音がした。","en":"<tips=93>Hayashida</tips> closed and locked the door with a metallic click.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r217","rowIndex":217,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「さあ、行こうか」","en":"“All right, let’s go.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"林田雄一","displayName":"Yuichi Hayashida","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r218","rowIndex":218,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=83>美紗</tips>を振り返ると、その顔にちょっと驚き、それから笑顔を浮かべて、","en":"He turned back to <tips=83>Misa</tips>, started a little at the expression on her face, then smiled:","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r219","rowIndex":219,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=83>能見</tips>さん、感情失禁かい？」","en":"“Ms. <tips=83>Nomi</tips>, a case of emotional incontinence?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"林田雄一","displayName":"Yuichi Hayashida","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r220","rowIndex":220,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=83>美紗</tips>はその冗談に気の利いた返事が出来ない。慌てて首を横にブンブンと振ると、","en":"<tips=83>Misa</tips> had no witty answer to the joke. Flustered, she shook her head hard from side to side.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r221","rowIndex":221,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「違いますよぅ」","en":"“Nooo, that’s not it.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"能見美紗","displayName":"Misa Nomi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r222","rowIndex":222,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　と言い、ノーメイクの顔をゴシゴシと手で拭った。","en":"She said it while scrubbing at her bare face with one hand.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r223","rowIndex":223,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして照れ隠しで笑うと、","en":"Then, with a laugh to hide her embarrassment, she said:","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r224","rowIndex":224,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「こういうのがあるから、患者さんって憎めないんですよね……」","en":"“It’s moments like this that make it impossible to stay mad at the patients...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"能見美紗","displayName":"Misa Nomi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r225","rowIndex":225,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　独り言のように呟いた。","en":"She murmured it almost to herself.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r226","rowIndex":226,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=83>美紗</tips>は<tips=9>Y地区</tips>のすぐ側の住宅地にアパートを借りて一人暮らしをしている。","en":"<tips=83>Misa</tips> lived alone in an apartment in a residential neighborhood just outside <tips=9>Y District</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r227","rowIndex":227,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　友人からはそんな場所に住んで危なくないのかとよく訊かれる。確かに<tips=9>Y地区</tips>のなかは治安が悪いが、駅の反対側まで行くと、そう距離が離れたわけでもないのに日本のどこにでもあるようなごく当たり前の住宅地となっている。","en":"Friends often asked whether it was dangerous to live in a place like that. <tips=9>Y District</tips> itself was certainly dangerous, but once you crossed to the far side of the station, an utterly ordinary residential neighborhood appeared—like any other in Japan, though it was hardly any distance away.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r228","rowIndex":228,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=83>美紗</tips>には大胆不敵というか無頓着なところがあって、最初はもっと病院に近い<tips=9>Y地区</tips>のなかのアパートを探したのだが、不動産屋に止められてこのアパートにしたのだ。","en":"<tips=83>Misa</tips> had a streak that might be called fearless—or simply unconcerned with danger. She had originally looked for an apartment inside <tips=9>Y District</tips>, closer to the hospital, but the real-estate agent talked her out of it and steered her to this one instead.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r229","rowIndex":229,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その時は、人に言われるまま決めてしまったことを後悔したりもしたが、今となってはその提案に従って良かったと思う。","en":"At the time, she had even regretted letting herself be talked into the choice. By now, though, she was glad she had taken the advice.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r230","rowIndex":230,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=9>Y地区</tips>は遊ぶには良い場所で、彼女もそこで飲んだり買い物をする。","en":"<tips=9>Y District</tips> was a good place to go out, and she drank and shopped there herself.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r231","rowIndex":231,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=57>滑走路通り</tips>などの表通りを利用しているかぎり、よく語られる治安の悪さを体験することは確かに少ない。しかし、すれ違う人間が外国人ばかりで、街中に読むことの出来ない言語で書かれた文字があふれているというのは、顔見知りばかりが暮らす田舎町で育った<tips=83>美紗</tips>にはどうにも落ち着かない。そして裏通りではしょっちゅう殺人や暴力事件が起きているという。","en":"As long as she kept to main streets such as <tips=57>Runway Street</tips>, she rarely encountered the danger for which the district was notorious. Even so, almost everyone she passed seemed to be from abroad, and the streets overflowed with writing in languages she could not read. <tips=83>Misa</tips> had grown up in a country town where every face was familiar; she could never quite feel at ease there. And in the backstreets, they said, murders and assaults occurred all the time.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r232","rowIndex":232,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そういう話があるたび、自分のような平凡な人間が住む場所ではないと実感する。","en":"Each time she heard a story like that, she was reminded that this was no place for an ordinary person like her to live.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r233","rowIndex":233,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それにしても夜勤明けの精神状態というのは不思議なものだ。","en":"Still, there was something strange about the state of mind that followed a night shift.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r234","rowIndex":234,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　病院にいた時はあれほど眠くて仕方がなかったのに、勤務時間が終わると妙に晴れ晴れとした気持ちになって睡魔などどこかへ消えてしまう。","en":"At the hospital, she had been almost unbearably sleepy. Yet the moment her shift ended, she felt strangely clear and light, and every trace of drowsiness vanished.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r235","rowIndex":235,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　同僚のなかには、そのまま遊びに行くものもいる。その気持ちは<tips=83>美紗</tips>にもわかるが、身体に残る疲労を考えると同じような行動は出来ない。","en":"Some of her colleagues went straight out to have fun afterward. <tips=83>Misa</tips> understood the impulse, but the fatigue still lodged in her body kept her from doing the same.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r236","rowIndex":236,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　アパートに戻るとシャワーを浴び、<tips=57>滑走路通り</tips>で買ったハンバーガーを食べながら勉強をする。そのハンバーガーの味付けは、<tips=83>美紗</tips>の好みからすると少し濃かったが、なかなかの美男子が販売しており、いつでもさわやかな笑顔で挨拶をしてくれるため、それが理由でしばしば購入している。","en":"After she got home, she showered and studied over a burger from <tips=57>Runway Street</tips>. It was seasoned a little too heavily for <tips=83>Misa’s</tips> taste, but the man who sold it was quite handsome and always greeted her with a bright, winning smile. That was why she kept buying them.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r237","rowIndex":237,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　勉強をはじめると一旦吹き飛んだ睡魔がまた襲ってくる。勉強と言っても、本を読むだけなのだが。","en":"She had only to begin studying for the drowsiness she had shaken off to come rushing back. Though by “studying,” she meant nothing more than reading a book.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r238","rowIndex":238,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それは<tips=94>主任</tips>から勧められた出版されたばかりの新しい本で、<tips=17>タイプB</tips>患者の看護法について書かれたものであった。","en":"<tips=94>The chief</tips> had recommended it: a new book, just published, on nursing care for <tips=17>Type B</tips> patients.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r239","rowIndex":239,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その冒頭には、<tips=17>タイプB</tips>についての基礎的な情報が記述されている。","en":"It opened with the basic facts about <tips=17>Type B</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r240","rowIndex":240,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　まず<tips=17>タイプB</tips>というのは、<tips=16>タイプA</tips>と同じ、ミュータントの一種である。","en":"To begin with, <tips=17>Type B</tips>, like <tips=16>Type A</tips>, was a kind of mutant.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r241","rowIndex":241,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ただ、そのありようは<tips=16>タイプA</tips>とは大分違う。","en":"Its nature, however, was very different from that of <tips=16>Type A</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r242","rowIndex":242,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=16>タイプA</tips>は、いわゆるサイキックである。一般的な人間にはなかなか実現出来ない能力を持っている。","en":"A <tips=16>Type A</tips> was what people commonly called a psychic: someone possessing abilities beyond what an ordinary human could readily achieve.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r243","rowIndex":243,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それは、念動力や、発火、読心など、古典的なSFでよく目にするものから、例えば目隠しして指先で触れるだけでカップラーメンの銘柄を正確に当てるだけという、なぜ備わったのかよくわからない能力まで、数え切れないくらいの多様な能力が存在する。","en":"Countless varieties of those abilities existed. They ranged from the familiar powers of classical science fiction—telekinesis, pyrokinesis, and mind reading—to the inexplicable gift of identifying the brand of instant noodles in a cup merely by touching it with a fingertip while blindfolded.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r244","rowIndex":244,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その能力の強さも人それぞれで、例えば念動力なら、大の大人を宙高く飛ばしてしまうものから、何分も集中して一円玉を乗せた計りの数値がやっと一グラム軽くなるようなものまで幅広い。","en":"Their strength varied just as widely. One telekinetic might send a grown man flying high into the air; another might concentrate for minutes merely to make a scale bearing a one-yen coin register one gram lighter.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r245","rowIndex":245,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=83>美紗</tips>が小学生の頃、クラスに一人<tips=16>タイプA</tips>がいたが、集中してコップ一杯の水道水を見つめると五分で３℃上昇するというものだった。ミネラルウォーターや牛乳では出来ないし、手でさわって温度の上昇が確認出来るほど温度が上がるわけでもないので、そう語る本人の言葉を聞くだけで実際その能力を確認することは出来なかった。実際のところ、世間の<tips=16>タイプA</tips>というのはこの程度のささやかな能力者ばかりらしい。","en":"When <tips=83>Misa</tips> was in elementary school, she had a classmate who was <tips=16>Type A</tips>. His power, he said, was to raise the temperature of a glass of tap water by three degrees Celsius after staring at it in concentration for five minutes. It would not work on mineral water or milk, and three degrees was too little to verify by touch, so Misa could only take his word for it. In practice, most people classified as <tips=16>Type A</tips> apparently possessed only modest powers of this order.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r246","rowIndex":246,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして、<tips=16>タイプA</tips>のもう一つの特徴として『<tips=77>特質変異</tips>』がある。","en":"Another defining characteristic of <tips=16>Type A</tips> was “<tips=77>trait mutation</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r247","rowIndex":247,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=16>タイプA</tips>として生まれた人間の何割かは、とても考えられないような肉体の異常を持って生まれる。","en":"A certain proportion of people born <tips=16>Type A</tips> also entered the world with physical abnormalities that seemed almost inconceivable.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r248","rowIndex":248,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　たとえば全身が毛むくじゃらで指の間に水かきがあるとか、目が一つしかなく顔の中央にあるとか、象のように長い牙が生えているとか。","en":"One might be covered in hair and possess webbing between the fingers, have a single eye in the middle of the face, or grow long tusks like an elephant’s.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r249","rowIndex":249,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　能力が強いほど人間離れした<tips=77>特質変異</tips>を持つ傾向があるというが、実際には大した能力がなくともとんでもない変形をしている人がいたり、絶大な能力がありながら全くノーマルと変わらない人もいる。","en":"Stronger abilities were said to accompany more inhuman <tips=77>trait mutations</tips>. In practice, however, some people underwent grotesque physical changes despite having no significant power, while others wielded immense power and looked entirely Normal.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r250","rowIndex":250,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　こうした<tips=16>タイプA</tips>は、ノーマルの延長線上に存在しているというのが最近の考え方だ。","en":"Current thinking held that <tips=16>Type A</tips> existed on a continuum with Normals.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r251","rowIndex":251,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　すべての人間は<tips=16>タイプA</tips>であり、現在ノーマルと認定されている人も、実際は測定が不可能な程度のなんらかの能力が備わっているのではないかと予測されている。","en":"Some theorized that every human being was <tips=16>Type A</tips>—that even those now classified as Normal possessed some ability too faint to measure.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r252","rowIndex":252,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　この辺りが、<tips=17>タイプB</tips>とは特に違うところだ。","en":"This was the point on which it differed most sharply from <tips=17>Type B</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r253","rowIndex":253,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=17>タイプB</tips>もかつては<tips=16>タイプA</tips>の一種だと考えられていた。","en":"<tips=17>Type B</tips>, too, had once been regarded as a variety of <tips=16>Type A</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r254","rowIndex":254,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しかし、あまりにも同じ能力と、同じ肉体の変異を持つ者が多すぎたため、これは何か別の種類のミュータントなのではないかと考えられるようになり、独立して『<tips=17>タイプB</tips>』と呼ばれるようになった。","en":"But so many of them shared precisely the same abilities and the same bodily mutations that researchers came to suspect they were a separate kind of mutant, and they were eventually given the independent classification “<tips=17>Type B</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r255","rowIndex":255,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"『<tips=17>タイプB</tips>』と呼ばれる前は、『金目病』とか、『Berserkr』とか、世界各地で色々な名前をつけられていたようである。","en":"Before they came to be called “<tips=17>Type B</tips>,” people around the world had apparently given them various names, among them “Gold-Eye Disease” and “Berserkr.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r256","rowIndex":256,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　古い人が<tips=17>タイプB</tips>のことを『<tips=78>金目</tips>』と呼んだりするのはその名残で、現在では差別用語とされて公的な場面では使われなくなったが、日常生活では未だに生きた言葉であった。魚のキンメダイと似たニュアンスになって、やはりちょっと馬鹿にしたような意味になるので一般的には使わない方が無難ではあるが。","en":"Older people still calling <tips=17>Type B</tips> people “<tips=78>Gold-Eyes</tips>” was a remnant of that history. The term was now considered a slur and had disappeared from official use, but it remained alive in everyday speech. In Japanese, it also sounded like kinmedai, the name of a fish, which gave it a faintly mocking ring. It was generally best avoided.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r257","rowIndex":257,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　この<tips=17>タイプB</tips>は、普段はノーマルとほとんど変わらない。","en":"A <tips=17>Type B</tips> ordinarily differed very little from a Normal.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r258","rowIndex":258,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しかし、興奮したり発作を起こしたりしたときには、瞳の色が金色に変化する。これが『<tips=95>金眼現象</tips>』と呼ばれる<tips=17>タイプB</tips>を特徴付ける現象で、この目が現れたとき、患者は通常の人間より優れた肉体能力を発揮する。その結果、思わぬ怪力や俊敏性を見せる。","en":"When a patient became excited or suffered an episode, however, their eyes turned gold. This was the “<tips=95>golden-eye phenomenon</tips>” that distinguished <tips=17>Type B</tips>. When those eyes appeared, the patient exhibited physical abilities beyond an ordinary human being’s, including unexpected strength and agility.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r259","rowIndex":259,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それは、特別な訓練をしていないような人間でも、<tips=95>金眼</tips>時にはスポーツ選手顔負けの身体能力に達してしまうほど極端なものだ。それは筋肉だけでなく、視力、聴力といった部分にまで適用される。","en":"The change was so extreme that even someone with no special training could rival an athlete when their <tips=95>golden eyes</tips> appeared. Nor was it limited to muscular strength: it extended to vision and hearing as well.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r260","rowIndex":260,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　これだけならばノーマルよりも優れた人種ということになるが、しかし実際にはデメリットが存在する。","en":"If that were the whole story, Type Bs would be a race superior to Normals. In reality, however, there were drawbacks.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r261","rowIndex":261,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=17>タイプB</tips>は一般的にノーマルよりも不安定な精神を持つ。泣いたり怒ったり、感情の変化が激しい。そして、もっとも悩ましいのが『<tips=17>タイプB</tips>発作』の存在だ。","en":"<tips=17>Type Bs</tips> were generally less psychologically stable than Normals, prone to tears, anger, and violent swings of emotion. Most troubling of all were the “<tips=17>Type B</tips> episodes.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r262","rowIndex":262,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　この発作が起こると、<tips=17>タイプB</tips>は様々な精神症状に襲われる。それは麻薬や覚醒剤などの禁断症状と似ている。妄想、幻聴、幻視などが代表的である。","en":"During an episode, a <tips=17>Type B</tips> was beset by a range of psychiatric symptoms resembling withdrawal from narcotics or stimulants. Delusions, auditory hallucinations, and visual hallucinations were typical.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r263","rowIndex":263,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　発作を何度も繰り返すと、症状は次第に悪化してゆく。発作が起きていないときでも幻覚や幻聴に苛まれ、現実を認識する能力が失われる。知能が低下し、人格が荒廃する。意味もなく笑い続けるようになる。——こうなれば最早社会生活は営めない。","en":"With each repeated episode, the symptoms gradually worsened. Even between episodes, visions and voices tormented the patient, who steadily lost the ability to recognize reality. Intellect declined. Personality deteriorated. They began to laugh endlessly for no reason. —By then, life in society was no longer possible.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r264","rowIndex":264,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　たとえ症状が人格を崩壊させるまで進行していなくとも、ひとたび発作が起きてしまえば、<tips=17>タイプB</tips>は妄想と幻覚で予想出来ぬ行動をとり、しかも優れた肉体能力を持つという、場合によっては非常に驚異的な存在となってしまうのだ。この状態で犯罪を起こしてしまうと、そのまま病院に収容され、多くの場合そのまま外に出ることは出来なくなる。現代社会はまだ<tips=17>タイプB</tips>を受け入れることが出来ない。","en":"Even if the symptoms had not yet progressed to the collapse of the personality, a single episode could make a <tips=17>Type B</tips> act unpredictably under delusions and hallucinations while endowed with extraordinary physical ability—a combination that could make them a formidable presence indeed. If they committed a crime in that condition, they would be confined to a hospital and, in many cases, never released. Modern society was not yet capable of accepting <tips=17>Type Bs</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r265","rowIndex":265,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　向精神薬によってある程度幻聴や幻覚を抑制することは出来る。","en":"Psychotropic drugs could suppress the visions and voices to some extent.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r266","rowIndex":266,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しかし、一度壊れてしまった人間性を取り戻すことは出来ないし、発作のリスクをゼロにする方法も現在は見付かっていない。","en":"But no drug could restore a personality once it had been destroyed, and no way had yet been found to eliminate the risk of another episode.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r267","rowIndex":267,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　どんなに穏やかに暮らしていても、ある日突然とんでもない発作に襲われて、自分でも予期せぬ行動をとってしまう可能性が、すべての<tips=17>タイプB</tips>に常につきまとっている。","en":"The possibility always hung over every <tips=17>Type B</tips>: no matter how peaceful their life, a terrible episode might strike without warning and drive them to actions even they could never have foreseen.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r268","rowIndex":268,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　つまり、<tips=17>タイプB</tips>として生まれ、ノーマルと変わらない生活を送りたいのならば、ただ発作が起きないよう祈り続けるしかないのだ。","en":"Thus, if someone born <tips=17>Type B</tips> wished to live no differently from a Normal, there was nothing to do but continue praying that an episode would never occur.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r269","rowIndex":269,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　こうした事情が、同じミュータントと言えども、<tips=16>タイプA</tips>が高い社会的地位を得たり指導者的な立場につくことが少なくないのに比べ、<tips=17>タイプB</tips>が差別的な境遇におかれたり、社会からドロップアウトして貧困に陥ったりする現状を作っている。","en":"These circumstances had created the present disparity between the two mutant types. <tips=16>Type As</tips> often attained high social status or positions of leadership, while <tips=17>Type Bs</tips> were subjected to discrimination or dropped out of society and fell into poverty.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r270","rowIndex":270,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　――本の冒頭に記述されたこれらの事柄は、<tips=83>美紗</tips>は今更言われなくともよく知っている話であり、看護学校の教科書にも記載されていた。","en":"—None of this in the book’s opening was news to <tips=83>Misa</tips>. It had all appeared in her nursing-school textbooks as well.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r271","rowIndex":271,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ただ、学生の頃は文字としてしか受け取れなかったものが、今となっては言葉の一つ一つがすべて実体のある具体的なイメージとなる。例えば、幻聴や妄想によって善良な<tips=17>タイプB</tips>が犯罪を起こしてしまう例などを読むと、自分の病院にいる患者の何人かを思い浮かべる。そして、彼らの犯した犯罪と、症状の関係について考える。","en":"As a student, she had been able to take it in only as words on a page. Now every word had substance; each one called up a concrete image. When she read, for example, of a decent <tips=17>Type B</tips> committing a crime under the influence of hallucinations or delusions, several patients at her own hospital came to mind. She found herself considering how their crimes had related to their symptoms.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r272","rowIndex":272,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　自分は看護師としてその症状のケアがうまく出来ているだろうか？　そして、ケアした先に何があるのだろうか？　退院も出来ず、一生病院で暮らす患者ばかりなのに。十代から病院にいて、老境を迎えてしまったような患者の人生とは一体なんなのか？","en":"Was she doing enough, as a nurse, to care for those symptoms? And what awaited beyond that care? Her patients could not leave; they would spend their entire lives in the hospital. What, really, was the life of someone who had entered the hospital in her teens and grown old there?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r273","rowIndex":273,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その一方毎日幸福そうに楽しく生きている患者も少なくない。病院のなかは、社会とちがって<tips=17>タイプB</tips>だからといっていじめられないのが良いと言う。","en":"And yet many of the patients seemed to live happy, enjoyable lives each day. They said the good thing about the hospital was that, unlike in society outside, no one bullied them for being <tips=17>Type B</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r274","rowIndex":274,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それは確かに一理ある。この病院で長期入院をするような患者は、大体そとの世界で酷い目にあって、苦しい人生を過ごしていたものばかりだ。","en":"There was certainly truth in that. Most patients who ended up hospitalized here for the long term had been treated terribly in the outside world and lived lives full of suffering.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r275","rowIndex":275,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そういう人々と接すると、そもそも、人が幸福に生きて死ぬということは何なのかと考えさせられる。","en":"Contact with people like these made Misa wonder what it really meant for a person to live and die happily.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r276","rowIndex":276,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=82>Ｕ</tips>のようにまだほんの子供のうちから病院に入ってしまって、そしておそらく一生ここで暮らすような生き方は人生と呼べるのだろうか？　なんとか社会に戻してやりたいが、彼女のレベルまでADL（日常生活動作）が低下してしまうと、もうどんな手を尽くしても回復は難しいだろう。それに、たとえADLが改善されたとしても、受け入れる場所がないのかもしれない。彼女は外の世界で症状による大失敗を犯しており、真っ先に受け入れるべき家族たちが、誰よりも社会復帰に反対している。","en":"Could <tips=82>U’s</tips> way of life—hospitalized when still hardly more than a child and probably destined to live here forever—truly be called a life? Misa wanted somehow to return her to society. But once her ADL—her ability to perform the activities of daily living—had fallen this far, recovery would likely be difficult no matter what anyone did. Even if her ADL improved, perhaps there would be nowhere willing to take her. Her illness had led her to make a terrible mistake in the outside world, and the very family who should have been first to welcome her home opposed her return more fiercely than anyone.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r277","rowIndex":277,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　このままでは人生のほぼ全てを病院で過ごすことになる。","en":"At this rate, she would spend almost her entire life in the hospital.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r278","rowIndex":278,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それはあまりにも悲惨な人生だ……。","en":"It seemed too wretched a life to bear...","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r279","rowIndex":279,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　考えているうちに眠くなり、本題まで読み進める前に、机に突っ伏すように眠りについてしまった。","en":"Thinking it over made her drowsy, and before she ever reached the book’s main subject, she fell asleep sprawled over the desk.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r280","rowIndex":280,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　携帯電話の着信音で目が覚める。相手は、田舎の母親であった。","en":"Her cell phone’s ringtone woke her. Her mother was calling from back home.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r281","rowIndex":281,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"『<tips=83>美紗</tips>ちゃん、元気？』","en":"“<tips=83>Misa</tips>, honey, how are you?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r282","rowIndex":282,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「うん、まあ……」","en":"“Yeah, more or less...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r283","rowIndex":283,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=83>美紗</tips>の声が我知らず暗くなるのは、母との仲が悪いからというわけではない。","en":"<tips=83>Misa’s</tips> voice darkened despite herself. It was not because she and her mother were on bad terms.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r284","rowIndex":284,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　むしろ良好なのであるが、母がこれから言い出そうとしていることがおおかた想像出来て、しかもその話題があまり好ましくないということもわかっているので、この先の言葉を聞きたくはなれなかった。","en":"Quite the opposite: they got along well. But she could already guess most of what her mother was about to say, and she knew she would not care for the subject. She had no desire to hear what came next.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r285","rowIndex":285,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　母は実家から自転車で十分の銀行の事務員として働き、車で五分で到着する地元の役所に勤める公務員を夫にしたという、きわめて狭い世界で人生を送っており、看護師という<tips=83>美紗</tips>の仕事に対しても、<tips=17>タイプB</tips>、<tips=9>Y地区</tips>、という事柄に対しても、特別な知識を持たない。","en":"Her mother had passed her life in an exceedingly small world: she worked as a clerk at a bank ten minutes by bicycle from her childhood home, and had married a civil servant whose local government office was five minutes away by car. She knew nothing in particular about <tips=83>Misa’s</tips> work as a nurse, <tips=17>Type B</tips>, or <tips=9>Y District</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r286","rowIndex":286,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　メディアで取り上げられたり、知り合いの誰かが訳知り顔で偏見に満ちた言葉を語れば、そのまま信じてしまうような、ある意味非常に純真な人物であった。","en":"She was, in a sense, extraordinarily innocent—the kind of person who believed whatever she heard in the media, or whatever some acquaintance pronounced with a knowing look, no matter how full of prejudice.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r287","rowIndex":287,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ということはつまり、彼女は全く善良な親切心でもって、<tips=83>美紗</tips>の仕事に反対しているのである。","en":"Which meant that she opposed <tips=83>Misa’s</tips> work out of perfectly genuine concern and kindness.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r288","rowIndex":288,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　今の職場に入職してから三年、常に辞めろ辞めろと言い続けている。","en":"For all three years since Misa had taken her present job, her mother had never stopped telling her to quit.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r289","rowIndex":289,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"『なんだか声が暗いわ。仕事でいやなことがあるんでしょう？』","en":"“You sound awfully down. Something happened at work, didn’t it?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r290","rowIndex":290,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そんなことないよ。仕事は毎日楽しいし、やりがいがあるもの」","en":"“That’s not true. I enjoy my job every day, and it feels worthwhile.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r291","rowIndex":291,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"『そうかしら。お母さんにはとても信じられないわ……』","en":"“Really? I find that very hard to believe...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r292","rowIndex":292,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「お母さんにはわからないかもしれないけど、本当に楽しいのよ。患者さんと接していると、今まで考えたこともなかったようなことを沢山考えるし、それに同僚からも色んな価値観を学べるわ。確かに特殊な職場だとは思うけど、だからこそ学べることが多いの」","en":"“You may not understand, Mom, but I really do enjoy it. Being with the patients makes me think about all kinds of things I’d never considered before, and my coworkers teach me so many different ways of looking at life. I know it’s an unusual workplace, but that’s exactly why there’s so much I can learn there.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r293","rowIndex":293,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"『そんなの、きっと他でも学べるわよ。職場をそんなに褒めるのもなんだか不自然な気がする。楽しいばかりの仕事なんてあるわけないでしょう。ねえ、毎日、ちょっと変になった患者さんと喋ってばかりで、それがうつってしまってるってこともあるんじゃない？』","en":"“You could surely learn those things somewhere else. It feels strange to hear you praise your workplace so insistently. No job is fun all the time. Listen, when you spend every day talking to patients who’ve gone a little strange themselves, don’t you think some of it might be rubbing off on you?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r294","rowIndex":294,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「お母さんが、いっつもいっつも否定ばっかりするから、私は良いところを説明することになってるんでしょ！」","en":"“You do nothing but criticize it, over and over, so of course I end up having to explain what’s good about it!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r295","rowIndex":295,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　つい語気が荒くなってしまう。","en":"Her voice grew harsh despite herself.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r296","rowIndex":296,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　母親の愛情や不安を想像は出来るが、しかしこちらの言葉を全く理解してくれずに何度も同じ話題を繰り返す母親には、<tips=83>美紗</tips>もさすがにストレスを感じている。","en":"<tips=83>Misa</tips> could imagine the love and anxiety behind her mother’s words. Even so, she could not help feeling the strain when her mother understood nothing she said and returned to the same subject over and over.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r297","rowIndex":297,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　母親は受話器の向こうで溜息をついてから、","en":"Her mother sighed on the other end of the line, then said,","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r298","rowIndex":298,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"『ごめんね。でも、ただ心配してるだけなのよ』","en":"“I’m sorry. I’m only worried about you, that’s all.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r299","rowIndex":299,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それはわかってるよ。こっちこそ大きな声を出してごめん」","en":"“I know. I’m sorry I raised my voice too.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r300","rowIndex":300,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"『もう<tips=83>美紗</tips>も大人だし、いちいち口を出してはいけないって思うんだけど、この間電話を切ってからもずっと考えちゃってね。……ほら、患者さんのなかには、ひどい犯罪をした人もたくさんいるんでしょ？　<tips=83>美紗</tips>の職場は、そういう人を預かる場所なんでしょ？　いくら薬が効いて大人しくなってるって言っても、私からすると、とても危ない場所にいるようにしか思えないの』","en":"“<tips=83>Misa</tips>, you’re an adult now, and I know I shouldn’t have something to say about every little thing you do. But ever since we hung up the other day, I haven’t been able to stop thinking about it. ...Some of the patients have committed terrible crimes, haven’t they? Your hospital is where they keep people like that, isn’t it, <tips=83>Misa</tips>? You say the medicine keeps them quiet, but to me it sounds as though you’re working in a terribly dangerous place.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r301","rowIndex":301,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　なかなか理解をしてくれない母に、どうしても自分の気持ちを知って欲しかった。母の言うことはよく分かる。世間の人の多くはそんな偏見を持っているのだろう。","en":"Her mother simply could not seem to understand, and Misa desperately wanted her to know how she felt. Misa understood what her mother was saying. Most people probably shared the same prejudice.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r302","rowIndex":302,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちの現場を見なければ、なかなかわかりづらいことだ。ここで何を言ってもどうにもならないのかもしれない。","en":"No one could easily understand without seeing their ward for themselves. Perhaps nothing Misa said over the phone would make any difference.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r303","rowIndex":303,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それでも——それでも<tips=83>美紗</tips>は、自分がやりがいを持ってこの仕事に打ち込んでいることをこの母に伝えたかったのだ。自然と口調は熱を帯びる。","en":"Still—still, <tips=83>Misa</tips> wanted her mother to know how much meaning she found in the work, how completely she had devoted herself to it. Her voice grew heated of its own accord.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r304","rowIndex":304,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ごめんなさい、こんなことを話した私が悪かった。でも、本当にお母さんが思っているような場所じゃないの。私が新人でミスばっかりしてた時だって、助けてくれたのは患者さんだし、それに発作以外の部分は、みんな普通の人なのよ？　むしろ、普通の人よりも純粋で正直な人ばかりで……」","en":"“I’m sorry. I shouldn’t have told you any of this. But it really isn’t the kind of place you think it is. Even when I was new and doing nothing but making mistakes, the patients were the ones who helped me. And apart from their episodes, they’re all ordinary people, you know? If anything, they’re more innocent and honest than ordinary people...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r305","rowIndex":305,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"『<tips=83>美紗</tips>、あなたは仕事にのめりこみすぎよ。言えば言うほど、なにか、おかしな感じがするわ。昔とは違う』","en":"“<tips=83>Misa</tips>, you’re too wrapped up in that job. The more you say, the more something about you feels wrong. You’re not the way you used to be.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r306","rowIndex":306,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　母の予想外に冷静な口調に、<tips=83>美紗</tips>は言葉を失う。","en":"The unexpected calm in her mother’s voice struck <tips=83>Misa</tips> speechless.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r307","rowIndex":307,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"『ねえ、看護師さんを辞めろとは言わないわ。でも、せめてもっと普通の病院に勤めて、普通の人と関わって頂戴。お母さんね、何か<tips=83>美紗</tips>が知らない人になってゆくようでこわいの』","en":"“Listen, I won’t tell you to stop being a nurse. But please, at least find a more ordinary hospital and work with ordinary people. I’m scared, <tips=83>Misa</tips>. It feels as if you’re turning into someone I don’t know.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r308","rowIndex":308,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=83>美紗</tips>は咄嗟に返事を口にすることが出来なかった。","en":"<tips=83>Misa</tips> could not answer at once.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r309","rowIndex":309,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「私はやめないよ」","en":"“I’m not quitting.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r310","rowIndex":310,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しばらく経ってから、どうにかそれだけを口にして、","en":"After a while, she managed to force out those words and nothing more.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r311","rowIndex":311,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「じゃあごめんね。今日は切るね。明日は明け日勤だから、今日はゆっくり休みたいの」","en":"“Sorry, then. I’m going to hang up. I’ve got day shift tomorrow after being on nights, so I want to get some proper rest today.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r312","rowIndex":312,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　返事を待たずに一方的に通話を切った。","en":"Without waiting for a reply, she simply hung up.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r313","rowIndex":313,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そしてよろよろと椅子を立つと、ベッドの上に突っ伏す。","en":"She rose unsteadily from the chair and collapsed facedown across the bed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r314","rowIndex":314,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　この病院で、それまでは想像もしなかったような人たちとの出会いがあり、確かに変わった。","en":"At this hospital, she had met people she could never have imagined before, and those encounters had undeniably changed her.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r315","rowIndex":315,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　自分ではそれを人間的な成長だと考えている。素晴らしいものを見つけたし、これまで考えられなかったことも考えられるようになった。有り体に言って、視野が広がったのだ。","en":"She regarded that change as personal growth. She had discovered something wonderful; she had learned to think about things once beyond her imagination. Put plainly, her horizons had broadened.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r316","rowIndex":316,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しかし、母はこの成長を、おかしくなったとしか受け止められないらしい。","en":"Her mother, however, seemed able to see that growth only as her daughter going strange.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r317","rowIndex":317,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　毎日の努力のなかから手に入れたこの宝物を、もっとも自分を愛してくれているはずの母親が理解出来ないというのはどういうことだろう？","en":"What could it mean that her mother—the person who ought to love her more than anyone—could not understand this treasure she had earned through her efforts day after day?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-1:r318","rowIndex":318,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それを思うと、声を出して泣きたいような、それとは逆にシンと醒めて心が鉄の塊になってしまったような、矛盾する二つの感情が一遍に胸に押し寄せた。","en":"At the thought, two contradictory feelings swept into her chest at once: an urge to sob aloud and, at the same time, a cold, absolute lucidity, as though her heart had hardened into a lump of iron.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}}]},{"position":6,"code":"X2-2","unitId":"X2-2","rows":[{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r1","rowIndex":1,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その日の<tips=83>美紗</tips>は日勤だった。","en":"That day, <tips=83>Misa</tips> was working the day shift.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r2","rowIndex":2,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　看護師の勤務は昼と夜とが目まぐるしく入れ替わり、<tips=83>美紗</tips>はもう新人ではなかったけれども、こんな風に夜勤明け翌日の日勤は眠い。通常夜勤から日勤に変わるときは、間に一日以上休みを入れるようにはなっているが、シフトの都合でどうしてもこのような明け日勤になることがある。","en":"Nurses’ schedules swung dizzyingly between days and nights. <tips=83>Misa</tips> was no longer new to the job, but a day shift the day after coming off nights still left her this sleepy. Normally, at least one day off was placed between night and day shifts; sometimes, however, the demands of the roster made a shift like this unavoidable.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r3","rowIndex":3,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ドアの外であくびをしてから看護室の隣の休憩室に足を踏み入れると、すでに先輩ナースたちが出勤しており、長椅子に座って談笑をしている。","en":"After yawning outside the door, she stepped into the break room beside the nurses’ station. Several senior nurses were already there, sitting on the couch and chatting.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r4","rowIndex":4,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=83>能見</tips>さん、もう聞いた？」","en":"“Ms. <tips=83>Nomi</tips>, have you heard?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"古川","displayName":"Furukawa","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r5","rowIndex":5,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そのうちの、古川ナースが緑茶の入ったピンクのマグカップを片手に声をかけて来る。","en":"Nurse Furukawa, holding a pink mug of green tea, called to her from among them.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r6","rowIndex":6,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「何をですか？」","en":"“Heard what?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"能見美紗","displayName":"Misa Nomi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r7","rowIndex":7,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「夜勤帯で、フクちゃんがステっちゃったんだって」","en":"“I heard Fuku died during the night shift.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"古川","displayName":"Furukawa","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r8","rowIndex":8,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「えっ？」","en":"“What?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"能見美紗","displayName":"Misa Nomi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r9","rowIndex":9,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「消灯後に転倒して頭打っちゃってね、洗面所の周りが血みどろだったらしいわよ」","en":"“She fell after lights-out and struck her head. I hear there was blood all over the washroom.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"古川","displayName":"Furukawa","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r10","rowIndex":10,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうなんですか。あんなに足腰しっかりしてたのに。なんで急に」","en":"“Really? But she was so steady on her feet. Why, all of a sudden...?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"能見美紗","displayName":"Misa Nomi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r11","rowIndex":11,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=83>美紗</tips>はバッグをいつもの位置にしまいながら答える。","en":"<tips=83>Misa</tips> replied as she put her bag away in its usual place.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r12","rowIndex":12,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「眠剤を変えた影響かしらねえ。まあでも、あんた良かったわねえ。夜勤が一日ずれてたら、大変だったわよお。ねえ、箕田さん」","en":"“Maybe changing her sleeping pills did it. Still, you got lucky. If your night shift had fallen one day later, you’d have had a hell of a time. Right, Ms. Minoda?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"古川","displayName":"Furukawa","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r13","rowIndex":13,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ベテランの古川ナースは、ちょうど休憩室に入ってきた昨夜の夜勤者である箕田ナースを呼び止める。","en":"The veteran Nurse Furukawa stopped Nurse Minoda, who had just entered the break room after working the night shift.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r14","rowIndex":14,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうなのよ。最近の夜勤帯は平和だったから、余計忙しく感じちゃった。あ、お茶入れてくれてたの？　ありがとう。仮眠もとれなかったから、眠くって眠くって」","en":"“That’s right. Night shifts have been so quiet lately, it made this one feel even worse. Oh, is that tea for me? Thanks. I didn’t even get a nap, and now I’m so, so sleepy.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"箕田","displayName":"Minoda","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r15","rowIndex":15,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　箕田ナースは犬のキャラクターが描かれた可愛らしい自分のマグカップを手に取り、緑茶を一口すすると、","en":"Nurse Minoda picked up her own charming mug, decorated with a cartoon dog, and took a sip of green tea before continuing.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r16","rowIndex":16,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「私も忍野さんもエンゼルケアやるの久しぶりで、いろいろ忘れちゃってたから、二階に電話してやり方聞きながらやったりね。まあとにかく大変だったけど、家族とすぐに連絡がついたから良かったわ。朝一で遺体を引き取りに来てくれたのよ。矢沢さんのときなんか、家族がごちゃごちゃしてて結局二ヶ月も預かってたでしょ？　<tips=83>能見</tips>ちゃん、あの時の遺体見た？」","en":"“It had been ages since either Ms. Oshino or I had done postmortem care, and we’d forgotten all sorts of things. We had to call the second floor and have them talk us through it while we worked. Anyway, it was a lot, but thank goodness we reached the family right away. They came for the body first thing this morning. Remember Ms. Yazawa? Things with her family got so complicated that we ended up keeping the body for two whole months. <tips=83>Nomi</tips>, did you see her then?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"箕田","displayName":"Minoda","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r17","rowIndex":17,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いや、私は見なかったですね」","en":"“No, I never saw her.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"能見美紗","displayName":"Misa Nomi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r18","rowIndex":18,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=83>美紗</tips>は設置された電気ポットから自分のマグカップにお湯を注ぎ、インスタントコーヒーを作りながらそう答えた。","en":"<tips=83>Misa</tips> answered as she poured hot water from the electric kettle into her mug and made instant coffee.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r19","rowIndex":19,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あれは可哀想だったねえ。あ、そのおせんべい頂戴」","en":"“That was awful, poor thing. Oh, pass me one of those rice crackers.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"古川","displayName":"Furukawa","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r20","rowIndex":20,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　古川ナースは<tips=94>吉田主任</tips>が開封した醤油せんべいの袋に手を伸ばし、ポリポリと音を立てて咀嚼する。","en":"Nurse Furukawa reached into the packet of soy-sauce rice crackers <tips=94>Chief Yoshida</tips> had opened and crunched noisily on one.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r21","rowIndex":21,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まあでも、エンゼルケアくらいちゃんと覚えておいてもらわないと困るわ」","en":"“Still, I need you two to remember how to do postmortem care properly.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"吉田主任","displayName":"Chief Yoshida","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r22","rowIndex":22,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=94>吉田主任</tips>は苦い顔をする。","en":"<tips=94>Chief Yoshida</tips> grimaced.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r23","rowIndex":23,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=83>能見</tips>ちゃんも、ちゃんとやり方を確認しておきなさい。当たらないときはずっと当たらなかったりするけど、いつ必要になるかわからないんだから、忘れないようにしなきゃ」","en":"“<tips=83>Nomi</tips>, you need to make sure you review the procedure too. Sometimes we can go ages without having to do it, but you never know when we might need it, so you can’t let yourself forget.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"吉田主任","displayName":"Chief Yoshida","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r24","rowIndex":24,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうですね。わたしもしばらく当たってないですし、前の時は前野さんが指示出してくれましたから」","en":"“Right. I haven’t had one in a while either, and last time Ms. Maeno was there to talk me through it.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"能見美紗","displayName":"Misa Nomi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r25","rowIndex":25,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=83>美紗</tips>は言って、コーヒーを啜る。","en":"<tips=83>Misa</tips> said, then took a sip of coffee.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r26","rowIndex":26,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　Fの死はあまりにも唐突だった。しかし、この病棟では患者の死というものはいつも突然訪れる。","en":"F’s death had been shockingly sudden. Yet on this ward, death always came suddenly.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r27","rowIndex":27,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ここの患者は老人は多いが、『<tips=17>タイプB</tips>症状が進んでいる』という以外、肉体的には健康だ。内臓に腫瘍が出来たとか、癌が見つかったとか、そういった身体的な問題が発生して手厚い内科的看護が必要になった患者はC棟に移動する。","en":"The ward had many elderly patients, but apart from the progression of their <tips=17>Type B</tips> symptoms, they were physically healthy. Anyone who developed a serious physical problem—a tumor in an internal organ, for example, or cancer—and required intensive medical care was transferred to Building C.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r28","rowIndex":28,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　だから、この病棟で命を落とすケースと言えば、誤嚥で食べ物を喉に詰まらせるとか、Fのように転んで頭を打つとか、大量飲水をして水中毒になるというような突発的な事故ばかりだ。少なくとも、<tips=83>美紗</tips>が入職してから死んだ患者たちはみなそうだった。何の前触れもなく突然死んだ。","en":"Deaths on this ward therefore came almost entirely through sudden accidents: a patient aspirating food and choking, falling and striking her head as F had done, or drinking so much water that she suffered water intoxication. At least, every patient who had died since <tips=83>Misa</tips> joined the staff had gone that way. Each had died suddenly, without warning.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r29","rowIndex":29,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　だから、そう多くはないとは言え、<tips=83>美紗</tips>も何度か体験しているので慣れてはいる。死そのものにも、激しく感情がゆさぶられたりもしない。","en":"So although deaths were not especially common, <tips=83>Misa</tips> had been through this several times and was used to it. Death itself no longer shook her to the core.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r30","rowIndex":30,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ただ、その死について思うところはある。","en":"Even so, F’s death gave her something to think about.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r31","rowIndex":31,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　Fは騒々しい患者だった。昨日も<tips=82>Ｕ</tips>に突き飛ばされ、あんなに悪態をついていた。","en":"F was a noisy patient. Only yesterday, <tips=82>U</tips> had shoved her down, and F had been hurling abuse with such vigor.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r32","rowIndex":32,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　あの威勢のよかった人物が、今はもうこの世におらず、そしてその遺体さえも病院には存在しないと思うと不思議な気分だった。さらに、あんなに病院を出たがっていたFが、死体になった途端こんなに簡単に出て行けるというのも、何やら皮肉なものだと思った。","en":"It felt strange to think that the person who had been so full of spirit no longer existed in the world, and that even her body was already gone from the hospital. Stranger still, and somehow ironic, was the fact that F—who had wanted so badly to leave—had been able to do so with such ease the moment she became a corpse.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r33","rowIndex":33,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=83>美紗</tips>は看護師たちの雑談を上の空で聞きながら、コーヒーを啜り続けた。","en":"<tips=83>Misa</tips> continued sipping her coffee, only half listening to the nurses’ conversation.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r34","rowIndex":34,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そうしているうちに時間になり、いつも通りの業務がはじまる。","en":"Before long, it was time, and the day’s work began as usual.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r35","rowIndex":35,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　満床だったのがFの死によりベッドが一つ空いた。しかし、その日の昼前には二階の患者が上がって来て、すぐに満床へと戻る。二階職員の言葉を聞き、サマリーを読む限り、新しく上がってきた患者はおとなしくてFよりも手がかからない人物のようだったので、職員はみな安堵した。","en":"F’s death had left one bed vacant on the full ward. Before noon, however, a patient came up from the second floor, and the ward was immediately full again. From what the second-floor staff said and what they could read in the summary, the newcomer seemed quiet and less demanding than F. Everyone breathed a sigh of relief.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r36","rowIndex":36,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　患者たちは動揺しない。深夜に起きた事故とは言え何人かの患者は目撃をしており、その死は認識されているはずだが、不穏になって大騒ぎをする患者はいなかった。ここの患者のほとんどは他人に無関心で、残りのうち何割かは死という概念そのものを理解出来ず、さらに残りの何割かは死に慣れて不感症になっている。悲しみを見せるものや、自分の症状と重ねていつもより少し不穏になるものもいるが、それだけだ。","en":"The patients were not disturbed. Although the accident had occurred late at night, several of them had witnessed it and must have understood that F had died, yet none grew agitated or caused an uproar. Most patients here were indifferent to other people. Of those who remained, some could not understand the concept of death at all, while others had grown numb through familiarity with it. Some showed grief, while others connected F’s death with their own symptoms and grew a little more agitated than usual, but that was all.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r37","rowIndex":37,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　患者たちは午前は作業療法で歌を歌い、午後は二日に一度のおやつである焼きプリンを食べて喜んでいた。それはいつもと何も変わらない日常だった。","en":"That morning, the patients sang during occupational therapy. That afternoon, they delighted in the baked custard served as their every-other-day snack. It was an ordinary day, no different from any other.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r38","rowIndex":38,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=83>美紗</tips>は明け日勤の眠い目をこすりながら業務をこなし、夕方に、昨日保護室にいれたばかりの<tips=82>Ｕ</tips>を解放する指示が出たので、<tips=92>水村ナース</tips>と二人で保護室に入ってその少女を連れ出した。","en":"<tips=83>Misa</tips> rubbed her sleep-starved eyes as she worked through the day. Toward evening, an order came to release <tips=82>U</tips>, whom they had placed in seclusion only the day before. Misa and <tips=92>Nurse Mizumura</tips> went into the seclusion room together and brought the girl out.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r39","rowIndex":39,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=82>Ｕ</tips>は本来は黒く澄んだ瞳を持っているのだが、まだ<tips=95>金眼</tips>が治りきっていない。問いかけても反応が薄く、笑っている。","en":"<tips=82>U’s</tips> eyes were normally a clear, deep black, but the <tips=95>golden color</tips> had not yet faded completely. She responded only faintly when spoken to and went on smiling.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r40","rowIndex":40,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「本当に出しても大丈夫なんですかねえ」","en":"“Are you sure it’s safe to let her out?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"水村","displayName":"Mizumura","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r41","rowIndex":41,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=92>水村ナース</tips>は首をひねる。","en":"<tips=92>Nurse Mizumura</tips> tilted her head doubtfully.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r42","rowIndex":42,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まあ、先生の指示ですから」","en":"“Well, those are the doctor’s orders.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"能見美紗","displayName":"Misa Nomi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r43","rowIndex":43,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=83>美紗</tips>はそう答えたが、彼女も半信半疑ではある。以前も保護室から出した後のお茶の時間に、テーブルの上に並べられた他の患者のマグカップを片っ端からひっくり返すという事件があった。状態が安定していない時の<tips=82>Ｕ</tips>は、そういうことをする。","en":"<tips=83>Misa</tips> answered, though she was not convinced either. Once before, after <tips=82>U</tips> had been released from seclusion, she had gone down the table at tea time overturning every other patient’s mug in turn. U did that sort of thing when her condition had not yet stabilized.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r44","rowIndex":44,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=95>金眼</tips>のまま不安定になると、強い薬を与えられて普段はふらふらしているような患者でも素早く動き、職員の静止が間に合わないケースがある。それが、他の病気とは違う<tips=17>タイプB</tips>患者のやっかいなところだった。","en":"While unstable and <tips=95>golden-eyed</tips>, even patients who ordinarily staggered under heavy medication could move so fast that the staff failed to restrain them in time. That was what made <tips=17>Type B</tips> patients uniquely difficult compared with patients suffering from other illnesses.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r45","rowIndex":45,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　実際二人の不安は的中したかのように見えた。","en":"In fact, it soon appeared that the two nurses’ fears had been justified.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r46","rowIndex":46,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　昼過ぎ、職員たちが看護室に集まってショートカンファレンスを行っているところ、患者のKが看護室の小窓を叩く。","en":"Early that afternoon, while the staff were gathered in the nurses’ station for a short conference, patient K tapped on the little window.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r47","rowIndex":47,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どうしたの？」","en":"“What is it?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"水村","displayName":"Mizumura","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r48","rowIndex":48,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　窓の近くにいた<tips=92>水村ナース</tips>が尋ねると、","en":"<tips=92>Nurse Mizumura</tips>, who was standing near the window, went over and asked:","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r49","rowIndex":49,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「看護師さん早くきて！　きて！　<tips=82>ヒロちゃん</tips>がまたやったの！　廊下にやっちゃったのよ！　あの子が！」","en":"“Nurse, hurry! Come quick! <tips=82>Hiro</tips> did it again! She did it right in the hallway! That girl did!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r50","rowIndex":50,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「Kさん、わかったからそのキンキン声で叫ぶのやめて」","en":"“K, I heard you. Now stop yelling in that shrill voice.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"水村","displayName":"Mizumura","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r51","rowIndex":51,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　まくし立てるKに、<tips=92>水村ナース</tips>は苦い顔をして窓を閉めると、<tips=82>Ｕ</tips>の受け持ちである<tips=83>美紗</tips>を振り返る。","en":"With K still rattling on, <tips=92>Nurse Mizumura</tips> grimaced, slid the window shut, and turned to <tips=83>Misa</tips>, who was responsible for <tips=82>U</tips> that day.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r52","rowIndex":52,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「らしいですよ」","en":"“Looks like she’s done it again.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"水村","displayName":"Mizumura","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r53","rowIndex":53,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「行きます」","en":"“I’ll go.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"能見美紗","displayName":"Misa Nomi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r54","rowIndex":54,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そう答えたときにはもう<tips=83>美紗</tips>は立ち上がっていて、すぐに看護室を出る。","en":"By the time she answered, <tips=83>Misa</tips> was already on her feet, and she immediately left the nurses’ station.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r55","rowIndex":55,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　すると、すぐに廊下に全裸で座り込んでいる<tips=82>Ｕ</tips>の姿が目に入った。二人の女性看護助手が彼女を立たせようとするが、その手を振り払っていやいやをしている。","en":"Just down the corridor, she found <tips=82>U</tips> sitting stark naked on the floor. Two female nursing assistants were trying to haul her to her feet, but U kept batting their hands away and shaking her head no.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r56","rowIndex":56,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どうしたんですか？」","en":"“What happened?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r57","rowIndex":57,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「尿失禁しちゃって。拭きたいんですけど、動こうとしないんです」","en":"“She’s had an accident. We need to clean her up, but she won’t move.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r58","rowIndex":58,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=82>Ｕ</tips>はヘラヘラと笑いながら、脱いだ自分の服の上に座っている。そして確かに、その服は湿っていた。","en":"<tips=82>U</tips> sat on top of the clothes she had removed, grinning vacantly. The clothes were unmistakably wet.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r59","rowIndex":59,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　随分大量の尿を失禁したようで、ピンクのトレーナーでは吸いきれず、廊下に尿が流れ出そうとする。助手の一人がそれを介護ペーパーで拭い、広がらないようにする。","en":"She seemed to have emptied an enormous quantity of urine, more than the pink sweatshirt could absorb, and it was beginning to run across the corridor. One assistant mopped at it with an absorbent care sheet to keep it from spreading farther.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r60","rowIndex":60,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「立って」","en":"“Stand up.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r61","rowIndex":61,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=83>美紗</tips>の促しは耳に入らないようで、中空をみつめて笑い、時折なにか呟いている。","en":"U seemed not to hear <tips=83>Misa’s</tips> prompt. She stared into empty space and smiled, occasionally murmuring something.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r62","rowIndex":62,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ほら、女の子なんだからこんな格好でおしっこしてたら恥ずかしいでしょ？　しっかりしないとダメよ」","en":"“Come on, you’re a girl. Isn’t it embarrassing, sitting here like this after wetting yourself? You have to pull yourself together.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r63","rowIndex":63,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　助手の一人が半透明のPVCグローブをつけた手でその肘の辺りを掴み、立たせようとしても、やはり動かない。","en":"One assistant, her hand covered by a translucent PVC glove, gripped U around the elbow and tried to make her stand. Still she would not move.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r64","rowIndex":64,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ダメなんですよぅ」","en":"“It’s no gooood.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r65","rowIndex":65,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=82>Ｕ</tips>は顔をしかめて、<tips=83>美紗</tips>の言葉をオウム返しするように呟く。","en":"<tips=82>U</tips> frowned and muttered the last of <tips=83>Misa’s</tips> words back at her like a parrot.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r66","rowIndex":66,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　結局力ずくで立ち上がらせ、廊下の後始末は助手たちに任せると<tips=83>美紗</tips>は自らシャワー室で<tips=82>Ｕ</tips>の体を洗った。洗っているさなかにも<tips=82>Ｕ</tips>は放尿をし、流れる水が黄色く濁った。","en":"In the end, they hauled her to her feet by force. Leaving the assistants to clean the corridor, <tips=83>Misa</tips> washed <tips=82>U</tips> herself in the shower room. Even as she was being washed, <tips=82>U</tips> urinated again, turning the runoff a cloudy yellow.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r67","rowIndex":67,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しかし、問題はこれだけで、このあとすぐに<tips=82>Ｕ</tips>は<tips=95>金眼</tips>を脱していつもの状態に戻った。","en":"That, however, was the only trouble. Soon afterward, <tips=82>U</tips> emerged from the <tips=95>golden-eyed state</tips> and returned to normal.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r68","rowIndex":68,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　といっても、<tips=82>Ｕ</tips>のいつもの状態というのは、年の近い患者のSにまとわりついて<tips=8>グレートホール</tips>について繰り返し同じ質問をしたり、部屋でノートに意味の分からない文言の日記を書き付けたりといった、正常な人間からすれば十分異常なものなのだが。——言ってしまえばさきほどの失禁も、彼女にとっては日常的な光景ではある。","en":"Granted, <tips=82>U’s</tips> usual condition was still abnormal enough by any ordinary person’s standards: she followed S, a patient close to her own age, everywhere, asking her the same questions about the <tips=8>Great Hole</tips> again and again, or filled a notebook in her room with diary entries composed of incomprehensible phrases. —Put bluntly, even the incontinence just now was part of everyday life for her.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r69","rowIndex":69,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　とにかく、夕食を取る様子も危なげがなく、夜に保護室に戻す必要もないと思われる程度には回復したということだ。","en":"In short, she had recovered enough to eat dinner without any sign of danger and no longer appeared to need keeping in seclusion that night.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r70","rowIndex":70,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あぶなっかしかったけど、ちゃんと元に戻りましたね」","en":"“She looked unstable for a while, but she really did get back to her usual self.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"水村","displayName":"Mizumura","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r71","rowIndex":71,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　一緒に<tips=82>Ｕ</tips>を保護室に戻した<tips=92>水村ナース</tips>が溜息をつく。","en":"<tips=92>Nurse Mizumura</tips>, who had helped Misa return <tips=82>U</tips> to the seclusion room, let out a sigh.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r72","rowIndex":72,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「保護室に入ると長引いちゃう子なのに、今回は早かったと思いません？　外に出して刺激を与えたのがよかったんでしょうか。安田先生もたまには的確な指示を出すんですね」","en":"“She usually takes forever once she goes into seclusion, but don’t you think she came around quickly this time? Maybe getting her out and giving her some stimulation did her good. I suppose even Dr. Yasuda gives the right order once in a while.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"水村","displayName":"Mizumura","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r73","rowIndex":73,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いえ、解放したのは主治医じゃなくて<tips=5>太刀川</tips>先生なのよ」","en":"“Actually, it wasn’t her attending physician who released her. It was Dr. <tips=5>Tachikawa</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"能見美紗","displayName":"Misa Nomi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r74","rowIndex":74,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=83>美紗</tips>が伝えると、","en":"When <tips=83>Misa</tips> corrected her,","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r75","rowIndex":75,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ああ、そうなんですか」","en":"“Oh, I see.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"水村","displayName":"Mizumura","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r76","rowIndex":76,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=92>水村ナース</tips>は納得したように頷き、","en":"<tips=92>Nurse Mizumura</tips> nodded as if everything now made sense.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r77","rowIndex":77,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「さすが名医ですね」","en":"“No wonder. He really is a brilliant doctor.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"水村","displayName":"Mizumura","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r78","rowIndex":78,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　と複雑な顔で言った。","en":"She said it with a conflicted expression.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r79","rowIndex":79,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　医者には個性がある。この病院の医者も、それぞれ個性、というか癖がある。しかも強い癖だ。他にいくらでも診療科があるだろうにわざわざ<tips=17>タイプB</tips>専門医となるのだから、その時点でよほど変わりものに決まっている、というのが看護師たちの共通した認識だ。","en":"Every doctor had a personality. The doctors at this hospital had theirs too—or rather, they had their quirks, and pronounced ones at that. With any number of other specialties to choose from, anyone who went out of their way to become a <tips=17>Type B</tips> specialist was bound to be deeply eccentric. At least, all the nurses agreed on that.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r80","rowIndex":80,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　例えば<tips=82>Ｕ</tips>の主治医である安田医師は薬物療法よりも精神療法を重要視するタイプで、薬を最低限度しか処方しない、というよりも最低限度さえ処方しないときがある。","en":"Dr. Yasuda, <tips=82>U’s</tips> attending physician, for instance, placed greater importance on psychotherapy than medication. He prescribed only the bare minimum of drugs—or, at times, less than the bare minimum.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r81","rowIndex":81,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「私はねえ、<tips=17>タイプB</tips>といえども、まずよく話を聞いてあげることが彼らの心にとって一番大切だと考えているのですよ。傾聴対応しながら観察をお願いします」","en":"“You see, even with <tips=17>Type B</tips> patients, I believe the most important thing for their state of mind is to begin by listening closely to what they have to say. Please listen attentively and observe.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r82","rowIndex":82,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　この「傾聴対応しながら観察」というのが一種のキャッチフレーズで、患者が何か問題を起こして報告すると、大体この言葉を口にするだけで、よほどでなければ頓服薬などを出してくれない。","en":"“Listen attentively and observe” was something of a catchphrase. Whenever the staff reported a problem with a patient, he generally offered those words and nothing more. Unless matters were exceptionally serious, he would not even prescribe an as-needed dose.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r83","rowIndex":83,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　が、いくら傾聴対応、つまりその話に耳を傾けたって<tips=17>タイプB</tips>はそう簡単に落ち着かない。この人手不足のなかで、看護師がまるまる一人とられてしまうのは現場にとっても苦しいし、妄想まみれで会話が成立しない相手に長時間対応するのは消耗が激しい。","en":"But no amount of attentive listening—of lending an ear to what they said—would calm a <tips=17>Type B</tips> so easily. With the ward already understaffed, losing an entire nurse to a single patient put tremendous pressure on everyone else. Spending hours with someone so deep in delusion that no conversation could take place was also profoundly exhausting.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r84","rowIndex":84,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それを言うと、","en":"Whenever the staff pointed this out, he would answer:","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r85","rowIndex":85,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それは職員の都合でしょう？　患者さんのためじゃなくて、職員の手間の都合で薬なんか出せません。あなたたちが言っているのは、看護じゃなくて管理の話です」","en":"“That is a matter of convenience for the staff, is it not? I cannot prescribe drugs for your convenience rather than the patient’s welfare. What you are discussing is control, not nursing.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r86","rowIndex":86,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　よく言えば人道主義なのかもしれない。正論とも言えるのかもしれない。先生の言うこともわからないでもないよ？　しかし、現場からすればとてもたまったものじゃない。そりゃ一人一人にきめ細かい看護をしたいのはやまやまだが、人手不足の状態で事故を起こしてはいけないと思えばどうしても管理的になる時もある。","en":"Put kindly, perhaps it was humanism. Perhaps he was even right. It was not as though the staff could not see his point. But for the people working on the ward, it was more than they could bear. Of course they wanted nothing more than to give each patient careful, individual attention. Yet when an understaffed ward still had to prevent accidents, there were inevitably times when nursing became management.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r87","rowIndex":87,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　理想を実現させたいならとりあえず人を増やせ。そもそも安田先生は電話で言うだけで滅多に実際の患者を見に来ないじゃないか。全くあの「ケイチョウシナガラカンサツ」は！　人に言うならまず自分が病棟に来て、四時間でも五時間でも傾聴して、現場がどういうものだか知った方が良い。眠らずに三日間でも平気で喋り続けるような患者だっているんだ！","en":"If he wanted his ideals put into practice, he could start by getting them more staff. Besides, Dr. Yasuda only ever said these things over the phone. He hardly came to see the patients himself. That damned “listen attentively and observe” of his! If he was going to tell other people to do it, he ought to come to the ward, listen for four or five hours himself, and learn what the place was really like. Some patients could happily talk for three days straight without sleeping.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r88","rowIndex":88,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　というのが、看護室でよく聞かれる愚痴だ。","en":"Such complaints were commonly heard in the nurses’ station.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r89","rowIndex":89,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その正反対で、富川という年配の医師は何でもかんでも看護師の言う通りに処方してしまう。","en":"At the opposite extreme was an older doctor named Tomikawa, who prescribed absolutely anything the nurses suggested.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r90","rowIndex":90,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あのー、この人最近ちょっと眠れないんですけど……」","en":"“Um, this patient has been having a little trouble sleeping lately...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r91","rowIndex":91,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あ、じゃあこの薬一錠増やしておくよ」","en":"“Oh, then I’ll add another tablet of this.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r92","rowIndex":92,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「こっちの患者さんは、最近便通が悪くて」","en":"“And this patient has been constipated recently.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r93","rowIndex":93,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「じゃあ夜の下剤を少し盛っておくね」","en":"“Then I’ll increase her laxative a little tonight.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r94","rowIndex":94,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　職員だけでなく、患者からの訴えに対しても、ろくに話も聞かずにホイホイと薬を盛ってしまうので、看護師の方が心配になるときもある。","en":"He did this not only for the staff but for patients too, blithely piling on medication without properly hearing them out. Sometimes even the nurses began to worry.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r95","rowIndex":95,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「私はみなさんを信頼しているから」","en":"“I trust all of you.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r96","rowIndex":96,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　富川医師は笑顔でいつも言うのだが、単に面倒なのだろうというのが看護師たちの見解だ。","en":"Dr. Tomikawa always said it with a smile. The nurses suspected that he simply found it all too much trouble.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r97","rowIndex":97,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それでもこの二人の医師は嫌われているわけではない。陰口を叩かれながらも愛されてはいるし、それなりの尊敬もされているだろう。大体医師である時点で看護師による愚痴や陰口の対象となってしまうことは絶対に避けられないのだ。","en":"Even so, neither of those two doctors was disliked. For all the gossip behind their backs, the staff were fond of them and probably respected them in their own ways. Any doctor, by the very fact of being a doctor, would inevitably become a target of nurses’ complaints and gossip.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r98","rowIndex":98,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ただ、たった一人だけ、本当にきらわれている医師がいる。","en":"There was only one doctor they truly disliked.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r99","rowIndex":99,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　法条医師がそれである。","en":"That was Dr. Hojo.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r100","rowIndex":100,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　優れた論文を多数学会に発表し、世間での評価はすこぶる高い。業界のレジェンドとも言われている高名な医師の愛弟子で、格という意味ではこの病院の医師のなかで最上位だろう。それが、看護スタッフに評判が悪いというのは理由がある。","en":"He had presented numerous highly regarded papers at medical conferences and enjoyed an exceptionally high reputation in the outside world. He was the favored pupil of a famous physician described as a legend in the field, and in prestige he probably ranked above every other doctor at the hospital. Nevertheless, he was deeply unpopular with the nursing staff—and not without reason.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r101","rowIndex":101,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　病棟にはよくやって来る。というのは、看護スタッフを全く信用せず、自分の目で患者を観察しなければ気が済まないからで、看護師を介在させずに密室のなかで患者を診察し、それが終わると一方的に指示だけを下して帰ってゆく。それだけでも評判が悪いが、患者のためを思ってのことならまだ擁護するものもいるだろう。","en":"He visited the ward frequently. That was because he had no trust whatsoever in the nursing staff and would not be satisfied until he had observed his patients with his own eyes. He examined them alone behind a closed door, without a nurse present, then emerged, issued his instructions unilaterally, and left. That alone did little for his popularity, but some might still have defended him if they believed he acted for the patients’ sake.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r102","rowIndex":102,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しかし、実際法条医師のやっていることは、患者の症状を抑えて日々の苦痛を取り去ったり、生活のレベルを上げてやる、というようなものではないのだ。","en":"What Dr. Hojo actually did, however, was not to suppress his patients’ symptoms, relieve their daily suffering, or improve their quality of life.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r103","rowIndex":103,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　もちろん本人がそう宣言しているわけではないが、効果があるのかないのかわからない新療法を行い、患者が苦しんでも一般的な方法には切り換えずにそのまま強行し、そのすぐ後に新療法についての論文を発表しているところを見れば、そうとしか解釈が出来なくなってしまう。","en":"He certainly made no such declaration himself. But when he tried new therapies of uncertain benefit, pressed on with them without switching to standard methods even when patients suffered, and published papers on those therapies immediately afterward, there seemed no other possible interpretation.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r104","rowIndex":104,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　つまり、彼は患者を実験台にしているというのが、看護師たちの見解であった。","en":"In other words, the nurses’ view was that he was using his patients as test subjects.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r105","rowIndex":105,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　法条医師の患者は例外なく問題児で、しかも症状は著しく悪化してゆく。間近でその苦しみを見て、後始末をさせられ、しかも絶対的な指示によって他の患者にしているような当たり前の救済策を取ることが禁じられている看護師たちの苦痛は大変なものだ。","en":"Every one of Dr. Hojo’s patients became a problem case, and every one of them grew markedly worse. The nurses had to witness their suffering at close range and clean up the consequences, while Hojo’s absolute orders forbade them the ordinary measures they used to bring other patients relief. The strain on them was immense.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r106","rowIndex":106,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あんなことをやりたいのなら、ここじゃなくて大学病院にでも行けば良いのに！」","en":"“If he wants to do things like that, he should go to a university hospital instead of doing them here!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r107","rowIndex":107,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　などという、大学病院への偏見と、医師への憤りの両方があわさった言葉が看護室ではよく聞かれる。","en":"The nurses’ station often rang with remarks like this, equal parts fury at the doctor and prejudice against university hospitals.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r108","rowIndex":108,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　このように、多種多様な医師がいるなかで、さらに一風変わっているのが<tips=5>太刀川</tips>という医師であった。","en":"Among this motley collection of doctors, one who was stranger still was Dr. <tips=5>Tachikawa</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r109","rowIndex":109,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　名だたる大学を出たというわけでもなく、むしろこの病院のメンバーのなかでは劣った学歴であるらしいが、おそらく臨床医師としての能力は最も高い。処方も指示も的確で、はじめはどうかと思われるような常識外れの指示でも、投薬でも、実際行ってみるとぴたりと当たる。","en":"He had not graduated from any celebrated university. In fact, his academic pedigree was apparently among the least distinguished at the hospital. Yet he was probably its finest clinician. His prescriptions and instructions were precise, and even an order or medication that at first seemed to defy common sense proved exactly right once put into practice.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r110","rowIndex":110,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　人間である以上失敗する時もあるが、それは誰が判断しても難しいようなケースに限られており、それで評判を落としたことはない。名医と言ってまず間違いがない。主治医を差し置いて他の医者の患者の治療について指示を出すのは本来歓迎されないが、彼は頻繁にそれをやり、能力によってそれが許されている。","en":"Being human, he did sometimes fail, but only in cases that anyone would have found difficult; it had never hurt his reputation. He could safely be called a brilliant doctor. Ordinarily, a physician was not welcome to overrule the attending doctor and issue instructions for someone else’s patient. Tachikawa did so frequently, and his ability won him that license.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r111","rowIndex":111,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　が、とにかく変わっている。","en":"But he was undeniably strange.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r112","rowIndex":112,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　何が変わっているのかというと、まず風貌が変わっている。","en":"What was unusual about him? To begin with, his appearance.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r113","rowIndex":113,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　癖の強く黒々としたひじきのような髪は、前頭部から頭頂部にかけて大分寂しくなっている。","en":"His coarse, jet-black hair, curly as hijiki seaweed, had grown decidedly sparse from his forehead to the crown.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r114","rowIndex":114,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして身につけたものも特徴的だ。この病院の医師は、みな比較的自由な服を着ているのだけれど、それはあくまでも白衣の下に着る服の話で、<tips=5>太刀川</tips>のように四六時中サングラスをかけているものは他にいない。しかもそのサングラスはレンズが丸く、何の光も通さないほど黒いもので、これをこの<tips=5>太刀川</tips>がかけるといかにも異様だ。彼は<tips=16>タイプA</tips>で、このサングラスは目の辺りにあらわれた<tips=77>特質変異</tips>を隠すためだという説もあるが推測の域を出ない。誰もサングラスをとった素顔を見たことがないからである。","en":"What he wore was equally distinctive. The doctors at this hospital all dressed relatively freely, but only in the choice of clothes they wore under their white coats. No one but <tips=5>Tachikawa</tips> wore sunglasses at every hour of the day. Their lenses were round and black enough to admit no light, and on <tips=5>Tachikawa</tips> they looked particularly bizarre. One theory held that he was <tips=16>Type A</tips> and wore them to conceal a <tips=77>trait mutation</tips> expressed around his eyes, but it remained pure speculation. No one had ever seen his face without them.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r115","rowIndex":115,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして彼は長身だった。いつもカツカツと杖をつきながら病棟へやって来るが、足が悪いらしく、一歩足を進めるたびに肩が妙な揺れかたをする。","en":"He was also tall. He always arrived on the ward tapping a cane against the floor. Something appeared to be wrong with his leg, and his shoulders swayed oddly with each step.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r116","rowIndex":116,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　白衣を肩に引っかけていなければどう見ても不審人物で、初めてこの医師の姿を見た者は誰でもぎょっとするに違いない。","en":"Without the white coat draped over his shoulders, he would have looked like nothing but a suspicious character. Anyone seeing the doctor for the first time was sure to be startled.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r117","rowIndex":117,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　変わっているのは外見だけではない。","en":"His appearance was not the only strange thing about him.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r118","rowIndex":118,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　人柄も変わっている。口調こそ丁寧で、患者のみならず看護師や助手、清掃員にまで敬語を使うのだが、愛想というものがない。いつも簡潔に用件だけを伝え、余計なことは全く言わない。挨拶さえもしない。無駄を省略するという一種の合理性なのだ。","en":"His personality was strange as well. His manner of speech was unfailingly polite—he used respectful language not only with patients but with nurses, assistants, and even cleaners—yet he had not a trace of warmth. He stated his business briefly and never said a word more. He did not even greet people. It was a kind of rationalism founded on eliminating the unnecessary.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r119","rowIndex":119,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　自分の担当外の患者を無断で診るのだって、普通の医者ならやりはしないが、自分の方がより適切な診断を下せるのだから診るという、ただそれだけの理由であろう。他の医者に対する面当てだとか、自分の能力を示すだとかいった様子はなく、ただただ患者第一主義で淡々としている。日中は医局にこもることなくあちこちの病棟を歩き回って多くの患者を診ている。当直をするときは、どんな時間に電話をかけても乱れのない身だしなみで病棟へやって来る。","en":"An ordinary doctor would never examine another physician’s patient without permission. Tachikawa apparently did it for the simple reason that he believed he could make the more accurate diagnosis. There was no sign that he intended to spite the other doctors or advertise his own skill. He simply put the patient first, without fuss. By day, rather than seclude himself in the doctors’ office, he made the rounds of wards throughout the hospital and saw a great many patients. When he was on call, a telephone summons at any hour brought him to the ward impeccably dressed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r120","rowIndex":120,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　他の医者たちには相当嫌われているようだが、全く意に介することもない。彼自身も他の医者が嫌いなのかもしれない。いや医者だけではない。","en":"The other doctors appeared to dislike him intensely, but he paid it no attention whatsoever. Perhaps he disliked them in return. Or perhaps his aversion was not limited to doctors.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r121","rowIndex":121,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　職員に対しては、けして真正面から見ようとせず、会話をするときでもいつもそっぽを向いている。一説には視線を合わせるのを極度に嫌っているという話だ。そのくせ、患者に対してはいつだって真っ正面から見据えるのだから、職員より患者の方がよほど好きなのだろう。","en":"He never faced members of staff directly; even in conversation, he always turned aside. According to one theory, he had an extreme aversion to meeting another person’s eyes. Yet he always looked his patients squarely in the face, so perhaps he simply preferred them to the staff.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r122","rowIndex":122,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　この<tips=5>太刀川</tips>を、業務を終えてロッカールームへ向かうところだった<tips=83>美紗</tips>はB棟の前で見かけた。","en":"<tips=83>Misa</tips> encountered <tips=5>Tachikawa</tips> outside Ward B while she was on her way to the locker room at the end of her shift.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r123","rowIndex":123,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「お疲れ様です」","en":"“Good work today.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"能見美紗","displayName":"Misa Nomi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r124","rowIndex":124,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=83>美紗</tips>は頭を下げたが、例によって<tips=5>太刀川</tips>は視線をやるそぶりも見せず、こちらに向けた顔をチラとも動かさない。そして、挨拶を返すということもない。","en":"<tips=83>Misa</tips> bowed. As usual, <tips=5>Tachikawa</tips> gave no sign of looking her way. Although his face was already turned in her direction, he did not move it so much as an inch. Nor did he return her greeting.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r125","rowIndex":125,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　朝から病院にいた<tips=5>太刀川</tips>はもう勤務時間も終わって帰っても良さそうな時刻だが、まだ仕事をするつもりらしく、今<tips=83>美紗</tips>が出て来たB棟へ入ろうとしているようだった。","en":"<tips=5>Tachikawa</tips> had been at the hospital since morning, and it was late enough for his working day to have ended. Nevertheless, he apparently intended to continue. He seemed about to enter the Ward B building from which <tips=83>Misa</tips> had just emerged.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r126","rowIndex":126,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あの、<tips=82>Ｕ</tips>さんのことですが」","en":"“Um, about <tips=82>U</tips>...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"能見美紗","displayName":"Misa Nomi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r127","rowIndex":127,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　挨拶をしない<tips=5>太刀川</tips>だが、患者の名前を出すとぴたりと足を止める。が、<tips=83>美紗</tips>の方を見ようとはしない。","en":"<tips=5>Tachikawa</tips> offered no greetings, but at the name of a patient his feet stopped at once. He still made no attempt to look at <tips=83>Misa</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r128","rowIndex":128,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なんですか？」","en":"“What about her?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"太刀川良馬","displayName":"Ryoma Tachikawa","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r129","rowIndex":129,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そう問い返されると、呼び止めた<tips=83>美紗</tips>の方がどぎまぎしてしまう。風に吹かれて、側頭部から生えた<tips=5>太刀川</tips>の黒髪が揺れている。","en":"The question left <tips=83>Misa</tips>—the one who had stopped him—flustered instead. The wind stirred the black hair growing from the sides of <tips=5>Tachikawa’s</tips> head.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r130","rowIndex":130,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=83>美紗</tips>はこの奇妙だが勤勉な医者に興味があった。","en":"<tips=83>Misa</tips> was curious about this strange but dedicated doctor.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r131","rowIndex":131,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「廊下で放尿などがありましたが、その後は落ち着かれて静穏に過ごされています」","en":"“There was an episode of urination in the corridor, but she settled down afterward and has remained calm.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"能見美紗","displayName":"Misa Nomi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r132","rowIndex":132,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうですか」","en":"“I see.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"太刀川良馬","displayName":"Ryoma Tachikawa","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r133","rowIndex":133,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=5>太刀川</tips>は青白い顔に比べて紅すぎる唇を開いてそう答えた。","en":"<tips=5>Tachikawa</tips> answered, parting lips that looked unnaturally red against his pallid face.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r134","rowIndex":134,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あ、あの」","en":"“Um...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"能見美紗","displayName":"Misa Nomi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r135","rowIndex":135,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　立ち去ってしまおうとする<tips=5>太刀川</tips>を、もう一度呼び止めた。","en":"He began to leave, and Misa stopped <tips=5>Tachikawa</tips> a second time.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r136","rowIndex":136,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「私、<tips=82>Ｕ</tips>さんのプライマリーなんです。いつも注意深く<tips=82>Ｕ</tips>さんのことを観察しているつもりなのですが、なかなか驚かされることも多いんです。<tips=5>太刀川</tips>先生は、どうやって一目で患者様の状態を的確に判断なさっているのでしょうか？　何か観察するポイントなどがあるのでしょうか？」","en":"“I’m <tips=82>U’s</tips> primary nurse. I try to keep a close eye on <tips=82>U</tips> at all times, but she still surprises me often. Dr. <tips=5>Tachikawa</tips>, how are you able to assess a patient’s condition accurately at a glance? Is there something in particular you look for?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"能見美紗","displayName":"Misa Nomi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r137","rowIndex":137,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=5>太刀川</tips>の洞察力に日頃から不思議なものを感じていたため、勢いでそう言ってしまったものの、言ってしまってからまっすぐ向かい合ってこのような質問をすることの不躾さに<tips=83>美紗</tips>は気付き、恥ずかしげに目をそらす。","en":"She had long found <tips=5>Tachikawa’s</tips> powers of observation mysterious, and the words had escaped her in a rush. Only after speaking did <tips=83>Misa</tips> realize how impertinent it was to ask him such a question straight to his face, and she averted her eyes in embarrassment.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r138","rowIndex":138,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……あの、看護の参考にしたいんです」","en":"“...I mean, I thought it might help me with my nursing.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"能見美紗","displayName":"Misa Nomi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r139","rowIndex":139,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それはですね」","en":"“That is because...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"太刀川良馬","displayName":"Ryoma Tachikawa","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r140","rowIndex":140,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=5>太刀川</tips>は<tips=83>美紗</tips>のとってつけたような言い訳を意に介さない。","en":"<tips=5>Tachikawa</tips> paid no attention to <tips=83>Misa’s</tips> transparent afterthought.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r141","rowIndex":141,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「私だからわかるんです。あなたには同じことは出来ませんし、他のドクターにも不可能でしょう。あなたたちはあなたたちのやり方を見つけることです」","en":"“I know because I am who I am. You cannot do the same, nor can any other doctor. You must each find your own way.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"太刀川良馬","displayName":"Ryoma Tachikawa","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r142","rowIndex":142,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それは、先生が<tips=16>タイプA</tips>で、特別な能力があるからということですか？」","en":"“Do you mean because you’re <tips=16>Type A</tips> and possess a special ability?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"能見美紗","displayName":"Misa Nomi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r143","rowIndex":143,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=83>美紗</tips>は自分でも予期しなかった言葉に動揺してしまったが、<tips=5>太刀川</tips>は態度に変化を見せない。","en":"<tips=83>Misa</tips> was shaken by her own unexpected question. <tips=5>Tachikawa</tips>, however, showed no change in his manner.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r144","rowIndex":144,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「その通りです。私は<tips=16>タイプA</tips>です。しかし、その力については何も言えません。プライバシーに関することですのでね」","en":"“That is correct. I am <tips=16>Type A</tips>. But I cannot tell you anything about my ability. It is a matter of privacy.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"太刀川良馬","displayName":"Ryoma Tachikawa","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r145","rowIndex":145,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　看護師たちの長年の疑問に、あまりにもあっさりと回答をした<tips=5>太刀川</tips>に、<tips=83>美紗</tips>は驚きを隠せない。おそらく秘密というわけでもなく、今まで誰も直接尋ねなかったから知られていなかっただけで、もし誰かが聞いていたら同じように説明していたのだろう。","en":"<tips=83>Misa</tips> could not conceal her surprise at how readily <tips=5>Tachikawa</tips> had answered the nurses’ long-standing question. It was probably no secret. No one had known simply because no one had asked him directly before, and he would presumably have given the same explanation to anyone who had.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r146","rowIndex":146,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　単に、<tips=83>美紗</tips>が最初の一人だったのだ。","en":"<tips=83>Misa</tips> merely happened to be the first.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r147","rowIndex":147,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　が、<tips=83>美紗</tips>とすればさらに動揺を深めてしまう。","en":"For her part, however, <tips=83>Misa</tips> only grew more flustered.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r148","rowIndex":148,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あ、あの……」","en":"“Um...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"能見美紗","displayName":"Misa Nomi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r149","rowIndex":149,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　動揺のせいか、彼女は聞かなくて良いことまで聞いてしまった。","en":"In her agitation, she asked something she had no need to ask at all.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r150","rowIndex":150,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「先生は、どうして職員と目を合わせようとしないのですか？」","en":"“Why do you refuse to make eye contact with the staff?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"能見美紗","displayName":"Misa Nomi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r151","rowIndex":151,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　こんな不躾な質問に対しても、<tips=5>太刀川</tips>はよどみなく言葉を返す。","en":"Even to such an impertinent question, <tips=5>Tachikawa</tips> answered without hesitation.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r152","rowIndex":152,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「目を見れば、見たくないものまで見えてしまいますから」","en":"“Because if I look into their eyes, I see things I do not wish to see.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"太刀川良馬","displayName":"Ryoma Tachikawa","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r153","rowIndex":153,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そ、そうなんですか……」","en":"“I-I see...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"能見美紗","displayName":"Misa Nomi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r154","rowIndex":154,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　さすがに言い過ぎたと自覚した<tips=83>美紗</tips>は、後悔したように黙り込んでしまう。","en":"Aware now that she had gone too far, <tips=83>Misa</tips> lapsed into regretful silence.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r155","rowIndex":155,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その様子を見て、これ以上の質問はないと悟ったのか、<tips=5>太刀川</tips>は無言でその場を去って行った。","en":"Perhaps <tips=5>Tachikawa</tips> inferred from her silence that there would be no more questions. Without a word, he walked away.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r156","rowIndex":156,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「やっぱり、休日前の夜は最高ですね」","en":"“There’s nothing better than the night before a day off.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"水村","displayName":"Mizumura","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r157","rowIndex":157,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　一杯目をあっという間にあけ、二杯目に手を付けた<tips=92>水村ナース</tips>はけろりとした顔でそう言った。","en":"<tips=92>Nurse Mizumura</tips> had tossed back her first drink in no time and was already into her second when she said this, looking utterly unfazed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r158","rowIndex":158,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　大人しそうな見かけによらず大変な酒豪で、いくら飲んでも少し赤くなるくらいでほとんど行動が乱れない。","en":"Contrary to her demure appearance, she was a formidable drinker. However much alcohol she consumed, she did little more than redden slightly and almost never lost control of herself.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r159","rowIndex":159,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　年が近い<tips=83>美紗</tips>は彼女としょっちゅう飲みに出るが、最初は負けん気もあってその飲酒のペースについていこうとしていたが、今は完全に敗北を認めて彼女は彼女に任せ、自分はつき合わずにマイペースで飲んでいる。","en":"Being close to her in age, <tips=83>Misa</tips> often went drinking with her. At first, Misa’s competitive streak had made her try to match Mizumura drink for drink. By now she had admitted complete defeat and let Mizumura set her own pace while keeping to hers.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r160","rowIndex":160,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　二人は<tips=9>Y地区</tips>の一角にある飲食店に来ていた。","en":"The two had come to a restaurant in one corner of <tips=9>Y District</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r161","rowIndex":161,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=9>Y地区</tips>は世間ではとやかく言われるが、そこで働く利点の一つに、こうした仕事帰りなどに足を運ぶ飲食店に困らないという点がある。<tips=57>滑走路通り</tips>を含めた中心街は、そう広くない範囲に様々な国の料理店が密集して営業をしており、路上販売のワゴンなども含めれば、その日のどんな気分にも対応出来るだけのバラエティがある。","en":"Whatever people might say about <tips=9>Y District</tips>, one of the advantages of working there was never wanting for somewhere to eat or drink after a shift. The city center, including <tips=57>Runway Street</tips>, packed restaurants serving food from all over the world into a relatively small area. Add the street vendors’ carts, and there was enough variety for any mood on any given day.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r162","rowIndex":162,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　今日彼女たちが訪れたのは、英国式のバーで、平日の夜にもかかわらず若者たちで賑わっていた。","en":"That evening they had chosen a British-style pub, bustling with young people despite it being a weeknight.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r163","rowIndex":163,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　テーブルの上には、フィッシュアンドチップスと茹でたソーセージが乗せられ、二人はそれをつまみながらグラスのビールを飲んでいる。そして彼女たちが口にするのは、もっぱら職場の愚痴であった。","en":"Fish and chips and boiled sausages sat on the table. The two of them picked at the food over glasses of beer, talking about little but their complaints from work.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r164","rowIndex":164,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「私、今日またR野さんにしつこくつきまとわれちゃってえ」","en":"“R—no wouldn’t leave me alone again today.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"水村","displayName":"Mizumura","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r165","rowIndex":165,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=92>水村ナース</tips>は油のついた指先を拭いながら言う。","en":"<tips=92>Nurse Mizumura</tips> spoke as she wiped the grease from her fingertips.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r166","rowIndex":166,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　Ｒ野というのは、症状以前に人間性に問題を抱える患者で、その乱暴な言動でしばしば病棟の職員を困らせている人物であった。そして、<tips=92>水村ナース</tips>の担当患者でもある。","en":"R—no was a patient whose problems went beyond her symptoms to her very character. Her abusive language and violent behavior frequently caused trouble for the ward staff. She was also one of <tips=92>Nurse Mizumura’s</tips> assigned patients.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r167","rowIndex":167,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まーた、多訴的になってるんで、普段は適当に傾聴対応してるんですけど、今日は時間がなかったから、早めに打ち切っちゃったんですよ。そしたら『お前らアタシを無理矢理閉じ込めやがって！　この病院は最低の場所だ！』がはじまっちゃって」","en":"“She’s back to complaining about every little thing. Usually I just listen and make the right noises, but I didn’t have time today, so I cut her off early. Then she launched into the usual: ‘You people locked me up against my will! This hospital is the worst!’”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"水村","displayName":"Mizumura","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r168","rowIndex":168,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ああ、いつもの」","en":"“Oh, the usual.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"能見美紗","displayName":"Misa Nomi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r169","rowIndex":169,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=83>美紗</tips>が相づちをうつと、<tips=92>水村ナース</tips>が頷き、","en":"<tips=83>Misa</tips> made an understanding noise, and <tips=92>Nurse Mizumura</tips> nodded.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r170","rowIndex":170,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そう、いつものです。だからもう、私ムカっとしちゃって、言っちゃったんですよ。この病院よりあなたを大事に扱ってくれる場所はないって。あなたが退院出来るのなら、職員全員涙を流して大喜びするから、頑張って症状を克服してくださいねって」","en":"“Right, the usual. It pissed me off, so I told her, ‘Nowhere will treat you better than this hospital. If you ever do manage to get discharged, the entire staff will be so overjoyed they’ll cry, so please work hard to overcome your symptoms.’”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"水村","displayName":"Mizumura","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r171","rowIndex":171,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それは、ムカっとしたわりには結構抑えたね」","en":"“That’s pretty restrained for losing your temper.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"能見美紗","displayName":"Misa Nomi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r172","rowIndex":172,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうです！　全くその通りです！　出せるものなら出したいですよ！　でも、サマリーを書いて送っただけで門前払いでしょうね。あちこちの施設で追い出されてうちに来たんですから……。まったく、どうしようもないやつだ！　出来るものなら、門を開いてどうぞご自由にって言いたいですよ。……固いものを食べればすぐ詰まらせて、おむつも自分で取り替えられなくてすぐ汚して、ふらふらしててすぐ転ぶからヘッドガードも外せないのに、感謝どころか怒ってばっかり！　なんで外で暮らしていけると思ってるのかしら？　外に出たら三日ももたないで死んじゃうでしょうに」","en":"“Exactly! That’s exactly right! If we could discharge her, believe me, we would! But the moment another place saw her summary, they’d turn her away at the door. She only came to us after being thrown out of facility after facility... What a hopeless case! If I had my way, I’d open the gates and tell her, ‘Go on, you’re free to leave.’ ...She chokes as soon as she eats anything solid, she can’t even change her own diaper and is always soiling herself, and she’s so unsteady and falls so often that we can’t take off her protective helmet—and instead of being grateful, all she ever does is get angry! Why in the world does she think she could live outside? She’d be dead in three days.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"水村","displayName":"Mizumura","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r173","rowIndex":173,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=92>水村ナース</tips>はジョッキのビールを飲み干すと、ドンとテーブルの上に置く。","en":"<tips=92>Nurse Mizumura</tips> drained her beer and slammed the mug down on the table.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r174","rowIndex":174,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その顔には今風の化粧がなされている。仕事中はほとんどノーメイクだったのに、いつの間にほどこしたのだろう？　それに気がつくと<tips=83>美紗</tips>は、眉毛と目しか手を加えていない仕事時のままの自分の顔が恥ずかしくなった。","en":"She was wearing stylish makeup. She had been almost bare-faced at work; when had she found the time to put it on? The realization made <tips=83>Misa</tips> self-conscious about her own face, still just as it had been on shift, with nothing done beyond her eyebrows and eyes.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r175","rowIndex":175,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「でたらめなサマリー書いて遠くの病院に転院させちゃうとか、任意入院に切り換えて本人のお望み通り退院させるとか、出来ないんですか？　あの人の生活がよくなるように一生懸命やってるのに、なんであんなに馬鹿にされたり、ちょっと考えられないような理不尽な悪意を持たれたりしなくちゃいけないのか……。受容的態度って言うけれど、なんでもかんでも受容しなくちゃいけないんですか？　我々は？　私だって人間なんですよ？」","en":"“Couldn’t we falsify her summary and transfer her to some hospital far away? Or switch her to voluntary status and discharge her, just like she wants? We work so hard to make her life better. Why do I have to be insulted and subjected to malice so irrational I can hardly believe it...? They tell us to maintain an accepting attitude, but are we supposed to accept absolutely everything? Are we? I’m a human being too, you know.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"水村","displayName":"Mizumura","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r176","rowIndex":176,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「Ｒ野さんはあなたのことが好きで、構ってほしいからあれこれ言ってるだけよ」","en":"“R—no likes you. She says all those things because she wants your attention.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"能見美紗","displayName":"Misa Nomi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r177","rowIndex":177,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そういう愛着障害があるのはわかってるんですけど……」","en":"“I know she has that kind of attachment disorder, but...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"水村","displayName":"Mizumura","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r178","rowIndex":178,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=92>水村ナース</tips>は溜息をつく。","en":"<tips=92>Nurse Mizumura</tips> sighed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r179","rowIndex":179,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あの人に限らず、患者さんの言う通りに全部やってみたらどうかしらって思うんですよ。出たいって人は出してあげて、食事制限に怒ってる糖尿病の人には好きなだけ食べさせて……。あと、ここの患者さんはよく<tips=8>グレートホール</tips>に帰りたいっていう人が多いけど、一回穴までつれて行ってみたいと思ってるんです。本当にドンドン飛び込んじゃうのかしら？」","en":"“Not just her. Sometimes I think we should give all the patients exactly what they ask for. Let anyone who wants out go home; let the diabetic patients who hate their dietary restrictions eat as much as they like... And so many patients here say they want to return to the <tips=8>Great Hole</tips>. I’d like to take them to the Hole just once and see. Would they really start jumping in one after another?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"水村","displayName":"Mizumura","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r180","rowIndex":180,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「さあどうだろう。でも、みんな飛び込んじゃったら、私たちの仕事が楽になりすぎちゃうね」","en":"“Who knows? But if they all jumped in, our jobs would become much too easy.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r181","rowIndex":181,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　大分酒のまわりはじめた<tips=83>美紗</tips>が笑いながらそう答えると、","en":"Already fairly drunk, <tips=83>Misa</tips> answered with a laugh.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r182","rowIndex":182,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「患者さんがいなくなったら、楽になるどころか失業しちゃいますよ」","en":"“If the patients disappeared, our jobs wouldn’t get easier. We’d be unemployed.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"水村","displayName":"Mizumura","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r183","rowIndex":183,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=92>水村ナース</tips>は苦い顔で言う。","en":"<tips=92>Nurse Mizumura</tips> made a sour face.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r184","rowIndex":184,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「でも<tips=83>能見</tips>さん、いつまでここで働くつもりなんですか？」","en":"“But Ms. <tips=83>Nomi</tips>, how long are you planning to stay at the hospital?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"水村","displayName":"Mizumura","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r185","rowIndex":185,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　病院の職員が見ているわけでもないが、<tips=92>水村ナース</tips>は声をひそめて言う。","en":"Although no one from the hospital was watching, <tips=92>Nurse Mizumura</tips> lowered her voice.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r186","rowIndex":186,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「特にやめることは考えていないけど、水ちゃんはやめるつもりなの？」","en":"“I don’t have any plans to leave. Are you thinking of quitting, Mizu?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"能見美紗","displayName":"Misa Nomi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r187","rowIndex":187,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どうしよっかなあって思ってて。私、<tips=17>タイプB</tips>相手の仕事向いてないような気がするんです」","en":"“I’ve been wondering. I don’t think I’m cut out for working with <tips=17>Type Bs</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"水村","displayName":"Mizumura","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r188","rowIndex":188,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうかなあ？　そんなことないと思うけど。それに、ここより条件の良い職場なんかそうそうないわよ」","en":"“Really? I don’t think so. Besides, jobs with conditions this good are hard to come by.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"能見美紗","displayName":"Misa Nomi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r189","rowIndex":189,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そこ！　それが問題なんですよねえ」","en":"“That’s just it! That’s the problem.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"水村","displayName":"Mizumura","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r190","rowIndex":190,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=92>水村ナース</tips>は腕組みをすると、","en":"<tips=92>Nurse Mizumura</tips> folded her arms.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r191","rowIndex":191,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「でも、ここにいると、普通の医療処置をあんまりしないじゃないですか。いればいるほど、腕がなまって、看護師として潰しが効かなくなりそうな気がして……」","en":"“The thing is, we hardly do any ordinary medical procedures here. The longer I stay, the rustier I’ll get, until I won’t be any use as a nurse anywhere else...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"水村","displayName":"Mizumura","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r192","rowIndex":192,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それならC棟に行けば？　あそこなら一般科みたいな仕事も多いでしょ。給料も上がるし」","en":"“Then why not transfer to Building C? They do a lot more work like an ordinary medical ward there. The pay is better too.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"能見美紗","displayName":"Misa Nomi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r193","rowIndex":193,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いやです！　いやです！　あんなとこ。あそこの業務、メチャクチャ大変じゃないですか。朝とか挨拶すると、職員みんな死にそうな顔してますよ。それに、<tips=83>能見</tips>さんは入職のとき見学させて貰いました？　あそこの上の方の階って、保護室みたいな個室が一杯あるんですよ。その一つ一つに患者さんが拘束されてて、ずーっと喚いてガチャガチャやってるんです。拘束帯も、見たことがないようなぶっとい奴なんですよ」","en":"“No! No way! Not there. The work is insanely hard. When I say good morning, every member of staff looks like they’re about to die. Did they show you around when you first started, Ms. <tips=83>Nomi</tips>? The upper floors are full of private rooms like seclusion rooms, and every single one has a patient tied down inside, screaming and rattling their restraints all day long. Even the restraint straps are ridiculously thick—nothing like the ones we use.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"水村","displayName":"Mizumura","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r194","rowIndex":194,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=92>水村ナース</tips>は目を丸くして、人差し指と親指でその太さを示してみせる。","en":"<tips=92>Nurse Mizumura</tips> widened her eyes and used her thumb and forefinger to demonstrate their thickness.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r195","rowIndex":195,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そこに入院してるのは薬が全然効かないような患者さんばっかりなんですって。力もすごくて、普通のやつだと引きちぎっちゃうから、そんなに太くて、しかも中に金属が入ってるんだそうです。暴れたら、みんなで押さえつけたり棒で殴ったりするんですって……。あんなところではとても仕事なんか出来ません」","en":"“They say everyone admitted there is the kind of patient medication doesn’t work on at all. They’re incredibly strong, too, and they’d tear ordinary restraints apart, so the straps have to be that thick, with metal inside. I hear when one of them gets violent, the whole staff piles on to hold them down or beats them with poles... I could never work in a place like that.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"水村","displayName":"Mizumura","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r196","rowIndex":196,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女は溜息をつく。","en":"She sighed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r197","rowIndex":197,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それに知ってます？　C棟の最上階では、特に<tips=72>傾向値</tips>が高い患者さんを集めて、人体実験してるんだそうですよ？」","en":"“And did you know? They say the top floor of Building C is where they gather patients with especially high <tips=72>tendency values</tips> and perform human experiments on them.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"水村","displayName":"Mizumura","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r198","rowIndex":198,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それは、ただの噂でしょう……」","en":"“That’s just a rumor...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"能見美紗","displayName":"Misa Nomi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r199","rowIndex":199,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いやー、やっててもおかしくないですよ。だって、この病院は<tips=17>タイプB</tips>のなかでも選りすぐった重症者ばっかりいるんですから。どこの国だって<tips=17>タイプB</tips>の研究は盛んでしょ？　きっと法条先生がここにいるのも、そこで実験をして新しい論文を書くためなんだわ」","en":"“Oh, I wouldn’t be surprised if they were doing it. This hospital is full of the worst of the worst among <tips=17>Type Bs</tips>. Every country is pouring resources into <tips=17>Type B</tips> research, isn’t it? I bet Dr. Hojo is only here so he can experiment on them and write another paper.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"水村","displayName":"Mizumura","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r200","rowIndex":200,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それはさすがに人聞きが悪い……」","en":"“That makes him sound awful...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"能見美紗","displayName":"Misa Nomi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r201","rowIndex":201,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=83>美紗</tips>は苦笑する。","en":"<tips=83>Misa</tips> gave a wry smile.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r202","rowIndex":202,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「C棟と言えば、知ってます？　最近幽霊がよく出るんですって！　黒い服を着た、女の人の幽霊が！　どこの病院でも、こういう噂ってすぐ出来るんですね。まったく笑っちゃいます」","en":"“Speaking of Building C, did you hear? Apparently it’s been haunted lately! By the ghost of a woman dressed in black! I suppose every hospital gets rumors like this in no time. It’s laughable.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"水村","displayName":"Mizumura","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r203","rowIndex":203,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「よっぽどストレスがたまってるのねえ」","en":"“They must really be under a lot of stress.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"能見美紗","displayName":"Misa Nomi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r204","rowIndex":204,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうなんですよ。そもそも、私、<tips=17>タイプB</tips>の人ってあんまり好きになれません。ベテランの人はずっと一緒にいるせいか、患者さんのこと仕事じゃないみたいにすっごく大事にしてるけど……でもやっぱり異質ですよ。原因不明の病気だし、こわい気がします。<tips=83>能見</tips>さんはどうですか？」","en":"“Exactly. Honestly, I just can’t bring myself to like <tips=17>Type Bs</tips> very much. Maybe it’s because they’ve been around them so long, but the veterans care about the patients so much you’d think it wasn’t even a job to them... Still, there’s something alien about them. No one knows what causes the disease, and I can’t help finding them frightening. What about you, Ms. <tips=83>Nomi</tips>?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"水村","displayName":"Mizumura","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r205","rowIndex":205,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「わ、私は……ほらみんな、子供みたいで素直じゃない。病棟に行くと、<tips=83>能見</tips>さん<tips=83>能見</tips>さーんって、笑顔で寄って来るし……」","en":"“I-I... Well, aren’t they all so open and guileless, almost like children? Whenever I go onto the ward, they come over smiling and call, ‘Ms. <tips=83>Nomi</tips>! Ms. <tips=83>Nomi</tips>!’”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"能見美紗","displayName":"Misa Nomi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r206","rowIndex":206,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あー、<tips=83>能見</tips>さんも主任コースだ。きっと、患者さんに肩入れしすぎて一生この病院から出られなくなるんだわ」","en":"“Oh, you’re on track to become a chief too, Ms. <tips=83>Nomi</tips>. You’re going to get far too attached to the patients and end up trapped in this hospital for the rest of your life.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"水村","displayName":"Mizumura","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r207","rowIndex":207,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=92>水村ナース</tips>は、さっきより深いため息をつく。","en":"<tips=92>Nurse Mizumura</tips> sighed more deeply than before.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r208","rowIndex":208,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「入る前に、私友だちに言われたんですよ。こういう病棟の患者さんは何十年も入院することになるから、必要以上に情がわいたら職員も病院から出られなくなるって。<tips=83>能見</tips>さん、危ないですよ？」","en":"“Before I started here, a friend warned me that patients on wards like this end up staying for decades, so if you get more attached than you should, the staff can end up unable to leave the hospital too. You’d better watch out, Ms. <tips=83>Nomi</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"水村","displayName":"Mizumura","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r209","rowIndex":209,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あははは、わ、私はそんなことないよ？　きっと……」","en":"“Ahahaha. Th-that won’t happen to me. I’m sure...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"能見美紗","displayName":"Misa Nomi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r210","rowIndex":210,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どうかしらねえ」","en":"“We’ll see about that.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"水村","displayName":"Mizumura","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r211","rowIndex":211,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=92>水村ナース</tips>はくっくっと意地悪く笑う。こう見えても、多少は酔いがまわっているのだろう。","en":"<tips=92>Nurse Mizumura</tips> gave a low, mischievous chuckle. Perhaps the alcohol was getting to her after all, appearances notwithstanding.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r212","rowIndex":212,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「でも、確かに辞めたくなる気持ちもわかるよ。普通の病院と違って、ここは元気になって退院してゆく人がいないし、なんだかやるせない感じもするもの。でも、発症してしまった人って、もうどうやっても回復することはないのかしら？」","en":"“Still, I do understand why you’d want to leave. This isn’t like an ordinary hospital. No one here gets better and goes home, and it can leave you feeling so helpless. But once someone develops symptoms, is there really no way for them ever to recover?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"能見美紗","displayName":"Misa Nomi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r213","rowIndex":213,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=83>能見</tips>さん、知らないんですか？」","en":"“You don’t know, Ms. <tips=83>Nomi</tips>?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"水村","displayName":"Mizumura","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r214","rowIndex":214,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「何を？」","en":"“Know what?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"能見美紗","displayName":"Misa Nomi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r215","rowIndex":215,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「一時的になら、回復させる方法はあるんですよ」","en":"“There is a way to bring them back—temporarily.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"水村","displayName":"Mizumura","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r216","rowIndex":216,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ああ、もしかして、『<tips=45>ローズ</tips>』のこと？」","en":"“Oh, do you mean <tips=45>Rose</tips>?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"能見美紗","displayName":"Misa Nomi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r217","rowIndex":217,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そう、それです」","en":"“Exactly.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"水村","displayName":"Mizumura","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r218","rowIndex":218,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それなら、学校で習ったことあるけど、実際どれくらい回復するのかしら？　たとえばうちの<tips=82>ヒロミ</tips>ちゃんみたいな子でも、発症する前の状態に戻るの？」","en":"“We learned about that in school. But how much do they actually recover? Would even someone like our <tips=82>Hiromi</tips> go back to the way she was before her symptoms appeared?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"能見美紗","displayName":"Misa Nomi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r219","rowIndex":219,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうなるって話です。低下していた知能も元通りになるって話です。私も実際に見たことはないですけど」","en":"“That’s what they say. Supposedly even their diminished intelligence returns to normal. I’ve never actually seen it myself, though.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"水村","displayName":"Mizumura","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r220","rowIndex":220,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「とても信じられない。ある程度回復はしたとしても、そんなことが起こりうるなんて……」","en":"“I just can’t believe it. I could understand some degree of recovery, but for something like that to be possible...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"能見美紗","displayName":"Misa Nomi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r221","rowIndex":221,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=83>美紗</tips>は首を横に振った。","en":"<tips=83>Misa</tips> shook her head.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r222","rowIndex":222,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"『<tips=45>ローズ</tips>』というのは、麻薬の名前である。強烈な快楽体験をもたらすその薬は、正体不明の誰かによって家庭用製薬機向けのレシピがネットに公開されることで、犯罪組織などが手軽に量産出来るようになり、世界中で大流行した。","en":"<tips=45>Rose</tips> was a narcotic, one that produced experiences of intense pleasure. Once some unknown person published a recipe for home pharmaceutical synthesizers online, criminal organizations and others could mass-produce it with ease, and the drug swept across the world.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r223","rowIndex":223,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　これを<tips=17>タイプB</tips>に一定量以上投与すると、廃人同様になったような者でも発症前の人間性を取り戻すという話だ。","en":"It was said that when a <tips=17>Type B</tips> received a sufficient dose, even someone reduced to little more than a shell would regain their pre-onset personality.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r224","rowIndex":224,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=17>タイプB</tips>の発症によって苦しむものたちにとっては夢のような話だが、そんなに簡単なものでもない。","en":"For those suffering after the onset of <tips=17>Type B</tips> symptoms, the promise sounded miraculous. The reality, however, was not so simple.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r225","rowIndex":225,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"『<tips=45>ローズ</tips>』は非常に強力な依存性を持っている。耐性もつきやすく、濫用すればすぐに使用量が増大して中毒死してしまう。死なずとも廃人になる。","en":"<tips=45>Rose</tips> was powerfully addictive. Tolerance developed quickly, and with abuse the doses soon mounted until the user died of an overdose. Even those it did not kill were left human wrecks.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r226","rowIndex":226,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　他の麻薬と比べても極めてデメリットが大きすぎるのだ。","en":"The risks were simply too great, even by the standards of other narcotics.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r227","rowIndex":227,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その危険性が世間に知れ渡った現在では、完全に自制心を失った麻薬中毒者でもなければこの薬を買い求めようとはしないほどなのである。","en":"Now that its dangers were widely known, only a drug addict who had completely lost all self-control would even try to buy it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r228","rowIndex":228,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　いくら快楽が強烈で、入手が容易でも、人をあまりにも簡単に廃人に変えてしまうようでは誰にも受け入れらない。","en":"No matter how intense its pleasures or how easy it was to obtain, no one would accept a drug that could reduce a person to a wreck so readily.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r229","rowIndex":229,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　家庭で簡単に作れることから、犯罪組織も商材として売り出すこともないし、現在ではたまに怖い物知らずのティーンエイジャーが製造、濫用して問題になるくらいで、世の中にはほとんど出回っていない。","en":"Because it was so easy to make at home, even criminal organizations had no reason to market it. Nowadays the only trouble came from the occasional fearless teenager making and abusing it; otherwise, it had all but vanished from circulation.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r230","rowIndex":230,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　医療現場でこの薬が使われることもない。モルヒネのような麻薬として有名な薬でさえ、医療機関で厳重に管理された上で限定的に使用されるものだが、<tips=45>ローズ</tips>を認可している国はおそらく存在しないだろう。","en":"The drug saw no medical use, either. Even medicines widely known to be narcotics, such as morphine, were used on a limited basis under strict controls in medical institutions. <tips=45>Rose</tips>, however, was probably not approved in a single country.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r231","rowIndex":231,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　このような曰く付きのドラッグを、大量に投与しなくては<tips=17>タイプB</tips>は回復しない。これが何を意味するのかと言うと、たとえ薬効によって一時的に正気を取り戻したとしても、そのすぐ先に重い薬物依存が待っているということだ。","en":"And this was the dubious drug a <tips=17>Type B</tips> had to receive in massive doses before they would recover. In other words, even if its effects temporarily restored a patient’s sanity, severe drug dependence waited just beyond it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r232","rowIndex":232,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　このような薬を、軽々しく使うことは出来ない。","en":"A drug like this could not be administered lightly.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r233","rowIndex":233,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　公的な機関で患者に投与したというデータも存在しない。だから、『<tips=45>ローズ</tips>』が<tips=17>タイプB</tips>に効くというのは、街の噂を前提とした、ほとんど都市伝説のようなものだ。","en":"No data existed from any public institution administering it to patients. Thus, the claim that “<tips=45>Rose</tips>” worked on <tips=17>Type Bs</tips> was based on street rumors and amounted to little more than an urban legend.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r234","rowIndex":234,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　街の麻薬中毒者を調べてこの現象を調査した医療関係者の報告でも、報告する者によって結論が異なっている。","en":"Even among reports by medical professionals who investigated the phenomenon in the city’s drug addicts, the conclusions differed from one author to the next.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r235","rowIndex":235,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　こうした事情を踏まえた上で、<tips=83>美紗</tips>は、『<tips=45>ローズ</tips>』を投与することである程度回復はしたとしても、完全に発症前の状態を取り戻すというようなことはないだろうと考えていた。<tips=17>タイプB</tips>について医者が書いた本を何冊か読んだが、そこでも、発作を繰り返すごとに<tips=17>タイプB</tips>の脳は器質的に不可逆的な変化が起きているという考えが主流だったはずだ。つまり、発作を繰り返すごとに少しずつ壊れてゆくというのである。","en":"Knowing all this, <tips=83>Misa</tips> believed that <tips=45>Rose</tips> might produce some recovery, but could never restore a patient completely to their pre-onset state. She had read several books on <tips=17>Type Bs</tips> written by doctors, and as she recalled, the prevailing view was that every episode produced organic, irreversible changes in the brain of a <tips=17>Type B</tips> patient. In other words, the brain broke down a little further each time.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r236","rowIndex":236,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それが、投薬で回復することがあり得るのだろうか？","en":"Could medication truly restore what had been destroyed?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r237","rowIndex":237,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「でも、本当にそんなことが起こりうるなら、一回くらい患者さんみんながまともになったところを見てみたいですよね。私たちはおかしくなった彼らしか知らないじゃないですか？　だから、正常な頃があったということがうまく想像出来ない」","en":"“But if it really can happen, I’d like to see all our patients back to normal just once, wouldn’t you? We’ve only ever known them after they went strange. It’s hard to imagine there was ever a time when they were normal.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"水村","displayName":"Mizumura","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r238","rowIndex":238,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=92>水村ナース</tips>は溜息をつき、","en":"<tips=92>Nurse Mizumura</tips> sighed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r239","rowIndex":239,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それは確かに。私も患者さんのご家族と会った時とか考えるわ。患者さんのご家族はみんな少なからず正常な頃の思い出を持ってるから、どうしてもおかしいところしか知らない私たちとでは、患者さんの見え方も違うんだろうなって」","en":"“That’s true. I think about that whenever I meet a patient’s family. Every family has at least some memories of what the patient was like when they were normal, so they must see them differently from us, who have only ever known them after they became ill.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"能見美紗","displayName":"Misa Nomi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r240","rowIndex":240,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=83>美紗</tips>もまた溜息をつく。","en":"<tips=83>Misa</tips> sighed as well.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r241","rowIndex":241,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「もし私だったら、<tips=45>ローズ</tips>を打って欲しいですね。耐性がついても、致死量をこえるまで打ち続けます。どんどん人間性を失いながら長く生きるよりは、たとえ薬物中毒ですぐに死ぬことになっても、正気のままでいたいです。<tips=83>能見</tips>さんもそう思いますよね？」","en":"“If it were me, I’d want them to give me <tips=45>Rose</tips>. Even after I built up a tolerance, I’d keep taking it until the dose became lethal. I’d rather stay sane, even if the addiction killed me soon afterward, than live a long life while losing more and more of who I am. You feel the same, don’t you, Ms. <tips=83>Nomi</tips>?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"水村","displayName":"Mizumura","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r242","rowIndex":242,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「私は、なんとも言えないなあ。患者さんみてると、みんなニコニコしてて、それほど不幸そうにも見えないし……」","en":"“I don’t know. When I look at the patients, they’re all smiling. They don’t seem all that unhappy...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"能見美紗","displayName":"Misa Nomi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r243","rowIndex":243,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それは、ただの空笑で笑ってたり、認知能力が低下して悲劇が理解出来なくなったりしてるだけですよ」","en":"“That’s either hollow laughter, or their cognitive faculties have declined so far that they can no longer grasp the tragedy of their situation.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"水村","displayName":"Mizumura","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r244","rowIndex":244,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうかなあ」","en":"“Do you think so?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"能見美紗","displayName":"Misa Nomi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r245","rowIndex":245,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=83>美紗</tips>は首をひねる。彼女にはどうも、そうは思えないのだ。","en":"<tips=83>Misa</tips> tilted her head. Somehow, she could not agree.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r246","rowIndex":246,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　発症したばかりで症状が安定しない急性期の<tips=17>タイプB</tips>はみな苦しみそのものといった顔つきをしているが、発作を繰り返し慢性化し、ある程度まで人格が崩壊すると、幻覚や幻聴の氾濫した世界に生きながらも、ある種幸福な境地に達しているように感じる。","en":"In the acute phase, when their symptoms had only just appeared and remained unstable, <tips=17>Type Bs</tips> all wore faces that seemed the very image of suffering. Yet once repeated episodes had made the illness chronic and broken down the personality beyond a certain point, Misa felt that they attained a kind of happiness, even while living in a world overrun by visual and auditory hallucinations.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r247","rowIndex":247,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しかしそれを口にしたら、<tips=92>水村ナース</tips>にからかわれそうなので、口には出さなかった。","en":"She did not say so aloud. <tips=92>Nurse Mizumura</tips> would only tease her.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r248","rowIndex":248,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あー、もう、次の出勤したくないなあ。私、またリーダーなんですよねえ。指示受けしたくないなあ……」","en":"“Ugh, I don’t want to go in for my next shift. I’m team leader again. I don’t want to be the one taking all the doctors’ orders...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"水村","displayName":"Mizumura","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r249","rowIndex":249,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女は考え込む<tips=83>美紗</tips>をよそに、ブツブツと愚痴を続けている。","en":"Oblivious to <tips=83>Misa’s</tips> thoughts, she continued muttering complaints.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r250","rowIndex":250,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そう遅くならないうちに二人は店を出た。<tips=92>水村ナース</tips>は<tips=9>Y地区</tips>外の実家から通っている。駅前で彼女と別れ、しかしまだ遊び足りなかった<tips=83>美紗</tips>は、またなんとなく<tips=57>滑走路通り</tips>に戻ってしまう。","en":"The two left the pub before it grew too late. <tips=92>Nurse Mizumura</tips> commuted from her family home outside <tips=9>Y District</tips>, so <tips=83>Misa</tips> said goodbye to her at the station. Still not ready for the night to end, Misa somehow found herself wandering back to <tips=57>Runway Street</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r251","rowIndex":251,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ネオンの氾濫する街で服やアクセサリーを物色し、その間に少し酔いが醒め、そしてもう少し飲み直そうと考えた。そこで、普段とは少し違う場所の店を選んでみようと、一人歩きなのに思ってしまったあたり、酔いが正常な判断力を奪っていたのだと思われる。","en":"She browsed clothes and accessories amid the flood of neon, sobering up a little as she did, then decided to start drinking again. The fact that, despite being alone, she thought she might try somewhere a little outside her usual territory suggests that the alcohol had robbed her of her better judgment after all.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r252","rowIndex":252,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　裏通りに足を踏み入れて、二つばかり角を曲がると、もうそこは<tips=57>滑走路通り</tips>とは別の世界だった。","en":"She entered a back street and turned only two corners before finding herself in a world entirely different from <tips=57>Runway Street</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r253","rowIndex":253,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　街灯もまばらな真っ暗で細い道。通りに出された立て看板は、どれも店名が書いてあるだけでどんな店なのかの説明など一切なく、ドアには窓一つなく中の様子をうかがえない。完全に、『知っている』客だけを相手にした店ばかりが並んでいる。","en":"It was a narrow road sunk in near-total darkness, with streetlights few and far between. Every sidewalk sign bore a shop’s name and nothing else, never a word about what kind of place it was; the doors did not have so much as a window through which to glimpse the interior. Every establishment there catered exclusively to customers already in the know.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r254","rowIndex":254,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして、所在なげに路上に立つ露出の多い服を着た女は、娼婦であろう。子供のように若い女も、シワの目立つ年頃の女も、白い肌も、黒い肌もいる。さらにもっと進むと、建物はまるきり普通のアパートだが、門のあたりに椅子を置いて老女が座っている、そんな光景がどこまでも続く路地に出る。","en":"The women loitering along the street in revealing clothes were probably prostitutes. Some looked as young as children; others were old enough for their wrinkles to show. There were pale-skinned women and dark-skinned women alike. Farther on, Misa came to an alley where the same sight repeated itself without end: perfectly ordinary-looking apartment buildings, each with an old woman seated on a chair by the gate.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r255","rowIndex":255,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=83>美紗</tips>は知らなかったが、これもやはり売春のための施設で、客は老女に話して交渉し、アパートの一室で待機している女とことをなすのだ。","en":"<tips=83>Misa</tips> did not know it, but these too were brothels. A customer would negotiate with the old woman, then have sex with a woman waiting in one of the apartments.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r256","rowIndex":256,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ここはちょっと違う。","en":"This was a little too different.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r257","rowIndex":257,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　さすがに<tips=83>美紗</tips>も気がついて、引き返そうとしたところで声をかけられた。","en":"At last even <tips=83>Misa</tips> realized she had wandered somewhere she should not be. Just as she was about to turn back, someone called out to her.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r258","rowIndex":258,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あ、あの、お姉さん」","en":"“E-excuse me, miss.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r259","rowIndex":259,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　振り返ると、髪の毛を金髪に染めたアジア系の少年が立っていた。街灯の下で笑顔を浮かべている。","en":"She turned to find an Asian boy with dyed blond hair standing beneath a streetlight, smiling.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r260","rowIndex":260,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「さっきから見てたんですけど、このあたりをうろうろとして、何かお探しですか？」","en":"“I’ve noticed you wandering around here for a while. Are you looking for something?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r261","rowIndex":261,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いえ、別に……」","en":"“No, nothing...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r262","rowIndex":262,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　警戒しながら返事をしたその前で、少年の目から何かぽろりと落ちた。","en":"As Misa answered warily, something dropped from the boy’s eye.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r263","rowIndex":263,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　どうやら落ちたものはカラーコンタクトレンズのようだ。そのコンタクトが落ちた方の瞳の色が、先ほどとは変わっている。真っ黒に見えていた瞳が、暗くてわかりにくかったが、何か明るい色になった。","en":"It seemed to be a colored contact lens. The eye it had fallen from was a different color than before. It was too dark to tell clearly, but the iris that had looked black a moment ago was in fact some bright color.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r264","rowIndex":264,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"（……この人、患者さんだ）","en":"(...He’s a patient.)","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r265","rowIndex":265,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　街で暮らす<tips=17>タイプB</tips>は、<tips=95>金眼</tips>によってそうと知られないようにカラーコンタクトを装着して生活をするのが一般的だ。","en":"It was common for <tips=17>Type Bs</tips> living in the city to wear colored contacts so that their <tips=95>golden eyes</tips> would not give them away as Type B.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r266","rowIndex":266,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして、相手の少年のもつ雰囲気は、明らかに病棟で毎日接している患者たちが<tips=95>金眼</tips>状態になったときのものと同じだった。どこかふわふわしたような、浮き世離れした感じ。","en":"There was also something unmistakably familiar about the air surrounding the boy. It was the same air the patients on her ward took on every day when they entered the <tips=95>golden-eyed</tips> state: a vague, floating quality, detached from the ordinary world.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r267","rowIndex":267,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「何かお困りだったら、お手伝いしますよ？　おれはそうしないといけないんです。誰かのお手伝いをするために、今日はずっとここを歩いていたんです」","en":"“If you’re having trouble, I’ll help you. I have to. I’ve been walking around here all day so I could help someone.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r268","rowIndex":268,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　先ほど<tips=92>水村ナース</tips>に患者は可愛いと言ったが、病院の外で会う<tips=17>タイプB</tips>は思いの外に恐ろしかった。","en":"Misa had just told <tips=92>Nurse Mizumura</tips> that she found the patients endearing, but encountering a <tips=17>Type B</tips> outside the hospital was far more frightening than she had expected.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r269","rowIndex":269,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=83>美紗</tips>は、<tips=17>タイプB</tips>の患者が思いも寄らぬ突発的な行動を起こすことを知っている。病院の患者たちは薬でコントロールされている上に、危険物を所有出来ないようになっている。さらに周りには頼りになる専門的なスタッフがいたのだ。","en":"<tips=83>Misa</tips> knew that <tips=17>Type B</tips> patients could behave in sudden, utterly unpredictable ways. In the hospital, medication kept the patients under control, and they were prevented from possessing anything dangerous. Reliable, trained staff were always close at hand as well.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r270","rowIndex":270,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しかし路上ではすべてが違う。","en":"But on the street, everything was different.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r271","rowIndex":271,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　目の前の人間がどんな症状を持ち、どんな道具を隠しているかわからない。","en":"She had no idea what symptoms the person before her might have or what he might be hiding on him.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r272","rowIndex":272,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それを思うと身が凍り付くような恐怖であった。","en":"The thought froze her with terror.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r273","rowIndex":273,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"（世間の人たちは、みんなこんな風に感じているってことなのかな……）","en":"(Is this how everyone else feels...?)","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r274","rowIndex":274,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　病院にいると、<tips=17>タイプB</tips>への風当たりの強さはほとんど偏見によるものだと考えたくなる。実際根拠のない偏見も多いが、しかしこうして体験してみると、そう考えるのも仕方がないのだと実感する。","en":"Within the hospital, it was tempting to regard the hostility toward <tips=17>Type Bs</tips> as almost entirely prejudice. Much of that prejudice truly had no foundation. But now that Misa experienced this fear herself, she understood why others might feel it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r275","rowIndex":275,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　後ずさりする<tips=83>美紗</tips>の肩を少年が掴むと、","en":"As <tips=83>Misa</tips> backed away, the boy grabbed her shoulder.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r276","rowIndex":276,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「きゃあっ！」","en":"“Aah!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r277","rowIndex":277,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　自分でも信じられないくらい大きな声が出た。","en":"The cry that escaped her was louder than she could believe.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r278","rowIndex":278,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　相手が怪訝な顔をしたのを見た<tips=83>美紗</tips>は、大きな声を出して無用の刺激をしてしまったのではないかとおそれ、表情をひきつらせる。","en":"The boy looked puzzled. Afraid that her shout had needlessly provoked him, <tips=83>Misa’s</tips> expression stiffened.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r279","rowIndex":279,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そこに、もう一人別の人物が現れた。","en":"Then another person appeared.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r280","rowIndex":280,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「何をしているんですか」","en":"“What are you doing?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"太刀川良馬","displayName":"Ryoma Tachikawa","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r281","rowIndex":281,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　背後から聞こえたその落ち着いた声には聞き覚えがある。そして振り返ると、やはり思った通りの、そして他の誰かと見間違いようのない人物が立っていた。","en":"Misa recognized the calm voice behind her. When she turned, there stood exactly the person she expected—someone impossible to mistake for anybody else.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r282","rowIndex":282,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=5>太刀川</tips>先生……」","en":"“Dr. <tips=5>Tachikawa</tips>...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r283","rowIndex":283,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そう、そこに杖をついて立つ長身の人物は、医師の<tips=5>太刀川</tips>であった。","en":"The tall figure standing there with a cane was indeed Dr. <tips=5>Tachikawa</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r284","rowIndex":284,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　白衣のかわりに真っ黒なジャケットと真っ黒な帽子をかぶっている。そして目には、こんな暗い夜だというのにやはり黒いサングラスをかけている。","en":"Instead of his white coat, he wore a black jacket and matching black hat. And even on a night this dark, his eyes were hidden, as always, behind black sunglasses.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r285","rowIndex":285,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"（不便だろうに、一体、どんな<tips=77>特質変異</tips>なのかしら……）","en":"(They must be terribly inconvenient. What kind of <tips=77>trait mutation</tips> could he possibly have...?)","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r286","rowIndex":286,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=83>美紗</tips>はふとそんなことを思った。","en":"The thought occurred idly to <tips=83>Misa</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r287","rowIndex":287,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「これは、フジワラ君じゃないですか。あまり調子がよくないみたいですね」","en":"“Well, if it isn’t Fujiwara. You don’t look too well.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"太刀川良馬","displayName":"Ryoma Tachikawa","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r288","rowIndex":288,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=5>太刀川</tips>は<tips=83>美紗</tips>の方をチラとも見ずに、相手の<tips=17>タイプB</tips>少年の顔だけを見ながらそう言った。けして職員の顔は見ないのに、患者の顔はこんなにすんなりと見つめるのか。","en":"<tips=5>Tachikawa</tips> spoke without so much as glancing at <tips=83>Misa</tips>, his eyes fixed only on the face of the <tips=17>Type B</tips> boy. He never looked a member of staff in the face, yet he could meet a patient’s gaze without the slightest hesitation?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r289","rowIndex":289,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あ、先生！　こんばんは。今夜は本当に月が綺麗ですね！」","en":"“Oh, doctor! Good evening. The moon is really beautiful tonight!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r290","rowIndex":290,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　少年はだらしのない笑顔を浮かべる。","en":"The boy wore a slack smile.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r291","rowIndex":291,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=83>美紗</tips>はつい空を見上げたが、どんよりと曇った漆黒の空があるだけだった。","en":"<tips=83>Misa</tips> involuntarily looked up. There was only a black sky, heavy with cloud.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r292","rowIndex":292,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ちょっと、腕を出してください」","en":"“Hold out your arm, please.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"太刀川良馬","displayName":"Ryoma Tachikawa","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r293","rowIndex":293,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　言うと、少年は素直に右腕を差し出す。","en":"At the instruction, the boy obediently held out his right arm.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r294","rowIndex":294,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=5>太刀川</tips>は手にした大きな黒い革の鞄をごそごそとあさって、中から注射器を取り出すと、その針を、熟練の手技で少年の静脈に突き刺した。","en":"<tips=5>Tachikawa</tips> rummaged through the large black leather bag in his hand and removed a syringe. With practiced technique, he inserted the needle into the boy’s vein.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r295","rowIndex":295,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「もう家に帰りなさい。こういうときは外に出たりしたらいけないと言ったでしょう？」","en":"“Go home now. I told you not to go outside when you’re like this, didn’t I?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"太刀川良馬","displayName":"Ryoma Tachikawa","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r296","rowIndex":296,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「はい。すみませんでした」","en":"“Yes. I’m sorry.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r297","rowIndex":297,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　少年は本当に驚くほど<tips=5>太刀川</tips>に対して素直で、ぺこりと頭を下げるとその場を辞した。","en":"The boy’s obedience to <tips=5>Tachikawa</tips> was almost astonishing. He bowed and left at once.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r298","rowIndex":298,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"（一体どういうことなんだろう？）","en":"(What in the world just happened?)","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r299","rowIndex":299,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=83>美紗</tips>が驚いて医師の顔を見つめると、","en":"<tips=83>Misa</tips> stared at the doctor in amazement.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r300","rowIndex":300,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「彼は私の患者なんです」","en":"“He is one of my patients.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"太刀川良馬","displayName":"Ryoma Tachikawa","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r301","rowIndex":301,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　何も問うてはいないのに、その漆黒の衣で身を固めた名医はそっぽを向いたまま返答をする。","en":"Though Misa had asked nothing, the eminent doctor dressed head to toe in black answered her unspoken question without turning to face her.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r302","rowIndex":302,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「暇な時は、このあたりをブラブラしてね、診察なんかをしているんですよ」","en":"“In my spare time, I wander around this neighborhood and see patients.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"太刀川良馬","displayName":"Ryoma Tachikawa","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r303","rowIndex":303,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"（暇な時なんか、とてもあるとは思えないけど……）","en":"(I can’t imagine that he ever has spare time...)","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r304","rowIndex":304,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=5>太刀川</tips>は誰よりも早く病院に来て、誰よりも多くの患者を診て、誰よりも遅く帰る。暇な時間などあるようには思えない。それとも、独身だと時間を持てあますのだろうか？　そうだとしても、夜の街をうろうろして<tips=17>タイプB</tips>を探し求めて診察するなど、酔狂と呼ぶにも程がある。正気の沙汰とは思えない。","en":"<tips=5>Tachikawa</tips> arrived at the hospital before anyone else, saw more patients than anyone else, and left later than anyone else. How could he possibly have spare time? Could being single really leave him with that many hours on his hands? Even so, prowling the city at night in search of <tips=17>Type Bs</tips> to examine went beyond eccentricity. It was madness.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r305","rowIndex":305,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"（一体どれだけ仕事が、そして患者さんが好きなのかしら。病棟の先輩ナースたちも相当だと思っていたけれど、この人はそれ以上だわ）","en":"(Just how much does he love his work—and his patients? I thought the senior nurses on my ward were devoted, but he goes far beyond any of them.)","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r306","rowIndex":306,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=83>美紗</tips>はほとんど目の前がクラクラとするような思いだった。","en":"<tips=83>Misa</tips> almost felt dizzy.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r307","rowIndex":307,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=83>能見</tips>さん」","en":"“Ms. <tips=83>Nomi</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"太刀川良馬","displayName":"Ryoma Tachikawa","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r308","rowIndex":308,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「は、はい！」","en":"“Y-yes?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"能見美紗","displayName":"Misa Nomi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r309","rowIndex":309,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「これから一つ診察する場所があるのですが、見学しませんか？」","en":"“There is one more place where I need to see a patient. Would you care to observe?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"太刀川良馬","displayName":"Ryoma Tachikawa","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r310","rowIndex":310,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「は、はい！」","en":"“Y-yes!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r311","rowIndex":311,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"（病院のなかの感覚でつい返事しちゃったけど、コレで良かったのかしら？）","en":"(I answered automatically, as if we were in the hospital. Was that really the right thing to say?)","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r312","rowIndex":312,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　後ろも見ずに行く<tips=5>太刀川</tips>の後ろを歩きながら、<tips=83>美紗</tips>は未だに動揺を鎮めることが出来ないでいた。","en":"<tips=5>Tachikawa</tips> walked ahead without looking back. Following him, <tips=83>Misa</tips> still could not calm herself.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r313","rowIndex":313,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"（考えてみれば、助けて貰って「ありがとう」の言葉さえまだ言っていないんだよね。……でも、驚くに決まってるよ。急に名前なんか呼ばれちゃったし、こんな風に誘ってくるし……。病院ではそんな態度見たことがないもの）","en":"(Come to think of it, I still haven’t even thanked him for helping me. ...But of course I’m surprised. He called me by name out of nowhere, and now he’s invited me along like this... I’ve never seen him act this way at the hospital.)","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r314","rowIndex":314,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　病院ではどの職員に対しても冷淡と言えるほどにそっけなく、名前で誰かを呼んでいるのを聞いたこともない。","en":"At the hospital he was so brusque with every member of staff that he could almost be called cold. Misa had never once heard him address anyone by name.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r315","rowIndex":315,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"（私、もしかしてこの人に気にいられている？）","en":"(Could it be that he’s taken a liking to me?)","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r316","rowIndex":316,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そう考えると、ますます<tips=83>美紗</tips>の胸には動揺が広がった。","en":"The thought only deepened <tips=83>Misa’s</tips> agitation.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r317","rowIndex":317,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　この不思議な医者が、自分に好感を持っているとしたらどうだろう？　それも、スタッフとしてではなく、異性としてだとしたら？","en":"What if this mysterious doctor really did have feelings for her? And not merely as a member of staff—what if he was interested in her as a woman?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r318","rowIndex":318,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"（ああ、どうしたらいいんだろう！　確かに先生は変な人だし、年も離れているけれど……。でも、独身だし、医者なんだよね）","en":"(Oh, what would I do? He is certainly strange, and quite a bit older than I am... But he is single. And he is a doctor.)","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r319","rowIndex":319,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　収入に関して全く問題がない。医者という肩書きは、田舎の両親を喜ばせるだろう。","en":"There would certainly be no worries about money. And the title of doctor would delight her parents back in the country.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r320","rowIndex":320,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"（見た目はちょっと好みではないけど、だれもが認める名医だし、それに、仕事熱心なところとか、患者さんに優しいところはすごく尊敬出来るし……）","en":"(He’s not exactly my type, but everyone agrees he’s a brilliant doctor, and I really do respect how hard he works and how kind he is to his patients...)","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r321","rowIndex":321,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　改めて考えてみると意外と悪くない話で、そう気がつくと、より一層自分自身を動揺させる。","en":"Now that she actually considered it, the prospect was surprisingly not bad. Realizing that only flustered her more.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r322","rowIndex":322,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"（私ってそんな人だったんだ！）","en":"(I never knew I was that kind of woman!)","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r323","rowIndex":323,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　変な汗をかきながらグルグルと考えていると、前を行く<tips=5>太刀川</tips>が唐突に立ち止まり、振り返った。","en":"Her thoughts spinning in circles, Misa broke out in a nervous sweat. Then <tips=5>Tachikawa</tips>, walking ahead of her, abruptly stopped and turned around.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r324","rowIndex":324,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そこで、はじめて<tips=83>美紗</tips>はこの医者と正面から向き合うことになる。","en":"For the first time, <tips=83>Misa</tips> stood directly face-to-face with the doctor.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r325","rowIndex":325,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ふむ」","en":"“Hmm.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"太刀川良馬","displayName":"Ryoma Tachikawa","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r326","rowIndex":326,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼は<tips=83>美紗</tips>を見て、妙な形に口を歪める。それは、いつも表情のないポーカーフェイスである<tips=5>太刀川</tips>にしては珍しい変化であった。","en":"He looked at <tips=83>Misa</tips> and twisted his mouth into a peculiar shape. For <tips=5>Tachikawa</tips>, normally so utterly poker-faced, it was a rare change of expression.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r327","rowIndex":327,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"（私、こんな表情をされるほど変な顔をしていたのかしら！）","en":"(Was I making a face strange enough to get that reaction?)","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r328","rowIndex":328,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　半分パニックになりながら、<tips=83>美紗</tips>は、","en":"Half panicking, <tips=83>Misa</tips> said,","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r329","rowIndex":329,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「さ、さっきは、助けてくれてありがとうございました」","en":"“Th-thank you for helping me earlier.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"能見美紗","displayName":"Misa Nomi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r330","rowIndex":330,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　と、完全にタイミングが遅れてしまった感謝の言葉を述べ、頭を下げた。","en":"She delivered the badly belated thanks and bowed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r331","rowIndex":331,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=5>太刀川</tips>はそんな彼女を無言で見つめる。緊張しながら次の言葉を待つ<tips=83>美紗</tips>には、その沈黙はあまりにも長く感じられた。","en":"<tips=5>Tachikawa</tips> stared at her in silence. To <tips=83>Misa</tips>, waiting nervously for whatever he might say next, that silence felt far too long.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r332","rowIndex":332,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=5>太刀川</tips>は結局何も言わず、","en":"In the end, <tips=5>Tachikawa</tips> said nothing about it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r333","rowIndex":333,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ここが、今夜の診察所です」","en":"“This will be our clinic for tonight.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"太刀川良馬","displayName":"Ryoma Tachikawa","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r334","rowIndex":334,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ステッキを上げて、背後の児童養護施設を<tips=83>美紗</tips>に示した。","en":"He lifted his cane and indicated the children’s home behind him to <tips=83>Misa</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r335","rowIndex":335,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ここは捨て子が多い街です。ノーマルも<tips=16>タイプA</tips>も居ますが、一番多いのは<tips=17>タイプB</tips>ですね。この街で生まれた子供だけでなく、よその地域からも捨てに来ているらしいです。何しろ、<tips=9>Y地区</tips>はミュータントが多いことで知られていますからね。この街に捨てれば、仲間が多くて幸せに暮らせると考えるのかもしれません」","en":"“A great many children are abandoned in this city. There are Normals and <tips=16>Type As</tips> among them, but the largest group is <tips=17>Type B</tips>. And it is not only children born here. Apparently, people come from other regions to abandon children as well. After all, <tips=9>Y District</tips> is known for its large mutant population. Perhaps they imagine that if they leave a child here, the child will find plenty of their own kind and live happily.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"太刀川良馬","displayName":"Ryoma Tachikawa","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r336","rowIndex":336,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　鞄の中から診察道具を取り出し、施設職員の用意してくれた机の上に並べながら<tips=5>太刀川</tips>は説明する。","en":"<tips=5>Tachikawa</tips> explained while removing his instruments from the bag and arranging them on a desk the facility’s staff had prepared.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r337","rowIndex":337,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あ、手伝います！」","en":"“Oh, let me help!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"能見美紗","displayName":"Misa Nomi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r338","rowIndex":338,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ぼんやり立ったまま話に耳を傾けていた<tips=83>美紗</tips>は、我に返ってそう申し出たが、<tips=5>太刀川</tips>は首を横に振る。","en":"<tips=83>Misa</tips> had been standing there in a daze, listening to him. Coming back to herself, she offered to help, but <tips=5>Tachikawa</tips> shook his head.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r339","rowIndex":339,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「今日は見学してくれればよいのです。こうした場所の患者たちを見るのも仕事の役に立つかもしれません」","en":"“You need only observe tonight. Seeing the patients in a place like this may prove useful in your work.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"太刀川良馬","displayName":"Ryoma Tachikawa","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r340","rowIndex":340,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　一通り道具を並べ終えると、最後にカルテのファイルを取り出し、<tips=83>美紗</tips>に手渡した。","en":"Once he had arranged all the instruments, he removed a file of medical charts and handed it to <tips=83>Misa</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r341","rowIndex":341,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「子供が入って来たら名前を言うのでその子のカルテを渡してください。あなたの今日の仕事はそれだけです」","en":"“When a child comes in, I will tell you the name. Please hand me that child’s chart. That is all I need you to do tonight.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"太刀川良馬","displayName":"Ryoma Tachikawa","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r342","rowIndex":342,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そう告げると<tips=5>太刀川</tips>は若い女性職員を呼び、子供を一人ずつ部屋に入れるよう伝えた。","en":"After giving the instruction, <tips=5>Tachikawa</tips> called a young female staff member and told her to bring the children into the room one at a time.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r343","rowIndex":343,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「今日は十人くらいみましょう。状態のよくない子から入れてください」","en":"“Let us see around ten tonight. Start with the children in the worst condition.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"太刀川良馬","displayName":"Ryoma Tachikawa","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r344","rowIndex":344,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「今ちょっと、寝る前のお祈りの時間でして……」","en":"“They’re just saying their prayers before bed...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r345","rowIndex":345,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ああ、結構。それが終わってからにしてください」","en":"“Ah, that is fine. Have them come when the prayers are over.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"太刀川良馬","displayName":"Ryoma Tachikawa","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r346","rowIndex":346,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　職員は礼をして、部屋を出て行く。そしてすぐに戻ってくると、","en":"The staff member bowed and left the room. She soon returned.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r347","rowIndex":347,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「インスタントで恥ずかしいのですが」","en":"“I’m afraid it’s only instant.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r348","rowIndex":348,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そう言って、二人分のコーヒーを置いていった。","en":"With those words, she left two cups of coffee.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r349","rowIndex":349,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　この感じからすると、<tips=5>太刀川</tips>がここで診察を行うのは一度や二度ではないようだ。","en":"From the easy familiarity of the exchange, it seemed this was far from the first or second time <tips=5>Tachikawa</tips> had held a clinic here.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r350","rowIndex":350,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=5>太刀川</tips>は早速コーヒーに手を付ける。<tips=83>美紗</tips>も同じように手を伸ばし、そして落ち着かぬままキョロキョロと視線を動かす。","en":"<tips=5>Tachikawa</tips> immediately began drinking his coffee. <tips=83>Misa</tips> reached for hers as well, her restless gaze roaming around the room.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r351","rowIndex":351,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そこは普段は応接室として使われているらしい。ソファーやローテーブルは診察がしやすいように部屋の隅に追いやられ、かわりに子供を座らせるためのパイプ椅子を部屋の中央に置いている。","en":"Apparently, the room ordinarily served to receive visitors. The sofas and low table had been pushed into a corner to make space for the examinations. A folding chair for the children stood in the center instead.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r352","rowIndex":352,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　壁際の棚の上には、子供が作ったらしい、折り紙や紙粘土細工が飾られており、職員と子供たちがにこやかな顔で写る集合写真などもあった。","en":"Shelves against the wall displayed what appeared to be the children’s origami and modeling-clay creations. There were also group photographs of staff and children smiling together.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r353","rowIndex":353,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=5>太刀川</tips>はここで無料で子供たちを診ているそうだ。<tips=83>美紗</tips>は彼がこんなところで慈善活動を行っているということに、イメージと違うような、むしろ逆にしっくり来るような、どっちつかずの印象を持った。","en":"Apparently, <tips=5>Tachikawa</tips> treated the children here free of charge. The discovery that he did charitable work in a place like this left <tips=83>Misa</tips> with an oddly divided impression: it seemed out of character for him, yet somehow perfectly fitting at the same time.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r354","rowIndex":354,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「褒められたことではないですが、<tips=17>タイプB</tips>の子供をここに捨てるのは、なかなか理にかなっています」","en":"“It is hardly praiseworthy, but there is a certain logic to abandoning a <tips=17>Type B</tips> child here.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"太刀川良馬","displayName":"Ryoma Tachikawa","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r355","rowIndex":355,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=5>太刀川</tips>はうつむき加減でコーヒーを啜りながら先ほどの話の続きをする。","en":"<tips=5>Tachikawa</tips> continued his earlier explanation, head lowered slightly as he sipped his coffee.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r356","rowIndex":356,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ここでは<tips=17>タイプＢ</tips>だからというだけで差別されることはありませんし、彼らのための仕事もたくさんあります。朝の稲荷神社の方に行ったことがありますか？　あの辺りではよく斡旋業者が大声を張り上げていて、日雇いの肉体労働者をトラックに乗せています。<tips=17>タイプB</tips>の方が多いようですね。発症している方も見えます。ノルマ方式の作業だと、<tips=17>タイプB</tips>の方は相当稼ぐそうですよ。女性だったらもっと沢山稼ぐことが出来ます。<tips=9>Y地区</tips>にはその手の仕事は多いですからね。症状が重くなってしまうとなかなか仕事もないようですが。それでも<tips=9>Y地区</tips>は、<tips=17>タイプB</tips>に限らず、マイノリティ全般に優しい町だと言えるでしょう」","en":"“No one here will discriminate against them merely for being <tips=17>Type B</tips>, and there is plenty of work meant for them. Have you ever been near Inari Shrine in the morning? Labor brokers are often there shouting at the top of their lungs and loading day laborers onto trucks. A great many of the workers appear to be <tips=17>Type B</tips>; you can even see some whose symptoms have already manifested. I am told that <tips=17>Type B</tips> workers can earn considerable sums in quota-based jobs. Women can earn far more still. <tips=9>Y District</tips> has plenty of work of that sort. Once their symptoms become severe, however, there seems to be very little work even here. Nevertheless, one could call <tips=9>Y District</tips> a city kind to minorities in general, not only to <tips=17>Type Bs</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"太刀川良馬","displayName":"Ryoma Tachikawa","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r357","rowIndex":357,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=83>美紗</tips>にはあまり幸福な将来にも、優しい社会にも聞こえなかったが、太刀川は皮肉や冗談のつもりで言っているわけでもないようだ。","en":"To <tips=83>Misa</tips>, this sounded neither like a happy future nor a kind society. Yet Tachikawa did not appear to be speaking ironically or making a joke.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r358","rowIndex":358,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　自分とは価値の基準が大分異なっていて、そして、<tips=5>太刀川</tips>のそれの方がシビアで現実的であるような気がして、訳もなく恥ずかしくなった。","en":"His standards of value seemed utterly different from her own, and <tips=5>Tachikawa’s</tips> struck her as the sterner, more realistic of the two. The thought left her ashamed for reasons she could not explain.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r359","rowIndex":359,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どうして、<tips=9>Y地区</tips>には<tips=17>タイプB</tips>が多いのですか？」","en":"“Why are there so many <tips=17>Type Bs</tips> in <tips=9>Y District</tips>?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"能見美紗","displayName":"Misa Nomi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r360","rowIndex":360,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「元々、この街自体が、基地の撤去後の野原に世間のあぶれものが集まって出来たという経緯もあるのでしょうが、それだけでもないでしょう。<tips=17>タイプB</tips>は<tips=8>グレートホール</tips>の側を好むという統計があります。さらに、<tips=8>グレートホール</tips>の近くでは<tips=17>タイプB</tips>の出生率があがり、その程度を示すアウラー指数も他の地域より高くなる傾向があり、発症率も高いです。<tips=16>タイプA</tips>も同様です」","en":"“The city’s history may be one reason. It arose when society’s outcasts gathered on the open land left behind after the military base was removed. But that cannot be the entire explanation. Statistics show that <tips=17>Type Bs</tips> prefer to live near the <tips=8>Great Hole</tips>. In the vicinity of the <tips=8>Great Hole</tips>, the <tips=17>Type B</tips> birth rate rises, the corresponding Aura Index readings tend to be higher than in other regions, and the rate of symptom onset is higher as well. The same is true of <tips=16>Type As</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"太刀川良馬","displayName":"Ryoma Tachikawa","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r361","rowIndex":361,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それは知っています。ミュータントと<tips=8>グレートホール</tips>に、何か関係性があるんでしょうか？」","en":"“I know that much. Is there some connection between mutants and the <tips=8>Great Hole</tips>?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"能見美紗","displayName":"Misa Nomi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r362","rowIndex":362,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「直接的な関係性は見つかっていません。そもそも、グレートホールはただの深い穴です。探索機が何度も下ろされて、それ以外の何物でもないことははっきりしています。ミュータントと何か関係があるとすれば、<tips=8>グレートホール</tips>につきものの周辺の汚染物質でしょうね」","en":"“No direct connection has been found. To begin with, the Great Hole is simply a deep pit. Probes have been lowered into it time and again, and they have established beyond doubt that it is nothing more than that. If there is any connection to mutants, it most likely lies in the contaminants invariably found around the <tips=8>Great Hole</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"太刀川良馬","displayName":"Ryoma Tachikawa","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r363","rowIndex":363,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「患者さんの妄想に、よく<tips=8>グレートホール</tips>が出て来るようなのですが……」","en":"“The <tips=8>Great Hole</tips> seems to appear very often in our patients’ delusions...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"能見美紗","displayName":"Misa Nomi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r364","rowIndex":364,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「世間ではまだまだミステリアスなものとして認識されているようですし、雄大で恐ろしいイメージもありますから、患者からすれば格好の妄想の材料なのでしょう。他には何もないと思いますよ」","en":"“The public still sees it as a great mystery, and its image is both immense and terrifying. It presumably makes ideal material for a patient’s delusions. I do not believe there is anything more to it.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"太刀川良馬","displayName":"Ryoma Tachikawa","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r365","rowIndex":365,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=83>美紗</tips>は何かもっと別の、科学とはまた違う繋がりが、患者と<tips=8>グレートホール</tips>の間にあるような気がしたが、それを口にすると馬鹿にされそうで言えなかった。","en":"<tips=83>Misa</tips> felt there must be some other bond between the patients and the <tips=8>Great Hole</tips>, one of a different order from anything science could explain. But she could not bring herself to say so, afraid she would be ridiculed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r366","rowIndex":366,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　幽霊とか、占いとか、そういったものも好きだが、普段は恥ずかしくてそのことについて語れないのと一緒だ。","en":"She liked ghosts and fortune-telling and things of that sort too, but she was normally too embarrassed to talk about them. This was no different.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r367","rowIndex":367,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　こういった自分の感覚的な考え方は、医療従事者として似つかわしくないような気もする。","en":"At times, she felt that this intuitive way of thinking was unbecoming in a medical professional.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r368","rowIndex":368,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「うちの病院がここに建てられたのも、<tips=8>グレートホール</tips>の影響を考えてのことなのでしょうか」","en":"“Was our hospital built here with the <tips=8>Great Hole’s</tips> influence in mind as well?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"能見美紗","displayName":"Misa Nomi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r369","rowIndex":369,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それは単に、他に建てる場所がなかったからですよ。純粋に治療のことだけを考えたら、<tips=8>グレートホール</tips>から遠い方がいいに決まってます」","en":"“No. It was built here simply because there was nowhere else to put it. If treatment alone were the concern, farther from the <tips=8>Great Hole</tips> would obviously be better.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"太刀川良馬","displayName":"Ryoma Tachikawa","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r370","rowIndex":370,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=5>太刀川</tips>のカップが空になる頃、最初の患者が入って来た。","en":"By the time <tips=5>Tachikawa’s</tips> cup was empty, the first patient came in.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r371","rowIndex":371,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　六、七才くらいの活発そうな少女で、顔やキャミソールからはみ出した首筋や肩が真っ黒に日焼けしている。顔には大きなやけどのあとがあり、笑うと、白い八重歯がさわやかに映えた。そしてその目は金色である。","en":"She was a lively-looking girl of six or seven, her face and the neck and shoulders exposed by her camisole tanned nearly black. A large burn scar marked her face, but when she smiled, a white, slightly crooked canine flashed fresh and bright. Her eyes were gold.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r372","rowIndex":372,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「三井遙香ちゃん」","en":"“Haruka Mitsui.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"太刀川良馬","displayName":"Ryoma Tachikawa","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r373","rowIndex":373,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「はい！」","en":"“Yes!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r374","rowIndex":374,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=5>太刀川</tips>の問いに、少女は即座に大きな声で返事をする。<tips=83>美紗</tips>はアルファベット順に並べられたカルテから「Ｈａｒｕｋａ　Mｉｔｓｕｉ」と書かれたファイルを探し出して、<tips=5>太刀川</tips>の脇の机に置く。","en":"The girl answered <tips=5>Tachikawa’s</tips> call at once, her voice ringing out. <tips=83>Misa</tips> searched the alphabetically arranged charts, found the file labeled “Haruka Mitsui,” and set it on the desk beside <tips=5>Tachikawa</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r375","rowIndex":375,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そのままカルテに書かれた文章を読むと、少女は発症はしていないが、<tips=95>金眼</tips>があらわれやすく、それによる身体能力の向上度も高い。本人はそれを自覚しておらず、たびたび問題行動を起こすらしい。","en":"According to the chart, the girl had not developed symptoms, but her eyes frequently turned <tips=95>gold</tips> and the resulting increase in her physical ability was unusually great. Apparently, she was unaware of the change and often caused trouble as a result.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r376","rowIndex":376,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　こんな少女も、将来は不幸になってしまうのだろうかと<tips=83>美紗</tips>が暗い気持ちになっていると、","en":"<tips=83>Misa’s</tips> thoughts darkened. Would even a girl like this be doomed to unhappiness one day?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r377","rowIndex":377,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「じゃあ、その椅子に座って……」","en":"“Now, sit in that chair...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"太刀川良馬","displayName":"Ryoma Tachikawa","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r378","rowIndex":378,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　少女は職員が座るよう指示したのもきかず、笑顔のままタタタと彼に駆け寄ると<tips=5>太刀川</tips>の身体にしがみついた。","en":"Ignoring the staff member’s instruction to sit, the girl kept smiling, darted over to <tips=5>Tachikawa</tips>, and flung her arms around him.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r379","rowIndex":379,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「せんせいっ、大好きぃっ！」","en":"“Doctor, I love youuu!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r380","rowIndex":380,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　少女は親愛の情を示したつもりなのだろうが、彼女の身体は想像以上の筋力があるようで、腰の辺りからめきめきと音がする。","en":"The girl presumably meant only to show her affection, but there was far more strength in her body than anyone might have imagined. A series of alarming cracks came from somewhere around Tachikawa’s waist.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r381","rowIndex":381,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　やはり<tips=95>金眼</tips>が発動した<tips=17>タイプＢ</tips>というのは、子供であっても凄い力があるものだ。","en":"Sure enough, when the <tips=95>golden eyes</tips> of a <tips=17>Type B</tips> activated, even a child possessed tremendous strength.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r382","rowIndex":382,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「うっ……」","en":"“Ugh...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"太刀川良馬","displayName":"Ryoma Tachikawa","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r383","rowIndex":383,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=5>太刀川</tips>は口元を引きつらせてうめき声をあげる。","en":"<tips=5>Tachikawa’s</tips> mouth drew tight as a groan escaped him.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r384","rowIndex":384,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「こ、こら」","en":"“N-now, stop that.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"能見美紗","displayName":"Misa Nomi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r385","rowIndex":385,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=83>美紗</tips>も駆け寄ったが、それより職員の方が早かった。少女の頭を軽くはたいて、<tips=5>太刀川</tips>から引きはがす。","en":"<tips=83>Misa</tips> rushed over, but the staff member beat her to it, giving the girl a light rap on the head and peeling her away from <tips=5>Tachikawa</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r386","rowIndex":386,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「へへへ」","en":"“Hehehe.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r387","rowIndex":387,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　少女は悪びれもせずに屈託のない笑顔を浮かべている。","en":"Utterly unabashed, the girl beamed back at them without a care in the world.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r388","rowIndex":388,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　一方<tips=5>太刀川</tips>はその独特の髪型を乱し、ぜえぜえと荒く呼吸をしながら、","en":"Meanwhile, <tips=5>Tachikawa’s</tips> distinctive hair was in disarray, and he was panting hard when at last he said:","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r389","rowIndex":389,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あいかわらず、ちょっと元気すぎるようですね」","en":"“As usual, you appear to be slightly too energetic.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"太刀川良馬","displayName":"Ryoma Tachikawa","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X2-2:r390","rowIndex":390,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そんなことを言ったので、<tips=83>美紗</tips>はついうっかり噴き出してしまった。","en":"At that, <tips=83>Misa</tips> burst out laughing before she could stop herself.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}}]},{"position":7,"code":"A2-2","unitId":"A2-2","rows":[{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r1","rowIndex":1,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　朝早く、先日結婚したばかりの<ruby=マー・メイメイ><tips=24>馬美美</tips></ruby>から電話があった。","en":"Early that morning, I received a call from <tips=24>Ma Meimei</tips>, who had only recently married.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r2","rowIndex":2,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　いや、今はもう馬姓ではないのだろうか？　結婚相手は日本人であるし、婿をとったという話でもなかったようだから、別姓を選択でもしなければ夫の名字になっている筈だ。だとすれば、今の名字はわからないけれども。","en":"Or perhaps she no longer went by Ma? Her husband was Japanese, and I did not recall hearing that he had married into her family, so unless they had opted to keep separate surnames, she ought to have taken her husband's. In that case, though, I had no idea what her surname was now.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r3","rowIndex":3,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　まあとにかく名字がどうであろうとその相手は僕が昔から知っている<tips=24>美美</tips>である。彼女が子供の頃からの早口気味な口調で伝えた用件は、今日の昼からの昼食会に参加をしないかという誘いだった。","en":"Whatever her surname might be now, she was still the same <tips=24>Meimei</tips> I had known since childhood. Speaking in the same slightly rapid cadence she had had even as a girl, she invited me to a luncheon that day.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r4","rowIndex":4,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　結婚式のためにちょうど今この街に人間が集まっているから、私的なパーティを行うのだと言う。これが<tips=4>馬明</tips>の言っていたやつだろう。","en":"She said that with so many people in town for the wedding, she was throwing a private party. This must have been what <tips=4>Ma Ming</tips> had mentioned.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r5","rowIndex":5,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　参加者も<tips=4>馬明</tips>が言っていたとおりだった。主催者は<tips=85>二路元帥</tips>である<tips=4>馬明</tips>の娘<tips=24>美美</tips>で、彼女が招待したのはまず<tips=27>廖志明</tips>の息子の<tips=28>トミー</tips>。それから<tips=35>ジョゼ・フェルナンデス</tips>のところの三姉妹。さらに僕が行くことになれば<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>の有力幹部のジュニア世代そろい踏みとなる。","en":"The guest list was just as <tips=4>Ma Ming</tips> had said. Hosting was <tips=24>Meimei</tips>, daughter of <tips=4>Ma Ming</tips>, the <tips=85>Second Route Marshal</tips>. She had invited <tips=28>Tommy</tips>, son of <tips=27>Liao Chi-ming</tips>, and the three daughters of <tips=35>José Fernandes</tips>. If I went as well, the junior generation of all <tips=7>YS's</tips> leading officers would be present.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r6","rowIndex":6,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　話によると、こうした会合は<tips=24>美美</tips>の主催によりたびたび行われているらしい。街を離れていた僕は知らなかった。","en":"Apparently, <tips=24>Meimei</tips> often hosted gatherings like this. I had not known, since I had been away from the city.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r7","rowIndex":7,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　さてどうするか？","en":"So what was I to do?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r8","rowIndex":8,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕は街を離れて大分事情に疎くなっている。状況の把握という意味では彼らと話したほうがいいだろう。ただ、あまり<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>がらみの人間と積極的に付き合いたくないというのも本心だ。私的な場所と言っても、彼らはみな背景のある人間だ。この微妙な時期にのこのこと出かけていって、きなくさいことに巻き込まれてもつまらない。僕はこの街に戻るつもりはないのだから、なるべく接触はしない方がいいのだ。","en":"I had been away from the city long enough to fall badly out of touch, so talking to them would probably help me take stock of the situation. But the truth was, I had no desire to cultivate ties with people connected to <tips=7>YS</tips>. Private gathering or not, every one of them had powerful interests behind them. There was nothing to gain by waltzing in at such a delicate time and getting dragged into something ugly. I had no intention of moving back to this city; the less contact I had with them, the better.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r9","rowIndex":9,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　話しながらメリットデメリットのバランスを考えていた僕だが、結局意見がまとまらぬまま<tips=24>美美</tips>の強引な説得に押し切られるかたちで参加を了承することとなった。","en":"As we spoke, I weighed the pros and cons. In the end, before I had reached a conclusion, <tips=24>Meimei's</tips> forceful persuasion wore me down and I agreed to attend.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r10","rowIndex":10,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして僕は時間になるとホテルを出発した。会場は二人の新居ではなく、彼女の実家である<tips=4>馬明</tips>の屋敷であった。","en":"When the time came, I left the hotel. The gathering was being held not at the newlyweds’ home but at <tips=4>Ma Ming’s</tips> estate, Meimei’s family home.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r11","rowIndex":11,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そこには僕も子供の頃から何度も訪れている。","en":"I had visited the place many times since childhood.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r12","rowIndex":12,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　案内されなくともその建物の構造はよく知っていた。タクシーを門の前で降りると、インターフォンに出た使用人に開けさせ、ずかずかとリビングルームに入り込む。","en":"I knew the building's layout well enough not to need a guide. I got out of the taxi at the gate, had the servant who answered the intercom let me in, and strode straight into the living room.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r13","rowIndex":13,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　すると、テーブルにはすでに料理が並べられていた。","en":"There, the table was already laid with food.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r14","rowIndex":14,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　屋敷付きの調理人が作ったのであろう、広東風の料理である。一般的に大陸の方では北の料理は味が濃くて辛かったりするが、南の料理はあっさりとしているらしい。僕は一度も行ったことがないので聞いただけだが、確かに僕らが慣れ親しんでいる料理は淡泊な味付けのものだ。","en":"It was Cantonese food, presumably prepared by the estate’s cook. On the mainland, northern cooking is generally said to be strongly flavored and spicy, while southern cooking is lighter. I had never been to the mainland myself and knew this only by hearsay, but the food we had grown up with certainly was lightly seasoned.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r15","rowIndex":15,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　父もそうだが、この街の中国人は南方出身が多い。","en":"Most of the Chinese people in this city, my father among them, came from the south.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r16","rowIndex":16,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ようこそ。今日はよく来てくれたね」","en":"“Welcome. I’m glad you came today.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬美美ベールなし","displayName":"Ma Meimei (Without Veil)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r17","rowIndex":17,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=24>美美</tips>は笑顔で僕を出迎える。","en":"<tips=24>Meimei</tips> greeted me with a smile.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r18","rowIndex":18,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「招いてくれてありがとう。式では騒いでしまって申し訳ない」","en":"“Thank you for inviting me. And I’m sorry about all the commotion at the wedding.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r19","rowIndex":19,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いいんだよ。別に。お父さんも久しぶりに<tips=2>阿亮</tips>とじゃれあえて楽しそうだったよ」","en":"“It’s fine, really. Father looked like he had fun roughhousing with <tips=2>Ah Leung</tips> again after so long.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬美美ベールなし","displayName":"Ma Meimei (Without Veil)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r20","rowIndex":20,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そう言う彼女は裏表のない率直な笑みを浮かべている。","en":"She said it with an open, unguarded smile.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r21","rowIndex":21,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ご主人は？」","en":"“Where is your husband?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r22","rowIndex":22,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「お父さんと二人で出かけてる。お父さんの店を案内してもらうんだって。すごい緊張した顔で出て行ったわ」","en":"“He went out alone with Father. Apparently, Father’s showing him around the business. He looked terribly nervous when he left.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬美美ベールなし","displayName":"Ma Meimei (Without Veil)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r23","rowIndex":23,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そりゃイカツイ連中に取り囲まれて案内されても生きた心地はしないだろう。ご主人はそういう世界の人じゃないんでしょう？」","en":"“Anyone would be scared half to death getting shown around by a pack of bruisers like that. Your husband isn’t from that world, is he?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r24","rowIndex":24,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕が言うと、<tips=24>美美</tips>は笑う。","en":"At my remark, <tips=24>Meimei</tips> laughed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r25","rowIndex":25,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=44>シウ</tips>ちゃんは元気だった？　会ったんでしょ？」","en":"“<tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> was doing well, wasn't she? You saw her, right?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬美美ベールなし","displayName":"Ma Meimei (Without Veil)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r26","rowIndex":26,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女はそう言いながら、近くに来た給仕の女のトレイから食前酒の入ったグラスをひとつとると、僕に差し出した。","en":"As she spoke, she took a glass of aperitif from the tray of a passing server and held it out to me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r27","rowIndex":27,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「うん、相変わらずだったよ」","en":"“Yeah, same as ever.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r28","rowIndex":28,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕は受け取りながらそう答える。","en":"I answered as I accepted it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r29","rowIndex":29,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あの、ええと、<tips=55>松子</tips>ちゃんは？」","en":"“Um, er... and <tips=55>Matsuko</tips>?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬美美ベールなし","displayName":"Ma Meimei (Without Veil)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r30","rowIndex":30,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「今日は仕事だって」","en":"“She said she had work today.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r31","rowIndex":31,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「働いてらっしゃるの？」","en":"“Oh, she’s working?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬美美ベールなし","displayName":"Ma Meimei (Without Veil)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r32","rowIndex":32,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どこかの施設で孤児の面倒を見てるらしい」","en":"“Apparently, she looks after orphans at some kind of home.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r33","rowIndex":33,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まあ、<tips=70>シオクリーン</tips>のお嬢様が、えらいねえ」","en":"“My, the young lady of <tips=70>Shio Clean</tips>. How admirable.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬美美ベールなし","displayName":"Ma Meimei (Without Veil)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r34","rowIndex":34,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「何でこの街に住んでいる人間の近況を、街の外で暮らしている僕が答えるかたちになっているんだ？」","en":"“Why am I the one who lives outside the city telling you how the people who live here are doing?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r35","rowIndex":35,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ふふ、同じ街でも、なかなか会えない人もいるのよ。前に姿を見たのは何年前だったかしらねえ」","en":"“Hee hee. Even in the same city, there are some people you hardly ever see. How many years has it been since I last saw her, I wonder?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬美美ベールなし","displayName":"Ma Meimei (Without Veil)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r36","rowIndex":36,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それにしても、彼女が幸せそうで良かった。親同士が義兄弟だという縁があり、一つ上の彼女は、ほとんど生まれた頃からの知り合いなのだ。","en":"Still, I was glad to see her looking happy. Our fathers were sworn brothers, and since Meimei was a year older than I was, I had known her practically from birth.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r37","rowIndex":37,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=4>馬明</tips>などは子供の頃から僕と彼女をくっつけたいようだったが、結局お互いを異性として見る機会のないまま今日を迎えている。","en":"Ever since we were children, <tips=4>Ma Ming</tips> had apparently wanted to see the two of us together. In the end, however, we had arrived at this day without either of us ever seeing the other as a potential partner.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r38","rowIndex":38,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そう言えば、お兄さんは？」","en":"“Speaking of which, where is your brother?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r39","rowIndex":39,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕はこの場にいない<tips=25>世傑</tips>のことを訊ねた。","en":"I asked about <tips=25>Sai-kit</tips>, who was not there.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r40","rowIndex":40,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あの人は、ちょっと……」","en":"“He’s... well...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬美美ベールなし","displayName":"Ma Meimei (Without Veil)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r41","rowIndex":41,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女は表情を曇らせる。","en":"Her expression clouded.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r42","rowIndex":42,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「やあ<tips=24>美美</tips>、こんにちは。そして<tips=2>阿亮</tips>、昨日はどうも」","en":"“Hi, <tips=24>Meimei</tips>. And <tips=2>Ah Leung</tips>—thanks for yesterday.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r43","rowIndex":43,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=24>美美</tips>が顔を曇らせたところで現れたのは<tips=27>廖志明</tips>の一人息子の<tips=28>トーマス・リャオ</tips>だった。","en":"The man who appeared just as <tips=24>Meimei’s</tips> expression clouded was <tips=28>Thomas Liao</tips>, the only son of <tips=27>Liao Chi-ming</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r44","rowIndex":44,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　昨日の緊張の場面とはうってかわって、にこやかでリラックスした表情をしている。","en":"In complete contrast to the tense scene the day before, his face was relaxed and cheerful.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r45","rowIndex":45,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なんだか、大変なことになったねえ。あ、こちらは僕の大切な友人の<tips=29>アイス</tips>だ」","en":"“This has all turned into quite a mess, hasn’t it? Oh, and this is my dear friend <tips=29>Ice</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r46","rowIndex":46,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ボディーガードの<tips=29>アイス</tips>です」","en":"“I am <tips=29>Ice</tips>, his bodyguard.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アイス","displayName":"Ice","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r47","rowIndex":47,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　紹介された背の高い女性は、丁寧にお辞儀をする。","en":"The tall woman he introduced bowed politely.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r48","rowIndex":48,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　偽名かニックネームのように思える正体不明の名前だが、日本人だろうか？　それとも中国人か。肌と髪の色からすると東洋人のようには思えるのだが。","en":"The name gave me nothing to go on; it sounded like either an alias or a nickname. Was she Japanese? Or Chinese? Judging by her skin and hair, she did at least appear East Asian.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r49","rowIndex":49,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　美人といえる顔立ちだが、その片側半分がやけどで爛れ、気の毒なほど容姿の印象を破壊している。前髪を片方垂らしていたが隠し切れていない。","en":"She had the features of a beautiful woman, but burns had ravaged one entire side of her face, tragically marring her appearance. She wore her bangs down over that side, though they could not hide it completely.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r50","rowIndex":50,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ボディーガードと言うからには、普通の女ではなく、訓練を積んだ<tips=17>タイプＢ</tips>か能力のある<tips=16>タイプA</tips>だろう。<tips=16>タイプＡ</tips>だとしたらどこかに<tips=77>特質変異</tips>があるはずだ。","en":"If she was a bodyguard, she was no ordinary woman. She was probably either a trained <tips=17>Type B</tips> or a <tips=16>Type A</tips> with some ability of her own. If she was a <tips=16>Type A</tips>, there ought to be a <tips=77>trait mutation</tips> somewhere on her body.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r51","rowIndex":51,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　首を隠す高い襟の服と長袖長ズボンという出で立ちで、すっぽりと全身を隠している。衣服の下に<tips=16>タイプA</tips>である証があるのかもしれないが、ひとまず身体には特徴を見つけることは出来ない。","en":"A high-collared top covered her neck, and long sleeves and trousers concealed her entire body. Some sign that she was <tips=16>Type A</tips> might lie beneath her clothes, but for the moment I could find nothing distinctive about her body.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r52","rowIndex":52,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　この顔のやけどは<tips=16>タイプＡ</tips>の<tips=77>特質変異</tips>ではないはずだ。","en":"The burn on her face could not be a <tips=16>Type A</tips> <tips=77>trait mutation</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r53","rowIndex":53,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ねえ<tips=2>阿亮</tips>、これからこの街はどうなるのかなあ？」","en":"“Hey, <tips=2>Ah Leung</tips>, what do you think will happen to this city now?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r54","rowIndex":54,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「街を離れている僕に聞くなよ。こっちが聞きたいくらいだ」","en":"“Don't ask me. I live outside the city—I'm the one who'd like to know.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r55","rowIndex":55,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いや、<tips=2>阿亮</tips>なら何か言ってくれるんじゃないかと思って。やっぱり、きな臭い感じはするんだよねえ」","en":"“No, I thought <tips=2>Ah Leung</tips> might have something to say. It really does feel as though trouble is brewing, doesn't it?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r56","rowIndex":56,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そりゃ、権勢を誇ったボスが死のうとしているわけだからきな臭さはあるだろう。しかし、この街がどうなるかというのは、彼の父親である<tips=27>廖志明</tips>次第じゃないか。","en":"Of course things felt ominous: a boss who had wielded enormous power was dying. But what happened to the city depended on his own father, <tips=27>Liao Chi-ming</tips>, didn't it?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r57","rowIndex":57,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それくらい彼にだってわかりそうなものだけれど、他人事のように話しているのはいかにも彼らしい。","en":"You would think even he could see that much, yet talking about it as though it had nothing to do with him was just like him.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r58","rowIndex":58,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　この<tips=28>トミー</tips>は抜け目ない父親とはまるで正反対の人柄で、よく言えば鷹揚で温厚。別の言い方をすればお人好しで少々抜けている。人間的には嫌いじゃない。","en":"<tips=28>Tommy</tips> was the complete opposite of his shrewd father. Put kindly, he was easygoing and mild-mannered. Put less kindly, he was a soft touch and a little clueless. Personally, I didn’t dislike him.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r59","rowIndex":59,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ありがとうございます。もう一つ貰えますか？」","en":"“Thank you. Could I have another?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r60","rowIndex":60,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　給仕の女に<tips=28>トミー</tips>がにっこりと微笑みかけると、給仕はその丁寧な物腰に恐縮しながらもう一つ手渡す。<tips=28>トミー</tips>はそれを手ずからアイスに渡した。<tips=29>アイス</tips>は遠慮して断ろうとしたが、彼は無理矢理握らせるようにして、それを許さなかった。","en":"When <tips=28>Tommy</tips> gave the server a bright smile, his impeccable manners left her flustered as she handed him another. <tips=28>Tommy</tips> offered it to <tips=29>Ice</tips> himself. She politely tried to refuse, but he pressed it into her hand and gave her no choice.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r61","rowIndex":61,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「みんな、今日は<tips=2>阿亮</tips>が来てくれたよ」","en":"“Everyone, look—<tips=2>Ah Leung</tips> came to see us today.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r62","rowIndex":62,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=24>美美</tips>は振り返り、ちょうど部屋に入ってきた三姉妹に声をかける。","en":"<tips=24>Meimei</tips> turned and called to the three sisters as they entered the room.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r63","rowIndex":63,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あら、おそろいで。みなさんこんにちは」","en":"“Oh, all three of you. Hello.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アウロラ・フェルナンデス","displayName":"Aurora Fernandes","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r64","rowIndex":64,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　近づいて来て、代表で挨拶をしたのは長女の<tips=36>アウロラ</tips>だ。","en":"<tips=36>Aurora</tips>, the eldest, approached and offered the greeting on behalf of the others.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r65","rowIndex":65,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=2>阿亮</tips>、来てくれたのね」","en":"“<tips=2>Ah Leung</tips>, you came!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アウロラ・フェルナンデス","displayName":"Aurora Fernandes","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r66","rowIndex":66,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どうも」","en":"“Hello.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r67","rowIndex":67,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕は軽く頭を下げた。","en":"I inclined my head slightly.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r68","rowIndex":68,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　世間で美女と名高い三人が勢揃いして並ぶとなかなか威圧感がある。","en":"All three sisters were famed for their beauty, and seeing them assembled in a row made for quite an imposing sight.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r69","rowIndex":69,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「でも今日は料理をひっくり返さないでよ」","en":"“But don't knock over the food today.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アウロラ・フェルナンデス","displayName":"Aurora Fernandes","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r70","rowIndex":70,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　顔を合わせてそうそう<tips=36>アウロラ</tips>がそんな風にからかうので、僕は思わずむっとする。","en":"<tips=36>Aurora</tips> began teasing me the moment we met, and I could not help bristling.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r71","rowIndex":71,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あら怒らないで。私<tips=2>阿亮</tips>のこと大好きよ」","en":"“Oh, don't be angry. I love you, <tips=2>Ah Leung</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アウロラ・フェルナンデス","displayName":"Aurora Fernandes","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r72","rowIndex":72,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして僕の手を握ろうとしたので、","en":"Then, when she tried to take my hand—","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r73","rowIndex":73,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「やっぱり僕はきみのことが苦手だな」","en":"“I really don't know how to deal with you.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r74","rowIndex":74,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その手を振り払うと、<tips=36>アウロラ</tips>は可笑しそうに笑う。","en":"I brushed her hand away, and <tips=36>Aurora</tips> laughed, plainly amused.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r75","rowIndex":75,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　派手で社交家の長女<tips=36>アウロラ</tips>。","en":"The flamboyant, sociable eldest sister, <tips=36>Aurora</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r76","rowIndex":76,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　皮肉屋で気むずかしい次女の<tips=37>アナ・クララ</tips>。","en":"The sardonic, difficult second sister, <tips=37>Ana Clara</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r77","rowIndex":77,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　控えめで大人しい三女の<tips=38>リタ</tips>。","en":"The reserved, quiet youngest sister, <tips=38>Rita</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r78","rowIndex":78,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　三人姉妹を簡単に説明すればそのようになる。","en":"That was the simplest way to describe the three sisters.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r79","rowIndex":79,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=24>美美</tips>、結婚おめでとう。式は出席出来なくてごめんなさい。どうしても行けない用事があったの」","en":"“Congratulations on your marriage, <tips=24>Meimei</tips>. I’m sorry I couldn’t attend the wedding. There was something I absolutely could not miss.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アナ・クララ","displayName":"Ana Clara","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r80","rowIndex":80,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=37>アナ・クララ</tips>は僕と<tips=36>アウロラ</tips>のやりとりを尻目に、主催者にそう挨拶をした。","en":"Ignoring the exchange between <tips=36>Aurora</tips> and me, <tips=37>Ana Clara</tips> offered her greeting to our hostess.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r81","rowIndex":81,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ありがとう。式のことは気にしなくていいのよ。こうして会いに来てくれたんだから」","en":"“Thank you. Don’t worry about the wedding. You came to see me now, and that’s enough.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬美美ベールなし","displayName":"Ma Meimei (Without Veil)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r82","rowIndex":82,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=24>美美</tips>はにこやかにそう返す。","en":"<tips=24>Meimei</tips> answered with a warm smile.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r83","rowIndex":83,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そう言ってくれれば助かるわ。でも、私たちのうちであなたが最初に結婚するなんてびっくり。男の子っぽくて、さばさばしてて、一番そんな風じゃなかったのに。しかも結婚前に子供まで出来ちゃうなんて」","en":"“That’s a relief. But I still can’t believe you were the first of us to get married. You were such a tomboy, so no-nonsense—the last person I ever expected. And then you even got pregnant before the wedding.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アナ・クララ","displayName":"Ana Clara","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r84","rowIndex":84,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そう？」","en":"“Really?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬美美ベールなし","displayName":"Ma Meimei (Without Veil)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r85","rowIndex":85,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=24>美美</tips>ははにかんで肩をすくめる。","en":"<tips=24>Meimei</tips> gave a bashful shrug.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r86","rowIndex":86,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「本当にびっくりよ。……<tips=2>阿亮</tips>、元気だった？」","en":"“It really was a surprise. ...How have you been, <tips=2>Ah Leung</tips>?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アナ・クララ","displayName":"Ana Clara","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r87","rowIndex":87,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=37>アナ・クララ</tips>は次は僕にそう話しかける。","en":"<tips=37>Ana Clara</tips> addressed me next.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r88","rowIndex":88,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まあね」","en":"“Well enough.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r89","rowIndex":89,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「学生生活は楽しいでしょ？　私も、もっと長くいたかったわ。<tips=35>ジョゼ・フェルナンデス</tips>の娘じゃない、私自身として生きられたのってあのときだけ。ああいうのが青春だったのかしら」","en":"“Student life must be wonderful. I wish I could have stayed longer. That was the only time I ever got to live as myself, not as <tips=35>José Fernandes’s</tips> daughter. I wonder if that was what youth is.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アナ・クララ","displayName":"Ana Clara","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r90","rowIndex":90,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　去年大学を卒業した<tips=37>アナ・クララ</tips>はそう言って溜息をつく。","en":"<tips=37>Ana Clara</tips>, who had graduated from university the year before, sighed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r91","rowIndex":91,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そう言えば、<tips=36>アウロラ</tips>と<tips=37>アナ・クララ</tips>も大学時代は<tips=2>阿亮</tips>みたいにマンション暮らしをしてたんだよね」","en":"“Come to think of it, <tips=36>Aurora</tips> and <tips=37>Ana Clara</tips> also lived in an apartment like <tips=2>Ah Leung</tips> when they were at university, didn't they?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r92","rowIndex":92,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=28>トミー</tips>が言うと、<tips=37>アナ・クララ</tips>は頷き、","en":"At <tips=28>Tommy’s</tips> question, <tips=37>Ana Clara</tips> nodded.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r93","rowIndex":93,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうだよ。お姉ちゃんと二人で暮らして、お姉ちゃんが卒業してからは一人で住んでた。こっちにいるといつも誰かしら近くに人がいるからね。とっても自由だったわ」","en":"“That's right. I lived with my sister, and after she graduated, I lived alone. Back here, there's always someone close by. I was so free there.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アナ・クララ","displayName":"Ana Clara","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r94","rowIndex":94,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして彼女は入り口の方にいる自分たちのボディーガードにそっと視線をやる。","en":"Then she cast a discreet glance toward their bodyguards by the entrance.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r95","rowIndex":95,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「へえ、楽しそうだなあ。僕も一回くらい一人で暮らしてみたいよ」","en":"“Wow, that sounds like fun. I’d like to try living alone at least once.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r96","rowIndex":96,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=28>トミー</tips>は心底羨ましそうに溜息をつく。","en":"<tips=28>Tommy</tips> gave a sigh of genuine envy.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r97","rowIndex":97,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　母親にアメリカにつれて行かれたり、父親に呼び戻されて<tips=9>Y地区</tips>に来たり、振り回された生活をしている彼には外からは見えないストレスもあるのだろう。","en":"His mother had taken him to America; his father had summoned him back to <tips=9>Y District</tips>. A life spent being pulled about by others had presumably placed him under pressures invisible from the outside.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r98","rowIndex":98,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「楽しかったよ。お父さんの教育方針らしいんだけど、普通の女子大生みたいな生活をしろってさ。ぼろくて古いマンションで、仕送りも最低限しかなかったんだ。自炊しないと電気代が払えなくなっちゃうくらい！　だからアルバイトだってしたんだよ」","en":"“It was fun. Apparently, it was Father’s idea of an education—he told us to live like ordinary college girls. Our apartment was old and run-down, and our allowance was the bare minimum. If we hadn’t cooked for ourselves, we wouldn’t even have been able to pay the electric bill! We even had part-time jobs.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アナ・クララ","displayName":"Ana Clara","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r99","rowIndex":99,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうなのよ。この子は家庭教師をしてたわ。私なんか、レストランで料理運んだりしてたのよ？　こうやって、お皿三枚片手で運べるんだから」","en":"“That’s right. This one was a tutor. I actually waited tables at a restaurant, you know? Look—I can carry three plates in one hand.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アウロラ・フェルナンデス","displayName":"Aurora Fernandes","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r100","rowIndex":100,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=36>アウロラ</tips>が皿を運ぶ仕草をやってみせると、<tips=28>トミー</tips>は感心して頷く。","en":"<tips=36>Aurora</tips> demonstrated how she had carried the plates, and <tips=28>Tommy</tips> nodded with admiration.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r101","rowIndex":101,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「すごいねえ。二人が働いてるところなんて想像出来ないや」","en":"“Wow. I can’t even imagine the two of you working.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r102","rowIndex":102,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「私たち意外と働きものなのよ？　家のことだって、分担してやってるんだもの。テーブルを拭いたり、床を磨いたりね。お父さんだって当番の日はやるわ。自分でバケツに水を汲んで、雑巾でゴシゴシ擦るのよ。家に住まわせてる若い人と一緒に汗だくになってね。そういうことをしないと人間は駄目になるって、昔からそうだったんだから」","en":"“We work harder than you’d think, you know. We split up the housework too—wiping tables, polishing floors. Even Father takes his turn on his assigned day. He fills a bucket himself and scrubs away with a rag, working up a sweat alongside the young people he has living with us. He’s always done it. He says people are no good if they never do that kind of work.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アウロラ・フェルナンデス","displayName":"Aurora Fernandes","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r103","rowIndex":103,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうなんだ！　長いつき合いなのに、そんなのはじめて聞いたよ。うちでは全部お手伝いさんがやってくれてるのに。なんだか尊敬しちゃうなあ」","en":"“Really? We’ve known each other so long, and this is the first I’ve heard of it. At our house, the servants do everything for us. I have a whole new respect for you.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r104","rowIndex":104,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=28>トミー</tips>は目を丸くして驚く。","en":"<tips=28>Tommy’s</tips> eyes widened in surprise.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r105","rowIndex":105,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=2>阿亮</tips>だって子供の時はレストランに預けられてたから、掃除でも料理でもなんでも出来るんでしょ？　何にも出来ないのが僕だけだと思うと、なんだか情けないよ。……ねえ、<tips=29>アイス</tips>は料理が出来る？」","en":"“<tips=2>Ah Leung</tips> was looked after at a restaurant when he was little, so he can cook, clean, and do everything else, right? It makes me feel pathetic to think I’m the only one who can’t do anything. ...<tips=29>Ice</tips>, can you cook?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r106","rowIndex":106,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　急に話題をふられた<tips=29>アイス</tips>は、周囲に視線をやってこの場で自分が発言すべきかどうか若干迷いを見せてから、","en":"The abrupt question caught <tips=29>Ice</tips> unprepared. She looked at the people around her and hesitated over whether it was her place to speak.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r107","rowIndex":107,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ええ、まあ、一通りは……」","en":"“Yes, well... I know the basics...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アイス","displayName":"Ice","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r108","rowIndex":108,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　控えめな声でそう言った。","en":"She spoke in a subdued voice.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r109","rowIndex":109,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうかあ！　じゃあ今度屋敷でも何か作ってくれるかい？」","en":"“You can! Then would you cook something for me at the estate sometime?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r110","rowIndex":110,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……シェフの料理の方が良いかと……」","en":"“...I think you would prefer the chef's cooking...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アイス","displayName":"Ice","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r111","rowIndex":111,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いいんだよ。僕は、きみがどんな料理を食べて育ったか知りたいんだ」","en":"“I don’t mind. I want to know what kind of food you grew up eating.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r112","rowIndex":112,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=28>トミー</tips>は<tips=29>アイス</tips>の手を両手で握って真顔で頼む。","en":"<tips=28>Tommy</tips> took both of <tips=29>Ice’s</tips> hands in his own and made the request with perfect seriousness.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r113","rowIndex":113,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どうしてもとおっしゃるなら……」","en":"“If you truly insist...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アイス","displayName":"Ice","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r114","rowIndex":114,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「お願い。僕はきみのことならすべてを知りたいといつも考えているって忘れないで」","en":"“Please. Don’t forget that I always want to know everything about you.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r115","rowIndex":115,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=28>トーマス</tips>様……」","en":"“<tips=28>Master Thomas</tips>...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アイス","displayName":"Ice","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r116","rowIndex":116,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=29>アイス</tips>は戸惑いながら視線を返し、そして二人は見つめ合う。","en":"<tips=29>Ice</tips> looked back at him uncertainly, and their eyes met.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r117","rowIndex":117,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕は二人の人目をはばからないやりとりに若干戸惑いを感じたが、<tips=36>アウロラ</tips>などが気にせずに<tips=24>美美</tips>と雑談などをはじめたところを見ると、今回が特別だということでもなく、いつものことなのだろう。","en":"Their exchange, conducted without the slightest regard for the people watching, left me somewhat disconcerted. <tips=36>Aurora</tips> and the others ignored it and began chatting with <tips=24>Meimei</tips>, however. Evidently, this was nothing exceptional, but a regular occurrence.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r118","rowIndex":118,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　親たちの間では色々とあるが、子の世代は年も近く、幼い頃からの知り合いで、性格的にも穏やかなものが多いから割合仲が良い。こうしていれば<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>幹部の子息たちの会合には見えないだろう。","en":"There were all manner of complications among their parents. The children, by contrast, were close in age, had known one another since childhood, and were mostly mild by nature. As a result, they got along reasonably well. Seen like this, they hardly looked like a gathering of the children of <tips=7>YS</tips> executives.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r119","rowIndex":119,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「このパーティはしょっちゅうやっているの？」","en":"“Do you have gatherings like this often?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r120","rowIndex":120,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「さ、最近は、月に一度くらいはやっています……」","en":"“R-recently, we've been holding one about once a month...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"リタ・フェルナンデス","displayName":"Rita Fernandes","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r121","rowIndex":121,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　雑談に交じれないでぽつんと突っ立っていた<tips=38>リタ</tips>に聞いてみると、彼女はそう答えた。","en":"<tips=38>Rita</tips> had been standing alone, unable to enter the conversation. When I asked her, she gave that answer.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r122","rowIndex":122,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いつもこのメンツで？」","en":"“Always with this group?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r123","rowIndex":123,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「普段はもっといます。<tips=24>美美</tips>さんのお友だちの方とか、お姉ちゃんのお友だちとか、色んな人がいらして……<tips=39>ウォン</tips>さんのところのご姉妹とか、ボネットさんのところのサウル君とかも前はよく来ていました。サウル君はとにかく女性にちょっかいをかけるので、出入禁止になってしまいましたが……」","en":"“There are usually more people. Friends of <tips=24>Meimei</tips>, friends of my sisters—all sorts of people come... The sisters from the <tips=39>Wong</tips> family and Saul from the Bonetto family used to come quite often too. But Saul wouldn’t stop hitting on the women, so he ended up being banned...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"リタ・フェルナンデス","displayName":"Rita Fernandes","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r124","rowIndex":124,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　カジノ王<tips=34>ダリオ・ボネット</tips>の息子のサウルも参加していたというのは意外だった。","en":"I was surprised that Saul, the son of casino king <tips=34>Dario Bonetto</tips>, had attended these gatherings.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r125","rowIndex":125,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ボネット・ファミリーと<tips=4>馬明</tips>は特別仲が悪いというわけでもないが、同じ<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>でもほとんど接点のない関係である。","en":"The Bonetto Family and <tips=4>Ma Ming</tips> were not particularly hostile to each other, but despite belonging to the same <tips=7>YS</tips>, they otherwise had very little to do with one another.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r126","rowIndex":126,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「今は微妙な時期だし、僕も来るからメンバーを絞ったのかな？」","en":"“It’s a delicate time, and she knew I was coming. Maybe that’s why she kept the guest list small?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r127","rowIndex":127,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「すみません。それは私にもわかりません」","en":"“I’m sorry. I don’t know either.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"リタ・フェルナンデス","displayName":"Rita Fernandes","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r128","rowIndex":128,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=38>リタ</tips>は首を左右に振る。","en":"<tips=38>Rita</tips> shook her head.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r129","rowIndex":129,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「でも、いいことだと思います。私たちの世代がこうやって交流を深めていければ、この先のことに何か良い影響があるかもしれないですし……」","en":"“But I do think these gatherings are a good thing. If our generation can keep deepening our ties like this, perhaps it might have some positive effect on what lies ahead...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"リタ・フェルナンデス","displayName":"Rita Fernandes","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r130","rowIndex":130,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女の口からそういった言葉が飛び出るとは思っていなかったので、思わずその顔をまじまじと見つめてしまった。","en":"I had never expected such words from her, and I found myself studying her face.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r131","rowIndex":131,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あら、二人きりで何をこそこそ話し合ってるの？」","en":"“My, what are you two whispering about all alone?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アナ・クララ","displayName":"Ana Clara","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r132","rowIndex":132,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　振り返ると、目の前にはいつのまにか<tips=37>アナ・クララ</tips>が立っている。","en":"I turned. Somehow, <tips=37>Ana Clara</tips> was standing right in front of us.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r133","rowIndex":133,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　冷静そうな顔をしているが、その頬は、既にアルコールで赤くなりはじめていた。","en":"She looked perfectly composed, but alcohol had already begun to redden her cheeks.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r134","rowIndex":134,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「こっちに来て、みんなで話しましょうよ。<tips=2>阿亮</tips>がいるなんて滅多にないんだから、たくさん話してもらうわ」","en":"“Come over and talk with everyone. We hardly ever have <tips=2>Ah Leung</tips> here, so we’re going to get plenty out of him.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アナ・クララ","displayName":"Ana Clara","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r135","rowIndex":135,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そう言って、僕の袖を掴むとぐいと引っ張る。","en":"She seized my sleeve and pulled hard.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r136","rowIndex":136,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　この次女も、長女に劣らず酒癖が悪いのだ。","en":"The second sister was every bit as bad a drunk as the eldest.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r137","rowIndex":137,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕は酔って今日一日を台無しにするつもりもなかったので、最初の食前酒を飲んだ他にはいくら勧められてもアルコールに手を付けずに過ごした。","en":"I had no intention of growing drunk and ruining the entire day. After my first aperitif, I refused every offer and passed the afternoon without touching any more alcohol.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r138","rowIndex":138,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=36>アウロラ</tips>と<tips=24>美美</tips>がよく喋り、時々<tips=37>アナ・クララ</tips>が二人の話を混ぜっ返す。<tips=28>トミー</tips>は自分からはほとんど喋らずに、彼女たちの会話にあわせて笑い、時々傍らの<tips=29>アイス</tips>に耳打ちして何かを説明した。<tips=29>アイス</tips>自身はほとんど何も喋らず、ぴったり<tips=28>トミー</tips>の側に付き従っている。<tips=38>リタ</tips>も黙って、姉たちの会話を眺めている。","en":"<tips=36>Aurora</tips> and <tips=24>Meimei</tips> did most of the talking, with <tips=37>Ana Clara</tips> occasionally cutting in to stir things up. <tips=28>Tommy</tips> seldom spoke on his own; he laughed along with the women and sometimes whispered an explanation to <tips=29>Ice</tips> beside him. <tips=29>Ice</tips> herself said almost nothing and stayed close by <tips=28>Tommy's</tips> side. <tips=38>Rita</tips> too remained silent, watching her sisters converse.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r139","rowIndex":139,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　話は<tips=36>アウロラ</tips>の趣味のヴァイオリン演奏の話や、<tips=24>美美</tips>の新婚生活などについてのやくたいもない世間話ばかりだった。","en":"They discussed nothing but idle topics: <tips=36>Aurora's</tips> violin playing, <tips=24>Meimei's</tips> newlywed life, and the like.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r140","rowIndex":140,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　黙っていると彼女たちのペースに巻き込まれて、世間話につき合わされてしまう。しかも僕は年下の部類に入るから、変なからかわれかたをしてばかりだ。","en":"If I sat there quietly, they swept me along at their pace and made me join in their small talk. Worse, I was one of the younger people there, so they kept finding bizarre ways to tease me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r141","rowIndex":141,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　いやになって無理矢理<tips=28>トミー</tips>を相手にチェスを指し始めたのだけれど、女どもはお構いなく話しかけてくる。","en":"At last I tired of it and forced <tips=28>Tommy</tips> into a game of chess, but the women continued addressing me as though nothing had changed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r142","rowIndex":142,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ねえ<tips=2>阿亮</tips>。あのゴミ屋のお嬢様と別れて、私と結婚する気ない？　私に求婚してくるのはオジサンばっかりでうんざり」","en":"“Say, <tips=2>Ah Leung</tips>. Why don’t you leave that garbage man’s daughter and marry me? I’m sick of getting proposals from nothing but old men.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アウロラ・フェルナンデス","displayName":"Aurora Fernandes","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r143","rowIndex":143,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　と<tips=36>アウロラ</tips>が僕の腕をとり、その大きな胸を押しつけてくる。","en":"As she spoke, <tips=36>Aurora</tips> took my arm and pressed her ample breasts against it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r144","rowIndex":144,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それがいいわ！　そうしたら、<tips=75>フェルナンデス・ファミリー</tips>と一緒になって、<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>の未来も安泰よ。ツェーおじさんもきっと喜ぶわ」","en":"“What a wonderful idea! Then you could unite with the <tips=75>Fernandes Family</tips> and secure the future of <tips=7>YS</tips>. Uncle Tse would surely be delighted.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬美美ベールなし","displayName":"Ma Meimei (Without Veil)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r145","rowIndex":145,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　妊娠中のために酒など口にしていないはずの<tips=24>美美</tips>が妙に浮かれた調子で同調する。","en":"<tips=24>Meimei</tips>, who could hardly have been drinking while pregnant, chimed in in a strangely giddy tone.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r146","rowIndex":146,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕は無視をして、盤上のナイトを動かす。<tips=28>トミー</tips>は頭を抱えている。","en":"I ignored them and moved a knight across the board. <tips=28>Tommy</tips> clutched his head.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r147","rowIndex":147,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼はそれなりに自信があったらしいが、もうはじめの頃の余裕はなくなっていた。彼のクイーンはすでに退場し、キングを守るのはルークとビショップ一個ずつである。","en":"He had apparently been fairly confident, but all his early composure was now gone. His queen was already off the board, and his king was defended by a single rook and bishop.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r148","rowIndex":148,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「姉さんやめときなよ。冗談でもそんなこと言うと、<tips=38>リタ</tips>が怒るわよ」","en":"“Knock it off, sis. Even as a joke, talk like that will make <tips=38>Rita</tips> angry.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アナ・クララ","displayName":"Ana Clara","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r149","rowIndex":149,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=37>アナ・クララ</tips>がたしなめると、","en":"When <tips=37>Ana Clara</tips> chided her,","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r150","rowIndex":150,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ちっ、違います！」","en":"“Th-that’s not true!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"リタ・フェルナンデス","displayName":"Rita Fernandes","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r151","rowIndex":151,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=38>リタ</tips>が真っ赤になって否定する。","en":"<tips=38>Rita</tips> turned scarlet as she denied it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r152","rowIndex":152,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　一体、何の話をしているのやら。","en":"What in the world were they talking about?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r153","rowIndex":153,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女たちは何やらわいわいと騒ぎながら料理のテーブルの方へ揃って歩いて行く。","en":"The women all walked off toward the food table together, still chattering excitedly about something.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r154","rowIndex":154,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なんだかめちゃくちゃ疲れる。<tips=28>トミー</tips>は毎回こんなのに参加しているの？」","en":"“This is exhausting. Do you come to these every time, <tips=28>Tommy</tips>?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r155","rowIndex":155,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕が溜息をつくと、彼はルークに手を伸ばしながら、","en":"I sighed. He reached toward a rook as he answered,","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r156","rowIndex":156,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうだよ。みんな賑やかで明るくてとても楽しい」","en":"“I do. Everyone’s so cheerful and lively. It’s a lot of fun.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r157","rowIndex":157,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　言ってから、またルークから手を放した。迷っているようだ。","en":"Then he took his hand away from the rook. He seemed uncertain.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r158","rowIndex":158,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「賑やかすぎるんじゃないか？」","en":"“Aren’t they a little too lively?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r159","rowIndex":159,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「僕は楽しいよ。息抜きになる。屋敷にいると息が詰まって仕方がないんだ。父さんはやたらと僕に仕事のための勉強をさせようとするし、部下の人たちはみんなぴりぴりしてるし……」","en":"“I'm having fun. It gives me a chance to breathe. Being at the estate is so stifling I can hardly bear it. Father is always making me study for the business, and all his men are perpetually on edge...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r160","rowIndex":160,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=28>トミー</tips>は肩をすくめる。そして溜息をつくと、チェス盤を覗き込むようにしていた上体を起こし、ドリンクに手を付ける。","en":"<tips=28>Tommy</tips> shrugged. With a sigh, he straightened up from where he had been leaning over the chessboard and reached for his drink.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r161","rowIndex":161,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どうも、敗戦濃厚だな。ちょっと休憩だ」","en":"“This is looking pretty hopeless. I need a short break.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r162","rowIndex":162,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「降参するかい？」","en":"“Are you resigning?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r163","rowIndex":163,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いや」","en":"“No.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r164","rowIndex":164,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=28>トミー</tips>は首を横に振ると、","en":"<tips=28>Tommy</tips> shook his head.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r165","rowIndex":165,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「父さんは僕を立派な跡継ぎにしたいみたいなんだけど、正直僕には荷が重いよね。多分<tips=2>阿亮</tips>と比べてるんだと思う。でも僕に<tips=2>阿亮</tips>みたいに出来るようになれって言ったって土台無理な話なんだよ。僕には特別な才能はなんにもないんだ」","en":"“Father seems to want to make a proper heir of me, but honestly, it’s too much for me. I suppose he’s comparing me to <tips=2>Ah Leung</tips>. But telling me to do everything the way <tips=2>Ah Leung</tips> does is impossible from the start. I don’t have any special gifts.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r166","rowIndex":166,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=28>トミー</tips>は言葉の割には卑屈な様子もなく、いたって自然な調子だ。","en":"For all that, <tips=28>Tommy</tips> did not sound self-deprecating in the least. He said it as naturally as anything.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r167","rowIndex":167,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　確かに彼はあまりにも人柄がおっとりとしていて、父の<tips=27>廖志明</tips>のように部下や仲間を統率して物事を成すというタイプではないだろう。それを自分のようなギャングにしようとしつけている<tips=27>廖</tips>という人物が、僕にとっては何やらおかしく感じられる。","en":"He was certainly too easygoing to be a man who commanded subordinates and allies to accomplish his designs, as his father <tips=27>Liao Chi-ming</tips> did. It struck me as oddly absurd that <tips=27>Liao</tips> would try to mold a son like this into a gangster after his own image.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r168","rowIndex":168,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「きみのお父さんは相当怜悧な人だと思うけれど、息子に対しては目が曇るというか、期待しすぎているというか、溺愛しているんだねえ」","en":"“Your father strikes me as an exceptionally shrewd man, but when it comes to his son, perhaps his judgment gets clouded—or perhaps he simply expects too much. He really does dote on you.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r169","rowIndex":169,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕が素直に感心すると、","en":"I said it in genuine admiration.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r170","rowIndex":170,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あはは、確かに期待はされているね！　応えることは全然出来ていないけれど」","en":"“Ahaha, he certainly has high hopes for me! I haven’t lived up to any of them, though.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r171","rowIndex":171,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……あの<tips=29>アイス</tips>ってのは、どういう人なんだ？　本人はきみのボディーガードって言ってたけれど」","en":"“...Who is this <tips=29>Ice</tips>, anyway? She said herself that she's your bodyguard.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r172","rowIndex":172,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕は、二人で話しているのがよほど気になるのか、遠くからチラチラとこちらに視線を向けている<tips=29>アイス</tips>について尋ねた。","en":"I asked about <tips=29>Ice</tips>, who kept glancing over at us from across the room, apparently unable to stop wondering what the two of us were discussing.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r173","rowIndex":173,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「彼女はああ言っていたし、そういうことになっているけれど、それはただの建前だよ。僕のことを守れなんて一言も言ったことがないし、そんな危ないことはして欲しくない。僕にとってはもっと大事な存在で……あの、とても素晴らしい女性なんだ」","en":"“That’s what she said, and that’s the arrangement, but it’s really just for appearances. I’ve never once told her to protect me, and I don’t want her doing anything so dangerous. To me, she’s someone much more important than that... um, she’s a truly wonderful woman.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r174","rowIndex":174,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=28>トミー</tips>は目をきらきらさせてそう言った。","en":"<tips=28>Tommy’s</tips> eyes shone as he spoke.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r175","rowIndex":175,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　素直な人間で、その話題になった途端に表情がぱっと輝くのを見れば彼が<tips=29>アイス</tips>に対してどう思っているのか口にせずともわかる。","en":"He was an open, guileless man. The way his expression lit the moment the subject arose made his feelings for <tips=29>Ice</tips> obvious without any declaration.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r176","rowIndex":176,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「お父さんは何て言ってる？」","en":"“What does your father say?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r177","rowIndex":177,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「必要以上に親しくするなって言ってるけど……」","en":"“He tells me not to get any closer to her than necessary...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r178","rowIndex":178,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そうだろう。","en":"Of course he did.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r179","rowIndex":179,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　あのやけどの痕と、特有の雰囲気から察するに、あまり素性の良い人間だとは思えない。","en":"Judging solely from the burn scars and her peculiar air, she did not seem to come from a particularly respectable background.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r180","rowIndex":180,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「でも、何と言われても、これだけは従えないな。たとえ父さんだろうとね」","en":"“But no matter what he says, this is the one thing I can’t obey him on. Even if he is my father.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r181","rowIndex":181,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=28>トミー</tips>は笑いながらそう言った。","en":"<tips=28>Tommy</tips> said it with a smile.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r182","rowIndex":182,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「立派なもんだね」","en":"“How admirable.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r183","rowIndex":183,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕の言葉は皮肉ではなかったが、皮肉と受け取られても仕方ないような言い方だった。","en":"I was not being sarcastic, though no one could have been blamed for hearing sarcasm in my tone.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r184","rowIndex":184,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　が、<tips=28>トミー</tips>は別に悪く取ったりはしないだろう。","en":"<tips=28>Tommy</tips>, however, was unlikely to take it the wrong way.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r185","rowIndex":185,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そういえば」","en":"“That reminds me.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r186","rowIndex":186,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼はふと話題を変える。","en":"He changed the subject without warning.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r187","rowIndex":187,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=2>阿亮</tips>は、こないだ言われたように、お父さんのあとを継いで<tips=81>龍頭</tips>になるの？」","en":"“Are you going to do as he asked the other day, <tips=2>Ah Leung</tips>—succeed your father and become <tips=81>Longtou</tips>?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r188","rowIndex":188,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　今の僕の立場では、<tips=27>廖志明</tips>の息子である<tips=28>トミー</tips>に対してはどちらとも答えようのない質問だったが、本人は繊細な部分に触れる質問をした自覚がないらしい。","en":"Given my present position, this was not a question I could answer either way before the son of <tips=27>Liao Chi-ming</tips>. <tips=28>Tommy</tips> himself appeared unaware that he had touched upon anything sensitive.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r189","rowIndex":189,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「是非そうすべきだよ。あの時の<tips=81>龍頭</tips>の顔は、とても真剣だった。心底<tips=2>阿亮</tips>に自分の事業を引き継いで欲しいんだよ。もし<tips=2>阿亮</tips>がうんと言えば、とても喜ぶと思うし、病気と戦うはげみにもなる」","en":"“You really should. The <tips=81>Longtou</tips> looked completely serious that day. From the bottom of his heart, he wants <tips=2>Ah Leung</tips> to take over his work. If <tips=2>Ah Leung</tips> said yes, I think it would make him very happy—and give him strength to fight his illness.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r190","rowIndex":190,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕の気持ちは決まっていたが、こたえず、グラスの炭酸水を飲んだ。","en":"My mind was settled, but I did not answer. I drank from my glass of sparkling water.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r191","rowIndex":191,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「僕は賛成だよ。きっと、<tips=36>アウロラ</tips>たちも賛成してくれるし、協力もしてくれると思う。僕らは子供の時からずっと、頭の良い<tips=2>阿亮</tips>が<tips=81>龍頭</tips>になって、組織を守ってくれるって信じてるんだから」","en":"“I'm for it. I'm sure <tips=36>Aurora</tips> and the others will agree and help as well. Ever since we were children, we've believed that clever <tips=2>Ah Leung</tips> would become <tips=81>Longtou</tips> and protect the organization for us.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r192","rowIndex":192,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ありがとう」","en":"“Thank you.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r193","rowIndex":193,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　と僕が言ったのは、ごく単純に彼の優しい言葉に対する感謝の気持ちだった。","en":"I meant nothing more than simple gratitude for his kind words.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r194","rowIndex":194,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……よし、やっと手が決まったぞ。これはどうだ？」","en":"“...Good, I've finally chosen my move. What do you say to this?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r195","rowIndex":195,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=28>トミー</tips>は自信満々にビショップを動かして僕のナイトを取ったが、それが悪手で、それから三手後には彼のキングは詰まされることとなった。","en":"With perfect confidence, <tips=28>Tommy</tips> moved his bishop and took my knight. It was a bad move. Three moves later, his king was checkmated.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r196","rowIndex":196,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　思ったよりも楽しい会合だったかもしれない。","en":"Perhaps I had enjoyed the gathering more than I expected.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r197","rowIndex":197,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕の少年時代は彼らよりもむしろ街の連中とのつき合いの方が深い。彼らと会うのは、何か<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>の会合のようなお仕着せの場面でが多かったが、それでも僕らが物心つく前からの幼なじみであり、<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>幹部のジュニア世代だという共通した立場は、他の人間とは共有出来ないものだ。","en":"As a boy, I had been closer to the people of the streets than to them. Most of our meetings had been obligatory occasions resembling <tips=7>YS</tips> functions. Even so, we had known one another since before any of us could remember, and our shared position as the junior generation of <tips=7>YS</tips> officers was a bond we had with no one else.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r198","rowIndex":198,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして、子供の頃からの知人と、大人になってからまた話すと、人間というものはさほどかわらないということも実感させられる。<tips=36>アウロラ</tips>は幼い頃からおしゃまだし、<tips=37>アナ・クララ</tips>は理屈っぽく、<tips=38>リタ</tips>は二人の姉の影にいつも隠れている。<tips=28>トミー</tips>は少し抜けていて、<tips=24>美美</tips>はいつでも僕の姉気取りだ。きっと彼らも、僕のことを子供の頃の姿と重ねて見ているのだろう。","en":"Talking again as adults with people I had known as a child also made me realize how little people really changed. <tips=36>Aurora</tips> had been precocious from an early age; <tips=37>Ana Clara</tips> argumentative; <tips=38>Rita</tips> forever hiding in the shadow of her two sisters. <tips=28>Tommy</tips> had always been a little clueless, and <tips=24>Meimei</tips> was forever playing at being my big sister. They must have looked at me and seen the boy I used to be, too.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r199","rowIndex":199,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　だからお互いに子供に戻ったように話すことが出来る。それぞれ大人としての悩みを隠しているにしろ。","en":"That allowed us to speak as though we had all become children again, even if each of us concealed the troubles of adulthood.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r200","rowIndex":200,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　宴はこれからというところだったが、僕は不意に目眩を覚え、意識がじわじわと闇に浸食されてゆくのを感じた。例の発作が始まろうとしているのだ。","en":"The party was only beginning in earnest when a sudden wave of dizziness passed through me and I felt darkness gradually invade my consciousness. One of the familiar episodes was about to begin.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r201","rowIndex":201,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「悪いけど、すごく眠くなった。少し昼寝をさせてもらうよ」","en":"“Sorry, but I’ve suddenly gotten incredibly sleepy. I’m going to lie down for a little while.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r202","rowIndex":202,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「えー、なんで急に？　まだちょっとお話しましょ」","en":"“Aww, why all of a sudden? Stay and chat a little longer.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アウロラ・フェルナンデス","displayName":"Aurora Fernandes","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r203","rowIndex":203,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=36>アウロラ</tips>が僕の腕を掴もうとすると、","en":"<tips=36>Aurora</tips> tried to seize my arm.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r204","rowIndex":204,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まあまあ、休ませてあげなよ。<tips=2>阿亮</tips>も色々あって疲れてるんだから」","en":"“Now, now, let <tips=2>Ah Leung</tips> rest. He's been through all sorts of things and he's tired.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬美美ベールなし","displayName":"Ma Meimei (Without Veil)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r205","rowIndex":205,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕の体質を知っている<tips=24>美美</tips>がそう割り込んで、なおも食い下がろうとするアウロラを引きはがすと、目配せをくれる。","en":"<tips=24>Meimei</tips>, who knew about my condition, cut in and pulled Aurora away when she continued to protest. Then she gave me a knowing look.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r206","rowIndex":206,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕は有り難く目配せを返し、別室のソファーに倒れ込んだ。","en":"I returned the look gratefully and collapsed onto a sofa in another room.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r207","rowIndex":207,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そこで僕は夢を見た。はっきりとは覚えていないが、なんだかとても寂しい夢だ。","en":"There, I had a dream. I couldn’t remember it clearly, but it was somehow a terribly lonely one.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r208","rowIndex":208,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　目を覚ますと１５時。丁度宴が終わろうとする時刻だった。","en":"When I woke, it was three in the afternoon, precisely when the party was drawing to a close.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r209","rowIndex":209,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=2>阿亮</tips>！」","en":"“<tips=2>Ah Leung</tips>!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アウロラ・フェルナンデス","displayName":"Aurora Fernandes","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r210","rowIndex":210,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　別れ際、迎えの車に乗り込もうというところで、<tips=36>アウロラ</tips>はドアに手をかけたまま僕を振り返る。","en":"As we parted, <tips=36>Aurora</tips> was about to climb into the car that had come for her. With one hand on the door, she looked back at me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r211","rowIndex":211,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あなたがこの街の次のボスよ！」","en":"“You are the next boss of this city!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アウロラ・フェルナンデス","displayName":"Aurora Fernandes","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r212","rowIndex":212,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　突然何を言うのかとその顔をじっと見つめると、<tips=36>アウロラ</tips>は意味ありげに笑い、そして車に乗り込んだ。","en":"I stared into her face, wondering what could have prompted the sudden declaration. <tips=36>Aurora</tips> gave me a meaningful smile and climbed into the car.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r213","rowIndex":213,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=54>汐さん</tips>と連絡がついたので、僕はホテルには戻らずにその足のまま汐家に向かった。","en":"I got in touch with <tips=54>Mr. Shio</tips>, so instead of returning to the hotel, I went straight to his house.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r214","rowIndex":214,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=55>松子</tips>が仕事で出払った静かな家で、<tips=54>汐さん</tips>は一人でグラスに注がれた琥珀色の液体を舐めている。傍らには、彼のお気に入りのテネシーウイスキーのボトルがあった。","en":"In the quiet house, with <tips=55>Matsuko</tips> away at work, <tips=54>Mr. Shio</tips> sat alone, sipping an amber liquid from a glass. Beside him stood a bottle of his favorite Tennessee whiskey.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r215","rowIndex":215,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「よくつまみも水もなくそんな強い酒を飲めるもんだね」","en":"“I don’t know how you drink liquor that strong without so much as a snack or any water.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r216","rowIndex":216,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕が呆れて言ったが、彼はそれには答えず、","en":"I said it in exasperation, but he ignored the remark.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r217","rowIndex":217,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=1>亮</tips>、服を着替えて手を洗え。地下室へ行くぞ」","en":"“<tips=1>Ryo</tips>, change your clothes and wash your hands. We're going to the basement.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r218","rowIndex":218,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　一方的に言って立ち上がった。","en":"He stood without waiting for an answer.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r219","rowIndex":219,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕は言われたとおり風呂場で清潔な服に着替え、アルコールで手指消毒を行ってから地下の実験室へ下りる。そこでは白衣を着た<tips=54>汐さん</tips>が机の上に例の虎の肉片の入ったシャーレを置き、傍らのモニターに映ったグラフを眺めていた。","en":"As instructed, I changed into clean clothes in the bathroom and disinfected my hands with alcohol before descending to the underground laboratory. <tips=54>Mr. Shio</tips> was there in a white coat. A petri dish containing the tiger tissue sat on the table, and he was studying a graph displayed on the monitor beside it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r220","rowIndex":220,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「見ろ」","en":"“Look.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r221","rowIndex":221,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　言われて僕はシャーレのなかをのぞき込む。生理食塩水で洗浄され、培養液に漬けられたその肉片は先日のように活発には動かない。","en":"At his instruction, I bent over the petri dish. Washed with saline and immersed in culture medium, the piece of tissue was no longer moving as actively as it had the other day.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r222","rowIndex":222,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なんだか弱ってるような気がするんだけど」","en":"“It seems weaker somehow.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r223","rowIndex":223,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ああ、反応がきわめて微弱になっている。ほら、こっちの画面を見ろ。良くないだろ？　このままだと、今日か、明日には活動を停止するだろうな」","en":"“Yes. The response has grown extremely faint. Look at this screen. It doesn't look good, does it? At this rate, it will cease activity today or tomorrow.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r224","rowIndex":224,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……コアの培養は失敗か。培養液がよくなかったのかな。それとも、僕らが知っているものとは根本的に違うのか……<tips=72>傾向値</tips>はいくつだったの？」","en":"“...So culturing the core has failed. Maybe the culture medium was wrong. Or perhaps it is fundamentally different from the things we know... What was its <tips=72>tendency value</tips>?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r225","rowIndex":225,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「２７００程度だな」","en":"“Approximately twenty-seven hundred.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r226","rowIndex":226,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕は口笛を吹き、","en":"I whistled.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r227","rowIndex":227,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ちょうどいいね」","en":"“Just right.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r228","rowIndex":228,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　血液を分析することで計測される<tips=17>タイプB</tips>の傾向値は、７００を越えれば<tips=95>金眼</tips>や発作といった症状が見られ、身体能力の向上もはっきりと認識されるため、このあたりが<tips=17>タイプB</tips>とノーマルの境目とされている。<tips=72>傾向値</tips>が全てではないけれども、数値が高ければ高いほどより<tips=17>タイプB</tips>としての特徴が顕著になり、一般的には１０００を越えれば女性でもノーマルの男性以上の身体能力を持つと言われ、１４００にもなればスポーツ選手として一流の成績を残せると言われていた。","en":"The <tips=17>Type B</tips> tendency value is measured through blood analysis. Above seven hundred, symptoms such as the <tips=95>golden-eye phenomenon</tips> and episodes appear, with a clearly perceptible increase in physical ability. That level is therefore conventionally treated as the boundary between <tips=17>Type B</tips> and Normal. Although the <tips=72>tendency value</tips> is not everything, the higher the number, the more pronounced a person’s <tips=17>Type B</tips> characteristics become. Generally, above one thousand even a woman is said to possess greater physical ability than a Normal man; at fourteen hundred, a person is said to be capable of first-rate athletic performance.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r229","rowIndex":229,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　２７００というのは、通常はまず見られない数値だ。何か特別に<tips=72>傾向値</tips>を高めでもしなければこういった個体は生まれない。いや、現在の技術ではそれでもここまでの数値を記録することは難しいだろう。","en":"A value of twenty-seven hundred was almost never seen under normal circumstances. A specimen like this could not arise without some special intervention to raise its <tips=72>tendency value</tips>. No—even with current technology, it would probably be difficult to record a value this high.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r230","rowIndex":230,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しかし、僕と<tips=54>汐さん</tips>にとっては初めて見る数字ではない。そして、こうした超高<tips=72>傾向値</tips>のサンプルを用いた実験も　”二回目”　になる。","en":"But this was not the first time either <tips=54>Mr. Shio</tips> or I had seen such a number. And it would be our “second” experiment using a sample with such an extremely high <tips=72>tendency value</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r231","rowIndex":231,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「何にしろ、もたもたしてはいられなさそうだ。さっさと始めよう」","en":"“Either way, it looks like we don’t have time to waste. Let’s get started.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r232","rowIndex":232,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それなら、酒なんか飲んでないで、僕が来るのを待たずにやってくれてても良かったのに」","en":"“Then you could've laid off the booze and started without waiting for me.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r233","rowIndex":233,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「お前がやらないと意味がないだろう？」","en":"“There would be no point unless you did it.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r234","rowIndex":234,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=54>汐さん</tips>はぶっきらぼうに言って、立ち上がる。","en":"<tips=54>Mr. Shio</tips> said it bluntly, then rose.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r235","rowIndex":235,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　地下の別室には金属の大きな棚があり、そこには透明なプラスチックのケージが並べられている。","en":"A separate room in the basement held a large metal rack lined with transparent plastic cages.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r236","rowIndex":236,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その小さなケージの中には今日届いたばかりの真っ白なネズミが一匹ずつ詰め込まれており、棚全体がカサカサと音を立てていた。","en":"A single pure-white mouse, freshly delivered that day, had been crammed into each tiny cage, and the entire rack rustled with their movement.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r237","rowIndex":237,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「マウスは何匹？」","en":"“How many mice?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r238","rowIndex":238,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「傾向値３００のノーマルが１０、<tips=72>傾向値</tips>９００の<tips=17>タイプB</tips>が１０で、計２０だ」","en":"“Ten Normal mice with a tendency value of three hundred, and ten <tips=17>Type Bs</tips> with a <tips=72>tendency value</tips> of nine hundred. Twenty in all.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐健慈朗","displayName":"Kenjiro Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r239","rowIndex":239,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そう」","en":"“I see.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r240","rowIndex":240,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「組織が小さいからな。これくらいが限度だろう。もっと大きく切断してくれればよかったんだが」","en":"“The tissue sample is small. This is probably the limit. I wish you'd cut off a larger piece.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐健慈朗","displayName":"Kenjiro Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r241","rowIndex":241,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「僕らは肉屋じゃないんだ。なかなか思うようにいかないよ。急いでいたしね」","en":"“We're not butchers. It wasn't easy to make the cut we wanted. And we were in a hurry.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r242","rowIndex":242,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まあ、これでやってみるしかない。……解析用に残せる分はあまりないな」","en":"“We'll just have to try with this. ...There won't be much left for analysis.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐健慈朗","displayName":"Kenjiro Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r243","rowIndex":243,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ほんのちょっと残せばいいよ。あとは食わせてしまおう」","en":"“We only need to save a tiny bit. Let's feed them the rest.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r244","rowIndex":244,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　これからこの二つの<tips=72>傾向値</tips>を持ったマウスをさらに二つのグループにわけ、そこに虎の死骸から持って来た肉片を餌として与える。","en":"We would take the mice at each of these two <tips=72>tendency values</tips>, divide them further into two groups, and feed them tissue taken from the tiger’s carcass.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r245","rowIndex":245,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　まず第一のグループは、ゲル状になった　”生きている”　組織を与え、そしてもう一つのグループには大きく切り取ってきたもう動かない塊から切り取った組織を与える。","en":"The first group would receive the gelatinous, “living” tissue; the other, tissue cut from the large inert mass we had removed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r246","rowIndex":246,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そうして、逐一<tips=72>傾向値</tips>を調べ、再生能力の有無を確かめるというのが今回の実験の概要である。","en":"We would then measure their <tips=72>tendency values</tips> at every stage and determine whether they possessed regenerative ability. That was the experiment in outline.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r247","rowIndex":247,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=17>タイプB</tips>の傾向値というものは、食物によって増加する。傾向値の高いものを摂取し続けると、食べた方の<tips=72>傾向値</tips>も上がり、一定限度をこえると<tips=17>タイプB</tips>としての特徴を有しはじめるのだ。","en":"<tips=17>Type B</tips> tendency values increase through diet. If a person keeps consuming food with a high value, the eater’s <tips=72>tendency value</tips> rises as well. Once it passes a certain threshold, that person begins to exhibit <tips=17>Type B</tips> traits.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r248","rowIndex":248,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そもそも、人間にこれほどまでに<tips=17>タイプB</tips>が誕生するようになったのも、食物が原因だった。","en":"In the first place, food was what had caused so many <tips=17>Type Bs</tips> to emerge among humans.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r249","rowIndex":249,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　まず最初にどこか特定地域の農産物がなんらかの理由で異常に高い<tips=72>傾向値</tips>を持ってしまい、そして、これが輸出されることによって世界の各国で大量の<tips=17>タイプB</tips>が発生したのだろうと言われている。","en":"It was believed that some agricultural product from a particular region had, for reasons unknown, first acquired an abnormally high <tips=72>tendency value</tips>, and that its export had then caused <tips=17>Type Bs</tips> to emerge in large numbers throughout the world.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r250","rowIndex":250,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして気がついた時には、世界中の人間や動物に膨大な<tips=72>タイプＢ傾向値</tips>が蓄積され、人類と<tips=17>タイプB</tips>を切り離すことは不可能な状態になっていた。","en":"By the time anyone realized what was happening, <tips=72>Type B tendency values</tips> had reached enormous levels in humans and animals around the world, making it impossible to separate humanity from <tips=17>Type B</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r251","rowIndex":251,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　発生源は今でも正確に特定することは出来ていないが、おそらくアジアの某国で生産された穀物だろうと推測されている。","en":"The original source still could not be identified precisely, but it was suspected to be grain produced in an unnamed Asian country.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r252","rowIndex":252,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=17>タイプB</tips>の大量発生は世界中で問題となり、現在では、まともな食卓からは<tips=72>タイプB傾向値</tips>の高いものが排除されているが、しかし一旦蓄積された<tips=72>タイプB傾向値</tips>というものは、子の代、孫の代にまで受け継がれる。","en":"The mass emergence of <tips=17>Type Bs</tips> became a worldwide problem. Today, foods with high <tips=72>Type B tendency values</tips> have been removed from ordinary diets. Once accumulated, however, a <tips=72>Type B tendency value</tips> is passed down to one's children and grandchildren.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r253","rowIndex":253,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　だから食事として新しく摂取しなくとも、親が<tips=17>タイプB</tips>ならば子が<tips=17>タイプB</tips>になる確率は高く、また子が<tips=17>タイプB</tips>でなくとも、孫や、その子が<tips=17>タイプB</tips>にならないという保証はない。","en":"Thus, even without fresh intake through food, a child of a <tips=17>Type B</tips> parent is highly likely to be <tips=17>Type B</tips>; and even if that child is not <tips=17>Type B</tips>, no one can guarantee that a grandchild or later descendant will not be <tips=17>Type B</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r254","rowIndex":254,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　このように、一度<tips=17>タイプB</tips>によって汚染された血はなかなか元には戻らず、これが<tips=17>タイプB</tips>発症者やその家族が差別を受けたり、結婚が出来なくなる理由の一つになっている。","en":"Thus, blood once contaminated by <tips=17>Type B</tips> did not readily return to its former state. This became one reason symptomatic <tips=17>Type Bs</tips> and their families suffered discrimination or found themselves unable to marry.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r255","rowIndex":255,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ちなみに、我が家の母親は<tips=17>タイプB</tips>であったから、同じ<tips=17>タイプB</tips>である妹の<tips=44>筱喬</tips>だけでなく、僕の<tips=72>傾向値</tips>もそれなりに高い。","en":"My own mother had been a <tips=17>Type B</tips>, so not only was my sister <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> a <tips=17>Type B</tips> as well, but my own <tips=72>tendency value</tips> was fairly high.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r256","rowIndex":256,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=44>筱喬</tips>は８００程度で、僕も５００は越えている。ノーマルでいられるギリギリの数値だ。","en":"<tips=44>Siu-kiu’s</tips> was approximately eight hundred; mine exceeded five hundred, barely low enough for me to remain Normal.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r257","rowIndex":257,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕くらいの<tips=72>傾向値</tips>でも発症する人はいるから、<tips=17>タイプB</tips>の世界に半分足を踏み入れていると言えるのかもしれない。","en":"Some people develop symptoms even at a <tips=72>tendency value</tips> like mine, so perhaps I already had one foot in the <tips=17>Type B</tips> world.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r258","rowIndex":258,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=72>傾向値</tips>の高いものを食べ続ければ僕もいつか<tips=17>タイプB</tips>になるだろう。","en":"If I kept eating things with high <tips=72>tendency values</tips>, I too would eventually become <tips=17>Type B</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r259","rowIndex":259,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　とにかく、<tips=17>タイプB</tips>というものは、汚染された何かを食べることで<tips=72>傾向値</tips>が高まるのだ。","en":"In short, when a <tips=17>Type B</tips> consumes something contaminated, their <tips=72>tendency value</tips> rises.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r260","rowIndex":260,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　だから、今回このマウスに<tips=72>傾向値</tips>２７００もある餌を与え続ければ、当然マウス自体の<tips=72>傾向値</tips>が高くなる。","en":"Naturally, if we kept feeding these mice tissue with a <tips=72>tendency value</tips> of twenty-seven hundred, the mice’s own <tips=72>tendency values</tips> would rise.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r261","rowIndex":261,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それ自体は明白な事実で、今回の実験にとってはさほど重要な部分ではない。","en":"That in itself was an obvious fact, and not a particularly important part of this experiment.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r262","rowIndex":262,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕らが確認したいのは、そうして<tips=72>傾向値</tips>が上がった結果、元の虎がそうであったように、傷がその場で治癒し、肉片になっても生き続けるような、異常な再生力が発現するかどうかという一点である。","en":"What we wanted to determine was one thing only: whether the resulting increase in <tips=72>tendency value</tips> would cause the same abnormal regenerative power the original tiger possessed to manifest—the ability to heal wounds on the spot and keep living even when reduced to pieces of flesh.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r263","rowIndex":263,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　一般的に<tips=17>タイプB</tips>は普通の人間よりも怪我や病気の治りがいい。しかし、世間によくある<tips=17>タイプB</tips>は、いくら<tips=72>傾向値</tips>が高くとも肉片のまま動いて生き続けるなどということはありえない。","en":"Generally, <tips=17>Type Bs</tips> recovered from injuries and illnesses more quickly than ordinary people. But no matter how high the <tips=72>tendency value</tips> of an ordinary <tips=17>Type B</tips> grew, its severed flesh could never continue moving and living on its own.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r264","rowIndex":264,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　この虎は、<tips=17>タイプB</tips>には違いないが、普通とは違う特別な<tips=17>タイプB</tips>なのだ。","en":"The tiger was unquestionably <tips=17>Type B</tips>, but it was a special <tips=17>Type B</tips>, unlike ordinary ones.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r265","rowIndex":265,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その非常識さは、ある意味<tips=16>タイプA</tips>の超能力に通じるものがある。","en":"In one sense, the sheer absurdity of it resembled the superhuman powers of <tips=16>Type A</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r266","rowIndex":266,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=17>タイプB</tips>は<tips=16>タイプA</tips>に比べればまだ手応えのある研究が行われているが、この『<tips=97>特殊タイプＢ</tips>』というものの存在は、世間ではまだ認知されていない。","en":"Research on <tips=17>Type B</tips> has at least yielded more concrete results than research on <tips=16>Type A</tips>. Yet the public still does not recognize the existence of these “<tips=97>special Type Bs</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r267","rowIndex":267,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ミュータントの研究はどこの機関でも最重要機密になっているから、どこかの秘密の研究施設ではもっと詳しいことが判明しているのかもしれないが、少なくとも公開された研究論文には、それについて書かれたものはないようだ。","en":"Research on mutants was classified at the highest level in every institution, so secret facilities somewhere might have discovered far more. At least, however, no published research paper appeared to address the subject.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r268","rowIndex":268,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕と<tips=54>汐さん</tips>はこの『<tips=97>特殊タイプＢ</tips>』が存在することを大分前から知っていた。そしてかつては検証実験も行っていたのだ。","en":"<tips=54>Mr. Shio</tips> and I had known for many years that these “<tips=97>special Type Bs</tips>” existed. And once, we had even conducted experiments to verify it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r269","rowIndex":269,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　今までの実験では特殊性の再現を上手くコントロールすることが出来なかった。発生させられなかったわけではないが、条件がさっぱりわからなかったのである。","en":"In our earlier experiments, we had failed to reproduce the special trait under controlled conditions. We had managed to produce it, but we had no idea what conditions made it appear.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r270","rowIndex":270,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しかし今回の実験を始めるにあたって、当時とは違う条件を一つ付け加えた。","en":"But in beginning this experiment, we added one condition that had been absent then.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r271","rowIndex":271,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕らの推測が当たっていれば、この少ない数のマウスでも、一匹くらいは特殊化するかもしれない。","en":"If our hypothesis was correct, perhaps even among this small number of mice, one might develop the special trait.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r272","rowIndex":272,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　まず、ノーマルマウス三匹と、<tips=17>タイプB</tips>マウス三匹を選び出し、それにシャーレのなかでうごめく、僕たちが　”コア組織”　と呼ぶ方の体細胞を摂取させた。","en":"First, we selected three Normal mice and three <tips=17>Type B</tips> mice and made them consume the somatic cells writhing in the petri dish—the material we called “core tissue.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r273","rowIndex":273,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　マウスを一匹ずつ掴み、コア組織を口元にねじ込むようにして直接囓らせるのだ。","en":"We took the mice one at a time, forced the core tissue against their mouths, and made each one gnaw off a piece directly.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r274","rowIndex":274,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　この直接囓らせる、というのがこれまでと違う点だった。","en":"Making them gnaw it directly was what differed from our previous method.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r275","rowIndex":275,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　今までは、抜き取った<tips=97>特殊タイプＢ</tips>の血液を保管して、それを飼料に混ぜ込んで与えていた。","en":"Until then, we had stored blood drawn from a <tips=97>special Type B</tips> and mixed it into their feed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r276","rowIndex":276,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しかし、生体を直接食べさせたらどうだろう？　もしかしたら、餌の保存段階において大事な要素が失われていたのかもしれない。","en":"But what if we made them eat living tissue directly? Perhaps some vital element had been lost while the feed was being stored.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r277","rowIndex":277,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　もっとも新鮮なかたちで摂取させたら、また違った結果が出るのではないか。前回の実験が失敗したときにこの疑問が浮かんだのだが、その時は遂に試すことがなく中断された。いまそれを再開するのだ。","en":"What if making them consume it in the freshest form possible produced a different result? The question had occurred to us when the previous experiment failed, but the work was halted before we could ever test it. Now we were resuming it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r278","rowIndex":278,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　六匹に一口ずつ囓らせると、コア細胞はちょうど半分ほどになった。","en":"After we made each of the six mice gnaw off a mouthful, roughly half the core tissue remained.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r279","rowIndex":279,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　この半分は残しておいて、また実験の過程で使用する。","en":"We would preserve this half and use it later in the course of the experiment.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r280","rowIndex":280,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　とにかく、この生体から直接囓らせたこの六匹が今回の実験の本命となる。","en":"In any case, these six mice, which had been made to gnaw directly on the living tissue, were the principal subjects of the experiment.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r281","rowIndex":281,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　次は、残ったマウスたちにあたえる飼料の作成作業を行わなくてはならない。","en":"Next, we had to prepare the feed for the remaining mice.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r282","rowIndex":282,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　冷凍していた虎の肉塊を洗浄し、汚れやいたみの酷い場所を切除して捨てると使用出来る部分はかなり少なくなった。","en":"We washed the frozen mass of tiger meat, then cut away and discarded the worst of the dirt and decay. That left us with very little we could actually use.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r283","rowIndex":283,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　少しでも多くの組織を残せるよう、無心で作業をしていると、<tips=54>汐さん</tips>が口を開いた。","en":"As we worked single-mindedly to preserve as much tissue as possible, <tips=54>Mr. Shio</tips> spoke.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r284","rowIndex":284,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「昨日今日と、仕事の合間にな、この<tips=57>滑走路通り</tips>を襲った虎が、どこからやって来たのか調べていたんだ」","en":"“Yesterday and today, in the time I could spare from work, I’ve been investigating where the tiger that attacked <tips=57>Runway Street</tips> came from.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐健慈朗","displayName":"Kenjiro Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r285","rowIndex":285,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕は彼の顔を見た。彼の視線はディスポの手袋をはめた自分の指先の作業に向けられたままだったので、僕も手元に視線を戻しながら聞く。","en":"I looked at him. His gaze stayed fixed on what he was doing with his gloved hands, so I looked back down at my own work and listened.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r286","rowIndex":286,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あのあと、西通りの方の一軒家で、壊れた鉄檻と食い殺された老人が転がっているのが見つかったんだそうだ。虎はおそらくそこで飼われていたんだろう」","en":"“Afterward, they apparently found a broken iron cage and an old man who’d been killed and eaten at a house over on West Street. The tiger was probably being kept there.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐健慈朗","displayName":"Kenjiro Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r287","rowIndex":287,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「老人？」","en":"“An old man?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r288","rowIndex":288,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ミノカワって名前に記憶はないか？」","en":"“Does the name Minokawa mean anything to you?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐健慈朗","displayName":"Kenjiro Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r289","rowIndex":289,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……いや、ちょっと思い出せないな……」","en":"“...No, I can’t quite place it...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r290","rowIndex":290,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうか。お前の父親ならよく知っているだろう。元々、<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>……というか<tips=69>義勝</tips>とつき合いのあった商売人だ。大分前に引退して、のどかに暮らしていたようだ」","en":"“I see. Your father would know him well. He was a businessman who once had dealings with <tips=7>YS</tips>—or rather, <tips=69>Yisheng</tips>. He retired long ago and apparently lived a quiet life.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐健慈朗","displayName":"Kenjiro Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r291","rowIndex":291,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=69>義勝</tips>が何か関係しているのかい？」","en":"“Does <tips=69>Yisheng</tips> have something to do with this?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r292","rowIndex":292,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=69>義勝</tips>が老人に虎を引き渡したんだ」","en":"“<tips=69>Yisheng</tips> gave the tiger to the old man.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐健慈朗","displayName":"Kenjiro Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r293","rowIndex":293,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なぜ虎なんか……」","en":"“Why a tiger...?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r294","rowIndex":294,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あの虎は元々『<tips=18>ローズ・クラブ</tips>』の虎だったんだ。つまり、お前の想像は当たっていたということさ」","en":"“That tiger originally belonged to the <tips=18>Rose Club</tips>. In other words, your guess was right.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐健慈朗","displayName":"Kenjiro Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r295","rowIndex":295,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=54>汐さん</tips>が言うと、思わず僕の口から溜息がもれる。","en":"I couldn’t help sighing at what <tips=54>Mr. Shio</tips> had told me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r296","rowIndex":296,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"『<tips=18>ローズ・クラブ</tips>』というのはかつてこの街にあった秘密クラブの名前だ。","en":"The <tips=18>Rose Club</tips> was the name of a secret club that had once operated in this city.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r297","rowIndex":297,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　この街ではその名は半ばタブーになっており、語られることも少ない。","en":"In this city, the name was nearly taboo and seldom spoken.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r298","rowIndex":298,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そこでは、普通の賭博、売春といったものだけではなく、もっとおぞましい様々なショーやサービスが提供されていたのだ。それらは、特に選ばれた会員のみに利用を許されていたため、その実態が明らかになったのはクラブがなくなって何年も経ってからのことだった。","en":"It provided not only ordinary gambling and prostitution, but an array of far more appalling shows and services. Access to those was restricted to specially selected members, and the reality of what took place there did not come to light until many years after the club had disappeared.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r299","rowIndex":299,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　例えば、後年明らかになったものの一つに『死なない女』という残酷ショーがある。","en":"Among the things later brought to light was a brutal show called The Woman Who Wouldn't Die.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r300","rowIndex":300,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　内容はごくシンプルで、手足を鎖で縛り付けた女を生きたまま虎に食わせるというものなのだが、これがただの残酷ショーとちょっと違うのは、いくら食わせても女は死なないという点であった。","en":"Its premise was perfectly simple: a woman was chained by her arms and legs and fed alive to a tiger. What made it a little different from an ordinary spectacle of cruelty was that no matter how much of her the tiger ate, the woman did not die.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r301","rowIndex":301,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　体の半分も食われてしまったような状況でも、まるで活き作りの魚のように女は死なずに動き、そして一週間もすれば五体揃った健康な姿で客の前に姿を現す。","en":"Even after half her body had been devoured, she would remain alive and moving, like a fish carved up and served while still alive. A week later, she would appear before the guests again, healthy and whole in every limb.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r302","rowIndex":302,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　当時は整形手術で全く同じ姿の女を何人も用意したとも言われていたようだが、真実は、この女もまた『<tips=97>特殊タイプＢ</tips>』だったのだろう。","en":"It was said at the time that plastic surgery had been used to prepare several women who looked exactly alike. In truth, however, this woman had probably also been a “<tips=97>special Type B</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r303","rowIndex":303,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　隆盛を誇った『<tips=18>ローズ・クラブ</tips>』は、その後<tips=69>義勝</tips>の<tips=81>龍頭</tips>であった<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>、つまり若き日の僕の父によって壊滅させられることになる。","en":"The once-prosperous <tips=18>Rose Club</tips> would later be destroyed by <tips=3>Chris Tse</tips>, <tips=69>Yisheng’s</tips> <tips=81>Longtou</tips>—in other words, my father as a young man.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r304","rowIndex":304,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　このとき、ショーで女の肉を食べていた虎が、その老人に引き取られたのだとしたら？","en":"What if the tiger that had eaten the woman's flesh during that show was later taken in by the old man?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r305","rowIndex":305,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして、今目の前で僕らに切り刻まれている肉片になったのだとしたら？","en":"And what if it had ended up as the pieces of meat Mr. Shio and I were now carving apart?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r306","rowIndex":306,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"『<tips=97>特殊タイプＢ</tips>』である女の肉を生きた肉体から直接食べ続けた虎が、やはり『<tips=97>特殊タイプＢ</tips>』であった。","en":"A tiger that had kept eating the flesh of a “<tips=97>special Type B</tips>” directly from her living body was itself a “<tips=97>special Type B</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r307","rowIndex":307,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　これが全て偶然による符合だとは考えにくい。","en":"It was hard to believe that all these pieces had fallen into place by sheer coincidence.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r308","rowIndex":308,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「『<tips=18>ローズ・クラブ</tips>』が崩壊したあと、街をうろついていた虎を<tips=69>義勝</tips>が捕獲したんだ。それをミノカワが欲しがって、譲り渡したのさ」","en":"“After the <tips=18>Rose Club</tips> collapsed, <tips=69>Yisheng</tips> captured the tiger roaming the streets. Minokawa wanted it, so they handed it over to him.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐健慈朗","displayName":"Kenjiro Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r309","rowIndex":309,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なるほどね。そうか……。いいね。今回の実験、うまくいきそうな気がしてきたよ」","en":"“I see. So that’s it... Good. I’m starting to think this experiment might actually work.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r310","rowIndex":310,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　あまり期待はしていなかったのだが、急に成功が現実味を帯びてきた。にわかに緊張を覚え、僕はすっかり乾いた口でそう言った。","en":"I had not expected much, but suddenly success felt like a real possibility. A sudden tension seized me, and I spoke through a mouth gone completely dry.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r311","rowIndex":311,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「しかし、もしすべてが仮定通りだったらどうする？」","en":"“But what will you do if all our hypotheses prove correct?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐健慈朗","displayName":"Kenjiro Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r312","rowIndex":312,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どうするって、何が？」","en":"“What do you mean, what will I do?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r313","rowIndex":313,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「仮定が正しければ、我々はこの限りなく不死に近い異常な再生力を思いのまま与えることが出来るようになる。つまりそれは、たとえば、体がグズグズと崩れ落ちるような末期患者にも、健康を取り戻させることが出来るということだ」","en":"“If the hypothesis is correct, we’ll be able to bestow this abnormal regenerative power, something approaching immortality, at will. In other words, we could restore to health even a terminal patient whose body was crumbling away.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐健慈朗","displayName":"Kenjiro Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r314","rowIndex":314,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ああ」","en":"“Ah.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r315","rowIndex":315,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼がそこまで言って、僕はようやく何を伝えようとしているのか理解した。","en":"Only when he said that did I finally understand what he was trying to tell me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r316","rowIndex":316,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　つまり、僕の父<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>を助けられるのではないかと言っているのだ。","en":"In other words, he was saying we might be able to save my father, <tips=3>Chris Tse</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r317","rowIndex":317,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「生き延びさせることは出来るかもしれない。でもどうだろう？　高<tips=72>傾向値</tips>になれば精神にも影響を与えるだろうし、あの絶大な権力を持った人間が狂ったまま健康になられたら全部滅茶苦茶になる。第一、本人がうんというかもわからない。何もかも現実的じゃない」","en":"“We might be able to keep him alive. But should we? A high <tips=72>tendency value</tips> would probably affect his mind, and if a man with that kind of absolute power returned to health insane, everything would go to hell. For one thing, we don’t even know whether he’d agree to it. None of this is realistic.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r318","rowIndex":318,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まあ、そうだな。おれとしても、あの<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>に不死身の<tips=17>タイプＢ</tips>として復活されては困る」","en":"“Yeah, true. I wouldn’t exactly welcome <tips=3>Chris Tse</tips> coming back as an immortal <tips=17>Type B</tips>, either.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐健慈朗","displayName":"Kenjiro Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r319","rowIndex":319,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=54>汐さん</tips>はそう言って、肩をすくめた。","en":"<tips=54>Mr. Shio</tips> said with a shrug.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r320","rowIndex":320,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　すべての作業を終えた。こうして準備を終えたら、あとの細かい作業と定期的なデータ採取は、いつもこうした場合に<tips=54>汐さん</tips>が雇っているアルバイトがこなしてくれるだろう。","en":"We finished our work. With the preparations complete, the remaining minor tasks and regular data collection could be left to the part-timer <tips=54>Mr. Shio</tips> always hired for experiments like this.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r321","rowIndex":321,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして実験室のフラスコでコーヒーを一杯入れて一息つくと、ちょうど<tips=55>松子</tips>が帰って来る時刻になっていた。僕らは地下室を出て、何食わぬ顔でリビングルームのテレビなどを見はじめる。","en":"After brewing a cup of coffee in a laboratory flask and taking a short break, we found it was almost time for <tips=55>Matsuko</tips> to return. We left the basement and began watching television in the living room as though nothing had happened.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r322","rowIndex":322,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ちょうどプロ野球の試合もはじまる頃合いで、<tips=54>汐さん</tips>は贔屓チームの選手たちのプレーにぶつくさ文句を言いながら、飲みかけだったウイスキーをまた飲み始める。","en":"A professional baseball game was about to begin. <tips=54>Mr. Shio</tips> resumed drinking his unfinished whiskey while grumbling at the way his favorite team's players performed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r323","rowIndex":323,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　野球にちっとも興味がない僕は、頬杖をついてなんとなく画面を眺めている。","en":"I had no interest in baseball whatsoever, so I propped my cheek on one hand and gazed absently at the screen.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r324","rowIndex":324,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ただいま」","en":"“I’m home.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐松子","displayName":"Matsuko Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r325","rowIndex":325,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そこへ予定通り<tips=55>松子</tips>が自前の買い物袋に近所で購入した食材を詰めて帰って来た。","en":"Just as planned, <tips=55>Matsuko</tips> returned, carrying groceries from nearby shops in her own shopping bags.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r326","rowIndex":326,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あ、もう二人揃っていたんですね！　これから急いで食事を作るので、待っていてください」","en":"“Oh, you’re both here already! I’ll hurry and make dinner, so please wait for me!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐松子","displayName":"Matsuko Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r327","rowIndex":327,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　黙って野球観戦している二人の姿を認めると、パタパタとスリッパを鳴らしてキッチンへ去ってゆく。","en":"At the sight of the two of us silently watching baseball, she pattered away to the kitchen, slippers clapping against the floor.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r328","rowIndex":328,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そんなに急がなくてもいいよ」","en":"“You don’t have to rush so much.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r329","rowIndex":329,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕は彼女の消えた方向に向かってそう声をかけた。","en":"I called out in the direction she had disappeared.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r330","rowIndex":330,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「でも、腹ぺこですよね？」","en":"“But you must both be starving, aren’t you?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r331","rowIndex":331,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「子供じゃないんだから、それくらい待てるよ」","en":"“I’m not a child. I can wait that long.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r332","rowIndex":332,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ありがとうございます。でも、待たせるのはいやなんです」","en":"“Thank you. But I don’t like to keep you waiting.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r333","rowIndex":333,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　キッチンから食材の梱包などを剥がす物音がして、僕は渋々口を閉ざした。","en":"I heard the sound of packages being opened in the kitchen and reluctantly held my tongue.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r334","rowIndex":334,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=1>亮</tips>、親父さんの状態はよくないのか？」","en":"“<tips=1>Ryo</tips>, is your father in bad shape?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐健慈朗","displayName":"Kenjiro Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r335","rowIndex":335,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　やりとりを黙って見ていた<tips=54>汐さん</tips>はそう尋ねる。","en":"<tips=54>Mr. Shio</tips>, who had watched our exchange in silence, asked me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r336","rowIndex":336,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まあよくはないかな。……料理が出来るまで、一局どう？」","en":"“Well, I wouldn’t say he’s doing well. ...How about a game before dinner’s ready?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r337","rowIndex":337,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「やらん。お前と碁を打ってもつまらんからな」","en":"“No. Playing Go with you is no fun.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐健慈朗","displayName":"Kenjiro Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r338","rowIndex":338,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=54>汐さん</tips>は断固として首を横に振り、","en":"<tips=54>Mr. Shio</tips> shook his head emphatically.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r339","rowIndex":339,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なあ、親父さんの仕事を引き継ぐのか？」","en":"“So, are you going to take over your father's business?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐健慈朗","displayName":"Kenjiro Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r340","rowIndex":340,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　あまりにも急な話題だが、こんな具合に<tips=54>汐さん</tips>が唐突に何かを言い出すのは今に始まったことではない。","en":"It was an extraordinarily abrupt change of subject, but <tips=54>Mr. Shio</tips> had always had a habit of suddenly blurting things out like this.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r341","rowIndex":341,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そんなつもりはないよ。最低の商売だ。人を脅したり騙したり、欲望につけこんで金を儲けるんだ」","en":"“I have no intention of doing that. It’s the worst kind of business. You make money by threatening people, deceiving them, and preying on their desires.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r342","rowIndex":342,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうか」","en":"“I see.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐健慈朗","displayName":"Kenjiro Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r343","rowIndex":343,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そう言って、彼はまた野球に視線を戻した。","en":"With that, he turned his eyes back to the baseball game.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r344","rowIndex":344,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　他人にあまり関心が無い<tips=54>汐さん</tips>でも、やっぱり僕の動向は気になるのか。","en":"Even <tips=54>Mr. Shio</tips>, who took little interest in other people, was concerned about what I would do after all.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r345","rowIndex":345,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そんな風に意外に思っていると、<tips=54>汐さん</tips>の唇から飛び出した次の言葉には、さらにもっと驚かされた。","en":"As I was still wondering at that, what <tips=54>Mr. Shio</tips> said next surprised me even more.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r346","rowIndex":346,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それなら、お前、この際だから松と一緒にならないか？」","en":"“Then why don’t you take this opportunity to marry Matsu?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐健慈朗","displayName":"Kenjiro Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r347","rowIndex":347,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「えっ」","en":"“What?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r348","rowIndex":348,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　思わず大きな声を出してしまうと、","en":"My voice rose before I could stop it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r349","rowIndex":349,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どうしましたか？」","en":"“Is something wrong?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r350","rowIndex":350,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=55>松子</tips>が向こうから質問してくる。","en":"<tips=55>Matsuko</tips> called to us from the kitchen.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r351","rowIndex":351,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いや、なんでもない！」","en":"“No, it’s nothing!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r352","rowIndex":352,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕は慌てて<tips=55>松子</tips>にそう返してから、","en":"After hurriedly calling back to <tips=55>Matsuko</tips>,","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r353","rowIndex":353,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「急に何を。ちょっとおかしいんじゃないか？」","en":"“What are you talking about all of a sudden? Have you lost your mind?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r354","rowIndex":354,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　声をひそめて<tips=54>汐さん</tips>の裾を引いた。","en":"I whispered, tugging at the hem of <tips=54>Mr. Shio’s</tips> shirt.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r355","rowIndex":355,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ギャングのボスになりたくないなら、<tips=55>松子</tips>と結婚しておれのところで仕事を手伝えばいいじゃないか。もちろん、仕事は学校を卒業してからでいい。<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>だってうちの社員を<tips=81>龍頭</tips>にしようとは思わないだろう。うん、それが一番いい」","en":"“If you don't want to become a gang boss, why not marry <tips=55>Matsuko</tips> and help me with the business? You can wait until after you graduate, of course. Even <tips=7>YS</tips> wouldn't try to make one of our employees <tips=81>Longtou</tips>. Yes, that's best.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐健慈朗","displayName":"Kenjiro Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r356","rowIndex":356,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その声は普段喋っている通りのトーンで、<tips=55>松子</tips>に聞こえてしまわないか僕はどぎまぎしたが、彼は無頓着だった。","en":"His voice remained at its usual volume. I grew flustered at the thought that <tips=55>Matsuko</tips> might hear him, but he was completely unconcerned.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r357","rowIndex":357,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=1>謝亮</tips>の名を捨てて、<tips=1>菅原亮</tips>としてうちに入るんだ。それが一番いいだろう。親の仕事を継ぎたくはないんだろ？」","en":"“Give up the name <tips=1>Tse Leung</tips> and join our family as <tips=1>Ryo Sugawara</tips>. That would be best, wouldn’t it? You don’t want to take over your father’s business, do you?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐健慈朗","displayName":"Kenjiro Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r358","rowIndex":358,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「性急だな。まるで、<tips=54>汐さん</tips>が今にも死んでしまうような性急さだ。それとも、どこか悪いのかい？」","en":"“You’re in an awful hurry, <tips=54>Mr. Shio</tips>—as if you were about to drop dead. Or is there something wrong with you?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r359","rowIndex":359,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いや別にそういうわけじゃないが。しかし、こんな不摂生をしているわけだから、その日がいつ来てもおかしくない」","en":"“No, nothing in particular. But given the way I live, it wouldn’t be strange if my time came any day.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐健慈朗","displayName":"Kenjiro Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r360","rowIndex":360,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それなら、酒を減らしなよ」","en":"“Then cut back on the booze.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r361","rowIndex":361,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕は肩をすくめる。","en":"I shrugged.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r362","rowIndex":362,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「結婚したくないのか？」","en":"“Don't you want to get married?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐健慈朗","displayName":"Kenjiro Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r363","rowIndex":363,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼はまだこの話題を続けたいようだ。","en":"He apparently still wanted to pursue the subject.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r364","rowIndex":364,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そういう話じゃないよ。今この時期に<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>のボスの息子が<tips=70>シオクリーン</tips>社長の娘と結婚して会社を継ぐなんてことになったら、とんでもなくややこしいことになる。少なくとも、この街で生活するのは無理だ」","en":"“That's not what this is about. If the son of the <tips=7>YS</tips> boss married the daughter of <tips=70>Shio Clean's</tips> president and took over the company at a time like this, it would make things unbelievably complicated. At the very least, we couldn't live in this city.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r365","rowIndex":365,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして、外で暮らそうという僕の提案は断られたばかりだ。","en":"And my suggestion that we live outside the city had only just been rejected.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r366","rowIndex":366,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「僕はね、ギャングになるつもりもなければ、会社社長にもなりたくない。研究者になるんだよ。そのために色々やって来たんだ。……あのね、そもそも僕がこの街に戻って来て暮らすこと自体ありえないんだよ」","en":"“Look, I have no intention of becoming a gangster, and I don’t want to be a company president. I’m going to be a researcher. That’s what I’ve been working toward all this time. ...In the first place, there’s no chance I would ever come back and live in this city.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r367","rowIndex":367,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうか？」","en":"“Is that so?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐健慈朗","displayName":"Kenjiro Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r368","rowIndex":368,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「何が違うっていうのさ」","en":"“What makes you think otherwise?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r369","rowIndex":369,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「お前は結局街に帰ってくるよ」","en":"“You'll come back to this city in the end.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐健慈朗","displayName":"Kenjiro Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r370","rowIndex":370,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まったく、何を言っているんだよ。そんなわけ……」","en":"“Honestly, what are you talking about? There's no way—”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r371","rowIndex":371,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あるね」","en":"“There is.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐健慈朗","displayName":"Kenjiro Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r372","rowIndex":372,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=54>汐さん</tips>はきっぱりと断言する。","en":"<tips=54>Mr. Shio</tips> declared it flatly.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r373","rowIndex":373,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なあ、おれは研究者としてこの街にやって来て、そして離れられなくなったんだ。ここには我々の好奇心を満たすものがたくさんある。お前は変に嫌っているようだが、そもそもお前が学問をしようと思ったのだって、この街にいたからだろう。お前は、ここにあるものをもっと詳しく知りたくて学校に行っているんだよ」","en":"“Listen. I came to this city as a researcher, and then I found I couldn’t leave. There’s plenty here to satisfy our curiosity. You act as though you hate the place for some reason, but this city is why you chose an academic life to begin with. You’re at university because you want to understand what’s here in greater depth.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐健慈朗","displayName":"Kenjiro Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r374","rowIndex":374,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「決めつけられたくないな」","en":"“I don't want you deciding that for me.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r375","rowIndex":375,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「帰って早々、嬉々としてあんな虎の細胞をここに持って来たのがその証拠だ。本当に学問の道を志しているのなら、サンプルを大学に持って帰って手柄にするべきだ。ここじゃおままごとみたいなことしか出来ないんだからな」","en":"“The proof is that the moment you came back, you gleefully brought those tiger cells here. If you were truly committed to the path of scholarship, you should have taken the sample back to the university and made a name for yourself with it. We can only play at research here, after all.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐健慈朗","displayName":"Kenjiro Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r376","rowIndex":376,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=54>汐さん</tips>はきっぱりと言う。","en":"<tips=54>Mr. Shio</tips> said it flatly.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r377","rowIndex":377,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「お前は人のことはよく見ているくせに、自分のやっていることは分析が出来ないのだな。お前はこの街に戻って来ると、おれにはわかっている。だが、ギャングにはなって欲しくないんだ。だから、そうなる前に、うちの仕事をやらないかと言っている。結婚がいやなら、社員になるだけでもいい。仕事はしなくてもいい。研究でもなんでも好きな事をすればいいじゃないか。おれみたいに人生を失敗して欲しくはないんだよ」","en":"“You observe other people so closely, yet you cannot analyze your own actions. I know that you will return to this city. But I don't want you to become a gangster. That is why I'm asking you to work for me before it comes to that. If you don't want to marry, you can simply become an employee. You needn't even work. You could do research, or whatever else you like. I don't want you to fail at life the way I did.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐健慈朗","displayName":"Kenjiro Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r378","rowIndex":378,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「えらく親切だ。そこまで僕に肩入れしてくれたって、何にもないよ」","en":"“That’s remarkably kind of you. But even if you go this far out of your way for me, there’s nothing in it for you.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r379","rowIndex":379,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「お前は大分年下だが、大切な親友だと思っている」","en":"“You're much younger than I am, but I consider you a dear friend.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐健慈朗","displayName":"Kenjiro Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r380","rowIndex":380,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　小さな頃からの付き合いだが<tips=54>汐さん</tips>がそんな言葉を口にするのは初めてで、僕は戸惑いながら、","en":"We had known each other since I was very small, but this was the first time <tips=54>Mr. Shio</tips> had ever said anything like that. Flustered, I said,","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r381","rowIndex":381,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……とにかく、決めつけないで欲しいね。それに大丈夫。僕はどうなったってギャングにはならない。犯罪者なんかまっぴらごめんだし、この街で下らない争いをして人生を無駄遣いしたくもない」","en":"“...In any case, please don't decide my future for me. And don't worry. Whatever happens, I will never become a gangster. I want nothing to do with being a criminal, and I don't want to waste my life fighting pointless battles in this city.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r382","rowIndex":382,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　言うと、<tips=54>汐さん</tips>は暫く考えた後、","en":"When I said that, <tips=54>Mr. Shio</tips> thought for a while, then—","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r383","rowIndex":383,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それならいいんだが」","en":"“If that’s true, then fine.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐健慈朗","displayName":"Kenjiro Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r384","rowIndex":384,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「信用して欲しいな。僕は昔からああいうチンピラのことが大嫌いだったじゃないか」","en":"“I wish you'd trust me. I've always hated punks like that, haven't I?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r385","rowIndex":385,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕にとっては疑いのない話なのだが、<tips=54>汐さん</tips>は最後まで完全に僕を信じてはくれなかった。","en":"I had no doubt of it myself, yet <tips=54>Mr. Shio</tips> never came to believe me completely—not even in the end.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r386","rowIndex":386,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まあ、結局な……」","en":"“Well, in the end...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐健慈朗","displayName":"Kenjiro Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r387","rowIndex":387,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=54>汐さん</tips>が言いかけたところで、キッチンの方からガシャンと何かを盛大にひっくり返す音が聞こえた。","en":"Just as <tips=54>Mr. Shio</tips> began to continue, we heard a tremendous crash from the kitchen—the sound of something being knocked over.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r388","rowIndex":388,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　すぐに立ち上がって駆けつけると、<tips=55>松子</tips>が床に座り込んで、手を押さえている。その付近には、刻まれた野菜が散乱し、銀色のボウルがひっくり返っている。","en":"I leapt up and ran in. <tips=55>Matsuko</tips> sat on the floor, clutching one hand. Chopped vegetables lay scattered around her, and a metal mixing bowl had overturned nearby.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r389","rowIndex":389,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「怪我をしたのか？」","en":"“Are you hurt?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r390","rowIndex":390,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　尋ねると、彼女は恥ずかしそうにうつむき、","en":"At my question, she lowered her head in embarrassment.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r391","rowIndex":391,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「すみません。馬鹿なんです。買い物袋の端が引っかかっていたのに気づかずに引っ張ったら、お皿とかが全部ひっくりかえってしまって……。お皿はなんとか落ちる前に助けられたんですが……」","en":"“I’m sorry. That was so stupid of me. The edge of a shopping bag had caught on something, and I pulled without noticing, so all the dishes and everything went flying... I managed to save the plates before they hit the floor, but...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐松子","displayName":"Matsuko Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r392","rowIndex":392,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして僕に、左手の指の股に挟んだ三枚の皿を見せる。落ちようとしている皿を片手で三枚掴むというのは、他の人間にはなかなか出来ない芸当だろう。","en":"She showed me three plates wedged between the fingers of her left hand. Snatching three falling plates with one hand was a feat few other people could have managed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r393","rowIndex":393,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その一方で体の陰に隠そうとしていた右手を取ると、固く握りしめた指の間から止めどもなく血液が流れ出ていた。","en":"I took the right hand she had been trying to hide behind her body. Blood streamed between her tightly clenched fingers without stopping.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r394","rowIndex":394,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「手を開いて見せて」","en":"“Open your hand and let me see.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r395","rowIndex":395,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　言うと<tips=55>松子</tips>は渋々右手のひらを開く。それぞれの指の内側に、ぱっくりと切れ目が刻まれ、そこから血液があふれている。","en":"At my instruction, <tips=55>Matsuko</tips> reluctantly opened her right palm. Deep cuts gaped along the inside of every finger, blood welling from each one.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r396","rowIndex":396,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「お皿の方に集中していたら、うっかり包丁を握ってキャッチしてしまって……。ごめんなさい。こんなに割ったり、汚したりして……」","en":"“I was concentrating on the plates, and I accidentally grabbed the knife by the blade... I’m sorry. I’ve broken things and made such a mess of everything...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐松子","displayName":"Matsuko Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r397","rowIndex":397,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「きみがこんなドジをするなんて珍しい。よっぽど慌てていたんだな」","en":"“It's rare for you to make a blunder like this. You must have been in a terrible hurry.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r398","rowIndex":398,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕はひとまず溜息をつく。","en":"For the moment, all I could do was sigh.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r399","rowIndex":399,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ほんとうに、恥ずかしいです」","en":"“I’m so embarrassed.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐松子","displayName":"Matsuko Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r400","rowIndex":400,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女は肩をすくめてばつが悪そうにする。","en":"She hunched her shoulders, looking sheepish.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r401","rowIndex":401,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=55>松子</tips>の場合、このくらいの傷ならば何も心配する必要はない。","en":"With <tips=55>Matsuko</tips>, an injury of this degree was no cause for concern.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r402","rowIndex":402,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その証拠として、こうして眺めている間にも、傷はみるみるうちにふさがってゆく。","en":"Indeed, even as we watched, the wounds rapidly closed before our eyes.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r403","rowIndex":403,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして２０秒ほどしてから血を拭き取ると、もうどこを見ても肌の上に傷を見つけ出すことが出来なくなった。","en":"After about twenty seconds, I wiped away the blood. There was no longer a wound to be found anywhere on her skin.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r404","rowIndex":404,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それから二日、昼は汐家にマウスの状態を観察しに行き、夜はホテルに帰って寝た。","en":"For the next two days, I visited the Shio residence by day to observe the mice and returned to the hotel to sleep at night.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r405","rowIndex":405,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　いつ父の容体の変化などがあるかもわからず、いざというときにわかりやすい場所にいた方が良いだろうというつもりだったが、特に何事もない。","en":"My father’s condition might change at any time, so I thought it best to remain somewhere easy to find if anything happened. Nothing did, however.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r406","rowIndex":406,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　一方、実験の方は早くも変化があらわれていた。","en":"The experiment, on the other hand, was already producing changes.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r407","rowIndex":407,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　死んだ肉を与えた１４匹のマウスたちは、１００から２００傾向値が上昇した。","en":"The tendency values of the fourteen mice fed the dead flesh had risen by one to two hundred points.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r408","rowIndex":408,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　これは、<tips=97>特殊なタイプＢ</tips>を用いなくとも、ごく普通の<tips=72>タイプB傾向値</tips>の高い食物を与えた時でも起こる普通の現象である。","en":"This was an ordinary phenomenon, no different from what occurred when they were fed any food with a high <tips=72>Type B tendency value</tips>; it did not require tissue from a <tips=97>special Type B</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r409","rowIndex":409,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして、そのマウスたちには<tips=72>傾向値</tips>が上がった他にはなんの変化もみられなかった。","en":"Those mice exhibited no change other than the rise in <tips=72>tendency value</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r410","rowIndex":410,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　問題は、コア組織を与えた六匹のマウスだ。","en":"What mattered were the six mice fed the core tissue.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r411","rowIndex":411,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「おい、効果覿面だぞ」","en":"“Hey. It worked like a charm.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r412","rowIndex":412,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その日汐邸を訪れた僕に、<tips=54>汐さん</tips>は若干興奮した面持ちでそう告げた。","en":"<tips=54>Mr. Shio</tips> greeted me with those words when I visited his home that day, a trace of excitement on his face.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r413","rowIndex":413,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まあ、来てくれ」","en":"“Come along.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r414","rowIndex":414,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕の言葉も待たずに歩きはじめる<tips=54>汐さん</tips>に従って、地下の実験室に下りた。","en":"Without waiting for my reply, <tips=54>Mr. Shio</tips> started walking, and I followed him down to the basement laboratory.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r415","rowIndex":415,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　コア細胞を与えたマウスは一匹ずつ別々のケージに入れられている。その計六つのケージは、実験室中央のテーブルの上に並べられていた。","en":"Each mouse fed the core tissue had been placed in a separate cage. The six cages stood in a row on the table at the center of the laboratory.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r416","rowIndex":416,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そのうち、僕が到着した時点でなかにマウスが入っていたのはわずかに二つであった。","en":"By the time I arrived, only two of those cages still contained mice.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r417","rowIndex":417,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　残りのケージはすでに空で、中で過ごしていたマウスたちはケージの脇に置かれた金属トレイの上で死体となって並べられ、足にはタグが付けられている。","en":"The others were already empty. Their former occupants lay dead on a metal tray beside the cages, tags fastened to their legs.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r418","rowIndex":418,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　生き残った二匹のマウスも、あきらかに以前とは様子が違っていた。","en":"The two survivors were also plainly different from before.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r419","rowIndex":419,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　一匹は、僕たちの姿を見ると狂ったようにケージのなかを走り回り、明らかな興奮を見せている。もう一匹は、ケージの隅の方に蹲り、体を膨らませたりしぼませたりして深い呼吸を行っている。","en":"One caught sight of us and raced madly around its cage, visibly agitated. The other crouched in a corner, its body expanding and contracting with deep breaths.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r420","rowIndex":420,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして両方とも、その瞳を金色に輝かせていた。","en":"Both had eyes that shone gold.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r421","rowIndex":421,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なるほど……」","en":"“I see...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r422","rowIndex":422,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕はある程度事態を察し、頷く。","en":"I understood enough to nod.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r423","rowIndex":423,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「録画によると、摂取して３３時間程度で相次いで反応が出て、死んでいる」","en":"“According to the recording, reactions began appearing one after another about thirty-three hours after ingestion, and deaths followed.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐健慈朗","displayName":"Kenjiro Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r424","rowIndex":424,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=72>傾向値</tips>は上がっていた？」","en":"“Did their <tips=72>tendency values</tips> rise?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r425","rowIndex":425,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「死体も生きている方も、平均して１０００程度上昇しているな。ノーマルマウスはすべて摂取後に<tips=95>金眼現象</tips>が確認されている。<tips=17>タイプB</tips>マウスは二匹に異常動作が見られ、そのうち一匹は異常行動の一時間後に死んだ」","en":"“Both the dead mice and the living ones showed an average increase of about one thousand. All the Normal mice displayed the <tips=95>golden-eye phenomenon</tips> after ingestion. Two of the <tips=17>Type B</tips> mice exhibited abnormal behavior, and one of them died an hour afterward.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐健慈朗","displayName":"Kenjiro Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r426","rowIndex":426,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=54>汐さん</tips>は端末を操作し、時系列に並べられた観察記録を眺めている。","en":"<tips=54>Mr. Shio</tips> worked the terminal, studying the observation records arranged in chronological order.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r427","rowIndex":427,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……こっちの、生きている方は……こっちのケージがノーマルかな？」","en":"“...As for the living ones... this cage is the Normal, right?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r428","rowIndex":428,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ああ、この走り回っている方が、摂取前は<tips=72>傾向値</tips>３００だったノーマルマウスだ。こちらの大人しいのは９００の<tips=17>タイプB</tips>マウス。そして、肝心の特殊化だが……」","en":"“Yes. The one racing around was a Normal mouse with a <tips=72>tendency value</tips> of three hundred before ingestion. The quiet one was a <tips=17>Type B</tips> mouse at nine hundred. And now for the crucial question of specialization...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐健慈朗","displayName":"Kenjiro Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r429","rowIndex":429,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　汐はうずくまったまま呼吸をしているマウスを指さし、","en":"Mr. Shio pointed to the mouse that remained crouched and breathing.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r430","rowIndex":430,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「こちらには超再生能力が見られる」","en":"“This one exhibits super-regenerative ability.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐健慈朗","displayName":"Kenjiro Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r431","rowIndex":431,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その言葉に、僕は息を飲みつつ、","en":"At those words, I caught my breath and—","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r432","rowIndex":432,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ちょっと、確認してもいい？」","en":"“Can I check?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r433","rowIndex":433,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いいとも」","en":"“Of course.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐健慈朗","displayName":"Kenjiro Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r434","rowIndex":434,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕は手袋をはめると、ケージのマウスを慎重に取り出した。","en":"I put on a pair of gloves and carefully removed the mouse from its cage.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r435","rowIndex":435,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　マウスは多少もがいて抵抗を見せたが、掴む手に力を入れるとすぐに諦め、その金色の瞳に不安を浮かべて僕を見る。","en":"It struggled and resisted a little, but when I tightened my grip it soon gave up and looked at me, anxiety in its golden eyes.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r436","rowIndex":436,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そのマウスを、手足を縛って固定するクリップのついたアクリルボードに、背を向けた格好で、貼り付けのように固定した。","en":"I placed the mouse on an acrylic board fitted with clips that bound its limbs, fixing it flat in place with its back exposed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r437","rowIndex":437,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　背中には、一部剃毛して素肌があらわになった部分がある。<tips=54>汐さん</tips>がテストのために剃ったのだろう。僕は<tips=54>汐さん</tips>の手からメスを受け取り、その無毛の部分に傷を付けると、ぷっくりと血の塊がふくらむ。","en":"Part of its back had been shaved, exposing the bare skin. <tips=54>Mr. Shio</tips> must have prepared it for testing. I accepted a scalpel from <tips=54>Mr. Shio</tips> and made an incision in the hairless area. A plump bead of blood swelled from the cut.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r438","rowIndex":438,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その血を脱脂綿で何度か拭うと、すぐに血が出なくなった。そして、切り傷もなくなっている。","en":"After I wiped the blood away several times with absorbent cotton, the bleeding soon stopped. I could no longer see the cut.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r439","rowIndex":439,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕はもう一度、次は筋肉を切断するほどに深く切り込みを入れた。","en":"I cut it again, this time deeply enough to sever the muscle.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r440","rowIndex":440,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　マウスは板の上で激しく暴れ、流れ出た血液はその体全体を濡らしてアクリルボードを汚すほどだが、その傷もすぐに消えた。","en":"The mouse thrashed violently on the board, and the blood flowed heavily enough to drench its entire body and stain the acrylic. Yet this wound, too, disappeared almost at once.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r441","rowIndex":441,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「これは特殊化しているんじゃないか……」","en":"“So it really has undergone specialization...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r442","rowIndex":442,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そう思うよな」","en":"“You think so too, don't you?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐健慈朗","displayName":"Kenjiro Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r443","rowIndex":443,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ノーマルマウスは三匹のうち二匹が死んで、残り一匹は<tips=17>タイプB</tips>化した上に異常行動しかしなくなった。<tips=17>タイプB</tips>マウスは二匹に異常行動が見られ、一匹が行動には変化がみられない特殊化……これを結果としていいのならば、僕らの仮定からは逸脱していないんじゃないかな……」","en":"“Of the three Normal mice, two died, while the remaining one became <tips=17>Type B</tips> and began displaying nothing but abnormal behavior. Two of the <tips=17>Type B</tips> mice displayed abnormal behavior; one underwent specialization with no behavioral change... If we’re prepared to call this a result, then I’d say it still falls within our hypothesis...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r444","rowIndex":444,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕は溜息をついた。","en":"I sighed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r445","rowIndex":445,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　マウスは手足の束縛からのがれようと、体をよじらせている。","en":"The mouse twisted its body, struggling to free its limbs from their restraints.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r446","rowIndex":446,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「だが、これだけでは特殊化の断定は出来ない」","en":"“But this alone isn't enough to conclude that it has become special.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐健慈朗","displayName":"Kenjiro Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r447","rowIndex":447,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=54>汐さん</tips>はそう言った。","en":"<tips=54>Mr. Shio</tips> said.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r448","rowIndex":448,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「一匹しかいないけれど、やってみようか？　それとも、少し観察を続けてからにするかい？」","en":"“We only have one. Shall we try it? Or should we continue observing it for a while first?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r449","rowIndex":449,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「今やろう。特殊化していなかったら、観察する価値もない」","en":"“Let's do it now. If it hasn't become special, there's no point in observing it.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐健慈朗","displayName":"Kenjiro Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r450","rowIndex":450,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=54>汐さん</tips>は神妙な面持ちで呟いた。","en":"<tips=54>Mr. Shio</tips> murmured the words with a solemn expression.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r451","rowIndex":451,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　再生能力が強化されたからといって、それで完全に特殊化がなされたとは見なせない。","en":"An enhancement of regenerative ability did not in itself prove that specialization was complete.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r452","rowIndex":452,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕らが特殊化と呼んでいる状態は、今のところ数値では計ることが出来なかった。だから、もっとシンプルな方法で確かめるしかない。","en":"The state we called specialization could not, for now, be measured numerically. We therefore had no choice but to confirm it by a simpler method.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r453","rowIndex":453,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「じゃあ、やるよ」","en":"“All right. I’ll do it.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r454","rowIndex":454,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　通常の<tips=17>タイプB</tips>でも人より強い再生能力は保有している。通常の生物ならば完全に死亡しているような状態での生存能力を発揮出来るかどうか。それを確認するのだ。","en":"Even ordinary <tips=17>Type Bs</tips> possess greater regenerative powers than normal humans. We were going to test whether this mouse could survive in a state that would mean certain death for an ordinary organism.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r455","rowIndex":455,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕はメスを右手に取り、肋骨に水平になるよう持ち替え、手袋をした左手でしっかり押さえつけると、背中側から先端を貫通させる。メスが皮を突き破った時点でマウスは左手のなかで激しく暴れたが、メスが奥へ進み、おそらく心臓を損傷したと思われる時点で、その動きが止まった。","en":"I took the scalpel in my right hand and adjusted it until the blade lay parallel to the ribs. Pinning the mouse firmly with my gloved left hand, I drove the tip through from its back. The mouse thrashed violently in my grip when the scalpel pierced the skin, but as the blade advanced deeper and presumably damaged its heart, the movement ceased.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r456","rowIndex":456,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そしてメスを引き抜くとどっと血液があふれ出す。","en":"When I withdrew the scalpel, blood came surging out.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r457","rowIndex":457,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕は溜息をつき、まくった袖で額の汗を拭う。","en":"I sighed and wiped the sweat from my brow with my rolled-up sleeve.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r458","rowIndex":458,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　マウスはぐったりとしたままなかなか動き出そうとしなかった。","en":"The mouse remained limp, showing no sign that it would move again.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r459","rowIndex":459,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……駄目かな？」","en":"“…Maybe it’s not going to work?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r460","rowIndex":460,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いや、動くぞ」","en":"“No—it’s moving.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐健慈朗","displayName":"Kenjiro Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r461","rowIndex":461,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=54>汐さん</tips>は真剣な声色で言った。","en":"<tips=54>Mr. Shio</tips> said in a serious tone.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r462","rowIndex":462,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　はたしてマウスはその状況から復活した。体をびくりと震わせると、急に電源が入ったかのように動きだし、元のように拘束から逃れる動きをする。","en":"Sure enough, the mouse revived. Its body jerked once, and then, as though someone had suddenly switched it on, it began to move. Once more it struggled to escape its restraints.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r463","rowIndex":463,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「やはり間違いなさそうだな」","en":"“Looks like there’s no mistaking it after all.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐健慈朗","displayName":"Kenjiro Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r464","rowIndex":464,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうだね。でも、念のためもう一度。次は、もう少し大きな損傷を与えてみるか……」","en":"“Right. But just to be sure, let’s try once more. This time, maybe we should inflict a more serious injury...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r465","rowIndex":465,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして僕は、次はマウスの首を切断した。","en":"Then, this time, I cut off the mouse’s head.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r466","rowIndex":466,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　あの虎だったら、これくらいの損傷でも当たり前のように活動を続けていたのだ。同程度の再生能力があるのならば、このマウスにも同じ現象が期待出来る。","en":"That tiger had continued to function as though even this degree of damage were nothing. If this mouse possessed regenerative abilities on the same level, we could expect the same phenomenon from it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r467","rowIndex":467,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　切断された頭部を、束縛された体と並べて動き出すのを待った。","en":"We placed the severed head beside the bound body and waited for one of them to begin moving.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r468","rowIndex":468,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　虎の場合は頭部の方がコア細胞となって動き始めたが、僕らが前にやったマウスを用いた同様の実験では体の方が動き出したこともある。","en":"In the tiger’s case, the head had become the core tissue and begun moving, but in a similar experiment we had performed on a mouse before, it was the body that began moving instead.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r469","rowIndex":469,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　体を複数に切断した場合どれが生き残るのか、実際のところ法則性はまったく理解出来ていない。そもそも、必ずしも一つしか生き残らないのか、やりかたによっては分裂生殖する生物のように増やすことが出来るのか、それもはっきりとはわからない。","en":"To tell the truth, we had no understanding whatsoever of any rule governing which part would survive when a body was cut into several pieces. Nor did we know for certain whether only one part would invariably survive, or whether some method might allow us to make it multiply like an organism that reproduced by fission.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r470","rowIndex":470,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それで僕らは切断した身体のどれかが動き出すのを注意深く見守ったのだが——しかし、いつまで経っても動き出すことはなかった。","en":"And so we watched carefully, waiting for one of the severed pieces to begin moving—but no matter how long we waited, none of them did.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r471","rowIndex":471,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「親となった虎ほどの再生能力はないようだね」","en":"“It doesn’t seem to have regenerative abilities on par with the tiger it came from.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r472","rowIndex":472,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕はマウスの頭をメスの先端でつつきながら溜息をつく。","en":"I sighed as I prodded the mouse’s head with the tip of the scalpel.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r473","rowIndex":473,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「特殊化にも段階があるのかもしれない。あるいはものによって種類が違うのか。……こうなってしまうと、何やら話が複雑になってくるな」","en":"“Perhaps specialization comes in stages. Or perhaps the kind of specialization varies from specimen to specimen. …If so, this is getting rather complicated.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐健慈朗","displayName":"Kenjiro Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r474","rowIndex":474,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=54>汐さん</tips>は顔を顰めて、そして僕と同じような溜息をついた。","en":"<tips=54>Mr. Shio</tips> frowned and let out a sigh much like mine.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r475","rowIndex":475,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そしてああでもないこうでもないと話に夢中になっていると、背後でがたんと物音がする。","en":"We became absorbed in debating one possibility after another, until something clattered behind us.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r476","rowIndex":476,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そこには掃除機を抱えた<tips=55>松子</tips>が驚きの表情で立っている。","en":"There stood <tips=55>Matsuko</tips>, a vacuum cleaner in her arms and surprise on her face.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r477","rowIndex":477,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あの、すみません。カードがなかったもので」","en":"“Um, I’m sorry. There was no card in the door.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐松子","displayName":"Matsuko Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r478","rowIndex":478,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　実験室へ下りるドアにはカードを差し込む場所があり、第三者に立ち入って欲しくないときはそこに『立ち入り厳禁』のカードを入れることになっている。そして、それ以外の時は自由に入って掃除などをしてもいいと伝えてあった。","en":"The door leading down to the laboratory had a slot for a card. When we did not want anyone else to enter, we were supposed to insert the card marked DO NOT ENTER. At all other times, we had told Matsuko that she was free to come in and clean.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r479","rowIndex":479,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　差し込んだつもりだったが、何かの加減でそれが落ちてしまったのだろう。だから<tips=55>松子</tips>が入って来たのだ。","en":"I thought we had inserted it, but something must have caused the card to fall out. That was why <tips=55>Matsuko</tips> had come inside.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r480","rowIndex":480,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　若干困ったことになった。","en":"This put us in a bit of a bind.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r481","rowIndex":481,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女の視線はトレイの上に並べられたマウスの肉片に注がれたまま動かない。","en":"Her gaze remained fixed on the pieces of mouse flesh arranged on the tray.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r482","rowIndex":482,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「い、いや、これは……」","en":"“N-no, this is...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐健慈朗","displayName":"Kenjiro Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r483","rowIndex":483,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=54>汐さん</tips>は弁解しようとするが、途中で諦めたようで、苦い顔のまま黙り込んでしまった。","en":"<tips=54>Mr. Shio</tips> tried to explain, but seemed to give up halfway through. He fell silent with a bitter grimace.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r484","rowIndex":484,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「別に隠していたわけじゃないんだ。ただ……」","en":"“It’s not as though we were hiding it from you. It’s just...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐健慈朗","displayName":"Kenjiro Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r485","rowIndex":485,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いえ、いいんです。ただ、私に見せたくないものを見てしまって、すみません……」","en":"“No, it’s all right. I’m sorry I saw something you didn’t want me to see...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐松子","displayName":"Matsuko Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r486","rowIndex":486,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=55>松子</tips>は申し訳なさそうに表情を曇らせる。","en":"<tips=55>Matsuko’s</tips> face clouded apologetically.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r487","rowIndex":487,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕と<tips=54>汐さん</tips>は視線を交わす。こういう風に、何でもない風にしている方が僕らとしては心配だ。僕が小さく頷くと、それで<tips=54>汐さん</tips>に伝わったようだ。","en":"<tips=54>Mr. Shio</tips> and I exchanged glances. Seeing her act as though nothing were wrong only made us worry more. I gave a slight nod, and <tips=54>Mr. Shio</tips> seemed to understand.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r488","rowIndex":488,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ある程度結果が出たら、お前にも話そうと思っていたんだ」","en":"“I meant to tell you once we had some results.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐健慈朗","displayName":"Kenjiro Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r489","rowIndex":489,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=54>汐さん</tips>はそう言って、あらましを語る。","en":"With that, <tips=54>Mr. Shio</tips> gave her an outline of what had happened.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r490","rowIndex":490,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　先日<tips=57>滑走路通り</tips>を襲った虎が、松子と同じ<tips=97>特殊タイプＢ</tips>であったこと。その虎の細胞で、かつて<tips=55>松子</tips>の協力のもとに行った実験と同じ結果が出るかどうかをテストをしていること。","en":"That the tiger which had recently attacked <tips=57>Runway Street</tips> was a <tips=97>special Type B</tips>, like Matsuko. And that, using cells from the tiger, we were testing whether we would get the same results as in the experiments we had once conducted with <tips=55>Matsuko’s</tips> help.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r491","rowIndex":491,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まあ、虎の話は聞いていましたが、そこに<tips=1>リョウ</tips>さんもいたんですか」","en":"“Well, I had heard about the tiger, but were you there too, <tips=1>Ryo</tips>?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐松子","displayName":"Matsuko Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r492","rowIndex":492,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女は驚いている。","en":"She was surprised.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r493","rowIndex":493,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どう見ても普通の虎じゃなかったんだ。だから調べる必要があった」","en":"“Clearly, it was no ordinary tiger. That was why we had to investigate it.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r494","rowIndex":494,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕はそう言った。それから、いまの新しい実験について説明をした。当時<tips=55>松子</tips>に協力して貰ったときは成功率が低かったが、今回そこを修正したら、別の結果が出たと。","en":"I told her as much, then explained the new experiment we were conducting. When <tips=55>Matsuko</tips> had helped us back then, the success rate had been low; this time, however, we had changed that part of the procedure and gotten a different result.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r495","rowIndex":495,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「きみの時は、採取した血液を保存してから使用していたよね。保存しても<tips=17>タイプB</tips>の<tips=72>傾向値</tips>が低くなるわけじゃなかったし、数値的には何も変化がないから問題視しなかった。だけど、後々良く考えてみると、特殊化に成功したマウスは、採血したばかりの新鮮な血液を与えたものだったんだ」","en":"“When we experimented with you, we stored the collected blood before using it. Storage didn’t lower its <tips=17>Type B</tips> <tips=72>tendency value</tips>, and the numbers showed no change, so we never regarded it as a problem. But when we reconsidered it later, we realized that the mouse that had successfully become specialized had received fresh blood immediately after it was drawn.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r496","rowIndex":496,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして、生きた組織をそのまま食べさせたことを伝えた。","en":"Then I told her that we had fed the living tissue directly to the mice.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r497","rowIndex":497,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「生体に近いほうが影響力が強いのだろう。もしかしたら、生きている<tips=97>特殊タイプＢ</tips>の肉をそのまま囓らせたら、もっと高確率で<tips=97>特殊タイプＢ</tips>になるのかもしれない。傷口から直接血液を飲ませても同じような結果が出るはずだ」","en":"“A sample’s influence must be stronger the closer it is to a living state. Perhaps if we let a mouse gnaw flesh directly from a living <tips=97>special Type B</tips>, it would have an even greater chance of becoming a <tips=97>special Type B</tips> itself. Letting it drink blood directly from a wound should produce the same result.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r498","rowIndex":498,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それは……相手がネズミじゃなくて、人間でも？」","en":"“Would that... be true if the subject were a human instead of a mouse?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐松子","displayName":"Matsuko Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r499","rowIndex":499,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「おそらく。さすがに人体実験は出来ないけれどね」","en":"“Probably. Human experimentation is out of the question, naturally.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r500","rowIndex":500,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕は全ての説明を終えて、彼女の表情に注目する。","en":"Once I had finished explaining everything, I studied her expression.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r501","rowIndex":501,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうですか。それは大変なことですね」","en":"“I see. That’s quite serious.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐松子","displayName":"Matsuko Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r502","rowIndex":502,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女はなんともなさそうに笑っている。だが以前もこのような笑顔を見せていたので、僕も<tips=54>汐さん</tips>も落ち着かない。","en":"She smiled as though nothing were wrong. But she had shown us this same smile before, so neither <tips=54>Mr. Shio</tips> nor I could relax.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r503","rowIndex":503,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「本当に、気にしないで下さい」","en":"“Please, really, don’t worry about it.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐松子","displayName":"Matsuko Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r504","rowIndex":504,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕らの気配を察して、<tips=55>松子</tips>は困ったように笑う。","en":"Sensing our unease, <tips=55>Matsuko</tips> gave us a troubled smile.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r505","rowIndex":505,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「私があんな風になってしまったから、気を遣ってくださるんですね。申し訳ないです。あのときは、協力が出来なくなってしまって」","en":"“You’re being so considerate because of what happened to me before, aren’t you? I’m sorry I couldn’t continue helping you then.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐松子","displayName":"Matsuko Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r506","rowIndex":506,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いや、あれは……」","en":"“No, that was…”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐健慈朗","displayName":"Kenjiro Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r507","rowIndex":507,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=54>汐さん</tips>は言ったが、言葉が続かない。","en":"<tips=54>Mr. Shio</tips> began, but could not continue.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r508","rowIndex":508,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「でも、私は大丈夫だったんですよ。それに、なんとも思っていません。だって、私はお二人の実験のおかげでいまここにいるわけですから」","en":"“But I was all right. And it doesn’t bother me at all. After all, I’m here now thanks to the experiments you two performed.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐松子","displayName":"Matsuko Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r509","rowIndex":509,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女は僕らを気遣ってそう言っているのかもしれないが、ますます僕らは何も言えなくなってしまう。","en":"Perhaps she was only saying it for our sake, but it left us at an even greater loss for words.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r510","rowIndex":510,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「言って頂ければ、またご協力しますよ。だから、気軽に言って下さいね」","en":"“If you let me know, I’ll be happy to help again. So please, don’t hesitate to ask.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐松子","displayName":"Matsuko Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r511","rowIndex":511,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=55>松子</tips>は笑顔で言う。<tips=54>汐さん</tips>は気まずそうに黙っている。","en":"<tips=55>Matsuko</tips> said with a smile. <tips=54>Mr. Shio</tips> said nothing, looking uncomfortable.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r512","rowIndex":512,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いや、その必要はない。きみはもう実験に関わらなくていいんだ」","en":"“No, that won’t be necessary. You don’t have to be involved in the experiments anymore.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r513","rowIndex":513,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうですか……」","en":"“I see...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐松子","displayName":"Matsuko Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r514","rowIndex":514,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=55>松子</tips>は僕と<tips=54>汐さん</tips>が複雑な表情をしているのを気まずそうに眺めると、","en":"<tips=55>Matsuko</tips> looked uneasily at the conflicted expressions <tips=54>Mr. Shio</tips> and I wore, then said,","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r515","rowIndex":515,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「とにかく、お邪魔してすみませんでした」","en":"“In any case, I’m sorry for intruding.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐松子","displayName":"Matsuko Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r516","rowIndex":516,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そう言って頭を下げ、そして早足で階段をのぼっていった。","en":"After saying that, she bowed and hurried up the stairs.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A2-2:r517","rowIndex":517,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=55>松子</tips>の姿が見えなくなると、僕と<tips=54>汐さん</tips>の溜息が重なる。","en":"Once <tips=55>Matsuko</tips> was out of sight, <tips=54>Mr. Shio</tips> and I sighed in unison.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}}]},{"position":8,"code":"A3","unitId":"A3","rows":[{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r1","rowIndex":1,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　この街には四季がない。","en":"This city has no seasons.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r2","rowIndex":2,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　一年中空がどんよりと曇って雨ばかりが降り、暑くなって上着が要らなくなれば夏、寒くなってコートが要るようになれば冬。","en":"All year long, the sky hangs heavy with cloud and the rain never seems to stop. When it grows warm enough to shed your jacket, it is summer; when it grows cold enough to need a coat, it is winter.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r3","rowIndex":3,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　空き地を見ればそこに自生する植物の変化で春と秋を感じることも出来るが、<tips=57>滑走路通り</tips>を毎日うろついているだけでは体感することはなく、暑いから寒いに切り替わる季節に、カレンダーの数字でも見ながら、ああいまは春なんだな、秋なんだなと思い出す程度のものだ。","en":"In a vacant lot, the changing wild plants might let you feel the arrival of spring and autumn. But if all you ever do is wander <tips=57>Runway Street</tips>, you never experience either one. Only as the weather shifts between heat and cold do the numbers on a calendar remind you: ah, so it is spring now—or autumn.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r4","rowIndex":4,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　もっとも、日本の繁華街の多くはそのようなものだろう。","en":"Then again, most entertainment districts in Japan are probably much the same.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r5","rowIndex":5,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　いま、暦の上では秋だ。まだ薄い上着一枚でもなんとかなるが、もうすぐマフラーや手袋なしでは外を歩きたくなくなるのだろう。","en":"By the calendar, it is autumn now. A light jacket will still just about do, but soon enough I will not want to venture outside without a scarf and gloves.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r6","rowIndex":6,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=4>馬明</tips>に呼び出された<tips=41>グランドタワー</tips>の一室で、<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>の病状が最終段階に入ったことを告げられた。","en":"<tips=4>Ma Ming</tips> summoned me to a room in the <tips=41>Grand Tower</tips>, where I was told that <tips=3>Chris Tse’s</tips> illness had entered its final stage.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r7","rowIndex":7,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　医師がことこまかに説明する会議室にいたのは、<tips=39>ジェフリー・ウォン</tips>、<tips=4>馬明</tips>、それから武器商人の<tips=31>エリー・ホワイト</tips>。","en":"As the doctor explained the situation in exhaustive detail, the others in the conference room were <tips=39>Jeffrey Wong</tips>, <tips=4>Ma Ming</tips>, and the arms dealer <tips=31>Ellie White</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r8","rowIndex":8,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=81>龍頭</tips>は今、昏睡と覚醒の間を行ったり来たりしています。段々昏睡している時間が長くなり、そして戻らなくなるでしょう。それは明日か、明後日……長くとも、三日後まではもちますまい」","en":"“The <tips=81>Longtou</tips> is now drifting in and out of consciousness. The periods of coma will gradually lengthen until, eventually, he no longer wakes. That may happen tomorrow, or the day after... At most, he has three days.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r9","rowIndex":9,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　今診察を終えたばかりの主治医は感情の抑揚のない静かな口調で告げる。","en":"Fresh from examining him, the attending physician delivered the news in a quiet, utterly dispassionate voice.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r10","rowIndex":10,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その時深い溜息がもれたのは、だれの口からかはわからなかった。","en":"A deep sigh escaped someone then, though I could not tell who had breathed it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r11","rowIndex":11,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　一昨日に彼の容体が急変してからここ二日ほど、僕たちは<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>の今後について話しあっていた。いまここで彼が死んでもその後のことは混乱なく執り行われるようになっている。","en":"For the two days since his condition suddenly worsened, we had been discussing the future of <tips=7>YS</tips>. Everything was now arranged so that, whenever he died, what followed could be carried out without confusion.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r12","rowIndex":12,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そういう意味では動揺したり焦ったりする必要はなかったのだが、実際その言葉を告げられると重苦しいものが胸のあたりに詰め込まれたような気分になるのも事実だった。","en":"In that sense, there was no reason for us to panic or rush. Yet when the words were actually spoken, I still felt as though something heavy had been wedged inside my chest.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r13","rowIndex":13,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　死の床についた父は<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>の幹部を招集するよう指示を出した。最期の別れをする時がやって来たのだ。","en":"From his deathbed, Father ordered the officers of <tips=7>YS</tips> summoned. The time had come for final farewells.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r14","rowIndex":14,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=4>馬明</tips>は事務方の構成員に伝えるべき内容を詳しく説明してから、ロビーのソファーにどっしりと腰をおろした。","en":"After giving one of the administrative staff detailed instructions on what was to be communicated, <tips=4>Ma Ming</tips> sank heavily onto a sofa in the lobby.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r15","rowIndex":15,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そこには先ほど会議室にいた四人がそのまま移動していたが、誰も何も言わず、重苦しい空気が漂っていた。","en":"The same four of us from the conference room had moved into the lobby, but no one spoke, and a leaden air hung over us.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r16","rowIndex":16,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なあ、こうして無言で顔をつきあわせていても仕方がない。誰が最初に来るか、賭けでもするかね？」","en":"“Listen, there’s no use sitting here in silence and staring at each other. Shall we bet on who arrives first?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬明","displayName":"Ma Ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r17","rowIndex":17,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=4>馬明</tips>はいつも通り陽気な調子でそう言ったが、その表面的な明るさの裏に横たわる沈鬱さは隠せない。","en":"<tips=4>Ma Ming</tips> spoke in his usual jovial tone, but it could not conceal the despondency beneath his outward cheer.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r18","rowIndex":18,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　笑っているのは口元だけで、目には疲労があらわれている。","en":"Only his mouth was smiling; the exhaustion showed in his eyes.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r19","rowIndex":19,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「通知はメールで一斉送信される。みな条件は同じだ。これで、誰が早くやって来るかを賭けにしようじゃないか」","en":"“The notice will go out to everyone by email at the same time. They’re all starting on equal footing, so let’s make a wager of it: who gets here first?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬明","displayName":"Ma Ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r20","rowIndex":20,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「私はそんな気分じゃないな」","en":"“I’m not in the mood for that.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ジェフリー・ウォン","displayName":"Jeffrey Wong","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r21","rowIndex":21,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=39>ジェフリー</tips>は謹直な態度を崩さずそう言った。白い額には蒼い血管が浮かび、目の下には濃い隈があらわれている。","en":"<tips=39>Jeffrey</tips> replied without relaxing his rigidly proper bearing. Blue veins stood out on his pale forehead, and deep shadows had formed beneath his eyes.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r22","rowIndex":22,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それは信頼する義兄弟を失うことへの悲しみか、偉大な英雄を失った組織の今後に対する不安から生まれたものかは窺い知ることが出来ない。","en":"Whether this was grief at the impending loss of a trusted sworn brother, or anxiety for the future of an organization about to lose its great hero, I could not tell.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r23","rowIndex":23,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=2>阿亮</tips>は？」","en":"“What about <tips=2>Leung</tips>?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬明","displayName":"Ma Ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r24","rowIndex":24,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「悪くない」","en":"“Not bad.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r25","rowIndex":25,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕も睡眠不足で、何もしないとうとうとしてしまう。","en":"I was short on sleep myself, and began to nod off whenever I sat idle.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r26","rowIndex":26,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=81>龍頭</tips>の死が確定した瞬間から、僕の身に何が起こるかはわからず、充分に休息と睡眠をとってこの場に来なければいけなかったが、そうはいかなかった。","en":"From the moment the <tips=81>Longtou’s</tips> death was confirmed, there was no telling what might happen to me. I should have made sure to rest and sleep enough before coming here, but that had proved impossible.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r27","rowIndex":27,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　いや、この死の場面に立ち会ってしまって良かったのだろうか？　この場所に顔を出して<tips=4>馬明</tips>たちと一緒に駆けつけてくる幹部を出迎えるということは、<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>の宣言を受け容れ、後継者への道を認めたのと同じことだ。","en":"No—was it really wise for me to be here at his deathbed? By showing my face and standing with <tips=4>Ma Ming</tips> and the others to receive the officers as they arrived, I was effectively accepting <tips=3>Chris Tse’s</tips> declaration and consenting to the path he had laid out for me as his successor.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r28","rowIndex":28,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>との繋がりを拒絶するつもりならこうなる前に何か手を打つべきだったが、何もしなかった。","en":"If I meant to reject all ties to <tips=7>YS</tips>, I should have done something before matters reached this point. But I had done nothing.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r29","rowIndex":29,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　――<tips=44>筱喬</tips>でもかっさらって街を逃げた方が良かったか？　このギャングがひしめき、サイキックまでも配置されたこのビルの中枢から？　それとも<tips=44>筱喬</tips>を置き去りにして一人でどこかへ消えるか？　それにしたって<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>の後継者をこの街の連中が放置しておくわけはないだろう。結局学生はやめて、身を隠すことになる。","en":"—Would I have been better off grabbing <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> and fleeing the city? From the heart of this building, packed with gangsters and guarded even by psychics? Or abandoning <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> and disappearing somewhere on my own? Even then, no one in this city would simply leave <tips=3>Chris Tse’s</tips> successor alone. I would end up dropping out of school and going into hiding.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r30","rowIndex":30,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そもそも逃げることなんか出来ないんだ。結婚式の招待状が来たときから、なんとなくそういう予感はしていた。いや、街を出ると決めた時から、いつか引き戻されることになるだろうと、心のどこかで思っていたのかもしれない。","en":"There had never been any escaping. I had vaguely sensed as much from the moment the wedding invitation arrived. No—perhaps, somewhere in my heart, I had known ever since I decided to leave the city that one day it would draw me back.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r31","rowIndex":31,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しかし、ただ一つだけ方法はある。","en":"There was, however, just one way.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r32","rowIndex":32,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それはちょっと禁じ手のようなもので、うまく行くかどうかは自信がない。ただうまく行けば、とりあえず僕が<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>の後継者を目指すなんていう必要はなくなるし、彼の死によって生まれるだろう混乱も起きない。","en":"It was something of a taboo move, and I had no confidence it would work. But if it did, there would be no need for me to set my sights on succeeding to <tips=7>YS</tips>, and the turmoil his death would otherwise cause could be avoided.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r33","rowIndex":33,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕は朝までその方法について検討していて、結論は出なかったけれども、今のところは、使うべきではないのかなという風に傾いている。","en":"I had spent until morning weighing that option without reaching a conclusion, but for now I was leaning against using it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r34","rowIndex":34,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　リスクが大きすぎるのだ。","en":"The risk was too great.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r35","rowIndex":35,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「何を賭ける？」","en":"“What shall we wager?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r36","rowIndex":36,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕はややこしいことについて考えるのをやめ、あくびをかみ殺しながらそう言った。","en":"I put the whole tangled question out of my mind and asked, stifling a yawn.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r37","rowIndex":37,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=2>阿亮</tips>は何が欲しい？」","en":"“What do you want, <tips=2>Leung</tips>?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬明","displayName":"Ma Ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r38","rowIndex":38,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　と言われても、すぐには思いつかなかった。","en":"Put on the spot, I could not think of anything right away.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r39","rowIndex":39,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　物として欲しいものなどは何もない。<tips=4>馬明</tips>と金を賭けても馬鹿馬鹿しいだけだろう。","en":"There was nothing in particular I wanted to own, and betting money with <tips=4>Ma Ming</tips> would be pointless.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r40","rowIndex":40,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうだな……僕が勝ったら<tips=25>世傑</tips>を街に呼び戻してくれ」","en":"“Let’s see... If I win, bring <tips=25>Sai-kit</tips> back to the city.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r41","rowIndex":41,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「えっ」","en":"“Huh?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬明","displayName":"Ma Ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r42","rowIndex":42,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　まったく想像していなかった言葉らしく、<tips=4>馬明</tips>は目を丸くする。","en":"The request was evidently the last thing <tips=4>Ma Ming</tips> had expected, and his eyes widened.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r43","rowIndex":43,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=25>馬世傑</tips>というのは、この街から追放されている彼の長男である。","en":"<tips=25>Ma Sai-kit</tips> was his eldest son, who had been banished from the city.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r44","rowIndex":44,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そりゃあ無理だよ。出来ない」","en":"“That’s impossible. I can’t.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬明","displayName":"Ma Ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r45","rowIndex":45,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「男らしくないな。そっちから何が欲しいか聞いたんじゃないか」","en":"“Not very manly of you. You’re the one who asked what I wanted.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r46","rowIndex":46,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「何だって、そんなことを望む？」","en":"“Why would you want that?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬明","displayName":"Ma Ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r47","rowIndex":47,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いや、僕だけこの街に引き戻されるのは不公平だから、幼なじみも道連れにしようと思っただけさ。……それに、<tips=4>馬明</tips>だって呼び戻す口実が欲しいだろ？」","en":"“It’s just that it would be unfair if I were the only one dragged back to this city, so I thought I’d take my childhood friend down with me. ...Besides, you want an excuse to call him back too, don’t you, <tips=4>Ma Ming</tips>?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r48","rowIndex":48,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕が言うと、彼は肩をすくめて溜息をつく。","en":"At that, he shrugged and sighed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r49","rowIndex":49,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……わかった。ただし、先に選ばせてくれよ」","en":"“...All right. But I get first pick.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬明","displayName":"Ma Ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r50","rowIndex":50,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いいよ。で、<tips=4>馬明</tips>は何がほしい？」","en":"“Fine. So what do you want, <tips=4>Ma Ming</tips>?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r51","rowIndex":51,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「おれが勝ったら、組織に入って兄貴の後継者になると約束してもらう」","en":"“If I win, you promise to join the organization and take our brother’s place as his successor.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬明","displayName":"Ma Ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r52","rowIndex":52,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……どちらにしろ、ここまで来て無関係ではいられないさ」","en":"“...Either way, with things this far along, I can’t stay uninvolved.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r53","rowIndex":53,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ふん、どうだか。お前はまた隙を見て抜け出すかもしれんからな」","en":"“Hmph. We’ll see. You may slip away again the first chance you get.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬明","displayName":"Ma Ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r54","rowIndex":54,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=4>馬明</tips>は頑としてこの条件を譲らないようだった。","en":"<tips=4>Ma Ming</tips> seemed determined not to budge on that condition.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r55","rowIndex":55,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「わかった。ただし、<tips=4>馬明</tips>の予想が僕の予想と同じだったら、賭けは不成立だ。事前に負けるとわかってる賭けはしたくないからね」","en":"“All right. But if <tips=4>Ma Ming’s</tips> prediction is the same as mine, the wager is off. I don’t care to bet when I know in advance that I’ll lose.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r56","rowIndex":56,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いいとも」","en":"“Fine by me.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬明","displayName":"Ma Ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r57","rowIndex":57,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　このやりとりに、最初不快な顔で見守っていた<tips=39>ジェフリー</tips>も、少し身を乗り出してきた。","en":"<tips=39>Jeffrey</tips>, who had initially watched this exchange with a look of displeasure, now leaned forward a little.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r58","rowIndex":58,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕が勝って<tips=4>馬明</tips>の長男が戻ってくるにしろ、<tips=4>馬明</tips>が勝って僕が後継者の約束をするにしろ、彼の立場からすれば興味深い結果ではあるのだ。","en":"Whether I won and <tips=4>Ma Ming’s</tips> eldest son returned, or <tips=4>Ma Ming</tips> won and I promised to become the successor, either outcome would be interesting from his perspective.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r59","rowIndex":59,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=2>阿亮</tips>、お前も随分とおごり高ぶったもんだな。おれの方が誰がどういうヤツかよくわかっている。お前に勝ち目はないぞ」","en":"“<tips=2>Leung</tips>, you’ve gotten awfully full of yourself. I know these men better than you do. You don’t stand a chance.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬明","displayName":"Ma Ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r60","rowIndex":60,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「御託はいいから早く言いなよ」","en":"“Spare me the speech and get on with it.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r61","rowIndex":61,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「最初に来るのは<tips=26>劉建志</tips>だ」","en":"“The first to arrive will be <tips=26>Ryu Kenshi</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬明","displayName":"Ma Ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r62","rowIndex":62,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=4>馬明</tips>はそういって独特のぎょろ目で僕を見る。","en":"<tips=4>Ma Ming</tips> fixed me with his distinctive bulging eyes.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r63","rowIndex":63,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「僕の予想とは違う」","en":"“That isn’t my prediction.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r64","rowIndex":64,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕は首を横に振ると、","en":"I shook my head.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r65","rowIndex":65,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「よし、じゃあおれの勝ちだ！」","en":"“Good! Then I’ve won!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬明","displayName":"Ma Ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r66","rowIndex":66,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼は自分の膝を手のひらでパンと叩く。","en":"He slapped his knee with a crack.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r67","rowIndex":67,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あいつは間違いなく最初にすっ飛んで来るぞ」","en":"“No question about it. He’ll come running before anyone else.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬明","displayName":"Ma Ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r68","rowIndex":68,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうかね」","en":"“Is that so?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r69","rowIndex":69,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうさ！　嫌われ者のゴロツキだったところを拾い上げ、組織の幹部にまで仕立て上げたのは他ならぬ兄貴なんだぞ。組織で一番兄貴を崇拝していると言っても過言じゃない。<tips=9>Y地区</tips>の狂犬と呼ばれていた男が、<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>に入ったら<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>の忠実な猟犬になったとよくからかわれている」","en":"“That’s right! It was our brother who picked him up when he was a hated hoodlum and made him an officer of the organization. It would be no exaggeration to say he worships our brother more than anyone else in the organization. People often joke that the man once called the Mad Dog of <tips=9>Y District</tips> became <tips=3>Chris Tse’s</tips> loyal hound the moment he joined <tips=7>YS</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬明","displayName":"Ma Ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r70","rowIndex":70,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どちらにしても犬か」","en":"“A dog either way, then.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r71","rowIndex":71,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まあ犬よばわりが相応しい男だよ」","en":"“Well, he’s the sort of man who deserves to be called a dog.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬明","displayName":"Ma Ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r72","rowIndex":72,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　どうも、<tips=4>馬明</tips>は忠誠心を評価しているわりには、<tips=26>劉建志</tips>自体にはあまり好意を持っていないようだ。","en":"For all the value <tips=4>Ma Ming</tips> placed on loyalty, he did not seem particularly fond of <tips=26>Ryu Kenshi</tips> himself.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r73","rowIndex":73,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「彼は確かに忠犬かもしれないが、そんなに早く来られるかね」","en":"“He may indeed be a loyal hound, but can he really get here that quickly?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r74","rowIndex":74,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「間違いなく最初に来る。いつだって、あいつは兄貴の命令とあればすっとんで来た。今だって、兄貴の病状が心配で、そわそわしながら連絡を待っているだろうよ。正直言って、この予想が<tips=2>阿亮</tips>と一致しなかったのが不思議なくらいだ。やっぱり、お前は<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>がどういう組織なのか理解していないようだな」","en":"“He’ll be the first here, no question. Whenever our brother gave an order, that man came running. Even now, he must be beside himself over our brother’s condition, waiting for word. Frankly, I can hardly believe you picked someone else, <tips=2>Leung</tips>. Just as I thought—you still don’t understand what kind of organization <tips=7>YS</tips> is.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬明","displayName":"Ma Ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r75","rowIndex":75,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=4>馬明</tips>は勝ち誇って言う。","en":"<tips=4>Ma Ming</tips> declared triumphantly.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r76","rowIndex":76,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「自信満々のところ申し訳ないが、<tips=4>馬明</tips>の予想は当たらない。来るのは別の人間だよ」","en":"“Sorry to spoil your confidence, <tips=4>Ma Ming</tips>, but your prediction is wrong. Someone else will get here first.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r77","rowIndex":77,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「お前は誰だと予想しているんだ？」","en":"“Then who are you betting on?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬明","displayName":"Ma Ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r78","rowIndex":78,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=27>廖志明</tips>さ」","en":"“<tips=27>Liao Chi-ming</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r79","rowIndex":79,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あっははは！　それは正気で言っているのかい？　あの男が、兄貴のために血相変えて駆けつけてくることなんかあるわけないだろう！　兄貴が元気な時だって、およそ礼儀というものを知らなかったのだぞ？　今だって、こんなに早く死ぬことを誰よりも嬉しがっているに違いない。<tips=2>阿亮</tips>は、存外賭けが下手だな！」","en":"“Ah-ha-ha-ha! Are you serious? That man would never come racing here in a panic for our brother’s sake! He never had the slightest notion of courtesy even when our brother was well. I’m sure he’s happier than anyone that our brother is going to die so soon. You’re a surprisingly poor gambler, <tips=2>Leung</tips>!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬明","displayName":"Ma Ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r80","rowIndex":80,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=4>馬明</tips>はそう言って、おかしくて堪えきれないという風に笑う。","en":"<tips=4>Ma Ming</tips> laughed as though he simply could not contain himself.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r81","rowIndex":81,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「結果はすぐに出るさ」","en":"“We’ll know the result soon enough.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r82","rowIndex":82,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼の態度があまりにも小馬鹿にしたものだったので、説明する気も失せてそう呟くと、","en":"His manner was so openly derisive that I no longer felt like explaining myself, and merely muttered the answer.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r83","rowIndex":83,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=1>謝亮</tips>、その予想はどんな理由で？」","en":"“<tips=1>Tse Leung</tips>, what leads you to that prediction?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ジェフリー・ウォン","displayName":"Jeffrey Wong","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r84","rowIndex":84,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　興味深そうに尋ねたのは、<tips=4>馬明</tips>ではなく<tips=39>ジェフリー</tips>だった。","en":"It was <tips=39>Jeffrey</tips>, not <tips=4>Ma Ming</tips>, who asked with interest.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r85","rowIndex":85,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それはね、<tips=39>ジェフリー</tips>」","en":"“You see, <tips=39>Jeffrey</tips>...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r86","rowIndex":86,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕は笑っている<tips=4>馬明</tips>にではなく、彼だけに説明するつもりで向き直り、","en":"I turned away from the laughing <tips=4>Ma Ming</tips> and faced Jeffrey, as if explaining it to him alone.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r87","rowIndex":87,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そりゃ<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>には何の個人的感情もないだろう。だけれど、彼は<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>の後釜を狙ってるわけだし、その人気だって理解している。用意周到に準備していると考えるのが自然だろう」","en":"“Of course he feels no personal attachment to <tips=3>Chris Tse</tips>. But he’s after <tips=3>Chris Tse’s</tips> position, and he knows how popular the man is. Naturally, he’ll have prepared for this very carefully.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r88","rowIndex":88,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なるほど」","en":"“I see.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ジェフリー・ウォン","displayName":"Jeffrey Wong","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r89","rowIndex":89,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それで<tips=39>ジェフリー</tips>は納得したが、","en":"That satisfied <tips=39>Jeffrey</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r90","rowIndex":90,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どういう意味だ」","en":"“What does that mean?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬明","displayName":"Ma Ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r91","rowIndex":91,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=4>馬明</tips>はまだ納得が出来ないようだった。","en":"<tips=4>Ma Ming</tips>, however, still appeared unable to follow.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r92","rowIndex":92,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「相変わらず察しが悪いなあ」","en":"“Slow on the uptake as ever, I see.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r93","rowIndex":93,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕があきれて言うと、","en":"I said in exasperation.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r94","rowIndex":94,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いいから、もっとわかりやすく説明してもらおうか」","en":"“Never mind. Explain it more clearly.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬明","displayName":"Ma Ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r95","rowIndex":95,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=4>馬明</tips>は口をへの字に曲げて要求する。","en":"<tips=4>Ma Ming</tips> demanded, his mouth twisted into a frown.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r96","rowIndex":96,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「充分わかりやすいと思うけど。それに、自分の予想に絶対の自信があるんじゃないの？」","en":"“I think that was perfectly clear. Besides, weren’t you absolutely confident in your own prediction?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r97","rowIndex":97,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あるさ。だけれど、<tips=2>阿亮</tips>がどういう考え方をするのかというのも知っておくべきだろう。今後のためにも」","en":"“Of course I am. But I ought to know how <tips=2>Leung</tips> thinks, too. It may come in handy later.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬明","displayName":"Ma Ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r98","rowIndex":98,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　へんな理屈をこねだしたものだ。","en":"That was quite a rationale he had concocted.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r99","rowIndex":99,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……いいかい<tips=4>馬明</tips>」","en":"“Look, <tips=4>Ma Ming</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r100","rowIndex":100,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕はしかたなく、彼の目を見てゆっくりと話す。","en":"Having no choice, I met his eyes and began to explain slowly.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r101","rowIndex":101,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=27>廖志明</tips>は街でも組織内でも評価は高いが人気がない。今後<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>の後釜を狙うのなら、もうちょっと組織内での人気が欲しいところだ。少しでもこのリーダーの死に早く駆けつけて、忠誠心や愛情といったものをアピールするのは、彼の印象を変えるだろう。世間でだって、金持ちが死にそうになると、疎遠だったはずの親戚が急に前から好きだったみたいな素振りを見せるじゃないか」","en":"“<tips=27>Liao Chi-ming</tips> is highly regarded both in the city and within the organization, but he isn’t popular. If he means to take over <tips=7>YS</tips>, he could use a little more support within its ranks. Getting to the leader’s deathbed before anyone else and making a show of loyalty and affection would improve people’s opinion of him. You see the same thing everywhere: the moment a rich man is dying, relatives who had supposedly grown distant begin acting as though they had always adored him.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r102","rowIndex":102,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そんなあからさまなことをするかねえ？」","en":"“Would he really do something that blatant?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬明","displayName":"Ma Ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r103","rowIndex":103,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そりゃするでしょう。少なくてもやらないよりはマシだし、大した手間でもない。それに、彼には強い自信があるから、自分が一芝居打ったときの効果を高く見積もるだろう」","en":"“Of course he would. At the very least, it can’t hurt, and it would hardly take any effort. Besides, he has enormous confidence in himself, so he’s bound to overestimate what a little performance can accomplish.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r104","rowIndex":104,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そんなみっともない……」","en":"“How undignified...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬明","displayName":"Ma Ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r105","rowIndex":105,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=4>馬明</tips>は腑に落ちてはいないようだ。","en":"<tips=4>Ma Ming</tips> still did not appear convinced.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r106","rowIndex":106,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あいつが兄貴のことをなめてるのは誰だって知っている。今さらそんなことをしたところで誰も騙されないだろう」","en":"“Everyone knows that man has no respect for our brother. No one would be fooled if he tried something like that now.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬明","displayName":"Ma Ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r107","rowIndex":107,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうかな。……たとえば、普段はスカしているあの<tips=27>廖志明</tips>が、<tips=81>龍頭</tips>の最期の場面には汗だくになって、髪の毛も整えず、息を弾ませてやってくる……なんていう白々しい茶番をやったとして、彼のことをよく知らない若いメンバーなんかはそれを見たらコロッと騙されちゃうんじゃないかな。ベテランだって、悪くは思わないだろう。こういうのは、ポーズでもなんでも、やることが大事なんだ。織田信長が死んだ時に、秀吉が最初に帰って来たのが有利に働いたのと同じだよ」","en":"“I’m not so sure. ...Imagine <tips=27>Liao Chi-ming</tips>, aloof as ever, turning up at the <tips=81>Longtou’s</tips> deathbed drenched in sweat, hair disheveled, gasping for breath. The whole thing would be a transparent charade, but younger members who don’t know him well might swallow it whole. Even the veterans wouldn’t hold it against him. With these things, what matters is making the gesture, sincere or not. It would be just like how being the first back after Oda Nobunaga’s death worked in Hideyoshi’s favor.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r108","rowIndex":108,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「最後のたとえはよくわからんが」","en":"“I don’t really follow that last comparison.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬明","displayName":"Ma Ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r109","rowIndex":109,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「日本では有名な史実だ」","en":"“It’s a famous event in Japanese history.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r110","rowIndex":110,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「うむ……」","en":"“Hmm...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬明","displayName":"Ma Ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r111","rowIndex":111,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=4>馬明</tips>は腕組みをして、","en":"<tips=4>Ma Ming</tips> folded his arms.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r112","rowIndex":112,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「お前はどう思う？」","en":"“What do you think?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬明","displayName":"Ma Ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r113","rowIndex":113,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=39>ジェフリー</tips>に尋ねるが、彼は肩をすくめてコメントを避ける。","en":"He put the question to <tips=39>Jeffrey</tips>, who merely shrugged and declined to comment.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r114","rowIndex":114,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そこに、<tips=4>馬明</tips>の部下がやって来て、彼に耳打ちをする。","en":"Then one of <tips=4>Ma Ming’s</tips> subordinates approached and whispered in his ear.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r115","rowIndex":115,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「メールを送信したそうだ。これでレースのはじまりだな」","en":"“Apparently the email has gone out. Now the race begins.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬明","displayName":"Ma Ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r116","rowIndex":116,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まあ、結果はすぐに出るよ」","en":"“We’ll know the result soon enough.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r117","rowIndex":117,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕は背もたれに寄りかかり、胸の中に淀んだ空気を一息に吐いた。","en":"I leaned back against the sofa and let all the stale air trapped in my chest escape in a single breath.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r118","rowIndex":118,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　三人とも黙り込み、ロビーには沈黙が生まれる。向こうのエレベーターの前で待機している部下の咳払いが、床や天井に反響する。","en":"All three of us fell silent, and a hush settled over the lobby. A subordinate waiting by the distant elevators cleared his throat, the sound echoing off the floor and ceiling.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r119","rowIndex":119,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　さて、僕の思惑通り<tips=27>廖志明</tips>が最初に来るだろうか？","en":"Now then, would <tips=27>Liao Chi-ming</tips> arrive first, just as I had calculated?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r120","rowIndex":120,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　もし来たとしたら、彼が部屋に入ってくるその足音が、<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>の相続争い開始の合図となるわけだ。","en":"If he did, the sound of his footsteps entering the room would signal the beginning of the succession struggle for <tips=7>YS</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r121","rowIndex":121,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　面倒だな、と思う。","en":"What a nuisance, I thought.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r122","rowIndex":122,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　もちろん何の波乱もなく<tips=81>龍頭</tips>の遺言通り進めばいいのだが、そんな風に思っているものはここにはいないだろう。","en":"Of course, it would be best if everything proceeded without incident according to the <tips=81>Longtou’s</tips> wishes, but no one here believed it would go that smoothly.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r123","rowIndex":123,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　偉大なるカリスマが死ねば、何らかの形で問題が巻き起こるのは当然のことだ。あらかじめ打てる手は打ってはいるだろうけれど、それには限界がある。","en":"Whenever a great, charismatic leader dies, turmoil of some kind is inevitable. Every possible precaution had surely been taken in advance, but there were limits to what preparation could accomplish.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r124","rowIndex":124,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　予期しないことが起きないとも限らない。","en":"Something unforeseen might very well happen.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r125","rowIndex":125,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　この問題を回避する方法は、そう、たった一つしかない。","en":"There was only one way to avoid this problem.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r126","rowIndex":126,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕は今朝まで考えていた全てを解決する方法のことを、また考えていた。","en":"My thoughts returned to the plan I had spent all night considering—a way to solve everything.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r127","rowIndex":127,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　結局、問題は簡単なのだ。まだ若い<tips=81>龍頭</tips>がこんなに早く死んでしまうのがいけない。","en":"In the end, the problem was simple: the <tips=81>Longtou</tips> was still young, and he was dying far too soon.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r128","rowIndex":128,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　もし彼が頑健な肉体と意欲に満ちた精神を持って、死の淵から戻ってくれば、彼の寿命が尽きるまでは何も心配することはない。<tips=4>馬明</tips>のわずかに残った頭髪がこれ以上抜け落ちるのをある程度は防げるだろうし、青ざめる一方の<tips=39>ジェフリー</tips>の顔色もいくらか健康的になるかもしれない。そして、少なくとも、僕がしゃしゃり出る必要は全くなくなるだろう。僕は全く面倒な数日間だったと溜息をついて街を出て大学に戻ればいい。","en":"If he returned from the brink of death with a robust body and a spirit full of vigor, there would be nothing more to worry about until the end of his natural life. It might keep what little hair <tips=4>Ma Ming</tips> had left from falling out, and perhaps put some color back into <tips=39>Jeffrey’s</tips> ever-paling face. At the very least, there would be no need whatsoever for me to stick my neck out. I could sigh over what a troublesome few days it had all been, leave the city, and go back to university.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r129","rowIndex":129,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　つまり、僕の考えていたプランというのは、<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>を死ななくする方法である。あの日<tips=54>汐さん</tips>が冗談めかして言っていたことを、僕は改めて検討していた。","en":"In other words, the plan I had been considering was a way to stop <tips=3>Chris Tse</tips> from dying. I had reconsidered the suggestion <tips=54>Mr. Shio</tips> had made half in jest that day.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r130","rowIndex":130,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　――<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips><tips=81>龍頭</tips><tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>を不死身の<tips=97>特殊タイプＢ</tips>にしたらいいのでは？","en":"—Why not turn <tips=3>Chris Tse</tips>, the <tips=81>Longtou</tips> of <tips=7>YS</tips>, into an immortal <tips=97>special Type B</tips>?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r131","rowIndex":131,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　マウスを使った実験では、何匹かが虎から生命力を受け継ぐことが出来た。","en":"In the experiment with the mice, several had managed to inherit the tiger’s vitality.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r132","rowIndex":132,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　あの再生力ならば、医師が見放した不治の病も、回復させることが出来るかもしれない。","en":"With regenerative power like that, even a disease the doctors had deemed incurable might be overcome.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r133","rowIndex":133,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　虎の体組織はもう存在しないが、しかし僕らにはかわりがある。しかもそれは虎よりもさらに上の<tips=72>傾向値</tips>を持ったサンプルだ。","en":"The tiger’s tissue no longer existed, but we had a substitute—and it was a sample with an even higher <tips=72>tendency value</tips> than the tiger’s.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r134","rowIndex":134,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ようするに、今から<tips=55>松子</tips>に連絡をしてここへ来させ、その手首でも切って血液を<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>にすすらせてみたらどうかと言っているのだ。","en":"In other words, I was contemplating calling <tips=55>Matsuko</tips> here now, having her wrist slit, and seeing what happened if <tips=3>Chris Tse</tips> drank her blood.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r135","rowIndex":135,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　父の命を救いたい、と言えばおそらく<tips=55>松子</tips>は反対しない。むしろ自分から血液を提供したいと言い出すかも知れない。そこは障害にはならないだろう。","en":"If I told her I wanted to save Father’s life, <tips=55>Matsuko</tips> would probably not object. She might even volunteer her blood herself. That part of the plan would pose no obstacle.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r136","rowIndex":136,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　問題は他にいくつかあって、まず第一に、そもそも目論見通り<tips=97>特殊タイプＢ</tips>化が成功するのかという点。","en":"There were several other problems. The first was whether the transformation into a <tips=97>special Type B</tips> would succeed as intended in the first place.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r137","rowIndex":137,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　虎とマウスではある程度兆しは見えたが、しかし六匹のうち五匹は気が狂ったり死亡し、残った一匹も元の虎ほどの生命力はなかった。試行回数も少ないし、単純に六分の一の確率というわけではなく、極めてレアなケースを引いただけかもしれない。それを、人間で試して同じように成功するという保証はなく、完全な博打だろう。","en":"The tiger-and-mouse experiment had shown some promise, but five of the six mice had either gone mad or died, and even the survivor possessed less vitality than the original tiger. With so few trials, the odds were not simply one in six; we might merely have chanced upon an extraordinarily rare case. There was no guarantee the same experiment would work on a human being. It would be a total gamble.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r138","rowIndex":138,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そもそも、今までも<tips=55>松子</tips>の血液を使った実験では一度も成功したことがない。","en":"In the first place, none of our previous experiments using <tips=55>Matsuko’s</tips> blood had ever succeeded.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r139","rowIndex":139,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そう、僕と<tips=54>汐さん</tips>はかつてあの地下室で<tips=55>松子</tips>の協力を元に、彼女の例を見ないあの不思議な体質を研究していたのである。<tips=54>汐さん</tips>は元々<tips=17>タイプＢ</tips>専門の科学者であったし、僕は好奇心の強い子供だった。","en":"Yes: with <tips=55>Matsuko’s</tips> cooperation, <tips=54>Mr. Shio</tips> and I had once studied that strange constitution of hers, unlike any other, in the basement. <tips=54>Mr. Shio</tips> had been a scientist specializing in <tips=17>Type B</tips>, and I had been an inquisitive child.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r140","rowIndex":140,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕らは遊びの延長のつもりだったが、結局その実験は中断されることとなって――いや、そのことは今はいい。","en":"We had thought of it as little more than an extension of our games, but in the end the experiments had to be abandoned—and no, that does not matter now.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r141","rowIndex":141,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　とにかく、かつても彼女の血液をマウスの飼料に混ぜて与えるというテストも行ったのだが、そこではほとんど良好な結果は得られなかったのだ。","en":"In any event, we had also tested mixing her blood into the mice’s feed, and those tests had produced almost no favorable results.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r142","rowIndex":142,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　虎の傾向値は２７００だったが、<tips=55>松子</tips>の傾向値は５３００をこえている。この極めて高い<tips=72>傾向値</tips>は、ほんの数滴の血液を飲ませただけのノーマルマウスを即座に<tips=17>タイプB</tips>化、あるいは死亡させるほどのものだった。","en":"The tiger’s tendency value had been 2,700, while <tips=55>Matsuko’s</tips> exceeded 5,300. Just a few drops of blood carrying that extraordinarily high <tips=72>tendency value</tips> were enough either to transform a Normal mouse instantly into <tips=17>Type B</tips> or to kill it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r143","rowIndex":143,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして多くのマウスを実験材料にしたが、結局その時は<tips=55>松子</tips>のような再生能力を持つ個体を作り出すことは出来ないまま終わった。","en":"We used many mice as experimental subjects, but in the end we never managed to produce one with regenerative abilities like <tips=55>Matsuko’s</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r144","rowIndex":144,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　だが、今回はあの時とは違う。その後僕らはあの虎と出会った。この虎も不死身の力を持ち、しかも『<tips=18>ローズ・クラブ</tips>』の死なない女のショーで使われていた個体だったのだ。","en":"But this time was different. Since then, we had encountered the tiger. It, too, possessed the power of immortality—and it was the very animal that had appeared in the <tips=18>Rose Club’s</tips> undying-woman show.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r145","rowIndex":145,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　この虎は死なない女の身体を生きたまま喰らい、そして特殊化した。僕らが<tips=55>松子</tips>で何度も実験しても成功しなかったのに、である。","en":"The tiger had fed on the undying woman while she was still alive, and had become specialized. Our repeated experiments with <tips=55>Matsuko</tips>, meanwhile, had never once succeeded.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r146","rowIndex":146,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　一体何が違うのか？","en":"What, exactly, had been different?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r147","rowIndex":147,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕らは考えた末、一つ違いを見つけた。<tips=55>松子</tips>のときは採取した血液を別容器にとって保存して、そこからマウスに与えていた。一方虎は直接相手に囓りついていた。一旦別にとったからといって成分的には差がないようだが、しかし、現実にはこういう何でも無いような差が結果を変えることがある。特に、<tips=16>タイプA</tips>――サイキックを対象にした実験では、理屈上は何も変わらないような違いでも、結果に影響を及ぼす。そういう意味では、魔術のようなものに近いのかもしれない。","en":"After considering the question, we found one difference. With <tips=55>Matsuko</tips>, we had collected the blood in a separate container, stored it, and then fed it to the mice. The tiger, by contrast, had bitten directly into its subject. Removing it first should not have changed its composition, but in reality, seemingly trivial differences can alter the result. Especially in experiments involving <tips=16>Type A</tips>—psychics—even distinctions that should theoretically change nothing can affect the outcome. In that sense, perhaps it is closer to magic.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r148","rowIndex":148,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　常識をこえた力をもつ<tips=97>特殊タイプＢ</tips>にも、そのような魔術的な要素があったとしてもおかしくはない。","en":"For <tips=97>special Type Bs</tips>, whose powers defied common sense, some such element of magic would hardly be surprising.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r149","rowIndex":149,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして実際、今回の実験ではマウスに特殊化の兆候が見られた。","en":"And in fact, this experiment had shown signs of specialization in the mice.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r150","rowIndex":150,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　これで仮説が証明されたわけではないが、しかし、少なくとも、予想された結果を導くことは出来たのだ。","en":"That did not prove the hypothesis, but at the very least, we had managed to produce the predicted result.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r151","rowIndex":151,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　だから、今回父に<tips=55>松子</tips>の血を直接飲ませれば、彼が不死身の力を得るという可能性はゼロではない。","en":"Therefore, if Father drank <tips=55>Matsuko’s</tips> blood directly, there was at least some chance that he might acquire the same immortal power.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r152","rowIndex":152,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　――しかし、失敗してしまったら？","en":"—But what if it failed?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r153","rowIndex":153,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　今回の実験だって、六匹のマウスのうち五匹は、気が狂ったり、死亡してしまっている。","en":"Even in this experiment, five of the six mice had either gone mad or died.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r154","rowIndex":154,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>に与えて、元より寿命のない病人の命を縮めるだけならばまだいい。しかし、気の狂った<tips=17>タイプB</tips>になってしまったら？","en":"It would still be one thing if giving it to <tips=3>Chris Tse</tips> merely shortened the life of a terminal patient with virtually no time left. But what if he became a deranged <tips=17>Type B</tips>?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r155","rowIndex":155,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>はこの街にとって影響力の強いリーダーだ。身体が弱った今こそ勢力が衰えてしまったが、身体が健康になれば再びかつての威光を取り戻すに違いない。その上で正気を失ってしまったら、どう対処するべきか。殺害しなくてはいけないのだろうが、彼は不死身の再生力と<tips=17>タイプＢ</tips>としての並外れた身体能力を得て、しかも生まれつきの優れたサイキック能力がある。","en":"<tips=3>Chris Tse</tips> was a leader of immense influence in this city. His power had waned only because his body had weakened; restored to health, he would surely recover his former prestige. If he then lost his sanity, how could we possibly deal with him? We would have to kill him—but he would possess immortal regenerative power, the extraordinary physical abilities of a <tips=17>Type B</tips>, and the exceptional psychic gifts he had possessed from birth.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r156","rowIndex":156,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　被害をゼロにするのは難しいだろうし、偉大な創業者を狂った猛獣扱いして狩り殺したあと組織に何が残るのか。","en":"It would be difficult to contain the damage entirely—and after treating our great founder like a rabid beast and hunting him down, what would remain of the organization?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r157","rowIndex":157,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして、もっと悪いシナリオもある。","en":"And there was an even worse scenario.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r158","rowIndex":158,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=17>タイプＢ</tips>はみなあきらかに狂ってしまうわけではなく、そこまでに至る段階がある。つまり、一見正気に見えても何か妄想にとりつかれていたり、わけのわからない思い込みに囚われてしまう可能性もある。再生された父がほとんど正気でありながら、見えないところに狂気を潜ませていたら？　周りの者はだれも気づかず、これまで通り彼に従うことになるだろう。そうなった場合、どんな結末が訪れるか想像も出来ない。","en":"Not every <tips=17>Type B</tips> becomes visibly insane all at once; there are stages along the way. Someone who appears sane may still be possessed by a delusion or captive to some incomprehensible conviction. What if Father came back largely sane, but with madness lurking somewhere out of sight? No one around him would notice, and they would go on obeying him as before. I could not imagine where that would lead.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r159","rowIndex":159,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　街を支配するギャングのボスが狂ってしまえば、この街全体が狂気にさらされることになる。","en":"If the gang boss who ruled the city went mad, the whole city would be placed at the mercy of his madness.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r160","rowIndex":160,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　いや、たとえ正気が保てたとしてもだ。元々巨大な権力と、サイキック能力を持っていた男が、不死身の肉体まで身につけてしまうのだ。たとえ病気の影響などなくとも、彼はそれまでどおりの人間でいられるのだろうか？　彼は本来の理性や判断力を維持した上で人格を歪めてしまうかもしれない。","en":"No—even if he remained sane. A man who already possessed immense power and psychic abilities would acquire an immortal body as well. Even if the disease itself left no mark on his mind, could he remain the man he had always been? His reason and judgment might remain intact even as his personality grew distorted.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r161","rowIndex":161,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　もしかしたら、これが一番最悪の展開かもしれない。","en":"Perhaps that would be the worst outcome of all.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r162","rowIndex":162,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=54>汐さん</tips>は安易に提案してくれたけれども、どう考えても、分の良い賭けだとは思えない。","en":"<tips=54>Mr. Shio</tips> had suggested it so casually, but no matter how I looked at it, the odds were poor.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r163","rowIndex":163,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　これで、このことをもし<tips=44>筱喬</tips>に相談したら、何が何でもチャレンジしろと言うだろうな。助けるために全てを尽くせと。","en":"If I consulted <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> about it, she would tell me to attempt it at any cost—to do everything in my power to save him.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r164","rowIndex":164,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それはとても素晴らしいことだ。遮二無二親の生存を望むというのは子供としてはあるべき姿だろう。僕も息子なのだから本来そうすべきなのかもしれない。","en":"That was a wonderful thing. Desperately wishing for a parent to survive was surely how a child ought to feel. Since I was his son, perhaps I ought to do the same.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r165","rowIndex":165,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しかし――。","en":"But—","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r166","rowIndex":166,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　最初の来訪者は思ったより早くやって来た。","en":"The first visitor arrived sooner than I expected.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r167","rowIndex":167,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　沈黙がはじまってすぐに火を付けた<tips=4>馬明</tips>の煙草がまだ半分ほど残っている。","en":"The cigarette <tips=4>Ma Ming</tips> had lit as the silence began was still only about half smoked.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r168","rowIndex":168,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　メール送信から１０分も経っていないだろう。我々の側に控えている秘書代わりの部下が携帯電話を取り出す。幹部の誰かが車で駐車場にやって来て、相手の運転手とやりとりをしているようだ。","en":"It could not have been ten minutes since the email went out. The subordinate serving as our secretary took out his phone. One of the officers had apparently arrived in the parking lot by car, and the subordinate was speaking with his driver.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r169","rowIndex":169,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いくら何でも早すぎる。もしかして、<tips=27>廖志明</tips>は近くの喫茶店で待機でもしていたんじゃないか？」","en":"“That’s far too fast. Could <tips=27>Liao Chi-ming</tips> have been lying in wait at some nearby café?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r170","rowIndex":170,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕は思わず首をひねる。","en":"I could not help wondering.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r171","rowIndex":171,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いやいや、<tips=26>劉建志</tips>が飛んできたのさ。あいつはなんでも行動が早いからな。……おい、お前、誰が来たか言わなくていいからな。その姿を実際に見ることで、結果発表としようじゃないか」","en":"“Nonsense. That’ll be <tips=26>Ryu Kenshi</tips>—he’s come flying over. The man never wastes time on anything. ...Hey, don’t tell us who it is. Let’s wait until we see him and make that the grand reveal.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬明","displayName":"Ma Ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r172","rowIndex":172,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=4>馬明</tips>はちょうど通話を終えた部下にそう言った。","en":"<tips=4>Ma Ming</tips> addressed the subordinate, who had just ended the call.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r173","rowIndex":173,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しかし、やって来たのは<tips=4>馬明</tips>が予想した<tips=26>劉建志</tips>ではなく、また、僕が予想した<tips=27>廖志明</tips>でもなかった。","en":"But the man who arrived was neither <tips=26>Ryu Kenshi</tips>, whom <tips=4>Ma Ming</tips> had predicted, nor <tips=27>Liao Chi-ming</tips>, my own choice.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r174","rowIndex":174,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「これはこれは、<tips=69>義勝</tips>のみなさんおそろいで。いやあ、びっくりしましたよ。<tips=81>龍頭</tips>がもうそんな状態だとはねえ」","en":"“Well, well—the whole <tips=69>Yisheng</tips> contingent is here. What a shock. I had no idea the <tips=81>Longtou</tips> was already in such a condition.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ダリオ・ボネット","displayName":"Dario Bonetto","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r175","rowIndex":175,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　脂ぎってテカテカとした顔にわざとらしい悲痛の表情を浮かべたのは、でっぷりと太った<tips=9>Y地区</tips>のカジノ王<tips=34>ダリオ・ボネット</tips>である。","en":"The man whose greasy, gleaming face wore a theatrically anguished expression was <tips=34>Dario Bonetto</tips>, the corpulent casino king of <tips=9>Y District</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r176","rowIndex":176,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=34>ダリオ</tips>さん、どうしてこんなに早く？」","en":"“Mr. <tips=34>Bonetto</tips>, how did you arrive so quickly?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬明","displayName":"Ma Ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r177","rowIndex":177,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=4>馬明</tips>はあからさまに不機嫌になってそう尋ねる。","en":"<tips=4>Ma Ming</tips> asked, openly disgruntled.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r178","rowIndex":178,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「え、いや、ちょうど<tips=81>龍頭</tips>のお見舞いに来ようと思いたちましてね、車が<tips=41>グランドタワー</tips>に着いたところで、通知を受け取ったんです。それで、そのまま上がって来たんですが？」","en":"“What? No, I had just decided to visit the <tips=81>Longtou</tips>, you see. My car had reached the <tips=41>Grand Tower</tips> when I received the notice, so I came straight up. Was that wrong?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ダリオ・ボネット","displayName":"Dario Bonetto","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r179","rowIndex":179,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=4>馬明</tips>の顔を見て<tips=34>ダリオ</tips>は戸惑っている。まあ、彼からすればこんな仏頂面は理解不能だろう。","en":"<tips=34>Dario</tips> looked bewildered by <tips=4>Ma Ming’s</tips> expression. From his perspective, of course, the sour face made no sense at all.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r180","rowIndex":180,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「おめでとう。あんたが一番乗りだ」","en":"“Congratulations. You’re the first to arrive.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬明","displayName":"Ma Ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r181","rowIndex":181,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=4>馬明</tips>はやはり機嫌の悪さを隠さない。","en":"<tips=4>Ma Ming</tips> still made no attempt to hide his ill humor.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r182","rowIndex":182,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「え、あ、ああ、そうですか。それは良かった」","en":"“What? Ah—yes, I see. Well, that’s good.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ダリオ・ボネット","displayName":"Dario Bonetto","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r183","rowIndex":183,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まあ、そこにお座りください」","en":"“Please, have a seat over there.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ジェフリー・ウォン","displayName":"Jeffrey Wong","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r184","rowIndex":184,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　戸惑う<tips=34>ダリオ</tips>に<tips=39>ジェフリー</tips>は椅子をすすめる。","en":"<tips=39>Jeffrey</tips> offered the bewildered <tips=34>Dario</tips> a chair.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r185","rowIndex":185,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=2>阿亮</tips>、どちらの予想も当たらなかった場合はどうする？」","en":"“<tips=2>Leung</tips>, what do we do if neither prediction was right?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬明","displayName":"Ma Ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r186","rowIndex":186,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「仕方ない。自分が賭けた馬が先に来た方を勝ちにしよう」","en":"“It can’t be helped. Whoever’s horse arrives first wins.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r187","rowIndex":187,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうだな。しかし、一番手が<tips=34>ダリオ</tips>さんというのは、なんだか釈然としないが……」","en":"“That’s true. Still, <tips=34>Dario</tips> taking first place somehow doesn’t sit well with me...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬明","displayName":"Ma Ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r188","rowIndex":188,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「仕方ないさ。本人だって悪気があってのことじゃないんだから」","en":"“It can’t be helped. It’s not as though he meant any harm.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r189","rowIndex":189,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あ、あの、今はお邪魔しては悪いタイミングだったのかな？」","en":"“Um, was this perhaps a bad time for me to intrude?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ダリオ・ボネット","displayName":"Dario Bonetto","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r190","rowIndex":190,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　こそこそ耳打ちで会話する僕らを見ながら、<tips=34>ダリオ</tips>は<tips=39>ジェフリー</tips>にそう尋ねる。","en":"Watching the two of us whisper together, <tips=34>Dario</tips> put the question to <tips=39>Jeffrey</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r191","rowIndex":191,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いえ、とんでもありません。それより、準備がお済みなら、<tips=81>龍頭</tips>とお会いになりますか？　……<tips=4>馬明</tips>、<tips=1>謝亮</tips>、我々は<tips=34>ダリオ</tips>様に同席して……」","en":"“No, not at all. More importantly, if you are ready, would you like to see the <tips=81>Longtou</tips>? ...<tips=4>Ma Ming</tips>, <tips=1>Tse Leung</tips>, we should accompany <tips=34>Mr. Bonetto</tips> and—”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ジェフリー・ウォン","displayName":"Jeffrey Wong","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r192","rowIndex":192,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして<tips=39>ジェフリー</tips>が立ち上がろうとした時に、もう一度<tips=4>馬明</tips>の部下が携帯電話を取り出す。","en":"Just as <tips=39>Jeffrey</tips> began to rise, <tips=4>Ma Ming’s</tips> subordinate took out his cell phone again.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r193","rowIndex":193,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「誰だ？」","en":"“Who is it?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r194","rowIndex":194,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=4>馬明</tips>は今度は待ちきれずに、通話をしている途中の部下に問う。","en":"This time <tips=4>Ma Ming</tips> could not wait, and questioned the subordinate while he was still on the phone.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r195","rowIndex":195,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……<tips=27>廖志明</tips>様です」","en":"“...<tips=27>Mr. Liao Chi-ming</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r196","rowIndex":196,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その言葉に、彼はふうと溜息をついて、ソファーに体をうずめた。","en":"At the name, Ma Ming released a long breath and sank into the sofa.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r197","rowIndex":197,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「諸君。まったく、ひどい天気だな」","en":"“Gentlemen. Absolutely dreadful weather.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"廖志明","displayName":"Liao Chi-ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r198","rowIndex":198,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　部下と共にエレベーターを降りてきた<tips=27>廖志明</tips>は開口一番そう言った。","en":"That was the first thing <tips=27>Liao Chi-ming</tips> said as he stepped out of the elevator with his subordinates.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r199","rowIndex":199,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼はゴルフウェアを身につけ、体中をびしょ濡れにして、疲弊した感じを前面に押し出している。","en":"He wore golfing clothes, his body drenched from head to foot, and made a great display of his exhaustion.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r200","rowIndex":200,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いやあ、庭で傘を差して雨中のパターの練習をしていたら、突然の通知じゃないか。着替えている時間も惜しく、そのままやって来たんだが、途中で車が故障してしまってね。久しぶりに全力で駆け足をしたよ。おかげでずぶ濡れになってしまった……ん、どうした？　<tips=39>ウォン</tips>君。気分でも悪いのかね？」","en":"“I was out in the garden practicing my putting under an umbrella when the message suddenly arrived. I couldn’t spare the time to change, so I came just as I was—but then my car broke down on the way. I had to run flat out for the first time in years, and now I’m soaked to the skin... Hmm? What’s wrong, Mr. <tips=39>Wong</tips>? Are you feeling unwell?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"廖志明","displayName":"Liao Chi-ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r201","rowIndex":201,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　もちろん<tips=39>ジェフリー</tips>は気分が悪いのではない。あまりにも僕が事前に指摘した通りの茶番を演じている<tips=27>廖</tips>に、笑いを堪えて口元を押さえているだけだ。","en":"<tips=39>Jeffrey</tips> was not ill, of course. <tips=27>Liao’s</tips> farce matched my prediction so perfectly that Jeffrey had covered his mouth to suppress a laugh.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r202","rowIndex":202,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「駆け足で来たんですか」","en":"“You ran here?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r203","rowIndex":203,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=39>ジェフリー</tips>に助け船を出すつもりで僕が尋ねると、","en":"I asked, hoping to throw <tips=39>Jeffrey</tips> a lifeline.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r204","rowIndex":204,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうだとも。今まで色々あったが、おれと彼の仲だからな。しかし、必死で走る恥ずかしい姿を街の人々に見られてしまったなあ」","en":"“Indeed I did. We’ve had our differences, but he and I go back a long way. Still, people all over the city saw the embarrassing spectacle of me running for all I was worth.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"廖志明","displayName":"Liao Chi-ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r205","rowIndex":205,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=27>廖</tips>はそう言った。まあ、わざと見せたのだろう。そんな念の入った演技をしなければ最初に到着できたのかもしれないのに。","en":"So <tips=27>Liao</tips> claimed. Presumably, he had made sure the townspeople saw him. If he had not been so thorough in staging his performance, he might actually have arrived first.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r206","rowIndex":206,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あ、そこにいるのは<tips=34>ダリオ</tips>どのじゃないか！」","en":"“Ah! Why, if it isn’t <tips=34>Mr. Bonetto</tips>!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"廖志明","displayName":"Liao Chi-ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r207","rowIndex":207,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=27>廖</tips>は<tips=34>ダリオ</tips>を見て目を丸くする。","en":"<tips=27>Liao’s</tips> eyes widened when he saw <tips=34>Dario</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r208","rowIndex":208,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どうしてきみがここに？」","en":"“What are you doing here?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"廖志明","displayName":"Liao Chi-ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r209","rowIndex":209,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「彼が最初に来てくれたんだ」","en":"“He was kind enough to get here first.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r210","rowIndex":210,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　相変わらずソファーに埋もれたままの<tips=4>馬明</tips>がふてくされて言うと、<tips=27>廖</tips>は顔をしかめ、","en":"<tips=4>Ma Ming</tips> remained buried in the sofa and spoke sulkily. <tips=27>Liao</tips> frowned.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r211","rowIndex":211,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どういうことなんだ？　さっき連絡があったばかりじゃないか。なんできみがこんなに早く到着しているんだ？　いくらなんでもおかしいじゃないか」","en":"“What’s going on? The message only just went out. How did you get here so quickly? This doesn’t add up.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"廖志明","displayName":"Liao Chi-ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r212","rowIndex":212,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「たまたま近くにいたもので……。しかしなんだか、私は今日責められてばかりのような……」","en":"“I happened to be nearby... But somehow, all anyone has done today is blame me for it...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ダリオ・ボネット","displayName":"Dario Bonetto","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r213","rowIndex":213,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=34>ダリオ</tips>が再び困惑してしまうのには、見ている僕の方もさすがに笑いそうになった。","en":"The sight of <tips=34>Dario</tips> growing bewildered all over again nearly made even me laugh.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r214","rowIndex":214,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「何をそんなに気にしているんですか？」","en":"“Why does it concern you so much?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r215","rowIndex":215,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕はわかっていながら意地悪く訊く。","en":"I knew perfectly well, but asked just to be mean.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r216","rowIndex":216,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いや、別に何も気にしてはいないが、ただ少し驚いて……」","en":"“No, it doesn’t particularly concern me. I was merely a little surprised...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"廖志明","displayName":"Liao Chi-ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r217","rowIndex":217,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうでしょう。お二方とも、こんなに早く来て頂いたわけですから、息子としてはとても有り難い話です。<tips=34>ダリオ</tips>さん、一番に来て頂いてありがとうございます。あなたが最初に到着するのは正直予想外でしたが、僕にとっては問題のない範囲のイレギュラーです」","en":"“Naturally. As his son, I’m deeply grateful that both of you came so quickly. Mr. <tips=34>Bonetto</tips>, thank you for arriving first. To be honest, I never predicted that you would, but to me, your arrival represents an irregularity well within acceptable bounds.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r218","rowIndex":218,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「え、あ、いや、どういたしまして」","en":"“What? Ah, no, you are very welcome.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ダリオ・ボネット","displayName":"Dario Bonetto","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r219","rowIndex":219,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕が頭を下げると、<tips=34>ダリオ</tips>も頭を下げる。","en":"When I bowed, <tips=34>Dario</tips> bowed in return.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r220","rowIndex":220,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そして<tips=27>廖</tips>さんも、どうもありがとうございます。あなたならきっと早く来て頂けると思ってました。僕はとても感謝しています」","en":"“And thank you as well, Mr. <tips=27>Liao</tips>. I was sure you would come quickly. I’m very grateful.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r221","rowIndex":221,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうか……<tips=2>阿亮</tips>、ご丁寧にありがとう」","en":"“I see... Thank you for being so very courteous, <tips=2>Leung</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"廖志明","displayName":"Liao Chi-ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r222","rowIndex":222,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=27>廖</tips>は苦々しく頷く。","en":"<tips=27>Liao</tips> gave a bitter nod.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r223","rowIndex":223,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それでは、早速父に会って頂きましょう。<tips=39>ジェフリー</tips>、もう準備は済んでいるんだよね？」","en":"“Then let us take you to my father at once. <tips=39>Jeffrey</tips>, all the preparations are finished, aren’t they?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r224","rowIndex":224,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「はい」","en":"“Yes.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r225","rowIndex":225,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「じゃあ行きますか。まずは、誰よりも早く到着してくださった<tips=34>ダリオ</tips>さんから」","en":"“Then shall we go? Mr. <tips=34>Bonetto</tips> first, since he arrived before anyone else.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r226","rowIndex":226,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕が言うと、<tips=27>廖</tips>はしかめっつらを作るが、気がつかぬふりをして、","en":"<tips=27>Liao</tips> scowled when I said it, but I pretended not to notice.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r227","rowIndex":227,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「二番目に到着した<tips=27>廖</tips>さんは、二番目の会見になるので、ここでしばしお待ちください」","en":"“Mr. <tips=27>Liao</tips> arrived second, so he will have the second audience. Please wait here for a short while.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r228","rowIndex":228,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そう、二番目、二番目と言うものじゃない。せっかく来た客に順番をつけて呼ぶだなんて失礼じゃないか」","en":"“You needn’t keep repeating ‘second, second.’ Isn’t it discourteous to assign numbers to your guests and call them in order?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"廖志明","displayName":"Liao Chi-ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r229","rowIndex":229,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=27>廖</tips>は苦い顔だった。","en":"<tips=27>Liao</tips> wore a sour expression.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r230","rowIndex":230,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして僕たちは、<tips=27>廖志明</tips>の対応を部下たちに任せ、<tips=34>ダリオ</tips>と共にエレベーターに乗り、父の元へ向かう。","en":"Leaving our subordinates to attend to <tips=27>Liao Chi-ming</tips>, we entered the elevator with <tips=34>Dario</tips> and made our way to Father.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r231","rowIndex":231,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「約束、覚えてるね？」","en":"“You remember your promise?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r232","rowIndex":232,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=39>ジェフリー</tips>と<tips=34>ダリオ</tips>を先に行かせ、僕は<tips=4>馬明</tips>に耳打ちした。","en":"I let <tips=39>Jeffrey</tips> and <tips=34>Dario</tips> walk ahead, then whispered into <tips=4>Ma Ming’s</tips> ear.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r233","rowIndex":233,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「わかってる。男に二言はない」","en":"“I remember. A man does not go back on his word.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬明","displayName":"Ma Ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r234","rowIndex":234,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「さすが、<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>にその人有りと言われた<tips=4>馬明</tips>だ」","en":"“As expected of the renowned <tips=4>Ma Ming</tips> of <tips=7>YS</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r235","rowIndex":235,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まったく、こんなくだらない賭けをするんじゃなかった」","en":"“I should never have agreed to such a stupid wager.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬明","displayName":"Ma Ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r236","rowIndex":236,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼は苦虫を噛みつぶしたような顔のまま、溜息をつく。","en":"Still looking as though he had swallowed something bitter, he sighed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r237","rowIndex":237,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そうして、<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>の個室において<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>幹部たちとの面会が、一人ずつ行われることとなった。","en":"And so, in <tips=3>Chris Tse’s</tips> private room, the officers of <tips=7>YS</tips> began meeting with him one by one.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r238","rowIndex":238,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　死を目の前にした<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>はその直前まで意識もうつろな状態であったが、人と会うとなると、気が張ったのか、にわかに活力を取り戻したようだった。","en":"Until just before the meetings, <tips=3>Chris Tse</tips> had lain barely conscious with death before him. But when the time came to receive visitors, the tension seemed to rally him, and he abruptly recovered some of his vitality.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r239","rowIndex":239,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　見栄っ張りな彼は、体に繋がれたチューブやセンサーを可能な限り取り除き、看護師の手を借りて衣服を普段着ていたスーツに着替え、ベッドを高く起こし、体中のかさぶたさえのぞけば一見すると末期患者とは思えぬような姿に整えた。","en":"Vain as ever, he had as many of the tubes and sensors attached to his body removed as possible. With a nurse’s help, he changed into one of his usual suits and had the head of the bed raised high, arranging his appearance so that, were it not for the scabs covering his body, no one would have taken him at a glance for a terminal patient.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r240","rowIndex":240,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それでも、どうしても取り外すわけにはいかない心電図が、ピッピッと電子音で彼の鼓動を伝えている。","en":"Even so, the ECG monitor that could not be disconnected continued to report his heartbeat in steady electronic beeps.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r241","rowIndex":241,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　この音を背景に、幹部たちとの最期の別れが始まった。","en":"With those beeps in the background, his final farewells with the officers began.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r242","rowIndex":242,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　最初にその前に立ったのは、地域のカジノ王である<tips=34>ダリオ・ボネット</tips>。","en":"The first man to stand before him was <tips=34>Dario Bonetto</tips>, the casino king of the district.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r243","rowIndex":243,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　この太ったイタリア人は、元々はイタリア料理人として青年の頃に日本へやって来たのだが、勤務先のホテルで事件を起こして<tips=9>Y地区</tips>へ逃れ、<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>系列のカジノの厨房で働くようになったのが裏社会へ足を踏み入れるきっかけだった。というのが表向きの経歴だが、実際にはこの街に来る前からのアウトローらしい。","en":"This corpulent Italian had ostensibly come to Japan in his youth to work as an Italian chef. After causing an incident at his hotel, he fled to <tips=9>Y District</tips> and took a job in the kitchen of a <tips=7>YS-affiliated</tips> casino—the beginning, supposedly, of his involvement with the underworld. That was the official story, at least. In reality, he appeared to have been an outlaw long before he reached this city.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r244","rowIndex":244,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　暗闇通りを本拠地にするギャングで、賭博をファミリーの生業にしている。","en":"His gang was based on Darkness Street, and gambling was the family trade.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r245","rowIndex":245,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　普段は腰が低く、他の幹部に対して非常に気を遣った様子を見せるが、仮にも大ファミリーのボスがそんな気弱なわけがなく、なかなか本心の見えない人物だ。","en":"Ordinarily he was humble and showed extreme deference toward the other officers. But the boss of a major family could hardly be so timid, and he was a difficult man to read.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r246","rowIndex":246,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　イタリア人らしく、身だしなみには気を遣っており、品のいいスーツを身につけ、髪や口髭は毎日お抱えの美容師に整えさせている。","en":"Italian that he was, he paid close attention to his appearance, dressing in tasteful suits and having a personal stylist tend his hair and mustache every day.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r247","rowIndex":247,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　いつもそうであるように、この日も<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>の目の前に立ったことで緊張し、顔をこわばらせていた。","en":"As always, he stood before <tips=3>Chris Tse</tips> with his face stiffened by nerves.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r248","rowIndex":248,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なんといったらいいか。とにかく、ご連絡に大変驚きました。たまたま本日、お見舞いに伺おうとしていたところでしたので……。しかし、こうして拝見させていただきましても、とても状態が悪いようには見えません……」","en":"“I hardly know what to say. In any event, your message came as a tremendous shock. By coincidence, I had been preparing to visit you today... But even seeing you now, I find it difficult to believe that your condition is so grave...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ダリオ・ボネット","displayName":"Dario Bonetto","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r249","rowIndex":249,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=34>ダリオ</tips>が不安の表情を浮かべているのは、演技ではないだろう。","en":"The anxiety on <tips=34>Dario’s</tips> face was probably no performance.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r250","rowIndex":250,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ボネットのファミリーは<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>の他のファミリーのように血族的な繋がりも、地域的な繋がりもない、金で繋がりを持つ寄せ集めである。数はそれなりに多いが、勢力としての結束力は弱く、<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>の後継者として名乗りを上げられるような背景を持っていない。中立を保ち独自路線を展開するのも難しいだろう。","en":"Unlike the other families within <tips=7>YS</tips>, the Bonetto Family possessed neither ties of blood nor a shared region. It was a motley collection bound together by money. Its numbers were respectable, but its cohesion as a power was weak, and it had no foundation from which to put forward a claimant as <tips=3>Chris Tse’s</tips> successor. Maintaining neutrality and pursuing an independent course would probably prove difficult as well.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r251","rowIndex":251,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　必然的に<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>の死後はどこかの勢力につくことになるのだろうが、そんな選択を迫られてしまうこと自体、彼の状況からすれば心穏やかではないはずだ。","en":"After <tips=3>Chris Tse’s</tips> death, it would therefore have little choice but to align itself with one power or another. Given Dario’s circumstances, being forced to make such a choice could hardly have been a comforting prospect.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r252","rowIndex":252,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「少し、遠い。もっと近づけ」","en":"“You’re too far away. Come closer.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r253","rowIndex":253,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕の父である<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>がかすれ声でそう指示すると、","en":"My father, <tips=3>Chris Tse</tips>, gave the instruction in a hoarse voice.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r254","rowIndex":254,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「で、では失礼して……」","en":"“Th-then, if you’ll excuse me...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ダリオ・ボネット","displayName":"Dario Bonetto","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r255","rowIndex":255,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=34>ダリオ</tips>は一層体を固くして、その唇に耳を近づける。","en":"<tips=34>Dario</tips> stiffened still further and leaned in until his ear was close to my father’s lips.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r256","rowIndex":256,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そう、それでいい。……それで<tips=34>ダリオ</tips>、息子は少しは落ち着いたのか？」","en":"“Yes, that will do. ...Now, <tips=34>Dario</tips>, has your son settled down at all?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r257","rowIndex":257,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>の声はかすれてはいたが、<tips=34>ダリオ</tips>にさせたように耳を近づけさせなくとも、傍らで見守る僕に聞こえる程にはっきりとしていた。","en":"<tips=3>Chris Tse’s</tips> voice was hoarse, but clear enough for me to hear from where I watched beside him, without having to lean in as <tips=34>Dario</tips> had.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r258","rowIndex":258,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ええ、おかげさまで」","en":"“Yes, thanks to you.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ダリオ・ボネット","displayName":"Dario Bonetto","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r259","rowIndex":259,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=34>ダリオ</tips>は恐縮して汗をハンカチで拭う。","en":"Thoroughly abashed, <tips=34>Dario</tips> mopped the sweat from his face with a handkerchief.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r260","rowIndex":260,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼の長男であるサウル・ボネットは、<tips=24>馬美美</tips>の開催するパーティを出入禁止になった、あの人物である。女癖が悪いことで有名で、その手のエピソードには事欠かない。","en":"His eldest son, Saul Bonetto, was the same man who had been barred from <tips=24>Ma Meimei’s</tips> parties. He was a notorious womanizer, with no shortage of stories to prove it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r261","rowIndex":261,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「最近はやっと落ちついて、仕事の方でもなかなか頑張っているようです」","en":"“He’s finally settled down lately, and he seems to be applying himself to the business as well.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ダリオ・ボネット","displayName":"Dario Bonetto","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r262","rowIndex":262,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうか、それは頼もしいな。奥さんは少し体調を崩していたようだが、どうしている？」","en":"“I see. That is reassuring. I understand your wife has been a little unwell. How is she now?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r263","rowIndex":263,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=34>ダリオ</tips>に対する<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>の質問は、その家族やプライベートに関するものばかりであった。","en":"Every question <tips=3>Chris Tse</tips> put to <tips=34>Dario</tips> concerned his family or his private life.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r264","rowIndex":264,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ビジネスよりも自分の生活を優先させる<tips=34>ダリオ</tips>にあわせた話題なのか、本当に知りたい話題なのか、端で聞いていてもよくわからない。","en":"Even listening from beside them, I could not tell whether he had chosen subjects suited to <tips=34>Dario</tips>, a man who placed his private life before business, or whether these were simply the things he truly wished to know.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r265","rowIndex":265,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　なんだか散漫なやりとりが続けられている。","en":"The rather desultory exchange continued.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r266","rowIndex":266,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　もっとも、これほど衰弱した病人の言葉に、特別な意図を求めるほうが間違いなのかもしれない。","en":"Then again, perhaps it was a mistake to search for some deeper purpose in the words of a patient this badly weakened.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r267","rowIndex":267,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「私が死んだ後も、次の<tips=81>龍頭</tips>になる叔父殿や、私の部下や息子を今まで通り引き立ててくれるかね？」","en":"“After I die, will you continue to look after my uncle—the next <tips=81>Longtou</tips>—and my subordinates and son, just as you have until now?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r268","rowIndex":268,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　一通りの話を済ませた後に<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>がそう言うと、","en":"<tips=3>Chris Tse</tips> put the question after their conversation had run its course.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r269","rowIndex":269,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「もちろんです。出来うる限りのことはさせていただきます」","en":"“Of course. I will do everything within my power.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ダリオ・ボネット","displayName":"Dario Bonetto","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r270","rowIndex":270,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　うやうやしく礼をしたが、果たしてこの辺りの言葉と態度は本心なのだろうか。","en":"Dario bowed with the utmost reverence, but were those words and that manner truly sincere?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r271","rowIndex":271,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして<tips=34>ダリオ</tips>は部屋を出て行った。","en":"Then <tips=34>Dario</tips> left the room.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r272","rowIndex":272,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ああいうやつは、特に気をつけて丁重に扱ってやらなくてはいかん」","en":"“Men like him have to be handled with particular care and courtesy.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r273","rowIndex":273,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>は傍らで見守る僕たち三人に対し、言い聞かせるようにそう言った。","en":"<tips=3>Chris Tse</tips> spoke to the three of us watching beside him as though impressing a lesson upon us.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r274","rowIndex":274,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「腰は低いがプライドは高い。打算よりも感情が先に立つ。普段はそれなりに理性的な行動をとるが、プライドを傷つけたら、どんな馬鹿げた方法で意趣返しをしてくるか想像も出来ない」","en":"“He carries himself humbly, but his pride runs high. Emotion gets ahead of calculation. Ordinarily, he acts rationally enough—but wound his pride, and there is no telling what absurd means he might use to get even.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r275","rowIndex":275,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼はそこまで言うと、深呼吸をし、まぶたを閉じた。","en":"Having said that much, he drew a deep breath and closed his eyes.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r276","rowIndex":276,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「大丈夫ですか？」","en":"“Are you all right?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r277","rowIndex":277,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=39>ジェフリー</tips>の問いかけに、わずかに顎を動かして頷く。","en":"In answer to <tips=39>Jeffrey’s</tips> question, he gave the slightest dip of his chin.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r278","rowIndex":278,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼は、こうやって幹部一人一人の特徴と扱い方を、僕らに教えてゆくつもりなのだろうか？","en":"Did he mean to go on like this, teaching us each officer’s character and how best to handle them?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r279","rowIndex":279,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　このマイペースな父が、そのために自分の最期となる貴重な時間を、自分のために使わず、死後の事業のために割いたのだと考えると、空気が急に重苦しく感じられた。","en":"When I realized that this father of mine, a man who always moved at his own pace, had devoted his precious remaining time not to himself but to the work that would continue after his death, the air abruptly grew heavy.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r280","rowIndex":280,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　どちらかと言えば、自分の死んだ後のことなど知ったことかと考えそうな人物だと思っていたのに。","en":"I had always taken him for the sort of man more likely to say that what happened after his death was no concern of his.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r281","rowIndex":281,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　これは執念か。","en":"Was this sheer tenacity?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r282","rowIndex":282,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　やはり、悔しいのだろうか。","en":"Did he resent having to die after all?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r283","rowIndex":283,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　考えていると、<tips=27>廖志明</tips>が部屋に入ってきた。","en":"As I considered the question, <tips=27>Liao Chi-ming</tips> entered the room.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r284","rowIndex":284,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　さて、問題の人物である。","en":"Now for the man in question.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r285","rowIndex":285,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>亡き後の<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>において、もっとも強い影響力を持つであろう個人が彼だ。","en":"After <tips=3>Chris Tse’s</tips> death, he would probably be the single most influential person in <tips=7>YS</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r286","rowIndex":286,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼のファミリーはこの<tips=9>Y地区</tips>において長い間最大の勢力を誇っていた集団であり、<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>の前身である<tips=69>義勝</tips>などよりも、本来は格上の存在である。","en":"His family had long been the greatest power in <tips=9>Y District</tips>. In its original standing, it ranked above even <tips=69>Yisheng</tips>, the predecessor of <tips=7>YS</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r287","rowIndex":287,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　カリスマの死により、<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>という連合体制が崩壊してしまったならば、彼の組織が元の位置に返り咲く可能性が非常に高い。","en":"If the federation called <tips=7>YS</tips> collapsed with the death of its charismatic leader, there was a very strong possibility that Liao’s organization would return to its former supremacy.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r288","rowIndex":288,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=27>廖志明</tips>自身、そのことは誰よりもよく理解しているだろうし、そうしたナンバーワンの地位に対する野心も持っているはずだ。","en":"<tips=27>Liao Chi-ming</tips> surely understood that better than anyone, and must have harbored ambitions for the top position himself.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r289","rowIndex":289,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その、今後のキーポイントとなるべき人間が、今はゴルフウェア姿で悠然と<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>の前に立っている。","en":"The man who would be a key figure in what came next now stood at his ease before <tips=3>Chris Tse</tips> in golfing clothes.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r290","rowIndex":290,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　すでに一番を取れなかった動揺は消え、不敵な顔つきに戻っている。","en":"Any agitation at having failed to take first place was gone, and his features had returned to their customary fearlessness.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r291","rowIndex":291,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「思ったより、元気そうですな」","en":"“You seem healthier than I expected.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"廖志明","displayName":"Liao Chi-ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r292","rowIndex":292,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=4>馬明</tips>に無言で促され、<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>の口元に顔を近づけると、彼はそう言った。","en":"At <tips=4>Ma Ming’s</tips> silent prompting, Liao brought his face close to <tips=3>Chris Tse’s</tips> mouth and spoke.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r293","rowIndex":293,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そう見えるなら嬉しいが、残念ながらもうおれの命はあとわずかなんだ。いや、<tips=27>廖</tips>さんにとっては、待ちに待ったその時かもしれんが」","en":"“Glad I look it. Unfortunately, I don’t have long. Then again, Mr. <tips=27>Liao</tips>, this may be the moment you’ve been waiting for.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r294","rowIndex":294,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　こんな挑発的な態度で行くというのは、僕にとってはやや意外だった。","en":"I had not expected him to open so provocatively.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r295","rowIndex":295,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「悪い冗談を」","en":"“What a tasteless joke.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"廖志明","displayName":"Liao Chi-ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r296","rowIndex":296,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=27>廖</tips>はさらりと受け流し、","en":"<tips=27>Liao</tips> brushed the remark lightly aside.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r297","rowIndex":297,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=81>龍頭</tips>とは長いつき合いだ。思えば、<tips=69>義勝</tips>の先代の家で会ったのが最初だったかな？　あのとききみは洟垂れ小僧だった」","en":"“The <tips=81>Longtou</tips> and I go back a very long way. As I recall, we first met at the home of <tips=69>Yisheng’s</tips> previous leader. You were a snot-nosed little brat then.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"廖志明","displayName":"Liao Chi-ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r298","rowIndex":298,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あなたはすでにファミリーのボスだった」","en":"“You were already the boss of your family.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r299","rowIndex":299,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まさか、あの時はきみがこの<tips=9>Y地区</tips>のギャングをまとめ上げて、自分のボスになるとは想像もしなかったよ」","en":"“I never imagined that boy would bring the gangs of <tips=9>Y District</tips> together and become my own boss.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"廖志明","displayName":"Liao Chi-ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r300","rowIndex":300,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あのときあなたはなんて言ったか覚えているか？」","en":"“Do you remember what you said then?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r301","rowIndex":301,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「忘れてしまったな」","en":"“I’m afraid I’ve forgotten.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"廖志明","displayName":"Liao Chi-ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r302","rowIndex":302,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「おれははっきりと覚えている。あんたはこう言ったんだ……『能力の高い<tips=16>タイプA</tips>は大成しない』ってね」","en":"“I remember perfectly. You said, ‘Highly capable <tips=16>Type As</tips> never amount to anything.’”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r303","rowIndex":303,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ハハハ、そんなこと言ったかな？」","en":"“Ha-ha-ha! Did I say such a thing?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"廖志明","displayName":"Liao Chi-ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r304","rowIndex":304,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=27>廖</tips>は笑ったが、僕の観察では、はっきりとその時の自分の発言を覚えているようにしか見えない笑い方だった。","en":"<tips=27>Liao</tips> laughed. To my eye, it was the laugh of a man who remembered his own words perfectly well.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r305","rowIndex":305,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ミュータントはノーマルの畏怖をかき立てる。<tips=77>特質変異</tips>によって醜い姿に生まれたならばなおさらだ。この世界はノーマルが大多数を占めている。仮に高い能力があっても、足を引っ張られ、終生浮かび上がることはないだろう。こちらはよく憶えているよ」","en":"“Mutants inspire fear in Normals—all the more so when <tips=77>trait mutation</tips> leaves them ugly from birth. Normals are the overwhelming majority in this world. However great a mutant’s abilities, others will drag him down, and he will never rise above his station for as long as he lives. I remember that much very well.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r306","rowIndex":306,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その言葉に、<tips=27>廖</tips>は肩をすくめておどける。","en":"At the recitation, <tips=27>Liao</tips> shrugged theatrically.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r307","rowIndex":307,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「当時はそういう認識が一般的だったんだ。今のように先進国の政府首脳陣に<tips=77>特質変異</tips>持ちの<tips=16>タイプA</tips>が何人も就任するなんて考えられない時代だった。もし私が本当にその時そう言ったのなら、ただ当時の常識としての一般論を口にしただけだよ」","en":"“That was the prevailing view at the time. It was an age when no one could have imagined several <tips=16>Type As</tips> with <tips=77>trait mutations</tips> serving among the leaders of developed nations, as they do now. If I truly said it, I was merely expressing the conventional wisdom of the day.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"廖志明","displayName":"Liao Chi-ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r308","rowIndex":308,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いや、感謝しているんだ。あの言葉があったから、それをバネにして、おれはここまで来たのだろう」","en":"“No, I’m grateful. Those words gave me the drive to make it this far.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r309","rowIndex":309,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=27>廖</tips>はその言葉を皮肉ととらえたのか、ただ無言で笑った。","en":"Perhaps taking the remark as sarcasm, <tips=27>Liao</tips> merely smiled without a word.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r310","rowIndex":310,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そして、<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>を結成して、共に仕事をするようになってからは、非常に優れたビジネスパートナーだった。あんたがいなければ、今の<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>もなかったに違いない」","en":"“And after we established <tips=7>YS</tips> and began working together, you proved an exceptional business partner. Without you, the <tips=7>YS</tips> of today would surely not exist.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r311","rowIndex":311,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「つまり、私ははからずも、<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>という偉大な<tips=81>龍頭</tips>と、<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>という巨大な組織を育ててしまったわけですな」","en":"“So, quite by accident, I was the one who nurtured both the great <tips=81>Longtou</tips>, <tips=3>Chris Tse</tips>, and the vast organization called <tips=7>YS</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"廖志明","displayName":"Liao Chi-ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r312","rowIndex":312,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=27>廖</tips>はあきれたように溜息をつくが、<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>は真顔だった。三つの瞳で<tips=27>廖</tips>の顔を見つめている。","en":"<tips=27>Liao</tips> gave an exasperated sigh, but <tips=3>Chris Tse</tips> remained perfectly serious, all three of his eyes fixed on <tips=27>Liao’s</tips> face.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r313","rowIndex":313,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あんたには、最期のお願いがある」","en":"“I have one final request to make of you.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r314","rowIndex":314,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なんですかな？」","en":"“And what might that be?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"廖志明","displayName":"Liao Chi-ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r315","rowIndex":315,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「その調子で、私が死んだ後もこの組織をひき立て、そして私の息子である<tips=1>謝亮</tips>を一人前の<tips=81>龍頭</tips>に育てて欲しい」","en":"“After I die, I want you to keep supporting this organization in just the same way—and to make a proper <tips=81>Longtou</tips> of my son, <tips=1>Tse Leung</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r316","rowIndex":316,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「その調子で、というのがどういう意味なのか、この話の流れではわかりかねるが」","en":"“Given the direction this conversation has taken, I’m not at all sure what ‘in just the same way’ is supposed to mean.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"廖志明","displayName":"Liao Chi-ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r317","rowIndex":317,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「初めて会った私にしたようなやり方で結構だ。いや、もっと荒っぽいやり方をするのだろうが」","en":"“The way you treated me when we first met will do. Though I imagine you’ll be even rougher with him.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r318","rowIndex":318,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「別に私は<tips=81>龍頭</tips>を育てるつもりではなかったのだがね」","en":"“It’s not as though I ever intended to raise a <tips=81>Longtou</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"廖志明","displayName":"Liao Chi-ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r319","rowIndex":319,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「結果的には同じことだ。おれの息子はどんなやりかたでも乗り越え、おれと同じようにあんたを糧にするだろう」","en":"“The result was the same. Whatever you do to him, my son will overcome it and, like me, use you as fuel to make himself stronger.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r320","rowIndex":320,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「今日の<tips=81>龍頭</tips>の言葉は、私にはちっとも理解出来ないな」","en":"“I haven’t understood a word the <tips=81>Longtou</tips> has said today.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"廖志明","displayName":"Liao Chi-ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r321","rowIndex":321,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=27>廖</tips>は表情を変えないが、その瀕死の病人を見る眼差しには憤りに似た敵意の色が見えた。","en":"<tips=27>Liao’s</tips> expression did not change, but as he looked at the dying patient, I saw hostility tinged with something like indignation in his gaze.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r322","rowIndex":322,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「わかるはずだよ。あんたは全部わかっているはずだ。おれだってもちろんわかっている」","en":"“You should understand. You should understand all of it. I do, of course.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r323","rowIndex":323,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その言葉に、<tips=27>廖</tips>は首を左右に振ると、","en":"<tips=27>Liao</tips> shook his head from side to side.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r324","rowIndex":324,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まあ、何だっていい。ただ一つ、あなたは、自分の最期の時間をもっと穏やかに過ごすべきだとは思うがね」","en":"“Well, never mind. I will say only that you ought to spend your final hours more peacefully.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"廖志明","displayName":"Liao Chi-ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r325","rowIndex":325,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「これは性分でね。今すぐ死ぬと言われたって、人間は別の誰かになれやしないのさ」","en":"“It’s my nature. Tell a man he’s about to die, and he still can’t become someone else.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r326","rowIndex":326,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「私もそうありたいものだ。きみには混じりっけなしの敬意を捧げるよ」","en":"“I hope I can be the same. I offer you my pure, unalloyed respect.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"廖志明","displayName":"Liao Chi-ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r327","rowIndex":327,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=27>廖</tips>はそう言うと、大げさに見えるほどうやうやしい礼をして、部屋を去った。","en":"With that, <tips=27>Liao</tips> bowed with a reverence so deep it appeared almost exaggerated, then left the room.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r328","rowIndex":328,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼が部屋を出て、ドアが閉められた途端、左右の<tips=4>馬明</tips>と<tips=39>ジェフリー</tips>の口から同時に溜息が漏れる。","en":"The instant he stepped outside and the door closed, sighs escaped <tips=4>Ma Ming</tips> and <tips=39>Jeffrey</tips> simultaneously on either side of me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r329","rowIndex":329,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　一方僕は納得がいかなかった。","en":"I, for my part, could not make sense of it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r330","rowIndex":330,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　どうしてあんな、ほとんど宣戦布告と言えるような言葉を投げつける必要があったのか。","en":"Why had my father needed to fling words at Liao that amounted to a declaration of war?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r331","rowIndex":331,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それを不審に思っていると、","en":"I was still puzzling over that.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r332","rowIndex":332,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なあ、気分が盛り上がって来ただろ？　ファイトが沸いて来ないか？　おれが死んだ後、お前たちは三人で、あの不遜な男をうまく捌いて、この脆い組織を経営していかなくてはならないんだ」","en":"“Come on, that got your blood up, didn’t it? Don’t you feel ready for a fight? After I die, the three of you will have to keep that insolent man under control while running this fragile organization.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r333","rowIndex":333,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>は面白そうに言う。","en":"<tips=3>Chris Tse</tips> said it with evident amusement.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r334","rowIndex":334,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「仕事を難しくするような、余計なことはしないで欲しかったですね」","en":"“I wish you wouldn’t create needless complications that make our work harder.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r335","rowIndex":335,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕は憤りを露わにしてそう返す。","en":"I replied without attempting to conceal my indignation.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r336","rowIndex":336,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そう怒るなよ。おれだって、自分のすべてをタダで人にくれてやるのは少々しゃくに障るのさ」","en":"“Don’t get so angry. Having to hand over everything I have to someone for nothing rubs me the wrong way, too.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r337","rowIndex":337,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それから、<tips=26>劉建志</tips>、<tips=35>ジョゼ・フェルナンデス</tips>、<tips=33>壬生屋タカシ</tips>と、到着した順に一人ずつ部屋を訪れ、<tips=81>龍頭</tips>と最期の会談に臨む。","en":"Afterward, <tips=26>Ryu Kenshi</tips>, <tips=35>José Fernandes</tips>, and <tips=33>Takashi Mibuya</tips> visited the room one by one in their order of arrival and held their final conversations with the <tips=81>Longtou</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r338","rowIndex":338,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕からすれば茶番のように思えるけれども、人が死ぬときというのはこのような儀式も必要なのかもしれない。","en":"To me, it resembled a farce, but perhaps a person’s death required ceremonies of this kind.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r339","rowIndex":339,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=27>廖</tips>のすぐ後に部屋に入ってきた<tips=26>劉建志</tips>は、字面だけでは大陸風の名前に見えるが、『りゅうけんし』と日本語で読み下す。","en":"<tips=26>Ryu Kenshi</tips>, who entered immediately after <tips=27>Liao</tips>, had a name whose written characters looked mainland Chinese, but which he read in Japanese as Ryu Kenshi.","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"劉建志","displayName":"Ryu Kenshi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r340","rowIndex":340,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　実際彼がどこの国をルーツに持つ人間なのかは誰も知らない。彼自身が語ろうとしないのだ。","en":"No one knew what country his ancestry actually traced to. He refused to speak of it himself.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r341","rowIndex":341,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=16>タイプＡ</tips>の<tips=77>特質変異</tips>持ちとして生まれた彼は、親の愛や平和な家庭とは無縁に育った。裏通りで暴力と犯罪にあけくれ、<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>に見いだされるまでは明日のない生き方をしていた。","en":"Born with a <tips=16>Type A</tips> <tips=77>trait mutation</tips>, he grew up without parental love or a peaceful home. He spent his days immersed in violence and crime in the back streets, living without a future until <tips=3>Chris Tse</tips> discovered him.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r342","rowIndex":342,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>に加入してからは<tips=81>龍頭</tips>の忠実な部下として、<tips=80>紅棍</tips>と呼ばれる、主に暴力を扱う役職で順調な出世を重ねた。","en":"After joining <tips=7>YS</tips>, he served as the <tips=81>Longtou’s</tips> loyal subordinate and rose steadily through the ranks as a <tips=80>Red Pole</tips>, an office concerned chiefly with violence.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r343","rowIndex":343,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　やがて<tips=80>紅棍</tips>のなかで最も優れたものであることを意味する<tips=80>双花紅棍</tips>と呼ばれるようになり、現在は幹部の一人として自分のファミリーを持っている。","en":"In time he came to be known as a <tips=80>Double Flower Red Pole</tips>, signifying the finest of the <tips=80>Red Poles</tips>, and now, as one of the officers, he had a family of his own.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r344","rowIndex":344,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　年齢は３２才。幹部のなかで最も若い。<tips=77>特質変異</tips>を隠す派手な仮面は京劇の『孫悟空』の意匠を取り入れたものだそうで、さらに背中の一面には見事な花和尚魯智深の刺青がほどこされている。これらが彼のトレードマークとなっている。","en":"He was thirty-two, the youngest of the officers. His flamboyant mask, which concealed his <tips=77>trait mutation</tips>, was said to incorporate a Sun Wukong design from Peking opera. A magnificent tattoo of Lu Zhishen, the Flowery Monk, covered his entire back. Together these had become his trademarks.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r345","rowIndex":345,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　こうした経歴もあって、彼の<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>に対する感情は他の幹部たちとは一線を画していた。","en":"Given that history, his feelings toward <tips=3>Chris Tse</tips> stood apart from those of the other officers.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r346","rowIndex":346,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　部屋に入ってくるなり、ベッドの上の<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>の膝元にすがりつき、背を震わせて慟哭した。","en":"The instant he entered the room, he threw himself against <tips=3>Chris Tse’s</tips> knees at the bedside and wailed, his back shaking.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r347","rowIndex":347,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=26>劉建志</tips>は<tips=16>タイプA</tips>としての能力だけではない。背はさほど高くはないが、武術の鍛錬を欠かさないその筋骨隆々たる肉体は、それだけで他人を圧倒する。","en":"<tips=26>Ryu Kenshi</tips> possessed more than his <tips=16>Type A</tips> ability. He was not particularly tall, but the rippling physique he maintained through relentless martial training was imposing in its own right.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r348","rowIndex":348,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それが、子供のように声をあげて泣きじゃくるのである。","en":"And now that man sobbed aloud like a child.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r349","rowIndex":349,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「おい、そう泣くな。みっともない」","en":"“Hey, don’t carry on like that. It’s unbecoming.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r350","rowIndex":350,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>が苦笑すると、<tips=26>劉</tips>は仮面の下の顔を袖で拭い、","en":"<tips=3>Chris Tse</tips> smiled wryly. <tips=26>Ryu</tips> slipped his sleeve beneath the mask and wiped his face.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r351","rowIndex":351,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「しかし<tips=81>龍頭</tips>！」","en":"“But <tips=81>Longtou</tips>!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"劉建志","displayName":"Ryu Kenshi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r352","rowIndex":352,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　と、震える声で言った。","en":"His voice trembled.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r353","rowIndex":353,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「とても、とても、こんな瞬間を信じることが出来ません！　なぜ<tips=81>龍頭</tips>のような人がこれほど早く死なねばならぬのか」","en":"“I cannot—I cannot believe this moment has come! Why must a man like the <tips=81>Longtou</tips> die so soon?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"劉建志","displayName":"Ryu Kenshi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r354","rowIndex":354,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=26>劉</tips>は終始この調子で、ほとんど会話にならなかった。","en":"<tips=26>Ryu</tips> remained in that state throughout, making anything resembling a conversation nearly impossible.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r355","rowIndex":355,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　取り乱す彼に<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>が語ったのは、まず短気な部分を直し部下を大事にして自分のファミリーを守ること。次に暴力以外の方法で物事を解決する方法を学ぶこと。人に騙されやすいから、巧言を用いる人間を疑ってかかること。","en":"<tips=3>Chris Tse</tips> counseled the distraught man first to master his temper, value his subordinates, and protect his family; next, to learn methods of resolving problems that did not depend upon violence; and finally, because others deceived him so easily, to be suspicious of smooth talkers.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r356","rowIndex":356,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=26>劉</tips>は泣きながらも、うんうんと素直に頷いて聞いていた。","en":"Even as he wept, <tips=26>Ryu</tips> listened obediently, nodding again and again.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r357","rowIndex":357,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　諭すような<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>の態度と言葉は、他の幹部に対するものと違い、やはり子飼いの部下となれば特別の情もあるのだろう。","en":"The gently admonishing manner and words <tips=3>Chris Tse</tips> used with him differed from those he had offered the other officers. A subordinate he had raised from the beginning must have inspired a special affection after all.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r358","rowIndex":358,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そんなことを考えながら場面を眺めていたのだが、<tips=26>劉</tips>が去ってからの彼の言葉は冷淡だった。","en":"That was what I thought as I watched them. But after <tips=26>Ryu</tips> left, my father’s words were cold.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r359","rowIndex":359,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あいつをこんな地位まで上げてしまったのはミスだったかもしれない」","en":"“Perhaps raising that man to such a position was a mistake.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r360","rowIndex":360,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　もう少し説明が欲しかったが、このとき彼はすでに疲労の色が濃厚で、次の幹部がやって来るまでに少しでも体力の回復が必要に見えたので、僕は言葉を遠慮した。","en":"I wanted a little more explanation. By then, however, his exhaustion was plain, and he looked as though he needed to recover what little strength he could before the next officer arrived, so I held my tongue.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r361","rowIndex":361,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=35>ジョゼ・フェルナンデス</tips>はそれから３０分後にやって来た。","en":"<tips=35>José Fernandes</tips> arrived thirty minutes later.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r362","rowIndex":362,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼は<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>幹部のなかでは<tips=27>廖志明</tips>に次ぐ勢力と、この街での歴史を持っており、言うまでもなく、<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>亡き後の<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>の運命を左右する人物の一人であった。","en":"Among the officers of <tips=7>YS</tips>, his power and his history in this city were second only to <tips=27>Liao Chi-ming’s</tips>. Needless to say, he was one of the men who would determine the fate of <tips=7>YS</tips> after <tips=3>Chris Tse’s</tips> death.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r363","rowIndex":363,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼は取り乱した様子もなく、静かに<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>の側に立ち、その横顔を見守った。","en":"He showed no sign of agitation, but stood quietly beside <tips=3>Chris Tse</tips>, studying his profile.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r364","rowIndex":364,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「娘さんたちは元気かい？」","en":"“Are your daughters well?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r365","rowIndex":365,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なかなか片付いてくれなくて困る」","en":"“I can’t seem to get any of them married off. It’s a problem.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ジョゼ・フェルナンデス","displayName":"José Fernandes","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r366","rowIndex":366,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「本当に困っているのかね？　誰も嫁に出すつもりなんかなさそうに見える」","en":"“Does it really trouble you? You don’t seem to have any intention of marrying any of them off.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r367","rowIndex":367,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>は口辺を曲げて笑みの形を作った。","en":"<tips=3>Chris Tse</tips> worked the corner of his mouth into a smile.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r368","rowIndex":368,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　対する<tips=35>フェルナンデス</tips>は無表情だ。今では裏社会の大物というよりもむしろ評判の美人三姉妹の父親として知られるこの人物は、感情を露わにすることが少なく、いつも岩のようにごつごつとした顔の奥で思慮深い瞳を穏やかに光らせている。","en":"<tips=35>Fernandes</tips> remained expressionless. Now better known as the father of three famously beautiful sisters than as a great figure of the underworld, he seldom displayed his emotions. Thoughtful eyes always shone calmly from the depths of his craggy, stone-like face.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r369","rowIndex":369,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　若い頃はそれなりに血気盛んなところもあったようだが、僕の知る限り<tips=35>ジョゼ・フェルナンデス</tips>というのは寡黙で重々しい、年を取った職人や肉体労働者がいつしか身につけるものと似た哲学的な風貌をもった人物であった。","en":"He had apparently possessed a measure of youthful fire once. But as far as I knew him, <tips=35>José Fernandes</tips> was a taciturn, grave man, with the philosophical air that elderly craftsmen and laborers sometimes acquire over the years.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r370","rowIndex":370,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「私も妻ももう若くない。早く、しかるべき人物の妻になってほしいと考えている」","en":"“My wife and I are no longer young. We want them to marry suitable men as soon as they can.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ジョゼ・フェルナンデス","displayName":"José Fernandes","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r371","rowIndex":371,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いま娘たちを取り巻いている連中は気にいらないのかい？」","en":"“You dislike the men who surround your daughters now?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r372","rowIndex":372,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=35>フェルナンデス</tips>はそれには返答せず、","en":"<tips=35>Fernandes</tips> did not answer that question.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r373","rowIndex":373,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「私の後継者などということは考えず、愛すべき夫を持ち、本人たちが幸せになってくれればそれで良いのだ」","en":"“I’m not concerned with who succeeds me. All I want is for them to find husbands they can love and to be happy themselves.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ジョゼ・フェルナンデス","displayName":"José Fernandes","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r374","rowIndex":374,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　と別なことを言った。","en":"He answered with something else instead.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r375","rowIndex":375,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=2>阿亮</tips>」","en":"“<tips=2>Leung</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ジョゼ・フェルナンデス","displayName":"José Fernandes","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r376","rowIndex":376,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=35>フェルナンデス</tips>は急に顔を上げて僕の名を呼んだ。","en":"<tips=35>Fernandes</tips> suddenly looked up and called my name.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r377","rowIndex":377,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「はい」","en":"“Yes?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r378","rowIndex":378,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼と顔を合わせる機会は少なくなかったが、ほとんどまともに口をきいたことがなかったので、こんな場面で名を呼ばれることに戸惑いを感じた。","en":"I had met him often enough, but we had scarcely ever exchanged more than a few words. Hearing him call my name in a setting like this caught me off guard.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r379","rowIndex":379,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「一度街を出ていったのに、なぜ戻って来た？」","en":"“You left this city once. Why have you returned?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ジョゼ・フェルナンデス","displayName":"José Fernandes","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r380","rowIndex":380,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　質問の内容も、彼の口から出る言葉にしては意外なものだった。","en":"The question itself was unexpected coming from him.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r381","rowIndex":381,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「こんなところに顔を出して、何かきみらしくないようだが」","en":"“Showing your face in a place like this seems somehow unlike you.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ジョゼ・フェルナンデス","displayName":"José Fernandes","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r382","rowIndex":382,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　誰に関しても、たとえば<tips=81>龍頭</tips>である<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>の動向に関してさえさほど興味がなさそうに、自分の仕事だけをやり続けたこの人物でも、こんなことを言うのだろうか。","en":"Would even this man say such a thing—the man who seemed interested in no one, who simply went about his own work without much concern even for the movements of <tips=3>Chris Tse</tips>, the <tips=81>Longtou</tips>?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r383","rowIndex":383,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「この街で、まだやることがあったみたいです。僕自身としても意外ですが」","en":"“It appears there were still things I had to do in this city. That came as a surprise to me as well.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r384","rowIndex":384,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「私には、血の雨を降らせに来たように見える」","en":"“To me, it looks as though you came here to make it rain blood.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ジョゼ・フェルナンデス","displayName":"José Fernandes","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r385","rowIndex":385,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=35>フェルナンデス</tips>は、僕の存在が、<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>死後の混乱を増大する、或いは血なまぐさいものにすると考えているのだろうか？","en":"Did <tips=35>Fernandes</tips> believe my presence would deepen the confusion after <tips=3>Chris Tse’s</tips> death, or make it bloodier?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r386","rowIndex":386,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　どういう予想を前提にそう話しているのかはわからないが、少なくとも僕の存在を歓迎しているようではなかった。","en":"I could not tell what future he envisioned when he said it. At the very least, he did not appear to welcome my presence.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r387","rowIndex":387,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼はこれまで通り、この地でどういう騒動があっても中立を維持するのではないかと想像していたが、必ずしもそうとは言い切れないのかもしれない。","en":"I had imagined that, as before, he would remain neutral no matter what disturbance arose here. Perhaps that could no longer be taken for granted.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r388","rowIndex":388,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「僕にそれほどの影響力はないですし、そもそも、誰の血が流れるのも、望むところではありません。すべてが丸く収まるよう、我々に協力していただければ幸いです」","en":"“I do not have that kind of influence, and I have no desire to see anyone’s blood shed in the first place. I would be grateful for your cooperation in bringing everything to a peaceful conclusion.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r389","rowIndex":389,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕の言葉に彼は返事をせず、ただじっと見つめている。","en":"He gave no answer, merely watching me intently.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r390","rowIndex":390,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　表情の裏に隠した真意を見透かされそうでいやだったが、僕は黙って見つめ返した。","en":"I disliked the feeling that he might see through my expression to the intentions hidden beneath it, but I silently held his gaze.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r391","rowIndex":391,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼は無言で視線を<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>に戻すと、","en":"Without a word, he turned his eyes back to <tips=3>Chris Tse</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r392","rowIndex":392,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「きみはこんなところで我々と話している場合ではない。残されたわずかな時間のうち、少しでも多くを家族たちと共に過ごすことに使うべきだ。私ならそうする」","en":"“You should not be spending your time here talking to us. You ought to give as much as you can of the little time you have left to your family. That is what I would do.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ジョゼ・フェルナンデス","displayName":"José Fernandes","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r393","rowIndex":393,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ご忠告ありがとう」","en":"“Thank you for the advice.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r394","rowIndex":394,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>は苦笑いをし、","en":"<tips=3>Chris Tse</tips> smiled wryly.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r395","rowIndex":395,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あなたの言うことはごもっともだが、おれがそんな境地に達するのは結局無理だったようだ。まだ諦められないのだよ。何もかも」","en":"“You are entirely right. But in the end, it seems I could never reach that state of mind. I still cannot let go. Not of anything.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r396","rowIndex":396,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　まだ諦められない、という言葉に、僕ははっとする思いだったが、この場では僕以外にそのような受け取り方をしたものは誰もいないだろう。","en":"The words ‘cannot let go’ gave me a start, though probably no one else present understood them as I did.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r397","rowIndex":397,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　——本当に、この人があきらめたくないというのなら……。","en":"...If this man truly did not want to let go...","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r398","rowIndex":398,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕は、やはり話すべきなのかもしれない。","en":"Perhaps I ought to tell him after all.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r399","rowIndex":399,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「おれは一つだけあなたに訊きたかったのだが、いいかい？」","en":"“There’s one thing I wanted to ask you. Mind?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r400","rowIndex":400,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>の問いかけに、<tips=35>フェルナンデス</tips>は頷きを返す。","en":"At <tips=3>Chris Tse’s</tips> question, <tips=35>Fernandes</tips> nodded.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r401","rowIndex":401,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なぜすんなり<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>に参加してくれたんだ？」","en":"“Why did you join <tips=7>YS</tips> so readily?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r402","rowIndex":402,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「きみが誘ったからじゃないか」","en":"“Because you invited me.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ジョゼ・フェルナンデス","displayName":"José Fernandes","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r403","rowIndex":403,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いや、それはそうなんだが、すんなり参加して貰えるとは思わなかった。あなたはいつもどことも手を組まずに中立を保っていたし、　”<tips=22>老人たち</tips>”　のように独立してやっていく手もあったはずだ」","en":"“Yes, certainly. But I never expected you to agree without resistance. You had always refused to ally yourself with anyone and maintained your neutrality, and you could have remained independent like the ‘<tips=22>Elders</tips>.’”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r404","rowIndex":404,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……私には理想がある」","en":"“...I have an ideal.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ジョゼ・フェルナンデス","displayName":"José Fernandes","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r405","rowIndex":405,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=35>フェルナンデス</tips>はしばし考えてから、慎重に言葉を返した。","en":"<tips=35>Fernandes</tips> considered for a moment before replying with care.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r406","rowIndex":406,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「この街を、もっと平和で豊かな場所にして、行き場がなく辿り着いた同胞たちが希望を持って暮らせるようにしたい。きみの方針は、それにあっているように感じていた」","en":"“I want to make this city more peaceful and prosperous, so that those of our fellows who arrive here with nowhere else to go can live with hope. I felt that your policies accorded with that ideal.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ジョゼ・フェルナンデス","displayName":"José Fernandes","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r407","rowIndex":407,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それはまったく意外だな。さっきのあなたの言葉を借りれば、当時のおれは、誰よりも多く血の雨を降らせていたんじゃないか？」","en":"“That I never expected. To borrow your words from a moment ago, didn’t I make it rain more blood than anyone else in those days?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r408","rowIndex":408,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「きみがいなければもっと多くの犠牲者が出ていたし、街も今のようにはなっていなかったろう」","en":"“Without you, there would have been more victims, and the city would not have become what it is today.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ジョゼ・フェルナンデス","displayName":"José Fernandes","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r409","rowIndex":409,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あなたにそんな風に評価してもらえるとは光栄だな……」","en":"“I’m honored to be judged so highly by you...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r410","rowIndex":410,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>はいつものようにおどけることも出来ず、神妙な顔をしている。","en":"For once unable to joke as he usually did, <tips=3>Chris Tse</tips> looked solemn.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r411","rowIndex":411,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「当時の街を知っているものが今を見れば、その変化に目を見張るだろう。それはきみの努力によるものだ」","en":"“Anyone who knew the city then would marvel to see how it has changed. That transformation is the product of your efforts.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ジョゼ・フェルナンデス","displayName":"José Fernandes","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r412","rowIndex":412,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いや、時の流れだよ。おれは確かにここでは偉そうに振る舞って来たが、個人の力など些細なものだ。かわるべくしてかわった」","en":"“No. It was the passage of time. I may have thrown my weight around here, but the power of any one person amounts to very little. The city changed because it was bound to change.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r413","rowIndex":413,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「謙遜する必要はない」","en":"“There is no need for modesty.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ジョゼ・フェルナンデス","displayName":"José Fernandes","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r414","rowIndex":414,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それに、まだまだ物足りない」","en":"“Besides, it’s still nowhere near enough.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r415","rowIndex":415,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それは欲張りというものだ。残りの仕事は後の者に任せるべきだ。きみはもう充分働いた。繰り返すが、最期の時間くらい自分のために使うべきだ」","en":"“That is asking too much. You should entrust the remaining work to those who follow. You have worked enough. I repeat: at least use your final hours for yourself.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ジョゼ・フェルナンデス","displayName":"José Fernandes","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r416","rowIndex":416,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「こうしている時間も、全部自分のためさ……」","en":"“Every moment I spend like this is for myself...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r417","rowIndex":417,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>はそう言って、目を閉じると、","en":"<tips=3>Chris Tse</tips> said it and closed his eyes.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r418","rowIndex":418,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「すまないが、急に疲れた」","en":"“Sorry. I’m suddenly tired.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r419","rowIndex":419,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうか。長居してしまったようだな」","en":"“I see. It appears I stayed too long.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ジョゼ・フェルナンデス","displayName":"José Fernandes","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r420","rowIndex":420,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いや、いい時間だった。ありがとう、<tips=35>ジョゼ・フェルナンデス</tips>。そしてさようなら」","en":"“No. It was time well spent. Thank you, <tips=35>José Fernandes</tips>. And goodbye.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r421","rowIndex":421,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=35>フェルナンデス</tips>が去っても、彼は目を閉じて黙ったままだった。","en":"Even after <tips=35>Fernandes</tips> left, he remained silent with his eyes closed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r422","rowIndex":422,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　本人の言葉通り、ただ疲労し、休んでいるようには見えなかった。もしかしたら、泣いているのだろうか？","en":"Despite his own words, he did not look as though he were merely tired and resting. Could he have been crying?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r423","rowIndex":423,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そう思うと、僕は何故か胸がざわざわとするのを感じた。","en":"For some reason, the thought set my chest stirring uneasily.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r424","rowIndex":424,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……お前たち」","en":"“...You three.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r425","rowIndex":425,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>は目を閉じたまま口を開いた。","en":"<tips=3>Chris Tse</tips> spoke without opening his eyes.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r426","rowIndex":426,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=35>ジョゼ・フェルナンデス</tips>は義理堅く、信用出来る男だ。困ったら彼に相談するといい」","en":"“<tips=35>José Fernandes</tips> is honorable and trustworthy. If you run into trouble, go to him for advice.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r427","rowIndex":427,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　１６時をまわる頃、最後に<tips=41>グランドタワー</tips>にやって来たのは、<tips=33>壬生屋タカシ</tips>だった。","en":"It was just after four in the afternoon when the last man reached the <tips=41>Grand Tower</tips>: <tips=33>Takashi Mibuya</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r428","rowIndex":428,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=9>Y地区</tips>の売春王の二代目は、見るたびに違うスーツを身につけ、違うアクセサリーをしているが、目はいつも血走っている。けして醜い容姿ではないのだが、色白で病的な印象がある。","en":"The second-generation king of <tips=9>Y District’s</tips> prostitution trade wore a different suit and different accessories every time I saw him, but his eyes were always bloodshot. He was by no means ugly, yet his pallor gave him a sickly air.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r429","rowIndex":429,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その服も、宝石も、街で貧しい女が体を売った金で手に入れたものであるということから、巷では　”吸血鬼”　という異名で呼ばれているそうだが、この風貌もイメージを作るのに一役買っているのだろう。","en":"His clothes and jewels had all been bought with the money poor women in the city earned by selling their bodies. I heard that people therefore called him the ‘Vampire,’ and his appearance presumably helped reinforce the image.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r430","rowIndex":430,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　実際には彼の支配下で体を売る女のすべてが貧しくて不幸であるわけでもなく、イメージ通りの悲惨な運命をたどる女も、彼のあくどい商売が原因というよりも、社会の構造的な問題からすりつぶされてしまったようなケースが多い。","en":"In reality, not every woman who sold her body under his control was both poor and unhappy. Even among those who met the miserable fate suggested by his reputation, many appeared to have been ground down less by his unscrupulous business than by structural problems in society.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r431","rowIndex":431,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼の商売は女を食い物にするものではあったが、それでも業界内では比較的良心的な制度を採用しており、ことさらに強調されるべきあくどさはない。結局、人より多く稼ぎ、注目を集めていることが、<tips=33>壬生屋</tips>一家の悪評を高める最大の原因なのだ。","en":"His business did prey upon women. Even so, it employed relatively conscientious practices by the standards of the industry, with no particular viciousness that deserved to be singled out. In the end, the greatest cause of the <tips=33>Mibuya</tips> family’s bad reputation was simply that it earned more than its competitors and attracted more attention.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r432","rowIndex":432,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　だが、僕自身そうした現実を知っているにもかかわらず、あえて<tips=33>壬生屋</tips>を擁護する気になれない程度には彼は非人間的で利己的だった。","en":"Yet <tips=33>Mibuya</tips> was so inhuman and self-serving that, even knowing all of this, I still had no desire to defend him.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r433","rowIndex":433,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どうも、ご機嫌うるわしゅう」","en":"“A very good day to you.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"壬生屋タカシ","displayName":"Takashi Mibuya","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r434","rowIndex":434,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　香水のにおいをぷんぷんさせながら、彼は<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>の目の前に立った。","en":"Reeking of perfume, he stood before <tips=3>Chris Tse</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r435","rowIndex":435,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いやあ、ご連絡を頂きながら、遅れてしまって申し訳ありません。仕事が忙しくて、なかなか手が離せなかったのですよ」","en":"“I do apologize for arriving so late after receiving your message. Business has been terribly busy, and I could hardly tear myself away.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"壬生屋タカシ","displayName":"Takashi Mibuya","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r436","rowIndex":436,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なかなか繁盛しているようだな」","en":"“Business seems to be booming.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r437","rowIndex":437,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まあ悪くはないですね。最近はこの街にも若者たちが多く集まるようになったせいで、学生やらがよく働きに来るようになりました。これが実に稼ぐんですよ。最近は、この街出身の混血の女にも、日本人だの学生だのと名乗らせています。その方が高い値段を付けられる。立ちんぼみたいなのは、タダみたいな値段でも、なかなか客はつきませんな。そういうのを好む客自体減ったのかもしれません。この街も、よその地域みたいに若くて素人の日本人が一番高く売れるようになった。独自性がなくなって、哀しいもんですな」","en":"“Oh, we’re doing well enough. So many young people have been coming to the city lately that students often turn up looking for work—and they bring in a remarkable amount. Recently, we’ve even had mixed-race women from the city market themselves as Japanese, or as students. We can charge more that way. Streetwalkers can barely find a customer now even when they’re practically giving it away. Perhaps there are simply fewer clients who want that sort of thing. Just like everywhere else, young Japanese amateurs now fetch the highest prices in this city. A sad loss of local character, really.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"壬生屋タカシ","displayName":"Takashi Mibuya","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r438","rowIndex":438,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=33>壬生屋</tips>は尋ねられずとも、一方的にぺらぺらとまくしたてる。","en":"Without anyone asking, <tips=33>Mibuya</tips> rattled all of this off in a one-sided torrent.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r439","rowIndex":439,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「先代は元気かい？」","en":"“Is your predecessor well?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r440","rowIndex":440,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「元気なようですよ。ハワイでの暮らしは性に合っているらしい。私もいつかリタイアしたらあんなふうに暮らしたいものですな」","en":"“He seems well enough. Apparently life in Hawaii agrees with him. I’d like to live that way myself when I retire someday.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"壬生屋タカシ","displayName":"Takashi Mibuya","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r441","rowIndex":441,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうか」","en":"“I see.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r442","rowIndex":442,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　壬生屋家は<tips=9>Y地区</tips>における売春業の大元締めであるが、いわゆるギャングではなかった。経済力は<tips=27>廖志明</tips>のファミリーと肩を並べるほどのものがあっても、組織力や、いわゆる戦闘力は比較にならず、地域内での影響力もさほどではない。","en":"The Mibuya family controlled the prostitution industry of <tips=9>Y District</tips>, but it was not what one would ordinarily call a gang. Its economic power rivaled that of <tips=27>Liao Chi-ming’s</tips> family, yet its organization and so-called fighting strength were no match for theirs, and its influence within the district was modest.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r443","rowIndex":443,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>結成時から組織に名前を連ねてはいたが、形式としてはギャングではなく、やはり売春業者でしかなかった。しかし、二代目として先代から事業を譲り受けた<tips=33>壬生屋タカシ</tips>はそれをよしとはしなかった。","en":"Its name had appeared on the rolls of <tips=7>YS</tips> since the organization’s founding, but formally it was not a gang and remained nothing more than a prostitution business. <tips=33>Takashi Mibuya</tips>, however, was the second-generation head who inherited the enterprise from his predecessor, and he was not content with that position.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r444","rowIndex":444,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　先代の壬生屋太一が自分の組織をギャング化することを嫌ったのとは正反対で、執行部に接近して自らファミリーを持ったのである。","en":"In direct opposition to Taichi Mibuya, who had resisted turning his organization into a gang, Takashi approached the executive leadership and formed a family of his own.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r445","rowIndex":445,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>内では、<tips=26>劉建志</tips>と特に親しい。","en":"Within <tips=7>YS</tips>, he was particularly close to <tips=26>Ryu Kenshi</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r446","rowIndex":446,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　二人は年が近く、幼い頃からの知り合いであったようだ。その<tips=26>劉</tips>が、先に<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>内で立場を築いて街で幅を利かせるようになったのが、<tips=33>壬生屋</tips>がギャングになろうとした直接的な理由らしい。","en":"The two were close in age and apparently had known each other since childhood. <tips=26>Ryu</tips> established his position in <tips=7>YS</tips> first and began to wield influence in the city; it appeared that his success directly inspired <tips=33>Mibuya</tips> to become a gangster.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r447","rowIndex":447,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=33>壬生屋タカシ</tips>が執行部に取り入る橋渡しをしたのも、<tips=26>劉</tips>である。","en":"It was also <tips=26>Ryu</tips> who opened the way for <tips=33>Takashi Mibuya</tips> to ingratiate himself with the executive leadership.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r448","rowIndex":448,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=39>ジェフリー</tips>や<tips=4>馬明</tips>は、経済面で強い<tips=33>壬生屋</tips>の組織が武力を持つことを危惧し、ギャング化することに反対したと聞いているが、この時も<tips=26>劉</tips>が<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>を説得した。","en":"I had heard that <tips=39>Jeffrey</tips> and <tips=4>Ma Ming</tips>, fearing that <tips=33>Mibuya’s</tips> financially powerful organization would acquire armed force, opposed its transformation into a gang. On that occasion too, <tips=26>Ryu</tips> persuaded <tips=3>Chris Tse</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r449","rowIndex":449,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それによって、<tips=33>壬生屋タカシ</tips>は、<tips=81>龍頭</tips>公認で業者からギャングとなり、彼の根城である<tips=59>暗闇通り</tips>の一角を支配することとなったわけである。","en":"As a result, with the <tips=81>Longtou’s</tips> official sanction, <tips=33>Takashi Mibuya</tips> went from vice operator to gangster and came to rule a section of <tips=59>Darkness Street</tips>, his stronghold.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r450","rowIndex":450,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　こういう経緯のせいか、どこか<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>に対してもなれなれしいように見える。","en":"Perhaps because of that history, he appeared somewhat overfamiliar even with <tips=3>Chris Tse</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r451","rowIndex":451,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　もっとも、単に彼の性分かもしれないが。","en":"Then again, perhaps that was simply his nature.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r452","rowIndex":452,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ときに二代目」","en":"“By the way, Junior.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r453","rowIndex":453,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　いい気になって自分の商売について語る<tips=33>壬生屋</tips>を、<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>はそう言って遮った。","en":"<tips=3>Chris Tse</tips> cut <tips=33>Mibuya</tips> off as he smugly carried on about his business.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r454","rowIndex":454,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なんですか？」","en":"“Yes?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"壬生屋タカシ","displayName":"Takashi Mibuya","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r455","rowIndex":455,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「商売繁盛は結構だが、最低限のルールを守って貰わなくてはならない」","en":"“Good for you that business is booming, but you still have to follow the basic rules.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r456","rowIndex":456,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その言葉に、<tips=33>壬生屋</tips>は露骨に眉をひそめ、","en":"At the remark, <tips=33>Mibuya’s</tips> brows visibly drew together.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r457","rowIndex":457,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どういう意味でしょう？」","en":"“What might you mean by that?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"壬生屋タカシ","displayName":"Takashi Mibuya","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r458","rowIndex":458,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「私が口にすれば後に引けなくなってしまう。指摘されないうちに、自分で改めるんだな」","en":"“If I say it outright, I won’t be able to back down. Put things right yourself before I have to point them out.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r459","rowIndex":459,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「な、何もやましいことなどありませんが？」","en":"“I-I haven’t done anything improper.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"壬生屋タカシ","displayName":"Takashi Mibuya","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r460","rowIndex":460,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=33>壬生屋</tips>は笑顔を作るが、その顔は引きつっている。","en":"<tips=33>Mibuya</tips> forced a smile, but his face was rigid with strain.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r461","rowIndex":461,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そういうことにしておいてやろう。ただ、私が死んでも情報はここにいる三人に引き継がれる。うかつな真似はしないほうがいいぞ。それが、<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>からの最期の忠告だ」","en":"“I’ll let that be your story. But even after I die, everything I know will pass to the three men here. Don’t do anything foolish. Take that as <tips=3>Chris Tse’s</tips> final warning.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r462","rowIndex":462,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……おっしゃる意味はわかりませんが、ありがたく受け止めさせていただきます」","en":"“...I can’t say I understand what you mean, but I’ll take your warning to heart.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"壬生屋タカシ","displayName":"Takashi Mibuya","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r463","rowIndex":463,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=33>壬生屋</tips>はうやうやしく礼をするが、来た時の礼よりは、いささか動作が早いようだった。","en":"<tips=33>Mibuya</tips> bowed deferentially, though rather more quickly than he had on arriving.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r464","rowIndex":464,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それでは」","en":"“Then, if you will excuse me.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r465","rowIndex":465,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　逃げるようにその場を立ち去る。","en":"He all but fled the room.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r466","rowIndex":466,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「わかりやすいやつだ。大物にはなれないな」","en":"“Easy to read. He’ll never make it big.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r467","rowIndex":467,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ドアが閉まった後、<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>はそう言って溜息をついた。","en":"After the door closed, <tips=3>Chris Tse</tips> delivered the verdict with a sigh.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r468","rowIndex":468,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「何か情報を掴んでらっしゃるのですか？」","en":"“Have you learned something?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r469","rowIndex":469,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=39>ジェフリー</tips>の問いには首を横に振り、","en":"He shook his head at <tips=39>Jeffrey’s</tips> question.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r470","rowIndex":470,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「別に。適当にからかっただけさ。調子に乗ってベラベラと話しやがるのでむかついてな」","en":"“No. I was just messing with him. The bastard got carried away and wouldn’t stop running his mouth. It pissed me off.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r471","rowIndex":471,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして従者の少女に促して吸い飲みを差し出させ、それで口の中を湿らすと、","en":"At his signal, the girl attending him held out a spouted cup, and he wet his mouth from it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r472","rowIndex":472,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あいつはきわめて優秀だが、扱うのは容易い。脅威にはならないだろう」","en":"“He is extremely capable, but easy to handle. He probably poses no threat.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r473","rowIndex":473,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　と、にべもなく短評をのべた。","en":"That was his brusque assessment.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r474","rowIndex":474,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　すべての来訪者が帰ると、ずっと別室で待っていた<tips=31>エリー・ホワイト</tips>の番となる。","en":"Once every visitor had left, it was the turn of <tips=31>Ellie White</tips>, who had been waiting in another room throughout.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r475","rowIndex":475,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>本人の希望により、僕らは退室し、二人きりの面会となった。","en":"At <tips=3>Chris Tse’s</tips> own request, we withdrew and left the two to meet alone.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r476","rowIndex":476,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=81>龍頭</tips>とあの女は、そんなに親密な関係だったのかい？」","en":"“Were the <tips=81>Longtou</tips> and that woman really that close?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r477","rowIndex":477,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　別室で彼らの面会の終わりを待つこととなった僕は、温かいお茶を飲みながら<tips=4>馬明</tips>にそう話しかけた。","en":"Waiting in another room for their meeting to end, I put the question to <tips=4>Ma Ming</tips> over a cup of warm tea.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r478","rowIndex":478,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まあそうだなあ。確かにつき合いは長いが……」","en":"“Well, I suppose. They’ve certainly known each other a long time, but...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬明","displayName":"Ma Ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r479","rowIndex":479,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=4>馬明</tips>は曖昧に頷く。","en":"<tips=4>Ma Ming</tips> nodded noncommittally.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r480","rowIndex":480,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「親密と言えば親密なんだろう。実のところおれもそこまで二人の関係について、詳しくは知らないんだが」","en":"“You could call them close, I suppose. Truth is, even I don’t know all that much about their relationship.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬明","displayName":"Ma Ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r481","rowIndex":481,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その言葉を受けて<tips=39>ジェフリー</tips>の方を振り向くと、彼は無言で首を左右に振る。","en":"At his answer, I turned to <tips=39>Jeffrey</tips>. He silently shook his head.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r482","rowIndex":482,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　側近の彼がまるきり知らないというのは考えにくいから、<tips=81>龍頭</tips>のプライベートについて語りたくないということだろう。","en":"It was difficult to imagine that his close aide knew nothing at all. Presumably, he meant that he did not wish to discuss the <tips=81>Longtou’s</tips> private life.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r483","rowIndex":483,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「しかし、兄貴が心から愛していたのは、お前の母さんだけだったと思うぞ」","en":"“Still, I believe the only woman our brother ever truly loved was your mother.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬明","displayName":"Ma Ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r484","rowIndex":484,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そんなことを心配しているわけじゃない」","en":"“That wasn’t my concern.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r485","rowIndex":485,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕は顔を顰める。","en":"I frowned.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r486","rowIndex":486,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「二人の関係によって、僕が今後の対応を考える必要があるかどうかを知りたかっただけだよ」","en":"“I only wanted to know whether their relationship was something I’d need to take into account going forward.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r487","rowIndex":487,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そういう意味では、あまり考えなくともいいんじゃないか？　おれの感じでは、少なくとも一時は恋人か愛人関係だったとは思うが、二人とも組織のなかでは一線を引いて振る舞っている。<tips=31>エリー・ホワイト</tips>は一筋縄ではいかない女だが、そんなに悪い奴ではないし、特別扱いしなくともややこしい問題にはならんだろう」","en":"“If that’s what you mean, I don’t think you need to worry much about it. Far as I can tell, they were lovers—or she was his mistress, at least for a while. But they’ve always kept that separate from how they conduct themselves in the organization. <tips=31>Ellie White</tips> can be a handful, but she’s not a bad sort. I doubt she’ll cause trouble just because you don’t give her special treatment.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬明","displayName":"Ma Ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r488","rowIndex":488,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　全く信用するに足らない、<tips=4>馬明</tips>のおおざっぱな印象に基づく見解だったが、<tips=39>ジェフリー</tips>の訂正がないところを見ると滅茶苦茶な意見というわけでもないのだろう。","en":"It was an opinion based on <tips=4>Ma Ming’s</tips> hopelessly rough impressions and not remotely trustworthy. Still, since <tips=39>Jeffrey</tips> did not correct him, it was probably not complete nonsense either.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r489","rowIndex":489,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうか。だけど、女とは二人きりで別れを済ませたいだなんて、ロマンチックなところもあるんだね」","en":"“I see. Still, wanting to say goodbye to a woman in private... I suppose he has a romantic side after all.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r490","rowIndex":490,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕が溜息をつくと、","en":"I sighed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r491","rowIndex":491,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「知らないのか？　兄貴は昔から誰よりもロマンチックだ。お前の母さんへのアタックも、もの凄いものだったぞ？　よし、暇つぶしに話してやろうか」","en":"“You didn’t know? Our brother has always been the biggest romantic of us all. You should have seen the way he pursued your mother. How about I tell you the story while we wait?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬明","displayName":"Ma Ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r492","rowIndex":492,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いや、それはいい」","en":"“No, thanks.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r493","rowIndex":493,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕が思いきり苦い顔で否定すると、","en":"I refused with an emphatic grimace.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r494","rowIndex":494,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうか。今度<tips=44>筱喬</tips>と二人揃ったときにしてやろう。聞いたら自分たちがどんなに運命的な恋愛の末に生まれたか、実感するだろうよ」","en":"“I see. Then I’ll save it until you and <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> are together. Once you hear it, you’ll understand just what a fateful romance brought the two of you into the world.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬明","displayName":"Ma Ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r495","rowIndex":495,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=4>馬明</tips>はそう言って笑った。","en":"<tips=4>Ma Ming</tips> laughed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r496","rowIndex":496,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=31>エリー・ホワイト</tips>は謎に包まれた人物だ。","en":"<tips=31>Ellie White</tips> was a figure veiled in mystery.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r497","rowIndex":497,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　銃器に限らず、その他、普通の手段では手に入らないものを密輸入し、この<tips=9>Y地区</tips>で販売している。物に限らず、人間の密入国、密出国も手伝っており、とにかくいかなるものでも国境をこえさせるというのが彼女の仕事だ。","en":"Her work was not limited to firearms. She smuggled other goods unobtainable through ordinary channels into <tips=9>Y District</tips> and sold them there. Nor did she deal only in objects: she helped people enter and leave countries illegally as well. Her business, in short, was getting anything at all across a border.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r498","rowIndex":498,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ここまでは少しこのあたりの裏社会に通じているものなら誰でも知っているところだが、その来歴や、どんなルートで物や人を動かしているのかは明らかにされていない。","en":"Anyone with even a little knowledge of the local underworld knew that much. Her background, however, and the routes she used to move people and goods remained unknown.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r499","rowIndex":499,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ただ、背景にロシアンマフィアとの繋がりがあるのは間違いがないだろう。この街にはロシア人は数が少なくあまり大きな影響力を持ってはいないが、彼女の身のまわりにはロシア人が多く出入りしている。彼女が取り扱う商品の内容などをみても、ロシアとの繋がりを否定するのは難しい。","en":"Even so, it seemed certain that she had ties to the Russian Mafia behind the scenes. Russians were few in the city and wielded little influence, yet a great many moved in and out of her circle. The goods she handled made her connection to Russia equally difficult to deny.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r500","rowIndex":500,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そうだとすると、彼女自身もロシア人である可能性が高いが、それに関しては直接的な証拠はない。その素性はまったく不明だ。商売の長さからすれば彼女は相当若作りをしているか、幼い頃から商売をしていたことになるが、昔の<tips=31>エリー・ホワイト</tips>と今の<tips=31>エリー・ホワイト</tips>は別人だという話もあり、そこから何かを辿ることも出来ない。何しろ、いつも真っ黒な喪服を着て、顔の上半分を通常のものよりずっと濃いヴェールで隠しているのである。","en":"If that was true, Ellie herself was probably Russian, but there was no direct evidence. Her identity remained wholly unknown. Given the length of her career, she either looked considerably younger than her age or had entered the trade as a child. There were also stories that the <tips=31>Ellie White</tips> of the past and the <tips=31>Ellie White</tips> of the present were different people, so even the name gave us nothing to trace. She always wore black mourning clothes and concealed the upper half of her face behind a veil far darker than any ordinary one.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r501","rowIndex":501,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　こういう人物が<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>の幹部としての座についているというのは不思議な話だが、<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>と個人的な、そして感情的な繋がりがあるのならばある程度は納得出来る話だ。","en":"It was strange for someone like her to hold a seat among the officers of <tips=7>YS</tips>. Personal and emotional ties to <tips=3>Chris Tse</tips>, however, would explain it to some extent.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r502","rowIndex":502,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=31>エリー・ホワイト</tips>の面会時間は思ったよりも短く、<tips=4>馬明</tips>が、昨夜<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>の意外な友人がここを訪れたというような話をはじめたところで、ドアを開く音が聞こえた。","en":"<tips=31>Ellie White’s</tips> audience was shorter than I expected. <tips=4>Ma Ming</tips> had only just begun telling me that an unexpected friend of <tips=3>Chris Tse’s</tips> had visited the night before when we heard a door open.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r503","rowIndex":503,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕と<tips=4>馬明</tips>が部屋から外へ出ると、ボディーガードと共にエレベーターの方へ向かって歩く彼女の背中が見えた。","en":"<tips=4>Ma Ming</tips> and I left the room and saw her walking away toward the elevator with her bodyguards.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r504","rowIndex":504,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「もう終わったのかい」","en":"“Finished already?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬明","displayName":"Ma Ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r505","rowIndex":505,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=4>馬明</tips>が声をかけると、彼女は振り返った。","en":"At <tips=4>Ma Ming’s</tips> call, she turned.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r506","rowIndex":506,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ええ」","en":"“Yes.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エリー・ホワイト","displayName":"Ellie White","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r507","rowIndex":507,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「今日はここで最後まで見守らないのか？」","en":"“You’re not staying to watch over him until the end?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬明","displayName":"Ma Ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r508","rowIndex":508,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ええ。もう用は済んだもの。それに私にはまだ仕事があるわ」","en":"“No. My business here is finished. And I still have work of my own.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エリー・ホワイト","displayName":"Ellie White","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r509","rowIndex":509,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうか」","en":"“I see.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬明","displayName":"Ma Ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r510","rowIndex":510,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それでは、ごきげんよう。また連絡を待っているわ」","en":"“Goodbye, then. I’ll be waiting to hear from you again.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エリー・ホワイト","displayName":"Ellie White","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r511","rowIndex":511,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=31>エリー</tips>は気丈に頭を下げて、そしてくるりと踵を返すとエレベーターへ向かって歩き始めた。","en":"<tips=31>Ellie</tips> bowed with composure, turned neatly on one heel, and resumed walking toward the elevator.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r512","rowIndex":512,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「目が真っ赤に腫れてたな」","en":"“Her eyes were red and swollen.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬明","displayName":"Ma Ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r513","rowIndex":513,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=4>馬明</tips>が言うのに、僕は無言で頷いた。","en":"At <tips=4>Ma Ming’s</tips> words, I nodded in silence.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r514","rowIndex":514,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　こうしてすべての幹部たちの面会が終わり、ついに僕と<tips=44>筱喬</tips>が部屋に入る番になった。","en":"With that, every officer’s visit was over. At last, it was time for <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> and me to enter the room.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r515","rowIndex":515,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「お嬢様は、いま支度をなさっています。少々お待ちください」","en":"“The young lady is getting ready now. Please wait just a little longer.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"レイレイ","displayName":"Leilei","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r516","rowIndex":516,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　別室で妹を待っている僕に、<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>の身のまわりの世話をしていた少女——<tips=30>レイレイ</tips>はそう言った。","en":"So <tips=30>Leilei</tips>—the girl who had been attending to <tips=3>Chris Tse</tips>—told me as I waited for my sister in the other room.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r517","rowIndex":517,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ありがとう」","en":"“Thank you.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r518","rowIndex":518,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕の言葉に、<tips=30>レイレイ</tips>は頭を下げて、部屋を出て行こうとする。","en":"At my thanks, <tips=30>Leilei</tips> bowed and started to leave the room.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r519","rowIndex":519,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「帰るのかい？」","en":"“Are you going home?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r520","rowIndex":520,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いえ、お嬢様の準備をお手伝いしに戻ります」","en":"“No. I’m going back to help the young lady get ready.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"レイレイ","displayName":"Leilei","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r521","rowIndex":521,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「何日ここで仕事をしているんだ？　目の下のくまは酷いし、足元はふらふらで、とても見ていられない」","en":"“How many days have you been working here? The circles under your eyes are terrible, and you can barely stay on your feet. I can’t stand seeing you like this.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r522","rowIndex":522,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=30>レイレイ</tips>は答えようとしない。","en":"<tips=30>Leilei</tips> made no attempt to answer.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r523","rowIndex":523,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「今すぐ帰るんだ。倒れてしまう。きみがそこまで尽くす必要はないだろう」","en":"“Go home right now. You’re going to collapse. You don’t have to do this much for him.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r524","rowIndex":524,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いえ、それは出来ません」","en":"“No. I cannot do that.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"レイレイ","displayName":"Leilei","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r525","rowIndex":525,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=30>レイレイ</tips>は顔を横に振る。","en":"<tips=30>Leilei</tips> shook her head.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r526","rowIndex":526,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いま、<tips=81>龍頭</tips>様のそばを離れるわけにはいかないんです」","en":"“I cannot leave the <tips=81>Longtou’s</tips> side now.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"レイレイ","displayName":"Leilei","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r527","rowIndex":527,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　衰弱しているわりに意志のこもったきっぱりとした言葉だった。","en":"Weak as she was, her words were firm and full of resolve.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r528","rowIndex":528,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「しかしきみ……」","en":"“But you...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r529","rowIndex":529,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「好きにさせてやれ」","en":"“Let her do as she wishes.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬明","displayName":"Ma Ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r530","rowIndex":530,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　言おうとする僕を<tips=4>馬明</tips>が遮った。","en":"<tips=4>Ma Ming</tips> interrupted me before I could finish.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r531","rowIndex":531,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それが人情ってもんだろう。それにな、どうせお前が何か言ったって聞きやしない。兄貴が何度帰れと言っても無駄だったんだ」","en":"“That’s only natural. Besides, she won’t listen to anything you say. Our brother told her to go home any number of times, and it did no good.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬明","displayName":"Ma Ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r532","rowIndex":532,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=4>馬明</tips>がそこまで言うのならば、僕もそれ以上無理強いする気にはなれなかった。","en":"With <tips=4>Ma Ming</tips> putting it that way, I no longer felt like pressing her any further.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r533","rowIndex":533,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　溜息をついて肩をすくめ、諦めたことをジェスチャーで伝えると、","en":"I sighed and shrugged to show that I was giving up.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r534","rowIndex":534,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ありがとうございます」","en":"“Thank you.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"レイレイ","displayName":"Leilei","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r535","rowIndex":535,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=30>レイレイ</tips>はぺこりと頭を下げ、よろけるような足取りで部屋を出て行く。","en":"<tips=30>Leilei</tips> dipped her head in a bow and left the room on unsteady feet.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r536","rowIndex":536,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　やがて、準備が出来た<tips=44>筱喬</tips>がやって来て、僕は<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>——父の部屋のドアを開けた。","en":"Eventually, <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> arrived, ready at last, and I opened the door to <tips=3>Chris Tse’s</tips> room—to Father’s room.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r537","rowIndex":537,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　何人もの面会で彼は疲労していたが、意識ははっきりとしていた。","en":"The succession of visitors had left him exhausted, but his mind was clear.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r538","rowIndex":538,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　今日の昼間まで、覚醒と昏睡の間で混濁していたのと同じ人物とは思えない。最期の仕事だという高揚感が彼の意識を支えているのだろうか。","en":"He seemed a different man from the one who had drifted between consciousness and coma until that afternoon. Perhaps the exhilaration of performing his final work sustained his awareness.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r539","rowIndex":539,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=44>筱喬</tips>ははじめから泣いてしまってほとんど話にならなかった。","en":"<tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> was in tears from the moment she entered and could hardly speak at all.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r540","rowIndex":540,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　父の姿を見るなり、その胸元にすがりつき、号泣する。","en":"The instant she saw Father, she clung to his chest and wept uncontrollably.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r541","rowIndex":541,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「うっ……お父さん……どうして……どうしてこんな……うううっ……」","en":"“Ngh... Dad... why...? How could this... nnngh...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r542","rowIndex":542,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　父は穏やかにその背中を見守っていた。","en":"Father gazed calmly down at her back.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r543","rowIndex":543,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕もこの期に及んで妹を邪魔する気はない。黙って泣き疲れるのを待った。","en":"Even I had no desire to interrupt my sister at a time like this. I waited in silence for her to cry herself out.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r544","rowIndex":544,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕は妹のように泣く気にはなれなかった。理由は少し考えるだけでもいくつも思いつく。","en":"I could not bring myself to cry the way she did. Even a moment’s thought suggested any number of reasons why.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r545","rowIndex":545,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　まず第一に父さんはまだ生きている。","en":"First, Father was still alive.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r546","rowIndex":546,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　第二に彼の死によって引き起こされる色々なことが頭をよぎっている。","en":"Second, all the things his death would set in motion kept passing through my mind.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r547","rowIndex":547,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　第三に、そもそも僕は人の死で泣いたことがない。","en":"Third, I had never cried over anyone’s death in the first place.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r548","rowIndex":548,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　——そして第四に、僕は、彼が死から逃れる最後の可能性が存在することを知っている。","en":"—And fourth, I knew there was still one last chance for him to escape death.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r549","rowIndex":549,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　父の手が少し動いた。","en":"Father’s hand moved slightly.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r550","rowIndex":550,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おそらく、<tips=44>筱喬</tips>の頭か背中でも撫でたかったのだろうが、持ち上がらなかった。","en":"He probably wanted to stroke <tips=44>Siu-kiu’s</tips> head or back, but could not raise his hand.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r551","rowIndex":551,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕はその手を取って、<tips=44>筱喬</tips>の背におく。","en":"I took the hand and placed it upon <tips=44>Siu-kiu’s</tips> back.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r552","rowIndex":552,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ありがとう」","en":"“Thank you.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r553","rowIndex":553,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　と父はかすれた声で呟いた。","en":"Father murmured the words hoarsely.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r554","rowIndex":554,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=44>筱喬</tips>が散々泣いて、落ち着きを取り戻してから、父は一言だけ言葉を残した。","en":"After <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> had wept and wept, then recovered a measure of calm, Father left her with a single sentence.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r555","rowIndex":555,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「お前は体に気をつけて、自分の幸せのために生きろ。他のことは何も考えるな」","en":"“Look after yourself and live for your own happiness. Don’t think about anything else.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r556","rowIndex":556,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=44>筱喬</tips>は何度も頷いて、また少し泣いた。","en":"<tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> nodded again and again, then wept a little more.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r557","rowIndex":557,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　次は僕の番だが、僕がこれから語ろうとしていることは<tips=44>筱喬</tips>には聞かせられない。","en":"My turn came next, but I could not allow <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> to hear what I was about to say.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r558","rowIndex":558,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「二人で話したいんだ。席を外してくれるかい？」","en":"“I want to speak with him alone. Would you leave us for a moment?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r559","rowIndex":559,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=44>筱喬</tips>は思ったより素直で、こくりと頷くと、顔をこすりながら部屋を出て行った。","en":"<tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> was more cooperative than I expected. With a small nod, she left the room wiping at her face.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r560","rowIndex":560,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そうして僕は父と完全に二人きりになった。","en":"And then Father and I were entirely alone.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r561","rowIndex":561,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　こんな風に、空間のなかにたった二人で放り出されるのは、いつ以来だろう。","en":"How long had it been since the two of us were left alone together in a room like this?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r562","rowIndex":562,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　考えてみて、少なくとも自分の記憶のなかでは過去に一度もなかったことに気がついた。","en":"Thinking it over, I realized it had never once happened before, at least as far as I could remember.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r563","rowIndex":563,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　——二人きりになったのはこれが初めてなのか。","en":"Was this the first time we had ever been alone?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r564","rowIndex":564,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そう自覚すると、心の中ににわかに緊張感が生まれた。","en":"The moment I realized it, a sudden tension rose inside me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r565","rowIndex":565,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「お前には自由に生きてもらうつもりだったが、結局、こんな形になってしまってすまないな」","en":"“I meant to let you live as you pleased. I’m sorry it’s come to this in the end.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r566","rowIndex":566,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　意外にも父の最初の言葉は謝罪だった。","en":"Unexpectedly, Father’s first words were an apology.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r567","rowIndex":567,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「謝る必要はありません。まだ僕はあなたの言う通りにすると決めたわけじゃないですから」","en":"“You have no need to apologize. I still haven’t decided to do as you say.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r568","rowIndex":568,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まだそんなこと言っているのか。無駄なあがきだよ。結局自分の生まれ故郷からは離れられない。お前はそういうやつだ。今ここで何と言おうが、結局おれの言った通りにしてくれるはずだ」","en":"“Still saying that? You can fight it all you like, but it’s no use. In the end, you can’t get away from the place where you were born. That’s the kind of man you are. Say whatever you like now—you’ll end up doing what I asked.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r569","rowIndex":569,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「僕のことなんか大して知らないでしょうに」","en":"“You hardly know me.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r570","rowIndex":570,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　父は肯定も否定もせず、微笑していた。","en":"Father only smiled, neither agreeing nor disagreeing.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r571","rowIndex":571,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　どことなく、僕の言葉が彼の心に浸透していないような感じがする。","en":"Somehow, I felt as though my words were not sinking in.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r572","rowIndex":572,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　衰弱が彼の知性を奪おうとしているのかもしれない。","en":"Perhaps his weakness was beginning to rob him of his intelligence.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r573","rowIndex":573,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　無理もないことだ。","en":"That was hardly surprising.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r574","rowIndex":574,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　医者の言葉によれば、まさしく死を目の前にした人間なのだ。","en":"According to the doctor, he was a man staring death in the face.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r575","rowIndex":575,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼は自分の目の前の空間を見つめながら沈黙し、時間は無為に消費されてゆく。","en":"He stared in silence at the space before him while time passed to no purpose.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r576","rowIndex":576,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　父の方からもうこれ以上言うことがないのか。","en":"Did Father have nothing more to say to me?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r577","rowIndex":577,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　とすれば、僕はここを出て、後はその死を待つことになる。","en":"If so, I would leave, and all that remained would be to wait for his death.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r578","rowIndex":578,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……実は、僕はあなたに一つだけ質問があるんです」","en":"“...Actually, there’s just one thing I want to ask you.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r579","rowIndex":579,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　この瞬間までほとんど言うつもりがなかったその言葉を、僕は口にしてしまった。","en":"I found myself voicing what, until that very moment, I had had almost no intention of saying.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r580","rowIndex":580,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼の視線はゆっくりと動き、そして僕の顔の上で止まった。","en":"His gaze moved slowly, then settled on my face.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r581","rowIndex":581,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　本当に言ってもいいのだろうか？　僕は顔を顰め、しかしここで話をやめるわけにはいかなかった。","en":"Could I really tell him? I grimaced, but having begun, I could not stop now.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r582","rowIndex":582,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕は手短に伝えた。かつて<tips=18>ローズ・クラブ</tips>で行われていた不死身の人間を作成する方法が判明したことを。","en":"I briefly told him that we had discovered how the <tips=18>Rose Club</tips> had once created immortal human beings.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r583","rowIndex":583,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして、それを実行可能なことを。","en":"And that we could do it ourselves.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r584","rowIndex":584,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　細かい情報を、全て包み隠さず伝えた。過去の実験での成功率や、失敗時の発症のデメリット。成功した場合でも起こりうるリスク。","en":"I held nothing back, giving him every detail: the success rate in the earlier experiments, the consequences if the attempt failed and he developed symptoms, and the risks that remained even if it succeeded.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r585","rowIndex":585,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　父はその間表情を変えず、相づちもせずに黙っており、理解しているのかどうか不安になるほどだった。","en":"Father remained silent throughout without changing his expression or offering the slightest response, until I grew uncertain whether he understood me at all.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r586","rowIndex":586,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「不死身か。面白い話だねえ」","en":"“Immortality, eh? Now that’s an interesting proposition.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r587","rowIndex":587,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　父はそっと息を吐く。","en":"Father let out a quiet breath.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r588","rowIndex":588,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼には驚いた様子もないし、疑うような態度もみえない。まるで、前に一度同じ話を聞かされたかのように穏やかな表情をしている。","en":"He showed neither surprise nor doubt. His expression was so calm that one might have thought he had heard the same account once before.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r589","rowIndex":589,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　当然そういう女がいたことは知っているはずだ。当時彼は誰よりも深く<tips=18>ローズ・クラブ</tips>と関わっていたのだから。","en":"Naturally, he must have known that such a woman existed. In those days, he had been more deeply involved with the <tips=18>Rose Club</tips> than anyone else.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r590","rowIndex":590,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「が、それは出来ないな」","en":"“But I can’t do it.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r591","rowIndex":591,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その答えは、前から答えを用意していたかのように、自然に彼の口から出て来た。","en":"The answer came naturally to his lips, as though he had prepared it long ago.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r592","rowIndex":592,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「おれは若い時から、人の一生の美しさというものを考えて生きて来た」","en":"“Ever since I was young, I’ve lived with the beauty of a human life always on my mind.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r593","rowIndex":593,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その声はかすかで、唇に接するほど耳を近づけなければ聞き取れないほどだった。","en":"His voice was so faint that I had to bring my ear almost to his lips to make it out.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r594","rowIndex":594,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「人生は絵画のようなもので、自分という筆でそこに何かを描くのだ。そういう意味ではなかなかうまくやって来たと思う。しかし、お前の提案に乗れば最後の最後ですべてを汚すことになる。人間の命は、ただあるだけで輝くわけではない。行動が輝かせるんだ。命惜しさに<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>が他人の血を啜ったとなればお笑い草さ」","en":"“A life is like a painting: you use yourself as the brush and leave something upon it. By that measure, I think I’ve done fairly well. But if I take you up on this, I’ll ruin the whole work at the very end. A human life does not shine merely by existing. It is what a person does that makes it shine. If word got around that <tips=3>Chris Tse</tips> had drunk another person’s blood out of fear for his own life, what a joke I’d be.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r595","rowIndex":595,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「でも」","en":"“But—”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r596","rowIndex":596,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「でももクソもない。そもそもな、世の中ってのはどういうわけか、こういう試みは必ず失敗に終わるように出来てるんだ。今おれがその提案にのれば、生き延びたとしても、必ず醜い姿を晒すのさ。そう決まっているんだ。……なあ<tips=1>亮</tips>。自分の人生を自分で汚すものは、かならず最悪の結末を迎えるんだよ。おれが今まで見てきた人間は全てそうだった」","en":"“No buts, damn it. Somehow, the world is made so that attempts like this always end in failure. If I take you up on it now, then even if I survive, I’ll inevitably end up showing the world an ugly spectacle. That’s simply how it works. ...Listen, <tips=1>Leung</tips>. Anyone who soils his own life with his own hands is bound to meet the worst possible end. Every person I’ve seen do it ended that way.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r597","rowIndex":597,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……生きたくはないんですか？」","en":"“Don’t you want to live?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r598","rowIndex":598,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「生きたいさ。でもそれをやれば、命より大事なものを失う。……なあ、おれはその『命より大事なもの』のために、意地を張って、沢山の人間の命を奪ってきたんだぜ。ここで譲ってたまるか」","en":"“Of course I want to live. But if I do that, I’ll lose something more important than life. ...Listen, I’ve stubbornly held my ground for the sake of that ‘something more important than life,’ and I’ve taken a great many lives for it. I’m damned if I’ll give way now.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r599","rowIndex":599,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「僕には、そういう人生の美学みたいなものはわかりません」","en":"“I don’t understand that kind of philosophy about the beauty of a life.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r600","rowIndex":600,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いいんだよ。おれだけが分かっていれば」","en":"“That’s all right. I’m the only one who needs to understand.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r601","rowIndex":601,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして、父は僕の目を見る。","en":"Then Father looked into my eyes.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r602","rowIndex":602,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どこからそんな話を仕入れたか知らねえが、お前も気をつけるんだな。人を死ななくするだなんて、まともな話じゃねえんだ」","en":"“I don’t know where you picked up a story like that, but you’d better be careful too. There’s nothing sane about trying to make people immortal.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r603","rowIndex":603,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「僕は学術的な興味しかないので、ご心配なく」","en":"“My interest is purely academic, so you needn’t worry.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r604","rowIndex":604,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕が肩をすくめると、父はじっと僕の目を見つめたまま何か言いたそうなそぶりを見せたが、結局何も言わず、かわりに小さな溜息をついた。","en":"I shrugged. Father kept his eyes fixed on mine and seemed about to say something, but in the end he said nothing, merely letting out a small sigh.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r605","rowIndex":605,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「だけど、そう言ってくれて、正直ほっとしています。もし何があっても生きたいと言ったら、僕はひどくおぞましい行為をしなければならなかった」","en":"“Still, to be honest, I’m relieved you answered that way. If you had said you wanted to live no matter what, I would have been forced to do something truly abhorrent.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r606","rowIndex":606,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なら最初から言うな」","en":"“Then you shouldn’t have told me in the first place.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r607","rowIndex":607,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　父は苦笑する。","en":"Father smiled wryly.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r608","rowIndex":608,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「教えないのはフェアじゃないと思ったんです」","en":"“I thought it would be unfair not to tell you.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r609","rowIndex":609,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「相変わらず変な奴だな……。ああ、すこし疲れた……。おれに残された時間はもうほんの僅かしかないようだ。お前とは、もっとゆっくりと話したいことがたくさんあったんだが、おれは、このあと兄弟たちとも会わなければならない……すまねえな……」","en":"“You’re as strange as ever... Ah, I’m a little tired... It seems I have almost no time left. There were so many things I wanted to talk over with you at our leisure, but I still have to see my brothers after this... I’m sorry...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r610","rowIndex":610,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　父は、すでに意識がもうろうとしているようだった。","en":"Father’s consciousness already appeared to be growing dim.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r611","rowIndex":611,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「わかっています。そろそろ、僕は引き下がりましょう」","en":"“I understand. I should leave you now.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r612","rowIndex":612,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……ああ、本当に、お前には、何と言ったらいいのか。感謝をしている。それを、一度も言ったことはなかったが、それだけは、最後に伝えなけりゃと……」","en":"“...Ah, I truly don’t know what to say to you. I’m grateful. I never once told you, but that much, at least, I have to say before the end...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r613","rowIndex":613,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「べつに、感謝されるようなことはしていませんよ」","en":"“I haven’t done anything that deserves your gratitude.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r614","rowIndex":614,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕の言葉は、彼の耳にはうまく届かないようだった。","en":"My words did not seem to reach his ears.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r615","rowIndex":615,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「お前と<tips=44>筱喬</tips>には、本当に、頭が上がらない。……母さんのことを、お前たちに任せきりにしてしまって……」","en":"“I owe you and <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> more than I can say. ...I left your mother entirely in the hands of the two of you...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r616","rowIndex":616,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「感謝されるようなことじゃありません」","en":"“You don’t need to thank us for that.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r617","rowIndex":617,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「思えばおれは、逃げていたのかもしれないな……。変わり果ててしまった母さんと向かい合うことが出来なかった。すべて、お前たちに押しつけて……」","en":"“Looking back, perhaps I was running away... I couldn’t face your mother after she had changed beyond recognition. I left the two of you to bear all of it...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r618","rowIndex":618,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そんなことを、いまここで言われるとは思わなかった。","en":"I had never expected him to say such a thing here and now.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r619","rowIndex":619,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕は言葉に詰まってしまう。","en":"The words caught in my throat.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r620","rowIndex":620,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「すまない。そして、ありがとう……」","en":"“I’m sorry. And thank you...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r621","rowIndex":621,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その言葉を聞いたとき、僕は目の前がぼやけた。","en":"When I heard those words, everything before me blurred.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r622","rowIndex":622,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　なんでこんなにぼやけるんだろう？","en":"Why was my vision blurring so badly?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r623","rowIndex":623,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ああ、僕は涙ぐんでいるんだと、気がつくまで少し時間がかかった。気がついたら恥ずかしくてしかたなかった。","en":"It took me a moment to realize that tears had filled my eyes. When I did, I was unbearably ashamed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r624","rowIndex":624,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「もう時間だ。そろそろ、お別れの時間だ……」","en":"“It’s time. Almost time for us to say goodbye...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r625","rowIndex":625,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　いまここで席を離れれば、もう意識のある彼と、二度と話すことはないかもしれない。何か伝えなければいけないことがあったはずだ。言いたいことがあったはずだ。しかも、両手で抱えきれないほどたくさん。","en":"If I left his side now, I might never speak to him while he was conscious again. There had to be something I needed to tell him. Something I wanted to say. So many things—more than I could hold in both arms.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r626","rowIndex":626,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それはわかっていたのだけれど、僕はもう、これ以上ここにいることが出来なかった。","en":"I understood that, but I could no longer remain here.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r627","rowIndex":627,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「じゃあ、さようなら、父さん」","en":"“Then goodbye, Dad.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r628","rowIndex":628,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕が泣きじゃくる子供みたいに顔を拭いながらそう言うと、","en":"I spoke while wiping my face like a sobbing child.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r629","rowIndex":629,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あとを頼む。これからはお前の時代だ」","en":"“I’m counting on you to handle the rest. This is your time now.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r630","rowIndex":630,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ありがたいことに、弱った父はそんな僕の様子に気がつかなかったようで、目を閉じたままそう言った。","en":"Thankfully, Father was so weak that he did not seem to notice the state I was in. He spoke with his eyes still closed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r631","rowIndex":631,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その後<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>は、長年一心同体で仕事をしてきた二人の義兄弟に最期の別れを告げた。","en":"Afterward, <tips=3>Chris Tse</tips> said his final farewells to the two sworn brothers who had worked at his side as one for so many years.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r632","rowIndex":632,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それが終わるとすぐに意識を失い、そして夜明け頃、僕らの見守る前でしずかに息を引き取った。","en":"As soon as that ended, he lost consciousness. Around dawn, with all of us watching, he quietly breathed his last.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r633","rowIndex":633,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　関係者への通知が速やかに行われ、それから三日後に、父の埋葬が行われた。","en":"Everyone concerned was notified at once. Three days later, Father was buried.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r634","rowIndex":634,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=41>グランドタワー</tips>から母さんが眠る教会の墓地まで、棺を乗せたオープンカーを中心にした<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>組織員による葬儀の列が、<tips=57>滑走路通り</tips>など<tips=9>Y地区</tips>の主要道路を練り歩いて街中の人々に偉大なる<tips=81>龍頭</tips>の死を見せつけることになっている。","en":"From the <tips=41>Grand Tower</tips> to the church cemetery where Mother lay, a funeral procession of <tips=7>YS</tips> members would follow an open car bearing the coffin through the main roads of <tips=9>Y District</tips>, including <tips=57>Runway Street</tips>, making a spectacle of the great <tips=81>Longtou’s</tips> death before the entire city.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r635","rowIndex":635,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　先頭となる車に棺と共に同乗するのは、次の<tips=81>龍頭</tips>となる<tips=84>マイケル・ツェー</tips>の予定だったが、彼は頑なにそれを固辞し、結局僕がその最も目立つ場所に座ることとなった。","en":"<tips=84>Michael Tse</tips>, the next <tips=81>Longtou</tips>, was supposed to ride in the lead car beside the coffin, but he adamantly refused, so in the end I took that most conspicuous seat.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r636","rowIndex":636,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕は全く眠っておらず、頭痛がし、少し歩くとふらふらとした。","en":"I had not slept at all; my head ached, and even a short walk left me unsteady on my feet.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r637","rowIndex":637,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「やはり顔がいいってのは得だな。見栄えとしては先代をこえている。これで練り歩けば、街中の人々が未来の<tips=81>龍頭</tips>の姿に魅了されるだろう」","en":"“It really pays to have a handsome face. You cut a finer figure than your predecessor. If we parade you through the streets like this, everyone in the city will be captivated by the sight of its future <tips=81>Longtou</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r638","rowIndex":638,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　当日、喪服姿の僕を前に、<tips=4>馬明</tips>が顔を顰めたくなるようなことを言う。","en":"On the day of the funeral, <tips=4>Ma Ming</tips> said something that made me want to grimace as I stood before him in mourning clothes.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r639","rowIndex":639,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「これが初舞台みたいなものだから、しっかりするんだぞ。とにかく、この先<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>にどんなことが起きても、<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>の正統な後継者はお前だってことを、街の連中にしっかり記憶させるんだ」","en":"“Think of this as your debut, so pull yourself together. Whatever happens to <tips=7>YS</tips> from here on, make damn sure the people of this city remember that you are <tips=3>Chris Tse’s</tips> rightful successor.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r640","rowIndex":640,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「言われなくともわかっている」","en":"“You don’t have to tell me.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r641","rowIndex":641,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕はそう答えた。","en":"That was how I answered him.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r642","rowIndex":642,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　すると、彼は少し驚いた顔をする。","en":"At that, he looked a little surprised.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r643","rowIndex":643,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「もう迷わない。やるしかないんだろう？」","en":"“No more wavering. I’ve got no choice but to do it, right?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r644","rowIndex":644,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕が寝ないで考えた結論だった。","en":"That was the conclusion I had reached after thinking it through all night without sleeping.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r645","rowIndex":645,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　別に父の最後の言葉に心を動かされたわけではない。<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>が死を選び、後継者争いとなれば僕がいくら関わりたくないと言ったって、そうはいかないのだ。僕の身体には彼の血が流れており、そしてこの街には最後の家族となった妹がいる。僕の意志など関係なく、やらなきゃいけない。","en":"It wasn’t that Father’s final words had moved me. <tips=3>Chris Tse</tips> had chosen death, and if a succession struggle broke out, there would be no staying out of it, no matter how much I said I wanted nothing to do with it. His blood ran in my veins, and my sister—now the last family I had left—was here in this city. My own wishes were irrelevant. I had to do it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r646","rowIndex":646,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　これから始まるであろう<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>の混乱に、僕は<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>の後継者として立ち向かってゆく。","en":"As <tips=3>Chris Tse’s</tips> successor, I would face the turmoil that was sure to come within <tips=7>YS</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r647","rowIndex":647,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　今日でこれまでの僕の人生は終わり、ギャングとしての新しい人生が始まるのだ。","en":"Today, the life I had lived until now would end, and my new life as a gangster would begin.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r648","rowIndex":648,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　かつて僕があれほど嫌悪していたその世界の中央に、足を踏み入れてゆくのだ。","en":"I was about to set foot in the very heart of the world I had once despised so intensely.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r649","rowIndex":649,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ここまで、どうにかこの街から逃げようと、お金を貯めて学校に行き、そして大学生活を送ってきた全ての努力を思い返すと虚しくなった。","en":"It felt hollow to look back on everything I had done in my struggle to escape this city—saving money, making it through school, building a life at university.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r650","rowIndex":650,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　色んなことを研究したり、学んだりしたかったな。でも、もう自分にはそういう時間は戻ってこないのだろう。","en":"I had wanted to study things, to learn all sorts of things. But that kind of time would probably never be mine again.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r651","rowIndex":651,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=54>汐さん</tips>はどう思うだろうか？　絶対にギャングになんかならないと言ったのに、恥ずかしくて顔を合わせられない。","en":"What would <tips=54>Mr. Shio</tips> think? I had told him I would never become a gangster, and now I was too ashamed to face him.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r652","rowIndex":652,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして<tips=55>松子</tips>は——彼女はもう自分の人生を歩きはじめているから、きっとなんの問題もない。今の<tips=55>松子</tips>なら、僕がいなくても大丈夫。それだけが救いだ。","en":"And <tips=55>Matsuko</tips>—she had already begun living her own life, so I was sure she would be fine. The <tips=55>Matsuko</tips> she was now would be all right without me. That alone was a comfort.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r653","rowIndex":653,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　——ああ、散々偉そうなことを言っても、結局、僕は自分の人生さえ選ぶことが出来なかったのか。","en":"—Ah. After all that high-and-mighty talk, in the end I couldn’t even choose my own life?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r654","rowIndex":654,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　決めてしまえばもう後悔も迷いもない。ただ、虚しかった。","en":"Once I had made the decision, there were no more regrets or doubts. I only felt hollow.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r655","rowIndex":655,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=44>シウ</tips>は？」","en":"“Where is <tips=44>Siu</tips>?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r656","rowIndex":656,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ひどい取り乱しようで、泣きじゃくっていたから、そのままにしてきた。連れてきた方が良かったかね？」","en":"“She was in a terrible state, sobbing uncontrollably, so I left her where she was. Should I have brought her?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r657","rowIndex":657,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いや、泣かせてやってほしい。……もともと、あいつは参加しない方がいいと思っていたんだ」","en":"“No. Let her cry. ...I never thought she should participate in the first place.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r658","rowIndex":658,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　この葬送の列に参加すれば、街の人々は、<tips=44>筱喬</tips>の顔を<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>の娘の顔として記憶する。それは彼女の今後の人生を重苦しいものに変えてしまうだろう。","en":"If she joined this procession, the people of the city would remember <tips=44>Siu-kiu’s</tips> face as the face of <tips=3>Chris Tse’s</tips> daughter. That would weigh heavily on her for the rest of her life.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r659","rowIndex":659,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その日、朝はよく晴れていた。しかしさすがは雨の<tips=9>Y地区</tips>。<tips=57>滑走路通り</tips>にさしかかったあたりで小雨が降り始める。","en":"The morning had been clear. But this was rainy <tips=9>Y District</tips>, and as we approached <tips=57>Runway Street</tips>, a light drizzle began to fall.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r660","rowIndex":660,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　部下が傘を差しだしたが、僕はそれを受け取らず、濡れるがままに任せた。","en":"A subordinate offered me an umbrella. I refused it and allowed the rain to soak me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r661","rowIndex":661,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>の正規構成員が一斉に揃ったのはこれが初めてだった。列を作ると道を埋め尽くすほどで、それが<tips=57>滑走路通り</tips>を行く。沿道の店からは<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>にゆかりのある従業員たちが商売を中止して雨の中に立ってこの街で最も影響力があった男の葬列を見送った。観光客たちは戸惑い、行列とそれに敬意をあらわにする街の人々の両方に奇異の視線を向けた。また、怖い物知らずは手元の端末で撮影をしたりする。","en":"This was the first time all the regular members of <tips=7>YS</tips> had assembled in one place. Their ranks filled the road as the procession advanced down <tips=57>Runway Street</tips>. Employees of shops along the route with ties to <tips=7>YS</tips> suspended business and stood in the rain to see off the funeral procession of the city’s most influential man. Tourists stared in bewilderment at both the procession and the townspeople openly paying their respects. A few fearless onlookers even recorded it on their devices.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r662","rowIndex":662,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕は例の発作によってこのパレードの最中に不意の睡魔に意識を奪われてしまうことを恐れたが、幸いそれは訪れなかった。","en":"I was afraid that, in the middle of the parade, one of my familiar attacks would let a sudden drowsiness rob me of consciousness. Fortunately, it never came.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r663","rowIndex":663,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　行列の歩みはゆっくりとしており、教会へ辿り着く頃には僕は雨でずぶ濡れになっていた。","en":"The procession advanced slowly. By the time we reached the church, the rain had soaked me to the skin.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r664","rowIndex":664,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　母さんの墓の横に新しい穴が掘られ、そこにも水たまりが出来ている。","en":"A new hole had been dug beside Mother’s grave, and a pool of rainwater had formed inside it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r665","rowIndex":665,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　父さんの棺はそのなかに据えられ、近しいものがその蓋の上に一輪ずつ花を投げかけると、上から土が被せられた。","en":"Father’s coffin was lowered into it. Those closest to him each cast a single flower onto the lid, and then the earth was shoveled over it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r666","rowIndex":666,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　教会の墓地であったが、故人の遺志により、神父は立ち会わず、祈りの言葉も捧げられなかった。","en":"Although the burial took place in a church cemetery, in accordance with the deceased’s wishes, no priest attended and no prayers were offered.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r667","rowIndex":667,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　埋葬が終わったからと言って、その日の仕事が終わったわけではない。","en":"The burial may have been over, but the day’s work was not.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r668","rowIndex":668,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　すぐに<tips=41>グランドタワー</tips>にて、二代目の<tips=81>龍頭</tips>の就任の儀式が行われる。","en":"The installation ceremony for the second-generation <tips=81>Longtou</tips> would begin immediately at the <tips=41>Grand Tower</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r669","rowIndex":669,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その場には、<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>の主要幹部の他に、<tips=9>Y地区</tips>近隣の有力者たちが勢揃いしていた。市長や国会議員、取引のある銀行の頭取、企業の役員、そして警察署の幹部までも出席していたようだ。","en":"Besides the principal officers of <tips=7>YS</tips>, the leading figures of <tips=9>Y District</tips> and the surrounding area were all assembled there: the mayor, members of the Diet, presidents of banks with which YS did business, corporate executives, and apparently even senior police officials.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r670","rowIndex":670,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　儀式そのものは、<tips=81>龍頭</tips>の証である銀の杯で酒を飲み干すといったごくシンプルなものだ。<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>がかつて『<tips=69>義勝</tips>』と呼ばれる香港の秘密結社だったころはもっと煩雑な手順があったそうだが、<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>になって様々な儀礼が排除されたのと同様、就任の儀式もこうした形となった。","en":"The ceremony itself was perfectly simple: the new <tips=81>Longtou</tips> drained a measure of liquor from the silver cup that symbolized the office. Back when <tips=7>YS</tips> was a Hong Kong secret society called <tips=69>Yisheng</tips>, the procedure was reportedly more elaborate. But just as various other rites had been abolished when it became <tips=7>YS</tips>, the installation ceremony had taken its present form.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r671","rowIndex":671,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=84>マイケル・ツェー</tips>がこの儀式に従って酒を飲むと、あとは出席者にも酒と料理が振る舞われ、就任の儀式はそのまま就任の宴となった。","en":"Once <tips=84>Michael Tse</tips> had drunk from the cup as the rite required, food and liquor were served to the guests, and the installation rite passed seamlessly into an installation banquet.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r672","rowIndex":672,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>のイベントをいつも盛りあげてくれるジャズバンドの演奏があり、それから、<tips=9>Y地区</tips>出身であることを公表して正月のテレビ番組などにも顔を出している歌手のムニラも歌声を披露し、宴を盛りあげた。","en":"The jazz band that could always be counted on to enliven <tips=7>YS</tips> events performed, followed by Munira, a singer who openly acknowledged being from <tips=9>Y District</tips> and even appeared on New Year’s television specials. Her singing lent further excitement to the banquet.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r673","rowIndex":673,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　この日の主役は<tips=84>マイケル・ツェー</tips>ではあったが、生前の父のあの会合での発言はよく知られており、僕も膨大な出席者たちの対応に追われることとなる。","en":"Although <tips=84>Michael Tse</tips> was the central figure that day, what my father had said at his final meeting was widely known, and I too found myself besieged by an enormous number of guests demanding my attention.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r674","rowIndex":674,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　一通り主要人物と挨拶を交わしたところで、僕は疲労を感じて会場の外に出た。","en":"Once I had exchanged greetings with all the principal figures, fatigue drove me outside the hall.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r675","rowIndex":675,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　廊下の壁に背をもたれてぼんやりとしていると、今日もやはり酒を飲み過ぎて顔を真っ赤にしている<tips=4>馬明</tips>がやって来る。","en":"As I leaned against the corridor wall in a daze, <tips=4>Ma Ming</tips> came over, his face once again flushed scarlet from too much drink.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r676","rowIndex":676,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「おい<tips=2>阿亮</tips>。ムニラからサインを貰ってきたぞ」","en":"“Hey, <tips=2>Ah Leung</tips>! I got Munira’s autograph.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬明","displayName":"Ma Ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r677","rowIndex":677,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼はウキウキして僕に色紙を見せる。","en":"Beaming with excitement, he showed me the autograph board.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r678","rowIndex":678,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼と<tips=81>龍頭</tips>は子供の頃からの義兄弟の筈だが、もう彼の顔に悲しみの雰囲気はない。多くの死にまみれて生きて来た彼には死の感傷に浸るという習慣はないのだろう。","en":"He and the <tips=81>Longtou</tips> had, as I understood it, been sworn brothers since childhood, yet there was no longer any trace of grief on his face. Having lived his life steeped in death, perhaps he simply had no habit of surrendering himself to its sentiment.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r679","rowIndex":679,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「おれの分と、<tips=24>美美</tips>の分と２枚あるんだ。いやあ、親子揃ってファンだったんだよ。いつかこうやって顔を合わせる機会があるんじゃないかと思って、狙ってたんだ」","en":"“I got two—one for me and one for <tips=24>Meimei</tips>. We’ve both been fans for years. I figured an occasion like this might give me the chance to meet her someday, so I’ve been biding my time.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬明","displayName":"Ma Ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r680","rowIndex":680,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それはよかったね」","en":"“I’m glad it worked out.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r681","rowIndex":681,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=2>阿亮</tips>も貰ったらどうだ？　いや、お前なら、連絡先だって聞けるかもしれない。おれも、あと２０年若ければチャレンジするんだがなあ。ほら、行ってこいよ」","en":"“Why don’t you get one too, <tips=2>Ah Leung</tips>? Hell, you might even get her contact information. If I were twenty years younger, I’d try my luck myself. Go on—get over there.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r682","rowIndex":682,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕は言葉では答えず、ただ肩をすくめてみせた。","en":"I did not answer in words. I only shrugged.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r683","rowIndex":683,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なんだその覇気のない顔は！　既に疲れてるようじゃだめだな！　お前の父親だったら、こんな場面でだって、喜んで口説きに行っていたところだぞ。寿命で死んだんだぞ！　こんなにめでたいことがあるか？」","en":"“What’s with that dispirited face? You can’t be worn out before you’ve even begun! If it were your father, he’d happily go hit on her even at a time like this. He lived out his natural span! What could be more worth celebrating than that?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬明","displayName":"Ma Ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r684","rowIndex":684,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=4>馬明</tips>は満面の笑顔で僕の肩を叩く。","en":"Beaming from ear to ear, <tips=4>Ma Ming</tips> clapped me on the shoulder.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r685","rowIndex":685,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　酔って力の加減が出来なくなっているのか、やたらと痛い。","en":"Maybe the alcohol had robbed him of any sense of his own strength; it hurt far more than it should have.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r686","rowIndex":686,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なあ、これからだ！　これからなんだよ。お前が兄貴の仕事を完成させなきゃいけない！　そうでなきゃ、このあまりにも早い死が……」","en":"“Listen, this is where it starts! It all starts now. You’ve got to finish our brother’s work! Otherwise, this death that came far too soon...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬明","displayName":"Ma Ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r687","rowIndex":687,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その目に光るものが浮かぶと、彼はさっと腕で拭い、","en":"Something shone in his eyes. He swiftly wiped them with his arm.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r688","rowIndex":688,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「お前が父親をこえるんだ！　わかったな<tips=1>謝亮</tips>！」","en":"“You have to surpass your father! Do you understand me, <tips=1>Tse Leung</tips>?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬明","displayName":"Ma Ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r689","rowIndex":689,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　うわずった声で言うと、くるりと背を向けてまた会場に戻っていった。","en":"His voice strained high, he turned sharply away and went back into the hall.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A3:r690","rowIndex":690,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕は思いがけぬ彼の感情の発露に、その場に動けないでいた。","en":"Caught off guard by his unexpected outpouring of emotion, I stood rooted to the spot.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}}]},{"position":9,"code":"C1","unitId":"C1","rows":[{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r1","rowIndex":1,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　前日に買った弁当があったので、外食をせず、まっすぐ帰宅してすぐに冷蔵庫を開けた。","en":"I had bought a boxed meal the day before, so instead of eating out, I went straight home and opened the refrigerator as soon as I arrived.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r2","rowIndex":2,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　庫内はちっとも冷えていない。これはどういうことかと電源コードを確認しても異常はなく、コンセント自体が電源を供給していないようだった。","en":"The interior was not cold in the least. I checked the power cord for an explanation and found nothing wrong; the outlet itself appeared to be dead.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r3","rowIndex":3,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　管理会社に電話をすると、工事の業者を手配するというので都合の良い時間を伝えた。最近上の階の部屋でも、壁の内側でネズミがコードを囓って断線するという障害が発生したばかりだと担当者は言った。","en":"I called the management company. They said they would arrange a contractor, so I gave them a convenient time. The representative said that a similar failure had just occurred in an apartment upstairs, where mice had gnawed through a cable inside the wall.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r4","rowIndex":4,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　このビルのトラブルは多い。四台あるエレベーターのうち一つは故障中のまま稼働しているのを見たことがなく、廊下の電球は常にどこかしら切れているか、点滅をしている。<tips=9>Y地区</tips>では高級の部類にカテゴライズされるマンションで、高い管理費を支払わされているのを考えると、見合わないように思われた。","en":"This building had no end of problems. One of its four elevators had been out of order for as long as I had known the place, and somewhere in the corridors there was always a dead or flickering bulb. Considering that it was classed as a luxury apartment building by <tips=9>Y District</tips> standards and charged correspondingly high management fees, the service hardly seemed commensurate.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r5","rowIndex":5,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　これが<tips=9>Y地区</tips>流というものなのだろう。","en":"Perhaps this was simply the <tips=9>Y District</tips> way.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r6","rowIndex":6,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は冷蔵庫に物を溜め込まないので、幸い被害はそう甚だしいものではない。弁当一つと牛乳一本、それと、迷ったが開封済みのミネラルウォーターを一本捨てた。","en":"I never let much accumulate in the refrigerator, so fortunately, the damage was not severe. I threw away one boxed meal, a bottle of milk, and—after some hesitation—an opened bottle of mineral water.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r7","rowIndex":7,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　これで予定していた夕食がなくなってしまった。","en":"That left me without the dinner I had planned.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r8","rowIndex":8,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　仕方なく棚の奥から朝食用のシリアルを取り出しティーバッグで紅茶を淹れて、それをたっぷりとかけた。シリアルは粥のようにドロドロになってしまい、勤め先の嚥下や咀嚼に問題のある患者に与えている朝食を思い出した。私は容器の端に唇を付けて啜るようにしてそれを摂取した。食味は悪い。","en":"With no alternative, I retrieved breakfast cereal from the back of a cupboard, brewed tea with a tea bag, and poured a generous quantity over it. The cereal dissolved into a porridge-like sludge, reminding me of the breakfasts served at my workplace to patients with difficulties swallowing or chewing. I placed my lips against the rim of the container and consumed it by sucking. It tasted bad.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r9","rowIndex":9,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　出かける段になって、目が酷く痛んだので洗面所にてサングラスを外す。","en":"When it was time to leave, my eye began to hurt badly, so I removed my sunglasses in the washroom.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r10","rowIndex":10,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私の左目。<tips=77>特質変異</tips>によって、一つの眼球に二つの瞳が存在している。このせいで、こちらの目ではまともに物を見ることが出来ず、遠近感を測ることが不得意だ。しかし、そのかわりにこの目は、通常人には見えない物を見ることが出来た。","en":"My left eye. Through a <tips=77>trait mutation</tips>, two pupils existed within a single eyeball. The eye could not see objects properly, leaving me poor at judging distance. In exchange, however, it could see things invisible to ordinary people.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r11","rowIndex":11,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　いまこの私の特別な目は、強膜の部分が真っ赤に充血している。鼻の先が鏡に触れるほど近づくと、小さな羽虫が瞳と瞳の間の部分に張り付き、もがいているのが見えた。私はそれを指先でつまみとってから、眼球を洗眼液でよく洗った。","en":"At present, the sclera of this special eye was severely bloodshot. When I brought my face close enough for the tip of my nose to touch the mirror, I saw a tiny winged insect clinging between the two pupils and struggling. I plucked it away with my fingertips, then washed the eyeball thoroughly with eyewash.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r12","rowIndex":12,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　外に出ると雨は先ほどより強さを増している。やや風もあり、大きめの傘をさしても膝の辺りから下に雨がかかった。","en":"Outside, the rain had grown heavier. There was some wind as well, and even beneath a large umbrella, the rain struck me from the knees down.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r13","rowIndex":13,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　古傷によって膝の動きが悪い私はどこへ行くにも杖が必要で、傘を持たなければならない雨の日は傘と杖で両手がふさがって何かと不便だ。荷物でつまった重いカバンを肩にかけると、どうも重心が安定しない。","en":"An old injury had impaired the movement of my knee, making a cane necessary wherever I went. On rainy days, when I also had to carry an umbrella, both hands were occupied and everything became inconvenient. With a heavy bag crammed full of belongings hanging from my shoulder, I could not seem to keep my balance steady.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r14","rowIndex":14,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　この地域は<tips=9>Y地区</tips>のなかでは比較的静かな場所だ。街娼やポン引きもここには姿を現さない。道の向こうでは高級スーパーが２４時間営業しており、その隣にはドラッグストアもあるため、照明が煌々とアスファルトを照らしている。","en":"This neighborhood was comparatively quiet by the standards of <tips=9>Y District</tips>. Neither streetwalkers nor pimps appeared here. Across the road, an upscale supermarket stayed open twenty-four hours a day, with a drugstore beside it, their lights blazing across the asphalt.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r15","rowIndex":15,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　女性が一人で夜道を歩いたとしても、この周辺ならばそうそう犯罪に遭遇することもないだろう。最も、一番危険な地域であっても、女性一人で歩いていたからといって必ず犯罪被害者になるというわけでもない。","en":"Even a woman walking alone at night would be unlikely to meet with crime in this vicinity. That said, walking alone did not invariably make a woman a victim even in the most dangerous parts of the district.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r16","rowIndex":16,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　現に、地元の若者はさほど警戒感なく夜でも平気でうろついている。","en":"In fact, local young people wandered around at night with very little apparent caution.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r17","rowIndex":17,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　もっとも、彼らは裏通りの歩き方を知っているからあのように歩いているわけで、何が危険なのか見分けがつかないような部外者はその限りではない。犯罪被害者の多くは、そうと知らずに自分から犯罪の原因となるものに近づいてしまうものだ。","en":"Of course, they could walk that way because they knew how to conduct themselves in the back streets. The same did not hold for outsiders unable to recognize danger. Many victims of crime unwittingly stray toward the very source of it themselves.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r18","rowIndex":18,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=9>Y地区</tips>の裏通りが評判ほど危険でないから女が一人で歩けるのだ、という表現よりも、歩き方さえ学んでしまえばどのような場所でも平気な顔で歩いて行ける、というのが正しい。","en":"It would be wrong to say that a woman could walk the back streets of <tips=9>Y District</tips> alone because they were not as dangerous as their reputation. The truth was that once one learned how to walk such streets, one could pass through any place without appearing the least concerned.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r19","rowIndex":19,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私がこれから向かおうとしているのは、<tips=58>パラシュート通り</tips>から北に入ったところにある、細かい路地が入り組んだ地域であった。","en":"My destination lay north of <tips=58>Parachute Street</tips> in an area woven from a maze of narrow alleys.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r20","rowIndex":20,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その地域は貧民がすむスラムというほどでもなかったが、簡易宿泊所などが点在しているため、バックパッカーのような旅行者が多い。こうした旅行者はよく盗難や詐欺、時によっては殺人のターゲットになりやすいが、住民にとっては特別危険な地域というわけでもない。安全な地域というわけでもないが。","en":"The neighborhood was not quite a slum inhabited by the destitute, but cheap lodging houses stood here and there, attracting many backpackers and similar travelers. Such visitors often became targets for theft and fraud, and sometimes murder. For residents, however, the area was not especially dangerous. Nor was it safe.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r21","rowIndex":21,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　宿泊所の他には、異国から来た住民たちが自分の手で建てたような、とても日本のものとは思えない、レンガや木材を建築用接着剤で組み合わせて作った集合住宅がいくつもあって、様々な髪や肌の色を持つ人々が住み、様々な言語が飛び交っている。","en":"Besides the lodging houses stood a number of apartment buildings that seemed to have been raised by foreign-born residents with their own hands—structures one could scarcely imagine being Japanese, pieced together from brick and timber with construction adhesive. People of every color of hair and skin lived in them, and languages of every kind flew back and forth.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r22","rowIndex":22,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そうした様々な背景を持つ家庭の子供たちが、夕方になると路上で集まってサッカーなどに興じている。肌の色も言語も違う子供たちが、一つのボールを追いかけている光景は平和な気持ちにさせる。","en":"Toward evening, children from families of all those different backgrounds gathered in the street to play soccer and other games. The sight of children divided by skin color and language all chasing the same ball left me feeling peaceful.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r23","rowIndex":23,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　目的地へ向かうのにもっとも近いルートを選択すると、<tips=59>暗闇通り</tips>と十番道路を通過することになる。","en":"I chose the shortest route to my destination, which would take me through <tips=59>Darkness Street</tips> and Tenth Road.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r24","rowIndex":24,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=59>暗闇通り</tips>は街灯ごとに娼婦が立ち、一般住宅を流用した娼館が建ち並ぶ風俗街で、十番道路には秘密クラブや地下カジノが軒を連ねている。<tips=57>滑走路通り</tips>を<tips=9>Y地区</tips>の表の顔だとすれば、これらの通りはいわば裏の顔であった。","en":"A prostitute stood beneath every streetlight on <tips=59>Darkness Street</tips>, a vice district lined with ordinary homes converted into brothels, while secret clubs and underground casinos crowded Tenth Road. If <tips=57>Runway Street</tips> was the public face of <tips=9>Y District</tips>, these streets were the face it kept hidden.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r25","rowIndex":25,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その十番道路に足を踏み入れたところで、<tips=50>路地邦昭</tips>に声をかけられた。","en":"I had just set foot on Tenth Road when <tips=50>Kuniaki Roji</tips> called to me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r26","rowIndex":26,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「やあ先生」","en":"“Hey, Doc.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"路地邦昭","displayName":"Kuniaki Roji","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r27","rowIndex":27,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=50>路地</tips>は１９０センチに近い高い身長と、それを支える頑強な骨格、さらに多量の筋肉が隆々として、くたびれたスーツとよれよれのシャツを内側から押し上げている。","en":"<tips=50>Roji</tips> stood nearly one hundred ninety centimeters tall. A powerful frame supported his height, and great masses of muscle strained against his worn suit and rumpled shirt from within.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r28","rowIndex":28,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　無精髭だらけの口元に、なれなれしい笑みを浮かべていた。額の中央にはこぶとも角ともつかぬ尖った隆起物がある。それは<tips=16>タイプA</tips>であることを示す<tips=77>特質変異</tips>だが、彼はそれを隠そうともしない。","en":"He wore an overfamiliar smile on his stubble-covered mouth. At the center of his forehead rose a pointed protrusion, neither quite a lump nor a horn. It was a <tips=77>trait mutation</tips> identifying him as <tips=16>Type A</tips>, and he made no effort to conceal it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r29","rowIndex":29,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　熊のような体躯に、この角がある姿を見ると、私はいつも昔話に出て来る鬼を思い出す。","en":"The sight of that horn on his bear-like frame always reminded me of an ogre from an old folktale.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r30","rowIndex":30,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼は傘もささず、ずぶ濡れでそこに立っていた。","en":"He stood there without an umbrella, soaked through by the rain.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r31","rowIndex":31,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「久しぶりじゃないですか。元気ですか？」","en":"“It’s been a while, hasn’t it? How have you been?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"路地邦昭","displayName":"Kuniaki Roji","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r32","rowIndex":32,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私よりいくつか年下のその男に対し、私の方は特に用件を持たなかった。","en":"The man was several years younger than I was. For my part, I had nothing in particular to say to him.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r33","rowIndex":33,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そのまま通り過ぎようとすると、","en":"I tried to walk straight past him.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r34","rowIndex":34,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=5>太刀川</tips>先生！」","en":"“Dr. <tips=5>Tachikawa</tips>!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"路地邦昭","displayName":"Kuniaki Roji","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r35","rowIndex":35,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=50>路地</tips>はもう一度呼び止め、","en":"<tips=50>Roji</tips> called after me again.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r36","rowIndex":36,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「つれないじゃないですか。それなりに長いつき合いでしょうよ」","en":"“Don’t be like that. We’ve known each other a long time, haven’t we?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"路地邦昭","displayName":"Kuniaki Roji","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r37","rowIndex":37,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼は昔からしつこい男だった。以前は探偵業という人が秘す事情を調査する職業についていたためにその必要性があったが、辞めて暫く経っているはずだ。態度に代わり映えしないところをみると、探偵を辞めた後も似たような職についているのかもしれない。","en":"He had always been a persistent man. That persistence had been necessary when he worked as a private detective, a profession devoted to investigating matters people wished to keep hidden, but he had left that work some time ago, as I recalled. Since his manner had not changed in the least, perhaps he had found a similar line of work after giving up detective work.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r38","rowIndex":38,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「私は診察があるんですよ」","en":"“I have patients to see.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r39","rowIndex":39,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「こんな雨の日でも、貧乏人のところを回ってるんですか？　頭が下がる。……おっと、おれの目を見ないでくださいよ。心を覗かれちゃたまらない」","en":"“You still make the rounds among the poor even in rain like this? My hat’s off to you. ...Whoa, don’t look me in the eye. I don’t want you poking around in my mind.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"路地邦昭","displayName":"Kuniaki Roji","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r40","rowIndex":40,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=50>路地</tips>は分厚い手のひらで自分の目を隠してそう言った。","en":"<tips=50>Roji</tips> covered his eyes with one thick palm as he spoke.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r41","rowIndex":41,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いちいちそんなことはしません。大体、あなたの心を覗いて私に何の得があるって言うんです？　<tips=16>タイプＡ</tips>がみだりに能力を使うのは違法行為だ。特に我々のような強い力を与えられた者は他の軽微な能力者よりも振る舞いに気をつけなくてはいけない。あなたは誰よりもそれをよくご存じのはずだ」","en":"“I don’t go around doing that. What could I possibly gain by looking into your mind? It is illegal for a <tips=16>Type A</tips> to use their ability indiscriminately. Those of us with particularly powerful abilities must be even more careful in our conduct than people with minor ones. You ought to know that better than anyone.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r42","rowIndex":42,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「相変わらず先生は真面目な方だ。しかし、誰よりもよくご存じでってのは一本とられましたな。確かにおれは能力を濫用したらえらいことになるということについては、人よりもよく知っている」","en":"“As serious as ever, Doctor. But you got me there with ‘better than anyone.’ It’s true: I know better than most what a mess you can make by abusing an ability.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"路地邦昭","displayName":"Kuniaki Roji","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r43","rowIndex":43,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=50>路地</tips>は手のひらをどけた。","en":"<tips=50>Roji</tips> removed his hand.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r44","rowIndex":44,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「しかし、病院のおつとめもあるのに、プライベートでまで<tips=78>金目</tips>の連中を診てやるとは、ご苦労なことです。でも、ほどほどにした方がいいですよ。先生の活発な慈善活動を『<tips=22>老人たち</tips>』はあまりよく思ってないって噂です」","en":"“Still, you have your duties at the hospital, yet you spend even your private hours treating the <tips=78>gold-eyes</tips>. Such devotion. But I’d be careful not to overdo it. I hear the ‘<tips=22>Elders</tips>’ don’t think much of your energetic charitable work.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"路地邦昭","displayName":"Kuniaki Roji","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r45","rowIndex":45,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……彼らに対して何かをした覚えはありませんが？」","en":"“...I don’t recall having done anything to them.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r46","rowIndex":46,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いやいや」","en":"“No, no.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"路地邦昭","displayName":"Kuniaki Roji","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r47","rowIndex":47,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=50>路地</tips>は再び手で目を隠し、","en":"<tips=50>Roji</tips> covered his eyes again.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r48","rowIndex":48,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あなたの慈善行為が、気に障るんです。……もちろん先生は純粋に善意から診察をしているのは私はよく知っています。しかし、世の中には善意による行動というものが存在することを信じず、利害関係でしか物事を解釈出来ない無粋な連中は多いですからね。『<tips=22>老人たち</tips>』も、わざわざそんな面倒なことをする先生には下心があると考えているようですよ。身よりがない<tips=17>タイプB</tips>の子供や大人を手なずけて、何か企んでいるのだろうってね」","en":"“It’s your charity that bothers them. ...Of course, I know perfectly well that you treat these people out of pure goodwill. But there are plenty of boors in the world who refuse to believe that anyone ever acts from goodwill, and who can understand things only in terms of self-interest. The ‘<tips=22>Elders</tips>’ apparently think that anyone who goes to such trouble must have an ulterior motive. They say you’re taming <tips=17>Type B</tips> children and adults with no family to call their own as part of some scheme.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"路地邦昭","displayName":"Kuniaki Roji","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r49","rowIndex":49,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あきれたものです」","en":"“Unbelievable.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r50","rowIndex":50,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は溜息をついた。","en":"I sighed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r51","rowIndex":51,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうでしょう。先生のような奇特な聖人にとっては、ああいった俗物どもの考えは理解出来ますまい。でも、もっと行動には注意した方がいい。世の中というものは、そうした俗物どもの感情で動いているものですし、あなたの正体は、知っている人ならば知っています。ごく限られた人間ですがね。警戒されても仕方がないでしょう？」","en":"“Exactly. A rare saint like you could never understand how such philistines think. Still, you ought to be more careful about what you do. The world runs on the feelings of men like them, and there are people who know what you really are—very few, granted. You can hardly blame them for being wary, can you?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"路地邦昭","displayName":"Kuniaki Roji","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r52","rowIndex":52,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いや、あきれたというのは、そんなくだらない話を、この雨の中でながながと私に聞かせたあなたについてです」","en":"“No. What I find unbelievable is you, making me stand here in the rain while you tell me such nonsense at such length.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r53","rowIndex":53,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「これは、もう一本取られましたな」","en":"“You got me again.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"路地邦昭","displayName":"Kuniaki Roji","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r54","rowIndex":54,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=50>路地</tips>は声を立てて笑う。","en":"<tips=50>Roji</tips> laughed aloud.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r55","rowIndex":55,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「くだらないかもしれないですが、私にとっては重要でね。時は流れても変わらないものはあるんですよ。先生にとっては忘れかけた過去の話でも、街はしっかりと覚えています。……そういえば、<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>が死の床に伏しているという話を知っていますか？　……おや、その様子だとご存じがないようだ。まあ、表の生活に戻られた先生には裏社会の噂など耳に入ることはないのでしょうね。しかし、一度くらい連絡をとってみたらいかがですかねえ？　彼も、最後にもう一度先生と会いたいと思っているでしょう。なんでも、死を目前にして既に意識も定かではないという話です」","en":"“It may be nonsense, but it matters to me. Time passes, yet some things do not change. It may be a piece of the past you’ve nearly forgotten, but the city remembers perfectly well. ...Speaking of which, have you heard that <tips=3>Chris Tse</tips> is on his deathbed? ...Ah, from the look of you, apparently not. I suppose underworld rumors no longer reach a man who’s returned to respectable life. Still, why not contact him at least once? He may want to see you one last time. I hear death is close and he’s barely lucid anymore.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"路地邦昭","displayName":"Kuniaki Roji","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r56","rowIndex":56,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それこそ、私には関係のない話です」","en":"“That really has nothing to do with me.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r57","rowIndex":57,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いや、余談が長くなって申し訳ありません。これは話の成り行きで語っただけで、声をかけた本当の用事はまったく別の件なんです」","en":"“Sorry for the long digression. I only mentioned it because our conversation happened to lead there. The real reason I stopped you is something else entirely.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"路地邦昭","displayName":"Kuniaki Roji","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r58","rowIndex":58,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まだ何か話すつもりですか？　どうしてあなたはそんな大きな身体をしているのに、そんなにおしゃべりなのでしょう」","en":"“Are you going to keep talking? How can such a large man be such a chatterbox?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r59","rowIndex":59,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「へえ、身体が大きいと、口数が少なくなるというような医学的根拠があるんですか？」","en":"“Oh? Is there medical evidence that having a large body makes a person less talkative?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"路地邦昭","displayName":"Kuniaki Roji","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r60","rowIndex":60,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「とてもつき合いきれませんね」","en":"“I really can’t keep indulging you.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r61","rowIndex":61,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして私はもう一度立ち去ろうとしたのだが、","en":"I attempted once more to leave.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r62","rowIndex":62,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「次に殺されるのは、あなたの患者かもしれませんよ！」","en":"“Your patient may be the next one murdered!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"路地邦昭","displayName":"Kuniaki Roji","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r63","rowIndex":63,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=50>路地</tips>は容易ならざることを口にし、私の足を止めた。","en":"<tips=50>Roji</tips> uttered the grave claim and stopped me in my tracks.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r64","rowIndex":64,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「先生、最近<tips=59>暗闇通り</tips>から<tips=58>パラシュート通り</tips>に行く辺りで、連続殺人事件が起こっているのをご存じですか？」","en":"“Doctor, do you know about the recent series of murders in the area between <tips=59>Darkness Street</tips> and <tips=58>Parachute Street</tips>?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"路地邦昭","displayName":"Kuniaki Roji","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r65","rowIndex":65,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=50>路地</tips>は目を隠す手の人差し指と中指をチラと開いて、その隙間から私の表情をうかがうとすぐに閉じ、そして口元にまた笑顔を浮かべた。","en":"<tips=50>Roji</tips> briefly parted the index and middle fingers of the hand covering his eyes, peered through the gap to read my expression, then closed it at once and smiled again.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r66","rowIndex":66,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「若い女がバラバラ死体にされるってやつですよ。観光客だったり、地元の若い子だったりね。あのあたりは先生が診てる患者もたくさん住んでるんじゃないですか？」","en":"“Young women are turning up in pieces. Some tourists, some local girls. Plenty of your patients live around there, don’t they?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"路地邦昭","displayName":"Kuniaki Roji","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r67","rowIndex":67,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　傘の端からぽたぽたとしたたり落ちる雨だれが、いつの間にか私の肩を濡らしていた。","en":"Rain dripping from the edge of my umbrella had begun to wet my shoulder without my noticing.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r68","rowIndex":68,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は傘の位置を直した。","en":"I adjusted the umbrella’s position.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r69","rowIndex":69,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どういうわけか、私はその事件を調べるってことになってしまいましてね。途方に暮れていたんですが、先生が力を貸してくれれば百人力だ。ギャラは出ると思いますよ。引き受けていただけなければ明かすことは出来ないのですが、スポンサーはしっかりしたところなので安心してください。街の人々の命を守るために、是非とも、おれと一緒に……」","en":"“Somehow or other, I’ve ended up investigating those crimes. I was at a loss, but with your help I’d have the strength of a hundred men. I expect there’ll be a fee. I can’t tell you who the sponsor is unless you accept, but they’re perfectly reputable, so don’t worry. To protect the lives of the people of this city, I implore you to join me and—”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"路地邦昭","displayName":"Kuniaki Roji","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r70","rowIndex":70,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は路地をその場に置いたまま、そっと背を向けて立ち去った。目を隠している<tips=50>路地</tips>は背後でなおも喋り続けていたが、すぐに雨音にかき消されて聞こえなくなった。","en":"I quietly turned my back on <tips=50>Roji</tips> and left him where he stood. Still covering his eyes, he continued speaking behind me, but the rain soon drowned his words beyond hearing.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r71","rowIndex":71,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　完全に離れてから、私はそっと溜息をつく。","en":"Only once I was completely clear of him did I let out a quiet sigh.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r72","rowIndex":72,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　この左目は、視線をあわせた人間の心をそのまま私の心のなかに送り込んでくれる。私が望もうと、望むまいと、目を合わせただけで自動的に送り込まれる。そう、私は人の感情にじかに触れることが出来るのだ。","en":"Whenever my gaze meets another person’s, this left eye sends that person’s heart directly into my own. Whether I want it or not, the instant our eyes meet the transmission occurs automatically. Yes: I can come into direct contact with another person’s emotions.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r73","rowIndex":73,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　もうこの能力は、自分のためにしか使わない。私はそう決めている。","en":"I had decided that from now on, I would use this ability for no one but myself.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r74","rowIndex":74,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　今私は一人でも多くの患者を診て、その心を覗くことにしか興味がないし、他にはもうなにも——たとえそれがどのようなものであれ、私には関係がない。<tips=50>路地</tips>がおおげさに語った猟奇殺人など、殺人自体が無数に発生するこの街でことさらに何を恐れる必要があるのだろうか。","en":"All I cared about now was seeing as many patients as possible and looking into their hearts. Nothing else—whatever it might be—had anything to do with me anymore. Why should I feel any special fear over <tips=50>Roji’s</tips> lurid tale of bizarre murders in a city where murders themselves occurred beyond number?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r75","rowIndex":75,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しかし、『<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>』という名を出された瞬間には、少なからず動揺をしたことを認めなくてはいけない。","en":"Nevertheless, I must admit that the name ‘<tips=3>Chris Tse</tips>’ shook me more than a little the instant it was spoken.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r76","rowIndex":76,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　正直に告白しよう。私は、もう何年もの間意識的にその名を避けていた。","en":"I will confess it plainly: for years, I had consciously avoided that name.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r77","rowIndex":77,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　施設での診察は、２３時過ぎには終了した。","en":"My examinations at the facility ended after eleven that night.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r78","rowIndex":78,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　今日診たのは施設で暮らす五人の子供。それから、診察を聞きつけてやってきた一組の母子と、二人の女。そして一人息子が連れて来た、車椅子の老父であった。","en":"I saw five children who lived at the facility, then a mother and child who had heard that I was examining patients and come together, two women, and an elderly father in a wheelchair brought by his only son.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r79","rowIndex":79,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　このうち二人が初めて診る患者で、後は継続して診察を行っている患者だ。この施設はこの辺りでも大きなもので、多くの子供たちが住んでいる。このくらいの人数ならば極めて少ないといって差し支えないだろう。","en":"Two were new patients; I treated the rest regularly. This was a large facility by the standards of the neighborhood and housed many children. It would be fair to call so few patients an exceptionally light evening.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r80","rowIndex":80,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして、すべての診察を終えて、最後に診たのは、その施設で働く若い女だった。","en":"After every other examination was complete, my final patient was a young woman who worked at the facility.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r81","rowIndex":81,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「じゃあ、この一週間の間発作は起きていないということですね」","en":"“So you haven’t had another episode this past week?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r82","rowIndex":82,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「はい、でも、いつまた発作が起きるのではないかと不安で……。念のため、お薬を増やしていただくわけにはいかないのでしょうか？」","en":"“No, but I’m afraid another one could happen at any time... Could you increase my dosage, just as a precaution?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r83","rowIndex":83,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「薬というものは、やみくもに増やすものではないですよ。当然副作用も重くなりますし、そうなれば、いまのように仕事を続けてゆくのが難しくなるかもしれません」","en":"“Medication isn’t something to increase blindly. The side effects would naturally get worse, and then you might not be able to keep working as you do now.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r84","rowIndex":84,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それは困りますが、どうしてもこわくて……」","en":"“That would be a problem, but I’m just so frightened...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r85","rowIndex":85,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　職員は私の目をじっと見つめる。","en":"The staff member looked steadily into my eyes.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r86","rowIndex":86,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　確かに<tips=16>タイプA</tips>の能力をみだりに用いるのは違法だが、私の場合は医療目的で使用する限りは許可されている。そもそも私の能力は自分の意志と無関係に常時発動しているので、意図的に能力を限定するには、視線をあわせないように特別な努力を払うか、薬剤によって能力そのものを使えなくしてしまうしかないのだが。","en":"The indiscriminate use of a <tips=16>Type A</tips> ability was certainly illegal, but in my case it was permitted so long as I used it for medical purposes. Besides, my ability was active at all times, regardless of my will. To limit it deliberately, I had either to make a special effort not to meet anyone’s gaze or to take medication that disabled the ability itself.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r87","rowIndex":87,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そこで私は、目の力を使って彼女を『見た』。","en":"And so I used the eye’s power to ‘see’ her.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r88","rowIndex":88,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　この特別な目によって得られる情報は、あくまでも感情だ。思考を読み取ることまでは出来ない。","en":"What this special eye gave me was emotion, and emotion alone. It could not go so far as to read thoughts.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r89","rowIndex":89,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　怒り、焦燥、不安、そうした心の動きが、静かに私の脳に侵入して来る。","en":"Anger, agitation, anxiety—such stirrings of the heart quietly invaded my brain.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r90","rowIndex":90,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　体験をしたことがないものは、もっと気軽なものだと考えているのだろうが、全くの他人の感情が自分の心に入り込んで来るというのは容易ではない。それは、例えば麻酔なしで鼻から胃カメラを挿入するような、生理的な拒絶感と苦痛を伴うものだ。","en":"Those who had never experienced it probably imagined something far easier, but there was nothing easy about having a complete stranger’s emotions force their way into one’s heart. It brought a visceral revulsion and pain, like having a gastroscope pushed through the nose without anesthesia.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r91","rowIndex":91,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　他人の感情というものは、水銀に似ている。冷たく重く、キラキラと周囲の様々な風景を映すものが、ずるずると脳の中央部に注入されてゆく。","en":"Another person’s emotions were like mercury: cold and heavy, glittering as they reflected the surrounding world, while they were poured in a sluggish stream into the center of my brain.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r92","rowIndex":92,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そうして異物として侵入した他人の感情は、脳による分解を経て、自分の感情として再体験される。","en":"Once those emotions had entered as foreign matter, my brain broke them down and I experienced them anew as emotions of my own.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r93","rowIndex":93,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その段階まで来ても不快感は消えない。まったく自分の身に覚えのない借り物の感情が胸の中に巻き起こるのは、まるで白昼夢を見せられているかのような、吐き気を伴う浮遊感を味わうことになる。","en":"Even then, the discomfort did not disappear. When borrowed emotions wholly foreign to my own experience welled up inside my chest, they left me floating and nauseated, as though someone had forced a waking dream upon me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r94","rowIndex":94,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　これは、本来ならば『心を読む』というよりも、『感情が完全に同調する』能力と言うのが正しいのだろう。","en":"Strictly speaking, the ability was not so much ‘mind reading’ as ‘complete emotional synchronization.’","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r95","rowIndex":95,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私はぞわぞわとする職員の感情を体験しながら、その中を分析し、ただちに問題となるべきものがあるか探した。","en":"As the staff member’s emotions crawled through me, I analyzed them, searching for anything that demanded immediate attention.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r96","rowIndex":96,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　症状によるものか、将来に対する不安、焦燥は強い。心のなかにどこかイライラとしたものがあるのは、おそらくさきほど語っていた恋人の不理解に由来するものだろう。こうしたものは一般的な感情である。","en":"Whether because of her symptoms or not, her anxiety and agitation about the future were intense. The irritation somewhere inside her probably came from the lack of understanding shown by the lover she had mentioned earlier. These were all ordinary emotions.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r97","rowIndex":97,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=17>タイプＢ</tips>特有の、感情がぽっかりとした黒い闇に侵食されるような感覚は、僅かにはあるが、まだ少ない。","en":"There was a trace of the sensation peculiar to <tips=17>Type B</tips>, as though emotion itself were being eaten away by a gaping black void, but it remained slight.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r98","rowIndex":98,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　感情風景の端に、黒いものがチラチラと揺れているだけである。これが発作が起こると感情全体を飲み込み、そして<tips=17>タイプＢ</tips>特有の、なんとも言えない何もかもがピカピカと輝いたあの素晴らしい極彩色の感情に作り替えてしまうのだ。","en":"Only something black flickered at the edge of her emotional landscape. When an episode struck, it would swallow her emotions whole and remake them into that indescribable, magnificent riot of color peculiar to <tips=17>Type B</tips>, in which everything glittered and shone.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r99","rowIndex":99,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=17>タイプB</tips>は、発症初期こそ派手な行動を取るが、進行するにつれて反応が鈍くなり、意思の疎通も悪くなり、外から見ると無感情な石のような存在に思える。しかし、私の能力でさぐった限り、全くそうではない。彼らの内面は、楽園のようにまばゆく美しい光で彩られているのだ。","en":"In the early stages after onset, <tips=17>Type Bs</tips> behaved flamboyantly. As the condition progressed, their responses dulled and communication grew difficult, until to an outside observer they seemed as devoid of emotion as stones. But when I probed them with my ability, nothing could have been further from the truth. Within, they were suffused with light as dazzling and beautiful as paradise.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r100","rowIndex":100,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ただ、これが本当の相手の内面そのものなのかはわからない。","en":"I did not know, however, whether this was truly the other person’s inner self.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r101","rowIndex":101,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そもそも、私の能力自体が常に事実を伝えるという保証がない。<tips=16>タイプA</tips>の能力というものは、<tips=17>タイプB</tips>の症状以上に不安定で未知の要素が多いものだ。私が目を使って<tips=17>タイプB</tips>の心が豊かなものだと感じたのだとしても、それはただ単に、私の目が<tips=17>タイプB</tips>を見る時だけ狂ってしまっているという可能性もある。","en":"There was no guarantee that my ability itself always conveyed the truth. <tips=16>Type A</tips> abilities were even less stable than <tips=17>Type B</tips> symptoms and involved still more unknowns. Even if, when I used my eye, I perceived the mind of a <tips=17>Type B</tips> as rich, perhaps my eye simply went awry whenever it looked at a <tips=17>Type B</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r102","rowIndex":102,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しかし、いずれにしても、<tips=17>タイプB</tips>の心が私に特別な興味を抱かせるものであることは間違いがない。","en":"In any event, there was no question that the <tips=17>Type B</tips> mind held a special fascination for me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r103","rowIndex":103,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は一通り彼女の感情を精査した後に、感情の同調をやめた。その瞬間には同一化した彼女の感情がずるりとはぎ取られ、自分本来の感情に戻る、あの独特の感覚がある。","en":"After examining the full range of her emotions, I ended the synchronization. At that instant came the peculiar sensation of her emotions, now one with mine, peeling slickly away as I returned to my own.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r104","rowIndex":104,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それもけして心地の良いものではなく、自分の感情に戻ったときには、思わず溜息のようなものが出てしまう。","en":"That, too, was anything but pleasant, and when I returned to my own emotions, I could not help letting out something like a sigh.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r105","rowIndex":105,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　こうした感情の着脱時における不快感は、自分自身の感情をなるべく平坦なものにすることで、ある程度は軽減することが出来る。しかし軽減したからといってゼロになるわけではない。","en":"The discomfort of taking emotions on and casting them off could be mitigated to some extent by keeping my own feelings as flat as possible. But mitigating it did not make it disappear.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r106","rowIndex":106,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私が日頃から何も感じないようにして、自分の感情を抑えながら生活をするようになってから久しいが、それでも一定の不快感は残る。","en":"I had long since begun suppressing my feelings and living so as to experience nothing in my daily life. Even so, a certain discomfort remained.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r107","rowIndex":107,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「やはり、追加の薬は必要がないようです」","en":"“As I thought, there doesn’t appear to be any need for additional medication.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r108","rowIndex":108,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は静かに職員に告げた。","en":"I told the staff member quietly.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r109","rowIndex":109,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうですか」","en":"“I see.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r110","rowIndex":110,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　職員はまだ浮かない顔つきだが、それ以上食い下がることはなかった。","en":"Her face remained downcast, but she did not press the matter further.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r111","rowIndex":111,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そういえば、いつも居るあの若い女性は一度も診察に来たことがありませんが」","en":"“Now that I think of it, the young woman who is always here has never come for an examination.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r112","rowIndex":112,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「え、誰のことですか？」","en":"“What? Who do you mean?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r113","rowIndex":113,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ほら、いつも子供と一緒に歌をうたっている」","en":"“The one who is always singing with the children.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r114","rowIndex":114,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ああ、シオさんですか。彼女、<tips=17>タイプB</tips>じゃないですよ？」","en":"“Oh, Ms. Shio? She isn’t <tips=17>Type B</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r115","rowIndex":115,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　職員はそう言って笑った。","en":"The staff member smiled as she said it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r116","rowIndex":116,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しかし私の見たてでは、そのシオという女性は<tips=17>タイプB</tips>にしか見えない。","en":"To my eye, however, the woman named Shio could only be <tips=17>Type B</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r117","rowIndex":117,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　人見知りをするたちなのか、なかなか視線を合わせない。だから、一定時間視線をあわせる必要がある私の能力を使ったことはないが、医師としての一般的な観察からすると間違いなく<tips=17>タイプB</tips>の要件を満たしている。","en":"Perhaps she was shy around strangers, for she rarely met anyone’s eyes. I had therefore never used my ability on her, which required sustained eye contact. Yet by the standards of ordinary medical observation, she unquestionably satisfied the criteria for <tips=17>Type B</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r118","rowIndex":118,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　世間では<tips=17>タイプB</tips>の発作時の特徴は<tips=95>金眼</tips>だけだとされている。確かにそれが一番はっきりと状態を確認出来る材料ではあるが、専門家は別の部分から<tips=17>タイプB</tips>を見抜くことが出来る。","en":"The public believed that <tips=95>golden eyes</tips> were the only characteristic of a <tips=17>Type B</tips> episode. They were certainly the clearest evidence of the condition, but a specialist could recognize a <tips=17>Type B</tips> from signs elsewhere on the body.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r119","rowIndex":119,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　だから、<tips=17>タイプB</tips>患者がよくやるカラーコンタクトでの偽装だけでは、専門家を相手に正体を隠せるというようなものでもない。","en":"Colored contact lenses, a disguise often used by <tips=17>Type B</tips> patients, were not enough by themselves to hide what they were from a specialist.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r120","rowIndex":120,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その変化は体の様々な箇所に出て、一つ一つでは<tips=17>タイプB</tips>発作とは判別出来ないが、いくつかの要素を同時に満たすことで高い精度で断定することが出来る。頬の紅潮。リンパの独特の腫れ。口唇に違和感が出るため唇を引き締めたり舌で舐めたりして潤いを与えるような動作を繰り返す。——エトセトラエトセトラ。","en":"The changes appeared in various parts of the body. No single sign was enough to identify a <tips=17>Type B</tips> episode, but when several appeared together, a diagnosis could be made with great accuracy: flushed cheeks; a distinctive swelling of the lymph nodes; repeatedly pursing or licking the lips to moisten them in response to an unfamiliar sensation there; et cetera, et cetera.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r121","rowIndex":121,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　シオという職員は、私の見る限り、常にこうした発作時の特徴が顕れている。おそらく目に付けたカラーコンタクトを取れば、いつでも<tips=95>金眼</tips>が見られるだろう。","en":"As far as I could tell, the staff member named Shio exhibited these signs of an episode constantly. If she took out the colored contacts she wore, her <tips=95>golden eyes</tips> would probably be visible at any hour of the day.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r122","rowIndex":122,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　常に発作を起こし<tips=95>金眼</tips>の状態でありながら、安定した日常生活を送る<tips=17>タイプB</tips>患者というのは、かなり希だが例としてはいくつか存在する。","en":"<tips=17>Type B</tips> patients who remained in a permanent episode, with <tips=95>golden eyes</tips>, yet led stable daily lives were extremely rare, but several such cases did exist.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r123","rowIndex":123,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ただその場合でも、医師の診察を受けることが望ましいのは間違いがない。","en":"Even in such cases, however, there was no question that the patient ought to be examined by a doctor.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r124","rowIndex":124,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして私は安定型の発症患者を診る機会が乏しかったので興味があった。","en":"I was interested, because I had had few opportunities to examine patients with stable, persistent symptoms.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r125","rowIndex":125,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その患者の感情は、どのような風景を持っているのか。<tips=17>タイプB</tips>患者の持つ精神風景は、常に私の感情を魅了してやまないが、なぜ彼らの心がそんな風景を作り出すのか、あるいは、なぜ私にはそのような風景が見えてしまうのか、手がかりがそこにあるような気がする。","en":"What sort of landscape lay within that patient’s emotions? The inner landscapes of <tips=17>Type B</tips> patients never ceased to fascinate me. I had a feeling that here I might find some clue as to why their minds created such landscapes—or why I saw those landscapes in them at all.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r126","rowIndex":126,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しかし、同僚にも<tips=17>タイプB</tips>であることを隠しているようでは診察を無理強いすることは出来ない。","en":"But if she concealed her <tips=17>Type B</tips> status even from her coworkers, I could not force an examination upon her.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r127","rowIndex":127,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうですか。私の勘違いだったようです」","en":"“I see. It appears I was mistaken.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r128","rowIndex":128,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私はそれ以上の言及を諦めた。","en":"I let the subject drop.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r129","rowIndex":129,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　焦らなくとも、この生活を続けていれば、そのうち機会もあるだろう。","en":"There was no need to rush. If I continued living this way, an opportunity would arise sooner or later.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r130","rowIndex":130,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして職員の手を借りながら帰り支度をしていると、","en":"Then, as I prepared to leave with the staff member’s help, she spoke again.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r131","rowIndex":131,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そう言えば、ご存じですか」","en":"“By the way, have you heard?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r132","rowIndex":132,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　職員は手を動かしながら、ふと思い出したように口にする。","en":"She kept working as she spoke, as though the thought had only just occurred to her.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r133","rowIndex":133,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>のボスが、もうすぐ亡くなってしまうんですって」","en":"“They say the boss of <tips=7>YS</tips> doesn’t have long to live.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r134","rowIndex":134,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女が口にしたのは、ごく一般的な世間話として<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>の病状にふれる話題であった。","en":"She mentioned <tips=3>Chris Tse’s</tips> condition as a piece of perfectly ordinary gossip.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r135","rowIndex":135,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　内容自体は街の噂話の範疇を出ないものだが、先ほど<tips=50>路地</tips>からあんな話を聞かされたばかりであるから奇妙な符合を意識させられ、苦い気分だ。","en":"The story itself amounted to nothing more than common city gossip. But coming just after what <tips=50>Roji</tips> had told me, the strange coincidence forced itself upon my notice and left me bitter.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r136","rowIndex":136,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「体がボロボロになってしまう、とても苦しい病気にかかってしまったんだそうですよ。これまで悪いことを沢山してきた報いなのでしょうかねえ」","en":"“Apparently, he has some terrible, painful disease that leaves his whole body in ruins. Do you suppose it’s punishment for all the bad things he’s done?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r137","rowIndex":137,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>の話をする彼女は、彼と私との関係は知らない。知っていたらこのような話は出来ないだろう。<tips=50>路地</tips>は私の過去を知るものもいると言って脅したが、実際はそんなものは考慮にも値しないのだ。","en":"As she spoke of <tips=3>Chris Tse</tips>, she knew nothing of the connection between him and me. Had she known, she could hardly have spoken this way. <tips=50>Roji</tips> had tried to frighten me by saying that some people knew my past, but in truth the possibility was not even worth considering.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r138","rowIndex":138,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「その人が道徳的にふるまったかどうかが病に影響するというようなことはありません」","en":"“Whether a person has behaved morally has no bearing on illness.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r139","rowIndex":139,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私ははっきりとそう言った。","en":"I told her so flatly.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r140","rowIndex":140,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうでしょうか」","en":"“Do you think so?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r141","rowIndex":141,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　職員は思いの外にかたくなだった。","en":"The staff member was more obstinate than I had expected.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r142","rowIndex":142,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「確かに、悪人が健康に過ごして長生きをしたり、善人が早く死んでしまうことは世の中では珍しくはないですよね。でも、そういうのにも、きっとどこかに理由が隠されているのではないでしょうか？　私、すべての病は神様が与えるものだと思っているんです。そうでなければ、不治の病というものは、人間にとってあまりに救いがなさすぎるように思うのです」","en":"“It’s true that bad people sometimes live long, healthy lives, and good people die young. That’s hardly unusual. But don’t you think there must be some reason hidden in that, too? I believe every illness is something God gives us. Otherwise, incurable disease would be far too utterly without salvation for human beings.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r143","rowIndex":143,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そこではじめて私は、彼女は最初から事実を求めてこんな会話をしているのではないのだと気がついた。","en":"Only then did I realize that facts were not what she had wanted from this conversation in the first place.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r144","rowIndex":144,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なるほど、確かにそんな考え方も、あるのかもしれませんね」","en":"“I see. Yes, perhaps there is something to that way of thinking.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r145","rowIndex":145,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　このような心にもない言葉は、青年時代の私だったら、けして口にすることはなかったろう。","en":"When I was young, I would never have uttered words I did not mean.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r146","rowIndex":146,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その帰り道、私は不意の感傷に襲われた。","en":"On the way home, I was suddenly overcome by sentimentality.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r147","rowIndex":147,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　雨はいつしか止んでいた。うつむき、路上の水たまりの表面を傘でつつきながら無心で歩いている私の胸に、どうしようもない悲しみが押し寄せた。","en":"At some point, the rain had stopped. I walked on without thought, head bowed, prodding the surfaces of puddles with my umbrella, when an uncontrollable sorrow came surging over me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r148","rowIndex":148,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そこには胸をかきむしりたくなるような寂しさも含まれている。","en":"It contained a loneliness that made me want to claw at my own chest.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r149","rowIndex":149,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　これは一体どういう反応なのだろう？","en":"What in the world was this reaction?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r150","rowIndex":150,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　長年人の感情に同調し続けた報いで、自分の感情のメカニズムが狂ってしまったのかもしれない。","en":"Perhaps synchronizing with others for so many years had deranged the mechanisms of my own emotion.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r151","rowIndex":151,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　単に年を取っただけかもしれない。","en":"Perhaps I had simply grown old.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r152","rowIndex":152,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　患者の心に触れながら生きるいまの生活に、一点の不満があるわけでもないはずなのに。","en":"There should not have been a single thing to dissatisfy me in the life I now led, touching the hearts of my patients.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r153","rowIndex":153,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　何か薬を処方してもいいが、その前にするべきことがあるような気がした。","en":"I could prescribe myself something, but before I did, I felt there was something else I ought to do.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r154","rowIndex":154,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　翌日、気がつけば私は<tips=41>グランドタワー</tips>の前に立っていた。","en":"The next day, I found myself standing before the <tips=41>Grand Tower</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r155","rowIndex":155,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=9>Y地区</tips>に堂々とそびえ立つそのビルは、太陽の光を眩しく反射していた。そこは地域最大のマフィア組織<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>の本拠地であり、そのボスである<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>の暮らす場所でもある。","en":"The building towered proudly over <tips=9>Y District</tips>, dazzling in the reflected sunlight. It was the headquarters of <tips=7>YS</tips>, the largest Mafia organization in the area, and also the home of its boss, <tips=3>Chris Tse</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r156","rowIndex":156,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　勿論私もこのビルのことは知っていた。しかし、<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>の名を避けていたのと同様、街のどこからでも見えるこのビルからも目をそらしながら過ごして来た。","en":"Of course I had known about the building. But just as I had avoided the name <tips=3>Chris Tse</tips>, I had passed my days averting my eyes from this tower that could be seen from anywhere in the city.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r157","rowIndex":157,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　従って、こうしてビルの目の前まで来るのも初めてであった。","en":"Consequently, this was the first time I had stood directly before it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r158","rowIndex":158,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　高い壁がぐるりと周囲を取り囲み、数少ない門扉の周りには体格の良い男が警備をしている。私はその一人を捕まえて、声をかけた。","en":"A high wall enclosed the grounds, and powerfully built men guarded the few gates. I approached one and addressed him.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r159","rowIndex":159,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あなたたちのボスである<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>に会わせて欲しいのですが」","en":"“I would like to see your boss, <tips=3>Chris Tse</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r160","rowIndex":160,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　率直に用向きを告げたのだが、男は視線もあわせずに一方的に奇妙な用件を言う私を頭のおかしい人間だと思ったようで、まともには取り合ってくれなかった。","en":"I stated my business plainly, but the man apparently took me for a lunatic making a bizarre demand without so much as meeting his eyes, and refused to give me a serious hearing.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r161","rowIndex":161,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「こんなところで会いたいと言ったって、会えるようなものじゃない。うちのボスはそこらのちんぴらとは違うンだ。どうしてもって言うなら、正式にアポを取ってまともな時間に来てくれ」","en":"“You can’t just show up here, say you want to see him, and expect us to let you in. Our boss isn’t some two-bit punk. If you’re serious, make a proper appointment and come back at a decent hour.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r162","rowIndex":162,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　男は犬でも追い払うように手を振る。","en":"The man waved his hand as though driving away a dog.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r163","rowIndex":163,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「私は誰の連絡先も知らないのです」","en":"“I do not know how to contact anyone here.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r164","rowIndex":164,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうだろう！　じゃあ、あきらめるんだな」","en":"“Of course you don’t! Then give up.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r165","rowIndex":165,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は自分が医師であり、<tips=81>龍頭</tips>の知人であることを説明したが、男は信じようともしない。","en":"I explained that I was a doctor and an acquaintance of the <tips=81>Longtou</tips>, but the man would not believe a word of it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r166","rowIndex":166,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あんた<tips=78>金目</tips>野郎だろ？　こういうやつはよくいるんだ！　自分が<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>の幹部だとか、<tips=81>龍頭</tips>の義兄弟だとか、アラブの石油王だとか、わけのわからないことを言って中に入りたがるやつが。怖がりもしないからすぐわかる」","en":"“You’re one of those <tips=78>gold-eyed</tips> freaks, aren’t you? We get your kind all the time! They claim they’re a big shot in <tips=7>YS</tips>, or the <tips=81>Longtou’s</tips> sworn brother, or some Arab oil tycoon—whatever nonsense they can think of to get inside. You can always tell. They don’t even act scared.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r167","rowIndex":167,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　すっかり<tips=17>タイプB</tips>患者だと思われてしまったらしい。","en":"He had apparently decided that I was a <tips=17>Type B</tips> patient.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r168","rowIndex":168,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私はあきらめて帰るか、目の力をつかって相手の感情を探りながらうまく抜け道を探すか、どちらの選択をとるべきか考えていると、ちょうどビルに入ろうとしていた一台の車が止まり、窓が開いた。","en":"I was weighing whether to give up and go home or use my eye to probe his emotions for some opening I could exploit, when a car about to enter the grounds stopped and its window rolled down.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r169","rowIndex":169,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あなた、もしかして<tips=5>太刀川</tips>さんではありませんか？　覚えていませんか？　<tips=4>馬明</tips>です」","en":"“Could you be Dr. <tips=5>Tachikawa</tips>, by any chance? Don’t you remember me? I’m <tips=4>Ma Ming</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬明","displayName":"Ma Ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r170","rowIndex":170,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そういって窓から覗いた顔には見覚えがある。","en":"I recognized the face peering out through the window.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r171","rowIndex":171,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ああ、馬さんですか。覚えています。昔とは少々髪型が違うようですが……」","en":"“Ah, Mr. Ma. Yes, I remember you. Your hairstyle seems a little different from what it was in those days...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r172","rowIndex":172,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「寄る年波には勝てませんや」","en":"“Can’t fight the years.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬明","displayName":"Ma Ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r173","rowIndex":173,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼はスキンヘッドをつるりと撫でると、","en":"He ran a hand over his smooth-shaven head, then said,","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r174","rowIndex":174,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「しかし、実に懐かしい！　いつ以来でしょうかねえ」","en":"“But this really takes me back! How long has it been?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬明","displayName":"Ma Ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r175","rowIndex":175,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そこにあらわれたのは、<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>の弟分だった<tips=4>馬明</tips>という男だ。当時は<tips=3>クリス</tips>同様チンピラの一人でしかなかったが、今は<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>の幹部として街の顔役の一人になったと聞いている。","en":"The man who had appeared was <tips=4>Ma Ming</tips>, once one of <tips=3>Chris Tse’s</tips> junior men. In those days he had been no more than another common hoodlum, just like <tips=3>Chris</tips>, but I had heard that he was now a senior figure in <tips=7>YS</tips> and one of the city’s men of influence.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r176","rowIndex":176,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いやあ、先生はあまりおかわりがありませんな。しかし、こんなところに姿を現すとは、うちの兄貴のことですな？」","en":"“Well, Doctor, you haven’t changed much at all. But if you’ve shown up here of all places, this must be about my boss, eh?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬明","displayName":"Ma Ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r177","rowIndex":177,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　馬は車から降りて私の前に立った。","en":"Ma stepped out of the car and stood before me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r178","rowIndex":178,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ええ、彼の病状が思わしくないと聞いてお見舞いに来たのですが、どうもこの方に信用していただけなくて」","en":"“Yes. I heard he wasn’t doing well, so I came to see him, but this gentleman doesn’t seem to believe me.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r179","rowIndex":179,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は驚きの表情で硬直している警備の男を指さした。","en":"I pointed to the guard, who stood rigid, shock written across his face.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r180","rowIndex":180,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「はあ、そりゃあ、急に言ってもなかなか信用は出来ないでしょう」","en":"“Well, you can hardly blame him. It’s not easy to believe something like that when it comes out of nowhere.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬明","displayName":"Ma Ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r181","rowIndex":181,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうですね。優秀な警備員です。しかし私としても他に方法がなかったのです」","en":"“Yes. He’s an excellent guard. But I had no other way.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r182","rowIndex":182,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして私は誘われるまま<tips=4>馬明</tips>の車に乗り込み、彼と共に<tips=41>グランドタワー</tips>に足を踏みいれた。","en":"At <tips=4>Ma Ming’s</tips> invitation, I got into the car and rode with him into the <tips=41>Grand Tower</tips> grounds.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r183","rowIndex":183,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　エレベーターを乗り継いで最上層まで上がる。","en":"We took a succession of elevators up to the top floor.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r184","rowIndex":184,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　外装同様、内装も手の込んだ作りだったが、あちこちに設置された<tips=42>UB波感知装置</tips>が気になった。<tips=16>タイプA</tips>が能力を使うと即座に反応する装置で、おそらくビルのどこかにあるコントロールルームに通知する仕組みになっているのだろう。","en":"The interior was as elaborate as the exterior, but the <tips=42>UB-wave detectors</tips> installed throughout caught my attention. The devices responded immediately whenever a <tips=16>Type A</tips> used an ability and presumably sent an alert to a control room somewhere in the building.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r185","rowIndex":185,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ビルを取り巻く防壁といい、この仕掛けといい、命知らずだったスラムの青年が、随分と用心深くなったものだ。","en":"The defensive wall around the tower, these devices—the daredevil youth from the slums had become remarkably cautious.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r186","rowIndex":186,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いやあ、それにしてもよく訪ねて来てくださった。いつ以来ですか？　きっと<tips=81>龍頭</tips>も喜びますよ。是非会ってください」","en":"“I really am glad you came. How long has it been now? The <tips=81>Longtou</tips> will be delighted. You absolutely must see him.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬明","displayName":"Ma Ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r187","rowIndex":187,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私の知っている顔よりすっかり老けた<tips=4>馬明</tips>は、興奮した声で言った。","en":"<tips=4>Ma Ming</tips>, far older than I remembered him, spoke excitedly.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r188","rowIndex":188,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「しかし、私が通りかかって良かった。今日は自分の仕事が立て込んでいたので、本来ならば顔を出す予定ではなかったんです。たまたまこの薬酒を手に入れましてね。少しでも早く届けようと、仕事をほっぽりだして駆けつけたら……これも、巡り合わせというものなんでしょうなあ。しかし、こんな真っ昼間に訪ねてくるとは。昔は、あなたがやって来るのはいつも夜だった」","en":"“And thank goodness I happened to come by. I was buried in work today, so I wasn’t supposed to show my face here at all. Then I happened to get hold of this medicinal liquor. I dropped everything and rushed over to deliver it as soon as I could, and here you were... I suppose that’s what they call fate. But imagine you coming in broad daylight! In the old days, you always came at night.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬明","displayName":"Ma Ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r189","rowIndex":189,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　喋るのは<tips=4>馬明</tips>にまかせ、思い出話をするつもりがない私は黙っていた。","en":"I left the speaking to <tips=4>Ma Ming</tips> and remained silent, having no intention of reminiscing.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r190","rowIndex":190,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=3>クリス</tips>の居室の前にもガードマンらしきものが居た。<tips=4>馬明</tips>が<tips=3>クリス</tips>の状態を聞くと、朝に目が覚めてから音楽などを聴いて過ごしていると言う。","en":"Another apparent guard stood outside <tips=3>Chris’s</tips> quarters. When <tips=4>Ma Ming</tips> asked how he was, the man said <tips=3>Chris</tips> had been listening to music and passing the time since he woke that morning.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r191","rowIndex":191,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「じゃあ、はいりましょう」","en":"“Well then, let’s go in.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬明","displayName":"Ma Ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r192","rowIndex":192,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=4>馬明</tips>が陽気にノックをし、そして返事も待たずにドアを開けた。","en":"<tips=4>Ma Ming</tips> knocked cheerfully and opened the door without waiting for an answer.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r193","rowIndex":193,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして私は彼との再会を果たしたのであった。","en":"And so I was reunited with him.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r194","rowIndex":194,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　部屋には彼と、若い女がいた。いやよく見ると、女、というよりも少女と呼ぶべきかもしれない。そのワンピースを着た少女は<tips=3>クリス</tips>の指示でオーディオを操作している。","en":"He was in the room with a young woman. No—on closer inspection, perhaps girl would have been the better word. The girl, wearing a dress, was operating the audio equipment at <tips=3>Chris’s</tips> direction.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r195","rowIndex":195,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　突然の来訪者に二人は驚くこともなく、我々を出迎えた。","en":"Neither showed any surprise at our sudden visit; they simply welcomed us in.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r196","rowIndex":196,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「随分珍しい客が来たもんだな」","en":"“Well, now. There’s a rare guest.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r197","rowIndex":197,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　背もたれを起こしたギャッジベッドの上で幾本ものチューブに繋がれた彼はかすれ声で言った。","en":"He lay connected to several tubes in an adjustable hospital bed, its back raised, and spoke in a hoarse voice.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r198","rowIndex":198,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「兄貴、誰だかわかりますか？」","en":"“Boss, do you recognize him?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r199","rowIndex":199,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「こんなツラの人間は他に知らないよ。もうちょっと近づいてくれ。そこまで声を届かせるのは疲れる。……そうそう、それくらいでいい。助かる。しかし、随分久しぶりじゃねえか。最後に会ってから、もう十五年以上かい？」","en":"“I don’t know anyone else with a mug like that. Come a little closer. It’s tiring, making my voice carry all the way over there. ...Yeah, that’s about right. That helps. Damn, it’s been a long time, hasn’t it? More than fifteen years since we last met?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r200","rowIndex":200,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=3>クリス</tips>の顔の皮膚はあちこちが壊死しボロボロと崩れている。喋れる体力はまだ残っているようだが、皮膚がこの状態だということは内部も相当病状が進行している筈で、いつ急変してもおかしくはない。","en":"The skin of <tips=3>Chris’s</tips> face was necrotic in places and crumbling away. He still had strength enough to speak, but if his skin had reached this state, the disease must have advanced considerably inside his body as well. His condition could take a sudden turn at any moment.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r201","rowIndex":201,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=50>路地</tips>が言っていた、今日明日を争う命、というのはあながち嘘でもなさそうだ。","en":"<tips=50>Roji’s</tips> claim that Chris might not last another day or two did not seem so far from the truth.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r202","rowIndex":202,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「きみは随分と姿が変わってしまったようですね」","en":"“You seem to have changed a great deal.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r203","rowIndex":203,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そりゃあ、病に倒れれば誰だってこうなる。倒れる前は、年の割には若いって評判だったんだがね。……おい、明仔、<tips=30>レイレイ</tips>、二人ともちょっと席を外してくれないか？　おれはこの特別なお客さんと二人きりで話したいんだ」","en":"“Anyone would look like this once disease had laid him low. Before that, I had a reputation for looking young for my age. ...Hey, Ming-jai, <tips=30>Leilei</tips>. Could you two step outside for a while? I want to speak with this special guest alone.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r204","rowIndex":204,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　少女は顔をしかめて難色を浮かべるが、<tips=4>馬明</tips>が無言であごをしゃくると、不承不承ながら従う。","en":"The girl frowned in reluctance. When <tips=4>Ma Ming</tips> silently motioned with his chin, she obeyed despite her displeasure.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r205","rowIndex":205,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そしてその場を辞去しようと仕掛けたとき、","en":"She had just begun to withdraw when Chris called after her.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r206","rowIndex":206,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あ、<tips=30>レイレイ</tips>。お前はそのまま自宅へ帰んなさい」","en":"“Oh, <tips=30>Leilei</tips>. You head straight home.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r207","rowIndex":207,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=81>龍頭</tips>、しかし、そういうわけには……」","en":"“<tips=81>Longtou</tips>, but I couldn’t possibly...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r208","rowIndex":208,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「昨日からほとんど寝ていないじゃないか。目の下にも隈が浮かんでいる。おれがもうすぐ死ぬから、それまでずっとへばりついてようって魂胆なのだろうが、まだ死なないから安心するんだ。……正直言うとな、そうやってへとへとになって張り付いている姿を見せつけられたら、可哀想だから早く死んでやらなくちゃいけないような気分になっちまうんだよ。おれが困るんだ」","en":"“You have barely slept since yesterday. You have dark circles under your eyes. I know what you are up to: you think I am going to die soon, so you plan to stick here until I do. But I am not dying yet, so relax. ...Honestly, when you hover over me looking that exhausted, I feel so sorry for you that I start thinking I ought to hurry up and die for you. That puts me in a real bind.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r209","rowIndex":209,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「もっ、申し訳ありません！　そんなつもりはないんです！　ただ私は、<tips=81>龍頭</tips>さまのお体が心配で……」","en":"“I-I’m terribly sorry! I never meant anything like that! I’m only worried about your health, <tips=81>Longtou</tips>, sir...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r210","rowIndex":210,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「わかったわかった」","en":"“All right, all right.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r211","rowIndex":211,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=3>クリス</tips>が目配せをすると、<tips=4>馬明</tips>はいつまでも頭を上げようとしない少女の袖を引き、後ろ髪引かれるように何度も振り返る彼女を連れて部屋を出て行った。","en":"<tips=3>Chris</tips> signaled with his eyes. <tips=4>Ma Ming</tips> tugged the sleeve of the girl, who still would not raise her head, and led her from the room as she kept looking back, reluctant to leave.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r212","rowIndex":212,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「やれやれ」","en":"“Good grief.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r213","rowIndex":213,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=3>クリス</tips>は溜息をつく。","en":"<tips=3>Chris</tips> sighed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r214","rowIndex":214,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あの子は死んだ部下の娘でね。両親が殺されて孤児になったのを拾ってやったんだ。ノーマルだが、ひどい畸形でね。あの服の下は<tips=16>タイプＡ</tips>の<tips=77>特質変異</tips>みたいになってる。本当は娘の遊び相手にしようと思ったんだが……どうもウマが合わなくて、おれの身のまわりのことばかりしたがって困る」","en":"“That girl is the daughter of a man who worked for me and died. Her parents were killed, leaving her an orphan, so I took her in. She’s a Normal, but terribly malformed. Under those clothes, her body looks almost like a <tips=16>Type A</tips> <tips=77>trait mutation</tips>. I had meant for her to be a playmate for my daughter... but they never took to each other. Now all she ever wants to do is look after me. It’s a nuisance.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r215","rowIndex":215,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私の能力を知っているはずの<tips=3>クリス</tips>が無遠慮にこちらを見るので、私の方から、視線が合わないようにする。","en":"Although <tips=3>Chris</tips> ought to have known about my ability, he stared at me without the slightest concern, forcing me to avert my own gaze so that our eyes would not meet.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r216","rowIndex":216,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「重病人なのにおしゃべりですね」","en":"“You are remarkably talkative for a gravely ill patient.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r217","rowIndex":217,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「全部薬のおかげだよ。妙にハイになってしまう。やっぱりおれはこういう薬は好かないな」","en":"“It’s all thanks to the medicine. Gets me strangely high. I never did like this kind of drug.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r218","rowIndex":218,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　言って、ゴホゴホと咳き込む。","en":"He broke into a fit of coughing.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r219","rowIndex":219,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「少しは自重した方が良いですよ」","en":"“You should take it a little easier.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r220","rowIndex":220,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「自重なんか出来る性格ならこんなところにはいないさ。しかし、あんたは健康そうだね」","en":"“If restraint were in my nature, I wouldn’t have ended up here. But you look healthy.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r221","rowIndex":221,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「とんでもない。あちこち調べれば、年齢なりの数値が出ますよ」","en":"“Hardly. Run enough tests and you’ll find numbers perfectly normal for a man my age.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r222","rowIndex":222,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうかい。ちょっと失礼するよ」","en":"“I see. Excuse me a moment.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r223","rowIndex":223,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=3>クリス</tips>が手元のスイッチを操作すると、ベッドからモーターの駆動音がして、持ち上がっていた頭部側が少し下がる。","en":"<tips=3>Chris</tips> operated the control beside his hand. A motor sounded inside the bed, and the raised head section lowered slightly.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r224","rowIndex":224,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=5>太刀川</tips>さん。あんたの噂は何度か耳にした。夜な夜な街をうろつき回って診察をしているそうじゃないか。相変わらずだね。昔とちっともかわらない」","en":"“Dr. <tips=5>Tachikawa</tips>, I’ve heard rumors about you now and then. They say you roam the city night after night, seeing patients. You’re the same as ever. Haven’t changed a bit.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r225","rowIndex":225,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「他にやることもないですからね」","en":"“There’s nothing else for me to do.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r226","rowIndex":226,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「病院をやめたのかい？」","en":"“Did you leave the hospital?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r227","rowIndex":227,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まだ勤めてますよ。休みの時間に家にいても仕方がないから、街に出ているだけのことです」","en":"“I still work there. There’s no point sitting at home in my free time, so I go out into the city. That’s all.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r228","rowIndex":228,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「奥さんや子供は何も言わないのか？」","en":"“Doesn’t your wife say anything? Or your children?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r229","rowIndex":229,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「独身です」","en":"“I’m single.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r230","rowIndex":230,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それはいけないよ。あんたは未だに呪縛に囚われている。だから、それほどの力があるのに、このしみったれた街を離れることも出来ず、裏通りでわけのわからないボランティアなんかに身を入れることになるんだ。さっさと可愛い女を見つけて、家庭を持つんだ。十五年前にもそう言ったはずだ」","en":"“That won’t do. You’re still bound by the curse. That’s why, for all the power you have, you can’t even leave this miserable little city and instead bury yourself in some incomprehensible volunteer work in the back streets. Hurry up, find yourself a pretty girl, and start a family. I told you the same thing fifteen years ago.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r231","rowIndex":231,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「興味のない話題です……これも十五年前に答えましたね」","en":"“I have no interest in the subject... I gave you that same answer fifteen years ago.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r232","rowIndex":232,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は机についていた椅子をベッド脇まですべらせて、その上に腰掛けた。","en":"I slid the chair at the desk over to the bedside and sat down.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r233","rowIndex":233,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「今日はきみの話を聞きに来たんですよ。何か私に言いたいことがあるんじゃないかと思いましてね」","en":"“I came to hear what you had to say. I thought there might be something you wanted to tell me.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r234","rowIndex":234,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「もちろん、もちろんだとも……なんてったって、あんたはおれの数少ない友人の一人だからな」","en":"“Of course. Of course I do... After all, you are one of the very few friends I have.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r235","rowIndex":235,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=3>クリス</tips>はすっと息を吸い込んで、そして吐いた。胸の力が衰えて、深く呼吸をするだけでも力を振り絞らなくてはならないのだ。","en":"<tips=3>Chris</tips> slowly inhaled, then exhaled. His chest had grown so weak that even a deep breath required him to muster all his strength.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r236","rowIndex":236,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=5>太刀川</tips>さん、昔から、あんたとおれの能力はよく比較されたよな。お互い『目』に<tips=77>特質変異</tips>がある。そして人が見えないものを見ることが出来る。おれはどんなに厳重に隠した物でも覗き見ることが出来て、あんたは本人でさえ気づかぬほど深くその心を見抜いてしまう。……こう言うと似たような力に聞こえるし、事実他人はそう思っていたろうが、おれは全然意味合いの違うものだと昔から思っていたんだ」","en":"“Dr. <tips=5>Tachikawa</tips>, people used to compare our abilities all the time. We both have a <tips=77>trait mutation</tips> in our ‘eyes,’ and we can see what no one else can. I can see anything, no matter how carefully it’s hidden, while you see so deeply into a person’s heart that you find things even they don’t know are there. ...Put that way, our powers sound alike, and I’m sure everyone else thought they were. But I’ve always believed they mean entirely different things.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r237","rowIndex":237,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　静かに語る彼の声は穏やかだった。","en":"His quiet voice was gentle.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r238","rowIndex":238,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「おれの力はただ隠されたものを暴くだけだが、あんたは違う。他人の感情をそのまま受け入れて共感するんだ。なんて優しい能力だろう？　おれの知っている限り、これほど優しい能力を見たことがない。……そして<tips=16>タイプA</tips>は多かれ少なかれ自分の能力に人生が囚われる。あんたの場合それは少々哀しい結果をもたらしたようだ。そんなにえげつない能力を持ちながら、スラムを這いずり回って壊れた心に触れるだけで人生を終えようとするのは、あまりに無欲すぎやしねえか？　今からでも遅くない。もう少し、自分のための人生を歩んだらどうだい？　貧しい病人の気持ちに触れることが、そんなに楽しいのか？」","en":"“My power does nothing but expose what is hidden, but yours is different. You take another person’s emotions into yourself exactly as they are and feel them with him. Could there be a gentler ability? I’ve never seen one, at any rate. ...Every <tips=16>Type A</tips> has his life held captive by his own power to one degree or another, and in your case that seems to have led to a rather sad result. For a man with such a vicious ability, isn’t it far too selfless to end your life crawling through the slums, doing nothing but touching broken hearts? It isn’t too late. Why not live a little more for yourself? Do you really enjoy touching the feelings of poor patients that much?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r239","rowIndex":239,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そんな状態でも、きみは相変わらずの演説好きですね」","en":"“Even in this condition, you remain as fond of making speeches as ever.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r240","rowIndex":240,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は溜息をついた。","en":"I sighed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r241","rowIndex":241,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「すまねえな。これが生きがいなんだ」","en":"“Sorry about that. It’s what I live for.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r242","rowIndex":242,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼はそういって口辺に笑みを浮かべる。その笑い方は、青年だった頃の彼と寸分違わない。","en":"A smile played about the corners of his mouth. The way he smiled was no different at all from when he had been a young man.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r243","rowIndex":243,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「私は別に何かに囚われているわけじゃありません。ただこの街と、その住民が好きなだけなんですよ」","en":"“It isn’t as if I’m bound by anything. I simply like this city and the people who live in it.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r244","rowIndex":244,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ふん」","en":"“Hmph.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r245","rowIndex":245,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=3>クリス</tips>は私の言葉をちっとも信じていない様子だった。","en":"<tips=3>Chris</tips> did not appear to believe a word I said.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r246","rowIndex":246,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ただ、今の意見は私にとって数少ない友人の言葉として心にとどめておきます」","en":"“Still, I will take what you have just said to heart as the words of one of my few friends.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r247","rowIndex":247,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうしてくれ。まあ、何にしろ、おれはあんたが無欲なおかげで随分得をしたわけだからね。少しは恩を感じているのさ」","en":"“See that you do. In any case, your selflessness has profited me handsomely, so I do feel I owe you something.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r248","rowIndex":248,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それから私たちは二人しか知らない昔話などをいくつか話した。","en":"After that, we talked over a few memories that belonged to the two of us alone.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r249","rowIndex":249,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　途中何度か彼が痛みを訴えたので、傍らに用意されていた注射器を用いて彼に薬を打った。","en":"Several times he complained of pain, and I used a syringe prepared at his bedside to give him an injection.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r250","rowIndex":250,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　やがて帰らなくてはいけない時間が訪れ、席を立つ。","en":"Eventually, the time came for me to go, and I rose from my seat.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r251","rowIndex":251,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうだ。先生、最後にひとつプレゼントをしよう」","en":"“Ah, yes. Doctor, let me give you one final present.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r252","rowIndex":252,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「プレゼント？」","en":"“A present?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r253","rowIndex":253,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そう。栄華を極めたサイキックのギャングが、死を迎えてどんな感情を抱いているか、知りたくはないか？」","en":"“That’s right. Don’t you want to know what a psychic gangster who once reached the very height of glory feels as he faces death?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r254","rowIndex":254,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼はそう言って私の方を見る。私はその真意を測りかねて黙っている。","en":"He turned his eyes toward me. Unable to determine his true intention, I remained silent.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r255","rowIndex":255,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あんたは何も受け取らないだろうから、せめてもの医学的サンプルとしてね。……いや違うな。覚えておいて欲しいんだよ。あんたに。おれの感情を」","en":"“You never accept anything from anyone, so think of it as a medical sample, if nothing else. ...No, that’s not it. I want you to remember them. You. My feelings.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r256","rowIndex":256,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼は力なく笑う。","en":"He smiled weakly.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r257","rowIndex":257,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「わかりました」","en":"“Very well.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r258","rowIndex":258,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は頷き、彼の三つある目を見た。","en":"I nodded and looked into his three eyes.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r259","rowIndex":259,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼の偽りのない全ての感情が、私の心のなかに流れ込む。","en":"All of his emotions, utterly unfeigned, flowed into my heart.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r260","rowIndex":260,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　一分ほどそうしていただろうか。","en":"Perhaps we remained that way for a minute.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r261","rowIndex":261,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　シンクロが長すぎて彼の感情に私自身が感化されそうになった時点で目を閉じ、深呼吸をしながら自分の心に戻るのを待った。","en":"When the synchronization had gone on so long that I felt myself succumbing to his emotions, I closed my eyes and breathed deeply as I waited to return to my own heart.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r262","rowIndex":262,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そしてそれが終わると、私は顔を拭い、ゆっくりとまぶたを開く。","en":"When it was over, I wiped my face and slowly opened my eyes.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r263","rowIndex":263,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「これで本当のお別れだ」","en":"“Now this is truly goodbye.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r264","rowIndex":264,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>。私はギャングは嫌いですが、きみのことはそれほど嫌いではありませんでした」","en":"“<tips=3>Chris Tse</tips>. I hate gangsters, but I never hated you all that much.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r265","rowIndex":265,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それは光栄だね」","en":"“That’s an honor.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r266","rowIndex":266,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「お大事に」","en":"“Take care.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r267","rowIndex":267,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　部屋を出ようとすると、","en":"I began to leave the room.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r268","rowIndex":268,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=5>太刀川</tips>さん、もう一ついいか？」","en":"“Dr. <tips=5>Tachikawa</tips>, can I ask you one more thing?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r269","rowIndex":269,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　呼び止められ、私はもう一度彼に近づいた。","en":"At his call, I approached him again.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r270","rowIndex":270,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なあ、死ってのは実感出来るものなのかい？」","en":"“Tell me, is death something you can actually experience as real?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r271","rowIndex":271,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どういう意味ですか？」","en":"“What do you mean?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r272","rowIndex":272,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「痛みや、暑さ寒さみたいにさ、死ぬ瞬間ってのは、何か特別な感覚があるのかと思ってね。……おれは世の中の様々なものを見てきたが、自分の死ってやつだけはまだ体験したことがない。そして『死』ってやつは一度しか体験出来ねえわけだし、それをたっぷりと実感してから死にたいんだが、そもそも死に感覚があるのかなと思ってさ。何も感じないのなら、体験しようがない」","en":"“Like pain, or heat and cold. I got to wondering whether there’s some special sensation at the instant you die. ...I’ve seen all kinds of things in this world, but the one thing I haven’t experienced yet is my own death. And ‘death’ is something you only get to experience once. I want to feel it to the fullest as I go, but then I wondered whether death has any sensation at all. If you can’t feel anything, there’s no way to experience it.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r273","rowIndex":273,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「残念ながら、私に答えられることはありません」","en":"“Unfortunately, I have no answer for you.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r274","rowIndex":274,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうかい。……あれを体験した先生ならわかるかと思ったんだがね」","en":"“I see. ...I thought you might know, after what you experienced back then.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r275","rowIndex":275,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その問いに、私は首を横に振る。","en":"I shook my head at the question.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r276","rowIndex":276,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「わからないんですよ。『あの時』確かに見たはずなのに、私はまだ理解出来ていないのです。その後も機会はあったんですがね、恐怖が先にたって、結局覗き見ることが出来ませんでした」","en":"“I don’t know. I must have seen it ‘that time,’ and yet I still don’t understand. I had other opportunities afterward, but fear came first, and in the end I couldn’t bring myself to look.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r277","rowIndex":277,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どんな頭のおかしな人間の心とも平気でシンクロするあんたにも、人間らしく、怖いものがあったか」","en":"“So even you, a man who thinks nothing of synchronizing with any lunatic’s mind, have something you’re afraid of. How human of you.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r278","rowIndex":278,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「怖いものはたくさんあります。私はどちらかというと怖がりでしょう」","en":"“There are many things I’m afraid of. If anything, I would say I’m rather timid.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r279","rowIndex":279,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「おもしろい冗談だ」","en":"“That’s a good one.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r280","rowIndex":280,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼は弱く笑って見せ、","en":"He offered a weak laugh.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r281","rowIndex":281,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「おれはね、その瞬間が近づいても痛み止めも何も使わずに出来るだけ意識をクリアにしてもらって、ギリギリのところまで自分が死んでゆくのを観察してみようと思うんだ。自分が死ぬってのはどんな感じなのか、たっぷり味わいながらね。それが、この世での最後の楽しみさ」","en":"“When the moment comes, I’m going to have them keep me off painkillers and everything else, keep my head as clear as possible, and watch myself die right up to the very edge. I want to savor what it feels like for all it’s worth. That’ll be my last pleasure in this world.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r282","rowIndex":282,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「奇特ですな」","en":"“How remarkable.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r283","rowIndex":283,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私の言葉に、彼は無言で笑顔を返す。","en":"He answered my words with a silent smile.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r284","rowIndex":284,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして私は部屋を出た。<tips=4>馬明</tips>が扉の前で、ビルの前で私を追い払おうとした警備の男と話し込んでいる。","en":"Then I left the room. Outside the door, <tips=4>Ma Ming</tips> was deep in conversation with the guard who had attempted to drive me away at the entrance.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r285","rowIndex":285,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私の姿をみとめた<tips=4>馬明</tips>は微笑みを浮かべ、警備の男は緊張で体をこわばらせる。私の能力の全貌を知らない彼は、うっかりすると視線が合いそうになるので、私の方から注意深く視線をそらさなくてはいけない。","en":"When <tips=4>Ma Ming</tips> saw me, he smiled; the guard’s body stiffened with tension. Because he did not know the full nature of my ability, he was liable to meet my gaze by accident, so I had to avert my own eyes carefully.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r286","rowIndex":286,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「お話は出来ましたか？」","en":"“Were you able to speak with him?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r287","rowIndex":287,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ええ」","en":"“Yes.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r288","rowIndex":288,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は頷き、エレベーターに向かって歩き始める。","en":"I nodded and began walking toward the elevator.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r289","rowIndex":289,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「さっきは申し訳ありませんでした」","en":"“I’m sorry about earlier.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r290","rowIndex":290,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　警備の男が、後ろから私に恐縮の声をかけた。","en":"The guard addressed me from behind in a deeply apologetic voice.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r291","rowIndex":291,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いえ、警備として当然のことです」","en":"“Not at all. You were only doing your duty as a guard.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r292","rowIndex":292,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　エレベーターのところには既に別の者がいて、ドアを開けた状態で私を待ってくれていた。私は乗り込んだが<tips=4>馬明</tips>たちはまだこの場所に用があるのか、乗り込もうとしない。","en":"Someone else already waited at the elevator, holding its doors open for me. I entered, but <tips=4>Ma Ming</tips> and the others apparently still had business there and made no attempt to follow.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r293","rowIndex":293,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まさか、あなたが<tips=81>龍頭</tips>と共に<tips=18>ローズ・クラブ</tips>と戦った『ドクター』だったとは……」","en":"“To think that you were ‘the Doctor’ who fought the <tips=18>Rose Club</tips> beside the <tips=81>Longtou</tips>...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C1:r294","rowIndex":294,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　男がそう言いかけたところで、エレベーターのドアが閉まり、残りの言葉を遮断した。","en":"The elevator doors closed just as the man began to speak, cutting off the rest of his words.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}}]},{"position":10,"code":"E1","unitId":"E1","rows":[{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r1","rowIndex":1,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　今は栄える<tips=57>滑走路通り</tips>も、北の端まで行けば、かつての面影そのままの狭く小汚い飲食店が建ち並んでいる。","en":"Even <tips=57>Runway Street</tips>, prosperous as it is today, gives way at its northern end to rows of cramped, grimy little restaurants that look just as they did in the old days.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r2","rowIndex":2,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その辺りから繋がる裏路地も含めた一帯は、懐は寒いが飲むことをやめることも出来ぬ、どうしようもない酒飲みにはたまらぬ場所となっていた。","en":"Together with the back alleys branching off from there, the whole area was irresistible to hopeless drinkers whose pockets were empty but who could not bring themselves to stop drinking.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r3","rowIndex":3,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　まだ日が高いにもかかわらず、どの店を覗いても顔を真っ赤にした男や女がぐでんぐでんになってくだを巻いている。","en":"Though the sun was still high, a glance into any establishment revealed red-faced men and women, blind drunk and holding forth incoherently.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r4","rowIndex":4,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　いわゆる赤提灯街といった風情だが、日本でありがちなそうした店が甘い醤油だれや出汁の匂いを路上にたちこめさせるのと違って、この街の路地にはさまざまな国のスパイスやハーブの匂いが入り交じった空気がたちこめている。","en":"It had all the flavor of a red-lantern drinking quarter. But where the familiar establishments of that kind in Japan fill the street with the sweet smells of soy glaze and dashi, the air in these alleys was thick with spices and herbs from countries the world over.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r5","rowIndex":5,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　世界広しといえども、こんな豊かな匂いのする通りは<tips=9>Y地区</tips>にしかないだろう。","en":"The world was wide, but surely no street outside <tips=9>Y District</tips> could boast such a wealth of aromas.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r6","rowIndex":6,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「クニちゃん。何も食べずにお酒ばっかり続けて飲んだら身体に毒よ」","en":"“Kuni, you can’t keep drinking without eating a bite. It’s terrible for you.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"カルロッタ","displayName":"Carlotta","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r7","rowIndex":7,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"『<ruby=プエルト>Ｐｕｅｒｔｏ</ruby>』のオーナー、カルロッタは私が新しいテキーラを注文するたびに口うるさく言う。","en":"Carlotta, the owner of Puerto, scolded me every time I ordered another tequila.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r8","rowIndex":8,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　この店は分類としては一応スペイン風のバルとなるのだろう。小さいながらも繁盛店で、店内のカウンター席とテーブル席はいずれも客で埋まっている。","en":"For purposes of classification, I suppose it counted as a Spanish-style bar. Though small, it was a thriving establishment, with every seat at the counter and every table occupied.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r9","rowIndex":9,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=9>Y地区</tips>では大体こういった店は当地の出身者が経営するものだが、カルロッタは、それらしくスペイン風の名を名乗っているものの、正真正銘のタイ人である。学生時代にスペインへ留学し、そこの料理にいたく感動した経験があり、この街で店を開いた。","en":"In <tips=9>Y District</tips>, establishments of this sort were generally run by people from the country whose food they served. Carlotta had adopted a suitably Spanish-sounding name, but she was Thai through and through. She had studied in Spain as a student, fallen in love with its cuisine, and later opened this place in the city.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r10","rowIndex":10,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　女にしては背が異様に高い。というか、カルロッタは生物学的な意味での女ではない。生まれた時は男であったそうだが、どうにもしっくりこなくて、幾度もの手術を経ていまの姿になった。","en":"She was extraordinarily tall for a woman. Or rather, Carlotta was not a woman in the biological sense. She had apparently been born male, but it had never felt right to her, and after a succession of operations she had arrived at her present form.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r11","rowIndex":11,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私も、ものは試しと彼女と一度寝たことがあるが、確かに普通の女とは若干違うものの、そう言われなければ気がつかない程度のもので、きわめて完成度が高い。","en":"In the spirit of trying anything once, I had slept with her myself. She was indeed a little different from an ordinary woman, but not enough that one would notice without being told. The work was extraordinarily complete.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r12","rowIndex":12,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いっつもお酒しか飲まないじゃない。たまには自慢の料理も頼んで欲しいわ」","en":"“All you ever have is liquor. I wish you’d order one of my specialties once in a while.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"カルロッタ","displayName":"Carlotta","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r13","rowIndex":13,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そう言われて、チラと壁にかかった黒板を見て、本日のおすすめメニューと白いチョークで書かれた文字を眺めた。","en":"At that, I glanced at the blackboard on the wall and looked over the day’s specials written in white chalk.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r14","rowIndex":14,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　この店のメニューにはアヒージョなどといったスペイン風の料理と、カルロッタの故郷タイのスパイスをふんだんに用いた料理が混在している。なかなか評判が良いようだが、私は一度も注文したことがない。","en":"The menu mixed Spanish-style food such as ajillo with dishes lavishly seasoned with spices from Carlotta’s native Thailand. Her cooking seemed to have quite a good reputation, though I had never ordered any of it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r15","rowIndex":15,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　無言のまま視線を戻すと、カルロッタは溜息をつく。","en":"When I returned my gaze to her without a word, Carlotta sighed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r16","rowIndex":16,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「おれは酒を飲むときは酒だけを飲むんだ」","en":"“When I drink, I drink liquor and nothing else.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r17","rowIndex":17,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私の言い訳がましい言葉に、彼女は相手をせず、","en":"She refused to dignify my rather defensive excuse with an answer and went on.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r18","rowIndex":18,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「こんな明るいうちからお酒を飲んでていいの？」","en":"“Should you really be drinking while it’s still light out?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"カルロッタ","displayName":"Carlotta","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r19","rowIndex":19,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「何言ってるんだ。こんな時間に酒を売っているのはお前だろう」","en":"“What are you talking about? You’re the one selling liquor at this hour.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r20","rowIndex":20,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうじゃなくて、あんた、原稿を書くんじゃなかったの？」","en":"“That isn’t what I mean. Weren’t you supposed to be writing your manuscript?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"カルロッタ","displayName":"Carlotta","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r21","rowIndex":21,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……今月の原稿はもう渡したよ」","en":"“...I already submitted this month’s piece.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r22","rowIndex":22,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あなたが個人的に書いてるヤツの話よ。なんとかっていうドキュメンタリーの賞を取るんでしょ。あんなふうにする、こんなふうにするってよく話すけど、まだ全然手を付けていないみたいじゃない」","en":"“I mean the thing you’re writing for yourself. You’re going to win some documentary prize or other, aren’t you? You’re always telling me how you’ll do this and that with it, but it doesn’t look as if you’ve even started.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"カルロッタ","displayName":"Carlotta","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r23","rowIndex":23,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「今日は休みにしたんだ。……そう気軽に書き散らかせるものじゃないんだよ。傑作というのはさ」","en":"“I gave myself the day off. ...A masterpiece isn’t something you can just casually dash off.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r24","rowIndex":24,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そう答えると、カルロッタはまた溜息をつく。","en":"When I answered, Carlotta sighed again.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r25","rowIndex":25,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いい加減、普通に働いたら？　あなたの原稿料なんか、お小遣いくらいにしかならないでしょ？　どこかちゃんとしたところに勤めて、早く<tips=53>ミユキ</tips>ちゃんを楽にしてあげないと……」","en":"“Isn’t it about time you got a regular job? What you earn from those manuscripts can’t be more than pocket money. You need to find a proper place to work and take some of the burden off <tips=53>Miyuki</tips> as soon as you can...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"カルロッタ","displayName":"Carlotta","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r26","rowIndex":26,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「この店は客の就職相談までしてくれるのか？」","en":"“Does this place give its customers career counseling too?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r27","rowIndex":27,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　年をとって、カルロッタも随分と厚かましくなったものだ。","en":"Carlotta had certainly grown a great deal pushier with age.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r28","rowIndex":28,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　内心の腹立ちを、唇を歪めて皮肉の笑みに変えてそう言った。","en":"I twisted my lips into a sarcastic smile, disguising my irritation as I spoke.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r29","rowIndex":29,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は人よりいささか強靱な体躯を持っており、すごんで見せれば大体の相手は震え上がるのだが、古なじみの彼女には通用しないようだ。","en":"My build was somewhat sturdier than most men’s, and if I chose to loom, I could generally make the other person tremble. But that trick seemed to have no effect on an old acquaintance like her.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r30","rowIndex":30,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうよ。就職だけじゃなくて、恋愛相談でもなんでも、この店では取り扱っているわ」","en":"“Yes, it does. Not only career counseling, either. Romance, or anything else you like—we handle it all here.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"カルロッタ","displayName":"Carlotta","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r31","rowIndex":31,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　こちらが不機嫌なのを承知の上で、すまし顔をしている。","en":"She knew full well that I was in a foul mood, yet sat there looking perfectly unconcerned.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r32","rowIndex":32,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は舌打ちをしてから、ズボンのポケットに手を突っ込み、中でしわくちゃになっている幾枚かの紙幣を取り出すと、わざと乱暴に音を立ててカウンターの上に置く。","en":"I clicked my tongue, thrust a hand into my trouser pocket, and pulled out several crumpled banknotes. I deliberately slapped them down on the counter.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r33","rowIndex":33,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「釣りはいらん。酒がまずくなった」","en":"“Keep the change. You’ve spoiled my drink.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r34","rowIndex":34,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そしてくるりと背を向けると、","en":"Then I spun on my heel—","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r35","rowIndex":35,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「足りないわよ」","en":"“It isn’t enough.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r36","rowIndex":36,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　後ろから彼女の声がする。","en":"Her voice came from behind me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r37","rowIndex":37,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「つけておいてくれ」","en":"“Put it on my tab.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r38","rowIndex":38,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そう答えると、カルロッタが三度目の溜息をついたのを背中で感じた。","en":"At my answer, I could feel Carlotta heave her third sigh behind my back.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r39","rowIndex":39,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　店にはこの時間でも客が入っている。","en":"Even at this hour, the place had customers.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r40","rowIndex":40,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして、店内は少し客が入ればかき分けなければ歩けなくなってしまうほどに狭い。","en":"It was so cramped that even a handful left you squeezing past people to get anywhere.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r41","rowIndex":41,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　アルバイトたちは社交ダンスのように身体の向きを縦にしたり横にしたりしながら料理を届けている。","en":"The part-time staff turned edge-on and square again as they carried dishes through the room, as if performing a ballroom dance.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r42","rowIndex":42,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しかし、私にはその必要はなかった。","en":"But I had no need to do that.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r43","rowIndex":43,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私の人並み外れた頑強な肉体と、額に生えた、サイのような大きな角を見れば、何も言わずとも人は避けてくれる。私はそうして私のために開いた道を、肩で風を切って歩けばよかった。","en":"One look at my preternaturally robust body and the great rhinoceros-like horn growing from my forehead made people move aside without a word. All I had to do was swagger down the path that opened for me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r44","rowIndex":44,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=50>路地</tips>君」","en":"“<tips=50>Roji</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"堂島","displayName":"Dojima","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r45","rowIndex":45,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　店の外に出て、煙草に火を付けたところでそう声をかけられた。","en":"Someone called to me just as I stepped outside and lit a cigarette.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r46","rowIndex":46,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　相手は、<tips=48>堂島</tips>という警察官である。この人物——と言っても、一見しただけでは人間とわからぬだろう。一張羅のくたびれた安物のスーツからにょっきと生えているのは、人ではなく犬の頭なのである。狼男か何か、そういった類の仮装をしているようにしか見えないが、これはかぶり物でもなんでもない、生まれたままの彼の顔であった。","en":"The speaker was a police officer named <tips=48>Dojima</tips>. This man—though one could hardly recognize him as human at first glance—had a dog’s head protruding from the collar of his one good suit, a shabby, cheap thing. He looked for all the world like someone dressed as a werewolf or some similar creature, but this was no mask. It was the face with which he had been born.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r47","rowIndex":47,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　これが、サイキックとして生まれた彼が能力と引き換えに与えられた姿である。","en":"This was the form he had been given in exchange for the power he was born with as a psychic.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r48","rowIndex":48,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まったく今日はろくなことがない」","en":"“Today has been nothing but trouble.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r49","rowIndex":49,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は露骨に顔を顰めて舌打ちをした。","en":"I made no effort to hide my scowl as I clicked my tongue.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r50","rowIndex":50,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼はこの<tips=9>Y地区</tips>で<tips=16>タイプＡ</tips>による犯罪を専門に取り締まっている特別捜査官である。","en":"He was a special investigator assigned to crimes committed by <tips=16>Type As</tips> in <tips=9>Y District</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r51","rowIndex":51,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして、私はかつて犯罪者として彼に逮捕されたことがある。","en":"And I had once been arrested by him as a criminal.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r52","rowIndex":52,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「カルロッタの説教から逃げて来たと思ったら、旦那と出くわすなんてね。どうやらさっさと帰って布団をかぶったほうが良さそうだ」","en":"“Just when I thought I’d escaped Carlotta’s lecture, I have to run into you, sir. Looks like I’d better hurry home and pull the covers over my head.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r53","rowIndex":53,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「偶然出くわしたわけじゃない。<tips=53>ミユキ</tips>さんに聞いたら、ここに居るだろうと言うんで訪ねて来たんだ。きみに頼み事があるんだよ」","en":"“We didn’t run into each other by chance. I asked <tips=53>Miyuki</tips>, and she said you would probably be here, so I came looking. I have a favor to ask of you.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"堂島","displayName":"Dojima","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r54","rowIndex":54,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その鼻元に、ふうと煙を吐きかけてやると、彼は鼻の頭にしわをうかべ、不快な顔をする。彼にとって、煙草の悪臭はつらかろう。","en":"I blew a stream of smoke toward his muzzle. He wrinkled his nose in displeasure. The stench of tobacco must have been painful to him.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r55","rowIndex":55,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「こりゃあ、布団をかぶるだけじゃなくて、線香と盛り塩で厄除けしなくちゃいけませんな。旦那が頼み事をしに来るだなんて、こりゃあもうただ不吉ってだけじゃなく、何か悪いものに取り憑かれているとしか思えない」","en":"“It seems the covers won’t be enough. I’ll need incense and a mound of salt to ward off this misfortune. You coming to ask me a favor is more than an ill omen—it can only mean something evil has possessed you.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r56","rowIndex":56,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「きみに何かが取り憑いているとすれば、それは<tips=53>ミユキ</tips>さんの生き霊だろうよ」","en":"“If anything is possessing you, it must be the living spirit of <tips=53>Miyuki</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"堂島","displayName":"Dojima","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r57","rowIndex":57,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「堅物の旦那にしては上出来の冗談だ」","en":"“Not bad, for a stuffed shirt like you.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r58","rowIndex":58,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は鼻で笑って、","en":"I gave a snort.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r59","rowIndex":59,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あんたはちょくちょく私に頼み事をしに来るが、いつもろくでもない話ばかりだ。いい加減気づいてくれよ。私はあんたに協力する義理はないんだ。あんたのおかげで、大分不自由な生活を強いられているんだからな。能力がなくなって、<tips=77>特質変異</tips>だけ残って……これじゃあ、ただ角が生えただけのおかしな人間だ」","en":"“You come asking me for favors every so often, and it’s always some rotten business or other. Take the hint already. I don’t owe you any help. Thanks to you, I’ve been forced to live with one restriction after another. My ability is gone, and all I have left is the <tips=77>trait mutation</tips>... Now I’m nothing but a freak with a horn growing out of his head.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r60","rowIndex":60,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「私を責めるのはお門違いだ。きみの能力が抑制されているのは、私が逮捕したせいではなく、きみが能力を濫用したからだよ」","en":"“Blaming me is misplaced. Your ability is being suppressed not because I arrested you, but because you abused it.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"堂島","displayName":"Dojima","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r61","rowIndex":61,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そんなことはわかっていますよ。そうやって、私が生まれながらにして授かったこの貴重な能力を社会正義だのなんだのと言って封じたんだ。おかげで私は探偵業を廃業し、この街の風俗情報やゴシップを原稿にして、ゴミみたいな雑誌に買いたたかれながら日銭を得る情けない身の上となった。こんな私を、あんたらの都合のいいときだけ利用しようってのはいくらなんでも勝手すぎやしませんかね？」","en":"“I know that perfectly well. You invoked social justice and whatever else to seal away the precious ability bestowed upon me at birth. Thanks to that, I had to close my detective agency. Now I eke out a miserable living writing about this city’s nightlife and gossip, then selling the copy to trashy magazines for a pittance. Isn’t it rather shameless for your people to make use of me only when it happens to suit you?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r62","rowIndex":62,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「報酬は支払っている」","en":"“We are paying you.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"堂島","displayName":"Dojima","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r63","rowIndex":63,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そういう話をしているんじゃない。人としての筋と道理の話をしているんだ。人を馬鹿にするのもほどがあると言っているんです」","en":"“That’s not what I’m talking about. I’m talking about what’s right and proper between human beings. I’m saying there’s a limit to how much you can make a fool of a man.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r64","rowIndex":64,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は<tips=48>堂島</tips>の顔に自分の顔を近づけてそう言ってやったが、彼は表情一つかえず――と言っても、彼の顔は人間のように豊かに感情を表現するには不向きだったが――懐から手帳とペンを取り出すと、","en":"I brought my face close to <tips=48>Dojima’s</tips> as I told him so. He did not alter his expression in the slightest—though admittedly, his face was ill suited to displaying the rich range of human emotion—and instead removed a notebook and pen from inside his coat.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r65","rowIndex":65,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「今回は、これだけ用意出来る」","en":"“This time, I can offer you this much.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"堂島","displayName":"Dojima","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r66","rowIndex":66,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　数字を走り書きして、私に見せた。それは、相場の倍はある額で、けして豊かな生活をしているとは言えない私にとって、非常に魅力的な数字ではあった。","en":"He scribbled a figure and showed it to me. The sum was at least twice the going rate, and for someone as far from prosperous as I was, it was exceedingly tempting.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r67","rowIndex":67,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しかし、金額を見せられた途端に態度を豹変させるような安いマネはしたくない。その程度の矜持は私にもある。","en":"But I had no intention of putting on a cheap display by changing my tune the instant I saw the sum. I had at least that much pride.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r68","rowIndex":68,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……なぜこんな額を？　いつもは小遣い程度しか出さないくせに」","en":"“...Why this much? You usually only shell out pocket change.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r69","rowIndex":69,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　顔色を変えないようにしながらそう訊ねた。","en":"I asked, careful not to let my expression change.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r70","rowIndex":70,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「今回の事件は特別なんだ。……話を聞きたいのなら、店に入ろう。立ち話でするような内容でもない」","en":"“This case is special. ...If you want to hear about it, let’s go inside. It isn’t something to discuss standing in the street.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"堂島","displayName":"Dojima","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r71","rowIndex":71,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=48>堂島</tips>は辺りの様子を気にしながら言った。確かに、犬の頭をしたものと、角を生やした大男の立ち話はこの百鬼夜行の街でも目立つ。","en":"<tips=48>Dojima</tips> said this while casting an eye around. Certainly, a dog-headed creature and a hulking, horned man standing around talking drew attention even amid this city’s Night Parade of a Hundred Demons.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r72","rowIndex":72,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして今さっき後にしたばかりの『Ｐｕｅｒｔｏ』に舞い戻った。","en":"And so I returned to Puerto, which I had only just left.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r73","rowIndex":73,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=48>堂島</tips>を連れて他の客と少し離れた席に座ると、勘の良いカルロッタはそれですべてを悟ったようで、余計なことは言わなかった。ただ事務的に注文をとり、運んでくれた。","en":"I brought <tips=48>Dojima</tips> to a table somewhat removed from the other customers. Quick-witted Carlotta appeared to grasp the situation at once and said nothing unnecessary. She merely took our order and brought it over with businesslike efficiency.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r74","rowIndex":74,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女のこの賢さがこの店を繁盛店にしたのだ。","en":"It was this shrewdness of hers that had made the bar such a success.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r75","rowIndex":75,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「今この街で猟奇殺人事件が連続して発生しているのを知っているか？」","en":"“Do you know there’s been a string of bizarre murders in the city?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r76","rowIndex":76,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=48>堂島</tips>は顔を近づけると、声をひそめて言う。","en":"<tips=48>Dojima</tips> leaned close and lowered his voice.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r77","rowIndex":77,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「この辺りじゃ、殺人事件なんかいつだって連続的に起きてますよ」","en":"“Around here, murders happen one after another all the time.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r78","rowIndex":78,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「同じ手口の殺人が続いているんだ。若い女ばかりが殺され、バラバラにされている。我々は同一犯の仕業だと考えて、連続殺人事件として捜査している」","en":"“The same method has been used in every case. All the victims are young women, murdered and cut to pieces. We believe one perpetrator is responsible, so we’re treating it as a serial murder case.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r79","rowIndex":79,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なるほど」","en":"“I see.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r80","rowIndex":80,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私はそう言って、テキーラのグラスに鼻を近づけ、香りを嗅ぎ、口に含んだ。","en":"I brought my nose to my glass of tequila, breathed in its aroma, and took a sip.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r81","rowIndex":81,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私の内臓は人より頑丈に出来ており、少々のアルコールではほろ酔い程度にもならない。","en":"My insides were sturdier than most people’s. A little alcohol wasn’t enough even to make me tipsy.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r82","rowIndex":82,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　一方<tips=48>堂島</tips>は全くアルコールを口にしない。というよりも、どの店に入ってもほとんど何も口にしない。今も、カルロッタにアルコール一杯分の金を払って、いつも持ち歩いている精製水のパックにストローをさして飲んでいる。","en":"<tips=48>Dojima</tips>, on the other hand, never touched alcohol. In fact, no matter what establishment he entered, he hardly put anything at all in his mouth. Even now, he had paid Carlotta the price of a drink and was sipping through a straw from the carton of purified water he always carried.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r83","rowIndex":83,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼のサイキックとしての能力は、恐ろしく鋭敏な味覚と嗅覚である。","en":"His psychic ability was an extraordinarily acute sense of taste and smell.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r84","rowIndex":84,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼の舌と鼻はあらゆるもののにおいや味を、人間離れした精度で繊細に感じ取る。","en":"His tongue and nose could pick up the taste and smell of anything with inhuman sensitivity and precision.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r85","rowIndex":85,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　だから、世の中のあらゆるものの背景が『わかりすぎてしまう』のだ。","en":"That was why he ended up knowing far too much about what lay behind everything in the world.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r86","rowIndex":86,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　たとえば、調理道具の表面にわずかに残った洗剤の成分を判別したり、トイレから帰った後の手洗いが不十分のまま調理したことに気がついてしまったりする。体臭から目の前の人間の体調を見抜くこともあり、場合によっては病名や余命までも言い当てる。","en":"He could, for example, identify traces of detergent left on the surface of a cooking utensil, or tell when someone had gone back to cooking without washing their hands properly after using the toilet. Sometimes a person’s body odor alone told him the state of their health—even their disease and how long they had left to live.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r87","rowIndex":87,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それほどの嗅覚であるから、どの店でもいちいち気になるらしく、口に入れるものに関してはほとんど潔癖症なほどのこだわりを見せている。","en":"With a nose that sensitive, something seemed to bother him wherever he ate, and he was so particular about what went into his mouth that it bordered on an obsession with cleanliness.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r88","rowIndex":88,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なにが特別な事件なんですか？　あの食人野郎のヒュー・マルケスや、『皮剥ぎ』のリンよりもひどいやつなんですか？」","en":"“What makes this case so special? Is the perpetrator worse than that cannibal Hugh Marques, or Lin the ‘Skinner’?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r89","rowIndex":89,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「残虐性ではそれらより上というわけでもないが、それでも今回は特別なんだよ。大物なんだ」","en":"“He isn’t necessarily any more brutal than those two, but this time is special all the same. This one is big game.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r90","rowIndex":90,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「もう犯人がわかってるんですか？」","en":"“You already know who the killer is?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r91","rowIndex":91,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　問うと、彼は頷き、","en":"When I asked, he nodded.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r92","rowIndex":92,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そいつは『<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>』と呼ばれている」","en":"“He is known as ‘<tips=20>Koschei</tips>.’”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r93","rowIndex":93,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「聞いたことがない。この街の住人ではないんですか？」","en":"“I’ve never heard of him. Isn’t he a resident of this city?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r94","rowIndex":94,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そう、よそ者だ。そして、この名はコードネームみたいなもので本名ではない。ロシアのマスコミがつけたのが最初だそうだよ」","en":"“That’s right. He’s an outsider, and the name is more like a codename than his real one. Apparently the Russian press coined it.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r95","rowIndex":95,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>ですか……」","en":"“<tips=20>Koschei</tips>...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r96","rowIndex":96,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「この<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>は、世界をまたにかけ、ありとあらゆる場所で卑劣な猟奇殺人を繰り返している。手口はいつも同じで、女を巧妙に誘い出し、殺してバラバラにするんだ。これまでに何度か逮捕されているが、脱獄の名人でね。すぐに抜け出してしまった」","en":"“This <tips=20>Koschei</tips> has traveled the globe, committing despicable, grotesque murders wherever he goes. His method is always the same: he deftly lures a woman away, kills her, and cuts her to pieces. He has been arrested several times, but he is a master of escape and has always broken out again almost at once.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r97","rowIndex":97,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あんたが捜査しているってことは、そいつはサイキックなんでしょうな」","en":"“If you’re the one investigating him, I take it he’s a psychic.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r98","rowIndex":98,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それは間違いない。脱獄もその能力が関与していると思われる。ただ具体的にどんな力があるのかは判明していない。……この有名な手配犯が、日本に来ているらしいという情報が少し前から入っていたのだが、居場所がわからなかった。そんなとき、この<tips=9>Y地区</tips>でバラバラ死体が見つかって、私の出番となったのさ」","en":"“There is no doubt of that. We believe his ability is involved in his escapes as well, though we still don’t know precisely what that power is. ...We had been receiving reports for some time that this notorious fugitive had come to Japan, but we couldn’t locate him. Then a dismembered body was found here in <tips=9>Y District</tips>, and that was where I came in.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r99","rowIndex":99,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なぜ死体を見ただけでそいつの犯行とわかったんです？」","en":"“How could you tell it was his work just from looking at the body?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r100","rowIndex":100,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「死体に、共通する独特の特徴があったんだよ」","en":"“The body had a peculiar feature in common with the others.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r101","rowIndex":101,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どんな？」","en":"“What was it?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r102","rowIndex":102,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「これ以上警察の情報を知りたいのなら、引き受けるという返事を貰ってからだな」","en":"“If you want any more information from the police, I’ll need your answer that you accept the job first.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r103","rowIndex":103,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「世界的な犯罪者がこの街に来たというのは、なかなかそそられる話ではあるが……」","en":"“A criminal notorious the world over turning up in this city does have a certain appeal...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r104","rowIndex":104,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうだろう。それに、きみの仕事はそう難しくない。ただ、こっちの指示通り能力を使ってくれればいいんだ」","en":"“I thought so. Besides, your part isn’t especially difficult. All you have to do is use your ability exactly as we instruct.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r105","rowIndex":105,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「旦那。私は、その、便利な道具みたいな扱いが不愉快だって言ってるんですよ」","en":"“Sir, what I’m saying is that I don’t like being treated like some convenient tool.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r106","rowIndex":106,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「すまん」","en":"“Sorry.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r107","rowIndex":107,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=48>堂島</tips>はそう謝ってくれたが、その表情は普段と変わらない。","en":"<tips=48>Dojima</tips> did apologize, but his expression never changed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r108","rowIndex":108,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「大体ねえ……」","en":"“Anyway...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r109","rowIndex":109,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私が言いかけたところで、プルルルと、着信音がそれを遮る。","en":"Just as I began, the trill of a ringtone cut me off.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r110","rowIndex":110,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=48>堂島</tips>の携帯電話が鳴ったのだ。","en":"<tips=48>Dojima’s</tips> cell phone was ringing.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r111","rowIndex":111,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「失礼する」","en":"“Excuse me.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r112","rowIndex":112,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼はスーツの胸元から電話を取り出し、席を立つ。","en":"He drew the phone from inside his suit jacket and rose from his seat.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r113","rowIndex":113,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は溜息をつき、彼の帰りを待った。","en":"I sighed and waited for him to return.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r114","rowIndex":114,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いつも思うんですが、音はちゃんと切っておいてくださいよ。マナー違反ですよ」","en":"“You know, you really ought to keep your phone on silent. It’s bad manners.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r115","rowIndex":115,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　帰って来た<tips=48>堂島</tips>を、私はそうたしなめた。","en":"I chided <tips=48>Dojima</tips> with those words when he returned.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r116","rowIndex":116,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼は私の言葉に返事をしない。","en":"He gave no answer.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r117","rowIndex":117,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「じゃあ返事をきかせてもらおうか」","en":"“Well, then. Let’s hear your answer.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r118","rowIndex":118,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その言葉に、返事をしないのは今度はこちらの番だった。","en":"At that, it was my turn to answer with silence.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r119","rowIndex":119,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どうした？　事件に興味があるんだろう？」","en":"“What’s wrong? You’re interested in the case, aren’t you?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r120","rowIndex":120,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まあ、少しはね」","en":"“A little.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r121","rowIndex":121,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうだろう。軽薄なきみには相手が世界的な存在と言うだけで魅力的に感じられるはずだ」","en":"“I thought so. A frivolous man like you is bound to be interested just because the target is world-famous.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r122","rowIndex":122,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=48>堂島</tips>には全く悪意がないのだろうが、いつも一言多いのが欠点だ。","en":"<tips=48>Dojima</tips> probably meant no harm at all, but his one fault was that he always said one thing too many.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r123","rowIndex":123,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ギャラも出るわけですし、手伝いますよ。結局思い通りになっちまうのは、あまり面白くはないですが」","en":"“You’re paying me for it, so I’ll help. I don’t much like that you’ve gotten your way in the end, though.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r124","rowIndex":124,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それなら、今から早速……と言いたいところだが、酒を飲んでいて大丈夫か？」","en":"“Then let’s get started at once... is what I’d like to say, but are you all right to work after drinking?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r125","rowIndex":125,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「この程度のアルコールなんぞ、気付け薬程度のものですよ」","en":"“This little bit of booze is nothing more than a pick-me-up.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r126","rowIndex":126,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして<tips=48>堂島</tips>は辺りの視線を気にしながら、机の上に警察用の端末を置いた。","en":"Glancing around to see who might be watching, <tips=48>Dojima</tips> placed a police terminal on the table.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r127","rowIndex":127,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=48>堂島</tips>は指先で操作をし、トランプ大のモニターに捜査資料となる画像を表示させる。","en":"<tips=48>Dojima</tips> operated it with a fingertip, bringing up images from the case materials on its playing-card-sized screen.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r128","rowIndex":128,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ちなみに<tips=48>堂島</tips>の指も、毛に覆われ、肉球のついた犬のものだ。見たことはないが、おそらく服を脱げばその下にも犬とそっくりの毛むくじゃらの身体があるのだろうし、尻尾も生えているに違いない。","en":"<tips=48>Dojima’s</tips> fingers, incidentally, were canine too, covered in fur and furnished with pads. I had never seen him undressed, but beneath his clothes there was probably a shaggy body just like a dog’s, and he must have had a tail as well.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r129","rowIndex":129,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「これが<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>のものと思われる最初の事件で、これが四日後に起きた二件目の事件。そしてこの路上の写真がつい昨日死体が発見された三件目の事件で、この事件から私が捜査に携わっている」","en":"“This is the first incident believed to be <tips=20>Koschei’s</tips> work, and this is the second, four days later. This photograph of the street is from the third incident—the body was discovered only yesterday—and that is the point at which I joined the investigation.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r130","rowIndex":130,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=48>堂島</tips>が操作をするたびに、次々と断裂した遺体の画像が表示される。","en":"Each time <tips=48>Dojima</tips> operated the terminal, another image of a dismembered body appeared.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r131","rowIndex":131,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「死体だけ見せられてもよくわからないな。その<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>ってやつの事件だと断定するに至った、共通する特徴ってのを教えてもらいましょうか」","en":"“Looking at nothing but the bodies doesn’t tell me much. How about telling me what they had in common that made you conclude this <tips=20>Koschei</tips> was responsible?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r132","rowIndex":132,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まず、被害者がすべて十代から二十代の若い女であること。それから……ほら、見ろよ。どの現場も、切断された遺体が几帳面にビニール袋に入れられて、棚に整頓されているだろう？　路上のやつも、ご丁寧にビニール袋に小分けされて積み重ねてあったんだ」","en":"“First, all the victims were young women in their teens or twenties. Then... here, look. At every scene, the severed remains had been meticulously placed in plastic bags and arranged on shelves. Even the body in the street had been painstakingly portioned into separate bags and stacked.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r133","rowIndex":133,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「模倣犯の可能性もあるのではないですか？　私は知らなかったが、その<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>ってのはその筋では有名な殺人鬼なんでしょう？　そういうやつを崇拝するイカレた野郎ってのはいるんだ。この街のチンピラが真似をしているのかもしれない」","en":"“Could it be a copycat? I’d never heard of him, but this <tips=20>Koschei</tips> is a famous killer among the right sort of people, isn’t he? There are sick bastards who worship men like that. Maybe some punk from this city is copying him.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r134","rowIndex":134,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「その可能性はもちろん考慮しているが、現段階では<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>本人の犯行と考えて捜査している。遺体の切断の箇所なども過去の例と一致しているんだ。一般には公開されていない情報だから、そうそう簡単に真似出来るものじゃない」","en":"“We have naturally considered that possibility, but at present, the investigation is proceeding on the assumption that <tips=20>Koschei</tips> himself is responsible. The points of dismemberment on the bodies also match those in earlier cases. That detail has never been made public, so it would not be easy for an imitator to reproduce.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r135","rowIndex":135,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ふむ」","en":"“Hmm.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r136","rowIndex":136,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は<tips=48>堂島</tips>の端末を自分の手元に引き寄せ、指先で画像をめくる。","en":"I pulled <tips=48>Dojima’s</tips> terminal toward me and flicked through the images with a fingertip.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r137","rowIndex":137,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　確かに彼が言うとおり、棚に整然とビニール袋が並べられた光景は、殺人現場としては珍しいものだろう。","en":"As he had said, plastic bags arranged so neatly upon shelves would be an unusual sight at a murder scene.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r138","rowIndex":138,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　何枚かごとに、ビニール袋の中身の、切断された部分の画像もあるが、どうも頭部まで何等分かにされているらしく、目と頭髪の一部がついただけのパーツなども撮影されており、なかなかにグロテスクだ。こうした飲食店で見るような画像ではない。","en":"Interspersed among the photographs were close-ups of the severed parts inside the bags. Even the head appeared to have been divided into several pieces; one photograph showed a fragment consisting of little more than an eye and a patch of hair. It was quite grotesque—hardly the sort of thing to look at in a restaurant.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r139","rowIndex":139,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「その、これは切断されただけなんですか？」","en":"“So... were the bodies only cut apart?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r140","rowIndex":140,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どういう意味だ？」","en":"“What do you mean?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r141","rowIndex":141,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「つまり、一部を食べたりだとか、体液が付着していたりだとか」","en":"“I mean, had any part of them been eaten, or were there any bodily fluids on the remains?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r142","rowIndex":142,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうした痕跡が見られないのも、<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>の犯罪の特徴だ。彼はただ若い女を切断し、棚に綺麗に並べるだけなんだよ」","en":"“The absence of such traces is another characteristic of <tips=20>Koschei’s</tips> crimes. He simply cuts young women apart and arranges the pieces neatly on shelves.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r143","rowIndex":143,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なるほど。そりゃ確かに変態だ」","en":"“I see. That certainly is twisted.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r144","rowIndex":144,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私が感心しながら画像をもう一度眺め、","en":"Impressed despite myself, I looked over the images once more.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r145","rowIndex":145,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「しかし、こんな安直な殺人事件ならば、旦那一人で充分なんじゃないですか？　あんたの嗅覚をもってすれば難しいことなんぞ何もないでしょう。犯人のにおいを覚えて、街中をうろうろ歩き回ってればすぐに居場所がわかる」","en":"“But if the case is this straightforward, surely you can handle it alone, sir. With your nose, there shouldn’t be anything difficult about it. Learn the killer’s scent, wander around the city, and you’ll find him in no time.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r146","rowIndex":146,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「きみが思っているほど万能じゃない。それに、私はまだ死後何日も経った現場や、野ざらしにされて水で流された現場しか見ていない」","en":"“It isn’t as all-powerful as you imagine. Besides, so far I’ve seen only scenes several days after the death, or outdoor scenes that had been left exposed and washed clean by water.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r147","rowIndex":147,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「でも、あんたなら痕跡を嗅ぎつけられるはずだ」","en":"“But surely you can sniff out a trace.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r148","rowIndex":148,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まあ、多少はね。現場のにおいのなかに、<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>らしきものは見つけてある。が、どうもおかしな感じがして、はっきりと確信が持てないんだ。……まあとにかく、私一人ではなかなか難しい状況だと思ったから、こうしてきみの協力を得に来たわけだ」","en":"“To some extent. Among all the smells at the scenes, I did find one that may have belonged to <tips=20>Koschei</tips>. But something about it feels wrong, and I can’t be certain. ...In any case, I decided the situation would be difficult to handle alone. That is why I came to ask for your help.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r149","rowIndex":149,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして<tips=48>堂島</tips>は、バッグから透明な袋に入った携帯電話を取り出し、カウンターの上に置く。","en":"Then <tips=48>Dojima</tips> took a cell phone sealed in a transparent bag out of his own bag and set it on the counter.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r150","rowIndex":150,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「これは？」","en":"“What is this?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r151","rowIndex":151,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「被害者の携帯電話だ。このロックを外して欲しいんだよ」","en":"“A victim’s cell phone. I want you to remove its lock.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r152","rowIndex":152,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そんなの、電話会社に連絡して国家権力で外させればいいじゃないですか」","en":"“Why don’t you call the phone company and use the might of the state to make them unlock it?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r153","rowIndex":153,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうしたいんだが、ナントカという海外の企業が開発したセキュリティシステムを導入していてな」","en":"“I would, but it uses a security system developed by some foreign company called... something or other.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r154","rowIndex":154,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ブルーシップ？」","en":"“Blue Ship?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r155","rowIndex":155,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そんな名前だったかな」","en":"“Something like that.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r156","rowIndex":156,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ブルーシップというのは正確には企業ではない。","en":"Strictly speaking, Blue Ship was not a corporation.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r157","rowIndex":157,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　匿名のプログラマー集団によるプロジェクトで、さまざまなソフトウェアを開発しているが、なかでもセキュリティソフトはいかなる状況下でも完全に個人情報を守るということを売りにしており、携帯のみならず様々なデジタルデバイスにおいて、定番のソフトとして定着している。","en":"It was a project run by an anonymous collective of programmers, developing all manner of software. Its security software in particular promised complete protection of personal information under any circumstances, and had become standard not only on phones but across all kinds of digital devices.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r158","rowIndex":158,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ソフトはいかにプログラムに精通した人間でも突破出来ない防衛力を持ち、ブルーシップはいかなる勢力に圧力をかけられても交渉しないと明言していた。","en":"The software’s defenses could not be breached by even the most accomplished programmer, and Blue Ship had declared that it would never negotiate, no matter what organization tried to pressure it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r159","rowIndex":159,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「こんな厄介なものを、誰でも簡単に利用出来るんだからやりにくい世の中だ」","en":"“It’s a difficult world to work in when anyone can get their hands on something this troublesome so easily.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r160","rowIndex":160,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　機械に疎い<tips=48>堂島</tips>は、若干憎しみのようなものを込めてそう呟いた。","en":"Technologically inept, <tips=48>Dojima</tips> muttered the words with something very much like hatred.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r161","rowIndex":161,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「が、こんな堅牢なシステムでもきみなら解除できる。そうだろう？　それとも、これは無理か？」","en":"“But even a system this robust is something you can defeat. Isn’t that right? Or is this one too much for you?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r162","rowIndex":162,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どんなシステムでも同じですよ」","en":"“Every system is the same to me.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r163","rowIndex":163,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は腕まくりをして、毛むくじゃらの腕を<tips=48>堂島</tips>の前に差し出した。","en":"I rolled up my sleeve and extended my hairy arm toward <tips=48>Dojima</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r164","rowIndex":164,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「頼もしいものだ」","en":"“Reassuring.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r165","rowIndex":165,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼はそう言って、ポケットからボールペンのような形状のものを取り出す。そして水色のプラスチックキャップを外すと、透明のシリンジが現れ、その先端に取り付けられた針が店内の照明を反射して輝く。","en":"With those words, he took something shaped like a ballpoint pen from his pocket. He removed its pale-blue plastic cap to reveal a transparent syringe, the needle at its tip glinting in the bar’s light.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r166","rowIndex":166,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　この、糖尿病患者が使うインシュリンキットのような道具こそが、私の身体に常に投与されている<tips=16>タイプＡ</tips>能力抑制剤の効果を中和させる薬——つまり、封印された私の能力を解き放つものであった。","en":"This device, resembling the insulin pens used by people with diabetes, contained a drug that neutralized the effects of the <tips=16>Type A</tips> ability suppressant constantly being administered to my body—in other words, it released the ability sealed inside me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r167","rowIndex":167,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=48>堂島</tips>は慣れた手つきで私の腕に針を刺す。チクリと痛んだあとに、冷たいものが腕の内側に入って行く。","en":"With practiced ease, <tips=48>Dojima</tips> sank the needle into my arm. A sharp prick of pain came first, followed by something cold flowing into it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r168","rowIndex":168,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　すべての薬剤を注入すると、<tips=48>堂島</tips>は元通りキャップをはめ、辺りの様子を気にしながら懐にしまった。","en":"Once he had injected all of the drug, <tips=48>Dojima</tips> replaced the cap and slipped the device back inside his coat, keeping an eye on the people around us as he did so.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r169","rowIndex":169,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　薬が効き始めるまでおよそ十五分。一度席を立ち、店の外で煙草を二本ほど吸って帰って来ると、ちょうどそれくらいの時間が過ぎていた。","en":"The drug took about fifteen minutes to work. I left the table, smoked a couple of cigarettes outside, and by the time I returned, almost exactly that long had passed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r170","rowIndex":170,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「やってみましょう」","en":"“Let’s try it.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r171","rowIndex":171,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私が手のひらを差し出すと、<tips=48>堂島</tips>はその上に被害者の携帯電話を置く。","en":"I held out my hand, and <tips=48>Dojima</tips> placed the victim’s phone in it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r172","rowIndex":172,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それは流行に敏感な若者のものというだけあって、最新式の端末だった。そして外側には、ごてごてと装飾のシールのようなものが貼り付けてある。","en":"Just as one would expect from a fashion-conscious young person, it was the latest model, and the outside had been plastered with gaudy decorative stickers.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r173","rowIndex":173,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は片手でそれを操作した。","en":"I used it one-handed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r174","rowIndex":174,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　スリープを解除すると、生体認証を行うよう画面に表示が出る。私はそれに従い、タッチ画面に指を置きながら、携帯電話の上部に取り付けられたカメラに自分の目を映す。","en":"When I woke it from sleep, a prompt appeared requesting biometric authentication. Following its instructions, I pressed a finger to the touchscreen and held my eye before the camera mounted at the top of the phone.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r175","rowIndex":175,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　すると、何のエラーもなくセキュリティは解除され、メニュー画面があらわれた。","en":"The security lock opened without so much as an error, and the menu screen appeared.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r176","rowIndex":176,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いつ見ても凄いものだな。どういう仕組みになってるんだ」","en":"“It’s remarkable every time I see it. How does it work?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r177","rowIndex":177,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=48>堂島</tips>は溜息をつく。","en":"<tips=48>Dojima</tips> sighed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r178","rowIndex":178,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「私は、旦那の顔を見るたび、今旦那が言ったのと同じことを感じますよ」","en":"“Every time I see your face, sir, I wonder exactly the same thing.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r179","rowIndex":179,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私が言うと、さすがに<tips=48>堂島</tips>も気を悪くしたのか眉間にしわをよせる。","en":"That finally seemed to offend even <tips=48>Dojima</tips>; he furrowed his brow.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r180","rowIndex":180,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　もちろん本来は、正当な持ち主の網膜や指紋でなければロックは解除されない。","en":"Naturally, the lock should have opened only for the rightful owner’s retina and fingerprints.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r181","rowIndex":181,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しかし、能力を使える状態の私が手にしてしまえば、そんな事情にはお構いなく、すべてのシステムが解除されてしまうのだ。","en":"But once I took the phone in hand with my ability active, none of that mattered. Every system simply unlocked.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r182","rowIndex":182,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　これが私の能力だ。","en":"This was my ability.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r183","rowIndex":183,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　携帯のロックを解くだけではない。ありとあらゆる鍵は私の前では機能しない。ドアにどんなにハイテクな鍵をかけても、あるいは昔ながらのシンプルな錠前でさえも、私がドアノブをひねれば、はじめから鍵などかかっていなかったかのように開く。","en":"And it did more than unlock phones. No lock of any kind functioned before me. A door could be secured with the most advanced technology or with an old-fashioned, simple lock; if I turned the handle, it would open as though no one had locked it in the first place.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r184","rowIndex":184,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私はどんな場所にも自由に立ち入れるし、どんな箱でも自由に開けられるし、どんな厳重に隠されたデータでも閲覧・操作することが出来る。","en":"I could freely enter any place, open any container, and view or manipulate data however securely it had been hidden.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r185","rowIndex":185,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　二十代のころ、私はこの能力を使って、子供の時分からのあこがれである探偵業をこの街で営んでいた。","en":"In my twenties, I had used this ability to work as a private detective in the city—the profession I had dreamed of since childhood.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r186","rowIndex":186,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それなりに繁盛をしていたのだが、ある時警察のサーバーの中身を勝手に覗いてしまったのがよくなかった。私の能力はどんな鍵も開けることが出来るものの、侵入の痕跡を消してはくれない。","en":"Business was reasonably good, but then one day I made the mistake of taking an unauthorized look inside a police server. My ability could open any lock, but it did nothing to erase the traces of my intrusion.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r187","rowIndex":187,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　普段<tips=9>Y地区</tips>内での<tips=16>タイプA</tips>事件は、かなり重大なものでもほったらかしにするくせに、自分たちがターゲットになると警察の動きは驚くほど迅速で厳格だ。","en":"The police ordinarily neglected <tips=16>Type A</tips> crimes within <tips=9>Y District</tips>, however serious they became. Yet when they themselves were the target, they moved with astonishing speed and severity.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r188","rowIndex":188,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　外部に繋ぐ方が悪いと言っても勿論意味がない。私はたちまちこの<tips=48>堂島</tips>刑事に逮捕された。","en":"Naturally, it did me no good to argue that connecting the server to an outside network was their own fault. Detective <tips=48>Dojima</tips> arrested me almost at once.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r189","rowIndex":189,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=16>タイプA</tips>犯罪者は矯正施設に入るか、定期的に能力抑制剤を打ちながら外の世界で暮らすか、選ぶことが出来る。","en":"A <tips=16>Type A</tips> offender could choose either to enter a correctional facility or to live in the outside world while receiving regular injections of an ability suppressant.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r190","rowIndex":190,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そこで私は後者を選び、せっかくの生まれ持った能力を失い、<tips=77>特質変異</tips>だけが残るという、随分割に合わない状態のまま生きてゆくこととなった。","en":"I chose the latter, and so went on living with a decidedly raw deal: losing the ability I had been born with while retaining only my <tips=77>trait mutation</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r191","rowIndex":191,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　能力がなくとも探偵業は続けられるだろうが、能力がなければ以前のような常人にはこなせぬスペシャルな仕事が出来ない。身の入らぬまま開店休業し、やがて副業として書いていた原稿の仕事が本業となった。","en":"I might have continued the detective business without my ability, but I could no longer take on the special jobs no ordinary person could manage, as I once had. I kept the agency nominally open but lost all heart for it, until the writing I had begun as a sideline became my principal occupation.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r192","rowIndex":192,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　探偵の頃に<tips=9>Y地区</tips>の裏社会を渡り歩いた経験と人脈を活用し、この街の裏側で起きた出来事やそこで暮らす人々の姿などを、くだらないゴシップ雑誌に売り、それはネットなどで公開された。","en":"Drawing upon the experience and connections I had acquired moving through <tips=9>Y District’s</tips> underworld as a detective, I sold accounts of events behind the city’s public face and portraits of the people who lived there to trashy gossip magazines. Those pieces were published online and elsewhere.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r193","rowIndex":193,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　なかなか評判も良く、もう探偵としての意欲を失っていた私も、この世界でやっていけるのではないかと、その気になった。","en":"The work was rather well received, and with my enthusiasm for detective work already gone, I began to think I might be able to make a life in the writing world.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r194","rowIndex":194,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ノンフィクションの作品を一つものにして、なんとかその世界で身を立てようとしているのが現在の私の状況だ。","en":"Now I was trying to produce a work of nonfiction and somehow establish myself in that world.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r195","rowIndex":195,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そもそも探偵小説の主人公に憧れて探偵を志したのだから、文章やエンターテイメントといった世界にも興味がないわけではない。","en":"After all, I had wanted to become a detective because I admired the hero of a detective novel. It was not as though writing and entertainment held no interest for me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r196","rowIndex":196,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　が、今一つ本気になりきれないのはやはり探偵業への未練か。文筆の仕事を積極的に増やす気にもならず、少しでも気に入らない仕事は断り、かといって自ら望んで書き始めたはずのノンフィクションも進まない。","en":"And yet I could never quite give myself to it in earnest—perhaps because I still had not let go of detective work. I had no desire to seek out more writing jobs and turned down anything I disliked in the slightest; meanwhile, the nonfiction project I had supposedly begun because I wanted to write it was going nowhere.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r197","rowIndex":197,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私はその被害者のものだという携帯電話を少し操作してみた。","en":"I fiddled for a while with the phone that supposedly belonged to the victim.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r198","rowIndex":198,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　設定画面でセキュリティ設定を変更してから、ふと画像を呼び出すと、笑顔をカメラに向けている二人の若い女の顔が映る。","en":"After changing the security settings, I opened a photograph on a whim. Two young women were smiling into the camera.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r199","rowIndex":199,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　どちらかが被害者なのだろうか。","en":"Was one of them the victim?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r200","rowIndex":200,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　幸せそうな笑顔に居たたまれなくなって画像を閉じた。","en":"Unable to bear the happiness in their smiles, I closed the photograph.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r201","rowIndex":201,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「これで、いつでも誰でもなかを覗けるはずですよ」","en":"“Now anyone should be able to look inside it whenever they like.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r202","rowIndex":202,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私はそう言って、<tips=48>堂島</tips>に携帯電話を返す。","en":"I said this and returned the phone to <tips=48>Dojima</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r203","rowIndex":203,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「よくやってくれた。あとは本部の方で調べてくれるだろう」","en":"“Well done. Headquarters can take care of the rest.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r204","rowIndex":204,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=48>堂島</tips>は言うとビニール袋にくるんで懐に戻す。","en":"With that, <tips=48>Dojima</tips> wrapped it in the plastic bag again and tucked it back inside his coat.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r205","rowIndex":205,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「これで私の仕事は終わりですか？」","en":"“Is that my part done?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r206","rowIndex":206,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まあそうなるが……この後時間はあるか？」","en":"“I suppose it is... but do you have time after this?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r207","rowIndex":207,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……特に予定はないですが」","en":"“...Nothing in particular.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r208","rowIndex":208,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「これから現場に行くんだが、つき合わないか？」","en":"“I’m heading to the scene now. Care to join me?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r209","rowIndex":209,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「現場？　犯行現場に行くんですか？」","en":"“A scene? You’re going to the scene of the crime?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r210","rowIndex":210,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=48>堂島</tips>は頷きを返す。","en":"<tips=48>Dojima</tips> nodded in reply.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r211","rowIndex":211,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そんなことをしていいんですか？　規則違反でしょう」","en":"“Are you allowed to do that? Isn’t it against regulations?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r212","rowIndex":212,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「かまやしないさ。きみだって、文字を書くなんてことより、本当はこっちの方が好きなんだろう」","en":"“Never mind that. You would rather be doing this than writing, wouldn’t you?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r213","rowIndex":213,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「これから文章を本業に選ぼうとしている私としては、そうではないと言いたいところですが、やっぱりそうなんでしょうなあ」","en":"“As someone trying to make writing his profession, I’d like to say no—but I suppose I do.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r214","rowIndex":214,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は認めざるを得ず、頭をかく。","en":"I had to admit it and scratched my head.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r215","rowIndex":215,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「でも、当たり前でしょう？　あんたら警察に能力を消されるまでは、そっちの世界で一生やって行くつもりだったんですから」","en":"“But that’s only natural, isn’t it? Before you police took my ability from me, I’d meant to spend my entire life in that world.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r216","rowIndex":216,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それならば、能力を消されるような馬鹿な真似はすべきじゃなかった。……まあ、とにかく、興味があるなら来るがいい。私もね、職務とは言え、きみから楽しみを奪ったことを、多少は気にしているのさ」","en":"“Then you shouldn’t have done anything foolish enough to get it taken away. ...In any case, come if you’re interested. Duty or not, it has bothered me somewhat that I deprived you of something you enjoyed.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r217","rowIndex":217,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「へえ驚いた。旦那も人間らしいことを言うんですね」","en":"“Well, I’m amazed. So even you can say something human once in a while, sir.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r218","rowIndex":218,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうとも。こう見えても私はれっきとした人間なんだ。時々自分でも疑わしくなるがね」","en":"“That’s right. Believe it or not, I am a human being through and through—though sometimes even I have my doubts.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r219","rowIndex":219,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして私たちは店を出て、最も新しい犯行の行われた場所へ向かった。","en":"Then we left the bar and headed for the site of the most recent crime.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r220","rowIndex":220,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「しかし、旦那はいつも一人で行動しているんですね。警察というのは、大抵二人以上で捜査するものだと聞いていましたが」","en":"“Still, you always work alone, sir. I’d heard the police generally investigate in teams of at least two.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r221","rowIndex":221,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は少し早足で私の前を歩く<tips=48>堂島</tips>にそう話した。","en":"I called up to <tips=48>Dojima</tips>, who was walking a little way ahead of me at a brisk pace.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r222","rowIndex":222,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「私には普通の職員と同じルールは適用されない」","en":"“The same rules that apply to ordinary personnel do not apply to me.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"堂島","displayName":"Dojima","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r223","rowIndex":223,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=48>堂島</tips>は振り返りもせずに言う。彼の言葉はいつも簡潔だ。","en":"<tips=48>Dojima</tips> said it without looking back. He was always a man of few words.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r224","rowIndex":224,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「でも、特別捜査官だからって、一人で捜査しなきゃいけないって規則があるわけでもないでしょう？　聞き込みをするにしたって、旦那みたいなの一人じゃみんな驚いて話にならなそうですがね」","en":"“But being a special investigator doesn’t mean there’s a rule saying you have to work alone, does it? Even when you’re canvassing for witnesses, a fellow like you showing up by himself must scare everyone too badly to get a word out of them.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r225","rowIndex":225,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「場所がこの<tips=9>Y地区</tips>で、犯人は<tips=16>タイプＡ</tips>なんだ。ノーマルを連れていたって足手まといになるだけだよ。それに、私は一人が好きなんだよ」","en":"“The place is <tips=9>Y District</tips>, and the killer is a <tips=16>Type A</tips>. Bringing Normals with me would only get in the way. Besides, I prefer being alone.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"堂島","displayName":"Dojima","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r226","rowIndex":226,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ふうん。ま、わからなくはないですな」","en":"“Hmm. Well, I can’t say I don’t understand.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r227","rowIndex":227,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は頷いて、","en":"I nodded.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r228","rowIndex":228,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「一匹狼……ならぬ、一匹犬と言うわけですな」","en":"“A lone wolf—or rather, a lone dog.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r229","rowIndex":229,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=48>堂島</tips>の背中に向かってそうふざけてみたが、彼は返事をせずに黙殺する。","en":"I tried the joke on <tips=48>Dojima’s</tips> retreating back, but he ignored it without a word.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r230","rowIndex":230,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして私たちが辿り着いたのは、さきほど渡された携帯電話の持ち主が殺害された現場だった。","en":"The place we arrived at was the scene where the owner of the phone I had just handled had been murdered.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r231","rowIndex":231,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=57>滑走路通り</tips>からそう遠くない路地裏で、道の端にはゴミ捨て場があり、『<tips=70>シオクリーン</tips>』と企業名が書かれたシートが被せられている。","en":"It was a back alley not far from <tips=57>Runway Street</tips>. At one side of the road was a garbage collection point covered by a sheet bearing the company name <tips=70>SHIO CLEAN</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r232","rowIndex":232,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　被害者は、このゴミ捨て場で家庭ゴミにまざって発見されたのだと<tips=48>堂島</tips>は言う。","en":"<tips=48>Dojima</tips> told me that the victim had been found there among the household refuse.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r233","rowIndex":233,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「親に大事に育てられたろうに、最期はゴミと一緒に捨てられるとは」","en":"“Her parents must have cherished her, only for her to meet her end thrown out with the garbage...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r234","rowIndex":234,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>は大体室内に遺体を放置するのだが、今回は珍しくこの場所で見つかった」","en":"“<tips=20>Koschei</tips> generally leaves the remains indoors. Finding them in a place like this was unusual.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"堂島","displayName":"Dojima","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r235","rowIndex":235,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=48>堂島</tips>は私の感傷にはつき合わず、淡々と説明をする。","en":"Refusing to indulge my sentimentality, <tips=48>Dojima</tips> continued his explanation in the same matter-of-fact tone.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r236","rowIndex":236,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「しかし、捨て場は変わっても彼の癖は健在でね。切断された肉片は、いくつもの箱にきっちりとしまわれていた。箱は現場に捨てられていたアルミ製のものだ」","en":"“But though the dumping place had changed, his old habit was alive and well. The severed pieces of flesh had been packed neatly into several boxes—aluminum containers that had been discarded at the scene.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"堂島","displayName":"Dojima","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r237","rowIndex":237,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=48>堂島</tips>はその画像を私に見せる。","en":"<tips=48>Dojima</tips> showed me the image.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r238","rowIndex":238,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=9>Y地区</tips>でよく目にする菓子の箱に、赤黒い何かがみっしりとつめこまれているのが見て取れた。","en":"In a confectionery tin of a kind commonly seen in <tips=9>Y District</tips>, I could make out something dark red that had been crammed tightly inside.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r239","rowIndex":239,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「これで、同一犯の犯行だとわかったのさ。被害者は、電車で三十分ほど離れた町に暮らす大学生だ。特にこの街に知り合いなどがいるわけでもないだろうが、普段からショッピングのために訪れていたそうだから、今回もそうだろうね」","en":"“That was how we knew it was the same perpetrator. The victim was a university student who lived in a town about thirty minutes away by train. She probably knew no one in this city in particular, but apparently she came here to shop regularly, so that is most likely what brought her here this time as well.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"堂島","displayName":"Dojima","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r240","rowIndex":240,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「大学生ですか。最近は、外から来た人間がトラブルに巻き込まれますな」","en":"“A university student, huh? People from outside have been getting themselves mixed up in trouble around here lately.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r241","rowIndex":241,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「歌手だかなんだかが有名になってよく取り上げられているせいだろう。<tips=57>滑走路通り</tips>が洒落た街だと紹介されて、どういう場所か知らないで来る若者も多いらしい。若い刑事がそんなことを言っていたよ」","en":"“It must be because that singer or whatever became famous and is always in the news. <tips=57>Runway Street</tips> gets presented as a fashionable neighborhood, and apparently plenty of young people come here without knowing what kind of place it really is. That is what a young detective told me.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"堂島","displayName":"Dojima","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r242","rowIndex":242,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それでこんな事件に巻き込まれて……。実に、気の毒なものだ」","en":"“And then she gets caught up in a crime like this... A terrible shame.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r243","rowIndex":243,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は憤りを隠せなかった。","en":"I could not hide my outrage.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r244","rowIndex":244,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「旦那、私はねえ、こういう事件が一番許せないのですよ。普通に生きれば、これから先楽しいこともたくさん経験するだろうに。全て失っちまうんだ。……まったく、こういう殺しをするやつってのは、どんなつもりでこんな惨いことをしでかすんですかねえ？」","en":"“Sir, this is the kind of crime I can’t stand. If she’d simply gone on living, she would have had so many happy experiences ahead of her. Now she’s lost every one of them. ...Just what goes through someone’s head when they do something this cruel?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r245","rowIndex":245,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「殺人者の心理なんか、人それぞれだよ。快楽目的もあれば、怨恨もあるし、営利目的ということもある」","en":"“Every killer has different motives. Some act for pleasure, others from resentment, and still others for profit.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"堂島","displayName":"Dojima","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r246","rowIndex":246,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ふん、いずれにしたってくだらない話だ。人を殺すってのはね、最低なことですよ。人間なんかほっといたって全員死ぬってのに、どうしてわざわざ殺す必要があります？　それに、こんな、ただの大学生の女を……私はどうも、特に女を殺すってのが受け付けられなくてね。これは性分なんでしょうが。しかし、旦那だって、こんな未来もあって、何も知らないような女を殺すのは、特別腹が立つでしょう？」","en":"“Hmph. Whatever the reason, it’s all worthless nonsense. Killing another person is the lowest thing anyone can do. Leave people alone and every last one of them will die eventually, so why go out of your way to kill them? And an ordinary university student like this... I’ve simply never been able to stomach the killing of women in particular. Maybe that’s just how I’m made. But surely even you find it especially infuriating when someone kills an innocent young woman with her whole future ahead of her?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r247","rowIndex":247,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いや」","en":"“No.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"堂島","displayName":"Dojima","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r248","rowIndex":248,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「何も変わりませんか？」","en":"“It makes no difference to you?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r249","rowIndex":249,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ああ。私にとっては、男だろうが、女だろうが、他の何かだろうが、被害者はすべて同じ被害者だよ」","en":"“That’s right. To me, whether it is a man, a woman, or something else, a victim is a victim.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"堂島","displayName":"Dojima","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r250","rowIndex":250,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=48>堂島</tips>は私の興奮に呆れるように肩をすくめる。","en":"<tips=48>Dojima</tips> shrugged, apparently exasperated by my agitation.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r251","rowIndex":251,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まあいいですよ。とにかく、胸くそ悪い事件だってことはよくわかりました。……しかし、犯人はサイキックなんでしょう？　どんな能力かわからないと言いましたが、本当に何もわかっていないんですか？」","en":"“Fine. In any case, I understand perfectly well now that it’s a sickening case. ...But the killer is a psychic, isn’t he? You said you don’t know what his ability is, but do you really know nothing at all?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r252","rowIndex":252,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「わかっていない。ずっと追っていたロシアの警察は何か知っているようだが、いくらつついても情報は送ってくれない。まあ、サイキックの扱いはどの国でも難しいからな」","en":"“Nothing. The Russian police who pursued him for so long seem to know something, but no matter how much we prod them, they won’t send us any information. Dealing with psychics is difficult in every country, after all.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"堂島","displayName":"Dojima","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r253","rowIndex":253,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まったく能力のわからないサイキックを相手にするなんて、命がいくつあっても足りやしない」","en":"“No number of lives would be enough to take on a psychic whose ability is a complete unknown.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r254","rowIndex":254,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「私の仕事はいつもそんなもんさ」","en":"“That is what my work is always like.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"堂島","displayName":"Dojima","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r255","rowIndex":255,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「旦那の気持ちが初めてわかりましたよ。……そういえば、さっき、<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>のにおいに、何かおかしい点があるって言ってましたね。それはなんですか？」","en":"“Now I finally understand how you feel. ...Come to think of it, you said earlier that something about <tips=20>Koschei’s</tips> scent seemed wrong. What was it?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r256","rowIndex":256,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ああ、それか……」","en":"“Ah, that...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"堂島","displayName":"Dojima","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r257","rowIndex":257,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「聞かせてください」","en":"“Tell me.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r258","rowIndex":258,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……私の嗅いだにおいは、二十代か、三十代前半の青年男性のものだ。しかし、犯人が本当にコシチェイならばそんな筈はないんだ。<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>は、記録上ではもう二十年も犯罪を犯し続けている。そして最初の犯罪のとき、既に青年だったんだ」","en":"“...The scent I caught belonged to a young man in his twenties or early thirties. But if the perpetrator truly is <tips=20>Koschei</tips>, that should be impossible. According to the records, Koschei has been committing crimes for twenty years—and at the time of his first crime, he was already a young man.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"堂島","displayName":"Dojima","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r259","rowIndex":259,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=48>堂島</tips>は首をひねる。","en":"<tips=48>Dojima</tips> tilted his head in puzzlement.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r260","rowIndex":260,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「じゃあやっぱり、<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>の犯行を真似た模倣犯では？」","en":"“Then doesn’t that mean it really is a copycat imitating <tips=20>Koschei’s</tips> crimes?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r261","rowIndex":261,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「その可能性はある。が、私の感覚が間違っているのかもしれん。日の経ったにおいだから、はっきりと嗅ぎ取れたわけじゃないんだよ。どうもぼやけている。例えばいまここで本人とすれ違っても、気がつかないかもしれん」","en":"“Possibly. But my senses may have been wrong. The scent was days old, so I couldn’t pick it up clearly. It was blurred somehow. Even if the man himself walked past me here and now, I might not notice him.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"堂島","displayName":"Dojima","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r262","rowIndex":262,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「頼りないですな」","en":"“Not much use, are you?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r263","rowIndex":263,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まったくだ。出来たてほやほやの新しい殺人現場に出くわせれば、すぐにわかるんだがね。しかし、警察官としてはそれを望むわけにもいかない」","en":"“Not at all. If I happened upon a brand-new murder scene while it was still perfectly fresh, I would know at once. But as a police officer, I can hardly wish for one.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"堂島","displayName":"Dojima","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r264","rowIndex":264,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「警察官じゃなくて、人間として望むようなことじゃないですぜ。……まあ、そこに気づけたのは旦那にしては上出来だ。旦那はね、これ以上殺人を起こさせないよう、なんとか、その<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>ってやつを逮捕しなきゃいかんのですよ」","en":"“Forget being a police officer—that isn’t something you should wish for as a human being. ...Still, for you, realizing that much is pretty good. What you need to do is find some way to arrest this <tips=20>Koschei</tips> before he can murder anyone else.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r265","rowIndex":265,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうしたいものだがな。……それに、においの件に関してはもう一つ気になることが……これは、もしかしたら気のせいかもしれないんだが」","en":"“I would like to. ...There is one other thing about the scent that bothers me... though it may only be my imagination.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"堂島","displayName":"Dojima","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r266","rowIndex":266,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なんです？」","en":"“What is it?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r267","rowIndex":267,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いや、馬鹿げた話だ。きっと私の考え過ぎだろう……」","en":"“No, it’s ridiculous. I’m sure I’m simply overthinking it...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"堂島","displayName":"Dojima","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r268","rowIndex":268,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=48>堂島</tips>は彼にしては珍しく歯切れが悪かった。","en":"For <tips=48>Dojima</tips>, he was uncharacteristically reluctant to speak plainly.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r269","rowIndex":269,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まあいいです。においの他には何か見つからなかったんですか？」","en":"“All right. Did you find anything besides the scent?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r270","rowIndex":270,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「物証は何も残していない。その点に関しては手慣れている」","en":"“He left no physical evidence. In that respect, he is clearly practiced.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"堂島","displayName":"Dojima","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r271","rowIndex":271,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それなら、ノーマルを毛嫌いせずに、お仲間と一緒に警察お得意の人海戦術でも使ったらどうです？」","en":"“Then why not stop treating Normals like the plague, get together with your colleagues, and try that great police specialty of throwing manpower at the problem?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r272","rowIndex":272,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「捜査本部の連中も、出来ることはやっているようだがね。きみもよく知っているとおり、この街の住民ほど警察に非協力的なものはない。ここで犯人を見つけ出すためには、もっと特別なやり方と能力が必要なんだよ。……私はいつもそうやって捕まえて来たんだが、今回はどうも自信がない」","en":"“The people on the task force seem to be doing what they can. But as you know very well, no one is less willing to cooperate with the police than the residents of this city. Finding a perpetrator here requires more unusual methods and abilities. ...That is how I have always caught them before, but this time I am not so confident.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"堂島","displayName":"Dojima","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r273","rowIndex":273,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=48>堂島</tips>は肩をすくめる。","en":"<tips=48>Dojima</tips> shrugged.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r274","rowIndex":274,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なんだかえらく消沈してますな。そろそろヤキが回ったんじゃないですか？」","en":"“You’re awfully down in the dumps. Maybe age is finally catching up with you?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r275","rowIndex":275,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうかもしれん」","en":"“Perhaps.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"堂島","displayName":"Dojima","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r276","rowIndex":276,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　えらく素直に認めたもので、拍子抜けしてしまう。","en":"He admitted it so readily that it took the wind out of my sails.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r277","rowIndex":277,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それでなんだが、<tips=50>路地</tips>君。こうして被害者に共感して憤慨する正義心の強いきみに、携帯電話のロック解除の他に、もう一つお願いがあるのだが」","en":"“Speaking of which, <tips=50>Roji</tips>—since you are a man of such strong moral conviction, so moved by sympathy for the victim and outrage on her behalf, I have one more favor to ask of you besides unlocking the phone.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"堂島","displayName":"Dojima","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r278","rowIndex":278,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そんな言い方をされると、嫌な予感しかしませんな」","en":"“When you put it like that, I can only assume something bad is coming.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r279","rowIndex":279,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうでもないはずさ」","en":"“I don’t think it will be so bad.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"堂島","displayName":"Dojima","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r280","rowIndex":280,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どうだか」","en":"“We’ll see about that.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r281","rowIndex":281,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まあ聞きたまえ」","en":"“Hear me out.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"堂島","displayName":"Dojima","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r282","rowIndex":282,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=48>堂島</tips>は咳払いを一つして、","en":"<tips=48>Dojima</tips> cleared his throat.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r283","rowIndex":283,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「携帯のロック解除なんかより、もっと興味深く、事件に踏み込んだ協力をして貰いたい」","en":"“I want your help with something more interesting than unlocking a phone—something that will take you deeper into the case.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"堂島","displayName":"Dojima","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r284","rowIndex":284,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どういうことです？」","en":"“What do you mean?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r285","rowIndex":285,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「きみも独自でこの事件を捜査するんだ。探偵としての経験と、この街の住人としての知識を使って、<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>について調べ上げて欲しい。私も可能な限り警察の情報を提供する。そして、捜査に協力している間は中和剤を渡してやるから、能力も自由に使える。これでどうだ？」","en":"“I want you to conduct an investigation of your own. Use your experience as a detective and your knowledge as a resident of this city to find out everything you can about <tips=20>Koschei</tips>. I will share police information wherever possible. And for as long as you are helping with the investigation, I will give you neutralizer so that you can use your ability freely. How does that sound?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"堂島","displayName":"Dojima","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r286","rowIndex":286,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「報酬の話がないようですが？」","en":"“I don’t seem to have heard anything about payment.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r287","rowIndex":287,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「さっき店でしただろう」","en":"“We settled that back at the bar, didn’t we?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"堂島","displayName":"Dojima","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r288","rowIndex":288,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あれは、能力を一回使うことへの報酬でしょう。本格的に調査するとなれば、別に頂かなくては」","en":"“That was payment for using my ability once. A full-scale investigation will cost you extra.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r289","rowIndex":289,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あれ以上は出せんな」","en":"“I can’t pay more than that.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"堂島","displayName":"Dojima","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r290","rowIndex":290,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「話にならない」","en":"“That isn’t even worth discussing.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r291","rowIndex":291,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「さすがにきみのような人間に捜査そのものをやらせるとなると、上を説得出来ないんだよ。なあ、きみもさっき、この犯人を許せないと言っていたじゃないか。それに、こういった事件は好きだろう？」","en":"“My superiors would never approve of letting someone like you conduct the investigation outright. Come now—you said yourself just a moment ago that you couldn’t forgive the perpetrator. Besides, you enjoy cases like this, don’t you?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"堂島","displayName":"Dojima","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r292","rowIndex":292,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ちょっと待ってくださいよ。捜査をするとなれば、私だってその間仕事が出来なくなるんだ。報酬がなければ受けられません」","en":"“Hold on. If I’m conducting an investigation, I can’t do my own work in the meantime. I can’t take the job without being paid.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r293","rowIndex":293,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「手伝ってくれれば、私に恩を売れるぞ。これはきみにとって相当メリットのある話だ。私の意見や報告は、きみの今後の処遇に重大な影響を与えるのだからな。逆に言うと、悪く報告することも出来るというわけだ」","en":"“If you help me, you’ll put me in your debt. That is a considerable advantage for you. My opinion and my reports will have a great deal of influence on what happens to you from here on out. Put another way, I can submit an unfavorable report as well.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"堂島","displayName":"Dojima","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r294","rowIndex":294,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まったく、なんていう人だ！」","en":"“Honestly, what kind of man are you?!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r295","rowIndex":295,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は声を抑えることが出来なかった。","en":"I could not keep my voice down.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r296","rowIndex":296,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼の言っていることは、ほとんど脅迫と変わらない。","en":"What he was saying amounted to little more than a threat.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r297","rowIndex":297,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どうしてもいやか？」","en":"“Is it entirely out of the question?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"堂島","displayName":"Dojima","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r298","rowIndex":298,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いやです」","en":"“Entirely.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r299","rowIndex":299,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「わかった。じゃあ、もしきみの捜査が<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>の逮捕を決定的なものにしたら、きみの能力を永久に解放するよう上にかけあってやってもいい」","en":"“Very well. Then, if your investigation proves decisive in the arrest of <tips=20>Koschei</tips>, I could petition my superiors to have your ability released permanently.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"堂島","displayName":"Dojima","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r300","rowIndex":300,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「出来もしないことを」","en":"“As if you could.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r301","rowIndex":301,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「信じないのか？」","en":"“You don’t believe me?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"堂島","displayName":"Dojima","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r302","rowIndex":302,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「当然です」","en":"“Of course not.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r303","rowIndex":303,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「もし上に拒否されても、私が一生中和剤をわけてやる。きみにとっては願ってもない話だろう？」","en":"“Even if my superiors refuse, I’ll keep supplying you with neutralizer for the rest of your life. You couldn’t wish for a better offer, could you?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"堂島","displayName":"Dojima","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r304","rowIndex":304,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「とても信用出来ませんな。旦那はそんなふうに私を信用する人間ではないはずだ」","en":"“I don’t believe a word of it. You’re not the sort of man who would put that much trust in me, sir.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r305","rowIndex":305,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私が真顔で言うと、<tips=48>堂島</tips>は肩をすくめ、","en":"When I said this with a perfectly straight face, <tips=48>Dojima</tips> shrugged.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r306","rowIndex":306,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「とにかく、きみには期待しているということだ。今日は用事があるのでここで失礼させて貰うが、知りたいことや、捜査に進捗があったらいつでも連絡をしてくれ」","en":"“In any case, the point is that I have high expectations of you. I have business to attend to today, so I must be going. Contact me whenever there is anything you want to know or you make any progress in the investigation.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"堂島","displayName":"Dojima","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r307","rowIndex":307,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いやだ。私はやりません」","en":"“No. I’m not doing it.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r308","rowIndex":308,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「期待してるぞ」","en":"“I’m counting on you.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"堂島","displayName":"Dojima","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E1:r309","rowIndex":309,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=48>堂島</tips>は私の拒否を全く無視して、その場を立ち去った。","en":"<tips=48>Dojima</tips> ignored my refusal completely and walked away.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}}]},{"position":11,"code":"E2","unitId":"E2","rows":[{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r1","rowIndex":1,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　地図を見れば<tips=9>Y地区</tips>の西側に「門後」という地名を見つけることが出来るだろう。","en":"Looking at a map, you will find a place called Kadoushiro on the western side of <tips=9>Y District</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r2","rowIndex":2,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　七丁目まであって、<tips=57>滑走路通り</tips>の一部と、<tips=59>暗闇通り</tips>の大半がその地名に含まれている。","en":"It is divided into seven chome, encompassing part of <tips=57>Runway Street</tips> and most of <tips=59>Darkness Street</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r3","rowIndex":3,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　文字からすると、かつてこの地には寺院か神社があったのだと思うが、今は何の痕跡もなく名だけが残る。","en":"Judging by the characters, I think a temple or shrine once stood here, but now only the name remains, with no trace of it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r4","rowIndex":4,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=59>暗闇通り</tips>が含まれていることからもわかるとおり、現在の門後は著しく治安の悪い、<tips=9>Y地区</tips>でも有数のディープなスポットとなっている。","en":"As the presence of <tips=59>Darkness Street</tips> might suggest, present-day Kadoushiro was exceptionally dangerous, one of the seediest corners even in <tips=9>Y District</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r5","rowIndex":5,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　この門後三丁目、というのが私が暮らすアパートの住所であり、ご想像通り酷い界隈だ。","en":"Kadoushiro 3-chome was the address of my apartment and, as you may imagine, it was an appalling neighborhood.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r6","rowIndex":6,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　道ばたにはゴミがあふれ、いつも異臭が漂っている。","en":"Garbage overflowed along the roadside, and a foul odor always hung in the air.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r7","rowIndex":7,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　煙草が高くて買えない子供たちが集まって、大麻を回して一口ずつ吸っている。栽培が簡単な大麻は多くの貧民の家庭で栽培されており、元締めの家に集まって紙で巻く作業を行う。","en":"Children who cannot afford expensive tobacco gather and pass marijuana around, taking one puff each. Cannabis is easy to cultivate, so many poor households grow it; the growers gather at the local boss’s house to roll it in paper.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r8","rowIndex":8,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　子供たちが集まって遊んでいると、よく大人が声をかけて、この作業を手伝わせる。その駄賃は何本かの出来上がった紙巻き大麻で支払われるため、このあたりの貧しい子供にとって、大麻はゲームなどよりずっと身近な娯楽だった。","en":"When children gathered to play, adults would often call them over and put them to work helping with the rolling. They were paid a few finished joints for their labor, which made marijuana a far more readily available pastime than video games for the poor children of the neighborhood.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r9","rowIndex":9,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　時々板に毛皮を貼りつけて干しているのを見かけるが、あれはこの辺りを通りかかった野良猫の皮で、肉は夕食の一品となっている。","en":"From time to time, I saw fur stretched over boards to dry. It came from stray cats that had wandered through the neighborhood; their meat ended up as one of the dishes for dinner.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r10","rowIndex":10,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　街灯もろくに交換されておらずに消えたままで、かわりに親切な誰かがテープでLEDランプを街灯の支柱に貼り付け、それが夜になると妖しい光を路上に落としている。極めて安価なものだが時々盗まれる。","en":"The streetlights, too, go unreplaced and remain dark. In their place, some kind soul has taped LED lamps to the poles, and at night they cast an eerie light onto the street. They are extremely cheap, but are sometimes stolen.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r11","rowIndex":11,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　一歩路地を出ると<tips=59>暗闇通り</tips>で、街娼が立ち並び、道行く男に見境なく声をかける。道の両脇に並んだボロアパートはそのほとんどが住宅にみせかけた売春宿であった。","en":"One step out of the alley brought you onto <tips=59>Darkness Street</tips>, where prostitutes lined the road and called out indiscriminately to every man who passed. Nearly all the dilapidated apartment buildings on either side were brothels disguised as residences.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r12","rowIndex":12,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=59>暗闇通り</tips>と言うと、いくつもの風俗店を経営する<tips=33>壬生屋</tips>一族の名前がまず挙がるだろうが、この猥雑な通りではむしろ<tips=33>壬生屋</tips>グループの店舗はビジネスとしては非常に洗練された経営形態をとっており、多くはこの街娼やボロアパートに代表されるような原始的なやり方で性を売り買いしている。","en":"The name most readily associated with <tips=59>Darkness Street</tips> was probably the <tips=33>Mibuya</tips> family, which ran numerous establishments in the sex trade. Amid the street’s tawdry squalor, however, the <tips=33>Mibuya</tips> Group’s establishments were, if anything, exceptionally sophisticated business operations. Most sex here was bought and sold by primitive means, typified by its streetwalkers and crumbling apartments.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r13","rowIndex":13,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　この通りではあらゆる性が売り買いされているため、立っているのは女だけではなく、少年もいる。彼らは同性愛者を相手にすることになる。","en":"Every kind of sexual service was bought and sold here, so boys stood on the street as well as women. Their customers were gay men.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r14","rowIndex":14,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=33>壬生屋</tips>グループ二代目の若き経営者<tips=33>壬生屋タカシ</tips>がゲイであることは、本人が隠しているにもかかわらず、この<tips=59>暗闇通り</tips>では半ば公然の秘密であった。","en":"It was something of an open secret on <tips=59>Darkness Street</tips> that <tips=33>Takashi Mibuya</tips>, the young second-generation head of the <tips=33>Mibuya</tips> Group, was gay, despite his efforts to hide it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r15","rowIndex":15,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しかしだからといって彼はこうした少年たちを雇って同性愛者向けのサービスを行おうとはしない。個人的な趣味とビジネスは切り分けるという彼なりの考えなのだろうか、他に何かあるのだろうか。","en":"Even so, he made no attempt to employ these boys and offer services to gay customers. Perhaps he believed in separating personal taste from business, or perhaps there was some other reason.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r16","rowIndex":16,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　噂好きのこの通りの連中はあれこれと憶測をするが、決定的な結論は出ない。","en":"The street's habitual gossips speculated endlessly without arriving at a definitive answer.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r17","rowIndex":17,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私はこの町に住んでもう五年になり、このような街角に立つ連中とも見知ったものであった。","en":"I had lived in the neighborhood for five years, and by then the people who stood on corners like these had all become familiar faces.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r18","rowIndex":18,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　古い女たちはみな非常に明るく、暗い顔をして俯いているのは大体新しくこの商売についた女と決まっている。彼女たちは道を行く私に気安く挨拶の言葉を掛け、私はそれに小さく頷きを返しながら歩いた。","en":"The veterans were all remarkably cheerful; the ones who wore gloomy expressions and kept their heads down were almost invariably new to the trade. They greeted me familiarly as I passed, and I walked on, answering each with a small nod.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r19","rowIndex":19,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　少年たちは昼の間は街角に集まってゲーム機などで遊び、聞いてもいないのに私にゲームの内容を説明してくる。そういうとき、彼らの目はきらきらと輝いていて、その表情は世界のどの少年にも共通したものだろうと感じさせる。","en":"During the day, the boys gathered at street corners to play on game consoles and the like. Without being asked, they would explain the games to me. At such times, their eyes shone, and their faces looked like those of boys anywhere in the world.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r20","rowIndex":20,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私はこの街でずっと生きて来た。","en":"I have lived in this city all my life.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r21","rowIndex":21,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　窓を開けて酒など飲んでいると、よく子供のむずがって泣く声や、男の怒鳴る声が、部屋のなかにまで飛び込んでくる。子供はこの辺りに暮らす娼婦の子供で、男は誰かの亭主だろうか。","en":"When I sat drinking with the window open, the fretful cries of a child or the angry shouts of a man would often come flying straight into my room. The child would belong to one of the prostitutes who lived nearby; the man was perhaps somebody’s husband.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r22","rowIndex":22,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　尋常でない激しい言葉や、ものの壊れる音などが聞こえることもある。","en":"At times, I heard violently abusive shouting or the sounds of objects breaking.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r23","rowIndex":23,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　はじめは何か事件が起きたかと身を固くしたものだが、今となっては、また裏のマー坊が泣いてやがるなとか、今日のチェさんの夫婦げんかは熱帯魚の水槽までひっくり返したのかなどと、音だけでそれぞれの家庭の風景が脳裏に浮かび、それをつまみに一人ニヤニヤしながら酒を飲むような始末だ。","en":"At first, such noises had made me tense at the thought that something might have happened. By now, sound alone summoned the scene inside each home: Little Ma was bawling out back again, or the Ches’ marital row had gone so far today that they had overturned even the tropical-fish tank. I had reached the point of drinking alone with a grin, treating these domestic dramas as snacks to go with my liquor.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r24","rowIndex":24,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　また、昼の決まった時間には、地の底から響いてくるような低い男の叫び声がする。これは三件隣のタカハシさんのご主人の叫び声だ。重度の<tips=17>タイプB</tips>症状に悩まされるタカハシさんは、病院で治療を受けることも出来ない。会話もままならず、排便や食事も誰かの介助がないと行えない。<tips=17>タイプB</tips>のなれの果て、いわゆる人格荒廃という状態である。","en":"At the same time each afternoon came the low cry of a man, as though sounding from the bottom of the earth. It belonged to Mrs. Takahashi’s husband, three doors down. Afflicted with severe <tips=17>Type B</tips> symptoms, he could not receive treatment at a hospital. He could barely manage a conversation, and needed someone’s help even to defecate or eat. He represented the end stage of <tips=17>Type B</tips>—the condition known as personality deterioration.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r25","rowIndex":25,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　普段は置物のように無表情でじっとしているが、突発的に妻や息子に暴力を振るうため、一日中鎖で繋がれている。時々繋いだものが壊れて、近所のものが集まって捕まえたりしている。食事は一日一回昼に与えることになっており、正気をうしなった彼もその習慣だけは心得ていて、昼前の決まった時間に時報のように催促のうなり声をあげるのだ。","en":"Ordinarily he sat motionless and expressionless, like an inanimate object, but because he sometimes attacked his wife and son without warning, they kept him chained all day. Now and then whatever he was chained to would break, and the neighbors had to gather and restrain him. He was fed once a day, at noon. Though he had lost his mind, that one routine remained with him, and at the same time before noon each day he gave a demanding growl as punctual as a time signal.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r26","rowIndex":26,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　いや実際、この近所ではこのうなり声を合図に食事の準備を始める家庭もあるという話である。「こんな主人でも人の役に立つことがあるのねえ」と、タカハシ夫人はそれを聞いて笑っていた。","en":"Indeed, I heard that some households in the neighborhood take the growl as their cue to begin preparing lunch. “So even a husband like mine can be useful to people,” Mrs. Takahashi said with a laugh.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r27","rowIndex":27,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そんな街である。","en":"Such was the neighborhood.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r28","rowIndex":28,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「すみれ荘」という、いかにもレトロなネーミングのアパートが、私の住まいであった。こういった純和風の建物名はこの街では珍しい。","en":"My home was an apartment building with the quintessentially retro name Sumire Apartments. A purely Japanese building name of that sort was rare in this city.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r29","rowIndex":29,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「おかえりなさい」","en":"“Welcome home.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ミユキ","displayName":"Miyuki","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r30","rowIndex":30,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　無言で部屋に足を踏み入れた私を、<tips=53>ミユキ</tips>が笑顔で出迎える。","en":"<tips=53>Miyuki</tips> greeted me with a smile as I entered the room without a word.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r31","rowIndex":31,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ビールでいい？　あら、お酒臭い。もう飲んできたのね」","en":"“Is beer all right? Oh, you smell like alcohol. You’ve already been out drinking.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ミユキ","displayName":"Miyuki","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r32","rowIndex":32,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=53>ミユキ</tips>は顔を顰めて、一旦テーブルの上に置いたビール瓶を引っ込めようとする。私はそれを奪うようにつかみ取ると、栓を抜き、グラスに注いだ。","en":"<tips=53>Miyuki</tips> frowned and tried to withdraw the beer bottle she had just set on the table. I snatched it up first, pulled off the cap, and poured it into a glass.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r33","rowIndex":33,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「今日は仕事に行かないのか？」","en":"“Aren’t you working today?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r34","rowIndex":34,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「うん、今日は休み。そう言えば、<tips=48>堂島</tips>さんが<tips=50>邦昭さん</tips>のこと探してたけど、会えた？」","en":"“No, I have the day off. Oh, that reminds me—Mr. <tips=48>Dojima</tips> was looking for you. Did he find you, <tips=50>Kuniaki</tips>?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ミユキ","displayName":"Miyuki","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r35","rowIndex":35,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「おかげさまでカルロッタの店で捕まったよ。それで、面倒な用事を押しつけられた」","en":"“Thanks to you, he caught me at Carlotta’s bar and foisted a troublesome errand on me.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r36","rowIndex":36,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ああ、だからそんなに不機嫌そうなのね。一体どんな用件だったのかしら」","en":"“Ah, so that’s why you look so grumpy. What on earth did he want?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ミユキ","displayName":"Miyuki","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r37","rowIndex":37,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そう言って興味津々な態度をあらわにして向かいの席に腰掛ける<tips=53>ミユキ</tips>に、私はビールを飲みながら、いま<tips=48>堂島</tips>と会って話したことを説明した。","en":"Her curiosity plain on her face, <tips=53>Miyuki</tips> sat down opposite me. Over my beer, I explained what <tips=48>Dojima</tips> and I had just discussed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r38","rowIndex":38,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　思い出してみても、なんともすっきりしない話だ。それほど長くもない説明が終わる頃には、テーブルの上にビール瓶が三本並んでいた。","en":"Even in retrospect, the whole business left me feeling vaguely dissatisfied. It was not a particularly long explanation, yet by the time I finished, three beer bottles stood lined up on the table.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r39","rowIndex":39,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まったく、人をなんだと思ってやがるんだ。あの犬のおまわりさんは」","en":"“Honestly, what the hell does that dog of a cop take me for?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r40","rowIndex":40,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「でも、話だけ聞いてると、<tips=50>邦昭さん</tips>が喜びそうな話だけど……。それに、もしかしたらまた超能力を使えるようにしてくれるかもしれないんでしょ？」","en":"“But from what you’ve told me, it sounds like exactly the sort of thing you would enjoy, <tips=50>Kuniaki</tips>... And he might even get your ability working again, mightn’t he?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ミユキ","displayName":"Miyuki","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r41","rowIndex":41,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=53>ミユキ</tips>は首をかしげる。","en":"<tips=53>Miyuki</tips> tilted her head.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r42","rowIndex":42,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ありえないね。調べたことがあるんだが、一度この処置がとられた<tips=16>タイプA</tips>が、再び能力を与えられた例はひとつもない。<tips=16>タイプA</tips>の能力ってのは、それだけ危険視されてるんだよ」","en":"“Not a chance. I looked into it once. There has never been a single case of a <tips=16>Type A</tips> having their ability restored after undergoing that procedure. That’s how dangerous <tips=16>Type A</tips> abilities are considered.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r43","rowIndex":43,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「でも、<tips=48>堂島</tips>さんなら……」","en":"“But if it’s Mr. <tips=48>Dojima</tips>...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ミユキ","displayName":"Miyuki","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r44","rowIndex":44,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「無理だね。それにな、報酬の問題だけじゃない。もう一つ、非常に重要な問題がある。何かわかるか？」","en":"“No chance. And payment isn’t the only problem. There’s another extremely important issue. Can you guess what it is?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r45","rowIndex":45,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=53>ミユキ</tips>は首を横にふる。","en":"<tips=53>Miyuki</tips> shook her head.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r46","rowIndex":46,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「おれはあの旦那の言い方が気に食わないのさ。あれは許せないな。お前はくだらないことで腹を立ててると思うだろうがね、この、メンツってのは男にとっては死活問題なんだよ。人にものを頼むにはそれ相応のやり方ってのがある」","en":"“I don’t like the way that man spoke to me. I can’t let that pass. You probably think I’m getting worked up over nothing, but a man’s pride is a matter of life and death. There’s a proper way to ask someone for something.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r47","rowIndex":47,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「知ってるわ。あたしのママもよく言ってたもの。男の人はプライドだけで生きてるんだって」","en":"“I know. My mama used to say it all the time: men live on pride alone.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ミユキ","displayName":"Miyuki","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r48","rowIndex":48,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=53>ミユキ</tips>は頭をこくこくと上下して何度も頷いている。","en":"<tips=53>Miyuki</tips> nodded emphatically again and again.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r49","rowIndex":49,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　大げさな納得の仕草であるが、実際仕草に相応しいだけの理解を本当に出来てるのかどうか甚だ怪しい。私は無視して言葉を続け、とにかく言いたいことだけ言うことにした。","en":"The gesture made an extravagant show of understanding, though whether she really understood enough to justify it was highly doubtful. I ignored her and went on, determined simply to say my piece.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r50","rowIndex":50,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あんな脅迫めいた言い方じゃあ、誰だって気持ちよく協力することなんか出来ない。<tips=48>堂島</tips>の旦那はその辺りの配慮ってものがないんだ。まったくデリカシーがない。だから誰とも組めずにいつも一人でいるのさ。人望がないんだな」","en":"“Nobody could feel good about cooperating when asked in such a threatening way. <tips=48>Dojima</tips> has no consideration for people—no tact at all. That is why he can never work with anyone and is always on his own. He has no one’s respect.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r51","rowIndex":51,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そう、あたしは<tips=48>堂島</tips>さんて素敵だと思うけど」","en":"“Really? I think Mr. <tips=48>Dojima</tips> is wonderful.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ミユキ","displayName":"Miyuki","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r52","rowIndex":52,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そりゃお前が動物好きだからだよ」","en":"“That’s only because you’re fond of animals.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r53","rowIndex":53,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まあ、ひどい」","en":"“Oh, that’s mean.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ミユキ","displayName":"Miyuki","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r54","rowIndex":54,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あれは駄目だよ。とにかく、こんな道楽みたいなことをやっている暇はないのさ。おれは忙しいんだ」","en":"“He’s hopeless. Anyway, I don’t have time to fool around with something like this. I’m busy.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r55","rowIndex":55,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうだよね。<tips=50>邦昭さん</tips>は、傑作を書いて立派な作家先生になるんだもんね」","en":"“That’s right. You’re going to write a masterpiece and become a great author, <tips=50>Kuniaki</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ミユキ","displayName":"Miyuki","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r56","rowIndex":56,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　他の誰かが言えば皮肉にしかならないが、<tips=53>ミユキ</tips>は心底そう信じてくれているのだろう。およそ、私の言葉を疑うということがない女なのだ。","en":"From anyone else, the remark could only have been sarcastic, but <tips=53>Miyuki</tips> doubtless believed it with all her heart. She was the kind of woman who never seemed to doubt a word I said.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r57","rowIndex":57,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その無邪気さに、ちくりと胸が痛む。","en":"That innocence sent a small, sharp pain through my chest.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r58","rowIndex":58,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「でも、そんな風に言うけど<tips=50>邦昭さん</tips>は、本当は<tips=48>堂島</tips>さんが好きなんだと思うな」","en":"“You say all that, but I think you really do like Mr. <tips=48>Dojima</tips>, <tips=50>Kuniaki</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ミユキ","displayName":"Miyuki","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r59","rowIndex":59,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なぜそう思う」","en":"“What makes you think so?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r60","rowIndex":60,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「だって、<tips=50>邦昭さん</tips>は、本当に嫌いな人は話題に出さないでしょう？　あなたは、嫌いな人のことで自分の時間を使うのがいやだってタイプだもの。こんな風に愚痴るってことは、<tips=48>堂島</tips>さんのことが、それだけ労力を支払う価値がある相手だって認めてるんだよね？」","en":"“Because you never talk about people you truly hate, do you, <tips=50>Kuniaki</tips>? You’re the sort of person who hates wasting time on someone you dislike. If you’re willing to complain about Mr. <tips=48>Dojima</tips> like this, that means you think he’s worth the effort, doesn’t it?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ミユキ","displayName":"Miyuki","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r61","rowIndex":61,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=53>ミユキ</tips>は時々思わぬ推察力を発揮する。","en":"At times, <tips=53>Miyuki</tips> showed an unexpected gift for reading a situation.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r62","rowIndex":62,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私が反論出来ずに、黙ったまま新しいビールの栓を抜いていると、","en":"Unable to answer, I opened another beer in silence.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r63","rowIndex":63,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「やったらいいと思うよ。だって、それだって、<tips=50>邦昭さん</tips>の原稿に役立つでしょう？」","en":"“I think you should do it. After all, it would help with your manuscript too, <tips=50>Kuniaki</tips>, wouldn’t it?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ミユキ","displayName":"Miyuki","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r64","rowIndex":64,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　こともあろうに、<tips=48>堂島</tips>への協力を勧めて来る。","en":"Of all things, she was urging me to help <tips=48>Dojima</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r65","rowIndex":65,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まあネタの一つにはなるかもしれないがね。だが、もうすぐそれより重大な事件が起こる」","en":"“It might give me something to write about. But something much more important is about to happen.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r66","rowIndex":66,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「何？」","en":"“What?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ミユキ","displayName":"Miyuki","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r67","rowIndex":67,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>が死ぬんだ」","en":"“<tips=3>Chris Tse</tips> is going to die.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r68","rowIndex":68,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「えっ、<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>さんって……」","en":"“What? <tips=3>Chris Tse</tips>...?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ミユキ","displayName":"Miyuki","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r69","rowIndex":69,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　人死にと聞いて驚いてみたものの、その人物が誰だか、<tips=53>ミユキ</tips>は急には思い出せないようだ。","en":"The mention of a death had startled her, but <tips=53>Miyuki</tips> did not seem able to remember immediately who he was.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r70","rowIndex":70,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>のボスだよ。知ってるだろう？」","en":"“The boss of <tips=7>YS</tips>. You know him, don’t you?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r71","rowIndex":71,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ああ、ああ、うん、知ってる。目が三つあるひとでしょ？」","en":"“Oh, right. Yes, I know. The man with three eyes, right?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ミユキ","displayName":"Miyuki","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r72","rowIndex":72,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そう。前からサイキック病だったろう？　ほら、<tips=16>タイプA</tips>の病気さ。実際にはノーマルにも患者がいるらしいがね。身体がどんどん崩れて腐ってゆくんだ。生きながらにして。発症したらもう助からない」","en":"“That’s right. He’s had psychic disease for a while, remember? The <tips=16>Type A</tips> disease. Apparently Normals can get it too. The body gradually falls apart and rots away while the person is still alive. Once it starts, there’s no saving them.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r73","rowIndex":73,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「こわい……。<tips=50>邦昭さん</tips>は、大丈夫よね？」","en":"“That’s scary... You’re going to be all right, aren’t you, <tips=50>Kuniaki</tips>?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ミユキ","displayName":"Miyuki","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r74","rowIndex":74,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうそうかかるもんじゃない。交通事故で死ぬよりも低い確率だよ。<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>は運が悪かったんだ。これまでの行いのせいかもしれないな。……とにかく、<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>が死ねば、<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>は今まで通りってわけにはいかない。もともと、素性の違うギャング組織を<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>が一人でまとめたような組織だからな。必ず何か起こるだろう。おれは、これからそれを取材しなきゃいけないんだよ」","en":"“It’s not something people get often. You’re less likely to get it than to die in a traffic accident. <tips=3>Chris Tse</tips> was unlucky. Maybe the way he’s lived finally caught up with him. ...Anyway, once <tips=3>Chris Tse</tips> dies, <tips=7>YS</tips> can’t simply carry on as before. It was an organization <tips=3>Chris Tse</tips> built by single-handedly bringing together gangs from completely different backgrounds. Something is bound to happen. That’s what I have to cover next.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r75","rowIndex":75,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうなんだ……」","en":"“I see...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ミユキ","displayName":"Miyuki","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r76","rowIndex":76,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そう、殺人鬼の話も面白いが、この<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>の後継者争いの方が、<tips=9>Y地区</tips>にとって重要な話だ。こんな、一銭にもならない仕事を請け負う理由はないのさ」","en":"“Exactly. The killer is an interesting story too, but the succession struggle inside <tips=7>YS</tips> matters more to <tips=9>Y District</tips>. There’s no reason for me to take an unpaid job like this.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r77","rowIndex":77,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「でも、その<tips=3>クリス</tips>さんがなくなるのは確実なの？　お医者に余命宣告されたって、その通りにはならないものでしょう」","en":"“But are you sure <tips=3>Chris</tips> is going to die? Even when doctors say how long someone has left, they aren’t always right, are they?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ミユキ","displayName":"Miyuki","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r78","rowIndex":78,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いや、もう今日死んでもおかしくないほど弱ってるって話だぜ。確実な情報なんだ。街ではそこまで詳しく情報が漏れちゃいないが、おれは特別な人脈があるから耳に入ってくる。ただ毎日遊び歩いているだけじゃない」","en":"“No. I hear he’s so weak that no one would be surprised if he died today. It’s solid information. Word on the street isn’t that specific yet, but I hear things through connections of my own. I don’t spend every day just fooling around.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r79","rowIndex":79,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=53>ミユキ</tips>は私の自慢に気づかなかったようで、","en":"<tips=53>Miyuki</tips> appeared not to notice my boast.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r80","rowIndex":80,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「でも、こういうの、<tips=50>邦昭さん</tips>は好きじゃないでしょう？」","en":"“But you don’t like this sort of thing, do you, <tips=50>Kuniaki</tips>?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ミユキ","displayName":"Miyuki","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r81","rowIndex":81,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「こういうのって？」","en":"“What sort of thing?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r82","rowIndex":82,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「女の人とか、子供とかが殺される事件。そういうの、いつもすっごく怒るじゃない。……本当は、自分の手で犯人を捕まえたいとか、思ってるんじゃないの？」","en":"“Cases where women or children get killed. You always get so angry about those. ...Don’t you really want to catch the killer yourself?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ミユキ","displayName":"Miyuki","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r83","rowIndex":83,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は肩をすくめた。","en":"I shrugged.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r84","rowIndex":84,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「買いかぶりだ。そんな正義感はない。なんだって、<tips=48>堂島</tips>の旦那と同じようなことを……」","en":"“You give me too much credit. I’m not that righteous. Why do you have to sound just like <tips=48>Dojima</tips>...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r85","rowIndex":85,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=53>ミユキ</tips>は私の言葉を遮って、私の手を握りしめた。","en":"<tips=53>Miyuki</tips> cut me off and clasped my hand tightly.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r86","rowIndex":86,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=50>邦昭さん</tips>は文章書きになろうとしてるけど、やっぱり本当は超能力をつかって探偵をしてた頃が一番楽しそうだった。だから、たとえ短い間でも、また昔みたいにイキイキと目を輝かせてほしいの」","en":"“You’re trying to become a writer, but I still think you were happiest back when you used your ability and worked as a detective. Even if it’s only for a little while, I want to see you come alive again, with your eyes shining the way they used to, <tips=50>Kuniaki</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ミユキ","displayName":"Miyuki","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r87","rowIndex":87,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「何言ってる。まず金がなけりゃ話にならん。殺人鬼なんか追いかけたって、金になるとは限らないが、原稿さえ書いていれば、いくばくかの金にはなる」","en":"“What are you talking about? Money comes first. Without it, nothing else matters. Chasing a killer might not make me any money, but if I keep writing, at least it brings in something.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r88","rowIndex":88,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「小さなことを心配しないで。私はね、本がたくさんうれてお金持ちになるよりも、<tips=50>邦昭さん</tips>が幸せそうにしてることの方が大事なんだよ？　だから、<tips=50>邦昭さん</tips>にはこまかいことを気にせずに、いつも好きなことをやっていてほしいの。ねえ、何にも心配はないのよ。お金だったら、私がなんとかするから。……本当に興味がないのなら、それでいいけど、ちょっとでも気になるのなら……」","en":"“Don’t worry about little things. Seeing you happy matters more to me than seeing your books sell and make you rich, <tips=50>Kuniaki</tips>. I want you to stop worrying about every little detail and always do what you love, <tips=50>Kuniaki</tips>. There’s nothing to worry about. I’ll take care of the money somehow. ...If you truly aren’t interested, that’s fine—but if even a little part of you is curious...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ミユキ","displayName":"Miyuki","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r89","rowIndex":89,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は溜息をつき、ビールのグラスに口を付ける。","en":"I sighed and brought the glass of beer to my lips.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r90","rowIndex":90,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　チンタオビールはすっきりあっさりとした味わいの酒で、夏の蒸し暑い日や、風呂上がりの一杯として炭酸ののどごしを楽しむには適しているが、散々他の酒を飲んだ後に口にするには物足りない。","en":"Tsingtao was a clean, light beer, well suited to the muggy heat of a summer day or to a drink after a bath, when the bite of carbonation on the throat was exactly what one wanted. After all the other liquor I had put away, however, it seemed disappointingly thin.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r91","rowIndex":91,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「危なそうな仕事なの？　それなら、やらないっていうのもありだけど……。あっ」","en":"“Is it dangerous work? If it is, maybe you shouldn’t take it after all... Oh.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ミユキ","displayName":"Miyuki","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r92","rowIndex":92,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は飲みかけのグラスをテーブルの上に置き、<tips=53>ミユキ</tips>の手を引いた。","en":"I set my half-finished glass upon the table and pulled <tips=53>Miyuki</tips> toward me by the hand.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r93","rowIndex":93,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　必然、彼女の身体は私の胸の中に引き込まれるような形になる。そして私はもう片方の手で彼女の顎をつまむと、その唇に自分の唇を押し当てた。","en":"The pull naturally brought her body against my chest. I caught her chin with my other hand and pressed my lips to hers.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r94","rowIndex":94,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女は目を閉じ、私にされるがままにしている。","en":"She closed her eyes and yielded to me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r95","rowIndex":95,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その唇の間に、まだビールで濡れている私の舌を滑り込ませると、彼女はねっとりとした舌遣いでそれに応えた。","en":"I slid my tongue, still wet with beer, between her lips, and she answered with a slow, sensuous movement of her own tongue.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r96","rowIndex":96,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私の口腔にある唾液が、お互いの舌を伝って彼女の口のなかに入り、入り切らぬものは唇の端から顎へとしたたる。","en":"Saliva from my mouth ran along our tongues and into hers; the rest escaped at the corner of her lips and trickled down her chin.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r97","rowIndex":97,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「んっ……」","en":"“Mmm...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ミユキ","displayName":"Miyuki","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r98","rowIndex":98,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=53>ミユキ</tips>はコクンと喉を鳴らしてそれを飲み込んだ。","en":"<tips=53>Miyuki</tips> swallowed it with an audible gulp.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r99","rowIndex":99,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「別に危なくはない。まあ、お前がそこまで言うなら、少し考えてみるさ」","en":"“It’s not particularly dangerous. Well, if you feel that strongly about it, I’ll give it some thought.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r100","rowIndex":100,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私がそう言うと、彼女はうるんだ目でこちらを見つめながら、小さく頷いた。","en":"When I said that, she gazed at me through glistening eyes and gave a small nod.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r101","rowIndex":101,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女の仕事は娼婦であった。","en":"She worked as a prostitute.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r102","rowIndex":102,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=59>暗闇通り</tips>で、この辺りでは老舗と言える、古い店で働いている。","en":"She worked at an old establishment on <tips=59>Darkness Street</tips>, something of a local institution.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r103","rowIndex":103,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして彼女の母親も、その店で働く娼婦であった。","en":"Her mother, too, had been a prostitute there.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r104","rowIndex":104,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女は自分の父親を知らない。親しい客の誰かであろうと、複数候補はいたが、そのうちの誰なのかははっきりしない。","en":"She did not know who her father was. He was presumably one of her mother’s favored clients; there were several candidates, and no way to know which.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r105","rowIndex":105,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　日本人でもないかもしれない。というより、店の客層を考えればどこか異国の血を受け継いでいる可能性の方が高い。","en":"He might not even have been Japanese. Indeed, given the establishment’s clientele, it was more likely than not that some foreign blood ran in her veins.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r106","rowIndex":106,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　顔立ちは、はっきりとした二重のまぶた。少し厚ぼったい唇。抜けるように白い肌。","en":"Clearly defined double eyelids. Slightly full lips. Skin of a startling whiteness.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r107","rowIndex":107,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　日本人としては少数の部類になる特徴がいくつかあるが、しかし、だからといって日本人ではないと断定することは出来ない。","en":"Several of these features were uncommon among Japanese people, but none was enough to conclude that she was not Japanese.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r108","rowIndex":108,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そもそも、日本人というもの自体が、アジア地域のさまざまな人種が混じり合い、多種多様な顔つきをしている。","en":"The Japanese, after all, were themselves a mixture of the many peoples of Asia, and their faces were correspondingly diverse.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r109","rowIndex":109,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私の家系は九州にあり、血筋を何代辿っても日本人しかいないが、鼻が高く、彫りが深く、そして身体がでかいせいで、この街ではあまり日本人だとは思われない。そして、他人が「似てる」と持ち出す有名人の名前は、大抵中東系である。","en":"My family was from Kyushu, and however many generations one traced the line back, there was no one in it but Japanese people. Yet because I had a prominent nose, deeply chiseled features, and a huge build, people in this city seldom took me for Japanese. Whenever someone told me I looked like a celebrity, the name they produced was almost always Middle Eastern.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r110","rowIndex":110,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　さらに、<tips=53>ミユキ</tips>の母親も、娘と同様父親が不明であり、容姿に日本人としては珍しい特徴を有していた。","en":"<tips=53>Miyuki’s</tips> mother was in the same position: her own father was unknown, and she too had features unusual for a Japanese woman.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r111","rowIndex":111,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　とすると、<tips=53>ミユキ</tips>の身体を流れる血液の大半は、誰のものかわからないということになる。","en":"It followed that no one could say where most of the blood flowing through <tips=53>Miyuki’s</tips> body had come from.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r112","rowIndex":112,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　本人はそれを気にすることもない。いつも明るく、それが彼女の最大の取り柄であった。","en":"She herself never let it trouble her. She was always cheerful, and that was her greatest virtue.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r113","rowIndex":113,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女は自分の素性と職業のことで私に引け目を感じている。","en":"She felt inferior to me because of her background and occupation.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r114","rowIndex":114,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そしてまた、私の方も彼女を平然と食い物にしている自分の生活態度に引け目を感じている。が、感じながらも、彼女のその引け目を利用して、食い物にし続けているのだ。","en":"I, in turn, was ashamed of the life I led, calmly exploiting her as I did. Yet even while feeling that shame, I took advantage of her own sense of inferiority and continued to exploit her.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r115","rowIndex":115,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は彼女に金を稼がせてそれを浪費し、手持ち無沙汰になれば、その肉体を性欲のはけ口として使う。彼女は私に対して好意があるらしい。人の感情に無限なものというものはないからいつか枯れるのだろうが、今のところはまだ枯渇の徴候は見えなかった。","en":"I made her earn the money, and I squandered it. Whenever I had nothing else to occupy me, I used her body as an outlet for my sexual appetite. She seemed to have feelings for me. No human emotion is inexhaustible, so hers would presumably run dry one day; for the moment, however, I saw no sign of depletion.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r116","rowIndex":116,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それを考えると私は若干の自己嫌悪を覚えるが、しかしその感情が自堕落な欲求を上回ることはなかった。","en":"The thought stirred a measure of self-loathing in me, but it was never enough to outweigh my appetite for self-indulgence.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r117","rowIndex":117,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　醜く、そしてこの街ではありふれたこの関係はいつまで続くのだろう。","en":"How long would this ugly relationship, so commonplace in the city, continue?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r118","rowIndex":118,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その日は、朝からシトシトと雨が降っていた。","en":"A soft rain had been falling steadily since morning.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r119","rowIndex":119,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私はカルロッタの店へ向かうことにした。","en":"I decided to go to Carlotta’s bar.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r120","rowIndex":120,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　最近<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>の状態に変化があったようで、その情報には常に気を配っていた。","en":"There had apparently been a recent change in <tips=3>Chris Tse’s</tips> condition, and I had been keeping a close watch for any news of him.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r121","rowIndex":121,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>がらみの情報源はいくつかあり、そのなかでもっとも正確で内容が豊富なのは<tips=57>滑走路通り</tips>側のラーメン屋の二階で暮らすフルカワという女だ。","en":"I had several sources of information concerning <tips=7>YS</tips>. The most accurate and comprehensive was a woman named Furukawa, who lived above a ramen shop on the <tips=57>Runway Street</tips> side of the neighborhood.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r122","rowIndex":122,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>の幹部の情婦であり、以前は私とも関係があった。<tips=59>暗闇通り</tips>で薬を買って持っていくと、上機嫌でベラベラと男との寝物語で仕入れた情報を語った。","en":"She was the mistress of a <tips=7>YS</tips> officer, and she and I had once been involved as well. If I brought her drugs bought on <tips=59>Darkness Street</tips>, she would cheerfully chatter away, divulging whatever she had picked up from her man’s pillow talk.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r123","rowIndex":123,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>はいよいよ容体が悪く、自室から出ることも出来なくなっているそうだ。死を前にした最後の会合で彼は、学生の息子を<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>の幹部にすると宣言したらしい。それに対し、<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>の現幹部たちが反発しているという。","en":"<tips=3>Chris Tse’s</tips> condition had reportedly grown so poor that he could no longer leave his room. At his final meeting, with death close at hand, he had apparently declared that he would make his son, still a student, an officer of <tips=7>YS</tips>. The current officers of <tips=7>YS</tips> were said to be resisting the decision.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r124","rowIndex":124,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　息子の名前は<tips=1>謝亮</tips>。私の情報が間違いなければ、かつてこの街で<tips=1>菅原亮</tips>と名乗っていた少年と同一人物の筈だ。","en":"The son’s name was <tips=1>Tse Leung</tips>. Unless my information was mistaken, he must have been the same boy who once called himself <tips=1>Ryo Sugawara</tips> in this city.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r125","rowIndex":125,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その頃の彼のことなら知っている。","en":"I knew what he had been like in those days.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r126","rowIndex":126,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　不良少年たちのリーダーの一人で、もう一人のリーダーである<tips=10>見土道夫</tips>が陽気な性格とハイブリッドとしての傑出した能力で仲間の人望を集めていたのに対し、<tips=1>菅原</tips>は人間の好き嫌いが強く、気さくでもなく、あまり人を寄せ付けない人間だった。","en":"He had been one of the leaders of a group of delinquent boys. Their other leader, <tips=10>Michio Mido</tips>, had won the group’s loyalty through his cheerful nature and his exceptional abilities as a hybrid. <tips=1>Sugawara</tips>, by contrast, was intensely selective about whom he liked, anything but approachable, and inclined to keep people at a distance.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r127","rowIndex":127,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　二人はあらゆる点で対照的だった。","en":"The two were opposites in every respect.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r128","rowIndex":128,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=10>見土</tips>は喧嘩やものを壊したりといった乱暴な行動を好んだが、一線をこえるようなことはなく、仲間たちをよく統御し、街の大人たちからも一定の信頼を得ていた。","en":"<tips=10>Michio</tips> enjoyed fighting and smashing things, but he never went too far. He kept his companions firmly in line and had earned a measure of trust even from the adults of the city.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r129","rowIndex":129,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>菅原</tips>は普段は大人しく、とてもリーダー格とは思えないような存在感のなさだったが、ひとたび行動を起こせば一線を平気で飛び越えて目的を達成した。","en":"<tips=1>Sugawara</tips> was ordinarily quiet and so inconspicuous that one would never have taken him for a leader. But once he acted, he crossed the line without a qualm to accomplish his objective.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r130","rowIndex":130,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　騒動に慣れた街の住民が顔をしかめるようなとんでもないことをしでかすのはこの<tips=1>菅原亮</tips>の方だった。","en":"When someone did something outrageous enough to make even residents inured to disorder wince, <tips=1>Ryo Sugawara</tips> was the one responsible.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r131","rowIndex":131,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　いつだったか、不良グループの少女が身ごもったことがある。","en":"Once, a girl in the delinquent group became pregnant.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r132","rowIndex":132,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　相手は<tips=58>パラシュート通り</tips>のアパートで暮らす飲食店員の男だったが、彼は認めず、少女と諍いになった。","en":"The man responsible was a restaurant employee living in an apartment on <tips=58>Parachute Street</tips>, but he denied it, and the two quarreled.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r133","rowIndex":133,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　よくある痴話げんかで、この時点では<tips=1>菅原</tips>も何もしなかったが、グループ内の別の少女がその男によって妊娠させられると黙ってはいなかった。","en":"It was an ordinary lovers’ quarrel, and <tips=1>Sugawara</tips> did nothing at that point. When the man got another girl in the group pregnant, however, Sugawara did not let it pass.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r134","rowIndex":134,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>菅原</tips>は仲間と共に男の家に乗り込むと、怯えて泣いて謝る男の睾丸を蹴り潰した。ショックで気絶した男は一命こそとりとめたが、まもなく街を出ていった。","en":"<tips=1>Sugawara</tips> and his companions forced their way into the man's home, and while the man wept and apologized in terror, Sugawara crushed his testicles with a kick. The man fainted from the shock. He survived, but left the city soon afterward.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r135","rowIndex":135,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　子供たちに薬を売っていた売人の家が燃え、大事にしていたペットたちがすべて焼け死んだのも、彼の仕業だと言われている。","en":"When the home of a dealer who sold drugs to children burned down, killing every one of his beloved pets, that too was said to have been Sugawara’s work.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r136","rowIndex":136,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　仲間を裏切ろうとするものや、騙して不当な利益をあげようとするものは、いつも事前に彼が発見して、制裁を加えた。昨日まで仲間として普通に接していた相手を、無表情でリンチするその姿を、少年たちは恐れたらしい。","en":"Anyone who meant to betray the group, or cheat it for an unfair profit, was invariably discovered by him in advance and punished. The boys were apparently terrified by the sight of him expressionlessly beating someone he had treated as an ordinary companion only the day before.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r137","rowIndex":137,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=13>ヘドロ団地</tips>で街の外からやって来た公務員が死体となって発見されたことがある。結局犯人は見つからずじまいだったが、私の耳に入る噂では、これにも、当時十四才だった<tips=1>菅原亮</tips>が関わっているという話だった。","en":"A civil servant from outside the city was once found dead in the <tips=13>Sludge Housing Complex</tips>. The perpetrator was never identified, but according to rumors that reached me, <tips=1>Ryo Sugawara</tips>—fourteen years old at the time—had been involved in that crime as well.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r138","rowIndex":138,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　当時は知らなかったが、この<tips=1>菅原亮</tips>が<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>の跡取り息子であるというのなら、常軌を逸した振る舞いにも納得がいく。","en":"I had not known it then, but if <tips=1>Ryo Sugawara</tips> was <tips=3>Chris Tse’s</tips> son and heir, behavior so far outside ordinary bounds began to make sense.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r139","rowIndex":139,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　血なのだろう。","en":"It must have been in the blood.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r140","rowIndex":140,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>亡き後は、<tips=27>廖志明</tips>や、<tips=35>ジョゼ・フェルナンデス</tips>が<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>内で主流的な地位をしめるだろうと囁かれていたが、この<tips=1>菅原亮</tips>——<tips=1>謝亮</tips>が父の跡を継ぐのが既定路線となるのならば、勢力図に影響が出て来るかもしれない。","en":"It had been rumored that after <tips=3>Chris Tse’s</tips> death, <tips=27>Liao Chi-ming</tips> and <tips=35>José Fernandes</tips> would emerge as the leading figures within <tips=7>YS</tips>. But if it became a settled matter that <tips=1>Ryo Sugawara</tips>—<tips=1>Tse Leung</tips>—would succeed his father, the balance of power might shift.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r141","rowIndex":141,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　とにかく、すべてが動き出すのは、<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>が死んでからだ。","en":"In any event, nothing would be set in motion until <tips=3>Chris Tse</tips> was dead.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r142","rowIndex":142,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　別に混乱を望んでいるわけではないが、一体どんなことが起こるのか知りたくて、自然と<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>の死を待つような気持ちになってしまう。","en":"I did not want chaos for its own sake, but my desire to know what would happen had left me, almost without meaning to, waiting for <tips=3>Chris Tse’s</tips> death.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r143","rowIndex":143,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私の書こうとしている作品では、<tips=9>Y地区</tips>の裏社会での出来事が多く書かれる予定であり、<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>にも多くの文章量を割くことになっている。","en":"The work I intended to write would deal extensively with events in the <tips=9>Y District</tips> underworld, and <tips=7>YS</tips> would occupy a great many pages.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r144","rowIndex":144,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　これから争う跡目争いが興味深いものになれば、私の作品の価値も高まるというわけだ。","en":"If the coming succession struggle proved interesting, it would increase the value of my work.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r145","rowIndex":145,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして無事出版され、評価され、売り上げにつなげられれば――そうすれば、私と<tips=53>ミユキ</tips>も閉塞した生活から脱却出来る。そして、なんとも言えない、今の息苦しさから解放されるのだろう。","en":"And if the work saw publication, earned acclaim, and sold—then <tips=53>Miyuki</tips> and I could escape the dead end our lives had become. Perhaps we would be freed from the inexpressible suffocation that oppressed us now.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r146","rowIndex":146,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　兎にも角にも、我々の生活には金が足りない。","en":"Whatever else might be true, our lives lacked money.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r147","rowIndex":147,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　金銭を、社会的に認められる形で稼ぎ出す必要がある。","en":"We needed to earn money in a socially respectable way.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r148","rowIndex":148,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ドキュメンタリー作品をヒットさせるというのは、全くの夢物語のつもりはない。私は、出版界でメシを食っているだれよりもこの地域の裏事情に通じている。","en":"The idea of producing a successful work of documentary literature was not pure fantasy. I knew more about the hidden affairs of this district than anyone who made a living in publishing.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r149","rowIndex":149,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　最近は<tips=9>Y地区</tips>出身者の活躍もあり、世間のこの地域への関心は高い。今回の作品のために、雑誌には渡さなかったネタをまだいくつも貯めてある。","en":"Recent successes by people from <tips=9>Y District</tips> had also heightened public interest in the area. For this work, I had kept in reserve a number of pieces of material I had never handed over to the magazines.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r150","rowIndex":150,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それらを文章にすれば、まとまった金にはなるはずだ。","en":"If I turned all that material into prose, it ought to bring in a substantial sum.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r151","rowIndex":151,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それは分かっているのだが、そんな仕事をいくら頑張っても、私と<tips=53>ミユキ</tips>がどこか閑静な住宅街で並んで庭でも眺めているような、そして我々の心がそれによって満たされるというな、そんな想像が出来なかった。","en":"I knew that. Yet however hard I worked, I could not picture <tips=53>Miyuki</tips> and me someday in a quiet residential neighborhood, sitting side by side and gazing out at a garden, our hearts somehow made whole by it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r152","rowIndex":152,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　確かに我々には金がないが、しかし金を得たからといって、それが本質的な解決になるのだろうか？　我々のような見捨てられた人間の精神に根付く欠乏感は埋まるのだろうか？","en":"We certainly had no money, but even if we obtained some, would that solve anything fundamental? Could money fill the sense of absence rooted in the hearts of abandoned people like us?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r153","rowIndex":153,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=53>ミユキ</tips>は全てが解決すると信じているようだが、私はそんなに純粋にはなれない。","en":"<tips=53>Miyuki</tips> seemed to believe it would solve everything, but I could not share her innocence.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r154","rowIndex":154,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　――どうせ、作品が売れたって、おれたちの本質的な部分はどうにもなりゃしねえんだ。クズは金があろうがなかろうがクズなんだよ。","en":"—Even if the book sells, it won’t do a damn thing about what we are underneath. Scum is scum, with money or without it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r155","rowIndex":155,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その思いが、原稿と向かい合う気力を蝕んでいる。","en":"That conviction ate away at my will to face the manuscript.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r156","rowIndex":156,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いらっしゃい」","en":"“Welcome.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"カルロッタ","displayName":"Carlotta","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r157","rowIndex":157,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　店内に足を踏み入れると、グラスを拭いていたカルロッタが顔を上げた。","en":"When I stepped inside, Carlotta looked up from the glass she was polishing.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r158","rowIndex":158,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「びしょ濡れじゃない。また傘をさしてこなかったの？」","en":"“You’re soaked through. Did you go out without an umbrella again?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"カルロッタ","displayName":"Carlotta","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r159","rowIndex":159,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「好きじゃないんだよ。傘」","en":"“I don’t like umbrellas.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r160","rowIndex":160,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そんなことばかり言って」","en":"“There you go again.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"カルロッタ","displayName":"Carlotta","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r161","rowIndex":161,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　カルロッタが困り顔で差し出すタオルで、私は雨水によってすっかり濡れそぼった顔と頭を拭った。","en":"With the towel Carlotta held out, concern on her face, I dried my rain-soaked head and face.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r162","rowIndex":162,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「風邪をひいたらどうするの？　あんたはいいけど、それを<tips=53>ミユキ</tips>ちゃんにうつしちゃったらかわいそうでしょ」","en":"“What are you going to do if you catch a cold? You may not mind, but it wouldn’t be fair to <tips=53>Miyuki</tips> if you passed it on to her.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"カルロッタ","displayName":"Carlotta","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r163","rowIndex":163,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「うるせえな」","en":"“Quit nagging.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r164","rowIndex":164,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は席を立ち、まだ何か言い続けているカルロッタを背中に、今入って来たばかりのドアを開けて往来へ出た。","en":"I rose, turned my back upon Carlotta—who was still saying something—and went through the door I had only just entered, returning to the street.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r165","rowIndex":165,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　雨脚は一段と強さを増している。私は酒を飲む気力を失い、取材でもしようかとフルカワの元へ向かった。","en":"The rain had grown harder still. I no longer felt like drinking, so I headed toward Furukawa’s place to see what information I could gather instead.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r166","rowIndex":166,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「昨日の今日に来られたって、特に変化なんかないわ」","en":"“You were just here yesterday. Nothing has changed.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"フルカワ","displayName":"Furukawa","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r167","rowIndex":167,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　フルカワは肩をすくめる。","en":"Furukawa shrugged.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r168","rowIndex":168,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まあそうだろうな。何かあったら連絡をくれ。……話は変わるが、このまま<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>が死んだらお前の旦那はどうするつもりなんだ？」","en":"“I suppose not. Contact me if anything happens. ...Changing the subject, if <tips=3>Chris Tse</tips> dies with things as they are, what does your man intend to do?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r169","rowIndex":169,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　フルカワの情夫は、<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>率いる<tips=76>香港派</tips>の一員で、特に<tips=3>クリス</tips>個人に対する忠誠心が強いことで知られている。","en":"Furukawa’s lover belonged to the <tips=76>Hong Kong faction</tips> led by <tips=3>Chris Tse</tips> and was known for his especially fierce personal loyalty to <tips=3>Chris</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r170","rowIndex":170,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そのことに関しては何も言っていないわ。でも、あの人は<tips=81>龍頭</tips>のことは好きでも、他の部下とはそりが合わないからね……」","en":"“He hasn’t said anything about that. He’s fond of the <tips=81>Longtou</tips>, but he doesn’t get along with the other men in the organization...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"フルカワ","displayName":"Furukawa","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r171","rowIndex":171,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なるほど。じゃあ、<tips=26>劉建志</tips>は新体制が出来ても今までのようには従わないのかもしれないってことか」","en":"“I see. So <tips=26>Ryu Kenshi</tips> may not be as obedient once the new order is in place.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r172","rowIndex":172,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「その名を口にするのはやめて」","en":"“Don’t say his name.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"フルカワ","displayName":"Furukawa","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r173","rowIndex":173,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なぜ」","en":"“Why?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r174","rowIndex":174,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あなたの口から聞きたくないわ」","en":"“I don’t want to hear you say it.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"フルカワ","displayName":"Furukawa","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r175","rowIndex":175,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　フルカワは溜息をついて、肩から落ちかかったキャミソールの紐を直す。","en":"Furukawa sighed and adjusted the camisole strap slipping from her shoulder.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r176","rowIndex":176,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それより、知ってる？」","en":"“Anyway, have you heard?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"フルカワ","displayName":"Furukawa","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r177","rowIndex":177,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「何をだ」","en":"“Heard what?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r178","rowIndex":178,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=73>リュウカ</tips>ちゃん。殺されたんだって」","en":"“<tips=73>Ryuka</tips>. I heard she was murdered.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"フルカワ","displayName":"Furukawa","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r179","rowIndex":179,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「え？」","en":"“What?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r180","rowIndex":180,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「つい先週ね、自宅でバラバラにされていたの。警察も来て、大変だったんだって」","en":"“Just last week. They found her cut to pieces in her own home. The police came and everything. I heard it caused a huge commotion.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"フルカワ","displayName":"Furukawa","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r181","rowIndex":181,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……バラバラって、もしかして、棚に詰め込まれていたのか？」","en":"“...Cut to pieces? You mean the pieces were stuffed onto shelves?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r182","rowIndex":182,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「よく知ってるわね」","en":"“You know a lot about it.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"フルカワ","displayName":"Furukawa","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r183","rowIndex":183,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そういう事件があったのは知ってる。現場写真を見たんだ。しかし、被害者があの子だったとは気がつかなかった……」","en":"“I knew a crime like that had occurred. I saw the photographs of the scene. But I didn't realize the victim was that girl...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r184","rowIndex":184,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「かわいそうねえ。せっかく、好きな仕事について、毎日が充実してるって喜んでいたのに……。一ヶ月前、私は……あっ、ちょっと。<tips=50>路地</tips>君」","en":"“Poor thing. She was so happy to have found work she loved, and said every day was fulfilling... A month ago, I— Wait. <tips=50>Roji</tips>!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"フルカワ","displayName":"Furukawa","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r185","rowIndex":185,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　フルカワの言葉を最後まで聞かず、私は路上に出た。","en":"Before Furukawa could finish, I went out into the street.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r186","rowIndex":186,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　先ほどより少し強くなった雨が私の身体を濡らす。","en":"The rain, a little heavier than before, soaked my body.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r187","rowIndex":187,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　――そう言えば、ゴミ捨て場で<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>に女が殺されたのも、こんな風に雨の降った日だと言っていたな。","en":"—Come to think of it, he said it had been raining like this the day <tips=20>Koschei</tips> killed that woman at the garbage dump.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r188","rowIndex":188,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は<tips=48>堂島</tips>に見せられたその写真を思い出し、そして第一の被害者と思われる女性の写真を思い出した。","en":"I remembered the photograph <tips=48>Dojima</tips> had shown me, then the image of the woman believed to be the first victim.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r189","rowIndex":189,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　遺体はあまりにも損傷が激しく、その写真だけでは女性か男性かも、老人か若者かもわからなかった。——情報の通りなら、私の知っている人間のはずなのに。","en":"The body was so badly damaged that the photograph alone gave no indication whether it was a woman or a man, old or young. —And yet, if the information was correct, it had to be someone I knew.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r190","rowIndex":190,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=73>リュウカ</tips>というのは、去年まで暗闇通りで娼婦をしていた二十代の女だった。<tips=53>ミユキ</tips>と同じように<tips=59>暗闇通り</tips>で生まれた親の顔を知らない人間で、彼女の場合は名前もなく、子供の頃は好き勝手に呼ばれていたのだが、店で働くようになってからは<tips=73>リュウカ</tips>という店長がつけた源氏名をそのまま本名にしていた。","en":"<tips=73>Ryuka</tips> was a woman in her twenties who had worked as a prostitute on Darkness Street until the previous year. Like <tips=53>Miyuki</tips>, she had been born on <tips=59>Darkness Street</tips> without knowing either parent. She had no name of her own and was called whatever people pleased when she was a child. Once she began working at the establishment, she took <tips=73>Ryuka</tips>—the professional name its manager gave her—as her real name.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r191","rowIndex":191,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　境遇が同じである<tips=53>ミユキ</tips>とは仲が良く、私も街で見かけて何度か話したことがある。病気になって子供が産めない身体になったのをきっかけに、施設で子供の面倒を見る仕事がしたいといって娼婦を辞めていった。","en":"Her shared background had made her close to <tips=53>Miyuki</tips>, and I too had stopped to talk with her several times when I saw her around the city. After an illness left her unable to bear children, she quit prostitution, saying she wanted a job caring for children at a facility.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r192","rowIndex":192,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女のような境遇の人間が、彼女の言うようなまっとうな理由で暗闇通りを出て行くことは珍しい。","en":"It was rare for someone with her background to leave Darkness Street for the respectable reason she had given.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r193","rowIndex":193,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　一般的に、泥沼で生まれたものは泥沼のなかでずっと生きてゆくものだ。彼女を<tips=59>暗闇通り</tips>から送り出す送別会に行った<tips=53>ミユキ</tips>が、喜びでむせび泣きながら家に帰って来たのを記憶している。それくらい奇跡的なことなのだ。","en":"As a rule, those born in the mire spend their whole lives in it. I remember <tips=53>Miyuki</tips> coming home from the farewell party held when Ryuka left <tips=59>Darkness Street</tips>, sobbing with joy. That was how close to a miracle her departure had been.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r194","rowIndex":194,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それ以来<tips=59>暗闇通り</tips>の人間と疎遠になり、てっきり今も平和に暮らしていると思っていたのだが。","en":"Afterward, Ryuka had drifted away from everyone on <tips=59>Darkness Street</tips>, and I had taken it for granted that she was still living peacefully.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r195","rowIndex":195,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　アパートの自室で分断され、肉塊となって棚に仕舞われてしまうとは。","en":"And now she had been dismembered in her own apartment, reduced to chunks of meat and packed away on shelves.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r196","rowIndex":196,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　とても<tips=53>ミユキ</tips>に教えることが出来ないし、私も苛立って仕方がない。目に入る電柱でも蹴りたくなるが、その気持ちを抑えた。顔見知りの死というものはやはり特別だ。全く知らない被害者だと思って写真を見ただけでも腹が立ったのに、まさか顔見知りだったとは。","en":"I could not possibly tell <tips=53>Miyuki</tips>, and my anger would not subside. I wanted to kick the first utility pole I saw, but forced down the impulse. Death was different when the victim was someone familiar. The photographs had infuriated me even when I thought the victim a complete stranger. To think she had been someone I knew.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r197","rowIndex":197,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>とかいう男について、やはり調べなければいけないのだろうか？　これだけのことをしておいて、今もこの街のどこかでのうのうとしていると思うと反吐が出る。","en":"Did I have no choice but to investigate this man <tips=20>Koschei</tips>? The thought that he could do such a thing and continue living at ease somewhere in the city made me sick.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r198","rowIndex":198,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=48>堂島</tips>の依頼からは四日が過ぎていた。この四日間、<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>の事件のことは忘れようとしていたが、どうもそうはいかないのかもしれない。ここで思いがけなくこの情報を耳にするというのは、何か運命のようなものがあるだろう。","en":"Four days had passed since <tips=48>Dojima’s</tips> request. Throughout those four days, I had tried to put the <tips=20>Koschei</tips> case out of my mind, but perhaps it would not let me. There had to be something like fate in my hearing this news here so unexpectedly.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r199","rowIndex":199,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は歩きながら携帯電話を取り出すと、<tips=48>堂島</tips>に電話をかけた。自分がこの仕事を引き受けることを伝えて、成功のあかつきには能力を解放するという、彼が口にした条件をもう一度確認するためだった。","en":"As I walked, I pulled out my phone and called <tips=48>Dojima</tips>. I meant to tell him that I would accept the work and confirm once more the condition he had stated: that if I succeeded, he would restore my ability.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r200","rowIndex":200,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ちっ」","en":"“Tch.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r201","rowIndex":201,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　肝心なときに電話は繋がらない。用件を文章にしてメールを送り、私は歩き出す。","en":"At the crucial moment, the call would not connect. I typed out what I wanted in a message, sent it, and continued walking.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r202","rowIndex":202,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　調査は、<tips=48>堂島</tips>と会って中和剤をもらってから行うことにしよう。能力がなければ、私は多少腕力が強いだけの平凡な男だ。","en":"I would wait until I had met <tips=48>Dojima</tips> and received the neutralizer before beginning the investigation. Without my ability, I was nothing more than an ordinary man with a little extra muscle.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r203","rowIndex":203,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　重苦しい気持ちだった。私は気晴らしのために、酒場の方へ足を向けた。","en":"My spirits were heavy. Seeking a distraction, I headed toward the bars.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r204","rowIndex":204,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　十番道路にさしかかったとき、前方に背が高くひょろよろとした男が片手に杖、片手に傘をもち、大きいバッグを肩にかけてよろよろと歩いているのを見つけた。その独特の横顔には見覚えがある。","en":"As I reached Tenth Road, I noticed a tall, lanky man ahead. He walked unsteadily with a cane in one hand and an umbrella in the other, a large bag hanging from his shoulder. I recognized the distinctive profile.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r205","rowIndex":205,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「やあ先生」","en":"“Hello, Doctor.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r206","rowIndex":206,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そう声をかけると、その痩身の男は顔を上げて私を見た。","en":"At my greeting, the thin man raised his face and looked at me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r207","rowIndex":207,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「久しぶりじゃないですか。元気ですか？」","en":"“It’s been a while, hasn’t it? How have you been?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r208","rowIndex":208,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　相手は止まらない。そのまま通り過ぎようとする。","en":"He did not stop. He simply tried to walk past me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r209","rowIndex":209,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=5>太刀川</tips>先生！」","en":"“Dr. <tips=5>Tachikawa</tips>!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r210","rowIndex":210,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私はもう一度声を張り上げた。","en":"I raised my voice once more.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r211","rowIndex":211,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「つれないじゃないですか。それなりに長いつき合いでしょうよ」","en":"“Don’t be like that. We’ve known each other a long time, haven’t we?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r212","rowIndex":212,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そこまで言うと漸く、<tips=5>太刀川</tips>医師はしかめっ面で足を止めた。","en":"Only after that did Dr. <tips=5>Tachikawa</tips> finally stop and turn a scowl on me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r213","rowIndex":213,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「私は診察があるんですよ」","en":"“I have patients to see.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"太刀川良馬","displayName":"Ryoma Tachikawa","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r214","rowIndex":214,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「こんな雨の日でも、貧乏人のところを回ってるんですか？　頭が下がる。……おっと、おれの目を見ないでくださいよ。心を覗かれちゃたまらない」","en":"“You still make the rounds among the poor even in rain like this? My hat’s off to you. ...Whoa, don’t look me in the eye. I don’t want you poking around in my mind.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r215","rowIndex":215,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私はそう言って自分の目を隠す。","en":"As I spoke, I covered my eyes.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r216","rowIndex":216,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ふざけているわけではない。この<tips=5>太刀川</tips>という医者は、特別な力を持っている。目が合った人間の感情を読む——つまりテレパシー能力者だ。","en":"I was not entirely joking. This physician named <tips=5>Tachikawa</tips> possessed a special power. He could read the emotions of anyone who met his gaze—in other words, he was a telepath.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r217","rowIndex":217,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　具体的な思考を読むことは出来ないようだが、感情の動きはつぶさに知ることが出来るらしい。つまり、嘘を見破ったり、相手の秘めた本心を見抜くことが出来るというわけだ。","en":"He did not seem able to read specific thoughts, but apparently he could perceive every shift in emotion. In other words, he could detect lies and discern a person's hidden feelings.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r218","rowIndex":218,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　この世間によく知られる古典的な能力は、現実に使用出来る人間はそう多くなく、使用出来たとしても非常に微弱であったり、様々な限定条件がつく。実用に足るレベルで人の内面を読むことが出来る数少ない能力者はいずれも特別な職務に就いている。","en":"This classic ability, familiar throughout society, was in reality possessed by very few people. Even among them, it was ordinarily extremely weak or subject to various limiting conditions. The handful capable of reading another person’s inner life to a useful degree had all entered special occupations.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r219","rowIndex":219,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=5>太刀川</tips>のように、それなりの強度がある能力を持ちながら、精神科医になってこんなろくでもない街でろくでもない患者の治療のために働いているのはよほどのかわりものだろう。","en":"For someone with an ability as strong as <tips=5>Tachikawa’s</tips> to become a psychiatrist and work in this rotten city treating its equally rotten patients—he had to be an extraordinary eccentric.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r220","rowIndex":220,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　いいところで出会ったものだ。","en":"I had run into him at just the right moment.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r221","rowIndex":221,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　この<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>の捜査について、彼も巻き込んでしまえないだろうか？","en":"Could I somehow drag him into the <tips=20>Koschei</tips> investigation too?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r222","rowIndex":222,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いちいちそんなことはしません。大体、あなたの心を覗いて私に何の得があるって言うんです？　<tips=16>タイプＡ</tips>がみだりに能力を使うのは違法行為だ。特に我々のような強い力を与えられた者は他の軽微な能力者よりも振る舞いに気をつけなくてはいけない。あなたは誰よりもそれをよくご存じのはずだ」","en":"“I don’t go around doing that. What could I possibly gain by looking into your mind? It is illegal for a <tips=16>Type A</tips> to use their ability indiscriminately. Those of us with particularly powerful abilities must be even more careful in our conduct than people with minor ones. You ought to know that better than anyone.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"太刀川良馬","displayName":"Ryoma Tachikawa","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r223","rowIndex":223,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私が彼の過去をよく知っているように、彼も私の素性について知っている。——もっとも、私の素性は彼の過去ほど秘密めいたものではなく、この街の古い住人の多くが知っているものだが。","en":"Just as I knew his past well, he knew my background. —Granted, there was nowhere near as much mystery about my background as there was about his past; many longtime residents of the city knew it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r224","rowIndex":224,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼と最初に出会ってからもう十五年以上が過ぎている。当時、彼はまだ医者になりたての青年で、私も探偵を始めたばかりの、まだ二十才になったかどうかという若造だった。","en":"More than fifteen years had passed since I first met him. At the time, he was a young man newly qualified as a doctor, while I was a greenhorn barely twenty who had only just begun working as a detective.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r225","rowIndex":225,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「相変わらず先生は真面目な方だ。しかし、誰よりもよくご存じでってのは一本とられましたな。確かにおれは能力を濫用したらえらいことになるということについては、人よりもよく知っている」","en":"“As serious as ever, Doctor. But you got me there with ‘better than anyone.’ It’s true: I know better than most what a mess you can make by abusing an ability.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r226","rowIndex":226,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私はそう言って、目を隠す手のひらをどけた。大げさに隠したのは彼に対する冗談のようなもので、今私は彼に読まれて困る感情はない。","en":"With that, I lowered the hand covering my eyes. The exaggerated gesture had been a joke at his expense; just then, I had no feelings I would mind him reading.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r227","rowIndex":227,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「しかし、病院のおつとめもあるのに、プライベートでまで<tips=78>金目</tips>の連中を診てやるとは、ご苦労なことです。でも、ほどほどにした方がいいですよ。先生の活発な慈善活動を『<tips=22>老人たち</tips>』はあまりよく思ってないって噂です」","en":"“Still, you have your duties at the hospital, yet you spend even your private hours treating the <tips=78>gold-eyes</tips>. Such devotion. But I’d be careful not to overdo it. I hear the ‘<tips=22>Elders</tips>’ don’t think much of your energetic charitable work.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r228","rowIndex":228,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　最近この街で手に入れた情報の一つを、彼の前にちらつかせる。","en":"I dangled before him one tidbit I had recently picked up in the city.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r229","rowIndex":229,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　この街ではギャングにしろ、商売人にしろ、出身地や人種によって固まっているケースが多いが、出身地も人種も問わない特別な、そして強力な秘密組織がこの街には存在する。","en":"In this city, gangs and merchants alike often formed groups according to place of origin or ethnicity. But the city also harbored a special and powerful secret organization that made no distinction between either.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r230","rowIndex":230,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"『<tips=21>八龍会</tips>』というのが正式名称だ。本来の発音に沿えば「バーロンフゥイ」となるのだろう。日本語で読み下して「はちりゅうかい」と呼ばれたり、また英語で「ドラゴン・クラブ」と呼ばれることも希にある。一般的には「バーロン」と略されるか、「<tips=22>老人たち</tips>」と隠語で呼ばれることが多い。","en":"Its official name was the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips>. Following the original pronunciation, it would be called Bā Lóng Huì. It was sometimes read in Japanese as Hachiryukai and, on rare occasions, called the Dragon Club in English. Usually, however, the name was shortened to Balong or referred to in code as “the <tips=22>Elders</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r231","rowIndex":231,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　中国語圏のどこかに、<tips=17>タイプB</tips>の美称として『龍』という言葉を使う地域があるらしい。","en":"Somewhere in the Chinese-speaking world, apparently, there was a region where the word “dragon” served as a flattering name for <tips=17>Type Bs</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r232","rowIndex":232,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　つまり、これは<tips=17>タイプB</tips>たちの組織なのだ。","en":"In other words, this was an organization of <tips=17>Type Bs</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r233","rowIndex":233,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　精神面にハンディキャップを持ち、差別の対象になりやすい<tips=17>タイプB</tips>たちが、人種、年齢、社会的立場に関わらず、自由な身分で密かに通じ合い、お互いを助け合うというのがその組織の目的だ。","en":"Its purpose was to allow <tips=17>Type Bs</tips>—people burdened with mental disabilities and therefore prone to discrimination—to communicate secretly and aid one another as free individuals, without regard to race, age, or social position.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r234","rowIndex":234,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　どの地域にも似たような組織があるらしいが、<tips=9>Y地区</tips>では特に<tips=17>タイプB</tips>が多く、社会のあらゆる場所に存在しているため、影響力が大きい。しかも基本的には会員であることを公表しないために、その影響が目に見えない。","en":"Similar organizations apparently existed in every region. In <tips=9>Y District</tips>, however, <tips=17>Type Bs</tips> were especially numerous and occupied every part of society, giving the organization great influence. Because members ordinarily concealed their affiliation, that influence remained invisible.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r235","rowIndex":235,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その会員は、例えばスーパーマーケットの店員にもいるだろうし、警察官にもいるだろうし、地域の最大マフィア組織である<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>の内部にもいるだろうが、具体的に誰が会員かとなればそれはわからない。","en":"Its membership presumably included supermarket employees, police officers, and people within <tips=7>YS</tips>, the region’s largest Mafia organization. Which particular individuals were members, however, no one could say.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r236","rowIndex":236,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　この不気味な組織の指導者は、<tips=9>Y地区</tips>の一角に住む三人の<tips=22>老人たち</tips>であることはよく知られている。","en":"Everyone knew that the leaders of this sinister organization were three old men living in one corner of <tips=9>Y District</tips>—the three known as the <tips=22>Elders</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r237","rowIndex":237,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　だから、この街のなかでは、この見えない脅威への恐れと、幾分かの<tips=17>タイプB</tips>への侮蔑心から『<tips=22>老人たち</tips>』と隠語で呼ぶ者が多いのだ。","en":"Thus many people in the city referred to the invisible threat in code as “the <tips=22>Elders</tips>,” expressing both their fear of it and a measure of contempt for <tips=17>Type Bs</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r238","rowIndex":238,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……彼らに対して何かをした覚えはありませんが？」","en":"“...I don’t recall having done anything to them.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"太刀川良馬","displayName":"Ryoma Tachikawa","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r239","rowIndex":239,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　案の定気になったようで、<tips=5>太刀川</tips>は私の方を見た。","en":"As expected, that had caught <tips=5>Tachikawa’s</tips> attention, and he looked at me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r240","rowIndex":240,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いやいや」","en":"“No, no.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r241","rowIndex":241,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　今は、感情を悟られたくはない。","en":"This time, I did not want him reading my feelings.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r242","rowIndex":242,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は今度は冗談ではなく、手で目を隠した。","en":"This time in earnest, I covered my eyes with one hand.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r243","rowIndex":243,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あなたの慈善行為が、気に障るんです。……もちろん先生は純粋に善意から診察をしているのは私はよく知っています。しかし、世の中には善意による行動というものが存在することを信じず、利害関係でしか物事を解釈出来ない無粋な連中は多いですからね。『<tips=22>老人たち</tips>』も、わざわざそんな面倒なことをする先生には下心があると考えているようですよ。身よりがない<tips=17>タイプB</tips>の子供や大人を手なずけて、何か企んでいるのだろうってね」","en":"“It’s your charity that bothers them. ...Of course, I know perfectly well that you treat these people out of pure goodwill. But there are plenty of boors in the world who refuse to believe that anyone ever acts from goodwill, and who can understand things only in terms of self-interest. The ‘<tips=22>Elders</tips>’ apparently think that anyone who goes to such trouble must have an ulterior motive. They say you’re taming <tips=17>Type B</tips> children and adults with no family to call their own as part of some scheme.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r244","rowIndex":244,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あきれたものです」","en":"“Unbelievable.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"太刀川良馬","displayName":"Ryoma Tachikawa","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r245","rowIndex":245,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=5>太刀川</tips>は溜息をついた。","en":"<tips=5>Tachikawa</tips> sighed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r246","rowIndex":246,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうでしょう。先生のような奇特な聖人にとっては、ああいった俗物どもの考えは理解出来ますまい。でも、もっと行動には注意した方がいい。世の中というものは、そうした俗物どもの感情で動いているものですし、あなたの正体は、知っている人ならば知っています。ごく限られた人間ですがね。警戒されても仕方がないでしょう？」","en":"“Exactly. A rare saint like you could never understand how such philistines think. Still, you ought to be more careful about what you do. The world runs on the feelings of men like them, and there are people who know what you really are—very few, granted. You can hardly blame them for being wary, can you?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r247","rowIndex":247,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いや、あきれたというのは、そんなくだらない話を、この雨の中でながながと私に聞かせたあなたについてです」","en":"“No. What I find unbelievable is you, making me stand here in the rain while you tell me such nonsense at such length.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"太刀川良馬","displayName":"Ryoma Tachikawa","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r248","rowIndex":248,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「これは、もう一本取られましたな」","en":"“You got me again.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r249","rowIndex":249,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その皮肉に、私は笑わずにはいられなかった。","en":"I could not help laughing at the sarcasm.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r250","rowIndex":250,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「くだらないかもしれないですが、私にとっては重要でね。時は流れても変わらないものはあるんですよ。先生にとっては忘れかけた過去の話でも、街はしっかりと覚えています。……そういえば、<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>が死の床に伏しているという話を知っていますか？　……おや、その様子だとご存じがないようだ。まあ、表の生活に戻られた先生には裏社会の噂など耳に入ることはないのでしょうね。しかし、一度くらい連絡をとってみたらいかがですかねえ？　彼も、最後にもう一度先生と会いたいと思っているでしょう。なんでも、死を目前にして既に意識も定かではないという話です」","en":"“It may be nonsense, but it matters to me. Time passes, yet some things do not change. It may be a piece of the past you’ve nearly forgotten, but the city remembers perfectly well. ...Speaking of which, have you heard that <tips=3>Chris Tse</tips> is on his deathbed? ...Ah, from the look of you, apparently not. I suppose underworld rumors no longer reach a man who’s returned to respectable life. Still, why not contact him at least once? He may want to see you one last time. I hear death is close and he’s barely lucid anymore.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r251","rowIndex":251,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は指の隙間から、そっと彼の顔を見た。","en":"I stole a cautious look at his face through the gap between my fingers.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r252","rowIndex":252,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それこそ、私には関係のない話です」","en":"“That really has nothing to do with me.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"太刀川良馬","displayName":"Ryoma Tachikawa","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r253","rowIndex":253,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私には彼のような読心能力はないが、経験によって多少は人の感情を読むのに自信がある。","en":"I had no power to read minds as he did, but experience had given me some confidence in reading people’s emotions.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r254","rowIndex":254,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その私の目からすると、関係ないと言いつつも、<tips=5>太刀川</tips>はわずかに動揺しているように見えた。","en":"To my eyes, <tips=5>Tachikawa</tips> seemed slightly shaken despite insisting that it had nothing to do with him.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r255","rowIndex":255,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そうだろう。今は全く別の道を歩いているとは言え、<tips=5>太刀川</tips>には、<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>と一心同体だった時代があった。","en":"That was only natural, I thought. However different the road he walked now, there had been a time when <tips=5>Tachikawa</tips> and <tips=3>Chris Tse</tips> had been inseparable.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r256","rowIndex":256,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いや、余談が長くなって申し訳ありません。これは話の成り行きで語っただけで、声をかけた本当の用事はまったく別の件なんです」","en":"“Sorry for the long digression. I only mentioned it because our conversation happened to lead there. The real reason I stopped you is something else entirely.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r257","rowIndex":257,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>のニュースを口にすることで、多少なりとも<tips=5>太刀川</tips>に私の言葉を聞く姿勢が出来たのを確認出来たので、私は本題に入ることにした。","en":"I had confirmed that the news about <tips=3>Chris Tse</tips> had made <tips=5>Tachikawa</tips> at least somewhat more willing to hear me out, so I turned to the real subject.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r258","rowIndex":258,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まだ何か話すつもりですか？　どうしてあなたはそんな大きな身体をしているのに、そんなにおしゃべりなのでしょう」","en":"“Are you going to keep talking? How can such a large man be such a chatterbox?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"太刀川良馬","displayName":"Ryoma Tachikawa","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r259","rowIndex":259,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「へえ、身体が大きいと、口数が少なくなるというような医学的根拠があるんですか？」","en":"“Oh? Is there medical evidence that having a large body makes a person less talkative?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r260","rowIndex":260,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「とてもつき合いきれませんね」","en":"“I really can’t keep indulging you.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"太刀川良馬","displayName":"Ryoma Tachikawa","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r261","rowIndex":261,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そこで<tips=5>太刀川</tips>が私に背を向けようとしたので、","en":"<tips=5>Tachikawa</tips> began to turn his back upon me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r262","rowIndex":262,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「次に殺されるのは、あなたの患者かもしれませんよ！」","en":"“Your patient may be the next one murdered!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r263","rowIndex":263,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は大声でそう言い、彼の足を止めた。","en":"I shouted after him, stopping him in his tracks.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r264","rowIndex":264,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「先生、最近<tips=59>暗闇通り</tips>から<tips=58>パラシュート通り</tips>に行く辺りで、連続殺人事件が起こっているのをご存じですか？」","en":"“Doctor, do you know about the recent series of murders in the area between <tips=59>Darkness Street</tips> and <tips=58>Parachute Street</tips>?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r265","rowIndex":265,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は先ほどから指の小さな隙間から彼の様子を観察していたのだが、ここでわざと指を大きく開いて、いかにも『あんたのいまの顔を見たぞ』というそぶりをしてからすぐに閉じた。","en":"I had been watching him through a narrow gap between my fingers. Now I deliberately spread them wide, ostentatiously letting him know I had seen the look on his face, then closed them again at once.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r266","rowIndex":266,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=5>太刀川</tips>は正直なたちで、露骨に不快な表情をする。","en":"Honest by nature, <tips=5>Tachikawa</tips> made no attempt to hide his displeasure.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r267","rowIndex":267,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　思い通りの反応に、私は思わず笑いつつ、","en":"The reaction was exactly what I wanted. Unable to suppress a smile, I went on:","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r268","rowIndex":268,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「若い女がバラバラ死体にされるってやつですよ。観光客だったり、地元の若い子だったりね。あのあたりは先生が診てる患者もたくさん住んでるんじゃないですか？」","en":"“Young women are turning up in pieces. Some tourists, some local girls. Plenty of your patients live around there, don’t they?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r269","rowIndex":269,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=5>太刀川</tips>は言葉を返さなかったが、内心では穏やかではないらしく、傘が傾き、雨が肩を濡らす。","en":"<tips=5>Tachikawa</tips> did not answer, but he appeared far from calm. His umbrella tilted, allowing the rain to wet one shoulder.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r270","rowIndex":270,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　すぐに彼もそれに気がつき、傘の位置を直した。","en":"He noticed a moment later and righted the umbrella.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r271","rowIndex":271,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どういうわけか、私はその事件を調べるってことになってしまいましてね。途方に暮れていたんですが、先生が力を貸してくれれば百人力だ。ギャラは出ると思いますよ。引き受けていただけなければ明かすことは出来ないのですが、スポンサーはしっかりしたところなので安心してください。街の人々の命を守るために、是非とも、おれと一緒に……」","en":"“Somehow or other, I’ve ended up investigating those crimes. I was at a loss, but with your help I’d have the strength of a hundred men. I expect there’ll be a fee. I can’t tell you who the sponsor is unless you accept, but they’re perfectly reputable, so don’t worry. To protect the lives of the people of this city, I implore you to join me and—”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r272","rowIndex":272,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そこで<tips=5>太刀川</tips>は私に背を向け、その場を去ろうとする。","en":"At that point, <tips=5>Tachikawa</tips> turned his back upon me and began to leave.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r273","rowIndex":273,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は構わず言葉を続けた。　","en":"Undeterred, I kept talking.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r274","rowIndex":274,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「先生！　こう見えて、私はあなたのことを尊敬しているんですよ。我々のような実用的な力をもった<tips=16>タイプA</tips>は、本来ならばその力を正しく使わなくっちゃいけない。それはねえ、企業や政府に高く売って、出世したり、自分の欲を満たすってことじゃないんです。他の誰にも助けられないような、弱いものたちを救うのは、この世界のルールから逸脱した力をもった我々の使命なんですよ……先生のやり方はまさに理想的だ。聞いてますか？　<tips=5>太刀川</tips>さん！」","en":"“Doctor! I may not look it, but I respect you. <tips=16>Type As</tips> like us, with powers that are actually useful, ought to use them properly. I don’t mean selling those powers to corporations or governments for the highest price, climbing the ladder, and gratifying ourselves. We possess powers that stand outside the rules of this world; our duty is to save the vulnerable people no one else can. What you’re doing is exactly the ideal. Are you listening, Dr. <tips=5>Tachikawa</tips>?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r275","rowIndex":275,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=5>太刀川</tips>は振り返りもせずにそのまま歩いて行く。","en":"<tips=5>Tachikawa</tips> continued walking without looking back.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r276","rowIndex":276,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「私はねえ、<tips=5>太刀川</tips>さん。我々のような人間は、常に奉仕の気持ちでいなければならないと思っているんですよ。そうでなければ、きっと恐ろしいことをしでかしてしまうでしょうからね」","en":"“You know, Dr. <tips=5>Tachikawa</tips>, I believe people like us must always hold on to the desire to serve others. Otherwise, sooner or later, we’re bound to do something terrible.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r277","rowIndex":277,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は聞こえていないのを承知でそう呟くと、一人笑って、そして溜息をついた。","en":"Knowing he could no longer hear me, I muttered the words, laughed to myself, and sighed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r278","rowIndex":278,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その後私は<tips=59>暗闇通り</tips>にあるバーに酒を飲みに行き、一人の女と出会った。","en":"Afterward, I went drinking at a bar on <tips=59>Darkness Street</tips> and met a woman.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r279","rowIndex":279,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　薄暗い店内の片隅には狭い店内に似つかわしくないグランドピアノが設置してあり、時々マスターがピアニストを呼んで客に生演奏を聴かせる。","en":"A grand piano, wildly out of place in the cramped interior, occupied one corner of the dim bar. From time to time, the proprietor invited a pianist to perform live for his customers.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r280","rowIndex":280,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　今はすっかり有名になってしまったムニラが、この街で暮らしていた無名時代にこのピアノを弾いたことがあるとマスターはよく誇らしげに語るが、私の記憶にはない。毎日通っていたわけではなかったから確証はないにしろ、どうにも眉唾だ。","en":"The proprietor often boasted that Munira, now famous, had once played this piano back when she was an unknown living in the city. I had no memory of it. Then again, I had not come every day, so I could not be certain; still, the story struck me as dubious.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r281","rowIndex":281,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ムニラはなぜか世間では<tips=9>Y地区</tips>の貧民街で育ったように言われているが、彼女は地区の内外に何店舗かの料理店を経営する実業家、アリー・マリクの養女であり、<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>と強い結びつきを持つ資産家の娘だ。","en":"For some reason, Munira was commonly said to have grown up in the slums of <tips=9>Y District</tips>. In truth, she was the adopted daughter of Ali Malik, a businessman who owned several restaurants within the district and beyond—and a wealthy man with close ties to <tips=7>YS</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r282","rowIndex":282,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　この街ではトップエリートの部類であり、いくら無名であったとは言え、その令嬢が<tips=59>暗闇通り</tips>のこんなバーでアルバイトをするとは考えにくい。","en":"She belonged to the highest echelon of the city’s elite. Even if she had yet to make a name for herself, it was hard to imagine a daughter of that family working part-time at a bar like this one on <tips=59>Darkness Street</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r283","rowIndex":283,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　マスターの作り話であろう。","en":"The master must have invented the tale.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r284","rowIndex":284,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そのピアノで、いつもここで弾いているピアニストとは違う、見慣れぬ女が演奏していた。","en":"An unfamiliar woman—not the pianist who usually played here—was seated at that piano.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r285","rowIndex":285,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「新しい子かい？」","en":"“Is she new?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r286","rowIndex":286,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　訊ねると、","en":"When I asked, the proprietor replied:","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r287","rowIndex":287,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「客だよ。どうしても弾きたいって言うんで、弾かせたんだ」","en":"“A customer. She said she simply had to play, so I let her.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r288","rowIndex":288,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「うまいな。いつも来てる子より上手いんじゃないか？」","en":"“She’s good. Better than the girl who usually plays here, don’t you think?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r289","rowIndex":289,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その女は頬をアルコールによって真っ赤に染めていたが、演奏はよどみなく、指がもつれるようなことはなかった。","en":"Alcohol had turned the woman’s cheeks scarlet, yet her performance flowed without a stumble, and her fingers never faltered.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r290","rowIndex":290,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「驚いている。いつものだって、相当上手い部類なんだぜ？　もしかしたら、名のあるピアニストなのかもしれない」","en":"“I’m astonished. The usual girl is already quite a pianist, you know. Maybe this woman is someone famous.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r291","rowIndex":291,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　マスターは感嘆の溜息をつく。","en":"The master sighed in admiration.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r292","rowIndex":292,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しかし、私を驚かせたのは、そのピアノの腕前よりも、美貌であった。","en":"Yet her beauty astonished me more than her skill at the piano.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r293","rowIndex":293,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　この街では外見だけで出身地を当てるのが非常に困難だが、髪や瞳の色や顔立ちからすると、東洋人であろうと思われる。","en":"In this city, it was exceedingly difficult to identify a person’s origins by appearance alone. Judging from the color of her hair and eyes and the shape of her features, however, she appeared Asian.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r294","rowIndex":294,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　年齢は二十代後半から、三十代前半と言ったところか。","en":"She was perhaps in her late twenties or early thirties.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r295","rowIndex":295,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　演奏が終わったところで、私は彼女にカクテルを一杯おごり、名前を尋ねた。彼女は私の額に生えた角に驚きの表情を見せてから、","en":"When she finished playing, I bought her a cocktail and asked her name. She stared in surprise at the horn protruding from my forehead, then answered,","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r296","rowIndex":296,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……<tips=61>ヒトミ</tips>よ」","en":"“<tips=61>Hitomi</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r297","rowIndex":297,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「名字は」","en":"“Your surname?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r298","rowIndex":298,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「名前なんか必要かしら？」","en":"“Do you really need a name?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r299","rowIndex":299,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　と肩をすくめる。","en":"She shrugged.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r300","rowIndex":300,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「日本人なのか？」","en":"“Are you Japanese?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r301","rowIndex":301,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「うふふ、どうかしら。私もよく知らないわ」","en":"“Hee-hee. Who knows? I’m not really sure myself.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r302","rowIndex":302,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女は艶っぽく笑ってから、私の差し出した酒を一口飲む。","en":"She gave a sultry laugh and took a sip of the drink I had offered.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r303","rowIndex":303,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あなたこそ、どういう人なの？　随分不思議な姿をしているけれど。全身ずぶ濡れで、その角……まるで鬼みたいだわ」","en":"“What about you? Who are you? You’re quite a strange sight, soaked to the skin with that horn of yours... You look just like an ogre.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r304","rowIndex":304,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「れっきとした人間だよ。おそらく」","en":"“I am unquestionably human. Probably.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r305","rowIndex":305,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「良い返事だわ。……私もそうよ。何人か、何者なのかはわからないけれど、人間のはずだわ。おそらくね」","en":"“Good answer. ...The same goes for me. I don’t know what nationality I am, or even what I am, but I ought to be human. Probably.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r306","rowIndex":306,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうかい。まあ、この街はそんなやつばっかりだ」","en":"“I see. Well, this city is full of people like that.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r307","rowIndex":307,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「うふふ、そうね」","en":"“Hee-hee. That's true.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r308","rowIndex":308,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして女は、もう一口酒を飲み、自分の唇についた雫を舌で舐めとった。","en":"The woman took another sip, then licked a droplet from her lips.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r309","rowIndex":309,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　奇妙な女だった。私の角を見れば<tips=16>タイプＡ</tips>であることは自明であり、初対面の人間はその能力の内容を気にする。","en":"She was a peculiar woman. My horn made it obvious at a glance that I was <tips=16>Type A</tips>, and people meeting me for the first time invariably wondered what my power was.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r310","rowIndex":310,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ズケズケと単刀直入に訊ねる失礼なものも居れば、興味がないフリを装いながらも興味を隠せず婉曲にそちらの話題に触れようとするものもいる。しかし、彼女のように、最初に角のことを口にしただけであとは一切そのことに触れようとせず、一方的に喋り続ける人間には出会ったことがなかった。","en":"Some were rude enough to ask me outright. Others feigned indifference but could not hide their curiosity, and tried to steer the conversation toward it indirectly. But I had never met anyone like her: someone who remarked on the horn at first, never tried to return to the subject, and simply talked at me instead.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r311","rowIndex":311,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女の話す内容はとりとめがなかった。","en":"There was no rhyme or reason to the things she talked about.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r312","rowIndex":312,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=57>滑走路通り</tips>で買った軽食がとてもまずかったことを話していたかと思えば、猫と犬を比較して結局自分はどちらも好きでないと言ってみたり。","en":"One moment she was telling me how awful a snack she had bought on <tips=57>Runway Street</tips> had been; the next she was comparing cats and dogs, only to conclude that she liked neither.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r313","rowIndex":313,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　表情がコロコロと変わる、感情表現の豊かな女だった。","en":"Her expression changed from moment to moment; she was vividly expressive.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r314","rowIndex":314,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　直接そう口にしたわけではないが、やはり音楽に関わる何かをしているのだろうと思った。","en":"She never said so directly, but I assumed she must be involved in music somehow.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r315","rowIndex":315,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　音楽用語を比喩に使ったり、私が名前だけしか知らないような現代音楽家の名を口にしてみたり、言葉の端々に造詣の深さを感じさせる表現を使っていた。","en":"She spoke in metaphors drawn from musical terminology, dropped the names of contemporary musicians who were little more than names to me, and scattered her speech with expressions that betrayed the depth of her knowledge.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r316","rowIndex":316,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「きみは不思議な女だな。なんの用事でこの街に来た？」","en":"“You are a peculiar woman. What business brought you to this city?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r317","rowIndex":317,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「好きで来たわけじゃないわ。他人の用事に付き合わされて、気がつけばここに居たのよ。私は出来ればこんなところに来たくなんかなかった。……でもしかたないわね。私の運命なんか、いつもそんなものだもの」","en":"“It wasn’t my idea to come. I got dragged along on someone else’s business, and before I knew it, here I was. If I’d had any choice, I would never have come to a place like this. ...But there’s no helping it. That’s how my fate always seems to go.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r318","rowIndex":318,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　女は溜息をつく。","en":"The woman sighed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r319","rowIndex":319,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　仕事のためにあちこちを飛び回る音楽関係者か、或いは、どこかの金持ちの囲われ女か何かで、男に連れ回されているのか。","en":"Perhaps she worked in the music business and traveled from place to place for her job. Or perhaps she was some rich man’s kept woman, dragged wherever he chose to go.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r320","rowIndex":320,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　女は傍らに大きなスーツケースを置いている。このようなバーに飲みに来るだけならホテルに置いておくべきような荷物を、どうして持って出ているのか。不穏な事情があるのかもしれない。","en":"A large suitcase stood beside her. If she had come merely to drink at a bar like this, it was the sort of luggage she should have left at her hotel. Why carry it around with her? Perhaps there was something ominous behind it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r321","rowIndex":321,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　あてずっぽうで想像してみたが、アルコールが回りつつある私にとって、実のところ彼女の素性に対する関心はほとんどなかった。いま興味があるのは彼女の肉体だけだ。","en":"I indulged in idle speculation, but in truth, with the alcohol beginning to work on me, I had almost no interest in who she really was. Her body was all that interested me now.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r322","rowIndex":322,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　女は胸元の開いた、ドレスのような服を着ている。そうして露わになった鎖骨に、喋りながら時々触った。","en":"The woman wore a dresslike garment cut low at the chest. As she spoke, she sometimes touched her exposed collarbone.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r323","rowIndex":323,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　女の、いかにも音楽家らしい、長く細い指がそこに触れるたび、私は目の前がくらくらとするような興奮を感じた。","en":"Whenever the woman’s long, slender, unmistakably musicianlike fingers touched that bare skin, a dizzying excitement came over me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r324","rowIndex":324,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私はおしゃべりに返事もせず、ずっと相手の目を見つめていると、そのうち女は言葉少なになった。","en":"I offered no reply to her chatter, only held her gaze. Before long, she began to talk less and less.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r325","rowIndex":325,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そこで私が誘うと、女はこくりと頷いてそれに応じた。","en":"When I propositioned her, she answered with a little nod.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r326","rowIndex":326,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　女はこうした誘いを受けるのも、それに乗るのも慣れているようだった。","en":"She seemed accustomed both to being propositioned this way and to saying yes.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r327","rowIndex":327,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ホテルに到着すると、余計な手間や時間を使わずに、我々はお互いの服を脱がせ、ベッドの上で素肌を重ねることになる。","en":"Once we reached the hotel, we wasted no time or effort on anything unnecessary. We undressed one another and lay together naked on the bed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r328","rowIndex":328,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして私たちはその遊戯を楽しんだ。","en":"And so we enjoyed our game.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r329","rowIndex":329,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しかし、一体この女は何者なのだろう？","en":"But who in the world was this woman?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r330","rowIndex":330,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　大きなスーツケースを持っているところを見ると旅行者のようだ。その表面の革が傷だらけなのを見ると、これを持って今まで色々な場所を旅して来たに違いない。","en":"The large suitcase suggested that she was a traveler. Its leather was scarred all over; she must have carried it with her through any number of places.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r331","rowIndex":331,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"『流しの演奏家』という言葉が思い浮かぶが、そんな詩的な職業が現実に存在するのだろうか。","en":"The phrase “wandering musician” came to mind, but did such a poetic occupation really exist?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r332","rowIndex":332,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そんなことを考えつつ、濃密な時間を終えた。","en":"With those thoughts running through my mind, I brought our intense time together to an end.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r333","rowIndex":333,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　二人とも汗だくで、はあはあと荒い息をついている。","en":"Both of us were drenched in sweat, panting heavily.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r334","rowIndex":334,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あなた、タフなのねえ……」","en":"“You’ve certainly got stamina...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r335","rowIndex":335,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　女はそう言って、まだ紅潮している頬に微笑を浮かべる。","en":"The woman smiled, her cheeks still flushed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r336","rowIndex":336,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして立ち上がると、シャワーも浴びずに服を身につけはじめた。","en":"Then she rose and began dressing without even taking a shower.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r337","rowIndex":337,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「何をそんなに急いでいるんだ？」","en":"“Why are you in such a hurry?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r338","rowIndex":338,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「別に急いでいるわけじゃないわ。もう用は終わったから」","en":"“I’m not in a hurry. We’re simply done here.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r339","rowIndex":339,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　女は身体にぴったりと沿ったラインを持つ服のファスナーを引き上げながらそう言った。","en":"She answered as she pulled up the zipper of her close-fitting dress.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r340","rowIndex":340,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「合理的だ」","en":"“Efficient.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r341","rowIndex":341,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私はそう言って、ベッドの上からサイドテーブルに手を伸ばし、ビールのボトルを手に取った。","en":"From the bed, I reached toward the side table and took a bottle of beer.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r342","rowIndex":342,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「帰るなら、気をつけた方が良い」","en":"“If you’re leaving, be careful.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r343","rowIndex":343,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「平気よ。私、この街に来るのが初めてってわけじゃないんだから。昔、住んでたことだってあるのよ」","en":"“I’ll be fine. This is not my first time in the city. I even lived here once.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r344","rowIndex":344,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そう言って女はスーツケースに手をかける。","en":"The woman reached for her suitcase.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r345","rowIndex":345,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうだったのか。それにしては、見たことがない顔だな。きみみたいな女なら、すれ違っただけでも覚えているはずだが」","en":"“Really? I’m surprised I’ve never seen you before. A woman like you—I’d remember even if we’d only passed each other in the street.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r346","rowIndex":346,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まあ、この街の女の顔を全部知っているような言い方ね！」","en":"“My. You speak as if you know the face of every woman in the city!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r347","rowIndex":347,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　女は笑う。","en":"The woman laughed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r348","rowIndex":348,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「この街に住んでいたことがあるならば治安が良くないことは知っているだろうが、最近は少し別の事情がある」","en":"“If you’ve lived here before, you already know the city isn’t safe. But lately there’s been something else to worry about.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r349","rowIndex":349,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「事情？」","en":"“Something else?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r350","rowIndex":350,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どうも、おかしな殺人鬼が住み着いているらしいんだ」","en":"“It seems some strange killer has made himself at home here.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r351","rowIndex":351,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「へえ、殺人鬼」","en":"“Oh? A killer.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r352","rowIndex":352,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　女はまた笑う。","en":"The woman laughed again.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r353","rowIndex":353,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「冗談じゃないさ」","en":"“I’m not joking.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r354","rowIndex":354,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私はボトルを飲み干してテーブルの上に戻すと、","en":"I emptied the bottle and returned it to the table.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r355","rowIndex":355,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「女ばかりを殺して、切り分けて、きっちりと棚に並べて整理するんだとさ。コンビニの陳列棚のスナック菓子みたいに」","en":"“I hear he kills women and only women, cuts them up, and sorts the pieces neatly onto shelves. Like bags of snacks in a convenience-store display.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r356","rowIndex":356,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「へえ……」","en":"“Oh...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r357","rowIndex":357,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　女は驚くでも怯えるでもなく、興ざめしたような表情をした。","en":"The woman looked neither surprised nor frightened. If anything, she seemed to have lost interest.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r358","rowIndex":358,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なんだか気持ちのわるい話ね。……でも、この街には、そんな人間だってありふれているんじゃないの？」","en":"“What a sickening story. ...But aren’t people like that a dime a dozen in this city?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r359","rowIndex":359,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「とんでもない。よく誤解されるが、この街にはこの街なりのルールがある。残酷な事件はよくあるが、何にだって背景があるのさ。まあ、たまに<tips=17>タイプＢ</tips>が妄想にとりつかれておかしなことをしたりはするが、それにしたって、そうそうあるものじゃない」","en":"“Not at all. People often get this wrong, but even this city has rules of its own. Brutal incidents are common, but there’s a reason behind every one of them. Now and then a <tips=17>Type B</tips> may fall prey to some delusion and do something strange, granted, but even that is rare.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r360","rowIndex":360,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうそうはなくとも、全くないわけじゃないんだ」","en":"“Rare or not, that means it does happen.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r361","rowIndex":361,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　女は苦笑する。","en":"The woman smiled wryly.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r362","rowIndex":362,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まあね。……とにかく、その連続殺人鬼のやりかたは特別なんだ。海外の人間で、世界中で殺人を繰り返した札付きのやつらしい。誰にも捕まえることが出来なかった……何か特殊な力があるやつなんだろう」","en":"“Well, yes. ...Anyway, this serial killer’s methods are exceptional. He’s apparently a notorious foreigner who has committed murder all over the world, and no one has ever been able to catch him... He must have some kind of special power.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r363","rowIndex":363,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まあ、そんなニュース聞いたこともないわ。詳しいのね」","en":"“My, I’ve never heard a word about any of this. You certainly know a lot.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r364","rowIndex":364,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうさ。だから、あんたがいくらこの街に慣れているとしても、ちょっと気をつけたほうが良い」","en":"“That's right. So however familiar you are with the city, you should still be careful.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r365","rowIndex":365,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「用が済んだあとの女に対して、随分優しいのね」","en":"“You’re remarkably kind to a woman now that you’re finished with her.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r366","rowIndex":366,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「忠告しないで死なれたらさすがに気分が悪い。忠告を無視して死んだのならなんとも思わないがね。つまり自分の精神衛生のために、ちょっと口を動かしてみただけなのさ」","en":"“I’d feel rotten if you died because I hadn’t warned you. If you ignore my warning and die anyway, I won’t feel a thing. In other words, I only opened my mouth for the sake of my own peace of mind.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r367","rowIndex":367,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は肩をすくめてそう答えた。","en":"I answered with a shrug.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r368","rowIndex":368,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「というわけだから、とりあえずおれは義務を果たした。あとはきみが自分で決めればいい」","en":"“In any case, I have now fulfilled my duty. The decision is yours.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r369","rowIndex":369,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……そうまで言われて出て行く気にはなれないわ」","en":"“...After all that, I hardly feel like leaving.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r370","rowIndex":370,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　女も、私の真似をするように肩をすくめた。","en":"The woman shrugged in imitation of me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r371","rowIndex":371,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　翌朝、メールを読んだ<tips=48>堂島</tips>からの電話があり、その着信音で私は目を覚ました。","en":"The next morning, <tips=48>Dojima</tips> called after reading my message, and the ringing phone woke me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r372","rowIndex":372,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その時女は既に部屋にいなかった。それはいいのだが、同時に私の財布まで消えていた。","en":"By then, the woman was already gone from the room. That was fine, but my wallet had vanished along with her.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r373","rowIndex":373,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　やられた。あの女に盗まれたのだ。金に困っているようには見えなかったが、そうとしか考えられない。","en":"She got me. That woman had stolen it. She hadn't looked short of money, but there was no other explanation.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r374","rowIndex":374,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なんだきみ、やたらに女臭いじゃないか。それも、<tips=53>ミユキ</tips>さんじゃない。まったく不実な男だなきみは」","en":"“What’s this? You positively reek of a woman—and she isn’t <tips=53>Miyuki</tips>. You really are a faithless man.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"堂島","displayName":"Dojima","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r375","rowIndex":375,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　カルロッタの店で待ち合わせた<tips=48>堂島</tips>は、開口一番そう言った。","en":"Those were <tips=48>Dojima’s</tips> first words when we met at Carlotta’s bar.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r376","rowIndex":376,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あんたのその鼻でいろんなことがわかってしまうのは仕方ない。それはあんた自身でも制御出来ないことですから。けれど、そうして知ったことを臆面もなく口にするのは感心しませんな。それだから、いいとしをして結婚も出来ないし、友人もいない。あんたの前に来ると、なんでもあからさまに指摘されてしまうんだから当然だ」","en":"“It can’t be helped that nose of yours tells you all sorts of things. You have no control over that. But I can’t say I approve of you blurting out everything you learn without a trace of shame. That’s why a man your age still can’t get married and has no friends. Of course no one comes near you—you point out everything about them to their face.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r377","rowIndex":377,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は苦々しく舌打ちをする。そして私は、ポケットからハンドタオルを取り出すと<tips=48>堂島</tips>の顔に投げつける。","en":"I clicked my tongue in disgust. Then I pulled a hand towel from my pocket and flung it at <tips=48>Dojima’s</tips> face.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r378","rowIndex":378,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=48>堂島</tips>は手を上げて、それをキャッチする。","en":"<tips=48>Dojima</tips> raised one hand and caught it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r379","rowIndex":379,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「これはなんだ？」","en":"“What is this?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r380","rowIndex":380,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「女の使ったタオルですよ。それでばっちりにおいを覚えてください」","en":"“A towel the woman used. Get a good fix on her scent.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r381","rowIndex":381,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なぜ私がそんなことを」","en":"“Why would I do such a thing?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r382","rowIndex":382,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いや、あの女にきっちり話さなきゃならんことがあるんですよ。連絡先を聞きそびれたんで、旦那の力を借りたいんだ」","en":"“I have something I need to settle with that woman. I forgot to get her contact information, so I need your help, sir.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r383","rowIndex":383,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ふむ、随分しつこくするんだな」","en":"“Hmm. You are remarkably persistent.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r384","rowIndex":384,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そりゃ、かなりの美人でしたからね！」","en":"“Well, she was quite a beauty!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r385","rowIndex":385,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　すると<tips=48>堂島</tips>は呆れたように肩をすくめ、","en":"<tips=48>Dojima</tips> shrugged in exasperation.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r386","rowIndex":386,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「くだらん火遊びはやめた方が良い。そんな女にもう一度会おうだなんて、とんでもない話だ」","en":"“You would do well to give up these foolish affairs. Trying to see a woman like that again is out of the question.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r387","rowIndex":387,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「私だってあんたの頼みを聞いてやるわけなんですから、旦那も少しは私のために動いてくれたっていい」","en":"“I’m agreeing to help with your request, so you could stand to do one small thing for me too, sir.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r388","rowIndex":388,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「気が進まないな。まあ、もうにおいは覚えてしまった。私から積極的に協力する気はないが、何かの偶然で気がついたことがあったら言うさ。……じゃあ、そろそろ本題に入ろうか」","en":"“I’m not keen on the idea. Still, I’ve already learned her scent. I have no intention of actively helping you, but if I happen to notice something by chance, I’ll tell you. ...Now then, shall we get to the matter at hand?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r389","rowIndex":389,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=48>堂島</tips>はそう言いつつ、タオルを私に突き返そうとして、しかし途中でその手を引っ込め、首をひねる。","en":"As he spoke, <tips=48>Dojima</tips> held the towel out to return it to me. Halfway there, however, he pulled his hand back and cocked his head.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r390","rowIndex":390,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どうしました？」","en":"“What is it?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r391","rowIndex":391,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=48>堂島</tips>はすぐには答えないで、自分の手の中のタオルをもう一度嗅ぐ。","en":"<tips=48>Dojima</tips> did not answer at once. He raised the towel in his hand and sniffed it again.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r392","rowIndex":392,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いや……」","en":"“No...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r393","rowIndex":393,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　表情はわからないが、声色と態度からすると、驚いているようだ。","en":"I could not read his expression, but his voice and manner suggested surprise.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r394","rowIndex":394,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　散々嗅いだあと、首をひねり、","en":"After sniffing it over and over, he cocked his head again.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r395","rowIndex":395,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なんでもない。気のせいだったようだ」","en":"“It’s nothing. I must have imagined it.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r396","rowIndex":396,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いやあ、今の様子は気のせいって感じでもなかったですよ。そう言えば、この間もそんなふうに言葉を濁してましたね。大丈夫なんですか？　本当に能力がおかしくなってるんじゃないでしょうね？」","en":"“I don’t know—the way you just acted didn’t look like a simple mistake to me. Come to think of it, you were just as evasive the other day. Are you all right? Don’t tell me there really is something wrong with your power.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r397","rowIndex":397,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=48>堂島</tips>が差し出すタオルを受け取りながら私は渋い顔をする。","en":"Grimacing, I took the towel <tips=48>Dojima</tips> held out to me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r398","rowIndex":398,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「さあ、どうだろうな。私にも、よくわからないんだ」","en":"“Who knows? I do not fully understand it myself.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r399","rowIndex":399,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「しっかりしてくださいよ。これから一緒に仕事をしようってのに、それじゃ心許ない」","en":"“You need to get hold of yourself. If we are about to work together, this is hardly reassuring.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r400","rowIndex":400,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「私としてもなんとも言えないのだよ。年をとって能力が変質することもあるらしいからな。それより、女はなんというやつだった？　名前は？」","en":"“I couldn’t tell you. I hear a person’s power can change as they age. Never mind that—what did the woman call herself? What was her name?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r401","rowIndex":401,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……<tips=61>ヒトミ</tips>と言ってましたが、本名かどうかはわかりませんな」","en":"“...She said her name was <tips=61>Hitomi</tips>, but I don't know whether that was her real name.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r402","rowIndex":402,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どこで出会った？　どこに泊まっている？」","en":"“Where did you meet her? Where is she staying?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r403","rowIndex":403,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まったく知りませんよ。でも、興味をもってくれて私は嬉しいですよ。なんだかんだ言って、私のささやかな趣味に協力してくれるんですね」","en":"“I haven’t the slightest idea. Still, I’m delighted to see you taking an interest. For all your protests, you’re going to help me with my humble little hobby after all.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r404","rowIndex":404,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうじゃない」","en":"“That's not it.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r405","rowIndex":405,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「またまた。そんなに、女のことばかり訊ねて」","en":"“Oh, come now. All these questions about the woman say otherwise.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r406","rowIndex":406,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「私の能力がおかしくなったんじゃなくて、においの主の方に問題があるということもあるからな」","en":"“The problem may lie with the owner of the scent rather than with my ability.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r407","rowIndex":407,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どういう意味です？」","en":"“What do you mean?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r408","rowIndex":408,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「さあね」","en":"“Who knows?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r409","rowIndex":409,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=48>堂島</tips>は肩をすくめた。","en":"<tips=48>Dojima</tips> shrugged.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r410","rowIndex":410,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あんたの秘密主義には付き合えませんな」","en":"“I can’t keep playing along with all this secrecy of yours.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r411","rowIndex":411,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は苦々しく言う。","en":"I spoke bitterly.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r412","rowIndex":412,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「秘密主義はお互い様だろう。まあ、私なりの結論が出たら話すさ。とりあえず、仕事の話をしようか。何と言っても、我々の人生には仕事というものしかないのだからね」","en":"“You’re every bit as secretive as I am. Once I’ve reached my own conclusion, I’ll tell you. For now, let’s talk business. After all, work is the only thing either of us has in his life.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r413","rowIndex":413,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼は冗談のつもりで言ったようだが、声も顔も普段通りなので、私は受け取り方に困って溜息をついた。","en":"He appeared to intend a joke, but his voice and face remained precisely as usual. Unsure how to take it, I sighed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r414","rowIndex":414,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なるほど、つまり、顔見知りが被害者だったから、捜査に乗り気になったというわけだね」","en":"“I see. So learning that you knew one of the victims changed your mind about the investigation.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r415","rowIndex":415,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私が事情を話すと、<tips=48>堂島</tips>はそう言って頷いた。","en":"When I explained the circumstances, <tips=48>Dojima</tips> nodded.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r416","rowIndex":416,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それだけじゃあありませんがね。まあそれもあります」","en":"“That is not the only reason. But yes, it is one of them.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r417","rowIndex":417,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「理由はなんだっていいさ。こうして協力をしてくれることになったわけだからな」","en":"“The reason doesn't matter. What matters is that you've agreed to cooperate.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r418","rowIndex":418,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=48>堂島</tips>はそう言うと、懐から端末を取り出す。","en":"<tips=48>Dojima</tips> removed a terminal from inside his coat.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r419","rowIndex":419,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それならば、きみにもこちらの持っている情報を共有してもらう」","en":"“In that case, I’ll share the information we have with you as well.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r420","rowIndex":420,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それは助かりますが、その前に……」","en":"“That would help. But first...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r421","rowIndex":421,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ん？」","en":"“What is it?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r422","rowIndex":422,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「中和剤を」","en":"“The neutralizer.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r423","rowIndex":423,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ああ、そうだな」","en":"“Ah. Of course.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r424","rowIndex":424,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=48>堂島</tips>は別のポケットからアンプルの入ったケースを取り出す。","en":"<tips=48>Dojima</tips> removed a case containing ampoules from another pocket.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r425","rowIndex":425,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼は基本的に鞄を持たない人間で、必要なものはいつもジャケットのポケットにしまっている。だから、どんなに暑い夏だろうが、その黒いジャケットを手放さず、胸や腰のポケットは外から見てもわかるくらい膨らんでいる。","en":"He was not a man who carried a bag; everything he needed went into his jacket pockets. That was why he never parted with the black jacket, however hot the summer, and why the pockets at his chest and waist bulged visibly even from a distance.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r426","rowIndex":426,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それなりに仕立てのいい上等のジャケットのようだが、そのように酷使しているせいで、生地のあちこちがすり切れ、傷んでいる。","en":"It appeared to be an expensive jacket of reasonably fine tailoring, but the abuse had left its fabric frayed and worn in places all over.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r427","rowIndex":427,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　手渡されたケースにはアンプルが二本入っていた。","en":"The case he handed me contained two ampoules.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r428","rowIndex":428,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いくらなんでも少ない」","en":"“Two is far too few.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r429","rowIndex":429,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そう大量に持ち出せないんだ。使ったらまた渡す」","en":"“I can’t take them out in bulk. Once you’ve used those, I’ll give you more.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r430","rowIndex":430,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「仕方ないですね……。しかし、これで私も、生まれたままの本来の私として活動出来るわけだ」","en":"“I suppose I’ll have to make do... Still, this means I can finally operate as the real me—the way I was born.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r431","rowIndex":431,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「捜査以外には力を使うなよ。私が報告しなくても、きみが警察全体の監視対象であることはかわらない。おかしな使い方をすればすぐにバレるぞ」","en":"“Do not use your power for anything but the investigation. Whether I report you or not, you remain a subject of surveillance for the entire police force. Use it for anything strange and they’ll know at once.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r432","rowIndex":432,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「わかってますよ」","en":"“I understand.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r433","rowIndex":433,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私はそう言って、アンプルをポケットにしまう。","en":"I put the ampoules in my pocket.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r434","rowIndex":434,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……そう言えば、昨日<tips=5>太刀川</tips>先生に会いましたよ」","en":"“...Come to think of it, I met Dr. <tips=5>Tachikawa</tips> yesterday.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r435","rowIndex":435,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=5>太刀川</tips>？　……ああ、あの」","en":"“<tips=5>Tachikawa</tips>? ...Ah. That man.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r436","rowIndex":436,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうです。今回の捜査協力をお願いしてみたんですが、断られました」","en":"“Yes. I asked him to cooperate with this investigation, but he refused.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r437","rowIndex":437,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「だろうね。彼は立派な医者としてやっているそうじゃないか」","en":"“Of course he did. I hear he is working as a perfectly respectable doctor now.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r438","rowIndex":438,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「でも、まるっきり裏社会に興味がないような感じでもなかったですがね。<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>が死にそうなことを話したら、顔色が変わりましたよ」","en":"“Still, he didn’t seem entirely indifferent to the underworld. When I told him <tips=3>Chris Tse</tips> was on the verge of death, the look on his face changed.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r439","rowIndex":439,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうか」","en":"“I see.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r440","rowIndex":440,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「興味なさそうですね」","en":"“You don’t seem very interested.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r441","rowIndex":441,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「私が関心があるのは犯罪をおかした<tips=16>タイプA</tips>だけだ。彼は犯罪者じゃないからな。昔はともかく、今はね」","en":"“I am interested only in <tips=16>Type As</tips> who have committed crimes. Whatever he may have been in the past, he is not a criminal now.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r442","rowIndex":442,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「じゃあ、<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>は？」","en":"“What about <tips=3>Chris Tse</tips>?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r443","rowIndex":443,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「彼は現段階では捜査対象にしないという取り決めになっているからやはり興味がない。それにもうすぐ死ぬ。そんな人間を相手にする意味はあるかね」","en":"“We have an agreement not to make him a target of investigation for the time being, so he doesn’t interest me either. Besides, he’ll be dead soon. What would be the point of dealing with a man like that?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r444","rowIndex":444,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=48>堂島</tips>のそっけない態度に、私は苦笑し、","en":"I gave a wry smile at <tips=48>Dojima’s</tips> curt reply.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r445","rowIndex":445,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「私は、他の<tips=16>タイプA</tips>がどういう生き方をしているかっていうのは、いつも気になっていますよ」","en":"“I’m always curious about how other <tips=16>Type As</tips> live their lives.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r446","rowIndex":446,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうか」","en":"“I see.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r447","rowIndex":447,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「我々<tips=16>タイプA</tips>というものは、一人一人、全く違う特別な力と、個性的な容姿を与えられている。人間と言って良いのかわからないくらいのオリジナリティです。これはもう親や兄弟とも別の生き物なんですよ。特に、能力が強ければなおさらね……。強い能力をもった<tips=16>タイプA</tips>はその意志一つで、自分も周囲も……ときには世の中さえも、がらりと変えてしまう強大な力があるわけじゃないですか。孤立と恐るべき力を同時にあたえられ、これとどう向き合うかというのは、その人の本質が出るんですよ」","en":"“Every one of us <tips=16>Type As</tips> is given a unique power and a singular appearance. The originality is so profound that you can hardly be sure we ought to count as human at all. We are different creatures even from our own parents and siblings—and the stronger the power, the truer that becomes. ...A <tips=16>Type A</tips> with a powerful ability can, by an act of will, utterly transform himself and everything around him... sometimes even the world itself. We are given isolation and terrifying power at once. How a person confronts those gifts reveals his true nature.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r448","rowIndex":448,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私の言葉に、<tips=48>堂島</tips>は反応を見せない。それでも私は言葉を続ける。","en":"<tips=48>Dojima</tips> showed no response. I continued regardless.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r449","rowIndex":449,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……以前は私も他人のことなど気にしていなかったのですが、自分の能力を失ってからは、よく考えるようになりましてね。<tips=16>タイプA</tips>という存在の特別性と、そのあり方について。例えば、<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>のように、迷いなく超人として正々堂々と振る舞って自己実現を果たすというのも一つの生き方でしょう。また、<tips=5>太刀川</tips>先生のように、まるでこれは善良なる神から授かった使命だと言わんばかりに、ひたすら人を助ける奉仕の存在となるのも興味深い。……旦那は、正直よくわからないな。大した楽しみもなく、毎日仕事ばかりしている。危険で、しかも<tips=16>タイプA</tips>である旦那にしか出来ない特別な仕事なのに、月給もそれほど高くないって、知ってますよ。でも、それほど不満もなさそうだ。……そういえば、聞いたことがなかったですね。なんで警官になったんですか？」","en":"“...I never used to care about other people, but since losing my power I’ve found myself thinking often about what makes <tips=16>Type As</tips> special, and the different ways we can exist. Take <tips=3>Chris Tse</tips>: one path is to embrace being a superman without hesitation, stand proudly in the open, and realize yourself to the fullest. Then there is Dr. <tips=5>Tachikawa</tips>, who devotes himself to serving others as though it were a sacred charge bestowed by a benevolent God. That is fascinating in its own right. ...You, though, I honestly cannot understand, sir. You spend every day doing nothing but work, with no great pleasures to speak of. It’s dangerous, highly specialized work that only a <tips=16>Type A</tips> like you could do, yet I happen to know the monthly salary isn’t especially high. And still, you don’t seem all that dissatisfied. ...Come to think of it, I’ve never asked. Why did you become a police officer?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r450","rowIndex":450,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「私の話は別にいいだろう」","en":"“There is no need to discuss me.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r451","rowIndex":451,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「よかあないですよ。答えてもらいます」","en":"“Oh, there most certainly is. I want an answer.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r452","rowIndex":452,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「今はそんな無駄話をしている場合じゃない」","en":"“This is no time for idle conversation.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r453","rowIndex":453,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうは思いませんな。我々化け物二人が組んで、これから同胞である化け物を捕まえようと言うんだ。この、ノーマルの社会のために。……<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>って野郎はとんでもなく不快なやつですがね、<tips=16>タイプA</tips>がそういう異常犯罪に走る気持ちが全くわからないではないんですよ。私はね。だから、本格的に仕事に入る前に旦那の<tips=16>タイプA</tips>としての心構えを聞いておきたい」","en":"“I don’t agree. The two of us monsters are about to join forces and capture one of our fellow monsters, all for the sake of Normal society. ...This <tips=20>Koschei</tips> is an unspeakably unpleasant bastard, but I cannot claim to be wholly unable to understand what might drive a <tips=16>Type A</tips> to that kind of abnormal crime. So before we begin in earnest, I want to know how you approach this as a <tips=16>Type A</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r454","rowIndex":454,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「相変わらず見かけの割に口数の多い男だ」","en":"“As always, you talk an astonishing amount for a man who looks like you.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r455","rowIndex":455,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=48>堂島</tips>は溜息をつく。","en":"<tips=48>Dojima</tips> sighed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r456","rowIndex":456,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「旦那、知ってますか？　どこの国でもね、<tips=16>タイプA</tips>犯罪者を追う捜査官は、<tips=16>タイプA</tips>ばっかりなんですよ。その特殊な力が捜査に向くからというだけでなくてね。あまり捜査と関係ない能力者でも、自ら志願するんだそうです。どうしてだと思いますか？」","en":"“Did you know, sir? In every country, the investigators who hunt <tips=16>Type A</tips> criminals are almost all <tips=16>Type As</tips> themselves. And it isn’t merely that their special powers happen to suit police work. I hear even people whose abilities have almost nothing to do with investigation volunteer for the job. Why do you suppose that is?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r457","rowIndex":457,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「知らないな」","en":"“I have no idea.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r458","rowIndex":458,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ある心理学者が調査したんですが、彼らには共通する使命感があるんだそうです。同じ<tips=16>タイプA</tips>が社会に対して害を為しているから、自分がそれを捕まえる側に立って、<tips=16>タイプA</tips>は悪いものではないと証明しなくてはならないってね。これは、マイノリティならではの発想ですな。どこかと戦争になったとき、敵国となった国からの移民が、誰よりも勇敢な志願兵になるのとよく似ている。……そしてもう一つ」","en":"“A psychologist studied them and found that they shared a common sense of mission. When another <tips=16>Type A</tips> harms society, they feel they must stand on the side that captures him and prove that <tips=16>Type As</tips> are not evil. It is a distinctly minority way of thinking. When war breaks out, immigrants from the country that has become the enemy often volunteer and fight more bravely than anyone else. The impulse is much the same. ...Then there is one more thing.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r459","rowIndex":459,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は<tips=48>堂島</tips>の顔を見た。彼は無反応で、聞いているのかいないのか、わからぬような顔をして居る。","en":"I studied <tips=48>Dojima’s</tips> face. He gave no reaction; his expression offered no clue whether he was even listening.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r460","rowIndex":460,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「自分と同じ<tips=16>タイプA</tips>を、ノーマルや<tips=17>タイプB</tips>なんかに逮捕させたくないという心理も見られたそうです。そのノーマルを見下す意識からね。旦那は、こっちじゃありませんか？」","en":"“The study also reportedly found that they do not want to see another <tips=16>Type A</tips> arrested by a Normal or a <tips=17>Type B</tips>. It comes from their contempt for Normals. Isn't that your motive?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r461","rowIndex":461,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=48>堂島</tips>は溜息をつく。","en":"<tips=48>Dojima</tips> sighed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r462","rowIndex":462,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「特別な理由はないさ。安定した給料が出る仕事ならなんでもよかった」","en":"“There was no special reason. I would have accepted any job with stable pay.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r463","rowIndex":463,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「旦那は嘘つきだな」","en":"“You’re a liar, sir.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r464","rowIndex":464,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は肩をすくめ、","en":"I shrugged.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r465","rowIndex":465,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あんたは、どういうかたちであれ<tips=16>タイプA</tips>以外と関わりたくないんだ。だから、<tips=16>タイプA</tips>の犯罪者を一人で追い回すのが好きなんだ。歪んだ愛情みたいなもんですよ。だって、ノーマルである仲間の警官を信用せずに、私なんかのところに押しかけてくる。わかりやすい」","en":"“One way or another, you want nothing to do with anyone who isn’t <tips=16>Type A</tips>. That’s why you enjoy hunting <tips=16>Type A</tips> criminals all by yourself. It’s a kind of warped affection. You don’t trust your fellow police officers because they’re Normals, so instead you come barging in on someone like me. It could hardly be more obvious.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r466","rowIndex":466,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　堂島は否定も肯定もしない。ただ黙って私の顔を見ている。","en":"Dojima neither agreed nor denied it. He merely watched my face in silence.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r467","rowIndex":467,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そうだろう。自分に関する話題には、一切口を開かないのがこの<tips=48>堂島</tips>という男だ。","en":"Just as I thought. This was <tips=48>Dojima</tips>: whenever the subject turned to himself, he refused to say a word.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r468","rowIndex":468,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まあ、そんな姿と性格ですからね。さぞかしつらい人生だったでしょう。心が歪んでしまうのも同情しますな」","en":"“Well, with looks and a personality like yours, life must have been terribly hard. I can hardly blame you for ending up so warped.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r469","rowIndex":469,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そんなことはないさ」","en":"“That is not true.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r470","rowIndex":470,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　これまでの憂さを晴らすつもりで一方的にからかっていると、意外にも<tips=48>堂島</tips>は反論をした。","en":"I had been needling him without mercy, trying to vent my pent-up frustration. To my surprise, <tips=48>Dojima</tips> answered back.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r471","rowIndex":471,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「私は田舎暮らしだったんだが、家族も近所の子供たちも、非常によくしてくれた。少なくとも私は、子供の頃は自分がそこまで特別な容姿で、特別な能力だと悲観的に意識したことはない」","en":"“I grew up in the countryside, and my family and the other children in the neighborhood treated me exceptionally well. At least when I was a child, I never thought of my appearance and power as so exceptional that I ought to despair over them.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r472","rowIndex":472,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　驚くほど静かな口調だった。","en":"His tone was astonishingly quiet.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r473","rowIndex":473,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そんな風に、自分のことを話す<tips=48>堂島</tips>を見たことがない。","en":"I had never seen <tips=48>Dojima</tips> speak about himself in this fashion.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r474","rowIndex":474,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「きみや、私が仕事で関わる容疑者たちは、みな驚くほど特殊な幼年期を過ごしたようだが、私には本当にそういった経験がないんだよ。幸福だったんだと思う。……この街で、いろんな<tips=16>タイプA</tips>たちと関わることで、それに気がついた」","en":"“You and the suspects I encounter through my work all seem to have had extraordinarily unusual childhoods. I truly have no experiences like that. I believe I was happy. ...It was only through meeting so many different <tips=16>Type As</tips> in this city that I came to realize it.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r475","rowIndex":475,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　堂島はそう言った。言葉の響きには、どこか申し訳なさそうな気配があった。そんな声色を使う<tips=48>堂島</tips>を見るのもはじめてだ。","en":"As <tips=48>Dojima</tips> spoke, I thought I heard something faintly apologetic in the sound of his words. That too was a tone I had never heard from him.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r476","rowIndex":476,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「私の田舎では、勉強が飛び抜けて出来るような特別なやつ以外は公務員になるのが最高の目標だった。だから私は自分の能力を高く評価してくれる警察官になった。別に交番のおまわりさんでも良かったんだがね。気がついたらこういう特殊な部署に回され、この街にやって来ることになった。本当にそれだけだ」","en":"“In my hometown, becoming a government employee was the highest ambition for anyone without exceptional academic talent. So I became a police officer, since the police placed a high value on my ability. I would have been content as an ordinary officer in a neighborhood police box. Before I knew it, they transferred me to this specialized department and sent me to this city. That is truly all.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r477","rowIndex":477,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あんたがその顔で交番に居たらだれも入って来ませんよ」","en":"“If you sat in a police box with that face, no one would ever come in.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r478","rowIndex":478,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は苦笑して、","en":"I gave a wry smile and said,","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r479","rowIndex":479,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「しかし、それはそれでわかるような気がしますな」","en":"“Still, I think I can understand that.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r480","rowIndex":480,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「何をわかるって？」","en":"“What do you understand?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r481","rowIndex":481,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「私が思ったことを言いましょうか」","en":"“Shall I tell you what I think?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r482","rowIndex":482,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私はふんと鼻を鳴らしてから、","en":"I gave a dismissive snort.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r483","rowIndex":483,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「つまり田舎で何不自由なく生まれ育った旦那は、この街で悲惨な<tips=16>タイプA</tips>犯罪者たちと接するに従って、コンプレックスを持つようになったんです。<tips=16>タイプA</tips>はみんな重いものを背負っているのに、自分はそれがなくていいのかってね。……そこで、あんたは<tips=16>タイプA</tips>犯罪者に奇妙な同情を持つようになった」","en":"“In other words, you were born and raised in the country without ever wanting for anything. Then you came to this city, met one miserable <tips=16>Type A</tips> criminal after another, and developed a complex of your own. Every other <tips=16>Type A</tips> carried some terrible burden. Was it really right for you to have none? ...And so you developed this peculiar sympathy for <tips=16>Type A</tips> criminals.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r484","rowIndex":484,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ふん」","en":"“Hmph.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r485","rowIndex":485,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……ノーマルの作る社会で落伍した<tips=16>タイプA</tips>を、何も知らないノーマルに逮捕させるわけにはいかない。せめて、同じ<tips=16>タイプA</tips>である自分が逮捕してやろう。<tips=16>タイプA</tips>のことは、<tips=16>タイプA</tips>がけりを付ける。……これが、あんたが淡々と孤独な仕事をやり続ける理由です。切腹のときに武士が介錯してやるようなものですな。あんたは、そうやって悲しい義務感を背負って捜査をしているんだ」","en":"“...You cannot leave a <tips=16>Type A</tips> cast aside by a society of Normals to be arrested by Normals who understand nothing. At the very least, you can arrest them yourself, as another <tips=16>Type A</tips>. The fate of a <tips=16>Type A</tips> should be settled by another <tips=16>Type A</tips>. ...That is why you continue this lonely work with such perfect composure. You are like the samurai who serves as second at another man’s seppuku. That is the sad burden of duty you carry into every investigation.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r486","rowIndex":486,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ふん」","en":"“Hmph.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r487","rowIndex":487,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どうですか？」","en":"“Well?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r488","rowIndex":488,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「やっぱりきみはヘボ探偵だな。心理学者の真似はやめたほうがいい」","en":"“You really are a third-rate detective. You should stop playing psychologist.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r489","rowIndex":489,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=48>堂島</tips>はにべもない。","en":"<tips=48>Dojima</tips> dismissed the theory without ceremony.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r490","rowIndex":490,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「私にとっては仕事は仕事、容疑者は容疑者。捜査の対象であるということ以外なにものでもない」","en":"“To me, work is work and a suspect is a suspect. A suspect is nothing more than the subject of an investigation.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r491","rowIndex":491,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ふん、素直になりゃあいいのに」","en":"“Hmph. Why not just admit it?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r492","rowIndex":492,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「何を言う」","en":"“What are you talking about?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r493","rowIndex":493,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まあ、わかりましたよ。そういうことにしておきましょう」","en":"“All right, I understand. We’ll say that’s how it is.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r494","rowIndex":494,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「勝手なやつだ」","en":"“You really do suit yourself.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r495","rowIndex":495,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=48>堂島</tips>は眉間にしわをよせる。それによって、彼のもつ犬の顔は、本当は表情を作れることを知った。そこには、明らかに苦々しい感情があらわれていたのだ。","en":"<tips=48>Dojima</tips> furrowed his brow. Only then did I discover that his canine face was capable of expression after all. It now displayed unmistakable displeasure.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r496","rowIndex":496,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　いままで表情を見せなかったのは、顔の構造のせいではなく、彼がことさらに表情を隠していたせいなのだろう。","en":"If he had never shown any expression before, it was not because of the structure of his face. He must have been going out of his way to hide them.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r497","rowIndex":497,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私はそう感じつつ、言葉を続ける。","en":"Even as I thought this, I continued.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r498","rowIndex":498,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「じゃあ、仕事の話をしましょうか。我々は立場も境遇も違うが、こうして同じ仕事をすることになった。これも巡り合わせというものです。私はあんたが気に食わないが、一緒に仕事をするのは楽しみですな」","en":"“Then shall we discuss the work? Our positions and circumstances differ, yet we have come to share a task. You could call that a turn of fate. I dislike you, but I look forward to working with you.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r499","rowIndex":499,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……ふむ」","en":"“...Hmm.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E2:r500","rowIndex":500,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=48>堂島</tips>はジャケットの襟を直すと、小さく溜息をついた。","en":"<tips=48>Dojima</tips> adjusted the collar of his jacket and let out a quiet sigh.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}}]},{"position":12,"code":"E3","unitId":"E3","rows":[{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r1","rowIndex":1,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=57>滑走路通り</tips>は、足の踏み場もないほどの人混みでごったがえしている。","en":"<tips=57>Runway Street</tips> churned with a crowd so dense there was scarcely room to set foot anywhere.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r2","rowIndex":2,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　別段、何か祭りやイベントのようなものが行われているわけでは――いや、或いは、この街にとってはこれ以上ない祭りでありイベントであるのかもしれない。","en":"It was not as though any particular festival or event was taking place—no, perhaps for this city, there could be no greater festival or event.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r3","rowIndex":3,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>のボス、<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>が死んだ。","en":"<tips=3>Chris Tse</tips>, the boss of <tips=7>YS</tips>, was dead.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r4","rowIndex":4,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　漢字の表記で謝大輝と書くその男は、この街では敵するものがない最高の権力者となったが、不治の病の前にはなすすべもなかった。","en":"The man whose name was written 謝大輝 in kanji had risen to become the most powerful man in the city, without a rival to challenge him. Yet against an incurable disease, there had been nothing even he could do.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r5","rowIndex":5,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その、葬送の列が今にも雨が降り出しそうな曇り空の下、粛々と<tips=57>滑走路通り</tips>を練り歩いているのである。","en":"His funeral procession now advanced solemnly along <tips=57>Runway Street</tips> beneath an overcast sky that threatened rain at any moment.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r6","rowIndex":6,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まったく、大げさなことをするもんだ」","en":"“They certainly know how to overdo things.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"堂島","displayName":"Dojima","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r7","rowIndex":7,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　人混みのなかを歩きにくそうにしながら<tips=48>堂島</tips>は呟く。","en":"<tips=48>Dojima</tips> muttered as he moved awkwardly through the crowd.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r8","rowIndex":8,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……派手好きの男でしたからな。しかし、ギャングどもをまとめていた彼が死んだとなれば、この街の治安もどうなるかわからない。警察も、戦々恐々としているんじゃないですか？」","en":"“...He always did love a spectacle. Still, now that the man who kept all the gangs in line is dead, there’s no telling what will happen to the city’s public order. I imagine the police are on edge too, aren’t they?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r9","rowIndex":9,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「さあどうだろう。部署が違うからわからんね」","en":"“Who knows? It is not my department.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"堂島","displayName":"Dojima","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r10","rowIndex":10,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=48>堂島</tips>は自分の捜査対象以外には興味がなさそうだ。","en":"<tips=48>Dojima</tips> seemed to have no interest in anything beyond his own investigation.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r11","rowIndex":11,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちは<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>についての有力な情報をつかみ、その場所へ向かう途中であった。","en":"We had obtained a promising lead on <tips=20>Koschei</tips> and were on our way to follow it up.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r12","rowIndex":12,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　人混みをかき分けるようにして歩いていると、<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>の葬列を眺める野次馬たちの囁き合う声が耳に入る。","en":"As we forced our way through the crowd, I heard the spectators watching <tips=3>Chris Tse’s</tips> funeral procession whispering among themselves.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r13","rowIndex":13,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どうも、今、<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>の御曹司がそこを通っているようですな」","en":"“It seems <tips=3>Chris Tse’s</tips> young scion is passing by right now.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r14","rowIndex":14,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は前を行く<tips=48>堂島</tips>に囁きかけた。","en":"I whispered it to <tips=48>Dojima</tips> ahead of me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r15","rowIndex":15,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「御曹司？」","en":"“His heir?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"堂島","displayName":"Dojima","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r16","rowIndex":16,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ツェー・ルオンとかなんとか言うんだったかな？　<tips=1>謝亮</tips>って書くんだ。数年前まで悪ガキをあつめて悪さをしていた<tips=1>菅原亮</tips>と同一人物だって噂のガキですよ。ついこの間、<tips=57>滑走路通り</tips>の虎騒ぎのときもこいつがいたって話ですな」","en":"“Was it Tse Leung, or something like that? His name is written <tips=1>謝亮</tips>. He’s the kid rumored to be the same person as <tips=1>Ryo Sugawara</tips>, who used to gather young delinquents and make trouble until a few years ago. They say he was there during that recent business with the tiger on <tips=57>Runway Street</tips>, too.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r17","rowIndex":17,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「聞いたこともあるような気がするが、詳しくは知らないな」","en":"“I think I may have heard of him, but I don’t know the details.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"堂島","displayName":"Dojima","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r18","rowIndex":18,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「つれないな。旦那も<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>とはそれなりに因縁のある仲でしょうに」","en":"“How cold, sir. You and <tips=3>Chris Tse</tips> had a fair bit of history yourselves.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r19","rowIndex":19,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「息子どうこうは、私が彼の担当をやめたあとの話だろう」","en":"“The business with his son came after I stopped handling his case, didn’t it?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"堂島","displayName":"Dojima","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r20","rowIndex":20,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「この機会に、息子のツラを拝んでおきますか？　これから、この街の重要人物になるかもしれないやつだ」","en":"“Why not take this chance to get a look at the son’s face? He may be an important figure in this city before long.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r21","rowIndex":21,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「言ったろう。私は部署違いなんだよ。ほら、急ごう。我々も暇ではない」","en":"“I told you, it is not my department. Come on, let’s hurry. We do not have time to spare either.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r22","rowIndex":22,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼の捜査対象外への無関心は徹底している。","en":"His indifference to anything outside the subject of his investigation was absolute.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r23","rowIndex":23,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ドキュメンタリー作家志望の私としては、この歴史的場面をちょっと見てみたい気もするんですがね。……しかし、時間が流れるのは早いですな。あのごろつきの<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>がいつのまにか<tips=9>Y地区</tips>のボスになったかと思えば、今度はその息子が表舞台に出て来るだなんて。我々もその分年をとったということです。……あ、そう言えば中和剤をくださいよ。使い切ってしまったんだ」","en":"“As an aspiring documentary writer, I must admit I’d like to witness this historic moment. ...But time moves quickly. That thug <tips=3>Chris Tse</tips> became boss of <tips=9>Y District</tips> before we knew it, and now his son is stepping onto the public stage. We’ve grown that much older ourselves. ...Ah, that reminds me. Give me more neutralizer. I used the last of it.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r24","rowIndex":24,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「次にきみの能力が必要になったときに渡すさ」","en":"“I will give it to you the next time I need your ability.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r25","rowIndex":25,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=48>堂島</tips>は足を止めずに歩き続ける。","en":"<tips=48>Dojima</tips> continued walking without stopping.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r26","rowIndex":26,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は名残惜しく、ちょっと背伸びをして通りの方を見てみたが、背の高い私でも、この位置からでは人混みの向こうで車に乗った人物の姿を見ることは出来なかった。","en":"Still reluctant to leave it unseen, I rose onto my toes and peered toward the street. But even at my height, from where I stood I could not make out the person in the car beyond the crowd.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r27","rowIndex":27,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　溜息をつき、大分先に行ってしまった<tips=48>堂島</tips>の後を追う。","en":"I sighed and hurried after <tips=48>Dojima</tips>, who had gone quite some distance ahead.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r28","rowIndex":28,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　連続殺人鬼『<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>』。","en":"The serial killer known as <tips=20>Koschei</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r29","rowIndex":29,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼の出身地はロシアの東部にある田舎町らしい。二十数年前に、既に現在と同じようなスタイルの殺人事件を起こしており、当地の警察に逮捕された。しかし、すぐに警察の施設から脱出し、それ以降様々な国を渡り歩いて犯罪を繰り返している。","en":"He apparently came from a provincial town in eastern Russia. Some twenty-odd years earlier, he had committed murders in the same style he used today and been arrested by the local police. He escaped from police custody almost at once, and ever since had moved from country to country, committing crime after crime.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r30","rowIndex":30,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　大胆な手口と、長期的な活動のわりにはほとんどその実像を把握されていなかった。彼を逮捕したロシア当局は、彼に関してはかなり詳しい情報を持っているはずだが、犯行が行われた各国からの度重なる要請にも関わらず、一切公開しようとしない。","en":"For all the boldness of his methods and the length of his career, the reality of who he was remained almost entirely unknown. The Russian authorities who had arrested him must have possessed detailed information, yet despite repeated requests from the countries where his crimes took place, they refused to make any of it public.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r31","rowIndex":31,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　一説には<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>事件は当局にとってスキャンダルとなる要素が含まれているという話もあるが、根拠のない噂の域を出ない。","en":"There was also talk that the <tips=20>Koschei</tips> case involved something potentially scandalous for the authorities, but it remained an unsupported rumor.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r32","rowIndex":32,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そういうわけで、現在でも<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>の実像に関する重要な情報となると、逮捕当時に現地のメディアが伝えたものを参照しなくてはならない。","en":"Consequently, even now, any important information about the real <tips=20>Koschei</tips> had to be sought in reports produced by the local media at the time of his arrest.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r33","rowIndex":33,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　正面から彼の顔をとらえた写真と、警察に左右の腕を抱え込まれながら裁判所へ足を踏み入れる映像が残されている。","en":"There remained a full-face photograph of him, along with footage of police officers holding both his arms as they escorted him into a courthouse.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r34","rowIndex":34,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それによると、黒髪の美青年で、なるほどこれならば女を騙すのは容易だったろう。","en":"Those images showed a handsome young man with black hair. Looking at him, it was easy to believe that deceiving women had come naturally.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r35","rowIndex":35,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　当時としても素性は謎だったようで、逮捕されるまでに彼がどういった職業につき、何をしていたかなどは明らかにされていない。","en":"Even then, his background appeared to have been a mystery. Nothing had been disclosed about his occupation or how he had lived before the arrest.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r36","rowIndex":36,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　本名さえあきらかではなかった。","en":"Not even his true name was known.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r37","rowIndex":37,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>、というのはあくまでも犯行時にメディアがつけたニックネームである。逮捕後に本人は<tips=64>アレクセイ</tips>と名乗ったが、それが本名であると裏付ける情報は存在しない。","en":"<tips=20>Koschei</tips> was merely a nickname coined by the media when reporting on his crimes. After his arrest, he called himself <tips=64>Alexei</tips>, but no evidence exists to establish that it was his real name.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r38","rowIndex":38,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼は逮捕されてから僅か三日後に留置された場所から姿を消す。","en":"Barely three days after his arrest, he vanished from custody.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r39","rowIndex":39,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　もちろん彼のような凶悪犯であるから、厳重な警備はなされていた。脱出時の状況は公表されていないが、この時彼の<tips=16>タイプA</tips>能力が使われたと考えられている。","en":"Naturally, a vicious criminal like him had been held under strict guard. The circumstances of the escape were never made public, but he was believed to have used his <tips=16>Type A</tips> ability.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r40","rowIndex":40,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼の<tips=16>タイプA</tips>としての能力もやはりはっきりとは判明していないが、その後何度も犯罪をおかしながらもけして逮捕されることもなく、姿をとらえられることもなかったことから、身を隠し、追及を逃れるのに適した能力なのだろうと推測されていた。","en":"The nature of his <tips=16>Type A</tips> ability was likewise never clearly established. Yet because he went on committing crime after crime without ever being arrested or having his whereabouts pinned down, it was assumed to be a power well suited to concealment and evading pursuit.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r41","rowIndex":41,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「具体的に、どんな能力なんですかねえ」","en":"“So what, exactly, do you think his power is?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r42","rowIndex":42,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は与えられた資料に一通り目を通したあと、<tips=48>堂島</tips>にそう尋ねた。","en":"After reading through the materials I had received, I put the question to <tips=48>Dojima</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r43","rowIndex":43,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「専門家たちは、何か人の感覚を狂わせたり、幻惑する能力だと考えているようだ」","en":"“The experts appear to believe that he can somehow disrupt the senses or deceive perception.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r44","rowIndex":44,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「旦那もそう思いますか？」","en":"“Is that what you think too, sir?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r45","rowIndex":45,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=48>堂島</tips>は首をひねり、考えるそぶりを見せてから、","en":"<tips=48>Dojima</tips> cocked his head and appeared to consider the question.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r46","rowIndex":46,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なんとも言えないが、その可能性も否定出来ない」","en":"“Hard to say, but I cannot rule it out.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r47","rowIndex":47,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「曖昧な言い方ですね」","en":"“That’s rather vague.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r48","rowIndex":48,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「サイキック能力に予断を持てば、命取りになるからな。……しかし、どんな能力があるにしろ、犯罪自体はそれほど精巧に行われているわけではないんだ。目撃者もいるし、科学捜査でも本人の痕跡らしきものが見つかっている。こんなやり方で、最初の逮捕以外は、どこの国でも捕まってこなかったというのは不思議な気がする」","en":"“Going into this with preconceived ideas about psychic abilities could get us killed. ...But whatever ability he has, the crimes themselves aren’t carried out with any great sophistication. There are witnesses, and forensic investigation has found what appear to be traces of the man himself. It’s strange that, using methods like these, he has never been caught in any country since that first arrest.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r49","rowIndex":49,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「でも実際逮捕されてこなかった」","en":"“And yet the fact remains that no one has arrested him.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r50","rowIndex":50,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そう。だから、実用的な能力があるのは間違いない。現状では地道な捜査を続けていればすぐに見つかりそうな気がするし、そうであって欲しいが、評判通りの大犯罪者なら、そのうちやつの能力の恐ろしさをいやというほど実感させられるかもしれん」","en":"“Right. So there is no question that he has a practical ability. As things stand, it feels as though patient police work ought to turn him up quickly, and I hope it does. But if he’s the master criminal his reputation says he is, sooner or later he may force us to learn just how terrifying his ability is.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r51","rowIndex":51,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=48>堂島</tips>はそんな風に言っていた。","en":"That was <tips=48>Dojima’s</tips> answer.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r52","rowIndex":52,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私としては、そんな実感をせずに早急に解決したいものだ。もちろん、<tips=48>堂島</tips>もそうであろう。だから、この私を仲間に巻き込んだのである。","en":"For my part, I wished to resolve the case quickly without experiencing any such thing. Naturally, <tips=48>Dojima</tips> must have felt the same. That was why he had dragged me into this with him.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r53","rowIndex":53,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　先日私がロックを解除した携帯電話は、そのあと警察に返したが、そこには犯人などとのやりとりが記憶されているでもなく、そして重要なデータにはことごとく本人の認証が必要であり、結局彼らは何も手がかりを掴むことが出来ずにまた私の手元に戻って来た。","en":"I had returned the telephone whose lock I removed to the police. It contained no record of any exchange with a likely perpetrator, and every significant piece of data required the owner’s authentication. The police ultimately discovered nothing and returned the device to me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r54","rowIndex":54,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　警察が欲しているデータは、携帯電話に搭載されたGPSの記録である。被害者の持っていた携帯電話は常に位置情報をサーバーに送っており、あとで本人がアクセスすれば、自分がいつどのように移動したのかが把握出来るようになっている。","en":"The police wanted its GPS record. The victim’s telephone had constantly transmitted its position to a server, allowing the owner to access the record later and review when and how she had moved.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r55","rowIndex":55,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　サーバーのデータは携帯電話のメーカーが管理している。","en":"The data on the server was managed by the phone’s manufacturer.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r56","rowIndex":56,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　社会や組織よりも個人の権利保護が叫ばれる昨今、死者のデータとは言え、警察が引き出すには企業との交渉がいるし、時間がかかる。しかも相手は海外の企業であり、特に交渉は困難だ。場合によっては裁判を起こして司法を介入させる必要が出て来るかもしれない。","en":"In an age when the protection of individual rights was championed above the claims of society and its institutions, even obtaining a dead person’s data required the police to negotiate with the company, and that took time. Worse, the company was overseas, making the negotiations particularly difficult. Depending on how matters went, the police might even have to bring a lawsuit and secure the intervention of the courts.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r57","rowIndex":57,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　とてもやってられないというわけで、再び私の能力を頼って来たのだ。","en":"The police had decided they could not possibly go through all that, which was why they had turned to my power again.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r58","rowIndex":58,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　もちろん、私の手にかかれば造作もない。ものの数秒で被害者の殺害されたその日の足取りを表示させ、<tips=48>堂島</tips>に見せてやると、彼は感心半分、呆れ半分といった態度で、","en":"Naturally, in my hands it was effortless. Within seconds I brought up the victim’s movements on the day she was murdered and showed them to <tips=48>Dojima</tips>. Half impressed and half exasperated, he said,","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r59","rowIndex":59,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「相変わらずきみの能力はやりたい放題だな。きみを逮捕するときに、ものすごく苦労したのを思い出す」","en":"“As ever, your ability permits you to do anything you please. It reminds me of the extraordinary difficulty I experienced arresting you.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r60","rowIndex":60,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　思い出すのは良いが、私の能力を解放するようかけあってくれるという約束を反故にされてはたまらないと、私は内心で思ったものだ。","en":"He was welcome to remember it, I thought, but I would not stand for him reneging on his promise to argue for the restoration of my power.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r61","rowIndex":61,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そうして私たちは今日、哀れな女子大生がこの街に訪れてから殺害され解体されゴミ捨て場に捨てられるまでの足取りを追いながら聞き込みを行っていたのだ。","en":"And so that day we had been retracing the poor university student’s movements and questioning witnesses, following her from the moment she entered the city to her murder, her dismemberment, and the dumping of her remains at a refuse site.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r62","rowIndex":62,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　駅で降りて<tips=9>Y地区</tips>までやって来ると、彼女はまず<tips=57>滑走路通り</tips>をうろうろし、雑貨屋などでウインドウショッピングをしたらしい。店員たちの多くは彼女の顔写真を見せても思い出せず、見覚えがあると言った店員も、うろ覚えで、確信はないようだった。","en":"After leaving the station and entering <tips=9>Y District</tips>, she had apparently wandered <tips=57>Runway Street</tips>, window-shopping at general stores and similar establishments. Most employees could not remember her when shown her photograph. Even those who thought she looked familiar remembered her only vaguely and were not certain.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r63","rowIndex":63,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　この時点ではおそらく犯人と接触していないだろう。","en":"She probably had not yet encountered the perpetrator at that point.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r64","rowIndex":64,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　GPSの履歴によると、被害者は<tips=57>滑走路通り</tips>を端から端まで見て歩くと、小さなイタリア料理店のある角で図書館通りを曲がる。この辺りは<tips=9>Y地区</tips>では比較的健全な料理店が多く建ち並んでいる。この時点で１６時。被害者は一軒の店に入る。","en":"According to the GPS history, the victim walked <tips=57>Runway Street</tips> from end to end, then turned onto Library Street at the corner with a small Italian restaurant. This part of <tips=9>Y District</tips> was lined with an unusual number of respectable restaurants. At four in the afternoon, the victim entered one of them.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r65","rowIndex":65,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「一体なんの調査なの？」","en":"“What exactly are you investigating?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r66","rowIndex":66,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　被害者が立ち寄ったスペイン料理店の肌が黒いホールスタッフは、<tips=48>堂島</tips>が警察だと名乗ると露骨に顔を顰める。","en":"When <tips=48>Dojima</tips> identified himself as police, a dark-skinned waiter at the Spanish restaurant the victim had visited scowled openly.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r67","rowIndex":67,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=48>堂島</tips>の外見に驚いたというのもあるだろうが、<tips=16>タイプA</tips>の多いこの街ではそれのために顔色を変えない程度のたしなみは彼にも身についているだろう。それよりも、警察という肩書きを警戒したに違いない。この街の住人には、よくある反応だ。","en":"<tips=48>Dojima’s</tips> appearance may indeed have surprised him. But in a city with so many <tips=16>Type As</tips>, even he would have acquired enough social grace not to let that show on his face. No, it was surely the word ‘police’ that had put him on guard. Among the people of this city, it was a common reaction.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r68","rowIndex":68,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「安心してくれ。我々が探している犯人は、この街とは全く関係ない部外者だ。よそからやってきて、恐ろしい殺人事件を繰り返している」","en":"“You can relax. The perpetrator we seek is an outsider with no connection whatsoever to the city. He came from elsewhere and has repeatedly committed terrible murders.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"堂島","displayName":"Dojima","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r69","rowIndex":69,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私が前に進み出て、店員にそう説明をする。","en":"I stepped forward and gave the employee that explanation.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r70","rowIndex":70,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼らが気にしているのは、つまり、余計なことを言って、<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>や、その他の街の組織の人間を売ってしまうかたちになることだ。","en":"In other words, men like him feared that saying too much would amount to betraying someone from <tips=7>YS</tips> or one of the city’s other organizations.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r71","rowIndex":71,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　この街で生まれ育った若者の多くは、警察や法律に従わなくても生きていけるし、それらは自分を守ってくれないが、マフィアたちに逆らえば生きていけないと考えている。","en":"Many young people born and raised here believed they could live without obeying the police or the law, which did nothing to protect them, but could not survive if they defied the Mafia.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r72","rowIndex":72,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「この店は確か、ボネット・ファミリーと契約をしているんじゃなかったかな？　私はあそこの<ruby=幹部>カポ</ruby>を何人か知っている。おかしなことはしない」","en":"“This restaurant has an arrangement with the Bonetto Family, if I remember correctly. I know several of their capos—their senior men. We aren’t here to cause trouble.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r73","rowIndex":73,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　店員はいぶかしげに私を見る。","en":"The employee studied me suspiciously.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r74","rowIndex":74,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　どの店が誰の勢力下にあるか、というのは表向きは隠すもので、内情に詳しい人間でなくては言い当てることが出来ない。","en":"Which establishment lay within whose sphere of control was information kept hidden from the public. Only someone intimately familiar with the city’s inner workings could identify such an affiliation on sight.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r75","rowIndex":75,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それを口にした私を不審に思っているのだろう。","en":"He was probably wondering what sort of man would say such a thing aloud.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r76","rowIndex":76,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「私は<tips=50>路地</tips>だ。昔は探偵をやっていた」","en":"“My name is <tips=50>Roji</tips>. I used to be a detective.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r77","rowIndex":77,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……その名前は、<tips=59>暗闇通り</tips>のあたりで聞いたことあるな。有名人かい？」","en":"“...I’ve heard that name around <tips=59>Darkness Street</tips>. Are you famous?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r78","rowIndex":78,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それなりに古くからこの街で仕事をしている。なあ、きみはこの街の生まれだろう？　よそからやって来たヤツが、この街に訪れたお客さんを殺して八つ裂きにしてるって思うと、腹が立たないか？」","en":"“I’ve been working in this city for a good many years. You were born here, weren’t you? Doesn’t it make your blood boil to think some outsider came into our city, murdered a guest, and tore her limb from limb?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r79","rowIndex":79,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……本当に、よそものを探しているんだね？」","en":"“...You really are only after an outsider?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r80","rowIndex":80,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうだ」","en":"“We are.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r81","rowIndex":81,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「わかった。見るよ」","en":"“All right. I’ll look.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r82","rowIndex":82,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=48>堂島</tips>が端末を差し出すと、店員はその画面を覗き込む。","en":"<tips=48>Dojima</tips> held out the device, and the employee leaned in to look at the screen.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r83","rowIndex":83,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「これが殺された被害者だ。心当たりはないか？」","en":"“This is the victim. Do you remember her?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"堂島","displayName":"Dojima","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r84","rowIndex":84,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「これは、どうだったかなあ。見たような、見なかったような。何しろ、もう何日も前ですからね」","en":"“I’m not sure. I may have seen her, or I may not. It has been several days, after all.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r85","rowIndex":85,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=48>堂島</tips>の問いに、店員は首をひねる。","en":"The employee cocked his head at <tips=48>Dojima’s</tips> question.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r86","rowIndex":86,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「よく思い出してくれないか。もしかしたら、当日は茶色いフレームの眼鏡をかけていたかもしれない」","en":"“Please try to remember. She may have been wearing glasses with brown frames that day.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"堂島","displayName":"Dojima","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r87","rowIndex":87,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=48>堂島</tips>は、次に、遺品として残されていた眼鏡と同じ商品の画像を店員に見せた。","en":"Next, <tips=48>Dojima</tips> showed the employee an image of the same model of glasses that remained among the victim’s possessions.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r88","rowIndex":88,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「うーん……」","en":"“Hmm...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r89","rowIndex":89,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「一人でいたか、誰かと一緒だったか、それだけでも知りたいんだ。もう一人は、こういう西洋人で……」","en":"“We only need to know whether she was alone or accompanied. The other person was a Westerner who looked like this...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"堂島","displayName":"Dojima","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r90","rowIndex":90,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=48>堂島</tips>は今度は二十年前の<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>の画像を見せ、","en":"This time, <tips=48>Dojima</tips> showed him the image of <tips=20>Koschei</tips> from twenty years earlier.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r91","rowIndex":91,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……古い写真だが、今でもきっと……」","en":"“...It’s an old photograph, but surely even now...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"堂島","displayName":"Dojima","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r92","rowIndex":92,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あっ、このお客さんなら覚えてる」","en":"“Ah, I remember this customer.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r93","rowIndex":93,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「本当か？」","en":"“You do?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"堂島","displayName":"Dojima","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r94","rowIndex":94,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうそう、確か、女の子と一緒だった。そう言えば、相手のヤツはさっきの写真の男だったかもしれない」","en":"“Right, right. I’m pretty sure he was with a girl. Come to think of it, the man she was with may well have been the one in that photograph.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r95","rowIndex":95,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「よく思い出してくれ。本当に、この子と一緒だったんだな？　時間は１６時くらいじゃなかったか？」","en":"“Think carefully. This really was the girl he was with? And it was around four in the afternoon?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"堂島","displayName":"Dojima","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r96","rowIndex":96,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私が割り込むと、店員は眉間にしわを寄せて、","en":"When I interrupted, the employee furrowed his brow.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r97","rowIndex":97,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「たぶん、そうだと思う。男の人の方はよく覚えているよ。日本語は上手だったけれど、それとは別に、この街ではあまり聞かない言葉を使ってたから」","en":"“I think so. Probably. I remember the man much better. His Japanese was excellent, but he also spoke another language, one you rarely hear in this city.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r98","rowIndex":98,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「もしかして、ロシア語か？」","en":"“Could it have been Russian?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"堂島","displayName":"Dojima","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r99","rowIndex":99,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「わからない。とにかく、ポルトガル語でも英語でも中国語でもスペイン語でもない言葉だったんだ」","en":"“I don’t know. In any event, it was not Portuguese, English, Chinese, or Spanish.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r100","rowIndex":100,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「旦那」","en":"“Sir.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r101","rowIndex":101,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=48>堂島</tips>の方を見ると、","en":"I looked at <tips=48>Dojima</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r102","rowIndex":102,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「飲食店の周りでうろうろしているところで、<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>が声をかけたんだろう」","en":"“<tips=20>Koschei</tips> must have approached her while she wandered around the restaurants.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"堂島","displayName":"Dojima","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r103","rowIndex":103,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼は頷く。","en":"He nodded.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r104","rowIndex":104,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それはどうなんだろう」","en":"“I’m not sure about that.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r105","rowIndex":105,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　と、首をひねったのは聞いていた店員だった。","en":"The employee had been listening to us; now he cocked his head.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r106","rowIndex":106,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「女の子の方が積極的だったような。積極的に話しかけてたのは女の子でしたよ。相手はハンサムな白人だったから……でも、それで殺されちゃったんなら、なんだかいたたまれないね。いやあ、この街は恐ろしい場所だなあと、改めて感じるなあ」","en":"“If anything, the girl seemed to be the forward one. She was the one who kept striking up conversation. The man was a handsome white guy, so... But if that was what got her killed, I can hardly bear to think about it. It reminds you all over again what a terrifying place this city is.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r107","rowIndex":107,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ハンサムと言うけれど、どれくらいの年齢だった？　この写真通りかい？　もっと年配じゃないか？」","en":"“You say he was handsome, but how old was he? Did he look just as he does in this photograph? Wasn’t he older?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r108","rowIndex":108,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は店員に尋ねる。","en":"I put the question to the employee.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r109","rowIndex":109,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「え、女の子よりちょっと年上ってくらいにしか見えなかったけれどなあ。二十代か……いっても、三十ってところ。この写真そのまんまだった」","en":"“What? He looked only a little older than the girl. In his twenties... thirty at most. He looked exactly like this photograph.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r110","rowIndex":110,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　店員はそう言って、<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>の画像を指さす。","en":"The employee pointed to <tips=20>Koschei’s</tips> image.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r111","rowIndex":111,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どういうことなんですかね。二十か三十という年齢は、旦那が自信がないって言う、現場のにおいと一致しますが……」","en":"“What do you make of that, sir? Somewhere between twenty and thirty matches the age you smelled at the scene, although you said you weren’t certain...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r112","rowIndex":112,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……実は、目撃者の証言でも、犯人と見られる男の年格好はそれくらいの年齢なんだ。古い写真を見て、その通りの顔だったと言っている。……見た目は変装や整形手術でいくらでも誤魔化せるにしても、においを変えられるはずがない。体臭は身体の分泌物から生まれるのだからな。それとも、何か方法があるのか……？」","en":"“...Actually, witnesses also put the man believed to be the culprit at about that age. They looked at an old photograph and said that was exactly the face they saw. ...Appearances can be faked any number of ways through disguise or plastic surgery, but no one should be able to change his scent. Body odor comes from the substances the body secretes. Unless there is some way...?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"堂島","displayName":"Dojima","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r113","rowIndex":113,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=48>堂島</tips>は考え込んでいる。","en":"<tips=48>Dojima</tips> fell silent in thought.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r114","rowIndex":114,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうなんですか。私が頂いた資料では、単に目撃者に犯人の写真を見せたとしか書いてありませんでしたな。何もかも全部書いてあるとは思っちゃいませんでしたが、そこまで情報が隠されていたんですか」","en":"“Is that so? The material you gave me said only that the witnesses had been shown a photograph of the culprit. I wasn’t expecting every last detail to be in there, but did you really have to keep that much from me?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r115","rowIndex":115,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は溜息をつき、","en":"I sighed, then said,","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r116","rowIndex":116,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……しかし、そういうこととなると、ややこしいですな。顔と手口を似せた別人の成りすましか、それとも、若い共犯者がいるのか、あるいは、<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>の<tips=16>タイプA</tips>能力が関係しているのか……考えたらきりがない」","en":"“...But if that’s the case, this is complicated. It could be a different man passing himself off as him by copying his face and methods, or there could be a young accomplice, or <tips=20>Koschei’s</tips> <tips=16>Type A</tips> ability could be involved... The possibilities are endless.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r117","rowIndex":117,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……とりあえず、ここを出よう」","en":"“...For now, let’s get out of here.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"堂島","displayName":"Dojima","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r118","rowIndex":118,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして私たちは店を後にした。","en":"With that, we left the restaurant.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r119","rowIndex":119,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　パレードの時にはぽつぽつと降り始めていた雨が、このときは止んでいた。","en":"The rain that had begun to fall in scattered drops during the procession had stopped by then.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r120","rowIndex":120,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　次に私たちが向かったのは、同じ通りにあるバーであった。カウンター席だけの小さなバーで、マスターが一人で切り盛りしている店だ。私たちが訊ねた時、マスターは丁度<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>の葬列見物から帰って来たところで、画像を見せて話を聞くと、いまさっきの店員と同じような話がきけた。","en":"Next we visited a bar on the same street. It was a tiny place with nothing but counter seating, run single-handedly by the proprietor. When we arrived, he had just returned from watching <tips=3>Chris Tse’s</tips> funeral procession. We showed him the images and heard much the same story as before.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r121","rowIndex":121,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　女のほうがどちらかといえば積極的で、男は聞き役に回っていたということだ。","en":"The woman had been the more forward of the two, while the man largely listened.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r122","rowIndex":122,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　バーを出た後、二人は五分ほど歩いた場所にあるホテルへ向かい、そこで三時間ほど過ごした後、遺体発見現場となるゴミ捨て場に辿り着き、そこで電池が切れるまでそこに留まり続ける。","en":"After leaving the bar, the two walked to a hotel about five minutes away. They spent roughly three hours there, after which the phone arrived at the refuse site where the body would be discovered and remained there until its battery died.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r123","rowIndex":123,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　このホテルが殺害現場であろう。私たちは携帯電話のロックをといた後、一番最初に調査したが、すでに何人もの客が泊まった後で、<tips=48>堂島</tips>の能力をもってしてもそれらしきにおいを発見することが出来なかった。従業員も二人を覚えておらず、なんの情報も得られない。","en":"The hotel was presumably the site of the murder. We investigated it first after unlocking the telephone. By then, several other guests had occupied the room, and not even <tips=48>Dojima’s</tips> ability could locate a relevant scent. The employees did not remember the pair, and we obtained no information.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r124","rowIndex":124,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　今は、鑑識班が現場検証を行っているはずである。私たちはその報告を聞くべく、ホテルへと向かった。","en":"By now, a forensic team ought to have been examining the scene. We headed for the hotel to hear what they had found.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r125","rowIndex":125,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そこでは、ホテルのオーナーである女が、腕組みをして職員の動きを睨み付けるように眺めていた。私たちが調査させて欲しいと頼んだときも「営業妨害だ！」とこっぴどく拒否したこの女は、いまも警察が営業を邪魔しているのを快く思っていないのだろう。","en":"We found the woman who owned the hotel standing with her arms folded and glaring at the officers as they worked. When we asked permission to investigate, she had flatly refused, shouting that we were obstructing her business. Apparently, she remained displeased that the police continued to interfere with it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r126","rowIndex":126,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　鑑識班はホテル周辺や部屋と繋がる下水道まで調べてくれたらしいが、めぼしいものは何も見つからなかったと報告した。このホテルは殺害現場であり、そして解体現場でもあるはずだが、鑑識の科学調査によっても何も見つけることが出来ないとは、手際のいいものだ。","en":"The forensic team had apparently examined the area around the hotel and even the sewer connected to the room, yet reported finding nothing of note. The hotel ought to have been both the murder scene and the place where the body was dismembered. To leave nothing that even a scientific forensic examination could uncover was remarkably efficient work.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r127","rowIndex":127,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして私たちはホテルを出て、最終的に被害者が辿り着いたゴミ捨て場へと向かう。","en":"We left the hotel and headed for the refuse site where the victim’s trail had finally ended.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r128","rowIndex":128,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　もう日が落ちようとしていた。","en":"The sun was about to set.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r129","rowIndex":129,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　止んだはずの雨がいつのまにか本降りになっており、大粒の雫がビニール袋の上で音を立てている。","en":"The rain that had stopped was now falling hard again, heavy drops drumming against the plastic bags.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r130","rowIndex":130,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まったく、今日の天気は不安定だな」","en":"“This weather cannot make up its mind.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"堂島","displayName":"Dojima","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r131","rowIndex":131,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=48>堂島</tips>が舌打ちをする。","en":"<tips=48>Dojima</tips> clicked his tongue.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r132","rowIndex":132,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「この街に住んでいて、いちいち雨に怒っていたらやってられませんぜ」","en":"“If you get angry every time it rains in this city, you’ll never last.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r133","rowIndex":133,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おそらく、事件のあったその日も、このように雨が降りしきっていたのだろう。そして、肉片となった被害者は静かにその雨に打たれていた。","en":"It had probably rained just as relentlessly on the day of the crime. Reduced to pieces of flesh, the victim had lain in silence while the rain beat down upon her.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r134","rowIndex":134,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「しかし、被害者の足取りもこれで終点です。……どうします、他の事件についても、洗い直しますか？」","en":"“This brings us to the end of the victim’s trail. ...What next? Shall we go back over the other cases?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r135","rowIndex":135,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は<tips=48>堂島</tips>に振り返る。","en":"I turned toward <tips=48>Dojima</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r136","rowIndex":136,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「今日はいいだろう。ひとまずどこかで休んで、これまでの情報を整理しよう」","en":"“We have done enough for today. Let’s rest somewhere and organize what we have learned.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"堂島","displayName":"Dojima","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r137","rowIndex":137,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……それじゃあ、うちに来ますか？　<tips=53>ミユキ</tips>も、事件の話を聞きたがっているんですよ」","en":"“...Then why not come back to my place? <tips=53>Miyuki</tips> has been wanting to hear about the case too.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r138","rowIndex":138,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「話したのか？」","en":"“You told her?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"堂島","displayName":"Dojima","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r139","rowIndex":139,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「自宅で殺された<tips=73>リュウカ</tips>って子は、<tips=53>ミユキ</tips>の知り合いでしてね」","en":"“The girl killed in her home, <tips=73>Ryuka</tips>, was an acquaintance of <tips=53>Miyuki’s</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r140","rowIndex":140,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……そういえば、二番目の被害者は<tips=59>暗闇通り</tips>出身だったな」","en":"“...Come to think of it, the second victim came from <tips=59>Darkness Street</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"堂島","displayName":"Dojima","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r141","rowIndex":141,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それを話したら、なんとしても犯人を捕まえてくれって頼まれたんですよ」","en":"“When I told her, she begged me to catch the killer, whatever it took.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r142","rowIndex":142,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうか」","en":"“I see.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"堂島","displayName":"Dojima","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r143","rowIndex":143,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あの事件の時、犯人らしき男が目撃されたんですよね」","en":"“There was a sighting of a man believed to be the culprit during that case, wasn’t there?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r144","rowIndex":144,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ああ。……知っての通り、あの事件は被害者の自宅が殺害現場となったんだが、遺体の発見がかなり早くてね」","en":"“Yes. ...As you know, the victim’s home was the murder scene in that case, but the body was discovered quite soon.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"堂島","displayName":"Dojima","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r145","rowIndex":145,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それは資料に書いてありました。同僚が通報したんですよね。その同僚が貴重な目撃者になった」","en":"“I read that in the material you gave me. One of her coworkers called it in, correct? And that coworker became a crucial witness.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r146","rowIndex":146,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=73>リュウカ</tips>の無断欠勤を心配して同僚が二人で自宅を訪ねたところ、不審な男に襲われた。","en":"Two of <tips=73>Ryuka’s</tips> coworkers, worried when she failed to show up for work without notice, went to her home and were attacked by a suspicious man.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r147","rowIndex":147,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　一人がなんとか部屋を脱出して通報、警察がすぐに駆けつけたということだ。","en":"One of them managed to escape the room and call the police, who arrived immediately.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r148","rowIndex":148,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　不審者は取り逃してしまったが、この同僚の証言は有力な手がかりになっている。","en":"The suspicious man escaped, but the coworker’s testimony became a powerful lead.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r149","rowIndex":149,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうだ。その時、自宅からバラバラになった<tips=73>リュウカ</tips>の遺体が見つかったんだ」","en":"“That’s right. It was then that <tips=73>Ryuka’s</tips> dismembered body was found in her home.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"堂島","displayName":"Dojima","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r150","rowIndex":150,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「この同僚の事情聴取の細かい内容は、私には見せてくれないんですか？　さっきみたいに、基礎的な情報もないようじゃ、私だって困る」","en":"“Are you going to let me see the full record of this coworker’s interview? I cannot do my part if even basic information is being kept from me, as it was just now.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r151","rowIndex":151,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私が渡された資料は、被害者以外の人名や、身元に繋がるような詳しい発言内容は伏せられていて、個人情報に関わる部分だから仕方がないと納得してはいたが、ここまで深く捜査に関わる情報が抜け落ちていたとなれば、読んだ意味がない。","en":"The material I had received concealed every name but the victim’s, along with any detailed statement that might lead to someone’s identity. I had accepted those omissions as unavoidable matters of personal privacy. But if information this central to the investigation had been left out as well, reading the material had been pointless.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r152","rowIndex":152,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「確かに私は部外者ですが、情報は全て共有してもらわないと」","en":"“I may be an outsider, but you need to share all the information with me.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r153","rowIndex":153,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうだな。手配しておこう」","en":"“You’re right. I’ll arrange it.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"堂島","displayName":"Dojima","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r154","rowIndex":154,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　堂島は頷き、","en":"Dojima nodded, then said,","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r155","rowIndex":155,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「何にしろ、あの事件の時、警察は犯人と接触したんだ」","en":"“In any case, during that incident the police came into direct contact with the culprit.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"堂島","displayName":"Dojima","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r156","rowIndex":156,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして、話を続ける。","en":"He went on.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r157","rowIndex":157,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「もし事件の直後に私が介入していれば、もっと決定的な証拠を押さえられていたかもしれないが、まだその時点では私は捜査に参加していなくてね。すぐにまわしてくれれば良かったのだが、つまらないプライドがあったのかもしれないな。残念なことだ」","en":"“Had I intervened immediately after the crime, I might have secured more decisive evidence. But at that point I had not yet joined the investigation. They should have turned it over to me at once; perhaps some petty pride kept them from doing so. It is regrettable.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"堂島","displayName":"Dojima","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r158","rowIndex":158,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　堂島は溜息をつく。","en":"Dojima sighed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r159","rowIndex":159,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうですか。……とにかく、旦那は、私が知らない情報をまだたくさん持っているようですな。そのことについて、うちで洗いざらい話して貰いましょう。ちょうど夕食どきだ。旦那は他人の家のメシは食えないんでしょうが、私は腹が減った。……まったく、捜査を手伝えと言いながら、大事な情報を隠されては困る」","en":"“I see. ...In any event, sir, it appears you still know a great many things I do not. Once we reach my place, you’re going to tell me every last one of them. It’s just about dinnertime. I know you cannot eat food prepared in another person’s home, but I’m hungry. ...Honestly, you cannot ask for my help and then hide vital information from me.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r160","rowIndex":160,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私が睨み付けると、<tips=48>堂島</tips>は肩をすくめた。","en":"When I glared at him, <tips=48>Dojima</tips> shrugged.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r161","rowIndex":161,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして私たちは、私のアパートがある門後の方へ向かって歩き始めた。","en":"Then we began walking toward Kadoushiro, where my apartment stood.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r162","rowIndex":162,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……隠し事と言えば、もう一つあるんだが」","en":"“...Speaking of things I kept from you, there’s one more thing.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"堂島","displayName":"Dojima","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r163","rowIndex":163,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　歩きながら、<tips=48>堂島</tips>は悪びれもせずに言う。","en":"<tips=48>Dojima</tips> said this unabashedly as we walked.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r164","rowIndex":164,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「きみがバーで引っかけたという女について、少し調査したんだ」","en":"“I looked into the woman you said you picked up at the bar.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"堂島","displayName":"Dojima","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r165","rowIndex":165,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そりゃ驚いた。旦那も抱かせてもらおうと思ったんですか？」","en":"“Well, there’s a surprise. Were you hoping she’d let you sleep with her too, sir?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r166","rowIndex":166,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=48>堂島</tips>は首を横に振る。","en":"<tips=48>Dojima</tips> shook his head.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r167","rowIndex":167,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「じゃあ、なんで」","en":"“Then why?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r168","rowIndex":168,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「その女は<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>と関係があるかもしれない」","en":"“The woman may be connected to <tips=20>Koschei</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"堂島","displayName":"Dojima","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r169","rowIndex":169,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「えっ！」","en":"“What?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r170","rowIndex":170,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は立ち止まった。<tips=48>堂島</tips>は振り返る。","en":"I stopped. <tips=48>Dojima</tips> turned toward me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r171","rowIndex":171,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あんた、当たり前のように言うけれど、それこそ、真っ先に話してくれなきゃ困る！　大事な話じゃないですか」","en":"“You say that like it’s nothing, but that’s the very first thing you should’ve told me! This is important!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r172","rowIndex":172,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「確かにそうだが、確信が持てなくてな。かえってきみを混乱させてしまうと思って黙っていたんだ。それでだな……」","en":"“True. But I couldn’t be certain, and I thought telling you would only confuse you, so I kept quiet. And so...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"堂島","displayName":"Dojima","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r173","rowIndex":173,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼が話そうとしたところで、例のけたたましい着信音が鳴る。<tips=48>堂島</tips>は胸元から携帯電話を取り出し、そして今回は着信相手を見ただけで、電話には出ず、保留操作をしてまたポケットに戻した。","en":"Just as he was about to continue, that same shrill ringtone sounded. <tips=48>Dojima</tips> took the phone from his breast pocket. This time he merely checked the caller, put the call on hold without answering, and slipped the phone back into his pocket.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r174","rowIndex":174,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「すまんな」","en":"“Sorry.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"堂島","displayName":"Dojima","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r175","rowIndex":175,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「せめて音を小さくしたらどうですか」","en":"“Could you at least lower the volume?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r176","rowIndex":176,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「聞き逃したら困るだろう」","en":"“I’d be in trouble if I missed one, wouldn’t I?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"堂島","displayName":"Dojima","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r177","rowIndex":177,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　犬のくせに何を言っているのか。その返事に私は溜息をついてから、","en":"What could a dog possibly have to worry about missing? I sighed at his answer, then asked,","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r178","rowIndex":178,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「で、その女の件ですが、やっぱり、においで何かわかったんですね？　私が女のタオルを渡したときの」","en":"“About the woman—you found something in her scent when I gave you her towel, didn’t you?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r179","rowIndex":179,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「気づいたか」","en":"“You noticed?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"堂島","displayName":"Dojima","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r180","rowIndex":180,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そりゃね。渡したときの反応がおかしかったし、<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>のにおいについて話した時にも、何か不審な点があると言っていた。何があったんです？」","en":"“Of course. You reacted strangely when I handed it to you, and when you talked about <tips=20>Koschei’s</tips> scent, you said something about it seemed suspicious. What happened?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r181","rowIndex":181,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……においが変わったんだよ」","en":"“...The scent changed.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"堂島","displayName":"Dojima","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r182","rowIndex":182,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「かわった？」","en":"“Changed?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r183","rowIndex":183,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「最初は、きみが言うような若い女のにおいだったんだがね、嗅いでるうちに、ふと、思春期の少年のにおいに変わった。そして、さっきまで嗅いでいた女のにおいが全く消えてしまった」","en":"“At first, it was the scent of a young woman, just as you described. Then, as I kept smelling it, it suddenly became the scent of an adolescent boy. The woman’s scent I had been smelling until then vanished completely.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"堂島","displayName":"Dojima","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r184","rowIndex":184,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「え？」","en":"“What?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r185","rowIndex":185,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そして次の瞬間にはまた女のにおいに戻っていた。今度はいくら嗅いでも少年のにおいなどなくなっている」","en":"“The next instant, it was a woman’s scent again. This time, no matter how long I smelled it, there was no trace of the boy’s scent.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"堂島","displayName":"Dojima","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r186","rowIndex":186,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どういうことですか？　私が寝た女が、本当は男だったということですか？」","en":"“What does that mean? Was the woman I slept with actually a man?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r187","rowIndex":187,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どうしてそうなる」","en":"“How do you arrive at that conclusion?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"堂島","displayName":"Dojima","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r188","rowIndex":188,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=48>堂島</tips>は眉間にしわを寄せて見せてから、","en":"<tips=48>Dojima</tips> furrowed his brow.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r189","rowIndex":189,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「嗅いでいるにおいが変化したんだよ。こんなのは通常ならば全くあり得ないことだ。しかも、これは初めての体験じゃなかった」","en":"“What I was smelling changed. Ordinarily, that would be completely impossible. And it wasn’t the first time it had happened to me.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"堂島","displayName":"Dojima","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r190","rowIndex":190,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なるほど。それはつまり……」","en":"“I see. In other words...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r191","rowIndex":191,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そう。<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>の犯行現場で、全く同じ体験をしていたんだよ」","en":"“Yes. I had experienced exactly the same thing at one of <tips=20>Koschei’s</tips> crime scenes.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"堂島","displayName":"Dojima","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r192","rowIndex":192,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=48>堂島</tips>は言うと、深く溜息をついた。","en":"<tips=48>Dojima</tips> released a deep sigh.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r193","rowIndex":193,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「その時は、それまで青年のものだったにおいが急に全く別の人間……若い少女のにおいにしか感じられなくなってね。自分の嗅覚に何が起きたんだろうと混乱した。翌日納得がいかずに、もう一度同じ場所に行ったら、少女のにおいなんかせずに最初に嗅いだ青年のにおいしかしなくなっていた。……きっと、たまたま私の体調がおかしくて能力が不安定になったのだろうと、その時は片付けたのだが……」","en":"“At the time, the scent that had belonged to a young man suddenly seemed to me like that of a completely different person... a young girl. I was bewildered, wondering what had happened to my sense of smell. Still unconvinced, I went back to the same place the next day, and then there was no trace of the girl’s scent—only the young man’s scent I had detected at first. ...At the time, I dismissed it as my ability becoming unstable because I happened to be in poor health...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"堂島","displayName":"Dojima","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r194","rowIndex":194,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「私のタオルで同じことがもう一度起きたと」","en":"“And the same thing happened again with my towel.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r195","rowIndex":195,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そう」","en":"“Yes.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"堂島","displayName":"Dojima","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r196","rowIndex":196,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=48>堂島</tips>は頷く。","en":"<tips=48>Dojima</tips> nodded.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r197","rowIndex":197,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「内心で血の気が引いたよ。自分の能力が本格的に狂いかけているのかってね。<tips=16>タイプＡ</tips>の能力ほど不安定なものはないから、以前から心配もしていた。でも、別の理由があるのかもしれないと、念のために女も調査することにしたのさ」","en":"“My blood ran cold. I wondered if my ability was truly starting to go haywire. Nothing is more unstable than a <tips=16>Type A</tips> ability, and it had worried me before. But there might be some other explanation, so I decided to look into the woman as a precaution.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"堂島","displayName":"Dojima","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r198","rowIndex":198,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「で、何がわかりました？」","en":"“And what did you discover?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r199","rowIndex":199,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「女がピアノを弾いていたというバーに行ったり、きみが泊まったという部屋に行ってみた」","en":"“I visited the bar where she had played the piano and the room where you said you stayed.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"堂島","displayName":"Dojima","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r200","rowIndex":200,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「自分がいたした部屋のにおいをあんたに嗅がれたと思うと、あまり楽しい気分にはなれませんな」","en":"“The thought of you sniffing around the room where I did the deed doesn’t exactly thrill me.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r201","rowIndex":201,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私がしかめっ面をするのを、<tips=48>堂島</tips>は相手にせず、","en":"<tips=48>Dojima</tips> ignored my scowl.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r202","rowIndex":202,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そして、バーでピアノを嗅いだとき、私はひどく驚いた。どうしてだと思う？」","en":"“When I smelled the piano at the bar, I was terribly surprised. Why do you suppose that was?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"堂島","displayName":"Dojima","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r203","rowIndex":203,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「また嗅いだことのない、おかしなにおいでもしましたか？」","en":"“Did you find another strange scent you had never smelled before?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r204","rowIndex":204,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「逆だよ。嗅いだことのあるにおいがそこにあったんだ。つまり、犯行現場に残されていた、<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>と思われる青年のにおいだ。びっくりじゃないか。私を惑わした二回の経験が、ここで結びついたんだ。私はマスターに、女の後に誰か別の人間がこのピアノを使ったかと聞いたが、誰も使っていないと言う。じゃあ、<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>はこっそり忍び込んでピアノに触れたとでもいうのか？　何のために？　そんなことはありえないさ」","en":"“The opposite. There was a scent I had smelled before: the scent of the young man believed to be <tips=20>Koschei</tips>, left behind at the crime scene. Surprising, isn’t it? The two incidents that had confounded me were connected after all. I asked the bartender whether anyone else had used the piano after the woman, but he said no. Are we to believe that <tips=20>Koschei</tips> secretly crept into the bar and touched the piano? What for? It’s inconceivable.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"堂島","displayName":"Dojima","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r205","rowIndex":205,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>とあの女は、二人とも残り香がころころとかわり、その変化のなかで同じにおいになる瞬間もあるというわけですか。……なかなか興味深い話ですな」","en":"“So the lingering scents left by <tips=20>Koschei</tips> and the woman both keep changing, and at moments during those changes they become one and the same. ...That is quite a fascinating story.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r206","rowIndex":206,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「だろう」","en":"“Isn’t it?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"堂島","displayName":"Dojima","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r207","rowIndex":207,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「旦那の能力がおかしくなったのではないとすれば、の話ですが」","en":"“Assuming it isn’t your ability that’s gone haywire, sir.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r208","rowIndex":208,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　もしこの話が事実ならば、<tips=48>堂島</tips>が言うとおり、女と<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>に密接な関係があるのはまず間違いがない。","en":"If his account was accurate, then, just as <tips=48>Dojima</tips> said, there could be little doubt that the woman and <tips=20>Koschei</tips> were closely connected.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r209","rowIndex":209,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「これは、<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>の持つ能力によるものでしょうな。それが、何らかの理由で女にも影響を及ぼしている」","en":"“This must be due to an ability <tips=20>Koschei</tips> possesses. For some reason, it is affecting the woman as well.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r210","rowIndex":210,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そう考えるのが自然だ」","en":"“That is the natural conclusion.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"堂島","displayName":"Dojima","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r211","rowIndex":211,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どんな能力なんでしょうね。……もしかしたら他人の<tips=16>タイプA</tips>能力を狂わせる能力ってことも……」","en":"“What sort of ability could it be? ...Perhaps it can even disrupt other people’s <tips=16>Type A</tips> abilities...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r212","rowIndex":212,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「その他にもいくらでも考えつくさ。本当に私の能力が狂いかけているだけかもしれん。とにかく、このようなことがあっては、においはあまり信用出来ないというわけだ。そのような予感はしていたのだが……」","en":"“There are any number of other possibilities. Perhaps my ability truly is beginning to go awry. In any case, if things like this can happen, scent is not evidence we can place much faith in. I had a feeling that might be so...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"堂島","displayName":"Dojima","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r213","rowIndex":213,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……まあ、能力に頼らない捜査を続けましょう。<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>でなくとも、あの女に関する情報でもいいんだ。手がかりが増えて良かったじゃないですか」","en":"“...Well, let’s keep investigating without relying on our abilities. Even if she isn’t <tips=20>Koschei</tips>, information about the woman is still information. We’ve gained another lead; that’s a good thing, isn’t it?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r214","rowIndex":214,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は<tips=48>堂島</tips>の肩を叩いて促すと、再び歩き始めた。","en":"I tapped <tips=48>Dojima</tips> on the shoulder to urge him onward, and we resumed walking.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r215","rowIndex":215,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　歩きながら、私は<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>の能力について考えていた。","en":"As I walked, I considered the nature of <tips=20>Koschei’s</tips> ability.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r216","rowIndex":216,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　もしそれが、他人の<tips=16>タイプA</tips>能力に干渉するようなものならば、私と<tips=48>堂島</tips>は捜査の仕方を全く変えなくてはいけない。しかし、サイキックを無効にするというだけでは、これまでこの街で警察の追及を逃れ続けられたことの説明にはならないだろう。","en":"If it interfered with other people’s <tips=16>Type A</tips> abilities, <tips=48>Dojima</tips> and I would have to change our entire approach to the investigation. But merely neutralizing psychic powers would not explain how he had continued to elude the police in this city.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r217","rowIndex":217,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　通常捜査に対して有効な能力なのは間違いないのだから、まずはそっちを軸に想定すべきだ。","en":"There could be no doubt that his ability worked against conventional police work, so that had to be the starting point for our hypothesis.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r218","rowIndex":218,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして私は、自分たちが追い詰める側として<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>のことをあれこれと考えていたのだが、迂闊にも、それよりももっと明白な脅威を見落としていた。","en":"And so, thinking of ourselves as the ones closing in on <tips=20>Koschei</tips>, I considered him from every angle—but carelessly overlooked a far more obvious threat.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r219","rowIndex":219,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　あと少し時間があればそれに気がついていたのかもしれない。","en":"Given a little more time, I might have noticed it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r220","rowIndex":220,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しかし、現実に何が起きたのかと言うと、私が自発的にそれに気がつくよりも先に、結果としてそれは目の前に現れた。","en":"But before I could recognize the threat for myself, its consequences brought it plainly into view.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r221","rowIndex":221,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「待て」","en":"“Wait.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"堂島","displayName":"Dojima","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r222","rowIndex":222,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私の住む「すみれ荘」のすぐ目の前まで来た時、<tips=48>堂島</tips>が鋭く言った。","en":"<tips=48>Dojima</tips> spoke sharply just as we reached Sumire Apartments, where I lived.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r223","rowIndex":223,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どうしました？」","en":"“What is it?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r224","rowIndex":224,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その張り詰めた態度を不審に思いつつ、私は彼の方を見る。","en":"Puzzled by the tension in his manner, I looked toward him.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r225","rowIndex":225,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=48>堂島</tips>は私に横顔を見せている。その二つの瞳は、まっすぐ私の部屋のドアにクギ付けになっており、微動だにしなかった。","en":"<tips=48>Dojima</tips> had turned his profile to me. His eyes were riveted on the door to my apartment and did not move by so much as a fraction.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r226","rowIndex":226,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=50>路地</tips>君、落ち着いて聞くんだ」","en":"“<tips=50>Roji</tips>, I need you to stay calm and listen.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"堂島","displayName":"Dojima","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r227","rowIndex":227,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　押し殺した声でそう囁く。","en":"He whispered in a low, carefully controlled voice.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r228","rowIndex":228,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「何をですか？」","en":"“What do you mean?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r229","rowIndex":229,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いいか、動揺してはいけない」","en":"“Listen to me. You mustn’t panic.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"堂島","displayName":"Dojima","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r230","rowIndex":230,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼の声にも、顔つきにも、緊迫感が満ちている。","en":"Tension showed in both his voice and his face.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r231","rowIndex":231,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「旦那。もったい付けないで、はやく言ってくれませんか」","en":"“Sir, stop drawing this out and tell me already, would you?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r232","rowIndex":232,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ただ事でないその態度に、私も何事かを察し、我知らず怒気をはらませながら彼をせかした。","en":"His manner made it clear that this was no ordinary matter. Sensing something without yet knowing what, I pressed him on, my voice filling with anger despite myself.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r233","rowIndex":233,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……においがするんだ。きみの部屋から。血のにおいが……。それも、ほんのわずかな量ではなく、おびただしい出血でなければありえないような猛烈なものだ。そして、血液以外の、さまざまな分泌液や、内臓内の未消化物や排泄物のにおいも……」","en":"“...There’s a scent coming from your room. The scent of blood... Not a tiny quantity, but something overwhelming, possible only after tremendous blood loss. And beyond the blood, I smell various secretions, undigested matter from internal organs, and excrement...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"堂島","displayName":"Dojima","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r234","rowIndex":234,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「血って、誰の血ですか？　旦那なら、わかるでしょうっ？」","en":"“Blood? Whose blood is it? You can tell, can’t you, sir?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r235","rowIndex":235,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=48>堂島</tips>は振り返って私の目を見つめると、何も答えない。","en":"<tips=48>Dojima</tips> turned, met my eyes, and gave no answer.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r236","rowIndex":236,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　言うまでも、ないということだろう。","en":"He must have meant that the answer went without saying.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r237","rowIndex":237,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……<tips=53>ミユキ</tips>」","en":"“...<tips=53>Miyuki</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r238","rowIndex":238,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=48>堂島</tips>が嗅ぎ取ったにおいは、正常な状態の人間ならば、すべて体内に収められているものだ。それが、彼の超嗅覚によるものとは言え、こんな部屋の外でも感じ取ることが出来る。しかも雨だというのに。","en":"Every substance <tips=48>Dojima</tips> smelled would, under normal circumstances, have been contained inside a person’s body. Yet even allowing for his superhuman nose, he could perceive them from outside the room—and through the rain.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r239","rowIndex":239,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それはつまり、そうした体内のあれこれが、露出した状態であるということだ。そして奇しくも、我々が今追いかけているのは人間をバラバラに解体する殺人鬼である。","en":"In other words, the various substances ordinarily enclosed within the body now lay exposed. And by a terrible coincidence, we were pursuing a killer who dismembered human beings.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r240","rowIndex":240,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女がいまどういう状態で部屋にいるか、容易に想像がついた。","en":"It was easy to imagine the condition in which she now lay inside the room.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r241","rowIndex":241,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　我を失いそうになりながら、私は必死で考える。","en":"Even as I nearly lost control, I desperately forced myself to think.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r242","rowIndex":242,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しかし、相手が<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>だとすれば、なぜここに？","en":"But if <tips=20>Koschei</tips> was responsible, why had he come here?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r243","rowIndex":243,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ああ……」","en":"“Ah...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r244","rowIndex":244,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　少し考えて、すぐに私は気がついた。","en":"A moment’s thought, and it struck me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r245","rowIndex":245,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そうだ、あの夜ひっかけたあの女は、<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>と繋がりがあって、そして、私の財布を盗んだのだった！","en":"Of course. The woman I picked up that night had some connection to <tips=20>Koschei</tips>—and she had stolen my wallet.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r246","rowIndex":246,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　あの時私は女に、<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>のことを話した。その世界的に有名な殺人鬼がこの街で殺人を犯しているという情報は、まだニュースにもなっていない、警察関係者だけが知っている情報だった。女は、そんな情報を知っている私を不審に思い、財布を盗んでいったに違いない。","en":"That night, I had told her about <tips=20>Koschei</tips>. The fact that this internationally infamous murderer was killing people in the city had not yet appeared in the news. It was information known only to those connected with the police. The woman must have grown suspicious of me for knowing it and stolen my wallet.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r247","rowIndex":247,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして、財布のなかのカードや身分証からこの住所を割り出し、<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>に伝えたのだ。","en":"She must then have worked out this address from the cards and identification in my wallet and passed it on to <tips=20>Koschei</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r248","rowIndex":248,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　今の今までその可能性に気づかなかったとは、なんと愚かなことか！　そして、はじめから財布を盗まれたことを<tips=48>堂島</tips>に伝えていれば、彼が気づいたかもしれないのに、それもしなかったとは！","en":"How could I have been so foolish as not to see the possibility until this very moment! And if I had told <tips=48>Dojima</tips> from the start that my wallet had been stolen, he might have realized it—but I had not even done that!","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r249","rowIndex":249,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　すべて、私のせいなのだ。","en":"Everything was my fault.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r250","rowIndex":250,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　体中から血がすっとひくような感覚があり、そして耳の奥がツンとした。感情がふくれあがり、爆発しそうだった。私は目をつむると、手のひらで胸の辺りをわしづかみにし、奥歯をぎゅっと噛みしめてそれに耐えた。","en":"I felt the blood drain from every part of my body, and something stung deep inside my ears. My emotions swelled until they seemed ready to burst. I closed my eyes, clutched at my chest, and clenched my back teeth against them.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r251","rowIndex":251,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=50>路地</tips>君……」","en":"“<tips=50>Roji</tips>...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"堂島","displayName":"Dojima","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r252","rowIndex":252,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は大きく息を吸い、そして吐き出してからまぶたを開く。そして、こちらを見つめる<tips=48>堂島</tips>に答えた。","en":"I took a deep breath and let it out before opening my eyes. Then I answered <tips=48>Dojima</tips>, who was watching me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r253","rowIndex":253,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「大丈夫ですよ。私は取り乱さない。取り乱せば、わずかに残った可能性も失うだけだ……」","en":"“I’m all right. I won’t lose control. If I do, I’ll only lose what little chance remains...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r254","rowIndex":254,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私はもう一度深呼吸をして、","en":"I took another deep breath.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r255","rowIndex":255,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「私たちが今行うことは、未知の脅威に警戒しながら、まず状況を正確に把握することだ。そうでしょう？」","en":"“What we have to do now is stay alert for an unknown threat and first get an accurate grasp of the situation. Am I right?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r256","rowIndex":256,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　言うと、<tips=48>堂島</tips>は無言で頷いた。","en":"<tips=48>Dojima</tips> nodded without a word.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r257","rowIndex":257,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=48>堂島</tips>は路上に四つん這いになり、そこに残された足跡のにおいを嗅ぐ。私はその間周囲を見回し、何者かが潜んでいないか確認をする。","en":"<tips=48>Dojima</tips> dropped to all fours in the street and smelled the footprints left there. Meanwhile, I searched the area for anyone hiding nearby.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r258","rowIndex":258,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「旦那、わかりますか？」","en":"“Can you tell, sir?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r259","rowIndex":259,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　見回しながら、私は足元の<tips=48>堂島</tips>に尋ねる。","en":"Without taking my eyes off our surroundings, I asked <tips=48>Dojima</tips> at my feet.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r260","rowIndex":260,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=50>路地</tips>君、どうやらこれは私の知っているにおいのようだ」","en":"“<tips=50>Roji</tips>, this seems to be a scent I recognize.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"堂島","displayName":"Dojima","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r261","rowIndex":261,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>ですか？」","en":"“<tips=20>Koschei</tips>?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r262","rowIndex":262,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼の方を見ると、彼はすぐには返事をせず、考え込んでいる。","en":"When I looked toward him, he did not immediately respond but sank into thought.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r263","rowIndex":263,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どうしました？　違うんですか？」","en":"“What is it? Am I wrong?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r264","rowIndex":264,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いや、おそらく、そうだろう」","en":"“No—I think it probably is.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"堂島","displayName":"Dojima","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r265","rowIndex":265,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼は頷きを返した。","en":"He nodded.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r266","rowIndex":266,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　やはりそうか。","en":"So it was him after all.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r267","rowIndex":267,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　あの残虐な殺人鬼が、こともあろうに私の住まいを訪れたというのか。","en":"That brutal killer had come to my home, of all places.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r268","rowIndex":268,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私と堂島は、静かにアパートの階段の側まで近づく。","en":"Dojima and I quietly approached the apartment stairs.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r269","rowIndex":269,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　階段は屋根に守られており雨で洗い流されてはいない。<tips=48>堂島</tips>の嗅覚が、より精密に感知出来る状況だった。","en":"The stairs were protected by a roof, so the rain had not washed the scents away. That made it easier for <tips=48>Dojima’s</tips> nose to read them precisely.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r270","rowIndex":270,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　犬のように這いつくばって階段の上がり口のにおいを嗅いでいた<tips=48>堂島</tips>は、私の襟を掴み、ぐいと顔を近づけ、小さな声で囁いた。","en":"After crawling like a dog and smelling the foot of the stairs, <tips=48>Dojima</tips> seized my collar, pulled me close, and whispered,","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r271","rowIndex":271,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「においはえらく新鮮だ。この近く……もしくは、まだ部屋にいるかもしれんぞ」","en":"“The scent is extremely fresh. He may be somewhere nearby... or still inside the room.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"堂島","displayName":"Dojima","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r272","rowIndex":272,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「本当か？」","en":"“Really?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r273","rowIndex":273,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　冷静でいなくてはならないのは理解しているが、全身の血が沸騰しそうになるのは止められない。","en":"I knew I had to remain calm, but I could not stop the blood in my veins from threatening to boil.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r274","rowIndex":274,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　本当だったら今すぐにも駆け出して、部屋のドアを叩き破りたかったが、どうにかその衝動を抑える。短絡的な行動は我々の命を奪う。ここで我々が死ねば、それは単なる我々の敗北というだけではなく、<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>という連続殺人鬼の逮捕自体が遠のくということだ。","en":"If he really was there, I wanted to charge up at once and smash down the door, but somehow I suppressed the impulse. A rash act could cost us our lives. If we died here, it would mean more than our own defeat: it would make the capture of the serial killer <tips=20>Koschei</tips> more distant still.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r275","rowIndex":275,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　逆に言えば、ここまで相手に接近した今こそが、彼を捕まえる最大のチャンスなのである。","en":"By the same token, now that we had come this close, this was our best chance to capture him.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r276","rowIndex":276,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=53>ミユキ</tips>のことを、少しでも思うと心が乱れる。","en":"The slightest thought of <tips=53>Miyuki</tips> threw my mind into turmoil.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r277","rowIndex":277,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　今まで相当な修羅場をくぐって来たつもりだが、こんな感情になるのは初めてだ。","en":"I thought I had been through my share of hell, but I had never felt anything like this before.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r278","rowIndex":278,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は、極力<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>を捕まえるということだけに意識を集中したが、それでも息苦しいのである。さらに、自分のせいだという罪悪感が空気を薄くする。","en":"I concentrated as hard as I could on nothing but capturing <tips=20>Koschei</tips>, yet I still struggled to breathe. Worse, the guilt of knowing it was my fault thinned the air.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r279","rowIndex":279,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちはすぐに階段を上り始める。","en":"We immediately began climbing the stairs.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r280","rowIndex":280,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　薄っぺらい金属板で出来た階段は、僅かな足音でも大きく響かせる。私も<tips=48>堂島</tips>のように四つん這いになって、両手にも体重を分散させながら階段をのぼった。私たちは物音を立てない。かわりに、雨の降りしきるジャアジャアという音が、やたらと耳にこびりついた。","en":"Constructed from thin sheet metal, the stairs magnified even the faintest footstep. I dropped to all fours like <tips=48>Dojima</tips> and distributed my weight across my hands as I climbed. Neither of us made a sound. In its place, the ceaseless rush of falling rain clung intolerably to my ears.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r281","rowIndex":281,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ドアのすぐ目の前まで来たところで、部屋のなかからゴトッと何か重いものが床に落ちる音がきこえる。","en":"Just as we reached the door, something heavy fell to the floor within with a dull thud.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r282","rowIndex":282,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちはその場でぴたりと足を止め、まるで恋人同士のようにぴったり身を寄せ合って薄っぺらいドア一枚隔てた向こうの様子を窺った。","en":"We stopped dead and pressed ourselves tightly together like lovers, trying to make out what was happening beyond the flimsy door.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r283","rowIndex":283,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いるな。ごそごそとしている。音が遠い。奥の部屋にいるようだが……何か探しているのか？」","en":"“Someone’s in there. I hear them rummaging around. The sound is distant—they seem to be in the back room... Are they looking for something?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"堂島","displayName":"Dojima","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r284","rowIndex":284,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=48>堂島</tips>がその状態で囁きながら、懐から銃を抜く。","en":"Still whispering in that position, <tips=48>Dojima</tips> drew a pistol from inside his coat.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r285","rowIndex":285,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼の見た目は犬そのもので、嗅覚は犬さえ凌駕しているが、聴覚は平凡な人間と変わらない。","en":"He looked precisely like a dog, and his sense of smell surpassed even a dog’s. His hearing, however, was no better than an ordinary person’s.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r286","rowIndex":286,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「さて、どうやって逮捕するかな……。やつは脱出の名人だが……」","en":"“Now, how are we going to arrest him...? He’s a master of escape...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"堂島","displayName":"Dojima","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r287","rowIndex":287,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「突入しましょう。相手にどんな能力があっても、使われる前にそいつで撃ち殺せば良いんだ」","en":"“Let’s go in. Whatever ability he has, we can shoot him dead with that before he uses it.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r288","rowIndex":288,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「上からは、生きたまま逮捕するよう指示が出ている」","en":"“I have orders from above to take him alive.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"堂島","displayName":"Dojima","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r289","rowIndex":289,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「不可能です」","en":"“Impossible.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r290","rowIndex":290,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……そうだな。……あと、<tips=50>路地</tips>君、気を強く持ちたまえ。つらいだろうが……」","en":"“...Yes. ...And <tips=50>Roji</tips>—steel yourself. I know this will be painful, but...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"堂島","displayName":"Dojima","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r291","rowIndex":291,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いや」","en":"“No.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r292","rowIndex":292,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は<tips=48>堂島</tips>の言葉を遮った。","en":"I cut <tips=48>Dojima</tips> off.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r293","rowIndex":293,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「同情はいりません。これは私のせいなんですよ」","en":"“I don’t need your sympathy. This is my fault.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r294","rowIndex":294,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は痛みはじめたこめかみを指先で押さえながら、","en":"Pressing my fingertips to my aching temple, I continued,","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r295","rowIndex":295,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ヤツは、私の財布に入っていたものからこの場所を突き止めたんでしょう」","en":"“He must have found this place from something in my wallet.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r296","rowIndex":296,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「財布？」","en":"“Your wallet?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"堂島","displayName":"Dojima","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r297","rowIndex":297,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「みっともないので旦那には言っていませんでしたがね。あの夜、女が消えたとき私の財布も消えていたんですよ。私がうっかり<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>のことを口にしていたので、私の素性を調べようと盗んだんですな。何もかも、私のまいた種です」","en":"“I was too embarrassed to tell you, sir, but the night the woman disappeared, my wallet disappeared with her. I had carelessly let <tips=20>Koschei’s</tips> name slip, so she stole it to find out who I was. I sowed every seed of this myself.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r298","rowIndex":298,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……そうか」","en":"“...I see.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"堂島","displayName":"Dojima","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r299","rowIndex":299,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=48>堂島</tips>は視線をそらし、","en":"<tips=48>Dojima</tips> averted his gaze.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r300","rowIndex":300,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「鍵はかかっていないようだな。……よし、銃を持っている私が突入する。一気に駆け込んで、奥の部屋にいる対象を制圧する。きみは後ろで私の死角を警戒してくれ。対象は一人のようだが、今回は私の能力を過信できないし、共犯者がいる可能性もある。油断するな」","en":"“The door appears to be unlocked. ...Very well. I have the pistol, so I will enter. I will rush straight into the back room and subdue the target there. Stay behind me and guard my blind side. The target appears to be alone, but this time I cannot place too much faith in my ability, and there may be an accomplice. Stay alert.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"堂島","displayName":"Dojima","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r301","rowIndex":301,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして、ドアノブに手をかけた。","en":"Then he placed his hand upon the doorknob.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r302","rowIndex":302,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ラジャー」","en":"“Roger.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r303","rowIndex":303,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私が頷くのを見届けてから彼は銃口をドアの方向に向けた。そして、呼吸を止めてから、一息にノブをひねる。","en":"After seeing me nod, he directed the muzzle toward the door. He held his breath, then turned the knob in one motion.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r304","rowIndex":304,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　バンと音を立ててドアを開き、<tips=48>堂島</tips>は同時に身体を滑り込ませる。それなりの年齢の筈だが、猟犬のように素早い動きだ。","en":"The door flew open with a bang, and <tips=48>Dojima</tips> slipped through it in the same instant. He had to be getting on in years, yet he moved with the speed of a hunting dog.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r305","rowIndex":305,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その後で足を踏み入れた私の目の前には、想像はしていたが、実際そうあって欲しくなかった光景が広がっていた。","en":"I stepped in behind him, and there before me lay the sight I had imagined but desperately wished not to find in reality.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r306","rowIndex":306,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちの住むアパートは、２DKのコンパクトな間取りであった。ドアを開くとすぐそこは、ダイニングキッチンとなっている。テーブルと椅子を並べ、私と<tips=53>ミユキ</tips>で向かい合って食事をとる場所だ。","en":"Our apartment possessed a compact two-room layout with a dining kitchen. Immediately beyond the door was the kitchen and dining area, where <tips=53>Miyuki</tips> and I sat across from one another at the table for our meals.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r307","rowIndex":307,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　古くさい建物だが、日頃<tips=53>ミユキ</tips>は几帳面に掃除をし、<tips=57>滑走路通り</tips>で買ってきた雑貨などで飾り付けて見栄え良くしていた。その飾り付けのあまりにも女性らしいセンスに、私が居心地悪く感じたほどだ。","en":"The building was old, but <tips=53>Miyuki</tips> kept the place meticulously clean and made it attractive with ornaments she bought on <tips=57>Runway Street</tips>. Her taste in decoration was so thoroughly feminine that even I had felt out of place there.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r308","rowIndex":308,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　今はその空間が、殺人現場と変わり果てている。","en":"Now that same space had been transformed beyond recognition into a murder scene.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r309","rowIndex":309,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　床一面に血液と、何やらわからぬ肉片が散乱していた。","en":"Blood and unidentifiable fragments of flesh lay scattered across the entire floor.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r310","rowIndex":310,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そのなかでひときわ目立つのはスイカのような丸い塊だ。それは首で切断された<tips=53>ミユキ</tips>の頭部で、彼女は両目を丸く見開き、唇をわずかにあけ、驚きの表情を浮かべたまま血みどろになっている。","en":"Most conspicuous among them was a round mass like a watermelon. It was <tips=53>Miyuki’s</tips> head, severed at the neck. Her eyes were opened wide, her lips slightly parted, and her face remained frozen in surprise, drenched in blood.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r311","rowIndex":311,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=48>堂島</tips>はその血の海を駆け抜けて、奥の部屋へと向かう。私はその後を追わなくてはならなかったが、<tips=53>ミユキ</tips>と目が合った瞬間、頭の中が真っ白になって、気がつけば血の海のなかに跪いていた。","en":"<tips=48>Dojima</tips> raced through the sea of blood toward the back room. I needed to follow him. But the instant my eyes met <tips=53>Miyuki’s</tips>, my mind went blank. When awareness returned, I was kneeling in the blood.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r312","rowIndex":312,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして、バラバラになった肉片一つ一つをかき集め、それぞれが彼女の身体の一部だったことを確認する。それらはすべて、私が触れ、そして私に触れたものたちだった。","en":"I gathered every piece of the dismembered flesh and identified each as part of her body. Every one had once been touched by me and had touched me in return.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r313","rowIndex":313,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その後ろで、何やらパンパンと乾いた銃声が鳴った。<tips=48>堂島</tips>が<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>に向かって発砲したのだろう。音はとても大きく聞こえるのに、なぜかどこか遠く、別の世界で鳴っているように感じた。","en":"Behind me came several dry cracks of gunfire. Presumably, <tips=48>Dojima</tips> was firing at <tips=20>Koschei</tips>. The reports sounded extraordinarily loud, yet somehow seemed distant, occurring in another world.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r314","rowIndex":314,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=50>路地</tips>君……」","en":"“<tips=50>Roji</tips>...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r315","rowIndex":315,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ふと気がつくと、目の前に銃をだらりとぶらさげた<tips=48>堂島</tips>が私を見下ろしている。","en":"When I suddenly came to myself, <tips=48>Dojima</tips> stood over me, looking down with his pistol hanging loosely at his side.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r316","rowIndex":316,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「やりましたか？」","en":"“Did you get him?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r317","rowIndex":317,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ああ……」","en":"“Yes...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r318","rowIndex":318,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=48>堂島</tips>も、血の海の側にしゃがみ込み、","en":"<tips=48>Dojima</tips> crouched beside the sea of blood.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r319","rowIndex":319,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「気立ての良い娘さんだった。気の毒に」","en":"“She was a sweet-natured young woman. Poor girl.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r320","rowIndex":320,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「旦那が悔やみを言うなんて珍しいですな」","en":"“It’s unusual to hear you offer condolences, sir.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r321","rowIndex":321,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は笑ったつもりだったが、ひきつったような表情にしかならなかった。","en":"I meant to smile, but my face only twisted into a strained grimace.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r322","rowIndex":322,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=50>路地</tips>君。自分を責めないことだ。人の力ではどうにもならない巡り合わせというものがある」","en":"“<tips=50>Roji</tips>, don’t blame yourself. There are turns of fate that human strength can do nothing to prevent.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r323","rowIndex":323,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「慰めるなんて、さらに珍しい。こりゃあ良くないことが起こる予兆かもしれません」","en":"“Now you’re consoling me? That’s rarer still. Maybe it’s an omen that something worse is coming.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r324","rowIndex":324,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私が言うと、<tips=48>堂島</tips>は溜息をつき、","en":"When I said it, <tips=48>Dojima</tips> sighed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r325","rowIndex":325,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「じゃあ私らしく言ってやろう。いまきみにここでリタイヤされては困るんだ。まだ仕事をしてもらう必要があるかもしれないからね」","en":"“Then I’ll say it in a way more befitting me. I can’t have you retiring here and now. I may still have work for you.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r326","rowIndex":326,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どういうことです？　<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>は始末したんでしょう？」","en":"“What do you mean? You dealt with <tips=20>Koschei</tips>, didn’t you?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r327","rowIndex":327,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……そう思いたいんだがな」","en":"“...I would like to believe so.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r328","rowIndex":328,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　疑問に首をひねる私に向かって、<tips=48>堂島</tips>は<tips=53>ミユキ</tips>の遺体を指さしつつ口を開く。","en":"I looked at him in confusion. Pointing at <tips=53>Miyuki’s</tips> remains, <tips=48>Dojima</tips> said,","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r329","rowIndex":329,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「この現場の状況が、おかしいとは思わないか？」","en":"“Don’t you think there’s something strange about this scene?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r330","rowIndex":330,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「何がですか？」","en":"“In what way?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r331","rowIndex":331,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「これまでの<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>の現場とは、大分違う」","en":"“This scene is very different from <tips=20>Koschei’s</tips> previous crime scenes.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r332","rowIndex":332,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どこがです。同じバラバラ死体じゃないですか。そりゃ綺麗に棚に仕舞われてはいませんが、これからそうするつもりだったんでしょう」","en":"“How? It’s another dismembered body, isn’t it? The pieces haven’t been arranged neatly on the shelves, sure, but he was probably going to do that next.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r333","rowIndex":333,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それはそうかもしれないが……」","en":"“That may be true, but...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r334","rowIndex":334,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=48>堂島</tips>は腕組みをする。","en":"<tips=48>Dojima</tips> folded his arms.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r335","rowIndex":335,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……なんと言うかね。遺体の切断の仕方が違うんだよ。これまでは、刃物を使って関節にそって垂直に切断し、胴体に対する切断方法も、垂直や水平といった、きっちりとした角度で刃物が入れられている。そして、遺体は長方形に近い形状をとるんだが……今回は、めちゃくちゃだ。実に乱暴だよ」","en":"“...How can I put it? The way the body was dismembered is different. Before, a blade was used to cut vertically along the joints, and the torso too was cut at precise vertical or horizontal angles. The pieces of the body would be nearly rectangular... This time, it’s a mess. Brutally crude.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r336","rowIndex":336,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……単に理由の違いではないですか？　今までは本人の趣味嗜好での解体だったわけじゃないですか。今回はそうじゃない。主目的はこのアパートの調査で、解体はそのついでだから、いつもとは気分が違って……」","en":"“...Couldn’t it simply be a difference in purpose? Before, he was dismembering them to satisfy his own tastes, wasn’t he? Not this time. His main objective was to search this apartment, and the dismemberment was incidental, so perhaps he was in a different frame of mind...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r337","rowIndex":337,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうは思えないな。あそこまでこだわりの強い犯人が、急いでいるからといってこんなやり方をするだろうか。それに、断面も違う。切断に使った道具も違うんじゃないか？　そのあたりは、鑑識が見ないとわからないが……」","en":"“I doubt it. Would a killer that particular really work this way simply because he was in a hurry? The cut surfaces are different as well. Might he have used another tool to dismember the body? We won’t know until forensics examines it...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r338","rowIndex":338,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「でも、実際に旦那はここで<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>を撃ち殺したわけでしょう？」","en":"“But you did just shoot <tips=20>Koschei</tips> dead here, sir, didn’t you?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r339","rowIndex":339,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そのはずだ。少なくとも、私の嗅いだにおいは、<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>の現場で嗅いだものと全く同じだった」","en":"“It should have been him. At the very least, the scent I smelled was identical to the one I found at <tips=20>Koschei’s</tips> crime scene.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r340","rowIndex":340,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どういうことです？」","en":"“What do you mean?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r341","rowIndex":341,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……その目でヤツの遺体を見ればわかる」","en":"“...You’ll understand once you see his body with your own eyes.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r342","rowIndex":342,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=48>堂島</tips>は立ち上がる。","en":"<tips=48>Dojima</tips> rose.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r343","rowIndex":343,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私も続いて立ち上がろうとして、両手にかき集めた<tips=53>ミユキ</tips>のかけらをどうするか、一瞬躊躇った。","en":"I began to follow, then hesitated over what to do with the pieces of <tips=53>Miyuki</tips> gathered in my hands.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r344","rowIndex":344,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして同時に、自分の両腕が肩のあたりまで真っ赤に染まっていることにも、その時初めて気がついた。","en":"At the same moment, I noticed for the first time that both my arms were stained red to the shoulders.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r345","rowIndex":345,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　酷い姿だ。","en":"I was an appalling sight.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r346","rowIndex":346,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　まじまじと自分の両手を眺めていると、","en":"As I studied both hands,","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r347","rowIndex":347,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「うっ」","en":"“Urgh.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r348","rowIndex":348,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=48>堂島</tips>がうめき声を上げ、そして視線を上げたら、そのグレーのスーツを着た肩に、細身のナイフが突き刺さっている。","en":"<tips=48>Dojima</tips> groaned. When I raised my eyes, I saw a slender knife embedded deep in his shoulder through the gray suit.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r349","rowIndex":349,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　振り返ると、ドアのあたりに、先ほどまではいなかった二人の少女が立ち、こちらを見ている。","en":"I looked back. Two girls who had not been there a moment before stood near the door, watching us.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r350","rowIndex":350,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　制服を身につけたその少女たちは、全く同じ顔立ちで、全く同じ長い黒髪を持つ、見分けのつかない二人だった。","en":"The girls wore school uniforms. Their faces were identical, as was their long black hair. It was impossible to distinguish them.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r351","rowIndex":351,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「灰上！」","en":"“Haigami!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"堂島","displayName":"Dojima","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r352","rowIndex":352,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そう叫んだのは、いつの間にか振り返っていた<tips=48>堂島</tips>だった。","en":"<tips=48>Dojima</tips>, who had somehow already turned toward them, shouted the name.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r353","rowIndex":353,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「鬼と、狼男。まるでお化け屋敷だわ」","en":"“An ogre and a werewolf. It’s like a haunted house.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"灰上江梨子","displayName":"Eriko Haigami","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r354","rowIndex":354,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あなたたちのこと知ってる。サイキックばっかり逮捕するワンコロ刑事さんに、その手下の元探偵さんでしょ」","en":"“We know who you are. You’re the mutt detective who does nothing but arrest psychics, and his ex-detective lackey, right?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"灰上璃映子","displayName":"Rieko Haigami","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r355","rowIndex":355,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　少女たちは順番に口を開く。","en":"The girls spoke in turn.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r356","rowIndex":356,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=86>灰上姉妹</tips>と言えば、この街では割と名の知れたミュータントの双子だ。妹は<tips=17>タイプＢ</tips>で、姉は<tips=16>タイプＡ</tips>である。<tips=13>ヘドロ団地</tips>のボスに可愛がられており、その事情を知る者は誰も二人には逆らえない。","en":"The <tips=86>Haigami sisters</tips> were mutant twins of some renown in the city. The younger was <tips=17>Type B</tips>, the elder <tips=16>Type A</tips>. They were favorites of the boss of the <tips=13>Sludge Housing Complex</tips>, and no one who knew that dared cross them.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r357","rowIndex":357,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その口ぶりからすると、ここを私の住まいと知ってやって来たわけではなさそうだ。","en":"From their manner of speaking, they had apparently come without knowing that this was my home.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r358","rowIndex":358,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「おまえたちが、なぜここに？」","en":"“Why are you two here?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"堂島","displayName":"Dojima","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r359","rowIndex":359,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=48>堂島</tips>が、かすれた声でそう訊ねる。……彼の傷の具合はどの程度なのだろうか？　こうして動いているということは、急所は免れたのかもしれないが、ナイフは深々と刺さっているように見えた。","en":"<tips=48>Dojima</tips> asked in a hoarse voice. ...How serious was his wound? The fact that he still moved might mean the knife had missed a vital point, but it appeared to be embedded deeply.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r360","rowIndex":360,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>と、関わっているのか？」","en":"“...Are you involved with <tips=20>Koschei</tips>?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"堂島","displayName":"Dojima","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r361","rowIndex":361,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼からすれば、サイキックである灰上姉は当然監視対象で、その素性はよく知っているだろう。その彼からしても、この状況はとても理解が出来ないようだった。","en":"As a psychic, the elder Haigami sister would naturally have been under his surveillance, and he presumably knew her background well. Yet the situation appeared incomprehensible even to him.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r362","rowIndex":362,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=86>灰上姉妹</tips>は答えない。","en":"The <tips=86>Haigami sisters</tips> did not answer.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r363","rowIndex":363,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　片方が、手を前に差し出す。そこには、<tips=48>堂島</tips>の背中に突き刺さったものと全く同じナイフが握られていた。","en":"One extended a hand before her. It held a knife identical to the one embedded in <tips=48>Dojima’s</tips> back.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r364","rowIndex":364,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　少女はその握った手を放す。となれば、ナイフは本来重力にひかれて地面に落ちる筈だが、そうはならず、空中に静止している。それどころか、ゆらりと舞ってから、浮上する。","en":"The girl released her grip. The knife should naturally have fallen to the floor under the pull of gravity, but it did not. It hung motionless in the air, then drifted gently and began to rise.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r365","rowIndex":365,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　灰上姉の能力は、念動力だ。ナイフは彼女の能力によって操られているのだろう。おそらく、<tips=48>堂島</tips>の肩に突き刺さったのも、投げたのではなく能力によるもののはずだ。","en":"The elder Haigami sister possessed telekinesis. She must have been controlling the knife with her ability. Presumably, the one embedded in <tips=48>Dojima’s</tips> shoulder had not been thrown, but driven by the same power.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r366","rowIndex":366,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「大人しく退散しなさい。さっきのは警告よ。次は急所を狙う」","en":"“Leave quietly. That was a warning. Next time, I’ll aim somewhere vital.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"灰上璃映子","displayName":"Rieko Haigami","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r367","rowIndex":367,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「馬鹿なことはやめろ。おまえたちがこの殺人鬼に手を貸す理由はないはずだ」","en":"“Stop this nonsense. You have no reason to help this killer.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"堂島","displayName":"Dojima","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r368","rowIndex":368,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=48>堂島</tips>が毅然として言ったが、その言葉は効果がなかったようだ。ナイフは<tips=48>堂島</tips>に向かって飛んで行く。","en":"<tips=48>Dojima</tips> spoke resolutely, but his words appeared to have no effect. The knife flew toward <tips=48>Dojima</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r369","rowIndex":369,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　念動力で動かされたナイフは通常の放物線を描かない。どう襲い来るか分からない以上、回避は非常に困難だ。しかし、こうした場数を踏んだ<tips=48>堂島</tips>の動きは早かった。","en":"A knife moved by telekinesis did not travel along an ordinary parabola. With no way to predict its approach, evasion was exceedingly difficult. But <tips=48>Dojima</tips> was seasoned in confrontations like this, and he reacted quickly.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r370","rowIndex":370,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼は避けず、腕を上げる。そこには銃が握られていた。","en":"He did not dodge. He raised his arm. A pistol was clenched in his hand.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r371","rowIndex":371,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　パンと銃声が鳴り響き、ナイフを取り出した方の少女の肩で血がはじけた。","en":"A gunshot cracked, and blood burst from the shoulder of the girl who had drawn the knife.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r372","rowIndex":372,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「うっ」","en":"“Urgh.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r373","rowIndex":373,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　傷口をおさえて蹲ると、宙に浮いていたナイフが急に糸が切れたように地面に落ちる。","en":"She crouched and clutched the wound. The knife suspended in the air fell abruptly to the floor as if its string had been cut.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r374","rowIndex":374,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「答えろ！　なぜここにいる！　そして私たちに危害を加える？」","en":"“Answer me! Why are you here? Why are you attacking us?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"堂島","displayName":"Dojima","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r375","rowIndex":375,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=48>堂島</tips>は鋭く言い放った。","en":"<tips=48>Dojima</tips> snapped.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r376","rowIndex":376,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その肩は激しく上下し、足元はゆらゆらとしている。やはり、背中の傷は軽くはないのか。","en":"His shoulders rose and fell violently, and he swayed on his feet. The wound in his back was evidently not slight.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r377","rowIndex":377,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　肩を撃たれた少女を、もう一人が支える。……こちらが妹になるのだろう。","en":"The other girl supported the one shot in the shoulder. ...She must have been the younger sister.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r378","rowIndex":378,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「やったわね。これで私たちも、容赦する理由がなくなったみたいね……」","en":"“Now you’ve done it. Looks like we don’t have any reason to hold back anymore...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"灰上江梨子","displayName":"Eriko Haigami","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r379","rowIndex":379,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　妹が呟くと、その瞳が金色に変化する。","en":"As the younger sister spoke, her eyes changed to gold.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r380","rowIndex":380,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　姉の方もまだ気力を失ったわけではなく、怒りのこもった眼差しで<tips=48>堂島</tips>を睨み付ける。","en":"The elder had not lost her will to fight. She glared at <tips=48>Dojima</tips> with fury.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r381","rowIndex":381,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「おかしな真似をするな。それ以上能力を使って危害を加えようとするのならば、私の職権において射殺する」","en":"“Don’t try anything. If you use your abilities again to hurt anyone, I will shoot you dead under my authority as an officer.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"堂島","displayName":"Dojima","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r382","rowIndex":382,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=48>堂島</tips>の声は冷徹だ。","en":"<tips=48>Dojima’s</tips> voice was cold.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r383","rowIndex":383,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　実際彼には、<tips=16>タイプA</tips>の少年犯罪者を殺害した例がある。そのことは、<tips=86>灰上姉妹</tips>も知っているだろう。この街に住む多くの<tips=16>タイプA</tips>の記憶に、<tips=48>堂島</tips>の名は刻まれている。","en":"He had, in fact, killed a juvenile offender who was <tips=16>Type A</tips> before. The <tips=86>Haigami sisters</tips> presumably knew it. <tips=48>Dojima’s</tips> name was etched into the memories of many <tips=16>Type As</tips> in the city.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r384","rowIndex":384,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=48>堂島</tips>は嗅覚以外特殊な能力があるわけではないが、こうした場面での判断力には優れているようで、たびたび窮地を脱している。","en":"<tips=48>Dojima</tips> possessed no special ability beyond his sense of smell, but his judgment in situations like this appeared exceptional, and it had carried him through many a desperate predicament.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r385","rowIndex":385,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それにそもそも、いかなる<tips=16>タイプA</tips>とは言えども、目の前で銃口を向けられた時に状況を覆すほどの能力を持つものはまれだった。灰上姉の能力はまだ戦える方だが、こうなってしまっては分が悪い。","en":"Besides, however formidable a <tips=16>Type A</tips> might be, few possessed an ability capable of reversing the situation once a pistol was already aimed at them. The elder Haigami sister’s ability was better suited to combat than most, but even she now stood at a disadvantage.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r386","rowIndex":386,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして私は念動力者と火器所持者が向かい合ったこの緊迫した場面で、身動きがとれないでいた。","en":"As the telekinetic and the man with the firearm faced each other in that moment of tension, I could not move.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r387","rowIndex":387,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私の能力は戦闘では役に立たないし、体格や筋力において多少優れているとしても、<tips=17>タイプB</tips>である灰上妹には及ばないだろう。","en":"My ability was useless in combat, and even if my build and strength were somewhat above average, I would probably be no match for the younger Haigami sister, who was <tips=17>Type B</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r388","rowIndex":388,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして、私も<tips=48>堂島</tips>同様、<tips=86>双子</tips>の登場に驚いていた。","en":"Like <tips=48>Dojima</tips>, I was astonished by the sudden arrival of <tips=86>the twins</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r389","rowIndex":389,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　この<tips=86>灰上姉妹</tips>は、ほんのこの間まで<tips=1>菅原亮</tips>や<tips=10>見土道夫</tips>が率いる不良グループの一員だったはずだ。<tips=1>菅原</tips>が大学へ行き、<tips=10>見土</tips>が引退したあとグループは解散し、この姉妹は地区外の学校へ通うようになったと聞いている。今二人が身につけているシンプルな制服も、その学校のものだ。","en":"Until very recently, the <tips=86>Haigami sisters</tips> had belonged to the delinquent group led by <tips=1>Ryo Sugawara</tips> and <tips=10>Michio Mido</tips>. After <tips=1>Sugawara</tips> went to university and <tips=10>Michio</tips> retired, the group disbanded, and I had heard that the sisters began attending a school outside the district. The plain uniforms they now wore were from that school.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r390","rowIndex":390,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　この辺りでは有名な学校で、特に学業に優れたものにしか入学を許していない。","en":"It was a celebrated institution in the area and admitted only students of exceptional academic ability.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r391","rowIndex":391,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私もそこまで<tips=86>双子</tips>について詳しかったわけではないが、そんな学校に入学し、最近は何か問題を起こしたという噂も聞いていなかったから、てっきりまっとうな道を歩んでいるのだと思っていた。そもそも、この<tips=86>双子</tips>は問題行動こそ多かったが、そのほとんどはいたずらという言葉に収まる範囲のもので、今のように他人にナイフを突き立てるような凶悪な事件は、起こしたことがなかったはずだ。","en":"I did not know the <tips=86>twins</tips> all that well myself. But they had enrolled in a school like that, and I had heard no rumors of any recent trouble, so I had assumed they were following a respectable path. To begin with, although the <tips=86>twins</tips> had often caused trouble, almost all of it still fell within the bounds of what could be called a prank. As far as I knew, they had never committed a vicious crime like plunging a knife into another person the way they were now.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r392","rowIndex":392,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それがなぜ、警告もなく<tips=48>堂島</tips>を襲ったのか。","en":"Then why had they attacked <tips=48>Dojima</tips> without warning?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r393","rowIndex":393,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　我々に対する二人の態度を見ると、この殺害現場で犯人と取り違えた、というわけでもなさそうだ。","en":"Judging by their attitude toward us, they did not seem to have mistaken us for the killer at the scene.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r394","rowIndex":394,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「必要な警告はもうしたわ。あなたは自分の運命を自分で決めたのよ」","en":"“We’ve already given you all the warning you need. You chose your own fate.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"灰上璃映子","displayName":"Rieko Haigami","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r395","rowIndex":395,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　姉は肩を撃たれて若干血の気のひいた顔で、不敵に言った。","en":"The elder sister, her face somewhat pale after the bullet struck her shoulder, spoke with defiance.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r396","rowIndex":396,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>とどういう繋がりか、あとでゆっくりと調べさせてもらおうか」","en":"“...We’ll take our time finding out how you’re connected to <tips=20>Koschei</tips> later.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"堂島","displayName":"Dojima","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r397","rowIndex":397,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=48>堂島</tips>は言って、懐からもう片方の手で新たな銃を取り出す。","en":"As he spoke, <tips=48>Dojima</tips> drew another gun from inside his coat with his free hand.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r398","rowIndex":398,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その銃が、どういうものなのか<tips=86>灰上姉妹</tips>は知らないだろうが、私は知っている。","en":"The <tips=86>Haigami sisters</tips> probably did not know what sort of gun it was. I did.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r399","rowIndex":399,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　銀色に光るその銃は『Anti-Psychic Tranquilizer Gun』という名前で分類される射撃装置の一種で、通常は<tips=43>APTG</tips>と略称で呼ばれる。","en":"The gleaming silver weapon was one of a class of projectile devices designated Anti-Psychic Tranquilizer Guns, ordinarily abbreviated <tips=43>APTG</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r400","rowIndex":400,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　直訳すると対サイキック用麻酔銃といったところだが、実際には麻酔薬を発射するわけではない。その大きな銃口から打ち出される注射筒には、<tips=16>タイプA</tips>の能力を抑制する薬が詰められている。","en":"Rendered literally, the name meant something like ‘tranquilizer gun for use against psychics,’ but it did not actually fire anesthetic. The syringe launched from its large barrel contained a drug that suppressed <tips=16>Type A</tips> abilities.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r401","rowIndex":401,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　軍の特殊部隊や<tips=48>堂島</tips>のような特別捜査官といった、ごく限られた人間のみが持つことを許されている対<tips=16>タイプA</tips>用の秘密兵器である。世間では大して効果がないとか、批判的に語られることもあるが、効く相手にはよく効く。私も大昔にそれで撃たれたことがあるからよく知っている。","en":"This secret weapon against <tips=16>Type As</tips> could be carried only by a very select few, such as military special forces and special investigators like <tips=48>Dojima</tips>. Some dismissed it as largely ineffective, but against those susceptible to it, it worked extremely well. I knew—I had been shot with one myself a very long time ago.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r402","rowIndex":402,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　これで灰上姉の<tips=16>タイプA</tips>能力を無効化すれば、状況は我々の圧倒的有利になるだろう。","en":"If this nullified the elder Haigami sister’s <tips=16>Type A</tips> ability, we would have an overwhelming advantage.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r403","rowIndex":403,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しかし、<tips=48>堂島</tips>はそれを発射するまでには至らなかった。","en":"But <tips=48>Dojima</tips> never got the chance to fire it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r404","rowIndex":404,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ぐっ」","en":"“Ghh.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r405","rowIndex":405,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼はうめいて、その場に蹲る。そして、その背後には別の男が立っていた。","en":"Dojima groaned and collapsed into a crouch. Another man stood behind him.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r406","rowIndex":406,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　長身で細身の、白人男性である。ふらふらとした足取りでそこに立ち、手には血に濡れたナイフを握っている。","en":"He was a tall, slender white man, standing there on unsteady feet with a blood-soaked knife in his hand.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r407","rowIndex":407,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　黒い髪を持ち、くっきりとした二重の涼しげな瞳を持つその顔に、私は見覚えがあった。","en":"I recognized him by the black hair, the sharply defined double eyelids, and the cool gaze.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r408","rowIndex":408,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>……か？　そうなのか？」","en":"“...<tips=20>Koschei</tips>...? Is that you?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r409","rowIndex":409,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=48>堂島</tips>が、その男を見て、震える声で呟く。","en":"<tips=48>Dojima</tips> looked at the man and muttered in a trembling voice.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r410","rowIndex":410,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そう、そこに立っていたのは、画像で見た<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>そのものだった。","en":"Yes. The man standing there was the very image of <tips=20>Koschei</tips> I had seen in the photograph.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r411","rowIndex":411,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　驚くべきことに、彼は誇張ではなく、文字通り写真そのものの姿をしているのだ。","en":"Incredibly, this was no exaggeration. He looked literally identical to the photograph.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r412","rowIndex":412,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　二十年前に撮影されていたという画像と、目の前にいる人物が、見分けがつかぬというのはどういうことなのか？　どう見ても、数字として計算出来る年齢とつじつまが合わない。","en":"How could the man before us be indistinguishable from an image supposedly taken twenty years earlier? No matter how one looked at it, his apparent age did not agree with the age the numbers demanded.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r413","rowIndex":413,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そしてもう一つ、驚くべきことがあった。","en":"And there was one other astonishing detail.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r414","rowIndex":414,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼のシャツの胸は真っ赤な血で染まっており、そこには二つの穴が空いている。","en":"The chest of his shirt was stained scarlet with blood, and two holes gaped in the cloth.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r415","rowIndex":415,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　あれは<tips=48>堂島</tips>の射撃によって出来たものだろう。","en":"<tips=48>Dojima’s</tips> bullets must have produced them.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r416","rowIndex":416,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　だとすれば間違いなく致命傷で、だから<tips=48>堂島</tips>も相手の死を確信してこちらへ戻って来たのだ。","en":"If so, the wounds should unquestionably have been fatal. <tips=48>Dojima</tips> had presumably returned to us because he too was certain the man was dead.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r417","rowIndex":417,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……そうか。わかったぞ。お前の力の正体が……」","en":"“…I see. I understand now. The true nature of your power…”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r418","rowIndex":418,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=48>堂島</tips>は地面の上に這いつくばったまま、取り落としてしまった銃に手を伸ばす。<tips=16>タイプＡ</tips>用の弾薬が込められたほうの銃だ。","en":"Still crawling upon the floor, <tips=48>Dojima</tips> reached toward the pistol he had dropped—the one loaded with ammunition for use against <tips=16>Type As</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r419","rowIndex":419,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうか。だが、ちょっと遅かったな」","en":"“I see. But you’re a little too late.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アレクセイ","displayName":"Alexei","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r420","rowIndex":420,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼は日本語でそう言うと薄く笑い、","en":"He spoke in Japanese and smiled faintly.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r421","rowIndex":421,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「死んでやれればよかったんだが、気の毒だがおれは死なないんだ。<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>という言葉は、不死身って意味なんだよ」","en":"“I’d have obliged you by dying if I could, but too bad—I don’t die. The word <tips=20>Koschei</tips> means immortal.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アレクセイ","displayName":"Alexei","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r422","rowIndex":422,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼はゆらゆらと揺れている。言葉通り、銃弾を受けて全く消耗していないというわけではないらしい。","en":"He swayed unsteadily. Despite his words, the bullets had not left him wholly unaffected.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r423","rowIndex":423,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まったく、今日はツイてない。こんな下らない仕事をさせられた上に、こんな穴だらけにされちまって……」","en":"“What rotten luck. First I get saddled with this stupid job, and then I get shot full of holes...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アレクセイ","displayName":"Alexei","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r424","rowIndex":424,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=48>堂島</tips>は握った銃を彼に向け、震える腕で構える。","en":"<tips=48>Dojima</tips> raised the pistol and aimed it at the man with a trembling arm.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r425","rowIndex":425,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして引き金を引いたが、その瞬間、銃口が不自然に右に逸れて、注射筒はあらぬ方向へ飛んでゆく。","en":"He pulled the trigger. At that instant, the muzzle veered unnaturally to the right, and the syringe flew in a wholly different direction.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r426","rowIndex":426,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=48>堂島</tips>は横目で<tips=86>灰上姉妹</tips>の方を見る。姉が、らんらんと光る目をこちらに向けている。彼女の力が銃口をそらしたのだろう。","en":"<tips=48>Dojima</tips> glanced toward the <tips=86>Haigami sisters</tips>. The elder fixed luminous eyes upon us. Her power must have turned the muzzle aside.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r427","rowIndex":427,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は手元にあった何かを夢中でひっつかんでそちらへ投げつけた。灰皿だったらしいと、空中で弧を描くそれを見て初めて気がついた。","en":"In a frenzy, I snatched up whatever lay within reach and hurled it at her. Only when I saw it tracing an arc through the air did I realize it was an ashtray.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r428","rowIndex":428,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　投擲の精度は正しく灰上姉を狙っていたはずだが、それは空中で不自然なカーブを描いて目標をそれて隣の壁へぶつかる。","en":"My throw should have struck the elder Haigami sister. Instead, it curved unnaturally in midair, missed its target, and struck the neighboring wall.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r429","rowIndex":429,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ものを投げても意味がない。<tips=48>堂島</tips>の拳銃をチラと探したが、散らかった部屋の中ですぐには見つけられなかった。私は立ち上がり、<tips=86>灰上姉妹</tips>の方へかけ出した。","en":"Throwing objects was useless. I searched briefly for <tips=48>Dojima’s</tips> pistol but could not immediately locate it in the disordered room. I rose and charged toward the <tips=86>Haigami sisters</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r430","rowIndex":430,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　勝算があるとは思えなかったが、こうして挟まれ、<tips=48>堂島</tips>がさらなる怪我を負ってしまった以上、私がどちらかを引き受ける必要がある。","en":"I saw little chance of winning. But now that we were caught between them and <tips=48>Dojima</tips> had suffered another wound, I had to take one of our enemies on myself.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r431","rowIndex":431,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　灰上姉へ掴みかかろうとしたところで、妹の方がさっと前へ出たのが見えた。そして次の瞬間、<tips=17>タイプＢ</tips>特有の、人間離れした素早い動きで、姉へ伸ばした私の腕を掴んでいた。","en":"As I reached for the elder Haigami sister, I saw the younger dart in front of her. The next instant, with the inhuman speed peculiar to a <tips=17>Type B</tips>, she had seized the arm I was extending toward her sister.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r432","rowIndex":432,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「このっ」","en":"“You—!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r433","rowIndex":433,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は彼女につかまれたままの腕を渾身の力で振る。","en":"With all my strength, I whipped the arm she held through the air.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r434","rowIndex":434,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=17>タイプＢ</tips>といえども、体重が増えるわけではない。華奢な少女の身体くらい、やすやすと振り回せるはずだ。そして宙へ浮かせてふんばりをなくしてしまえば持ち前の怪力も使いにくい。これは体格の劣る<tips=17>タイプB</tips>相手に私がよく使う喧嘩の戦法である。","en":"Being a <tips=17>Type B</tips> did not increase her body weight. I ought to have been able to swing the body of a slender girl with ease. Once I lifted her clear and robbed her of her footing, she would have difficulty bringing her prodigious strength to bear. It was a fighting tactic I often used against smaller <tips=17>Type Bs</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r435","rowIndex":435,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しかし彼女は振り回されながらも片手一本で私の腕に掴まっている。よほど濃い<tips=17>タイプB</tips>の血を持っているのだろう。見かけからは想像も出来ない、万力のような握力だ。","en":"Yet even as I swung her around, she clung to my arm with one hand. Her <tips=17>Type B</tips> blood must have run unusually strong. Nothing in her appearance could have suggested that vise-like grip.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r436","rowIndex":436,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しかし体重の軽さはいかんともしがたい。さらに振り回すと、遠心力で彼女の足は地面を離れかける。このまま浮かせたらどこか尖ったところに叩きつけてやる。","en":"But nothing could compensate for her light weight. As I swung harder, centrifugal force began to lift her feet off the floor. Once I had her airborne, I would smash her into something sharp.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r437","rowIndex":437,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私がぐっと力を込めたとき、彼女は完全に足が離れる直前に自分から床を蹴って、私に飛びかかる。","en":"As I put my full strength into it, she kicked off the floor just before her feet left it completely and launched herself at me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r438","rowIndex":438,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「くそっ」","en":"“Damn.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r439","rowIndex":439,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　灰上妹は無言で金色の目を光らせ、私の上半身にしがみつくと、そのままもの凄い力で私の両手の動きを押さえつける。バランスを崩した私の足元は、何かを踏んですべり、そのまま倒れてしまう。","en":"The younger Haigami sister said nothing. Her golden eyes shone as she clung to my upper body and used astonishing strength to pin both my arms. Thrown off balance, my foot came down on something and slipped, and I fell.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r440","rowIndex":440,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　腹ばいに倒れた私の背中に灰上妹が座り込み、両手で私の動きを制す。彼女の身体は鋼鉄のように強靱になって、私がいかにもがこうが動かない。","en":"I landed facedown, and the younger sister sat on my back and held me immobile with both hands. Her body had become as unyielding as steel; no matter how I struggled, she would not budge.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r441","rowIndex":441,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　息を切らす私の視線の先には震える身体の上半身を起こす<tips=48>堂島</tips>の姿が見える。その向こうで<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>はただ突っ立ったままだ。動くほどの体力はないのかもしれない。<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>よりも<tips=48>堂島</tips>の方が、活力においては若干勝っているように見えた。","en":"Panting for breath, I saw <tips=48>Dojima</tips> ahead of me lifting his trembling torso. Beyond him, <tips=20>Koschei</tips> simply stood there. Perhaps he lacked even the strength to move. Compared with <tips=20>Koschei</tips>, <tips=48>Dojima</tips> seemed to have slightly more vitality left.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r442","rowIndex":442,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しかし、その頭上にはふらりとナイフが舞い上がっている。","en":"But above Dojima’s head, a knife was drifting unsteadily into the air.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r443","rowIndex":443,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「旦那っ！　上だっ！」","en":"“Detective! Above you!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r444","rowIndex":444,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私の声に反応して、<tips=48>堂島</tips>は頭上を見上げる。","en":"At my voice, <tips=48>Dojima</tips> looked up.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r445","rowIndex":445,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それと、舞っていたナイフが落下するのはほぼ同時だった。<tips=48>堂島</tips>は身体をねじるようにしながら右手を振り上げ、それを防ごうとするが、動作が緩慢すぎて間に合わない。ナイフは毛で覆われた<tips=48>堂島</tips>の喉にまっすぐ突き刺さり、彼はそのまま仰向けに倒れた。","en":"Almost simultaneously, the knife spinning through the air began to fall. <tips=48>Dojima</tips> twisted and flung up his right hand to block it, but he moved too slowly. The knife plunged straight into <tips=48>Dojima’s</tips> fur-covered throat, and he fell onto his back.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r446","rowIndex":446,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「犬ころめ！　人間様に、従順に従えばいいものを！」","en":"“You miserable mutt! You should’ve known your place and obeyed your human masters!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r447","rowIndex":447,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　姉が逆上して叫ぶ。","en":"The elder sister screamed in a fit of rage.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r448","rowIndex":448,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「くそっ」","en":"“Damn.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r449","rowIndex":449,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私がうめき、そしてもう一度体中の力を振り絞ってもがいたが、","en":"I groaned, mustered all the strength I had left, and struggled again.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r450","rowIndex":450,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「無駄よ」","en":"“It’s no use.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r451","rowIndex":451,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　背中の上の少女は頑として動かない。","en":"The girl upon my back did not move in the least.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r452","rowIndex":452,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まったく、ひどいケガだ」","en":"“Damn, I’m in bad shape.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アレクセイ","displayName":"Alexei","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r453","rowIndex":453,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　向こうで<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>はそうつぶやき、ゆらりと一歩踏み出す。","en":"<tips=20>Koschei</tips> muttered from across the room and took one unsteady step.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r454","rowIndex":454,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「しっかりしてよ。おかげで、こんなことをするハメになったわ……。あなたと同じ立場だね」","en":"“Pull yourself together. You got us dragged into all this... Now we’re in the same boat as you.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"灰上璃映子","displayName":"Rieko Haigami","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r455","rowIndex":455,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　灰上姉は強がってはいるがその顔は蒼白だった。殺人に慣れている、というわけでもないらしい。","en":"The elder sister maintained a bold front, but her face had gone ashen. She did not appear accustomed to murder.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r456","rowIndex":456,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「別に頼んだ覚えはない。おれは女に借りは作らん。……しかし、どこかで休息が必要だな」","en":"“I don’t recall asking. I make it a point not to owe women any favors. ...Still, I need somewhere to rest.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アレクセイ","displayName":"Alexei","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r457","rowIndex":457,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そんなズタボロになっておいて、よく言う」","en":"“Big words for someone in such a sorry state.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"灰上璃映子","displayName":"Rieko Haigami","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r458","rowIndex":458,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「しかし驚いたな。どうしてここがわかったんだ？」","en":"“Still, I’m surprised. How did you find this place?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アレクセイ","displayName":"Alexei","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r459","rowIndex":459,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「探していたら、銃声がきこえてね。まだあなたとの話は終わってないわ」","en":"“We were looking for you when we heard the gunshots. Our business with you isn’t finished.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"灰上璃映子","displayName":"Rieko Haigami","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r460","rowIndex":460,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……まあ、良いタイミングで現れてくれたものだよ。何を考えているのかわからないが、それに関しては、礼を言わなくちゃいけない」","en":"“...Well, you showed up at just the right moment. I don’t know what you two are thinking, but for that, at least, I have to thank you.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アレクセイ","displayName":"Alexei","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r461","rowIndex":461,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうよ。素直になってくれればいいのよ」","en":"“Exactly. You need only be honest.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"灰上璃映子","displayName":"Rieko Haigami","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r462","rowIndex":462,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「やれやれ」","en":"“Good grief.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アレクセイ","displayName":"Alexei","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r463","rowIndex":463,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>は肩をすくめて、","en":"<tips=20>Koschei</tips> shrugged.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r464","rowIndex":464,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「生きていると、こんな奇妙な連中に会うこともあるんだな」","en":"“Live long enough, and you meet some very strange people.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アレクセイ","displayName":"Alexei","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r465","rowIndex":465,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そう言った。","en":"That was what he said.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r466","rowIndex":466,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その会話からは彼らの関係性が垣間見えたが、私はいまそれについて深く考える余裕はなかった。","en":"Their conversation offered a glimpse of their relationship, but I had no room to think deeply about it then.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r467","rowIndex":467,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼らが私を生かして帰すとは思えない。次に殺されるのは私だろう。","en":"I could not imagine that they would allow me to leave alive. Presumably, I would be the next to die.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r468","rowIndex":468,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=53>ミユキ</tips>が殺され、<tips=48>堂島</tips>が殺された。そして私もここで死ぬというのか。","en":"<tips=53>Miyuki</tips> had been killed. <tips=48>Dojima</tips> had been killed. Was I to die here as well?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r469","rowIndex":469,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　二人の死の原因を思えば、自分の命を惜しむ気にはなれなかったが、ここで自分も死んでしまえば誰が二人の無念を晴らすというのだろう？　死ぬわけにはいかない。","en":"When I thought of what had caused their deaths, I could not bring myself to care what happened to my own life. But if I died here as well, who would avenge them? I could not die.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r470","rowIndex":470,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　とは言え、絶体絶命の状況だ。","en":"Nevertheless, the situation was desperate.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r471","rowIndex":471,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　腕力では灰上妹には敵わないし、その他にも相手には灰上姉と<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>という二人の<tips=16>タイプA</tips>がいる。","en":"I could not overcome the younger Haigami sister in raw strength, and besides her the enemy had two <tips=16>Type As</tips>: the elder Haigami sister and <tips=20>Koschei</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r472","rowIndex":472,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　救いと言えば、<tips=86>双子</tips>の方はそれほど殺人に積極的ではないという点だろう。<tips=48>堂島</tips>に対しても、ギリギリまで警告を行っていた。殺した後の今も、動揺を隠せていない。","en":"If there was any saving grace, it was that <tips=86>the twins</tips> did not seem eager to kill. They had continued warning <tips=48>Dojima</tips> until the very last moment. Even now, after killing him, they could not hide how shaken they were.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r473","rowIndex":473,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　最初のナイフが急所ではなく肩にささったというのも、ミスではなく殺人へのためらいがあったからだろう。彼女たちはまだ『向こう側』へ足を踏み入れてはいないのだ。","en":"The first knife had struck his shoulder rather than a vital point. Perhaps that too was not an error, but hesitation before murder. They had not yet stepped across to “the other side.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r474","rowIndex":474,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その辺りの状況を考えれば、チャンスはないわけではないな。彼らの会話を黙って聞きながら、私は生き延びる方法を考えた。","en":"Taken together, those circumstances meant there might still be an opening. As I listened to their conversation in silence, I searched for a way to survive.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r475","rowIndex":475,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そしてふと<tips=48>堂島</tips>に目をやったとき、そのうつろに開いた目と視線が合う。","en":"Then, when I happened to glance at <tips=48>Dojima</tips>, my gaze met his vacant, open eyes.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r476","rowIndex":476,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　――思えば彼とも長いつき合いだった。私を逮捕した彼に対し、死んでしまえと思ったこともあるが、実際こうして死んでしまうと悲しみしか感じられない。<tips=53>ミユキ</tips>が言った通り、嫌いではなかったのかもしれない。","en":"...Come to think of it, he and I had known each other a long time. I had even wished the man who arrested me dead, but now that he actually was dead, I felt nothing but sorrow. Perhaps <tips=53>Miyuki</tips> had been right. Maybe I had not disliked him after all.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r477","rowIndex":477,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その顔を見ていられず、視線をそらそうとしたとき、そのまぶたがぴくりと動いた。","en":"Unable to endure his face, I began to look away. His eyelid twitched.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r478","rowIndex":478,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　改めて見直すと、<tips=48>堂島</tips>はまだ微かに息があるようだ。","en":"When I looked again, <tips=48>Dojima</tips> seemed to be breathing faintly.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r479","rowIndex":479,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　思わず私は声をあげそうになったが、なんとかこらえる。","en":"I nearly cried out, but somehow restrained myself.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r480","rowIndex":480,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その向こうで、<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>はバランスを崩し、壁に手をつく。","en":"Beyond him, <tips=20>Koschei</tips> lost his balance and braced one hand against the wall.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r481","rowIndex":481,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「偉そうな口をきくわりに弱ってるのね」","en":"“You talk awfully big for someone so weak.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"灰上璃映子","displayName":"Rieko Haigami","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r482","rowIndex":482,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……そりゃ、胸に風穴を開けられて弱らなかったら化け物だ」","en":"“...If getting holes blown through your chest didn’t weaken you, you’d be a monster.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アレクセイ","displayName":"Alexei","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r483","rowIndex":483,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「充分化け物でしょうに」","en":"“You’re already enough of a monster.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"灰上璃映子","displayName":"Rieko Haigami","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r484","rowIndex":484,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　灰上姉は部屋に足を踏み入れると<tips=48>堂島</tips>の側を通り抜け、<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>に手を貸す。","en":"The elder Haigami sister entered the room, passed <tips=48>Dojima</tips>, and offered <tips=20>Koschei</tips> her hand.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r485","rowIndex":485,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>はその手を借りる。","en":"<tips=20>Koschei</tips> accepted it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r486","rowIndex":486,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まったく」","en":"“Honestly.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"灰上璃映子","displayName":"Rieko Haigami","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r487","rowIndex":487,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　灰上姉はつぶやきながら、チラリと<tips=48>堂島</tips>の方を見たが、まだ彼に息があることには気がつかなかったようだ。","en":"As she muttered, the elder sister glanced at <tips=48>Dojima</tips>. She appeared not to notice that he still breathed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r488","rowIndex":488,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして彼らはゆっくりと出口の方へ向かって歩き、妹に取り押さえられている私のすぐ側まで来ると、","en":"They walked slowly toward the exit and came up beside me, still pinned beneath the younger sister.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r489","rowIndex":489,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あの探偵さんはどうしよう？」","en":"“What shall we do about the detective?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"灰上璃映子","displayName":"Rieko Haigami","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r490","rowIndex":490,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　と<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>に訊ねた。","en":"She put the question to <tips=20>Koschei</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r491","rowIndex":491,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どうでもいい」","en":"“Who cares?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アレクセイ","displayName":"Alexei","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r492","rowIndex":492,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どうでもいいって……、彼らはあなたのことを嗅ぎ廻っているんじゃないの？」","en":"“You don’t care...? Aren’t they sniffing around after you?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"灰上璃映子","displayName":"Rieko Haigami","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r493","rowIndex":493,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　灰上姉はあきれて顔を顰める。","en":"The elder sister frowned in exasperation.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r494","rowIndex":494,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうだろうね。でもどうだっていいさ。そもそもおれはこんな馬鹿馬鹿しいことはしたくなかった。疑われているからといって、こそこそと家を漁るだなんて、小物っぽくてみっともない話さ。そんなみっともないことをするから、こんなふうに余計な怪我を負ったりするのさ。……あの心配性のジジイのおかげで酷い目にあった。もうおれはやりたいようにやる。……それに、なんだいこのやたらと散らかった場所は？　おれはこういう場所にいると気が狂いそうになるんだ。さっさとここを離れて、どこかでゆっくりと横になって……ああ、つめたく冷やしたグレープフルーツジュースでも飲みたいな」","en":"“Probably. But who cares? I never wanted to do anything this ridiculous in the first place. Sneaking around and rifling through someone’s home just because I’m under suspicion makes me look like some pathetic little man. And it’s because I let myself get dragged into something so disgraceful that I ended up with all these pointless injuries. ...That fretful old man has put me through hell. From now on, I’m doing as I please. ...Besides, what is this absurd mess? Places like this drive me out of my mind. I want to get out of here, find somewhere to lie down in peace... Ah, and have a nice glass of ice-cold grapefruit juice.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アレクセイ","displayName":"Alexei","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r495","rowIndex":495,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ねえ、このままでいいの？」","en":"“Are you sure we can leave it this way?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"灰上璃映子","displayName":"Rieko Haigami","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r496","rowIndex":496,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　うわごとのように呟く<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>に、灰上姉はそう尋ねる。","en":"The elder Haigami sister asked <tips=20>Koschei</tips> this as he muttered as though delirious.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r497","rowIndex":497,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いいよ」","en":"“It’s fine.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アレクセイ","displayName":"Alexei","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r498","rowIndex":498,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>は振り向きもせずにこたえる。","en":"Without even turning around, <tips=20>Koschei</tips> answered.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r499","rowIndex":499,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「でも、このままにしておいたら、色々とまずくない？」","en":"“But won’t leaving things this way cause all kinds of trouble?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"灰上璃映子","displayName":"Rieko Haigami","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r500","rowIndex":500,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そう思うなら、きみらが好きにすればいい。まったく、残酷なやつらだなあ。おれは人を殺したり、乱暴をするのは好きじゃないんだって言ってるだろ」","en":"“If that’s what you think, do whatever you like. Honestly, what a cruel pair you are. I’ve told you, I don’t like killing people or resorting to violence.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アレクセイ","displayName":"Alexei","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r501","rowIndex":501,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なんで、猟奇殺人者にそんなこと言われているのかしら……」","en":"“Why is a gruesome murderer lecturing us about cruelty...?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"灰上璃映子","displayName":"Rieko Haigami","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r502","rowIndex":502,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　灰上姉は溜息をついてから、","en":"The elder Haigami sister sighed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r503","rowIndex":503,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ねえ、元探偵さん」","en":"“Hey, Mr. Former Detective.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"灰上璃映子","displayName":"Rieko Haigami","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r504","rowIndex":504,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私に向かって話しかける。","en":"She addressed me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r505","rowIndex":505,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　いよいよ私の番が近づいて来たのだ。","en":"At last, my turn was drawing near.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r506","rowIndex":506,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あなたとこうして話すのは初めてだけど、その顔と名前は小さな時から知ってるわ。いつも、<tips=59>暗闇通り</tips>をその角で風を切って歩いていたものね」","en":"“This is the first time we’ve spoken, but we’ve known your face and name since we were little. You were always striding down <tips=59>Darkness Street</tips> with that horn of yours cutting through the wind.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"灰上璃映子","displayName":"Rieko Haigami","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r507","rowIndex":507,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私を見おろして、姉がそう言い、","en":"The elder sister spoke while looking down at me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r508","rowIndex":508,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「確か昔は、<tips=50>路地</tips>探偵事務所の探偵さんと言えば、<tips=59>暗闇通り</tips>のみんなを助ける正義の人だったような気がするけど、いつのまにか警察の手先になっちゃって、みじめなものね」","en":"“As we remember it, the detective from <tips=50>Roji</tips> Detective Agency used to be a champion of justice who helped everyone on <tips=59>Darkness Street</tips>. But somewhere along the way you became a police lackey. How pathetic.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"灰上江梨子","displayName":"Eriko Haigami","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r509","rowIndex":509,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　次に背中の妹が言う。","en":"The younger sister upon my back spoke next.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r510","rowIndex":510,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「おっしゃるとおりだが、こんなところで殺人鬼の手伝いなんかするよりはマシな生き方だと思うがね」","en":"“You’re right about that, but I’d say it’s still a better way to live than helping a murderer in a place like this.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r511","rowIndex":511,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　言いながら私は、<tips=48>堂島</tips>の方を見る。","en":"As I spoke, I looked toward <tips=48>Dojima</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r512","rowIndex":512,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼はまったく動かず、ここからでは生きているようには見えない。","en":"He lay utterly still, and from where I was, he did not look alive.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r513","rowIndex":513,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　――もう駄目か。","en":"...Was it already too late?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r514","rowIndex":514,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そう心の中で呟いたとき、ふと、彼のおかしな姿に気がついた。彼は倒れ、だらんと腕を床の上に広げているのだが、その手が、人差し指だけを伸ばして、私の方を指さすような形になっている。","en":"As I thought it, I suddenly noticed something peculiar in his posture. He had fallen with both arms hanging loose across the floor. But on one hand, only the index finger was extended, as if pointing toward me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r515","rowIndex":515,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　何かの偶然かと思いつつ、その指さす先を見ると、そこには椅子があり、その下に最初に灰上を撃った銃が転がっていた。手を伸ばせばすぐに届きそうな距離である。","en":"Wondering whether it was a coincidence, I followed the direction of his finger. It pointed to a chair. Beneath it lay the pistol he had first used to shoot Haigami, close enough for me to reach at once.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r516","rowIndex":516,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　これは偶然ではないだろう。","en":"This could hardly have been coincidence.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r517","rowIndex":517,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"（恩に着るぜ……）","en":"(I owe you one...)","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r518","rowIndex":518,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しかし、こう押さえつけられた状況では、もしうまく手を動かせたとしても、拾って、構え、撃つまでの時間が得られるとは思えない。","en":"But pinned down as I was, even if I managed to move my hand, there was no chance I would have time to pick up the pistol, aim it, and fire.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r519","rowIndex":519,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私はひとまずその銃から視線を離し、<tips=86>双子</tips>に気取られないように気をつけながら、チャンスを待つことにした。","en":"For the moment, I looked away from the pistol and resolved to wait for an opening, careful not to let <tips=86>the twins</tips> notice what had caught my attention.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r520","rowIndex":520,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「私たちは殺人鬼の手伝いをしているわけじゃないわ」","en":"“We are not helping a killer.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"灰上璃映子","displayName":"Rieko Haigami","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r521","rowIndex":521,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ただ、何か価値のあるものを探しているだけ。人生ってそういうものでしょ？」","en":"“We’re just looking for something worthwhile. That’s what life is about, isn’t it?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"灰上江梨子","displayName":"Eriko Haigami","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r522","rowIndex":522,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……お前が<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>ってやつか。資料でみた大昔の写真とまったく姿が変わらないが、どんな秘密があるんだい？」","en":"“...So you’re this <tips=20>Koschei</tips>. You look exactly the same as in those ancient photographs in the files. What’s your secret?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r523","rowIndex":523,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は<tips=86>双子</tips>の言葉を無視して、<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>に向かってそう問う。若い女に押さえつけられ、床に這いつくばりながらでは格好もつかないが。","en":"I ignored <tips=86>the twins</tips> and directed the question to <tips=20>Koschei</tips>. Pinned beneath a young woman and sprawled face-down on the floor, I hardly cut an impressive figure.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r524","rowIndex":524,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>は答えない。","en":"<tips=20>Koschei</tips> did not answer.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r525","rowIndex":525,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　灰上に肩を貸されながら、気怠げに見下ろしている。","en":"Supported by Haigami’s shoulder, he looked listlessly down at me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r526","rowIndex":526,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なんだって、こんなところへやって来て、無関係な女を殺した。いや、こんな質問は頭のイカレた殺人鬼には無意味かな？　お前は狂った頭で、手当たり次第に女を殺し続けるのさ」","en":"“Why did you come here and kill a woman who had nothing to do with any of this? No—maybe there’s no point asking a lunatic murderer. You’re insane, and you just keep killing women at random.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r527","rowIndex":527,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　挑発すると、<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>は顔を顰めて反応を示し、口を開いた。","en":"The provocation made <tips=20>Koschei</tips> frown. He opened his mouth.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r528","rowIndex":528,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「失礼なやつだな。……そもそも、お前が調べたりするから、この女も死ぬことになった。この女は本来死ぬ必要はなかったんだ。おれはひどく心を痛めている」","en":"“How rude. ...To begin with, this woman only died because you went poking around. She never needed to die at all. It pains me deeply.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アレクセイ","displayName":"Alexei","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r529","rowIndex":529,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……どうして胸を撃たれたのに生きている。それがお前の能力か？」","en":"“...How are you alive after being shot in the chest? Is that your ability?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r530","rowIndex":530,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「会話をするつもりがないのか？　なんだか、面倒だな……」","en":"“You’re not even going to have a conversation? What a pain...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アレクセイ","displayName":"Alexei","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r531","rowIndex":531,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>は溜息をつくと、彼は明後日の方向を向いて、誰もいない空間にそう話しかける。そこで使われている言葉は、私には理解出来ないものだったが、おそらく彼の母語であるはずのロシア語であろう。","en":"<tips=20>Koschei</tips> sighed, turned his face in a wholly unrelated direction, and addressed a patch of empty space where no one stood. I could not understand the language he used, but it was presumably Russian, which ought to have been his native tongue.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r532","rowIndex":532,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……ダー、ダー」","en":"“...Da. Da.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アレクセイ","displayName":"Alexei","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r533","rowIndex":533,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして、見えない何かと会話しているように、一人で相槌を打つ。","en":"He offered responses all by himself, as though conversing with something invisible.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r534","rowIndex":534,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　幻覚や幻聴と会話をして居るのだろうか？　発症した<tips=17>タイプB</tips>によく見られる現象ではあるが、麻薬中毒者や精神疾患者にも同様の現象は起こる。","en":"Was he conversing with a hallucination, or with a voice only he could hear? Such behavior was common among symptomatic <tips=17>Type B</tips> patients, but it could also occur among drug addicts and people with mental illness.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r535","rowIndex":535,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「おい、お前ら」","en":"“Hey, you two.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r536","rowIndex":536,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　見えない誰かとの会話に夢中になっている<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>をよそに、私は<tips=86>双子</tips>に向かってそう呼びかけた。","en":"Leaving <tips=20>Koschei</tips> absorbed in his invisible conversation, I addressed <tips=86>the twins</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r537","rowIndex":537,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「こいつがどういうやつか、知っていて一緒にいるのか？」","en":"“Do you know what kind of man he is and still choose to stay with him?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r538","rowIndex":538,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうよ」","en":"“Yes.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"灰上璃映子","displayName":"Rieko Haigami","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r539","rowIndex":539,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「大体ね」","en":"“More or less.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"灰上江梨子","displayName":"Eriko Haigami","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r540","rowIndex":540,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　――それならば、こちらとしても一切同情する必要はないわけだ。","en":"...Then I had no reason to feel the slightest sympathy for them.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r541","rowIndex":541,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして私は行動を起こした。","en":"And then I made my move.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r542","rowIndex":542,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　妹に押さえつけられながら、ただじっとしていたのではない。","en":"I had not remained entirely motionless beneath the younger sister.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r543","rowIndex":543,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女は腕力こそ強いが、格闘技などを身につけているわけではないようで、ただ力任せに上から押さえつけられているだけだったから、全身身動きがとれないということはなかった。会話をしながら、そっと彼女たちの視界からは死角になっているところで手を動かし、自分の携帯電話に触れていた。","en":"Though enormously strong, she apparently had no martial-arts training. She was merely pinning me down from above by brute force, so my whole body was not completely immobilized. While we talked, I quietly moved one hand where it lay outside their field of vision and felt for my phone.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r544","rowIndex":544,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　タッチ操作の携帯端末を手探りで操作するのは難しかったが、最新の着信にコールバックするくらいはなんとか出来る。","en":"Operating a touchscreen phone without looking was difficult, but I could at least manage to return the most recent call.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r545","rowIndex":545,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして、最後に私に電話をかけてきたのは、<tips=48>堂島</tips>だった。","en":"And the last person to telephone me had been <tips=48>Dojima</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r546","rowIndex":546,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　プルルル、と、倒れた<tips=48>堂島</tips>の胸元からけたたましい着信音が鳴る。","en":"The phone at <tips=48>Dojima’s</tips> chest shrilled.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r547","rowIndex":547,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=86>双子</tips>たちの視線が一瞬<tips=48>堂島</tips>の方へ集まる。その一瞬さえあれば良かった。私は転がる銃に手を伸ばし、掴むと、自分の肩越しに背後の灰上妹の方へ発砲する。","en":"For one instant, the <tips=86>twins</tips> both looked toward <tips=48>Dojima</tips>. That single instant was all I needed. I reached for the pistol on the floor, seized it, and fired over my shoulder at the younger Haigami sister behind me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r548","rowIndex":548,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あっ！」","en":"“Ah!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r549","rowIndex":549,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　叫び声がして、背中の上の妹がバランスを崩した。私は次に前方の<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>に向かって発砲する。","en":"She cried out and lost her balance upon my back. Next, I fired toward <tips=20>Koschei</tips> ahead of me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r550","rowIndex":550,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その胸で血がはじける。灰上姉が驚きの表情を浮かべる。","en":"Blood burst from his chest. The elder Haigami sister wore an expression of shock.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r551","rowIndex":551,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は身体を転がして体勢を崩した妹の下から脱し、壁を背後にして姉妹と<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>のすべてが視界に入るような位置を取る。","en":"I rolled free of the younger sister and took a position with my back to the wall, keeping both twins and <tips=20>Koschei</tips> within my field of vision.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r552","rowIndex":552,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　妹はすぐに私に飛びかかって来ようとしたが、その顔面に銃口を向けて動きを制する。見たところ、さっきの一発はどこにも命中していなかったようだ。","en":"The younger sister immediately tried to spring at me, but I checked her by aiming the pistol at her face. From what I could see, the previous shot had missed her entirely.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r553","rowIndex":553,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は女子供には暴力を振るわないというポリシーを持っていたが、完全に頭から吹き飛んでいた。強い感情が内面の全てを焼き切っている。<tips=53>ミユキ</tips>と<tips=48>堂島</tips>を殺した一味の少女に対して、ごく自然に、そして即座に引き金を引いた。","en":"I had a rule against using violence on women or children, but it had been blown completely out of my mind. Fierce emotion had burned away everything inside me. It felt perfectly natural to pull the trigger at once on a girl who belonged to the group that had killed <tips=53>Miyuki</tips> and <tips=48>Dojima</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r554","rowIndex":554,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しかし、弾はあらぬ方向へ逸れて、彼女のすぐそばの床に穴を開けただけだった。","en":"But the bullet veered aside and did nothing more than punch a hole in the floor beside her.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r555","rowIndex":555,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　狙いがはずれたわけではない。発射の直前、銃口が見えない力によってぐいと横に動かされたのだ。","en":"My aim had not failed. Immediately before the shot, an invisible force jerked the muzzle to one side.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r556","rowIndex":556,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　振り返ると、姉が私を睨み付けていた。","en":"I looked back and found the elder sister glaring at me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r557","rowIndex":557,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女が抱きかかえる<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>は、胸に空いた新しい穴から血を噴き出し、そしてだらりとのけぞった顔に開いた口からも、ごぷごぷと血を垂れ流している。少女はその血を浴びて真っ赤になっていた。","en":"<tips=20>Koschei</tips> sagged backward in her arms. Blood spurted from the new hole in his chest and gurgled from his open mouth, drenching the girl scarlet.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r558","rowIndex":558,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は再び妹の方に視線を移す。直感的に、この状況ならば身体能力に優れる妹の方が危険だと判断した。","en":"I returned my gaze to the younger sister. Instinct told me that her superior physical abilities made her the greater danger in the current situation.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r559","rowIndex":559,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして彼女に向かって銃を構える。今度は両手で、しっかりと銃を持つ。見えない力がその銃口をブレさせるが、私の腕力の方が上だった。思った通り、姉の念動力はパワー自体はそれほどではないようだ。","en":"I aimed at her again, this time gripping the pistol firmly in both hands. The invisible force shook the muzzle, but my strength overcame it. As I had thought, the elder sister’s telekinesis was not especially powerful in itself.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r560","rowIndex":560,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私はもう一度引き金を引く。","en":"I pulled the trigger again.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r561","rowIndex":561,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ひっ」","en":"“Eek.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r562","rowIndex":562,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　命中すると思ったが、しかしすんでのところで銃弾は外れたようだった。彼女の頬をかすめて、細い傷を作っただけだ。","en":"I thought the shot would hit, but at the last possible instant the bullet seemed to slip wide. It only grazed her cheek, leaving a thin cut.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r563","rowIndex":563,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　多少ぶれても命中するように、私は一歩前に足を踏み出す。","en":"I stepped forward, closing the distance so that a slight deviation would not prevent another shot from striking.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r564","rowIndex":564,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　今度は銃口を動かすのではなく、ナイフかなにかを飛ばしてくるだろうか？　だとしても、あの非力さなら恐るるに足りない。たとえ私が致命傷を受けたしても、息絶えるまでに妹を射殺し、姉を射殺するだけだ。","en":"Would she stop trying to move the muzzle and send another knife or something at me instead? Even then, given how weak her telekinesis was, I had nothing to fear. Even if she dealt me a fatal wound, all I had to do was shoot the younger sister dead, then the elder, before I stopped breathing.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r565","rowIndex":565,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しかし、姉のとった行動は想定とは違った。三度目の射撃を行おうとした刹那、一瞬白い物が見えたかと思うと、目に何か粉のようなものが入って視界がふさがれる。","en":"The elder did something different from what I had expected. Just as I prepared to fire a third time, something white flashed across my vision; then powder struck my eyes and blinded me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r566","rowIndex":566,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　小麦粉か片栗粉のような、とにかくキッチンに並んでいた何かをぶちまけたのだろう。私は思わず目を腕で覆いながら、同時に引き金を引く。","en":"Perhaps she had thrown flour, potato starch, or some other powder from the kitchen. I instinctively covered my eyes with one arm and pulled the trigger at the same time.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r567","rowIndex":567,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「こいつっ！」","en":"“You—!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r568","rowIndex":568,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　声とともに私は突き飛ばされ、尻餅をついた。","en":"At the same instant as the cry, I was shoved backward and landed hard on my backside.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r569","rowIndex":569,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いや、ここは逃げよう！」","en":"“No, let’s get out of here!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r570","rowIndex":570,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「う、うんっ！」","en":"“Y-yes!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r571","rowIndex":571,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=86>双子</tips>の呼び合う声がし、ガタガタと物音がする。私はおぼろげに見える人影にむかって発砲したが、当たった気配はない。","en":"<tips=86>The twins</tips> called to each other amid a clatter of movement. I fired toward the shapes visible through the haze, but sensed no impact.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r572","rowIndex":572,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ドアの方から逃げようとしているのか？","en":"Were they attempting to escape through the door?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r573","rowIndex":573,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ほとんど視界がないままその後を追うと、前方から椅子が飛んでくる。妹が投げつけたのだろう。私は腕で受けたが、その拍子に銃を取り落としてしまった。","en":"I followed despite having almost no vision. A chair flew toward me. The younger sister must have thrown it. I blocked it with one arm, but the impact knocked the pistol from my hand.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r574","rowIndex":574,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　散らかった床から銃を拾い上げ、流しでざっと目を洗ってからドアを出る。","en":"I retrieved the pistol from the cluttered floor, rinsed my eyes quickly at the sink, and went out the door.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r575","rowIndex":575,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして、日の落ちた暗い裏通りに彼らの姿を探すが、すべては闇のなかに溶け込んで誰の姿も見えない。","en":"Outside, I searched the dark back street for them, but night had swallowed everything, and not one of them was visible.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r576","rowIndex":576,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　あの状況でどうやってこんなに早く移動したのか？　<tips=17>タイプB</tips>の妹がその怪力で二人を担いで駆けていったのだろうか？　そうだとしたら、恐ろしい身体能力だ。","en":"How had they moved so quickly in those circumstances? Had the <tips=17>Type B</tips> younger sister carried both of the others and run? If so, her physical ability was terrifying.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r577","rowIndex":577,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は階段を下りてその姿を探した。路上には<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>のものらしい血液が落ちていたが、それもすぐに消えている。","en":"I descended the stairs and searched for them. Blood that appeared to belong to <tips=20>Koschei</tips> lay in drops upon the street, but the trail soon vanished.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r578","rowIndex":578,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　数歩あるいて、目の前に通行人がいるのに気がついた。","en":"After walking several steps, I noticed a passerby ahead of me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r579","rowIndex":579,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　三人を見なかったか訊ねようとしたが、悲鳴を上げて逃げていってしまう。","en":"I tried to ask whether the passerby had seen the three of them, but they screamed and fled.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r580","rowIndex":580,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　こんなところに、街の住民以外が入り込むとは珍しい。<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>の葬列で<tips=57>滑走路通り</tips>が混雑していたから、人が溢れ出たのだろうか？　まだ街は、あの人混みを見せているのだろうか？","en":"It was unusual for anyone but a resident to venture into a place like this. Had the crowds for <tips=3>Chris Tse’s</tips> funeral procession overflowed from <tips=57>Runway Street</tips>? Was the city still showing that same crush of people?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r581","rowIndex":581,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　いや、そもそも、私は今両腕が血みどろで、しかも拳銃を握りしめている。角が生えた大男がこんな姿をしていれば、三人を見つける前に、私の方が捕まってしまうだろう。<tips=57>滑走路通り</tips>があの騒ぎならば、警察もさすがに多数動員されているだろうし。","en":"No. To begin with, both my arms were drenched in blood, and I was gripping a pistol. A huge horned man in such a state would be arrested before he ever found the three fugitives. If the commotion on <tips=57>Runway Street</tips> was still going on, the police would surely have deployed a great many officers as well.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r582","rowIndex":582,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　逃げたあの連中も、あの姿のままなら街のどこかで誰かに咎められるだろうか？　しかし、この街は繁華街のきらめきとは対照的に、裏通りの闇はあまりにも濃い。期待出来るものではないだろう。","en":"If the fugitives remained in that condition, might someone elsewhere in the city stop them? Yet in contrast to the glitter of its entertainment quarter, the darkness in the city’s back streets was too deep. I could hardly count on anyone doing so.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r583","rowIndex":583,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は諦めて、アパートに引き返した。","en":"I abandoned the pursuit and returned to the apartment.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r584","rowIndex":584,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　部屋の中は酷い有様だ。","en":"The room was appalling.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r585","rowIndex":585,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は<tips=48>堂島</tips>に近づき、その息を確かめたが、すでに事切れてその身体は冷たくなりはじめている。","en":"I approached <tips=48>Dojima</tips> and checked his breathing. He was already dead, and his body had begun to grow cold.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r586","rowIndex":586,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　目は大きく見開かれたままだ。私はまぶたを下ろしてやりたかったが、何度指で押さえてもうまく行かず、いつまでも<tips=48>堂島</tips>の目は開いたままだった。","en":"His eyes remained wide open. I wanted to close them for him, but no matter how many times I pressed the lids down with my fingers, <tips=48>Dojima’s</tips> eyes stayed open.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r587","rowIndex":587,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=53>ミユキ</tips>も<tips=48>堂島</tips>も死んでしまった。二人とも私のミスで死んでしまった。そして私だけが生き残った。","en":"<tips=53>Miyuki</tips> and <tips=48>Dojima</tips> were dead. Both had died because of my mistake. I alone remained alive.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r588","rowIndex":588,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ひどく喉が渇く。冷蔵庫を開けて、水を取り出そうとしたときに左腕がひどく痛んだ。見ると、骨が折れて、ぷらぷらと揺れている。灰上が投げた椅子を受けとめたときに痛めたのだろう。","en":"My throat was terribly dry. When I opened the refrigerator to take out some water, a violent pain shot through my left arm. I looked and saw that the bone was broken; the arm hung limp and swayed. I must have injured it when I blocked the chair Haigami threw.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E3:r589","rowIndex":589,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ちっとも気がつかなかった。","en":"I had not noticed at all.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}}]},{"position":13,"code":"B2","unitId":"B2","rows":[{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r1","rowIndex":1,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その日おれは前の日から工場に泊まり込んで、『<tips=71>グレートホール饅頭</tips>』の改良に取り組んでいた。","en":"That day, I had been holed up at the factory since the day before, working to improve the <tips=71>Great Hole buns</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r2","rowIndex":2,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　工場と言っても、廃業した個人経営のパン屋を買い取って、そのまま設備を流用しただけの建物だから、仲間四人と共にああでもないこうでもないと様々な種類の試作品を作って並べているとすぐ手狭になってしまう。","en":"Factory was a grand name for it. We had simply bought a defunct mom-and-pop bakery and reused its equipment as it stood. Once my four companions and I began debating this and that while making and lining up every sort of prototype, we quickly ran out of room.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r3","rowIndex":3,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　今回集まったのは商品開発部のメンバーで、おれにとっては実に頼りになる友人たちだが、世間ではなかなか認められない顔ぶれであるとは思う。","en":"The people gathered this time were the members of our product-development team—wonderfully dependable friends, as far as I was concerned, though I had to admit they were not a cast society was likely to accept.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r4","rowIndex":4,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=17>タイプＢ</tips>で発症済の独り言が多い元中華料理人、<tips=16>タイプA</tips>の<tips=77>特質変異</tips>を隠すために顔を包帯でぐるぐる巻きにしたパティシエの女、ギャングの女に手を出して酸で顔を焼かれて失業し現在はヤク中の元フランス料理シェフ、盗癖があってどこへいってもすぐに辞めさせられるウェイトレス。","en":"A former Chinese chef, a symptomatic <tips=17>Type B</tips> who constantly talked to himself; a female pastry chef whose face was wound in bandages to hide her <tips=16>Type A</tips> <tips=77>trait mutation</tips>; a former French chef who got involved with a gangster’s woman, had his face burned with acid, lost his job, and was now a drug addict; and a waitress with a habit of stealing who got fired everywhere she went.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r5","rowIndex":5,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　こうして並べてみるとまったくひどいな！　ミュータントもノーマルも混じって人種も様々なこの連中なのだけれども、饅頭を作るより、お化け屋敷でもやった方が手っ取り早く儲けられるんじゃないか？","en":"Put them all together like that and they sounded absolutely terrible! Mutants and Normals, every race under the sun—wouldn’t this bunch make money faster running a haunted house than making buns?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r6","rowIndex":6,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しかし、こういったメンツでやるからこそ、このプロジェクトは意味があるのだと思っているんだよね。","en":"But I believed this project meant something precisely because we were doing it with people like them.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r7","rowIndex":7,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そんな面々でなかなか売り上げが伸びない饅頭のテコ入れを行い、夜が明けるころにはみなぐったりとして、男も女も調理場に隣接した古畳の座敷の上にごろ寝になっているのだ。","en":"This was the crew that had spent the night trying to give our sluggish bun sales a boost. By daybreak they were all exhausted, men and women alike sprawled asleep on the old tatami in the room adjoining the kitchen.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r8","rowIndex":8,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　みなで一緒に一つのことに取り組んでいるのはなかなか楽しく、ずっとこうしていたいが、しかしおれはここでのんびり寝ているわけにはいかない。三十分ほど仮眠を取ると、今日販売しなければならない在庫を抱え、眠っている連中を起こさぬように工場を出た。","en":"There was something wonderful about all of us working together toward one thing, and I wished we could go on like this forever. But I could not afford to lie around sleeping. After a nap of about thirty minutes, I gathered up the stock we had to sell that day and left the factory without waking the others.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r9","rowIndex":9,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　空はまだ曇っていたが、昨日降っていた雨はもうやんでいる。","en":"The sky remained cloudy, but the rain from the day before had stopped.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r10","rowIndex":10,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　眠くて眠くてたまらないけれど、それをおして進む。","en":"I could hardly keep my eyes open, but I pushed on all the same.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r11","rowIndex":11,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　必死に饅頭売りなんてやって何のつもりなの？　頭がおかしくなったの？","en":"What are you trying to prove, working yourself to death selling buns? Have you lost your mind?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r12","rowIndex":12,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そんな風に笑われることは多いが、おれはちっとも気にしてはいない。","en":"People often laughed at me that way, but I did not mind in the least.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r13","rowIndex":13,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そりゃ、貞操観念の薄い女の子を集めて饅頭一個買って貰うごとにスペシャルサービスを行ったり、一定の期間ネット端末を無制限に使えるプリペイドカードを箱の裏に隠したりすればもっと高い値段をつけたって飛ぶように売れるだろうけれども、それじゃあいけないのだ。","en":"Sure, if we gathered girls with loose notions of chastity and offered a special service with every bun, or hid prepaid cards for a fixed period of unlimited network-terminal use on the backs of the boxes, we could charge much more and still have them flying off the shelves. But that would defeat the purpose.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r14","rowIndex":14,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そういう店ならたくさんある。この街には、正真正銘おいしい饅頭だけを売る、まっとうな饅頭売りが必要だ。","en":"There were already plenty of stores like that. What this city needed was an honest bun seller who sold nothing but genuinely delicious buns.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r15","rowIndex":15,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=9>Y地区</tips>が昔よりも健全になって、住民はみな健全な仕事で金を手に入れるようになった。——そんな雰囲気が漂う今日この頃だけれども、その言説はある意味正しくて、ある意味間違っている。","en":"<tips=9>Y District</tips> had become more respectable than before, and now all its residents earned their money through honest work. ...That was the story in the air these days, and it was true in one sense but false in another.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r16","rowIndex":16,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　確かに<tips=57>滑走路通り</tips>には小綺麗な店が増えて、まともな商品を提供し、余所から来た客が安心して利用出来るようになったが、そんな小綺麗な店を経営しているのは大体よそから来た人々だ。","en":"<tips=57>Runway Street</tips> had certainly gained more neat, attractive shops offering legitimate products that visitors from elsewhere could buy with confidence. Most of those shops, however, were run by people from elsewhere themselves.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r17","rowIndex":17,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=9>Y地区</tips>に元々住んでいた連中の経営していたうさんくさい店は、どんどん減っている。そして表通りからそうした店が消えることで、<tips=9>Y地区</tips>にたくさんいるうさんくさい連中がまっとうに金を稼ぐ手段がどんどん減っている。","en":"The dubious businesses once run by longtime residents of <tips=9>Y District</tips> were disappearing one after another. And as those shops vanished from the main streets, all the dubious people who filled <tips=9>Y District</tips> had fewer and fewer ways to earn an honest living.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r18","rowIndex":18,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=17>タイプB</tips>やら<tips=16>タイプA</tips>やら、日本になんの伝手もない移民の子やらは自尊心の低い卑屈な連中が多いから、自分なんか価値のないクズだと思い込んでいるから、将来なんか信じちゃいないから、職を失うと簡単にろくでもない商売に身を投じてしまう。","en":"A lot of <tips=17>Type Bs</tips>, <tips=16>Type As</tips>, and children of immigrants with no connections in Japan were beaten-down people with little self-respect. They convinced themselves they were worthless trash; they put no faith in any future. So when they lost a job, it was all too easy for them to throw themselves into some rotten trade.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r19","rowIndex":19,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そりゃろくでもない商売はやりかたによってはぼろ儲けも出来るけれども、本当の意味での自尊心は育たない。","en":"Sure, if you went about it right, a rotten line of work could make you filthy rich. But it could never give you any real self-respect.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r20","rowIndex":20,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　つまりそこには未来なんかないってことだ。","en":"In other words, there is no future in it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r21","rowIndex":21,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　結局のところ、表通りにならぶ店がよそからのお客さん向けに綺麗になったというだけの話で、裏路地に捨てられる子供の数や、殺人事件は増加する一方なのである。","en":"In the end, all that had happened was that the shops lining the main streets had been cleaned up for out-of-town customers; meanwhile, the number of children abandoned in the back alleys and the number of murders kept rising.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r22","rowIndex":22,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　今のこの街に必要なのは、よそ者に表通りから追い払われたろくでなしでも、陽の当たる場所で生きていけるという自信だ。誰に会っても胸を張って語れる、まっとうに金を稼げる場所だ。","en":"What this city needed now was the confidence that even a good-for-nothing driven off the main streets by outsiders could still live in the sunlight. It needed a place where people could earn honest money and hold their heads high when they told anyone what they did for a living.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r23","rowIndex":23,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おれは、<tips=71>グレートホール饅頭</tips>こそが、その役割を果たすと思っているから、どんなに笑われてもやめるわけにはいかないんだよね。","en":"I believed the <tips=71>Great Hole buns</tips> would fulfill that role. No matter how much people laughed at me, I could not give up on them.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r24","rowIndex":24,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そしておれは、今日もいつものようにバーバラの勤める花屋の店先で<tips=66>コンタ</tips>と一緒に店番をすることになっている。だから、自転車を飛ばしてそこへ向かう。","en":"Today, as usual, I was due to run the stall with <tips=66>Konta</tips> outside the flower shop where Barbara worked. So I raced over on my bicycle.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r25","rowIndex":25,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　到着し、そして彼女に場所を借りるための挨拶をしたところで、意外なことを報された。","en":"When I arrived and gave her my usual greeting before asking to borrow the space, she told me something unexpected.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r26","rowIndex":26,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　どうも、<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>の<tips=81>龍頭</tips>であり、<tips=1>亮</tips>の父親でもある<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>が死んだらしい。昨日<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>から通達があって、<tips=57>滑走路通り</tips>をその葬儀の列が通過するとのこと。","en":"Apparently <tips=3>Chris Tse</tips>, the <tips=81>Longtou</tips> of <tips=7>YS</tips> and also <tips=1>Ryo’s</tips> father, had died. <tips=7>YS</tips> sent notice the day before that his funeral procession would pass along <tips=57>Runway Street</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r27","rowIndex":27,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　どれくらいの時間をかけて彼らが通過するのか知らないが、その間は商売をすることは難しいだろうとバーバラは言う。","en":"Barbara said she did not know how long the procession would take to pass, but we would probably find it difficult to conduct business during that time.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r28","rowIndex":28,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「少しでも多く売らなきゃいけないのに大変ですね」","en":"“That must be difficult when you need to sell as many as you can.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r29","rowIndex":29,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いや、それは別にいいんだ。しかし、ついに死んじまったのか……」","en":"“No, that part’s fine. But so he’s finally dead...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r30","rowIndex":30,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>の心情はいかなるものか。口を開けば文句ばかりだが、親子というものはそういうもんじゃないだろう。","en":"What must <tips=1>Ryo</tips> be feeling? He did nothing but complain whenever he opened his mouth, but weren’t parents and children often like that?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r31","rowIndex":31,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それに、これからどうするつもりなのだろう？　街ではもうあいつが後継者に決まったような前提であれこれと噂話が囁かれている。","en":"And what did he mean to do now? Whispers were already running through the city, all of them taking it for granted that he had been chosen as the successor.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r32","rowIndex":32,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　本人はやりたくはないだろう。けれども、まわりがそう望めば裏切ることは出来ないはずだ。","en":"He probably did not want the job. But if the people around him wanted it, he would not be able to let them down.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r33","rowIndex":33,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　昔からそういうやつだった。――あいつが<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>のボスか。組織を嫌っていたのに、なんだか気の毒なような気もする。","en":"He had always been like that. —Ryo, the boss of <tips=7>YS</tips>. He had hated the organization. I could not help feeling a little sorry for him.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r34","rowIndex":34,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>のボスになるということは、この街の裏社会における最重要人物になるということだ。","en":"Becoming the boss of <tips=7>YS</tips> meant becoming the single most important figure in this city’s underworld.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r35","rowIndex":35,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　子供の頃から知っていたあの男が、急に別の誰かになった――というよりも、本来の場所に戻っていったのかもしれない。","en":"The man I had known since childhood had suddenly become someone else—or perhaps he had simply returned to where he belonged.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r36","rowIndex":36,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　午前十一時頃に小雨がぱらつきはじめると、その雨が呼び込むように葬列はやって来た。","en":"A light rain began to fall around eleven in the morning, and as though summoned by that rain, the funeral procession arrived.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r37","rowIndex":37,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ただでさえ人の多いこの道を、押しのけるようにしてしずしずと向かってくる。先導車が通り過ぎ、豪勢な棺をのせたオープンカーがやってくると、その車に<tips=1>亮</tips>は乗っていた。","en":"The procession advanced solemnly, forcing its way through a street crowded even on an ordinary day. The lead vehicle passed; then came an open car carrying a magnificent coffin. <tips=1>Ryo</tips> was riding in it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r38","rowIndex":38,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　傘もささず、雨に打たれるままにしている。","en":"He carried no umbrella, simply letting the rain beat down on him.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r39","rowIndex":39,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　あんな一番目立つところに座っているとは。自分が後継者だということを街中に宣伝しているようだ。","en":"There he was, sitting in the most conspicuous place of all. It was as though he were proclaiming to the whole city that he was the successor.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r40","rowIndex":40,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「やっぱり<tips=1>亮</tips>は、おれたちとは住む世界が違うんだなあ」","en":"“I suppose <tips=1>Ryo</tips> really does live in a different world from us.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"田中紺太","displayName":"Konta Tanaka","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r41","rowIndex":41,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　隣で<tips=66>コンタ</tips>が溜息をつく。","en":"<tips=66>Konta</tips> sighed beside me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r42","rowIndex":42,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おれはそうは思わなかったが、けれど、なんだか凜々しく感じた。定食屋の息子と偽って裏通りでやんちゃをしていた過去なんか、まるではじめから存在しなかったみたいだ。","en":"I did not see it that way. And yet, somehow, he looked positively gallant. It was as though his past—pretending to be a diner owner’s son while running wild through the back streets—had never existed at all.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r43","rowIndex":43,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　友人の立場の変化に対し、誇らしいような、心配なような、寂しいような複雑な感情を抱えながら、行列が去ってゆくのを見守った。これからのあいつの人生は一筋縄ではいかないだろう。しかし、何にしろ、これがあの<tips=1>亮</tips>が自分で選んだ道なのだ。","en":"With pride, worry, and loneliness mingling inside me at the change in my friend’s position, I watched the procession disappear. His life from this point forward would hardly be simple. Whatever else might be said, however, this was the road <tips=1>Ryo</tips> had chosen for himself.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r44","rowIndex":44,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして、一行が去って、人の流れが元に戻ってからやっといつもの商売だ。","en":"Once the procession had gone and the flow of people returned to normal, it was finally back to business as usual.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r45","rowIndex":45,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>の心配をしている場合ではない。おれも自分の仕事をしなくちゃならん。<tips=71>グレートホール饅頭</tips>を事業化しなくてはならん。","en":"This was no time to worry about <tips=1>Ryo</tips>. I had my own work to do. I had to turn the <tips=71>Great Hole buns</tips> into a viable business.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r46","rowIndex":46,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　というわけで、雨にも負けずにいつも以上に気持ちを込めて売り声をあげているところにまた邪魔が入った。","en":"And so, undaunted by the rain, I was calling my wares with more spirit than ever when something interrupted me again.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r47","rowIndex":47,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　携帯電話が鳴る。","en":"My phone rang.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r48","rowIndex":48,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おれは通知された発信者の名前を見ると、見なかったことにして、またポケットにしまった。","en":"I saw the caller’s name on the screen, pretended I had seen nothing, and slipped the phone back into my pocket.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r49","rowIndex":49,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=10>道夫</tips>君、どうして電話に出ないの？」","en":"“<tips=10>Michio</tips>, why aren’t you answering?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"田中紺太","displayName":"Konta Tanaka","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r50","rowIndex":50,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=66>コンタ</tips>が不審げにおれを見ている。","en":"<tips=66>Konta</tips> was eyeing me suspiciously.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r51","rowIndex":51,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「出たくないんだよ」","en":"“Because I don’t want to.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r52","rowIndex":52,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　どうせろくでもない用件に決まっている。この電話の相手は、一度だっておれにまともな用件をもたらしたことなどない。","en":"Whatever he wanted was bound to be some worthless errand. Not once had this caller ever brought me a decent request.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r53","rowIndex":53,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　だから出たくはなかったのだけれども、いくら無視をしたって何度も何度もしつこく鳴らすものだから、根負けして出てしまった。","en":"I truly did not want to answer, but he rang again and again no matter how long I ignored him. Eventually he wore me down, and I answered.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r54","rowIndex":54,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"『今からうちへ来てくれ』","en":"“Come over to my place. Now.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r55","rowIndex":55,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ひからびた老人の声でそう言った。","en":"The words came in the wizened voice of an old man.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r56","rowIndex":56,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なんの用件ですか？」","en":"“What do you need?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r57","rowIndex":57,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　どうせ大して重要でもない、くだらない話だろう、という気持ちを隠すつもりもないトーンでおれはそう尋ね返す。","en":"I asked in a tone that made no attempt to hide my certainty that this was some pointless nonsense.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r58","rowIndex":58,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"『とにかく来てくれればいい』","en":"“Just come here.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r59","rowIndex":59,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　老人はそう言って、一方的に通話を切った。","en":"With that, the old man unilaterally ended the call.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r60","rowIndex":60,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「はあ……」","en":"“Haaah...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r61","rowIndex":61,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おれは通話の終わった携帯電話を眺めながら深いため息をつく。","en":"I stared at the phone in my hand and heaved a deep sigh.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r62","rowIndex":62,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どんな話だったの？」","en":"“What was it about?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"田中紺太","displayName":"Konta Tanaka","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r63","rowIndex":63,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=66>コンタ</tips>は不審そうに尋ねる。","en":"<tips=66>Konta</tips> asked, plainly suspicious.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r64","rowIndex":64,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「とにかく来いってさ。なんの用事だかわからないが、どうせまた新しいゲームソフトを持ってこいとか、そんな話に決まってるんだよ。未だに子供だと思って、下らない雑用ばっかり言いつけやがる。いちいち呼ばれるおれの気持ちにもなってくれってんだ」","en":"“He just said to come. I have no idea what he wants, but I guarantee it’s something like bringing over a new video game. He still thinks I’m a kid, and all he ever does is saddle me with stupid chores. He ought to spare a thought for how it feels to be summoned every time.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r65","rowIndex":65,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「はあ、あの人たちからの電話だったんだ」","en":"“Oh, so that call was from those people.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"田中紺太","displayName":"Konta Tanaka","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r66","rowIndex":66,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうとも！　まったく、恩があるからむげにもできないが、これじゃあ召使いとかわらん」","en":"“Exactly! I owe them too much to turn them away, but at this point I’m no different from a servant.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r67","rowIndex":67,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いやあ、あの人たちは<tips=10>道夫</tips>君を将来リーダーにしようと思ってるから、目をかけてるんでしょ」","en":"“Well, they have their eye on you because they mean to make you their leader one day, don’t they, <tips=10>Michio</tips>?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"田中紺太","displayName":"Konta Tanaka","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r68","rowIndex":68,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「面白がってこきつかってるだけさ。古い人たちだから、ハイブリッドってものに変な幻想を持ってるんだよ」","en":"“They’re just ordering me around for their own amusement. They’re old, so they have all sorts of peculiar fantasies about hybrids.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r69","rowIndex":69,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おれは言って、もう一度溜息をついた。","en":"I said it with another sigh.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r70","rowIndex":70,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　仕事中に抜け出すのは気が重くてしかたがないが、<tips=66>コンタ</tips>も行けとすすめるし、完全に無視を決めこむわけにもいかないのでおれはその電話の主の家へ向かった。","en":"I hated leaving in the middle of work, but <tips=66>Konta</tips> urged me to go, and I could not simply ignore the summons altogether. So I set out for the caller’s house.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r71","rowIndex":71,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それは、<tips=59>暗闇通り</tips>のすぐ側にある民家で、日本のどの地域でも見かけられるような平凡な一軒家だった。","en":"It was an ordinary detached house standing just beside <tips=59>Darkness Street</tips>, the sort one might find in any part of Japan.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r72","rowIndex":72,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=59>暗闇通り</tips>のあたりは狭い道が入り組んだわかりにくい路地ばかりだが、小さい頃から歩き尽くしているおれは目をつぶってたって迷わない。片手には傘、もう片方の手で自転車のハンドルを操作してその家の前まで来ると、","en":"The area around <tips=59>Darkness Street</tips> was a bewildering maze of narrow lanes, but I had walked every one of them since childhood and could have found my way with my eyes shut. With an umbrella in one hand and the other on my bicycle’s handlebars, I came up to the house and—","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r73","rowIndex":73,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「おや」","en":"“Oh?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r74","rowIndex":74,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　門の側に、見知らぬ人物が立っていた。","en":"A stranger stood beside the gate.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r75","rowIndex":75,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ぶかぶかのレインコートを着た小柄の人物がおれに背を向けて、おれの目的地である家を見上げている。子供が親の服でも借りて来たのだろうか？　しかも、レインコートの下からのびた細い足は靴も靴下も穿いていない、いくらなんでも路上には痛々しい素足なのだ。","en":"A small figure in an oversized raincoat stood with their back to me, gazing up at the house I meant to visit. Had some child borrowed a parent’s coat? A pair of slender legs emerged from beneath the raincoat, bare of shoes and socks. Out on the street, those naked feet were a painful sight.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r76","rowIndex":76,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しかしなんだって、子供が一人でこの家に？","en":"But why would a child come to this house alone?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r77","rowIndex":77,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　すぐ頭に思い浮かんだのは、どこかの家で虐待を受けている子供が逃げて来たというシチュエーションだった。素足である辺りからそんな発想をしたのだ。","en":"My first thought was that an abused child had run away from some nearby home. The bare feet were what gave me the idea.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r78","rowIndex":78,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「やあ、こんにちは！」","en":"“Hello there!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r79","rowIndex":79,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おれが声をかけると、その人物は振り向いた。","en":"When I called, the figure turned around.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r80","rowIndex":80,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　すっぽりかぶったフードから覗いたその容貌に、おれはおもわず息をのんだ。","en":"The face peering from beneath the enveloping hood made me catch my breath.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r81","rowIndex":81,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　人種がまざるとたまにとんでもない美形が生まれるもので、世界中の移民が集まって三十年以上が過ぎたこの街には、そうして生まれた奇跡的な美女やら美男やらが何人か存在する。","en":"When races mingle, now and then someone of astonishing beauty is born. More than thirty years after immigrants from around the world began gathering here, the city was home to a handful of the miraculous beauties that mingling had produced, men and women alike.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r82","rowIndex":82,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　まあ、<tips=9>Y地区</tips>には美しい人間だけでもなく、醜いとか、どうみたって人間じゃねえだろって奴もたくさんいるから、大抵の容姿には驚かなくなってしまう。","en":"Of course, <tips=9>Y District</tips> was not all beautiful people. There were plenty of ugly ones too, and plenty who made you think, No way is that even human. By now, most appearances no longer surprised me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r83","rowIndex":83,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　が、そうした連中を見慣れたおれでさえハッとするほど整った顔立ちの少女がそこに居て、むしろその自分の驚きこそが驚きである。","en":"And yet there stood a girl with features so perfect that even I, accustomed to all those people, caught my breath. More astonishing still was the fact that I had been astonished at all.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r84","rowIndex":84,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　年は思春期まっただなかといった頃合いで、個人的趣味からすると幼すぎるけれども、そうした好き嫌いとは別に容貌の美しさというものは実感出来るものなわけで、おれはこれまで生きて来て、こんなに美しい人間を見たことがない。","en":"She appeared to be in mid-adolescence—far too young to interest me personally. But one could recognize beauty regardless of preference, and in all my life, I had never seen a human being so beautiful.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r85","rowIndex":85,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　透けるような薄く白い皮膚に、淡い色の金髪は何か特殊なコーティングでもされたかのようにつややかだ。","en":"Her thin, white skin was almost translucent, and her pale-blond hair gleamed as though it had been treated with some special coating.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r86","rowIndex":86,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その気色悪いほど美しい少女が、いぶかしげにおれを見て、そしてまた建物に目を戻す。","en":"The girl, beautiful to the point of eeriness, regarded me with suspicion and then returned her gaze to the building.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r87","rowIndex":87,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　表情には切羽詰まった様子もないし、暴力を振るわれたような形跡もない。虐待児童という線はどうも違うらしい。","en":"She did not look desperate, nor could I see any sign that she had been subjected to violence. Apparently the abused-child theory was wrong.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r88","rowIndex":88,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　じゃあなぜこんな姿でここに？","en":"Then why had she come here looking like this?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r89","rowIndex":89,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なあ、お嬢ちゃん。そこが誰の家なのか知っているのかい？」","en":"“Hey, kid. Do you know whose house that is?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r90","rowIndex":90,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　美しすぎるというのは、醜すぎる以上に不穏で不吉な予感がする。","en":"Someone too beautiful gave me an even darker, more ominous feeling than someone too ugly.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r91","rowIndex":91,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　慎重にそう話しかけると、少女は自分が見つめる先を指さす。","en":"When I cautiously spoke to her, the girl pointed at what she had been staring at.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r92","rowIndex":92,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　建物の外壁に、灰色の蛾が止まっている。","en":"A gray moth rested upon the building’s outer wall.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r93","rowIndex":93,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ナカオビキリガだな」","en":"“A nakaobi-kiriga moth.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r94","rowIndex":94,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おれが名前を教えてやると、","en":"When I told her what it was—","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r95","rowIndex":95,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「えび」","en":"“Ebi.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r96","rowIndex":96,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　少女はか弱いボソボソとした声でそう言った。","en":"The girl murmured it in a frail little voice.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r97","rowIndex":97,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「エビじゃなくて、蛾だよ」","en":"“Ebi? It’s not a shrimp. It’s a moth.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r98","rowIndex":98,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「えび」","en":"“Ebi.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r99","rowIndex":99,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　少女はおれの方を見て繰り返す。","en":"She looked at me and repeated the word.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r100","rowIndex":100,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「お嬢ちゃんは日本語あんまり得意じゃないのかな？　これは、虫のなかまで、蛾って言うんだよ」","en":"“Maybe you’re not very good at Japanese? This is a kind of bug. It’s called a moth.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r101","rowIndex":101,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おれがそう言うと、少女は不機嫌そうに顔を振り、","en":"When I said that, the girl irritably tossed her head and said,","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r102","rowIndex":102,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「うそつき、ごみ」","en":"“Liar. Garbage.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r103","rowIndex":103,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　と、外見とおっとりとした声に似合わぬ毒舌を吐く。","en":"The poisonous words suited neither her appearance nor her placid voice.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r104","rowIndex":104,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「おいおい何だよ。お前なー」","en":"“Hey. What’s that supposed to mean—”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r105","rowIndex":105,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おれが言いかけたところで、少女はぱっと踵を返して道の向こうへかけてゆき、姿を消してしまう。","en":"Before I could finish, the girl abruptly turned on her heel, ran across the street, and disappeared.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r106","rowIndex":106,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　一体なんだったのだろう？","en":"What in the world had that been about?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r107","rowIndex":107,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　溜息をつきつつ自転車を門の前に停め、インターフォンを押す。","en":"With a sigh, I parked my bicycle before the gate and pressed the intercom.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r108","rowIndex":108,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　するとハウスキーパーの佐藤さんが出たので名を名乗って通して貰った。","en":"Mr. Sato, the housekeeper, answered. I gave my name, and he admitted me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r109","rowIndex":109,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そしてリビングルームへ向かうと、いつもの様に三人の老人がビデオゲームに興じている。","en":"When I went into the living room, the three old men were absorbed in a video game as usual.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r110","rowIndex":110,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「来ましたよ」","en":"“I’m here.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r111","rowIndex":111,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おれの声で三人は振り返る。","en":"The three men turned at my voice.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r112","rowIndex":112,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　三人は年格好こそ似通っているが、人種はそれぞれ違っていた。","en":"They were similar in age and build, but each was of a different race.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r113","rowIndex":113,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　東洋人らしい顔つきをしているのは、<tips=90>ミスター・チェン</tips>。","en":"The one with East Asian features was <tips=90>Mr. Chen</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r114","rowIndex":114,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　真っ白な肌を持つのは、<tips=89>ミスター・アーノルド</tips>。","en":"The one with stark-white skin was <tips=89>Mr. Arnold</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r115","rowIndex":115,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　真っ黒な肌を持つのは、<tips=91>ミスター・スミス</tips>。","en":"The one with deep-black skin was <tips=91>Mr. Smith</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r116","rowIndex":116,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　あまりにもありふれたそれぞれの名は、到底本名だとは思えないけれど、かといって他の呼ばれ方をしているのをただの一度も聞いたことがない。幼い頃から身近で育ってきたおれでさえもだ。","en":"Their names were so ordinary that I could scarcely believe any of them genuine. Yet I had never once heard the men called anything else, despite having grown up in their company from early childhood.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r117","rowIndex":117,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「早かったネ」","en":"“You got here fast.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ミスター・チェン","displayName":"Mr. Chen","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r118","rowIndex":118,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　さきほど電話をかけてきたのは、このニヤニヤと笑っている<tips=90>ミスター・チェン</tips>だ。","en":"The man who had called me earlier was the smirking <tips=90>Mr. Chen</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r119","rowIndex":119,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　この三人は人種もバラバラだが、性格もそれぞれで、おしゃべりで社交的なのがチェン、皮肉屋で理屈っぽいのがアーノルド、寡黙で無表情なのがスミスと、うまい具合に別れている。","en":"The three men differed in personality as completely as they did in race. Chen was talkative and sociable, Arnold cynical and argumentative, and Smith silent and expressionless. The division was almost too perfect.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r120","rowIndex":120,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「しつこく呼ぶからじゃないですか！　なんですか！　人を呼びつけておいてゲームに夢中になっているなんて」","en":"“Only because you wouldn’t stop calling! What is this? You summon me all the way over here, then sit there absorbed in a game!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r121","rowIndex":121,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「すまんすまん」","en":"“Sorry, sorry.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ミスター・チェン","displayName":"Mr. Chen","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r122","rowIndex":122,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=90>ミスター・チェン</tips>は口ではそう言うが悪びれる様子もない。","en":"<tips=90>Mr. Chen</tips> said the words, but he did not look the least bit sorry.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r123","rowIndex":123,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　こうして三人でゲーム機を囲んでいると、老後を悠々自適にすごす老人会か何かのメンバーにしか見えないし、実際そのような姿も真実の一つじゃないかとおれは思うのだけれど、世間では少し違う形で知られている。","en":"Sitting together around a game console like this, the three looked like nothing more than members of some old men’s club, peacefully enjoying their retirement. And I thought that picture of them was one genuine part of the truth. The world at large, however, knew them in a somewhat different form.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r124","rowIndex":124,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼らは<tips=9>Y地区</tips>に住む<tips=17>タイプB</tips>たちのとりまとめ役なのだ。<tips=35>ジョゼ・フェルナンデス</tips>が南米系移民を、また<tips=27>廖志明</tips>が客家系華僑を統率しているように、<tips=22>老人たち</tips>は街の<tips=17>タイプB</tips>の代表者であった。","en":"They were the men who coordinated the <tips=17>Type Bs</tips> living in <tips=9>Y District</tips>. Just as <tips=35>José Fernandes</tips> led the Latin American immigrants and <tips=27>Liao Chi-ming</tips> the Hakka Chinese, these <tips=22>elders</tips> represented the city’s <tips=17>Type Bs</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r125","rowIndex":125,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　街の権力者であることにはかわりないが、それは、ギャングたちとは違うかたちでの権力である。","en":"They were still powerful figures in the city, though their power took a different form from the gangs’.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r126","rowIndex":126,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　暴力や経済力で人を支配するギャングの権力のあり方を表だとするならば、彼らのそれは裏と言うべきだろう。","en":"If the gangsters’ dominion through violence and economic strength was the visible face of power, the elders’ power was its hidden underside.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r127","rowIndex":127,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　世間で何かと差別されやすく、社会生活を営めない<tips=17>タイプB</tips>たちは、表社会での職業や身分とは別に、<tips=17>タイプB</tips>同士でネットワークを作り、情報や利益を共有している。その、いわば秘密組織の長が、この<tips=22>老人たち</tips>なのだ。","en":"Often subjected to discrimination and unable to lead ordinary social lives, <tips=17>Type Bs</tips> formed networks with other <tips=17>Type Bs</tips> apart from their jobs and standing in public society, sharing information and mutual advantage. These <tips=22>elders</tips> were the heads of what amounted to a secret organization.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r128","rowIndex":128,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　この<tips=9>Y地区</tips>において、<tips=17>タイプB</tips>は<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>にも警察にも街の商店にも存在する。この<tips=22>老人たち</tips>は、そういう街のあちこちに紛れ込んだ<tips=17>タイプB</tips>たちに影響力を持っているわけで、なかなか馬鹿にならない。","en":"Within <tips=9>Y District</tips>, <tips=17>Type Bs</tips> could be found in <tips=7>YS</tips>, the police, and shops throughout the city. The <tips=22>elders</tips> wielded influence over the <tips=17>Type Bs</tips> embedded across all those parts of city life, making them a force not to be underestimated.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r129","rowIndex":129,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　見かけによらず結構怖い爺さんがたなのである。","en":"They were rather frightening old men, whatever their appearance might suggest.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r130","rowIndex":130,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして、おれからすれば、困ったことに親もなく街角をうろついていたところを拾い育ててくれた、親のような存在であったりする。","en":"To complicate matters for me personally, they were also like parents. They had found me wandering the streets with no family, taken me in, and raised me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r131","rowIndex":131,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　さらに、<tips=71>グレートホール饅頭</tips>の起業資金の何割かも彼らから借りている。","en":"I had also borrowed part of the startup capital for the <tips=71>Great Hole buns</tips> business from them.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r132","rowIndex":132,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　だから、おれとしてはなかなか頭が上がらないところがあるのだ。","en":"After all that, it was hard for me to stand up to them.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r133","rowIndex":133,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「今日これから人と会います。お前には、それに立ちあってもらおうと思っているんですよ」","en":"“We are meeting someone today. I want you to be present.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ミスター・アーノルド","displayName":"Mr. Arnold","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r134","rowIndex":134,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=89>ミスター・アーノルド</tips>がパイプをふかしながらそう言った。","en":"<tips=89>Mr. Arnold</tips> said this as he puffed on his pipe.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r135","rowIndex":135,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「誰と会えって言うんです？」","en":"“Who do you want me to meet?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r136","rowIndex":136,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=10>道夫</tips>の知らない人間です。我々もはじめて会います」","en":"“It is someone <tips=10>Michio</tips> does not know. This will be our first meeting as well.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ミスター・アーノルド","displayName":"Mr. Arnold","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r137","rowIndex":137,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　悪い予感しかしない言い方だけれども、会わないわけにもいかない。","en":"The way he put it gave me nothing but a bad feeling, but I could hardly refuse to meet the person now.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r138","rowIndex":138,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　部屋に姿を現したのは、腰が曲がりステッキを突く白人の老人だった。","en":"The visitor who appeared in the room was an elderly white man, bent at the waist and leaning upon a walking stick.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r139","rowIndex":139,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「おお、お三方おそろいで、どうも。今日はお会いできて光栄ですネ」","en":"“Ah, all three gentlemen together. How do you do? It is an honor to meet you today.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エフゲニ・ヘス","displayName":"Yevgeny Hess","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r140","rowIndex":140,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　老人は枯れ枝のような手を差し出すと、三人の<tips=22>老人たち</tips>と握手をする。","en":"The old man extended a hand like a withered branch and shook hands with each of the three <tips=22>elders</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r141","rowIndex":141,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ようこそ。<tips=65>エフゲニ・ヘス</tips>さん。そこの椅子にお座りください」","en":"“Welcome, Mr. <tips=65>Yevgeny Hess</tips>. Please sit in that chair.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ミスター・アーノルド","displayName":"Mr. Arnold","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r142","rowIndex":142,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「アリガトウ。私のことは、エフゲニと気楽に呼んでクダサイ」","en":"“Thank you. Please, call me Yevgeny—there is no need for formality.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エフゲニ・ヘス","displayName":"Yevgeny Hess","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r143","rowIndex":143,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=90>ミスター・チェン</tips>が籐で編んだ椅子を勧めると、<tips=65>エフゲニ・ヘス</tips>と名乗ったその男は、その手で椅子の肘掛けを掴み、腰を労るような仕草を見せながら、ゆっくりと腰をおろした。","en":"When <tips=90>Mr. Chen</tips> offered him a wicker chair, the man who had introduced himself as <tips=65>Yevgeny Hess</tips> gripped its arm with that branch-like hand and slowly lowered himself into the seat, moving gingerly to spare his back.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r144","rowIndex":144,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　部屋にお爺ちゃんがまた一人増えてしまった。","en":"The room had gained yet another grandpa.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r145","rowIndex":145,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　エフゲニって名前からするとロシアの人間だろうか？　いや、ヘスって名前はドイツ語だっけ？","en":"Was he Russian, judging from the name Yevgeny? No—wasn’t Hess a German name?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r146","rowIndex":146,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　口元に蓄えた豊かな白いひげの感じからすると、ユダヤ人にも見える。","en":"His luxuriant white beard made me think he might be Jewish.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r147","rowIndex":147,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　大きな鷲鼻を持ち、張り出した額のしたの落ちくぼんだ眼窩の奥に、幾重にもシワのよったまぶたを眠そうに半開きにしていた。","en":"He had a large aquiline nose, and beneath his jutting brow, eyes buried deep in their sockets peered sleepily through half-open lids creased with layer upon layer of wrinkles.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r148","rowIndex":148,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「こちらは、私どもの息子の<tips=10>見土道夫</tips>です」","en":"“This is our son, <tips=10>Michio Mido</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ミスター・チェン","displayName":"Mr. Chen","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r149","rowIndex":149,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=90>ミスター・チェン</tips>はいつもの愛想の良い笑顔を浮かべながらおれを紹介する。","en":"<tips=90>Mr. Chen</tips> introduced me with his usual amiable smile.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r150","rowIndex":150,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=10>道夫</tips>です」","en":"“<tips=10>Michio</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r151","rowIndex":151,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　言って、おれは左手を差し出した。","en":"With that, I held out my left hand.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r152","rowIndex":152,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=65>ヘス</tips>は最初右手を出したが、おれが左手を引っ込める様子がないのを見ると、左手に変えて握手をした。","en":"<tips=65>Hess</tips> initially offered his right hand. When he saw that I had no intention of withdrawing my left, he changed hands and shook it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r153","rowIndex":153,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「その子は右手に<tips=77>特質変異</tips>がありましてネ」","en":"“The boy has a <tips=77>trait mutation</tips> in his right hand.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ミスター・チェン","displayName":"Mr. Chen","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r154","rowIndex":154,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=90>ミスター・チェン</tips>が説明してくれた。","en":"<tips=90>Mr. Chen</tips> explained for me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r155","rowIndex":155,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ナルホド、そうでしたか」","en":"“I see. So that is why.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エフゲニ・ヘス","displayName":"Yevgeny Hess","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r156","rowIndex":156,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=65>ヘス</tips>はチラとおれの右手を見てから頷く。","en":"<tips=65>Hess</tips> glanced at my right hand, then nodded.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r157","rowIndex":157,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「つまり、ハイブリッドということデスな」","en":"“In other words, he is a hybrid, then.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エフゲニ・ヘス","displayName":"Yevgeny Hess","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r158","rowIndex":158,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうです。……なかなか優秀な、うちの秘蔵っ子なんですヨ」","en":"“Yes. …He is an exceptional talent—our prized protégé.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ミスター・チェン","displayName":"Mr. Chen","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r159","rowIndex":159,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=90>ミスター・チェン</tips>がそう言ったところで、ハウスキーパーの佐藤さんが中国茶を淹れて持って来てくれた。","en":"As <tips=90>Mr. Chen</tips> said it, Mr. Sato, the housekeeper, entered with Chinese tea he had prepared for us.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r160","rowIndex":160,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=9>Y地区</tips>に来たのは久しぶりなんですが、随分変わってしまったもんデスネ」","en":"“It has been a long time since I visited <tips=9>Y District</tips>. The place has changed considerably.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エフゲニ・ヘス","displayName":"Yevgeny Hess","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r161","rowIndex":161,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=65>ヘス</tips>は眉間にしわを寄せ、","en":"<tips=65>Hess</tips> furrowed his brow.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r162","rowIndex":162,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=57>滑走路通り</tips>には世界のどこでも見られるようなチェーン店が増え、ブランドショップも店を開き……ナンダカ、平凡な街になってしまったような気がシマス」","en":"“<tips=57>Runway Street</tips> is filling with the same chain stores one finds anywhere in the world, and luxury brands have opened shops of their own... Somehow, I feel the city has become ordinary.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エフゲニ・ヘス","displayName":"Yevgeny Hess","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r163","rowIndex":163,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「この街を平凡と言う人には初めて会いましたヨ」","en":"“You are the first person I have met who calls this city ordinary.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ミスター・チェン","displayName":"Mr. Chen","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r164","rowIndex":164,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いや、語弊がありましたネ。昔と比べてという意味デス。昔はもっとオリジナリティにあふれていて、混沌としていて……自由を体現したような場所でした。随分と平和になってしまって……いや、それは良いことなんでしょう。そのおかげで、<tips=57>滑走路通り</tips>を歩く人種も大分かわりました。なんというか、平凡な人がたくさんやって来るようになったのデスな。まあ、活気があるのは良いことデス。私の故郷も<tips=8>グレートホール</tips>のそばなのですが、すっかり寂れてしまいまして。<tips=8>グレートホール</tips>と隣接していながらこれほど発展している街は、世界を探しても他にないでしょう」","en":"“No, I put that badly. I meant only compared with the past. It used to overflow with originality, with chaos... It was a place that seemed to embody freedom itself. Now it has grown remarkably peaceful... No, I suppose that is a good thing. Thanks to that, the kinds of people walking <tips=57>Runway Street</tips> have changed considerably too. How shall I put it? A great many ordinary people have begun coming here. Well, vitality is a good thing. My own homeland lies beside <tips=8>Great Hole</tips>, but it has fallen utterly into decline. Search the world and you will find no other city that has prospered to this degree while bordering <tips=8>Great Hole</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エフゲニ・ヘス","displayName":"Yevgeny Hess","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r165","rowIndex":165,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「随分と、この街にお詳しいようですな」","en":"“You appear to know a great deal about this city.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ミスター・アーノルド","displayName":"Mr. Arnold","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r166","rowIndex":166,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ええ、住んでいましたから。大分昔のことデスが……。世界中いろいろな場所を旅しましたけれど、定住しようと思ったのはここだけデス。危ないこともたくさんありましたが、どんなものでも平等に混じり合い、<tips=17>タイプB</tips>でも自然に暮らせる、素晴らしい街でした」","en":"“Yes. I once lived here, though it was long ago... I have traveled to many places around the world, but this was the only one where I wished to settle. There were many dangers, yet everything mingled here on equal terms, and even a <tips=17>Type B</tips> could live naturally. It was a marvelous city.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エフゲニ・ヘス","displayName":"Yevgeny Hess","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r167","rowIndex":167,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=65>ヘス</tips>はにこりともせずに言うと、鷲鼻の先をくっつけそうになりながらお茶を啜った。","en":"<tips=65>Hess</tips> spoke without the slightest smile, then sipped his tea with the tip of his aquiline nose nearly touching the cup.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r168","rowIndex":168,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そんな毒にも薬にもならぬような無意味な話はやめて、本題に入らせてもらってもいいですか？」","en":"“May we stop this pointless talk, which does neither harm nor good, and get to the matter at hand?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ミスター・スミス","displayName":"Mr. Smith","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r169","rowIndex":169,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　無愛想な態度で<tips=91>ミスター・スミス</tips>が割り込む。","en":"<tips=91>Mr. Smith</tips> cut in brusquely.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r170","rowIndex":170,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いやこれは失礼しました。まったくそのとおりデス。時は金なりとは、よく言ったものデスな」","en":"“No, forgive me. You are entirely correct. ‘Time is money,’ as the saying goes.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エフゲニ・ヘス","displayName":"Yevgeny Hess","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r171","rowIndex":171,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=65>ヘス</tips>はおどけて言うと、ジャケットの内ポケットから包みを取り出す。そして指先でつまみ上げてテーブルの上に並べたのは、透明な液体の入った三つのアンプルと、ティーバッグほどの大きさの透明なポリ袋に入れられた白い薬だった。","en":"After saying this in a playful tone, <tips=65>Hess</tips> removed a package from the inside pocket of his jacket. Pinched between his fingertips as he set them out on the table were three ampoules of clear liquid and a transparent plastic bag, about the size of a tea bag, containing a white drug.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r172","rowIndex":172,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「これが？」","en":"“Is this it?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ミスター・アーノルド","displayName":"Mr. Arnold","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r173","rowIndex":173,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=89>ミスター・アーノルド</tips>が促すと、<tips=65>ヘス</tips>は頷き、","en":"At <tips=89>Mr. Arnold’s</tips> prompting, <tips=65>Hess</tips> nodded, then said,","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r174","rowIndex":174,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そう、これが『<tips=46>ネオ・ローズ</tips>』です……」","en":"“Yes. This is ‘<tips=46>Neo Rose</tips>’...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エフゲニ・ヘス","displayName":"Yevgeny Hess","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r175","rowIndex":175,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　この怪しげな老人<tips=65>ヘス</tips>がやって来る、直前のことだった。","en":"The following had taken place just before this suspicious old man, <tips=65>Hess</tips>, arrived.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r176","rowIndex":176,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「その人物は『<tips=46>ネオ・ローズ</tips>』のレシピを知っていると言うんですよ」","en":"“This person claims to know the recipe for ‘<tips=46>Neo Rose</tips>.’”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ミスター・アーノルド","displayName":"Mr. Arnold","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r177","rowIndex":177,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=65>ヘス</tips>がやって来る直前、<tips=89>ミスター・アーノルド</tips>はそんなふうに説明してくれた。","en":"That was how <tips=89>Mr. Arnold</tips> had explained the matter shortly before <tips=65>Hess</tips> arrived.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r178","rowIndex":178,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まったく驚いたよ！　どこで知ったのだか知らないが、うちのホットラインに突然電話をかけてきて、一緒にその薬を製造、販売しないかと言うんだヨ。どういう人物なのかねえ」","en":"“It was astonishing! I do not know how this person learned about us, but they suddenly called our hotline and proposed that we manufacture and sell the drug together. What sort of person could this be?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ミスター・チェン","displayName":"Mr. Chen","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r179","rowIndex":179,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=90>ミスター・チェン</tips>は言って、首をひねる。","en":"<tips=90>Mr. Chen</tips> tilted his head as he spoke.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r180","rowIndex":180,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"『<tips=46>ネオ・ローズ</tips>』という名の新薬についてはおれも聞いたことがある。","en":"I had heard about the new drug called <tips=46>Neo Rose</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r181","rowIndex":181,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　かつて『<tips=45>ローズ</tips>』という薬があった。","en":"There had once been a drug called <tips=45>Rose</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r182","rowIndex":182,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　家庭用の製薬機で製造できる覚醒剤で、そのレシピがネットで公開されると同時に世界中で爆発的に流行した。","en":"It was a stimulant that could be manufactured with a home pharmaceutical synthesizer. When the recipe appeared online, its popularity exploded around the world.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r183","rowIndex":183,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　お手軽に製造できてお手軽に効果があらわれ、そしてお手軽に耐性がついてお手軽に廃人になれるという、なんとも短絡的な薬なのだけれども、<tips=17>タイプB</tips>発作による精神異常を取り除くという効果があった。","en":"Easy to make, easy to feel, easy to build a tolerance to, and easy to turn yourself into a human wreck with—it was convenience carried to its most appalling extreme. Yet it also eliminated the mental derangement caused by a <tips=17>Type B</tips> episode.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r184","rowIndex":184,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=17>タイプB</tips>の発作は、一般的な向精神薬でも抑えられたり、アンフェタミンやメタンフェタミンといったありふれた覚醒剤でも誤魔化すことは出来るのだけど、『<tips=45>ローズ</tips>』ほど劇的に<tips=17>タイプB</tips>を正気に戻す薬は他に存在しない。","en":"<tips=17>Type B</tips> episodes could sometimes be suppressed with ordinary psychotropic drugs or masked with commonplace stimulants such as amphetamine and methamphetamine. No other drug, however, could restore a <tips=17>Type B</tips> to sanity as dramatically as <tips=45>Rose</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r185","rowIndex":185,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しかも『<tips=45>ローズ</tips>』は、ただ症状を抑えるだけでなく、発作によって向上した身体能力を維持したまま正常な精神を取り戻させるのだ。つまり、『<tips=45>ローズ</tips>』を使用した<tips=17>タイプB</tips>は、発作の良いところだけを引き出せるのである。","en":"Furthermore, <tips=45>Rose</tips> did more than merely suppress the symptoms: it restored a sound mind while preserving the enhanced physical abilities produced by the episode. In other words, using <tips=45>Rose</tips> allowed a <tips=17>Type B</tips> to draw out only the beneficial effects of an episode.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r186","rowIndex":186,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そういうわけで、あまりにもひどい副作用のために今ではよほど重度のジャンキー以外は手を出すことがなくなった『<tips=45>ローズ</tips>』だが、重度の<tips=17>タイプB</tips>にとっては最後の切り札としてまま使われることがあった。","en":"Its side effects were so terrible that these days, no one but a hardcore addict would touch <tips=45>Rose</tips>. Nevertheless, people with severe <tips=17>Type B</tips> symptoms occasionally used it as a last resort.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r187","rowIndex":187,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それでも、使うべきではない薬なのだけれども。","en":"Even then, it was a drug no one ought to use.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r188","rowIndex":188,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　で、そこであらわれたのが『<tips=46>ネオ・ローズ</tips>』だ。","en":"Then <tips=46>Neo Rose</tips> appeared.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r189","rowIndex":189,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　この薬は、『<tips=45>ローズ</tips>』を<tips=17>タイプＢ</tips>用に改良した薬らしい。","en":"Supposedly, it was an adaptation of <tips=45>Rose</tips> designed for <tips=17>Type Bs</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r190","rowIndex":190,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　覚醒剤としての作用は『<tips=45>ローズ</tips>』よりも穏やかだが、<tips=17>タイプＢ</tips>発作を抑える力は同程度。そして筋肉注射によって、一ヶ月も二ヶ月も発作を抑え続けることも出来る。","en":"Its stimulant action was milder than <tips=45>Rose</tips>, but it suppressed <tips=17>Type B</tips> episodes with equal power. One intramuscular injection could hold an episode at bay for a month or even two.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r191","rowIndex":191,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　耐性がつかないわけではなく、廃人になるリスクがないわけではないけれども、ほとんどインスタント廃人製造機だった『<tips=45>ローズ</tips>』とは比較にならない。","en":"Tolerance could still develop, and the risk of becoming a human wreck had not vanished. But that was nothing compared with <tips=45>Rose</tips>, which had practically been an instant human-wreck machine.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r192","rowIndex":192,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　こう並べれば、まさしく発作に悩む<tips=17>タイプＢ</tips>の人生を変える夢の薬なわけだ。","en":"Put like that, it really was a wonder drug that could change the lives of <tips=17>Type Bs</tips> suffering from episodes.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r193","rowIndex":193,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　こうした噂のどの程度が真実なのかは知らないけれども。","en":"I had no idea how much of those rumors was true, of course.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r194","rowIndex":194,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どうも、眉唾ですねえ」","en":"“That sounds too good to be true.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r195","rowIndex":195,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おれは首をひねらざるを得ない。","en":"I could not help cocking my head in doubt.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r196","rowIndex":196,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"『<tips=46>ネオ・ローズ</tips>』というのは、その筋ではすぐに有名になったが、現物はほとんど出回っていない。実際のところ幻の薬と言って良く、現実に存在しないのではないかとも言われている。","en":"<tips=46>Neo Rose</tips> had quickly become famous in certain circles, but almost none of the substance itself circulated. In practical terms it was a phantom drug, and people even suggested it did not exist.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r197","rowIndex":197,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なんで、会ったこともない我々にそんな重要な話をもちかけるんですかね？　大体、おれはそんな都合のいい薬自体存在しないと思ってるんですけど。よくある、<tips=17>タイプＢ</tips>を騙して金を巻き上げようって言うどこかの詐欺師のネタが、伝言ゲームで現実みたいに言われるようになっただけでしょ」","en":"“Why would he bring something this important to people he’s never met? For that matter, I don’t believe any drug that convenient even exists. Some swindler somewhere invents a scheme to fleece <tips=17>Type Bs</tips>, and then a game of telephone turns it into something people talk about as though it were real. That’s all this is, isn’t it?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r198","rowIndex":198,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「私も似たような感想です。まったくもって信用出来ない話ですよ。しかし、その人物はサンプルとしての実物も用意すると言っています」","en":"“My own impression is similar. The affair is entirely untrustworthy. However, the man says he will provide the actual substance as a sample.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ミスター・アーノルド","displayName":"Mr. Arnold","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r199","rowIndex":199,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=89>ミスター・アーノルド</tips>は眉間にしわをよせ、腕組みをしている。","en":"<tips=89>Mr. Arnold</tips> folded his arms, a deep crease between his brows.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r200","rowIndex":200,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「たしかにうさんくさいのはわかるヨ？　具体的な話は、そのサンプルを見て、実際に我々の設備で製造したものが同程度の効果が出るかを確かめてということになるだろう。けれど、もし本当ならこれは我々にとっての福音となりうるじゃないか！　これはとんでもないことだヨ」","en":"“I understand perfectly well that it looks suspicious. Any concrete negotiation will have to wait until we examine the sample and confirm that a batch manufactured with our own equipment produces the same effect. But if it is genuine, it could become our salvation! The implications are tremendous.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ミスター・チェン","displayName":"Mr. Chen","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r201","rowIndex":201,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=90>ミスター・チェン</tips>は興奮を隠せない面持ちで言った。","en":"<tips=90>Mr. Chen</tips> could not conceal his excitement.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r202","rowIndex":202,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=22>老人たち</tips>の持つ裏の顔の一つに、薬物の製造と売買がある。麻薬や覚醒剤を買い入れ、街角で販売をする。また、家庭用製薬機を何十台も並べた『工場』を、<tips=9>Y地区</tips>およびその近隣にいくつも持ち、そこで作れるものは作って、商品としている。","en":"One of the <tips=22>elders</tips>’ hidden occupations was the manufacture and sale of drugs. They purchased narcotics and stimulants, then sold them on street corners. They also maintained several “factories” throughout <tips=9>Y District</tips> and its surroundings, each containing dozens of home pharmaceutical synthesizers. Whatever those machines could make, the elders manufactured and sold.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r203","rowIndex":203,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"『<tips=45>ローズ</tips>』こそ取り扱ってはいないものの、そうした薬物には<tips=17>タイプB</tips>症状に効果があるものも存在し、これらは、組織内のメンバーに格安で販売・配布されていた。","en":"They did not handle <tips=45>Rose</tips> itself, but some of their drugs relieved <tips=17>Type B</tips> symptoms, and these had been sold cheaply or distributed to members of the organization.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r204","rowIndex":204,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　これがあるため、組織に加入する<tips=17>タイプＢ</tips>は後を絶たないのだろう。","en":"Presumably, that benefit explained why <tips=17>Type Bs</tips> continued to join them.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r205","rowIndex":205,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>は麻薬の取引を行わないという内規のため、この<tips=9>Y地区</tips>で非合法薬物の販売を行えるのは、この<tips=22>老人たち</tips>の秘密グループだけなのだ。","en":"Because an internal rule forbade <tips=7>YS</tips> from trading in narcotics, the <tips=22>elders</tips>’ secret group was the only organization in a position to sell illegal drugs within <tips=9>Y District</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r206","rowIndex":206,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「確かに『<tips=46>ネオ・ローズ</tips>』を製造できるとなったら、とんでもないことだとは思うけれど……」","en":"“I agree that being able to manufacture <tips=46>Neo Rose</tips> would be tremendous, but...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r207","rowIndex":207,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　噂でしか聞いたことがないようなその夢の薬を自前で製造し、販売出来るとなれば、間違いなく<tips=22>老人たち</tips>の目玉商品となるだろう。","en":"If the <tips=22>elders</tips> could manufacture and sell for themselves a wonder drug they had only ever heard about in rumors, it would unquestionably become their flagship product.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r208","rowIndex":208,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　金銭的にも非常に魅力的だし、組織を構成する<tips=17>タイプＢ</tips>たちの人生も良くなるのかもしれない。","en":"The financial attraction was immense. Perhaps it would also improve the lives of the <tips=17>Type Bs</tips> who made up the organization.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r209","rowIndex":209,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しかしおれは、どうしても素直にうんと言えない。","en":"And yet I just could not bring myself to say yes.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r210","rowIndex":210,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　なぜって、そうした薬によって症状を抑えるという行動自体が好きじゃないんだ。","en":"The truth was, I disliked the very act of suppressing symptoms with drugs.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r211","rowIndex":211,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そりゃ症状は抑えられるかもしれないが、薬に頼れば薬の奴隷になる。薬物中毒になったら惨めなものだし、ならなくとも、薬を得るために生きるようになってしまう。そんな人間をたくさん見てきた。","en":"Sure, the symptoms might be suppressed, but rely on a drug and you became its slave. Drug addiction was a miserable thing; and even if you never became addicted, you could end up living for the sole purpose of obtaining the drug. I had seen plenty of people like that.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r212","rowIndex":212,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　発症したなら発症したで、症状とつき合っていけばいいじゃないか！","en":"If your symptoms manifested, then they manifested—why not learn to live with them!","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r213","rowIndex":213,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おれなどはそう思うのだけれども、実際まだ発症していないからそんな悠長なことを言っているだけなのか？　実際そうなったら考え方は変化してしまうのか？","en":"That was how I felt—but was I only able to talk so complacently because my own symptoms had not manifested yet? If they actually did, would my whole way of thinking change?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r214","rowIndex":214,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　何にしろ、発症していない以上は偉そうなことは言えない。","en":"Whatever the answer, as long as I had not developed symptoms, I had no right to talk as though I knew better.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r215","rowIndex":215,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　だから、滅多にそのあたりの判断について意見を言うことはないんだけれども、","en":"For that reason, I almost never voiced an opinion on judgments of that kind.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r216","rowIndex":216,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それは、どうかなあ」","en":"“I don’t know about that.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r217","rowIndex":217,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　さすがに今回は素直に肯けなかった。","en":"This time, however, I could not simply nod along.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r218","rowIndex":218,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「話自体がうさんくさいし、それに、これ以上薬とズブズブになるのはどうなんですか？　おれは、そういうやり方じゃなくて、発症して少しくらいおかしくなったって、仲良くやっていけるような街にしていく方がいいと思うんだ」","en":"“The whole proposition is suspicious. Besides, do we really want to become even more entangled with drugs? Instead of proceeding that way, I think it would be better to make this a city where we can still get along even after someone develops symptoms and becomes a little strange.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r219","rowIndex":219,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おれが言うと、<tips=89>ミスター・アーノルド</tips>は溜息をつき、","en":"When I finished, <tips=89>Mr. Arnold</tips> sighed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r220","rowIndex":220,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まったく、お前は現実味のないことばかりを言いますね。今までだって、悲惨な現実を沢山見てきたはずなのに、なぜそんなお気楽な考えなのですか」","en":"“Honestly, you say nothing but things divorced from reality. You have seen a great many horrors already, so why do you persist in such carefree thinking?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ミスター・アーノルド","displayName":"Mr. Arnold","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r221","rowIndex":221,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あははは、生まれつき馬鹿なんです。ほっといてください」","en":"“Ahahaha! I was born stupid. Leave me alone.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r222","rowIndex":222,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おれは笑ってみせてから、","en":"I laughed, then continued.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r223","rowIndex":223,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「でもそんなに現実味がないっすかね？　おれはそうは思わないんだけどなあ。確かに、発症すれば知的な程度が低くなって、ちょっとお馬鹿さんになっちゃうけど、人柄は前よりよくなるやつとかいるし。みんな、発症というものについて、ちょっと悲劇的に考えすぎなような……」","en":"“But is it really that unrealistic? I don’t think so. Sure, when someone’s symptoms manifest, their intellectual level drops and they get a little silly. But some people actually become nicer than they were before. Sometimes I think everyone looks at the onset of symptoms a little too tragically...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r224","rowIndex":224,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=10>道夫</tips>の考え方はいつもユニークだと思うヨ。でも、もっと簡単に、こう考えたらどうだい？」","en":"“Your way of thinking is always unique, <tips=10>Michio</tips>. But why not consider the matter more simply?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ミスター・チェン","displayName":"Mr. Chen","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r225","rowIndex":225,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=90>ミスター・チェン</tips>は笑顔のまま指を一本立て、","en":"Still smiling, <tips=90>Mr. Chen</tips> raised one finger.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r226","rowIndex":226,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=10>道夫</tips>が饅頭屋を一年営業して得た利益を、我々の商売なら一日で得ることが出来るし、『<tips=46>ネオ・ローズ</tips>』が手に入ればもっと簡単に手に入れることが出来るよね。これだけあればどれだけ助かる人がいると思う？　金に善悪はないんだヨ」","en":"“Our business can earn in one day what <tips=10>your</tips> bun shop earns in a year. With <tips=46>Neo Rose</tips>, we could earn it even more easily. Imagine how many people that money could help. Money itself is neither good nor evil.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ミスター・チェン","displayName":"Mr. Chen","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r227","rowIndex":227,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そんなことはおれだってわかってますが……。それとは別のやり方も我々には必要だっていう……」","en":"“I understand that as well as anyone... I’m saying that we also need another way...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r228","rowIndex":228,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「我々も、その<tips=10>道夫</tips>の言い分を理解してるから、好きにやらせてるんじゃないカ」","en":"“We understand your position too, <tips=10>Michio</tips>. Isn’t that why we let you do as you please?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ミスター・チェン","displayName":"Mr. Chen","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r229","rowIndex":229,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……それは、感謝してます」","en":"“...And I’m grateful for it.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r230","rowIndex":230,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「だったら、<tips=10>道夫</tips>にも協力してほしいモンダヨ。我々だって、好き好んで麻薬を売り買いしてるわけじゃないんだ」","en":"“Then we would like <tips=10>your</tips> cooperation too. We do not buy and sell narcotics because we enjoy it.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ミスター・チェン","displayName":"Mr. Chen","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r231","rowIndex":231,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……協力しないとは言っていませんが……」","en":"“...I didn’t say I wouldn’t cooperate...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r232","rowIndex":232,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そう言って黙り込むおれを、<tips=90>ミスター・チェン</tips>は優しい笑顔で、<tips=89>ミスター・アーノルド</tips>は呆れたような顔つきで、<tips=91>ミスター・スミス</tips>は信頼したまっすぐな目で見つめている。","en":"When I fell silent, <tips=90>Mr. Chen</tips> watched me with a kindly smile, <tips=89>Mr. Arnold</tips> with an exasperated expression, and <tips=91>Mr. Smith</tips> with a direct and trusting gaze.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r233","rowIndex":233,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おれは溜息をつき、","en":"I sighed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r234","rowIndex":234,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そもそも、おれに何をさせようって言うんです？」","en":"“What exactly is it you expect me to do?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r235","rowIndex":235,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「我々ももう年だからネ。もし今回の取引が成立したら、そのあとの企画は、<tips=10>道夫</tips>がリーダーとなって進めて欲しいんだヨ」","en":"“We are old men now. If this deal goes through, we want <tips=10>you</tips> to take charge of the project from then on.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ミスター・チェン","displayName":"Mr. Chen","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r236","rowIndex":236,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=90>ミスター・チェン</tips>は言う。他の二人が何も言わないところを見ると、あらかじめ決めてあった話なのだろう。","en":"<tips=90>Mr. Chen</tips> said it. Judging from the other two men’s silence, they must have decided on this beforehand.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r237","rowIndex":237,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そしてゆくゆくは、この組織を率いて、<tips=9>Y地区</tips>の<tips=17>タイプＢ</tips>たちを導いてほしいネ」","en":"“And in time, we want you to lead this organization and guide the <tips=17>Type Bs</tips> of <tips=9>Y District</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ミスター・チェン","displayName":"Mr. Chen","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r238","rowIndex":238,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そんな話、はじめて聞きましたけど？」","en":"“This is the first I’ve heard of any of that!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r239","rowIndex":239,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　街の饅頭屋さんになりたかったのに、街の麻薬屋さんになるだなんてとんでもない！","en":"I wanted to become the city’s bun dealer, and now they meant to turn me into its drug dealer!","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r240","rowIndex":240,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　まんじゅうと、まやくで、語感はちょっと似てるけど、やることは全然違うように思うんだけれども！","en":"Manju and mayaku—buns and drugs—might sound a little alike, but I was pretty sure the work could not be more different!","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r241","rowIndex":241,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しかし、そんなおれの内心の葛藤と、三人の老人の思惑はまったく無関係だった。","en":"But my inner struggle had nothing at all to do with what the three old men had in mind.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r242","rowIndex":242,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>も<tips=81>龍頭</tips>が死んで、息子がリーダーになると言います。我々もそろそろ世代交代をしなければいけないでしょう。まあ、お前がその地位に就く前に、我々も仕事をしなきゃいけませんが。これから<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>は混乱するだろうし、そうなれば我々の稼ぎ時です」","en":"“<tips=7>YS</tips> has lost its <tips=81>Longtou</tips>, too, and they say his son will become the leader. We must soon hand things over to the next generation as well. Of course, we still have work to do before you assume that position. <tips=7>YS</tips> will descend into disorder, and when it does, that will be our time to make money.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ミスター・アーノルド","displayName":"Mr. Arnold","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r243","rowIndex":243,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=89>ミスター・アーノルド</tips>が意地悪く笑うと、","en":"<tips=89>Mr. Arnold</tips> gave a mean little smile.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r244","rowIndex":244,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>は賢明だったネ。我々の力をよく理解し、丁重に扱ってくれた。でも、<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>の残りの連中はどうだろう。なかなか、仲良くなれないような気がするんだヨ。とても残念だネ」","en":"“<tips=3>Chris Tse</tips> was a wise man. He understood our power and treated us with due respect. But what of the people remaining in <tips=7>YS</tips>? I have a feeling we may not find it so easy to become friends. Most regrettable.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ミスター・チェン","displayName":"Mr. Chen","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r245","rowIndex":245,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=90>ミスター・チェン</tips>は言葉とは裏腹にニコニコと笑いながら言い、","en":"<tips=90>Mr. Chen</tips> said this with a cheerful smile that belied his words.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r246","rowIndex":246,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=10>道夫</tips>。時代は動こうとしているんだ」","en":"“<tips=10>Michio</tips>. The times are about to change.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ミスター・スミス","displayName":"Mr. Smith","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r247","rowIndex":247,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=91>ミスター・スミス</tips>までも、芝居がかった台詞を口にして遠くを眺めるのだった。","en":"Even <tips=91>Mr. Smith</tips> came out with this theatrical line, then gazed into the distance.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r248","rowIndex":248,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おれはその三人の老人の目が、同じような欲望と野心で輝いているのを見て、なんとも言えない複雑な気持ちになったものだった。","en":"Seeing all three elders’ eyes shine with the same desire and ambition left me with feelings I could not begin to sort out.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r249","rowIndex":249,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　で、その問題の『<tips=46>ネオ・ローズ</tips>』を、<tips=65>ヘス</tips>はこうしておれたちの目の前に示したのである。","en":"And now <tips=65>Hess</tips> had produced the <tips=46>Neo Rose</tips> in question before our very eyes.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r250","rowIndex":250,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「こちらのガラス瓶が、筋肉注射用のデポ剤が入ったアンプルデス。これはお尻に注射する薬。発症してしまった者でも、一度注射すれば二週間くらいは症状を抑えられます。注意事項としては、右のお尻に打ったら、次は左のお尻といった具合に、交互に打つことデスネー。それだけ守れば、トテモ安全に、簡単に、症状から解放されます」","en":"“These glass vials are ampoules containing a depot formulation for intramuscular injection. The drug is injected into the buttocks. Even for someone whose symptoms have already manifested, one injection will suppress them for roughly two weeks. There is one precaution: if you inject the right buttock, use the left the next time, and continue alternating between them. Follow that one rule and you can be freed from your symptoms simply and very safely.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エフゲニ・ヘス","displayName":"Yevgeny Hess","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r251","rowIndex":251,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=65>ヘス</tips>は節くれ立った指でアンプルの小瓶をつまんで見せながら説明する。次にポリ袋をつまみ上げ、","en":"<tips=65>Hess</tips> held up one of the small ampoules between his gnarled fingers as he explained. Next he lifted the plastic pouch.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r252","rowIndex":252,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「こっちは粉末で、生理食塩水などに溶かして静脈注射してもいいし、そのまま口から飲んでも効果が出ますネ。とにかく即効性が売りデス。症状が出ている者に飲ませれば、すぐにそれは消えるでしょう」","en":"“This one is a powder. You may dissolve it in saline solution and inject it intravenously, or swallow it as it is. Above all, its selling point is how quickly it acts. Give it to someone in the midst of an episode and the symptoms will disappear at once.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エフゲニ・ヘス","displayName":"Yevgeny Hess","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r253","rowIndex":253,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それは素晴らしい！　でも、本当に、そんなによく効くものなんでしょうかねえ」","en":"“How wonderful! But can it truly be so effective?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ミスター・チェン","displayName":"Mr. Chen","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r254","rowIndex":254,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=90>ミスター・チェン</tips>は首をかしげる。","en":"<tips=90>Mr. Chen</tips> tilted his head.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r255","rowIndex":255,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「『<tips=45>ローズ</tips>』を使ったことがありますか？　あれと同程度の効果が期待出来ます」","en":"“Have you ever used <tips=45>Rose</tips>? You can expect comparable effects.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エフゲニ・ヘス","displayName":"Yevgeny Hess","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r256","rowIndex":256,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おれたちは今日本語で会話をしているんだけれども、<tips=65>ヘス</tips>の発音は若干カタコトではあるものの、語彙は並の日本人より難解なものを扱う。","en":"We were conversing in Japanese. <tips=65>Hess</tips> spoke it somewhat brokenly, but used vocabulary more sophisticated than the average Japanese speaker’s.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r257","rowIndex":257,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　カタコトのなまりにしても、どこか特定の言語の影響が感じられるというわけでもない。名前からすればロシア系にも思えるが、しかしおれの知っているロシア人はこんななまりかたをしない。","en":"Nothing in his unusual accent seemed to reflect the influence of any particular language. His name suggested a Russian origin, but none of the Russians I knew spoke this way.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r258","rowIndex":258,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　どうにも不可思議な人間だ。","en":"I could make nothing of him.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r259","rowIndex":259,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「依存性は？　噂が確かならば、そのあたりも大分改善されているはずだが」","en":"“What about dependence? If the rumors are correct, that too should have been greatly improved.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ミスター・アーノルド","displayName":"Mr. Arnold","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r260","rowIndex":260,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=89>ミスター・アーノルド</tips>が率直に相手の目を見て質問する。","en":"<tips=89>Mr. Arnold</tips> looked directly into the visitor’s eyes and asked the question without preamble.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r261","rowIndex":261,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「『<tips=45>ローズ</tips>』のひどさを考えれば、劇的に改善はされています。ただ、率直に申し上げて、それでも無視出来るレベルまで低減されたわけではありマせん。薬が抜けるときは倦怠感や疲労感といった副作用も出ますし、濫用は危険デス。ただ、適切に使用すれば、長いつき合いが出来る薬となるでしょう」","en":"“Compared with the horrors of <tips=45>Rose</tips>, it is a dramatic improvement. Frankly, however, the risk has still not been reduced to a negligible level. As the drug wears off, side effects such as lethargy and fatigue occur, and abuse is dangerous. Used properly, however, it should prove suitable for the long term.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エフゲニ・ヘス","displayName":"Yevgeny Hess","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r262","rowIndex":262,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「人並みの寿命を生きるとして、一生使い続けることが出来るのか？」","en":"“Assuming a normal lifespan, could someone continue using it for life?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ミスター・アーノルド","displayName":"Mr. Arnold","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r263","rowIndex":263,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「新しい薬なので長期的なデータはありませんが、適量を守っているかぎりは、最低五年は問題なく健康に過ごせることがわかっていマス。もちろん、今後経過が観察されるにつれて、保証期間は長くなるでしょう。何十年も経てばデータは出揃うでしょうが、それまで待ちますか？」","en":"“Because it is a new medicine, there are no long-term data. But we know that, so long as the proper dosage is observed, a person can remain healthy without difficulty for at least five years. Of course, as observation continues, the period we can guarantee will grow longer. In a few decades, the data will be complete—but do you intend to wait until then?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エフゲニ・ヘス","displayName":"Yevgeny Hess","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r264","rowIndex":264,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「本当に『<tips=45>ローズ</tips>』と同じレベルで症状を消せるなら、使う価値はありそうですね」","en":"“If it truly eliminates the symptoms as effectively as <tips=45>Rose</tips>, it sounds worth using.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ミスター・アーノルド","displayName":"Mr. Arnold","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r265","rowIndex":265,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=89>ミスター・アーノルド</tips>は慎重に言葉を選びながら、","en":"<tips=89>Mr. Arnold</tips> selected his words carefully.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r266","rowIndex":266,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「しかし、実際に取引を行うかどうかは、あなたが信用出来ると確信出来てからです」","en":"“However, we will conduct no actual transaction until we are certain that you can be trusted.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ミスター・アーノルド","displayName":"Mr. Arnold","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r267","rowIndex":267,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「もちろんデス。もちろんデスとも！　そのためにこのサンプルをお持ちしたんデス。これを発症者に使って、どうぞ効き目を実感してください」","en":"“Of course. Of course! That is precisely why I brought these samples. Administer one to someone whose symptoms have manifested and experience its effectiveness for yourselves.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エフゲニ・ヘス","displayName":"Yevgeny Hess","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r268","rowIndex":268,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=65>ヘス</tips>が笑うと、ひげの間に黄色い乱杭歯がヌッとあらわれた。","en":"When <tips=65>Hess</tips> smiled, crooked yellow teeth jutted into view through his beard.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r269","rowIndex":269,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうしてくれないと困ります。で、完全に確認がとれる五年後まで待っていただけるのですか？」","en":"“That is essential. And are you willing to wait until five years from now, when we can confirm it completely?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ミスター・アーノルド","displayName":"Mr. Arnold","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r270","rowIndex":270,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=89>ミスター・アーノルド</tips>は薄笑いを浮かべながら言う。","en":"<tips=89>Mr. Arnold</tips> spoke with a thin smile.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r271","rowIndex":271,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そればかりは信じて頂く他ないのデスが、まあ、数回使えば、たとえ数年使えることに確証がなくとも、充分魅力的な薬であることがおわかりになるでしょう。これは完璧な薬ではないデスが、忌まわしい薬や症状に縛られている<tips=17>タイプB</tips>を解放し、より豊かな人生を提供する程度の能力はあります。そして何より、あなたたちには莫大な富をもたらすはずデス」","en":"“On that point you can only trust me. Still, after using it several times, you will understand that the drug is attractive enough even without certainty about years of use. It is not a perfect medicine, but it can liberate <tips=17>Type Bs</tips> from the hateful drugs and symptoms that bind them and offer them richer lives. And most importantly, it should bring you enormous wealth.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エフゲニ・ヘス","displayName":"Yevgeny Hess","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r272","rowIndex":272,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=65>ヘス</tips>は自信に満ちた口ぶりで、丁重な言葉ながらもプライドの高さを感じさせた。","en":"<tips=65>Hess</tips> spoke with complete confidence. His language remained courteous, but his pride was unmistakable.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r273","rowIndex":273,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　歯は汚いが身なりは上品で清潔だし、見かけだけならそれなりに身分のある人間にも見える。","en":"His teeth were filthy, but his clothing was elegant and clean. By appearances alone, he might have been a man of some social standing.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r274","rowIndex":274,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いやあ、結構、結構。それでは私どもで預からせて頂くとしましょう」","en":"“Excellent, excellent. Then we shall take these samples into our care.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ミスター・チェン","displayName":"Mr. Chen","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r275","rowIndex":275,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=90>ミスター・チェン</tips>は執り成すように笑顔で割り込むと、","en":"<tips=90>Mr. Chen</tips> broke in with a conciliatory smile.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r276","rowIndex":276,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「しかし、こんなどこでもお目にかかることの出来ないものを取り扱うだなんて、驚きです。不躾ですが、あなたは一体どんな方なので？」","en":"“Still, it is astonishing that you should be dealing in something impossible to find anywhere else. Forgive my bluntness, but who exactly are you?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ミスター・チェン","displayName":"Mr. Chen","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r277","rowIndex":277,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「身分を明かすことは出来ないのデスが……」","en":"“I cannot reveal my identity...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エフゲニ・ヘス","displayName":"Yevgeny Hess","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r278","rowIndex":278,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「もちろんです。もちろんですとも。差し支えのない範囲で結構です」","en":"“Of course. Of course. Whatever you are free to disclose will suffice.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ミスター・チェン","displayName":"Mr. Chen","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r279","rowIndex":279,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「この薬を開発した連中と、個人的なつき合いがありましてネ。それに関しては詳しくお話出来ないので恐縮デスが……」","en":"“I have personal connections with the people who developed this medicine. I regret that I cannot tell you more about that…”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エフゲニ・ヘス","displayName":"Yevgeny Hess","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r280","rowIndex":280,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まあそうでしょうな。しかし、これはとても貴重なものでしょう？　大企業や国家を相手に交渉出来る材料だ。こんなかたちで我々に売ってしまっては、お知り合いも怒るのではないですか？」","en":"“I suppose so. But this must be extremely valuable, mustn’t it? It would give you leverage in negotiations with major corporations or even nations. Wouldn’t your associates be angry if you simply sold it to us this way?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ミスター・チェン","displayName":"Mr. Chen","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r281","rowIndex":281,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「問題ありません。私と彼らは、まあ一口で言えない関係デスから。……それに私は、大企業だのなんだのとは付き合いたくない。こうして、患者さんの多い町を世界中歩き回って、直接お売りするのが喜びなんデス」","en":"“There is no problem. My relationship with them is, well, not something I can sum up in a few words. …Besides, I want nothing to do with major corporations and the like. My joy is to travel the world this way, visiting cities with many patients and selling to them directly.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エフゲニ・ヘス","displayName":"Yevgeny Hess","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r282","rowIndex":282,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうですか」","en":"“I see.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ミスター・チェン","displayName":"Mr. Chen","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r283","rowIndex":283,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=90>ミスター・チェン</tips>は笑顔を崩さなかったが、<tips=65>ヘス</tips>の返事に満足しているわけではないのはその顔を見ればわかる。","en":"<tips=90>Mr. Chen’s</tips> smile did not waver, but one look at his face made it clear that <tips=65>Hess’s</tips> answer had not satisfied him.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r284","rowIndex":284,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　まあそうだろう。おれだって、こんな話を聞けば何かわけありだとしか思えない。","en":"No wonder. Even I could tell, after hearing a story like that, that there had to be more behind it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r285","rowIndex":285,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「もっと詳しい話は、実際使用して効果を確認出来てからにしましょうか。その前にごちゃごちゃ話しても仕方がありません。それではこの場はおしまいにしようと思いますが……<tips=10>道夫</tips>はまだ何も言っていませんね。最後に何か質問はありますか？」","en":"“Why don’t we leave the detailed discussion until after we have actually used it and confirmed its effects? There is no point making a great fuss before then. I think we can conclude the meeting here... But <tips=10>Michio</tips> has not said anything yet. Do you have one final question?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ミスター・アーノルド","displayName":"Mr. Arnold","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r286","rowIndex":286,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=89>ミスター・アーノルド</tips>はそう言っておれに話を向ける。","en":"<tips=89>Mr. Arnold</tips> turned the conversation toward me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r287","rowIndex":287,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「じゃあ、聞きます」","en":"“Then I’ll ask.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r288","rowIndex":288,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おれは疑問と言うか、なんとなくひっかかっていたことを彼に尋ねることにした。","en":"I decided to ask him about something that was not quite a question, but had been vaguely nagging at me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r289","rowIndex":289,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ちょっと関係ない話なんですけれど、さっき、この辺りで見かけない女の子が家の前をうろうろしていたんですが、お連れかなにかですか？」","en":"“This is a little off topic, but there was a girl I had never seen in this area wandering outside the house a short time ago. Is she with you?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r290","rowIndex":290,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「女の子？」","en":"“A girl?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エフゲニ・ヘス","displayName":"Yevgeny Hess","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r291","rowIndex":291,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「サイズのあわない大きなレインコートを着た、金髪の女の子です。とても綺麗な……」","en":"“A blond girl wearing an oversized raincoat. She was extraordinarily beautiful...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r292","rowIndex":292,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いや、知りませんな。ここに来たのは私一人デス」","en":"“No. I do not know her. I came here alone.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エフゲニ・ヘス","displayName":"Yevgeny Hess","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r293","rowIndex":293,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=65>ヘス</tips>は首をひねる。","en":"<tips=65>Hess</tips> tilted his head.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r294","rowIndex":294,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あともう一つ、いいですか？」","en":"“May I ask one more thing?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r295","rowIndex":295,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どうぞ」","en":"“Please.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エフゲニ・ヘス","displayName":"Yevgeny Hess","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r296","rowIndex":296,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あなたは目にカラーコンタクトをしているようですが」","en":"“You appear to be wearing colored contact lenses.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r297","rowIndex":297,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ああ、お気づきでしたか。見分けにくいものを付けていたつもりなのデスが……」","en":"“Ah, you noticed. I believed I had chosen a kind that was difficult to detect...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エフゲニ・ヘス","displayName":"Yevgeny Hess","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r298","rowIndex":298,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「おれ、目はすごくいいんです。それ、<tips=17>タイプＢ</tips>用の新しいやつですよね？」","en":"“I’ve got very sharp eyes. Those are the new lenses for <tips=17>Type Bs</tips>, aren’t they?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r299","rowIndex":299,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ええ、ええ、そうデス」","en":"“Yes, yes, that’s right.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エフゲニ・ヘス","displayName":"Yevgeny Hess","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r300","rowIndex":300,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ちょっと、取ってみてもらえませんか？」","en":"“Would you mind removing them?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r301","rowIndex":301,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=10>道夫</tips>、それは失礼な……」","en":"“<tips=10>Michio</tips>, that is discourteous...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ミスター・チェン","displayName":"Mr. Chen","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r302","rowIndex":302,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いや、やっていただきましょう」","en":"“No. Let us have you do it.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ミスター・スミス","displayName":"Mr. Smith","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r303","rowIndex":303,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　口を挟もうとした<tips=90>ミスター・チェン</tips>の言葉を、<tips=91>ミスター・スミス</tips>がさらに遮った。","en":"<tips=91>Mr. Smith</tips> cut off <tips=90>Mr. Chen</tips> as he tried to interject.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r304","rowIndex":304,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうデスネ。これも、私を信用して頂くためには都合がいいかもしれません」","en":"“Yes. Perhaps this will help you trust me.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エフゲニ・ヘス","displayName":"Yevgeny Hess","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r305","rowIndex":305,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=65>ヘス</tips>は何でもなく笑い、そして指先をまぶたの間に突っ込むと、コンタクトレンズをつまみとった。","en":"<tips=65>Hess</tips> smiled as though it were nothing, then slipped a fingertip between his eyelids and pinched out the contact lenses.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r306","rowIndex":306,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それは……」","en":"“Those are...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ミスター・チェン","displayName":"Mr. Chen","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r307","rowIndex":307,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=90>ミスター・チェン</tips>は声をあげ、他の二人の老人も息をのんだ。","en":"<tips=90>Mr. Chen</tips> exclaimed, and the other two elders caught their breath.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r308","rowIndex":308,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　レンズの下からあらわれた、彼の本当の瞳は、金色に輝いていたのである。","en":"His true eyes, revealed beneath the lenses, shone gold.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r309","rowIndex":309,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「私も発症者なんです。そして、『<tips=46>ネオ・ローズ</tips>』の使用者でもある」","en":"“I’ve developed symptoms myself. I’m also a user of <tips=46>Neo Rose</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エフゲニ・ヘス","displayName":"Yevgeny Hess","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r310","rowIndex":310,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「確かに、『<tips=45>ローズ</tips>』を使用したものは<tips=95>金眼現象</tips>が発現するが、それだけでは何かを証明したことにはならない」","en":"“It is true that those who use <tips=45>Rose</tips> exhibit the <tips=95>golden-eye phenomenon</tips>, but that alone proves nothing.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ミスター・スミス","displayName":"Mr. Smith","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r311","rowIndex":311,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=95>金眼</tips>につきものの過度な興奮や、精神症状が、今の私にあらわれているように見えますか？」","en":"“Do I appear now to be showing the excessive excitement or psychiatric symptoms that ordinarily accompany <tips=95>golden eyes</tips>?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エフゲニ・ヘス","displayName":"Yevgeny Hess","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r312","rowIndex":312,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それくらいなら、訓練で同じことが出来る」","en":"“The same thing can be achieved through training.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ミスター・スミス","displayName":"Mr. Smith","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r313","rowIndex":313,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「フフ、疑い深いものデスな」","en":"“Heh-heh. How distrustful you are.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エフゲニ・ヘス","displayName":"Yevgeny Hess","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r314","rowIndex":314,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=65>ヘス</tips>は不敵に笑い、","en":"<tips=65>Hess</tips> smiled defiantly and said,","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r315","rowIndex":315,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「とにかくサンプルを試して頂くのが一番デス。……今日はこれくらいにしておきましょう。このあと、ちょっと片付けたい野暮用があります」","en":"“In any event, the best thing is for you to test the samples. ...Let us leave matters there for today. I have a tiresome little errand to take care of afterward.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エフゲニ・ヘス","displayName":"Yevgeny Hess","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r316","rowIndex":316,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　言うと、ポケットから新しいコンタクトレンズを取り出し、金色の瞳に装着した。","en":"With that, Hess removed a new pair of contact lenses from his pocket and placed them over his golden eyes.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r317","rowIndex":317,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=22>老人たち</tips>の家を出て、すぐに饅頭売りに戻る気にもなれず、<tips=57>滑走路通り</tips>の喧噪のなかをぶらぶらとうろついた。","en":"After leaving the <tips=22>elders</tips>’ house, I could not bring myself to go straight back to selling buns. Instead, I wandered aimlessly through the commotion of <tips=57>Runway Street</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r318","rowIndex":318,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>の大行列が去って、もう<tips=57>滑走路通り</tips>は日常を取り戻している。雨も<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>と共に去ってしまったが、まだ重苦しい雲がどんよりと覆っている。","en":"The great procession of <tips=7>YS</tips> had departed, and <tips=57>Runway Street</tips> had already returned to ordinary life. The rain had left with <tips=7>YS</tips>, though heavy, oppressive clouds still blanketed the sky.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r319","rowIndex":319,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そう、おれの今の気持ちと同じように。","en":"Yes—just like the way I felt.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r320","rowIndex":320,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=46>ネオ・ローズ</tips>が本物ならば、喜んだ方がいいのだろうけれども、どうもそんな気にはなれない。","en":"If <tips=46>Neo Rose</tips> was genuine, perhaps I ought to have been pleased. Somehow, I could not feel that way.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r321","rowIndex":321,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　まず何よりも、あの年寄りたちの強欲っぷりといったら！","en":"First of all, the greed of those old men!","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r322","rowIndex":322,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=17>タイプB</tips>の仲間のため、という言葉は口先だけではないだろうが、しかし富と力に目がくらんでいるのも事実だろう。","en":"Their talk of helping their fellow <tips=17>Type Bs</tips> was surely more than mere lip service. But it was equally true that wealth and power had blinded them.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r323","rowIndex":323,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=46>ネオ・ローズ</tips>を製造販売すれば、資金は倍増するだろうし、現在発作で悩む連中が<tips=17>タイプB</tips>発作の良いところだけを残したスーパーマンになる。そして、街で最大のライバルと目される<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>はボスが死んだばかりだ！","en":"Manufacturing and selling <tips=46>Neo Rose</tips> would multiply their funds and turn everyone currently troubled by episodes into supermen who retained only the beneficial aspects of <tips=17>Type B</tips> episodes. And <tips=7>YS</tips>, regarded as their greatest rival in the city, had only just lost its boss!","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r324","rowIndex":324,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そうはっきりとは言わなかったが、あの老人どもは年甲斐もなく、野望がもたげてきたんじゃないだろうか？　今では大人しくやっているが、昔はこの<tips=21>八龍会</tips>もギャングのように武装して、覇権を争っていたと言うし。","en":"They had never said so outright, but hadn’t ambition begun to stir again in those old men, old as they were? They behaved themselves now, but I had heard that in the old days the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips> had armed itself like a gang and fought for supremacy.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r325","rowIndex":325,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=65>ヘス</tips>が帰った後、三人でにんまり笑った顔は、間違いなくそう物語っていた。","en":"The knowing grins on all three faces after <tips=65>Hess</tips> left told me so beyond any doubt.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r326","rowIndex":326,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しかも、組織の新しいボスをおれにするだって？　そういう体制で、<tips=1>亮</tips>を新しい<tips=81>龍頭</tips>に据えた<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>と対立しろっていうのか？","en":"And they intended to make me the organization’s new boss? Was that supposed to put me in opposition to <tips=7>YS</tips>, with <tips=1>Ryo</tips> installed as its new <tips=81>Longtou</tips>?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r327","rowIndex":327,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　冗談じゃない！","en":"Absolutely not!","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r328","rowIndex":328,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おれは麻薬よりも饅頭を売りたいんだよ。","en":"I wanted to sell buns, not drugs.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r329","rowIndex":329,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=22>老人たち</tips>のところでごちゃごちゃやっていたせいですっかり食事の時を逃してしまった。腹が減ったので、知り合いの屋台で軽食を買う。","en":"All that business at the <tips=22>elders</tips>’ house had made me miss mealtime entirely. Hungry, I bought a snack from a street vendor I knew.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r330","rowIndex":330,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　甘辛いタレをたっぷりつけて焼いた羊肉を、甘味のないパンで挟んだもので、何年も前から売り続けていたのだけれど、去年雑誌か何かで紹介され、それ以来人気商品としていつも行列が出来ている。<tips=59>暗闇通り</tips>のそばのやっすいプレハブに住んでいた店員夫婦は、地区の北側の一等地に庭付きの４LDKを買った。","en":"It was lamb grilled in a generous coating of sweet-and-savory sauce and sandwiched between pieces of unsweetened bread. The stall had sold it for years, but a magazine or something featured the dish the previous year, and ever since, the now-famous product had drawn a constant line. The married couple who ran the stall had once lived in a cheap prefabricated house near <tips=59>Darkness Street</tips>, but they had since bought a prime property on the district’s north side: a four-bedroom home with living and dining rooms, a kitchen, and even a garden.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r331","rowIndex":331,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　きっかけこそ雑誌でも、商品の出来がいいから今でも売れ続けているのだろう。","en":"The magazine might have provided the break, but the food’s quality must be why it continued to sell.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r332","rowIndex":332,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　願わくば、おれの<tips=71>グレートホール饅頭</tips>もこのような商品になってほしいものだ。","en":"If only my <tips=71>Great Hole buns</tips> could become a product like that one day.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r333","rowIndex":333,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それにしたって、『<tips=46>ネオ・ローズ</tips>』だ！","en":"But <tips=46>Neo Rose</tips>!","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r334","rowIndex":334,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ベンチを探したが空いている場所がなかった。おれは階段の一番下のところの段を椅子がわりに腰掛けると、とりあえず軽食は脇に置き、<tips=22>老人たち</tips>の家で貰ってきた紙袋を取り出した。","en":"I searched for a bench but found no free seat. I used the bottom step of a stairway as a chair, set my snack beside me for the moment, and took out the paper bag I had received at the <tips=22>elders</tips>’ house.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r335","rowIndex":335,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして中に入っているアンプルの一本をつまみとって光に当てる。","en":"I took one ampoule from inside and held it up to the light.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r336","rowIndex":336,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=65>ヘス</tips>が帰った後、発症してすっかり気が狂い、あとはもう処分を待つだけだった犬に使ってみたら、瞬く間に正気を取り戻した。","en":"After <tips=65>Hess</tips> departed, we tried it on a dog whose symptoms had manifested and driven it completely mad, leaving it with nothing ahead but disposal. The animal recovered its sanity in an instant.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r337","rowIndex":337,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そうして、無事動物実験を終えた<tips=22>老人たち</tips>は、発症している人間に使ってみろとおれに手渡したのだ。","en":"Having thus concluded their animal experiment successfully, the <tips=22>elders</tips> handed it to me and told me to try it on a human whose symptoms had manifested.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r338","rowIndex":338,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　まあ、おそらく本物だろう。これだけで断定するのは早いけれど、<tips=65>ヘス</tips>の振る舞いなどを思い出すと、この薬に関しては信用していいように思える。","en":"Well, it was probably genuine. It was too soon to conclude that from a single test, but when I thought back on <tips=65>Hess’s</tips> behavior and everything else, I felt he could be trusted where this drug was concerned.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r339","rowIndex":339,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おれの勘は結構当たるのだ。","en":"My hunches are often right.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r340","rowIndex":340,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しかし、だからといって人に使えと言われれば戸惑う。この薬を投与し、そして<tips=65>ヘス</tips>の言う素晴らしい効果が確認されてしまったら——それは、何か恐ろしいことのはじまりのような気がするんだよね。","en":"Even so, being told to use it on a person made me hesitate. If I administered the drug and ended up confirming all the wonderful effects <tips=65>Hess</tips> had promised—somehow, it felt as though that would be the beginning of something terrible.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r341","rowIndex":341,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おれの勘は、結構当たるのだ。","en":"My hunches are often right.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r342","rowIndex":342,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　アンプルの側面に浮き彫りにされた薔薇の意匠を眺めていると、けたたましくブザーの音が鳴った。","en":"As I examined the rose design embossed upon the side of the ampoule, a piercing buzzer began to sound.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r343","rowIndex":343,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　これは<tips=42>サイキック発見器</tips>の音だ！","en":"That was the <tips=42>psychic detector’s</tips> alarm!","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r344","rowIndex":344,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　この近くで<tips=16>タイプA</tips>が能力を使いやがったのだ。こんな明るい時間に？　こんな雑踏のなかで？","en":"Some <tips=16>Type A</tips> bastard had used an ability nearby. In broad daylight? Amid a crowd like this?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r345","rowIndex":345,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　経験的に言って、こういう場合は泥棒か痴漢が能力を使ったのだ。","en":"Experience suggested that in such circumstances, a thief or molester had used a power.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r346","rowIndex":346,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　どこの商品が、誰の財布が、狙われているのだ？","en":"What merchandise—or whose wallet—was being targeted?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r347","rowIndex":347,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　あたりを見回すが、事件は思ったよりおれの近くで発生していた。","en":"I looked around. The crime had occurred rather closer than I expected.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r348","rowIndex":348,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　脇においた軽食の包みが、空中に浮いているのである。","en":"The wrapped snack I had placed beside me was floating in the air.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r349","rowIndex":349,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あっ」","en":"“Ah.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r350","rowIndex":350,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　思わず手を伸ばしても包みはスイと避けてつかまらない。そのまま、すーっと空中を飛んで、階段の上の方に向かっていく。","en":"I reached for it without thinking, but the package darted neatly aside before I could catch it. Then it glided through the air toward the top of the stairs.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r351","rowIndex":351,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そこには二人の少女がニタニタと笑いながら立っていて、包みはその右側の少女の手のなかにぴたりと収まった。","en":"Two girls stood there wearing smug grins. The package came to rest perfectly in the hand of the girl on the right.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r352","rowIndex":352,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　何であんなところにいるのかわからないが、きっと、　”能力”　を使ったのだろう。","en":"I had no idea why they were there, but one of them must have used her ‘ability.’","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r353","rowIndex":353,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　二人とも、黒く長いストレートの髪をなびかせている。","en":"Both girls’ long, straight black hair streamed behind them.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r354","rowIndex":354,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　いや、似ているのは髪型だけではない。身につけた制服も、背格好も、そして顔立ちまでもそっくり同じだ。","en":"Their hair was hardly the only resemblance. They had identical uniforms, identical builds, and even identical faces.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r355","rowIndex":355,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「おい、灰上」","en":"“Hey, Haigami.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r356","rowIndex":356,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おれはこの二人を知っている。","en":"I knew the pair.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r357","rowIndex":357,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=10>見土道夫</tips>はあいかわらず迂闊だな！」","en":"“<tips=10>Michio Mido</tips> is as careless as ever!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r358","rowIndex":358,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　左側の少女が言うと、その隣で右側の少女が包みを開き、パンを半分に割って渡した。","en":"The girl on the left spoke. Beside her, the girl on the right opened the package, tore the bread in half, and handed one half to her.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r359","rowIndex":359,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　受け取ると、一口囓る。","en":"She accepted it and took a bite.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r360","rowIndex":360,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=86>灰上姉妹</tips>と言えば、このあたりでは有名な一卵性双生児だ。","en":"The <tips=86>Haigami sisters</tips> were famous in the neighborhood as identical twins.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r361","rowIndex":361,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　姉の<tips=11>璃映子</tips>は<tips=16>タイプA</tips>で念動力を使い、妹の<tips=12>江梨子</tips>は<tips=72>傾向値</tips>の高い<tips=17>タイプB</tips>で怪力を持つ。","en":"The elder sister, <tips=11>Rieko</tips>, was <tips=16>Type A</tips> and employed telekinesis; the younger, <tips=12>Eriko</tips>, was <tips=17>Type B</tips>, with a high <tips=72>tendency value</tips> and tremendous strength.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r362","rowIndex":362,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　姉には<tips=77>特質変異</tips>がなく、こうして向かい合っているとどっちが<tips=16>タイプA</tips>でどっちが<tips=17>タイプB</tips>なのか、さっぱりわからない。","en":"The elder possessed no <tips=77>trait mutation</tips>, so with the two standing before me, I could not distinguish the <tips=16>Type A</tips> from the <tips=17>Type B</tips> at all.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r363","rowIndex":363,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おれとは小さな頃からの知り合いだ。街では札付きの問題児で、誰も相手にしないような二人だ。","en":"I had known them since we were small. They were notorious troublemakers in the city, the sort no one wanted anything to do with.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r364","rowIndex":364,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　こうしてブザーが鳴っても素知らぬ顔で、街の連中も自分たちの姿を見たら諦めると知っている。","en":"Even with the buzzer sounding, they could stand there pretending not to know a thing, secure in the knowledge that anyone in the city would give up the instant they saw the pair.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r365","rowIndex":365,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　とにかく性格が悪い。根性がねじ曲がっている。そのあたりは、おれでもちょっと否定出来ないけれど、でも根はそんなに悪くない連中なのだ。多分。","en":"Anyway, they had terrible personalities. They were thoroughly warped. Even I could hardly deny that much. But deep down, they were not really bad. Probably.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r366","rowIndex":366,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　とにかく、探知機を作動させたのもこいつらだろう。","en":"At any rate, they must have been the ones who set the detector off.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r367","rowIndex":367,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「おい、人の飯をかっぱらうなよ。もうガキじゃないのに、まだいつも腹を空かせているのか？」","en":"“Hey, don’t swipe someone else’s food. You’re not kids anymore—are you still hungry all the time?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r368","rowIndex":368,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうじゃない。あんたがあまりにもぼんやりとした顔で座っているからだよ」","en":"“That’s not why. You were sitting there with such a vacant look on your face.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r369","rowIndex":369,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「言うほどおかしな顔かなあ」","en":"“Did I really look that funny?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r370","rowIndex":370,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おれが首をひねると、","en":"When I tilted my head—","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r371","rowIndex":371,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「見てるだけで笑っちゃう」","en":"“Just looking at you makes me laugh.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r372","rowIndex":372,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=86>双子</tips>は奪った軽食にぱくつきながら交互におれをからかう。","en":"<tips=86>The twins</tips> munched greedily on my stolen snack, taking turns making fun of me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r373","rowIndex":373,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まあいいや。それにしても、久しぶりだなあ。学校生活はどうだ？　<tips=1>亮</tips>が通っていたのと同じ学校に通ってるんだろ？」","en":"“Never mind. Still, it’s been a while. How’s school? You go to the same school <tips=1>Ryo</tips> attended, right?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r374","rowIndex":374,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「紹介してくれたあいつの性格と同じで、つまらなくて退屈で死にそう」","en":"“It’s just as dreary as the guy who recommended it. I’m bored to death.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r375","rowIndex":375,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=1>菅原亮</tips>にはすっかり騙されたわ。行くんじゃなかった！　毎日毎日、何かを覚えてそれをテストで書くだけの生活なんて、何が面白いのか！」","en":"“<tips=1>Ryo Sugawara</tips> completely deceived us. We never should have gone! Day after day, all we do is memorize something and write it down on a test. What could possibly be interesting about such a life?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r376","rowIndex":376,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　二人揃って顔を顰める。","en":"Both girls grimaced together.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r377","rowIndex":377,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「親切で紹介してやったんだろうに、あいつも悲しむぞ。あ、そうだ。最近この街にいるみたいだから会ったらどうだ？　懐かしいだろう」","en":"“He was only trying to help. He’d be sad to hear you say that. Oh, right—apparently he’s back in the city now. Why don’t you see him if you get the chance? You must miss him.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r378","rowIndex":378,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おれが言うと、二人は揃って顔を顰め、","en":"At my suggestion, the two of them grimaced together once more.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r379","rowIndex":379,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうらしいね。でも、いやだよ」","en":"“So we heard. But no.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r380","rowIndex":380,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あいつ気持ち悪いもの」","en":"“He’s disgusting.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r381","rowIndex":381,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　この二人は怖いものなしのはずだが、なぜか<tips=1>亮</tips>に対してだけは、昔から不思議な苦手意識がある。","en":"The sisters were supposed to fear nothing, yet for some reason, <tips=1>Ryo</tips> alone had always made them strangely uneasy.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r382","rowIndex":382,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうか……それはともかく、丁度良かった。お前らに聞きたいことがあったんだよ」","en":"“I see... In any case, your timing is perfect. There was something I wanted to ask you.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r383","rowIndex":383,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「何？　手短にしてよね」","en":"“What? Make it quick.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r384","rowIndex":384,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=10>道夫</tips>の話って、いつも長すぎるのよ」","en":"“You always talk much too long, <tips=10>Michio</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r385","rowIndex":385,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いいから答えてくれよ。なあ、お前ら。この世界にたくさんいるノーマルたちと、自分たちミュータントの違いについて考えたことはあるか？　なぜ自分たちのような存在がこの世の中に生まれたのかってさ」","en":"“Just answer me. Tell me: have you ever thought about what makes us mutants different from all the Normals in the world? About why people like us were born in the first place?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r386","rowIndex":386,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おれが無理矢理そう質問すると、<tips=86>双子</tips>はお互いに見合わせた顔を、思いっきり顰めてから、こちらを振り返り、","en":"I forced the question upon them. <tips=86>The twins</tips> looked at each other, pulled the fiercest grimaces they could manage, then turned back toward me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r387","rowIndex":387,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あの<tips=10>見土道夫</tips>が、思春期になりたての子供みたいな哲学的な問いかけをしているわ」","en":"“Imagine <tips=10>Michio Mido</tips> asking philosophical questions like some kid who just hit puberty.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r388","rowIndex":388,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「大丈夫？　頭でも打ったんじゃないの？」","en":"“Are you all right? Did you hit your head?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r389","rowIndex":389,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「おい、たまには真面目におれの話を……」","en":"“Hey, once in a while, you could listen seriously when I—”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r390","rowIndex":390,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それより、私たち、用事があるのよ」","en":"“Never mind that. We have somewhere to be.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r391","rowIndex":391,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そう、こんな寄り道をしている暇はないんだわ！　<tips=10>見土道夫</tips>があんまりからかいたくなる顔をしているから……」","en":"“That’s right! We don’t have time for detours like this! It’s just that <tips=10>Michio Mido</tips> has the kind of face you can’t help making fun of...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r392","rowIndex":392,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「おれのせいなのかよ」","en":"“So this is my fault?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r393","rowIndex":393,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……私たち、とても面白い遊びを見つけたの」","en":"“...We found a really fun game.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r394","rowIndex":394,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「だからもう、<tips=10>見土道夫</tips>とは遊べないんだから。ごめんなさいね」","en":"“So we won’t be able to play with you anymore, <tips=10>Michio Mido</tips>. Sorry.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r395","rowIndex":395,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　二人はキラキラとした笑顔で言う。","en":"The girls spoke with radiant smiles.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r396","rowIndex":396,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おれはその表情と言葉に、なんとも言えない違和を感じた。","en":"Something about their expressions and their words felt indefinably wrong to me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r397","rowIndex":397,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ん、どういうことだ？」","en":"“Hm? What do you mean?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r398","rowIndex":398,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それは言えないわ！」","en":"“We can’t tell you!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r399","rowIndex":399,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「用事があるの！　じゃあね！」","en":"“We have somewhere to be! See you!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r400","rowIndex":400,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「お、おい。ちょっと待て」","en":"“H-hey. Wait a moment.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r401","rowIndex":401,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　呼び止める声も虚しく、姉は念動力でふわりと、妹の方は<tips=17>タイプB</tips>特有の身体能力で、階段の手すりを飛び越えて路上に飛び降りると、そのまま人混みの中へ消えてしまう。","en":"My attempt to stop them was wasted. The elder floated lightly over the stair railing by telekinesis, while the younger vaulted it with the physical ability peculiar to <tips=17>Type Bs</tips> and dropped to the street. Then both disappeared into the crowd.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r402","rowIndex":402,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まったく……」","en":"“Honestly...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B2:r403","rowIndex":403,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　立ち上がってズボンの尻についた埃をはたいて落とすと、結局満たされることのなかったおれの空腹がぐうと音を立てた。","en":"I stood, brushed the dust from the seat of my trousers, and heard my still-unsatisfied stomach give a loud growl.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}}]},{"position":14,"code":"F1","unitId":"F1","rows":[{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r1","rowIndex":1,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちの家は靴屋だった。","en":"Our home was a shoe shop.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r2","rowIndex":2,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　道路に面した半分がお店で、うしろ半分に家族で住んでいた。","en":"The front half, facing the road, was the shop; our family lived in the back.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r3","rowIndex":3,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　お店のドアはいつも開いていて、通りかかる人は入り口の側に椅子を置いて作業をしているお父さんを見ながら通り過ぎていった。","en":"The shop door was always open, and passersby would glance at our father working in a chair beside the entrance as they went by.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r4","rowIndex":4,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　お父さんは評判の職人で、街の偉い人たちもこの小さな店に来て、靴底の張り替えや、かかとの修理を依頼した。","en":"Our father was a renowned craftsman. Even important people from the city came to our little shop to have their soles replaced or their heels repaired.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r5","rowIndex":5,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ハンマーを握るお父さんの手のひらは皮が分厚くなってゴツゴツとしていて、それで頭を撫でられると痛かった。","en":"The skin on our father’s hammer-wielding palms had grown thick and rough, and it hurt when he stroked our heads with them.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r6","rowIndex":6,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　お父さんとお母さんが死ぬと、私たちはお店の常連だった<tips=14>深沢</tips>に連れられて<tips=13>溝平B団地</tips>にやって来た。","en":"After our father and mother died, <tips=14>Fukazawa</tips>, one of the shop’s regular customers, brought us to the <tips=13>Mizohira B Housing Complex</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r7","rowIndex":7,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その団地は、街の人々が『<tips=13>ヘドロ団地</tips>』と呼ぶ場所で、勝手に恐れて近づかない。<tips=14>深沢</tips>はそこで一番偉いということになっていて、団地の人たちに顎をしゃくるだけで色々な命令を下していた。","en":"People in the city called the place the <tips=13>Sludge Housing Complex</tips> and kept their distance, frightened by their own imaginings. <tips=14>Fukazawa</tips> was considered the most important man there; a mere jerk of his chin was enough for him to issue all manner of orders to the residents.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r8","rowIndex":8,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちはその<tips=13>溝平B団地</tips>に二人だけの部屋を与えられて暮らしている。","en":"We were given a room of our own in <tips=13>Mizohira B Housing Complex</tips>, where the two of us now live.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r9","rowIndex":9,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　子供の頃は朝から晩まで<tips=9>Y地区</tips>の方へ出かけて過ごしていた。今はその頃ほど長い時間を過ごすことはなくなったけれど、それでも食事や買い物などで<tips=57>滑走路通り</tips>周辺へは頻繁に出かける。","en":"When we were children, we spent every day from morning until night in <tips=9>Y District</tips>. We no longer spend as much time there as we did then, but we still often go to the area around <tips=57>Runway Street</tips> for meals or shopping.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r10","rowIndex":10,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その昼の時間に何をしているのかというと、地区の外にある学校へ通って、そこで過ごしている。","en":"And what do we do with those daytime hours now? We attend a school outside the district and spend them there.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r11","rowIndex":11,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　小さい時から私たちを知っている人は、今の私たちを見て、","en":"People who had known us since we were little would look at us now and say,","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r12","rowIndex":12,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「随分と立派になったのね。偉いわ。本当はやれば出来る子たちなんだから」","en":"“Look how respectable you’ve become. How admirable. You were always capable children when you applied yourselves.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r13","rowIndex":13,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　と褒める。","en":"That was how they praised us.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r14","rowIndex":14,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それに対して私たちはいつも無言で笑っている。","en":"We always responded with a silent smile.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r15","rowIndex":15,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして二人きりになると、こう言い合った。","en":"Then, once the two of us were alone, we would say to each other:","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r16","rowIndex":16,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「馬鹿みたいね！」","en":"“How stupid!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r17","rowIndex":17,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「馬鹿みたいだわ！」","en":"“How stupid!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r18","rowIndex":18,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「私たちは何も変わっていないし、何も良くなっていないっていうのに」","en":"“We haven’t changed at all. We haven’t improved at all.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r19","rowIndex":19,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「世間の人々は、どうしてこんなに簡単に騙されるのかしら？」","en":"“Why are people so easily fooled?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r20","rowIndex":20,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その日は前日から降り続く雨で、路上のあちこちに深い水たまりが出来て道脇の排水溝へ濁流となって流れ落ちていた。","en":"It had been raining since the previous day. Deep puddles covered the road, spilling in muddy torrents into the gutters beside it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r21","rowIndex":21,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちは当初<tips=57>滑走路通り</tips>で食事をとろうと思った。道端には花が置かれていた。前日に虎が現れて、そこで警官と子供を食い殺したのだと後で知った。しかし<tips=57>滑走路通り</tips>はいつもと変わらなかった。","en":"We initially meant to eat on <tips=57>Runway Street</tips>. Flowers had been placed beside the road. We learned later that a tiger had appeared there the previous day and devoured a police officer and a child. Yet <tips=57>Runway Street</tips> looked no different than usual.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r22","rowIndex":22,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　飲食店の看板を見ながら通りを端から端まで歩いても食べたいものが見つからなかったので<tips=58>パラシュート通り</tips>の方へ足を向けた。","en":"We walked the street from one end to the other, studying restaurant signs without finding anything we wanted to eat, and finally turned toward <tips=58>Parachute Street</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r23","rowIndex":23,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=58>パラシュート通り</tips>周辺の路地にはバックパッカー御用達の小さな飲食店がいくつかある。最近は治安もよくなって、新しい店がいくつも出来てる。","en":"The alleys around <tips=58>Parachute Street</tips> held several little restaurants popular with backpackers. The area had grown safer lately, and a number of new places had opened.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r24","rowIndex":24,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちは<tips=9>Y地区</tips>の裏通りは何度も歩いてよく知っていたけれど、<tips=58>パラシュート通り</tips>の辺りはそれほど詳しくなかった。ゴミゴミとした路地で迷ってしまった。","en":"We had walked the back streets of <tips=9>Y District</tips> many times and knew them well, but we were less familiar with the area around <tips=58>Parachute Street</tips>. We became lost among its cluttered alleys.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r25","rowIndex":25,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そこで私たちは一人の少年と出会った。","en":"That was where we met a boy.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r26","rowIndex":26,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　金髪で真っ白な肌を持った少年がうつろな表情で路地の暗がりにしゃがみ込み、すすり泣いている。","en":"A blond boy with stark-white skin crouched in the darkness of an alley, sobbing with a vacant look on his face.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r27","rowIndex":27,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どうしたの？」","en":"“What is it?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r28","rowIndex":28,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そう話しかけると彼は顔を上げた。","en":"When we spoke to him, he looked up.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r29","rowIndex":29,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼の顔は真っ赤な血に濡れて、ひどく震えている。","en":"His face was drenched in bright-red blood, and he was trembling violently.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r30","rowIndex":30,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ちょっと、大けがしているじゃないの」","en":"“Wait. You’re badly hurt.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r31","rowIndex":31,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　黒い服を着ていたので分かりづらかったが、襟元から覗く彼の鎖骨の辺りには傷口があり、そこからドクドクと血が噴き出している。","en":"His black clothes had made it difficult to see, but a wound showed near his collarbone at the open collar, pumping blood in heavy pulses.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r32","rowIndex":32,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「これ、銃で撃たれた傷みたいじゃない？」","en":"“Doesn’t that look like a gunshot wound?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r33","rowIndex":33,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「本当だ。どこかで飼われていたのが逃げ出したのかしら？」","en":"“It does. Maybe he escaped from wherever they were keeping him.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r34","rowIndex":34,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうかもしれないね」","en":"“Maybe.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r35","rowIndex":35,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちは少年に話しかけた。けれど、日本語も、英語も、中国語、ポルトガル語も通じない。","en":"We spoke to the boy, but he understood none of the Japanese, English, Chinese, or Portuguese we tried.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r36","rowIndex":36,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　途方にくれたところで、","en":"Just as we had run out of ideas—","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r37","rowIndex":37,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「マーマ、マーマ……」","en":"“Mama, Mama...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"サーシェンカ","displayName":"Sashenka","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r38","rowIndex":38,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　と悲しげに口にしたので私たちは彼の話せる言葉を知り、その言葉で話しかけた。","en":"He uttered the words mournfully. That told us what language he spoke, and we addressed him in it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r39","rowIndex":39,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ここにはきみのお母さんはいないよ」","en":"“Your mother isn’t here.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r40","rowIndex":40,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼は伏せていた顔をあげて、その青い目をキョロキョロとさせると取り囲む私たちを見た。","en":"He raised his lowered face, darted his blue eyes around, and looked at us gathered around him.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r41","rowIndex":41,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「へえ、随分キレイな顔しているのね」","en":"“Wow. You have such a pretty face.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r42","rowIndex":42,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どこから来たの？」","en":"“Where did you come from?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r43","rowIndex":43,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼は答えず、反応の鈍いぼんやりとした表情でじっと私たちの顔を見ている。","en":"He gave no answer. His dazed face showed no reaction; he merely stared at us.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r44","rowIndex":44,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「痛いでしょう。血が沢山出てるよ」","en":"“That must hurt. You’re bleeding so much.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r45","rowIndex":45,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「病院へ連れて行ってあげようか？」","en":"“Shall we take you to a hospital?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r46","rowIndex":46,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちの問いかけには何一つ答えない。ただ唇を震わせているだけだ。","en":"He answered none of our questions. His lips merely trembled.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r47","rowIndex":47,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「こわがっているのかな？」","en":"“Do you think he is scared?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r48","rowIndex":48,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どうだろう。とりあえず、どこかで医者に診せてみる？　このままじゃ死ぬかもしれないよ」","en":"“Who knows? For now, should we take him to a doctor? He may die if we leave him like this.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r49","rowIndex":49,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちは彼の近くにしゃがみ込んだ。","en":"We crouched beside him.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r50","rowIndex":50,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　どの程度の傷なのか。カバンに入っていた未開封のミネラルウォーターで傷口の血を洗い流してその様子を確認する。","en":"How serious was the injury? We washed the blood from the wound with an unopened bottle of mineral water from our bag and examined it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r51","rowIndex":51,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……！」","en":"“...!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"サーシェンカ","displayName":"Sashenka","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r52","rowIndex":52,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼は身体をビクリとさせる。声はあげない。","en":"His body jerked, but he made no sound.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r53","rowIndex":53,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「やっぱりこれ、銃創ね。……貫通してる？」","en":"“It really is a gunshot wound. ...Did the bullet go all the way through?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r54","rowIndex":54,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「みたい。やっぱり、ちゃんと病院へ連れていかないと……あっ、ちょっと見て」","en":"“It looks that way. We really do need to take him to a proper hospital... Wait. Look at this.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r55","rowIndex":55,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちは彼の傷口をのぞき込む。口径の小さな銃で撃ち抜かれたようなその穴の奥には、筋肉や脂肪の破損が観察できる。じっと見ていると、その破壊されて歪に引き裂かれた組織が、少しずつ丸みを帯び、繋がってゆく。","en":"We peered into the wound. It resembled the hole left by a small-caliber bullet, and damaged muscle and fat were visible inside. As we watched, the ragged tissue gradually grew rounded and knitted itself together.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r56","rowIndex":56,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……これ、再生してない？」","en":"“Isn’t this regenerating?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r57","rowIndex":57,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「本当だ……」","en":"“It is...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r58","rowIndex":58,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちは顔を見合わせる。","en":"We looked at each other.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r59","rowIndex":59,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ねえ、この子ってさ……」","en":"“Hey, do you think this boy might be...?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r60","rowIndex":60,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちが視線をそらした隙に、彼は立ち上がる。立ち上がると、思ったより背が高かった。そして彼は道の向こうへと走り去ってゆく。","en":"While our eyes were turned away, he rose. Once upright, he was taller than we had expected. Then he ran off down the street.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r61","rowIndex":61,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちはその後を追わなかった。","en":"We did not follow.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r62","rowIndex":62,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あんなのって、<tips=55>汐松子</tips>の他にもいるんだ」","en":"“So <tips=55>Matsuko Shio</tips> isn’t the only one like that.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r63","rowIndex":63,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちの片方がそう言い、","en":"One of us spoke.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r64","rowIndex":64,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「うん」","en":"“Yes.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r65","rowIndex":65,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　もう片方が頷いた。","en":"The other nodded.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r66","rowIndex":66,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「驚いたね。でも、よく考えれば世界でただ一人だけの特別な個性を持った人間なんかいないんだから、驚くほどのことじゃない」","en":"“That was a surprise. But when you think about it, no human being has some special trait all their own, so there is nothing surprising about it.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r67","rowIndex":67,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうだね。<tips=55>汐松子</tips>がいるんだから、他にも沢山居るのが当たり前だ」","en":"“True. If <tips=55>Matsuko Shio</tips> exists, it is only natural that many others do too.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r68","rowIndex":68,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「うん」","en":"“Yes.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r69","rowIndex":69,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それが一週間前のことで、私たちはもう一度この少年と出会うことになった。","en":"That had been a week ago. Now we were about to meet the boy again.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r70","rowIndex":70,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その日私たちは仮病で学校を休んだ。私たちはしばしばそうやって自主的に休校日を作っていた。","en":"That day, we feigned illness and stayed home from school. We often appointed our own school holidays that way.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r71","rowIndex":71,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちはテストでいつも同じくらいの点数をとり、成績を維持し、留年をせずに三年で卒業することを通学する上での目標にしていた。それ以上は必要がないと思っていたので、単位を取得できる最低限の日数だけ出席していた。","en":"Our goal in attending school was to keep scoring roughly the same as each other on tests, maintain our grades, and graduate in three years without being held back. We thought anything beyond that was unnecessary, so we attended only the minimum number of days required to earn our credits.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r72","rowIndex":72,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　学校生活が新しい知見をもたらしてくれたのははじめのうちだけで、一年も過ぎたころには私たちに何かを期待させるものは何もなくなっていた。","en":"Only at first did school life bring us new knowledge. By the end of a year, there was nothing left there for us to look forward to.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r73","rowIndex":73,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　同級生は<tips=9>Y地区</tips>出身の生徒を見下し、陰口を言い、同級生として共有するべき情報なども伝えず、<tips=9>Y地区</tips>出身というだけで何かと不自由で不快な学校生活を送らされている。私たちは最初から出身地は口にせず、誰かと必要以上に親しく交際することも避けていた。","en":"Our classmates looked down on students from <tips=9>Y District</tips>, bad-mouthed them, and withheld information that should have been shared among classmates. Simply for coming from <tips=9>Y District</tips>, those students were made to endure an inconvenient and unpleasant school life. From the beginning, we kept our place of origin to ourselves and avoided growing closer to anyone than necessary.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r74","rowIndex":74,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　正直に<tips=9>Y地区</tips>からやって来たなどと言う生徒は愚かだ。","en":"Any student who honestly admitted to coming from <tips=9>Y District</tips> was a fool.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r75","rowIndex":75,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　空模様は薄曇りで、路上には前日の雨が残り、アスファルトに黒いシミを作っている。","en":"The sky was lightly overcast. Rain from the previous day still lingered on the road, leaving dark patches across the asphalt.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r76","rowIndex":76,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=57>滑走路通り</tips>は平日の昼下がりでも人の行き来が絶えなかった。私たちは<tips=57>滑走路通り</tips>から少し狭い路地に入ったところに用があった。そこにはトルコ人のデザイナーが住んでいて、独特なデザイン性のある携帯電話のケースを販売していると学校の知人に聞いていた。","en":"Even on a weekday afternoon, people streamed endlessly along <tips=57>Runway Street</tips>. We had business in a narrower alley just off <tips=57>Runway Street</tips>. A school acquaintance had told us that a Turkish designer lived there and sold cell-phone cases with distinctive designs.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r77","rowIndex":77,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　用事を済ませて店を出たところで、私たちは少年を見つけた。","en":"We found the boy when we came out of the shop.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r78","rowIndex":78,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　目が合うと逃げだそうとしたので、私たちは呼び止めた。","en":"When our eyes met, he tried to run, so we called out to stop him.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r79","rowIndex":79,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「逃げることはないでしょう。心配していたんだよ」","en":"“You don’t have to run. We were worried about you.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r80","rowIndex":80,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「傷はどうなったの？　あの調子だと、もう治った？」","en":"“What happened to your wound? The way it was going, has it healed already?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r81","rowIndex":81,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……うん」","en":"“...Yes.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"サーシェンカ","displayName":"Sashenka","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r82","rowIndex":82,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　少年は視線を合わせるのをさけるようにしながら頷いた。","en":"The boy nodded, seeming to avoid our eyes.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r83","rowIndex":83,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なんであんな怪我をしたの？」","en":"“How did you get hurt like that?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r84","rowIndex":84,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「普通の傷じゃなかったよ」","en":"“It wasn’t an ordinary wound.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r85","rowIndex":85,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……わからない」","en":"“...I don’t know.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"サーシェンカ","displayName":"Sashenka","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r86","rowIndex":86,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「怪我をしたときのことを覚えていないって言うの？」","en":"“You mean you don’t remember being injured?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r87","rowIndex":87,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちの問いかけに少年は頷く。","en":"In answer to our question, the boy nodded.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r88","rowIndex":88,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「とても、知らないうちに出来ているような傷じゃなかったのに」","en":"“That wasn't the kind of wound that could appear without you noticing.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r89","rowIndex":89,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「薬で意識でも失わされていたの？」","en":"“Did someone drug you unconscious?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r90","rowIndex":90,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……わからないんだ。目が覚めたら、知らない場所にいて、あの格好で、あんな怪我をしていて……」","en":"“...I don’t know. When I woke up, I was in a place I didn’t recognize, dressed like that and injured that way...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"サーシェンカ","displayName":"Sashenka","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r91","rowIndex":91,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　少年はそう言って、うつろな視線を宙にさまよわせた。","en":"As he spoke, the boy stared vacantly into space.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r92","rowIndex":92,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「何だか知らないけれど、大変ねえ」","en":"“Whatever happened, that sounds awful.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r93","rowIndex":93,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あっ、ちょっと待って。この子、なんだか汚れてる」","en":"“Oh, wait. He's all dirty somehow.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r94","rowIndex":94,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちの一人が、手を伸ばして彼の上着をまくり上げる。","en":"One of us reached out and lifted his jacket.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r95","rowIndex":95,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あっ」","en":"“Ah.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"サーシェンカ","displayName":"Sashenka","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r96","rowIndex":96,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　黒い上着の下には白いシャツを着ていたが、それが真っ赤な血液でべっとりと濡れていた。","en":"Beneath the black coat, he wore a white shirt soaked through with bright-red blood.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r97","rowIndex":97,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「きみ、また大けがしてるんじゃないの？」","en":"“Have you been badly hurt again?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r98","rowIndex":98,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　声をかけたが、少年は自分の胸についたおびただしい血液を見たままぼんやりとしている。","en":"We spoke to him, but the boy only stared vacantly at the enormous amount of blood on his chest.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r99","rowIndex":99,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どうしたの？　驚いたの？　まるで今知ったみたいな顔をして」","en":"“What is it? Are you surprised? You look as though you’re only discovering it now.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r100","rowIndex":100,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……これはなんだろうなって。どうして、こんなことばっかり起こるんだろう。ああ、いつもいつも、僕はもううんざりだ……」","en":"“...I was just wondering what this was. Why do things like this keep happening to me? Oh, over and over again... I'm so tired of it all...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"サーシェンカ","displayName":"Sashenka","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r101","rowIndex":101,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして彼は唇を噛み、暗い表情で黙り込む。","en":"He bit his lip and fell silent, his expression dark.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r102","rowIndex":102,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　少年の身体には傷はついていない。血がまだ新しいものであることを思うと、怪我が再生して血だけが残ったというわけでもなさそうだと私たちは判断した。","en":"The boy’s body was uninjured. Because the blood remained fresh, we concluded that it was unlikely to have been left behind when one of his own wounds healed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r103","rowIndex":103,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「とすると、他人の血？」","en":"“Then it is someone else’s blood?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r104","rowIndex":104,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……わからない」","en":"“...I don’t know.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"サーシェンカ","displayName":"Sashenka","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r105","rowIndex":105,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　少年はやはり何も覚えていなかった。","en":"Once again, the boy remembered nothing.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r106","rowIndex":106,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「気がついたら路上にいて、ふらふらと歩いていたんだ……」","en":"“I came to in the street and found myself wandering...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"サーシェンカ","displayName":"Sashenka","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r107","rowIndex":107,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いつもって言うけど、こういうこと、よくあるの？」","en":"“You said ‘always.’ Does this sort of thing happen often?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r108","rowIndex":108,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちの言葉に、少年は目を細め、覇気のない声で言った。","en":"At that, the boy narrowed his eyes and answered in a listless voice.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r109","rowIndex":109,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「よくあるなんてもんじゃない。……いつもね、目が覚めるたびに知らない場所にいて、わけのわからないことになってる。……ねえ、ここはどこなんだい？　何て言う国？」","en":"“Often doesn’t begin to cover it. ...Every time I wake up, I’m somewhere I don’t recognize, and everything’s gone all wrong. ...Hey, where is this? What country am I in?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"サーシェンカ","displayName":"Sashenka","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r110","rowIndex":110,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まあ、それさえもわからないって言うの？」","en":"“You mean you don’t even know that?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r111","rowIndex":111,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「大分前からここにいるんだと思うけど……読めない文字ばかりだし、人に話しかけてもわけのわからない言葉で喋るんだ。言葉が通じたのは、きみたちが初めてだよ……」","en":"“I think I’ve been here for quite a while... but I can’t read any of the writing. Whenever I speak to someone, they answer in a language I don’t understand. You’re the first people whose words I’ve understood...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"サーシェンカ","displayName":"Sashenka","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r112","rowIndex":112,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちはここは日本の<tips=9>Y地区</tips>だと説明をした。","en":"We explained that he was in <tips=9>Y District</tips>, Japan.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r113","rowIndex":113,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼はきょとんとして、","en":"He stared at us in bewilderment.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r114","rowIndex":114,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「日本だって？　……さっぱり気がつかなかった。でも、こんな場所だったっけなあ。前は、ちがったような気がするけれど……」","en":"“Japan? ...I never realized. But was it always like this? I feel as though it was different before...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"サーシェンカ","displayName":"Sashenka","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r115","rowIndex":115,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「来たことあるの？」","en":"“Have you been here?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r116","rowIndex":116,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「うん。……大分昔。今居る場所は日本だって聞いたことがある」","en":"“Yes. ...A long time ago. I remember being told that the place I was in was Japan.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"サーシェンカ","displayName":"Sashenka","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r117","rowIndex":117,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「もしかしたら、日本でも、ここじゃなくて別の場所だったのかもしれない」","en":"“Maybe it was somewhere else in Japan, not here.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"サーシェンカ","displayName":"Sashenka","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r118","rowIndex":118,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ねえ、ロシア語を喋るってことは、きみは生まれたところはロシアなわけでしょ？」","en":"“If you speak Russian, then you were born in Russia, weren’t you?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r119","rowIndex":119,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼は首を横に振る。","en":"He shook his head.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r120","rowIndex":120,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「じゃあどこ？」","en":"“Then where?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r121","rowIndex":121,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……僕は、<tips=8>グレートホール</tips>から生まれたんだ。この地上のどこの国も、僕の生まれ故郷じゃない」","en":"“...I was born from <tips=8>Great Hole</tips>. No country on this earth is my homeland.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"サーシェンカ","displayName":"Sashenka","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r122","rowIndex":122,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その言葉に、私たちは思わず顔を見合わせた。","en":"We exchanged an involuntary glance.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r123","rowIndex":123,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちは彼の言葉の内容について、それが事実だとはほとんど信じられなかった。","en":"We could hardly believe that what he had said was true.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r124","rowIndex":124,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼は目が覚めるたびに、知らない場所にいて、時に国さえも変わって、そして思いがけない状態であると言う。この間のように怪我をしていたり、今回のように誰の物とも知らぬ血液で汚れていたり。","en":"Every time he woke, he said, he was in an unfamiliar place. Sometimes even the country had changed, and he was always in some unexpected state: injured as he had been the other day, or covered in the blood of some unknown person as he was now.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r125","rowIndex":125,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　眠っている間に何が起きているのかはわからない。眠っている時間がどのくらいなのかもよくわからない。すべてが断片的で、支離滅裂なのだということだ。","en":"According to him, he did not know what happened while he slept or even how long he remained asleep. Everything came to him in fragments, all of it disjointed and incoherent.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r126","rowIndex":126,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「もううんざりだ。僕の人生はどうなっているんだ……」","en":"“I’m sick of it. What is happening to my life...?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"サーシェンカ","displayName":"Sashenka","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r127","rowIndex":127,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　少年は小さな声で呟き、嘆息する。","en":"The boy muttered under his breath and sighed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r128","rowIndex":128,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どうする？　なんだかぼんやりした子だね。薬でも使っているのかしら？」","en":"“What should we do? He seems terribly dazed. Do you think he’s using some kind of drug?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r129","rowIndex":129,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「さあ。こういう人のようにも思えるけど」","en":"“Who knows? Maybe that is just the sort of person he is.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r130","rowIndex":130,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちは顔を見合わせた。","en":"We looked at each other.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r131","rowIndex":131,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「考えられるのは……精神疾患、脳障害」","en":"“The possibilities are... mental illness, a brain disorder.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r132","rowIndex":132,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それから、薬物の後遺症？　……それとも、何か大事なことを隠して嘘をついている？」","en":"“Or the aftereffects of drugs? ...Or maybe he is lying to hide something important.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r133","rowIndex":133,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「嘘をついてる感じはしない。でも、この血液は嘘でもまぼろしでもないよね」","en":"“He doesn’t seem to be lying. But this blood is no lie or illusion.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r134","rowIndex":134,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちはぼんやりとした顔のままそこに突っ立っている少年に、問い直す。","en":"We questioned the boy again as he stood before us with the same dazed expression.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r135","rowIndex":135,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ねえ、本当に何もわからないの？　わかってることが少しでもあったら教えて」","en":"“Do you really know nothing? If there’s even one thing you do know, tell us.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r136","rowIndex":136,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「私たち、この街には昔から住んでいるの。ヒントがあれば少しは助けになるわ」","en":"“We’ve lived in this city for a long time. Give us a clue, and perhaps we can help.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r137","rowIndex":137,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「わかってることって言っても……」","en":"“What I know... I don’t know...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r138","rowIndex":138,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「何でも話して。自分が眠っている間、何をしているか知りたくない？」","en":"“Tell us anything. Don’t you want to learn what you do while you’re asleep?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r139","rowIndex":139,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「世界中のあちこちを移動したり、血まみれになったり、よほどのことだよ。調べた方がいいと思わない？」","en":"“You move around from one place in the world to another, and you wind up covered in blood. Something serious must be going on. Don’t you think you should look into it?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r140","rowIndex":140,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　少年は戸惑いながら私たちの顔を交互に見て、","en":"Looking bewildered, the boy glanced back and forth between our faces,","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r141","rowIndex":141,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……きみたちは双子かい？」","en":"“...Are you twins?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"サーシェンカ","displayName":"Sashenka","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r142","rowIndex":142,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　質問されたこととは別のことを言った。","en":"He answered with something entirely unrelated to what we had asked.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r143","rowIndex":143,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうよ」","en":"“Yes.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r144","rowIndex":144,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうか。僕にも昔は、兄弟がいたような気がするんだけれど……」","en":"“I see. I think I may once have had siblings too...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"サーシェンカ","displayName":"Sashenka","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r145","rowIndex":145,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　少年はそっぽを向いて俯く。","en":"The boy turned away and lowered his head.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r146","rowIndex":146,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……大事な家族がいたはずなのに、うまく思い出せない。どうしてこんなことになったんだろう？　いつも、目が覚めるたびに恐ろしくて酷いものを見せられる……。いつも、姿の見えない、なんだかこわいものにあやつられているんだ」","en":"“...I know I had a family I loved, but I can’t remember them properly. How did this happen to me? Every time I wake up, I’m shown something horrible and terrifying... I’m always being controlled by some unseen, somehow frightening thing.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"サーシェンカ","displayName":"Sashenka","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r147","rowIndex":147,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「だから、それがなにか、私たちが一緒に確かめてあげるって言ってるの」","en":"“That’s why we’re telling you we’ll help find out what it is.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r148","rowIndex":148,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「私たち、なんだかきみにとても興味があるの。それとも、他に頼る人でもいるの？」","en":"“There’s just something about you that really interests us. Or do you have someone else to turn to?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r149","rowIndex":149,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いない。いないよ……言葉も通じないし……」","en":"“No. No one... I can’t even make myself understood...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"サーシェンカ","displayName":"Sashenka","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r150","rowIndex":150,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　少年は首を横に振る。","en":"The boy shook his head.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r151","rowIndex":151,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「知り合いなんか、一人もいない。僕はひとりぼっちなんだ。いつだって……」","en":"“I don’t know a single person. I’m all alone. I always am...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"サーシェンカ","displayName":"Sashenka","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r152","rowIndex":152,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ねえ、知ってることを全部教えて」","en":"“Come on. Tell us everything you know.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r153","rowIndex":153,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　少年は暫く迷っているようだったが、","en":"The boy seemed to hesitate for a while, but then said:","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r154","rowIndex":154,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ありがとう。でも僕と関わったらいけない。僕をあやつってるのは、すごく恐ろしいやつなんだ。人殺しだって平気でするようなやつなんだよ。とても言えないような恐ろしい場所で目を覚ましたことが何度もあるんだ。きっと、きみたちも危険な目に遭わせてしまう」","en":"“Thank you. But you mustn’t get involved with me. Whatever is controlling me is terrifying. It’s something that kills people without a second thought. I’ve woken up many times in places too horrible to describe. I’m sure I’ll end up putting you in danger too.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"サーシェンカ","displayName":"Sashenka","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r155","rowIndex":155,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「平気だよ。私たちそういうのに慣れてるから」","en":"“We’ll be fine. We’re used to that sort of thing.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r156","rowIndex":156,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「危険なことや人は見慣れてるの。小さなころからね。人が見たことがないものをたくさんみて、人がしたことがないことをたくさんしてるわ」","en":"“We’re used to dangerous people and dangerous situations. We have been since we were little. We’ve seen many things no one else has seen and done many things no one else has done.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r157","rowIndex":157,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちはケタケタと笑う。","en":"We laughed shrilly.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r158","rowIndex":158,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「わからない。どうしてこんなに僕に構って、良くしてくれるの？」","en":"“I don’t understand. Why are you paying so much attention to me and being so kind to me?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"サーシェンカ","displayName":"Sashenka","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r159","rowIndex":159,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まあ確かに、あんたみたいなめんどくさそうなの見つけたら、十人中十人がスルーするかもね」","en":"“Well, sure. If anyone came across someone who looked like as much trouble as you, ten people out of ten would probably pass you by.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r160","rowIndex":160,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「でもさー、選択があるたびに毎回十人中十人が選ぶことしか選ばなかったら、十人中十人の人生になるよ？」","en":"“But if every time you have a choice, you only ever pick what ten people out of ten would pick, you’ll end up with the same life as all ten of them, won’t you?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r161","rowIndex":161,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それって、生きてる意味があるわけぇ？」","en":"“What would be the point of living like that?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r162","rowIndex":162,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「だから私たちは普通のことは選ばないの」","en":"“That’s why we never make the ordinary choice.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r163","rowIndex":163,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「だって私たちは特別な人間だから、特別な人生を生きなくちゃいけないの」","en":"“Because we’re special people. We have to live special lives.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r164","rowIndex":164,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「わかった？」","en":"“Understand?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r165","rowIndex":165,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……そうなんだ。確かにきみたちは特別かもしれない。……こんなに僕に話しかけてくれた人なんて、今までいなかったし……」","en":"“...I see. Maybe you really are special. ...No one’s ever talked to me this much before...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"サーシェンカ","displayName":"Sashenka","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r166","rowIndex":166,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　少年はその灰色の瞳で私たちの目をじっと見つめた。","en":"The boy fixed his gray eyes on ours.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r167","rowIndex":167,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「僕、きみたちのことを信じるよ。でも、もしひどいものを見ても、僕を嫌いにならないでくれる？　僕、人に嫌われるの、すごく苦手なんだ……」","en":"“I’ll trust you. But if you see something horrible, could you please not hate me? I’m really bad at being hated...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"サーシェンカ","displayName":"Sashenka","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r168","rowIndex":168,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「へーきへーき」","en":"“It’s fine, it’s fine.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r169","rowIndex":169,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「安心しなよ。私たちは誰のことも嫌いにならないわ」","en":"“Relax. We don’t hate anyone.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r170","rowIndex":170,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「多分」","en":"“Probably.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r171","rowIndex":171,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「わかった。じゃあ信用する。きみたちは、僕と同じくらいの年みたいだし……でも、もし恐ろしいものに出会ったら、すぐに逃げてよね。僕にはきっと、どうすることも出来ないから……。目が覚めた時、目の前に君たちの死体があったら、とても悲しいと思うんだ」","en":"“All right. Then I’ll trust you. You look about my age, too... But if you run into anything terrible, get away at once. I’m sure I won’t be able to do anything... I think I’d be very sad if I woke up and found your bodies in front of me.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"サーシェンカ","displayName":"Sashenka","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r172","rowIndex":172,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼は心配げに私たちを見る。","en":"He watched us anxiously.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r173","rowIndex":173,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「忠告ありがとう」","en":"“Thank you for the warning.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r174","rowIndex":174,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「で、あなたの名前は？」","en":"“And what is your name?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r175","rowIndex":175,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「僕は、<tips=63>サーシェンカ</tips>って呼ばれていたような気がする。よくわからないけど、たぶんそれが名前なんだと思う」","en":"“I think I was called <tips=63>Sashenka</tips>. I don’t know for certain, but that is probably my name.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"サーシェンカ","displayName":"Sashenka","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r176","rowIndex":176,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それって愛称じゃない？　フルネームはなんていうの？」","en":"“Isn’t that a nickname? What’s your full name?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r177","rowIndex":177,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「わからない……」","en":"“I don’t know...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"サーシェンカ","displayName":"Sashenka","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r178","rowIndex":178,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その返事に私たちは溜息をつく。名前なんか人と被りやすいものだから、私たちはなるべくフルネームを知りたかった。","en":"We sighed at the answer. A given name could belong to any number of people, so we wanted his full name if we could get it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r179","rowIndex":179,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……きみたちは？」","en":"“...And you?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"サーシェンカ","displayName":"Sashenka","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r180","rowIndex":180,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　少年は落ち着きのない態度でそう訊ねる。","en":"The boy asked, fidgeting uneasily.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r181","rowIndex":181,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「私は<tips=11>灰上璃映子</tips>」","en":"“I’m <tips=11>Rieko Haigami</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r182","rowIndex":182,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「私は<tips=12>灰上江梨子</tips>。……よろしくね」","en":"“I’m <tips=12>Eriko Haigami</tips>. ...Pleased to meet you.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r183","rowIndex":183,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして私たちは話を聞いた。","en":"And so we listened to his story.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r184","rowIndex":184,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　少年のこの街での記憶は断片的で、いつもわけのわからない状況のなかで目が覚めるけれど、何度か同じ場所で目を覚ますこともあったと言う。","en":"The boy’s memories of the city were fragmentary. He said that he always woke in circumstances he could not understand, though on several occasions he had awakened in the same place.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r185","rowIndex":185,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なんだか、古い作りの建物で……もしかしたら、僕はそこに住んでいるのかもしれない。この近くだと思うんだけど……」","en":"“It was some kind of old-fashioned building... Maybe I live there. I think it’s nearby...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r186","rowIndex":186,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　建物の特徴を聞くと、私たちに心当たりがあった。その時私たちが立ち話をしていたところから、通りを二つほど越えたところにある一軒家だ。そこに案内すると、少年は建物を見上げて「ここだ」と言った。","en":"When we asked what the building looked like, one came to mind: a detached house two streets from where we stood talking. We led the boy there. He looked up at it and said, ‘This is it.’","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r187","rowIndex":187,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それは私たちが子供のころからある建物で、いままでに何度か借り手がついたものの誰も定住せず、最後の記憶では空き家になっていた筈だ。建物の前にずっとかかっていた住居者を募集するプレートなどはもうなくなっている。","en":"The building had stood there since we were children. It had been rented several times, but no one ever stayed for long, and the last we remembered, it had stood vacant. The sign advertising it for rent, which had hung out front for so long, was gone.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r188","rowIndex":188,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「きみが借りたの？　それとも、あなたをここに連れてきた誰かが借りたの？」","en":"“Did you rent it? Or did the person who brought you here rent it?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r189","rowIndex":189,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　建物に人の気配はなく、ひっそりと静まりかえっていた。","en":"There was no sign of anyone inside the building. It lay utterly still.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r190","rowIndex":190,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「わからない……。でも、ここには見覚えがあるような気がする」","en":"“I don’t know... But I feel as though I recognize this place.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r191","rowIndex":191,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　果たして、少年のポケットの中には鍵があった。おそるおそる敷地に足を踏み入れて、それをドアの鍵穴に差し込んで捻ると、カチャリと音を立てて回った。","en":"Sure enough, there was a key in the boy’s pocket. He stepped hesitantly onto the property, inserted it into the front door’s keyhole, and twisted. It turned with a click.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r192","rowIndex":192,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして少年はドアに手をかけ、そこで立ち止まる。","en":"The boy reached for the door, then stopped.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r193","rowIndex":193,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どうしたの？」","en":"“What is it?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r194","rowIndex":194,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　言葉をかけると彼は振り返り、","en":"When we spoke to him, he turned around.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r195","rowIndex":195,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「本当に、きみたちはなかに入るの？」","en":"“Are you really coming inside?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r196","rowIndex":196,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「もちろん」","en":"“Of course.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r197","rowIndex":197,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「当たり前でしょう」","en":"“Naturally.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r198","rowIndex":198,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　少年は何か言いかけて唇を動かした。しかし言葉は形作られることなく唇は元通り結ばれた。","en":"The boy parted his lips to say something, but no words formed, and he closed them again.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r199","rowIndex":199,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　少年はドアを開いた。","en":"He opened the door.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r200","rowIndex":200,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　建物のなかから漏れ出る空気には、花を思わせるような甘い香りがついていた。","en":"The air spilling from the building carried a sweet, flowerlike fragrance.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r201","rowIndex":201,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちは足を踏み入れ、周囲を見回した。","en":"We stepped inside and looked around.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r202","rowIndex":202,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　がらんとして必要最低限の物しかない玄関ホールだった。床や手すりにはうっすらと埃が積もり、足跡や触れたあとを視認できる。","en":"The entrance hall was empty, containing only the bare necessities. A thin layer of dust covered the floor and banister, revealing footprints and marks where someone had touched them.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r203","rowIndex":203,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　電気は問題なく通っており、玄関脇のスイッチを押すと天井の照明に明かりが灯った。","en":"The electricity still functioned. When we pressed the switch beside the entrance, the ceiling lights came on.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r204","rowIndex":204,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まず、着替えないとね。着替えとかはあるの？　そういうのも何もない？」","en":"“First, you need to change. Do you have other clothes? Or is there nothing like that either?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r205","rowIndex":205,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「寝室にバッグがあったと思う。たぶんそれに、服とかも入ってる」","en":"“I think there was a bag in the bedroom. It probably has clothes and things inside.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"サーシェンカ","displayName":"Sashenka","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r206","rowIndex":206,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「じゃあ、そこへつれて行って」","en":"“Then take us there.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r207","rowIndex":207,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　寝室は二階にあった。部屋の中央に木製のダブルベッドが設置され、乱れた布団が乗っている。ベッドの脇には旅行用の大きなスーツケースが放り出されていた。","en":"The bedroom was on the second floor. A wooden double bed occupied its center, covered in rumpled bedding. A large travel suitcase had been thrown down beside it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r208","rowIndex":208,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「バッグってこのスーツケースのこと？　鍵がかかってる。……あなた鍵を持ってる？　それか番号わかる？」","en":"“By ‘bag,’ do you mean this suitcase? It’s locked. ...Do you have the key? Or do you know the combination?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r209","rowIndex":209,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ううん……。ないみたい」","en":"“No... It doesn’t look like it.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"サーシェンカ","displayName":"Sashenka","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r210","rowIndex":210,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　少年は着衣のポケットを探ってからそう答える。","en":"The boy answered after searching his pockets.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r211","rowIndex":211,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「壊しちゃおっか？」","en":"“Should we break it open?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r212","rowIndex":212,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いや、待って、あそこに服がある」","en":"“No, wait. There are clothes over there.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r213","rowIndex":213,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　部屋の隅に置かれた椅子の背もたれに、白い物がかかっている。広げてみると、男物のシャツと、さらにその下に黒いズボンもかけられていた。","en":"Something white hung over the back of a chair in the corner. When we unfolded it, we found a man’s shirt, with black trousers hanging beneath it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r214","rowIndex":214,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「荷物はこのスーツケースだけかな？　だとしたら少ないね。ねえ<tips=63>サーシェンカ</tips>。ここで、誰かと一緒に過ごしたりした覚えはある？　それともずっと一人だけかな？」","en":"“Is this suitcase all the luggage you have? If so, it isn’t much. Tell us, <tips=63>Sashenka</tips>: do you remember ever spending time here with anyone else? Or have you always been alone?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r215","rowIndex":215,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ここでは誰にもあったことないけど……。でも、時々知らない荷物が置いてあったり、テーブルの上にメモ書きが置いてあったりするんだ。メモの内容は、冷蔵庫に食べ物が入っているとか、机の上の物に触ってはいけないとか……。そういうのは昔からよくあって、僕の知らない間に、誰かが身のまわりでいろいろしているんだとは思う」","en":"“I’ve never met anyone here... But sometimes I find luggage I don’t recognize or notes left on the table. The notes say things like there’s food in the refrigerator, or not to touch the things on the desk... That sort of thing has happened a lot for as long as I can remember. I think someone has been doing all kinds of things around me without my knowing.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"サーシェンカ","displayName":"Sashenka","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r216","rowIndex":216,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「きみが夢遊病か何かで、自分で書いているんじゃないの？」","en":"“Maybe you write them yourself when you’re sleepwalking or something?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r217","rowIndex":217,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そんな……」","en":"“That can’t be...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"サーシェンカ","displayName":"Sashenka","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r218","rowIndex":218,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まあいいわ。その辺りのことはあとで調べるとして、とりあえず、本人の方を調べようか」","en":"“Never mind. We can look into all that later. For now, let’s examine you.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r219","rowIndex":219,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そうして私たちは少年の前に立つ。","en":"We stood before the boy.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r220","rowIndex":220,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ほら、さっさとしてよ」","en":"“Come on. Hurry.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r221","rowIndex":221,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……どういうこと？」","en":"“...What do you mean?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"サーシェンカ","displayName":"Sashenka","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r222","rowIndex":222,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「その汚れた服を脱いでよ。きみの身体も調べないと」","en":"“Take off those stained clothes. We need to look over your body, too.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r223","rowIndex":223,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「この間の怪我もみたいし、新しい何かがあるかもしれないし」","en":"“We want to see the previous injury, and there may be something new.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r224","rowIndex":224,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「え……それは……でも……」","en":"“What...? But...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"サーシェンカ","displayName":"Sashenka","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r225","rowIndex":225,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「さっさとしてよ。私たちは協力するんだから、きみは言うことを聞くのよ」","en":"“Hurry. We’re helping you, so you must do what we say.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r226","rowIndex":226,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちが取り囲むように立っていると、彼はしばらく悩んでから、自分の血みどろになった服のボタンにおずおずと手をかけた。","en":"With the two of us standing around him, he deliberated for a while, then timidly reached for the buttons of his blood-soaked shirt.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r227","rowIndex":227,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　血で汚れてはいるが、彼が着ていたものも、椅子にかけてあった白いシャツと同じ形のシャツだった。上半身裸になった彼は私たちにそれを手渡す。","en":"Though stained with blood, the shirt he had been wearing was the same cut as the white shirt draped over the chair. He removed it, baring his upper body, and handed it to us.","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"サーシェンカ白シャツ","displayName":"Sashenka (White Shirt)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r228","rowIndex":228,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちは汚れていない部分をつまむようにしてそれを受け取る。","en":"We pinched a clean part between our fingers as we took it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r229","rowIndex":229,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「うーん、これは何の血なんだろう？　人？　動物？」","en":"“What kind of blood is this? Human? Animal?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r230","rowIndex":230,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「見ただけじゃわからないね……。ポケットにも何も入ってない。……ほら、きみは突っ立ってないで、着替えなよ」","en":"“We can’t tell just by looking... There’s nothing in the pockets, either. ...Come on, don’t just stand there. Get changed.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r231","rowIndex":231,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「うん……」","en":"“All right...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"サーシェンカ白シャツ","displayName":"Sashenka (White Shirt)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r232","rowIndex":232,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　少年は浮かない顔をしながらも、従順に動き始める。","en":"Though he looked glum, the boy obediently began to move.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r233","rowIndex":233,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そしてズボンを脱ぎ、下着になり、全裸になった。彼はさほど羞恥心もないようで、前を隠そうともしない。あまり表情のかわらない顔で服を着替えている。","en":"Then he took off his trousers, stripped to his underwear, and removed that as well. He did not seem especially embarrassed and made no attempt to cover himself. With scarcely a change in expression, he went on changing clothes.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r234","rowIndex":234,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「見なよ。この間の傷はほとんどわからない。信じられない。やっぱり再生したんだわ」","en":"“Look. You can barely see where the wound was before. I can’t believe it. It really did regenerate.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r235","rowIndex":235,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　前に傷があったはずの場所を見て、私たちはそう言った。","en":"We said this as we looked at the spot where the wound should have been.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r236","rowIndex":236,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「本当。すごいねえ。ねえ<tips=63>サーシェンカ</tips>。あなた、<tips=17>タイプB</tips>なの？」","en":"“You’re right. That’s amazing. Hey, <tips=63>Sashenka</tips>—are you <tips=17>Type B</tips>?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r237","rowIndex":237,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=17>タイプB</tips>って何……？」","en":"“What is <tips=17>Type B</tips>...?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r238","rowIndex":238,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「きみって何にも知らないのね」","en":"“You really don’t know anything, do you?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r239","rowIndex":239,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ごめん……」","en":"“I’m sorry...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r240","rowIndex":240,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ほら、ちょっとくるっと回って、背中も見せて」","en":"“Come on, turn around and show us your back, too.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r241","rowIndex":241,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「うん……」","en":"“All right...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r242","rowIndex":242,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どこにも傷がない。すくなくとも、今回の血液はこの子のじゃないみたい。いくらなんでもまだ血が乾いていないくらいの時間なのに、これだけ出血するほどの怪我が完全に再生したとは思えないでしょう。<tips=55>汐松子</tips>にだって不可能だよ」","en":"“There isn’t a wound anywhere. At least this time, the blood doesn’t seem to be his. It’s still wet; there’s no way an injury severe enough to produce this much blood could have regenerated completely in so little time. Even <tips=55>Matsuko Shio</tips> couldn’t do that.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r243","rowIndex":243,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうだね。それにしても、真っ白だね。雪みたい。それに痩せてる。栄養状態がよくないのかしら？」","en":"“True. He’s so pale. Like snow. And he’s thin. Maybe he’s malnourished?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r244","rowIndex":244,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちの一人が、肋骨の浮き出た脇腹に指先で触れると、彼はビクリと身体を揺らす。","en":"One of us touched the side of his body, where his ribs stood out, with her fingertips. He flinched sharply.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r245","rowIndex":245,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ありがとう」","en":"“Thank you.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r246","rowIndex":246,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「もういいわ」","en":"“That’s enough.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r247","rowIndex":247,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちが言うと、彼はのろのろと服を身につける。","en":"At that, he slowly got dressed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r248","rowIndex":248,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ねえきみ、何才なの？」","en":"“How old are you?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r249","rowIndex":249,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それは……」","en":"“I...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"サーシェンカ白シャツ","displayName":"Sashenka (White Shirt)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r250","rowIndex":250,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まあ、断片的な記憶しかない人が、自分の年齢なんかわかるわけないか」","en":"“Well, I guess someone with nothing but fragments of memory couldn’t possibly know his own age.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r251","rowIndex":251,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「同じくらいのとしってあなた言ったけれど、それにしては背が低いよね」","en":"“You said he was about our age, but he is awfully short for that, isn’t he?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r252","rowIndex":252,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちの一人が、彼の緩やかなカーブのかかった髪に手のひらでふれ、それを並行移動させて自分の頭へもってゆき、身長を比べる。","en":"One of us rested a palm on his softly curling hair, then held it level against her own head to compare their heights.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r253","rowIndex":253,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ほら、私たちと身長もかわらない……」","en":"“See? He is as tall as we are...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r254","rowIndex":254,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ねえ、<tips=63>サーシェンカ</tips>、いつもずっと何もしないでいたの？　メモの指示でもなんでもいいけど、何か変なことさせられたとか思ったことある？」","en":"“Hey, <tips=63>Sashenka</tips>, have you really done nothing all this time? It could be instructions in those notes or anything else, but have you ever thought you were being made to do something strange?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r255","rowIndex":255,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どうだったかな……」","en":"“Let me think...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"サーシェンカ白シャツ","displayName":"Sashenka (White Shirt)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r256","rowIndex":256,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼は無表情のまま首を捻る。","en":"His expression unchanged, he tilted his head.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r257","rowIndex":257,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「思い出そうとすること自体久しぶりだ。そのせいかな……いや、そうじゃない。やっぱり、最初からわかりはしないんだ。……変なことって言われても、全部変なことしかないからわからないよ……」","en":"“It’s been a long time since I even tried to remember. Maybe that’s why I can’t... No, that isn’t it. I never knew any of it to begin with. ...Even if you ask me what was strange, everything has been strange, so I don’t know...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"サーシェンカ白シャツ","displayName":"Sashenka (White Shirt)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r258","rowIndex":258,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼は溜息をつく。","en":"He sighed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r259","rowIndex":259,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「じゃあ、もっと具体的な質問をするわ」","en":"“Then I’ll ask you something more specific.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r260","rowIndex":260,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「死体とか人殺しとか言ってたけど、どういうこと？　殺人現場で目が覚める？」","en":"“You mentioned bodies and murder. What did you mean? Do you wake at murder scenes?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r261","rowIndex":261,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうなんだ……何が何だか、全然わからなくて……。こんなの、きみたちだってこわいよね……」","en":"“That’s right... I don’t understand any of it... This must be frightening for you, too...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"サーシェンカ白シャツ","displayName":"Sashenka (White Shirt)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r262","rowIndex":262,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼は俯いてしまう。","en":"He hung his head.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r263","rowIndex":263,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「私たちは別にこわくなんかないよ」","en":"“We’re not scared at all.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r264","rowIndex":264,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あなたの方がこわいでしょう？　死体なんか見せられて」","en":"“You must be the one who’s scared, aren’t you? Being made to look at dead bodies and all.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r265","rowIndex":265,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちが言うと彼はおずおずと顔を上げ、","en":"At that, he timidly raised his head and said,","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r266","rowIndex":266,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「優しいんだね。……僕、きみたちのことがとても好きになったよ」","en":"“You’re both so kind. ...I really like you.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"サーシェンカ白シャツ","displayName":"Sashenka (White Shirt)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r267","rowIndex":267,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そう」","en":"“I see.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r268","rowIndex":268,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「嬉しいわ。じゃあ、私たちも約束してあげる」","en":"“I’m glad. Then we’ll make you a promise too.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r269","rowIndex":269,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あなたに何が起きているのか、その真実を突き止めてみせるわ。なんだか面白そうだもの」","en":"“We’ll get to the truth of what’s happening to you. It sounds rather interesting.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r270","rowIndex":270,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それは……うれしいな」","en":"“That... makes me happy.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"サーシェンカ白シャツ","displayName":"Sashenka (White Shirt)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r271","rowIndex":271,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして彼は笑った。","en":"And then he smiled.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r272","rowIndex":272,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　相変わらず屋敷のなかは静まりかえっている。","en":"The house remained utterly silent.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r273","rowIndex":273,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　騒々しい<tips=9>Y地区</tips>のなかで、ここはまるで別世界のようだ。","en":"Amid the clamor of <tips=9>Y District</tips>, this place seemed like another world.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r274","rowIndex":274,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　自分たちの足音を聞きながら階段を下りるとキッチンを見つけた。それを見て、私たちは喉が渇いているのに気がついた。","en":"Listening to our own footsteps as we descended the stairs, we found the kitchen. The sight of it made us realize we were thirsty.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r275","rowIndex":275,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　カウンターによってキッチンとリビングルームが仕切られた大きな部屋だった。たとえばここでホームパーティをするとして、十人呼んだって余裕を持って楽しめるだろう。","en":"It was a large room, with the kitchen and living room divided by a counter. There would still be plenty of room even if you invited ten people to a house party.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r276","rowIndex":276,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　キッチンのなかには少し古かったが備え付けの大きなオーブンがあり、業務用のものとそっくりのガスコンロがあった。普段は使っていないようで鍋や食器の類はない。けれどほったらかしで埃が積もっているというわけでもなく、掃除が行き届いている。","en":"The kitchen contained a large built-in oven, somewhat old, and a gas range almost identical to commercial equipment. It did not seem to be in regular use; there were no pots or dishes. Yet it had not been left to gather dust. It was meticulously clean.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r277","rowIndex":277,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちはそのシンクで手を洗い、水を飲んだ。浄水器が内蔵されたタイプらしく、蛇口を捻ると下の方から微かな音が聞こえる。","en":"We washed our hands in the sink and drank some water. The faucet seemed to have a built-in water purifier; when we turned it on, a faint hum came from below.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r278","rowIndex":278,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　蛇口を締め水を止めたとき、排水口のなかに何かがあるのを見つけた。","en":"When we turned off the faucet, we noticed something inside the drain.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r279","rowIndex":279,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あれ、何かある……」","en":"“Huh? There’s something in there...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r280","rowIndex":280,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　カバーを外してゴミ受けを確認すると、ピンク色の小さな塊がそのなかに落ちていた。","en":"We removed the cover and inspected the strainer beneath it. A small pink mass lay inside.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r281","rowIndex":281,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なんだこれ……」","en":"“What is this...?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r282","rowIndex":282,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　指先と人差し指でつまみ上げ、二人でそれをまじまじと見つめる。","en":"We pinched it between thumb and forefinger and examined it closely together.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r283","rowIndex":283,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「これって……」","en":"“Could this be...?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r284","rowIndex":284,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「うん、たぶん……」","en":"“Yes. Probably...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r285","rowIndex":285,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それは、どう見ても人間の指先にしか見えなかった。人差し指か、中指か……第一関節から先の部分が切断され、その上には爪もついていた。","en":"By every appearance, it was the tip of a human finger—an index finger, perhaps, or a middle finger. The portion beyond the first joint had been severed, and the nail remained attached.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r286","rowIndex":286,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なるほどねえ」","en":"“I see.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r287","rowIndex":287,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その指をシンク脇にそっと置くと、流水で触れてしまった指先を洗う。","en":"We gently set the finger beside the sink, then washed the fingertips that had touched it under running water.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r288","rowIndex":288,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちはお互い頷きあい、キッチンを調べ始めた。","en":"We nodded to each other and began investigating the kitchen.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r289","rowIndex":289,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　流しの下の棚には食器や鍋はなかったが、そのかわり大きな包丁があった。端の方に若干の刃こぼれがあり、使用したあとが見られる。","en":"The cupboard beneath the sink contained no dishes or pots, but in their place lay a large kitchen knife. Small chips marked one edge of the blade, which showed signs of use.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r290","rowIndex":290,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして壁に並んだ食器棚のなかに、私たちはもっと直接的なものを発見した。","en":"Then, inside the cabinets lining the wall, we found something less ambiguous.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r291","rowIndex":291,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　白い発泡ウレタンのシートで包装されたものが並んでいる。一つや二つではなく、棚一杯に、整然と並んでいる。","en":"Objects wrapped in white sheets of urethane foam lined the shelves—not one or two, but enough to fill the cabinet, all arranged in perfect order.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r292","rowIndex":292,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「備え付けの鍋や食器？」","en":"“Pots and dishes supplied with the house?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r293","rowIndex":293,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それにしては量が多すぎる。それに、そんなものまで備え付けであるものかしら」","en":"“There are way too many. Besides, would a place really come with all of those?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r294","rowIndex":294,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ガラス戸を開けると、戸のなかに隠れていた無数の小バエが一斉に飛び出して、私たちの髪の毛や服にまとわりついた。そして、むせかえるような悪臭が同時に解き放たれる。","en":"When we opened the glass door, countless tiny flies that had been hidden inside burst out at once and swarmed around our hair and clothes. At the same moment, a choking stench was released.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r295","rowIndex":295,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「けほっ、こほっ……」","en":"“Cough, cough...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r296","rowIndex":296,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちは咳き込む口もとを服の袖で覆いながら、もう片方の手で小バエを振り払った。","en":"We covered our coughing mouths with our sleeves and used our free hands to drive away the flies.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r297","rowIndex":297,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ひとまず開いた戸の前を離れ、部屋の外に退避する。","en":"For the moment, we backed away from the open cabinet and took refuge outside the room.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r298","rowIndex":298,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「気持ち悪い。吐きそう……」","en":"“That’s disgusting. I think I’m going to throw up...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r299","rowIndex":299,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「私も……」","en":"“Me too...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r300","rowIndex":300,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちは涙目になり、くしゃくしゃになった顔をつき合わせた。そしてそこで何度か深呼吸をしてから、ハンカチで口と鼻を抑えつつキッチンに戻った。","en":"Eyes watering and faces contorted, we looked at each other. After taking several deep breaths, we covered our mouths and noses with handkerchiefs and returned to the kitchen.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r301","rowIndex":301,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　棚のなかから解き放たれた小バエたちと悪臭は部屋全体に拡散している。部屋のすべてが臭くなった分、棚の前の強烈な悪臭はやや薄れていたし、刺激臭に晒された私たちの鼻も馬鹿になってにおいを感じ取りにくくなっていた。","en":"The flies and stench from the cabinets had spread throughout the room. Now that the whole room reeked, the air directly before the shelves was no longer so much worse than anywhere else. The irritant had also numbed our noses, making the smell harder to detect.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r302","rowIndex":302,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「『ちから』を使う？」","en":"“Should we use the ‘power’?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r303","rowIndex":303,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「やめておいた方がいいかも。この手の建物には、たまに<tips=42>サイキック探知機</tips>が設置されてるし」","en":"“Maybe we’d better not. Buildings like this sometimes have <tips=42>psychic detectors</tips> installed.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r304","rowIndex":304,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「別にいいじゃない。警報なんか鳴ったって。いつも『ちから』を使ってるじゃない」","en":"“What does it matter? Who cares if an alarm goes off? You use your ‘power’ all the time.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r305","rowIndex":305,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ここに警察が乗り込んできたら厄介でしょう」","en":"“It’ll be trouble if the police storm in here.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r306","rowIndex":306,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「でも……」","en":"“But...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r307","rowIndex":307,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「もう、手を使おう！　私たちは、自分の手を汚すことを恐れるような人間にはなりたくなかったはずだもの」","en":"“Enough. We’ll use our hands! We never wanted to become the sort of people who feared dirtying their own hands.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r308","rowIndex":308,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうだね。そうだったね」","en":"“Yeah. That’s right.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r309","rowIndex":309,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　棚の前で、私たちは片手で口元を押さえ、それぞれがもう片方の手を伸ばす。その二人分の二本の手で、そっと白い包みの左右に触れた。","en":"Before the cabinet, each of us covered her mouth with one hand and extended the other. Together, those two hands touched the opposite sides of a white package.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r310","rowIndex":310,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　協力して持ち上げると、それは柔らかく、ずっしりとした重みがあった。そして、持ち上げた拍子に液体が底部のほうに回って私たちの指を汚した。さらに、大量の小バエがわっと飛び上がって私たちの顔を襲う。","en":"When we lifted it together, the package felt soft, yet heavy and dense. The motion sent liquid running toward the bottom and over our fingers. At the same time, a great cloud of tiny flies rose and swarmed our faces.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r311","rowIndex":311,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　思わず声が出て、そして取り落としそうになるが、なんとか耐え、震える二人の腕でキッチンのテーブルの上に置く。","en":"We cried out and nearly dropped it, but managed to hold on and set the package on the kitchen table with both pairs of arms trembling.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r312","rowIndex":312,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「もういいっ！　限界！　ここから先は『ちから』をつかう。探知機が鳴ったらその時はその時よ」","en":"“That’s enough! I’m at my limit! We’re using the ‘power’ from here on out. If the detector goes off, we’ll deal with it when it happens.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r313","rowIndex":313,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちの一人が涙目でそう宣言する。","en":"One of us declared this, her eyes watering.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r314","rowIndex":314,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「うう、そうしよう。もう充分手を汚したよう」","en":"“Ugh, let’s. We’ve gotten our hands dirty enough already.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r315","rowIndex":315,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　もう一人が同じく涙目でそう返す。","en":"The other replied, her eyes watering too.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r316","rowIndex":316,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちは水道水でねとつく指先の汚れを洗浄する。石けんで擦っても匂いは完全には落ちてくれなかったので、そこは諦めた。","en":"We washed the sticky grime from our fingertips under the running tap. Even scrubbing with soap failed to remove the smell entirely, so we gave up.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r317","rowIndex":317,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　テーブルに置かれた包みからは茶色く濁った液体がしみ出している。私たちはその前に立った。","en":"Cloudy brown liquid seeped from the package on the table. We stood before it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r318","rowIndex":318,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちの一人が『ちから』を使う。","en":"One of us used her ‘power.’","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r319","rowIndex":319,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　包みの上部を固定するテープが見えない指につままれたように引き剥がされ、ぴりぴりと音がする。それが完全に包みから剥がれると、テープは空中で力を失い、ハラハラとテーブルの下に舞い落ちた。","en":"The tape securing the top of the package was torn away as though pinched by invisible fingers, making a faint ripping sound. Once it had come completely free, the tape lost its invisible support and fluttered down beneath the table.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r320","rowIndex":320,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そうしたら、次は包み自体がときほどかれる番だ。","en":"Then it was the package itself that began to come undone.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r321","rowIndex":321,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　発泡ウレタンのシートは巻き付くように中のなにかを覆っている。『ちから』によってテープが剥がれて自由になった一端を水平に引き、ごろんごろんと包みをその場で回転させながら、シートをはぎ取る。","en":"The sheet of urethane foam was wrapped around the object within. The ‘power’ pulled the newly freed end sideways, and the heavy package rolled in place as the sheet unwound from around it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r322","rowIndex":322,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そうして姿を現したのは、蛆にまみれた腐肉の立方体であった。","en":"What emerged was a cube of rotten flesh crawling with maggots.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r323","rowIndex":323,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ひときわ激しい悪臭が私たちの鼻を、そして目までも刺激する。","en":"An even more violent stench struck us, burning our noses and eyes.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r324","rowIndex":324,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「これは人間の太ももの部分ね」","en":"“This is part of a human thigh.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r325","rowIndex":325,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうね。上の方は皮膚かしら？　色がかわっているけど」","en":"“Yes. Is that skin on top? The color has changed.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r326","rowIndex":326,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちは鼻と口を袖で覆いながら頷き合った。","en":"Covering our noses and mouths with our sleeves, we nodded to one another.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r327","rowIndex":327,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　腐敗と昆虫によって本来の姿を大きく損なっていたが、僅かに残る皮膚の表面の質感や、そのゆるやかな曲線は、人間以外の何かが作り出したものとは考えにくかった。","en":"Decay and insects had badly ravaged its original form, but the texture and gentle curve of the small amount of skin that remained made it difficult to imagine that the flesh had come from anything but a human body.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r328","rowIndex":328,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「女性かしら？」","en":"“A woman?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r329","rowIndex":329,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうっぽいけど……」","en":"“Looks like it...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r330","rowIndex":330,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　断面は腐敗によって黒ずんだ筋肉と、黄色みがかった脂肪が層を作っている。その皮下脂肪の感じを見ながら私たちはそんなふうに話し合った。","en":"Muscle darkened by decay and yellowish fat formed layers across the cut surface. We reached that conclusion as we studied the appearance of the subcutaneous fat.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r331","rowIndex":331,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「こんなのが、山ほど棚に詰め込まれているの？」","en":"“The cabinets are packed with piles and piles of this?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r332","rowIndex":332,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あの子がこれをやったのかしら？　だとしたら、とんでもなく偏執的ね」","en":"“Did that boy do this? If he did, he’s incredibly obsessive.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r333","rowIndex":333,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"『ちから』によって、肉片をひっくり返し、様々な角度から観察していると、背後で物音がした。","en":"As we turned the piece of flesh with the ‘power’ and observed it from various angles, we heard a sound behind us.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r334","rowIndex":334,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　何者かが階段を下りて来る音である。","en":"It was the sound of someone coming down the stairs.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r335","rowIndex":335,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちは顔を見合わせた。","en":"We looked at each other.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r336","rowIndex":336,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「つきつけて聞いてみる？　それとも、隠して知らない振りをする？」","en":"“Should we confront him with this and ask? Or hide it and pretend we don’t know?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r337","rowIndex":337,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どっちがいいかな？」","en":"“Which would be better?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r338","rowIndex":338,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「聞いてみようか。たぶん、彼が犯人だし」","en":"“Let’s ask him. He’s probably the culprit anyway.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r339","rowIndex":339,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうだね……」","en":"“Yeah...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r340","rowIndex":340,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　コツコツと足音が近づき、そしてノブをガチャリと回してドアが開いた。","en":"The footsteps clicked closer. The handle turned with a rattle, and the door opened.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r341","rowIndex":341,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そこに現れたのは<tips=63>サーシェンカ</tips>ではなかった。","en":"The person who appeared was not <tips=63>Sashenka</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r342","rowIndex":342,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ああ、めんどくさい、めんどくさい。なんてことをしてくれる。せっかく片付けたものを、散らかしてもらっちゃこまるじゃないか」","en":"“Oh, what a bother, what a bother. Now look what you’ve done. I went to all the trouble of putting everything away, and you’ve made a mess of it.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アレクセイ","displayName":"Alexei","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r343","rowIndex":343,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　溜息をついたのは、<tips=63>サーシェンカ</tips>よりもっと年上の、黒い髪の男だった。彼は<tips=63>サーシェンカ</tips>とは違って流暢な日本語をあやつっている。","en":"The man who sighed was black-haired and much older than <tips=63>Sashenka</tips>. Unlike <tips=63>Sashenka</tips>, he spoke fluent Japanese.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r344","rowIndex":344,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　困ったような顔をして、くっきりとした二重の目で私たちを静かに見つめていた。","en":"A troubled look on his face, he watched us quietly through sharply defined double-lidded eyes.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r345","rowIndex":345,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「せっかくキレイに片付けて、掃除をしたのに、そんなに汚しちゃいけない。まったくこれは……」","en":"“After I went to all the trouble of putting everything away neatly and cleaning up, you really shouldn’t make such a mess. Honestly, this is just...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アレクセイ","displayName":"Alexei","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r346","rowIndex":346,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ブツブツと呟く男を横目に、私たちはお互いに目で合図を送りあって頷く。","en":"Watching the muttering man from the corners of our eyes, we exchanged a glance and nodded.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r347","rowIndex":347,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして、片方が駆け足で素早く男に近づいた。","en":"Then one of us darted over to him.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r348","rowIndex":348,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あっ！」","en":"“Ah!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アレクセイ","displayName":"Alexei","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r349","rowIndex":349,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　気づいたときにはもう遅く、男は驚きの表情のまま押し倒される。","en":"By the time he noticed, it was too late: still wearing an expression of surprise, the man was knocked to the floor.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r350","rowIndex":350,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼を押し倒した私たちの片方の目は金色に変わっていた。この状態ならば、とても早く、そして強く身体を動かすことが出来る。","en":"The eyes of the one who had knocked him down had turned gold. In that state, she could move with tremendous speed and strength.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r351","rowIndex":351,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そのまま片方は男に馬乗りになって抑えつけ、そして動かなかったもう片方はナイフを取り出して男の目の前に立った。","en":"The first remained astride the man and pinned him down, while the other, who had not moved, drew a knife and stood before him.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r352","rowIndex":352,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「おいっ、何をしやがる」","en":"“Hey! What the hell are you doing?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アレクセイ","displayName":"Alexei","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r353","rowIndex":353,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　男はもがいたが、並の力でははねのけることは出来ない。","en":"The man struggled, but ordinary strength could not throw her off.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r354","rowIndex":354,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「小娘のくせに、化け物みたいな力だ」","en":"“For a little girl, you’ve got the strength of a monster.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アレクセイ","displayName":"Alexei","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r355","rowIndex":355,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　男は吐き捨てるように言う。","en":"The man spat the words.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r356","rowIndex":356,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あなたがこの気色のわるいオブジェの作者？」","en":"“Are you the artist behind these disgusting objects?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r357","rowIndex":357,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　片方がナイフをちらつかせながらそう問う。","en":"One of us asked, flashing the knife before him.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r358","rowIndex":358,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そのとおりだ。その子はね、街角に立っていた娼婦だよ。名前はなんだっけな……忘れちまったが、素晴らしい女性だった」","en":"“That’s right. She was a prostitute who worked a street corner. What was her name...? I’ve forgotten, but she was a marvelous woman.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アレクセイ","displayName":"Alexei","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r359","rowIndex":359,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　汗だくになっても抜け出せない男は抵抗をやめ、白い歯をむき出して笑った。","en":"Drenched in sweat and still unable to break free, the man stopped resisting and grinned, baring his white teeth.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r360","rowIndex":360,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どこから入って来たの？　玄関のドアが開いたような音はしなかったはずだけど」","en":"“How did you get in? We should have heard the front door open.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r361","rowIndex":361,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「質問をするつもりなら、このみっともない状態を解除してくれると助かるんだが？」","en":"“If you intend to question me, I would appreciate being released from this humiliating position.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アレクセイ","displayName":"Alexei","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r362","rowIndex":362,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　大した力のない相手だ。恐れることはないだろう。","en":"He was not very strong. There was probably nothing to fear.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r363","rowIndex":363,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちはポケットになんの武器も入っていないのを確認してから、彼を立たせた。","en":"We checked his pockets for weapons, then let him stand.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r364","rowIndex":364,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　実際彼は武器を持っていなかった。のみならず、武器以外にもどんな所持品もなく、身につけた白いシャツと黒いズボンだけだった。そしてそれは、<tips=63>サーシェンカ</tips>の着替えとして私たちが置いていったものと同じように見える。","en":"He did, in fact, carry no weapon. Nor did he have any other belongings. All he wore was a white shirt and black trousers, and they looked just like the clothes we had left for <tips=63>Sashenka</tips> to change into.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r365","rowIndex":365,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「乱暴なやつらだ。まったくもっておれの好みじゃない。なんだって、あのガキはこんなやつらを気にいっているんだ」","en":"“What a violent pair. You’re not my type in the least. Why would that brat take a liking to people like you?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アレクセイ","displayName":"Alexei","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r366","rowIndex":366,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　男は服を叩いて埃を払いながらぶつくさ言った。","en":"The man grumbled as he beat the dust from his clothes.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r367","rowIndex":367,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あのガキって<tips=63>サーシェンカ</tips>のこと？」","en":"“By ‘that brat,’ do you mean <tips=63>Sashenka</tips>?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r368","rowIndex":368,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どういう関係なの？」","en":"“How are you connected to him?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r369","rowIndex":369,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ほら見ろ、ここがすりむけている」","en":"“Look. The skin’s scraped off right here.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アレクセイ","displayName":"Alexei","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r370","rowIndex":370,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　男は私たちの質問には答えず、そう言って肘を見せる。","en":"Ignoring our questions, he showed us his elbow.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r371","rowIndex":371,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　確かに肘の先端部分は皮がすりむけて、ピンク色の擦過傷が出来ていた。","en":"The skin over the point of his elbow was indeed scraped, leaving a pink abrasion.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r372","rowIndex":372,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しかし、その傷が存在したのはほんの僅かな時間で、私たちの目の前でみるみる治り、すぐに消えてなくなった。","en":"Yet the injury existed for only a moment. Before our eyes, it rapidly healed and soon vanished without a trace.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r373","rowIndex":373,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「その再生力は<tips=63>サーシェンカ</tips>と同じ」","en":"“That regeneration is the same as <tips=63>Sashenka’s</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r374","rowIndex":374,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「説明してもらうよ」","en":"“You will explain.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r375","rowIndex":375,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……えらそうなやつらだな。まあいい、見られてしまったんだ。だが、その前に水を一杯」","en":"“...You two are awfully full of yourselves. Oh, well. You’ve already seen it. But first, a glass of water.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アレクセイ","displayName":"Alexei","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r376","rowIndex":376,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　男は悠然と靴音を立てて私たちの目の前を横切ると、棚からグラスを取り出してシンクの前に立った。","en":"The man strode calmly across our path, his shoes sounding upon the floor, took a glass from a cabinet, and stood before the sink.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r377","rowIndex":377,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「おい、この場所じゃだめだ。使ったら元の場所に戻して貰わないと困る」","en":"“Hey, it can’t stay here. If you use something, put it back where it belongs.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アレクセイ","displayName":"Alexei","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r378","rowIndex":378,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼はそう言って私たちが手を洗うのに使った石けんを掴むと、横に移動させた。元々私たちが置いた場所と、彼が移動させた場所に、何の違いがあるのかは見ていてもわからなかった。","en":"He picked up the soap we had used to wash our hands and moved it to one side. We could see no difference between the place where we had left it and the place he chose.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r379","rowIndex":379,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼はグラスに水道水を注ぎ一息に飲み干した。","en":"He filled the glass with tap water and drained it in one breath.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r380","rowIndex":380,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そしてそのグラスを、テーブルの上、腐った肉塊の隣に置く。","en":"Then he set the glass on the table, beside the rotten mass of flesh.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r381","rowIndex":381,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まったく、可哀想に。こんなに醜い姿を電灯の下にさらしてしまうなんて。……気の毒だと思わないか？」","en":"“Poor thing. To expose such an ugly form beneath the electric light... Don’t you feel sorry for her?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アレクセイ","displayName":"Alexei","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r382","rowIndex":382,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼は引き出しを開け、ティッシュ箱のような紙箱から医療機関でよく使われる使い捨てのプラスチックグローブを取り出すと両手にはめた。","en":"He opened a drawer. From a paper carton resembling a tissue box, he removed the disposable plastic gloves commonly used in medical facilities and pulled them over both hands.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r383","rowIndex":383,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「待っていなよ。いま、もとのように清潔に包み直して、ちゃんと棚にキレイに並べてやるからね」","en":"“Just wait. I’ll wrap you up nice and clean again, the way you were, and set you back neatly on the shelf.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アレクセイ","displayName":"Alexei","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r384","rowIndex":384,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　男は肉塊に話しかけながら身体をかがめると、床に落ちていたシートを拾い上げ、そしてそれでもってテーブルの上の肉塊を包み始める。","en":"Speaking to the mass of flesh, the man bent down, picked up the sheet from the floor, and began wrapping the flesh on the table with it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r385","rowIndex":385,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「この子は実に魅力的な瞳と足を持った女性だった。黒髪のアジア人でね、身長は１６０センチ。体重は５０キロくらいだったろう。ちょっと舌っ足らずでね。本人は十八才だと言っていたよ」","en":"“That girl had truly lovely eyes and legs. She was an Asian woman with black hair, a hundred and sixty centimeters tall and around fifty kilograms. She spoke with a slight lisp. She told me she was eighteen.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アレクセイ","displayName":"Alexei","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r386","rowIndex":386,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼はシートと肉塊の間にわずかの空気も入らぬよう、几帳面に指先を動かしながら丁寧に包む。","en":"Meticulously working his fingertips, he wrapped it with care so that not even the slightest pocket of air remained between the sheet and the flesh.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r387","rowIndex":387,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして、腐敗によってあふれでた液体がしみ出るたび、キッチンペーパーで拭う。","en":"Whenever fluid released by the decay seeped out, he wiped it away with a paper towel.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r388","rowIndex":388,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「声をかけたのは彼女の方だった。いつだってそうさ。おれの方から女の子に声をかけたことはない。おれに関わるとどうしても悲しい結末になってしまうし、それは見たくないからね。彼女も、あそこで声をかけなければこんな目に遭うことはなかったのに。気の毒なものさ」","en":"“She was the one who approached me. It always happens that way. I have never approached a girl myself. Anyone who becomes involved with me inevitably comes to a sad end, and I don’t want to see that. If only she hadn’t spoken to me there, none of this would have happened to her. Poor thing.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アレクセイ","displayName":"Alexei","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r389","rowIndex":389,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼の細い指によって手際よく肉塊は包まれてゆく。","en":"His slender fingers made quick work of wrapping the flesh.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r390","rowIndex":390,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「彼女に誘われるままおれたちは近くのホテルに入り、そこでセックスをした。それが終わると彼女はおれともっと仲良くなりたいと言い出したんだ。だからおれは、親しくなった相手にはいつもとても酷いことをしてしまうからやめた方が良いと、正直に言ってやった。すると彼女は言ったんだ。『あなたになら何をされてもいいわ』ってね」","en":"“At her invitation, we entered a nearby hotel and had sex. When it was over, she said she wanted to get to know me better. So I told her honestly that I always end up doing terrible things to people I grow close to, and that she would be better off keeping her distance. Then she said, ‘You can do anything you want to me.’”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アレクセイ","displayName":"Alexei","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r391","rowIndex":391,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼は引き出しから取り出したテープを適度な長さでカットし、包んだシートの端をとめた。","en":"He took tape from a drawer, cut off a suitable length, and secured the edge of the wrapping.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r392","rowIndex":392,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「おれだって殺人なんかしたくないんだよ。命ってのは取り返しのつかないものだし。人を殺す感触は、あれは、本当にいやなものだ。でも彼女はそこまで言うし、おれは彼女に好感を持っていた。となれば、もうやるしかない。……ナイフを刺した時の、彼女の恐怖で引きつった悲痛な表情と、食用蛙をうっかり踏みつぶしてしまったような、ぐえっという低い悲鳴が忘れられないよ。ああ、人を殺すというのは、本当に恐ろしくていやなものだ。殺す瞬間は本当にいやだ。吐きそうになる。思い出すだけでもぞっとする」","en":"“I don’t want to murder anyone, either. Once a life is taken, it can never be restored. And the sensation of killing someone—that is truly awful. But she had gone that far, and I was fond of her. That left me no choice but to do it. ...I can’t forget the anguished expression on her face, drawn tight with terror when I stabbed her, or the low ‘guh’ she let out, like an edible frog accidentally crushed underfoot. Ah, killing a person is truly horrible and repulsive. The instant of killing is truly awful. It makes me want to vomit. Just remembering it sends a chill through me.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アレクセイ","displayName":"Alexei","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r393","rowIndex":393,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼は包み上がった肉塊を、元の食器棚に戻した。","en":"He returned the wrapped flesh to its original cabinet.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r394","rowIndex":394,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「よし、これでキレイに並んだ。見なよ。美しく整頓されているだろう？　棚のこっち側が下半身で、こちらが上半身。これは頭部を半分に割ったやつだ。こうやって、かつて人間だったものが静かに、そして整然と棚に並んでいるのを見ると、なんとも言えないうっとりとした気持ちにならないか？　おれはこうすると、なにか世界の大きなものと繋がったような気持ちになれるんだよ。この喜びのおかげで、おれはなんとか、あの胸くそ悪い作業を続けることが出来るんだ。彼女たちも死んだことは残念だろうが、最終的には満足だろう。こんなふうにちゃんとしてくれるのは、おれくらいしかいないんだから」","en":"“There. Neatly arranged again. Look—isn’t it beautifully organized? This side of the cabinet is for lower bodies, and that side is for upper bodies. This one is a head split in half. When you see things that were once human beings sitting silently in perfect order on the shelves like this, don’t you feel an indescribable rapture? When I do this, I can feel as though I’ve connected to something vast in the world. That joy is what enables me to carry on with that revolting work. They may regret being dead, but in the end I’m sure they’re satisfied. After all, I’m the only one who would take proper care of them this way.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アレクセイ","displayName":"Alexei","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r395","rowIndex":395,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そうして彼は振り返ると、言葉通り恍惚の表情を浮かべていた。そして、その股間の辺りが大きくなってズボンを下から突き上げているのが目立った。","en":"He turned toward us with precisely the rapturous expression he had described. A pronounced swelling at his crotch pushed upward against his trousers.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r396","rowIndex":396,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「おれは生真面目すぎるんだよ。なんでもちゃんとしなきゃ気が済まない。おれからすれば、おれがただ自然なだけで、みんなのほうがあまりにもいい加減なんだ」","en":"“I’m too conscientious, that’s all. I can’t stand to leave anything improperly done. From my perspective, I’m simply behaving naturally; everyone else is far too careless.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アレクセイ","displayName":"Alexei","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r397","rowIndex":397,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼は私たちをじっとみる。","en":"He stared at us.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r398","rowIndex":398,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちは肩をすくめる。","en":"We shrugged.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r399","rowIndex":399,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ちょっと興味深いけど」","en":"“It’s kind of interesting, but...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r400","rowIndex":400,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「共感出来る部分はないかな」","en":"“I don’t think there’s any part of it we can relate to.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r401","rowIndex":401,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「仕方ないね。わかりやしないのさ。誰にもわかることなどできないのさ。もしかしたら、これはおれ個人の生理的な要素が強いのかもしれない。だとしたら、どうしてこうなったのか。おれはただ、感じてしまうんだよ。おまえたちが男にキスをされ股間を触られた時に、自分でわざとやったわけでもないのに濡れてしまうようにね。生まれながらにそうなのさ。もし世の中に神がいるのなら、それがおれをこういうふうに作ったんだよ。人とは違うように。理由はわからないが、神はおれを選んだってことだ」","en":"“It can’t be helped. You don’t understand. No one could possibly understand. Maybe this is rooted largely in my own physiology. If so, why did I turn out this way? I simply feel it, that’s all. The way the two of you get wet when a man kisses you and touches you between the legs, even when you haven’t made it happen on purpose. I was born this way. If there’s a god in this world, then that god made me like this—different from everyone else. I don’t know why, but it means that god chose me.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アレクセイ","displayName":"Alexei","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r402","rowIndex":402,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼はフと笑った。","en":"He gave a small laugh.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r403","rowIndex":403,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「一人だけ？　この街に来てから何人もやったの？」","en":"“Only one? Have you killed many since coming to this city?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r404","rowIndex":404,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いや、大してやってない。ほんのちょっとだけだよ。まだ十人もいっていないと思う。いやになってゴミに捨てちゃった子もいるけれど、でも、手元に置いておきたいお気に入りにも出会えたから良かったんだ。ほら、ここに」","en":"“No, not many. Only a few. I don’t think it’s even been ten yet. There were some girls I got tired of and threw out with the trash, but I was lucky enough to find some favorites I wanted to keep close. Look—right here.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アレクセイ","displayName":"Alexei","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r405","rowIndex":405,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼はいくつもの包みが並んだ食器棚を指さす。","en":"He pointed toward the cabinet with its many packages.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r406","rowIndex":406,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まあ、それはいいさ。おれのことはもういいだろう。で、ちょっと聞きたいんだが、これを知ったおまえたちはどうするつもりなんだ？　警察にでも通報するかね？」","en":"“Well, never mind that. Enough about me. But there is one thing I’d like to ask: now that you know about this, what do you intend to do? Report me to the police?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アレクセイ","displayName":"Alexei","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r407","rowIndex":407,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そう言われて、私たちは顔を見合わせた。","en":"At the question, we looked at each other.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r408","rowIndex":408,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そういえば、そういうルールだったね」","en":"“Come to think of it, that was the rule.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r409","rowIndex":409,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「私たち、生まれてから一度も通報ってアイデアを思いついたことはなかったわ」","en":"“Not once since we were born has it ever occurred to us to report anything.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r410","rowIndex":410,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「善良な市民なら当然のことを忘れるだなんて。あんまりふざけないでくれ」","en":"“I can’t believe decent citizens would forget their most obvious duty. Don’t be ridiculous.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アレクセイ","displayName":"Alexei","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r411","rowIndex":411,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そう言って男は溜息をついた。","en":"With that, the man sighed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r412","rowIndex":412,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いい？　私たちは、自分が何者であるかは、いつだって自分で決めるの」","en":"“Listen. We always decide for ourselves what we are.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r413","rowIndex":413,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「私たちが善良な市民として振る舞うかどうかも、これから決める」","en":"“We’ll decide for ourselves whether to behave like respectable citizens.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r414","rowIndex":414,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「だって、そうじゃなければしなくちゃいけないことが何もかも自動的に決まってしまって、生きている意味がないでしょう？」","en":"“Otherwise, everything we’re supposed to do would be decided for us automatically. What would be the point of living?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r415","rowIndex":415,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「私たち、世の中には自分の知らないことがたくさんあるのを知ってるわ」","en":"“We know there are lots of things in the world we don’t know.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r416","rowIndex":416,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「だから、何かをはじめから決めつけたりはしない。すべてのことは味を見てから決める」","en":"“That’s why we never make up our minds about anything from the start. We taste everything before we decide.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r417","rowIndex":417,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ふん、えらそうに。……じゃあどうするつもりだ？」","en":"“Hmph. So high and mighty... Well, what are you going to do?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アレクセイ","displayName":"Alexei","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r418","rowIndex":418,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼は傍らの椅子を引き寄せて、その上に座った。","en":"He drew a nearby chair toward himself and sat down.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r419","rowIndex":419,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なあ、おれは自分が最低の人殺しだってことは分かっているんだ。社会としては、おれなんか刑務所かどこかに閉じ込めて、一生殺人をしないようにしなきゃいけないだろう。おれはそれでもいいと思ってる。絶対脱出出来ない場所に閉じ込められたならば、おれは残りの人生を、詩を読みながら静かに暮らせる」","en":"“Listen. I know I’m the lowest kind of murderer. Society ought to lock someone like me in prison or somewhere else and keep me from killing for the rest of my life. I would be fine with that. If I could be locked away somewhere absolutely impossible to escape, I could spend the rest of my life quietly reading poetry.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アレクセイ","displayName":"Alexei","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r420","rowIndex":420,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「つかまったら、あなたに残りの人生なんかないでしょう」","en":"“If they caught you, there wouldn’t be any ‘rest of your life’ for you.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r421","rowIndex":421,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「最近は、すぐに死刑執行されるからねー」","en":"“They’re pretty quick to execute people these days, you know.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r422","rowIndex":422,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちが茶化すのを彼は無視する。","en":"He ignored our teasing.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r423","rowIndex":423,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ただね、悲しいことに、おれを閉じ込められる場所なんか世界に存在しないんだ。おれが閉じ込められるのをいくら望もうと、誰にもおれを閉じ込めることは出来ない。閉じ込めるだけでなく、おれを殺すことも出来ない。だから、おれはこのまま女を殺し続けるしかないんだ。悲しい話だよ。社会にとってはね」","en":"“But sadly, there is no place in the world that can hold me. However desperately I might wish to be confined, no one can confine me. Nor can anyone kill me. Therefore, I have no choice but to go on killing women as I do now. A sad state of affairs—for society, that is.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アレクセイ","displayName":"Alexei","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r424","rowIndex":424,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼は大げさに表情を歪めて溜息をついた。","en":"He pulled an exaggerated face and sighed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r425","rowIndex":425,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「女の子を好きになったら、いつだって一生大事にしようと決意するんだよ。結局それだけなんだ。好きな相手をいつも側に置いておきたいという欲求自体は自然なものだろう？　ただおれは少し度を越してるんだ」","en":"“Whenever I fall in love with a girl, I resolve to treasure her for the rest of my life. That’s all it amounts to in the end. The desire to always keep someone you love at your side is natural, isn’t it? I merely take it a little too far.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アレクセイ","displayName":"Alexei","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r426","rowIndex":426,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「少しどころじゃないでしょう」","en":"“That’s a lot more than a little.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r427","rowIndex":427,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どこからどう見ても大変態だね」","en":"“Any way you look at it, you are a colossal pervert.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r428","rowIndex":428,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちはそう言って頷き合った。","en":"We said so, then nodded to each other.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r429","rowIndex":429,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「もうわかった。あなたが自分のこと大好きなのはよくわかった。だから、あなたのくだらない自分語りは後でまたきくわ」","en":"“We get it now. We understand perfectly well that you adore yourself. You can continue your boring monologue about yourself later.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r430","rowIndex":430,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「今は、大変態の人殺しだってことだけわかれば充分。あなたは自分のこと特別だと思ってるみたいだけど、平凡な変態だよ」","en":"“For now, all we need to know is that you’re a killer and a colossal pervert. You seem to think you’re special, but you’re just an ordinary pervert.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r431","rowIndex":431,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「おまえたちは何もわかっていない。視野が狭いし、教育が足りていないんだろうきっと」","en":"“You understand nothing. You’re narrow-minded, and probably undereducated.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アレクセイ","displayName":"Alexei","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r432","rowIndex":432,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちは返事のかわりに揃って溜息をつき、","en":"Instead of answering, we sighed together.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r433","rowIndex":433,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それより、最初の質問に答えて頂戴」","en":"“Forget that. Answer our first question.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r434","rowIndex":434,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=63>サーシェンカ</tips>とどういう関係なの？」","en":"“What is your relationship with <tips=63>Sashenka</tips>?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r435","rowIndex":435,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「彼もあなたの仲間？」","en":"“Is he one of you?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r436","rowIndex":436,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あなたたちはこの街で、一体なにをしているの？」","en":"“What in the world are all of you doing in this city?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r437","rowIndex":437,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そんなに一遍に質問するもんじゃない……まったく、なんて非常識なガキどもだ」","en":"“You shouldn’t ask so many questions all at once... Honestly, what an ill-mannered pair of brats.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アレクセイ","displayName":"Alexei","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r438","rowIndex":438,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼は呆れて首を左右に振る。","en":"He shook his head in exasperation.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r439","rowIndex":439,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あのガキのことは、あとでちゃんと教えてやる。その前におれの質問に答えろ。先に訊いたはずだぞ。おまえらはこれからどうするつもりなんだ？」","en":"“I’ll tell you all about that brat later. First, answer my question. I asked you first, remember. What do you plan to do now?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アレクセイ","displayName":"Alexei","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r440","rowIndex":440,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「警察には突き出さない」","en":"“We won’t hand you over to the police.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r441","rowIndex":441,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あなたは好きに生きればいいわ」","en":"“Live however you like.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r442","rowIndex":442,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちはそう言った。彼は神経質そうに片方の眉をつり上げる。","en":"We said this. He raised one eyebrow with a nervous look.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r443","rowIndex":443,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あなたが誰を殺そうが私たちには関係がないもの」","en":"“We don’t care whom you kill.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r444","rowIndex":444,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どうでもいいけど、あなたは人殺しとして生まれたんだから、自信をもって人殺しとしてのくだらない人生を送ればいいのよ。人殺しのくせに、善人のフリして自分の悪口を言うだなんて卑怯だわ。本当は自分のこと大好きなくせに」","en":"“Whatever. You were born a murderer, so hold your head high and live your worthless life as one. It’s cowardly to pretend to be a good person and run yourself down when you’re a murderer. You really love yourself, don’t you?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r445","rowIndex":445,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「好き勝手に生きて、そして最後は人殺しとして残酷でむごいやりかたで殺されればいいわ」","en":"“Live exactly as you please. Then, in the end, be killed as a murderer in some cruel and brutal fashion.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r446","rowIndex":446,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「私たち、何かを裁こうなんて思わない」","en":"“We have no desire to pass judgment on anything.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r447","rowIndex":447,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ただ色んなことを、もっとよく知りたいだけなの」","en":"“We just want to know more about all kinds of things.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r448","rowIndex":448,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それに、あなた、ちょっと私たちの友だちに似てる」","en":"“Besides, you resemble one of our friends a little.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r449","rowIndex":449,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ははは」","en":"“Hahaha.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アレクセイ","displayName":"Alexei","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r450","rowIndex":450,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼は声を立てて笑った。","en":"He laughed aloud.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r451","rowIndex":451,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「間違った考えだな。その考えは必ずおまえたちを殺すだろう」","en":"“That’s the wrong way to think. That way of thinking will surely be the death of you.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アレクセイ","displayName":"Alexei","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r452","rowIndex":452,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そんなことはどうでもいい」","en":"“That doesn’t matter.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r453","rowIndex":453,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「とにかく答えたよ。だからこっちの疑問にも答えて」","en":"“Anyway, we answered your question. Now answer ours.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r454","rowIndex":454,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ふむ……ちょっと待て」","en":"“Hmm... Wait a moment.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アレクセイ","displayName":"Alexei","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r455","rowIndex":455,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼はそう言い、顎を傾けて視線を中空にやった。","en":"He tilted his chin and turned his gaze toward empty air.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r456","rowIndex":456,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どうする？　……ああ、そうか。わかった」","en":"“What are you going to do? ...Ah, I see. Understood.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アレクセイ","displayName":"Alexei","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r457","rowIndex":457,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼は独り言のように、空に向かって喋る。","en":"He addressed the air as though talking to himself.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r458","rowIndex":458,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そこで使われた言葉は、<tips=63>サーシェンカ</tips>が使ったものと同じ言葉だった。","en":"He used the same language <tips=63>Sashenka</tips> had spoken.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r459","rowIndex":459,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「本来ならおまえたちは始末すべき対象なんだが、あのガキのお気に入りだし、危害もなさそうなので、特別に生かしておくそうだ」","en":"“Ordinarily, you’d be targets we ought to eliminate. But apparently you’re that brat’s favorites and don’t seem dangerous, so I’m told we’ll make an exception and let you live.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アレクセイ","displayName":"Alexei","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r460","rowIndex":460,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その口ぶりはさっきまでの神経質で感情的な感じとは違って、威厳と落ち着きに満ちたものだ。","en":"His tone, unlike the nervous, emotional manner of moments before, was full of dignity and composure.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r461","rowIndex":461,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちの<tips=16>タイプA</tips>としての『ちから』は知らないとしても、<tips=17>タイプB</tips>としての身体能力を見た上でこう言っているのだから、彼も何か特別な力を隠しているのだろうと私たちは考えたが、いまここでそれを詮索しようとは思わなかった。","en":"Even if he knew nothing of our <tips=16>Type A</tips> ‘power,’ he had said this after seeing our physical abilities as <tips=17>Type Bs</tips>. We therefore assumed that he too must be concealing some special power, but we had no intention of probing it here and now.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r462","rowIndex":462,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それは光栄だね」","en":"“That is an honor.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r463","rowIndex":463,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「で、私たちへの質問の答えは？」","en":"“And the answers to our questions?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r464","rowIndex":464,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まあ焦るな。今あのガキを連れてきてやる。それを見れば、おれたちの関係はよくわかるだろう」","en":"“Don’t rush me. I’ll go get the brat now. Once you see that, you’ll understand our relationship well enough.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アレクセイ","displayName":"Alexei","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r465","rowIndex":465,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「待ってよ。あなたは何者なの？」","en":"“Wait. Who are you?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r466","rowIndex":466,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「人には<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>と呼ばれている。本当の名は……」","en":"“People call me <tips=20>Koschei</tips>. My true name is...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アレクセイ","displayName":"Alexei","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r467","rowIndex":467,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼はそう言うと、ガクンとうなだれた。","en":"After he spoke, his head dropped abruptly.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r468","rowIndex":468,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　突然気を失ったように見えた。","en":"It appeared that he had suddenly lost consciousness.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r469","rowIndex":469,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そしてそのまま動かない。","en":"He remained motionless.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r470","rowIndex":470,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　驚いた私たちが声をかけようとしたとき、その姿に変化が起きた。","en":"As we prepared to call out in surprise, his appearance began to change.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r471","rowIndex":471,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼の髪型が癖っ毛の金髪に変わり、若干からだが縮んで、全体的に細くもなった。","en":"His hair changed into unruly blond curls. His body shrank slightly and became thinner all over.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r472","rowIndex":472,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして、彼はゆっくりと顔を上げる。","en":"Then he slowly raised his head.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r473","rowIndex":473,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「「<tips=63>サーシェンカ</tips>！」」","en":"“<tips=63>Sashenka</tips>!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r474","rowIndex":474,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちは同時に叫んだ。","en":"We shouted together.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r475","rowIndex":475,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……あれ、ここは……」","en":"“...Huh? Where am I...?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"サーシェンカ白シャツ","displayName":"Sashenka (White Shirt)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F1:r476","rowIndex":476,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　眠そうにまぶたを擦る彼の姿は、どこからどう見ても、さっき上の階に置いてきたはずの<tips=63>サーシェンカ</tips>そのものだった。","en":"Rubbing his eyelids sleepily, he was unmistakably the <tips=63>Sashenka</tips> we thought we had just left upstairs.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}}]},{"position":15,"code":"A4","unitId":"A4","rows":[{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r1","rowIndex":1,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=22>老人たち</tips>はまだ連絡をよこさない。彼らは新体制に従うつもりがないのでしょうか」","en":"“The <tips=22>Elders</tips> still haven’t contacted us. Do they have no intention of accepting the new regime?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ジェフリー・ウォン","displayName":"Jeffrey Wong","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r2","rowIndex":2,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=39>ジェフリー・ウォン</tips>は苛立ちを隠せずそう言った。","en":"<tips=39>Jeffrey Wong</tips> said this, unable to conceal his irritation.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r3","rowIndex":3,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>が息を引き取った居室は、そのまま二代目の執務室となっている。","en":"The room in which <tips=3>Chris Tse</tips> had breathed his last had been left intact and made into the second Longtou’s office.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r4","rowIndex":4,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　遺言通り、<tips=3>クリス</tips>の叔父である<tips=84>マイケル・ツェー</tips>が新しい<tips=81>龍頭</tips>としてこの部屋の主人となった。そして、いよいよ本格的に執務を行うこととなった彼は、今日もこの部屋で部下の報告を受けたり、来客の対応を行っている。","en":"In accordance with the will, <tips=3>Chris’s</tips> uncle, <tips=84>Michael Tse</tips>, became the master of this room as the new <tips=81>Longtou</tips>. Now that he had finally begun attending to his duties in earnest, he passed his days here receiving reports from subordinates and meeting with visitors.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r5","rowIndex":5,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　もっとも、<tips=84>マイケル</tips>はこれまで<tips=81>龍頭</tips>の叔父として組織内での地位は高かったものの、実務にはさほど関わってはいなかった。だから、実際に仕事を行っているのは先代<tips=81>龍頭</tips>の義兄弟であり腹心であった<tips=39>ジェフリー・ウォン</tips>だ。","en":"To be fair, although <tips=84>Michael</tips> had held a high position in the organization as the <tips=81>Longtou’s</tips> uncle, he had never been greatly involved in its day-to-day operations. The man actually doing the work was <tips=39>Jeffrey Wong</tips>, the previous <tips=81>Longtou’s</tips> sworn brother and closest confidant.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r6","rowIndex":6,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕も名目的には彼と同じ新<tips=81>龍頭</tips>の補佐官ということになっていたが、実際は見習いのようなものである。<tips=39>ジェフリー</tips>の側にいてその仕事ぶりを見学することが仕事だった。","en":"Nominally, I too was an aide to the new <tips=81>Longtou</tips>, just like Jeffrey, but in practice I was more of an apprentice. My job was to stay at <tips=39>Jeffrey’s</tips> side and observe how he worked.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r7","rowIndex":7,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その僕の教師であるべき<tips=39>ジェフリー</tips>が、どうもイライラと感情的になっている。","en":"Yet <tips=39>Jeffrey</tips>, who was supposed to serve as my teacher, seemed irritable and emotional.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r8","rowIndex":8,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「昨日の今日だし、そう焦る必要はないのでは？」","en":"“It only happened yesterday. Is there any need for such haste?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r9","rowIndex":9,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　黙っているつもりだったが、<tips=39>ジェフリー</tips>の苛立ちが尋常ではないように見受けられたので、言わないわけにはいかなかった。","en":"I had meant to keep quiet, but <tips=39>Jeffrey</tips> seemed so extraordinarily irritated that I had no choice but to speak.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r10","rowIndex":10,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そんな僕を、彼は苦々しく見て、","en":"He gave me a bitter look.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r11","rowIndex":11,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「葬儀にも来ず、就任式にもあらわれず、そして未だに連絡がない。これは、我々を軽く見ているということなのですよ」","en":"“They did not attend the funeral, did not appear at the installation, and have yet to contact us. They are treating us with contempt.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ジェフリー・ウォン","displayName":"Jeffrey Wong","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r12","rowIndex":12,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼が言っているのは、この街の<tips=17>タイプB</tips>の総元締めである『<tips=21>八龍会</tips>』の<tips=22>老人たち</tips>のことだ。","en":"He was referring to the <tips=22>Elders</tips> of the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips>, the supreme authority over all the <tips=17>Type Bs</tips> in this city.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r13","rowIndex":13,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「軽く見ている、というより、様子見をしているんだろう」","en":"“Rather than treating us with contempt, I imagine they are waiting to see how things go.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r14","rowIndex":14,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「様子を見るということは、状況によってつき合い方を変えようとしているわけです。それが、我々を軽く見ているということです」","en":"“Waiting to see means they intend to change how they deal with us depending on the circumstances. That is what it means to treat us with contempt.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ジェフリー・ウォン","displayName":"Jeffrey Wong","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r15","rowIndex":15,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「だって、それは当然だよ。だから我々は……」","en":"“But that’s only natural. That’s exactly why we...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r16","rowIndex":16,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=2>阿亮</tips>、あなたはまだ余計な口出しをしなくて結構。しばらくは黙ってやり方を見ていてください」","en":"“<tips=2>Ah Leung</tips>, you needn’t interfere just yet. For the time being, remain silent and observe how things are done.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ジェフリー・ウォン","displayName":"Jeffrey Wong","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r17","rowIndex":17,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=39>ジェフリー</tips>はぴしゃりと言い放つと、","en":"<tips=39>Jeffrey</tips> snapped, then continued:","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r18","rowIndex":18,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「とにかく、状況は思ったよりもよくありません。我々が影響力を失えば、街の外の連中もこの街へ手を出すでしょう。先代が友好関係を築いた者たちも、こうなればいつ手のひらを返すかわかりません。我々は、先代がなくとも以前と同じ力を持っていることを証明しなくてはいけないのです」","en":"“In any event, the situation is worse than we anticipated. If we lose our influence, outsiders will begin making moves on the city. Even those with whom the former Longtou established friendly relations may turn on us at any moment now. We must demonstrate that we possess the same power as before, even without him.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ジェフリー・ウォン","displayName":"Jeffrey Wong","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r19","rowIndex":19,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして眉間にしわをよせ考え始める。","en":"Then he furrowed his brow and began to think.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r20","rowIndex":20,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　この僕に余計な口出しをするなとはよく言ったものだ。","en":"He had some nerve telling me, of all people, not to interfere.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r21","rowIndex":21,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　だけれどまあ、僕と違って今まで組織の中枢で仕事をしていた彼にすれば、細かい変化に敏感になってしまうのは仕方ないのかもしれない。","en":"Still, unlike me, he had always worked at the heart of the organization, so perhaps it was only natural that he should be sensitive to the slightest changes.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r22","rowIndex":22,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それにしても、<tips=39>ジェフリー</tips>とはこれほど感情的な人間だったろうか？","en":"Even so, had <tips=39>Jeffrey</tips> always been this emotional?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r23","rowIndex":23,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　父の側近として振る舞っていたときは、もっと冷静な印象だった。今が我々にとって簡単な状態ではないのはわかるが、<tips=3>クリス</tips>が死ねば<tips=76>香港派</tips>は以前ほど重くは見て貰えないというのは事前に予想出来たわけだし、今更ぴりぴりするのは遅すぎる。","en":"When he had served as Father’s aide, I had thought him far calmer. I understood that our present position was difficult, but we had known in advance that once <tips=3>Chris</tips> died, the <tips=76>Hong Kong faction</tips> would no longer be taken as seriously as before. It was rather late to become so overwrought now.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r24","rowIndex":24,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>という絶対的な信頼を抱いていた義兄弟を失ったことが、やっぱり不安にさせているのか。","en":"Was losing <tips=3>Chris Tse</tips>, the sworn brother in whom he had placed absolute trust, making him anxious after all?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r25","rowIndex":25,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　とにかく、<tips=39>ジェフリー</tips>は今日は朝からずっとイライラとしっぱなしだ。","en":"Whatever the reason, <tips=39>Jeffrey</tips> had remained irritable since morning.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r26","rowIndex":26,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=39>ジェフリー</tips>の不快の原因は、今話題にした<tips=22>老人たち</tips>だけではない。","en":"The <tips=22>Elders</tips> we had just discussed were not the only source of <tips=39>Jeffrey’s</tips> displeasure.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r27","rowIndex":27,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　就任の儀式時の、<tips=33>壬生屋タカシ</tips>が<tips=84>マイケル・ツェー</tips>にとった不遜な態度や、儀式が終わるや否や、その後の宴会に参加せずにさっさと帰ってしまった<tips=27>廖志明</tips>の振る舞いやら、数え上げればきりがないようだ。","en":"There was <tips=33>Takashi Mibuya’s</tips> insolent behavior toward <tips=84>Michael Tse</tips> at the installation, and <tips=27>Liao Chi-ming’s</tips> departure immediately after the ceremony without attending the banquet. The list, apparently, had no end.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r28","rowIndex":28,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　名目上の最高責任者である第二代<tips=81>龍頭</tips><tips=84>マイケル・ツェー</tips>は直接自分が軽く見られているわけだが、事情が分かっているのかどうなのか、のほほんとした顔で苛立つ<tips=39>ジェフリー</tips>を眺めている。","en":"The nominal supreme authority, the second <tips=81>Longtou</tips>, <tips=84>Michael Tse</tips>, was himself the one being slighted. Yet whether he understood the situation or not, he watched the irritated <tips=39>Jeffrey</tips> with a placid expression.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r29","rowIndex":29,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=81>龍頭</tips>は、何かご意見はありますか？」","en":"“<tips=81>Longtou</tips>, do you have any opinion on the matter?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r30","rowIndex":30,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕が尋ねてみても、","en":"Even when I tried asking him directly,","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r31","rowIndex":31,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いやあ、特になにも。すべて<tips=39>ウォン</tips>君に任せているからね。彼がうまいことやって、そして将来的に<tips=2>阿亮</tips>にいいかたちで繋いでくれれば良いんだ。私は余計なことはしないからね」","en":"“Well, nothing in particular. I’ve left everything to <tips=39>Wong</tips>. He just needs to handle it well and eventually hand things over to <tips=2>Ah Leung</tips> in good order. I won’t interfere.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"マイケル・ツェー","displayName":"Michael Tse","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r32","rowIndex":32,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ニコニコとそんなことを答えるだけで、まるきり頼りにならない。彼も若い頃はそれなりの武勇伝などもあり、能力がないというわけではないと思うのだけれど、自らお飾りのリーダーに徹している。任せてくれるのは、まあ扱いやすくてやりやすいのだろうが。","en":"he merely smiled as he answered, proving utterly undependable. He had his share of stories of daring from his younger days, and I did not think him incapable, but he had deliberately settled into the role of figurehead. Having him leave everything to us probably made him easier to manage and our work easier, at least.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r33","rowIndex":33,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　さて、今の僕はこうしてぼんやりと無為に<tips=39>ジェフリー</tips>の側に突っ立っているわけだが、今の僕の仕事がこれだけで、他にまるきり何もしていないというわけではない。","en":"At the moment, then, I stood idly at <tips=39>Jeffrey’s</tips> side with nothing to do. But that did not mean this was the full extent of my present work, or that I was doing nothing else at all.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r34","rowIndex":34,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>の<tips=81>龍頭</tips>の地位こそ<tips=84>マイケル・ツェー</tips>が引き継いだが、ツェー・ファミリーつまり旧『<tips=69>義勝</tips>』の盟主は僕ということになっている。挨拶回りというわけではないが、彼らにあらためて自分の新しい立場を説明し、また彼らの考えや人柄を知っておくために空いている時間は彼らの元を訪ねた。","en":"<tips=84>Michael Tse</tips> had inherited the position of <tips=81>Longtou</tips> of <tips=7>YS</tips>, but I had become head of the Tse Family—in other words, the old <tips=69>Yisheng</tips>. It was not exactly a formal round of introductions, but whenever time permitted, I visited its members to explain my new position and learn how they thought and what sort of people they were.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r35","rowIndex":35,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それまで見向きもしなかったのに急に後継者として<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>に入った僕を、自分の足場となるべき<tips=76>旧義勝</tips>の面々がどう受け止めているのか、まず何よりも、それを把握したかった。","en":"Until then I had paid them no attention, only to enter <tips=7>YS</tips> abruptly as its successor. Before anything else, I wanted to understand how the members of the <tips=76>old Yisheng</tips>—the base I would have to rely on—regarded me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r36","rowIndex":36,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　これは、なかなか発見があり、刺激的な仕事だった。","en":"I learned a remarkable amount from the work and found it stimulating.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r37","rowIndex":37,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼らの多くは血の繋がりがあったり、父と出身地を同じくするものばかりで、幼い頃から顔見知りの人間ばかりだったが、新しい立場で出会うと、意外なほどに<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>内の他派閥に対して敵愾心が強いのを感じた。南米人は信用出来ないだとか、<tips=33>壬生屋</tips>は屑だとか、そんな言葉ばかりが聞こえて来る。","en":"Most were blood relatives or hailed from the same region as Father, and nearly all had known me since childhood. Yet meeting them in my new position, I sensed a hostility toward the other factions within <tips=7>YS</tips> far stronger than I had imagined. All I heard were remarks like “South Americans can’t be trusted” and “<tips=33>Mibuya</tips> is scum.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r38","rowIndex":38,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　父が<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>という連合組織を作る前の敵対時の怒りや憎しみは、長い時間をおいてもそのまま保存されていたようだ。","en":"It seemed the anger and hatred from the days of conflict before Father created the alliance called <tips=7>YS</tips> had survived all those years unchanged.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r39","rowIndex":39,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして、彼らが皆<tips=39>ジェフリー</tips>の強硬な態度を絶賛している。ときに不自然にも思える<tips=39>ジェフリー</tips>の態度は、こうした<tips=76>旧義勝</tips>の空気に後押しされてのものだったのだろう。","en":"And every one of them acclaimed <tips=39>Jeffrey’s</tips> hard line. <tips=39>Jeffrey’s</tips> behavior, which sometimes struck me as unnatural, must have been bolstered by this atmosphere within the <tips=76>old Yisheng</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r40","rowIndex":40,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕は父の死後、<tips=27>廖志明</tips>のところだとか、<tips=35>フェルナンデス</tips>のところだとか、他のファミリーの動向ばかり気にしていたが、自分の足元も何やらあやしいようだ。<tips=76>旧義勝</tips>も、<tips=3>クリス</tips>というたががはずれて排他的な集団へかわろうとしている。いや、もともとそういう集団であったのに、戻ろうとしていると言うべきか。","en":"After Father’s death, I had concerned myself almost entirely with the movements of the other families—<tips=27>Liao Chi-ming’s</tips> group, <tips=35>Fernandes’s</tips>, and the rest—but now the ground beneath my own feet seemed unstable as well. With the restraining band of <tips=3>Chris</tips> removed, the <tips=76>old Yisheng</tips> was turning into an insular group. Or rather, perhaps I should say it was reverting to what it had originally been.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r41","rowIndex":41,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　とまれ、どうもこのまま平和なままではいられないような雰囲気である。","en":"At any rate, there was an air about things suggesting that we would not remain at peace much longer.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r42","rowIndex":42,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　以前は、やり方によっては大きな衝突はなんとか避けられるのではないかという思いが頭のどこかにあったが、こうした経験を経て、僕の頭からその考えはもう消え去っていた。","en":"Before, part of me had believed that if we handled things correctly, we might somehow avoid a major conflict. After these experiences, that belief was already gone from my mind.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r43","rowIndex":43,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そうして僕は日々街をうろついていたが、新入りの僕がしなくてはならない仕事はそれだけではない。ファミリーが持つ資産の内容、ファミリーで行っているあらゆる経済活動の収支報告書――直接経営する飲食店やカジノの帳簿や、用心棒代やら各種設備のリース料やらというかたちで徴収されるみかじめ料に関する帳簿、正式な書類がなければメモでもかまわないが、とにかく手に入る限りの書類を集め、それに目を通していた。","en":"I spent my days walking throughout the city, but those visits were not my only obligation as a newcomer. I gathered every document I could obtain and read through them: inventories of the family’s assets; statements for every part of its economic activity; ledgers from the restaurants and casinos it operated directly; ledgers for protection money collected in the form of security fees, equipment leases, and so forth. If no formal record existed, even a memorandum would do.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r44","rowIndex":44,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　とにかく僕には情報が足りない。その他、自分のファミリーだけでなく、<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>全体や、他のファミリーの状況まで把握しようとすれば、書類の山が出来る。","en":"Above all, I lacked information. If I meant to grasp the state not only of my own family, but of <tips=7>YS</tips> as a whole and each of its other families, the papers formed a mountain.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r45","rowIndex":45,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　空いた時間を使って少しずつ情報を崩しているのだが、それでも時間が足りない。正直言って、名目だけの補佐官としてぼんやり<tips=39>ジェフリー</tips>の側に突っ立っている時間が一番不必要に思えるのだが、そういうわけにもいかない。","en":"I worked through the information little by little whenever I had an empty moment, but there was never enough time. Frankly, the hours I spent standing vacantly beside <tips=39>Jeffrey</tips> as an adviser in name alone seemed the most unnecessary of all. Yet there was nothing I could do about them.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r46","rowIndex":46,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ろくに睡眠時間もとれないような忙しい時間を過ごしはじめたところで、一つ事件が持ち上がった。","en":"Just as my days became so busy that I could scarcely find time to sleep, an incident arose.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r47","rowIndex":47,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　新<tips=81>龍頭</tips>が就任してから三日が過ぎた日の夕暮れのことである。","en":"It was evening, three days after the new <tips=81>Longtou’s</tips> installation.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r48","rowIndex":48,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>の資産整理について話し合っていたところ、何やら重要な電話が入ったと、先代の死後も引き続き<tips=81>龍頭</tips>の従者のような仕事をしている<tips=30>レイレイ</tips>が取り次いだ。","en":"We were discussing how to settle <tips=3>Chris Tse’s</tips> estate when <tips=30>Leilei</tips>—who had continued serving as a sort of attendant to the <tips=81>Longtou</tips> even after the previous Longtou’s death—put through what seemed to be an important call.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r49","rowIndex":49,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　相手は、<tips=59>暗闇通り</tips>でいくつかの飲食店を営む有力オーナーである。","en":"The caller was an influential proprietor who operated several restaurants on <tips=59>Darkness Street</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r50","rowIndex":50,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それは、本当のことですか？」","en":"“Is that true?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ジェフリー・ウォン","displayName":"Jeffrey Wong","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r51","rowIndex":51,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　電話を受けた<tips=39>ジェフリー</tips>が青筋の入った額にしわを寄せる。","en":"<tips=39>Jeffrey</tips> took the call with a furrowed brow and a vein standing out on his forehead.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r52","rowIndex":52,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　通話を切ったあと、彼は苦い顔で事態を説明した。","en":"After ending it, he explained the circumstances with a bitter expression.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r53","rowIndex":53,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どうも、<tips=26>劉建志</tips>が酔っ払って、店で大暴れをしたようです」","en":"“It appears <tips=26>Ryu Kenshi</tips> became drunk and went on a rampage in an establishment.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ジェフリー・ウォン","displayName":"Jeffrey Wong","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r54","rowIndex":54,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=59>暗闇通り</tips>のバーで一人で酒を飲んでいた<tips=26>劉建志</tips>が他の客の連れていた女にその客の目の前で声をかけ、大喧嘩をしたらしい。","en":"<tips=26>Ryu Kenshi</tips> had been drinking alone in a bar on <tips=59>Darkness Street</tips> when he approached a woman who was there with another patron, right in front of the man, and apparently got into an enormous fight.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r55","rowIndex":55,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　顔の特質変異を隠すためにいつもつけている仮面をせずに、別のもので誤魔化していたらしく、その時点では客も店員も彼の正体に気がつかなかったのだ。いや、はじめから喧嘩をふっかけるつもりでトレードマークの仮面をしなかったのかもしれない。","en":"Instead of the mask he always wore to hide the trait mutation on his face, he had apparently disguised it with something else, so neither the patrons nor the employees realized who he was at the time. Or perhaps he had left off his trademark mask because he meant to start a fight from the outset.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r56","rowIndex":56,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　とにかく、若い頃から喧嘩の強いことで知られる<tips=26>劉建志</tips>はさんざんに相手をやっつけ、喧嘩相手は女を置いて命からがら逃げ出したということだ。大立ち回りを演じた店の設備は散々に破損され、相手の血で汚れ、大変な有様となった。","en":"In any event, <tips=26>Ryu Kenshi</tips>, renowned as a formidable fighter since his youth, beat the other man severely. His opponent abandoned the woman and fled for his life. The establishment where the brawl unfolded was wrecked, stained with the man’s blood, and left in a dreadful state.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r57","rowIndex":57,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それについて当然店主が苦情を言ったが、彼はこの店主も殴り倒し、そして堂々と自分の名を告げ、奪い取った女をさらうようにしてその場を去ったという。","en":"Naturally, the proprietor complained, but Ryu beat him down as well, boldly announced his own name, and left with the woman he had taken, practically abducting her.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r58","rowIndex":58,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ひどいなあ。被害者には気の毒だが、<tips=26>劉建志</tips>らしい話だ」","en":"“How awful. I feel sorry for his victims, but it sounds exactly like <tips=26>Ryu Kenshi</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r59","rowIndex":59,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕は思わず笑ってしまったが、<tips=39>ジェフリー</tips>はその失笑に溜息をつき、首を横に振る。","en":"I laughed despite myself. <tips=39>Jeffrey</tips> sighed at my laughter and shook his head.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r60","rowIndex":60,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「笑っている場合じゃないですよ。その店は昔からしっかり上納金を納めてくれていて、先代ともつき合いがあった。その店でこんな大騒ぎをされたら、<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>に金を払う店はなくなる。これは懲罰ものですよ」","en":"“This is no laughing matter. That establishment has faithfully paid its dues for years, and its owner had dealings with the former Longtou. If we allow an uproar like this there, no establishment will continue paying <tips=7>YS</tips>. This calls for punishment.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ジェフリー・ウォン","displayName":"Jeffrey Wong","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r61","rowIndex":61,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「懲罰とは穏やかじゃない」","en":"“Punishment? That is rather drastic.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r62","rowIndex":62,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「酒で酔って女を奪おうと喧嘩をふっかけるなど、ありえないことです。そもそも部下も連れずに一人でふらりと飲みに行くのがあまりに不用意です。<tips=26>劉建志</tips>はただのチンピラではなく、<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>の重要な立場にある人間です。こんなくだらないことで騒ぎを起こすようでは、とてもその地位に相応しいとは言えません」","en":"“Starting a fight while drunk to steal a woman is unthinkable. It was grossly careless for him to wander off drinking alone without even taking subordinates. <tips=26>Ryu Kenshi</tips> is no common thug; he occupies an important position in <tips=7>YS</tips>. If he causes disturbances over something so trivial, he cannot possibly be considered worthy of that position.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ジェフリー・ウォン","displayName":"Jeffrey Wong","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r63","rowIndex":63,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それはもっともだけれど、街の人間は<tips=26>劉建志</tips>が昔どういう人間だかみんな知っている。今更評判どうこうって話でもない。そもそも、彼は先代の死を悲しむあまり飲み過ぎたんだろう。ある種美談みたいなもんじゃないか」","en":"“That is fair. But everyone in the city knows what kind of man <tips=26>Ryu Kenshi</tips> used to be. It is hardly a question of his reputation at this late date. Besides, he probably drank too much because the former Longtou’s death grieved him. You could almost call it a touching story of sorts.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r64","rowIndex":64,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それは理由にはなりません。幹部としての振る舞いが出来ないのならば、ふさわしい地位に戻って貰うだけです。そもそも彼は、最初から器ではなかったのです」","en":"“That is no excuse. If he cannot conduct himself as an officer, he need only be returned to a rank appropriate for him. He was never fit for his position in the first place.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ジェフリー・ウォン","displayName":"Jeffrey Wong","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r65","rowIndex":65,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=39>ジェフリー</tips>が異様な緊張感でこわばった顔でそう言った。","en":"<tips=39>Jeffrey</tips> said this, his face rigid with an unsettling tension.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r66","rowIndex":66,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=26>劉建志</tips>ほどの立場の人間を降格させるとなればおおごとだが、本気でやるつもりらしい。","en":"Demoting a man of <tips=26>Ryu Kenshi’s</tips> standing would be a major affair, but he apparently meant to go through with it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r67","rowIndex":67,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「これからは大変な時期になります。彼のような無法者を重要な地位につけたままにしておくのは危険です」","en":"“Difficult times lie ahead. It is dangerous to leave an outlaw like him in an important position.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ジェフリー・ウォン","displayName":"Jeffrey Wong","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r68","rowIndex":68,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして<tips=39>ジェフリー</tips>はすぐに<tips=81>龍頭</tips>である<tips=84>マイケル・ツェー</tips>の名で<tips=26>劉建志</tips>を呼び出すと、一時間ほどで本人が執務室に姿を現した。","en":"Then <tips=39>Jeffrey</tips> immediately summoned <tips=26>Ryu Kenshi</tips> in the name of the <tips=81>Longtou</tips>, <tips=84>Michael Tse</tips>, and Ryu himself appeared in the office about an hour later.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r69","rowIndex":69,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　この日はトレードマークの仮面を身につけており、その表情こそ窺えなかったが、背を丸めてポケットに手を突っ込むという姿で<tips=84>マイケル・ツェー</tips>の前に立ち、自分の不機嫌さを隠そうともしなかった。","en":"That day he wore his trademark mask, concealing his expression. Even so, he made no attempt to hide his displeasure as he stood before <tips=84>Michael Tse</tips>, back bent and hands thrust into his pockets.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r70","rowIndex":70,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なぜ呼び出したか、わかっていますね？」","en":"“You understand why you were summoned, I assume.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ジェフリー・ウォン","displayName":"Jeffrey Wong","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r71","rowIndex":71,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=39>ジェフリー</tips>は感情の消え失せた冷たい表情でそう尋ねた。","en":"<tips=39>Jeffrey</tips> asked with a cold, impassive expression.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r72","rowIndex":72,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「さっぱりわかりませんね」","en":"“I haven’t the faintest idea.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"劉建志","displayName":"Ryu Kenshi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r73","rowIndex":73,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=26>劉</tips>はふてくされているようだった。","en":"<tips=26>Ryu</tips> appeared sullen.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r74","rowIndex":74,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「先日、飲食店で狼藉を働いた件に関してです」","en":"“It concerns your misconduct at an establishment the other day.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ジェフリー・ウォン","displayName":"Jeffrey Wong","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r75","rowIndex":75,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「記憶にありませんな。どこからそんな話を聞いたんです？」","en":"“I don’t recall any misconduct. Where did you hear such a story?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"劉建志","displayName":"Ryu Kenshi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r76","rowIndex":76,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「随分派手にやったらしいですね。我々としては無視出来ない案件です」","en":"“I hear you made quite a spectacle of yourself. This is not something we can ignore.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ジェフリー・ウォン","displayName":"Jeffrey Wong","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r77","rowIndex":77,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ああ、なるほど。オーナーのヤンか。やっぱりそうですか。文句があるならおれに直接来いと言ったのに。あの野郎、普段はおべっかばっかりつかってるくせに、くだらない告げ口なんかしやがって」","en":"“Ah, I see. Yang, the proprietor. I knew it. I told him that if he had a complaint, he could bring it directly to me. That bastard is always fawning over me, yet he went running to you with some petty tale.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"劉建志","displayName":"Ryu Kenshi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r78","rowIndex":78,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　案の定、<tips=26>劉</tips>は話を漏らした人間への怒りを露わにする。","en":"As expected, <tips=26>Ryu</tips> openly vented his anger at the man who had leaked word of the incident.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r79","rowIndex":79,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「自分の縄張りの店で狼藉を働くだなんて、我々の根幹を否定する行為です。相応の責任をとっていただきます。言い分があるならば聞きますが？」","en":"“Committing violence at an establishment in your own territory repudiates the very foundation of what we do. You will be made to take appropriate responsibility. If you have something to say for yourself, I’ll hear you out.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ジェフリー・ウォン","displayName":"Jeffrey Wong","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r80","rowIndex":80,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=39>ジェフリー</tips>の冷徹な声に<tips=26>劉</tips>は舌打ちをして、","en":"In response to <tips=39>Jeffrey’s</tips> cold voice, <tips=26>Ryu</tips> clicked his tongue and said:","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r81","rowIndex":81,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なんであんたばっかり喋ってる。<tips=81>龍頭</tips>の意見はないんですか？」","en":"“Why are you doing all the talking? Does the <tips=81>Longtou</tips> have no opinion?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"劉建志","displayName":"Ryu Kenshi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r82","rowIndex":82,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「私の言葉は<tips=81>龍頭</tips>のご意見です」","en":"“My words express the <tips=81>Longtou’s</tips> opinion.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ジェフリー・ウォン","displayName":"Jeffrey Wong","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r83","rowIndex":83,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=81>龍頭</tips>に聞いているんですがねえ」","en":"“I asked the <tips=81>Longtou</tips> himself.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"劉建志","displayName":"Ryu Kenshi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r84","rowIndex":84,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「私は、<tips=39>ウォン</tips>君と同意見だ。軽率だと思う」","en":"“I agree with <tips=39>Wong</tips>. Your behavior was reckless.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"マイケル・ツェー","displayName":"Michael Tse","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r85","rowIndex":85,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=84>マイケル・ツェー</tips>はそれだけ言って、あとは困った顔で黙ってしまう。","en":"<tips=84>Michael Tse</tips> said only that much, then fell silent with a troubled expression.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r86","rowIndex":86,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あははは！　これじゃ腹話術の人形だよ。<tips=3>クリス</tips>様ならこんな情けない茶番はしなかった」","en":"“Ahahaha! He’s a ventriloquist’s dummy. Lord <tips=3>Chris</tips> would never have put on a pathetic farce like this.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r87","rowIndex":87,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「劉建志。<tips=81>龍頭</tips>への侮辱は降格だけでは済まないのを知っていますか？」","en":"“Ryu Kenshi. Do you understand that insulting the <tips=81>Longtou</tips> will cost you more than a demotion?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ジェフリー・ウォン","displayName":"Jeffrey Wong","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r88","rowIndex":88,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「これは失礼！　侮辱ではないんですよ。ただ、先代が懐かしくなっただけでしてね」","en":"“My apologies! I meant no insult. I merely found myself missing the former Longtou.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"劉建志","displayName":"Ryu Kenshi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r89","rowIndex":89,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どんな理由であれ、<tips=81>龍頭</tips>の前では言葉を慎みなさい」","en":"“Whatever the reason, guard your tongue before the <tips=81>Longtou</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ジェフリー・ウォン","displayName":"Jeffrey Wong","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r90","rowIndex":90,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「気に障ったとおっしゃるのなら、謝罪します。しかし、本人がぼーっと座ってるだけで側近が全部決めるだなんて、新しい<tips=81>龍頭</tips>はお飾りか何かなんですかねえ？　随分頼りないものですな」","en":"“If you say I have offended him, then I apologize. But when the man himself merely sits there in a daze while his aide decides everything, is our new <tips=81>Longtou</tips> some kind of figurehead? He seems remarkably unreliable.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"劉建志","displayName":"Ryu Kenshi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r91","rowIndex":91,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=26>劉建志</tips>どの」","en":"“Mr. <tips=26>Ryu Kenshi</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ジェフリー・ウォン","displayName":"Jeffrey Wong","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r92","rowIndex":92,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いや、重ね重ね失礼」","en":"“Well, my apologies yet again.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"劉建志","displayName":"Ryu Kenshi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r93","rowIndex":93,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=26>劉</tips>は億劫そうに礼をし、","en":"<tips=26>Ryu</tips> gave a reluctant bow, as though it were all too much trouble, and said:","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r94","rowIndex":94,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「話がそれだけなら、帰らせてもらってもいいですかね？　喪に服している間にサボってしまった仕事が溜まっているんですよ」","en":"“If that’s all, may I go? I’ve got work piled up that I let slide while I was in mourning.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"劉建志","displayName":"Ryu Kenshi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r95","rowIndex":95,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「結構。処分はあとで連絡します」","en":"“Very well. You will be informed of your punishment later.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ジェフリー・ウォン","displayName":"Jeffrey Wong","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r96","rowIndex":96,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=26>劉</tips>はマスクから見える口元にひきつったような笑顔を浮かべると、そのままくるりと背を向けて、カツカツ足音を立てて執務室を出て行った。","en":"A strained smile appeared on the portion of <tips=26>Ryu’s</tips> mouth visible beneath the mask. Then he turned on his heel and strode out of the office, his footsteps ringing sharply.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r97","rowIndex":97,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ヤンさんに気をつけるよう言った方がいいかもしれないね」","en":"“Perhaps we should warn Mr. Yang to watch his back.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r98","rowIndex":98,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ドアが閉まった後、僕は溜息をついた。","en":"After the door closed, I sighed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r99","rowIndex":99,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうですな。しかし、あのようなチンピラの論理で逆恨みとは、まったく人間が小さい」","en":"“Indeed. But to harbor a grudge with all the logic of a common thug... What a small-minded man.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ジェフリー・ウォン","displayName":"Jeffrey Wong","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r100","rowIndex":100,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「先代が出世させるべきじゃなかったと言っていたが、その通りだな。チンピラのころと何も変わってないじゃないか。今は抗争があるわけでもないし、あんなやついらないんじゃないか？」","en":"“The former Longtou said he never should have promoted him, and he was right. He has not changed at all since his hoodlum days. There is not even a gang war going on now—do we really need someone like that?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r101","rowIndex":101,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕が疑問を口にすると、","en":"When I voiced my doubts,","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r102","rowIndex":102,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「先代にとっては従順で有能な猟犬だったのですよ。それに、我々の組織は、おそらく<tips=1>謝亮</tips>が思っている以上に、彼のような戦闘力が必要なのです」","en":"“To the former Longtou, he was an obedient and capable hound. Besides, our organization needs the kind of fighting strength he provides more than <tips=1>Tse Leung</tips> probably imagines.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ジェフリー・ウォン","displayName":"Jeffrey Wong","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r103","rowIndex":103,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=39>ジェフリー</tips>は最後の言葉を口にするとき、暗い目つきになった。","en":"<tips=39>Jeffrey’s</tips> eyes darkened as he spoke those final words.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r104","rowIndex":104,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……まあ、彼は我々のために汚い仕事を請け負ってくれた功労者ではあります」","en":"“...And he has served us well by taking on our dirty work.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ジェフリー・ウォン","displayName":"Jeffrey Wong","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r105","rowIndex":105,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その言い方で、僕は<tips=26>劉</tips>がどうやって出世をしたのかわかった。","en":"The way he put it told me how <tips=26>Ryu</tips> had risen through the ranks.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r106","rowIndex":106,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それなら、今後も役に立つんじゃないか？　いろいろあるんだろうからさ」","en":"“Then couldn’t he still prove useful? I’m sure all sorts of things are going to come up.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r107","rowIndex":107,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「難しいですね。彼は我々を軽蔑していますし……それに、どうも<tips=27>廖</tips>と接触をしているという情報もあります」","en":"“That would be difficult. He despises us... and there is also intelligence that he has been in contact with <tips=27>Liao</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ジェフリー・ウォン","displayName":"Jeffrey Wong","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r108","rowIndex":108,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=39>ジェフリー</tips>は僕の知らなかった情報を口にした。","en":"<tips=39>Jeffrey</tips> told me something I had not known.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r109","rowIndex":109,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「本来野心の強い男ですから。我々よりも<tips=27>廖志明</tips>の方を利用価値が高い相手と見ているのでしょう。もし彼が、あの短慮で、牙を我々に剥いたらと考えると、力を持たせたままでいるのは危険です」","en":"“He is ambitious by nature. He probably sees <tips=27>Liao Chi-ming</tips> as more useful to him than we are. Given his rashness, if he should bare his fangs at us, it would be dangerous to leave him in power.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ジェフリー・ウォン","displayName":"Jeffrey Wong","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r110","rowIndex":110,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なあ<tips=39>ウォン</tips>君。あの<tips=26>劉</tips>という男が、どうしても我々に従わなかったらどうするつもりなのか？　大人しく降格を受け入れるようには見えなかったが……」","en":"“Tell me, <tips=39>Wong</tips>. What do you plan to do if <tips=26>Ryu</tips> simply refuses to obey us? He didn’t look likely to accept a demotion quietly...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"マイケル・ツェー","displayName":"Michael Tse","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r111","rowIndex":111,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕たちのやりとりを横で聞いていた<tips=84>マイケル・ツェー</tips>は、不安そうにそう言った。","en":"<tips=84>Michael Tse</tips>, who had been listening beside us, asked anxiously.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r112","rowIndex":112,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「不服だとしても拒否する権利はありません。彼は他の幹部とは違って、あくまでも<tips=69>義勝</tips>の人間なんですから。<tips=69>義勝</tips>には<tips=69>義勝</tips>の掟があります。<tips=81>龍頭</tips>に逆らうことは絶対に許されません。そのときは、こちらも掟通り振る舞うだけです」","en":"“Even if he objects, he has no right to refuse. Unlike the other officers, he remains a man of <tips=69>Yisheng</tips>. <tips=69>Yisheng</tips> has <tips=69>Yisheng’s</tips> own code. Defiance of the <tips=81>Longtou</tips> is absolutely forbidden. If he defies him, we will simply act according to that code.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ジェフリー・ウォン","displayName":"Jeffrey Wong","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r113","rowIndex":113,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「つまり？」","en":"“Meaning?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"マイケル・ツェー","displayName":"Michael Tse","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r114","rowIndex":114,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「抗命には死を」","en":"“Defiance means death.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ジェフリー・ウォン","displayName":"Jeffrey Wong","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r115","rowIndex":115,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=39>ジェフリー</tips>のきっぱりとした言葉に、僕は顔を顰めた。","en":"I grimaced at <tips=39>Jeffrey’s</tips> unequivocal declaration.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r116","rowIndex":116,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「断固とした処断をしなければ、我々が<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>を支配してゆくことなど到底不可能です」","en":"“Without resolute punishment, it will be utterly impossible for us to rule <tips=7>YS</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ジェフリー・ウォン","displayName":"Jeffrey Wong","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r117","rowIndex":117,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼はそう言うと、座った椅子に背を預ける。背もたれからキイと音が鳴る。","en":"After saying this, he leaned back in his chair. The backrest creaked.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r118","rowIndex":118,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その目の下には隈が浮かんでいる。彼はその部分を指先で揉んでから、","en":"Dark circles had formed beneath his eyes. He rubbed the skin there with his fingertips, then","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r119","rowIndex":119,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ご存じのように、先代を失った今、我々が過去のままの立場を維持するのは非常に困難です。他のファミリーは、現状をよしとしないものばかりですからね。主流派として、決然とした意志を知らしめてゆく他ありません」","en":"“As you know, now that we have lost the former Longtou, preserving our former position will be exceedingly difficult. Every one of the other families is dissatisfied with the present order. As the dominant faction, we have no choice but to keep demonstrating our firm resolve.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ジェフリー・ウォン","displayName":"Jeffrey Wong","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r120","rowIndex":120,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あんただって気乗りしてるわけじゃなさそうだ」","en":"“You do not seem all that eager yourself.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r121","rowIndex":121,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「気乗りするしないの話ではありません。やらなくてはいけないことなのです」","en":"“This is not a question of whether I want to. It has to be done.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ジェフリー・ウォン","displayName":"Jeffrey Wong","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r122","rowIndex":122,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=4>馬明</tips>はなんて言ってる？」","en":"“What does <tips=4>Ma Ming</tips> say?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r123","rowIndex":123,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「昔に戻ったみたいだと喜んでいますよ。理解出来ません」","en":"“He is delighted, saying it feels like the old days. I cannot understand him.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ジェフリー・ウォン","displayName":"Jeffrey Wong","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r124","rowIndex":124,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=39>ジェフリー</tips>は呆れたように言い、","en":"<tips=39>Jeffrey</tips> spoke in exasperation, then continued.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r125","rowIndex":125,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ともあれ、我々が<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>の執行部に居る間は、いかなる造反も許しません。それは我々が執行部としてあり続ける以上、絶対に譲ってはならないラインなのです。……まず<tips=26>劉建志</tips>がどう振る舞うか。その結果次第では私たちの仕事が増えることになりますね」","en":"“In any case, so long as we remain in the executive leadership of <tips=7>YS</tips>, we will tolerate no rebellion. As long as we continue to lead, that is a line on which we must never yield. ...First we shall see how <tips=26>Ryu Kenshi</tips> behaves. Depending on the outcome, we may find ourselves with more work to do.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ジェフリー・ウォン","displayName":"Jeffrey Wong","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r126","rowIndex":126,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=39>ジェフリー</tips>の言う『結果』は思ったより早くかたちとなった。","en":"The “result” of which <tips=39>Jeffrey</tips> spoke took shape sooner than expected.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r127","rowIndex":127,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それから二日後のことだ。<tips=59>暗闇通り</tips>の飲食店オーナーであるヤンが、自宅にて妻と二人の娘と共に死体となって発見された。","en":"It happened two days later. Yang, the proprietor of a restaurant on <tips=59>Darkness Street</tips>, was found dead at home with his wife and two daughters.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r128","rowIndex":128,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　発見者は彼の家に食料品を届けている業者の従業員で、我々と繋がりの深い店だったため、警察ではなくこちらに連絡が来た。","en":"They were discovered by an employee of a supplier that delivered food to Yang’s home. Because the business had close ties to us, word came to us rather than the police.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r129","rowIndex":129,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=26>劉</tips>の仕業とは限らんだろう。強盗かもしれん。なにか証拠はあったのか？」","en":"“It may not have been <tips=26>Ryu</tips>. It could have been a robbery. Was there any evidence?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬明","displayName":"Ma Ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r130","rowIndex":130,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　駆けつけて来た<tips=4>馬明</tips>が尋ねると、<tips=39>ジェフリー</tips>は引き出しから重いものを取り出し、どさりと机の上に置いた。","en":"When <tips=4>Ma Ming</tips> arrived and asked, <tips=39>Jeffrey</tips> removed something heavy from a drawer and set it on the desk with a thud.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r131","rowIndex":131,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それは、透明なビニール袋で、中には血で汚れた自動拳銃が入っている。","en":"It was a transparent plastic bag containing an automatic pistol stained with blood.","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ジェフリー・ウォン","displayName":"Jeffrey Wong","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r132","rowIndex":132,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ヤンの死体が握っていた銃ですが、弾が弾倉のなかで暴発しています。これは<tips=26>劉</tips>の能力で間違い有りません」","en":"“This is the gun Yang’s body was clutching. Its rounds discharged inside the magazine. There can be no doubt that this was <tips=26>Ryu’s</tips> ability.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ジェフリー・ウォン","displayName":"Jeffrey Wong","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r133","rowIndex":133,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=39>ジェフリー</tips>は物憂げな顔で<tips=4>馬明</tips>にそう説明すると、","en":"<tips=39>Jeffrey</tips> explained it to <tips=4>Ma Ming</tips> with a melancholy expression.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r134","rowIndex":134,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「何かしでかすだろうとは思っていましたが、まさか一家皆殺しにするとは思いませんでしたね」","en":"“I expected that he would do something, but I never imagined he would slaughter an entire family.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ジェフリー・ウォン","displayName":"Jeffrey Wong","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r135","rowIndex":135,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「飼い主が死んで、猟犬が狂犬に戻ったのさ。……さてどうする？　ヤツは言い訳の効かないことをしでかしてくれたわけだが」","en":"“His master died, and the hound went back to being a mad dog. ...Now, what do we do? The bastard has done something for which no excuse will serve.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬明","displayName":"Ma Ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r136","rowIndex":136,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どうもこうも、もう他に方法はありません。<tips=26>劉</tips>は我々の、ひいては<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>の誇りを傷つけました。降格や追放では済みません。……<tips=81>龍頭</tips>、異論はありませんね？」","en":"“What else can we do? There is no other course now. <tips=26>Ryu</tips> has wounded our pride—and, by extension, the pride of <tips=7>YS</tips>. Demotion or expulsion will not be enough. ...<tips=81>Longtou</tips>, you have no objection?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ジェフリー・ウォン","displayName":"Jeffrey Wong","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r137","rowIndex":137,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ああ、私からは何もない」","en":"“No objection from me.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"マイケル・ツェー","displayName":"Michael Tse","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r138","rowIndex":138,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　さすがの<tips=84>マイケル・ツェー</tips>も、このときばかりは顔を緊張でこわばらせている。","en":"For once, even <tips=84>Michael Tse’s</tips> face was rigid with tension.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r139","rowIndex":139,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=1>謝亮</tips>の意見も聞いておきましょうか」","en":"“We should hear <tips=1>Tse Leung’s</tips> opinion as well.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ジェフリー・ウォン","displayName":"Jeffrey Wong","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r140","rowIndex":140,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕にしても言うことはなにもない。黙って肩をすくめた。","en":"I had nothing to say either. I merely shrugged in silence.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r141","rowIndex":141,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「誰も反対しないのならば、決定ですね」","en":"“If no one objects, the decision is made.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ジェフリー・ウォン","displayName":"Jeffrey Wong","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r142","rowIndex":142,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=39>ジェフリー</tips>が頷き、そして<tips=26>劉建志</tips>の処刑はすんなりと決まった。","en":"<tips=39>Jeffrey</tips> nodded, and <tips=26>Ryu Kenshi’s</tips> execution was settled without difficulty.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r143","rowIndex":143,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　決まれば、次はどうやってその処刑を行うかだ。","en":"Once that was decided, the next question was how the execution would be carried out.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r144","rowIndex":144,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ヒットマンを彼の住まいに送り込みましょう。ですが、相手が相手です。人選は慎重に行う必要があります」","en":"“We will send a hitman to his residence. But given who the target is, we must choose our man carefully.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ジェフリー・ウォン","displayName":"Jeffrey Wong","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r145","rowIndex":145,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……何と言っても、相手は<tips=80>双花紅棍</tips>だからな」","en":"“...After all, our target is a <tips=80>Double Flower Red Pole</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬明","displayName":"Ma Ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r146","rowIndex":146,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=4>馬明</tips>は腕組みをして考え込む。","en":"<tips=4>Ma Ming</tips> folded his arms and sank into thought.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r147","rowIndex":147,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「普通なら寝込みを襲うだけの簡単な仕事だが、やつはサイキックだ。しかも、ただのサイキックじゃなくてあの<tips=26>劉建志</tips>だ。最近の若い連中はそれだけで恐れてしまうかもしれない。ほら、いつだったか、強盗を返り討ちにした件もある」","en":"“Ordinarily, attacking a sleeping man would be easy work. But he is a psychic—and not just any psychic, but <tips=26>Ryu Kenshi</tips>. That alone may frighten the young men these days. Remember the time he turned the tables on those robbers?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬明","displayName":"Ma Ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r148","rowIndex":148,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「その話、事実なのかい？」","en":"“Was that story true?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r149","rowIndex":149,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕も聞いたことがあるが、どうも眉唾っぽく思っていた<tips=26>劉建志</tips>の武勇伝だ。","en":"I had heard that story about <tips=26>Ryu Kenshi’s</tips> exploits myself, though it had always struck me as dubious.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r150","rowIndex":150,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼がまだ<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>に入ったばかりの頃の話だ。","en":"This happened when he had only just joined <tips=7>YS</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r151","rowIndex":151,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その日<tips=26>劉</tips>は<tips=59>暗闇通り</tips>で女を買い、ホテルにしけこんでまさに行為をいたそうとしていた。そこに、銃で武装した強盗が現れたのである。","en":"That day, <tips=26>Ryu</tips> had hired a woman on <tips=59>Darkness Street</tips> and taken her to a hotel, where they were just about to have sex. Then armed robbers appeared.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r152","rowIndex":152,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼らの目的は金だったが、彼らはそれを得るどころか自分たちの命を失うことになった。","en":"They had come for money, but instead of getting it, they lost their lives.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r153","rowIndex":153,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=26>劉</tips>は相手が銃で武装し、三人もいたにもかかわらず、逆に射殺してしまったと言うのである。","en":"Although there were three of them and all were armed with guns, <tips=26>Ryu</tips> turned the tables and shot them dead.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r154","rowIndex":154,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　超能力を用いたのだろうがすさまじい戦闘力だ。そしてその上で、行為を再開し、その死体の転がる部屋で最後までやり遂げたということだ。","en":"He must have used his psychic power, but even so, it was a staggering display of combat ability. Then, on top of that, he resumed what he had been doing and carried it through to the end in the room where the bodies lay.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r155","rowIndex":155,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ああ、事実だとも。その夜<tips=26>劉</tips>の相手をした女はおかしくなっちまってな。その辺りでナンバーワンの稼ぎ頭だったし、色々と大変だったんだよ」","en":"“Oh, it is true. The woman who serviced <tips=26>Ryu</tips> that night lost her mind afterward. She had been the highest earner in that part of the street, and the whole affair caused no end of trouble.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬明","displayName":"Ma Ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r156","rowIndex":156,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そりゃあ、豪傑だなあ」","en":"“Now there’s a man of valor.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r157","rowIndex":157,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=2>阿亮</tips>、感心してる場合じゃない。とにかくあいつは滅法強いんだ。それを倒す勇気と能力があって、しかも、口の堅い男が必要だ」","en":"“<tips=2>Ah Leung</tips>, this is no time to be impressed. In any event, he is phenomenally strong. We need a man with both the courage and ability to defeat him—and who can keep his mouth shut.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬明","displayName":"Ma Ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r158","rowIndex":158,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「適任者はいないのかい？」","en":"“Isn’t there anyone suited to the job?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r159","rowIndex":159,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ただ威勢のいいだけのやつならたくさん居るし、<tips=26>劉建志</tips>に恨みがあるやつもいる。しかし、確実に仕留められる実力の持ち主となると、なかなか思い浮かばない。今までは、こういう仕事は全部<tips=26>劉</tips>に任せていたものだが、今回はあいつ自身がターゲットだからな。あいつに自分を殺させるわけにもいくまい」","en":"“We have plenty of men with more nerve than sense, and some who bear grudges against <tips=26>Ryu Kenshi</tips>. But when I consider who actually possesses the skill to kill him without fail, no one comes readily to mind. Until now, we left every job like this to <tips=26>Ryu</tips>, but this time he is the target. We can hardly have him kill himself.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬明","displayName":"Ma Ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r160","rowIndex":160,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=4>馬明</tips>は渋い顔をする。","en":"<tips=4>Ma Ming</tips> grimaced.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r161","rowIndex":161,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「数を出しますか。被害は出そうですが」","en":"“Should we send in a large force? There are likely to be casualties.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ジェフリー・ウォン","displayName":"Jeffrey Wong","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r162","rowIndex":162,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=39>ジェフリー</tips>が言うと、<tips=4>馬明</tips>は頷き、","en":"When <tips=39>Jeffrey</tips> suggested it, <tips=4>Ma Ming</tips> nodded and said,","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r163","rowIndex":163,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうだな。やつは危険だ。よし、久しぶりにこのおれが銃を持って現場に……」","en":"“Right. He’s dangerous. All right, then—for the first time in ages, I’ll pick up a gun and go into the field myself—”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬明","displayName":"Ma Ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r164","rowIndex":164,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「馬鹿言っちゃいけない」","en":"“Don’t be ridiculous.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r165","rowIndex":165,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕は<tips=4>馬明</tips>の言葉を遮った。","en":"I cut <tips=4>Ma Ming</tips> off.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r166","rowIndex":166,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「今回は、僕に任せてもらおう」","en":"“This time, leave it to me.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r167","rowIndex":167,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「突然何を言い出すんですか。そんなこと出来るわけないでしょう？」","en":"“Where did that come from? There’s no way we can let you do such a thing.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ジェフリー・ウォン","displayName":"Jeffrey Wong","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r168","rowIndex":168,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=39>ジェフリー</tips>は驚いて否定する。","en":"<tips=39>Jeffrey</tips> reacted with surprise and objected.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r169","rowIndex":169,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうでもないよ。もちろん僕一人ってわけにはいかないけれど」","en":"“Not necessarily. It couldn’t be just me, of course.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r170","rowIndex":170,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「しかし<tips=1>謝亮</tips>……」","en":"“But, <tips=1>Tse Leung</tips>...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ジェフリー・ウォン","displayName":"Jeffrey Wong","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r171","rowIndex":171,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いや、話を聞いてみよう」","en":"“No. Let’s hear him out.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬明","displayName":"Ma Ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r172","rowIndex":172,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　反対しようとする<tips=39>ジェフリー</tips>を押しとどめたのは<tips=4>馬明</tips>だった。","en":"It was <tips=4>Ma Ming</tips> who forestalled <tips=39>Jeffrey’s</tips> objection.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r173","rowIndex":173,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「彼は勝算もなくこんなことを言い出す人間ではない。……何か秘策があるんだろ？」","en":"“He’s not the kind of man to propose this without believing he can pull it off. ...You’ve got some secret plan, haven’t you?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬明","displayName":"Ma Ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r174","rowIndex":174,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その問いに僕は肩をすくめ、","en":"I shrugged at the question and replied,","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r175","rowIndex":175,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「べつに秘策ってほどじゃない。ただ<tips=16>タイプA</tips>だからってそこまで恐れる必要はないと思うんだ。こちらは、完全ではないにしろ、ある程度は彼の能力について知っている」","en":"“I wouldn’t call it a secret plan. I just don’t think we need to fear him that much merely because he’s a <tips=16>Type A</tips>. Even if our knowledge is incomplete, we do know something about his ability.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r176","rowIndex":176,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「知っていたって銃を使えないことはかわらない。刃物で襲うつもりですか？　まあ、それでも奇襲を掛ければ倒せるかもしれませんが、こちらには被害が出ます。私たちは今<tips=1>謝亮</tips>を失うわけにはいかないんですよ」","en":"“Knowing that does not change the fact that you cannot use guns. Do you plan to attack him with knives? Well, even then a surprise attack might kill him, but we would take casualties. We cannot afford to lose <tips=1>Tse Leung</tips> now.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ジェフリー・ウォン","displayName":"Jeffrey Wong","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r177","rowIndex":177,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=39>ジェフリー</tips>は溜息をついて首を横に振る。","en":"<tips=39>Jeffrey</tips> sighed and shook his head.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r178","rowIndex":178,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あいつの能力は銃を使えなくするものだって、みんなそう言うけど、僕はちょっと違う能力だと思っている。……まあ、任せてくれたらわかるよ。そんなに被害もなく始末出来る筈だ」","en":"“Everyone says his ability renders guns useless, but I think it works somewhat differently. ...Well, you will understand if you leave it to me. I should be able to dispose of him without many casualties.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r179","rowIndex":179,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……ふむ、そこまで言うなら、まず作戦をうかがいましょうか」","en":"“...Hm. If you’re that certain, perhaps you can tell us the plan first.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ジェフリー・ウォン","displayName":"Jeffrey Wong","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r180","rowIndex":180,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それはいやだな」","en":"“I would rather not.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ジェフリー・ウォン","displayName":"Jeffrey Wong","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r181","rowIndex":181,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なぜですか？」","en":"“Why not?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r182","rowIndex":182,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうして、僕がここで喋ったら、それを別の人間にやらせるつもりでしょう？　冗談じゃない。今回は僕がやるんだ」","en":"“And once I’ve explained it here, you mean to have someone else carry it out, don’t you? Not a chance. This time, I’m doing it.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r183","rowIndex":183,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうは言っても、言っていただかなければ、我々としても危険かどうか判断出来ない」","en":"“Even so, unless you tell us, we cannot judge how dangerous it is.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ジェフリー・ウォン","displayName":"Jeffrey Wong","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r184","rowIndex":184,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「僕の考えを採点しようというのなら、それは余計なお世話だ」","en":"“If you intend to grade my idea, that is none of your business.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r185","rowIndex":185,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕が率直に言うと、彼はさすがにむっとしたようだった。","en":"When I put it so bluntly, even he seemed to bristle.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r186","rowIndex":186,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「はっはっは、そう言ってやるな<tips=2>阿亮</tips>。<tips=39>ジェフリー</tips>はただ心配しているだけなんだよ」","en":"“Hahaha, don’t talk to <tips=39>Jeffrey</tips> that way, <tips=2>Ah Leung</tips>. He’s only worried about you.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬明","displayName":"Ma Ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r187","rowIndex":187,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=4>馬明</tips>は場の空気を和らげるようにそう言うと、","en":"<tips=4>Ma Ming</tips> said, as though to ease the tension in the room,","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r188","rowIndex":188,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なあ<tips=39>ジェフリー</tips>。信じてやろうじゃないか。彼はこう見えても喧嘩に関しては慣れているし、無謀なことを出来ると言う人間でもない。勝算があるんだろう」","en":"“Come on, <tips=39>Jeffrey</tips>. Let’s put our faith in him. He may not look it, but he knows his way around a fight, and he’s not the sort to claim he can pull off something reckless. He must believe he can win.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬明","displayName":"Ma Ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r189","rowIndex":189,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「しかし、これはあまりにも危険だ……」","en":"“But this is far too dangerous...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ジェフリー・ウォン","displayName":"Jeffrey Wong","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r190","rowIndex":190,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=2>阿亮</tips>、本当に自信があるんだろ？」","en":"“<tips=2>Ah Leung</tips>, you really are confident you can do this?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬明","displayName":"Ma Ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r191","rowIndex":191,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「もちろん」","en":"“Of course.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r192","rowIndex":192,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕は頷き、","en":"I nodded and said,","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r193","rowIndex":193,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ただ、人と道具は僕の言う通り集めて欲しい」","en":"“But I want you to assemble the people and equipment exactly as I specify.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r194","rowIndex":194,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どんな人間をつかうか、もう決めているんだな？」","en":"“You have already decided what sort of people you will use, then?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬明","displayName":"Ma Ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r195","rowIndex":195,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕は返事の代わりに頷きを返す。","en":"I nodded again instead of answering.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r196","rowIndex":196,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「じゃあ、いいじゃないか。やらせてみよう」","en":"“Then that settles it. Let him try.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬明","displayName":"Ma Ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r197","rowIndex":197,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いや、無茶苦茶です。<tips=1>謝亮</tips>を参加させるわけには行きません。将来のリーダーなんですよ？」","en":"“No, this is absurd. We cannot allow <tips=1>Tse Leung</tips> to participate. He is our future leader.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ジェフリー・ウォン","displayName":"Jeffrey Wong","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r198","rowIndex":198,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=39>ジェフリー</tips>はなおも食い下がる。","en":"<tips=39>Jeffrey</tips> continued to press his objection.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r199","rowIndex":199,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「人材は確保するし、バックアップはおれが全面的に行う。処刑は汚れ仕事だが、<tips=26>劉</tips>は名高い豪傑であるし、それを<tips=2>阿亮</tips>が始末したとなれば誰もが彼を認めるだろう。まさに兄貴の後継者の初仕事にふさわしい。今みたいに、ぼんやりお前のそばにいるだけじゃ、本人のためにもファミリーのためにもならんよ。将来ボスになるにしたって、実績が何も無ければ誰も認めやしない。それはわかっているだろう？　……おい、まず人材は、誰がほしいんだ？」","en":"“I’ll secure the personnel and give you all the support you need. An execution is dirty work, but <tips=26>Ryu</tips> is a renowned fighter. If <tips=2>Ah Leung</tips> is the one who eliminates him, everyone will acknowledge the boy. It’s exactly the right first job for Big Brother’s successor. Just having him stand vaguely at your side the way he does now won’t help him or the family. Even if he’s going to be boss one day, no one will accept him without a record of his own. You know that. ...Now then, who do you want first?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬明","displayName":"Ma Ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r200","rowIndex":200,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=4>馬明</tips>は考え込む<tips=39>ジェフリー</tips>から、僕の方へ視線を移す。","en":"<tips=4>Ma Ming</tips> shifted his gaze from the brooding <tips=39>Jeffrey</tips> to me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r201","rowIndex":201,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まず<tips=40>天明</tips>と<tips=40>天祥</tips>が必要だね。あとは、二、三人荒っぽいことに実績がある人間を貸して欲しい。……それと<tips=25>世傑</tips>がいれば間違いない」","en":"“First, I’ll need <tips=40>Tin-ming</tips> and <tips=40>Tin-cheung</tips>. Then I want you to lend me two or three people with a proven record in violent work. ...And with <tips=25>Sai-kit</tips> along, we can’t go wrong.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r202","rowIndex":202,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「おい<tips=2>阿亮</tips>、<tips=25>世傑</tips>なんかを……」","en":"“Hey, <tips=2>Ah Leung</tips>, <tips=25>Sai-kit</tips>, of all people...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬明","displayName":"Ma Ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r203","rowIndex":203,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「約束したじゃないか。きみが何を言っても彼を借りるからね。葬儀の時に姿を見かけたから、今は近くにいるんでしょ？　万全を期すには彼のような経験のある優秀な<tips=80>紅棍</tips>が必要なんだ」","en":"“You gave me your word. Whatever you say, I’m borrowing him. I saw him at the funeral, so he’s nearby now, isn’t he? To make absolutely sure, I need an experienced, first-rate <tips=80>Red Pole</tips> like him.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r204","rowIndex":204,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ううむ」","en":"“Hmm...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬明","displayName":"Ma Ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r205","rowIndex":205,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=4>馬明</tips>は渋い声でうなり声を上げる。","en":"<tips=4>Ma Ming</tips> groaned unhappily.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r206","rowIndex":206,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「わかった。認めよう！　よし<tips=39>ジェフリー</tips>。これなら心配はないだろう。いい人選じゃないか。お前の二人の娘はこういう場合には誰よりも役に立つ。<tips=25>世傑</tips>は屑だがいないよりはマシだろう。おれと、おまえと、兄貴、三人の子供で最初の仕事をやろうってわけだ。あとは経験豊富な部下を何人かつければ、<tips=2>阿亮</tips>なら立派にやりとげるよ」","en":"“Fine. I approve! There, <tips=39>Jeffrey</tips>. Nothing to worry about now, is there? It’s a good selection. Your two daughters are more useful than anyone in a situation like this. <tips=25>Sai-kit</tips> is scum, but he’s better than no one. The children of the three of us—yours, mine, and Big Brother’s—will be doing their first job together. Add a few experienced subordinates, and <tips=2>Ah Leung</tips> will carry it off admirably.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬明","displayName":"Ma Ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r207","rowIndex":207,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そのメンツならば、<tips=25>世傑</tips>を実行部隊の隊長にして、<tips=1>阿<tips=1>亮</tips></tips>は作戦だけ立てて結果を待てば良いのでは？」","en":"“With that lineup, why not put <tips=25>Sai-kit</tips> in command of the strike team, have <tips=1>Ah-<tips=1>Leung</tips></tips> devise the plan, and wait for the result?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ジェフリー・ウォン","displayName":"Jeffrey Wong","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r208","rowIndex":208,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「僕が乗り込まないと意味がない」","en":"“There’s no point unless I go in myself.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r209","rowIndex":209,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それは認められませんよ。あまりにも危険です」","en":"“I cannot allow that. It is far too dangerous.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ジェフリー・ウォン","displayName":"Jeffrey Wong","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r210","rowIndex":210,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=39>ジェフリー</tips>は渋るが、しかし<tips=4>馬明</tips>は譲らなかった。","en":"<tips=39>Jeffrey</tips> remained reluctant, but <tips=4>Ma Ming</tips> would not yield.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r211","rowIndex":211,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「心配はもっともだが、こいつは大丈夫。兄貴だって危険をいとわず仕事をしてのぼりつめたんだ。<tips=1>阿<tips=1>亮</tips></tips>も同じ道を歩むべきだ。何より、こいつなら誰よりうまくやるだろう。<tips=25>世傑</tips>を隊長にするだなんて、とんでもない。……なあ、<tips=26>劉</tips>を取り立てたのはもともと兄貴なんだ。兄貴の息子である<tips=1>阿<tips=1>亮</tips></tips>の手で引導を渡すのが一番筋が通っているし、奴に対する慈悲でもある。功労者であることは確かだからな。御曹司が刺客ならば、誇りも傷つくまい」","en":"“Your concern is reasonable, but this boy will be fine. Big Brother rose to the top by taking on dangerous work without flinching. <tips=1>Ah-<tips=1>Leung</tips></tips> should follow the same path. More than that, I expect he’ll handle it better than anyone. Putting <tips=25>Sai-kit</tips> in command is out of the question. ...Listen, Big Brother was the one who raised <tips=26>Ryu</tips> up in the organization. It’s only proper that Big Brother’s son, <tips=1>Ah-<tips=1>Leung</tips></tips>, deliver the final blow, and it will be a mercy to Ryu as well. He did render distinguished service, after all. Being killed by the young master shouldn’t wound his pride.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬明","displayName":"Ma Ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r212","rowIndex":212,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「私にはどうしても、不必要なリスクを冒すようにしか思えませんが」","en":"“To me, it still seems that we would be taking an unnecessary risk.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ジェフリー・ウォン","displayName":"Jeffrey Wong","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r213","rowIndex":213,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=39>ジェフリー</tips>」","en":"“<tips=39>Jeffrey</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r214","rowIndex":214,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　まだ迷いを見せる彼に、僕は言った。","en":"I addressed him as he continued to hesitate.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r215","rowIndex":215,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「僕を将来の<tips=81>龍頭</tips>として考えているならば、やらせるべきだ。<tips=4>馬明</tips>が言うとおり、このままじゃ僕のことなんか誰も信用しない。それに、こんなところで死ぬのならば、そもそも<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>の<tips=81>龍頭</tips>としてやってゆく能力も運もないってことだ。迷う理由はない」","en":"“If you regard me as the future <tips=81>Longtou</tips>, you should let me do it. <tips=4>Ma Ming</tips> is right: if things continue as they are, no one will ever trust me. Besides, if I die in a place like this, then I never had the ability or the luck to lead <tips=7>YS</tips> as its <tips=81>Longtou</tips> in the first place. There is no reason to hesitate.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r216","rowIndex":216,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうだろう！　まったくそのとおりだ！」","en":"“Precisely! Exactly right!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬明","displayName":"Ma Ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r217","rowIndex":217,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　大声で賛成したのは<tips=4>馬明</tips>だ。","en":"It was <tips=4>Ma Ming</tips> who loudly voiced his agreement.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r218","rowIndex":218,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「しかし、随分積極的になったな。この間まで、組織に入りたくないとごねていたくせに」","en":"“Still, you’ve certainly become eager. Only the other day, you were making a fuss about not wanting to join the organization.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬明","displayName":"Ma Ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r219","rowIndex":219,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「今だって楽しかないが、やるとなったら、中途半端にやるわけにはいかない。いい加減なことをしていたら自分の寿命が縮むだけだからね。<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>の息子なんか、みんな殺したくて仕方ないだろう。ここにいるなら僕は力をつけないといけないんだ」","en":"“It’s not as though I enjoy it now. But once I’m doing this, I can’t afford half measures. Going about it half-heartedly would only shorten my life. Everyone must be dying to kill <tips=3>Chris Tse’s</tips> son. If I’m going to stay here, I have to become strong.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r220","rowIndex":220,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕が苦々しく言うと、<tips=4>馬明</tips>はニヤリと笑う。","en":"When I spoke bitterly, <tips=4>Ma Ming</tips> grinned.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r221","rowIndex":221,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……そこまで言うならば仕方ありません」","en":"“...If you insist upon putting it that way, I have no choice.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ジェフリー・ウォン","displayName":"Jeffrey Wong","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r222","rowIndex":222,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=39>ジェフリー</tips>は神経質に眉間にしわを寄せながら、","en":"<tips=39>Jeffrey</tips> knitted his brow nervously and said,","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r223","rowIndex":223,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「わかりました。しかし、絶対に無茶はしないでください」","en":"“Very well. But you must not do anything reckless.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ジェフリー・ウォン","displayName":"Jeffrey Wong","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r224","rowIndex":224,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　――<tips=26>劉建志</tips>。３２才。生まれたのは<tips=9>Y地区</tips>の外れにある<tips=13>溝平B団地</tips>。通称<tips=13>ヘドロ団地</tips>。<tips=9>Y地区</tips>のなかでもつまはじきにされるようなろくでなしたちが住み着く、半分廃墟となった建物が彼の故郷だ。","en":"—<tips=26>Ryu Kenshi</tips>. Thirty-two years old. Born in the <tips=13>Mizohira B Housing Complex</tips> at the edge of <tips=9>Y District</tips>. Better known as the <tips=13>Sludge Housing Complex</tips>. That half-ruined building, inhabited by lowlifes ostracized even within <tips=9>Y District</tips>, was the place he called home.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r225","rowIndex":225,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　両親は揃って救いがたいジャンキーで、幼い頃から虐待されて育ち、１３才になると銃を持って二人を射殺した。これが彼にとって初めての殺人だ。","en":"Both his parents were irredeemable addicts, and they abused him from early childhood. At thirteen, Ryu took a gun and shot them both to death. It was his first murder.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r226","rowIndex":226,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そのまま団地を出て<tips=59>暗闇通り</tips>に住み着き、能力を使って不良少年たちのリーダーとなるかたわら、売春宿の用心棒なども務める。","en":"He left the complex and settled on <tips=59>Darkness Street</tips>, where he used his ability to become the leader of the delinquent youths while also working as a brothel guard.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r227","rowIndex":227,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　身長１８３センチ。体重は８５キロ。右利き。好きな音楽のジャンルはレゲエ。好きな映画はアーサー・チェン監督の港町シリーズ。煙草とマリファナを好み、酒は強くはなく、酒乱のケがあり、普段は自重している。靴下はチェック柄のものしか穿かない。エトセトラ、エトセトラ。","en":"Height: 183 centimeters. Weight: 85 kilograms. Right-handed. Favorite genre of music: reggae. Favorite films: director Arthur Chen’s Harbor Town series. Fond of cigarettes and marijuana. Unable to hold his liquor and prone to violence when drunk, so he generally keeps himself in check. Wears nothing but checkered socks. Et cetera, et cetera.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r228","rowIndex":228,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼の家は<tips=59>暗闇通り</tips>から路地を一つ入った場所のビルの中にある。","en":"His home was in a building one alley off <tips=59>Darkness Street</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r229","rowIndex":229,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　古い雑居ビルを買い取ったもので、中には彼の住まいの他に、幾人かの部下の住居も入っており、他の階ではダーツバーやカジノも営業している。","en":"He had purchased an old mixed-use building. In addition to his own residence, it contained quarters for several subordinates, while a dart bar and casino operated on other floors.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r230","rowIndex":230,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　午前五時、日が明ける直前の時刻にその建物を襲撃することにした。","en":"We decided to assault it at five in the morning, immediately before dawn.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r231","rowIndex":231,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　今回の作戦のために、<tips=76>旧義勝</tips>のなかで暗殺において実績のある二人の<tips=80>紅棍</tips>を借り受けた。","en":"For this operation, I borrowed two <tips=80>Red Poles</tips> with proven records in assassination from the <tips=76>old Yisheng</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r232","rowIndex":232,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　一人は普段精肉屋をやっている射撃の名手姜浩強、もう一人は学生時代クレー射撃の選手だった林徳軒という、射撃の腕前に定評のある二人だ。","en":"One was Jiang Haoqiang, an expert marksman who ordinarily worked as a butcher. The other was Lin Dexuan, who had competed in clay shooting as a student. Both had well-established reputations for their skill as marksmen.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r233","rowIndex":233,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　最近<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>では抗争は減ったけれども、二人ともこうした仕事の経験が豊富だ。","en":"Violent conflicts had become less common within <tips=7>YS</tips> in recent years, but both men had extensive experience in work of this nature.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r234","rowIndex":234,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　これに、僕の選んだ人間を足した計六人がビルの近くの真っ暗な路地で蹲っている。","en":"Together with the people I had selected, that made six of us crouching in a pitch-black alley near the building.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r235","rowIndex":235,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　周囲にはゴミ箱から漂う生臭いにおいが漂っている。","en":"A rank, fishy stench wafted from the garbage bins around us.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r236","rowIndex":236,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　周囲の不自然な改築を繰り返した建物は、まだ夜の明け切らぬ薄暗い空を背景にいびつなシルエットを作っている。","en":"The buildings around us, warped by one haphazard alteration after another, formed jagged silhouettes against a dim sky not yet fully touched by dawn.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r237","rowIndex":237,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ああ、これが<tips=9>Y地区</tips>の路地裏だ。僕は再び<tips=9>Y地区</tips>のまっただ中に戻って来た。","en":"Ah, this was a back alley in <tips=9>Y District</tips>. Once again, I had returned to the very heart of <tips=9>Y District</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r238","rowIndex":238,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「感じ取れる？」","en":"“Can you sense them?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r239","rowIndex":239,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕が囁くように尋ねると、それまでじっと集中して能力を使っていた<tips=40>天明</tips>は顔を伏せたまま、","en":"I asked in a whisper. <tips=40>Tin-ming</tips>, who had been sitting utterly still and concentrating on her ability, answered without lifting her head.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r240","rowIndex":240,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……<tips=26>劉</tips>幹部の部屋に六人。……部下たちの居室には、誰もいません。……二階のカジノに一人。……三階のダーツバーは誰もいないようです」","en":"“...Six people in Officer <tips=26>Ryu’s</tips> rooms. ...No one in the subordinates’ quarters. ...One person in the casino on the second floor. ...The dart bar on the third floor appears empty.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"黄天明","displayName":"Wong Tin-ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r241","rowIndex":241,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=39>ジェフリー・ウォン</tips>の二人の娘、<tips=40>黄天明</tips>と<tips=40>黄天祥</tips>は共に<tips=16>タイプA</tips>で、その<tips=77>特質変異</tips>と引き替えにレーダーのようにある程度以上の生命体を感知する能力を授かっている。","en":"<tips=39>Jeffrey Wong’s</tips> two daughters, <tips=40>Wong Tin-ming</tips> and <tips=40>Wong Tin-cheung</tips>, were both <tips=16>Type As</tips>. In exchange for their <tips=77>trait mutations</tips>, each had been granted an ability that sensed living things above a certain size, much like radar.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r242","rowIndex":242,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕とは子どもの時からの顔見知りだが、彼女たちは幼い頃からこの能力を使うために父のそばに居たので、あまり顔を合わせる機会がなかった。","en":"I had known them since childhood, but because they had remained at their father’s side from an early age to put this ability to use, I had rarely had occasion to see them.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r243","rowIndex":243,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　普段は<tips=81>龍頭</tips>のそばに控えて招かれざる人物の接近を許さぬよう見張っているのを、今日は特別に借りて来た。","en":"Ordinarily, they remained beside the <tips=81>Longtou</tips>, keeping watch against the approach of unwanted visitors. Today, as a special exception, I had borrowed their services.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r244","rowIndex":244,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=26>劉</tips>の部屋の六人は何をしているかわかるかい？」","en":"“Can you tell what the six people in <tips=26>Ryu’s</tips> rooms are doing?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r245","rowIndex":245,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……具体的な行動は定かではないですが、六人とも動きが少なく、部屋でじっとしています」","en":"“...I can’t tell exactly what they’re doing, but all six are barely moving. They’re keeping still in the room.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"黄天明","displayName":"Wong Tin-ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r246","rowIndex":246,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女たちの感知能力は個人の姿形を見分けるようなものではなく、ぼうっと蝋燭の炎のように生命の存在を感じ取っているのだと聞いたことがある。","en":"I had heard that their ability could not distinguish a person’s figure or shape. They sensed the presence of life only as a dim impression, like the flame of a candle.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r247","rowIndex":247,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　だから、移動しているか、止まっているかがわかるくらいで、それ以上の詳しい動作はわからないのだろう。","en":"They could therefore tell whether a presence moved or remained still, but presumably could not make out any more detailed movements.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r248","rowIndex":248,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　他の部屋に誰もいないとなると、部下たちを自分の部屋に呼んで酒でも飲み、そのまま雑魚寝でもしているのかもしれない。まだ起きて話し込んでいるということも考えられるが。","en":"If none of the other rooms were occupied, Ryu might have called his subordinates into his own rooms for drinks, and they might all have crashed there together. Or they might still be awake, talking.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r249","rowIndex":249,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　いずれにしろ、一カ所に集まっているというのは僕らにとってこの上なく好都合だ。","en":"Whatever the case, having all of them gathered in one place could not suit us better.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r250","rowIndex":250,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　五分ほどそこで待機して彼らの動向を窺ったが、やはりほとんど動きがないことから、眠っていることが確認出来た。彼らが起き出す前に、計画通り突入する。","en":"We waited there for about five minutes and watched for movement. When they still barely moved, we could confirm that they were asleep. We would enter according to plan before they woke.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r251","rowIndex":251,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=1>謝亮</tips>様、やっぱり危険ですよ。今は寝ているとは言え、相手はあの<tips=26>劉建志</tips>なんです。……突入なんかしないで、たとえば毒ガスでいぶり出すとか、爆弾を投げ込むとか、そういう方法はないんでしょうか？」","en":"“Master <tips=1>Tse Leung</tips>, this really is dangerous. He may be asleep now, but our opponent is <tips=26>Ryu Kenshi</tips>. ...Couldn’t we avoid going inside and use some other method—smoke them out with poison gas, for example, or throw in a bomb?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"黄天明","displayName":"Wong Tin-ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r252","rowIndex":252,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=40>黄天明</tips>が心配そうに言う。","en":"<tips=40>Tin-ming</tips> said anxiously.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r253","rowIndex":253,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「きみは面白いことを言うね。街中で致死量の毒ガスをばらまくとか、派手に爆発させるとか、近隣住民ごと吹っ飛ばそうっていうのかい？　なかなかダイナミックで素敵なアイデアだと思うけれど、残念ながら僕らはテロリストではないんだ」","en":"“That’s quite an idea. Are you proposing that we release a lethal concentration of gas in the middle of the city? Or set off a spectacular explosion and blow up all the neighbors along with them? It’s certainly dynamic—I’ll give you that. Unfortunately, we’re not terrorists.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r254","rowIndex":254,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「す、すみません。でも、<tips=1>謝亮</tips>様が心配で……」","en":"“I-I’m sorry. But I’m worried about you, Master <tips=1>Tse Leung</tips>...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"黄天明","displayName":"Wong Tin-ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r255","rowIndex":255,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=40>天明</tips>は謝りながらもなお不安そうにしている。","en":"<tips=40>Tin-ming</tips> apologized but still looked anxious.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r256","rowIndex":256,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あの……よく警察とかが、犯罪を起こした<tips=16>タイプA</tips>を逮捕するために、能力を抑える薬を使いますよね？　ああいうのは、手には入らないんですか？」","en":"“Um... The police use drugs that suppress <tips=16>Type A</tips> abilities when they arrest Type As who have committed crimes, do they not? Is there no way to obtain something like that?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"黄天祥","displayName":"Wong Tin-cheung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r257","rowIndex":257,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　妹の<tips=40>天祥</tips>が控えめに提案する。","en":"Her younger sister, <tips=40>Tin-cheung</tips>, offered a tentative suggestion.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r258","rowIndex":258,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「確かにあれがあればベストだ。でも、無理だってさ。<tips=31>エリー</tips>が言うには、銃器や麻薬よりもよほど入手しにくいシロモノらしい」","en":"“That would certainly be ideal. But apparently there’s no chance. According to <tips=31>Ellie</tips>, that stuff is far harder to get hold of than guns or narcotics.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r259","rowIndex":259,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕は肩をすくめて、","en":"I shrugged.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r260","rowIndex":260,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まあ、そんなものなくても楽勝だと思うよ。……今は不安かもしれないけれど、終わってみれば僕の言う通りだったとわかるさ。ここには。かつて将来を嘱望された若き<tips=80>紅棍</tips>もいるんだし」","en":"“Well, I think this should be easy even without it. ...You may be anxious now, but once it’s over, you’ll see that I was right. Besides, we have with us someone once hailed as a promising young <tips=80>Red Pole</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r261","rowIndex":261,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それ、アタシのこと？」","en":"“You mean me?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬世傑","displayName":"Ma Sai-kit","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r262","rowIndex":262,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=25>世傑</tips>が何故かいやそうな顔をして言う。","en":"For some reason, <tips=25>Sai-kit</tips> looked displeased as he spoke.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r263","rowIndex":263,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうだよ。期待しているんだ」","en":"“That’s right. I’m counting on you.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r264","rowIndex":264,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いやんなっちゃうわ。アタシ、期待されるのと信頼されるのは苦手なの」","en":"“Oh, I hate this. I’m no good at being trusted or counted on.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬世傑","displayName":"Ma Sai-kit","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r265","rowIndex":265,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼は顔を顰め、肩をすくめた。","en":"He frowned and shrugged.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r266","rowIndex":266,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まあ、私もアンタには期待してるわよ。噂は色々と聞いてるし……この間の<tips=57>滑走路通り</tips>で、あの<tips=10>見土</tips>が人食い虎をやっつけたときもアンタがいたんでしょ？」","en":"“Well, I’m counting on you too. I’ve heard all sorts of stories... You were there on <tips=57>Runway Street</tips> the other day when that <tips=10>Mido</tips> took down the man-eating tiger, weren’t you?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬世傑","displayName":"Ma Sai-kit","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r267","rowIndex":267,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「詳しいな」","en":"“You know a lot.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r268","rowIndex":268,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕は顔を顰める。","en":"I frowned.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r269","rowIndex":269,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そりゃそうよ。でも、おもしろいものよね。ここで寝ている<tips=26>劉</tips>は　”<tips=81>龍頭</tips>の猟犬”　って呼ばれてたわけでしょ？　虎に続いて犬とは、よくよく猛獣退治に縁のあることね」","en":"“Naturally. It is funny, though. The <tips=26>Ryu</tips> sleeping in there used to be called ‘the <tips=81>Longtou’s</tips> hound,’ didn’t he? First a tiger, and now a dog. You really do have a peculiar connection to the slaying of savage beasts.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬世傑","displayName":"Ma Sai-kit","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r270","rowIndex":270,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=25>世傑</tips>はおほほと笑う。","en":"<tips=25>Sai-kit</tips> laughed with an affected “Ohoho.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r271","rowIndex":271,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　これが<tips=25>馬世傑</tips>という男だ。どうしてあの<tips=4>馬明</tips>からこんな人間が生まれたのかよくわからないが、しかし能力があることは知っている。","en":"That was the sort of man <tips=25>Ma Sai-kit</tips> was. I could not understand how <tips=4>Ma Ming</tips> had produced such a person, but I knew he was capable.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r272","rowIndex":272,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「下らないお喋りはやめよう。ビジネスの時間だ」","en":"“Enough pointless chatter. It’s time for business.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r273","rowIndex":273,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕はそう宣言し、そして作戦を開始した。","en":"With that declaration, I set the operation in motion.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r274","rowIndex":274,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=40>黄姉妹</tips>はその場に残し、残りの四人が突入部隊と決めてあった。襲撃を前に、この突入部隊は黄色と白のツートンカラーのカプセルを一錠ずつ飲み込む。","en":"The <tips=40>Wong sisters</tips> would remain behind, while the other four of us formed the entry team. Before the assault, each member of the entry team swallowed one yellow-and-white capsule.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r275","rowIndex":275,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　これは『ピーク』という興奮剤で、集中力と筋力の増強が見込める。軍隊のために開発された薬で、今は街の不良の喧嘩から、ギャングの抗争までよく使われるありふれた薬だ。効果が切れたあとに軽い虚脱感があるが、今回のような短い作戦ならば充分に役に立つだろう。","en":"It was a stimulant called Peak, expected to heighten concentration and physical strength. Developed for the military, it had since become a commonplace drug, used in everything from street fights among the city’s delinquents to gang warfare. Its effects left a mild crash after they wore off, but it would serve well enough for a short operation like this one.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r276","rowIndex":276,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして僕たちは裏口の側に移動する。","en":"We moved to the rear entrance.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r277","rowIndex":277,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　建物に特別なセキュリティシステムはなく、鍵はあらかじめ合い鍵を作ってあるのでそれを使って、この裏口から普通に侵入するだけだ。","en":"The building possessed no special security system. We had prepared a duplicate key in advance, so we could simply use it to enter through the rear door.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r278","rowIndex":278,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕はこの場面で、ふと、この作戦中に例の発作が訪れて、眠りこけてしまわないかと心配になった。","en":"At that moment, it occurred to me to worry that one of those attacks might strike during the operation and send me to sleep.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r279","rowIndex":279,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　いつもは大体前兆が現れてから意識を失うまで五分くらいかかり、予兆もなく突然倒れてしまうのは滅多にないが、ありえないことではない。交戦中に倒れてグースカ眠りはじめては何もかも台無しである。","en":"Ordinarily, approximately five minutes passed between the first warning sign and my loss of consciousness. I rarely collapsed without warning, but it was not impossible. If I fell in the middle of combat and began snoring peacefully, it would ruin everything.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r280","rowIndex":280,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　可能性としては極めて薄いとしても、最悪のトラブルというものは、最悪のタイミングで起こるものだ。","en":"However remote the possibility, the worst kind of trouble has a way of striking at the worst possible moment.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r281","rowIndex":281,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　まあ、その時は、その時だ。","en":"Well, if it happened, I would deal with it then.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r282","rowIndex":282,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その場で持ち物の最終確認をして、お互いが無言で頷き合う。そして僕は<tips=25>世傑</tips>に突入の合図を目配せした。","en":"We checked our gear one last time and nodded to one another in silence. I then gave <tips=25>Sai-kit</tips> the signal to enter with a glance.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r283","rowIndex":283,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼が蝶番が錆び付いたドアをキイと音を鳴らしながら開くと、誘導灯が薄暗い緑色の光で部屋を照らす裏玄関となる。","en":"The rusted hinges squealed as he opened the door, revealing a rear entry hall lit by the dim green glow of an emergency sign.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r284","rowIndex":284,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ビルで営業する店舗の搬入口として使っているだろう、このホールの片隅には、段ボールや飲料水のタンクが積まれている。そしてすぐ目の前には細く狭い階段があった。","en":"The hall was presumably used as a delivery entrance by the businesses in the building. Cardboard boxes and tanks of drinking water stood piled in one corner, and a narrow, cramped staircase rose immediately before us.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r285","rowIndex":285,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　目的の<tips=26>劉</tips>の部屋は一番上の四階にあり、エレベーターは設置されていないから、そこに辿り着くにはこの階段を上るほかない。","en":"<tips=26>Ryu’s</tips> rooms occupied the fourth and highest floor. The building had no elevator, leaving this staircase as the only way to reach them.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r286","rowIndex":286,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　二人が肩を並べると窮屈になるこの階段を、僕らは一人ずつ上った。","en":"The stairs were too narrow for two people to walk comfortably abreast, so we climbed in single file.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r287","rowIndex":287,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕らはそれぞれの肩にライフルを担いでいる。これは<tips=26>劉建志</tips>を倒すために用意した特別な武器だ。普通の火器では彼を倒すことが困難であるため、<tips=31>エリー・ホワイト</tips>の協力によって急遽調達された。","en":"Each of us had a rifle slung over one shoulder. These were special weapons prepared to defeat <tips=26>Ryu Kenshi</tips>. Ordinary firearms would have great difficulty killing him, so they had been procured at short notice with <tips=31>Ellie White’s</tips> assistance.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r288","rowIndex":288,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=26>劉建志</tips>は、その<tips=16>タイプA</tips>としての能力によって、遠くに設置した爆弾や銃を任意のタイミングで作動させて目標を攻撃したり、敵対者の持つそれらを暴発させて無力化させることが出来る。","en":"With his <tips=16>Type A</tips> ability, <tips=26>Ryu Kenshi</tips> could trigger guns and bombs planted at a distance whenever he chose, using them to attack a target. He could also force weapons held by his enemies to discharge and render them useless.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r289","rowIndex":289,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　一般的には銃器や爆発物を遠隔操作する能力だと思われているようだが、僕が分析した限りではちょっと違う。彼の能力は、火薬に着火するというものだ。","en":"His ability was generally believed to control firearms and explosives from a distance, but my analysis produced a somewhat different conclusion. His power ignited gunpowder.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r290","rowIndex":290,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=16>タイプA</tips>が自分の能力を告白することは命取りだから、彼自身がそう明言したことはないし、僕以外でそれに気がついている者がいるのかどうかもわからないが、彼が能力を使った場面を考えるとほぼ間違いがない。","en":"For a <tips=16>Type A</tips>, confessing the nature of one’s ability can be fatal. Ryu had never stated it himself, and I did not know whether anyone else had noticed, but his recorded uses of the ability left almost no room for doubt.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r291","rowIndex":291,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　今回の仕事が決まってから彼が能力を使った記録にあたったのだが、着火すると言っても何にでも火を付ける能力ではないようで、木材やガソリンに火を付けたという例は見られなかった。対象は火薬限定なのだろう。","en":"After the operation was approved, I examined those records. Although his ability caused ignition, it did not appear capable of setting fire to just anything. There was no example of him igniting wood or gasoline. Gunpowder was presumably its sole target.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r292","rowIndex":292,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　相手が振り回す拳銃の弾倉内に収められた銃弾の火薬を発火させ、思いのままに暴発させているところなどを見ると、能力のすばやさと精密性はすさまじいものがあるらしい。","en":"Judging from the way he could ignite the propellant in cartridges inside an opponent’s pistol magazine and make them discharge at will, the speed and precision of his ability must have been extraordinary.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r293","rowIndex":293,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　もしかしたら、彼の能力にはただ着火させるだけでなく、特定の範囲内の火薬を感知するような力も含まれているのかもしれない。その感知した火薬のなかから、選んだものを自由に発火出来るのかもしれない。","en":"Perhaps his ability did more than ignite gunpowder: it might also detect gunpowder within a particular range. He might then choose freely among the charges he sensed and ignite whichever one he wished.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r294","rowIndex":294,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　いずれにしろ、非常にすぐれた能力で、お互い銃を手にして戦うような場面ではほとんど無敵と言って良いだろう。","en":"In any event, it was an exceptional power. In any exchange where both sides carried guns, he could be called nearly invincible.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r295","rowIndex":295,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そうでなくとも、近代兵器というのはその多くに火薬を使用している。これらを特別な仕掛けもなしに肉体一つで操れるということは、あらゆる場面で役に立つに違いない。","en":"Even beyond firearms, many modern weapons used gunpowder. The power to control such weapons with nothing but his own body, and without any special mechanism, must have been useful in every imaginable situation.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r296","rowIndex":296,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　が、能力の内容さえわかっていれば、対処自体は可能だ。","en":"But once the nature of the ability was understood, countermeasures were possible.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r297","rowIndex":297,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　世間の多くの人は、すぐれたサイキックを相手にするとなると、常人とは違うというだけで必要以上の恐れを抱いてしまうものだけど、誰が相手でも、どんな場合でも、同じことをするだけだ。そこにあるものだけを見ればいい。","en":"When facing a formidable psychic, most people grow excessively afraid simply because the opponent differs from an ordinary human being. Yet whoever the opponent may be, and whatever the circumstances, one need only do the same thing: look solely at what is actually there.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r298","rowIndex":298,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　今回用意したこの銃ならば、彼の能力でも無効化することは出来ない。それでも、その場にある他の銃は彼の思いのままであるため、油断は出来ないが。","en":"He could not neutralize the guns we had prepared. Even so, every other gun present would remain subject to his will, so we could not let our guard down.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r299","rowIndex":299,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　軍隊や警察の最新装備として配備されている<tips=16>タイプA</tips>能力を無効化するガスを用意出来ればもっと良かったが、これは<tips=31>エリー・ホワイト</tips>の調達ルートを持ってしても手に入れることは不可能だった。","en":"It would have been better to obtain the gas now deployed by militaries and police forces as cutting-edge equipment to neutralize <tips=16>Type A</tips> abilities, but even <tips=31>Ellie White’s</tips> procurement channels could not secure it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r300","rowIndex":300,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ねえ猟犬で思い出したんだけど、<tips=2>阿亮</tips>、むかーし<tips=58>パラシュート通り</tips>に住んでいた、オズワルドという男を知ってる？」","en":"“Speaking of hounds, <tips=2>Ah Leung</tips>, do you remember a man named Oswald who lived on <tips=58>Parachute Street</tips> a looong time ago?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬世傑","displayName":"Ma Sai-kit","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r301","rowIndex":301,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　先頭を行く<tips=25>馬世傑</tips>が、足取り重く億劫そうに階段を上りながら、そのすぐ後ろを行く僕に話しかけた。","en":"<tips=25>Ma Sai-kit</tips> led the way, trudging up the stairs as though every step were a chore and speaking to me as I followed immediately behind.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r302","rowIndex":302,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「聞いたような名前だけれど誰だっけ」","en":"“The name sounds familiar. Who was he?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r303","rowIndex":303,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「禿げた白人の男よ。犬を沢山飼ってた」","en":"“A bald white man. He kept a great many dogs.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬世傑","displayName":"Ma Sai-kit","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r304","rowIndex":304,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　父とちっとも似ないスリムな体を黒いスーツに包んだその長髪の優男は、父の『強く男らしくあるべし』という教育方針で、物心つく前から様々な流派の武術教師を雇われ、そしていずれも高いレベルで習得していた。いや、高いレベルなどという生やさしいものではなく、ほとんど常人離れした才能を発揮したのである。しかし、肝心の男らしさは全く身につかず、子供の頃から女言葉を使う。","en":"Slender and delicate-featured, bearing no resemblance at all to his father, Sai-kit wore a black suit and kept his hair long. Ma Ming’s educational principle was that his son must grow strong and manly, so from before Sai-kit was old enough to remember, he had hired instructors in a variety of martial traditions. Sai-kit mastered every one of them to a high degree—no, “a high degree” scarcely described it. He displayed talent almost beyond ordinary human limits. Yet none of the intended masculinity took root, and he had spoken in feminine language since childhood.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r305","rowIndex":305,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　人に同性愛者と疑われても否定をしないが、実際には過度の女好きで、しかも女に容赦がない。","en":"When people suspected him of being homosexual, he made no attempt to deny it. In reality, he was an inveterate womanizer—and merciless toward women.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r306","rowIndex":306,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼によって破滅した女は多い。","en":"Many women had been ruined by him.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r307","rowIndex":307,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そもそも、<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>の若き<tips=80>紅棍</tips>として頭角を現していた彼を、父の<tips=4>馬明</tips>が自ら<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>に願い出て組織から追放した理由も女がらみのトラブルだった。","en":"Indeed, trouble involving a woman was the reason <tips=4>Ma Ming</tips> himself had petitioned <tips=3>Chris Tse</tips> to expel his own son from the organization, despite Sai-kit’s rising prominence as a young <tips=80>Red Pole</tips> of <tips=7>YS</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r308","rowIndex":308,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ちなみに、今日は彼に限らず全員が黒いスーツを着ていたが、それは彼の断固たる主張によるもので、汚れ仕事を行うときは喪服を着るのが彼にとって死にゆくものへの敬意だとか、ポリシーだとか、よくわからない美学をごちゃごちゃと語っていた。","en":"Incidentally, everyone wore a black suit that day, not only Sai-kit. He had insisted upon it, rambling on about some muddled personal aesthetic: when doing dirty work, wearing mourning clothes was his way of showing respect for those about to die, or a matter of principle, or something of the sort.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r309","rowIndex":309,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ああ、それなら覚えてる。有名人じゃないか。でかい犬を何匹も一遍に散歩させて、すれ違う人がこわがるのを見てニヤニヤしていたやつだろう？」","en":"“Ah, now I remember. He was something of a celebrity, wasn’t he? The man who used to walk several enormous dogs at once and grin when people recoiled from them?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r310","rowIndex":310,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうよ。慈善活動という名目で、行き場のない犬を引き取って、犬屋敷みたいにして住んでた男」","en":"“That’s him. He took in unwanted dogs under the name of charity and lived in a house that was almost a kennel.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬世傑","displayName":"Ma Sai-kit","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r311","rowIndex":311,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼がそう言ったところで、さしかかろうとしていた二階のドアがギイと開いて、従業員が姿を現した。","en":"Just as he finished, the second-floor door we were approaching opened with a creak and an employee appeared.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r312","rowIndex":312,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ギョッとする男に、<tips=25>世傑</tips>はドアが開きかけた時点で無造作でありつつ素早い動作で照準を合わせライフルの引き金を引く。暗闇のなかでカチャッという銃自体の作動音とプシュッと空気の抜ける音が同時に鳴り、相手が悲鳴を上げる間もなく倒れた。出血は確認出来なかったが急所に命中したのだろう。","en":"The man recoiled. Before the door had opened fully, <tips=25>Sai-kit</tips> aimed with a casual yet swift motion and pulled the trigger. The click of the rifle’s mechanism sounded together with a rush of escaping air in the darkness. The other man fell before he could scream. I could see no blood, but the shot had presumably struck a vital point.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r313","rowIndex":313,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　このライフルは拳銃よりもさらに威力が劣る武器だが、当たり所が良かったとは言え一撃で倒したところを見ると、近距離で用いる分には問題がないようだ。ただ反響する階段で使うと思ったより射撃音が大きい。","en":"The rifle was even less powerful than a pistol. The shot may have been well placed, but the fact that it had brought the man down in one hit suggested the weapon would serve perfectly well at close range. Its report was louder than I had expected in the echoing stairwell.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r314","rowIndex":314,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「アタシ、あのイギリス人と結構親しかったのよね」","en":"“I was rather close to that Englishman.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬世傑","displayName":"Ma Sai-kit","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r315","rowIndex":315,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕が自分のライフルを差し出すと、<tips=25>世傑</tips>は今一発撃ったライフルをそれと交換し、何事もなかったかのように会話を続けながら階段を上る。","en":"I held out my own rifle to <tips=25>Sai-kit</tips>. He exchanged it for the one he had just fired, then continued up the stairs, carrying on the conversation as though nothing had happened.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r316","rowIndex":316,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それは初耳だね」","en":"“That’s news to me.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r317","rowIndex":317,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕たちは床に倒れた男の死体を踏まぬように足を置くが、何しろ暗く、靴底で流れ出た血液を踏んでしまった。","en":"We picked our way around the body, careful not to step on it. But the stairwell was dark, and we still ended up stepping in the blood flowing from it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r318","rowIndex":318,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あの男、最後は奥さんに殺されてしまったでしょう？　その理由が、まったく傑作なのよ」","en":"“His wife killed him in the end, remember? And the reason why was absolutely priceless.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬世傑","displayName":"Ma Sai-kit","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r319","rowIndex":319,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「飼い犬と性交してるのがばれて、逆上されたんだっけ？」","en":"“She flew into a rage after catching him having sex with one of his dogs, wasn’t that it?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r320","rowIndex":320,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「アハハ、それ、それ。アタシ、実はその趣味について彼が生きてる時から聞いて知っていたのよねえ」","en":"“Ahaha, yes, that’s it. The truth is, I’d already heard about that particular taste of his before he died.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬世傑","displayName":"Ma Sai-kit","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r321","rowIndex":321,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「へえ、妙な繋がりがあるもんだ」","en":"“I see. What a peculiar connection.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r322","rowIndex":322,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕は階段の先を見上げた。","en":"I looked toward the top of the staircase.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r323","rowIndex":323,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　目指す階まであとわずか。そこで、僕の目的の人物が待っている。","en":"The floor we sought was only a little farther. My target waited there.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r324","rowIndex":324,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「特殊な性癖の人って、昔からとても興味があるのよ。人間の業の深さを感じるでしょう？　それである時ね、彼の性癖が気になって、尋ねたことがあるの。ここに、メスの柴犬、シェパード、ゴールデンレトリバー、チワワなんかがいたとして、どれが一番そそるんですかって。そしたら彼、首を振ってこういうの。『その中には私の好みの犬はいない』って。アタシは『じゃあ、他のどんな犬種でもいいので、好きな犬をあげてください』って言ったのね。すると彼はもう一度首を振って、『犬種の問題じゃないんだ』と言うのよ。そのあと好みの犬を教えてくれたんだけど、結局彼が好きな犬というのはどんな犬だったと思う？」","en":"“I’ve always been fascinated by people with unusual sexual tastes. They give you a sense of how deep the compulsions of human nature run, don’t they? So one day, curiosity about his tastes got the better of me, and I asked him a question. Suppose there were a female Shiba Inu, German shepherd, golden retriever, and Chihuahua here—which one would turn him on the most? He shook his head and said, ‘There isn’t a dog I like among them.’ So I said, ‘Then name any other breed you like.’ He shook his head again and answered, ‘It isn’t a question of breed.’ After that, he told me what kind of dog he preferred. What do you think it was?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬世傑","displayName":"Ma Sai-kit","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r325","rowIndex":325,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「犬種の問題じゃないのなら、境遇かな？　ボランティアで不幸な犬を拾っていたから、虐待されていた犬ほど好みだとか……」","en":"“If it wasn’t a question of breed, perhaps it was a question of circumstances. He rescued suffering dogs as charity—did he prefer the ones that had been abused most severely?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r326","rowIndex":326,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして僕たちは、ようやく目指す階のドアの前に辿り着いた。","en":"At last, we reached the door leading onto the floor we were after.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r327","rowIndex":327,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ちがうわ」","en":"“Wrong.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬世傑","displayName":"Ma Sai-kit","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r328","rowIndex":328,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=25>世傑</tips>は声を落とし、ドアノブをひねる。","en":"<tips=25>Sai-kit</tips> lowered his voice and turned the doorknob.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r329","rowIndex":329,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その向こうには廊下があるが真っ暗だった。","en":"The corridor beyond was completely dark.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r330","rowIndex":330,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=25>世傑</tips>がペンライトで照らすと、奥の右手にドアが見える。あのドアの向こうに、ターゲットがいる。","en":"When <tips=25>Sai-kit</tips> illuminated it with a penlight, we saw a door toward the back on the right. Our target waited beyond it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r331","rowIndex":331,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕たちはドアをくぐり抜け、廊下に足を踏み入れた。","en":"We passed through the door and entered the corridor.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r332","rowIndex":332,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　少し広くなったので、二人ずつ肩を並べて歩く。","en":"It was somewhat wider, allowing us to proceed two abreast.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r333","rowIndex":333,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「じゃあ、どんな犬が好みだったのさ」","en":"“Then what kind of dog did he prefer?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r334","rowIndex":334,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕はひそめた声でそう尋ねる。","en":"I asked in a lowered voice.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r335","rowIndex":335,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そんなに難しい話じゃないわ。あのね、彼はこう言ったの」","en":"“It’s not that complicated. You see, this is what he told me.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r336","rowIndex":336,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=26>劉</tips>の居室へ繋がるドアの前に立つと、その向こうから人の気配がする。彼らは眠ってはいないようだ。","en":"When we stopped before the door to <tips=26>Ryu’s</tips> residence, we sensed people beyond it. They did not appear to be asleep.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r337","rowIndex":337,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=25>世傑</tips>はニヤニヤと笑いながらそのノブを握り、","en":"<tips=25>Sai-kit</tips> grinned as he grasped the knob.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r338","rowIndex":338,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「『私が好きなのはメスじゃない。オスなんだ』ってね。ねえ、あの男は犬をファックしていたんじゃなくて、犬にファックされていたのよ」","en":"“‘It’s not females I like. It’s males.’ You see, he wasn’t fucking the dogs. The dogs were fucking him.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r339","rowIndex":339,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼は僕らに目配せをして合図を送ってから、鍵を開け、そしてドアを開け放った。","en":"He gave us the signal with a glance, unlocked the door, and flung it open.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r340","rowIndex":340,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ライフルを構えた僕たちは一斉に部屋になだれ込む。","en":"Rifles raised, we all poured into the room at once.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r341","rowIndex":341,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　部屋の中は薄暗かった。マリファナの匂いがたちこめ、どこかのスピーカーがレゲエを鳴らしていた。","en":"The room was dim. The odor of marijuana filled the air, and reggae played from a speaker somewhere.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r342","rowIndex":342,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼らは揺らめくランプの炎を取り囲み、あるものはぐったりと背もたれによりかかり、また別のものは煙の立ち上るものを咥えている。","en":"They surrounded the flickering flame of a lamp. Some slumped against the backs of their seats, while others held smoking objects between their lips.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r343","rowIndex":343,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=26>劉建志</tips>は街のチンピラあがりだが、彼も、その仲間たちも、昔を彷彿とさせるラフないでたちで、安っぽいアクセサリーをじゃらじゃらと身につけ、肌の刺青を露出させている。","en":"<tips=26>Ryu Kenshi</tips> had started out as one of the city’s street punks, and both he and his companions wore rough clothes reminiscent of those days, cheap accessories jangling against their exposed tattoos.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r344","rowIndex":344,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　このなかで、僕が狙うのは<tips=26>劉建志</tips>。","en":"Among them, the one I would target was <tips=26>Ryu Kenshi</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r345","rowIndex":345,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼はトレードマークのマスクをしていなかったが、そのおかげですぐに本人だと断定出来た。","en":"He was not wearing his trademark mask. Thanks to that, I could immediately identify him with certainty.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r346","rowIndex":346,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　危険な場所に立ち入るとき、部下に自分のマスクをかぶらせて偽装するのはよく彼が使う手だ。","en":"When entering a dangerous place, he often disguised a subordinate with his own mask.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r347","rowIndex":347,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そうでなくとも、座興で別の人間にかぶらせるなどしていたら、僕たちは判断を間違える可能性がある。","en":"Even without such a plan, if Ryu had let someone else put it on as a joke, we might have chosen the wrong target.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r348","rowIndex":348,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しかし、<tips=77>特質変異</tips>によって生じた額の口は、他の誰とも見間違えることのないものだった。","en":"But the mouth upon his forehead, born from his <tips=77>trait mutation</tips>, could not be mistaken for that of any other person.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r349","rowIndex":349,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕たちは手にしたライフルを<tips=26>劉</tips>に向ける。","en":"We aimed our rifles at <tips=26>Ryu</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r350","rowIndex":350,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼はちょうどドアが視界に入る場所に座っていて、僕らの姿をその両目でしっかりと確認したが、何も出来なかった。能力を使うことさえ出来たか、どうか。テーブルに置いた銃に手を伸ばそうとしたその体を、いくつかの銃弾が貫いた。","en":"He was sitting with a clear view of the door and saw us plainly with both eyes, but there was nothing he could do. Whether he even managed to use his ability, I couldn’t tell. As he reached for the gun on the table, several bullets tore through his body.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r351","rowIndex":351,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕らの手にした武器は、狩猟に使うプリチャージ式の空気銃だ。事前にポンプで空気を圧縮しておき、引き金を引くとその圧力で弾が飛ぶ。海外製の鹿や熊さえも仕留めることが出来る大口径のものを、さらに改造で威力を上げている。","en":"Our weapons were precharged pneumatic air rifles used for hunting. Air was compressed in advance with a pump, and when the trigger was pulled, that pressure launched the projectile. These large-bore foreign models could kill even deer and bears, and modification had increased their power still further.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r352","rowIndex":352,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　当然どこにも火薬は使われておらず、<tips=26>劉</tips>が能力を使っていつものように暴発させようとしたところで、出来るものではない。畢竟、彼のような<tips=16>タイプA</tips>でもこうして銃弾の的になるしかない。","en":"Naturally, they used no gunpowder anywhere in their mechanism. Even if <tips=26>Ryu</tips> invoked his ability and attempted to make them discharge as he ordinarily did, there was nothing for it to ignite. In the final analysis, even a <tips=16>Type A</tips> like him could do nothing but become a target for our projectiles.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r353","rowIndex":353,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そのすぐれた能力で幾多もの修羅場をくぐってきた<tips=16>タイプA</tips>と言えども、肝心の能力が使えない上に、手の内を知り尽くした組織の同志が油断したときを狙えばあっけないものだ。","en":"He was a <tips=16>Type A</tips> who had survived countless scenes of carnage with his exceptional ability. Yet with that crucial ability denied him, and caught off guard by comrades who knew every card in his hand, he went down with almost anticlimactic ease.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r354","rowIndex":354,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=26>劉</tips>の体が後ろ向きに倒れるが、それが完全に倒れるのを待たず、僕たちは彼のためだけに用意したエアライフルを捨て、第二の武器を取り出した。それは小型のサブマシンガンだった。","en":"<tips=26>Ryu’s</tips> body fell backward. Without waiting for it to reach the floor, we discarded the air rifles prepared solely for him and drew our secondary weapons: compact submachine guns.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r355","rowIndex":355,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　空気銃のマガジンには五発装填できた。構造上、一発撃つごとに威力が落ちる。マガジンひとつ分程度の数の銃弾なら殺傷力を維持したまま撃ち終えることが可能なのは前もってテスト済だけれども、こうした室内の乱戦で使い続けるには心許ない。連射能力が低く、一発撃つごとにレバーを引いて新しい弾を装填するという余計な動作もある。","en":"An air-rifle magazine held five rounds. By the nature of the mechanism, power declined with every shot. Our advance tests showed that we could empty one complete magazine while maintaining lethal force, but the weapons were not something to rely on throughout a chaotic fight indoors. Their rate of fire was low, and every shot required the extra motion of working a lever to chamber the next round.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r356","rowIndex":356,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　新しく取り出したサブマシンガンはそれこそ雨のように銃弾をばらまくことが出来、屋内での制圧力は圧倒的だった。","en":"The submachine guns we drew could spray bullets like rain, giving them overwhelming stopping power indoors.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r357","rowIndex":357,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しかも相手はマリファナによって動きも判断力も鈍い。彼らを仕留めるのは、銃でテロリストを殺すコンピューターゲーム『Red Fire』のファーストステージをイージーモードでクリアするよりはるかに簡単な仕事だ。","en":"Our opponents’ movements and judgment had also been dulled by marijuana. Killing them was far easier than clearing the first stage of Red Fire—a computer game about shooting terrorists—on easy mode.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r358","rowIndex":358,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　瞬く間に<tips=26>劉</tips>の脇にいたもう一人、スキンヘッドの南米人は蜂の巣となってがっくりと崩れ落ち、<tips=26>劉</tips>が拾おうとしたテーブルの銃に手を伸ばした角刈りのアジア人が次の犠牲者となった。","en":"In an instant, the bald South American beside <tips=26>Ryu</tips> was riddled with bullets and collapsed. A crew-cut Asian man reaching for the gun upon the table—the same one <tips=26>Ryu</tips> had tried to take—became our next victim.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r359","rowIndex":359,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　他のメンバーは、銃弾の雨のなか咄嗟にソファーの裏に隠れるなどして、ひとまず視界から姿を消した。","en":"The other occupants vanished from view for the moment, reacting to the rain of bullets by diving behind a sofa or seeking similar cover.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r360","rowIndex":360,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕は視界が光で満ちあふれ、なんとも魂が輝くような陶酔感を感じた。それは興奮剤のせいだけでなく、脳内にドーパミンが分泌されているからだ。","en":"My vision flooded with light, and I felt an ecstatic rush as though my very soul were shining. It came not only from the stimulant, but from the dopamine pouring through my brain.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r361","rowIndex":361,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　例えばギャンブルで大金を賭けたとき、登山などをして死の瀬戸際に立たされたとき、そういった極限状態になるとなんとも言えない幸福感を覚える。","en":"The same indescribable happiness appears when a person stakes an enormous sum upon a wager, or stands at the brink of death while climbing a mountain.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r362","rowIndex":362,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その結果、スリルというものが自分の生きている実感だと勘違いをするバカが良くいるが、たんに脳内麻薬でラリっているだけのことだ。危険のなかでないと生きる実感がないとか格好つけているやつは、単にこの分泌物による中毒で日常が物足りなくなっているだけだ。","en":"This leads plenty of fools to mistake the thrill for the feeling of being alive, when all they’re doing is getting high on narcotics produced by their own brains. Anyone who tries to sound impressive by claiming he only feels alive in danger has simply become addicted to those secretions and finds everyday life dull by comparison.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r363","rowIndex":363,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕ら人間は、そもそもハッピーな気持ちで快感に満たされながら危険を冒し、殺し合うことが出来るように作られている。それは肉体の問題であり、そこには思想的真実はない。","en":"We human beings were made capable of taking risks and killing one another while flooded with happiness and pleasure. It is purely a matter of physiology; there is no profound philosophical truth in it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r364","rowIndex":364,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　嗚呼、この、暴力を行使している瞬間の陶酔感はなんとも不快だ。僕はどうしても好きになれない。早く終わらせたくて仕方がない。","en":"Ah, how unpleasant this intoxication of committing violence is. I simply cannot bring myself to like it. I want nothing more than to finish as quickly as possible.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r365","rowIndex":365,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=40>黄姉妹</tips>の言葉によれば敵は六人。既に三人倒したから残るは三人。","en":"According to the <tips=40>Wong sisters</tips>, there had been six enemies. We had already brought down three, leaving three more.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r366","rowIndex":366,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=25>世傑</tips>の目配せに従い、僕たちは彼らが盾にとったソファーに銃弾を送り込んだ。","en":"Following <tips=25>Sai-kit’s</tips> signal, we poured bullets into the sofa they had taken as a shield.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r367","rowIndex":367,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ソファーはなかなかに頑丈で、僕らの武器では貫通したかあやしい。僕が手を上げ、一旦銃撃をやめさせて気配を窺うと、不意にソファーの向こうに一人が立ち上がり、部屋の向こう側へ向けて逃げ出そうとする。","en":"The sofa was surprisingly sturdy, and I could not tell whether our rounds had penetrated. I raised a hand to stop the fire for a moment and listened for movement. Without warning, one person rose beyond the sofa and attempted to flee toward the far side of the room.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r368","rowIndex":368,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しかし、<tips=25>世傑</tips>はそれを許さない。","en":"But <tips=25>Sai-kit</tips> had no intention of letting him escape.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r369","rowIndex":369,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　銃を構えるとその背中に銃弾を命中させた。男は顔から床に倒れ、胸に空いた穴からとめどもなく流れる血液がすぐに黒い水たまりを作った。","en":"He raised his weapon and planted a bullet in the man’s back. The man pitched face-first onto the floor, and the blood streaming from the hole in his chest swiftly formed a black pool.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r370","rowIndex":370,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それにしてもなんと素早く正確なことか。彼の身体能力は<tips=17>タイプB</tips>顔負けであるのだが、しかしその瞳は金色になってはいない。何か秘密があるのだと思うが僕はそれを知らない。","en":"Even so, his speed and accuracy were astonishing. His physical abilities rivaled those of a <tips=17>Type B</tips>, yet his eyes had not turned gold. I assumed there was some secret to it, but I did not know what.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r371","rowIndex":371,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　再び部屋に静寂が戻る。もう視界には動くものがいない。","en":"Silence returned to the room. There was no longer anything moving in sight.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r372","rowIndex":372,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しかし、まだ警戒が必要だ。お互いが目配せをしたところで、ソファーの向こうから荒い呼吸音が聞こえてくる。","en":"But we still had to be cautious. Just as we exchanged glances, harsh breathing came from beyond the sofa.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r373","rowIndex":373,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まだ生きているが」","en":"“Someone is still alive, but...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r374","rowIndex":374,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　このまま障害物越しに銃撃を再開するか、回り込んで確実にクリアリングするか、判断を求めて<tips=25>世傑</tips>に視線を送ったところで、","en":"Just as I looked to <tips=25>Sai-kit</tips> for a decision—whether to resume firing through the obstruction or circle around the sofa and clear it with certainty—","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r375","rowIndex":375,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「お、おい！　ちょっと待ってくれ」","en":"“H-hey! Wait a moment!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r376","rowIndex":376,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ソファーの向こうから、恐怖に震える声がした。","en":"A voice trembling with terror came from beyond the sofa.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r377","rowIndex":377,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「誰か知らないが、助けてくれ！　おれは<tips=26>劉</tips>の部下じゃない。たまたま遊びに来ていただけなんだ！　もう大けがもしている。とても抵抗なんか出来やしない……」","en":"“I don’t know who you are, but spare me! I’m not <tips=26>Ryu’s</tips> subordinate. I only happened to come here for a visit! I’m already badly injured. I couldn’t resist you if I tried...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r378","rowIndex":378,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕はもう一度<tips=25>世傑</tips>の顔を見た。彼は顔を横に振る。","en":"I looked at <tips=25>Sai-kit</tips> again. He shook his head.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r379","rowIndex":379,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「わかったわ。助けてあげる。だから、両手を頭の後ろに重ねて立ち上がってちょうだい」","en":"“Very well. I’ll spare you. Place both hands behind your head and stand up.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r380","rowIndex":380,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=25>世傑</tips>は朗々と通る声でそう呼びかけた。","en":"<tips=25>Sai-kit</tips> called out in a clear, resonant voice.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r381","rowIndex":381,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「む、無理だ！　足にたまが当たって、とても立ち上がれない……」","en":"“I-I can’t! I was shot in the leg. There’s no way I can stand...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r382","rowIndex":382,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「出来ないならいいわ。さようなら」","en":"“If you can’t, that’s fine. Goodbye.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r383","rowIndex":383,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ま、待ってくれ！　やってみる！　やってみるから待ってくれ……くっ……畜生、なんでこんな……」","en":"“W-wait! I’ll try! I’ll try, so wait... Ngh... Damn it. Why is this happening...?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r384","rowIndex":384,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ソファの向こうの荒い息に、うめき声が混じり、そして漸くその人物はよろよろと立ち上がった。","en":"Groans mingled with the ragged breathing beyond the sofa. At last, the person rose unsteadily into view.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r385","rowIndex":385,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そこにいるのは筋肉の隆々とした、逞しい男で、よほど痛むのか、顔や肌にびっしりと汗を浮かべ、全身をプルプルと震わせている。","en":"He was a powerfully built, muscular man. The pain must have been severe: sweat covered his face and body, and he trembled all over.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r386","rowIndex":386,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その苦痛に歪む顔には、金色に光る目があった。<tips=17>タイプB</tips>なのであろう。","en":"Golden eyes shone in his pain-contorted face. He appeared to be <tips=17>Type B</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r387","rowIndex":387,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「やったぞ。……だから、命だけは……」","en":"“I did it... So please, at least spare my life...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r388","rowIndex":388,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「やれば出来るじゃない」","en":"“See? You can do it when you try.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r389","rowIndex":389,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=25>世傑</tips>は無表情に銃を上げると、正確な射撃で彼の顔面を撃ち抜いた。","en":"<tips=25>Sai-kit</tips> raised his gun without expression and shot the man cleanly through the face.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r390","rowIndex":390,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　するともうソファーの向こうに気配はなくなった。","en":"No presence remained beyond the sofa.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r391","rowIndex":391,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しかし、計算ではあと一人残っている筈である。","en":"By our count, however, there should have been one more person.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r392","rowIndex":392,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=25>世傑</tips>はさほど緊張の見えない顔で僕に目配せをすると、軽い足取りでソファーの向こうを覗いた。そしてまた僕たちを見て、","en":"Showing little sign of tension, <tips=25>Sai-kit</tips> signaled to me with a glance, then lightly stepped over and peered beyond the sofa. He looked back at us once more.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r393","rowIndex":393,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どうやら終わってたようね」","en":"“Looks like that one was already done for.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r394","rowIndex":394,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　と言った。","en":"he said.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r395","rowIndex":395,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕は溜息をつき、彼に近づく。そして自分の目でソファーの裏を確認すると、そこに転がっていたのは若い女の死体だった。","en":"I sighed and approached him. When I looked behind the sofa with my own eyes, I found the body of a young woman lying there.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r396","rowIndex":396,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕はその死体を爪先で押してごろりと転がすと、血まみれの顔がこちらを向いた。","en":"I pushed the body with the toe of my shoe and rolled it over, turning its blood-covered face toward us.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r397","rowIndex":397,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「えっ……」","en":"“Huh...?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r398","rowIndex":398,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕は言葉を失う。頭がクラクラとする。振り返ったのは、僕が予想していたのと全く違う、見覚えのある顏だったのだ。","en":"I was struck speechless. My head swam. The face that had turned toward me was familiar—and nothing at all like the one I had expected.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r399","rowIndex":399,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=44>シウ</tips>……」","en":"“<tips=44>Siu</tips>...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r400","rowIndex":400,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そう、それは僕の妹だ。どうしてこんなところに？　なぜ死んでいる？　僕は彼女のために、こんなことをしているんだぞ！","en":"Yes. It was my sister. Why was she here? Why was she dead? I was doing all this for her!","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r401","rowIndex":401,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　いや、そんな筈はない。ここに妹が居るはずがない。僕は目を閉じ、そして開く。すると、さっきは妹の<tips=44>筱喬</tips>の顔に見えていたものが、まったく別の顏になっていた。気のせいだったんだ。僕はほっと内心で溜息をつく。","en":"No, that could not be. My sister could not possibly be here. I closed my eyes, then opened them. The face that had looked like my sister <tips=44>Siu-kiu’s</tips> a moment ago was now an entirely different face. I had imagined it. I breathed an inward sigh of relief.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r402","rowIndex":402,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どうしたの？」","en":"“What is it?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r403","rowIndex":403,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=25>世傑</tips>が僕を見つめている。","en":"<tips=25>Sai-kit</tips> was staring at me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r404","rowIndex":404,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いや、なんでもない」","en":"“No, it’s nothing.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r405","rowIndex":405,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕は動揺を隠して冷静を装う。","en":"I concealed my agitation and pretended to be calm.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r406","rowIndex":406,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「こいつは<tips=26>劉</tips>の娘だな。確か<tips=26>劉</tips>が１７才の時に生ませた娘だったはずだから、１５才か」","en":"“This is <tips=26>Ryu’s</tips> daughter. If I remember correctly, <tips=26>Ryu</tips> fathered her when he was seventeen, so she must be fifteen.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r407","rowIndex":407,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そう。そりゃ、随分と気の毒な場所に居合わせてしまったものね」","en":"“Yes. What a terribly unfortunate place for her to have found herself.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r408","rowIndex":408,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=25>世傑</tips>はそう言うと、肩をすくめる。","en":"<tips=25>Sai-kit</tips> shrugged.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r409","rowIndex":409,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ともあれ、すべての仕事はこれで終わった。僕は緊張から解き放たれ、溜息をついた。","en":"In any event, the work was finished. Released from the tension, I let out a sigh.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r410","rowIndex":410,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　姜浩強は煙草に火を付ける。林徳軒は携帯電話を取りだして誰かにメールを打ち始めた。","en":"Jiang Haoqiang lit a cigarette. Lin Dexuan took out his mobile phone and began typing a message to someone.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r411","rowIndex":411,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　部屋のマリファナの匂いは敵の撃った銃の硝煙の匂いで大分打ち消されてはいたが、ゆったりとしたレゲエのBGMは相変わらずだった。その一方で、目に映る光景はさっきとは全く違う、死体の転がる凄惨な殺人現場となっている。","en":"The smell of marijuana in the room had been largely overwhelmed by the gunsmoke from the enemy’s weapon, but the laid-back reggae continued to play in the background. Everything visible, however, had changed completely. The room was now a gruesome murder scene strewn with bodies.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r412","rowIndex":412,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　先ほどまでここでくつろいでマリファナ遊びに興じていた六人もの人間は、一瞬にして血を流す死体に変わっていた。彼らはもう人間としては存在せず、これらの肉塊は微生物たちの養分となって腐り行く。","en":"The six people who only moments before had been relaxing here, amusing themselves with marijuana, had become bloodied corpses in an instant. They no longer existed as human beings. These masses of flesh would feed microorganisms as they rotted away.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r413","rowIndex":413,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　こんな場面を、犯行者がアップロードしたネットの映像や、新聞の記事で見たことはあるが、製作者の一人として現場に立つことになるとは思わなかった。今僕はどういう心境なのだろうか？","en":"I had seen scenes like this in newspaper articles and in videos uploaded to the internet by the perpetrators. I had never imagined standing inside one as one of the people who had created it. What did I feel now?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r414","rowIndex":414,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕はあどけない少女だった死体をじっと眺めた。","en":"I stared at the body that had belonged to an innocent-looking girl.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r415","rowIndex":415,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　見事に頭を撃ち抜かれ、顔はまったくわからなくなっているが、その派手目の服装はこの辺りの少女の流行を取り入れたもので、普段は普通の若者として遊び歩いていたのだろう。ここに遊びに来ていなければ、明日からも同じように遊べたに違いない。","en":"A bullet had destroyed her head so completely that her face was no longer recognizable. But her showy clothes followed the fashions of girls in this part of the city. Ordinarily, she had probably gone out and had fun like any other young person. Had she not come here, she would surely have gone on doing the same tomorrow.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r416","rowIndex":416,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それから、その父だった死体を眺めた。","en":"Then I looked toward the body that had been her father.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r417","rowIndex":417,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　百戦錬磨の彼にしてはあまりに油断しすぎているようにも思えたが、まあ無理もないのか。","en":"For so battle-hardened a man, he appeared to have let his guard down far too completely. Yet perhaps that was understandable.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r418","rowIndex":418,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　いまはどこかと抗争しているわけでもないし、彼が頻繁にトラブルを起こす市民たちは、普通<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>の名を恐れて復讐などしない。まさか、執行部が、先代の抜擢した幹部である自分に暗殺者を差し向けるなんて想像もしなかったろう。もっと警戒をしていれば、僕らは襲撃自体を諦め、彼もまた明日を生きられたろう。","en":"There was no conflict underway with another faction, and the citizens with whom he so frequently caused trouble ordinarily feared the name of <tips=7>YS</tips> too much to seek revenge. He could never have imagined that the executive would send assassins after him when the former Longtou himself had elevated him to officer. Had he been more cautious, we would have abandoned the attack itself, and he too might have lived to see tomorrow.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r419","rowIndex":419,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕も自らの手で彼を殺すことになるとは、ほんの数日前まで想像していなかった。","en":"Until only a few days ago, I had never imagined that I would kill him with my own hands.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r420","rowIndex":420,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　この<tips=26>劉建志</tips>という人物のことはさほど嫌いではなかった。凶暴で頭は悪いけれど、その直情的でシンプルな人間性は、むしろ好きな方だ。子供の時からその豪快な人柄は噂として聞いていた。","en":"I had never especially disliked <tips=26>Ryu Kenshi</tips>. He was violent and stupid, but I rather liked his straightforward, uncomplicated nature. I had heard stories of his larger-than-life personality since childhood.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r421","rowIndex":421,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あまり気にしないことです」","en":"“Best not to dwell on it.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"姜浩強","displayName":"Jiang Haoqiang","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r422","rowIndex":422,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　姜浩強が僕にそう話しかけた。","en":"Jiang Haoqiang addressed me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r423","rowIndex":423,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「この世界は、こういうものです。理性を失った<tips=26>劉</tips>がいけない」","en":"“This is the nature of our world. <tips=26>Ryu</tips> is to blame for losing his reason.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"姜浩強","displayName":"Jiang Haoqiang","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r424","rowIndex":424,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕は首を横に振り、","en":"I shook my head and","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r425","rowIndex":425,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「何も気にしていないよ。気にするかと思っていたけど、そうでもない。そのかわり、ちょっと、思い出した」","en":"“It doesn’t bother me at all. I thought it might, but apparently not. It just reminded me of something.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r426","rowIndex":426,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「何をですか？」","en":"“Remembered what?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"姜浩強","displayName":"Jiang Haoqiang","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r427","rowIndex":427,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……子供の時のことだよ。昔、ヤツ川の畔にヌートリアが増えたことがあったでしょう？　あれを捕まえたことがあるんだ」","en":"“...Something from my childhood. Do you remember when nutria started multiplying along the banks of the Yatsu River? I once caught one.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r428","rowIndex":428,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ヌートリア？」","en":"“A nutria?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"姜浩強","displayName":"Jiang Haoqiang","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r429","rowIndex":429,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「大きなネズミというか、カピバラというか、そんな動物だよ。……味がとにかく旨いってことで、みんなは肉に興味があった。僕は哺乳類の内臓が教科書で見た通りになっているのか確かめてみたかった。それで、みんなで自転車で繰り出したんだ」","en":"“An animal like an enormous rat, or perhaps a capybara. ...Everyone was interested in the meat, which was said to be exceptionally good. I wanted to discover whether a mammal’s internal organs truly looked as they did in my textbooks. So all of us rode out there on our bicycles.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r430","rowIndex":430,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「はあ」","en":"“I see...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"姜浩強","displayName":"Jiang Haoqiang","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r431","rowIndex":431,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼は僕の意図が読めず、生返事をする。","en":"Unsure where I was going with this, he offered a noncommittal response.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r432","rowIndex":432,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「僕らはべつに動物をいじめたかったんじゃなくて、魚を食べるために釣りに行ったり、食用蛙が案外うまいと聞いてみんなで石を投げ込んだのと同じような雰囲気だったと思う。普段は猫や犬に石をぶつけたりといった、弱い物いじめにはみな抵抗があるような感じだったんだけれど、食べるとなると、不思議なもので、そういう感覚はなくなるんだ。わかる？」","en":"“We did not particularly want to torment an animal. I think it felt the same as when we went fishing because we meant to eat the fish, or when we heard edible frogs were surprisingly good and all went out to stone them. Ordinarily, everyone seemed reluctant to bully something weaker by throwing stones at cats or dogs. Yet once we meant to eat the animal, that resistance mysteriously vanished. Do you understand?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r433","rowIndex":433,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕は彼の返事を待たずに続ける。","en":"I continued without waiting for his answer.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r434","rowIndex":434,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それで、結局一匹捕まえることができた。みんなえらい興奮してたよ。押さえつけて、棒で殴り殺してから、僕がナイフを手にとって、解体をしたんだ。……今思い返してみれば、あれが僕にとって生まれて初めての動物の解剖実験だったんだなあ。……まあそれはともかく、腹を割いたところで、はじめてそいつがメスだったってのがわかったんだ。何でかっていうと、子宮から胎児がゴロゴロと出て来たんだよ」","en":"“In the end, we caught one. Everyone was tremendously excited. We pinned it down, beat it to death with a stick, and then I took a knife and cut it apart. ...Looking back, that was my first experiment in animal dissection. ...But never mind that. It was only when I cut open its belly that we discovered it was female. Do you know how? Fetuses came tumbling out of its uterus.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r435","rowIndex":435,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕は姜を振り返る。","en":"I turned toward Jiang.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r436","rowIndex":436,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「みんな気持ち悪がったけど、焼いてみて味が旨いとわかると全部食った。なんとなく、その時の気持ちを思い出して、ぼうっとしてたんだ。いま」","en":"“Everyone found it disgusting, but once we cooked the meat and discovered it tasted good, we ate all of it. I suppose I remembered how I felt then. That was why I was staring into space just now.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r437","rowIndex":437,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼は眉間にしわをよせて、困惑の表情を作る。","en":"He frowned in confusion.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r438","rowIndex":438,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……まあ、それだけです。ああ、べつに、遺体を解剖して人間の内臓を見てみたいと思ったっていう話じゃないよ？」","en":"“...Well, that’s all. Ah, I’m not saying I wanted to dissect these bodies and see the organs inside them.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r439","rowIndex":439,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「はあ、それはわかっていますが」","en":"“Yes, I do understand that much, but...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"姜浩強","displayName":"Jiang Haoqiang","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r440","rowIndex":440,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　姜は生返事を返す。","en":"Jiang offered another noncommittal reply.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r441","rowIndex":441,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　まあ、とにかく僕を心配する必要なんかないんだ。本当は僕は前に一度だけ人を殺したことがあるし、その時銃も使った。","en":"In any case, no one needed to worry about me. The truth was that I had killed a person once before, and I had used a gun then as well.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r442","rowIndex":442,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして僕は傍らに倒れていた椅子を起こして腰掛けようとしたが、足の一本が銃弾で打ち砕かれていてうまく立たせることが出来なかった。","en":"I righted a chair lying beside me and attempted to sit, but a bullet had shattered one of its legs, and I could not make it stand properly.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r443","rowIndex":443,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕は溜息をつく。","en":"I sighed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r444","rowIndex":444,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　とにかく、作戦としては完全なかたちで遂行することが出来たわけだ。予定したことがその通り完了しただけで、それほど嬉しくもないが、一つの成果を出したことにはかわらない。","en":"In operational terms, everything had been executed perfectly. The plan had simply unfolded as intended, so I felt no particular happiness about it. Nevertheless, it remained an achievement.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r445","rowIndex":445,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　これはすべてのはじまりだ。これで僕は、正式にファミリーの一員となったのだ。","en":"This was the beginning of everything. I had now officially become a member of the family.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r446","rowIndex":446,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　緊張感が抜けるにつれて、じわじわと体中に疲労が満ちてゆく。脳を麻痺させていたドーパミンの影響が消え、世界に満ちあふれていた光が消えてゆく。","en":"As the tension drained away, fatigue gradually filled my entire body. The dopamine that had numbed my brain lost its hold, and the light that had flooded the world went with it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r447","rowIndex":447,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そんななか、気がつけば<tips=25>世傑</tips>がデジカメを手に持って、凄惨な部屋の全景を、そして死体の一つ一つを撮影している。","en":"Amid all this, I noticed <tips=25>Sai-kit</tips> holding a digital camera. He was photographing the gruesome room as a whole, then each individual body.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r448","rowIndex":448,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「もういいんじゃない？　作戦完了の報告写真は、もう充分撮れたはずだ」","en":"“Isn’t that enough? You must have all the photographs you need to prove the job is done.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r449","rowIndex":449,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕が尋ねると、彼は笑顔を作り、","en":"At my question, he smiled.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r450","rowIndex":450,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「これは趣味」","en":"“It’s a hobby.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬世傑","displayName":"Ma Sai-kit","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r451","rowIndex":451,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「趣味？」","en":"“Your hobby?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r452","rowIndex":452,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「アタシは時間があるときはいつも殺した相手の写真を撮っているのよ。大事なメモリーだからね」","en":"“Whenever time permits, I photograph everyone I kill. They are precious memories.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬世傑","displayName":"Ma Sai-kit","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r453","rowIndex":453,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いい趣味だ」","en":"“An excellent hobby.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r454","rowIndex":454,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうでしょ」","en":"“Isn’t it?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬世傑","displayName":"Ma Sai-kit","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r455","rowIndex":455,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼はクスクスと笑い、撮影を再開した。","en":"He giggled and resumed taking photographs.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r456","rowIndex":456,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ぼんやりそれを眺めていると、段々まぶたが重くなってきた。","en":"As I watched him in a daze, my eyelids gradually grew heavy.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r457","rowIndex":457,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　なんてことだろう？　こんな時に、例の睡魔がやって来てしまったらしい。","en":"What timing. It seemed that familiar drowsiness had chosen this of all moments to descend on me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r458","rowIndex":458,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なんだか眠くなった。一時間くらいここで眠っても安全だと思う？」","en":"“I’m getting sleepy. Do you think it would be safe to sleep here for an hour?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r459","rowIndex":459,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=25>世傑</tips>に尋ねると、","en":"I asked <tips=25>Sai-kit</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r460","rowIndex":460,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まあ大丈夫かな。しかし、こんな地獄絵図みたいな部屋のなかで眠たくなるなんて、それも初仕事だっていうのに、なんてあきれた人なのかしら！」","en":"“I suppose it should be safe. But getting sleepy in a room that looks like a vision of hell—and on your very first assignment! You truly are unbelievable.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬世傑","displayName":"Ma Sai-kit","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r461","rowIndex":461,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕だってそう思う。いくら終わったとは言え、今さっきまで殺しあいの興奮のまっただなかにいたのだ。興奮剤の『ピーク』だってまだ効き目が切れていないはずだ。どんな精神構造をしているのかと、自分に問うてみたい。","en":"I thought so too. The fight may have ended, but only moments before, I had been in the very midst of the excitement of killing and being killed. The stimulant Peak should still have been working as well. I wanted to ask myself just what kind of mind could work this way.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r462","rowIndex":462,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「眠たくなったんだからしょうがないよ」","en":"“I’m sleepy. I can’t help it.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r463","rowIndex":463,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そう言うほかない。実際それは嘘偽りのない率直な感想だ。","en":"There was nothing else I could say. It was my plain, unvarnished reaction, without a trace of deceit.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r464","rowIndex":464,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕は<tips=25>世傑</tips>が驚くのを尻目に、銃弾を受けて穴だらけになったソファーを手で払い、血液で濡れていないのを確認してからごろりと横になる。すると、睡魔はすぐに僕の意識を消し飛ばした。","en":"Ignoring <tips=25>Sai-kit’s</tips> astonishment, I brushed off the sofa riddled with bullet holes, made sure it was not wet with blood, and stretched out upon it. Sleep claimed my consciousness at once.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r465","rowIndex":465,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　眠りから覚めた僕の目に、まず入ってきたのはいつの間にか部屋にやって来ていた<tips=40>黄姉妹</tips>の姿だった。","en":"When I woke, the first thing I saw was the <tips=40>Wong sisters</tips>, who had entered the room at some point.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r466","rowIndex":466,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女らは青ざめた顔でこちらを見つめており、そして僕が何も口にするまでもなく、","en":"They stared at me with pale faces. Before I could say anything,","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r467","rowIndex":467,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「初仕事、お見事でした」","en":"“Splendid work on your first assignment.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"黄天祥","displayName":"Wong Tin-cheung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r468","rowIndex":468,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=26>劉建志</tips>ほどのものを相手に、よくぞご無事で」","en":"“To have faced a man of <tips=26>Ryu Kenshi’s</tips> stature and returned unharmed...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"黄天明","displayName":"Wong Tin-ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r469","rowIndex":469,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　と順番に口を開く。","en":"they said in turn.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r470","rowIndex":470,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ありがとう。でも、夜中に完全武装して襲ったんだからまあ当然だよ。相手が本気で警戒してたらわからなかったけどね」","en":"“Thank you. But we attacked fully armed in the middle of the night, so this much was only natural. I couldn’t say what would have happened if he’d truly been on guard.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r471","rowIndex":471,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ご謙遜を」","en":"“You are too modest.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"黄天祥","displayName":"Wong Tin-cheung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r472","rowIndex":472,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その時僕は、<tips=40>黄姉妹</tips>の表情が異常にこわばっているのに気がついた。","en":"Then I noticed how unusually tense the <tips=40>Wong sisters</tips> looked.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r473","rowIndex":473,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「こういうのは慣れていないのかい？」","en":"“You’re not used to this sort of thing?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r474","rowIndex":474,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕が尋ねると、彼女らは申し訳なさそうに頷き、姉妹で交互に話す。","en":"At my question, they nodded apologetically and took turns answering.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r475","rowIndex":475,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「お恥ずかしい話ですが」","en":"“It is shameful to admit...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"黄天明","displayName":"Wong Tin-ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r476","rowIndex":476,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「私たちは、いつも<tips=3>クリス</tips>様の側で不審者の接近を見張るのが仕事で、このように襲撃に参加するのは初めてなのです」","en":"“Our work has always been to remain beside Lord <tips=3>Chris</tips> and watch for the approach of suspicious persons. This is the first time we have participated in an assault of this nature.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"黄天祥","displayName":"Wong Tin-cheung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r477","rowIndex":477,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうか」","en":"“I see.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r478","rowIndex":478,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女らは、その能力で敵の生命が一つずつ消えてゆくさまを見ていたのだろう。","en":"Through their ability, they had presumably sensed the lives of our enemies disappearing one by one.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r479","rowIndex":479,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ショックを受けるのは無理もないさ。不心得者から守るために殺すのと、無警戒な相手を襲って殺すのは全然違うからね。今日は早めに帰って、ゆっくり休んだらいい」","en":"“It’s only natural that you’d be shocked. Killing to protect someone from a would-be assailant is entirely different from attacking and killing someone who isn’t expecting it. Go home early today and get some proper rest.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r480","rowIndex":480,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「情けないです。いざとなれば<tips=1>謝亮</tips>様の盾にならなければならないのに、こんなありさまで……」","en":"“How pathetic of us. When the time comes, we’re supposed to serve as shields for Master <tips=1>Tse Leung</tips>, and yet here we are...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"黄天祥","displayName":"Wong Tin-cheung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r481","rowIndex":481,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その言葉に、僕は思わず顔を顰めた。","en":"At those words, I frowned despite myself.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r482","rowIndex":482,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「盾になんてならなくていい。僕は<tips=81>龍頭</tips>でもなんでもないんだから」","en":"“You don’t need to be my shields. I’m not the <tips=81>Longtou</tips> or anything of the kind.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r483","rowIndex":483,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　言うと、姉妹は戸惑いを見せる。","en":"My answer left the sisters looking perplexed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r484","rowIndex":484,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その顔を見て、自分がこの先リーダーとしてやってゆくためには、こうした他人の献身を笑顔で受け入れて彼らのモチベーションを高めていかなければならないのだと気がついた。","en":"Seeing their faces, I realized that if I meant to lead others from now on, I would have to accept such devotion with a smile and use it to keep them motivated.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r485","rowIndex":485,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しかし、そんな振る舞いは、今の僕には難しそうだ。","en":"For the moment, such behavior seemed beyond me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r486","rowIndex":486,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それにしても、本当にアンタ、銃を使うの初めてなの？」","en":"“Still, are you honestly telling me this was your first time using a gun?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬世傑","displayName":"Ma Sai-kit","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r487","rowIndex":487,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　帰ろうとして立ち上がると、<tips=25>世傑</tips>がそう訊ねた。","en":"As I rose to leave, <tips=25>Sai-kit</tips> asked me that.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r488","rowIndex":488,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「触ったことくらいはあるけれど、動くものを撃ったのは初めてだ。昨日<tips=41>グランドタワー</tips>の駐車場で練習したくらいだよ」","en":"“I had handled one before, but this was the first time I had shot at anything that moved. I only practiced in the <tips=41>Grand Tower</tips> parking lot yesterday.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r489","rowIndex":489,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「信じられないわ」","en":"“I can’t believe it.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬世傑","displayName":"Ma Sai-kit","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r490","rowIndex":490,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「これだけ近距離で、あれだけ的が大きければ当てるだけなら誰でも当てられるさ」","en":"“At this distance, with targets that large, anyone could at least hit them.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r491","rowIndex":491,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「違うのよ。人間ってさ、人を殺すのってすごい抵抗があるものなのね。だから、最初に生きている人間を撃つときってどんなに射撃が上手くても、無意識に照準が逸れて、誰もいないところを撃っちゃうものなの。でも、アンタの弾は全部人間に向かって飛んでたわ。迷いなく」","en":"“That’s not what I mean. You know, people have a real resistance to killing someone. So the first time they fire at a living person, no matter how good a shot they are, their aim drifts without them even realizing it, and they end up firing where no one is standing. But every one of your bullets went straight at a person. Not a moment’s hesitation.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬世傑","displayName":"Ma Sai-kit","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r492","rowIndex":492,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=25>世傑</tips>は右手の人差し指と親指を立てて鉄砲を撃つ真似をして、","en":"<tips=25>Sai-kit</tips> raised the thumb and forefinger of his right hand and mimed firing a pistol.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r493","rowIndex":493,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「本当に今日がはじめてなら、アンタ、才能があるわよ」","en":"“If today really was your first time, then you’ve got a gift.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬世傑","displayName":"Ma Sai-kit","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r494","rowIndex":494,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　感心したように一人頷くが、僕は肩をすくめるしかなかった。","en":"He nodded to himself as if impressed, but all I could do was shrug.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r495","rowIndex":495,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして僕は、一旦は起き上がったソファーに再びもたれて溜息をつく。","en":"Then I leaned back against the sofa again and sighed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r496","rowIndex":496,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　なんだかひどく疲れた。","en":"I felt terribly tired.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A4:r497","rowIndex":497,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　夜が明けてから<tips=41>グランドタワー</tips>に帰還すると、<tips=26>劉</tips>の処刑を伝える書面が<tips=39>ジェフリー</tips>によって起草され、それに<tips=26>劉建志</tips>の遺体写真が添付されたメールが、<tips=81>龍頭</tips><tips=84>マイケル・ツェー</tips>の名で組織に所属するすべての人物に送信された。","en":"When we returned to the <tips=41>Grand Tower</tips> after dawn, <tips=39>Jeffrey</tips> drafted a document announcing <tips=26>Ryu’s</tips> execution. An email containing it, together with a photograph of <tips=26>Ryu Kenshi’s</tips> body, was sent in the name of <tips=81>Longtou</tips> <tips=84>Michael Tse</tips> to every person in the organization.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}}]},{"position":16,"code":"A5","unitId":"A5","rows":[{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r1","rowIndex":1,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「もうごちゃごちゃくだらないことを考えたって仕方ねえ。<tips=27>廖</tips>の野郎を始末するのが一番だ」","en":"“There’s no point going around in circles over this stupid crap. The best thing is to kill that bastard <tips=27>Liao</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬明","displayName":"Ma Ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r2","rowIndex":2,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=4>馬明</tips>はもうとっくに考えるのを放棄して、同じ自説を繰り返し主張している。","en":"<tips=4>Ma Ming</tips> had long since given up thinking and was simply repeating the same argument over and over.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r3","rowIndex":3,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「こういうのは素早く片付けるのが大事なんだ。長々と<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>の中で揉めているのは悪手なんだよ。ぐだぐだしていれば<tips=22>老人たち</tips>も大人しくしてはいないだろうし、<tips=68>木下組</tips>の連中もちょっかいを出してくるのは確実だ」","en":"“The important thing with problems like this is to settle them quickly. Letting the dispute inside <tips=7>YS</tips> drag on is a bad move. If we keep dithering, the <tips=22>elders</tips> won’t sit quietly, and the <tips=68>Kinoshita-gumi</tips> are certain to start interfering.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬明","displayName":"Ma Ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r4","rowIndex":4,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=68>木下組</tips>というのは日本最大の広域暴力団U会系に属する二次団体で、この辺りの都市では大きな勢力を持っている。一時は<tips=9>Y地区</tips>にも進出をはかり、先代の<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>率いる<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>と抗争になったこともある。現在は<tips=9>Y地区</tips>へは手出ししないという約束を取り付けているが、多くの人と金が集まるこの街に対する野心を失ったわけではないだろう。","en":"The <tips=68>Kinoshita-gumi</tips> was a second-tier affiliate of the U-kai, Japan’s largest nationwide yakuza syndicate, and wielded considerable power in the surrounding cities. It had once attempted to expand into <tips=9>Y District</tips>, bringing it into conflict with <tips=7>YS</tips> under the former Longtou, <tips=3>Chris Tse</tips>. We had since secured its promise to leave <tips=9>Y District</tips> alone, but it was unlikely to have abandoned its ambitions toward a city where so many people and so much money converged.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r5","rowIndex":5,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「『兵は拙速を聞くも、未だ<ruby=たくみ>巧</ruby>の久しきを<ruby=み>睹</ruby>ざるなり』と孫武も言ってる。迷ってる場合じゃない。どうせいつかやるなら、さっさとやるしかねえんだよ」","en":"“Sun Wu himself said, ‘In war I have heard of clumsy haste, but never seen skill in a prolonged campaign.’ This is no time to hesitate. If we’re going to do it someday anyway, we may as well get it done now.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬明","displayName":"Ma Ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r6","rowIndex":6,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そう荒ぶる<tips=4>馬明</tips>とは対照的に、<tips=39>ジェフリー・ウォン</tips>はしかめっ面でその考えを黙殺するのみだ。","en":"In contrast to <tips=4>Ma Ming</tips>, raging on like this, <tips=39>Jeffrey Wong</tips> merely frowned and ignored the idea.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r7","rowIndex":7,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　可哀想に<tips=39>ジェフリー</tips>はすっかり憔悴しきっている。目の下のくまは濃く、頬の肉も幾分そげ落ちたようだ。","en":"Poor <tips=39>Jeffrey</tips> was thoroughly worn down. The shadows beneath his eyes were deep, and even his cheeks appeared to have lost some flesh.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r8","rowIndex":8,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　自分の醜態が街中にばらまかれているのが相当きついらしい。まあ当然だろう。そんな目に遭ったら、誰だってきつい。僕だってきつい。","en":"Having his humiliating spectacle spread all over the city had apparently taken a considerable toll on him. Naturally it had. Anyone would find that hard to bear. I certainly would.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r9","rowIndex":9,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　何があったのかというと、<tips=39>ジェフリー</tips>が若い女と裸で抱き合っている——まさに行為の真っ最中を捉えた写真が、街のあちこちに貼り出され、ビラとして山積みにされ、そしてネットにも同じものが公開された。","en":"What had happened was this: photographs of <tips=39>Jeffrey</tips> locked in a naked embrace with a young woman—captured in the very midst of sex—had been posted all over the city, piled in stacks as flyers, and published online as well.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r10","rowIndex":10,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　本人に聞いてみたら、これはでっちあげた合成写真ではなく事実であるという。","en":"When I asked him, he said the image was no fabricated composite. It was genuine.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r11","rowIndex":11,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　こんな無防備な写真を撮られてしまうのは、立場のあるものとしてあまりに迂闊ではあるが、サイキックが闊歩するようなこの街で、それくらいのことはあっても仕方ない。こんな無防備な姿を晒しながら、命があっただけマシだと言うべきだろう。これから注意してくれればいい。","en":"For a man in his position, allowing such an unguarded photograph to be taken was far too careless. Still, in a city where psychics roamed the streets, such things could hardly be helped. Considering how exposed he had been, he should count himself lucky simply to be alive. So long as he was more careful from now on, that was enough.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r12","rowIndex":12,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それに、愛人を囲っていたという、その事実もどうでもよい。この堅物がこんなことをいつの間に、と、僕としてはただ面白いだけだ。","en":"Nor did I care that he had been keeping a mistress. For my part, I merely found it amusing that someone as straitlaced as Jeffrey had somehow been carrying on like that without my knowing.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r13","rowIndex":13,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　けれども、本人からすれば笑い事ではない。","en":"To Jeffrey himself, however, it was no laughing matter.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r14","rowIndex":14,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　くだらない手ではあるけれど、相手を消耗させるという点においては案外有効なものだと感心してしまう。消耗すれば当然普段よりミスが増えるだろうし、まるっきり無駄というわけでもないのだ。","en":"It was a petty tactic, but I found myself impressed by how unexpectedly effective it was at wearing down its target. Once exhausted, a person would naturally make more mistakes than usual, so the effort was not entirely pointless.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r15","rowIndex":15,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　こういうやり方もアリなのか。<tips=39>ジェフリー</tips>の顔を見ながらそんなことを考えた。","en":"Perhaps this sort of method had its uses too. I considered the possibility as I looked at <tips=39>Jeffrey’s</tips> face.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r16","rowIndex":16,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　——考えつつ彼の横顔を見ると、僕でさえあのビラに印刷されていた<tips=39>ジェフリー</tips>のヨガる顔を無意識のうちに思い出してしまうのだから残酷だ。","en":"—Yet as I watched his profile while thinking all this, even I involuntarily recalled the face <tips=39>Jeffrey</tips> had made in the throes of pleasure, printed on those flyers. It was cruel.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r17","rowIndex":17,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　だが<tips=39>ジェフリー</tips>はそのことに対して一言も恨み節を言わない。自分の落ち度だと感じているのか、話題に触れたくないのか、おそらく両方だろう。","en":"Yet <tips=39>Jeffrey</tips> had not uttered one resentful word about it. Perhaps he regarded it as his own failing; perhaps he simply did not want the subject raised. Most likely both.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r18","rowIndex":18,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ビラのことは無視し、これまで通り職務を遂行していきたいという考えのようだが、<tips=4>馬明</tips>の方がそれでは納得がいかないようだった。","en":"He appeared determined to ignore the flyers and discharge his duties as before, but <tips=4>Ma Ming</tips> plainly found that response unacceptable.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r19","rowIndex":19,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「街中のやつが、<tips=27>廖</tips>の仕業だと思っている。それで何もしなければ、お前はただ笑われるだけじゃなく、腰抜けだと軽蔑されるようになるぞ」","en":"“Everyone in the city thinks <tips=27>Liao</tips> did it. If you do nothing, they won’t merely laugh at you. They’ll despise you as a coward.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬明","displayName":"Ma Ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r20","rowIndex":20,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　これは親友としての心からの怒りだろう。","en":"This must have been the sincere anger of a close friend.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r21","rowIndex":21,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「しかし、証拠がないんだ。あの件に<tips=27>廖</tips>が関わっていたという証拠が。どれだけうまくやったのか知らないが、実行犯も主犯も、まったく見つからないんだよ」","en":"“But we have no proof. No proof that <tips=27>Liao</tips> had anything to do with it. I don’t know how skillfully it was done, but we have found neither the people who carried it out nor whoever was behind it.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ジェフリー・ウォン","displayName":"Jeffrey Wong","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r22","rowIndex":22,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しつこい<tips=4>馬明</tips>に根負けして、ついに<tips=39>ジェフリー</tips>もその話題につきあった。","en":"Worn down by <tips=4>Ma Ming’s</tips> persistence, <tips=39>Jeffrey</tips> finally consented to discuss the subject.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r23","rowIndex":23,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「警察や法律家じゃあるまいし、我々の行動に証拠なんか必要ない！　そうであるとみなが確信出来ればそれで決まりだ！　大体、他に犯人がいるわけないだろうが。これはお前個人じゃなく、我々ファミリーに対する挑戦なんだよ。あの野郎の命をとるんだ。それ以外に我々が名誉を回復する方法はない。会議か何かで<tips=41>グランドタワー</tips>にやって来たところでそのアタマを銃で撃ち抜いてやるだけだ。簡単な話だよ」","en":"“We’re not the police or lawyers. We don’t need proof before we act! If everyone is convinced he did it, then that settles the matter! Who else could possibly be responsible? This wasn’t a challenge to you alone. It was a challenge to our family. We take that bastard’s life. There is no other way to restore our honor. The next time he comes to <tips=41>Grand Tower</tips> for a meeting or anything else, we put a bullet through his head. Simple.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬明","displayName":"Ma Ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r24","rowIndex":24,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=4>馬明</tips>は<tips=39>ジェフリー</tips>の言い分がまったく気にいらない様子だ。","en":"<tips=4>Ma Ming</tips> appeared thoroughly displeased with <tips=39>Jeffrey’s</tips> argument.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r25","rowIndex":25,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「お前はお行儀が良すぎる。それじゃダメだ」","en":"“You’re far too well-behaved. That’s no good.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬明","displayName":"Ma Ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r26","rowIndex":26,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=39>ジェフリー</tips>は静かに首を振って答える。","en":"<tips=39>Jeffrey</tips> quietly shook his head before answering.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r27","rowIndex":27,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「我々には大義名分が必要だ。<tips=26>劉建志</tips>を処刑した時のように、<tips=27>廖志明</tips>を殺すならばそれに見合った罪が必要だ。私個人を中傷したというだけでは、仮に証拠があったとしても、<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>として殺す理由にはならない」","en":"“We require a legitimate cause. Just as when we executed <tips=26>Ryu Kenshi</tips>, <tips=27>Liao Chi-ming</tips> would need to have committed a crime commensurate with his death. Even if we possessed proof that he had slandered me personally, that alone would not give <tips=7>YS</tips> cause to kill him.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ジェフリー・ウォン","displayName":"Jeffrey Wong","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r28","rowIndex":28,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あほか！　お前は公然と笑いものにされたのだぞ！　名分なんぞそれで充分だろうが。侮辱されたら相手を殺さなければ一生一人前の顔などできん。これがこの世界のルールだ。お前はやはり自分を政治家か何かと勘違いしている。まさか、スキャンダルで世間の非難を浴びたから、補佐役を降りるとでも言い出しかねない」","en":"“Are you an idiot? You were made a laughingstock in public! That is more than enough justification. If someone insults you and you don’t kill them for it, you’ll never be able to hold your head up as a man again. That is the rule in this world. You still mistake yourself for some politician or other. At this rate, you’ll be saying that public outrage over your scandal obliges you to step down as adviser.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬明","displayName":"Ma Ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r29","rowIndex":29,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「場合によってはそれも必要だと思っている」","en":"“Depending upon the circumstances, I believe that may indeed be necessary.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ジェフリー・ウォン","displayName":"Jeffrey Wong","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r30","rowIndex":30,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「これは呆れる！　どうしちまったんだよ、おい！　一体全体どんな優良企業の役員のつもりでいるんだい？　女と遊んだくらいでなんだ！　盗撮して公開するという侮辱の罪の方がずっと重い。なあ<tips=39>ジェフリー</tips>よ。我々は、愛されたり、尊敬されるよりも、恐れられることが一番重要なんだ。恐怖なくして我々の仕事など存在しない。思い出せ！　腰抜け！」","en":"“This is unbelievable! What happened to you? What kind of executive at some blue-chip corporation do you imagine you are? So you fooled around with a woman—who cares? Secretly photographing you and publishing it was a far worse offense. Listen, <tips=39>Jeffrey</tips>. For us, being feared matters more than being loved or respected. Without fear, our work could not exist. Remember that, coward!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬明","displayName":"Ma Ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r31","rowIndex":31,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=4>馬明</tips>は激昂して机を叩くが、<tips=39>ジェフリー</tips>はその挑発には乗らない。","en":"<tips=4>Ma Ming</tips> slammed the desk in a fury, but <tips=39>Jeffrey</tips> refused to rise to the provocation.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r32","rowIndex":32,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　むしろその声はますます低く冷徹になる。","en":"If anything, his voice grew lower and colder.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r33","rowIndex":33,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「みなで裏通りをかけずり回っていた頃とは違う。我々はクーラーもないあばら屋で半裸で会議をしていた貧しい移民のゴロツキではなく、街で一番大きいビルを根城にする『<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>』なんだよ。品格というものがある」","en":"“Things are different from when we all ran through the back streets together. We are no longer impoverished immigrant hoodlums holding meetings half naked in a shack without air-conditioning. We are ‘<tips=7>YS</tips>,’ headquartered in the largest building in the city. We have a certain dignity now.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ジェフリー・ウォン","displayName":"Jeffrey Wong","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r34","rowIndex":34,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まったく、なんてつまらない男に成り下がってしまったんだ！　お前は！」","en":"“What a tedious man you’ve become! Honestly!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬明","displayName":"Ma Ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r35","rowIndex":35,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=4>馬明</tips>はもう一度机を叩く。","en":"<tips=4>Ma Ming</tips> struck the desk once more.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r36","rowIndex":36,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「つまらないもなにも、<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>とこの街がギブアンドテイクの関係にあるのは確かだ。我々は警察や法律が意味をなさないこの街に暴力によってある程度の秩序をもたらし、その見返りとして住人は我々に協力してくれている。この関係を崩しては我々は存在価値を失う」","en":"“Tedious or not, it remains true that <tips=7>YS</tips> and this city exist in a relationship of give-and-take. Through violence, we provide a measure of order in a city where the police and the law mean nothing. In return, its residents cooperate with us. If we destroy that relationship, we lose our reason to exist.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ジェフリー・ウォン","displayName":"Jeffrey Wong","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r37","rowIndex":37,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「勘違いするな。街の連中が協力するのは我々を恐れているからだ。公然と侮辱されて何も仕返しをしないような指導者が率いているんじゃ、街の連中からもなめられ、やつらを従わせる恐怖感も、やつらからの信頼も失うと言っている！」","en":"“Don’t get this wrong. The people of this city cooperate because they fear us. If we’re led by a man who does nothing after being publicly humiliated, they’ll start looking down on us. We’ll lose the fear that keeps them obedient and the trust they place in us!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬明","displayName":"Ma Ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r38","rowIndex":38,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「私はそうは思わない。これはビジネスなんだよ。重要なのはフェアであることだ」","en":"“I disagree. This is business. What matters is that we are fair.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ジェフリー・ウォン","displayName":"Jeffrey Wong","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r39","rowIndex":39,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　こうした二人のやりとりを、僕はなんだかおかしく見守っていた。中傷された本人が慎重論を口にして、蚊帳の外にいる人間が本人以上に激怒して報復を訴えている。","en":"I watched their exchange with a certain amusement. The man who had been slandered was urging restraint, while a man entirely outside the affair was angrier than the victim himself and clamoring for revenge.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r40","rowIndex":40,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　父が生きているころは、この間でうまくバランスをとっていたのかもしれないが、第二代<tips=81>龍頭</tips>はおろおろしながら不安げに二人を見守るだけだ。","en":"Perhaps Father had once maintained a skillful balance between them, but the second <tips=81>Longtou</tips> could do no more than watch the two men in nervous bewilderment.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r41","rowIndex":41,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　もっとも僕も今この場で黙って傍観しているわけだから、あまり二代目のことを悪くも言えないのだが。","en":"Then again, I too was standing by in silence, so I could hardly criticize the second Longtou too severely.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r42","rowIndex":42,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そうして彼らの議論が紛糾し、聞いている僕の方が疲れ始める頃、一通のメールが届いた。","en":"By the time their argument had become hopelessly tangled and even I was growing tired of listening, an email arrived.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r43","rowIndex":43,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それは<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>の幹部同士のやりとりに使われる、ごく限られた人間しか知らないアドレス宛のメールで、発信者は<tips=27>廖志明</tips>であった。","en":"It had been sent to an address used for correspondence among <tips=7>YS</tips> officers and known only to that very small circle. Its sender was <tips=27>Liao Chi-ming</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r44","rowIndex":44,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕と<tips=4>馬明</tips>と<tips=39>ジェフリー</tips>の三人は、<tips=30>レイレイ</tips>がプリントアウトして持って来たものを覗き込み、そして最後まで読み終わると、お互いに困惑の顔を向け合った。","en":"The three of us—<tips=4>Ma Ming</tips>, <tips=39>Jeffrey</tips>, and I—peered at what <tips=30>Leilei</tips> had printed and brought us. When we finished reading it, we exchanged bewildered looks.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r45","rowIndex":45,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　内容は、<tips=27>廖</tips>の屋敷に侵入者があったという報告であった。","en":"It reported that an intruder had entered <tips=27>Liao’s</tips> residence.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r46","rowIndex":46,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　誰もいないはずの部屋で物音がして、駆けつけると黒衣の女が立っていたらしい。足元には搬入したばかりの胸像が切断されていたが、女はそれを可能にするような道具は何も持っていなかった。","en":"A noise had been heard in a room that ought to have been empty. When people rushed to investigate, they allegedly found a woman dressed in black. A bust that had only just been brought into the room lay severed at her feet, although she carried no implement capable of cutting it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r47","rowIndex":47,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　女は「街の怒りを代表するものだ」と名乗り、<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>の幹部である<tips=27>廖志明</tips>の命を狙いに来たのだと言った。ボディーガードの<tips=23>エリオット</tips>が発砲すると幽霊が消えるかのように姿を消して退散し、<tips=27>廖</tips>は難を逃れたと言う。","en":"The woman had called herself ‘a representative of the city’s anger’ and said she had come for the life of <tips=27>Liao Chi-ming</tips>, an officer of <tips=7>YS</tips>. When his bodyguard <tips=23>Elliott</tips> opened fire, she vanished like a ghost and withdrew, leaving <tips=27>Liao</tips> unharmed—or so the report said.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r48","rowIndex":48,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　メールには切断された銅像の画像が添付されていた。","en":"An image of the severed bronze bust was attached to the email.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r49","rowIndex":49,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　これだけだったら、驚きのニュースではあるにしろ、僕たちがそこまで困惑することはなかったろう。","en":"Had that been all, the news would certainly have surprised us, but not left us quite so perplexed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r50","rowIndex":50,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　報告のあとに書かれた<tips=27>廖</tips>の言葉がふるっている。","en":"The words <tips=27>Liao</tips> appended to his report were remarkable.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r51","rowIndex":51,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"『当人は<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>に恨みある者だと名乗っていたが、このような不審者の言葉を素直に信じるのは難しい。そもそも、もし言った通りの理由ならば、真っ先に<tips=81>龍頭</tips>どのを襲うのが自然である。なのに最初に標的にしたのは私だった。……あるいはこの女は私個人に恨みがある者によって雇われたというのが真実かもしれない。となれば、最近私に対して憎しみをもった者が真犯人と考えるのが自然だろう。残念ながら心当たる者がいないのだが、逆恨みかもしれぬ。そうであれば危険が及ぶのは私だけだろうが、しかし、本人が言ったとおり、<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>全体を憎んでいる人物による犯行という可能性もなくはない。諸兄は念のため、身辺の警備体制などを見直されるべきである』","en":"‘The individual claimed to bear a grudge against <tips=7>YS</tips>, but it is difficult to take such a suspicious person at their word. If her stated reason were genuine, it would have been natural for her to attack the <tips=81>Longtou</tips> first. Yet I was her first target. ...Perhaps the truth is that this woman was hired by someone with a personal grudge against me. In that case, it would be natural to suppose that the true culprit is someone who has recently come to hate me. Regrettably, no one comes to mind, though this may be a case of misplaced resentment. If so, I alone should be in danger. However, one cannot entirely exclude the possibility that, as she claimed, this was the work of someone who hates <tips=7>YS</tips> as a whole. As a precaution, I recommend that each of you review your personal security arrangements.’","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r52","rowIndex":52,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なんだか、おれたちが刺客を雇ったと言いたいみたいだな」","en":"“It sounds as if he’s trying to say we hired the assassin.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬明","displayName":"Ma Ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r53","rowIndex":53,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=4>馬明</tips>が苦い顔で言ったとおり、とりようによってはそのような当てこすりをしているようにも読める。","en":"As <tips=4>Ma Ming</tips> observed with a grimace, it was possible to read the message as precisely that sort of insinuation.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r54","rowIndex":54,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「失礼な野郎だ！　本当に殺し屋を送り込んでやろうか！」","en":"“The insolent bastard! Perhaps we ought to send a real hitman after him!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬明","displayName":"Ma Ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r55","rowIndex":55,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いや待て<tips=4>馬明</tips>。それじゃ<tips=27>廖</tips>の思うつぼだ。こんな挑発をする以上、警備は厳重にしているだろう。成功の見込みは薄い」","en":"“No, wait, <tips=4>Ma Ming</tips>. That would play directly into <tips=27>Liao’s</tips> hands. If he is issuing a provocation like this, his security will be tight. Our chances of success are slim.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ジェフリー・ウォン","displayName":"Jeffrey Wong","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r56","rowIndex":56,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そんなもの、武器と人を揃えてしっかり計画を練ればどうにでもなる。なあ<tips=2>阿亮</tips>？　こないだ<tips=26>劉</tips>をやったみたいに、何か方法は考えてるんだろ？」","en":"“With enough weapons and men and a solid plan, anything can be managed. Isn’t that right, <tips=2>Ah Leung</tips>? You’ve thought of some way, haven’t you—like when you took care of <tips=26>Ryu</tips> the other day?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬明","displayName":"Ma Ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r57","rowIndex":57,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いや、難しいよ。<tips=39>ジェフリー</tips>の言う通りだと僕も思う。<tips=27>廖</tips>は用心深い。<tips=26>劉</tips>とは違うんだ」","en":"“No, it would be difficult. I agree with <tips=39>Jeffrey</tips>. <tips=27>Liao</tips> is cautious. He isn’t like <tips=26>Ryu</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r58","rowIndex":58,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕の返事に顔を歪める<tips=4>馬明</tips>に、<tips=39>ジェフリー</tips>はさらに言う。","en":"<tips=4>Ma Ming</tips> grimaced at my reply, and <tips=39>Jeffrey</tips> continued.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r59","rowIndex":59,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いずれ決定的な対立は避けられないとしても、現段階で挑発に乗って戦争を仕掛けるのは下策だ。我々の方から無用の血を強いるような真似をすれば、幹部の多くは<tips=27>廖</tips>に味方するだろう。そうなれば<tips=35>フェルナンデス</tips>も中立とは限らない。我々が窮地に立つことになる」","en":"“Even if a decisive confrontation is ultimately unavoidable, launching a war now because we took his bait would be folly. If we are the ones to force needless bloodshed upon YS, many of the officers will side with <tips=27>Liao</tips>. Even <tips=35>Fernandes</tips> may not remain neutral. We would place ourselves in an untenable position.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ジェフリー・ウォン","displayName":"Jeffrey Wong","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r60","rowIndex":60,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ふざけてやがる」","en":"“He’s fucking with us.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬明","displayName":"Ma Ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r61","rowIndex":61,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=39>ジェフリー</tips>の言葉に一応は納得したようだが、それでも<tips=4>馬明</tips>の怒りは到底収まらないようだった。","en":"<tips=4>Ma Ming</tips> appeared to accept <tips=39>Jeffrey’s</tips> argument in principle, but he was far from appeased.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r62","rowIndex":62,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それにしても、うさんくさいメールですな」","en":"“Nevertheless, this is a deeply suspicious email.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ジェフリー・ウォン","displayName":"Jeffrey Wong","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r63","rowIndex":63,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=39>ジェフリー</tips>は文面を改めて眺めながらそう言った。","en":"<tips=39>Jeffrey</tips> spoke as he examined the text once more.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r64","rowIndex":64,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「一体どれくらい真実が書かれているのか。そもそも、本当に襲撃者はあったのか？　自分たちの武装強化を正当化し、我々へのいわれのない不信感を煽るのが目的ではないのか？　この件は調査がもう少し必要なようですな」","en":"“How much of this is true? Was there truly an attacker at all? Is his real purpose to justify strengthening his own forces while fomenting groundless suspicion of us? It appears this matter requires a little more investigation.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ジェフリー・ウォン","displayName":"Jeffrey Wong","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r65","rowIndex":65,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=39>ジェフリー</tips>は厳かにそう言った。","en":"<tips=39>Jeffrey</tips> said this solemnly.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r66","rowIndex":66,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ひとまず、<tips=27>廖志明</tips>に詳しい話をききましょう。……<tips=30>レイレイ</tips>、<tips=27>廖志明</tips>につないでくれませんか？」","en":"“First, we will obtain a fuller account from <tips=27>Liao Chi-ming</tips>. ...<tips=30>Leilei</tips>, would you connect me with <tips=27>Liao Chi-ming</tips>?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ジェフリー・ウォン","displayName":"Jeffrey Wong","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r67","rowIndex":67,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「僕がかわりに話そうか？」","en":"“Would you like me to speak to him instead?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r68","rowIndex":68,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　例のスキャンダル写真のことがあるから、冷静に会話が出来るか心配だった。","en":"In light of the scandalous photograph, I was concerned that Jeffrey might not be able to converse calmly.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r69","rowIndex":69,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「その方がいいかもしれないな」","en":"“That might be better.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬明","displayName":"Ma Ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r70","rowIndex":70,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕の意図を察して<tips=4>馬明</tips>も同調してくれるが、","en":"<tips=4>Ma Ming</tips> understood my intent and agreed, but—","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r71","rowIndex":71,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「私の方が良いでしょう。これは筆頭補佐官である私の役目です」","en":"“It would be better if I handled it. This is my duty as chief adviser.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ジェフリー・ウォン","displayName":"Jeffrey Wong","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r72","rowIndex":72,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=39>ジェフリー</tips>はにべもない。","en":"<tips=39>Jeffrey</tips> rejected the suggestion flatly.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r73","rowIndex":73,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=27>廖志明</tips>との通話は１０分にも満たない短い時間で終わった。その間、<tips=39>ジェフリー</tips>の口調は普段よりも若干固くは感じられたが、取り乱すこともなく、相手の声は聞こえなかったにしろ、受け答えも妥当のように思えた。","en":"The call with <tips=27>Liao Chi-ming</tips> ended in less than ten minutes. <tips=39>Jeffrey’s</tips> tone sounded slightly more rigid than usual throughout, but he never lost his composure. Although we could not hear the other man’s voice, Jeffrey’s answers appeared reasonable.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r74","rowIndex":74,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「襲撃者が現れたのは事実ですが、その能力については目の当たりにしてもおらず、全く正体不明なようですな」","en":"“An attacker really did appear, but he did not witness her ability firsthand, and its nature remains entirely unknown.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ジェフリー・ウォン","displayName":"Jeffrey Wong","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r75","rowIndex":75,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=39>ジェフリー</tips>はそう言って、机の上に投げ出すように両手を置いて、その指を組んだ。","en":"As he spoke, <tips=39>Jeffrey</tips> dropped both hands heavily onto the desk and interlaced his fingers.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r76","rowIndex":76,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「フードで顔が隠されていて、声にもまったく聞き覚えがない。使った言葉は発音のおかしい英語。屋敷のまわりを監視しているカメラにも何も写っていない。おそろしい相手だから、くれぐれも気をつけるように、とのことですよ」","en":"“Her hood concealed her face, and he did not recognize her voice at all. She spoke English with a strange accent. None of the cameras monitoring the area around the residence recorded anything. He says the adversary is terrifying and that we must exercise the greatest possible caution.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ジェフリー・ウォン","displayName":"Jeffrey Wong","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r77","rowIndex":77,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「身に染みる忠告痛み入るね」","en":"“How deeply grateful I am for that hard-earned advice.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r78","rowIndex":78,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕は苦笑してしまう。","en":"I could not help giving a wry smile.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r79","rowIndex":79,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　襲撃者の能力の手がかりや容姿など、一番大事な情報が完全に抜け落ちている。これで気をつけろ、はない。","en":"The most important information—clues to the attacker’s ability or appearance—was entirely absent. Under those conditions, telling us to exercise caution was absurd.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r80","rowIndex":80,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　もし<tips=27>廖</tips>の言っていることがすべて事実だとしたら、あの厳重な警備を突破して屋敷に潜り込み、しかも銅像をこわすなんていういたずらをやってのけた高度な能力者を、能力の手がかりもなしにどう対策しろというのだろう？","en":"If everything <tips=27>Liao</tips> said was true, then a highly capable psychic had penetrated that formidable security and even played a prank by destroying a bronze bust. How were we supposed to prepare for someone like that without the slightest clue to her ability?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r81","rowIndex":81,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どこまでが本当で、どこが嘘やら」","en":"“Who knows where the truth ends and the lies begin?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬明","displayName":"Ma Ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r82","rowIndex":82,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=4>馬明</tips>は溜息をつく。","en":"<tips=4>Ma Ming</tips> sighed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r83","rowIndex":83,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「僕は、我々を狙う<tips=16>タイプA</tips>自体は存在するんだと思うよ」","en":"“I do think a <tips=16>Type A</tips> who means to attack us actually exists.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r84","rowIndex":84,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕が言うと、<tips=39>ジェフリー</tips>はこちらに視線をやり、","en":"At that, <tips=39>Jeffrey</tips> looked over at me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r85","rowIndex":85,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「根拠はありますか？」","en":"“Do you have grounds for that conclusion?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ジェフリー・ウォン","displayName":"Jeffrey Wong","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r86","rowIndex":86,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その言い方はなんとなくトゲがある。僕がたびたび彼の意向を無視したような言動をとるのを、少なからず不快に思っているのかもしれない。","en":"There was something faintly barbed in the question. Perhaps my repeated tendency to speak and act in defiance of his intentions displeased him more than a little.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r87","rowIndex":87,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「根拠って言うほど確かなものじゃないけど、完全なでっち上げだとしたら、書かれた情報がいびつで不自然すぎるからね。おそらく<tips=27>廖</tips>は、僕らを狙う何者かの存在を察知していて、それが実際に行動を起こした時、自分に疑いがかかることを避けるためにこんなメールを事前に送りつけたんだ。もちろん、僕らが襲撃者に殺されること自体は大歓迎だから襲撃者の能力といったような大事な情報は教えない。……そう考えると不自然さは消える」","en":"“Nothing firm enough to call evidence. But if the whole thing were fabricated, the information in the email would be far too oddly selective. I suspect <tips=27>Liao</tips> knows that someone is targeting us and sent the email in advance to keep suspicion from falling on him once they make their move. Of course, he would be delighted to see the attacker kill us, so he left out the vital information—what kind of ability the attacker has, for instance. ...Look at it that way, and nothing seems strange anymore.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r88","rowIndex":88,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=2>阿亮</tips>とは考え方が違うが、おれも狙ってるヤツはいると思うね。まあ、今すぐ<tips=27>廖</tips>を呼んで絞り上げよう。そうすれば全てがわかる」","en":"“<tips=2>Ah Leung</tips> and I see it differently, but I also think someone is after us. Anyway, let’s call <tips=27>Liao</tips> in right now and squeeze the truth out of him. Then we’ll know everything.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬明","displayName":"Ma Ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r89","rowIndex":89,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=4>馬明</tips>はやはり単純な解決策を提示するが、さすがにそれは僕も受け容れられない。","en":"<tips=4>Ma Ming</tips> offered the same simple solution as ever, but even I could not accept it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r90","rowIndex":90,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そんなこと出来るわけないよ。表立ってそんなことすれば、それこそ執行部の暴走だって、<tips=27>廖</tips>に口実を与えることになる」","en":"“There’s no way we can do that. If we did something like that openly, we’d give <tips=27>Liao</tips> the perfect pretext to accuse the executive leadership of running wild.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r91","rowIndex":91,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　先日、<tips=26>劉</tips>を殺したことで、幹部たちは少なからず動揺している。その死を悲しむような者は少なかったが、新しい執行部が、同じ派閥に属する身内の幹部を殺害したのだ。","en":"Our killing of <tips=26>Ryu</tips> the other day had considerably unsettled the officers. Few had mourned him, but the new executive had nevertheless killed an officer from its own faction—one of its own.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r92","rowIndex":92,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　この件は、新執行部をなめていた彼らに一定の緊張感を与えることには成功した。しかし、それが我々にとって好ましい反応を引き起こすかどうかは、まだはっきりとはしない。","en":"This affair had succeeded in instilling a measure of tension among those who had held the new executive in contempt. It was not yet clear, however, whether that tension would provoke a reaction favorable to us.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r93","rowIndex":93,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　現在のところ、<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>の覇権を争う舞台に上がっているのは我々と<tips=27>廖志明</tips>で、あとの連中は照明のあたらない観客席で自らの態度を保留している。まあ、<tips=27>廖志明</tips>もはっきりとそう言ったわけではないが、最近の発言や態度を知っているものならば、その野心を疑うものはいないだろう。","en":"At present, we and <tips=27>Liao Chi-ming</tips> occupied the stage upon which the contest for supremacy over <tips=7>YS</tips> was being fought. The others withheld judgment from seats beyond the reach of the lights. <tips=27>Liao</tips> had never explicitly declared himself a contender, naturally, but no one acquainted with his recent words and conduct could doubt his ambition.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r94","rowIndex":94,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その<tips=27>廖</tips>は他の幹部を仲間につけて、正式な手順で我々を執行部の座から追放しようとしている。ここで隙を見せるようなことは出来ない、というのが僕の基本的な考え方だ。","en":"<tips=27>Liao</tips> was working to bring the other officers over to his side and have us formally removed from the executive. My basic position was that we could not afford to give him an opening.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r95","rowIndex":95,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まあ、襲撃者が存在するという前提で調べ、警備も固めましょう。この件について今できることはそれしかない。我々は、他にも沢山の仕事を抱えているのですから」","en":"“Very well. We will investigate on the assumption that the attacker exists and strengthen our security as well. There is nothing else we can do about the matter at present. We have a great many other duties to attend to.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ジェフリー・ウォン","displayName":"Jeffrey Wong","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r96","rowIndex":96,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　最後に<tips=39>ジェフリー</tips>はそう言って、溜息をついた。","en":"With those final words, <tips=39>Jeffrey</tips> sighed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r97","rowIndex":97,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　結局その日はそれ以上顔をつきあわせても何も進展がないということで、解散し、それぞれの仕事に戻ることとなった。","en":"In the end, we decided that sitting there any longer would get us nowhere. We called it a day and went back to our respective work.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r98","rowIndex":98,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=41>グランドタワー</tips>を出る前に、久しぶりに<tips=44>筱喬</tips>に会っていこうかと、ふと思った。思えば父が死んでからこっち、たまに顔を合わせる程度でじっくり時間をとって会話らしい会話をしていない。","en":"Before leaving <tips=41>Grand Tower</tips>, it occurred to me that I might stop by and see <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips>. It had been a while. Come to think of it, since Father died, our paths had crossed only occasionally, and we had never made time for anything that could really be called a conversation.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r99","rowIndex":99,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　新しい仕事でもちろん忙しかったのだが、僕がなんとなく避けていたというのも間違いではない。","en":"Of course, my new job had kept me busy, but it was also true that I had been keeping my distance without quite meaning to.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r100","rowIndex":100,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　幼い頃、あれだけ一人で生きることを強調していた僕が、結局父のあとを継ぐ形になってしまったことが、なんとなく気まずかった。そして<tips=26>劉建志</tips>を殺してからは、そのことが話題になるのが面倒で、なおさら足が遠のいた。","en":"When I was young, I had made such a point of insisting that I would make my own way in life, only to end up taking Father's place after all. It made things awkward. And after I killed <tips=26>Ryu Kenshi</tips>, I stayed away even more, unwilling to deal with the subject coming up.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r101","rowIndex":101,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しかし、いつまでも避けているわけにもいかないだろう。僕らは二人きりの兄妹なのだ。","en":"But I could hardly avoid her forever. We were each other’s only sibling.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r102","rowIndex":102,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　意を決してそのドアの前に立ち、一呼吸おいてからノックをした。","en":"I made up my mind, stood before her door, took a breath, and knocked.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r103","rowIndex":103,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「誰？」","en":"“Who is it?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r104","rowIndex":104,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「僕だよ」","en":"“It’s me.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r105","rowIndex":105,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……お兄ちゃん？」","en":"“...Big Brother?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r106","rowIndex":106,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　内側から静かにドアが開き、そして僕たちは顔を合わせた。","en":"The door opened quietly from within, and we came face-to-face.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r107","rowIndex":107,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=44>筱喬</tips>は僕の顔を見ると、ぎょっと驚きの表情を見せる。","en":"The instant <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> saw me, she looked startled.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r108","rowIndex":108,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どうかした？」","en":"“Is something wrong?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r109","rowIndex":109,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ううん、なんでもない」","en":"“No. It’s nothing.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r110","rowIndex":110,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=44>筱喬</tips>はあきらかに動揺しながら否定する。そして僕を部屋に招き入れると、窓の側のレースのカーテン越しに日の差し込む椅子に腰掛けた。身体が重そうな気怠い雰囲気で、少し痩せたようだった。","en":"Though plainly shaken, <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> insisted that nothing was wrong. She invited me in, then sat in a chair by the window, sunlight filtering through the lace curtains. There was a listless heaviness about her, and she looked a little thinner than before.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r111","rowIndex":111,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女は父が死んだ後も引き続きこの<tips=41>グランドタワー</tips>で生活をしている。","en":"She had continued to live in <tips=41>Grand Tower</tips> after Father’s death.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r112","rowIndex":112,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　父のかわりに彼女の面倒を見ているのは第二代<tips=81>龍頭</tips>である<tips=84>マイケル・ツェー</tips>だった。そして普段は<tips=84>マイケル</tips>の妻子や、他の<tips=41>グランドタワー</tips>住みの幹部の女家族と交流しながら過ごしているらしい。","en":"The second <tips=81>Longtou</tips>, <tips=84>Michael Tse</tips>, had taken Father's place in looking after her. Apparently, she spent her days socializing with <tips=84>Michael's</tips> wife and children and the women in the families of the other officers who lived in <tips=41>Grand Tower</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r113","rowIndex":113,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　初代<tips=81>龍頭</tips>の娘である<tips=44>筱喬</tips>が組織のVIPなのは確かだし、しかも世間知らずの上に<tips=17>タイプB</tips>であるから、保護という意味でも叔父であり<tips=81>龍頭</tips>でもある<tips=84>マイケル・ツェー</tips>がこのビルで面倒を見るのはまあ妥当だろう。","en":"As the daughter of the first <tips=81>Longtou</tips>, <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> was undeniably one of the organization’s VIPs. She was also sheltered and a <tips=17>Type B</tips>. So it was reasonable enough, even as a matter of protecting her, for the <tips=81>Longtou</tips>, <tips=84>Michael Tse</tips>—her uncle—to look after her in this building.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r114","rowIndex":114,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ビルの外に置いたら、どういった人間と接触したり、利用されるかわからない。","en":"If she lived outside the building, there would be no telling what sort of people she might come into contact with—or who might take advantage of her.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r115","rowIndex":115,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「お兄ちゃんが大変なのに、なんの手伝いも出来なくてごめんなさい」","en":"“I’m sorry I haven’t been able to do anything to help when you’re going through so much, Big Brother.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r116","rowIndex":116,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そんなことは気にしないでいい。それより、最近の生活はどうだ？」","en":"“You don't need to worry about that. Anyway, how have things been for you lately?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r117","rowIndex":117,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕は手近な椅子に腰掛けてからそう訊ねた。","en":"I sat down in a nearby chair and asked.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r118","rowIndex":118,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=81>龍頭</tips>になった<tips=84>マイケル</tips>おじさんも、その奥さんも、すごく優しくしてくれて快適だよ」","en":"“Uncle <tips=84>Michael</tips>, who is now the <tips=81>Longtou</tips>, and his wife have both been terribly kind. I’m comfortable here.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r119","rowIndex":119,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それはよかった」","en":"“I’m glad.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r120","rowIndex":120,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「でも、なんだか浮き足立ってて、落ち着かない感じ。……お兄ちゃんはまだホテルにいるの？」","en":"“But everything feels unsettled somehow. I can't relax. ...Are you still staying at the hotel, Big Brother?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r121","rowIndex":121,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「もうホテル暮らしはやめた」","en":"“I’m not living at the hotel anymore.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r122","rowIndex":122,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「じゃあ、ここにいるの？」","en":"“Then are you staying here?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r123","rowIndex":123,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「何日か住んでたんだけどね、ここじゃ、どうも居心地が悪くて仕方ないからやめた」","en":"“I stayed here for a few days, but I never felt at home, so I left.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r124","rowIndex":124,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ここにいた時があったなんて、ちっとも知らなかった！　どうして教えてくれなかったの？　お兄ちゃんと近くで暮らせるなんて、本当に久しぶりなのに」","en":"“I had no idea you were here! Why didn’t you tell me? It’s been so long since you and I could live near each other.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r125","rowIndex":125,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「一番忙しい時期だったからね。理解してほしい」","en":"“That was when I was busiest. I hope you can understand.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r126","rowIndex":126,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……じゃあ今は、どこにいるの？」","en":"“...So where are you staying now?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r127","rowIndex":127,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=57>滑走路通り</tips>の近くに住んでるメンバーの家に間借りしてる。……そのうち、昔みんなが住んでいたあの家を掃除して使ってもいいかもしれないな。覚えてるだろう？」","en":"“I'm renting a room from a member who lives near <tips=57>Runway Street</tips>. ...Once things settle down, I might clean up that old house we all used to live in and move back there. You remember it, don't you?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r128","rowIndex":128,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「うん、いいな……」","en":"“Yes. That would be nice...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r129","rowIndex":129,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=44>筱喬</tips>は物憂げに目を細める。","en":"<tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> narrowed her eyes, looking melancholy.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r130","rowIndex":130,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうなったら、お前も暮らすか？」","en":"“Would you like to live there too, if we did?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r131","rowIndex":131,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そんなこと、出来るの？」","en":"“Could I really?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r132","rowIndex":132,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「出来るよ。このビルが安全だとは言うけれど、今の状況ではそれほどのものだとは思わない」","en":"“Of course you could. People say this building is safe, but under the circumstances, I'm not convinced it really is.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r133","rowIndex":133,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　このビルは確かに優れた防御設備ではあるとは思う。通常の設備を用いた機械的な警戒システムの他に、<tips=40>黄姉妹</tips>のレーダーのような生命感知能力がある。それによって、たとえば留守の間に何物かが侵入してどこに隠れていようともすぐに見つけだしてしまうし、かつては、それに加えて<tips=81>龍頭</tips>の透視能力があったのだから、文字通り城塞のように機能していたのだろう。","en":"I did think the building was well defended. Beyond its ordinary mechanical security systems, the <tips=40>Wong sisters</tips> had a radar-like ability to detect life. If someone entered while the building was empty and hid anywhere within it, for example, they would be discovered at once. And formerly there had also been the <tips=81>Longtou’s</tips> clairvoyance. The building must literally have functioned as a fortress.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r134","rowIndex":134,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しかしそれはあくまでも、明白な敵意をもった侵入者に対する防衛能力であって、身内の裏切りや客の予期せぬ変心を発見したり排除するものではない。透視能力のある先代<tips=81>龍頭</tips>なら、どんなに偽装しても隠し持った武器を見つけ出すことが出来たが、彼はもういない。","en":"Yet those systems defended only against intruders with evident hostile intent. They could neither detect nor prevent treachery from within or an unexpected change of heart in a guest. The former <tips=81>Longtou’s</tips> clairvoyance could uncover a concealed weapon no matter how skillfully it was hidden, but he was gone.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r135","rowIndex":135,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　このビルには<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>の様々な関係者が訪れる。現在我々が警戒しなくてはいけないのは、いずれも<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>内部の人間なのだから、こうした警備体制はほとんど用を成さない。","en":"All manner of people connected to <tips=7>YS</tips> visited the building. And everyone we presently needed to guard against belonged to <tips=7>YS</tips>, making these defenses almost entirely useless.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r136","rowIndex":136,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　先代の死によって最も信頼出来る筈の我々<tips=76>旧義勝</tips>のメンバーにも動揺がある。<tips=39>ジェフリー</tips>をはじめとする新体制に馴染めない誰かが他のファミリーに工作をされ、手土産に<tips=44>筱喬</tips>の身柄を、なんていうのは極端な想像ではあるが、非現実的なほどではない。","en":"The former Longtou's death had unsettled even the members of the <tips=76>old Yisheng</tips>, the people we should have been able to trust most. It was an extreme scenario, but not an impossible one: another family might turn someone who could not accept the new order under <tips=39>Jeffrey</tips>, and that person might offer up <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> as a gift to their new allies.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r137","rowIndex":137,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　街に住むのが安全だとは言わないが、少なくとも<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>関係者がやって来ることはない。","en":"I would not call life in the city safe, but at least no one connected to <tips=7>YS</tips> would visit her there.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r138","rowIndex":138,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それと、<tips=27>廖志明</tips>の屋敷を襲った<tips=16>タイプＡ</tips>のように、厳重な警備を突破して易々と侵入できるほどの能力の持ち主ならば、このビルの警備体制をあてにしてここに居たって全く意味がないかもしれない。","en":"Besides, if the <tips=16>Type A</tips> who attacked <tips=27>Liao Chi-ming's</tips> residence truly possessed an ability that let them slip so easily through heavy security, there might be no point in staying here and relying on this building's defenses at all.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r139","rowIndex":139,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　もっとも、そんな存在するかどうかもわからない、能力の実態も掴めていない<tips=16>タイプA</tips>を想定しても仕方がないが――。","en":"Of course, it was pointless to plan around a <tips=16>Type A</tips> whom we did not know to exist and whose ability we had not even begun to understand...","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r140","rowIndex":140,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それに安全面だけでなく、とにかく僕は、<tips=44>筱喬</tips>を<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>から遠ざけたかった。","en":"But beyond the question of safety, I simply wanted to get <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> away from <tips=7>YS</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r141","rowIndex":141,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「もうちょっと落ち着いたら、このビルから出た方がいい」","en":"“Once things settle down a little, you should leave this building.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r142","rowIndex":142,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そう……」","en":"“I see...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r143","rowIndex":143,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=44>筱喬</tips>は肘掛けに肘を立て、頬杖をついている。","en":"<tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> rested an elbow on the arm of her chair and propped her cheek on one hand.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r144","rowIndex":144,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　もっと喜ぶかと思ったがさほどでもない。","en":"I had expected her to be happier, but she did not seem particularly pleased.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r145","rowIndex":145,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女は溜息をつき、","en":"She sighed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r146","rowIndex":146,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「小さい頃は幸せだったな。あの家で、お兄ちゃんとお母さんが毎日近くにいて、お父さんも月に一度くらいはプレゼントを持って来てくれた」","en":"“I was happy when I was little. You and Mother were always there with me in that house, and Father would come by with a present about once a month.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r147","rowIndex":147,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕が定食屋にあずけられるまでの時間、僕はそこで母と妹と暮らした。","en":"I lived there with my mother and sister until I was sent to live with the family from the diner.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r148","rowIndex":148,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして母が発症すると、僕は定食屋からまたその家に戻り、<tips=44>筱喬</tips>と一緒に母親の面倒を見た。","en":"When Mother’s symptoms manifested, I returned from the restaurant to that house, where <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> and I cared for her together.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r149","rowIndex":149,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　母が死ぬと、<tips=44>筱喬</tips>は<tips=41>グランドタワー</tips>に引き取られ、僕は短い期間街で一人暮らしをした後に進学して<tips=9>Y地区</tips>を出た。","en":"After Mother died, <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> was taken in at <tips=41>Grand Tower</tips>. I lived alone in the city for a short time, then left <tips=9>Y District</tips> to continue my education.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r150","rowIndex":150,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あの頃に戻りたい」","en":"“I want to go back to those days.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r151","rowIndex":151,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それは無理だな」","en":"“That isn’t possible.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r152","rowIndex":152,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「わかってる。……もう<tips=44>シウ</tips>も子供じゃないんだよね」","en":"“I know. ...<tips=44>Siu</tips> isn’t a child anymore.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r153","rowIndex":153,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……何かしたいことがあるか？　今だったらお前は自分の人生を選び直せる。あの家じゃなくても、この街を出て暮らすことも出来る」","en":"“...Is there anything you want to do? You still have the chance to choose a different life for yourself. It doesn't have to be in that house. You could leave this city and live somewhere else entirely.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r154","rowIndex":154,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「無理だよ。この街の外で<tips=17>タイプB</tips>が普通に暮らせるところなんかないわ」","en":"“I can’t. There’s nowhere outside this city where a <tips=17>Type B</tips> can live an ordinary life.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r155","rowIndex":155,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうでもない。お前くらいの年で、一人暮らしをして居る<tips=17>タイプB</tips>の女の子は学校にもたくさんいた。お前も知らない街で、そうやって<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>と無関係な人間として生きて行くんだ」","en":"“That isn’t true. There were plenty of <tips=17>Type B</tips> girls your age living by themselves at my university. You can live the same way in a city where no one knows you, as someone with no connection to <tips=7>YS</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r156","rowIndex":156,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ちょっと前まではお兄ちゃんも、そうやって<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>と無関係な生活をしていたんだね」","en":"“Until a little while ago, you were the one living without any connection to <tips=7>YS</tips>, weren’t you?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r157","rowIndex":157,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうだ」","en":"“That’s right.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r158","rowIndex":158,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それで、そのときは<tips=44>シウ</tips>がこのビルで<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>の人たちと一緒に暮らしてた。そして今はこれが反対になって、お兄ちゃんが<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>に入り、私が無関係な人として暮らせって言うんだ」","en":"“And back then, <tips=44>Siu</tips> lived in this building with the people from <tips=7>YS</tips>. Now it’s the other way around: you’ve joined <tips=7>YS</tips>, and you’re telling me to live as someone with no connection to it.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r159","rowIndex":159,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「何を言いたい？」","en":"“What are you trying to say?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r160","rowIndex":160,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=44>筱喬</tips>はじっと僕の目を見る。","en":"<tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> stared into my eyes.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r161","rowIndex":161,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……お兄ちゃんが学生をやめて<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>に入ったのは、<tips=44>シウ</tips>のみがわりになって、<tips=44>シウ</tips>を<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>から解放するため？」","en":"“...Did you leave school and join <tips=7>YS</tips> so you could take <tips=44>Siu’s</tips> place and set <tips=44>Siu</tips> free from <tips=7>YS</tips>?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r162","rowIndex":162,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕は答えにつまってしまった。","en":"I could find no answer.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r163","rowIndex":163,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=44>筱喬</tips>が状況をそんなかたちで把握しているとは思わなかった。自分を取り巻く状況について、僕が想像していたよりも冷静に認識している。","en":"I had not imagined that <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> understood the situation in those terms. She saw her own circumstances far more clearly than I had supposed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r164","rowIndex":164,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうじゃない」","en":"“That isn’t why.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r165","rowIndex":165,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　結局そう答えたが、返答までの一瞬の間が、彼女に言葉の内容とは別の意味を悟らせてしまったろう。","en":"That was the answer I eventually gave her. Yet the instant of silence before it must have told her something different from the words themselves.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r166","rowIndex":166,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「やっと自由になれたのに、足手まといになっちゃってごめんなさい」","en":"“You had finally won your freedom. I’m sorry I became a burden.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r167","rowIndex":167,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「本当に違うんだ。<tips=44>シウ</tips>は勘違いをしている。僕は誰かの身代わりになるなんてことだけのために行動したりはしない。自分にとって意味があるから戻って来たんだ」","en":"“That's really not it. You've got the wrong idea, <tips=44>Siu</tips>. I would never do something like this solely to take someone else's place. I came back because doing so means something to me.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r168","rowIndex":168,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……そうなの？」","en":"“...Is that true?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r169","rowIndex":169,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=44>筱喬</tips>は信じてはいないようだった。","en":"<tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> did not appear to believe me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r170","rowIndex":170,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「僕はなんだっていいのさ。実験を繰り返して新しい発見をするのも楽しいが、この奇妙な街で奇妙な連中を観察するのも悪くないだろうよ。いつか死ぬときに、まあまあ悪くない人生だったと思えるならば、何をしたって一緒さ」","en":"“I can do whatever. Running experiment after experiment and making new discoveries is enjoyable, but observing the strange people in this strange city isn't bad either. If, when the time comes for me to die, I can look back and think my life wasn't half bad, then one choice is as good as another.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r171","rowIndex":171,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕は笑ってみせ、","en":"I gave her a smile.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r172","rowIndex":172,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「つき合ってみて思ったけれどね、僕はこの世界の、欲望に素直で、行動もシンプルな連中がそこまで嫌いじゃないかもしれない。何か野生動物の群れのなかで暮らしているような気がするよ。彼らを観察するのは悪くない。ある意味、自然科学的なフィールドワークみたいなもんさ」","en":"“Now that I’ve spent some time with them, I think I may not dislike the people of this world quite as much as I expected. They are honest about their appetites, and their actions are simple. I feel as though I’m living among a pack of wild animals. Observing them is not unpleasant. In a sense, it resembles fieldwork in the natural sciences.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r173","rowIndex":173,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「でも、それは……」","en":"“But that...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r174","rowIndex":174,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=44>筱喬</tips>は言いかけてから、目をそらして、口をつぐんだ。","en":"<tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> started to say something, then looked away and fell silent.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r175","rowIndex":175,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「言ってご覧」","en":"“Go on. Tell me.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r176","rowIndex":176,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　促すと、彼女は再び僕に視線を向ける。","en":"At my prompting, she met my eyes again.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r177","rowIndex":177,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そんな風に考えたら、だめだよ。お兄ちゃんも、きっとこの世界に取り込まれてしまう。<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>から離れなきゃいけないのは<tips=44>シウ</tips>じゃなくてお兄ちゃんだよ。お兄ちゃんが街を出た判断は間違ってなかったんだ」","en":"“You can’t think that way. You’ll get swallowed up by this world too. The one who has to leave <tips=7>YS</tips> isn’t <tips=44>Siu</tips>—it’s you. Your decision to leave the city wasn’t wrong.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r178","rowIndex":178,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女の目は真剣だった。言葉には熱っぽい訴えがあり、確信めいたものが感じられた。","en":"Her eyes were earnest. There was a fervent appeal in her words, and what felt like genuine conviction.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r179","rowIndex":179,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　言葉の内容よりも、その態度が僕に驚きのようなものを与える。","en":"It was her manner, more than what she had said, that took me by surprise.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r180","rowIndex":180,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そんなことはないさ。それより……」","en":"“That's not true. Anyway—”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r181","rowIndex":181,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「このままだったら、きっとお兄ちゃんは近いうちに死ぬよ」","en":"“At this rate, you're going to die soon.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r182","rowIndex":182,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　話題を変えようとした僕を、彼女は許さない。","en":"She refused to let me change the subject.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r183","rowIndex":183,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「私、もしかしたら人の死ぬのがわかるのかもしれない。お母さんの時も、お父さんの時も、もうすぐ死ぬって本当にわかる前から、会うとなんだか変にモヤモヤとした感じがしてたの。その他にも何人か、そういう人がいた。……その時はなんだかわからなかったけど、今になって思うと、みんなそれから二、三年のうちに死んじゃってる」","en":"“I think I may be able to tell when people are going to die. With Mother and Father, long before there was any real way to know they would die soon, I felt this strange haze whenever I saw them. There were a few other people too. ...I didn’t understand it then, but when I look back now, every one of them died within two or three years.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r184","rowIndex":184,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　自分の意識が世界と繋がっているような気がして、目の前の出来事が、すべて自分が予知していたもののように感じてしまう。……<tips=17>タイプB</tips>の症状の一つにはそういった錯覚があるのを僕は知っている。","en":"I knew of a <tips=17>Type B</tips> symptom in which a person felt as though their consciousness were connected to the world and everything before them seemed to be something they had predicted.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r185","rowIndex":185,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　心配になって僕は<tips=44>筱喬</tips>の顔をじっと見た。目は金色にはなっていないし、興奮や過度の緊張も見られない。過去に見た<tips=17>タイプB</tips>発症者の感じとは違っているが、<tips=17>タイプB</tips>の発症パターンというのは、専門家でも把握しきれないほど様々な形で現れるそうだから油断は出来ない。","en":"Concerned, I studied <tips=44>Siu-kiu’s</tips> face. Her eyes had not turned gold, nor did I see agitation or excessive tension. She did not resemble the symptomatic <tips=17>Type Bs</tips> I had observed in the past. But the patterns of <tips=17>Type B</tips> symptom onset reportedly varied so widely that even specialists could not understand them completely, and I could not afford to dismiss the possibility.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r186","rowIndex":186,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いまの<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>の偉い人たちは、みんな会うとそういうモヤモヤがある。きっと、もうすぐ死んじゃうんだと思う。お兄ちゃんも、前はそんな感じしなかったのに、<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>に入った今、それをすごく感じるんだ。だから、さっき顔を見たとき驚いたの。ねえ、今すぐ抜けられない？　私、お兄ちゃんが死んだらどうしていいかわからない」","en":"“Whenever I see any of the important people in <tips=7>YS</tips> now, I feel that same haze. I think they’re all going to die soon. I never used to feel it from you, but now that you’ve entered <tips=7>YS</tips>, it’s terribly strong. That’s why I was so startled when I saw your face. Big Brother, can’t you leave right now? I don’t know what I’ll do if you die.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r187","rowIndex":187,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>の偉い人たちって、誰のことだ？　<tips=39>ジェフリー</tips>？　<tips=4>馬明</tips>？」","en":"“Which important people in <tips=7>YS</tips> do you mean? <tips=39>Jeffrey</tips>? <tips=4>Ma Ming</tips>?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r188","rowIndex":188,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「二人とも。<tips=81>龍頭</tips>になった<tips=84>マイケル</tips>おじさんからはそれを感じないわ。きっと、上手く生き延びるんだと思う」","en":"“Both of them. I don’t feel it from Uncle <tips=84>Michael</tips>, who is now the <tips=81>Longtou</tips>. I think he’ll find some way to survive.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r189","rowIndex":189,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なんだか変にリアリティのある話だね」","en":"“That sounds oddly plausible.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r190","rowIndex":190,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕が肩をすくめると、","en":"I shrugged.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r191","rowIndex":191,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「信じられないのはわかるよ。私もそんなのありえないとずっと思ってたし、そんないやなものが予知できちゃうなんて嫌で嫌でしかたなかったんだけど、どうしてもそうとしか思えないから。……お父さんだって、ああいう特別な力があったんだし……」","en":"“I understand why you can’t believe me. For a long time, I thought it couldn’t possibly be true. I hated the thought that I could predict something so awful—I hated it more than anything. But I can’t find any other explanation. ...And Father did have a special power of that kind...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r192","rowIndex":192,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=16>タイプA</tips>の資質は<tips=17>タイプB</tips>と違って遺伝しないよ」","en":"“Unlike <tips=17>Type B</tips>, an aptitude for <tips=16>Type A</tips> abilities isn't inherited.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r193","rowIndex":193,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕は手を伸ばし<tips=44>筱喬</tips>の頭を撫でると、","en":"I reached out and stroked <tips=44>Siu-kiu’s</tips> head.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r194","rowIndex":194,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「大丈夫。僕はそう簡単には死にやしない。この世の中で、やりたいことがまだたくさんあるんだ。だから心配しなくていいよ」","en":"“It's all right. I won't die that easily. There's still so much I want to do in this world. So don't worry.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r195","rowIndex":195,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そう答えたとき、僕の胸ポケットのなかで携帯電話が振動した。","en":"As I said this, the phone in my breast pocket began to buzz.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r196","rowIndex":196,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　地下の駐車場に待たせている運転手からの電話で、会食の時間が迫っているとのことだった。","en":"It was a call from the driver waiting in the underground garage. The time for my dinner engagement was approaching.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r197","rowIndex":197,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　今日の相手は、<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>の大叔父にあたる人物で、<tips=57>滑走路通り</tips>の裏手にいくつかのアダルトショップを経営している。ファミリーに古くからいる重要人物の一人だ。もう老境に達して一線を退いているが、発言にはそれなりの影響力があり、今日は彼の要望で自宅に招かれている。","en":"The man I was to meet that day was <tips=3>Chris Tse’s</tips> great-uncle, who operated several adult shops behind <tips=57>Runway Street</tips>. He was an important, long-standing member of the family. Though advanced age had taken him out of active work, his words still carried considerable influence, and I had been invited to his home at his request.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r198","rowIndex":198,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おそらく、彼好みに油たっぷりで仕上げられた豪勢な広東料理を肴に、何か有り難い説教でもしてくれるつもりなのだろう。若い時の殺人やら、レイプやらの話が大好きな老人だ。","en":"Presumably he intended to serve some sumptuous Cantonese food prepared with as much oil as his tastes demanded and deliver an edifying lecture or two over dinner. The old man dearly loved telling stories about the murders and rapes of his youth.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r199","rowIndex":199,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕はちっとも面白くもないが、<tips=4>馬明</tips>がファミリー内での繋がりは大事にしろというので従っている。どんな役職についても、基本的には年長者を立てるのが我々の伝統なのだそうだ。","en":"I found none of it remotely interesting, but <tips=4>Ma Ming</tips> insisted that I must value my connections within the family, and so I complied. No matter one’s position, deference to one’s elders was apparently our tradition.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r200","rowIndex":200,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　父も、こうした身内の長老の呼び出しには素直に従っていたそうで、彼のような人物が大人しく話を聞いている姿を想像するとおかしいが、僕も他人事ではない。先のことはわからないが、今はある程度ルールに従うのが賢明だろう。","en":"Apparently, even Father had obediently answered summonses from the family's elders. It was amusing to imagine a man like him sitting quietly and listening, but this was no longer someone else's problem. I had no idea what the future held, but for now, it seemed wise to follow the rules to some extent.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r201","rowIndex":201,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「悪いが、行かなくちゃいけない。今度時間をとって話をしよう」","en":"“I’m sorry, but I have to go. We’ll make time to talk again.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r202","rowIndex":202,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……待ってる。私ももっと話したい」","en":"“...I’ll be waiting. I want to talk more too.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r203","rowIndex":203,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=44>筱喬</tips>がそう言うのを聞いてから、僕はその部屋を後にした。","en":"After hearing <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> say it, I left her room.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r204","rowIndex":204,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その日は<tips=9>Y地区</tips>ではよくあるぐずついた一日で、どんよりと曇った灰色の空から静かな雨がしとしとと降ったり止んだりを繰り返していた。","en":"It was the sort of unsettled day common in <tips=9>Y District</tips>. A quiet rain fell in fine drops from the dull gray sky, stopped, then began again.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r205","rowIndex":205,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕はファミリーの連中に提出させた帳簿を夜っぴてデータ化し、グラフにまとめたりしていたので朝から睡眠不足で頭が重かった。何でも数字を求め、グラフにしてしまうのが大学に通うようになってから身についた癖だ。","en":"I had spent the entire night digitizing the ledgers the family members had submitted and assembling graphs from the data, leaving me foggy-headed with fatigue all morning. My university years had given me the habit of reducing everything to numbers and turning those numbers into graphs.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r206","rowIndex":206,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips><tips=81>龍頭</tips>であった父の部下は、第二代<tips=81>龍頭</tips>の<tips=84>マイケル・ツェー</tips>がすべて譲り受けることになったから、現在のところ、僕の唯一の個人的な部下は<tips=25>世傑</tips>だけだった。彼と共に車に乗って昼過ぎに<tips=41>グランドタワー</tips>に到着すると、いつも車のドアを開けてくれるスーツ姿の部下に挨拶をし、エレベーターに乗った。","en":"All the subordinates who had served my father as <tips=7>YS</tips> <tips=81>Longtou</tips> were to pass to <tips=84>Michael Tse</tips>, the second <tips=81>Longtou</tips>, so for the time being <tips=25>Sai-kit</tips> was my only personal subordinate. He and I drove to <tips=41>Grand Tower</tips> in the early afternoon. After greeting the suited subordinate who always opened the car door for us, we took the elevator.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r207","rowIndex":207,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=25>世傑</tips>は最近気にいっているワインの銘柄の話を、僕が聞いていないのに一方的にして、それから彼の父の<tips=4>馬明</tips>が最近いきいきと仕事に取り組んでいることを話した。先代が死んで責任が増えたことと、きなくさい状況が生む緊張感が、彼にやりがいを与えているのだろうと<tips=25>世傑</tips>は分析した。","en":"Without being asked, <tips=25>Sai-kit</tips> launched into a one-sided account of a wine he had taken a liking to lately. Then he told me that his father, <tips=4>Ma Ming</tips>, had recently been throwing himself into his work with unusual vitality. <tips=25>Sai-kit's</tips> analysis was that the greater responsibility following the former Longtou's death, along with the tension produced by the trouble brewing around us, had given him a renewed sense of purpose.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r208","rowIndex":208,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　最上階で<tips=30>レイレイ</tips>と会うと、今日は<tips=44>筱喬</tips>が街に買い物に出ていることを伝えてくれた。僕が先日積極的に<tips=44>筱喬</tips>を街に出すよう<tips=81>龍頭</tips>に要望したのを、早速実行に移してくれたらしい。今日は服や部屋に置く小物を見に、<tips=9>Y地区</tips>の外に行っているのだそうだ。","en":"When I met <tips=30>Leilei</tips> on the top floor, she told me that <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> had gone shopping in the city that day. The <tips=81>Longtou</tips> seemed to have acted promptly on my recent request that he make a point of getting <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> out into the city. She had gone beyond <tips=9>Y District</tips> to look at clothes and small things for her room.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r209","rowIndex":209,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=9>Y地区</tips>のなかの方が何かとトラブルの種が多いと誰かが判断したのだろうが、賢明だろう。","en":"Someone must have judged that <tips=9>Y District</tips> itself offered too many opportunities for trouble. That was probably wise.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r210","rowIndex":210,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　執務室では<tips=39>ジェフリー</tips>が自分でポットを持ってコーヒーを淹れていた。コーヒーは彼の数少ない趣味で、生のままの豆を売っている店に自ら足を運び、焙煎の仕方まで指定して買ってくる。それを飲むたびに使用する分だけハンドミルで挽いて、こだわりの温度にあたためたお湯を使って抽出する。どんなに忙しくても、昼食後の一杯だけはそうやって自分で淹れる。","en":"In the office, <tips=39>Jeffrey</tips> was brewing his own coffee. Coffee was one of his few pleasures. He personally visited a shop that sold green beans and specified exactly how they were to be roasted. Whenever he made a cup, he ground only as many beans as he needed in a hand mill, then brewed them with water heated to his preferred temperature. No matter how busy he was, he always made that one cup after lunch himself.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r211","rowIndex":211,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　他人には全くわからないが、同じように淹れても日によって味が違うと本人は力説し、うまく淹れられた日は上機嫌で、思ったのと違っていれば不機嫌になる。","en":"No one else could detect the slightest difference, but he insisted that the taste varied from day to day even when he followed the same procedure. When the coffee came out well, it put him in an excellent mood; when it differed from what he had intended, he became irritable.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r212","rowIndex":212,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その日はよほど上手に淹れられたらしく、青白い肌と、目の下のくまが一層濃くなった顔に笑みを浮かべて、僕と<tips=25>世傑</tips>を出迎えた。","en":"He must have brewed it especially well that day. He welcomed <tips=25>Sai-kit</tips> and me with a smile on a face made all the more haggard by his pallid skin and the deepening shadows beneath his eyes.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r213","rowIndex":213,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「一杯どうですか？」","en":"“Would you care for a cup?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ジェフリー・ウォン","displayName":"Jeffrey Wong","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r214","rowIndex":214,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼は僕らのためにも珈琲を注いでくれる。","en":"He poured coffee for us as well.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r215","rowIndex":215,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕はブラックのまま飲み、酒飲みのくせに甘党の<tips=25>世傑</tips>は砂糖とミルクを大量に入れる。<tips=39>ジェフリー</tips>はその様子をちらと見たが、何も言わず、笑顔も崩さなかった。","en":"I drank mine black. <tips=25>Sai-kit</tips>, a drinker with a sweet tooth, added a vast quantity of sugar and milk. <tips=39>Jeffrey</tips> cast one glance at the spectacle but said nothing, and his smile never faltered.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r216","rowIndex":216,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　来客の予定もなく、珍しく平穏な一日になる筈だった。","en":"We expected no visitors. For once, it should have been a peaceful day.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r217","rowIndex":217,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=4>馬明</tips>は自分の子分たちと<tips=57>滑走路通り</tips>に新しく出来たエクアドル料理店に食べに行っているらしい。やがて第二代<tips=81>龍頭</tips>の<tips=84>マイケル・ツェー</tips>がやって来ると、僕たちは四人で珈琲を飲むこととなった。","en":"<tips=4>Ma Ming</tips> had apparently gone with his men to eat at a newly opened Ecuadorian restaurant on <tips=57>Runway Street</tips>. When <tips=84>Michael Tse</tips>, the second <tips=81>Longtou</tips>, eventually joined us, the four of us drank coffee together.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r218","rowIndex":218,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　まず<tips=39>ジェフリー</tips>から報告があった。<tips=27>廖志明</tips>に関する調査は現在なんの進展もないらしい。例の<tips=16>タイプA</tips>についても、何もわからない。","en":"<tips=39>Jeffrey</tips> began with his report. The investigation of <tips=27>Liao Chi-ming</tips> had apparently made no progress. We had learned nothing about the <tips=16>Type A</tips> in question either.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r219","rowIndex":219,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕は帳簿を見て気がついた問題点を指摘した。","en":"I raised the problems I had discovered in the ledgers.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r220","rowIndex":220,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　香港の黒社会時代の古い伝統と儀式で飾られた不合理そのもののシステムが、我々の経済力を削いでいる。<tips=27>廖志明</tips>の客家系グループのような現代の会社組織めいたすっきりとしたものにしなければ彼らに対抗してゆくのは難しい。この先ファミリーのあり方を変えて行くべきだろう。","en":"An irrational system decorated with ancient traditions and rituals from the Hong Kong underworld was sapping our economic strength. If we meant to compete with the clean, modern corporate structure of a Hakka-affiliated group such as <tips=27>Liao Chi-ming’s</tips>, the family would have to change the way it operated.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r221","rowIndex":221,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=39>ジェフリー</tips>は一定の理解を示したが、香港時代からの古老たちが納得しないだろうと予測を述べた。","en":"<tips=39>Jeffrey</tips> agreed up to a point, but predicted that the old guard from the Hong Kong days would never accept it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r222","rowIndex":222,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「何をするにも、彼らが天寿を全うしてからですね」","en":"“Whatever we mean to do must wait until they have lived out their natural lives.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ジェフリー・ウォン","displayName":"Jeffrey Wong","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r223","rowIndex":223,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=39>ジェフリー</tips>はなんとものんびりとしたことを言うが、僕はそれほど気長にはなれない。","en":"<tips=39>Jeffrey</tips> could afford to take the long view, but I was nowhere near that patient.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r224","rowIndex":224,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　黙って考えていたら、","en":"As I considered the matter in silence,","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r225","rowIndex":225,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「最近<tips=2>阿亮</tips>は金のことばかり言っているなあ」","en":"“<tips=2>Ah Leung</tips> talks about nothing but money these days,”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"マイケル・ツェー","displayName":"Michael Tse","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r226","rowIndex":226,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　と二代目がからかった。","en":"the second Longtou teased me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r227","rowIndex":227,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そりゃ、金と暴力が一番大事でしょう。……それより<tips=81>龍頭</tips>、そろそろ<tips=44>筱喬</tips>にも<tips=41>グランドタワー</tips>の外での暮らしを体験させたいのですが、どうですか？」","en":"“Of course. Money and violence are what matter most. ...Anyway, <tips=81>Longtou</tips>, I think it's about time <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> had some experience of life outside <tips=41>Grand Tower</tips>. What do you think?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r228","rowIndex":228,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それはいつでも問題ないでしょう」","en":"“That should be possible at any time.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ジェフリー・ウォン","displayName":"Jeffrey Wong","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r229","rowIndex":229,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　二代目の代わりにこたえたのは<tips=39>ジェフリー</tips>だった。","en":"<tips=39>Jeffrey</tips> answered in place of the second Longtou.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r230","rowIndex":230,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ただ、それなりの安全が確保出来る形でないと困りますがね」","en":"“Provided, of course, that arrangements are made to ensure an appropriate degree of safety.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ジェフリー・ウォン","displayName":"Jeffrey Wong","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r231","rowIndex":231,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それから話は雑談へと移り、<tips=25>世傑</tips>が<tips=9>Y地区</tips>出身の歌手ムニラが昔<tips=57>滑走路通り</tips>のバーでアルバイトをしていたころの話をし、<tips=81>龍頭</tips>が少年時代の<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>の話や、やんちゃ坊主だった<tips=4>馬明</tips>の話などをした。無駄話をしながら、僕と<tips=81>龍頭</tips>で囲碁を打った。<tips=81>龍頭</tips>はそれなりに自信があったらしく、僕にあっというまに負かされてしまうと、暫く言葉を失って呆然としていた。二度挑んで来たが、どちらも同じ結果で、最後には「もう<tips=2>阿亮</tips>とは囲碁を打ちたくないなあ」と言い、「僕の一番の特技なんです」と僕がフォローをしても力なく笑うだけだった。","en":"The conversation then turned to idle subjects. <tips=25>Sai-kit</tips> spoke of the days when Munira, a singer from <tips=9>Y District</tips>, had worked part-time at a bar on <tips=57>Runway Street</tips>. The <tips=81>Longtou</tips> told stories about <tips=3>Chris Tse</tips> as a boy and <tips=4>Ma Ming</tips> as a little terror. As we chatted, the <tips=81>Longtou</tips> and I played Go. The <tips=81>Longtou</tips> appeared reasonably confident at first, but sat speechless in a daze when I defeated him almost at once. He challenged me twice more with the same result. At last he said, ‘I don’t want to play Go with <tips=2>Ah Leung</tips> anymore.’ Even when I reassured him that it was my greatest talent, he could manage only a feeble smile.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r232","rowIndex":232,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　街に戻って自分の業務を再開しようとした時に、部屋の和やかな雰囲気を打ち破る荒々しい足音を立てて<tips=39>ジェフリー</tips>の部下が部屋に駆け込んできた。","en":"I was preparing to return to the city and resume my own work when one of <tips=39>Jeffrey’s</tips> men shattered the room’s amiable atmosphere, charging through the door with thunderous footsteps.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r233","rowIndex":233,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「一体、どうしたんだ？」","en":"“What in the world has happened?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ジェフリー・ウォン","displayName":"Jeffrey Wong","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r234","rowIndex":234,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=39>ジェフリー</tips>は怪訝な顔をする。","en":"<tips=39>Jeffrey</tips> looked at him in bewilderment.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r235","rowIndex":235,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「非常事態です！　何者かが、ビルに侵入しました！」","en":"“It's an emergency! Someone has broken into the building!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r236","rowIndex":236,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　男の狼狽ぶりはただごとではない。思わず、<tips=39>ジェフリー</tips>と僕は顔を見合わせる。","en":"The man’s panic was extraordinary. <tips=39>Jeffrey</tips> and I instinctively exchanged looks.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r237","rowIndex":237,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どういうこと？　警備の方からは何も連絡がないけど？」","en":"“What do you mean? We haven’t heard anything from security.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬世傑","displayName":"Ma Sai-kit","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r238","rowIndex":238,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=25>世傑</tips>は首をひねる。","en":"<tips=25>Sai-kit</tips> tilted his head.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r239","rowIndex":239,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　今はいってきた男はモニタールームで監視カメラの映像をチェックしていたはずである。監視カメラは主にビルの内部や、人の目の届かない死角をフォローするもので、不審者が侵入したのなら、まずそちらの方から異状を知らされているはずだ。この部屋には、彼らの手元の端末からワンボタンで繋がる電話機が設置されている。","en":"The man who had just entered should have been checking the surveillance-camera feeds in the monitor room. Those cameras primarily covered the building’s interior and blind spots beyond ordinary view. If a suspicious person had entered, we should have heard from the monitor room first. The operators’ terminals could connect to a telephone in this office at the press of a single button.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r240","rowIndex":240,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それが、本当に侵入してきたんです。……私どもにも、何がなんだか……」","en":"“But someone really did break in. ...We don't understand it either...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r241","rowIndex":241,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　男の顔はすっかり蒼白になっている。","en":"The man’s face had gone entirely white.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r242","rowIndex":242,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「とにかく、早く、こちらへいらしてください！　実際に見て頂かないと、どう説明したらいいのか……」","en":"“Please, come at once! Unless you see it for yourselves, I don’t know how to explain...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r243","rowIndex":243,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ただごとではないようだな。わかった、行こう」","en":"“This is evidently no ordinary matter. Very well. Let us go.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ジェフリー・ウォン","displayName":"Jeffrey Wong","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r244","rowIndex":244,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=39>ジェフリー</tips>がそう言って頷いたときには、僕はもうモニタールームに向かって駆け出していた。","en":"By the time <tips=39>Jeffrey</tips> nodded, I had already begun running toward the monitor room.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r245","rowIndex":245,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　嫌な予感がしてたまらない。","en":"I could not shake an ominous feeling.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r246","rowIndex":246,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　モニタールームは執務室を出てすぐのドアの向こうにある、目と鼻の先の部屋である。","en":"The monitor room was only a few steps away, behind the first door outside the office.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r247","rowIndex":247,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そこには常時二人か三人の部下が配置され、ビルの各所から送られてくる監視カメラの映像をチェックしている。普段はサイキックの<tips=40>黄姉妹</tips>もこの部屋に居て、彼らと連携をとりつつ<tips=81>龍頭</tips>の身辺の安全を確保しているが、<tips=40>黄姉妹</tips>の不在時は表の警備員と警報システム、そしてこのカメラの監視員でビルを守っている。","en":"Two or three men were stationed there at all times, checking the feeds from surveillance cameras throughout the building. Ordinarily, the psychic <tips=40>Wong sisters</tips> were also in the room, coordinating with them to ensure the <tips=81>Longtou’s</tips> personal safety. When the <tips=40>Wong sisters</tips> were absent, the building was protected by the guards out front, the alarm system, and the camera monitors in this room.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r248","rowIndex":248,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　まっさきに部屋のドアを開けて足を踏み入れると、<tips=40>黄姉妹</tips>と、そしてもう一人の監視員が、いま僕らに異変を告げた男と同じような動揺を浮かべて壁一面に並ぶモニターの前に立っている。","en":"I was the first through the door. The <tips=40>Wong sisters</tips> and another surveillance operator stood before the bank of screens covering one wall, looking every bit as shaken as the man who had reported the emergency.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r249","rowIndex":249,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=2>阿亮</tips>！」","en":"“<tips=2>Ah Leung</tips>!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r250","rowIndex":250,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　モニターを見つめていた監視役の男が僕の名を呼ぶ。","en":"The surveillance operator staring at the screens called my name.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r251","rowIndex":251,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=40>黄姉妹</tips>もその声で僕を振り返り、","en":"At his voice, the <tips=40>Wong sisters</tips> turned toward me as well.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r252","rowIndex":252,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「大変なことが……とても、信じられません」","en":"“Something terrible has... I can hardly believe it.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"黄天明","displayName":"Wong Tin-ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r253","rowIndex":253,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=40>天明</tips>が震える声で言った。","en":"<tips=40>Tin-ming’s</tips> voice trembled.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r254","rowIndex":254,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「何が起きたの？」","en":"“What happened?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r255","rowIndex":255,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「一階ロビーです。現在の状況を、中央のモニターにうつします」","en":"“The first-floor lobby. We will put the current view on the central monitor.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"黄天明","displayName":"Wong Tin-ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r256","rowIndex":256,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　監視役の男が手元のパネルを操作する。","en":"The surveillance operator worked the panel before him.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r257","rowIndex":257,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　すると、中央の一番大きなメインモニターに、目を疑うような光景が映し出された。","en":"The largest screen in the center displayed a sight that made me doubt my eyes.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r258","rowIndex":258,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あっ殺されてる」","en":"“Oh. Someone's dead.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r259","rowIndex":259,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕が思ったまま口にすると、","en":"I said exactly what occurred to me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r260","rowIndex":260,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そりゃ、だから呼ばれたんでしょうよ」","en":"“Why do you think they called us?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r261","rowIndex":261,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=25>世傑</tips>がとなりで苦い顔をする。","en":"<tips=25>Sai-kit</tips> grimaced beside me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r262","rowIndex":262,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ひっ」","en":"“Ah!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r263","rowIndex":263,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　女の声に振り返ると、<tips=81>龍頭</tips>や<tips=39>ジェフリー</tips>たちが部下を引き連れて到着し、僕の後ろでモニターの光景に呆然としている。","en":"I turned toward the woman’s voice. The <tips=81>Longtou</tips> and <tips=39>Jeffrey</tips> had arrived with their subordinates and now stood behind me, staring dumbstruck at the screen.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r264","rowIndex":264,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　悲鳴を上げたのは<tips=30>レイレイ</tips>で、このひょんなことから<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>で働くこととなった哀れな少女はすっかり全身を硬直させてしまっていた。","en":"The scream had come from <tips=30>Leilei</tips>. The unfortunate girl who had found herself working for <tips=7>YS</tips> through such a strange turn of events had gone rigid from head to foot.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r265","rowIndex":265,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　男が言った通り、そこは<tips=41>グランドタワー</tips>の一階ロビーの光景だった。部屋の天井隅に、入り口付近の床を見下ろすように取り付けられたカメラには、窓から差し込む自然光が床材として使われた大理石で反射する様子や、中央に敷かれた鮮やかな模様の手織り絨毯が大写しになっている。","en":"As the man had said, the image showed the first-floor lobby of <tips=41>Grand Tower</tips>. The camera had been installed in a corner of the ceiling, looking down upon the floor near the entrance. Natural light from the windows gleamed on the marble, and a vividly patterned, handwoven carpet filled the center of the frame.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r266","rowIndex":266,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それだけなら、僕が毎日のように通り過ぎる部屋の景色だが、ドアの付近に、印象を全く変えてしまうものが映っているのである。","en":"Ordinarily, it would have been nothing more than the familiar room I passed through nearly every day. But something by the door transformed the scene completely.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r267","rowIndex":267,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　一言で言って血の海。","en":"In a word: a sea of blood.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r268","rowIndex":268,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　鮮血が絨毯と床に飛び散り、そのなかに塊がいくつか転がっている。それは人の腕だったり、胴体だったり、足……つまりそこには、バラバラに切断された人間の死体が映っているのだ。","en":"Fresh blood was spattered across the carpet and floor, and several lumps lay scattered amid it—human arms, a torso, legs. In other words, the screen showed a body that had been cut to pieces.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r269","rowIndex":269,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　切り離された腕や足には、死者が身につけていた黒いスーツの袖やズボンが着ていたときの形のまま、例えば手首のあたりからのぞく白いシャツまでも乱れがなく、とても鋭利な包丁で海苔巻きを切断したような印象だった。","en":"The black suit sleeves and trouser legs still held their shape around the severed limbs. Even the white shirt showing at the wrists remained perfectly neat. It looked as though an exceedingly sharp knife had sliced cleanly through a nori roll.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r270","rowIndex":270,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「門の方も、地下の駐車場も、人の出入りする場所のカメラには何も映っていないし、守っている連中も誰もやられていないんです。なのに、ロビーだけ、こんな……」","en":"“None of the cameras covering the gate, the underground parking garage, or any other entrance shows a thing. And none of the men guarding them have been attacked. But the lobby alone is... like this...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r271","rowIndex":271,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　最初に駆け足で僕らに報告してくれた男もこの部屋に戻っていて、そう説明してくれる。","en":"The man who had first run to alert us was back in the room, and it was he who explained.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r272","rowIndex":272,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「へえ、それはすごいね」","en":"“Huh. That’s impressive.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r273","rowIndex":273,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「見てよ<tips=2>阿亮</tips>。あれ、拳銃じゃない？　持ってた拳銃まで綺麗に切断されてるわ」","en":"“Look, <tips=2>Ah Leung</tips>. Isn’t that a pistol? Even the gun he was holding has been cut clean through.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r274","rowIndex":274,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=25>世傑</tips>が指さす黒い物体は、画面では小さく、確認がしにくかったが、確かに見ようによっては引き金の付け根あたりで真っ二つに切断されたオートマチックの拳銃のように見える。","en":"The black object <tips=25>Sai-kit</tips> indicated was small and difficult to make out on the screen. Seen a certain way, however, it did indeed resemble a semiautomatic pistol cut cleanly in two near the base of its trigger.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r275","rowIndex":275,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「こんなの見たことない。血の気が引いちゃうわ」","en":"“I’ve never seen anything like it. It makes my blood run cold.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r276","rowIndex":276,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=25>世傑</tips>は溜息をついて首を左右に振る。","en":"<tips=25>Sai-kit</tips> sighed and shook his head.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r277","rowIndex":277,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　画面上で遺体になっているのは、おそらくファン・ドゥック・フエ。","en":"The body on the screen was probably Phan Duc Hue.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r278","rowIndex":278,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>には、どのファミリーにも属さないで<tips=81>龍頭</tips>と直接契約して<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>自体に所属する形の組織員も多いが、彼もその一人で、先代の<tips=81>龍頭</tips>の前で入会の儀式を執り行って構成員となった人物だ。","en":"Many members of <tips=7>YS</tips> belonged to no family at all, but contracted directly with the <tips=81>Longtou</tips> and thereby joined <tips=7>YS</tips> itself. Phan was one of them, initiated into the organization in a ceremony before the former <tips=81>Longtou</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r279","rowIndex":279,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　この間結婚式のすぐ後に、まだ生きていた父を訪ねた時に僕を先導してくれた黒服である。","en":"He was the man in black who had guided me when I visited Father while he was still alive, immediately after the wedding.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r280","rowIndex":280,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　いつも一階ロビーに居て出入りする人間にうやうやしく礼をする人物で、あまりにその仕草が丁寧なので、一度訊ねてみたことがある。","en":"He was always in the first-floor lobby, bowing reverently to everyone who entered or left. His movements were so unfailingly courteous that I once asked him about them.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r281","rowIndex":281,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　すると、以前は他の街で小さなやくざ組織に所属していたと教えてくれた。","en":"He told me that he had once belonged to a small yakuza organization in another city.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r282","rowIndex":282,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　古い組織で、上下関係が厳しく、礼儀を一通り身につけさせられたのだと言う。その組織が経済的な事情で潰れ、流れるようにしてこの<tips=9>Y地区</tips>にやって来て、そしてこの街の女と結婚し、<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>に入ったのだそうだ。","en":"It had been an old-fashioned group with a rigid hierarchy, and they had drilled him in all the proper forms of etiquette. When financial difficulties forced the organization to fold, he drifted into <tips=9>Y District</tips>, married a local woman, and joined <tips=7>YS</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r283","rowIndex":283,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　家には小さな女の子とその弟がいると言う。","en":"He said there was a young girl and her little brother at home.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r284","rowIndex":284,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　このビルにやって来る時にはいつも目にする人物で、今日もここに上がってくるときに<tips=25>世傑</tips>と共に挨拶をしたばかりだ。","en":"I saw him whenever I came to the building. <tips=25>Sai-kit</tips> and I had exchanged greetings with him just moments ago on our way upstairs.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r285","rowIndex":285,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「彼が殺される瞬間の録画を再生出来る？」","en":"“Can you play the recording of the moment he was killed?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r286","rowIndex":286,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕が訊ねると、","en":"I asked.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r287","rowIndex":287,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「は、はい。今すぐ流します。……今から、ちょうど五分前の映像です」","en":"“Y-yes. I’ll play it at once. ...This is the feed from exactly five minutes ago.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r288","rowIndex":288,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　顔色は悪く、声も明らかに動揺していたが、前もって準備していてくれたらしく、監視役の男はすぐにその場面を再生したので、僕はその仕事ぶりに感心した。","en":"His face had gone pale and his voice was plainly shaken. He nevertheless seemed to have prepared in advance, for the surveillance operator replayed the scene at once, and I found myself impressed by his work.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r289","rowIndex":289,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「私も見たのですが、見直しても何が何やらわけがわからなくて……」","en":"“I watched it myself, but no matter how often I look, I cannot understand what happened...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r290","rowIndex":290,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　男がそう言った通り、すべてはあまりに一瞬のうちに起きてしまう。","en":"As he said, it all happened far too quickly.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r291","rowIndex":291,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　まず、いつもと同じようにファンがドアの側にぼんやりと立っている場面から始まる。そして次の瞬間には、彼のいた場所には別の人物が立っており、同時に手足は床の上に転がり、さらに画面外から血をふきながら彼の頭がついた胴体がふってくる。","en":"The recording began with Phan standing vacantly beside the door as usual. In the next instant, another person stood in his place. His arms and legs lay scattered across the floor, while his torso and attached head fell into the frame from above, spraying blood.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r292","rowIndex":292,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そこで、","en":"At that point,","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r293","rowIndex":293,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あっ」","en":"“Ah!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r294","rowIndex":294,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　と後ろで声をあげたのは、これまで黙っていた第二代<tips=81>龍頭</tips><tips=84>マイケル・ツェー</tips>。","en":"exclaimed the second <tips=81>Longtou</tips>, <tips=84>Michael Tse</tips>, from behind me. He had remained silent until then.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r295","rowIndex":295,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「これ、黒い服の女」","en":"“That's the woman in black.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r296","rowIndex":296,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼が画面を指さすとおり、血の海の上に立っているのは、だぶだぶの黒い服を着た細身の女であった。彼女はフードをかぶり、白い素足でファンの死体を踏みしめ、そしてぼんやり辺りを見回してから、ぴょんとジャンプをし、そしてそのまま着地を待たずに空中で消えてしまう。","en":"As he pointed out, a slender woman in loose black clothing stood amid the sea of blood. She wore a hood, her bare white feet planted on Phan's body. After looking vaguely around, she made a little hop and vanished in midair before she could come back down.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r297","rowIndex":297,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　小柄な背格好で、女というよりもむしろ少女と表現したほうが相応しく思える。","en":"She was so small that ‘girl’ seemed more appropriate than ‘woman.’","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r298","rowIndex":298,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「待ってよこれ。肝心の場面がカットされてるじゃないの？　女が殺すシーンと、女が去ってゆくシーン両方が映ってないわ」","en":"“Wait. The crucial parts have been cut out, haven’t they? The scene where she kills him and the scene where she leaves are both missing.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬世傑","displayName":"Ma Sai-kit","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r299","rowIndex":299,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=25>世傑</tips>が苦い顔をして言うと、男は首をふり、","en":"<tips=25>Sai-kit</tips> spoke with a bitter expression, but the man shook his head.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r300","rowIndex":300,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そう見えますが、これが何も編集していないリアルタイムの映像なんです」","en":"“It does look that way, but this is the unedited, real-time feed.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r301","rowIndex":301,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そう言いながら男は何度か繰り返して見せてくれたが、やはり、すべてが間のコマを何枚も抜き去ったような唐突さだ。","en":"As he spoke, he replayed the footage several times for us. But each time, the transition was just as abrupt, as though several frames in between were simply missing.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r302","rowIndex":302,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「な、なあこれ、<tips=27>廖志明</tips>が言ってた<tips=16>タイプA</tips>の女ってやつじゃないか？　あの、銅像をスッパリと切断した……」","en":"“I-isn’t that the <tips=16>Type A</tips> woman <tips=27>Liao Chi-ming</tips> told us about? The one who cut the bronze statue clean in two...?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"マイケル・ツェー","displayName":"Michael Tse","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r303","rowIndex":303,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=84>マイケル・ツェー</tips>が<tips=39>ジェフリー</tips>に囁くように尋ねる。","en":"<tips=84>Michael Tse</tips> whispered the question to <tips=39>Jeffrey</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r304","rowIndex":304,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「確かに、特徴は全く同じです」","en":"“The description matches exactly.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ジェフリー・ウォン","displayName":"Jeffrey Wong","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r305","rowIndex":305,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=39>ジェフリー</tips>は低い声でそうこたえる。","en":"<tips=39>Jeffrey</tips> answered in a low voice.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r306","rowIndex":306,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「こ、これがその<tips=16>タイプA</tips>だとしたら、私たちを殺しに来たってことか？　こんなわけのわからないものに、どう対応すればいいんだ？」","en":"“I-if this is that <tips=16>Type A</tips>, has she come to kill us? How can we possibly respond to something so incomprehensible?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"マイケル・ツェー","displayName":"Michael Tse","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r307","rowIndex":307,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その問いには、<tips=39>ジェフリー</tips>は返答をせず黙ったままだった。","en":"<tips=39>Jeffrey</tips> remained silent and offered no answer.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r308","rowIndex":308,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「この映像、スローに出来る？　問題の場面はコマ送りで」","en":"“Can you slow the recording down? Take us through the relevant moment frame by frame.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r309","rowIndex":309,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼らのやりとりをモニターに目を向けたまま背中で聞いていた僕は、男にそう注文した。","en":"Without taking my eyes off the monitor, I listened to their exchange behind me, then gave the operator my instructions.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r310","rowIndex":310,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　すると、彼はすぐにその通り再生をしてくれる。","en":"He immediately replayed it as I had requested.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r311","rowIndex":311,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「コマ送りでも、全く同じね……。これ、テレポーテーションってやつなの？」","en":"“Even frame by frame, it looks exactly the same... Is this what they call teleportation?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬世傑","displayName":"Ma Sai-kit","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r312","rowIndex":312,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=25>世傑</tips>は唇を噛む。","en":"<tips=25>Sai-kit</tips> bit his lip.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r313","rowIndex":313,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「こう、立ってる彼がいて、そのすぐ次のコマでもう同じ場所にこの女が現れている。すり替えたみたいに。でもすり替えたのは胴体だけで、ほら、このコマだとまだ腕は空中に浮いているし、足の太ももから下はもとどおり。……あれー胴体はどこへいったのかなって思いながら見ていると、次のコマからは腕は血を出しながら足元に落下しはじめ、足は自立を保てずに倒れる。そして、もう少しコマが進むと、画面の上の方から、なくなっていた胴体がおかえりなさいして……」","en":"“Here he is, standing there, and in the very next frame this woman has appeared in exactly the same spot. As though they changed places. But only his torso changed places. See? In this frame his arms are still suspended in the air, and both legs remain where they were from the thighs down. ...You find yourself wondering where the torso went. In the next frame, the arms begin falling to the floor and shedding blood, while the legs can no longer stand by themselves and collapse. Then, several frames later, the missing torso comes home to us from the top of the screen...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬世傑","displayName":"Ma Sai-kit","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r314","rowIndex":314,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=25>世傑</tips>は溜息をつき、","en":"<tips=25>Sai-kit</tips> sighed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r315","rowIndex":315,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=27>廖</tips>からきたメールの女だとしたら、ふらりと立ち寄った訳でもなくて、<tips=81>龍頭</tips>の命を狙いに来たわけでしょう？　こんなの、とても相手に出来ないわ。……ねえ、<tips=40>天明</tips>、あんたの能力でこの女の今の居場所はわかる？」","en":"“If she is the woman from <tips=27>Liao’s</tips> email, she didn’t simply drop in on a whim. She came for the <tips=81>Longtou’s</tips> life, didn’t she? We can’t possibly fight something like that. ...<tips=40>Tin-ming</tips>, can your ability locate her now?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬世傑","displayName":"Ma Sai-kit","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r316","rowIndex":316,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=40>天明</tips>は顔を横に振り、","en":"<tips=40>Tin-ming</tips> shook her head.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r317","rowIndex":317,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「すみません。私たちの力は、あくまでも人間の生命をぼんやりとした明かりとしてその場所を感知するだけなんです。個々を見分ける力はありません。いるはずのない場所の生命や、おかしな動きをしていないと、不審者を見分けることが出来ません。今回の襲撃は、近づいてくるのに全然気がつきませんでした。カメラに映ってからは、おそらくまだビルに居るはずのこの女をなんとか特定しようとしているんですが、ビルの下層は遠くて、人が多いから、どうも判別しにくくて……」","en":"“I’m sorry. Our power does nothing more than detect the location of human lives as vague lights. We cannot distinguish one person from another. We can only recognize an intruder when a life appears somewhere no one should be, or moves in an abnormal way. This time, we had no idea the attacker was approaching. Since she appeared on camera, we have been trying to identify the woman, who is probably still inside the building. But the lower floors are distant and crowded, and it is extremely difficult to distinguish her...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"黄天明","displayName":"Wong Tin-ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r318","rowIndex":318,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうなの……」","en":"“I see...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬世傑","displayName":"Ma Sai-kit","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r319","rowIndex":319,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　考え込んでしまう<tips=25>世傑</tips>にかわって<tips=39>ジェフリー</tips>が訊ねる。","en":"As <tips=25>Sai-kit</tips> lapsed into thought, <tips=39>Jeffrey</tips> took over the questioning.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r320","rowIndex":320,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=40>天明</tips>、中層には誰もいないか？」","en":"“<tips=40>Tin-ming</tips>, is there anyone on the middle floors?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ジェフリー・ウォン","displayName":"Jeffrey Wong","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r321","rowIndex":321,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=41>グランドタワー</tips>は最上階付近は<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>の幹部やその家族たちが住み、一階や地下の下層には各種施設や業者が店舗や住居を構えているが、その間となる中層はほとんど人が立ち入らない空き部屋ばかりになっている。","en":"The upper floors of <tips=41>Grand Tower</tips> housed the officers of <tips=7>YS</tips> and their families, while the ground floor and basement contained various facilities, shops, and residences. The middle floors between them, however, consisted almost entirely of vacant rooms into which hardly anyone ventured.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r322","rowIndex":322,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　これは利用するうちに自然とそうなったのか、先代に意図があって計画的に部屋を割り振ったのかはわからないが、もし何か不心得者が忍び込んだとしても、ここを通過する段階で<tips=40>黄姉妹</tips>が能力で発見出来るようになっている。","en":"I did not know whether the pattern had arisen naturally as the tower came into use or whether the former Longtou had deliberately assigned the rooms that way. In either case, it allowed the <tips=40>Wong sisters</tips> to spot anyone who slipped in as they passed through those floors.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r323","rowIndex":323,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「今のところ、誰もいません」","en":"“At present, no one.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"黄天明","displayName":"Wong Tin-ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r324","rowIndex":324,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうか。じゃあとりあえず下層に意識を集中してて欲しい。……さて、これはどう対応すべきか」","en":"“I see. Then for the moment, focus on the lower floors. ...Now, how should we respond to this?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ジェフリー・ウォン","displayName":"Jeffrey Wong","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r325","rowIndex":325,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=39>ジェフリー</tips>は腕組みをする。","en":"<tips=39>Jeffrey</tips> folded his arms.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r326","rowIndex":326,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まずさ、下層の人たちにアナウンスして、避難させたらどうかな？」","en":"“Why don’t we begin by making an announcement to the people downstairs and evacuating them?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r327","rowIndex":327,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕が提案すると、","en":"I suggested it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r328","rowIndex":328,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「下層には業者も多く、我々の指示が直接届くものばかりではありません。館内放送で伝えれば、相当の混乱が予想されますが……」","en":"“There are many outside businesses on the lower floors, and not everyone there is directly under our command. An announcement over the building's public-address system would cause considerable confusion...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ジェフリー・ウォン","displayName":"Jeffrey Wong","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r329","rowIndex":329,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「でも、このままじゃ<tips=40>天明</tips>たちがいても相手を見つけることが困難だよ。もっと人を減らさないと」","en":"“But as things stand, <tips=40>Tin-ming</tips> and Tin-cheung will have difficulty finding the attacker. We need to reduce the number of people down there.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r330","rowIndex":330,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……そうですね」","en":"“...Yes, that is true.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ジェフリー・ウォン","displayName":"Jeffrey Wong","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r331","rowIndex":331,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=39>ジェフリー</tips>がちらと<tips=81>龍頭</tips>の顔を見ると、","en":"<tips=39>Jeffrey</tips> glanced toward the <tips=81>Longtou</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r332","rowIndex":332,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「わ、私はかまわんが……」","en":"“I-I have no objection...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"マイケル・ツェー","displayName":"Michael Tse","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r333","rowIndex":333,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それならば、<tips=1>謝亮</tips>の言う通り、避難させましょう。それから上層にいる、我々の家族や、業務にあたっている部下たちにもすぐ指示を出したほうがいいでしょうね。家族はすぐに避難できるよう３０階のロビーに集合させる。部下たちには、武器を持ってこのモニタールーム前に集合させます」","en":"“Then we shall evacuate them, as <tips=1>Tse Leung</tips> suggests. We should also send immediate instructions to our families above and the men at work there. Have the families assemble in the thirtieth-floor lobby, prepared to evacuate at once. Order our men to collect their weapons and gather outside this monitor room.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ジェフリー・ウォン","displayName":"Jeffrey Wong","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r334","rowIndex":334,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼は緊張の面持ちでそう言うと、","en":"He issued the orders with a tense expression, then continued.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r335","rowIndex":335,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「さて、そして問題の侵入者にはどう対処すべきか……」","en":"“Now, the question is how to deal with the intruder herself...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ジェフリー・ウォン","displayName":"Jeffrey Wong","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r336","rowIndex":336,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=2>阿亮</tips>、何か作戦はないの？　アタシはこんな<tips=16>タイプA</tips>見たことないわよ」","en":"“<tips=2>Ah Leung</tips>, don’t you have a plan? I’ve never seen a <tips=16>Type A</tips> like this.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬世傑","displayName":"Ma Sai-kit","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r337","rowIndex":337,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=25>世傑</tips>が促すけれども、僕だってこんな相手は初めてだ。","en":"<tips=25>Sai-kit</tips> urged me on, but I had never faced anyone like her either.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r338","rowIndex":338,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まあ、一筋縄ではいかない感じだねえ」","en":"“Well, she doesn't look easy to handle.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r339","rowIndex":339,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕が腕組みして考えはじめると、","en":"I folded my arms and began to think.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r340","rowIndex":340,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=2>阿亮</tips>、いま我々はどうしたらいいんだろう？　サイキック？　こいつは一体何者なんだ？　私は、どうも、何がなんだかわからなくて混乱していて……」","en":"“<tips=2>Ah Leung</tips>, what are we supposed to do now? A psychic? What in the world is she? I... I don't understand any of this. I'm completely lost...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"マイケル・ツェー","displayName":"Michael Tse","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r341","rowIndex":341,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=81>龍頭</tips>が途方に暮れた顔で僕に尋ねる。","en":"The <tips=81>Longtou</tips> looked utterly at a loss as he appealed to me for an answer.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r342","rowIndex":342,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「僕に訊ねられたところで、映像からわかることしかわかりませんが。……とりあえず、みんなが見た通り、相手は<tips=16>タイプA</tips>です。能力は、さっき<tips=25>世傑</tips>が言ったようにテレポーテーション。いわゆる瞬間移動ってやつでしょう。……いや、もっと正確に言うなら、空間のスワップ能力とでも表現したほうがいいのかな」","en":"“Even if you ask me, all I know is what we can see in the footage. ...For now, as everyone saw, we're dealing with a <tips=16>Type A</tips>. Her ability is teleportation, just as <tips=25>Sai-kit</tips> said—what people call instantaneous movement. ...No. To be more precise, perhaps I should call it the ability to swap two regions of space.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r343","rowIndex":343,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「スワップ？」","en":"“Swap?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"マイケル・ツェー","displayName":"Michael Tse","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r344","rowIndex":344,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=81>龍頭</tips>は首をひねる。","en":"The <tips=81>Longtou</tips> tilted his head.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r345","rowIndex":345,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「空間と空間を交換するんですよ。自分とその周囲の空間を、目標となる空間の位置を入れ替えるから、結果として瞬間移動になる」","en":"“She exchanges one region of space for another. She swaps the position of her body and the space around it with the target region, producing what looks like instantaneous movement.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r346","rowIndex":346,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ものがすっぱり切れてしまうのはどういうことなんだ？」","en":"“Then why are objects cut cleanly apart?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"マイケル・ツェー","displayName":"Michael Tse","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r347","rowIndex":347,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「入れ替えが起きた場所と、入れ替えが起きずにその場に残ったものとの間で切断が起こるんです。……いまの映像で言うと……もう一度、コマ送りでお願い。……いや、もうちょっと前から。そうそう……」","en":"“The cut occurs along the boundary between the space that changed places and anything left behind. ...Using the recording we just saw... Please take us through it frame by frame again. ...No, begin a little earlier. Yes, there...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r348","rowIndex":348,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　画面にファンが断裂する瞬間の映像を表示させながら、僕は説明をする。","en":"I explained while the screen displayed the instant Phan came apart.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r349","rowIndex":349,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ここにファンが立っているでしょう？　このとき女はおそらくこの画面の外、天井辺りに居たはずです。そこから、このファンの胴体のあたりに能力を使う。……女の身体とその周囲の空間はこちらに移動し、かわりにファンの身体が天井付近に移動するけれど、女が小さかったため、手足は移動せずにこの場に残る……そして、画面から消えた胴体は天井付近に移動して居るわけだから、続く映像で画面の上から降って来る。これがバラバラ死体の製造方法ですね。実に素晴らしい」","en":"“Phan is standing here, you see? At this point the woman was probably outside the frame, somewhere near the ceiling. From there, she used her ability on the area around Phan’s torso. ...Her body and the space surrounding it moved here. Phan’s body moved near the ceiling in exchange, but because the woman was smaller than he was, his arms and legs did not move and remained behind. ...The torso that vanished from the frame had moved near the ceiling, and so, in the following images, it falls back into view from above. And that is how you make a dismembered corpse. Truly magnificent.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r350","rowIndex":350,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕はそこで黙って一同を振り返ったが、彼らは何も言わずにただ画面を見つめているので、僕は話を続けることにした。","en":"I fell silent and looked around at the others. They merely stared at the screen without speaking, so I decided to continue.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r351","rowIndex":351,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「しかし、こいつはやっかいなヤツだよ。……次はもうちょっと前まで映像を遡ってもらって……ほらこの場面、画面の左端に、黒いのが一瞬映るでしょ？　これ、女の服の端じゃないかな？　女は外からこのロビーに飛び込んだあと、一旦部屋の天井付近にジャンプしてるんだ。そして、そこからファンを攻撃している。そしてすぐにその場から消えた。画面で確認出来るだけでも四回能力を使っている」","en":"“This one is trouble. ...Now take the recording a little farther back. Look at this instant. Something black appears for a moment at the left edge of the screen, doesn’t it? Could that be the hem of her clothes? After entering the lobby from outside, she made one jump to a position near the ceiling. From there, she attacked Phan, then vanished again at once. We can confirm at least four uses of her ability from the recording alone.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r352","rowIndex":352,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……短い時間に連続して使用出来るなんて、凄い能力ね」","en":"“...An extraordinary ability, if she can use it repeatedly in so short a time.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬世傑","displayName":"Ma Sai-kit","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r353","rowIndex":353,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=25>世傑</tips>が感心したように言う。","en":"<tips=25>Sai-kit</tips> sounded impressed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r354","rowIndex":354,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「確かにそれもそうだけれど、攻撃の前にわざわざ一回移動を挟んでいるのが秀逸だよ。部屋に入ってきてのんびり相手を確認してから攻撃するんじゃなく、相手に攻撃されないよう、部屋に入ってすぐに細かい移動を一つ挟んでから相手の場所を確認し、攻撃してるんだ」","en":"“That is true. What is more impressive, however, is that she took the trouble to make one additional move before attacking. She did not enter the room, leisurely find her target, then strike. The instant she arrived, she made one short jump to prevent anyone from attacking her, used that position to locate her target, and only then struck.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r355","rowIndex":355,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なるほど」","en":"“I see.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬世傑","displayName":"Ma Sai-kit","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r356","rowIndex":356,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「冷静だし、手慣れてる。こんな見かけだけど、こいつはプロだな。……こういうヤツが、本拠地に一人で乗り込んで来るってのは、とんでもない自信があるんだろうね。いやんなっちゃうよ」","en":"“She's calm, and she's done this before. She may not look it, but she's a professional. ...If someone like her is willing to storm an enemy headquarters alone, she must be awfully confident. What a pain.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r357","rowIndex":357,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「うーん、<tips=27>廖</tips>から前に届いていたメールでは、街の怒りを代表するものだと名乗ったとかなんとか言っていたけれど、どうなのかしらね」","en":"“Hmm. <tips=27>Liao’s</tips> email claimed she called herself a representative of the city’s anger, or words to that effect. What do you make of that?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬世傑","displayName":"Ma Sai-kit","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r358","rowIndex":358,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まあ、適当なことを言ったんだろうと思うよ。こんな手慣れた殺し屋が街のなかにいてたまるか。<tips=27>廖</tips>が雇ったのかねえ。……<tips=27>廖</tips>に雇われるようなタマだとも思えないけど……。もしかして、すべてただの偶然じゃないか？　で、<tips=27>廖</tips>のメールとまるっきり関係ないのかもしれないよ？　ここに来たのも、ふらりと立ち寄っただけで、べつに<tips=81>龍頭</tips>の命を狙ってるわけじゃないのかもしれない。だとしたら、戦わないで済むかもしれない」","en":"“She probably just made something up. There's no way a killer this experienced has simply been roaming around the city. Did <tips=27>Liao</tips> hire her? ...Then again, she doesn't strike me as the sort who would work for <tips=27>Liao</tips>. ...Maybe the whole thing is a coincidence. She might have nothing whatsoever to do with <tips=27>Liao's</tips> email. Maybe she just wandered in and isn't here for the <tips=81>Longtou's</tips> life at all. If so, we might be able to avoid fighting her.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r359","rowIndex":359,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そんな偶然あるわけないでしょ」","en":"“There's no way that's all a coincidence.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬世傑","displayName":"Ma Sai-kit","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r360","rowIndex":360,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=25>世傑</tips>は冷静に否定する。","en":"<tips=25>Sai-kit</tips> calmly rejected the possibility.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r361","rowIndex":361,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「だよねえ」","en":"“No, I suppose not.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r362","rowIndex":362,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕が考え込んでしまうと、","en":"I fell silent, thinking it over.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r363","rowIndex":363,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「女の正体について色々と思うところがあるのはわかりますが、今はその詮索をしてる場面じゃありません。相手が何者にしろ、排除すべき侵入者なのは間違いがないのです。始末をしてから考えましょう」","en":"“I understand that you have questions about the woman’s identity, but this is not the time to pursue them. Whoever she may be, she is unquestionably an intruder who must be eliminated. We can think about her identity after we dispose of her.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ジェフリー・ウォン","displayName":"Jeffrey Wong","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r364","rowIndex":364,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうだけどさ」","en":"“Yes, but...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r365","rowIndex":365,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=39>ジェフリー</tips>の指摘に、僕は肩をすくめる。","en":"I shrugged at <tips=39>Jeffrey’s</tips> observation.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r366","rowIndex":366,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ここまで話したところで、さっそく指示した通りに上層にいる部下たちが廊下に到着したと報告が入った。","en":"Just then, word arrived that the men on the upper floors had assembled in the corridor as instructed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r367","rowIndex":367,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕はモニタールームのドアの外に並んだ彼らを確認する。","en":"I went to the monitor-room door and looked over the men assembled outside.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r368","rowIndex":368,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼らは総勢１５名。まだ到着していないものがもう、２、３人いるそうだ。","en":"There were fifteen in all. We were told that another two or three had not yet arrived.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r369","rowIndex":369,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼らの武器を調べると、ほとんどが拳銃のみを手にし、それ以外では警備担当のものが２人、小型のサブマシンガンを持っているだけだった。その他には、日本刀や青竜刀などの刃物を持って来ていたが、これは今回の敵には役に立たないだろう。倉庫にあったのは軍用のライフルが８丁で、拳銃が約３０丁、サブマシンガンが５丁。","en":"An inspection of their weapons showed that almost all carried only pistols. The sole exceptions were two guards with compact submachine guns. Others had brought Japanese swords, Chinese broadswords, and similar blades, but those would be of no use against this enemy. The armory held eight military rifles, approximately thirty pistols, and five submachine guns.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r370","rowIndex":370,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「天下の<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>の武器庫のわりにはおもちゃみたいな武器しかないんだね」","en":"“For the arsenal of the mighty <tips=7>YS</tips>, there's nothing here but toys.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r371","rowIndex":371,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕が言うと、","en":"I said.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r372","rowIndex":372,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「前は大物もたくさんあったらしいけれどねえ。昔相手の事務所にロケットランチャー打ち込んだ事件があったでしょ？　でも、ああいうのは警察と協定を結んだときに手放したんだって。今は、街のもめ事に使うならこれで充分だしねえ……」","en":"“Apparently they used to have plenty of heavy weapons. You remember the incident when they fired a rocket launcher into an enemy office, don’t you? They gave up things like that when they reached their agreement with the police. What we have now is more than enough for disputes within the city...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬世傑","displayName":"Ma Sai-kit","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r373","rowIndex":373,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=25>世傑</tips>は倉庫から持って来た拳銃の一つを懐に入れながら、","en":"<tips=25>Sai-kit</tips> slipped one of the pistols from the armory into his coat.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r374","rowIndex":374,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「もっとも、たとえミサイルがあったって、正体不明の能力をもった<tips=16>タイプA</tips>を相手にするのは気分がよくないわね。まったくもって、何をされるのかわからない」","en":"“Still, even if we had a missile, I wouldn't feel good about facing a <tips=16>Type A</tips> whose ability we don't understand. We have absolutely no idea what she might do to us.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬世傑","displayName":"Ma Sai-kit","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r375","rowIndex":375,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そう顔を顰める。","en":"He grimaced.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r376","rowIndex":376,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「同感だけど、お客さんの方から勝手に訪ねて来たんだから、今あるもので持て成さないといけないよ」","en":"“I agree. But the guest has chosen to call without an invitation, so we must entertain her with whatever we have.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r377","rowIndex":377,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「こんな状況じゃフルコースをご馳走するのは無理よ？」","en":"“Under these conditions, we can hardly offer her a full-course meal.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬世傑","displayName":"Ma Sai-kit","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r378","rowIndex":378,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それでも満足はさせるさ。シェフの腕の見せ所だ」","en":"“We'll satisfy her all the same. This is where the chef gets to show what he can do.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r379","rowIndex":379,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　すぐに僕たちが部屋に戻って<tips=81>龍頭</tips>と<tips=39>ジェフリー</tips>に状況を報告すると、彼らは彼らで今後の方策を話し合っていたようだ。","en":"When we returned to the room and reported the situation to the <tips=81>Longtou</tips> and <tips=39>Jeffrey</tips>, we found that they had been discussing their own course of action.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r380","rowIndex":380,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まず非戦闘員を避難させなければいけません。集まった女子供には護衛をつけ、出口へ向かって移動させます。避難ルートは、<tips=40>天明</tips>のレーダーを頼りにこちらから適宜指示するのがベストですね。そして残った我々が、この最上階で相手を待ち受けます。……この方針がベストでしょう」","en":"“We must evacuate the noncombatants first. Give the assembled women and children an escort and move them toward the exit. Relying on <tips=40>Tin-ming’s</tips> radar, we can redirect them as circumstances demand. Those of us who remain will await the adversary here on the top floor. ...That would appear to be our best course.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ジェフリー・ウォン","displayName":"Jeffrey Wong","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r381","rowIndex":381,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼の問いかけに、僕は頷く。","en":"I nodded in answer to his question.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r382","rowIndex":382,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「みんなで逃げるって手もあるわよ？」","en":"“We could all run away.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬世傑","displayName":"Ma Sai-kit","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r383","rowIndex":383,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=25>世傑</tips>が苦笑しながら言うが、","en":"<tips=25>Sai-kit</tips> offered the suggestion with a bitter smile.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r384","rowIndex":384,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「本当はそうしたいさ。けれど、ビルには大勢住んでいる。守らなくちゃいけない人々もいる。相手の目的はまだ定かじゃないが、仕留められるなら、それがベストだ」","en":"“Honestly, that's what I'd prefer. But a great many people live in this building, and some of them are ours to protect. We still don't know what the attacker wants, but if we can take her down, that would be best.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r385","rowIndex":385,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕が言うと、","en":"At my words, Sai-kit agreed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r386","rowIndex":386,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうね。それに、小娘一人にビルを捨てて全員で逃げたら、普段威張ってる<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>がって、みんなに笑われちゃうわ」","en":"“True. Besides, <tips=7>YS</tips> throws its weight around all the time. If every last one of us abandoned the building and ran from a single little girl, we'd be a laughingstock.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬世傑","displayName":"Ma Sai-kit","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r387","rowIndex":387,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=25>世傑</tips>が意見を翻して同調し、その言葉に<tips=81>龍頭</tips>が苦い顔をする。","en":"<tips=25>Sai-kit</tips> reversed his position. The <tips=81>Longtou’s</tips> expression turned bitter at his words.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r388","rowIndex":388,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そう言えば、<tips=4>馬明</tips>とか、ビルの外にいるメンバーには襲撃を報せたのかい？」","en":"“Speaking of which, have <tips=4>Ma Ming</tips> and the other members outside the building been informed of the attack?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r389","rowIndex":389,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「はい、最初の段階で。急行するとのことですが、間に合いはしないでしょう」","en":"“Yes, at the very beginning. They intend to hurry here, but they cannot possibly arrive in time.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ジェフリー・ウォン","displayName":"Jeffrey Wong","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r390","rowIndex":390,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「だろうね。それに、来ても被害者が増えるだけかもしれない」","en":"“I figured as much. Besides, if they come, we may only end up with more victims.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r391","rowIndex":391,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕は溜息をつき、<tips=39>ジェフリー</tips>がその通り部下に命じている間、手近なソファーに身を沈める。","en":"I sighed and sank onto the nearest sofa while <tips=39>Jeffrey</tips> issued the orders we had discussed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r392","rowIndex":392,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「さて、それではこの化け物をうまく迎撃する方法を考えようか。……そうだ<tips=40>天明</tips>、まだ相手の位置は特定出来ないかい？」","en":"“All right, let's figure out how to intercept this monster. ...<tips=40>Tin-ming</tips>, any luck locating her yet?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r393","rowIndex":393,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕が訊ねると、緊張のせいか、暑くもないのに首元がじっとりと汗ばんだ<tips=40>天明</tips>は首を横に振る。","en":"At my question, <tips=40>Tin-ming</tips> shook her head. From tension, perhaps, the skin around her neck was damp with sweat even though the room was not warm.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r394","rowIndex":394,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まだ下層は混乱していて、なんとも。通知は携帯電話にメールで送ったものですから、気がついていないものもいるかもしれません。……館内放送でアナウンスしますか？」","en":"“The lower floors remain in confusion, so we cannot say. We sent the evacuation notice by email to their mobile phones, and some may not have seen it. ...Should we make an announcement over the building’s system?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"黄天明","displayName":"Wong Tin-ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r395","rowIndex":395,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それはやめとこう。相手にも聞かれてしまうからね。こっちが対応してるってことをはっきり知られたくない。……なるべく多くの人が無事に逃げられればいいんだけれどね……」","en":"“No. The attacker would hear it too. I would rather not make it clear that we are responding to her presence. ...I only hope as many people as possible can escape safely...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r396","rowIndex":396,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　下層にいるのは<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>のメンバーだけではない。ビル内に店舗を構え、メンバー相手に営業を行うクリーニング屋、料理店、子供たちに勉強を教える教師など……彼らの多くはこういった非常事態には慣れていないだろうし、スムーズな行動も期待は出来ない。<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>のメンバーが誘導に当たっているはずだが、それでも、彼らがビルから去るのには、相当な時間がかかるだろう。","en":"The people on the lower floors were not limited to <tips=7>YS</tips> members. There were dry cleaners, restaurants, tutors who taught the children, and other businesses within the tower that served the organization’s people. Most would be unaccustomed to an emergency of this kind, and we could not expect them to move smoothly. <tips=7>YS</tips> members should have been guiding them, but even so, their departure from the building would take considerable time.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r397","rowIndex":397,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それよりも、あの女が中層に足を踏み入れて、それを<tips=40>天明</tips>たちが発見する方が先かもしれない。","en":"The woman might enter the middle floors and be detected by <tips=40>Tin-ming</tips> and Tin-cheung before the evacuation was complete.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r398","rowIndex":398,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕がソファーに座って考えている間、部屋の他の人々は女が殺す場面を繰り返し眺めて、あれこれと話し合っている。","en":"While I sat upon the sofa and considered the problem, the others replayed the woman’s killing again and again and debated what they saw.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r399","rowIndex":399,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……<tips=25>世傑</tips>君。この映像のスピードで連続的に瞬間移動してくる相手に銃弾を命中させることは可能ですか？」","en":"“...<tips=25>Sai-kit</tips>, do you think you could hit her with a bullet if she kept teleporting at the speed shown in this footage?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ジェフリー・ウォン","displayName":"Jeffrey Wong","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r400","rowIndex":400,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「とても自信がないわ」","en":"“I’m not remotely confident.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬世傑","displayName":"Ma Sai-kit","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r401","rowIndex":401,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=39>ジェフリー</tips>の質問に、彼は首を横に振る。","en":"He shook his head in answer to <tips=39>Jeffrey's</tips> question.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r402","rowIndex":402,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうですか。だとすれば、相手からの攻撃を防ぐのは不可能に近いということになりますね。……なら、こちらから攻撃する方が良いのでしょう。幸い、こちらには監視カメラと、<tips=40>天明</tips>たちの人間レーダーという優れた目があります。これを利用して先制攻撃するのが最善でしょうか……<tips=1>謝亮</tips>、どう思います？」","en":"“I see. In that case, defending against her attacks would be nearly impossible. ...Then perhaps it would be better for us to strike first. Fortunately, we have excellent eyes in the form of the surveillance cameras and the human radar provided by <tips=40>Tin-ming</tips> and her sister. Would our best course be to use them to launch a preemptive attack? ...What do you think, <tips=1>Tse Leung</tips>?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ジェフリー・ウォン","displayName":"Jeffrey Wong","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r403","rowIndex":403,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まあそうなんだけど、瞬間移動する相手に先制攻撃の機会を作るのが難しい」","en":"“Sure, but it'll be hard to get the drop on someone who can teleport.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r404","rowIndex":404,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それは確かに」","en":"“Indeed.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ジェフリー・ウォン","displayName":"Jeffrey Wong","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r405","rowIndex":405,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　先に攻撃出来るなら、それは確かに最良の手段かもしれない。しかし、いくら<tips=40>天明</tips>のレーダーがあっても、壁も天井も無視して移動する相手に先制攻撃を加えるのは、不可能とは言わないが非常に困難だ。外部から直接上層にテレポーテーションして来ずに、一階ロビーに姿を現した点からすると、敵の能力はそう遠くまで移動出来るものではないのかもしれないが、映像で見せたような短いジャンプで連続して上に移動してきたら、到底追いつけるものではない。","en":"If we could attack first, that might indeed be our best option. Yet even with <tips=40>Tin-ming's</tips> radar, launching a preemptive strike against an enemy who could move without regard for walls or ceilings would be extremely difficult—not impossible, perhaps, but close to it. The fact that she had appeared in the first-floor lobby instead of teleporting directly to the upper floors from outside might mean her ability could not carry her very far. But if she climbed through a rapid succession of short jumps like those in the footage, we could never keep up.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r406","rowIndex":406,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しかも、中途半端な形で遭遇すれば、それこそ銃で狙いを付けるよりも早く、一瞬にしてこちらが殺されてしまうのだ。","en":"And if we encountered her before we were fully prepared, she would kill us in an instant, before we could even bring a gun to bear.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r407","rowIndex":407,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まあ、<tips=16>タイプA</tips>の能力は使うと疲労するものらしいから、そう無制限に連続で瞬間移動出来るってわけでもないだろう。でも個人差があるからね。この相手が結局何回空間を飛ぶことが出来るかなんて、現段階ではまったくわからない」","en":"“Then again, using a <tips=16>Type A</tips> ability apparently causes fatigue, so she probably can't keep teleporting forever. But it varies from person to person. Right now, we have no idea how many jumps through space this particular opponent can manage.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r408","rowIndex":408,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「じゃあ、どうするのよ」","en":"“Then what are we going to do?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬世傑","displayName":"Ma Sai-kit","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r409","rowIndex":409,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうせかすなよ。慎みて軽速なるなかれ」","en":"“Don't rush me. Act with prudence, not haste.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r410","rowIndex":410,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「孫子かなにか？」","en":"“Is that Sun Tzu or something?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬世傑","displayName":"Ma Sai-kit","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r411","rowIndex":411,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「囲碁の格言。僕もいま一番良い方法を考えているんだ」","en":"“A Go proverb. I'm trying to figure out our best move too.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r412","rowIndex":412,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……ねえ、どうせここに来るには直通エレベーターと非常階段のどっちかしかないんだし、そこに何人か先回りさせておいたほうが良くないかしら？　ここで廊下に待機させているのは、無駄のような気がするのよ」","en":"“...Listen. The only ways up here are the express elevator and the emergency stairs. Wouldn’t it be better to send a few people ahead to cover them? Keeping everyone waiting in this corridor feels like a waste.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬世傑","displayName":"Ma Sai-kit","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r413","rowIndex":413,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=25>世傑</tips>もやはり危機を感じているらしく、いつも以上に緊迫した面持ちだった。","en":"<tips=25>Sai-kit</tips> plainly sensed the danger as well. His expression was more tense than usual.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r414","rowIndex":414,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それは分かるけど、何の策もなくただ待ち受けるってのは、賢い選択かな？」","en":"“I understand your point, but is simply lying in wait without any plan really a wise choice?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r415","rowIndex":415,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いや、<tips=25>世傑</tips>の言うことは一理あります」","en":"“No. There is merit in <tips=25>Sai-kit’s</tips> suggestion.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ジェフリー・ウォン","displayName":"Jeffrey Wong","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r416","rowIndex":416,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　黙って聞いていた<tips=39>ジェフリー</tips>が口を挟んだ。","en":"<tips=39>Jeffrey</tips>, who had listened in silence, interjected.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r417","rowIndex":417,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「幸い、ライフルがいくつかあります。どこか見通しのいい通路に使えるやつを配置して、相手の視界の外からの狙撃を行わせましょう」","en":"“Fortunately, we have several rifles. Let us station our best shots somewhere with a clear view down a corridor and have them snipe the intruder from outside her field of vision.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ジェフリー・ウォン","displayName":"Jeffrey Wong","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r418","rowIndex":418,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　能力のよくわからない<tips=16>タイプA</tips>に対して、ライフルなどの射程の長い武器で遠くから狙うというのは、いつの場合でもきわめて有効だ。","en":"Against a <tips=16>Type A</tips> whose ability we did not fully understand, attacking from a distance with a long-range weapon such as a rifle was generally an extremely effective approach.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r419","rowIndex":419,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「悪くはないけれど……」","en":"“It is not a bad idea, but...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r420","rowIndex":420,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　今回の場合、もっと他に良い方法があるような気がする。","en":"But in this particular case, I had a feeling there was a better way.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r421","rowIndex":421,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しかし、漠然とした感覚のようなもので、うまく言葉にすることが出来なかった。","en":"It was nothing more than a vague impression, however, and I could not put it properly into words.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r422","rowIndex":422,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「誰か、ライフルの扱いに特に自信があるものを五人くらい選んで……」","en":"“Choose approximately five men who are particularly confident with a rifle and...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ジェフリー・ウォン","displayName":"Jeffrey Wong","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r423","rowIndex":423,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕の言葉を待たず、<tips=39>ジェフリー</tips>が部下に言いかけたところで、","en":"Without waiting for me, <tips=39>Jeffrey</tips> had begun to give the order when—","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r424","rowIndex":424,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「「あっ、今……」」","en":"“Ah—just now...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"黄天明","displayName":"Wong Tin-ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r425","rowIndex":425,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=40>天明</tips>と<tips=40>天祥</tips>の姉妹が声を揃えた。","en":"<tips=40>Tin-ming</tips> and <tips=40>Tin-cheung</tips> cried out in unison.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r426","rowIndex":426,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どうした？　何かあったか？」","en":"“What is it? Did something happen?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ジェフリー・ウォン","displayName":"Jeffrey Wong","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r427","rowIndex":427,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=39>ジェフリー</tips>が鋭く訊ねると、<tips=40>天明</tips>が説明をする。","en":"At <tips=39>Jeffrey’s</tips> sharp question, <tips=40>Tin-ming</tips> explained.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r428","rowIndex":428,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「か、下層で避難中の集団に変化がありました。二階のロビー付近の通路で、それまでスムーズに移動していた集団が突然パニックを起こしています」","en":"“S-something changed in one of the groups evacuating below. A group that had been moving smoothly through the corridor near the second-floor lobby suddenly panicked.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"黄天明","displayName":"Wong Tin-ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r429","rowIndex":429,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「襲撃を受けたのか？」","en":"“Were they attacked?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r430","rowIndex":430,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕はそう訊ねる。","en":"I asked her.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r431","rowIndex":431,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そのようですが……だれか死んだかどうかは、混乱のせいで、正確に判別することが出来ません……」","en":"“It appears so... But with the confusion, we cannot determine precisely whether anyone has died...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"黄天明","displayName":"Wong Tin-ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r432","rowIndex":432,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「場所は？」","en":"“Where?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r433","rowIndex":433,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「おそらく、２１２号室周辺の廊下だと思います」","en":"“I believe it is the corridor near Room 212.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"黄天明","displayName":"Wong Tin-ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r434","rowIndex":434,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうか」","en":"“I see.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ジェフリー・ウォン","displayName":"Jeffrey Wong","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r435","rowIndex":435,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=39>ジェフリー</tips>は頷き、","en":"<tips=39>Jeffrey</tips> nodded.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r436","rowIndex":436,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「二階の監視カメラで探しましょう。切り換えを頼む」","en":"“Let’s search with the second-floor surveillance cameras. Change the feed.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ジェフリー・ウォン","displayName":"Jeffrey Wong","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r437","rowIndex":437,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「はい」","en":"“Yes.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r438","rowIndex":438,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=39>ジェフリー</tips>の命令の前からすでにその行動に取りかかっていたらしく、画面はすぐに切り替わる。","en":"The surveillance operator appeared to have begun even before <tips=39>Jeffrey</tips> gave the order, for the picture changed at once.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r439","rowIndex":439,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　案の定、その廊下も血にまみれていた。","en":"As expected, that corridor too was covered in blood.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r440","rowIndex":440,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　床には先ほどのファンと同じようなバラバラ死体が散らばり、その血だまりのなかに黒衣の少女が立っている。","en":"Dismembered bodies like Phan’s were scattered across the floor, and the girl in black stood amid their blood.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r441","rowIndex":441,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「画面に映ってる遺体は男二人と、女一人分だけだな。この場所にいたのはこれだけ？」","en":"“The remains on the screen account for two men and one woman. Were they the only people there?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r442","rowIndex":442,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　バラバラ死体の手足の数をかぞえてから僕はそう訊ねる。","en":"I asked after counting the arms and legs among the scattered remains.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r443","rowIndex":443,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いえ、１０人程度はいました。唯一現場にのこった生命以外は、みな離れたようです」","en":"“No. There were approximately ten. Except for one life remaining at the scene, all the others have moved away.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r444","rowIndex":444,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「出会った相手を皆殺しにするってわけでもないんだね。やろうと思えば出来るんだろうけど」","en":"“Then she does not necessarily kill everyone she encounters. I imagine she could if she wished.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r445","rowIndex":445,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　死体の上に立ち、廊下の向こうがわ……おそらく家族が逃げていった方向をぼんやりとながめている少女の後ろ姿を見ながら、僕はそう呟く。","en":"I murmured the observation while watching the girl’s back as she stood upon the bodies and stared vacantly down the corridor—probably in the direction the family members had fled.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r446","rowIndex":446,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そこでモニタールームの電話が鳴った。すぐに部下の一人がとると、今まさに襲撃を受けた家族からのものだったので、通話をスピーカーに切り換える。","en":"The monitor-room telephone rang, and one of the men answered at once. When it proved to be a call from the family group that had just been attacked, he put it on speaker.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r447","rowIndex":447,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"『きゅ、きゅうにっ、血を噴いて倒れてっ……』","en":"‘S-suddenly, they sprayed blood and fell—’","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r448","rowIndex":448,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　動揺に取り乱す女の声が、生々しい当事者の感覚をモニタールームの静まりかえった空間に呼び起こす。","en":"The frantic woman’s voice brought the raw immediacy of the event into the silent monitor room.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r449","rowIndex":449,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　今回襲撃を受けたのは、下層に住む<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>メンバーの家族たちだったらしい。避難途中で不幸にも敵に遭遇し、命を落としてしまったのだ。","en":"The group attacked this time appeared to have consisted of the families of <tips=7>YS</tips> members living on the lower floors. They had encountered the enemy during their evacuation, and some had lost their lives in the attack.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r450","rowIndex":450,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=39>ジェフリー</tips>はそれをなだめつつ、彼女に別の退避ルートを指示するよう部下に命じた。","en":"<tips=39>Jeffrey</tips> soothed the caller while ordering a subordinate to direct her toward another evacuation route.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r451","rowIndex":451,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そのやりとりをしている間にも、画面上の少女には動きがある。","en":"Even as he did so, the girl on the screen began to move.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r452","rowIndex":452,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女は血だまりから抜け出すと、廊下になすりつけるようにして裸足の足の裏の血を拭い、そして袖で顔にかかった返り血を拭き取るなどという行為をしていたのだが、不意に床の上に膝をついて、うなだれた。","en":"She stepped out of the pool of blood, wiped the soles of her bare feet against the corridor floor as though smearing it there, and used her sleeve to clean the spattered blood from her face. Then, without warning, she sank to her knees and bowed her head.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r453","rowIndex":453,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ど、どうしたんだ？　具合でも悪くなったのか？　急な腹痛とか……」","en":"“W-what's wrong with her? Is she feeling sick? A sudden stomachache, perhaps...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r454","rowIndex":454,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　もちろん<tips=81>龍頭</tips>は期待してそう言ったのだろうけれども、声の響きが体調を心配しているようにも聞こえておかしかった。","en":"Naturally, the <tips=81>Longtou</tips> was only voicing the hope that something had incapacitated her. But the concern in his voice made it sound as though he were genuinely worried about her health, which I found amusing.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r455","rowIndex":455,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「これ、祈っているのよ」","en":"“She is praying.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r456","rowIndex":456,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=25>世傑</tips>が言うとおり、胸の前で手を組み、唇を小さく動かしている少女の様子は、神に向かって祈りを捧げているようにも見えた。","en":"As <tips=25>Sai-kit</tips> said, the girl clasped her hands before her chest and moved her lips faintly, as though offering a prayer to God.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r457","rowIndex":457,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「懺悔の祈りでもしてるのかな。殺人マシーンじみた手際のよさで人を殺しておいて、信心深いもんだな」","en":"“Maybe she's praying for forgiveness. She kills people like some kind of murder machine, and yet she's so devout.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r458","rowIndex":458,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕がそう呟くと、<tips=25>世傑</tips>は呆れたように溜息をつき、","en":"At my murmur, <tips=25>Sai-kit</tips> gave an exasperated sigh.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r459","rowIndex":459,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あら、<tips=2>阿亮</tips>も案外不勉強ね。これが人間ってものよ。どんな人間だって、どんなに慣れたって、心に何か特別な支えがなければ殺人なんて続けていけないわ」","en":"“My, <tips=2>Ah Leung</tips>, you've got more to learn than I thought. That's what it means to be human. No matter who you are or how used to killing you become, you can't keep doing it without something special to hold you up inside.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r460","rowIndex":460,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それは体験談かい？」","en":"“Is that from personal experience?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r461","rowIndex":461,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうよ」","en":"“I do.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r462","rowIndex":462,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「案外ヒューマニストなんだね」","en":"“You are more of a humanist than I expected.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r463","rowIndex":463,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「当然だわ。人を殺せば誰でもそうなる」","en":"“Naturally. Killing does that to everyone.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r464","rowIndex":464,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　断言する<tips=25>世傑</tips>に対して僕は苦笑し、","en":"<tips=25>Sai-kit</tips> said it flatly, and I gave a wry smile.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r465","rowIndex":465,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どういう事情があるにしろ、誰かを殺すたびに、のんびり祈りを捧げてくれるんならありがたい話だ」","en":"“Whatever her circumstances, if she takes her time praying whenever she kills someone, that is excellent news.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r466","rowIndex":466,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そう話し合う僕らをよそに、<tips=39>ジェフリー</tips>と<tips=81>龍頭</tips>も言葉を交わす。","en":"While we talked, <tips=39>Jeffrey</tips> and the <tips=81>Longtou</tips> exchanged words of their own.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r467","rowIndex":467,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「とにかく、これはチャンスですね。誰か近くに武器を持ったものはいないか？　今なら無防備です。攻撃をするチャンスでしょう」","en":"“In any event, this is an opportunity. Is there anyone armed nearby? She is defenseless now. This is our chance to attack.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r468","rowIndex":468,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=39>ジェフリー</tips>は早速部下に命じて手配するが、しかし、奇襲を加える時間はないようだった。","en":"<tips=39>Jeffrey</tips> immediately ordered his men to arrange it, but there appeared to be no time for a surprise attack.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r469","rowIndex":469,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　画面のなかの少女は祈りをやめ、立ち上がっていた。そしてぴょんと跳躍すると、空中で消えてしまうのである。","en":"The girl on the screen had ended her prayer and risen. She gave a little jump and vanished in midair.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r470","rowIndex":470,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=40>天明</tips>」","en":"“<tips=40>Tin-ming</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r471","rowIndex":471,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕が短くその名を呼ぶ。","en":"I called her name curtly.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r472","rowIndex":472,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「廊下の生命反応は消えて、西方向に新しい反応があらわれました。ロビー付近に移動したと思われます」","en":"“The life response in the corridor has disappeared, and a new response has appeared to the west. I believe she moved near the lobby.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"黄天明","displayName":"Wong Tin-ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r473","rowIndex":473,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その言葉を受けて、モニターを操作する部下は、誰かの指示を待つまでもなく画面を切り換える。","en":"At those words, the man operating the monitors changed the feed without waiting for anyone’s command.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r474","rowIndex":474,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ファンが殺された部屋の真上に当たる二階ロビーのカメラは、四つ並ぶエレベーターのドアを見下ろす形で設置されていた。","en":"The camera in the second-floor lobby, directly above the room where Phan had been killed, looked down upon four elevator doors standing in a row.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r475","rowIndex":475,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　少女は画面端からとことこと歩いてきて、そのドアの並ぶ前に立つと、ぴょんと飛び、そして姿を消した。<tips=40>黄姉妹</tips>のレーダーによると、エレベータールーム内部で目まぐるしく移動をしたようだ。そしてまた、監視カメラの映し出す風景のなかに現れる。","en":"The girl pattered into view from the edge of the screen and stopped before the doors. She jumped, then vanished. According to the <tips=40>Wong sisters</tips>’ radar, she moved about the inside of the elevator room at a dizzying pace before reappearing on camera.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r476","rowIndex":476,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ビルの警備システムをチェックしていた部下の報告によると、彼女はエレベーターのケーブルを切断し、使えなくしたらしい。","en":"A subordinate inspecting the building’s security systems reported that she appeared to have severed the elevator cables, disabling them.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r477","rowIndex":477,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「我々を逃がさないつもりか」","en":"“Does she intend to prevent our escape?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"マイケル・ツェー","displayName":"Michael Tse","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r478","rowIndex":478,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=81>龍頭</tips>が渋い顔で言い、","en":"The <tips=81>Longtou</tips> said with a grimace.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r479","rowIndex":479,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「網に追い込まれた魚になったような気分ね」","en":"“I feel like a fish being driven into a net.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬世傑","displayName":"Ma Sai-kit","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r480","rowIndex":480,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=25>世傑</tips>が肩をすくめる。","en":"<tips=25>Sai-kit</tips> shrugged.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r481","rowIndex":481,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「とりあえず、こいつの用件は最上層の僕らだってのははっきりした。もてなしの準備をしなくちゃね」","en":"“At least it is clear that we on the top floor are the ones she came for. We had better prepare to entertain her.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r482","rowIndex":482,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　少女はエレベーターの前を少しうろうろした後、また軽くジャンプをして、瞬間移動をした。今度は二つ上の階へと移動したようだ。","en":"The girl wandered for a moment before the elevators, then gave another light jump and teleported. This time she appeared to have moved two floors upward.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r483","rowIndex":483,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　どうも、計画性があるのかないのかよくわからない。移動の仕方を見ていると無駄が多く、ビルの構造などをあらかじめ把握して来たわけでもなさそうだ。","en":"I could not decide whether she had a plan. Her movements were remarkably inefficient, and it did not appear that she had studied the building’s structure in advance.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r484","rowIndex":484,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　エレベーターを破壊したのも、予定された行動ではなく、目の前にあったからなんとなく破壊したように思える。最初から使用不可能にするつもりなら、一階ロビーでファンを殺傷した時点でそうしていたはずだ。","en":"Even the destruction of the elevators looked less like a planned action than something she had done because they happened to be in front of her. Had she intended from the beginning to make them unusable, she should have done so when she attacked Phan in the first-floor lobby.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r485","rowIndex":485,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　家族と出会った時も、中途半端に殺しているが、あれも意味がわからない。戦闘力がある男だけを狙ったようにも見えるが、本当に警戒するなら女だからといって他を逃がすのは甘いし、戦闘したくないなら最初から避けるのも容易なはずだ。","en":"Nor could I understand why she had killed only some of the family group she encountered. She appeared to have targeted the men capable of fighting. Yet if she were truly cautious, sparing the others merely because they were women would be naive. If she wished to avoid combat, she could easily have avoided the entire group from the beginning.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r486","rowIndex":486,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　戦い方だけは手慣れているが、行動はどうも行き当たりばったりだ。","en":"Her fighting was practiced; everything else she did seemed improvised.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r487","rowIndex":487,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　慣れてはいても、所詮小娘ということなのだろうか？　戦闘能力が高すぎるから、綿密に計画を立てたりしないでもやってこれたのかもしれない。","en":"Perhaps, for all her experience, she was merely a young girl. Or perhaps her ability was so overwhelming that she had never needed to plan in detail.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r488","rowIndex":488,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「少し迷っているのかどうか、うろうろしてはいますが、やはりこっちへ向かおうとはしているようですね」","en":"“She's wandering around a little, as though she might be lost, but she does seem to be trying to make her way toward us.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"黄天明","displayName":"Wong Tin-ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r489","rowIndex":489,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=40>天明</tips>が少女の位置を報告するのを聞きながら、<tips=39>ジェフリー</tips>はそう呟く。","en":"<tips=39>Jeffrey</tips> murmured the observation as he listened to <tips=40>Tin-ming</tips> report the girl’s position.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r490","rowIndex":490,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「この子、随分のんびりしてるわね。アタシたちが襲撃に気がついてないとでも思ってるのかしら？」","en":"“This child is taking her time. Does she imagine we haven’t noticed the attack?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬世傑","displayName":"Ma Sai-kit","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r491","rowIndex":491,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=25>世傑</tips>が首をひねる。","en":"<tips=25>Sai-kit</tips> tilted his head.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r492","rowIndex":492,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「普通のビルだったらそう思うかもしれないけど、ここは僕らの本拠地なんだよ？　監視カメラにもばっちり映ってるし、いくらなんでもそこまで何も考えていないとは……」","en":"“She might believe that in an ordinary building, but this is our headquarters. The surveillance cameras have captured her perfectly. Surely she cannot be quite that thoughtless...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r493","rowIndex":493,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ないとは言い切れないわ。だって子供なのよ」","en":"“We can't rule it out. She's a child, after all.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬世傑","displayName":"Ma Sai-kit","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r494","rowIndex":494,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「こいつをただの子供だと思うのは危険じゃないか？　確かにうかつというか、仕事が雑な気はするけれど……」","en":"“Isn’t it dangerous to assume she is just a child? Granted, she does seem careless—or at least sloppy about her work...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r495","rowIndex":495,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕もそこはどうも自信がなかったが、","en":"I was not entirely sure of that myself, but—","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r496","rowIndex":496,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まあとにかく、このあたりでダラダラしてくれているなら今がタイミングかな？　家族を下ろせそうじゃないか。<tips=39>ジェフリー</tips>、そう思わない？」","en":"“In any case, if she is going to keep dawdling around here, this may be our chance. It looks as though we can get the families downstairs. Don’t you agree, <tips=39>Jeffrey</tips>?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r497","rowIndex":497,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「同感です」","en":"“I do.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ジェフリー・ウォン","displayName":"Jeffrey Wong","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r498","rowIndex":498,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=39>ジェフリー</tips>は頷き、<tips=81>龍頭</tips>の許可を得ると、早速その指示を出した。","en":"<tips=39>Jeffrey</tips> nodded. Once he had obtained the <tips=81>Longtou’s</tips> permission, he immediately issued the order.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r499","rowIndex":499,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　相手は下層からエレベーターを使わずに、徒歩と瞬間移動を交えながら階を上がってきている。","en":"The adversary was ascending from the lower floors through a combination of walking and teleportation, without using the elevators.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r500","rowIndex":500,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　上層で待機している家族たちは上層エレベーターで下りられる一番低い階の１５階までまず下りる。下層エレベーターは破壊されてしまったから、その先は、少女とはなるべく離れた階段を使う。","en":"The families waiting above would first take the upper-floor elevator down to the fifteenth floor, the lowest it could reach. The lower-floor elevators had been destroyed, so from there they would use whichever stairwell kept them farthest from the girl.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r501","rowIndex":501,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　少女は行ったり来たりしながら不規則に進んでいるから正確な予測は難しいが、階段で１階か２階下りた辺りですれ違うことになるだろう。狭い階段を移動している最中に出会ってしまえば凄惨なことになるのは間違いないが、ビルの構造を知り、<tips=40>黄姉妹</tips>の目がある我々ならば、遭遇することなく、やりすごせる公算が高い。","en":"Her erratic back-and-forth progress made a precise prediction difficult, but we would likely pass one another after the families had descended a floor or two by the stairs. If they encountered her in the narrow stairwell, the result would unquestionably be gruesome. With our knowledge of the building and the <tips=40>Wong sisters</tips>' sight, however, there was a good chance we could guide them past without an encounter.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r502","rowIndex":502,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　準備が整ったところで、","en":"Once the preparations were complete,","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r503","rowIndex":503,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「よし、じゃあ、<tips=81>龍頭</tips>と<tips=39>ジェフリー</tips>は<tips=40>天明</tips>たちを連れてみんなを誘導してくれ」","en":"“Good. <tips=81>Longtou</tips>, <tips=39>Jeffrey</tips>, take <tips=40>Tin-ming</tips> and the others and direct everyone.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r504","rowIndex":504,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　と僕は言った。","en":"I said.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r505","rowIndex":505,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=39>ジェフリー</tips>は僕の分担が気にいらないらしく露骨に顔を顰める。僕はそれを無視して、言葉を続ける。","en":"<tips=39>Jeffrey</tips> plainly disliked the assignment I had given him and frowned openly. I ignored him and continued.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r506","rowIndex":506,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ここは僕と<tips=25>世傑</tips>が受け持とう。そして、僕らがあの<tips=16>タイプＡ</tips>を迎え撃つ」","en":"“<tips=25>Sai-kit</tips> and I will hold this position. We'll intercept that <tips=16>Type A</tips> ourselves.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r507","rowIndex":507,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=1>謝亮</tips>」","en":"“<tips=1>Tse Leung</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ジェフリー・ウォン","displayName":"Jeffrey Wong","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r508","rowIndex":508,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=39>ジェフリー</tips>は苦々しく僕を咎める。","en":"<tips=39>Jeffrey</tips> rebuked me bitterly.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r509","rowIndex":509,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「言いたいことはわかる。でも、どうか言うことを聞いてくれ」","en":"“I know what you want to say. But please, just do as I ask.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r510","rowIndex":510,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ねえ、勝手に居残り組に入れられたアタシの意見は聞いてくれないの？」","en":"“Hey, aren’t you going to ask what I think before volunteering me for the group staying behind?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬世傑","displayName":"Ma Sai-kit","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r511","rowIndex":511,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そこで<tips=25>世傑</tips>が口を挟むが、","en":"<tips=25>Sai-kit</tips> interjected.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r512","rowIndex":512,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「きみは僕の部下じゃないか」","en":"“You are my subordinate, aren’t you?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r513","rowIndex":513,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕が言うと、いやそうに顔にしわを浮かべる。","en":"At my answer, he grimaced in distaste.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r514","rowIndex":514,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「今回ばかりはその意見を通すわけには行きません。個人的な手柄をあげたいのなら、もう<tips=26>劉建志</tips>の件で充分です。自重してください」","en":"“This time, I cannot allow you to have your way. If you're after personal glory, what you did with <tips=26>Ryu Kenshi</tips> was more than enough. Exercise some restraint.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ジェフリー・ウォン","displayName":"Jeffrey Wong","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r515","rowIndex":515,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうだとも」","en":"“That's right.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"マイケル・ツェー","displayName":"Michael Tse","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r516","rowIndex":516,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=81>龍頭</tips>が珍しく語気を強くして同調する。","en":"For once, the <tips=81>Longtou</tips> spoke forcefully as he backed him up.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r517","rowIndex":517,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「形式としていまは私が<tips=81>龍頭</tips>の座を務めさせて貰っているが、本当の後継者はお前なのだぞ。お前こそ、みなとともに避難しなくてはならないのだ」","en":"“Formally, I have been allowed to serve as <tips=81>Longtou</tips> for the present. But you are the true successor. You, more than anyone, must evacuate with the others.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"マイケル・ツェー","displayName":"Michael Tse","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r518","rowIndex":518,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼は僕をまっすぐと見つめる。","en":"He looked directly into my eyes.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r519","rowIndex":519,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「逆に私は、形式的でも<tips=81>龍頭</tips>である以上は、部下を捨てて逃げることなど出来ない。ここに残る」","en":"“And precisely because I am the <tips=81>Longtou</tips>, even if only in name, I cannot abandon my subordinates and flee. I will remain here.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"マイケル・ツェー","displayName":"Michael Tse","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r520","rowIndex":520,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　と<tips=81>龍頭</tips>が勇気を示してみせたが、","en":"The <tips=81>Longtou</tips> made a brave show of it, but—","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r521","rowIndex":521,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いや、<tips=81>龍頭</tips>も<tips=1>謝亮</tips>と一緒に避難してください」","en":"“No. You must evacuate with <tips=1>Tse Leung</tips>, <tips=81>Longtou</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ジェフリー・ウォン","displayName":"Jeffrey Wong","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r522","rowIndex":522,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=39>ジェフリー</tips>にぴしゃりと言われてしまう。","en":"<tips=39>Jeffrey</tips> shut him down with a curt reply.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r523","rowIndex":523,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「しかし、私は……」","en":"“But I...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"マイケル・ツェー","displayName":"Michael Tse","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r524","rowIndex":524,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=81>龍頭</tips>はなおも何か言いたげだった、<tips=39>ジェフリー</tips>はそれを遮って、","en":"The <tips=81>Longtou</tips> still appeared to have something to say, but <tips=39>Jeffrey</tips> interrupted him.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r525","rowIndex":525,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ここには私と私の部下が残ります」","en":"“My men and I will remain here.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ジェフリー・ウォン","displayName":"Jeffrey Wong","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r526","rowIndex":526,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そう断言した。","en":"He declared it flatly.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r527","rowIndex":527,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「何を言ってるんだ。相手は未知の<tips=16>タイプＡ</tips>なんだよ？　ここは僕の方がずっと……」","en":"“What are you talking about? We're dealing with an unknown <tips=16>Type A</tips>. I'm far better suited to this—”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r528","rowIndex":528,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そういう喧嘩の経験がある。だから、こういう場面では絶対に譲りたくはないのだが、","en":"I'd fought battles like this before. In a situation like this, I absolutely refused to back down. But—","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r529","rowIndex":529,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=2>阿亮</tips>、それはいかん。これは<tips=81>龍頭</tips>命令だ。お前はおりるのだ。お前が正当な後継者なんだぞ」","en":"“<tips=2>Ah Leung</tips>, that will not do. This is an order from the <tips=81>Longtou</tips>. You are leaving. You are the rightful successor.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"マイケル・ツェー","displayName":"Michael Tse","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r530","rowIndex":530,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=81>龍頭</tips>は、はっきりとそう言って僕の肩をつかんだ。","en":"The <tips=81>Longtou</tips> stated it plainly and took hold of my shoulder.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r531","rowIndex":531,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼だってこの業界ではそれなりの立場がある人間なのだ。先代の血縁とは言え、この間まで街を出て好き勝手やっていた僕に、そこまで言う、その心情は察するに余り有った。","en":"He had a position of some standing in this world himself. Blood relative of the former Longtou or not, until just the other day I'd been off doing as I pleased outside the city. I understood all too well what he must be feeling to go that far for me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r532","rowIndex":532,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕は思わず黙ってしまう。","en":"I fell silent despite myself.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r533","rowIndex":533,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「何でもいいから、早くきめてよ！　自分が残る、自分が残るって言い争ってるうちに、家族は逃げ遅れて、結局全員で居残ることになるわ」","en":"“I don't care who stays—just decide already! If you keep arguing, ‘I'm staying,’ ‘No, I'm staying,’ the families will miss their chance to escape, and then we'll all be stuck here.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬世傑","displayName":"Ma Sai-kit","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r534","rowIndex":534,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=25>世傑</tips>がせかすのももっともだ。","en":"<tips=25>Sai-kit</tips> was right to urge me on.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r535","rowIndex":535,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ここは私が決定します。私にはその権利があります。抗命は許しません」","en":"“I will decide this matter. I have the authority to do so. I will tolerate no disobedience.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ジェフリー・ウォン","displayName":"Jeffrey Wong","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r536","rowIndex":536,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=39>ジェフリー</tips>は有無を言わさぬ調子で言った。","en":"<tips=39>Jeffrey’s</tips> tone admitted no argument.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r537","rowIndex":537,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=1>謝亮</tips>、策があるなら、それをここで言うのです。私がそれを実行しましょう」","en":"“<tips=1>Tse Leung</tips>, if you have a plan, tell me now. I will carry it out.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ジェフリー・ウォン","displayName":"Jeffrey Wong","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r538","rowIndex":538,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「しかしこれは……」","en":"“But this...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r539","rowIndex":539,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=39>ジェフリー</tips>は僕の言葉を最後まで聞かない。","en":"<tips=39>Jeffrey</tips> wouldn't let me finish.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r540","rowIndex":540,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「自分で実行すれば、作戦が外れて失敗したときでも、自分の命で責任が取れると考えているのではありませんか？　そんな幼い考え方は捨てなさい。あなたはこれから<tips=81>龍頭</tips>になるのです。自分の考えた方針で、部下が危険にさらされるなんてことは、この先何度もあるでしょう。危険な賭けをするたびに自分が現場に赴くつもりですか？　あなたにどれだけ自信があるのか知りませんが、すべての作戦が成功するわけじゃないでしょう。そんなことをしていれば、すぐに死にますよ」","en":"“Do you think that if you carry it out yourself, you can answer for the plan's failure with your own life? Put such childish thinking behind you. You are to become the <tips=81>Longtou</tips>. There will be many times when decisions you make place your subordinates in danger. Do you intend to take the field yourself every time you make a dangerous gamble? I don't know how much faith you have in your own abilities, but not every plan will succeed. Keep doing that, and you will soon be dead.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ジェフリー・ウォン","displayName":"Jeffrey Wong","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r541","rowIndex":541,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　随分はっきりと言う。","en":"He was remarkably blunt.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r542","rowIndex":542,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その物言いに眉をひそめていると、彼はさらに続ける。","en":"I frowned at the way he put it, but he continued.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r543","rowIndex":543,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「本音を言うと、私は皆が言うほどあなたを評価していません。しかしあなたは先代の決めた後継者なのです。皆そう思っているから、あなたを優先して逃がそうとしている」","en":"“To be honest, I don't think as highly of you as everyone else does. But you are the successor chosen by the former Longtou. Everyone accepts that, which is why they are putting your escape before their own.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ジェフリー・ウォン","displayName":"Jeffrey Wong","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r544","rowIndex":544,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そしてじっと僕を見つめる。","en":"He stared steadily at me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r545","rowIndex":545,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「気分を害しましたか？」","en":"“Have I offended you?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ジェフリー・ウォン","displayName":"Jeffrey Wong","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r546","rowIndex":546,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「多少はね。でも、知っていたことさ」","en":"“A little. But I already knew that.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r547","rowIndex":547,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうですか」","en":"“I see.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ジェフリー・ウォン","displayName":"Jeffrey Wong","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r548","rowIndex":548,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どう思われたっていいんだ。それより、いまあんたは、なんだか撃退出来ずに死ぬのが決まってるような言い方だったけれど……」","en":"“I don't care what you think of me. More importantly, you were talking just now as if it were a foregone conclusion that you'd fail to stop her and die...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r549","rowIndex":549,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕は溜息をついて、","en":"I sighed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r550","rowIndex":550,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「僕が残れば僕らは必ず勝つだろう。だけど、あんたらだったらどうだろうね。そこまで言うなら譲るが、やるからには確実な成功が必要だ。そのための僕の意見は受け入れてもらう。この期に及んで聞けないということはないはずだ」","en":"“If I stayed, we'd win. With you, I'm not so sure. If you're that determined, I'll give way—but if you're going to do this, it has to succeed. You'll take my advice toward that end. After coming this far, you can hardly refuse to listen.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r551","rowIndex":551,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　言うと、<tips=39>ジェフリー</tips>が少し笑ったのがしゃくに障った。","en":"The faint smile <tips=39>Jeffrey</tips> gave me in response got under my skin.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r552","rowIndex":552,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「じゃあ、説明しよう」","en":"“Then I’ll explain.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r553","rowIndex":553,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=39>ジェフリー</tips>に僕の考えた撃退案を伝えて、幹部の家族たちと共に移動を開始した。","en":"I laid out my plan for repelling her to <tips=39>Jeffrey</tips>, then set out with the officers' families.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r554","rowIndex":554,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕に同行するのは<tips=81>龍頭</tips><tips=84>マイケル・ツェー</tips>、<tips=30>レイレイ</tips>、<tips=25>馬世傑</tips>、<tips=40>黄天明</tips>と<tips=40>天祥</tips>。<tips=39>ジェフリー</tips>は１０名の部下と共に最上階に残った。避難する家族のなかには<tips=39>ジェフリー</tips>の妻もおり、別れ際に抱擁をかわした。","en":"Accompanying me were <tips=81>Longtou</tips> <tips=84>Michael Tse</tips>, <tips=30>Leilei</tips>, <tips=25>Ma Sai-kit</tips>, and <tips=40>Wong Tin-ming</tips> and <tips=40>Tin-cheung</tips>. <tips=39>Jeffrey</tips> remained on the top floor with ten of his men. <tips=39>Jeffrey's</tips> wife was among the evacuating families, and they embraced before parting.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r555","rowIndex":555,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　女性と子供ばかりの避難者たちには今このビル内で起きていることをつまびらかに伝えてはいないが、この状況からただごとでないことは察しているようだった。しかし、その多くが幹部の家族ということだけあって、誰かを捕まえて質問攻めにするということもなく、むずがったり落ち着きのない子供たちをなだめ、我々の指示を守ってくれた。","en":"We had not told the women and children exactly what was happening inside the building, but the situation made it clear that this was no ordinary emergency. Perhaps because most of them were officers' families, none seized hold of anyone and peppered them with questions. Instead, they soothed the fussy and restless children and followed our instructions.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r556","rowIndex":556,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　高速エレベーターで中層の１５階まではすんなり下りることが出来た。<tips=40>黄姉妹</tips>のレーダーによると、相手は１２階付近にいる。ここで遭遇すれば、僕らは身を守るすべがない。一応銃を構えてはいるが、映像で見たような速度で瞬間移動を繰り返されれば弾は命中することなく、一方的にやられるだろう。","en":"The express elevator took us down to the fifteenth floor without incident. According to the <tips=40>Wong sisters</tips>' radar, she was somewhere around the twelfth. If we encountered her here, we had no way to defend ourselves. We kept our guns trained ahead, but if she kept teleporting at the speed we'd seen in the footage, our bullets would never touch her. She would cut us down without a fight.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r557","rowIndex":557,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ここまで相手は階段を使わず瞬間移動で階を上っている。何階か上るごとに、北側の階段と東側の階段の方を警戒するそぶりを見せる。そしてその他に、少しその辺りをうろうろと歩きまわったり、動きを止めてじっとしていたりする。ビルから脱出しようとするものを警戒しているつもりなのかもしれないが、相変わらず不規則で挙動不審だ。","en":"Until now, she had ascended by teleportation without using the stairs. Every few floors, she would show signs of keeping watch on the north and east stairwells. At other times, she wandered about the vicinity or stopped and remained entirely still. Perhaps she meant to watch for anyone attempting to escape the building, but her behavior remained irregular and suspicious.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r558","rowIndex":558,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　だからその移動先を正確に読むのは難しいが、１５階に到着した時点で直線距離はそれなりに開いている。","en":"That made her destination difficult to predict precisely, but by the time we reached the fifteenth floor, a fair straight-line distance separated us.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r559","rowIndex":559,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ここまで相手は長距離の瞬間移動は見せていなかったので、おそらく安全距離は保たれているだろう。","en":"She had demonstrated no long-distance teleportation to this point, so we had probably preserved a safe distance.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r560","rowIndex":560,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　我々は、おそらく彼女が見落としていると思われる西側の階段を使って下りることにした。","en":"We decided to descend by the western stairs, which she appeared to have overlooked.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r561","rowIndex":561,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　１５階の階段を下りるのは体力のない者には難しかったが、僕の想定では、一階まで下りる必要はなく、どこかの段階で少女が最上層に辿り着き、そこで<tips=39>ジェフリー</tips>たちに処理される筈だった。","en":"The fifteen-floor descent would be hard on anyone without much stamina, but by my calculation, we wouldn't need to make it all the way to the first floor. At some point, the girl should reach the uppermost floors, where <tips=39>Jeffrey's</tips> group would deal with her.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r562","rowIndex":562,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　エレベーターから階段までの移動は、ひどく緊張する時間となる。","en":"The walk from the elevator to the stairs was excruciatingly tense.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r563","rowIndex":563,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　子供の混じった集団の移動はもともと遅いものだが、少女と出会った場合の無力さを知っている僕らにとってはより一層遅く感じられた。","en":"Any group with children in it was bound to move slowly. To those of us who knew how helpless we'd be if we encountered the girl, they seemed slower still.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r564","rowIndex":564,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あっ」","en":"“Ah!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"黄天明","displayName":"Wong Tin-ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r565","rowIndex":565,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　と<tips=40>天明</tips>の声で、僕はいやな予感がした。","en":"The moment I heard <tips=40>Tin-ming</tips> cry out, I had a bad feeling.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r566","rowIndex":566,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どうした？」","en":"“What is it?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r567","rowIndex":567,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「相手は上ではなく、こちらの方向へ、瞬間移動をしました」","en":"“She's teleported toward us instead of upward.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"黄天明","displayName":"Wong Tin-ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r568","rowIndex":568,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　まさか何らかの方法で、我々を感知しているのか？　だとすれば絶体絶命だ。","en":"Could she somehow be detecting us? If so, we were doomed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r569","rowIndex":569,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　肝を冷やしたが、次の移動で彼女は上の階へと飛び、ほっと胸をなで下ろす。","en":"A chill passed through me, but her next movement carried her to the floor above, and I breathed a sigh of relief.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r570","rowIndex":570,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まったく、女の気まぐれに振り回されるってのはいやなものね」","en":"“Honestly, there's nothing worse than being jerked around by a fickle woman.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬世傑","displayName":"Ma Sai-kit","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r571","rowIndex":571,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　さすがの<tips=25>世傑</tips>も冷や汗をかきながらそう言った。","en":"Even <tips=25>Sai-kit</tips> broke into a cold sweat as he spoke.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r572","rowIndex":572,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして僕たちは階段まで辿り着く。","en":"Then we reached the stairs.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r573","rowIndex":573,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　少女はさっきのようにエレベーターを破壊してから、北側階段を警戒しながら最上層へ向かっているようだった。","en":"The girl appeared to have destroyed the elevator as before, after which she continued toward the highest floors while watching the northern stairwell.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r574","rowIndex":574,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　我々の方はひとまず危機を脱したと言って良いだろう。","en":"It was reasonable to say that we had escaped the immediate danger.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r575","rowIndex":575,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ここから先は焦って駆け出して転び落ちたりしないよう、慎重に下りて行けばいいだけだ。","en":"From here, we needed only descend with care, without rushing and tumbling down the stairs.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r576","rowIndex":576,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕たちは<tips=39>ジェフリー</tips>たちと常に連絡を取りながら移動している。僕は今の少女の位置を伝えてから、提案をした。","en":"We maintained constant contact with <tips=39>Jeffrey’s</tips> party as we moved. After reporting the girl’s current position, I made a proposal.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r577","rowIndex":577,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ねえ<tips=39>ジェフリー</tips>。もしかしたら戦う必要はないかもしれないよ。やっぱり相手は全然ビルの構造を把握していないんだ。それならば、全員で逃げるってのが非常に有効だ。こっちから指示を出すから、今すぐそこを撤収してくれ」","en":"“Listen, <tips=39>Jeffrey</tips>. We may not have to fight at all. Just as I thought, she has no grasp of the building's layout. In that case, the best move is for everyone to escape. We'll guide you from here, so clear out now.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r578","rowIndex":578,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　中層から上へ向かう階段は少なく、二つしかない。エレベーターは壊され、北側は警戒されているが、しかし<tips=40>天明</tips>の報告からすると南側の階段の側には近づいていない。そこを通れば最上層にいるものたちも脱出することが出来るだろう。","en":"Only two stairways connected the middle floors to the upper levels. The elevator had been destroyed, and she was watching the northern stairs, but according to <tips=40>Tin-ming's</tips> report, she had gone nowhere near the southern stairs. The men on the uppermost floors could escape by that route.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r579","rowIndex":579,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=40>黄姉妹</tips>のレーダーがなければ二分の一の賭けを強制させられることになるが、幸い我々は迷うことなく正解を選ぶことが出来る。","en":"Without the <tips=40>Wong sisters</tips>’ radar, we would have been forced into a fifty-fifty gamble. Fortunately, we could select the correct path without hesitation.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r580","rowIndex":580,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「さっきも言いましたが、<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>の本拠地に乗り込んだ者を、手ぶらで帰しては世間の笑いものです」","en":"“As I said before, if we let someone storm <tips=7>YS</tips> headquarters and leave empty-handed, we'll be the world's laughingstock.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r581","rowIndex":581,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=39>ジェフリー</tips>はきっぱりと断言する。","en":"<tips=39>Jeffrey</tips> was adamant.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r582","rowIndex":582,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「前に写真をばらまかれたときは、メンツなんか大事じゃないって言ってたじゃないか」","en":"“When those photographs were circulated before, you said saving face didn't matter.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r583","rowIndex":583,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「もともと大して評判もよくない私個人が情けない姿をばらまかれて笑いものになるのとはわけが違いますよ」","en":"“That's different. I never had much of a reputation to begin with, so it was only me looking pathetic in those pictures and becoming a laughingstock.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r584","rowIndex":584,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　珍しく自嘲の冗談を言うあたり、余裕があるのか、逆に緊張しすぎているのか。","en":"A self-deprecating joke was rare for him. Either he still had composure to spare, or he was so tense that it had come out the other way.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r585","rowIndex":585,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=39>ジェフリー</tips>はどうしても、ここで戦うつもりでいるようだった。","en":"<tips=39>Jeffrey</tips> appeared determined to fight here, no matter what.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r586","rowIndex":586,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　――僕が考えついたのは、作戦というような立派なものでもない、ごく簡単でシンプルなやり方だった。","en":"What I'd come up with was nothing so grand as a plan. It was an extremely simple approach.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r587","rowIndex":587,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　相手はものすごい能力を持っていて、もしかしたら未知の能力もあるのかもしれないけれども、相手を感知することにおいては普通の人間とかわらない。それは、ファンを殺す映像で相手を捕捉するために手間をかけていることからもはっきりしている。","en":"She possessed an incredible power and might have other abilities we knew nothing about, but when it came to detecting people, she was no different from an ordinary human being. The effort it had taken her to locate Phan in the footage of his death made that perfectly clear.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r588","rowIndex":588,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして目的は、あくまでも<tips=27>廖</tips>のメールを信用するならばだが、<tips=81>龍頭</tips>の命である。メールが出鱈目だとしても、最上層を目指しているようだから<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>の幹部に用があるに違いない。とすれば、執務室に行くのはまず間違いないだろう。","en":"And, assuming <tips=27>Liao's</tips> email could be trusted, her target was the <tips=81>Longtou's</tips> life. Even if the email was nonsense, the fact that she was headed for the uppermost floors meant she had to be after someone in the <tips=7>YS</tips> leadership. She was almost certain to go to the executive office.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r589","rowIndex":589,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　だから執務室に隠れて彼女を待ち伏せする。","en":"They would hide inside the office and ambush her.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r590","rowIndex":590,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　執務室の内部には監視カメラはないが、みなから集めた携帯端末を部屋の各所に置いて監視カメラ代わりにする。物陰に隠れるものはその携帯端末のカメラに映った映像を自分の端末で受信すれば、一切自分の姿をさらすことなく部屋の状況を知ることが出来る。","en":"There were no surveillance cameras inside the office, but they could place mobile devices collected from the others around the room to serve in their place. Anyone hiding behind cover could watch the feeds from those cameras on his own device and know what was happening in the room without ever exposing himself.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r591","rowIndex":591,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　部屋に入ってきたら、まず一人が少女を射撃する。これでうまく仕留めれば被害者ゼロだが、そうはいかないかも知れない。そのための対策が、今回の作戦の肝要な部分だ。","en":"When the girl entered, the first man would shoot her. Ideally, that would kill her with no casualties on our side. It might not. The preparation for that possibility was the crucial part of the plan.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r592","rowIndex":592,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　少女の攻撃方法というのは、非常に強力だが、最大の弱点がある。","en":"Her method of attack was tremendously powerful, but it had one great weakness.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r593","rowIndex":593,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それは、攻撃した後の彼女自身の居場所を予測するのが容易だという点だ。","en":"Her position after an attack was easy to predict.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r594","rowIndex":594,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女の攻撃は瞬間移動で対象のいる場所に移動するということでしか成立しない。つまり、もし最初の射撃が失敗し、少女がその第一の射撃者を攻撃するとなれば、彼がいた場所に少女がいるということだ。","en":"She could attack only by teleporting into the space occupied by her target. In other words, if the first shot missed and she attacked the first shooter, the girl would then occupy the position where he had stood.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r595","rowIndex":595,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　移動先がわかっているのだから、あらかじめ照準を合わせておくことが出来る。","en":"Because her destination was known, another shooter could aim there in advance.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r596","rowIndex":596,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　第二の射撃者は、第一の射撃者が攻撃を行うのと同時に、物陰から第一の狙撃者に狙いを付けておく。そうしておけば、もし第一の射撃者が失敗して敵の攻撃を受けてしまっても、あらためて照準をあわせる必要はなく、ただ微調整をして引き金を引くだけで弾が敵に向かって飛んでゆく。これを回避するのは難しい。","en":"The second shooter would take aim at the first from cover at the instant the first man attacked. Then, even if the first shot missed and the enemy struck him, the second shooter would not need to acquire a new target. He would make a minute correction and pull the trigger, sending the bullet into her. It would be difficult to evade.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r597","rowIndex":597,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　これを、第二、第三、第四と繰り返してゆく。","en":"The process would repeat with a second man, then a third and fourth.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r598","rowIndex":598,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　重要なのは相手に見破られずに射撃者を配置することと、指示通りのタイミングでアクションを起こすことの二点だ。","en":"Two things were essential: positioning the shooters without letting her discover them, and having each man act at precisely the instructed moment.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r599","rowIndex":599,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　これさえクリア出来れば、相手が無傷で部屋を出て行くのは難しいだろう。","en":"If those two conditions were met, she would find it exceedingly difficult to leave the room unharmed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r600","rowIndex":600,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　この考えを披露したときは、さすがに<tips=39>ジェフリー</tips>の顔色が変わった。","en":"When I laid out the idea, even <tips=39>Jeffrey's</tips> expression changed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r601","rowIndex":601,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「仲間を囮にするわけですな」","en":"“Then we would be using our comrades as decoys.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ジェフリー・ウォン","displayName":"Jeffrey Wong","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r602","rowIndex":602,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「最初の一発で仕留められなければね」","en":"“If the first shot doesn’t finish her.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r603","rowIndex":603,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なるほど……」","en":"“I see...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ジェフリー・ウォン","displayName":"Jeffrey Wong","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r604","rowIndex":604,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=39>ジェフリー</tips>は腕組みをして考え始める。","en":"<tips=39>Jeffrey</tips> folded his arms and considered it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r605","rowIndex":605,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「考えてみたのだけどね、相手が不規則に移動するんだから、普通に狙おうとすればクレー射撃よりもよほど難しい。それなら、どこかに誘導するしかないんだ。そこで囮がいる。相手は攻撃するためにはそこに移動するしかないんだからね。爆弾や毒ガスみたいな範囲の広い道具でもあればまた違うやり方もあるんだろうけれど、そうはいかない。――死者を前提にしてる時点で作戦としては最低の部類だ。だから繰り返すけど、本当は相手をせずに逃げるのが一番なんだよ。そして後で素性を洗うんだ。きっとあいつもどこかから命令を受けてやってるんだろう。ねぐらさえわかれば、相手がどんな能力者だろうと、狙撃なり、毒殺なり、方法はいくらだって……」","en":"“I've thought it through. She moves unpredictably, so trying to hit her normally would be far harder than shooting clay pigeons. We have no choice but to lure her to a specific place, and that means using a decoy. She has to move there in order to attack. If we had something with a wide area of effect, like a bomb or poison gas, there might be another way, but we don't. Any plan that assumes casualties from the start is about as bad as a plan can be. So I'll say it again: the best option is to escape without engaging her, then investigate who she is afterward. I'm sure she's carrying out orders from somewhere. Once we find her lair, it doesn't matter what kind of abilities she has. We can snipe her, poison her—there are any number of ways...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r606","rowIndex":606,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それは出来ません。絶対に」","en":"“That is not an option. Absolutely not.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ジェフリー・ウォン","displayName":"Jeffrey Wong","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r607","rowIndex":607,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「だいたい、出来るのかい？　目の前で盟友が断裂するのを見ながら冷静に行動するんだ。それが出来なければ、もし実行したって犬死にになる」","en":"“Can your men even pull it off? They'd have to act calmly while watching their comrades torn apart right before their eyes. If they can't do that, carrying out the plan will only get them killed for nothing.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r608","rowIndex":608,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕の言葉からやや間を空けて、<tips=39>ジェフリー</tips>は答えた。","en":"<tips=39>Jeffrey</tips> waited a moment after my words before answering.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r609","rowIndex":609,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あなたは知らないのですよ。この<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>というものが、本来どういう組織なのか。何を大事にしてここまでやって来たのか」","en":"“You don't understand what kind of organization <tips=7>YS</tips> was always meant to be—or what we have held dear to make it this far.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ジェフリー・ウォン","displayName":"Jeffrey Wong","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r610","rowIndex":610,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　こわばってはいるが、彼は確かに微笑みを浮かべていた。","en":"His face was rigid, but he was unmistakably smiling.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r611","rowIndex":611,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「実に勇敢な作戦ですよ。成功させれば<tips=69>義勝</tips>の誇りとなるでしょう」","en":"“It is a truly courageous plan. If we bring it off, it will become a source of pride for <tips=69>Yisheng</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ジェフリー・ウォン","displayName":"Jeffrey Wong","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r612","rowIndex":612,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そういう考え方は好きじゃないな。正常じゃない。それに、あんな小娘一人と本気で殺し合ったって誇りにはならないさ」","en":"“I don’t like that way of thinking. It isn’t sane. Besides, a fight to the death with one little girl would hardly be anything to take pride in.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r613","rowIndex":613,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ただの小娘扱いをするなら、それこそ、小娘一人から逃げ回るわけにはいかないでしょう？　……それに、我々のいる世界が正常だと、いつから思い違いをしているんですか？　これは先が思いやられる。我々には命よりも大事なものがある。そのためには狂気を見せることが必要なのです」","en":"“If you insist on treating her as just a little girl, then surely we cannot run from one little girl, can we? ...And when did you begin laboring under the delusion that our world was sane? I fear for what lies ahead. There are things we value more than life itself. For their sake, we must be willing to show our madness.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ジェフリー・ウォン","displayName":"Jeffrey Wong","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r614","rowIndex":614,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　――さて、その<tips=39>ジェフリー</tips>は現在すでに配置を終えている。","en":"—By then, <tips=39>Jeffrey</tips> had already finished positioning his men.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r615","rowIndex":615,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　特に射撃に慣れ、勇気に秀でたものを五人選び、射撃者として現場に配置した。","en":"He selected the five best shots among the bravest men and positioned them in the office as shooters.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r616","rowIndex":616,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　みな興奮剤の『ピーク』を通常の倍量飲んで精神をギンギンに研ぎ澄ませている。","en":"Each had taken twice the usual dose of the stimulant Peak, leaving his nerves razor-sharp.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r617","rowIndex":617,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　あとの五人はモニタールームで我々から送られてくる<tips=40>天明</tips>の情報を受けつつ、監視カメラの映像をチェックしており、いよいよとなったら彼らも物陰に隠れる。","en":"The other five remained in the monitor room, receiving <tips=40>Tin-ming’s</tips> information from us while they watched the camera feeds. When the time came, they too would conceal themselves.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r618","rowIndex":618,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=39>ジェフリー</tips>もモニタールームにいて、その瞬間には物陰に隠れて現場のものたちに指示を出す。","en":"<tips=39>Jeffrey</tips> was also in the monitor room. At that point, he would take cover and issue instructions to the men on the scene.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r619","rowIndex":619,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「むっつりと黙り込んじゃって、やっぱり心配？」","en":"“You've gone all sullen and quiet. So you are worried after all?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬世傑","displayName":"Ma Sai-kit","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r620","rowIndex":620,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　階段を下りていると、<tips=25>世傑</tips>が怪訝な顔をする。","en":"<tips=25>Sai-kit</tips> gave me a puzzled look as we descended the stairs.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r621","rowIndex":621,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「こんな時にぺちゃくちゃと喋るものじゃない」","en":"“This is hardly the moment for idle chatter.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r622","rowIndex":622,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「でも、何か考え込んでいたでしょう？」","en":"“But you were thinking hard about something, weren't you?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬世傑","displayName":"Ma Sai-kit","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r623","rowIndex":623,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まあね。ただ、心配というのとはちょっと違うよ。こんな大人数でぞろぞろ薄暗い階段を下りていると、可笑しくなっちゃってね。<tips=39>ジェフリー</tips>は女の子一人を殺すために執務室で待ち構えている。女の子の方も、わざわざギャングのビルに乗り込んで来るなんて何が楽しいのか。バルコニーでお菓子でも食べてたほうがずっと幸せだろうに。争いっていうのはまったく下らない。生命なんてものは、放っておくだけでも勝手に寿命で滅んでしまうのに、何を焦ってお互いの寿命を縮める必要があるのか。しかもみんな悪ふざけじゃなくて真剣だって言うんだから、おかしくって、おかしくって……」","en":"“Something like that. But it isn't quite worry. Seeing this whole crowd trudge down a dim staircase together suddenly struck me as absurd. <tips=39>Jeffrey</tips> is lying in wait in the office to kill one girl. And what could possibly be fun about that girl going out of her way to storm a gang's headquarters? She'd be far happier eating sweets on a balcony. Conflict is so utterly pointless. Life comes to an end all by itself once its time runs out, so why are we all in such a hurry to shorten one another's lives? And everyone is perfectly serious about it—they aren't fooling around. It's absurd. So absurd...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r624","rowIndex":624,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「何急に達観したようなこと言ってるのよ。そんなんじゃ困るわ」","en":"“What's with the sudden philosopher act? I can't have you talking like that.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬世傑","displayName":"Ma Sai-kit","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r625","rowIndex":625,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それはわかっちゃいるがね。でも仕方ないじゃないか。心底くだらないと思ったから、僕は街を出ていたわけだしさ」","en":"“I know that. But it can’t be helped. I left the city because I thought it all utterly pointless in the first place.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r626","rowIndex":626,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕の言葉に、<tips=25>世傑</tips>は苦い顔をして黙り込む。","en":"<tips=25>Sai-kit</tips> fell silent with a bitter expression.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r627","rowIndex":627,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「大丈夫。こうなった以上は真剣にやるさ。そしてやるなら、誰よりもうまくやってやる」","en":"“Don’t worry. Now that it has come to this, I’ll take it seriously. And if I’m going to do it, I’ll do it better than anyone.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r628","rowIndex":628,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうだとありがたいわね」","en":"“I hope so.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬世傑","displayName":"Ma Sai-kit","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r629","rowIndex":629,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=25>世傑</tips>は溜息をつく。","en":"<tips=25>Sai-kit</tips> sighed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r630","rowIndex":630,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕たちは階段を下り続ける。老人や子供など、体力のないものをいたわりながらの移動はまったくもって遅い。一方、侵入者はうろうろと無駄な動きをしながらの移動だが、早かった。","en":"We continued down the stairs. Having to look after the elderly, the children, and everyone else without much stamina made our progress agonizingly slow. The intruder, meanwhile, was moving quickly despite all her aimless wandering.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r631","rowIndex":631,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕らがやっと七階まで下りてきたところで、侵入者は<tips=39>ジェフリー</tips>たちのすぐ下の階に辿り着く。","en":"We had only just reached the seventh floor when she arrived directly below <tips=39>Jeffrey’s</tips> position.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r632","rowIndex":632,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ここからあと一階瞬間移動すれば執務室に現れることも可能だ。<tips=39>ジェフリー</tips>たちはもう身を隠していて、僕らが相手の位置を伝えると、小さく抑えたかすれ声で返事が返ってきた。","en":"One more upward teleportation could bring her into the office. <tips=39>Jeffrey’s</tips> party was already concealed. When we reported the adversary’s position, a faint, hoarse whisper came back.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r633","rowIndex":633,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　いよいよその瞬間が近づいて来ている。","en":"The moment had finally drawn near.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r634","rowIndex":634,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕は手元の端末の画面に集中した。","en":"I focused on the screen of the device in my hand.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r635","rowIndex":635,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=39>ジェフリー</tips>が部屋に仕掛けた端末の数は六つ。","en":"<tips=39>Jeffrey</tips> had placed six devices throughout the room.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r636","rowIndex":636,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それらの映像は僕の端末にも送られており、様々な角度からとらえた執務室の映像が画面に分割表示されている。","en":"Their feeds were transmitted to mine as well, and its split screen showed the office from several angles.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r637","rowIndex":637,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　画面上には誰も映っていない。部屋には普段は置かれていない家具やらが持ち込まれており、そのどこかに五人の刺客が潜んでいるはずだが、僕の目からも、どこにいるのかはわからなかった。","en":"Not one person was visible. Furniture that ordinarily had no place there had been brought into the room, and five would-be assassins were supposed to be concealed somewhere among it, but even I couldn't tell where they were.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r638","rowIndex":638,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　少なくとも、隠れるという点においては完璧だ。その上で、ちゃんと作戦が機能するように配置されているかどうかというのが気になったが、そればかりは実際に相手が部屋にやって来るまで知りようがなかった。そして何よりも、射撃者たちが作戦通りに実行できるかどうか。配置さえ正しければ、後はあらかじめ決まった場所に狙いを定め、少女がその先に現れた瞬間に引き金を引くだけの簡単な作業となるが、緊迫した場面で、<tips=16>タイプA</tips>の異常な力で味方の身体が断裂するのを目の当たりにしながら混乱なく実行できるものなのか。","en":"In terms of concealment, at least, the preparations were perfect. Whether they had been placed correctly for the plan to function was another matter, but one we could not know until the adversary entered. Most important of all was whether the shooters could execute the plan as instructed. Provided their positions were correct, the remaining work was simple: aim at a predetermined point, then pull the trigger the instant the girl appeared there. But could they do so without confusion amid such tension, while watching the unnatural power of a <tips=16>Type A</tips> tear their comrades apart before their eyes?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r639","rowIndex":639,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　経験豊かで勇気のある者を残したということだが、僕にとっては未知数だ。","en":"They said they'd left their most experienced and courageous men behind, but as far as I was concerned, their ability was still an unknown.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r640","rowIndex":640,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　やはり無理矢理にでも撤退させるべきだろうか？","en":"Should I force them to withdraw after all?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r641","rowIndex":641,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　迷いが僕の頭に浮かんだ時、その瞬間は唐突に訪れた。","en":"Just as that doubt entered my mind, the moment arrived without warning.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r642","rowIndex":642,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それまで誰もいなかった執務室の窓際、床から一メートルくらいの高さの場所に、ふっと少女が現れたかと思うと、すぐに消え、同時に右手の壁側に現れる。そしてそのまま絨毯の上に着地した。","en":"The girl suddenly appeared by the window of the previously empty office, about a meter above the floor. Almost at once she vanished again, reappeared beside the wall to the right, and landed on the carpet.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r643","rowIndex":643,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　映像でも見せた、細かい移動を挟みながら状況を把握する彼女のやり方だ。","en":"It was the same method shown in the recording: making short jumps while she assessed the situation.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r644","rowIndex":644,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　部屋に降り立った彼女は、左右をきょろきょろと確認する。部屋に誰もいないことをどう思っているのか。フードで顔の上半分が隠れているため、うかがい知ることが出来ない。","en":"After landing, she looked around the room, her eyes darting left and right. What did she make of finding it empty? With the upper half of her face hidden beneath her hood, I had no way to tell.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r645","rowIndex":645,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女は周囲を警戒しながら、部屋の奥中央に置かれた<tips=81>龍頭</tips>の椅子に近づく。そこの椅子のヘッドレスト部分には意味ありげに帽子が被せられている。","en":"Watching her surroundings, she approached the <tips=81>Longtou’s</tips> chair in the center of the room’s far end. A hat had been placed conspicuously upon its headrest.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r646","rowIndex":646,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そろそろね」","en":"“Any moment now.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r647","rowIndex":647,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　隣から画面をのぞき込んでいた<tips=25>世傑</tips>が言い、僕は頷く。","en":"<tips=25>Sai-kit</tips> said it while peering at the screen beside me. I nodded.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r648","rowIndex":648,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　二歩、三歩、少女が歩いたが襲撃者はあらわれない。<tips=39>ジェフリー</tips>がどのタイミングで指示を出すのか、僕は聞いていない。あるいは最初の射撃者に、そのタイミングはゆだねられているのかも知れない。","en":"The girl took two steps, then a third, but no attacker revealed himself. I hadn't asked when <tips=39>Jeffrey</tips> intended to give the order. Perhaps the timing had been left to the first shooter.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r649","rowIndex":649,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　少女は無人の部屋のなかをきょろきょろと見回す。さすがに警戒はしているようだ。","en":"The girl surveyed the empty room. At least she appeared to be on her guard.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r650","rowIndex":650,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして少女は椅子の上に置かれた帽子に視線をやる。いかにも意味ありげに置かれたその帽子に、やはりひときわ強い警戒心を抱いているらしい。テーブルの端に置いてあったグラスを手に取り、それに投げつける。","en":"Then her eyes fell upon the hat on the chair. The conspicuously placed hat seemed to make her particularly wary. She picked up a glass from the edge of the table and hurled it at the hat.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r651","rowIndex":651,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　命中し、帽子が落ちる。","en":"The glass struck home, knocking the hat to the floor.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r652","rowIndex":652,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それだけだ。","en":"That was all.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r653","rowIndex":653,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　もうすぐ彼女は瞬間移動を使って部屋から逃げてしまうだろうが、まだ最初の射撃者は攻撃をしない。","en":"She would probably teleport out of the room very soon, yet the first shooter did not attack.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r654","rowIndex":654,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　少女が狙撃可能なエリアに足を踏み入れていないのか、それとも、射撃者が怖じ気づいたのかもしれない。","en":"Perhaps the girl had not yet stepped into an area where he could shoot her. Or perhaps the shooter had lost his nerve.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r655","rowIndex":655,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それならそれでかまわない。自信がないのに無理に攻撃をするよりも、ここはやりすごして次のチャンスを狙うという手もある。","en":"That too was acceptable. If he lacked confidence, letting this chance pass and waiting for another opportunity would be better than forcing an attack.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r656","rowIndex":656,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ここで彼らが攻撃をしないのなら、少女はまたビルを降りてくるだろう。ならば、僕たちはもう少し階段を下りる速度を上げなくてはいけない——。それか、僕らがここで迎え討つか——。","en":"If the men didn't attack here, the girl would start descending through the building again. In that case, we'd have to pick up our pace down the stairs—or turn and intercept her here—","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r657","rowIndex":657,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕がその場合の作戦について考え始めた時だった。","en":"Just as I began formulating a plan for that possibility—","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r658","rowIndex":658,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　端末から、連続的な銃声が鳴り響く。","en":"A succession of gunshots thundered from my device.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r659","rowIndex":659,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　画面に射撃者の姿は現れない。隠れたままサブマシンガンで発砲したらしい。これが命中したのか、どうか。","en":"The shooter appeared on none of the feeds. He had evidently fired the submachine gun without leaving cover. But had he hit her?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r660","rowIndex":660,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　端末を分割した小さな画面でも、ぱっと肩の辺りで血がはじけたのが見える。","en":"Even on one of the small split-screen panes, I saw blood burst near her shoulder.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r661","rowIndex":661,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　フルオートのサブマシンガンは引き金を引いているかぎり弾薬が空になるまで連続して銃弾を撃ち出すことが出来るが、射撃精度を維持するためには三、四発程度をひとつのセットとして引き金をそのたびに戻しながら射撃するのが望ましい。今回の射撃者もそれを心得ていて、最初の三発を発射したあと一旦区切ってから、次の射撃を開始する。","en":"A fully automatic submachine gun can continue firing until its ammunition is exhausted as long as the trigger remains depressed. To preserve accuracy, however, one should fire bursts of three or four rounds, releasing the trigger between them. This shooter understood the principle. After discharging the first three rounds, he paused before beginning a second burst.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r662","rowIndex":662,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しかし、二回目の銃声が鳴るのとほとんど同時に少女の姿は消えている。","en":"But almost the instant the second burst sounded, the girl vanished.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r663","rowIndex":663,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　六つの画面のあちこちに、チラチラと少女の姿が映る。移動を繰り返しながら、相手の位置を探っているのだ。","en":"Her figure flickered from one of the six screens to another. She was making jump after jump as she searched for the shooter's position.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r664","rowIndex":664,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　奇襲を受け、負傷しているにもかかわらず、部屋から逃げずに相手を見つけて攻撃しようとしている辺り、好戦的な相手だ。","en":"Despite being caught by surprise and wounded, she was trying to find and attack the shooter instead of fleeing the room. She was a remarkably belligerent opponent.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r665","rowIndex":665,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　射撃者は、その状態でもまだ冷静さを維持しているのはさすがだった。パニックになると引き金を引きっぱなしにしてあっという間に弾倉を空にしてしまうものだろうが、一瞬でも少女が見えたところに向かって、銃を構え、短く引き金を引く。","en":"The shooter displayed admirable composure even then. Panic would presumably have made a man hold the trigger down and empty the magazine in an instant. Whenever he caught the briefest sight of the girl, he raised the gun and fired a short burst.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r666","rowIndex":666,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しかし、空中を移動しながら飛び回る相手を狙撃するのは不可能だった。","en":"But it was impossible to hit a target leaping through the air by teleportation.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r667","rowIndex":667,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　この射撃で、少女はどこから撃たれているか、その場所を把握した。相手のいる場所に少女はジャンプする。","en":"Those shots told the girl where the shooter was. She jumped into the space he occupied.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r668","rowIndex":668,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　少女がそれまでいた空中に、棚の一部と男の断裂した上半身があらわれる。そして、画面手前の棚がガラガラと崩れた。最初の射撃者はそこにいたのだろう。そして、射撃者の上半身が床に落下するよりも早く、第二の射撃者による銃声。","en":"Part of a cabinet and the severed upper half of a man appeared in the air where she had been. The cabinet in the foreground collapsed with a clatter. That must have been the first shooter’s hiding place. Before his upper body could strike the floor, the second shooter opened fire.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r669","rowIndex":669,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ほぼベストのタイミングで放たれた銃弾は少女足の辺りに命中したようだったが、致命傷には至らない。今度は少女も相手の発砲が見えたらしく、一度空中への瞬間移動を挟んだだけで、すぐに第二の射撃者の頭部を空に浮かせることになる。","en":"The shot came at almost the best possible moment and appeared to strike the girl near the leg, but the wound was not fatal. This time, she seemed to have seen the shooter fire. After only one intervening teleport into midair, the second shooter's head appeared suspended there in its place.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r670","rowIndex":670,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しかし、二発の銃弾を身体に受けたのは相当の痛手だったらしく、第二の射撃者の首なし遺体の側で、小さく蹲る。","en":"The two bullets in her body had evidently done considerable harm. Beside the second shooter’s headless body, she curled into a tight crouch.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r671","rowIndex":671,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　蹲ってしまったことで、第三の射撃者の射線から外れてしまったのかもしれない。","en":"Perhaps crouching carried her out of the third shooter’s line of fire.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r672","rowIndex":672,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　或いは、死角を保ちながら撃つのに良い場所が見つからなかったために、最初からそういう手はずで考えていたのか。","en":"Or perhaps he had been unable to find a position from which he could fire while remaining behind cover, and this had been the plan from the beginning.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r673","rowIndex":673,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　とにかく、三人目は自らカーテンの裏から飛び出して、少女を射撃したのだ。","en":"Whatever the reason, the third man sprang out from behind a curtain and opened fire on the girl.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r674","rowIndex":674,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　これが最初から予定の行動で、そのとおり実行してるのだとしたら、なかなか勇気のある行動だ。いや、正直言ってここまでの戦闘のなかでも、すでに僕の想像を上回る勇敢さを見せている。","en":"If that had been prescribed from the beginning and he was executing the plan exactly, it was an impressively courageous act. Indeed, even in the fighting thus far, they had already shown bravery far beyond anything I had imagined.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r675","rowIndex":675,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あっ」","en":"“Ah!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r676","rowIndex":676,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　と僕が思わず声をあげたのは、同時にもう一人、ソファーの裏から飛び出してしまったのだ。","en":"The cry escaped me because another man leaped from behind the sofa at the same time.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r677","rowIndex":677,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「だめだ、いけない」","en":"“No—don't!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r678","rowIndex":678,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　思わず言葉が漏れる。","en":"The words slipped out before I could stop them.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r679","rowIndex":679,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　二人同時に攻撃すればなんとかなるという相手でもない。それより、一人ずつでも物陰から一方的に射撃をしていった方が確実だ。こんなふうに飛び出してはいけない。仲間が一人ずつやられてゆくのに焦りを感じたのかもしれない。引き金をひきっぱなしで、銃弾をばらまきながら最後の一人は現れた。","en":"This wasn't an opponent they could overwhelm simply by attacking two at once. It was far more reliable for them to fire on her from cover, one after another. They must not expose themselves like this. Perhaps watching their comrades fall one by one had made them panic. The last man emerged with his trigger held down, spraying bullets everywhere.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r680","rowIndex":680,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そう思ったその直後に、僕が危惧していた光景が画面の上に展開される。","en":"The sight I had feared unfolded upon the screen in the very next instant.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r681","rowIndex":681,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　姿を現した二人は、ほとんど同時に少女の移動によって切断された。","en":"The girl’s movement severed both exposed men almost simultaneously.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r682","rowIndex":682,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして少女の姿も消え、画面のなかに残ったのは盛大にぶちまけられた四人分の死体であった。銃弾や少女の移動攻撃によって破損した家具と、人の手足や内臓が混じり合うように床の上にばらまかれている。見ているだけで生臭い血のにおいがしそうだ。","en":"Then the girl vanished as well. All that remained on the screen were the bodies of four men, their remains strewn spectacularly across the room. Furniture shattered by bullets and the girl's teleportation attacks lay scattered over the floor, mingled with human limbs and viscera. The sight alone seemed to carry the raw reek of blood.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r683","rowIndex":683,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どこへ行った？」","en":"“Where did she go?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r684","rowIndex":684,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕は<tips=40>天明</tips>に訊く。","en":"I asked <tips=40>Tin-ming</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r685","rowIndex":685,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「に、西へ１０メートル程度移動し、そこでじっとしています！」","en":"“S-she moved approximately ten meters west and has remained entirely still!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"黄天明","displayName":"Wong Tin-ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r686","rowIndex":686,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女は悲痛な顔でそう言った。","en":"She gave the report with an anguished look.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r687","rowIndex":687,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「休憩室ね」","en":"“The private lounge.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬世傑","displayName":"Ma Sai-kit","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r688","rowIndex":688,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=25>世傑</tips>が言うとおり、おそらく相手がいるのは<tips=81>龍頭</tips>のためのベッドなどが置かれた部屋だろう。","en":"As <tips=25>Sai-kit</tips> said, the adversary was probably in the room containing a bed for the <tips=81>Longtou</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r689","rowIndex":689,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=39>ジェフリー</tips>。きみたちはそこに隠れたまま待機。我々はこのままビルを離脱する。相手も負傷をしているから、おそらくすぐに退散するだろう。隠れていれば見つからないはずだ。申し訳ないが僕の作戦は失敗だ。だが、相手の奇襲も失敗と言えるだろう。今回は痛み分けで手を打とうじゃないか」","en":"“<tips=39>Jeffrey</tips>, you and your men stay hidden and hold your position. We'll continue evacuating the building. She's wounded too, so she'll probably retreat before long. As long as you remain hidden, she shouldn't find you. I'm sorry—my plan failed. But you could say her surprise attack failed as well. Let's call it even this time.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r690","rowIndex":690,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　こちらの会話が聞こえているはずの<tips=39>ジェフリー</tips>に、そう呼びかける。","en":"I called to <tips=39>Jeffrey</tips>, who should have been able to hear us.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r691","rowIndex":691,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"『いえ、我々はこれから攻撃に向かいます。この<tips=41>グランドタワー</tips>を襲撃した者を、生きて帰す訳にはいきません』","en":"‘No. We are moving to attack now. We cannot allow the person who attacked <tips=41>Grand Tower</tips> to leave alive.’","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r692","rowIndex":692,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「無理をするな。きみたちはよくやった。<tips=39>ジェフリー</tips>が言うとおり、みな勇敢だった。胸を張って帰って来てくれ」","en":"“Don't push yourselves any further. You've done well. Just as <tips=39>Jeffrey</tips> said, every one of you fought bravely. Come back with your heads held high.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r693","rowIndex":693,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"『そうは行きません』","en":"‘We cannot.’","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r694","rowIndex":694,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「駄目だ！　帰ってくるんだ！」","en":"“No! Come back!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r695","rowIndex":695,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕は怒鳴った。","en":"I shouted.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r696","rowIndex":696,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ここで深追いするのは愚かな考えだぞ！」","en":"“Pursuing her any farther is foolish!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r697","rowIndex":697,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"『……相手は負傷しています。そして居場所もわかっている。この状態で怯えて隠れていろと？』","en":"‘The adversary is wounded. We know her position. And you would have us cower in hiding under those conditions?’","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r698","rowIndex":698,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうだ。くだらないメンツなんか、犬にでも食わせておけばいい」","en":"“Yes. Throw your worthless pride to the dogs.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r699","rowIndex":699,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"『これはメンツではないですよ。必要な仕事がまだ残っているというだけです。……休憩室ですね？　相手が移動したら、また連絡をしてください』","en":"‘This is not about saving face. There is simply work that still needs to be done. ...She's in the lounge, correct? Contact us again if she moves.’","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r700","rowIndex":700,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それから先は、僕が何を呼びかけても<tips=39>ジェフリー</tips>は返事をしなかった。","en":"From that point onward, <tips=39>Jeffrey</tips> gave no answer, no matter what I said.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r701","rowIndex":701,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ち、父たちも、移動をはじめました」","en":"“M-my father and his men have started moving too.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"黄天明","displayName":"Wong Tin-ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r702","rowIndex":702,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=40>天明</tips>が狼狽を押し殺しながらそう報告する。","en":"<tips=40>Tin-ming</tips> suppressed her panic as she delivered the report.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r703","rowIndex":703,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうか……」","en":"“I see...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r704","rowIndex":704,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕は言って、端末をポケットにいれた。","en":"I put the device into my pocket.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r705","rowIndex":705,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=39>ジェフリー</tips>は自分の部下を死に追いやった以上、たとえ自殺行為でも、自分が責任をとらなければならないと考えたのだろうか？　それとも、本当に勝算があるのか。僕にはちょっとわからない。","en":"Having sent his subordinates to their deaths, did <tips=39>Jeffrey</tips> believe that he was obliged to accept responsibility himself, even if doing so was suicidal? Or did he truly believe he could win? I could not tell.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r706","rowIndex":706,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「我々は移動速度を上げる。みな、足元に気をつけながら急いでくれ」","en":"“We are increasing our pace. Hurry, everyone, but watch your footing.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r707","rowIndex":707,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕たちはガタガタと足音を立てながら階段を下り進める。","en":"Our footsteps clattered as we continued down the stairs.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r708","rowIndex":708,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=40>天明</tips>は逐一、最上階での生命の位置や数の変化を報告し、そして僕らが三階に辿り着いた辺りで、最上階に置いてきたすべての仲間が死に絶え、少女だけが残ったことをうわずった声で耳打ちした。","en":"<tips=40>Tin-ming</tips> kept us apprised of every change in the positions and number of lives on the top floor. By the time we reached the third floor, she whispered in a high, strained voice that every comrade we'd left above was dead. Only the girl remained.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r709","rowIndex":709,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ご苦労」","en":"“Good work.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r710","rowIndex":710,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕が<tips=40>天明</tips>をねぎらうと、","en":"When I thanked <tips=40>Tin-ming</tips>, the Longtou spoke.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r711","rowIndex":711,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=2>阿亮</tips>」","en":"“<tips=2>Ah Leung</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"マイケル・ツェー","displayName":"Michael Tse","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r712","rowIndex":712,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=81>龍頭</tips>が不安げに僕を見る。","en":"The <tips=81>Longtou</tips> looked at me anxiously.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r713","rowIndex":713,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕は彼に頷きを返す。","en":"I answered him with a nod.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r714","rowIndex":714,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうか……」","en":"“I see...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"マイケル・ツェー","displayName":"Michael Tse","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r715","rowIndex":715,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　察して、下唇を噛んだ。","en":"Understanding, he bit his lower lip.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r716","rowIndex":716,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「一体、何があったんですか？」","en":"“What in the world happened?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"レイレイ","displayName":"Leilei","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r717","rowIndex":717,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　声をかけたのは<tips=30>レイレイ</tips>だった。その向こうには<tips=39>ジェフリー</tips>の妻がいて、こちらをじっと見ている。","en":"The question came from <tips=30>Leilei</tips>. Beyond her stood <tips=39>Jeffrey’s</tips> wife, watching us without looking away.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r718","rowIndex":718,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あとで説明する。今は先を急ぐんだ」","en":"“I'll explain later. Right now, we need to keep moving.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r719","rowIndex":719,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　口ごもる<tips=81>龍頭</tips>のかわりに僕がこたえた。<tips=39>ジェフリー</tips>の妻は何も言わない。彼女にも他の家族同様何も説明をしていないが、僕らの態度ですべてを察したのだろう。","en":"I answered in place of the <tips=81>Longtou</tips>, who was struggling to speak. <tips=39>Jeffrey's</tips> wife said nothing. Like the other families, she had been told nothing, but she must have understood everything from the way we were acting.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r720","rowIndex":720,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　目が合うと、顔をこわばらせる。","en":"When our eyes met, her face stiffened.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r721","rowIndex":721,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=81>龍頭</tips>」","en":"“<tips=81>Longtou</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r722","rowIndex":722,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕は脚を止めて俯く彼に声をかけると、顔を上げる。","en":"I addressed the Longtou, who had stopped and bowed his head. He looked up.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r723","rowIndex":723,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あなたはみんなを連れて、ビルの外まで逃がしてください。僕らは少し引き返して１５階で迎え撃ちます」","en":"“Take everyone and get them safely out of the building. We'll double back a little way and intercept her on the fifteenth floor.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r724","rowIndex":724,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「しかし、今<tips=39>ジェフリー</tips>はそのやり方で……」","en":"“But <tips=39>Jeffrey</tips> just used the same method, and...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"マイケル・ツェー","displayName":"Michael Tse","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r725","rowIndex":725,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「彼は冷静じゃなかった。僕はもう少しうまくやります」","en":"“He wasn’t calm. I’ll handle it a little better.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r726","rowIndex":726,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=2>阿亮</tips>。さっきも言ったように、お前を危険にさらすわけには……」","en":"“<tips=2>Ah Leung</tips>. As I said before, we cannot expose you to danger...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"マイケル・ツェー","displayName":"Michael Tse","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r727","rowIndex":727,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「今はそんな状況ではありません。<tips=39>ジェフリー</tips>が言ったように、相手が消耗している以上、今がチャンスなのは確かです」","en":"“We're past that now. As <tips=39>Jeffrey</tips> said, she's been worn down. That makes this our best chance.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r728","rowIndex":728,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕の言葉に、<tips=81>龍頭</tips>はうんと頷こうとしない。ただ苦い顔で僕を見つめている。","en":"The <tips=81>Longtou</tips> would not agree. He merely stared at me with a bitter expression.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r729","rowIndex":729,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……<tips=39>ジェフリー</tips>がいなくなった以上、僕が唯一の補佐役のはずです。僕の意見に従ってください。<tips=30>レイレイ</tips>、<tips=81>龍頭</tips>を頼むよ」","en":"“...Now that <tips=39>Jeffrey</tips> is gone, I should be your sole adviser. Follow my counsel. <tips=30>Leilei</tips>, take care of the <tips=81>Longtou</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r730","rowIndex":730,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　渋る<tips=81>龍頭</tips>に家族と共に下に行かせ、僕は<tips=25>世傑</tips>と<tips=40>黄姉妹</tips>、そして三人の部下を借り、下りて来た階段を上り始めた。","en":"I sent the reluctant <tips=81>Longtou</tips> downstairs with the families. Then, borrowing <tips=25>Sai-kit</tips>, the <tips=40>Wong sisters</tips>, and three of his men, I started back up the stairs we had just descended.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r731","rowIndex":731,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「大丈夫？　むきになってない？」","en":"“Are you all right? You aren’t letting this become personal?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬世傑","displayName":"Ma Sai-kit","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r732","rowIndex":732,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　隣を行く<tips=25>世傑</tips>が、不安げに訊ねる。","en":"<tips=25>Sai-kit</tips> walked beside me and asked anxiously.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r733","rowIndex":733,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「僕は至って冷静だよ。自分でも恐ろしいほどだ」","en":"“I am entirely calm. Frighteningly so, even to myself.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r734","rowIndex":734,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕は自分の銃に弾丸が装填されているのを確認しながらこたえる。","en":"I answered while checking that my gun was loaded.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r735","rowIndex":735,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あの当たり方からすると、手当てをしない限り相手は出血で消耗し続けるはずだ。<tips=39>ジェフリー</tips>たちのやり方は無謀だったが、それを処理するのに相手も大分能力を使った。相手はどこかに逃げて治療を受けることを優先するだろう。そこを不意打ちする。相手は思考能力や注意力も落ちているだろうしね。……観察して、想定よりも消耗がないようなら接触を避けて撤退する」","en":"“Judging by where the bullets struck, she should continue losing blood and weakening unless she receives treatment. <tips=39>Jeffrey’s</tips> method was reckless, but dealing with it also forced her to use her ability a great deal. She will probably make escaping somewhere to obtain treatment her priority. We will take her by surprise then. Her judgment and attention should be impaired as well. ...We will observe her. If she appears less exhausted than expected, we will withdraw without contact.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r736","rowIndex":736,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それならいいけど。でも……」","en":"“If that's really how you intend to handle it, fine. But...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬世傑","displayName":"Ma Sai-kit","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r737","rowIndex":737,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=25>世傑</tips>が言いかけたのを、<tips=40>天明</tips>が遮る。","en":"<tips=40>Tin-ming</tips> interrupted <tips=25>Sai-kit</tips> before he could continue.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r738","rowIndex":738,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=1>謝亮</tips>様、相手が移動を開始しました！」","en":"“<tips=1>Tse Leung</tips>, sir, the adversary has begun moving!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"黄天明","displayName":"Wong Tin-ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r739","rowIndex":739,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　冷静でないのはむしろこの<tips=40>黄姉妹</tips>だろう。父が死んだショックで二人とも、その顔を青ざめさせてはいるが、復讐の念は強いのか、さっきとは違う感情のこもった声でそう伝える。","en":"If anyone had lost composure, it was more likely the <tips=40>Wong sisters</tips>. The shock of their father’s death had left both faces pallid. Perhaps their desire for revenge was powerful, for Tin-ming’s report now carried an emotion absent from her earlier voice.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r740","rowIndex":740,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「北側の方へゆっくり移動して……あっ……」","en":"“She's moving slowly northward... Ah!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"黄天明","displayName":"Wong Tin-ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r741","rowIndex":741,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どうした？」","en":"“What's wrong?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r742","rowIndex":742,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……見失いました」","en":"“...I've lost her.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"黄天明","displayName":"Wong Tin-ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r743","rowIndex":743,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「え？」","en":"“What?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r744","rowIndex":744,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ビルの外に瞬間移動したんです！　それで、そのまま連続して瞬間移動し、あれよあれよと地上まで辿り着いて、そのまま人混みのなかへ……そこで見失いました。すみません……」","en":"“She teleported outside the building! Then she continued teleporting in rapid succession, reached the ground before we knew it, and entered the crowd... We lost her there. I’m sorry...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"黄天明","displayName":"Wong Tin-ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r745","rowIndex":745,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=40>天明</tips>はくやしげに下唇を噛む。彼女の肩は震えている。もし彼女に普通の人間のように目があったら、涙をこぼしていたかもしれない。","en":"<tips=40>Tin-ming</tips> bit her lower lip in frustration. Her shoulders trembled. Had she possessed eyes like an ordinary person, she might have been shedding tears.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r746","rowIndex":746,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「きみが謝る必要はないよ」","en":"“You have nothing to apologize for.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r747","rowIndex":747,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕は溜息をつき、階段を上る足を止める。一同もそれに倣う。","en":"I sighed and stopped climbing. Everyone else followed my example.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r748","rowIndex":748,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そうだ。相手は瞬間移動を連続して使うことが出来るのだ。わざわざビルの中を伝って下りる必要などない。","en":"Of course. The adversary could teleport repeatedly. She had no reason to make her way down through the building.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r749","rowIndex":749,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　なぜ襲うときは、同じように空中を連続移動して直接最上階を狙わなかったのか？　どうしてわざわざ正面から攻撃して、ビル全体を制圧しようとしたのか？","en":"Then why, when she attacked, had she not made the same succession of movements through the air and gone directly to the highest floor? Why had she attacked from the front and taken the trouble to try to take control of the entire building?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r750","rowIndex":750,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　考えようとしたが、急に気の抜けたような感じになってしまって、うまく考えられない。","en":"I tried to think, but suddenly felt drained and could not make my thoughts work.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r751","rowIndex":751,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　……とにかく、僕は、相手を逃がしてしまったのだ。部下たちを好き放題殺し、<tips=39>ジェフリー</tips>を殺した相手を。","en":"...Whatever the reason, I had let her escape. The woman who had slaughtered my men at will and killed <tips=39>Jeffrey</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r752","rowIndex":752,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕は階段の段の上に腰をおろす。","en":"I sat down on one of the steps.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r753","rowIndex":753,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「大丈夫？」","en":"“Are you all right?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬世傑","displayName":"Ma Sai-kit","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r754","rowIndex":754,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=25>世傑</tips>がそう声をかける。","en":"<tips=25>Sai-kit</tips> asked.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r755","rowIndex":755,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「大丈夫だよ。もちろん」","en":"“I’m all right. Of course.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r756","rowIndex":756,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕は溜息をつき、","en":"I sighed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r757","rowIndex":757,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ただ、悪いけど、ほんの少しだけ休ませてくれないか？　なんだか、ひどく疲れたんだ」","en":"“Sorry, but could you let me rest for just a little while? Somehow, I'm completely exhausted.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r758","rowIndex":758,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ビルから退避したすべてのものに、襲撃者が去ったことを伝え、僕は<tips=25>世傑</tips>や<tips=81>龍頭</tips>と共に戦場となった最上階に戻る。","en":"We informed everyone evacuated from the building that the attacker was gone. Then the <tips=81>Longtou</tips>, <tips=25>Sai-kit</tips>, and I returned to the top floor that had become a battlefield.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r759","rowIndex":759,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　執務室は映像で見た通りの血の海が広がり、そして隣の休憩室も同様だった。","en":"Just as it had appeared on the screen, a sea of blood spread across the office. The private lounge next door was no different.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r760","rowIndex":760,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　壁には銃弾によって穿たれた穴がいくつかあり、<tips=25>世傑</tips>は無言でそれに指先で触れていた。","en":"Bullets had punched several holes in the walls. <tips=25>Sai-kit</tips> touched them silently with his fingertips.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r761","rowIndex":761,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　休憩室に転がる遺体も、瞬間移動によって切断されている。<tips=39>ジェフリー</tips>は頭のてっぺんから右脇の下にかけて楕円を描くような形で切断されていた。彼の握る銃の弾丸は二発使われていた。他の遺体が持つ銃も、一、二発は消費されているのを見ると、一方的に返り討ちにされたのではなく、それなりに戦闘の形をとることは出来たようだ。","en":"The bodies scattered through the private lounge had also been severed by teleportation. <tips=39>Jeffrey</tips> had been cut along an oval running from the crown of his head to beneath his right arm. Two rounds were missing from the gun he still held. The weapons carried by the other bodies had also discharged one or two rounds. It appeared that they had achieved something resembling a battle, rather than being cut down entirely without reply.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r762","rowIndex":762,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　父の遺体に直面した<tips=40>黄姉妹</tips>は、両手の平で顔を覆った。目などないはずだが、においや雰囲気が生々しく状況を伝えたのだろう。その肩は細かく震えている。","en":"Confronted with their father’s body, the <tips=40>Wong sisters</tips> covered their faces with both hands. They had no eyes, but the smell and atmosphere must have communicated the scene with terrible immediacy. Their shoulders trembled faintly.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r763","rowIndex":763,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　やがて<tips=81>龍頭</tips>が<tips=4>馬明</tips>と共に到着した。","en":"In time, the <tips=81>Longtou</tips> arrived with <tips=4>Ma Ming</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r764","rowIndex":764,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=4>馬明</tips>は顔を真っ赤にして怒ったが、何も言わなかった。普段はうるさいほど饒舌なくせに。","en":"<tips=4>Ma Ming’s</tips> face reddened with fury, but he said nothing. Ordinarily, he was almost oppressively talkative.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r765","rowIndex":765,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして、黙って僕を見ていた。言いたいことがあるのなら言えばいい。","en":"He merely stared at me in silence. If he had something to say, he should say it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r766","rowIndex":766,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「エレベーターはすぐには直らないそうだ。遺体は人力で下ろし、丁重に埋葬しよう」","en":"“I'm told the elevator will not be repaired anytime soon. We will carry the bodies down ourselves and give them a proper burial.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"マイケル・ツェー","displayName":"Michael Tse","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r767","rowIndex":767,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=81>龍頭</tips>は沈鬱な表情でそう言った。","en":"The <tips=81>Longtou</tips> spoke with a somber expression.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r768","rowIndex":768,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=39>ジェフリー</tips>は死にたかったんだろう」","en":"“<tips=39>Jeffrey</tips> must have wanted to die.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r769","rowIndex":769,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕はそう呟く。","en":"I muttered the words under my breath.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r770","rowIndex":770,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「街中に知れ渡るような手ひどい恥をかかされたし、この先僕とやってゆくのもいやだった。だから戦いに固執したんだ。僕のことが気に食わないから死んだんだよ。子飼いの部下と一緒にね」","en":"“He'd been subjected to a crushing humiliation that the whole city knew about, and he must have hated the thought of having to work with me from then on. That's why he was so determined to fight. He died because he couldn't stand me—and took the men he'd personally raised with him.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r771","rowIndex":771,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕の言葉を聞いた<tips=81>龍頭</tips>は困ったように<tips=4>馬明</tips>の方を見る。<tips=4>馬明</tips>は何も言わない。口を真一文字に閉ざして、巌のように押し黙っている。","en":"Hearing me, the <tips=81>Longtou</tips> looked uneasily toward <tips=4>Ma Ming</tips>. <tips=4>Ma Ming</tips> said nothing. His lips pressed into a straight line, he remained silent as a crag.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r772","rowIndex":772,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それを見て、溜息をつくと、","en":"Seeing this, the Longtou sighed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r773","rowIndex":773,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=2>阿亮</tips>には、次の<tips=81>龍頭</tips>になって貰いたい」","en":"“I want <tips=2>Ah Leung</tips> to become the next <tips=81>Longtou</tips>,”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"マイケル・ツェー","displayName":"Michael Tse","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r774","rowIndex":774,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　と言った。","en":"he said.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r775","rowIndex":775,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「私にはこの混乱のなかで<tips=81>龍頭</tips>を続けてゆく能力がない。<tips=39>ウォン</tips>君が死んでしまった今となってはなおさらだ」","en":"“I lack the ability to continue as <tips=81>Longtou</tips> amid this confusion. All the more so now that <tips=39>Wong</tips> is dead.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"マイケル・ツェー","displayName":"Michael Tse","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r776","rowIndex":776,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして<tips=81>龍頭</tips>の証しである杯を取り出す。","en":"He produced the cup that symbolized the office of <tips=81>Longtou</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r777","rowIndex":777,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「これを持つのに一番相応しいのは、<tips=2>阿亮</tips>だよ。他の者がどう思おうと、私はそう信じている」","en":"“The person most worthy to carry this is <tips=2>Ah Leung</tips>. Whatever anyone else may think, that is what I believe.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"マイケル・ツェー","displayName":"Michael Tse","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r778","rowIndex":778,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕に向かって差し出した。","en":"He held it out to me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r779","rowIndex":779,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「近いうちに、儀式を行おう。私のときのように盛大な宴を用意することが出来ないのが申し訳ないが……」","en":"“We will hold the ceremony soon. I am sorry that we cannot prepare a grand banquet like the one for my succession...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"マイケル・ツェー","displayName":"Michael Tse","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r780","rowIndex":780,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いや、儀式なんか何もいらない。そういうのは好きじゃないんだ」","en":"“No, we don’t need any kind of ceremony. I don’t like that sort of thing.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A5:r781","rowIndex":781,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕は首を振り、その杯をその場で受け取った。","en":"I shook my head and accepted the cup then and there.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}}]},{"position":17,"code":"X3-1","unitId":"X3-1","rows":[{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r1","rowIndex":1,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=26>劉建志</tips>処刑の報は<tips=81>龍頭</tips><tips=84>マイケル・ツェー</tips>の名で通達され、<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>内に衝撃を与えた。","en":"Word of <tips=26>Ryu Kenshi’s</tips> execution was issued in the name of <tips=81>Longtou</tips> <tips=84>Michael Tse</tips>, sending shock waves through <tips=7>YS</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r2","rowIndex":2,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その直後に<tips=41>グランドタワー</tips>で行われた幹部の定例会食には、みなこわばった顔であらわれる。","en":"At the regular officers' dinner held in <tips=41>Grand Tower</tips> immediately afterward, everyone appeared with a rigid expression.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r3","rowIndex":3,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=3>クリス</tips>が行っていたのと同様、食事の後に重要な話し合いが行われるという段取りだが、食事の時間は無言で、だれひとり口をきかないという異常事態だった。","en":"As under <tips=3>Chris</tips>, the arrangements called for important discussions to be held after the meal. But the meal itself passed in silence, an extraordinary state of affairs in which not one person spoke.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r4","rowIndex":4,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして食後の会合では、まず<tips=81>龍頭</tips>が型どおりの報告を行ったあと、<tips=39>ジェフリー</tips>の口からあらためて<tips=26>劉建志</tips>の処刑について説明が行われた。","en":"At the meeting after dinner, the <tips=81>Longtou</tips> first delivered the customary reports, after which <tips=39>Jeffrey</tips> once again explained the execution of <tips=26>Ryu Kenshi</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r5","rowIndex":5,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼がくどくどと話すまでもなく、<tips=26>劉建志</tips>の常軌を逸した行動は死に相当する罪であり、<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>のルールに従えばその決定自体は誰にも否定出来ない筈だった。","en":"There should have been no need for him to belabor the point. <tips=26>Ryu Kenshi’s</tips> aberrant conduct constituted a crime punishable by death, and under the rules of <tips=7>YS</tips>, no one should have been able to dispute the decision itself.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r6","rowIndex":6,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しかし、これを公然と批判したのは<tips=27>廖志明</tips>だ。","en":"Yet <tips=27>Liao Chi-ming</tips> openly condemned it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r7","rowIndex":7,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「幹部クラスの人間に対する処刑は、幹部の合議で決めるべきだ。<tips=26>劉建志</tips>君は若輩者とは言え、自分のファミリーを持つ幹部の一人だ。今回のやり方は執行部の暴走としか言いようがない」","en":"“The execution of an officer should be decided by a council of the officers. <tips=26>Ryu Kenshi</tips> may have been young, but he was still an officer with a crew of his own. This can only be called the executive leadership running amok.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"廖志明","displayName":"Liao Chi-ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r8","rowIndex":8,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼は憤りをあらわにしてそう言った。","en":"He spoke with open indignation.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r9","rowIndex":9,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　実際のところ彼が<tips=26>劉建志</tips>にそこまで肩入れする理由は見当たらなかったし、その怒りが演技か本当の心から出たものかはその場に居る誰も判別がつかなかった。おそらく本人自身も区別がついていないだろう。彼のように演技的に生きて来た人間は、顔の表情だけでなく、感情そのものまで自分に都合のよいように動かしてしまうものだ。","en":"In truth, there was no evident reason for him to feel so strongly about <tips=26>Ryu Kenshi</tips>, and no one present could tell whether his anger was a performance or arose from the heart. Liao himself probably could not distinguish between the two. A man who had spent his life performing as he had could bend not only his expression, but emotion itself, to whatever served him best.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r10","rowIndex":10,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして、<tips=26>劉建志</tips>のことを話したあとはその部下たちのことにふれ、<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>を破門されて路頭に迷うしかなくなった彼らを引き取ると宣言した。","en":"After speaking about <tips=26>Ryu Kenshi</tips>, he turned to the man’s subordinates and announced that he would take them in now that their expulsion from <tips=7>YS</tips> had left them with nowhere to go.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r11","rowIndex":11,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=26>劉建志</tips>のファミリーの構成員は、ほとんどが<tips=3>クリス</tips>が貸した<tips=76>香港派</tips>の人員で、それが元の場所に戻ると<tips=26>劉</tips>のチンピラ仲間のようなものしか残らなかったが、<tips=39>ジェフリー</tips>はこうした<tips=27>廖</tips>の態度自体を問題視した。","en":"Most of <tips=26>Ryu Kenshi's</tips> crew were men <tips=3>Chris</tips> had loaned him from the <tips=76>Hong Kong faction</tips>. Once they returned to their old posts, only <tips=26>Ryu's</tips> former street-thug companions remained. <tips=39>Jeffrey</tips>, however, took issue with <tips=27>Liao's</tips> conduct itself.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r12","rowIndex":12,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「今回の処置は<tips=81>龍頭</tips>の決定です。あなたの立場を軽んじるわけではありませんが、こうした処罰の権限は<tips=81>龍頭</tips>に委任されているはずです。しかも<tips=26>劉建志</tips>は我々の身内です」","en":"“This action was the <tips=81>Longtou’s</tips> decision. I do not mean to slight your position, but authority over punishments of this kind is supposed to be delegated to the <tips=81>Longtou</tips>. Besides, <tips=26>Ryu Kenshi</tips> was one of our own.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ジェフリー・ウォン","displayName":"Jeffrey Wong","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r13","rowIndex":13,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「はっ、笑わせる」","en":"“Ha! Don’t make me laugh.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"廖志明","displayName":"Liao Chi-ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r14","rowIndex":14,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=27>廖志明</tips>は聞き入れなかった。","en":"<tips=27>Liao Chi-ming</tips> refused to listen.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r15","rowIndex":15,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「実際に指示を下しているのは<tips=39>ジェフリー・ウォン</tips>、きみだろう？　きみは<tips=81>龍頭</tips>を傀儡とし、組織を私物化している。相談役といえども、明らかに越権行為じゃないか？　掟がどうこうと口うるさく言うが、きみこそ<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>の掟を乱すものではないか？」","en":"“You’re the one actually giving the orders, <tips=39>Jeffrey Wong</tips>, aren’t you? You have made the <tips=81>Longtou</tips> your puppet and turned the organization into your private property. Even for an adviser, aren’t you plainly overstepping your authority? You’re forever harping on about the code, but aren’t you the one undermining the code of <tips=7>YS</tips>?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"廖志明","displayName":"Liao Chi-ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r16","rowIndex":16,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=27>廖</tips>と<tips=39>ジェフリー</tips>のやりとりを、他の面々は静かに黙って聞いている。","en":"The others listened to the exchange between <tips=27>Liao</tips> and <tips=39>Jeffrey</tips> in silence.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r17","rowIndex":17,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼らのうち誰がどちらにつくつもりなのか、まだ品定めをしている最中なのか、それとも自分が新たな勢力となるつもりなのか、本人以外にはうかがい知る余地はなかった。","en":"Whether they meant to side with one man or the other, were still sizing both men up, or intended to emerge as a new force in their own right—no one but the individuals themselves could know.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r18","rowIndex":18,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それは<tips=81>龍頭</tips>に対する侮辱ですよ」","en":"“That is an insult to the <tips=81>Longtou</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ジェフリー・ウォン","displayName":"Jeffrey Wong","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r19","rowIndex":19,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「何が<tips=81>龍頭</tips>だ。先代の意志は尊重するが、みろ、この場においてただうろたえているだけではないか。<tips=84>マイケル</tips>どのは悪い人間ではないが、盟主の器ではないのではないか？」","en":"“What <tips=81>Longtou</tips>? I respect our predecessor's wishes, but look at him—he has done nothing here but flounder. <tips=84>Michael</tips> may be a decent man, but does he truly have what it takes to lead this alliance?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"廖志明","displayName":"Liao Chi-ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r20","rowIndex":20,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「問題発言です。口を慎んでください」","en":"“That remark is unacceptable. Watch your tongue.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ジェフリー・ウォン","displayName":"Jeffrey Wong","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r21","rowIndex":21,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「じゃあどうする？　私も<tips=26>劉建志</tips>のように処刑するか？　できっこないね。そもそも、私は<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>のために言っているのだ。先代がもし生きていて、このありさまを見たら、やはり自分の決定は間違っていたと撤回するだろう。彼は自分の行動が間違っていたと分かればすぐに訂正出来る男だったからな」","en":"“Then what will you do? Execute me like <tips=26>Ryu Kenshi</tips>? You couldn’t. In the first place, I am saying this for the good of <tips=7>YS</tips>. If our predecessor were alive and saw this sorry state of affairs, he too would admit his decision had been wrong and reverse it. He was a man who corrected himself at once whenever he realized he had done wrong.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"廖志明","displayName":"Liao Chi-ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r22","rowIndex":22,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「別に間違ったことはしてないんでしょう？」","en":"“But they didn’t do anything wrong, did they?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エリー・ホワイト","displayName":"Ellie White","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r23","rowIndex":23,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そこではじめて口を開いたのは、<tips=31>エリー・ホワイト</tips>だった。","en":"<tips=31>Ellie White</tips> spoke for the first time.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r24","rowIndex":24,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=26>劉建志</tips>は幹部にあるまじきことをして、処刑された。当然のことじゃありませんか。仮に会議なんかしたところで結果は同じでしょう。そんな悠長なことをしていたら、<tips=26>劉</tips>を取り逃したかもしれない。あなたが食ってかかる理由がわかりませんね」","en":"“<tips=26>Ryu Kenshi</tips> did something no officer should ever do, and he was executed. Wasn’t that only natural? Even if we had held some meeting, the outcome would have been the same. If we had taken our time like that, <tips=26>Ryu</tips> might have gotten away. I simply don’t understand why you’re coming at us like this.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エリー・ホワイト","displayName":"Ellie White","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r25","rowIndex":25,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「マダムは執行部を支持なさるか」","en":"“Does Madam support the executive, then?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"廖志明","displayName":"Liao Chi-ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r26","rowIndex":26,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=27>廖</tips>が目を細め、唇の端を引き上げて笑うと蛇のような顔になった。","en":"<tips=27>Liao</tips> narrowed his eyes and drew up one corner of his mouth, giving his face the look of a snake.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r27","rowIndex":27,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「じゃあ<tips=33>壬生屋</tips>君はどうだね？　君は故人とは幼なじみだったと思うが」","en":"“And what do you think, <tips=33>Mibuya</tips>? I believe you and the deceased were childhood friends.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"廖志明","displayName":"Liao Chi-ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r28","rowIndex":28,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　急に話を振られた<tips=33>壬生屋タカシ</tips>は、この場では傍観者を決め込むつもりでいたらしい。旗幟を鮮明にするよう求めるような<tips=27>廖</tips>の質問に対して苦り切ったような顔をすると、","en":"<tips=33>Takashi Mibuya</tips>, abruptly put on the spot, had apparently intended to remain an observer. Faced with a question from <tips=27>Liao</tips> that seemed designed to force him to show his colors, he pulled a sour face and—","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r29","rowIndex":29,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まあ、あれだけみっともないことをしたら処刑はやむなしでしょう。まだ子供だった娘まで殺すのはちょっとやりすぎな気もしますが……」","en":"“Well, after disgracing himself that badly, I suppose his execution was unavoidable. Killing his daughter too, when she was still a child, does seem to me like going a little too far...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"壬生屋タカシ","displayName":"Takashi Mibuya","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r30","rowIndex":30,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まったくだ。やり方が乱暴すぎる。おなじ処刑を選ぶにしても、我々が合議していれば、もっと適切な方法をとれただろう」","en":"“Precisely. Their methods were far too brutal. Even if execution had been the inevitable outcome, collective deliberation would have allowed us to choose a more appropriate way of carrying it out.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"廖志明","displayName":"Liao Chi-ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r31","rowIndex":31,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いや、私は……」","en":"“No, I...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"壬生屋タカシ","displayName":"Takashi Mibuya","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r32","rowIndex":32,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=27>廖</tips>が納得したように頷くと、お茶を濁したつもりだった<tips=33>壬生屋</tips>はますます困った顔をする。","en":"<tips=27>Liao</tips> nodded as though <tips=33>Mibuya</tips> had agreed with him, leaving the man—who had meant to say nothing of substance—looking more troubled than ever.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r33","rowIndex":33,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「何を言っているのかしら。当然でしょう？　<tips=26>劉</tips>はヤンの家で、娘も妻も殺したのですから」","en":"“What are you talking about? Of course killing her was justified. <tips=26>Ryu</tips> killed both the daughter and the wife at Yang's home, after all.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エリー・ホワイト","displayName":"Ellie White","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r34","rowIndex":34,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=31>エリー・ホワイト</tips>は冷たく言い捨てる。","en":"<tips=31>Ellie White</tips> delivered the words coldly.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r35","rowIndex":35,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ふん、<tips=26>劉</tips>が娘を殺そうが赤子を殺そうが、それは<tips=26>劉</tips>の罪だ。<tips=26>劉</tips>の娘には罪はないだろう。……とにかく、こんな無茶なやりかたではだれもついて来ないし、それでは<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>の未来は暗いと私は言っているんだよ。今は昔とは時代が違うんだ」","en":"“Hmph. Whether <tips=26>Ryu</tips> killed a daughter or a baby, that was <tips=26>Ryu’s</tips> crime. <tips=26>Ryu’s</tips> daughter was innocent, wasn’t she? ...In any case, no one will follow leadership this reckless, and I am telling you that leaves <tips=7>YS</tips> with a bleak future. Times are different now from the old days.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"廖志明","displayName":"Liao Chi-ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r36","rowIndex":36,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「話になりませんな。あなたは無理矢理問題を大きくして、我々を責めようとしているだけです」","en":"“This is absurd. You are deliberately blowing the matter out of proportion just to condemn us.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ジェフリー・ウォン","displayName":"Jeffrey Wong","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r37","rowIndex":37,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=39>ジェフリー</tips>も一歩も引かない。","en":"<tips=39>Jeffrey</tips> refused to yield an inch.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r38","rowIndex":38,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「もうやめたまえ！」","en":"“That is enough!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"マイケル・ツェー","displayName":"Michael Tse","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r39","rowIndex":39,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そこで、甲高い声で割って入ったのは、それまで黙っていた<tips=81>龍頭</tips>、<tips=84>マイケル・ツェー</tips>であった。","en":"The high-pitched voice that cut into the argument belonged to the <tips=81>Longtou</tips>, <tips=84>Michael Tse</tips>, who had remained silent until then.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r40","rowIndex":40,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「とにかく、今回はこういう形で決まったのです。<tips=27>廖</tips>どの、あなたの意見もよく分かった。私がふがいないという意見もごもっともだ。次回からはそのようなこともよく考えて物事を進めるから、今日は引いてくれないか？」","en":"“In any case, this is how the matter was decided. Mr. <tips=27>Liao</tips>, I understand your position. Your criticism that I am unequal to the role is entirely fair as well. From now on, I will give such concerns full consideration before proceeding. Would you please let the matter rest for today?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"マイケル・ツェー","displayName":"Michael Tse","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r41","rowIndex":41,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=81>龍頭</tips>がそうおっしゃるのなら、今回はこのあたりにしておきますが……」","en":"“If that is what the <tips=81>Longtou</tips> says, I will leave the matter there for today...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r42","rowIndex":42,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=27>廖</tips>は<tips=39>ジェフリー</tips>の顔を睨み付けたまま渋々口を開き、","en":"Still glaring at <tips=39>Jeffrey</tips>, <tips=27>Liao</tips> replied reluctantly.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r43","rowIndex":43,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「今日はこれ以上ここで話し合いをする気にはなれない。帰らせていただく。……おい、<tips=28>トーマス</tips>帰るぞ」","en":"“I have no desire to discuss anything further here today. I will take my leave. ...<tips=28>Thomas</tips>, we’re going.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r44","rowIndex":44,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　相手の返事も待たず、あたふたとする息子を連れて部屋を出て行った。","en":"Without waiting for an answer, he left the room with his flustered son in tow.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r45","rowIndex":45,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　こうして、<tips=39>ジェフリー</tips>を代表とする執行部と、<tips=27>廖志明</tips>の対立は表面化することになった。","en":"Thus the conflict between <tips=27>Liao Chi-ming</tips> and the executive led by <tips=39>Jeffrey</tips> came into the open.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r46","rowIndex":46,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しかし、だからといって急に何かが起こったわけでもないが、この会議と前後して、街には怪文書が出回るようになる。それは、<tips=39>ジェフリー</tips>が愛人と裸で抱き合っている姿を盗撮した画像に、彼の不道徳さを面白おかしく非難する文章が添えられたものだ。","en":"That did not produce any sudden event by itself. Around the time of the meeting, however, anonymous broadsheets began circulating through the city. Each combined a clandestine photograph of <tips=39>Jeffrey</tips> naked in an embrace with his mistress and a piece of writing that gleefully denounced his immorality.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r47","rowIndex":47,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=39>ジェフリー</tips>たち執行部は<tips=27>廖志明</tips>が何らかの形で関わっているのだと考えたが、何の証拠も見つけることが出来ず、その後もネットに音声や動画なども公開され、ただひたすら<tips=39>ジェフリー</tips>が街の笑いものにされ続けた。","en":"<tips=39>Jeffrey</tips> and the rest of the executive believed <tips=27>Liao Chi-ming</tips> was involved somehow, but could find no evidence. Audio recordings, videos, and the like continued to appear online, while <tips=39>Jeffrey</tips> simply went on being made the laughingstock of the city.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r48","rowIndex":48,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「おい見ろよ。新作だ。このみっともない姿を。あの男、堅物そうに見えてとんでもない変態だな」","en":"“Hey, look. A new one. Just look at the state of him. He puts on such a straitlaced act, but underneath it all, he's one hell of a pervert.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"廖志明","displayName":"Liao Chi-ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r49","rowIndex":49,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=28>トミー</tips>こと<tips=28>トーマス・リャオ</tips>が自宅のリビングルームで<tips=29>アイス</tips>と共に映画鑑賞をしていると、父の<tips=27>廖志明</tips>がタブレット型端末を手にして、やたらとウキウキしながら満面の笑顔で部屋に入って来たのである。","en":"<tips=28>Tommy</tips>—that is, <tips=28>Thomas Liao</tips>—was watching a movie with <tips=29>Ice</tips> in the living room of their home when his father, <tips=27>Liao Chi-ming</tips>, came into the room carrying a tablet, grinning from ear to ear and almost absurdly excited.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r50","rowIndex":50,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　一体なにをそんなに浮かれているのかと画面に目をやると、どこかのビルの一室で、<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>の最高幹部となった<tips=39>ジェフリー・ウォン</tips>と、若い女が裸で抱き合っている。女はこちらに背中を向け、下になった<tips=39>ジェフリー</tips>のもだえる表情がしっかりととらえられている。","en":"Wondering what had him so excited, Thomas looked at the screen. In a room in some building, <tips=39>Jeffrey Wong</tips>, now one of <tips=7>YS’s</tips> top executives, and a young woman were embracing naked. The woman had her back to the camera, while the writhing expression of <tips=39>Jeffrey</tips>, beneath her, had been captured in full.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r51","rowIndex":51,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「傑作だろう？　あの生真面目ぶった男が、真っ昼間からこんなボロアパートでお楽しみなんだ。これが街中にばらまかれている。一体、やつはどんな顔をしているんだろうなあ？」","en":"“A masterpiece, isn’t it? That man puts on such a straitlaced act, yet here he is enjoying himself in a dump like this in broad daylight. This is being spread all over town. I wonder what sort of face he’s making now.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"廖志明","displayName":"Liao Chi-ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r52","rowIndex":52,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「父さん、そんな可哀想な写真はみたくないよ」","en":"“Dad, I don't want to look at such a pitiful picture.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r53","rowIndex":53,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=28>トーマス</tips>は苦い顔をして目を背ける。","en":"<tips=28>Thomas</tips> grimaced and turned away.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r54","rowIndex":54,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「何が可哀想なもんか。これは身から出た錆というんだ」","en":"“What’s there to feel sorry for? He’s only reaping what he sowed.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"廖志明","displayName":"Liao Chi-ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r55","rowIndex":55,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「錆なら父さんの方が一杯出るじゃないか」","en":"“In that case, Dad, you’ve got quite a harvest coming.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r56","rowIndex":56,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=28>トーマス</tips>が言うとおり、こと関係を持った愛人の数ならば、<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>幹部のなかでも<tips=27>廖志明</tips>が飛び抜けているだろう。","en":"As <tips=28>Thomas</tips> implied, among all the officers of <tips=7>YS</tips>, <tips=27>Liao Chi-ming</tips> probably stood unrivaled in the number of mistresses he had taken.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r57","rowIndex":57,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼の女好きは街でも知らぬものがいないほどで、関係を持つためのその強引な手法と、やたらと金髪碧眼の女性ばかりを選ぶというわかりやすい趣味から、彼に対する嫌悪や軽蔑の一因となっていた。","en":"His womanizing was known to virtually everyone in the city. The forceful methods he used to get women into bed, coupled with his transparent preference for blond-haired, blue-eyed women, were one source of the disgust and contempt he inspired.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r58","rowIndex":58,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ふん」","en":"“Hmph.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"廖志明","displayName":"Liao Chi-ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r59","rowIndex":59,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=27>廖志明</tips>は鼻で笑うと、","en":"<tips=27>Liao Chi-ming</tips> snorted.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r60","rowIndex":60,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「おれの場合は『英雄色を好む』と言うんだ」","en":"“In my case, the saying is, ‘A hero is known by his love of women.’”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"廖志明","displayName":"Liao Chi-ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r61","rowIndex":61,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　悪びれる様子もなく、<tips=28>トーマス</tips>の斜め前に置かれたソファーに腰をおろす。","en":"Without the slightest sign of shame, he sat down on the sofa diagonally across from <tips=28>Thomas</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r62","rowIndex":62,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=29>アイス</tips>がファミリーのボスである<tips=27>廖</tips>との同席を遠慮して席を立とうとすると、それを手で制して、","en":"When <tips=29>Ice</tips> made to rise out of deference to <tips=27>Liao</tips>, the head of the family, he motioned for her to remain seated.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r63","rowIndex":63,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「おれはこんな間抜けな写真を撮られるようなことはないし、万一そんなものが出回ったって屁でもない。腹は立つが、今更そんなものではおれの立場は揺るがないのはわかっているからな。<tips=28>トーマス</tips>よ、本物の実力者というものはそういうものだ」","en":"“I would never let an idiotic photograph like this be taken, and even if one did circulate, I wouldn’t give a damn. I would be angry, but I know something like that could no longer shake my position. <tips=28>Thomas</tips>, that is what a man of genuine power looks like.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"廖志明","displayName":"Liao Chi-ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r64","rowIndex":64,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　手にしたタブレットを、急に興味がなくなったようなつまらない顔をして放り投げる。","en":"He tossed the tablet aside and abruptly looked bored, as though it no longer interested him.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r65","rowIndex":65,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「しかし<tips=39>ジェフリー・ウォン</tips>は違うだろうよ。あいつは世間の評判や、組織の人間が自分をどう思ってるのか、気になって仕方がない人間だ。街中で噂され、笑われ、目の前の人間も内心ではあの写真を思い出して軽蔑しているのだと想像すると、気が狂いそうな気分だろう」","en":"“But <tips=39>Jeffrey Wong</tips> is different. He is the sort of man who cannot stop worrying about his public reputation or what people inside the organization think of him. With the whole town gossiping and laughing, he’ll imagine that even the person before him is remembering that photograph and despising him in secret. It must feel as though he’s going mad.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"廖志明","displayName":"Liao Chi-ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r66","rowIndex":66,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=27>廖</tips>はそう言って、テーブルの上に置かれた彼のための葉巻を手に取り、宝石のついたシガーカッターで先端をカットした。","en":"<tips=27>Liao</tips> selected one of the cigars laid on the table for him and clipped its tip with a jeweled cutter.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r67","rowIndex":67,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「でも僕は、こんなやりかたは好きじゃないな」","en":"“Even so, I don't like doing things this way.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r68","rowIndex":68,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　街では、一連の<tips=39>ジェフリー・ウォン</tips>への中傷騒ぎは<tips=27>廖志明</tips>の仕業だと言われている。<tips=28>トーマス</tips>は<tips=27>廖</tips>が犯人であるという情報を直接目にしたわけではないが、そうした噂はほぼ事実であろうと推測していた。","en":"The campaign against <tips=39>Jeffrey Wong’s</tips> reputation was widely rumored to be <tips=27>Liao Chi-ming’s</tips> work. <tips=28>Thomas</tips> had seen no direct evidence that <tips=27>Liao</tips> was responsible, but considered the rumor almost certainly true.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r69","rowIndex":69,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうかい？　おれはなかなか痛快だがね。誰が犯人だかは知らないが」","en":"“Don't you? I find it rather exhilarating myself. Not that I have any idea who's responsible.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"廖志明","displayName":"Liao Chi-ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r70","rowIndex":70,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=27>廖</tips>は白々しくそう言って、葉巻を咥え、火を付ける。","en":"With that transparent denial, <tips=27>Liao</tips> put the cigar between his lips and lit it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r71","rowIndex":71,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"（その誰かというのは父さんじゃないかなあ？　陰険で姑息で、そして相手が一番いやがりそうな……父さんなら、いかにもやりかねない方法だと思うよ）","en":"(Isn’t that ‘whoever’ you, Dad? It’s insidious and underhanded, and it attacks precisely where its victim will suffer most. It seems exactly like the sort of method you would use.)","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r72","rowIndex":72,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=28>トーマス</tips>は、父親のことを尊敬している。しかし、その性格に対しては、ついていけない部分があるのも事実だ。","en":"<tips=28>Thomas</tips> respected his father. It was nevertheless true that there were parts of the man’s character he simply could not go along with.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r73","rowIndex":73,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"（父さんはあまりにもリアリストで、おそらく僕はそういう部分が弱いんだろう。<tips=2>阿亮</tips>どころか、<tips=36>アウロラ</tips>とか<tips=24>美美</tips>と比べても、どうも僕はだめだ）","en":"(Dad is such an uncompromising realist. I suppose that's where I'm weak. Forget <tips=2>Ah Leung</tips>—even compared with <tips=36>Aurora</tips> or <tips=24>Meimei</tips>, I just don't measure up.)","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r74","rowIndex":74,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　平然と煙草をふかす父を見ながら、そんな風に自分の能力を疑ってしまうのだ。","en":"As he watched his father calmly puff on his cigar, Thomas found himself questioning his own abilities.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r75","rowIndex":75,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=27>廖志明</tips>は大変な女好きで、数知れない女たちと関係を持ったが、どうも彼の肉体は生殖能力に問題があるようで、実際に生まれた子供は行きずりのアメリカ人との間に生まれた<tips=28>トーマス</tips>ただ一人であった。","en":"<tips=27>Liao Chi-ming</tips> was an inveterate womanizer who had slept with more women than anyone could count. Apparently, however, he had difficulty fathering children. <tips=28>Thomas</tips>, born to an American woman from a casual encounter, was his only child.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r76","rowIndex":76,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　当然彼はこの一人息子を自分の後継ぎとするべく幼い頃から英才教育を施したのだが、母は息子がギャングになることを好まず、<tips=28>トーマス</tips>を連れて祖国に帰ってしまう。<tips=27>廖</tips>はなんとか息子を取り戻そうとしたが、遠いアメリカの地では彼の影響力は知れている。数年にわたる交渉の結果、ようやく街に呼び戻したのが、三年前のことであった。","en":"Naturally, he had given his only son an elite education from early childhood, intending him to be his heir. But the boy’s mother did not want her son becoming a gangster, and took <tips=28>Thomas</tips> back to her homeland. <tips=27>Liao</tips> did everything he could to get his son back, but in distant America his influence extended only so far. It was three years ago, after several years of negotiations, that he finally managed to bring him back to the city.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r77","rowIndex":77,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　かくして<tips=28>トーマス</tips>は、生まれてから暫くはギャングの御曹司、学生時代はアメリカの平凡な学生として過ごし、そして再びマフィアの後継者として街に戻って来るというなんとも落ち着かない半生を、彼の意志など全く関与しない両親の意志のみによって歩まされてきたわけだが、しかし彼はそれで両親に敵意を持ったり、境遇を嘆いたりしたことはなかった。","en":"<tips=28>Thomas</tips> had therefore spent his early childhood as the son of a gang lord, his school years as an ordinary American student, and then returned to the city as a mafia heir. It was a thoroughly unsettled life, directed solely by his parents’ wishes with no regard for his own. Yet he had never resented his parents or lamented his circumstances.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r78","rowIndex":78,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　普通ならばそうした感情はあって当然だろう。彼はどこか抜け落ちているのか、或いは途方もないお人好しなのか、両親の攻撃的なやりとりを哀しく思うことはあっても、自分が一方的に振り回されているという事実については何も考えなかった。","en":"Such feelings would have been perfectly natural. Perhaps he lacked something other people possessed; perhaps he was good-natured beyond all measure. His parents’ hostile exchanges made him sad, but he gave no thought to the fact that they were unilaterally tossing his life back and forth between them.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r79","rowIndex":79,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　もしそれを誰かに指摘されたならば、","en":"If anyone pointed this out to him, he would probably say—","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r80","rowIndex":80,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いやあ、ごめんなさい。言われてみれば確かにそうなんですが、ちょっと、そこまで考えが及びませんでした」","en":"“Oh, I’m sorry. Now that you mention it, you’re certainly right. I simply hadn’t thought that far.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r81","rowIndex":81,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　と照れ笑いをするだろう。","en":"—with an embarrassed laugh.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r82","rowIndex":82,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　こうした息子の資質を、父である<tips=27>廖志明</tips>は、欠点というよりも希有な才能として最大限評価していた。","en":"His father, <tips=27>Liao Chi-ming</tips>, valued this quality in his son to the utmost, regarding it as a rare gift rather than a defect.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r83","rowIndex":83,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「お前には王者の風格がある」","en":"“You have the bearing of a king.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r84","rowIndex":84,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　先日も、真顔で息子にそう言った。","en":"Only the other day, he had said the same thing to his son with a completely straight face.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r85","rowIndex":85,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>の最も優れたところは、その<tips=16>タイプA</tips>能力でも、勇気や行動力でもない。あいつには妙な愛嬌があった。喋り方か、表情か、性格か、具体的に何がそうさせたのかはわからんが、その背景や人種などを越えて、あいつの言うことなら仕方ないと許せてしまうんだよ。だから、<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>のようなものを作り上げることが出来た。今の執行部の連中にはそれはない。とてもまとめ上げることは出来ないだろう。私ならば別の方法で<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>を率いることが出来るだろうが、<tips=3>クリス</tips>のようなやりかたは不可能だ。私は抜け目なくすべてにわたって優秀だが、それゆえにあのような愛嬌はない。しかし、<tips=28>トーマス</tips>、お前にはそれがある」","en":"“<tips=3>Chris Tse’s</tips> greatest gift was not his <tips=16>Type A</tips> ability, nor his courage or capacity for action. He had a peculiar charm. I couldn’t tell you exactly where it came from—his way of speaking, his expressions, his personality—but it crossed every boundary of background and race. If Chris said it, people felt there was nothing to be done; they forgave him. That was how he built something like <tips=7>YS</tips>. The current executives have none of that. They could never hold <tips=7>YS</tips> together. I could lead it by other means, but I could never do it <tips=3>Chris’s</tips> way. I am shrewd and superior in every respect, and that is precisely why I lack his kind of charm. But you have it, <tips=28>Thomas</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r86","rowIndex":86,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　冗談でもなく、本気でそう言っているらしい。","en":"He appeared to mean every word, with not a trace of humor.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r87","rowIndex":87,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あの御曹司はこの街から学校に行く程度は賢いのもしれないが、父親の最も重要な資質は受け継いでいない。もしあいつが<tips=81>龍頭</tips>になったとしても力不足だよ」","en":"“That young master may be smart enough to leave this city for school, but he inherited none of his father’s most important quality. Even if he became <tips=81>Longtou</tips>, he would not be up to the role.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r88","rowIndex":88,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうかなあ」","en":"“I wonder.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r89","rowIndex":89,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=28>トーマス</tips>は父の言うことに素直に頷けない。","en":"<tips=28>Thomas</tips> could not simply nod along with what his father was saying.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r90","rowIndex":90,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>謝亮</tips>のことは子供の頃から親に連れられたパーティなどで会って知っているが、彼が<tips=28>トーマス</tips>と会っている時以外は<tips=1>菅原亮</tips>という名で素性を隠して生活していたことを知ったのはつい最近のことだ。","en":"He had known <tips=1>Tse Leung</tips> since childhood, having met him at parties his parents took him to. But it was only recently that he learned that, whenever Tse Leung was not meeting <tips=28>Thomas</tips>, he hid his identity and lived under the name <tips=1>Ryo Sugawara</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r91","rowIndex":91,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>菅原亮</tips>と言えば、この<tips=9>Y地区</tips>の不良少年の間では相当の名前だったと聞いている。ファミリーの若い者と話すとみなその名を知っていて、今回その正体があの<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>の息子だったという事実が広く知られることになったのだが、驚きつつも納得しているようだった。","en":"Thomas had heard that <tips=1>Ryo Sugawara</tips> had made quite a name for himself among the young delinquents of <tips=9>Y District</tips>. Every young gangster Thomas spoke with knew the name. Now it had become widely known that Ryo was the son of <tips=3>Chris Tse</tips>, and although they were surprised, they also seemed to find the truth perfectly fitting.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r92","rowIndex":92,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=28>トーマス</tips>自身は街の不良少年と関わったこともなく、そういった世界を知らないが、しかし<tips=1>謝亮</tips>のように親や家族の後ろ盾なくして頭角を現せるかといえばまったくそんな自信はない。不可能だろう。","en":"<tips=28>Thomas</tips> himself had never associated with the town’s young delinquents and knew nothing of their world. But he had no confidence at all that, without the support of his parents or family, he could have distinguished himself as <tips=1>Tse Leung</tips> had. It would have been impossible.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r93","rowIndex":93,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして今回、自ら武器を取ってあの悪名高いサイキックの<tips=26>劉建志</tips>を襲撃し、見事倒した。屈強な<tips=26>劉</tips>の仲間もろとも皆殺しにしたのだ。これでもう、彼をただの御曹司とからかうものはいないだろう。立派なギャングの仲間入りである。これだって絶対に自分には不可能だ。おびえてその場で立ちすくむだけだろう。","en":"And now he had taken up a weapon himself, attacked the notorious psychic <tips=26>Ryu Kenshi</tips>, and defeated him. He had slaughtered <tips=26>Ryu’s</tips> formidable companions along with him. No one would mock him as merely a young master anymore. He was a bona fide gangster now. Thomas could never have done that either. He would only have frozen in terror on the spot.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r94","rowIndex":94,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　父は過小評価しているようだが、もし<tips=1>謝亮</tips>がボスになれば、同世代の若者の多くはあの<tips=1>菅原亮</tips>がボスならと信頼して支持をするのではないだろうか？　そういう若者は街には多いだろうし、<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>のなかにもいる。我らが<tips=74>廖ファミリー</tips>のなかにも、かつて彼と親しかったというような人間がいるかもしれない。","en":"Father seemed to underestimate him. But if <tips=1>Tse Leung</tips> became the boss, wouldn’t many of the young people of their generation place their trust in him and offer their support because he was that same <tips=1>Ryo Sugawara</tips>? There must be many such young people in the city, some of them within <tips=7>YS</tips>. There might even be people in our own <tips=74>Liao Family</tips> who had once been close to him.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r95","rowIndex":95,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　繰り返すが、街で暴虐の振る舞いを重ねてきた<tips=26>劉建志</tips>を自ら武器を手にして処刑したのだ。さらにその少し前には、<tips=57>滑走路通り</tips>で子供と警官を食い殺した虎を倒し、市民を救ったという。その勇気と行動力と公平性を讃え、父親の<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>の再来だと言う人もいる。","en":"To repeat: he had taken up a weapon himself and executed <tips=26>Ryu Kenshi</tips>, who had committed outrage after outrage in the city. A little earlier, he was also said to have defeated the tiger that had devoured a child and a police officer on <tips=57>Runway Street</tips>, thereby saving the citizens. Some praised his courage, initiative, and impartiality, calling him the second coming of his father, <tips=3>Chris Tse</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r96","rowIndex":96,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=28>トーマス</tips>にすれば、もう彼は既に英雄的な人物で、あこがれこそすれ自分と比較する気にはなれない。","en":"To <tips=28>Thomas</tips>, he was already a heroic figure—someone to admire, not someone he could imagine comparing himself with.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r97","rowIndex":97,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ああいう人こそ人と戦って勝つために生まれてきたような感じがするけれど」","en":"“He seems like someone born to fight people and win.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r98","rowIndex":98,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「確かにあの御曹司はなかなか派手なめぐりあわせをする星の下に生まれたようだ。だが真の王者はそういうものではないんだよ。あの御曹司には器はない。しかし、<tips=28>トーマス</tips>。お前は違うんだ。お前は私にもないものを持っている。あの小僧が覇王項羽ならば、お前は高祖劉邦だ。ゆくゆくはお前がこの街の頂点に立ち、君臨することになる。私はそのために、今の執行部を駆逐しなくてはならない。彼らに任せていては、せっかく出来上がった<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>という巨大組織がまた分裂してしまう。これは実にもったいない話だ」","en":"“That young master does seem to have been born under a star destined for one dramatic turn of fortune after another. But that is not what makes a true king. He lacks the stature for it. You are different, <tips=28>Thomas</tips>. You possess something even I do not. If that boy is Xiang Yu, the Hegemon-King, then you are Gaozu, Liu Bang. In time, you will stand at the summit of this city and reign over it. To make that happen, I must drive out the present executive. If we leave <tips=7>YS</tips> in their hands, this great organization we have built will fragment once more. That would be a terrible waste.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r99","rowIndex":99,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　真に迫った父の言葉に、<tips=28>トーマス</tips>はくすぐったいような、父親が冷静な判断力を失っているのを心配してしまうような、複雑な感情を抱かざるを得ない。","en":"The conviction in his father’s words left <tips=28>Thomas</tips> with complicated feelings: a sort of flattered embarrassment mingled with concern that his father had lost his capacity for sound judgment.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r100","rowIndex":100,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"（本当なのかなあ？　父さんは人を見る目はあるって話だけれども、どうもこの発言に関してはただの親馬鹿のような気がする）","en":"(Can that really be true? They say Dad has an eye for people, but when it comes to this, he sounds like nothing more than a doting parent.)","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r101","rowIndex":101,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　いずれにしても、今彼がそういう立場に立っているわけでもないし、将来そのような仕事に立たされたとしても自分に出来ることをやるだけだろうし、そこで実績を作らなければ何の意味もないのだ。","en":"In any case, Thomas held no such position now. If he were ever entrusted with that sort of responsibility, he would simply do whatever he could. Until he had actual accomplishments to show for it, none of this meant anything.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r102","rowIndex":102,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　才能があると言われても何も成していない状態では何の自信にもならないし、何か絵に描いた餅の話をされているような、彼にとっては何か現実味のない話題だった。そもそもこんなことを言うのはこの父だけなのである。","en":"Being told that he possessed talent could give him no confidence when he had accomplished nothing. It all felt like pie in the sky, a subject with no reality to it for him. To begin with, his father was the only person who ever said such things.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r103","rowIndex":103,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　だから彼は、いつも父から期待の言葉を貰っても、なかなかその気にならずに読書やスポーツを好み、人当たりやわらかく、街の情勢が移りつつあることは適度に心配しながら、マイペースに毎日を過ごすのであった。","en":"And so, no matter how often his father voiced his expectations, Thomas could never quite feel moved to act on them. As always, he favored books and sports, remained gentle in his dealings with others, and lived each day at his own pace while maintaining a measured concern for the city’s changing situation.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r104","rowIndex":104,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=27>廖志明</tips>はそんな一粒種の息子を、もどかしく思いながらも溺愛している。","en":"<tips=27>Liao Chi-ming</tips> doted upon his only son despite the frustration Thomas caused him.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r105","rowIndex":105,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=39>ジェフリー・ウォン</tips>の写真についての話題は終わり、父と息子で古い映画の話などをしていると、ドアをノックして、背の高い男が入って来た。","en":"The subject of <tips=39>Jeffrey Wong’s</tips> photograph had given way to a conversation between father and son about old movies when there came a knock at the door and a tall man entered.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r106","rowIndex":106,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　金色の髪。白い肌。目は灰色とも青色ともつかない。典型的なアングロサクソンの特徴を有した人物だった。","en":"Golden hair. White skin. Eyes that were neither quite gray nor quite blue. He was a man with typically Anglo-Saxon features.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r107","rowIndex":107,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その男は、『<tips=23>エリオット</tips>』という本名だか偽名だか分からぬファーストネームだけで知られる人物で、<tips=27>廖志明</tips>のボディーガードを務めていた。","en":"The man was known only by the first name ‘<tips=23>Elliott</tips>,’ which might or might not have been genuine, and served as <tips=27>Liao Chi-ming’s</tips> bodyguard.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r108","rowIndex":108,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ボス、例の件が片付いたそうですぜ」","en":"“Boss, it seems that business has been taken care of.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エリオット・ネス","displayName":"Eliot Ness","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r109","rowIndex":109,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=23>エリオット</tips>は無精ひげにかこまれた唇でそう言うと、断りもせずに空いた席に腰掛ける。","en":"<tips=23>Elliott</tips> spoke, his mouth framed by stubble, then took an empty seat without asking permission.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r110","rowIndex":110,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　元軍人という触れ込みである彼の肉体は、逞しくはあったが必要以上に筋肉で膨らんでいるわけでもなく、鋼のように引きしまった実用的なものだった。これまでも<tips=27>廖志明</tips>の危機を幾度となく救い、危険の芽を未然に察知し、そして時折見せる射撃の腕前は人々の評判になるほどで、態度は失礼であったが<tips=27>廖</tips>には多大な信頼を寄せられている。","en":"Though reputed to be a former soldier, he was powerfully built without being swollen by needless muscle, his functional physique taut as steel. He had saved <tips=27>Liao Chi-ming</tips> from danger many times, detected threats before they could ripen, and earned a public reputation for the shooting skill he occasionally displayed. Despite his insolent manner, he enjoyed <tips=27>Liao’s</tips> immense trust.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r111","rowIndex":111,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　口辺には常にゆるやかな笑みを浮かべていたが、<tips=28>トーマス</tips>には、その目に常に悲しみが湛えられているように見えた。","en":"A gentle smile always played at the corners of his mouth, but <tips=28>Thomas</tips> thought he could see an abiding sadness in Elliott’s eyes.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r112","rowIndex":112,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=28>トーマス</tips>はこの自分の事情をあまりにも語りたがらないボディーガードがどんな人生を送ってきたのか興味があったので、一度深い話をしてみたかったが、フランクな態度の奥に何か冷たい威圧感のようなものがあり、どうしても気後れしてしまって言葉が口の中にこもってしまう。","en":"<tips=28>Thomas</tips> was curious what kind of life this bodyguard, who was so reluctant to talk about himself, had led, and wanted to have a serious conversation with him at least once. Yet behind the man’s frank manner lay something cold and intimidating; Thomas could never quite overcome his diffidence, and the words stayed trapped in his mouth.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r113","rowIndex":113,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうか。被害は？」","en":"“I see. What was the damage?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"廖志明","displayName":"Liao Chi-ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r114","rowIndex":114,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=27>廖志明</tips>が短く問うと、","en":"<tips=27>Liao Chi-ming</tips> asked the question curtly.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r115","rowIndex":115,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「壁紙とカーペットは取り替えた方がよさそうですな」","en":"“The wallpaper and carpet should probably be replaced.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エリオット・ネス","displayName":"Eliot Ness","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r116","rowIndex":116,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=23>エリオット</tips>は卓上の葉巻を断りもなく三本つかみ取り、そのうち二本をポケットにしまいながらそう言った。","en":"<tips=23>Elliott</tips> took three cigars from the table without so much as asking and slipped two of them into his pocket as he said this.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r117","rowIndex":117,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なんの話？」","en":"“What are you talking about?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r118","rowIndex":118,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=28>トーマス</tips>がふと尋ねると、","en":"<tips=28>Thomas</tips> found himself asking.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r119","rowIndex":119,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「お、仕事に興味があるのか？」","en":"“Oh? Taking an interest in the business?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"廖志明","displayName":"Liao Chi-ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r120","rowIndex":120,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「興味というか……」","en":"“I wouldn’t call it interest...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r121","rowIndex":121,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=23>エリオット</tips>。画像があるだろ。<tips=28>トーマス</tips>の携帯に送ってやれ」","en":"“<tips=23>Elliott</tips>, you have the picture. Send it to <tips=28>Thomas’s</tips> phone.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"廖志明","displayName":"Liao Chi-ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r122","rowIndex":122,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　画像と聞いて嫌な予感しかしなかったが、実際送られたものを開くとまったくその予感通りで目眩がしそうだった。","en":"The mention of a picture gave Thomas an immediate sense of dread. When he opened the image, it was exactly what he had feared, and the sight nearly made him faint.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r123","rowIndex":123,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　どこかの一般家庭の絨毯の上に、頭を撃ち抜かれた中年男性が仰向けで転がっている。","en":"A middle-aged man lay on his back on the carpet of an ordinary home, shot through the head.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r124","rowIndex":124,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「こいつは貸金の事務所で雇ってやった男なんだがな、帳簿をちょろまかして顧客の金を横領していたんだ」","en":"“We employed this man at one of our lending offices, but he tampered with the accounts and embezzled the customers’ money.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"廖志明","displayName":"Liao Chi-ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r125","rowIndex":125,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　一瞥しただけで気分が悪くなり、画像を閉じた<tips=28>トーマス</tips>に<tips=27>廖</tips>は穏やかに説明をする。","en":"<tips=28>Thomas</tips> closed the image after a single nauseating glance, while <tips=27>Liao</tips> explained in a mild voice.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r126","rowIndex":126,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=28>トーマス</tips>は、","en":"<tips=28>Thomas</tips> thought—","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r127","rowIndex":127,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"（女子学生が友だちとの集合写真を送るみたいに気軽に惨殺死体の画像を送るのはやめてほしいんだけどなあ……）","en":"(I wish they wouldn’t send pictures of slaughtered bodies as casually as schoolgirls share group photographs with their friends...)","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r128","rowIndex":128,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　と思うが口に出せない。","en":"—but could not bring himself to say it aloud.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r129","rowIndex":129,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「充分な給料はやっていた筈なのに、馬鹿なことをする。真面目に働いて、おれに尽くしていれば、はした金を盗むとるよりもっと素晴らしいものに手が届いたんだがなあ。信頼を損ねるまねをするからすべてを失うことになった。……<tips=28>トーマス</tips>、この世の中で大事なものは信頼だ。信頼の価値を理解し、やりとりすることが出来るものだけが、効率的に人や金を動かすことが出来るのだ。そうだろ<tips=23>エリオット</tips>？」","en":"“He was paid well enough, and still he did something so foolish. Had he worked diligently and devoted himself to me, he could have attained far greater things than the pittance he stole. Instead, he betrayed my trust and lost everything. ...<tips=28>Thomas</tips>, trust is what matters in this world. Only those who understand its value and know how to exchange it can move people and money efficiently. Isn’t that right, <tips=23>Elliott</tips>?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"廖志明","displayName":"Liao Chi-ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r130","rowIndex":130,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　葉巻をふかしはじめた<tips=23>エリオット</tips>にそう尋ねる。","en":"He put the question to <tips=23>Elliott</tips>, who had begun puffing on a cigar.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r131","rowIndex":131,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いやあ、どうですかねえ。私には込み入ったことはわかりませんな」","en":"“Well, who can say? Complicated matters are beyond me.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エリオット・ネス","displayName":"Eliot Ness","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r132","rowIndex":132,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=23>エリオット</tips>は口元にいつもの笑顔を浮かべたまま答える。","en":"<tips=23>Elliott</tips> answered with his usual faint smile.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r133","rowIndex":133,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まったく、お前はそうやっていつもはぐらかす。それはいかん」","en":"“Honestly, you always dodge the question like that. It’s a bad habit.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"廖志明","displayName":"Liao Chi-ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r134","rowIndex":134,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それに、信頼の話なら、<tips=26>劉建志</tips>を処刑した執行部は完全に正しいってことじゃないですか」","en":"“Besides, if we’re talking about trust, wouldn’t that mean the leadership was entirely right to execute <tips=26>Ryu Kenshi</tips>?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エリオット・ネス","displayName":"Eliot Ness","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r135","rowIndex":135,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そりゃ正しいよ。おれでもああいう馬鹿は早いうちに殺す。なあ、<tips=23>エリオット</tips>、お前はなかなか賢い男だと思うが、どうしていつまで経ってもおれを理解しない？」","en":"“Of course they were right. I’d have killed a fool like that early on myself. You’re a fairly clever man, <tips=23>Elliott</tips>, so why is it that after all this time you still don’t understand me?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"廖志明","displayName":"Liao Chi-ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r136","rowIndex":136,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=27>廖</tips>が不機嫌になって<tips=23>エリオット</tips>に説教をはじめるのを聞きながら、<tips=28>トーマス</tips>は血を見たショックから脱しきれぬまま、目眩をもてあましている。","en":"As <tips=27>Liao</tips> grew irritable and began lecturing <tips=23>Elliott</tips>, <tips=28>Thomas</tips> sat fighting dizziness, still shaken by the sight of blood.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r137","rowIndex":137,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼は父のことは好きだったが、この、あまりにも簡単に人を殺すところだけはどうしても馴染むことが出来ないと感じていた。","en":"He loved his father, but felt he could never grow accustomed to the ease with which the man killed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r138","rowIndex":138,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ねえ<tips=29>アイス</tips>、父さんは<tips=2>阿亮</tips>のところと争うつもりなのかなあ？」","en":"“<tips=29>Ice</tips>, do you think Dad means to fight <tips=2>Ah Leung’s</tips> group?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r139","rowIndex":139,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私室で二人きりになると、<tips=28>トーマス</tips>は溜息と共にそう呟いた。","en":"Once they were alone in his private room, <tips=28>Thomas</tips> murmured the question with a sigh.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r140","rowIndex":140,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　時間は二十時を過ぎたところだ。二十四時間騒がしいこの街も、<tips=74>廖ファミリー</tips>の根城であるこの辺りの路地は、昼でもひっそりと静まりかえっている。","en":"It was just past eight in the evening. The city was noisy around the clock, yet the alleys surrounding the <tips=74>Liao Family’s</tips> stronghold remained hushed and still even by day.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r141","rowIndex":141,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　父の<tips=27>廖志明</tips>は夕食をとると言ってそそくさと屋敷を出て行ったきり帰って来ない。どこぞの女の家で暮らしているのだろう。ボディーガードの<tips=23>エリオット</tips>は、こうもあちこちの女の家に遊びに行ってはとても身の安全は保証出来ないとはっきり宣言しているが、彼はやめようとしない。","en":"His father, <tips=27>Liao Chi-ming</tips>, had hurried out of the residence saying that he was going to dinner and had yet to return. He was probably staying at some woman’s home. <tips=23>Elliott</tips>, his bodyguard, had plainly told him that no one could guarantee his safety if he kept visiting women all over the city, but Liao refused to stop.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r142","rowIndex":142,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　あれだけ女遊びの激しい父が、その女のことで<tips=39>ジェフリー・ウォン</tips>を中傷しているという図式をトーマスは奇妙に感じる。いや、本人は自分は関与していないと口では言っていたが、おそらく間違いないだろうと<tips=28>トーマス</tips>は思っている。街の大部分の人間が同じであろう。","en":"Thomas found something strange about the spectacle of his notoriously womanizing father slandering <tips=39>Jeffrey Wong</tips> over that woman. True, his father had said he was not involved, but <tips=28>Thomas</tips> believed that he almost certainly was. Most people in the city probably thought the same.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r143","rowIndex":143,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　こんな女好きに女のことで中傷される<tips=39>ジェフリー・ウォン</tips>も気の毒だ。","en":"It was hard not to feel sorry for <tips=39>Jeffrey Wong</tips>, slandered over a woman by such an inveterate womanizer.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r144","rowIndex":144,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=76>香港派</tips>の重要人物であり、先代<tips=81>龍頭</tips><tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>の片腕だった<tips=39>ジェフリー・ウォン</tips>について、<tips=28>トーマス</tips>はそれほど深く知っているわけではない。しかし、真面目で責任感の強い人物だということは知っている。","en":"<tips=28>Thomas</tips> did not know <tips=39>Jeffrey Wong</tips>—an important member of the <tips=76>Hong Kong faction</tips> and former <tips=81>Longtou</tips> <tips=3>Chris Tse’s</tips> right-hand man—especially well. He did know that Jeffrey was earnest and had a powerful sense of responsibility.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r145","rowIndex":145,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そんな人物が妻の他に愛人を持っているというのは意外にも思えるが、写真を撮影した時期が<tips=3>クリス</tips>が病に倒れてからのものらしいことからすると、責任感が強いがためのプレッシャーが彼を苦しめていたのだろう。魔が差してしまうのも人情的には許されるはずだ。","en":"It was surprising that such a man would have a mistress as well as a wife. But the photograph appeared to have been taken after <tips=3>Chris</tips> fell ill, and perhaps the pressure born of Jeffrey’s very sense of responsibility had been weighing on him. A moment of weakness ought to be humanly forgivable.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r146","rowIndex":146,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しかし世間は心なく彼を笑うだろうし、本人はひどく傷つくだろう。……犯人が父ならば、それを狙ったに違いないが。","en":"The public would laugh at him without pity, however, and he would be deeply wounded. ...If Thomas’s father was responsible, that must have been precisely what he intended.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r147","rowIndex":147,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「お話を伺っている限り、そうお考えではないかと」","en":"“From what I have heard him say, I believe that is what he intends.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アイス","displayName":"Ice","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r148","rowIndex":148,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　普段は驚くほど無口な<tips=29>アイス</tips>も、主人の<tips=28>トーマス</tips>に尋ねられれば普通に言葉を返す。","en":"<tips=29>Ice</tips> was ordinarily quiet to an astonishing degree, but she answered readily whenever her master, <tips=28>Thomas</tips>, asked her a question.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r149","rowIndex":149,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あんなビラをまけば、相手も怒るよね。当然父さんの仕業だと思うだろうし。そうやって、喧嘩を売らせようとしているのかなあ」","en":"“Scattering broadsheets like those is bound to make the other side angry. They’ll naturally assume Dad did it. Is he trying to provoke them into starting a fight?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r150","rowIndex":150,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それは……私の口からはなんとも申し上げられません」","en":"“That... is not for me to say.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アイス","displayName":"Ice","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r151","rowIndex":151,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「もし争いになったとして、人が死んだりするような事態になると思う？」","en":"“If there is a conflict, do you think it could reach the point where people die?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r152","rowIndex":152,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「わかりません。……その場合はお互いただでは済みませんから、簡単にはそこまで至らないとは思いますが、後に引けないままエスカレートすれば、或いは」","en":"“I don’t know. ...Neither side would emerge unscathed, so I don’t believe they will go that far easily. But if matters escalate until neither can retreat, then perhaps...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アイス","displayName":"Ice","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r153","rowIndex":153,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「困ったな。そんなのはちょっと、嫌だな……」","en":"“That’s troubling. I really wouldn’t like that...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r154","rowIndex":154,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=28>トーマス</tips>はもう一度溜息をついた。","en":"<tips=28>Thomas</tips> sighed again.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r155","rowIndex":155,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼はパジャマに着替え、傍らに侍す<tips=29>アイス</tips>はいつもと変わらないスーツ姿のままだった。","en":"He had changed into his pajamas; <tips=29>Ice</tips>, in attendance beside him, remained in her customary suit.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r156","rowIndex":156,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　こうして私室に二人でいるときでも、彼のボディーガードであるという役目を忘れていないということだろう。<tips=28>トーマス</tips>としてはそれが寂しかった。","en":"Even when they were alone in his private room, she apparently never forgot that she was his bodyguard. That made <tips=28>Thomas</tips> feel lonely.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r157","rowIndex":157,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼が促せば着替えてはくれるのだけれども、あくまでもそれは命令に従うというだけのことで、彼としてはもっと自発的になってほしかった。そうした状況と気持ちを作ってやるのは自分の役目なのだろうとは思うが、どうやれば<tips=29>アイス</tips>が打ち解けてくれるのかがわからない。","en":"She would change if he prompted her, but only in obedience to an order. Thomas wanted her to act more freely of her own accord. He understood that it might be his responsibility to create the circumstances and frame of mind that would allow that, but he had no idea how to help <tips=29>Ice</tips> open up to him.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r158","rowIndex":158,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「執行部の人たちはどういうつもりなのかな。……あっ、そうだ。<tips=2>阿亮</tips>に電話をして話してみようか？　彼は賢いし、いろいろうまい方法を考えてくれるかもしれない」","en":"“I wonder what the leadership intends to do. ...Oh, I know. What if I called <tips=2>Ah Leung</tips> and talked it over with him? He’s clever. He might come up with a good way to handle all this.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r159","rowIndex":159,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それは、おやめになったほうが良いかと」","en":"“I believe you should refrain.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アイス","displayName":"Ice","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r160","rowIndex":160,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どうして？」","en":"“Why?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r161","rowIndex":161,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=28>トーマス</tips>様は友人だと思っていても、相手はもうこちらを敵と見なしているかもしれません。そうだったら、うっかり相手に有利な情報を与えかねませんから。それに、相手方の重要人物とあまり気軽に連絡をとってしまっては、身内にもあらぬ誤解を抱かせることになります」","en":"“You may consider him a friend, <tips=28>Master Thomas</tips>, but he may already regard us as enemies. If so, a careless remark could give him information that advantages his side. And if you communicate too casually with an important member of the opposing faction, it could cause unfounded suspicions among our own people as well.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アイス","displayName":"Ice","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r162","rowIndex":162,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「確かに、それはそうだね。<tips=29>アイス</tips>は賢いなあ」","en":"“You’re right. <tips=29>Ice</tips>, you really are clever.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r163","rowIndex":163,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=28>トーマス</tips>はおどけて見せたが、<tips=29>アイス</tips>は乗らず、前髪に隠されていない方の目を伏せるだけだ。","en":"<tips=28>Thomas</tips> made a playful show of it, but <tips=29>Ice</tips> did not play along. She merely lowered the eye not hidden by her bangs.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r164","rowIndex":164,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=29>アイス</tips>、もし僕が<tips=2>阿亮</tips>の敵になったら、やっぱり彼は<tips=26>劉建志</tips>にしたみたいに僕を殺そうとするのかなあ？」","en":"“<tips=29>Ice</tips>, if I become <tips=2>Ah Leung’s</tips> enemy, do you think he’ll try to kill me the way he killed <tips=26>Ryu Kenshi</tips>?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r165","rowIndex":165,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「私見ですが、あの方ならば、もし必要とあればそれを実行するかと」","en":"“This is only my opinion, but I believe he would do so if he judged it necessary.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アイス","displayName":"Ice","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r166","rowIndex":166,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「やっぱりそうだよね」","en":"“That’s what I thought.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r167","rowIndex":167,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=28>トーマス</tips>は溜息をつく。","en":"<tips=28>Thomas</tips> sighed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r168","rowIndex":168,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「でも、もしそうなっても、私がお守りしますから」","en":"“But if that happens, I will protect you.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アイス","displayName":"Ice","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r169","rowIndex":169,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その言葉に、<tips=28>トーマス</tips>はもう一度溜息をつく。","en":"At those words, <tips=28>Thomas</tips> sighed once more.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r170","rowIndex":170,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　まったく溜息の多い夜だ、と、彼はそのことに溜息をつきたくなった。","en":"What a night for sighing, he thought, and nearly sighed at that too.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r171","rowIndex":171,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼の部屋は屋敷の二階、東側にある。壁には大きな窓が設置されていたが正面にはアラカシが枝を張ってその葉が視界を覆っている。父によれば外からの狙撃などを防ぐ意味があるそうなのだが、<tips=28>トーマス</tips>からすればせっかくの窓を台無しにしているようで閉塞感がある。","en":"His room occupied the eastern side of the residence’s second floor. A large window had been installed in one wall, but a ring-cupped oak stood directly before it, its leaves blocking the view. His father claimed that the tree helped prevent sniping from outside. To <tips=28>Thomas</tips>, it only ruined a perfectly good window and made the room feel confined.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r172","rowIndex":172,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　棚の上にはアメリカの母の実家で母の家族や、その地での友人と撮った写真が飾られている。広大な大地と広い空。母の実家は銀行員だったが、曾祖父の世代までは農業をやっており、今は住宅地となっている周囲の土地はむかしは全部うちのものだったんだと祖父がよく自慢をしていた。","en":"On a shelf stood photographs taken with his mother’s family and his friends at her family home in America: immense land beneath an immense sky. His mother’s family worked in banking, but until his great-grandfather’s generation they had been farmers. His grandfather liked to boast that all the surrounding land, now covered in homes, had once belonged to them.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r173","rowIndex":173,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　父からは母と連絡をとることを禁じられていたが、今でも時々電話をしている。父も知っているだろうが、あえてとがめ立てはしなかった。","en":"His father had forbidden him to contact his mother, but they still spoke on the telephone occasionally. His father probably knew and had chosen not to make an issue of it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r174","rowIndex":174,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　母の実家で過ごした時間はそう長いものではなかったが、あの風景は自分と合っていたと<tips=28>トーマス</tips>は思い出す。この街も嫌いではないが、ゴミゴミしていて空気が臭いのには閉口する。","en":"<tips=28>Thomas</tips> had not spent very long at his mother’s family home, but he remembered that the landscape suited him. He did not dislike this city either, but its congestion and foul-smelling air were difficult to bear.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r175","rowIndex":175,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　生まれてから一度もこの街から出たことがないという<tips=29>アイス</tips>に、いつかあのすがすがしい景色を見せてやりたい。","en":"One day, he wanted to show that bracing view to <tips=29>Ice</tips>, who had never once left the city in her life.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r176","rowIndex":176,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女と出会ったのは、父に呼び戻されてこの街へ帰ってきてから半年もしなかったある日のことだ。","en":"He had met her less than six months after his father summoned him back to the city.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r177","rowIndex":177,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼は父に同行してファミリーの仕事を見学させられていた。<tips=74>廖ファミリー</tips>は言うまでもなく客家系華僑を母体とする集団だが、他の客家人がそうであるように<tips=74>廖ファミリー</tips>の主要な収入源は物を売ったり買ったりする商業活動によるものだった。香港の黒社会を母体とする<tips=69>義勝</tips>がもっと非合法な活動、たとえば恐喝や人身売買や売春やあらゆるものの偽造によって収入を得ていたのと比べると、比較的まっとうな商売で金を稼いでいた。","en":"Thomas had accompanied his father to observe the organization’s operations. The <tips=74>Liao Family</tips> was, of course, an organization rooted in the overseas Hakka community. Like other Hakka, the <tips=74>Liao Family</tips> depended chiefly on commerce—buying and selling goods—for its income. Compared with <tips=69>Yisheng</tips>, which had grown out of Hong Kong’s criminal underworld and earned its money through more openly illegal enterprises—extortion, human trafficking, prostitution, and the counterfeiting of anything and everything—the Liao Family made its money through relatively legitimate business.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r178","rowIndex":178,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　あくまでも比較であって、随所に暴力行為や犯罪行為がちりばめられてはいるのは間違いないが。","en":"That legitimacy was only relative. Violence and criminal acts were unquestionably woven through its operations at every turn.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r179","rowIndex":179,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そういう組織のボスであるから、<tips=27>廖志明</tips>の普段の仕事はギャングというよりも企業グループの会長といった趣があった。","en":"As the boss of such an organization, <tips=27>Liao Chi-ming’s</tips> daily work more closely resembled that of a corporate chairman than a gangster.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r180","rowIndex":180,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　部下や仲間の事務所を視察し、重要な取引相手と会談をし、そしてその合間に商売敵を脅迫などもするけれども、全体としては<tips=28>トーマス</tips>が思っていたよりもずっとまともな仕事なのである。","en":"He inspected the offices of his subordinates and associates, met important business partners, and occasionally threatened a commercial rival between appointments. On the whole, it was far more respectable work than <tips=28>Thomas</tips> had imagined.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r181","rowIndex":181,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その後次々とまともでない仕事現場を見てゆくことになるのだが、とにかく初日はそんな調子で、<tips=9>Y地区</tips>のギャングというのは毎日殺し合いをしている恐ろしい世界の住人だと思っていたのに比べると、どうもまっとうだ。これならやっていけそうだと安堵したその最後の最後で、<tips=29>アイス</tips>と衝撃的な出会いを果たしたのだ。","en":"He would later witness one disreputable workplace after another. On that first day, however, everything had seemed almost respectable. He had imagined the gangsters of <tips=9>Y District</tips> as inhabitants of a terrifying world where people killed one another every day; reality appeared surprisingly proper. He had just relaxed into thinking that perhaps he could manage this life after all when, at the very end of the day, he had his shocking first encounter with <tips=29>Ice</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r182","rowIndex":182,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=28>トーマス</tips>は父と共に周という男が経営する高利貸し事務所を視察した。周が型どおりの報告をしていると、奥の方からガタガタと、何やら物々しい音がきこえる。<tips=27>廖</tips>が尋ねると、今日はちょっとしたトラブルがあって、その始末をしているのだと言う。","en":"<tips=28>Thomas</tips> and his father visited a loan-sharking office operated by a man named Zhou. While Zhou delivered a routine report, alarming crashes and clatters came from somewhere in the back. When <tips=27>Liao</tips> asked about them, Zhou said there had been a small problem that day and it was being dealt with.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r183","rowIndex":183,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「トラブルとは？」","en":"“What kind of problem?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r184","rowIndex":184,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=27>廖</tips>の問いかけに周はこう答えた。","en":"Zhou answered <tips=27>Liao’s</tips> question.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r185","rowIndex":185,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「泥棒が入ったんですよ。まったく、この事務所に盗みに入るとは、無謀というか、勇気があるというか」","en":"“A thief broke in. Honestly, trying to rob this office—I can’t decide whether that takes recklessness or courage.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r186","rowIndex":186,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その不届き者を捕まえて、勝手口の外の裏路地で罪を償わせているのだそうだ。","en":"They had caught the offender and were making the thief pay for the crime in the back alley beyond the service entrance.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r187","rowIndex":187,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=27>廖</tips>はその泥棒を見てみたいと言い、<tips=28>トーマス</tips>は彼と共に路地裏に出た。","en":"<tips=27>Liao</tips> said that he wanted to see the thief, and <tips=28>Thomas</tips> accompanied him into the alley.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r188","rowIndex":188,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そこで<tips=29>アイス</tips>と出会った。","en":"That was where he met <tips=29>Ice</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r189","rowIndex":189,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=9>Y地区</tips>の裏路地のほとんどがそうであるように、そこも吐瀉物のにおいとヘドロのにおいが混じり合ったようななんとも言えぬ不快なにおいがたちこめていた。ビルの古い換気扇が回るカラカラという耳障りな音が鳴り続けていた。","en":"Like most of <tips=9>Y District’s</tips> back alleys, it was filled with an indescribably foul odor, something like vomit mingled with sludge. An old ventilation fan on the building turned with an incessant, grating rattle.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r190","rowIndex":190,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　アスファルトはあちこちはげかけて、ボロボロと崩れた破片がその表面に無数に転がっている。","en":"The asphalt had worn away in patches, leaving countless crumbling fragments scattered across its surface.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r191","rowIndex":191,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その上に、全裸の女が居た。既にぐったりと力を失い、路上に四肢を投げ出して大の字になっている。その右手はロープによって配管パイプに縛り付けられ、脱走を試みた痕跡か、手首の辺りが傷だらけだった。","en":"A completely naked woman lay on the asphalt. Already limp and strengthless, she was sprawled spread-eagled across the road. A rope bound her right hand to a pipe, and her wrist was covered in wounds—perhaps traces of an attempt to escape.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r192","rowIndex":192,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　白く華奢な全身が傷だらけで、血まみれで、特に股間の辺りは生々しい鮮血に塗れており、彼女が単純な暴力以外の無惨な仕打ちをうけたことを物語っていた。","en":"Her slight, pale body was covered in wounds and blood. Around her crotch in particular she was smeared with vivid fresh blood, telling of horrors inflicted on her beyond simple violence.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r193","rowIndex":193,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「最初は売春宿にでも売ろうと思って電話してみたんですがね、最近はサービス重視だとかなんだとかで、そんな反抗的でめんどうな女を引き取ることは出来ないって言うんですよ。昔だったら、薬漬けにして、いやでもなんでも楽しく働かせられたんですがねえ」","en":"“At first, I called around thinking I might sell her to a brothel, but now they all claim to care about customer service. They said they couldn’t take a difficult, defiant woman like this. In the old days, we could have kept her drugged and made her enjoy the work whether she liked it or not.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r194","rowIndex":194,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「今はコストに見合わないからな。時代がかわったんだよ」","en":"“The expense doesn’t justify it anymore. Times have changed.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r195","rowIndex":195,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「しかも、こいつサイキックなんですよ。なんかよくわからないんですが、どうも、その力をつかって盗みをしようとしたようですな。全く誰も気がつかないうちに入ってきやがった」","en":"“And she’s a psychic. I don’t really understand it, but it seems she used that power to try to steal from us. She got inside without a single person noticing.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r196","rowIndex":196,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ああ、実際的な力がある<tips=16>タイプA</tips>か。それじゃあますます店はとらんなあ。どこでも嫌がるだろう？」","en":"“Ah, a <tips=16>Type A</tips> with a practical ability. That makes her even less suitable for a brothel. No one would want her, would they?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r197","rowIndex":197,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まったくですよ。何の使い道もなく、馬鹿馬鹿しいったらない」","en":"“Exactly. She’s no use for anything. The whole thing’s absurd.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r198","rowIndex":198,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　周と<tips=27>廖</tips>が世間話を交わす隣で、<tips=28>トーマス</tips>は絶句していた。","en":"Beside Zhou and <tips=27>Liao</tips>, who were chatting as though about the most ordinary thing in the world, <tips=28>Thomas</tips> stood speechless.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r199","rowIndex":199,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　こんなひどいことがあるのだろうか？　女はもう虫の息で、このまま放っておけば間違いなく命を落とすだろう。泥棒は確かにいけないことだが、あまりにも残酷すぎる。いやもしかしたら、もう死んでいるのかもしれない。","en":"How could anything so terrible happen? The woman was barely breathing. If they left her there, she would unquestionably die. Stealing was wrong, certainly, but this was far too cruel. Perhaps she was already dead.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r200","rowIndex":200,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　近づいて、間近でその様子を見ると、血まみれになった乳房はかすかに上下している。呼吸をしているのだ。","en":"He approached to examine her more closely. Her bloodied breasts rose and fell by the slightest measure. She was breathing.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r201","rowIndex":201,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　意識はどうだろう？","en":"Was she conscious?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r202","rowIndex":202,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　女は俯いて、その顔が前髪に隠れている。手を伸ばしてそっとめくると、下からあらわれた顔にぎょっとした。","en":"The woman’s head hung forward, her face hidden by her bangs. He reached down and gently brushed them aside, then recoiled at the face they revealed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r203","rowIndex":203,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　向かって右半分の皮膚が焼けただれている。今焼かれたというのではなく、大分前に焼かれたようだが、損傷がひどすぎて再生せずに焼かれたままの状態だ。眼球も落ち、眼窩は黒いくぼみでしかない。","en":"The skin on the half of her face to his right was seared and ravaged. The burns were not fresh; they appeared to be quite old, but the damage had been too severe for the flesh to regenerate, leaving it as ruined as when it was burned. The eyeball was gone as well. The socket was nothing but a black hollow.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r204","rowIndex":204,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=28>トーマス</tips>は驚いてのけぞりそうになったが、落ち着いてよくよく見ると、右半分とは対照的に顔の左半分は非常に美しかった。そして整った眉毛の下からこちらを見るその眼差しが、とても素晴らしい。","en":"<tips=28>Thomas</tips> nearly recoiled again in shock. Once he had calmed himself and looked more closely, however, he saw that the left half of her face, in contrast to the right, was exceptionally beautiful. And the gaze that met his from beneath her finely shaped brow was extraordinary.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r205","rowIndex":205,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　こんな状況なのに、絶望するでもなく、憎悪や怒りをあらわすでもなく、ただまっすぐに自分の髪をかき分けた目の前の<tips=28>トーマス</tips>を見つめていた。","en":"Even in these circumstances, she showed neither despair nor hatred nor anger. She only looked directly at <tips=28>Thomas</tips>, who had brushed the hair from her face.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r206","rowIndex":206,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして次に彼は、彼女の傷が体の前面にばかりついていることに気がついた。身体の向きが固定されているわけでもない。普通暴行を受けたら、恐怖によって身を丸め背を向けるものだろうから、身体の外側に傷が多くつくはずなのだ。こんなに体の前面に傷がつくということは、彼女は逃げようとしなかったのだ。野良猫や野良犬は、敵に立ち向かう心の強い個体は顔や胸に傷がつき、弱いものは背中や尻をやられると、近所の大人から教わった。彼女はどうしてそんな風に振る舞えたのだろう？　到底自分には出来ない。","en":"Then he noticed that nearly all her wounds were on the front of her body. She had not been held facing in one direction. Ordinarily, a person being beaten would curl inward in fear and turn away, leaving most injuries on the outer surfaces of the body. Wounds concentrated so heavily on her front seemed to mean that she had not tried to flee. A neighborhood adult had once taught Thomas that stray cats and dogs with the strength of heart to face their enemies were wounded on the face and chest, while weaker ones suffered injuries to their backs and hindquarters. How had she managed to behave that way? Thomas could never have done it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r207","rowIndex":207,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　思えば一目惚れだった。","en":"Looking back, it had been love at first sight.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r208","rowIndex":208,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=27>廖</tips>は、どうせ助からないと言い、あまりにも汚い女を拾うなと言い、なんとか思いとどまらせようとしたが<tips=28>トーマス</tips>は従わなかった。","en":"<tips=27>Liao</tips> said she would die anyway, told him not to pick up such a filthy woman, and did everything he could to dissuade him, but <tips=28>Thomas</tips> refused to obey.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r209","rowIndex":209,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女を街で一番の医者に診せ、するとなんとか一命を取りとめた。","en":"He took her to the finest doctor in the city, and somehow her life was saved.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r210","rowIndex":210,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その後、トーマスは半ば強引に彼女を自分のボディーガードとして雇った。","en":"Afterward, Thomas all but forced her to take a job as his bodyguard.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r211","rowIndex":211,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女に何か特別な技術があるわけではないが、その<tips=16>タイプA</tips>としての能力は下手なボディーガードよりも有用なものであったからだ。そして何よりも、<tips=28>トーマス</tips>は彼女に安定した収入と生活を与えたかった。","en":"She had no special skills, but her abilities as a <tips=16>Type A</tips> made her more useful than a second-rate bodyguard. Above all, <tips=28>Thomas</tips> wanted to give her a stable income and a secure life.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r212","rowIndex":212,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　息子に甘い<tips=27>廖</tips>は、当初反対したものの、<tips=28>トーマス</tips>が強く主張すると無理にやめさせるようなことはしなかった。そして実際、彼女は反抗するでもなく忠実にボディーガードの役目を果たしたので、<tips=27>廖</tips>は小言も言わなくなった。","en":"<tips=27>Liao</tips>, who was soft on his son, objected at first, but once <tips=28>Thomas</tips> insisted, he did not force him to give it up. In fact, she put up no resistance and faithfully performed her duties as a bodyguard, so in time <tips=27>Liao</tips> stopped complaining.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r213","rowIndex":213,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そうして、三年近くが経った。","en":"Nearly three years had passed since then.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r214","rowIndex":214,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=28>トーマス</tips>は椅子に座ってしばらく無言で考えていた。","en":"<tips=28>Thomas</tips> sat in his chair and thought in silence for a time.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r215","rowIndex":215,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その椅子は、父が買ってくれたアンティークチェアで、ヨーロッパのどこかの城で使われていたという触れ込みで、城主だった貴族の悲劇がなんちゃらと、古物商が熱心にドラマを語った。","en":"It was an antique chair his father had bought for him, supposedly once used in some European castle. The dealer had passionately related a dramatic tale about some tragedy or other that befell the nobleman who owned the castle.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r216","rowIndex":216,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=27>廖志明</tips>ともあろうものがその売り言葉を素直に信じたわけでもないが、作り話としても面白いと、買ったのだそうだ。","en":"A man like <tips=27>Liao Chi-ming</tips> had hardly accepted the sales pitch at face value. He had bought the chair, he said, because even as a fabrication, the story was entertaining.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r217","rowIndex":217,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=29>アイス</tips>」","en":"“<tips=29>Ice</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r218","rowIndex":218,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　現在の優れた椅子と比べて座り心地が良いわけでもないその椅子の上から、部屋の隅の彼女用の椅子に座る<tips=29>アイス</tips>に呼びかけた。","en":"The antique was hardly more comfortable than a fine modern chair. From it, Thomas called to <tips=29>Ice</tips>, who sat in a chair of her own in the corner of the room.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r219","rowIndex":219,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　三年の月日が過ぎた割には、彼が彼女について知っているのはその名前だけだ。それも、おそらく本名ではなく、ニックネームか何かだろう。最初の頃に<tips=28>トーマス</tips>が尋ねて答えてくれたのはそれだけで、あとは素性も生い立ちも何も語ってはくれなかった。","en":"Despite the three years they had spent together, her name was all he knew about her. Even that was probably a nickname rather than her true name. It was the only answer she had given when <tips=28>Thomas</tips> asked her in the early days; she had never told him anything else about her identity or upbringing.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r220","rowIndex":220,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それは警戒心が強かった当時のことだから、今改めて尋ねれば或いは教えてくれるかもしれない。しかし、言いたくないものをあえて聞くのは、むしろこうして身近な存在になってしまったからこそ<tips=28>トーマス</tips>には出来なかった。","en":"That had been back when she was deeply guarded. If he asked again now, perhaps she would tell him. Yet precisely because she had become so close to him, <tips=28>Thomas</tips> could not bring himself to press her about something she did not wish to discuss.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r221","rowIndex":221,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「もしかしたら、これから僕の身のまわりにも危険が及ぶかもしれない。それでも、一緒にいてくれるかい？」","en":"“Things may become dangerous around me too from now on. Even if they do, will you stay with me?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r222","rowIndex":222,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「はい」","en":"“Yes.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アイス","displayName":"Ice","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r223","rowIndex":223,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=29>アイス</tips>は真剣な顔で頷く。","en":"<tips=29>Ice</tips> nodded, her expression serious.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r224","rowIndex":224,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=28>トーマス</tips>様に危険がせまったら、私は命にかえてもお守りします」","en":"“If danger threatens you, <tips=28>Master Thomas</tips>, I will protect you even at the cost of my life.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アイス","displayName":"Ice","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r225","rowIndex":225,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ありがとう。でもね、そこまでして守ってくれなくてもいいんだ」","en":"“Thank you. But you truly don’t have to go so far to protect me.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r226","rowIndex":226,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いえ、私は、<tips=28>トーマス</tips>様のためなら何でもしますから」","en":"“No. I will do anything for you, <tips=28>Master Thomas</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アイス","displayName":"Ice","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r227","rowIndex":227,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「本当にいいんだよ。ただ一緒にいてくれれば。ねえもうちょっと、僕と対等につき合ってほしいんだ」","en":"“You don’t have to. I only want you to stay with me. I want you to treat me more like an equal.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r228","rowIndex":228,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=28>トーマス</tips>がじっと見つめる。<tips=29>アイス</tips>は黙り込む。その微かな表情の変化は、困っているようにも見えた。","en":"<tips=28>Thomas</tips> gazed steadily at her. <tips=29>Ice</tips> fell silent. The minute change in her expression made her look faintly troubled.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r229","rowIndex":229,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=29>アイス</tips>、もっと近くに来ておくれ」","en":"“<tips=29>Ice</tips>, come closer, please.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r230","rowIndex":230,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「はい」","en":"“Yes.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アイス","displayName":"Ice","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r231","rowIndex":231,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=29>アイス</tips>は立ち上がり、<tips=28>トーマス</tips>のすぐ近くに立つ。すると、鼻先になんともいえない良い匂いが漂った。","en":"<tips=29>Ice</tips> stood and came directly beside <tips=28>Thomas</tips>. An indescribably pleasant scent drifted to him.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r232","rowIndex":232,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「僕に、キスをしてくれる？」","en":"“Will you kiss me?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r233","rowIndex":233,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「はい。……失礼します」","en":"“Yes. ...Excuse me.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アイス","displayName":"Ice","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r234","rowIndex":234,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=29>アイス</tips>は跪き、言われたままに<tips=28>トーマス</tips>の唇に自分の唇を重ねた。","en":"<tips=29>Ice</tips> knelt and, exactly as instructed, pressed her lips to <tips=28>Thomas’s</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r235","rowIndex":235,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=29>アイス</tips>は置物のようにじっと静かにしている。少し目を伏せて、悲しそうな表情をしたがそれは<tips=28>トーマス</tips>には見えない。","en":"<tips=29>Ice</tips> remained perfectly still, like an ornament. She lowered her eyes slightly and took on a sorrowful expression, but <tips=28>Thomas</tips> could not see it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r236","rowIndex":236,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　暫くそうしたのち、<tips=28>トーマス</tips>は顔を離す。","en":"After they had continued for a time, <tips=28>Thomas</tips> pulled back.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r237","rowIndex":237,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ありがとう」","en":"“Thank you.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r238","rowIndex":238,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼の感謝の言葉に、<tips=29>アイス</tips>はやはりほんの少し困った表情をする。","en":"At his thanks, <tips=29>Ice</tips> again looked faintly troubled.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r239","rowIndex":239,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「僕はきみのことを愛している」","en":"“I love you.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r240","rowIndex":240,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それは何度も繰り返し伝えた言葉だ。<tips=29>アイス</tips>はやはり何も言わず、そこに立って<tips=28>トーマス</tips>を見下ろしている。「私も愛している」とは言ってくれない。","en":"He had told her so many times. As ever, <tips=29>Ice</tips> said nothing. She stood looking down at <tips=28>Thomas</tips>, but did not say, ‘I love you too.’","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r241","rowIndex":241,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　こんな時、彼はいつも自己嫌悪に襲われる。","en":"At moments like this, self-loathing always overcame him.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r242","rowIndex":242,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼が初めてキスをしたいと申し出たときも、彼女は文句一つ言わず、戸惑いも見せず、それに応じた。","en":"The first time he asked whether he might kiss her, she had complied without a word of complaint or the slightest sign of uncertainty.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r243","rowIndex":243,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　いや、彼女はおよそ、トーマスの要望や指示に対して逆らったことがない。このまま、キスより先の行為を<tips=28>トーマス</tips>が望んでも、いやとは言わないはずだ。","en":"In fact, she had never resisted any request or instruction Thomas gave her. Even if <tips=28>Thomas</tips> now wanted to go beyond kissing, she would probably not say no.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r244","rowIndex":244,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しかし彼はそれを命じたことはなかった。","en":"But he had never commanded it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r245","rowIndex":245,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　長年つき合って、<tips=29>アイス</tips>は非常に義務感が強く、そして自己愛が薄いことを知った。彼女はトーマスが命を救ってくれたのだから、<tips=28>トーマス</tips>のために自分の命を使うのだと思っている。","en":"Over the years they had spent together, he had learned that <tips=29>Ice</tips> possessed an extremely powerful sense of duty and very little regard for herself. She believed that because <tips=28>Thomas</tips> had saved her life, she should spend that life in his service.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r246","rowIndex":246,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　さっき「<tips=28>トーマス</tips>様のためなら何でもしますから」と言ったのも嘘でも誇張でもなく、彼女としてみれば当然のつもりでそう言ったのだろう。","en":"When she had said earlier, “I’ll do anything for <tips=28>Master Thomas</tips>,” she had been neither lying nor exaggerating. To her, it was probably the most natural thing in the world.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r247","rowIndex":247,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女の言葉は常に誠実で、だから、その肉体を自由にしようとしても、拒絶をするとは思えない。しかし、それをして何になるのだろう？　命令で従わせて、その体に触れて、いくらかの快楽を得たって、虚しいだけじゃないか？","en":"Her words were always sincere. He could not imagine that she would refuse even if he treated her body as his to command. But what would that accomplish? If he compelled her obedience, touched that body, and took a measure of pleasure from it, wouldn’t it leave him with nothing but emptiness?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r248","rowIndex":248,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　実際、こんなに軽いキスをしただけでもその罪悪感で居たたまれなくなる。相手は義務として行っているだけで、本当は不快なのではないかと疑ってしまう。","en":"Even so slight a kiss left him unable to bear the guilt. He could not help suspecting that she did it only as a duty and in truth found it unpleasant.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r249","rowIndex":249,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"（僕はただ<tips=29>アイス</tips>の体を自由にしたいんじゃない。<tips=29>アイス</tips>に愛されたいんだ）","en":"(I don’t just want the freedom to do as I please with <tips=29>Ice’s</tips> body. I want <tips=29>Ice</tips> to love me.)","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r250","rowIndex":250,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しかし、どうやってそれを確かめる？","en":"But how could he ever know for certain?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r251","rowIndex":251,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　たとえば、いまここで、自分を愛しているかと訊ねたら、もしかしたら彼女は愛していると言ってくれるかもしれない。","en":"If he asked her here and now whether she loved him, she might tell him that she did.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r252","rowIndex":252,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　だが、そう言ってくれたとしても、自分はそれを信じられるだろうか？　主人の心情を気遣って、そう答えてくれているのだろうと疑い、言葉を信じられないかもしれない。","en":"Even if she said it, could he believe her? He might suspect that she was answering only out of concern for her master’s feelings and find himself unable to trust her words.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r253","rowIndex":253,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そう考えてしまうと、主人と従者という関係である以上、どんな方法をとっても永遠に相手の気持ちを信じる方法なんかないのかもしれない。","en":"Once he began thinking in that fashion, it seemed that as long as they remained master and servant, perhaps nothing could ever let him trust that her feelings were her own.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r254","rowIndex":254,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"（結局僕は、自分を信じられないから、<tips=29>アイス</tips>にこれ以上触れられないんだ）","en":"(In the end, it is because I cannot trust myself that I cannot touch <tips=29>Ice</tips> any further.)","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r255","rowIndex":255,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　自分は能力にも容姿にも取り立てて優れた部分がないし、<tips=29>アイス</tips>を助けたのも結局は親の財力だ。","en":"He possessed no special ability and was not remarkably good-looking, and in the end it was his father’s wealth that had allowed him to save <tips=29>Ice</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r256","rowIndex":256,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　もし自分のことを、<tips=29>アイス</tips>に愛されるに相応しい価値と権利がある人間だと信じられるならば、こんなことをぐだぐだと悩んだりはしないように思う。","en":"If he could believe himself a man worthy of <tips=29>Ice’s</tips> love and entitled to receive it, perhaps he would not agonize over the matter so endlessly.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r257","rowIndex":257,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　――これから、状況は変わってゆく。","en":"—Things were going to change from now on.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r258","rowIndex":258,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そのなかで、自分がもっと正しい行動を重ねて、自分の価値を認められるようになれば、<tips=29>アイス</tips>の従順を、<tips=29>アイス</tips>の誠実な言葉を、もっと素直に受け入れられるようになるのだろう。","en":"If, in the course of all this, he continued to do what was right and learned to recognize his own worth, perhaps he would come to accept <tips=29>Ice’s</tips> obedience, <tips=29>Ice’s</tips> sincere words, more readily.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r259","rowIndex":259,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　いやそうだろうか？　自分には結局、どこまでいっても勇気が足りないのかもしれない。<tips=1>謝亮</tips>だったら迷いもしないだろう。自分はあまりにも迷う。","en":"Or would he? Perhaps, in the end, he would always lack courage. <tips=1>Tse Leung</tips> would not hesitate. Thomas hesitated far too much.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r260","rowIndex":260,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=28>トーマス</tips>はそっと溜息をつく。","en":"<tips=28>Thomas</tips> sighed softly.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r261","rowIndex":261,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「何か、悩み事でも？」","en":"“Is something troubling you?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アイス","displayName":"Ice","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r262","rowIndex":262,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=29>アイス</tips>の質問に対し、彼は首を横に振ってから笑う。","en":"In response to <tips=29>Ice’s</tips> question, he shook his head and smiled.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r263","rowIndex":263,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いやね、僕ももっと立派な人間にならなければなあと、考えていたんだ」","en":"“I was only thinking that I ought to become a better man.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r264","rowIndex":264,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=28>トーマス</tips>様は、すでに充分立派です」","en":"“You are already a fine man, <tips=28>Master Thomas</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アイス","displayName":"Ice","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r265","rowIndex":265,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"（その言葉を素直に信じられたらどれだけ幸せか！）","en":"(How happy I would be if I could simply believe those words!)","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r266","rowIndex":266,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=29>アイス</tips>の言葉で胸の中が千々に乱れるのを覆い隠すように、<tips=28>トーマス</tips>はもう一度ことさらに笑って見せた。","en":"As though it could conceal the turmoil <tips=29>Ice’s</tips> words had caused within him, <tips=28>Thomas</tips> made an exaggerated show of smiling again.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r267","rowIndex":267,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そう言ってくれるのは嬉しいよ。でも、僕にはものたりないんだ」","en":"“I’m glad you think so. But I still don’t feel good enough.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r268","rowIndex":268,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「今日、用事があって<tips=41>グランドタワー</tips>で<tips=39>ジェフリー・ウォン</tips>のやつと少し話したんだがね、いやあ、あいつ、親の仇を見るような憎しみの目でおれを見やがるんだよ」","en":"“I had some business at <tips=41>Grand Tower</tips> today and spoke briefly with <tips=39>Jeffrey Wong</tips>. You should have seen him. He looked at me as though I had murdered his father.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"廖志明","displayName":"Liao Chi-ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r269","rowIndex":269,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=27>廖志明</tips>は自宅の応接室にごく近しい人間を集めてソファーに座らせると、まずそう言って笑った。","en":"<tips=27>Liao Chi-ming</tips> had gathered the few people closest to him in the reception room of his home and had them sit on the sofas. He opened with those words and laughed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r270","rowIndex":270,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そりゃそうでしょう」","en":"“Of course he did.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r271","rowIndex":271,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=23>エリオット</tips>が言うと、<tips=28>トーマス</tips>も<tips=29>アイス</tips>も無言で頷く。","en":"When <tips=23>Elliott</tips> spoke, both <tips=28>Thomas</tips> and <tips=29>Ice</tips> nodded in silence.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r272","rowIndex":272,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"（しつこく何度も中傷ビラを街中にまかれて、その相手を憎まない人間がいるとは思えない）","en":"(I can’t imagine anyone being slandered again and again by broadsheets scattered all over town without coming to hate the person responsible.)","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r273","rowIndex":273,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=28>トーマス</tips>にすればごく当然のことである。","en":"To <tips=28>Thomas</tips>, it was the most natural thing in the world.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r274","rowIndex":274,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　むしろ、どう考えても他に犯人がいないのに『証拠がない』という一点で、<tips=27>廖志明</tips>に対して無言を貫いている<tips=39>ジェフリー・ウォン</tips>の忍耐力こそ賞賛されるべきだと彼は思う。","en":"If anything, he thought <tips=39>Jeffrey Wong’s</tips> patience deserved praise. Despite the absence of any plausible alternative culprit, the simple fact that there was no evidence had kept him from uttering a word against <tips=27>Liao Chi-ming</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r275","rowIndex":275,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いやあ、本当にひどい目つきだったんだ。お前も見たろう？　あんな形相の人間、滅多に拝見出来るもんじゃないぞ」","en":"“It was a truly vicious glare. You saw it too, didn’t you? You rarely have the privilege of seeing a man make a face like that.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"廖志明","displayName":"Liao Chi-ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r276","rowIndex":276,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=27>廖</tips>はエリオットに笑いかける。<tips=23>エリオット</tips>は渋い顔をして、","en":"<tips=27>Liao</tips> smiled at Elliott. <tips=23>Elliott</tips> made a sour face,","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r277","rowIndex":277,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「おれはむしろ彼に同情しますがね」","en":"“Personally, I sympathize with him.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エリオット・ネス","displayName":"Eliot Ness","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r278","rowIndex":278,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あっははは！　普段の行いが悪いのさ。先代の義兄弟だかなんだか知らんが、そんなものを盾に、あんな傲慢に振る舞いやがって。彼は、いつから、おれや<tips=35>フェルナンデス</tips>に上からものを言えるようになったのかな？」","en":"“Ah-ha-ha-ha! He brought it on himself. I don’t care if he was the former Longtou’s sworn brother or what. He uses that as a shield for all his arrogance. Since when has he been in any position to talk down to me or <tips=35>Fernandes</tips>?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"廖志明","displayName":"Liao Chi-ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r279","rowIndex":279,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　今日の<tips=27>廖</tips>はやたらと上機嫌で、葉巻をぷかぷかとふかしながら甲高い笑い声を立てていた。","en":"<tips=27>Liao</tips> was in exceptionally high spirits that day, puffing contentedly on his cigar and laughing in a shrill voice.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r280","rowIndex":280,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まあ、あんなものは序の口だろうよ。今後、あいつはどんどん部下や街の連中の評判を落としてゆくことになる。無能の二代目と一緒にな。そこへ颯爽と、<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>を救う新しいヒーローが登場するというわけさ」","en":"“Well, that is only the beginning. From here, his reputation will continue to fall with his subordinates and the people of the city. The same goes for that incompetent successor. Then a dashing new hero will stride in to save <tips=7>YS</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"廖志明","displayName":"Liao Chi-ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r281","rowIndex":281,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「先代の長男は、なかなか評判の良い若者らしいですな」","en":"“I hear the former Longtou’s eldest son has quite a good reputation himself.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エリオット・ネス","displayName":"Eliot Ness","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r282","rowIndex":282,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「おい<tips=23>エリオット</tips>。わかっていてわざと言っているんだろうが、おれが言っているのはあの御曹司のことじゃないぞ？」","en":"“<tips=23>Elliott</tips>, I know you said that deliberately, but the new hero I mean is not that young master.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"廖志明","displayName":"Liao Chi-ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r283","rowIndex":283,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=27>廖</tips>は苦い顔をして窘める。<tips=23>エリオット</tips>はうんともすんとも言わず、ただ腕組みをして黙っている。","en":"<tips=27>Liao</tips> rebuked him with a bitter expression. <tips=23>Elliott</tips> gave no answer whatsoever, merely folding his arms and falling silent.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r284","rowIndex":284,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……まあいい。しかし、執行部も馬鹿だな。どうしてあの御曹司をすぐ<tips=81>龍頭</tips>にしないんだろう。先代の遺言だかなんだかしらないが、<tips=84>マイケル・ツェー</tips>とかいうボンクラはさっさと引っ込めて、御曹司を三代目にしたほうがいい。先代の支持者も喜ぶだろうし、あの御曹司は街でそこそこの有名人だったんだろ？　なんで表に出ない場所で腐らせてしまうのか」","en":"“...Fine. But the leadership are fools. Why didn’t they make that young master <tips=81>Longtou</tips> right away? I don’t know or care about the former Longtou’s last wishes or whatever—they ought to make that blockhead <tips=84>Michael Tse</tips> step aside and install the young master as the third Longtou. The former Longtou’s supporters would be pleased, and the boy was something of a celebrity in the city, wasn’t he? Why let him rot somewhere out of public view?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"廖志明","displayName":"Liao Chi-ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r285","rowIndex":285,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「でも、父さんは<tips=2>阿亮</tips>をボスにするって意見にあんなに反対してたじゃない？　世襲だのなんだのって」","en":"“But Dad, you fought so hard against the proposal to make <tips=2>Ah Leung</tips> the boss. You called it hereditary succession and all sorts of things.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r286","rowIndex":286,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そりゃおれの立場からすれば反対するに決まってるだろ。でも、おれが<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>だったら絶対に<tips=2>阿亮</tips>を二代目にする。幹部が全員反対しようとな。そっちの方がどう考えても有効だ。……そのへんが、<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>の変にお行儀がいいというか、そういうところだな」","en":"“Of course I oppose it from where I stand. But if I were <tips=3>Chris Tse</tips>, I would absolutely make <tips=2>Ah Leung</tips> the second Longtou, even if every officer objected. No matter how you look at it, that would be more effective. ...That was the strange thing about <tips=3>Chris Tse</tips>: sometimes he could be too proper for his own good.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"廖志明","displayName":"Liao Chi-ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r287","rowIndex":287,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=27>廖</tips>は腕組みをして、ただの傍観者のように解説している。","en":"<tips=27>Liao</tips> folded his arms and explained it all as though he were a mere observer.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r288","rowIndex":288,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ねえ父さん。本当に、<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>の<tips=81>龍頭</tips>になるつもりなの？」","en":"“Dad, do you truly intend to become <tips=81>Longtou</tips> of <tips=7>YS</tips>?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r289","rowIndex":289,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=28>トーマス</tips>はその態度に呆れつつ、前からの疑問を口にしてみた。","en":"Exasperated by his manner, <tips=28>Thomas</tips> decided to voice a question he had been wondering about for some time.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r290","rowIndex":290,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しかし父は最愛の息子の質問にも、本心で答えるつもりはないようだった。","en":"But his father apparently had no intention of answering sincerely, not even when questioned by his beloved son.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r291","rowIndex":291,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「とんでもない！　おれはそんな野心はないさ。みずから<tips=81>龍頭</tips>の地位を奪おうだなんて、考えてはいない。そんな乱暴なことをしあって、誰もついては来ないだろうよ。ただし、このままではあの無能な執行部はおれたちをまとめ上げることは出来まいし、その結果、分裂をいやがったみながその地位に就いてくれと望むようになったならば、引き受けるのはやぶさかではないがな」","en":"“Of course not! I have no such ambition. I would never dream of seizing the position of <tips=81>Longtou</tips> myself. If we resorted to that sort of violence against one another, no one would follow me. But this incompetent leadership will never hold us together as things stand. And if everyone who wants to avoid a split should ask me to take the position, I would hardly refuse.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"廖志明","displayName":"Liao Chi-ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r292","rowIndex":292,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それは、少なくとも、暴力に訴えるようなことはしないということ？」","en":"“Does that at least mean you won’t resort to violence?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r293","rowIndex":293,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「もちろん」","en":"“Of course.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"廖志明","displayName":"Liao Chi-ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r294","rowIndex":294,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　父の返事に<tips=28>トーマス</tips>は一旦安堵の溜息をつきかけたが、","en":"<tips=28>Thomas</tips> had just begun to breathe a sigh of relief at his father’s answer when—","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r295","rowIndex":295,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ただ、何かの不幸なアクシデントで彼らが血を見ることはあるかもしれないがな」","en":"“Though of course some unfortunate accident might still end in bloodshed.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"廖志明","displayName":"Liao Chi-ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r296","rowIndex":296,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そう続いた父の言葉で、すぐに溜息を飲み込んだ。","en":"—his father’s continuation made him swallow the sigh at once.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r297","rowIndex":297,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　実際のところ、この手の話題で父の言葉を信用することは不可能なのだ。本人も、状況に応じてやり方や方針は随時適切なものにかえてゆくつもりなのだろう。","en":"In truth, it was impossible to trust his father on matters of this kind. Liao himself probably intended to change his methods and policies whenever circumstances called for it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r298","rowIndex":298,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>謝亮</tips>と<tips=44>筱喬</tips>の兄妹、それから<tips=24>馬美美</tips>といった<tips=76>香港派</tips>の知人たちと敵味方に分かれてしまうことになる。いや、父のやりかたによっては<tips=35>フェルナンデス</tips>の姉妹たちとも気まずい関係になってしまうかもしれない。","en":"Thomas would find himself on the opposite side from his acquaintances in the <tips=76>Hong Kong faction</tips>—the siblings <tips=1>Tse Leung</tips> and <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips>, as well as <tips=24>Ma Meimei</tips>. Depending on the methods his father chose, he might even end up on strained terms with the <tips=35>Fernandes</tips> sisters.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r299","rowIndex":299,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=27>廖志明</tips>はこの対決に興奮し、その結果得られるものを想像してすでに喜びさえ見られるが、<tips=28>トーマス</tips>としては気の進む話ではなかった。","en":"<tips=27>Liao Chi-ming</tips> was exhilarated by the confrontation and already took visible pleasure in imagining what he would gain from it. <tips=28>Thomas</tips>, for his part, found the whole prospect deeply unappealing.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r300","rowIndex":300,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「大丈夫。もし衝突するようなことになっても、おれたちが勝つ。そもそもあいつらとおれたちのファミリーは昔から格が違うんだ。資金力も違うし、兵隊の数も質も違う。執行部になって多少勢力を伸ばしたが、まだまだ。おろかにも、大事な戦力になる<tips=26>劉建志</tips>を自ら殺してしまったしな。あれは相当反感を買ってるぜ」","en":"“Don’t worry. Even if it comes to a clash, we’ll win. Their outfit has never been in the same league as ours. We have more money, and more and better soldiers. They gained some ground after taking over the leadership, but they still have a long way to go. Like fools, they even killed <tips=26>Ryu Kenshi</tips> themselves when he could have been such an important fighting asset. That earned them a great deal of resentment.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"廖志明","displayName":"Liao Chi-ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r301","rowIndex":301,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=27>廖</tips>は手酌で二つのグラスにウイスキーを注ぐと、一つは<tips=23>エリオット</tips>に勧め、のこったグラスを掴むと上機嫌で一口飲んだ。","en":"<tips=27>Liao</tips> poured whiskey into two glasses, offered one to <tips=23>Elliott</tips>, then took the remaining glass and drank from it in high spirits.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r302","rowIndex":302,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「幹部の多くはおれたちの方につくだろう……<tips=33>壬生屋</tips>や<tips=34>ダリオ</tips>はまず間違いがない。あの女はどうだろうな？　<tips=3>クリス</tips>の愛人だったが、本妻の息子とそのお仲間にそこまで肩入れするだろうか？　おれは、案外そう単純にはいかないと思ってる。ここまではべったりすり寄る姿勢を見せているがね」","en":"“Most of the officers will side with us... <tips=33>Mibuya</tips> and <tips=34>Dario</tips> are all but certain. I wonder about that woman. She was <tips=3>Chris’s</tips> mistress, but will she really go so far for his wife’s son and the boy’s friends? I suspect it won’t be quite that simple. She has been fawning all over them so far, of course.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"廖志明","displayName":"Liao Chi-ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r303","rowIndex":303,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「勝った気でいるようですが、本気で戦争するなら、あの香港の連中はなかなか手強いですよ」","en":"“You sound as though you’ve already won, but if this turns into a real war, those people from Hong Kong will be formidable.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エリオット・ネス","displayName":"Eliot Ness","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r304","rowIndex":304,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=23>エリオット</tips>は差し出されたグラスを指先で<tips=27>廖</tips>の手元に押し返し、かわりに懐からシガレットケースを出すと紙巻き煙草に火を付けた。","en":"<tips=23>Elliott</tips> pushed the offered glass back toward <tips=27>Liao</tips> with his fingertips. Instead, he drew a cigarette case from his coat and lit one.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r305","rowIndex":305,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「たしかに昔は武闘派として名を売ったが、当時からあいつらがやっていたのは所詮ちんぴらの喧嘩だよ。その証拠に、<tips=3>クリス</tips>が若く威勢の良かったあの頃からうちには一度も手を出したことがない。やれば負けるのがわかっていたからさ。関係が気まずくなったときも、先に謝りに来るのはあいつだ」","en":"“They may have made names for themselves as fighters in the old days, but even then, all they ever did was brawl like street punks. The proof is that they never once attacked us, not even in the days when <tips=3>Chris</tips> was young and full of fire. He knew that if he tried, he would lose. Even when our relations became strained, he was always the first to apologize.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"廖志明","displayName":"Liao Chi-ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r306","rowIndex":306,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「じゃあ、そもそもどうして<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>に参加して、<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>さんを<tips=81>龍頭</tips>として認めたの？」","en":"“Then why did you join <tips=7>YS</tips> in the first place and recognize Mr. <tips=3>Chris Tse</tips> as <tips=81>Longtou</tips>?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r307","rowIndex":307,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そりゃあ、それが都合が良かったからさ。『<tips=18>ローズ・クラブ</tips>』を壊滅させて街の人気者になったあいつがリーダーなら商売が捗る。おかげで随分と稼がせてもらったが、もうあいつはいない。金の切れ目が縁の切れ目ってやつだよ」","en":"“Because it suited me, naturally. Once he’d destroyed the <tips=18>Rose Club</tips> and become the city’s darling, business flourished with him as our leader. He made me a great deal of money, but now he’s gone. When the money runs out, so does the relationship.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"廖志明","displayName":"Liao Chi-ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r308","rowIndex":308,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　父の答えに、<tips=28>トーマス</tips>は今一つ理解が追いつかないようなぼんやりとした顔で黙り込む。","en":"<tips=28>Thomas</tips> fell silent with a blank expression, as though his understanding had not quite caught up with his father’s answer.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r309","rowIndex":309,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　いつも側にいる<tips=23>エリオット</tips>には聞き慣れた言葉らしく、彼は表情一つかえずに煙草をふかしている。","en":"The words were apparently familiar to <tips=23>Elliott</tips>, who was always at Liao’s side. He smoked without the slightest change in expression.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r310","rowIndex":310,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「その話はまた今度にしよう。今日お前に来て貰ったのは、見せたいものがあるからだ。……おい、いいぞ！」","en":"“We can discuss that another time. I asked you to come today because I have something to show you. ...All right, bring it in!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"廖志明","displayName":"Liao Chi-ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r311","rowIndex":311,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=27>廖</tips>が呼びかけると、ドアが開いて二人の使用人が台車に布がかかった何かを乗せてガラガラと押してくる。","en":"At <tips=27>Liao’s</tips> call, the door opened and two servants entered, rumbling a cart on which something stood beneath a cloth.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r312","rowIndex":312,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　２メートルの高さがあるドアをギリギリでくぐってきたのだから、台車の高さを含めても１８０センチくらいはありそうだ。使用人たちの押し方を見ると重量も相当あるらしい。","en":"It had barely cleared a two-meter-high door, so including the cart it appeared to stand around 180 centimeters tall. The servants’ efforts suggested that it was exceptionally heavy as well.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r313","rowIndex":313,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「これは？」","en":"“What is this?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r314","rowIndex":314,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「少し前に注文してあってな。やっと今日届いたんだ」","en":"“I ordered it a while ago. It finally arrived today.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"廖志明","displayName":"Liao Chi-ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r315","rowIndex":315,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　言って、<tips=27>廖</tips>が布をめくると、下から出て来たのはブロンズで出来た<tips=27>廖</tips>の胸像だった。","en":"With that, <tips=27>Liao</tips> pulled back the cloth, revealing a bronze bust of <tips=27>Liao</tips> himself.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r316","rowIndex":316,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どうだ、なかなかの出来だろう？」","en":"“Well? Fine work, isn’t it?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"廖志明","displayName":"Liao Chi-ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r317","rowIndex":317,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　胸像の横に立って胸を張り、同じ表情をしてみせる。","en":"He stood beside the bust, thrust out his chest, and assumed its expression.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r318","rowIndex":318,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ああすごい。立派なものだね！　まるでお父さんが偉人になったみたいだ」","en":"“Oh, that’s wonderful! Very impressive. It’s as if you’ve become a great historical figure, Dad.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r319","rowIndex":319,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「えっ」","en":"“What?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アイス","displayName":"Ice","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r320","rowIndex":320,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=28>トーマス</tips>は無邪気に褒めて、その様子に<tips=29>アイス</tips>は驚く。","en":"<tips=28>Thomas</tips> praised it with perfect innocence, and his reaction took <tips=29>Ice</tips> by surprise.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r321","rowIndex":321,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なかなかいい出来だよ。<tips=29>アイス</tips>もそう思わない？」","en":"“It really is well made. Don’t you think so, <tips=29>Ice</tips>?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r322","rowIndex":322,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=28>トーマス</tips>は振り返るが、彼女は困ったような表情を見せて口ごもる。<tips=23>エリオット</tips>は露骨に顔を顰めている。","en":"<tips=28>Thomas</tips> turned toward her, but she faltered with a troubled expression. <tips=23>Elliott</tips> wore an open scowl.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r323","rowIndex":323,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうだろう。立派だろう」","en":"“Precisely. Magnificent, isn’t it?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"廖志明","displayName":"Liao Chi-ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r324","rowIndex":324,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=27>廖</tips>は満足げに頷いた。","en":"<tips=27>Liao</tips> nodded in satisfaction.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r325","rowIndex":325,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「これは、どうするんですか？　ここに置くの？」","en":"“What are you going to do with it? Keep it here?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r326","rowIndex":326,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「達馬町の高校を新設するのに寄付をしてやったろう。その御礼として、こいつを敷地内に置かせてくれるんだそうだ。<tips=9>Y地区</tips>の未来を担う学生たちがな、毎日通学するたびにおれに感謝しながら通るわけだ。この街にギャングは多いが、自分の胸像を学校に置かせたものはおれの他にはいるまい」","en":"“You remember the donation I made toward building the new high school in Tatsuma Town. In gratitude, they have agreed to place this on the school grounds. Every day, the students who will shape <tips=9>Y District’s</tips> future can pass by it on their way to class and give thanks to me. This city has many gangsters, but I doubt anyone besides me has managed to place his own bust at a school.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"廖志明","displayName":"Liao Chi-ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r327","rowIndex":327,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=27>廖</tips>は満面の笑みを浮かべて胸像の台座を、コンコンと指先でノックする。","en":"Beaming, <tips=27>Liao</tips> tapped the bust’s pedestal with his fingertips.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r328","rowIndex":328,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なあ<tips=28>トーマス</tips>。おれが<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>のトップに立った暁には、麻薬を解禁して、じゃんじゃん儲けて、街のあちこちの施設に金をばらまく。そして、街中にこの胸像を建てて、この街は誰のおかげで豊かになったかということを知らしめるんだ」","en":"“Listen, <tips=28>Thomas</tips>. When I stand at the head of <tips=7>YS</tips>, I will legalize drugs, rake in money hand over fist, and scatter it among facilities all over the city. Then I will erect these busts throughout the city and make everyone understand who made this city prosperous.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"廖志明","displayName":"Liao Chi-ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r329","rowIndex":329,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ご機嫌の<tips=27>廖</tips>に、<tips=23>エリオット</tips>がさすがに苦言を呈す。","en":"With <tips=27>Liao</tips> in high spirits, even <tips=23>Elliott</tips> felt compelled to offer a word of caution.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r330","rowIndex":330,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ボス、いくらなんでも気が早すぎますぜ。さっきも言いましたが、どう考えても、そこまで簡単な相手じゃないと思いますがねえ」","en":"“Boss, you’re getting much too far ahead of yourself. As I said before, they won’t be an easy opponent by any stretch.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エリオット・ネス","displayName":"Eliot Ness","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r331","rowIndex":331,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ふん、そんなことは分かっている。もし戦争になれば、損害はいくらかあるだろう。だから、交渉で圧力をかけてうまく小競り合いだけで済ませることが出来ればそれは理想だし、そのための手も打つつもりさ。しかし、どんな手段を選ぶにしろ最終的に勝つのは我々だよ。もう<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>はいないんだ」","en":"“Hmph. I know that. If it comes to war, we will suffer some losses. Ideally, we will pressure them at the negotiating table and keep it to a few skirmishes; I intend to take steps toward that. But whatever means we choose, we will win in the end. <tips=3>Chris Tse</tips> is gone.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"廖志明","displayName":"Liao Chi-ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r332","rowIndex":332,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「確かに彼がいなくなったのは重要ですがねえ……」","en":"“His absence certainly matters, but...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エリオット・ネス","displayName":"Eliot Ness","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r333","rowIndex":333,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=23>エリオット</tips>は首をひねる。","en":"<tips=23>Elliott</tips> tilted his head.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r334","rowIndex":334,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「私にすれば、ボスは生前の<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>に対する評価が高すぎたせいで、彼がいなくなった香港勢というものを軽く見過ぎているように思えますな。それだけ<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>へのコンプレックスが強かったということでしょうが……」","en":"“Boss, it seems to me that because you rated <tips=3>Chris Tse</tips> too highly while he lived, you now greatly underestimate the Hong Kong faction without him. I suppose that only shows how deep your inferiority complex toward <tips=3>Chris Tse</tips> ran...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エリオット・ネス","displayName":"Eliot Ness","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r335","rowIndex":335,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=23>エリオット</tips>。いくらお前でも言葉がすぎるぞ」","en":"“<tips=23>Elliott</tips>. Even coming from you, that goes too far.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"廖志明","displayName":"Liao Chi-ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r336","rowIndex":336,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「すみませんね。思ったことをすぐ言ってしまうタチなもんで」","en":"“My apologies. I have a habit of saying whatever comes to mind.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エリオット・ネス","displayName":"Eliot Ness","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r337","rowIndex":337,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=23>エリオット</tips>は肩をすくめる。","en":"<tips=23>Elliott</tips> shrugged.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r338","rowIndex":338,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「でも、僕からしても、最近の父さんはちょっと様子がおかしいような気がするな。やっぱり、これから執行部と争いになる緊張が強くて、その裏返しでそんなに浮かれたふりをしてるんじゃないのかな？」","en":"“Even I can tell you’ve seemed a little strange lately, Dad. Maybe the prospect of fighting the leadership has you so tense that you’re putting on all this excitement to compensate?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r339","rowIndex":339,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なかなかするどい」","en":"“Very perceptive.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エリオット・ネス","displayName":"Eliot Ness","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r340","rowIndex":340,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=28>トーマス</tips>の言葉に、<tips=23>エリオット</tips>は頷く。","en":"<tips=23>Elliott</tips> nodded at <tips=28>Thomas’s</tips> observation.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r341","rowIndex":341,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　二人にそう言われてしまった<tips=27>廖</tips>は苛立ちを見せ、","en":"Having heard the same criticism from both of them, <tips=27>Liao</tips> showed his irritation.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r342","rowIndex":342,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「お前たちに説教されるほど落ちぶれてはいない！」","en":"“I have not fallen so low that I need lectures from either of you!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"廖志明","displayName":"Liao Chi-ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r343","rowIndex":343,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　大声を出してしまったことが、かえって<tips=28>トーマス</tips>と<tips=23>エリオット</tips>の疑問を裏付ける形になってしまった。","en":"The very fact that he had raised his voice seemed only to confirm <tips=28>Thomas</tips> and <tips=23>Elliott’s</tips> suspicions.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r344","rowIndex":344,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=27>廖</tips>も言った後すぐにそれに気がつき、不機嫌な顔で黙り込むと、その場に沈黙が生まれる。","en":"<tips=27>Liao</tips> realized this immediately after speaking. He fell silent with a sullen expression, and silence settled over the room.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r345","rowIndex":345,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「だいじょうぶ、シンパイいらない」","en":"“It’s all right. No need to worry.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r346","rowIndex":346,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そこで発せられた独り言のように呟く声は、その場の全員にとって思いがけないものだった。","en":"The murmured voice, almost as though its owner were speaking to herself, took everyone present by surprise.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r347","rowIndex":347,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ギョッとして、全員の姿勢が部屋の片隅の方に集まる。その先にはだぶだぶの黒いレインコートを身につけた美しい少女が裸足で立っており、壁に背中をもたせ掛けている。","en":"Startled, everyone turned toward one corner of the room. A beautiful girl stood there barefoot, wearing an oversized black raincoat and leaning back against the wall.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r348","rowIndex":348,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　いつの間にその場にあらわれたのか？","en":"When had she appeared?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r349","rowIndex":349,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=28>トーマス</tips>は目を疑った。少女が発言するその瞬間まで、誰もその存在に気がついていなかったはずだ。","en":"<tips=28>Thomas</tips> doubted his own eyes. No one appeared to have noticed her until the instant she spoke.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r350","rowIndex":350,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　いや、確かにさっきまでそこには誰もいなかった。すると、一瞬の間に少女がどこかから入り込んだことになるが、しかし彼女が背をもたせ掛けている壁はドアからも窓からも離れており、部屋のすべての人間の視線をあざむいてその場所に移動することは出来るとは思えない。","en":"No—there had certainly been no one there a moment ago. That meant the girl had slipped in from somewhere in a single instant. Yet the wall she leaned against was far from both doors and windows, and it seemed impossible for her to have reached it without crossing anyone’s field of view.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r351","rowIndex":351,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　まさに、幽霊か何かのように、忽然とその場所に現れたのだった。","en":"She had appeared there without warning, exactly like a ghost.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r352","rowIndex":352,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「もしかして、この子はきみと同じ力を……」","en":"“Could she have the same power as you?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r353","rowIndex":353,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=29>アイス</tips>を振り返ると、","en":"Thomas turned to <tips=29>Ice</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r354","rowIndex":354,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いや、違うような気がします……」","en":"“No. I don’t believe so...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r355","rowIndex":355,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女は首を振る。","en":"She shook her head.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r356","rowIndex":356,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　一方不意の侵入を許してしまった<tips=23>エリオット</tips>が舌打ちをしながら、懐の拳銃を目にもとまらぬ早さで引き抜き、銃口を少女に向ける。","en":"<tips=23>Elliott</tips> clicked his tongue at having allowed an intruder to slip in, whipped the pistol from inside his coat too quickly for the eye to follow, and aimed it at the girl.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r357","rowIndex":357,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「おい待て、話を聞こう。……お嬢さん、何のご用件だね？」","en":"“Wait. Let’s hear what she has to say. ...Young lady, what brings you here?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r358","rowIndex":358,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=27>廖</tips>は今にも引き金を引こうとしていた<tips=23>エリオット</tips>を遮って、少女に微笑みかけた。","en":"<tips=27>Liao</tips> stopped <tips=23>Elliott</tips> just as he was about to pull the trigger, then smiled at the girl.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r359","rowIndex":359,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「おまえはつぎのろんたおになるよ」","en":"“You will be the next Longtou.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"マリア","displayName":"Maria","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r360","rowIndex":360,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　少女はゆらりと壁から背を離す。","en":"The girl swayed away from the wall.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r361","rowIndex":361,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「かみさまがそう言ってる。だから<tips=62>マリア</tips>がてつだう」","en":"“God says so. That’s why <tips=62>Maria</tips> will help you.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"マリア","displayName":"Maria","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r362","rowIndex":362,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　少女はその場で飛び跳ねた。すると、空中でぱっと姿が黒っぽい別のものに変わる。みなが注目するそのなかで、それは落下して床にぶつかり、ゴトッと重い音を立てて転がった。","en":"The girl sprang into the air. In that instant, her shape abruptly became something else, something dark. It fell before the eyes of everyone watching, struck the floor with a heavy thud, and rolled.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r363","rowIndex":363,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それは、さっきまでみなが見ていた<tips=27>廖</tips>の胸像だった。ちょうど胸の真ん中辺りで切断され、内側のがらんどうが見て取れる。","en":"It was the bust of <tips=27>Liao</tips> they had all been looking at moments earlier. It had been severed across the middle of the chest, exposing the hollow within.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r364","rowIndex":364,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"（銅像の内側って、空っぽになっていたんだ）","en":"(So bronze statues are empty inside.)","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r365","rowIndex":365,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=28>トーマス</tips>は自分でも変だと思ったが、ついそんなことを考えてしまった。","en":"<tips=28>Thomas</tips> knew it was a peculiar thought under the circumstances, but it occurred to him all the same.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r366","rowIndex":366,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その背後で、また声がする。","en":"The voice came again from behind him.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r367","rowIndex":367,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「おまえのテキはしぬ。<tips=62>マリア</tips>がころすから」","en":"“Your enemies will die. <tips=62>Maria</tips> will kill them.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r368","rowIndex":368,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　消えたはずの少女は、いつの間にか台座の前に立っている。","en":"The girl who was supposed to have vanished was somehow standing in front of the pedestal.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r369","rowIndex":369,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　つまり、胸像と少女が瞬時にその場所を交換したような格好だが、これもまた、誰の目にも移動した瞬間は見えなかった。","en":"In other words, the bust and the girl appeared to have exchanged places instantaneously. Once again, however, not one person had seen the moment of movement.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r370","rowIndex":370,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=23>エリオット</tips>はすぐにそちらに銃を構え直す。","en":"<tips=23>Elliott</tips> immediately swung his gun back toward her.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r371","rowIndex":371,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ボス」","en":"“Boss.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r372","rowIndex":372,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼は先ほどの制止命令の撤回を求めるべく小さくそう呼んだが、","en":"He uttered the quiet appeal, asking Liao to withdraw his earlier order to hold fire.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r373","rowIndex":373,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「大丈夫だ。撃つな」","en":"“It’s all right. Don’t shoot.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r374","rowIndex":374,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=27>廖</tips>はもう一度繰り返し、","en":"<tips=27>Liao</tips> repeated the command.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r375","rowIndex":375,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「お前の名は<tips=62>マリア</tips>というのか？」","en":"“Your name is <tips=62>Maria</tips>?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r376","rowIndex":376,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうだ」","en":"“That’s right.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r377","rowIndex":377,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=27>廖</tips>の質問に、<tips=62>マリア</tips>と名乗った少女はこくりとうなずく。","en":"In answer to <tips=27>Liao’s</tips> question, the girl who had called herself <tips=62>Maria</tips> gave a small nod.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r378","rowIndex":378,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「じゃあ<tips=62>マリア</tips>。お前がどういう立場の人間で、なぜそんな提案をするのか知らないが、我々は彼らを殺そうなんて思ってはいない。世間でおかしな噂でも聞いたかもしれないが、我々はきわめて平和にすべてを進めたいと思っている」","en":"“Very well, <tips=62>Maria</tips>. I don’t know what your position is or why you are making this proposal, but we have no intention of killing them. You may have heard some peculiar rumor in the street, but we wish to conduct the entire matter peacefully.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r379","rowIndex":379,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=28>トーマス</tips>から見える<tips=27>廖</tips>の横顔は冷酷な笑みをたたえている。","en":"The profile of <tips=27>Liao</tips> visible to <tips=28>Thomas</tips> bore a ruthless smile.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r380","rowIndex":380,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それは他人に緊張を強いる独特の雰囲気がある表情で、この顔が、世間の人間が知っている<tips=27>廖志明</tips>という男の顔なのだ。","en":"There was something singular in that expression that put other people on edge. This was the face of the man the world knew as <tips=27>Liao Chi-ming</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r381","rowIndex":381,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「だが、お前は素晴らしい能力を持っている。いつか協力が必要な時が来るかも知れない。だからとりあえず、連絡先だけでも教えて、今回は何もしないで引き取ってくれないかね？」","en":"“But you possess a remarkable ability. The day may come when we require your cooperation. For now, would you give us some way to contact you, do nothing further today, and be on your way?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r382","rowIndex":382,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　この状況で交渉をしようとしている父に、<tips=28>トーマス</tips>は驚きを隠せなかった。","en":"<tips=28>Thomas</tips> could not conceal his surprise that his father would attempt a negotiation under these circumstances.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r383","rowIndex":383,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼は事態について行けなくて、ただただ混乱してしまっている。","en":"He could not keep up with what was happening and was simply, utterly bewildered.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r384","rowIndex":384,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どうだい？」","en":"“What do you say?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r385","rowIndex":385,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　なかなか答えようとしない<tips=62>マリア</tips>に<tips=27>廖</tips>は威圧感のある笑顔を浮かべてそう促す。","en":"When <tips=62>Maria</tips> showed no inclination to answer, <tips=27>Liao</tips> pressed her with an intimidating smile.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r386","rowIndex":386,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=62>マリア</tips>はかみさまじゃないヒトのメイレイはきかない」","en":"“<tips=62>Maria</tips> doesn’t take orders from people who aren’t God.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r387","rowIndex":387,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　無表情に言うと、またゆらりと動いてからぴょんと飛び跳ね、そして空中でぱっと消えた。","en":"She spoke without expression, swayed again, and hopped into the air. Then, in midair, she abruptly disappeared.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r388","rowIndex":388,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=28>トーマス</tips>は二度目にも関わらず息をのむほどに驚き、また先ほどのように別の場所に移動したのかと部屋のあちこちを見回したが、もうどこにも少女の姿は見えなかった。少女は完全に消えたのだ。","en":"Despite having seen it once before, <tips=28>Thomas</tips> gasped in surprise. He searched every corner of the room, wondering whether she had moved to some other position as she had before, but the girl was nowhere to be found. She had vanished completely.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r389","rowIndex":389,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「帰ったかな」","en":"“Think she’s gone?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エリオット・ネス","displayName":"Eliot Ness","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r390","rowIndex":390,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=23>エリオット</tips>は銃を握ったまま窓から外を覗くと、舌打ちをして、そして戻って来た。","en":"Still gripping his pistol, <tips=23>Elliott</tips> looked outside through the window, clicked his tongue, and returned.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r391","rowIndex":391,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「かなり危険な<tips=16>タイプA</tips>でしたな。相手がその気だったら、我々もその銅像みたいになっていました。今日は害意はないようですが、やはり殺しておくべきだったと思いますぜ。今だったらやれたでしょうが、もし相手が最初からその気で本気でかかってきたら、私も完全に防ぎきれるとは言えない」","en":"“She was an extremely dangerous <tips=16>Type A</tips>. If she had meant us harm, we would have ended up like that bronze bust. She did not appear to have any hostile intent today, but I still think we should have killed her. We probably could have done it just now. But if she came at us in earnest with murder in mind from the very start, I couldn’t promise that even I would stop her completely.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エリオット・ネス","displayName":"Eliot Ness","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r392","rowIndex":392,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼は苦虫を噛みつぶしたような顔をしている。","en":"He wore a thoroughly sour expression.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r393","rowIndex":393,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いい話はどこに転がっているかわからんからな。一応話だけは聞くのがおれの流儀だ」","en":"“You never know where a good opportunity may turn up. I make a point of hearing people out.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"廖志明","displayName":"Liao Chi-ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r394","rowIndex":394,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「危険を冒して大して面白くもない話でしたな」","en":"“A great deal of risk for a proposition that wasn’t even very interesting.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エリオット・ネス","displayName":"Eliot Ness","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r395","rowIndex":395,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「おれはそうは思わなかったがね」","en":"“I wouldn’t say that.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"廖志明","displayName":"Liao Chi-ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r396","rowIndex":396,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「何にしろ、あいつは危険すぎます。次は、見た瞬間に射殺しますよ」","en":"“In any event, she’s too dangerous. The next time I see her, I’ll shoot her dead on sight.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エリオット・ネス","displayName":"Eliot Ness","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r397","rowIndex":397,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ふむ。……しかし、とんでもないやつだったな……」","en":"“Hmm. ...Still, she was extraordinary...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"廖志明","displayName":"Liao Chi-ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r398","rowIndex":398,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=27>廖</tips>は脱力した身体を投げ出すようにソファに腰掛けると、大きく息を吐いた。その視線は、どんな道具を使っても真似出来ないほど鮮やかに切断された胸像の断面に注がれている。","en":"<tips=27>Liao</tips> dropped onto the sofa as though all the strength had left his body and let out a long breath. His eyes remained fixed on the cross section of the bust, cut more cleanly than any tool could have managed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r399","rowIndex":399,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　とにかく、少女は去ったらしい。何が起こったのかまったくわからなかったが、とにかく危険も去ったということでいいのだろうか？","en":"At any rate, the girl appeared to have gone. Thomas understood nothing of what had happened, but could he at least conclude that the danger had passed with her?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r400","rowIndex":400,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=27>廖</tips>や<tips=23>エリオット</tips>の態度を見ると、どうやらそのようだ。","en":"Judging from <tips=27>Liao</tips> and <tips=23>Elliott’s</tips> behavior, apparently he could.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r401","rowIndex":401,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=28>トーマス</tips>はおそるおそる息を吐き、肩の力を抜く。そして、いつの間にか顔に浮かんだ冷や汗を拭うべく左腕を動かそうとした時になって、やっと、<tips=29>アイス</tips>が自分のすぐそばによりそって、手を掴んでいてくれていたことに気がついた。","en":"<tips=28>Thomas</tips> cautiously let out his breath and relaxed his shoulders. It was only when he tried to move his left arm to wipe away the cold sweat that had appeared on his face that he finally realized <tips=29>Ice</tips> had drawn close beside him and was holding his hand.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r402","rowIndex":402,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ありがとう。僕は、すっかり動転してしまって」","en":"“Thank you. I completely lost my composure.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r403","rowIndex":403,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=28>トーマス</tips>が苦笑いすると、","en":"<tips=28>Thomas</tips> gave a wry smile.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r404","rowIndex":404,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「大丈夫です。<tips=28>トーマス</tips>様だけは、お守りしますから」","en":"“It’s all right. I will protect you, <tips=28>Master Thomas</tips>, whatever else may happen.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アイス","displayName":"Ice","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r405","rowIndex":405,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=29>アイス</tips>は、緊張の見えない、いつも通り表情のない顔でそう言った。","en":"<tips=29>Ice</tips> spoke with her usual expressionless face, which betrayed no tension.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r406","rowIndex":406,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「能力だけでなく、アタマの方もまともではなさそうだった。あの様子だと、あいつは近いうちに<tips=81>龍頭</tips>を襲撃しそうだな。……それを踏まえて、おれはどう動くべきか？　あいつが襲撃に成功しても、失敗しても、まず疑われるのはおれだろう。今の段階で<tips=81>龍頭</tips>襲撃者の嫌疑をかけられるのはいかがなものか？」","en":"“It wasn’t only her ability—she didn’t seem right in the head, either. Judging by her behavior, she may attack the <tips=81>Longtou</tips> before long. ...Given that, how should I proceed? Whether she succeeds or fails, I will be the first person they suspect. Being suspected of an attack on the <tips=81>Longtou</tips> at this stage would hardly be desirable.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"廖志明","displayName":"Liao Chi-ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r407","rowIndex":407,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=27>廖</tips>はすでに落ち着きを取り戻していて、人差し指で自分のこめかみをとんとんと叩いている。これは彼が思索にふけるときの決まった動作であった。","en":"<tips=27>Liao</tips> had already regained his composure and was tapping his index finger against his temple. It was his habitual gesture when deep in thought.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r408","rowIndex":408,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　言葉は疑問形になっているが、これも彼が考え事をするときの癖で、周囲の人間に答えを求めているわけではない。","en":"He phrased the words as questions, but that too was a habit of his when thinking. He was not seeking answers from those around him.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r409","rowIndex":409,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=27>廖志明</tips>は他人からの情報は積極的に求めるが、いかなるときでも他人の考えを求めようとはしない。だから、参謀や腹心のようなものは持たない。そのやり方でこの立場まで上り詰めてきており、絶対の自信を持っている。","en":"<tips=27>Liao Chi-ming</tips> actively sought information from others, but under no circumstances did he seek anyone else’s opinion. For that reason, he kept neither a strategist nor a confidant. That approach had carried him to his present position, and he had absolute confidence in it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r410","rowIndex":410,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いっそのこと、こんな来訪者があったと事前に通達して恩を売るか？　……いや、今更そんな恩を売るメリットは薄いな。そもそも、香港の連中が殺されてくれること自体は問題がない。襲撃が失敗しても、それなりの被害があれば、たった一人のサイキックのガキにいいようにされたと、世間は彼らを侮るだろう。……襲撃の成否にかかわらず、我々が不利益を被ることなく次の一手を選択出来る何かが必要というわけか……」","en":"“Should I warn them that we had such a visitor and put them in my debt? ...No, there is little advantage in doing them that favor now. It makes no difference to me if the Hong Kong faction is killed. Even if the attack fails, any appreciable damage will make the public scorn them for being toyed with by a single psychic child. ...So I need something that leaves us free to choose our next move without paying a price, regardless of whether the attack succeeds...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"廖志明","displayName":"Liao Chi-ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r411","rowIndex":411,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　作戦を考えるときの<tips=27>廖志明</tips>には、<tips=9>Y地区</tips>有数のファミリーのボスに相応しい威厳に満ちた、人を寄せ付けない雰囲気がある。","en":"When devising an operation, <tips=27>Liao Chi-ming</tips> assumed an unapproachable dignity befitting the head of one of <tips=9>Y District’s</tips> leading criminal organizations.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r412","rowIndex":412,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　一同は、彼の黙考を静かに見守る他なかった。","en":"The others had no choice but to watch him deliberate in silence.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r413","rowIndex":413,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　五分ほど過ぎて、不意に彼は顔を上げた。","en":"About five minutes later, he abruptly raised his head.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r414","rowIndex":414,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ときに<tips=28>トーマス</tips>」","en":"“By the way, <tips=28>Thomas</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"廖志明","displayName":"Liao Chi-ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r415","rowIndex":415,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「な、なに？」","en":"“W-what?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r416","rowIndex":416,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　急に名を呼ばれて彼はたじろぐ。","en":"Thomas flinched when his father suddenly called his name.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r417","rowIndex":417,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「お前、今携帯電話は持っているか？」","en":"“Do you have your cell phone with you?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"廖志明","displayName":"Liao Chi-ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r418","rowIndex":418,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「う、うん」","en":"“Y-yes.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r419","rowIndex":419,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ここでそれを預かる。それから監視者を付けて、他の手段での通信や連絡も、制限させて貰う」","en":"“I’ll take it from you for now. I’ll also have someone watch you and restrict your access to any other means of communication.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"廖志明","displayName":"Liao Chi-ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r420","rowIndex":420,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「わかったよ。……でも、どうして？」","en":"“All right. ...But why?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r421","rowIndex":421,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「お前を信じないわけではないが、妙にあの御曹司に肩入れしているようだからな。悪く思うな」","en":"“It isn’t that I don’t trust you, but you seem strangely partial to that young master. Don’t hold it against me.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"廖志明","displayName":"Liao Chi-ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r422","rowIndex":422,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　普段の父としての表情と、ボスとしての表情のいりまじった複雑な顔でそう言われると、<tips=28>トーマス</tips>も頷くしかなかった。","en":"He said it with a complex expression in which the father and the boss were intermingled, leaving <tips=28>Thomas</tips> no choice but to nod.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r423","rowIndex":423,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それを確認すると、<tips=27>廖</tips>は即座に立ち上がって自分の秘書を呼ぶよう従者に伝える。","en":"Once <tips=27>Liao</tips> had confirmed his assent, he stood at once and ordered a servant to summon his secretary.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r424","rowIndex":424,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「よし、方針は決まったぞ！　さっきの少女は、我々の幸運の女神となるだろう！」","en":"“Good. Our course is decided! That girl will become our goddess of fortune!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"廖志明","displayName":"Liao Chi-ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-1:r425","rowIndex":425,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　一同にそう宣言すると、カツカツと靴音を立てて部屋を出て、<tips=23>エリオット</tips>が無言のままそれを追った。","en":"After making the declaration to everyone present, he strode out of the room, his shoes striking sharply against the floor. <tips=23>Elliott</tips> followed in silence.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}}]},{"position":18,"code":"D1-1","unitId":"D1-1","rows":[{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r1","rowIndex":1,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　世界というものはどうしてこれほどにつまらなく、味気ないものだろうと、ずっと思っていた。","en":"All my life, I had wondered why the world had to be so dull, so utterly devoid of flavor.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r2","rowIndex":2,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　花や月などという自然の美しさも、賢そうな人たちが褒めそやす自動車やマンションより高い値がつくアートの価値もわからない。","en":"I could appreciate neither the natural beauty of things like flowers and the moon nor the value of art that clever-looking people showered with praise and that fetched higher prices than cars or condominiums.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r3","rowIndex":3,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　食べ物は好きなものもあるけど、大体のものはくさくてまずくて口に入れたくもないようなものばかり。頼んでもいないのに時間になれば親が出し、仕方なく詰め込む。食事の時間は基本的には苦痛だ。","en":"There were foods I liked, but most things stank and tasted so awful I did not even want to put them in my mouth. When mealtime came, my parents served them without my asking, and I had no choice but to stuff them down. Mealtimes were generally an ordeal.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r4","rowIndex":4,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　学校のテストでも、運動でも、優劣に意味を感じない。悪い成績でもそんなものか、良い成績でもそんなものか。","en":"Whether on school tests or in sports, I saw no meaning in being better or worse. Bad result or good, my reaction was the same: So that’s how it is.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r5","rowIndex":5,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　小遣いを貰えばちょっと心弾むが、かといって大金持ちになって豪邸に住みたいとか、ブランド物の服を買いあさりたいとは思えない。","en":"A little pocket money could make my heart leap. That did not mean I wanted to become fabulously wealthy, live in a mansion, or buy armloads of designer clothes.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r6","rowIndex":6,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　何か名誉あることをなしとげて、人に賞賛されたり、尊敬されたりしたいとも思わない。そもそも、他人というものはみんな石の裏の湿った土に集まる虫のようにワサワサしていて、うごめいていて気持ち悪い。","en":"I had no desire to achieve some glorious feat and be praised or respected for it, either. To begin with, other people made me think of insects massing in the wet earth under a stone—all that swarming and writhing was revolting.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r7","rowIndex":7,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　他人にはまるきり敬意がもてなくて、争いで負けたらわりと悔しいのに、勝ってもさほど嬉しくないから割に合わず、争いたくない。","en":"I could not muster the slightest respect for other people. Losing a contest with them was fairly galling, yet winning one brought me little pleasure, so it was not worth the trouble. I wanted no part of competing.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r8","rowIndex":8,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　他人となんか関わりたくないし、話したくもないし、いい思い出なんか無邪気だった幼児のころまで遡らないと見つからないっていうのに、携帯電話に登録がないのを見ると死にたくなるし、一週間人と喋らず人に姿を見られることもない生活を送るとこの若くて人生で一番美しい時期を見られずにしわくちゃになってしまうのかと思って死にたくなるし、誰にも愛されていないということは世の中にとって必要のない人間なのだなと死にたくなる。矛盾している。","en":"I wanted nothing to do with other people, did not even want to speak to them, and had to go all the way back to my innocent early childhood to find a pleasant memory—yet an empty contact list on my phone made me want to die. A week in which I spoke to no one and no one even saw me made me think I would grow old and wrinkled without anyone ever looking upon me in this young and most beautiful season of my life, and that made me want to die. The fact that no one loved me meant the world had no need for me, and that made me want to die. I was a contradiction.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r9","rowIndex":9,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　実際私はありとあらゆるところで、矛盾し、破綻し、混乱している。","en":"The truth was that I contradicted myself, came apart, and lost my way in every conceivable respect.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r10","rowIndex":10,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　死にたい死にたいとすぐ心の中で呟くわりには、自殺をしようなんてちっとも思わないし、むしろ醜くもがいて世界にしがみついてでも生きて行きたい。","en":"For someone so quick to mutter I want to die, I want to die inside my head, I did not want to attempt suicide in the least. Quite the opposite: I wanted to live, even if I had to cling to the world in an ugly, desperate struggle.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r11","rowIndex":11,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　幸福になりたいと思う反面、みんなに愛されて欲しいものを全部手に入れていい気になって笑っている自分を想像すると吐き気がして、気持ち悪くて、何もないまま空っぽに死ねばいいと思ってしまう。","en":"Part of me wanted happiness. But when I imagined myself loved by everyone, possessed of everything I wanted, laughing in smug satisfaction, the image nauseated me. It was repulsive. I thought I should die empty, with nothing at all.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r12","rowIndex":12,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　他人をすべて見下しているくせに、全人類の誰よりも自分の方が劣っている屑だと感じている。","en":"I looked down on every other person alive, yet felt that I was garbage, inferior to every last one of them.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r13","rowIndex":13,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ひとりぼっちでじゅくじゅくとねちねちと色んなことを考えている自分のあり方は、まじりっけない本物の自分らしい生き方だと思うけど、これも自分に対する欺瞞にしか思えなくなって耐えられない時もある。","en":"Brooding alone, letting one thought after another fester and ooze inside me—that seemed like the pure, unadulterated, authentic way for me to live. At times, though, even that came to feel like nothing but self-deception, and I could not bear it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r14","rowIndex":14,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　他人と自分でやりとりをすると、あるいは他人同士のやりとりを見ると、人間というもののほとんどは、目の前の人間を人間だと思っていないように感じる。心があり人生があり生まれた背景があり、自分と同じだけのものを持った存在が目の前にいるってことをちっとも想像出来ていないように感じる。","en":"Whenever I dealt with another person, or watched two other people deal with each other, I felt that most human beings did not regard the human being before them as human at all. They seemed wholly incapable of imagining that this person had a heart and a life and a history that had brought them into being, that the person standing there possessed as much within them as they themselves did.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r15","rowIndex":15,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして表面だけを撫で合って、本当の意味ではかみ合っていない言葉をなげあって、何か人間関係をやっていると勘違いしているように見える。","en":"Instead, they stroked one another’s surfaces and tossed back and forth words that never truly met, under the mistaken impression that they were having some sort of human relationship.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r16","rowIndex":16,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そういうのを見るのがつらい。","en":"It hurt to watch.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r17","rowIndex":17,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私にとって世の中は、寒いし暑いし痛いし眠たいのに眠れないしくさいし哀しいし寂しいし、寂しい。寂しい。寂しい。","en":"To me, the world was cold, hot, painful; it made me sleepy yet would not let me sleep; it stank; it was sad; and it was lonely, lonely. Lonely. Lonely.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r18","rowIndex":18,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「私はファウスト博士の前にあらわれた、すべてを否定する霊なのだ。時間よ止まれ、汝は美しい！」","en":"“I am the spirit who appeared before Doctor Faust—the spirit that denies all things. Time, stand still—thou art beautiful!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r19","rowIndex":19,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　死ぬまでにそんなことを言えるような体験をしたいのだ。しかし、どこにもそんなものはありえないというような気もしている。","en":"Before I die, I want to experience something that will let me say those words. Yet part of me suspects that no such thing could exist anywhere.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r20","rowIndex":20,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私はいわゆる<tips=16>タイプA</tips>というやつだ。サイキックとも言う。ミュータントとも言う。言う。","en":"I was what they called a <tips=16>Type A</tips>. A psychic, they called it. A mutant, they called it. Called it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r21","rowIndex":21,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　同じミュータントに分類される<tips=17>タイプB</tips>は心がおかしくなってしまうことがあるが、<tips=16>タイプA</tips>は身体がおかしくなる。おかしくならない人もいるらしい。残念ながら私はおかしな身体を持った人間だ。心もおかしい。","en":"A <tips=17>Type B</tips>, likewise classified as a mutant, can sometimes go wrong in the mind; with <tips=16>Type A</tips>, it is the body that goes wrong. Some people apparently escape without anything going wrong at all. Unfortunately, I was someone with a body that had gone wrong. My mind was wrong too.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r22","rowIndex":22,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　世の中の<tips=16>タイプA</tips>には、どう見ても人間とは思えない姿になってしまう人もいる。","en":"Some people with <tips=16>Type A</tips> end up in forms no one could possibly take for human.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r23","rowIndex":23,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　かろうじて人間のかたちを保ってはいても、一目でそうとわかる明らかに異常な特徴を与えられる人もいる。","en":"Others barely retain a human shape and are saddled with some obvious abnormality visible at a glance.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r24","rowIndex":24,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そういう人たちと比べれば、私は一見すると普通の人間と区別がつかないだけ恵まれた<tips=77>特質変異</tips>だと言えるのかもしれない。","en":"Compared with them, perhaps I could call mine a fortunate <tips=77>trait mutation</tips>, simply because at first glance I am indistinguishable from an ordinary person.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r25","rowIndex":25,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　だけれどまあ、より酷い誰かを見て自分はあの人よりマシだって安堵するのは、心のくさった反吐の出るような低い人間がやるおぞましい満足の仕方だよね。","en":"But looking at someone worse off and reassuring yourself that at least you are better than they are—that is a hideous sort of satisfaction for low, rotten-hearted people who make you want to vomit, isn’t it?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r26","rowIndex":26,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　比較のなかでしか喜びを見いだせない人間の魂は『比較』の泥沼で死ぬ。","en":"A soul capable of finding joy only through comparison will die in the mire of “comparison.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r27","rowIndex":27,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は誰がなんと言おうと、何と比べようと、絶対に揺るがない心の根底から確信が持てる黄金の価値観を持ちたいんだ。それが本当の人生だと思うから。","en":"No matter what anyone said, no matter what anyone compared it with, I wanted a golden system of values—something absolute and unshakable, something I could believe from the very bottom of my heart. Because that, I thought, would be a real life.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r28","rowIndex":28,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私の<tips=77>特質変異</tips>はとめどもなく流れる体液だ。","en":"My <tips=77>trait mutation</tips> was a ceaseless flow of bodily fluid.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r29","rowIndex":29,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　普通の人でも汗をかく体質の人とそうでもない人に分かれるだろうが、その中でもとびっきりの汗っかきを十人くらい集めて、その流れ出る汗にゆるゆるの鼻水みたいな若干の粘りけをもたせたら私の<tips=77>特質変異</tips>になると考えてもらっていいだろう。","en":"Even among ordinary people, some sweat more than others. Imagine gathering ten of the very sweatiest, then giving all the sweat pouring off them the slight viscosity of runny mucus, and you will have a fair idea of my <tips=77>trait mutation</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r30","rowIndex":30,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　精神や体調の具合で多少の変動はあるものの、肌はいつもしっとりと濡れ、半日も服を着替えず拭いもせずにいるならば何もかもぐっしょりと濡れて、池に落ちでもしたのかという有様だ。","en":"The volume varied somewhat with my mental and physical condition, but my skin was always damp. If I went half a day without changing my clothes or wiping myself down, everything would be soaked through, as if I had fallen into a pond.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r31","rowIndex":31,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　髪の毛もすぐにべっとりとしてみっともなくなってしまうので、タオルが手放せない。","en":"My hair quickly became greasy and unsightly too, so I could never be without a towel.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r32","rowIndex":32,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして歩いたところには、体液がきらきら光るレインボーロードが出来る。","en":"And wherever I walked, my bodily fluid left behind a glittering Rainbow Road.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r33","rowIndex":33,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その様は、海を割って人々の前に道を示したモーセか、あるいはナメクジのようである。","en":"The sight resembled Moses parting the sea to show his people a path—or else a slug.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r34","rowIndex":34,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そしてこのナメクジの身体と引き替えに手に入れた能力は、飛行。","en":"In exchange for this slug’s body, I had received the power of flight.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r35","rowIndex":35,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は何の力を借りなくても空を飛ぶことが出来る。しかも、ふんわりではなく、割と速い速度でぴゅんぴゅんと飛べる。このナメクジは蝿や蚊のように素早いのである。","en":"I could fly without relying on any other power. Not merely drift gently, either: I could zip around at a fairly high speed. This slug was as quick as a fly or mosquito.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r36","rowIndex":36,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　いわゆる能力強度だとかいうやつが相当優れているらしく、歩いたり走ったりするよりも飛んでるほうが全然疲れなくて、人の目がなければもう一生歩かずに移動は飛行と乗り物だけにしたいくらい快適である。","en":"Apparently my so-called ability strength was exceptionally high, and flying tired me far less than walking or running. If not for other people’s eyes, it was so comfortable that I would gladly have spent the rest of my life traveling solely by air or vehicle, never taking another step.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r37","rowIndex":37,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　まさしく私は空飛ぶナメクジ女だ。","en":"I was, in the most literal sense, the Flying Slug Woman.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r38","rowIndex":38,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　一口に<tips=16>タイプA</tips>といっても、しょうもない能力を与えられるのが大多数なのを思えば、これはとても素晴らしい能力だ。子供が憧れるようなロマンがある。私のような陰湿な人間には似つかわしくない爽やかな力だ。そして、使い方によっては就職にも役に立つだろうし、実際親や親戚もそうすべきだと言う。科学が発展した今でも、自力で空をすいすいと飛ぶのは私くらいのものであろう。","en":"Given that the great majority of people called <tips=16>Type A</tips> were saddled with worthless abilities, mine was magnificent. It had the romance children dreamed of—a bright, exhilarating power ill suited to a gloomy person like me. Used properly, it could even help me find work, and my parents and relatives did in fact say I should put it to use that way. Even with science as advanced as it was, I was probably the only person who could glide freely through the sky under my own power.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r39","rowIndex":39,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しかし私は働きたくなかった。","en":"But I did not want to work.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r40","rowIndex":40,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　いや、家にいながらのんびりとできる仕事ならやってもいい。でも、飛行能力を活かした仕事となると、大抵肉体労働なわけでしょ？　しかも屋外で。そんな仕事をやりたいわけがない。","en":"Well, I might have accepted some leisurely job I could do from home. But work that made use of flight would usually mean manual labor, wouldn’t it? Outdoors, no less. Why would I want a job like that?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r41","rowIndex":41,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　いや、それだけで私を生まれながらのナマケモノ、出来損ないと言ってくれるな。私だって最初から働きたくなかったわけじゃない。","en":"No, do not go calling me a born idler and a failure on that basis alone. It was not as if I had never wanted to work at all.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r42","rowIndex":42,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　学校を中退して家に引きこもる日々を続けるなかで、いくらなんでもこのまま一生を終えてはいけないと、社会復帰をしなければいけないと、アルバイトに挑戦したことだってある。","en":"After dropping out of school and spending my days shut away at home, I told myself I could not go on like this for the rest of my life, that I had to rejoin society, and even tried taking a part-time job.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r43","rowIndex":43,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　明るいオシャレな仕事や人と会話する仕事や複雑な動きをする仕事は絶対に出来ないと思ったので、工場でライン上に流れる物品を検査するという私の性格にぴったりな職場だった。","en":"I knew I could never handle a bright, stylish workplace, a job where I had to converse with people, or one involving any complicated motions. So I found a position perfectly suited to my nature: inspecting goods as they traveled down a factory line.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r44","rowIndex":44,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　まわりも外国人ばかりでみんな顔をマスクで隠して髪の毛も帽子で隠して、私は<tips=16>タイプA</tips>であることを隠して、ああ、これなら馴染める打ち解けられるやっていけると思ったのだけど、いくらタオルを取り替えてもびしょびしょ床を濡らしてしまうし、そんな場所にも同僚間での派閥があってグループがあって私はどこにも入れずに孤立して昼休みはご飯を食べる場所がないので敷地外に出ようとしたら課長に怒られるし、仕事はくそつまんないし、<tips=16>タイプA</tips>であることが完全にばれるとなんだかいじめられるようになって、もう、休憩のたびにトイレでゲロを吐くし。","en":"Everyone around me was a foreigner, and everyone concealed their face behind a mask and their hair beneath a cap. I hid the fact that I was a <tips=16>Type A</tips> and thought, Ah, I can fit in here, connect with them, make it work. Except however often I changed my towels, I still left the floor sopping wet; even a place like that had cliques among the workers, little groups, and I could not get into any of them, so I was isolated; at lunch I had nowhere to eat, and when I tried to leave the premises, the section chief yelled at me; the work was fucking boring; and once everyone realized I was a <tips=16>Type A</tips>, somehow they started bullying me, and by then I was vomiting in the bathroom at every break.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r45","rowIndex":45,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そこで心は完全に折れ、もう絶対に二度と働くものかという思いを新たにした。","en":"That broke my spirit completely and renewed my conviction that I would never, ever work again.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r46","rowIndex":46,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　今では労働を具体的に考えるだけでも、わけのわからぬ緊張で心臓がバクバクし、目眩がしてしまう。これはかつて学校に対して私が持っていた感情そのものである。どうして自分はこんなにメンタルが弱いのか、本当に嫌になってしまう。あえてよく言えば繊細。","en":"Now, merely thinking about the concrete realities of employment brings on an anxiety I cannot explain: my heart pounds and I grow dizzy. It is precisely what I once felt toward school. I truly hate how mentally weak I am. To put it as kindly as possible: sensitive.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r47","rowIndex":47,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　バイトにめげて家で号泣している私を母親が慰めに来た時も「お母さんがこんな変な身体に生んだせいでつらいことばっかりだ！」と、叫んでしまった。","en":"When my mother came to comfort me as I sobbed at home, crushed by the job, I screamed at her, “It’s because you gave me this freakish body that nothing ever happens to me but pain!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r48","rowIndex":48,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　両親が自分を<tips=16>タイプA</tips>として産んでしまったことで負い目を感じているのを私は知っている。","en":"I knew my parents felt guilty for having brought me into the world as a <tips=16>Type A</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r49","rowIndex":49,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その一方で、私が<tips=16>タイプA</tips>として生まれたことに対して、両親の責任は全くないのも知っている。","en":"At the same time, I knew that my being born a <tips=16>Type A</tips> was not their fault in the slightest.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r50","rowIndex":50,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　生んだせいで、なんて当たるのは間違いなのだ。","en":"Blaming them—saying, “This is your fault for giving birth to me”—was wrong.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r51","rowIndex":51,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　わかっているのに私はさらにこうも叫んでしまった。","en":"Even though I knew that, I went on to scream this as well:","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r52","rowIndex":52,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なんで私なんか産んだんだ！　<tips=16>タイプA</tips>だと分かった時点でしめ殺してくれれば良かったのに！」","en":"“Why did you ever have me? Once you knew I was a <tips=16>Type A</tips>, you should have strangled me to death!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r53","rowIndex":53,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　痛い、痛い。思い出しても心が痛い。","en":"It hurts. It hurts. Even the memory makes my heart hurt.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r54","rowIndex":54,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　中学生なら許されるその台詞。だけれど私はもう十八才。","en":"A line one might forgive from a middle schooler. But I was already eighteen.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r55","rowIndex":55,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　この広大無辺の世界のなかで両親というたった二人の人間だけが私を気にかけてくれる、愛してくれるのだ。だからそこに甘えているだけなんだ。","en":"In this vast and boundless world, my parents were the only two people who cared about me, who loved me. I was only taking advantage of that.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r56","rowIndex":56,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　でも親の愛だって無限とは限らない。両親は、私の人格などを評価してるのではなく、ただ自分たちの作った子だという属性だけで、いわば子を愛する動物の本能で愛してくれているのだけれど、この立場が本当に盤石とは思えない。","en":"But even parental love was not necessarily infinite. My parents did not love me because they valued my character, but solely because I possessed the attribute of being a child they had made—because of what one might call the animal instinct to love one’s offspring. Yet I could not believe that status was truly secure.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r57","rowIndex":57,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ひどいことをする親は世の中に沢山いるわけで。そういう親だったら、私なんかとっくに見放されていてもおかしくない。","en":"The world contained plenty of parents who did terrible things. With parents like those, it would hardly have been surprising if someone like me had been abandoned long ago.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r58","rowIndex":58,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私の両親は本当に心が強く、すごいと思う。感謝もしている。","en":"My parents were both astonishingly strong at heart. I truly admired them. I was grateful to them too.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r59","rowIndex":59,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　出来れば私の関与によってあの人たちを幸福に出来ることがあればいいが、残念だ。無理だ。それは私の能力の限界というものを超えているのです。余計なことはしないでいいから、悪く言わんから、ただ消えてなくなれば良いのにねという声がどこからか聞こえて来るよう。","en":"If there were any way my involvement could make those two happier, I would like that. Unfortunately. Impossible. It lay beyond the limits of my abilities. I could almost hear a voice from somewhere: Don’t do anything unnecessary. Take my advice—just disappear.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r60","rowIndex":60,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どこでも働けないのなら、うちの手伝いでもしたらどう？」と両親は安易に言う。我が家はわりと歴史の古い蕎麦屋なのだが、庶民的に出前などもやっている。","en":"“If you cannot work anywhere else, why not help us?” my parents proposed with blithe simplicity. Our family ran a soba shop with a fairly long history, but it was a modest, everyday place that made deliveries too.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r61","rowIndex":61,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「空を飛んで届けたら、きっと評判になって売り上げもあがるから沢山お給料をあげるよ」と両親は言う。","en":"“If you flew the orders out, people would talk, and sales would rise. We could pay you lots of money,” my parents said.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r62","rowIndex":62,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　でも私はあのみっともない岡持を持って空を飛ぶのはいやだ！　そんなの絶対にいやだ！　そもそも私は誰にも見られずにこそこそ飛びたいんだ。さらに言うと私は全然蕎麦が好きじゃない。ラーメンは大好きだ。むしろ食べ物のなかではっきり胸を張って好きだと言えるのはラーメンくらいだよ。なんだよ蕎麦って。つゆは甘塩っぱいだけで、麺はなんだか貧乏くさい味がする。","en":"But I did not want to fly carrying that embarrassing-looking soba delivery case! Absolutely not! To begin with, I wanted to fly furtively, where nobody could see me. Moreover, I did not like soba in the least. I adored ramen. In fact, ramen was about the only food I could plant my feet and proudly proclaim that I loved. What the hell was soba? Its broth was nothing but sugary salt, and its noodles tasted vaguely of poverty.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r63","rowIndex":63,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　だから百歩譲ってラーメン屋に転業するならやってもいいけど、蕎麦なんか絶対に運びたくない。売りたくない。自分が美味しいと言えない食べ物を届けるなんて私には出来ない。そもそも、そんな風に能力を使ったら、<tips=42>サイキック探知機</tips>がギャンギャンなって、警察がやって来てしまうじゃないか！","en":"I might—might—have agreed if they converted the place into a ramen shop, but I would never carry soba. Never sell it. I could not deliver food I could not honestly call delicious. And to begin with, using my ability that openly would set every <tips=42>psychic detector</tips> wailing and bring the police down on me!","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r64","rowIndex":64,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そんなわけで私はせっかくの飛行能力を全く有意義に使ってはいない。社会のために使ってはいない。そうして何に使っているのかと言うと、自分の性癖を満足させるためにのみ使っているのである。","en":"Thus I made no meaningful use whatsoever of my precious power of flight. I did not use it for society. What did I use it for, then? Exclusively to satisfy my own sexual proclivities.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r65","rowIndex":65,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私の趣味というのはひたすら家に引きこもって自慰をしながらネットゲームをしたり、自慰をしながら本を読んだり、とにかく依存的にしつこく性器を弄りながら何かをするというものだ。貴重な<tips=16>タイプA</tips>能力も勿論そのためだけに使われる。私は精神的にも肉体的にも自慰ばかりしているのだ。","en":"My preferred pastime was to barricade myself at home and play online games while masturbating, or read a book while masturbating—to do something, anything, while compulsively and relentlessly fondling my genitals. Naturally, my precious <tips=16>Type A</tips> ability was used for that purpose alone. Mentally and physically, all I ever did was masturbate.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r66","rowIndex":66,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は晴れの日は空を飛ばない。<tips=77>特質変異</tips>の体液がたらたらと地上に落下して、人が自分に気がついてしまうのではないかと、気が気でないからだ。だから、雨の降った日、しかもなるべく暗い時間帯に飛ぶことにしている。","en":"I never flew on clear days. I could not stop worrying that the fluid of my <tips=77>trait mutation</tips> would drip to the ground and make people notice me. So I flew only on rainy days, at as dark an hour as possible.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r67","rowIndex":67,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そうすると、他人の人生の様々なシーンを盗み見ることが出来てしまう。","en":"That let me steal glimpses of all manner of scenes from other people’s lives.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r68","rowIndex":68,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　人は頭上からの視線に対して無警戒だ。特に背の高い建物に住む人はなおさらだ。大事な異性との愛の営みをカーテンも閉めずに行ってしまう人もいる。","en":"People were heedless of eyes above them—especially those who lived in tall buildings. Some even made love to a beloved partner without bothering to close the curtains.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r69","rowIndex":69,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私はそういうシーンを空に留まりつつ、いつも持ち歩いている双眼鏡で観察する。時には空中に留まったまま自慰を行った。","en":"I would hover in the sky and observe such scenes through the binoculars I always carried. Sometimes I masturbated while suspended in midair.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r70","rowIndex":70,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　屋根裏の散歩者ならぬ、空中の飛行者である。","en":"Not The Stalker in the Attic, but The Flier in the Air.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r71","rowIndex":71,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　働きもせず、養ってくれる親を傷つけ、貴重な<tips=16>タイプA</tips>能力を無駄にしているという罪悪感も、そうしている間だけは薄れるような気がするのである。","en":"Only while I was doing that did the guilt of refusing to work, wounding the parents who supported me, and squandering a precious <tips=16>Type A</tips> ability seem to recede.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r72","rowIndex":72,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　相手が自分を見ない、自分だけが相手を見ているというのは、なんだか自分が無生物になったような、大気の一部になったような、なんとも言えない存在の軽さを感じさせてくれる。","en":"To watch someone who could not watch me in return—to be the sole observer—made me feel somehow inanimate, part of the atmosphere, possessed of an indescribable lightness of being.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r73","rowIndex":73,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そうして私はだらだらと毎日を過ごしていた。何もしないでいると苦痛で塗りつぶされてしまう時間を、いろいろな気休めで無理矢理埋めながら、無為に生きていた。","en":"And so I let one day after another dribble away. I lived idly, forcing one empty distraction after another into the hours that, if left unfilled, would have been painted over entirely with pain.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r74","rowIndex":74,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それが変わったのは、彼女と出会ってからだ。","en":"That changed when I met her.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r75","rowIndex":75,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私の家から最も近い駅を越えた向こう側は<tips=9>Y地区</tips>という、非常に治安の悪い地域となっている。親や学校の教師たちは口を酸っぱくして近づくなと言うけれども、他では手に入らない服やアクセサリーが手に入ったり、最近はオシャレな食べ物屋も出来たり、雑誌でもよく取り上げられたりでこのあたりの学生はよく遊びに行く。","en":"Across the station nearest my home lay <tips=9>Y District</tips>, a notoriously dangerous neighborhood. Parents and teachers warned students until they were hoarse never to go near it. But it offered clothes and accessories unavailable elsewhere, fashionable restaurants had opened there lately, and magazines covered it often enough that local students regularly visited for fun.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r76","rowIndex":76,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は学生ではないけれども、やはりこの地域の空をふわふわと飛ぶのが好きだった。","en":"I was no longer a student, but I too loved drifting through the sky above the district.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r77","rowIndex":77,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=9>Y地区</tips>には外国人やミュータントが多く、日本の法律とは別のルールで生きている世界もあり、空から見える景色も随分とスリリングで楽しい。売春地域なども多く、男女の営みに関しても独特のものがある。下から鉄砲で狙い撃ちでもされたらどうしようというドキドキ感とあいまって、刺激の少ない私にとっては格好の遊び場だった。","en":"<tips=9>Y District</tips> was home to many foreigners and mutants. Some communities within it lived by rules separate from Japanese law, and even the views from above were thrilling and entertaining. Prostitution districts abounded, along with their own unusual practices surrounding sex. Combined with the excitement of wondering whether someone below might shoot me out of the sky, it made a perfect playground for a person as starved of stimulation as I was.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r78","rowIndex":78,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　雨の日に、この街のネオンの上を飛ぶだけで、私は何か世界のどこかにうまった大事な宝物を探しているような気持ちに浸れるのだった。","en":"Simply flying above the city’s neon on a rainy day could immerse me in the feeling that I was hunting for some precious treasure buried somewhere in the world.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r79","rowIndex":79,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　実際はただの自慰のための素材を探してるだけにしても、である。","en":"Even if what I was really hunting was nothing but masturbation material.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r80","rowIndex":80,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そんな、いつもと同じ雨の日、私は彼女と出会った。","en":"It was on a rainy day just like any other that I met her.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r81","rowIndex":81,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=9>Y地区</tips>で他人の性交を覗くのは楽しい。それは性欲だけの話ではない。そこには金持ちがいて、貧乏人がいて、売春婦がいて、ギャングがいて、肌の違う様々な人々がいて、ミュータントたちがいる。色んな立場と、色んな姿形を持った人々が、思い思いの性交をしている。","en":"Watching other people have sex in <tips=9>Y District</tips> was fun, and not merely because it aroused me. There were wealthy people and poor people, prostitutes and gangsters, people of every color, and mutants. People of every station and every conceivable shape had sex in their own fashion.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r82","rowIndex":82,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そこにはそれぞれの文化があり、個性がある。私はそうして、人々が全裸になってお互いの個人的嗜好と、文化的背景をぶつかり合わせるのを見ながら、人間の奥深さを日々学ぶのであった。最近はもう、よほどきわどいものを見ても性欲などが起こることもない。窃視を続けていると、段々自分が人間でなく風景の一部になったような気になるとさっき言ったが、しばらくするとその感覚がさらに進んで、普段あれだけごちゃごちゃとくだらないことばかり考えてしまう私なのに、なぜかアタマが空っぽになって妙に冷静で落ち着いた気持ちになるようになった。","en":"Each had its own culture, its own individuality. By watching people strip naked and bring their private tastes and cultural backgrounds into collision, I deepened my understanding of humanity day by day. Lately, even the most extreme sight rarely stirred any sexual desire in me. I said before that continued voyeurism gradually made me feel less like a human being and more like part of the scenery. After a while the sensation went further still. Despite all the pointless, tangled thoughts that ordinarily crowded my head, it would somehow empty completely, leaving me in a strangely cool and tranquil state.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r83","rowIndex":83,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　これはもう性欲を満たすよりも良い感覚で、このまま窃視を続けていたら仏教で言う悟りの境地に達してしまうんじゃないかと心配になるほどだ。","en":"The feeling was better than satisfying my lust. I began to fear that if I persisted in my voyeurism, I might attain what Buddhism called enlightenment.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r84","rowIndex":84,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　だから、私は雨の夜には休まず他人の生活の一部を盗み見る。そこには誰かに知られたくない秘密もあるだろうし、重要な弱点もあるだろう。そうした情報を利用すれば、私は自分に利益をもたらすことが出来るのを理解していたが、それは絶対にしてはならないと自分で決めていた。","en":"So on rainy nights, without fail, I stole pieces of other people’s lives. They must have contained secrets the subjects wanted no one to know, and weaknesses of great importance. I understood that exploiting this information could bring me profit, but I had made an absolute rule against doing so.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r85","rowIndex":85,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ただ観察するだけで、そこで見たものは誰にもけして話さないし、観察対象とは接触しない。それがもっとも純粋でいいやり方だ。","en":"I would only observe. I would never tell anyone what I had seen, and I would not make contact with the subject of my observation. That was the purest and best method.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r86","rowIndex":86,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は、私の存在になど全く気づかない他人の大事な生活を見る。それは性欲だけを満たすわけではない。自分を意識しない相手の動きを見るということは、それだけでもう相手と充分な繋がりを得ることができるのだ。","en":"I watched the private life of another person who remained wholly unaware that I existed. It did more than satisfy lust. Simply watching the movements of someone who had no awareness of me felt, in itself, like connection enough.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r87","rowIndex":87,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして、見たことに最後まで気づかれず、私が完全に黙っていれば、誰も何も失わない。誰も何も失わないのに、私の心はしっかりと充足感を得ているのだから、これはもう幸福というものを無からクリエイトしていると言っていいんじゃないだろうか？","en":"And if I was never discovered and kept perfectly silent until the end, no one lost anything. No one lost a thing, while my heart found genuine fulfillment. Surely one could say that I had created happiness out of nothing?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r88","rowIndex":88,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　もし、見たものを前提に相手を脅すなどしてしまえばそれはただの暴力でしょう？　私は暴力は嫌いだし、そんな風に誰かを貶めて手に入れる充足感というのも不純な気がする。だから、なるべく対象には接触しない、ばれそうになったら絶対に逃げるというようなつもりでいたんだけど……しかし人間というのは、力をもつと最終的に暴力に流されてしまうものだ。","en":"If I threatened someone on the basis of what I had seen, that would simply be violence, wouldn’t it? I hated violence, and any satisfaction acquired by degrading another person that way seemed impure. I therefore meant to avoid contact with my subjects whenever possible and flee without fail if they looked likely to discover me... But human beings, once given power, ultimately drift toward violence.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r89","rowIndex":89,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私にも、ついにそのルールを破ってしまう時が来た。","en":"At last, the day came when I too broke my rule.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r90","rowIndex":90,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=9>Y地区</tips>には大きなビルは少ないが、そのうちの一つに<tips=41>グランドタワー</tips>という建物がある。","en":"<tips=9>Y District</tips> had few large buildings. One of them was a structure called <tips=41>Grand Tower</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r91","rowIndex":91,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　なんでも<tips=9>Y地区</tips>で最も強いギャングが根城にして、部下と一緒に住んでいるとかで、私もその評判を聞いて普段は近寄らないようにしていた。いくら飛行能力があるとは言え、相手に先に捕捉され、狙撃でもされてしまえばひとたまりもないからだ。","en":"According to rumor, the most powerful gangster in <tips=9>Y District</tips> used it as his base and lived there with his subordinates. After hearing his reputation, even I ordinarily kept my distance. Flight or no flight, if they spotted me first and took a shot at me, I would not stand a chance.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r92","rowIndex":92,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その日も、<tips=42>サイキック探知機</tips>の効力が及ばない高さまで飛んでふらふらと飛び回っていたのだけれども、面白そうなものがなにも見つからず、退屈だった。だから魔が差した。","en":"That night too, I had risen beyond the reach of <tips=42>psychic detectors</tips> and drifted aimlessly about. But I could find nothing interesting and had grown bored. Temptation seized me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r93","rowIndex":93,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ギャングの本拠地って普段どんな生活をしているのかしら？　と、ふと芽生えた余計な好奇心に勝つことができなかったのである。","en":"How did people live inside a gang headquarters? A seed of unnecessary curiosity sprouted within me, and I could not resist it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r94","rowIndex":94,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　といっても私は臆病なので、出来うる限り慎重なやりかたでの観察である。","en":"Coward that I was, however, I observed as cautiously as I possibly could.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r95","rowIndex":95,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ビルの最上階よりも少し高い場所から、見下ろすようなポジションを取った。空は黒く曇っていたし、そうすれば暗灰色でかためた全身の服がカモフラージュの役割を果たす。","en":"I positioned myself a little above the top floor of the building and looked down. Against a sky black with clouds, the dark-gray clothing I wore from head to toe would camouflage me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r96","rowIndex":96,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その上で充分な距離をとり、双眼鏡の焦点距離を最も遠くにして、ビルの窓の一つ一つを観察したのだ。","en":"Then, keeping a generous distance and setting my binoculars to their most distant focus, I examined each of the building’s windows in turn.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r97","rowIndex":97,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　もう日が暮れている。","en":"The sun had already set.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r98","rowIndex":98,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　昼は日光を反射して鏡みたいに見える窓も、内側の方が明るくなれば中を見通すのは容易い。","en":"Windows that reflected the daylight like mirrors became easy to see through once the room within was brighter than the world outside.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r99","rowIndex":99,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ビルの正面は全面ガラス張りでオフィスビルのようになっているが、左右や裏には小さな窓が並んでいて、それらの多くはカーテンやらブラインドやらが掛かって内部が見えなくなっていたり、真っ暗で使っていなそうな感じだったのだけれども、灯りが点ってカーテンも開き、無防備に内部を見通せる部屋もいくつかある。","en":"The front of the building was entirely glass, like an office building, but rows of small windows lined the sides and rear. Most had curtains or blinds that hid their interiors, or else were dark and apparently unused. But a handful of lighted rooms had their curtains open, leaving the interiors exposed and plainly visible.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r100","rowIndex":100,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　サイキックの能力というのは体力を使うものだけど、私の場合は速度に応じて疲労度が等比級数的に増えていくけれども、浮いているだけならばほとんど疲れない。","en":"Psychic abilities consumed physical energy. In my case, fatigue rose geometrically with speed, but simply floating in place required almost no effort.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r101","rowIndex":101,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は空中にふわふわと浮かびながら、双眼鏡をのぞき込んでそうした部屋の一つ一つを覗くのである。","en":"I hovered softly in the air, peering through the binoculars into each of the exposed rooms.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r102","rowIndex":102,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　窓が開いているのは、大体ビルの中層辺りだった。窓越しにリビングなどが見えるのだけれど、当たり前と言えば当たり前なのかもしれないが、ギャングといっても部屋の中は普通の家庭とさほどかわらない。","en":"Most of the uncovered windows were around the middle floors. I could see living rooms through the glass, but obvious as the point might have been, their interiors differed little from ordinary homes despite belonging to gangsters.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r103","rowIndex":103,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私のイメージは貧困であるから、鹿の頭の剥製とか、熊の頭がついた毛皮の絨毯とか、神棚に日本刀とか、そういうのを期待していたのだけれども、そんなものは見つからなかった。どこにでもあるマンションみたいな白い壁紙の部屋に、システムキッチンがあったり、量販店の家具屋で買ったようなありふれた家具が並び、エプロンをした女の人が料理を作ったり、ジャージやスウェットを着た人たちが集まって麻雀をしたりしている。","en":"My imagination was impoverished, so I had expected mounted deer heads, bearskin rugs with the heads still attached, or a Japanese sword on the household shrine. Nothing of the kind appeared. The rooms had the plain white wallpaper of any apartment, fitted kitchens, and commonplace furniture that looked as if it had come from a mass-market store. Women in aprons cooked, while people in tracksuits and sweats gathered to play mahjong.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r104","rowIndex":104,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　いやらしいことをしている場面も見つからないし、薬を打ったり銃の手入れをして居る場面も見られない。なんて健全なのだろう！　それとも、そういうことをする人たちはさすがにカーテンを閉めているのかな。","en":"I found no one engaged in anything indecent, shooting drugs, or cleaning a gun. How wholesome! Or perhaps the people doing those things had, sensibly enough, closed the curtains.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r105","rowIndex":105,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　よく分からないけれども、思ったより面白くない。","en":"I could not tell. In any case, it was less interesting than expected.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r106","rowIndex":106,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その辺の階の住人は下っ端だから平凡な生活をしているのかな？　上の方には幹部などが住んでいるのかもしれない。","en":"Perhaps the residents on those floors were rank-and-file and led ordinary lives. The officers might live higher up.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r107","rowIndex":107,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しかし、さすがに上の階に住む幹部たちは用心深いのか、灯りがついている部屋はあれども、カーテンを開けっ放しにしている部屋はない。","en":"The officers on the upper floors did appear more cautious. Some rooms had their lights on, but not one had left its curtains open.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r108","rowIndex":108,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　思ったより刺激が、胸のときめきがない。――もうちょっと、近づいてみようかな？","en":"Less stimulation than I had expected, less of a flutter in my chest. —Maybe I could go a little closer?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r109","rowIndex":109,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　この暗い夜でカーテンが閉まっているということは、向こうからこちらも見えないはずだ。上の方から近づけば、誰にも気づかれないかもしれない。","en":"If the curtains were closed on a night this dark, no one inside should be able to see out, either. If I approached from above, I might escape everyone’s notice.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r110","rowIndex":110,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ここまで来ると、もう窃視に対する欲望よりも、誰も近づけないギャングの本拠地に接近してみたいという変な欲求の方が強かった。","en":"By that point, the bizarre desire to approach a gang headquarters no one else could get near had become stronger than any appetite for voyeurism.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r111","rowIndex":111,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　辺りを警戒しながら近づく。","en":"I advanced, keeping a wary eye on my surroundings.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r112","rowIndex":112,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　地上には高い塀があって、外部の人間を寄せ付けないようになっているが、私には全くの無力だ。","en":"A high wall on the ground kept outsiders at bay, but it was utterly powerless against me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r113","rowIndex":113,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ふわふわと上空を通り抜けると、塀の内側の光景なども見られるが、特にめぼしいものもなく、関係者以外見られないものを見ているという喜び以外のものはない。","en":"Drifting above it let me see the grounds within, but I found nothing of note and felt no pleasure beyond the illicit thrill of seeing what outsiders were never meant to see.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r114","rowIndex":114,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　さて、そうしてビルの窓ガラスに触れるほど近づいた。","en":"And so I drew near enough to touch the building’s windows.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r115","rowIndex":115,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　一つ一つ窓をチェックして、カーテンやブラインドの隙間を探しながらゆっくりと飛ぶ。","en":"I flew slowly along, checking each one and hunting for gaps in the curtains and blinds.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r116","rowIndex":116,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　まず、灯りのついていない部屋を点検する。それらは、何の面白みもない白いカーテンやブラインドが使われており、隙間を覗いても、何もない空き部屋か、棚が並ぶ倉庫みたいな部屋、椅子と机が並べられた企業の会議室みたいな部屋だったりする。","en":"First I inspected the dark rooms. Their wholly uninteresting white curtains and blinds concealed either empty rooms with nothing in them, storage spaces lined with shelves, or corporate-looking conference rooms furnished with rows of chairs and tables.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r117","rowIndex":117,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　やはり灯りがついている部屋を調べるしかないようだ。さすがに緊張するけれども、まさか、この高さにある部屋の窓から人が覗いているとは思わないはずだ。","en":"It seemed I would have to examine the lighted rooms after all. That certainly made me nervous, but no one would imagine a person peering through a window at this height.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r118","rowIndex":118,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そんな風に、心臓をバクバクさせながら灯りのついた窓を巡っても、しかし期待したような面白さはない。","en":"Yet even as I made the rounds of the lighted windows with my heart pounding, I found none of the excitement I had expected.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r119","rowIndex":119,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ギャングのアジトだからといって、普段から銃を撃ち合ったりしているわけでもなく、おじさんたちがうろうろしているだけだ。<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>の幹部の顔とか知っていたら少しは楽しめるのか。","en":"Being a gang hideout did not mean people were always shooting at one another; there were only middle-aged men wandering around. Maybe I would enjoy it a little more if I knew what the <tips=7>YS</tips> officers looked like.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r120","rowIndex":120,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　さて、最初の興奮もさめ、飽き始めてきたころ、私はその窓を見つけた。およそ場違いな、ピンク色の地に花のついた可愛らしいカーテン。","en":"Just as my initial excitement had faded and boredom begun to set in, I found that window. A darling little curtain, utterly out of place, pink and patterned with flowers.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r121","rowIndex":121,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　こんなビルに女の子の部屋でもあるのかな、と、迂闊に窓の目の前に浮かんでしまうと、急にカーテンが開いた。","en":"As I carelessly floated right up to the window, wondering whether a building like this might have girls’ rooms in it, the curtains suddenly opened.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r122","rowIndex":122,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「うわっ！」","en":"“Whoa!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r123","rowIndex":123,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　びっくりして、反射的にぴゅんと後ろに逃げてしまう。","en":"I started and instinctively zipped backward.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r124","rowIndex":124,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　けれども、もっと驚いたのは、カーテンが開いたことよりも、その向こうに姿を現した人物だった。","en":"What astonished me more than the curtains opening, though, was the person who appeared behind them.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r125","rowIndex":125,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　女の子がそこに立ち、驚いた顔でこちらを見ているのである。","en":"A girl stood there, staring at me in surprise.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r126","rowIndex":126,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　年は私と同じくらいだろうか？　私と同じくらいの身長だけれど、私よりすらっとしていて、私より足が細くて、私より色が白くて、そして私より遥かに美人だった。","en":"Was she about my age? She was about my height, but more slender; her legs were slimmer than mine, her skin fairer, and she was incomparably more beautiful.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r127","rowIndex":127,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　観察対象に近づかない、お互いに絶対に干渉してはならないという私のポリシーからすれば、ここで飛び去るべきだった。でも私はそれが出来なかった。","en":"By my policy—never approach the subject of my observation, never under any circumstances allow either side to interfere with the other—I should have flown away then. But I could not.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r128","rowIndex":128,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「うわあ、きれい……」","en":"“Oh, wow. You’re beautiful...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r129","rowIndex":129,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　うっとりして近づいてしまうと、相手は何か口を動かして言っている。","en":"As I drifted toward her in a daze, she moved her lips and seemed to say something.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r130","rowIndex":130,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ガラスは分厚いらしく、私のグレーのレインコートを叩く雨音と相まって、彼女の声を通さない。窓ははめ殺しになっていて開かない。","en":"The glass was evidently thick, and with the rain beating against my gray raincoat, I could not hear her voice through it. The window was fixed and could not be opened.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r131","rowIndex":131,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なに？　聞こえない！」","en":"“What? I can’t hear you!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r132","rowIndex":132,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私はフードをとって耳に手を当て、首を横に振り、全力で聞こえないというジェスチャーを行う。","en":"I pulled down my hood, cupped a hand to my ear, shook my head, and gave the most emphatic I-can’t-hear-you pantomime of which I was capable.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r133","rowIndex":133,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　すると意図が伝わったらしく、ガラスの向こうで彼女は右手の方を指さした。そちらを見ると、ベランダがある。","en":"She seemed to understand. From behind the glass, she pointed to her right. I looked that way and saw a balcony.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r134","rowIndex":134,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は頷いた。すると彼女も頷きを返した。","en":"I nodded. She nodded back.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r135","rowIndex":135,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ベランダは割と広く、一脚の机と、二脚の椅子が設えられ、隅には柄のついた器に観葉植物が飾られている。晴れた昼下がりに紅茶でも飲んだら似合いそうな空間で、多分さっきの女の子もそうしているんだろう。","en":"The balcony was fairly spacious, furnished with a table and two chairs. In one corner, a leafy plant stood in a decorated pot. It was the sort of space that would suit afternoon tea on a clear day, and the girl had probably used it for precisely that.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r136","rowIndex":136,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　部屋とは大きなガラスがはめ込まれたドアで仕切られており、その向こうにはさっき窓から覗いた部屋が見えた。けれど、少女の姿がない。","en":"A door inset with a great pane of glass separated it from the room I had seen through the window. But the girl was no longer there.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r137","rowIndex":137,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　どこへ行ったんだろう？","en":"Where had she gone?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r138","rowIndex":138,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　風はさほどなく、雨は奥の方まで吹き込んでいなかった。私は乾いたところを濡らすのをきらい、ベランダに腰掛けた。後から考えると不用心だったと思う。こんな建物の住人と接触しようだなんて、無思慮にもほどがある。","en":"There was little wind, and the rain had not reached the inner part of the balcony. Hating to wet a dry area, I sat down on the balcony. In hindsight, I had been terribly careless. Attempting contact with a resident of that building was thoughtless beyond belief.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r139","rowIndex":139,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そもそも私は観察対象と接しないというポリシーがあったはずだ。しかし、もうこの時点で、私のアタマからポリシーは消え去っていた。まあ、私が自分に要求するルールなんか、いつもこのようにして簡単に破られてしまうのだけど。","en":"I was, after all, supposed to have a policy against contact with the people I observed. By then, however, the policy had already vanished from my head. Well, every rule I imposed on myself was always broken just this easily.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r140","rowIndex":140,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その時の私は女の子のことばかりで頭がいっぱいになっていて、他のことなどすっかり抜け落ちていた。","en":"My mind was filled entirely with the girl, to the exclusion of everything else.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r141","rowIndex":141,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　すると、すぐに女の子が駆け足でやって来て、ガラス戸を開く。","en":"A moment later, she came running back and opened the glass door.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r142","rowIndex":142,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女はショールのようなものを羽織っていて、それを取りに一旦奥へ引っ込んでいたのかもしれない。","en":"She now had something like a shawl around her shoulders. Perhaps she had gone deeper into the room to fetch it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r143","rowIndex":143,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あなた……！」","en":"“You...!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r144","rowIndex":144,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　女の子はくっきりとした二重まぶたの目を驚きに見開いて、私に呼びかける。","en":"She called out to me, her eyes—their double lids sharply defined—wide with astonishment.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r145","rowIndex":145,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「空を飛べるの？」","en":"“You can fly?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r146","rowIndex":146,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうだよ」","en":"“That’s right.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r147","rowIndex":147,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　女の子は美しすぎてコンプレックスを感じてしまう。私はフードで自分の顔を隠しながらそう答えた。","en":"She was so beautiful that merely looking at her gave me an inferiority complex. I answered while hiding my face beneath my hood.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r148","rowIndex":148,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　夢中になって飛びついてしまったけれど、ろくに髪の毛もとかしていないし、化粧もしていないし、なんなら風呂に入って身体を洗ったのはいつだったろうか？　こんな状態でかわいい子の前に出るのはあまりにも恥ずかしい。","en":"I had thrown myself into the encounter without thinking. I had barely combed my hair, I wore no makeup, and when had I last taken a bath and washed my body? Appearing before a pretty girl in this state was mortifying.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r149","rowIndex":149,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「雨の日はよくここらへんを飛んでる」","en":"“I fly around here a lot when it rains.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r150","rowIndex":150,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　どうしようどうしようどうしよう！","en":"What do I do what do I do what do I do!","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r151","rowIndex":151,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　内心はどぎまぎしていて心臓はバクバクしていたけれど、声も態度も自分でもびっくりするくらい落ち着いている。","en":"Inside, I was in a panic and my heart was pounding. My voice and manner, however, remained so composed that even I found it astonishing.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r152","rowIndex":152,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=16>タイプA</tips>なの？」","en":"“Are you a <tips=16>Type A</tips>?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r153","rowIndex":153,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「うん」","en":"“Yes.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r154","rowIndex":154,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「空を飛べるなんて、いいなあ……」","en":"“It must be so wonderful to fly...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r155","rowIndex":155,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女は目を輝かせている。","en":"Her eyes shone.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r156","rowIndex":156,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　あきらかに不審人物な私に対して、警戒心というものがないのだろうか？","en":"Did she feel no wariness whatsoever toward someone as obviously suspicious as me?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r157","rowIndex":157,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「私も空が飛べれば良かったのに」","en":"“I wish I could fly too.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r158","rowIndex":158,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そう言って、溜息をつく。","en":"She sighed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r159","rowIndex":159,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ねえ、そんな端っこにいるから、雨がかかってるよ？　もっとなかにおいでよ？」","en":"“You’re so close to the edge that the rain’s hitting you. Why don’t you come farther in?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r160","rowIndex":160,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いいんだ、ここで」","en":"“I’m fine here.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r161","rowIndex":161,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「でも、風邪ひいちゃうよ？」","en":"“But you’ll catch a cold.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r162","rowIndex":162,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「大丈夫、私、能力の副産物なのか、なんなのか自分でもわからないんだけど、寒さに異常に強いんだ。雨の中、服を湿らせて空を飛んでても、冷え込まないで全然平気。やったことないけど、多分真冬に氷水に飛び込んでも普通に泳げる。雪のなかで眠っても死なないんじゃないかと思う」","en":"“It’s fine. I don’t know whether it’s some by-product of my ability or what, but I’m abnormally resistant to cold. I can fly through the rain with my clothes soaked and never feel cold at all. I’ve never tried it, but I could probably dive into ice water in the dead of winter and swim just fine. I don’t think even sleeping in the snow would kill me.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r163","rowIndex":163,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「すごーい」","en":"“Amazing!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r164","rowIndex":164,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女は素直に感情を顔に出してそう言うと、","en":"She said it with her delight plain on her face. Then—","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r165","rowIndex":165,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「でも、あなたが良くても、雨に打たれてるってかわいそうだから、もっとこっちに来て」","en":"“But even if it doesn’t bother you, I feel bad watching you get rained on. Come farther in.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r166","rowIndex":166,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　有無を言わせぬ調子だった。","en":"Her tone allowed no argument.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r167","rowIndex":167,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「仕方ないな」","en":"“If you insist.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r168","rowIndex":168,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　近づくと、彼女の身体のいいにおいさえかげそうで、もう内心とても平静じゃいられない。可愛いその肉体がこんなに近づいてしまうなんて！　きめ細かい肌の艶さえはっきりと見える！","en":"Once I drew nearer, I could almost catch her sweet scent, and inwardly I could no longer begin to keep calm. That adorable body, this close to me! I could even see the smooth sheen of her skin!","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r169","rowIndex":169,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それにしても、なんて豊かな睫毛をもっているんだろう？　つけまつげをして増やしたり、変にカールさせたりする必要なんかないくらい、ちょうどいい長さと密度だ。瞬きするたびに目の間から音符が転がり出てきそうだ。","en":"And what extraordinary eyelashes she had. They possessed exactly the right length and fullness, with no need for false lashes or unnatural curling. Every blink seemed ready to send musical notes tumbling from between her eyes.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r170","rowIndex":170,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あなたはここに住んでるの？」","en":"“Do you live here?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r171","rowIndex":171,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　訊ねると、彼女はうんと頷き、","en":"When I asked, she gave a firm nod.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r172","rowIndex":172,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「もう何年くらいになるのかな……。お母さんと街に住んでたんだけど、お母さんが亡くなってから、ずっとここに暮らしてる。ほとんど外に出してもらえない」","en":"“I wonder how many years it’s been... I used to live in the city with my mother, but I’ve lived here ever since she died. I’m hardly ever allowed outside.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r173","rowIndex":173,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　表情を曇らせる。","en":"Her expression clouded.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r174","rowIndex":174,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　どうも、悪いことを聞いちゃったんだろか？","en":"Had I asked something I shouldn’t have?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r175","rowIndex":175,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　黙っていると、彼女は言葉を続ける。","en":"When I said nothing, she continued.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r176","rowIndex":176,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「私<tips=17>タイプB</tips>なの。お母さんも<tips=17>タイプB</tips>だった。お父さんは私たち家族のことは愛しているけど、<tips=17>タイプB</tips>は苦手なんだと思う。だから、お母さんと私を家から離したところで暮らさせて、今は私をほとんど部屋から出さないでいるような気がする。私のところにもあまり会いに来ない。私のためだ、お母さんのためだってずっと言ってるけど……身内が<tips=17>タイプB</tips>だってことを、直視したくないんだよ。哀しいし、仕方がないことだけど」","en":"“I’m a <tips=17>Type B</tips>. My mother was a <tips=17>Type B</tips> too. Father loves us, but I think <tips=17>Type Bs</tips> make him uncomfortable. That’s why he had Mother and me live away from the family home—and I feel as if that’s why he hardly ever lets me out of this room now. He rarely comes to see me himself. He always says it’s for my sake, and it was for Mother’s... But he doesn’t want to face the fact that someone in his family is a <tips=17>Type B</tips>. It’s sad, but I suppose it can’t be helped.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r177","rowIndex":177,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　こんな突然の来訪者に急に打ち明け話をするなんて、よほど話し相手がいないんだろうか？　それとも警戒心がないのか？","en":"Why had she suddenly confided all that in such an unexpected visitor? Was she so starved for someone to talk to? Or did she simply have no sense of caution?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r178","rowIndex":178,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私はちょっと戸惑いながら、","en":"A little bewildered, I asked—","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r179","rowIndex":179,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いいの？　こんな、空からやって来た不審者にそんなことを話して」","en":"“Are you sure you should tell all that to a suspicious stranger who just dropped out of the sky?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r180","rowIndex":180,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　すると彼女は頷いて、笑顔を作る。","en":"She nodded and smiled.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r181","rowIndex":181,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「顔見たらわかるもの。あなたはきっといい人だから、大丈夫」","en":"“I can tell from your face. I’m sure you’re a good person, so it’s all right.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r182","rowIndex":182,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その言葉と表情で私はすっかりやられてしまった。","en":"That answer, paired with that expression, did me in completely.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r183","rowIndex":183,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　世間知らずというのか、純粋培養というのか、ちょっと痴呆みたいな感じがするけど、その汚れのなさがまた可愛い。汚れに塗れた私の目には笑顔がまぶしいくらいだ。","en":"Call it ignorance of the world or a hothouse upbringing—she seemed almost half-witted, but that very lack of corruption made her lovelier still. To my eyes, steeped in filth, her smile was dazzling.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r184","rowIndex":184,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私のことをいい人だなんて、外に出したらあっというまに悪い奴に騙されて散々暴行された上にどっかに売り飛ばされそうなくらい無防備だけど、そういう危ういところもまたたまらない。","en":"If she could call me a good person, she was so defenseless that the moment she was let out into the world, some villain would surely deceive her, subject her to every manner of abuse, and sell her off somewhere. Even that dangerous vulnerability was irresistible.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r185","rowIndex":185,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「この噂のビルにどんな人が住んでるんだか気になってきたんだけど、あなたみたいな子がいるなんて想像もしてなかったよ」","en":"“I was starting to wonder what sort of people lived in this building I’d heard so much about, but I never imagined I’d find a girl like you.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r186","rowIndex":186,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そう？」","en":"“Really?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r187","rowIndex":187,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「うん、<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>ってギャングの本拠地なんでしょ。怖い人ばかりいるんだと思ってた」","en":"“Yeah. It’s the headquarters of a gang called <tips=7>YS</tips>, isn’t it? I thought everyone here would be frightening.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r188","rowIndex":188,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そんなことないよ。下の方には<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>に入ってない人も一杯住んでるし、この階とかに住んでる人も、小さい子とか女の人も多いし」","en":"“That’s not true. Lots of people on the lower floors aren’t even in <tips=7>YS</tips>. And on floors like this one, there are plenty of little children and women.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r189","rowIndex":189,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうなんだ」","en":"“I see.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r190","rowIndex":190,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「でも、なんで今日が大丈夫な日ってわかったの？」","en":"“But how did you know today was safe?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r191","rowIndex":191,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「大丈夫って？」","en":"“Safe?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r192","rowIndex":192,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「だって、今日はお父さんたちが出かけてて、見張ってる人がいないのわかってたんでしょ？」","en":"“Father and the others are out today, so no one is watching. You knew that, didn’t you?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r193","rowIndex":193,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「え、どういうこと？」","en":"“What do you mean?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r194","rowIndex":194,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「知らなかったの？」","en":"“You didn’t know?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r195","rowIndex":195,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女は目を丸くする。","en":"Her eyes widened.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r196","rowIndex":196,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「う、うん……ただちょっとふらっと好奇心が出て……」","en":"“N-no... I just happened to wander over when curiosity got the better of me...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r197","rowIndex":197,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「じゃあ、すごくラッキーだったんだね」","en":"“Then you were incredibly lucky.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r198","rowIndex":198,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女の説明によると、彼女の父親は<tips=16>タイプA</tips>で、透視能力を持っているのだと言う。そして父親のボディーガードも<tips=16>タイプA</tips>で、これはレーダーのように周囲の生命を感知することが出来るのだそうだ。つまり、ボディーガードが不審者を発見し、父親がどこに隠れていてもその正体を見極める。これによって、近づく侵入者はほぼ完全に把握されてしまうのだという。","en":"According to her, her father was a <tips=16>Type A</tips> with clairvoyant powers. His bodyguard was also a <tips=16>Type A</tips>, supposedly able to detect living things in the surrounding area like radar. In other words, the bodyguard would detect a suspicious person, and her father would identify them no matter where they hid. Together, they could obtain an almost complete picture of any intruder who approached.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r199","rowIndex":199,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それは……」","en":"“That...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r200","rowIndex":200,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は絶句してしまう。","en":"Words failed me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r201","rowIndex":201,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　もしそんな能力者がいて、ギャングに空から近づくのを察知されていたとしたらと考えると背筋が冷たくなる。","en":"A chill ran up my spine at the thought that someone with an ability like that might have detected me approaching the gang from the air.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r202","rowIndex":202,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=42>サイキック探知機</tips>には多少の警戒はしていたけれども、そんな<tips=16>タイプA</tips>能力者がいるとは想像していなかった。そんなのが居るときにうっかり空からふわふわ近づいていたら、銃で撃ち落とされてもおかしくないし、そうなったら私の死体はこの<tips=9>Y地区</tips>のカオスの狭間にひっそり飲み込まれてゆくだけだったろう。お母さんとお父さんは娘が帰ってこないからと、おかしくなってしまうかもしれない。","en":"I had been somewhat wary of <tips=42>psychic detectors</tips>, but had never imagined <tips=16>Type As</tips> like those. If I had carelessly floated toward the place through the air while they were around, they might well have shot me down. My corpse would simply have vanished in silence into the folds of <tips=9>Y District’s</tips> chaos. My mother and father might have lost their minds when their daughter failed to come home.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r203","rowIndex":203,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「でも、それってすごい偶然だよね！」","en":"“But that’s an incredible coincidence!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r204","rowIndex":204,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女はまた笑顔になって言う。","en":"She smiled again.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r205","rowIndex":205,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「たまたま見張りが居ない時にビルの近くに来て、たまたま私の部屋の前に来たところで私がカーテンを開けたってことでしょ？　こんな偶然ってあると思う？」","en":"“You happened to come close to the building while no guards were here, and just as you happened to reach my room, I opened the curtains. Do you think a coincidence like that can really happen?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r206","rowIndex":206,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まあ、あるんじゃないかな……」","en":"“Well, I suppose it could...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r207","rowIndex":207,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　少なくとも、前から知っていてストーカーのように窓の側で見張っていたんではないよ。そんな変質者ではないよ。別の意味では変質者だろうけど、そこはちがうんだ。という意味を込めて私はそう言った。","en":"What I meant was: At least I wasn’t a stalker who already knew about you and waited outside your window. I am not that kind of deviant. A different kind of deviant, perhaps, but not that kind.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r208","rowIndex":208,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いいや、これ偶然じゃないよ」","en":"“No, this wasn’t a coincidence.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r209","rowIndex":209,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「え……」","en":"“What...?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r210","rowIndex":210,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「きっと、何かの運命なんだよ。私たちが会うの」","en":"“It must have been some sort of fate that brought us together.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r211","rowIndex":211,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女はきっぱりとそう言った。","en":"She said it with finality.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r212","rowIndex":212,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そう思うよね？」","en":"“Don’t you think so?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r213","rowIndex":213,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あ、うん……」","en":"“Oh, sure...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r214","rowIndex":214,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は運命とか幽霊とか奇跡とか神とか占いとかジンクスとかマーフィーの法則とかそういうものは全然信じない。全くもって非科学的だからだ。まあ、その存在が確認されたとき有名な科学者が自殺したほど非科学的である<tips=16>タイプA</tips>という人種の一人である私が言うのもなんだが。","en":"I did not believe in fate, ghosts, miracles, gods, fortune-telling, jinxes, Murphy’s law, or anything of the sort. They were entirely unscientific. Admittedly, that was a strange complaint from a <tips=16>Type A</tips> like me, when the very confirmation of our existence had driven a famous scientist to suicide.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r215","rowIndex":215,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しかし、彼女が私に好感を抱いてくれる方に運ぶのなら認めるのにやぶさかではない。私は欲望のためならいつでも主義主張と相反する行動をとれる、融通が利き過ぎるくらい利く人間である。","en":"But I had no objection to accepting fate if it would make her like me. I was an exceedingly flexible person, always capable of acting against my principles and convictions in the service of desire.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r216","rowIndex":216,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうだね。きっとこれは運命だ。私たちはきっと出会うべくして出会ったんだよ」","en":"“You’re right. This must be fate. We met because we were meant to meet.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r217","rowIndex":217,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　いけしゃあしゃあとそう言った。","en":"I said it without the slightest shame.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r218","rowIndex":218,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　すると、彼女はうんと満足げに頷き、","en":"She gave an emphatic, thoroughly satisfied nod.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r219","rowIndex":219,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「私、<tips=44>筱喬</tips>。<tips=44>シウ</tips>ってよく呼ばれる。あなたは？」","en":"“I’m <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips>. People usually call me <tips=44>Siu</tips>. And you?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r220","rowIndex":220,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=51>さくら</tips>っていうんだ。よろしく」","en":"“My name’s <tips=51>Sakura</tips>. Nice to meet you.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r221","rowIndex":221,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私が調子に乗って濡れた手を出すと、彼女は躊躇なく握る。","en":"Getting carried away, I offered her my wet hand. She took it without hesitation.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r222","rowIndex":222,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ああ、私の、普段あんなことやこんなことをしている手が、こんな可憐な美少女の手を握っている！","en":"Ah! This hand of mine—the hand I usually used to do this and that—was clasping the hand of such a delicate young beauty!","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r223","rowIndex":223,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その場で倒れたくなるけれども、見せかけ上はあくまでも冷静でいなければならない。","en":"I could have collapsed on the spot, but appearances required me to remain perfectly composed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r224","rowIndex":224,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　名残惜しく手を離すと、","en":"When at last I reluctantly released her hand—","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r225","rowIndex":225,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ねえ、そのフードをとって、顔をよく見せて」","en":"“Take off that hood and let me see your face properly.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r226","rowIndex":226,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ああ、うん、でもびしょびしょだから……」","en":"“Oh, sure, but I’m soaked...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r227","rowIndex":227,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ただでさえたいしたことがない顔を、ノーメイクで見せるというのは気が進まない。","en":"I was reluctant to display a face that was nothing special to begin with, particularly without makeup.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r228","rowIndex":228,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「さっき、窓越しのときちょっと見せてくれたじゃない。いいでしょ？　ねえ」","en":"“You showed me a little of your face through the window earlier, didn’t you? So it’s all right. Please?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r229","rowIndex":229,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しかし、こんな子にまっすぐな視線で懇願されては、従わないわけにはいかなかった。","en":"But when a girl like her looked straight at me and pleaded, how could I refuse?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r230","rowIndex":230,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「わあ、かわいい」","en":"“Wow, you’re cute.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r231","rowIndex":231,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　お世辞だろうけれど、そんなことを言ってくれる。","en":"She even said that to me, though it was probably flattery.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r232","rowIndex":232,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は照れくさくて相手の顔を直視出来ない。","en":"I was too embarrassed to look her directly in the face.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r233","rowIndex":233,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「目がきりっとしてて、なんだかりりしい顔してるんだね」","en":"“Your eyes are so sharp. There’s something gallant about your face.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r234","rowIndex":234,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そ、そういえばさ……」","en":"“S-speaking of which...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r235","rowIndex":235,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は自分の顔の話題が苦手なので、顔だけでなく話題もそらしにかかる。","en":"I did not handle conversations about my face well, so I worked to turn away both my face and the conversation.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r236","rowIndex":236,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あなたのお父さん、ボディーガードがいるとか言ってたけどさ、<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>でも偉い人なの？」","en":"“You said your father has a bodyguard. Is he important in <tips=7>YS</tips>?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r237","rowIndex":237,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうみたいだね。お父さんの仕事のことはよく知らないけど」","en":"“I suppose so. I don’t know much about Father’s work.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r238","rowIndex":238,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私のあからさまな話題転換に、彼女は屈託なくそう答えてくれる。","en":"She took my blatant change of subject in stride and answered without a care.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r239","rowIndex":239,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なんて人？」","en":"“What’s his name?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r240","rowIndex":240,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　軽い気持ちでそう訊ねたのだけれど、彼女の答えは驚くべきものだった。","en":"I asked casually, but her answer was astonishing.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r241","rowIndex":241,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>って言うんだ」","en":"“<tips=3>Chris Tse</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r242","rowIndex":242,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「えっ？」","en":"“What?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r243","rowIndex":243,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　びっくりして彼女の顔を振り返る。","en":"Startled, I turned back to look at her.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r244","rowIndex":244,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女は、自分の言葉が私のような一般人に対して、どんなふうに聞こえているのか理解していないらしく、相変わらずの笑顔を浮かべていた。","en":"She apparently had no idea how those words sounded to an ordinary person like me. The same smile remained on her face.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r245","rowIndex":245,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　こんないたいけな子が、私でも知っている最強ギャングの娘だっていうの？　じゃあ、変に手を出したら、ものすごく大変なことにならない？　でも相手は、どうも私と仲良くしたがってるみたい！","en":"This innocent little girl was the daughter of the strongest gang leader even I knew? Wouldn’t making any kind of move on her land me in a truly catastrophic mess? But she seemed to want to be my friend!","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r246","rowIndex":246,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　——実にいいじゃないか。","en":"—Excellent.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r247","rowIndex":247,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「知ってる？」","en":"“Have you heard of him?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r248","rowIndex":248,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　不安げに小首をかしげる彼女に対し、私はうんと頷き、","en":"She tipped her head anxiously. I gave an emphatic nod.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r249","rowIndex":249,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「うん、知ってる。すごい有名人だね」","en":"“Yes, I have. He’s incredibly famous.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r250","rowIndex":250,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　なんでもないような声色を作る。","en":"I made my voice perfectly casual.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r251","rowIndex":251,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そんな有名人の子で、こんなに可愛い子と友だちになれるなんて幸せ」","en":"“I’m so happy I get to be friends with someone as cute as you—and the daughter of someone so famous, at that.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r252","rowIndex":252,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「えへへ」","en":"“Hee hee.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r253","rowIndex":253,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私の言葉に彼女は照れくさそうに笑い、","en":"She laughed shyly at my words.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r254","rowIndex":254,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「私も、空を飛べる友だちが出来るなんて最高」","en":"“It’s wonderful to have a friend who can fly.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r255","rowIndex":255,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　控えめにそう言ったのだった。","en":"That was her modest way of putting it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r256","rowIndex":256,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　これが、私と<tips=44>謝筱喬</tips>の出会いである。","en":"That was how <tips=44>Siu-kiu Tse</tips> and I met.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r257","rowIndex":257,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　もう三ヶ月は前のことだ。このとき携帯電話の番号を交換し、<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>が外出して例のボディーガードがいないという連絡を受けて、私は彼女の窓へ忍び、親しくなっていった。","en":"It was more than three months ago. We exchanged phone numbers that night, and afterward, whenever I heard that <tips=3>Chris Tse</tips> had gone out and taken the bodyguard with him, I stole up to her window. In that fashion, we became close.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r258","rowIndex":258,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>の娘がどんな人間で、どんな生活をして居るのか、世間の人はほとんど知らないだろう。","en":"Virtually no one in the outside world could have known what kind of person <tips=3>Chris Tse’s</tips> daughter was, or how she lived.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r259","rowIndex":259,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女はほとんど<tips=41>グランドタワー</tips>から出ることがない。どころか、自分の住む階の他に行くこともまれだ。ビルの下の方には映画館や飲食店などが入り、それなりに楽しむ施設もあるそうなのだが、そこに降りることが出来るのは月に一度か二度だと言う。","en":"She almost never left <tips=41>Grand Tower</tips>. For that matter, it was rare for her to visit any floor but her own. The lower levels apparently contained a movie theater, restaurants, and a respectable assortment of other entertainment, but she said she was allowed down only once or twice a month.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r260","rowIndex":260,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　同じ階には他の幹部の家族などが住んでいて、そこの子供や夫人と話したり遊んだりするのが、彼女のごく少ない他人との接点なのだそうだ。夫人たちは、ボスの娘である<tips=44>筱喬</tips>に気を遣い、子供と遊んでいる時が一番癒やされると彼女は言う。","en":"The families of other officers lived on her floor. Speaking and playing with the women and children there provided some of her very few points of contact with other people. The wives were deferential toward <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> because she was the boss’s daughter, and she said she felt most at ease when playing with the children.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r261","rowIndex":261,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ましてや、ビルの外に行くことは、ほとんどありえない。","en":"Going outside the building was all but inconceivable.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r262","rowIndex":262,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=17>タイプB</tips>は精神の動揺やストレスによって発作が引き起こされる、ということで、極力刺激を遠ざけて暮らすよう父の<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>がはからっているらしい。","en":"<tips=17>Type B</tips> episodes were said to be triggered by emotional disturbance and stress, so her father, <tips=3>Chris Tse</tips>, had apparently arranged for her to live shielded from as much stimulation as possible.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r263","rowIndex":263,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「昔お母さんと街に住んでいるときは、<tips=44>シウ</tips>は外がこわくってあんまり出たいと思わなかったけど、ここに住むようになってから、妙に出たくなっちゃった。このビルのなかにも、なんでもあるんだけどね」","en":"“When I lived in the city with Mother, the outside frightened <tips=44>Siu</tips>, and I hardly ever wanted to go out. But since I started living here, I’ve developed this strange longing to leave. There’s everything you could want inside this building, too.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r264","rowIndex":264,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=44>筱喬</tips>はよくそう言って苦笑する。親しくなってから、時々彼女は自分を呼ぶときに「私」ではなく「<tips=44>シウ</tips>」と名前で呼ぶことが混じるようになって来た。本人は気づいていないようだ。信頼してくれている証拠のように思えて嬉しい。","en":"<tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> often said that with a rueful smile. After we became close, she began occasionally referring to herself as ‘<tips=44>Siu</tips>’ instead of ‘I.’ She did not seem aware of it. I was happy, taking it as proof that she trusted me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r265","rowIndex":265,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女が今言った気持ちは私もよくわかる。私だって、人から禁止されたり、駄目だと言われると何が何でもやりたくなる。その逆に、やれと言われたり、最善の方法だとしたり顔で教えられたりすると、何が何でもやりたくなくなる。","en":"I understood the feeling she described perfectly. Tell me something was forbidden or that I must not do it, and I would want to do it at any cost. Conversely, tell me to do something, or smugly explain that it was the best course available, and I would do anything not to.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r266","rowIndex":266,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　人間の心というものはそのように出来ているのだと教えてあげたが、彼女はあまり納得がいかないようだった。まだ私の域には達していないのだろう。","en":"I explained that the human heart was built that way, but she did not seem entirely convinced. Evidently, she had not yet reached my level.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r267","rowIndex":267,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それはともかく、あんまりにもしょっちゅう外の世界を見たいというので、私は、それならひとっ飛びで街まで連れてってあげようかと提案したのだ。","en":"In any case, she talked so constantly about wanting to see the outside world that I finally offered to fly her into the city.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r268","rowIndex":268,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「えっ、本当？」","en":"“What? Really?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r269","rowIndex":269,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女は大きな目を見開いて希望に輝かせるが、すぐに困ったような顔になってしまう。","en":"Her large eyes widened and shone with hope, only for her face to grow troubled a moment later.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r270","rowIndex":270,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「でも、勝手にそんなことしたらお父さんが悲しまないかな……」","en":"“But if I did that without asking, wouldn’t Father be sad?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r271","rowIndex":271,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=44>筱喬</tips>はしょっちゅう父親について愚痴をこぼすが、それでも非常に父親のことを気にかけているらしく、いつもそんな言葉が口から出て来る。","en":"<tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> often complained about her father, yet she plainly cared about him a great deal all the same. Remarks like that were always slipping out.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r272","rowIndex":272,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女の語る言葉だけで<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>という人間を想像すると、なんだか、健康や品性については口やかましいけれども、他の面ではだだ甘な、どこにでもいる平凡な娘大好きお父さんになってしまう。","en":"If I imagined <tips=3>Chris Tse</tips> from nothing but her accounts, he became an ordinary father who adored his daughter, strict about her health and morals but utterly indulgent in every other respect.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r273","rowIndex":273,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=44>筱喬</tips>とつき合うようになってから、私も<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>について調べた。そうして実際に行われたと思われる情報をもとにすると、かなり非道なこともやっている、恐ろしい人物である。この無茶苦茶な街で帝王と呼ばれているのは伊達ではない。どう考えても、彼女が言うような人物ではない。","en":"I had researched <tips=3>Chris Tse</tips> myself after becoming involved with <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips>. Judging from the information available about deeds he was believed to have actually committed, he was a terrifying man capable of considerable cruelty. They did not call him emperor of this lawless city for nothing. There was no possible way he could be the person she described.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r274","rowIndex":274,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それからもう一人、よく話題に出て来るのは街を出て一人暮らしをしている大学生の兄の話だ。","en":"The other family member who frequently entered her stories was her elder brother, a university student who had left the city and lived alone.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r275","rowIndex":275,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女の言葉だけで想像すると、どうも頭が良くてルックスも良くて服のセンスも良くて人望もあって優しく、そして妹のことを愛しているという、まるで完全無欠のような人間が出来上がってしまう。","en":"Constructed solely from her words, his image became that of a flawless human being: intelligent, handsome, well dressed, respected, kind, and devoted to his sister.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r276","rowIndex":276,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その兄のことは何の情報もないけれど、多分彼女がそう思っているだけでそのような人物ではないのだろう。","en":"I possessed no information whatsoever about the brother, but he was probably nothing like that in reality. Perhaps that was simply how she saw him.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r277","rowIndex":277,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　死んだ母親のことも、よく会話には出て来る。そして話しながらいつも涙ぐんでしまうのだ。","en":"Her dead mother often appeared in our conversations too, and Siu-kiu’s eyes invariably filled with tears as she spoke.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r278","rowIndex":278,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は、そんな風に家族のことを溺愛している<tips=44>筱喬</tips>が好きだった。","en":"I loved <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> for the way she adored her family.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r279","rowIndex":279,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「じゃあやめとく？」","en":"“Should we forget it, then?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r280","rowIndex":280,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　父への罪悪感で苦しむようなら無理にとは思わない。私は撤回しようとした。","en":"I had no wish to force her if it would leave her racked with guilt over her father. I tried to withdraw the offer.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r281","rowIndex":281,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……ねえ<tips=51>さくら</tips>だったら、どうする？」","en":"“...What would you do, <tips=51>Sakura</tips>?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r282","rowIndex":282,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「私だったら悩みもしない。だって、こっそり出かけて、何事もなくこっそり帰ってくれば、私はやりたいことが出来て満足。親も自分の言う通り部屋に閉じこもってると信じて満足。お互い満足でまるくおさまる」","en":"“I wouldn’t even agonize over it. If I slipped out in secret and came back without incident, I’d be satisfied because I’d done what I wanted. My parents would be satisfied because they’d believe I was obeying them and staying in my room. Everyone would be satisfied, and everything would work out neatly.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r283","rowIndex":283,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女は私のこの考え方には全然共感しなかったようだけれども、しかし、よくよく考えて、外界を見ることを選んだ。","en":"She did not seem to sympathize with that philosophy in the least. But after a great deal of thought, she chose to see the outside world.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r284","rowIndex":284,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「だって、じっとしてたって発症する人はするんだよ。私もいつ発症して頭がおかしくなっちゃうかわかんないもの。それまでに、一杯いろんなものを見て、いろんなことを感じて、いろんなことを考えておかないと、私、なんのために生まれてきたのかわかんない！　このまま、世の中の何もかもが嫌いなまま死んでしまうなんてあんまりだよ。……無から有は生まれないけど、有から有は作り出せるでしょ？　この世界にも素晴らしい意味があるってわかれば、私の人生にも意味があるって信じられるかもしれない」","en":"“Some people develop symptoms even if they sit perfectly still. I might develop them and lose my mind at any time. Before that happens, I have to see all sorts of things, feel all sorts of things, and think about all sorts of things—or I’ll never know what I was born for! It would be too cruel to die while I still hate everything in the world. ...You can’t create something from nothing, but you can create something new from what already exists, can’t you? If I discover that this world has some wonderful meaning, perhaps I’ll be able to believe that my life has meaning too.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r285","rowIndex":285,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　なんのために生まれてきたのか？　人生に意味はあるのか？","en":"What had she been born for? Did life have meaning?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r286","rowIndex":286,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そんなの私だって全然わからない。というか、なんの理由もないんだろう。人間はただ親がセックスした結果によってのみ生まれるのであって理由も意味もない。","en":"I had no idea either. Rather, there probably was no reason. Human beings were born solely because their parents had sex. There was neither reason nor meaning in it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r287","rowIndex":287,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　はっきり言ってそう思ってるんだけど、自分の決意に対して目をきらきらさせている<tips=44>筱喬</tips>にそう言う勇気はなかったし、もしかしたら私にはまったく存在を想像も出来ない人生の意味とやらを、彼女は見つけ出すことが出来るのかもしれない。そうだったら、それは素晴らしいことだ。","en":"That was honestly what I believed. But I lacked the courage to say it to <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> when her eyes shone with determination. And perhaps she could find this thing called the meaning of life, whose very existence I could not even imagine. If she did, it would be wonderful.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r288","rowIndex":288,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そりゃ、彼女を連れ出すのは危険だ。<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>の本拠地から、ボスの娘をさらうというのは、いくら本人の手引きがあるとしても危険この上ない。ことによっちゃ死ぬなんてこともあるが、どうせ大した価値もない命。それでも彼女に出来ることをしてやりたかった。そういう風に思える自分に驚きだ。なんだか、生きてるっぽい。いや生きてるのだろう私は。","en":"Taking her out was dangerous, of course. Abducting the boss’s daughter from <tips=7>YS</tips> headquarters was as dangerous as anything could be, even with the girl’s cooperation. It might get me killed. But my life was worth little anyway, and I wanted to do what I could for her. I was astonished to find myself capable of feeling that way. It made me seem alive. No. I suppose I am alive.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r289","rowIndex":289,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　さっそく次の機会に連れ出すことにした。","en":"I promptly decided to take her out at the next opportunity.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r290","rowIndex":290,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>は仕事の用事で<tips=9>Y地区</tips>を一週間ほど離れるという。これほど良い機会はないだろう。もちろん、途中で気が変わってUターンするなんていう可能性はないわけでもないが、そんなの歩道を歩いていたら突然車道から暴走した車が突っ込んで来てそれに直撃して死ぬくらいのものだ。そんなにアンラッキーならどうせ何をしたって死ぬだろう。","en":"<tips=3>Chris Tse</tips> was leaving <tips=9>Y District</tips> on business for about a week. There could be no better chance. Of course, it was not impossible that he might change his mind midway and turn back, but the likelihood seemed comparable to a car suddenly careening off the roadway while I walked down the sidewalk, striking and killing me. If I was that unlucky, I would die no matter what I did.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r291","rowIndex":291,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　いつものようにベランダで彼女と出会い、用意した大人用のおんぶひもを取り出して見せた。母親が赤ん坊を背中にくくりつけるアレの大人版で、本来は防災用で、ぐったりした要救護者を運ぶための道具らしい。","en":"I met her on the balcony as usual and produced an adult rescue harness I had prepared. It was an adult-sized version of the carriers mothers used to secure babies to their backs, apparently intended for disaster response and transporting people in need of rescue who could not move under their own power.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r292","rowIndex":292,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それを使って彼女を背中にくくりつけ、いざ飛ぼうとしたその時、","en":"I strapped her to my back with it. Just as I prepared to fly—","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r293","rowIndex":293,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ちょ、ちょちょっと待って！」","en":"“W-w-wait!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r294","rowIndex":294,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=44>筱喬</tips>は急にストップをかける。","en":"<tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> abruptly stopped me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r295","rowIndex":295,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なに？」","en":"“What?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r296","rowIndex":296,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なんかこれ、想像以上に恥ずかしい……」","en":"“This is much more embarrassing than I imagined...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r297","rowIndex":297,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「赤ちゃんみたいだから？」","en":"“Because you look like a baby?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r298","rowIndex":298,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　首をねじって背後の<tips=44>筱喬</tips>に尋ねると、すぐ至近距離に頬を赤らめて頷く顔が視界の端に入った。","en":"When I twisted my neck to ask <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> behind me, her blushing, nodding face appeared at the edge of my vision, only inches away.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r299","rowIndex":299,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　あまりにも顔が近いので、私はどぎまぎしてしまう。","en":"The closeness of her face flustered me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r300","rowIndex":300,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ああ、そうか、今私はこの美少女と密着しているのだ。とめどなくあふれる体液を吸い取るために、上着の下に分厚い衣服を着込んでしまったのを後悔した。正直いってこれほど後悔したことはかつてない。これがなければ、彼女の胸の柔らかみなどを背中に感じることが出来たというのに。そして青春のときめき以上の何かを感じることが出来たというのに。","en":"Oh. Of course. At that moment, this beautiful girl was pressed against me. I bitterly regretted the thick clothing I had put on beneath my jacket to absorb the endless flow of fluid. Frankly, I had never regretted anything so much in all my life. Without it, I could have felt the softness of her breasts against my back. I could have felt something beyond the tender stirrings of youth.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r301","rowIndex":301,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　でも、それは出来ない。この気持ちの悪い粘液のことは、彼女に知られたくない。絶対に知られたくない。","en":"But that was impossible. I did not want her to learn about this revolting slime. Absolutely not.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r302","rowIndex":302,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女の前ではクールな態度を気取っている私は、そんな本音をおくびにも出さずに、","en":"Playing it cool in front of her, I gave no sign of what I was really thinking.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r303","rowIndex":303,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「気にしない、気にしない」","en":"“Don’t worry about it, don’t worry about it.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r304","rowIndex":304,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　一方的に言うと、ベランダから飛び出した。","en":"Having settled the matter for both of us, I launched myself from the balcony.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r305","rowIndex":305,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「こわい？」","en":"“Are you scared?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r306","rowIndex":306,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「こわくない。とっても気持ちいい」","en":"“No. It feels wonderful.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r307","rowIndex":307,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　降りる地点を探してゆっくり飛びながら、背中の<tips=44>筱喬</tips>と話すと、首筋に彼女の温かい吐息がかかって幸せな気分だ。","en":"We talked as I flew slowly in search of a place to land. <tips=44>Siu-kiu’s</tips> warm breath brushed the nape of my neck, filling me with happiness.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r308","rowIndex":308,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=51>さくら</tips>はいつもこんな気分なんだね。うらやましいな。こんな能力があるなんて、とっても恵まれてるよ」","en":"“This is how you feel all the time. I envy you, <tips=51>Sakura</tips>. You’re so fortunate to have a power like this.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r309","rowIndex":309,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それは確かにそうかもしれない。","en":"She might have been right.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r310","rowIndex":310,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　いろいろなことが嫌いな私だけれども、この力で空を飛び回ることは、正直好きだ。","en":"I hated many things, but I honestly loved using this power to fly through the air.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r311","rowIndex":311,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　何故私のような性格の人間に、こんなあまりにも自由な翼が授かっているのか、どうにも似つかわしくないような気がして、考え込みたくなってしまうくらいだ。","en":"It was enough to make me brood over why someone like me had been granted such impossibly free wings, and how completely they failed to suit me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r312","rowIndex":312,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「降りたら何をしたい？」","en":"“What do you want to do once we land?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r313","rowIndex":313,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　何か食べ物屋に行きたいとか、洋服を見たいとか、そういった返答を予想していたのだが答えは違った。","en":"I expected an answer like visiting a restaurant or looking at clothes. Her reply was something else.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r314","rowIndex":314,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「何をしたいって言うか……どこか、ミュータントの人がたくさんいるところを知らない？」","en":"“It’s not exactly something I want to do... Do you know anywhere with lots of mutants?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r315","rowIndex":315,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「たくさんって……<tips=9>Y地区</tips>全体が他の地域に比べて明らかに圧倒的に多いけど」","en":"“Lots? I mean... <tips=9>Y District</tips> as a whole has an overwhelmingly larger mutant population than other areas...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r316","rowIndex":316,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そのなかでも多いところってない？」","en":"“Is there anywhere with especially many?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r317","rowIndex":317,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……私はあんまり詳しくないからなあ。でも、<tips=57>滑走路通り</tips>を歩いているだけでも、<tips=16>タイプA</tips>やBの人とか、よく見かけるよ」","en":"“...I don’t know that much about it. But even just walking down <tips=57>Runway Street</tips>, you often see <tips=16>Type As</tips> and Type Bs.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r318","rowIndex":318,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「じゃあ、ぷらっとお散歩したいな。……それでもいい？　<tips=51>さくら</tips>はどこか遊びに行きたい？」","en":"“Then I’d like to take a little walk. ...Is that all right? Is there somewhere you want to go for fun, <tips=51>Sakura</tips>?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r319","rowIndex":319,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「私は<tips=44>シウ</tips>の行きたいところならどこでもいいよ」","en":"“Wherever you want to go is fine with me, <tips=44>Siu</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r320","rowIndex":320,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ありがとう」","en":"“Thank you.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r321","rowIndex":321,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=44>筱喬</tips>は上機嫌だ。","en":"<tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> was in high spirits.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r322","rowIndex":322,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女がミュータントとしての自分にこだわりがあるのは知っている。だけど、こんな時くらいは同年代の普通の若者らしいことをした方がいいんじゃないかと、それをしたかったんじゃないかと、私は思っていたのである。彼女はどうも、<tips=17>タイプB</tips>のことばっかり考えているせいか、最近疲れが見える。","en":"I knew how deeply she was preoccupied with being a mutant. But I had thought that, at a moment like this, she ought to do something ordinary for a person her age—perhaps that was what she wanted too. Lately, perhaps because she thought of nothing but being a <tips=17>Type B</tips>, she had begun to look tired.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r323","rowIndex":323,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ねえ<tips=51>さくら</tips>」","en":"“<tips=51>Sakura</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r324","rowIndex":324,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=44>筱喬</tips>は黙っている私の耳元に独り言のように囁きかける。","en":"<tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> whispered into my ear as I remained silent, as though talking to herself.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r325","rowIndex":325,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あなたは、死ぬまでに絶対にしたいこととかある？」","en":"“Is there something you absolutely want to do before you die?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r326","rowIndex":326,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「急に何を……」","en":"“Where did that come from...?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r327","rowIndex":327,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「生まれたからにはこれをしないと死ねないもの、でもいいよ。……なんていうかなあ、京都に行ったら金閣寺を見たい、とか、フランスに行ったらエッフェル塔を体験したい、みたいなノリで、命があって現世にいるならこれだけはしたいってことない？」","en":"“It could be something you have to do before you can die, now that you’ve been born. ...How can I put it? Like wanting to see Kinkaku-ji if you go to Kyoto, or experience the Eiffel Tower if you go to France. Since you’re alive and here in this world, isn’t there one thing you simply have to do?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r328","rowIndex":328,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「突然言われても困るなあ……」","en":"“That’s a difficult question to spring on me...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r329","rowIndex":329,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は首をひねって考える。","en":"I tilted my head and thought.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r330","rowIndex":330,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そんなの、思いつかない。ないような気がするなあ……あ、そうだ、私、ガンジス川をこの目で見てみたいかも」","en":"“Nothing comes to mind. I don’t think I have anything like that... Oh, wait. I might want to see the Ganges with my own eyes.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r331","rowIndex":331,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ガンジス川ってインドの？」","en":"“The Ganges in India?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r332","rowIndex":332,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうそう。ガンジス川ってインドの人にとってはとても聖なるものだそうでね、人間が死んだら火葬した灰を流したり、燃やしもせずに死体をそのまま流したり、その水につかって沐浴したり、洗濯したり、飲んだり、食べる物を煮たり、工業廃水も垂れ流してるし、とにかく何にでも使う、世界で一番万能の川なんだってー。すごいよねー？　なんかそこに人間のすべてがあるような気がする。それを肉眼で見てみないと、人間ってどういうものかなんて、絶対にわからないような気がするよ」","en":"“Right. They say the Ganges is extremely sacred to the people of India. When someone dies, they scatter the cremated ashes in it—or sometimes send the whole body down without even burning it. They bathe in its waters, wash clothes in it, drink it, cook food with it, dump industrial wastewater into it—they use it for absolutely everything. It’s supposed to be the most versatile river in the world. Isn’t that amazing? I feel as if everything about humanity is there. As if I could never understand what human beings are until I saw it with my own eyes.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r333","rowIndex":333,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……それはインド旅行すればすぐに叶いそうだね」","en":"“...You could make that happen easily enough by traveling to India.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r334","rowIndex":334,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いやだよめんどくさい」","en":"“No way. Too much trouble.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r335","rowIndex":335,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「うーん」","en":"“Hmm.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r336","rowIndex":336,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=44>筱喬</tips>は納得いかなそうな顔をする。私の答えはなにか間違っていたのだろうか？","en":"<tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> looked unconvinced. Had I answered incorrectly somehow?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r337","rowIndex":337,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=44>筱喬</tips>はそういうの、あるの？」","en":"“Do you have something like that, <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips>?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r338","rowIndex":338,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　沈黙に気まずくなって私がそう尋ねると、","en":"The silence grew awkward, so I put the same question to her.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r339","rowIndex":339,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「うん」","en":"“Yes.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r340","rowIndex":340,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女は子供のようにこくんと頷き、","en":"She gave a little nod like a child.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r341","rowIndex":341,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=44>シウ</tips>はね、答えが欲しいの」","en":"“<tips=44>Siu</tips> wants an answer.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r342","rowIndex":342,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「答え？」","en":"“An answer?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r343","rowIndex":343,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そう。生まれてから死ぬまで……それか、正気を失うまでの間に、自分の人生の答えを見つけておきたい。自分の人生とはなんだったのかという、総論？　意味のあるものだったって、納得出来る何か。……他のみんなみたいに遊びたいとも思うけど、それよりもっと大事なことなんだ」","en":"“Yes. Between being born and dying... or before I lose my sanity, I want to find the answer to my life. A summation of what my life was, maybe? Something that can convince me it meant something. ...I want to have fun like everyone else, but this matters much more.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r344","rowIndex":344,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は自分の安易な考えを見透かされたようなその説明に、どきりとして何も言うことが出来なかった。","en":"Her explanation seemed to see straight through my facile thinking, startling me into silence.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r345","rowIndex":345,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「最近特にそう思う。……ねえ<tips=51>さくら</tips>、私のお父さん、病気みたいなの」","en":"“I’ve felt it especially strongly lately. ...<tips=51>Sakura</tips>, I think my father is ill.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r346","rowIndex":346,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「お父さんが？」","en":"“Your father?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r347","rowIndex":347,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そう。教えて貰ったわけじゃないけど、なんとなくわかる。今回の出張も検査か何かだと思う。きっと、とても悪い病気……。父さんに何かあったら、私もどうなるかわからない。今のうちに、少しでも出来ることはしておかなくちゃ」","en":"“Yes. No one told me, but I can somehow tell. I think this business trip is really for tests or something. It must be a very serious illness... If anything happens to Father, I don’t know what will happen to me. I have to do whatever little I can while there’s still time.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r348","rowIndex":348,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>の<tips=81>龍頭</tips><tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>に何かあったら、その無力な一人娘はどうなるか。","en":"If something happened to <tips=3>Chris Tse</tips>, the <tips=81>Longtou</tips> of <tips=7>YS</tips>, what would become of his powerless only daughter?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r349","rowIndex":349,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ちょっとお金のある家庭でも、家長が死ねばそれなりの混乱が生まれるものだ。<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>ともなれば、私の想像もつかない事情もあるのかもしれない。少なくとも<tips=44>筱喬</tips>はそう予測している。","en":"Even a moderately wealthy household falls into some disorder when the head of the family dies. With <tips=7>YS</tips>, there might be complications beyond anything I could imagine. <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips>, at least, seemed to expect as much.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r350","rowIndex":350,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「その時は、私がなんとかするよ」","en":"“When that happens, I’ll do something about it.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r351","rowIndex":351,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そう言いたかったが、口に出すかどうか、迷った。","en":"That was what I wanted to say. I hesitated to let the words out.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r352","rowIndex":352,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　だって、私はサイキックだけど、それ以外はどうってことのない人間だし、言ったって何の説得力もない。","en":"I might have been a psychic, but in every other respect I was nothing special. Anything I said would carry no weight.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r353","rowIndex":353,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　——いや、それでも口にするのが人として正しいありかたなんじゃない？","en":"—But wasn’t saying it anyway the right thing to do as a human being?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r354","rowIndex":354,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「その時は……」","en":"“When that happens...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r355","rowIndex":355,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私がうっかり真剣になって言葉を出しかけたとき、","en":"I had carelessly let myself get serious and was just beginning to speak when—","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r356","rowIndex":356,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ねえ<tips=51>さくら</tips>」","en":"“<tips=51>Sakura</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r357","rowIndex":357,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=44>筱喬</tips>が同時に口を開いて、彼女の言葉によって遮られるようなかたちになる。","en":"<tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> opened her mouth at the same instant, and her words cut across mine.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r358","rowIndex":358,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あっ、ごめん」","en":"“Oh, I’m sorry.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r359","rowIndex":359,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いいよ。<tips=44>シウ</tips>が言って」","en":"“It’s fine. You go ahead, <tips=44>Siu</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r360","rowIndex":360,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私が促すと、<tips=44>筱喬</tips>はもう一度やり直す。","en":"At my prompting, <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> began again.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r361","rowIndex":361,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「うん。……あのね、<tips=51>さくら</tips>」","en":"“Yeah. ...Um, <tips=51>Sakura</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r362","rowIndex":362,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なに？」","en":"“What?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r363","rowIndex":363,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「髪の毛、今度伸ばしてみなよ。短いのもかっこよくて似合ってるけど、長くしたところも見てみたいな？」","en":"“You should try growing your hair out sometime. Short hair looks cool on you, but I’d like to see how you look with it long too.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r364","rowIndex":364,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……アハハ」","en":"“...Ha ha.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r365","rowIndex":365,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なに？」","en":"“What?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r366","rowIndex":366,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　何か真剣な話をされるのかと思って身構えていた私は、拍子抜けして苦笑してしまったのだ。","en":"I had braced myself for something serious. The anticlimax drew a wry laugh from me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r367","rowIndex":367,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なんでもない。……伸ばす気はないかな」","en":"“Nothing. ...I don’t think I want to grow it out.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r368","rowIndex":368,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なんで？」","en":"“Why not?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r369","rowIndex":369,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「私はなんだっていいんだ。<tips=44>シウ</tips>みたいに可愛いわけじゃないし。長くしたってめんどくさいだけだよ」","en":"“It doesn’t matter what I look like. I’m not cute like you, <tips=44>Siu</tips>. Long hair would only be a nuisance.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r370","rowIndex":370,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そんなことないんだけどなあ」","en":"“That isn’t true...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r371","rowIndex":371,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=44>筱喬</tips>は不満げに溜息をついた。","en":"<tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> sighed unhappily.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r372","rowIndex":372,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　このときは二人で<tips=57>滑走路通り</tips>をぷらぷらと歩き、彼女は<tips=77>特質変異</tips>の強い<tips=16>タイプA</tips>の店員などと会話をしたり、<tips=17>タイプB</tips>のストリートチルドレンに声をかけたりしていた。私は人見知りなのでそれを黙って隣で見ているだけだった。","en":"That day, the two of us wandered idly down <tips=57>Runway Street</tips>. She chatted with shop clerks who had pronounced <tips=77>trait mutations</tips> and were <tips=16>Type A</tips>, and called out to <tips=17>Type B</tips> street children. Shy around strangers, I merely stood beside her and watched in silence.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r373","rowIndex":373,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　これは彼女にとって感慨深い体験だったようで、帰ってからもよくこのときのことを話題にしたがった。そして、もう一度、外に遊びに行こうという話が出て来た頃だ。","en":"The experience appeared to affect her deeply, and afterward she often wanted to talk about it. Just as we had begun to discuss going out again—","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r374","rowIndex":374,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女の父、<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>が死んだ。","en":"Her father, <tips=3>Chris Tse</tips>, died.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r375","rowIndex":375,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私はその葬儀の列を、<tips=57>滑走路通り</tips>沿いの建物のてっぺんに座り込んで、双眼鏡で眺めていた。黒塗りの高級車や、コワモテの男たちが多数列を成して往来をゆっくりと練り歩く様はなかなかの壮観で、全く何も知らない頃の私だったら、馬鹿みたいに口をぼんやり開けて見守っていただろうけれど、<tips=44>筱喬</tips>と知り合った今では胸中複雑だった。","en":"I sat on the roof of a building along <tips=57>Runway Street</tips> and watched his funeral procession through my binoculars. A great number of black luxury cars and hard-faced men formed ranks and made their stately way down the street. It was an impressive spectacle. Before I knew anything, I would have watched slack-jawed like an idiot. Now that I knew <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips>, my feelings were not so simple.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r376","rowIndex":376,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして、行列が通り過ぎると、部屋に閉じこもる<tips=44>筱喬</tips>を訪ねた。","en":"Once the procession had passed, I went to see <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips>, who had shut herself away in her room.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r377","rowIndex":377,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女はベッドの上で泣きじゃくっていた。私が入ると一瞬泣き止んで顔を上げたが、","en":"She was sobbing on the bed. When I entered, she stopped for an instant and raised her face.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r378","rowIndex":378,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「う、う、うあぁぁぁああん……」","en":"“U-uh—uwaaaaaah...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r379","rowIndex":379,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　すぐにまた子供のような声をあげて泣き出した。","en":"Then she immediately began crying aloud again like a child.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r380","rowIndex":380,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私はそのすぐ隣に座って、震える細い肩を眺めた。","en":"I sat directly beside her and watched her slender shoulders tremble.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r381","rowIndex":381,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女の最大の庇護者である父親が死んだら、これから先誰が彼女を守るのだろう？　母親はもういない。兄が唯一の肉親になるけれど、行列で見たそれらしい人物は、あまりにも若すぎて頼りなかった。しかも学生だと言う。","en":"Now that her father, her greatest protector, had died, who would keep her safe? Her mother was already gone. Her elder brother would be her only remaining blood relative, but the figure who appeared to be him in the procession looked far too young to inspire confidence. He was supposedly a student, no less.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r382","rowIndex":382,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>にはたくさんの部下がいたが、そうした人々は本当にアテになるのだろうか？　本当の家族のようには信じられないだろう。","en":"<tips=3>Chris Tse</tips> had many subordinates, but could she truly rely upon those people? She could hardly trust them the way she would real family.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r383","rowIndex":383,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そのことを考えると、私の方が心細くなってしまいそうだった。","en":"Thinking about it made even me feel anxious and alone.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r384","rowIndex":384,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　一方、おそらく<tips=44>筱喬</tips>自身はそんな自分の将来の心配などはしていないだろう。","en":"<tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> herself, on the other hand, was probably not worrying about her own future at all.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r385","rowIndex":385,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ただただ、父親の死を悲しみ、泣き続けている。","en":"She did nothing but grieve her father and cry.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r386","rowIndex":386,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は慰めの言葉を探したが見つからなかった。大好きな身内を失った悲しみというのは、絶望的で、個人的で、どうしようもないものだ。他人がどんな言葉をくれても、何をしてくれても、その行為と自分の心の間に透明の壁が出来てしまって、何も届かなくしてしまう。","en":"I searched for words of comfort and found none. The grief of losing a beloved family member was desperate, private, and beyond anyone’s power to remedy. No matter what another person said or did for you, a transparent wall rose between their gesture and your heart, preventing any of it from reaching you.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r387","rowIndex":387,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私がいまここで何を言っても説得力のない的はずれの言葉になってしまうのだ。","en":"Whatever I said now would miss the point and ring hollow.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r388","rowIndex":388,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私はそっと手を伸ばし、彼女の背中をさすった。","en":"I quietly reached out and rubbed her back.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r389","rowIndex":389,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それは、まだ幼い頃、夜中に目が覚めて眠れないと泣きじゃくった私に、死んだ祖母がしてくれた行為だった。その手のひらの温かみには途轍もない安心感があり、それをなんとか再現出来ないだろうかと考えたのだ。","en":"When I was still small and woke crying in the middle of the night because I could not fall asleep again, my late grandmother had done that for me. The warmth of her palm carried a tremendous sense of safety. I wondered if I could reproduce it somehow.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r390","rowIndex":390,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　実際はそれほどわかっているわけでもないが、何でもわかっているような穏やかな表情をして、静かに撫で続ける。","en":"In truth, I understood very little. But I arranged my face into the tranquil expression of someone who understood everything and continued stroking her in silence.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r391","rowIndex":391,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「うっ、うっ、うううぅ……」","en":"“Uh... uh... uuuuh...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r392","rowIndex":392,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私のなでなで大作戦は、少しは効果を示したのか、彼女の泣き声は段々小さくなってゆく。","en":"My great back-stroking operation appeared to have some effect. Little by little, her sobs grew quieter.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r393","rowIndex":393,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　やがて、歯を食いしばり、ときおりしゃくり上げるという程度にまで収まってきたが、しかし泣き止むというところまではいかなかった。その姿を見ていると、祖母が死んだときの幼い自分の姿が思い出された。","en":"At length, her crying subsided until she merely clenched her teeth and occasionally hiccuped, though it had not stopped altogether. Looking at her brought back my younger self when my grandmother died.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r394","rowIndex":394,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　祖母が死んだとき、もし祖母が側にいてくれたならば、こんなふうに背中を撫でてくれて慰めてくれたのだろうか？　矛盾した想像だけど。","en":"When my grandmother died, if my grandmother had been there beside me, would she have stroked my back and comforted me like this? A contradiction, of course.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r395","rowIndex":395,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「哀しいね」","en":"“It’s sad.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r396","rowIndex":396,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は初めて同情の言葉を口にした。","en":"For the first time, I put my sympathy into words.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r397","rowIndex":397,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女は私の顔を振り返ると、引きつった顔を見せて、そして両手で私の身体にしがみつくようにして、また声をあげて泣き始める。","en":"She turned to look at me, her features contorted, then clung to me with both arms and began wailing once more.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r398","rowIndex":398,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私の言葉は、収まりかけた彼女の感情を再び刺激してしまったらしい。","en":"My words appeared to have stirred up the feelings that had nearly subsided.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r399","rowIndex":399,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　やはり私はどうもせっかちなようだ。さきほどまで、好きなだけ泣かせてやればいい、疲れ果てるまで黙って泣くのを見守ってやろう、と思っていたが、なんだか急速にその考えが間違っているような気持ちになって来た。","en":"It seemed I really was impatient after all. Until a moment ago, I had intended to let her cry as much as she needed and remain silent until she wore herself out. Then, with peculiar speed, the whole plan began to feel wrong.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r400","rowIndex":400,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　どうしようもなく悲しいことだとしても、私たちはもう子供でもないし、悲しむ以外の別の認識を持たなくてはいけない。","en":"Even if the sadness was beyond remedy, we were no longer children. We had to find some way of understanding it besides grief.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r401","rowIndex":401,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=44>シウ</tips>」","en":"“<tips=44>Siu</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r402","rowIndex":402,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は少し乱暴に彼女の肩を掴み、顔を上げさせ、至近距離で見つめ合う。","en":"I took her by the shoulders a little roughly, made her lift her face, and from inches away, we stared into each other’s eyes.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r403","rowIndex":403,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　悲しみを乗り越えるきっかけになるような言葉をかけてやろうとしたのだけれども、言葉を思いつく前にこんな行動に出てしまったから、何も言えず、変な沈黙が生まれてしまう。","en":"I meant to give her words that might help her begin to overcome the grief, but had acted before thinking of any. Nothing emerged. An awkward silence opened between us.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r404","rowIndex":404,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……<tips=44>シウ</tips>」","en":"“...<tips=44>Siu</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r405","rowIndex":405,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私はもう一度その名を言って、","en":"I spoke her name again.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r406","rowIndex":406,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「人が死ぬのは悲しいことだけど、いつまでも悲しんでる暇はないよ」","en":"“It’s sad when a person dies, but you don’t have the time to grieve forever.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r407","rowIndex":407,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=44>筱喬</tips>はまた泣き出そうとして、目から涙がこぼれ落ちる。私はその雫を親指で拭い、","en":"Tears spilled from <tips=44>Siu-kiu’s</tips> eyes as she seemed about to start crying again. I wiped one drop away with my thumb.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r408","rowIndex":408,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「死ぬのは人ごとじゃない。時間が流れるのは早くて、私たちもすぐに年取って死ぬんだ。次にやることを考えるんだ。<tips=44>シウ</tips>は人生を意義のあるものにしたいっていつも言ってるじゃないか。だから……」","en":"“Death isn’t something that only happens to other people. Time passes quickly. Soon enough, we’ll grow old and die too. You have to think about what you’ll do next. <tips=44>Siu</tips>, you’re always saying you want to make your life meaningful. So...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r409","rowIndex":409,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　何とかそこまで言ったが、<tips=44>筱喬</tips>の真剣な眼差しに見つめられたまま、結論が出てこない。","en":"I managed that much, but no conclusion followed as <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> watched me with earnest eyes.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r410","rowIndex":410,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それに、何もしないで自宅で引きこもっていた私に偉そうなことを言う資格があるのかと考えると、とてつもなく恥ずかしくなって来た。","en":"Then it occurred to me that, as a recluse who did nothing but sit at home, I had no right to lecture her. The thought made me overwhelmingly ashamed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r411","rowIndex":411,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「だから、えーと、あの……」","en":"“So, um... Well...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r412","rowIndex":412,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ここでまごついてしまう私はなんてカッコ悪いんだろう！　焦って、顔が熱くなってきた。きっと赤面しているのだと思う。","en":"How spectacularly uncool I was, floundering now! I panicked; my face grew hot. I was surely blushing.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r413","rowIndex":413,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しかし、いまのこの、悲しみにうちひしがれて涙を目にためてキラキラと輝かせて私を頼る、すぐにでも崩れてしまいそうな儚げな表情の<tips=44>筱喬</tips>の美しさと言ったら！","en":"But the beauty of <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> at that moment! Crushed by sorrow, her eyes bright with tears, relying upon me, her fragile expression seeming as though it might crumble at any moment!","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r414","rowIndex":414,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして、それを元気づけることも出来ない私のみじめさと言ったら！","en":"And how pathetic I was, unable to cheer her up!","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r415","rowIndex":415,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……ありがとう」","en":"“...Thank you.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r416","rowIndex":416,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=44>筱喬</tips>は言って、泣き顔に、無理に笑顔を作ろうとする。","en":"<tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> said, trying to force her tearful face into a smile.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r417","rowIndex":417,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　元気づけようという私の気持ちをくみ取って、気遣ってくれたのだ。その笑顔に、呼吸が止まるような、はっとするような、乙女っぽくいうと胸がきゅんとするような、そんな感じがしてしまう。","en":"She had understood that I wanted to encourage her, and was trying to spare my feelings. That smile took my breath away and made my heart jump—or, to put it in girlish terms, made my heart flutter.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r418","rowIndex":418,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　——言っておくけれども、悲しみで生まれた彼女の心細さにつけ込もうというつもりはない。いや、私のゲスな根性からすると、深層心理レベルではそうした打算もあったのかもしれないが、少なくとも表面的な部分ではまったくそんなことは考えていなかった。","en":"—For the record, I did not mean to exploit the vulnerability her grief had created. Given the vileness of my character, perhaps some calculation of that kind existed at the level of my subconscious. At least on the surface, however, nothing of the sort had entered my thoughts.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r419","rowIndex":419,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ただ元気を出して欲しかった。それと、やっぱり私は<tips=44>筱喬</tips>を心底いとおしく思っているのだと実感した。","en":"I only wanted her to feel better. And I realized once more that I truly, deeply cherished <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r420","rowIndex":420,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「お父さんが死んでから、お兄ちゃんも、誰も、みんな忙しくて<tips=44>シウ</tips>に会いに来てくれないのに、心配して飛んできてくれたのは<tips=51>さくら</tips>だけだよ。<tips=51>さくら</tips>だけが<tips=44>シウ</tips>のこと考えてくれるんだね」","en":"“Ever since Father died, Big Brother and everyone else have all been too busy to come see <tips=44>Siu</tips>. <tips=51>Sakura</tips> was the only one who worried about me and flew here. <tips=51>Sakura</tips> is the only one who thinks about <tips=44>Siu</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r421","rowIndex":421,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その言葉が駄目押しだった。","en":"Those words did me in.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r422","rowIndex":422,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　気がつけば、私は吸い込まれるように彼女に口づけをしていたのである。","en":"Before I knew what I was doing, I leaned in as though drawn to her and kissed her.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r423","rowIndex":423,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「んっ……」","en":"“Mmm...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r424","rowIndex":424,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女は驚いたようだが、私を突き飛ばすようなことはしなかった。","en":"She appeared surprised, but did not push me away.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r425","rowIndex":425,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は唇を離して彼女のうるんだ目をまっすぐ見つめ、","en":"I drew back and looked directly into her tear-filled eyes.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r426","rowIndex":426,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「私たちは、誰よりも仲良くしよう」","en":"“Let’s be closer than anyone else.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r427","rowIndex":427,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=44>筱喬</tips>はおずおずと頷く。","en":"<tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> gave a timid nod.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r428","rowIndex":428,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「よかった」","en":"“I’m glad.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r429","rowIndex":429,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私はもう一度彼女に口づけをし、さらに両腕で彼女の身体を抱きしめた。","en":"I kissed her again, then wrapped both arms around her body.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r430","rowIndex":430,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　頭が痺れるような感覚に浮かされたまま、私は手を彼女の服の下に入れる。","en":"Still intoxicated by the sensation numbing my mind, I slipped my hand beneath her clothes.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r431","rowIndex":431,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女は抵抗はしないが、驚きの顔で私を見ている。","en":"She did not resist, but looked at me in surprise.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r432","rowIndex":432,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いや？」","en":"“You don’t like it?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r433","rowIndex":433,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうじゃないけど……こういうこと、女の子同士でするの？」","en":"“It’s not that... But do girls do things like this together?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r434","rowIndex":434,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　さすがに<tips=44>筱喬</tips>といえども、私が今行い、さらにこれからしようとしている行為が、単なる友人同士のスキンシップの範囲を超えていることは知っているらしい。","en":"Even <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> apparently understood that what I was doing, and what I meant to do next, went beyond the ordinary range of physical affection between friends.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r435","rowIndex":435,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「こういうことって、どういうこと？」","en":"“Things like what?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r436","rowIndex":436,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私はどの程度の知識があるのか、訊ねてみた。","en":"I tried to determine how much she knew.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r437","rowIndex":437,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……こうやって、舌を触れ合ってキスをしたり……肌に直接触ったり……」","en":"“...Kissing with our tongues touching like this... and touching each other’s bare skin...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r438","rowIndex":438,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女が恥ずかしそうに言うので、私の嗜虐心がそそられてしまう。","en":"Her embarrassment aroused my sadistic side.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r439","rowIndex":439,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そういうのをする女の子同士だっているよ」","en":"“There are girls who do those things with each other.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r440","rowIndex":440,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……で、でも、男女の恋人同士でするものでしょう？」","en":"“...B-but it’s something a man and a woman do when they’re lovers, isn’t it?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r441","rowIndex":441,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　すぐ近くで顔を近づけ合って話しているから、彼女が少し大きな声を出すと、その吐息が私の顔にかかる。","en":"We were speaking with our faces close together. When she raised her voice slightly, her breath brushed my face.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r442","rowIndex":442,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「男女でもするけど、男同士ですることもあるし、女同士ですることもあるよ」","en":"“Men and women do it, but sometimes men do it with men, or women with women.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r443","rowIndex":443,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……そうかもしれないけど、普通は……」","en":"“...Maybe, but normally...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r444","rowIndex":444,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「普通って何？　お互いがいやじゃなければ、それでいいと思うけど。<tips=44>筱喬</tips>はいや？」","en":"“What does ‘normal’ mean? I think it’s fine as long as neither of us minds. Do you mind, <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips>?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r445","rowIndex":445,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「い、嫌じゃないけど……でも……」","en":"“I-I don’t dislike it, but... still...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r446","rowIndex":446,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=44>筱喬</tips>は困ったように私を見つめ、","en":"<tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> looked at me uncertainly and asked,","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r447","rowIndex":447,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=51>さくら</tips>は、女の子が好きなの？」","en":"“Do you like girls, <tips=51>Sakura</tips>?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r448","rowIndex":448,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……いわゆる同性愛者ではないと思う。私は<tips=44>筱喬</tips>が好きなだけ」","en":"“...I don’t think I’m what you’d call homosexual. I simply like you, <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r449","rowIndex":449,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……<tips=44>シウ</tips>も、そうなのかな……」","en":"“...I wonder if <tips=44>Siu</tips> is the same...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r450","rowIndex":450,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうかもしれないし、そうじゃないかもしれないね」","en":"“Maybe you are. Maybe you aren’t.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r451","rowIndex":451,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は笑って見せて、そしてまた彼女にキスをした。","en":"I gave her a smile, then kissed her again.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r452","rowIndex":452,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして、彼女の手を握ろうとしたところで、","en":"And just as I tried to take her hand—","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r453","rowIndex":453,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あっ」","en":"“Ah.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r454","rowIndex":454,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ぬるっと肌がすべって、そして手を離すと、私の指先と<tips=44>筱喬</tips>の手首の間に透明の糸が引いた。","en":"Her skin slid slickly against mine, and when I released her hand, a transparent thread stretched between my fingertips and <tips=44>Siu-kiu’s</tips> wrist.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r455","rowIndex":455,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しまった。今日も体液を吸い込む厚着をしていたけれど、もう飽和してしまったらしい。吸い込みきれなくなった粘液が、袖口から指先の方へ伝わってしまったのだ。","en":"Damn it. I was wearing thick clothes to absorb my fluids today too, but apparently they were already saturated. The slime they could no longer absorb had found its way from my cuffs down to my fingertips.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r456","rowIndex":456,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それ……」","en":"“That...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r457","rowIndex":457,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=44>筱喬</tips>は驚きの目で見ている。","en":"<tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> stared at it in surprise.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r458","rowIndex":458,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は今日までずっとそれを隠していた。そのことを忘れて、どうしてこんなことをしようとしてしまったんだろう！","en":"I had hidden it from her until that very day. How could I have forgotten that and tried to do something like this?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r459","rowIndex":459,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私が人と触れあえるわけなんてないのに。","en":"There was no way I could ever touch another person.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r460","rowIndex":460,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「がおー、納豆女だぞ」","en":"“Raaah! I’m the Natto Woman!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r461","rowIndex":461,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は粘液にまみれた両手を両手の前にかざし、熊手のように指を折り曲げて、彼女の目の前で動かし、くっついたり離れたりした指の間に糸が出来るのを見せると、","en":"I raised both slime-coated hands before her, curled my fingers into claws, and moved them back and forth, displaying the threads that formed whenever my fingers parted.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r462","rowIndex":462,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……これが私の<tips=77>特質変異</tips>」","en":"“...This is my <tips=77>trait mutation</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r463","rowIndex":463,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　袖をまくって絞り、大量の体液が肘を伝いベッドを汚すのを見せた。","en":"I rolled up and wrung out a sleeve, letting a great quantity of bodily fluid run down my elbow and soil the bed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r464","rowIndex":464,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ぬるぬるした液体が体中からどんどん出て来るの。手足の先と、顔はあんまり出ないけど、他の皮膚からは四六時中にじみ出てくる。いつもはこういう厚手のセーターみたいなのを全身に着て吸い取らせてるの」","en":"“Slippery fluid keeps pouring from my entire body. Not much comes from my fingers, toes, or face, but it seeps out of the rest of my skin around the clock. Usually I cover myself in thick sweaters and things like this so they will soak it up.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r465","rowIndex":465,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「これが……」","en":"“So this is...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r466","rowIndex":466,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=44>筱喬</tips>は起き上がると私の腕に触れて指先に粘液を取り、まじまじと見つめる。","en":"<tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> sat up, touched my arm, collected some slime on the tip of one finger, and studied it intently.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r467","rowIndex":467,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……だから、雨の日にやってくることが多いの？」","en":"“...Is that why you so often come when it rains?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r468","rowIndex":468,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ふと気がついて、私の顔を見上げた。","en":"The realization came to her suddenly, and she looked up at me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r469","rowIndex":469,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうだよ。濡れてもわかりにくいからね」","en":"“That’s right. The rain makes it harder to notice.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r470","rowIndex":470,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どうしてもっと早く教えてくれなかったの？　<tips=77>特質変異</tips>はないって言ってたじゃない」","en":"“Why didn’t you tell me sooner? You said you didn’t have a <tips=77>trait mutation</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r471","rowIndex":471,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=44>筱喬</tips>は責めるような態度で私を見つめる。","en":"<tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> stared at me accusingly.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r472","rowIndex":472,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「知られたくなかったから。私はこの体質、だいっきらいなんだ」","en":"“Because I didn’t want you to know. I hate this condition. I absolutely hate it.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r473","rowIndex":473,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「知ったら<tips=44>シウ</tips>がいやがると思った？　だから嘘をついたの？」","en":"“You thought <tips=44>Siu</tips> would be disgusted if she found out? Is that why you lied?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r474","rowIndex":474,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「うん。だってそうでしょう？　気持ち悪いでしょう？」","en":"“Yeah. Because of course you would, wouldn’t you? It’s disgusting, isn’t it?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r475","rowIndex":475,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私が乾いた声で笑うと、彼女は口をむっとへの字に曲げてから、","en":"I gave a mirthless laugh. Her lips tightened into an angry line.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r476","rowIndex":476,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「気持ち悪くなんかない」","en":"“It’s not disgusting.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r477","rowIndex":477,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「でも」","en":"“But...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r478","rowIndex":478,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「気持ち悪くなんかない。でも、隠すなんてひどい。私たち、友だちだったんじゃないの？」","en":"“It’s not disgusting. But it was awful of you to hide it. Weren’t we friends?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r479","rowIndex":479,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=44>筱喬</tips>は怒っている。","en":"<tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> was angry.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r480","rowIndex":480,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　本当に怒っている。だって、目が金色になっているもの。","en":"She was truly angry. I could tell because her eyes had turned gold.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r481","rowIndex":481,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「い、いや、私はね……」","en":"“I-I mean...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r482","rowIndex":482,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「こんなの、隠すことないじゃない！」","en":"“There’s no reason to hide something like this!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r483","rowIndex":483,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　説明しようとする私を遮って、<tips=44>筱喬</tips>は言う。","en":"<tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> interrupted before I could explain.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r484","rowIndex":484,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=44>シウ</tips>を信用してないんでしょ。だから隠したんだわ。何でも言ってって、いつも言ってるのに」","en":"“You don’t trust <tips=44>Siu</tips>. That’s why you hid it. I’m always telling you that you can tell me anything.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r485","rowIndex":485,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「でも、そんなの無理だよ。いや、<tips=44>筱喬</tips>が悪いんじゃないんだ。私には、なんというか、人を信じるとかそういう心がなくて……」","en":"“But I can’t do that. It isn’t your fault, <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips>. I just don’t have whatever part of the heart lets you trust people...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r486","rowIndex":486,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それは臆病だからよ。<tips=51>さくら</tips>は、自分以外の人はみんな簡単に他人を信じてると思ってる？　そうじゃないわ。<tips=44>シウ</tips>だっていつも誰かを信じるときは勇気を出してるんだよ。相手と本当に仲良くなるためには、ありのままを見せないといけないもの」","en":"“That’s because you’re afraid. Do you think everyone but you trusts other people without any difficulty? That isn’t true. Even <tips=44>Siu</tips> has to find her courage every time she trusts someone. If you truly want to grow close to someone, you have to show them who you really are, <tips=51>Sakura</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r487","rowIndex":487,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=44>筱喬</tips>のまっすぐな視線が、私の汚れた心にはまぶしすぎる。くらくらとする。","en":"<tips=44>Siu-kiu’s</tips> forthright gaze was too dazzling for my filthy heart. It made my head spin.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r488","rowIndex":488,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　実際ありのままを見せようという試み自体が、根源的には意味のないものだ。<tips=44>筱喬</tips>はなんでもかんでも喋ることでありのままを見せているつもりなのだろうけど、私は嘘をついたりかっこつけたりごまかしたりするのがありのままの私だし、ここで<tips=44>筱喬</tips>の情熱に打たれて告白をしてもありのままの私だろう。","en":"In fact, the very attempt to show someone your true self was meaningless at the most fundamental level. <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> probably believed that telling someone absolutely everything meant showing them who she really was. But lying, showing off, and dodging the truth were also who I really was. And if <tips=44>Siu-kiu’s</tips> passion moved me to confess here, that too would be who I really was.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r489","rowIndex":489,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ありのまま、というのはどこにでも偏在するもので、むしろありのままじゃないものってなんだろうと私は思う。世の中のすべての存在は常にありのままだし、ありのままでしか存在し得ないのだ。","en":"The condition of being ‘as you really are’ was everywhere. What, I wondered, could possibly not be as it really was? Everything in the world was always exactly what it was and could exist no other way.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r490","rowIndex":490,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　まあ<tips=44>筱喬</tips>が言いたいことはそうじゃないってのはわかっている。そしてその情熱に私の心は打たれている。私にも心はあるってことだね。","en":"Well, I understood that <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> meant something else. And her passion had moved my heart. Apparently I possessed one after all.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r491","rowIndex":491,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まあでも、私なりには最大限信じてるよ？　<tips=44>筱喬</tips>のこと」","en":"“Still, I trust you as much as I possibly can, in my own way, <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r492","rowIndex":492,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それはわかってる。いつもここに来てくれるし、今もここにいてくれるし」","en":"“I know. You always come here, and you’re still here with me now.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r493","rowIndex":493,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=44>筱喬</tips>は両手をさしのべて、それぞれの手で私のそれぞれの手を握ると、","en":"<tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> reached out, taking one of my hands in each of hers.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r494","rowIndex":494,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いつまでもとは言わない。<tips=44>シウ</tips>の精神が正常なうちは、友だちとして何でもしゃべって。嘘をついたり、誤魔化したりして、遠回りに時間を無駄遣いしてしまうのがこわいの」","en":"“I won’t ask you to do it forever. But as long as <tips=44>Siu</tips> is still sane, tell me everything as my friend. I’m afraid we’ll waste what time we have taking the long way around with lies and evasions.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r495","rowIndex":495,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　訴えるような視線で私の目を見つめる。","en":"Her pleading gaze searched my eyes.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r496","rowIndex":496,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私はいつものようにごちゃごちゃと言いたくなったけれど、今くらいは心を、私の理不尽な心をそのまま言葉にしようと決めた。","en":"As usual, I wanted to muddle things with a whole mess of words. But this once, I decided to put my heart—my unreasonable heart—into words exactly as it was.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r497","rowIndex":497,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　思考はいつだって理論的だが、ハートはいつだって理不尽だ。私はつじつまの合わないハートを馬鹿にして、普段はなるべくハートの声を無視しようとしているけれど、今は、そのハートの言葉を届けることが、きっとそれが<tips=44>筱喬</tips>とつき合って行く上で大事なことなのだ。","en":"My thoughts were always logical, but my heart was always unreasonable. I ridiculed my inconsistent heart and ordinarily tried to ignore its voice. Now, however, letting its words reach her—surely that was important if I meant to go on being with <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r498","rowIndex":498,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……<tips=44>筱喬</tips>は発症しないよ」","en":"“...You won’t develop symptoms, <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r499","rowIndex":499,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私はそう断言した。","en":"I declared it without qualification.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r500","rowIndex":500,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どうしてそんなこと言えるの？」","en":"“How can you say that?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r501","rowIndex":501,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そう思ってるから。それだけだよ」","en":"“Because that’s what I believe. That’s all.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r502","rowIndex":502,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……じゃあ、もし発症したら？」","en":"“...Then what if I do?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r503","rowIndex":503,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「私は認めない。いつでも普通に会いに来て、いつもみたいに話しかける」","en":"“I refuse to accept it. I’ll come see you anytime, just like normal, and talk to you the way I always do.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r504","rowIndex":504,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「わけがわからなくなって、うんちとか垂れ流すようになっても？」","en":"“Even if I stop understanding anything and start pooping myself?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r505","rowIndex":505,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「私が毎日おむつを取り替えてあげる」","en":"“I’ll change your diapers every day.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r506","rowIndex":506,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……」","en":"“...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r507","rowIndex":507,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=44>筱喬</tips>は黙り込んで、いぶかしむような視線を私に向ける。","en":"<tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> fell silent and turned a dubious look on me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r508","rowIndex":508,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　なんてかわいい表情をするのだろう！","en":"What an adorable expression!","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r509","rowIndex":509,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いひひ、なんなら、今やってあげようか？　おむつ穿かせてあげるから、そこに横になってごらんよ」","en":"“Heh heh. In fact, why don’t I do it now? Lie down over there and I’ll put a diaper on you.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r510","rowIndex":510,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私が<tips=44>筱喬</tips>のズボンに手を伸ばすようなふりをすると、彼女は慌てて後ずさって、","en":"I made as if to reach for <tips=44>Siu-kiu’s</tips> pants. She hastily backed away.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r511","rowIndex":511,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それはいい！　……でも、本気で言ってるの？」","en":"“No, thank you! ...But do you mean it?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r512","rowIndex":512,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「本気だよ。ちゃんとこう、足首掴んで股をひらかせてから、おむつをこう……」","en":"“I certainly do. First I take you by the ankles, spread your legs, and then put the diaper right...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r513","rowIndex":513,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうじゃなくって！」","en":"“That isn’t what I meant!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r514","rowIndex":514,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あー、そっちか」","en":"“Oh, that.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r515","rowIndex":515,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は白々しく頷くと、","en":"I nodded with elaborate innocence.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r516","rowIndex":516,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「もちろん。本気だよ。いまの私は何があってもそばにいようと思ってる。なんの約束もしないけどね。誰とでも、なんの約束もしない主義なんだ。先のことはわからないから。……そのときになったら、気が変わってるかもしれないし、明日は全然ちがうことに夢中になってるかもしれないでしょ。でも、少なくとも今この瞬間そう思ってるのは本当だし嘘はない」","en":"“Of course. I mean it. Right now, I intend to stay beside you whatever happens. I’m not making any promises, though. I make a point of promising nothing to anyone. The future is unknowable. ...When the time comes, I might have changed my mind. Tomorrow, I could be completely absorbed in something else. But at least at this very moment, it’s what I truly feel. There is no lie in it.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r517","rowIndex":517,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「今そう思ってくれるだけでも充分」","en":"“It’s enough that you feel that way now.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r518","rowIndex":518,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=44>筱喬</tips>の目にみるみるうちに涙があふれて、","en":"Tears rapidly filled <tips=44>Siu-kiu’s</tips> eyes.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r519","rowIndex":519,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ありがとう……」","en":"“Thank you...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r520","rowIndex":520,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その言葉は最後は嗚咽に変わった。","en":"Her words ended in a sob.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r521","rowIndex":521,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして彼女は泣き始める。私がこの部屋に訪れたときのように。","en":"Then she began to cry, just as she had when I entered the room.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r522","rowIndex":522,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……ごめんね……。ごめん。なんだか、すごく心細くて……こわくって……」","en":"“...I’m sorry... I’m sorry. I just feel so alone... and scared...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r523","rowIndex":523,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「しょうがないよ。まだ泣き足りなかったんだ」","en":"“It’s all right. You hadn’t finished crying yet.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r524","rowIndex":524,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私はその背中をさすろうとして、ねとねとの手が彼女の服を汚してしまうことに気がつき、すぐに引っ込めた。","en":"I started to rub her back, then realized my sticky hand would soil her clothes and immediately drew it away.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r525","rowIndex":525,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　すると<tips=44>筱喬</tips>がその手を掴み、自分の頬に当てる。","en":"<tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> caught the hand and pressed it against her own cheek.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r526","rowIndex":526,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「顔が汚れるよ」","en":"“You’ll get your face dirty.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r527","rowIndex":527,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私の言葉には応えず、彼女は私のぬるぬるの手に顔を押しつけるようにして泣き続ける。","en":"Without answering, she pressed her face into my slippery hand and continued crying.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r528","rowIndex":528,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私はその姿をぼーっと、なんでかしらないけれどすっかり空っぽになって見つめていた。","en":"I stared at her in a daze, feeling for some reason completely empty inside.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r529","rowIndex":529,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あのさ、<tips=44>シウ</tips>」","en":"“Um, <tips=44>Siu</tips>?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r530","rowIndex":530,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私が声をかけると、彼女は鼻水と涙と私の体液でぐしょぐしょになった顔をあげる。","en":"At my voice, she lifted a face drenched in snot, tears, and my bodily fluid.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r531","rowIndex":531,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「一応きくけど、泣き終わったら、続きをしてくれるってことはないよね？」","en":"“Just checking—once you’re done crying, there’s no chance you’ll let me pick up where we left off, right?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r532","rowIndex":532,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ばか」","en":"“Idiot.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r533","rowIndex":533,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=44>筱喬</tips>はちょっと笑って、","en":"<tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> gave a small laugh.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r534","rowIndex":534,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「今日はもうよしておこう」","en":"“Let’s stop for today.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r535","rowIndex":535,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　と言った。","en":"That was her answer.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r536","rowIndex":536,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「やっぱそうだよねー」","en":"“I thought so.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r537","rowIndex":537,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私はぽりぽりと自分の頭をかく。","en":"I scratched my head.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r538","rowIndex":538,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　今日『は』もうよしておこう——か。","en":"Stop for ‘today,’ hmm.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r539","rowIndex":539,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　と、これが大体半月ほど前までの成り行きだ。","en":"That, in broad outline, was how matters had unfolded up to half a month ago.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r540","rowIndex":540,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=44>筱喬</tips>と知り合うことで、それまでまったく縁のなかった世界と関わることになった。","en":"Meeting <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> had brought me into a world I had never had any connection to before.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r541","rowIndex":541,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それまでは、雨の夜でないと外に出られない、この部屋が私の生活の大部分を占めていたというのに。","en":"Until then, this room had contained most of my life. I could go outside only on rainy nights.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r542","rowIndex":542,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私はベッドにごろりと横になって部屋を見回す。","en":"I flopped onto the bed and looked around.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r543","rowIndex":543,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　この部屋は特別に改造したもので、部屋の半分がタイル敷きになっており、シャワーとバスタブが設置されている。居住空間との仕切りは少し段があるだけで、壁はない。","en":"The room had been specially remodeled. Tile covered half the floor, and a shower and bathtub had been installed there. Only a low step separated that area from the living space; there was no wall.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r544","rowIndex":544,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　もともとはそれぞれ別個の部屋だったのだけれども、べとべとになって気持ち悪くなった身体を、いつでもすぐに流せるようにと壁を取り払ってもらったのだ。","en":"They had originally been separate rooms, but I had the wall removed so I could immediately rinse off whenever my sticky body began to feel unpleasant.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r545","rowIndex":545,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　はじめはその機能性に大喜びしていた私だけれど、住んでいるうちに、段々動物園の檻のなかにいるような気分になって来る。","en":"At first, I was delighted by the room’s functionality, but as I lived there, I gradually began to feel as though I were inside a cage at the zoo.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r546","rowIndex":546,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　柵のなかに、ちょっとした水場があったりするでしょう？　なんだかそんな感じ。","en":"There are little pools inside zoo enclosures, aren’t there? It felt something like that.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r547","rowIndex":547,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　まあ実際動物園の動物のようなものだしな。異常な体質、異常な能力。しかも、こんなにぬるぬるしてそこら中のものを汚してしまうなんて、動物園のなかでも扱いが面倒な方じゃないか？","en":"Well, I really was something like a zoo animal. An abnormal constitution, an abnormal ability. And slimy enough to soil everything around me—wouldn’t that make me one of the more troublesome creatures to handle even by zoo standards?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r548","rowIndex":548,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　これは私の将来の運命を暗示しているんじゃないか？　将来私たちサイキックから人権が剥奪されて、そうしたらおかしな動物のように扱われてしまうんだ。","en":"Was this foreshadowing my future fate? Someday we psychics would be stripped of our human rights, and then we would be treated like bizarre animals.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r549","rowIndex":549,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　動物園の動物ならまだいいかもしれない。","en":"Being a zoo animal might not be so bad.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r550","rowIndex":550,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　実験動物にされたら最悪だ。ゲームだって出来なくなるし、お菓子だって食べられなくなるし、苦痛も味わわされるだろう。私は全身に電極を差し込まれ、毎日虚ろな目でコロシテコロシテと呟くだけの肉体になるのだ。","en":"Being turned into a laboratory animal would be the worst. I wouldn’t even be able to play games or eat sweets, and they’d surely subject me to pain. They would drive electrodes into me all over, and I would become nothing but a body staring vacantly and muttering Kill me, kill me every day.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r551","rowIndex":551,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ああいやだいやだ。","en":"Oh, no. No, no.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r552","rowIndex":552,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　という具合に、私はいつも気持ちをささくれさせて、どうしようもないことをネチネチと考えていたものなのだけれど<tips=44>筱喬</tips>と出会ってからはほとんどそんなことは考えなくなった。","en":"And so I used to let my feelings grow raw and brood endlessly over things I could do nothing about, but after I met <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips>, I almost entirely stopped thinking that way.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r553","rowIndex":553,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=44>筱喬</tips>をこの部屋に招いて彼女とぬるぬる遊びが出来たらいいなあと、無邪気なことを夢想することはあれども。","en":"Though I did innocently fantasize about inviting <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> to the room for some slippery fun together.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r554","rowIndex":554,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　すっかり更生してしまった。","en":"I had reformed completely.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r555","rowIndex":555,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　確かに生活が変わったのかもしれない。","en":"Perhaps my life truly had changed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r556","rowIndex":556,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　だけど、本当はまだ全然彼女たちの事情に深入りしているわけじゃないことを、私は知っているんだよね。","en":"But I knew that, in truth, I had not yet become deeply involved in their circumstances at all.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r557","rowIndex":557,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　たとえば、携帯電話の電源を切って<tips=44>筱喬</tips>からの連絡を絶ち、<tips=9>Y地区</tips>から発信されるいろんな情報に目を閉じてしまえば、私はまだ元の平和で刺激のない生活に戻ることが出来てしまう。","en":"If I switched off my phone, severed contact with <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips>, and closed my eyes to everything coming out of <tips=9>Y District</tips>, I could still return to my old, peaceful, uneventful life.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r558","rowIndex":558,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そうしたら、<tips=44>筱喬</tips>は裏切られたと私を罵るのかな？　私のことを臆病ものだと蔑むのかな？　いや、彼女のことだから、自分の抱えている事情が重すぎるのだと、ただ静かに絶望するだけだろう。","en":"Would <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> accuse me of betraying her? Would she despise me as a coward? No. Knowing her, she would probably conclude that the burden of her circumstances was simply too heavy and despair in silence.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r559","rowIndex":559,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は、その気ならば、そういう選択をとることも出来るんだ。","en":"If I so chose, that option remained open to me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r560","rowIndex":560,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　実際<tips=44>筱喬</tips>をとりまく状況は日ごとに過激さを増している。","en":"In fact, the situation surrounding <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> was growing more volatile by the day.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r561","rowIndex":561,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　つい先週も、<tips=9>Y地区</tips>のとあるビルで殺人事件があった。死んだのは、ビルに入った飲食店の店長と、<tips=26>劉</tips>とかいう<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>の幹部とその娘、そしてその仲間たちだ。","en":"Only the previous week, a murder had taken place in a building in <tips=9>Y District</tips>. The dead included the manager of a restaurant in the building, a <tips=7>YS</tips> officer named <tips=26>Ryu</tips>, his daughter, and his associates.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r562","rowIndex":562,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　実行犯は、<tips=44>筱喬</tips>の兄の<tips=1>謝亮</tips>だというのがほぼ確定的らしい。","en":"<tips=44>Siu-kiu’s</tips> brother, <tips=1>Tse Leung</tips>, was apparently all but certain to have carried out the killings.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r563","rowIndex":563,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　殺害の理由は、<tips=26>劉建志</tips>が街の飲食店でトラブルを起こし、そのオーナー家族を殺戮したことに対する罰だと言う。事情をよく知らない私がその話だけ聞いたとき、いくら市民を殺したからといって身内の、しかも幹部を処刑するだなんて、なかなか筋のとおった人たちなのだなあという印象を受けてしまったけれども、冷静に考えると同じビルの飲食店店主はとばっちりで殺されてるし、仲間や娘まで皆殺しにしてしまうというのは、筋が通り過ぎていて、正直ひくわー、といった感がある。","en":"The stated reason was that <tips=26>Ryu Kenshi</tips> had caused trouble at a restaurant in the city and slaughtered the owner’s family. Knowing little of the circumstances, my first impression on hearing the story was that executing even one of their own officers for killing civilians made them surprisingly principled. On sober reflection, however, the restaurant manager in the same building had died as collateral damage, while killing Ryu’s associates and daughter along with him carried that same principle a little too far. Honestly, it made me recoil.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r564","rowIndex":564,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その<tips=26>劉建志</tips>やその娘の遺体を撮影した画像、というものもネットに流出していて、私はそれも見た。<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>のメンバーに配布された画像だそうで、信憑性はかなり高いらしいんだけれども、それを見てもやっぱり、ひくわー、というのが正直な感想だ。","en":"Pictures said to show the bodies of <tips=26>Ryu Kenshi</tips> and his daughter had leaked online, and I looked at them. They had allegedly been distributed to members of <tips=7>YS</tips> and were regarded as highly credible. Even after seeing them, my honest response remained: Yeah, that’s seriously disturbing.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r565","rowIndex":565,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　むごい。何も殺さなくてもいいじゃん。人間なんか放っておいてもそのうち勝手に死ぬんだし。","en":"It was horrible. There was no need to kill them. Leave people alone, and sooner or later they die on their own.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r566","rowIndex":566,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=44>筱喬</tips>の話だと、お兄さんは普通の大学生で、とても優しくて賢い、ということだったけれども、こんなのやらかすなんて、世界にどっぷり浸かってる本物のマフィアとしか思えない。そして調べてみると、どうも子供の頃から<tips=9>Y地区</tips>の悪餓鬼を率いていたリーダーなのだそうで、完全に悪のエリートとしての人生を送っている。","en":"According to <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips>, her brother was an ordinary university student, extremely kind and intelligent. But anyone capable of that seemed to me nothing less than a genuine mafioso steeped in that world. When I looked into him, I learned that he had apparently led the young delinquents of <tips=9>Y District</tips> since childhood. Plainly, his was the career of an elite in villainy.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r567","rowIndex":567,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　葬式のときに見かけた顔は、あんなに綺麗だったのに。","en":"Yet the face I had seen at the funeral was so beautiful.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r568","rowIndex":568,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　——そういう人も、<tips=44>筱喬</tips>の前ではいいお兄ちゃんなのだろうか。それとも、<tips=44>筱喬</tips>自体がそっちの世界の人間であるから、感覚が麻痺しているんだろうか？","en":"—Could even someone like that be a good big brother to <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips>? Or is <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> herself so much a part of that world that her sensibilities have gone numb?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r569","rowIndex":569,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　まあこうやって殺すには殺す理由があるのかもしれないが、自分とは違う世界に住んでいると実感するには充分な事件だった。","en":"Perhaps there were reasons for killing them the way he had. Still, the incident was more than enough to make me feel that we inhabited different worlds.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r570","rowIndex":570,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　だからもう、私はついていけないわ、もう関わりたくないわ、連絡しないでね——といった具合にすべてを拒絶するのも不自然ではないだろう。そしてそれは実際不可能なことではないのだよね。","en":"It would hardly have been unnatural to reject everything—to say, I cannot follow you any farther, I do not want anything more to do with you, do not contact me—and it was not actually impossible.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r571","rowIndex":571,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=44>筱喬</tips>に言った言葉は嘘じゃない。だけど、そのときに補足したように、あくまでもその瞬間の真実だ。","en":"The words I had spoken to <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> were not lies. But as I had added then, they were true only at that moment.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r572","rowIndex":572,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は意志が強い人間ではないし、情に厚い人間でもないし、誠実な人間でもない。むしろその逆ばかり行っているような気がする。認めたくないけれども、冷静に自己分析を試みると結論はそうなる。その時その時のことがいつも一番大事で、そのためだけに生きている。","en":"I was neither strong-willed, warmhearted, nor sincere. If anything, I seemed to head unfailingly in the opposite direction. I did not want to admit it, but a sober attempt at self-analysis could reach no other conclusion. Whatever was happening at any given moment was always the most important thing to me, and I lived for that alone.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r573","rowIndex":573,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　——正直言って、それらにどんな価値があるのかがわからない。強い意志とかいって、自分にやりたくもないことを自分に強制するのはいやだし、情だとかいって義務みたいにいつもかわらず誰かにやさしくするなんて馬鹿みたいだし、誠実とかいって善人でもないのにいつでも善良に振る舞いたくもない。自分に嘘をついているような気がする。誰かのふりをして生きるなんていやだ。","en":"—Frankly, I had no idea what any of those qualities were worth. I didn’t want to call it strong will and use it to force myself to do things I didn’t even want to do. It seemed idiotic to call it devotion and turn showing someone the same kindness forever into an obligation. And I was no good person, so I didn’t want to call it sincerity and act virtuous all the time. It felt like lying to myself. I didn’t want to live my life pretending to be somebody else.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r574","rowIndex":574,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私はやりたいときにやりたいことをやり、優しくしたい時と相手にだけ優しくして、嘘をつきたいときは嘘をついて、素直に話したいときは話す。","en":"I did what I wanted when I wanted to do it, showed kindness only when and to whom I wished, lied when I wanted to lie, and spoke honestly when I wanted to speak.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r575","rowIndex":575,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それ以外にこの人生をすこしでもマシに生きる方法がわからない。","en":"I knew no other way to live this life even slightly better.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r576","rowIndex":576,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　だから、その時になったら<tips=44>筱喬</tips>を見捨ててしまうかもしれないし、こわくなってしまうかもしれないし、気持ちが醒めているかもしれない。——まあ傍観者として考えると、未来の私にもっとまっとうな人間として振る舞ってほしいという気持ちはあるし、出来ればみなの期待に確実にこたえる立派な人であってほしいのだけど、過去の実績を考えると、まあ難しいだろう。","en":"So when the moment came, I might abandon <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips>. I might grow afraid. My feelings might have cooled. —As a detached observer, I did want the future me to behave like a more decent human being. Ideally, that future me would become an admirable person who unfailingly lived up to everyone’s expectations. Judging from my past performance, though, that was probably asking too much.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r577","rowIndex":577,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　悲しい。","en":"Sad.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r578","rowIndex":578,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は携帯電話を手にとって、電話帳から<tips=44>筱喬</tips>の名前を探し出す。","en":"I picked up my phone and found <tips=44>Siu-kiu’s</tips> name in the contacts.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D1:r579","rowIndex":579,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それを見ているだけで、なんだかうっとりとするような良い気持ちになれる。今のその感情に嘘偽りはないのだけれども、今度この相手から電話がかかってきた瞬間、私は、どんな気持ちで居るだろうか？","en":"Merely looking at it gave me a dreamy, wonderful feeling. There was no lie or deception in what I felt now. But the next time that person called me, what would I feel at the very instant the phone began to ring?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}}]},{"position":19,"code":"D1-2","unitId":"D1-2","rows":[{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r1","rowIndex":1,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　どのような義務も、義務というだけでやりたくなくなる。","en":"Any obligation makes me want nothing to do with it, simply because it is an obligation.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r2","rowIndex":2,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しなければいけないことがあるのは理解していたけれど、私は何もしたくなかったし、そのことについて考えたくもなかったので、ゲームをはじめた。","en":"I understood that there were things I had to do, but I wanted to do nothing and did not even want to think about them, so I started a game.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r3","rowIndex":3,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　銃を持った兵士を操作して、五人対五人の戦闘に参加する。","en":"I take control of a soldier with a gun and enter a five-on-five battle.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r4","rowIndex":4,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　味方の兵士たちも、敵の兵士たちも、全てネットワークで繋がれた誰かが操作している肉入りだ。","en":"Every soldier, ally and enemy alike, has a real person at the controls—someone connected over the network.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r5","rowIndex":5,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　どこの国の、どんな年齢の、男か女かもわからないが、とにかく世界中の見知らぬ人間同士、お互いに銃弾を飛ばして殺し合う。","en":"There is no telling what country they are from, how old they are, or even whether they are male or female; they are simply strangers from around the world, firing bullets at one another and killing one another.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r6","rowIndex":6,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　昔は外国の人とネットでゲームをすると通信の遅れが出てすぐにそうとわかったらしいが、現代では隣のアパートの部屋のケンちゃんと遊ぶのも、世界の裏側のブラジルのなんちゃらと遊ぶのも、ほとんど区別がつかない。","en":"Apparently, playing online with foreigners once produced enough lag to make their location immediately obvious. Nowadays, there is virtually no difference between playing with Kenny in an apartment next door and playing with somebody-or-other in Brazil on the other side of the world.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r7","rowIndex":7,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　隣のアパートにケンちゃんという人がいるかどうか知らんけど。","en":"Not that I know whether anyone named Kenny lives in the apartment building next door.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r8","rowIndex":8,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　このゲームで使われるコミュニケーションは、ゲーム内で用意された定型文チャットで行われるので、言語の壁もない。日本語以外いかなる言語も解さない私でも、世界の誰とでも何不自由なくゲームを遊び興じることが出来るというわけだ。","en":"Communication in this game is conducted through preset chat messages provided within the game, so there is no language barrier either. Even though I understand no language but Japanese, I can play to my heart’s content with anyone in the world without the slightest difficulty.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r9","rowIndex":9,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ちなみに、この素晴らしい現代技術の結晶である高速回線の費用を払っているのは両親だ。私は学校へも行かず、働きもせず、ひたすら好き勝手に遊び惚けて日々を過ごしている。人生における限られた資源である時間というものを、無為に消費し続けている。","en":"Incidentally, my parents pay for this splendid high-speed connection, that marvel of modern technology. I neither attend school nor work, but spend my days idling about and amusing myself however I please. I continue to squander time—that limited resource of human life—in complete futility.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r10","rowIndex":10,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　人間誰しも少しは取り柄というものがある。私はこの手のゲームが結構得意だ。道具は全てプロが使うような遅延のないものであるが、その性能だけに頼っているわけではない。上手く立ち回って有利な状況で戦闘を開始することが出来るし、対等な条件でお互い正面から撃ち合うような場面になってもまず負けない。相手が有利な地形に陣取った時などに、侵入して崩すのが得意だ。チームの状況にもよるけれど、自分が一回殺されるまでの間に、平均２．８人くらいは殺すことが出来る。上位のクラン戦ならともかく、野良なら大体私のいる方のチームが勝つ。","en":"Everyone has at least one thing they are good at. I am fairly good at this kind of game. All my equipment is the lag-free sort professionals use, but I do not rely on its performance alone. I can maneuver well enough to begin fights from an advantageous position, and even if conditions are equal and we end up shooting at each other head-on, I almost never lose. My specialty is infiltrating and breaking up enemy positions when they have entrenched themselves on favorable terrain. It depends on the team, but on average I can kill about 2.8 people for every time I am killed. At the highest level of clan play, things might be different, but in random matches, the team with me on it generally wins.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r11","rowIndex":11,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ネット上でこのゲームの話題をするような場所では、よく自分がゲーム内で使っている名前が出て来る。","en":"In online places where people discuss this game, my in-game name often comes up.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r12","rowIndex":12,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　物事においてほとんど自信というものがない私でも、このゲームの技術に関してだけは、ちょっと評価してやってもいいかなと思っている。","en":"Even though I have almost no confidence in anything, I sometimes think I can give myself a little credit for my skill at this game.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r13","rowIndex":13,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　もちろん、父や母に誇れるようなものでもないが。","en":"Of course, it is nothing I could proudly tell my parents about.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r14","rowIndex":14,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　だけれど今日はどうも調子が悪くて、殺したり殺されたり、勝ったり負けたりを繰り返してしまう。","en":"Today, however, something was wrong. I kept killing and being killed, winning and losing in turn.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r15","rowIndex":15,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それもそのはずだ。今日の私は銃を構えながらも、気がつけば目の前の敵ではなく、全く違うことを考えて、そして気がつけば相手に射殺されてしまうのだ。とても集中が出来ない。","en":"There was a reason. Today, even with my weapon raised, I would realize that I was thinking not about the enemy before me but about something else entirely—and then realize that enemy had shot me dead. I could not concentrate at all.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r16","rowIndex":16,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　嗚呼、余計なことを考えたくなくてゲームを始めたはずなのに、どうして考えてしまうのだろう？","en":"Ah, I started the game because I did not want to think about unnecessary things, so why do I keep thinking about them?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r17","rowIndex":17,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　今頃<tips=44>筱喬</tips>は同じビルに住む知人たちと一緒に<tips=57>滑走路通り</tips>に繰り出している。","en":"By now, <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> is out on <tips=57>Runway Street</tips> with acquaintances who live in the same building.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r18","rowIndex":18,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　街に出るなど、彼女のお父さんがボスだったときは考えられなかったらしいのだが、親戚の<tips=84>マイケル</tips>という人が新しくボスになってからは、規則が緩くなったそうだ。","en":"Apparently, going out into the city was unthinkable while her father was boss, but the rules have been loosened since a relative named <tips=84>Michael</tips> became the new boss.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r19","rowIndex":19,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=44>筱喬</tips>自身はまだお父さんの死の悲しみから抜け出せずふさぎ込んでいて、その変化を喜べるような心境ではない。それを、その新しいボスである<tips=84>マイケル</tips>さんの奥さんだの娘だのが、どうにかして元気づけてやろうと、この外出を計画したという話である。","en":"<tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> herself is still withdrawn, unable to emerge from the grief of her father’s death, and is in no state of mind to welcome the change. Apparently, the new boss <tips=84>Michael’s</tips> wife and daughter planned this outing in hopes of somehow cheering her up.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r20","rowIndex":20,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女の周囲の人はみな彼女のことを心配しており、お兄さんも、ただ外出するだけではなく、いつかは<tips=41>グランドタワー</tips>の外で暮らせるよう取りはからってくれると約束したそうだ。","en":"Everyone around her is worried about her, and her brother has reportedly promised not merely to let her go out, but to arrange for her to live outside <tips=41>Grand Tower</tips> someday.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r21","rowIndex":21,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それは全部<tips=44>筱喬</tips>のためには良いことであろうと思うのだが、私の胸中は複雑だ。","en":"I think all of that is probably good for <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips>, but my feelings are complicated.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r22","rowIndex":22,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=44>筱喬</tips>が自由に外に出られるようになって、そしたら、もう私っていらなくないか？","en":"Once <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> is free to go outside, won’t that make me unnecessary?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r23","rowIndex":23,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女にとって私が特別だったのは、彼女を外に連れ出せる唯一の友人だったからで、その特権がなくなったら、私はすぐにその他大勢に戻ってしまうだろう。彼女自身にそんなつもりがなくとも、自然とそうなってしまうだろう。","en":"I was special to her because I was the only friend who could take her outside. Once that privilege disappeared, I would quickly become just one face in the crowd again. She might have no such intention, but it would happen naturally.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r24","rowIndex":24,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女はあちらの世界では立場のある人間で、その周囲にはたくさんの人間がいる。私というものにこだわる必要はない。それに、なんとなれば人間の心とは流されやすいものなのだ。――なんて感じで、引きこもりである私が、自分を基準にして人間全般を語るのは滑稽だって？　そうかな？　本当にそう思う？　人間の心はけして流されたりしないって、そんなの、どんな経験をしたって誰にも確言できるものではないと思うよ。","en":"She is a person of standing in that world of hers, and there are many people around her. She has no need to remain attached to me. Besides, the human heart is easily swept along. —What? You think it’s ridiculous for a shut-in like me to use myself as the standard and talk about humanity in general? Is that so? Do you really believe that? I don’t think anyone, no matter what they’ve experienced, can declare with certainty that the human heart will never be swept along.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r25","rowIndex":25,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は結局ゲームをやめた。","en":"In the end, I stopped playing.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r26","rowIndex":26,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　こんな茫漠とした気持ちでゲームをやっていてはランクを無駄に下げてしまうし、一緒に遊んでいる他のプレイヤーにも失礼というものだ。","en":"Playing in such a vague, drifting state of mind would only needlessly damage my rank, and it would be rude to the other people playing with me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r27","rowIndex":27,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ゲームは遊びじゃない。","en":"Games are serious business.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r28","rowIndex":28,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして私は上着を着て外へ出た。","en":"I put on a jacket and left the house.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r29","rowIndex":29,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　今日はしとしと雨が降ったり止んだりする不安定な気候。この街ではよくある天気。隣町では晴れているのに、ここだけ雨雲が覆っていることも珍しくない。山や丘のかたちで風の吹き込みがかわって、そういうふうになっているのかしらん。","en":"The weather today is unsettled, a gentle rain starting and stopping. This is common weather in the city. It is not unusual for rain clouds to cover this place alone while the neighboring town is sunny. Maybe the contours of the mountains and hills change the way the wind enters the city and cause it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r30","rowIndex":30,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私としてはもっとたくさん雨が降ってくれた方が気兼ねなく空を飛べるのだけれど、贅沢は言えない。晴れていないだけマシだ。今日はどうしても家にいたくない。私の心がブツブツと呟いている。<tips=44>筱喬</tips>がどうしているのか知りたい。","en":"I would prefer heavier rain so I could fly without worrying about being seen, but I can’t be choosy. At least it isn’t sunny. I absolutely don’t want to stay home today. My heart is muttering away. I want to know what <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> is doing.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r31","rowIndex":31,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　外に出たときばかりは、お父さんの死のことなど忘れて、悲しいことなぞ忘れて、楽しくしていればいいなあ。――と、素直に思えればいいのだけれども、私はいわゆる善人ではないので、心にひっかかるものがある。","en":"If only I could honestly hope that, while she’s out, she forgets her father’s death, forgets all those sad things, and enjoys herself. But I’m not what you’d call a good person, and something still catches at my heart.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r32","rowIndex":32,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　いや、楽しくしてくれるのはいいのだけれども、死を忘れてくれるのもいいのだけれども、彼女が喜ぶその理由に私はこだわっている。","en":"No, it’s fine for her to have fun, and it’s fine for her to forget about death. What I’m hung up on is the reason she’s happy.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r33","rowIndex":33,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　つまり、率直に言うと私以外の誰かによって彼女が元気になるのはいやだってことだ。私の関与していないところで彼女が幸せになっていると、喜ばなくちゃいけないのに嫉妬に似た気持ちで胸が苦しくなる。私が何かすることによって元気になってくれるのなら、一点の曇りもなく幸せを共有出来るのに。","en":"To put it plainly, I hate the thought of someone other than me cheering her up. When she’s happy somewhere I had no part in, my chest aches with something like jealousy even though I ought to rejoice. If something I did were what cheered her up, I could share her happiness without the faintest cloud over my heart.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r34","rowIndex":34,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　さらにひどいことに、どうせ私が関与していないのならば、むしろ「ああ、やっぱり<tips=51>さくら</tips>と一緒じゃないと外にいても全く楽しくないわ」と、暗い顔をしていてくれたほうが嬉しいかもしれない。","en":"Worse still, if I was not going to be involved anyway, I might almost have preferred her to walk around with a gloomy face and say, Ah, of course going outside isn’t any fun at all when I’m not with <tips=51>Sakura</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r35","rowIndex":35,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　とは言うものの、まるきり利己的にもなれない中途半端な私は、実際に<tips=44>筱喬</tips>が暗い顔をしてトボトボ<tips=57>滑走路通り</tips>を歩いているのを見たら、きっと、それはそれで胸が痛むのだろう。嬉しいけれど、胸が痛むのだろう。","en":"On the other hand, I am too halfhearted even to be thoroughly selfish. If I actually saw <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> trudging down <tips=57>Runway Street</tips> with a dark expression, it would surely hurt in its own way. I would be pleased, but it would hurt.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r36","rowIndex":36,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　まったく、どうしろって言うんだ？　自分の感情の仕組みに自己嫌悪する。みなはこのように感じているのを、押し隠して生きているのか、それとも最初からこのようには感じないのか、ちょっと気になるところだ。","en":"Honestly, what am I supposed to do? I loathe the very workings of my own emotions. I find myself wondering whether everyone lives while concealing feelings like these, or whether they simply never feel this way to begin with.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r37","rowIndex":37,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　押し隠しているのだとすれば、みんな、すごいなあ。","en":"If they are concealing them, then everyone is amazing.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r38","rowIndex":38,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　整理がつかぬ感情のまま、私は大空から<tips=44>筱喬</tips>を探す。","en":"With my feelings still in a hopeless tangle, I search the city from high in the sky for <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r39","rowIndex":39,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その居場所を見つけるのは簡単だ。","en":"Finding her location was easy.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r40","rowIndex":40,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　いつだったか、<tips=44>筱喬</tips>の携帯をいじらせて貰ったとき、勝手に私の携帯機器を保護者として登録しておいた。","en":"Once, when <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> let me handle her phone, I secretly registered my own mobile device as her guardian.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r41","rowIndex":41,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　これが何を意味するのかというと、いついかなるときでも彼女が携帯で何をしているのかを監視可能で、なおかつ、その携帯がどこにあるのかも分かってしまうということなのである！","en":"This meant I could monitor anything she did on her phone at any time and determine precisely where the device was!","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r42","rowIndex":42,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　これは我が子を心配する親にとって非常に便利な機能ではあるが、私のようなストーカーにとっても非常に有用なシステムである。そして考えてみれば、親とストーカーには近似性があるなと気がついてみたり。","en":"A highly convenient feature for a parent worried about a child—and an exceptionally useful system for a stalker like me. Come to think of it, parents and stalkers do have certain similarities.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r43","rowIndex":43,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　機械に疎い<tips=44>筱喬</tips>はそんなおそろしい設定がされたとはつゆ知らず、誰にも見られていないと思って、男性アイドルのウェブ日記を読みあさったり、犬や猫の動画を閲覧したりしている。性的なサイトを見ていないのが驚きである。ある時、半日間も「糸こんにゃく」について調べていたのは意味不明で面白かった。","en":"Technologically inept <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> has no idea that such a horrifying setting was enabled. Believing no one is watching, she devours male idols’ blogs and watches videos of dogs and cats. It is surprising that she never visits sexual sites. Once, however, she spent half a day researching shirataki noodles, which was baffling and amusing.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r44","rowIndex":44,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女の誰にも知られないプライベートを知る喜びはあるけれど、もしこれが本人に知られたら私が積み重ねてきた信用が全て消失してしまうだろう。折を見て設定を解除しなくてはいけないが、これがなかなかやめられない。","en":"There is pleasure in knowing about the private life she reveals to no one, but if she ever discovered this, all the trust I have built up would vanish. I need to disable the setting when the opportunity arises, but I cannot seem to give it up.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r45","rowIndex":45,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　さて、そういうわけで私はネックストラップで胸元にぶら下がった携帯画面を確認しつつ彼女のもとへ向かう。","en":"And so, checking the screen of the phone hanging at my chest from a neck strap, I headed toward her.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r46","rowIndex":46,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=44>筱喬</tips>から事前に聞いた話では、午前中から出かけて、映画を観て、昼食をとり、そして街をぷらぷらしてから帰るということだった。","en":"<tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> had told me in advance that they would leave in the morning, watch a movie, have lunch, wander around the city, and then return.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r47","rowIndex":47,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　この時間は多分買い物をしているんじゃなかろうか。と、思っていたのだけれど、彼女の携帯の発信地は繁華街のなかではなく、少し裏道に入ったところなのである。この街の裏道は例外なく治安が悪く、気軽にうろつくような場所ではない。<tips=41>グランドタワー</tips>と<tips=57>滑走路通り</tips>の間くらいの場所だから、もしかして、もう帰ろうとしているのだろうか？　いや動いていないから、移動ではなく、休憩でもしているのか。","en":"I had figured she would probably be shopping at this hour. But the signal from her phone was coming not from the commercial district, but from a little way down a back street. Every back street in this city is dangerous without exception, hardly the sort of place one strolls into casually. Since it was roughly halfway between <tips=41>Grand Tower</tips> and <tips=57>Runway Street</tips>, perhaps they were already on their way back? No, it was not moving, so perhaps they were not traveling but had stopped to rest.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r48","rowIndex":48,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　いずれにしろそのあたりは<tips=42>サイキック探知機</tips>の密集地だ。近づきすぎると音が鳴る。","en":"In any event, that area was thick with <tips=42>psychic detectors</tips>. If I got too close, they would sound an alarm.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r49","rowIndex":49,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それでもある程度は近づかないと状況を把握出来ない。私は、探知機のリスクをとって空から近づくか、歩いて地上から近づくか、少し考えてから、空から行くことにした。","en":"Even so, I had to get within a certain range to understand what was happening. I considered whether to risk the detectors and approach by air or walk in along the ground, then decided to fly.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r50","rowIndex":50,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　地上からの方が気づかれにくいとは思うが、相手の足は車だし、移動されたら追いつけない。それに、テクテク歩くのはめんどくさい。世間の人たちは、よくもまあ自分の足を使って歩いているものだと思う。","en":"I thought an approach on the ground would be harder to notice, but they had a car. If they moved, I could never catch up. Besides, trudging along on foot was tiresome. I marveled that the people of the world could stand using their own legs to walk.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r51","rowIndex":51,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=42>サイキック探知機</tips>は横方向の探索範囲は広いが、縦方向にはそれほどではない。私のように空を飛ぶ能力者は想定していないのかもしれない。この仕様を日常的に気にしているのは私くらいだろうから、よく知っている。その辺りのビルの頭より高く飛んでいれば、まあ警報が鳴ることはないだろう。それくらい近づければ充分だ。","en":"<tips=42>Psychic detectors</tips> have a wide horizontal search range, but much less vertical reach. Perhaps they were not designed with psychics like me who can fly in mind. I am probably the only person who routinely has to care about this quirk, so I know it well. As long as I flew above the roofs of the surrounding buildings, the alarms probably would not sound. Getting that close would be enough.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r52","rowIndex":52,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　携帯の発信地はちょっとした雑木林のすぐ隣で、双眼鏡で覗くとその辺りには黒塗りの高級車が一台停まっている。おそらく、あれに乗っているに違いない。","en":"The signal came from beside a small grove. Through the binoculars, I saw a single black luxury car parked nearby. That had to be the one they were in.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r53","rowIndex":53,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　何をしているのだろう？","en":"What were they doing?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r54","rowIndex":54,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ぼうっと眺めていても、ちっとも動き出す気配がないのである。異常事態かもしれない。","en":"I kept watching, but it showed no sign whatsoever of moving. This might be an emergency.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r55","rowIndex":55,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私はちょっと気になって、直接電話をしてみることにした。素知らぬふりをして、それとなく状況を探るのである。それと、<tips=84>マイケル</tips>さんの家族たちの前でも、私からの電話をとれるのかどうかというのを確かめたいという、ちょっと意地悪な気持ちもあった。","en":"A little concerned, I decided to call her directly. I would pretend to know nothing and casually sound out the situation. A slightly mean-spirited part of me also wanted to find out whether she could answer a call from me in front of <tips=84>Michael’s</tips> family.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r56","rowIndex":56,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　コールをするが、<tips=44>筱喬</tips>はなかなかとらない。","en":"I called, but it took <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> a while to answer.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r57","rowIndex":57,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　やっぱりそうだよね。楽しい外出中に、私の電話などとれぬよね。私の優先順位はそれらより下なのだよね。","en":"Of course. She couldn’t very well answer a call from me in the middle of an enjoyable outing. All of that came before me in her order of priorities, didn’t it?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r58","rowIndex":58,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　気持ちがどんよりとしはじめたころ、双眼鏡の向こうで車のドアがあき、<tips=44>筱喬</tips>が外に出る。彼女は携帯を手に持っていて……あっ、私からの電話をとってくれるようだ。","en":"Just as my mood began to sink, I saw through my binoculars that the car door had opened and <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> was getting out. Her phone was in her hand... Ah! She was going to take my call.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r59","rowIndex":59,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"『もしもし』","en":"‘Hello?’","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r60","rowIndex":60,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その声は嫌そうなものではなく、私はほっとする。","en":"There was no reluctance in her voice, and I felt relieved.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r61","rowIndex":61,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なんか電話したくなっちゃって。……迷惑？」","en":"“I just felt like calling you. ...Am I bothering you?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r62","rowIndex":62,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"『ううん、そんなことないよ。なんだか人混みにいたら目眩がしちゃって、休んでたの。本当は帰りたいんだけど、なんだか<tips=41>グランドタワー</tips>で何かがあったみたいで、連絡するまで帰って来るなって……』","en":"‘No, not at all. The crowd made me feel dizzy, so I was resting. I really want to go home, but something seems to have happened at <tips=41>Grand Tower</tips>. They told us not to come back until they call...’","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r63","rowIndex":63,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「何か？」","en":"“Something?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r64","rowIndex":64,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"『うん、詳しいことは教えてくれない。ボディーガードで一緒に来てくれてる人に連絡があったんだけど、ただ待機しなきゃいけないって言うだけで、怖い顔をして黙っちゃってる。奥様が聞いても駄目で……すごい不安だったから、<tips=51>さくら</tips>の声を聞けて良かった』","en":"‘Yes. They won’t tell me the details. The bodyguard who came along with us received a message, but he only says we have to wait here. He’s gone quiet and looks frightening. Even Madam can’t get him to explain... I was terribly anxious, so I’m glad I could hear <tips=51>Sakura’s</tips> voice.’","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r65","rowIndex":65,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　双眼鏡越しに見る彼女は、うつむき加減だ。私は上空からそれを見ているため、表情を見ることは出来ない。","en":"Through the binoculars, I saw her with her head lowered. From my position above, I could not see her expression.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r66","rowIndex":66,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「何があったのかな……ひとっ飛びして<tips=41>グランドタワー</tips>の方見てこよっか？」","en":"“I wonder what happened... Should I fly over and take a quick look at <tips=41>Grand Tower</tips>?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r67","rowIndex":67,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"『それはだめだよ！　きっと、何かこわいことが起きてるんだ。<tips=41>グランドタワー</tips>のこと考えると、ゾワゾワと変な感じがするの……』","en":"‘You mustn’t! Something frightening must be happening. When I think about <tips=41>Grand Tower</tips>, I get this strange creeping feeling...’","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r68","rowIndex":68,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「わかった……」","en":"“All right...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r69","rowIndex":69,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は低い声でそうこたえる。","en":"I answered in a low voice.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r70","rowIndex":70,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"『だめだよ。絶対に、近づいたらだめだよ。<tips=51>さくら</tips>って、わかったって言っても、いつもわかってないでしょ？　だめって言ったら、だめなんだからね』","en":"‘No. You absolutely must not go near it. <tips=51>Sakura</tips>, whenever you say you understand, you never really do, do you? When I say no, I mean no.’","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r71","rowIndex":71,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私の性格をよく理解しているのが嬉しい。","en":"I was glad she understood my personality so well.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r72","rowIndex":72,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「本当にわかったよ。大丈夫」","en":"“I really do understand. Don’t worry.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r73","rowIndex":73,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"『ねえ<tips=51>さくら</tips>。<tips=44>シウ</tips>ね……あっ』","en":"‘Hey, <tips=51>Sakura</tips>. <tips=44>Siu</tips> was just... Ah.’","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r74","rowIndex":74,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　車のドアが開いて、革のブルゾンを身につけた体格の良い男が降りて来る。このイカツイのが<tips=44>筱喬</tips>のボディーガードだろう。","en":"The car door opened, and a large, powerfully built man in a leather jacket stepped out. This intimidating specimen must have been <tips=44>Siu-kiu’s</tips> bodyguard.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r75","rowIndex":75,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=44>筱喬</tips>はそれに、電話のマイク付近を押さえて対応し、","en":"<tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> covered her phone’s microphone as she responded to him, then said,","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r76","rowIndex":76,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"『……ごめん！　雨で濡れるから車のなかにいろって。一旦切るね』","en":"‘...Sorry! He says I’ll get wet, so I have to get back in the car. I’m hanging up for now.’","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r77","rowIndex":77,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そうして通話が終わる。","en":"The call ended.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r78","rowIndex":78,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　確かに、ぽつりぽつりと雨が降り出している。","en":"Raindrops had indeed begun to fall here and there.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r79","rowIndex":79,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　さて、<tips=44>筱喬</tips>にはああ言ったけれど、もちろん危険だという理由で一度芽生えた好奇心をおさえつけられる私ではない。何があったって別に、私には失うものなんかありゃしないのである。丁度おあつらえ向きに雨が降ってくれたから、<tips=41>グランドタワー</tips>を見に行こう。","en":"Now, I had told <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> that, but of course I was not the sort of person who could suppress a newly awakened curiosity merely because there was danger involved. Whatever happened, I had nothing to lose. And right on cue, the rain had begun to fall. I would go take a look at <tips=41>Grand Tower</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r80","rowIndex":80,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして、まっすぐ天にそびえるその建物へ向かおうとしたところで、足元からけたたましいサイレンが響く。","en":"Just as I prepared to head for the building that towered straight into the heavens, a piercing siren erupted beneath me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r81","rowIndex":81,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私か？　いや、この高度ならひっかかるはずはない。それに、さっきから私はずっと動いていない。こちらから近づいてはいないのだから、探知機の方からこちらに近づかなければ鳴るはずもなく、そんなことはありえない。","en":"Was it me? No. I should not have tripped it at this altitude. Besides, I had been stationary this entire time. Since I had not approached it, the alarm could sound only if the detector itself approached me, and that was impossible.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r82","rowIndex":82,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　つまり、私以外の誰かが<tips=16>タイプA</tips>能力を使った。","en":"In other words, someone other than me had used a <tips=16>Type A</tips> ability.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r83","rowIndex":83,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その結論に辿り着くのとほぼ同時に、<tips=44>筱喬</tips>の車の方から銃声が聞こえる。","en":"Almost as soon as I reached that conclusion, gunshots came from the direction of <tips=44>Siu-kiu’s</tips> car.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r84","rowIndex":84,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私がそちらを振り向いたとき、すでに事態は発生していた。","en":"By the time I turned to look, it had already happened.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r85","rowIndex":85,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　見慣れぬ金髪の少女が<tips=44>筱喬</tips>の腕を掴んでいる。そしてその足元には血みどろの腕が、頭が、バラバラになった死体が転がっている。……さっきの革ジャンボディーガード。","en":"An unfamiliar blond girl had <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> by the arm. At her feet lay a blood-soaked arm, a head, and the scattered pieces of a corpse. ...The bodyguard in the leather jacket.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r86","rowIndex":86,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　目を離したのは一瞬のはずなのに、こんな惨状になってしまっているのはなぜ？","en":"I could only have looked away for an instant, so why had the scene already become such carnage?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r87","rowIndex":87,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　心臓の鼓動が激しくなる私の目の前で、少女は<tips=44>筱喬</tips>にしがみつこうとし、<tips=44>筱喬</tips>はそれを振りほどいて逃げようとし、もみ合うような格好になっている。","en":"My heart pounded as the girl tried to cling to <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> before my eyes. <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> tried to shake her off and escape, leaving them locked in a struggle.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r88","rowIndex":88,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　どうしよう？　どうしよう？　考えていると、ついに少女が<tips=44>筱喬</tips>を抱きかかえるような姿勢をとり、そして次の瞬間、二人の姿は細い木の枝に変身した。","en":"What do I do? What do I do? While I was still thinking, the girl finally managed to wrap <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> in an embrace, and the next instant, both of them transformed into a slender tree branch.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r89","rowIndex":89,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　これはっ、忍法変わり身の術？","en":"Was this the Ninja Art of Substitution?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r90","rowIndex":90,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　混乱していると、傍らの林からガサガサと音がする。見ると、一本の木がゆっくりと倒れようとしている。音は、葉や枝が周りの木と擦れて生まれたものだ。そして、倒れてゆく木の根元あたりに、<tips=44>筱喬</tips>と金髪忍者少女の二人の姿が見えた。","en":"As I stood there confused, a rustling came from the grove beside them. I looked and saw a tree slowly beginning to fall. The sound came from its leaves and branches scraping against the surrounding trees. At the base of the falling tree, I could see <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> and the blond ninja girl.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r91","rowIndex":91,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　移動するところが見えなかった。瞬間移動か？","en":"I did not see them move. Teleportation?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r92","rowIndex":92,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　とにかく見失ってはいけない。","en":"Whatever happened, I could not lose sight of them.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r93","rowIndex":93,"pageCtrl":"","jp":" そちらへ向かおうとすると、二人はすぐにまた消える。","en":"As I started toward them, the two immediately disappeared again.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r94","rowIndex":94,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　今度はどこへ移動したのかわからない。見つからない。","en":"This time I had no idea where they had moved. I could not find them.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r95","rowIndex":95,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　まずいまずいまずい！　ボディーガードを一瞬でバラバラにした何者かに、<tips=44>筱喬</tips>がさらわれようとしている。どうにかしなければいけないが、この状況で何が出来る？　嗚呼、うるさい！　警報がけたたましく鳴り続けている。","en":"This is bad, bad, bad! <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> is being abducted by someone who tore a bodyguard to pieces in an instant. I have to do something, but what can I do in this situation? Ah, shut up! The alarm is still screaming.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r96","rowIndex":96,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　とにかく、情報が必要だ。","en":"First of all, I need information.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r97","rowIndex":97,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私はありったけの早さで<tips=44>筱喬</tips>たちの車の上まで飛び、状況を確認する。","en":"I flew as fast as I could to a point above <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> and the others’ car, then surveyed the scene.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r98","rowIndex":98,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　断裂した手足が真っ赤な血の海のなかに転がっているのを見ると気がおかしくなりそうだが、おかしくなってる場合じゃない。何かヒントはないか？　おや、車のなかから子供の泣き声が聞こえる。……あれは<tips=84>マイケル</tips>さんの娘の声だろうか。","en":"The sight of severed limbs lying in a sea of bright-red blood threatened to drive me mad, but I had no time to go mad. Was there any clue? Oh—a child was crying inside the car. ...Was that <tips=84>Michael’s</tips> daughter?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r99","rowIndex":99,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　もう探知機を気にしている場合ではない。私は一旦地上へ降りる。","en":"This was no time to worry about the detectors. I descended to the ground for the moment.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r100","rowIndex":100,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　いつの間にか本降りになっていた雨に打たれるバラバラ死体は、内臓などがこぼれ、そこから湯気が立っていた。","en":"The dismembered corpse lay in the rain, which had somehow become a downpour. Its entrails had spilled out, and steam rose from them.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r101","rowIndex":101,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして、二人がいた場所に残された木の枝。太さからすると、枝ではなく幹のようだ。二人が林の中へ移動して、そして木が倒れ、彼女たちが元いた場所にはかわりにこんなものが現れた。","en":"Then there was the piece of wood left where the two girls had stood. Judging by its thickness, it looked more like part of a trunk than a branch. The two had moved into the grove, the tree had fallen, and this had appeared in their place.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r102","rowIndex":102,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　車の中には泣きじゃくる幼子を抱く女の姿がある。これが、奥さんと娘さんだろう。","en":"Inside the car was a woman holding a sobbing young child. Presumably, these were the wife and daughter.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r103","rowIndex":103,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「無事ですか？」","en":"“Are you all right?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r104","rowIndex":104,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私を見つめて呆然としてる奥さんに尋ねる。","en":"I asked the woman, who stared at me in shock.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r105","rowIndex":105,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「二人とも、怪我はありませんか？」","en":"“Are either of you hurt?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r106","rowIndex":106,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　もう一度問い直すと、二人はこくこくと頷く。","en":"When I repeated the question, both nodded several times.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r107","rowIndex":107,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　見た感じ怪我はない。とりあえず二人は無事らしい。しかし、肝心の<tips=44>筱喬</tips>はどこへ？　襲撃が一瞬だったことを思えば、彼女から情報を得るのは難しいだろう。","en":"They showed no visible injuries. For the moment, they appeared unharmed. But the crucial question was where <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> had gone. Given how instantaneous the attack had been, it would probably be difficult to get any information from the woman.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r108","rowIndex":108,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「だれか、<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>の人に連絡して下さい」","en":"“Someone, please contact <tips=7>YS</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r109","rowIndex":109,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それだけ言い残して、私はまた空へと舞い上がったのだけれど――ここで、ふと気がついた。えっ、私、何をするつもりなんだ？　いま、あの殺人サイキックから<tips=44>筱喬</tips>を追跡するつもりみたいだけれど、正気？　あの一瞬でバラバラ死体を作り上げたやつを相手に何が出来るっていうんだ。そんなことしたら、私もこの目の前のボディーガードみたいにバラバラになってしまうじゃないか。だって<tips=51>さくら</tips>さん、あなた、サイキックって言ったって空を飛ぶことしか出来ないのでしょう。瞬間移動に比べてあきらかに劣っている。","en":"With that, I rose into the air again—and then something suddenly occurred to me. Wait, what exactly am I planning to do? I seem to be about to pursue <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> and that murderous psychic, but have I lost my mind? What could I possibly do against someone who made a dismembered corpse in an instant? If I tried, I might end up in pieces like the bodyguard before me. Be reasonable, <tips=51>Sakura</tips>. You may be a psychic, but all you can do is fly. That is obviously inferior to teleportation.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r110","rowIndex":110,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おそらく、どう考えてもまともな判断じゃない。頭ではわかっているのに、あら不思議、私の身体は自動的に空中を飛び回り、私の目は知らぬ間に消えた二人を探している。","en":"By any rational measure, this was probably not a sound decision. I knew that perfectly well, yet—wonders never cease—my body flew through the air all by itself, and before I knew it, I was scanning for the vanished pair.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r111","rowIndex":111,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は顔にあたる雨粒が痛くなるほどの早さでそのあたりを旋回し、<tips=44>筱喬</tips>の姿を探す。とにかく、探して、そして見つけて、後から来る<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>の人に連絡するまで見張っているか……もし、そんなに待つことが出来なければ、出来なければ、どうすればいいのだろう？","en":"I circled the area so quickly that the raindrops hurt my face, searching for <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips>. For now, I would search, find them, and keep watch until I could contact the <tips=7>YS</tips> people when they arrived... But if I couldn’t wait that long—if I couldn’t, what was I supposed to do?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r112","rowIndex":112,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　心は定かではないが、とにかく余計なことを考えている場合じゃない。私が出来ることを考えよう。","en":"I had no clear idea what I intended to do, but this was no time for extraneous thoughts. I had to think about what I could do.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r113","rowIndex":113,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　上空から見ていたものを素直に信じるならば、相手の能力はテレポーテーション。自分の肉体は一瞬で他の場所へ移動し、移動先にあったものは問答無用でこちらにやってくる。移動というよりも、離れた空間を交換する能力というべきなのだろうか？　あの木の幹は相手の攻撃方法の大きなヒントになった。あれを木じゃなく、人にやるとどうなるか。たとえば人の上半身に重なるように移動すれば、相手の上半身だけこちらに移動し、下半身はその場に残ることになり、結果として切断される。現場にあったバラバラ死体はそうやって生まれたのだろう。","en":"If I took what I had seen from above at face value, the other girl’s ability was teleportation. Her body moved instantaneously to another place, while whatever occupied her destination was sent back here, no questions asked. Or rather than movement, should I call it an ability that exchanged two distant spaces? That tree trunk was a major clue to how she attacked. What would happen if she did that not to a tree, but to a person? If, for example, she moved so as to overlap someone’s upper body, only the victim’s upper body would move here while the lower body remained in place, severing them as a result. That must have been how the dismembered corpse at the scene was created.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r114","rowIndex":114,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　よし、いいぞ。冷静に推論が出来ている。","en":"Good. Excellent. I’m reasoning calmly.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r115","rowIndex":115,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　さて、能力の質はわかった。では、その能力の強度はどの程度のものか？　どれくらいの距離を、何回飛ぶことが出来るのか。","en":"So, I understood the nature of the ability. But how powerful was it? How far could she jump, and how many times?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r116","rowIndex":116,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　あんな近くの林の中にあらわれたのは、あまり遠くへ飛べないからか？　少なくとも、どこかの隠れ家までぱっと移動出来るような能力ではなさそうだ。――だとすれば、まだ近くにいる可能性が高い――。警報、一旦止まってくれないかな。こんなにずっと鳴り続けていると、どこで能力を使われたかわからないじゃないか。","en":"Had she appeared in that nearby grove because she could not jump very far? At the very least, it did not seem to be an ability that could whisk her straight to some hideout. If so, there was a strong chance she was still nearby. Could the alarm stop for a moment? If it kept sounding this whole time, I would never know where she used her ability.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r117","rowIndex":117,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そう考えていると、遠くから声がきこえて来る。","en":"As I considered that, I heard a voice in the distance.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r118","rowIndex":118,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「やめてっ！」","en":"“Stop!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r119","rowIndex":119,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　間違いない。<tips=44>筱喬</tips>だ。","en":"There was no mistaking it. <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r120","rowIndex":120,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　視線を巡らすと、林からさらに三十メートルほど離れた住宅の敷地のなかに、やはりさっきと同じようにもみあう<tips=44>筱喬</tips>と少女の姿を見つける。少女の方は血まみれで、それが<tips=44>筱喬</tips>の白い服を汚している。","en":"I swept my gaze around and found <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> and the girl struggling just as before in the yard of a house some thirty meters beyond the grove. The girl was covered with blood, which was staining <tips=44>Siu-kiu’s</tips> white clothes.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r121","rowIndex":121,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　――これを、誰か助けが来るまで見守っているなんて、私には出来ないな。","en":"—I can’t simply sit and watch this until someone comes to help.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r122","rowIndex":122,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　やっぱり、救出作戦と行くか。","en":"A rescue operation it was, then.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r123","rowIndex":123,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　相手の能力がある程度わかったような気がするが、やっぱり私の能力ではかなり分が悪い。","en":"I felt as though I understood the other girl’s ability to some extent, but my own still left me at a severe disadvantage.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r124","rowIndex":124,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　単純な移動力でも負けているし、こちらは殺傷力など皆無なのに比べて相手は一撃必殺だ。まともにやったら勝ち目がない。――ボディーガードは拳銃を持っていたはずだ。あれを持ってくればよかっただろうか？　いや、今からでも引き返してとってくる？","en":"Even in sheer mobility, she outmatched me. I had no lethal force at all, while she could kill with a single blow. I had no chance in a direct confrontation. —The bodyguard must have carried a handgun. Should I have brought it? Could I still turn around and retrieve it?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r125","rowIndex":125,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　一瞬迷ったけれども、やっぱりいらない。そんなことをしてる間に完全に相手を見失ってしまうかもしれないし、そもそも、ゲームのなかでしか銃を使ったことがない私に上手く扱えるはずもない。当たるはずもない拳銃に頼るのは危険だ。","en":"I hesitated for an instant, then rejected the idea. I might lose her completely while wasting time on that, and there was no chance I could handle a real gun well when I had only ever used one in games. Relying on a handgun I could not possibly aim was dangerous.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r126","rowIndex":126,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　いまの私が相手に勝っているところを探そう。まず、こちらが先に相手を見つけている上に、その能力も既に見せて貰っている。これはとても大事なアドバンテージだ。戦局を左右するのはいつだって情報だ。私が普段やっているゲームだったら、先に相手を見つけた方がほぼ勝利する。","en":"I had to find the ways in which I currently held the advantage. First, I had found her before she found me, and she had already shown me her ability. That was an extremely important advantage. Information always decides the course of battle. In the game I usually played, whoever spotted the enemy first almost always won.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r127","rowIndex":127,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ゲームなら躊躇なく攻撃するところだ。だって、もたもたすればするほど、相手が情報を得る確率が高くなり、せっかく得たアドバンテージが失われるだけだからね。――でも、ゲームのように見つけた敵をボタン一つで即射殺する力は現実の私にはないのだ。そもそも攻撃の手段自体がない。","en":"In a game, this would be the moment to attack without hesitation. The longer I dawdled, the greater the chance that the enemy would gain information, and the more of my hard-won advantage I would lose. —But in reality, I had no button that would instantly shoot a discovered enemy dead. I had no means of attacking at all.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r128","rowIndex":128,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　戦闘を避けて、うまく<tips=44>筱喬</tips>だけを連れ去れればベストなのだが、ああもみ合っているのを、どうやって引き剥がすか。それとも、うまく攻撃するべきなのか？","en":"Avoiding a fight and somehow getting <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> away on her own would be best, but how could I pull them apart while they were struggling like that? Or should I find some way to attack?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r129","rowIndex":129,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それほど長く悩んでいたわけではないが、考えている間に二人の姿はまた消える。そして今度はむこうの路地裏に現れた。金髪の少女は<tips=44>筱喬</tips>にしがみつきながら、ぜえぜえはあはあと肩で息をしている。","en":"I had not deliberated for very long, but while I was thinking, the two disappeared again. This time they appeared in another alley. The blond girl clung to <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips>, her shoulders heaving as she gasped for breath.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r130","rowIndex":130,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　能力を使えば、多かれ少なかれ体力を使う。あのサイキックがどれくらいの体力で、どれくらいの距離を移動出来るのかは知らない。しかし、すぐに次の移動をせずに、休憩を挟みながら飛んでいるところを見ると、今はフルに能力を使える体力がないのかもしれない。","en":"Using an ability consumed physical energy to some degree. I had no idea how much stamina this psychic possessed or how far she could travel. But since she did not teleport again at once and instead jumped with rests in between, perhaps she currently lacked the stamina to use her full power.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r131","rowIndex":131,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　さっきも今回も移動距離は三十メートル前後だった。そのあたりが、今のあいつの移動限界――つまり攻撃範囲と考えていいのだろうか？　――一度の能力使用によって移動出来る距離がその程度で、しかも使うごとに休憩が必要ならば、私の能力が全面的に劣っているわけでもないのかな。私はある程度の速度までならほとんど疲れない。限界まで速度を出せば多少は疲労するが、疲れたとしても降りる必要がなく、ゆっくり飛んだまま回復することが出来る。とにかく燃費がいい。","en":"Both of her jumps had covered about thirty meters. Could I regard that as her present limit—and therefore her attack range? If each use carried her only that far and required rest afterward, perhaps my ability was not inferior in every respect. Up to a certain speed, flying barely tired me at all. Reaching my maximum speed caused some fatigue, but even then I did not need to land; I could recover while continuing to fly slowly. My fuel efficiency was excellent, at any rate.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r132","rowIndex":132,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　つまり、<tips=44>筱喬</tips>を奪還した後、なんとか相手の一撃必殺の距離を脱してマラソンに持ち込むことが出来れば、そのまま私が逃げ切れるということだ。","en":"In other words, if I recovered <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips>, somehow escaped the range of the girl’s one-hit kill, and turned the chase into a marathon, I could get away.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r133","rowIndex":133,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　もちろん、どうやって<tips=44>筱喬</tips>を手に入れて、そこまで離れられるかが一番の問題なんだけれども――。","en":"The greatest problem, of course, was how to get hold of <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> and put that much distance between us and the girl—","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r134","rowIndex":134,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そう考えている間に、彼女はまたジャンプする。そして、別の裏路地に姿を現す。人気のないところを選んでいるあたり、ある程度の土地勘はあるのだろう。――こっちの方向は、<tips=59>暗闇通り</tips>に向かってる？","en":"While I was thinking, the girl jumped again and appeared in another back alley. The way she kept choosing deserted places suggested some familiarity with the area. —Was she heading toward <tips=59>Darkness Street</tips>?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r135","rowIndex":135,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　このまま空から尾行して、相手のアジトを見つけ、そこで油断したところにしかけるというのは？　――いや、それはよくない。狭い屋内ではこちらの能力が活かせず、あきらかに相手が有利だ。不意打ちで相手を行動不能に出来るのなら別だが――ああ、それをやるんだったら拳銃を持って来れば良かったな。でも、ない以上はこれでやるしかない。――とにかく、仕掛けるなら開けた場所だ。そうじゃないと、逃げ切ることさえ出来ない。とすると、助け出すのなら、辿り着く前にしかけなくちゃいけないのか――。","en":"What if I followed from the air, found her hideout, and struck once she let down her guard? —No, that was no good. In cramped indoor spaces I could not take advantage of my ability, and she would hold the obvious advantage. It would be different if I could incapacitate her with a surprise attack—ah, if I meant to do that, I should have brought the handgun. But since I did not have it, I had to make do with what I had. —In any event, if I made my move, it had to be in an open place. Otherwise, I could not even escape. Which meant that if I intended to rescue her, I had to act before they reached the hideout—","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r136","rowIndex":136,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　きっと、アジトを発見出来るのなら、そのまま見張って<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>の誰かに連絡をするというのが一番確実なんだろうけれど、でも、救出が来る前にアジトで<tips=44>筱喬</tips>が殺されるようなことになったら、おそらく私はもう一生立ち直れない。私が失敗しても、きっと、私が死ぬだけで済む。","en":"Surely the safest course, if I could locate the hideout, would be to watch it and contact someone from <tips=7>YS</tips>. But if <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> were killed inside before rescue arrived, I would probably never recover for the rest of my life. Even if I failed, surely only I would have to die.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r137","rowIndex":137,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　やっぱり、やるしかないな。","en":"I had no choice. I had to do it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r138","rowIndex":138,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は自分の予想を信じて、三十メートル前後の距離を意識しながら、空中からもみ合う二人に近づいた。","en":"I chose to trust my estimate and approached the struggling pair from the air, keeping the roughly thirty meters between us constantly in mind.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r139","rowIndex":139,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　三十メートルは相当近い。けれども、人はなかなか頭上を警戒しないものだし、この雨空では私の影が落ちることもない。","en":"Thirty meters was remarkably close. But people rarely thought to look overhead, and under these rain clouds, I cast no shadow.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r140","rowIndex":140,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　雨はいつだって私の味方だ。視界を悪くして私の姿を隠し、大地を濡らして私の身体から流れ落ちる液体を隠してくれる。","en":"Rain was always my ally. It ruined visibility and hid my form; it soaked the earth and concealed the fluid falling from my body.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r141","rowIndex":141,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　とは言え、何かの拍子に少女が見上げればすぐに気がつくだろう。そして気づかれたらもう近づくことは出来ない。一種の賭けだが、しかしこうしなければ<tips=44>筱喬</tips>を助け出すことは出来ない。","en":"Even so, if the girl happened to look up, she would notice me immediately, and once she noticed me, I could no longer approach. It was a gamble, but I could not rescue <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> any other way.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r142","rowIndex":142,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　近くにあった建物の屋上におりたち、床にしゃがみ込んで半分姿を隠すようにして二人を観察する。","en":"I landed on the roof of a nearby building, crouched down, and watched the pair with half my body concealed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r143","rowIndex":143,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　すぐにチャンスはやって来る。","en":"The opportunity came almost immediately.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r144","rowIndex":144,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「やめてっ！」","en":"“Stop!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r145","rowIndex":145,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=44>筱喬</tips>が大きな声を出し、両腕をつっぱって少女を突き飛ばした。","en":"<tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> shouted and thrust out both arms, shoving the girl away.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r146","rowIndex":146,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　思いの外に強い力で少女ははじき飛ばされ、背後の塀に激突する。すごいぞ、私もびっくりするほど力持ちだ！","en":"The girl went flying with more force than I had expected and slammed into the wall behind her. Amazing—even I was surprised by how strong she was!","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r147","rowIndex":147,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして<tips=44>筱喬</tips>はひらりと踵を返して同行者を残した車の方向へ走り出す。少女は起き上がるのに手間取っている。","en":"<tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> spun gracefully on her heel and ran toward the car where her companions remained. The girl struggled to rise.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r148","rowIndex":148,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　今しかない！　心の準備はまだ出来ていなかったが、私はありったけの速度で<tips=44>筱喬</tips>に近づく。","en":"Now or never! I was not mentally prepared yet, but I flew toward <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> as fast as I could.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r149","rowIndex":149,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=44>筱喬</tips>の走るのはびっくりするほど早いが、私の飛ぶ速度はそれを凌駕している。","en":"<tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> ran with astonishing speed, but I could fly faster still.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r150","rowIndex":150,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=44>筱喬</tips>！」","en":"“<tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips>!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r151","rowIndex":151,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　近づきながら呼びかけると、彼女は振り返る。","en":"I called to her as I approached, and she looked back.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r152","rowIndex":152,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その目は、<tips=17>タイプB</tips>の力が活性化している証として金色に輝いている。","en":"Her eyes shone gold, a sign that her <tips=17>Type B</tips> power had become active.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r153","rowIndex":153,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そうか、だから、あんなに力強く相手を突き飛ばし、これほど早く走ることが出来るのか。","en":"So that was how she had pushed her opponent with such force and could run this quickly.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r154","rowIndex":154,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「さく……んっ！」","en":"“Saku—mmph!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r155","rowIndex":155,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は少し速度を落として彼女を両腕でキャッチしたが、それでもぶつかるときは多少衝撃があった。","en":"I slowed slightly and caught her in both arms. Even then, the collision jarred us.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r156","rowIndex":156,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　抱きしめると、<tips=44>筱喬</tips>の身体からは、少女からうつされた血のにおいがする。","en":"As I held <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips>, I smelled the other girl’s blood on her body.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r157","rowIndex":157,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「私にしっかり掴まって」","en":"“Hold on to me tightly.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r158","rowIndex":158,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=44>筱喬</tips>の耳元に小さく呟くと、彼女の両腕が私に絡みつく。","en":"I whispered softly into <tips=44>Siu-kiu’s</tips> ear, and her arms wound around me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r159","rowIndex":159,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=17>タイプB</tips>の腕力ならば、きっと落ちずに掴んでいられるだろう。私は遠慮せずに可能な限りの速度を出すことにした。","en":"With <tips=17>Type B</tips> strength, she would surely be able to hold on without falling. I stopped holding back and accelerated as much as I could.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r160","rowIndex":160,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　空に向かって急上昇をする。地面の少女はやっと立ち上がるところだ。そして、四方を見回す。いいぞ、そのまま地上を探し続けろ。普通だったら上に逃げたとは思わないはずだ。","en":"I climbed steeply into the sky. On the ground, the girl had only just managed to stand and was looking in every direction. Good—keep searching the ground. Normally, she would never imagine that we had escaped upward.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r161","rowIndex":161,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　この時点で私は彼女との間に三十メートル以上の距離を確保出来ていた。ひとまず安全圏に逃れたと、ほっと溜息をつきたくなったが、それは出来なかった。勘がいいのか、すぐに少女は上空の私に気がつき、こちらを見たのだ。","en":"By then I had secured more than thirty meters of distance between us. I wanted to sigh in relief and believe we had reached temporary safety, but I could not. Perhaps she had good instincts, because the girl soon noticed me above and looked directly at me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r162","rowIndex":162,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして、目が合ってしまった。","en":"And then our eyes met.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r163","rowIndex":163,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　相手はまだあどけなさの残る、思ったよりもずっと若い子供であることに、その時初めて気がついた。","en":"Only then did I realize she was much younger than I had thought, a child whose face still retained its innocence.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r164","rowIndex":164,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　これだけ離れていれば一度の移動では私を攻撃出来ない。能力を二度使うにしても、垂直に上空へ飛ぶ私に追いつくためには、移動したその空中で、即座にもう一度能力をつかわなくてはならない。","en":"At this distance, a single jump could not let her attack me. Even if she used the power twice, catching me as I rose vertically would require her to use it again the instant she appeared in midair.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r165","rowIndex":165,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そんなことは出来やしない。さっきはあれだけ休んでいたじゃないか。お前は連続では能力を使えない！","en":"She could never do that. She had needed all that rest before. You cannot use your ability twice in succession!","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r166","rowIndex":166,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　確証があるわけじゃないが、もう祈るしかない。","en":"I had no proof, but now all I could do was pray.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r167","rowIndex":167,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　少女は能力を使い、姿を消す。そしてその瞬間に、現れたのは大体私の予想通り。私たちのいるところより大分低い空間だった。","en":"The girl used her ability and vanished. The instant she did, she reappeared almost exactly where I had expected: in midair, well below us.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r168","rowIndex":168,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私の予定ではそこから落下してくれるはずだったが、地球の引力が彼女を引き寄せる寸前に、パッと姿が消えた。そして、彼女がいた場所には、消えた彼女と入れ替わるようにして、私の足があらわれた。お気に入りの靴を履いたその足は、長年連れ添った私から切り離され、血を噴きながら落下してゆく。","en":"My plan had been for her to fall from there, but just before Earth’s gravity could pull her down, she vanished with a pop. Where she had been, my leg appeared, taking the vanished girl’s place. Still wearing my favorite shoe, it parted company with me after all our years together and fell through the air, spraying blood.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r169","rowIndex":169,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私の右足があんなところにすっ飛んだということは、かわりに相手がその場所にやって来たということだ。","en":"If my right leg had flown off to the place where she had been, that meant she had appeared in its place beside me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r170","rowIndex":170,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　すぐ目の前に少女がいる。その金髪の少女は、<tips=44>筱喬</tips>と甲乙付けがたいほどに美しい。そして私を見るその瞳は、やはり<tips=44>筱喬</tips>のように金色に輝いていた。","en":"The girl was directly in front of me. The blond child was every bit as beautiful as <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips>. And the eyes she turned on me shone gold just as <tips=44>Siu-kiu’s</tips> did.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r171","rowIndex":171,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ハイブリッド！","en":"A hybrid!","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r172","rowIndex":172,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ひっ」","en":"“Eek.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r173","rowIndex":173,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=44>筱喬</tips>が悲鳴を上げる。私は彼女を強く抱きしめる。","en":"<tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> screamed. I held her tightly.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r174","rowIndex":174,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　相手は、その気になれば連続して能力を使えるのだ。まあ、たまたま見たものに全てを賭けた私の考えが甘かったのだろう。だが、ラッキーだ。","en":"If she wanted to, the girl could use her power repeatedly without pause. I suppose I had been naive to stake everything on the little I happened to observe. But I was lucky.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r175","rowIndex":175,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　二回目の移動でもまだ致命傷は与えられていない。私はまだ生きている。足はとられたがこれならまだ大丈夫だ。","en":"Even her second jump had failed to deal a fatal wound. I was still alive. She had taken my leg, but I could still manage this.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r176","rowIndex":176,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は背筋に冷たいものを感じながら、速度を上げた。","en":"A chill ran down my spine as I increased my speed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r177","rowIndex":177,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　離れなくちゃいけない。とにかく私に出来ることは、全力で逃げるだけだ。","en":"I had to get away. All I could do was flee with everything I had.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r178","rowIndex":178,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　二回目の移動は、距離的には私を殺すのに充分だった。ただ、移動した場所がすこしズレていたから足一本で助かったのである。私の早さを捕捉出来なかったのか、彼女の能力自体が、それほど精度がないものなのかはわからない。もしくは、どうしても<tips=44>筱喬</tips>を殺したくなかったから中途半端な結果になったのか。何にしろ、とにかく外したのだ。もし三回目があっても、また外す可能性もある。","en":"Her second jump had covered enough distance to kill me. I had escaped with only one leg missing because she appeared slightly off target. Whether she had failed to track my speed, her ability itself lacked that much precision, or she had produced an incomplete result because she absolutely did not want to kill <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips>, I could not tell. Whatever the reason, she had missed. Even if there were a third jump, she might miss again.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r179","rowIndex":179,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　恐れていた三回目はすぐには訪れない。敵は顔を顰め、ふわっと落下をしはじめる。その時私は喜びかけたが、次の瞬間相手の姿が消えたのを見て即座に絶望した。","en":"The feared third jump did not come at once. The enemy grimaced and began to drift downward. I nearly rejoiced, only to despair the instant her figure vanished again.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r180","rowIndex":180,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　やられる！　悲鳴が出そうになったが、しかし、三回目のテレポーテーションは、ほんの数十センチ前方に移動しただけで、私たちには到底届かなかった。","en":"She’s got us! I almost screamed, but her third teleport carried her only a few dozen centimeters forward, nowhere near us.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r181","rowIndex":181,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女の身体全体から力が抜けるのが見て取れる。ふっと目を細め、ぽかんと口を開けたまま、地面に向かって落下してゆく。","en":"I could see the strength leave her entire body. Her eyes drifted half closed and her mouth fell slack as she dropped toward the ground.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r182","rowIndex":182,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ここは地上四十メートルほどの高さだ。足元はアスファルト。このまま落下に身を任せれば、彼女の小さな身体は激しく叩きつけられるだろう。","en":"We were roughly forty meters above the ground, with asphalt below. If she simply surrendered herself to the fall, her small body would slam violently into it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r183","rowIndex":183,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私はその瞬間を見ることが出来ず、目を背けた。ドサリと、柔らかく重い何かがぶつかる音がきこえる。","en":"I could not watch the moment of impact and turned away. I heard the heavy thud of something soft striking the ground.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r184","rowIndex":184,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして私はその場を後にした。","en":"Then I left.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r185","rowIndex":185,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　降りられる場所を探した。普段使わない高速移動を多用したのもあるが、何しろこの失血だ。全身が鉛のようにだるくなって、意識がもうろうとしている。とりあえず助かったが、このまま手当てをしなければきっと私も助からない。","en":"I searched for somewhere to land. Repeated bursts of high-speed flight, something I did not normally do, had contributed, but above all there was the blood loss. My whole body felt heavy as lead, and my consciousness was growing hazy. I had survived for the moment, but if I did not receive treatment, I surely would not survive much longer.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r186","rowIndex":186,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ここで死ぬのかな？　そんな考えがチラと頭をよぎったが、興奮しすぎているせいかちっとも怖くなかった。","en":"Was I going to die here? The thought flickered through my mind, but perhaps I was too excited, because I was not frightened at all.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r187","rowIndex":187,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=44>筱喬</tips>の車のところに戻るか？　<tips=42>サイキック探知機</tips>が作動していたから、もしかしたら警察か何かが来ているかもしれない。いっそのこと警察に助けてもらうか？　そうしたら、私の治療もして貰えるはずだし。――いや、それはちょっと、避けた方がいいかな。<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>的には<tips=44>筱喬</tips>が警察の手に渡るのは困るだろう。どうせなら、私は自分の仕事を完全にやりとげたい。","en":"Should I return to <tips=44>Siu-kiu’s</tips> car? A <tips=42>psychic detector</tips> had gone off, so perhaps the police or someone like that had already arrived. Should I just ask the police for help? They ought to treat me as well. —No, perhaps I should avoid that. As far as <tips=7>YS</tips> was concerned, letting <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> fall into police hands would be a problem. Since I had come this far, I wanted to see my job through.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r188","rowIndex":188,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=57>滑走路通り</tips>から道一本隔てた商店街の裏手あたりならば、たしか探知機もなかったし、人通りもそれほどなかったはずだ。","en":"If memory served, there were no detectors and few pedestrians behind the shopping street one road over from <tips=57>Runway Street</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r189","rowIndex":189,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=44>筱喬</tips>。もう大丈夫だよ」","en":"“It’s all right now, <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r190","rowIndex":190,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　自分の衰弱を悟られぬよう声色に気をつけながら、そう声をかけた。","en":"I carefully controlled my voice so she would not realize how weak I had become.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r191","rowIndex":191,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=51>さくら</tips>……足が……」","en":"“<tips=51>Sakura</tips>... Your leg...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r192","rowIndex":192,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女は私の足の方を見ながら、呆然としている。","en":"She stared blankly toward what remained of my right leg.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r193","rowIndex":193,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「へーきへーき」","en":"“It’s fine, it’s fine.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r194","rowIndex":194,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「でも……」","en":"“But...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r195","rowIndex":195,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=44>筱喬</tips>は私の顔を見ようとしかけてから、慌てて顔をそらした。<tips=95>金眼</tips>となった自分の目を隠したかったのかもしれない。","en":"<tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> began to look at my face, then hastily turned away. Perhaps she wanted to hide her own <tips=95>Golden Eyes</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r196","rowIndex":196,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　べつに、隠さなくたっていいのに。","en":"There was no need to hide them from me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r197","rowIndex":197,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　思ったよりも早く、意識が薄れてきた。けれども、足元は住宅地で、こんなところには降りられない。もっと、人気のないところに。","en":"My consciousness began to fade sooner than expected. But a residential district still lay beneath us, and I could not land in a place like this. I had to find somewhere more deserted.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r198","rowIndex":198,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　嗚呼、このままじゃ落っこちてしまう。","en":"Oh. At this rate, we would fall.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r199","rowIndex":199,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　意識を保とうとしたが、それはどうやら難しそうだ。","en":"I tried to remain conscious, but it did not seem as though I could.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r200","rowIndex":200,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　こうなれば悠長に降りる場所を選んではいられない。高度を落とし、どこかに不時着をしようとしたのだけれど、すっかり意識力が散漫になってしまっていたのか、立木に正面から突っ込んでしまった。","en":"There was no longer time to be leisurely about choosing a landing site. I descended and tried to make an emergency landing somewhere, but my concentration must have deserted me completely: I flew straight into a tree.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r201","rowIndex":201,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ぶつかる刹那、私はどうにか<tips=44>筱喬</tips>と身体を入れ替え、そこまでが意識を保っていられる限界だった。","en":"At the instant of impact, I somehow managed to switch positions with <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips>. That was as long as I could hold on to consciousness.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r203","rowIndex":203,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　目が覚めると、私は病院の清潔な白いベッドの上に寝かされていた。","en":"When I awoke, I was lying in a clean white hospital bed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r204","rowIndex":204,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ベッドの脇には、顔を涙で濡らす<tips=44>筱喬</tips>と、見たことがない背の高い青年がいる。","en":"Beside the bed stood <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips>, her face wet with tears, and a tall young man I had never seen before.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r205","rowIndex":205,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私の身体には白いシーツの掛け布団がかけられている。左足の爪先の膨らみは見て取れたが、右の方は、膝から下に膨らみはなく、ぺったりと敷き布団に張り付いている。現実感のない景色だ。夢のような気がしたけれども、夢ではないのだな。やっぱり。","en":"A white sheet covered my body. I could make out the rise of my left toes, but on the right, there was no shape beneath it below the knee. The sheet lay flat against the mattress. The sight felt unreal. It seemed like a dream, but it was not. Of course it was not.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r206","rowIndex":206,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「平べったいな。関東大平原だ」","en":"“It’s flat. The Great Kanto Plain.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r207","rowIndex":207,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　足のあるべき場所をぼんやりつぶやいた私に<tips=44>筱喬</tips>がしがみつく。","en":"As I stared at the place where my leg should have been and murmured dazedly, <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> clung to me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r208","rowIndex":208,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=51>さくら</tips>、<tips=51>さくら</tips>っ！」","en":"“<tips=51>Sakura</tips>! <tips=51>Sakura</tips>!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r209","rowIndex":209,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「うん、大丈夫」","en":"“Yes. I’m all right.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r210","rowIndex":210,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私はその頬に触れ、涙に触れた。指先に絆創膏のざらりとした感触がある。触れた私の腕にも、絆創膏がいくつも貼られていた。","en":"I touched her cheek and the tears upon it. The rough texture of an adhesive bandage met my fingertips. Several more bandages covered the arm I had reached out with.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r211","rowIndex":211,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　立木に突っ込んだのだから、あちこち切り傷を作ったのだろう。自分の顔に触れてみると、やはりそこにも何かがわちゃわちゃと張り付いている。","en":"I had flown into a tree, so I must have cut myself in several places. When I touched my own face, I found a jumble of bandages stuck there as well.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r212","rowIndex":212,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=44>筱喬</tips>があまり傷ついていないところを見ると、なんとか守ることは出来たのだな。","en":"<tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> appeared to have escaped serious injury, which meant I had managed to protect her somehow.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r213","rowIndex":213,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　何か薬を投与されているのだと思うが、頭がぼうっとする。嬉しいはずの心の動きがにぶい。","en":"They must have given me some kind of drug. My thoughts were hazy, and the stirrings of happiness I ought to have felt were dull.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r214","rowIndex":214,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　こんなに意識がぼやけているなんて、どんな薬を投与されているのだろう？　と数秒考えて、痛み止めであるのだと気がついた。思えば切断された筈の足の痛みはほとんどない。そんなことがすぐにわからないなんて、頭の回転も大分にぶっている。","en":"What had they given me to leave me this disoriented? I wondered for several seconds before realizing it was a painkiller. Come to think of it, my severed leg barely hurt. The fact that I could not recognize something so obvious showed how badly my mind had slowed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r215","rowIndex":215,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「気分はどうだい？」","en":"“How do you feel?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫","displayName":"Michio Mido","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r216","rowIndex":216,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　若者が、さわやかな笑顔で私に尋ねる。背が高く、すらっとしていて、今風の服を着て、髪の毛もかっこよく整えている、ガード下のバスケットコートで仲間を集めてスリーオンスリーをやってさわやかに笑っていそうな――私の苦手なタイプだ。","en":"The young man asked with a bright smile. He was tall and slender, dressed in fashionable clothes, his hair stylishly arranged—the sort of guy who looked as though he spent his time gathering friends for three-on-three basketball on a court beneath an overpass, smiling brightly all the while. Precisely the sort of person I could not handle.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r217","rowIndex":217,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……あなたは？」","en":"“...Who are you?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r218","rowIndex":218,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「おれは<tips=10>見土</tips>ってんだ。いや、家の中で作業をしていたらガサってすごい音がしてね。庭に飛び出たら木の葉に塗れたあんたたちが落ちていたんだよ」","en":"“Name’s <tips=10>Mido</tips>. I was working inside the house when I heard this tremendous crash. I ran into the yard and found you two lying there covered in leaves.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫","displayName":"Michio Mido","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r219","rowIndex":219,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……ミド」","en":"“...Mido.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r220","rowIndex":220,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そう、饅頭屋をやってる」","en":"“That’s right. I run a bun shop.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫","displayName":"Michio Mido","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r221","rowIndex":221,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「饅頭屋……若いのに……」","en":"“A bun shop... At your age...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r222","rowIndex":222,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「若くたって年寄りだって饅頭くらい売るさ。うちのは最高にうまいんだぜ。今も持ってるんだけど、ちょっと食べてみるかい？」","en":"“Young or old, anyone can sell buns. Ours are the best you’ll ever taste. I have some with me now. Want to try one?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫","displayName":"Michio Mido","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r223","rowIndex":223,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……いらない。あんこ嫌い」","en":"“...No. I hate sweet bean paste.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r224","rowIndex":224,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうか。まあ意識取り戻した直後に食べるものでもないよな」","en":"“Fair enough. I suppose a bun isn’t really the thing to eat right after you wake up.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫","displayName":"Michio Mido","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r225","rowIndex":225,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=10>見土</tips>と名乗ったその人物はハハハと笑った。","en":"The man who had introduced himself as <tips=10>Mido</tips> gave a hearty laugh.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r226","rowIndex":226,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　話を聞くと、驚くべきことに、私は五日間眠り続けていたらしい。","en":"From what they told me, astonishingly, I had apparently slept for five days.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r227","rowIndex":227,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　足の怪我というよりも、失血して体力が落ちた状態で限界まで<tips=16>タイプA</tips>能力を使ったことで、精神の方が消耗したのが原因のようだ。一歩間違えれば意識が戻らないまま廃人になっていた可能性もあったという。","en":"They said the cause was not so much the wound to my leg as the strain on my mind from pushing a <tips=16>Type A</tips> ability to its limit after blood loss had sapped my physical strength. One wrong turn, and I might have remained permanently unresponsive without ever regaining consciousness.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r228","rowIndex":228,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=10>見土道夫</tips>は庭に落ちた私を病院に運ぶよう手配し、<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>の使いの者が来るまで<tips=44>筱喬</tips>と<tips=84>マイケル・ツェー</tips>の家族を守り、取り乱す<tips=44>筱喬</tips>から言葉を聞き出し<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>の使いに正確な情報を伝え、おまけに藪の中に落ちていた私の足まで拾ってくれるという、ほとんど頭おかしいんじゃないかと思えるくらい親切で的確な手助けをしてくれたのだそうだ。","en":"<tips=10>Michio Mido</tips> had arranged for me to be taken from his garden to the hospital, protected <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> and <tips=84>Michael Tse’s</tips> family until representatives of <tips=7>YS</tips> arrived, managed to get an account from the distraught <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> and relayed accurate information to the <tips=7>YS</tips> representatives, and even recovered my leg from where it had fallen in the brush. Apparently, he had helped with such kindness and competence that I almost had to wonder whether he was out of his mind.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r229","rowIndex":229,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「残念ながら、足はくっつかないみたいだけど……」","en":"“Unfortunately, it sounds as if they can’t reattach the leg...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫","displayName":"Michio Mido","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r230","rowIndex":230,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　と、自分のことのように悲痛な顔で彼は伝えてくれる。","en":"He told me with a pained expression, as though the loss were his own.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r231","rowIndex":231,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=51>さくら</tips>にこんな大けがをさせてしまって、どう謝ったらいいのか……」","en":"“You were hurt this badly because of me, <tips=51>Sakura</tips>. I don’t know how I can ever apologize...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r232","rowIndex":232,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=44>筱喬</tips>は苦しそうにうつむく。","en":"<tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> lowered her head in anguish.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r233","rowIndex":233,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「何を謝るの？」","en":"“What are you apologizing for?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r234","rowIndex":234,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「だって……」","en":"“But...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r235","rowIndex":235,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「私はほとんど死ぬと思ってやったんだよ。でも、たったの足一本で済んだ。あなたのことも無事助けられた。どちらかと言えばトクをしたのよ？」","en":"“I did it thinking I would almost certainly die. But it cost me only one leg, and I managed to save you too. If anything, I came out ahead.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r236","rowIndex":236,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=51>さくら</tips>……」","en":"“<tips=51>Sakura</tips>...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r237","rowIndex":237,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=44>筱喬</tips>は涙で潤む目で私を見つめる。","en":"<tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> stared at me through tear-filled eyes.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r238","rowIndex":238,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は私で、なんだかかっこつけたような言葉を口にしてしまったので照れくさかった。","en":"I had gone and said something that sounded as though I was trying to act cool, and now I felt embarrassed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r239","rowIndex":239,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　だから、彼女の目を見つめられず、視線をそらしてしまう。","en":"Unable to meet her gaze, I looked away.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r240","rowIndex":240,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いいんだよ。本当に。私はほとんど足なんか使わないから飾りみたいなものだったんだから、なくしたところでどうってことない」","en":"“It’s truly all right. I barely ever used my legs. They were practically decorative, so losing one doesn’t matter.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r241","rowIndex":241,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　言うと、<tips=44>筱喬</tips>は声をあげて泣き出す。","en":"At that, <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> burst into tears.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r242","rowIndex":242,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　やっぱり、無理してこんなことを言っていると思われてしまったのかもしれない。本当に、嘘偽りなく、私は足一本で済んでトクをしたと思っているし、言葉に虚勢はなかったのだが。","en":"Perhaps she assumed I was forcing myself to speak that way. But without the slightest lie or deception, I genuinely believed that losing only one leg meant I had come out ahead. There had been no bravado in my words.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r243","rowIndex":243,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　こんなに泣かれると困惑してしまうばかりだ。携帯電話を仕込んで、ストーカーとかしてるのに、こんなにされて申し訳がない。","en":"With her crying this hard, I could only be at a loss. I had tampered with her phone and stalked her, yet here I was receiving such concern from her. I felt terribly guilty.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r244","rowIndex":244,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「きみは立派な女性だな」","en":"“You’re an admirable woman.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫","displayName":"Michio Mido","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r245","rowIndex":245,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=10>見土</tips>さんが微笑みを浮かべてそう言うと、ますます罪悪感が。","en":"When <tips=10>Mido</tips> said that with a smile, my guilt only grew.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r246","rowIndex":246,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「立派だなんて言われるの、いやだな……」","en":"“I hate being called admirable...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r247","rowIndex":247,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は溜息をつき、天井を見つめる。","en":"I sighed and stared at the ceiling.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r248","rowIndex":248,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　医師と看護師がやって来て、私の状態を調べるとまた去って行った。","en":"A doctor and nurse came, examined my condition, and then left again.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r249","rowIndex":249,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私が意識を失っている間、ほとんど睡眠も食事もとれていなかったという<tips=44>筱喬</tips>が泣き疲れて私のベッドにもたれたまま安堵の眠りについている。<tips=10>見土</tips>さんはその背中に自分の上着をかけた。","en":"While I was unconscious, <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> had apparently eaten and slept almost nothing. Now, exhausted from crying, she had fallen into a relieved sleep leaning against my bed. <tips=10>Mido</tips> laid his jacket across her back.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r250","rowIndex":250,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「もう少し起きていられそうかい？　それとも、もう休む？」","en":"“Do you think you can stay awake a little longer? Or would you rather rest?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫","displayName":"Michio Mido","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r251","rowIndex":251,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「全然眠くないです」","en":"“I’m not sleepy at all.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r252","rowIndex":252,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　事実、ちっとも眠くなかった。","en":"In fact, I was not remotely sleepy.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r253","rowIndex":253,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私の頭のなかは、このことをどうやって両親に説明するかで一杯だった。","en":"My head was full of the question of how I would explain this to my parents.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r254","rowIndex":254,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　五日間も勝手に家を空けて、そのうち足を一本なくしている。いくら寛容な両親とは言え、これはちょっとまずい。","en":"I had disappeared from home without permission for five days and lost a leg in the process. However forgiving my parents might be, this was a bit of a problem.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r255","rowIndex":255,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　怒られるだろうか？　泣かれるだろうか？　どちらもいやなので、うまいこと和やかで笑顔のあるような雰囲気になる説明の方法を考えていたのだけれども、どうにも思い浮かばない。ミッション・インポッシブルというやつだ。","en":"Would they be angry? Would they cry? I wanted neither, so I had been trying to invent an explanation that would somehow keep the mood warm and everyone smiling. Nothing came to mind. It was what they call mission impossible.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r256","rowIndex":256,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうか、じゃあ、会って欲しい人がいるんだが、会って貰える？」","en":"“I see. In that case, there’s someone I’d like you to meet. Would you be willing to see him?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫","displayName":"Michio Mido","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r257","rowIndex":257,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=10>見土</tips>さんはそう訊いて来る。","en":"<tips=10>Mido</tips> asked me that.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r258","rowIndex":258,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「会って欲しい人？」","en":"“Someone you want me to meet?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r259","rowIndex":259,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=44>シウ</tips>ちゃんの兄だよ。目が覚めたら連絡して欲しいって、言われていたんだ」","en":"“<tips=44>Siu’s</tips> older brother. He asked me to call once you woke up.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫","displayName":"Michio Mido","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r260","rowIndex":260,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「お兄さんって……」","en":"“Her brother...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r261","rowIndex":261,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「知ってるかい？」","en":"“Do you know him?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫","displayName":"Michio Mido","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r262","rowIndex":262,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「だって、街の有名人だし……」","en":"“He’s famous in the city...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r263","rowIndex":263,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>の葬儀パレードで、人相の悪い人間に囲まれた黒塗りのオープンカーに乗っていたあの美青年の姿が脳裏に浮かぶ。","en":"The image rose in my mind of that beautiful young man in a black convertible, surrounded by menacing-looking people during <tips=3>Chris Tse’s</tips> funeral procession.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r264","rowIndex":264,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　あのとき私は遠くから眺めつつ、なんだかもの凄いものを見てしまったという感慨に浸っていたが、その人物がいまこの病室にやって来るというのだ。私に会うために。","en":"Watching from a distance, I had marveled at the extraordinary sight. Now that very person was coming into this hospital room—to meet me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r265","rowIndex":265,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そ、それはちょっと、なんとかなんないですかね。療養中に緊張するというのは……」","en":"“Th-that’s a little... Is there any way around it? Being made nervous while I’m supposed to be recuperating...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r266","rowIndex":266,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「何にも心配しないでいいさ。まあ、色々肩書きはあるが、ただ君の親友の兄貴が来るというだけのことだからね。友だちの家に遊びに行って、その家族と会ったくらいの場面を想像していればいいんだ」","en":"“You don’t need to worry about anything. He has various titles, sure, but all that is happening is that your best friend’s brother is coming. Just imagine you have gone to a friend’s house and happen to meet her family.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫","displayName":"Michio Mido","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r267","rowIndex":267,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=10>見土</tips>さんが気楽に言うのに一瞬納得しかけたけれども、私はそもそも友だちの家に遊びに行ったことも、ましてやそこでその家族と会った経験もないし、もしそうなったら滅茶苦茶緊張してしまうに決まっている。","en":"<tips=10>Mido’s</tips> casual advice almost convinced me for an instant. But I had never visited a friend’s house, much less met the family there, and if it ever happened, I would obviously be a complete nervous wreck.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r268","rowIndex":268,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　困っている私をよそに、彼はその場で電話を取り出す。","en":"While I sat there fretting, he took out his phone then and there.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r269","rowIndex":269,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「おっす、おれだけど。<tips=51>さくら</tips>ちゃん、今起きたんよ。医者も今来て大丈夫だって。……うん、そう。会ってくれるって。……思ったより元気そうだよ」","en":"“Hey, it’s me. <tips=51>Sakura</tips> just woke up. The doctor came by and said it’s all right to visit now. ...Yeah, that’s right. She says she’ll meet you. ...She looks better than I expected.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫","displayName":"Michio Mido","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r270","rowIndex":270,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼は軽い調子で通話相手に話しかけている。","en":"His voice remained light as he spoke to the person on the other end.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r271","rowIndex":271,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あの、今の相手って……」","en":"“Um... Was that...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r272","rowIndex":272,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　通話を終えた<tips=10>見土</tips>におそるおそる尋ねると、彼は頷き、","en":"After the call ended, I timidly asked <tips=10>Mido</tips>, and he nodded.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r273","rowIndex":273,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「その兄貴だよ」","en":"“Her brother.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫","displayName":"Michio Mido","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r274","rowIndex":274,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……どういう関係なんですか？」","en":"“...What is your relationship with him?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r275","rowIndex":275,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ガキのころからの親友なんだ。いやあ、今は随分偉くなっちゃったけど、ダチはダチだかんね。……<tips=51>さくら</tips>ちゃんにとっての<tips=44>シウ</tips>ちゃんだって、そうだろう？　立場なんか関係ないのさ」","en":"“We’ve been best friends since we were kids. Sure, he’s become awfully important, but a buddy’s a buddy. ...It’s the same with you and <tips=44>Siu</tips>, isn’t it, <tips=51>Sakura</tips>? Status has nothing to do with it.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫","displayName":"Michio Mido","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r276","rowIndex":276,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そう言って、<tips=10>見土</tips>さんは春の日差しのような明るい笑顔で笑った。","en":"<tips=10>Mido</tips> smiled as brightly as the spring sunshine.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r277","rowIndex":277,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=44>筱喬</tips>の兄……<tips=1>亮</tips>さんが到着するまでの間、私は<tips=10>見土</tips>さんから説明を受けた。","en":"While I waited for <tips=44>Siu-kiu’s</tips> brother—<tips=1>Ryo</tips>—to arrive, <tips=10>Mido</tips> explained the situation to me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r278","rowIndex":278,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私が戦ったあの少女は、<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>の本拠地である<tips=41>グランドタワー</tips>を襲撃した人物らしい。","en":"The girl I had fought was apparently the same person who attacked <tips=41>Grand Tower</tips>, the headquarters of <tips=7>YS</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r279","rowIndex":279,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そこで重要な幹部と構成員たちを何人か殺害したあと、<tips=41>グランドタワー</tips>を去る。そしてその直後に、ビルに戻れずに路上で待機していた<tips=44>筱喬</tips>たちと遭遇し、彼女たちを襲った。","en":"There, she had killed several important officers and members before leaving <tips=41>Grand Tower</tips>. Immediately afterward, she encountered <tips=44>Siu-kiu’s</tips> party waiting in the street, unable to return to the building, and attacked them.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r280","rowIndex":280,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「え、あの子の死体は見つかってないんですか？」","en":"“Wait, they never found that girl’s body?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r281","rowIndex":281,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は不思議に思ってそう訊ねた。","en":"I asked because I found that strange.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r282","rowIndex":282,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そういう話は聞いていないな」","en":"“I haven’t heard anything like that.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫","displayName":"Michio Mido","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r283","rowIndex":283,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「おかしいな。かなり高いところから落ちた筈なのに……」","en":"“That’s strange. She fell from a considerable height...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r284","rowIndex":284,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「うまいこと能力を使って助かったんじゃないかな」","en":"“Maybe she managed to use her ability and save herself.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫","displayName":"Michio Mido","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r285","rowIndex":285,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうでしょうか……」","en":"“Do you think so...?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r286","rowIndex":286,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は、どうも腑に落ちない。どう見たって彼女の体力は限界に見えた。もう一度瞬間移動が出来たなら、私たちの命はなかったはずだ。","en":"Something about it did not sit right with me. By every appearance, she had reached the limit of her strength. If she had been capable of one more teleport, we should not have survived.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r287","rowIndex":287,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そんな私に<tips=10>見土</tips>さんは溜息をつき、","en":"Seeing that I was still unconvinced, <tips=10>Mido</tips> sighed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r288","rowIndex":288,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それにしても、君は凄い。<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>の連中がボロボロにやられちゃったような凶悪な相手から、見事<tips=44>シウ</tips>ちゃんを奪還したんだから大したもんだ。とても信じられないよ」","en":"“In any case, you’re incredible. You successfully took <tips=44>Siu</tips> back from a vicious opponent who devastated the people of <tips=7>YS</tips>. That’s quite an achievement. I can hardly believe it.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫","displayName":"Michio Mido","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r289","rowIndex":289,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あの……それは、私も実は<tips=16>タイプA</tips>で……」","en":"“Um... The truth is, I’m a <tips=16>Type A</tips> too...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r290","rowIndex":290,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「もちろんそれはわかってるよ。そのことについては、詳しくは話さなくていいからね。自分の能力のことを知られるのは嬉しくないだろう。おれも<tips=16>タイプA</tips>だからわかるよ。……もっとも、おれは全然隠しちゃいないけど」","en":"“Of course I understand. You don’t have to discuss the details of that. It doesn’t feel good to have people learn about your ability, does it? I’m a <tips=16>Type A</tips> too, so I understand. ...Although I make no effort to hide it myself.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫","displayName":"Michio Mido","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r291","rowIndex":291,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=10>見土</tips>さんは苦笑してから、","en":"<tips=10>Mido</tips> gave a wry smile.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r292","rowIndex":292,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=1>亮</tips>が来ても、その辺りは話さなくていい。<tips=44>シウ</tips>ちゃんも心得てる。そうやって<tips=16>タイプＡ</tips>は自分の身を守るんだ」","en":"“You don’t have to discuss any of that when <tips=1>Ryo</tips> arrives. <tips=44>Siu</tips> understands the boundary too. That is how a <tips=16>Type A</tips> protects themself.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫","displayName":"Michio Mido","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r293","rowIndex":293,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　少し真面目な顔になって、そう忠告してくれた。","en":"His face grew somewhat more serious as he offered the warning.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r294","rowIndex":294,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして、噂では何度も聞いた<tips=44>筱喬</tips>の兄……<tips=9>Y地区</tips>最大の英雄の後継者である<tips=1>謝亮</tips>は、私の病室に姿を現した。<tips=10>見土</tips>さんが電話をしてから、三十分も過ぎていない。","en":"Then <tips=44>Siu-kiu’s</tips> brother appeared in my hospital room—the man I had heard about so often, <tips=1>Tse Leung</tips>, heir to <tips=9>Y District’s</tips> greatest hero. Less than thirty minutes had passed since <tips=10>Mido’s</tips> call.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r295","rowIndex":295,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「はやかったな。一人か？」","en":"“That was fast. Are you alone?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫","displayName":"Michio Mido","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r296","rowIndex":296,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=10>見土</tips>さんがそう問うと、","en":"At <tips=10>Mido’s</tips> question—","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r297","rowIndex":297,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「外に待たせてる。病室にゾロゾロと押しかけるわけにはいかないからね。……<tips=44>シウ</tips>は寝ているね。じゃあ、そのまま起こさないでやってくれ。衰弱が気になっていたんだ」","en":"“I left them waiting outside. We can hardly descend on a hospital room in a mob. ...<tips=44>Siu</tips> is asleep, I see. Then let her rest. I was worried about how weak she’d become.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r298","rowIndex":298,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>さんは透き通るような声で言った。","en":"<tips=1>Ryo</tips> spoke in a voice of crystalline clarity.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r299","rowIndex":299,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　あの時路上で遠くから見たままの、美しい顔立ちの青年がそこにいた。表情はどこか暗く、冷たい印象があったが、そのアンニュイな雰囲気が整った容姿をさらに引き立てている。","en":"The beautiful young man stood there just as I had seen him from a distance in the street. Something about his expression seemed dark and cold, but that air of ennui only enhanced his perfectly formed features.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r300","rowIndex":300,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　謝家の兄妹は、なんという美形揃いなのだろう。こんな二人が家庭のなかにいたら、それだけでもうドラマか映画のような現実感のない風景になってしまうに違いない。","en":"What an impossibly beautiful pair the Tse siblings were. Put these two in the same household and the whole scene would surely look like a movie or television drama, stripped of any sense of reality.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r301","rowIndex":301,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は自分の家庭のあまりに庶民的な光景を思い出してクラクラとした。","en":"I remembered the painfully ordinary scenes of my own home and grew dizzy.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r302","rowIndex":302,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「はじめまして、<tips=51>熨田さくら</tips>さん。僕が<tips=44>筱喬</tips>の兄<tips=1>謝亮</tips>だ。日本風に<tips=1>リョウ</tips>と呼んでくれればいい」","en":"“It’s a pleasure to meet you, <tips=51>Sakura Noshida</tips>. I’m <tips=44>Siu-kiu’s</tips> brother, <tips=1>Tse Leung</tips>. You can call me <tips=1>Ryo</tips>, the Japanese way.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r303","rowIndex":303,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ど、どうも。熨田です」","en":"“H-hello. I’m Noshida.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r304","rowIndex":304,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いや、そのままでいいよ」","en":"“No, please stay as you are.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r305","rowIndex":305,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　会釈をするために上半身を起こそうとした私を、<tips=1>亮</tips>さんはそう言って押しとどめる。","en":"I tried to raise my upper body to bow, but <tips=1>Ryo</tips> stopped me with those words.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r306","rowIndex":306,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「随分とひどい怪我をしたようだ」","en":"“It appears you were badly injured.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r307","rowIndex":307,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼は私の欠損した足の方を見ながら、僅かに目を細める。","en":"His eyes narrowed slightly as he looked toward my missing leg.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r308","rowIndex":308,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いえ、これくらい別に……」","en":"“No, this is nothing...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r309","rowIndex":309,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どう感謝したらいいかわからないが、とにかく、ありがとう」","en":"“I don’t know how I can thank you, but at any rate—thank you.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r310","rowIndex":310,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そう言って、彼は頭を下げた。","en":"He bowed his head.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r311","rowIndex":311,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>の次期リーダーと言われ、しかもこれほどの美男子が、私に向かって感謝の言葉を述べ、頭を下げている。なんということだろう。これほどの美男子が。美男子が。","en":"The rumored next leader of <tips=7>YS</tips>—and such a beautiful man—was thanking me and bowing his head. What was happening? A man this beautiful. This beautiful man.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r312","rowIndex":312,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　舞い上がってしまいそうになる自分を抑えつつ、なるべく低い声で、","en":"I fought to keep myself from getting carried away and made my voice as low as possible.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r313","rowIndex":313,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いえ、感謝していただく必要はありません。すべて、自分のためにやったことです。後悔しないために」","en":"“No thanks are necessary. Everything I did, I did for myself—so I wouldn’t have to regret it.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r314","rowIndex":314,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　出来うるかぎりのポーカーフェイスを取り繕いながらそう言った。","en":"I said it behind the best poker face I could muster.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r315","rowIndex":315,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……僕が全面的に責任を持ち、最良の医療を受けられるように取り計らおう。医師に診せないと再生出来るかどうかはわからないが、最悪でも義肢は用意出来ると思う」","en":"“...I will take full responsibility and arrange the best medical care available. A doctor will have to examine you before we know whether the leg can regenerate, but at worst, I believe we can provide a prosthesis.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r316","rowIndex":316,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それは……」","en":"“That...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r317","rowIndex":317,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それくらい、素直に受け入れなよ。<tips=44>シウ</tips>ちゃん以外のギャングとつき合うのは嫌かもしれないけどさ」","en":"“At least accept that much. You may not want anything to do with gangsters besides <tips=44>Siu</tips>, but still.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫","displayName":"Michio Mido","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r318","rowIndex":318,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私が断ろうとしたのを察したのか、<tips=10>見土</tips>さんがそう言う。","en":"<tips=10>Mido</tips> appeared to sense that I was about to refuse.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r319","rowIndex":319,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そういうつもりではなかったんですが……わかりました。ご厚意に甘えさせていただきます」","en":"“That wasn’t what I meant... All right. I gratefully accept your kindness.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r320","rowIndex":320,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それくらいさせてくれなきゃ僕が困る。元はと言えば、僕らが仕留め損なったからこんなことになったんだからね」","en":"“If you don’t let me do at least that, you’ll put me in a difficult position. This only happened because we failed to finish her off ourselves.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r321","rowIndex":321,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>さんはそう言って、ちょっとおどけたみたいだった。","en":"<tips=1>Ryo</tips> said it with a touch of playfulness.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r322","rowIndex":322,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あの……きいても良いですか？」","en":"“May I... ask you something?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r323","rowIndex":323,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は勇気を出して、彼にそう声をかけた。","en":"I gathered my courage and addressed him.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r324","rowIndex":324,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どうぞ」","en":"“Please.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r325","rowIndex":325,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あのテレポーテーションの子は、<tips=41>グランドタワー</tips>を襲って、妹さんを襲ったということは、<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>を狙ってるってことなんですよね？」","en":"“That teleporting girl attacked <tips=41>Grand Tower</tips> and then attacked your sister. That means she’s targeting <tips=7>YS</tips>, doesn’t it?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r326","rowIndex":326,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>か、執行部か、それとも我々謝一族か、どれかはわからないけど、僕らを狙ってることはまず間違いないだろうね」","en":"“Whether her target is <tips=7>YS</tips>, the executive leadership, or the Tse family, I couldn’t say. But we ourselves are almost certainly the target.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r327","rowIndex":327,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「だとすれば、また襲ってくる可能性が高い」","en":"“Then there’s a strong chance she’ll attack again.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r328","rowIndex":328,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「生きているなら、おそらく」","en":"“If she’s alive, probably.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r329","rowIndex":329,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「じゃあ、やっぱり、私はあの子のことを、詳しくお伝えしなければいけないと思うんです。聞いていただけますか？」","en":"“Then I think I need to tell you in detail what I know about her. Will you listen?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r330","rowIndex":330,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「もちろん。……実を言うと、僕も、そのことについてはしっかりと聞いておかなければいけないと思ってここへ来ている。まさか話題を先回りされるとはね」","en":"“Of course. ...To tell the truth, I came here because I too believed I had to hear a complete account of that. I never expected you to raise the subject before I did.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r331","rowIndex":331,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>さんはそう言って、微笑して見せた。","en":"<tips=1>Ryo</tips> gave me a smile.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r332","rowIndex":332,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は彼に、その時の状況を伝えた。<tips=10>見土</tips>さんには事前に言われていたけれど、自分の能力についても話した。そこを隠したままでは、詳しく状況を伝えることが出来なかったからだ。","en":"I told him what had happened. <tips=10>Mido</tips> had warned me beforehand, but I also described my own ability. I could not give a detailed account of the situation while concealing that part.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r333","rowIndex":333,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私が話している間、<tips=1>亮</tips>さんは無言で相槌をうちながら聞いていた。その真剣な顔に、どうしても緊張してしまう。","en":"As I spoke, <tips=1>Ryo</tips> listened in silence, nodding at intervals. His grave expression made it impossible for me not to feel nervous.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r334","rowIndex":334,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なかなか興味深い話だ」","en":"“A most interesting account.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r335","rowIndex":335,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私が一通り話をすると、彼はそう言って頷いた。","en":"When I finished, he said that and nodded.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r336","rowIndex":336,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ハイブリッドだというのは、僕らは気がつかなかった。でもそう考えればいろいろと説明がつくな」","en":"“We didn’t realize she was a hybrid. But now that we know, it explains a number of things.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r337","rowIndex":337,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あの、あと、個人的に思ったことがあって」","en":"“There was something else I thought...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r338","rowIndex":338,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なんだい？」","en":"“What is it?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r339","rowIndex":339,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「負傷していたのを差し引いても、そう長い距離を移動出来る能力ではないと思うんです。それに、多分精度もそこまで高くない。距離が離れれば離れるほど、狙った場所へジャンプするのが難しくなるのではないでしょうか……」","en":"“Even allowing for her injuries, I don’t think her ability can move her over very long distances. And it probably isn’t terribly accurate. The greater the distance, the harder it may become to land exactly where she intends...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r340","rowIndex":340,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なるほど……」","en":"“I see...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r341","rowIndex":341,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>さんは、腕組みをして考え始める。","en":"<tips=1>Ryo</tips> folded his arms and began to think.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r342","rowIndex":342,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その様子を見ると、変なことを言ってしまったのじゃないかと急に恥ずかしくなって、","en":"Watching him think, I suddenly grew embarrassed that I might have said something strange.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r343","rowIndex":343,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「本当にただの勘というか、感想なんで、余計な意見だったかもしれないですが……」","en":"“It’s truly nothing more than a hunch—or an impression—so perhaps I was out of line to say it...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r344","rowIndex":344,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　すると<tips=1>亮</tips>さんは顔を上げ、","en":"<tips=1>Ryo</tips> looked up.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r345","rowIndex":345,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いや、実際に対面した<tips=16>タイプA</tips>の意見だから、参考になるよ」","en":"“No. It’s the opinion of a <tips=16>Type A</tips> who actually faced her. It will be useful.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r346","rowIndex":346,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そ、それと、彼女はまだ別の力を隠しているかもしれません」","en":"“Th-there’s one more thing. She may still be hiding another power.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r347","rowIndex":347,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それは？」","en":"“What makes you think so?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r348","rowIndex":348,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「彼女は三十メートル以上の高さから落下したんです。激突する音もきこえました。それなのに、死体が見つかっていません。……見る限り、彼女は瞬間移動しても、身体に働いている慣性力はそのままだったようです。だから、例えば落下した場合、いくら瞬間移動しても、落下速度を和らげることは出来ないはずです。それでも生きているなんて、とても考えられない。<tips=17>タイプB</tips>の身体能力がいくら高いとしても……。だから、生きているとしたら瞬間移動以外の未知の能力があると思うんです。……死んでいたとしたら、誰かが死体を回収したのでしょう。あれだけの美しい少女だし、拾ったのが仲間とは限りませんが……」","en":"“She fell more than thirty meters. I heard the impact. But no body was found. ...As far as I could observe, teleportation appeared to preserve the momentum acting on her body. So if she were falling, no amount of teleportation should reduce her speed. I can’t imagine her surviving the impact, no matter how physically capable a <tips=17>Type B</tips> might be. If she is alive, then I think she possesses some unknown ability besides teleportation. ...If she died, perhaps someone recovered the corpse. She was extremely beautiful, so whoever picked her up need not even have been an associate...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r349","rowIndex":349,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まあ、世の中に変態は多いからね。特にこの街は変態のメッカみたいなもんだし」","en":"“There are plenty of perverts in the world. This city is practically their mecca.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫","displayName":"Michio Mido","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r350","rowIndex":350,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=10>見土</tips>さんが苦笑している。","en":"<tips=10>Mido</tips> gave a wry smile.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r351","rowIndex":351,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ああ、そういうことか。それなら、僕にはある程度推測がついている」","en":"“Oh, I see. In that case, I already have some idea what it might be.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r352","rowIndex":352,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そ、そうですか。ごめんなさい……」","en":"“I-I see. I’m sorry...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r353","rowIndex":353,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いや、でも話してくれてありがとう。優れたレポートだ」","en":"“No, thank you for telling me. That’s an excellent report.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r354","rowIndex":354,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼は真顔でそう頷く。","en":"He nodded with a perfectly serious expression.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r355","rowIndex":355,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私はやっぱり恥ずかしくて、胸がどきどきして、目をそらしてしまう。","en":"Once again, I felt embarrassed. My heart pounded, and I looked away.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r356","rowIndex":356,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼は腕組みをほどくと、","en":"He uncrossed his arms.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r357","rowIndex":357,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それにしても、きみが<tips=44>筱喬</tips>の友だちでよかった。勇敢だし、頭もいい。ああいう場面でそれだけ相手を冷静に観察して、方針を決めて、そしてその通り行動できるなんて並大抵のことじゃない。話も、論理的に順序立っていて理解しやすかった」","en":"“I must say, I’m glad you are <tips=44>Siu-kiu’s</tips> friend. You’re brave and intelligent. To observe an opponent so calmly in a situation like that, choose a course of action, and then carry it through—that is no ordinary feat. Your account was logical, orderly, and easy to understand.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r358","rowIndex":358,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そ、そんな……」","en":"“N-no, I...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r359","rowIndex":359,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　もう駄目だ。予想外の褒め言葉だ。淡々とした冷静な口調で、だからこそ余計に冗談やお世辞でないのがよくわかる。","en":"This was too much. I had never expected such praise. His delivery was calm and matter-of-fact, which made it all the clearer to me that he was neither joking nor flattering me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r360","rowIndex":360,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　異性にこんなに褒められたのは生まれて初めてだ。異性以外も含めると、<tips=44>筱喬</tips>に続く二人目の人間だ。そもそも人生でほとんど褒められたことがない人間である。","en":"It was the first time a man had ever praised me so highly. If I included women, he was the second person, after <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips>. Then again, I had received almost no praise in my life.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r361","rowIndex":361,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　恥ずかしすぎて、戸惑ってしまって、もう彼の方を見ることなどできない。","en":"The embarrassment and confusion became so intense that I could no longer look at him at all.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r362","rowIndex":362,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「きみじゃなければ助けられなかったよ。例えばね、優れた能力を持った<tips=16>タイプA</tips>でも、何も考えないで突っ込んで正面対決を挑むようなどこかの単細胞だったら、確実に返り討ちにあっていた」","en":"“No one else could have saved her. For example, even a <tips=16>Type A</tips> with an exceptional ability would certainly have been killed if they charged in thoughtlessly and challenged her head-on—like a certain simpleton I could name.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r363","rowIndex":363,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なんだか悪口を言われているような気がする」","en":"“I feel as if someone is insulting me.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫","displayName":"Michio Mido","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r364","rowIndex":364,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=10>見土</tips>さんが口をへの字に曲げる。","en":"<tips=10>Mido</tips> twisted his mouth into a frown.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r365","rowIndex":365,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「事実だからね。でも今回はお前も役に立ったよ。見つけたのがお前じゃなければ、もっと面倒なことになっていた」","en":"“It’s only the truth. But you were useful this time too. If someone else had found them, matters would have become far more difficult.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r366","rowIndex":366,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「口に出さなくていい。お前が感謝しているのはわかっている」","en":"“You don’t have to say it. I know you’re grateful.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫","displayName":"Michio Mido","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r367","rowIndex":367,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=10>見土</tips>さんの軽口に、<tips=1>亮</tips>さんは答えない。そっとその顔を見ると、優しそうな微笑を浮かべている。","en":"<tips=1>Ryo</tips> made no answer to <tips=10>Mido’s</tips> teasing. When I stole a look at him, I found a gentle smile on his face.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r368","rowIndex":368,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　この二人は本当に仲が良いのだろう。しかし、こうして話しているところは、普通の若者のようだ。とても、ギャング一家の長男とは見えない。しかも、この人はただの血縁ではなく、組織のまっただなかにいる。","en":"The two of them truly did appear close. Yet speaking together this way, they looked like ordinary young men. Ryo hardly seemed the eldest son of a gangster family—and he was no mere relative, but a person directly at the center of the organization.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r369","rowIndex":369,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ついこの間も、ナントカという<tips=16>タイプA</tips>のギャングを自ら武器をもって襲撃し、部下や家族もろとも皆殺しにしたと言う噂だ。知的な印象で、とても、そんな恐ろしい暴力を振るうような人には見えないのに……。","en":"Rumor had it that only recently he had personally taken up a weapon and attacked some <tips=16>Type A</tips> gangster or other, killing the man, his subordinates, and his family. Ryo looked so intelligent, nothing like a person capable of such horrifying violence...","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r370","rowIndex":370,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　目が合うと、<tips=1>亮</tips>さんはその笑顔を私に向けて、","en":"Our eyes met, and <tips=1>Ryo</tips> gave me that smile.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r371","rowIndex":371,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「本当に、ありがとう」","en":"“Truly, thank you.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r372","rowIndex":372,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「い、いえ」","en":"“N-not at all.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r373","rowIndex":373,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=44>筱喬</tips>に何かあったら、とてもまともではいられなかった」","en":"“If anything had happened to <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips>, I would never have been able to keep myself together.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r374","rowIndex":374,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼が本当に喜んでくれているのが伝わる。","en":"I could tell how genuinely glad he was.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r375","rowIndex":375,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その表情がまぶしくて、私はまた目をそらしてしまう。","en":"His expression was so dazzling that I looked away again.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r376","rowIndex":376,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=44>筱喬</tips>というものがありながら、こんなに舞い上がってしまうなんて。……いや、同じ遺伝子を持つ二人に対して、こんな風になるのは、むしろ当然だよね？","en":"To think I could become this carried away when I already had <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips>. ...No. Given that the two shared the same genes, surely reacting this way to both of them was only natural?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r377","rowIndex":377,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「良かったら、これからも<tips=44>筱喬</tips>の友人でいてくれるかな」","en":"“If you don’t mind, will you continue to be <tips=44>Siu-kiu’s</tips> friend?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r378","rowIndex":378,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そんな、こちらこそ、私でよければ……」","en":"“No, I should be the one asking—if you think someone like me is good enough...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r379","rowIndex":379,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ありがとう。これからややこしいことがあるかもしれないが、僕が全部なんとかする。心配しないでほしい」","en":"“Thank you. Things may become complicated from here, but I will take care of everything. Please don’t worry.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r380","rowIndex":380,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして彼が部屋を出て、パタンとドアが閉まると、私はもう我慢が出来なかった。","en":"Then he left the room and the door clicked shut. I could contain myself no longer.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r381","rowIndex":381,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「み、<tips=10>見土</tips>さん。あの人、めっちゃかっこよくないですか？　なんであんなにかっこいいの？　モデルとかしてたの？」","en":"“M-<tips=10>Mido</tips>... Isn’t that man incredibly handsome? How can anyone be that handsome? Was he a model or something?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r382","rowIndex":382,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　早口でそう訴えると、<tips=10>見土</tips>さんはおかしそうに笑ったが、特に何も言わず、ただ黙って興奮する私を見守っていてくれた。","en":"I blurted it all out in a rush. <tips=10>Mido</tips> laughed in amusement, but said nothing and simply watched as I carried on in my excitement.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r383","rowIndex":383,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なに……？」","en":"“What...?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r384","rowIndex":384,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その声で<tips=44>筱喬</tips>が目を覚まし、眠そうに目をこすると、","en":"My voice woke <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips>. She rubbed her sleepy eyes.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r385","rowIndex":385,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ねえ、あなたのお兄さんって本当に素敵なのね？　<tips=44>筱喬</tips>の言ってたとおりだわ！　私どうしよう！」","en":"“Your brother really is wonderful, isn’t he? He’s everything you said, <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips>! What am I going to do?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r386","rowIndex":386,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そう言って肩を揺すると、彼女は事情なんか全然わかってないはずなのに、にたあと笑い、","en":"I shook her by the shoulders. She could not possibly have understood the situation, but a broad grin spread across her face.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r387","rowIndex":387,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうでしょう。そうでしょう」","en":"“Isn’t he? Isn’t he?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r388","rowIndex":388,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　と頷くのだ。","en":"She nodded.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r389","rowIndex":389,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　とにかく私はとても良い気持ちで、こんなに良い気持ちになったのは、過去に経験がない。今日は、会う人みんなが私を認めてくれて、好意的に肯定してくれる。それを思うと、世界がキラキラと輝き出すようだった。","en":"In any event, I felt wonderful—better than I had ever felt before. Today, every person I met had recognized something in me and responded with kindness and approval. The thought made the world itself begin to glitter.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D2:r390","rowIndex":390,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　なぜか「人類はみないい人たちだ！」と、大きな声でよくわからない言葉を叫び出したいような気分で、実際そう言ってしまうと、<tips=10>見土</tips>さんは今度は声を立てて笑った。","en":"For some reason, I felt like shouting something nonsensical at the top of my lungs—“All human beings are good people!” When I actually did, <tips=10>Mido</tips> laughed aloud this time.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}}]},{"position":20,"code":"X3-2","unitId":"X3-2","rows":[{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r1","rowIndex":1,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=57>滑走路通り</tips>と図書館通りが交差するところに『トラットリア・コズエ』という名のイタリア料理店がある。","en":"At the intersection of <tips=57>Runway Street</tips> and Library Street stood an Italian restaurant called Trattoria Kozue.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r2","rowIndex":2,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　イタリア人のシェフと、その日本人の妻が二人で切り盛りする小さな店だ。気取らない価格でイタリアの家庭の味を食わせるというのが売りで、地域の住人に愛されてのどかに経営をしていたのだが、<tips=9>Y地区</tips>が歓楽街として有名になりはじめた頃にメディアなどで取り上げられ、いまではすっかり人気店となった。","en":"It was a small restaurant run by an Italian chef and his Japanese wife. Its great attraction was the taste of Italian home cooking at unpretentious prices. Beloved by the neighborhood, it had once done business at a leisurely pace; but when <tips=9>Y District</tips> began to grow famous as an entertainment quarter, the media took notice, and by now it had become a popular destination.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r3","rowIndex":3,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ランチタイムともなると街の外からやってきた客が店の外まで行列を作り、今までのように気軽に食事をとることが出来ない。","en":"At lunchtime, customers from outside the neighborhood formed a line that stretched beyond the door, and it was no longer possible to drop in casually for a meal as before.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r4","rowIndex":4,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　観光客に店を奪われたような格好で、長らくこの店を愛して来たかつての常連客たちはかつてのようにふらりと店に入れない。かといって携帯端末をいじりながら行列を作るよそ者たちと一緒に並ぶのもためらわれ、結局冷たい視線を向けながら通り過ぎて行くことになる。観光客に人気なのはメインのイタリア料理ではなく、店主が地域の住人の要求にあわせて作った多国籍風のオリジナル料理の方で、いわばこの常連客たちが人気店にしたといっても過言ではない。その常連客が訪れにくくなったことについて、店主は心を痛めているらしい。","en":"It was as though the tourists had taken their restaurant away. The former regulars, who had loved the place for years, could no longer wander in as they once had. Yet they balked at lining up beside outsiders fiddling with handheld devices, and so in the end they passed by with cold looks. What the tourists favored was not the mainstay Italian fare, but the eclectic original dishes the proprietor had created to meet the neighborhood’s requests. It was no exaggeration to say that these regulars had made the restaurant popular. The proprietor was apparently distressed that they now found it so difficult to visit.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r5","rowIndex":5,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その日も小雨が降りそうで降らないとぼけた天候でありながら、『トラットリア・コズエ』の前には行列が出来ていた。このすぐ奥にはこの街でも古い住宅地があり、店の近辺もけして治安がいい訳ではなかったのだが観光客たちはそのことを知らない。行列の側を通り過ぎる住民たちの素性を、もし知ったらけしてのんきにしてはいられないだろう。","en":"That day, too, the weather remained noncommittal, forever threatening a drizzle that never came, yet a line had formed outside Trattoria Kozue. Just behind it lay one of the city’s older residential districts, and the area around the restaurant was by no means safe, though the tourists did not know that. If they knew who the residents passing beside the line really were, they could hardly have remained so carefree.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r6","rowIndex":6,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　肌や髪の色が違う、様々な人々が通り過ぎる。そのなかの一人に、とある細身の青年がいた。","en":"People of many different colors of skin and hair passed by. Among them was a certain slender young man.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r7","rowIndex":7,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼は何か考え事をしているのか、上着のポケットに手を突っ込み、若干背を丸め、前だけを見ながら早足で歩いていた。そして丁度行列の横を通り抜けようとしたところで、並んでいた若者の一人が仲間とふざけあって笑いながら二歩ほど後方へよろめき、ちょうど来た青年にぶつかってしまう。","en":"Apparently lost in thought, he walked quickly with his hands thrust into his jacket pockets, back slightly bent and eyes fixed ahead. Just as he was passing beside the line, one of the young men waiting there stumbled two steps backward while laughing and fooling around with his companions, colliding with him.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r8","rowIndex":8,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あっ、すみません」","en":"“Oh—sorry.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r9","rowIndex":9,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　若者はまだ笑みの消えきれない顔でそう謝ったが、青年はジロリとその方を一瞥しただけで、何も言わずに通り過ぎて行く。","en":"The young man apologized, the smile not yet gone from his face. The other gave him one sharp glance and continued on without a word.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r10","rowIndex":10,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なんだよ、あの態度は」","en":"“What’s with that attitude?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r11","rowIndex":11,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　若者は相手にも聞こえるような大きな声でそう言って、わざとらしく舌打ちをする。青年の耳にも届いているはずだが、振り返りもせずそのまま歩いて行った。","en":"The tourist said it loudly enough for the other man to hear and made an ostentatious click of his tongue. The young man must have heard him, but he walked on without looking back.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r12","rowIndex":12,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　相手が若者と年格好が変わらない、どこにでもいるような日本人に見えたからこのような大きな態度に出たのだろうが、もし青年の正体を知っていたら、どんな態度をとったのであろうか。","en":"The tourist had probably put on such a bold front because the other man looked like an ordinary Japanese man around his own age. But how would he have acted if he had known who the young man really was?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r13","rowIndex":13,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　無愛想な青年は、とてもそうは見えないが、この<tips=9>Y地区</tips>を支配する最大のマフィア組織『<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>』の幹部の一人であった。だけでなく、近いうちにそのボスの座につくことが約束されている。","en":"The unsociable young man hardly looked the part, but he was an officer of <tips=7>YS</tips>, the largest Mafia organization ruling <tips=9>Y District</tips>. More than that, he had been promised the boss’s seat in the near future.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r14","rowIndex":14,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　と言えばわかるだろう――何を隠そう、<tips=1>謝亮</tips>その人である。","en":"That should make it clear. The man was none other than <tips=1>Tse Leung</tips> himself.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r15","rowIndex":15,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼はこの三軒先にある中華料理店の三階に間借りし、そこで生活をしていた。","en":"He rented a room on the third floor of a Chinese restaurant three doors down and made his home there.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r16","rowIndex":16,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　店主の細君が時々手伝いなどもしてくれるが、基本的には身のまわりのことは自分で行う。食事なども材料を買ってきて自炊している。幼い頃に定食屋夫婦の家庭に預けられていたため一通りの料理は作ることが出来た。","en":"The proprietor’s wife sometimes helped him with one thing or another, but as a rule he took care of himself. He bought ingredients and cooked his own meals. Having been placed in the care of a couple who ran a set-meal restaurant when he was a child, he knew how to prepare a full range of ordinary dishes.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r17","rowIndex":17,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　食事時に訪問した来客は彼の手料理を口にする機会もあったらしく、実際にそれを賞味したとある<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>メンバーの話によると、なかなかの腕前であったそうだ。立場上<tips=1>謝亮</tips>のことを悪く言えないということを割り引いても、子供の頃にプロに技術を教わったのだから基本的なことは出来るのだろう。","en":"Visitors who came at mealtime apparently sometimes had the chance to taste his cooking. According to a certain member of <tips=7>YS</tips> who had sampled it, he was quite skilled. Even allowing for the man’s reluctance to criticize someone in <tips=1>Tse Leung’s</tips> position, Tse Leung had learned from professionals as a child, so he could presumably manage the fundamentals.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r18","rowIndex":18,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あいつは、なんでもやりたがるんですよ」","en":"“That guy always wants to try his hand at everything.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"林巧（十年後）","displayName":"Takumi Hayashi (10 Years Later)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r19","rowIndex":19,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　と語ったのは<tips=57>滑走路通り</tips>で喫茶店を経営している林という人物である。","en":"The speaker was a man named Hayashi who operated a coffee shop on <tips=57>Runway Street</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r20","rowIndex":20,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「好奇心が強いって言うのかな。色々と手を出して、器用だからそこそこなんでもこなす。出来ないことってあったのかな？　……あっ、そうだ。音楽だけは酷かったな。歌えば音痴だし、楽器を持たせればまるでリズムがとれない。……しかも、どういうわけか自分でそれに気がついていない。あいつが歌うと、みんなが笑ってからかうんですが、本人にとってはまるで不本意のようで、仏頂面で黙ってしまう」","en":"“He was intensely curious, I suppose. He tried his hand at all sorts of things, and because he was dexterous, he could do most of them passably well. Was there anything he couldn’t do? ...Oh, right. Music. He was terrible at that. He couldn’t carry a tune, and if you put an instrument in his hands, he couldn’t keep a beat at all. ...And for some reason, he never realized it himself. Whenever he sang, everyone laughed and teased him, but he seemed to think it grossly unfair and would clam up with a scowl.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"林巧（十年後）","displayName":"Takumi Hayashi (10 Years Later)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r21","rowIndex":21,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　林氏は子供の頃に<tips=1>亮</tips>とつき合いがあり、悪餓鬼仲間だった人物である。","en":"Mr. Hayashi had known <tips=1>Leung</tips> as a child and had belonged to the same little gang of delinquents.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r22","rowIndex":22,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　筆者がその家を訊ねた時は妻がいて、ひっきりなしに泣く赤子の面倒を見ていた。","en":"When the author visited his home, his wife was there, caring for a baby that cried almost without pause.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r23","rowIndex":23,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　かつて<tips=9>Y地区</tips>の不良少年には<tips=10>見土道夫</tips>を中心とし、<tips=17>タイプB</tips>の子供が多く集まった<tips=59>暗闇通り</tips>周辺のグループと、<tips=1>謝亮</tips>を中心とした<tips=58>パラシュート通り</tips>周辺のグループに別れて対立していた時期があった。","en":"There was a time when <tips=9>Y District’s</tips> juvenile delinquents were split between two rival groups: one, centered on <tips=10>Michio Mido</tips> around <tips=59>Darkness Street</tips>, included many <tips=17>Type Bs</tips>; the other centered on <tips=1>Tse Leung</tips> around <tips=58>Parachute Street</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r24","rowIndex":24,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　林氏もやはり<tips=17>タイプB</tips>で、見土や謝亮と同い年であり、少年時代の彼らと親しくしていた。筆者は当初見土<tips=10>道夫</tips>を中心に稿をまとめるつもりで、<tips=10>見土</tips>について取材すべく氏のもとを訪れたのだが、彼は<tips=10>見土</tips>ついては口が重く、結果、常に<tips=10>見土</tips>と並べて語られる<tips=1>謝亮</tips>の話になった。","en":"Mr. Hayashi was himself a <tips=17>Type B</tips>, the same age as Mido and Leung, and had been close to both as a boy. The author had originally intended to make <tips=10>Michio Mido</tips> the focus of the article and visited Mr. Hayashi to ask about <tips=10>Mido</tips>. Hayashi was reluctant to discuss <tips=10>Mido</tips>, however, and the interview turned instead to <tips=1>Tse Leung</tips>, whose name was invariably paired with <tips=10>Mido’s</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r25","rowIndex":25,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=1>菅原</tips>はそんなに悪いやつじゃなかったですよ」","en":"“<tips=1>Sugawara</tips> wasn’t such a bad guy.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"林巧（十年後）","displayName":"Takumi Hayashi (10 Years Later)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r26","rowIndex":26,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼は<tips=1>謝亮</tips>のことを、少年時代彼が名乗っていた<tips=1>菅原亮</tips>という名で呼ぶ。","en":"He called <tips=1>Leung</tips> by the name the boy had used in those days: <tips=1>Ryo Sugawara</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r27","rowIndex":27,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「おっかないところはありますけど、あれでも案外面倒見はいいんです。好き嫌いがあるから敵を作りやすいところはありますが。結構普通のやつですよ。……まあ、何を考えているかわからなくて、つかみ所がないのは確かです。仲間意識みたいなのもあんまりなかったんじゃないかな。誰にも相談しないで急に街を出て大学に行って、さらに帰って来たら、実は<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>の息子なので組織の跡を継ぐ、なんてねえ……」","en":"“He could be frightening, but for all that, he was surprisingly good about looking after people. His strong likes and dislikes did make it easy for him to make enemies. He was a fairly ordinary guy, really. ...Still, it’s true that you could never tell what he was thinking or get a handle on him. I don’t suppose he had much of a sense of comradeship, either. He left town for university without consulting anyone, then came back and announced that he was actually <tips=3>Chris Tse’s</tips> son and would inherit the organization...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"林巧（十年後）","displayName":"Takumi Hayashi (10 Years Later)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r28","rowIndex":28,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　林氏はそう言って立ち上がり、妻がいくらあやしても泣き止まない我が子を抱き上げた。","en":"With that, Mr. Hayashi rose and picked up his child, whom his wife had been unable to soothe.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r29","rowIndex":29,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>第三代<tips=81>龍頭</tips><tips=1>謝亮</tips>と言えば世間では冷酷な若きリーダーとしての印象が強く、私も同様の認識であったのだが、この旧友のどこかいとおしむような語り口で、思っていたのと違う実像があるのではないかと考えたのが、彼について本格的に調べるようになったきっかけである。","en":"The public image of <tips=1>Tse Leung</tips>, third <tips=81>Longtou</tips> of <tips=7>YS</tips>, is that of a cold-blooded young leader. I had shared it. Yet something in the old friend’s almost affectionate manner made me wonder whether the real man might differ from the one I had imagined. That question led me to investigate Leung in earnest.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r30","rowIndex":30,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その、<tips=1>謝亮</tips>。","en":"That <tips=1>Tse Leung</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r31","rowIndex":31,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　証しとなる杯はすでに譲り受けていたが、この時点で彼はまだ正式には第三代<tips=81>龍頭</tips>なってはいない。","en":"He had already inherited the cup that served as proof, but at this point he had not yet formally become the third <tips=81>Longtou</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r32","rowIndex":32,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　が、<tips=41>グランドタワー</tips>襲撃事件で<tips=39>ジェフリー・ウォン</tips>が死んだ今、事実上、彼が<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>、並びに<tips=76>香港派</tips>ギャングたちのリーダーであるのは間違いない。","en":"But with <tips=39>Jeffrey Wong</tips> dead in the attack on <tips=41>Grand Tower</tips>, there could be no doubt that he was the de facto leader of <tips=7>YS</tips> and the gangsters of its <tips=76>Hong Kong faction</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r33","rowIndex":33,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　第二代<tips=81>龍頭</tips>の<tips=84>マイケル・ツェー</tips>には組織をまとめようとする器量も気概もなく、方針のすべてを彼にゆだねていた。","en":"The second <tips=81>Longtou</tips>, <tips=84>Michael Tse</tips>, had neither the capacity nor the will to unite the organization and had entrusted every policy decision to Leung.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r34","rowIndex":34,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>創設者にして<tips=9>Y地区</tips>暗黒街のボスであった<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>の長男の最初の仕事は、この襲撃者への対応であった。","en":"The first task of the eldest son of <tips=3>Chris Tse</tips>—founder of <tips=7>YS</tips> and former boss of the <tips=9>Y District</tips> underworld—was to respond to the attacker.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r35","rowIndex":35,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　襲撃者はどういった派閥のものなのか、なぜ襲撃が起きたのか、事件そのものの調査はもちろんのこと、<tips=39>ジェフリー・ウォン</tips>はじめ襲撃で死んだ<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>組織員たちを弔ったり、動揺する組織に声明を発表したり、やるべきことはいくらでもあった。","en":"He had to determine which faction the attacker belonged to and why the attack had occurred, investigate the incident itself, mourn <tips=39>Jeffrey Wong</tips> and the other members of <tips=7>YS</tips> killed in it, and issue a statement to the shaken organization. There was no end to what had to be done.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r36","rowIndex":36,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　今日は病院からの帰り道である。彼が診察を受けたのではなく、他人の見舞いだ。","en":"Today he was on his way home from the hospital. He had not gone for an examination, but to visit someone.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r37","rowIndex":37,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　病院には<tips=51>熨田さくら</tips>という少女が入院している。","en":"A girl named <tips=51>Sakura Noshida</tips> had been admitted there.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r38","rowIndex":38,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=41>グランドタワー</tips>襲撃事件の犯人は、現場から逃走したあと、外出していた<tips=44>謝筱喬</tips>と遭遇した。","en":"After fleeing the scene, the culprit behind the attack on <tips=41>Grand Tower</tips> encountered <tips=44>Siu-kiu Tse</tips>, who had been out.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r39","rowIndex":39,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>謝亮</tips>はビルの外の方が安全だと考え、妹の<tips=44>筱喬</tips>には外での待機を命じていたのだが、これが裏目に出たのだ。混乱の報に触れてビルに帰れぬまま路上に車を停めて続報を持っていた<tips=44>筱喬</tips>を、この犯人のサイキックが襲撃したのである。","en":"<tips=1>Tse Leung</tips> had thought it safer outside the building and ordered his sister, <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips>, to wait there, but the decision backfired. Unable to return after hearing of the turmoil, <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> had parked on the street to await further news, and the psychic responsible for the attack assaulted her.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r40","rowIndex":40,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　車には、<tips=44>筱喬</tips>と共に<tips=81>龍頭</tips><tips=84>マイケル・ツェー</tips>の妻子なども同乗していた。少女が彼女たちの顔まで知っていたのか定かではないが、黒塗りの車のなかで屈強な男たちに守られている女たちという光景を見て、おおよその察しがついたのかもしれない。","en":"The car also held the wife and child of <tips=81>Longtou</tips> <tips=84>Michael Tse</tips>, along with <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips>. It was unclear whether the girl even knew their faces, but the sight of women inside a black car guarded by strapping men may have told her enough.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r41","rowIndex":41,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　手負いでもサイキックは強力だ。なんなくガードマンの一人を殺傷し、<tips=44>筱喬</tips>の誘拐を図る。","en":"Even wounded, a psychic was formidable. She effortlessly killed or wounded one guard and attempted to abduct <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r42","rowIndex":42,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そこに現れたのが、この<tips=51>熨田さくら</tips>だった。彼女は飛行能力を持った<tips=16>タイプA</tips>で、本人以外だれも知らなかったが、<tips=44>筱喬</tips>の秘密の友人だったらしい。","en":"It was <tips=51>Sakura Noshida</tips> who appeared. She was a <tips=16>Type A</tips> with the power of flight and, though no one else knew it, was apparently <tips=44>Siu-kiu’s</tips> secret friend.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r43","rowIndex":43,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=51>さくら</tips>はどうにか<tips=44>筱喬</tips>を奪還したものの、深い傷を負って病院に収容された。","en":"<tips=51>Sakura</tips> somehow managed to rescue <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips>, but suffered a grave wound and was taken to the hospital.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r44","rowIndex":44,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しばらく意識を失っていたのだが先日意識を取り戻し、<tips=1>亮</tips>はその入院先を見舞ったのだ。","en":"She had remained unconscious for some time, but regained consciousness the other day, and <tips=1>Leung</tips> had gone to visit her in the hospital.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r45","rowIndex":45,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　部屋に戻った<tips=1>亮</tips>は冷蔵庫にしまっておいた昨夜の夕食の残りを電子レンジに入れた。","en":"Back in his room, <tips=1>Leung</tips> put the remains of the previous night’s dinner, which he had stored in the refrigerator, into the microwave.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r46","rowIndex":46,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それは自分で作ったものではなく、<tips=57>滑走路通り</tips>のレストランで購入したものだった。パイ生地のなかにチリソースで味付けをした豚肉が入っている。テイクアウト可能なために、観光客がよく歩きながら食べているのを目にする。<tips=9>Y地区</tips>でありがちなどこかの国の郷土料理を持ち込んだものではなく、まったくのオリジナルのメニューだ。","en":"It was not something he had cooked himself, but something purchased at a restaurant on <tips=57>Runway Street</tips>: pork seasoned with chili sauce inside a pastry crust. Since it was available to take away, he often saw tourists eating it as they walked. It was not some traditional dish imported from one of the countries commonly represented in <tips=9>Y District</tips>, but an entirely original menu item.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r47","rowIndex":47,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>謝亮</tips>の夕食はごく簡素な自炊か、さもなければこうして街角で購入したもので、この生活スタイルは学生の頃と変わらない。","en":"<tips=1>Tse Leung’s</tips> dinners were either very simple meals he cooked himself or things purchased from street vendors in this fashion. His way of life had not changed since his student days.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r48","rowIndex":48,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=4>馬明</tips>などはもっと立場に相応しい生活をしろと口うるさく言うが、<tips=1>亮</tips>自身は簡素な生活が気にいっているようだ。生活と言えば、<tips=41>グランドタワー</tips>に住まないのも<tips=4>馬明</tips>は気にいらないらしい。不用心だと言うのである。","en":"<tips=4>Ma Ming</tips> was forever telling him to live in a manner more appropriate to his position, but <tips=1>Leung</tips> himself appeared to like a simple life. Speaking of his living arrangements, <tips=4>Ma Ming</tips> was apparently also displeased that he refused to live in <tips=41>Grand Tower</tips>. He considered it unsafe.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r49","rowIndex":49,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>謝亮</tips>も、もっともだとは思う。彼は今のところ正式に<tips=81>龍頭</tips>となったわけではないが、<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>の後継者に指名されている以上、<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>の、特に<tips=76>香港派</tips>にとって重要な人物であることはかわりない。現状組織のなかにも外にも<tips=1>謝亮</tips>を快く思わないものがいるだろうから、相応の備えをしたほうがいいのかもしれない。","en":"<tips=1>Tse Leung</tips> himself thought the concern reasonable. He had not yet formally become <tips=81>Longtou</tips>, but as the designated successor to <tips=3>Chris Tse</tips>, he remained an important figure to <tips=7>YS</tips>, especially its <tips=76>Hong Kong faction</tips>. There were likely people both inside and outside the organization who resented <tips=1>Tse Leung</tips>, so perhaps he ought to take suitable precautions.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r50","rowIndex":50,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ただ本人からすれば、たとえグランドタワーのなかで寝起きをしていても、危険度はさほど変わらないのだ。現在<tips=1>謝亮</tips>を殺して得をするのは、<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>の次代のリーダーを狙う人物だろう。組織のなかに敵がいるのだとすれば、<tips=41>グランドタワー</tips>に閉じこもっても意味はない。それならば街の外で暮らしたほうがマシだ。一応、一つのところに長居はせずに頻繁に住居を変え、彼の居場所を知っているのはごく一部の人間しかいないようにはしている。","en":"From his own perspective, however, sleeping in Grand Tower would hardly reduce the danger. At present, the person who stood to gain from killing <tips=1>Tse Leung</tips> would presumably be someone seeking to become the next leader of <tips=7>YS</tips>. If his enemies were inside the organization, shutting himself in <tips=41>Grand Tower</tips> would accomplish nothing. He would be better off living outside the city. He did at least move frequently rather than remain long in one place, and arranged matters so that only a very few people knew where he was.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r51","rowIndex":51,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そうして、御曹司に似つかわしくない薄ら寒い部屋でひとり食事の準備をする彼は、あの襲撃者のことを考えていた。","en":"And so, as he prepared his meal alone in a bleak, chilly room ill suited to a young heir, he thought about the attacker.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r52","rowIndex":52,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その襲撃者の少女は<tips=51>さくら</tips>と死闘を繰り広げ、かなりの上空から落下したそうだが今のところ死体は見つかっていない。","en":"The girl responsible for the attack had reportedly fought a life-or-death battle with <tips=51>Sakura</tips> and fallen from a considerable height, yet so far no body had been found.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r53","rowIndex":53,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　仲間がそばにいて、すぐに遺体を回収したのか。それとも、自力で逃走したのか。<tips=41>グランドタワー</tips>で銃弾を受け、さらに高所から落下したにもかかわらず、動くことが出来たというのなら、単に強靱だという言葉だけですませられる話ではない。普通に考えれば遺体が回収されていると考えるのが自然なのかもしれないが、<tips=1>謝亮</tips>は後者の説の方が有力だと考えていた。","en":"Had an accomplice been nearby and immediately recovered the body? Or had she escaped under her own power? If she had still been able to move after taking bullets at <tips=41>Grand Tower</tips> and then falling from a height, mere toughness could not explain it. Ordinarily, it might have been most natural to assume that someone had recovered the body, but <tips=1>Tse Leung</tips> considered the latter theory more likely.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r54","rowIndex":54,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それは、襲撃を受けた<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>のなかで、たった一人<tips=1>謝亮</tips>のみが想定出来る可能性であった。","en":"Of everyone in <tips=7>YS</tips> who had suffered the attack, it was a possibility <tips=1>Tse Leung</tips> alone could imagine.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r55","rowIndex":55,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼は、世の中には切り刻み肉片になっても生き続ける、途方もない存在があることを知っている。それは、<tips=17>タイプB</tips>のなかでもごく僅かな特別な存在のみが持つ能力であった。","en":"He knew that extraordinary beings existed in this world who continued living after they had been cut to pieces. It was an ability possessed by only a minute number of exceptional <tips=17>Type Bs</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r56","rowIndex":56,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　あれほどの強大な能力をもつものが、さらに無尽蔵の生命力を持っているという現実は考えたくはないが、そう考えるとすべてがしっくりとくる。襲撃者はあまりにも無謀だった。殺傷する動き自体は洗練されたものなのに、行動方針は行き当たりばったりで無計画。監視カメラで観た彼女の態度にもまるで緊張したところがない。","en":"He did not wish to contemplate the reality of someone who possessed both such tremendous power and inexhaustible vitality, yet the idea made everything fit. The attacker had been far too reckless. Her killing movements were refined, but her broader course of action was haphazard and unplanned. Even in the surveillance footage, she had shown no trace of tension.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r57","rowIndex":57,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　あれは不死身の肉体をもつがゆえの鈍感さだったのだろう。","en":"That insensibility to danger must have come from possessing an immortal body.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r58","rowIndex":58,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"（不死身の虎が出て来たと思えば、不死身のサイキックか）","en":"(First an immortal tiger, and now an immortal psychic?)","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r59","rowIndex":59,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　もし彼の考えている通り、相手が<tips=57>滑走路通り</tips>に現れたのと同じ無限の再生力を備えているのだとすれば、またすぐに回復し、襲撃をしてくるかもしれない。","en":"If, as he suspected, she possessed the same limitless regenerative power as the creature that had appeared on <tips=57>Runway Street</tips>, she might recover quickly and attack again.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r60","rowIndex":60,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　結局、相手の目的はなんなのか？　<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>の本拠地である<tips=41>グランドタワー</tips>を荒らしたかっただけなのか、それとも<tips=81>龍頭</tips>の命が欲しかったのか。明確な動機がわからない。現在明確に敵対している組織というものはない。<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>を憎んでいるということと、不死身ということを考えると、かつての<tips=18>ローズ・クラブ</tips>と関係が？　いや、それならば、<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>が生きていた時に襲撃していたはずだ。あれだけの能力を持ったサイキックがいるのならば、死を待つ必要もない。とすると、<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>が死んだことによって襲撃する理由が出来たのだと考えた方が自然だろう。","en":"What, ultimately, was her objective? Had she merely wanted to lay waste to <tips=41>Grand Tower</tips>, the headquarters of <tips=7>YS</tips>, or had she wanted the <tips=81>Longtou’s</tips> life? Her precise motive remained unknown. At present, no organization was openly hostile to them. Given both her hatred of <tips=7>YS</tips> and her immortality, could she have some connection to the former <tips=18>Rose Club</tips>? No. In that case, she should have attacked while <tips=3>Chris Tse</tips> was alive. A psychic with that much power would have had no need to wait for his death. It was more natural to suppose that <tips=3>Chris Tse’s</tips> death had given her a reason to attack.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r61","rowIndex":61,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"（やっぱり<tips=27>廖志明</tips>か……）","en":"(So it is <tips=27>Liao Chi-ming</tips> after all...)","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r62","rowIndex":62,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　この襲撃者は<tips=41>グランドタワー</tips>を襲う前に<tips=27>廖志明</tips>を襲撃している。これは単純に<tips=27>廖志明</tips>も敵のターゲットの一人だったと解釈することも出来るが、<tips=1>謝亮</tips>はそうは考えなかった。","en":"Before attacking <tips=41>Grand Tower</tips>, the assailant had attacked <tips=27>Liao Chi-ming</tips>. This could simply mean that <tips=27>Liao Chi-ming</tips> was another of her targets, but <tips=1>Tse Leung</tips> did not believe that.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r63","rowIndex":63,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　あれほどの力を持つサイキックの襲撃を受けたにもかかわらず、<tips=27>廖</tips>が無事で、しかもろくに犠牲者も出なかったというのはどうしても疑問が残る。むしろ、彼が襲撃に何らかの関わりを持っているのではないだろうか？　もっとも、現段階では何の証拠もないのだが。","en":"It remained deeply suspicious that <tips=27>Liao</tips> had emerged unhurt from an attack by a psychic of such power, with hardly any casualties at all. Might he instead have been involved in the attack somehow? At this stage, of course, there was no evidence.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r64","rowIndex":64,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"（何にしろ、やつのことははっきりさせなくてはいけない）","en":"(Whatever the truth, I have to get to the bottom of what he is up to.)","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r65","rowIndex":65,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　もしサイキック少女と<tips=27>廖志明</tips>の間に何の関わりもなかったとしても、彼の存在は香港グループの脅威として、前任者の<tips=39>ジェフリー・ウォン</tips>から引き継がれた課題であることは変わらない。","en":"Even if there was no connection between the psychic girl and <tips=27>Liao Chi-ming</tips>, his existence remained a threat to the Hong Kong group and an issue inherited from Leung’s predecessor, <tips=39>Jeffrey Wong</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r66","rowIndex":66,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=27>廖志明</tips>は相変わらず執行部に対して不遜な態度をつらぬいており、今回の件に関しても、二代目の名によるグランドタワーへの再三の呼び出しを、あれこれと理由を付けて断っている。彼が<tips=41>グランドタワー</tips>にやって来たのは、事件後一度きり。緊急会合で幹部を呼び集めたときだけだ。","en":"<tips=27>Liao Chi-ming</tips> maintained his insolent attitude toward the executive leadership. In the present matter, too, he had found one excuse after another to refuse repeated summonses to Grand Tower issued in the second Longtou’s name. He had come to <tips=41>Grand Tower</tips> only once since the incident, when the officers were summoned to an emergency meeting.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r67","rowIndex":67,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「だから私は警告をしていたでしょう？　奇妙な襲撃者がいると。しっかり備えをしておいたのかね？　備えをした上で、このざまだとしたら、あまりに情けない……」","en":"“I warned you, did I not? I told you that a strange attacker was at large. Did you prepare yourselves properly? If this is what happened even after you made preparations, it is altogether pathetic...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"廖志明","displayName":"Liao Chi-ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r68","rowIndex":68,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その席上、<tips=27>廖志明</tips>は挑発的に言い放った。","en":"At that meeting, <tips=27>Liao Chi-ming</tips> declared provocatively,","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r69","rowIndex":69,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「かつて<tips=69>義勝</tips>と言えば泣く子も黙る武闘派組織だったはずだ。これが、たとえ<tips=16>タイプA</tips>とは言え、娘っ子一人にこうも蹂躙されて幹部の命まで落とすとは、ふぬけたものですな」","en":"“<tips=69>Yisheng</tips> was once a fighting organization whose very name could silence a crying child. Yet here you have been trampled by one little girl, <tips=16>Type A</tips> or not, and even lost the life of an officer. How spineless you have become.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"廖志明","displayName":"Liao Chi-ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r70","rowIndex":70,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あなたも屋敷に入り込まれているじゃない」","en":"“Someone got into your mansion too, didn’t they?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エリー・ホワイト","displayName":"Ellie White","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r71","rowIndex":71,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=31>エリー・ホワイト</tips>がぼそりと呟くのを鼻で笑い、","en":"<tips=31>Ellie White</tips> muttered the remark. Liao snorted.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r72","rowIndex":72,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「私どもは見事撃退しましたぞ。……とにかく、こんな頼りのない執行部では、<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>の一員として非常に不安です。<tips=81>龍頭</tips>、この失態の責任をどうやってとるおつもりで？」","en":"“We drove ours off splendidly. ...In any event, as a member of <tips=7>YS</tips>, I find such an unreliable executive leadership deeply alarming. <tips=81>Longtou</tips>, how do you intend to take responsibility for this failure?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"廖志明","displayName":"Liao Chi-ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r73","rowIndex":73,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=27>廖志明</tips>の言い分は<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>の幹部として至極まっとうではあるが、疑いのフィルターを通すと、これを言いたいがために襲撃させたようにも聞こえる。","en":"<tips=27>Liao Chi-ming’s</tips> argument was perfectly reasonable for an officer of <tips=7>YS</tips>, but seen through the filter of suspicion, it sounded almost as though he had arranged the attack merely so that he could say it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r74","rowIndex":74,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「目下、犯人を捜索中だ。そのものを捕らえれば、色々なことが明らかになるだろう」","en":"“We are presently searching for the culprit. Once we capture that person, many matters will become clear.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"マイケル・ツェー","displayName":"Michael Tse","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r75","rowIndex":75,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=84>マイケル・ツェー</tips>の声はその自信のなさを反映して、とても小さくか弱かった。","en":"<tips=84>Michael Tse’s</tips> voice was very soft and frail, reflecting his lack of confidence.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r76","rowIndex":76,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「捕らえられるものですかな？　あなたがたに」","en":"“And do you believe the lot of you capable of capturing her?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"廖志明","displayName":"Liao Chi-ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r77","rowIndex":77,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=27>廖</tips>はもう一度鼻で笑う。面と向かって侮辱同然の言葉を吐かれた<tips=84>マイケル</tips>は、鼻白んで口を閉ざす。","en":"<tips=27>Liao</tips> snorted again. All but insulted to his face, <tips=84>Michael</tips> recoiled and fell silent.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r78","rowIndex":78,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　他の幹部たちはひそひそと囁き合っていた。<tips=27>廖</tips>の屋敷に訪れ、<tips=41>グランドタワー</tips>を襲撃したのならば、次は彼らの住まいに現れてもおかしくはない。そしてもしあのサイキックがやって来たら、追い返すのは簡単なことではない。","en":"The other officers whispered among themselves. If the attacker had visited <tips=27>Liao’s</tips> mansion and struck <tips=41>Grand Tower</tips>, she might appear at their homes next. And if that psychic came for them, driving her off would be no simple matter.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r79","rowIndex":79,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　今日の議題は彼らにとって他人事ではなかったのだ。","en":"For them, the matter under discussion that day was no abstract concern.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r80","rowIndex":80,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「もちろんだ」","en":"“Of course we are.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬明","displayName":"Ma Ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r81","rowIndex":81,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　こたえられなくなった<tips=81>龍頭</tips>のかわりに口を開いたのは<tips=4>馬明</tips>だった。","en":"<tips=4>Ma Ming</tips> spoke in place of the <tips=81>Longtou</tips>, who could no longer answer.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r82","rowIndex":82,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　長身に脂肪のついた巨大な身体をどっしりと椅子の上に乗せ、ギラギラと光る目で<tips=27>廖</tips>の顔を見つめている。<tips=69>義勝</tips>のなかでも特に武闘派として知られている彼は、<tips=69>義勝</tips>を軟弱と罵られては、黙っていられるものではない。しかも、親友の死まであざけられているのである。","en":"He settled his enormous, heavyset frame solidly into the chair and stared at <tips=27>Liao</tips> with glittering eyes. Known as one of <tips=69>Yisheng’s</tips> most militant fighters, he could hardly remain silent while <tips=69>Yisheng</tips> was reviled as weak—especially when his close friend’s death was being mocked into the bargain.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r83","rowIndex":83,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　今にも怒鳴り出しそうな感情を抑えつつ、一同を見回し、睨み付けた。","en":"Holding back the anger that had him on the verge of shouting, he swept a glare around the room.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r84","rowIndex":84,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そのために、みなさんがたにも協力していただく。侵入者の姿は映像としてとらえられている。これを資料としてお渡しするので、是非活用してほしい。我々の総力をあげ、<tips=9>Y地区</tips>の草の根を分けてでも、このガキを捕まえる。……<tips=27>廖</tips>どのも、協力していただけますな？」","en":"“To that end, we will require everyone’s assistance. The intruder was captured on video, which we will distribute as reference material. Please make full use of it. We will bring our combined strength to bear and comb every inch of <tips=9>Y District</tips> until we catch this brat. ...I trust we can count on your cooperation as well, Mr. <tips=27>Liao</tips>?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬明","displayName":"Ma Ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r85","rowIndex":85,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「もちろん。私も<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>の一員であることにはかわらない。このような失態をそのままにしておけませんからな」","en":"“Naturally. I remain a member of <tips=7>YS</tips>. We cannot leave a disgrace of this kind unanswered.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"廖志明","displayName":"Liao Chi-ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r86","rowIndex":86,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ふん、犯人が見つかったあとも、今と同じ態度でいられることを祈っていますよ」","en":"“Hmph. I hope you can maintain that same attitude after the culprit is found.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬明","displayName":"Ma Ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r87","rowIndex":87,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どういう意味だ？」","en":"“What do you mean?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"廖志明","displayName":"Liao Chi-ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r88","rowIndex":88,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=4>馬明</tips>の不穏な言葉に、<tips=27>廖</tips>は鋭い目で問い返す。","en":"At <tips=4>Ma Ming’s</tips> ominous words, <tips=27>Liao</tips> shot back with a piercing glare.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r89","rowIndex":89,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なにもかも出来すぎているんですよ。誰だって疑いを持ちたくなるほどに。これが全てただの偶然であることを祈りたいですな」","en":"“Everything is a little too convenient. Convenient enough to make anyone suspicious. I can only hope it is all mere coincidence.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬明","displayName":"Ma Ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r90","rowIndex":90,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　事前に<tips=1>謝亮</tips>と見解を一致させていた<tips=4>馬明</tips>は、二人で話したそのままの内容をこの席上で口にした。<tips=1>亮</tips>は苦い顔をしたが<tips=4>馬明</tips>自身は気にしてはいない。","en":"Having already agreed with <tips=1>Tse Leung</tips> on this point, <tips=4>Ma Ming</tips> repeated before the gathering exactly what the two of them had discussed in private. <tips=1>Tse Leung</tips> grimaced, but <tips=4>Ma Ming</tips> himself was unconcerned.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r91","rowIndex":91,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「自分が何を言っているか、わかっているのだろうな？」","en":"“You do understand what you’re saying, I trust?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"廖志明","displayName":"Liao Chi-ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r92","rowIndex":92,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「身の潔白を証明したいのなら、是非とも真剣に襲撃者を見つけ、本当の目的をはっきりさせることですな。そもそもあんたは……」","en":"“If you wish to prove your innocence, I suggest that you search for the attacker in earnest and establish her true purpose. To begin with, you—”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬明","displayName":"Ma Ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r93","rowIndex":93,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=4>馬明</tips>、もういい」","en":"“<tips=4>Ma Ming</tips>, that’s enough.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r94","rowIndex":94,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　挑発の笑みを浮かべながら続けようとする<tips=4>馬明</tips>に、<tips=1>亮</tips>は仕方なく釘を刺した。","en":"As <tips=4>Ma Ming</tips> started to continue with a provocative smile, <tips=1>Tse Leung</tips> reluctantly reined him in.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r95","rowIndex":95,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=27>廖</tips>さん。僕の方から謝罪します」","en":"“Mr. <tips=27>Liao</tips>, allow me to apologize on his behalf.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r96","rowIndex":96,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>が立ち上がって頭を下げると、<tips=27>廖</tips>は苦々しく鼻を鳴らし、","en":"<tips=1>Tse Leung</tips> rose and bowed. <tips=27>Liao</tips> gave a bitter snort.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r97","rowIndex":97,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いつもの軽口のつもりなのかもしれないが、こんな場所であまりにも軽々しいお喋りをすべきじゃない。命取りになっても知りませんよ」","en":"“Perhaps you mean it as your usual banter, but you should not speak so carelessly in a place like this. If it costs you your life, don’t say I didn’t warn you.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"廖志明","displayName":"Liao Chi-ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r98","rowIndex":98,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「その通りです。あまりに口が過ぎました。彼も<tips=39>ジェフリー</tips>の件で神経質になっているのです。どうか今回は許していただきたい」","en":"“You are quite right. He went far too far. What happened to <tips=39>Jeffrey</tips> has put him on edge. Please forgive him this once.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r99","rowIndex":99,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その<tips=1>亮</tips>の態度に<tips=4>馬明</tips>は不満そうだったが、口を挟むのはどうにか堪えたようだ。","en":"Though <tips=4>Ma Ming</tips> looked displeased at <tips=1>Tse Leung’s</tips> response, he somehow managed to keep himself from interrupting.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r100","rowIndex":100,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……御曹司がそこまで言うのなら、これは一つ貸しということにして、引き下がりましょう。以後気をつけることですな。……おい、帰るぞ」","en":"“...If the young master is prepared to go that far, I’ll let the matter drop and count this as a favor you owe me. See that it doesn’t happen again. ...Come, we’re leaving.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"廖志明","displayName":"Liao Chi-ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r101","rowIndex":101,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=27>廖</tips>は息子の<tips=28>トーマス</tips>に声をかけると、席を立った。","en":"<tips=27>Liao</tips> called to his son <tips=28>Thomas</tips>, then rose from his seat.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r102","rowIndex":102,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=28>トーマス</tips>は、もの言いたげな表情で<tips=1>亮</tips>の顔をちらちらと窺いながら、父のあとを追って行く。","en":"<tips=28>Thomas</tips> followed his father out, stealing repeated glances at <tips=1>Tse Leung</tips> as though he wanted to say something.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r103","rowIndex":103,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あの野郎。絶対ぶっ殺してやる」","en":"“That bastard. I’m going to fucking kill him.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r104","rowIndex":104,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　会合のあと、<tips=4>馬明</tips>は怒気をあらわにしてそう言った。","en":"That was what <tips=4>Ma Ming</tips> said after the meeting, his fury undisguised.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r105","rowIndex":105,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>は先ほどは<tips=4>馬明</tips>をなだめる側に回ったが、彼とても、<tips=27>廖志明</tips>をこのままにしていいと思っているわけではない。彼が襲撃事件に関わっていたとしても、そうでなかったとしてもだ。","en":"<tips=1>Tse Leung</tips> had taken it upon himself to calm <tips=4>Ma Ming</tips> earlier, but that did not mean he thought they could simply leave <tips=27>Liao Chi-ming</tips> be—whether Liao had been involved in the attack or not.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r106","rowIndex":106,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"（しかし、あの<tips=27>廖志明</tips>をやるのは簡単なことじゃないぞ。うまくやらないとこちらも大損害を被ることになる。<tips=4>馬明</tips>が言うように、さっさと殺してしまうというのも悪くはない手だが……）","en":"(But dealing with <tips=27>Liao Chi-ming</tips> won’t be easy. If we mishandle it, we’ll suffer heavy losses ourselves. Killing him outright, as <tips=4>Ma Ming</tips> suggests, isn’t a bad option, but...)","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r107","rowIndex":107,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　考え事をしていた<tips=1>亮</tips>は、電子レンジから取り出した夕食をほとんど無意識に口に詰め込んでしまった。","en":"Lost in thought, <tips=1>Tse Leung</tips> shoved a bite of the dinner he had taken from the microwave into his mouth without thinking.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r108","rowIndex":108,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「うわっ」","en":"“Whoa!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r109","rowIndex":109,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　と、誰もいない部屋で一人、声をあげて慌てる。外側はそれほどではなかったのだが、中の具は加熱されすぎていた。沸騰寸前まで熱せられた肉汁とソースの混じったものが口内に流れ込んだのだ。","en":"Alone in the empty room, he cried out and scrambled in alarm. The outside had not been especially hot, but the filling was scalding. Meat juices and sauce heated almost to boiling flooded his mouth.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r110","rowIndex":110,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼はすぐに冷たい水で口の中を冷やす。","en":"He immediately rinsed his mouth with cold water to cool it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r111","rowIndex":111,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"（そう言えば、子供の頃も定食屋の二人に、食べるときは食べ物に集中しろと言われていたっけ）","en":"(Come to think of it, when I was a child, the two of them at the diner were always telling me to pay attention to my food while I ate.)","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r112","rowIndex":112,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　成長していない自分に情けない気持ちになりつつ、一旦考え事をやめ、慎重に食べ進める。","en":"Feeling pathetic at how little he had grown, he set his thoughts aside for the moment and resumed eating carefully.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r113","rowIndex":113,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　一旦冷えて、温め直したにもかかわらずパイ生地はさくさくとしており、中の具はジューシィだ。チリソースで甘辛く味付けされた豚のバラ肉は肉の部分も柔らかく、脂身もしつこく感じられない。それほどいい肉を使っているはずはないから、処理がうまいのだろう。","en":"Though it had gone cold and been reheated, the pastry remained flaky and crisp, the filling juicy. The pork belly, seasoned sweet and spicy with chili sauce, was tender, and even the fat never felt cloying. They could hardly be using particularly fine meat, so they must know how to prepare it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r114","rowIndex":114,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"（下味には少しオイスターソースを使っているのかな）","en":"(Maybe they used a little oyster sauce in the marinade.)","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r115","rowIndex":115,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　火傷した口に温かいチリソースはしみたが、涙目になりながらもすぐに完食してしまった。","en":"The warm chili sauce stung his scalded mouth. Even so, he polished off the dish almost at once, his eyes watering all the while.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r116","rowIndex":116,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　思いの外に腹が減っていたようで、これだけでは物足りず、インスタントラーメンを鍋で茹でたのだが、さっき気をつけたばかりにもかかわらず、すぐに思索に耽ってタイマーをかけ忘れ、麺をのびさせてしまう。","en":"He must have been hungrier than he expected, because that alone did not satisfy him. He put a pot of instant ramen on to boil, but despite the lesson he had learned only moments ago, he promptly sank back into thought, forgot to set a timer, and let the noodles turn soggy.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r117","rowIndex":117,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　今日は一日中この調子だ。<tips=27>廖志明</tips>のこと、サイキック少女のこと、考えることは多かった。そして、目の前のことに対してほとんど上の空になっている。","en":"He had been like this all day. There was much to think about—<tips=27>Liao Chi-ming</tips>, the psychic girl—and he had become almost completely oblivious to whatever lay before him.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r118","rowIndex":118,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼はこれからすべきことに迷っているわけではなかった。具体的な方針は、心のなかでは決まっている。","en":"It was not that he was uncertain what to do next. In his heart, he had already settled upon a concrete course.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r119","rowIndex":119,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ただ、それを実行した場合どうなるのか。先のことを正確に予測しようとすれば、いくら考えても考えたりない。","en":"But what would happen if he put it into practice? If he meant to predict the future precisely, no amount of thought could ever be enough.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r120","rowIndex":120,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　人が自分の運命を切り開く時には、大きなギャンブルに挑戦しなくてはならない瞬間がある。彼自身がどう自覚しているかはわからないが、間違いなくその瞬間が訪れようとしていた。","en":"There comes a moment, when people carve out their own destinies, when they must risk everything on a great gamble. Whatever he himself may have thought, that moment was unmistakably drawing near.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r121","rowIndex":121,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼の少年時代からの行動を見る限り、用意周到に物事を運び、万全を期した上で実行に移るタイプのようだ。<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>に参加して、いくつかの危険な橋を渡らざるを得なかったのは彼としては不本意だったかもしれない。しかし、今回の件は、これまでのどれよりも危険な賭けとなるだろう。出来ればやりたくはなかったが、しかし他に方法もなさそうだ。彼とすればそこが苦しいところである。","en":"Judging from his conduct since boyhood, he appears to have been the sort who planned everything carefully and acted only after taking every possible precaution. Joining <tips=7>YS</tips> may have forced him, much against his wishes, to take several dangerous risks. Yet this affair would be his most dangerous gamble yet. He would rather avoid it if he could, but there seemed to be no other way. That was the bind he found himself in.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r122","rowIndex":122,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　結局日付が変わる直前まで考え続けて、そこでようやく彼は決断を下す。それを伝えるべく、まず側近である<tips=25>馬世傑</tips>の携帯電話に連絡をした。","en":"In the end, he continued thinking until shortly before midnight. Only then did he decide. To communicate that decision, he first called his close aide, <tips=25>Ma Sai-kit</tips>, on her cell phone.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r123","rowIndex":123,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"『何？』","en":"‘What?’","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r124","rowIndex":124,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そう遅い時間でもなかったが、<tips=25>世傑</tips>は眠たげな声で電話に出た。仕事のない日は早寝早起きにつとめていると普段から言っていたが、本当のようだ。","en":"It was not terribly late, but <tips=25>Sai-kit</tips> answered in a sleepy voice. She often said that on days without work she made a point of going to bed and rising early. Apparently, she meant it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r125","rowIndex":125,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=27>廖志明</tips>の件だ」","en":"“It’s about <tips=27>Liao Chi-ming</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r126","rowIndex":126,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"『……何か考えがまとまったの？』","en":"‘...Have you settled on a plan?’","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r127","rowIndex":127,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ああ。結論はシンプルだ。長引かせる必要はない。すぐにケリをつけよう」","en":"“Yes. The conclusion is simple. There’s no need to drag this out. Let’s settle it at once.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r128","rowIndex":128,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　受話器の向こうで息を飲む音がする。","en":"He heard a sharp intake of breath on the other end of the line.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r129","rowIndex":129,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"『やるのね？』","en":"‘You’re going to do it?’","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r130","rowIndex":130,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=25>世傑</tips>はその言葉で目を覚ましたらしい。","en":"Those words seemed to wake <tips=25>Sai-kit</tips> fully.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r131","rowIndex":131,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ああ。これ以上泳がせても、相手に時間を与えるだけだろう。<tips=4>馬明</tips>の言葉でこちらが疑っているのも明白になってしまった。少しでも早く動くのが得策だ。といっても、殺しはしない。交渉をして、こちらの言うことを聞いてもらう」","en":"“Yes. Leaving him at large any longer will only give him more time. <tips=4>Ma Ming’s</tips> words have made it clear that we suspect him. Our best move is to act as soon as possible. That said, we won’t kill him. We’ll negotiate and make him accept our terms.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r132","rowIndex":132,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"『交渉？　それは無理だわ。相手にまともに話し合う気なんかないのは明白じゃないの』","en":"‘Negotiate? That’s impossible. It’s obvious he has no intention of discussing anything seriously.’","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r133","rowIndex":133,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いやでも話したくなるさ。詳しい話は明日タワーで……いや、<tips=4>馬明</tips>の家でやろう。みんなを集めてくれ」","en":"“We’ll make him want to talk. I’ll explain the details tomorrow at the Tower—no, at <tips=4>Ma Ming’s</tips> house. Gather everyone.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r134","rowIndex":134,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　一方その頃、<tips=27>廖志明</tips>の屋敷では<tips=28>トーマス・リャオ</tips>が自室の椅子を立って、少し歩いてはまた座り、そして時折ううむとうなり声を上げていた。","en":"Meanwhile, at <tips=27>Liao Chi-ming’s</tips> estate, <tips=28>Thomas Liao</tips> kept rising from the chair in his room, pacing a little, and sitting down again, every so often letting out a troubled groan.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r135","rowIndex":135,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　金髪碧眼のアングロサクソンを母に持つ<tips=28>トーマス</tips>は、色の明るい巻き毛と、鳶色の瞳、血管が透けるような白い肌を持っている。これで造形のほうも良かったら文句のない容姿であったが、顔は愛嬌はあるもののとても美形とは言えないつくりで、薄あばたがある。スタイルも、背こそ高かったが脂肪が多く、小太りだった。","en":"<tips=28>Thomas’s</tips> mother was a fair-haired, blue-eyed Anglo-Saxon. From her he had inherited light-colored curls, hazel eyes, and skin so white the veins seemed to show through. Had his features been handsome as well, his appearance would have been beyond reproach. His face, however, was amiable but far from beautiful, with faint pockmarks. And though he was tall, his build carried a good deal of fat, leaving him pudgy.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r136","rowIndex":136,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「これはどうしたものだろう？」","en":"“What am I supposed to do about this?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r137","rowIndex":137,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　たまりかねて、傍らの<tips=29>アイス</tips>にそう声をかける。","en":"Unable to contain himself any longer, he addressed <tips=29>Ice</tips> beside him.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r138","rowIndex":138,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「襲撃には、本当に関係していないのに、<tips=4>馬明</tips>はすっかり僕らの差し金だと信じ込んでいる。ということは、<tips=2>阿亮</tips>も同じ考えなんだろう。……こんなふうに疑われるのなら、最初から全部正直に言えばよかったのに」","en":"“We truly had nothing to do with the attack, but <tips=4>Ma Ming</tips> is utterly convinced that we arranged it. Which means <tips=2>Ah Leung</tips> must think the same thing. ...If they were going to suspect us like this, we should have told them the whole truth from the beginning.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r139","rowIndex":139,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=28>トーマス</tips>からすると、そこが腑に落ちない。少女があらわれ、<tips=27>廖志明</tips>に協力を申し出たことや、目の前で消えて瞬間移動を披露したことなど、伝えるべき情報はいくらでもあったはずだ。","en":"That was the part <tips=28>Thomas</tips> could not understand. The girl had appeared and offered <tips=27>Liao Chi-ming</tips> her cooperation; she had vanished before his eyes and demonstrated her power of teleportation. There had been any number of things they ought to have reported.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r140","rowIndex":140,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「疑われても仕方ないんだよ。だって、わざと情報を隠して、あわよくば<tips=76>旧義勝</tips>の幹部たちが殺されればいいと、父さんはきっとそう思ってたんだからね。それならせめて黙ってればいいのに、ほれ見たことかと執行部を責めたり、事前にあんな変なメール送ったりして……。結局、相手を陥れることしか考えてないんだもの。これじゃ言い訳は出来ないよ」","en":"“We can hardly blame them for being suspicious. Dad deliberately hid the information, hoping, I’m sure, that with any luck the officers of <tips=76>old Yisheng</tips> would be killed. If that was what he wanted, he could at least have kept quiet. Instead he berated the executive leadership afterward, as if to say ‘See? I told you so,’ and even sent that strange email in advance... In the end, all he ever thinks about is how to bring down the other side. There’s no defending this.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r141","rowIndex":141,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「お父様のことをそんなふうにおっしゃるのはめずらしいですね」","en":"“It’s rare to hear you speak that way about your father.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アイス","displayName":"Ice","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r142","rowIndex":142,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=29>アイス</tips>はやや驚いたように口を開く。","en":"<tips=29>Ice</tips> answered with mild surprise.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r143","rowIndex":143,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「言いたくないけど、今回ばかりは言いたいよ！　それで実際<tips=39>ジェフリー</tips>さんや、たくさんの人が亡くなってしまったし……。すべて教えていれば、みんな助かったかもしれないでしょう？　やっぱり、どんな手を使ってでも<tips=2>阿亮</tips>に連絡をとればよかったんだ。嗚呼！　僕も勇気が足りなかった！」","en":"“I hate to say it, but this time it has to be said! Mr. <tips=39>Jeffrey</tips> and so many other people actually died because of it... If we had told them everything, they might all have survived. I should have contacted <tips=2>Ah Leung</tips>, no matter what it took. Ah! I didn’t have the courage!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r144","rowIndex":144,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=28>トーマス</tips>は頭を抱える。","en":"<tips=28>Thomas</tips> clutched his head.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r145","rowIndex":145,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=28>トーマス</tips>さまがご自分を責める必要はありません」","en":"“You have no need to blame yourself, <tips=28>Master Thomas</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アイス","displayName":"Ice","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r146","rowIndex":146,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=29>アイス</tips>はその肩にそっと手を置き、","en":"<tips=29>Ice</tips> placed a hand gently upon his shoulder.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r147","rowIndex":147,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=28>トーマス</tips>さまはとてもお優しい。純粋に死を悲しまれているのですね」","en":"“You are very kind, Master <tips=28>Thomas</tips>. You grieve for death itself, purely and without reservation.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アイス","displayName":"Ice","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r148","rowIndex":148,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あたりまえだよ。だって、僕にも責任があるんだから」","en":"“Of course I do. I bear some responsibility too.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r149","rowIndex":149,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いえ、<tips=39>ジェフリー・ウォン</tips>や彼の部下を悲しんでいるのは、<tips=28>トーマス</tips>さまの他には彼らの身内くらいのものでしょう。<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>の他のメンバーや、街のものたちは、悲しみとは別の意味を感じてはいるでしょうが」","en":"“No. Apart from Master <tips=28>Thomas</tips>, I expect that only their own families mourn <tips=39>Jeffrey Wong</tips> and his men. The other members of <tips=7>YS</tips> and the people of the city may feel something about their deaths, but it is not grief.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アイス","displayName":"Ice","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r150","rowIndex":150,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そんなはずないよ。だって、ついさっきまで普通に話していた人が死んでしまうなんて、それは誰であれ悲しいことじゃないか！　そりゃ、僕らには利害関係があるから表向きはそうも言ってられないだろうけど、みんな内心では必ずどこかに悲しみがあるんだよ。生物の死っていうものはそういうものだ」","en":"“That can’t be true. Someone you were talking to perfectly normally only moments ago is suddenly dead—how could anyone not find that sad? Of course our interests are entangled, so perhaps none of us can say so openly. But everyone must carry grief somewhere inside. That is simply what the death of a living creature means.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r151","rowIndex":151,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=28>トーマス</tips>の熱弁を、<tips=29>アイス</tips>は否定も肯定もせず、ただ穏やかに見つめている。","en":"<tips=29>Ice</tips> neither agreed with nor contradicted <tips=28>Thomas’s</tips> impassioned speech. She merely watched him with a gentle expression.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r152","rowIndex":152,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……僕の母方のお祖父ちゃんが狩猟が趣味だったんだ。だから僕も向こうにいるときは、よくお祖父ちゃんが鉄砲で撃った動物を食べさせてもらったよ。それはとても美味しいんだけど、でもやっぱり死体を目にすると、死そのものの悲しみがある。だから、僕はいつもね、何かを食べるときは、料理の味だけじゃなくて、死の味も感じてるんだ。何かの命を奪って生きているのに、死の味を忘れてしまうのは、とても傲慢なことだと思うから……。この街では色んな意見が対立していて、時には殺し合いも起きるけど、殺す方だってみんなどこかでは悲しみを感じていると思う。だってそれが人間なんだもの。<tips=29>アイス</tips>にもわかるでしょう？」","en":"“...My grandfather on my mother’s side hunted as a hobby. So when I was over there, he often fed me animals he had shot. The meat was delicious, but whenever I saw a carcass, I still felt the sorrow inherent in death itself. That is why, whenever I eat, I taste not only the food but death as well. We live by taking other lives, and I think it terribly arrogant to forget the taste of death... This city is divided by all kinds of conflicting beliefs, and sometimes people even kill one another over them. But I believe that even the killers feel sorrow somewhere inside. Because that is what human beings are. You understand, don’t you, <tips=29>Ice</tips>?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r153","rowIndex":153,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=29>アイス</tips>は答えにくそうに肩をすくめたが、<tips=28>トーマス</tips>はその目を見つめて、逃がそうとはしない。","en":"<tips=29>Ice</tips> shrugged as though the question were difficult to answer, but <tips=28>Thomas</tips> held her gaze and would not let her escape it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r154","rowIndex":154,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　仕方なく彼女は答えを口にした。","en":"Left with no choice, she gave him an answer.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r155","rowIndex":155,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……昔はあったような気はしましたが、今は何も感じません。あまりにもありふれていますから」","en":"“...I think perhaps I felt something like that once, but now I feel nothing. It has become far too commonplace.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アイス","displayName":"Ice","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r156","rowIndex":156,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「たくさんつらい目にあって来たんだね。かわいそうに……」","en":"“You must have suffered so much. You poor thing...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r157","rowIndex":157,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=28>トーマス</tips>はその瞳に涙を浮かべる。","en":"Tears gathered in <tips=28>Thomas’s</tips> eyes.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r158","rowIndex":158,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「この街にはきっと、<tips=29>アイス</tips>みたいな大人や、子供がたくさんいるんだと思う。心がひからびて固くなってしまっているんだ。……ねえ<tips=29>アイス</tips>。この街から、どうやったら意味のない争いや殺し合いをなくすことが出来るだろう？」","en":"“There must be many adults and children like you in this city, <tips=29>Ice</tips>. Their hearts have dried out and hardened. ...Tell me, <tips=29>Ice</tips>. How can we put an end to the meaningless conflict and killing in this city?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r159","rowIndex":159,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=29>アイス</tips>は、わからない、という風に首を横に振る。","en":"<tips=29>Ice</tips> shook her head as if to say she did not know.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r160","rowIndex":160,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「出来ることじゃないのかもしれないね。でも、少しでも減らしたいんだ」","en":"“Perhaps it can’t be done. But I want to reduce the conflict, even if only a little.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r161","rowIndex":161,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=28>トーマス</tips>は溜息をつき、脱力したように椅子の背もたれに身体を預ける。","en":"<tips=28>Thomas</tips> sighed and slumped back in the chair.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r162","rowIndex":162,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「僕は、父さんの仕事をあまりにも知らなすぎたな。前の<tips=39>ジェフリー</tips>さんへの中傷ビラのこともそうだし、今回の襲撃事件だって、まあ出会ったときの父さんの反応からすると九十九パーセント無関係だとは思うけど、でも絶対に何もしてないとは言い切れない。父さんが何をしているのか、よく見て、ちゃんと知っておかないと……」","en":"“I knew far too little about Dad’s work. The slanderous broadsheets about Mr. <tips=39>Jeffrey</tips> were one example. As for this attack, judging from Dad’s reaction when he encountered her, I believe he’s ninety-nine percent uninvolved. But I can’t say with certainty that he did nothing at all. I need to watch him closely and understand what he’s doing...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r163","rowIndex":163,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「言い方は悪いですが、監視をすると？」","en":"“To put it unkindly, you mean to monitor him?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アイス","displayName":"Ice","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r164","rowIndex":164,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=28>トーマス</tips>は頷く。","en":"<tips=28>Thomas</tips> nodded.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r165","rowIndex":165,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「父さんがファミリーみんなのために頑張ってるのはわかってるけど、それが沢山の対立や悲劇を生むのなら、僕も無関係ではいられない。……父さんのやりかたに反対するとか、止めるとか、そういう話ではなくて、知っておかなくちゃいけないことなんだよ」","en":"“I know Dad works hard for everyone in the family. But if what he does produces so much conflict and tragedy, I can’t remain uninvolved. ...I’m not talking about opposing the way he does things, or trying to stop him. I just need to know what he is doing.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r166","rowIndex":166,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「おっしゃりたいこと、わかります」","en":"“I understand what you mean.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アイス","displayName":"Ice","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r167","rowIndex":167,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ありがとう。そのときにはきっと、きみの『ちから』が必要になると思う。……手を貸してくれるかい？」","en":"“Thank you. When the time comes, I’m sure I will need your ‘power.’ ...Will you help me?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r168","rowIndex":168,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=28>トーマス</tips>がその目を見て頼むと、<tips=29>アイス</tips>はこくりと頷いて、","en":"When <tips=28>Thomas</tips> met her eyes and made the request, <tips=29>Ice</tips> gave a small nod and said,","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r169","rowIndex":169,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「命令してくだされば、おっしゃるとおりに致します」","en":"“If you give me the order, I will do as you command.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アイス","displayName":"Ice","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r170","rowIndex":170,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　と言った。","en":"That was her answer.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r171","rowIndex":171,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=39>ジェフリー・ウォン</tips>が死んでから、<tips=1>謝亮</tips>の組織内での存在感が増した。","en":"After <tips=39>Jeffrey Wong</tips> died, <tips=1>Tse Leung’s</tips> presence within the organization grew.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r172","rowIndex":172,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　たった一人の<tips=81>龍頭</tips>の補佐という立場になってからは、ほぼ<tips=81>龍頭</tips>と同等の地位にあるものとして扱われている。彼は父のようなサイキック能力こそなかったが、若く、発言は堂々としていて明快で、そして<tips=26>劉建志</tips>の件で勇気も示した。彼をただのボンボンだと評価するものはもういないだろう。これから先、<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>の運命に彼の言動が大きく影響してゆくのを、構成員の全てが感じていたはずだ。","en":"Once he became the <tips=81>Longtou’s</tips> sole aide, he was treated as holding virtually the same rank as the <tips=81>Longtou</tips> himself. He lacked his father’s psychic powers, but he was young, spoke boldly and clearly, and had shown courage in the affair involving <tips=26>Ryu Kenshi</tips>. No one could still dismiss him as a pampered scion. Every member of <tips=7>YS</tips> must have sensed that his words and actions would have a profound effect on the organization’s fate from that point forward.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r173","rowIndex":173,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　一方、街ではまだそれほど存在感のある人物ではなかった。","en":"In the city at large, however, he was not yet much of a presence.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r174","rowIndex":174,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>の御曹司であり将来の<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips><tips=81>龍頭</tips>になるだろうという程度の情報は流れていたが、これまでは<tips=39>ジェフリー・ウォン</tips>の影に隠れていたし、<tips=26>劉建志</tips>殺害に関与したことは世間に知られていない。","en":"People knew that he was <tips=3>Chris Tse’s</tips> heir and would probably become the next <tips=81>Longtou</tips> of <tips=7>YS</tips>, but until now he had remained in <tips=39>Jeffrey Wong’s</tips> shadow, and the public knew nothing of his involvement in the killing of <tips=26>Ryu Kenshi</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r175","rowIndex":175,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　不良少年<tips=1>菅原亮</tips>の名前はそれなりに有名だったが、顏を知っているのは同世代くらいだし、当時とは何年も経ってすっかり大人になっている。葬式パレードの時、オープンカーにのって礼服に身を包んだ彼が同一人物だと気づいたのは果たして何人だったろう？　つまり、この<tips=1>謝亮</tips>という人物は、事情に詳しくない多くの者にとって突然現れた見知らぬ人物であった。むしろ妹の<tips=44>謝筱喬</tips>のほうが<tips=81>龍頭</tips>の愛娘としてよく知られていたかもしれない。","en":"The name <tips=1>Ryo Sugawara</tips> had acquired a certain notoriety in his delinquent days, but only people of his own generation knew his face, and in the years since then he had grown fully into an adult. How many people at the funeral procession had recognized the man in formal dress riding in the convertible as that same delinquent? In other words, to the many people who did not know the circumstances, <tips=1>Tse Leung</tips> was a stranger who had suddenly appeared from nowhere. His sister, <tips=44>Siu-kiu Tse</tips>, may have been better known as the <tips=81>Longtou’s</tips> beloved daughter.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r176","rowIndex":176,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　この<tips=1>謝亮</tips>は様々な事件の当事者となり、街でも大いに恐れられる存在になってゆくのだが、その最初のきっかけは、やはり<tips=27>廖志明</tips>誘拐事件となる。","en":"This <tips=1>Tse Leung</tips> would become a party to many incidents and a figure greatly feared throughout the city, but the first event to set that course in motion was, after all, the kidnapping of <tips=27>Liao Chi-ming</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r177","rowIndex":177,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=76>旧義勝</tips>の香港グループにとって目下最大のライバルである<tips=27>廖志明</tips>には、世間によく知られた欠点がある。","en":"<tips=27>Liao Chi-ming</tips>, currently the greatest rival facing <tips=76>old Yisheng’s</tips> Hong Kong group, had one widely known weakness.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r178","rowIndex":178,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それは極度の女好きだということだ。","en":"That flaw was his extreme weakness for women.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r179","rowIndex":179,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=9>Y地区</tips>の内外に多くの愛人を持ち、夜ごと相手を変えて荒淫の限りを尽くしている。一度気にいった女はものにしなければ気が済まないという強引な性格で、当然トラブルも多かったが、豊富な財力と、街の支配者である<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>の大幹部であるという立場を使えばねじ伏せられないものはなかった。","en":"He kept many mistresses inside and outside <tips=9>Y District</tips>, changed partners nightly, and indulged his lust to every extreme. His overbearing nature would not let him rest until he possessed any woman who caught his eye. Naturally, this produced constant trouble, but with his abundant wealth and his position as a senior officer of <tips=7>YS</tips>, the organization ruling the city, there was nothing he could not crush.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r180","rowIndex":180,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「もうちょっと、控えたほうがいいんじゃないですかね」","en":"“Don’t you think you ought to exercise a little more restraint?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エリオット・ネス","displayName":"Eliot Ness","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r181","rowIndex":181,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ボディーガードの<tips=23>エリオット</tips>などは主人を守るという職務上の都合からそう忠告することがあったが、本人はどこ吹く風で、","en":"His bodyguard <tips=23>Elliott</tips> sometimes warned him out of professional concern for his master’s safety, but Liao merely let the warning wash over him:","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r182","rowIndex":182,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「英雄色を好む」","en":"“Heroes are fond of women.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"廖志明","displayName":"Liao Chi-ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r183","rowIndex":183,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　と、一向に耳を貸そうとはしなかった。","en":"He refused to listen in the slightest.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r184","rowIndex":184,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　あまりの強情さに、しまいには<tips=23>エリオット</tips>も、「女で死ぬのならボスにとって本望なんでしょうな」とさじを投げるほどである。","en":"He was so incorrigibly stubborn that even <tips=23>Elliott</tips> finally threw up his hands: ‘If the boss dies over a woman, I suppose that’s exactly how he’d want to go.’","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r185","rowIndex":185,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　当然のことながら、<tips=1>亮</tips>は彼のこの性質に目を付けた。","en":"Naturally, <tips=1>Tse Leung</tips> seized upon this trait.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r186","rowIndex":186,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　毎晩愛人のところへゆくのなら、そこを襲えば良い。もちろん<tips=27>廖志明</tips>も無防備というわけではなく、愛人宅へ向かうにも武器を持ったボディーガードを引き連れ、防弾装備を施した車を使う。そして、彼が愛人と愉しんでいるその間は、建物の周りにはぬかりなく部下を配置している。","en":"If he visited a mistress every night, then that was where they should strike. Of course, <tips=27>Liao Chi-ming</tips> was not defenseless: even on the way to a mistress’s home, he traveled in an armored car with armed bodyguards. And while he enjoyed himself with her, his men were deployed around the building with no gaps in their guard.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r187","rowIndex":187,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　自分が愛人と戯れる部屋のすぐ目の前を部下に警備させるなど、<tips=1>亮</tips>からすれば恥というものがないのかという感想だが、むしろその図太さこそが<tips=27>廖志明</tips>の強みなのかもしれない。","en":"To <tips=1>Tse Leung</tips>, making his subordinates guard the very door of the room where he dallied with a mistress raised the question of whether the man knew any shame at all. Yet perhaps that very shamelessness was one of <tips=27>Liao Chi-ming’s</tips> strengths.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r188","rowIndex":188,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　とまあ、<tips=27>廖</tips>は<tips=27>廖</tips>なりに警戒してはいるのだが、それでも彼の自宅を襲撃するよりはずっとやりやすいだろうというのが<tips=1>謝亮</tips>の判断だった。","en":"So <tips=27>Liao</tips> had taken precautions in his own distinctly <tips=27>Liao</tips> fashion, but <tips=1>Tse Leung</tips> judged that attacking him there would still be far easier than assaulting his estate.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r189","rowIndex":189,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「今回の作戦の肝は、なるべく流血を少なくすることだ。だって彼らには作戦の後は忠実な部下として働いて貰わなくちゃいけないんだからね。余計な遺恨は作りたくない。理想は死者をゼロで終わらせることだ」","en":"“The key to this operation is to shed as little blood as possible. After all, once it is over, we need them to work for us as loyal subordinates. I don’t want to create needless grudges. Ideally, we’ll finish without a single death.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r190","rowIndex":190,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　仲間を集めて<tips=1>亮</tips>は最初にそう言った。ここは<tips=41>グランドタワー</tips>ではなく、<tips=4>馬明</tips>の邸宅のリビングルームである。その場にいるのは、<tips=84>マイケル・ツェー</tips>、<tips=4>馬明</tips>、<tips=25>馬世傑</tips>をはじめとした<tips=76>旧義勝</tips>の幹部たちであり、他の派閥のものは一人もいない。","en":"After gathering his allies, <tips=1>Tse Leung</tips> opened with those words. They were not in <tips=41>Grand Tower</tips>, but in the living room of <tips=4>Ma Ming’s</tips> estate. Present were <tips=84>Michael Tse</tips>, <tips=4>Ma Ming</tips>, <tips=25>Ma Sai-kit</tips>, and the other officers of <tips=76>old Yisheng</tips>. Not one member of another faction was there.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r191","rowIndex":191,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=4>馬明</tips>と<tips=25>世傑</tips>という犬猿の仲の親子が同じ席に揃うのは珍しく、彼らは並んで腰掛けようとはせず、机の端と端に離れて着席している。","en":"It was rare for <tips=4>Ma Ming</tips> and <tips=25>Sai-kit</tips>, a father and daughter who got along like cats and dogs, to attend the same meeting. They refused to sit beside each other and took seats at opposite ends of the table.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r192","rowIndex":192,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そんな方法があるのか？　言うのは簡単だが、死者を出さないというのは難しいぞ」","en":"“Is there really a way to do that? It’s easy to say, but avoiding any deaths will be difficult.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬明","displayName":"Ma Ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r193","rowIndex":193,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その<tips=4>馬明</tips>ははじめから懐疑的な表情をしている。","en":"From the outset, <tips=4>Ma Ming</tips> wore a skeptical expression.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r194","rowIndex":194,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「別に難しくはないさ。<tips=4>馬明</tips>の頭には、人と武器を集めて勇ましく乗り込むなんてやり方しかないんだろうが」","en":"“It isn’t especially difficult. I suppose the only method <tips=4>Ma Ming</tips> can imagine is gathering men and weapons and charging in heroically.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r195","rowIndex":195,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　よく考えた上でこの場に臨んでいる<tips=1>亮</tips>は落ち着き払っていた。","en":"<tips=1>Tse Leung</tips> had come to the meeting only after thinking the plan through, and remained perfectly composed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r196","rowIndex":196,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まあ、僕の説明を聞いてくれ」","en":"“Just hear me out.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r197","rowIndex":197,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼はそう言って、皆が囲むテーブルの上にタブレットＰＣを置き、指先で操作をする。","en":"With that, he placed a tablet PC on the table in the middle of the group and began tapping at the screen.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r198","rowIndex":198,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「我々は<tips=39>ジェフリー</tips>の件の報復のために<tips=27>廖志明</tips>の女関係を調査し、愛人のリストを作成していたけれど、それが今回役に立った」","en":"“To retaliate for what happened to <tips=39>Jeffrey</tips>, we investigated <tips=27>Liao Chi-ming’s</tips> affairs and compiled a list of his mistresses. That work has proved useful now.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r199","rowIndex":199,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　画面には女の顔が映った画像が何枚も並べて表示される。","en":"The screen displayed a grid of photographs showing women’s faces.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r200","rowIndex":200,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=27>廖志明</tips>が手を出した女はこの<tips=9>Y地区</tips>の中だけでも数えきれないほどいるけれど、現在定期的に会っている女はこの七人だ。そのうち四人は同じマンションに住まわせて、ハーレムのようなものを構成している。残り三人は<tips=9>Y地区</tips>内外にそれぞれマンションの一室を与えられ、贅沢な生活をしている。この一人暮らしをしている方が、特にお気に入りってわけだろう。で、そのなかの一人が、このエリカ・ビリンガムだ」","en":"“<tips=27>Liao Chi-ming</tips> has pursued more women than anyone could count in <tips=9>Y District</tips> alone, but these are the seven he currently sees on a regular basis. Four live in separate rooms in the same apartment building, forming a kind of harem. The remaining three have each been given an apartment inside or outside <tips=9>Y District</tips> and live in luxury. The ones who live alone must be particular favorites of his. One of them is Erika Billingham.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r201","rowIndex":201,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼は写真の一枚をタップすると、画面一杯にその女の顔が表示される。","en":"He tapped one of the photographs, and the woman’s face expanded to fill the screen.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r202","rowIndex":202,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「えらい美人だこと。こんな子が、あのおっさんの愛人をしているのかと思うと、世界の悲しみというものを感じるわねえ」","en":"“What a beauty. To think a girl like this is that old man’s mistress makes me feel all the sorrow in the world.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬世傑","displayName":"Ma Sai-kit","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r203","rowIndex":203,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=25>世傑</tips>が溜息をつく。","en":"<tips=25>Sai-kit</tips> sighed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r204","rowIndex":204,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「彼女は二十才。他の愛人も大体そうなのだけれど、彼女も<tips=27>廖志明</tips>好みの金髪碧眼だな。両親はイギリス人で、元々は東京で英語教師を行っていたのが、八年前に<tips=9>Y地区</tips>へやって来て今は小さなパブを経営している。このエリカは昨年<tips=27>廖志明</tips>に目を付けられて愛人になった。別に好きでなったわけじゃない。両親のパブの経営状況が芳しくなくて、<tips=27>廖</tips>のちらつかせる金と暴力に屈する形で契約を受け入れたんだ。まあ、よくある話さ」","en":"“She is twenty. Like most of his other mistresses, she has the blond hair and blue eyes <tips=27>Liao Chi-ming</tips> favors. Her parents are British. They originally taught English in Tokyo, but came to <tips=9>Y District</tips> eight years ago and now run a small pub. Erika caught <tips=27>Liao Chi-ming’s</tips> eye last year and became his mistress. It wasn’t something she wanted. Her parents’ pub was struggling, and she accepted the contract only after capitulating to the money and violence <tips=27>Liao</tips> dangled before them. A common enough story.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r205","rowIndex":205,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>は表情一つ変えず、説明を続ける。","en":"<tips=1>Tse Leung</tips> continued his explanation without a change in expression.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r206","rowIndex":206,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「現在も<tips=27>廖</tips>の資金援助を受けている。だが、両親、特に父親のビリンガム氏は今でもしばしば<tips=27>廖</tips>への不満を露骨に言葉にし、そのせいでトラブルを引き起こしている。……どうも、彼は有色人種への差別意識が強い人物らしいね。中国人に娘を金で買われたのが屈辱的で仕方ないんだよ。<tips=27>廖</tips>のことは、あの中国野郎と言って、その名を呼ぶことさえしないんだぜ？　本来ならばこのような発言は許されないはずだが、<tips=27>廖</tips>は寛容に見て見ぬフリをしている。まあ、そこら辺は<tips=27>廖</tips>の面白いところだな。ちんけなプライドを発揮するよりも、娘のエリカを自由に出来るという実益の方を選んでいる。下手に父親に何かをすれば、エリカ本人がどういう行動をとるかわからないからね。彼女は精神的に不安定で、定期的に自殺などを試みては、病院へ運ばれている。本人もまだ現状を受け入れられないんだろう」","en":"“They still receive financial support from <tips=27>Liao</tips>. But her parents—especially Mr. Billingham—still voice their resentment toward <tips=27>Liao</tips> quite openly, causing trouble in the process. ...It seems he is deeply prejudiced against people of color. He finds it unbearably humiliating that a Chinese man bought his daughter. He calls <tips=27>Liao</tips> ‘that Chinese bastard’ and refuses even to say his name. Remarks like that would ordinarily never be tolerated, but <tips=27>Liao</tips> turns a remarkably indulgent blind eye. That is one interesting thing about <tips=27>Liao</tips>: rather than assert his petty pride, he chooses the practical benefit of being free to do as he pleases with Erika. If he handled her father clumsily, there would be no telling what Erika herself might do. She is emotionally unstable and periodically attempts suicide, only to be taken to the hospital. She probably still cannot accept her present situation.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r207","rowIndex":207,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>はそこで一同を見回し、","en":"At that point, <tips=1>Tse Leung</tips> looked around at them all and said,","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r208","rowIndex":208,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「今回、彼女を使う」","en":"“This time, we’ll use her.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r209","rowIndex":209,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それはどうかな」","en":"“I’m not so sure about that.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬明","displayName":"Ma Ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r210","rowIndex":210,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=4>馬明</tips>は渋い顔をしている。","en":"<tips=4>Ma Ming</tips> looked sour.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r211","rowIndex":211,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いくら現状に不満があったって、そう簡単に裏切るやつはいない。すくなくとも今のままだったら家族みな無事に生きていけるのだし、裏切りに失敗すれば死ぬよりも恐ろしい結末が待っている。恐怖に縛られた人間を動かすのは難しい」","en":"“No matter how dissatisfied she may be, people do not betray someone so easily. At least as things stand, her whole family can go on living in safety. If the betrayal fails, a fate worse than death awaits them. It is hard to make someone ruled by fear take action.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬明","displayName":"Ma Ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r212","rowIndex":212,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それは僕だってわかってる」","en":"“I know that.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r213","rowIndex":213,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>は即答をする。","en":"<tips=1>Tse Leung</tips> answered without hesitation.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r214","rowIndex":214,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「でも、出来るんだよ。<tips=27>廖志明</tips>を嫌っている女は他にもいるが、このエリカを選んだのには理由がある」","en":"“But it can be done. <tips=27>Liao Chi-ming</tips> has other mistresses who hate him, but I chose Erika for a reason.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r215","rowIndex":215,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「大事にしている両親を人質にでもとるか？」","en":"“Will you take her beloved parents hostage?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬明","displayName":"Ma Ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r216","rowIndex":216,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「物騒だなあ。そんなことはしないよ」","en":"“That’s awfully violent. I won’t do anything like that.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r217","rowIndex":217,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>は肩をすくめると、また指先を動かして画面を操作し、別の写真を呼び出す。","en":"<tips=1>Tse Leung</tips> shrugged, worked the screen with one finger again, and called up another photograph.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r218","rowIndex":218,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そこには、二十才前後と思われる東洋人の男性が映っていた。","en":"It showed an Asian man apparently around twenty years old.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r219","rowIndex":219,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「これはだれ？」","en":"“Who’s this?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬世傑","displayName":"Ma Sai-kit","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r220","rowIndex":220,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=25>世傑</tips>は<tips=1>亮</tips>の顔を見る。","en":"<tips=25>Sai-kit</tips> looked at <tips=1>Tse Leung</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r221","rowIndex":221,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「エリカ・ビリンガムの恋人だ」","en":"“Erika Billingham’s lover.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r222","rowIndex":222,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>は<tips=4>馬明</tips>の方を見ながらそう答える。","en":"<tips=1>Tse Leung</tips> answered while looking toward <tips=4>Ma Ming</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r223","rowIndex":223,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=27>廖志明</tips>と出会う前からつき合っていた。今もこっそり会っている。この恋人の存在は、東洋人ぎらいの父親はまったく知らない。もちろん<tips=27>廖志明</tips>も知らない。……この恋人がキーパーソンになるんだ」","en":"“They were together before she met <tips=27>Liao Chi-ming</tips>. They still meet in secret. Her father, who hates Asians, knows nothing of the lover’s existence. Of course, <tips=27>Liao Chi-ming</tips> knows nothing either. ...This lover is the key.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r224","rowIndex":224,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうか、この恋人を人質にとるんだな」","en":"“I see. So you’ll take the lover hostage.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬明","displayName":"Ma Ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r225","rowIndex":225,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=4>馬明</tips>、どうしてあんたはそういう発想しかないんだ」","en":"“<tips=4>Ma Ming</tips>, why is that the only kind of idea you ever have?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r226","rowIndex":226,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>は溜息をつき、","en":"<tips=1>Leung</tips> sighed, then said,","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r227","rowIndex":227,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「少し想像すればわかるだろう？　この恋人の東洋人も、エリカ・ビリンガムも僕と同じくらいの年齢だ。そして僕は昔、この街ではなかなか顔が広かった。つまりね、僕は昔から彼らを知っているんだよ。この恋人の東洋人は僕の仲間で、当時からエリカとつき合ってたからよく自慢されたものさ。……まあこの子じゃなくても、さっきの写真の赤毛の女も昔どこかで一度会ったことがあるし、他にも、知人の知人くらいで繋がってたりはするんだが、まあ、エリカが一番近いからね」","en":"“You could work it out with a little imagination. This man and Erika Billingham are both about my age, and I used to have connections all over this city. In other words, I’ve known them for years. He ran with my crowd, and because he was already dating Erika back then, I had to listen to him brag about her often enough. ...Well, even if it weren’t her, I once met that red-haired woman in the earlier photograph somewhere, and several of the others are connected to me through friends of friends. Erika is simply the closest connection.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r228","rowIndex":228,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ずいぶん顔が広いのね」","en":"“You certainly know an awful lot of people.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬世傑","displayName":"Ma Sai-kit","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r229","rowIndex":229,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=25>世傑</tips>が驚くと、","en":"When <tips=25>Sai-kit</tips> stared at him in surprise, he explained,","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r230","rowIndex":230,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=27>廖志明</tips>が街で評判の美人ばっかりかたっぱしから愛人にするからいけないのさ。僕らの世代ではそれなりに有名な女ばっかりだもの。僕じゃなくたって、当時の少年ならみんな顔くらい知ってるだろうよ。みんな毎日のように女の品評会をしていたからね」","en":"“The problem is that <tips=27>Liao Chi-ming</tips> works his way through every local beauty with a reputation and makes her his mistress. All of them were fairly well known among our generation. Any boy back then would at least have recognized their faces. We boys used to sit around rating girls practically every day.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r231","rowIndex":231,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>はそう言って苦笑する。","en":"<tips=1>Tse Leung</tips> gave a wry smile as he said it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r232","rowIndex":232,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なるほど、<tips=2>阿亮</tips>はそうなのねえ。私の頃は、もっと細かいグループで別れてたからねえ。そんなにたくさんの情報は入ってこなかったわ。さすが、不良グループの頂点に立ったボスだわねえ」","en":"“I see. So that was your world, <tips=2>Ah Leung</tips>. When I was that age, everyone was split up into much smaller groups, so that much information never reached me. I suppose that’s what I should expect from the boss who stood at the top of all the delinquent gangs.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬世傑","displayName":"Ma Sai-kit","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r233","rowIndex":233,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「僕はボスだったわけじゃない」","en":"“I wasn’t the boss.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r234","rowIndex":234,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>はあまりその話題に触れたくないのか、苦い顔をする。","en":"<tips=1>Tse Leung</tips> grimaced, apparently reluctant to touch on the subject.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r235","rowIndex":235,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「とにかく、このエリカと恋人に協力を取り付ける。彼らを説得する自信はある。……<tips=81>龍頭</tips>、ここまではよろしいでしょうか？」","en":"“In any event, we’ll win the cooperation of Erika and her lover. I’m confident I can persuade them. ...<tips=81>Longtou</tips>, does all of this meet with your approval so far?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r236","rowIndex":236,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>は<tips=81>龍頭</tips><tips=84>マイケル・ツェー</tips>の方を向いて言った。","en":"<tips=1>Tse Leung</tips> turned toward <tips=81>Longtou</tips> <tips=84>Michael Tse</tips> as he spoke.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r237","rowIndex":237,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「かまわない。……<tips=2>阿亮</tips>、お前はもう私の意見など聞く必要はないんだよ。すべて自由にやってくれてかまわない」","en":"“I have no objection. ...<tips=2>Ah Leung</tips>, you no longer need to ask for my opinion. You may do everything as you see fit.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"マイケル・ツェー","displayName":"Michael Tse","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r238","rowIndex":238,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼は肩をすくめるが、","en":"He gave a shrug, but said,","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r239","rowIndex":239,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうはいきませんよ」","en":"“I can’t do that.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r240","rowIndex":240,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>はまじめくさった顔で言い、そしてまた一同に向かうと、","en":"<tips=1>Tse Leung</tips> answered with a solemn expression, then turned back to the others:","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r241","rowIndex":241,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「じゃあ、説得に成功した後のことだけれど……」","en":"“Now, as for what happens once we’ve persuaded them...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r242","rowIndex":242,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=27>廖志明</tips>はシンガポールで生まれた。","en":"<tips=27>Liao Chi-ming</tips> was born in Singapore.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r243","rowIndex":243,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　といっても、本人には全くその地での記憶がない。生まれてすぐに両親と共に日本の中華街へやって来たからである。それ以来ずっと日本で暮らしている。","en":"That said, he had no memory of the place. Soon after his birth, he came with his parents to one of Japan’s Chinatowns and had lived in the country ever since.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r244","rowIndex":244,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ルーツを辿ればそこに辿り着くということで客家人を名乗っているが、もちろん客家語は喋れないし、こんな経歴だから、客家どころか中国本土に対しても、自分のルーツだという意識以外に何か具体的な思い出があるわけでもない。","en":"He called himself Hakka because that was where the trail of his ancestry ultimately led. Naturally, he could not speak the Hakka language. Given his history, neither the Hakka nor even mainland China meant anything concrete to him beyond the knowledge that his roots lay there.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r245","rowIndex":245,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼のファミリーにいる客家人の多くは似たような経歴で、実際には本土のことなど知らぬ、世界のあちこちで暮らす華僑の三世、四世といったものたちばかりである。","en":"Many of the Hakka in his Family had similar histories: they were third- and fourth-generation overseas Chinese living throughout the world who knew virtually nothing of the mainland itself.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r246","rowIndex":246,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　親は英語と中国語は得意だったが、どちらもシンガポール独特の訛りがあり、日本語は現在でもカタコトだ。<tips=27>廖志明</tips>はこの三つの言葉をすべて母国語のようにあやつった上に、ポルトガル語とフランス語の会話が出来る。父の商売の顧客に外国人が多かったというのもあるが、<tips=27>廖志明</tips>の誰とも臆せず喋れる図太さや、気軽に口まねを出来る軽薄さなどが生まれつきの記憶力やコミュニケーション能力の高さとあいまって、言語の習得を容易にしたのだろう。","en":"His parents spoke English and Chinese well, though both languages carried distinctive Singaporean accents, and even now their Japanese remained broken. <tips=27>Liao Chi-ming</tips> commanded all three languages like native tongues and could also converse in Portuguese and French. His father’s business had many foreign clients, but that was only part of the explanation. <tips=27>Liao Chi-ming</tips> also possessed the nerve to speak to anyone without hesitation and the glib willingness to imitate another person’s speech. Together with his inborn memory and communication skills, those traits probably made languages easy for him to acquire.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r247","rowIndex":247,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　この希有な才能が、<tips=9>Y地区</tips>に来てから非常に役に立った。","en":"This rare gift proved enormously useful after he arrived in <tips=9>Y District</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r248","rowIndex":248,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=27>廖志明</tips>が<tips=9>Y地区</tips>にやって来たのは二十才の頃だ。平凡な商売人だったはずの親はいつの間にか悪い取引にも手を出しはじめていて、商売は拡大していたが評判は悪かった。そして悪評が広まった結果中華街を追われ、従業員と共に<tips=9>Y地区</tips>へ移り住んだのである。","en":"<tips=27>Liao Chi-ming</tips> came to <tips=9>Y District</tips> when he was twenty. His parents, once supposedly ordinary merchants, had begun dabbling in disreputable transactions. Their business grew, but so did their bad reputation. Once that reputation spread, they were driven out of Chinatown and moved to <tips=9>Y District</tips> with their employees.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r249","rowIndex":249,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　当時の<tips=9>Y地区</tips>は基地の跡地に肉体労働者や密入国外国人や犯罪者が勝手に住み着いたもので、今ほど発展はしていなかったが今よりも荒んでいた。","en":"At the time, <tips=9>Y District</tips> had sprung up when manual laborers, foreigners who had entered the country illegally, and criminals settled without permission on the abandoned base. It was less developed than it is today, but even more run-down and lawless.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r250","rowIndex":250,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　この土地で商売をはじめた廖一家は、さらに事業を拡大させるためにマフィアへと変化する。<tips=9>Y地区</tips>では、出身地ごとの地域的な繋がりや、人種の繋がり、ミュータント同士の繋がりの組織が自衛のためにマフィアへとなってしまうケースが多いが、純粋に組織が金銭的な利益だけを求めた結果マフィアになってしまったのは、この<tips=74>廖ファミリー</tips>くらいだろう。","en":"The Liao household began doing business there and transformed itself into a Mafia organization in order to expand still further. In <tips=9>Y District</tips>, organizations linked by common homeland, race, or mutant status often became Mafia groups for self-defense, but the <tips=74>Liao Family</tips> may have been the only one to become Mafia purely through the pursuit of financial gain.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r251","rowIndex":251,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして、組織の成り立ちも珍しいが、構成する人員も変わっている。<tips=74>廖ファミリー</tips>は客家人の組織だとよく言われるが、実際のところ廖一家のルーツが客家系だというだけで、構成するメンバーの国籍は実に豊かである。","en":"The organization’s origins were unusual, and so was its membership. The <tips=74>Liao Family</tips> was often called a Hakka organization, but in truth only the Liao household’s roots were Hakka; its members represented a remarkable variety of nationalities.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r252","rowIndex":252,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ほとんど香港出身者ばかりで構成されている<tips=69>義勝</tips>や、南米人ばかりの<tips=75>フェルナンデス・ファミリー</tips>とは全く違うのだ。","en":"It was entirely unlike <tips=69>Yisheng</tips>, composed almost exclusively of people from Hong Kong, or the <tips=75>Fernandes Family</tips>, made up almost entirely of South Americans.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r253","rowIndex":253,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして、<tips=27>廖志明</tips>の持つ言語能力は、こうした国際色豊かな組織を率いるにはうってつけであった。","en":"<tips=27>Liao Chi-ming’s</tips> linguistic gifts were ideally suited to leading such an international organization.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r254","rowIndex":254,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　もちろん、雑多な民族の寄せ集めであるこの<tips=9>Y地区</tips>で商売を行うにも極めて有利である。その結果、彼はメンバーの支持を得て弱冠二十八才でリーダーとなった。","en":"Naturally, they also gave him an extraordinary advantage when conducting business in <tips=9>Y District</tips>, a jumble of many ethnic groups. As a result, he won the members’ support and became their leader at the young age of twenty-eight.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r255","rowIndex":255,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　親はまだ隠居をするような年でもなかったが、この時ファミリーから完全に離れてシンガポールに戻り、今も平和に遊び暮らしている。","en":"His parents were not yet old enough for retirement, but at that point they left the family completely and returned to Singapore, where they still enjoyed a peaceful life of leisure.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r256","rowIndex":256,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　この<tips=27>廖志明</tips>は若い頃から素行が悪い。特に女癖のひどさは中華街にいた少年時代からのもので、それによる失敗も多い。","en":"<tips=27>Liao Chi-ming</tips> had been badly behaved since his youth. His terrible way with women in particular went back to his boyhood in Chinatown and had landed him in trouble many times.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r257","rowIndex":257,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「このままじゃ、女で死にますよ」","en":"“At this rate, a woman will be the death of you.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r258","rowIndex":258,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　とボディーガードの<tips=23>エリオット</tips>は持ち前の無遠慮さでずけずけと口にしたが、<tips=27>廖志明</tips>は笑うばかりで、カエルのツラに小便といった案配だ。","en":"<tips=23>Elliott</tips> the bodyguard said it with his customary bluntness. <tips=27>Liao Chi-ming</tips> merely laughed, as unfazed as a frog being pissed on.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r259","rowIndex":259,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「おれはいい女を抱くために生きている。金を集めるのも、名誉を得るのも、すべてそのためだ」","en":"“I live to sleep with beautiful women. I gather money and pursue honor entirely for that purpose.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r260","rowIndex":260,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　臆面もなく開き直り、<tips=23>エリオット</tips>を閉口させている。","en":"He brazenly owned up to it, leaving <tips=23>Elliott</tips> speechless.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r261","rowIndex":261,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その<tips=27>廖志明</tips>。<tips=41>グランドタワー</tips>襲撃によって<tips=39>ジェフリー</tips>が死んでからは、動きが露骨になっている。","en":"Ever since <tips=39>Jeffrey’s</tips> death in the attack on <tips=41>Grand Tower</tips>, <tips=27>Liao Chi-ming’s</tips> moves had become conspicuously overt.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r262","rowIndex":262,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　今日は私邸に<tips=31>エリー・ホワイト</tips>を呼び寄せ会談をしていた。","en":"Today, he had summoned <tips=31>Ellie White</tips> to his private residence for a meeting.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r263","rowIndex":263,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>はもう死んだ。きみもいつまでも<tips=69>義勝</tips>の連中に肩入れする理由はなくなったんじゃないかね？」","en":"“<tips=3>Chris Tse</tips> is dead. Surely you no longer have any reason to keep siding with <tips=69>Yisheng</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"廖志明","displayName":"Liao Chi-ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r264","rowIndex":264,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=27>廖</tips>はソファーの端にちょこんと尻を乗せ、前のめりになって自分の膝に肘をつくような格好をしていた。高級なソファーのクッションをまったく無駄にしてしまう、落ち着きのない座り方だが、<tips=27>廖</tips>のよくやるスタイルである。","en":"<tips=27>Liao</tips> perched on the edge of the sofa, leaning forward with his elbows on his knees. It was a restless posture that rendered the expensive cushions entirely pointless, but one <tips=27>Liao</tips> often adopted.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r265","rowIndex":265,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「きみほど聡明な人が、まさか情だけで動いたりはしないだろう」","en":"“Someone as intelligent as you surely would not act on sentiment alone.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"廖志明","displayName":"Liao Chi-ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r266","rowIndex":266,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そう言って、<tips=31>エリー</tips>に笑いかける。","en":"With that, he smiled at <tips=31>Ellie</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r267","rowIndex":267,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「美味しい紅茶ですこと。どこで買ったのかしら」","en":"“What delicious tea. Wherever did you purchase it?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エリー・ホワイト","displayName":"Ellie White","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r268","rowIndex":268,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=31>エリー</tips>は出されたカップに口をつけると、そんなふうに話をはぐらかす。","en":"<tips=31>Ellie</tips> raised the cup she had been served to her lips and evaded the subject.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r269","rowIndex":269,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「きみがあの御曹司につくというのは、考えてみればおかしな話だ。あの小僧は、きみがいくら望んでも手に入れられなかった<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>の妻の座を射止めた女の息子なんだぞ」","en":"“When you think about it, there is something very strange about your siding with that heir. The boy is the son of the woman who secured the place as <tips=3>Chris Tse’s</tips> wife that you could never win for yourself, no matter how badly you wanted it.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"廖志明","displayName":"Liao Chi-ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r270","rowIndex":270,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=27>廖</tips>はじっとその表情を観察しながら返答を待ったが、<tips=31>エリー</tips>はやはり何も言わない。","en":"<tips=27>Liao</tips> watched her expression intently as he waited for an answer, but <tips=31>Ellie</tips> still said nothing.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r271","rowIndex":271,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「きみはあの小僧を憎みこそすれ、協力する筋合いはないんだ。自分でもわかっているだろう？」","en":"“If anything, you should hate that boy. You have no reason to cooperate with him. You know that yourself, don’t you?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"廖志明","displayName":"Liao Chi-ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r272","rowIndex":272,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「私は誰にも肩入れなどしません。公平にビジネスをするだけ。相手が誰であっても。……だから、こんな場所にまで来ているのですよ？」","en":"“I take no one’s side. I merely conduct my business impartially, no matter who the other party may be. ...Why else would I have come all the way to a place like this?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エリー・ホワイト","displayName":"Ellie White","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r273","rowIndex":273,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「こんな場所とはご挨拶だな」","en":"“‘A place like this’? That’s quite a greeting.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"廖志明","displayName":"Liao Chi-ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r274","rowIndex":274,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=27>廖</tips>はせせら笑い、","en":"<tips=27>Liao</tips> sneered.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r275","rowIndex":275,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まあ、何と言おうと、私にはきみの態度が中立的だとは思えない。<tips=3>クリス</tips>の遺志を守ろうとでもいうのかね？　義理堅いことだが、死人に囚われるようでは<tips=31>エリー・ホワイト</tips>の名が泣くぞ」","en":"“Whatever you may say, your attitude does not strike me as neutral. Do you mean to preserve <tips=3>Chris’s</tips> legacy? Admirably loyal of you, but if you let a dead man hold you captive, you’ll make a mockery of the name <tips=31>Ellie White</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"廖志明","displayName":"Liao Chi-ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r276","rowIndex":276,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その言葉に、<tips=31>エリー</tips>は表情を固くする。","en":"At those words, <tips=31>Ellie’s</tips> expression hardened.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r277","rowIndex":277,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どうやら図星のようだな」","en":"“It seems I have struck the mark.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"廖志明","displayName":"Liao Chi-ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r278","rowIndex":278,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ビジネスをするつもりがないのなら、帰らせて頂きますが？」","en":"“If you have no intention of doing business, I will take my leave.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エリー・ホワイト","displayName":"Ellie White","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r279","rowIndex":279,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　カップをテーブルに置き、立ち上がるそぶりをみせる<tips=31>エリー</tips>を、<tips=27>廖</tips>は余裕の笑みを浮かべたまま見つめている。","en":"<tips=31>Ellie</tips> set her cup upon the table and made as if to rise. <tips=27>Liao</tips> watched her with an untroubled smile.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r280","rowIndex":280,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「焦らずに、しっかり私の話を聞いた方がいいと思うがね。場合によっては君の運命にも関わってくる」","en":"“Don’t be so hasty. I think you had better hear me out. Depending on the circumstances, this could affect your fate as well.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"廖志明","displayName":"Liao Chi-ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r281","rowIndex":281,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「私の？」","en":"“Mine?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エリー・ホワイト","displayName":"Ellie White","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r282","rowIndex":282,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうとも。……お茶をもう一杯飲むかい？」","en":"“Precisely. ...Would you care for another cup of tea?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"廖志明","displayName":"Liao Chi-ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r283","rowIndex":283,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「結構。それよりも、さっさと本題に入ってください。大きなビジネスがあるというのは嘘だったのですか？」","en":"“No, thank you. Instead, please come to the point. Was your claim that you had major business for me a lie?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エリー・ホワイト","displayName":"Ellie White","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r284","rowIndex":284,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そう。まさに大きなビジネスだ」","en":"“Yes. Major business indeed.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"廖志明","displayName":"Liao Chi-ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r285","rowIndex":285,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=27>廖</tips>は新しい葉巻に火を付け、","en":"<tips=27>Liao</tips> lit a fresh cigar, then said,","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r286","rowIndex":286,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「単刀直入に言う。香港の連中との取引をやめ、我々につくんだ」","en":"“I’ll be blunt. Stop doing business with the Hong Kong crowd and side with us.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"廖志明","displayName":"Liao Chi-ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r287","rowIndex":287,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「何を言うかと思えば……あきれて言葉も出ないとはこのことですわ。誰とも自由にビジネスをすると、今言ったのをもうお忘れ？」","en":"“So that is what you meant... I truly am too appalled for words. Have you already forgotten that I just told you I am free to do business with anyone?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エリー・ホワイト","displayName":"Ellie White","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r288","rowIndex":288,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　呆れる<tips=31>エリー</tips>の言葉を、<tips=27>廖</tips>はものともせず、","en":"<tips=27>Liao</tips> was unfazed by <tips=31>Ellie’s</tips> incredulous response.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r289","rowIndex":289,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=39>ジェフリー・ウォン</tips>亡き後、執行部には無能の二代目と、単細胞の<tips=4>馬明</tips>、そしてついこのあいだまで学生だった御曹司がいるだけだ。これじゃあ組織をまとめることなど出来んよ。私が望む望まざるに関わらず、みなの推挙によって第三代<tips=81>龍頭</tips>になってしまうんだ」","en":"“With <tips=39>Jeffrey Wong</tips> gone, the executive leadership contains nothing but an incompetent second-generation successor, the simpleton <tips=4>Ma Ming</tips>, and an heir who was a student until only recently. They cannot hold the organization together. Whether I want it or not, everyone will nominate me, and I will end up becoming the third <tips=81>Longtou</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"廖志明","displayName":"Liao Chi-ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r290","rowIndex":290,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……私には興味のない話です」","en":"“...That does not interest me.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エリー・ホワイト","displayName":"Ellie White","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r291","rowIndex":291,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=31>エリー</tips>の言葉を<tips=27>廖</tips>は無視し、","en":"Ignoring <tips=31>Ellie’s</tips> words, <tips=27>Liao</tips> continued,","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r292","rowIndex":292,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なあ、冷静に考えてみたまえ。組織をまとめられなくなった香港の連中は、最終的に何をすると思う？　あの知恵のない連中は、武器を取って組織を力ずくで動かそうとするだろう。身内の<tips=26>劉建志</tips>を幼い娘ごと殺すような連中なんだ。いくらそれが正しいことだとしても、地位を奪われたら逆上するのは間違いない。となれば、組織内で戦争が起こるだろう。馬鹿馬鹿しいことだ。彼らに武器を流すということは、つまりそういうことなのさ」","en":"“Now, consider this calmly. What do you think the Hong Kong crowd will ultimately do once they can no longer hold the organization together? Those witless men will take up arms and try to move the organization by force. They are the sort who killed one of their own, <tips=26>Ryu Kenshi</tips>, together with his little daughter. No matter how justified that may have been, there is no doubt they will fly into a rage if stripped of their position. Then war will break out within the organization. It is absurd. Supplying them with weapons means enabling precisely that.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"廖志明","displayName":"Liao Chi-ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r293","rowIndex":293,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=27>廖</tips>はそう言ってうすら笑いを浮かべる。<tips=31>エリー</tips>は黙って唇を結んでいる。","en":"<tips=27>Liao</tips> finished with a thin smile. <tips=31>Ellie</tips> pressed her lips together in silence.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r294","rowIndex":294,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「もちろん、損失以上の対価をきみに与えよう。私が<tips=81>龍頭</tips>になったら、組織を作り替え、もっと合理的に利益をあげる集団にする。何しろいまの<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>は非効率すぎる。くだらぬ伝統やらしがらみが多すぎるんだ。……きみなら私の言っていることがわかるだろう？　今組織のなかで、まともにビジネスを考えられるのは、私ときみだけだから。手を組むべきだと思うね」","en":"“Naturally, I will give you more than enough to make up for any losses. When I become <tips=81>Longtou</tips>, I will remake the organization into a more rational enterprise that turns a greater profit. The present <tips=7>YS</tips> is far too inefficient, burdened with too many worthless traditions and entanglements. ...You understand what I mean, surely? You and I are the only people in the organization capable of thinking seriously about business. We ought to join forces.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"廖志明","displayName":"Liao Chi-ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r295","rowIndex":295,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして返答を待つ<tips=27>廖</tips>に向かって、<tips=31>エリー</tips>は溜息をつく。","en":"Then, facing <tips=27>Liao</tips> as he waited for her answer, <tips=31>Ellie</tips> sighed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r296","rowIndex":296,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ばかばかしい」","en":"“Ridiculous.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エリー・ホワイト","displayName":"Ellie White","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r297","rowIndex":297,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　小声でそう吐き捨てた。","en":"She spat the word quietly.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r298","rowIndex":298,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「この<tips=31>エリー・ホワイト</tips>の店ではすべてのお客様が平等です。対価さえ支払えば、誰でも、どんなものでも買うことが出来るのです。これが私どもが営業を始めてからずっと変わらぬポリシーです。誰に咎められても、脅されても、この自由を手放したりはしません」","en":"“At <tips=31>Ellie White’s</tips> establishment, every customer is equal. So long as they pay the price, anyone may buy anything. This has been our unwavering policy since the day we opened for business. No censure and no threat will make me surrender that freedom.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エリー・ホワイト","displayName":"Ellie White","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r299","rowIndex":299,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それは先代の婆さんの遺訓かい？　まったく死人に忠実な女だな」","en":"“Is that one of the old woman’s commandments from beyond the grave? You truly are a woman devoted to the dead.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"廖志明","displayName":"Liao Chi-ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r300","rowIndex":300,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=27>廖</tips>は苦笑して肩をすくめ、","en":"<tips=27>Liao</tips> gave a wry shrug, then continued:","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r301","rowIndex":301,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「しかし、たとえばこうなったらどうする？　きみが贔屓にしている香港の連中と誰かが戦争になったとしよう。そのとき、敵が武器を買いに来ても、きみは売るのか？　その武器できみの大事な<tips=2>阿亮</tips>を撃ち殺すつもりだとしても」","en":"“But what if this happened? Suppose someone went to war with the Hong Kong crowd you favor. If their enemy came to buy weapons, would you sell to them—even if they meant to use those weapons to shoot your precious <tips=2>Ah Leung</tips> dead?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"廖志明","displayName":"Liao Chi-ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r302","rowIndex":302,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「もちろん。仮に私の命を狙う殺し屋が来たとしても武器を売るでしょう。だから、あなたが今後どのような立場になろうとも、欲しいものがあれば、調達いたしますわ」","en":"“Naturally. Even if an assassin seeking my own life came to me, I would sell them a weapon. Whatever position you may occupy in the future, if there is something you desire, I will procure it for you.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エリー・ホワイト","displayName":"Ellie White","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r303","rowIndex":303,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まあ、いい心がけだ。だが賢明だとは言えない」","en":"“Well, it is an admirable policy. I cannot call it wise.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"廖志明","displayName":"Liao Chi-ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r304","rowIndex":304,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=27>廖</tips>が笑いを崩さずに言う。","en":"<tips=27>Liao</tips> said without letting his smile falter.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r305","rowIndex":305,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=31>エリー</tips>はそれには答えず、立ち上がろうとする。","en":"<tips=31>Ellie</tips> gave no answer and began to rise.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r306","rowIndex":306,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まて、もう一つ、別のビジネスの話をしよう」","en":"“Wait. I have one more proposition—another kind of business.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"廖志明","displayName":"Liao Chi-ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r307","rowIndex":307,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まだあるのですか？」","en":"“There is more?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エリー・ホワイト","displayName":"Ellie White","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r308","rowIndex":308,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=31>エリー</tips>はうんざりとしたように溜息をつく。","en":"<tips=31>Ellie</tips> sighed in exasperation.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r309","rowIndex":309,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あるとも。これは個人的な買い物なのだが……」","en":"“Indeed there is. This one is a personal purchase, however...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"廖志明","displayName":"Liao Chi-ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r310","rowIndex":310,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なんでしょう？」","en":"“What might that be?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エリー・ホワイト","displayName":"Ellie White","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r311","rowIndex":311,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　言葉を濁してニヤニヤと笑う<tips=27>廖</tips>に、<tips=31>エリー</tips>は冷たくそう訊ねる。","en":"<tips=31>Ellie</tips> asked coldly as <tips=27>Liao</tips> trailed off and grinned at her.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r312","rowIndex":312,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いや、きみの肉体を買いたくてね。いくらで私に売ってくれる？」","en":"“Why, I want to buy your body. What price would make you sell it to me?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"廖志明","displayName":"Liao Chi-ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r313","rowIndex":313,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=27>廖</tips>は舌で唇を舐め、","en":"<tips=27>Liao</tips> ran his tongue over his lips, then continued,","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r314","rowIndex":314,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「きみは私の好みより少し年齢を重ねているが、しかし、尊敬すべき精神を持っている。それに、肉体は充分に若く美しい」","en":"“You’re a little older than my usual taste, but you have a spirit worthy of respect. And your body is young and beautiful enough.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"廖志明","displayName":"Liao Chi-ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r315","rowIndex":315,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「このヴェールの下の素顔をご覧になったことはないでしょう」","en":"“You’ve never seen the face beneath this veil, have you?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エリー・ホワイト","displayName":"Ellie White","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r316","rowIndex":316,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それでもわかるのだ。さあ、いくらだ？」","en":"“Even so, I can tell. Now, how much?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"廖志明","displayName":"Liao Chi-ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r317","rowIndex":317,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「残念ながらこれは売り物ではございません」","en":"“I regret that this is not for sale.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エリー・ホワイト","displayName":"Ellie White","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r318","rowIndex":318,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「看板に偽りありとはこのことだ。誰にでもどんなものでも売るといったろう？」","en":"“So much for truth in advertising. Did you not say that you would sell anything to anyone?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"廖志明","displayName":"Liao Chi-ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r319","rowIndex":319,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「私は、人間を『もの』だと考えたことは一度もございません。人間を売り買いしたことも一度もございません。……あなたと違ってね」","en":"“I have never once considered a human being a ‘thing.’ Nor have I ever bought or sold one. ...Unlike you.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エリー・ホワイト","displayName":"Ellie White","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r320","rowIndex":320,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=31>エリー</tips>は立ち上がり、","en":"<tips=31>Ellie</tips> stood.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r321","rowIndex":321,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それでは、失礼いたします」","en":"“Now, if you will excuse me.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エリー・ホワイト","displayName":"Ellie White","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r322","rowIndex":322,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　深々と頭を下げると、<tips=27>廖</tips>の返事も待たずに部屋を去っていった。","en":"She bowed deeply and left the room without waiting for <tips=27>Liao’s</tips> reply.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r323","rowIndex":323,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=27>廖志明</tips>は溜息をつき、つけたばかりの葉巻を灰皿に押しつけて消すと、ソファーの背もたれによりかかる。","en":"<tips=27>Liao Chi-ming</tips> sighed, crushed the newly lit cigar into the ashtray, and leaned back against the sofa.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r324","rowIndex":324,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「見事にフラれましたな。こてんぱんに」","en":"“She shot you down beautifully. Utterly demolished you.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エリオット・ネス","displayName":"Eliot Ness","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r325","rowIndex":325,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=31>エリー</tips>と入れ替わるようにして、<tips=23>エリオット</tips>が部屋に入って来た。","en":"<tips=23>Elliott</tips> entered the room as though trading places with <tips=31>Ellie</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r326","rowIndex":326,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ニヤニヤしやがって。そんなに楽しいか？」","en":"“What are you grinning at? Are you enjoying yourself that much?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"廖志明","displayName":"Liao Chi-ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r327","rowIndex":327,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そりゃそうです。いたいけな少女が金で買いたたかれる、心の痛む場面ばかり見て来ましたからね。誰かさんのおかげで」","en":"“Of course I am. I’ve had to watch one heartbreaking scene after another, innocent young girls being bought up for a pittance. Thanks to a certain someone.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エリオット・ネス","displayName":"Eliot Ness","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r328","rowIndex":328,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして<tips=23>エリオット</tips>は主人の許可も待たず、正面のソファーに腰をおろす。","en":"Then, without waiting for his master’s permission, <tips=23>Elliott</tips> sat down on the sofa opposite him.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r329","rowIndex":329,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「人聞きの悪いことを言うな。慈善事業をしているのさ。彼女たちはみなおれと契約することによって、普通ならとても手に入らない暮らしを手に入れ、しかも、家族たちまでも何不自由なく暮らしている。感謝されて当然さ。これほど金払いのいい主人はなかなかいない」","en":"“Don’t make me sound disreputable. I’m doing charity work. By signing contracts with me, these women obtain lives they could never otherwise have, and even their families want for nothing. Of course they’re grateful. You won’t often find a master who pays this well.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"廖志明","displayName":"Liao Chi-ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r330","rowIndex":330,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「みなが感謝しているとは思えませんがね」","en":"“I doubt every one of them is grateful.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エリオット・ネス","displayName":"Eliot Ness","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r331","rowIndex":331,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「女というものはみな自分の価値を高く見積もりすぎなのさ」","en":"“Women invariably overestimate their own value.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"廖志明","displayName":"Liao Chi-ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r332","rowIndex":332,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あはは」","en":"“Ha ha ha.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エリオット・ネス","displayName":"Eliot Ness","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r333","rowIndex":333,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=23>エリオット</tips>は声を立てて笑う。","en":"<tips=23>Elliott</tips> laughed aloud.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r334","rowIndex":334,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「何がおかしい？」","en":"“What is so funny?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"廖志明","displayName":"Liao Chi-ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r335","rowIndex":335,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ありえないほどの大金を女につぎ込み、貴重な時間を使ってせっせと女のもとへ通うボスこそ、誰よりも女の価値を高く見積もっているんじゃないですか？」","en":"“You pour absurd sums into women and spend your valuable time dutifully visiting them. Doesn’t that make you the man who values women above anyone else, Boss?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エリオット・ネス","displayName":"Eliot Ness","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r336","rowIndex":336,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうさ」","en":"“It does.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"廖志明","displayName":"Liao Chi-ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r337","rowIndex":337,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=27>廖</tips>は笑いもせずにむすっとした表情のまま頷くと、","en":"<tips=27>Liao</tips> nodded without smiling, a sullen expression upon his face.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r338","rowIndex":338,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あれはいいものだ。自分がどれだけ力がある人間なのか。美しい女を自由にしているときこそ、この肉体で実感出来る。これは男の本能だ」","en":"“A beautiful woman is a wonderful thing. It is when I have one entirely at my disposal that I can feel, in this very flesh, just how powerful a man I am. It is male instinct.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"廖志明","displayName":"Liao Chi-ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r339","rowIndex":339,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　はっきりとそう言った。","en":"He stated it categorically.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r340","rowIndex":340,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そこまでいくと呆れるのを通り越してむしろ尊敬に値しますな」","en":"“Once you go that far, I pass beyond astonishment and almost have to respect you.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エリオット・ネス","displayName":"Eliot Ness","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r341","rowIndex":341,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=23>エリオット</tips>は呆れて溜息をつくと、","en":"With an exasperated sigh, <tips=23>Elliott</tips> asked,","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r342","rowIndex":342,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「しかし、本当に香港の連中と戦争になるんですか？」","en":"“But are we truly going to war with the Hong Kong group?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エリオット・ネス","displayName":"Eliot Ness","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r343","rowIndex":343,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まあ、ならんだろうな。さっきのはハッタリだよ」","en":"“Probably not. What I said before was a bluff.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"廖志明","displayName":"Liao Chi-ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r344","rowIndex":344,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうなんでしょうが、案外正鵠を射ているような気がするんですよ。ボスがさっき言った通り、彼らは追い詰められて来ているし、慎重派の<tips=39>ジェフリー・ウォン</tips>も死んでしまった。そして、組織の末端に至るまで我々を敵視してるという話です。これはまあ、ボスが挑発しまくっているからなんですが。あの写真は良くなかったですな」","en":"“I suppose so, but I have a feeling your bluff may have hit the mark. Just as you said, Boss, they’re being driven into a corner, and the cautious <tips=39>Jeffrey Wong</tips> is dead. And I hear that every last member of their organization regards us as the enemy. That is because you’ve never stopped provoking them, of course. That photograph was a mistake.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エリオット・ネス","displayName":"Eliot Ness","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r345","rowIndex":345,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ふん」","en":"“Hmph.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"廖志明","displayName":"Liao Chi-ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r346","rowIndex":346,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=27>廖</tips>はつまらなそうに鼻を鳴らすと、","en":"<tips=27>Liao</tips> snorted, plainly bored.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r347","rowIndex":347,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「今戦争を仕掛けたって、誰もやつらの味方なんかしない。勝ち目がないんだ。確かに<tips=39>ジェフリー</tips>は死んだが、<tips=81>龍頭</tips>も<tips=2>阿亮</tips>もそこまで馬鹿じゃない。手を出しはせんよ」","en":"“Even if they started a war now, no one would take their side. They have no chance of winning. <tips=39>Jeffrey</tips> may be dead, but neither the <tips=81>Longtou</tips> nor <tips=2>Ah Leung</tips> is that stupid. They won’t try anything.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"廖志明","displayName":"Liao Chi-ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r348","rowIndex":348,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どうでしょうかね」","en":"“I wonder...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エリオット・ネス","displayName":"Eliot Ness","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r349","rowIndex":349,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=23>エリオット</tips>は考え込んでしまう。","en":"<tips=23>Elliott</tips> sank into thought.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r350","rowIndex":350,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=27>廖</tips>はしばらくその様子を見ていたが、待ちきれなくなったのか咳払いをして<tips=23>エリオット</tips>の考え事をやめさせると、","en":"<tips=27>Liao</tips> watched him for a time, then apparently lost patience. He cleared his throat and broke <tips=23>Elliott’s</tips> reverie.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r351","rowIndex":351,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「結局、<tips=31>エリー・ホワイト</tips>は<tips=16>タイプA</tips>だったのか？」","en":"“So, in the end, is <tips=31>Ellie White</tips> a <tips=16>Type A</tips>?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"廖志明","displayName":"Liao Chi-ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r352","rowIndex":352,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まだ調査中ですが、どうも、ただの噂のような気がしますね。今のところ確かな情報はありません。あることないこと言われているだけでしょう。謎の女ってやつは、人の好奇心を刺激するもんです」","en":"“I’m still investigating, but I have the impression it’s nothing more than a rumor. So far, we have no reliable information. People are probably saying all sorts of things about her, true and false alike. A mysterious woman has a way of stirring people’s curiosity.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エリオット・ネス","displayName":"Eliot Ness","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r353","rowIndex":353,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうか。特別な能力がないなら、それはそれでいいんだ。<tips=16>タイプA</tips>ってのは、どうも厄介なやつばかりだからな」","en":"“I see. If she possesses no special ability, that is acceptable as well. <tips=16>Type As</tips> are invariably troublesome.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"廖志明","displayName":"Liao Chi-ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r354","rowIndex":354,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=27>廖</tips>は苦い顔をする。","en":"<tips=27>Liao</tips> grimaced.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r355","rowIndex":355,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=16>タイプA</tips>でなくとも、あれは厄介な女ですがね。……しかし、あんな女に惚れられるとは、<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>って人間は大した人物ですな。……いや、フラれちゃったボスもそれなりの人物だとは思いますよ？」","en":"“Even if she isn’t a <tips=16>Type A</tips>, she’s a troublesome woman. ...Still, for a woman like that to fall for him, <tips=3>Chris Tse</tips> must have been quite a man. ...Not that you aren’t something of a man yourself, Boss, even if she did turn you down.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エリオット・ネス","displayName":"Eliot Ness","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r356","rowIndex":356,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「うるさい」","en":"“Shut up.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"廖志明","displayName":"Liao Chi-ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r357","rowIndex":357,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=27>廖</tips>は苦い顏で言うと、","en":"<tips=27>Liao</tips> said with a sour look, then added,","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r358","rowIndex":358,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「もう話はおわりだ。今から出かけるぞ。準備しろ」","en":"“This conversation is over. We’re leaving now. Get ready.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"廖志明","displayName":"Liao Chi-ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r359","rowIndex":359,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そう言って、立ち上がる。","en":"With that, he rose.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r360","rowIndex":360,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そりゃいいですが、ここで葉巻を一口吸う時間くらいはありますよね？」","en":"“Fine by me, but surely there’s time for me to take one puff of a cigar before we go?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エリオット・ネス","displayName":"Eliot Ness","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r361","rowIndex":361,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=23>エリオット</tips>はソファーに腰掛けたまま、ふてぶてしく言う。","en":"Still seated on the sofa, <tips=23>Elliott</tips> spoke with brazen insolence.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r362","rowIndex":362,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「出発は一時間後だ」","en":"“We leave in one hour.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"廖志明","displayName":"Liao Chi-ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r363","rowIndex":363,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それならゆっくり一本吸えますな」","en":"“Then I have time to enjoy a whole one at my leisure.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エリオット・ネス","displayName":"Eliot Ness","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r364","rowIndex":364,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=23>エリオット</tips>は笑う。","en":"<tips=23>Elliott</tips> laughed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r365","rowIndex":365,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「勝手にしろ。おれは風呂に入ってくる」","en":"“Do as you please. I’m going to take a bath.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"廖志明","displayName":"Liao Chi-ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r366","rowIndex":366,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いつも身を清めてから女のところへ向かうのですな。妙なところだけ律儀だ」","en":"“You always purify yourself before visiting a woman. You are oddly scrupulous about the strangest things.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エリオット・ネス","displayName":"Eliot Ness","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r367","rowIndex":367,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=23>エリオット</tips>は早速葉巻をつかみ取ると、火を付けた。","en":"<tips=23>Elliott</tips> promptly seized a cigar and lit it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r368","rowIndex":368,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「で、今日の可哀想な犠牲者は誰です？」","en":"“And who is today’s unfortunate victim?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エリオット・ネス","displayName":"Eliot Ness","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r369","rowIndex":369,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「エリカだよ。だが、可哀想な犠牲者というのはないだろう。あいつだって、いつも汗だくになって喜んでいる。今日は<tips=31>エリー</tips>の分までかわいがってやるさ」","en":"“Erika. But ‘poor victim’ is hardly fair. She always ends up drenched in sweat and loving it. Today I’ll show her enough affection for <tips=31>Ellie</tips> too.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"廖志明","displayName":"Liao Chi-ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r370","rowIndex":370,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その下品な言葉に<tips=23>エリオット</tips>は大げさに肩をすくめたが、<tips=27>廖</tips>はそれに見向きもせず、スタスタと足音を立てて部屋を出て行った。","en":"At that vulgar remark, <tips=23>Elliott</tips> shrugged extravagantly. <tips=27>Liao</tips> paid him no mind and strode out of the room, his footsteps brisk and loud.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r371","rowIndex":371,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「出て行ったようですね」","en":"“It appears he has left.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アイス","displayName":"Ice","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r372","rowIndex":372,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　窓から外の様子を窺っていた<tips=29>アイス</tips>が呟いた。","en":"<tips=29>Ice</tips> murmured as she kept watch through the window.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r373","rowIndex":373,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そのようだね」","en":"“So it would seem.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r374","rowIndex":374,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=28>トーマス</tips>は溜息をつき、","en":"<tips=28>Thomas</tips> sighed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r375","rowIndex":375,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「こんな時に、よく女の人のところに出かける気になんかなれるものだよ。……もし、本当に女の人と会ってるなら、だけどさ」","en":"“At a time like this, how can he even feel like going to see a woman? ...Assuming he really is going to see a woman, that is.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r376","rowIndex":376,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「つけますか？」","en":"“Shall we follow him?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アイス","displayName":"Ice","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r377","rowIndex":377,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「もちろんだ。僕はどうしても、女の人と会うってだけの目的で、父さんがこれほどに危険な外出を繰り返しているとは思えないんだよ……」","en":"“Of course. I simply can’t believe Dad keeps making such dangerous excursions for no purpose beyond seeing women...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r378","rowIndex":378,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=28>トーマス</tips>が悲壮な顔で首を横に振るが、<tips=29>アイス</tips>はほんの少し眉間にしわを寄せて、","en":"<tips=28>Thomas</tips> shook his head with a stricken expression. <tips=29>Ice</tips> drew her brows together ever so slightly.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r379","rowIndex":379,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうでしょうか。こんな状況だからこそ、いつも以上に遊び回っているのかもしれません。プライドの高い方ですから、気にしているようなそぶりを見せたくないのかもしれません」","en":"“Do you think so? Perhaps it is precisely because things are like this that he is carousing more than usual. He’s a proud man; perhaps he doesn’t want to show any sign that it’s bothering him.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アイス","displayName":"Ice","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r380","rowIndex":380,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　と控えめに意見を述べた。","en":"She offered the opinion cautiously.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r381","rowIndex":381,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ああ、それは、あるかもしれないな。見栄っ張りだからね」","en":"“Ah. That may be it. He cares a great deal about appearances.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r382","rowIndex":382,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=28>トーマス</tips>のための車は、いつも屋敷の裏手の駐車場に用意されている。彼らは部屋を出ると、運転手を促して車に乗り込んだ。","en":"A car was always kept ready for <tips=28>Thomas</tips> in the parking area behind the estate. When they left the room, they hurried the driver and climbed aboard.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r383","rowIndex":383,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「父さんの車の行き先はわかりますか？」","en":"“Do you know where my father’s car is going?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r384","rowIndex":384,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「一応、聞いておりますよ」","en":"“I have been told, at least.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r385","rowIndex":385,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　老齢の運転手はエンジンをかけながらしゃがれ声で言う。","en":"The elderly driver answered in a hoarse voice as he started the engine.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r386","rowIndex":386,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「じゃあ、同じルートを辿って、あとをつけてほしいんです。まだ間に合いますよね？」","en":"“Then please follow the same route and trail him. We can still catch up, can’t we?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r387","rowIndex":387,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「はあ、おそらく……しかし、そんないたずらをして、あとでボスに怒られても知りませんぞ」","en":"“Most likely... But if the boss gets angry with you later for a prank like that, don’t blame me.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r388","rowIndex":388,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「大丈夫、万一のときでも、あなたが責任をとるようなことにはさせませんから」","en":"“Don’t worry. Even if something happens, I won’t permit you to be held responsible.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r389","rowIndex":389,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そんな心配をしているわけではありませんが……」","en":"“That was not what concerned me...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r390","rowIndex":390,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「とにかく、出発してください。あんまり遅いと、追いつけなくなってしまう！」","en":"“Please, just drive. If we wait much longer, we’ll never catch them!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r391","rowIndex":391,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=28>トーマス</tips>が促すと、老人は渋々サイドブレーキを下ろした。","en":"At <tips=28>Thomas’s</tips> urging, the old man reluctantly released the parking brake.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r392","rowIndex":392,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=27>廖志明</tips>はどこへ向かうにも毎回道を変えて、同じ道を使わない。これは<tips=23>エリオット</tips>の提案によるもので、不心得者に待ち伏せをされたり、使う道で行き先を予期されないためのものだそうだが、そのためどこへ行くにも少し遠回りになる。","en":"<tips=27>Liao Chi-ming</tips> varied his route every time he traveled, never using the same roads from one trip to the next. Reportedly, <tips=23>Elliott</tips> had proposed this measure to keep would-be attackers from setting an ambush or deducing their destination from the roads they took. The price was a slight detour wherever they went.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r393","rowIndex":393,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　だから<tips=28>トーマス</tips>たちは直行ルートを使えば出遅れた分を取り戻すことが出来るのだ。","en":"Thus, by taking a direct route, <tips=28>Thomas</tips> and his party could make up for their late start.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r394","rowIndex":394,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=27>廖</tips>たちが使うルートは、<tips=27>廖</tips>が車に乗り込んだ瞬間に決定するため、<tips=28>トーマス</tips>たちも知らない。しかし、今は<tips=27>廖</tips>の車には発信器が乗せられている。だから、直行ルートで距離さえ縮めることが出来れば、相手から見えない距離を保ちながらあとを付けることは容易だった。","en":"The route <tips=27>Liao</tips> and his men would take was decided only when <tips=27>Liao</tips> stepped into the car, so <tips=28>Thomas</tips> and his party did not know it either. But a transmitter had now been planted in <tips=27>Liao’s</tips> car. Once they closed the distance by taking a direct route, following from beyond visual range would be easy.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r395","rowIndex":395,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　このGPSは<tips=28>トーマス</tips>が<tips=27>廖</tips>の運転手にしつこく頼みこんで乗せて貰っているもので、もちろん<tips=27>廖</tips>自身は知らない。","en":"<tips=28>Thomas</tips> had pestered <tips=27>Liao’s</tips> driver until the man agreed to put the GPS tracker aboard. Naturally, <tips=27>Liao</tips> himself knew nothing about it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r396","rowIndex":396,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　この誰に対しても礼儀正しく、けして威張らない青年の懇願に対して、屋敷の使用人たちは総じて甘かった。そしてまた、使用人たちにも、主人である<tips=27>廖志明</tips>のいささか奔放すぎる私生活を多少は控えて欲しいという思いはあるのだ。","en":"The servants at the estate were uniformly indulgent toward this polite young man, who never lorded himself over anyone, and found his entreaties hard to resist. They, too, wished that their master, <tips=27>Liao Chi-ming</tips>, would show some restraint in his rather too uninhibited private life.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r397","rowIndex":397,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　こうした行動を起こす前に<tips=28>トーマス</tips>は<tips=23>エリオット</tips>にも相談はしたが、","en":"Before setting the plan in motion, <tips=28>Thomas</tips> had consulted <tips=23>Elliott</tips> as well.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r398","rowIndex":398,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「好きにすればいい。ただそれで坊っちゃんの身に何かあってもおれは守れないよ。それは契約外だしね」","en":"“Do as you please. But if something happens to you as a result, young master, I can’t protect you. That lies outside my contract.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r399","rowIndex":399,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=23>エリオット</tips>が口にした苦言めいた言葉はそれくらいで、あとは使用する発信器についていくつかアドバイスをした程度のものだった。彼は<tips=28>トーマス</tips>のやろうとしていることを詳しく知ろうとはしなかったから、今日こうしてあとを付けていることは知らないだろう。","en":"That was the extent of <tips=23>Elliott’s</tips> cautionary remarks. Beyond that, he merely offered a few pieces of advice about the transmitter. He made no attempt to learn the details of what <tips=28>Thomas</tips> intended to do, and presumably did not know they were following Liao that day.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r400","rowIndex":400,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　さて、そうして<tips=28>トーマス</tips>たちが乗った車は首尾良く<tips=27>廖</tips>たちの車に追いつき、尾行の体制が整った。","en":"<tips=28>Thomas’s</tips> car successfully caught up with <tips=27>Liao’s</tips>, leaving them perfectly positioned to begin the tail.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r401","rowIndex":401,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　現在のところ、やはり車は愛人のところへ向かっているようだった。","en":"For the moment, the car did indeed appear to be heading toward a mistress’s home.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r402","rowIndex":402,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　エリカ・ビリンガムは達馬町の高級マンションに住んでいる。","en":"Erika Billingham lived in a luxury apartment building in Tatsuma Town.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r403","rowIndex":403,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　達馬町と言えば<tips=9>Y地区</tips>内の富裕層が多く暮らし、綺麗な学校やホテルが建ち並ぶ一角だ。もちろん、すべての支払いは<tips=27>廖</tips>が受け持っている。","en":"Tatsuma Town was a quarter of <tips=9>Y District</tips> where many of the wealthy lived, its streets lined with handsome schools and hotels. Naturally, <tips=27>Liao</tips> covered every expense.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r404","rowIndex":404,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=28>トーマス</tips>は彼女の顔を見たことがなく、どういう人間であるかもまったく知らなかったが、父が強引な手段を用いて愛人にしたという噂は聞いていた。","en":"<tips=28>Thomas</tips> had never seen Erika’s face and knew nothing of what kind of person she was, but he had heard rumors that his father had coerced her into becoming his mistress.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r405","rowIndex":405,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　自分の親が今まさに浮気相手の住む場所へ向かっているのか、と思うと何やら複雑な思いだ。","en":"The thought that his own father might at that very moment be on his way to a mistress’s home left Thomas with decidedly mixed feelings.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r406","rowIndex":406,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=29>アイス</tips>は父さんを軽蔑するかい？」","en":"“Do you despise my father, <tips=29>Ice</tips>?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r407","rowIndex":407,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「突然、何を……」","en":"“Why would you suddenly ask...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アイス","displayName":"Ice","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r408","rowIndex":408,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「正直に答えて欲しいんだ。こんな風に、金と暴力で女の子を思いのままにしている父さんを、軽蔑するかい？」","en":"“I want an honest answer. Do you despise my father for using money and violence to do as he pleases with girls?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r409","rowIndex":409,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=28>トーマス</tips>は真摯な視線を<tips=29>アイス</tips>に向ける。","en":"<tips=28>Thomas</tips> fixed <tips=29>Ice</tips> with an earnest gaze.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r410","rowIndex":410,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼の家の使用人たちが誰も逆らえなくなってしまうその謙虚で純粋な表情に、<tips=29>アイス</tips>もやはり弱かった。","en":"It was that humble, guileless expression of his that left every servant in the household unable to defy him. <tips=29>Ice</tips>, too, was vulnerable to it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r411","rowIndex":411,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　逡巡したのちに、","en":"After hesitating, she answered.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r412","rowIndex":412,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そんな理由では軽蔑はしません」","en":"“I do not despise him for that reason.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アイス","displayName":"Ice","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r413","rowIndex":413,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どうして？　ひどいことだろう？」","en":"“Why not? What he’s doing is terrible.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r414","rowIndex":414,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どういう形であれ、持っている人間から、持たない人間へと金が流れるのは間違ったことではありません。この街には、金持ちのそうした欲望がなければ死ぬ人間が山ほどいるでしょう。死ぬような苦しい目に遭ってる人もたくさんいるでしょうが、死ぬよりはましです」","en":"“Whatever form it takes, there is nothing wrong with money flowing from those who have it to those who do not. Countless people in this city would die if the rich did not have desires of that kind. Many of them must endure suffering that feels like death, but it is still better than actually dying.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アイス","displayName":"Ice","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r415","rowIndex":415,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうだろうか……。死んだ方がマシなくらい苦しんでる人もいるはずだよ」","en":"“Is it? Surely some of them suffer enough that death would be preferable.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r416","rowIndex":416,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「本当に死ぬ方がマシだと思っているなら、いつでも死ねば良いんですよ。生きてる人間は、どんなに言葉の上で言い訳をしても、心の奥底では生きているほうがマシな理由があるから生きているんです」","en":"“If they truly believe death is preferable, they are free to die whenever they please. Whatever excuses the living may make aloud, they remain alive because deep in their hearts they still have some reason to find life preferable.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アイス","displayName":"Ice","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r417","rowIndex":417,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=29>アイス</tips>は、今まで、そういうことについて考えてきたみたいだね」","en":"“It sounds as though you’ve thought about such things before, <tips=29>Ice</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r418","rowIndex":418,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=28>トーマス</tips>が率直に感想を漏らすと、<tips=29>アイス</tips>は口ごもりながら、","en":"<tips=28>Thomas</tips> voiced the thought frankly. <tips=29>Ice</tips> faltered before answering.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r419","rowIndex":419,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……死にたい死にたいって心では思っても、結局自殺を選べるほど潔癖じゃなかったんですよ。生きてるってことは、どこかでその行為を受け入れることが出来たってことです。<tips=28>トーマス</tips>さまもご覧になったでしょう？　私はああいったことがあっても自殺はしない」","en":"“...However often I thought in my heart that I wanted to die, in the end I was never so uncompromisingly pure that I could choose suicide. The fact that I am alive means that somewhere inside, I was capable of accepting what was done to me. You saw it yourself, Master <tips=28>Thomas</tips>. Even after something like that, I will not kill myself.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アイス","displayName":"Ice","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r420","rowIndex":420,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あ」","en":"“Ah.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r421","rowIndex":421,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　自分の選んだ会話がそこへ行き着いてしまうことに、<tips=28>トーマス</tips>は初めて気がついて、うなだれた。","en":"Only then did <tips=28>Thomas</tips> realize where the subject he had chosen had led. He hung his head.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r422","rowIndex":422,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ごめん、<tips=29>アイス</tips>」","en":"“I’m sorry, <tips=29>Ice</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r423","rowIndex":423,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「気にしないでください」","en":"“Please don’t worry about it.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アイス","displayName":"Ice","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r424","rowIndex":424,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……きみは、僕の想像もつかないくらいつらいことを沢山経験しているんだろう。だけど、きみがそれを受け入れたから今ここにいるというのは、違うと思う」","en":"“...You must have experienced more suffering than I can imagine. But I don’t believe you are here now because you accepted it.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r425","rowIndex":425,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=28>トーマス</tips>はもう一度顔を上げて、<tips=29>アイス</tips>を見つめた。","en":"<tips=28>Thomas</tips> raised his face and looked at <tips=29>Ice</tips> once more.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r426","rowIndex":426,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「きみは自分のことを虚ろな人間だと思っているような気がするけど、それは違う。誰よりも強い希望を持ってる。だから生きてこられたんだ」","en":"“I have the impression that you consider yourself an empty person. You’re wrong. You possess a stronger hope than anyone. That is why you’ve survived.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r427","rowIndex":427,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=29>アイス</tips>は何も答えず、ただ黙って<tips=28>トーマス</tips>の目を見つめ返している。","en":"<tips=29>Ice</tips> gave no answer. She only returned <tips=28>Thomas’s</tips> gaze in silence.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r428","rowIndex":428,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……まあ何はともあれ、僕は、父さんのこのやり方は良くないと思う。これがこの街にとって必要な構造だとしても、なんとかそれを変えたい。貧しい人たちが、みな、人間らしい意志に従って生きていけるような街にしたいんだ」","en":"“...Be that as it may, I believe my father’s methods are wrong. Even if this city requires such a structure, I want to find some way to change it. I want a city where poor people can live with human dignity and by their own will.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r429","rowIndex":429,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それは……」","en":"“That...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アイス","displayName":"Ice","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r430","rowIndex":430,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=29>アイス</tips>は言葉を飲み込んだ。","en":"<tips=29>Ice</tips> swallowed the rest of the sentence.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r431","rowIndex":431,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女が「無理だ」と言おうとしたのは、<tips=28>トーマス</tips>にもわかっている。","en":"<tips=28>Thomas</tips> understood that she had meant to say it was impossible.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r432","rowIndex":432,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　確かに、自分は馬鹿げたことを言おうとしているのかもしれない。この街に限らず、どの場所でも弱いものは理屈に合わないものに食い物にされてしまうものだ。すべてを均等に分配するなんて出来っこないことは、人類の歴史上のいくつもの失敗が証明している。","en":"Perhaps what he was trying to say was absurd. In this city and everywhere else, the weak were preyed upon by injustices that defied all reason. The many failed experiments of human history had proved that distributing everything equally was impossible.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r433","rowIndex":433,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"（それでも、この街のなかだけならば、変えることが出来る）","en":"(Even so, I can change this one city.)","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r434","rowIndex":434,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　確たる理由もないのに、そう疑いもなく信じる<tips=28>トーマス</tips>は、あるいは<tips=9>Y地区</tips>で一番の夢想家だったかもしれない。","en":"<tips=28>Thomas</tips> believed it without doubt despite having no firm grounds. Perhaps he was the greatest dreamer in <tips=9>Y District</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r435","rowIndex":435,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=27>廖志明</tips>の乗った車は背の高い高級マンションの前で停まった。","en":"The car carrying <tips=27>Liao Chi-ming</tips> stopped before a tall luxury apartment building.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r436","rowIndex":436,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　やはりそこは女の家だった。","en":"It was a woman’s home after all.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r437","rowIndex":437,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　外出のための方便でもなんでもなく、正真正銘愛人を抱きに来たのかと、<tips=28>トーマス</tips>は若干失望しつつ、車を少し離れた場所に停めさせる。","en":"A little disappointed to discover that this was no mere pretext for going out and that his father really had come to sleep with his mistress, <tips=28>Thomas</tips> had their car stop a short distance away.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r438","rowIndex":438,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=27>廖</tips>を護衛している人間すべてが<tips=28>トーマス</tips>の企みを知っているわけではない。堂々と彼らのすぐ近くに車で乗り付けるつもりはなかった。","en":"Not everyone guarding <tips=27>Liao</tips> knew of <tips=28>Thomas’s</tips> scheme. He had no intention of boldly pulling up right beside them.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r439","rowIndex":439,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　アイスを従えて塀にへばりつくような動きでこそこそとマンションに近づく。","en":"With Ice behind him, Thomas crept toward the building as though glued to the wall.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r440","rowIndex":440,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　本人にすれば大まじめなのだろうが、上等なジャケットを着た青年が、女連れでこんな動作をしているのはいかにもあやしげで、通行人の目を引いた。<tips=29>アイス</tips>はこの不自然さに気がついているはずだが、何かと不器用な主人の振る舞いにいちいち指摘はしなかった。","en":"He was undoubtedly in earnest, but a young man in an expensive jacket moving this way with a woman looked intensely suspicious and drew the eyes of passersby. <tips=29>Ice</tips> must have noticed how unnatural it looked, but she did not point out every awkward move made by her clumsy master.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r441","rowIndex":441,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=28>トーマス</tips>は曲がり角からそっと顔を出してマンションの方を窺う。","en":"<tips=28>Thomas</tips> cautiously peeked around a corner toward the apartment building.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r442","rowIndex":442,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　マンションの玄関の側には<tips=27>廖</tips>の部下が二人、無表情に煙草をふかしている。主人が愛人と戯れているのをこんな夜空の下で待つというのだから、面白い仕事ではないだろう。","en":"Two of <tips=27>Liao’s</tips> subordinates stood near the entrance, smoking with blank expressions. Waiting out beneath the night sky while their master dallied with his mistress could hardly have been enjoyable work.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r443","rowIndex":443,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しかも今日が特別というわけでもなく、好色なボスは三日と日を空けることがないのだ。","en":"Nor was there anything exceptional about tonight; the lecherous boss hardly ever let three days pass without such a visit.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r444","rowIndex":444,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まったく、同情するよ」","en":"“I truly sympathize.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r445","rowIndex":445,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=28>トーマス</tips>は小さく呟き、路地を伝って今度はビルの裏側にまわる。","en":"<tips=28>Thomas</tips> murmured under his breath, then followed the alley around to the rear of the building.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r446","rowIndex":446,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そこには一台の黒塗りの車が止まっていて、それにもやはり<tips=27>廖</tips>の部下が乗り込んでいる。そのなかには<tips=23>エリオット</tips>もいるようだ。","en":"A single black car waited there, again occupied by <tips=27>Liao’s</tips> subordinates. <tips=23>Elliott</tips> appeared to be among them.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r447","rowIndex":447,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　裏口と正面を、取り囲むようにして部下たちが守っている。さすがにマンションのなかにまで護衛はついていかないようだ。","en":"The men guarded the rear and front entrances as though surrounding the building. At least they did not appear to follow him inside.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r448","rowIndex":448,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　マンションには一般の住人も多く住んでいる。一応ここに<tips=27>廖志明</tips>の愛人がいるということは秘密事項になっているのだが、こうも出入り口をしっかりと固められては、あまりにもあからさまだ。出入りする住人たちは、警備のものたちに露骨に不審の視線を浴びせている。","en":"Many ordinary residents lived in the building. The presence of <tips=27>Liao Chi-ming’s</tips> mistress there was supposed to be secret, but guarding the entrances this thoroughly made it all far too obvious. Residents passing in and out cast openly suspicious looks at the guards.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r449","rowIndex":449,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=27>廖志明</tips>は、けして愛人を屋敷に同居させようとはしない。","en":"<tips=27>Liao Chi-ming</tips> never attempted to have a mistress live at his estate.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r450","rowIndex":450,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それは、息子や部下の手前というわけでもなく、単に女と暮らすのが不得意なせいであった。この好色な人物は、自分が必要とする以外の時に女が入り込むことを極めて嫌う。だから結婚生活もうまくいかず、すぐに破綻することになったのだ。","en":"This was not out of consideration for his son or subordinates. He was simply incapable of living with a woman. The lecherous man intensely disliked a woman intruding into his life at any time he did not require her. That was precisely why his married life had gone badly and quickly collapsed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r451","rowIndex":451,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　この性格のせいで、部下たちは彼の娯楽にいつもつき合わされることになる。","en":"Because of this trait, his subordinates were forever forced to accompany him on his amusements.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r452","rowIndex":452,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ここにこうして突っ立っていたら、僕らも不審者と思われそうだね……」","en":"“If we keep standing here like this, people may decide we’re suspicious too...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r453","rowIndex":453,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　肩身をせまそうにする<tips=27>廖</tips>の部下たちの姿を見て、やっとそのことに気がついた<tips=28>トーマス</tips>は溜息をつく。","en":"Only after seeing how conspicuous and ill at ease <tips=27>Liao’s</tips> subordinates looked did the thought occur to <tips=28>Thomas</tips>. He sighed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r454","rowIndex":454,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どうします？」","en":"“What shall we do?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アイス","displayName":"Ice","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r455","rowIndex":455,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=29>アイス</tips>、このあたりで能力は使えるかい？」","en":"“<tips=29>Ice</tips>, can you use your ability around here?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r456","rowIndex":456,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　言われて<tips=29>アイス</tips>は懐から自分の携帯端末を取り出すと、何やら地図のようなものを画面に表示させる。","en":"At the question, <tips=29>Ice</tips> took her device from inside her coat and displayed what appeared to be a map.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r457","rowIndex":457,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それはネットに公開され、<tips=9>Y地区</tips>に住む<tips=16>タイプA</tips>の間で共有されている、<tips=42>タキノ式UB波感知器</tips>——つまり<tips=42>サイキック発見器</tips>の作動範囲を地図上に示してくれるアプリケーションソフトだった。","en":"It was an application published online and shared among the <tips=16>Type As</tips> of <tips=9>Y District</tips>. The map displayed the operating ranges of <tips=42>Takino-model UB-wave detectors</tips>—the devices commonly known as <tips=42>psychic detectors</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r458","rowIndex":458,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ビルの正面側に一台設置されています。その近くはもちろん作動範囲内ですが、ビルの正面付近もあやしいでしょう。……ビルの中央から、この辺りまでは完全に圏外です」","en":"“One has been installed in front of the building. Its immediate vicinity is naturally within range, and the area near the front of the building is probably unsafe as well. ...But from the center of the building to where we are now is completely outside its range.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アイス","displayName":"Ice","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r459","rowIndex":459,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうか。じゃあ、ちょっときみの力をつかって、敷地内を覗いてみよう」","en":"“I see. Then let’s use your power and look around the property.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r460","rowIndex":460,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「承知しました」","en":"“Understood.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アイス","displayName":"Ice","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r461","rowIndex":461,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=29>アイス</tips>は頷くと、","en":"<tips=29>Ice</tips> nodded.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r462","rowIndex":462,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「失礼します」","en":"“Excuse me.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アイス","displayName":"Ice","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r463","rowIndex":463,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=28>トーマス</tips>の手を握った。","en":"She took <tips=28>Thomas’s</tips> hand.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r464","rowIndex":464,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして、まぶたを閉じ、集中する表情を見せたその直後、能力が発動された。","en":"She closed her eyes, her face tightening with concentration. An instant later, the ability took effect.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r465","rowIndex":465,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　もしその時彼らの姿を見ていた人間がいたとしたら、その目には、二人の姿がじんわり風景に溶け込むようにして透明になってゆく場面が映っただろう。","en":"To any human watching them at that moment, the two figures would have seemed to dissolve gradually into the scenery and turn transparent.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r466","rowIndex":466,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=16>タイプA</tips>として<tips=29>アイス</tips>に与えられた能力。それは、どんな人間にも感知出来なくなるというものであった。彼女がひとたび能力を使うと、いかなる人間でも、その姿を見ることも、たてる音を耳にすることも、体臭を鼻で嗅ぐことも出来なくなってしまう。","en":"The power <tips=29>Ice</tips> had received as a <tips=16>Type A</tips> made her imperceptible to any human being. Once she activated it, no person could see her form, hear the sounds she made, or smell the odor of her body.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r467","rowIndex":467,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　と言っても、実際に姿が透明になり、音を立てなくなり、体臭が消えるわけではない。その証拠に、能力を使った状態でも、カメラにはしっかり姿が映る。足音も一緒に録音される。そして、犬に近づけば吼えられたりもする。","en":"Her body did not actually become transparent. Nor did she cease to make sounds or lose her odor. A camera still recorded her clearly while the ability was active, together with the sound of her steps. Even a dog might bark if she approached it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r468","rowIndex":468,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　にもかかわらず、どういうわけか人間だけが<tips=29>アイス</tips>を認識出来ない。もしかしたら、目には映って、耳にも聞こえてはいるが、それらの情報を処理する脳の方に働きかけて認識出来なくするという、催眠術めいた能力なのかもしれない。","en":"For some reason, humans alone could not recognize <tips=29>Ice</tips>. Perhaps their eyes still saw her and their ears still heard her, but the power acted upon the brain that processed the information and prevented recognition, like a form of hypnotism.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r469","rowIndex":469,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そういった詳しいメカニズムについては、詳しく調査された経験もなく、<tips=29>アイス</tips>自身にもわからないのだが、とにかく、この能力によって彼女は人間に対して自分の存在を完全に隠すことが出来る。","en":"No detailed study of the mechanism had ever been conducted, and <tips=29>Ice</tips> herself did not understand it. Whatever the explanation, the ability allowed her to hide her existence completely from human beings.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r470","rowIndex":470,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　効果範囲は自分自身と、接触したもう一人だ。この場合は彼女と手を繋いだ<tips=28>トーマス</tips>、二人とも姿が消える。","en":"The effect extended to herself and one other person in physical contact with her. In this instance, both she and <tips=28>Thomas</tips>, whose hand she held, disappeared from sight.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r471","rowIndex":471,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　実に優れた能力だが、不便なところもいくつかある。まず第一に、この能力を発動している間は<tips=29>アイス</tips>は目を閉ざしたままでいなくてはならないということ。目を開けた途端に能力は消えてしまう。","en":"It was a remarkable ability, but it had several drawbacks. First, <tips=29>Ice</tips> had to keep her eyes closed for as long as the power remained active. The instant she opened them, it vanished.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r472","rowIndex":472,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それから、先述した通りカメラなどの機械を誤魔化すことが出来ないというのもある。","en":"As already noted, it also could not deceive cameras or other machines.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r473","rowIndex":473,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　さらにもう一つ、口を開いて一言でも喋るとたちまち不思議な力が解除されて姿があらわになってしまうというものであった。これは<tips=29>アイス</tips>だけでなく、一緒に消えているもう一人にも適用される。","en":"One final restriction was that if either <tips=29>Ice</tips> or the person concealed with her opened their mouth and spoke so much as a word, the mysterious power immediately ended and both became perceptible once more.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r474","rowIndex":474,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=16>タイプA</tips>能力とは不思議なもので、言葉を発さずに沈黙さえしていれば、他にどんな物音を立てても能力を阻害しない。たとえば大きなシンバルを打ち鳴らしても、目の前に人間に聞こえることはないのである。もちろん、銃を撃っても同じことだ。撃たれた人間は自分が何をされたのかさえ気づかずに死んでゆくだろう。","en":"<tips=16>Type A</tips> abilities were strange things. So long as the user remained silent and uttered no words, no other sound they made would interfere with the ability. Even if they crashed a pair of large cymbals together, a person directly in front of them would hear nothing. The same, of course, went for firing a gun. The victim would likely die without even realizing what had been done to them.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r475","rowIndex":475,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=28>トーマス</tips>もこうした<tips=29>アイス</tips>の能力の性質については知っている。が、この状態で歩こうとすると、どうしても抜き足差し足忍び足になってしまう。","en":"<tips=28>Thomas</tips> knew these properties of <tips=29>Ice’s</tips> ability. Yet whenever he tried to walk in this condition, he could not help creeping on exaggerated tiptoe.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r476","rowIndex":476,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　目を閉ざす<tips=29>アイス</tips>の手を引いて、ビルの敷地内へ侵入しようとする動きは、まるでコメディアンが演じる泥棒のように大げさなものだった。","en":"Leading the closed-eyed <tips=29>Ice</tips> by the hand as they entered the building grounds, he moved with all the exaggeration of a comedian playing a burglar.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r477","rowIndex":477,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しかし、<tips=28>トーマス</tips>がどのように滑稽な動作をしていても、彼自身以外の誰にも目撃することは出来ない。","en":"However ridiculous <tips=28>Thomas’s</tips> movements became, no one else could see them.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r478","rowIndex":478,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その姿で彼らは今まさに<tips=23>エリオット</tips>たちの目の前を通過しようとしているが、彼はまったくそれに気がつかない。車の窓を開け放ったまま隣の席に座る同僚と<tips=9>Y地区</tips>内の飲み屋のうまいまずいを語り合っている。","en":"In that state, they were now about to pass directly in front of <tips=23>Elliott</tips> and the others, but he noticed nothing. He had left the car window open and was debating with the colleague beside him which bars in <tips=9>Y District</tips> were good and which were lousy.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r479","rowIndex":479,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　こっちからはこんなにはっきり相手の顔も声も感じられるのに、車のサイドミラーに映った自分の顔さえ見えるのに、どうして相手にはわからないのか。この鋭敏な<tips=23>エリオット</tips>でさえも。","en":"Thomas could perceive the man’s face and voice with perfect clarity. He could even see his own face reflected in the car’s side mirror. How could the other man fail to recognize him—even an extraordinarily sharp person like <tips=23>Elliott</tips>?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r480","rowIndex":480,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　何度体験しても、<tips=28>トーマス</tips>にとっては不思議な感覚である。","en":"However many times <tips=28>Thomas</tips> experienced it, the sensation remained uncanny.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r481","rowIndex":481,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=23>エリオット</tips>たちの目の前を通過し、マンションの敷地に侵入する。目の前には裏口として使われているガラス張りのドアがあり、右手はエレベーター式の駐車場だ。左手に回り込むとビルの正面に近づくことになり、警報器を鳴らしてしまう。<tips=28>トーマス</tips>が背伸びして駐車場の方の様子を確認すると、ちょうど裏口ドアの向こうに、ビルから出ようとする人影があらわれた。","en":"They passed right in front of <tips=23>Elliott</tips> and his men and slipped onto the apartment grounds. Ahead was a glass door used as the rear entrance, with an automated parking garage to the right. Going around to the left would take them nearer the front of the building and set off the alarm. When <tips=28>Thomas</tips> stood on tiptoe to peer toward the garage, a figure appeared beyond the rear door, about to leave the building.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r482","rowIndex":482,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　片手にベビーカー、もう片方の手に幼児の手を繋ぐ若い母親である。言うことを聞かない子供をなだめながらの移動でドアを出るのに手間取る母親の後ろをすり抜けるようにして二人はビルに足を踏み入れた。","en":"It was a young mother pushing a stroller with one hand and holding a small child’s hand with the other. She struggled through the door while soothing the uncooperative child, and Thomas and Ice slipped past her into the building.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r483","rowIndex":483,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=27>廖志明</tips>は、最愛の息子とそのボディーガードが同じビルに足を踏み入れたことなど夢にも思わない。","en":"<tips=27>Liao Chi-ming</tips> never dreamed that his beloved son and the boy’s bodyguard had entered the same building.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r484","rowIndex":484,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　エリカ・ビリンガムをどのように責めてやろうかと、そのことで頭がいっぱいで、車を降りたときからずっと顔にだらしない笑みを貼り付けている。","en":"His mind was consumed with how he would have his way with Erika Billingham, and a loose, lecherous grin had been plastered across his face ever since he stepped out of the car.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r485","rowIndex":485,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　単身エレベーターに乗り込み、エリカの住む階で降りる。カツカツと白いエナメルの靴のかかとを鳴らし、エリカの住む部屋のドアの前にやって来る。","en":"He rode the elevator alone and stepped out on Erika’s floor. The heels of his white patent-leather shoes clicked as he approached her door.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r486","rowIndex":486,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そしてインターフォンを使わずに自らの手でドアをノックするというのが、<tips=27>廖</tips>のいつもの作法であった。","en":"It was <tips=27>Liao’s</tips> custom to knock on the door himself instead of using the intercom.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r487","rowIndex":487,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　すぐにガチャリとドアが開いて、","en":"The lock clicked at once and the door opened.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r488","rowIndex":488,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どうぞ」","en":"“Please.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エリカ・ビリンガム","displayName":"Erika Billingham","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r489","rowIndex":489,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　エリカ・ビリンガムが姿を現す。","en":"Erika Billingham appeared.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r490","rowIndex":490,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「やあ」","en":"“Hello.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"廖志明","displayName":"Liao Chi-ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r491","rowIndex":491,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　エリカの暗い表情を気にもとめず、<tips=27>廖</tips>は陽気に挨拶をすると、部屋に上がり込んだ。","en":"Paying no heed to Erika’s dark expression, <tips=27>Liao</tips> greeted her cheerfully and strode into the apartment.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r492","rowIndex":492,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　外国人居住者が多く住むことを想定したこのマンションは、靴を履いたまま部屋に入る作りになっており、<tips=27>廖</tips>はそのまま足を踏み入れる。","en":"The apartment building had been designed with its many foreign residents in mind, allowing people to enter without removing their shoes. <tips=27>Liao</tips> walked in without taking his off.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r493","rowIndex":493,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　リビングにはすでに彼の好みの酒が氷や鉱泉水と共に用意されており、彼は上着をエリカに渡すと、さっそくソファーに腰をおろした。","en":"His favorite liquor had already been set out in the living room with ice and mineral water. He handed Erika his jacket and promptly settled onto the sofa.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r494","rowIndex":494,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　エリカはいつものようにロックでウイスキーを出し、続けてもう一つのグラスにチェイサーとして鉱泉水を注ぐ。<tips=27>廖</tips>は酒より先に水の方のグラスを手にとって、車内の効き過ぎた空調で乾いた喉を潤した。","en":"As always, Erika served him whiskey on the rocks, then poured mineral water into a second glass as a chaser. <tips=27>Liao</tips> reached for the water first, moistening a throat left dry by the car’s overzealous air-conditioning.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r495","rowIndex":495,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「こっちへ来るんだ」","en":"“Come here.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"廖志明","displayName":"Liao Chi-ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r496","rowIndex":496,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　向かいに座ったエリカにそう命じ、次は酒の方のグラスから琥珀色の液体を唇の間に流し込む。その冷たい液体が、彼の性欲にさらなる活力を与える。","en":"He issued the command to Erika across from him, then tipped the amber liquor from the other glass between his lips. The cold liquid put fresh vigor into his lust.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r497","rowIndex":497,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　隣に座ったエリカの腰を抱き寄せると、そのブラウスの襟から覗く胸もとから、香水のにおいと、女のにおいのまじったものが立ち上り、彼の鼻先をかすめる。","en":"When she sat beside him, he put an arm around her waist and drew her close. From the breast revealed by the open collar of her blouse rose the mingled scent of perfume and woman, grazing the tip of his nose.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r498","rowIndex":498,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「旦那様はいま、大変な状況だとお伺いしていますが……」","en":"“I understand that you are in a difficult situation at present, Master...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エリカ・ビリンガム","displayName":"Erika Billingham","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r499","rowIndex":499,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「何も大変なことなんかない。それにな、血なまぐさい仕事をしているときこそ、女が欲しくなるんだよ。さて、今日はどうしてやろうか……」","en":"“There’s nothing difficult about it. Besides, when I’m doing bloody work, that’s when I want a woman most. Now then, what shall I do with you today...?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"廖志明","displayName":"Liao Chi-ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r500","rowIndex":500,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=27>廖</tips>はだらしなく笑うと、エリカの唇に、自分の唇を押し当てる。","en":"<tips=27>Liao</tips> gave her a lecherous grin and pressed his lips to Erika’s.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r501","rowIndex":501,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「んっ……」","en":"“Mmph...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エリカ・ビリンガム","displayName":"Erika Billingham","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r502","rowIndex":502,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　エリカの口から声が漏れる。発作的に逃れようとするが、いつの間にか<tips=27>廖</tips>の腕が首の後ろにまわりこんでいて、頭をひくことが出来ない。","en":"A sound escaped Erika’s mouth. She made an instinctive attempt to pull away, but <tips=27>Liao’s</tips> arm had already slipped behind her neck, and she could not draw her head back.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r503","rowIndex":503,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　散々口づけをし、歪むエリカの顔を見て<tips=27>廖</tips>は笑う。","en":"After kissing her to his heart’s content, <tips=27>Liao</tips> looked at Erika’s contorted face and laughed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r504","rowIndex":504,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=27>廖</tips>は相手に行為は強要するが、演技は強要しない。命令に従っているかぎり、嫌悪を態度に出したとしても、叱るどころか注意をしたこともない。いかなる女に対してもそうだ。","en":"<tips=27>Liao</tips> forced women to submit to the acts themselves, but never forced them to put on a performance. So long as they obeyed his commands, he neither scolded nor even admonished them for showing their disgust. He treated every woman that way.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r505","rowIndex":505,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　愛想を振りまき、しなだれかかってくるような女はその媚態を愉しみ、エリカのように嫌悪を隠せない女は様々な行為を強要して生の反応を愉しむというのが、彼の女の楽しみ方だ。","en":"With women who fawned on him and draped themselves over him, he enjoyed their coquettish performance. With women like Erika, who could not hide their revulsion, he forced them to perform one act after another and enjoyed their raw reactions. These were the ways he took his pleasure in women.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r506","rowIndex":506,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「おい、舌を出して、おれの舌とからめるんだ」","en":"“Come on. Stick out your tongue and twine it around mine.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"廖志明","displayName":"Liao Chi-ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r507","rowIndex":507,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　エリカも、命令にさえ従えば相手が無茶をしないことを知っている。","en":"Erika knew that so long as she obeyed his commands, he would not go too far.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r508","rowIndex":508,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　いつまでたっても慣れることの出来ない相手に、震える舌を差し出す。<tips=27>廖</tips>はそれを自分の舌でねっとりと舐めてから、唇を強く重ね、自分の舌でエリカの口の中を蹂躙し、唾液を無理矢理交換させる。","en":"No matter how many times it happened, she could never grow accustomed to him. She offered him her trembling tongue. <tips=27>Liao</tips> licked it slowly with his own, then crushed his lips against hers, ravaged the inside of her mouth with his tongue, and forced her to exchange saliva with him.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r509","rowIndex":509,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　目をぎゅっととじてされるがままにしているエリカの胸元に<tips=27>廖</tips>は手を伸ばす。","en":"Erika squeezed her eyes shut and let him do as he pleased. <tips=27>Liao</tips> reached toward her breast.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r510","rowIndex":510,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　豊かな乳房を乱暴に揉み、せっかく着せたジャケットのボタンに手をかけて前を開くと、その下のブラウスのボタンも片手で器用に取り外す。ブラウスの下は、これも<tips=27>廖</tips>の指示で、下着をつけていない。形の良い乳房があらわになる。","en":"He roughly kneaded her ample breasts, then reached for the buttons of the jacket he had specially chosen for her and opened the front. With one hand, he deftly undid the buttons of the blouse beneath it as well. On <tips=27>Liao’s</tips> instructions, she wore no underwear beneath the blouse. Her shapely breasts lay exposed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r511","rowIndex":511,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いつ見ても、素晴らしい……」","en":"“Magnificent, no matter how often I see them...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"廖志明","displayName":"Liao Chi-ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r512","rowIndex":512,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=27>廖</tips>は手を伸ばし、それに触れる。","en":"<tips=27>Liao</tips> reached out and touched one.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r513","rowIndex":513,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ううっ……」","en":"“Nngh...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エリカ・ビリンガム","displayName":"Erika Billingham","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r514","rowIndex":514,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　エリカは<tips=27>廖</tips>の唾液でべとべとになった顔を歪める。","en":"Erika grimaced, her face now sticky with <tips=27>Liao’s</tips> saliva.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r515","rowIndex":515,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その屈辱の表情はさらに<tips=27>廖</tips>を刺激し、彼はエリカの首筋をべとべとになるまで舐め、そして胸に顔をうずめる。","en":"The humiliation on her face excited <tips=27>Liao</tips> even further. He licked Erika’s neck until it was slick, then buried his face in her breasts.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r516","rowIndex":516,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ふふふ……」","en":"“Heh heh heh...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"廖志明","displayName":"Liao Chi-ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r517","rowIndex":517,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=27>廖</tips>は身体を起こす。","en":"<tips=27>Liao</tips> straightened.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r518","rowIndex":518,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「今夜は長くなるぞ……」","en":"“We have a long night ahead of us...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"廖志明","displayName":"Liao Chi-ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r519","rowIndex":519,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そう呟いてから立ち上がった。","en":"He murmured the words, then stood.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r520","rowIndex":520,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　用を足そうというつもりらしい。トイレは部屋の奥側のドアを出て、廊下の突き当たりにある。","en":"Apparently, he meant to use the bathroom. The toilet lay at the end of the corridor beyond the door at the back of the room.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r521","rowIndex":521,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そのドアノブに手を伸ばしたところで、彼が触れるのを待たずにガチャリと音が鳴り、向こうから勝手に開いた。","en":"Just as he reached for its knob, a latch clicked. Before he could touch it, the door opened of its own accord from the other side.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r522","rowIndex":522,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ん？」","en":"“Hm?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"廖志明","displayName":"Liao Chi-ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r523","rowIndex":523,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　怪訝な表情をする<tips=27>廖</tips>の顔の目の前に、開いたドアの隙間からヌッと突き出された拳銃があらわれ、その銃口を額に当てる。","en":"As <tips=27>Liao</tips> frowned in puzzlement, a pistol suddenly thrust through the gap in the open door and pressed its muzzle to his forehead.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r524","rowIndex":524,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　拳銃を握るのは、無表情な<tips=25>馬世傑</tips>。","en":"<tips=25>Ma Sai-kit</tips> held the weapon, his face expressionless.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r525","rowIndex":525,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その銃口に押されるようにして<tips=27>廖</tips>が後ずさると、<tips=25>世傑</tips>の後ろからもう一人の人物が現れて、部屋に足を踏み入れる。","en":"Forced backward by the muzzle, <tips=27>Liao</tips> retreated into the room. A second figure appeared behind <tips=25>Sai-kit</tips> and stepped inside.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r526","rowIndex":526,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それは、黒いコートを纏った青年……<tips=1>謝亮</tips>であった。","en":"It was a young man in a black coat—<tips=1>Tse Leung</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r527","rowIndex":527,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=27>廖</tips>は血相を変え、背後を振り返る。","en":"<tips=27>Liao</tips> blanched and looked back over his shoulder.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r528","rowIndex":528,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……お前……」","en":"“...You...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"廖志明","displayName":"Liao Chi-ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r529","rowIndex":529,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　エリカはソファーに身を起こし、<tips=27>廖</tips>に触れられてぼさぼさになったブロンドをそのままに、露わになった胸を隠しもせず、怯えた視線をこちらに向けている。","en":"Erika had pushed herself upright on the sofa. Her blond hair remained disheveled from <tips=27>Liao’s</tips> handling; making no attempt to cover her exposed breasts, she turned a frightened gaze on them.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r530","rowIndex":530,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女はこの突然の状況に驚いてはいない。間違いない。こうなることを、事前に知っていたのだ。","en":"She showed no surprise at this sudden turn. There could be no doubt: she had known beforehand that this would happen.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r531","rowIndex":531,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「はかったな……」","en":"“You set me up...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"廖志明","displayName":"Liao Chi-ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r532","rowIndex":532,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　うめくように呟く<tips=27>廖</tips>に、<tips=1>謝亮</tips>は言った。","en":"<tips=27>Liao</tips> muttered the words in a groan. <tips=1>Tse Leung</tips> answered him.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r533","rowIndex":533,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「もうちょっと見物していても良かったんだが、さすがに可哀想だと思ってね」","en":"“I could have watched a little longer, but I did start to feel sorry for her.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r534","rowIndex":534,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>はクスリともしない。","en":"<tips=1>Leung</tips> did not so much as chuckle.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r535","rowIndex":535,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「お取り込み中のところ申し訳ないが、ビジネスの時間だ」","en":"“Sorry to interrupt you at such an intimate moment, but it’s time for business.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r536","rowIndex":536,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「くっ」","en":"“Ghh...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"廖志明","displayName":"Liao Chi-ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r537","rowIndex":537,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=27>廖</tips>は唇を噛む。","en":"<tips=27>Liao</tips> bit his lip.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r538","rowIndex":538,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ここにボディーガードはいない。呼び出しても相手の動きの方が早いだろう。つまり、完全に状況を支配されてしまったということだ。こんなやり方をするのだから、相手も簡単な要件で来たわけではないだろう。","en":"There were no bodyguards here. Even if he called them, the other side would move faster. In other words, they had complete control of the situation. Given the way they had gone about it, they could hardly have come on some trivial errand.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r539","rowIndex":539,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　今さっき「今夜は長くなる」とエリカに放った言葉が、そのまま自分に跳ね返ってくるのを感じていた。","en":"The words he had tossed at Erika only moments before—“We have a long night ahead of us”—now seemed to rebound upon him unchanged.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r540","rowIndex":540,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どうするつもりだ？」","en":"“What do you intend to do?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"廖志明","displayName":"Liao Chi-ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r541","rowIndex":541,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まず、そこに座ってもらおうか」","en":"“First, I would like you to sit over there.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r542","rowIndex":542,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=25>馬世傑</tips>の銃口に促されながら、先ほどエリカと戯れていた場所に腰をおろす<tips=27>廖志明</tips>。<tips=1>謝亮</tips>はその正面に座る。","en":"At the prompting of <tips=25>Sai-kit’s</tips> pistol, <tips=27>Liao Chi-ming</tips> sat down where he had just been fondling Erika. <tips=1>Tse Leung</tips> took the seat opposite him.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r543","rowIndex":543,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なんのつもりだ？　こんな場面に現れるのは間男と決まっているが、まさか、本当はお前がこの女の新しい男なんじゃないのかね？」","en":"“What is the meaning of this? The man who turns up at a moment like this is always the lover. Don’t tell me you’re actually this woman’s new man.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r544","rowIndex":544,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=27>廖</tips>は唇を歪めて笑顔を見せ、余裕の態度を作りながらそう問う。","en":"<tips=27>Liao</tips> twisted his lips into a smile and posed the question with a show of composure.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r545","rowIndex":545,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「残念ながら、僕はこの美女の新しい男でも古い男でもない。言ったろう？　ビジネスの話をしに来たんだ」","en":"“I’m afraid I’m neither this beauty’s new man nor her old one. I told you, didn’t I? I came to talk business.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r546","rowIndex":546,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　一方<tips=1>亮</tips>は無表情だ。","en":"<tips=1>Leung</tips>, for his part, remained expressionless.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r547","rowIndex":547,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=25>世傑</tips>、あれを」　","en":"“<tips=25>Sai-kit</tips>. Bring it out.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r548","rowIndex":548,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　言われて<tips=25>世傑</tips>は、銃口を<tips=27>廖</tips>に向けたまま、もう片方の手でバッグのなかを探り、取り出したものをテーブルの上に置いた。","en":"At the instruction, <tips=25>Sai-kit</tips> kept the pistol trained on <tips=27>Liao</tips> while rummaging through his bag with the other hand. He took something out and set it on the table.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r549","rowIndex":549,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それは美しく磨き上げられた金属の器で、<tips=27>廖</tips>は一目見て片方の眉をつり上げる。","en":"It was a beautifully polished metal cup. At the sight of it, <tips=27>Liao</tips> raised one eyebrow.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r550","rowIndex":550,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「もしや、それは？」","en":"“Could that possibly be...?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r551","rowIndex":551,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そう」","en":"“It is.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r552","rowIndex":552,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>は頷き、","en":"<tips=1>Leung</tips> nodded.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r553","rowIndex":553,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「これは<tips=81>龍頭</tips>の杯だ」","en":"“This is the <tips=81>Longtou’s</tips> cup.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r554","rowIndex":554,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……<tips=81>龍頭</tips>になったのか？」","en":"“...You have become <tips=81>Longtou</tips>?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r555","rowIndex":555,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まだ、正式になったわけじゃないが、二代目がどうしてもと言うので、僕が預かっている。あんたの件が片付いたら皆を集めて儀式を行うつもりだよ。いまここで素直になってくれるなら、あんたもその式に参加出来る」","en":"“It isn’t official yet, but the second-generation Longtou insisted, so I’m holding the cup for now. Once this business with you is settled, I intend to gather everyone and hold the ceremony. If you cooperate here and now, you can attend it too.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r556","rowIndex":556,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=27>廖</tips>は顔を顰めた。","en":"<tips=27>Liao</tips> scowled.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r557","rowIndex":557,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=84>マイケル</tips>が<tips=1>亮</tips>に杯を譲ることは予想出来たことだし、そうなれば次の代を狙えばいいことで、<tips=27>廖</tips>にとっては予定が狂ったというほどのことでもない。","en":"It had been easy enough to foresee <tips=84>Michael</tips> handing the cup to <tips=1>Tse Leung</tips>, and if that happened, <tips=27>Liao</tips> need only set his sights on the following succession. It was hardly enough to throw his plans off course.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r558","rowIndex":558,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しかし、こんな形で乗り込まれて、銃を突きつけられながら見せつけられるのは屈辱でしかなかった。","en":"But to have them barge in like this and flaunt it before him at gunpoint was nothing but humiliation.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r559","rowIndex":559,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「とにかく、そういう訳だから、これからの僕の言葉は<tips=81>龍頭</tips>……つまり<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>の意志として聞いて欲しい」","en":"“In any case, that’s how matters stand. From now on, I want you to take what I say as the word of the <tips=81>Longtou</tips>—in other words, as the will of <tips=7>YS</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r560","rowIndex":560,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>は言いながら指先で杯をつまみ、何度か位置を動かしてから、ようやく指を離す。","en":"As he spoke, <tips=1>Tse Leung</tips> took the cup between his fingertips and adjusted its position several times before finally letting go.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r561","rowIndex":561,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その行為に何の意味があるのかは、<tips=27>廖</tips>にはわからなかったが、しかしそのことについて深くは考えなかった。","en":"<tips=27>Liao</tips> did not know what the act signified, but he gave it no further thought.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r562","rowIndex":562,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　今現在危機的状況におかれている彼は、それ以外にも考えなければならないことが、あまりにも多かった。","en":"In his present crisis, there were far too many other things he had to consider.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r563","rowIndex":563,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「非礼をわびるなら今のうちだぞ。私を追い詰めたつもりでいい気になっているようだが、このビルの周囲は私の部下が固めているということを忘れるな。袋のネズミはお前の方だ」","en":"“If you intend to apologize for this insult, now is your chance. You seem quite pleased with yourself, thinking you have me cornered, but don’t forget that my men have this building surrounded. You’re the trapped rat here.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r564","rowIndex":564,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=27>廖</tips>は精一杯虚勢を張ってみたが、","en":"<tips=27>Liao</tips> mustered all the bravado he could, but","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r565","rowIndex":565,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「心配はいらない。僕は入ってきたときと同じように堂々と正面玄関から出てみせるさ。あんたはただ自分の心配だけしていればいい」","en":"“No need to worry. I’ll walk boldly out the front entrance, just as openly as I came in. All you need to worry about is yourself.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r566","rowIndex":566,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　相手には通用しないようだった。","en":"it seemed to have no effect on his opponent.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r567","rowIndex":567,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「大した自信だ」","en":"“Such confidence.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r568","rowIndex":568,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=27>廖</tips>は半ばやけくそになって笑う。","en":"<tips=27>Liao</tips> laughed in near desperation.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r569","rowIndex":569,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それより、あんたこそ、おかしな真似をしないよう気をつけるんだな。あんたの部下の動きは完全に把握している。今ここで僕らの目を誤魔化して合図を出したとしても、妙な動きをすればすぐにわかる」","en":"“More to the point, you’re the one who should take care not to try anything strange. We know every move your subordinates make. Even if you somehow signal them right now without our noticing, we’ll know at once if they make any suspicious move.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r570","rowIndex":570,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あのハゲ姉妹を連れて来ているのか。用意周到なことで。息子は父親と違ってずいぶんやり方が陰湿のようだ」","en":"“You brought those bald sisters along? You really do think of everything. The son’s methods seem considerably more underhanded than the father’s.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r571","rowIndex":571,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=27>廖</tips>は目の前の相手に煙を吐きかける。","en":"<tips=27>Liao</tips> blew smoke into the face of the man before him.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r572","rowIndex":572,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>はそれを避けようともせず、じっと相手の目を見つめながら口を開いた。","en":"<tips=1>Tse Leung</tips> made no attempt to avoid it. Staring steadily into the other man’s eyes, he spoke.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r573","rowIndex":573,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「我々に挑戦するのはあんたの自由だが、代償は高くつくと考えたほうがいい」","en":"“You’re free to challenge us, but you’d be wise to expect the price to be high.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r574","rowIndex":574,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その口調は気負いもないごく自然で冷静なもので、<tips=27>廖</tips>は目の前にしている若者が、思っていたよりも厄介な相手かも知れないと感じ始めていた。","en":"His tone was entirely natural and calm, without the slightest bravado. <tips=27>Liao</tips> began to suspect that the young man before him might prove more troublesome than he had imagined.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r575","rowIndex":575,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼らが差し向かっている間、エリカ・ビリンガムは少し離れた壁際に立ち、心配そうに見守っている。","en":"While the two sat face-to-face, Erika Billingham stood against a wall some distance away and watched anxiously.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r576","rowIndex":576,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=27>廖志明</tips>が気に食わないのは、その傍らに青年が一人立ち、エリカの肩を抱いていることだった。","en":"What displeased <tips=27>Liao Chi-ming</tips> was the young man standing beside her with an arm around her shoulder.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r577","rowIndex":577,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>謝亮</tips>の説明によると、その若者はエリカの恋人だということだ。","en":"According to <tips=1>Tse Leung</tips>, the young man was Erika’s lover.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r578","rowIndex":578,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>謝亮</tips>たちはこの若者を利用してエリカの協力を得て、ここで自分を待ち伏せたのだろう。","en":"<tips=1>Tse Leung</tips> and his companions must have used the young man to obtain Erika’s cooperation and lie in wait for him here.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r579","rowIndex":579,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　恋人を隠していたということは気にならない。<tips=27>廖</tips>は人の心を支配しようとはしないが、行動を支配出来なかったことが屈辱だった。","en":"That she had kept a lover secret did not bother him. <tips=27>Liao</tips> had never sought to control people’s hearts; what humiliated him was that he had failed to control their actions.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r580","rowIndex":580,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「おい兄ちゃん、あんたも物好きだな。金で自分を売り、おれに散々犯された女を救うために、命がけでこんなことをしたのか？　立派な心意気だが、割に合っていないだろうよ」","en":"“Hey, kid. You have peculiar tastes yourself. You risked your life to save a woman who sold herself for money and whom I raped time and again? Admirable devotion, but hardly worth it, is it?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r581","rowIndex":581,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=27>廖</tips>は若者に向かって挑発的に笑う。","en":"<tips=27>Liao</tips> gave the young man a provocative smile.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r582","rowIndex":582,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　若者は怒気を顔に立ちのぼらせたが、唇を噛み、黙っている。","en":"Anger flooded the young man’s face, but he bit his lip and remained silent.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r583","rowIndex":583,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　よほど忍耐強いのか、それとも事前に余計な口をきかぬよう<tips=1>謝亮</tips>と打ち合わせでもしてあるのか。","en":"Perhaps he was extraordinarily patient, or perhaps he and <tips=1>Tse Leung</tips> had agreed beforehand that he would not speak out of turn.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r584","rowIndex":584,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「頭は悪そうだが、その根性だけはなかなか見所がある。私のところで働かないか？　そうしたら、エリカをくれてやろう。いいアイデアじゃないか？　私が仲人として結婚式に出てやるぞ。どんなスピーチをするか、今から楽しみだ」","en":"“You don’t look very bright, but that grit of yours shows promise. Why not work for me? If you do, I’ll give Erika to you. Isn’t that a fine idea? I’ll attend the wedding as your matchmaker. I’m already looking forward to what sort of speech I’ll give.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r585","rowIndex":585,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そこまで言うと、若者は漸く口を開いた。","en":"At that, the young man finally opened his mouth.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r586","rowIndex":586,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「冗談じゃない。本当だったら、いまここでお前を引き裂いて殺してやりたいくらいだ」","en":"“Don’t make me laugh. If I had my way, I would tear you apart and kill you here and now.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"林巧","displayName":"Takumi Hayashi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r587","rowIndex":587,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「おーこわい」","en":"“Ooh, scary.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r588","rowIndex":588,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=27>廖</tips>はおおげさに肩をすくめておどけてみせてから、","en":"<tips=27>Liao</tips> gave an exaggerated shrug, clowning for effect, then said,","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r589","rowIndex":589,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「名は？　言うのはこわいか？」","en":"“What is your name? Or are you frightened to say it?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r590","rowIndex":590,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……林巧だ。覚えておけ」","en":"“...Takumi Hayashi. Remember it.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"林巧","displayName":"Takumi Hayashi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r591","rowIndex":591,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その返事に、<tips=27>廖</tips>はにやりと笑う。","en":"<tips=27>Liao</tips> grinned at the answer.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r592","rowIndex":592,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いやあ<tips=1>謝亮</tips>君。きみを無視して話をしていてすまなかったね。男の嫉妬心というのはどうにも醜いものだが、この勇ましい恋人に言わずにはいられなかったのだよ」","en":"“Well, <tips=1>Tse Leung</tips>. Forgive me for talking past you as though you weren’t there. A man’s jealousy is an ugly thing, but I simply couldn’t resist saying all that to this gallant lover.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r593","rowIndex":593,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ご自由に。そうやって彼をからかっていられるのも今のうちだからね」","en":"“Do as you please. Enjoy baiting him like that while you still can.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r594","rowIndex":594,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>はそう言って微笑する。その表情と口調に、<tips=27>廖</tips>はなぜか自分の背筋にぞくりと冷たいものが差し込まれたような感覚に襲われた。","en":"<tips=1>Tse Leung</tips> said this with a smile. For some reason, his expression and tone made <tips=27>Liao</tips> feel as though something cold had slipped into his spine.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r595","rowIndex":595,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そしてすぐその後に、こんな小僧に戦慄させられてしまった自分を不快に思い、舌打ちをした。","en":"Immediately afterward, he was disgusted with himself for shuddering at a mere boy and clicked his tongue.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r596","rowIndex":596,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　父の<tips=3>クリス</tips>も妙な迫力があったのを思い出す。やはり、蛙の子は蛙ということなのだろうか。","en":"He remembered that <tips=3>Chris</tips>, the man’s father, had possessed a peculiar presence too. Perhaps it truly was a case of like father, like son.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r597","rowIndex":597,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そんな<tips=27>廖</tips>をよそに、<tips=1>亮</tips>は素知らぬ顔で、","en":"Oblivious to <tips=27>Liao’s</tips> reaction, <tips=1>Tse Leung</tips> went on with an unconcerned expression,","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r598","rowIndex":598,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「さて、それでは大事な話をしようか」","en":"“Now then, let’s discuss what matters.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r599","rowIndex":599,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そう言うと、彼はテーブルの上にそのままにしてあった鉱泉水のボトルを手に取り、一口飲んだ。","en":"With that, he picked up the bottle of mineral water still sitting on the table and took a sip.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r600","rowIndex":600,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まず、確認させてもらう。……<tips=39>ジェフリー</tips>の件だ」","en":"“First, let me confirm something. ...It’s about <tips=39>Jeffrey</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r601","rowIndex":601,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>は、<tips=27>廖</tips>の目をまっすぐ見つめる。","en":"<tips=1>Tse Leung</tips> looked straight into <tips=27>Liao’s</tips> eyes.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r602","rowIndex":602,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=27>廖</tips>は、ささいな変化も見逃さぬかのような、相手の機敏な視線が鬱陶しかった。","en":"<tips=27>Liao</tips> found his opponent’s quick, searching gaze—as though determined not to miss the slightest change—irritating.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r603","rowIndex":603,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あの中傷事件やらは、どうしても自分がやったとは認めないんだね？」","en":"“You simply won’t admit that you were behind that smear campaign and the rest, will you?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r604","rowIndex":604,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「事実でないことを認めるわけがない」","en":"“I have no intention of admitting to something that isn’t true.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r605","rowIndex":605,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=27>廖</tips>はおどけたように肩をすくめて見せる。","en":"<tips=27>Liao</tips> gave a theatrical shrug.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r606","rowIndex":606,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「街の噂ではそういうことになっているらしいがね。そりゃ、状況を考えればそう疑いたくなるのも仕方がない。しかし、正真正銘私とは無関係の事件だ。故人を悪く言いたくはないが、彼は敵を作りやすい人柄だからね。きっとあれは……」","en":"“That is apparently what the rumors around the city say. Given the circumstances, I can hardly blame anyone for suspecting me. But the affair truly had nothing to do with me. I do not wish to speak ill of the dead, but Jeffrey had a way of making enemies. Surely it was—”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r607","rowIndex":607,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「余計なお喋りは無用だ」","en":"“No more pointless chatter.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r608","rowIndex":608,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=27>廖</tips>の言葉を遮って、<tips=1>亮</tips>は言う。","en":"<tips=1>Tse Leung</tips> cut <tips=27>Liao</tips> off.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r609","rowIndex":609,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「もう一度聞く。僕は同じことを何度も聞くのは嫌いだから、これが最後の質問だ。つまり、あんたは、あのビラを認める気はないというわけだね？」","en":"“I’ll ask once more. I dislike asking the same thing repeatedly, so this is the last question. In other words, you have no intention of admitting that you were behind those broadsheets?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r610","rowIndex":610,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「濡れ衣もいいところだ」","en":"“It’s a complete frame-up.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r611","rowIndex":611,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=27>廖</tips>は呆れたように溜息をつき、","en":"<tips=27>Liao</tips> sighed in exasperation.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r612","rowIndex":612,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「お前は何の証拠があってそう決めつけているんだ？　私がやったという証拠の一つでもあるのなら、認めてやってもいいが、そうでないのなら……」","en":"“What evidence do you have to accuse me like this? If you possess even one piece of proof that I was responsible, I might be willing to admit it. Otherwise...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r613","rowIndex":613,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=25>世傑</tips>、膝」","en":"“<tips=25>Sai-kit</tips>. The knee.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r614","rowIndex":614,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>が短く言葉を発すると、すぐに<tips=25>世傑</tips>はその言葉に反応し、彼の手にしたオートマチックの拳銃がカチャッと機械の作動する音を鳴らす。","en":"At <tips=1>Tse Leung’s</tips> curt command, <tips=25>Sai-kit</tips> reacted immediately. The automatic pistol in his hand gave a mechanical click.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r615","rowIndex":615,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼の手にした改造型のレフチェンコ・ピストルには極めて高度な消音機能がついている。発砲時にはこのごく小さな動作音の他にはどんな音も一切しない。すぐ側で見ていても、発射したのかどうか疑わしくなるほどのものだが、確かに弾丸は飛び出したらしく、作動音の直後に<tips=27>廖</tips>の膝が血しぶきを上げ、彼はその部分を抑えるように蹲った。","en":"The modified Levchenko pistol in his hand was equipped with an extremely advanced sound-suppression system. When fired, it made no sound whatsoever beyond that faint mechanical click. Even watching from close beside it, one might doubt whether it had fired at all. Yet a bullet clearly had left the barrel: an instant after the mechanism clicked, blood burst from <tips=27>Liao’s</tips> knee, and he doubled over clutching it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r616","rowIndex":616,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「き、きさま……」","en":"“Y-you bastard...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r617","rowIndex":617,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　猛烈な痛みに身体を震わせ、顔に脂汗を浮かべながら、<tips=27>廖</tips>は目の前のすまし顔の青年を睨み上げる。","en":"His body trembling with violent pain and his face gleaming with cold sweat, <tips=27>Liao</tips> glared up at the impassive young man before him.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r618","rowIndex":618,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「幹部を公然と中傷し、組織に混乱を招いた。そしてそれを謝ろうともしない。本来なら死が相応しいところだが、今回は特別に足一本で済ますこととしよう」","en":"“You publicly slandered an officer and threw the organization into disorder. Nor have you made any attempt to apologize. Ordinarily, death would be the proper penalty. This once, however, I will make a special exception and let one leg suffice.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r619","rowIndex":619,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……くっ」","en":"“...Ghh...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r620","rowIndex":620,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「さて、それでは本題に入りたいんだが、喋ることが出来るかい？　……どうも、それどころではなさそうだね。林、薬を打ってやってくれ」","en":"“Now then, I’d like to get to the matter at hand. Can you speak? ...It doesn’t look as though you’re in any state to. Hayashi, give him the shot.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r621","rowIndex":621,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「おい、何をする！」","en":"“What do you think you’re doing?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r622","rowIndex":622,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　注射器を片手に近づく若者を、<tips=27>廖</tips>は振りほどこうとするが、逆に押さえ込まれる。","en":"<tips=27>Liao</tips> tried to throw off the young man approaching with a syringe in one hand, but found himself pinned down instead.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r623","rowIndex":623,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「やめろっ！」","en":"“Stop!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r624","rowIndex":624,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「心配しなくていい。ちょっとした痛み止めと、気付けの薬だ」","en":"“Don’t worry. It’s only a little painkiller and something to perk you up.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r625","rowIndex":625,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　若者は<tips=27>廖</tips>に馬乗りになって、その首筋に注射の針を刺した。","en":"The young man straddled <tips=27>Liao</tips> and sank the needle into his neck.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r626","rowIndex":626,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その後、抵抗をやめてぐったりとなった<tips=27>廖</tips>の上半身を起こしてソファーの背もたれにもたれさせると、<tips=1>亮</tips>の顔を確認する。そして彼が頷きを返すのを確認すると、若者は立ち上がって再び恋人の元へ戻り、その手をぎゅっと握りしめた。","en":"Once <tips=27>Liao</tips> stopped resisting and went limp, the young man raised his upper body and propped him against the back of the sofa. He looked to <tips=1>Tse Leung</tips> for confirmation and, when Tse Leung nodded, stood and returned to his lover, taking her hand in a tight grip.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r627","rowIndex":627,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「はじめは少しぼんやりするかもしれないが、すぐにすっきりするはずだ。どうだろう？　もう喋るくらいは出来るんじゃないか？」","en":"“You may feel a little hazy at first, but it should clear up soon. Well? I imagine you can speak by now.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r628","rowIndex":628,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>がそう尋ねると、着衣と髪型が乱れてしまった<tips=27>廖</tips>はうつろな目で彼を見て、","en":"At the question, <tips=27>Liao</tips>—his clothes and hair now in disarray—looked at <tips=1>Tse Leung</tips> with vacant eyes.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r629","rowIndex":629,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ゴキゲンだよ。この世界に入ってからこんな恥をかかされたのは初めてだ。こんなにゴキゲンなことはない」","en":"“Never better. This is the first time since I entered this world that anyone has subjected me to such humiliation. I’ve never felt better.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r630","rowIndex":630,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それはよかった。それでは、本題にはいるとしよう」","en":"“I’m glad to hear it. Let us come to the matter at hand, then.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r631","rowIndex":631,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「仮にも父の大恩人である私に対してこのやり方は感心しない。予言してやろう、お前はいつか、犬ころのようなみじめな死に方をするよ」","en":"“I must say, I don’t care for this treatment of a man to whom your father owes so great a debt. Let me make you a prophecy: one day, you will die a miserable death like a dog.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r632","rowIndex":632,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=27>廖</tips>の憎しみを込めた言葉にも、<tips=1>亮</tips>は眉一つ変えず、話を続けた。","en":"<tips=1>Tse Leung</tips> continued without so much as raising an eyebrow at the hatred in <tips=27>Liao’s</tips> words.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r633","rowIndex":633,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いやあ、あのときは心臓がバクバクでしたよ。なんたって、あの場面で、<tips=27>廖志明</tips>に注射を打たなくちゃいけないんですよ。私は殺してやろうと思うくらい憎んでいたのに、あの場面になると完全に舞い上がってしまって、無我夢中でした」","en":"“I tell you, my heart was pounding. Just imagine: there I was, having to stick a needle into <tips=27>Liao Chi-ming</tips>. I hated him enough to want him dead, but when the moment actually came, I got completely carried away. I was acting on pure instinct.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"林巧（十年後）","displayName":"Takumi Hayashi (10 Years Later)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r634","rowIndex":634,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　林氏はそう言って溜息をつく。","en":"Mr. Hayashi sighed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r635","rowIndex":635,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それに比べて、<tips=1>菅原</tips>は実に落ち着いたものでね……まあ、あいつが取り乱したところなんざ見たことがないんですが。それでもやっぱり、注射を打ち終わって見上げたときに、どういう意味での興奮もせず、つまらなそうに<tips=27>廖志明</tips>を見ている<tips=1>菅原</tips>がそこにいるとね、ああ、こいつはどういうやつなんだろうって、呆れたような気持ちになったものですよ」","en":"“Compared with me, <tips=1>Sugawara</tips> was remarkably calm... Though I never saw him lose his composure at any time. Even so, after I finished the injection and looked up, there he was: <tips=1>Sugawara</tips>, not excited in any sense of the word, just staring at <tips=27>Liao Chi-ming</tips> as if bored. I remember thinking, almost in disbelief, what sort of man he could possibly be.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"林巧（十年後）","displayName":"Takumi Hayashi (10 Years Later)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r636","rowIndex":636,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>謝亮</tips>たちの協力を得て恋人を奪還した林氏は、にっくき<tips=27>廖志明</tips>の結末を見届けるべくそこに同席していた。","en":"With the assistance of <tips=1>Tse Leung’s</tips> group, Mr. Hayashi had rescued his lover. He remained on the scene to see what end would befall the detested <tips=27>Liao Chi-ming</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r637","rowIndex":637,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あの顏ははっきりと覚えていますよ。それでね、きっとこいつは大物になるんだろうと、あのときもう確信していたんだ」","en":"“I remember that face perfectly. Right then, I became convinced that this man was destined for great things.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"林巧（十年後）","displayName":"Takumi Hayashi (10 Years Later)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r638","rowIndex":638,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>謝亮</tips>は終始自信に満ちた態度で、何が起きても動じることなくその場に臨んでいたらしい。","en":"According to Hayashi’s recollection, <tips=1>Tse Leung</tips> conducted himself with unwavering confidence from beginning to end and faced whatever occurred without flinching.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r639","rowIndex":639,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>が<tips=27>廖志明</tips>に交渉を試みるのは事前に聞かされていたが、林氏が期待していたのは、もちろん交渉が決裂して<tips=27>廖志明</tips>が殺されることである。","en":"Mr. Hayashi had been told beforehand that <tips=1>Tse Leung</tips> intended to negotiate with <tips=27>Liao Chi-ming</tips>. What he hoped, of course, was that the negotiations would break down and <tips=27>Liao Chi-ming</tips> would be killed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r640","rowIndex":640,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=27>廖</tips>の部下に囲まれたこのマンションからどう脱出するかといった課題や、公然と<tips=27>廖</tips>を裏切ってしまってこれからどうやって生きるのかといった不安など、考えるべきことは多かった筈だが、林氏はどうしようもない憎しみにかられ、ただひたすら<tips=27>廖志明</tips>の死だけを願っていたのだ。","en":"He should have had plenty else to consider: how they would escape this apartment building surrounded by <tips=27>Liao’s</tips> men, and how he himself was to live after openly betraying <tips=27>Liao</tips>. But helpless hatred had Mr. Hayashi in its grip, and he wished single-mindedly for nothing but <tips=27>Liao Chi-ming’s</tips> death.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r641","rowIndex":641,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しかし、実際膝を抱え蹲る<tips=27>廖志明</tips>を見てしまったあとでは、その気持ちも雲散霧消したと言う。","en":"Yet after actually seeing <tips=27>Liao Chi-ming</tips> crouched there clutching his knee, Mr. Hayashi said, that desire vanished without a trace.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r642","rowIndex":642,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　氏も不良少年であったわけで、喧嘩などは見慣れていたが、人が人を銃で撃つその場面を目の当たりにしたのは初めてで、その衝撃は大きかった。","en":"Hayashi had been a delinquent himself and was no stranger to fights, but this was the first time he had ever witnessed one person shoot another. The shock was profound.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r643","rowIndex":643,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　事前に<tips=1>亮</tips>との打ち合わせをしたとおり、押さえつけて注射を打つところまではなんとかやり遂げたが、それが限界だ。","en":"As arranged beforehand with <tips=1>Tse Leung</tips>, he somehow managed to see the job through as far as pinning Liao down and giving him the injection. But that was his limit.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r644","rowIndex":644,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　傷つく<tips=27>廖</tips>に同情したというわけでもないが、足から血をダラダラ流しながら、薬の効果によってとろんとした目つきをした彼の姿を見たとき、自分でも予期しなかった恐怖が心にわき起こって、もうその場にいられなくなったと言う。","en":"It was not that he felt sympathy for the wounded <tips=27>Liao</tips>. But when he saw blood pouring from the man’s leg and his eyes glazed by the medicine, an entirely unexpected fear welled up inside him. He could no longer remain there, Hayashi later recalled.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r645","rowIndex":645,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「これから僕は一つ提案をする。あんたにとってもけして損とは言えない話だ」","en":"“I am about to make you a proposal. It is not a bad deal for you, either.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r646","rowIndex":646,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　一方<tips=1>亮</tips>は冷静で、そう話を切り出した。","en":"<tips=1>Tse Leung</tips>, by contrast, remained composed as he opened the negotiations.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r647","rowIndex":647,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「さっき言ったとおり、僕はもうすぐ第三代龍頭になる。だからあんたに<tips=81>龍頭</tips>の地位を譲ることは出来ないが、かわりに僕の後見人という立場を用意する」","en":"“As I told you, I will soon become the third <tips=81>Longtou</tips>. I cannot yield that position to you. In its place, however, I will offer you the position of my guardian.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r648","rowIndex":648,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=27>廖</tips>はこの言葉で、脂汗でびっしょりと濡れた顔に、例の蛇に似た顔にひきつり笑いを浮かべる。","en":"At these words, a strained smile twisted <tips=27>Liao’s</tips> familiar, snake-like face, now drenched in greasy sweat.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r649","rowIndex":649,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「私がお前の後見人？　銃弾をあびせ、訳の分からぬ薬を打って、そんなもの後見人に対する仕打ちではないだろう」","en":"“Me, your guardian? You shoot me, inject me with some drug I know nothing about—is that any way to treat a guardian?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r650","rowIndex":650,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そのあざけりの態度に、<tips=1>亮</tips>は表情一つ変えず言葉を続ける。","en":"<tips=1>Tse Leung</tips> continued without the slightest change of expression in the face of Liao’s mockery.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r651","rowIndex":651,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=81>龍頭</tips>の後見人となれば、格としては僕よりも上だし、あんたにとっては何も恥ずかしいことじゃない。もちろん、仕事は何もしなくて良い。……いや、この街ではもうどういった仕事をする必要もないんだ。あんたは第一線を退いて街の外で暮らすんだ。あんたの組織は執行部の管理下に入る」","en":"“As guardian to the <tips=81>Longtou</tips>, you would outrank even me formally, so there is nothing shameful in it for you. Naturally, you need do no work at all. ...No, there will be no need for you to conduct any sort of business in this city again. You will retire from the front line and live outside the city. Your organization will come under the executive committee’s control.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r652","rowIndex":652,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「私は街から追放で、組織は解体して<tips=69>義勝</tips>に吸収するということか」","en":"“You mean to exile me from the city, dismantle my organization, and absorb it into <tips=69>Yisheng</tips>?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r653","rowIndex":653,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　薬が本来の効き目を発揮し、落ち着きを取り戻したのか、<tips=27>廖</tips>の顔つきには鋭さが戻る。","en":"Perhaps the drug had begun to work as intended and restored his composure; the sharpness had returned to <tips=27>Liao’s</tips> face.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r654","rowIndex":654,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「馬鹿を言っちゃいけない」","en":"“Do not talk such nonsense.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r655","rowIndex":655,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　さすがにこういった場合の<tips=27>廖志明</tips>は迫力のある表情をするものだ。しかも、こんな絶望的な状況でも微塵もそれを感じさせない態度で、端で見ている林の背をぞくりとさせるものがあった。","en":"<tips=27>Liao Chi-ming</tips> could be genuinely intimidating at a moment like this. Even in so desperate a position, his manner betrayed none of it, and a chill ran down Hayashi’s back as he watched from the edge of the room.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r656","rowIndex":656,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　林氏はこうした組織のボスというものを間近に見るのは初めてだったが、なるほど伊達ではないのだと不本意ながら納得せざるをえなかった。","en":"Mr. Hayashi had never seen the head of an organization at such close range. Against his will, he understood that the man’s position was no empty title.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r657","rowIndex":657,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　が、最も近くで正面に座った<tips=1>亮</tips>は何も感じなかったようだ。","en":"Yet <tips=1>Tse Leung</tips>, seated directly opposite Liao at closest range, appeared to Hayashi not to feel a thing.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r658","rowIndex":658,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうかな？　最大限の敬意を払っているんだがね」","en":"“Is that so? I believe I am showing you the utmost respect.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r659","rowIndex":659,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼はさらりと言う。","en":"He spoke lightly.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r660","rowIndex":660,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「僕はこのままあんたを始末したっていいんだ。罪状は<tips=39>ジェフリー</tips>の件だけで充分だしね。しかし、まがりなりにもあんたは初代……つまり僕の父の若き日の恩人であり、長年にわたって最大の協力者でもあった。だからこうして、特別な厚遇を用意したんだ」","en":"“I could dispose of you right now. The charges in the <tips=39>Jeffrey</tips> affair alone would be enough. But whatever else may be said of you, you were a benefactor to the first Longtou—my father—in his youth, and his foremost ally for many years. That is why I’ve arranged this exceptionally generous treatment for you.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r661","rowIndex":661,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ふん、わかったわかった。こうなっては是非もなし。後見人になってやるから、もう帰ってくれ。早く治療をしなくては、おれは失血で死んでしまう」","en":"“Hmph. Very well, very well. There is nothing to be done now. I will become your guardian, so go home. Unless I receive treatment quickly, I will bleed to death.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r662","rowIndex":662,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして<tips=27>廖</tips>は、シッシッと、手を振って犬でも追い払うような仕草をする。","en":"<tips=27>Liao</tips> waved his hand as though shooing away a dog.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r663","rowIndex":663,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それに対して<tips=1>亮</tips>は、胸元から携帯端末を取り出すと、指先で操作をし、その画面を<tips=27>廖</tips>に見えるように置く。","en":"In response, <tips=1>Tse Leung</tips> took a mobile device from inside his coat, worked the controls with his fingertips, and placed the screen where <tips=27>Liao</tips> could see it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r664","rowIndex":664,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その画面には生体認証を促すメッセージが表示されている。","en":"A message on the screen requested biometric authentication.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r665","rowIndex":665,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=27>廖志明</tips>が親指を画面に押し当て、口頭で暗証番号を言えば、銀行のメニューに入り、手続きが行えるというものだ。","en":"If <tips=27>Liao Chi-ming</tips> pressed his thumb to the screen and spoke his PIN aloud, the device would open the banking menu and allow the necessary procedures.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r666","rowIndex":666,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「承諾するのなら、あんたの個人資産をこちらの管理下に置かせて貰う。すべてが終わったら返還する」","en":"“If you accept, I will place your personal assets under our control. They will be returned once everything is over.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r667","rowIndex":667,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　差し出された画面を前に、<tips=27>廖</tips>は口ごもる。","en":"Faced with the screen waiting for his authentication, <tips=27>Liao</tips> faltered.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r668","rowIndex":668,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「はやくしてくれないか？　失血死がこわいんだろう？」","en":"“Would you hurry? You are frightened of bleeding to death, aren’t you?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r669","rowIndex":669,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>が促すのに、<tips=27>廖</tips>は苦笑し、","en":"At <tips=1>Tse Leung’s</tips> prompting, <tips=27>Liao</tips> gave a strained smile.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r670","rowIndex":670,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そんなことをしなくても大丈夫。私は嘘をついたりはしないよ」","en":"“There is no need for that. I would never tell a lie.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r671","rowIndex":671,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どうしても認証したくないんだね？」","en":"“So you absolutely refuse to authenticate?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r672","rowIndex":672,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「この<tips=27>廖志明</tips>を信じろと言っている」","en":"“I’m telling you to trust <tips=27>Liao Chi-ming</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r673","rowIndex":673,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうか」","en":"“I see.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r674","rowIndex":674,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>はあっさりと端末を引っ込め、","en":"<tips=1>Tse Leung</tips> simply withdrew the device.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r675","rowIndex":675,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「こんな状況でも従わないあんたの度胸に個人的には敬服するが、まあ客観的には賢明とは言えないね」","en":"“Personally, I admire the nerve it takes to defy us even now. Objectively, however, I cannot call it wise.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r676","rowIndex":676,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ふざけるなっ！　だれが組織を手放して隠居などするか！」","en":"“Do not mock me! Who would surrender his organization and retire?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r677","rowIndex":677,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　突然<tips=27>廖</tips>は吼えた。","en":"<tips=27>Liao</tips> suddenly roared.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r678","rowIndex":678,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　目の前で大声をあげられた<tips=1>亮</tips>は顔を顰め、","en":"With Liao shouting in his face, <tips=1>Tse Leung</tips> frowned and said,","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r679","rowIndex":679,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「うるさいな」","en":"“You’re loud.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r680","rowIndex":680,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「殺すなら殺せ！　そうなれば私の組織とお前たちは全面戦争になるだろう。勝てると思うなよ。そもそも、私を殺してここから無事に帰れるかどうか……」","en":"“Kill me if you mean to! If you do, my organization and yours will be plunged into all-out war. Do not imagine you can win. To begin with, even if you kill me, do you truly think you can leave here alive...?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r681","rowIndex":681,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あんたをここで殺したって、大した争いにはならないよ。……あんたは本当に、自分の部下が、自分の死後も戦ってくれると思っているのかい？」","en":"“Killing you here would hardly lead to any serious conflict. ...Do you truly believe your subordinates would keep fighting even after you were dead?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r682","rowIndex":682,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>はあきれたように溜息をつく。","en":"<tips=1>Tse Leung</tips> sighed in exasperation.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r683","rowIndex":683,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あんたの組織は確かに巨大だが、僕らと争いたがっているのはあんただけだ。あんたが死んだら、僕は<tips=39>ジェフリー</tips>の件を公表し、組織の掟通りの処罰をしたことを宣言してから、きみの幹部たちに交渉をもちかける。すべてがすべてとは言わないが、大半はこちらの要求に応じてくれるだろう。我々と戦うより協力した方が利益になるのは彼らにもすぐ理解出来る。……あんたが知っているとおり、あんたの部下はみな非常に優秀で合理的で賢明だ。無意味な抗争よりビジネスを優先するだろうね」","en":"“Your organization is certainly enormous, but you are the only one in it who wants to fight us. If you die, I will make the <tips=39>Jeffrey</tips> affair public, announce that you were punished according to the organization’s rules, and then open negotiations with your senior men. I won’t claim that every one of them will agree, but most will accept our terms. They will quickly understand that cooperating with us is more profitable than fighting us. ...As you know, your subordinates are all extremely capable, rational, and prudent. They will put business before a pointless war.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r684","rowIndex":684,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=27>廖</tips>は反論をせずに、睨み付けている。ここで言い返さないということは、彼もその態度とは裏腹に<tips=1>亮</tips>と同じ見解を持っているということだろう。","en":"<tips=27>Liao</tips> offered no rebuttal and merely glared. His failure to answer suggested that, whatever his defiant manner, he shared <tips=1>Tse Leung’s</tips> assessment.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r685","rowIndex":685,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「だからあんたが本当に僕らに勝つつもりだったら、自分の身だけは最優先で守るべきだったのさ。くだらない女遊びは自重してね。……僕らの方から手を出すはずがないと、なめてたのかな？　僕らが、もっとあんたたちのことを恐れていると思っていた？　……その辺はやっぱり、結局ただの商売人上がりで、弱いモノを相手に暴力を使ってきた甘えなんだろうね。市民を脅しながら生きてきたあんたは、組織同士の戦いをしたことがない。市民だったら<tips=74>廖ファミリー</tips>の名前に怯えて何も出来ないだろうが、僕らはそうじゃない」","en":"“If you truly intended to defeat us, you should have made protecting yourself your first priority and restrained yourself from this foolish womanizing. ...Did you underestimate us because you thought we would never strike first? Did you think we were more afraid of you than that? ...In the end, I suppose that is the complacency of a mere merchant who has used violence only against the weak. You have spent your life threatening ordinary citizens. You have never waged war against another organization. A citizen may be too frightened by the name <tips=74>Liao Family</tips> to do anything, but we are not.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r686","rowIndex":686,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　淡々と語る<tips=1>亮</tips>を、<tips=27>廖</tips>はあざ笑い、","en":"<tips=27>Liao</tips> sneered at <tips=1>Tse Leung’s</tips> dispassionate speech.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r687","rowIndex":687,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「わかったようなことを。ボスというものはそうじゃない。ビクビク怯えて女遊びも出来なくなれば、部下たちも侮るだろう。お前の父親だって、いくら命を狙われたって平然とレストランに飯を食いに行っていたよ」","en":"“You talk as if you understand. That isn’t how a boss behaves. If he cowers in fear until he can’t even go womanizing, his subordinates will despise him. Even your father would calmly go out to restaurants no matter how many people were trying to kill him.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r688","rowIndex":688,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あんたの場合、その結果がこのみじめな有様なんだから、考え方を改めた方がいいな」","en":"“In your case, since that way of thinking has left you in this miserable state, you’d better reconsider it.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r689","rowIndex":689,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「この世界に生きている以上、誰だって最期はみじめなものさ。私はどんな死に方だろうが、恥だとも失敗だとも思わん」","en":"“Anyone who lives in this world meets a wretched end. However I die, I will consider it neither shame nor failure.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r690","rowIndex":690,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=27>廖</tips>は虚勢を張って笑って見せる。","en":"<tips=27>Liao</tips> forced a laugh in a show of bravado.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r691","rowIndex":691,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まあ何でも良いさ。とにかく、重要なのはビジネスだ。あんたは引退を拒否したが、やはりそれは間違っている」","en":"“Whatever. What matters is business. You refused to retire, but that remains the wrong choice.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r692","rowIndex":692,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>は机に置かれたままの<tips=81>龍頭</tips>の杯を見つめながら話している。","en":"As he spoke, <tips=1>Tse Leung</tips> kept his eyes on the <tips=81>Longtou’s</tips> cup, still sitting on the table.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r693","rowIndex":693,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　林氏はなぜ彼がこの交渉の場面でまったく相手の顔を見ようとしないのか、不自然に思ったが、理由を思いつくよりも早く<tips=1>亮</tips>は次の言葉を口にする。","en":"Mr. Hayashi found it unnatural that <tips=1>Tse Leung</tips> would not look at the other man’s face at all during the negotiations, but before he could think of a reason, Tse Leung spoke again.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r694","rowIndex":694,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「戦争になれば誰も得をしない。やはり、円満解決を目指そうじゃないか」","en":"“No one profits from a war. Let us aim for an amicable settlement after all.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r695","rowIndex":695,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「銃弾で傷つけ、脅迫をしながら円満解決とは笑わせてくれる」","en":"“You shoot and threaten me, then speak of an amicable resolution. How very amusing.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r696","rowIndex":696,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=27>廖志明</tips>、拗ねてる場合じゃない。いまからあんたはご自慢の頭脳で正しい判断を下さなければならないんだ。なに、難しいことじゃない。あんたの両肩に乗っているそいつがスイカか何かじゃないのならば、すぐにわかるはずさ」","en":"“<tips=27>Liao Chi-ming</tips>, this is no time to sulk. You now have to use that vaunted intellect of yours to make the correct decision. It isn’t difficult. If the thing sitting on your shoulders isn’t a watermelon or something, the answer should be obvious.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r697","rowIndex":697,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>は相変わらず視線を相手に向けない。","en":"<tips=1>Tse Leung</tips> still would not look at the other man.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r698","rowIndex":698,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あんたは優秀だったが、もう終わった人間だ。もっとも、もし<tips=81>龍頭</tips>になっていても、<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>のメンバーは誰もついて来なかったろうけどね。いくつかのファミリーが<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>を去り、そしてあんたは弱体化した<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>を立て直すことは出来ない。だけれど、僕と僕の仲間ならそれが出来る」","en":"“You were a capable man, but your time is over. Though even if you had become <tips=81>Longtou</tips>, no member of <tips=7>YS</tips> would have followed you. Some Families would leave <tips=7>YS</tips>, and you would be unable to rebuild the weakened <tips=7>YS</tips>. But my companions and I can.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r699","rowIndex":699,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=27>廖</tips>は何も言わずににらみ返している。","en":"<tips=27>Liao</tips> said nothing, only glaring back at him.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r700","rowIndex":700,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あんたにチャンスをやろうと言っているんだ。僕はあんたの組織を吸収したら、その後は、他のファミリーも取り込むつもりだ。大体、一つの組織のなかで、香港人だの、客家人だの、ブラジル人だの、いくつものファミリーに別れているのは効率的ではないんだよ。くだらない分断がなくなれば、<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>はもっと強くて巨大な組織になる」","en":"“I’m offering you a chance. Once I absorb your organization, I intend to take in the other Families as well. In the first place, it is inefficient for Hong Kong people, Hakka people, Brazilians, and all the rest to be divided into separate Families within a single organization. Once those pointless divisions are gone, <tips=7>YS</tips> will become larger and stronger.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r701","rowIndex":701,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そう上手くいくと思うなよ」","en":"“Do not imagine it will go so smoothly.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r702","rowIndex":702,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=27>廖</tips>は吐き捨てるように言う。","en":"<tips=27>Liao</tips> spat the words.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r703","rowIndex":703,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いくさ」","en":"“War.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r704","rowIndex":704,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>は目を細め、","en":"<tips=1>Tse Leung</tips> narrowed his eyes.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r705","rowIndex":705,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「すべてのファミリ－は一旦解散して、新しい<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>の部下となる。その時には、もちろん、<tips=76>香港派</tips>というのも消えてなくなっているし、<tips=69>義勝</tips>なんていう古くさい名前を口にするやつもいないだろう。今の執行部も潰すんだ。このやりかたなら、きっとうまくいく」","en":"“Every Family will first dissolve, and its members will become subordinates of a new <tips=7>YS</tips>. Naturally, by then the <tips=76>Hong Kong faction</tips> will also have ceased to exist, and no one will utter an antiquated name like <tips=69>Yisheng</tips>. The present executive committee will be dissolved as well. This approach is sure to work.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r706","rowIndex":706,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そう言った時、<tips=25>世傑</tips>も驚きの目で<tips=1>亮</tips>を見た。","en":"When he said this, even <tips=25>Sai-kit</tips> looked at <tips=1>Tse Leung</tips> in surprise.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r707","rowIndex":707,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼も事前に知らされていない内容だったのだろう。","en":"Evidently, he too had not been informed of the plan beforehand.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r708","rowIndex":708,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「新しい<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>は、出身地による派閥は作らせない」","en":"“The new <tips=7>YS</tips> will permit no factions based on place of origin.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r709","rowIndex":709,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「机上の空論だな。血と土地というものは人間の深い部分に根ざしたものだ。それはお前の父でも出来なかったことだ」","en":"“An armchair fantasy. Blood and land are rooted deep within human beings. Not even your father could achieve that.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r710","rowIndex":710,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「昔はそうだったのかもしれない。だけど、世代はかわる。僕らはこの街で生まれ育った。肌の色が違うやつらと遊んで育ち、家の中でしか母国の言葉を使わないやつも沢山いる。これからは、こういう人間がこの街を仕切ってゆくんだ。行ったこともない土地の名前に縛られるのは馬鹿馬鹿しい話さ」","en":"“Perhaps that was true in the old days. But generations change. We were born and raised in this city. We grew up playing with people of other skin colors, and many of us use the language of our ancestral country only inside the home. From now on, people like us will run this city. It is absurd to be bound by the name of a land one has never even visited.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r711","rowIndex":711,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>は机の上の<tips=81>龍頭</tips>の杯の位置を少し右に動かし、","en":"<tips=1>Tse Leung</tips> shifted the <tips=81>Longtou’s</tips> cup slightly to the right on the table and continued,","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r712","rowIndex":712,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そもそも街自体が古くさいのさ。元の国になんか戻れないような連中ばかりなのに、どうして国の名前を看板に掲げて争っているのか。全てを非効率にして、そしてその代償は自分たちが支払うんだ。……ウエスト通りの立ちんぼなんか悲惨だよ。元締めが稼ぎの七割くらい持って行く。何の商売の手伝いもしないくせに、上前だけはねてゆくんだ。<tips=59>暗闇通り</tips>で商売をしようにも、よその組織の縄張りで商売をすれば殺されても文句を言えない。そして売春婦たちは病気だの暴力だので、平均五年で死ぬ。育てられなかった子供はストリートチルドレンになるか、死んでその辺にゴミのように捨てられる。一方、穀潰しどもはその金で殺し合いをするんだ。こういう構造は街のあらゆるところに存在する。金貸しのあんたなら、こういう状況はよく知っているだろう？　故郷を捨てれば解決することなんだ。そして街が潤えば<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>の力にもなる」","en":"“The city itself is antiquated to begin with. It’s full of people who can never return to their countries of origin, so why do they hang those countries’ names on their signs and fight over them? It makes everything inefficient, and they themselves pay the price. ...The streetwalkers on West Street live miserably. Their handlers take around seventy percent of their earnings. They do nothing to help the business, yet skim their cut off the top. If the women try to work on <tips=59>Darkness Street</tips>, they’re doing business in another organization’s territory and can hardly complain if they’re killed. The prostitutes die after an average of five years, from disease or violence. Children they cannot raise become street children—or die and are discarded nearby like garbage. Meanwhile, the parasites use that money to kill one another. This same structure exists throughout the city. As a moneylender, you know these conditions perfectly well, don’t you? Abandoning the old homelands would solve the problem. And if the city prospers, <tips=7>YS</tips> grows stronger with it.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r713","rowIndex":713,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「くだらん話だ」","en":"“What nonsense.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r714","rowIndex":714,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=27>廖</tips>は不快を隠しもせずに顔を歪め、","en":"<tips=27>Liao’s</tips> face twisted with undisguised displeasure.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r715","rowIndex":715,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……お前は私を撃って、茶飲み話をしに来たのか？　だとすればイカしたジョークだな！　くどくどと無駄話をするくらいなら、私を殺してみろ！　そして、お前が言うように、私の部下が降伏するか、試してみれば良い。さあ殺せ！　その後に、お前も死ぬことになるのだからな！」","en":"“...Did you shoot me merely to come and have a pleasant chat? If so, that’s one hell of a joke! Rather than drone on with idle talk, try killing me! Then see whether my subordinates surrender as you claim. Go on, kill me! You’ll die afterward in any case!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r716","rowIndex":716,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そう吐き捨てて相手の顔を睨み付ける。","en":"He spat out the words and glared into his opponent’s face.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r717","rowIndex":717,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あまりがっかりさせないで欲しいもんだ。どうしても僕らに季節外れのスイカジュースを作らせたいのかい？」","en":"“I do wish you wouldn’t disappoint me so. Are you really determined to make us serve up watermelon juice out of season?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r718","rowIndex":718,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>は肩をすくめて溜息をつくと、","en":"<tips=1>Tse Leung</tips> shrugged and sighed, then said,","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r719","rowIndex":719,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……仕方ない。次はきみと話そうか。<tips=28>トーマス・リャオ</tips>」","en":"“...It can’t be helped. Shall I speak with you next, <tips=28>Thomas Liao</tips>?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r720","rowIndex":720,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=28>トミー</tips>だって？」","en":"“<tips=28>Tommy</tips>?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r721","rowIndex":721,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　声をあげたのは、<tips=27>廖志明</tips>だ。","en":"The cry came from <tips=27>Liao Chi-ming</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r722","rowIndex":722,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうとも」","en":"“That’s right.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r723","rowIndex":723,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>はこともなげに答える。","en":"<tips=1>Tse Leung</tips> answered as though it were the most ordinary thing in the world.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r724","rowIndex":724,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「おい小僧。<tips=28>トミー</tips>がこの部屋にいるというのか？」","en":"“Hey, kid. Are you saying <tips=28>Tommy</tips> is in this room?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r725","rowIndex":725,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=27>廖</tips>が顔を顰める。","en":"<tips=27>Liao</tips> frowned.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r726","rowIndex":726,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうだよ。僕はさっきからずっとそれに気がついていた。<tips=28>トミー</tips>、早く姿を現せよ。話をしようじゃないか」","en":"“That’s right. I’ve known you were here all along. <tips=28>Tommy</tips>, come out already. Let’s talk.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r727","rowIndex":727,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「嘘だ。お前はでたらめを言っている。<tips=28>トミー</tips>など、この部屋のどこにも……」","en":"“That’s a lie. You’re talking nonsense. <tips=28>Tommy</tips> is nowhere in this room...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r728","rowIndex":728,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「本名は李小玉」","en":"“Her real name is Li Xiaoyu.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r729","rowIndex":729,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>はそう言って、相手の言葉を遮った。","en":"<tips=1>Tse Leung</tips> cut the other man off with the answer.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r730","rowIndex":730,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「二十五年前に<tips=15>ボーダーエリア</tips>に住む夫婦の元に生まれた。三才の時に街の者との諍いで両親を殺される。十二才の時にエリアを出て、<tips=59>暗闇通り</tips>の空き家に住み着き窃盗を繰り返すが、ある時ヤミ金事務所に盗みに入った時に捕まり、リンチを受けて殺されるところを<tips=28>トーマス・リャオ</tips>に救われ、彼のボディーガードとなる」","en":"“She was born twenty-five years ago to a couple living in the <tips=15>Border Area</tips>. When she was three, her parents were killed in a dispute with people from the city. At twelve, she left the Area and occupied an abandoned house on <tips=59>Darkness Street</tips>, where she repeatedly committed theft. One day, she was caught breaking into a loan shark’s office. <tips=28>Thomas Liao</tips> saved her when they were about to beat her to death, and she became his bodyguard.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r731","rowIndex":731,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そこで<tips=27>廖</tips>の顔をチラと見ると、彼は落ち着きをなくし、黙り込んでいる。","en":"At that point, Tse Leung flicked a glance at <tips=27>Liao</tips> and found him visibly unsettled and silent.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r732","rowIndex":732,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「今は<tips=29>アイス</tips>と名乗っているその女の能力は、誰にも気づかれずに行動すること。彼女が能力を使えば、堂々と部屋のドアを開け、中に入っても僕らは自分の目や耳でそれを認識することが出来ない。……素晴らしい能力だが、万能ではない。多分、物理的に姿を消すのではなく、人間の心をいじる力なんだろう。だから、その能力で人間の感覚を欺くことが出来ても、機械の目はごまかせないし、鏡を使っても効果が消える。例えば監視カメラが相手では意味がないし、もし鏡がなかったとしても……」","en":"“The ability of the woman now calling herself <tips=29>Ice</tips> allows her to act without anyone noticing. When she uses it, she can brazenly open a room’s door and enter, yet our eyes and ears cannot register her presence. ...A magnificent ability, but not omnipotent. She probably does not physically vanish; the power likely interferes with the human mind. It can deceive human senses, but not a machine’s eye, and a mirror will nullify its effect. A surveillance camera, for example, renders it useless. And even if there were no mirror...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r733","rowIndex":733,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>は目の前の<tips=81>龍頭</tips>の杯を持ち上げ、","en":"<tips=1>Tse Leung</tips> lifted the <tips=81>Longtou’s</tips> cup from where it sat before him.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r734","rowIndex":734,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「よく磨かれた金属があれば、その姿がばっちり映り込んでしまう」","en":"“If there is a highly polished metal surface, her image will show up in it perfectly clearly.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r735","rowIndex":735,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それは……」","en":"“That...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r736","rowIndex":736,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　動揺を見せる<tips=27>廖</tips>をよそ目に、<tips=1>亮</tips>は誰もいないはずの空間に向かって言う。","en":"Paying no heed to <tips=27>Liao’s</tips> agitation, <tips=1>Tse Leung</tips> spoke toward a space where no one should have been.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r737","rowIndex":737,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「もう姿をあらわせよ。<tips=29>アイス</tips>……それと、<tips=28>トミー</tips>。<tips=40>天明</tips>が、ビルの側にあった二つの生命が突然消えたって報告した時からね、君らがここに来るのは分かっていたんだ」","en":"“Show yourselves already. <tips=29>Ice</tips>... and <tips=28>Tommy</tips>. I knew you would come here from the moment <tips=40>Tin-ming</tips> reported that two life signs beside the building had suddenly disappeared.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r738","rowIndex":738,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その言葉が部屋に響き、そして皆が固唾を飲んで見守るしばしの沈黙のあと、","en":"His words echoed through the room. A brief silence followed as everyone watched with bated breath, and then—","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r739","rowIndex":739,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「な、な、なんで……あっ」","en":"“H-how, how did you... Ah.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r740","rowIndex":740,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　声と共に、ふっと二人の男女が誰もいない空間に姿を現した。","en":"At the sound of the voice, a man and a woman shimmered into view in the empty space.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r741","rowIndex":741,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=28>トーマス</tips>はうっかり声を出してしまったことに一瞬後悔の表情を見せたが、今はそれよりも気になることがある。","en":"For an instant, <tips=28>Thomas</tips> looked as though he regretted letting the words escape. But he had a more pressing question.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r742","rowIndex":742,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なんで<tips=2>阿亮</tips>は、そこまで詳しく<tips=29>アイス</tips>のことを知ってるの？」","en":"“How come <tips=2>Ah Leung</tips> knows so much about <tips=29>Ice</tips>?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r743","rowIndex":743,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=16>タイプＡ</tips>らしい人間の情報は最優先で調べることにしているんだ。今回は<tips=15>ボーダーエリア</tips>の連中に大分金を使ったがね」","en":"“I make it a top priority to investigate anyone who seems to be a <tips=16>Type A</tips>. This time I spent a good deal of money on the people of the <tips=15>Border Area</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r744","rowIndex":744,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……ねえ<tips=29>アイス</tips>、君の本名は李小玉っていうの？」","en":"“...<tips=29>Ice</tips>, is your real name Li Xiaoyu?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r745","rowIndex":745,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=28>トーマス</tips>は<tips=29>アイス</tips>を振り返る。","en":"<tips=28>Thomas</tips> looked toward <tips=29>Ice</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r746","rowIndex":746,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=29>アイス</tips>は警戒に満ちた目でじっと<tips=1>亮</tips>の顔を見つめながら頷く。","en":"<tips=29>Ice</tips> nodded, her wary eyes fixed steadily on <tips=1>Tse Leung’s</tips> face.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r747","rowIndex":747,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「僕も全然しらなかったよ」","en":"“I had no idea either.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r748","rowIndex":748,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=28>トーマス</tips>は絶句した。","en":"<tips=28>Thomas</tips> was lost for words.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r749","rowIndex":749,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=28>トミー</tips>。とりあえず、おかしな真似はしないでね」","en":"“<tips=28>Tommy</tips>, for the moment, don’t try anything funny. All right?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r750","rowIndex":750,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=25>世傑</tips>はいつの間にかもう片方の手に新たな拳銃を握っており、<tips=28>トーマス</tips>たちに狙いをつけている。","en":"At some point, <tips=25>Sai-kit</tips> had drawn a second pistol in his other hand and trained it on <tips=28>Thomas</tips> and Ice.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r751","rowIndex":751,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=25>世傑</tips>、彼は大丈夫だ。銃を下ろしてくれ」","en":"“<tips=25>Sai-kit</tips>, he is no threat. Lower the gun.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r752","rowIndex":752,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>はすぐにそう言って、<tips=25>世傑</tips>に銃を下げさせる。","en":"<tips=1>Tse Leung</tips> immediately gave the order, and <tips=25>Sai-kit</tips> lowered the weapon.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r753","rowIndex":753,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……なぜここに」","en":"“...Why are you here?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"廖志明","displayName":"Liao Chi-ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r754","rowIndex":754,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=27>廖志明</tips>と言えども、このような形で息子と会うのはバツが悪いらしかった。","en":"Even <tips=27>Liao Chi-ming</tips> seemed uncomfortable meeting his son under these circumstances.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r755","rowIndex":755,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ここは愛人宅であるし、<tips=27>廖</tips>はまんまと罠にはまって銃で脅されているのである。しかも脅している相手は<tips=28>トーマス</tips>と幼なじみである<tips=1>謝亮</tips>だ。","en":"This was his mistress’s home, and <tips=27>Liao</tips> had walked straight into a trap and was now being held at gunpoint. Moreover, the man threatening him was <tips=1>Tse Leung</tips>, <tips=28>Thomas’s</tips> childhood friend.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r756","rowIndex":756,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「お父さんがどんなことをしているか知りたくって。それと、お父さんに何かあったら守ろうと……」","en":"“I wanted to find out what you were doing, Dad. And if anything happened to you, I wanted to protect you...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r757","rowIndex":757,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「守れていないじゃないか」","en":"“You haven’t protected me.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"廖志明","displayName":"Liao Chi-ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r758","rowIndex":758,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=27>廖</tips>は苦い顔で言う。","en":"<tips=27>Liao</tips> spoke bitterly.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r759","rowIndex":759,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「来た時にはもう傷ついていて、チャンスを待っていたら、つい、姿を現しそびれちゃって……。僕らは武器も持ってこなかったし……」","en":"“You were already wounded when we arrived. We waited for our chance, and then somehow we missed the moment to show ourselves... We didn’t bring any weapons, either...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r760","rowIndex":760,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「駄目なやつだ」","en":"“You’re hopeless.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"廖志明","displayName":"Liao Chi-ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r761","rowIndex":761,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=27>廖</tips>は肩を落として溜息をつく。","en":"<tips=27>Liao</tips> let his shoulders slump and sighed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r762","rowIndex":762,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「何もしなかったのは正解さ。僕らはきみらの能力を把握していたし、全員で見張っていたんだからね。おかしなことをしていたら、残念な結果になっていただろう」","en":"“Doing nothing was the right decision. We understood your abilities, and all of us were watching you. If you’d tried anything strange, it would have ended badly.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r763","rowIndex":763,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>の指摘を受け、<tips=27>廖</tips>は彼の顔を睨み付ける。","en":"At <tips=1>Tse Leung’s</tips> observation, <tips=27>Liao</tips> glared at him.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r764","rowIndex":764,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それより<tips=2>阿亮</tips>、今の言葉は本当かい？　<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>のなかから対立をなくして、街をよくするって」","en":"“More importantly, <tips=2>Ah Leung</tips>, did you mean what you just said? About ending the conflict within <tips=7>YS</tips> and making the city better?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r765","rowIndex":765,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「よくする、というわけでもないが、結果として多少はマシになるはずだ」","en":"“Not better, exactly, but it should be somewhat less bad as a result.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r766","rowIndex":766,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「路上で自分を売り物にするかわいそうな子供たちや、ケモノのように扱われるかわいそうなミュータントたちもいなくなるの？」","en":"“Will there no longer be poor children selling themselves on the street, or poor mutants treated like animals?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r767","rowIndex":767,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いなくなりはしない。だが何割かには、今よりももっと生き延びるチャンスが与えられるだろう」","en":"“They will not disappear. But at least some of them will have a better chance of survival than they do now.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r768","rowIndex":768,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　言われて<tips=28>トーマス</tips>は考え込む。","en":"At that, <tips=28>Thomas</tips> lapsed into thought.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r769","rowIndex":769,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なあ<tips=28>トミー</tips>、協力してくれないか？　きみたち親子が協力してくれるのなら、僕はとても助かるんだ。くだらない争いはしたくないだろう？」","en":"“Come on, <tips=28>Tommy</tips>. Won’t you cooperate with me? If you and your father joined me, it would make things much easier. You don’t want a pointless conflict either, do you?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r770","rowIndex":770,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>はソファーにどっしりと腰をおろしたまま、そう呼びかける。","en":"<tips=1>Tse Leung</tips> made the appeal without stirring from where he sat planted firmly on the sofa.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r771","rowIndex":771,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=2>阿亮</tips>と戦うのは、いやだな……」","en":"“I don’t want to fight you, <tips=2>Ah Leung</tips>...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r772","rowIndex":772,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=28>トーマス</tips>は俯き、顎に手を当てる。","en":"<tips=28>Thomas</tips> lowered his head and put a hand to his chin.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r773","rowIndex":773,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「おい、<tips=28>トミー</tips>！　何を考えることがある！」","en":"“<tips=28>Tommy</tips>! What is there to consider?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"廖志明","displayName":"Liao Chi-ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r774","rowIndex":774,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=27>廖</tips>は息子の思わぬ態度に慌てるが、<tips=28>トーマス</tips>は返事をせずに真剣な顔で考え続け、そして首を左右にふると、","en":"His son’s unexpected attitude alarmed <tips=27>Liao</tips>. <tips=28>Thomas</tips> did not answer, but continued thinking with a grave expression. At length, he shook his head.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r775","rowIndex":775,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「父さん、僕は、<tips=2>阿亮</tips>の言ってることの方が正しいような気がする」","en":"“Dad, I think <tips=2>Ah Leung</tips> is the one who’s right.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r776","rowIndex":776,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そしてまっすぐに父を見つめた。","en":"He looked directly into his father’s eyes.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r777","rowIndex":777,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「この街は、<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>みたいな大きい組織が出来る前は、<tips=68>木下組</tips>が好き放題やったり、よそ者がおかしな秘密クラブを作ったりして、メチャクチャだったんでしょ？　父さんが<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>のなかで変な争いを起こそうとしているのは、時代を逆戻りさせるのと同じことだと思うんだ。<tips=2>阿亮</tips>のお父さんが秘密クラブを潰し、<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>を作ったから、街は前より良くなったんだ。次の段階として、<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>内での垣根を取り払うとか、街の中での対立をなくそうというのは、すごくまっとうな考え方だと思う……。ねえ<tips=2>阿亮</tips>、今ここで僕がうんといえば、父さんを治療してくれるかい？」","en":"“Before a large organization like <tips=7>YS</tips> existed, this city was a complete mess, wasn’t it? The <tips=68>Kinoshita-gumi</tips> did whatever they pleased, and outsiders formed strange secret clubs. I think Dad trying to start another senseless conflict inside <tips=7>YS</tips> would be just like turning back the clock. <tips=2>Ah Leung’s</tips> father destroyed the secret clubs and founded <tips=7>YS</tips>, and the city became better than it had been. As the next step, removing the barriers within <tips=7>YS</tips> and trying to end the conflicts across the city seems perfectly reasonable to me... Tell me, <tips=2>Ah Leung</tips>: if I say yes here and now, will you treat Dad’s wound?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r778","rowIndex":778,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「もちろんだ」","en":"“Of course.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r779","rowIndex":779,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「おい、やめろ！　お前は、このガキがどれだけ見当違いなことを言っているのか分かっていない。こいつの言ったことを実行すれば、それこそすべてが混乱してしまう。まずまっさきに、こいつの仲間の<tips=69>義勝</tips>の連中が反対するだろうよ！　今の話を表に出した途端、こいつは最も重要な仲間に見放されるのだ」","en":"“Hey, stop! You don’t understand how far off the mark this boy is. If he puts any of that into practice, it will throw everything into chaos. His own comrades in <tips=69>Yisheng</tips> will be the very first to oppose him! The moment he makes this plan public, his most important allies will abandon him.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"廖志明","displayName":"Liao Chi-ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r780","rowIndex":780,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=27>廖志明</tips>の言葉は<tips=28>トーマス</tips>に対して一定の説得力があったろう。","en":"<tips=27>Liao Chi-ming’s</tips> words must have carried a certain weight with <tips=28>Thomas</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r781","rowIndex":781,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　実際、<tips=76>旧義勝</tips>が保守的だというのは広く知られており、他の組織が時代と共に他国人などを受け入れるケースが増えてきたのに対し、彼らは香港出身者以外を組織に招き入れない。","en":"The conservatism of <tips=76>Old Yisheng</tips> was widely known. While other organizations had increasingly begun to accept people from different countries as the times changed, Yisheng admitted no one who did not come from Hong Kong.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r782","rowIndex":782,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それが、<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>によって天下を取ったと言って良い<tips=76>香港派</tips>が伸び悩んで来た最大の理由でもあった。","en":"This was also the chief reason that, under <tips=3>Chris Tse</tips>, the <tips=76>Hong Kong faction</tips>—which could fairly be said to have gained supremacy over the city—had begun to stagnate.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r783","rowIndex":783,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……<tips=2>阿亮</tips>、もし、<tips=69>義勝</tips>の人たちが従えないと言い出したらどうするつもり？　もしくは、別の誰かを<tips=81>龍頭</tips>に仕立て上げるなんてことも言い出すかもしれないし……」","en":"“...<tips=2>Ah Leung</tips>, what will you do if the people of <tips=69>Yisheng</tips> say they can’t follow you? They might even decide to set someone else up as <tips=81>Longtou</tips>...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r784","rowIndex":784,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=28>トミー</tips>、<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>には掟がある」","en":"“<tips=28>Tommy</tips>, <tips=7>YS</tips> has rules.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r785","rowIndex":785,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>は<tips=28>トーマス</tips>の目をじっと見つめ、穏やかな口調で言った。","en":"<tips=1>Tse Leung</tips> looked steadily into <tips=28>Thomas’s</tips> eyes and spoke in a gentle tone.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r786","rowIndex":786,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=81>龍頭</tips>の方針に従えないのならば、追放されなければならない。<tips=81>龍頭</tips>を陥れようとするならば、死をもって償わなければならない。そして今の僕は<tips=81>龍頭</tips>と同等の存在なんだ。言ってることはわかるね？」","en":"“Anyone who cannot abide by the <tips=81>Longtou’s</tips> policy must be expelled. Anyone who attempts to bring down the <tips=81>Longtou</tips> must pay with their life. And at present, my authority is equivalent to the <tips=81>Longtou’s</tips>. You understand what I mean, don’t you?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r787","rowIndex":787,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……相手が誰でも？　だって、<tips=2>阿亮</tips>の親戚の人ばっかりなんだよ？」","en":"“...No matter who it is? But they’re all <tips=2>Ah Leung’s</tips> relatives.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r788","rowIndex":788,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「例外はない。例えば<tips=4>馬明</tips>だって、<tips=25>世傑</tips>だって、場合によっては僕自身にだって、掟は平等に適用される」","en":"“There are no exceptions. The rules apply equally to <tips=4>Ma Ming</tips>, to <tips=25>Sai-kit</tips>, and, if the situation arose, even to me.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r789","rowIndex":789,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そう……」","en":"“I see...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r790","rowIndex":790,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=28>トーマス</tips>は緊張の面持ちで、つばをごくりと飲み込んでから、","en":"With a tense expression, <tips=28>Thomas</tips> swallowed hard, then said,","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r791","rowIndex":791,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「わかった、信じるよ。父さんが銀行の認証をすればいいんだね？」","en":"“All right. I believe you. Dad just has to complete the bank authentication, is that right?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r792","rowIndex":792,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「おい、馬鹿！」","en":"“You idiot!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"廖志明","displayName":"Liao Chi-ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r793","rowIndex":793,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「父さん、僕は、<tips=2>阿亮</tips>の気持ちは本物だと思うんだ。力をあわせて対立をなくしたいって言葉を僕は信じたい」","en":"“Dad, I believe <tips=2>Ah Leung</tips> is sincere. I want to believe him when he says he wants us to join forces and put an end to the conflict.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r794","rowIndex":794,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=28>トーマス</tips>が真剣な眼差しを向けながらきっぱりそう告げると、<tips=27>廖</tips>は言葉を失う。","en":"<tips=28>Thomas</tips> delivered the words firmly, his gaze grave and unwavering. <tips=27>Liao</tips> could find no answer.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r795","rowIndex":795,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　父がこれ以上何も口にしないのを悟ると、<tips=28>トーマス</tips>は再び<tips=1>亮</tips>を振り返る。","en":"Realizing that his father would say no more, <tips=28>Thomas</tips> turned back to <tips=1>Tse Leung</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r796","rowIndex":796,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=2>阿亮</tips>、ただひとつだけ、条件をつけてほしい」","en":"“<tips=2>Ah Leung</tips>, there’s just one condition I want you to agree to.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r797","rowIndex":797,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なんだい？」","en":"“What is it?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r798","rowIndex":798,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「僕らのファミリーが<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>に吸収された後は、<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>のなかの一部署になると思うんだけど、そのリーダーは僕にやらせてくれないか？」","en":"“Once our Family is absorbed into <tips=7>YS</tips>, I imagine it will become a division within <tips=7>YS</tips>. Will you let me lead it?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r799","rowIndex":799,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「つまり、父のあとを継ぎたいということかい？」","en":"“In other words, you want to succeed your father?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r800","rowIndex":800,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「形としてはそうなるけれど、もちろんきみの部下として振る舞うよ……。<tips=41>グランドタワー</tips>に暮らすし、監視してくれてかまわない」","en":"“Formally, yes, but of course I would act as your subordinate... I would live in <tips=41>Grand Tower</tips>, and you may keep me under observation.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r801","rowIndex":801,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いままで、いくら勧めても、ファミリーを継ぎたいなんて口にしたことがなかったのに、なぜこんな場面になって……」","en":"“No matter how often I encouraged you, you never once said that you wished to inherit the Family. Why, at a moment like this...?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"廖志明","displayName":"Liao Chi-ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r802","rowIndex":802,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=27>廖</tips>は呆然とした面持ちで口にする。","en":"<tips=27>Liao</tips> spoke with a stunned expression.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r803","rowIndex":803,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それですべてが丸くおさまると思うんだ。形式上でも僕がリーダーということになれば、ファミリーのみんなは納得しやすいと思うし。執行部にとってもメリットのある提案だろう。……ねえ<tips=2>阿亮</tips>。どうかな？」","en":"“I think that would settle everything amicably. If I were made the leader, even if only in name, everyone in the Family would find the arrangement easier to accept. It would be a worthwhile proposal for the executive committee too. ...What do you say, <tips=2>Ah Leung</tips>?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r804","rowIndex":804,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「飲もう」","en":"“Agreed.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r805","rowIndex":805,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ありがとう……。きみが言う通り、世代が変わって、すべてが変わるんだと思う。<tips=36>アウロラ</tips>だって、きっと同意してくれるはずさ。これからの<tips=9>Y地区</tips>は、<tips=9>Y地区</tips>で生まれ育った人たちが作ってゆくんだ。僕が思うに、この街で悲しいことがたくさん起こるのは、仕切っている人々が愛するものがそれぞれ違っていたからだと思うんだよ。でも同じ街で生まれた僕らなら、同じようにこの街を愛せる」","en":"“Thank you... Just as you said, the generations are changing, and I think everything will change with them. <tips=36>Aurora</tips> is sure to agree. From now on, the people born and raised in <tips=9>Y District</tips> will be the ones to shape <tips=9>Y District</tips>. I think so many sad things happen in this city because each of the people running it loved something different. But those of us born in the same city can share the same love for it.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r806","rowIndex":806,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=28>トーマス</tips>様が生まれたのは<tips=9>Y地区</tips>ではなく、お母様のご実家近くの病院だったはずですが……」","en":"“<tips=28>Master Thomas</tips>, I believe you were born not in <tips=9>Y District</tips>, but at a hospital near your mother’s family home...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アイス","displayName":"Ice","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r807","rowIndex":807,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=29>アイス</tips>が小声で囁くが、<tips=28>トーマス</tips>は無視して、","en":"<tips=29>Ice</tips> whispered the correction. <tips=28>Thomas</tips> ignored her.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r808","rowIndex":808,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=2>阿亮</tips>、たくさんひどいことをした僕と父さんを許しておくれ。僕はきみの部下として、<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>が良くなるよう全力を尽くしたい……」","en":"“<tips=2>Ah Leung</tips>, please forgive Dad and me for all the terrible things we’ve done. As your subordinate, I want to devote myself completely to making <tips=7>YS</tips> better...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r809","rowIndex":809,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そう言って跪く<tips=28>トーマス</tips>。口をあんぐりと開け、目の前で起きていることが信じられない<tips=27>廖志明</tips>。そして林氏は、<tips=28>トーマス・リャオ</tips>という人間のことはよく知らなかったが、血みどろになって息絶え絶えの父親の前でこんな話をしているということに度肝を抜かれ、<tips=1>謝亮</tips>や<tips=27>廖志明</tips>と同じような、『自分とは違う人種』なのだと感じているのだった。","en":"With that, <tips=28>Thomas</tips> dropped to his knees. <tips=27>Liao Chi-ming</tips> gaped at him, unable to believe what was happening before his eyes. Mr. Hayashi knew little about <tips=28>Thomas Liao</tips>, but hearing him speak this way before his blood-soaked father, barely clinging to life, left Hayashi thunderstruck. He felt that Thomas, like <tips=1>Tse Leung</tips> and <tips=27>Liao Chi-ming</tips>, belonged to an entirely different breed from himself.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r810","rowIndex":810,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あっははははは！」","en":"“Ah-ha-ha-ha-ha!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r811","rowIndex":811,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>は、その場に居合わせたみなが面食らうような大きな声で笑い、笑い終わると、笑い涙を指先で拭い、そして言った。","en":"<tips=1>Tse Leung</tips> burst into laughter so loud that everyone present recoiled in surprise. When the laughter finally subsided, he wiped a tear from the corner of his eye with one fingertip and said,","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r812","rowIndex":812,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「素晴らしい」","en":"“Magnificent.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r813","rowIndex":813,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　――これが、<tips=27>廖志明</tips>事件の顛末である。","en":"—Such were the circumstances of the <tips=27>Liao Chi-ming</tips> affair.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r814","rowIndex":814,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　これによって<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>最大級の組織である<tips=74>廖ファミリー</tips>と<tips=76>旧義勝</tips>は統合されることになり、その事実はこれから一週間後に行われた<tips=1>謝亮</tips>の第三代<tips=81>龍頭</tips>就任の場において発表された。","en":"As a result, the <tips=74>Liao Family</tips>, one of the largest organizations in <tips=7>YS</tips>, was merged with <tips=76>Old Yisheng</tips>. The union was announced one week later, at <tips=1>Tse Leung’s</tips> investiture as the third <tips=81>Longtou</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r815","rowIndex":815,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　このときの所信表明において、<tips=1>謝亮</tips>は組織全体の統合についても口にした。今現在それぞれ別個の組織として存在するギャングたちを<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>という一つの名のもとに吸収するというこの言葉は、大きな反響と動揺をもたらし、それによって、新しい騒動が始まることになるが、それはまた別の話である。","en":"In his declaration of policy at the ceremony, <tips=1>Tse Leung</tips> also spoke of integrating the organization as a whole. His announcement that the gangs then existing as separate organizations would all be absorbed under the single name <tips=7>YS</tips> provoked an immense response and widespread alarm. It would set a new disturbance in motion—but that is another story.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r816","rowIndex":816,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　就任式の後、<tips=27>廖志明</tips>は約束通り街を去り、<tips=28>トーマス・リャオ</tips>は<tips=29>アイス</tips>と共に<tips=41>グランドタワー</tips>に住まいを移した。<tips=1>謝亮</tips>たちが愛人宅で待ち伏せし、脅迫めいたやりとりで統合を決意させたという事実は伏せられ、一部の者しか知らない。表向きは平和的な説得により<tips=27>廖志明</tips>が世代交代を決意したという形だった。経緯が経緯だけに、世間の者たちはにわかには信じがたかったが、<tips=1>謝亮</tips>就任の集まりにおいて<tips=27>廖志明</tips>自身が、後見人として新<tips=81>龍頭</tips>に祝福の言葉を述べたことで、その話題は大きくなることはなかった。","en":"After the investiture, <tips=27>Liao Chi-ming</tips> left the city as promised, and <tips=28>Thomas Liao</tips> moved into <tips=41>Grand Tower</tips> with <tips=29>Ice</tips>. The fact that <tips=1>Tse Leung’s</tips> group had ambushed Liao at his mistress’s apartment and induced him to accept the merger through what amounted to threats was kept secret and known only to a few. Publicly, the story was that peaceful persuasion had convinced <tips=27>Liao Chi-ming</tips> to accept the generational transition. Given the history involved, people initially found that hard to believe. But when <tips=27>Liao Chi-ming</tips> himself attended <tips=1>Tse Leung’s</tips> investiture and, as guardian, offered his blessing to the new <tips=81>Longtou</tips>, the story never grew into a larger controversy.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r817","rowIndex":817,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「一安心したわ」","en":"“What a relief.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬世傑","displayName":"Ma Sai-kit","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r818","rowIndex":818,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=27>廖</tips>が街を去ったあとに、<tips=25>世傑</tips>が溜息を漏らしたそうだ。","en":"<tips=25>Sai-kit</tips> reportedly sighed after <tips=27>Liao</tips> left the city.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r819","rowIndex":819,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=2>阿亮</tips>、もし彼らが、土壇場で裏切って来たらどうするつもりだったの？　私はかなりの確率で、<tips=27>廖志明</tips>はギリギリのところで態度を豹変させて、もう一波乱起こすと踏んでたんだけど」","en":"“<tips=2>Ah Leung</tips>, what were you planning to do if they betrayed us at the very last moment? I had put the odds fairly high that <tips=27>Liao Chi-ming</tips> would suddenly change his tune at the eleventh hour and cause one more commotion.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬世傑","displayName":"Ma Sai-kit","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r820","rowIndex":820,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それに対し<tips=1>謝亮</tips>は、","en":"<tips=1>Tse Leung</tips> answered.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r821","rowIndex":821,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうなったら受けて立つさ。戦っても勝つつもりはある。……が、そんな可能性は低かったろうね。<tips=27>廖</tips>は息子の発言で明らかに戦意を喪失していたし、それに、<tips=28>トミー</tips>が約束を破るなんて考えられないからね」","en":"“Then we’d meet them head-on. I intend to win even if it does come to a fight. ...But the likelihood was low. <tips=27>Liao</tips> had plainly lost the will to fight after what his son said, and I can’t imagine <tips=28>Tommy</tips> ever breaking a promise.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r822","rowIndex":822,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「随分信じてるのね」","en":"“You certainly have faith in him.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬世傑","displayName":"Ma Sai-kit","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r823","rowIndex":823,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうとも。僕は本来人を疑うのは苦手なんだ」","en":"“I do. I’ve never been good at doubting people.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r824","rowIndex":824,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あきれた」","en":"“Unbelievable.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬世傑","displayName":"Ma Sai-kit","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r825","rowIndex":825,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>が真顔で言ったため、<tips=25>世傑</tips>は何かの冗談なのか、本気で言っているのか判別がつかず、苦い顔をした。","en":"<tips=1>Tse Leung</tips> said it with a perfectly straight face. Unable to tell whether it was some kind of joke or whether he truly meant it, <tips=25>Sai-kit</tips> grimaced.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r826","rowIndex":826,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ああいう特別な場面に居合わせるというのは、なかなか体験出来るものじゃないですねえ」","en":"“It isn’t often that one has the chance to be present at such an extraordinary moment.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"林巧（十年後）","displayName":"Takumi Hayashi (10 Years Later)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r827","rowIndex":827,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　林氏は、赤子をあやしながら言った。","en":"Mr. Hayashi spoke while soothing the baby.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r828","rowIndex":828,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　先ほどまで家事をしていたはずの彼の細君も、いつの間にかその隣に座って筆者の取材風景を眺めている。","en":"His wife, who had apparently been attending to the housework moments earlier, had taken a seat beside him at some point and now watched the author conduct the interview.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r829","rowIndex":829,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女はかつてエリカ・ビリンガムという名だった。今は結婚により姓を変えてハヤシエリカと名乗っている。化粧っ気がないにも関わらず、かつて<tips=27>廖志明</tips>が夢中になったという美貌は衰えを感じさせなかった。","en":"She had once been named Erika Billingham. Marriage had changed her surname, and she was now Erika Hayashi. Even without a trace of makeup, she had lost none of the beauty said to have once captivated <tips=27>Liao Chi-ming</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r830","rowIndex":830,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　マンションでの話し合いの後、<tips=1>謝亮</tips>は<tips=27>廖志明</tips>にエリカの解放を交渉し、彼女は晴れて自由の身となった。林氏と結婚するにあたっては父親の反対などもあり、スムーズには行かなかったそうだが、最終的には彼女を解放するために林氏が命をかけたという事実が後押しした。","en":"After the negotiations at the apartment, <tips=1>Tse Leung</tips> negotiated Erika’s release from <tips=27>Liao Chi-ming</tips>, and she became a free woman at last. Her father’s opposition reportedly kept her marriage to Mr. Hayashi from proceeding smoothly, but in the end, the fact that Hayashi had risked his life to free her helped carry the day.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r831","rowIndex":831,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その後<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>とのつき合いはなく、小さな喫茶店を営業して真っ当な商売を行っていたそうだが、世間はそうは見ず、なかなか苦労をしたようである。","en":"The couple reportedly had no further dealings with <tips=7>YS</tips>. They operated a small coffee shop and earned an honest living. Society did not see them that way, however, and it appears that they endured no small hardship.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r832","rowIndex":832,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「珍しいものを見させてもらいましたよ。出来ればもう二度と見たくありませんが」","en":"“I was shown something rare indeed. I would prefer never to see it again, if possible.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"林巧（十年後）","displayName":"Takumi Hayashi (10 Years Later)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r833","rowIndex":833,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そう語る林氏には不良少年の境遇から、こうして平和な家庭を築き上げ、順調な人生を作り上げたという自信が見て取れた。","en":"The author could see in Mr. Hayashi the confidence of a man who had risen from a delinquent youth to build this peaceful home and fashion a successful life for himself.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r834","rowIndex":834,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その彼に、筆者は最後の質問をした。","en":"The author asked him one final question.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r835","rowIndex":835,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>第三代<tips=81>龍頭</tips><tips=1>謝亮</tips>とは、一体どういう人物なのか？","en":"What kind of man was <tips=1>Tse Leung</tips>, third <tips=81>Longtou</tips> of <tips=7>YS</tips>?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r836","rowIndex":836,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　街で名をはせる不良少年グループのリーダー格でありながら、街と仲間を捨てて東京で大学などに通い、そこで夢中になって研究にのめり込んでいたにもかかわらず、ひょいひょいと帰って来て父の跡を継ぎギャングのボスになる。そしてしまいには<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>の改革と<tips=9>Y地区</tips>の発展まで宣言してしまう。","en":"He had been one of the leaders of a delinquent band notorious throughout the city, only to abandon both city and comrades for a Tokyo university. There he immersed himself passionately in research—yet returned as casually as though he had merely stepped outside, succeeded his father, and became the boss of a gang. In the end, he even proclaimed the reform of <tips=7>YS</tips> and the development of <tips=9>Y District</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r837","rowIndex":837,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その頃の筆者にはどうにも行動の理念というか、本質のようなものを見つけ出すことが出来ず、<tips=1>謝亮</tips>という人物をつかみかねていた。","en":"At the time, the author could find no guiding principle behind his actions, nothing that seemed to reveal his essence. The man called <tips=1>Tse Leung</tips> remained elusive.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r838","rowIndex":838,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まあそんな、特別な人間ではないと思いますよ」","en":"“Well, I don’t think he was anyone so extraordinary.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"林巧（十年後）","displayName":"Takumi Hayashi (10 Years Later)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r839","rowIndex":839,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　林氏は遠い目になり、","en":"Mr. Hayashi gazed into the distance.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r840","rowIndex":840,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「今になると酷い悪人みたいに言われてますが、普通に笑ったり怒ったりしていましたし。立場が人を変えたんじゃないですかねえ」","en":"“People talk about him now as if he were some terrible villain, but he laughed and got angry like anyone else. Perhaps his position changed him.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"林巧（十年後）","displayName":"Takumi Hayashi (10 Years Later)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r841","rowIndex":841,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そう言って彼は苦笑する。","en":"He gave a wry smile.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r842","rowIndex":842,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あいつのことを思い出すと、自分が平凡な生まれでよかったと思いますよ。少なくとも、私には何が大事で何が幸福なのか、はっきりとわかっている」","en":"“Whenever I think of him, I’m glad I was born ordinary. At least I know perfectly well what matters to me and what happiness is.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"林巧（十年後）","displayName":"Takumi Hayashi (10 Years Later)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r843","rowIndex":843,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そこで林氏は愛娘に口づけをすると、","en":"At that, Mr. Hayashi kissed his beloved daughter and said,","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r844","rowIndex":844,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あんなことになって気の毒だと思いますね。悪い奴ではなかったんです。妻を無事救出し、結婚出来たのは<tips=1>菅原</tips>のおかげですからね。あいつがいなければ、この娘もいなかった。本当に、悪い奴ではないんです。私も別にきらいじゃありません。どうか、あんまり悪く書かないでくださいよ。ガキのころからの友だちなんですから……あっ、こら」","en":"“I feel sorry for how things turned out for him. He wasn’t a bad man. It was thanks to <tips=1>Sugawara</tips> that I got my wife out safely and was able to marry her. Without him, this girl would never have existed. Truly, he wasn’t a bad man. I don’t dislike him, either. Please don’t write too badly about him. We’d been friends since we were kids... Ah—hey, stop that!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"林巧（十年後）","displayName":"Takumi Hayashi (10 Years Later)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-2:r845","rowIndex":845,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼は、彼の鼻の穴に指を突っ込もうとする赤子の手を、幸せに満ちあふれた笑顔を浮かべながら払いのけた。","en":"Smiling with perfect happiness, he brushed away the baby’s hand as she tried to stick a finger up his nose.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}}]},{"position":21,"code":"X3-3","unitId":"X3-3","rows":[{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r1","rowIndex":1,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=41>グランドタワー</tips>最上階。<tips=81>龍頭</tips>の執務室であるその部屋の窓からは、<tips=9>Y地区</tips>の主要な地域を一望することが出来る。","en":"On the top floor of <tips=41>Grand Tower</tips> was the <tips=81>Longtou’s</tips> office. From its windows, one could survey every principal quarter of <tips=9>Y District</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r2","rowIndex":2,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=57>滑走路通り</tips>、<tips=58>パラシュート通り</tips>、<tips=59>暗闇通り</tips>――そしてその向こうに広がる森林公園の鬱蒼と茂った木々。その木々の枝葉に隠されて、<tips=8>グレートホール</tips>のぽっかりとあいた穴はさすがに見ることは出来ないが。","en":"<tips=57>Runway Street</tips>, <tips=58>Parachute Street</tips>, <tips=59>Darkness Street</tips>...and beyond them, the densely wooded expanse of Forest Park. Naturally, the gaping hole of the <tips=8>Great Hole</tips> could not be seen, concealed as it was beneath those spreading branches and leaves.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r3","rowIndex":3,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　新しく<tips=81>龍頭</tips>となった<tips=1>謝亮</tips>は、その窓際に立って街を眺めていた。","en":"<tips=1>Tse Leung</tips>, the new <tips=81>Longtou</tips>, stood at the window and gazed down at the city.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r4","rowIndex":4,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　目を細め、彼は何を考えているのか。","en":"He narrowed his eyes. What was he thinking?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r5","rowIndex":5,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　すると、背後でドアがノックされ、<tips=31>エリー・ホワイト</tips>が入って来る。","en":"Then came a knock at the door behind him, and <tips=31>Ellie White</tips> entered.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r6","rowIndex":6,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女は<tips=1>謝亮</tips>による新しい体制でも有力な幹部の一人としての地位を保っており、<tips=76>香港派</tips>の重要なビジネスパートナーでもあった。<tips=1>謝亮</tips>やその部下たちが持つ銃器などの武器は、もっぱら彼女の組織が調達したもので、<tips=81>龍頭</tips>に就任するにあたって、<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>の組織内での立場とは別の、様々な物品の売買における新たな契約を結んでいる。","en":"She had retained her position as one of the leading officers under the new regime of <tips=1>Tse Leung</tips> and remained an important business partner of the <tips=76>Hong Kong faction</tips>. Nearly all the firearms and other weapons carried by <tips=1>Tse Leung</tips> and his subordinates had been supplied by her organization, and upon assuming the office of <tips=81>Longtou</tips>, he had entered into new contracts with her for trade in a variety of goods, separate from her position within <tips=7>YS</tips> itself.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r7","rowIndex":7,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あなたのお父様も、よくその場所に立って街を見下ろしていました」","en":"“Your father often stood in that same place and looked down over the city.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エリー・ホワイト","displayName":"Ellie White","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r8","rowIndex":8,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=31>エリー</tips>に言われると、この若きリーダーはバツが悪そうに顔を顰める。","en":"At <tips=31>Ellie’s</tips> words, the young leader grimaced awkwardly.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r9","rowIndex":9,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そしてよく、この様な立場につき、こうして街を見下ろしていると、途方もない権力者になったような勘違いをしたくなると笑っておられました」","en":"“And he often laughed that standing here in such a position, looking down over the city like this, tempted him to mistake himself for a man of immeasurable power.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エリー・ホワイト","displayName":"Ellie White","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r10","rowIndex":10,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そう」","en":"“Yes.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r11","rowIndex":11,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あなたがそうして立っていると、まるでお父様の生き写しのよう」","en":"“When you stand there that way, you are the very image of your father.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エリー・ホワイト","displayName":"Ellie White","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r12","rowIndex":12,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=31>エリー</tips>は<tips=1>亮</tips>に歩み寄ると、その頬に触れ、じっと顔を見つめた。間近に見ると、ヴェールが透けて素顔が見えた。初めて見たその顔は、想像していたよりも若く美しい。そして、憂いに満ちている。","en":"<tips=31>Ellie</tips> walked up to <tips=1>Tse Leung</tips>, touched his cheek, and gazed steadily into his face. At such close range, he could see her bare features through the veil. It was the first time he had seen her face: younger and more beautiful than he had imagined, and filled with sorrow.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r13","rowIndex":13,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そう思いたいのかもしれないけれど、先代のようには振る舞えないし、真似をするつもりもない」","en":"“You may want to believe that, but I can’t behave the way my predecessor did, and I have no intention of imitating him.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r14","rowIndex":14,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「わかっています」","en":"“I know.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エリー・ホワイト","displayName":"Ellie White","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r15","rowIndex":15,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=31>エリー</tips>はそう呟くと<tips=1>亮</tips>に顔を近づけ、その唇を触れ合わせた。","en":"Murmuring the words, <tips=31>Ellie</tips> brought her face close to <tips=1>Tse Leung’s</tips> and touched her lips to his.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r16","rowIndex":16,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>は一瞬驚いた表情を見せたが、避けるそぶりも、かといって積極的になるでもなく、ただ静かに父の愛人だったと言われている女のなすことを受け入れた。その表情は茫漠としてとらえにくく、いかなる感情も映し出さず、人間観察に優れたものであっても、彼のいまの心情をうかがい知ることは出来なかったであろう。","en":"<tips=1>Tse Leung</tips> looked startled for an instant, but made no move to avoid her—and no move to reciprocate. He simply stood still and accepted what the woman said to have been his father’s lover was doing. His expression was so vast and indistinct as to defy interpretation, reflecting no emotion; even the keenest observer of human nature could not have divined what he felt at that moment.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r17","rowIndex":17,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=31>エリー</tips>は顔を離すと、再び<tips=1>亮</tips>の顔を見つめ、何か言おうとし、しかし言葉は出ずにかわりに涙がその目の端から流れ落ちた。","en":"<tips=31>Ellie</tips> drew back and looked into <tips=1>Tse Leung’s</tips> face once more. She tried to say something, but no words came; instead, a tear slipped from the corner of her eye.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r18","rowIndex":18,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「うっ」","en":"“Ngh...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エリー・ホワイト","displayName":"Ellie White","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r19","rowIndex":19,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　表情が泣き顔に歪み、嗚咽が漏れそうになる口元を押さえる。","en":"Her face twisted with grief, and she covered her mouth to stifle the sob threatening to escape.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r20","rowIndex":20,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=31>ミス・ホワイト</tips>がこんな安っぽいことをするべきじゃない。忘れることにするよ」","en":"“<tips=31>Miss White</tips> should not cheapen herself this way. I’ll forget this ever happened.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r21","rowIndex":21,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ありがとうございます」","en":"“Thank you.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エリー・ホワイト","displayName":"Ellie White","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r22","rowIndex":22,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=31>エリー</tips>はそのまま足早に部屋を立ち去って行く。","en":"<tips=31>Ellie</tips> hurried from the room without another word.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r23","rowIndex":23,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=31>エリー・ホワイト</tips>と言えば他のギャングのボスや、様々な男たちと対等に渡り合う辣腕で知られている。それが、このような姿を見せることがあるとは、誰も想像がつかないに違いない。","en":"<tips=31>Ellie White</tips> was renowned as a formidable woman, one who dealt with gang bosses and every sort of man on equal terms. No one could possibly have imagined her revealing herself this way.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r24","rowIndex":24,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>は深い溜息をつき、執務室の椅子に腰掛けた。これも、初代が残し、愛用した椅子である。","en":"<tips=1>Tse Leung</tips> heaved a deep sigh and sat down in the office chair. This, too, had been left behind by the first Longtou, who had made habitual use of it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r25","rowIndex":25,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　執務室の家具は先だっての<tips=16>タイプA</tips>少女の襲撃によっていくつか損なわれたが、似たようなものが調達され、同じ場所に配置されていた。","en":"Some of the furniture had been damaged in the recent attack by the <tips=16>Type A</tips> girl, but similar pieces had been procured and set in the same places.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r26","rowIndex":26,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　誰の指図でそうなったのか知らないが、初代の作り上げたものはそのまま手つかずで残すというのが<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>の、いや<tips=76>香港派</tips>の不文律になっている。","en":"Tse Leung did not know who had given the order, but leaving everything the first Longtou had built exactly as it was had become an unwritten law of <tips=7>YS</tips>—or rather, of the <tips=76>Hong Kong faction</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r27","rowIndex":27,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　さらに、部屋には<tips=39>ジェフリー・ウォン</tips>が持ち込んだコーヒーを作るための本格的な道具も、少女の襲撃を生き残って設置されたままだった。","en":"The room also still held the professional coffee equipment <tips=39>Jeffrey Wong</tips> had brought in, which had survived the girl’s attack.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r28","rowIndex":28,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　いつのまにかすっかり<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>の一員となってしまった<tips=30>レイレイ</tips>が、行き届いた清掃によって執務室の清潔感を保っており、コーヒー道具のケースはホコリ一つなくピカピカに拭かれていたが、<tips=39>ジェフリー</tips>が死んで以来使うものはいなかった。","en":"<tips=30>Leilei</tips>, who had somehow become a full-fledged member of <tips=7>YS</tips>, kept the office immaculate with her painstaking cleaning. The case containing the coffee equipment had been polished until it shone without a speck of dust, but no one had used it since <tips=39>Jeffrey</tips> died.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r29","rowIndex":29,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そうした、死者たちの持ち込んだ物が並ぶ部屋の真ん中で、<tips=1>謝亮</tips>が佇んでいる。","en":"<tips=1>Tse Leung</tips> stood amid a room filled with the things the dead had brought into it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r30","rowIndex":30,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼は今、あの偉大な父が持っていたものを全て手に入れたのだ。","en":"He now possessed everything his great father once had.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r31","rowIndex":31,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　どことなくメランコリックに見えるうつろな表情だった。晴れて<tips=81>龍頭</tips>となり、ライバルであった<tips=74>廖ファミリー</tips>を吸収し、この<tips=9>Y地区</tips>においてかつてないほどの強大な権力を手に入れつつあるが、それで単純に喜ぶほど彼は愚かではなかったということだろう。","en":"There was something melancholy in his vacant expression. He had now become <tips=81>Longtou</tips> in full, absorbed the rival <tips=74>Liao Family</tips>, and was gathering power on a scale unprecedented in <tips=9>Y District</tips>. Perhaps he simply was not fool enough to take uncomplicated joy in it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r32","rowIndex":32,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>はひとつあくびをして、そしてそのまま覆い被さるように机に伏せると、寝息を立て始めた。","en":"<tips=1>Tse Leung</tips> gave a single yawn, folded himself over the desk as though covering it with his body, and began to breathe in sleep.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r33","rowIndex":33,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　寝付いてすぐに、目の前の電話がけたたましい呼び出し音を立てる。","en":"He had only just drifted off when the telephone before him rang shrilly.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r34","rowIndex":34,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>は起きず、呼び出し音は一分ほど続いてから切れ、もう一度鳴ったがやはりとられることはなく、しまいには部下が直接部屋に入ってきた。","en":"<tips=1>Tse Leung</tips> did not wake. The ringing continued for about a minute before stopping, then started again and went unanswered once more. In the end, one of his subordinates came directly into the room.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r35","rowIndex":35,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=81>龍頭</tips>」","en":"“<tips=81>Longtou</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r36","rowIndex":36,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　何度呼びかけても<tips=1>亮</tips>は起きず、耳元で大きな声で呼んでも起きなかったため、","en":"When <tips=1>Tse Leung</tips> failed to wake no matter how many times the subordinate called to him—even when the man raised his voice directly beside his ear—he said,","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r37","rowIndex":37,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「失礼します」","en":"“Excuse me.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r38","rowIndex":38,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　揺すっても、すぐには目を覚まさない。心配になった部下が安否を確認するため、手首をとって脈を調べようとしたところで、やっと<tips=1>亮</tips>の目が開いた。","en":"Even when shaken, he did not wake at once. Growing concerned for his safety, the subordinate took his wrist and was about to check his pulse when <tips=1>Tse Leung’s</tips> eyes finally opened.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r39","rowIndex":39,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「すまない。うたた寝をしてしまった」","en":"“Sorry. I dozed off.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r40","rowIndex":40,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　寝ぼけまなこのままそう言う<tips=1>亮</tips>に、","en":"To <tips=1>Tse Leung</tips>, still bleary-eyed as he said this, the subordinate replied,","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r41","rowIndex":41,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「出発の準備が出来ました」","en":"“Everything is ready for your departure.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r42","rowIndex":42,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　と、部下は言う。","en":"the subordinate said.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r43","rowIndex":43,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「わかった。すぐ行く」","en":"“All right. I’ll be there at once.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r44","rowIndex":44,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>はふらつく身体で立ち上がると、机の引き出しにしまっていた自分の携帯電話を取りだした。","en":"<tips=1>Tse Leung</tips> rose on unsteady legs and took his cell phone from the desk drawer where he had left it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r45","rowIndex":45,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　知らぬ間に着信をしていたらしく、通知の表示が画面に出ている。電話をかけてきたのは<tips=54>汐健慈朗</tips>。","en":"A notification on the screen showed that a call had come in without his noticing. The caller was <tips=54>Kenjiro Shio</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r46","rowIndex":46,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼は無表情のまましばらくその名前を見つめてから、それをポケットにしまった。","en":"He stared at the name for a while without expression, then put the phone in his pocket.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r47","rowIndex":47,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>が向かったのは、<tips=57>滑走路通り</tips>の一角にある中華料理店「うまかしゅか」。","en":"<tips=1>Tse Leung’s</tips> destination was Umakashuka, a Chinese restaurant in one corner of <tips=57>Runway Street</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r48","rowIndex":48,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　文字をあてれば「馬家酒家」となるのだろう。<tips=4>馬明</tips>が経営する飲食店で、美食家である彼の趣味と実益をかねたサイドビジネスであった。","en":"Written in characters, the name would presumably be ‘Ma Family Restaurant.’ It was a restaurant run by <tips=4>Ma Ming</tips>—a sideline that indulged the gourmet’s tastes while turning him a profit.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r49","rowIndex":49,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　モダンアートを思わせる黒を基調としたシックで現代的な建物の、正面にある扉には臨時休業を伝える張り紙が貼ってある。","en":"A notice of temporary closure hung on the front door of its sleek, contemporary black building, reminiscent of a work of modern art.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r50","rowIndex":50,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　黒服の部下がその扉を開けると、<tips=1>亮</tips>はコートのポケットに手を突っ込んだまま店内に足を踏み入れる。","en":"A subordinate in a black suit opened the door, and <tips=1>Tse Leung</tips> stepped inside with his hands thrust into his coat pockets.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r51","rowIndex":51,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　店舗の地下は広めの貯蔵庫になっており、業務用冷蔵庫や、各種の棚が所狭しと並べられている。部屋の中央は少し広い作業場になっていて、そこで運び込まれた食材の荷ほどきや仕分けを行うのだが、いまはその作業台は取り払われ、かわりに一つ椅子が置かれ、そして一人の男がロープで縛り付けられていた。","en":"The restaurant’s basement was a spacious storeroom, crowded with commercial refrigerators and all manner of shelving. An open work area in the center was ordinarily used to unpack and sort incoming ingredients. Now the worktable had been removed; in its place stood a single chair, with a man bound to it by ropes.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r52","rowIndex":52,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　身体には無数の打撲痕があり、土汚れが付着している。顔も同様に暴力の痕跡があり、まぶたは青黒く腫れて目を圧迫し、唇はふくれあがってその端が切れ、赤い血を滴らせている。","en":"His body was covered in bruises and smeared with dirt. His face bore the same marks of violence: eyelids swollen blue-black until his eyes were nearly shut, lips bloated and split at one corner, dripping bright red blood.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r53","rowIndex":53,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　全体的に凄惨な姿であったが、中でも目を引くのは、肘掛けに縛り付けられていた両腕だった。","en":"The sight was gruesome in every respect, but most conspicuous were the arms lashed to the chair’s armrests.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r54","rowIndex":54,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　右手はすべての指が切り落とされ、左手も、親指が切断されている。その傍らには血で濡れた中華包丁を持った部下が立っており、その足元には血まみれの指が散らばり、奇妙な芋虫のようであった。","en":"Every finger had been cut from his right hand, and the thumb from his left. Beside him stood a subordinate holding a cleaver wet with blood. Severed fingers lay scattered at the man’s feet like strange caterpillars.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r55","rowIndex":55,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「吐いたか？」","en":"“Did he talk?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r56","rowIndex":56,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　部屋に降りてきた<tips=1>亮</tips>は、その無惨な光景に眉一つ動かさない。残虐行為が行われている場にそぐわない日常的な調子で、その現場の指揮者である<tips=4>馬明</tips>に尋ねる。","en":"<tips=1>Tse Leung</tips> came down into the room without so much as twitching an eyebrow at the horrific sight. In an everyday tone wholly out of place amid such brutality, he put the question to <tips=4>Ma Ming</tips>, the man directing the proceedings.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r57","rowIndex":57,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「吐いたとも。<tips=2>阿亮</tips>の言う通りだった。まったく愚かしいやつらだ」","en":"“He talked. You were right, <tips=2>Ah Leung</tips>. What utter fools they are.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬明","displayName":"Ma Ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r58","rowIndex":58,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=4>馬明</tips>は苦々しげに言った。","en":"<tips=4>Ma Ming</tips> spoke bitterly.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r59","rowIndex":59,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　暴行を加えられている男は謝浩俊という三十二才の人物であった。その姓から分かるとおり、<tips=1>謝亮</tips>とは親戚筋にあたり、<tips=76>旧義勝グループ</tips>では古く有力な家系だ。父の謝超亜は<tips=76>旧義勝</tips>の重鎮の一人である。","en":"The man being beaten was Tse Ho-chun, thirty-two years old. As his surname indicated, he was a relative of <tips=1>Tse Leung</tips> and belonged to an old, powerful family within the <tips=76>former Yisheng group</tips>. His father, Tse Chiu-a, was one of the <tips=76>former Yisheng’s</tips> leading figures.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r60","rowIndex":60,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　この浩俊は、<tips=1>亮</tips>が<tips=81>龍頭</tips>となって二日後に仲間に対してメールを送った。","en":"Two days after <tips=1>Tse Leung</tips> became <tips=81>Longtou</tips>, Ho-chun sent an email to his associates.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r61","rowIndex":61,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そこでは『にっくき客家人と手を組んだ<tips=1>謝亮</tips>は我らのリーダーではない』と宣言されており、<tips=1>亮</tips>を殺し、それにとってかわって別のリーダーを立てようというような呼びかけがされていた。","en":"It declared, ‘<tips=1>Tse Leung</tips>, who has joined hands with the hated Hakka, is no leader of ours,’ and urged them to kill <tips=1>Tse Leung</tips> and put another leader in his place.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r62","rowIndex":62,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　もちろんこれは許されることではなく、彼は昨夜自宅のマンションで<tips=25>世傑</tips>たちに拘束され、このような状況に置かれることとなった。","en":"Naturally, this could not be permitted. <tips=25>Sai-kit</tips> and his men had seized him at his apartment the previous night, and thus he found himself here.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r63","rowIndex":63,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「つまり、今回の件は父の超亜も協力しているということでいいんだね？」","en":"“So your father, Chiu-a, was in on this too. Is that right?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r64","rowIndex":64,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>は浩俊に呼びかけるが、彼はうつむいて荒い呼吸をするだけで反応を示さない。","en":"<tips=1>Tse Leung</tips> spoke to Ho-chun, but the man only hung his head and breathed raggedly, showing no response.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r65","rowIndex":65,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>と目の前のこの男はさほど親しいわけでもないが、幼い頃から何度か顔を合わせてはいる。<tips=1>亮</tips>が七才の時に彼は十七才で、遊ばなくなったゲームソフトを何本か譲ってくれた思い出があった。","en":"<tips=1>Tse Leung</tips> had never been particularly close to the man before him, though they had seen each other a number of times since Tse Leung was a child. When <tips=1>Tse Leung</tips> was seven and Ho-chun seventeen, Ho-chun had given him several games he no longer played. Tse Leung still remembered that.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r66","rowIndex":66,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「超亜に関しても、既に捕縛の手配をしている。<tips=25>世傑</tips>もそちらへ向かった」","en":"“Arrangements have already been made to capture Chiu-a as well. <tips=25>Sai-kit</tips> went there himself.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬明","displayName":"Ma Ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r67","rowIndex":67,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　何も言わない囚われの男のかわりに、<tips=4>馬明</tips>が口を開いた。","en":"<tips=4>Ma Ming</tips> spoke in place of the silent captive.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r68","rowIndex":68,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ご苦労」","en":"“Good work.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r69","rowIndex":69,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>は懐に手を入れると、拳銃を取り出した。<tips=27>廖志明</tips>を撃つのにも使用した、あの音のしない銃である。","en":"<tips=1>Tse Leung</tips> reached inside his coat and drew a pistol: the same silent gun he had used to shoot <tips=27>Liao Chi-ming</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r70","rowIndex":70,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あんたは不適切な考えを持ったが、指を六本落とされるまで口を開かなかった忍耐力には敬意を表する。本来ならば反逆者は生きたまま切り刻むというのが我々の掟だけれど、特別に楽に死なせよう。最後に何か言い残すことはあるかい？」","en":"“You entertained some improper ideas, but I respect your fortitude in holding out until they had cut off six of your fingers. Ordinarily, our rules call for traitors to be cut to pieces alive, but I’ll make an exception and give you an easy death. Any last words?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r71","rowIndex":71,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　浩俊は顔を上げ、膨れたまぶたに押しつぶされて細くなった目で<tips=1>亮</tips>を見る。","en":"Ho-chun raised his face and looked at <tips=1>Tse Leung</tips> through eyes narrowed to slits beneath his swollen lids.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r72","rowIndex":72,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「思い上がるな。……お前なんか、<tips=3>クリス</tips>の息子じゃなかったら……」","en":"“Don’t get above yourself. ...If you weren’t <tips=3>Chris’s</tips> son, you...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝浩俊","displayName":"Tse Ho-chun","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r73","rowIndex":73,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　かすれた声でそう言った。","en":"he said in a hoarse voice.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r74","rowIndex":74,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「情けないセリフだ。聞かなかったことにしてやるから、もう少しマシな言葉を考えてくれ。いい遺言が出来たら、あんたの妻と子に伝えよう」","en":"“What a pathetic thing to say. I’ll pretend I didn’t hear it, so think of something better. Once you’ve come up with some good last words, I’ll pass them on to your wife and child.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r75","rowIndex":75,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そう言って次の言葉を待ったが、相手はまた顔を伏せ、与えられた機会を拒絶した。","en":"He waited for the man’s next words, but Ho-chun lowered his face once more, rejecting the opportunity he had been offered.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r76","rowIndex":76,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>は溜息をついてから、浩俊の頭に銃口で狙いを付けると、ためらいもなく引き金を引く。","en":"<tips=1>Tse Leung</tips> sighed, aimed the pistol at Ho-chun’s head, and pulled the trigger without hesitation.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r77","rowIndex":77,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　浩俊は頭から血を噴いて絶命をする。","en":"Blood sprayed from Ho-chun’s head, and his life ended.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r78","rowIndex":78,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=4>馬明</tips>が合図をすると、部下たちがあらわれ、部屋の後片付けをはじめた。浩俊の遺体を黒いファスナー付きの袋にいれ、床についた血を拭い、切断された指や、銃弾によってはじき飛んだ肉や骨のかけらはちりとりに集められてゴミ袋へ捨てられた。","en":"At a signal from <tips=4>Ma Ming</tips>, subordinates appeared and began to clean the room. They placed Ho-chun’s body in a black zippered bag, wiped the blood from the floor, and swept the severed fingers and fragments of flesh and bone blown free by the bullet into a dustpan, then emptied it into a garbage bag.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r79","rowIndex":79,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「思ったより早くけりがついた。いまから仕込みをすれば、夜からの営業開始に間に合うぞ」","en":"“That was over sooner than I expected. If we start prepping now, we can still open tonight.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬明","displayName":"Ma Ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r80","rowIndex":80,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=4>馬明</tips>は自ら椅子や作業台の位置を戻しながらそう言った。","en":"<tips=4>Ma Ming</tips> spoke while personally restoring the chair and worktable to their proper places.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r81","rowIndex":81,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……しかし、どうしてこんな愚かな計画を立てたのか。たとえ<tips=2>阿亮</tips>を殺せたとしても、その後どうにかなるわけでもあるまいに」","en":"“...But why would they devise such a foolish plan? Even if they managed to kill you, <tips=2>Ah Leung</tips>, it isn’t as though that would solve anything afterward.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬明","displayName":"Ma Ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r82","rowIndex":82,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「浩俊が仲間に送った文面の通りの理由だよ。僕が客家人たちを受け入れたのが気にいらなかったのさ」","en":"“For exactly the reason Ho-chun gave in his email. They didn’t like that I had taken in the Hakka.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r83","rowIndex":83,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>は片隅の蛇口で、手をジャブジャブと洗いながらそう答える。","en":"<tips=1>Tse Leung</tips> answered as he splashed water over his hands at a faucet in one corner.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r84","rowIndex":84,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうかな？　おれは、言葉通りだとは思えない。そこまでするやつらじゃなかったろう」","en":"“You think so? I don’t believe that was the whole story. They were never the sort to go that far.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬明","displayName":"Ma Ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r85","rowIndex":85,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=76>旧義勝</tips>のなかには、ほとんど宗教的といっていいほどに他地域の出身者を憎み、普段から嫌悪感をあらわにしている連中がいるが、謝超亜・浩俊の親子は今までそういったそぶりを見せて来なかった。","en":"Some members of the <tips=76>former Yisheng</tips> harbored an almost religious hatred of people from other regions and openly displayed their disgust as a matter of course. Tse Chiu-a and Ho-chun, however, had never behaved that way before.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r86","rowIndex":86,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「彼らは客家人に対して借金があるんだ」","en":"“They owe money to the Hakka.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r87","rowIndex":87,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　親子はかつて飲食店にボディーガード代などを支払わせて自分たちの収入にしていたが、最近はうまくいかず、経済状態が逼迫している。そこで自分たちで商売を行おうとしたところことごとく失敗し、負債だけが残った。","en":"Father and son had once extorted protection money and similar payments from restaurants for their income. Lately, that business had gone poorly and their financial circumstances had grown desperate. They attempted to establish businesses of their own, failed at every one, and were left with nothing but debt.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r88","rowIndex":88,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼らは支払いを拒絶したが、困った業者は債権を売った。","en":"They refused to pay, so the suppliers they had left in the lurch sold their claims.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r89","rowIndex":89,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そこで債権を買ったのが、客家人の金貸しだってわけさ」","en":"“And the buyers were Hakka moneylenders.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r90","rowIndex":90,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　親子はその後も支払いを引き延ばし続けた。そして、客家人たちも<tips=81>龍頭</tips>の親戚である親子との面倒をさけ、いままで大事にすることなくやって来た。","en":"Father and son continued stalling on repayment afterward. The Hakka, for their part, wished to avoid trouble with relatives of the <tips=81>Longtou</tips> and had allowed the matter to rest without making an issue of it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r91","rowIndex":91,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　が、客家人がこれからは同じ組織の同志となり、<tips=27>廖志明</tips>が<tips=1>謝亮</tips>の後見人となってしまった以上、このような関係を続けることは難しいと考えたのだろう。","en":"But now that the Hakka were to become comrades in the same organization and <tips=27>Liao Chi-ming</tips> had become <tips=1>Tse Leung’s</tips> guardian, they must have realized that the old arrangement could not continue.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r92","rowIndex":92,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=76>旧義勝</tips>の掟では、仲間同士での取引は契約通りに公平に行わなければいけないことになっており、そして<tips=1>謝亮</tips>は、今後は客家人も香港人と全くおなじ扱いをすると公言している。","en":"The laws of the <tips=76>former Yisheng</tips> required all transactions between comrades to be conducted fairly and according to contract. And <tips=1>Tse Leung</tips> had publicly declared that the Hakka would henceforth receive precisely the same treatment as the Hong Kongers.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r93","rowIndex":93,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　掟通り借金を返せば親子の経済が立ちゆかなくなるし、返さなければ組織の掟に従って処罰される。どちらでも苦境と言うべきだろう。彼らは組織の外部の人間にはどう思われてもいいと考えていたのだろうが、組織内での評価が落ちるのは過剰に恐れていたのかもしれない。","en":"Repaying the debt as the law required would ruin the family’s finances; refusing would bring punishment under that same law. Either way, one might say they were in a bind. They likely did not care what outsiders thought of them, but perhaps they were excessively afraid of losing standing within the organization.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r94","rowIndex":94,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まあ、彼らみたいに特別能力があるわけでもなく、血縁だけで地位を維持している人間は、身内に馬鹿にされたら生きてはゆけないからね」","en":"“Well, people like them—men with no special abilities, clinging to their position through blood ties alone—can’t survive once their own people start looking down on them.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r95","rowIndex":95,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なるほど。……しかし、早い段階で察知出来て良かったな。気づくのが遅れたら、もっと大騒ぎになっていたかもしれん。ただな、正直言って、おれだって<tips=27>廖</tips>の部下を仲間にするってのは、素直に納得が出来たわけじゃないんだぞ。<tips=39>ジェフリー</tips>のこともあるしな。これは、おれだけの感情じゃないだろう。……まったく、よくもまあ大事になるまえに火種を消せたものだ」","en":"“I see. ...Still, it’s a good thing you caught this early. If you’d noticed any later, it might have caused a much greater uproar. To tell you the truth, even I can’t accept <tips=27>Liao’s</tips> men as our comrades without reservations. There’s what happened to <tips=39>Jeffrey</tips>, after all, and I’m sure I’m not alone in feeling that way. ...You did remarkably well to stamp out the spark before it became something serious.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬明","displayName":"Ma Ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r96","rowIndex":96,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=4>馬明</tips>はしきりに危機的状況だったことを強調する。","en":"<tips=4>Ma Ming</tips> repeatedly emphasized how dangerous the situation had been.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r97","rowIndex":97,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それに対し、<tips=1>亮</tips>は何も言わなかった。","en":"<tips=1>Tse Leung</tips> said nothing in reply.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r98","rowIndex":98,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ただ、これからもこういったことはあるだろうと思ってはいる。父の<tips=3>クリス</tips>も<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>のような組織を作った以上、ファミリーを解体したいとは思っていたはずだが、出来なかった、その要因は<tips=69>義勝</tips>のなかにある。よそものを徹底的に受け付けないのだ。","en":"Still, he expected more incidents of this kind. Once his father, <tips=3>Chris</tips>, had created an organization like <tips=7>YS</tips>, he too must have wanted to dissolve the Families, yet had been unable to. The reason lay within <tips=69>Yisheng</tips> itself: its absolute refusal to admit outsiders.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r99","rowIndex":99,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まあ、僕にはわかっていたんだよ」","en":"“Well, I knew.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r100","rowIndex":100,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　めんどくさそうに言うと、洗い終わった自分の手のにおいを嗅ぎ、","en":"He answered as though the whole matter were a nuisance, then lifted his freshly washed hands to his nose.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r101","rowIndex":101,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「硝煙の匂いがきつい。人に会わなきゃいけないのに」","en":"“The gunsmoke stinks. And I have to meet someone.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r102","rowIndex":102,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　と顔を顰めた。","en":"he said with a grimace.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r103","rowIndex":103,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうか、わかっていたか」","en":"“I see. So you knew.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬明","displayName":"Ma Ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r104","rowIndex":104,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=4>馬明</tips>は感心したように言うと、<tips=1>亮</tips>にタオルを渡す。","en":"Sounding impressed, <tips=4>Ma Ming</tips> handed <tips=1>Tse Leung</tips> a towel.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r105","rowIndex":105,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「兄貴は<tips=16>タイプA</tips>で、壁の向こうを見通す特別の目があった。息子のお前はノーマルで何の超能力もないが、父と同じように人には見えないものを見通す力があるようだ」","en":"“Big Brother was a <tips=16>Type A</tips>, with special eyes that saw through walls. You, his son, are a Normal without a single psychic power, yet it appears you share your father’s gift for seeing what no one else can.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬明","displayName":"Ma Ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r106","rowIndex":106,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=4>馬明</tips>の言葉に対し、<tips=1>亮</tips>は何も答えないまま手を拭っている。","en":"<tips=1>Tse Leung</tips> gave no answer to <tips=4>Ma Ming’s</tips> words, but went on drying his hands.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r107","rowIndex":107,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「とにかく、今回の件は大したもんだ」","en":"“In any case, what you pulled off this time was no small feat.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬明","displayName":"Ma Ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r108","rowIndex":108,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=4>馬明</tips>は溜息をつき、","en":"<tips=4>Ma Ming</tips> sighed, then said,","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r109","rowIndex":109,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=27>廖志明</tips>を屈服させるなんて想像も出来なかった。……やっぱりお前はおれが見込んだとおり、才能がある。<tips=25>世傑</tips>のことも、うまく使いこなしているようだな。だが、あいつを信じてはいかんぞ。何を考えているかわからんやつで、裏切りはお手の物だからな」","en":"“I never imagined you could bring <tips=27>Liao Chi-ming</tips> to heel. ...Just as I thought, you have talent. It seems you’re handling <tips=25>Sai-kit</tips> well, too. But don’t trust him. No one can tell what he’s thinking, and betrayal is second nature to him.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬明","displayName":"Ma Ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r110","rowIndex":110,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼は息子の<tips=25>世傑</tips>に対してはいつも手厳しい。","en":"He was invariably severe toward his son, <tips=25>Sai-kit</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r111","rowIndex":111,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=25>世傑</tips>は<tips=4>馬明</tips>が思ってるような人間じゃないよ」","en":"“You have <tips=25>Sai-kit</tips> all wrong, <tips=4>Ma Ming</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r112","rowIndex":112,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ふん、まあいい、おれはとにかく、お前がその気になってくれてうれしいぞ」","en":"“Hmph. Well, never mind. All that matters is that I’m glad you’ve finally gotten serious.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬明","displayName":"Ma Ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r113","rowIndex":113,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「別にその気になったわけじゃないが……」","en":"“I haven’t really gotten serious about anything...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r114","rowIndex":114,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>は目を細め、どこかうつろな表情を一瞬見せると、それを打ち消すように笑い、","en":"<tips=1>Tse Leung</tips> narrowed his eyes. A hollow look crossed his face for an instant; then, as though wiping it away, he smiled.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r115","rowIndex":115,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「仕事は仕事だ。割り切ってやってる」","en":"“A job’s a job. I treat it like one and get it done.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r116","rowIndex":116,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ねえ見て、<tips=28>トミー</tips>。あと一週間くらいで生まれるんだって」","en":"“Look, <tips=28>Tommy</tips>. They say the baby will be born in about a week.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬美美ベールなし","displayName":"Ma Meimei (Without Veil)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r117","rowIndex":117,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=24>馬美美</tips>は幸福に満ちた笑顔を浮かべて、はちきれんばかりにふくれた腹をさすった。","en":"<tips=24>Ma Meimei</tips> rubbed her belly, swollen almost to bursting, with a smile full of happiness.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r118","rowIndex":118,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「わあ、すごいねえ！　でも信じられないな。<tips=24>美美</tips>が本当にお母さんになっちゃうなんて」","en":"“Wow, that’s incredible! I still can’t believe you’re truly about to become a mother, <tips=24>Meimei</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r119","rowIndex":119,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=28>トーマス・リャオ</tips>は母となる喜びを素直に分かち合うような笑顔を浮かべる。","en":"<tips=28>Thomas Liao</tips> smiled as though he shared, openly and simply, in her joy at becoming a mother.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r120","rowIndex":120,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ねえ、触ってみてよ。なかで赤ちゃんが動くのわかるのよ」","en":"“Here, touch it. You can feel the baby moving inside.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬美美ベールなし","displayName":"Ma Meimei (Without Veil)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r121","rowIndex":121,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「え、あっ、そんなっ……」","en":"“What? Ah, I couldn’t possibly...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r122","rowIndex":122,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=24>美美</tips>が手を取ると、<tips=28>トーマス</tips>は露骨にうろたえる。","en":"When <tips=24>Meimei</tips> took his hand, <tips=28>Thomas</tips> became visibly flustered.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r123","rowIndex":123,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「何赤くなってるの？」","en":"“Why are you blushing?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬美美ベールなし","displayName":"Ma Meimei (Without Veil)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r124","rowIndex":124,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「だって、そんな、女の人のお腹にさわるなんて」","en":"“Because... I mean, touching a woman’s belly like that...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r125","rowIndex":125,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あら、変に意識しちゃって。いやらしいわねえ。あ、私、おっぱいも大きくなったのよ。こっち触ってみる？」","en":"“Oh, you’re making it strange all by yourself. What a dirty mind. My breasts have grown too, you know. Would you like to touch those instead?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬美美ベールなし","displayName":"Ma Meimei (Without Veil)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r126","rowIndex":126,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「うう、僕をばかにして。……ねえ聞いてよ。<tips=2>阿亮</tips>、<tips=24>美美</tips>の赤ちゃん、もうすぐ生まれるんだって」","en":"“Ugh, you’re making fun of me. ...Hey, listen, <tips=2>Ah Leung</tips>. <tips=24>Meimei</tips> says the baby’s almost here.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r127","rowIndex":127,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=28>トーマス</tips>は困って遠くの<tips=1>謝亮</tips>に助けを求めるが、","en":"At a loss, <tips=28>Thomas</tips> appealed for help to <tips=1>Tse Leung</tips>, who was sitting some distance away, but—","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r128","rowIndex":128,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そりゃよかった」","en":"“That’s good.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r129","rowIndex":129,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>は椅子に腰掛けたまま茶を飲むだけで、立ち上がろうともしない。","en":"<tips=1>Tse Leung</tips> only went on drinking his tea, making no move to rise from his chair.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r130","rowIndex":130,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼が飲んでいるのは最近<tips=24>美美</tips>が健康のために取り寄せているというマコモを使ったお茶で、身体にはいいのかもしれないが飲みにくくて仕方がない。","en":"It was a tea made from makomo that <tips=24>Meimei</tips> had recently taken to ordering for the sake of her health. It might well be good for the body, but it was miserably difficult to drink.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r131","rowIndex":131,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　渋い顔で、少しずつ喉の奥に流し込んでいる。","en":"Face puckered, he forced it down a little at a time.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r132","rowIndex":132,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"『うまかしゅか』の地下での出来事のあと、<tips=4>馬明</tips>に誘われてこの家にやって来たのがまずかった。その庭ではなぜか<tips=24>美美</tips>と<tips=28>トーマス</tips>が茶を飲んで話し込んでおり、その上<tips=4>馬明</tips>は急用が入って出かけていったので、なし崩し的に<tips=24>美美</tips>たちに合流することとなる。","en":"His mistake had been accepting <tips=4>Ma Ming’s</tips> invitation to this house after what happened in Umakashuka’s basement. For some reason, <tips=24>Meimei</tips> and <tips=28>Thomas</tips> were already sitting in the garden, deep in conversation over tea. Then some urgent business called <tips=4>Ma Ming</tips> away, and before Tse Leung knew it, he had been absorbed into <tips=24>Meimei’s</tips> company.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r133","rowIndex":133,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　一応<tips=81>龍頭</tips>である自分を置き去りにして私用で出かけるなどふざけていると、<tips=1>亮</tips>は<tips=4>馬明</tips>に対して思ってみたりもした。","en":"<tips=1>Tse Leung</tips> even found himself thinking that <tips=4>Ma Ming</tips> had some nerve, leaving him behind on personal business when he was, technically, the <tips=81>Longtou</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r134","rowIndex":134,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それにしても、<tips=1>亮</tips>からすれば、いくら客家人と和解が成立したとは言え、経緯を考えれば複雑なものがあってしかるべきだろう。正確な経緯を知らない<tips=24>美美</tips>はともかく、<tips=28>トーマス</tips>の頭にもそのあたりの葛藤はないようなのが理解しがたい。","en":"From <tips=1>Tse Leung’s</tips> perspective, however complete the reconciliation with the Hakka might be, their history ought to leave some complicated feelings behind. One thing for <tips=24>Meimei</tips>, who did not know exactly what had happened—but it was hard to understand how <tips=28>Thomas</tips>, too, could seem free of any such conflict.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r135","rowIndex":135,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>とて彼に私利私欲が薄いのは理解していたが、父親が負傷してもその姿勢を崩さないというのは、一種の狂人ではないのか。","en":"<tips=1>Tse Leung</tips> knew that Thomas was largely free of selfish desire, but to hold to that attitude even after his father had been wounded—didn’t that make him some species of madman?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r136","rowIndex":136,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　――いや、僕はどうも言葉が悪い。聖人とか、道徳者と言い直すべきか。","en":"—No. I do have a foul way with words. Perhaps I should say a saint, or a moral exemplar.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r137","rowIndex":137,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=28>トーマス</tips>と<tips=24>美美</tips>のやりとりを眺めながら<tips=1>亮</tips>はそんなことを考えている。","en":"These were <tips=1>Tse Leung’s</tips> thoughts as he watched <tips=28>Thomas</tips> and <tips=24>Meimei</tips> banter.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r138","rowIndex":138,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=28>トミー</tips>は相変わらずね。これで、お父さんの跡を継いだなんて、とても信じられない」","en":"“You haven’t changed a bit, <tips=28>Tommy</tips>. I can hardly believe you’ve taken over from your father.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬美美ベールなし","displayName":"Ma Meimei (Without Veil)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r139","rowIndex":139,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「僕も信じられないよ。でも、さっきも言ったようにね、やるからには恥ずかしくないリーダーになろうと思う。僕らはこの日本の法的には良くない存在かもしれないけれど、世間的には街にいる沢山の移民やミュータントたち自体が良くない存在って言われてるんだ。彼らの代表者として、そして部下や<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>のみんなの幸せのためにも、僕は必要なことをしなくちゃいけない」","en":"“Neither can I. But as I was saying, if I am to do it, I intend to become a leader I needn’t be ashamed of. Our very existence here in Japan may not be acceptable under the law, but society treats the many immigrants and mutants living in this city as though their existence were unacceptable too. As their representative—and for the happiness of my subordinates and everyone in <tips=7>YS</tips>—I must do what needs to be done.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r140","rowIndex":140,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=28>トミー</tips>は自分の言葉に、真顔でこくこくと頷く。","en":"<tips=28>Tommy</tips> nodded gravely along with his own words.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r141","rowIndex":141,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうだよね、<tips=2>阿亮</tips>……いや、<tips=81>龍頭</tips>」","en":"“Right, <tips=2>Ah Leung</tips>...? No—<tips=81>Longtou</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r142","rowIndex":142,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どうだろうね」","en":"“Who can say?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r143","rowIndex":143,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>は肩をすくめる。","en":"<tips=1>Tse Leung</tips> shrugged.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r144","rowIndex":144,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「バカね<tips=28>トミー</tips>。<tips=2>阿亮</tips>は、こういうところで仕事の話はしたくないのよ」","en":"“You dummy, <tips=28>Tommy</tips>. <tips=2>Ah Leung</tips> doesn’t like talking business at times like this.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬美美ベールなし","displayName":"Ma Meimei (Without Veil)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r145","rowIndex":145,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「べつにそういうわけでもないけどさ。……それより、今日は二人だけで何を話し込んでいたんだ？」","en":"“It isn’t that. ...More importantly, what were the two of you discussing here alone today?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r146","rowIndex":146,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……ちょっと、人生についての深い話をね」","en":"“...Just a little deep conversation about life.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r147","rowIndex":147,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=28>トーマス</tips>が格好をつけてそう言うと、","en":"<tips=28>Thomas</tips> said, trying to sound impressive, but—","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r148","rowIndex":148,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「安心しなさいよ。不適切なことはなにもないから」","en":"“You can relax. Nothing improper happened.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬美美ベールなし","displayName":"Ma Meimei (Without Veil)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r149","rowIndex":149,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それを台無しにするように、<tips=24>美美</tips>が冗談を言う。","en":"<tips=24>Meimei</tips> ruined the effect with a joke.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r150","rowIndex":150,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あ、当たり前だよ！　いい旦那さんがいて、これから子供が生まれるっていうのにそんな……」","en":"“O-of course not! You have a wonderful husband, and you’re about to have his child, so I would never...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r151","rowIndex":151,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=28>トーマス</tips>がしどろもどろになったところで、<tips=24>美美</tips>は使用人に呼ばれ、その場を去って行った。","en":"While <tips=28>Thomas</tips> floundered for words, a servant summoned <tips=24>Meimei</tips>, and she left them.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r152","rowIndex":152,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして、<tips=28>トーマス</tips>と二人、その場に取り残される。","en":"And so Tse Leung was left there alone with <tips=28>Thomas</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r153","rowIndex":153,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼と二人きりになるのは、第三代<tips=81>龍頭</tips>と、<tips=74>廖グループ</tips>リーダーという関係になってから、これが初めての機会であった。","en":"This was their first opportunity to speak alone since becoming, respectively, the third <tips=81>Longtou</tips> and the leader of the <tips=74>Liao group</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r154","rowIndex":154,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まったく困っちゃうよ。あんなことばかり言って」","en":"“Honestly, what am I going to do with her, saying things like that?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r155","rowIndex":155,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=28>トーマス</tips>は溜息をつく。","en":"<tips=28>Thomas</tips> sighed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r156","rowIndex":156,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「でも、真面目な話をするとねえ、<tips=2>阿亮</tips>。僕は、この立場でどうしたらいいのか、それですごく悩んでいるんだよ。だから考えることが多くて……」","en":"“But seriously, <tips=2>Ah Leung</tips>, I’ve been worrying a lot about what I’m supposed to do in this position. There’s so much I have to think about...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r157","rowIndex":157,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして神妙な顔でそう切り出した。","en":"His expression grew solemn as he began.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r158","rowIndex":158,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「この街を変えなくちゃいけないとは、すごく前から思ってるんだけど、あちこちに問題ばかりでどう解決したらいいのか……そうだ、<tips=2>阿亮</tips>は知ってる？」","en":"“I’ve thought for a very long time that this city has to change, but everywhere I look there are problems, and I don’t know how to solve them... Oh, <tips=2>Ah Leung</tips>, did you know?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r159","rowIndex":159,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「何を」","en":"“Heard what?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r160","rowIndex":160,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「この街には、<tips=17>タイプB</tips>の人たちの地下組織があるんだってね。三人のお爺さんに率いられた組織で、街のいろんな<tips=17>タイプB</tips>の人たちが隠れて所属している……」","en":"“Apparently, there’s an underground organization of <tips=17>Type Bs</tips> in this city. It’s led by three old men, and all kinds of <tips=17>Type Bs</tips> from across the city secretly belong to it...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r161","rowIndex":161,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「『<tips=22>老人たち</tips>』のことか」","en":"“You mean the ‘<tips=22>Elders</tips>’?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r162","rowIndex":162,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そう。僕の部下の言うところによるとね、彼らの活動がね、最近活発なんだって」","en":"“Yes. According to my men, they’ve been much more active lately.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r163","rowIndex":163,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どういうこと？」","en":"“In what way?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r164","rowIndex":164,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あ、<tips=2>阿亮</tips>も知らなかったんだ。うれしいなあ。<tips=2>阿亮</tips>より僕のほうが詳しいことがあるなんて」","en":"“Oh, so even <tips=2>Ah Leung</tips> didn’t know. I’m so happy! To think there’s something I know more about than <tips=2>Ah Leung</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r165","rowIndex":165,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「さっさと話せよ」","en":"“Get on with it.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r166","rowIndex":166,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>が眉間にしわを寄せてうながすと、","en":"<tips=1>Tse Leung</tips> urged him on, a crease forming between his brows, and—","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r167","rowIndex":167,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「う、うん」","en":"“Y-yeah.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r168","rowIndex":168,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=28>トミー</tips>は咳払いをして、","en":"<tips=28>Tommy</tips> cleared his throat, then continued:","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r169","rowIndex":169,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「彼らは知っての通り、この街で唯一麻薬を売り買いしている組織だけれど、新しい薬を盛大に売り出し始めたらしいんだ。なんでも、<tips=17>タイプB</tips>にとって特別な効き目があるという……」","en":"“As you know, they’re the only organization in this city that buys and sells narcotics. Apparently, they’ve started selling a new drug on a massive scale—one said to have a special effect on <tips=17>Type Bs</tips>...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r170","rowIndex":170,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=17>タイプB</tips>にって……『<tips=45>ローズ</tips>』みたいな？」","en":"“An effect on <tips=17>Type Bs</tips>...? Like <tips=45>Rose</tips>?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r171","rowIndex":171,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　新しい薬と聞いて、<tips=1>亮</tips>の目つきがにわかに鋭くなる。","en":"At the words ‘new drug,’ <tips=1>Tse Leung’s</tips> gaze abruptly sharpened.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r172","rowIndex":172,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いや、それを改良した新しい薬で、なんでも『<tips=46>ネオ・ローズ</tips>』というらしい」","en":"“No. It is said to be a new, improved form of Rose. I hear they call it ‘<tips=46>Neo Rose</tips>.’”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r173","rowIndex":173,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「『<tips=46>ネオ・ローズ</tips>』って、いや、そんな筈は……」","en":"“‘<tips=46>Neo Rose</tips>’? No, that can’t be...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r174","rowIndex":174,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「知ってるの？」","en":"“You know about it?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r175","rowIndex":175,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「噂ではね。それが本物ならば、確かに<tips=17>タイプB</tips>の人生を変えうる薬だ。<tips=17>タイプB</tips>の発作を抑え、その優れた能力だけを生かすことが出来る。副作用も少ない。<tips=17>タイプB</tips>にとっては夢の薬だよ。が、夢は夢のまま、実在しないと考えた方がいい。世間で<tips=46>ネオ・ローズ</tips>といって売り出しているのは、大抵<tips=45>ローズ</tips>に混ぜ物をしたまがい物だよ。今回もきっとそうだろう。『<tips=22>老人たち</tips>』も、あこぎな商売に乗り出したものだね」","en":"“Only through rumors. If it were real, it could certainly change the lives of <tips=17>Type Bs</tips>. It suppresses the seizures suffered by <tips=17>Type Bs</tips> while allowing them to make use of their extraordinary abilities, and it has few side effects. For a <tips=17>Type B</tips>, it would be a dream drug. But the dream is best left a dream. You should assume no such drug exists. Most of what gets sold as <tips=46>Neo Rose</tips> is nothing but counterfeit <tips=45>Rose</tips> cut with other substances. I’m sure this is the same. The ‘<tips=22>Elders</tips>’ have certainly taken up an unscrupulous trade.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r176","rowIndex":176,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「偽物なのかな？　巷では本当によく効くって噂をきくけど……」","en":"“You believe it’s counterfeit? The rumors on the street say it works remarkably well...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r177","rowIndex":177,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「完全に否定はしないけど、ガセネタだと思うよ。ただ、そうやっておおっぴらに商売を始めたというのは興味深い」","en":"“I won’t rule it out completely, but I think the story is bogus. Still, it is interesting that they’ve begun trading so openly.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r178","rowIndex":178,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>は腕組みをして考え込む。","en":"<tips=1>Tse Leung</tips> folded his arms and thought it over.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r179","rowIndex":179,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「彼らはどういうつもりなんだろう？」","en":"“What are they after?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r180","rowIndex":180,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>なんか眼中にないってことは確実だな。初代が死んでから、ほとんど僕らを無視している。やりたい放題だ」","en":"“One thing’s certain: they don’t give a damn about <tips=7>YS</tips>. Ever since the first Longtou died, they’ve all but ignored us. They do whatever they please.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r181","rowIndex":181,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうか。でも、何にしても、僕はうまく手を組んでいくべきだと思うな。……僕が何か言わなくても、<tips=2>阿亮</tips>はよく考えているんだろうけど。ただね、<tips=17>タイプB</tips>の人たちは、敵ではなく味方なんだよ。彼らの秘密結社に入っているほとんどの人は、ギャングでもなんでもない、街で普通に暮らす<tips=17>タイプB</tips>なんだし。僕らはまず彼らを助けてあげなくちゃいけないんだよ」","en":"“I see. Whatever else is true, I think we should find a way to work with them. ...I’m sure you’ve already thought it through without me saying anything, <tips=2>Ah Leung</tips>. But <tips=17>Type Bs</tips> are on our side, not our enemies. Most of the people in their secret society aren’t gangsters or anything of the sort. They’re ordinary <tips=17>Type Bs</tips> living normal lives in this city. The first thing we have to do is help them.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r182","rowIndex":182,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=28>トミー</tips>、僕は彼らを不当に扱うつもりはないが、とりたてて優遇するつもりもないんだよ」","en":"“<tips=28>Tommy</tips>, I don’t intend to treat them unjustly, but neither do I intend to give them preferential treatment.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r183","rowIndex":183,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「本当に？　だって、向こうには<tips=2>阿亮</tips>の親友の<tips=10>見土道夫</tips>って人もいるんでしょ？」","en":"“Really? But your close friend <tips=10>Michio Mido</tips> is with them, isn’t he, <tips=2>Ah Leung</tips>?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r184","rowIndex":184,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=28>トーマス</tips>は尋ねかけるが、<tips=1>亮</tips>はこたえない。","en":"<tips=28>Thomas</tips> put the question to him, but <tips=1>Tse Leung</tips> gave no answer.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r185","rowIndex":185,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そう言えば、<tips=10>見土道夫</tips>ってさ、このまま<tips=22>老人たち</tips>の後継者として<tips=17>タイプB</tips>のリーダーになるって、大分前から噂になってるけど、本当にそうなのかい？」","en":"“Come to think of it, there’s been a rumor for a long time that <tips=10>Michio Mido</tips> will succeed the <tips=22>Elders</tips> and become the leader of the <tips=17>Type Bs</tips>. Is it actually true?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r186","rowIndex":186,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「知らないよ」","en":"“I don’t know.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r187","rowIndex":187,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>は肩をすくめて答える。","en":"<tips=1>Tse Leung</tips> answered with a shrug.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r188","rowIndex":188,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「もしなったら、いいね。だって、幼なじみ同士なら、きっとうまくやれるでしょ？　<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>と彼らはもっと友好的にやるべきだと思うんだ」","en":"“I hope it happens. If the two of you are childhood friends, surely you’ll be able to work well together. <tips=7>YS</tips> and their organization ought to be on friendlier terms.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r189","rowIndex":189,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まあ、それが出来るならいいだろうね」","en":"“Well, if that can be done, all the better.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r190","rowIndex":190,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「でしょう？　大丈夫だよ。廖家と謝家だってこうして一つになれたんだから」","en":"“Right? It’ll be fine. Even the Liao and Tse families have managed to become one.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r191","rowIndex":191,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そんなに簡単じゃない。まあ、何もかも平和にってのは難しいだろうね」","en":"“It isn’t that simple. Well, I doubt everything can be settled peacefully.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r192","rowIndex":192,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どういうこと？」","en":"“What do you mean?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r193","rowIndex":193,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「これからも何らかのかたちで人死には出るだろう。きみのところだって、一つ間違えれば殺し合いになっていたよ。そうしたら、きみの父さんは死に、きみや<tips=29>アイス</tips>も死んでいたはずだ。気を悪くするかもしれないが、僕は負ける気はしていなかった」","en":"“People will continue to die in one form or another. Your family, too, was one wrong move away from a mutual slaughter. If that had happened, your father would have died, and you and <tips=29>Ice</tips> would have died too. This may offend you, but I never thought I would lose.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r194","rowIndex":194,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……きっと、<tips=2>阿亮</tips>の言う通りなんだろうね」","en":"“...I’m sure you’re right, <tips=2>Ah Leung</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r195","rowIndex":195,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=28>トーマス</tips>は素直に頷く。自分たちの死を口にされても動揺が見られないのは、彼も同じ意見を持っていたから自然に受け入られたのだろうが、しかしこうまで言われて侮辱と受け取るでもなく平然としているのはやはり彼の人間性なのだろう。","en":"<tips=28>Thomas</tips> nodded without resistance. He showed no distress when their deaths were spoken of, presumably because he shared Tse Leung’s assessment and could therefore accept it easily. But to hear himself addressed so bluntly and remain perfectly calm, without taking it as an insult—that, surely, was simply the kind of man he was.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r196","rowIndex":196,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=29>アイス</tips>のこともよく知ってたし、僕らのことなんか何でもお見通しなんだ」","en":"“You knew all about <tips=29>Ice</tips>, too. You see right through us—everything about us.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r197","rowIndex":197,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=28>トーマス</tips>は感心したように溜息をつく。","en":"<tips=28>Thomas</tips> sighed in admiration.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r198","rowIndex":198,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「僕は誰を敵に回すことも恐れていない。<tips=28>トミー</tips>は気にいらないかもしれないが、それが僕のやりかただ。もちろん、きみに意見があるなら聞くがね」","en":"“I’m not afraid to make an enemy of anyone. You may not like that, <tips=28>Tommy</tips>, but that’s how I operate. Of course, if you have an opinion, I’ll hear it.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r199","rowIndex":199,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「気にいらないとか、そういうことじゃないんだ。ただ、戸惑っていて……」","en":"“It isn’t that I object. I am simply confused...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r200","rowIndex":200,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうか。でも、そんなことで一々戸惑う必要はないんだよ。きみは今まで通り、自分のやりたいようにやっていればいい。僕もそれを期待しているんだから」","en":"“I see. But you don’t need to let every little thing throw you. Just keep doing things your own way, the way you always have. That’s what I expect from you.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r201","rowIndex":201,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=2>阿亮</tips>……きみが何を言わんとしているのか、僕には理解出来ないよ」","en":"“<tips=2>Ah Leung</tips>... I don’t understand what you’re trying to say.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r202","rowIndex":202,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　言いながら、<tips=28>トーマス</tips>は困惑を見せる。","en":"<tips=28>Thomas</tips> looked confused as he spoke.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r203","rowIndex":203,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「とにかくね、この街には僕らの<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>の他にもいろんな底の知れないものが一杯あって、そういうのが、どうも、最近動きが活発になってるって言いたかったんだ。<tips=2>阿亮</tips>のお父さんの死によって、僕たちだけじゃなく、いろんなものが変わろうとしているのかもしれないって伝えたくってさ」","en":"“What I was trying to say is that this city is full of unfathomable forces besides our <tips=7>YS</tips>, and lately they all seem to be growing more active. I wanted you to know that your father’s death may be changing more than just us, <tips=2>Ah Leung</tips>—that all sorts of things may be starting to shift.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r204","rowIndex":204,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それはわかった。僕も気にとめておこう。それでこの話は終わりだ。……そう言えば<tips=28>トミー</tips>、全く別の話だけれど、きみに一つ聞きたいことがあったんだ」","en":"“I understand. I’ll keep it in mind. That’s enough about that. ...Speaking of which, <tips=28>Tommy</tips>, this is a completely different subject, but there’s something I’ve been meaning to ask you.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r205","rowIndex":205,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「何でも聞いてよ。僕だって結構色々知ってるんだから」","en":"“Ask me anything. I know a surprising amount myself, you know.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r206","rowIndex":206,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=28>トーマス</tips>は胸を張る。","en":"<tips=28>Thomas</tips> puffed out his chest.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r207","rowIndex":207,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それは頼もしいな。じゃあはっきり聞くけれど」","en":"“How reassuring. Then I’ll ask plainly.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r208","rowIndex":208,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「何？」","en":"“What is it?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r209","rowIndex":209,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「エリカ・ビリンガムの家での態度ってさ、あれは本心だったのかい？　本当に、僕の意見に心の底から賛同して、ああいった態度になったのかい？」","en":"“The way you acted at Erica Billingham’s house—was that sincere? Did you truly agree with me, from the bottom of your heart? Is that why you behaved the way you did?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r210","rowIndex":210,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あれは……」","en":"“That was...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r211","rowIndex":211,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=28>トーマス</tips>は困り顔を浮かべて、","en":"<tips=28>Thomas</tips> looked troubled, then said:","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r212","rowIndex":212,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「嘘じゃない。<tips=2>阿亮</tips>の意見が僕と同じだったってのは、嘘ではないよ」","en":"“It wasn’t a lie. Your opinion really was the same as mine, <tips=2>Ah Leung</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r213","rowIndex":213,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「嘘ではないけど？」","en":"“It wasn’t a lie, but...?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r214","rowIndex":214,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=28>トーマス</tips>はしばし口をもごもごさせたままためらっていたが、<tips=1>亮</tips>がずっと見つめていると、あきらめたように溜息をつき、","en":"<tips=28>Thomas</tips> hesitated for a while, working his mouth without getting the words out. When <tips=1>Tse Leung</tips> continued to stare at him, Thomas gave a sigh of surrender and said:","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r215","rowIndex":215,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……ああ振る舞わなきゃ、絶対父さんが殺されるって思ったっていうのも、心のどこかではあったかもしれない。父さんはやけっぱちになってたし、<tips=2>阿亮</tips>はもう父さんをあきらめようとしてたし、なんだかすごく空気がギスギスとしていて……」","en":"“...Maybe some part of me did think Dad would definitely be killed unless I acted that way. Dad was getting desperate, <tips=2>Ah Leung</tips> looked ready to give up on him, and everything in the room felt so terribly brittle...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r216","rowIndex":216,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「道化を買って出たと」","en":"“So you volunteered to play the fool.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r217","rowIndex":217,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……そんな格好良いもんじゃないよ。ファミリーを合併するのに賛成しなきゃ<tips=2>阿亮</tips>は納得しない感じだったし、そして、僕があとを継ぐって言わなきゃ父さんは納得しないだろうし……他に何も思い浮かばなかったんだ。それに、<tips=2>阿亮</tips>の意見が僕と同じだって賛同したのも、まるきりの嘘じゃないんだ。嘘じゃないんだけど……なんか、ごめん」","en":"“...It wasn’t anything that noble. <tips=2>Ah Leung</tips> didn’t seem as though he would accept anything unless I agreed to merge the Families, and Dad didn’t seem as though he would accept anything unless I said I’d take over from him... I couldn’t think of any other way. And it wasn’t a complete lie when I said I agreed with you—that <tips=2>Ah Leung’s</tips> opinion was the same as mine. It wasn’t a lie, but... I don’t know. I’m sorry.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r218","rowIndex":218,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=28>トーマス</tips>が頭を下げると、","en":"When <tips=28>Thomas</tips> lowered his head, Tse Leung replied:","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r219","rowIndex":219,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いや、賢明な判断だ」","en":"“No. It was a wise decision.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r220","rowIndex":220,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「でも、<tips=2>阿亮</tips>、僕はもしかしたら自分のファミリーを売ったんじゃないかって……」","en":"“But, <tips=2>Ah Leung</tips>, what if I sold out my own Family...?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r221","rowIndex":221,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=28>トーマス</tips>が言いかけたところに<tips=24>美美</tips>が別室から戻ってくる。","en":"Before <tips=28>Thomas</tips> could finish, <tips=24>Meimei</tips> returned from another room.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r222","rowIndex":222,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「盛り上がってるところ悪いけど、<tips=2>阿亮</tips>にお客さんが来てるわ」","en":"“Sorry to interrupt just when the conversation was getting exciting, but you have a visitor, <tips=2>Ah Leung</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬美美ベールなし","displayName":"Ma Meimei (Without Veil)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r223","rowIndex":223,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　戻って来た彼女は、さっきまでとはうって変わって、硬い表情をしている。","en":"When she returned, her expression was hard, utterly unlike the one she had worn moments before.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r224","rowIndex":224,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「僕に？」","en":"“For me?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r225","rowIndex":225,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そう。あなたに大事な話があるんだそうよ。応接室に行って。そこで待ってるわ」","en":"“Yes. She says she has something important to discuss with you. Go to the reception room. She’s waiting there.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬美美ベールなし","displayName":"Ma Meimei (Without Veil)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r226","rowIndex":226,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　促されるまま応接室に足を踏み入れると、そこで待っていたのはフェルナンデス三姉妹の末娘、<tips=38>リタ・フェルナンデス</tips>。","en":"Tse Leung went as directed into the reception room. Waiting there was the youngest of the three Fernandes sisters, <tips=38>Rita Fernandes</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r227","rowIndex":227,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　二人の姉よりは華奢な彼女が、革張りのソファーの上にちょこんと腰掛けていた。","en":"Slighter than her two sisters, she perched neatly upon the leather sofa.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r228","rowIndex":228,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>にとっては意外な相手だったようで、眉の片側がわずかにあがって、驚きのような表情を作る。","en":"The visitor appeared to take <tips=1>Tse Leung</tips> by surprise: one eyebrow rose slightly, shaping something like a look of astonishment.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r229","rowIndex":229,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「お、お呼び立てするようなかたちになってしまって、すみません」","en":"“I-I’m sorry you had to come here because of me.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"リタ・フェルナンデス","displayName":"Rita Fernandes","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r230","rowIndex":230,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=38>リタ</tips>はいつも通りおどおどとした態度で、ぺこりと頭を下げる。","en":"<tips=38>Rita</tips> bowed timidly, behaving as she always did.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r231","rowIndex":231,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「構わないよ」","en":"“I don’t mind.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r232","rowIndex":232,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>は言いながら<tips=38>リタ</tips>の正面に腰掛けた。","en":"As he answered, <tips=1>Tse Leung</tips> sat down opposite <tips=38>Rita</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r233","rowIndex":233,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あ、あの、本当は今日ここにうちの姉妹もみんな呼ばれていたんです。でも、もう、<tips=24>美美</tips>さんの家に、あんまりにも簡単に行くのはやめようってことになって……。これからどうなるかわからないから。……私のうちでは、<tips=1>亮</tips>さんが<tips=81>龍頭</tips>になったことはあまり歓迎されていません……」","en":"“U-um, all three of us sisters were invited here today, actually. But we decided we shouldn’t keep coming to <tips=24>Meimei’s</tips> house so casually...not when we don’t know what will happen next. ...My family isn’t very pleased that you’ve become <tips=81>Longtou</tips>, Mr. <tips=1>Tse</tips>...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"リタ・フェルナンデス","displayName":"Rita Fernandes","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r234","rowIndex":234,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「以前は<tips=36>アウロラ</tips>も僕に父のあとをつげと言ってたように思うけれど」","en":"“I seem to remember <tips=36>Aurora</tips> once telling me that I should succeed my father.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝<tips=1>亮</tips>","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r235","rowIndex":235,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あ、あの、姉さんたちは、<tips=3>クリス</tips>様のやり方を継承することを期待していたと思うんです。でも、今回は、ああやって事実上<tips=28>トミー</tips>さんのところを吸収することになってしまって、それで、<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>を一つにするという話もされましたし、とても警戒しています……」","en":"“U-um, I think my sisters expected you to carry on the way your father, <tips=3>Chris</tips>, did things. But this time, you ended up effectively absorbing <tips=28>Tommy’s</tips> organization, and then there was the talk of unifying <tips=7>YS</tips>. They’re extremely wary...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"リタ・フェルナンデス","displayName":"Rita Fernandes","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r236","rowIndex":236,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=38>リタ</tips>は言いにくそうにしながらも、率直にそう答えた。","en":"<tips=38>Rita</tips> answered honestly, though the words were plainly difficult for her.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r237","rowIndex":237,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その様子を見て、<tips=1>亮</tips>は苦笑し、","en":"At the sight of her, <tips=1>Tse Leung</tips> smiled wryly.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r238","rowIndex":238,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まあ、わかってたさ。そうなるしかないと思ってた。とても自然な反応だ。……それで、お父さんも何か言ってるのかい？」","en":"“Well, I knew. I expected no other reaction. It is perfectly natural. ...And has your father said anything?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r239","rowIndex":239,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「父は家の中で仕事について何か言ったり、表情に出したりはしない人ですが、私の見たところでは、やっぱり歓迎しているとは言いがたいです……」","en":"“Father is not a man who discusses business at home or lets his feelings show, but from what I can tell, he is hardly pleased either...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"リタ・フェルナンデス","displayName":"Rita Fernandes","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r240","rowIndex":240,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうだろうね」","en":"“I thought as much.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r241","rowIndex":241,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>は頷き、","en":"<tips=1>Tse Leung</tips> nodded, then asked:","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r242","rowIndex":242,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「でも、そうしてお姉さんたちは断ったのに、どうしてきみだけは来たんだい？　きみの立場からすれば、なかなか思い切ったことだと思うが」","en":"“But if your sisters all refused, why did you come alone? From your position, I’d call that quite a bold step.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r243","rowIndex":243,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あの、私も断ろうと思ったんですが、<tips=24>美美</tips>さんから、<tips=1>亮</tips>さんもいると聞いて……。だ、だから少し話をしなくちゃいけないと思ったんです」","en":"“I-I was going to refuse too, but <tips=24>Meimei</tips> told me you would be here, Mr. <tips=1>Tse</tips>... S-so I thought I had to speak with you.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"リタ・フェルナンデス","displayName":"Rita Fernandes","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r244","rowIndex":244,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どうして？」","en":"“Why?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r245","rowIndex":245,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「私は、お姉さんたちとは少し考え方が違うんだと思います……」","en":"“I think my views differ somewhat from my sisters’...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"リタ・フェルナンデス","displayName":"Rita Fernandes","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r246","rowIndex":246,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=38>リタ</tips>はそう言って、寂しそうに目を伏せる。","en":"As she said this, <tips=38>Rita</tips> lowered her eyes, looking lonely.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r247","rowIndex":247,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ただ、ファミリーのことを考えてるのは、お姉さんたちと同じなんです。だから、まずちゃんと、意見を聞こうと思ってここに来ました。私の考え方が正しいのか……」","en":"“But I care about the family just as much as they do. That is why I came here: first, to hear your side. I need to know whether my own thinking is right...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"リタ・フェルナンデス","displayName":"Rita Fernandes","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r248","rowIndex":248,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=38>リタ</tips>はそこで目を上げると、まっすぐに<tips=1>亮</tips>を見つめた。その視線には意志の力がある。","en":"At that, <tips=38>Rita</tips> raised her eyes and looked straight at <tips=1>Tse Leung</tips>. There was force of will in her gaze.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r249","rowIndex":249,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女はただなんとなくやって来たのではなく、明確な覚悟を持ってこの場に来ているのだ。","en":"She had not simply drifted here without thinking. She had come prepared for what this meeting might demand of her.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r250","rowIndex":250,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それを感じ取った<tips=1>亮</tips>は意外に思い目を細めた。","en":"Sensing that resolve, <tips=1>Tse Leung</tips> narrowed his eyes, taken aback.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r251","rowIndex":251,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　三人姉妹のなかで一番大人しく、主体性のなさそうな末娘がこうして直接対決を挑みに来るとは。","en":"To think the youngest of the three sisters—the quietest and the one who seemed to have the least initiative—would come challenge him directly like this.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r252","rowIndex":252,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あなたたちは、私たちとこの先どうやってつき合ってゆくつもりなんですか？　返答によっては、私もフェルナンデス家のものとして、考え方を変えなくてはいけません」","en":"“What kind of relationship do you intend to have with us from now on? Depending on your answer, I may have to change the way I think—as a member of the Fernandes family.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"リタ・フェルナンデス","displayName":"Rita Fernandes","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r253","rowIndex":253,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=38>リタ</tips>はきっぱりと言った。","en":"<tips=38>Rita</tips> spoke firmly.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r254","rowIndex":254,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「素晴らしいね」","en":"“Splendid.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r255","rowIndex":255,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>は溜息をついた。","en":"<tips=1>Tse Leung</tips> sighed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r256","rowIndex":256,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そういう話は、<tips=36>アウロラ</tips>あたりからしてくるんだと思っていた。まさかきみが一人で乗り込んできて、そんなことを言うとはね」","en":"“I expected <tips=36>Aurora</tips> or someone like her to approach me with that conversation. I never imagined you would march in alone and say such a thing.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r257","rowIndex":257,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「わ、私だって、本当は、<tips=1>亮</tips>さんに向かってこんな聞き方をしたくはありません……」","en":"“I-I didn’t really want to question you this way either, Mr. <tips=1>Tse</tips>...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"リタ・フェルナンデス","displayName":"Rita Fernandes","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r258","rowIndex":258,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　本人なりに努力してはいるのだろうが、普段の気の弱い<tips=38>リタ</tips>が時々顔を出す。","en":"She was no doubt trying as hard as she could in her own way, but the usual timid <tips=38>Rita</tips> showed her face every now and then.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r259","rowIndex":259,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いや褒めてるんだよ。なんだかんだで、きみもあのフェルナンデスの娘だってことだな」","en":"“No, I’m praising you. When all’s said and done, you really are your father’s daughter—a Fernandes.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r260","rowIndex":260,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>が真顔で言うと、彼女は恐縮したように肩をすくめる。","en":"When <tips=1>Tse Leung</tips> said this with a perfectly straight face, she hunched her shoulders as though abashed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r261","rowIndex":261,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=35>ジョゼ・フェルナンデス</tips>と言えば意志の固いことで知られた男で、自分でこうと決めたらけして曲げない。若い頃に、拷問を受けても何一つ喋らなかったとか、その精神の強さを示すエピソードは数限りなかった。","en":"<tips=35>José Fernandes</tips> was renowned for his iron will. Once he had decided upon a course, nothing could make him bend. There were countless stories attesting to that strength of spirit—among them, how he had refused to say a single word under torture in his youth.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r262","rowIndex":262,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まず最初に言うけれど、僕はきみたちの家族と争うつもりはない。そもそも好き好んで<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>内で争いたい筈もない」","en":"“I’ll begin by saying that I have no intention of fighting your family. I could hardly want conflict within <tips=7>YS</tips> for its own sake.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r263","rowIndex":263,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その言葉に<tips=38>リタ</tips>はほっと安堵をしたが、続けて<tips=1>亮</tips>の口から出た言葉がすぐに彼女の身体をかたくした。","en":"Those words brought visible relief to <tips=38>Rita</tips>, but what came next from <tips=1>Tse Leung</tips> immediately made her body stiffen again.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r264","rowIndex":264,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「しかし、このままじゃ争いになる可能性もある」","en":"“But if matters remain as they are, there may be conflict.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r265","rowIndex":265,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それはどういうことですか？」","en":"“What do you mean?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"リタ・フェルナンデス","displayName":"Rita Fernandes","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r266","rowIndex":266,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「初代が死んでチャンスだと思っているのは<tips=27>廖</tips>だけじゃない。きみのところの若い連中もそう思っているはずだ。適切な手を打たなければ混乱するだろう。きみの父さんが積極的に戦争を望むとは思えないが、流血沙汰はありえるし、結果的にそうなる可能性はある」","en":"“<tips=27>Liao</tips> isn’t the only one who sees the first Longtou’s death as an opportunity. The younger men in your family must think the same way. Unless the right steps are taken, there will be chaos. I don’t believe your father actively wants a war, but blood could be spilled—and that could be where matters end up all the same.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r267","rowIndex":267,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そんな。信じられません……」","en":"“No. I can’t believe it...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"リタ・フェルナンデス","displayName":"Rita Fernandes","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r268","rowIndex":268,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=38>リタ</tips>は俯く。強く反対出来ないのは、彼女自身思い当たるフシがあるからだろう。","en":"<tips=38>Rita</tips> lowered her head. She could not protest too strongly, presumably because something in his warning rang familiar to her as well.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r269","rowIndex":269,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「だから、野心が具体的なかたちをとらないうちに手を打ちたい。<tips=81>龍頭</tips>になったときに宣言したとおり、<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>を一つにしたいという思いは本当だ。きみのお父さんにもそう伝えている。<tips=75>フェルナンデス・ファミリー</tips>という垣根を取り払って<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>の一部になるべきだ。今度正式にその話をしにゆく」","en":"“That is why I want to act before ambition takes concrete form. I meant what I said when I became <tips=81>Longtou</tips>: I intend to make <tips=7>YS</tips> one. I’ve told your father the same. The barriers around the <tips=75>Fernandes Family</tips> should be removed, and your Family should become part of <tips=7>YS</tips>. I will visit him soon to discuss the matter formally.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r270","rowIndex":270,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……うちでは、誰もその話を受け入れないと思います」","en":"“...I don’t think anyone in my family will accept that.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"リタ・フェルナンデス","displayName":"Rita Fernandes","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r271","rowIndex":271,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「きみもかい？」","en":"“Not even you?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r272","rowIndex":272,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=38>リタ</tips>はしばし口ごもってから、おずおずと頷いた。","en":"<tips=38>Rita</tips> faltered for a moment, then nodded hesitantly.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r273","rowIndex":273,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「気持ちはわかる。独立性を奪われて乗っ取られるように感じるんだろう。でもそうじゃない。僕はきみたちが合流した後も、いままでやって来た同郷人への支援や、きみの父さんの個人的な目的などは尊重するつもりだ。<tips=28>トミー</tips>のところのように、すぐに組織自体を解体してしまおうというつもりもない。統合といってもしばらくは名義だけのもので、実際にはいままで通りやって貰ってかまわないんだ」","en":"“I understand how you feel. It must seem as though you’re being stripped of your independence and taken over. But that isn’t what this is. Even after you join us, I intend to respect the support you’ve always given to people from your homeland, as well as your father’s personal aims. Nor do I intend to dissolve the organization immediately, as I did with <tips=28>Tommy’s</tips> group. For a while, the integration will be in name alone. In practice, you can carry on exactly as before.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r274","rowIndex":274,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「しばらくは」","en":"“For some time...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"リタ・フェルナンデス","displayName":"Rita Fernandes","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r275","rowIndex":275,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「将来的には人的にも我々と融合することになるだろう。ただ、僕の方から強制する気はない。時間が経てば、自然とそうなるさ」","en":"“Eventually, our personnel will likely blend as well. I have no intention of forcing that process from my side. Given time, it will happen naturally.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r276","rowIndex":276,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>が言っても、<tips=38>リタ</tips>は信用しきれない様子で黙り込んでいる。","en":"Even after <tips=1>Tse Leung</tips> said all this, <tips=38>Rita</tips> remained silent, looking unable to believe him completely.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r277","rowIndex":277,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「信じられないのはわかる。だから僕は、今度きみの父さんに会うとき、一つ提案を用意している。受け入れられるかどうかはわからないが、それが実現すれば、きみの父さんや姉さんたちもファミリーが<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>の一部となることを受け入れやすくなるはずだ」","en":"“I understand why you can’t believe me. That’s why I have a proposal ready for the next time I meet your father. I don’t know whether he’ll accept it, but if we can make it happen, it should make it easier for your father and sisters to accept the Family becoming part of <tips=7>YS</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r278","rowIndex":278,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そ、そんな、魔法のような方法があるんですか？」","en":"“Th-there’s really a solution like that? Something almost magical?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"リタ・フェルナンデス","displayName":"Rita Fernandes","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r279","rowIndex":279,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あるよ。難しいけれど、きみが協力してくれれば、うまくいく可能性は高い」","en":"“There is. It will be difficult, but with your cooperation, we have an excellent chance of succeeding.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r280","rowIndex":280,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そんな手段があって、私に出来ることがあるなら、や、やります！」","en":"“If such a solution exists, and there is something I can do, then I-I’ll do it!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"リタ・フェルナンデス","displayName":"Rita Fernandes","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r281","rowIndex":281,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「話す前に賛同したらいけないよ」","en":"“You shouldn’t agree before you hear it.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r282","rowIndex":282,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「で、でも。……じゃあ、話してくださいますか？」","en":"“B-but... Then will you please tell me?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"リタ・フェルナンデス","displayName":"Rita Fernandes","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r283","rowIndex":283,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「うん」","en":"“Sure.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r284","rowIndex":284,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>は気軽に頷き、","en":"<tips=1>Tse Leung</tips> gave an easy nod, then said:","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r285","rowIndex":285,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「僕ときみが結婚するんだ」","en":"“You and I are going to get married.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r286","rowIndex":286,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「けっ……」","en":"“Mar—”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"リタ・フェルナンデス","displayName":"Rita Fernandes","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r287","rowIndex":287,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=38>リタ</tips>は大きく目を見開いて絶句する。","en":"<tips=38>Rita</tips> stared wide-eyed, utterly speechless.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r288","rowIndex":288,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「フェルナンデス家と謝家が一つになれば、統合へのハードルは下がるだろう。仮にすぐに統合出来なくとも、親密な関係を作るには役立つはずだ」","en":"“If the Fernandes and Tse families become one, integration will face fewer obstacles. Even if an immediate merger remains impossible, it should help us establish a close relationship.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r289","rowIndex":289,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「せ、政略結婚というやつですか」","en":"“...You mean a p-political marriage?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"リタ・フェルナンデス","displayName":"Rita Fernandes","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r290","rowIndex":290,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=38>リタ</tips>は顔を真っ赤にしながら言った。一方<tips=1>亮</tips>は冷静だ。","en":"<tips=38>Rita</tips> spoke with her face burning scarlet. <tips=1>Tse Leung</tips>, by contrast, remained perfectly calm.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r291","rowIndex":291,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうなるね。本当は長女である<tips=36>アウロラ</tips>がいいのかもしれないけれど、僕はきみの方が適任だと思う」","en":"“That’s what you’d call it. Perhaps <tips=36>Aurora</tips>, as the eldest daughter, would be the natural choice, but I think you’re better suited.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r292","rowIndex":292,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>の顔は真剣だった。","en":"<tips=1>Tse Leung’s</tips> expression was entirely serious.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r293","rowIndex":293,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「余計なことは考えなくていい。結婚といっても、夫婦らしいことは何もしないでいいんだから。体裁だけの話さ。もしきみにも恋人がいるなら今まで通りつき合ってくれて構わないし、一緒に暮らしたりするのも自由だ」","en":"“Don’t overthink it. Even if we marry, we needn’t do anything expected of husband and wife. It would be for appearances alone. If you have a lover, you’re free to keep seeing them as before, or even live with them.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r294","rowIndex":294,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そんな、恋人なんかいないですけれど……」","en":"“B-but I’m not seeing anyone...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"リタ・フェルナンデス","displayName":"Rita Fernandes","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r295","rowIndex":295,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうかい。じゃあどうする？　さっきは、出来ることは何でもやるって言っていたようだけど」","en":"“I see. So what do you say? A moment ago, you said you’d do anything you could.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r296","rowIndex":296,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あうっ……」","en":"“Auh...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"リタ・フェルナンデス","displayName":"Rita Fernandes","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r297","rowIndex":297,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=38>リタ</tips>は赤い顔をさらに真っ赤にさせて俯く。","en":"<tips=38>Rita</tips> lowered her already scarlet face as it turned a still deeper red.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r298","rowIndex":298,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女は必死に考えていた。","en":"She racked her brain.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r299","rowIndex":299,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=38>リタ</tips>は三姉妹のなかでは発言も少なく目立たない存在だが、一番聡明な人間だった。","en":"<tips=38>Rita</tips> spoke little and attracted the least attention of the three sisters, but she was the most intelligent of them.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r300","rowIndex":300,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　まったく予想外の発言にパニックになりそうな頭のなかで、言葉の裏にもしかしたら隠されているかもしれない真の意味を探ろうとした。","en":"As her mind threatened to panic at this wholly unexpected statement, she struggled to discover whatever true meaning might lie concealed behind the words.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r301","rowIndex":301,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　――この人は私を利用しようとしているのかもしれない。でも、その目的は両家の平和的な統合で、それは私も同意出来るものなんだ。だったら、うんと頷いてもいい？　そして、結婚をする？　私と、<tips=1>亮</tips>さんが結婚？","en":"—This man might be trying to use me. But what he wants is a peaceful union between our families, and I can agree with that. So can I just nod and say yes? And get married? Me and Mr. <tips=1>Tse</tips>—married?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r302","rowIndex":302,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それを思うと、<tips=38>リタ</tips>の頭のなかには、いままでひっそりと空想のなかで思い描いていた二人で過ごす場面が、新婚という具体的なイメージとなってむやみやたらに展開され、目眩を感じるくらいだ。","en":"At the thought, every private fantasy in which <tips=38>Rita</tips> had imagined the two of them together sprang into wild motion, suddenly made concrete by the image of newlywed life. It was enough to leave her dizzy.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r303","rowIndex":303,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　心臓の鼓動が早くなる。くらくらとする。","en":"Her heart raced. Her head swam.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r304","rowIndex":304,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　利用されているだけで、別に好かれているわけでもないのだろうけど、でも「きみがいい」と言われたその言葉が、どうしても払拭できない。","en":"He was only using me, so he probably didn’t like me at all. But I couldn’t get his words—‘You’re the one I’d choose’—out of my mind.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r305","rowIndex":305,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　もしかしたら好意を持っていてくれたのだろうか？　客観的に考えて、そんな大好きってことはないと思う……でも、少なくとも結婚生活を送れる程度には好かれていたんだよね？　そうじゃなければ、こんな言い方しないはずだもの。いや、それがこの人の手だって可能性もあるけど……。ああ、私は何を考えているんだろう！　いまは、そんな、好かれているだとか、そうでないとかを考えている場合じゃない。それは重要なことじゃない。<tips=75>フェルナンデス家</tips>の代表としてここにいるんだから！","en":"Could he perhaps have feelings for me? Looking at it objectively, I don’t think he could like me that much... But he must at least like me enough to share a married life with me, right? Otherwise, he would never have put it that way. Unless putting it that way is part of his ploy... Oh, what am I thinking? This is no time to be wondering whether he likes me or not! That isn’t important. I’m here as a representative of the <tips=75>Fernandes Family</tips>!","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r306","rowIndex":306,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　胸を押さえ、心を抑えようとしたが、聡明な部分がいくら努力をしても、感情が思考をあらぬ方向へ誘おうとする。","en":"She pressed a hand to her chest and tried to calm her heart. However fiercely her rational mind labored, emotion continued to lure her thoughts in impossible directions.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r307","rowIndex":307,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　もう顔色は赤くなるのを通り過ぎて、青ざめ始めていた。ほとんど心臓や肺といった循環器系を病んだ人のように見えるほどあからさまに様子がおかしかった。","en":"Her complexion passed beyond red and began to turn pale. She looked so plainly unwell that one could almost have mistaken her for a patient with a cardiopulmonary disorder.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r308","rowIndex":308,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「大丈夫？」","en":"“Are you all right?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r309","rowIndex":309,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　さすがの<tips=1>亮</tips>も、この<tips=38>リタ</tips>の様子には、本当に体調が悪くなったのかと思ってしまったらしい。","en":"Even <tips=1>Tse Leung</tips> apparently began to wonder whether <tips=38>Rita</tips> had actually fallen ill.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r310","rowIndex":310,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「だっ、大丈夫ですっ」","en":"“I-I’m perfectly fine!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"リタ・フェルナンデス","displayName":"Rita Fernandes","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r311","rowIndex":311,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=38>リタ</tips>は目を合わせられないまま、顔を左右に振る。","en":"Unable to meet his eyes, <tips=38>Rita</tips> shook her head from side to side.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r312","rowIndex":312,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そっ、その話はっ、また今度にしましょう……」","en":"“W-we should discuss this another time...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"リタ・フェルナンデス","displayName":"Rita Fernandes","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r313","rowIndex":313,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=38>リタ</tips>はやはり<tips=1>亮</tips>の目を見られないまま、すっくりと立ち上がる。","en":"Still unable to meet <tips=1>Tse Leung’s</tips> eyes, <tips=38>Rita</tips> sprang to her feet.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r314","rowIndex":314,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうだね。僕も焦ってはいない。返事は一ヶ月後でも、二ヶ月後でもかまわない」","en":"“That’s fine. I’m in no hurry. I don’t mind if you give me your answer in a month, or even two.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r315","rowIndex":315,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それでは、また連絡します！」","en":"“Then I’ll contact you again!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"リタ・フェルナンデス","displayName":"Rita Fernandes","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r316","rowIndex":316,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そのまま胸を押さえ、逃げるようにそそくさと部屋を出て行った。","en":"One hand still pressed to her chest, she scurried from the room almost as though fleeing.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r317","rowIndex":317,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それと入れ替わるように、大きなお腹をした<tips=24>美美</tips>が入って来る。","en":"As though trading places with her, <tips=24>Meimei</tips> came in, her pregnant belly large before her.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r318","rowIndex":318,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どうしたの？　いま、<tips=38>リタ</tips>がすごい顔色で出て行ったわよ。体調でも崩したのかしら」","en":"“What happened? <tips=38>Rita</tips> just left looking terribly pale. Has she taken ill?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬美美ベールなし","displayName":"Ma Meimei (Without Veil)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r319","rowIndex":319,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　首をひねる<tips=24>美美</tips>に<tips=1>亮</tips>は肩をすくめて見せると、","en":"When <tips=24>Meimei</tips> cocked her head in puzzlement, <tips=1>Tse Leung</tips> merely shrugged and said:","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r320","rowIndex":320,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「僕はビジネスの話をしただけだ」","en":"“We were just talking business.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r321","rowIndex":321,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　平然とそう言い放った。","en":"He delivered the statement with perfect composure.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r322","rowIndex":322,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=28>トーマス</tips>は<tips=29>アイス</tips>と共に車に乗り込み、<tips=41>グランドタワー</tips>へ帰って行った。","en":"<tips=28>Thomas</tips> got into a car with <tips=29>Ice</tips> and returned to <tips=41>Grand Tower</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r323","rowIndex":323,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　一方<tips=1>亮</tips>は<tips=59>暗闇通り</tips>へ向かう。そこでこれから幹部の一人である<tips=34>ダリオ・ボネット</tips>と出会う予定があった。彼は<tips=9>Y地区</tips>のカジノ王で、<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>が最後の面会のために幹部たちを招集したとき、誰よりも早く<tips=41>グランドタワー</tips>にあらわれて、意図せず<tips=27>廖志明</tips>を出し抜いた人物でもあった。","en":"Meanwhile, <tips=1>Tse Leung</tips> headed for <tips=59>Darkness Street</tips>. He was due to meet one of the senior officers there, <tips=34>Dario Bonetto</tips>. The casino king of <tips=9>Y District</tips>, Dario had appeared at <tips=41>Grand Tower</tips> before anyone else when <tips=3>Chris Tse</tips> summoned the officers for their final meeting, inadvertently getting the better of <tips=27>Liao Chi-ming</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r324","rowIndex":324,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>は多忙だ。","en":"<tips=1>Tse Leung</tips> was a busy man.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r325","rowIndex":325,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>の統合計画を進めるために、自分のファミリーを持つすべての幹部たちに会い、話をしなくてはいけない。","en":"To advance his plan for the unification of <tips=7>YS</tips>, he had to meet and negotiate with every officer who commanded a family of their own.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r326","rowIndex":326,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　もちろん、<tips=81>龍頭</tips>に就任したばかりであるから、各種資料や、組織内の人などに会って、組織全体の把握をする必要もある。","en":"And since he had only just taken office as <tips=81>Longtou</tips>, naturally he also had to work through all manner of documents and meet people throughout the organization until he had a grasp of the whole.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r327","rowIndex":327,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　さらに、<tips=41>グランドタワー</tips>を襲撃したあの少女の正体も探らなくてはいけない。<tips=1>亮</tips>はその正体についてなんとなくの推測をしていたが、裏付けとなるものが必要だった。","en":"Then there was the identity of the girl who had attacked <tips=41>Grand Tower</tips>, which he still had to uncover. <tips=1>Tse Leung</tips> had a rough idea who she might be, but he needed something to bear it out.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r328","rowIndex":328,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それから、<tips=28>トーマス</tips>によると<tips=22>老人たち</tips>の動きも不穏なものがあると言う。これに関しても、正確な情報を集めておくべきだろう。","en":"Then, according to <tips=28>Thomas</tips>, there was something ominous in the recent activity of the <tips=22>Elders</tips>. He would need to gather reliable information about that as well.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r329","rowIndex":329,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　どれも厄介な仕事だが、やはり<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>の統合計画が最優先すべき課題だろう。まず、何をおいても自分の組織をまとめあげなければ、自由な動きはとれない。","en":"Every one of these was a difficult task, but the unification of <tips=7>YS</tips> surely came first. Unless he brought his own organization together before anything else, he could not act freely.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r330","rowIndex":330,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>内最大級の組織であった<tips=74>廖ファミリー</tips>を無傷で吸収出来たいま、執行部の勢力は他を寄せ付けぬものとなった。これによって、大分見通しは明るくなったとは言え、まだ安心するには早い。","en":"Now that he had absorbed the <tips=74>Liao Family</tips>—one of the largest organizations within <tips=7>YS</tips>—intact, the central leadership was far stronger than any rival. The outlook had grown considerably brighter, but it remained too early for confidence.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r331","rowIndex":331,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　素直に吸収を受け入れるものたちばかりではなかったし、何よりも、<tips=74>廖ファミリー</tips>に次ぐ勢力であった<tips=75>フェルナンデスのファミリー</tips>の状況が芳しくない。","en":"Not everyone would submit willingly to absorption. More importantly, the situation with the <tips=75>Fernandes Family</tips>—the next-largest force after the <tips=74>Liao Family</tips>—was far from promising.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r332","rowIndex":332,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　――いまさっき<tips=38>リタ</tips>にはああ提案したが、彼女が素直に受け入れてくれるかどうか。","en":"He had just made that proposal to <tips=38>Rita</tips>, but whether she would accept it so readily remained uncertain.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r333","rowIndex":333,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼とて安易に結婚を持ち出すのは情のないことだとわかってはいるが、それで無用の争いや人死にが避けられるのなら、選ぶ他ないと考えている。","en":"He knew that proposing marriage so readily was heartless, but if it could avert needless conflict and death, he believed he had no other choice.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r334","rowIndex":334,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=75>フェルナンデスのファミリー</tips>は、<tips=69>義勝</tips>の連中と同じで、同郷人で固まりたがり、排他的で保守的な性格があった。","en":"Like the men of <tips=69>Yisheng</tips>, the <tips=75>Fernandes Family</tips> tended to close ranks with people from the same homeland, giving it an insular, conservative character.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r335","rowIndex":335,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　もし<tips=38>リタ</tips>や、彼女以外の姉妹のだれかと<tips=1>亮</tips>が結婚して、両家が姻戚関係で結ばれたとしても、東洋人の彼が簡単に部下たちを服従させられるというわけでもないだろう。表立って反旗を翻す者がいるとも思えないが、運営には困難を伴うはずだ。","en":"Even if <tips=1>Tse Leung</tips> married <tips=38>Rita</tips> or one of her sisters and bound the two families together as kin, it did not follow that an East Asian outsider could easily make their subordinates obey him. He did not expect anyone to raise the flag of rebellion openly, but governing them would inevitably prove difficult.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r336","rowIndex":336,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　が、やらないよりはマシだ。","en":"Still, it was better than doing nothing.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r337","rowIndex":337,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼の予測では、このままではいずれ両グループの間で争いが起きる。","en":"As Tse Leung saw it, if matters were left as they stood, conflict would eventually break out between the two groups.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r338","rowIndex":338,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=35>フェルナンデス</tips>は幹部会議のなかでは穏健な意見を口にすることが多いが、誇り高く、必要となれば戦うことは厭わない。","en":"<tips=35>Fernandes</tips> often voiced moderate opinions at officers’ meetings, but he was proud and wholly willing to fight when necessity demanded it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r339","rowIndex":339,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>としては、これ以上組織内で武力衝突を起こして疲弊させることは避けたかった。","en":"<tips=1>Tse Leung</tips> wanted to avoid any further armed clashes within the organization, and the exhaustion they would bring.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r340","rowIndex":340,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　せっかく<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>を統合させても、その結果組織が荒廃し、<tips=9>Y地区</tips>外のギャングたちに侵略されたり、あるいは『<tips=21>八龍会</tips>』の<tips=22>老人たち</tips>に好き放題されてしまっては意味がない。","en":"Unifying <tips=7>YS</tips> would be meaningless if the process left it devastated and vulnerable to invasion by gangs from outside <tips=9>Y District</tips>, or permitted the <tips=22>Elders</tips> of the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips> to do whatever they pleased.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r341","rowIndex":341,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>は既に将来障害となる可能性のある勢力を具体的に想定しており、彼らとの戦いを考えるとこれ以上の消耗は危険なのだ。","en":"<tips=1>Tse Leung</tips> already had specific forces in mind that might obstruct him in the future. With the prospect of fighting them ahead, any further attrition now would be dangerous.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r342","rowIndex":342,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"（最悪の場合は戦うという選択肢も考慮しなくてはいけないが……）","en":"(Though if the worst comes to the worst, I’ll have to keep war among my options...)","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r343","rowIndex":343,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　あまりにも弱気な態度をとれば、戦いによる消耗以上のものを失うだろう。","en":"Too weak a posture could cost him more than a battle would.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r344","rowIndex":344,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"（とにかく、結婚して身内になればある程度状況はマシになる）","en":"(In any case, once we marry and become family, the situation should improve to some degree.)","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r345","rowIndex":345,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　現代的な感覚から言えば時代遅れだが、この世界ではやはり血というものは重要視される。","en":"By modern standards, the idea was antiquated, but in this world blood ties still carried enormous weight.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r346","rowIndex":346,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　特に、<tips=75>フェルナンデス・ファミリー</tips>も<tips=76>旧義勝</tips>も、どちらも因習にとらわれた古い組織だ。","en":"Both the <tips=75>Fernandes Family</tips> and the <tips=76>former Yisheng</tips> were old organizations bound by tradition.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r347","rowIndex":347,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　無理矢理にでも両家が親戚になってしまうというのが、確実ではないにしろ、最も手っ取り早く有力な手段なのは間違いない。","en":"Making the two families kin—even if the arrangement had to be forced through—was no guarantee, but it was unquestionably the quickest and most promising means available.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r348","rowIndex":348,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"（<tips=4>馬明</tips>のやつは何て言うかな）","en":"(I wonder what <tips=4>Ma Ming</tips> will say.)","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r349","rowIndex":349,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　この話は、全く誰にも相談せず独断で切り出してしまった。","en":"Tse Leung had broached the entire proposal on his own authority, without consulting anyone at all.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r350","rowIndex":350,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　あの頭の硬い昔からの知人は、<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>が死んでからまるきり父親気取りで、元々口うるさいのが最近エスカレートしている。","en":"Ever since <tips=3>Chris Tse’s</tips> death, that bullheaded old acquaintance had taken to playing father to Tse Leung, and his lifelong habit of nagging had lately escalated still further.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r351","rowIndex":351,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　この件を報告すれば、はげ頭のてっぺんまで真っ赤にして、そんな大事なことを勝手に進めてと怒るだろう。","en":"When Tse Leung reported it, Ma Ming would surely go red all the way to the crown of his bald head and rage at him for taking something so important into his own hands.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r352","rowIndex":352,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そうして<tips=75>フェルナンデス・ファミリー</tips>の懐柔策をあれこれ考えていると、携帯が通話を着信して震動でそれを伝える。確認すると、相手は<tips=25>世傑</tips>であった。","en":"As he turned over one scheme after another for winning over the <tips=75>Fernandes Family</tips>, his cell phone vibrated with an incoming call. He checked the screen. It was <tips=25>Sai-kit</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r353","rowIndex":353,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"『やあボス。仕事が完了したわよ』","en":"“Hey, Boss. Job’s done.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r354","rowIndex":354,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=25>世傑</tips>は暗くも明るくもないいつも通りの声であった。","en":"<tips=25>Sai-kit’s</tips> voice was neither dark nor bright. It was the same voice as ever.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r355","rowIndex":355,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どうなった？」","en":"“What happened?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r356","rowIndex":356,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"『問い詰めたら銃を取り出したから撃ったわ。超亜は死んだ』","en":"“He drew a gun when we questioned him, so I shot him. Chiu-a is dead.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r357","rowIndex":357,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ご苦労さん。死んだのは本人だけ？」","en":"“Good work. Was he the only one killed?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r358","rowIndex":358,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"『あと部下が二人死んだかしら？　家族の方はみんな捕まえて、いま自宅のなかで監視してる。浩俊の四つになる男の子もいる。どうする？』","en":"“And two of his men died too, I think. We’ve rounded up the entire family and are holding them under guard inside the house. Ho-chun has a four-year-old son as well. What should we do?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r359","rowIndex":359,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「他の家族と一緒に街から追放しろ」","en":"“Exile him from the city along with the rest of the family.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r360","rowIndex":360,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"『大丈夫？　大きくなって、復讐しにくるかもしれないわよ？　それに掟通りなら始末するしかないはずだけど』","en":"“Are you sure? The boy may grow up and return for revenge. Besides, under the law, we should have no choice but to dispose of him.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r361","rowIndex":361,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「確かにね、ファミリーのルールでは<tips=81>龍頭</tips>殺しは一族郎党皆殺しだ。ただ、今回は未遂だしね。これくらいがフェアじゃないか？」","en":"“True. Under Family law, anyone who kills the <tips=81>Longtou</tips> has his entire clan put to death. But this time it was only attempted. Isn’t this about fair?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r362","rowIndex":362,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"『初代だったら容赦なく皆殺しにしてたわよ』","en":"“The first Longtou wouldn’t have hesitated to kill them all.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r363","rowIndex":363,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「知らなかったのか？　僕は<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>よりも寛大でフェアなボスなんだ」","en":"“Didn’t you know? I’m a more merciful and fair-minded boss than <tips=3>Chris Tse</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r364","rowIndex":364,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　電話の向こうから笑い声が聞こえる。","en":"He heard laughter from the other end of the line.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r365","rowIndex":365,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「大体さ、四才の子供の復讐なんか早くたって十年は先のことだろう？　そんな先のことまで怯えなきゃいけないなら、僕はもう両手に機関銃でも持って<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>の人間を皆殺しにするしかなくなる。誰が敵になるかわかりゃしないんだ」","en":"“Besides, even at the earliest, a four-year-old won’t be taking revenge for another ten years. If I have to fear something that far in the future, I might as well grab a machine gun in each hand and massacre everyone in <tips=7>YS</tips>. There’s no telling who might turn out to be my enemy.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r366","rowIndex":366,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"『別におかしいと思ったわけじゃないわ。あなたらしいと思っただけ。じゃあ、オーケー。そうするわ』","en":"“It’s not that I thought it was strange. I only thought it was like you. All right, then. I’ll do that.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r367","rowIndex":367,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「頼む」","en":"“I’m counting on you.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r368","rowIndex":368,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"『……あと、一応<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>の掟では、自分のボスへ反逆を企てた者は路地に死体を捨てられることになってるんだけど、超亜と浩俊はどうする？」","en":"“...One more thing. Under the rules of <tips=7>YS</tips>, anyone who plots against their own boss is supposed to have their body dumped in an alley. What do we do with Chiu-a and Ho-chun?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r369","rowIndex":369,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そこは掟通りでいい」","en":"“On that point, follow the law.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r370","rowIndex":370,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"『一応聞いておくけど、掟の通りとは言え、身内を始末したら反発もあると思うわよ？』","en":"“I’ll ask just to be sure: even if it is the law, putting your own kin to death is bound to cause some backlash.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r371","rowIndex":371,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「承知の上だ」","en":"“I’m aware of that.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r372","rowIndex":372,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"『そう。わかったわ』","en":"“I see. Understood.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r373","rowIndex":373,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　通話が切れると、<tips=1>亮</tips>は溜息をついた。","en":"When the call ended, <tips=1>Tse Leung</tips> sighed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r374","rowIndex":374,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「身内同士、血で血を洗う争いをするのはこの世界の常ですが、難しく、そしてつらいものですな」","en":"“Blood feuds among kin are common in this world, but that does not make them any easier or less painful.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r375","rowIndex":375,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　運転席でハンドルを握る部下が、同情するような口調で言った。","en":"The subordinate at the wheel said this in a sympathetic tone.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r376","rowIndex":376,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼は父<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>の代から<tips=81>龍頭</tips>の運転手としてその車のハンドルを握ってきた人物で、ついこの間までは二代目の下で働き、<tips=1>亮</tips>が第三代<tips=81>龍頭</tips>となったことによって彼の車を運転することとなった。","en":"He had been at the wheel of the <tips=81>Longtou’s</tips> car since the time of Tse Leung’s father, <tips=3>Chris Tse</tips>. Until very recently he had served the second Longtou; when <tips=1>Tse Leung</tips> became the third <tips=81>Longtou</tips>, the man became his driver in turn.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r377","rowIndex":377,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>は子供の頃から彼の運転する車に乗っているが、当時もいまも外見的にはほとんど変化の見られない不思議な人物だ。経歴から計算すると、六十をいくつかこえた辺りだろう。","en":"<tips=1>Tse Leung</tips> had ridden in cars driven by this man since childhood, yet he was a curious figure whose appearance had hardly changed from then to now. Judging from his career, he was probably somewhere past sixty.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r378","rowIndex":378,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　中国の広東省の出身で、<tips=9>Y地区</tips>に来る前は日本のあちこちの料理店でシェフとして勤めていたというが、<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>では誰も彼が調理しているところを見たことがない。","en":"He was from Guangdong Province in China and was said to have worked as a chef in restaurants all over Japan before coming to <tips=9>Y District</tips>. Yet no one in <tips=7>YS</tips> had ever seen him cook.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r379","rowIndex":379,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>の周りには、このような父の代からの部下たちがひしめいている。","en":"<tips=1>Tse Leung</tips> was surrounded by subordinates of this sort, men who had served since his father’s day.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r380","rowIndex":380,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼らはみな幼かった頃の<tips=1>亮</tips>を知っているが、少年期は父の側から離れていたため、印象が幼年期のもので止まっている者も多い。","en":"They had all known <tips=1>Tse Leung</tips> when he was little, but because he had spent his boyhood away from his father, many of them still remembered him only as a very young child.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r381","rowIndex":381,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まあ、難しさはあるね」","en":"“Well, there are difficulties.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r382","rowIndex":382,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>は窓の外の景色に視線をやりながらそう答える。","en":"<tips=1>Tse Leung</tips> answered as he turned his gaze to the view outside the window.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r383","rowIndex":383,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「こんな古い組織の血族関係ってのは、サツマイモの根っこみたいに見えないあちこちで繋がっている。その繋がりも単純じゃなく、好き嫌いで色がついている。一つ刺激をすると、巡り巡っておかしなところから反応が来る」","en":"“In an organization this old, blood ties connect people invisibly in every direction, like the roots of a sweet potato. And none of those connections are simple; each is colored by its own likes and dislikes. Disturb one part, and the effects travel through the whole tangle before producing a reaction somewhere you would never expect.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r384","rowIndex":384,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……そういう部分の難しさもあるでしょうが、感情的なものもあるでしょう？　相手は幼なじみじゃないですか」","en":"“...That sort of thing must be difficult, too, but surely there is an emotional side to it? The man was your childhood friend, after all.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r385","rowIndex":385,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「確かに、幼なじみは幼なじみだけれど、感傷はないさ」","en":"“A childhood friend, yes. But I feel no sentimentality toward him.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r386","rowIndex":386,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうですか。……まあ、そうかもしれませんな。奥様は、日本人で、しかも<tips=17>タイプＢ</tips>でしたから、<tips=69>義勝</tips>の親戚にはいじめられていて、可哀想でした」","en":"“I see. ...Well, perhaps that is so. Madam was Japanese, and a <tips=17>Type B</tips> besides, so your relatives in <tips=69>Yisheng</tips> treated her cruelly. It was a pitiable thing.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r387","rowIndex":387,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　この老運転手が『奥様』と呼ぶのは初代<tips=81>龍頭</tips><tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>の妻、つまり<tips=1>亮</tips>の母親のことであった。","en":"By “Madam,” the old driver meant the wife of the first <tips=81>Longtou</tips>, <tips=3>Chris Tse</tips>—in other words, <tips=1>Tse Leung’s</tips> mother.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r388","rowIndex":388,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それでも、奥様は持ち前の人柄と努力で、なんとか打ち解けていったんですよ。文句一つ言わず。実に立派なお方でした」","en":"“Even so, through her natural warmth and her efforts, she managed to win them over. She never voiced a single complaint. She was a truly admirable lady.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r389","rowIndex":389,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「きみは随分おしゃべりだね」","en":"“You really do talk a lot.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r390","rowIndex":390,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>は不機嫌そうに溜息をつく。","en":"<tips=1>Tse Leung</tips> gave an irritated-looking sigh.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r391","rowIndex":391,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まだ<tips=44>妹</tips>が生まれる前、父さんと母さんと僕で旅行に行ったときも、きみはずっと運転席で話し続けていた」","en":"“Before my <tips=44>sister</tips> was born, when Dad, Mom, and I went away together, you talked from the driver’s seat the whole time.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r392","rowIndex":392,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「良く覚えていますな？　まだ赤ちゃんだったのに」","en":"“You remember that? You were still a baby.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r393","rowIndex":393,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「人に言うとよく驚かれるけど、僕は赤ん坊で寝転がってたころの記憶だってあるんだ。だから、赤ん坊の僕に、まわりの大人が油断して本心を見せたのだって見逃しちゃいないよ」","en":"“It often surprises people, but I even have memories from when I was a baby lying on my back. I didn’t miss the adults around me lowering their guard and revealing their true feelings before the infant they believed couldn’t understand.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r394","rowIndex":394,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「これは恐ろしい」","en":"“How frightening.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r395","rowIndex":395,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まあ、だからって恨んだり憎んだりはしないさ。<tips=69>義勝</tips>の連中が母さんや僕を嫌悪していたのは、彼らにすれば当然のことだ。いつまでもこだわるようなものじゃない。……まあ、向こうはそうではなかったようだけどね」","en":"“That doesn’t mean I resent or hate them for it. From the perspective of the people in <tips=69>Yisheng</tips>, their disgust for Mom and me was only natural. It isn’t something worth dwelling on forever. ...Though it seems they did not see it that way.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r396","rowIndex":396,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「考えすぎでしょう？」","en":"“You may be overthinking it.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r397","rowIndex":397,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ふん」","en":"“Hmph.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r398","rowIndex":398,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>は言わなかったが、超亜親子が密謀を打ち合わせるメールのなかで、<tips=1>亮</tips>のことを『あの日本人』と呼んだのを知っている。","en":"<tips=1>Tse Leung</tips> did not say so, but he knew that in the emails Chiu-a and his son had exchanged while plotting together, they had called <tips=1>Tse Leung</tips> “that Japanese.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r399","rowIndex":399,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　結局本当の意味で身内とは思って貰えていなかったようだ。こっちはそんな風に思った事もないのに。","en":"In the end, it seemed they had never truly considered him one of their own—even though he had never once thought of them as anything but his own people.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r400","rowIndex":400,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まあ、血は大事だよ。僕だって<tips=44>妹</tips>は大事にしているし、なくなった両親についてもその辺りの他人とは全く違う特別な存在だと感じている。人間ってものはそういうものさ。愛憎がある。近いものにはどうしたって愛や憎しみを感じてしまう。それ自体はとてもいいことだと思うね。それ自体はね」","en":"“Well, blood matters. I treasure my <tips=44>sister</tips>, and my dead parents are special to me in a way that no unrelated person could be. That is simply how human beings are. We love and we hate. The closer someone is to us, the more impossible it becomes not to love or hate them. And I think that, in itself, is a very good thing. In itself.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r401","rowIndex":401,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>は少し興奮してそう言った。運転手は困ったようで、","en":"<tips=1>Tse Leung</tips> said this with a touch of excitement. Looking rather at a loss, the driver replied:","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r402","rowIndex":402,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……世の中は難しいものですな」","en":"“...Life is a complicated thing, sir.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r403","rowIndex":403,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　と、毒にも薬にもならぬことを言った。","en":"It was a thoroughly noncommittal thing to say.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r404","rowIndex":404,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうかい」","en":"“I see.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r405","rowIndex":405,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　眠そうに返事をする<tips=1>亮</tips>の頭の中は、もう既に次のことを考え始めていた。","en":"Even as <tips=1>Tse Leung</tips> answered drowsily, his mind had already begun turning to what came next.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r406","rowIndex":406,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　超亜親子を処理した後、どうなるか？　運転手や<tips=25>世傑</tips>の言う通り、血族の死体を路上にさらすとなれば、少なからず香港グループに動揺を与えるだろう。","en":"What would happen after Chiu-a and his son had been dealt with? As the driver and <tips=25>Sai-kit</tips> had said, leaving the bodies of blood relatives on public display in the street would cause no small disturbance within the Hong Kong group.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r407","rowIndex":407,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　この苛烈な処理に自重するものもいれば、逆に第二、第三の超亜となるものも現れるかもしれない。彼の予想では具体的にそうなりそうな人物の予想はついている。","en":"Such harsh treatment would make some people rein themselves in, but it might drive others to become a second or third Chiu-a. Tse Leung already had a good idea exactly who was likely to do so.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r408","rowIndex":408,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　これは一種の踏み絵のようなものだ。心がふらついたものたちが、こうした自分のやり方によって改心してくれればいいし、それが出来ないのなら早めに膿を出しておきたい。そして、出た膿はみな殺す。殺す他に自分が<tips=76>旧義勝</tips>を統御する方法はないだろう。","en":"It was a kind of fumie—a test of hidden loyalties. If his methods made those of wavering heart mend their ways, well and good. If they could not, he wanted to draw out the pus early. And whatever pus emerged, he would kill. There was probably no other way for him to bring <tips=76>old Yisheng</tips> under control.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r409","rowIndex":409,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=76>旧義勝</tips>には、超亜親子の他にも幼なじみや親戚が多い。","en":"Beyond Chiu-a and his son, <tips=76>old Yisheng</tips> contained many of Tse Leung’s childhood friends and relatives.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r410","rowIndex":410,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼らは香港時代からの意識が強く、仮の姿とは言え<tips=9>Y地区</tips>の定食屋の息子として暮らし、不良少年として遊び、学校などに通った自分を軽んじているものもいる。そもそも、父の<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>さえも軽く見ているような人間が多い。父も、けして<tips=69>義勝</tips>のなかで有力な家柄というわけではなかった。","en":"Their sense of identity from the Hong Kong days remained strong, and some looked down on Tse Leung because he had lived—even if only as a cover—as the son of a diner owner in <tips=9>Y District</tips>, running wild as a delinquent and going to school like anyone else. Many of them even seemed to think little of his father, <tips=3>Chris Tse</tips>. His father’s family had never been especially powerful within <tips=69>Yisheng</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r411","rowIndex":411,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　もちろん、強力に自分を支持してくれるものもいる。ここで強硬な態度をとることは、彼らの信頼を得ることにも繋がるだろう。<tips=1>亮</tips>としては、<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>全体もそうだが、<tips=76>旧義勝</tips>というこの集団も新しく作り替えなければいけないと感じていた。","en":"Of course, there were also those who backed <tips=1>Tse Leung</tips> strongly. Taking a hard line here would help earn their trust as well. Tse Leung felt that this group called <tips=76>old Yisheng</tips>, no less than <tips=7>YS</tips> as a whole, would have to be rebuilt into something new.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r412","rowIndex":412,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　――それにしても、地獄だな。","en":"—Still, this is hell.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r413","rowIndex":413,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>はふと思った。","en":"The thought suddenly came to <tips=1>Tse Leung</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r414","rowIndex":414,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　子供の頃から知っている親戚を殺し、憎くもない誰かを脅したり殺したり、そして好きでもない相手に結婚を提案し、ビルの上で偉そうにふんぞり返っている。何一つそれを望んだわけでもないのに。その殺し合いの先に欲しいものが一つでもあるわけでもないというのに。","en":"He killed relatives he had known since childhood, threatened and killed people he did not even hate, proposed marriage to a woman he did not even like, and sat atop a building as though he owned the world. Not one of these things was anything he had wanted. And beyond all the killing, there was not a single thing he wanted to gain.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r415","rowIndex":415,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　こんな人生になるとは思わなかった。しかし、こうなるのも当然なのだろう。結局、自分という人間だって父親が人を殺して得たものでここまで来たのだ。そして、ここが自分の生まれた場所なのだ。","en":"He had never imagined his life would turn out this way. Yet perhaps it was only natural. After all, he himself had come this far on what his father had gained by killing people. And this was where he had been born.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r416","rowIndex":416,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それにしてもさ、我々ってのはどうしてこう殺し合うんだろうねえ？」","en":"“Still, why do people like us keep killing one another this way, I wonder?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r417","rowIndex":417,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>は後部座席から、運転手に向かってそう話しかける。","en":"<tips=1>Tse Leung</tips> put the question to the driver from the back seat.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r418","rowIndex":418,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「僕はね、この仕事を始める前はずっと思っていたんだよ。人間の最も素晴らしい叡智というのは、本来なんの価値もない生命というものを、最上の価値があるものだとでっちあげることだと。でもこの仕事をはじめてから、僕はまったく正反対のことをしている。生命を小銭みたいに消費している。別にそうしたいってわけじゃないけれど、最善策を選ぶと自然にそうなるんだよ」","en":"“You know, before I took this job, I had always thought humanity’s greatest feat of wisdom was to take life, something with no inherent value, and concoct the fiction that it possessed the highest value of all. But ever since I began this work, I’ve done exactly the opposite. I spend lives like small change. It isn’t what I want to do, but whenever I choose the best available course, that is where I naturally end up.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r419","rowIndex":419,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……<tips=81>龍頭</tips>」","en":"“...<tips=81>Longtou</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r420","rowIndex":420,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そんな心配そうな顔をしなくていい。僕はやけになっているわけじゃない」","en":"“You don’t have to look so worried. I’m not saying this out of despair.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r421","rowIndex":421,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>は苦笑してから、","en":"<tips=1>Tse Leung</tips> gave a wry smile, then continued:","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r422","rowIndex":422,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ただ、これも一種のフィールドワークなんだろうなと感じているんだ。体験しなければわからない。……僕らは非常に原始的だ。理屈もなんにもない。自分が持ってるものを全部つかってやっつけあうだけの世界に生きている。下らないけれど、非常にエキサイティングだよ。外から何かを眺めてごちゃごちゃとややこしいことを考えるより、こうやってプレイヤーとして無我夢中にやってるほうが、生物の本質に近い生き方なのかもしれないな」","en":"“I only feel that this must be a kind of fieldwork, too. You can’t understand it without experiencing it. ...We are terribly primitive. There is no reason or logic to any of it. We live in a world where all we do is throw everything we have into defeating one another. It is ridiculous, but extremely exciting. Perhaps losing myself in the struggle as a player is a way of living closer to the nature of a living creature than standing outside it all, looking on and tangling myself in complicated thoughts.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r423","rowIndex":423,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　年老いた運転手はこの若い主人が笑いながら口にする正体不明の質問に、どういう返事もかえすことが出来ず、ただルームミラー越しに困惑の視線を投げかけつつ、","en":"The old driver had no idea how to answer the strange, unclassifiable question his young master put to him with a laugh. He could only cast Tse Leung a bewildered glance through the rearview mirror before saying:","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r424","rowIndex":424,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「私は、人間より偉大な何かは存在すると思っています……。きっと、我々がこうして醜く争う姿を、世界の上から見つめているのでしょう。そして私たちの誰にも伝えられない苦しみや悲しみも、ご存じなのです。そうでなければ、あまりにも残酷すぎる……」","en":"“I believe something greater than humanity exists... Surely it watches from above the world as we fight one another so hideously. And it knows all the suffering and sorrow that none of us can tell anyone else. If it did not, things would be far too cruel...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r425","rowIndex":425,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　すると、<tips=1>亮</tips>は急に興を失ったような表情に戻り、","en":"<tips=1>Tse Leung’s</tips> face abruptly resumed an expression as though he had lost interest.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r426","rowIndex":426,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうかい。でも、そんな話をしているわけじゃないんだ。ただ、なんというか、ほら……」","en":"“I see. But that isn’t what I’m talking about. It’s just... How can I put this...?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r427","rowIndex":427,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼は珍しく言葉を詰まらせてから、","en":"For once, words failed him. Then he said:","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r428","rowIndex":428,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ただちょっと、もう少しこの状況を好きになりたいなっていうだけさ」","en":"“I only wish I could like this situation a little more than I do.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r429","rowIndex":429,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そう運転手に笑いかける。","en":"With that, he smiled at the driver.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X3-3:r430","rowIndex":430,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しかしその言葉はさらに年長の部下を混乱させるだけだった。彼は返事が出来ず、ただ困った顔でチラチラとバックミラー越しに主人の顔を見ている。","en":"But his words only confused the much older subordinate still further. Unable to answer, the driver merely kept glancing at his master’s face in the rearview mirror, looking troubled.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}}]},{"position":22,"code":"C2","unitId":"C2","rows":[{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r1","rowIndex":1,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　もう、二十年ほど前になるのだろうか？","en":"It must have been about twenty years ago now.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r2","rowIndex":2,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私が初めて<tips=9>Y地区</tips>を訪れた時、<tips=57>滑走路通り</tips>は今のように人で溢れかえった繁華街ではなかったが、それでも猥雑な活気はあった。","en":"When I first visited <tips=9>Y District</tips>, <tips=57>Runway Street</tips> was not yet the teeming entertainment district it is today, but it already possessed a certain sordid vitality.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r3","rowIndex":3,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　悪臭のする残飯を売るような屋台が並び、人々の足の間を野良猫やドブネズミが走り回っている。基地の跡地に作った掘っ立て小屋がそのまま残り、その中から肉体労働者や違法在留外国人がそっと外を窺って、通りを行き交う人間を物色している。そんな街だった。","en":"The street was lined with stalls selling what looked like foul-smelling leftovers, while stray cats and sewer rats darted between people’s feet. Ramshackle huts built on the remains of the military base still stood, and from inside them manual laborers and undocumented foreigners peered cautiously out, sizing up the passersby. That was the sort of district it had been.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r4","rowIndex":4,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　住人たちには正規な仕事はなく、今よりもずっと貧しかった。","en":"Its residents had no steady work and were far poorer than they are today.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r5","rowIndex":5,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そんな彼らが日銭を稼ぐためには、毎朝街角に立つ怪しげな男の手を借りなければならなかった。","en":"To earn each day’s wages, they had to rely on a dubious-looking man who stood on a street corner every morning.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r6","rowIndex":6,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　街の人々は彼を『人買い』と呼んでいた。","en":"The locals called him the “man-buyer.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r7","rowIndex":7,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"『人買い』は大声を張り上げてその日に働く労働者を募集する。彼の仕事は相場の半分くらいのはした金しか支払われなかったが、素性や国籍を問わず、日本語もほとんど話せないような人間でも筋肉さえあれば雇われ、その日の帰りには現金をポケットに入れられるので、いつも彼の周りには垢まみれの男たちが人だかりを作っていた。そしてトラック一杯の労働者たちが集まると、そのままどこかへと連れられてゆく。行き先は<tips=8>グレートホール</tips>近くの汚染地域の作業場など、普通の日本人ならだれもやりたがらぬような過酷な現場だ。","en":"The man-buyer would raise his voice and recruit that day’s laborers. The jobs he offered paid a pittance—about half the going rate—but he asked nothing about a man’s background or nationality. Even someone who could barely speak Japanese would be hired so long as he had muscle, and by the journey home that evening he would have cash in his pocket. A crowd of grime-covered men therefore gathered around the recruiter without fail. Once enough men had assembled to fill a truck, they were carried off somewhere: a worksite in the contaminated zone near the <tips=8>Great Hole</tips>, perhaps, or some other brutal place where no ordinary Japanese worker would willingly set foot.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r8","rowIndex":8,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　男たちは一日そこで汗を流すと、日が暮れる頃には帰って来て、<tips=9>Y地区</tips>のそこらじゅうにある飲食店の残飯を拾って味付けしたような飯を食い、たらふく酒を飲み、使い果たしてしまう。それよりいくらか理性のあるものは金を貯めて、女を抱く。そしてまったく理性のないものは、飯を買わずにそこらじゅうで売られている粗悪なドラッグを買って、そうなるともう一週間もせずに死んでゆく。","en":"After sweating through a day there, the men returned around sundown, ate food that seemed to have been made by gathering leftovers from restaurants all over <tips=9>Y District</tips> and seasoning them, drank their fill, and spent everything they had earned. Those with a little more sense saved up enough to buy a woman. Those with no sense at all went without food and bought the adulterated drugs sold everywhere. Once they did, they were dead within a week.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r9","rowIndex":9,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　当時の<tips=9>Y地区</tips>は大体そういった街だった。路地で売られているものは、食い物、酒、麻薬、女。充分な金を持っているものなどなく、道ばたに集まって博打に興じ、勝利して金を集めた一人が店に繰り出す。","en":"That was more or less the kind of place <tips=9>Y District</tips> had been in those days. What the alleys offered for sale was food, liquor, drugs, and women. No one possessed enough money on his own, so men gathered by the roadside to gamble, and the single winner who collected the pot would head off to spend it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r10","rowIndex":10,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　よそからの人間がやって来る路地には盲目の少年や、手足を失った子供が歌をうたって物乞いをして居る。それはギャングが子供を集めて身体を欠損させ、歌を仕込み、街角に立たせているのだ。","en":"In the alleys frequented by outsiders, blind boys and children missing limbs sang for alms. Gangsters gathered those children, mutilated their bodies, taught them songs, and placed them on street corners.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r11","rowIndex":11,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なあ<tips=5>太刀川</tips>、大戦後の闇市でさえ、ここまでひどくはなかったろうなあ」","en":"“Say, <tips=5>Tachikawa</tips>, even the black markets after the war couldn’t have been this bad.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r12","rowIndex":12,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　当時私は大学生で、悪友に半ば無理矢理連れてこられた。","en":"I was a university student at the time, and a disreputable friend had more or less dragged me there against my will.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r13","rowIndex":13,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼は地方の資産家の息子で、地元に居た頃は散々悪戯をしていたそうだが、こちらへ出て来て思うように遊ぶことが出来なくなった。そのストレスをこの街で発散しているのだろう。","en":"He was the son of a wealthy family in the provinces. I was told he had gotten into all manner of trouble back home, but after moving here he could no longer amuse himself as freely as he pleased. I suppose he came to this district to vent the resulting frustration.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r14","rowIndex":14,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=9>Y地区</tips>の外れには古い国立病院がある。そこは、重度の<tips=17>タイプB</tips>を扱う歴史ある病院で、そこに悪友の親戚が医師として働いていた。悪友はその親戚を訪ねたりするうちに遊びを覚えたのだそうだ。","en":"An old national hospital stood on the outskirts of <tips=9>Y District</tips>. It was a venerable institution specializing in severe cases of <tips=17>Type B</tips>, and a relative of my disreputable friend was working there as a physician. Apparently it was while visiting this relative that my friend learned how to amuse himself in the district.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r15","rowIndex":15,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　この街ではさまざま年齢の、さまざまな人種の女が安く買え、そしてスリルも味わえるのがたまらないのだと彼はよく語った。","en":"He often said that what he found irresistible was being able to buy women of every age and race cheaply in this district, and to taste danger at the same time.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r16","rowIndex":16,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は悪友に半ば騙されるような形でそそのかされて女を買った。","en":"My disreputable friend cajoled me into buying a woman, practically duping me into it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r17","rowIndex":17,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　女を知ったのはその時が初めてで、その後もこの悪友に何度か誘われて女を買ったが、大学を出て彼とつき合わなくなると足を向けることもなくなった。","en":"That was the first time I had known a woman. My friend invited me back several times afterward, and on each occasion I bought one; but once we graduated from university and ceased to associate, I no longer visited the district either.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r18","rowIndex":18,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　次に訪れたのは、私が医師免許を取得し研修医として病院勤めをはじめてからのことだ。","en":"I returned only after obtaining my medical license and beginning work at a hospital as a resident.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r19","rowIndex":19,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　当時の私は脳神経外科で学び、業務そのものにはやりがいも誇りもあったが、職場に対しては絶望を抱き始めていた。","en":"At the time, I was training in neurosurgery. The work itself gave me both purpose and pride, but I had begun to despair of my workplace.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r20","rowIndex":20,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　日本の医学界では、いやもしかしたら他の世界でもそうなのかもしれないが、<tips=16>タイプA</tips>はいかに実力を示しても出世が出来ないという風潮があり、私のいた病院でも例外ではなく、はっきりそう言われたこともある。","en":"In the Japanese medical establishment—perhaps the same was true in other spheres as well—there was a pervasive tendency to deny <tips=16>Type As</tips> advancement, no matter how much ability they demonstrated. My hospital was no exception; I had even been told as much outright.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r21","rowIndex":21,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は<tips=16>タイプA</tips>だった。しかもただの<tips=16>タイプA</tips>ではなく、人の感情を読み取る能力があるということで、その能力を知られれば確実に人に疎まれる。","en":"I was a <tips=16>Type A</tips>. Nor was I an ordinary <tips=16>Type A</tips>: I possessed the ability to read other people’s emotions, and if that ability became known, it was certain to make me an object of dislike.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r22","rowIndex":22,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　上司となればなおさらだった。","en":"All the more so when that person was my superior.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r23","rowIndex":23,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　出世が望めなければ、私が臨床医として病院にいる意味がない。かといって今更研究の道に専念する気にもなれず、心の定まらぬまま日々の業務をこなしたり、医局内の派閥争いに巻き込まれたりで、すっかり疲弊していた。","en":"If I could hope for no advancement, there was no reason for me to remain at the hospital as a clinician. Yet after coming this far, I could not bring myself to devote my life to research instead. With no settled course in mind, I went through my daily duties and became entangled in the factional struggles of the medical department, until I was thoroughly worn down.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r24","rowIndex":24,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そうした時分に、学生時代に遊んだこの街を思い出したのである。","en":"It was during that period that I remembered the district where I had gone in search of pleasure as a student.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r25","rowIndex":25,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は人間――特に女性に対しては不信感が強かった。","en":"I deeply distrusted human beings, women in particular.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r26","rowIndex":26,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私の容貌はお世辞にも本来の造形からしてけして褒められるような代物ではなかったが、さらに<tips=77>特質変異</tips>の影響によってほとんど怪物じみたものと化している。","en":"Even in its natural form, my face was not something any amount of flattery could have called attractive. The effects of <tips=77>trait mutation</tips> had rendered it almost monstrous.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r27","rowIndex":27,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　素直に罵倒してくれるのならまだいい。時に女たちは笑顔を浮かべ口では私の能力や実績を褒めたりもするが、目をあわせれば、私の能力によって、彼女たちの正直な感情はいやでも伝わってしまう。","en":"It would have been better if they had simply insulted me to my face. At times women would smile and praise my abilities or achievements aloud, but the moment our eyes met, my own power made their true feelings apparent to me whether I wished it or not.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r28","rowIndex":28,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　内心では酷く嫌悪しながらも、口では交際や結婚をほのめかしたりする女もいるのだから、まったく私の理解を超えている。","en":"There were even women who hinted aloud at courtship or marriage while inwardly feeling intense disgust. Such behavior was utterly beyond my comprehension.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r29","rowIndex":29,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　物心つく前から数えきれないほど繰り返された体験であり、慣れたとは言え、傷つかなくなるというわけではない。特に女と相対するときは心が砂のようになってしまうのは避けられない。","en":"The experience had repeated itself more times than I could count since before I was old enough to understand. I had grown accustomed to it, but that did not mean it no longer hurt. Especially when I faced a woman, I could not prevent my heart from turning to sand.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r30","rowIndex":30,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しかし、<tips=9>Y地区</tips>の娼婦の前ではそうした不快感を感じることがなかった。","en":"With the prostitutes of <tips=9>Y District</tips>, however, I felt none of that discomfort.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r31","rowIndex":31,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女たちは私が普段触れ合う人間よりも、異形のものに対する拒否感が少なく、いくつかのルールを守りさえすればごく普通の客の一人として接してくれる。","en":"Compared with the people I ordinarily encountered, they felt less instinctive rejection toward those of abnormal appearance. So long as I observed a few rules, they treated me as nothing more or less than an ordinary customer.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r32","rowIndex":32,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そこには金と性のやりとりがあるだけで、恋だの愛だのといったものは介在しなかった。たまにそうした感情を装って揺さぶりをかけてくるような女もいたが、そうした不心得者は二度と会わなければいい。","en":"What passed between us was money and sex, nothing more; notions such as romance and love never entered into it. From time to time a woman would feign such feelings in an attempt to unsettle or manipulate me, but such an unscrupulous woman could simply be avoided thereafter.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r33","rowIndex":33,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は時間があればこの退廃のかたまりのような街に入り浸るようになった。その頃になると、学生時代に遊びに来ていた時代よりも大分街は発展していた。<tips=57>滑走路通り</tips>はプレハブや簡易住宅が減ってかわりにネオンを灯す真っ当な飲食店が増え始め、今のような巨大繁華街の片鱗を見せ始めている。","en":"Whenever I had time, I began haunting this district, a place that seemed decadence incarnate. By then it had developed considerably since the days when I had visited as a student. The prefabricated shacks and temporary dwellings along <tips=57>Runway Street</tips> had begun to disappear, replaced by a growing number of legitimate eating and drinking establishments lit with neon—the first glimpse of the vast entertainment district it would become.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r34","rowIndex":34,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そこで私は<tips=52>ミアオ</tips>に出会った。","en":"It was there that I met <tips=52>Miao</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r35","rowIndex":35,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=52>ミアオ</tips>は<tips=59>暗闇通り</tips>の奥で商売をする女で、年ははっきり聞いたことはないが二十才前後だろう。","en":"<tips=52>Miao</tips> was a woman who did business in the depths of <tips=59>Darkness Street</tips>. I never asked her age outright, but I judged her to be around twenty.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r36","rowIndex":36,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　名前からすると中国人のようだが、本人に尋ねてみると名前をつけたのが中国人だというだけで、自分のルーツがどこの国なのかわからないと言う。","en":"Her name made her sound Chinese, but when I asked, she told me that only the person who had named her was Chinese; she herself had no idea what country her roots lay in.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r37","rowIndex":37,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それどころかこの<tips=52>ミアオ</tips>という名にしても、どういう字を書き、何の意味が有るのか知らないのだそうだ。","en":"For that matter, she did not even know what characters were used to write the name <tips=52>Miao</tips> or what it meant.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r38","rowIndex":38,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　見た目は日本人と言われても何の違和感もなく、言語も日本語が最も得意で、土地柄広東語と北京語と英語を多少使えるとのことだった。","en":"In appearance she could have passed for Japanese without raising the slightest doubt, and Japanese was the language she spoke best. Given the nature of the district, she could also manage a little Cantonese, Mandarin, and English.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r39","rowIndex":39,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女が商売をするのは、何の変哲もないアパートである。一階の入り口のところには陰気な中年女が座っていて、これがいわゆる『やり手婆』で、店の切り盛りをしている。彼女にコース時間と指名したい女の名を告げて金を払うと、その部屋へ案内してくれる。","en":"Her place of business was an utterly ordinary apartment building. A gloomy middle-aged woman sat beside the entrance on the ground floor. She was the establishment’s madam and managed its affairs. A customer told her the length of the session and the woman he wanted, paid his fee, and was shown to the appropriate room.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r40","rowIndex":40,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「今日も来てくれてたんですね。うれしい！」","en":"“You came to see me again today! I’m so happy!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r41","rowIndex":41,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ドアを開けると、彼女は栗鼠のようにくりくりとした目を輝かせて私に抱きつき、軽くキスをする。","en":"When I opened the door, she threw her arms around me, squirrel-like eyes gleaming, and kissed me lightly.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r42","rowIndex":42,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私の特別な目は、彼女の目を見ることで浮き足立つような明るい感情を伝え、その言葉に偽りがないことを教えてくれる。そして彼女が笑うたび、私は空気に無数の花が咲くような輝きを感じるのだ。","en":"When I looked into her eyes, my own extraordinary eyes conveyed to me a bright emotion, buoyant with excitement, and told me that her words were sincere. And whenever she smiled, I sensed a radiance like countless flowers bursting into bloom in the air.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r43","rowIndex":43,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　何回目からだろう。私たちは、型どおりの行為の前のシャワーや会話を省略し、出会ってすぐに身体をむさぼりあうようになった。","en":"I cannot remember which visit it began with. At some point we dispensed with the customary shower and conversation before the act, and began devouring each other’s bodies the moment we met.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r44","rowIndex":44,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　これは私の特権だと思いたいが、サービス精神にあふれて、誰にでも分け隔てない<tips=52>ミアオ</tips>の性分からすると、他の客にも同じようにしているのだろう。それを思うと、嫉妬する。","en":"I wanted to believe this was a privilege reserved for me. Yet given <tips=52>Miao’s</tips> natural eagerness to please and the fact that she treated everyone without distinction, she probably did the same with her other clients. The thought made me jealous.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r45","rowIndex":45,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その嫉妬心を打ち消すように、私はいつも行為に没頭するのだった。","en":"I always immersed myself in the act as though to extinguish that jealousy.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r46","rowIndex":46,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　端的に言って私は彼女に恋をしていたのだと思う。自分でそうはっきりと認めたくはなかったが、事実から目をそらすことは出来なかった。こんな街の娼婦に恋をしたところで行き止まりしかなく、それをはっきり分かっていても、自制することは不可能だった。","en":"Put simply, I think I was in love with her. I did not wish to admit it to myself in such explicit terms, but neither could I avert my eyes from the facts. Falling in love with a prostitute in a district like this could end only at a dead end. I understood that perfectly, yet found it impossible to restrain myself.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r47","rowIndex":47,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　こんなに表の顔と感情の動きが一致する人間は見たことがなかったし、さらに自分をある程度受け入れてくれるとなれば、この地球上を探し回ったとしても他にそのような人間が存在するとは思えなかった。ほとんど奇跡ではないかという思いが、恋を後戻りの出来ないものにしていた。","en":"I had never met anyone whose outward expression agreed so completely with the motion of her feelings. Nor did I believe another person who would accept me to some degree could exist anywhere on Earth, even if I searched the whole world. The conviction that this was almost a miracle made my love irreversible.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r48","rowIndex":48,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　こうして性欲に身を任せて行為に没頭していても、やはり胸には恋の苦しみや痛みが割り切れないまま存在してしまうのだ。","en":"Even as I surrendered to lust and immersed myself in the act, the torment and pain of love remained unresolved within my breast.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r49","rowIndex":49,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　お互いの身体と心が落ち着くと、バスルームに行き、彼女に身体を洗って貰う。<tips=52>ミアオ</tips>はいつも、よく泡立てた石けんで私の身体の隅々まで洗い、そしてシャワーで流してくれる。","en":"Once our bodies and hearts had calmed, we went into the bathroom and she washed me. <tips=52>Miao</tips> always cleaned every inch of my body with richly lathered soap, then rinsed it beneath the shower.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r50","rowIndex":50,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　部屋に戻ると、彼女は冷蔵庫からビールを取り出す。私たちはお互いにバスタオルを巻き付けたままの姿で隣り合って座り、残りの時間をのんびりと過ごすのだった。","en":"When we returned to the room, she took beers from the refrigerator. Still wrapped in our bath towels, we sat side by side and spent the remainder of our time together at leisure.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r51","rowIndex":51,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「タチカワさんが来てくれると、いつもこちらが癒やされます。なんだか申し訳ないくらい」","en":"“Whenever you come to see me, Mr. Tachikawa, I’m always the one who comes away feeling soothed. I almost feel bad about it.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r52","rowIndex":52,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　商売女が客を繋ぎ止めるための常套句であるその台詞も、彼女は嘘偽りなく本心で言ってくれる。","en":"It was the sort of stock phrase a prostitute used to keep a client coming back, yet she spoke it from the heart, without the slightest falsehood.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r53","rowIndex":53,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　嬉しいが、私は苦しかった。","en":"It made me happy. It also hurt.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r54","rowIndex":54,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私の感情が一方的なものであることも、やはり私の能力ゆえに誤魔化しようがなかった。","en":"The same ability made it impossible for me to deceive myself about the one-sidedness of my feelings.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r55","rowIndex":55,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女は私といるとき、いつも明るく、楽しげで――つまり恋するもの特有の苦しみや胸の痛みというものが全く感じられなかった。あくまでも、いい客であり、いい人でしかないのだ。","en":"When she was with me, she was always bright and happy—which is to say that I sensed in her none of the anguish or heartache peculiar to a person in love. To her, I remained nothing more than a good client and a good person.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r56","rowIndex":56,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しかし、私の方はそうはいかない。","en":"For me, however, it was not so simple.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r57","rowIndex":57,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　これだけ身体をむさぼった後でも、いやむしろその後だからこそ彼女がいとおしく感じられた。そして恋するもの特有の感性によって、彼女の顔も、表情も、喋り方も、仕草も、そのすべてがきらきらと眩しいほどに輝きを放って美しく見えた。","en":"Even after we had so thoroughly devoured each other’s bodies—indeed, precisely because we had—she seemed all the dearer to me. And through the peculiar sensibility of a person in love, her face, her expressions, her manner of speaking, her gestures—everything about her—seemed beautiful, glittering with a radiance bright enough to dazzle me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r58","rowIndex":58,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　こうして何よりも大事な彼女と二人で過ごす時間は幸福で、そして、同時に苦しかった。","en":"The time I spent alone with the woman more precious to me than anything else was happy—and, at the same time, painful.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r59","rowIndex":59,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　もし私が本気なら、彼女を自分のものにすることは可能かもしれない。私は出世の望みこそないとは言え、それでも同世代の平均的な収入は上回ってはいる。","en":"If my intentions were serious, perhaps I could make her mine. Though advancement was closed to me, I still earned more than the average person my age.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r60","rowIndex":60,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女にこの世界から足を洗わせることも出来なくはなかったのかもしれない。","en":"Perhaps I could have gotten her out of that world.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r61","rowIndex":61,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それを何度か口にしかけたこともあるが、それを彼女が断っても、受け入れても、今の関係が壊れてしまいそうな気がした。","en":"Several times I came close to saying as much to her. But whether she refused the offer or accepted it, I had the sense that our present relationship would be destroyed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r62","rowIndex":62,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　実際金で身体を買っているのだからやっていることは同じようなものなのだろうが、プロとして生きている彼女と、客として通っている私の関係は、少なくとも私は対等の立場だと思っていた。","en":"In practice, what I was doing was much the same, since I already bought her body with money. Even so, she lived as a professional and I visited as her client; in my mind, at least, we met as equals.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r63","rowIndex":63,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それを、仕事以外の時間まで金で奪おうというのは、暴力を使ってその人格を蹂躙するのと何ら変わりがあるようには思えず、そのようなことをしたら今の対等さを損ねてしまうように思えた。","en":"To use money to take possession even of her time outside work seemed to me no different from using violence to trample upon her personhood. I felt that if I did such a thing, the equality we presently shared would be lost.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r64","rowIndex":64,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　実際のところは私が充分な金を渡しさえすれば彼女は喜んだかもしれないし、金を渡すという行為は人格の蹂躙でもなんでもなく他者に対して誠意を示したり評価をかたちにする確実な方法で、間違いでもなんでもないのだが、若い私はそう思えなかった。","en":"In reality, Miao might have been delighted if only I gave her sufficient money. Giving money was no violation of personhood, but a sure way of demonstrating sincerity toward another person or giving tangible form to one’s esteem, and nothing about it was inherently wrong. Yet in my youth, I could not see it that way.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r65","rowIndex":65,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　全てのことを、「自分だったら」と置き換えて考えていたのだ。","en":"I viewed everything by asking myself, “What if it were me?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r66","rowIndex":66,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　たとえば私なら、どこかの大病院で患者を診て金を貰うのは誇りであったが、どこかの金持ちの専属の医者になって奴隷のように過ごすのは、いくら大金を積まれても、とても許容できない。","en":"For example, I took pride in examining patients at a large hospital and receiving money, but becoming some wealthy person’s private physician and living like a slave was something I could never accept, however vast the sum offered.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r67","rowIndex":67,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　若者特有の潔癖症で、金銭を汚れた物だととらえる価値観が強かった。","en":"With the moral fastidiousness peculiar to youth, I regarded money as something unclean.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r68","rowIndex":68,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=52>ミアオ</tips>自身に対しても神聖なイメージを抱いていたと思う。誰にでも分け隔て無く身体を与えるその職業は、私に献身的な博愛に似たものを感じさせたのだ。","en":"I believe I had made <tips=52>Miao</tips> herself into something sacred in my mind. In her profession—giving her body to anyone without distinction—I perceived something resembling a selfless love for all humanity.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r69","rowIndex":69,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　一方、彼女はどう考えていたのか。","en":"And what did she think?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r70","rowIndex":70,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　前述したように、私に対する感情は好意ではあったが、私が彼女に感じているような苦しみはない。だから、自分と同じ感情ではないのはわかっている。しかし、他の客と比べて、私が特別であったのか、それとも他の全ての客に同じような感情を持っているのか、そこを判別することは出来なかった。","en":"As I said before, what she felt toward me was fondness, but she suffered none of the anguish I felt for her. I therefore knew her feelings were not the same as mine. Yet I could not tell whether I was special to her compared with her other clients or whether she felt the same way toward every one of them.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r71","rowIndex":71,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　他の常連客にも私にしているのと同じような気持ちで接し、私にするような接客を行っていたのかもしれないと想像すると息苦しくなった。","en":"Whenever I imagined that she might approach her other regular clients with the same feelings she showed me, and serve them in the same way, my chest tightened.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r72","rowIndex":72,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　いや、もっと冷静に観察が出来ていれば判別はついたのかもしれない。","en":"No—if I had been capable of observing her more calmly, perhaps I could have told.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r73","rowIndex":73,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しかし、夢中になってしまった人間というものは判断力を奪われて驚くほど愚かになる。ほんの僅かな疑念を重大なことのように感じて絶望し、なんのこともない小さな希望を見ただけで全てがうまく行くと思い込んだりする。","en":"But a person consumed by passion loses all judgment and becomes astonishingly foolish. The faintest doubt feels momentous and drives him to despair, while one glimpse of some trivial hope convinces him that everything will work out.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r74","rowIndex":74,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私が人の感情を正確に盗めると言っても、こうなってしまっては何の役にも立たない。","en":"It made no difference that I could steal another person’s emotions with perfect accuracy; once I had fallen into such a state, the ability was of no use at all.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r75","rowIndex":75,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　結局私は能力のない人間と同じように、相手の言葉によって真実を確認したくて仕方がなかった。しかし、直接訊ねて事実を確かめる行為はみっともない振る舞いだと感じたし、また、単純にすべてを明白にしてしまう勇気もなかったため、結局質問は出来なかった。","en":"In the end, just like a person with no such power, I could not help wanting to hear the truth confirmed in her own words. Yet I felt that asking her directly would be an unseemly act, and I also lacked the simple courage to make everything explicit. In the end, I was unable to ask.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r76","rowIndex":76,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　――もし彼女が私に対して本気になったならば、という空想は、眠れぬ夜の寝床でよく思い描いた。","en":"—What if she were ever to fall for me in earnest? I often pictured that fantasy as I lay in bed on sleepless nights.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r77","rowIndex":77,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　実際彼女とプライベートのつき合いを持つとなれば、私の周囲の人間に対して彼女の正体を隠しきるのは難しいだろう。職場の人間はともかく、親は黙ってはいまい。","en":"If I were actually to form a private relationship with her, it would be difficult to conceal who she was from the people around me. My colleagues were one thing; my parents would never let the matter pass in silence.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r78","rowIndex":78,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私の両親は古く厳格な人間で、家柄などにうるさかった。私の交際相手となればいかなる手段を用いても素性を調べ上げるはずだ。そうして事実を知れば確実に反対をする。彼女が<tips=17>タイプB</tips>であるというだけでも、彼らは受け入れないだろう。","en":"My parents were old-fashioned and severe, preoccupied with family pedigree and similar matters. They would investigate any woman I courted by every available means. When they discovered the truth, they would oppose us without question. The fact that she was <tips=17>Type B</tips> alone would have made her unacceptable to them.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r79","rowIndex":79,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　想像のなかの私は、そんな両親に離縁を申し入れて彼女と二人の生活を選んだ。そして、どこかの田舎町で開業医になり、二人でいつまでもつつがなく暮らすのであった。","en":"In my imagination, I announced to my parents that I was severing our ties and chose a life with her instead. I would open a private practice in some country town, and the two of us would live there together, peacefully and without incident, for the rest of our days.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r80","rowIndex":80,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　もし人にこの時の気持ちを打ち明けていたならば、どこにでもあるような、熱病に浮かされた状態でしかないと笑われていただろう。当時の私も正気を喪っているのを自覚してはいたが、しかし間違っているとは思わなかった。","en":"Had I confided what I felt at the time to anyone, they would doubtless have laughed and said it was merely the same fevered state found everywhere. Even then I knew that I had lost my reason; nevertheless, I did not believe that what I felt was mistaken.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r81","rowIndex":81,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　正気であれ熱病であれ、私の気持ちは疑いのない正真正銘のものであることは確信していた。","en":"Sane or fevered, I was convinced that my feelings were unquestionably genuine.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r82","rowIndex":82,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　いや本来人の気持ちや感情というものは、全てが熱病に似た得体の知れぬ熱気なのだ。","en":"No—human feelings and emotions are, by their very nature, all an unknowable heat akin to fever.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r83","rowIndex":83,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私の心には確かに熱気があった。これまで様々な異性と関わったが、そのように感じたのは彼女だけだった。たとえ結果がどうなろうとも、この瞬間の真実は永劫に失われないように思われた。","en":"That heat was unquestionably present in my heart. I had involved myself with many different women, yet she was the only one who had ever made me feel this way. Whatever the outcome might be, it seemed that the truth of this moment would remain forever beyond loss.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r84","rowIndex":84,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女との関係はなかなか客と娼婦の関係を脱しなかったが、私は焦らなかった。","en":"Our relationship showed little sign of moving beyond that of client and prostitute, but I felt no need to hurry.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r85","rowIndex":85,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　こんな風に強く願っているのだから、きっといつか思うとおりになるだろうと信じていた。私の気持ちは間違いのない純粋なものだったし、それが相手に伝われば、自然とお互いが望むようになるはずだ。","en":"I believed that because I desired it so fervently, matters would surely turn out as I wished one day. My feelings were unquestionably pure, and once they reached her, it seemed only natural that she would come to want what I wanted as well.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r86","rowIndex":86,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私はやはり若かった。手を伸ばすこともなく、ただ心の中で念じて時間の経過に任せているだけでは、あらゆるものは変化し、そして何も起こらずに過ぎ去ってしまうのだ。","en":"I had indeed been young. If one never reached out, but merely wished inside one’s own heart and surrendered everything to the passage of time, all things would change, and then pass away without anything ever happening.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r87","rowIndex":87,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=52>ミアオ</tips>はある日突然目の前から姿を消した。","en":"Then one day, <tips=52>Miao</tips> suddenly vanished from my life.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r88","rowIndex":88,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　雨の日だった。","en":"It was raining.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r89","rowIndex":89,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　いつものように指名しようとすると、アパートの前の中年女が<tips=52>ミアオ</tips>はもういないと言った。行き先を訊ねても頑として首を横に振る。","en":"When I tried to ask for her as usual, the middle-aged woman at the entrance to the apartment told me that <tips=52>Miao</tips> was no longer there. When I asked where she had gone, the woman stubbornly shook her head.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r90","rowIndex":90,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=52>ミアオ</tips>から私に言付けはないかと聞いても、首を横に振るばかりだ。せめて連絡先を教えてほしいと食い下がったが、","en":"I asked whether <tips=52>Miao</tips> had left any message for me, and again she only shook her head. I persisted, begging for some means of contacting her, but—","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r91","rowIndex":91,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「これ以上しつこくすると、こわいお兄さんを呼ぶよ」","en":"“Keep bothering me and I’ll call in the scary boys.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r92","rowIndex":92,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そこまで言われては引き下がる他なかった。","en":"After that, I had no choice but to withdraw.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r93","rowIndex":93,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　いつでも会えると連絡先を交換しなかったのを後悔した。彼女に踏み込もうとしなかった自分の勇気のなさを後悔した。","en":"I regretted that, assuming I could see her whenever I wished, I had never exchanged contact information with her. I regretted my own cowardice in never trying to step any further into her life.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r94","rowIndex":94,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女の住んでいる地区など、会話の流れで大まかに聞いてはいたが正確な場所は知らない。雨でずぶ濡れになりながらその辺りをうろうろしてみても、見つかる筈もなかった。","en":"In the natural course of conversation, I had learned approximately which part of town she lived in, but I did not know the exact location. I wandered aimlessly through the area, soaked to the skin by the rain, but there had never been any real chance of finding her that way.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r95","rowIndex":95,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　何も伝えずにいなくなったということは、意図的に私を切り捨てたのかもしれない。その可能性は低くはないが、それどころか、おそらくもっとも妥当な結論なのだろうが、心が受け入れなかった。","en":"The fact that she had disappeared without telling me anything might have meant she had deliberately cast me aside. That was by no means unlikely—indeed, it was probably the most reasonable conclusion—yet my heart refused to accept it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r96","rowIndex":96,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　一度だけでも、会って、顔を見て、話したかった。","en":"I wanted to meet her, look her in the face, and speak with her just once.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r97","rowIndex":97,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　一方的に関係を切られたにもかかわらず、その行く先を調べ上げるのはあまりにみじめだったが、諦めることは出来なかった。","en":"After she had broken off our relationship unilaterally, trying to track down where she had gone was an utterly pathetic thing to do. Even so, I could not give up.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r98","rowIndex":98,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それから数日、私は街を歩き回って調べたが、よそ者に対する警戒心は強く、殴られたり、脅迫されるばかりで何も情報を手に入れることが出来なかった。","en":"For the next several days I walked all over the district, making inquiries. But its inhabitants were intensely wary of outsiders; all I received were beatings and threats, and I obtained no information whatsoever.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r99","rowIndex":99,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　こんなど素人が調査するなど土台不可能なのだろう。興信所に頼もうとしても、事情を話すと<tips=9>Y地区</tips>の調査は出来ないと断られ、あまりの落ち込みぶりに探偵に諦めた方が良いと慰められる始末だった。","en":"For a complete amateur like me, conducting such an investigation had probably been impossible from the outset. I tried to engage a private detective, but once I explained the circumstances, the agency refused to investigate <tips=9>Y District</tips>. I was so visibly dejected that the detective ended up consoling me and saying I would be better off giving up.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r100","rowIndex":100,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　何も見つからないまま数ヶ月が過ぎた、ある日のことだ。","en":"Several months passed without my finding anything. Then, one day—","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r101","rowIndex":101,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　かつて私をこの街に誘った悪友から再び連絡があった。彼は実家に戻って親の経営する個人病院で働いていた。頃合いを見て副院長、将来的には院長になるのだろう。","en":"the disreputable friend who had first invited me to this city contacted me again. He had gone home and taken a job at the private hospital run by his parents. In due course, he would no doubt become deputy director, and eventually director.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r102","rowIndex":102,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼は自分の病院で一緒に働かないかと私を誘った。個人病院ならば私のような<tips=16>タイプA</tips>でも、彼の一存でどんなポジションにもつくことが出来る。将来は役員になって経営に参加して欲しいとのことだった。","en":"He invited me to come work with him at his hospital. Because it was privately owned, his word alone could place even a <tips=16>Type A</tips> like me in whatever position he chose. In time, he said, he wanted me to become an executive and take part in running the hospital.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r103","rowIndex":103,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　都会の大学病院から地方の個人病院へうつるのは一般的には都落ちだが、院長が招いてやってきた医師となればぞんざいに扱われることなどないし、収入は間違いなく上がる。彼はそう言って私をかき口説いた。","en":"Leaving a university hospital in the city for a private hospital in the provinces was generally considered a step down in the world, he told me. But as a doctor personally recruited by the director, I would never be treated with disrespect, and my income would unquestionably rise. That was the pitch with which he tried to win me over.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r104","rowIndex":104,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は気が進まなかった。確かに今の病院では現状出世の目はないのかもしれないが、それでも将来的に<tips=16>タイプA</tips>の立場が変化する可能性がないわけでもない。事実社会はそのように変化しつつあり、一縷の望みを託していたのだ。","en":"I was reluctant. It might have been true that, under present conditions, I had no prospect of advancement at my hospital. Even so, it was not impossible that the position of <tips=16>Type As</tips> would change in the future. Society was in fact already moving in that direction, and I had entrusted a slender thread of hope to that change.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r105","rowIndex":105,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　何より、この病院でやっていけないからと友人の伝手に頼るというのは完全な敗北のように思えて仕方が無い。<tips=52>ミアオ</tips>のときは捨ててもかまわないと思っていたプライドだが、金銭をちらつかされて売り払えるほど安くもない。","en":"Above all, falling back on a friend’s connections because I could not make it at this hospital felt like total defeat. For <tips=52>Miao</tips>, I had thought that pride worth discarding, but it was not so cheap that I could sell it merely because someone flashed money before me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r106","rowIndex":106,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私が断ると、悪友は気を悪くするでもなく話を変えた。","en":"When I declined, my friend took no offense, but simply changed the subject.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r107","rowIndex":107,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=5>太刀川</tips>、お前、<tips=18>ローズ・クラブ</tips>を知ってるか？」","en":"“<tips=5>Tachikawa</tips>, have you heard of the <tips=18>Rose Club</tips>?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r108","rowIndex":108,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼が口にしたのは、<tips=9>Y地区</tips>にある巨大なレジャー施設の名だった。","en":"The name he had mentioned belonged to an enormous recreation complex in <tips=9>Y District</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r109","rowIndex":109,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「おれ、あそこのプラチナ会員なんだよ。一緒に遊びにいかないか？　一生に一度は行った方がいい。とても考えられないような、もの凄い体験が出来るぜ」","en":"“I’m a platinum member there. Want to go have some fun together? It’s the sort of place you ought to visit at least once in your life. You can have an experience so incredible you’d never believe it.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r110","rowIndex":110,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は難色を示したが、しかし今度は彼も引き下がらなかった。むしろこの誘いこそが、私と連絡をとった本当の目的だったのかもしれない。","en":"I expressed my reluctance, but this time he refused to back down. Indeed, this invitation may have been his true reason for contacting me in the first place.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r111","rowIndex":111,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　最終的に私は断り切れなくなり、彼に同行することとなった。","en":"In the end, I could no longer refuse him and agreed to accompany him.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r112","rowIndex":112,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そうして、久しぶりに<tips=9>Y地区</tips>を訪れた。","en":"And so, after a long absence, I visited <tips=9>Y District</tips> once more.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r113","rowIndex":113,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　時間が過ぎ、一時の気が狂わんばかりの激情は去ってくれたが、かわりに硬くしこりのような感情が心のどこかに突き刺さったまま残っていた。町並みを眺めているだけで、目は無意識のうちに<tips=52>ミアオ</tips>の影を追い求めてしまい、そんな自分に気がつくと胸が痛くなった。","en":"Time had passed, and the temporary passion that had nearly driven me mad had mercifully subsided. In its place, however, a hard, knotted emotion remained lodged somewhere in my heart. The mere sight of the streets made my eyes search unconsciously for <tips=52>Miao’s</tips> figure, and whenever I noticed myself doing it, my chest ached.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r114","rowIndex":114,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　悪友はそんな私の態度に気がつきもせず、冗談ばかり言いながら車を運転していた。","en":"My friend drove along making one joke after another, without the slightest awareness of my behavior.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r115","rowIndex":115,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=18>ローズ・クラブ</tips>は<tips=9>Y地区</tips>でも外れの方にあった。","en":"The <tips=18>Rose Club</tips> stood toward the outskirts of <tips=9>Y District</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r116","rowIndex":116,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　いまはその辺りにも小洒落たレストランや民家などが立ち並んでいるが、当時は鬱蒼とした林に囲まれた何もない場所だった。","en":"Today, the surrounding area is lined with fashionable little restaurants and private homes, but in those days it was an empty place enclosed by dense woods.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r117","rowIndex":117,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その向こうには街に暮らせない異形の<tips=16>タイプA</tips>たちが住居を構える<tips=15>ボーダーエリア</tips>があって、彼らは街の人間を敵視していたから、ちょうどそのあたりの林は街と<tips=15>ボーダーエリア</tips>の緩衝地帯になっていたのである。だから、<tips=18>ローズ・クラブ</tips>に用があるものでなければ足を向けることもない。","en":"Beyond the woods lay the <tips=15>Border Area</tips>, where grotesquely altered <tips=16>Type As</tips> who could not live in town had made their homes. They regarded the people of the town as enemies, and the woods in that vicinity therefore served as a buffer zone between the town and the <tips=15>Border Area</tips>. Unless someone had business at the <tips=18>Rose Club</tips>, there was no reason to set foot there.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r118","rowIndex":118,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　敷地は高いコンクリートの塀で囲まれているが、その外からでも中の建物の外観を確認出来る。まるで中国の宮殿のような派手派手しい外装を持った建物が二つ、暗い夜空にライトアップされている。思ったより大きな建物で、背が高いものと低いものがあるが、高い方はさすがに<tips=41>グランドタワー</tips>には及ばないものの、当時<tips=9>Y地区</tips>で一番大きかったホテルと比べても遜色がない。","en":"The grounds were enclosed by a high concrete wall, but even from outside it was possible to make out the buildings within. Two structures with flamboyant exteriors resembling Chinese palaces stood illuminated against the dark night sky. They were larger than I had expected, one tall and the other low. The taller one naturally fell short of <tips=41>Grand Tower</tips>, but in scale it compared favorably even with what was then the largest hotel in <tips=9>Y District</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r119","rowIndex":119,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　敷地の中に入るには受付で会員証を提示するか、身分証を出して入会しなければならなかった。","en":"To enter the grounds, one had to present a membership card at reception or provide identification and enroll.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r120","rowIndex":120,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　受付には屈強な<tips=17>タイプB</tips>が立っており、丁寧な物腰と正しい敬語を使って客に対応していた。<tips=9>Y地区</tips>の店では珍しく、従業員の教育が行き届いているのを感じた。","en":"A powerfully built <tips=17>Type B</tips> stood at reception and dealt with guests in a courteous manner, using proper honorific Japanese. Unlike most establishments in <tips=9>Y District</tips>, the place had plainly trained its employees thoroughly.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r121","rowIndex":121,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　悪友はプラチナ会員だったので、彼が会員証を提示することで、同行者である私は身分証を求められることはなかった。","en":"Because my friend was a Platinum member, the presentation of his membership card spared me, as his companion, from being asked for identification.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r122","rowIndex":122,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は会員証の代わりとなるゲストカードを渡され、そして施設内で顔を隠すためのマスクを選ぶこととなる。","en":"I was given a guest card in place of a membership card, then required to select a mask with which to conceal my face inside the complex.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r123","rowIndex":123,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ワゴンで運ばれてきたマスクは実に多彩で、仮面舞踏会で用いるようなきらびやかな装飾がなされたものから、能や狂言で使う木彫りの面、さらにほとんどジョークグッズのような有名人の顔を模したラバーマスクまで並んでいる。","en":"The masks delivered on a cart were remarkably varied. There were glitteringly ornamented pieces of the kind worn at masquerade balls, carved wooden masks used in Noh and kyogen, and even rubber masks modeled on the faces of celebrities, scarcely distinguishable from novelty goods.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r124","rowIndex":124,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私はそのなかから、顔全面を隠し、口の辺りが嘴のように尖ったマスクを選んだ。中世のペスト医のマスクを精巧に再現したもののようだ。","en":"From among them, I chose a mask that concealed the entire face and projected around the mouth in the shape of a pointed beak. It appeared to be a meticulously made replica of a medieval plague doctor’s mask.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r125","rowIndex":125,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「やはり医師としての矜持か？　そんなもの、ここでは捨てた方がいいぞ」","en":"“Is that your pride as a doctor talking? You’d be better off leaving such things behind in a place like this.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r126","rowIndex":126,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そう言う悪友は、『オペラ座の怪人』で使われるような目元を隠す白い仮面を手にとっている。","en":"As he spoke, my friend himself was holding a white half-mask like the one worn in The Phantom of the Opera.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r127","rowIndex":127,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「私はこれでいい」","en":"“This will do for me.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r128","rowIndex":128,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私がそれを選んだ理由は彼が言うような隠された意図があったわけではない。","en":"I had not chosen it with any hidden intention of the kind he suggested.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r129","rowIndex":129,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　マスクをかぶるには<tips=77>特質変異</tips>のある目を隠すため普段用いているサングラスを外さなくてはならず、マスク自体で瞳を隠せるものは限られている。ペスト医のマスクは目の部分に暗いガラスがはまっておりその用に足りる。そうでなければ目の穴の部分が小さい能面を選ぶしかなく、どちらも好みではないがペスト医の方がマシに思えたというだけのことだ。","en":"To put on a mask, I would have to remove the sunglasses I normally wore to conceal my eyes, which bore a <tips=77>trait mutation</tips>, and few of the available masks hid the eyes themselves. The plague doctor’s mask had dark glass set into its eye sockets and thus served my purpose. My only other choice would have been a Noh mask with very small eyeholes. Neither appealed to me; I merely thought the plague doctor preferable.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r130","rowIndex":130,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「よろしければ、サトウ様と同じプラチナ会員証を発行いたしますがいかがいたしましょう？」","en":"“If you wish, sir, we can issue you the same platinum membership that Mr. Sato holds. How would you like to proceed?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r131","rowIndex":131,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　二人がマスクを被り、準備を整えると、受付がそう質問をした。","en":"Once we had donned our masks and completed our preparations, the receptionist asked me that question.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r132","rowIndex":132,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いや、結構です」","en":"“No, thank you.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r133","rowIndex":133,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私が首を横に振ると、係の者がやって来て、施設へと案内してくれる。","en":"When I shook my head, an attendant approached to guide us into the complex.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r134","rowIndex":134,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あっちが一般会員で、こっちはゴールド以上の会員のための建物だ。そして、こちらのビルの上の方は、プラチナだけしか立ち入ることが出来ないエリアになっている」","en":"“That building is for regular members. This one is for Gold members and above—and the upper floors here form an area that only Platinum members can enter.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r135","rowIndex":135,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　悪友が建物を指さして、そう説明してくれた。","en":"My friend pointed to the buildings as he explained.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r136","rowIndex":136,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「一般会員でも楽しく遊べる場所だが、ゴールドはその上で、プラチナにいたってはもうこの世のものとは思えない……いや、この世だからこそ味わえる遊びが体験出来る」","en":"“Regular members can have plenty of fun, but Gold is another level. And once you reach Platinum, you can enjoy pleasures so otherworldly... No, pleasures possible precisely because they belong to this world.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r137","rowIndex":137,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼はそう言って舌なめずりをした。","en":"He licked his lips as he spoke.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r138","rowIndex":138,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ゴールド・プラチナ会員用の施設は、背の高い方の建物だった。","en":"The facility for Gold and Platinum members occupied the taller building.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r139","rowIndex":139,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　入り口のドアは自動ドアではなく、正装をした従業員が客が入るたびにうやうやしく開けたり閉めたりしている。","en":"The doors at the entrance were not automatic. Instead, formally dressed employees opened and closed them with elaborate deference each time a guest entered.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r140","rowIndex":140,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　建物のなかに一歩足を踏み入れると、柔らかな音楽が私たちを出迎えた。正面には噴水があり、その前に十人ほどの楽団が椅子を並べ、ピアノやヴァイオリンの柔らかな音色を部屋に満たしている。","en":"The moment we stepped inside, gentle music welcomed us. A fountain stood directly ahead, and before it an ensemble of roughly ten musicians sat in rows of chairs, filling the room with the mellow strains of piano and violin.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r141","rowIndex":141,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　一階は広いホールとなっていた。天井は吹き抜け式になっていて、頭上から眩しい光が降り注いでいる。見上げると幾重にもつらなる各階の通路が見え、そこを歩く客や従業員の姿が見えた。上機嫌な酔っ払いの声と、そして女の笑う声がどこからともなく聞こえる。","en":"The first floor formed one vast hall. The ceiling opened into an atrium, from which dazzling light poured down upon us. Looking up, I could see the corridors of every floor rising tier upon tier, and the guests and employees walking along them. Somewhere came the voices of cheerful drunks—and the laughter of women.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r142","rowIndex":142,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　案内係が何か訊ねる前に、悪友は迷わずプラチナ会員用のショーフロアに連れてゆくよう命令する。","en":"Before our guide could ask us anything, my friend unhesitatingly ordered him to take us to the show floor reserved for Platinum members.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r143","rowIndex":143,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「とりあえずショーを見て腹ごしらえをしながら、ここでの遊び方を教えてやる」","en":"“For now, we’ll watch the show and get something in our stomachs. While we’re at it, I’ll explain how things work around here.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r144","rowIndex":144,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうか。しかし、内装が何から何まで悪趣味な赤黒い色なのはなんでだ？　デオキシヘモグロビンみたいな色をしている」","en":"“Very well. But why is every last inch of this décor such a tasteless, blackish red? It’s the color of deoxyhemoglobin.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r145","rowIndex":145,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私の例えに悪友は笑った。","en":"My comparison made my friend laugh.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r146","rowIndex":146,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「薔薇の色のつもりだろうよ。<tips=18>ローズ・クラブ</tips>って言うくらいだからな。ほら見ろ、あそこの模様は薔薇の花じゃないか？」","en":"“I imagine it’s meant to be the color of roses. This is the <tips=18>Rose Club</tips>, after all. Look over there—isn’t that pattern a rose?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r147","rowIndex":147,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　悪友が指さした壁には、確かに赤の濃淡によって何か花びらのようなデザインがなされている。","en":"The wall he indicated did indeed bear a design in varying shades of red that resembled flower petals.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r148","rowIndex":148,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　案内係に先導されるまま、私たちはエレベーターに乗り込んだ。","en":"We followed our guide into an elevator.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r149","rowIndex":149,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　エレベーターも見える部分には木材が用いられたレトロな雰囲気のもので、そこだけ見ると強度に不安がありそうだが、操作パネルを見ると小さく大手メーカーのシンボルマークが刻印されており、中身は信頼出来る機械のようだった。","en":"The visible parts of the elevator were made of wood, lending it a retro air. Judged by appearances alone, its sturdiness might have inspired some concern; but the control panel bore the small stamped emblem of a major manufacturer, suggesting that the machinery beneath the surface could be trusted.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r150","rowIndex":150,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　一階で乗り込むと六階までは止まらず、そこからは一番上の十二階まで、各階に止まるようになっている。おそらく、五階までがゴールド会員のための設備なのだろう。","en":"Boarding on the first floor, we found that the elevator made no stops before the sixth; from there through the top floor, the twelfth, it stopped at every level. Presumably the facilities through the fifth floor were intended for gold members.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r151","rowIndex":151,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちは十階で降りた。","en":"We got off on the tenth floor.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r152","rowIndex":152,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　吹き抜けを取り囲むようにロの字になった回廊を歩く。手すりから下をのぞき込むと、目眩がするような遥か下に噴水と楽団が見えた。","en":"We walked along a square gallery encircling the atrium. When I leaned over the railing, I could see the fountain and ensemble a dizzying distance below.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r153","rowIndex":153,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「では、ごゆっくりお楽しみください」","en":"“Please take your time and enjoy yourselves.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r154","rowIndex":154,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　案内係が開いたドアから部屋に足を踏み入れる。","en":"We stepped through the door our guide had opened.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r155","rowIndex":155,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　中は薄暗く、私の勤務する病院の六人部屋くらいの広さはあった。小学校の教室より少し狭いくらいの部屋と説明した方がわかりやすいか。","en":"The room within was dim and roughly the size of a six-bed ward at my hospital. Perhaps it would be clearer to say it was slightly smaller than an elementary-school classroom.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r156","rowIndex":156,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　正面にはライトアップされたステージがあり、女たちが踊っている。客席にはゆったりと座れるソファーが並べられており、最前列の方はすでに先客が何人かいた。","en":"Directly ahead was an illuminated stage where women were dancing. The audience area was lined with spacious sofas, and several guests had already taken seats toward the very front.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r157","rowIndex":157,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちは一番後ろの席に陣取った。","en":"We claimed seats in the very back.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r158","rowIndex":158,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「何を飲む？」","en":"“What will you have to drink?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r159","rowIndex":159,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　悪友は目の前のローテーブルに置かれたメニューを手に取り私にそう尋ねた。","en":"My friend picked up a menu from the low table in front of us as he asked.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r160","rowIndex":160,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「酒はいらない。水でいい」","en":"“I don’t want alcohol. Water will do.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r161","rowIndex":161,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「炭酸は？」","en":"“Sparkling?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r162","rowIndex":162,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「炭酸入りで」","en":"“Sparkling.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r163","rowIndex":163,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうか。エルセンハムがあるな……」","en":"“I see. They have Elsenham...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r164","rowIndex":164,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　悪友が手を上げると、従業員が静かに席へとやって来る。そして我々は飲み物とオードブルを注文した。","en":"When my friend raised a hand, an employee quietly approached our seats. We ordered drinks and appetizers.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r165","rowIndex":165,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ステージの上では相変わらず女たちが緩やかな音楽に合わせて淫靡な踊りを踊っている。彼女たちの容姿は様々で、肌の黒いもの、白いもの、年齢の下は十代から、上は三十代まで、<tips=9>Y地区</tips>らしくバラエティーに富んでいる。そして、いずれも素晴らしい美貌とスタイルの持ち主であった。","en":"Onstage, the women continued to perform their lewdly suggestive dance to the slow music. Their appearances varied widely: some were dark-skinned, others white, and their ages ranged from the teens to the thirties. In characteristic <tips=9>Y District</tips> fashion, they presented an extraordinary variety. Every one of them, however, possessed both remarkable beauty and an excellent figure.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r166","rowIndex":166,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「みんな数字の入った札がついているな。あの数字でオーダーしろということか」","en":"“They’re all wearing tags with numbers. Are we supposed to order them by number?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r167","rowIndex":167,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「その通り。従業員を呼んで番号を言えば、別室で一晩そいつを楽しむことが出来る。プラチナは基本コースで三人まで女を選べるが、それでも物足りないならオプション料金で何人でも増やせるぜ」","en":"“Exactly. Call an employee and give them the number, and you can enjoy her all night in a private room. The standard Platinum package lets you choose up to three women. If that still isn’t enough, you can add as many as you like for an extra charge.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r168","rowIndex":168,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　悪友は興奮を隠せぬギラギラとした目をステージの上にやりながら、そう言った。","en":"My friend said this with his eyes fixed on the stage, glittering with excitement he could not conceal.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r169","rowIndex":169,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それだけだったら、まあ、よくあるシステムだ。女は上玉とは言え特別というほどじゃない。ここが他と全く違うところはな、他にあるんだ。……ほら、見ろよ。肩に、三日月マークのタトゥーが入っている女がいるだろ？」","en":"“Well, that system by itself is fairly common. The women are choice specimens, granted, but not so extraordinary as all that. What makes this place completely different from the others is something else. ...Here, look. See the woman with the crescent-moon tattoo on her shoulder?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r170","rowIndex":170,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「三日月だかなんだかわからないが、何かついてるやつはいるな」","en":"“I can’t tell whether it’s a crescent moon, but I do see one with something on her shoulder.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r171","rowIndex":171,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あれは、特別オプションをつけられる女だよ」","en":"“That means she’s available for a special option.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r172","rowIndex":172,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「特別オプション？」","en":"“A special option?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r173","rowIndex":173,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そう。あれがついている女はな、文字通り、追加料金さえ支払えば『何をしてもいい』のさ」","en":"“Yes. With any woman wearing that mark, you can pay the additional fee and quite literally ‘do anything you want.’”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r174","rowIndex":174,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　悪友はそう言って、舌なめずりをする。","en":"My friend licked his lips.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r175","rowIndex":175,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「『何をしてもいい』とは？」","en":"“What do you mean, ‘anything you want’?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r176","rowIndex":176,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「言葉通りの意味だよ。思いつく限り、なんでもだ。どんなにアブノーマルなプレーでも、その結果、殺してしまったってかまわない。部屋にはそのための道具も鍵付きの箱にしまわれている。ナイフだとか、ハサミだとか、他にはメスや鉗子などといった、きみのような外科医にうってつけの道具もある……」","en":"“Exactly what the words mean. Anything you can think of. No matter how abnormal the play, even if you end up killing her as a result, it doesn’t matter. The room has tools for that purpose stored in a locked box. Knives, scissors, and even scalpels and forceps—the perfect implements for a surgeon like you...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r177","rowIndex":177,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そんな馬鹿なことがあるか。私をからかっているんだろう？」","en":"“That’s absurd. You’re making fun of me, aren’t you?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r178","rowIndex":178,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「こんな冗談は言わないよ。全部本当のことだ。だからここは特別だって言っているんだよ。見てみろよ、あどけない顔をした幼い子供から、妙齢の美女まで、ああいう女たちを制限なしに玩具に出来るだなんて、考えるだけで震えてくるじゃないか」","en":"“I wouldn’t joke about this. It’s all true. That’s why I told you this place was special. Look at them—from innocent-faced little girls to beautiful women in their prime. Doesn’t the mere thought of turning women like that into toys without any limits send a shiver through you?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r179","rowIndex":179,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……とても信じられないな。君は正気なのか？　私は悪い夢を見ているようだ……」","en":"“...I cannot possibly believe this. Are you in your right mind? I feel as though I must be having a terrible dream...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r180","rowIndex":180,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そこで従業員が飲み物と料理を運んでくる。悪友は自分のビールに手を伸ばすが、私はとても何かを口に入れられる気分ではない。","en":"At that point, an employee brought our drinks and food. My friend reached for his beer, but I was in no state to put anything in my mouth.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r181","rowIndex":181,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「大体、そんなものは商売として成立しない。あの女たちはなぜ命を売ることを了承しているんだ？　いくら高額な報酬を貰ったって割にあわないだろう」","en":"“In the first place, that cannot function as a business. Why have those women agreed to sell their lives? However enormous the payment, it cannot possibly be worth it.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r182","rowIndex":182,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ま、家族か何かに支払われるんだろうな。見ろよあの女どもの顔をさ。みんな自分の運命を知っているはずだが、実に幸せそうににこにこ笑っているじゃないか。お前の力を使えば、その表情が嘘ではないことがわかるはずだ」","en":"“Well, I imagine the money goes to their families or something. Look at their faces. They must all know their fate, but every one of them is smiling away as happily as can be. Use your power, and you ought to know those expressions aren’t false.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r183","rowIndex":183,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「薬か」","en":"“Drugs?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r184","rowIndex":184,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まあそうだな。だが大丈夫、脳みそがドロドロになったような女はいない。そうなったらもっと下のクラスに落ちて、ゴールドや一般会員相手に商売をする。このプラチナには、まったくの手つかずの女だっている。そういう女だって、好きにしていいんだぜ」","en":"“Well, yes. But don’t worry—none of the women here have had their brains reduced to mush. Once that happens, they drop to a lower class and do business with Gold or regular members. Up here in Platinum, some of the women are completely untouched. And you can do whatever you like with them too.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r185","rowIndex":185,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　話を聞いているだけで私は目眩がしてしまう。","en":"Simply listening to him made my head spin.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r186","rowIndex":186,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼の言っていることはおそらく嘘ではないのだろう。この<tips=9>Y地区</tips>には、入国履歴がなく本来この国にいるはずのない外国人や、出生届も出されず書類上には存在しない子供たちが多くいる。そしてその多くはひどく貧しい生活を送っている。","en":"What he was telling me was probably true. <tips=9>Y District</tips> contained many foreigners who had no immigration record and therefore were not officially supposed to be in the country, as well as children whose births had never been registered and who consequently did not exist on paper. Many of these people lived in terrible poverty.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r187","rowIndex":187,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そこから『商品』を調達していると考えれば、どんな無法な契約もありうるような気がする。","en":"If the club procured its “merchandise” from that population, it seemed entirely possible that contracts of any degree of lawlessness might be made.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r188","rowIndex":188,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼らには身元というものが存在しない。だから、後始末さえ念入りに行えば、この密室でどのような運命を辿っても誰も知るよしがない。法的にははじめから存在しない人間が、本当に存在しなくなるだけのことだ。","en":"They possessed no identities that the authorities recognized. So long as the aftermath was handled thoroughly, no one would ever know what fate they met inside the sealed room. A person who had never existed in the eyes of the law would merely cease to exist in reality as well.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r189","rowIndex":189,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「しかしね、いくら<tips=9>Y地区</tips>が無法地帯だからって、こんな商売長続きはしないさ」","en":"“Even so, however lawless <tips=9>Y District</tips> may be, a business like this can’t last.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r190","rowIndex":190,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は嫌悪感をあらわにした。","en":"I made no attempt to hide my disgust.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r191","rowIndex":191,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうかもしれない。しかし、そんなことは関係がないね。今が楽しければそれでいいじゃないか」","en":"“Maybe it can’t. But that has nothing to do with us. If we can enjoy ourselves now, that’s all that matters.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r192","rowIndex":192,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……理解出来ないな。きみは身分証を提示して会員になっている。何かあったときはきみも破滅するぞ」","en":"“...I cannot understand you. You provided identification when you became a member. If anything happens, you will be ruined too.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r193","rowIndex":193,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「大丈夫だよ。ここのプラチナ会員がこの社会にとってどういう立場の人間で構成されているか、お前は知らないだろう？　いまそのあたりのソファーに座ってる連中の仮面を剥がせば、お前が驚くような顔もいくつか出て来るだろうぜ」","en":"“Don’t worry. You don’t know what kind of positions this club’s Platinum members occupy in society, do you? Tear the masks off the men on those sofas, and you’d find more than a few faces that would astonish you.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r194","rowIndex":194,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どんな形で情報が流出するかわからないさ。……とにかく、この場所が私にはあわないのは確かなようだな」","en":"“There is no telling how information might leak... In any event, it seems perfectly clear that this place is not for me.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r195","rowIndex":195,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうかい？」","en":"“You think so?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r196","rowIndex":196,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あまりに人間というものを蹂躙している」","en":"“It violates human dignity far too completely.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r197","rowIndex":197,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「何を言ってるんだ。とんでもない」","en":"“What are you talking about? Absolutely not.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r198","rowIndex":198,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　悪友は肩をすくめた。","en":"My friend shrugged.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r199","rowIndex":199,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ただのビジネスだよ。女も納得済みだ。彼女たちはどんな形であれ、最終的には自分で判断してこの施設で働いている。相当な金を支払われているんだろうよ。それを蹂躙というのは、あまりにも失礼だ。きみこそ、本人の意志というものを軽視しすぎているのではないか？」","en":"“It’s just business. The women agreed to the terms. However they came to it, in the end they judged for themselves and chose to work at this establishment. I expect they’re being paid a considerable amount. Calling that a violation is much too disrespectful. Aren’t you the one making too little of what they themselves decided?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r200","rowIndex":200,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「自分で納得しているって、なぜそんなことがわかる」","en":"“How could you possibly know they agreed to it?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r201","rowIndex":201,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私の問いに悪友は目を細め、少し笑う。","en":"My friend narrowed his eyes at my question and gave a slight smile.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r202","rowIndex":202,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして皿の生ハムを一枚つまみ取り、口に放り込んで咀嚼し、ビールで流し込んだ。","en":"Then he plucked a slice of prosciutto from a plate, tossed it into his mouth, chewed, and washed it down with beer.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r203","rowIndex":203,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……おれはねえ、ここのオーナーの<tips=60>ロジャー・アダムス</tips>とはね、この店を作る前からつき合いがあるのさ」","en":"“You see, I’ve known the owner of this place, <tips=60>Roger Adams</tips>, since before he opened it.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r204","rowIndex":204,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「お前……」","en":"“You...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r205","rowIndex":205,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「誤解するな。おかしな仕事をしていたってわけじゃない。おれの……いや、おれたちの本業でのつき合いだよ。お前は知ってるかどうかわからんが、我々の仕事だって、ここの女たちのような存在がいなければ成立しないんだぜ？」","en":"“Don’t get the wrong idea. I wasn’t involved in some shady line of work. I knew him through my... no, through our regular profession. I don’t know whether you realize it, but our work couldn’t function without people like the women here, either.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r206","rowIndex":206,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どういうことだ？」","en":"“What do you mean?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r207","rowIndex":207,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　悪友はすぐには答えず、まず新しいビールを注文した。","en":"Rather than answer at once, my friend first ordered another beer.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r208","rowIndex":208,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=60>ロジャー・アダムス</tips>という男はね、元々は臓器売買の仲介人だったのさ」","en":"“<tips=60>Roger Adams</tips> originally worked as a middleman in the organ trade.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r209","rowIndex":209,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼はスモークサーモンのマリネを玉ねぎと一緒にフォークに突き刺し、口に放り込む。","en":"He speared a slice of marinated smoked salmon together with some onion and popped them into his mouth.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r210","rowIndex":210,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして咀嚼しながら話を続ける。","en":"He continued speaking as he chewed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r211","rowIndex":211,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「現在、多数の生体移植手術が行われているが、どう考えたってドナーが足りない。ドナー数と手術数を詳しく調べれば帳尻があっていないことはすぐにわかるはずだ。お前だって、自分の扱う内臓が全部まともな経緯で手術室にやって来たなんて、信じていたわけじゃないだろう？」","en":"“A great many living-donor transplants are performed today, but by any reckoning, there aren’t enough donors. If you compared the donor count with the number of operations in detail, you’d see at once that the figures don’t add up. You never actually believed that every organ you handled reached the operating room through legitimate channels, did you?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r212","rowIndex":212,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼の言うことは間違いではない。","en":"He was not wrong.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r213","rowIndex":213,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ミュータントが増加するようになってから内部畸形も増えているし、それまでには起こりえなかった正体不明の疾患も増えている。臓器売買、そして人身売買は最も非人間的な犯罪の一つではあるが、圧倒的な需要の増加と、世界的な富の不均衡が加速した結果、モラルが実質に押し切られるかたちになった。貧しい地域から富裕国への人身売買は非常に大規模に、かつ組織的に行われ、中世以来の奴隷貿易時代が訪れたと言われている。","en":"As mutants had grown more numerous, so too had internal deformities, along with mysterious diseases that could never have arisen before. Organ trafficking and human trafficking were among the most inhuman of crimes, yet the overwhelming growth in demand and the accelerating global imbalance of wealth had forced morality to yield to material reality. Human trafficking from impoverished regions into wealthy nations was now conducted on a vast scale and in a highly organized fashion. It was said that an age of slave trading not seen since the Middle Ages had returned.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r214","rowIndex":214,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼の語る内臓の流れは、はっきり証拠立てるものこそないが、業界では暗黙の了解となっていた。","en":"There was no hard evidence for the flow of organs he described, but it was an open secret in the profession.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r215","rowIndex":215,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして、この<tips=18>ローズ・クラブ</tips>のオーナーも、かつてはこの臓器売買に携わっていたのだと悪友は言った。<tips=9>Y地区</tips>の貧民の子などを買い取って医療機関に売っていたのだと。","en":"My disreputable friend said that the owner of the <tips=18>Rose Club</tips> had once been involved in the organ trade as well. He had bought children of the poor in <tips=9>Y District</tips>, among others, and sold them to medical institutions.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r216","rowIndex":216,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「日本の他の地域ではありえないがね。この街ならではだよ。書類に記録されていない子供だらけだからね」","en":"“It couldn’t happen anywhere else in Japan. It’s unique to this city. It’s full of children who don’t exist on paper.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r217","rowIndex":217,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「じゃあ、もしかして、きみの病院でも？」","en":"“Then... could your hospital be doing it too?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r218","rowIndex":218,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私がそう訊ねると、","en":"When I asked him that question, he replied—","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r219","rowIndex":219,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それはノーコメントだ。でも、そうだとしても罪の意識は感じないね。世界中の病院で行われていることさ。お前の病院でもね」","en":"“No comment. But even if that were the case, I wouldn’t feel guilty about it. It happens in hospitals all over the world. Yours included.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r220","rowIndex":220,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　悪友は悪びれもせずに笑った。","en":"My friend laughed without a hint of shame.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r221","rowIndex":221,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そんなに青筋立てて怒るようなことじゃないんだ。すべてのビジネスに光の部分と闇の部分があるように、このシステムにだって良いところと悪いところがある。……そりゃ泣き叫ぶ子供を無理矢理さらってろくに金も払わないようなのは最悪だが、事実はそうじゃない。そんな闇の部分ばかり想像してしまうのは実態を知らないだけだ。……そうだな、たとえば、ここに金持ちの一人娘が死にかけていて……」","en":"“This isn’t something to get so furious about that the veins stand out on your forehead. Just as every business has its light and dark sides, this system has good points and bad ones... Of course, forcibly abducting screaming children without even paying properly is the worst of it, but that isn’t the reality. You imagine nothing but the dark side only because you don’t know how it actually works... Let’s see. Suppose, for example, that the only daughter of a wealthy family lies dying...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r222","rowIndex":222,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　悪友はピスタチオを一粒つまみ、テーブルの上に置く。","en":"My friend picked up a single pistachio and placed it on the table.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r223","rowIndex":223,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「もう一方で、食うや食わずの貧乏大家族がいるとしよう」","en":"“And on the other side, suppose we have a large, impoverished family barely managing to eat.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r224","rowIndex":224,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　今度は一掴みピスタチオをとると、先に置いたものの隣に盛る。","en":"This time, he took a handful of pistachios and piled them beside the first.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r225","rowIndex":225,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「貧乏大家族は貧しいくせに子供ばかりつくってお先真っ暗だ。このままじゃ全員で首をくくるか犯罪に手を染めるしかない。教育なんてもっての他だ。その一方で、金持ちの子供もひどい病気で、このままだったら死ぬ」","en":"“The poor family keeps having children despite being poor, and their future is utterly bleak. At this rate, the only choices left to them are for the whole family to hang themselves or to turn to crime. Education is out of the question. Meanwhile, the rich child is gravely ill and will die if nothing is done.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r226","rowIndex":226,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼は金持ちの子供をあらわす一粒の方のピスタチオの殻を割って食べた。","en":"He cracked open and ate the lone pistachio representing the rich family’s child.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r227","rowIndex":227,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「売買をしなければこの娘の命は失われてしまう。しかし、ここで移植手術によって貧乏の子供の命を使って、金持ちの方を助けたとしよう」","en":"“Without the transaction, this girl’s life will be lost. But suppose that, through a transplant, we use the life of one of the poor children to save the rich one.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r228","rowIndex":228,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　山盛りにしたピスタチオのひとつを、さっき食べてしまった一粒のピスタチオがあった場所に置く。","en":"He took one pistachio from the mound and placed it where the lone pistachio he had eaten had been.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r229","rowIndex":229,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「この場合、失われる命の数は一つ。同じなんだよ。けれど、貧しい家族は充分な報酬を得て、生活レベルは上がるし、医療も受けられて、子供たちに教育も与えられる。つまり、富の均衡化が行われるわけだ。しかも、実際には助かる命は一人とは限らない。一つの遺体で生まれる内臓はいくつもあるわけだからね。適合するレシピエントがいれば、何人もの命を助けられる。すると、命の総数は売買をしなかった時よりも増えるわけだ」","en":"“In that case, the number of lives lost is one—the same as before. But the poor family receives ample compensation, raising their standard of living, gaining access to medical care, and securing educations for their children. In other words, wealth is redistributed. And in reality, the donor’s organs need not save only one life. A single body yields many organs, after all. If there are compatible recipients, several people can be saved. The total number of lives is then greater than it would have been without the transaction.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r230","rowIndex":230,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼は三粒ほど新しいピスタチオを、『金持ちの娘』のピスタチオのそばに並べる。","en":"He arranged three new pistachios beside the one representing the rich man’s daughter.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r231","rowIndex":231,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「もちろん移植手術が必ず成功するとは限らないが、それでも今は昔より大分進歩している。冒険的なオペばかりを繰り返すというような事態でなければ充分生命の収支はプラスになるだろう。……なあ<tips=5>太刀川</tips>よ。これは本当に『悪』なのかい？　そりゃ人権的には問題があるのかもしれないが、その『人権』ってやつは、この状況でもっと良い解決策を提示してくれるのかい？　よりたくさんの命が救われる選択肢があるのならば、それを選択するのは医師のつとめじゃないか？　お前はなんのために医師をしている？　一つでも多くの命を救うためじゃないのか？」","en":"“Of course, transplant surgery does not always succeed, but it has advanced considerably since the old days. Unless all that is being done is one risky operation after another, the balance of lives should still come out well in the black... Tell me, <tips=5>Tachikawa</tips>. Is this really ‘evil’? There may be a problem in terms of human rights, but will these ‘human rights’ offer a better solution to this situation? If there is a choice that will save more lives, isn’t it a doctor’s duty to make it? What are you a doctor for? To save as many lives as you can, isn’t it?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r232","rowIndex":232,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼はにやにやと笑いながら私の目を見つめる。私は能力で人の感情や気持ちを相手の意志に関わらず読み取ってしまうので、普段は人の目を見ないようにしているのだが、うっかりその目を見てしまった。すぐに目を離したが、その感情に触れてしまった。","en":"He stared into my eyes with a smirk. Because my ability causes me to read people's emotions and feelings whether they wish it or not, I ordinarily try not to look anyone in the eye. This time, however, I carelessly met his gaze. I looked away at once, but I had already come into contact with his emotion.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r233","rowIndex":233,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼の心は悲痛な憤りに満ちていた。","en":"What I felt in him was anguished indignation.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r234","rowIndex":234,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「もちろん、クソみたいな業者は数多く存在するから、そいつらから買えばすべての前提は崩れる。だからおれは信頼のおける業者を探した。そこで出会ったのが<tips=60>ロジャー・アダムス</tips>というわけだ」","en":"“Of course, there are plenty of shit brokers out there, and if you buy from one of them, every premise I’ve laid out falls apart. That’s why I went looking for a broker I could trust. And that is how I met <tips=60>Roger Adams</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r235","rowIndex":235,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼は私の目を見るのをやめて、ソファーの背もたれに身体をあずける。","en":"He stopped looking into my eyes and leaned back against the sofa.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r236","rowIndex":236,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「彼は非常にスマートでフェアなビジネスをする男だ。ここにいる女たちもビジネスのためにいるのだろう。だからおれは、ここの女たちにおかしな同情をする気はないね。……ふん、納得出来ないってツラしてるな。それなら、三日月マークの女を一人指名して、そのご自慢の『目』を使って感情をのぞきながら話でも聞いたらどうだ？　別に、マークがあるからって殺さなきゃいけないわけじゃないし、お前が指名すれば少なくとも今夜は死なないですむ」","en":"“He’s a very sharp operator, and he does business fairly. I expect these women are here for business too. So I have no intention of wasting any strange sympathy on them... Hmph. You’ve got a look on your face that says you’re not convinced. In that case, why not choose one of the women with a crescent mark and hear her story while you use those precious ‘eyes’ you’re so proud of to look into her feelings? The mark doesn’t mean you have to kill her. If you choose her, at least she won’t have to die tonight.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r237","rowIndex":237,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　悪友はそのあと女を三人指名して、別室へ消えて行った。","en":"Afterward, my friend selected three women and disappeared into another room.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r238","rowIndex":238,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は一人残され、女たちのショーを眺めながら考えた。先ほど踊っていた女たちは退場し、全く違うメンツになっている。三日月マークは三人。彼女たちは、どんな過程を経てここにやって来たのだろうか。","en":"Left alone, I watched the women’s show and considered the matter. The dancers from before had left the stage, replaced by an entirely different group. Three bore crescent marks. What path had brought them to this place?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r239","rowIndex":239,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　瓶で来たミネラルウォーターを、グラスに注いで一口飲んだ。","en":"I poured some of the bottled mineral water into a glass and took a sip.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r240","rowIndex":240,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　悪友が臓器移植について語っていたことは、事実としては間違いではない。どこの病院でも入手先のわからぬ内臓を使った移植手術を繰り返している。人身売買のシンジケートは確実に存在するし、それを支持する人間も少なくないと聞く。","en":"In strictly factual terms, what my friend had said about organ transplantation was not wrong. Hospitals everywhere repeatedly performed transplant operations with organs of unknown provenance. Human-trafficking syndicates unquestionably existed, and I had heard that no small number of people supported them.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r241","rowIndex":241,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼なりに悩んだ上でこうした結論を下したのだろう。","en":"He had presumably reached his conclusion only after wrestling with the question in his own way.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r242","rowIndex":242,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　悪友の考え方は理屈としてわからないでもない。ただ私には、単純に肯定することも否定することも難しい。","en":"It was not that I could not understand the logic of my friend's position. Yet I found it difficult either simply to accept it or simply to reject it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r243","rowIndex":243,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　もし私が臓器を摘出する立場の医師だったとしたら、目の前の健康な人間を自分の手で殺すということは不可能であるように思われた。それで、助かる筈の何人かをむざむざと殺す結果になろうともだ。","en":"If I were the physician responsible for extracting the organs, I did not think I could kill a healthy person before my eyes with my own hands—even if my refusal meant needlessly allowing several people who could have been saved to die.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r244","rowIndex":244,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しかし、少し条件をかえてみよう。","en":"But let us change the conditions slightly.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r245","rowIndex":245,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　例えば私の最愛の人間が死を目前にしているとして、それを救うためには売買された臓器を使うしかなかったとしたらどうだろう？　その時私は、どこかの見知らぬ、なんの罪もない人物の命を守るため、金さえ払えば手に入る臓器を拒否して愛する人を見捨てることが出来るだろうか？","en":"But suppose the person I loved most stood on the brink of death, and the only way to save that person was to use an organ that had been bought and sold. When the time came, could I refuse an organ that could be had merely by paying for it, abandon the person I loved, and do so to protect the life of some innocent stranger somewhere?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r246","rowIndex":246,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その場合、私は臓器を摘出してしまうかもしれない。結局、私という人間は感情によって結論が変わるのだ。","en":"In that case, I might go through with extracting the organs. In the end, I was the sort of person whose conclusions changed with his emotions.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r247","rowIndex":247,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　自分が想像以上に非理性的な人間であることを自覚しないわけにはいかなかった。だから、悪友の言葉を肯定も否定もする権利はないように思えた。","en":"I was forced to recognize that I was far less rational than I had imagined. Therefore, I felt I had no right either to affirm or to deny my friend’s words.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r248","rowIndex":248,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「気にいった子がいないなら、アルバムでもお持ちしましょうか？」","en":"“If none of the girls appeal to you, shall I bring you an album?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r249","rowIndex":249,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　考え込んでいると、従業員が話しかけてきた。","en":"As I sat lost in thought, an employee addressed me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r250","rowIndex":250,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いえ、結構」","en":"“No, thank you.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r251","rowIndex":251,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ステージに目を移す。女たちが踊り続けている。誰かが指名をすると踊りをやめてステージ脇からはけてゆく。そして指名客も係員に案内されて部屋を出てゆく。","en":"I turned my gaze to the stage. The women continued to dance. Whenever someone selected one, she stopped dancing and left through the wings. The patron who had selected her was then escorted from the room by an attendant.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r252","rowIndex":252,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　悪友はフェアなビジネスだと言っていたが、ここで遊ぶということ関しては私ははっきりと否定的だ。","en":"My friend had called it a fair business, but as for indulging in the club's pleasures myself, my answer was an unequivocal no.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r253","rowIndex":253,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　理屈はどうあれ、ここで私が客として割り切って何かを楽しむというのは不可能だ。","en":"Whatever the reasoning might be, I could not put it all aside, regard myself as merely a customer, and take pleasure in anything this place offered.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r254","rowIndex":254,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は席をたった。","en":"I rose from my seat.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r255","rowIndex":255,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「お気に召しませんでしたか？　よろしければ、他のお部屋で別のお遊びもございますが。もし女性がお気に召さなければ、男性も様々なタイプのキャストが控えておりますが？」","en":"“Was the show not to your liking? If you wish, we offer other diversions in our other rooms. And if the women do not appeal to you, we have male cast members of many different types standing by.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r256","rowIndex":256,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　話しかける係員に私は無言で手を振って通り過ぎ、部屋を出る。","en":"I waved the attendant aside without a word, passed him, and left the room.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r257","rowIndex":257,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　手すりにもたれかかって吹き抜けを上から見下ろす。一階ホールの楽団が豆粒のように小さく見えるが、その音楽はこの場所まで届いてこない。","en":"I leaned against the railing and looked down into the atrium from above. The musicians in the first-floor hall looked no larger than grains, yet their music did not carry as far as where I stood.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r258","rowIndex":258,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は溜息をつき、ゆっくりとエレベーターの方へ歩き始めた。","en":"I sighed and began walking slowly toward the elevator.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r259","rowIndex":259,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　すると、横の廊下から突然ドレスを着た白い髪の少女がよろけるようにして飛び出して来る。","en":"Just then, a white-haired girl in a dress came bursting out of a side corridor, staggering as she ran.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r260","rowIndex":260,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女は床に膝をつき、私を見上げた。そして、不覚にも目が合った。彼女の真っ青な瞳から感情が流れ込む。","en":"She dropped to her knees on the floor and looked up at me. Before I could stop myself, our eyes met. Emotion came flooding into me from her deep-blue eyes.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r261","rowIndex":261,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それは、強烈な恐怖だった。そして顔にも同じ表情が浮かんでいる。","en":"It was overwhelming terror. The same emotion showed plainly on her face.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r262","rowIndex":262,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ミドルティーンだろうか？　やせたあどけない少女で、白い髪と白い肌、高い鼻を中心とした顔立ちはアジア人のものではない。そして、剥き出しになったその肩には、はっきりと黒い三日月のマークが刻印されていた。","en":"Perhaps she was in her mid-teens. She was a thin, innocent-looking girl. Her white hair, white skin, and high-bridged nose gave her features that were not Asian. And on her bare shoulder, a black crescent mark had been unmistakably branded.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r263","rowIndex":263,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「おい！」","en":"“Hey!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r264","rowIndex":264,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　廊下の向こうから男の怒声と、ドタバタとした足音がきこえた。","en":"An angry male voice and a clatter of footsteps sounded from farther down the corridor.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r265","rowIndex":265,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は咄嗟に少女の手を引いて、別の通路に隠れた。足音は私たちの居場所を通り過ぎて走り去ってゆく。","en":"Acting on instinct, I pulled the girl by the hand and hid with her in another passage. The footsteps raced past our hiding place and receded.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r266","rowIndex":266,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「何をされた？」","en":"“What was done to you?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r267","rowIndex":267,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　雨に濡れた子猫のように身体を震わせる少女に声をかけたが、彼女は返事が出来ない。","en":"I spoke to the girl as she trembled like a rain-soaked kitten, but she was unable to answer.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r268","rowIndex":268,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　目を見ると、恐怖と絶望感の他に、何か胸が痛むような苦しみがあるのを感じた。","en":"When I looked into her eyes, beyond the terror and despair I felt another anguish that made my chest ache.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r269","rowIndex":269,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして彼女は私の手を払って、また廊下へ出ようとする。その肩をつかんで引き留めた。","en":"Then she knocked my hand away and tried to step into the corridor again. I caught her by the shoulder and held her back.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r270","rowIndex":270,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「戻るつもりか？」","en":"“Are you going back?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r271","rowIndex":271,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……仕事をしないと怒られちゃう」","en":"“...If I don't do my job, I'll get in trouble.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アサヒ","displayName":"Asahi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r272","rowIndex":272,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　少女は怯えたままだった。踊っていた女たちは麻薬を投与されていたはずだ。この子はその投与を忘れているのか、効果が切れたのか、素肌の感情でそこにいる。","en":"The girl remained frightened. The dancers were supposed to have been administered narcotics. Perhaps this girl had missed her dose, or its effects had worn off; she stood before me with her emotions entirely unmasked.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r273","rowIndex":273,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　つかんだ肩に、ぬるりと感触がある。それは汗ではなく血液だった。","en":"The shoulder beneath my hand felt slick. It was not sweat, but blood.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r274","rowIndex":274,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「戻ったって、ひどいことをされるだけだろ？」","en":"“If you go back, you'll only have more terrible things done to you.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r275","rowIndex":275,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いいの。そのために、お金を沢山もらって、すごい贅沢をさせてもらったから……」","en":"“It’s all right. They paid me lots of money for it, and let me live in incredible luxury...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アサヒ","displayName":"Asahi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r276","rowIndex":276,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　少女は唇をかむ。","en":"The girl bit her lip.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r277","rowIndex":277,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ここにいたら、いくら金をもらったって使えない」","en":"“No matter how much they pay you, you cannot spend it if you remain here.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r278","rowIndex":278,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「お父さんとお母さんが使うから」","en":"“My father and mother will use it.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アサヒ","displayName":"Asahi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r279","rowIndex":279,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そう言って目を伏せる。その心にゆらめきがあった。","en":"She lowered her eyes as she spoke. Something wavered within her.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r280","rowIndex":280,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「両親と仲が良いわけじゃないんだな……義理の親か？」","en":"“You aren’t close to your parents... Are they your adoptive parents?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r281","rowIndex":281,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　少女は表情を硬くこわばらせたまま何も答えないが、その感情の動揺は伝わって来る。","en":"The girl said nothing, her expression rigid, but I felt agitation pass through her.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r282","rowIndex":282,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうか。親に売られたのか。……ふむ、確かに納得してここには来たらしい。義理の両親に虐待されていたんだな？　それに引き替え、ここでの生活は豊かで、みな優しかったと……」","en":"“I see. So your parents sold you. Hmm... It does seem that you agreed to come here. Your adoptive parents had abused you, hadn’t they? Whereas life here was comfortable, and everyone treated you kindly...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r283","rowIndex":283,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　少女は何も言わないが、筒抜けの感情を観察しながら投げかける私の言葉に驚きと困惑を感じている。","en":"The girl said nothing, but as I watched the emotions that lay completely open to me and put these suggestions to her, I could feel her surprise and confusion.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r284","rowIndex":284,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「私は目を見ればなんでもわかるんだ。きみが本当はここを逃げ出したいってこともね」","en":"“I can tell anything by looking into a person’s eyes. Including the fact that you truly want to escape this place.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r285","rowIndex":285,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ち、違う……」","en":"“Th-That’s not true...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アサヒ","displayName":"Asahi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r286","rowIndex":286,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　少女の目から涙があふれ落ちた。","en":"Tears spilled from the girl’s eyes.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r287","rowIndex":287,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その感情の高ぶりは、私の胸にもダイレクトに伝わり、思わず同じように涙をこぼしそうになる。これがあるから、私はみだりに能力を使うことが出来ないのだ。覗いた相手の感情が、自分の感情になってしまう。自分を変えてしまう。","en":"The surge of her emotion transmitted itself directly into my chest, and I nearly began to weep with her. This was why I could not use my ability indiscriminately. The emotions of the person whose heart I peered into became my own. They changed me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r288","rowIndex":288,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は胸に手を当て、彼女から受け取った激しい感情を抑えつけながら口を開いた。","en":"I pressed a hand to my chest and spoke while struggling to suppress the intense emotion I had received from her.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r289","rowIndex":289,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ちょうどいいタイミングだ。私はいま決めたばかりなんだ。賢く生きようとするのはやめて、ただ自分に正直に生きようとね。もっとも、振り返ってみると私は今まで一度も賢くはなかったようだが」","en":"“Your timing is perfect. I have only just made a decision: I am done trying to live sensibly. From now on, I will simply live true to myself. Though looking back, it seems I have never once been particularly sensible.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r290","rowIndex":290,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は冷や汗をかきながら、無理矢理自嘲じみた笑みを浮かべる。少女は顔を上げた。","en":"I broke out in a cold sweat and forced a self-mocking smile onto my face. The girl looked up.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r291","rowIndex":291,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「私はきみをここから脱出させる。それがきみにとって幸福かどうかは知らないが、私に会ってしまったのが運の尽きだ。私は臨床医で、目の前の人間を助けるのが自分の役割だと考えている」","en":"“I will get you out of here. I cannot say whether that will make you happy, but your luck ran out when you encountered me. I am a clinician, and I believe my role is to save the person before me.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r292","rowIndex":292,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　向こうからまたドタドタと足音が聞こえて来る。","en":"Another clatter of footsteps came from the other direction.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r293","rowIndex":293,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「おい、女が逃げたんだ。まったくこの店は……」","en":"“Hey, the woman ran away. Honestly, this place...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r294","rowIndex":294,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　今度は従業員を伴って引き返して来たらしい。","en":"The man now seemed to be returning with an employee.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r295","rowIndex":295,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は困惑する少女の腕を引いて駆け出すと、通路のさらに奥に進む。","en":"I seized the bewildered girl by the arm and broke into a run, leading her deeper into the passage.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r296","rowIndex":296,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　アクション映画じみたことをするのは柄じゃないが、目が合ってしまったのだから仕方が無い。目の前の人間の苦しみに触れてしまったのだ。","en":"This sort of action-movie behavior was hardly in character for me, but once our eyes had met, there was nothing else I could do. I had come into contact with the suffering of the person before me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r297","rowIndex":297,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　この厳重な警備のなかからどうやって抜け出す？　何も考えないで行動をしてしまった。あまりにも愚かだろう。しかし、これが私なのだ！","en":"How were we to escape security this tight? I had acted without thinking at all. It was far too foolish. But this was who I was!","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r298","rowIndex":298,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は心のなかの悪友に向かってそう叫びつつ、目の前のドアを開けた。","en":"With that cry directed at the version of my disreputable friend inside my mind, I opened the door in front of me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r299","rowIndex":299,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　よく確認せずに入ってしまったが、そこは男子トイレのようだった。正面に大きな鏡があり、洗面台がある。そしてそこには、一人の男がこちらに背を向けて立っていた。","en":"I had gone in without checking carefully, but it appeared to be a men's restroom. Directly ahead were a large mirror and the sinks. A man stood there with his back to us.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r300","rowIndex":300,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「失礼。プレイルームだと思いましてね」","en":"“Pardon us. I mistook this for a playroom.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r301","rowIndex":301,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は誤魔化しのつもりで冷静を装ってそう言った。男は背中を見せたまま振り返らない。かと思うと、洗面所に顔を突っ込んで、絞め殺される山羊のような声をあげた。吐いているようだ。","en":"Intending to bluff my way through, I spoke with an outward calm. The man kept his back to us and did not turn. Then he bent over a sink and gave a cry like a goat being strangled. Apparently, he was vomiting.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r302","rowIndex":302,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どうしました？　ご気分でも悪いのですか？」","en":"“Is something wrong? Are you feeling ill?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r303","rowIndex":303,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　あの客が遠くへ行くまでここで少し時間稼ぎがしたかった私は、心配するふりをした。","en":"I wanted to stall here for a short while until that patron had gone some distance, so I feigned concern.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r304","rowIndex":304,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いや……」","en":"“No...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r305","rowIndex":305,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　男は言葉を口にしかけてから、もう一度吐き、それから蛇口の水で口元を洗ったあと、振り返った。","en":"The man began to speak, vomited once more, then rinsed his mouth with water from the faucet before turning around.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r306","rowIndex":306,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なに、いやなものを見てね」","en":"“I simply saw something unpleasant.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー（過去・青年）","displayName":"Chris Tse (Past, Young)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r307","rowIndex":307,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そう微笑した顔を見て、私は驚いた。","en":"When I saw the face smiling as he said this, I was startled.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r308","rowIndex":308,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ひっ」","en":"“Ah!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アサヒ","displayName":"Asahi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r309","rowIndex":309,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　と後ろの少女も小さく悲鳴を上げる。","en":"The girl behind me gave a small shriek as well.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r310","rowIndex":310,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　振り向いたその顔には、三つの目があったのである。","en":"The face he turned toward us had three eyes.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r311","rowIndex":311,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その男は仮面をしていなかった。年は私とさほど変わらないだろう。二十代後半か、いっても三十になるかどうかといったといったところだ。髪をオールバックになで付けて、精悍な顔立ちをしていた。すらりとした身体はラフな服でも見栄え良く着こなし、両方の目は強い意志で輝いており、一目見ただけでも並々ならぬ自信があることがわかる。男からも女からも好感を持たれる魅力的な容姿と態度を備えていると言っていいだろう。","en":"The man was not wearing a mask. He appeared to be not much different from me in age—his late twenties, perhaps, and scarcely thirty even at the upper limit. His hair was slicked straight back, and his features were lean and forceful. Tall and slender, he managed to look good even in casual clothes. Both of his ordinary eyes shone with a powerful will, and a single glance was enough to tell that he possessed no ordinary degree of confidence. In both appearance and manner, it would be fair to call him an attractive man whom men and women alike would find likable.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r312","rowIndex":312,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ただし、額にある第三の目だけが彼を異様な存在にしていた。","en":"Only the third eye in his forehead made him an uncanny presence.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r313","rowIndex":313,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=16>タイプA</tips>の方ですか」","en":"“Are you <tips=16>Type A</tips>?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r314","rowIndex":314,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私が言うと、","en":"In response to my question, he replied,","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r315","rowIndex":315,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「おっと、失礼」","en":"“Oh—pardon me.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー（過去・青年）","displayName":"Chris Tse (Past, Young)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r316","rowIndex":316,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼は洗面台に置いてあった仮面を一度手に取ったが、今更意味がないと感じたのか、苦笑して元の位置に戻した。","en":"He picked up the mask lying on the sink, then apparently realized the gesture was meaningless by now. With a rueful smile, he set it back where it had been.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r317","rowIndex":317,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私はこの男の目を見た。彼の胸には、私たちに対する疑念や困惑よりも、別の何かに対する強い意志や怒りが渦巻いていた。","en":"I looked into the man’s eyes. More than any suspicion or confusion toward us, I felt powerful resolve and anger directed at something else.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r318","rowIndex":318,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　この施設に似つかわしくない興味深い感情だった。少なくとも、遊びに来た人間のもつ感情ではない。そして、人間性も独特のものがある。","en":"They were intriguing emotions, singularly out of place in this establishment—certainly not the emotions of a man who had come here for amusement. There was something distinctive in his character as well.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r319","rowIndex":319,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　実際の表情と相手の内心の感情を照らし合わせることで、瞬間的な接触でも相手の人間性をある程度正確につかむことが出来るのだが、この男からは少年じみた率直な何かを感じ取ることが出来た。幼いという意味ではない。","en":"By comparing a person’s outward expression with the emotions inside them, I can grasp something of their character with a degree of accuracy even in a momentary contact. From this man, I felt a certain boyish candor. I do not mean immaturity.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r320","rowIndex":320,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　が、あまり見つめているとまた私の感情が彼と同化してしまいそうだったので、すぐに目をそらす。","en":"But if I continued staring, my emotions seemed liable to merge with his again, so I quickly looked away.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r321","rowIndex":321,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どうやら、酒の飲み過ぎというわけでもないらしいですね」","en":"“It appears this isn't simply a matter of your having drunk too much.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r322","rowIndex":322,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私が言うと、彼は頷き、","en":"When I said this, he nodded and replied,","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r323","rowIndex":323,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まあね。でも、酒よりひどいものに触れたよ。ここで天国みたいな思いをする連中もいるんだろうが、おれからすれば地獄そのものだ。天国と地獄というのは全く同じものなんだぜ。あんたに言ってもわかりゃしないだろうが」","en":"“Something like that. But I've come into contact with something worse than alcohol. I suppose there are people who feel as though they're in heaven here, but to me this is hell itself. Heaven and hell are exactly the same thing, you know. Not that you'd understand if I told you.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー（過去・青年）","displayName":"Chris Tse (Past, Young)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r324","rowIndex":324,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その言葉には、私に対する敵意がいくらか含まれているようだった。","en":"His words seemed to carry a measure of hostility toward me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r325","rowIndex":325,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いや、同感です。とてもこんな場所は受け入れられない」","en":"“No, I agree with you. I cannot accept a place like this.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r326","rowIndex":326,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「何を言ってる。あんたもその子とこれからお楽しみなんだろ？　さっさとプレイルームとやらに行ったらどうだ？」","en":"“What are you talking about? You’re about to have your fun with that girl too, aren’t you? Hurry up and get to your ‘playroom.’”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー（過去・青年）","displayName":"Chris Tse (Past, Young)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r327","rowIndex":327,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼は吐き捨てるように言って笑う。","en":"He delivered the words with contempt, then laughed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r328","rowIndex":328,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それは嘘です。私はプレイルームを探していたのではなく、一時避難する場所としてこのドアを開いたんですよ」","en":"“That was a lie. I wasn't looking for a playroom when I opened this door. I merely needed somewhere to hide for a while.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r329","rowIndex":329,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どういうことだ？」","en":"“What do you mean?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー（過去・青年）","displayName":"Chris Tse (Past, Young)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r330","rowIndex":330,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「廊下を歩いていたら、この子が真っ青な顔で目の前に飛び出して来たので、逃がしてやろうと思いましてね。そしたら、客と従業員が探しに来て……」","en":"“I was walking down the corridor when this girl ran out in front of me, white as a sheet, so I decided to help her escape. Then the patron and an employee came looking for her...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r331","rowIndex":331,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私が説明をすると、彼は怪訝そうに首をひねる。","en":"When I explained what had happened, he cocked his head with a puzzled expression.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r332","rowIndex":332,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「しかし、冷静に考えてみると一人でこの子を連れて脱出するのはなかなか難しい。良かったら、手伝ってくれませんか？」","en":"“However, now that I consider the matter calmly, it will be rather difficult to get this girl out by myself. If you don't mind, would you help me?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r333","rowIndex":333,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「おれが？」","en":"“Me?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー（過去・青年）","displayName":"Chris Tse (Past, Young)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r334","rowIndex":334,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうです」","en":"“Yes.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r335","rowIndex":335,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は頷いた。","en":"I nodded.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r336","rowIndex":336,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「不躾なお願いですが、他意はありません。ただ私は、この子があのタイミングで飛び出して来たのが何か運命のような気がして……」","en":"“I realize this is an impertinent request, but I have no ulterior motive. I simply feel that her running out at that exact moment was somehow fate...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r337","rowIndex":337,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あははは！」","en":"“Ahahahaha!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー（過去・青年）","displayName":"Chris Tse (Past, Young)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r338","rowIndex":338,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼は突如として哄笑し、声が狭いトイレのなかで反響する。","en":"He suddenly roared with laughter, his voice echoing around the cramped restroom.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r339","rowIndex":339,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あんたはおかしなヤツだな。悪くない。おれもちょうど胸くそ悪くて、ひとつくらい土産が欲しかったところだ。じゃあ、あんたは……」","en":"“You're a strange one. I don't dislike it. I was already sick to my stomach, and I'd been wanting at least one souvenir to take away from this place. So you...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー（過去・青年）","displayName":"Chris Tse (Past, Young)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r340","rowIndex":340,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　言いかけて彼は口を閉じ、そして手招きをする。","en":"He broke off mid-sentence and beckoned to us.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r341","rowIndex":341,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「何を……」","en":"“What are you—”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r342","rowIndex":342,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「しっ」","en":"“Shh.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー（過去・青年）","displayName":"Chris Tse (Past, Young)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r343","rowIndex":343,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼は唇に人差し指を当てると、トイレの個室の方へ私たちを急かした。","en":"He pressed an index finger to his lips and hurried us toward one of the restroom stalls.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r344","rowIndex":344,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その様子が真剣だったので、私たちもすぐにその後を追って個室に入る。","en":"His manner was serious, so we immediately followed him into the stall.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r345","rowIndex":345,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして、彼が扉を閉めて鍵をした瞬間、何者かがトイレに入って来る物音がした。","en":"The instant he closed and locked the door, we heard someone enter the restroom.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r346","rowIndex":346,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ここにもいないようですね……」","en":"“It seems she isn’t here either...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r347","rowIndex":347,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「しかし、隠れるとしたらここくらいしかないだろう」","en":"“But if she were going to hide, this is about the only place she could do it.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r348","rowIndex":348,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　入って来たのは客と従業員らしい。少女を探しに来たのだ。男が私に頷き、私もそれに返す。","en":"The new arrivals appeared to be the patron and an employee. They had come looking for the girl. The man nodded to me, and I returned the gesture.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r349","rowIndex":349,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「もしよろしければ、別の女の子を指名していただければ……」","en":"“If you would be so kind as to select another girl instead...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r350","rowIndex":350,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いや、あいつでなければならん！　二週間も前から、どうしてやるかプランを練って来たんだぞ。それを台無しにされて黙っていられるか」","en":"“No, it has to be her! I've spent the last two weeks planning what I was going to do to her. You think I'm going to take it lying down when you ruin all that?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r351","rowIndex":351,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　客たちはなかなか去ろうとしない。私たち狭い個室で三人、息を潜めている。見つかったら少女は取り戻されてしまうだろう。","en":"The pair showed no sign of leaving. The three of us held our breath in the cramped stall. If they found us, they would undoubtedly take the girl back.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r352","rowIndex":352,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「おい、そこのドアが閉まってるぞ。あそこにいるんじゃないか？」","en":"“Hey, that door is closed. Isn’t she in there?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r353","rowIndex":353,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「しかし、お客様がご利用されている可能性が……」","en":"“But another guest may be using it...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r354","rowIndex":354,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いや、あそこにいるに違いない」","en":"“No. She must be in there.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r355","rowIndex":355,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　客はカツカツと足音を立てて私たちが隠れるドアに近づく。","en":"The patron approached the door behind which we were hiding, his hard footsteps clicking against the floor.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r356","rowIndex":356,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼は私たちの服を引っ張り、無言のまま手振りで私と少女に便器の上に乗るように指示する。","en":"Our companion tugged at our clothes and, without a word, motioned for the girl and me to stand on the toilet.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r357","rowIndex":357,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は一瞬戸惑ったが、すぐに、下から足を見られた時のためなのだと理解して、従った。","en":"I hesitated for an instant, then understood that this was to keep anyone from seeing our feet beneath the partition and obeyed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r358","rowIndex":358,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「おい、ここに隠れているだろ！」","en":"“Hey! You’re hiding in there, aren’t you?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r359","rowIndex":359,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　客は乱暴にドアを叩く。","en":"The patron pounded violently on the door.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r360","rowIndex":360,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　怯えて悲鳴を上げそうになる少女の口元に彼は手のひらを当て、安心するように微笑みかける。","en":"The girl nearly shrieked in fright, but our companion placed his palm over her mouth and gave her a reassuring smile.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r361","rowIndex":361,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「お客さま、おやめください」","en":"“Sir, please stop.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r362","rowIndex":362,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「開けろ！　開けるんだ！　あっ」","en":"“Open up! Open this door! Ah—”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r363","rowIndex":363,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　客が外側からドアを叩き続けるのに、彼は内側からそれ以上の力で叩き返す。","en":"The patron kept pounding on the door from outside, and the man pounded back from within even harder.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r364","rowIndex":364,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「おい、ふざけんな馬鹿野郎！　人のクソを邪魔しやがって！」","en":"“Hey, don’t fuck with me, asshole! How dare you interrupt a man taking a shit!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r365","rowIndex":365,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　嘘だと知っている私でも騙されそうなくらい迫真の演技で彼はそう怒鳴った。","en":"He shouted with a performance so convincing that even I, who knew it was a lie, nearly believed him.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r366","rowIndex":366,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「す、すまん……」","en":"“S-Sorry...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r367","rowIndex":367,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「もうやめましょう」","en":"“Let's stop now.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r368","rowIndex":368,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうだな。……部屋に戻るから、アルバムを見せてくれ」","en":"“You’re right... I’ll go back to the room. Bring me the album.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r369","rowIndex":369,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「かしこまりました。……お客様、大変失礼いたしました。あとで従業員にお申し付けいただければ、オプションを一つ無料でご用意させていただきます」","en":"“Certainly... Sir, please accept our profound apologies. If you speak to an employee later, we will provide one complimentary option.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r370","rowIndex":370,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「わかったから。早く出て行ってくれないか？　クソがひっこんじまう」","en":"“Fine. Now hurry up and get out, would you? You’re making my shit crawl back inside me.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r371","rowIndex":371,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　従業員の言葉のすぐあと、三ツ目の彼がそう口を挟む。","en":"The three-eyed man interjected immediately after the employee spoke.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r372","rowIndex":372,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「失礼いたしました」","en":"“Our apologies, sir.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r373","rowIndex":373,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして、客たちはようやくトイレを出て行き、私と少女は溜息をついた。","en":"At last, the pair left the restroom, and the girl and I sighed with relief.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r374","rowIndex":374,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=3>クリス</tips>はまだ気を抜かず、個室を出るとドアの向こうの方を眺めてから、","en":"<tips=3>Chris</tips> remained vigilant. He left the stall, looked through the door into the corridor, then murmured,","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r375","rowIndex":375,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ふん、どうやら行ったみたいだな」","en":"“Hmph. Looks like they’re gone.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー（過去・青年）","displayName":"Chris Tse (Past, Young)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r376","rowIndex":376,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　と呟き、私たちを振り返った。","en":"He turned back toward us.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r377","rowIndex":377,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まったく、肝を冷やしました。あなたがいなければどうなっていたか」","en":"“That gave me quite a fright. I don't know what would have happened if you hadn't been here.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r378","rowIndex":378,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いや、気にしないでくれ。あんたがその子と出会ったのが縁なら、おれとあんたがここで出会ったのも何かの縁なんだろう」","en":"“No, don’t mention it. If there was fate in your meeting this girl, then I suppose there must be some kind of fate in your meeting me here too.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r379","rowIndex":379,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そう言って彼は眩しそうに笑った。","en":"He said it with a smile, as though dazzled.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r380","rowIndex":380,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうかもしれません。しかし、どうして彼らが入って来るのがあんなに早く分かったんですか？　物音もしなかったと思うのですが……」","en":"“Perhaps so. But how did you know they were coming so early? I don't think they had made any sound...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r381","rowIndex":381,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「見えるんだよ」","en":"“I can see them.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r382","rowIndex":382,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼は肩をすくめて、","en":"He shrugged.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r383","rowIndex":383,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「聞いたことがないか？　『千里眼の<tips=3>クリス</tips>』と言えばおれのことだ」","en":"“Haven’t you heard? I’m ‘Clairvoyant <tips=3>Chris</tips>.’”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r384","rowIndex":384,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「『千里眼』……。もしや、透視が出来るんですか？」","en":"“‘Clairvoyance’... You mean you can see through things?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r385","rowIndex":385,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あんた、滅茶苦茶ツイてるぜ。この街で一番頼りになる男とここで出会ったんだ。その子は無事に脱出出来る」","en":"“You’re unbelievably lucky. You happened to meet the most dependable man in this city. That girl is getting out of here safely.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r386","rowIndex":386,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼は不敵に笑う。","en":"He gave me a bold, defiant grin.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r387","rowIndex":387,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　普通、<tips=16>タイプA</tips>というものは自分の能力を隠すものだ。","en":"As a rule, <tips=16>Type A</tips> people concealed their abilities.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r388","rowIndex":388,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　こんな場所で名を名乗り、能力の内容まで口にするというのは、私には理解出来ない。","en":"I could not understand why anyone would give his name in a place like this, much less disclose the nature of his ability.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r389","rowIndex":389,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しかし、先ほど感情を見た印象からすると、信用しても良さそうだった。","en":"Yet from the impression his emotions had given me before, I thought I could trust him.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r390","rowIndex":390,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「よろしくな」","en":"“Good to meet you.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r391","rowIndex":391,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そう言って握手のために手を差し出すが、私はそれを握る前にやることがあった。","en":"He extended a hand, but before I could shake it, there was something I had to do.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r392","rowIndex":392,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　手をマスクにかけて、それを外す。そして、私の左目を彼によく見せた。","en":"I raised a hand to my mask and removed it, making sure he had a clear view of my left eye.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r393","rowIndex":393,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あんた……」","en":"“You...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r394","rowIndex":394,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=3>クリス</tips>はさすがに驚きを隠せない。私の左目には二つの瞳があり、勘のいい彼ならばそれが単なる畸形ではないことを察するだろう。","en":"Even <tips=3>Chris</tips> could not conceal his surprise. My left eye held two pupils. A perceptive man like him would realize it was no mere deformity.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r395","rowIndex":395,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「私は<tips=5>太刀川</tips>。医師をしています。ご覧の通り<tips=16>タイプA</tips>で、人の目を見てその感情を正確に読み取ることが出来ます。気をつけてくださいね。私には嘘も誤魔化しも通用しません」","en":"“I am <tips=5>Tachikawa</tips>. I work as a physician. As you can see, I am <tips=16>Type A</tips>, and by looking into a person's eyes I can read that person's emotions accurately. You should be careful. Lies and attempts to deceive me will not work.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r396","rowIndex":396,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ふん、そうかい、妙な雰囲気だと思ったら、あんたもご同類ってわけか」","en":"“Hmph, is that right? I thought there was something peculiar about you, and it turns out you’re one of us.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r397","rowIndex":397,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=3>クリス</tips>は驚きを隠すように笑って、","en":"<tips=3>Chris</tips> laughed as if to conceal his surprise, then said,","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r398","rowIndex":398,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「よろしく」","en":"“Good to meet you.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r399","rowIndex":399,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　また手を差し出した。","en":"He offered his hand again.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r400","rowIndex":400,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「よろしく」","en":"“Likewise.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r401","rowIndex":401,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は彼との握手を済ませると、また元のようにマスクで顔を隠す。","en":"Once we had finished shaking hands, I concealed my face behind the mask once more.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r402","rowIndex":402,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「お嬢ちゃん、あんたの名は？」","en":"“And you, young lady? What’s your name?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r403","rowIndex":403,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=3>クリス</tips>は少女の方を見てそう訊ねる。","en":"<tips=3>Chris</tips> looked toward the girl as he asked.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r404","rowIndex":404,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……<tips=32>アサヒ</tips>」","en":"“...<tips=32>Asahi</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r405","rowIndex":405,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　少女は臆病な眼差しを<tips=3>クリス</tips>に向けながら、小声でそう名乗る。","en":"The girl gave her name quietly, directing a timid gaze at <tips=3>Chris</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r406","rowIndex":406,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それは本名かい？」","en":"“Is that your real name?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r407","rowIndex":407,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　少女は頷く。","en":"The girl nodded.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r408","rowIndex":408,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「わかった。じゃあ、<tips=32>アサヒ</tips>よ、お前は本当にここから逃げ出したいか？」","en":"“All right. Then, <tips=32>Asahi</tips>, do you truly want to escape this place?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r409","rowIndex":409,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　少女は一旦は口ごもったが、決意したかのように顔を上げ、唇を開く。","en":"The girl hesitated at first, but then she looked up as though she had made up her mind and began to speak.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r410","rowIndex":410,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「逃げ出したい。ここはいや」","en":"“I want to escape. I hate it here.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r411","rowIndex":411,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「よし、いい目をしているな。それなら大丈夫だ。外へ戻っても立派にやっていけるぜ」","en":"“Good. That's a fine look in your eyes. You'll be all right. Once you're back outside, you'll be able to stand on your own two feet.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r412","rowIndex":412,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=3>クリス</tips>は少女の頭を乱暴に撫でた。それから私の方を振り返ると、","en":"<tips=3>Chris</tips> roughly ruffled the girl’s hair. Then he turned back to me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r413","rowIndex":413,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=5>太刀川</tips>さんよ。しかし驚いたな。こんなところで初対面の相手に名前と素性を名乗って、しかも能力まで明かすなんて」","en":"“Dr. <tips=5>Tachikawa</tips>, I have to say I'm surprised. Giving your name and identity to someone you've just met in a place like this, and even revealing your ability...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r414","rowIndex":414,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私が彼に対して感じたことと同じ言葉を口にした。","en":"He had put into words precisely what I had thought about him.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r415","rowIndex":415,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「私も、自分の能力を他人に具体的に伝えるのは初めてです。こんな状況ですから、興奮しているのでしょう」","en":"“This is the first time I have ever told another person specifically what my ability does. Given the situation, I suppose I must be rather worked up.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r416","rowIndex":416,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「気にいったぜ」","en":"“I like you.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r417","rowIndex":417,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=3>クリス</tips>は笑って、洗面台の上に置いたままになっていた彼のマスクを手に取った。","en":"<tips=3>Chris</tips> smiled and picked up the mask that still lay on the sink.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r418","rowIndex":418,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「よし、出よう。今ならそのあたりに人はいない。誰にも見つからずにエレベーターまで行けるはずだ」","en":"“All right, let’s go. There’s no one nearby at the moment. We should be able to reach the elevator unseen.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r419","rowIndex":419,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼が先導するかたちで私たちはトイレを出て、エレベーターに乗り込んだ。そして乗り込んでもすぐに降りるボタンを押さず、足元の方をじっと見てから、また外に出る。","en":"With Chris leading the way, we left the restroom and entered the elevator. Once inside, however, he did not immediately press a button to descend. He stared toward the floor, then stepped out again.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r420","rowIndex":420,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「下に人がいて無理だな。やっぱり従業員用の通路を使おう」","en":"“No good. There are people below us. Let's use the staff passage after all.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー（過去・青年）","displayName":"Chris Tse (Past, Young)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r421","rowIndex":421,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちは彼に従って、廊下の端にあった小さなドアから従業員用のエリアに足を踏み入れる。","en":"Following him, we passed through a small door at the end of the corridor and entered the staff-only area.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r422","rowIndex":422,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　クリスは実に優れた『目』となって、暗く、複雑に折れ曲がった通路を導いてくれる。時折向こうから忙しげな従業員がやって来るが、<tips=3>クリス</tips>は事前にカーテンの裏や通路の曲がり角に私たちを誘導し、的確にニアミスを避けた。","en":"Chris served as a truly exceptional pair of ‘eyes,’ guiding us through dark and intricately twisting passages. Busy employees occasionally approached from ahead, but <tips=3>Chris</tips> directed us behind curtains or around corners before they appeared, steering us past every near collision without fail.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r423","rowIndex":423,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　神経がよほど図太いのか、一連の行動の間緊張する様子もなく、時に小さく鼻歌などを歌っている。このかくれんぼのスリルを楽しんでいるかのようだった。","en":"Perhaps he simply had nerves of steel. He betrayed no tension throughout the undertaking, and at times even hummed quietly. He appeared to be enjoying the thrill of this game of hide-and-seek.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r424","rowIndex":424,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「階段を使おう。少し疲れるが、あっちには人がいないんだ」","en":"“We’ll take the stairs. It’ll be a little tiring, but there’s no one over there.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー（過去・青年）","displayName":"Chris Tse (Past, Young)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r425","rowIndex":425,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼の指示どおり、私たちは切れかけた蛍光灯の点滅する非常階段を使って一階を目指す。","en":"As he instructed, we headed for the first floor via an emergency stairwell lit by failing fluorescent lamps.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r426","rowIndex":426,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ドクターよ、あんたはここの常連なのかい？」","en":"“So, Doc, are you a regular here?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー（過去・青年）","displayName":"Chris Tse (Past, Young)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r427","rowIndex":427,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　周りに人はいないらしく、<tips=3>クリス</tips>は抑えるつもりのない声でそう質問をする。","en":"There seemed to be no one around, for <tips=3>Chris</tips> asked the question without making any effort to lower his voice.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r428","rowIndex":428,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いえ、友人に誘われて、今日初めて来ました。<tips=9>Y地区</tips>自体は何度か通ったことがありますがね。……あなたは？」","en":"“No. A friend invited me, and today was my first visit. I have passed through <tips=9>Y District</tips> several times before, however... And you?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r429","rowIndex":429,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「おれは、招かれざる客だよ」","en":"“I’m an uninvited guest.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー（過去・青年）","displayName":"Chris Tse (Past, Young)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r430","rowIndex":430,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=3>クリス</tips>は笑う。","en":"<tips=3>Chris</tips> laughed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r431","rowIndex":431,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「塀を越えて忍び込んで来たのさ。会員証は一応他人のものを拝借しているが、ただ見せて使うだけならこれでいいとしても、受付の機械でチェックされたらすぐ本人じゃないってバレる。……つまり、さっきは恩を売るような言い方をしたが、どっちみちおれはこうやってこそこそ隠れて抜け出さなきゃいけなかったのさ」","en":"“I climbed over the wall and slipped in. I did borrow someone else’s membership card, but while it works well enough if I merely show it inside, the machine at reception would reveal at once that I’m not its owner... In other words, I made it sound as though I was doing you a favor back there, but I was going to have to sneak around and slip out like this anyway.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー（過去・青年）","displayName":"Chris Tse (Past, Young)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r432","rowIndex":432,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なるほど」","en":"“I see.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r433","rowIndex":433,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あ、言っておくが、別に、遊びたくて忍び込んだわけじゃないぜ。うちには怖いカミさんがいるからね、そんなことをしたらとっちめられちまう」","en":"“Oh, and just so you know, I didn't sneak in because I wanted to have some fun. I've got a terrifying wife at home, and she'd have my hide if I did anything like that.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー（過去・青年）","displayName":"Chris Tse (Past, Young)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r434","rowIndex":434,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「じゃあ、何のために？」","en":"“Then why did you come?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r435","rowIndex":435,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私が問うと、彼は表情をすごみのある笑顔にかえて、","en":"When I asked him, his expression changed into a smile with a menacing edge.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r436","rowIndex":436,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……この<tips=18>ローズ・クラブ</tips>をぶっ潰すためさ。だから、本当に噂通りのことが行われているのか、確認しに来たんだ。今後の下見もかねてね。ま、偵察だよ」","en":"“...To bring down the <tips=18>Rose Club</tips>. I came to determine whether the rumors about it were true—and to scout the place ahead of what I plan to do next. A reconnaissance mission, you could say.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー（過去・青年）","displayName":"Chris Tse (Past, Young)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r437","rowIndex":437,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「潰すとは……？」","en":"“Bring it down...?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r438","rowIndex":438,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「おれはこの街を愛している。そして住民を愛している。よそ者が、この街の女子供を玩具にして壊すのを許すことなんか出来ないのさ」","en":"“I love this city, and I love the people who live in it. I can't allow outsiders to use this city's women and children as toys and break them.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー（過去・青年）","displayName":"Chris Tse (Past, Young)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r439","rowIndex":439,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その目が余りにもギラギラと輝いているので、うっかり見てしまった。再び彼の強い憤りと熱い感情が心に流れ込み、慌てて目をそらす。そらした後も、彼の感情が私の心臓の鼓動を早めている。","en":"His eyes shone so fiercely that I looked into them without thinking. His powerful indignation and burning emotion poured into my heart once more, and I hurriedly averted my gaze. Even afterward, his emotion made my heart beat faster.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r440","rowIndex":440,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……しかし、そうして金を支払うことで救われる者たちもいると聞きます。なにより、多くは本人も納得しているそうじゃないですか」","en":"“...But I hear that the money paid in this way also saves some people. More importantly, isn’t it said that many of them agreed to the arrangement themselves?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r441","rowIndex":441,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そんなのクソ喰らえだね」","en":"“Fuck that.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー（過去・青年）","displayName":"Chris Tse (Past, Young)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r442","rowIndex":442,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=3>クリス</tips>は吐き捨てた。","en":"<tips=3>Chris</tips> spat out the words.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r443","rowIndex":443,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「おれが思うに、人間の命そのものには何の価値もない。命の価値というものは、その人間がどう考え、どう行動したかによってはじめて生まれる。……つまり作り出すものなんだ」","en":"“As I see it, a human life has no value in and of itself. The value of a life arises only from what that person thinks and how they act... In other words, it’s something we create.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー（過去・青年）","displayName":"Chris Tse (Past, Young)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r444","rowIndex":444,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=3>クリス</tips>は立ち止まり、階段を一段踏み外してよろけた<tips=32>アサヒ</tips>の身体を支えた。","en":"<tips=3>Chris</tips> stopped and caught <tips=32>Asahi</tips> when she missed a step and stumbled.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r445","rowIndex":445,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=18>ローズ・クラブ</tips>は確かに金払いは良い。この手の他の業者と比べれば良心的と言っても良い。だから、家族に金を払わずクラブに売りつける悪質な中間業者を排除出来れば、経済として成り立つかもしれない。しかし、それを突き詰めればどうなる？　子供を作って何年か育て、クラブに売ることを繰り返して、生計をたてるってやりかたがまかり通るようになるのさ」","en":"“The <tips=18>Rose Club</tips> certainly pays well. Compared with other operators in this line of business, you could even call it conscientious. If the crooked middlemen who sell children to the club without paying their families could be eliminated, the system might be economically sustainable. But what happens when you follow that logic to its end? It becomes acceptable to make a living by having children, raising them for a few years, selling them to the club, and then doing it all over again.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー（過去・青年）","displayName":"Chris Tse (Past, Young)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r446","rowIndex":446,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=3>クリス</tips>は怒りをにじませて言う。","en":"Anger seeped into <tips=3>Chris’s</tips> voice.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r447","rowIndex":447,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「街はクラブのための牧場になるんだ。そして住民はみんな繁殖するだけの家畜に成り下がる。実際そういうやつらが少しずつ現れ始めているんだよ。どういう運命になるか薄々わかっていながら子供を作り、送り出す。そして『平和で不安のない生活』とやらを買ってるんだ。まるっきり家畜の考え方だ！　あいつらは子供を一人売るたび、自分で自分の人間性を台無しにしていることに気がつかないのさ。まるで悪夢だ」","en":"“The city will become a ranch for the club, and all its residents will be reduced to livestock that exist only to breed. People like that are already beginning to appear, little by little. They have children and send them away despite having some idea of the fate awaiting them, and with the money they buy what they call ‘a peaceful life free from anxiety.’ That is the thinking of livestock! They don't realize that every time they sell a child, they are ruining their own humanity with their own hands. It's a nightmare.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー（過去・青年）","displayName":"Chris Tse (Past, Young)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r448","rowIndex":448,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=32>アサヒ</tips>が自分の足で立つと、また<tips=3>クリス</tips>は先導して歩き始める。","en":"Once <tips=32>Asahi</tips> was standing under her own power again, <tips=3>Chris</tips> resumed leading the way.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r449","rowIndex":449,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……だからこのクラブは潰さなきゃいけない。家庭を子供牧場にしてのんきに暮らしてるやつらは反対するかもしれないが、知ったことか。おれはそんな生き方は認めない」","en":"“...That is why this club has to be destroyed. The people who turn their homes into child ranches and live carefree lives may object, but to hell with them. I refuse to accept a life like that.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー（過去・青年）","displayName":"Chris Tse (Past, Young)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r450","rowIndex":450,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「しかし、潰すとは、具体的にどうするつもりですか？」","en":"“But when you say you will destroy it, what specifically do you intend to do?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r451","rowIndex":451,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私はその背中に向かってそう質問をした。","en":"I directed the question at his back.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r452","rowIndex":452,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「やり方は色々ある。でも、とにかく街の連中が一つにならないといけない。この街はずっと下らない争いをして来たからな。それをやめさせるんだ」","en":"“There are all sorts of ways to do it. But first, the people of this city have to become one. This city has always been caught up in stupid squabbles. I'm going to make them stop.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー（過去・青年）","displayName":"Chris Tse (Past, Young)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r453","rowIndex":453,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=3>クリス</tips>の全身は情熱で満ちている。","en":"<tips=3>Chris's</tips> entire body brimmed with passion.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r454","rowIndex":454,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その考え方や、やろうとしていることの是非は私には判断がつかないが、やるべきことに確信を持てている彼を羨ましく思った。","en":"I could not judge the merits of his beliefs or of what he intended to do, but I envied his certainty that he knew what must be done.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r455","rowIndex":455,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「勝算はあるんですか？」","en":"“Do you have any prospect of success?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r456","rowIndex":456,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「さあね。でも、おれがやるってことは、どんなに勝ち目が薄かったとしても最終的には勝つってことだ。とりあえず今日ここで見たことを話せば、街の連中も少しは耳を貸すだろう」","en":"“Who knows? But if I'm the one doing it, then no matter how slim the chances of victory may be, I'll win in the end. For a start, if I tell the people of the city what I saw here today, they should at least listen.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー（過去・青年）","displayName":"Chris Tse (Past, Young)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r457","rowIndex":457,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……一体何を見たんですか？　きみの様な強い人間が、洗面所で吐くなんて相当なことだ」","en":"“...What in the world did you see? It must have been something terrible if it made a strong man like you vomit in the washroom.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r458","rowIndex":458,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「とんでもないものを見たのさ。あんなものを見たら、まともな人間だったら誰だって頭がおかしくなるだろうよ」","en":"“I saw something appalling. It would drive any sane human being out of his mind.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー（過去・青年）","displayName":"Chris Tse (Past, Young)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r459","rowIndex":459,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そこで<tips=3>クリス</tips>は何かを前方に察知して、立ち止まる。","en":"At that point, <tips=3>Chris</tips> detected something ahead and stopped.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r460","rowIndex":460,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「誰か来ましたか？」","en":"“Is someone coming?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r461","rowIndex":461,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いや……大丈夫そうだ。向こうへ行った」","en":"“No... It looks safe. They went the other way.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー（過去・青年）","displayName":"Chris Tse (Past, Young)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r462","rowIndex":462,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そしてまた<tips=3>クリス</tips>は歩き始めた。","en":"<tips=3>Chris</tips> began walking once more.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r463","rowIndex":463,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「噂には聞いていたが、ひどいものだったよ。あんなにおぞましいバーベキューは見たことがなかったね」","en":"“I’d heard the rumors, but it was hideous. I’ve never seen such an abominable barbecue.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー（過去・青年）","displayName":"Chris Tse (Past, Young)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r464","rowIndex":464,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「バーベキュー？」","en":"“Barbecue?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r465","rowIndex":465,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうだよ」","en":"“That’s right.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー（過去・青年）","displayName":"Chris Tse (Past, Young)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r466","rowIndex":466,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=3>クリス</tips>は振り返り、","en":"<tips=3>Chris</tips> looked back at me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r467","rowIndex":467,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「人肉バーベキューだ。生きている女を少しずつ切り刻んで、泣き叫ぶのを見ながら焼いて食うんだよ。おれも色々とむごいものを見てきたが、あれはとびっきりだぜ。あんなものを見て喜ぶやつってのは一体全体どういう心の持ち主なんだ？」","en":"“A human barbecue. They cut up a living woman bit by bit, grill her, and eat her while watching her scream. I’ve seen my share of cruelty, but that was in a class of its own. What the hell kind of person can watch something like that and enjoy it?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー（過去・青年）","displayName":"Chris Tse (Past, Young)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r468","rowIndex":468,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　青ざめた顔で笑った。","en":"His face pale, he laughed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r469","rowIndex":469,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼が語るにはこういうことだった。","en":"According to Chris, this was what had happened.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r470","rowIndex":470,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私が入ったのと同じようなショーホールで、ステージに女が上がってきて笑顔で礼をする。","en":"In a show hall much like the one I had entered, a woman came onto the stage and bowed with a smile.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r471","rowIndex":471,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして女は金属で出来た台の上に寝て、ベルトで身体を固定される。","en":"She then lay down on a metal table, where belts secured her body.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r472","rowIndex":472,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　この女が今日の食材で、客席側には炭火の入ったバーベキュー用のコンロが設置されている。","en":"The woman was that day's principal ingredient, and charcoal barbecue grills had been set up on the audience side of the hall.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r473","rowIndex":473,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　大きなナイフを持った調理師が、この女の足を切り開いて太ももの肉を食べやすくカットしては、塩胡椒をかけてコンロの網の上に置く。同じように腹を切り裂き、内臓を一つ一つ火にくべてゆく。","en":"A cook with a large knife cut open the woman's leg, carved the flesh of her thigh into portions of a convenient size for eating, seasoned them with salt and pepper, and set them on the grill. He then cut open her abdomen in the same fashion and fed her organs into the fire one by one.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r474","rowIndex":474,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして、ホールに流れる音声が、いちいち今どこの部位をカットしたのか説明してくれる。女は猿ぐつわをかませられ、切り取られるたびに泣き叫んで身をよじるが、ベルトでたくみに固定されていて動かない。","en":"A voice over the hall speakers explained each body part as it was cut. The woman had been gagged. Each time something was removed, she screamed and writhed, but the skillfully fastened belts did not let her move.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r475","rowIndex":475,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　次に乳房が切り落とされ、肋骨が削り取られて肺が焼かれる。普通なら気を失ったり死亡しているはずなのに、女は最後まで意識を保って生きている。","en":"Next her breasts were cut off, her ribs were pared away, and her lungs were roasted. Ordinarily she should have lost consciousness or died, yet the woman remained conscious and alive until the very end.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r476","rowIndex":476,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そこで音声が説明をする。","en":"Then the voice over the speakers offered an explanation.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r477","rowIndex":477,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"『彼女は不死身です。いくら切り刻まれても死ぬことはありません。信じられない方は、また来月いらしてください。そこでまた、彼女とお会いになれるでしょう』","en":"‘She is immortal. No matter how extensively she is cut to pieces, she will not die. Those of you who find this impossible to believe are invited to return next month. You will be able to meet her again then.’","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r478","rowIndex":478,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なあドクター。医学的に、そんなことってあるのかい？」","en":"“Tell me, Doc. Is something like that medically possible?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー（過去・青年）","displayName":"Chris Tse (Past, Young)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r479","rowIndex":479,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼の言葉に衝撃をうけて呆然としていた私は咄嗟には返事が出来なかった。","en":"Stunned by his account, I could not answer immediately.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r480","rowIndex":480,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　きっと、その時の私の顔は蒼白になっていただろう。","en":"My face must have been deathly pale at that moment.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r481","rowIndex":481,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いや、聞いたことがない……」","en":"“No. I’ve never heard of anything like that...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r482","rowIndex":482,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうだよな。じゃあ、トリックか、本当に殺したのか……。来月出て来るってのは、双子か何かかな」","en":"“I thought not. Then it was some trick—or they truly killed her... Perhaps the woman who’ll appear next month is her twin or something.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー（過去・青年）","displayName":"Chris Tse (Past, Young)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r483","rowIndex":483,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=3>クリス</tips>は首を捻る。","en":"<tips=3>Chris</tips> tilted his head.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r484","rowIndex":484,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「その女本人か、従業員が<tips=16>タイプA</tips>で、何か特殊な能力を持っているのなら、それで人の目を欺いている可能性もありますが」","en":"“If either the woman herself or one of the employees is <tips=16>Type A</tips> and possesses some unusual ability, they may be using it to deceive the audience.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r485","rowIndex":485,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ちょっと調べてみるかな。<tips=9>Y地区</tips>で雇われた女だとすれば、素性を調べるのは不可能じゃない。そうだお嬢ちゃん、きみは何か知らないか？　あのトリックについてさ」","en":"“Maybe I'll look into it. If she was hired out of <tips=9>Y District</tips>, tracing her identity won't be impossible. Oh, that's right. What about you, kid? Do you know anything about that trick?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー（過去・青年）","displayName":"Chris Tse (Past, Young)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r486","rowIndex":486,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=32>アサヒ</tips>は首を横に振る。","en":"<tips=32>Asahi</tips> shook her head.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r487","rowIndex":487,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ごめんなさい。他の場所で何が行われてるかは、ちょっと……」","en":"“I’m sorry. I don’t really know what happens in the other parts of the club...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アサヒ","displayName":"Asahi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r488","rowIndex":488,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まあそうだろうね。うーん……あ、そう言えば、最初の挨拶のとき、名前を言ってたな」","en":"“That’s what I figured. Hmm... Oh, come to think of it, she did give her name when she first greeted the audience.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー（過去・青年）","displayName":"Chris Tse (Past, Young)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r489","rowIndex":489,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=3>クリス</tips>はパチンと指を鳴らし、","en":"<tips=3>Chris</tips> snapped his fingers.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r490","rowIndex":490,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうだ、<tips=52>ミアオ</tips>だ！　<tips=52>ミアオ</tips>って名乗ってた。お嬢ちゃん、聞いたことがないか？　……そうか、ないか」","en":"“That’s right—<tips=52>Miao</tips>! She said her name was <tips=52>Miao</tips>. Young lady, have you ever heard that name? ...No? I see.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー（過去・青年）","displayName":"Chris Tse (Past, Young)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r491","rowIndex":491,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私はその言葉で、全身の血の気が引くような思いがした。","en":"At those words, I felt all the blood drain from my body.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r492","rowIndex":492,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「戻ったら、この名前を少し調べるかね。面白い情報がわかるかもしれない」","en":"“Once we get back, perhaps I’ll investigate that name. I might uncover something interesting.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー（過去・青年）","displayName":"Chris Tse (Past, Young)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r493","rowIndex":493,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=3>クリス</tips>はまた前を向き、階段を下り始める。","en":"<tips=3>Chris</tips> faced forward and resumed his descent.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r494","rowIndex":494,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……その女は、アジア人でしたか？」","en":"“...Was this woman Asian?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r495","rowIndex":495,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　物思いに耽る<tips=3>クリス</tips>の背中に、私はそう訊ねた。","en":"I asked the question of <tips=3>Chris</tips> as he walked ahead of me, lost in thought.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r496","rowIndex":496,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「見た目はね」","en":"“At least, she looked it.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー（過去・青年）","displayName":"Chris Tse (Past, Young)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r497","rowIndex":497,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「もしかしたら、その女は<tips=59>暗闇通り</tips>の娼婦かもしれない」","en":"“That woman may have been a prostitute from <tips=59>Darkness Street</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r498","rowIndex":498,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「え」","en":"“What?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー（過去・青年）","displayName":"Chris Tse (Past, Young)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r499","rowIndex":499,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=3>クリス</tips>は驚き振り返る。","en":"<tips=3>Chris</tips> turned in surprise.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r500","rowIndex":500,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「五ヶ月前に姿を消したんです。私が特別に気に掛けていた女で、ずっと探していました」","en":"“She vanished five months ago. She was a woman I cared about especially, and I have been searching for her ever since.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r501","rowIndex":501,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あんた……」","en":"“You...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー（過去・青年）","displayName":"Chris Tse (Past, Young)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r502","rowIndex":502,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=3>クリス</tips>は何か言いかけて、途中で取りやめた。","en":"<tips=3>Chris</tips> began to say something, then stopped himself.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r503","rowIndex":503,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「彼女は<tips=17>タイプB</tips>でしたが、サイキックかどうかはわかりません。少なくとも身体のどこにも<tips=77>特質変異</tips>はなかったし、それらしい能力の行使を感じたこともありませんでした。彼女がいたのは<tips=59>暗闇通り</tips>の奥の方の『コーポひろかわ』というアパート式の店です。いつも店番している女性に<tips=52>ミアオ</tips>と言えばわかるでしょう」","en":"“She was <tips=17>Type B</tips>, but I don't know whether she was psychic. At the very least, there was no <tips=77>trait mutation</tips> anywhere on her body, and I never sensed her exercising any apparent ability. She worked at an apartment-style brothel called Corpo Hirokawa, deep in <tips=59>Darkness Street</tips>. The woman who always minds the place will know whom you mean if you ask for <tips=52>Miao</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r504","rowIndex":504,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうか。ありがとう、恩に着るぜ」","en":"“I see. Thank you. I owe you one.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー（過去・青年）","displayName":"Chris Tse (Past, Young)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r505","rowIndex":505,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=3>クリス</tips>は複雑な表情でそう言うと、階段を下り始める。","en":"<tips=3>Chris</tips> answered with a mixture of emotions on his face, then started down the stairs again.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r506","rowIndex":506,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　先ほどとはうって変わって無言となり、もうほとんど無駄口を叩こうとはしなかった。","en":"In a complete change from a moment before, he fell silent and made almost no more idle conversation.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r507","rowIndex":507,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　思わぬ名前が飛び出して、私は動揺していた。表面上は冷静を取り繕っていたが、もしかしたらいま<tips=3>クリス</tips>に話した声が震えていたかもしれない。自分でそれが確認出来ないほど、心から余裕が失われていた。","en":"The appearance of that unexpected name had shaken me. On the surface I maintained a calm facade, but my voice may have trembled as I spoke to <tips=3>Chris</tips>. I had lost so much of my inner composure that I could not even judge that for myself.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r508","rowIndex":508,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　よほど表情が硬かったのか、<tips=32>アサヒ</tips>が心配そうにチラチラと視線をよこす。","en":"Perhaps my expression had grown conspicuously rigid, for <tips=32>Asahi</tips> kept casting worried glances at me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r509","rowIndex":509,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「大丈夫ですか？　具合が悪いんですか？」","en":"“Are you all right? Are you feeling ill?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アサヒ","displayName":"Asahi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r510","rowIndex":510,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女が遂に質問をして、","en":"At last, she asked me directly.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r511","rowIndex":511,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「心配はいらないよ。大人はみんな強いんだ」","en":"“Don’t worry. All adults are strong.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r512","rowIndex":512,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　と返した。<tips=3>クリス</tips>はそのやりとりを黙って聞くだけで、何も言わなかった。","en":"<tips=3>Chris</tips> merely listened to our exchange in silence and said nothing.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r513","rowIndex":513,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=52>ミアオ</tips>がこのクラブに雇われていた。しかも、世にもおぞましいステージの主役をつとめていた。","en":"<tips=52>Miao</tips> had been employed by this club. Worse still, she had been the central figure in the most grotesque spectacle imaginable.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r514","rowIndex":514,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私はかつて、その肌を愛し、宝物のように大事に触れ、自分のものにしたいと苦しんでいた。それが刃物によって切り裂かれ、筋肉や内臓がえぐり取られた。","en":"I had once loved that skin, touched it with the care due a treasure, and suffered from the desire to make it mine. Now it had been torn apart by a blade, its muscles and organs gouged out.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r515","rowIndex":515,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私はかつて、彼女の心を慈しみ、少しでも負担なく仕事が出来るよう配慮し、私に好意を持ってくれるよう祈った。それが、冷たい刃物の痛みによって狂ったように泣き叫んだ。","en":"I had once cherished her heart, taken care that she could work with as little strain as possible, and prayed that she might feel affection for me. Now that heart had screamed and wept as though driven mad by the pain of a cold blade.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r516","rowIndex":516,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しかもそれらは誰ともわからぬ客たちの好奇心を満たすためにされた。","en":"And all of this had been done to satisfy the curiosity of an audience of complete strangers.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r517","rowIndex":517,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女はそれを望んだのだろうか？　金を得るために？　正気で？","en":"Had she wanted this? For money? In her right mind?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r518","rowIndex":518,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は先ほど<tips=3>クリス</tips>が使った『家畜』と言う言葉を思い出した。彼は先ほど命そのものに価値はないと言った。私はそうは思わない。命はそれ自体が価値のある美しいものだと思う。それは私が医師であるからそう思うのではなく、医師を目指す前から、心の奥に根ざした感情的なものだ。それがこのように扱われている。","en":"I remembered the word <tips=3>Chris</tips> had used before: “livestock.” He had said that life itself possessed no value. I did not agree. I believed life to be something beautiful and valuable in itself. That belief did not arise from my being a physician; it was an emotional conviction rooted deep within me since before I ever aspired to medicine. And here life was being treated this way.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r519","rowIndex":519,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女が自らこれを選んだのだと考えると、何か心の奥が冷え冷えとするような絶望的な苦しみを胸に感じた。","en":"When I contemplated the possibility that she had chosen this herself, I felt a despairing anguish deep in my chest, as if something at my core had gone cold.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r520","rowIndex":520,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　何か事情があるのかもしれない。とにかく、私はほとんど彼女について何も知らない。","en":"Perhaps there were circumstances I did not know. In any event, I knew almost nothing about her.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r521","rowIndex":521,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　今すぐ階段をのぼって、<tips=3>クリス</tips>がいたという部屋に駆け出したいという衝動にかられた。もう次のショーが始まっているだろうし、言ったところでどうにもならないと内心で自分に言い聞かせてみても、その衝動は収まらず、奥歯を噛みしめながら階段を下りた。","en":"I was seized by the urge to run back up the stairs and rush into the room <tips=3>Chris</tips> had described. The next show had presumably begun already, and I told myself that going there could accomplish nothing, but still the impulse would not subside. I descended the stairs with my jaw clenched.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r522","rowIndex":522,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　一階まで下りると、また先ほどのように<tips=3>クリス</tips>の指示で隠れたり曲がったりしながら進み、倉庫のドアから外に出る。そのあたりは丁度建物の裏口に当たるようで、目の前には業者の搬入口らしい無骨な黒い門があった。","en":"Once we reached the first floor, we proceeded as before, hiding and turning as <tips=3>Chris</tips> directed, and emerged through a storeroom door. We seemed to be right by the building’s rear entrance. Before us stood a stark black gate that looked like a commercial delivery entrance.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r523","rowIndex":523,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　いつの間にかの土砂降りで、トラックのタイヤがつけたと思われる地面に出来た傷口のようないくつもの溝に、水たまりが出来ていた。","en":"At some point, the rain had become torrential. Water gathered in the many woundlike grooves that truck tires had presumably torn through the ground.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r524","rowIndex":524,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=3>クリス</tips>は大きな門の隣にある通用口の鍵を偽造しており、それを使って我々は外に出た。大粒の雨で、我々はみるみるうちにずぶ濡れとなる。正面には大きな林が生い茂り、風でざわめいていた。","en":"<tips=3>Chris</tips> had forged a key to the service door beside the great gate, and we used it to leave the grounds. Large raindrops rapidly soaked us through. Dense woods rose before us, rustling in the wind.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r525","rowIndex":525,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　濡れたからだが風に吹かれると寒かった。<tips=32>アサヒ</tips>は露出の多いドレスで、一層寒かろう。生まれたての子鹿のように震えている。先ほど肩が血でべっとりと濡れていたが、今はもう雨に流され消えていた。傷口は見当たらない。あの血液は、彼女のものではなかったのだろう。あんなに怯えるほど、おそろしいものを見たのだ。","en":"The wind chilled my wet body. In her revealing dress, <tips=32>Asahi</tips> must have been colder still. She was trembling like a newborn fawn. Earlier, her shoulder had been soaked in blood, but by now the rain had washed it all away. I could find no wound. The blood probably had not been hers. She must have seen something terrifying to be so frightened.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r526","rowIndex":526,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「すぐに移動しましょう。このままじゃこの子が風邪をひいてしまう」","en":"“We should move at once. The girl will catch cold if we remain here.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r527","rowIndex":527,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そう焦りなさんな」","en":"“No need to rush.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー（過去・青年）","displayName":"Chris Tse (Past, Young)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r528","rowIndex":528,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=3>クリス</tips>は携帯電話を取り出して、どこかへ連絡する。通話を終えると、道の向こうに二人の男が現れた。","en":"<tips=3>Chris</tips> took out a mobile phone and contacted someone. When the call ended, two men appeared across the road.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r529","rowIndex":529,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あれはおれの仲間だ」","en":"“Those are my people.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー（過去・青年）","displayName":"Chris Tse (Past, Young)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r530","rowIndex":530,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=3>クリス</tips>はそう言うと、二人組の方へ振り返り、手を振った。","en":"<tips=3>Chris</tips> turned toward the pair and waved.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r531","rowIndex":531,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「明仔！　ジェフ！　今すぐ行くから、そこで待ってろ！」","en":"“Ming-jai! Geoff! We'll be right there, so wait for us!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r532","rowIndex":532,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そしてまた私たちの方へ振り返る。","en":"Then he turned back to us.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r533","rowIndex":533,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ドクター、向こうに車を用意してある。一緒に行こう」","en":"“Doc, we have a car ready over there. Come with us.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー（過去・青年）","displayName":"Chris Tse (Past, Young)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r534","rowIndex":534,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いえ、大丈夫です。私は向こうの大通りまで歩いてタクシーを拾います」","en":"“No, I'll be all right. I'll walk to the main road over there and hail a taxi.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r535","rowIndex":535,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「しかし……」","en":"“But...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー（過去・青年）","displayName":"Chris Tse (Past, Young)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r536","rowIndex":536,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「遠慮しているわけではないんです。一人で歩きたいんですよ」","en":"“I’m not just being polite. I want to walk alone.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r537","rowIndex":537,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「わかった。じゃあ、この子はおれが連れて行く。引取先には心当たりが有るんだ。それでいいか？」","en":"“All right. Then I’ll take her with me. I know somewhere that can take her in. Is that all right?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー（過去・青年）","displayName":"Chris Tse (Past, Young)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r538","rowIndex":538,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　感情が見えると前置きをしておいたのに、<tips=3>クリス</tips>は私の目をまっすぐ見つめる。","en":"Though I had told him up front that I could see emotions, <tips=3>Chris</tips> looked me straight in the eye.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r539","rowIndex":539,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼の言葉にはまったく嘘がない。私を騙してこの少女をどうこうするという企みはなさそうだ。彼は私にこの感情を見せたかったのだろう。","en":"His words held no trace of a lie. He did not seem to be plotting to deceive me so he could do something to the girl. He must have wanted me to see this emotion.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r540","rowIndex":540,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は<tips=32>アサヒ</tips>を見る。彼女は頷く。","en":"I looked at <tips=32>Asahi</tips>. She nodded.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r541","rowIndex":541,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「わかりました。しかし、大丈夫なんですか？」","en":"“All right. But are you sure?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r542","rowIndex":542,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「かまわない。それに、こっちだってその方が都合がいいんだ。なあ<tips=32>アサヒ</tips>、あとで落ち着いたら、<tips=18>ローズ・クラブ</tips>で見聞きしたことを教えてほしい」","en":"“That’s fine. Besides, this works better for me too. <tips=32>Asahi</tips>, after you’ve had a chance to calm down, I want you to tell me what you saw and heard at the <tips=18>Rose Club</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー（過去・青年）","displayName":"Chris Tse (Past, Young)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r543","rowIndex":543,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=32>アサヒ</tips>はもう一度頷く。","en":"<tips=32>Asahi</tips> nodded again.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r544","rowIndex":544,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いい子だ。じゃあドクター。そういうことでかまわないね？」","en":"“Good girl. So, Doc, you’re all right with that arrangement?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー（過去・青年）","displayName":"Chris Tse (Past, Young)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r545","rowIndex":545,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「感謝します」","en":"“I am grateful.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r546","rowIndex":546,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は彼に頭を下げた。","en":"I bowed to him.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r547","rowIndex":547,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「頭なんかさげるなよ。おれも楽しかった」","en":"“Don’t bow to me. I had fun too.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー（過去・青年）","displayName":"Chris Tse (Past, Young)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r548","rowIndex":548,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=3>クリス</tips>は照れくさそうに人差しの背中で指で鼻を擦ってから、","en":"<tips=3>Chris</tips> rubbed his nose bashfully with the back of his index finger.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r549","rowIndex":549,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それじゃ、ここでお別れだ。……ドクター。さっき言った通り、おれはこれから<tips=18>ローズ・クラブ</tips>を潰しにかかる。もし<tips=32>アサヒ</tips>に会いたくなったり、おれに用が出来たら<tips=58>パラシュート通り</tips>の日本人がやってる中華料理店を訪ねて、店主におれの名前を伝えてくれ。それで話は通るはずだ」","en":"“This is where we part, then... Doc. Like I told you, I'm going to start working on bringing down the <tips=18>Rose Club</tips>. If you want to see <tips=32>Asahi</tips> or have some business with me, go to the Chinese restaurant run by a Japanese man on <tips=58>Parachute Street</tips> and give the owner my name. That should be enough to get a message through.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー（過去・青年）","displayName":"Chris Tse (Past, Young)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r550","rowIndex":550,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ご厚意痛み入りますが、もうあなたと会うことはないでしょう」","en":"“I am most grateful for your kindness, but I doubt we will ever meet again.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r551","rowIndex":551,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうかな。おれはそうは思わないがね。これは能力じゃなくて、ただの勘だが、これがよく当たるんだ」","en":"“You think so? I don’t. This isn’t one of my abilities, just a hunch—but my hunches tend to be right.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー（過去・青年）","displayName":"Chris Tse (Past, Young)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r552","rowIndex":552,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=3>クリス</tips>は闇の中で白い歯をむき出して笑うと、向こうの仲間たちの方へ歩いて行く。","en":"<tips=3>Chris</tips> grinned, baring his white teeth in the darkness, then walked over to his companions.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r553","rowIndex":553,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ありがとうございました！」","en":"“Thank you very much!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アサヒ","displayName":"Asahi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r554","rowIndex":554,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=32>アサヒ</tips>は私にむかってペコリと頭を下げてから、くるりと背を向けて小走りで<tips=3>クリス</tips>のあとを追った。","en":"<tips=32>Asahi</tips> gave me a quick bow, spun around, and trotted after <tips=3>Chris</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r555","rowIndex":555,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は雨の中しばらく立ち尽くしてから、歩き始めた。","en":"I stood motionless in the rain for a while, then began to walk.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r556","rowIndex":556,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=52>ミアオ</tips>……」","en":"“<tips=52>Miao</tips>...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r557","rowIndex":557,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　思わず口に出た。","en":"The name escaped my lips.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r558","rowIndex":558,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　闇の中を彷徨うように歩き、途中、まだマスクをつけたままだったのに気がついて、それを外した。","en":"I walked on as though wandering through the darkness. Along the way, I realized I was still wearing the mask and took it off.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r559","rowIndex":559,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私の頬は、ずっとマスクに覆われていたはずなのに、あたたかく濡れている。","en":"My cheeks, which should have been covered by the mask all this time, were warm and wet.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C2:r560","rowIndex":560,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　――これが、マフィア組織『<tips=69>義勝</tips>』の若きリーダー<ruby=クリス・ツェー>謝大輝</ruby>との出会いだった。","en":"—This was how I first met Chris Tse, the young leader of the mafia organization <tips=69>Yisheng</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}}]},{"position":23,"code":"X6-1","unitId":"X6-1","rows":[{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r1","rowIndex":1,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　当時<tips=58>パラシュート通り</tips>にあった菅原食堂という名の小さな飲食店は、店名からはまったくそうとわからないが、中華料理を出す店だった。","en":"At the time, a small restaurant named Sugawara Diner stood on <tips=58>Parachute Street</tips>. You would never have guessed it from the name, but it served Chinese food.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r2","rowIndex":2,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　店長が香港のホテルで修業を積んだ経歴の持ち主だったために本格的な広東料理を安価で提供している。","en":"Its proprietor had trained at a hotel in Hong Kong, so it served authentic Cantonese cuisine at affordable prices.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r3","rowIndex":3,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　また、メニューにはなかったが、店主は気さくな性格で、頼めば日本人にも馴染みの深いエビチリなどの和風中華料理や、サンマ定食や生姜焼き定食といったものでも作ってくれた。","en":"The proprietor was also an affable man. Though they were not on the menu, if asked, he would prepare Japanese-style Chinese dishes familiar to Japanese diners, such as shrimp in chili sauce, or even set meals featuring Pacific saury or ginger pork.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r4","rowIndex":4,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　当時ほとんど日本人向けの飲食店がなかったこの街ではこういった定食はなかなか重宝され、故郷の味を懐かしむ中国人だけでなく、これを目当てに訪れる日本人も少なくなかったという。","en":"At a time when the city had almost no restaurants catering to Japanese people, set meals like these were greatly appreciated; the diner reportedly drew not only Chinese patrons nostalgic for the flavors of home, but also quite a few Japanese patrons who came expressly for them.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r5","rowIndex":5,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　従業員はこの店主とその妻の二人。","en":"The proprietor and his wife were its only employees.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r6","rowIndex":6,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　壁紙がところどころ剥がれ、カウンターの端には拭いてもとれない油のかたまりがこびりついているような庶民的な店である。","en":"It was an unpretentious neighborhood place, with wallpaper peeling here and there and a lump of grease caked onto the end of the counter that no amount of wiping could remove.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r7","rowIndex":7,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　出入り口は立て付けの悪いアルミサッシがはまっており、これを開けようとすると必ず途中で引っかかるため、客が入るたびにズッ、ズッと二回ほどサッシの擦れる音がする。","en":"A poorly fitted aluminum-framed door stood at the entrance. It invariably caught partway whenever someone tried to open it, so each arriving customer produced two rasps of the frame—scrape, scrape.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r8","rowIndex":8,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そのため、客の出入りの激しい昼時などは開けっ放しになっていることも多い。","en":"For that reason, it was often left standing open during the busy lunch hour.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r9","rowIndex":9,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　とある日の昼下がり。","en":"One afternoon.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r10","rowIndex":10,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ランチのピークを過ぎて閑散としたこの菅原食堂に、一人の客が訪れた。","en":"A lone customer came to Sugawara Diner, now deserted after the lunch rush.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r11","rowIndex":11,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼は初めてその店を訪れたらしく、最初の引っかかりのところで戸惑い手を止め、そしてサッシに何か異物が挟まったわけではないのを確認してからもう一度引き、どうにか身体を中に入れることが出来た。","en":"He appeared to be visiting the diner for the first time. When the door first caught, he stopped in confusion; after confirming that nothing had become wedged in the frame, he pulled again and somehow opened it far enough to squeeze inside.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r12","rowIndex":12,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　背の高い細身の身体に黒いコートと黒い帽子を身につけ、そして顔にはトリの嘴のようなものが生えたマスクを身につけている。","en":"A black coat and black hat covered his tall, slender frame, while a mask with what looked like a bird’s beak protruding from it concealed his face.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r13","rowIndex":13,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　この街にはミュータントが多く、彼らは覆面などで顔や身体の一部を隠すために異装が多かったが、そうしたこの街の基準でみても異様な風体と言って良い。","en":"Many mutants lived in the city, and because they often concealed parts of their faces or bodies with masks and other coverings, unusual attire was common among them. Even by the standards of this city, however, his appearance could fairly be called bizarre.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r14","rowIndex":14,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼は誰もいない店内を見回して、溜息をつく。そして引き返そうと踵を返したとき、","en":"He surveyed the empty dining room and sighed. Just as he turned on his heel to leave—","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r15","rowIndex":15,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「はい」","en":"“Yes?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮（少年時代）","displayName":"Tse Leung (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r16","rowIndex":16,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　声がして、まだ小学校にも上がらぬような少年が奥からやってきた。","en":"A voice answered him, and a boy who did not yet look old enough to have started elementary school emerged from the back.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r17","rowIndex":17,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「お客さんですか？　強盗じゃないですよね？」","en":"“Are you a customer? You aren’t a robber, are you?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮（少年時代）","displayName":"Tse Leung (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r18","rowIndex":18,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　無愛想な少年は幼さの残るあどけない顔で黒ずくめの客を見上げる。","en":"The unsmiling boy looked up at the visitor in black with an innocent face that still bore all the softness of early childhood.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r19","rowIndex":19,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「客だが……」","en":"“I am a customer, but...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"太刀川良馬ペスト仮面","displayName":"Ryoma Tachikawa (Plague Mask)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r20","rowIndex":20,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうですか。じゃあ、ちょっとまっててください」","en":"“I see. Then please wait just a minute.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮（少年時代）","displayName":"Tse Leung (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r21","rowIndex":21,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　少年はそう言うが早いか、くるりと踵を返して調理場に入ると、コップに水を汲んで客の目の前のテーブルにそれを置く。そして、入って来た入り口の方へ戻っていった。","en":"The words had scarcely left the boy’s mouth before he spun on his heel and entered the kitchen. He filled a glass with water, set it on the table before the visitor, then returned through the doorway from which he had come.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r22","rowIndex":22,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　客はもう一度溜息をつき、水を置いてくれた席の椅子を引いて座る。そして、マスクをちょっとずらして水を飲んだ。","en":"The visitor sighed once more, pulled out the chair at the table where the water had been placed, and sat. He shifted his mask slightly aside to drink.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r23","rowIndex":23,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　間もなく、太った中年女がやって来る。","en":"Before long, a plump, middle-aged woman appeared.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r24","rowIndex":24,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あら、ごめんなさいね。もうすぐ主人が来ますから、決まってたら注文だけでもどうぞ」","en":"“Oh, I’m sorry. My husband will be here in a moment, but if you’ve decided, you can at least give me your order.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r25","rowIndex":25,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　女はレジの横に畳まれていたエプロンを身につけながら、ちゃきちゃきとした口調で言う。","en":"The woman spoke in a brisk, energetic tone as she put on an apron that had been folded beside the register.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r26","rowIndex":26,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　男の仮面に驚かないのは、この街の住民ならではといったところだろう。","en":"Perhaps only a resident of this city could remain unfazed by the man’s mask.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r27","rowIndex":27,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「今のは息子さんですか？　小さいのに、随分と賢い」","en":"“Was that your son just now? Remarkably clever for one so young.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"太刀川良馬ペスト仮面","displayName":"Ryoma Tachikawa (Plague Mask)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r28","rowIndex":28,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……ありがとうございます。<tips=1>亮</tips>って言うんですよ。自慢の息子ですわ」","en":"“...Thank you. His name is <tips=1>Ryo</tips>. He's a son I can be proud of.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r29","rowIndex":29,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　女は嬉しそうに笑う。","en":"The woman smiled happily.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r30","rowIndex":30,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「言いにくいのですが、私はここの客というわけではないのです」","en":"“This is difficult to say, but I am not actually here as a customer.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"太刀川良馬ペスト仮面","displayName":"Ryoma Tachikawa (Plague Mask)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r31","rowIndex":31,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして彼は覆面を外す。青白く頬の落ちた理知的な顔があらわになる。","en":"He removed his mask, revealing an intelligent face with pale skin and hollow cheeks.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r32","rowIndex":32,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>に会いたいのです。私の名は<tips=5>太刀川</tips>と言います」","en":"“I would like to see <tips=3>Chris Tse</tips>. My name is <tips=5>Tachikawa</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"太刀川良馬過去","displayName":"Ryoma Tachikawa (Past)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r33","rowIndex":33,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼は瞳の二つある目で、相手を見つめながらそう言った。","en":"As he spoke, he stared at the woman with an eye that contained two pupils.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r34","rowIndex":34,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ああ……」","en":"“Ah...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r35","rowIndex":35,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　女は溜息をつくと、","en":"The woman sighed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r36","rowIndex":36,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「うかがっています。ちょっと、ここでお待ちくださいね」","en":"“Yes, I've heard about you. Please wait here a moment.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r37","rowIndex":37,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　と、身につけかけていたエプロンを元の場所に戻し、音の鳴る戸を開けて「準備中」の札をかけると、奥に引っ込んだ。","en":"She put the apron she had begun to don back where it had been, opened the door with its scraping noise, hung out the PREPARING TO OPEN sign, and withdrew into the back.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r38","rowIndex":38,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　女が出してくれた茶を飲みながら三十分ほどぼんやりしていると、乱暴にドアが開き、体格の良い男が店に入ってきた。","en":"After he had spent roughly half an hour idly drinking the tea the woman had brought him, the door was thrown open and a powerfully built man entered.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r39","rowIndex":39,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あんたが<tips=5>太刀川</tips>さんだね？」","en":"“You’re Mr. <tips=5>Tachikawa</tips>, right?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬明（過去）","displayName":"Ma Ming (Past)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r40","rowIndex":40,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=5>太刀川</tips>と同じか、少し年下だろうか。短めの髪をオールバックにし、広い額の下に太い眉を持ったその男は陽気な態度でそう話しかけた。","en":"He looked about <tips=5>Tachikawa’s</tips> age, or perhaps a little younger. With his short hair swept straight back and thick eyebrows beneath a broad forehead, the man addressed him cheerfully.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r41","rowIndex":41,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=5>太刀川</tips>は無言で頷きを返す。","en":"<tips=5>Tachikawa</tips> responded with a silent nod.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r42","rowIndex":42,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「おれは<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>の弟分で<ruby=マー>馬</ruby>ってものです。あんたを迎えに来ました」","en":"“I’m Ma, one of <tips=3>Chris Tse’s</tips> sworn younger brothers. I’ve come to collect you.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬明（過去）","displayName":"Ma Ming (Past)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r43","rowIndex":43,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「移動するのですか？」","en":"“Are we going somewhere else?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"太刀川良馬過去","displayName":"Ryoma Tachikawa (Past)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r44","rowIndex":44,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「兄貴に会いたいんでしょう？　それならゆっくり話が出来る場所に行きましょう。ここじゃ店の人に迷惑がかかる」","en":"“You want to meet Big Brother, don’t you? Then let’s go somewhere we can talk at our leisure. We’d only cause trouble for the people here.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬明（過去）","displayName":"Ma Ming (Past)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r45","rowIndex":45,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　馬と名乗ったその熊のような身体をした男はそう言って笑う。","en":"The bear-like man who had introduced himself as Ma laughed as he spoke.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r46","rowIndex":46,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ふむ、迷惑をかけるような話をするつもりもないですが」","en":"“Hmm. I have no intention of discussing anything that would inconvenience them, but—”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"太刀川良馬過去","displayName":"Ryoma Tachikawa (Past)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r47","rowIndex":47,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=5>太刀川</tips>はマスクを手にとって立ち上がった。","en":"<tips=5>Tachikawa</tips> picked up his mask and rose.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r48","rowIndex":48,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「これをかぶらせて貰いますよ。あまり顔を晒したくないので」","en":"“I’ll be wearing this. I don’t want to show my face any more than necessary.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"太刀川良馬過去","displayName":"Ryoma Tachikawa (Past)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r49","rowIndex":49,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「かまいません、かまいません。どうぞ、こちらにいらしてください。いやあ、話は兄貴から聞いていますよ。すごい力を持ってらっしゃるようですな。ほら、ここは足元が段差になっているので気を付けてください」","en":"“Not at all, not at all. Please, come this way. Big Brother has told me about you. It seems you have quite an ability. Here, mind the step at your feet.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬明（過去）","displayName":"Ma Ming (Past)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r50","rowIndex":50,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　馬は従者のように<tips=5>太刀川</tips>のためにサッシを開け、彼を通してから自分も外に出て、元のように閉める。","en":"Like an attendant, Ma opened the aluminum-framed door for <tips=5>Tachikawa</tips>, let him pass through first, then went outside himself and closed it again.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r51","rowIndex":51,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　車は店のすぐ前に停めてあった。古びた軽トラックで、あちこちの塗装が剥げて茶色く錆び付いている。馬は<tips=5>太刀川</tips>のために助手席のドアを開け、彼が乗ると自分が運転席に座ってハンドルを握った。","en":"Their vehicle was parked directly outside the diner. It was an aging kei truck whose paint had flaked away in places, leaving brown rust. Ma opened the passenger door for <tips=5>Tachikawa</tips>. Once his guest was seated, he took his place behind the wheel.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r52","rowIndex":52,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いやあ、せっかくの客人をお迎えするのに、もっとマシな車を用意したかったのですが、あいにくこれしかなくて」","en":"“When we're going to the trouble of welcoming a guest, I'd have liked to bring a better car, but unfortunately this is the only one we have.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬明（過去）","displayName":"Ma Ming (Past)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r53","rowIndex":53,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　馬はそう言って頭をかく。","en":"Ma scratched his head.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r54","rowIndex":54,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　車は、ごみごみした<tips=58>パラシュート通り</tips>を、車などお構いなしに歩く通行人や、リヤカーを引く人を避けるため、何度も止まったりクラクションを鳴らしたりしながらゆっくり進んでいる。","en":"The truck crawled along crowded <tips=58>Parachute Street</tips>, repeatedly stopping and sounding its horn to avoid pedestrians who ignored the traffic, as well as people pulling handcarts.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r55","rowIndex":55,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　馬はくだらぬ雑談を一方的に話しながら、すぱすぱと煙草を吸う。車内に充満した煙に辟易した<tips=5>太刀川</tips>がそっと窓を開けても、気がつかない。","en":"Ma chain-smoked while keeping up a one-sided stream of pointless chatter. Even when <tips=5>Tachikawa</tips>, disgusted by the smoke filling the cab, quietly rolled down his window, Ma failed to notice.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r56","rowIndex":56,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　のろのろ進むと前方に人だかりが見えて来た。","en":"As they crept onward, a crowd came into view ahead.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r57","rowIndex":57,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　中心に乗用車があり、そのまわりを子供が取り囲んで窓や車体を手のひらでバンバンと叩いている。中には拳銃を持って窓に銃口をぴったりとくっつけているものもいる。","en":"A passenger car stood at its center, surrounded by children who slapped their palms against its windows and body. Some held pistols with their muzzles pressed directly against the glass.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r58","rowIndex":58,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「よそ者の車が入ってきたら、ああやって取り囲んで金を巻き上げるんだ。トラックだったら荷物も頂く。おれも子供の頃はやってましたよ」","en":"“Whenever an outsider’s car comes through, they surround it like that and shake the driver down. If it’s a truck, they take the cargo too. I used to do it myself when I was a kid.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬明（過去）","displayName":"Ma Ming (Past)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r59","rowIndex":59,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　馬が笑いながら言い、<tips=5>太刀川</tips>はマスクの下で顔を顰める。","en":"Ma said this with a laugh, while <tips=5>Tachikawa</tips> grimaced beneath his mask.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r60","rowIndex":60,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「兄貴は車を止めるのがうまかった」","en":"“Big Brother was brilliant at stopping cars.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬明（過去）","displayName":"Ma Ming (Past)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r61","rowIndex":61,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　馬は車の速度を落としてクラクションを鳴らし、その隣を通り過ぎる。そのとき取り囲まれた車の運転手の顔が見えたが、真っ青になって携帯電話になにか怒鳴りつけていた。","en":"Ma slowed the truck and sounded the horn as they passed alongside. Tachikawa caught sight of the driver in the surrounded car: his face had gone deathly pale, and he was shouting something into a mobile phone.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r62","rowIndex":62,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=9>Y地区</tips>には教会通りという大きな道路がある。","en":"<tips=9>Y District</tips> had a major thoroughfare called Church Street.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r63","rowIndex":63,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　このあたりがまだ基地であった頃、兵士やその家族のために建てられた教会がそのままの形で残っていたのでそう呼ばれた。","en":"When the area was still a military base, a church had been built there for the soldiers and their families. The building remained in its original form, lending the street its name.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r64","rowIndex":64,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　後に<tips=9>Y地区</tips>が本格的な発展を遂げると各種ブランドショップや銀行などが進出して、このあたりでは珍しく小綺麗な通りになるのだが、当時は他の通りとかわらない簡易住宅などが並ぶゴミゴミとした街であった。","en":"Later, when <tips=9>Y District</tips> underwent full-scale development, brand-name shops, banks, and other businesses moved in, turning Church Street into one of the few neat, presentable streets in the area. At the time, however, it was a congested jumble like any other street, lined with temporary housing and similar structures.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r65","rowIndex":65,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　馬の車は、この教会通りにある四階建ての小さなオフィスビルの前に停まる。","en":"Ma stopped the truck before a small, four-story office building on Church Street.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r66","rowIndex":66,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ここの二階です」","en":"“It’s on the second floor.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r67","rowIndex":67,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　建物の正面には錆び付いたシャッターが閉じられているだけで、出入り口は向かって左側の路地に入ったところにある銀色のアルミサッシが唯一のものらしい。馬がそれを開けると、入ってすぐのところで若者が三人煙草を吸って中国語で会話をしており、彼らは馬の姿を見ると、慌てて煙草を消して挨拶をした。","en":"Nothing but a rusted shutter, firmly closed, faced the street. The building’s only entrance appeared to be a silver aluminum-framed door down the alley on the left. When Ma opened it, they found three young men immediately inside, smoking and talking in Chinese. At the sight of Ma, they hastily extinguished their cigarettes and greeted him.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r68","rowIndex":68,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ドアを入ってすぐ左に階段がある。","en":"A staircase stood directly to the left of the entrance.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r69","rowIndex":69,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「急ですから、気をつけてください」","en":"“It’s steep, so watch your step.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r70","rowIndex":70,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　馬に促されながら薄暗い階段を上がり、廊下を歩いてすぐのドアから室内に入る。そこはソファなどが並んだ応接に使いそうな部屋だったが、奥に一つこちらに向けて設置された木製の机があり、そこに一人の青年が、年上の仲間たちを周囲に立たせながら椅子にふんぞりかえっていた。","en":"At Ma’s urging, Tachikawa climbed the dim staircase, walked a short way down a corridor, and entered through a door. The room, furnished with sofas, appeared intended for receiving visitors. At the far end, however, a wooden desk faced the entrance. A young man sat sprawled imperiously in the chair behind it, with older associates standing around him.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r71","rowIndex":71,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「やあ、待っていたよ」","en":"“Ah, I've been waiting for you.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー（過去・青年）","displayName":"Chris Tse (Past, Young)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r72","rowIndex":72,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>は<tips=5>太刀川</tips>の姿を見つけると立ち上がり、近づいて握手を求める。","en":"When <tips=3>Chris Tse</tips> saw <tips=5>Tachikawa</tips>, he rose, approached, and offered his hand.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r73","rowIndex":73,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「おっと、目を見たら心を読まれるんだったな」","en":"“Oh, that’s right. If I meet your eyes, you’ll read my mind.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー（過去・青年）","displayName":"Chris Tse (Past, Young)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r74","rowIndex":74,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=3>クリス</tips>は両目を閉じる。","en":"<tips=3>Chris</tips> closed both of his ordinary eyes.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r75","rowIndex":75,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どうだい？　これなら心を読めないか？」","en":"“How’s this? You can’t read my mind now, can you?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー（過去・青年）","displayName":"Chris Tse (Past, Young)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r76","rowIndex":76,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　と言ったが、三つ目の目は開いたままである。それを見た<tips=5>太刀川</tips>は溜息をつき、","en":"So he said, though his third eye remained open. Seeing this, <tips=5>Tachikawa</tips> sighed, and—","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r77","rowIndex":77,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「こっちだって、やたらと他人の感情を流し込まれるのは不快ですから、そう滅多に人の目を見ませんよ」","en":"“It's unpleasant for me too, having other people's emotions pour into me at every opportunity. I don't look people in the eye very often.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"太刀川良馬ペスト仮面","displayName":"Ryoma Tachikawa (Plague Mask)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r78","rowIndex":78,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　マスクを脱ぎながらそれに応じる。","en":"He accepted the handshake as he removed his mask.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r79","rowIndex":79,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「久しぶりですね。<ruby=ロンタオ><tips=81>龍頭</tips></ruby>」","en":"“It has been some time, <tips=81>Longtou</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"太刀川良馬過去","displayName":"Ryoma Tachikawa (Past)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r80","rowIndex":80,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ふむ」","en":"“Hmm.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー（過去・青年）","displayName":"Chris Tse (Past, Young)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r81","rowIndex":81,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=5>太刀川</tips>の呼びかけに、<tips=3>クリス</tips>は顔をしかめる。","en":"<tips=3>Chris</tips> frowned at <tips=5>Tachikawa’s</tips> form of address.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r82","rowIndex":82,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あんたはそんな風におれを呼ぶ必要はない。部下ではないんだからな。それにしても、その呼び方を使うとはな」","en":"“You don't need to call me that. You're not one of my men. Still, I didn't expect you to know that form of address.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー（過去・青年）","displayName":"Chris Tse (Past, Young)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r83","rowIndex":83,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「私もあれから調べたんですよ。<tips=3>クリス</tips>、きみは確かにこの街ではちょっとした有名人のようです。香港出身の黒社会『<tips=69>義勝</tips>』の若きリーダーで、<tips=68>木下組</tips>を抗争の末に地域から追い払ったと書いてありました」","en":"“I did some research of my own afterward. <tips=3>Chris</tips>, you do appear to be something of a celebrity in this city. I read that you are the young leader of <tips=69>Yisheng</tips>, a Hong Kong underworld organization, and that after a violent conflict you drove the <tips=68>Kinoshita-gumi</tips> from the area.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"太刀川良馬過去","displayName":"Ryoma Tachikawa (Past)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r84","rowIndex":84,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どこで調べたのか知らないが、その情報はガセだな。やつらはまだ<tips=57>滑走路通り</tips>でも<tips=59>暗闇通り</tips>でも平気でうろついてやがる。これじゃあ駄目だ。恐ろしくてとても足を踏み入れられないくらいやってやらないと」","en":"“I don’t know where you did your research, but that part is bunk. Those bastards still stroll around <tips=57>Runway Street</tips> and <tips=59>Darkness Street</tips> without a care in the world. This won’t do. We have to hit them so hard they’re too terrified even to set foot there.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー（過去・青年）","displayName":"Chris Tse (Past, Young)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r85","rowIndex":85,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=3>クリス</tips>は肩をすくめて溜息をついた。","en":"<tips=3>Chris</tips> shrugged and sighed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r86","rowIndex":86,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「しかし、おれの言った通りになったな。必ず来ると思ってたんだ。あんたの様に人の気持ちを読む能力はないが、それくらいは分かるんだぜ？」","en":"“But it happened just as I said it would. I knew you’d come. I can’t read people’s feelings like you, but even I can tell that much.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー（過去・青年）","displayName":"Chris Tse (Past, Young)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r87","rowIndex":87,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=3>クリス</tips>はソファーに座り、<tips=5>太刀川</tips>にも座るよう促す。","en":"<tips=3>Chris</tips> sat on a sofa and motioned for <tips=5>Tachikawa</tips> to do the same.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r88","rowIndex":88,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「不本意でしたがね」","en":"“Much against my better judgment.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"太刀川良馬過去","displayName":"Ryoma Tachikawa (Past)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r89","rowIndex":89,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=5>太刀川</tips>が言われたとおり座ると、MA-1ジャケットを着た若者が、二人の前にそれぞれ珈琲を置く。","en":"When <tips=5>Tachikawa</tips> sat as directed, a young man in an MA-1 jacket set a cup of coffee before each of them.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r90","rowIndex":90,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「もちろん、もうこれ以上深入りすべきではないという常識的な考えも頭の中で囁きましたよ。でも気になることがいくつかあったんです。だから調べたんですよ。色々とね。……街の成り立ち、現在の状況、<tips=18>ローズ・クラブ</tips>を取り巻く様々な問題など、ネット、新聞、書籍、さまざまな資料を渉猟しました。それで気が済むだろうと思っていたのですが、資料を見るだけじゃどうしても納得出来なかった。肝心なことは何も書いてないですしね。だから私はすべてを知るためにここにやって来たんです」","en":"“Naturally, common sense whispered that I should involve myself no further. But several matters continued to trouble me, so I investigated them—all sorts of things. I scoured the internet, newspapers, books, and other sources for information about the city’s origins, its current situation, and the various problems surrounding the <tips=18>Rose Club</tips>. I expected that would satisfy me, yet consulting sources alone did not. Nothing contained what mattered most. And so I have come here to learn everything.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"太刀川良馬過去","displayName":"Ryoma Tachikawa (Past)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r91","rowIndex":91,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「例の女か」","en":"“That woman from the club?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー（過去・青年）","displayName":"Chris Tse (Past, Young)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r92","rowIndex":92,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=3>クリス</tips>は<tips=5>太刀川</tips>の表情を観察している。","en":"<tips=3>Chris</tips> studied <tips=5>Tachikawa’s</tips> expression.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r93","rowIndex":93,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=5>太刀川</tips>は答えない。","en":"<tips=5>Tachikawa</tips> did not answer.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r94","rowIndex":94,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「隠さなくたっていい。誰にも恥じるようなことじゃないさ」","en":"“You don't have to hide it. It's not something you need to be ashamed of in front of anyone.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー（過去・青年）","displayName":"Chris Tse (Past, Young)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r95","rowIndex":95,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……確かに彼女のことが一番の理由ですが、それだけではないんです。この街についてもっと知りたいんですよ。今まで私が知らなかったような人々が、私の知らない世界を作っている。そこにはもしかしたら、私にとっても価値のある何かがあるのかもしれない。そんな気がしたんです」","en":"“...She is certainly my chief reason, but not the only one. I want to know more about this city. People I never knew existed are creating a world unknown to me. Perhaps there is something there of value even to me. That was the feeling I had.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"太刀川良馬過去","displayName":"Ryoma Tachikawa (Past)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r96","rowIndex":96,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いいねえ。ドクターはじつに良いことを言う」","en":"“I like that. You really do say some fine things, Doc.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー（過去・青年）","displayName":"Chris Tse (Past, Young)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r97","rowIndex":97,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=3>クリス</tips>は笑った。","en":"<tips=3>Chris</tips> laughed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r98","rowIndex":98,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いや失敬。からかったわけじゃないんだ。あんたは見かけによらず子供のように純粋だ。そこが気にいってるんだよ。おれと同類の人間だからね」","en":"“No, pardon me. I wasn’t making fun of you. Despite your appearance, you’re as pure as a child. That’s what I like about you. You and I are the same kind of man.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー（過去・青年）","displayName":"Chris Tse (Past, Young)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r99","rowIndex":99,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=5>太刀川</tips>は無表情に押し黙るだけで、やはり肯定も否定もしない。","en":"<tips=5>Tachikawa</tips> merely fell silent, his expression blank. Once again, he neither affirmed nor denied the claim.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r100","rowIndex":100,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=3>クリス</tips>は気にせず、前屈みになって珈琲を一口すすると、言葉を続ける。","en":"Undeterred, <tips=3>Chris</tips> leaned forward, took a sip of coffee, and continued.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r101","rowIndex":101,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「目的はよく分かった。でも、ただ傍観者でいることは出来ないぜ？　すべてを知りたいなら、プレイヤーになるしかない。それがどういうことか、わかっているのかい？」","en":"“I understand your purpose. But you can’t remain a mere observer. If you want to know everything, you have no choice but to become a player. Do you understand what that means?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー（過去・青年）","displayName":"Chris Tse (Past, Young)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r102","rowIndex":102,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「もちろん」","en":"“Of course.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"太刀川良馬過去","displayName":"Ryoma Tachikawa (Past)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r103","rowIndex":103,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「確認するが、ここに来ておれにそういう話をするってことは、<tips=69>義勝</tips>を手伝ってもらうってことだ」","en":"“Let me be sure. Coming here and telling me all this means you’ll be helping <tips=69>Yisheng</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー（過去・青年）","displayName":"Chris Tse (Past, Young)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r104","rowIndex":104,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=3>クリス</tips>は挑発的に言うが、<tips=5>太刀川</tips>はあまり変化のない表情のまま力まずに答える。","en":"<tips=3>Chris’s</tips> tone was challenging, but <tips=5>Tachikawa</tips> answered without any outward sign of tension, his expression scarcely changing.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r105","rowIndex":105,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「私に出来ることがあるならば」","en":"“If there is anything I can do.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"太刀川良馬過去","displayName":"Ryoma Tachikawa (Past)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r106","rowIndex":106,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「これまであんたが生きて来た世界とは全然違うってことは理解しているか？」","en":"“Do you understand that this is a completely different world from the one you’ve lived in until now?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー（過去・青年）","displayName":"Chris Tse (Past, Young)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r107","rowIndex":107,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「くどいですね」","en":"“You're repeating yourself.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"太刀川良馬過去","displayName":"Ryoma Tachikawa (Past)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r108","rowIndex":108,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=5>太刀川</tips>は眉間にしわをよせる。","en":"<tips=5>Tachikawa</tips> furrowed his brow.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r109","rowIndex":109,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そりゃそうさ。ここに来るだろうとは思っていたが、そこまで言うとは思わなかった。これからおれは相当荒っぽいことをやろうとしている。あんたの歩いて来た立派な道を踏み外すことになるだろう。覚悟を聞かなきゃ信用出来ない」","en":"“Of course. I expected you to come here, but I didn’t expect you to go that far. What I’m about to do is going to get extremely rough. You’ll be stepping off the honorable path you’ve walked. I can’t trust you until I know you’re prepared for that.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー（過去・青年）","displayName":"Chris Tse (Past, Young)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r110","rowIndex":110,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「きみはあの夜何の見返りも求めないで私を脱出させてくれた。そして私はきみの心を見ておかしな人間じゃないと思った。だから私はきみを信用した。それだけです。これじゃ理由になりませんか？」","en":"“That night, you helped me escape without asking for anything in return. And when I looked into your heart, I decided you were not a suspicious sort of man. That is why I trusted you. That is all. Does that not qualify as a reason?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"太刀川良馬過去","displayName":"Ryoma Tachikawa (Past)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r111","rowIndex":111,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ははっ！」","en":"“Ha!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー（過去・青年）","displayName":"Chris Tse (Past, Young)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r112","rowIndex":112,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=3>クリス</tips>はさも愉快そうに身体を揺すって笑うと、","en":"<tips=3>Chris</tips> rocked with laughter, plainly delighted.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r113","rowIndex":113,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あんたの両親がそれを聞いたら泣くだろうよ。だが最高だ。あんたが力を貸してくれる限り、我々も全力であんたを保護しよう」","en":"“Your parents would weep if they heard that. But it’s fantastic. As long as you lend us your strength, we will do everything in our power to protect you.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー（過去・青年）","displayName":"Chris Tse (Past, Young)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r114","rowIndex":114,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ありがとうございます。……もっとも、役に立つかどうかは保証しませんが」","en":"“Thank you. Though I can’t promise I’ll be of any use.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"太刀川良馬過去","displayName":"Ryoma Tachikawa (Past)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r115","rowIndex":115,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「感情が読めるんだろう？　その能力を使うために、ややこしい限定条件とかはないよな？」","en":"“You can read emotions, can’t you? There aren’t any complicated restrictions on using that ability, are there?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー（過去・青年）","displayName":"Chris Tse (Past, Young)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r116","rowIndex":116,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「目が見えれば。読めるのは感情だけで、表層的な思考は読めませんがね」","en":"“If I can see their eyes. I can read only emotions, however, not surface thoughts.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"太刀川良馬過去","displayName":"Ryoma Tachikawa (Past)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r117","rowIndex":117,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「素晴らしい。感情だけで充分だ。……よし、じゃあちょっと来て貰おう。これからおれの計画のことを話す前に、ちょっと会って貰いたい人間がいるんだ」","en":"“Wonderful. Emotions alone are enough. Good—come with me, then. Before I tell you about my plan, there’s someone I’d like you to meet.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー（過去・青年）","displayName":"Chris Tse (Past, Young)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r118","rowIndex":118,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　せっかちな<tips=3>クリス</tips>はもう立ち上がりながらそう言う。","en":"The impatient <tips=3>Chris</tips> was already getting to his feet as he said this.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r119","rowIndex":119,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「会う？」","en":"“Meet?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"太刀川良馬過去","displayName":"Ryoma Tachikawa (Past)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r120","rowIndex":120,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「安心しな。今度はおんぼろの軽トラックじゃなくて、ピカピカの車を用意してある」","en":"“Relax. This time I’ve got a gleaming car waiting, not some beat-up pickup.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー（過去・青年）","displayName":"Chris Tse (Past, Young)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r121","rowIndex":121,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「誰と会うのですか？」","en":"“Who are we going to meet?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"太刀川良馬過去","displayName":"Ryoma Tachikawa (Past)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r122","rowIndex":122,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=5>太刀川</tips>は怪訝な顔をする。","en":"<tips=5>Tachikawa</tips> looked at him in puzzlement.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r123","rowIndex":123,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あんたが命がけで助けたあの子を、預かってもらってる人間だよ。調達屋をやってる女さ。<tips=31>エリー・ホワイト</tips>って言うんだ。みんな、『<tips=31>ミス・ホワイト</tips>』って呼んでる」","en":"“The person looking after the girl you risked your life to save. A woman who works as a procurement broker. Her name is <tips=31>Ellie White</tips>. Everyone calls her <tips=31>Miss White</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー（過去・青年）","displayName":"Chris Tse (Past, Young)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r124","rowIndex":124,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=3>クリス</tips>はそう言うと、部下が差し出したジャケットに腕を通した。","en":"With that, <tips=3>Chris</tips> slipped his arms into the jacket one of his men held out for him.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r125","rowIndex":125,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　車は『<tips=69>義勝</tips>』の事務所を静かに出発する。","en":"The car pulled quietly away from <tips=69>Yisheng's</tips> office.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r126","rowIndex":126,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　黒塗りのセダンを運転するのは、<tips=39>ジェフリー・ウォン</tips>。","en":"At the wheel of the black sedan was <tips=39>Jeffrey Wong</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r127","rowIndex":127,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　額に蒼い血管の浮かぶこの神経質そうな青年も、馬と同じく<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>の義兄弟だ。","en":"This nervous-looking young man, blue veins standing out on his forehead, was, like Ma, one of <tips=3>Chris Tse’s</tips> sworn brothers.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r128","rowIndex":128,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=69>義勝</tips>内での地位は『白紙扇』で、いわゆる参謀とか軍師といった知的な側面をサポートする役職だが、何人かいる白紙扇のなかではもっとも若年で、就任したばかりであるため、もっぱら<tips=3>クリス</tips>の秘書的な役割であった。その他、帳簿を管理して、事務を円滑に進める能力が高い。","en":"Within <tips=69>Yisheng</tips>, he held the rank of White Paper Fan—an adviser or strategist responsible for the intellectual side of the organization. He was the youngest of its several White Paper Fans and had only recently been appointed, so he served chiefly as <tips=3>Chris's</tips> secretary. He was also adept at keeping the books and making sure the organization's administrative work ran smoothly.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r129","rowIndex":129,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　義勝と言えば武闘派として知られ、血の気の多い者ばかりの組織なのでなかなか評価をされないが、彼が入ってから組織としてのまとまりが生まれ、数年前まで弱小だった<tips=69>義勝</tips>が他の有力組織と戦えるところまで成長した要因の一つだと言われている。","en":"Yisheng was known as a fighting outfit, an organization full of hotheads, so Jeffrey's abilities seldom received their due. Nevertheless, it was said that his arrival had given the organization cohesion, and that he was one reason the once-minor <tips=69>Yisheng</tips> had grown strong enough to contend with the other major powers.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r130","rowIndex":130,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　馬と名乗った男……<tips=4>馬明</tips>は『<tips=80>紅棍</tips>』といって武力面でのリーダーで、<tips=69>義勝</tips>での役割は抗争の場での現場指揮官的な役割だ。腕力が強く、拳法の達人で、並の<tips=17>タイプB</tips>なら素手で対等以上に渡りあう。そして人望もあった。","en":"The man who had introduced himself as Ma—<tips=4>Ma Ming</tips>—held the rank of <tips=80>Red Pole</tips>, a leader in matters of force whose role in <tips=69>Yisheng</tips> was akin to that of a field commander during conflicts. He possessed tremendous physical strength, was a master of martial arts, and could more than hold his own barehanded against an ordinary <tips=17>Type B</tips>. He also commanded considerable respect.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r131","rowIndex":131,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=17>タイプB</tips>は情緒面で脆いところがあり、組織ではリスク要因になりやすく、<tips=69>義勝</tips>は伝統的に組織のなかから<tips=17>タイプB</tips>を排除していたが、彼は<tips=17>タイプB</tips>でも積極的に採用して自分の部下にする。そして、持ち前の明るさと見かけによらぬ気遣いで彼らをうまく活用した。","en":"<tips=17>Type Bs</tips> were emotionally fragile and therefore prone to becoming liabilities within an organization, so <tips=69>Yisheng</tips> had traditionally excluded <tips=17>Type Bs</tips> from its ranks. Ma, however, actively recruited <tips=17>Type Bs</tips> and made them his own subordinates, then put them to effective use through his natural cheer and a thoughtfulness his appearance belied.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r132","rowIndex":132,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　三年ほど前から<tips=9>Y地区</tips>のなかではマフィア同士の抗争が激しくなり、<tips=69>義勝</tips>はもっぱら地元のやくざである<tips=68>木下組</tips>とロシアンマフィアを相手にして戦ったが、彼はそこで<tips=3>クリス</tips>と共にめざましく活躍した。<tips=80>紅棍</tips>の中で最も優れたものは<tips=80>双花紅棍</tips>と呼ばれるが、彼が次の<tips=80>双花紅棍</tips>になることは確実視されており、それどころか、すでに将来は<tips=85>二路元帥</tips>になるとまで言われている。","en":"Conflict among <tips=9>Y District’s</tips> criminal organizations had intensified about three years earlier, and <tips=69>Yisheng</tips> fought chiefly against the local <tips=68>Kinoshita-gumi</tips> and the Russian mafia. Ma distinguished himself in those battles alongside <tips=3>Chris</tips>. The finest among the <tips=80>Red Poles</tips> were called <tips=80>Double Flower Red Poles</tips>, and Ma was considered certain to become the next <tips=80>Double Flower Red Pole</tips>; indeed, people were already saying he would one day rise to <tips=85>Second Route Marshal</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r133","rowIndex":133,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　この二人が新<tips=81>龍頭</tips><tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>が最も信頼を置いている部下であった。","en":"These two were the subordinates in whom the new <tips=81>Longtou</tips>, <tips=3>Chris Tse</tips>, placed the greatest trust.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r134","rowIndex":134,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして、その<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>自身について。","en":"And as for <tips=3>Chris Tse</tips> himself.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r135","rowIndex":135,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　中国名は謝大輝。彼は<tips=69>義勝</tips>を支配する謝一族のなかでは傍流となる一家の当主であり、昨年<tips=81>龍頭</tips>の地位に就いたばかりの若々しいリーダーであった。","en":"His Chinese name was Tse Tai-fai. He headed a cadet branch of the Tse family that controlled <tips=69>Yisheng</tips>, and was a youthful leader who had taken the seat of <tips=81>Longtou</tips> only the year before.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r136","rowIndex":136,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=69>義勝</tips>はもともと香港で活動をしていた組織で、先々代の<tips=81>龍頭</tips>が部下と共に<tips=9>Y地区</tips>に移住し、活動を開始した。当初は香港でもっとも巨大な黒社会『三合会』の先遣部隊的な役割を持っていたのだが、三合会の内部のお家騒動の影響で撤退が決まった。その時<tips=69>義勝</tips>は香港に戻るものと、<tips=9>Y地区</tips>に留まるものとで二つに分裂した。留まった方の<tips=69>義勝</tips>は、人数が減った分を<tips=9>Y地区</tips>内の香港や広東省出身のもので補充し、現在のかたちとなったのである。","en":"<tips=69>Yisheng</tips> had originally operated in Hong Kong. The <tips=81>Longtou</tips> two generations before Chris moved to <tips=9>Y District</tips> with his subordinates and began operating there. At first, they served as a kind of advance detachment for the Triad, Hong Kong's largest underworld organization, but an internal power struggle led to the order to withdraw. <tips=69>Yisheng</tips> then split in two: those who returned to Hong Kong and those who remained in <tips=9>Y District</tips>. The latter <tips=69>Yisheng</tips> replenished its depleted ranks with <tips=9>Y District</tips> residents who hailed from Hong Kong or Guangdong, taking on its present form.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r137","rowIndex":137,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　武闘派として恐れられてはいたが組織の規模としては大きいというわけでもなく、<tips=9>Y地区</tips>内での影響力は薄かった。","en":"Though feared as a hard-fighting outfit, the organization was not especially large and wielded little influence in <tips=9>Y District</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r138","rowIndex":138,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それが急に名を上げたのは、<tips=68>木下組</tips>との戦いにおいてである。","en":"It suddenly made a name for itself in its war against the <tips=68>Kinoshita-gumi</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r139","rowIndex":139,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=68>木下組</tips>が<tips=9>Y地区</tips>に進出すると、他の多くの弱小組織と同じように、<tips=69>義勝</tips>も吸収、あるいは壊滅の憂き目に遭う運命となったのだが、そのとき組織を救ったのがこの<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>であった。","en":"When the <tips=68>Kinoshita-gumi</tips> moved into <tips=9>Y District</tips>, <tips=69>Yisheng</tips>, like so many other minor organizations, seemed destined to be absorbed or destroyed. The man who saved it from that fate was <tips=3>Chris Tse</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r140","rowIndex":140,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼の武器は、いかなる時にも動じない勇気と、機転、そして生まれながらに持ったサイキックとしての能力だった。<tips=80>紅棍</tips>であった父が死に、そのあとを継ぐと、すぐにめきめきと頭角を現すことになる。","en":"His weapons were courage that never deserted him, whatever the circumstances; quick wits; and the psychic ability he had possessed from birth. When his father, a <tips=80>Red Pole</tips>, died and Chris succeeded him, he quickly rose to prominence.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r141","rowIndex":141,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼のサイキック能力はすさまじい。こちらから襲撃する際にはどこに隠れた敵でも発見し、相手の気づかぬ場所から的確に奇襲をしかけることが出来る。逆に守る立場になっても事前に察知して奇襲を受けるようなことはなく、どんな窮地からも危なげなく脱した。","en":"His psychic power was formidable. On the attack, he could locate an enemy no matter where they hid, then strike with precision from a position they never suspected. On the defensive, he sensed attacks beforehand, was never taken by surprise, and emerged safely from every predicament.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r142","rowIndex":142,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　マフィアたちは多くのサイキックを戦闘部隊に加えていたが、それでも<tips=3>クリス</tips>を葬り去ることは出来なかった。そして<tips=69>義勝</tips>は躍進し、混乱時代に勢力を拡大した唯一の組織として、他の有力組織と肩を並べるところまで来たのである。","en":"The criminal organizations had added many psychics to their combat units, yet even they could not kill <tips=3>Chris</tips>. <tips=69>Yisheng</tips> flourished, becoming the only organization to expand during the years of turmoil, until it stood alongside the district's other major powers.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r143","rowIndex":143,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>はこの抗争の間に<tips=85>二路元帥</tips>まで昇進しており、去年先代が隠居すると、その座を引き継いで<tips=81>龍頭</tips>となった。順当な出世と言っていいだろう。","en":"<tips=3>Chris Tse</tips> had risen as far as <tips=85>Second Route Marshal</tips> during that conflict, and when the previous leader retired the year before, Chris succeeded him as <tips=81>Longtou</tips>. It was, by any measure, a natural rise through the ranks.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r144","rowIndex":144,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして<tips=81>龍頭</tips>となってからも<tips=3>クリス</tips>の勢いは衰えず、<tips=9>Y地区</tips>で他の有力組織と縄張り争いを繰り広げている。","en":"Even after becoming <tips=81>Longtou</tips>, <tips=3>Chris</tips> lost none of his momentum and continued fighting the other major organizations for territory in <tips=9>Y District</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r145","rowIndex":145,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　当時こうした裏社会の事情のすべてが文書化されていたわけではなく、<tips=5>太刀川</tips>の調査はごく表面的な噂程度の話を拾い集めたものに過ぎなかったが、それでも、<tips=3>クリス</tips>の華々しい活躍を知るには充分だった。この時すでに<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>は<tips=9>Y地区</tips>で最も有名なギャングスターだったのである。","en":"The affairs of the underworld had not all been documented at the time, and <tips=5>Tachikawa’s</tips> research amounted to no more than a collection of superficial rumors. Even so, it was enough to acquaint him with <tips=3>Chris’s</tips> spectacular exploits. By then, <tips=3>Chris Tse</tips> was already the most famous gangster in <tips=9>Y District</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r146","rowIndex":146,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=5>太刀川</tips>は、今の自分のおかれている状況が、実に奇妙なものだと感じないわけにはいかなかった。仏頂面で運転しているのが『白紙扇』の<tips=39>ジェフリー・ウォン</tips>。助手席で鼻歌交じりに冗談を言って笑っているのが『<tips=80>紅棍</tips>』の<tips=4>馬明</tips>。後部座席には自分と、あの<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>が並んで座っている。そして、今向かっているのは武器商人の女の家だというのだ。","en":"<tips=5>Tachikawa</tips> could not help finding his present circumstances utterly bizarre. The sullen man driving was <tips=39>Jeffrey Wong</tips>, the White Paper Fan. In the passenger seat, humming, cracking jokes, and laughing, was <tips=4>Ma Ming</tips>, the <tips=80>Red Pole</tips>. In the back seat, Tachikawa sat beside none other than <tips=3>Chris Tse</tips>. And their destination, he had been told, was the home of a woman who dealt in weapons.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r147","rowIndex":147,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ここにいるのは本当に自分だろうか？","en":"Was that really him sitting here?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r148","rowIndex":148,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そんな風に首を傾けたくなるような思いだ。","en":"The thought was enough to make him cock his head in disbelief.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r149","rowIndex":149,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　裕福な家庭で育ち、厳格な両親のもと塾と学校に通い、たまに友人と映画を見に行ったりするくらいの平凡な学生生活。そのまま順調にステップを踏み、医師になった。サイキックではあるが、ほとんどそれに頼らない生き方をしてきたので、ここまでは特別なことは何もない人生だった。","en":"He had grown up in a wealthy home, attending school and cram school under strict parents and occasionally going to the movies with friends. That was the extent of his uneventful student life. He had proceeded smoothly along that path until he became a doctor. Though a psychic, he had lived his life with scarcely any reliance on his power. Until now, nothing about it had been exceptional.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r150","rowIndex":150,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　改めて考えると、とても信じられない状況なのである。この自分が、本当に命のやりとりをする世界に足を踏み入れようとしているなんて。思春期の時でさえろくに反抗期もなく平穏にすごし、およそ人を殴ったり殴られたりしたこともなく育って来たというのに――。","en":"The more he considered it, the less believable his position became. That he, of all people, was truly about to set foot in a world where lives were taken and lost. Even in adolescence he had passed his days peacefully, without any real rebellious phase, and had grown up scarcely ever striking another person or being struck himself—","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r151","rowIndex":151,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　大学の時に悪友に誘われて悪所へ誘われたのがきっかけだったのか？　いや、もしかしたらこうなる運命だったのかもしれない。","en":"Had it begun when a bad friend from university took him to a den of vice? No—perhaps he had been destined to come to this all along.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r152","rowIndex":152,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　少年時代、布団についてからぼんやり夢想していたことを思い出す。","en":"He remembered the idle fantasies that used to visit him in bed as a boy.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r153","rowIndex":153,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　今もそうだが、当時もサイキック能力を使うということは道徳的にも、自分の成長のためにもよくないことだと教えられる。彼は従順な生徒で、教わった通りほとんど能力を使わないで毎日を過ごしていた。しかし、その一方で、ゲームや漫画のヒーローみたいに思う存分に能力を使って活躍する自分の姿を空想していたのも事実である。","en":"Then as now, he was taught that using psychic powers was wrong, both morally and for his own development. He was an obedient student and passed his days using his abilities hardly at all, just as he had been taught. Yet it was also true that he imagined himself wielding them freely and performing feats worthy of the heroes in games and manga.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r154","rowIndex":154,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それはスパイ映画の主人公のように、危険を冒して巨大な何かと戦い、美女と恋をする。あるいは、頼りになる仲間と共に、不思議な世界を冒険する。そんな自分を夢想していたのだ。","en":"Like the protagonist of a spy film, he would brave danger to battle some immense power and fall in love with a beautiful woman. Or he would explore a strange world with trustworthy companions. That was the self he had dreamed of being.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r155","rowIndex":155,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そしていま、多少形は違うが現実になろうとしている。","en":"And now, though the shape of it differed somewhat, the fantasy was on the verge of becoming real.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r156","rowIndex":156,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　敵は人の命と肉体を残酷に弄ぶおぞましい娯楽施設。そこには、はじめて心から恋した女性がかかわっている。それを打倒しようとしているギャングのリーダーが、自分のサイキック能力を求め、それに応じた。そしてこれから彼と共闘しようというのだ。","en":"As he saw it, his enemy was a hideous entertainment complex that cruelly toyed with human lives and bodies. The first woman he had ever truly loved was entangled with it. A gang leader intent on bringing it down had sought his psychic powers, and he had agreed. Now he was about to fight at that man's side.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r157","rowIndex":157,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ずっと忘れていた少年時代の妄想を、車に揺られながら、ふと思い出してしまった。","en":"As the car carried him along, the boyhood fantasy he had long forgotten unexpectedly returned to him.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r158","rowIndex":158,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そうした上で車のバックミラーに写ったペスト医の仮面をかぶった自分の姿を見ると、少年時代の夢想とのギャップでどうにも苦い顔になる。この格好は、アニメなら悪役が身につけるものだろう。","en":"Then he caught sight of himself in the rearview mirror, wearing the plague-doctor mask, and could only grimace at the gulf between the sight and his boyhood dreams. In an anime, this was the sort of outfit a villain would wear.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r159","rowIndex":159,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ドクター、どうした？」","en":"“Doctor, what’s wrong?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー（過去・青年）","displayName":"Chris Tse (Past, Young)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r160","rowIndex":160,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　黙り込んでしまった<tips=5>太刀川</tips>に、<tips=3>クリス</tips>がそう話しかける。","en":"<tips=3>Chris</tips> addressed <tips=5>Tachikawa</tips>, who had fallen silent.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r161","rowIndex":161,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いや、なんでもありません」","en":"“No, it's nothing.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"太刀川良馬ペスト仮面","displayName":"Ryoma Tachikawa (Plague Mask)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r162","rowIndex":162,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=5>太刀川</tips>は溜息をつき、","en":"<tips=5>Tachikawa</tips> sighed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r163","rowIndex":163,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あの子は……<tips=32>アサヒ</tips>は元気でいますか？　無理矢理脱出させてしまって、その後のことを気にしてはいたのです」","en":"“That girl... Is <tips=32>Asahi</tips> doing well? I made her escape against her will, and I've been worried about what happened to her afterward.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"太刀川良馬ペスト仮面","displayName":"Ryoma Tachikawa (Plague Mask)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r164","rowIndex":164,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「大丈夫だよ。すっかり元気になってる。あんたにも感謝してるぜ」","en":"“She’s fine. Completely recovered. And she’s grateful to you.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー（過去・青年）","displayName":"Chris Tse (Past, Young)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r165","rowIndex":165,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それならよかった」","en":"“I’m glad to hear it.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"太刀川良馬ペスト仮面","displayName":"Ryoma Tachikawa (Plague Mask)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r166","rowIndex":166,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「おれたちにとっても彼女を連れて来られたのはラッキーだった。<tips=18>ローズ・クラブ</tips>の内側の話をたくさん聞けたよ。いやあ、聞けば聞くほど胸くそ悪くなる場所だぜ、あそこは。……そうだ、ドクターにも聞いて貰いたい話が一つあるんだ」","en":"“We were lucky to bring her back with us, too. She told us a great deal about the inside of the <tips=18>Rose Club</tips>. God, the more I hear about that place, the sicker it makes me... Oh, that reminds me. There's one story in particular I'd like you to hear, Doc.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー（過去・青年）","displayName":"Chris Tse (Past, Young)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r167","rowIndex":167,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……どんな話ですか？」","en":"“...What sort of story?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"太刀川良馬ペスト仮面","displayName":"Ryoma Tachikawa (Plague Mask)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r168","rowIndex":168,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=5>太刀川</tips>が尋ね返すと、<tips=3>クリス</tips>はもったいぶって笑い、","en":"When <tips=5>Tachikawa</tips> asked, <tips=3>Chris</tips> smiled, drawing out the suspense.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r169","rowIndex":169,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「向こうに着いたら本人に話させよう。あんたがどう解釈するか楽しみだ」","en":"“When we get there, I’ll have her tell you herself. I’m looking forward to hearing how you interpret it.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"太刀川良馬ペスト仮面","displayName":"Ryoma Tachikawa (Plague Mask)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r170","rowIndex":170,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　と言った。","en":"That was all he said.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r171","rowIndex":171,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして車は『<tips=31>ミス・ホワイト</tips>』の屋敷に到着する。","en":"The car arrived at <tips=31>Miss White’s</tips> mansion.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r172","rowIndex":172,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その密輸入組織の女ボスは、黒い服を着て、黒い帽子を身につけ、上に行くほど色が濃くなる黒いヴェールで顔を隠していた。垣間見える唇は若々しい赤い口紅で塗りたくられ、肌は白い化粧が分厚くほどこされているが、その周囲の皺は隠せない。","en":"The woman who headed the smuggling organization wore a black dress and black hat, her face concealed by a black veil that darkened toward the top. The lips visible beneath it were slathered in youthful red lipstick. Her skin was caked in white makeup, yet the wrinkles around her mouth remained visible.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r173","rowIndex":173,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　孔雀の羽を広げたような背もたれのある、ピーコックチェアにゆったりと腰掛けている。","en":"She reclined at ease in a peacock chair, its back spread like the bird’s tail.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r174","rowIndex":174,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「こんにちは」","en":"“Good afternoon.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"太刀川良馬ペスト仮面","displayName":"Ryoma Tachikawa (Plague Mask)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r175","rowIndex":175,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=5>太刀川</tips>が握手のために手を差し出すと、","en":"<tips=5>Tachikawa</tips> extended his hand for a handshake.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r176","rowIndex":176,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「人に会うのに、随分と気色の悪い仮面をかぶっているわね」","en":"“That’s an awfully repulsive mask to wear when meeting someone.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r177","rowIndex":177,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女は自分の手をピクリとも動かさず、<tips=5>太刀川</tips>が差し出した手を無視した上で、そう言った。酒に焼けたようなしわがれ声だ。","en":"Without so much as twitching her own hand, she ignored <tips=5>Tachikawa’s</tips> outstretched hand and said this in a hoarse voice, as though scorched by liquor.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r178","rowIndex":178,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いつも辛気くさい葬式の格好をしている人には言われたくないだろうよ」","en":"“That’s rich coming from someone forever dressed for a dreary funeral.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー（過去・青年）","displayName":"Chris Tse (Past, Young)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r179","rowIndex":179,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=3>クリス</tips>は笑い飛ばして、","en":"<tips=3>Chris</tips> laughed it off.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r180","rowIndex":180,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まあ、この人は色々わけありでね。顔も名前も公にするわけにはいかないんだ。そうだな、『ドクター』と呼んでやってくれ」","en":"“He has his reasons. He can't let his face or name become public. Call him 'Doctor.'”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー（過去・青年）","displayName":"Chris Tse (Past, Young)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r181","rowIndex":181,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「失礼なのは承知しております。申し訳ありません」","en":"“I know it is discourteous. My apologies.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"太刀川良馬ペスト仮面","displayName":"Ryoma Tachikawa (Plague Mask)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r182","rowIndex":182,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=5>太刀川</tips>が手を差しのばしたまま言う。すると彼女は渋々手をあげて、軽く握手をすると、すぐに元の場所にひっこめた。","en":"<tips=5>Tachikawa</tips> spoke with his hand still extended. At last, she reluctantly raised her own, gave his the lightest clasp, and immediately withdrew it again.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r183","rowIndex":183,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼はその時、能力を使って彼女の感情を読んだ。<tips=5>太刀川</tips>に対する不信感は多少はあるが、見て取れる態度ほどではない。<tips=3>クリス</tips>に対する信頼感が上回るのだろうと彼は解釈した。","en":"At that moment, he used his ability to read her emotions. She did harbor some distrust toward <tips=5>Tachikawa</tips>, but not nearly as much as her manner suggested. He interpreted that to mean her trust in <tips=3>Chris</tips> probably outweighed it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r184","rowIndex":184,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「これからおれの仕事を手伝ってくれる大事な人間だからね。まず『<tips=31>ミス・ホワイト</tips>』に紹介しなくちゃと思って、まっさきに駆けつけて来たんだぜ」","en":"“He’s important—he’ll be helping with my work from now on. I thought <tips=31>Miss White</tips> had to be the first person I introduced him to, so I came straight here.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー（過去・青年）","displayName":"Chris Tse (Past, Young)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r185","rowIndex":185,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「よく言うわよ。用件はわかってる。あの子に会いたくて来たんでしょう？」","en":"“Oh, please. I know what you want. You came to see that girl, didn't you?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r186","rowIndex":186,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=31>ミス・ホワイト</tips>が呆れたように言うが、<tips=3>クリス</tips>は言い訳もせずに笑っている。","en":"<tips=31>Miss White</tips> sounded exasperated, but <tips=3>Chris</tips> merely grinned, making no attempt at an excuse.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r187","rowIndex":187,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=87>ベルーハ</tips>を呼んで」","en":"“Bring <tips=87>Belukha</tips> here.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r188","rowIndex":188,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=31>ミス・ホワイト</tips>は傍らに侍す年老いた使用人に言った。","en":"<tips=31>Miss White</tips> spoke to the elderly servant waiting at her side.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r189","rowIndex":189,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　黒いスーツに身を包む使用人は、寂しくなった白髪頭を下げて部屋を出ると、すぐに<tips=5>太刀川</tips>たちがあの日<tips=18>ローズ・クラブ</tips>から連れ出した少女を連れて戻って来た。","en":"The servant, clad in a black suit, bowed his thinning white head and left the room. He soon returned with the girl <tips=5>Tachikawa</tips> and the others had taken out of <tips=18>Rose Club</tips> that day.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r190","rowIndex":190,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……お兄さん」","en":"“...Mister.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アサヒ","displayName":"Asahi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r191","rowIndex":191,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女は<tips=5>太刀川</tips>の顔を見ると、目を丸くして驚き、それから嬉しそうに微笑んだ。あの夜には見られなかったその明るい表情を見るだけで、<tips=5>太刀川</tips>はここでの彼女の新生活がどのようなものかを察した。","en":"At the sight of <tips=5>Tachikawa</tips>, her eyes widened in surprise, then she smiled with delight. That bright expression, so unlike anything he had seen from her that night, gave <tips=5>Tachikawa</tips> some sense of the new life she led here.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r192","rowIndex":192,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「元気そうだね。……ここでは<tips=87>ベルーハ</tips>と呼ばれているのかい？」","en":"“You look well... Are they calling you <tips=87>Belukha</tips> here?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"太刀川良馬ペスト仮面","displayName":"Ryoma Tachikawa (Plague Mask)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r193","rowIndex":193,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=5>太刀川</tips>が安堵の溜息をついてからそう言うと、横から<tips=31>ミス・ホワイト</tips>が口を挟む。","en":"<tips=5>Tachikawa</tips> let out a relieved breath before speaking, only for <tips=31>Miss White</tips> to cut in from beside him.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r194","rowIndex":194,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「私がつけてやったのさ。過去を捨てて新しい人生を送りたいってんだから、名前も新しくしなくちゃね」","en":"“I named her. If she wants to cast off her past and live a new life, she’ll need a new name as well.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r195","rowIndex":195,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「もうちょっと、人間につけるような名前をつけてやれよ。婆さん、おれはペットをくれてやったわけじゃねえんだぜ」","en":"“You could've given her something that sounds a little more like a person's name. Granny, I didn't hand you a pet.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー（過去・青年）","displayName":"Chris Tse (Past, Young)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r196","rowIndex":196,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=3>クリス</tips>が呆れたように言うと、<tips=31>ホワイト</tips>はじろりと彼を睨み付ける。","en":"<tips=3>Chris</tips> sounded exasperated. <tips=31>White</tips> shot him a glare.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r197","rowIndex":197,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「坊や。私を『婆さん』と呼ぶのをやめなければ、取引を打ち切ると言ったはずだよ」","en":"“Boy. I told you, if you don't stop calling me 'Granny,' I'll stop doing business with you.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r198","rowIndex":198,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女は声にドスをきかせてそう言った。","en":"She delivered the warning in a menacing growl.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r199","rowIndex":199,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……わかってるよ」","en":"“...I know.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー（過去・青年）","displayName":"Chris Tse (Past, Young)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r200","rowIndex":200,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=3>クリス</tips>は肩をすくめる。","en":"<tips=3>Chris</tips> shrugged.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r201","rowIndex":201,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ふん、あまり生意気な態度をとるもんじゃないよ。『<tips=18>ローズ・クラブ</tips>』から逃げ出した女を匿うだなんて、この街で私以外の誰がいると思ってるんだい？」","en":"“Hmph. Don't get too cheeky with me. Who else in this city do you think would shelter a woman who escaped from the <tips=18>Rose Club</tips>?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r202","rowIndex":202,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それは感謝してるって。だからもういいだろ？　<tips=31>エリー婆さん</tips>」","en":"“I told you, I’m grateful. So let it go, will you, Granny <tips=31>Ellie</tips>?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー（過去・青年）","displayName":"Chris Tse (Past, Young)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r203","rowIndex":203,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「このクソガキが……」","en":"“You little bastard...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r204","rowIndex":204,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=31>ミス・ホワイト</tips>は顔をしかめて睨み付ける。","en":"<tips=31>Miss White</tips> scowled at him.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r205","rowIndex":205,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「わ、私、ここではとても良くしてもらってます！」","en":"“Th-they treat me wonderfully here!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アサヒ","displayName":"Asahi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r206","rowIndex":206,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そこへ割って入ったのは<tips=32>アサヒ</tips>――改め<tips=87>ベルーハ</tips>であった。","en":"It was <tips=32>Asahi</tips>—or rather, <tips=87>Belukha</tips>—who intervened.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r207","rowIndex":207,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「だから、そんな風に喧嘩しないでください。みなさんのおかげで、すごく、幸せなんです私。まるで夢みたいで……」","en":"“So please don't fight like that. Thanks to all of you, I'm so... so happy. It's like a dream...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アサヒ","displayName":"Asahi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r208","rowIndex":208,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=87>ベルーハ</tips>は青い目に涙を浮かべて<tips=3>クリス</tips>と<tips=31>ミス・ホワイト</tips>の顔を交互に見て、","en":"Tears welled in <tips=87>Belukha’s</tips> blue eyes as she looked back and forth between <tips=3>Chris</tips> and <tips=31>Miss White</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r209","rowIndex":209,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ただ、オクローシカだけは食べられないですけれど」","en":"“Except I can’t eat the okroshka.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アサヒ","displayName":"Asahi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r210","rowIndex":210,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　最後に申し訳なさそうに付け加える。","en":"She added this last part apologetically.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r211","rowIndex":211,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「良い子だ」","en":"“Good girl.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー（過去・青年）","displayName":"Chris Tse (Past, Young)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r212","rowIndex":212,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=3>クリス</tips>は微笑んで、","en":"<tips=3>Chris</tips> smiled.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r213","rowIndex":213,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「でもね、お嬢ちゃん。心配することはないんだよ。おれとこの『お姉さん』はね、とっても仲が良いからこういう冗談を言い合ってるだけなんだ」","en":"“But listen, young lady. You don’t have to worry. This ‘young woman’ and I are very good friends. That’s why we trade jokes like these.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー（過去・青年）","displayName":"Chris Tse (Past, Young)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r214","rowIndex":214,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=31>ミス・ホワイト</tips>は肯定も否定もしないでただ呆れたように顔を左右に振っている。","en":"<tips=31>Miss White</tips> neither agreed nor denied it, merely shaking her head in exasperation.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r215","rowIndex":215,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そ、そうなんですか？」","en":"“I-is that so?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アサヒ","displayName":"Asahi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r216","rowIndex":216,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=87>ベルーハ</tips>は不安げに<tips=3>クリス</tips>の顔を見つめる。","en":"<tips=87>Belukha</tips> stared anxiously at <tips=3>Chris</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r217","rowIndex":217,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「疑うのかい？　よく考えてみなよ。この、人間嫌いの上に、最近は体調も悪くて大事な客と会うこともなくなった『お姉さん』が、おれが来るとなったら、ちゃんと起き上がってこの応接室まで来て待ってくれているんだ。そして無茶な願い事も聞いてくれる。仲が良いなんてもんじゃない。おれのことが大好きなんだよ。どう考えたってそうだろ？　恋する乙女みたいに可愛いもんじゃねえか」","en":"“You doubt me? Think about it. This misanthropic 'young lady' has been in poor health lately and won't even see important clients, but the moment she hears I'm coming, she gets herself out of bed and comes all the way to the parlor to wait for me. She even indulges my outrageous requests. We're more than good friends. She loves me. Any way you look at it, that's the only conclusion, right? She's downright adorable—like some lovestruck maiden.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー（過去・青年）","displayName":"Chris Tse (Past, Young)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r218","rowIndex":218,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「た、確かにそれは……」","en":"“N-now that you mention it...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アサヒ","displayName":"Asahi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r219","rowIndex":219,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　自信に満ちあふれた<tips=3>クリス</tips>の言葉に、<tips=87>ベルーハ</tips>は思わず頷きかけたが、","en":"Faced with <tips=3>Chris’s</tips> supreme confidence, <tips=87>Belukha</tips> nearly found herself nodding along.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r220","rowIndex":220,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「おい」","en":"“Hey.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r221","rowIndex":221,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ドスの効いた<tips=31>ミス・ホワイト</tips>の言葉がそれを邪魔する。","en":"<tips=31>Miss White’s</tips> threatening rasp stopped her short.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r222","rowIndex":222,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「くだらない寝言で私の貴重な時間を無駄にしに来たのなら、<tips=69>義勝</tips>は明日から次のリーダーを探すことになるぞ。わかってるのかい？」","en":"“If you came here to waste my precious time with witless babble, <tips=69>Yisheng</tips> will be searching for its next leader as of tomorrow. Do you understand me?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r223","rowIndex":223,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「わかっているさ<tips=31>エリー</tips>。おれにとっても、時間はいくらあっても足りないんだから」","en":"“I understand, <tips=31>Ellie</tips>. I don’t have nearly enough time myself.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー（過去・青年）","displayName":"Chris Tse (Past, Young)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r224","rowIndex":224,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=3>クリス</tips>は平然と言うと、","en":"<tips=3>Chris</tips> answered without a trace of concern.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r225","rowIndex":225,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「じゃあ<tips=87>ベルーハ</tips>。この間おれに話したことを、今ドクターにも聞かせてやってくれねえか？」","en":"“All right, <tips=87>Belukha</tips>. Could you tell Doc what you told me the other day?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー（過去・青年）","displayName":"Chris Tse (Past, Young)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r226","rowIndex":226,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「はい」","en":"“Yes.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アサヒ","displayName":"Asahi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r227","rowIndex":227,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=87>ベルーハ</tips>は戸惑いつつも頷いた。","en":"Still uncertain, <tips=87>Belukha</tips> nodded.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r228","rowIndex":228,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「私が知っているのは、あくまでも自分の身のまわりのことだけで、クラブ全体のことではありません。全体からすると、ごく一部のことで、他の場所は全く事情が違うのかもしれません」","en":"“All I know is what happened immediately around me. I don’t know about the club as a whole. It was only one small part of the entire place, and conditions elsewhere may have been completely different.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アサヒ","displayName":"Asahi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r229","rowIndex":229,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　全員が着席し、お茶が振る舞われると、彼女は澄んだ声でそう話し始めた。","en":"Once everyone had taken a seat and tea had been served, she began her account in a clear voice.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r230","rowIndex":230,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「プラチナ会員向けのフロアで見聞きしたことを話してくれるんですね？」","en":"“You’re going to tell us what you saw and heard on the floor reserved for Platinum members?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"太刀川良馬ペスト仮面","displayName":"Ryoma Tachikawa (Plague Mask)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r231","rowIndex":231,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「はい」","en":"“Yes.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アサヒ","displayName":"Asahi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r232","rowIndex":232,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=5>太刀川</tips>の言葉に、<tips=87>ベルーハ</tips>は頷く。","en":"<tips=87>Belukha</tips> nodded in response to <tips=5>Tachikawa</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r233","rowIndex":233,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そうして彼女は自らの体験を交えて<tips=18>ローズ・クラブ</tips>の事情を話しはじめた。","en":"And so, drawing on her own experiences, she began to explain the inner workings of the <tips=18>Rose Club</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r234","rowIndex":234,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　養父母によって<tips=18>ローズ・クラブ</tips>に売られた彼女は、まずマネージャーの面接を受け、そこでランクが決定される。","en":"After her foster parents sold her to the <tips=18>Rose Club</tips>, a manager first interviewed her and determined her rank there.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r235","rowIndex":235,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　本人の自由意志で店にやってきたものは、この時点で自分でどのクラスのフロアで働くか希望を出せるらしい。収入が全く変わってくるために、ほとんどは可能な限り高いクラスで働くそうだが、それ相応のサービスが求められるのを嫌がり、低いランクで働くものもわずかにいるという。","en":"Those who came to work at the establishment of their own free will could apparently request which class of floor they wished to work on at this point. Because the difference in income was enormous, most reportedly chose the highest class available to them, though a small number preferred a lower rank because they objected to the services expected at the higher levels.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r236","rowIndex":236,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しかし、<tips=87>ベルーハ</tips>のように売られた女はそもそも選択の余地がなく、店からランクとフロアを指定される。","en":"Women who had been sold, like <tips=87>Belukha</tips>, had no choice in the first place. The establishment assigned both their rank and their floor.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r237","rowIndex":237,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「私は若くて、何も経験がなかったから、プラチナで働くことになったんだと思います」","en":"“I think they put me on the Platinum floor because I was young and had no experience.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アサヒ","displayName":"Asahi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r238","rowIndex":238,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「謙遜しているが、まあ、それだけじゃない。当然のことながら、顔やスタイル、それから人柄なんかも重視してるらしいってことはおれの調べでもわかっている」","en":"“She’s being modest, but that wasn’t all. Naturally, my own research has shown that they also place a premium on looks, figure, and personality.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー（過去・青年）","displayName":"Chris Tse (Past, Young)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r239","rowIndex":239,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=3>クリス</tips>は腕組みをしながら補足する。","en":"<tips=3>Chris</tips> added, his arms folded.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r240","rowIndex":240,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「三日月の女性は、店が勝手に選ぶのですか？」","en":"“Does the establishment decide on its own which women become Crescents?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"太刀川良馬ペスト仮面","displayName":"Ryoma Tachikawa (Plague Mask)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r241","rowIndex":241,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=5>太刀川</tips>は顎に手を当てつつそう訊ねる。","en":"<tips=5>Tachikawa</tips> asked with a hand to his chin.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r242","rowIndex":242,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それは人によります。最初の契約で拒否出来ない人もいれば、自分で望む人も……」","en":"“It depends on the person. Some aren’t allowed to refuse under their original contract, and some ask for it themselves...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アサヒ","displayName":"Asahi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r243","rowIndex":243,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あんなもの、自分で望む人がいるんですか？」","en":"“Some people ask for a thing like that?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"太刀川良馬ペスト仮面","displayName":"Ryoma Tachikawa (Plague Mask)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r244","rowIndex":244,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「はい、います。とてもいいお金が貰えるので」","en":"“Yes. They’re paid extremely well for it.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アサヒ","displayName":"Asahi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r245","rowIndex":245,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……信じられないな。だって、あのマークを受け入れるってことは、つまり、殺されるってことじゃないですか。死の刻印でしょう？　いくら金を貰っても割に合わない。ビジネスとして成立していない。薬か何かで判断力を奪われているのでは？」","en":"“...I can't believe it. Accepting that mark means being killed, doesn't it? It's a brand of death. No amount of money could make that worthwhile. It makes no sense as a business proposition. Have drugs or something robbed them of their judgment?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"太刀川良馬ペスト仮面","displayName":"Ryoma Tachikawa (Plague Mask)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r246","rowIndex":246,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=5>太刀川</tips>は何度も首を捻る。","en":"<tips=5>Tachikawa</tips> kept tilting his head in bafflement.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r247","rowIndex":247,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「確かに希望者には薬が与えられますが、それは意志を奪うのが目的ではありません。楽しい気持ちになって、恐怖心や痛みを消して、お客様にいいサービスを提供するためです」","en":"“It is true that girls who volunteer are given drugs, but those drugs are not intended to take away their will. They're meant to put them in a pleasant mood, take away their fear and pain, and help them give the guests good service.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アサヒ","displayName":"Asahi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r248","rowIndex":248,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そんな馬鹿な。じゃあ本当に望んでやっているのですか？　考えられない」","en":"“That’s absurd. Do they truly choose to do it, then? I can’t imagine it.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"太刀川良馬ペスト仮面","displayName":"Ryoma Tachikawa (Plague Mask)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r249","rowIndex":249,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それが大事なところなんだよ。おれもとても信じられなかったんだがね」","en":"“That's the crucial point. I could hardly believe it myself.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー（過去・青年）","displayName":"Chris Tse (Past, Young)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r250","rowIndex":250,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=3>クリス</tips>が横でそう口にする。","en":"<tips=3>Chris</tips> remarked from beside him.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r251","rowIndex":251,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あの、三日月のマークがついた女の子は、死なないんです」","en":"“Um... girls given the crescent mark don't die.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アサヒ","displayName":"Asahi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r252","rowIndex":252,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=87>ベルーハ</tips>の言葉を、そのまま信じることは難しい。","en":"It was difficult to take <tips=87>Belukha’s</tips> words at face value.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r253","rowIndex":253,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「何かトリックがあるという意味ですか？」","en":"“Do you mean there is some sort of trick?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"太刀川良馬ペスト仮面","displayName":"Ryoma Tachikawa (Plague Mask)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r254","rowIndex":254,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「違います。本当に、死なないんですよ。何をされても」","en":"“No. They truly don’t die, no matter what is done to them.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アサヒ","displayName":"Asahi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r255","rowIndex":255,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=5>太刀川</tips>は黙り込む。そして一瞬だけ<tips=87>ベルーハ</tips>の目を見る。彼女は何も嘘をついていない。","en":"<tips=5>Tachikawa</tips> fell silent. For a single instant, he looked into <tips=87>Belukha’s</tips> eyes. She was not lying about any of it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r256","rowIndex":256,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「順を追って話してやってくれ」","en":"“Tell him the story in order.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー（過去・青年）","displayName":"Chris Tse (Past, Young)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r257","rowIndex":257,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=3>クリス</tips>の言葉に、<tips=87>ベルーハ</tips>は頷く。","en":"At <tips=3>Chris's</tips> prompting, <tips=87>Belukha</tips> nodded.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r258","rowIndex":258,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「三日月をつけることが決まった人は、一人ずつ別の部屋に連れて行かれます。建物の一番上にあって、まわりがガラス張りで外が見渡せる、とても豪華な部屋です。そこでは男の人が椅子に座って待っています。金髪の優しそうな男の人で、おだやかな日本語を話します。名前も立場も言いませんでしたが、とてもえらい人だと思います」","en":"“Once it has been decided that someone will receive the crescent, she is taken alone to a separate room. It's at the very top of the building—a magnificent room with glass walls and a view in every direction. A man sits waiting there in a chair. He's blond and looks kind, and he speaks Japanese in a gentle voice. He never gave his name or position, but I think he must be very important.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アサヒ","displayName":"Asahi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r259","rowIndex":259,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「おそらくオーナーの<tips=60>ロジャー・アダムス</tips>だ」","en":"“Probably the owner, <tips=60>Roger Adams</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー（過去・青年）","displayName":"Chris Tse (Past, Young)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r260","rowIndex":260,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=3>クリス</tips>の言葉に、<tips=5>太刀川</tips>は頷きを返す。","en":"<tips=5>Tachikawa</tips> nodded in response to <tips=3>Chris</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r261","rowIndex":261,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そこで、その人から説明を受けます。……これから特別な儀式を行う。それに成功すれば死なない身体になって、病気や怪我になってもすぐ治るようになり、ここで沢山のお金を稼ぐことが出来る。万が一失敗すると、少し調子が悪くなるから、プラチナで働くのは難しいかもしれない。でも失敗したとしても、きみや、きみを売った家族に何かペナルティがかかるわけではないから安心してほしい。……私は彼の言葉に頷いて、そして、儀式がはじまりました」","en":"“Once there, the man explains what will happen. A special ritual is about to be performed. If it succeeds, you will gain a body that cannot die, you will recover immediately from any illness or injury, and you will be able to earn a great deal of money there. In the unlikely event that it fails, you will feel a little unwell and may find it difficult to work on the Platinum floor. But even then, neither you nor the family who sold you will be penalized, so there is no need to be afraid... I nodded, and then the ritual began.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アサヒ","displayName":"Asahi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r262","rowIndex":262,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「儀式？」","en":"“A ritual?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー（過去・青年）","displayName":"Chris Tse (Past, Young)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r263","rowIndex":263,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「はい。といっても、そんなにややこしいものではないんです。女の人がやって来て、その人が目の前で手首を切ります。ナイフで。そして流れ出た血を、傷口に唇をつけて飲むんです。それで無事不死身になることが出来たら、しるしとして三日月のタトゥーを入れられます」","en":"“Yes. It isn’t very complicated, though. A woman comes in and cuts her wrist in front of you with a knife. You press your lips to the wound and drink the blood that flows out. If you successfully become immortal, they give you the crescent tattoo as proof.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アサヒ","displayName":"Asahi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r264","rowIndex":264,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「つまりきみはそのテストに『合格』したんですね」","en":"“So you ‘passed’ that test.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"太刀川良馬ペスト仮面","displayName":"Ryoma Tachikawa (Plague Mask)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r265","rowIndex":265,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「はい」","en":"“Yes.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アサヒ","displayName":"Asahi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r266","rowIndex":266,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして、彼女は不死身になったと。","en":"And so, she had become immortal—or so she said.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r267","rowIndex":267,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=87>ベルーハ</tips>は嘘を言ってはいない。かといって、信じられるような話ではない。","en":"<tips=87>Belukha</tips> was not lying. Yet neither was this a story one could believe.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r268","rowIndex":268,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=5>太刀川</tips>は絶句したまま考え込んでしまう。確かに切り刻まれても死なずに生き返るというのならば、あの三日月マークのサービスも、仕事として成立するのかもしれない。<tips=3>クリス</tips>が語っていた、人肉バーベキューのショーにもそれが言える。","en":"<tips=5>Tachikawa</tips> was struck speechless and sank into thought. If a woman could be cut to pieces, return to life, and never die, then perhaps the services associated with that crescent mark could function as a business after all. The same would be true of the human barbecue show <tips=3>Chris</tips> had described.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r269","rowIndex":269,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しかし、死なない人間などありえるのだろうか？　<tips=87>ベルーハ</tips>はなにか催眠術のようなものでもかけられて、そう信じ込まされているだけではないのだろうか？","en":"But could a person who did not die truly exist? Had <tips=87>Belukha</tips> merely been subjected to some form of hypnosis and compelled to believe it?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r270","rowIndex":270,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　結論が出せない<tips=5>太刀川</tips>の目の前で、<tips=87>ベルーハ</tips>は一本の果物ナイフを取り出す。","en":"As <tips=5>Tachikawa</tips> struggled to reach a conclusion, <tips=87>Belukha</tips> took out a fruit knife in front of him.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r271","rowIndex":271,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「その証拠を、お見せします」","en":"“I’ll show you the proof.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アサヒ","displayName":"Asahi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r272","rowIndex":272,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「おいっ！」","en":"“Hey!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー（過去・青年）","displayName":"Chris Tse (Past, Young)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r273","rowIndex":273,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　驚いたのは<tips=3>クリス</tips>だった。彼は立ち上がって止めようとしたが、それより早く<tips=87>ベルーハ</tips>の手が動いた。","en":"<tips=3>Chris</tips> was the one who cried out in surprise. He sprang up to stop her, but <tips=87>Belukha’s</tips> hand moved first.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r274","rowIndex":274,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女はその切っ先で自分の喉を掻き切ったのだ。鮮血がどくどくと流れ出し、彼女はそのまま後ろに倒れ込んで背もたれの上にだらりと身体を投げ出す。その手からは、ナイフが落ちる。","en":"She had slashed her own throat with the blade. Bright blood pumped from the wound as she fell backward, her body going limp across the back of the chair. The knife dropped from her hand.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r275","rowIndex":275,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なんてことをしやがるっ！」","en":"“What the hell have you done?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー（過去・青年）","displayName":"Chris Tse (Past, Young)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r276","rowIndex":276,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=3>クリス</tips>は血の気の引いた顔で叫んで、抱きかかえたが、ベル－ハの目はうつろで、首はがくがくと揺れるばかりだ。","en":"<tips=3>Chris</tips> shouted, his face drained of blood, and gathered her into his arms. But Belukha's eyes were vacant, and her head merely lolled against him.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r277","rowIndex":277,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「傷は動脈に達しています」","en":"“The cut reached an artery.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"太刀川良馬ペスト仮面","displayName":"Ryoma Tachikawa (Plague Mask)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r278","rowIndex":278,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=5>太刀川</tips>は前屈みになり、机の上に両肘を置いて指を組み、その上に顎をのせるような格好をしている。少女の姿を食い入るように観察しているようだった。","en":"<tips=5>Tachikawa</tips> leaned forward, elbows planted on the table and fingers laced, with his chin resting atop them. He seemed to be watching the girl with fierce concentration.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r279","rowIndex":279,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「おい、ドクター！　座ってないで助けろ！」","en":"“Doctor! Don’t just sit there—help her!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー（過去・青年）","displayName":"Chris Tse (Past, Young)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r280","rowIndex":280,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どうでしょう。これは確かに致命傷です。本来ならば。でも彼女は不死身だと言っていた。嘘もついていなかった。理屈はわからないですが、本当に死なないのではないでしょうか」","en":"“I wonder. This is certainly a fatal wound—under normal circumstances. But she said she was immortal, and she wasn't lying. I don't understand how, but perhaps she truly cannot die.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"太刀川良馬ペスト仮面","displayName":"Ryoma Tachikawa (Plague Mask)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r281","rowIndex":281,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「不死身なんてあるわけないじゃないか！」","en":"“No one can actually be immortal!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー（過去・青年）","displayName":"Chris Tse (Past, Young)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r282","rowIndex":282,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうかもしれませんが……もう、私たちには彼女を信じて見守ることしか出来ないんですよ。何の道具もないですし、救急車を呼んでも間に合わない。不死身でないのならもう助けることは出来ません」","en":"“Perhaps not... But now all we can do is trust her and watch. We have no equipment, and an ambulance could not arrive in time. If she is not immortal, there is no saving her now.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"太刀川良馬ペスト仮面","displayName":"Ryoma Tachikawa (Plague Mask)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r283","rowIndex":283,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ドクター！」","en":"“Doctor!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー（過去・青年）","displayName":"Chris Tse (Past, Young)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r284","rowIndex":284,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=3>クリス</tips>は何か言おうとしたが、<tips=5>太刀川</tips>のこめかみにべっとりと脂汗のようなものが浮いているのを見つけて口を閉ざした。彼は彼なりに衝撃を受けているのだ。","en":"<tips=3>Chris</tips> started to say something, but when he saw clammy sweat coating <tips=5>Tachikawa's</tips> temple, he fell silent. Tachikawa had been shaken in his own way.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r285","rowIndex":285,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして、少女が倒れてから十分ほどが過ぎた。","en":"Around ten minutes had passed since the girl collapsed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r286","rowIndex":286,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=5>太刀川</tips>は同じ姿勢でじっと<tips=87>ベルーハ</tips>を見つめている。<tips=3>クリス</tips>は組んだ足をブラブラと揺らし、苛立ちを隠そうともしない。<tips=31>ホワイト</tips>は深く椅子に腰掛け、一言も喋らなかった。","en":"<tips=5>Tachikawa</tips> remained perfectly still, staring at <tips=87>Belukha</tips>. <tips=3>Chris</tips> swung his crossed leg without even attempting to conceal his irritation. <tips=31>White</tips> sat deep in her chair without uttering a word.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r287","rowIndex":287,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そろそろ、遺体の始末の手配をしなきゃいけないようだな」","en":"“It looks like we’d better arrange to dispose of the body.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー（過去・青年）","displayName":"Chris Tse (Past, Young)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r288","rowIndex":288,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=3>クリス</tips>は苦々しく言った。","en":"<tips=3>Chris</tips> spoke bitterly.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r289","rowIndex":289,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　先ほど<tips=5>太刀川</tips>は<tips=87>ベルーハ</tips>の心臓が完全に停止したのを確認している。そのときに椅子にもたれかかってぱっくりと喉の傷を開くという無惨な姿だった彼女の姿勢も変えてやった。今<tips=87>ベルーハ</tips>の肉体は、ソファーの上に横たわり、傷の部分にはタオルをかけて隠してある。","en":"Earlier, <tips=5>Tachikawa</tips> had confirmed that <tips=87>Belukha’s</tips> heart had stopped completely. He had also shifted her from the gruesome posture in which her body had slumped against the chair, her throat wound gaping. Now <tips=87>Belukha’s</tips> body lay on the sofa, a towel covering the wound from view.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r290","rowIndex":290,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「くそっ！　何だって、自分が不死身だなんて信じ込んだんだ？　なあドクター、一体、どんな手を使ったんだい？」","en":"“Damn it! What made her believe she was immortal? Doc, what kind of trick did they use on her?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー（過去・青年）","displayName":"Chris Tse (Past, Young)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r291","rowIndex":291,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「催眠術のようなものかもしれませんね。向精神薬を使ったり、生活環境を整えれば、ある程度はかかりやすく出来ます」","en":"“Perhaps something akin to hypnosis. Psychotropic drugs and a carefully controlled living environment can make a person more susceptible.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"太刀川良馬ペスト仮面","displayName":"Ryoma Tachikawa (Plague Mask)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r292","rowIndex":292,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=5>太刀川</tips>もさすがに諦めの心境になりつつあるのか、深く溜息をついた。","en":"Even <tips=5>Tachikawa</tips> seemed finally to be resigning himself to it. He heaved a deep sigh.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r293","rowIndex":293,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まったく、せっかく助けてやったのに、これじゃ何の意味もない！　胸くそ悪いぜ」","en":"“Damn it! We went to all that trouble to save her, and now it means nothing! This is sickening.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー（過去・青年）","displayName":"Chris Tse (Past, Young)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r294","rowIndex":294,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=3>クリス</tips>はそして入り口の方で二人並んで立っている<tips=4>馬明</tips>と<tips=39>ジェフリー・ウォン</tips>の方を向き、","en":"<tips=3>Chris</tips> turned toward <tips=4>Ma Ming</tips> and <tips=39>Jeffrey Wong</tips>, standing side by side near the entrance.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r295","rowIndex":295,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「おい。サミーに連絡してくれ。子供の女が一人だ」","en":"“Call Sammy. We’ve got a girl—a child.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー（過去・青年）","displayName":"Chris Tse (Past, Young)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r296","rowIndex":296,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「お、おう」","en":"“R-right.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r297","rowIndex":297,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　急に指示を出された<tips=4>馬明</tips>は若干うろたえながら二度頷くと、ドアを開けて部屋を出て行った。","en":"Slightly flustered by the sudden order, <tips=4>Ma</tips> nodded twice, opened the door, and left the room.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r298","rowIndex":298,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=31>ミス・ホワイト</tips>。遺体はうちで処理させて貰う。迷惑かけたな」","en":"“<tips=31>Miss White</tips>, we’ll handle the body. Sorry for the trouble.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー（過去・青年）","displayName":"Chris Tse (Past, Young)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r299","rowIndex":299,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……いいえ」","en":"“...It's all right.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エリー・ホワイト（先代）","displayName":"Ellie White (Previous Generation)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r300","rowIndex":300,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「おれもこんなことになるとは思わなかったんだ。あんたのところで勉強させて……」","en":"“I never imagined this would happen. After you took her in and gave her a chance to study—”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー（過去・青年）","displayName":"Chris Tse (Past, Young)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r301","rowIndex":301,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あっ」","en":"“Ah.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"太刀川良馬ペスト仮面","displayName":"Ryoma Tachikawa (Plague Mask)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r302","rowIndex":302,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=3>クリス</tips>の言葉を遮って、<tips=5>太刀川</tips>が声をあげた。","en":"<tips=5>Tachikawa</tips> cried out, cutting <tips=3>Chris</tips> off.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r303","rowIndex":303,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どうしたドクター？」","en":"“What is it, Doctor?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー（過去・青年）","displayName":"Chris Tse (Past, Young)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r304","rowIndex":304,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いま、指が動いたような……」","en":"“I thought I saw her finger move...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"太刀川良馬ペスト仮面","displayName":"Ryoma Tachikawa (Plague Mask)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r305","rowIndex":305,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=5>太刀川</tips>は横たわる<tips=87>ベルーハ</tips>の方を食い入るように見つめている。","en":"<tips=5>Tachikawa</tips> stared fixedly at <tips=87>Belukha</tips> where she lay.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r306","rowIndex":306,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「こんなときに冗談は困るぜ……」","en":"“This is no time for jokes...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー（過去・青年）","displayName":"Chris Tse (Past, Young)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r307","rowIndex":307,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　信じられず、顔を顰める<tips=3>クリス</tips>の横で<tips=5>太刀川</tips>は立ち上がると、素早く<tips=87>ベルーハ</tips>に近寄って、その手首をとる。そして次に、その胸に耳を当てる。","en":"<tips=3>Chris</tips> scowled in disbelief. Beside him, <tips=5>Tachikawa</tips> rose, moved swiftly to <tips=87>Belukha</tips>, and took her wrist. He then pressed an ear to her chest.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r308","rowIndex":308,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ドクター？」","en":"“Doctor?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エリー・ホワイト（先代）","displayName":"Ellie White (Previous Generation)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r309","rowIndex":309,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そこで<tips=31>ミス・ホワイト</tips>が初めて感情のこもった声を<tips=5>太刀川</tips>に投げかける。","en":"For the first time, <tips=31>Miss White</tips> addressed <tips=5>Tachikawa</tips> with emotion in her voice.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r310","rowIndex":310,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しかし彼は少女に集中しており、その言葉に反応しない。傷口にかかっていたタオルをはぎ取り、その部分を見る。","en":"But he was focused on the girl and did not respond. He tore away the towel covering the wound and inspected it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r311","rowIndex":311,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=3>クリス</tips>！」","en":"“<tips=3>Chris</tips>!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"太刀川良馬ペスト仮面","displayName":"Ryoma Tachikawa (Plague Mask)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r312","rowIndex":312,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ここにいるぜ」","en":"“Right here.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー（過去・青年）","displayName":"Chris Tse (Past, Young)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r313","rowIndex":313,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=5>太刀川</tips>が珍しく大きな声を出して呼びかけると、いつの間にかすぐ隣にいた<tips=3>クリス</tips>が答えた。","en":"When <tips=5>Tachikawa</tips> called out in an uncharacteristically loud voice, <tips=3>Chris</tips>, who had somehow appeared right beside him, answered.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r314","rowIndex":314,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「見てください。傷がふさがっている。それに、弱いですが心臓も動いています」","en":"“Look. The wound has closed. Her heartbeat is faint, but it’s there.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"太刀川良馬ペスト仮面","displayName":"Ryoma Tachikawa (Plague Mask)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r315","rowIndex":315,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　さすがの<tips=5>太刀川</tips>の声も、少し早口になっている。","en":"Even <tips=5>Tachikawa</tips> was speaking a little faster than usual.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r316","rowIndex":316,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……生き返ったのか？」","en":"“...She came back to life?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー（過去・青年）","displayName":"Chris Tse (Past, Young)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r317","rowIndex":317,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=3>クリス</tips>の問いに、<tips=5>太刀川</tips>は頷きを返す。","en":"<tips=5>Tachikawa</tips> nodded in answer to <tips=3>Chris</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r318","rowIndex":318,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それを聞くと、<tips=3>クリス</tips>は興奮に真っ赤になった顔で<tips=87>ベルーハ</tips>の頭の側に近づいて、その頬に手のひらで触れる。","en":"At the news, <tips=3>Chris</tips> hurried to <tips=87>Belukha’s</tips> side, his face scarlet with excitement, and laid his palm against her cheek.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r319","rowIndex":319,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「おい、<tips=32>アサヒ</tips>！　起きろ！　生きているのか？」","en":"“Hey, <tips=32>Asahi</tips>! Wake up! Are you alive?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー（過去・青年）","displayName":"Chris Tse (Past, Young)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r320","rowIndex":320,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いや、そっとしておきましょう」","en":"“No, let her rest.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"太刀川良馬ペスト仮面","displayName":"Ryoma Tachikawa (Plague Mask)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r321","rowIndex":321,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=5>太刀川</tips>は興奮する<tips=3>クリス</tips>の肩に手をかけてそれをやめさせる。","en":"<tips=5>Tachikawa</tips> put a hand on <tips=3>Chris's</tips> shoulder to restrain him.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r322","rowIndex":322,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「すまん……」","en":"“Sorry.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー（過去・青年）","displayName":"Chris Tse (Past, Young)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r323","rowIndex":323,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=3>クリス</tips>はじっとしていられないようだった。","en":"<tips=3>Chris</tips> seemed incapable of keeping still.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r324","rowIndex":324,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「だが、信じられねえよ。おれたちは夢でも見ているのか？　こんな……」","en":"“But I can’t believe this. Are we dreaming? Something like this...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー（過去・青年）","displayName":"Chris Tse (Past, Young)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r325","rowIndex":325,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「気持ちはわかります。しかし……」","en":"“I understand how you feel. But...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"太刀川良馬ペスト仮面","displayName":"Ryoma Tachikawa (Plague Mask)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r326","rowIndex":326,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=5>太刀川</tips>がそう口にしたところで、<tips=87>ベルーハ</tips>のまぶたがぴくりと動き、そしてゆっくりと開いた。","en":"As <tips=5>Tachikawa</tips> spoke, <tips=87>Belukha’s</tips> eyelids twitched, then slowly opened.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r327","rowIndex":327,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まったく驚いたぜ。いきなりあんなことをされちゃ困る」","en":"“You really gave me a shock. You can't spring something like that on us.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー（過去・青年）","displayName":"Chris Tse (Past, Young)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r328","rowIndex":328,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「すみません。でも、実際に見せなければ絶対に信じてもらえないと思って……」","en":"“I’m sorry. But I thought you would never believe me unless I actually showed you...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アサヒ","displayName":"Asahi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r329","rowIndex":329,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=87>ベルーハ</tips>は俯いたまま申し訳なさそうに答える。","en":"<tips=87>Belukha</tips> answered apologetically, her head still bowed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r330","rowIndex":330,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その服の胸元はまだ大量の血液で濡れており、顔も血の気を失って青白い。","en":"The front of her dress remained soaked with blood, and her face was deathly pale from the loss.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r331","rowIndex":331,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それにしたって、普通はあんなぱっくり自分の首を切れるものじゃない！　すごい度胸だ。ここじゃなくてうちで預かればよかったのかもな」","en":"“Even so, ordinary people can’t just cut their own throats wide open! That took incredible nerve. Perhaps I should’ve kept you with us instead of leaving you here.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー（過去・青年）","displayName":"Chris Tse (Past, Young)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r332","rowIndex":332,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=3>クリス</tips>は怒っているのか笑っているのか判別しがたい不思議な表情をする。","en":"<tips=3>Chris</tips> wore a peculiar expression, impossible to read as anger or amusement.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r333","rowIndex":333,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「すみません。……おば様も、すみませんでした。こんなに汚してしまって。あとで掃除をします」","en":"“I’m sorry... Auntie, I’m sorry to you as well. I’ve made such a mess. I’ll clean it afterward.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アサヒ","displayName":"Asahi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r334","rowIndex":334,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そんなことはどうでもいいんだよ。随分と珍しいものを見せて貰ったからね。……ただあんまりにも珍しすぎて、私も心臓が止まるかと思ったわよ」","en":"“That hardly matters. You’ve shown me quite a rarity... A little too rare, perhaps. I thought my own heart might stop.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エリー・ホワイト（先代）","displayName":"Ellie White (Previous Generation)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r335","rowIndex":335,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=31>ホワイト</tips>はそう言って苦笑する。","en":"<tips=31>White</tips> smiled wryly.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r336","rowIndex":336,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「すみません……」","en":"“I’m sorry...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アサヒ","displayName":"Asahi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r337","rowIndex":337,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=87>ベルーハ</tips>は恐縮して身を縮める。","en":"<tips=87>Belukha</tips> shrank into herself in mortification.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r338","rowIndex":338,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「気分はどのような感じですか？　本来ならば、とても活動出来るような血液は身体に残されていないはずですが」","en":"“How do you feel? Ordinarily, there should not be enough blood left in your body for you to move at all.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"太刀川良馬ペスト仮面","displayName":"Ryoma Tachikawa (Plague Mask)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r339","rowIndex":339,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=5>太刀川</tips>は落ち着きを取り戻した声でそう訊ねる。","en":"<tips=5>Tachikawa</tips> asked, his voice composed once more.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r340","rowIndex":340,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「クラクラしますが、大丈夫です。この後、ご飯を食べて、少し休めば元通りになります。刃物で切っただけだからそれほどじゃないんです。銃で撃たれたり、首を切断されたりすると時間はかかるみたいで……他の女の子が言うには、それでも、一ヶ月とかあれば大体治るみたいです」","en":"“I'm dizzy, but I'm all right. If I have something to eat and rest for a while, I'll return to normal. It isn't so bad when I've only been cut with a blade. If I'm shot, or if my head is cut off, it seems to take longer... The other girls say that even injuries like that mostly heal in about a month.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アサヒ","displayName":"Asahi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r341","rowIndex":341,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あまりにも私の常識を超えた話で目眩がしますが……こうして目の当たりにしては、認める他はないのでしょうね」","en":"“The whole story so thoroughly defies common sense that it makes me dizzy... but having witnessed it myself, I suppose I have no choice but to accept it.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"太刀川良馬ペスト仮面","displayName":"Ryoma Tachikawa (Plague Mask)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r342","rowIndex":342,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まったく、おれも、先日話を聞いた時は、何か仕掛けがあるのだろうと思い込んでいたんだがね」","en":"“I know. When I heard her account the other day, I was convinced there must be some trick.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー（過去・青年）","displayName":"Chris Tse (Past, Young)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r343","rowIndex":343,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=3>クリス</tips>は呆れたように首を振る。","en":"<tips=3>Chris</tips> shook his head in exasperation.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r344","rowIndex":344,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ドクター、この現象はなんなんだい？　こんなことって、医学的にありえるのかい？」","en":"“Doc, what in the world is this? Can anything like this happen medically?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー（過去・青年）","displayName":"Chris Tse (Past, Young)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r345","rowIndex":345,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「医学的にはありえませんね」","en":"“Medically, no.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"太刀川良馬ペスト仮面","displayName":"Ryoma Tachikawa (Plague Mask)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r346","rowIndex":346,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=5>太刀川</tips>は即答し、","en":"<tips=5>Tachikawa</tips> answered at once.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r347","rowIndex":347,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=87>ベルーハ</tips>、その儀式を受けた女性の身体に、何か特殊な変化はあらわれたりしませんでしたか？」","en":"“<tips=87>Belukha</tips>, did the bodies of the women who underwent that ritual exhibit any other unusual changes?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"太刀川良馬ペスト仮面","displayName":"Ryoma Tachikawa (Plague Mask)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r348","rowIndex":348,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「目が金色になったまま戻らなくなります。興奮状態の<tips=17>タイプB</tips>と同じで、いやがるお客さんも多いものですから、カラーコンタクトを入れたりします。私もそうです。それから、人によっては運動神経がよくなったり……私はあんまり変わらないですが……」","en":"“Their eyes turn gold and never change back. They look like the eyes of an agitated <tips=17>Type B</tips>, and many guests dislike them, so we wear colored contacts. I do too. And some people’s physical coordination improves... I haven’t changed very much myself...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アサヒ","displayName":"Asahi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r349","rowIndex":349,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「何か副作用……具合が悪くなったことはありますか？　幻覚を見るとか、幻聴が聞こえるとか、他になんでもいいんですが」","en":"“Have there been any side effects—any changes for the worse? Hallucinations, hearing voices, anything at all?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"太刀川良馬ペスト仮面","displayName":"Ryoma Tachikawa (Plague Mask)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r350","rowIndex":350,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いえ、そういう<tips=17>タイプB</tips>の人によくある症状は、特に聞いたことはないです。マネージャーとかは、だからこれは<tips=17>タイプB</tips>ではないと説明していて、みんな半信半疑ながら……でも自分にそう言いきかせていました」","en":"“No. I haven't heard of anyone suffering the symptoms common among <tips=17>Type Bs</tips>. The managers explained that this meant it wasn't a <tips=17>Type B</tips> condition. Everyone had their doubts... but they told themselves it was true.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アサヒ","displayName":"Asahi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r351","rowIndex":351,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ふむ……」","en":"“Hmm...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"太刀川良馬ペスト仮面","displayName":"Ryoma Tachikawa (Plague Mask)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r352","rowIndex":352,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=5>太刀川</tips>は<tips=3>クリス</tips>の方を見ると、","en":"<tips=5>Tachikawa</tips> looked toward <tips=3>Chris</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r353","rowIndex":353,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「私はやっぱり<tips=17>タイプB</tips>ではあると思います。<tips=17>タイプB</tips>になると、誰でも多少は治癒能力が向上しますからね。とは言え、普通の<tips=17>タイプB</tips>とは少し違うのではないでしょうか。この現象は、ただ<tips=17>タイプＢ</tips>というだけでかたづけるにはあまりにも限度を超えています。たとえば、サイキック能力が影響しているとか……調査しないとわかりません。とりあえず今度検査をさせてもらいたいところですね」","en":"“I still think she is a <tips=17>Type B</tips>. Everyone's healing ability improves somewhat when they become a <tips=17>Type B</tips>. That said, she may differ somewhat from an ordinary <tips=17>Type B</tips>. This phenomenon goes far beyond what can be dismissed as simply <tips=17>Type B</tips>. Perhaps psychic ability itself is having some effect... We won't know without investigating. In any event, I would like to examine her next time.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"太刀川良馬ペスト仮面","displayName":"Ryoma Tachikawa (Plague Mask)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r354","rowIndex":354,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「調べればわかるのか？」","en":"“Will an examination tell you what it is?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー（過去・青年）","displayName":"Chris Tse (Past, Young)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r355","rowIndex":355,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あまり期待しないでください。何年も調べた末に、何の手がかりも見つからなかったということも、よくあります」","en":"“Please don’t expect too much. It is quite common to investigate something for years without finding a single clue.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"太刀川良馬ペスト仮面","displayName":"Ryoma Tachikawa (Plague Mask)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r356","rowIndex":356,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ドクターも案外頼りにならなくて、だらしないもんだな」","en":"“So even you're not as dependable as I thought, Doc. That's pretty pathetic.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー（過去・青年）","displayName":"Chris Tse (Past, Young)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r357","rowIndex":357,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「おっしゃるとおりですが、私個人がだらしないわけではありません。今の医学の限界ですよ。<tips=16>タイプA</tips>というものが世の中に生まれるようになってから、あまりにも過去の理論とかけ離れたものが増えすぎた。我々医師は、世間の人々がとても見たことがないような、とんでもない現象を沢山相手にしているんです。そして常に無力感に直面しています。……まあ、それが我々を腐らせたのかもしれません」","en":"“You're right, but I am not personally inept. This is a limitation of modern medicine. Ever since <tips=16>Type As</tips> began appearing in the world, we have encountered far too many things that depart completely from every earlier theory. We physicians now deal with countless extraordinary phenomena that ordinary people could scarcely imagine. And we are constantly forced to confront our own powerlessness... Perhaps that is what has made us rot.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"太刀川良馬ペスト仮面","displayName":"Ryoma Tachikawa (Plague Mask)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r358","rowIndex":358,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=5>太刀川</tips>は肩をすくめる。","en":"<tips=5>Tachikawa</tips> shrugged.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r359","rowIndex":359,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それから二人はさらに<tips=18>ローズ・クラブ</tips>のことを少女に尋ねた。","en":"The two men then questioned the girl further about the <tips=18>Rose Club</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r360","rowIndex":360,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女は<tips=5>太刀川</tips>が感心するほど聰明で、自分が直接見聞きしたものと、人からの伝聞を混乱なく分けて説明し、記憶も自信がある部分と曖昧な部分は前もって言い、誤解を与えないよう細心の注意を払いながら語った。","en":"She was intelligent enough to impress <tips=5>Tachikawa</tips>. She kept what she had directly seen and heard distinct from what others had told her, and always made clear when her memory was certain and when it was vague. She spoke with scrupulous care not to give them a false impression.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r361","rowIndex":361,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「私のいた部署では、人並みに仕事をこなしていれば、店の人はみんな優しくしてくれるし、けして待遇が悪いわけではないんです。それは私のように売られた者でも同じでした。……でもルールを破った場合は厳しかったです。少しでも違反すればその都度罰金を支払わされました。脱走は最大の罪で、多額の罰金が設定されていますが、それが払えないとなると特別な罰が与えられました」","en":"“In the section where I worked, the staff were all kind as long as you did your work adequately. The treatment wasn’t bad at all. That was true even for people like me who had been sold. But they were strict about the rules, and every small violation brought a fine. Running away was the greatest offense and carried an enormous fine. If you could not pay it, they imposed a special punishment.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アサヒ","displayName":"Asahi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r362","rowIndex":362,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　縄で縛られ、鍵のかかった『ペナルティルーム』に、食事も与えられずに水だけが与えられ、そして死ぬまで放置される。","en":"Bound with rope, she would be locked in the Penalty Room, given water but no food, then left there until she died.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r363","rowIndex":363,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　トイレもなく、そのまま垂れ流しにするしかない。その部屋は壁の上の方に小窓がついており、ひとつは他の女への見せしめのため待機室と繋がっており、もう一つは金を払って見物する客のためのものだった。","en":"There was no toilet, so she had no choice but to relieve herself where she lay. Two small windows were set high in the walls. One opened onto the waiting room, making her an example for the other women; the other allowed paying guests to watch.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r364","rowIndex":364,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「三日月マークのついた女性はどうするんですか？　不死身だっていう触れ込みじゃないですか」","en":"“What do they do with a woman bearing the crescent mark? The claim is that she’s immortal, isn’t it?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"太刀川良馬ペスト仮面","displayName":"Ryoma Tachikawa (Plague Mask)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r365","rowIndex":365,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「死なせる方法があるんだそうです。どうやるのかはわからないんですが、三日月の女の子は別室でそれをされてから、ペナルティルームに入ります。すると、他の子と同じように弱って、死にます。そして死ぬと、真っ白な服を着た人たちが二人か三人入って来て、運び出します」","en":"“I’m told they have a way to make them die. I don’t know what they do, but a girl with the crescent is taken to a separate room and subjected to it before she enters the Penalty Room. Then she grows weak like any other girl, and dies. Once she is dead, two or three people dressed entirely in white come in and carry her away.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アサヒ","displayName":"Asahi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r366","rowIndex":366,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それはおそらく、死体を処理する専門の係の者なのだろうということだった。","en":"Belukha believed they were probably specialists responsible for disposing of the bodies.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r367","rowIndex":367,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　店の女はよく死んだ。自殺だったり、病気だったり、接客中の事故だったり。どの場合でもこの白い服を着た者たちがやって来て連れて行く。行き先は<tips=87>ベルーハ</tips>にはわからない。","en":"Women at the establishment died often: by suicide, through illness, or in accidents while serving customers. In every case, the people in white came and carried the woman away. <tips=87>Belukha</tips> did not know where they took them.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r368","rowIndex":368,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　こういった不慮の死が多かったことも、儀式の希望者が多い理由だったと言う。","en":"She said the frequency of such untimely deaths was another reason so many women requested the ritual.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r369","rowIndex":369,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　また、店の女は金を払えば麻薬の類も安く買うことが出来るのだが、これによって中毒になるものも多かった。そういった場合、最終的には精神に破綻を来してプラチナの資格を失い、下の階へと落ちてゆく。しかし店はむしろ薬物を買って楽しむことを推奨していたといいう。","en":"She also said the women could buy narcotics and other drugs cheaply from the establishment, and that many became addicted. In time, some suffered mental breakdowns, lost their qualification for Platinum, and descended to the lower floors. Yet the establishment encouraged them to buy and enjoy the drugs.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r370","rowIndex":370,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ここでは欲しいものは何も制限しない、働いてくれているのだから自分の使いたいように使ってくれてかまわない。","en":"The establishment claimed it would place no restrictions on anything the women wanted: they had worked for their money and could spend it however they pleased.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r371","rowIndex":371,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　と説明されたらしいが、それは建前で、店からすればそうすることで女から幾ばくかの金が回収出来るし、欲望を与えれば仕事にも熱心になるから特に禁止にはしなかったのだろうと、<tips=87>ベルーハ</tips>は言った。","en":"That was apparently the official explanation, but <tips=87>Belukha</tips> said it was only a pretext. Selling the drugs allowed the establishment to recover some of the women’s money, and indulging their desires made them work more eagerly, so the establishment probably saw no particular reason to prohibit them.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r372","rowIndex":372,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうなるのがいやだったから、私はどんな薬も口にしませんでした。仕事の前には、気持ちを楽にするために無償で配布されるんですが、それも絶対に使いませんでした。使わないとつらいけど……」","en":"“I didn’t want that to happen to me, so I never took any drugs. They hand some out for free before work to help you relax, but I absolutely refused those as well. It was painful without them, though...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アサヒ","displayName":"Asahi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r373","rowIndex":373,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女は自分の体験したおぞましい世界の出来事を、感情的にならず、淡々と語る。","en":"She related the events of that appalling world without becoming emotional, her voice level throughout.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r374","rowIndex":374,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「美味しいものが与えられたり、綺麗なものを着せて貰えたりしましたけど、何も楽しくなかったです。そんなことがあるなんて、外で貧乏暮らしをしていた時は、ちっとも想像しませんでした」","en":"“They gave me delicious food and beautiful clothes, but none of it made me happy. When I was living in poverty outside, I never imagined that could be possible.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アサヒ","displayName":"Asahi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r375","rowIndex":375,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=87>ベルーハ</tips>は溜息をついて、うつむいた。","en":"<tips=87>Belukha</tips> sighed and lowered her head.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r376","rowIndex":376,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女の場合はプラチナだが、<tips=3>クリス</tips>が言うには、多少の待遇の違いこそあれ、ゴールドやノーマルでも同じようなシステムが使われているらしい。","en":"Belukha had worked on the Platinum floor, but according to <tips=3>Chris</tips>, despite some differences in treatment, the same system was apparently used on the Gold and Normal floors.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r377","rowIndex":377,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　贅沢な食べ物や薬物を豊富に与え、それで店に縛り付ける。その結果働けなくなれば、処分すればいい。<tips=9>Y地区</tips>からは若くて新鮮な人間をいくらでも連れてこられるし、多くの客は新しい女を望んでいる。ベテランになってもなお馴染みの客を多く持つような人間は、最初から自滅するようなことをしないから残り続ける。","en":"The women were plied with luxurious food and abundant drugs to bind them to the establishment. Once that left them unable to work, they could simply be disposed of. Any number of young, fresh replacements could be brought in from <tips=9>Y District</tips>, and many guests wanted new women. Those who became veterans and still retained many regular clients were the sort who had never destroyed themselves to begin with, and so they remained.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r378","rowIndex":378,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=87>ベルーハ</tips>は使えなくなった女は下のランクに落とされると説明を受けていたようだが、おれが調べた限りじゃ、もっと悲惨な末路もあるようだ。そのまま『三日月』の仕事をさせられるんだよ。常連の一部は、『三日月』が不死身だって知っていただろうし、そういう客は、もっとリアルな体験を求めて、不死身じゃない女を高値で買いたがるんだ。……これを聞いたときゃ、そもそも不死身なんて信用していなかったから、いまいち事情が飲み込めなかったが……まあ、事実なんだろうな」","en":"“<tips=87>Belukha</tips> was told that women who became unusable would be dropped to a lower rank, but from what I’ve learned, some meet an even more miserable end. They’re put straight to work as ‘Crescents.’ Some of the regulars must have known the real ‘Crescents’ were immortal, and those guests wanted to pay handsomely for mortal women so they could have a more authentic experience. When I first heard this, I didn’t believe in immortality in the first place, so I couldn’t quite make sense of it... but I suppose it must be true.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー（過去・青年）","displayName":"Chris Tse (Past, Young)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r379","rowIndex":379,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=3>クリス</tips>は感情を押し殺し切れず、口調に憤りをにじませながらそう言う。","en":"<tips=3>Chris</tips> could not entirely suppress his feelings, and indignation seeped into his voice.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r380","rowIndex":380,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「良いものが食えて、良い酒が飲めて、欲しければドラッグも買い放題だと言われて連れて行かれた子供たちの末路はこんなもんだよ。正式な手続きをとればクラブをやめられるのは事実かもしれないが、円満に家族のところに戻ったのはどれくらいいることやら。胸くそ悪い話さ」","en":"“This is how it ends for children brought there with promises of good food, fine liquor, and all the drugs they could want. It may be true that completing the proper procedures lets them leave the club, but who knows how many ever made it peacefully back to their families. It’s sickening.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー（過去・青年）","displayName":"Chris Tse (Past, Young)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r381","rowIndex":381,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そうして<tips=5>太刀川</tips>たちは、結局一時間ほど<tips=31>ミス・ホワイト</tips>の屋敷で過ごした。","en":"And so <tips=5>Tachikawa</tips> and the others spent about an hour at <tips=31>Miss White’s</tips> mansion.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r382","rowIndex":382,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　男達が帰ってしまうと部屋は静寂に満たされる。","en":"Once the men had gone, silence filled the room.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r383","rowIndex":383,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=31>ミス・ホワイト</tips>は溜息をつき、椅子に座り続けていたせいで凝り固まってしまった首筋を右拳で軽く叩く。","en":"<tips=31>Miss White</tips> sighed. Her neck stiff from sitting in the chair for so long, she gently thumped it with her right fist.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r384","rowIndex":384,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あの坊やは、<tips=18>ローズ・クラブ</tips>を潰すといつも言っているけれど、どうするつもりなのかねえ……」","en":"“That boy is always saying he means to destroy the <tips=18>Rose Club</tips>. I wonder what he intends to do...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エリー・ホワイト（先代）","displayName":"Ellie White (Previous Generation)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r385","rowIndex":385,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　独り言なのか、話しかけているのかわからない口ぶりで、使用人は返事に困りながらこの女主人の顔を見つめる。","en":"Unable to tell whether she was talking to herself or addressing him, the servant stared at his mistress, uncertain how to answer.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r386","rowIndex":386,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「クラブはこの街にがっちりと食い込んでいる。<tips=68>木下組</tips>との結びつきがよく言われるけど、それだけじゃない。街の細かい組織とも繋がってるわ。そして、そういう組織同士は対立しあったりしてる。複雑なのよ。あの坊やのファミリーがいくら大きくなったとは言え、表立って<tips=18>ローズ・クラブ</tips>と敵対したら生きていけないわ」","en":"“The club has sunk its roots deep into this city. People often speak of its connection to the <tips=68>Kinoshita-gumi</tips>, but that is not the whole of it. It also has ties to the city’s smaller organizations, and those organizations sometimes feud among themselves. It is complicated. However large that boy’s family has grown, it could not survive open hostility with the <tips=18>Rose Club</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エリー・ホワイト（先代）","displayName":"Ellie White (Previous Generation)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r387","rowIndex":387,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=87>ベルーハ</tips>が傍らのサイドテーブルに置かれたケースから長細い紙巻き煙草を手に取り、浮かない顔でくわえると、使用人がすかさずライターで火をつける。","en":"<tips=87>Belukha</tips> took a long, slender cigarette from the case on the side table and held it between her lips with a gloomy look. The servant immediately lit it for her.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r388","rowIndex":388,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まあ、もめ事を起こしてくれるならば、私たちの仕事が増えるだけだから嬉しいけれど……。<tips=87>ベルーハ</tips>。良いのよ。掃除は他のものにしてもらうから。あなたは少し休んでなさい。顔が真っ白で、ふらふらしているわ」","en":"“Well, if he causes trouble, it will only bring us more work, so I ought to be pleased... <tips=87>Belukha</tips>, that's enough. I'll have someone else do the cleaning. You rest for a while. You're white as a sheet and unsteady on your feet.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エリー・ホワイト（先代）","displayName":"Ellie White (Previous Generation)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r389","rowIndex":389,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　血で汚れた服を着替えて部屋に戻ってきた<tips=87>ベルーハ</tips>がぬれ雑巾を持っているのを見て、そう声をかける。","en":"She said this when <tips=87>Belukha</tips> returned carrying a wet cloth, having changed out of her bloodstained dress.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r390","rowIndex":390,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「しかし、おばさま……」","en":"“But, Auntie...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アサヒ","displayName":"Asahi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r391","rowIndex":391,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いいの。そこに座ってて」","en":"“It’s all right. Sit over there.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エリー・ホワイト（先代）","displayName":"Ellie White (Previous Generation)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r392","rowIndex":392,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　一度立ち上がった<tips=87>ベルーハ</tips>は、申し訳なさそうにソファの上に腰を降ろす。","en":"<tips=87>Belukha</tips> had risen, but now sat back down on the sofa apologetically.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r393","rowIndex":393,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=87>ベルーハ</tips>。お前、随分思い切ったことをしたわね。話は聞いていたけれど、実際見るとやっぱり驚くわね」","en":"“<tips=87>Belukha</tips>, that was an awfully drastic thing you did. I’d heard the story, but seeing it for myself was still a shock.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エリー・ホワイト（先代）","displayName":"Ellie White (Previous Generation)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r394","rowIndex":394,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「すみません。なんだか、私の言葉を信じていただけていないようだったので……」","en":"“I’m sorry. It seemed as though they didn’t believe what I was telling them...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アサヒ","displayName":"Asahi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r395","rowIndex":395,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そこまでしなくてもいいのに。痛かったでしょう？」","en":"“You didn’t need to go that far. It hurt, didn’t it?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エリー・ホワイト（先代）","displayName":"Ellie White (Previous Generation)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r396","rowIndex":396,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「平気です。私、ちゃんと本当のことを伝えたかったんです。あの方たちは命の恩人ですから」","en":"“I'm all right. I wanted them to know the truth. They saved my life.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アサヒ","displayName":"Asahi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r397","rowIndex":397,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「命の恩人？　本当にそれだけ？」","en":"“Saved your life? Is that really all?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エリー・ホワイト（先代）","displayName":"Ellie White (Previous Generation)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r398","rowIndex":398,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「上手に隠してるつもりなのかもしれないけど、私にはわかるわ。お前、あの坊やのこと、とても気にいってるでしょう？」","en":"“You may think you’re hiding it well, but I can tell. You are very taken with that boy, aren’t you?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エリー・ホワイト（先代）","displayName":"Ellie White (Previous Generation)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r399","rowIndex":399,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そ、そんなっ、そんなことありません……」","en":"“N-no! That isn’t true...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アサヒ","displayName":"Asahi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r400","rowIndex":400,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=87>ベルーハ</tips>は頬を染めて、手を振り、必死で否定する。しかし、そのあからさまな反応が、<tips=31>ミス・ホワイト</tips>の言葉を証明していた。","en":"<tips=87>Belukha's</tips> cheeks flushed as she waved her hands, denying it desperately. But her transparent reaction only proved <tips=31>Miss White</tips> right.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r401","rowIndex":401,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=31>ホワイト</tips>は楽しそうに笑う。","en":"<tips=31>White</tips> laughed in delight.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r402","rowIndex":402,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「心が動くのはいいことよ。でも、本当に好きになってはだめ」","en":"“It is good for your heart to be stirred. But you must never truly fall in love.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エリー・ホワイト（先代）","displayName":"Ellie White (Previous Generation)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r403","rowIndex":403,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「はい。わかってます……」","en":"“Yes. I understand...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アサヒ","displayName":"Asahi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r404","rowIndex":404,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=87>ベルーハ</tips>は言って、俯く。","en":"<tips=87>Belukha</tips> lowered her head as she spoke.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r405","rowIndex":405,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「だって、<tips=31>ミス・ホワイト</tips>は誰のモノにもなってはいけないの」","en":"“Because <tips=31>Miss White</tips> must never belong to anyone.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エリー・ホワイト（先代）","displayName":"Ellie White (Previous Generation)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r406","rowIndex":406,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「え？」","en":"“What?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アサヒ","displayName":"Asahi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r407","rowIndex":407,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=87>ベルーハ</tips>は驚いて顔をあげる。","en":"<tips=87>Belukha</tips> looked up in surprise.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r408","rowIndex":408,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「『<ruby=ベルーハ>Белуха</ruby>』っていう言葉はね、『白い』っていう意味なの。白い山とか、シロイルカをそう呼ぶのよ。そしてそれは私が<tips=31>エリー・ホワイト</tips>と名乗る前の、まだ子供の頃のニックネームなのよ」","en":"“The word ‘Belukha’ means ‘white.’ White mountains and beluga whales are called that. It was also my nickname when I was still a child, before I took the name <tips=31>Ellie White</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エリー・ホワイト（先代）","displayName":"Ellie White (Previous Generation)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r409","rowIndex":409,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=87>ベルーハ</tips>はその言葉の真意を掴みかねて、首を捻る。","en":"Unable to grasp her true meaning, <tips=87>Belukha</tips> cocked her head.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r410","rowIndex":410,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「お前が次の『<tips=31>ミス・ホワイト</tips>』におなりなさい」","en":"“You are to become the next <tips=31>Miss White</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エリー・ホワイト（先代）","displayName":"Ellie White (Previous Generation)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r411","rowIndex":411,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そんな！　何をおっしゃるんですか！」","en":"“No! What are you saying?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アサヒ","displayName":"Asahi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r412","rowIndex":412,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=87>ベルーハ</tips>はとっさに立ち上がるも、貧血による立ちくらみでふらつき、ソファーにまた身体を降ろす。そして<tips=31>ホワイト</tips>の顔を見上げ、","en":"<tips=87>Belukha</tips> sprang to her feet, only to reel with a head rush from blood loss and sink back onto the sofa. She looked up at <tips=31>White</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r413","rowIndex":413,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「私なんかには、とても、こんな大それた仕事は……」","en":"“Someone like me could never take on such a tremendous responsibility...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アサヒ","displayName":"Asahi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r414","rowIndex":414,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そんなことないわ。この一ヶ月、私はお前をじっくり観察させて貰ったの。……役立たずで憎たらしい小娘だったらあの坊やに突っ返してやろうと思ってたんだけど」","en":"“That isn’t true. I’ve spent this past month observing you closely... If you had proved a useless, hateful little girl, I meant to send you straight back to that boy.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エリー・ホワイト（先代）","displayName":"Ellie White (Previous Generation)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r415","rowIndex":415,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=31>ホワイト</tips>は苦笑して、","en":"<tips=31>White</tips> smiled wryly.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r416","rowIndex":416,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「お前はとても賢くて心が強い。そして性格はどこか私に似てる……育ちが似てるせいかしらね？　そして若い頃の私よりもずっと可愛らしいわ。私が死んだら、もうこの店は畳ませるつもりだったんだけど……でも、お前を見ていたら惜しくなった。あとを継いで欲しいの」","en":"“You are very clever, and strong at heart. Something in your nature resembles me... Perhaps because our upbringings were alike. And you are far more endearing than I was at your age. I had intended for this business to close upon my death... Yet watching you made that seem a terrible waste. I want you to succeed me.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エリー・ホワイト（先代）","displayName":"Ellie White (Previous Generation)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r417","rowIndex":417,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「とても私につとまるとは思えません」","en":"“I don’t think I could ever manage it.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アサヒ","displayName":"Asahi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r418","rowIndex":418,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「大丈夫。今すぐってわけじゃない。これから私の仕事を手伝って、やりかたを覚えて貰うから。あんまり時間はないかもしれないけど、それでも、お前なら大丈夫」","en":"“You’ll be fine. I don’t mean immediately. From now on, you’ll help with my work and learn how it is done. We may not have very much time, but even so, I know you can do it.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エリー・ホワイト（先代）","displayName":"Ellie White (Previous Generation)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r419","rowIndex":419,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「わかりました……。お手伝いはします。でも、あとを継ぐとかそういう話は、もうしないでください。ずっと先のことでしょうし、きっと、その時になればそんな話があったことなんておばさまも忘れています」","en":"“All right... I’ll help you. But please don’t talk about my succeeding you anymore. It must be far in the future, and by then I’m sure you’ll have forgotten we ever had this conversation.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アサヒ","displayName":"Asahi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r420","rowIndex":420,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=87>ベルーハ</tips>は子供っぽく顔を歪める。","en":"<tips=87>Belukha’s</tips> face twisted in childish protest.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r421","rowIndex":421,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それでいい。手伝えば、お前も気が変わる。……ねえ、金と力を持てば別の世界を見ることになるの。そこでお前は自分が本当にやりたいことを見つけるんだよ」","en":"“That will do. Once you begin helping, you’ll change your mind... You see, money and power will show you another world. And there, you will discover what you truly want to do.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エリー・ホワイト（先代）","displayName":"Ellie White (Previous Generation)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r422","rowIndex":422,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=31>ミス・ホワイト</tips>はそう言って、意地悪に笑った。","en":"<tips=31>Miss White</tips> gave her a mischievous smile.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r423","rowIndex":423,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=5>太刀川</tips>たちは、また<tips=4>馬明</tips>の運転する車に揺られていた。","en":"<tips=5>Tachikawa</tips> and the others were once again riding in a car driven by <tips=4>Ma Ming</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r424","rowIndex":424,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それぞれが考え事をしており、車内は重苦しい沈黙が支配していた。","en":"Each appeared preoccupied with their own thoughts, and an oppressive silence filled the car.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r425","rowIndex":425,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そう言えばドクター」","en":"“By the way, Doc...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー（過去・青年）","displayName":"Chris Tse (Past, Young)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r426","rowIndex":426,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その沈黙を破ったのは、<tips=3>クリス</tips>だった。","en":"It was <tips=3>Chris</tips> who broke the silence.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r427","rowIndex":427,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なんですか」","en":"“What is it?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"太刀川良馬ペスト仮面","displayName":"Ryoma Tachikawa (Plague Mask)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r428","rowIndex":428,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ついでに<tips=52>ミアオ</tips>のことも調べておいたんだ。聞くか？」","en":"“While I was at it, I looked into <tips=52>Miao</tips> too. Want to hear?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー（過去・青年）","displayName":"Chris Tse (Past, Young)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r429","rowIndex":429,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=3>クリス</tips>は<tips=5>太刀川</tips>の顔を見る。彼は無言で頷く。","en":"<tips=3>Chris</tips> looked at <tips=5>Tachikawa</tips>, who nodded without a word.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r430","rowIndex":430,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=3>クリス</tips>は前を見て、言葉を続ける。","en":"<tips=3>Chris</tips> turned his eyes forward and continued.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r431","rowIndex":431,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……やっぱり、彼女はどうも<tips=18>ローズ・クラブ</tips>に行ったようだ。あのアパートのババアが売ったってゲロったぜ。おれが見たバーベキューの女が、きっと本人だったんだろう」","en":"“...It does look as though she went to the <tips=18>Rose Club</tips>. The old hag from that apartment confessed she sold her. The woman I saw at the barbecue was probably Miao herself.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー（過去・青年）","displayName":"Chris Tse (Past, Young)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r432","rowIndex":432,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうですか……」","en":"“I see...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"太刀川良馬ペスト仮面","displayName":"Ryoma Tachikawa (Plague Mask)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r433","rowIndex":433,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうだとしたら、まだ生きてるんじゃないか？　<tips=32>アサヒ</tips>みたいに血を飲んで不死身になってるんだろう。また会えるよ」","en":"“If that's true, isn't she probably still alive? She must have drunk the blood and become immortal, like <tips=32>Asahi</tips>. You'll see her again.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー（過去・青年）","displayName":"Chris Tse (Past, Young)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r434","rowIndex":434,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうですね」","en":"“Yes.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"太刀川良馬ペスト仮面","displayName":"Ryoma Tachikawa (Plague Mask)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r435","rowIndex":435,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=5>太刀川</tips>は今この場でその話題に深入りしたくないらしく、素っ気なくそう言った。","en":"Apparently unwilling to go any deeper into the subject just then, <tips=5>Tachikawa</tips> answered curtly.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r436","rowIndex":436,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それよりも<tips=3>クリス</tips>」","en":"“More importantly, <tips=3>Chris</tips>...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"太刀川良馬ペスト仮面","displayName":"Ryoma Tachikawa (Plague Mask)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r437","rowIndex":437,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なんだい？」","en":"“What is it?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー（過去・青年）","displayName":"Chris Tse (Past, Young)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r438","rowIndex":438,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「もし、あの<tips=87>ベルーハ</tips>のように不死身の肉体を手に入れられるとしたら、儀式を受けますか？」","en":"“If you could obtain an immortal body like <tips=87>Belukha’s</tips>, would you undergo the ritual?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"太刀川良馬ペスト仮面","displayName":"Ryoma Tachikawa (Plague Mask)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r439","rowIndex":439,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「飲む！　絶対に飲むね！」","en":"“I’d drink it! You bet I’d drink it!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬明（過去）","displayName":"Ma Ming (Past)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r440","rowIndex":440,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　急に大きな声で割り込んできたのは<tips=4>馬明</tips>である。","en":"It was <tips=4>Ma Ming</tips> who suddenly barged into the conversation at full volume.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r441","rowIndex":441,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「死なないで済むなんて、最高じゃないか！　そんな肉体があれば、マシンガンで蜂の巣にされたってへっちゃらだろうな。まさに戦士のための肉体だ」","en":"“Never having to die would be wonderful! With a body like that, you could be riddled with machine-gun fire and walk away laughing. It’s the perfect body for a warrior.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬明（過去）","displayName":"Ma Ming (Past)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r442","rowIndex":442,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「でも、どんなリスクがあるかわからないじゃないか？　少なくとも<tips=17>タイプＢ</tips>にはなってしまうわけだし、何かしら代償を支払わされるのだろう」","en":"“But we don’t know what risks it carries. At the very least, you do become a <tips=17>Type B</tips>, and there must be some price to pay.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ジェフリー（過去）","displayName":"Jeffrey (Past)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r443","rowIndex":443,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　冷静に窘めたのは<tips=39>ジェフリー</tips>である。","en":"It was <tips=39>Jeffrey</tips> who calmly reined him in.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r444","rowIndex":444,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=17>タイプB</tips>としてのリスクはないと仮定しましょう。<tips=3>クリス</tips>、その場合、きみならどうしますか？」","en":"“Let us assume there are no risks associated with becoming <tips=17>Type B</tips>. <tips=3>Chris</tips>, what would you do in that case?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"太刀川良馬ペスト仮面","displayName":"Ryoma Tachikawa (Plague Mask)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r445","rowIndex":445,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=5>太刀川</tips>に訊ねられると、<tips=3>クリス</tips>は考えるそぶりを見せてから、","en":"At <tips=5>Tachikawa’s</tips> question, <tips=3>Chris</tips> made a show of considering the matter.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r446","rowIndex":446,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……おれはいらねえかな」","en":"“...I don’t think I need it.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー（過去・青年）","displayName":"Chris Tse (Past, Young)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r447","rowIndex":447,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なんでだい、兄貴？　三ツ目の力の上、さらに不死身の身体まで手に入れたら無敵じゃないか」","en":"“Why not, Big Brother? If you added an immortal body to the power of your third eye, you’d be invincible.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬明（過去）","displayName":"Ma Ming (Past)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r448","rowIndex":448,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=4>馬明</tips>が意外そうに訊ねる。","en":"<tips=4>Ma</tips> asked in surprise.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r449","rowIndex":449,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「おれはこのままでいいのさ。死ななくなったら、こんなに素晴らしい命ってものを、愛することが出来なくなっちまうかもしれない。……そもそも、おれは今のままでも誰にも負けやしないしな」","en":"“I’m content as I am. If I could no longer die, perhaps I could no longer love this wonderful thing called life... Besides, no one can beat me as I am.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー（過去・青年）","displayName":"Chris Tse (Past, Young)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r450","rowIndex":450,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=3>クリス</tips>は冗談めかして言うと、自分で笑った。","en":"<tips=3>Chris</tips> spoke with a joking air, then laughed at his own remark.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r451","rowIndex":451,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「じゃあさ、ドクターはどうなんだい？　あんただったら、不死身になるか？」","en":"“Then what about you, Doc? Would you become immortal?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー（過去・青年）","displayName":"Chris Tse (Past, Young)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r452","rowIndex":452,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「私も、必要ありませんね」","en":"“I don’t need it either.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"太刀川良馬ペスト仮面","displayName":"Ryoma Tachikawa (Plague Mask)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r453","rowIndex":453,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=3>クリス</tips>の問いに、<tips=5>太刀川</tips>は静かに答える。","en":"<tips=5>Tachikawa</tips> quietly answered <tips=3>Chris’s</tips> question.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r454","rowIndex":454,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「理由は？」","en":"“Why?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー（過去・青年）","displayName":"Chris Tse (Past, Young)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r455","rowIndex":455,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「私の理由は単純です。そこまでして生きたい理由もないですから」","en":"“My reason is simple. I have no reason to want to live badly enough to go that far.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"太刀川良馬ペスト仮面","displayName":"Ryoma Tachikawa (Plague Mask)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r456","rowIndex":456,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「暗いこと言うなよなあ」","en":"“Come on, don't be so gloomy.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー（過去・青年）","displayName":"Chris Tse (Past, Young)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-1:r457","rowIndex":457,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=3>クリス</tips>は大げさに顔を顰めて溜息をつき、そしてその話題を打ち切って、<tips=4>馬明</tips>と贔屓のサッカーチームの話をしはじめた。","en":"<tips=3>Chris</tips> pulled an exaggerated face and sighed. He dropped the subject and began talking with <tips=4>Ma Ming</tips> about their favorite soccer teams.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}}]},{"position":24,"code":"X6-2","unitId":"X6-2","rows":[{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r1","rowIndex":1,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　覆面の怪人『ドクター』としての活動を開始するのに先だって、<tips=5>太刀川良馬</tips>は勤務先の病院に退職願を提出している。","en":"Before beginning his activities as the masked figure known as ‘the Doctor,’ <tips=5>Ryoma Tachikawa</tips> had submitted his resignation to the hospital where he worked.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r2","rowIndex":2,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　住んでいたマンションも解約し、<tips=9>Y地区</tips>に新しい住まいを持った。それまでつき合いのあった人間には一切告げず、ほとんど失踪というべきものであった。両親にもなんの説明もなく、彼らが息子の退職を知ったのは数ヶ月後になる。","en":"He canceled the lease on his apartment and made a new home in <tips=9>Y District</tips>. He told none of his former acquaintances; it amounted almost to a disappearance. Nor did he offer his parents any explanation, and they would not learn that their son had resigned until several months later.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r3","rowIndex":3,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして彼は<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>と手を組んで以降、徐々に<tips=9>Y地区</tips>の裏社会で名の知られた存在となっていった。","en":"After joining forces with <tips=3>Chris Tse</tips>, he gradually became a known figure in the underworld of <tips=9>Y District</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r4","rowIndex":4,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=69>義勝</tips>が交渉や説得を行う際には『ドクター』はいつも同席し、相手の真の感情を盗み読んだ。","en":"Whenever <tips=69>Yisheng</tips> conducted negotiations or tried to persuade someone, the Doctor was always present, secretly reading the other party's true feelings.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r5","rowIndex":5,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=3>クリス</tips>は物理的に隠されたものを暴き、<tips=5>太刀川</tips>が心に隠されたものを暴くことで、<tips=69>義勝</tips>はどこの組織よりも正確な情報を得ることが出来た。","en":"With <tips=3>Chris</tips> uncovering what was physically hidden and <tips=5>Tachikawa</tips> uncovering what was hidden in people’s hearts, <tips=69>Yisheng</tips> could obtain more accurate intelligence than any other organization.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r6","rowIndex":6,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　これが、抗争において、<tips=69>義勝</tips>が数多のギャング組織のなかから抜きん出た、大きな要因だったことは間違いないだろう。","en":"This was undoubtedly a major reason <tips=69>Yisheng</tips> pulled ahead of the many other gangs in the conflict.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r7","rowIndex":7,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　このように、傍目から見ると活動を開始してすぐに裏社会に馴染んで能力を発揮した<tips=5>太刀川</tips>であるが、しかし本人からすれば、この世界での出来事は驚くことばかりであった。","en":"Thus, to an outside observer, <tips=5>Tachikawa</tips> seemed to fit into the underworld and put his ability to work almost as soon as he began. To Tachikawa himself, however, this world was one surprise after another.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r8","rowIndex":8,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　たとえば、こんなことがあった。","en":"For example, there was this incident.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r9","rowIndex":9,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=5>太刀川</tips>が加入してまだ一週間ほどの時期だろうか、事務所に集まって今後の方針などを話し合っていた。そのときトイレに行こうと席を立った<tips=5>太刀川</tips>は、<tips=69>義勝</tips>の構成員の一人とすれ違う。","en":"It must have been about a week after <tips=5>Tachikawa</tips> joined. They had gathered at the office to discuss their plans going forward. When <tips=5>Tachikawa</tips> got up to use the bathroom, he passed one of <tips=69>Yisheng’s</tips> members.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r10","rowIndex":10,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼のサイキック能力を知っているのは<tips=69>義勝</tips>でもごく一部の幹部だけで、他の者たちは知らない。相手があまりにも無防備だったため、意識した訳ではないが、<tips=5>太刀川</tips>は相手の男の目を見てしまった。","en":"Only a handful of <tips=69>Yisheng’s</tips> senior officers knew about his psychic ability; the others did not. The man was so utterly unguarded that, without consciously meaning to, <tips=5>Tachikawa</tips> looked him in the eyes.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r11","rowIndex":11,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「こんにちは『ドクター』」","en":"“Hello, Doctor.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r12","rowIndex":12,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　と相手は愛想笑いを浮かべるが、その内心は顔とは裏腹にやたらと緊張している。","en":"The man gave him an affable smile, but behind it he was extraordinarily tense.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r13","rowIndex":13,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どうも」","en":"“Hello.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"太刀川良馬ペスト仮面","displayName":"Ryoma Tachikawa (Plague Mask)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r14","rowIndex":14,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　挨拶を返すも、<tips=5>太刀川</tips>は違和感を覚えてしかたがない。","en":"<tips=5>Tachikawa</tips> returned the greeting, but he could not shake the sense that something was wrong.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r15","rowIndex":15,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「さっき出ていった彼、えらく緊張していましたが、新人かなにかですか？」","en":"“That man who just left seemed terribly tense. Is he new or something?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"太刀川良馬ペスト仮面","displayName":"Ryoma Tachikawa (Plague Mask)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r16","rowIndex":16,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　部屋に戻って<tips=3>クリス</tips>にそのことを言うと、相手は首を捻った。","en":"When he returned to the room and told <tips=3>Chris</tips> about it, Chris cocked his head.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r17","rowIndex":17,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いや、十年以上前からいるやつだよ」","en":"“No, he’s been with us for more than ten years.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー（過去・青年）","displayName":"Chris Tse (Past, Young)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r18","rowIndex":18,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうですか。じゃあ、なんだったのでしょうね」","en":"“I see. Then what could it have been?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"太刀川良馬ペスト仮面","displayName":"Ryoma Tachikawa (Plague Mask)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r19","rowIndex":19,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……そのときのそいつの感情を、詳しく聞かせてくれ」","en":"“...Tell me in detail exactly what he was feeling at the time.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー（過去・青年）","displayName":"Chris Tse (Past, Young)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r20","rowIndex":20,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=3>クリス</tips>は鋭い表情を見せるでもなく、普通の顔で太刀川の話を聞いていたし、一通り説明するとそのことを忘れたかのように離席前の話題を再開したので、<tips=5>太刀川</tips>も気にしなかった。","en":"<tips=3>Chris</tips> listened with an entirely ordinary expression, displaying no hint of sudden alertness. Once Tachikawa had explained the matter from beginning to end, Chris resumed the subject they had been discussing before Tachikawa stepped away, as though he had forgotten all about the incident, so <tips=5>Tachikawa</tips> gave it no further thought either.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r21","rowIndex":21,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しかし、翌日事務所で顔を合わせると、驚くべき事態になっていた。","en":"When they met at the office the following day, however, the matter had taken an astonishing turn.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r22","rowIndex":22,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あいつ、<tips=68>木下組</tips>のスパイだったよ」","en":"“He was a spy for the <tips=68>Kinoshita-gumi</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー（過去・青年）","displayName":"Chris Tse (Past, Young)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r23","rowIndex":23,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=3>クリス</tips>が言うには、その男は<tips=18>ローズ・クラブ</tips>の有力なバックのひとつである<tips=68>木下組</tips>と接触し、金品を受け取るかわりに<tips=69>義勝</tips>の内部情報を提供していたということだ。","en":"According to <tips=3>Chris</tips>, the man had made contact with the <tips=68>Kinoshita-gumi</tips>, one of the <tips=18>Rose Club’s</tips> influential backers, and supplied it with internal information on <tips=69>Yisheng</tips> in exchange for money and goods.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r24","rowIndex":24,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「昨晩問い詰めたらゲロったんだ」","en":"“We leaned on him last night, and he talked.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー（過去・青年）","displayName":"Chris Tse (Past, Young)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r25","rowIndex":25,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……それで、彼はどうなったんですか？」","en":"“...And what happened to him?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"太刀川良馬ペスト仮面","displayName":"Ryoma Tachikawa (Plague Mask)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r26","rowIndex":26,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=5>太刀川</tips>は自分の何気ない言葉が一人の人間の運命を変えてしまったことを感じつつ、緊張しながらそう訊ねた。","en":"Conscious that his own casual words had altered the fate of another human being, <tips=5>Tachikawa</tips> asked nervously.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r27","rowIndex":27,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「掟にのっとり罰を受けてもらった。見るかい？」","en":"“He was punished according to our rules. Want to see?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー（過去・青年）","displayName":"Chris Tse (Past, Young)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r28","rowIndex":28,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　男は一階の車庫に転がされていた。衣服は身につけておらず、ロープによって手足は縛られている。肌はふくれあがり、全身紫に変色し、顔はパンパンにふくれあがって原形をとどめていなかった。凄惨なリンチを受けたことを物語る状態で、もう息はしていない。","en":"The man lay in the garage on the first floor. He wore no clothes, and ropes bound his hands and feet. His skin had swollen and turned purple across his entire body; his face was grotesquely bloated, its original shape no longer recognizable. His condition attested to a savage beating. He was no longer breathing.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r29","rowIndex":29,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　これを、構成員に一通り見せたあとに、路上に転がすのが裏切り者に与えられる伝統的な刑罰だと言う。","en":"Chris said that after every member of the organization had been shown the body, it would be dumped in the street. This was the traditional punishment for a traitor.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r30","rowIndex":30,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「『ドクター』が来てくれて助かるぜ。おれの目は何でも見通すことが出来るが、人の心だけは見えないからな。あんたがそこを見てくれれば怖いものはない」","en":"“Having the Doctor here is going to be a godsend. My eyes can see through anything, but a person’s heart is the one thing they can’t see. If you look into that for me, we’ll have nothing to fear.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー（過去・青年）","displayName":"Chris Tse (Past, Young)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r31","rowIndex":31,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=3>クリス</tips>は<tips=5>太刀川</tips>がかつて見たことがないほど残酷な顔で笑う。","en":"<tips=3>Chris</tips> wore a crueler smile than <tips=5>Tachikawa</tips> had ever seen from him before.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r32","rowIndex":32,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼がギャングのボスであることは理解していたはずだが、こうした一面を実際目の当たりにするのは初めてで、一見するとただの気さくな青年にしか見えないこの人物が、<tips=5>太刀川</tips>がこれまで関わってきた人間たちとはまったく違う生き物だというのを実感した瞬間だった。","en":"He had understood that Chris was a gang boss, or so he thought, but this was the first time he had witnessed this side of him firsthand. In that moment, <tips=5>Tachikawa</tips> realized that this man, who at first glance looked like nothing more than an easygoing young fellow, was an entirely different kind of creature from any of the people he had previously dealt with.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r33","rowIndex":33,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　この生き物たちの世界で生きてゆけるのだろうかと不安になったものだが、それも僅かな間のことで、彼もすぐに目の前で繰り返される暴力や殺人に慣れていった。","en":"He had wondered anxiously whether he could survive in this world of such creatures, but that lasted only a short while. He, too, soon grew accustomed to the violence and murder that played out again and again before him.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r34","rowIndex":34,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　さて、この<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>。","en":"Now, as for <tips=3>Chris Tse</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r35","rowIndex":35,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　当時彼の『<tips=69>義勝</tips>』は、<tips=68>木下組</tips>の影響を街から排除するために動いていた。","en":"At the time, his <tips=69>Yisheng</tips> was working to drive the <tips=68>Kinoshita-gumi’s</tips> influence out of the city.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r36","rowIndex":36,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　最終的な目標は<tips=18>ローズ・クラブ</tips>であるが、まず後援組織である<tips=68>木下組</tips>の力を削ぐ必要があった。","en":"Their ultimate target was the <tips=18>Rose Club</tips>, but first they needed to weaken its backer, the <tips=68>Kinoshita-gumi</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r37","rowIndex":37,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　組織の規模とすれば、木下組は<tips=69>義勝</tips>などとは比較にならないほど強大だ。","en":"In terms of sheer scale, the Kinoshita-gumi was incomparably more powerful than <tips=69>Yisheng</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r38","rowIndex":38,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ただ、<tips=9>Y地区</tips>という地域の特殊性のため、<tips=68>木下組</tips>も自由に動けない。","en":"The peculiar nature of <tips=9>Y District</tips>, however, kept the <tips=68>Kinoshita-gumi</tips> from operating freely.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r39","rowIndex":39,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ロシアンマフィアなどに金を払って介入させたりもしたが、結局それもうまく行かず、抗争は泥沼化していた。","en":"It had even paid groups such as the Russian mafia to intervene, but that too had ultimately failed, and the conflict had become a quagmire.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r40","rowIndex":40,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=9>Y地区</tips>には他にもいくつもの組織があったが、どこも地域の経済に重大な影響をもたらしている<tips=18>ローズ・クラブ</tips>との対立を恐れていた。","en":"There were several other organizations in <tips=9>Y District</tips>, but all of them feared opposing the <tips=18>Rose Club</tips>, whose business had a profound effect on the local economy.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r41","rowIndex":41,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　かといって武闘派で知られる<tips=69>義勝</tips>との敵対も好まず、結果としてどっちにもつかずに静観のかたちをとっている。","en":"Yet they were equally reluctant to antagonize <tips=69>Yisheng</tips>, renowned as a fighting outfit, and consequently took neither side and merely watched.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r42","rowIndex":42,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　これが<tips=5>太刀川</tips>が加入したときのこの街の状況であった。","en":"This was the state of the city when <tips=5>Tachikawa</tips> joined.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r43","rowIndex":43,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そんなこと、本当に出来ると思っているのか？」","en":"“Do you really think you can pull that off?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"廖志明（過去）","displayName":"Liao Chi-ming (Past)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r44","rowIndex":44,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その日、事務所を訪れた<tips=27>廖志明</tips>は、<tips=3>クリス</tips>の話を聞いてそう驚いた。","en":"That day, <tips=27>Liao Chi-ming</tips> visited the office and reacted in astonishment after hearing <tips=3>Chris</tips> out.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r45","rowIndex":45,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　この、整髪料でべったりと髪の毛をなでつけて、派手な高級スーツを着て、テカテカと光る黒い革靴を履いた男は、客家人たちで構成されるマフィアのボスである。","en":"His hair was plastered flat with styling product, and he wore a gaudy, expensive suit and gleaming black leather shoes. He was the boss of a mafia organization made up of Hakka people.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r46","rowIndex":46,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　先代からファミリーを引き継いだばかりで、まだ若い。<tips=3>クリス</tips>より三つ年上の二十九才である。","en":"He had only recently inherited the family from his predecessor and was still young: twenty-nine years old, three years <tips=3>Chris’s</tips> senior.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r47","rowIndex":47,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼のファミリーは資金力に優れ、その資金を義勝に援助するかわりに、<tips=69>義勝</tips>は彼らに武力を提供するという提携関係にあった。","en":"His family possessed abundant financial resources. In exchange for funding <tips=69>Yisheng</tips>, Yisheng supplied the family with armed force, creating an alliance between the two organizations.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r48","rowIndex":48,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「もちろん」","en":"“Of course.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー（過去・青年）","displayName":"Chris Tse (Past, Young)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r49","rowIndex":49,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=3>クリス</tips>はどんなときでも自信に満ちあふれている。","en":"<tips=3>Chris</tips> was brimming with confidence, as always.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r50","rowIndex":50,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「我々は下らない争いをやめて、力を合わせる……企業の合併みたいに、この街のギャングの連合チームを作るんだよ。そうすれば、<tips=68>木下組</tips>の圧倒的な人員と、<tips=18>ローズ・クラブ</tips>の経済力に対抗出来る」","en":"“We put an end to our petty squabbles and join forces... We form an alliance of this city’s gangs, like a corporate merger. Then we can stand against the overwhelming manpower of the <tips=68>Kinoshita-gumi</tips> and the financial power of the <tips=18>Rose Club</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー（過去・青年）","displayName":"Chris Tse (Past, Young)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r51","rowIndex":51,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そりゃ、実現すれば確かに強力だが……」","en":"“If it could actually be done, it would certainly be powerful, but...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"廖志明（過去）","displayName":"Liao Chi-ming (Past)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r52","rowIndex":52,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=27>廖</tips>は難しい顔で葉巻の灰を灰皿に落とす。","en":"Looking grave, <tips=27>Liao</tips> tapped the ash from his cigar into an ashtray.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r53","rowIndex":53,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どいつもこいつも頭が固くてプライドが高いお山の大将だ。肌や言葉が違う相手を嫌っている。それを、お手々つないで仲良くしようって？　その上、お前が組織のリーダーに？　<tips=35>フェルナンデス</tips>あたりを立てるならまだわかる」","en":"“Every last one of them is a stiff-necked, arrogant little king. They hate anyone with a different color of skin or a different language. And you mean to make them hold hands and play nicely together? On top of that, you intend to be their leader? I might understand if you put forward <tips=35>Fernandes</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"廖志明（過去）","displayName":"Liao Chi-ming (Past)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r54","rowIndex":54,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=35>フェルナンデス</tips>じゃ駄目さ。むしろ、おれじゃなければ誰を立ててもリーダーとは認めてくれないだろう。難しいのはわかってるが、出来ないとは思わないな」","en":"“<tips=35>Fernandes</tips> won't do. In fact, if it isn't me, they probably won't recognize anyone we put forward as leader. I know it will be difficult, but I don't think it's impossible.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー（過去・青年）","displayName":"Chris Tse (Past, Young)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r55","rowIndex":55,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ううむ」","en":"“Hmm...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"廖志明（過去）","displayName":"Liao Chi-ming (Past)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r56","rowIndex":56,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=27>廖</tips>は俯いて考え込む。","en":"<tips=27>Liao</tips> lowered his head and sank into thought.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r57","rowIndex":57,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……そこまで言うのなら、まあ、そうなのかもしれないな」","en":"“...If you're that certain, well, perhaps you're right.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"廖志明（過去）","displayName":"Liao Chi-ming (Past)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r58","rowIndex":58,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして<tips=27>廖</tips>は顔を上げ、クリスの顔を見た。","en":"Then <tips=27>Liao</tips> raised his face and looked at Chris.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r59","rowIndex":59,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あのウォッカ野郎を街から追い出した功績は、確かに、みな高く評価している。<tips=68>木下組</tips>と真っ向勝負をしてここまで持ちこたえているのも、内心ではありがたく思っているだろう。お前の言うことなら、まったく耳を貸さないということはない。……しかし、聞いてくれたからといって、うんとうなずくとは限らないがね」","en":"“Everyone certainly thinks highly of your achievement in driving that vodka bastard out of the city. Deep down, they are probably grateful that you have taken the <tips=68>Kinoshita-gumi</tips> head-on and held out this long. If the proposal comes from you, they won't simply refuse to hear you out. ...But listening doesn't mean they'll nod and say yes.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"廖志明（過去）","displayName":"Liao Chi-ming (Past)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r60","rowIndex":60,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうかな。おれの考えでは、ソムチャイ、<tips=34>ダリオ・ボネット</tips>、<tips=35>ジョゼ・フェルナンデス</tips>……あと、壬生屋太一あたりも説得すれば応じてくれるんじゃないかと思っている」","en":"“You think so? I believe Somchai, <tips=34>Dario Bonetto</tips>, <tips=35>José Fernandes</tips>... and perhaps Taichi Mibuya as well might agree if I persuade them.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー（過去・青年）","displayName":"Chris Tse (Past, Young)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r61","rowIndex":61,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ふん、随分と強気だな。確かに、その連中と組めば<tips=18>ローズ・クラブ</tips>に対抗出来る勢力になるだろうが。……そのときは、お前は名実ともにこの街の王だな」","en":"“Hmph. You're awfully confident. Certainly, if you joined forces with those men, you would command a force capable of opposing the <tips=18>Rose Club</tips>. ...And then you would be king of this city in every sense.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"廖志明（過去）","displayName":"Liao Chi-ming (Past)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r62","rowIndex":62,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=27>廖</tips>はそう言って苦笑する。","en":"<tips=27>Liao</tips> gave a wry smile as he spoke.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r63","rowIndex":63,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうだよ。そしてその時は、アンタにも参加してもらいたい」","en":"“That’s right. And when the time comes, I want you to join us too.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー（過去・青年）","displayName":"Chris Tse (Past, Young)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r64","rowIndex":64,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「その新しい連合に、お前の部下として？」","en":"“Join your new alliance as your subordinate?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"廖志明（過去）","displayName":"Liao Chi-ming (Past)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r65","rowIndex":65,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=27>廖</tips>はわざとらしく驚いて見せる。","en":"<tips=27>Liao</tips> made an elaborate show of surprise.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r66","rowIndex":66,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　確かにこの世界では<tips=3>クリス</tips>の方が古くから活躍し、名が売れている。しかし、<tips=27>廖</tips>の組織の方が勢力が大きく、しかも資金援助をしている側なのだ。","en":"<tips=3>Chris</tips> had admittedly been active in the underworld for longer and was better known. <tips=27>Liao’s</tips> organization, however, was larger—and it was Liao who supplied the funding.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r67","rowIndex":67,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「部下じゃない。同志だ」","en":"“Not as a subordinate. As a comrade.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー（過去・青年）","displayName":"Chris Tse (Past, Young)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r68","rowIndex":68,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「だが、お前がリーダーとして方針を決定するんだろ？」","en":"“But you'd be the leader setting its policy, wouldn't you?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"廖志明（過去）","displayName":"Liao Chi-ming (Past)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r69","rowIndex":69,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうだ」","en":"“I will.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー（過去・青年）","displayName":"Chris Tse (Past, Young)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r70","rowIndex":70,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=3>クリス</tips>は悪びれもせず、そう断言する。","en":"<tips=3>Chris</tips> declared it unapologetically.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r71","rowIndex":71,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なあ、あんたのことを信用しているんだよ。だから、こうして一番最初にこの計画を打ちあけた。この<tips=3>クリス</tips>が男と見込んでるんだぜ。他の腰抜けには話せない」","en":"“Listen, I trust you. That’s why you’re the very first person I’ve told about this plan. <tips=3>Chris</tips> knows a real man when he sees one. I couldn’t tell the other cowards.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー（過去・青年）","displayName":"Chris Tse (Past, Young)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r72","rowIndex":72,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「はっはっは」","en":"“Ha ha ha!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"廖志明（過去）","displayName":"Liao Chi-ming (Past)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r73","rowIndex":73,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=27>廖</tips>は膝を叩いて笑うと、","en":"<tips=27>Liao</tips> slapped his knee and laughed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r74","rowIndex":74,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いいだろう。そこまで言われて見捨てるわけにはいかない。私もお前に賭ける。もし、その連合が出来たときは参加しよう」","en":"“Very well. After all that, I can’t abandon you. I’ll bet on you too. If this alliance comes together, I’ll join it.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"廖志明（過去）","displayName":"Liao Chi-ming (Past)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r75","rowIndex":75,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ありがとう。きっと後悔はさせないぜ」","en":"“Thank you. I promise you won’t regret it.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー（過去・青年）","displayName":"Chris Tse (Past, Young)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r76","rowIndex":76,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「期待しているさ」","en":"“I expect great things.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"廖志明（過去）","displayName":"Liao Chi-ming (Past)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r77","rowIndex":77,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=27>廖</tips>には案外無邪気なところがあって、<tips=3>クリス</tips>にここまで言われたのが嬉しかったらしく、上機嫌で帰っていった。","en":"<tips=27>Liao</tips> had an unexpectedly innocent side. Apparently delighted that <tips=3>Chris</tips> had spoken so highly of him, he left in excellent spirits.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r78","rowIndex":78,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「聞いたな？　あいつはこう言ったぞ、『そのときは参加をする』と。はっきり言質がとれた。ドクターのおかげだ」","en":"“You heard him, didn't you? He said, 'I'll join if it comes together.' We got a clear commitment. Thanks to you, Doc.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー（過去・青年）","displayName":"Chris Tse (Past, Young)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r79","rowIndex":79,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=27>廖</tips>が去った後、<tips=3>クリス</tips>は満足げに頷いた。","en":"After <tips=27>Liao</tips> left, <tips=3>Chris</tips> nodded with satisfaction.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r80","rowIndex":80,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「私は何もしていませんよ。ただ後ろで見ていただけです」","en":"“I did nothing. I was only standing behind you and watching.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"太刀川良馬ペスト仮面","displayName":"Ryoma Tachikawa (Plague Mask)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r81","rowIndex":81,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　マスクをかぶった<tips=5>太刀川</tips>はそう言って肩をすくめる。彼は今の<tips=27>廖</tips>と<tips=3>クリス</tips>の会話を横で聞きながら、<tips=27>廖</tips>の心情を探っていた。","en":"The masked <tips=5>Tachikawa</tips> said this with a shrug. As he listened to <tips=27>Liao</tips> and <tips=3>Chris</tips> from beside them, he had been gauging <tips=27>Liao's</tips> state of mind.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r82","rowIndex":82,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして、もし<tips=27>廖</tips>の感情から<tips=68>木下組</tips>と通じているような雰囲気を感じ取ったら<tips=3>クリス</tips>にサインを送ることになっていたのである。","en":"They had arranged for him to signal <tips=3>Chris</tips> if he sensed anything in <tips=27>Liao’s</tips> emotions suggesting that Liao had ties to the <tips=68>Kinoshita-gumi</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r83","rowIndex":83,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　結果としてはそのサインを送ることなく終わった。つまり、今のところは<tips=27>廖</tips>の言葉を信じてあてにしても問題はないということだ。","en":"In the end, he never had to give the signal. In other words, for the time being there was no problem trusting <tips=27>Liao’s</tips> word and relying on him.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r84","rowIndex":84,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あんたがいるといないのとでは安心感が大違いだ」","en":"“Having you here makes a world of difference to my peace of mind.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー（過去・青年）","displayName":"Chris Tse (Past, Young)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r85","rowIndex":85,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=3>クリス</tips>は太刀川に葉巻をすすめるが、<tips=5>太刀川</tips>は断る。","en":"<tips=3>Chris</tips> offered Tachikawa a cigar, but <tips=5>Tachikawa</tips> declined.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r86","rowIndex":86,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「この連合のことは大分前から考えていたんだが、なかなか実行に移せなくてね。なんでかって、そりゃ、あの<tips=27>廖</tips>って人間を信じられなかったからだ。一筋縄ではいかないやつだし、どんなことを企んでるかわからん。この街の金の流れを握っているあいつが<tips=68>木下組</tips>に通じているようだったら、連合なんかとても作れない」","en":"“I'd been thinking about this alliance for quite some time, but I could never bring myself to put it into action. Why? Because I couldn't trust that man <tips=27>Liao</tips>. He's no easy man to deal with, and there's no telling what he might be plotting. If the man who controls the flow of money in this city turned out to be in league with the <tips=68>Kinoshita-gumi</tips>, there'd be no hope of forming an alliance.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー（過去・青年）","displayName":"Chris Tse (Past, Young)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r87","rowIndex":87,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……彼は口では無理だ無理だと言っていましたが、内心ではきみの意見に大分興味を示しているようでしたよ。彼も<tips=68>木下組</tips>には本心から困っているようです。通じているということはまずないでしょう」","en":"“...He kept saying it was impossible, but inwardly he seemed quite interested in your proposal. He too appears genuinely troubled by the <tips=68>Kinoshita-gumi</tips>. It is highly unlikely that he has ties to them.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"太刀川良馬ペスト仮面","displayName":"Ryoma Tachikawa (Plague Mask)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r88","rowIndex":88,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「すばらしい！　交渉ごとってのはどうしたってもやもやするもんだが、あんたがいれば相手の手の内がはっきり見える。こんなことって、普通じゃありえない」","en":"“Wonderful! Negotiations always leave you wondering, but with you here, I can see the other side's cards. Ordinarily, that would be impossible.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー（過去・青年）","displayName":"Chris Tse (Past, Young)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r89","rowIndex":89,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=3>クリス</tips>は手を打って喜び、<tips=5>太刀川</tips>はその感情表現の大きさに戸惑いを見せるほどだった。","en":"<tips=3>Chris</tips> clapped his hands in delight; the sheer intensity of his reaction visibly disconcerted <tips=5>Tachikawa</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r90","rowIndex":90,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「これで、あいつも参加することが確定した。<tips=27>廖</tips>がこっちにつくとなれば他の連中にも交渉もしやすいだろう。次もこの調子で頼むぜ」","en":"“That confirms he’ll participate. With <tips=27>Liao</tips> on our side, negotiating with the others should be easier. Keep this up for the next one.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー（過去・青年）","displayName":"Chris Tse (Past, Young)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r91","rowIndex":91,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=3>クリス</tips>はそう言って、<tips=5>太刀川</tips>の肩を叩いた。","en":"<tips=3>Chris</tips> gave <tips=5>Tachikawa</tips> a clap on the shoulder.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r92","rowIndex":92,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼の次の交渉相手は、<tips=35>ジョゼ・フェルナンデス</tips>であった。","en":"His next negotiating partner was <tips=35>José Fernandes</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r93","rowIndex":93,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=35>フェルナンデス</tips>はブラジル人地域のリーダーである。","en":"<tips=35>Fernandes</tips> was the leader of the Brazilian community.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r94","rowIndex":94,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　誇り高く、義理堅い人物として知られ、敵に対しては容赦なく残酷な手段をとるが、そうでない相手に自分から手を出すことはなく、約束を破ることはなかった。この街では多数派とは言えないブラジル人が、比較的尊重されているのは彼の能力によるものだろう。","en":"Known as a proud man who honored his obligations, he employed ruthlessly brutal methods against his enemies but never initiated violence against anyone else and never broke a promise. Brazilians were hardly a majority in the city; if they nonetheless received a measure of respect, it was probably owing to his ability.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r95","rowIndex":95,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　開放的で社交性があるという一般的なブラジル人のイメージとは違って、彼は厳格で閉鎖的な性格であり、よその団体とあまり接触を持たなかったが、こうした事情によって他の組織からも一定の敬意を持たれていた。","en":"Contrary to the popular image of Brazilians as open and gregarious, Fernandes was an austere and insular man who seldom dealt with outside groups. Yet the very qualities just described won him a certain respect from the other organizations.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r96","rowIndex":96,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　このような相手であるから、まず、会ってくれるかどうかという問題があったが、連絡をとるとスムーズにことが運んだ。","en":"Given the nature of the man, the first question was whether he would agree to see them at all. Once they made contact, however, the arrangements proceeded smoothly.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r97","rowIndex":97,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　場所は<tips=35>フェルナンデス</tips>の自宅で、<tips=69>義勝</tips>の一行はその館の前で武装解除され、その応接室で<tips=35>フェルナンデス</tips>と向かい合うことになった。","en":"The meeting took place at <tips=35>Fernandes’s</tips> home. The <tips=69>Yisheng</tips> delegation was disarmed outside the mansion, then brought face-to-face with <tips=35>Fernandes</tips> in its reception room.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r98","rowIndex":98,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼の両脇には戦場で使うようなアサルトライフルを持った部下が立ち、その足元では孫ほど年の離れた三人の幼い娘が遊んでいた。","en":"Subordinates holding military assault rifles stood on either side of him. At their feet played three little girls young enough to be his granddaughters.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r99","rowIndex":99,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　相手の本拠地のなか、こちらが丸腰で相手が重武装という状態だったが、<tips=5>太刀川</tips>の目が相手には明確な敵意がないことを見抜いていた。もちろん、これからの話によって変化しないとも限らないが。","en":"They were unarmed inside the other party's stronghold, while their hosts were heavily armed. But <tips=5>Tachikawa</tips> could see that the other side bore them no clear hostility—though there was no guarantee the coming conversation would not change that.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r100","rowIndex":100,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それより<tips=3>クリス</tips>は絨毯の上で大人たちの事情と無関心に遊ぶ三人娘の方が邪魔だったが、<tips=35>フェルナンデス</tips>はいつまで経っても去らせようとしなかたのでそのまま交渉を行うほかなかった。","en":"More than the guns, what bothered <tips=3>Chris</tips> was the presence of the three girls playing on the carpet, oblivious to the adults' affairs. Yet however long he waited, <tips=35>Fernandes</tips> showed no sign of sending them away, so Chris had no choice but to negotiate in front of them.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r101","rowIndex":101,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　少し雑談をして、<tips=5>太刀川</tips>のチェックにより<tips=35>フェルナンデス</tips>が<tips=68>木下組</tips>の支配下にないことを確認してから本題に入った。","en":"After some small talk, and after <tips=5>Tachikawa’s</tips> reading confirmed that <tips=35>Fernandes</tips> was not under the control of the <tips=68>Kinoshita-gumi</tips>, Chris came to the point.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r102","rowIndex":102,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「つまり、さまざまな勢力の代表者を集め、<tips=9>Y地区</tips>全体を代表する仕組みをつくるわけか？」","en":"“In other words, you would gather representatives of the various powers and create a body that speaks for <tips=9>Y District</tips> as a whole?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ジョゼ・フェルナンデス","displayName":"José Fernandes","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r103","rowIndex":103,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=3>クリス</tips>が一通りの説明をした時点で<tips=35>フェルナンデス</tips>はそう訊ねた。","en":"<tips=35>Fernandes</tips> asked the question once <tips=3>Chris</tips> had finished giving him an outline.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r104","rowIndex":104,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「その通りだ。このままバラバラでいたら、<tips=68>木下組</tips>に好き放題やられるだけだ。彼らに気づかれぬよう地下で手を結び、そして機を見て一挙に動く」","en":"“Exactly. If we stay divided, the <tips=68>Kinoshita-gumi</tips> will go on doing whatever they please. We form our alliance in secret, without them catching on, and then strike as one when the time is right.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー（過去・青年）","displayName":"Chris Tse (Past, Young)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r105","rowIndex":105,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=3>クリス</tips>からすると、この<tips=35>フェルナンデス</tips>という人物はタフな交渉相手だった。","en":"From <tips=3>Chris’s</tips> perspective, <tips=35>Fernandes</tips> was a tough man to negotiate with.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r106","rowIndex":106,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ついたり離れたりの激しい<tips=9>Y地区</tips>にあって常に独立を保ち続けていた<tips=35>フェルナンデス</tips>に、連合と言えば聞こえがいいが、実質<tips=3>クリス</tips>をリーダーとした新組織に加入しろという虫の良い提案をしているのである。","en":"Amid the constant forming and breaking of alliances in <tips=9>Y District</tips>, <tips=35>Fernandes</tips> had always maintained his independence. 'Alliance' made the proposal sound appealing, but in substance <tips=3>Chris</tips> was asking him to join a new organization led by Chris himself. It was an awfully convenient request for Chris to make.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r107","rowIndex":107,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　普通ならなかなか受け入れられる話ではない。","en":"Ordinarily, this was not the sort of proposal anyone would readily accept.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r108","rowIndex":108,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　すぐに断られるのではないかという危惧もあったが、しかし<tips=35>フェルナンデス</tips>は、無言で考え込む。","en":"Chris feared that <tips=35>Fernandes</tips> might reject it outright, but instead Fernandes fell silent, deep in thought.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r109","rowIndex":109,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=3>クリス</tips>は部屋の隅に座っている<tips=5>太刀川</tips>の方を見る。<tips=5>太刀川</tips>は手を上げてマスクの下の顔を指先で掻くそぶりを見せる。これは、押せというサインだ。","en":"<tips=3>Chris</tips> looked toward <tips=5>Tachikawa</tips>, who sat in a corner of the room. <tips=5>Tachikawa</tips> raised a hand and made a show of scratching his face beneath the mask. This was the signal to press harder.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r110","rowIndex":110,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あんたのところにだって、<tips=18>ローズ・クラブ</tips>に食い物にされた仲間がいるはずだ。このままでいいのか？　下らないプライドは捨てて、手を組むべき時期が来たんだよ」","en":"“Some of your people must have been preyed upon by the <tips=18>Rose Club</tips> too. Are you content to leave things as they are? The time has come to cast aside our petty pride and join forces.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー（過去・青年）","displayName":"Chris Tse (Past, Young)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r111","rowIndex":111,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして<tips=3>クリス</tips>は<tips=5>太刀川</tips>からのサインで相手の心情の変化を確認しながら、得意の雄弁で<tips=35>フェルナンデス</tips>を説き続けたのである。","en":"And so, watching <tips=5>Tachikawa's</tips> signals to track each change in the other man's feelings, <tips=3>Chris</tips> continued working on <tips=35>Fernandes</tips> with his customary eloquence.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r112","rowIndex":112,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「わかった。提案を受け入れよう」","en":"“Very well. I accept your proposal.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ジョゼ・フェルナンデス","displayName":"José Fernandes","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r113","rowIndex":113,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　最終的に<tips=35>フェルナンデス</tips>はそう言った。","en":"That was <tips=35>Fernandes's</tips> answer in the end.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r114","rowIndex":114,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　三人目の交渉相手は<tips=59>暗闇通り</tips>の壬生屋太一であった。","en":"The third man with whom they negotiated was Taichi Mibuya of <tips=59>Darkness Street</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r115","rowIndex":115,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼は暗闇通りに建ち並ぶ売春宿や娼婦たちの元締めの一人であり、<tips=59>暗闇通り</tips>で最も強大な人物であった。その仕事柄、<tips=18>ローズ・クラブ</tips>と直接の利害関係にある。","en":"He was one of the men who controlled the brothels and prostitutes lining Darkness Street, and the most powerful man on <tips=59>Darkness Street</tips>. The nature of his business gave him a direct stake in the <tips=18>Rose Club</tips> problem.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r116","rowIndex":116,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=3>クリス</tips>は一、二度どこかで見かけたことがある程度でほとんど関わりがないが、訪ねると相手はこっちを知っていたようで、大歓迎で迎えられた。","en":"<tips=3>Chris</tips> had done little more than glimpse him somewhere once or twice and had almost no dealings with him, but when Chris called, the other man apparently knew who he was and welcomed him enthusiastically.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r117","rowIndex":117,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そのでっぷりと太った男は、交渉場所に<tips=9>Y地区</tips>の外の高級ホテルの一室を指定していた。<tips=3>クリス</tips>が訪ねた時、彼は左右に美女を侍らせている。そのまま、面会となった。","en":"The heavily built man had chosen a room in a luxury hotel outside <tips=9>Y District</tips> as the meeting place. When <tips=3>Chris</tips> arrived, he found Mibuya seated with a beautiful woman on either side. And that was how the meeting began.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r118","rowIndex":118,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=3>クリス</tips>は<tips=5>太刀川</tips>、<tips=39>ジェフリー</tips>、<tips=4>馬明</tips>といったいつものメンツで、この美女に挟まれた男と交渉することになる。","en":"With the usual faces beside him—<tips=5>Tachikawa</tips>, <tips=39>Jeffrey</tips>, and <tips=4>Ma Ming</tips>—<tips=3>Chris</tips> began negotiating with the man between the two beauties.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r119","rowIndex":119,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼との交渉は簡単だった。元より、<tips=9>Y地区</tips>で最も<tips=18>ローズ・クラブ</tips>に悩まされている人物である。そして、彼らはギャングではなく商売人だった。金はあったが、彼が動かせる戦闘員はチンピラばかりで他の組織のように忠誠心が強く命をかけて戦うような部下がいない。","en":"The negotiation with him was simple. No one in <tips=9>Y District</tips> suffered more from the <tips=18>Rose Club</tips>. Moreover, his people were businessmen, not gangsters. They had money, but the fighters he could mobilize were mere hoodlums; he had no loyal subordinates prepared to risk their lives in battle as the members of other organizations would.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r120","rowIndex":120,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そのため壬生屋は勢力の大きさのわりには一段低く見られる傾向があり、この連合によって<tips=35>フェルナンデス</tips>や<tips=3>クリス</tips>と同格に見られ、しかも<tips=68>木下組</tips>の圧力に対してその戦闘力を借りられるのならば、渡りに船といった格好だった。","en":"For that reason, Mibuya tended to be looked down on despite the size of his operation. If the alliance would put him on an equal footing with <tips=35>Fernandes</tips> and <tips=3>Chris</tips>, and let him call on their fighting strength against pressure from the <tips=68>Kinoshita-gumi</tips>, then the offer was just what he needed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r121","rowIndex":121,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いいでしょう。私どもは荒っぽいことは出来ませんが、資金面の援助ならば惜しみません。連中を追い出して、我々の街を取り戻しましょう」","en":"“Very well. My people cannot handle the rough stuff, but I will spare no financial support. Let us drive them out and reclaim our city.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r122","rowIndex":122,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼はヌルヌルと光るナメクジのような唇の間からそう言った。","en":"The words emerged between sluglike lips, slick and shining.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r123","rowIndex":123,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　この女を食い物にしている評判の悪い男を、<tips=3>クリス</tips>はその人格も含めて嫌悪していたため、改めてそう言われるとゾクリと悪寒のようなものがしないでもなかったが、同志となることによっていくらか改められるかもしれないと自分を納得させ、彼と握手をした。","en":"The man was notorious for preying upon women, and <tips=3>Chris</tips> detested both his character and his trade. Hearing him speak in this fashion, Chris could not quite suppress a shiver of revulsion. He convinced himself that becoming comrades might reform Mibuya to some degree, then shook his hand.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r124","rowIndex":124,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　四人目に会ったのはソム・チャイだった。","en":"The fourth man they met was Somchai.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r125","rowIndex":125,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　タイ人のコミュニティを束ねる男で、体中に刺青を入れている。","en":"He led the Thai community and was tattooed all over.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r126","rowIndex":126,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼の勢力は数が多いわけではないが、結束力が強く、勇敢である。<tips=69>義勝</tips>と似た特徴を持つ組織で、仲間に引き入れられれば重要な戦力になると期待されていたが、最初のいくつかの会話で、既に<tips=68>木下組</tips>の影響下にあることが<tips=5>太刀川</tips>の目によって見抜かれた。","en":"His forces were not numerous, but they were tightly bound and brave. The organization resembled <tips=69>Yisheng</tips> in character, and Chris had hoped it would provide valuable fighting strength if brought into the fold. Within their first few exchanges, however, <tips=5>Tachikawa’s</tips> reading revealed that Somchai was already under the influence of the <tips=68>Kinoshita-gumi</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r127","rowIndex":127,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そのため、連合の話題を出すことなくその場を後にした。","en":"They consequently left without ever raising the subject of the alliance.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r128","rowIndex":128,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　五人目となったのは、<tips=34>ダリオ・ボネット</tips>である。","en":"The fifth man was <tips=34>Dario Bonetto</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r129","rowIndex":129,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　この男は国籍的はイタリア人だが、生まれて間もなく賭博師の父と共にマニラに移り住み、その後この<tips=9>Y地区</tips>へ流れ着いた。","en":"An Italian by nationality, he had moved to Manila with his gambler father shortly after his birth, and later washed up in <tips=9>Y District</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r130","rowIndex":130,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　同年代のヨーロッパ系移民と手を組み、主にカジノを経営したり、ヨーロッパのフットボールや自転車競技を対象に客たちに賭博をさせノミ行為をするのが主な活動のため、<tips=9>Y地区</tips>のカジノ王と呼ばれている。規模は小さいが麻薬取引やポルノビデオのコピー販売など、金になるものならなんでも行っていたようだ。","en":"He joined forces with European immigrants of his own generation. Their principal business was running casinos and acting as bookmakers for customers betting on European football and cycling, earning him the name of casino king of <tips=9>Y District</tips>. On a smaller scale, they apparently pursued anything that promised money, including drug dealing and the sale of pirated pornographic videos.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r131","rowIndex":131,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　かつては依頼殺人や暗殺も請け負っていたが、カジノの経営が成功して売り上げが充分なものとなってからはピタリとやめたようだ。","en":"They had once accepted contracts for murder and assassination as well, but after the casinos became successful and brought in sufficient revenue, they appeared to have stopped altogether.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r132","rowIndex":132,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　かつて<tips=9>Y地区</tips>で起きた数々の暗殺事件に直接関わったとされているが、本人は気の小さそうなふとっちょの中年男であり、とてもそれほど凶悪な人物とは思えない容姿をしている。","en":"Dario was said to have been directly involved in numerous assassinations in <tips=9>Y District</tips>. The man himself, however, was a timid-looking, fat, middle-aged fellow whose appearance scarcely suggested such brutality.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r133","rowIndex":133,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=9>Y地区</tips>のギャングというのは、<tips=35>フェルナンデス</tips>に代表されるように移民が生きてゆくために武装をしたという側面が多かれ少なかれあったが、彼らは生まれた時から純然たる犯罪組織であった。とにかく何をしでかすかわからず、危険な相手である。これまで<tips=69>義勝</tips>とはさほど関わりがなかったが、<tips=27>廖</tips>の組織と経済的な繋がりがあったため、その噂はよく聞いていた。","en":"To a greater or lesser extent, the gangs of <tips=9>Y District</tips>—<tips=35>Fernandes's</tips> being a prime example—had taken up arms so their immigrant communities could survive. Dario and his associates, by contrast, had been a criminal organization from the very beginning. There was no telling what they might do, which made them dangerous company. They had previously had little to do with <tips=69>Yisheng</tips>, but their financial ties to <tips=27>Liao's</tips> organization meant Chris had heard plenty of stories about them.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r134","rowIndex":134,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そのため、<tips=3>クリス</tips>も交渉において細心の注意を払わねばならなかった。","en":"For that reason, <tips=3>Chris</tips> had to exercise the utmost care in the negotiations.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r135","rowIndex":135,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　会見は<tips=59>暗闇通り</tips>にある、どちらの勢力下でもないレストランを借り切って行われた。","en":"The meeting was held in a restaurant on <tips=59>Darkness Street</tips> that lay within neither side's sphere of influence; they had reserved the entire place.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r136","rowIndex":136,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　以前木下組が進出を行ったとき、<tips=59>暗闇通り</tips>に賭博場を作ったため、<tips=34>ダリオ</tips>たちは直接対立したという過去がある。そのため、今回の<tips=18>ローズ・クラブ</tips>の台頭とそれに伴う<tips=68>木下組</tips>の活動に悩まされており、<tips=3>クリス</tips>の話には好意的だった。","en":"When the Kinoshita-gumi had previously moved into the area, it opened a gambling house on <tips=59>Darkness Street</tips>, bringing <tips=34>Dario's</tips> group into direct conflict with it. The rise of the <tips=18>Rose Club</tips> and the accompanying activity of the <tips=68>Kinoshita-gumi</tips> were therefore causing him considerable trouble, and he was receptive to what <tips=3>Chris</tips> had to say.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r137","rowIndex":137,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しかし、壬生屋が参加者の一人であることを聞くと顔を顰めた。","en":"When he learned that Mibuya was among the participants, however, his face tightened.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r138","rowIndex":138,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「残念ですが、彼がいるならご協力出来ません」","en":"“I regret to say that if he is involved, I cannot offer my cooperation.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ダリオ・ボネット","displayName":"Dario Bonetto","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r139","rowIndex":139,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　同じ<tips=59>暗闇通り</tips>を根城にする彼らは何かと対立しており、小さないざこざをいくつも起こしていた。","en":"Both men had made <tips=59>Darkness Street</tips> their base and constantly came into conflict, producing any number of minor altercations.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r140","rowIndex":140,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　もちろん<tips=3>クリス</tips>もその事情を知っている。そのため、今後お互いに不必要な挑発行為や干渉を控えるという協定書を作り、壬生屋太一にサインをさせてから持参していた。","en":"<tips=3>Chris</tips> naturally knew the history. He had therefore drawn up an agreement under which both parties would refrain from needless provocation and interference in the future, secured Taichi Mibuya’s signature, and brought the document with him.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r141","rowIndex":141,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あんたがこれにサインをして、おれがこれを預かる。どちらかが約束を破った場合は、おれが責任を持って対処する。これでどうだ？」","en":"“You sign this, and I hold on to it. If either one of you breaks the agreement, I’ll deal with him myself. How does that sound?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー（過去・青年）","displayName":"Chris Tse (Past, Young)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r142","rowIndex":142,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ミスター・ツェー。あなたは信用出来る人間だが……」","en":"“Mr. Tse, you are a man I can trust, but...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ダリオ・ボネット","displayName":"Dario Bonetto","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r143","rowIndex":143,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=34>ダリオ</tips>は言葉を濁した。","en":"<tips=34>Dario</tips> left the rest diplomatically unsaid.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r144","rowIndex":144,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そこで<tips=5>太刀川</tips>がこっそり<tips=3>クリス</tips>に合図を出し、二人はトイレに出向く。","en":"<tips=5>Tachikawa</tips> quietly signaled <tips=3>Chris</tips>, and the two withdrew to the bathroom.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r145","rowIndex":145,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=3>クリス</tips>、どうも壬生屋の名前が出るたびに、彼の心に殺意のようなものが見え隠れするんです。それも漠然としたものではなく、もっと具体的な……」","en":"“<tips=3>Chris</tips>, whenever Mibuya’s name comes up, something like murderous intent flickers through his mind. And it isn’t merely an abstract impulse. It is more specific...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"太刀川良馬ペスト仮面","displayName":"Ryoma Tachikawa (Plague Mask)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r146","rowIndex":146,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=3>クリス</tips>がその第三の目で盗聴器の類がないのを確認してから、<tips=5>太刀川</tips>はそう口にした。","en":"Only after <tips=3>Chris</tips> had used his third eye to confirm that no listening device was present did <tips=5>Tachikawa</tips> speak.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r147","rowIndex":147,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「壬生屋に対して、何かするつもりなのか？」","en":"“Are you planning to do something to Mibuya?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー（過去・青年）","displayName":"Chris Tse (Past, Young)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r148","rowIndex":148,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=3>クリス</tips>の確認に、<tips=5>太刀川</tips>は頷く。","en":"When <tips=3>Chris</tips> asked him to confirm it, <tips=5>Tachikawa</tips> nodded.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r149","rowIndex":149,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうですね。この感じからすると、今まさに殺害計画が進行している最中かもしれません」","en":"“Yes. Judging by what I’m sensing, a murder plot may be under way this very moment.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"太刀川良馬ペスト仮面","displayName":"Ryoma Tachikawa (Plague Mask)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r150","rowIndex":150,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それはまいったな。この状況で壬生屋を殺されては困る」","en":"“Now that is a problem. We can’t have Mibuya killed under the present circumstances.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー（過去・青年）","displayName":"Chris Tse (Past, Young)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r151","rowIndex":151,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=3>クリス</tips>はしばし考えてから、","en":"<tips=3>Chris</tips> considered the matter for a moment.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r152","rowIndex":152,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「わかった。一応食い下がってみるが、今日は無理かもしれねえな」","en":"“All right. I’ll keep pressing him, at least, but we may not get anywhere today.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー（過去・青年）","displayName":"Chris Tse (Past, Young)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r153","rowIndex":153,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして<tips=34>ダリオ</tips>との交渉の席に戻った。","en":"They then returned to the negotiating table with <tips=34>Dario</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r154","rowIndex":154,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=3>クリス</tips>はその後壬生屋との和解を勧めるが、<tips=34>ダリオ</tips>はうんと言わない。","en":"<tips=3>Chris</tips> continued urging him to reconcile with Mibuya, but <tips=34>Dario</tips> refused to agree.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r155","rowIndex":155,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しまいには組織の方針に干渉されたくないと苛立たせてしまう始末で、一旦その場を退散した。","en":"Eventually, the pressure only irritated him into declaring that he would tolerate no interference in his organization’s policies, and Chris was forced to withdraw for the time being.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r156","rowIndex":156,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その後一行は<tips=31>エリー・ホワイト</tips>の屋敷を訪ねた。","en":"The party next visited <tips=31>Ellie White’s</tips> mansion.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r157","rowIndex":157,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女はこの街の銃器などの密輸品の動きについて情報網を持っている。","en":"She possessed an intelligence network covering the movement of firearms and other contraband throughout the city.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r158","rowIndex":158,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そこでここ数ヶ月の間に銃器や弾薬、爆弾などを誰に売ったか知りたかった。","en":"Chris wanted to know who had bought guns, ammunition, explosives, and similar goods over the past several months.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r159","rowIndex":159,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　もし<tips=34>ダリオ</tips>が本当に壬生屋の命を狙って居るのならば、何か意味のある動きがあるかもしれない。","en":"If <tips=34>Dario</tips> truly had designs on Mibuya's life, there might have been some telltale activity.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r160","rowIndex":160,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=5>太刀川</tips>の推測の裏付けが欲しかった。","en":"Chris wanted corroboration for <tips=5>Tachikawa’s</tips> conjecture.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r161","rowIndex":161,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=31>エリー</tips>は今日、体調を崩して朝から休んでおります」","en":"“<tips=31>Ellie</tips> is unwell today and has been resting since this morning.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アサヒ","displayName":"Asahi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r162","rowIndex":162,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その日、彼らの応対をしたのは<tips=87>ベルーハ</tips>だった。","en":"<tips=87>Belukha</tips> received them that day.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r163","rowIndex":163,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　いつもと違う黒い服を身につけ、いつも<tips=31>ミス・ホワイト</tips>の座る椅子に腰掛けている。","en":"She was dressed in black, unlike usual, and sat in the chair ordinarily occupied by <tips=31>Miss White</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r164","rowIndex":164,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どうしても会えないか？　大事な用件があるんだ」","en":"“Is there no way we can see her? This is important.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー（過去・青年）","displayName":"Chris Tse (Past, Young)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r165","rowIndex":165,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「用件ならば、私がお伝えいたします」","en":"“If you tell me what you need, I shall convey it to her.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アサヒ","displayName":"Asahi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r166","rowIndex":166,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「お嬢ちゃん、きみがか？」","en":"“You, young lady?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー（過去・青年）","displayName":"Chris Tse (Past, Young)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r167","rowIndex":167,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「はい。健康が回復するまで、私が代理としてお客様の応対をするよう申しつけられております」","en":"“Yes. I have been instructed to receive our guests as her representative until she recovers.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アサヒ","displayName":"Asahi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r168","rowIndex":168,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「驚いたな。ちょっと見ない間に随分出世したもんだ」","en":"“Well, I’m astonished. You’ve come a long way in the short time since I last saw you.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー（過去・青年）","displayName":"Chris Tse (Past, Young)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r169","rowIndex":169,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=3>クリス</tips>は呆れたように笑う。","en":"<tips=3>Chris</tips> laughed in disbelief.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r170","rowIndex":170,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「私では、何か不都合がございますか？」","en":"“Would my handling the matter present some inconvenience?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アサヒ","displayName":"Asahi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r171","rowIndex":171,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=87>ベルーハ</tips>は冷たくそう言い放つ。","en":"<tips=87>Belukha</tips> delivered the question coldly.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r172","rowIndex":172,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その前に会ったときとは全く違う態度に<tips=3>クリス</tips>は肩をすくめ、","en":"Faced with an attitude wholly unlike the one he had seen at their last meeting, <tips=3>Chris</tips> shrugged.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r173","rowIndex":173,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いや、それならきみにお願いしよう」","en":"“No. In that case, I’ll put the matter to you.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー（過去・青年）","displayName":"Chris Tse (Past, Young)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r174","rowIndex":174,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして、用件を伝えた。","en":"He proceeded to explain why they had come.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r175","rowIndex":175,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　すると<tips=87>ベルーハ</tips>は溜息をつき、","en":"<tips=87>Belukha</tips> sighed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r176","rowIndex":176,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「申し訳ありませんが、そういったご用件ならば、<tips=31>エリー・ホワイト</tips>に聞くまでもありません」","en":"“I am sorry, but if that is the nature of your request, there is no need even to consult <tips=31>Ellie White</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アサヒ","displayName":"Asahi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r177","rowIndex":177,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=3>クリス</tips>の顔をまっすぐ見つめると、","en":"She looked <tips=3>Chris</tips> straight in the eye.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r178","rowIndex":178,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「当商店では地球上で手に入るものならどんなものでもお売りしますが、取り扱わないものが三つあります。人間と、麻薬と、お客様の情報です。これだけは、いくら積まれてもお売りすることは出来ません」","en":"“This establishment will sell you anything obtainable on the face of the earth, with three exceptions. We do not deal in human beings, narcotics, or information concerning our customers. No price, however large, can purchase any of those three things.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アサヒ","displayName":"Asahi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r179","rowIndex":179,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そう言わないでくれ。この街の未来のために必要な情報なんだ」","en":"“Please don’t say that. This information is necessary for the future of the city.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー（過去・青年）","displayName":"Chris Tse (Past, Young)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r180","rowIndex":180,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=3>クリス</tips>はすがるように言う。","en":"<tips=3>Chris’s</tips> appeal verged on pleading.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r181","rowIndex":181,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「おれがこうして頼んでもダメなのか？　ここできみの口から許可を出せと言っているわけじゃない。ただ<tips=31>エリー</tips>に取り次いでくれればいいんだ。言いたかねえが、我々はきみにいろいろとしてやったはずだぜ」","en":"“You still won’t do it when I ask you like this? I’m not telling you to authorize anything here and now. All I want is for you to pass the request along to <tips=31>Ellie</tips>. I’d rather not bring it up, but we have done a great deal for you.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー（過去・青年）","displayName":"Chris Tse (Past, Young)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r182","rowIndex":182,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　すると<tips=87>ベルーハ</tips>は額に小さく皺を浮かべて戸惑いを見せてから、","en":"A faint crease appeared in <tips=87>Belukha's</tips> brow, betraying a moment of uncertainty.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r183","rowIndex":183,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……どなたがおっしゃっても同じです。その様なご用件を<tips=31>エリー</tips>に伝えることはありません」","en":"“...My answer would be the same regardless of who asked. I will not convey any such request to <tips=31>Ellie</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アサヒ","displayName":"Asahi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r184","rowIndex":184,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そうはっきり言った。","en":"Her refusal was unequivocal.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r185","rowIndex":185,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「お客様はお帰りになるそうです。ドアを」","en":"“Our guests will be leaving. Show them to the door.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アサヒ","displayName":"Asahi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r186","rowIndex":186,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　朗々とした声で、ドアボーイに申しつける。","en":"She issued the instruction to the doorman in a clear, resonant voice.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r187","rowIndex":187,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうか。わかった」","en":"“I see. Very well.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー（過去・青年）","displayName":"Chris Tse (Past, Young)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r188","rowIndex":188,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=3>クリス</tips>は溜息をつき、","en":"<tips=3>Chris</tips> sighed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r189","rowIndex":189,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「迷惑をかけたな。<tips=31>ミス・ホワイト</tips>はなかなか優秀な代理人を見つけたもんだ。おそれいったよ」","en":"“I’m sorry to have troubled you. <tips=31>Miss White</tips> has found herself an exceptionally capable representative. I’m impressed.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー（過去・青年）","displayName":"Chris Tse (Past, Young)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r190","rowIndex":190,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　皮肉交じりにそう言って苦笑すると、仲間と共に部屋を出て行った。","en":"He delivered the compliment with a wry smile and a trace of irony, then left the room with his companions.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r191","rowIndex":191,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=87>ベルーハ</tips>様」","en":"“Lady <tips=87>Belukha</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r192","rowIndex":192,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ドアが閉まると椅子の手すりにもたれかかるようにうなだれた<tips=87>ベルーハ</tips>に、横で一部始終を見つめていた使用人がそう声をかける。","en":"Once the door had closed, <tips=87>Belukha</tips> sagged against the armrest of her chair, head bowed. The servant who had watched the entire exchange from beside her now addressed her.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r193","rowIndex":193,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ご立派でしたぞ。まるで<tips=31>エリー</tips>様が若返られたようでした」","en":"“You acquitted yourself splendidly. It was as though Lady <tips=31>Ellie</tips> herself had grown young again.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r194","rowIndex":194,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ありがとう。クレコフさん……」","en":"“Thank you, Mr. Krekov...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アサヒ","displayName":"Asahi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r195","rowIndex":195,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=87>ベルーハ</tips>はその姿勢のままうめくように言った。","en":"Still in the same posture, <tips=87>Belukha</tips> spoke as though with a groan.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r196","rowIndex":196,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　結局<tips=3>クリス</tips>たちは一方で壬生屋の身辺警護をしつつ、一方で暗殺計画の調査をすることとなった。","en":"In the end, <tips=3>Chris</tips> and his people guarded Mibuya while simultaneously investigating the assassination plan.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r197","rowIndex":197,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　壬生屋が殺されれば、状況の如何に関わらず<tips=34>ダリオ・ボネット</tips>が疑われるのは間違いない。その結果抗争となる可能性さえある。たとえ殺されなくとも、暗殺計画が表面化したら同じことになる。","en":"If Mibuya were killed, <tips=34>Dario Bonetto</tips> would unquestionably fall under suspicion, whatever the circumstances. The result might even be open warfare. The same thing would happen even if Mibuya survived, should the assassination plan itself come to light.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r198","rowIndex":198,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=3>クリス</tips>としては、<tips=18>ローズ・クラブ</tips>と戦う前に<tips=9>Y地区</tips>の有力組織同志で争うという事態は、なんとしても避けたかった。","en":"<tips=3>Chris</tips> was determined at any cost to prevent the leading organizations of <tips=9>Y District</tips> from fighting one another before the battle against the <tips=18>Rose Club</tips> had even begun.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r199","rowIndex":199,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　警護の方には<tips=39>ジェフリー</tips>が当たり、<tips=5>太刀川</tips>は<tips=4>馬明</tips>と組んで<tips=59>暗闇通り</tips>での調査を行った。<tips=5>太刀川</tips>がその目を使って聞き取りを行い、<tips=4>馬明</tips>がそのボディーガードをするという役割分担である。","en":"<tips=39>Jeffrey</tips> took charge of the guard detail, while <tips=5>Tachikawa</tips> joined <tips=4>Ma Ming</tips> in investigating <tips=59>Darkness Street</tips>. Their roles were divided accordingly: <tips=5>Tachikawa</tips> would employ his eyes while questioning people, and <tips=4>Ma Ming</tips> would serve as his bodyguard.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r200","rowIndex":200,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そう言えば、<tips=39>ジェフリー</tips>は今回子供たちを連れて来るとかなんとか言っていましたが、あれはどういうことなんですか？」","en":"“Come to think of it, <tips=39>Jeffrey</tips> said something about bringing his children this time. What did he mean?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"太刀川良馬ペスト仮面","displayName":"Ryoma Tachikawa (Plague Mask)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r201","rowIndex":201,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　昼食のラーメンをマスクの下で啜っていた<tips=5>太刀川</tips>は、ふと<tips=4>馬明</tips>に尋ねた。","en":"As he slurped his lunchtime ramen beneath his mask, <tips=5>Tachikawa</tips> happened to ask <tips=4>Ma Ming</tips> a question.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r202","rowIndex":202,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ああ、あいつの二人の子供はサイキックなんですよ。近くにいる人間の場所や数がレーダーみたいにわかるんです。それを、初めて実地で試してみようってわけなんでさ」","en":"“Oh, his two children are psychics. They can sense where people nearby are and how many there are, something like radar. He means to try out the ability in the field for the first time.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬明（過去）","displayName":"Ma Ming (Past)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r203","rowIndex":203,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=4>馬明</tips>はチャーハンをかき込む手をとめてそうこたえる。その頬には飯粒がついている。","en":"<tips=4>Ma Ming</tips> stopped shoveling fried rice into his mouth to answer. A grain of rice clung to his cheek.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r204","rowIndex":204,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　二人は中華料理店のカウンターに並んで腰掛けていた。","en":"The two men sat side by side at the counter of a Chinese restaurant.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r205","rowIndex":205,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いくつの子供なんです？」","en":"“How old are they?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"太刀川良馬ペスト仮面","displayName":"Ryoma Tachikawa (Plague Mask)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r206","rowIndex":206,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「上は５つで、下は４つかな」","en":"“The older one is five and the younger one four, I think.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬明（過去）","displayName":"Ma Ming (Past)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r207","rowIndex":207,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうですか……」","en":"“I see...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"太刀川良馬ペスト仮面","displayName":"Ryoma Tachikawa (Plague Mask)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r208","rowIndex":208,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=5>太刀川</tips>はそう言って、食事を再開する。","en":"<tips=5>Tachikawa</tips> resumed eating.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r209","rowIndex":209,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　すると、今度は<tips=4>馬明</tips>の方から訊ねた。","en":"This time, <tips=4>Ma Ming</tips> put a question to him.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r210","rowIndex":210,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ドクター、子供はいますか？」","en":"“Do you have any children, Doctor?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬明（過去）","displayName":"Ma Ming (Past)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r211","rowIndex":211,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……いえ。あなたは？」","en":"“...No. Do you?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"太刀川良馬ペスト仮面","displayName":"Ryoma Tachikawa (Plague Mask)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r212","rowIndex":212,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いますよ。<tips=39>ジェフリー</tips>のところより少し大きい男の子と女の子が一人ずつ。男の子には、ずっと拳法を教えているんだけれど、これがなかなか筋がいい。おれより才能があるかもしれませんな。親馬鹿かもしれないが」","en":"“I do. A boy and a girl, both a little older than <tips=39>Jeffrey's</tips>. I've been teaching the boy martial arts all along, and he has a real gift for it. He may have more talent than I do—though perhaps that's just a doting father talking.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬明（過去）","displayName":"Ma Ming (Past)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r213","rowIndex":213,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=4>馬明</tips>はそう言って笑う。","en":"<tips=4>Ma Ming</tips> laughed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r214","rowIndex":214,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「兄貴のところにも子供がいるんですよ。兄貴に良く似た生意気な子だ。知ってますか？」","en":"“The boss has a child too. A cheeky little thing, just like him. Did you know?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬明（過去）","displayName":"Ma Ming (Past)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r215","rowIndex":215,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いえ」","en":"“No.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"太刀川良馬ペスト仮面","displayName":"Ryoma Tachikawa (Plague Mask)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r216","rowIndex":216,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうですか。おれはね、ウチの子と、<tips=39>ジェフリー</tips>のところの兄弟、そして兄貴の子で、将来の<tips=69>義勝</tips>を盛り立てていってくれたらなと思ってるんですよ。そのためにも我々は頑張って、この街を取り戻し、組織をでかくしなきゃいかんわけです。ドクターみたいなすごい力の持ち主が仲間になってくれて、嬉しいですよ」","en":"“Is that so? I hope my children, <tips=39>Jeffrey’s</tips> boys, and the boss’s child will grow up to build up <tips=69>Yisheng</tips> together. For that to happen, we have to work hard, take back this city, and make the organization strong. I’m glad a man with a remarkable power like yours has joined us, Doctor.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬明（過去）","displayName":"Ma Ming (Past)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r217","rowIndex":217,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いや私は別に……」","en":"“Oh, I wouldn't say that...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"太刀川良馬ペスト仮面","displayName":"Ryoma Tachikawa (Plague Mask)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r218","rowIndex":218,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=5>太刀川</tips>は謙遜してから、丼を両手に持ってスープをすする。それも、マスクのどこも汚さずに行えるのだから随分と慣れたものだ。","en":"After demurring, <tips=5>Tachikawa</tips> lifted the bowl in both hands and drank the broth. He could do even that without getting a drop on his mask; evidently, he had had plenty of practice.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r219","rowIndex":219,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「将来は、兄貴とかドクターみたいなサイキックがリーダーになる世の中になるんですかねえ？　それでおれたちみたいなノーマルは、その指示に従って動くというような……」","en":"“Do you suppose the future will belong to leaders with psychic powers, like the boss and you, Doctor? People like us Normals would take orders and act under your direction...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬明（過去）","displayName":"Ma Ming (Past)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r220","rowIndex":220,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その言葉で<tips=5>太刀川</tips>は手を止めて隣の<tips=4>馬明</tips>の方を見るが、彼には特別な思惑もないらしく、こちらに横顔を見せてチャーハンを食べている。","en":"At those words, <tips=5>Tachikawa's</tips> hands stopped, and he turned to look at <tips=4>Ma Ming</tips> beside him. But the man seemed to have no ulterior motive; showing Tachikawa only his profile, he simply went on eating his fried rice.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r221","rowIndex":221,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それを見て<tips=5>太刀川</tips>は視線を正面に戻し、コップの水に手を伸ばした。","en":"Seeing this, <tips=5>Tachikawa</tips> faced forward again and reached for his glass of water.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r222","rowIndex":222,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　こうした状態が二週間ほど続いたが、壬生屋のまわりに暗殺者がやって来ることはなかった。","en":"This state of affairs continued for approximately two weeks, but no assassin appeared near Mibuya.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r223","rowIndex":223,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=5>太刀川</tips>たちもその計画のために動いているらしい人物を特定することは出来たが、<tips=34>ダリオ</tips>の部下と直接接触することは禁じられていたために完全な実態を明らかにするまでには至らなかった。","en":"<tips=5>Tachikawa’s</tips> group did identify people who appeared to be involved in the plan. They had been forbidden to make direct contact with <tips=34>Dario’s</tips> subordinates, however, and consequently failed to uncover the full picture.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r224","rowIndex":224,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=69>義勝</tips>のメンバーが動き回っていることを知って、<tips=34>ダリオ</tips>は計画を断念したのだろうと<tips=3>クリス</tips>は判断した。","en":"<tips=3>Chris</tips> concluded that <tips=34>Dario</tips> had learned <tips=69>Yisheng’s</tips> members were active and had abandoned the plan.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r225","rowIndex":225,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=34>ダリオ</tips>は暗殺には自信があっても、表立っての抗争は好まない。もしやっても、抗争のスペシャリストである義勝相手では分が悪い。得意の暗殺も千里眼を持つ<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>には効果が薄いだろう。","en":"<tips=34>Dario</tips> might have confidence in assassination, but he disliked open warfare. Even if he attempted it, his odds against Yisheng, a specialist in gang warfare, would be poor. His favored method of assassination would likewise be less effective against <tips=3>Chris Tse</tips> and his clairvoyant eye.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r226","rowIndex":226,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=34>ダリオ</tips>は<tips=69>義勝</tips>とは戦いたくはない。そのことは最初から<tips=3>クリス</tips>は把握しているが、後の関係を考えて露骨に突きつけようとはしなかった。","en":"<tips=34>Dario</tips> did not want to fight <tips=69>Yisheng</tips>. <tips=3>Chris</tips> had understood that from the beginning, but with their future relationship in mind, he had avoided confronting Dario with it too bluntly.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r227","rowIndex":227,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しかし、もうそうは言っていられない。もう一度<tips=3>クリス</tips>は<tips=34>ダリオ</tips>と会談の場を持った。今度は前と態度を変えて、冷淡な最終通告を突きつけるつもりだった。","en":"But he could no longer afford such restraint. <tips=3>Chris</tips> arranged another meeting with <tips=34>Dario</tips>. This time he intended to change tactics and deliver a cold ultimatum.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r228","rowIndex":228,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　まず暗殺計画を知っていると強気で伝えた。もはや壬生屋は仲間の一人である。こういった態度を続けるのならば、こちらもそれなりの対応をしなくてはならなくなる。この連合は<tips=18>ローズ・クラブ</tips>を追放するために出来上がった組織だが、露払いとして<tips=34>ダリオ</tips>と戦うことになるだろう。","en":"He began by telling Dario flatly that he knew about the assassination plot. Mibuya was one of them now, and if Dario persisted in such conduct, Chris's side would have no choice but to respond in kind. The alliance had been formed to drive out the <tips=18>Rose Club</tips>, he warned, but it might have to clear <tips=34>Dario</tips> out of the way first.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r229","rowIndex":229,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「こうしている間にも毎日この街の人間があの薄汚いクラブに買われている。おれたちはのんびりしているわけにはいかないんだ。くだらない陰謀劇を続けるのならば、おまえたちも<tips=68>木下組</tips>や<tips=18>ローズ・クラブ</tips>に与しているのと同じだ。考え直すならば、今が最後のチャンスだ」","en":"“Every day we spend here talking, more people from this city are bought by that filthy club. We don’t have the luxury of taking our time. If you persist with this petty intrigue, you are no different from an ally of the <tips=68>Kinoshita-gumi</tips> and the <tips=18>Rose Club</tips>. If you intend to reconsider, this is your last chance.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー（過去・青年）","displayName":"Chris Tse (Past, Young)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r230","rowIndex":230,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　今にも噛みつきそうな顔つきで<tips=3>クリス</tips>はそう言い放った。","en":"<tips=3>Chris</tips> spat out the ultimatum looking ready to bite his head off.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r231","rowIndex":231,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　決裂してもかまわないつもりだったが、恫喝紛いのこの台詞で、<tips=34>ダリオ</tips>は考えを改めたらしい。連合に参加するむねを口にし、その場で壬生屋との協定書にサインをした。","en":"He was prepared to let the talks collapse, but this speech—little short of intimidation—seemed to change <tips=34>Dario’s</tips> mind. He declared that he would join the alliance and signed the agreement with Mibuya on the spot.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r232","rowIndex":232,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　こうして、<tips=18>ローズ・クラブ</tips>打倒のための駒はすべて揃えられたのである。","en":"Every piece needed to overthrow the <tips=18>Rose Club</tips> had now been assembled.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r233","rowIndex":233,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　一同が勢揃いしたのは、それから三日後のことだった。","en":"The entire group gathered three days later.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r234","rowIndex":234,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　場所は、<tips=58>パラシュート通り</tips>の近くにある大きな一軒家だ。<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>の所有する建物で、本来の彼のすみかである。","en":"The meeting place was a large detached house near <tips=58>Parachute Street</tips>. The building belonged to <tips=3>Chris Tse</tips> and was properly his residence.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r235","rowIndex":235,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=3>クリス</tips>は普段は事務所やホテルに寝泊まりしているので、<tips=5>太刀川</tips>などはそういった家が存在するのをその時初めて知った。","en":"<tips=3>Chris</tips> ordinarily slept at the office or in hotels, so <tips=5>Tachikawa</tips> and the others had not known until then that such a home even existed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r236","rowIndex":236,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　デザイン住宅のような洒落た建物で、妻と娘が住んでいるらしい。会合の準備のために<tips=69>義勝</tips>の若い連中が先乗りして建物のなかを手持ち無沙汰に歩き回るのを、<tips=5>太刀川</tips>がぼんやり眺めていると、<tips=4>馬明</tips>が紹介してくれた。","en":"It was a stylish, architect-designed sort of house, apparently occupied by Chris's wife and daughter. Young members of <tips=69>Yisheng</tips> had arrived ahead of the meeting to prepare and were milling idly around inside. As <tips=5>Tachikawa</tips> watched them in a daze, <tips=4>Ma Ming</tips> introduced him to a woman.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r237","rowIndex":237,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>の妻の<tips=56>菅原和美</tips>です」","en":"“I’m <tips=56>Kazumi Sugawara</tips>, <tips=3>Chris Tse’s</tips> wife.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r238","rowIndex":238,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　と名乗ったのは、<tips=3>クリス</tips>と同じくらいの年頃の日本人だった。","en":"The Japanese woman who introduced herself appeared to be approximately <tips=3>Chris’s</tips> age.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r239","rowIndex":239,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　特別美人というわけでもなく、どこにでもいそうな普通の女性である。夫と違う名字なのは<tips=5>太刀川</tips>にとっては違和感があるが中国式の夫婦別姓なのだろう。","en":"She was no great beauty, just an ordinary woman one might encounter anywhere. The fact that her surname differed from her husband's struck <tips=5>Tachikawa</tips> as peculiar, though he supposed it reflected the Chinese custom of married couples retaining separate surnames.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r240","rowIndex":240,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しかしそれ以上に気になったのは、彼女は金色の目こそしていないものの、身体に<tips=17>タイプB</tips>特有の症状があらわれていることだった。<tips=17>タイプＢ</tips>なのかなとは思ったが、確信は持てない。人によって症状の出方が変化するものだし、<tips=5>太刀川</tips>の専門ではない。","en":"What drew his attention more strongly was that although her eyes were not golden, her body exhibited symptoms peculiar to <tips=17>Type B</tips>. He wondered whether she might be <tips=17>Type B</tips>, but he could not be certain. The symptoms varied from person to person, and the condition lay outside <tips=5>Tachikawa’s</tips> specialty.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r241","rowIndex":241,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　事実、<tips=32>アサヒ</tips>こと<tips=87>ベルーハ</tips>が<tips=17>タイプＢ</tips>であることも、本人に告白されるまで見抜くことが出来なかった。","en":"Indeed, he had been unable to recognize that <tips=32>Asahi</tips>, also known as <tips=87>Belukha</tips>, was <tips=17>Type B</tips> until she told him herself.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r242","rowIndex":242,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「『ドクター』ですね。あなたのお話は主人からうかがっています。まるでもう、この街を救うために天から降ってきたような方だと」","en":"“You must be the Doctor. My husband has told me about you. He makes you sound like someone sent down from heaven to save this city.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r243","rowIndex":243,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　笑顔の眩しい、はきはきと喋る女だった。","en":"She spoke briskly and directly, with a dazzling smile.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r244","rowIndex":244,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=3>クリス</tips>はそんなことを言っているのか」","en":"“So <tips=3>Chris</tips> says things like that?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r245","rowIndex":245,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=5>太刀川</tips>は歯の浮くような褒め言葉を裏で使われていると知り、困ったようにそう言った。すると<tips=56>和美</tips>は微笑み、","en":"Uncomfortable to learn that such embarrassingly fulsome praise was being lavished on him behind his back, <tips=5>Tachikawa</tips> managed the reply. <tips=56>Kazumi</tips> smiled and said,","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r246","rowIndex":246,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「お医者様なのに、こんな世界にやって来るだなんて変わってらっしゃいますね。何か、大変なご苦労をなされたんじゃないですか？　外から好き好んでこの街にやって来る人は、みな何か捜し物を求めているものです。ここには、何か他では見つけられない答えが見つけられるような、そんな空気があるのでしょうね……あ、<tips=44>筱喬</tips>！　すみません！」","en":"“It seems very unusual for a doctor to enter a world like this. Have you suffered some terrible hardship? Everyone who willingly comes to this city from outside is searching for something. Perhaps there is something in the air here that makes people feel they may find an answer unavailable anywhere else... Oh, <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips>! I’m sorry!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r247","rowIndex":247,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=5>太刀川</tips>に頭を下げると、向こうで泣き出した幼子の元へ駆けていった。","en":"She bowed to <tips=5>Tachikawa</tips>, then ran to the small child who had begun crying across the room.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r248","rowIndex":248,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なんだか、ギャングのボスの妻という立場からは想像出来ないような方ですね」","en":"“She isn’t at all the sort of person you would picture as a gang boss’s wife.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"太刀川良馬ペスト仮面","displayName":"Ryoma Tachikawa (Plague Mask)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r249","rowIndex":249,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　傍らの<tips=4>馬明</tips>に、<tips=5>太刀川</tips>はそう漏らした。","en":"<tips=5>Tachikawa</tips> murmured the observation to <tips=4>Ma Ming</tips> beside him.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r250","rowIndex":250,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「やっぱりわかりますか。あの人は、全然ちがう世界から来たんですよ。ドクターとちょっと似ている」","en":"“You can tell, then? She came from a wholly different world. In that respect, she’s a little like you, Doctor.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬明（過去）","displayName":"Ma Ming (Past)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r251","rowIndex":251,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「私と？」","en":"“Like me?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"太刀川良馬ペスト仮面","displayName":"Ryoma Tachikawa (Plague Mask)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r252","rowIndex":252,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そう、インテリなんです。どこだか忘れちまったが、頭の良い大学の学生で、学者先生と一緒に<tips=8>グレートホール</tips>の調査をしたりもしていたんですよ。そこで兄貴が一目惚れしてね、猛烈にアピールして、結婚となったんです」","en":"“That’s right—she’s an intellectual. I forget which one, but she studied at a prestigious university and even conducted research at the <tips=8>Great Hole</tips> with professors. The boss fell in love with her at first sight, courted her with everything he had, and ended up marrying her.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬明（過去）","displayName":"Ma Ming (Past)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r253","rowIndex":253,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なるほど」","en":"“I see.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"太刀川良馬ペスト仮面","displayName":"Ryoma Tachikawa (Plague Mask)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r254","rowIndex":254,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　娘を抱きかかえてあやすその若い妻の姿を眺めながら<tips=5>太刀川</tips>は頷いた。","en":"<tips=5>Tachikawa</tips> nodded as he watched the young wife cradle her daughter and soothe her.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r255","rowIndex":255,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そう言えば、<tips=3>クリス</tips>には息子さんもいるそうですが、その姿が見えませんね。さっき泣いていたのは娘さんでしょう？」","en":"“Come to think of it, I heard that <tips=3>Chris</tips> has a son too, but I don’t see him here. The child crying earlier was his daughter, wasn’t she?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"太刀川良馬ペスト仮面","displayName":"Ryoma Tachikawa (Plague Mask)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r256","rowIndex":256,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ああ……」","en":"“Ah...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬明（過去）","displayName":"Ma Ming (Past)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r257","rowIndex":257,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=4>馬明</tips>は顔を顰めると、","en":"<tips=4>Ma Ming</tips> grimaced.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r258","rowIndex":258,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「上の子は別のところに住んでいるんですよ」","en":"“His older child lives elsewhere.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬明（過去）","displayName":"Ma Ming (Past)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r259","rowIndex":259,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それはどうして？」","en":"“Why is that?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"太刀川良馬ペスト仮面","displayName":"Ryoma Tachikawa (Plague Mask)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r260","rowIndex":260,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「これはあまり大きな声では言えないんですがね……」","en":"“This isn’t something I ought to say too loudly...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬明（過去）","displayName":"Ma Ming (Past)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r261","rowIndex":261,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=4>馬明</tips>は苦虫を噛みつぶしたような顔をしながら声をひそめ、","en":"His expression sour, <tips=4>Ma Ming</tips> lowered his voice.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r262","rowIndex":262,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「奥さんは金目病なんですよ。年寄りたちが、<tips=78>金目</tips>はうつるってまだ信じていましてね」","en":"“His wife has Gold-Eye Disease. The old people still believe <tips=78>Gold-Eye</tips> is contagious.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬明（過去）","displayName":"Ma Ming (Past)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r263","rowIndex":263,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それは昔の迷信ですよ。今では完全に否定されています」","en":"“That is an old superstition. It has now been completely disproved.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"太刀川良馬ペスト仮面","displayName":"Ryoma Tachikawa (Plague Mask)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r264","rowIndex":264,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　やはり<tips=17>タイプＢ</tips>だったかと思いつつ、<tips=5>太刀川</tips>はそう言った。","en":"Thinking that she was <tips=17>Type B</tips> after all, <tips=5>Tachikawa</tips> said this.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r265","rowIndex":265,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうなんですがね。頭が古い。結婚もひどく反対されて、今でも嫌ってる人間もいる。……まあそういうわけで、上の子は奥さんの親戚の家に預かって貰ってるんですな」","en":"“Yes, but they’re old-fashioned. They fiercely opposed the marriage, and some of them still hate her. ...So his older child is staying with relatives on his wife’s side.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬明（過去）","displayName":"Ma Ming (Past)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r266","rowIndex":266,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうですか」","en":"“I see.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"太刀川良馬ペスト仮面","displayName":"Ryoma Tachikawa (Plague Mask)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r267","rowIndex":267,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　言いながら<tips=5>太刀川</tips>は、<tips=3>クリス</tips>と連絡をつけるために指定された『菅原食堂』の名前と、そこで出会った少年の姿を思い出していた。その時は<tips=69>義勝</tips>と親しい店なのかと思ったが、仕事を始めてからはまったくそんな様子もなく、なぜあそこだったのかずっと気になっていたのだ。","en":"As he spoke, <tips=5>Tachikawa</tips> remembered the name ‘Sugawara Diner,’ where he had been instructed to make contact with <tips=3>Chris</tips>, and the boy he had encountered there. At the time, he had assumed the restaurant was closely connected to <tips=69>Yisheng</tips>. Since beginning his work, however, he had seen no trace of such a relationship and had continually wondered why Chris had chosen that particular place.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r268","rowIndex":268,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=56>菅原和美</tips>と同じ名を持つ菅原食堂。あれが親戚だとすれば、あの少年こそが<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>の息子というわけか。","en":"The Sugawara Diner bore <tips=56>Kazumi Sugawara's</tips> surname. If its owners were the relatives in question, then that boy had to be <tips=3>Chris Tse's</tips> son.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r269","rowIndex":269,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　会合は十九時から始まることになっていた。","en":"The meeting was scheduled to begin at seven that evening.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r270","rowIndex":270,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　時間が近づくとメンバーが続々と集まってくる。極秘の会合だということで、門から先は最低限の人数で入るよう通達されており、多くの部下は外の車に待機させ、みな、二人か三人だけを引き連れて建物に入って来る。","en":"As the hour approached, the members arrived in rapid succession. Because the meeting was strictly secret, they had been instructed to bring only the minimum number of people past the gate. Most subordinates remained waiting in cars outside, while each leader entered the building with only two or three attendants.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r271","rowIndex":271,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=5>太刀川</tips>は玄関の側に椅子を置き、入って来る者たちの目を見て彼らに悪心がないことをチェックしていた。","en":"<tips=5>Tachikawa</tips> placed a chair near the entrance and looked into the eyes of every person who entered, checking for malicious intent.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r272","rowIndex":272,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その頃になると彼も<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>の重要なパートナーとして、その異様なマスクと共に知られており、向こうから声をかけられることも多かった。","en":"By then, he had become known as an important partner of <tips=3>Chris Tse</tips>, his peculiar mask and all, and the visitors often addressed him first.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r273","rowIndex":273,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「よっ、マスクマン。今日も陰気だな」","en":"“Hey, Masked Man. Gloomy as ever.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"廖志明（過去）","displayName":"Liao Chi-ming (Past)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r274","rowIndex":274,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　まず<tips=27>廖志明</tips>がやって来ると、手を上げて気軽に挨拶をする。","en":"<tips=27>Liao Chi-ming</tips> arrived first and raised a hand in casual greeting.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r275","rowIndex":275,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それに続くのは、<tips=35>ジョゼ・フェルナンデス</tips>、そしてその後から壬生屋太一。<tips=34>ダリオ・ボネット</tips>もほぼ同じ時間に到着していたが、壬生屋と共に歩くのを嫌がってドアの外で少し待ってから玄関へ足を踏み入れた。","en":"<tips=35>José Fernandes</tips> followed, then Taichi Mibuya. <tips=34>Dario Bonetto</tips> arrived at almost the same moment, but rather than walk inside beside Mibuya, he waited briefly beyond the door before stepping through the entrance.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r276","rowIndex":276,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして最後に入って来たのは、<tips=87>ベルーハ</tips>に付き添われた<tips=31>ミス・ホワイト</tips>である。いつも通り黒い喪服に身を包み、濃いヴェールで顔を覆っている。<tips=87>ベルーハ</tips>も、この間屋敷で会った時と同じ黒い服を身につけている。","en":"The last to arrive was <tips=31>Miss White</tips>, accompanied by <tips=87>Belukha</tips>. As always, White wore black mourning clothes and concealed her face behind a dark veil. <tips=87>Belukha</tips>, too, wore the same black outfit she had worn when they visited the mansion.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r277","rowIndex":277,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「この間は失礼を致しました」","en":"“I apologize for my discourtesy the other day.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アサヒ","displayName":"Asahi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r278","rowIndex":278,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=87>ベルーハ</tips>は恭しく頭を下げた。","en":"<tips=87>Belukha</tips> bowed respectfully.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r279","rowIndex":279,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「謝る必要はありません。きみは当然のことをしただけです。あんな態度でしたが、<tips=3>クリス</tips>も理解しています」","en":"“You have nothing to apologize for. You did precisely what you should have done. Despite the way he behaved, <tips=3>Chris</tips> understands that as well.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"太刀川良馬ペスト仮面","displayName":"Ryoma Tachikawa (Plague Mask)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r280","rowIndex":280,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そう言って下さると気持ちが楽になります」","en":"“I’m relieved to hear you say that.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アサヒ","displayName":"Asahi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r281","rowIndex":281,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そのまま二人は通り過ぎようとして、<tips=31>ミス・ホワイト</tips>が振り返った。","en":"The two women began to pass him, but <tips=31>Miss White</tips> looked back.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r282","rowIndex":282,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ドクター、あんたも新しい組織で何か役職につくのかね？」","en":"“Doctor, will you be taking some position in the new organization too?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エリー・ホワイト（先代）","displayName":"Ellie White (Previous Generation)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r283","rowIndex":283,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いや、そうはなりませんよ。私はあくまでも<tips=3>クリス</tips>個人の協力者であって、<tips=69>義勝</tips>のメンバーではありませんからね」","en":"“No, I will not. I am <tips=3>Chris’s</tips> personal associate, not a member of <tips=69>Yisheng</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"太刀川良馬ペスト仮面","displayName":"Ryoma Tachikawa (Plague Mask)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r284","rowIndex":284,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それがいい。あんたは用事があってこんなところにいるだけだろう？　それが済んだらさっさと足を洗うんだ。この世界には向いていない」","en":"“Good. You’re only in a place like this because you have some business to take care of, aren’t you? Finish it, then wash your hands of this world as quickly as you can. You aren’t suited to it.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エリー・ホワイト（先代）","displayName":"Ellie White (Previous Generation)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r285","rowIndex":285,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どういう意味ですか？　私は最近、水があうような気がしていたんですがね」","en":"“What do you mean? Lately I had begun to feel that I fit in rather well.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"太刀川良馬ペスト仮面","displayName":"Ryoma Tachikawa (Plague Mask)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r286","rowIndex":286,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それは勘違いだね。私は人を見る目には自信がある。少し話せばわかるよ。あんたはこの世界で生きてゆくには不必要なものを心に多く持ちすぎている。私や、<tips=3>クリス</tips>や、この子とは違う。潰れちまうよ」","en":"“Then you misunderstand yourself. I trust my judgment of people. A short conversation tells me enough. You carry far too much in your heart that has no place in a life like this. You are different from me, from <tips=3>Chris</tips>, and from this child. This world will crush you.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エリー・ホワイト（先代）","displayName":"Ellie White (Previous Generation)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r287","rowIndex":287,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……覚えておきます」","en":"“...I will remember that.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"太刀川良馬ペスト仮面","displayName":"Ryoma Tachikawa (Plague Mask)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r288","rowIndex":288,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　会合はリビングルームに設置されたテーブルに全員が着席すると開始された。","en":"The meeting began once everyone had taken a seat at the table set up in the living room.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r289","rowIndex":289,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　日は落ち、全面ガラス張りの窓の向こうは真っ暗になっている。<tips=5>太刀川</tips>は同席はせず、部屋の隅に<tips=4>馬明</tips>や<tips=39>ジェフリー</tips>と共に並んで立って見守った。","en":"The sun had set, leaving absolute darkness beyond the floor-to-ceiling windows. <tips=5>Tachikawa</tips> did not sit with the participants, but stood watching beside <tips=4>Ma Ming</tips> and <tips=39>Jeffrey</tips> in one corner of the room.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r290","rowIndex":290,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　まず<tips=3>クリス</tips>が立ち上がって、挨拶をする。","en":"<tips=3>Chris</tips> rose first and offered a greeting.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r291","rowIndex":291,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「みなさん、お集まりいただいてありがとう。今日は二つの意味で記念すべき日だ。一つは、肌の色も民族も国籍もこえた組織が、今日はじめてこの街に誕生したということ。もう一つは、長年干渉を繰り返し我々を混乱させてきた<tips=68>木下組</tips>、ならびに<tips=18>ローズ・クラブ</tips>がこの街から消え去ることが今日確実なものとなったということだ。この日は街の歴史に永遠に刻み込まれるだろう」","en":"“Thank you all for coming. Today is a historic day for two reasons. First, it marks the birth of this city's first organization to transcend color, ethnicity, and nationality. Second, as of today, the disappearance from our city of the <tips=68>Kinoshita-gumi</tips> and the <tips=18>Rose Club</tips>—the forces that have meddled in our affairs and kept us in turmoil for so many years—is assured. This day will be engraved forever in the history of our city.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー（過去・青年）","displayName":"Chris Tse (Past, Young)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r292","rowIndex":292,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その言葉を、それぞれ自分の組織を持ち街では恐れられている面々が、静かに聞いている。","en":"The figures listening in silence each commanded an organization of their own and were feared throughout the city.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r293","rowIndex":293,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=3>クリス</tips>は続けて、これからの活動について語った。それぞれは基本的には今までと同じ活動を行うが、必要とあればお互い協力し、けして争ったりはしない。最終目標は各組織にとって共通の敵である<tips=18>ローズ・クラブ</tips>及び<tips=68>木下組</tips>の影響を街から排除することであり、その過程においては彼らの勢力下にある組織との抗争も避けられないだろうが、これにも一致団結して対応する。","en":"<tips=3>Chris</tips> continued by describing how they would operate from that day forward. Each organization would essentially carry on as before, but they would cooperate whenever necessary and never fight among themselves. Their ultimate objective was to eliminate from the city the influence of the <tips=18>Rose Club</tips> and the <tips=68>Kinoshita-gumi</tips>, enemies common to them all. The process would doubtless bring them into conflict with organizations under their enemies' control, but they would meet those conflicts together, as one.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r294","rowIndex":294,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　組織の役割分担についてはこれから話し合って決定することになるが、基本的には<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>が<tips=81>龍頭</tips>――つまりリーダーとしてまとめ役となり、<tips=69>義勝</tips>が執行部として組織全体を統括する。","en":"They would discuss and determine the exact division of duties later. As a fundamental arrangement, however, <tips=3>Chris Tse</tips> would serve as <tips=81>Longtou</tips>—the leader who coordinated them—while <tips=69>Yisheng</tips> would act as the executive body overseeing the organization as a whole.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r295","rowIndex":295,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=81>龍頭</tips>という名称ではあるが、あくまでも役割分担の一つだ。誰かがまとめなければ、組織なんてものは全く機能しないからな。盟主であるおれが務めるのが穏当だろう。……誰か、異論があるものはいるか？」","en":"“Though the title is <tips=81>Longtou</tips>, it is only one part of our division of responsibilities. No organization can function at all unless someone coordinates it. As the head of the alliance, I am the natural choice for the role. ...Does anyone object?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー（過去・青年）","displayName":"Chris Tse (Past, Young)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r296","rowIndex":296,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=3>クリス</tips>がそれぞれの顔を見渡すが、誰も何も言わない。","en":"<tips=3>Chris</tips> surveyed every face, but no one spoke.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r297","rowIndex":297,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　これらの話は交渉の時点でみな了承済であり、彼がいま言ったことは再確認に過ぎないのだ。","en":"Each participant had already agreed to these matters during the negotiations. Chris’s words amounted to no more than a final confirmation.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r298","rowIndex":298,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それじゃあ堅苦しい話はここまでだ。酒と食い物を用意してある。これからの戦いのために過去のわだかまりを捨てて、友好を深め……」","en":"“That concludes the formal business. We have food and drink prepared. For the sake of the battle ahead, let us cast aside old grudges and deepen our friendship...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー（過去・青年）","displayName":"Chris Tse (Past, Young)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r299","rowIndex":299,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「その前に、決めなくちゃいけないことがあるだろう？」","en":"“Before that, don’t you have something left to decide?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"廖志明（過去）","displayName":"Liao Chi-ming (Past)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r300","rowIndex":300,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　声をあげたのは、<tips=27>廖志明</tips>だった。","en":"The voice belonged to <tips=27>Liao Chi-ming</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r301","rowIndex":301,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なんだい<tips=27>廖</tips>さん」","en":"“What is it, Mr. <tips=27>Liao</tips>?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー（過去・青年）","displayName":"Chris Tse (Past, Young)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r302","rowIndex":302,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「この、新しい組織の名前だよ」","en":"“The name of this new organization.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"廖志明（過去）","displayName":"Liao Chi-ming (Past)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r303","rowIndex":303,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そんなもの、連盟でも連合でも何でもいいさ」","en":"“Call it a league, an alliance—whatever you like.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー（過去・青年）","displayName":"Chris Tse (Past, Young)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r304","rowIndex":304,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=3>クリス</tips>は興味なさそうにそっけなく言った。","en":"<tips=3>Chris</tips> answered curtly, showing no interest.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r305","rowIndex":305,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうはいかない。これから百年続く勢力なのだからね、何かきっちりとしたものがあったほうがいい。そこで私は一つ考えて来たんだ。言ってもいいか？」","en":"“That won't do. This is going to be a power that lasts a hundred years, so it ought to have a proper name. As it happens, I've thought of one. May I?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"廖志明（過去）","displayName":"Liao Chi-ming (Past)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r306","rowIndex":306,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どうぞ」","en":"“By all means.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー（過去・青年）","displayName":"Chris Tse (Past, Young)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r307","rowIndex":307,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=27>廖</tips>はニヤリと笑うと、立ち上がりもったいぶってしばし沈黙を作ってから口を開いた。","en":"<tips=27>Liao</tips> grinned, rose to his feet, and paused theatrically before speaking.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r308","rowIndex":308,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「『<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>』、というのはどうだ？」","en":"“What do you say to <tips=7>‘YS’</tips>?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"廖志明（過去）","displayName":"Liao Chi-ming (Past)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r309","rowIndex":309,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ワイエス？」","en":"“Why-Ess?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r310","rowIndex":310,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=34>ダリオ</tips>が反芻する。","en":"<tips=34>Dario</tips> repeated the name.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r311","rowIndex":311,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうだ」","en":"“Precisely.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"廖志明（過去）","displayName":"Liao Chi-ming (Past)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r312","rowIndex":312,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=27>廖</tips>は頷き、","en":"<tips=27>Liao</tips> nodded.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r313","rowIndex":313,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「何と言おうと、やはりこれはクリスの組織だ。<tips=3>クリス</tips>が顔役をやるからこそ、我々は地域の支持を得ることが出来る。しかし、『<tips=69>義勝</tips>』の名をそのまま使ってはなんの新鮮味もないし、みなのプライドにも差し障るだろう。だから<ruby=ピンイン>ピン音</ruby>のアルファベットをとって『<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>』。そのままワイエスと読んでも良いし、イーシェンとこれまで通り読んでも良い。文字自体は意味を持たない方が、背景の違う我々が共有する名前としては都合がいいはずだ」","en":"“However we look at it, this remains Chris’s organization. Only with <tips=3>Chris</tips> as its public face can we win the support of the district. But simply retaining the name ‘<tips=69>Yisheng</tips>’ would offer nothing new and would wound the pride of everyone present. So we take the letters from its pinyin spelling and call it ‘<tips=7>YS</tips>.’ It may be read just as it is, ‘Why-Ess,’ or pronounced ‘Yisheng’ as before. A written name with no meaning of its own should be convenient for people of different backgrounds to share.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"廖志明（過去）","displayName":"Liao Chi-ming (Past)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r314","rowIndex":314,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「『<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>』ねえ……」","en":"“‘<tips=7>YS</tips>,’ hmm...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エリー・ホワイト（先代）","displayName":"Ellie White (Previous Generation)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r315","rowIndex":315,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=31>ミス・ホワイト</tips>は溜息をつき、","en":"<tips=31>Miss White</tips> sighed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r316","rowIndex":316,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「私は何だっていいわ。良い名前だとも思わないけれど」","en":"“I don’t care what it’s called. Not that I think it’s a good name.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エリー・ホワイト（先代）","displayName":"Ellie White (Previous Generation)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r317","rowIndex":317,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「賛同ありがとう。異論があるものはないか？」","en":"“Thank you for your support. Does anyone object?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"廖志明（過去）","displayName":"Liao Chi-ming (Past)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r318","rowIndex":318,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=27>廖</tips>がそう言って一同の顔を見回すと、","en":"<tips=27>Liao</tips> surveyed the assembled faces.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r319","rowIndex":319,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いいんじゃないですか？　私は悪くないと思います」","en":"“Why not? I don't think it's bad.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r320","rowIndex":320,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=34>ダリオ</tips>が上目遣いで<tips=27>廖</tips>を見つめながらそう言った。","en":"<tips=34>Dario</tips> spoke while looking up at <tips=27>Liao</tips> from beneath his brows.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r321","rowIndex":321,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ふむ、みな賛成のようだ。……で、<tips=81>龍頭</tips>、あなたの意見はどうだい？」","en":"“Hmm. Everyone appears to be in favor. ...So, <tips=81>Longtou</tips>, what is your opinion?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"廖志明（過去）","displayName":"Liao Chi-ming (Past)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r322","rowIndex":322,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=27>廖</tips>はそう言って<tips=3>クリス</tips>の方を見つめる。","en":"<tips=27>Liao</tips> turned his gaze upon <tips=3>Chris</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r323","rowIndex":323,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=3>クリス</tips>は肩をすくめてから、","en":"<tips=3>Chris</tips> shrugged.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r324","rowIndex":324,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それで結構だ。ありがとう<tips=27>廖</tips>さん。……じゃあ、今日から我々は『<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>』だ」","en":"“That will do nicely. Thank you, Mr. <tips=27>Liao</tips>. ...Well then, as of today, we are <tips=7>YS</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー（過去・青年）","displayName":"Chris Tse (Past, Young)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r325","rowIndex":325,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そう言って手元に置かれたワイングラスを手に取ると、","en":"He picked up the wineglass before him.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r326","rowIndex":326,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「この血のように赤い酒を、我々<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>の、さらなる発展と、永久に続く固い結束に捧げよう！」","en":"“I dedicate this wine, red as blood, to the continued growth of <tips=7>YS</tips> and to the firm bonds between us, unbroken for all eternity!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー（過去・青年）","displayName":"Chris Tse (Past, Young)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r327","rowIndex":327,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　一息にぐっと飲み干した。","en":"He drained it in a single gulp.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X6-2:r328","rowIndex":328,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　こうして、後にこの地域一帯を支配する空前の巨大犯罪組織となる『<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>』が誕生したのであった。","en":"Thus was born <tips=7>YS</tips>, which would later become a vast criminal organization on an unprecedented scale, ruling the entire region.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}}]},{"position":25,"code":"X7","unitId":"X7","rows":[{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r1","rowIndex":1,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その頃の<tips=9>Y地区</tips>にも僅かながらビジネスホテルや小綺麗なウィークリーマンションといった単身者に便利な宿泊施設は存在したが、<tips=5>太刀川</tips>はそれらは使っていない。","en":"In those days, even <tips=9>Y District</tips> had a handful of business hotels, tidy weekly rental apartments, and other accommodations convenient for single people, but <tips=5>Tachikawa</tips> used none of them.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r2","rowIndex":2,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　事務所から少し離れた安アパートの建ち並ぶ一角に部屋を借りて暮らしている。","en":"Instead, he lived in a room he rented amid a cluster of cheap apartment buildings a short distance from the office.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r3","rowIndex":3,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=3>クリス</tips>からそれなりの住居を無償で提供してくれるという提案もあったが断った。","en":"<tips=3>Chris</tips> had also offered to provide him with a respectable home free of charge, but he declined.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r4","rowIndex":4,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　充分な手当は貰っているし、無用の借りを作りたくなかったのである。それに、こうした小汚い建物に住んだ方が<tips=9>Y地区</tips>らしさに浸れるという思いもあった。","en":"He was already being paid well enough and did not want to incur any needless debts of gratitude. Besides, he felt that living in a grubby building like this let him soak in the character of <tips=9>Y District</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r5","rowIndex":5,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=5>太刀川</tips>の部屋は三階建ての三階にあり、窓の正面にはちょうど<tips=41>グランドタワー</tips>のそびえ立つ姿を眺めることが出来た。","en":"<tips=5>Tachikawa's</tips> room was on the top floor of a three-story building, and from its window he could gaze directly upon the soaring form of <tips=41>Grand Tower</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r6","rowIndex":6,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その、およそ土地に似つかわしくない巨大なビルは、かつてこの土地がこんな混沌とした状態になる前の都市計画の残骸である。複合商業施設として利用されることを想定していたようだが、結局本来の目的で使われることが一度もないまま廃墟と化してしまった。","en":"That enormous building, utterly incongruous with its surroundings, was a relic of an urban development plan drawn up before the district descended into its present chaos. It had apparently been intended as a mixed-use commercial complex, but fell into ruin without ever once serving its original purpose.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r7","rowIndex":7,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=3>クリス</tips>はよく、いつかはあのビルを買い取って自分たちの本拠地にしたいとうそぶいていたが誰も信じていない。","en":"<tips=3>Chris</tips> often boasted that someday he would buy the building and make it their headquarters, but no one believed him.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r8","rowIndex":8,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　地区最大のギャング連合である<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>が結成され、いよいよ<tips=18>ローズ・クラブ</tips>との決着の日が迫っている。この街から<tips=18>ローズ・クラブ</tips>――<tips=68>木下組</tips>の影響力が完全に払拭されれば、街は新しい時代を迎えるだろう。","en":"<tips=7>YS</tips>, the largest alliance of gangs in the district, had been established, and the day of its final reckoning with the <tips=18>Rose Club</tips> was rapidly approaching. If the influence of the <tips=18>Rose Club</tips>—and of the <tips=68>Kinoshita-gumi</tips>—could be completely purged from the city, a new age would begin.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r9","rowIndex":9,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その決戦を前に、今日<tips=3>クリス</tips>は<tips=69>義勝</tips>の古老たちのところを挨拶にまわっていた。","en":"Today, before the decisive battle, <tips=3>Chris</tips> had gone to pay his respects to <tips=69>Yisheng’s</tips> elders.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r10","rowIndex":10,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼は<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>の結成を、かつて<tips=69>義勝</tips>を統率し、今は組織に関わらずに暮らしているこの隠居老人たちに一言も話していなかった。","en":"He had not said a word about the formation of <tips=7>YS</tips> to these retired old men, who had once led <tips=69>Yisheng</tips> but now lived apart from the organization.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r11","rowIndex":11,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼らは他民族との間に長い確執の歴史を持っており、今も憎しみが消えてはおらず、なぜ手を組んだのかとカンカンに怒っているそうだ。","en":"They had a long history of feuds with other ethnic groups, and their hatred had still not faded. They were reportedly furious, demanding to know why he had joined forces with them.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r12","rowIndex":12,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=3>クリス</tips>は「どうせなんでも反対するだけだから」と、初めから相談するつもりもなかった。これは、何をしたってどうせ自分が最後に頭を下げれば丸く収まるだろうとたかを括っていたからだ。","en":"<tips=3>Chris</tips> had never intended to consult them in the first place, saying, “They oppose everything anyway.” This was because he confidently assumed that whatever he did, everything would work out if he bowed his head at the end.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r13","rowIndex":13,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　実際、そうやって事後に挨拶をすることで、すべては収まった。","en":"In fact, everything was settled when he went to pay his respects after the fact.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r14","rowIndex":14,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　結局、<tips=22>老人たち</tips>もこの若くて情熱あふれるサイキックが可愛くて仕方がないのだ。","en":"Ultimately, the <tips=22>elders</tips> simply could not help adoring this young psychic, overflowing with passion.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r15","rowIndex":15,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=5>太刀川</tips>は予定のない日はあてどもなく街をぶらつく。","en":"On days when he had no plans, <tips=5>Tachikawa</tips> wandered the city without a destination.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r16","rowIndex":16,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=57>滑走路通り</tips>などのメインストリートには建物らしい建物が建ち並び、本格的な飲食店が営業をしていたが、裏通りに入れば路上にひっくり返した段ボール箱を並べてトタン板を敷き、その上に商品を並べてものを売る姿がいくらでも見られた。","en":"Proper buildings lined the main streets, such as <tips=57>Runway Street</tips>, and full-scale restaurants did business there. Turn into a back street, however, and one encountered countless vendors who laid sheets of corrugated metal over cardboard boxes turned upside down in the road, then arranged their goods on top.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r17","rowIndex":17,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼はこの風景を眺めて歩くのが好きだった。","en":"He enjoyed walking through scenes of this kind.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r18","rowIndex":18,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　客と物売りは英語だの中国語だの日本語だのをごっちゃに使って安いだの高いだの交渉をし、時に口論がゆきすぎて怒鳴りあいになったりもする。はたから聞いていても何がなんだかさっぱりわからぬやりとりでも、本人同士では不思議と通じている。","en":"Buyers and sellers bargained over whether something was cheap or expensive in a jumble of English, Chinese, and Japanese. At times, an argument went too far and became a shouting match. An onlooker could make neither head nor tail of the language, yet somehow the people involved understood each other.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r19","rowIndex":19,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　夕方になって大きな鍋が路上に引き出されると、香辛料の豊かなにおいがそこらじゅうに満ちる。売っているのは肉だの野菜だのがどろどろに煮込まれた黄色いスープだ。","en":"When a large pot was wheeled out into the street toward evening, the rich aroma of spices filled the air. The fare was a yellow soup in which meat and vegetables had been stewed to a thick mush.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r20","rowIndex":20,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　仕事帰りの肉体労働者たちにはこれが大人気で、毎日列を作っている。","en":"It was tremendously popular with laborers returning from work, who formed a line every day.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r21","rowIndex":21,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　金を払い、渡されたプラスチックのボウルを持って並ぶと、ふとった中年女がお玉で一人頭三杯ずつ掬ってくれる。これが実におおざっぱで、具が野菜ばかりだったり、肉ばかりだったりと不公平この上ないのだが、客がいくら苦情を言っても受け付けない。ここではこの女が絶対的権力者なのだ。","en":"After paying, each man took the plastic bowl he was given and joined the line, where a fat, middle-aged woman served him three ladlefuls. Her portions were astonishingly careless—some bowls held almost nothing but vegetables, others almost nothing but meat—and could hardly have been more unfair, but no matter how the customers complained, she took no notice. Here, the woman wielded absolute power.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r22","rowIndex":22,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　スープの隣では米飯やらチャパティやらも売られていて、大抵の男たちはスープと共にこちらも買った。","en":"Rice and chapatis were also sold beside the soup, and most of the men bought some to go with it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r23","rowIndex":23,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そうして男たちはそこらじゅうの路上に座りこみ、二皿を地べたに並べて、あるものは手づかみで、あるものは銀色のスプーンでむさぼるのである。","en":"Then the men squatted down all over the street, set the two dishes on the ground, and devoured them—some with their bare hands, others with silver-colored spoons.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r24","rowIndex":24,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　値段は非常に安く、都会でランチセットを頼むのと同じ金を使えば、大の男が三人掛かりでも食い切れぬほどの量となるだろう。","en":"The prices were extraordinarily low. The same amount that would buy one lunch set downtown would purchase more food than three grown men together could finish.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r25","rowIndex":25,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　発展途上国のような活気が街のあちこちに満ちあふれている。","en":"The city overflowed with the vitality of a developing country.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r26","rowIndex":26,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　海外のどこに旅行をしても腹をこわしてトイレに閉じこもり気味になる<tips=5>太刀川</tips>は、これらの得体の知れない食べ物を自ら買うほどの勇気はなかったが、この風景をぼんやりと眺めるのは好きだった。ただ飯を買って食うだけの当たり前の日々の営みが、これほど騒がしく生命力に満ちあふれて見えるのが<tips=9>Y地区</tips>なのだろう。<tips=52>ミアオ</tips>のあの輝きもこの生命力を分け与えられたせいなのかもしれない。","en":"<tips=5>Tachikawa</tips>, whose stomach failed him wherever he traveled abroad and who tended to spend such trips shut in the bathroom, lacked the courage to buy any of these mysterious foods himself, but he enjoyed gazing absently at the scene. Perhaps this was what made <tips=9>Y District</tips> what it was: the ordinary daily business of simply buying and eating a meal looked so noisy and so bursting with life. Perhaps <tips=52>Miao's</tips> radiance had come from sharing in that vitality.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r27","rowIndex":27,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ふと、物思いにふけっていると、","en":"Then, while he was lost in thought—","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r28","rowIndex":28,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ドクター」","en":"“Doctor.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"路地邦昭（若い）","displayName":"Kuniaki Roji (Past, Young)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r29","rowIndex":29,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　と声をかけられた。","en":"Someone addressed him.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r30","rowIndex":30,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　振り向くと、背の高く体格の良い青年が顔にあたる夕日に眩しそうに顔を顰めてそこに立っていた。","en":"He turned. A tall, powerfully built young man stood there, squinting as the setting sun struck his face.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r31","rowIndex":31,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その額には一本の角が生え、顔にその影を落としている。","en":"A single horn grew from his forehead, casting its shadow across his features.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r32","rowIndex":32,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=16>タイプＡ</tips>の<tips=77>特質変異</tips>なのだろうか。その異様な姿よりも別のことが<tips=5>太刀川</tips>は気になった。彼は私用で出かける時はマスクをしていない。もちろん今もそうだ。なのに彼はいま『ドクター』と呼びかけた。","en":"Was it perhaps a <tips=16>Type A</tips> <tips=77>trait mutation</tips>? What bothered <tips=5>Tachikawa</tips>, however, was something other than the man's bizarre appearance. Tachikawa did not wear his mask when he went out on private business. Naturally, he was not wearing it now. Yet the man had just called him “Doctor.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r33","rowIndex":33,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　自分のこの素顔を見て、ドクターとわかるのは、限られた人間しかいないはずだ。","en":"Only a handful of people should have been able to see his unmasked face and recognize him as the Doctor.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r34","rowIndex":34,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　どういうつもりなのか、その目を見て心を読もうとしたが、彼は手で自分の目を隠す。","en":"Tachikawa tried to read the man's intentions in his eyes, but the stranger covered them with one hand.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r35","rowIndex":35,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それとも、<tips=5>太刀川</tips>先生と呼んだ方がいいですかね？」","en":"“Or would you rather I called you Dr. <tips=5>Tachikawa</tips>?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"路地邦昭（若い）","displayName":"Kuniaki Roji (Past, Young)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r36","rowIndex":36,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼は不敵に笑う。","en":"He gave Tachikawa a fearless smile.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r37","rowIndex":37,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　相手は確実にこちらのことを知っている。能力のことまで知っているとは。あまりにも不審だ。","en":"The man unquestionably knew who he was. He even knew about his ability. It was far too suspicious.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r38","rowIndex":38,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　能力の内容は素顔以上の特秘事項であるし、『能力を使うためには目を見る必要がある』という事実までも知っているのは<tips=3>クリス</tips>しかいないが、むやみに喋るとは思えない。それは彼にとっても不利益になる。","en":"The nature of his ability was a more closely guarded secret than his bare face, and only <tips=3>Chris</tips> knew even that he had to look into a person's eyes to use it. Tachikawa could not imagine Chris speaking of the matter carelessly; doing so would work against his own interests.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r39","rowIndex":39,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しかし、どう記憶を探っても目の前の若者に見覚えはない。年は、二十才になるかならないかといったところだろうか？　身体は大きいがどことなく少年の面影を残す顔立ちで、そう寒くもないのに丈の長い軍用ジャケットを身につけている。","en":"Yet no search of his memory produced any recollection of the young man before him. He appeared to be approximately twenty, perhaps not quite. His body was large, but his face retained a trace of boyhood, and he wore a long military jacket despite the mild weather.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r40","rowIndex":40,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　いや、知り合いであったとしても、そこまで詳しく知っているというのは考えられない。サイキック能力というものは極めてプライベートな情報だから、同僚や友人にも能力についてはほとんど話さない。サイキックであることさえ知らないだろう。世の中は、<tips=77>特質変異</tips>だけあって、能力をほとんど持たない<tips=16>タイプＡ</tips>ばかりなのだ。","en":"Indeed, even an acquaintance could hardly have known so much. A psychic ability was intensely private information, and most psychics said almost nothing about theirs even to colleagues and friends. Their colleagues and friends might not even know they were psychic. The world was full of <tips=16>Type As</tips> who possessed a <tips=77>trait mutation</tips> and almost no ability beyond it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r41","rowIndex":41,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　政府の関係者ならば知っていても不思議ではない。<tips=16>タイプＡ</tips>は能力を公的機関で調査し、書類として届け出る義務がある。もちろん能力自体を隠すものも少なくはないが、<tips=5>太刀川</tips>のようにまっとうに生きて来た人間なら皆提出しているはずだ。もちろん<tips=5>太刀川</tips>も彼が物心つく前に機関の検査を受けている。","en":"It would not be strange for someone connected to the government to know. <tips=16>Type As</tips> were obligated to have their abilities examined by a public agency and file the resulting documents. Many naturally concealed the ability itself, but anyone who had lived an upright life like <tips=5>Tachikawa</tips> should have submitted the paperwork. <tips=5>Tachikawa</tips>, of course, had been examined by the agency before he was old enough to remember.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r42","rowIndex":42,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しかし、目の前の若者はどう見ても、そのような機密情報にアクセス出来る政府関係者には見えない。","en":"The young man before him, however, looked nothing like a government official with access to such classified information.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r43","rowIndex":43,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　だとすれば、他に考えられる可能性はそう多くない。","en":"That left very few other possibilities.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r44","rowIndex":44,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あなたはサイキックですね。どんな力があるのですか？」","en":"“You're a psychic, aren't you? What kind of power do you have?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"太刀川良馬過去","displayName":"Ryoma Tachikawa (Past)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r45","rowIndex":45,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=5>太刀川</tips>は相手の顔を見つめながらそう言った。","en":"<tips=5>Tachikawa</tips> spoke while studying the stranger’s face.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r46","rowIndex":46,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　相手は答えずに、にやりと笑うと、","en":"The young man did not answer. He only grinned.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r47","rowIndex":47,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あんたに渡したいものがあるんだ」","en":"“I’ve got something for you.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"路地邦昭（若い）","displayName":"Kuniaki Roji (Past, Young)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r48","rowIndex":48,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　懐に手を突っ込んで、折りたたまれた紙片を取り出すと<tips=5>太刀川</tips>に差し出した。","en":"He thrust a hand inside his coat, drew out a folded piece of paper, and offered it to <tips=5>Tachikawa</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r49","rowIndex":49,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=5>太刀川</tips>は警戒しながら手を伸ばしそれを受け取る。","en":"<tips=5>Tachikawa</tips> warily reached out and accepted it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r50","rowIndex":50,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ここじゃ開かない方が良い。あとで<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>と一緒に見てくれ」","en":"“You shouldn’t open it here. Look at it later, with <tips=3>Chris Tse</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"路地邦昭（若い）","displayName":"Kuniaki Roji (Past, Young)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r51","rowIndex":51,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「これは何ですか？」","en":"“What is this?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"太刀川良馬過去","displayName":"Ryoma Tachikawa (Past)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r52","rowIndex":52,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=18>ローズ・クラブ</tips>と契約している人買いと、そいつらの売った商品のリストだ」","en":"“A list of the Man Buyers under contract with the <tips=18>Rose Club</tips>, and of the merchandise they sold.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"路地邦昭（若い）","displayName":"Kuniaki Roji (Past, Young)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r53","rowIndex":53,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　容易ならぬ言葉が相手の口から飛び出し、<tips=5>太刀川</tips>は眉間にしわをよせる。","en":"The alarming disclosure came readily from the man's lips, and <tips=5>Tachikawa</tips> knitted his brow.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r54","rowIndex":54,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「じゃあな！」","en":"“See you!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"路地邦昭（若い）","displayName":"Kuniaki Roji (Past, Young)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r55","rowIndex":55,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　若者は説明を避けるように、それだけ言うと背を向けて人混みに紛れていった。","en":"As though avoiding an explanation, the young man said no more, turned his back, and disappeared into the crowd.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r56","rowIndex":56,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=5>太刀川</tips>はそのことを翌日事務所で<tips=3>クリス</tips>に伝えた。","en":"<tips=5>Tachikawa</tips> reported the encounter to <tips=3>Chris</tips> at the office the following day.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r57","rowIndex":57,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「うさんくさい話だ」","en":"“That sounds fishy.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー（過去・青年）","displayName":"Chris Tse (Past, Young)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r58","rowIndex":58,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=3>クリス</tips>は<tips=5>太刀川</tips>から紙片を受け取り、それに目を通す。","en":"<tips=3>Chris</tips> took the paper from <tips=5>Tachikawa</tips> and examined it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r59","rowIndex":59,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その紙にはいくつもの個人名とその電話番号、そして記号や数字が記載されている。","en":"It bore numerous personal names and telephone numbers, together with symbols and figures.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r60","rowIndex":60,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ドクター、この名前の横の、P１とかＪ4とかいうのはなんなんだい？」","en":"“Doctor, what do these things beside the names mean—P1, J4, and so on?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー（過去・青年）","displayName":"Chris Tse (Past, Young)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r61","rowIndex":61,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ちょっとわからないですね」","en":"“I’m afraid I don’t know.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"太刀川良馬ペスト仮面","displayName":"Ryoma Tachikawa (Plague Mask)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r62","rowIndex":62,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうか。しかし、これは信じがたいな……」","en":"“I see. But this is difficult to believe...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー（過去・青年）","displayName":"Chris Tse (Past, Young)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r63","rowIndex":63,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「知っている名前でもあったんですか？」","en":"“Did you recognize one of the names?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬明（過去）","displayName":"Ma Ming (Past)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r64","rowIndex":64,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=4>馬明</tips>がそう訊ねると<tips=3>クリス</tips>は紙片をテーブルの上に置き、","en":"When <tips=4>Ma Ming</tips> asked the question, <tips=3>Chris</tips> set the paper on the table.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r65","rowIndex":65,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まあね。しかし、正体不明のやつから渡された怪文書を、信用するというのもな」","en":"“Well, yes. But can we really trust an anonymous document handed over by a man we can't identify?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー（過去・青年）","displayName":"Chris Tse (Past, Young)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r66","rowIndex":66,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=81>龍頭</tips>。そいつのこと、知ってるかもしれません」","en":"“<tips=81>Longtou</tips>. I may know who he is.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ジェフリー（過去）","displayName":"Jeffrey (Past)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r67","rowIndex":67,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　横からそう言ったのは<tips=39>ジェフリー</tips>だった。","en":"It was <tips=39>Jeffrey</tips> who spoke up from beside them.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r68","rowIndex":68,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「角が生えている男ですよね？　聞いたことがあります。そいつは、<tips=50>路地</tips>っていうガキでしょう」","en":"“A man with a horn, yes? I've heard of him. He must be a brat named <tips=50>Roji</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ジェフリー（過去）","displayName":"Jeffrey (Past)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r69","rowIndex":69,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=50>路地</tips>？」","en":"“<tips=50>Roji</tips>?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー（過去・青年）","displayName":"Chris Tse (Past, Young)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r70","rowIndex":70,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=3>クリス</tips>が問い返す。","en":"<tips=3>Chris</tips> echoed the name.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r71","rowIndex":71,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「浮浪児あがりのチンピラですよ。暗闇通りに事務所を開いて、勝手に探偵と名乗っているようです。<tips=59>暗闇通り</tips>にトラブルがあるとしゃしゃり出てなんやかんや面倒を見るから、あの辺りで妙な人気が出ているようですな」","en":"“He's a punk who grew up as a street urchin. Apparently he opened an office on Darkness Street and started calling himself a detective. Whenever trouble breaks out on <tips=59>Darkness Street</tips>, he comes barging in and sorts it out one way or another. Seems that's made him oddly popular around there.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ジェフリー（過去）","displayName":"Jeffrey (Past)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r72","rowIndex":72,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ドクターはサイキックだと推測しているようだが、それはどうなんだ？」","en":"“The Doctor seems to think he's psychic. What do you know about that?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー（過去・青年）","displayName":"Chris Tse (Past, Young)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r73","rowIndex":73,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そこまでは知りません。けれど、あんなガキが持てはやされているのですから、そう考えた方が自然かもしれませんね」","en":"“I don't know that much. But if a brat like him is making such a name for himself, I suppose that would be the natural explanation.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ジェフリー（過去）","displayName":"Jeffrey (Past)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r74","rowIndex":74,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=39>ジェフリー</tips>はそう言って肩をすくめる。","en":"<tips=39>Jeffrey</tips> shrugged.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r75","rowIndex":75,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうか。無視しても良いんだが、ちょっと気になるな。一体その<tips=50>路地</tips>というやつがどこまで知っているのか、どういうつもりなのか……。強い力をもつサイキックというものは、いつだってイレギュラーの原因になる」","en":"“I could ignore him, but something about this bothers me. Just how much does this <tips=50>Roji</tips> know, and what is he after? ...A psychic with great power is always a wildcard.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー（過去・青年）","displayName":"Chris Tse (Past, Young)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r76","rowIndex":76,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「調べましょうか？」","en":"“Shall I investigate?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ジェフリー（過去）","displayName":"Jeffrey (Past)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r77","rowIndex":77,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=39>ジェフリー</tips>はそう訊ねる。","en":"<tips=39>Jeffrey</tips> put the question to him.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r78","rowIndex":78,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いや、お前はおれと一緒に作戦の最終調整をやって貰う。……ドクター、ちょっと行って貰っていいか？　相手はサイキックだし、万が一を考えるとおれが行った方がいいとは思うんだが、こっちも手が離せない。それに、この紙切れを渡す相手にわざわざあんたを選んだってことは、相手にも何か特別な理由があるような気がするんだ」","en":"“No. You'll stay with me and help make the final adjustments to the operation. ...Doctor, would you go? The other man is psychic, so I would rather handle it myself in case something happens, but I can't leave this work. Besides, he went out of his way to choose you as the person who received that paper. I have the feeling he must have had some special reason.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー（過去・青年）","displayName":"Chris Tse (Past, Young)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r79","rowIndex":79,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「かまいません。私も気になりますからね。相手の目的を探ればいいんですね？」","en":"“I don't mind. I'm curious myself. You want me to discover his purpose?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"太刀川良馬ペスト仮面","displayName":"Ryoma Tachikawa (Plague Mask)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r80","rowIndex":80,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「頼むよ。明仔も行ってボディーガードをしてくれ。くれぐれも慎重にな」","en":"“I'm counting on you. Ming-jai, go with him as his bodyguard. And both of you, be very careful.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー（過去・青年）","displayName":"Chris Tse (Past, Young)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r81","rowIndex":81,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「了解。サイキックの相手はぞっとしないけれども」","en":"“Understood. Though I can’t say I relish dealing with a psychic.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬明（過去）","displayName":"Ma Ming (Past)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r82","rowIndex":82,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=4>馬明</tips>はそう言って苦笑いをした。","en":"<tips=4>Ma Ming</tips> gave a wry smile.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r83","rowIndex":83,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして彼らはすぐに事務所を出て、例の軽トラックで<tips=59>暗闇通り</tips>に向かった。事務所の場所は、壬生屋太一が知っていた。","en":"Then they immediately left the office and headed for <tips=59>Darkness Street</tips> in the familiar kei truck. Taichi Mibuya knew where the detective's office was located.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r84","rowIndex":84,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"『あのガキが何かしやがったのかい？』","en":"“Did that brat do something?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r85","rowIndex":85,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=59>暗闇通り</tips>のことなら彼に聞けばわかるだろうと<tips=5>太刀川</tips>が電話をかけたら、案の定壬生屋は不快感をむきだしにしている。","en":"When <tips=5>Tachikawa</tips> telephoned Mibuya on the assumption that he would know anything concerning <tips=59>Darkness Street</tips>, Mibuya predictably made no effort to conceal his displeasure.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r86","rowIndex":86,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　顔を見なくともそのしかめっ面が思い浮かぶほどだ。","en":"Even without seeing his face, one could all but picture the scowl upon it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r87","rowIndex":87,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　詳しい内容は話したがらなかったが、彼は<tips=50>路地</tips>によってよほど酷い目に遭ったらしい。","en":"He had no wish to discuss the details, but <tips=50>Roji</tips> appeared to have put him through something truly unpleasant.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r88","rowIndex":88,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"『油断しない方が良い。人をなめたガキだからな。正義の味方きどりで思い上がってやがる』","en":"“You'd better not let down your guard. The brat has no respect for anyone. He's all puffed up with the idea that he's some champion of justice.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r89","rowIndex":89,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　というのが、売春王壬生屋からのアドバイスであった。","en":"Such was the advice of Mibuya, king of the brothels.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r90","rowIndex":90,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その事務所は、軽トラックでも通るのを躊躇われる、ネズミの通り道のように狭い路地の奥にあった。車を置いて二人でその薄暗い道を行くと、右手の壁にアルミのドアがあり『路地探偵事務所』と書かれた札がかかっている。","en":"The office stood at the end of a roji—an alley as narrow as a passage for rats, which even the kei truck could hardly have entered. The two men left it behind and walked down the dim passage. An aluminum door stood in the wall to their right, bearing a sign that read ROJI DETECTIVE AGENCY.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r91","rowIndex":91,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「路地の先に路地探偵事務所か。ふざけてやがるのか？」","en":"“Roji Detective Agency at the end of an alley? Is he screwing with us?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬明（過去）","displayName":"Ma Ming (Past)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r92","rowIndex":92,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=4>馬明</tips>はそう言って人差し指で表札を弾く。","en":"<tips=4>Ma Ming</tips> flicked the sign with his index finger.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r93","rowIndex":93,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして<tips=5>太刀川</tips>がそのドアをノックしようとすると、","en":"Then, just as <tips=5>Tachikawa</tips> was about to knock on the door—","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r94","rowIndex":94,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「開いてるよ。はいんな」","en":"“The door's open. Come in.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r95","rowIndex":95,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　中から声がした。","en":"A voice came from inside.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r96","rowIndex":96,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「路地裏の路地探偵事務所へようこそ。おれが<tips=50>路地</tips>だ」","en":"“Welcome to the back-alley Roji Detective Agency. I'm <tips=50>Roji</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"路地邦昭（若い）","displayName":"Kuniaki Roji (Past, Young)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r97","rowIndex":97,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　部屋に入ると、昨日のあの角の生えた若者が奥の椅子にふんぞり返って不敵な笑みを浮かべていた。","en":"They entered the room. The horned young man from the day before sat sprawled imperiously in a chair at the back, wearing a fearless grin.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r98","rowIndex":98,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「今日は聞きたいことがありましてね」","en":"“We have a few questions for you today.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"太刀川良馬ペスト仮面","displayName":"Ryoma Tachikawa (Plague Mask)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r99","rowIndex":99,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=5>太刀川</tips>は散らかった部屋の中を見回しながら言う。","en":"<tips=5>Tachikawa</tips> spoke while surveying the cluttered room.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r100","rowIndex":100,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうだろう。来ると思ってたんだ。そっちのゴツいのは<tips=4>馬明</tips>だな。……<ruby=シンセン>深セン</ruby>出身の二十七才。錠前屋の父に連れられて<tips=9>Y地区</tips>にやって来たのは三才の時だ。体術の達人で、<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>の義兄弟にして<tips=69>義勝</tips>の若き幹部。……いや、今は<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>の幹部と言った方がいいのかい？」","en":"“Naturally. I expected you to come. That big brute over there is <tips=4>Ma Ming</tips>, isn't he? ...Twenty-seven years old, from Shenzhen. Your locksmith father brought you to <tips=9>Y District</tips> when you were three. A master of unarmed combat, sworn brother to <tips=3>Chris Tse</tips>, and a young officer of <tips=69>Yisheng</tips>. ...Or should I say an officer of <tips=7>YS</tips> now?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"路地邦昭（若い）","displayName":"Kuniaki Roji (Past, Young)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r101","rowIndex":101,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ふん、聞いたとおり、こざかしく嗅ぎ回る小僧だな。好奇心猫を殺すってことわざを知ってるか？」","en":"“Hmph. Just as I heard: a little brat who thinks he's clever, nosing into everyone's affairs. Have you ever heard the proverb ‘curiosity killed the cat’?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬明（過去）","displayName":"Ma Ming (Past)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r102","rowIndex":102,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=4>馬明</tips>は手近な椅子に断りもなく腰掛けると、悠然と構えてそう言った。","en":"<tips=4>Ma Ming</tips> sat without permission in a nearby chair and delivered the threat with perfect composure.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r103","rowIndex":103,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「この街に住んでいるものなら誰でも、あんたらが今やろうとしていることを知る権利はあるはずだ。そうだろう？」","en":"“Anyone who lives in this city has the right to know what you people are about to do. Wouldn’t you agree?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"路地邦昭（若い）","displayName":"Kuniaki Roji (Past, Young)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r104","rowIndex":104,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=50>路地</tips>は<tips=4>馬明</tips>の脅迫めいた言葉にも動じず、ただ肩をすくめる。","en":"Unmoved by <tips=4>Ma Ming’s</tips> threatening words, <tips=50>Roji</tips> merely shrugged.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r105","rowIndex":105,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「私たちはきみがあまりにも事情をよく知っているので驚いています。昨日の書類はどういうつもりなのか、<tips=18>ローズ・クラブ</tips>に対してどういう立場なのか、良かったら教えていただけませんか？」","en":"“We are surprised by how much you know about the circumstances. If you don’t mind, could you explain what you intended by yesterday’s document and where you stand in regard to the <tips=18>Rose Club</tips>?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"太刀川良馬ペスト仮面","displayName":"Ryoma Tachikawa (Plague Mask)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r106","rowIndex":106,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=5>太刀川</tips>は立ったままそう訊ねる。今日は昨日とは違って、いつものマスクを身につけている。","en":"<tips=5>Tachikawa</tips> asked the question without sitting. Unlike the day before, he wore his usual mask.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r107","rowIndex":107,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なんだか誤解しているようだが、おれはギャング同士の抗争には興味がない。勝手に殺し合えばいいんだ。ただ、今回は、おれが引き受けた依頼の兼ね合いがあってね。関わりたくないが、関わってやった。見ただろう？　あれはあんたらにとってとても衝撃的な情報のはずだ」","en":"“You seem to have misunderstood. I don't care about wars between gangs. You can kill one another as you please. This time, though, there's a connection to a case I accepted. I wanted no part of it, but I got involved for your sake. You saw it, didn't you? That information should have been quite a shock to you.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"路地邦昭（若い）","displayName":"Kuniaki Roji (Past, Young)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r108","rowIndex":108,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なぜ私に？　そこまで知っているなら私が構成員じゃないことも知っているでしょう。確実に届けたいなら<tips=3>クリス</tips>の部下の誰かに渡しても良かったはずです」","en":"“Why give it to me? If you know so much, you must know that I am not a member of the organization. Had you wanted to ensure its delivery, you could have given it to any of <tips=3>Chris’s</tips> subordinates.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"太刀川良馬ペスト仮面","displayName":"Ryoma Tachikawa (Plague Mask)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r109","rowIndex":109,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そりゃね、先生は『違う』からだよ。経歴を見ればわかる。まっとうに生きて来た人間だ。何かの間違いでここにいるんだろうが、本来はこんな場所にいるべきじゃない。先生が高校時代に卒業文集に書いた作文は、なかなか感動的なものだった。……ガキのころから高い理想を持っていて、その通り医者になったんだな。なあ、どうして今はギャングになんか手を貸しているんだい？」","en":"“Well, that's because you're ‘different,’ Doctor. Anyone can see it from your history. You've lived an upright life. Some mistake must have brought you here, but this isn't where you belong. The essay you wrote for your high-school graduation anthology was quite moving. ...You held lofty ideals even as a boy, and you really did become a doctor just as you intended. So tell me: why are you helping a gang now?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"路地邦昭（若い）","displayName":"Kuniaki Roji (Past, Young)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r110","rowIndex":110,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なぜそこまで……」","en":"“How could you know so much...?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"太刀川良馬ペスト仮面","displayName":"Ryoma Tachikawa (Plague Mask)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r111","rowIndex":111,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「先生みたいな強力な<tips=16>タイプＡ</tips>は当局に監視されて、生活の細々とした情報が全部データとして保管されている。知らなかったのなら、気をつけるんだな。……ただ、<tips=9>Y地区</tips>に来てからはさすがに追い切れないのか、情報がごっそり抜け落ちているがね」","en":"“Powerful <tips=16>Type As</tips> like you are kept under government surveillance. Every last detail of your lives is preserved as data. If you didn't know, you'd better start being careful. ...Then again, perhaps <tips=9>Y District</tips> is too much for them to follow. There's an enormous gap in the data after you came here.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"路地邦昭（若い）","displayName":"Kuniaki Roji (Past, Young)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r112","rowIndex":112,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「やっぱり、きみには特別な力があるようですね。情報を盗む能力ですか」","en":"“Then you really do have a special power. Is it the ability to steal information?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"太刀川良馬ペスト仮面","displayName":"Ryoma Tachikawa (Plague Mask)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r113","rowIndex":113,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=5>太刀川</tips>は合点がいったかのように頷く。","en":"<tips=5>Tachikawa</tips> nodded as though the pieces had fallen into place.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r114","rowIndex":114,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　相手が語る内容は、いかに優れた探偵であったとしても、常人が知ることが出来る範囲を超越している。","en":"What the man was telling them exceeded anything an ordinary person could know, no matter how gifted a detective he might be.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r115","rowIndex":115,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　とすれば、人智を超えた能力を持っているということでほぼ間違いが無い。","en":"That being so, there was almost no doubt that he possessed a power beyond the reach of ordinary human knowledge.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r116","rowIndex":116,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=50>路地</tips>は肯定も否定もせず、ただ薄笑いを浮かべて<tips=5>太刀川</tips>を眺めている。","en":"<tips=50>Roji</tips> neither confirmed nor denied it. He merely watched <tips=5>Tachikawa</tips> with a faint smile.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r117","rowIndex":117,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「おい小僧。依頼を受けたからどうのと言ったが、それはどういうことだ？　<tips=18>ローズ・クラブ</tips>に関係した仕事か？」","en":"“Listen, boy. You said something about accepting a case. What did you mean? Was it work connected to the <tips=18>Rose Club</tips>?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬明（過去）","displayName":"Ma Ming (Past)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r118","rowIndex":118,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　まるきり無視された形となった<tips=4>馬明</tips>が不機嫌にそう訊ねる。","en":"Thoroughly ignored until now, <tips=4>Ma Ming</tips> asked the question irritably.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r119","rowIndex":119,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「子供を誘拐されたとある母親から、捜索の依頼を受けてね。その依頼自体は果たしたんだが、あまりにもひどい結末だったのさ」","en":"“A certain mother whose child had been abducted hired me to find the child. I did fulfill the request itself, but the outcome was appalling.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"路地邦昭（若い）","displayName":"Kuniaki Roji (Past, Young)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r120","rowIndex":120,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=50>路地</tips>は暗い顔で溜息をつく。","en":"<tips=50>Roji</tips> sighed, his face dark.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r121","rowIndex":121,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ひどい結末、ですか？」","en":"“A terrible outcome?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"太刀川良馬ペスト仮面","displayName":"Ryoma Tachikawa (Plague Mask)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r122","rowIndex":122,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「昨日渡した文章は見たかい？」","en":"“Did you look at the document I gave you yesterday?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"路地邦昭（若い）","displayName":"Kuniaki Roji (Past, Young)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r123","rowIndex":123,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ざっと目を通す程度ですが」","en":"“I only skimmed it.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"太刀川良馬ペスト仮面","displayName":"Ryoma Tachikawa (Plague Mask)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r124","rowIndex":124,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「人買いの名前の横に、アルファベットと数字が書いてあったろ？」","en":"“You remember the letters and numbers beside the Man Buyers' names?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"路地邦昭（若い）","displayName":"Kuniaki Roji (Past, Young)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r125","rowIndex":125,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「覚えています」","en":"“I do.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"太刀川良馬ペスト仮面","displayName":"Ryoma Tachikawa (Plague Mask)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r126","rowIndex":126,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あれは、その人買いが<tips=18>ローズ・クラブ</tips>に連れて来た人間の、質と数をあらわしている。Pはプラチナクラスの上玉ってことさ。あとは、Gはゴールド、Rがレギュラーの意味で、最後のJはジャンク。Ｊ7と書いてあればジャンクを７人ってことだよ」","en":"“They indicate the quality and number of the people each Man Buyer brought to the <tips=18>Rose Club</tips>. P means a prize specimen in the Platinum class. Then G means Gold, R means Regular, and the last one, J, means Junk. If it says J7, that means seven pieces of Junk.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"路地邦昭（若い）","displayName":"Kuniaki Roji (Past, Young)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r127","rowIndex":127,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ジャンク？」","en":"“Junk?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"太刀川良馬ペスト仮面","displayName":"Ryoma Tachikawa (Plague Mask)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r128","rowIndex":128,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「とても客には出せない『ガラクタ』ってことだよ。こいつは解体されてそのまま臓器売買に回される」","en":"“‘Scrap’ that can’t possibly be offered to customers. They’re taken apart and sent directly into the organ trade.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"路地邦昭（若い）","displayName":"Kuniaki Roji (Past, Young)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r129","rowIndex":129,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そんな……」","en":"“That can’t...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"太刀川良馬ペスト仮面","displayName":"Ryoma Tachikawa (Plague Mask)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r130","rowIndex":130,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「で、おれに依頼してくれた母親の大事な大事なおぼっちゃんも『ジャンク』に判定されてたってわけさ。まあ、見てくれは悪いし病弱だったからね。事実を知った母親の悲しみようったらないぜ。貧しい家で病弱な子供を育てるのは、どれだけ大変なことだったか……。しかし他人から見ればただのゴミで、ゴミのような末路を辿ったということさ。とても見ていられない。……最近、そんな事件が多くてね。同じような親をあちこちで見かける。ただでさえ悲惨なやつらが、さらに悲惨な目にあっている。おれはむかついているんだよ」","en":"“And the mother's precious, precious little boy—the one she hired me to find—had been classified as ‘Junk.’ Well, he was ugly and sickly. You should have seen the mother's grief when she learned the truth. How hard must it have been to raise a sickly child in a poor home? ...Yet to anyone else he was nothing but garbage, and he met an end fit for garbage. It was more than I could stand to watch. ...There have been a lot of cases like that lately. I keep encountering the same sort of parents everywhere. People whose lives were miserable enough already are being subjected to still greater misery. It makes me furious.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"路地邦昭（若い）","displayName":"Kuniaki Roji (Past, Young)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r131","rowIndex":131,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=18>ローズ・クラブ</tips>は正当な報酬を支払っているという話でしたが」","en":"“I had heard that the <tips=18>Rose Club</tips> paid fair compensation.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"太刀川良馬ペスト仮面","displayName":"Ryoma Tachikawa (Plague Mask)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r132","rowIndex":132,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「前はそうだったがね。今は全部が全部そうってわけじゃない。本体の方針が変わったのか、末端の人買い業者のタチが悪くなったのか知らないが、誘拐したり、親を薬や金でハメたり、手段を選ばないよ。特にプラチナ確実の上玉を見つけたら、それこそ親を殺してでも連れて行く。……だから、あんたらになんとかして欲しいのさ。<tips=18>ローズ・クラブ</tips>がナワバリのなかで好き勝手暴れ回ってるのは、あんたらには致命的だろう？」","en":"“That used to be true. Now it isn't true across the board. I don't know whether the people at the top changed their policy or the Man Buyers at the bottom grew worse, but now they'll stop at nothing. They abduct children or trap the parents with drugs and money. If they find a prize certain to qualify for Platinum, they'll kill the parents themselves to take the child. ...That's why I want you to do something about them. The <tips=18>Rose Club</tips> running wild in your own territory is fatal for you, isn't it?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"路地邦昭（若い）","displayName":"Kuniaki Roji (Past, Young)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r133","rowIndex":133,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=50>路地</tips>は肩をすくめ、","en":"<tips=50>Roji</tips> shrugged, then said,","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r134","rowIndex":134,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「昨日渡した情報は信用していい。やつらの内部資料をそのまんまプリントしたものだからな」","en":"“You can trust the information I gave you yesterday. It's a direct printout of their internal documents.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"路地邦昭（若い）","displayName":"Kuniaki Roji (Past, Young)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r135","rowIndex":135,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「その前に、私の質問にちゃんと答えてください。どうやってそのようなものを入手したんですか？　非合法組織の資料を盗んだり、公的機関のデータを閲覧したり、どんな能力を使えばそんなことが出来るのか」","en":"“Before that, answer my question properly. How did you obtain such things? Stealing documents from an illegal organization, accessing government data—what sort of ability lets you do all that?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"太刀川良馬ペスト仮面","displayName":"Ryoma Tachikawa (Plague Mask)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r136","rowIndex":136,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「アハハ、先生、言えるわけないでしょう？　それは企業秘密ってやつだよ」","en":"“Ha ha! Doctor, you can’t expect me to tell you that. It’s what you might call a trade secret.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"路地邦昭（若い）","displayName":"Kuniaki Roji (Past, Young)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r137","rowIndex":137,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=50>路地</tips>は笑ってそう言うと、","en":"<tips=50>Roji</tips> laughed before continuing.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r138","rowIndex":138,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「とにかく、おれの事情はそれだけだ。別に抗争に深く関わるつもりはないし、昨日渡した書類以上の協力をするつもりもない。もう一度言うがね、ギャングってのは好きじゃないんだよ。弱い者いじめばかりするからな。今回は成り行き上あんたらの方が多少はマシだと思うから余計なことをしたが、特例中の特例だ。実際ね、<tips=18>ローズ・クラブ</tips>だろうが<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>だろうがそこまで大きな差はないんだよ。どちらも街の血を吸って生きるダニだ。本当は共倒れして欲しいんだがね」","en":"“Anyway, that's my side of it. I don't intend to get deeply involved in your gang war, and I won't help you beyond the document I gave you yesterday. I'll say it again: I don't like gangs. All they do is bully the weak. This time, events left me thinking your side was a little better, so I stuck my nose in where it didn't belong—but this is the exception to every rule. The truth is, there isn't much difference between the <tips=18>Rose Club</tips> and <tips=3>Chris Tse</tips>. You're both ticks living on the blood of this city. What I'd really like is to see you take each other down.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"路地邦昭（若い）","displayName":"Kuniaki Roji (Past, Young)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r139","rowIndex":139,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「坊主、相手をよく見て言葉を選ぶんだな」","en":"“Boy, take a good look at the man you’re addressing and choose your words.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬明（過去）","displayName":"Ma Ming (Past)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r140","rowIndex":140,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=4>馬明</tips>は不快感をあらわにして睨み付ける。","en":"<tips=4>Ma Ming</tips> glared at him with open displeasure.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r141","rowIndex":141,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ふん、ちょっと腕っ節が強いだけのノーマルのくせに偉そうに」","en":"“Hmph. For a Normal who’s merely stronger than most, you think a lot of yourself.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"路地邦昭（若い）","displayName":"Kuniaki Roji (Past, Young)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r142","rowIndex":142,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=50>路地</tips>は冷やかな視線を<tips=4>馬明</tips>に返す。","en":"<tips=50>Roji</tips> returned <tips=4>Ma Ming’s</tips> stare with a frigid gaze.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r143","rowIndex":143,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「おれはあんたのところのボスが嫌いだね。天から授かった能力を悪用して、チンピラどものボスになって、自分の王国なんぞを作ろうとしてさ。選ばれた<tips=16>タイプＡ</tips>の生き方ってのはよ、そういうもんじゃないだろうよ。才能には責任が伴うはずだ。おれは、能力をあんなふうには使わない……先生はどう思う？」","en":"“I hate your boss. He abuses the power granted him by heaven, makes himself boss of a pack of thugs, and tries to build some kingdom of his own. That's no way for a chosen <tips=16>Type A</tips> to live. Talent should carry responsibility. I would never use my ability that way... What do you think, Doctor?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"路地邦昭（若い）","displayName":"Kuniaki Roji (Past, Young)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r144","rowIndex":144,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「おい、このクソ餓鬼！　それ以上はゆるさんぞ！」","en":"“You rotten little brat! I won't allow you to say another word!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬明（過去）","displayName":"Ma Ming (Past)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r145","rowIndex":145,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=4>馬明</tips>は椅子を蹴飛ばすようにして立ち上がった。","en":"<tips=4>Ma Ming</tips> sprang to his feet, all but kicking the chair away.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r146","rowIndex":146,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=5>太刀川</tips>は今にも<tips=50>路地</tips>に襲い掛かろうとする<tips=4>馬明</tips>をおさえ、","en":"<tips=5>Tachikawa</tips> held back <tips=4>Ma Ming</tips>, who looked ready to pounce on <tips=50>Roji</tips> at any moment, and said,","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r147","rowIndex":147,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「私はそうは思いませんね。<tips=3>クリス</tips>のような生き方は、羨ましく感じますよ」","en":"“I don't see it that way. The way <tips=3>Chris</tips> lives is something I envy.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"太刀川良馬ペスト仮面","displayName":"Ryoma Tachikawa (Plague Mask)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r148","rowIndex":148,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そりゃ、羨ましいことは羨ましいだろうが……」","en":"“Well, of course it’s enviable, but...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"路地邦昭（若い）","displayName":"Kuniaki Roji (Past, Young)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r149","rowIndex":149,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=50>路地</tips>は失笑する。","en":"<tips=50>Roji</tips> gave a derisive laugh.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r150","rowIndex":150,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「今日はこのあたりでおいとましましょう。お騒がせしました」","en":"“I believe we should take our leave for today. I apologize for the disturbance.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"太刀川良馬ペスト仮面","displayName":"Ryoma Tachikawa (Plague Mask)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r151","rowIndex":151,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=5>太刀川</tips>はまだ何か言おうとする<tips=50>路地</tips>に頭を下げ、興奮する<tips=4>馬明</tips>の袖を引いて半ば無理矢理外に連れ出した。","en":"<tips=5>Tachikawa</tips> bowed to <tips=50>Roji</tips>, who still had something to say, then took the agitated <tips=4>Ma Ming</tips> by the sleeve and half dragged him outside.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r152","rowIndex":152,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　車に戻ってすぐ携帯電話を取り出し、<tips=3>クリス</tips>に今<tips=50>路地</tips>から得た情報のすべてを順序立てて報告する。","en":"The moment they returned to the truck, Tachikawa pulled out his phone and methodically relayed to <tips=3>Chris</tips> everything they had just learned from <tips=50>Roji</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r153","rowIndex":153,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"『わかった。信頼出来そうだな。じゃあ、精々有効に使わせて貰うよ』","en":"“Understood. The information sounds reliable enough. We'll make the best use we can of it.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r154","rowIndex":154,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　とだけ<tips=3>クリス</tips>は言って、電話を切った。","en":"<tips=3>Chris</tips> said nothing more before ending the call.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r155","rowIndex":155,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=5>太刀川</tips>はその声が普段より重苦しかったことに気がついたが、それが何を意味しているのかはわからなかった。","en":"<tips=5>Tachikawa</tips> noticed that his voice sounded graver than usual, but did not know what it meant.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r156","rowIndex":156,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「少し出て来る。一時間もかからない」","en":"“I’m going out for a little while. I’ll be less than an hour.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー（過去・青年）","displayName":"Chris Tse (Past, Young)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r157","rowIndex":157,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=5>太刀川</tips>との電話を追えた<tips=3>クリス</tips>はそう言い残して、<tips=27>廖志明</tips>と<tips=31>ミス・ホワイト</tips>のいる会合の場から退席した。","en":"After ending his call with <tips=5>Tachikawa</tips>, <tips=3>Chris</tips> said as much to <tips=27>Liao Chi-ming</tips> and <tips=31>Miss White</tips>, then excused himself from their meeting.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r158","rowIndex":158,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼らがいたのはホテルの一室で、ドアを開けるとすぐ前の前で待機していた<tips=39>ジェフリー</tips>に声をかける。","en":"The meeting was taking place in a hotel room. When Chris opened the door, he spoke to <tips=39>Jeffrey</tips>, who was waiting immediately outside.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r159","rowIndex":159,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「車の鍵を貸してくれ」","en":"“Lend me your car keys.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー（過去・青年）","displayName":"Chris Tse (Past, Young)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r160","rowIndex":160,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どうしました？」","en":"“What happened?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ジェフリー・ウォン（若い頃)","displayName":"Jeffrey Wong (Past, Young)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r161","rowIndex":161,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　予定よりも早く部屋を出て来た<tips=3>クリス</tips>に、<tips=39>ジェフリー</tips>は怪訝な表情をする。","en":"When <tips=3>Chris</tips> emerged from the room earlier than expected, <tips=39>Jeffrey</tips> gave him a puzzled look.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r162","rowIndex":162,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ドクターのところに向かうんですか？」","en":"“Are you going to see the Doctor?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ジェフリー・ウォン（若い頃)","displayName":"Jeffrey Wong (Past, Young)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r163","rowIndex":163,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その質問に対し、<tips=3>クリス</tips>は首を横に振る。","en":"In response, <tips=3>Chris</tips> shook his head.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r164","rowIndex":164,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうじゃない。別の野暮用だ。一人で行って、すぐに帰って来る。お前はここで待っていてくれ」","en":"“No. I have another personal errand. I'm going alone, and I'll be straight back. Wait here.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー（過去・青年）","displayName":"Chris Tse (Past, Young)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r165","rowIndex":165,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　この時クリスが何をしていたのか、<tips=39>ジェフリー</tips>も<tips=5>太刀川</tips>も結局知ることはなかった。","en":"In the end, neither <tips=39>Jeffrey</tips> nor <tips=5>Tachikawa</tips> ever learned what Chris was doing at the time.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r166","rowIndex":166,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　――筆者がこの後の<tips=3>クリス</tips>の行動を知り得たのは、あとで一人の少年が証言してくれたおかげである。","en":"—The reason this writer was able to learn what <tips=3>Chris</tips> did next was that a boy later gave testimony.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r167","rowIndex":167,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その少年は<tips=58>パラシュート通り</tips>に住む貧民の子で、その頃は地域にある小さな教会の庭で何種類かの花を育てており、その日も様子を見に教会を訪ねていた。","en":"The boy came from a poor family on <tips=58>Parachute Street</tips>. At the time, he was cultivating several kinds of flowers in the garden of a small church in the neighborhood, and had visited that day to see how they were growing.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r168","rowIndex":168,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　花の世話を終えて帰ろうとしたとき、硬い表情で一人の男が礼拝堂へ入って行くのを見かけた。","en":"As he was about to leave after tending the flowers, he saw a grim-faced man enter the chapel alone.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r169","rowIndex":169,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　少年はその男の顔に見覚えがあった。たまに日曜のミサに顔を出しているので、何度か会話をしたことがあるのだ。だが少年はその相手が、<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>というギャングのボスだとまでは知らず、ごく普通の信者だと思っていた。","en":"The boy recognized his face. The man sometimes attended Sunday Mass, and they had spoken several times. But the boy did not know that he was <tips=3>Chris Tse</tips>, a gang boss, and believed him to be an ordinary member of the congregation.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r170","rowIndex":170,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　少年はなんとなしにこの知り合いの気さくな男のあとをついて礼拝堂へ入り、そして、その事件の唯一の目撃者となったのだ。","en":"For no particular reason, the boy followed his genial acquaintance into the chapel—and became the sole witness to the incident.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r171","rowIndex":171,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　礼拝堂には真っ白な髪の痩せ細った神父がいて、分厚い英語の本を読んでいる。","en":"A gaunt priest with pure white hair was inside the chapel, reading a thick book in English.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r172","rowIndex":172,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=3>クリス</tips>はそれに荒々しく声をかける。","en":"<tips=3>Chris</tips> addressed him harshly.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r173","rowIndex":173,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まさか、あんたが薄汚い人買いだとは思わなかったぜ！」","en":"“I never imagined you were a filthy Man Buyer.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー（過去・青年）","displayName":"Chris Tse (Past, Young)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r174","rowIndex":174,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そのイギリス人神父はゆっくりと振り返り、鳶色の瞳で<tips=3>クリス</tips>の顔を見た。","en":"The British priest slowly turned around and looked at <tips=3>Chris</tips> with hazel eyes.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r175","rowIndex":175,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　風邪気味らしく、鷲の嘴のように折れ曲がった大きな鼻をすすってから、","en":"He appeared to have a cold. After sniffling through his large, eagle-beaked nose, he replied,","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r176","rowIndex":176,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なんの話だろう？」","en":"“What are you talking about?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"神父","displayName":"Priest","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r177","rowIndex":177,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　と返事をする。","en":"The priest replied.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r178","rowIndex":178,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「しらばっくれるのかい？　プラチナが一人、ゴールドが四人、レギュラーが八人で、ジャンクが五人。つまり、十三人の子供が金持ちどもの性玩具になり、五人の子供がバラバラに切り刻まれて内臓を奪い取られた。あんたの差し金でね」","en":"“You mean to play innocent? One Platinum, four Gold, eight Regular, and five Junk. In other words, thirteen children became rich men's sex toys, and five were cut to pieces so their organs could be taken. All at your behest.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー（過去・青年）","displayName":"Chris Tse (Past, Young)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r179","rowIndex":179,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　この言葉で、少年はただならぬ状況を察し、冷や汗をかきながら長椅子の後ろに姿を隠した。","en":"The boy realized from these words that something extraordinary was happening. Breaking out in a cold sweat, he concealed himself behind a pew.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r180","rowIndex":180,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……何を言っているんだ？」","en":"“...What are you talking about?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"神父","displayName":"Priest","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r181","rowIndex":181,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　神父の言葉に<tips=3>クリス</tips>は耳を貸さず、ジャケットの内側に手を突っ込んで銃を引き抜いた。","en":"<tips=3>Chris</tips> paid no heed to the priest's words. He reached inside his jacket and drew a gun.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r182","rowIndex":182,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「おれはこれから<tips=18>ローズ・クラブ</tips>を潰し、そのやり口を世間に公開するつもりだ。そうしたら<tips=68>木下組</tips>はこの街から手を引かざるを得なくなるし、あいつらと手を組んでいた人買いどもは、街の連中の憎しみによって一人残らず殺されるだろう。あんたみたいな聖職者ヅラした偽善者は、特に悲惨な末路を辿るだろうな。おれは、そうなる前に道を選ばせてやる。ここで神に懺悔をしてから死ぬか、それとも犯した罪を認めないまま救いがたい罪人として死ぬか。おれが引き金を引くまでの間に好きな方を選びな」","en":"“I'm about to destroy the <tips=18>Rose Club</tips> and make its methods public. Once I do, the <tips=68>Kinoshita-gumi</tips> will have no choice but to withdraw from this city, and the townspeople's hatred will see every last Man Buyer who worked with them killed. A hypocrite masquerading as a clergyman, like you, will come to an especially miserable end. Before that happens, I'm giving you a choice. Die here after confessing to God, or die an unrepentant sinner without acknowledging your crimes. Choose whichever you prefer before I pull the trigger.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー（過去・青年）","displayName":"Chris Tse (Past, Young)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r183","rowIndex":183,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=3>クリス</tips>、きみは昔から優しくて、勇気のある子だ。だがすこし、ものの見方が一面的すぎる」","en":"“<tips=3>Chris</tips>, you have been a kind and courageous boy since you were young. But your perspective is rather too one-sided.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"神父","displayName":"Priest","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r184","rowIndex":184,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　黒光りする銃を目にして、神父は少しも怯まなかった。","en":"The sight of the black-gleaming gun did not make the priest flinch in the least.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r185","rowIndex":185,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「きみは私の行いを非難したいのだろうが、間違ったことをしたとは思っていない」","en":"“You wish to condemn my actions, but I do not believe that I have done anything wrong.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"神父","displayName":"Priest","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r186","rowIndex":186,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして神父はじっと<tips=3>クリス</tips>の目を見つめる。","en":"The priest gazed steadily into <tips=3>Chris’s</tips> eyes.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r187","rowIndex":187,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=3>クリス</tips>が一瞬たじろいだように見えたのは、彼のなかでは<tips=50>路地</tips>のリストが偽であることを期待する気持ちがあったせいかもしれない。","en":"Perhaps <tips=3>Chris</tips> seemed to flinch for an instant because some part of him had hoped that <tips=50>Roji's</tips> list was false.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r188","rowIndex":188,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しかし神父は事実については否定しようとすらしなかったのである。","en":"But the priest did not even try to deny the facts.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r189","rowIndex":189,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=3>クリス</tips>とこの神父は、まだクリスが物心つく前からの知り合いだった。","en":"<tips=3>Chris</tips> had known this priest since before he was old enough to remember.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r190","rowIndex":190,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　両親もギャングではあったが一方で熱心なカトリックで、赤子だった<tips=3>クリス</tips>の額に洗礼を授けたのもこの神父なのである。そして妻との結婚式も、この教会で執り行った。","en":"Although his parents were gangsters, they were also devout Catholics, and it was this priest who had baptized <tips=3>Chris</tips> as an infant. He had also conducted Chris's wedding in this church.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r191","rowIndex":191,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　神父は普段から貧者への施しを頻繁に行い、昼夜の区別なく信者の懺悔に耳を傾け、この辺りでは人格者として尊敬を集めている。","en":"The priest frequently gave alms to the poor, listened to his parishioners' confessions at any hour of day or night, and was revered throughout the neighborhood as a man of virtue.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r192","rowIndex":192,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=3>クリス</tips>もその一人で、こうして本人が認めるまでは、実のところ半信半疑だったのだ。","en":"<tips=3>Chris</tips> was among those who revered him and, in truth, had remained half-convinced the accusation was false until the priest admitted it himself.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r193","rowIndex":193,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しかし、もう疑う余地はない。","en":"But now there was no room for doubt.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r194","rowIndex":194,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=3>クリス</tips>は唇を噛みしめながら、銃の照準を神父の頭にあわせた。","en":"Biting his lip, <tips=3>Chris</tips> trained the gun on the priest's head.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r195","rowIndex":195,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「私は、生きるためには他に何の手立てもないものだけを紹介している。……貧しき者が生きて行くにはこれしかないのだよ」","en":"“I refer only those who have no other means of survival. ...For the poor, this is the only way to go on living.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"神父","displayName":"Priest","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r196","rowIndex":196,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　神父は銃口を向けられながらも、普段のミサの時と同じような落ち着いた態度だった。","en":"Even with the gun trained on him, the priest remained as composed as he was during Mass.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r197","rowIndex":197,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「売られた子供たちがどうなるかわかってるのか？　どんな理由をつけても、貧しい人々をそそのかして命を売り渡させていることには変わらない。あんたは悪魔だ」","en":"“Do you know what happens to the children you sell? Whatever excuses you make, you're still coaxing poor people into selling their children's lives. You're a devil.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー（過去・青年）","displayName":"Chris Tse (Past, Young)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r198","rowIndex":198,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「子供たちは売られるのではない。神に捧げられるのだ。子供たちもみなそれを納得し、家族と信仰のために身を捧げるという喜びを持って、全てを理解した上で自分から家を出てゆく。家族たちも我が子の貴い信仰心を誇りに思い、その後の人生を幸福と共に過ごしてゆく。誰も破滅などしない」","en":"“The children are not sold. They are offered to God. Every one of them understands this and, rejoicing in the chance to dedicate themselves to their families and their faith, chooses to leave home of their own accord with full knowledge of everything. Their families take pride in the noble faith of their children and live out their remaining years in happiness. No one is ruined.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"神父","displayName":"Priest","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r199","rowIndex":199,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「子供が出て行く最後の日はここで家族揃って神に祈る。どの家族も、とてもおだやかで、それはいつだって愛に満ちた感動的な光景だ。そしてそれからあとの人生を、貴い殉教者の意志に感謝しながら生きてゆく。真の救済というものは、裕福に暮らすことでも、命をただ無為につなげることでもなく、その愛の光景のなかにあるのだろう。きみもそれを見れば考えが変わる」","en":"“On the final day before a child leaves, the entire family prays here together before God. Every family is perfectly serene. It is invariably a moving sight, filled with love. Then they live out the rest of their lives in gratitude for the noble martyr's resolve. True salvation lies not in living amid wealth, nor in merely prolonging life without purpose, but in that vision of love. If you witnessed it yourself, you would change your mind.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"神父","displayName":"Priest","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r200","rowIndex":200,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「反吐が出るぜ。それがあんたの結論か？」","en":"“It makes me sick. That's your conclusion?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー（過去・青年）","displayName":"Chris Tse (Past, Young)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r201","rowIndex":201,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=3>クリス</tips>、我々は獣ではないんだ。ただ生きるのではなく、信仰に正しく生きなくてはいけない。そして、いかなる人間も罪から逃げることは出来ない。だから正しい行いには苦悩はつきものなのだ。<tips=60>アダムス</tips>君だって、非常に苦しみながらこの仕事を始めたのだよ。きみのように自分の欲望のために無意味に人を殺しているわけではない」","en":"“<tips=3>Chris</tips>, we are not beasts. We must not merely live; we must live rightly by our faith. And no human being can escape sin. That is why doing what is right always brings anguish. Even Mr. <tips=60>Adams</tips> undertook this work only after great anguish. He is not like you, killing people pointlessly to satisfy his own desires.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"神父","displayName":"Priest","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r202","rowIndex":202,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=60>ロジャー・アダムス</tips>のことを前から知っているのか？　……あいつは臓器売りだったな。もしかすると、その頃からあんたは共犯者だったということか？　これは驚いたね」","en":"“Have you known <tips=60>Roger Adams</tips> for a long time? ...He used to be an organ dealer. Could it be that you were his accomplice even then? Well, that's a surprise.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー（過去・青年）","displayName":"Chris Tse (Past, Young)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r203","rowIndex":203,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「きみは少し広い視野を持った方が良い。固定観念は目を曇らせる」","en":"“You would do well to broaden your perspective. Preconceptions cloud your vision.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"神父","displayName":"Priest","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r204","rowIndex":204,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そこで神父はまた鼻を啜り、","en":"The priest sniffed again, then said,","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r205","rowIndex":205,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「駄々っ子のように、自分が嫌いなものを否定して生きゆくだけでは見えるものも見えなくなる。……きみもさまよえる羊だよ。しかし、厄介者の黒い羊だ。きみは解放と自立を街にもたらすつもりなのかもしれないが、その結果さらなる混沌が生まれ、強い者はより強く、弱い者はより弱くなり、苦しむだろう。導く者を殺してはいけない」","en":"“If you live like a petulant child, rejecting whatever you dislike, you will become blind even to what stands before you. ...You, too, are a lost sheep. A troublesome black sheep. Perhaps you intend to bring liberation and independence to this city, but the result will be still greater chaos. The strong will grow stronger, and the weak will grow weaker and suffer. You must not kill those who guide them.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"神父","displayName":"Priest","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r206","rowIndex":206,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「最後にもう一度聞いてやる。本当に、懺悔する気はないのか？」","en":"“I'll ask you one last time. Do you truly have no intention of confessing?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー（過去・青年）","displayName":"Chris Tse (Past, Young)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r207","rowIndex":207,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「きみは勘違いをしている。ゆるしの秘蹟は神に対する誠意の表明であり、こんな脅迫のために利用するものではない。……それに、私は考えるべきことはもう考え尽くした。今まで神に対し、何もしてこなかったとでも思っているのかね？」","en":"“You misunderstand. The Sacrament of Reconciliation is an expression of sincerity toward God, not something to be used for coercion such as this. ...Besides, I have already considered everything there is to consider. Do you think I have done nothing before God all these years?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"神父","displayName":"Priest","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r208","rowIndex":208,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　神父の目には沼のように深く混ざり合った感情があり、彼が長年にわたる自分の行いをどのようにとらえているのか、隠されているようだった。","en":"In the priest's eyes, emotions mingled in swamp-like depths, concealing how he regarded his own deeds over the years.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r209","rowIndex":209,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「私は命を惜しいとは思ってない。しかし、きみのために言う。殺人はやめたまえ。そんなことをしても、ただきみの手が汚れるだけで……」","en":"“I do not cling to my life. But for your sake, I tell you: stop killing. It will only stain your hands, and...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"神父","displayName":"Priest","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r210","rowIndex":210,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「説教はいらないよ。おれの温情はもう売り切れだ」","en":"“I don’t need a sermon. I’m all out of mercy.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー（過去・青年）","displayName":"Chris Tse (Past, Young)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r211","rowIndex":211,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=3>クリス</tips>は最後まで喋らせず、神父に歩み寄るとその襟元を掴み、その口に銃口を強引にねじこむ。","en":"<tips=3>Chris</tips> did not let him finish. He strode up to the priest, seized him by the collar, and forced the muzzle of the gun into his mouth.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r212","rowIndex":212,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「黒い羊で結構。おれはこの街を、気高く生きる黒い羊たちの町に変えるのさ。なあ神父よ。人間は所詮土くれだ。誇りをなくし、心を濁らせれば糞と変わらねえのさ」","en":"“A black sheep suits me fine. I'm going to turn this city into a town of black sheep who live nobly. Listen, Father. Human beings are nothing but clay in the end. Lose your pride and muddy your heart, and you're no different from shit.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー（過去・青年）","displayName":"Chris Tse (Past, Young)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r213","rowIndex":213,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=3>クリス</tips>は吐き捨てると、相手の口に突っ込んだ銃の角度を変える。","en":"<tips=3>Chris</tips> spat out the words, then changed the angle of the gun jammed into the priest's mouth.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r214","rowIndex":214,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　神父は目をつぶり、歯を食いしばって銃身を噛みしめる。<tips=3>クリス</tips>は引き金を引いた。","en":"The priest closed his eyes, clenched his teeth around the barrel, and bit down hard. <tips=3>Chris</tips> pulled the trigger.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r215","rowIndex":215,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　口の中から斜め上に向かって発射された銃弾は、頭の上半分ごと脳を吹き飛ばし、神父はドサリと音を立てて仰向けに倒れる。","en":"The bullet fired diagonally upward through his mouth blew away his brain along with the upper half of his head, and the priest fell heavily onto his back.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r216","rowIndex":216,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=3>クリス</tips>はその遺体をほとんど見ようともせず、汚れた銃口をハンカチで拭うと携帯電話を取り出した。","en":"<tips=3>Chris</tips> scarcely looked at the body. He wiped the fouled muzzle with a handkerchief, then took out his mobile phone.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r217","rowIndex":217,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どうやらリストは本物らしい。おれはすぐに帰る。みんなを事務所に呼び集めろ」","en":"“It looks like the list is genuine. I'll be right back. Call everyone to the office.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r218","rowIndex":218,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=3>クリス</tips>はそれだけ言うと携帯をしまい、早足で礼拝堂を出て行く。","en":"<tips=3>Chris</tips> put away the phone after saying that and hurried out of the chapel.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r219","rowIndex":219,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　少年は驚きと恐怖で身体が凍り付き、物陰で震えながら、その後ろ姿を見送った。","en":"Frozen with shock and terror, the boy trembled in hiding and watched him go.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r220","rowIndex":220,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　神父の死は教会に通う信徒たちに多少の動揺を与えた。","en":"The priest's death unsettled the congregation.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r221","rowIndex":221,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　人に慕われる聖職者が異教徒や薬物中毒者に殺されることはこの街では少なくなかったので、またそういったやりきれない事件が起きたのだろうと人々は噂した。","en":"It was not uncommon in this city for a beloved clergyman to be killed by an adherent of another faith or a drug addict, so people assumed that another such grim tragedy had occurred.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r222","rowIndex":222,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして、神父は篤実な人格者として埋葬された。","en":"The priest was buried as a man of steadfast virtue.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r223","rowIndex":223,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　後日<tips=18>ローズ・クラブ</tips>の人買いのリストが公開されたが、そこにあるはずの彼の名は削り取られており、彼の行っていた人買いの事実は長年明らかにされることはなかった。<tips=3>クリス</tips>が消したようだ。","en":"A list of the <tips=18>Rose Club's</tips> Man Buyers was released later, but his name, which should have appeared on it, had been removed. For years, the fact that he had trafficked people remained unknown. It appears that <tips=3>Chris</tips> erased it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r224","rowIndex":224,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　死後神父の名声が傷つけられることを避けるためにそうしたのか、それとも別の意図があったのか、誰も知る由がない。","en":"No one could know whether he did so to keep the priest's reputation from being tarnished after his death, or whether he had some other intent.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r225","rowIndex":225,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　全ての準備が済み、いよいよ<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>による<tips=18>ローズ・クラブ</tips>壊滅作戦がはじまった。","en":"With every preparation complete, <tips=7>YS's</tips> operation to destroy the <tips=18>Rose Club</tips> finally began.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r226","rowIndex":226,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それに先立って<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>結成の事実が<tips=9>Y地区</tips>内の各組織に通達される。ここまで水面下で進めていたこの盟約をここで公開したのは、<tips=9>Y地区</tips>内に多数存在する<tips=68>木下組</tips>派の組織を牽制するためだった。","en":"Beforehand, every organization in <tips=9>Y District</tips> was notified of the formation of <tips=7>YS</tips>. The alliance had been developed in secrecy until then; disclosing it now was intended to deter the numerous organizations in <tips=9>Y District</tips> that supported the <tips=68>Kinoshita-gumi</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r227","rowIndex":227,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　事実、<tips=9>Y地区</tips>史上最大のギャング組織の誕生を知らされた組織のいくつかは木下組への態度を変化させた。","en":"Indeed, several organizations changed their position toward the Kinoshita-gumi after learning that the largest gang organization in <tips=9>Y District's</tips> history had been formed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r228","rowIndex":228,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　組織の規模としては<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>よりも<tips=68>木下組</tips>の方がはるかに大きかったが、<tips=9>Y地区</tips>内の話に限れば<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>に対抗出来る勢力はひとつも存在しないのだ。","en":"The <tips=68>Kinoshita-gumi</tips> remained far larger than <tips=7>YS</tips> as an organization, but within <tips=9>Y District</tips> itself, no power could oppose <tips=7>YS</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r229","rowIndex":229,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>の<tips=81>龍頭</tips><tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>はこの勢力を背景に<tips=68>木下組</tips>に、<tips=9>Y地区</tips>からの撤退と、<tips=18>ローズ・クラブ</tips>の閉鎖を要求し、そのための会談の場を求めた。","en":"Backed by this strength, <tips=3>Chris Tse</tips>, <tips=81>Longtou</tips> of <tips=7>YS</tips>, demanded that the <tips=68>Kinoshita-gumi</tips> withdraw from <tips=9>Y District</tips> and close the <tips=18>Rose Club</tips>, and requested a meeting to discuss those terms.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r230","rowIndex":230,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　木下組はこの要求を黙殺した。","en":"The Kinoshita-gumi ignored the demand.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r231","rowIndex":231,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=68>木下組</tips>からすれば<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>といえども移民の寄せ集めの烏合の衆でしかなく、若い<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>はチンピラ同然の存在で、その強硬な態度も気に障るものでしかなかったのだろう。","en":"In the eyes of the <tips=68>Kinoshita-gumi</tips>, even <tips=7>YS</tips> was nothing more than a disorganized mob of immigrants. The young <tips=3>Chris Tse</tips> was little better than a common hoodlum, and his aggressive manner apparently did nothing but irritate them.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r232","rowIndex":232,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　相手が無視を決め込んだのを見て、<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>は<tips=50>路地</tips>からあずかった『人買い』のリストを公開した。雑誌社や新聞社にも同じものを送ったが、当時は記事にされなかった。信用性が低いと判断されたのか、それとも裏社会に踏み込むことを恐れたのかはわからない。","en":"Seeing that the other side had decided to ignore him, <tips=3>Chris Tse</tips> released the list of “Man Buyers” entrusted to him by <tips=50>Roji</tips>. He also sent the same material to magazines and newspapers, but they did not report it at the time. Whether they judged it unreliable or feared venturing into the underworld is unknown.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r233","rowIndex":233,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　このリストはインターネット上にもばらまかれた。メディアが記事にしなくとも、これによって<tips=9>Y地区</tips>の多くの人々に知られることとなる。","en":"The list was also spread across the internet. Even without media coverage, it consequently became known to many people in <tips=9>Y District</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r234","rowIndex":234,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　組織ぐるみで<tips=18>ローズ・クラブ</tips>に加担し、人を売りさばいていたギャングの存在が明らかになった。結果、リストに名前が掲載されたものは住民の猛烈な反発を招くこととなり、その一人が路上で死体となって発見される事件も発生した。","en":"The release exposed entire gangs that had helped the <tips=18>Rose Club</tips> traffic people. As a result, those named on the list faced a fierce backlash from local residents, and one of them was found dead in the street.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r235","rowIndex":235,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　こうしてとりまく状況が変わると、<tips=68>木下組</tips>も、もはや黙ってはいられなかった。クリス宛に、敵対行動をやめるよう求めた書面が届く。もちろん<tips=3>クリス</tips>は受け入れない。再度<tips=9>Y地区</tips>からの撤退を求めてリーダー同士の面会を提案したが、<tips=68>木下組</tips>はやはり拒否した。","en":"Once the surrounding circumstances changed in this way, the <tips=68>Kinoshita-gumi</tips> could no longer remain silent. <tips=3>Chris</tips> received a written demand that he cease his hostile activity. Naturally, he refused. He again called for their withdrawal from <tips=9>Y District</tips> and proposed a meeting between the leaders, but the <tips=68>Kinoshita-gumi</tips> rejected the proposal once more.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r236","rowIndex":236,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=68>木下組</tips>はこうした書面のやりとりの前後で、二度ほど<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>殺害のためのヒットマンを送り込んでいたが、いずれも事前に発見され、殺害されている。","en":"Around the time of this correspondence, the <tips=68>Kinoshita-gumi</tips> twice sent hitmen to kill <tips=3>Chris Tse</tips>, but both were detected in advance, and the hitmen were killed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r237","rowIndex":237,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=39>ジェフリー・ウォン</tips>の二人の娘と、<tips=81>龍頭</tips><tips=3>クリス</tips>自身のサイキック能力は安易な襲撃者を見つけ出すことが出来る。そして、スパイや工作目的の人間は<tips=5>太刀川</tips>によって発見された。","en":"The psychic powers of <tips=39>Jeffrey Wong's</tips> two daughters and <tips=81>Longtou</tips> <tips=3>Chris</tips> himself could detect any would-be attacker who approached them incautiously. Spies and covert operatives were detected by <tips=5>Tachikawa</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r238","rowIndex":238,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=9>Y地区</tips>はこの<tips=69>義勝</tips>のメンバー以外にも強力なサイキックが存在する。","en":"<tips=9>Y District</tips> was home to powerful psychics besides these members of <tips=69>Yisheng</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r239","rowIndex":239,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼らとの戦いは普通のやりかたでは通用しない。","en":"Ordinary methods would not work in a fight against them.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r240","rowIndex":240,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=68>木下組</tips>は自分たちが相手にしているのが普通の人間ではないと、今まで認識していないわけではなかったが、改めて再認識させられることとなった。","en":"The <tips=68>Kinoshita-gumi</tips> had not been altogether unaware that its opponents were no ordinary people, but now it was forced to recognize that fact anew.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r241","rowIndex":241,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=68>木下組</tips>が窮する一方で、<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>にはさらに好ましい状況の変化が訪れていた。","en":"Even as the <tips=68>Kinoshita-gumi</tips> found itself in straits, events took another favorable turn for <tips=7>YS</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r242","rowIndex":242,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=21>八龍会</tips>から協力を表明する書面が届いたのである。","en":"A letter arrived from the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips> declaring its support.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r243","rowIndex":243,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=21>八龍会</tips>とは<tips=9>Y地区</tips>に住む<tips=17>タイプＢ</tips>らの秘密組織の名称だ。三人の老人によってとりまとめられ、メンバーは国籍、民族、社会的地位にかかわらずあちこちに存在し、その実態は誰にも掴むことが出来ない。","en":"The <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips> was the name of a secret organization of <tips=17>Type Bs</tips> living throughout <tips=9>Y District</tips>. Three old men coordinated the group, whose members could be found everywhere without regard to nationality, ethnicity, or social position. No one could grasp its true extent.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r244","rowIndex":244,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　本来は<tips=17>タイプＢ</tips>同士の支え合いが主な役割であるから表立った活動をすることは滅多になく、その総数は把握されていなかったが、<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>が出来る前までは間違いなく最大の組織であったろう。","en":"Its principal role was mutual support among <tips=17>Type Bs</tips>, and it rarely acted in public. Its total membership remained unknown, but before the creation of <tips=7>YS</tips>, it would unquestionably have been the largest organization in the district.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r245","rowIndex":245,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その<tips=21>八龍会</tips>が、<tips=68>木下組</tips>排除に取り組む<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>に賛同の意を表明したのである。","en":"Now the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips> had declared its approval of <tips=7>YS’s</tips> campaign to expel the <tips=68>Kinoshita-gumi</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r246","rowIndex":246,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=21>八龍会</tips>は<tips=17>タイプＢ</tips>の組織であるため当然薬物を取り扱っており、<tips=9>Y地区</tips>で麻薬を売ろうとしている<tips=68>木下組</tips>と利害が対立している。だから、妨害はされないだろうと<tips=3>クリス</tips>たちも想像してはいたのだが、ギャングとはいつも一線を引いていた彼らがわざわざ書面を送りつけて来るとは想像もしていなかった。","en":"As a <tips=17>Type B</tips> organization, the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips> naturally dealt in drugs, so its interests clashed with those of the <tips=68>Kinoshita-gumi</tips>, which intended to sell narcotics in <tips=9>Y District</tips>. <tips=3>Chris</tips> and his people had therefore assumed the Society would not stand in their way. They had never imagined, however, that an organization which always kept the gangs at arm's length would go so far as to send them a letter.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r247","rowIndex":247,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ともかく、これで懸念材料がひとつ消えることとなり、彼らはいよいよ作戦の最終局面に踏み出すのである。","en":"In any event, one source of concern had now disappeared, and they advanced at last into the final stage of their operation.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r248","rowIndex":248,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=69>義勝</tips>が元々得意としていた抗争の手段。つまり、<tips=18>ローズ・クラブ</tips>を武力的に襲撃しようというのだ。","en":"They would resort to the form of gang warfare at which <tips=69>Yisheng</tips> had always excelled: an armed assault on the <tips=18>Rose Club</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r249","rowIndex":249,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　目的はオーナーの<tips=60>ロジャー・アダムス</tips>並びに主立った重役たちの殺害。","en":"The objective: to kill the owner, <tips=60>Roger Adams</tips>, and the principal executives.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r250","rowIndex":250,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　クラブで重役会議が行われる日を選び、襲撃部隊を送り込んで一網打尽にする。","en":"They would choose a day when the club held an executive meeting and send in an assault force to eliminate them all at once.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r251","rowIndex":251,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その襲撃部隊は、<tips=76>旧義勝</tips>のメンバーで構成された。他の組織が人員を出し渋ったというよりも、<tips=3>クリス</tips>があらかじめ決めていたことだった。","en":"The assault force was composed of members of the <tips=76>old Yisheng</tips>. This was not so much because the other organizations hesitated to supply personnel as because <tips=3>Chris</tips> had decided the matter in advance.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r252","rowIndex":252,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　活きの良い若い者を選び、軍隊顔負けの装備が与えられ、襲撃の二週間ほど前から合宿をして全員に扱い方を覚えさせ、<tips=18>ローズ・クラブ</tips>の見取り図を使って作戦の確認をした。","en":"They selected promising young men, issued them equipment that would have put an army to shame, and brought them into a training camp roughly two weeks before the assault. There they learned to use every item and rehearsed the operation with floor plans of the <tips=18>Rose Club</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r253","rowIndex":253,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　用意された銃器は、各国の陸軍歩兵が主力の武器とするアサルトライフルよりは小型で扱いやすく、テロリストなどがよく使うことで有名なスコーピオンなどの短機関銃よりは威力と射程のある銃器である。","en":"The firearms supplied to them were smaller and easier to handle than the assault rifles used as primary weapons by infantrymen in armies around the world, yet offered greater power and range than submachine guns such as the Skorpion, a weapon famous for its use by terrorists.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r254","rowIndex":254,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　具体的に言うとH&K MP7という銃で、小型で携行しやすく、反動も小さめで精度も高くて扱いやすい。特殊部隊などにも良く使用される、高性能の武器である。","en":"Specifically, the men received H&K MP7s: compact and easy to carry, with modest recoil, high accuracy, and easy handling. Frequently used by special forces, they were high-performance weapons.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r255","rowIndex":255,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　教官となったのは<tips=27>廖志明</tips>のボディーガードで、経歴は不明だが、どこかの国で軍隊経験があるという人物だった。","en":"Their instructor was <tips=27>Liao Chi-ming's</tips> bodyguard. His background was unknown, but he was said to have served in some country's military.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r256","rowIndex":256,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼が集団での動き方から、作戦の修正まで、細かく指導を行った。","en":"He trained them meticulously in everything from coordinated movement to refining the operational plan.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r257","rowIndex":257,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そうして、襲撃の日がやって来る。","en":"And so the day of the assault arrived.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r258","rowIndex":258,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　昼頃、<tips=9>Y地区</tips>郊外にある空き家に襲撃部隊が集まって作戦の最終確認が行われた。","en":"Around noon, the assault force gathered at an empty house on the outskirts of <tips=9>Y District</tips> and conducted a final review of the plan.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r259","rowIndex":259,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それが済むと、みなケブラー素材の黒いボディアーマーを着込み、各自銃や弾丸を確認する。","en":"Once that was complete, each donned black Kevlar body armor and checked his own weapon and ammunition.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r260","rowIndex":260,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　用意されたものを全て装備すると街のギャングというよりも軍隊の特殊部隊のような姿になった。","en":"Fully equipped with everything prepared for them, they looked less like a city gang than a military special-forces unit.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r261","rowIndex":261,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ここには組織の主要メンバーも参加している。","en":"The organization's principal members were also taking part.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r262","rowIndex":262,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=39>ジェフリー</tips>の顔があり、<tips=4>馬明</tips>の顔があった。そして<tips=5>太刀川</tips>もたっての願いで同行している。","en":"<tips=39>Jeffrey</tips> was there, as was <tips=4>Ma Ming</tips>. At his own earnest insistence, <tips=5>Tachikawa</tips> accompanied them as well.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r263","rowIndex":263,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ドクター、本当に襲撃に行くつもりなのかい？」","en":"“Doctor, do you really mean to take part in the assault?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー（過去・青年）","displayName":"Chris Tse (Past, Young)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r264","rowIndex":264,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=3>クリス</tips>がとても信じられないという風に笑いながら問いかけると、","en":"Laughing in utter disbelief, <tips=3>Chris</tips> asked,","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r265","rowIndex":265,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「行きます。今日は行かなくてはならないのです」","en":"“I am. Today, I have to go.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"太刀川良馬ペスト仮面","displayName":"Ryoma Tachikawa (Plague Mask)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r266","rowIndex":266,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=5>太刀川</tips>はまじめくさった声色で言った。いつものマスクをつけているので、どんな表情をしているのかは誰にも見えなかったが、きっと声と同様、数学教師のようにまじめくさった顔をしているのだろう。","en":"<tips=5>Tachikawa</tips> spoke in a solemn voice. His customary mask concealed his expression from everyone, but it was doubtless as solemn as his tone—the face of a serious mathematics teacher.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r267","rowIndex":267,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「例の女なら、おれがちゃんと確認しておくから、慣れないことはしないほうがいい」","en":"“If it's that woman you're worried about, I'll make sure to check on her, so you shouldn't do anything you're not used to.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー（過去・青年）","displayName":"Chris Tse (Past, Young)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r268","rowIndex":268,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いえ、すべての現実を、この目で見たいのです。そうでなければ意味がありませんから」","en":"“No. I want to see the reality of it all with my own eyes. Otherwise, there would be no point.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"太刀川良馬ペスト仮面","displayName":"Ryoma Tachikawa (Plague Mask)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r269","rowIndex":269,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=5>太刀川</tips>は一歩も譲る気がない強い口調だった。","en":"<tips=5>Tachikawa's</tips> forceful tone made it clear that he would not yield an inch.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r270","rowIndex":270,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうか。……じゃあ、ずっとおれの近くに居てくれ。くれぐれも無茶をして怪我なんぞしてくれるなよ」","en":"“I see. ...Then stay close to me at all times. And whatever you do, don't act recklessly and get yourself hurt.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー（過去・青年）","displayName":"Chris Tse (Past, Young)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r271","rowIndex":271,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=3>クリス</tips>は言って、武器を持つのを嫌がる<tips=5>太刀川</tips>に無理矢理一丁の拳銃を押しつけた。","en":"With that, <tips=3>Chris</tips> pressed a handgun on <tips=5>Tachikawa</tips> despite his reluctance to carry a weapon.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r272","rowIndex":272,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「この仕事が片付いたら、正式に<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>のメンバーにならないか？　今後もおれの片腕としてフォローをしてほしい」","en":"“When this job is over, how about becoming a full member of <tips=7>YS</tips>? I want you to keep backing me up as my right-hand man.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー（過去・青年）","displayName":"Chris Tse (Past, Young)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r273","rowIndex":273,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=3>クリス</tips>は能力を恐れずに、マスクの奥の<tips=5>太刀川</tips>の目をじっと見つめた。","en":"Unafraid of <tips=5>Tachikawa's</tips> power, <tips=3>Chris</tips> stared into his eyes behind the mask.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r274","rowIndex":274,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「メンバーに？」","en":"“A member?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"太刀川良馬ペスト仮面","displayName":"Ryoma Tachikawa (Plague Mask)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r275","rowIndex":275,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうだ。誰も文句は言わないよ。ドクターの能力も、責任感のある人柄も、みな認めている。これから組織が大きくなれば、あんたの力はもっと重要なものになるだろう。条件はなんでも言ってくれ。あんたが望むなら、どんなことでも出来うるかぎり応えたい」","en":"“That's right. No one will object. Everyone recognizes both your abilities and your responsible character. As the organization grows, your power will become even more important. Name whatever terms you like. Whatever you want, I'll do everything in my power to meet them.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー（過去・青年）","displayName":"Chris Tse (Past, Young)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r276","rowIndex":276,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それは……」","en":"“I...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"太刀川良馬ペスト仮面","displayName":"Ryoma Tachikawa (Plague Mask)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r277","rowIndex":277,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「返事は今すぐにとは言わない。考えておいてくれ」","en":"“You don’t have to answer immediately. Think about it.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー（過去・青年）","displayName":"Chris Tse (Past, Young)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r278","rowIndex":278,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=3>クリス</tips>はそう言うと、唇の端を歪めて笑った。","en":"<tips=3>Chris</tips> twisted one corner of his mouth into a smile.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r279","rowIndex":279,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そうしてすべての準備が整うと、<tips=3>クリス</tips>は一同の前に立ち、激励の言葉を述べた。","en":"Once all preparations were complete, <tips=3>Chris</tips> stood before the assembled men and addressed them with a few words of encouragement.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r280","rowIndex":280,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「この夜に、おれたちの今後の運命がかかっている！　心して戦えよ！　帰って来たら、全員に<tips=59>暗闇通り</tips>のなかでもよりすぐりの女を抱かせてやるからな！」","en":"“Our future rides on tonight! Keep that in mind when you fight! When you get back, I'll see that every last one of you gets to bed one of the finest women on <tips=59>Darkness Street</tips>!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r281","rowIndex":281,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その言葉に一同は歓声を上げて反応をする。その多くは、前回の抗争の時もクリスと共に戦った者ばかりであった。彼らはみな興奮剤の『ピーク』によって目がぎらぎらとしている。なかには副作用で鼻血を出し、ちり紙を鼻孔に詰め込んでいるものもいた。","en":"The men answered with a cheer. Most had fought beside Chris in the previous war. Their eyes now glittered under the influence of the stimulant Peak. Some suffered nosebleeds as a side effect and had stuffed twists of tissue into their nostrils.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r282","rowIndex":282,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=3>クリス</tips>はやがて組織からドラッグの完全排除に乗り出すことになるが、この頃は彼らの組織のなかでも徹底されてはいなかったし、そもそも『ピーク』はいわゆる覚醒剤や麻薬の類には数えられていなかった。","en":"<tips=3>Chris</tips> would eventually set about purging drugs completely from the organization, but in those days the policy was not yet consistently enforced even among his own people. Besides, Peak was not considered a stimulant or narcotic in the usual sense.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r283","rowIndex":283,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして五台の車に分乗し、<tips=18>ローズ・クラブ</tips>へ向かって出発する。","en":"They divided themselves among five vehicles and departed for the <tips=18>Rose Club</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r284","rowIndex":284,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　クリスと太刀川が乗った車は、施設の裏側にまわって林の中で停車する。車を降りて、そこからは徒歩で進む。","en":"The vehicle carrying Chris and Tachikawa circled behind the facility and stopped in the woods. They disembarked and continued on foot.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r285","rowIndex":285,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　すると、以前に<tips=87>ベルーハ</tips>を伴って<tips=3>クリス</tips>と<tips=5>太刀川</tips>の二人で逃げた、あの通用門が見えて来る。","en":"Before long, they saw the service gate through which <tips=3>Chris</tips> and <tips=5>Tachikawa</tips> had once escaped with <tips=87>Belukha</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r286","rowIndex":286,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「この林には鴨が来るんだよ。昔はよくパチンコで打って、売ったり食ったりしたよ。羽をむしって焚き火で丸焼きにするとうまいんだ」","en":"“Ducks come to these woods. I often shot them with a slingshot in the old days, then sold or ate them. They're delicious when you pluck the feathers and roast them whole over a fire.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r287","rowIndex":287,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=3>クリス</tips>は黒い木々を見上げながらそんな話をした。","en":"<tips=3>Chris</tips> told the story while looking up at the black trees.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r288","rowIndex":288,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いいか、くれぐれも客は殺すなよ。ややこしくなるからな。身分証だけ頂いたら逃がすんだ」","en":"“Listen: whatever you do, don't kill the customers. It'll make things complicated. Take their identification and let them run.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r289","rowIndex":289,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　最後にクリスがそう念を押して、部下たちはそれぞれの持ち場に散った。","en":"With that final reminder from Chris, his men scattered to their respective positions.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r290","rowIndex":290,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　襲撃チームは総員２０名。","en":"The assault team numbered twenty in all.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r291","rowIndex":291,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=3>クリス</tips>と<tips=5>太刀川</tips>を含むこちらの５人は別働隊で、残りの１５人の主力部隊は<tips=4>馬明</tips>が隊長となり、正面から侵入をする手はずになっている。","en":"This party of five, including <tips=3>Chris</tips> and <tips=5>Tachikawa</tips>, formed a detached unit. The remaining fifteen constituted the main force, with <tips=4>Ma Ming</tips> as their captain, and were to enter through the front.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r292","rowIndex":292,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　施設に入った後は、<tips=4>馬明</tips>たちは三つの班に分かれて下の階から順々に制圧し、<tips=3>クリス</tips>たち別働隊は一直線で最上階の重役室を目指して<tips=60>ロジャー・アダムス</tips>たちの命を狙う。","en":"Once inside the facility, <tips=4>Ma Ming's</tips> men would divide into three squads and secure it floor by floor from the bottom. <tips=3>Chris's</tips> detached unit would head straight for the executive rooms on the top floor to kill <tips=60>Roger Adams</tips> and the others.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r293","rowIndex":293,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　時刻は十八時。","en":"It was 6:00 p.m.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r294","rowIndex":294,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　日が暮れて、人家の少ないこのあたりはもう真っ暗になっている。","en":"The sun had set, and this sparsely inhabited area was already pitch-dark.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r295","rowIndex":295,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=5>太刀川</tips>は藪のなかに潜んで、<tips=4>馬明</tips>たちからの合図を待っていた。","en":"Concealed in the brush, <tips=5>Tachikawa</tips> waited for the signal from <tips=4>Ma Ming's</tips> group.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r296","rowIndex":296,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　隣で<tips=3>クリス</tips>がガムを噛み、くっちゃくっちゃと音がする。","en":"<tips=3>Chris</tips> chewed gum beside him, filling the silence with wet smacks.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r297","rowIndex":297,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　予定では十八時三十分に作戦を開始することになっていた。","en":"The operation was scheduled to begin at half past six.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r298","rowIndex":298,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　まだ時間が残っている。","en":"There was still time.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r299","rowIndex":299,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=18>ローズ・クラブ</tips>の方を眺めると、下品なほどに壮麗な建物が、窓明かりやら照明やらの赤や黄色で、子供の頃に見た夜祭りの山車を思い出させるように、闇の中、ぼうっと浮かびあがっていた。","en":"When Tachikawa looked toward the <tips=18>Rose Club</tips>, the building floated hazily out of the darkness in the red and yellow glow of its windows and lights. Its magnificence bordered on vulgarity, reminding him of the night-festival floats he had seen as a child.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r300","rowIndex":300,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　時間丁度に<tips=4>馬明</tips>たちは動き出す。","en":"<tips=4>Ma Ming's</tips> men moved at precisely the appointed time.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r301","rowIndex":301,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　まず一台の車が施設の目の前まで行って停まり、三人のメンバーが降りる。彼らは目出し帽をかぶらずに素顔のままで、私服の下に薄い防弾チョッキを身につけた軽装で、銃はバッグに隠していた。","en":"First, a single vehicle drove directly in front of the facility and stopped. Three members stepped out. They wore no balaclavas, leaving their faces exposed, and were lightly equipped: thin bulletproof vests beneath their everyday clothes, with their guns concealed in bags.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r302","rowIndex":302,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「申し訳ありませんが、駐車場はあちらになっております」","en":"“I’m sorry, but the parking lot is over there.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r303","rowIndex":303,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうなのかい。でも、先に受け付けを済ませることは出来ないかな？」","en":"“Is it? Couldn’t we check in first?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r304","rowIndex":304,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　一人が職員たちに笑顔で話しかけ、メンバーカードを取り出す振りをして、そしておもむろに銃を出し、受付に向ける。","en":"One man smiled as he addressed the staff. He pretended to reach for a membership card, then deliberately produced his gun and pointed it toward the reception desk.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r305","rowIndex":305,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　受付は血相を変えてカウンターの下にある銃に手を伸ばそうとするが間に合わず、銃口からダダダダと、連続した銃声がなってそのまま蜂の巣にされる。","en":"The receptionist's face contorted in alarm. He reached for the gun beneath the counter, but too late. A burst of automatic fire rattled from the muzzle and riddled him with bullets where he stood.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r306","rowIndex":306,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　門の側にいる二人の警備員も、胸元から拳銃を取り出して発砲しようとするが、構えただけで発射には至れず、血を噴いて土の上に倒れる。","en":"The two guards beside the gate also drew handguns from inside their jackets and attempted to fire. They managed only to raise the weapons before blood erupted from their bodies and they fell to the ground.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r307","rowIndex":307,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それを合図に、残りの車がやって来て門の前に停まり、目出し帽をかぶって銃を抱えた男たちが次々とドアを開けて飛び出してくる。","en":"At this signal, the remaining vehicles arrived and stopped before the gate. Men in balaclavas, guns clutched in their hands, flung open the doors and poured out one after another.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r308","rowIndex":308,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「行け！　進め！」","en":"“Go! Move!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r309","rowIndex":309,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　銃の他に、腰に青竜刀をぶら下げているのは<tips=4>馬明</tips>で、仲間を叱咤しながら自らも走り出す。","en":"<tips=4>Ma Ming</tips> alone wore a Chinese broadsword at his waist in addition to his gun. Urging his men on, he charged forward with them.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r310","rowIndex":310,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　部下の一人が銃口の大きな信号拳銃を取り出して夜空に向かって構えると、まばゆく輝く照明弾を打ち出した。これが、作戦が開始されたことを<tips=3>クリス</tips>たち別働隊に伝える合図であった。","en":"One subordinate drew a large-bore signal pistol and aimed it into the night sky, firing a blindingly bright flare. This signaled to <tips=3>Chris's</tips> detached unit that the operation had begun.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r311","rowIndex":311,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それと同時に<tips=3>クリス</tips>たちも動き出す。彼らが手にした銃は<tips=4>馬明</tips>たちのものと同じH&K MP7だが、こちらは先端に黒い筒状のサプレッサーが装着されていた。","en":"<tips=3>Chris's</tips> group moved at the same moment. They carried the same H&K MP7s as <tips=4>Ma Ming's</tips> men, but a black cylindrical suppressor had been fitted to each barrel.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r312","rowIndex":312,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　外の見張りは正面の方に駆けつけており無人だった。","en":"The exterior guards had run toward the front, leaving the area deserted.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r313","rowIndex":313,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　覆面を被った黒ずくめの五人は通用門に近づき、門の脇のドアの鍵を銃で撃って破壊して、敷地の中へ侵入する。","en":"The five black-clad, masked men approached the service gate, shot apart the lock on the door beside it, and entered the grounds.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r314","rowIndex":314,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「はいってすぐのところで清掃員が片付けをしている。武装はしていないようだ。おれが先行するから続け。発砲はするな」","en":"“A cleaner is tidying up just inside. She doesn't appear to be armed. I'll go first; follow me. Don't fire.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r315","rowIndex":315,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=3>クリス</tips>が呟くと、他のメンバーは頷く。","en":"<tips=3>Chris</tips> murmured the instructions, and the other members nodded.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r316","rowIndex":316,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=3>クリス</tips>は建物の裏側にあるドアのノブを慎重に捻って、そのなかに身体を滑り込ませる。","en":"<tips=3>Chris</tips> carefully turned the knob of a door at the back of the building and slipped inside.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r317","rowIndex":317,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その部屋には彼が前もって伝えていたとおり、作業服を着た清掃係の中年女がゴミ袋の口を縛っていた。","en":"Just as Chris had told them beforehand, a middle-aged cleaner in work clothes stood in the room, tying shut a garbage bag.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r318","rowIndex":318,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ひっ」","en":"“Eek!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r319","rowIndex":319,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　なだれ込んできた黒衣の五人の姿を見て、女は顔を歪める。","en":"The woman’s face twisted at the sight of five black-clad men flooding into the room.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r320","rowIndex":320,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「動くな。抵抗したら撃つ」","en":"“Don't move. Resist, and I'll shoot.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r321","rowIndex":321,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いっ、命だけは……」","en":"“P-please, spare my life...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r322","rowIndex":322,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「安心しろ。大人しく従えば命までは奪わない」","en":"“Don’t worry. Do as you’re told, and we won’t kill you.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r323","rowIndex":323,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=3>クリス</tips>が銃で脅しつけ、残りのメンバーで清掃員を縛り上げると、その口に黒いガムテープを貼った。","en":"<tips=3>Chris</tips> held her at gunpoint while the other members bound her, then sealed her mouth with black duct tape.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r324","rowIndex":324,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　下働きの人間は地域の一般市民がほとんどなので、余裕があるかぎりは極力殺害しないというのが今回の方針だ。","en":"Most menial workers were ordinary residents of the district, so the policy for this operation was to avoid killing them whenever circumstances allowed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r325","rowIndex":325,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　武器を持った人間と、抵抗する人間、それとマネージャークラス以上の職員は問答無用で射殺する。職員の役職は、バラをかたどった胸のバッジを見れば判別がつく。","en":"Anyone carrying a weapon, anyone who resisted, and any employee of managerial rank or above would be shot without question. An employee's rank could be identified by the rose-shaped badge on their chest.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r326","rowIndex":326,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=3>クリス</tips>たちの行くルートは、ちょうど、この間<tips=32>アサヒ</tips>こと<tips=87>ベルーハ</tips>を逃がすときに使った経路を遡ったものとなる。","en":"The route <tips=3>Chris</tips> and the others would take was the exact reverse of the one they had used not long before to help <tips=32>Asahi</tips>, also known as <tips=87>Belukha</tips>, escape.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r327","rowIndex":327,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　裏階段を使って十階のプラチナフロアまで上がり、そこから別の階段で一つ上の階に行けば管理職たちのビジネスフロアになる。","en":"They would use the rear staircase to climb to the Platinum floor on the tenth story, then take a different staircase up one more level to the business floor occupied by management.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r328","rowIndex":328,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　最重要ターゲットの<tips=60>ロジャー・アダムス</tips>たちは今そこに集まっているはずだ。","en":"<tips=60>Roger Adams</tips> and the other highest-priority targets should be gathered there now.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r329","rowIndex":329,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　裏階段を上っていると、馬明たちの暴れる銃声の音と、女の悲鳴などが壁越しに聞こえてくる。そのたびに<tips=3>クリス</tips>は振り向き、彼にしか見えない壁の向こうの状態を確認する。別働隊の<tips=4>馬明</tips>たちも順調に作戦をこなしているようだった。","en":"As they climbed the rear stairs, they could hear Ma Ming's men firing wildly and women screaming beyond the walls. Each time, <tips=3>Chris</tips> turned and checked what was happening on the other side, a sight only he could see. <tips=4>Ma Ming's</tips> detached force appeared to be proceeding smoothly as well.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r330","rowIndex":330,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　十階を階段で駆け上がるのはそれなりに労が要る。","en":"Running up ten floors demanded considerable effort.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r331","rowIndex":331,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　急がなければいけないが、駆け足になれば息が切れてしまう。","en":"They needed to hurry, but a full sprint would leave them breathless.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r332","rowIndex":332,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　焦らず黙々と上っていると、<tips=5>太刀川</tips>の身体はじっとりと汗ばみ、分厚い装備の下で蒸れて不快だった。","en":"As they climbed steadily without rushing, <tips=5>Tachikawa's</tips> body grew slick with sweat, hot and clammy beneath his heavy gear.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r333","rowIndex":333,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　こうした場における<tips=3>クリス</tips>というのはほとんど万能の働きを発揮する。","en":"In circumstances of this kind, <tips=3>Chris</tips> displayed an almost superhuman competence.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r334","rowIndex":334,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　四階を過ぎたところでふと立ち止まり、上の階のドアに向かって発砲をした。","en":"Just after passing the fourth floor, he abruptly stopped and fired at the door on the floor above.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r335","rowIndex":335,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　銃はサプレッサーをつけているとは言え、音が消えるわけではなく、銃声が階段中に響き渡る。","en":"The suppressor did not eliminate the sound, and the shots rang throughout the stairwell.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r336","rowIndex":336,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　銃を撃ち終わると<tips=3>クリス</tips>は自ら階段を駆け上がって、驚く仲間たちに得意げにドアを開いて見せた。その先には、拳銃を握った二人の男が頭を撃ち抜かれて倒れている。","en":"Once he finished firing, <tips=3>Chris</tips> personally ran up the stairs and proudly opened the door for his startled companions. Beyond it lay two men with handguns in their fists and bullets through their heads.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r337","rowIndex":337,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　万事この調子であり、自分で発見し自分で処理をする。","en":"Everything proceeded in this fashion: Chris discovered every threat and dealt with it himself.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r338","rowIndex":338,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　他の面々は彼の後をついてその指示に従うだけでほとんど何もする必要がなかった。","en":"The others needed to do almost nothing but follow him and obey his instructions.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r339","rowIndex":339,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　一方、<tips=18>ローズ・クラブ</tips>側は完全に混乱していた。","en":"The <tips=18>Rose Club</tips>, meanwhile, had descended into complete confusion.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r340","rowIndex":340,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その日の会議に参加していたのは六人。オーナー社長である<tips=60>ロジャー・アダムス</tips>の他も、組織の役員ばかりであった。","en":"Six people attended the meeting that day. Apart from <tips=60>Roger Adams</tips>, the owner and president, every participant was an officer of the organization.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r341","rowIndex":341,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その日の定例会議は、出席者にあくびが目立つようなゆるんだ空気のなか、最近の芳しくない収支報告について議論が行われていた。といっても、<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>の妨害活動が原因であるのだが、それに対処するのは<tips=68>木下組</tips>であり、<tips=18>ローズ・クラブ</tips>側で出来ることはない。","en":"The day's regular meeting proceeded in a listless atmosphere, punctuated by yawns, as they discussed the recent poor financial results. The cause, of course, was <tips=7>YS's</tips> campaign of obstruction. But dealing with it was up to the <tips=68>Kinoshita-gumi</tips>; there was nothing the <tips=18>Rose Club</tips> itself could do.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r342","rowIndex":342,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　決定的な対処法がないのはみなわかっているのだ。","en":"Everyone knew there was no decisive remedy available to them.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r343","rowIndex":343,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その停滞した雰囲気を破って、血相を変えたチーフマネージャーが飛び込んで来た。","en":"The chief manager burst into the room with panic written across his face, shattering the stagnant atmosphere.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r344","rowIndex":344,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「しゅっ、襲撃です！」","en":"“W-we’re under attack!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r345","rowIndex":345,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼はしどろもどろになりながら、正面受付が突破され、武装した集団が施設内に流れ込んだことを伝えた。","en":"Stumbling over his words, he reported that armed men had broken through the front reception and were pouring into the facility.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r346","rowIndex":346,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　一同に動揺に走るなか、<tips=60>ロジャー・アダムス</tips>は落ち着いていた。","en":"Alarm swept through the assembled officers, but <tips=60>Roger Adams</tips> remained calm.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r347","rowIndex":347,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　金色の髪と青い瞳を持ち、長身をグレーのスーツに包んでいる。顔立ちは整っており、表情には屈折したところがなく、黙っていても温厚な印象を人に与える。テレビドラマに出演するのならば、正義の医者か弁護士といった役柄が相応しいだろう。少なくとも、とても臓器移植の違法コーディネーターあがりの、変態クラブオーナーには見えない。","en":"He was a tall man with golden hair and blue eyes, dressed in a gray suit. His features were handsome, and there was nothing twisted or guarded in his expression; even in silence, he gave an impression of gentleness. Were he cast in a television drama, he would have suited the role of a virtuous doctor or lawyer. At the very least, he looked nothing like an illegal organ-transplant coordinator turned owner of a perverse club.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r348","rowIndex":348,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あの<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>の連中かい？」","en":"“Is this the work of those people from <tips=7>YS</tips>?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ロジャー・アダムス","displayName":"Roger Adams","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r349","rowIndex":349,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=60>アダムス</tips>は穏やかにそう訊ねた。","en":"<tips=60>Adams</tips> asked mildly.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r350","rowIndex":350,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「わかりませんが、おそらく……。軍隊のようなものものしい銃器で武装しています」","en":"“We don't know, but probably... They're armed with an imposing arsenal, like some kind of army.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r351","rowIndex":351,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それは困った」","en":"“That's a problem.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ロジャー・アダムス","displayName":"Roger Adams","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r352","rowIndex":352,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=60>アダムス</tips>はふうと溜息をつく。","en":"<tips=60>Adams</tips> sighed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r353","rowIndex":353,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「彼らはフロアになだれ込んで、従業員を、しゃっ、射殺して……」","en":"“They’ve flooded the floors and sh-shot the employees...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r354","rowIndex":354,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「わかった、わかった。少し黙って落ち着きたまえ」","en":"“All right, all right. Now be quiet for a moment and compose yourself.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ロジャー・アダムス","displayName":"Roger Adams","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r355","rowIndex":355,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=60>アダムス</tips>は手をあげて、チーフマネージャーに口を閉じるよう促す。","en":"<tips=60>Adams</tips> raised a hand, motioning for the chief manager to be silent.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r356","rowIndex":356,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=68>木下組</tips>の予想は外れたみたいですね」","en":"“It appears the <tips=68>Kinoshita-gumi’s</tips> prediction was mistaken.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ロジャー・アダムス","displayName":"Roger Adams","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r357","rowIndex":357,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼は動揺する役員たちに向かってそう肩をすくめた。","en":"He shrugged as he addressed the shaken officers.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r358","rowIndex":358,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=18>ローズ・クラブ</tips>は再三<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>への具体的な対処を求めたが、<tips=68>木下組</tips>は、彼らがこのような実力行使に出ることはないと動かなかったのだ。","en":"The <tips=18>Rose Club</tips> had repeatedly asked the <tips=68>Kinoshita-gumi</tips> to take concrete measures against <tips=7>YS</tips>, but the group refused to act, convinced that YS would never resort to a direct show of force like this.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r359","rowIndex":359,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　――<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>は<tips=68>木下組</tips>を恐れ、出来れば交渉で決着をつけたいと思っている。今まで<tips=9>Y地区</tips>の連中は常にそのような態度であったし、武闘派と知られている<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>も<tips=68>木下組</tips>に対してはそこまで強硬な手段をとったことがない。","en":"—<tips=7>YS</tips> fears the <tips=68>Kinoshita-gumi</tips> and wants, if possible, to settle matters through negotiation. The people of <tips=9>Y District</tips> have always taken that attitude, and even <tips=3>Chris Tse</tips>, known for his militancy, has never resorted to such forceful measures against the <tips=68>Kinoshita-gumi</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r360","rowIndex":360,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それが<tips=68>木下組</tips>の判断の根拠だった。","en":"That was the basis of the <tips=68>Kinoshita-gumi's</tips> judgment.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r361","rowIndex":361,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「みなさん、彼らの目的はなんだと思いますか？」","en":"“Ladies and gentlemen, what do you believe they want?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r362","rowIndex":362,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　慌てふためく役員たちに、一人落ち着きを保つ<tips=60>アダムス</tips>はそう訊ねた。","en":"Still the only one who remained calm, <tips=60>Adams</tips> asked the panicking officers.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r363","rowIndex":363,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　こんな火急の時に悠長に質問をしている彼に、役員たちは戸惑いの視線を向ける。","en":"The officers gave him bewildered looks, unable to understand how he could ask such a leisurely question in the midst of a crisis.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r364","rowIndex":364,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「おそらく我々経営陣の命でしょう。今日を狙ったのも、こうして役員が集まる日だからです。まっすぐここに来ますよ。一刻も早くここから去った方が良いでしょう」","en":"“Most likely, they're after the lives of everyone in management. They chose today because this is when the officers gather here. They'll come straight for this room. We should leave as quickly as possible.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ロジャー・アダムス","displayName":"Roger Adams","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r365","rowIndex":365,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして<tips=60>アダムス</tips>は立ち上がり、チーフマネージャーに呼びかける。","en":"<tips=60>Adams</tips> rose and addressed the chief manager.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r366","rowIndex":366,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「きみ、武器を持っているものを集めて、みなさんを逃がしてやってくれないか？　監視カメラの映像を良く見て、敵と遭遇しないよう脱出ルートを選ぶんだ」","en":"“Could you gather everyone carrying a weapon and help these people escape? Watch the surveillance feeds carefully and choose a route that will keep you from encountering the enemy.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ロジャー・アダムス","displayName":"Roger Adams","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r367","rowIndex":367,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「オ、オーナーは？」","en":"“What about you, sir?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r368","rowIndex":368,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「僕はここに残る。彼らが一番欲しい命は、僕だろうからね……。ほら、早く！　早く行動をしないと、手遅れになる！」","en":"“I'll remain here. I'm probably the one they want dead most of all. ...Come on, hurry! If you don't act immediately, it'll be too late!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ロジャー・アダムス","displayName":"Roger Adams","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r369","rowIndex":369,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=60>アダムス</tips>はそう言って、他の人々に今すぐ部屋を出るように促した。その言葉で役員たちにもスイッチが入ったようで、彼らは恐怖に駆られるままにドタバタとドアから出て行った。","en":"<tips=60>Adams</tips> urged the others to leave the room at once. His words appeared to flip a switch within the officers. Driven by terror, they tumbled noisily through the door.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r370","rowIndex":370,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして部屋には一人<tips=60>アダムス</tips>だけが残される。","en":"<tips=60>Adams</tips> alone remained in the room.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r371","rowIndex":371,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼は暗い表情で椅子に座り直すと、震える手で何度も取り落としながら煙草に火をつけた。","en":"His expression dark, he sat down again and tried to light a cigarette, his trembling hands fumbling and dropping it several times.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r372","rowIndex":372,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その一本を吸い終わらないうちに、開きっぱなしにしたドアから銃を持った黒ずくめの五人が部屋に入ってくる。","en":"Before he could finish it, five black-clad men carrying guns entered through the door that had been left open.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r373","rowIndex":373,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　先頭の男が自分に銃口を向けて来るのを見ながら、彼は強く吸って煙草の残りを燃焼させ、灰皿に潰した。","en":"Watching the man in front aim at him, Adams inhaled deeply enough to burn away the remainder of the cigarette, then crushed it in the ashtray.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r374","rowIndex":374,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「お前が<tips=60>ロジャー・アダムス</tips>だな？」","en":"“You’re <tips=60>Roger Adams</tips>?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r375","rowIndex":375,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　相手の声はうわずっていないし、早口でもなく、落ち着いたものだった。","en":"The other man’s voice was neither shrill nor hurried, but calm.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r376","rowIndex":376,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうだ。きみが誰なのか教えてくれるかな？」","en":"“I am. Would you tell me who you are?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ロジャー・アダムス","displayName":"Roger Adams","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r377","rowIndex":377,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その言葉に応じて、相手は覆面をはぎ取り、床に投げ捨てた。","en":"In answer, the man tore away his mask and threw it upon the floor.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r378","rowIndex":378,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　下からは汗ばんだ男の顔があらわれ、その三つの目で<tips=60>アダムス</tips>を睨み付ける。","en":"Beneath it emerged a man's sweat-slick face, its three eyes glaring at <tips=60>Adams</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r379","rowIndex":379,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なるほど、きみが名高い<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>か。リーダー自らお出ましとは勇ましい。しかし、襲撃部隊に千里眼のきみがいるということは、誰も逃げることは出来なかったのだろうな……」","en":"“I see. So you're the famous <tips=3>Chris Tse</tips>. Bold of the leader himself to come in person. Still, if a clairvoyant like you is part of the assault force, I suppose no one could have escaped after all...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ロジャー・アダムス","displayName":"Roger Adams","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r380","rowIndex":380,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=60>アダムス</tips>は目を細めながらそう言った。","en":"<tips=60>Adams</tips> narrowed his eyes as he spoke.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r381","rowIndex":381,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「この部屋からあたふたと出て行ったお仲間のことなら、一足先に地獄で待ってるぜ」","en":"“If you mean the friends who scurried out of this room, they’ve gone ahead to wait for you in hell.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー（過去・青年）","displayName":"Chris Tse (Past, Young)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r382","rowIndex":382,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>の構える銃口は<tips=60>アダムス</tips>の顔面に狙いがつけられている。","en":"The muzzle of the gun in <tips=3>Chris Tse's</tips> hands was trained on <tips=60>Adams's</tips> face.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r383","rowIndex":383,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　引き金にかかった指がほんの少し動けば、4.6mmの弾丸がいくつも飛び出し彼の頭部を『トムとジェリー』に出て来るチーズのように穴だらけにするだろう。","en":"If the finger upon the trigger moved by the smallest degree, a stream of 4.6 mm rounds would punch his head full of holes like a wheel of cheese in Tom and Jerry.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r384","rowIndex":384,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しかし<tips=60>アダムス</tips>は冷静だった。さきほどあんなに手が震えていたのが嘘のように落ち着いている。汗一つかかず、涼しい顔で<tips=3>クリス</tips>に語りかける。","en":"Yet <tips=60>Adams</tips> remained calm, so composed now that one could scarcely believe how violently his hands had trembled moments earlier. Without so much as a bead of sweat on his brow, he addressed <tips=3>Chris</tips> with an unruffled expression.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r385","rowIndex":385,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「きみは自分がしていることがわかっているのかい？　僕を殺したって、人の欲望を殺せるわけじゃない。このクラブがなくなっても、また別のところに同じような施設が出来るだけだろう。そして、もっとあくどく稼ぐんだ。結局、誰かがこの汚れ仕事を引き受けなきゃいけないんだ。それなら僕でいい。……自分で言うのもなんだがね、僕には私利私欲が全くない。僕ほど公平な経営者はいないだろう。実際、多くの金が従業員の家族たちの手にわたり、街の総幸福量は増加しているはずだよ。僕がいなくなれば、全てが悪くなる」","en":"“Do you understand what you are doing? Killing me cannot kill human desire. If this club disappears, another facility of the same kind will simply be built elsewhere—and it will make its money by even more vicious means. Ultimately, someone must undertake this dirty work. It might as well be me. ...If you will forgive me saying so, I possess no selfish motive whatsoever. You will find no proprietor fairer than I am. In fact, much of the money reaches the employees' families, and the total happiness in this city must be increasing. Without me, everything will grow worse.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ロジャー・アダムス","displayName":"Roger Adams","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r386","rowIndex":386,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そんなのはおれには関係ないね。この街のガキに手を出すやつがいなくなりゃ、あとはどうだっていいんだ」","en":"“That’s no concern of mine. So long as no one touches the kids in this city, the rest can go to hell.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー（過去・青年）","displayName":"Chris Tse (Past, Young)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r387","rowIndex":387,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なるほど。まあね、それも一つの考え方だ。近しい人を何よりも優先するというのは、それはそれで理にかなった正しい感じ方だろう」","en":"“I see. Well, that too is one possible view. Placing the people close to you above all others is, in its fashion, a rational and proper way to feel.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r388","rowIndex":388,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=60>アダムス</tips>があっさりと認めたので、<tips=3>クリス</tips>は若干拍子抜けしたようだった。","en":"<tips=3>Chris</tips> appeared somewhat deflated when <tips=60>Adams</tips> accepted the point so readily.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r389","rowIndex":389,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ひとつ、聞いてもいいですか？」","en":"“May I ask you one question?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"太刀川良馬ペスト仮面","displayName":"Ryoma Tachikawa (Plague Mask)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r390","rowIndex":390,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　襲撃者の一人、妙な仮面を被った男が声をあげる。彼だけは、この襲撃者のなかでただ一人、小さな拳銃しか持っていない。","en":"One of the attackers spoke—a man wearing a strange mask. Alone among them, he carried only a small handgun.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r391","rowIndex":391,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あなたは血を飲ませて何人もの女性を不死身にしたそうですが、あれはなんなのですか？　科学ですか？　それとも、サイキックの力ですか？」","en":"“I am told that you gave several women your blood to drink and made them immortal. What was that? Science? Or a psychic power?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"太刀川良馬ペスト仮面","displayName":"Ryoma Tachikawa (Plague Mask)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r392","rowIndex":392,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「この場面で妙なことを聞くものだね。しかし、それはきみたちが知る必要がないことだ」","en":"“What a strange question to ask at a time like this. But that is nothing you need to know.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ロジャー・アダムス","displayName":"Roger Adams","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r393","rowIndex":393,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=60>アダムス</tips>は微笑を浮かべる。","en":"<tips=60>Adams</tips> smiled faintly.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r394","rowIndex":394,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「冷静を取り繕っていますが、今感情が動きましたね。これは……悲しみだ。どうして悲しむんですか？　それに何か、いとおしむような気持ちが混ざっている。あなたと不死の間に、どんな関係があるんです？」","en":"“You're pretending to be calm, but something stirred in you just now. This is... sadness. Why are you sad? There's something like tenderness mingled with it, too. What connection do you have to immortality?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"太刀川良馬ペスト仮面","displayName":"Ryoma Tachikawa (Plague Mask)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r395","rowIndex":395,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　問われると<tips=60>アダムス</tips>はわずかに動揺を見せたが、何も言わなかった。ただ黙って、発言者をじっと見つめている。","en":"At the question, <tips=60>Adams</tips> showed a flicker of agitation, but said nothing. He merely stared at the speaker.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r396","rowIndex":396,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ドクター、気が済むまで話させてやりたいが時間がない。もうお喋りは終わりだ。そいつとのラインをオフにしな。シンクロしたままでいたら、気が狂っちまうぜ」","en":"“Doctor, I'd let you question him until you were satisfied, but we don't have time. The conversation's over. Shut down your line to him. Stay synchronized much longer and it'll drive you insane.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー（過去・青年）","displayName":"Chris Tse (Past, Young)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r397","rowIndex":397,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=3>クリス</tips>が忠告すると、その男――<tips=5>太刀川</tips>はがっかりしたように溜息をつき、視線を<tips=60>アダムス</tips>の目からそらした。","en":"At <tips=3>Chris’s</tips> warning, the man—<tips=5>Tachikawa</tips>—sighed in disappointment and looked away from <tips=60>Adams’s</tips> eyes.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r398","rowIndex":398,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>、きみはこれから……」","en":"“<tips=3>Chris Tse</tips>, from this moment you will...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"太刀川良馬ペスト仮面","displayName":"Ryoma Tachikawa (Plague Mask)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r399","rowIndex":399,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=60>アダムス</tips>が口を開きなにか言おうとしたが、その言葉が終わる前に、彼の鼻から上は何発もの銃弾によって跡形もなく吹き飛ばされた。","en":"<tips=60>Adams</tips> opened his mouth and attempted to continue, but before the sentence ended, multiple bullets blew away everything above his nose without leaving a trace.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r400","rowIndex":400,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼は言いかけた唇のかたちのまま仰向けにのけぞり、そして椅子ごと後ろに倒れる。","en":"With his lips still holding the shape of the interrupted words, he arched backward, then toppled with the chair.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r401","rowIndex":401,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ドクター、確認してくれ」","en":"“Doctor, check him.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー（過去・青年）","displayName":"Chris Tse (Past, Young)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r402","rowIndex":402,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=3>クリス</tips>は倒れて動かなくなった<tips=60>アダムス</tips>の身体から目をそらさないでそう言った。","en":"<tips=3>Chris</tips> gave the instruction without taking his eyes from <tips=60>Adams’s</tips> fallen, motionless body.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r403","rowIndex":403,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=5>太刀川</tips>は頷き、その身体の側にかがみ込むと、手首に触れて脈をとり、胸に耳を当てて心音を聞き取り、そして破壊された頭部をじっと観察する。","en":"<tips=5>Tachikawa</tips> nodded and crouched beside the body. He felt the wrist for a pulse, placed an ear against the chest to listen for a heartbeat, then closely examined the destroyed head.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r404","rowIndex":404,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「再生している様子は全くないですね。死体現象がはじまっています」","en":"“There is no sign of regeneration whatsoever. Postmortem changes have begun.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"太刀川良馬ペスト仮面","displayName":"Ryoma Tachikawa (Plague Mask)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r405","rowIndex":405,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そう言って、すっと立ち上がった。","en":"He rose smoothly to his feet.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r406","rowIndex":406,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうか、意外だな。てっきりこいつも不死身になっているのかと思ったんだが」","en":"“Really? That's a surprise. I could've sworn this one was immortal too.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー（過去・青年）","displayName":"Chris Tse (Past, Young)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r407","rowIndex":407,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=3>クリス</tips>はどうにも解せないらしく、<tips=60>アダムス</tips>の死体を爪先で蹴る。しかし、やはりそれは無反応であった。","en":"Still unable to make sense of it, <tips=3>Chris</tips> kicked <tips=60>Adams's</tips> corpse with the toe of his boot. It remained unresponsive.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r408","rowIndex":408,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　この部屋に追い詰められてからの<tips=60>ロジャー・アダムス</tips>の態度はあまりに平然としていて慌てる様子もなかったから、彼はそんな風に考えたのだ。","en":"<tips=60>Roger Adams</tips> had been so utterly unruffled after they cornered him in the room, without the slightest sign of panic, that Chris had drawn that conclusion.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r409","rowIndex":409,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「よくわからないやつだったが、まあ、おかげで手間が減って助かる。不死身だったらどうやって死なそうかと思っていたんだ」","en":"“I never did understand him, but this saves us a lot of trouble. I was wondering how we’d manage to kill him if he was immortal.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー（過去・青年）","displayName":"Chris Tse (Past, Young)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r410","rowIndex":410,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=3>クリス</tips>は仲間に振り返って苦笑すると、床に落ちた目出し帽を拾い、一旦被りかけたが途中で思いとどまり、ズボンのポケットにしまった。","en":"<tips=3>Chris</tips> turned to his companions with a wry smile. He picked up the balaclava from the floor and began to put it on, then changed his mind halfway through and stuffed it into his trouser pocket.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r411","rowIndex":411,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「さて、我々の作戦目標は達成した。合流地点に移動するぞ」","en":"“All right, we've achieved our objective. Let's move to the rendezvous point.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー（過去・青年）","displayName":"Chris Tse (Past, Young)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r412","rowIndex":412,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そしてまだじっと死体を見つめている<tips=5>太刀川</tips>を促し部屋を出る。そこで<tips=3>クリス</tips>のヘッドセットに<tips=4>馬明</tips>からの通信があった。","en":"He urged <tips=5>Tachikawa</tips>, who still stood staring at the body, to come with them and left the room. Outside, <tips=3>Chris</tips> received a call from <tips=4>Ma Ming</tips> over his headset.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r413","rowIndex":413,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どうした？」","en":"“What is it?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー（過去・青年）","displayName":"Chris Tse (Past, Young)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r414","rowIndex":414,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"『兄貴、そっちは大丈夫か？』","en":"“Big Brother, are things all right over there?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r415","rowIndex":415,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ああ。今から合流地点に向かうところだ。そっちは何かあったのか？」","en":"“Yes. We’re about to head for the rendezvous point. Did something happen on your end?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー（過去・青年）","displayName":"Chris Tse (Past, Young)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r416","rowIndex":416,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"『こっちもプラチナフロアの制圧が終わったところなんだが、予想外の光景に出くわしちまって……』","en":"“We’ve just finished securing the Platinum floor, but we ran into something we didn’t expect...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r417","rowIndex":417,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「予想外？」","en":"“Something unexpected?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー（過去・青年）","displayName":"Chris Tse (Past, Young)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r418","rowIndex":418,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　言いながら、<tips=3>クリス</tips>は足元に視線をやる。彼の額の第三の目は、床の向こうにある下のフロアを見通しているのだろう。","en":"As he spoke, <tips=3>Chris</tips> lowered his gaze toward the floor. The third eye on his forehead was presumably looking through it to the level below.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r419","rowIndex":419,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"『言われたとおり、肩に三日月のタトゥーがあるやつらを保護しようとしたんだよ。それで見取り図にある、例の場所に来たんだが……』","en":"“Just as you said, we tried to protect the people with crescent tattoos on their shoulders. Then we came to that place on the floor plan...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r420","rowIndex":420,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=87>ベルーハ</tips>から聞いた三日月の女の待機所は、計画の段階で見取り図にマークをつけて特に重要な場所としてあった。","en":"<tips=87>Belukha</tips> had told them about the waiting room for the women marked with crescents. During the planning stage, they had marked it on the floor plan as a location of particular importance.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r421","rowIndex":421,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=3>クリス</tips>はその図を頭に思い浮かべながら、そちらに視線をやる。","en":"With the floor plan in mind, <tips=3>Chris</tips> directed his gaze toward the room.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r422","rowIndex":422,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"『その部屋に足を踏み入れたら……』","en":"“When we stepped inside...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r423","rowIndex":423,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「わかった。今から行く」","en":"“Got it. We're coming now.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー（過去・青年）","displayName":"Chris Tse (Past, Young)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r424","rowIndex":424,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=3>クリス</tips>は相手の言葉を最後まで聞かず、通話を切った。その表情はさっきまでとはうってかわって硬いものとなっている。","en":"<tips=3>Chris</tips> ended the call without hearing the other man out. His expression had hardened into something utterly unlike what it had been moments before.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r425","rowIndex":425,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=4>馬明</tips>と話しながら能力を使った彼は、説明されるまでもなく、その光景を自分の目で見てしまったのだ。","en":"By using his ability while speaking with <tips=4>Ma Ming</tips>, Chris had seen the scene with his own eyes before it ever needed to be explained.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r426","rowIndex":426,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=3>クリス</tips>は不安げにこちらを見ている<tips=5>太刀川</tips>たちに向き直った。","en":"<tips=3>Chris</tips> faced <tips=5>Tachikawa</tips> and the others, who watched him anxiously.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r427","rowIndex":427,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「予定変更だ。これからおれたちはプラチナフロアに向かう」","en":"“Change of plan. We're going to the Platinum floor now.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー（過去・青年）","displayName":"Chris Tse (Past, Young)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r428","rowIndex":428,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その言葉で一同は察し、無言で頷いた。","en":"The party understood from those words and nodded in silence.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r429","rowIndex":429,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　女たちの待機所は、階段を下りると空中回廊を歩いて、この間初めて<tips=32>アサヒ</tips>と<tips=5>太刀川</tips>が出会ったあの場所より先に進み、さらに右の薄暗い通路に入った突き当たりの部屋である。","en":"To reach the women's waiting room, they descended the stairs, crossed the elevated corridor, continued beyond the place where <tips=32>Asahi</tips> and <tips=5>Tachikawa</tips> had first met not long before, then entered a dim passage on the right. The room stood at its far end.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r430","rowIndex":430,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　久しぶりにやって来たその場所は、壁には無数の弾痕が残り、床には血みどろの従業員や流れ弾に当たった女の死体が転がり、カーテンは破れ、戦闘の痕跡を生々しく残していた。一行は死体をまたぎながら進む。","en":"The place to which they now returned bore vivid traces of the battle. Countless bullet scars marked the walls. Blood-soaked employees and women struck by stray rounds lay dead upon the floor, and the curtains hung torn. The party stepped over the bodies as it advanced.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r431","rowIndex":431,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　目的の部屋のドアは開きっぱなしになっており、先頭の<tips=3>クリス</tips>が最初にそのなかに入ると、<tips=5>太刀川</tips>は二番目に部屋に足を踏み入れた。","en":"The door to their destination stood open. <tips=3>Chris</tips> entered first, and <tips=5>Tachikawa</tips> stepped into the room immediately behind him.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r432","rowIndex":432,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「これは……」","en":"“This is...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー（過去・青年）","displayName":"Chris Tse (Past, Young)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r433","rowIndex":433,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ここに来るまでの<tips=3>クリス</tips>の表情と態度でおおよその想像はついていたが、実際目の当たりにするとさすがに驚かないわけにはいかなかった。","en":"<tips=3>Chris’s</tips> expression and manner on the way had allowed Tachikawa to imagine the scene in broad outline. Confronting it with his own eyes shocked him nevertheless.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r434","rowIndex":434,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　プラチナフロアの待機所は、客室に劣らぬくらい豪華な作りになっている。天井には金の飾りがついたシャンデリアがぶら下がり、足元には上質の絨毯が敷き詰められている。その上に、下着のように露出の多いドレスを身に纏った女たちが、折り重なるように倒れていた。<tips=5>太刀川</tips>が以前に見たショーと同じ、子供のように幼い女も、成熟した者も、肌が黒い者も、白い者も、あるいは白目を剥き、苦悶の表情を浮かべ、ぴくりとも動かない。女だけではない。割合は少ないが、少年や青年の姿もそのなかにまざっている。","en":"The waiting room on the Platinum floor had been constructed as luxuriously as any guest room. A chandelier with golden decorations hung from the ceiling, and a fine carpet covered the floor. Upon it, women wearing revealing dresses scarcely more substantial than underwear had collapsed over one another. Just as in the show <tips=5>Tachikawa</tips> had once witnessed, some were as young as children and others mature, some dark-skinned and others pale. Some showed the whites of their eyes; some wore expressions of agony. None moved. Nor were all of them female. Fewer in number, boys and young men lay among them.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r435","rowIndex":435,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　先に到着した<tips=4>馬明</tips>とその部下たちは、その女たちを爪先や銃口でつついたりしながら、生存者の確認を行っていた。","en":"<tips=4>Ma Ming</tips> and the subordinates who had arrived first were prodding the women with their toes and gun barrels as they searched for survivors.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r436","rowIndex":436,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「駄目かい」","en":"“No good?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー（過去・青年）","displayName":"Chris Tse (Past, Young)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r437","rowIndex":437,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=3>クリス</tips>が、しかめっつらでしゃがみこみ、遺体の顔を眺めていた<tips=4>馬明</tips>にそう尋ねる。","en":"<tips=3>Chris</tips> asked <tips=4>Ma Ming</tips>, who was crouched with a scowl, studying the face of one of the bodies.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r438","rowIndex":438,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どうやらそうらしい」","en":"“It looks that way.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r439","rowIndex":439,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=4>馬明</tips>は立ち上がってかぶりを振る。","en":"<tips=4>Ma Ming</tips> rose and shook his head.","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬明（過去）","displayName":"Ma Ming (Past)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r440","rowIndex":440,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「他の女たちは？」","en":"“What about the other women?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー（過去・青年）","displayName":"Chris Tse (Past, Young)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r441","rowIndex":441,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「もう移動させた。今頃階段を下りているはずだよ」","en":"“We moved them already. They should be going down the stairs by now.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬明（過去）","displayName":"Ma Ming (Past)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r442","rowIndex":442,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうか。しかし、おかしいな。どいつも三日月のマークがついているのに……」","en":"“I see. But this makes no sense. Every one of them has the crescent mark...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー（過去・青年）","displayName":"Chris Tse (Past, Young)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r443","rowIndex":443,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=3>クリス</tips>はドレスから剥き出しになった女たちの肩を見ながら首を捻った。男の遺体のシャツをめくってみると、やはりそこにも三日月のマークがある。","en":"<tips=3>Chris</tips> tilted his head as he studied the women’s shoulders, exposed by their dresses. When he lifted the shirt of one male body, he found a crescent mark there as well.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r444","rowIndex":444,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そう言えば、<tips=87>ベルーハ</tips>は『三日月』から不死身の力を奪う方法があると言っていたな。それを使ったのか？」","en":"“Come to think of it, <tips=87>Belukha</tips> said there was a way to strip the Crescents of their immortality. Did they use it?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー（過去・青年）","displayName":"Chris Tse (Past, Young)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r445","rowIndex":445,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=3>クリス</tips>は<tips=5>太刀川</tips>の姿を探す。彼は床に這いつくばるようにして、死体の状態を確認していた。","en":"<tips=3>Chris</tips> looked for <tips=5>Tachikawa</tips>. The doctor was almost crawling over the floor as he examined the bodies.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r446","rowIndex":446,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ドクター、どう思う？」","en":"“What do you think, Doctor?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー（過去・青年）","displayName":"Chris Tse (Past, Young)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r447","rowIndex":447,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どの遺体も、腕に静脈注射の痕跡があります。なにかの薬品で殺害された可能性が高いですね」","en":"“Every body bears the mark of an intravenous injection on the arm. There is a strong possibility that some drug was used to kill them.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"太刀川良馬ペスト仮面","displayName":"Ryoma Tachikawa (Plague Mask)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r448","rowIndex":448,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　言葉は冷静を装っていたが、声には動揺があらわれていた。","en":"His words feigned calm, but his voice betrayed his agitation.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r449","rowIndex":449,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「わざわざ三日月の女ばかり集めて……。そうだ、<tips=4>馬明</tips>、ここに来るまでに不死身のやつを見かけなかったか？　銃で撃ったのに起き上がって来るとか、まだ動いているとかさ」","en":"“They went out of their way to gather only women with crescents... Wait. <tips=4>Ma Ming</tips>, did you see anyone immortal on your way here? Someone who got back up after being shot, or was still moving?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー（過去・青年）","displayName":"Chris Tse (Past, Young)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r450","rowIndex":450,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いや、見かけなかった」","en":"“No, I didn’t see anyone.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬明（過去）","displayName":"Ma Ming (Past)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r451","rowIndex":451,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「こっちもだ。不死身なのは、商売用の女だけなのかねえ。どうも気になるな。……<tips=4>馬明</tips>、このフロアをもう一度調べてくれないか」","en":"“Neither did we. Are only the women they use for business immortal, then? Something about this bothers me. ...<tips=4>Ma Ming</tips>, could you search this floor one more time?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー（過去・青年）","displayName":"Chris Tse (Past, Young)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r452","rowIndex":452,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=3>クリス</tips>は顔をあげて<tips=4>馬明</tips>にそう指示した。","en":"<tips=3>Chris</tips> looked up as he gave <tips=4>Ma Ming</tips> the order.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r453","rowIndex":453,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「了解。……一班の者は、おれについてこい」","en":"“Understood. ...First squad, come with me!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬明（過去）","displayName":"Ma Ming (Past)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r454","rowIndex":454,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=4>馬明</tips>が部下をまとめて部屋を出て行こうとしたとき、","en":"As <tips=4>Ma Ming</tips> gathered his men and started for the door,","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r455","rowIndex":455,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「この女、まだ息があります！」","en":"“This woman is still breathing!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r456","rowIndex":456,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　遺体を調べていた部下の一人がそう声をあげた。それを受けて、<tips=5>太刀川</tips>はすぐに立ち上がって駆け寄る。","en":"The shout came from one of the subordinates examining the bodies. At that, <tips=5>Tachikawa</tips> immediately stood and hurried over.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r457","rowIndex":457,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして部下を押しのけ、女の顔をのぞき込むと、そのからだがこわばり凍り付いた。","en":"He pushed the man aside and looked into the woman's face. His body went rigid, frozen in place.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r458","rowIndex":458,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「お、おおお……」","en":"“O-ohhh...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"太刀川良馬ペスト仮面","displayName":"Ryoma Tachikawa (Plague Mask)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r459","rowIndex":459,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　動けなくなった<tips=5>太刀川</tips>の唇の間からうめき声が漏れる。","en":"A groan escaped <tips=5>Tachikawa's</tips> lips as he stood frozen.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r460","rowIndex":460,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　普段冷静沈着な『ドクター』の、見たこともない異常な感情の揺らぎは、まるで何か神経性の発作のようにさえ見えた。その場に居合わせた一同は戸惑いを浮かべる。","en":"No one present had ever witnessed such a violent emotional upheaval in the ordinarily composed Doctor. It almost resembled some form of nervous seizure. The entire party stared in bewilderment.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r461","rowIndex":461,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ドクター！」","en":"“Doctor!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r462","rowIndex":462,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　部下の一人が彼の肩を叩くが、<tips=5>太刀川</tips>は微動だにしない。","en":"One subordinate tapped him on the shoulder, but <tips=5>Tachikawa</tips> did not so much as twitch.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r463","rowIndex":463,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　一人落ち着いている<tips=3>クリス</tips>は手を上げて、ドクターから離れるよう無言で指示を出す。","en":"<tips=3>Chris</tips> alone remained calm. He raised a hand and silently directed the others away from the Doctor.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r464","rowIndex":464,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「もしかして、これが例の？」","en":"“Could this be the one you mentioned?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー（過去・青年）","displayName":"Chris Tse (Past, Young)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r465","rowIndex":465,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　女をまたいでやって来た<tips=4>馬明</tips>が耳に囁くと、<tips=3>クリス</tips>は頷く。","en":"<tips=4>Ma Ming</tips> came over, stepping across the woman, and whispered in <tips=3>Chris's</tips> ear. Chris nodded.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r466","rowIndex":466,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=52>ミアオ</tips>……」","en":"“<tips=52>Miao</tips>...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"太刀川良馬ペスト仮面","displayName":"Ryoma Tachikawa (Plague Mask)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r467","rowIndex":467,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=5>太刀川</tips>は喉の奥から絞り出すようにその名を口にした。","en":"<tips=5>Tachikawa</tips> forced the name from deep in his throat.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r468","rowIndex":468,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして彼女の肩の三日月の刻印を見て顔を顰める。","en":"Then he saw the crescent branded on her shoulder and frowned.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r469","rowIndex":469,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そう、そこに倒れていたのは彼が長年探し求めていたその女だったのである。","en":"Yes—the woman lying there was the very one he had sought for so many years.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r470","rowIndex":470,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　夢にまで見たその肉体は、以前とちっとも変わらず美しかったが、その命が尽きようとしているのは明白だった。","en":"The body he had seen even in his dreams remained every bit as beautiful as before, but it was plainly on the verge of death.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r471","rowIndex":471,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　女は確かにまだ息がある。微かに呼吸をし、弱々しい脈拍も感じ取れた。","en":"The woman was indeed still alive. She breathed faintly, and a weak pulse could be felt.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r472","rowIndex":472,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しかしその肌は血の気が失せて蒼白になっている。","en":"But all color had drained from her skin, leaving it deathly pale.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r473","rowIndex":473,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=5>太刀川</tips>はその手を取って裏返し、その内側を見た。","en":"<tips=5>Tachikawa</tips> took her hand, turned it palm-up, and examined the inside of her wrist.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r474","rowIndex":474,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そこにも注射のあとがある。","en":"There was a needle mark there too.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r475","rowIndex":475,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=5>太刀川</tips>は唇を噛んだ。","en":"<tips=5>Tachikawa</tips> bit his lip.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r476","rowIndex":476,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=52>ミアオ</tips>、私だ……」","en":"“<tips=52>Miao</tips>, it’s me...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r477","rowIndex":477,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼は<tips=52>ミアオ</tips>を抱きかかえ、その焦点の定まらない目に自分の顔を見せつけようとしたところで、まだ帽子をかぶったままなのに気がつき、荒々しい手つきではぎ取り、投げ捨てる。","en":"He gathered <tips=52>Miao</tips> into his arms and tried to bring his face before her unfocused eyes. Only then did he realize he was still wearing his hat. He tore it off with a savage motion and flung it aside.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r478","rowIndex":478,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「私だ、<tips=5>太刀川</tips>だ……わかるか？」","en":"“It's me—<tips=5>Tachikawa</tips>... Do you recognize me?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r479","rowIndex":479,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　首筋をそっと撫でながらそう呟くと、<tips=52>ミアオ</tips>は首をわずかに持ち上げて、ゆらゆらと定まらない視点を彼の顔にあわせようと動かす。","en":"He murmured the words while gently stroking the side of her neck. <tips=52>Miao</tips> lifted her head a fraction and moved her wandering gaze in an effort to bring his face into focus.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r480","rowIndex":480,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「え……タチカワ……さん……」","en":"“Huh...? Mr. Tachikawa...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r481","rowIndex":481,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　かすれる声でそう呟くと、うすく微笑した。","en":"She whispered in a rasping voice, then smiled faintly.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r482","rowIndex":482,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……久しぶり……」","en":"“...It’s been a long time...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r483","rowIndex":483,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ああ、久しぶりだ。本当に……久しぶりだ……」","en":"“Yes. It really has been... such a long time...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r484","rowIndex":484,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　言葉につまり、<tips=5>太刀川</tips>の目に涙の塊が浮かぶ。","en":"His words caught in his throat, and tears pooled in <tips=5>Tachikawa's</tips> eyes.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r485","rowIndex":485,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「駄目だ、これじゃぼやけてしまって、お前の目が見えない……」","en":"“No, this won’t do. Everything’s blurred—I can’t see your eyes...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r486","rowIndex":486,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=5>太刀川</tips>は袖口で涙をぬぐい取った。","en":"<tips=5>Tachikawa</tips> wiped the tears away with his cuff.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r487","rowIndex":487,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……んっ……あっ……」","en":"“...Ngh... Ah...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r488","rowIndex":488,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=52>ミアオ</tips>は苦悶に顔を歪め、身体を引きつらせる。その強く閉ざしたまぶたにしわが浮かぶ。","en":"<tips=52>Miao’s</tips> face twisted in agony, and her body convulsed. Furrows formed across her tightly shut eyelids.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r489","rowIndex":489,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「苦しいか？　大丈夫だ。もう心配いらない。私は医師だ」","en":"“Are you in pain? It's all right. You don't have to worry anymore. I'm a doctor.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r490","rowIndex":490,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=5>太刀川</tips>はそう励まし、<tips=52>ミアオ</tips>の身体を抱き寄せる。彼女の華奢な身体は腕の中にすっぽりとおさまり、その痙攣が彼女の生を実感させる。","en":"<tips=5>Tachikawa</tips> drew <tips=52>Miao’s</tips> body close as he reassured her. Her slender frame fit entirely within his arms, and its convulsions made the life within her palpable.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r491","rowIndex":491,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　やがて彼女の身体のひきつりが収まった。","en":"In time, the spasms subsided.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r492","rowIndex":492,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　不安になって<tips=5>太刀川</tips>は身体を離し、彼女の顔を見た。<tips=52>ミアオ</tips>は目を閉じているが、先ほどの苦痛の表情は消え、穏やかに微笑んでいる。","en":"Growing anxious, <tips=5>Tachikawa</tips> drew back and looked at her face. <tips=52>Miao’s</tips> eyes were closed, but the agony had vanished from her features. She wore a tranquil smile.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r493","rowIndex":493,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……そうだね……タチカワさんは、優秀だから……」","en":"“...That’s right... because you’re so capable, Mr. Tachikawa...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r494","rowIndex":494,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうだ。おれは同期の誰よりも優秀だった。だから安心していい。お前は助かるんだ」","en":"“I am. I was better than anyone else in my class. So you can rest easy. I’m going to save you.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r495","rowIndex":495,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……そう」","en":"“...I see.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r496","rowIndex":496,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=52>ミアオ</tips>はそう呟いた。","en":"<tips=52>Miao</tips> whispered the words.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r497","rowIndex":497,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しかし、穏やかでいられたのは一瞬だった。すぐに彼女の顔には苦しみがもどり、その手足に、これほど弱った人間のものとは思えない力が入る。","en":"Her peace lasted only an instant. Pain swiftly returned to her face, and a strength inconceivable in one so weakened flooded her limbs.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r498","rowIndex":498,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あっ……あああっ！」","en":"“Ah... Aaaagh!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r499","rowIndex":499,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　開いた口の奥から、人のものとは思えない声があがる。","en":"From the depths of her open mouth rose a cry that scarcely seemed human.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r500","rowIndex":500,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=5>太刀川</tips>はその目を見ようとしたが、彼女のまぶたはぴったりと閉ざされていた。","en":"<tips=5>Tachikawa</tips> tried to look into her eyes, but her lids remained sealed tight.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r501","rowIndex":501,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=52>ミアオ</tips>、目を開けろ！　開けてくれ！」","en":"“<tips=52>Miao</tips>, open your eyes! Please, open them!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r502","rowIndex":502,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あ、あ、ああっ！」","en":"“Ah... Ah... Aaaagh!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r503","rowIndex":503,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=5>太刀川</tips>の叫び声はもう彼女の耳には届かない。","en":"<tips=5>Tachikawa’s</tips> cries no longer reached her ears.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r504","rowIndex":504,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「おれにも、わけてくれ！　お前の感情をっ！」","en":"“Share them with me—your feelings!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r505","rowIndex":505,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=5>太刀川</tips>は咄嗟に片手を伸ばし、指先を彼女のまぶたにあてがって、むりやり目を開かせる。","en":"Acting on impulse, <tips=5>Tachikawa</tips> extended one hand, set his fingertips against her lids, and forced her eyes open.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r506","rowIndex":506,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「やめろっドクター！　何をしている！　何を見ようとしている！」","en":"“Stop, Doctor! What are you doing? What are you trying to see?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r507","rowIndex":507,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=3>クリス</tips>は叫んだ。","en":"<tips=3>Chris</tips> shouted.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r508","rowIndex":508,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「黙れ<tips=3>クリス</tips>っ！」","en":"“Be quiet, <tips=3>Chris</tips>!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r509","rowIndex":509,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=5>太刀川</tips>の空気が震えるほどのすさまじい怒声で、駆け寄ろうとした<tips=3>クリス</tips>の足が止まる。","en":"<tips=5>Tachikawa's</tips> tremendous, furious roar seemed to shake the very air, stopping <tips=3>Chris</tips> in his tracks as he rushed toward him.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r510","rowIndex":510,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「うあっ……あああっ……」","en":"“Uagh... Aaaagh...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r511","rowIndex":511,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=52>ミアオ</tips>は口からよだれを垂れ流しながら、手足をばたつかせ、そして<tips=5>太刀川</tips>にしがみつく。","en":"Drool streaming from her mouth, <tips=52>Miao</tips> thrashed her limbs and clung to <tips=5>Tachikawa</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r512","rowIndex":512,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=5>太刀川</tips>はどうにかしてその目を開かせようとする。","en":"<tips=5>Tachikawa</tips> tried desperately to make her open her eyes.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r513","rowIndex":513,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「目をっ、目を開けてくれっ！」","en":"“Your eyes—open your eyes!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r514","rowIndex":514,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　やっとその声が届いたのか、<tips=52>ミアオ</tips>の目は大きく見開かれた。<tips=5>太刀川</tips>はほとんどキスをするように顔を近づけ、彼女の目と自分の眼球が二つある目をくっつきそうなくらい接近させる。","en":"Perhaps his voice finally reached her, for <tips=52>Miao’s</tips> eyes opened wide. <tips=5>Tachikawa</tips> brought his face so close it was almost a kiss, until her eye and the two eyeballs set within his own nearly touched.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r515","rowIndex":515,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　すると、<tips=5>太刀川</tips>の全身も硬くこわばり、ぷるぷると震え始めた。","en":"Then <tips=5>Tachikawa’s</tips> entire body went rigid and began to tremble.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r516","rowIndex":516,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あああああああっ……」","en":"“Aaaaaaaaaagh...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r517","rowIndex":517,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして、彼の口からも、<tips=52>ミアオ</tips>とそっくりの苦しみの声が漏れる。","en":"From his mouth came a cry of agony almost identical to <tips=52>Miao’s</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r518","rowIndex":518,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「馬鹿野郎っ！」","en":"“You damn fool!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r519","rowIndex":519,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ついに近づいた<tips=3>クリス</tips>がその肩をつかんだが、太刀川は乱暴に振り払う。しかしその拍子でミアオの身体が離れ、彼女は床に仰向けに倒れた。<tips=5>太刀川</tips>はその上に覆い被さるような姿勢をとると、<tips=52>ミアオ</tips>の顔を両手で挟むように固定し、その目をじっと見つめる。","en":"At last, <tips=3>Chris</tips> reached him and seized his shoulder, but Tachikawa violently shook him off. The motion caused Miao's body to slip away from him, and she fell onto her back on the floor. <tips=5>Tachikawa</tips> bent over her, held <tips=52>Miao's</tips> face immobile between his hands, and stared into her eyes.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r520","rowIndex":520,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=52>ミアオ</tips>の感情と、<tips=5>太刀川</tips>の感情が完全に一体化する。","en":"<tips=52>Miao’s</tips> emotions and <tips=5>Tachikawa’s</tips> merged completely.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r521","rowIndex":521,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あっ……ああっ……」","en":"“Ah... Aah...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r522","rowIndex":522,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ミアオが身体をびくりと痙攣させると、<tips=5>太刀川</tips>も同じように痙攣し、<tips=52>ミアオ</tips>の全身から力がぬけてぐったりと倒れ込むと、<tips=5>太刀川</tips>も脱力してそのまま彼女の上に倒れた。","en":"Miao's body jerked in a spasm, and <tips=5>Tachikawa</tips> convulsed with her. The strength left <tips=52>Miao's</tips> entire body and she collapsed limply; <tips=5>Tachikawa</tips> likewise went slack and fell on top of her.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r523","rowIndex":523,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「おい！　ドクター！」","en":"“Hey! Doctor!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー（過去・青年）","displayName":"Chris Tse (Past, Young)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r524","rowIndex":524,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=3>クリス</tips>は<tips=5>太刀川</tips>の身体を掴んで引き起こす。","en":"<tips=3>Chris</tips> seized <tips=5>Tachikawa</tips> and hauled him upright.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r525","rowIndex":525,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しかし、彼の首はぐらぐらと揺れ、目は見開き、口からは泡を吹いている。<tips=52>ミアオ</tips>も同様だった。","en":"But his head lolled, his eyes were wide open, and foam spilled from his mouth. <tips=52>Miao</tips> was the same.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r526","rowIndex":526,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「マジかよ……」","en":"“You’ve got to be kidding...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー（過去・青年）","displayName":"Chris Tse (Past, Young)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r527","rowIndex":527,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=3>クリス</tips>は<tips=5>太刀川</tips>の胸に耳を当てる。そこには確かに心音がある。ほっとして、次は<tips=52>ミアオ</tips>の胸に耳を当てると、そこには何の音もない。電池の切れた時計に耳を当てたかのように何も聞こえない。","en":"<tips=3>Chris</tips> pressed an ear to <tips=5>Tachikawa’s</tips> chest. There was definitely a heartbeat. Relieved, he listened next at <tips=52>Miao’s</tips> chest, but there was no sound at all. He heard nothing, as though he had put his ear to a clock with a dead battery.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r528","rowIndex":528,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=5>太刀川</tips>はまだ生きているが、<tips=52>ミアオ</tips>はもう死んでいた。彼女が不死身だったとしても、他の三日月の女と同じように薬を打たれていたのだとしたら、蘇ることもないだろう。","en":"<tips=5>Tachikawa</tips> was still alive, but <tips=52>Miao</tips> was already dead. Even if she had been immortal, if she had been injected with the drug like the other crescent women, she would not come back to life.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r529","rowIndex":529,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=3>クリス</tips>は目を剥いたままの<tips=52>ミアオ</tips>のまぶたを指先で閉じてやってから立ち上がった。","en":"<tips=3>Chris</tips> used his fingertips to close the lids over <tips=52>Miao’s</tips> staring eyes, then stood.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r530","rowIndex":530,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　生きている人間の精神に、死ぬ瞬間の人間の心が流れ込んだらどうなるのだろうか？　<tips=5>太刀川</tips>はいまそれを身をもって試したということになる。","en":"What would happen if the mind of a person at the instant of death flowed into the mind of someone still living? <tips=5>Tachikawa</tips> had just found out firsthand.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r531","rowIndex":531,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼は他人の感情と自分の感情が入り交じってしまう自分の能力が、自分にとってどれだけリスクがあるものなのかよく理解していた。","en":"He understood very well how much danger his ability—mingling another person’s emotions with his own—posed to him.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r532","rowIndex":532,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　だから、能力を用いるときも非常に慎重で、クリスの仕事を手伝う時も、対象の感情に引きずり込まれないよう、必要な瞬間を選んでピンポイントで能力を使っていた。あからさまに精神に異常をきたしている相手には、けして能力を使おうとしなかった。","en":"That was why he was extremely cautious when using it. Even when helping Chris with his work, he chose the necessary instant and used his ability with pinpoint precision so as not to be swept up in his subject’s emotions. He never tried to use it on anyone showing unmistakable signs of mental disturbance.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r533","rowIndex":533,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=5>太刀川</tips>自身は人より強い精神力を持っていたが、それでも、仕事の後は情緒が不安定になって精神安定剤などを服用していたのを<tips=3>クリス</tips>は知っている。","en":"<tips=5>Tachikawa</tips> himself possessed greater mental fortitude than most, but even so, <tips=3>Chris</tips> knew that after a job he became emotionally unstable and took tranquilizers and similar medication.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r534","rowIndex":534,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　他人の感情に直に触れるというのは、それだけ自分の感情をかき乱すということなのだろう。","en":"To touch another person’s emotions directly must be enough to throw one’s own emotions into turmoil.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r535","rowIndex":535,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「無茶をしやがる」","en":"“Damn fool, pushing himself like that...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー（過去・青年）","displayName":"Chris Tse (Past, Young)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r536","rowIndex":536,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ぐったりと倒れたまま起き上がろうとしない<tips=5>太刀川</tips>を見下ろしながら<tips=3>クリス</tips>はそう呟いた。","en":"<tips=3>Chris</tips> whispered as he looked down at <tips=5>Tachikawa</tips>, who lay limp and made no attempt to rise.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r537","rowIndex":537,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「おいドクター！　おい！」","en":"“Hey, Doctor! Hey!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬明（過去）","displayName":"Ma Ming (Past)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r538","rowIndex":538,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=4>馬明</tips>が彼の頬を手のひらではたくが、反応をしめさない。","en":"<tips=4>Ma Ming</tips> slapped his cheek with an open hand, but Tachikawa showed no response.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r539","rowIndex":539,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どうも、大変なことになったな……」","en":"“This has gotten serious...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r540","rowIndex":540,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=4>馬明</tips>は溜息をつくと、<tips=5>太刀川</tips>の身体を引き起こし、その広い背中に背負った。","en":"<tips=4>Ma Ming</tips> sighed, pulled <tips=5>Tachikawa</tips> upright, and hoisted him onto his broad back.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r541","rowIndex":541,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「これじゃ、死体を背負ってるのとかわらない」","en":"“I might as well be carrying a corpse.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬明（過去）","displayName":"Ma Ming (Past)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r542","rowIndex":542,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　自分の背中の上で、ぶらぶらと自然に<tips=5>太刀川</tips>の手足が揺れる。その足からはダラダラと血が流れ落ちる。","en":"On his back, <tips=5>Tachikawa’s</tips> arms and legs swung limply. Blood streamed steadily from his leg.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r543","rowIndex":543,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　本人は一言も口にしなかったが、どこかで膝を負傷していたらしい。","en":"He himself had not said a word, but apparently he had injured his knee somewhere along the way.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r544","rowIndex":544,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その様子を見て<tips=4>馬明</tips>は顔を顰めた。","en":"At the sight, <tips=4>Ma Ming</tips> frowned.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r545","rowIndex":545,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「兄貴、もう予定時間を過ぎてる。撤収しよう」","en":"“Big Brother, we’re already past the scheduled time. Let’s pull out.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬明（過去）","displayName":"Ma Ming (Past)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r546","rowIndex":546,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その問いに、<tips=3>クリス</tips>は頷き、","en":"<tips=3>Chris</tips> nodded in answer.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r547","rowIndex":547,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「わかった。その前に、ちょっとだけ確認させてくれ」","en":"“All right. Just give me a moment to check first.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー（過去・青年）","displayName":"Chris Tse (Past, Young)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r548","rowIndex":548,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そう言って、千里眼でフロアを見回す。","en":"With that, he surveyed the floor with his clairvoyant eye.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r549","rowIndex":549,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=39>ジェフリー</tips>の子供たちのように瞬間的に付近の人間を察知する能力ではなく、どこを見るか意識的に調整しなければいけない力であるから、ざっと見回したくらいでは見落としもあるだろうが、ゆっくりしている時間もない。警察はおそらく来ないだろうが、<tips=68>木下組</tips>の救援が来るかも知れない。","en":"Unlike <tips=39>Jeffrey’s</tips> children, whose power let them instantly detect people nearby, his power required him to consciously direct his attention toward whatever place he wished to see. A cursory scan might therefore miss something, but there was no time to linger. The police probably would not come, though reinforcements from the <tips=68>Kinoshita-gumi</tips> might.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r550","rowIndex":550,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　今の<tips=3>クリス</tips>たちの装備なら負ける相手ではないが、意味のない戦いは避けたかった。","en":"With the equipment <tips=3>Chris</tips> and his men now had, they could not lose to such opponents, but he wanted to avoid a pointless fight.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r551","rowIndex":551,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「よし、切り上げよう」","en":"“All right, let's wrap this up.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー（過去・青年）","displayName":"Chris Tse (Past, Young)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r552","rowIndex":552,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして撤収の準備に取りかかると、今度は<tips=39>ジェフリー</tips>から連絡があった。","en":"As they began preparing to withdraw, a report came from <tips=39>Jeffrey</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r553","rowIndex":553,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それによると、一階で火災が発生したらしい。<tips=69>義勝</tips>のメンバーが制圧したときには何事もなかった場所が火元だというから、あとで誰かが火をつけたのだろう。消火に当たる者もなく、火の手は猛烈な勢いで広がりつつある。早急に退去すべきだという意見を<tips=39>ジェフリー</tips>は述べた。","en":"According to him, a fire had apparently broken out on the first floor. Its source was somewhere that had been fine when <tips=69>Yisheng’s</tips> men secured it, so someone must have set it afterward. With no one fighting it, the flames were spreading at a tremendous pace. <tips=39>Jeffrey</tips> urged them to evacuate immediately.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r554","rowIndex":554,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　もちろん<tips=3>クリス</tips>にも異論がない。部下たちに事態を伝えると、自ら先導して降り始めた。","en":"Of course <tips=3>Chris</tips> had no objection. He told his subordinates what was happening and began leading the way down himself.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r555","rowIndex":555,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　来る時に使った裏階段は炎に巻かれ、煙がもくもくと階下からのぼってきており使えない。エレベーターに乗ったら、途中でチカチカと電灯が瞬いて、消える。同時にエレベーターも停止する。ドアをこじ開けて外に出たら建物の中全体が真っ暗になっていた。炎によって電気設備が壊れたのだろう。","en":"The rear stairway they had used on the way in was engulfed in flame and unusable, with dense smoke billowing up from below. They entered the elevator, but partway down its lights flickered and went out. The car stopped at the same instant. When they forced the doors open and emerged, the entire building was dark. The fire had probably destroyed the electrical equipment.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r556","rowIndex":556,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　回廊の手すりにつかまって、吹き抜けから下を覗き込むが、煙があがって来てとても目を開けていられない。一階のホールも燃えているのだ。","en":"Clinging to the gallery railing, they looked down through the atrium, but rising smoke made it impossible to keep their eyes open. The first-floor hall was burning as well.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r557","rowIndex":557,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　炎が下から上へと移動する速度は速い。特に巨大な吹き抜けを持つこの建物ならば瞬く間に全体が炎に包まれるだろう。","en":"Flames climbed from lower floors to higher ones with terrible speed. In a building with an enormous atrium such as this, the whole structure would be enveloped in fire in the blink of an eye.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r558","rowIndex":558,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　普通なら絶体絶命の状況かもしれないが、<tips=3>クリス</tips>の目はこういう場合でも役に立つ。","en":"Under ordinary circumstances, they might have been trapped with no hope of escape, but <tips=3>Chris’s</tips> eye was useful even in a situation like this.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r559","rowIndex":559,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　煙と炎を壁一枚、ドア一枚隔てて、紙一重のルートで進み、その途中で逃げ損ねた女を拾う余裕さえみせながら、無事に脱出をした。","en":"They threaded a razor-thin route past the smoke and flames, never more than a single wall or door away, and still found time to rescue a woman who had failed to escape. In the end, they emerged safely from the building.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r560","rowIndex":560,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　来る時に縛った清掃員も助けてやりたかったが、火元がそちらの方向だったので助けることが出来なかったことだけが<tips=3>クリス</tips>の心残りだ。","en":"<tips=3>Chris’s</tips> sole regret was that he could not rescue the cleaner they had bound on the way in. The fire had started in that direction, making it impossible to reach her.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r561","rowIndex":561,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　最初の襲撃で<tips=4>馬明</tips>たちが破壊した受付を乗り越え外に出ると、<tips=9>Y地区</tips>特有の雨がしとしと降っている。建物の方を見ると、すでに上の方の窓からも炎の赤い舌が噴き出していた。この程度の雨では、炎の勢いの方が上回るだろう。","en":"They climbed over the reception desk <tips=4>Ma Ming’s</tips> men had destroyed in the initial assault and stepped outside into the gentle rain peculiar to <tips=9>Y District</tips>. When they looked back, red tongues of flame were already bursting from windows high above. Such light rain could never overcome the force of the fire.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r562","rowIndex":562,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　クリスがふと振り返ると、建物から脱出したものたちが呆然と炎を眺めている姿が目に映った。","en":"When Chris happened to turn around, he saw those who had escaped the building standing dumbstruck, staring at the flames.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r563","rowIndex":563,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　情事の最中に追い出された半裸の客や女がいれば、きらびやかなドレス姿の女も、作業着を着た下働きの従業員も、そして武装した<tips=3>クリス</tips>の部下たちも、さまざまな立場のものが、さまざまな格好をして、しかし同じような無心の表情で炎を見上げている。","en":"Among them were half-naked patrons and women driven out in the midst of sex, women in glittering dresses, low-ranking employees in work clothes, and <tips=3>Chris’s</tips> armed subordinates—people of every station, dressed in every fashion, yet all gazing up at the blaze with the same vacant expressions.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r564","rowIndex":564,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼らすべての瞳に、その猛火を分け与えられたように小さな赤い炎が映っている。","en":"A tiny red flame was reflected in every one of their eyes, as though each had been granted a portion of the inferno.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r565","rowIndex":565,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=3>クリス</tips>にとって、この光景は終生忘れ得ないものとなった。","en":"For <tips=3>Chris</tips>, it became a sight he would remember until the end of his life.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r566","rowIndex":566,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それから四日後、教会通りから一本路地に入った小さな診療所のベッドで<tips=5>太刀川</tips>は目を覚ました。","en":"Four days later, <tips=5>Tachikawa</tips> woke in a bed at a small clinic one alley off Church Street.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r567","rowIndex":567,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼は金具の塗装があちこちはげて錆が浮かんだベッドの上で、腕が点滴に繋がれ、おむつをはかされ、尿道には排尿用のカテーテルが差し込まれている自分を発見する。身動きすると右足がひどく痛んだ。負傷したときは気が立っていたためかすり傷くらいに思っていたが、思いのほか重い怪我らしく、包帯でぐるぐると膝の辺りが巻かれている。","en":"He found himself lying on a bed whose metal fittings were flaking paint and spotted with rust, with an IV in his arm, a diaper around his waist, and a urinary catheter inserted into his urethra. When he tried to move, his right leg hurt terribly. Perhaps because he had been so keyed up when he was injured, he had thought it no worse than a scratch, but the injury seemed more serious than expected, and his knee was wound round and round with bandages.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r568","rowIndex":568,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　部屋をざっと見回すと、古い木造建築で、柱の木材は経年によって茶色く変色し、白い壁紙はその端が剥がれかけていた。窓が開いていて、その向こうにこの街では珍しい青い空と白い雲がみえる。ときどき風がそよいで、窓に吊された風鈴が音を立てる。","en":"A quick look around revealed an old wooden building. Age had stained the timber pillars brown, and the edges of the white wallpaper had begun to peel. The window stood open, showing blue sky and white clouds of a kind seldom seen in this city. Now and then a breeze stirred the wind chime hanging there and set it ringing.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r569","rowIndex":569,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　田舎の祖父母の家をなんとなく思い出されるようなレトロな光景で、<tips=5>太刀川</tips>は、ここ何年もの暗い出来事が、すべて少年の自分が見た長い長い悪夢だったような錯覚さえおこしそうだ。","en":"The old-fashioned scene vaguely reminded him of his grandparents’ home in the country. <tips=5>Tachikawa</tips> could almost fall under the illusion that all the dark events of the past several years had been nothing but a long, long nightmare dreamed by his boyhood self.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r570","rowIndex":570,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そうして本物の自分はあの薄くて畳のかたさが背中にこたえる寝床の中で目を覚まし、祖母が焼いてくれたしょっぱいタラコと、椎茸と豆腐の入った味噌汁で、白米をこれでもかというほど沢山食べるのだ。これからはじまる一日を、どんなやりかたで目一杯楽しんでやろうかと計画を練りながら。","en":"His real self would awaken in that thin bed, the hardness of the tatami pressing into his back, then eat bowl upon bowl of white rice with the salty cod roe his grandmother had grilled and miso soup full of shiitake mushrooms and tofu—all while planning how to squeeze every last bit of enjoyment from the day about to begin.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r571","rowIndex":571,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=52>ミアオ</tips>……」","en":"“<tips=52>Miao</tips>...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r572","rowIndex":572,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　少年時代の記憶に思いをはせていたはずなのに、ふと口から漏れたのは全く関係ない別の名だった。","en":"Though his thoughts had been wandering through childhood memories, the name that suddenly escaped his lips belonged to something else entirely.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r573","rowIndex":573,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=5>太刀川</tips>はそんな自分に驚きつつ、そして最後の瞬間の少し前に見せた彼女の微笑みが脳裏に浮かんだ。そうするともう、とめどもなく思い出が彼の感情を埋め尽くし、それは涙となって流れ出た。","en":"<tips=5>Tachikawa</tips> surprised himself. Then he remembered the smile she had shown shortly before the end. Memory after memory flooded in, filled his heart, and spilled from him as tears.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r574","rowIndex":574,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　泣き終わるのを見計らうように中年の看護師が姿を現し、<tips=5>太刀川</tips>は彼女に<tips=3>クリス</tips>を呼ぶよう頼んだ。","en":"A middle-aged nurse appeared as though she had waited for his weeping to end. <tips=5>Tachikawa</tips> asked her to summon <tips=3>Chris</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r575","rowIndex":575,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「おう、やっとお目覚めかい。もう起きないんじゃないかと思ってたよ」","en":"“Hey, finally awake? I was beginning to think you’d never wake up.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー（過去・青年）","displayName":"Chris Tse (Past, Young)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r576","rowIndex":576,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=3>クリス</tips>は冗談めかして笑う。","en":"<tips=3>Chris</tips> laughed, making light of it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r577","rowIndex":577,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「私は四日も眠り込んでいたのですね」","en":"“I was asleep for four whole days, wasn’t I?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"太刀川良馬過去","displayName":"Ryoma Tachikawa (Past)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r578","rowIndex":578,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうだよ。あんたが寝ている間に後始末は大体終わった。<tips=68>木下組</tips>はもう完全に手を引くだろう」","en":"“That's right. While you were asleep, we tied up most of the loose ends. The <tips=68>Kinoshita-gumi</tips> should pull out for good now.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー（過去・青年）","displayName":"Chris Tse (Past, Young)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r579","rowIndex":579,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうですか……」","en":"“I see...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"太刀川良馬過去","displayName":"Ryoma Tachikawa (Past)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r580","rowIndex":580,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=5>太刀川</tips>はそう言って目を細めた。","en":"<tips=5>Tachikawa</tips> narrowed his eyes as he spoke.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r581","rowIndex":581,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「しかし、無茶苦茶するなあ。あんなの、誰だって危険だってわかるだろうに。本当に二度と目が覚めなくてもおかしくなかったんじゃないか？」","en":"“But that was completely insane. Anyone could tell how dangerous it was. You really might never have woken up again, you know?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー（過去・青年）","displayName":"Chris Tse (Past, Young)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r582","rowIndex":582,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おどける<tips=3>クリス</tips>の様子に、<tips=5>太刀川</tips>は薄く苦笑して、","en":"<tips=5>Tachikawa</tips> gave a faint, wry smile at <tips=3>Chris’s</tips> bantering manner.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r583","rowIndex":583,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「確かに後先考えずに行動してしまいましたが、でも、必要なことだったんです。私は目をそらすわけにはいかなかった……」","en":"“It is true that I acted without thinking of the consequences. But it was something that had to be done. I could not look away...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"太刀川良馬過去","displayName":"Ryoma Tachikawa (Past)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r584","rowIndex":584,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まあ、満足出来たのならいいけどよ」","en":"“Well, if you’re satisfied, I guess that’s fine.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー（過去・青年）","displayName":"Chris Tse (Past, Young)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r585","rowIndex":585,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=3>クリス</tips>は口ではそう言うが、顔は納得出来ない様子だった。","en":"<tips=3>Chris</tips> said the words, but his face showed that he was not convinced.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r586","rowIndex":586,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　うっかり感情を盗んでしまわないよう、その顔から視線をそらしている<tips=5>太刀川</tips>は、彼の表情に気づかぬまま言葉を続ける。","en":"With his gaze averted from the other man’s face lest he accidentally steal his emotions, <tips=5>Tachikawa</tips> failed to notice the expression and continued.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r587","rowIndex":587,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「死の瞬間を迎えた人間と感覚を共有したのは今回が初めてだったのですがね、とても不思議な感覚でした」","en":"“It was my first time sharing the senses of someone at the moment of death, you see. It was a very strange experience.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"太刀川良馬過去","displayName":"Ryoma Tachikawa (Past)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r588","rowIndex":588,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「不思議な感覚？」","en":"“A strange sensation?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー（過去・青年）","displayName":"Chris Tse (Past, Young)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r589","rowIndex":589,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それは、ただ死に行く人の心だからというだけじゃ説明がつかない。彼女が<tips=17>タイプB</tips>だったせいもあるのでしょう……とても独特で不思議な世界で、体験したことのないものでした。その余韻として、しこりのようなものが心に残っているんです。……いや、しこりというより、もっと別の……彼女の魂が私の心のなかに存在しているような。わかりますか？」","en":"“It cannot be explained simply by the fact that hers was the mind of someone dying. Perhaps her being a <tips=17>Type B</tips> had something to do with it... It was a unique and mysterious world, unlike anything I had ever experienced. As its lingering echo, something like a knot remains in my mind. ...No, not a knot, but something else altogether... as though her soul exists inside my mind. Do you understand?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"太刀川良馬過去","displayName":"Ryoma Tachikawa (Past)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r590","rowIndex":590,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「わかるような、わからないような……。いや、やっぱり全然わからねえな！」","en":"“I think I do... and then I think I don’t... No, I don’t understand at all!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー（過去・青年）","displayName":"Chris Tse (Past, Young)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r591","rowIndex":591,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=3>クリス</tips>はそう言って苦笑する。","en":"<tips=3>Chris</tips> said it with a wry smile.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r592","rowIndex":592,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうですか、残念ですね。でも、これはとても重要なもののような気がするんですよ。何か新しい価値観を与えてくれそうな……。あの世界の向こうには、とても穏やかで平和な……満ち足りた……そんなものがあるような気がします。もしかしたら逆に酷くおそろしいものかもしれませんが」","en":"“I see. That is unfortunate. But I feel as though this is something extremely important. As though it might give me some new way of seeing the world... I have the sense that beyond that world lies something extraordinarily tranquil and peaceful... a sense of perfect fulfillment. Though it may instead be something terrible and frightening.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"太刀川良馬過去","displayName":"Ryoma Tachikawa (Past)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r593","rowIndex":593,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そこで<tips=5>太刀川</tips>は一旦言葉を切って<tips=3>クリス</tips>の顔を見る。彼は肩をすくめて「わからない」というジェスチャーをとってみせる。","en":"<tips=5>Tachikawa</tips> broke off there and looked at <tips=3>Chris</tips>. Chris shrugged, making a gesture that said, “I don’t understand.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r594","rowIndex":594,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「とにかく、私は今までこの能力を疎ましく思ったりしたものですが、おかげで、今はそんな風には感じません。サイキックとして生まれて、人の心を分かち合う力を与えられて、幸運だったと素直に思えます」","en":"“In any event, there were times when I resented this ability, but thanks to what happened, I no longer feel that way. I can honestly say I was fortunate to be born a psychic and given the power to share another person’s heart.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"太刀川良馬過去","displayName":"Ryoma Tachikawa (Past)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r595","rowIndex":595,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうか、それは良かった」","en":"“I see. That’s good.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー（過去・青年）","displayName":"Chris Tse (Past, Young)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r596","rowIndex":596,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=3>クリス</tips>は相手の言葉が理解出来ないまま複雑な表情でそう言うと、明るく切り換え、","en":"<tips=3>Chris</tips> said this with a complicated expression, still unable to understand what the other man meant. Then he brightened and changed tack:","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r597","rowIndex":597,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……まあ、とにかく、本当に良かったよ！　目を覚ましてくれてさ。その調子ですぐに元気になって、バリバリ働いてもらわなくちゃな！　これから<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>はどんどん大きくなる。それと同時に、おれとドクターの仕事もスケールが大きくなってゆくだろう。もう誰にも馬鹿にさせない。地を這い回るチンピラじゃないんだ。あんただって、この世界に来たことを素直に喜べるようになるだろう。なあ、おれ、ドクターにはどんなポストがいいのか考えてたんだぜ？」","en":"“...Well, anyway, I'm really glad! Glad you woke up. Now hurry up and get well, because I need you working your tail off! <tips=7>YS</tips> is only going to keep growing. And as it does, the work you and I do will grow in scale along with it. No one will ever look down on us again. We're not petty thugs crawling in the dirt anymore. You'll come to be genuinely glad you entered this world, too. You know, I've been thinking about what sort of position would suit you, Doctor.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー（過去・青年）","displayName":"Chris Tse (Past, Young)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r598","rowIndex":598,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうですか……」","en":"“I see...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"太刀川良馬過去","displayName":"Ryoma Tachikawa (Past)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r599","rowIndex":599,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=5>太刀川</tips>は申し訳なさそうに顔を歪めて、","en":"<tips=5>Tachikawa</tips> winced apologetically.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r600","rowIndex":600,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それはとても光栄です。しかし、その話を請けることは出来ません」","en":"“I am greatly honored. But I cannot accept.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"太刀川良馬過去","displayName":"Ryoma Tachikawa (Past)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r601","rowIndex":601,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どうしてだい？」","en":"“Why not?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー（過去・青年）","displayName":"Chris Tse (Past, Young)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r602","rowIndex":602,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「また、医者に戻ろうと思うんです。だから、この仕事はここまでにしたいのです」","en":"“I intend to return to practicing medicine. So I would like our work together to end here.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"太刀川良馬過去","displayName":"Ryoma Tachikawa (Past)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r603","rowIndex":603,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「おい、ここまで二人でやって来てそれはないだろう？」","en":"“Hey, after we’ve come this far together, you can’t just walk away.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー（過去・青年）","displayName":"Chris Tse (Past, Young)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r604","rowIndex":604,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=3>クリス</tips>の念願だった<tips=18>ローズ・クラブ</tips>打倒は果たされ、私の望みだった<tips=52>ミアオ</tips>との再会も叶いました。ここでひとまず私たちの関係は終わりにしましょう」","en":"“<tips=3>Chris’s</tips> long-held wish of bringing down the <tips=18>Rose Club</tips> has been fulfilled, and so has my wish to see <tips=52>Miao</tips> again. For the time being, let us end our association here.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"太刀川良馬過去","displayName":"Ryoma Tachikawa (Past)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r605","rowIndex":605,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ドクター……」","en":"“Doctor...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー（過去・青年）","displayName":"Chris Tse (Past, Young)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r606","rowIndex":606,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=3>クリス</tips>はじっと<tips=5>太刀川</tips>の顔を見つめたが、彼の固い決意はその表情にあらわれていた。","en":"<tips=3>Chris</tips> searched <tips=5>Tachikawa's</tips> face, but the other man's firm resolve was plain in his expression.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r607","rowIndex":607,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　仕方なく溜息をつき、","en":"Left with no choice, he sighed:","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r608","rowIndex":608,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「わかった。……ドクターがここまでだって言うなら、しかたねえな。残念だけどさ……」","en":"“All right. ...If you say this is where it ends, Doctor, then I guess that’s that. I hate to see you go...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー（過去・青年）","displayName":"Chris Tse (Past, Young)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r609","rowIndex":609,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=3>クリス</tips>はもっと何か言いたそうだったが、言わず、頭をボリボリと乱暴に掻いた。","en":"<tips=3>Chris</tips> looked as though he had more to say, but kept it to himself and scratched vigorously at his head.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r610","rowIndex":610,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「別に遠くへ行くわけじゃありませんよ。街の外れに<tips=17>タイプＢ</tips>専用の古い病院があったでしょう？　あそこで働けないかなと思って」","en":"“It isn’t as though I’m going far. There was an old hospital reserved for <tips=17>Type Bs</tips> on the outskirts of the city, wasn’t there? I thought I might see whether they would let me work there.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"太刀川良馬過去","displayName":"Ryoma Tachikawa (Past)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r611","rowIndex":611,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「えっ『<tips=6>タイプＢ収容所</tips>』のことか？　知ってるのか？　あそこの患者は頭のイカレた<tips=17>タイプＢ</tips>ばっかりなんだぜ？　何が楽しくって、そんなことを」","en":"“What, the ‘<tips=6>Type B Internment Center</tips>’? You know about it? The patients there are all <tips=17>Type Bs</tips> who are out of their minds! What could possibly be enjoyable about—”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー（過去・青年）","displayName":"Chris Tse (Past, Young)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r612","rowIndex":612,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「私は今まで発症した<tips=17>タイプＢ</tips>の目を見たことがありません。怖かったからです。でも、今は違う。彼らの心を見てみたい。きっとそこに、<tips=52>ミアオ</tips>が残してくれた宿題に対する手がかりがあるはずなのです」","en":"“Until now, I have never looked into the eyes of a symptomatic <tips=17>Type B</tips>. I was afraid. But that has changed. I want to look into their hearts. I am certain that somewhere within them lies a clue to the task <tips=52>Miao</tips> left me.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"太刀川良馬過去","displayName":"Ryoma Tachikawa (Past)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r613","rowIndex":613,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「理解出来ねえな……」","en":"“I don’t understand you...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー（過去・青年）","displayName":"Chris Tse (Past, Young)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r614","rowIndex":614,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=3>クリス</tips>ははあと溜息をついて、","en":"<tips=3>Chris</tips> let out a long sigh.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r615","rowIndex":615,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まあ、理解は出来ないが、あんたらしいぜ。なんたって、そもそも行きずりの女のために全てを捨ててギャングの手伝いをするような男だからな」","en":"“Well, I don’t understand, but it certainly sounds like you. After all, you’re the kind of man who would throw everything away for a woman he met in passing and go to work for a gang.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー（過去・青年）","displayName":"Chris Tse (Past, Young)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r616","rowIndex":616,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　残念そうに言うと、口を歪めて複雑な笑いを浮かべた。","en":"He spoke regretfully, then twisted his mouth into a conflicted smile.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r617","rowIndex":617,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ありがとう<tips=3>クリス</tips>。おかげで貴重な体験が出来ました」","en":"“Thank you, <tips=3>Chris</tips>. Thanks to you, I had an invaluable experience.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"太刀川良馬過去","displayName":"Ryoma Tachikawa (Past)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r618","rowIndex":618,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「こちらこそ、ドクター。あんたがいなきゃ、この成功はなかった」","en":"“And thank you, Doctor. We never could have achieved this without you.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー（過去・青年）","displayName":"Chris Tse (Past, Young)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r619","rowIndex":619,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そう言ってから、<tips=3>クリス</tips>は鼻を啜り、","en":"After speaking, <tips=3>Chris</tips> sniffed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r620","rowIndex":620,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……あの帰りに雨に打たれてから少し風邪気味でね。おまけに、ひどい眠気で、どこでもかまわず眠たくなっちまうんだ。疲れてるのかな」","en":"“...I’ve had a bit of a cold since I got soaked in the rain on the way back. And on top of that, I get terribly sleepy wherever I am. Maybe I’m tired.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー（過去・青年）","displayName":"Chris Tse (Past, Young)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r621","rowIndex":621,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「大丈夫ですか？　診察は受けましたか？」","en":"“Are you all right? Have you seen a doctor?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"太刀川良馬過去","displayName":"Ryoma Tachikawa (Past)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r622","rowIndex":622,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どうってことないさ」","en":"“It’s nothing.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー（過去・青年）","displayName":"Chris Tse (Past, Young)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r623","rowIndex":623,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=3>クリス</tips>はふざけたような笑みを見せて、","en":"With a playful smile, <tips=3>Chris</tips> said,","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r624","rowIndex":624,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まあ、気持ちはわかった。今後は他人として振る舞うよ。ギャングとつき合いがあるとなっちゃ、医者の仕事に差し支えるだろうからな。……でも、いつでも帰って来ていいんだぜ？　なんたって、<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>は半分あんたが作ったようなものなんだから」","en":"“Well, I understand how you feel. From now on, we’ll act like strangers. Being associated with a gang would interfere with your work as a doctor, after all. ...But you can always come back, you hear? <tips=7>YS</tips> is practically half your creation.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー（過去・青年）","displayName":"Chris Tse (Past, Young)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r625","rowIndex":625,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ありがとう」","en":"“Thank you.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"太刀川良馬過去","displayName":"Ryoma Tachikawa (Past)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r626","rowIndex":626,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=5>太刀川</tips>は一言だけそう返した。","en":"That was <tips=5>Tachikawa’s</tips> only reply.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r627","rowIndex":627,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=3>クリス</tips>も、もうそれ以上は余計な言葉は口にせず、","en":"<tips=3>Chris</tips> said no more than was necessary:","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r628","rowIndex":628,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「お大事に」","en":"“Take care.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー（過去・青年）","displayName":"Chris Tse (Past, Young)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r629","rowIndex":629,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　最後に一言そう言い、病室を出て行った。","en":"With that last remark, he left the hospital room.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r630","rowIndex":630,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ドアがパタンと音を立ててしまったあと、<tips=5>太刀川</tips>は目を閉じ、そしてすぐに安らかな寝息を立て始めた。","en":"After the door closed with a soft click, <tips=5>Tachikawa</tips> shut his eyes and was soon breathing peacefully in sleep.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r631","rowIndex":631,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　これ以降、彼らは別々の道を歩きはじめた。","en":"From that point on, they began walking separate paths.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X7:r632","rowIndex":632,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして、次に彼らが出会うのは十五年もの長い月日が流れたあと――つまり、<tips=3>クリス</tips>が病に倒れ、死の床についてからのことである。","en":"The next time they met would be after fifteen long years had passed—after <tips=3>Chris</tips> fell ill and lay on his deathbed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}}]},{"position":26,"code":"X8","unitId":"X8","rows":[{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r1","rowIndex":1,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=41>グランドタワー</tips>最上階の一番大きな部屋は第三代<tips=81>龍頭</tips><tips=1>謝亮</tips>の執務室である。そしてその部屋に付き従うようにいくつかの部屋があり、そこには<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>の最高幹部たちの部屋となっていた。","en":"The largest room on the top floor of <tips=41>Grand Tower</tips> is the office of the third <tips=81>Longtou</tips>, <tips=1>Tse Leung</tips>. Several smaller rooms cluster around it as though in attendance, serving as offices for the highest-ranking officers of <tips=7>YS</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r2","rowIndex":2,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=28>トーマス・リャオ</tips>もその部屋の一つを与えられ、日中はそこで執務を行っている。今日も机に座ってパソコンを眺めているのだが、モニターに並んだ数字を前に、閉口しきっていた。","en":"<tips=28>Thomas Liao</tips> was given one of those rooms and works there during the day. Today, too, he sits at his desk staring at his computer, utterly at a loss before the figures arrayed across the monitor.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r3","rowIndex":3,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　難しい顔をして、唸ったり、溜息をついたり、首を捻ったりしており、その様子を彼のボディーガード兼秘書である<tips=29>アイス</tips>が心配そうに見守っている。","en":"His face grave, he groans, sighs, and tilts his head this way and that, while <tips=29>Ice</tips>—his bodyguard and secretary—watches with concern.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r4","rowIndex":4,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>は<tips=1>謝亮</tips>による新体制になった。その時、<tips=27>廖志明</tips>のファミリーは執行部に吸収され、<tips=28>トーマス</tips>自身もこうして幹部の一人として執行部に組み込まれた。とは言え、現状のところあくまでも名目上の所属がかわったというだけで、ファミリーを解散させられたわけではなく、組織のかたちはそのまま残されている。","en":"<tips=7>YS</tips> came under a new regime led by <tips=1>Tse Leung</tips>. At that time, <tips=27>Liao Chi-ming’s</tips> Family was absorbed into the central leadership, with <tips=28>Thomas</tips> himself brought in as one of its officers. For the moment, however, the change is nominal: the Family has not been forced to disband, and its organization remains intact.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r5","rowIndex":5,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=28>トーマス</tips>は父の業務を引き継いで、この旧<tips=74>廖ファミリー</tips>のリーダーとして執務に当たっているというわけだ。","en":"Having inherited his father's duties, <tips=28>Thomas</tips> now handles the affairs of the former <tips=74>Liao Family</tips> as its leader.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r6","rowIndex":6,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼が今脂汗をかき、苦しみながら眺めている数字の羅列はファミリーの月間収支報告だった。そこには、直接経営するヤミ金業者や飲食店の売り上げや支出、一般店舗から徴収したみかじめ料など、金銭に関するありとあらゆる数字がまとめられている。","en":"The rows of figures he now studies in torment, beads of greasy sweat standing on his brow, make up the Family's monthly financial report. They compile every conceivable number pertaining to money: the income and expenses of the loan-sharking operations and restaurants it runs directly, the protection money collected from ordinary shops, and much more besides.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r7","rowIndex":7,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　この数字の見方は、父の代からの秘書である李という男から説明を受けてはいるのだが、リーダーとしてこの数字をどう理解し、組織運営に反映させていいのかさっぱりわからず、ひたすら苦しんでいるのである。","en":"A man named Lee, who had served as secretary since his father’s time, had explained how to read the figures. Thomas nevertheless had no idea how a leader was supposed to interpret them or put them to use in running the organization. He could only sit there and suffer.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r8","rowIndex":8,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼は学校の授業でも、数字を扱う教科は不得意で、数学の試験の時間は真っ赤な顔で空欄ばかりのテスト用紙を眺めて過ごしていた。数字に対しては、ほとんどアレルギーのような苦手意識がある。","en":"Even in school, Thomas had been poor at subjects involving numbers. During mathematics examinations, he would spend the entire period staring red-faced at an answer sheet covered in blanks. He has something very nearly like an allergy to numbers.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r9","rowIndex":9,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あの、李さんもざっと目を通すだけでいいとおっしゃっていましたし、そんなにむきになって理解しようとしなくても良いのではないのでしょうか？」","en":"“Um, Mr. Lee did say you only had to skim them. Perhaps you needn't try quite so hard to understand everything?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アイス","displayName":"Ice","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r10","rowIndex":10,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　見るに見かねた<tips=29>アイス</tips>がそう提案するが、<tips=28>トーマス</tips>は首を横に振る。","en":"Unable to watch any longer, <tips=29>Ice</tips> offered the suggestion. <tips=28>Thomas</tips> shook his head.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r11","rowIndex":11,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「父さんはこういう数字を自分で沢山見て、ずばずばとリーダーシップを発揮していたんでしょう？　それならば、僕も出来る限りやらなくちゃ」","en":"“Father pored over lots of figures like these himself and made one decisive call after another, didn't he? Then I have to do everything I can too.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r12","rowIndex":12,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「お父様は元々商売をなさっていて、こうした数字の扱いには精通していらっしゃったわけですから。<tips=28>トーマス</tips>様はお父様とは違うのですし、それはみな理解していますから、<tips=28>トーマス</tips>様なりのやり方でいいのではないかと……」","en":"“Your father was originally a businessman and was thoroughly familiar with handling figures like these. You are different from your father, Master <tips=28>Thomas</tips>, and everyone understands that. I believe it would be perfectly acceptable for you to do things in your own way, Master <tips=28>Thomas</tips>...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アイス","displayName":"Ice","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r13","rowIndex":13,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そう言われても、やはり<tips=28>トーマス</tips>としては素直に受け入れるわけには行かない。しかし、やりなれないことをして既に疲労困憊だった。","en":"Even put that way, <tips=28>Thomas</tips> could not simply accept the advice. Yet the unfamiliar work had already exhausted him.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r14","rowIndex":14,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　いつ淹れたかもうわからないすっかり冷めた珈琲を飲み、溜息をついて、椅子ごとくるりと<tips=29>アイス</tips>に振り返る。","en":"He takes a sip of coffee that has long since gone cold—he can no longer remember when it was brewed—sighs, and swivels around in his chair to face <tips=29>Ice</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r15","rowIndex":15,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「こういう数字って、他のボスたちも見たりしているの？」","en":"“Do the other bosses look at figures like these too?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r16","rowIndex":16,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「このような細かい数字を自らチェックするところはあまりないはずです」","en":"“I don't believe many of them personally inspect figures this detailed.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アイス","displayName":"Ice","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r17","rowIndex":17,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうか……」","en":"“I see...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r18","rowIndex":18,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=28>トーマス</tips>は安心したように溜息をつく。","en":"<tips=28>Thomas</tips> released a sigh of relief.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r19","rowIndex":19,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あ、でも、確か<tips=1>謝亮</tips>様は、現場で使っている細かい書類まで、ほとんど目を通しているとか……」","en":"“Oh, but I hear that Master <tips=1>Tse Leung</tips> looks through almost everything, even the detailed paperwork used in the field...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アイス","displayName":"Ice","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r20","rowIndex":20,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=2>阿亮</tips>はそこまでやってるのか。さすがだね……」","en":"“<tips=2>Ah Leung</tips> goes that far too? Impressive...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r21","rowIndex":21,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=28>トーマス</tips>はさっき得たばかりの安心感を失い、溜息をつく。","en":"<tips=28>Thomas</tips> lost the reassurance he had only just found and sighed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r22","rowIndex":22,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=28>トーマス</tips>様、もう『<tips=2>阿亮</tips>』様ではなく、『<tips=81>龍頭</tips>』様と呼ぶのではなかったのですか？」","en":"“Master <tips=28>Thomas</tips>, hadn't you decided to call him ‘the <tips=81>Longtou</tips>’ rather than ‘<tips=2>Ah Leung</tips>’?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アイス","displayName":"Ice","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r23","rowIndex":23,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=29>アイス</tips>が話題を変えたのは気を遣ってのことだろう。","en":"<tips=29>Ice</tips> had probably changed the subject to spare his feelings.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r24","rowIndex":24,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あ、またそう言っていたかい？　意識してるつもりなんだけれど、どうしても忘れちゃう。……まあ、とにかく、<tips=81>龍頭</tips>がそこまでやっているのなら、僕だって自分でもうちょっとやらないといけないな」","en":"“Oh, did I call him that again? I’m trying to keep it in mind, but I just can't seem to remember. ...Well, in any case, if the <tips=81>Longtou</tips> goes that far, I have to do a little more myself too.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r25","rowIndex":25,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=1>謝亮</tips>様と同じことをなさらなくてもいいではないですか」","en":"“You needn’t do exactly what Master <tips=1>Tse Leung</tips> does.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アイス","displayName":"Ice","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r26","rowIndex":26,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうはいかないよ！　きみは笑うだろうけど、僕は彼をライバルだと思ってるんだからね。お互いを高め合う関係になりたいんだ。まだほど遠いけど……」","en":"“That won't do! You may laugh, but I really do consider him my rival. I want us to have the kind of relationship where we push each other to greater heights. Though I'm still a long way from that...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r27","rowIndex":27,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「私は笑ったりはしません」","en":"“I would never laugh at you.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アイス","displayName":"Ice","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r28","rowIndex":28,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうか。ありがとう」","en":"“I see. Thank you.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r29","rowIndex":29,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=28>トーマス</tips>は苦い顔をしながら、またモニターの方を向くが、数字の羅列が目に入った途端頭がクラクラとする。","en":"Still wearing a pained expression, <tips=28>Thomas</tips> turns back to the monitor. The instant the rows of figures come into view, his head begins to spin.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r30","rowIndex":30,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ちょ、ちょっと休憩……」","en":"“I-I need a little break...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r31","rowIndex":31,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼は椅子を立ち気分転換に窓の外を眺めるが、三十五階からの眺めは高所恐怖症の<tips=28>トーマス</tips>にとって、やはり頭をクラクラとさせる要素でしかなかった。","en":"He rose from his chair and looked out the window for a change of pace. But for <tips=28>Thomas</tips>, who was afraid of heights, the view from the thirty-fifth floor only made his head spin all over again.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r32","rowIndex":32,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　顔を真っ青にしながら椅子に戻り、頭を抱える。","en":"His face deathly pale, he returned to his chair and clutched his head.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r33","rowIndex":33,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=28>トーマス</tips>様、大丈夫ですか？」","en":"“Master <tips=28>Thomas</tips>, are you all right?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アイス","displayName":"Ice","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r34","rowIndex":34,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「平気だよ。平気……あ、そうだ<tips=29>アイス</tips>……」","en":"“I’m fine. Fine... Oh, that’s right, <tips=29>Ice</tips>...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r35","rowIndex":35,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=28>トーマス</tips>は顔を上げて、","en":"<tips=28>Thomas</tips> looked up.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r36","rowIndex":36,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あのベトナム料理屋のタンさんの娘さんが、独立してスイーツの屋台をはじめたんだって。結構評判いいらしいから、ちょっと視察に行かないか？」","en":"“I heard the daughter of Mr. Tan from that Vietnamese restaurant has struck out on her own and opened a sweets stall. It seems to be doing quite well. Why don't we go conduct an inspection?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r37","rowIndex":37,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「視察……ですか？」","en":"“An inspection...?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アイス","displayName":"Ice","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r38","rowIndex":38,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　急に生き返ったような生き生きとした表情で語りかける<tips=28>トーマス</tips>に、<tips=29>アイス</tips>は若干戸惑いを浮かべつつ応えた。","en":"<tips=28>Thomas</tips> speaks with the sudden animation of a man restored to life. <tips=29>Ice</tips> answers him, looking slightly bewildered.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r39","rowIndex":39,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうだよ。視察だよ。数字も大事だけれど、自分の傘下のお店が、どんな美味しいものを作ってるか、この目と舌で確認するのも大事な仕事だよね。さあ、そうと決まれば今すぐ行こう！」","en":"“That's right—an inspection. Figures are important, but surely it's also a vital part of my work to see and taste for myself what delicious things the shops under me are making. Now that we've settled that, let's go at once!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r40","rowIndex":40,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あ、は、はい」","en":"“Ah... Y-yes.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アイス","displayName":"Ice","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r41","rowIndex":41,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=28>トーマス</tips>は強引に<tips=29>アイス</tips>の手を掴むと、その丸っこい身体を鞠のように弾ませながら、小走りで部屋を出た。","en":"<tips=28>Thomas</tips> took <tips=29>Ice</tips> firmly by the hand and trotted out of the room, his round body bouncing like a ball.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r42","rowIndex":42,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「外出なさるのなら、李さんか誰かに連絡をしておかないと……」","en":"“If you are going out, we ought to inform Mr. Lee or someone else...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アイス","displayName":"Ice","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r43","rowIndex":43,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「良いって良いって、ちょっとの時間だし、出る時に駐車場の人に言っておけば大丈夫だから」","en":"“It’s fine, it’s fine. We’ll only be gone a little while. I’ll tell the people in the parking garage on our way out.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r44","rowIndex":44,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「しかし、また怒られますよ」","en":"“But you’ll be scolded again.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アイス","displayName":"Ice","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r45","rowIndex":45,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=29>アイス</tips>はあきれ顔でそう言った。","en":"<tips=29>Ice</tips> said with an exasperated look.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r46","rowIndex":46,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　つい先日も、今のように視察と行って街に出かけたきり、<tips=59>暗闇通り</tips>の子供たちと夕方まで遊び惚け、あの白髪の李老人にいつものしかめっつらで小言を言われたばかりなのである。","en":"Only a few days earlier, Thomas had likewise set out into the city on an “inspection,” only to spend the whole day playing with the children of <tips=59>Darkness Street</tips>. He had just received another lecture from the white-haired old Mr. Lee and his customary scowl.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r47","rowIndex":47,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いいんだよ。これも僕の仕事なんだから」","en":"“It’s all right. This is part of my work too.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r48","rowIndex":48,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=28>トーマス</tips>は全く気にすることなく笑っている。","en":"<tips=28>Thomas</tips> only smiles, utterly unconcerned.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r49","rowIndex":49,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　最上階から一階まで下りるには、十五階で一度エレベーターを乗り換えなくてはいけないのがこのビルのややこしいところだ。","en":"The confusing thing about this building is that getting from the top floor to the first requires changing elevators on the fifteenth floor.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r50","rowIndex":50,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その乗り換えのところで、二人は思わぬ人物に出くわした。","en":"At that transfer point, the two encountered people they had not expected to see.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r51","rowIndex":51,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　三人の屈強な男に囲まれるように、二人の若い女が立っている。彼らはエレベーターを待っており、こちらに背を向けてドアの上の階表示を見上げていた。","en":"Two young women stood surrounded by three powerfully built men. Waiting for the elevator, they had their backs turned as they looked up at the floor indicator above the doors.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r52","rowIndex":52,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「やあ」","en":"“Hello.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r53","rowIndex":53,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=28>トーマス</tips>は気さくに声をかける。","en":"<tips=28>Thomas</tips> calls out to them in his easygoing way.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r54","rowIndex":54,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　振り向いた二人の褐色の肌をした美女は、フェルナンデス家の娘、長女<tips=36>アウロラ</tips>と三女<tips=38>リタ</tips>だった。こうして近づくと二人とも香水の良いにおいがした。<tips=28>トーマス</tips>はその臭いにあてられながら、内心で（<tips=29>アイス</tips>も負けないくらい美人なんだから何かつければいいのに）と思った。","en":"The two beautiful, brown-skinned women who turn around are daughters of the Fernandes Family: <tips=36>Aurora</tips>, the eldest, and <tips=38>Rita</tips>, the third daughter. Up close, both carry the lovely scent of perfume. Slightly overcome by it, <tips=28>Thomas</tips> thinks, (<tips=29>Ice</tips> is every bit as beautiful as they are. She ought to wear a little perfume herself.)","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r55","rowIndex":55,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　まわりの屈強な男たちは<tips=75>フェルナンデス・ファミリー</tips>のメンバーで、彼女たちのボディーガードだ。","en":"The burly men around them were members of the <tips=75>Fernandes Family</tips> and served as the women’s bodyguards.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r56","rowIndex":56,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「こんにちは、今日は<tips=2>阿亮</tips>に用事かい？」","en":"“Hello. Are you here to see <tips=2>Ah Leung</tips> today?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r57","rowIndex":57,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=28>トーマス</tips>はいつも通りのニコニコとした円満な笑みで、この子供の頃からのつき合いである二人の女にそう言った。","en":"Wearing his usual amiable smile, <tips=28>Thomas</tips> addressed the two women he had known since childhood.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r58","rowIndex":58,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しかし、今日の二人は虫の居所が良くないようだった。","en":"Today, however, the two of them appeared to be in a very poor humor.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r59","rowIndex":59,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうよ。断りに来たの」","en":"“We are. We came to turn him down.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アウロラ・フェルナンデス","displayName":"Aurora Fernandes","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r60","rowIndex":60,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=36>アウロラ</tips>はぴりぴりとした苛立たしげな態度であった。","en":"<tips=36>Aurora’s</tips> manner bristled with irritation.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r61","rowIndex":61,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その隣の<tips=38>リタ</tips>も、いつも以上におどおどとして落ち着きがない。","en":"<tips=38>Rita</tips> beside her was even more nervous and restless than usual.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r62","rowIndex":62,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「断るって？　何を？」","en":"“Refuse what?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r63","rowIndex":63,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「結婚よ」","en":"“Marriage.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アウロラ・フェルナンデス","displayName":"Aurora Fernandes","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r64","rowIndex":64,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「誰の結婚？」","en":"“Whose marriage?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r65","rowIndex":65,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「もう大分前のことだけど、<tips=28>トミー</tips>は知らなかったの？　<tips=2>阿亮</tips>は<tips=38>リタ</tips>に結婚を申し込んでいたのよ」","en":"“It was some time ago now, but didn’t you know, <tips=28>Tommy</tips>? <tips=2>Ah Leung</tips> asked <tips=38>Rita</tips> to marry him.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アウロラ・フェルナンデス","displayName":"Aurora Fernandes","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r66","rowIndex":66,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「えーっ！」","en":"“What?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r67","rowIndex":67,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=28>トーマス</tips>は目を丸くして、辺りをはばからない大きな声で叫んでしまう。","en":"<tips=28>Thomas's</tips> eyes go wide, and he cries out at the top of his voice, heedless of everyone around them.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r68","rowIndex":68,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=2>阿亮</tips>が？　きみに？」","en":"“<tips=2>Ah Leung</tips>? He asked you?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r69","rowIndex":69,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「は、はい……」","en":"“Y-yes...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"リタ・フェルナンデス","displayName":"Rita Fernandes","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r70","rowIndex":70,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=38>リタ</tips>は気まずそうに頷く。","en":"<tips=38>Rita</tips> nods uneasily.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r71","rowIndex":71,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ちっとも知らなかった。驚いたなあ……。<tips=29>アイス</tips>は知ってた？」","en":"“I had no idea. What a surprise... Did you know, <tips=29>Ice</tips>?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r72","rowIndex":72,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=29>アイス</tips>は無言で首を横に振る。","en":"<tips=29>Ice</tips> silently shook her head.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r73","rowIndex":73,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうだよね。しかし、<tips=36>アウロラ</tips>はなんでそんなに怒ってるんだい？　別にプロポーズされたって、怒るようなことじゃないでしょう。もしかして、<tips=38>リタ</tips>がすごくいやだったの？　<tips=2>阿亮</tips>のことが嫌いだとか？　全然そうは見えなかったけど……」","en":"“I didn't think so. But why are you so angry, <tips=36>Aurora</tips>? A proposal isn't anything to get angry about, is it? Did <tips=38>Rita</tips> hate the idea that much? Does she dislike <tips=2>Ah Leung</tips>? It never looked that way to me...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r74","rowIndex":74,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=38>リタ</tips>は俯いたまま応えようとしない。","en":"<tips=38>Rita</tips> keeps her head bowed and makes no attempt to answer.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r75","rowIndex":75,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=28>トミー</tips>、<tips=2>阿亮</tips>はね、<tips=38>リタ</tips>を利用しようとしてるだけなのよ？」","en":"“<tips=28>Tommy</tips>, <tips=2>Ah Leung</tips> is only trying to use <tips=38>Rita</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アウロラ・フェルナンデス","displayName":"Aurora Fernandes","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r76","rowIndex":76,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　かわりに<tips=36>アウロラ</tips>がその美しく整えられた眉をしかめながら言う。","en":"<tips=36>Aurora</tips> answers in her place, her immaculately groomed brows drawing together.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r77","rowIndex":77,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あいつはいま、<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>に所属してるファミリーを全部自分の部下にしようとしてるでしょ？　うちのお父さんは絶対反対だし、私たちだってそんなの我慢がならないわ。だから、<tips=38>リタ</tips>を騙してそこから取り入ろうとしたの。<tips=38>リタ</tips>があいつのことを好きなのを知ってるから、気持ちを踏みにじったのよ！」","en":"“He's trying to bring every Family in <tips=7>YS</tips> under his command now, isn't he? Father will never accept that, and neither will we. So he deceived <tips=38>Rita</tips> and tried to use her as his way in. He knew <tips=38>Rita</tips> loved him, and he trampled all over her feelings!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アウロラ・フェルナンデス","displayName":"Aurora Fernandes","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r78","rowIndex":78,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=38>リタ</tips>、きみは彼のことが好きだったの？　それに、取り入るだなんて、そんな言い方は……」","en":"“<tips=38>Rita</tips>, were you in love with him? And saying he was trying to use her as his way in... surely you don't have to put it like that...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r79","rowIndex":79,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=28>トーマス</tips>は<tips=36>アウロラ</tips>の言葉に驚きつつそう訊ねた。","en":"<tips=28>Thomas</tips> asks, taken aback by <tips=36>Aurora's</tips> accusation.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r80","rowIndex":80,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=28>トミー</tips>、私は……」","en":"“<tips=28>Tommy</tips>, I...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"リタ・フェルナンデス","displayName":"Rita Fernandes","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r81","rowIndex":81,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=38>リタ</tips>が何か言いかけたが、<tips=36>アウロラ</tips>が遮った。","en":"<tips=38>Rita</tips> began to speak, but <tips=36>Aurora</tips> cut her off.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r82","rowIndex":82,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「他に言いようがないわ。卑怯なやり方よ。<tips=2>阿亮</tips>は変わってしまったわ。こんな冷酷なやつだとは思わなかった。彼が<tips=81>龍頭</tips>になってからしたことって、やりかたに反対する仲間をどんどん追放したり、殺したり、<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>の昔からのルールを変えたり、そんなことばっかり！　これからこの街はどうなってしまうの？」","en":"“There’s no other way to put it. It's a cowardly way to do things. <tips=2>Ah Leung</tips> has changed. I never knew he could be so cold-blooded. Since becoming <tips=81>Longtou</tips>, all he’s done is expel or kill comrades who oppose his methods and rewrite the old rules of <tips=7>YS</tips>! What is going to happen to this city?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アウロラ・フェルナンデス","displayName":"Aurora Fernandes","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r83","rowIndex":83,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=36>アウロラ</tips>はそう吐き捨てて、舌打ちをする。","en":"<tips=36>Aurora</tips> spat out the words and clicked her tongue.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r84","rowIndex":84,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=36>アウロラ</tips>の言い分もよくわかるけど、<tips=2>阿亮</tips>は<tips=2>阿亮</tips>で、色々考えてやってるんだと思うよ……。そんな、利用だなんて……」","en":"“I understand where <tips=36>Aurora</tips> is coming from, but <tips=2>Ah Leung</tips> has his side of things too. I'm sure <tips=2>Ah Leung</tips> has thought carefully about what he's doing... I wouldn't call it using her...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r85","rowIndex":85,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=28>トーマス</tips>は悲しげな表情でそう言った。","en":"<tips=28>Thomas</tips> says, looking sorrowful.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r86","rowIndex":86,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　心優しい彼にすれば、事情がどうあれ<tips=36>アウロラ</tips>がこんな風に<tips=1>謝亮</tips>のことを憎々しく罵っているという状況が耐えがたいものであった。","en":"Kindhearted as he was, Thomas could not bear to hear <tips=36>Aurora</tips> speak of <tips=1>Tse Leung</tips> with such bitter hatred, whatever the circumstances.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r87","rowIndex":87,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あいつは自分のことしか考えてないわ。ねえ、<tips=28>トミー</tips>、大体なんであなたはそんなヘラヘラとしていられるの？」","en":"“That man only thinks of himself. And <tips=28>Tommy</tips>, why are you able to stand there grinning like a fool?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アウロラ・フェルナンデス","displayName":"Aurora Fernandes","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r88","rowIndex":88,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=36>アウロラ</tips>がずいと顔を近づける。","en":"<tips=36>Aurora</tips> leans abruptly in close.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r89","rowIndex":89,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「え、僕？」","en":"“What, me?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r90","rowIndex":90,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=28>トーマス</tips>は若干のけぞりながらそうこたえる。","en":"<tips=28>Thomas</tips> leaned back slightly as he answered.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r91","rowIndex":91,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうよ。お父さんがあんな目に遭わされて、自分のファミリーは全部<tips=2>阿亮</tips>たちに奪われて、それで平気で居られるのが信じられない」","en":"“Yes, you. After what happened to your father—after <tips=2>Ah Leung</tips> and his people took your entire Family away from you—I can’t believe you can act as though nothing happened.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アウロラ・フェルナンデス","displayName":"Aurora Fernandes","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r92","rowIndex":92,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「と、父さんは<tips=2>阿亮</tips>の考えに納得して、相談役として身を引いただけで……」","en":"“F-Father accepted <tips=2>Ah Leung’s</tips> reasoning and simply stepped back into an advisory role...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r93","rowIndex":93,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　目をそらして言い訳をしようとする<tips=28>トーマス</tips>を、<tips=36>アウロラ</tips>は許さない。","en":"<tips=28>Thomas</tips> averts his eyes and tries to make excuses, but <tips=36>Aurora</tips> will not let him off so easily.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r94","rowIndex":94,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そんなの嘘だってみんな知ってるわよ。何か裏で争いがあって、それに<tips=27>廖志明</tips>が負けたんでしょ？　それなのに、あなたへらへらしちゃって、なんで怒らないの？　それでもあなた男なの？」","en":"“Everyone knows that’s a lie. Something happened behind the scenes, and <tips=27>Liao Chi-ming</tips> lost, didn’t he? And yet you stand there grinning. Why aren’t you angry? Are you even a man?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アウロラ・フェルナンデス","displayName":"Aurora Fernandes","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r95","rowIndex":95,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「元々は、父さんが発端だったんだし……それに、ぼ、僕は……」","en":"“Father was the one who started it... And b-besides, I...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r96","rowIndex":96,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=28>トーマス</tips>は顔を上げて<tips=36>アウロラ</tips>の視線を正面から見つめ返すと、","en":"<tips=28>Thomas</tips> looks up and meets <tips=36>Aurora’s</tips> gaze head-on.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r97","rowIndex":97,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=2>阿亮</tips>の考え方もわかるんだ。<tips=36>アウロラ</tips>が言うような、自分のことばかり考えているってわけじゃないと思う。もう少し、信じたらどうだろう？　いろいろ言われてるけど、僕の部下たちは約束通りすごく良くして貰ってるし、思った以上に<tips=69>義勝</tips>の人たちと連携がとれてる。彼はきっと<tips=36>アウロラ</tips>のことだってちゃんと考えていると思う。<tips=38>リタ</tips>を悲しませるつもりだってなかったと思う。もちろん、結婚のことは僕からはどうこう言える話じゃないけど……」","en":"“I understand <tips=2>Ah Leung’s</tips> way of thinking too. I don’t believe he considers only himself, the way <tips=36>Aurora</tips> says. Couldn’t you place a little more trust in him? Whatever people may say, my subordinates have been treated very well, just as he promised, and they’re cooperating with the people of <tips=69>Yisheng</tips> much better than I expected. I’m sure he has <tips=36>Aurora’s</tips> interests properly in mind too. I don’t believe he ever intended to hurt <tips=38>Rita</tips>. Of course, their marriage isn’t a matter on which I have any right to speak...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r98","rowIndex":98,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まあ、すっかり<tips=2>阿亮</tips>に洗脳されてるのね」","en":"“Well. <tips=2>Ah Leung</tips> has thoroughly brainwashed you.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アウロラ・フェルナンデス","displayName":"Aurora Fernandes","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r99","rowIndex":99,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=36>アウロラ</tips>は驚いて目を丸くすると、","en":"<tips=36>Aurora’s</tips> eyes widened in surprise.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r100","rowIndex":100,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それなら、あなたとも話すことはなさそうね。残念だわ」","en":"“Then I suppose I have nothing more to say to you either. What a shame.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アウロラ・フェルナンデス","displayName":"Aurora Fernandes","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r101","rowIndex":101,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　溜息をつき首を左右に振る。","en":"She sighed and shook her head.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r102","rowIndex":102,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=38>リタ</tips>、行きましょう」","en":"“<tips=38>Rita</tips>, let’s go.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アウロラ・フェルナンデス","displayName":"Aurora Fernandes","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r103","rowIndex":103,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして彼女たちは、とっくにドアが開いているエレベーターに乗り込んだ。","en":"The women step into the elevator, whose doors have been standing open all this time.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r104","rowIndex":104,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「さようなら<tips=28>トミー</tips>。きっと近いうちにこの街は<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>が出来る前みたいな混乱に戻ってしまうけど、あなたとは敵にならないよう願ってるわ」","en":"“Goodbye, <tips=28>Tommy</tips>. I’m sure this city will soon return to the chaos it knew before <tips=7>YS</tips> was created, but I hope you and I will not become enemies.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アウロラ・フェルナンデス","displayName":"Aurora Fernandes","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r105","rowIndex":105,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　硬い表情でそう告げると、ドアは閉まり、エレベーターは降りていった。","en":"She delivers the warning with a hard expression. Then the doors close, and the elevator descends.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r106","rowIndex":106,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　残された<tips=28>トーマス</tips>は溜息をついてから、","en":"<tips=28>Thomas</tips>, left behind, sighed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r107","rowIndex":107,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「僕らも降りるつもりだったのに、閉め出されちゃったね」","en":"“We meant to go down too, but they shut us out.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r108","rowIndex":108,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　と苦笑を浮かべた。","en":"He gave a wry smile.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r109","rowIndex":109,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「せっかくだから、ちょっと<tips=2>阿亮</tips>と話してから出かけようか？」","en":"“Since we’re here, why don’t we speak with <tips=2>Ah Leung</tips> before we go out?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r110","rowIndex":110,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「はい」","en":"“Very well.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アイス","displayName":"Ice","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r111","rowIndex":111,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして二人は来た道を引き返す。","en":"The two retraced their steps.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r112","rowIndex":112,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「確かにね、<tips=36>アウロラ</tips>の言い分も理解出来るんだ」","en":"“I certainly understand <tips=36>Aurora’s</tips> position too.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r113","rowIndex":113,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=28>トーマス</tips>は歩きながら、先ほど書類と格闘していた時の情けない顔とは別人のような真面目な表情でそう言った。","en":"As he walked, <tips=28>Thomas</tips> spoke with a serious expression utterly unlike the pathetic face he had worn while wrestling with the documents.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r114","rowIndex":114,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=75>フェルナンデス・ファミリー</tips>は昔から独立独歩だったものね。<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>には参加していたけれど、それでもやっぱりずっと執行部の干渉は許さないで来た。……彼らはあくまでも同じ出身地の仲間を守るための組織でいたいだけで、本当のギャングにはなりたくなかったんだよ。だから、<tips=2>阿亮</tips>がやろうとしている、今までのグループを解体して今までのファミリーの壁を取り払った組織にしようっていうのは絶対に受けいれられない」","en":"“The <tips=75>Fernandes Family</tips> has always charted an independent course. They participated in <tips=7>YS</tips>, but even then, they never permitted interference from the central leadership. ...They only want to remain an organization that protects people from the same homeland. They never wished to become a true gang. That means they can never accept <tips=2>Ah Leung’s</tips> attempt to dismantle the existing groups and build an organization without the old walls between Families.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r115","rowIndex":115,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=28>トーマス</tips>はまっすぐ前だけを見ながら歩いている。隣を歩く<tips=29>アイス</tips>は、その真剣な横顔をチラチラと見ていた。","en":"<tips=28>Thomas</tips> walked with his eyes fixed straight ahead. Beside him, <tips=29>Ice</tips> repeatedly stole glances at his earnest profile.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r116","rowIndex":116,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「でも、結婚は悪くないと思うんだけどな……。政略結婚って<tips=36>アウロラ</tips>は言うけれどさ、本当に愛情はないのかな？　正直、<tips=2>阿亮</tips>がどう考えてるかはわからないけど、<tips=38>リタ</tips>はまんざらでもなさそうな気がするし、それが不幸だとも限らないと思うんだけど……<tips=29>アイス</tips>はどう思う？」","en":"“Still, I don’t think marriage would necessarily be bad... <tips=36>Aurora</tips> calls it a political marriage, but is there truly no affection in it? To be honest, I don’t know what <tips=2>Ah Leung</tips> thinks. But I have a feeling <tips=38>Rita</tips> might not be entirely opposed to it, and that it would not necessarily make her unhappy... What do you think, <tips=29>Ice</tips>?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r117","rowIndex":117,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「えっ」","en":"“What?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アイス","displayName":"Ice","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r118","rowIndex":118,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　意外な話題を振られて<tips=29>アイス</tips>は戸惑いを見せる。","en":"Caught off guard by the unexpected question, <tips=29>Ice</tips> looks visibly flustered.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r119","rowIndex":119,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……私は、そういう男女の機微はちょっとわかりかねます……」","en":"“...I am afraid I know very little about such subtleties between men and women...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アイス","displayName":"Ice","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r120","rowIndex":120,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>の執務室につくと、彼の他に秘書兼身のまわりの世話役の<tips=30>レイレイ</tips>と、見知らぬはげ頭の中年男がいた。<tips=1>亮</tips>はシャツ姿で部屋の中央に立ち、男は手に持ったメジャーで身体の各部位を測っている。","en":"When they reached <tips=1>Leung's</tips> office, they found him there with <tips=30>Leilei</tips>, his secretary and personal attendant, and an unfamiliar bald, middle-aged man. <tips=1>Leung</tips> stood in the center of the room in his shirtsleeves while the man measured various parts of his body with a tape measure.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r121","rowIndex":121,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「話があったんだけど、今、忙しいみたいだね」","en":"“There was something I wanted to discuss, but you seem busy.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r122","rowIndex":122,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その部屋の様子に<tips=28>トーマス</tips>が引き返そうとすると、","en":"Seeing what is going on in the room, <tips=28>Thomas</tips> starts to turn back.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r123","rowIndex":123,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いや、このまま話してくれてもかまわないよ」","en":"“No, I don't mind if we talk while we do this.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r124","rowIndex":124,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　身体を測られながら<tips=1>亮</tips>はそう答える。","en":"<tips=1>Leung</tips> answers as the tailor continues measuring him.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r125","rowIndex":125,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「スーツを新調しようと思ってね。僕はそのあたりの吊るしで選んでも良かったんだが、<tips=4>馬明</tips>はどうしてもオーダーメイドじゃなければいけないと言い張って」","en":"“I thought I would get a new suit. I would have been perfectly satisfied choosing something ready-made, but <tips=4>Ma Ming</tips> insisted that nothing less than bespoke would do.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r126","rowIndex":126,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうなんだ」","en":"“I see.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r127","rowIndex":127,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　男は今は<tips=1>亮</tips>の後ろにまわってその肩幅を測っているところだった。","en":"The man had now moved behind <tips=1>Leung</tips> and was measuring the breadth of his shoulders.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r128","rowIndex":128,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いや、さっきね、<tips=36>アウロラ</tips>たちとそこで会って、少し話をしたんだけど……」","en":"“Well, I ran into <tips=36>Aurora</tips> and the others just now, and we spoke for a moment...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r129","rowIndex":129,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=28>トーマス</tips>はその男をチラチラと気にしながら言う。外部の人間の前で話してもかまわないのだろうかと、彼は考えていた。","en":"<tips=28>Thomas</tips> kept glancing toward the man as he spoke, wondering whether they ought to discuss the matter in front of an outsider.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r130","rowIndex":130,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「気にしないで良い。この人は父さんの頃から服を頼んでいる人で……僕とはそう親しくはないけれど、この場での話をよそで漏らすことのリスクをよく知っている人ではあると思う」","en":"“You needn’t concern yourself. This gentleman has made clothes for us since Father’s time... I can’t say he and I are particularly close, but I believe he understands perfectly well the risk of repeating elsewhere anything said here.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r131","rowIndex":131,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=28>トーマス</tips>の気持ちをくみ取って<tips=1>亮</tips>がそう言うと、仕立屋は苦笑する。","en":"Seeing what <tips=28>Thomas</tips> is worried about, <tips=1>Leung</tips> offers the explanation. The tailor gives a wry smile.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r132","rowIndex":132,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なんとつれない。<tips=81>龍頭</tips>の小さい頃だって、服を作らせて頂いたじゃないですか」","en":"“How cold of you. Why, I had the honor of making clothes for the <tips=81>Longtou</tips> even when you were a little boy, did I not?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r133","rowIndex":133,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「これは失礼した。まあ、僕を殺したいやつはそこらじゅうにいるから、つい、ね」","en":"“My apologies. Well, people who wish to kill me are everywhere, so the habit comes naturally.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r134","rowIndex":134,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>の言う通り、つい先日も彼の暗殺計画が露見したばかりである。","en":"Just as <tips=1>Leung</tips> said, another plot to assassinate him had come to light only days earlier.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r135","rowIndex":135,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　最近彼は執行部配下の構成員の増員を行ったのだが、その時<tips=76>旧義勝</tips>とは別の香港人グループを吸収した。このグループは<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>が出来る以前に<tips=69>義勝</tips>と犬猿のなかだった人々で、今は数人しかいない小さな組織である。","en":"He had recently expanded the ranks under the central leadership, absorbing in the process a Hong Kong group separate from <tips=76>old Yisheng</tips>. Before <tips=7>YS</tips> was created, its members and <tips=69>Yisheng</tips> had been bitter enemies. By now it was a tiny organization with only a few people remaining.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r136","rowIndex":136,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その他、異国人なども多く採用した。","en":"He had also recruited many foreigners.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r137","rowIndex":137,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　これが<tips=76>旧義勝</tips>の反<tips=1>謝亮</tips>派とも言うべき<tips=22>老人たち</tips>の不興を買い、暗殺者を送り込まれたのである。","en":"This displeased the <tips=22>old men</tips> who might be called the anti-<tips=1>Leung</tips> faction within <tips=76>old Yisheng</tips>, and an assassin was sent after him.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r138","rowIndex":138,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　事前に察知していた<tips=1>謝亮</tips>の手配により暗殺者は<tips=41>グランドタワー</tips>の内部で射殺されたが、謝亮が第三代<tips=81>龍頭</tips>なってから、実に三回目の暗殺騒ぎである。","en":"<tips=1>Leung</tips> had learned of the plot in advance and arranged for the assassin to be shot dead inside <tips=41>Grand Tower</tips>. It was, in fact, the third assassination scare since Leung became the third <tips=81>Longtou</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r139","rowIndex":139,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そのうち二回は<tips=69>義勝</tips>内部からのものであり、残り一回は<tips=59>暗闇通り</tips>に住む<tips=17>タイプB</tips>の若者が<tips=1>謝亮</tips>を殺せば自分が<tips=81>龍頭</tips>になれるという妄想にとりつかれて起こしたものだった。彼は元々は<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>の構成員で、<tips=34>ダリオ・ボネット</tips>の部下であった。発症して発砲事件を起こしたために除名になり、街で物乞いのようにして暮らしていた。","en":"Two of those attempts had originated within <tips=69>Yisheng</tips>. The remaining one had been carried out by a young <tips=17>Type B</tips> man from <tips=59>Darkness Street</tips>, possessed by the delusion that killing <tips=1>Tse Leung</tips> would make him <tips=81>Longtou</tips>. He had once belonged to <tips=7>YS</tips> as a subordinate of <tips=34>Dario Bonetto</tips>, but had been expelled after his symptoms manifested and he caused a shooting incident. Since then, he had lived in the city like a beggar.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r140","rowIndex":140,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ただ、この反発は不当なものではあった。こうした敵対組織の吸収や異国人の採用は父親の<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>も何度か行っているのである。そもそも<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>自体が根本的にはそういった発想のもと生まれた組織なのだ。","en":"The opposition was nevertheless unjustified. <tips=3>Chris Tse</tips>, Leung’s father, had himself absorbed hostile organizations and recruited foreigners on several occasions. Indeed, <tips=7>YS</tips> itself had fundamentally been founded on that very idea.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r141","rowIndex":141,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「父さんがやれば許せても、僕が同じことをやったらはらわたが煮えくりかえる連中がいる。それと、僕みたいな実績も超能力もない若造なら簡単に殺してとってかわれると甘く考えている連中もいる。……まあ、時間が経てばそのうちどちらも静かになるさ」","en":"“There are people who could forgive Father for something, but boil with rage if I do precisely the same. There are also people naive enough to think that a young nobody like me, without achievements or psychic power of my own, can easily be killed and replaced. ...Given time, both groups will eventually quiet down.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r142","rowIndex":142,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=4>馬明</tips>が<tips=22>老人たち</tips>の反発に腹を立てて怒鳴り散らしたとき、<tips=1>亮</tips>はそう笑った。","en":"<tips=1>Leung</tips> had laughed and said this when <tips=4>Ma Ming</tips> raged at the opposition from the <tips=22>old men</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r143","rowIndex":143,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=31>エリー・ホワイト</tips>は新しい<tips=81>龍頭</tips>を積極的に支持しているが、それ以外の<tips=35>フェルナンデス</tips>、<tips=34>ボネット</tips>、<tips=33>壬生屋</tips>などの本心ははっきりしない。彼らだって、<tips=27>廖志明</tips>のような野心がないとは限らない。<tips=3>クリス</tips>が死んで自分のチャンスが巡ってきたと考えても不思議ではないだろう。","en":"<tips=31>Ellie White</tips> actively supported the new <tips=81>Longtou</tips>, but the true feelings of <tips=35>Fernandes</tips>, <tips=34>Bonetto</tips>, <tips=33>Mibuya</tips>, and the others remained unclear. There was no guarantee that they lacked ambitions like those of <tips=27>Liao Chi-ming</tips>. It would hardly be strange if they believed <tips=3>Chris’s</tips> death had finally presented them with their chance.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r144","rowIndex":144,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>としてはまだ完全に信頼するという訳にはいかない。","en":"<tips=1>Leung</tips> could not yet bring himself to trust them completely.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r145","rowIndex":145,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　さらに別の不安要素もある。この間<tips=27>廖志明</tips>の銅像を破壊し、<tips=41>グランドタワー</tips>を一人で血の海に変えたテレポート少女もまだ居場所が見つかっていない。彼女の狙いが何だったのか定かではないが、前回は最上階の<tips=81>龍頭</tips>の部屋を狙い、初代の娘である<tips=44>筱喬</tips>をさらおうとしたのだから、謝家を狙っていると考えても不思議ではない。とすれば、今のターゲットが新<tips=81>龍頭</tips>の<tips=1>謝亮</tips>であるというのも充分に考えられる話だ。","en":"There was another cause for concern. The teleporting girl who had recently destroyed <tips=27>Liao Chi-ming’s</tips> statue and single-handedly turned <tips=41>Grand Tower</tips> into a sea of blood had still not been found. Her objective remained unclear, but during her previous attack she had targeted the <tips=81>Longtou’s</tips> room on the top floor and tried to abduct <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips>, the first Longtou’s daughter. It would therefore be no surprise if she were targeting the Tse family. If so, the new <tips=81>Longtou</tips>, <tips=1>Tse Leung</tips>, might very well be her present target.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r146","rowIndex":146,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>の命は常に危険にさらされている。組織の中からも、外からも。<tips=28>トーマス</tips>などからすればとても生きた心地がしないような生活に思えるのだが、<tips=1>亮</tips>は睡眠不足でクマを作るわけでもなく、食欲不振になるでもなく、血色のいい肌つやをしている。","en":"<tips=1>Leung’s</tips> life was always in danger, from both inside the organization and outside it. To <tips=28>Thomas</tips>, such a life seemed scarcely endurable. Yet <tips=1>Leung</tips> neither developed dark rings from lack of sleep nor lost his appetite. His complexion remained healthy and glowing.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r147","rowIndex":147,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ねえ<tips=2>阿亮</tips>、<tips=38>リタ</tips>に結婚を申し込んだというのは本当なのかい？」","en":"“Tell me, <tips=2>Ah Leung</tips>. Is it true that you asked <tips=38>Rita</tips> to marry you?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r148","rowIndex":148,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=28>トーマス</tips>はさっき『<tips=2>阿亮</tips>』と呼ばないと言ったことをすっかり忘れてそう訊ねた。","en":"<tips=28>Thomas</tips> asks, having completely forgotten what he said earlier about not calling him <tips=2>Ah Leung</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r149","rowIndex":149,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「本当だよ」","en":"“It is.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r150","rowIndex":150,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それで断られたって聞いたけれど」","en":"“I heard you got turned down.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r151","rowIndex":151,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まあね。<tips=36>アウロラ</tips>と会ったのかい？　とんでもなく怒ってたろう。あんなに怒るところははじめて見たよ」","en":"“Well, yes. Did you run into <tips=36>Aurora</tips>? She was incredibly angry, wasn’t she? I had never seen her so furious.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r152","rowIndex":152,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>はそう言って肩をすくめる。","en":"<tips=1>Leung</tips> gives a shrug as he says it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r153","rowIndex":153,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そりゃもう、すごい勢いで。政略結婚なんかで<tips=38>リタ</tips>の気持ちを踏みにじって許せないって。いますぐにでも<tips=75>フェルナンデス・ファミリー</tips>が<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>を離脱するような言い方だった」","en":"“Oh, she tore into me. She said she couldn’t forgive you for trampling on <tips=38>Rita’s</tips> feelings with a political marriage. She spoke as though the <tips=75>Fernandes Family</tips> might leave <tips=7>YS</tips> at any moment.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r154","rowIndex":154,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=28>トーマス</tips>の言葉に、<tips=1>亮</tips>は溜息をつく。","en":"At <tips=28>Thomas’s</tips> words, <tips=1>Leung</tips> sighed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r155","rowIndex":155,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どうして<tips=38>リタ</tips>に結婚を申し込んだんだい？　彼女を利用しようとしたのかい？」","en":"“Why did you ask <tips=38>Rita</tips> to marry you? Were you trying to use her?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r156","rowIndex":156,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「政略結婚なのは確かだが、利用というのは人聞きが悪いな。事態を丸くおさめ、みんなが笑顔になれる一番の方法だよ。それは本人にもちゃんと説明した。理解出来なかったのは彼らの限界だね」","en":"“It certainly was a political marriage, but saying I meant to use her makes it sound ugly. It was the best way to settle the situation amicably and leave everyone smiling. I explained that properly to Rita herself. That they failed to understand only shows their limitations.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r157","rowIndex":157,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>は肩をすくめる。","en":"<tips=1>Leung</tips> shrugged.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r158","rowIndex":158,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「だってさ、紙切れ一枚で家族ってことにすれば円満解決なんだよ？　これほど平和的な解決はないだろう？　<tips=35>フェルナンデス</tips>のところとは、できるだけうまくやって行きたいのさ。彼らは家族関係ってのを大切にするからね。……お互いにとってメリットのある話だと思ったんだが、同意は得られなかった」","en":"“After all, if a single sheet of paper makes us family, the whole matter is amicably resolved. What solution could be more peaceful? I want to get along with <tips=35>Fernandes</tips> as well as possible. Family ties matter greatly to them. ...I thought the proposal would benefit both sides, but they would not agree.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r159","rowIndex":159,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まさか<tips=36>アウロラ</tips>があそこまで反対するとは。どうしてそんなにいやなんだろう？　別に実際の夫婦生活なんかしなくたっていいのに。もしかして、<tips=36>アウロラ</tips>自身が後継者になりたかったのだろうか？　<tips=38>リタ</tips>が僕と結婚すれば、どうしても<tips=38>リタ</tips>の地位が重くなるだろうからね。でも、<tips=36>アウロラ</tips>にそんな野心があるとは考えにくいんだが」","en":"“I never imagined <tips=36>Aurora</tips> would oppose it so strongly. Why was she so against it? We wouldn't even have to lead a real married life. Could <tips=36>Aurora</tips> herself have wanted to become the successor? If <tips=38>Rita</tips> married me, <tips=38>Rita's</tips> standing would inevitably rise. But it's hard to imagine <tips=36>Aurora</tips> harboring ambitions like that.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r160","rowIndex":160,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「た、多分そういう問題じゃないと思うけど。もっと、人情的な部分じゃないかな……。ほら、<tips=38>リタ</tips>は<tips=2>阿亮</tips>に気があったような感じだったし……」","en":"“I-I don’t think that’s the problem. It’s probably something more to do with people's feelings... <tips=38>Rita</tips> did seem to have feelings for <tips=2>Ah Leung</tips>, after all...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r161","rowIndex":161,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=28>トーマス</tips>が苦い顔をすると、","en":"<tips=28>Thomas</tips> grimaced.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r162","rowIndex":162,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=81>龍頭</tips>も、意外と駄目なところあるんですね」","en":"“So even the <tips=81>Longtou</tips> has his unexpected shortcomings.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r163","rowIndex":163,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=29>アイス</tips>がその耳に囁いた。","en":"<tips=29>Ice</tips> whispered into his ear.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r164","rowIndex":164,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まあ、とにかく残念な話だ。このままだと<tips=35>フェルナンデス</tips>は離脱することになるだろう。僕らにとっても、彼らにとっても何のメリットもないのに」","en":"“Well, in any case, it is regrettable. At this rate, <tips=35>Fernandes</tips> will withdraw. There is nothing to be gained from that, either for us or for them.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r165","rowIndex":165,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　身体を測り終わって、<tips=30>レイレイ</tips>が<tips=1>亮</tips>にジャケットを着せる。","en":"Once the measurements are finished, <tips=30>Leilei</tips> helps <tips=1>Leung</tips> into his jacket.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r166","rowIndex":166,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼は部屋の正面にある<tips=81>龍頭</tips>用の椅子に腰掛け足を組んだ。","en":"He sat in the <tips=81>Longtou’s</tips> chair at the front of the room and crossed his legs.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r167","rowIndex":167,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　黒い革靴の爪先がピカピカと光っている。","en":"The toes of his black leather shoes gleamed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r168","rowIndex":168,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「とは言え、離脱したいなら僕に止めることは出来ない。もともとそういう約束で彼らは<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>に参加しているんだ」","en":"“That said, if they wish to withdraw, I cannot stop them. They entered <tips=7>YS</tips> under an agreement that permits precisely that.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r169","rowIndex":169,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「もし彼らが離れても、抗争にはならないよね？」","en":"“Even if they leave, it won’t mean war, will it?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r170","rowIndex":170,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=28>トーマス</tips>は心配をあらわにしてそう訊ねる。","en":"<tips=28>Thomas</tips> asks, making no attempt to hide his concern.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r171","rowIndex":171,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そう願いたいけれど、先のことはわからない」","en":"“I hope not, but no one knows the future.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r172","rowIndex":172,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「でも、もし敵になったら<tips=36>アウロラ</tips>たちとも戦うの？」","en":"“But if they do become enemies, will you fight <tips=36>Aurora</tips> and the others?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r173","rowIndex":173,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「今の時点でその質問に答えるのは難しいが……」","en":"“It is difficult to answer that question at this stage...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r174","rowIndex":174,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>は背もたれに身体を伸ばし、","en":"<tips=1>Leung</tips> settled back against the chair.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r175","rowIndex":175,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>の仕事を手伝うようになってから今日まで、街で醜態をさらすバカやら、僕を暗殺しようとするヤツが現れるやらで、僕は十三人殺した。そのなかには血の繋がった親戚もいるし、子供もいる。それが必要ならば、誰が相手だって戦いをためらうことは出来ないんだ。ためらえばもっと大きなものを失うことになる。……<tips=28>トミー</tips>、きみ以外はみんなそのことを知ってる。もちろん<tips=36>アウロラ</tips>だってそうだ。多分彼女はもうやる気なんじゃないかな？」","en":"“From the day I began helping with <tips=7>YS</tips> work until today, idiots have made spectacles of themselves in the city and people have attempted to assassinate me. I have killed thirteen people. Some were my blood relatives, and one was a child. If fighting is necessary, I cannot hesitate, no matter who stands against me. If I hesitate, I will lose something far greater. ...<tips=28>Tommy</tips>, everyone but you knows that. <tips=36>Aurora</tips> included. In fact, I imagine she is already prepared to fight.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r176","rowIndex":176,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ごめん、<tips=2>阿亮</tips>……。きみはそこまで考えたから、自分の結婚という大事なものまで使って争いを避けようとしたんだね」","en":"“I’m sorry, <tips=2>Ah Leung</tips>... You thought that far ahead, and tried to avert a conflict even if it meant using something as important as your own marriage.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r177","rowIndex":177,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そう言われると僕もなんだかむず痒いが、とりあえず<tips=28>トミー</tips>があやまる必要はない。それがきみの良いところでもあるし……それに、本当はきみのような感じ方をするのが人間としては正常なんだろうな」","en":"“When you put it that way, I feel a little embarrassed myself, but in any case, <tips=28>Tommy</tips>, you have no need to apologize. It is one of your good qualities... And in truth, yours is probably the normal way for a human being to feel.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r178","rowIndex":178,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>はそう言って、意味ありげな微笑を浮かべた。","en":"<tips=1>Leung</tips> gave an enigmatic smile.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r179","rowIndex":179,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「とにかく、僕らと<tips=75>フェルナンデス・ファミリー</tips>が戦えば、他の組織につけいる隙を与えるだけだ。僕らが弱くなれば<tips=68>木下組</tips>だってまた色気が出て来るだろう。……まあ、もし戦いになっても僕らが確実に勝つのだから、<tips=35>フェルナンデス</tips>の賢明さに期待しよう」","en":"“In any case, if we fight the <tips=75>Fernandes Family</tips>, we’ll merely leave an opening for other organizations to exploit. If we grow weaker, even the <tips=68>Kinoshita-gumi</tips> may begin to entertain ambitions here again. ...Still, if war does come, we will certainly win, so let us place our hopes in <tips=35>Fernandes’s</tips> good judgment.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r180","rowIndex":180,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　仕立屋が頭を一つ下げて部屋を出て行く。彼はそれに頷きを返してから、","en":"The tailor bowed and left the room. Leung acknowledged him with a nod, then continued.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r181","rowIndex":181,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そう動揺しないでくれ。<tips=28>トミー</tips>、きみはそのままでいてくればいい。ただ僕のことは信じて欲しい。僕は今この仕事に手応えを感じている。きっと最終的には全部僕の思った通りになるだろうし、それはきみにとっても悪い結論ではないはずだ。この<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>は、今までよりもっと強く巨大な、そして素晴らしい組織になるよ」","en":"“Don’t be so upset. <tips=28>Tommy</tips>, you need only remain exactly as you are. Just trust me. I can feel that I'm making headway in this work. In the end, I am sure everything will turn out as I intend, and the result should not be a bad one for you either. This <tips=7>YS</tips> will become stronger and greater than ever before—a magnificent organization.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r182","rowIndex":182,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……<tips=2>阿亮</tips>、僕は、子供の時からこれまで一度もきみを疑おうなんて思ったことはないよ」","en":"“...<tips=2>Ah Leung</tips>, not once since we were children has it ever occurred to me to doubt you.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r183","rowIndex":183,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=28>トーマス</tips>は言葉とは裏腹に心配げな表情をしている。","en":"Despite his words, <tips=28>Thomas</tips> still looks worried.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r184","rowIndex":184,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして<tips=1>謝亮</tips>はこれから別の人間と会う予定があるとのことで、<tips=28>トーマス</tips>と<tips=29>アイス</tips>の二人はそのまま部屋を辞した。","en":"<tips=1>Leung</tips> had another appointment, so <tips=28>Thomas</tips> and <tips=29>Ice</tips> took their leave.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r185","rowIndex":185,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いやあ、ミスターリャオがわざわざ足を運んでくれるなんて、うれしいですねえ」","en":"“Well! I’m so pleased that Mr. Liao came all this way to visit.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r186","rowIndex":186,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ベトナム料理屋店主タンの娘は、顏一杯に人なつこい笑顔を浮かべている。","en":"The daughter of Mr. Tan, owner of the Vietnamese restaurant, beams at them with a broad, friendly smile.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r187","rowIndex":187,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女の屋台は元々おでんか何かの中古屋台を買い取って改造したものらしく、下のリヤカー部分も、上の木造の屋台本体も、錆が浮いたり日光で変色したりで年季を感じさせられた。","en":"Her stall appeared to be a secondhand oden cart or something similar that she had bought and remodeled. Both the handcart beneath and the wooden stall above showed their age, spotted with rust and faded by sunlight.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r188","rowIndex":188,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　評判の店だけあって買い求める客が列を作り、近くでは彼女の商品を持った客があちこちに座って食べている。","en":"True to its reputation, the stall had attracted a line of customers. All around it, others sat eating what they had bought from her.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r189","rowIndex":189,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=28>トーマス</tips>と<tips=29>アイス</tips>は彼女の申し出を断って列に並んで買い求めたが、食べる場所は彼女の懇願じみた要望に従って、作業スペースとして使っていたテーブルを片付けて使わせて貰っている。","en":"<tips=28>Thomas</tips> and <tips=29>Ice</tips> declined her offer of special treatment and waited in line to make their purchases. At her almost pleading insistence, however, they ate at a table she cleared for them from the work area.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r190","rowIndex":190,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女が販売しているのは『チェー』と呼ばれるもので、あんこやフルーツにココナッツミルクをかけた、あんみつやぜんざいのようなスイーツだった。ベトナムでは有名な食べ物で、温かいものも冷たいものもある。","en":"She sold a dessert called chè: sweet bean paste and fruit topped with coconut milk, something like anmitsu or zenzai. It was a well-known food in Vietnam and could be served either hot or cold.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r191","rowIndex":191,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女の屋台は小さいながらも数多くの具材を用意してあり、珍しいものからオーソドックスなものまで客の好みで選べるが、人気があるのは柱に貼られた紙に書かれている彼女おすすめの組み合わせだ。","en":"Small though the stall was, she had prepared a great many ingredients, allowing customers to choose everything from the familiar to the unusual. The most popular selections, however, were her recommended combinations, written on sheets of paper pasted to a pillar.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r192","rowIndex":192,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"『ダナンの恋人たちの語らい』だとか『メコン河に落ちる黄昏』だとか、具材の内容がまったく想像出来ない彼女の考案した名前がついている。","en":"They bore names of her own devising that revealed nothing whatsoever about their contents, such as “Sweet Nothings Between Lovers in Da Nang” and “Twilight Falling on the Mekong.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r193","rowIndex":193,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　いずれの名前にもベトナムの地名がおりこまれているが、本人は<tips=9>Y地区</tips>生まれ<tips=9>Y地区</tips>育ちでベトナムには行ったことがないそうである。","en":"Every one of her names incorporated a Vietnamese place, though the woman herself had apparently been born in <tips=9>Y District</tips>, spent her entire childhood in <tips=9>Y District</tips>, and never once set foot in Vietnam.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r194","rowIndex":194,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　透明のプラスチックコップにカラフルな具材が積み重ねられ、白いココナッツミルクで満たされた様子は、見た目も華やかで美しい。","en":"Layers of colorful ingredients filled transparent plastic cups, all bathed in white coconut milk, making them look bright and beautiful.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r195","rowIndex":195,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　この陽気な食べ物を前に、<tips=29>アイス</tips>と<tips=28>トーマス</tips>は暗い顔で佇んでいる。","en":"Before this cheerful food, <tips=29>Ice</tips> and <tips=28>Thomas</tips> sat wearing gloomy faces.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r196","rowIndex":196,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どうしました？　お口にあわなかったですか？」","en":"“Is something wrong? Was it not to your taste?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r197","rowIndex":197,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　店主が心配して訊ねるのに、<tips=28>トーマス</tips>は愛想笑いを浮かべて首を横に振る。","en":"When the proprietor asks in concern, <tips=28>Thomas</tips> forces a polite smile and shakes his head.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r198","rowIndex":198,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「とっても美味しいよ。ただちょっと僕は考え事があるんだ。あと、この子は普段からあんまり笑わないから気にしないでくれ」","en":"“It’s absolutely delicious. I simply have something on my mind. And this girl rarely smiles at the best of times, so please don’t worry about her.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r199","rowIndex":199,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　客が待っているから戻るよう伝えると、店主は渋々作業を再開する。","en":"He told her to return to the waiting customers, and she reluctantly resumed her work.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r200","rowIndex":200,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　実際スイーツは美味であったし、店主に誤解されたくはなかったが、<tips=28>トーマス</tips>はなかなか気持ちを切り換えることが出来なかった。","en":"The dessert truly is delicious, and <tips=28>Thomas</tips> has no wish for the proprietor to misunderstand. Even so, he cannot seem to shake off his mood.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r201","rowIndex":201,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なんだか、最近の<tips=2>阿亮</tips>は少し怖い気がしない？」","en":"“Don't you think <tips=2>Ah Leung</tips> has been a little frightening lately?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r202","rowIndex":202,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=28>トーマス</tips>は辺りを憚り声を落としてそう囁く。","en":"Mindful of those around them, <tips=28>Thomas</tips> lowered his voice to a whisper.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r203","rowIndex":203,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうですか？　私は、初めて会った時から常にいつ会っても恐ろしいと感じていますが」","en":"“Do you think so? I have found him frightening at every encounter since the first time we met.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アイス","displayName":"Ice","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r204","rowIndex":204,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「確かに、あのマンションの時の<tips=2>阿亮</tips>はこわかったけど……」","en":"“Admittedly, <tips=2>Ah Leung</tips> was frightening that day at the apartment, but...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r205","rowIndex":205,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=28>トーマス</tips>がそう言うと、<tips=29>アイス</tips>は僅かに顔を歪めた。","en":"At <tips=28>Thomas’s</tips> words, <tips=29>Ice’s</tips> face tightened by the smallest degree.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r206","rowIndex":206,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=27>廖志明</tips>の愛人のマンションで能力を<tips=1>亮</tips>に見破られたことは、普段自分の能力で主人を守り切ると宣言している彼女にとってはあまり思い出したくない屈辱的な記憶だった。","en":"<tips=1>Leung’s</tips> discovery of her ability at <tips=27>Liao Chi-ming’s</tips> mistress’s apartment was a humiliating memory she cared little to revisit, particularly when she ordinarily declared that her power would enable her to protect her master under any circumstances.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r207","rowIndex":207,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=28>トーマス</tips>はそんな彼女の態度に気づく様子もなく、","en":"<tips=28>Thomas</tips> showed no sign of noticing her response.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r208","rowIndex":208,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まあ、気のせいかもしれないね。……何かが変わったわけじゃなくて、立場がそう感じさせているのかもしれない。だとしたら、前と同じように接してあげなくちゃ駄目だな。やたらとまわりの人に恐れられるというのは、きっと寂しいだろうし」","en":"“Well, perhaps I’m imagining it. ...Perhaps nothing about him has changed, and his position merely makes me feel that way. If so, I must be certain to treat him just as I did before. It must be lonely to have everyone around you constantly afraid.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r209","rowIndex":209,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=29>アイス</tips>には自分の暗殺計画を初めて報告された時でさえ顔色一つ変えなかった<tips=1>亮</tips>がそんなことを寂しがるようには思えなかったが、優しい主人のためにその意見を口にはしなかった。","en":"<tips=29>Ice</tips> found it difficult to imagine that <tips=1>Leung</tips>, who had not so much as changed expression upon first learning of a plot to assassinate him, could be lonely for such a reason. For the sake of her kind master, however, she left the opinion unspoken.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r210","rowIndex":210,"pageCtrl":"","jp":" 　食べ終わり、礼を言って立ち去ろうとすると、娘は<tips=28>トーマス</tips>にまだ温かい紙袋を押しつけた。","en":"When they finished eating, thanked her, and prepared to leave, the woman pressed a warm paper bag into <tips=28>Thomas’s</tips> hands.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r211","rowIndex":211,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「揚げたてのバインザンです。あとで召し上がってください」","en":"“These are freshly fried bánh rán. Please enjoy them later.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r212","rowIndex":212,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その屋台ではチェーの他にもフライヤーで団子を揚げて売っているが、その揚げたてを詰めてくれたのだと言う。","en":"In addition to chè, the stall used a fryer to prepare and sell balls of dough. She had apparently filled the bag with a batch fresh from the oil.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r213","rowIndex":213,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「払うよ。いくらなの？」","en":"“I’ll pay. How much are they?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r214","rowIndex":214,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いいんですよ。あなたにはこれから頑張って貰わないといけないんですから。<tips=81>龍頭</tips>様も若くてかっこいい人になったし、何か変わるんじゃないかってみんな期待してるんですよ」","en":"“They’re free. We're counting on you to do your best for us from now on. The new <tips=81>Longtou</tips> is young and handsome too, and everyone is hoping that things might change.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r215","rowIndex":215,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「わかった。ありがとう。協力してくれる街のみんなのために頑張るよ」","en":"“All right. Thank you. I’ll work hard for everyone in the city who supports us.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r216","rowIndex":216,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=28>トーマス</tips>はそう言って、自らその紙袋を受け取った。","en":"<tips=28>Thomas</tips> accepted the paper bag himself.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r217","rowIndex":217,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「これ、ひとつ<tips=2>阿亮</tips>……<tips=81>龍頭</tips>にもあげておくよ。きっと喜ぶと思うよ。彼は意外とこういう食べ物好きだからね」","en":"“I’ll save one for <tips=2>Ah Leung</tips>... for the <tips=81>Longtou</tips>. I’m sure he’ll be pleased. He has a surprising fondness for this sort of food.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r218","rowIndex":218,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「い、いや！　とんでもないです！　それは恐れ多くて……」","en":"“N-no! Certainly not! I could never presume...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r219","rowIndex":219,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　急に慌てる娘を見て、<tips=28>トーマス</tips>は自分も一応幹部なのになと思わぬでもなかったが、そのことについては特に何も言わずにその場をあとにした。","en":"The woman’s sudden panic did make <tips=28>Thomas</tips> think that he was an officer too, after a fashion. He said nothing about it and left.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r220","rowIndex":220,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その日は空がどんよりと曇り、風が強く、少し肌寒かったが<tips=57>滑走路通り</tips>はいつも通りの活気に満ちあふれている。","en":"The sky that day is heavily overcast, the wind strong and the air slightly chilly. <tips=57>Runway Street</tips> nevertheless overflows with its usual vitality.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r221","rowIndex":221,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　この街の裏側では、<tips=3>クリス</tips>の死に伴う世代交代以後、ぴりぴりとした雰囲気が全体を覆っているが、表通りを見る限りではまるきり影響を感じられなかった。もっとも、<tips=57>滑走路通り</tips>にはよその地域から参入した人々の店舗なども多く、かつてのように、誰もが裏社会との関わりを持っているわけではない。","en":"Since the generational transition brought by <tips=3>Chris’s</tips> death, a tense atmosphere had covered the city’s underworld. On the main street, however, none of that tension could be felt. Admittedly, <tips=57>Runway Street</tips> held many businesses operated by newcomers from other regions, and unlike in the old days, not everyone had ties to the underworld.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r222","rowIndex":222,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>という絶対的な組織が生まれたことで、この街は、これでもだいぶ平和になったのだ。そして外から客も店も集まって来て、この繁栄を生んだ。これは街の住民にとっても多くの利益を生み出したが、反面割を食った住民も少なくなかった。<tips=9>Y地区</tips>の移民同士は年と共に少しずつ混ざり合ってきたものの、こうした新しくやって来た者たちと古い住民とのトラブルは増えている。","en":"The birth of a dominant organization called <tips=7>YS</tips> had made the city considerably more peaceful. Customers and businesses flocked in from outside, creating its present prosperity. That prosperity benefited many residents, but plenty of others got the short end of the bargain. The immigrant communities of <tips=9>Y District</tips> had gradually mingled over the years, yet conflict between newcomers of this kind and older residents was increasing.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r223","rowIndex":223,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=28>トーマス</tips>は積極的に街に出て、人々の声を聞いていた。","en":"<tips=28>Thomas</tips> made a point of going out into the city and listening to what its people had to say.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r224","rowIndex":224,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼の<tips=74>廖ファミリー</tips>は、街の発展によって明らかに利益を伸ばした側だったので、当然彼の感覚では誰もがこの現在の栄華を歓迎していると思っていただけに、そうではない者たちが多くいると知ったのは新しい発見だった。","en":"His own <tips=74>Liao Family</tips> had clearly profited from the city’s development. Thomas had naturally assumed from his perspective that everyone welcomed its present prosperity, and discovering how many did not came as a revelation.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r225","rowIndex":225,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして、<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>についても様々な評判を聞いた。","en":"He also heard a wide variety of opinions about <tips=7>YS</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r226","rowIndex":226,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>の幹部の一人と言えばこの街では相当地位の高いギャングであり、<tips=81>龍頭</tips>が街の王だとすれば、諸侯くらいの地位はある。しかし<tips=28>トーマス</tips>の温厚な人柄のせいか、<tips=29>アイス</tips>一人を引き連れるだけという身軽な姿のためか、彼が訊ねると皆忌憚のない意見を語ってくれた。","en":"An officer of <tips=7>YS</tips> occupied an extremely high station in this city. If the <tips=81>Longtou</tips> was its king, an officer might be one of its feudal lords. Perhaps because of <tips=28>Thomas’s</tips> gentle personality, or because he traveled lightly with <tips=29>Ice</tips> alone, everyone offered a candid opinion when he asked.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r227","rowIndex":227,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　たとえば彼の父の<tips=27>廖志明</tips>や、他の諸侯である<tips=34>ダリオ・ボネット</tips>や<tips=33>壬生屋タカシ</tips>ではそうはいかないだろう。彼らはみな高級な車を乗り回し、武装したボディーガードで身のまわりを固め、人々は目もあわさぬように震え上がる。","en":"The same could hardly have been said of his father, <tips=27>Liao Chi-ming</tips>, or of other such lords as <tips=34>Dario Bonetto</tips> and <tips=33>Takashi Mibuya</tips>. All of them drove expensive cars and surrounded themselves with armed bodyguards. People trembled before them and took care not even to meet their eyes.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r228","rowIndex":228,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「僕からすると、いまの<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>の評判はそんなに悪くないんだよね」","en":"“From what I have seen, <tips=7>YS’s</tips> reputation isn’t particularly bad at present.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r229","rowIndex":229,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=28>トーマス</tips>は<tips=29>アイス</tips>を相手にそう語る。","en":"<tips=28>Thomas</tips> shared his thoughts with <tips=29>Ice</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r230","rowIndex":230,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「元々さあ、<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>で人気があるのって、<tips=2>阿亮</tips>のお父さんだけだったじゃない？　そりゃ、あのひとは善人ってわけじゃないしすごく恐れられてはいたけれど、でも住民に対しては寛容だったからね。毎年クリスマスには街角で炊き出しもしてたでしょう？　<tips=29>アイス</tips>も知ってるよね」","en":"“Originally, the only popular person in <tips=7>YS</tips> was <tips=2>Ah Leung’s</tips> father, wasn’t he? Certainly, he was no good man and people feared him terribly, but he was generous toward the residents. Every Christmas, he used to serve meals on street corners. You know that too, don’t you, <tips=29>Ice</tips>?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r231","rowIndex":231,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「知ってます。よく子供が列を作ってるのを見ました」","en":"“I do. I often saw the children standing in line.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アイス","displayName":"Ice","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r232","rowIndex":232,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「でしょう？　<tips=35>フェルナンデス</tips>さんのところも同じような活動はしていたけど、あの人の場合は出身地が違う人たちには結構冷淡だったから、異教徒でも異国人にでも分け隔てなく与えた<tips=3>クリス</tips>さんみたいな人気はないよね。そして、僕の見るところ、街の人たちは<tips=2>阿亮</tips>にもお父さんと同じような印象を抱いているんだよ」","en":"“Exactly. Mr. <tips=35>Fernandes</tips> did similar work, but he could be quite cold toward people from outside his own community. He was never as popular as Mr. <tips=3>Chris</tips>, who gave without distinction, regardless of creed or country. And from what I’ve seen, the people of the city have formed much the same impression of <tips=2>Ah Leung</tips> as they held of his father.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r233","rowIndex":233,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そ、それはちょっと。<tips=28>トーマス</tips>様は<tips=81>龍頭</tips>様のことがお好きだから、贔屓目になってしまうのでは……」","en":"“I-I’m not sure about that. Master <tips=28>Thomas</tips>, you are so fond of the <tips=81>Longtou</tips> that your judgment may be biased...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アイス","displayName":"Ice","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r234","rowIndex":234,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「確かに大好きだけど、そうじゃないんだって。だって、街で嫌われ者だった<tips=26>劉建志</tips>を処刑したことは評価されてるし、それに、<tips=81>龍頭</tips>になってから、<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>内の派閥をなくし、ひいては街でもそういった対立をなくしたいと考えてるのも好意的に受け止められてるんじゃない？」","en":"“I certainly love him, but that isn’t it. Executing <tips=26>Ryu Kenshi</tips>, whom everyone in the city hated, has been well received. And since becoming <tips=81>Longtou</tips>, he has wanted to eliminate the factions within <tips=7>YS</tips> and eventually put an end to such conflicts throughout the city. Don’t you think people view that favorably too?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r235","rowIndex":235,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どうでしょうか」","en":"“I’m not so sure.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アイス","displayName":"Ice","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r236","rowIndex":236,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=29>アイス</tips>はわかってないな。たとえばさ、逆に、女性を売り買いする<tips=33>壬生屋</tips>さんとか、どうしても過去の暗殺屋のイメージがつきまとうボネットさんはメチャクチャ不人気でしょう？　<tips=2>阿亮</tips>には彼らをなんとかしてくれるんだなって、期待されてるところもあるんだよ。それにね……」","en":"“You don’t understand, <tips=29>Ice</tips>. Take Mr. <tips=33>Mibuya</tips>, who buys and sells women, or Mr. Bonetto, who can never shake his past reputation as an assassin. They’re terribly unpopular, aren’t they? Part of what people expect of <tips=2>Ah Leung</tips> is that he’ll do something about men like them. And then...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r237","rowIndex":237,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まだあるんですか？」","en":"“There's more?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アイス","displayName":"Ice","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r238","rowIndex":238,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「うん」","en":"“Yes.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r239","rowIndex":239,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=28>トーマス</tips>は頷き、","en":"<tips=28>Thomas</tips> nodded.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r240","rowIndex":240,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=2>阿亮</tips>が子供の頃、よその子供と同じように裏通りを走り回っていたというのもプラスだよね。かつて一緒に遊んだ仲間たちが、この街には沢山存在するんだよ。親近感がある。あと、お父さんみたいに人間離れをしたサイキックじゃなくて、ノーマルの若者だっていうのもいいんじゃないかな。それになんといっても顏が格好いい！　女の子の人気は高いね。間違いなく」","en":"“The fact that <tips=2>Ah Leung</tips> ran through the back streets like any other child when he was young works in his favor as well. A great many people who once played with him still live here. They feel a sense of kinship with him. And perhaps it helps that he is a young Normal, not a superhuman psychic like his father. And above all, he’s handsome! He’s popular with the girls. No question about it.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r241","rowIndex":241,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「はあ」","en":"“Mm.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アイス","displayName":"Ice","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r242","rowIndex":242,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「だから、<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>の古い人や、一部の利害関係がある人にはともかく、街では多くの人に期待されているんじゃないかな」","en":"“That’s why I think that, whatever the old guard of <tips=7>YS</tips> or certain people with vested interests may feel, many people in the city have placed their hopes in him.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r243","rowIndex":243,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まあ、そういう側面もゼロではないのかもしれませんが」","en":"“Well, perhaps there is something to that.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アイス","displayName":"Ice","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r244","rowIndex":244,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=29>アイス</tips>もむげに否定するつもりはないのだけれど、主人が<tips=1>亮</tips>に入れ込んでいるのを常々心配しているだけに、つい苦言を言うような形になってしまう。","en":"<tips=29>Ice</tips> has no wish to dismiss the idea out of hand. Yet because she is always worried by her master's devotion to <tips=1>Leung</tips>, she cannot help sounding critical.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r245","rowIndex":245,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「でも、それが実態に沿った期待なのか、単に初代の期間が長かったために生まれたストレスの裏返しなのかは判別がつかないところですよ。初代は人気もありましたが、敵も多かったわけですし。もし<tips=81>龍頭</tips>様のやりかたが期待とかけ離れたものだとしたら、みなすぐに手のひらを返すでしょう」","en":"“But it is difficult to tell whether those hopes are grounded in reality or are merely the reverse side of frustrations that built up during the first Longtou's long tenure. The first Longtou was popular, but he also had many enemies. If Master <tips=81>Longtou’s</tips> methods prove far removed from what people expect, they will turn on him at once.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アイス","displayName":"Ice","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r246","rowIndex":246,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうかもしれないけどさあ……」","en":"“Maybe so, but...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r247","rowIndex":247,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それに、その期待の一部は、<tips=28>トーマス</tips>様にも向けられているはずです」","en":"“And some of that hope must be placed in you as well, Master <tips=28>Thomas</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アイス","displayName":"Ice","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r248","rowIndex":248,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうだね。新しい世代として僕にも責任があるんだ」","en":"“That’s true. As a member of the new generation, I have responsibilities too.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r249","rowIndex":249,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=28>トーマス</tips>は考え込んで、","en":"<tips=28>Thomas</tips> grows thoughtful.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r250","rowIndex":250,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ねえ<tips=29>アイス</tips>、僕たちは所詮裏社会の人間だし、いくら力があったって社会からすれば寄生虫みたいなものなのかもしれないけど、まだまだこの街には僕らのような存在が必要だと思うんだ。この街にはここでしか生きていけない人が沢山いるし、法律や警察は彼らを守ってはくれないんだもの」","en":"“Tell me, <tips=29>Ice</tips>. We may be people of the underworld, and however powerful we become, society may still see us as little more than parasites. But I believe this city still needs people like us. Many people can live nowhere but here, and neither the law nor the police will protect them.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r251","rowIndex":251,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　力強くそう言った。","en":"He declared it with conviction.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r252","rowIndex":252,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　少し暗くなりはじめ、電光看板に明かりが点り始める。","en":"The light begins to fade, and the electric signs flicker to life.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r253","rowIndex":253,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ネオンの照り返しで顔に色がついた<tips=28>トーマス</tips>は、人混みを眺めながら言った。","en":"Reflected neon colors <tips=28>Thomas’s</tips> face as he gazes out over the crowd and speaks.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r254","rowIndex":254,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=2>阿亮</tips>もきっとそういうことを考えていると思う。そして<tips=36>アウロラ</tips>たちもきっと……。目指すところはみんなおんなじなんだよ。だから、話し合えばちゃんとわかると思うんだ」","en":"“I’m sure <tips=2>Ah Leung</tips> is thinking about those things too. And <tips=36>Aurora</tips> and the others must be as well... They are all striving for the same thing. That’s why I believe they can come to understand one another if they talk.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r255","rowIndex":255,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして<tips=29>アイス</tips>の顔をまっすぐ見つめるが、彼女は何も応えない。","en":"He looks straight at <tips=29>Ice</tips>, but she gives no answer.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r256","rowIndex":256,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女がこういうときに同意の言葉を口にしないで黙っているということは、違う意見なのだということを<tips=28>トーマス</tips>は知っている。","en":"<tips=28>Thomas</tips> knows that when Ice falls silent instead of agreeing with him at times like this, it means she disagrees.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r257","rowIndex":257,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=29>アイス</tips>、きっときみは<tips=2>阿亮</tips>のことをあんまり信用していなくて……」","en":"“<tips=29>Ice</tips>, perhaps you don’t place very much trust in <tips=2>Ah Leung</tips>...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r258","rowIndex":258,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=28>トーマス</tips>が言いかけたとき、誰かが彼の太ももの辺りにぶつかった。","en":"As <tips=28>Thomas</tips> begins to say it, someone bumps into him at thigh level.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r259","rowIndex":259,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それは、フードのついた裾の長い服を着た子供で、前を見ずに歩いていたらしく、道路の上にひっくり返る。","en":"It was a child wearing a long, hooded garment. Apparently walking without looking ahead, the child tumbled backward onto the road.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r260","rowIndex":260,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その子供は手さげ袋を持っていて、転んだ拍子にその中に入っていた玉ねぎやらリンゴやらがいくつも飛び出しコロコロと散らばってゆく。","en":"The child had been carrying a shopping bag. The fall sent onions, apples, and other items spilling out to roll in every direction.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r261","rowIndex":261,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あっ、ごめんっ！」","en":"“Oh! I’m sorry!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r262","rowIndex":262,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　倒れた子供を助けようか、遠くへ逃げてゆく野菜を拾ってやろうか、<tips=28>トーマス</tips>は迷って一瞬硬直してしまう。","en":"For one instant, <tips=28>Thomas</tips> froze in indecision, unable to choose between helping the fallen child and chasing down the vegetables rolling into the distance.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r263","rowIndex":263,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　一方<tips=29>アイス</tips>は素早く動き、まずさっと子供の手を引いて立たせ、次に遠くへ転がろうとする野菜を回収にかかる。","en":"<tips=29>Ice</tips>, meanwhile, moved swiftly. First she pulled the child upright by one hand; then she began collecting the vegetables before they could roll farther away.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r264","rowIndex":264,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ぼ、僕も」","en":"“I-I’ll help too.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r265","rowIndex":265,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=29>アイス</tips>に続いて野菜を拾おうと中腰になると、","en":"He bent to help <tips=29>Ice</tips> gather the vegetables.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r266","rowIndex":266,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「大丈夫です。<tips=28>トーマス</tips>様はその子を見ていてください」","en":"“It's all right. Please keep an eye on the child, Master <tips=28>Thomas</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アイス","displayName":"Ice","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r267","rowIndex":267,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女がそう言ったので、大人しくそれに従った。","en":"So he meekly does as she says.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r268","rowIndex":268,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どこか痛くない？」","en":"“Does anything hurt?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r269","rowIndex":269,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　子供はフードを目深に被っている。<tips=28>トーマス</tips>がしゃがんでその顔を見ようとしたら、俯いてそのフードで顔を隠すような仕草をした。","en":"The child wore the hood pulled low. When <tips=28>Thomas</tips> crouched to look at the child’s face, the child bowed still lower and hid behind the hood.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r270","rowIndex":270,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"『怪我とかしてないかな？』","en":"“Are you hurt anywhere?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r271","rowIndex":271,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　最初の言葉は日本語で、次に英語で尋ねたが、やはり子供は返事をしない。","en":"Thomas asks first in Japanese and then in English, but still receives no answer.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r272","rowIndex":272,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「今あのお姉さんが全部拾ってくれるから、待っててね」","en":"“That young lady is picking everything up for you, so just wait here, all right?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r273","rowIndex":273,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　アイスは手早く玉ねぎなどを拾っている。通行人も手伝ってくれて、すぐに袋から転がり出たものはすべて回収された。<tips=28>トーマス</tips>は<tips=29>アイス</tips>と、拾ってくれた通行人たちに礼を言うと、拾った野菜をはたいて埃を払う仕草をしてから、子供が持っている手提げ袋のなかに一つずつ入れる。","en":"Ice quickly gathered up the onions and the rest. Passersby helped as well, and everything that had rolled from the bag was soon recovered. <tips=28>Thomas</tips> thanked <tips=29>Ice</tips> and the people who had assisted, brushed the dust from each piece of produce, then returned them one by one to the child's shopping bag.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r274","rowIndex":274,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　子供はその間、一言も口をきかずに俯いたままで、<tips=28>トーマス</tips>が全部の野菜を戻すと頭一つ下げずに駆け去っていった。","en":"Throughout the process, the child remained silent with head bowed. The moment <tips=28>Thomas</tips> had returned every vegetable, the child ran away without so much as a nod of thanks.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r275","rowIndex":275,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どこの子かな？　怪我してなければいいけど……」","en":"“I wonder where that child came from. I hope the child wasn’t hurt...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r276","rowIndex":276,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　去ってゆく子供の背中を心配そうに眺めながら彼はそう呟いた。","en":"Thomas murmurs, watching anxiously as the child runs off.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r277","rowIndex":277,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あの子、<tips=15>ボーダーエリア</tips>の子供です」","en":"“That child is from the <tips=15>Border Area</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アイス","displayName":"Ice","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r278","rowIndex":278,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=29>アイス</tips>は無感情な声で言った。","en":"<tips=29>Ice</tips> spoke without emotion.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r279","rowIndex":279,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「身体を隠すぶかぶかの服を着ていましたよね。あれ、<tips=15>ボーダーエリア</tips>の人が良く着る服なんです」","en":"“The child was wearing baggy clothes that hid the shape of the body, remember? People from the <tips=15>Border Area</tips> often dress that way.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アイス","displayName":"Ice","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r280","rowIndex":280,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……きみは<tips=15>ボーダーエリア</tips>の出身だって、<tips=2>阿亮</tips>が言ってたね」","en":"“...<tips=2>Ah Leung</tips> told me that you came from the <tips=15>Border Area</tips> too.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r281","rowIndex":281,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　あの時<tips=1>亮</tips>は、トーマスも知らなかった<tips=29>アイス</tips>の出身地の話をした。気にしてはいたが、そのことについて今まで<tips=28>トーマス</tips>は訊ねなかった。","en":"That day, <tips=1>Leung</tips> had spoken of where <tips=29>Ice</tips> came from, something even <tips=28>Thomas</tips> had not known. The matter had remained on his mind, but he had never asked her about it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r282","rowIndex":282,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=8>グレートホール</tips>を中心とした汚染地帯と<tips=9>Y地区</tips>の主要繁華街の境界であるため、その地域は『<tips=15>ボーダーエリア</tips>』或いは単に『ボーダー』と呼ばれている。","en":"Because it formed the border between the contaminated region surrounding <tips=8>Great Hole</tips> and the principal commercial districts of <tips=9>Y District</tips>, the neighborhood was called the <tips=15>Border Area</tips>, or simply the Border.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r283","rowIndex":283,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そのあたりは昔は基地ではなく住宅街であったが、<tips=8>グレートホール</tips>の出現と汚染の発生により住民が退去し、廃墟となっていた。","en":"It had once been a residential neighborhood rather than part of the base. The appearance of <tips=8>Great Hole</tips> and the contamination, however, drove out its residents and left it in ruins.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r284","rowIndex":284,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　今そこには、街の中心地に住むことが出来ない<tips=16>タイプA</tips>たちが、崩れた壁に板を張ったり、コンクリートで塗り固めながら暮らしている。彼らの多くは<tips=77>特質変異</tips>により醜く崩れた肉体を持っていた。","en":"It is now home to people classified as <tips=16>Type A</tips> who cannot live in the city center. They make their homes by boarding over collapsed walls and shoring them up with concrete. Many possess bodies grotesquely disfigured by <tips=77>trait mutation</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r285","rowIndex":285,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼らは外部の人間とは必要最低限しか交渉せず、独自のルールや宗教を持ち、静かに暮らしている。","en":"They dealt with outsiders only when absolutely necessary, lived by their own rules and religion, and kept quietly to themselves.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r286","rowIndex":286,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼らのなかには優れた能力を持った者も存在するという噂があり、実際、昔とある小さなギャング組織が彼らを利用しようと干渉したときに、ボスとその家族が全員不審死するという事件があり、その犯人は見つかることがなかった。","en":"Rumor held that some among them possessed extraordinary powers. There had, in fact, once been an incident in which a small gang tried to interfere with the community and exploit its residents, after which the boss and his entire family died under mysterious circumstances. The culprit was never found.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r287","rowIndex":287,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=9>Y地区</tips>のギャングたちともお互いに関わり合うことがなく、<tips=13>溝平B団地</tips>こと『<tips=13>ヘドロ団地</tips>』と並んで、外部の人間が立ち入らない閉ざされたエリアとして知られていた。","en":"The community and the gangs of <tips=9>Y District</tips> avoided all involvement with one another. Along with <tips=13>Mizohira B Housing Complex</tips>, otherwise known as the <tips=13>Sludge Housing Complex</tips>, the Border was known as a closed area outsiders never entered.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r288","rowIndex":288,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「私も、小さな時はああいう服を着ていました」","en":"“When I was small, I wore clothes like that too.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アイス","displayName":"Ice","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r289","rowIndex":289,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=29>アイス</tips>は淡々と言った。","en":"<tips=29>Ice</tips> says it matter-of-factly.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r290","rowIndex":290,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「へえ、そうなんだ。……<tips=15>ボーダーエリア</tips>っていうのは、どんな場所なんだい？」","en":"“Oh, I see. ...What kind of place is the <tips=15>Border Area</tips>?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r291","rowIndex":291,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「街の人が思っているような神秘的な場所でもなく、<tips=16>タイプA</tips>といってもほとんど使えるような能力を持った人もいません。ただとても静かで、平和でした。……<tips=9>Y地区</tips>は他で生きられない者が生きてゆく街だとおっしゃいましたが、醜い姿のために、そこでさえも生きられなくなった者たちを受け入れる場所です。一度そこへやって来ると、もう誰も出て行こうとはしません。醜い自分の姿から目をそらし、傷をなめ合うようにして一生をそこで暮らすのです。そこは化け物たちの楽園なんです。私もその一人でした」","en":"“It is not the mysterious place people in the city imagine. Though the residents are classified as <tips=16>Type A</tips>, almost none possess abilities of any practical use. It was simply very quiet and peaceful. ...You said that <tips=9>Y District</tips> is a city for people who have nowhere else to live. The Border takes in those whose ugly forms make even this city uninhabitable for them. Once someone comes there, no one ever tries to leave. They turn their eyes from their own ugliness and spend their whole lives licking one another’s wounds. It is a paradise for monsters. I was one of them.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アイス","displayName":"Ice","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r292","rowIndex":292,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=29>アイス</tips>が自分のことを喋るのは初めてで、<tips=28>トーマス</tips>は嬉しかった。","en":"This is the first time <tips=29>Ice</tips> has spoken about herself, and <tips=28>Thomas</tips> is glad.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r293","rowIndex":293,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女はそうして見られていることに気づいているはずだが、何の反応もせずにまっすぐ前だけを見ている。","en":"She must be aware of him watching her, but she gives no response and keeps her eyes fixed straight ahead.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r294","rowIndex":294,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「でもきみはそこを出た」","en":"“But you left.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r295","rowIndex":295,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=28>トーマス</tips>の言葉に、<tips=29>アイス</tips>は下唇を噛む。それくらいの表情の変化でも、彼女にしては珍しいことだ。","en":"At <tips=28>Thomas’s</tips> words, <tips=29>Ice</tips> bites her lower lip. Even so slight a change of expression is rare for her.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r296","rowIndex":296,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=28>トーマス</tips>もそれ以上は何も訊ねない。<tips=1>亮</tips>があの時言った言葉を思い出していた。","en":"<tips=28>Thomas</tips> asked nothing further. He remembered what <tips=1>Leung</tips> had said that day.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r297","rowIndex":297,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"『……本名は李小玉。二十五年前に<tips=15>ボーダーエリア</tips>に住む夫婦の元に生まれた。三才の時に街の者との諍いで両親を殺される。十二才の時にエリアを出て、<tips=59>暗闇通り</tips>の空き家に住み着き窃盗を繰り返すが、ある時ヤミ金事務所に盗みに入った時に捕まり、リンチを受けて殺されるところを<tips=28>トーマス・リャオ</tips>に救われ、彼のボディーガードとなる』","en":"‘...Her real name is Li Xiaoyu. She was born twenty-five years ago to a couple living in the <tips=15>Border Area</tips>. When she was three, her parents were killed in a dispute with people from the city. At twelve, she left the Area and occupied an abandoned house on <tips=59>Darkness Street</tips>, where she repeatedly committed theft. One day, she was caught breaking into a loan shark’s office. <tips=28>Thomas Liao</tips> saved her from being beaten to death, and she became his bodyguard.’","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r298","rowIndex":298,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「僕が思うに、化け物っていうのは、ちょっと人と姿が違うだけの人間をさすために使う言葉じゃない。どんな人間の心にも住み着いている、えたいの知れない存在のことを呼ぶ言葉なんだよ。それにとりつかれた人間は、ときに本来の人格とはまったく違う生き物に化けてしまう」","en":"“As I see it, ‘monster’ isn’t a word for a human being who merely looks a little different from other people. It names an unknowable presence that lives in every human heart. When it possesses someone, they may turn into a creature utterly unlike their original self.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r299","rowIndex":299,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=28>トーマス</tips>は<tips=29>アイス</tips>の手を握りしめる。","en":"<tips=28>Thomas</tips> clasps <tips=29>Ice’s</tips> hand.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r300","rowIndex":300,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「この街にはそうして取り憑かれて変わり果ててしまった人々があふれている。彼らは悪人ではなくて、人格を奪われているだけなんだ。僕たちの仕事は、それと向き合い、時に飼い慣らして、うまく使いこなさなきゃいけないんだよ。……行こう<tips=29>アイス</tips>。もっと勉強しなきゃ。僕はまだあまりにも未熟だから、もっといろんな人と会って、もっと賢くならなきゃいけない」","en":"“This city is overflowing with people who have been possessed and changed beyond recognition. They aren’t evil. Their personalities have merely been stolen from them. Our work requires us to confront that presence—and at times to tame it and learn to harness it. ...Come, <tips=29>Ice</tips>. I need to learn more. I am still far too immature, so I must meet all kinds of people and become much wiser.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r301","rowIndex":301,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼はそう言うと、手を掴んだまま歩き始めた。","en":"With that, he began to walk, still holding her hand.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r302","rowIndex":302,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>が死んでも、週に一度、大幹部たちが集まって食事と会議を行う定例会食は続いている。","en":"Even after <tips=3>Chris Tse’s</tips> death, the regular dinners at which the senior officers gathered once each week for a meal and a meeting continued.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r303","rowIndex":303,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　絶え間なく冗談を口にしていた<tips=3>クリス</tips>に比べて、<tips=1>謝亮</tips>の主催する定例会は淡々と必要最低限の報告を行い合うだけの静かなものだった。","en":"<tips=3>Chris</tips> had kept up a constant stream of jokes. By contrast, the meetings hosted by <tips=1>Tse Leung</tips> were quiet affairs where the participants did little more than exchange the minimum necessary reports.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r304","rowIndex":304,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それは<tips=1>謝亮</tips>の人柄もあったろうが、もちろん、彼が<tips=81>龍頭</tips>就任時に宣言した、すべてのファミリーを統合するという計画に対する反応でもある。","en":"<tips=1>Leung’s</tips> personality may have played a part, but so did the participants’ response to the plan he had announced upon becoming <tips=81>Longtou</tips>: the integration of every Family.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r305","rowIndex":305,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　会食のメンバーは、<tips=3>クリス</tips>存命時のものから少し顔ぶれが変わっている。死亡した<tips=39>ジェフリー・ウォン</tips>と処刑された<tips=26>劉建志</tips>はいなくなり、追放された<tips=27>廖志明</tips>のかわりに<tips=28>トーマス・リャオ</tips>が参加し、あとは<tips=35>ジョゼ・フェルナンデス</tips>、<tips=33>壬生屋タカシ</tips>、<tips=34>ダリオ・ボネット</tips>、<tips=31>エリー・ホワイト</tips>、そして<tips=4>馬明</tips>。","en":"The roster at the dinners had changed somewhat since <tips=3>Chris</tips> was alive. <tips=39>Jeffrey Wong</tips> was dead and <tips=26>Ryu Kenshi</tips> had been executed; <tips=28>Thomas Liao</tips> now attended in place of the exiled <tips=27>Liao Chi-ming</tips>. The others were <tips=35>José Fernandes</tips>, <tips=33>Takashi Mibuya</tips>, <tips=34>Dario Bonetto</tips>, <tips=31>Ellie White</tips>, and <tips=4>Ma Ming</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r306","rowIndex":306,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　現状このなかで明確に<tips=1>亮</tips>の統合計画を支持するものは<tips=28>トーマス</tips>だけだ。<tips=31>エリー</tips>も<tips=1>亮</tips>という個人については支持を表明していたが、こと統合に関しては難色を示している。","en":"At present, only <tips=28>Thomas</tips> among them unequivocally supports <tips=1>Leung's</tips> integration plan. <tips=31>Ellie</tips> has expressed her support for <tips=1>Leung</tips> personally, but even she is reluctant when it comes to integration itself.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r307","rowIndex":307,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その日もみな積極的に話そうとはせず、報告が終わってしまうと、ナイフやフォークのカチャカチャとした音ばかりが響いた。","en":"That day, too, no one spoke willingly. Once the reports ended, little could be heard but the clatter of knives and forks.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r308","rowIndex":308,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　この雰囲気を打ち破ったのは、<tips=35>ジョゼ・フェルナンデス</tips>だった。","en":"It is <tips=35>José Fernandes</tips> who breaks the silence.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r309","rowIndex":309,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=81>龍頭</tips>。一つ、私の方から伝えたいことがあるのだが」","en":"“<tips=81>Longtou</tips>. There is one matter I wish to bring to your attention.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ジョゼ・フェルナンデス","displayName":"José Fernandes","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r310","rowIndex":310,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　会食が終わりに近づき、みなの前にデザートが運ばれてから、彼はそう言った。","en":"He spoke as the dinner approached its end, once dessert had been brought to the table.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r311","rowIndex":311,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「発言してもかまわないか？」","en":"“May I?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ジョゼ・フェルナンデス","displayName":"José Fernandes","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r312","rowIndex":312,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「もちろん」","en":"“Of course.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r313","rowIndex":313,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　と<tips=1>亮</tips>は言った。","en":"<tips=1>Leung</tips> replies.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r314","rowIndex":314,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　このとき部屋全体の空気が張り詰めたが、誰よりも緊張していたのは<tips=28>トーマス</tips>だったろう。明らかに落ち着きを失って、<tips=1>亮</tips>と<tips=35>フェルナンデス</tips>の間で視線を行ったり来たりさせている。","en":"The air throughout the room drew taut. <tips=28>Thomas</tips> was probably more nervous than anyone. Plainly unable to compose himself, he looked back and forth between <tips=1>Leung</tips> and <tips=35>Fernandes</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r315","rowIndex":315,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「私のファミリーは、<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>から離脱する」","en":"“My Family will withdraw from <tips=7>YS</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ジョゼ・フェルナンデス","displayName":"José Fernandes","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r316","rowIndex":316,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　皆が注目するなか、<tips=35>フェルナンデス</tips>ははっきりとした声でそう宣言した。","en":"With everyone watching, <tips=35>Fernandes</tips> makes the declaration in a clear voice.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r317","rowIndex":317,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「元々この<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>という組織は、<tips=18>ローズ・クラブ</tips>を潰し、<tips=68>木下組</tips>から街を守るために生まれたものだ。その役割を果たした時点で本来の役割は終わっている。あの時献身的に戦ってくれた初代<tips=81>龍頭</tips>への恩があったから今日までともに歩んできたが、彼が死んだ今、もうその義理もない」","en":"“<tips=7>YS</tips> was originally created to destroy the <tips=18>Rose Club</tips> and protect the city from the <tips=68>Kinoshita-gumi</tips>. Once it fulfilled that purpose, its role should have ended. Our obligation to the first <tips=81>Longtou</tips>, who fought devotedly for us in those days, is why we have remained part of it until today. Now that he is dead, we owe you no such obligation.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ジョゼ・フェルナンデス","displayName":"José Fernandes","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r318","rowIndex":318,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　覚悟していたとは言え、実際その言葉を聞くと、<tips=28>トーマス</tips>は<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>崩壊の序曲が流れはじめたような思いがして背筋が冷たくなった。","en":"<tips=28>Thomas</tips> had expected this. Yet hearing the words nevertheless sent a chill down his back, as though the overture to the collapse of <tips=7>YS</tips> had begun to play.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r319","rowIndex":319,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そして現在<tips=81>龍頭</tips>のやろうとしていることにも賛同出来ない。合理化だの融和だのと言えば聞こえがいいが、それぞれのファミリーのなかにある絆や繋がりを解体しようとしているだけだ」","en":"“Nor can I support what the present <tips=81>Longtou</tips> is attempting. ‘Rationalization’ and ‘reconciliation’ may sound pleasant, but all he is doing is dismantling the bonds and connections within each Family.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ジョゼ・フェルナンデス","displayName":"José Fernandes","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r320","rowIndex":320,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=35>ミスター・フェルナンデス</tips>らしくもない。あまりにも軽率ではありませんか？」","en":"“That isn't like you, Mr. <tips=35>Fernandes</tips>. Aren't you being far too rash?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エリー・ホワイト","displayName":"Ellie White","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r321","rowIndex":321,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　苦笑交じりにそう言ったのは、出席者で唯一の女性である<tips=31>エリー・ホワイト</tips>であった。","en":"The speaker is the only woman present, <tips=31>Ellie White</tips>, a faint, wry smile on her lips.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r322","rowIndex":322,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「軽率とは？」","en":"“Rash?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ジョゼ・フェルナンデス","displayName":"José Fernandes","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r323","rowIndex":323,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=35>フェルナンデス</tips>は猛禽類のようにぎょろりとした目を動かし、<tips=31>エリー</tips>を睨み付ける。","en":"<tips=35>Fernandes</tips> swings his bulging, raptor-like eyes toward <tips=31>Ellie</tips> and glares at her.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r324","rowIndex":324,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　並の女であったら震え上がってしまうような恐ろしい顔つきであったが、しかしその黒衣の女性は平然とヴェールの下の口元に微笑を浮かべたままだ。","en":"It is a terrifying look, enough to make an ordinary woman tremble. But the woman in black remains perfectly calm, the smile beneath her veil undisturbed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r325","rowIndex":325,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「失礼ですが、<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>と離れたらあなたは立ちゆきませんよ？　今は、<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>を結成したあの頃とは違います。街は商業的に大きく発展し、様態が変化しました。我々の仕事も複雑化しています。しかし残念ながらあなたのファミリーは時代の変化にとりのこされ、現状に適応出来ていない。その結果、規模に対して経済力が追いつかなくなっている。<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>を離れ、我々との連携がなくなればいずれ苦しい状況に陥るのではないですか？」","en":"“Forgive me, but you cannot sustain yourself apart from <tips=7>YS</tips>. The city is no longer what it was when we formed <tips=7>YS</tips>. It has developed tremendously as a commercial center, and its character has changed. Our work has grown more complex as well. Unfortunately, your Family has been left behind by the times and failed to adapt to present conditions. As a result, its economic power has not kept pace with its size. If you leave <tips=7>YS</tips> and lose your cooperative ties with us, will you not eventually find yourself in considerable difficulty?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エリー・ホワイト","displayName":"Ellie White","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r326","rowIndex":326,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ふん、その言い方には何やら私情を感じるね。いや、女の執念かな？」","en":"“Hmph. I sense something personal in that choice of words. Or should I call it a woman’s vindictiveness?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"壬生屋タカシ","displayName":"Takashi Mibuya","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r327","rowIndex":327,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　独り言のようにそう言ってせせら笑ったのは<tips=33>壬生屋タカシ</tips>であった。","en":"<tips=33>Takashi Mibuya</tips> mutters the remark almost to himself and sneers.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r328","rowIndex":328,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=31>エリー</tips>はその発言が聞こえなかったかのように無視し、<tips=35>フェルナンデス</tips>の方を向いてその答えを待っている。","en":"<tips=31>Ellie</tips> ignores him as though she heard nothing, keeping her eyes on <tips=35>Fernandes</tips> as she waits for his answer.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r329","rowIndex":329,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼は口をへの字に結んだまま、黙っている。","en":"His mouth set in a hard frown, he remains silent.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r330","rowIndex":330,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=31>エリー</tips>の指摘は間違ってはいない。","en":"<tips=31>Ellie</tips> is not wrong.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r331","rowIndex":331,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　街の経済が発展し、あの武闘派で知られた<tips=76>旧義勝</tips>のメンバーたちも今はさまざまなビジネスに手を広げている。","en":"As the city's economy has developed, even the members of <tips=76>old Yisheng</tips>, once known for its militancy, have branched out into all manner of businesses.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r332","rowIndex":332,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　一方<tips=35>フェルナンデス</tips>はただ暴力を持つだけの、移民たちの守護者的なあり方を変えず、<tips=74>廖ファミリー</tips>の経営する飲食店に用心棒を派遣したり、ヤミ金の取り立てを代行したりといったかたちで協力関係を結ぶことで利益を上げている。これらがなくなれば、別の食い扶持を探す必要に迫られるだろう。","en":"By contrast, <tips=35>Fernandes</tips> has never moved beyond his role as a protector of immigrants whose only real resource is violence. He earns money through cooperative arrangements—sending guards to restaurants run by the <tips=74>Liao Family</tips>, collecting debts for loan sharks, and the like. Without those arrangements, he would be forced to find some other source of income.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r333","rowIndex":333,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「また昔のような荒っぽいやりかたでひと稼ぎしますか？　しかし、そうなれば私たちと対立せざるを得ないでしょう。その覚悟はおありで？」","en":"“Will you return to making money through the rough methods of the old days? But if you do, we will have no choice but to oppose you. Are you prepared for that?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エリー・ホワイト","displayName":"Ellie White","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r334","rowIndex":334,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=31>エリー</tips>はさらに追及する。","en":"<tips=31>Ellie</tips> presses him further.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r335","rowIndex":335,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ご心配いただいて恐縮だが、それは余計なお世話と言うものだ。金のために誇りを譲り渡せというような話ならば、なおさら従うわけにはいかない」","en":"“I appreciate your concern, but it is also unwelcome interference. If you mean that money should compel us to surrender our pride, that only gives us still greater reason to refuse.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ジョゼ・フェルナンデス","displayName":"José Fernandes","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r336","rowIndex":336,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=35>フェルナンデス</tips>は毅然としてその言葉をはねのける。","en":"<tips=35>Fernandes</tips> resolutely rejects her argument.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r337","rowIndex":337,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そこで、意外な方向から声があがった。","en":"Then a voice rises from an unexpected quarter.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r338","rowIndex":338,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=31>ミス・ホワイト</tips>。これは、そんなに大げさな話ではないんだよ」","en":"“<tips=31>Miss White</tips>. This is not such a momentous matter.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r339","rowIndex":339,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　と言ったのは<tips=1>亮</tips>である。","en":"It is <tips=1>Leung</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r340","rowIndex":340,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「彼は争いをしたいわけじゃない。ただ仲間思いなだけなんだよ。彼の仲間たちはみな故郷との結びつきが強いからね。ファミリーとしてのかたちを崩したら、今までのように組織の内外にかかわらず同郷者の手助けをするということが出来なくなるかもしれない。それを危惧してるんだ。そうでしょう、<tips=35>フェルナンデス</tips>さん？」","en":"“He does not want conflict. He simply cares for his comrades. They all have strong ties to their homeland. He fears that if the Family structure is dismantled, they may no longer be able to help people from their homeland as they always have, whether those people belong to the organization or not. Isn’t that so, Mr. <tips=35>Fernandes</tips>?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r341","rowIndex":341,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>の言葉に、<tips=35>フェルナンデス</tips>は何も言わず、しわだらけのむっつりした顔で黙り込んでいる。","en":"At <tips=1>Leung’s</tips> words, <tips=35>Fernandes</tips> falls silent, his deeply lined face set in a sullen frown.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r342","rowIndex":342,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それは杞憂だと私は何度も話したはずだけれど、あなたはどうしても信じなかった。それならば仕方ない。<tips=81>龍頭</tips>に従えないのなら、<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>としても同志と呼ぶわけにはいかない。離脱してもらうしかないが、だからといって険悪な関係になるのではなく、今後はあくまでも独立した組織同士として、提携してゆくべきだろう。……それでどうだ？　あなただって、別に、いまここで我々と絶交するつもりではないと思うのだけれど」","en":"“I have told you repeatedly that those fears are groundless, but you refuse to believe me. In that case, it cannot be helped. If you cannot obey the <tips=81>Longtou</tips>, <tips=7>YS</tips> can no longer call you a comrade. You will have no choice but to withdraw. But that need not make us enemies. From now on, we should continue cooperating as independent organizations. ...What do you say? I do not imagine that you intend to break with us here and now.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r343","rowIndex":343,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「もちろんだ。私としても、好き好んで対立を求めているわけではない」","en":"“Of course not. I have no desire to seek conflict for its own sake.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ジョゼ・フェルナンデス","displayName":"José Fernandes","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r344","rowIndex":344,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「本音としては非常に残念だが……しかし、判断自体は尊重する。<tips=81>龍頭</tips>である私に組織の決定権があるように、あなたにも自分の組織の行き先を決める権利があるのだから」","en":"“In truth, I deeply regret your decision... but I respect it. Just as I, as <tips=81>Longtou</tips>, have the right to decide the course of my organization, you have the right to determine the future of yours.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r345","rowIndex":345,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「感謝する。では、今日は用があるのでこれで」","en":"“Thank you. I have other business today, so I will take my leave.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ジョゼ・フェルナンデス","displayName":"José Fernandes","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r346","rowIndex":346,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=35>フェルナンデス</tips>はそう言って立ち上がり、デザートを残したまま退室した。","en":"<tips=35>Fernandes</tips> rose at those words and left the room, his dessert unfinished.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r347","rowIndex":347,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　このやりとりは同席した面々に少なからず衝撃を与えた。","en":"The exchange came as a considerable shock to the others in the room.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r348","rowIndex":348,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　統合に従えないことを理由に<tips=35>フェルナンデス</tips>は離脱を宣言し、<tips=81>龍頭</tips>はそれを全く引き留めず、それどころか、方針に従えないのならば出て行く他ないと断言をしたのである。態度を保留するかたちであった他の幹部たちも、判断を迫られている。","en":"<tips=35>Fernandes</tips> had declared that he would withdraw because he could not accept integration. The <tips=81>Longtou</tips> made no attempt whatsoever to stop him—indeed, he had stated outright that if Fernandes could not obey the policy, he had no choice but to leave. The other officers, who had withheld their own decisions, were now being forced to choose.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r349","rowIndex":349,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それ以降会食が解散されるまで誰も<tips=35>フェルナンデス</tips>の離脱について話題にはしなかったが、みなそれを強く意識しているのは明白だった。","en":"No one raises the subject of <tips=35>Fernandes’s</tips> withdrawal before the gathering breaks up, but it is plain that the matter is foremost in everyone's mind.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r350","rowIndex":350,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　会食が終わった後、<tips=4>馬明</tips>は<tips=35>フェルナンデス</tips>の離脱を全く咎めようとしなかったことを心配したが、<tips=1>亮</tips>は一笑に付すばかりであった。","en":"After the dinner, <tips=4>Ma Ming</tips> voices concern that <tips=1>Leung</tips> made no attempt to reproach <tips=35>Fernandes</tips> for withdrawing. Leung merely dismisses the concern with a laugh.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r351","rowIndex":351,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「彼は惜しいが、どうせ引き留めたところで離脱するのはわかっていたからね。それならはっきりさせた方が良い。これから状況が動くだろう」","en":"“It's a shame to lose him, but I knew he would leave no matter how I tried to stop him. Better to settle the matter clearly. Things will start moving now.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r352","rowIndex":352,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「しかし……」","en":"“But...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬明","displayName":"Ma Ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r353","rowIndex":353,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=4>馬明</tips>は納得が出来ないようだ。","en":"<tips=4>Ma Ming</tips> does not appear convinced.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r354","rowIndex":354,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「状況が動くというのは、悪いことばかりじゃない。まあ、待っていればいい」","en":"“It's not all bad when things start moving. Just wait and see.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r355","rowIndex":355,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　果たして事態は彼の言う通りになった。","en":"Events did indeed unfold as he had said.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r356","rowIndex":356,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　翌日には<tips=33>壬生屋タカシ</tips>が執務室を訪れて、統合に賛成すると言い出した。その代わり、<tips=28>トーマス</tips>と同じように今の立場を保証して貰いたいということだ。","en":"The following day, <tips=33>Takashi Mibuya</tips> visited the office and announced his support for integration. In exchange, he wanted his present position guaranteed, just as <tips=28>Thomas’s</tips> had been.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r357","rowIndex":357,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　同席していた<tips=4>馬明</tips>は驚いた。","en":"<tips=4>Ma Ming</tips>, who was present, was astonished.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r358","rowIndex":358,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まさか、あいつが来るとは思わなかった！」","en":"“I never expected him to come!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬明","displayName":"Ma Ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r359","rowIndex":359,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　会談を終えた<tips=33>壬生屋</tips>が退室すると、目を丸くして声をあげる。","en":"When <tips=33>Mibuya</tips> leaves after the meeting, Ma Ming exclaims, his eyes wide.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r360","rowIndex":360,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どうして思わなかったのさ？」","en":"“Why not?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r361","rowIndex":361,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>は机に肘をつき、<tips=4>馬明</tips>に問い返す。","en":"<tips=1>Leung</tips> props his elbows on the desk and asks <tips=4>Ma Ming</tips> in return.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r362","rowIndex":362,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「だって、<tips=33>壬生屋</tips>は処刑された<tips=26>劉建志</tips>の親友だろう？　我々に憎しみを持っていたっておかしくないだろうに」","en":"“<tips=33>Mibuya</tips> was close friends with <tips=26>Ryu Kenshi</tips>, the man we executed. It would be perfectly natural for him to hate us.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬明","displayName":"Ma Ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r363","rowIndex":363,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「彼はそんな風には考えないよ。合理的な人間だからね。処刑されるようなへまをした<tips=26>劉建志</tips>が愚かだとしか思いやしない。むしろ、ライバルの一人が減ったと喜んでいるだろう」","en":"“He doesn’t think that way. He is a rational man. He would simply consider <tips=26>Ryu Kenshi</tips> a fool for blundering badly enough to be executed. If anything, he is probably pleased to have one fewer rival.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r364","rowIndex":364,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>は苦笑しながらそう言った。","en":"<tips=1>Leung</tips> says this with a wry smile.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r365","rowIndex":365,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「でも、僕もやっぱり不思議な気がするよ。あんなに<tips=2>阿亮</tips>のやり方に反対していたのに……」","en":"“I still find it strange too. He was so strongly opposed to <tips=2>Ah Leung’s</tips> methods...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r366","rowIndex":366,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その場にいた<tips=28>トーマス</tips>も驚きをもってそう首をひねる。","en":"<tips=28>Thomas</tips>, who is also present, tilts his head in surprise.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r367","rowIndex":367,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「よく考えるといい。全然不思議なことはないんだよ」","en":"“Think it through. There’s nothing strange about it at all.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r368","rowIndex":368,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>は穏やかに言う。","en":"<tips=1>Leung</tips> says calmly.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r369","rowIndex":369,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=33>壬生屋タカシ</tips>が統合に反対したのはただのポーズだったんだ。ごねて僕らから条件を引き出したかったんだよ。最初から<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>を出るつもりなんかない」","en":"“<tips=33>Takashi Mibuya’s</tips> opposition to integration was nothing but posturing. He only meant to dig in his heels until he extracted concessions from us. He never intended to leave <tips=7>YS</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r370","rowIndex":370,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どうしてそう思う？　<tips=33>壬生屋</tips>はかなりの力をつけている。独立してもやっていけないことはないだろう」","en":"“Why do you think that? <tips=33>Mibuya</tips> has amassed considerable power. He could probably make it on his own.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬明","displayName":"Ma Ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r371","rowIndex":371,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=4>馬明</tips>は腑に落ちない顔で問う。彼の言う通り、<tips=33>壬生屋</tips>のビジネスは<tips=9>Y地区</tips>の経済的発展の恩恵を最も大きく受けていたため、彼のファミリーは充分な資金と組織力を持っている。","en":"<tips=4>Ma Ming</tips> asks with an unconvinced look. He has a point: <tips=33>Mibuya’s</tips> businesses have benefited more than any others from <tips=9>Y District’s</tips> economic development, and his Family possesses ample funds and organizational strength.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r372","rowIndex":372,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まあ実力はあるが、<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>を出たら彼は売春組織のオーナーに戻るだけだからね。女衒、女衒と軽く見られるのを嫌っている彼にその選択肢は選べない。かといって、<tips=27>廖志明</tips>のように僕にとってかわろうとするのは、これも現実的じゃない。仮に僕を殺すか追放出来たとしても、<tips=33>壬生屋</tips>には誰もついてこないのは誰よりも彼自身が理解しているからね。だから、僕の下で少しでもいい地位を確保するってのが最善の手になるんだ」","en":"“He is certainly capable, but if he leaves <tips=7>YS</tips>, he goes back to being nothing more than the owner of a prostitution business. He cannot choose that when he despises being dismissed as a common pimp. On the other hand, trying to replace me as <tips=27>Liao Chi-ming</tips> did is equally unrealistic. Even if he managed to kill or expel me, <tips=33>Mibuya</tips> understands better than anyone that no one would follow him. That makes securing the best position he can under me his wisest course.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r373","rowIndex":373,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なるほど」","en":"“I see.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬明","displayName":"Ma Ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r374","rowIndex":374,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そこで<tips=4>馬明</tips>は納得して頷く。","en":"At that, <tips=4>Ma Ming</tips> nods in understanding.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r375","rowIndex":375,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「しかし、<tips=2>阿亮</tips>は、最初からこうなることがわかっていたみたいだな。とすると、<tips=35>フェルナンデス</tips>の娘を嫁に貰おうなどということを企てたのも、最初から決裂させるつもりだったのか？」","en":"“Still, <tips=2>Ah Leung</tips>, it sounds as though you knew from the beginning this would happen. If so, was your plan to marry <tips=35>Fernandes’s</tips> daughter meant to fall apart from the start?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬明","displayName":"Ma Ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r376","rowIndex":376,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まさか」","en":"“Of course not.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r377","rowIndex":377,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>は肩をすくめる。","en":"<tips=1>Leung</tips> shrugs.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r378","rowIndex":378,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あの結婚がうまく行った方が本当は良かったんだ。それは本心さ。だって、どう考えたって<tips=35>フェルナンデス</tips>が一番厄介な問題だからね。……これから少し面倒くさくなる」","en":"“I truly wanted that marriage to succeed. That is the honest truth. No matter how you look at it, <tips=35>Fernandes</tips> is the most troublesome problem of all. ...Things are going to get a little complicated now.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r379","rowIndex":379,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼はそう言うと、わざとらしく溜息をついて見せた。","en":"With that, he gives an exaggerated sigh.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r380","rowIndex":380,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しかし、実際にはこの後<tips=1>謝亮</tips>が<tips=35>ジョゼ・フェルナンデス</tips>の対応で頭を悩ませることにはならなかった。","en":"In fact, however, <tips=1>Leung</tips> would never have to trouble himself over how to deal with <tips=35>José Fernandes</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r381","rowIndex":381,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　なぜならば、それから数日後に<tips=35>ジョゼ・フェルナンデス</tips>は死んでしまったからである。","en":"That was because, only a few days later, <tips=35>José Fernandes</tips> died.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r382","rowIndex":382,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　――それは一本の電話から始まった。","en":"—It began with a single telephone call.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r383","rowIndex":383,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　まだ夜も明けぬ午前四時。ベッドで眠りこけていた<tips=1>亮</tips>は電話の呼び出し音で目を覚ました。久しぶりの<tips=38>リタ・フェルナンデス</tips>からの通話着信を、一体なんの用かと出てみると、感情の乱れたとりとめのない言葉がスピーカーから溢れ出た。","en":"At four in the morning, before the first light of dawn, the ringing phone woke <tips=1>Leung</tips> from a deep sleep. The call was from <tips=38>Rita Fernandes</tips>, from whom he had not heard in some time. He answered, wondering what she could want, and a flood of rambling words, disordered by emotion, poured from the speaker.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r384","rowIndex":384,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"『<tips=2>阿亮</tips>っ！　お父さんとお姉ちゃんが……ああ……。どうして……』","en":"‘<tips=2>Ah Leung</tips>! Father and my sister... Ah... Why...?’","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r385","rowIndex":385,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=38>リタ</tips>は完全に動揺し、半分泣きながら何かを訴えている。落ち着かせながら話を聞くと、彼女は屋敷に居て、どうも襲撃に遭ったらしい。<tips=1>謝亮</tips>はどこかに身を隠して動かぬよう伝えてベッドから飛び起きた。","en":"<tips=38>Rita</tips> was completely distraught, attempting through her sobs to tell him something. <tips=1>Leung</tips> calmed her enough to learn that she was at the family residence and that it had apparently been attacked. He told her to hide somewhere and remain still, then leapt out of bed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r386","rowIndex":386,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=80>双花紅棍</tips>の<tips=25>馬世傑</tips>をたたき起こし、すぐに動かせる数名を連れて<tips=41>グランドタワー</tips>を出る。","en":"He roused <tips=80>Double Flower Red Pole</tips> <tips=25>Ma Sai-kit</tips> and left <tips=41>Grand Tower</tips> with the handful of men he could mobilize at once.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r387","rowIndex":387,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その日は土砂降りで、真っ黒い空から滝のような雨がアスファルトを叩きつけていた。","en":"That night, rain poured from the pitch-black sky like a waterfall, hammering the asphalt.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r388","rowIndex":388,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　屋敷に到着すると、<tips=35>フェルナンデス</tips>の部下たちが先に到着していて建物に入ろうとする<tips=1>亮</tips>の行き先を阻む。","en":"When they reached the residence, <tips=35>Fernandes’s</tips> subordinates had already arrived. They barred <tips=1>Leung’s</tips> party from entering the building.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r389","rowIndex":389,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「我々は、もう<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>の一員ではありませんから。お引き取りください」","en":"“We are no longer members of <tips=7>YS</tips>. Please leave.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エンゾ・アラーニャ・エ・シウバ","displayName":"Enzo Aranha e Silva","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r390","rowIndex":390,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ポロシャツを着て、浅黒い肌をした口ひげの男が<tips=1>亮</tips>たちの前に立ちはだかった。彼はその場で一番立場の高い者らしく、近くのものに指示を出しながら、<tips=1>亮</tips>たちの対応に当たっている。","en":"A dark-skinned, mustachioed man in a polo shirt blocked <tips=1>Leung’s</tips> party. Apparently the senior person present, he issued instructions to those around him while dealing with <tips=1>Leung</tips> and the others.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r391","rowIndex":391,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その男と雨に打たれながら押し問答をしていると、寝間着姿の<tips=38>リタ</tips>が現れ、","en":"As they argue with the man in the driving rain, <tips=38>Rita</tips> appears in her nightclothes.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r392","rowIndex":392,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「私が呼んだのです！　お願いします、通してあげてください！」","en":"“I called them! Please, let them through!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"リタ・フェルナンデス","displayName":"Rita Fernandes","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r393","rowIndex":393,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　と叫んだので<tips=1>亮</tips>たちはやっとその現場に足を踏み入れることが出来た。","en":"Only after she shouts this are <tips=1>Leung</tips> and the others finally allowed inside.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r394","rowIndex":394,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　屋敷のなかも、銃を持った男たちが歩き回り、ポルトガル語で言葉を交わしている。<tips=38>リタ</tips>は電話の時よりは落ち着いていたが、<tips=1>亮</tips>の顔を見ると張り詰めていたものが切れてしまったらしく、説明しかけたところでボロボロと涙を流し泣き崩れてしまった。","en":"Inside the residence, too, armed men walked the halls and exchanged words in Portuguese. <tips=38>Rita</tips> was calmer than she had been on the phone, but the sight of <tips=1>Leung’s</tips> face seemed to break the tension holding her together. She had scarcely begun her explanation when tears streamed down her face and she broke down sobbing.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r395","rowIndex":395,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして喋れなくなってしまった彼女のかわりに、さきほど<tips=1>亮</tips>たちを入り口のところで押しとどめた口ひげの男が説明した。","en":"The mustachioed man who had stopped <tips=1>Leung’s</tips> party at the entrance gave the explanation in her place.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r396","rowIndex":396,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　今夜、<tips=35>フェルナンデス</tips>たちは家族で集まってリビングルームで話し合いをしていたらしい。","en":"The <tips=35>Fernandes</tips> family had apparently gathered in the living room that night for a discussion.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r397","rowIndex":397,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それは夜更けまで続き、<tips=38>リタ</tips>は眠くなって寝室に戻った。これが結果として彼女の命を救うことになる。","en":"It continued until late, when <tips=38>Rita</tips> grew sleepy and returned to her bedroom. In the end, that saved her life.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r398","rowIndex":398,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　襲撃は午前四時頃に行われた。覆面をかぶって武装した集団が襲来し、入り口の守衛を撃ち殺すとそのまま屋敷の敷地内に入り、庭に回ってそこから直接リビングルームを襲った。そこには二人のボディーガードが居たが突然の襲撃には対応出来なかった。そして<tips=35>フェルナンデス</tips>と二人の娘、それと使用人の若い女と中年の男が殺害された。","en":"The attack occurred at approximately four in the morning. A masked, armed group stormed the residence, shot dead the guard at the entrance, entered the grounds, circled around to the garden, and attacked the living room directly from there. Two bodyguards were present, but the surprise attack gave them no chance to respond. <tips=35>Fernandes</tips> and two of his daughters were killed, along with a young female servant and a middle-aged male servant.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r399","rowIndex":399,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　正確な人数は明らかになってはいないが、４、５人とのことだ。","en":"The attackers’ exact number remained unclear, but reports put it at four or five.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r400","rowIndex":400,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=38>リタ</tips>が騒音で起きてリビングに足を踏み入れた時にはすでに襲撃者は去っており、その現場から<tips=1>亮</tips>に連絡したのがさっきの電話であったらしい。一方、<tips=38>リタ</tips>と同様体調不良で自室で休んでいたもう一人の使用人も難を逃れ、こちらは口ひげの男に報告をしたのだそうだ。","en":"By the time the noise woke <tips=38>Rita</tips> and she entered the living room, the attackers had already left. The telephone call had apparently been placed to <tips=1>Leung</tips> from that scene. Another servant, who like <tips=38>Rita</tips> had been resting in their own room because of illness, likewise escaped the attack and reported what had happened to the mustachioed man.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r401","rowIndex":401,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　説明が終わるころには<tips=38>リタ</tips>も気を取り直していた。口ひげの男は<tips=38>リタ</tips>の精神状態を心配して現場にはもう行くべきでないと反対したが、<tips=38>リタ</tips>はそれを聞かず、自ら先頭に立って<tips=1>亮</tips>たちを現場となったリビングルームに案内した。","en":"By the time the explanation ended, <tips=38>Rita</tips> had regained her composure. Concerned for <tips=38>Rita’s</tips> mental state, the mustachioed man argued that she should not return to the scene, but <tips=38>Rita</tips> ignored him and personally led <tips=1>Leung’s</tips> group to the living room where the attack had occurred.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r402","rowIndex":402,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そこに足を踏み入れ、部屋の照明のスイッチを入れると、説明から想像される通りの光景が目の前に広がった。","en":"They entered and switched on the lights. The scene before them was exactly what the report had led them to expect.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r403","rowIndex":403,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　庭へ続く全面ガラス張りのサッシは銃弾によって破壊され、強い雨が吹き込んで毛足の長い絨毯を濡らしている。暗い庭には飼い犬が撃たれて死んでいるのが見えた。","en":"Gunfire had destroyed the floor-to-ceiling glass doors leading to the garden. Driving rain blew through the opening and soaked the deep-pile carpet. In the dark garden, they could see the family dog lying dead from a gunshot.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r404","rowIndex":404,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　部屋のなかの壁もソファーも、あらゆるものは穴だらけになるか、完全に打ち壊されて原形をとどめていなかった。","en":"Inside the room, the walls, the sofas, and everything else had either been riddled with holes or destroyed beyond recognition.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r405","rowIndex":405,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　床には血液や肉の塊が飛び散り、部屋全体を血なまぐさくしている。","en":"Blood and lumps of flesh lay scattered across the floor, filling the entire room with the reek of blood.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r406","rowIndex":406,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして部屋の中央には毛布をかぶせられて盛り上がりがある。<tips=25>世傑</tips>が近づいて端をめくると、犠牲者の遺体が胸の上で手を組むかたちで並べられていた。<tips=35>フェルナンデス</tips>の部下たちがいたましい姿で倒れていた主人たちをこのように整えたのだと言う。","en":"At the center of the room was a mound covered by a blanket. <tips=25>Sai-kit</tips> approached and lifted one edge. The victims’ bodies had been arranged side by side with their hands folded upon their chests. <tips=35>Fernandes’s</tips> subordinates had apparently arranged their masters’ bodies this way after finding them where they had fallen.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r407","rowIndex":407,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　犠牲者は、<tips=35>ジョゼ・フェルナンデス</tips>、<tips=36>アウロラ・フェルナンデス</tips>、<tips=37>アナ・クララ・フェルナンデス</tips>。","en":"The victims were <tips=35>José Fernandes</tips>, <tips=36>Aurora Fernandes</tips>, and <tips=37>Ana Clara Fernandes</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r408","rowIndex":408,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　いずれも<tips=1>亮</tips>が子供の頃からよく知っている人々だ。","en":"<tips=1>Leung</tips> had known all three well since childhood.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r409","rowIndex":409,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　使用人たちの遺体はさほどでもなかったが、<tips=35>フェルナンデス</tips>の家族はどれも大量の銃弾を受けて損傷が激しかった。特に頭部は原形がないほどに破壊されており、<tips=36>アウロラ</tips>などはとれかけた下あごが首と皮一枚で繋がっているだけでそこから上は完全に失われている。あの街中に知れ渡った美貌は、この部屋に散らばる無数の赤い塊になってしまったのだろう。","en":"The servants’ bodies were not as badly damaged, but every member of the <tips=35>Fernandes</tips> family had been struck by an enormous number of bullets. Their heads in particular had been destroyed beyond recognition. <tips=36>Aurora’s</tips> lower jaw hung from her neck by a single strip of skin, and everything above it was gone. The beauty once famous throughout the city had presumably become the countless red fragments scattered across the room.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r410","rowIndex":410,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あまり慣れてない人間の犯行ね。きっと、家族にひどく恨みがある連中よ」","en":"“This looks like the work of amateurs. Whoever did it must have held an extraordinary grudge against the family.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬世傑","displayName":"Ma Sai-kit","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r411","rowIndex":411,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　毛布をかけ直してから<tips=25>世傑</tips>はそう言った。","en":"<tips=25>Sai-kit</tips> says this after replacing the blanket.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r412","rowIndex":412,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「大した戦闘も起きていない一方的な殺戮の筈なのに、あまりにも散らかし過ぎだもの。興奮しすぎて頭の中が真っ白になったのかしらね？　弾をそこらじゅうの壁や家具やらにプレゼントしてるわ」","en":"“It should have been a one-sided massacre with hardly any fighting, but they made far too much of a mess. Perhaps they became so excited that their minds went blank. They handed out bullets as presents to every wall and piece of furniture in the place.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬世傑","displayName":"Ma Sai-kit","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r413","rowIndex":413,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼はそっけなく言ったが、今日の被害者は幼い頃からつき合いのある人間たちであった。普段なら絶え間なく冗談を口にする彼も、この屋敷に到着してから一度も軽口を叩いていない。","en":"He speaks curtly, but he has known the victims since childhood. Ordinarily, his joking is endless; since reaching the residence, however, he has not made a single flippant remark.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r414","rowIndex":414,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　先ほどまで泣いていた<tips=38>リタ</tips>は、<tips=1>亮</tips>の隣に立ち、さきほど<tips=25>世傑</tips>が毛布をめくったときも目をそらさず気丈に家族の姿を見た。","en":"<tips=38>Rita</tips>, who had been weeping moments earlier, stands beside <tips=1>Leung</tips>. When <tips=25>Sai-kit</tips> lifts the blanket, she does not look away, but bravely faces the sight of her family.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r415","rowIndex":415,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　顔は血の気が引いて蒼白だったが、襲撃者に対する怒りが表情にあらわれていた。","en":"Her face was drained white, yet anger toward the attackers showed in her expression.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r416","rowIndex":416,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>は感情のうかがい知れない鈍い表情をしている。","en":"<tips=1>Leung’s</tips> face is dull and unreadable.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r417","rowIndex":417,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そしてふとしゃがみ込み、毛布をめくって死者たちの姿をもう一度確認してから立ち上がると、<tips=38>リタ</tips>の顔を見る。","en":"Then, on impulse, he crouches, lifts the blanket, and inspects the dead once more. He stands again and looks into <tips=38>Rita’s</tips> face.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r418","rowIndex":418,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その時の彼の目はあまりにも冷たく、<tips=38>リタ</tips>の身体に鳥肌が立つほどであった。","en":"The look in his eyes is so cold that gooseflesh rises all over <tips=38>Rita’s</tips> body.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r419","rowIndex":419,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「この件は僕たちも追う」","en":"“We will pursue this as well.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X8:r420","rowIndex":420,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ぽつりと一言だけ言い、あとは相手の返事も聞かず、仲間と共にその場を後にした。","en":"He offered only those few words. Without waiting for an answer, he left the scene with his companions.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}}]},{"position":27,"code":"X9","unitId":"X9","rows":[{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r1","rowIndex":1,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　あまり<tips=9>Y地区</tips>のニュースを取り上げないメディアも、さすがにフェルナンデス一家殺害は取り上げた。","en":"Even the media, which seldom covered news from <tips=9>Y District</tips>, reported the murder of the Fernandes family.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r2","rowIndex":2,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　また、<tips=9>Y地区</tips>の街のなかでも、この事件は話題となった。","en":"The case also became the talk of the town in <tips=9>Y District</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r3","rowIndex":3,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　故人は<tips=9>Y地区</tips>を代表するギャングの一人であり、二人の娘もこの街では美女の例えとして持ち出されるほどの有名人である。それが自宅で無惨に殺害されたとなれば、騒ぎにならないはずがない。","en":"The dead man was one of the foremost gangsters in <tips=9>Y District</tips>, and his two daughters were so famous that people throughout the city held them up as paragons of beauty. When figures like them were brutally murdered in their own home, an uproar was inevitable.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r4","rowIndex":4,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして犯人が見つかっていないとなれば、様々な憶測が飛び交うのもまた当然の成り行きである。無責任な街の人々の間でいくつも生まれた陰謀説のなかで、もっとも信憑性が高く、多くの人々が信じたのが<tips=1>謝亮</tips>犯人説ではないだろうか。","en":"And with the killer still unidentified, it was only natural for all manner of speculation to fly. Among the many conspiracy theories dreamed up by irresponsible townspeople, the one most widely believed—and deemed most credible—was probably that <tips=1>Tse Leung</tips> was the culprit.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r5","rowIndex":5,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　何と言っても<tips=75>フェルナンデス・ファミリー</tips>が<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>を離脱した直後の事件である。身内の粛清などで過激な活動が目立ちはじめていた<tips=1>亮</tips>が第一に犯人として疑われるのは無理のない話で、事情に暗いものも通じたものも、彼の陰謀であるのは間違いないと断言するものが多かった。","en":"After all, the incident occurred just after the <tips=75>Fernandes Family</tips> withdrew from <tips=7>YS</tips>. <tips=1>Leung</tips> had begun drawing notice for extreme measures such as purging his own people, so it was understandable that he would be the first suspect. Many people—those ignorant of the circumstances and those well acquainted with them alike—declared that he had unquestionably orchestrated it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r6","rowIndex":6,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その噂は街の無関係な人々だけでなく、裏社会の人間たち、もっと言えば<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>のメンバーでさえそう信じているものが少なくない。","en":"The rumor was believed not only by people in the city with no connection to the case, but also by members of the underworld—indeed, by more than a few members of <tips=7>YS</tips> itself.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r7","rowIndex":7,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼らは事件直後に<tips=1>亮</tips>が現場へ急行し、そして犯人の捜索を行っていることは知っていたが、それさえもこの狡猾な<tips=81>龍頭</tips>の偽装行為であると信じているようだった。","en":"They knew that <tips=1>Leung</tips> had rushed to the scene immediately after the incident and was searching for the culprits, yet they seemed to believe that even this was a ruse staged by the cunning <tips=81>Longtou</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r8","rowIndex":8,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「やっぱり、あれをやったのは<tips=81>龍頭</tips>ですよね？」","en":"“It was the <tips=81>Longtou</tips> who did it, wasn’t it?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r9","rowIndex":9,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=28>トーマス</tips>も、部下にそう訊ねられた時には驚く他なかった。","en":"<tips=28>Thomas</tips> could only be astonished when one of his own subordinates asked him that question.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r10","rowIndex":10,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼はそんなわけがないと噂を否定したが、部下は信じようとしない。それどころか、","en":"He denied the rumor, insisting that it could not possibly be true. His subordinate refused to believe him. Instead, the man went so far as to say:","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r11","rowIndex":11,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=81>龍頭</tips>を信じちゃ駄目ですよ。あれは用無しになったり、邪魔になった人間はすぐに消すじゃないですか。<tips=35>フェルナンデス</tips>の件もそうでしょうな。……やはり、我々は独立をした方がいいのではないですか？　そして、他の華僑たちと連合して新しい組織を作りましょう。この街には<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>とは違う華僑だけの組織が必要です」","en":"“You mustn’t trust the <tips=81>Longtou</tips>. Doesn’t he get rid of people the moment they’re no longer useful—or become an obstacle? What happened to <tips=35>Fernandes</tips> proves it, doesn’t it? …Surely we’d be better off declaring independence? Then we could join forces with the other overseas Chinese and create a new organization. This city needs an organization solely for overseas Chinese, separate from <tips=7>YS</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r12","rowIndex":12,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　部下は本気でそれが最善の方法だと考えているらしく、<tips=28>トーマス</tips>もなだめるのに骨を折った。","en":"His subordinate seemed to believe quite sincerely that this was the best course, and <tips=28>Thomas</tips> had a hard time calming him down.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r13","rowIndex":13,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そもそも、今回の事件がなくとも、もう一度<tips=74>廖ファミリー</tips>の独立を希望する声は組織のなかに根強く残っている。","en":"Even without this latest incident, there remained a strong current within the organization calling for the <tips=74>Liao Family</tips> to regain its independence.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r14","rowIndex":14,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=28>トーマス</tips>はこうやって独立を口に出されるたびに、内心閉口しながら、<tips=1>亮</tips>に協力することの意味と必然性を説明するのだった。","en":"Whenever one of them spoke of independence, <tips=28>Thomas</tips> would suppress his private exasperation and explain why cooperating with <tips=1>Leung</tips> was both meaningful and necessary.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r15","rowIndex":15,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>謝亮</tips>という人間はそこまで非情ではない――とは思うのだが、ただ難しいのは、今回の事件においては、<tips=28>トーマス</tips>でさえも完全にその可能性を否定しきれないというところだ。","en":"At least, <tips=28>Thomas</tips> did not believe <tips=1>Tse Leung</tips> was that ruthless. The trouble was that, in this case, even he could not entirely rule out the possibility.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r16","rowIndex":16,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"（あれだけフェルナンデス家を警戒していたんだ。<tips=2>阿亮</tips>ならやりかねないんじゃないか？）","en":"(He'd been so wary of the Fernandes family. Wasn't <tips=2>Ah Leung</tips> capable of something like this?)","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r17","rowIndex":17,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そんな疑念が、頭の片隅をよぎる瞬間もある。","en":"At times, that suspicion flickered through the back of his mind.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r18","rowIndex":18,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　だが、そんな風に思ってしまったときは慌ててその考えを否定し、<tips=1>亮</tips>を疑ってしまった自分を恥じるのだ。","en":"But whenever he caught himself thinking that way, he hastily rejected the idea and felt ashamed for having doubted <tips=1>Leung</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r19","rowIndex":19,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　確かに<tips=1>亮</tips>は必要があれば戦うと言っていたが、幼なじみの<tips=36>アウロラ</tips>や、<tips=37>アナ・クララ</tips>を無慈悲に殺害するような人間だとは、やはり<tips=28>トーマス</tips>には思えないのである。","en":"It was true that <tips=1>Leung</tips> had said he would fight if necessary, but <tips=28>Thomas</tips> still could not believe he was the sort of man who would mercilessly murder his childhood friends <tips=36>Aurora</tips> and <tips=37>Ana Clara</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r20","rowIndex":20,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そんな噂が飛び交うなか、<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>は襲撃犯の一人を特定した。","en":"Amid all these rumors, <tips=7>YS</tips> identified one of the attackers.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r21","rowIndex":21,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　名前はミゲル。","en":"His name was Miguel.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r22","rowIndex":22,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ブラジル出身の二十三才の<tips=17>タイプB</tips>で、かつては<tips=35>フェルナンデス</tips>の世話になっていたが、組織の決まり事が守れず除名。<tips=57>滑走路通り</tips>をうろついて観光客を狙ったスリやひったくりでその日暮らしをしている男だ。","en":"He was a twenty-three-year-old <tips=17>Type B</tips> from Brazil. He had once been under <tips=35>Fernandes’s</tips> care, but was expelled for failing to follow the organization’s rules. He drifted around <tips=57>Runway Street</tips>, living hand to mouth by picking tourists’ pockets and snatching their bags.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r23","rowIndex":23,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そんな彼が、サブマシンガンを入手して、酒場で見せびらかして自慢をしていたという情報が入った。","en":"Word came that he had obtained a submachine gun and had been showing it off and bragging about it in a bar.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r24","rowIndex":24,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ちんけな泥棒にしては、あまりにも物々しい武器である。この街なら手に入れることが不可能ではないが、安価ではない。","en":"For a small-time thief, it was an extraordinarily formidable weapon. It was not impossible to obtain in this city, but it did not come cheap.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r25","rowIndex":25,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その時期もフェルナンデス家襲撃のタイミングと符合する。","en":"The timing also matched that of the attack on the Fernandes family.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r26","rowIndex":26,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　情報を得るために<tips=25>馬世傑</tips>が仲間と共に彼が寝床としている<tips=58>パラシュート通り</tips>の簡易宿泊所を訪ねた。","en":"Seeking information, <tips=25>Ma Sai-kit</tips> and several companions visited the cheap lodging house on <tips=58>Parachute Street</tips> where Miguel slept.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r27","rowIndex":27,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ミゲルはベッドの上でぐにゃぐにゃになって笑っていた。その手元には注射器。","en":"Miguel sprawled limply across the bed, laughing. A syringe lay beside him.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r28","rowIndex":28,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　麻薬を楽しんでいたのである。","en":"He was enjoying a drug-induced high.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r29","rowIndex":29,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　すっかり薬でイカれているミゲルは侵入者たちが部屋を物色し始めてもあらがう術がない。","en":"Completely out of his mind on drugs, Miguel was powerless to resist when the intruders began rifling through the room.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r30","rowIndex":30,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　はたして、彼の部屋からは銃と血のついた札束が見つかり、即刻<tips=41>グランドタワー</tips>に連行されることになる。","en":"Sure enough, a gun and a bundle of bloodstained bills were found in his room, and he was promptly taken to <tips=41>Grand Tower</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r31","rowIndex":31,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ミゲルは臆病な小心者で、彼に口を割らせるのに薬剤や拷問は必要なかった。","en":"Miguel was a timid coward, and neither drugs nor torture was needed to make him talk.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r32","rowIndex":32,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　窓のない暗い部屋で椅子に縛り付けて少し脅しただけでぺらぺらと喋り出し、それによってフェルナンデス一家殺人事件の全容が明らかになった。","en":"They merely tied him to a chair in a dark, windowless room and made a few threats. He began talking freely, revealing the full story behind the murder of the Fernandes family.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r33","rowIndex":33,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　主謀者はダヴィという二十一才の若者である。","en":"The mastermind was a twenty-one-year-old named Davi.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r34","rowIndex":34,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=17>タイプB</tips>で、少年のころに発症しており時々幻覚に襲われることがあった。そのためトラブルが多く、故郷を追われ、あちこちを彷徨い、<tips=35>フェルナンデス</tips>という面倒見の良い親分がいるとききつけこの街にやって来たのが去年のことだ。","en":"He was a <tips=17>Type B</tips> whose symptoms had first manifested when he was a boy, and he was sometimes beset by hallucinations. This brought him constant trouble; he was driven from his hometown and wandered from place to place. Then he heard that a boss named <tips=35>Fernandes</tips>, known for looking after people, lived in this city, and came here the previous year.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r35","rowIndex":35,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そこでダヴィは境遇に同情した<tips=35>フェルナンデス</tips>によって非常に親切な扱いを受け、屋敷に居候させて貰いながら彼の紹介した仕事場で働くことになった。","en":"There, <tips=35>Fernandes</tips>, moved by Davi’s circumstances, treated him with extraordinary kindness. He let Davi stay at the mansion and arranged work for him through his own connections.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r36","rowIndex":36,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しかし、どの仕事場でも彼は長続きしなかった。理由は症状だけでなく、盗癖があり、店や同僚のものを盗んでしまうからだった。","en":"But Davi never lasted long at any job. His symptoms were not the only reason: he also had a compulsion to steal, and took things from shops and coworkers.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r37","rowIndex":37,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　このことが知れても<tips=35>フェルナンデス</tips>は家から追い出したりしようとはせず、彼の更生を期待して説教をしたり、彼のために労力を割いたがそれは報われなかった。結局ダヴィ自身がその生活に嫌気がさし、何も言わずに姿を消した。","en":"Even after this came to light, <tips=35>Fernandes</tips> did not try to throw Davi out. He lectured the young man in hope of reforming him and put time and effort into helping him, but none of it bore fruit. In the end, Davi himself grew sick of that life and vanished without a word.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r38","rowIndex":38,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして街でこそ泥などをして暮らしていると、同じような境遇のミゲルと知り合った。","en":"As he made his living as a petty thief in the city, he met Miguel, whose circumstances were much like his own.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r39","rowIndex":39,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ダヴィはミゲルに対し、よく<tips=35>フェルナンデス</tips>のことを語ったが、いずれも嫉妬と憎悪に塗れたものであった。","en":"Davi often spoke to Miguel about <tips=35>Fernandes</tips>, but everything he said was steeped in envy and hatred.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r40","rowIndex":40,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　フェルナンデス家の豊かな財産、美しく仲の良い娘たちとの幸福な家庭、どんな命令にも従う忠実な部下と、彼らから得る敬意、そして<tips=17>タイプB</tips>の苦しみとは無縁なノーマルとして生まれついていること。いずれも、ダヴィが渇望してもけして手に入れることなど出来ないものだ。彼はフェルナンデス家に優しくされるたび、屈辱と憎悪をつのらせていたのである。","en":"The Fernandes family’s vast wealth. His happy home with his beautiful, close-knit daughters. His loyal subordinates, who obeyed every command, and the respect they showed him. The fact that he had been born a Normal, untouched by the suffering of a <tips=17>Type B</tips>. These were all things Davi could long for but never possess. Every time the Fernandes family treated him kindly, his humiliation and hatred grew.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r41","rowIndex":41,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　この屈折した感情が具体的な犯行計画に変わるのに、そう長い時間はかからなかった。","en":"It did not take long for those twisted feelings to become a concrete plan for the crime.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r42","rowIndex":42,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　武器を買い、泥棒仲間をさらに二人加え、着々と準備が進められた。目的はファミリーの殺害と、金品の奪取。屋敷で居候していたダヴィは、金がどこにあって、どのようなルートなら襲撃が成功しやすいかを知っていた。ミゲルはあの<tips=75>フェルナンデス・ファミリー</tips>の本拠地を襲撃することに尻込みしたが、襲撃成功後の豊かな生活を何度も語られるうち、いつしかうんと頷いていた。","en":"Weapons were bought, two more fellow thieves recruited, and preparations steadily advanced. The objectives were to kill the Family and steal its valuables. Having lived in the mansion, Davi knew where the money was kept and which route offered the best chance of a successful attack. Miguel balked at attacking the headquarters of the <tips=75>Fernandes Family</tips>, but after hearing again and again about the rich life awaiting them once the attack succeeded, he eventually found himself nodding along.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r43","rowIndex":43,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そしてあの夜、計画は実行に移されたのである。","en":"That night, they put the plan into action.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r44","rowIndex":44,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　四人は泥棒が専門で、殺人などの経験がない。恐怖を吹き飛ばすために興奮剤を注射してからの犯行となったが、みな無我夢中だった。","en":"All four were thieves by trade and had no experience with murder. They injected themselves with stimulants to drive away their fear before committing the crime, but all of them acted in a frenzy.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r45","rowIndex":45,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　現場の状況も、想定とは少し違う。本当ならば屋敷の各部屋をまわって家族を一人ずつ殺してゆく筈だったのだが、深夜にもかかわらずにフェルナンデス一家はリビングルームに集まっていた。","en":"The situation at the scene also differed somewhat from what they had anticipated. Their plan had been to go from room to room through the mansion and kill the family one by one, but despite the late hour, the entire Fernandes family was gathered in the living room.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r46","rowIndex":46,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　無事建物に侵入したところで彼らはそれに気がついた。","en":"Only once they had safely entered the building did they realize this.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r47","rowIndex":47,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　全員揃っているなら都合がいいと、深く考えずに興奮剤の勢いでそのまま突入をする。歴戦の勇者がそこにいなかったのが彼らにとって幸いだった。浮かされたような気持ちのままばらまかれた銃弾はけして精度が高いわけではなかったが、ほとんど明け方に近い時刻、アルコールも入り、もう眠ろうとしている人々を殺害するには充分だった。","en":"Seeing everyone gathered in one place, they charged in without thinking, borne along by the stimulants. Their good fortune was that the seasoned warrior was not there. The bullets they sprayed in their fevered state were far from accurate, but at an hour near dawn, they were more than sufficient to kill people who had been drinking and were preparing for sleep.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r48","rowIndex":48,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼らが銃弾を撃ち尽くすと、家族は物言わぬ死体となり、部屋のなかは静まりかえった。<tips=38>リタ</tips>がその場にいないことには気がついていたが、その静寂は彼らの感情を呼び起こし、急に怖くなった。そこで彼らは<tips=38>リタ</tips>の殺害を断念すると、金庫を破壊して金を盗み、現場から逃げ出したのである。","en":"Once their ammunition was spent, the family lay as silent corpses and the room fell still. They had noticed that <tips=38>Rita</tips> was not there. But the silence brought them back to their senses, and suddenly they were afraid. Abandoning the attempt to kill <tips=38>Rita</tips>, they broke open the safe, stole the money, and fled the scene.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r49","rowIndex":49,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その後は奪ったものを分配してバラバラになったので、他の実行犯がどうしているかはミゲルも知らなかった。","en":"Afterward, they divided the proceeds and went their separate ways. Miguel did not know what had become of the other participants.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r50","rowIndex":50,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　この報告を受け、<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>は動く。","en":"Upon receiving the report, <tips=7>YS</tips> sprang into action.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r51","rowIndex":51,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=81>龍頭</tips>の<tips=1>謝亮</tips>は即座に残りの実行犯の捕縛を<tips=25>世傑</tips>に命じた。","en":"The <tips=81>Longtou</tips>, <tips=1>Tse Leung</tips>, immediately ordered <tips=25>Sai-kit</tips> to capture the remaining perpetrators.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r52","rowIndex":52,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　共犯者の一人、ペドロはカジノで遊んでいるところを発見される。","en":"One accomplice, Pedro, was found gambling at a casino.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r53","rowIndex":53,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　素手で抵抗したが体術の達人である<tips=25>世傑</tips>にはかなわず瞬く間に失神させられ、<tips=41>グランドタワー</tips>に運ばれた。","en":"He resisted barehanded, but was no match for <tips=25>Sai-kit</tips>, a master of hand-to-hand combat. Sai-kit knocked him unconscious in moments, and he was taken to <tips=41>Grand Tower</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r54","rowIndex":54,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　もう一人、ジョアンは売春宿から出て来たところを<tips=25>世傑</tips>の部下が接触。銃撃戦になりその場で死亡させてしまうが、遺体として回収される。","en":"Another accomplice, João, was approached by <tips=25>Sai-kit’s</tips> men as he emerged from a brothel. A gunfight broke out, and Sai-kit’s men ended up killing him at the scene, but they recovered his body.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r55","rowIndex":55,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして主犯者のダヴィは<tips=59>暗闇通り</tips>で見つかり、一旦は逃げることに成功したが、その後街から脱出しようと試みたところで、<tips=40>黄天明</tips>、<tips=40>天祥</tips>の人間レーダー姉妹に発見される。<tips=25>世傑</tips>本人に銃を突きつけられると大人しく降伏し、<tips=41>グランドタワー</tips>に連行された。","en":"Davi, the mastermind, was found on <tips=59>Darkness Street</tips> and initially managed to escape. Later, however, when he tried to flee the city, he was found by the human-radar sisters <tips=40>Wong Tin-ming</tips> and <tips=40>Wong Tin-cheung</tips>. When <tips=25>Sai-kit</tips> himself held him at gunpoint, he surrendered quietly and was taken to <tips=41>Grand Tower</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r56","rowIndex":56,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼らは<tips=81>龍頭</tips>である<tips=1>謝亮</tips>自らによる尋問を受けた。","en":"They were interrogated in person by <tips=1>Tse Leung</tips>, the <tips=81>Longtou</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r57","rowIndex":57,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そしてフェルナンデス一家殺害に関与したことが明らかになると、<tips=75>フェルナンデス・ファミリー</tips>に身柄を引き渡されることになった。","en":"Once their participation in the murder of the Fernandes family had been established, they were handed over to the <tips=75>Fernandes Family</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r58","rowIndex":58,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=35>ジョゼ・フェルナンデス</tips>亡きあとのファミリーは、一時的な措置としてあの口ひげの幹部――<tips=96>エンゾ・アラーニャ・エ・シウバ</tips>が指揮を執っている。","en":"After <tips=35>José Fernandes’s</tips> death, the mustachioed officer <tips=96>Enzo Aranha e Silva</tips> had assumed command of the Family as a temporary measure.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r59","rowIndex":59,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼は他の幹部や<tips=38>リタ</tips>との協議の末、最大の罪を犯したもののみに行われる、伝統的な手法で彼らを処刑することを決定した。","en":"After consulting the other officers and <tips=38>Rita</tips>, he decided to execute the prisoners by a traditional method reserved solely for those who had committed the gravest crimes.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r60","rowIndex":60,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　三人の襲撃者は赤く熱した鉄の棒で滅多打ちにされ、やがて死亡が確認されると鉈によって首を切断される。こうして出来上がった三つの斬首死体は、先に死んでいるジョアンの遺体とあわせ、<tips=59>暗闇通り</tips>の路上に放置されることになった。","en":"The three attackers were savagely beaten with red-hot iron bars. Once they were confirmed dead, their heads were hacked off with a machete. The resulting three decapitated corpses were left in the street on <tips=59>Darkness Street</tips>, along with the body of João, who had died earlier.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r61","rowIndex":61,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ワゴン車で運んできた遺体をアスファルトの上に蹴り落とす場面には<tips=1>謝亮</tips>も同行し、四人の襲撃犯の無惨な最後を見届けた。","en":"When the bodies were brought in a van and kicked out onto the asphalt, <tips=1>Tse Leung</tips> was there as well. He witnessed the grisly end of all four attackers.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r62","rowIndex":62,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　遺体の胴体はうつぶせに並べられ、切り取られた頭部はその背中の上に置かれる。","en":"The torsos were laid face down in a row, with each severed head placed upon its owner’s back.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r63","rowIndex":63,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ギリギリまで冷静を保ってこの設置作業を見守っていた<tips=38>リタ</tips>も、去る間際には我慢が出来なくなり、涙を流しながら遺体に石を投げつけた。","en":"<tips=38>Rita</tips> watches the bodies being arranged, maintaining her composure until the last possible moment. As they are about to leave, however, she can endure it no longer. Weeping, she hurls stones at the bodies.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r64","rowIndex":64,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　こうして一件が落着すると、<tips=38>リタ</tips>が父の跡を継いで新しいボスに就任し、<tips=96>エンゾ</tips>のサポートを受けながらファミリーを率いてゆくことが決定した。","en":"With the affair thus brought to a close, it was decided that <tips=38>Rita</tips> would succeed her father as the new boss and lead the Family with <tips=96>Enzo’s</tips> support.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r65","rowIndex":65,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=59>暗闇通り</tips>からほど近く、一見すると何の変哲もないその民家こそが、<tips=9>Y地区</tips>中の<tips=17>タイプB</tips>たちが加盟しているという秘密結社『<tips=21>八龍会</tips>』の本拠地だ。","en":"Not far from <tips=59>Darkness Street</tips> stood an utterly unremarkable home. It was, in fact, the headquarters of the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips>, the secret organization said to count <tips=17>Type Bs</tips> throughout <tips=9>Y District</tips> among its members.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r66","rowIndex":66,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　何かの祝い事の日には近所の<tips=17>タイプB</tips>の子供が集まってパーティを行ったり、平日の昼間に<tips=17>タイプB</tips>のカウンセラーや主婦たちが集まって彼らならではの悩み事を打ち明け合ったり、明るく健康的な活動の反面、夜にはギャング組織の幹部などがとりまきを引き連れて出入りしたりもしている。そして<tips=17>タイプB</tips>たちに、症状を和らげる薬物を、合法非合法限らずに安く販売もする。","en":"On days of celebration, neighborhood <tips=17>Type B</tips> children gathered there for parties. On weekday afternoons, <tips=17>Type B</tips> counselors and housewives met to share problems particular to their condition. Alongside these bright, wholesome activities, gang officers and their entourages also came and went at night. The Society also sold symptom-relieving drugs to <tips=17>Type Bs</tips> at low prices, whether the drugs were legal or illegal.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r67","rowIndex":67,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その家の主は三人の老人で、東洋人、黒人、白人とそれぞれ違った人種であり、三人の間に上下はない。","en":"The house belonged to three old men—one East Asian, one Black, and one white man. None held authority over the others.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r68","rowIndex":68,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　裏社会の表立った支配者が<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>であり、その<tips=81>龍頭</tips>である<tips=1>謝亮</tips>だとするならば、裏社会のさらに裏の支配者と言えばこの三人になるだろう。この街ではあらゆる組織に<tips=17>タイプB</tips>が入り込んでおり、彼らはそれに強い影響力を持っている。","en":"If <tips=7>YS</tips> and its <tips=81>Longtou</tips>, <tips=1>Tse Leung</tips>, were the overt rulers of the underworld, then these three might be called the rulers of the world behind the underworld. <tips=17>Type Bs</tips> had made their way into organizations throughout the city, and the elders exerted powerful influence over them.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r69","rowIndex":69,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　フェルナンデス一家が殺害されてから数日後のことだ。","en":"This was several days after the Fernandes family murders.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r70","rowIndex":70,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　昼下がり、この三人の老人はのんびりと麻雀に興じていた。屋敷に遊びに来たゲストなどもよく使う古い全自動卓は、来客のない時でも三人によって酷使され、塗装のあちこちに剥げなどが目立つ。","en":"One afternoon, the three old men were enjoying a leisurely game of mahjong. Guests to the house often used the old automatic table, but the elders put it through heavy use even when no visitors were present, and its finish had worn away in patches.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r71","rowIndex":71,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼らの遊んでいるルールは、一般的によく知られている四人で遊ぶものではなく、<ruby=サンマ>三麻</ruby>とよばれる三人麻雀であった。しかも一局ごとに点数を精算するタイプのルールを採用している。","en":"They were playing not the familiar four-player game, but a three-player form called sanma. They also used rules under which the scores were settled after every hand.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r72","rowIndex":72,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　点数が高く、しかも展開の早い刺激的なルールで、よく遊ばれている半荘制のように大きなゲームの区切りがないからいつまでも遊んでいられる。<tips=22>老人たち</tips>はこのルールを非常に好んでおり、滅多に四人打ちでは遊ばない。","en":"It was a thrilling, high-scoring ruleset with fast-paced play. Unlike the common hanchan format, it had no major break between games, so they could play as long as they pleased. <tips=22>The old men</tips> greatly favored these rules and rarely played four-player mahjong.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r73","rowIndex":73,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　現に今日も、<tips=10>見土道夫</tips>がいるのに、彼を見学させたまま三人でゲームを繰り返している。","en":"Indeed, even with <tips=10>Michio Mido</tips> present today, they had left him to watch while the three of them played hand after hand.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r74","rowIndex":74,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=10>道夫</tips>、お前はまだやくたいもない饅頭売りをしているのかい？」","en":"“<tips=10>Michio</tips>, are you still peddling those worthless little buns?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r75","rowIndex":75,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=90>ミスター・チェン</tips>は牌を一枚取り、そのまま卓の上に捨てるという動作をしながら言った。","en":"<tips=90>Mr. Chen</tips> asked the question as he drew a tile and discarded it upon the table in one uninterrupted motion.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r76","rowIndex":76,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼はリーチをしており、あとはあがるための牌を持って来るか、他のメンツが出すのを待つだけである。","en":"He had declared riichi. All that remained was to draw his winning tile or wait for one of the others to discard it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r77","rowIndex":77,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「やくたいもないって言い方はないでしょう」","en":"“You don’t have to call them worthless.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r78","rowIndex":78,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まるで成果が出ていないようじゃないか」","en":"“But it looks as though you haven’t achieved a thing.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r79","rowIndex":79,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　三人の牌を取り、捨てるテンポは早く、すぐに<tips=90>ミスター・チェン</tips>の手番が回ってくる。","en":"The three men drew and discarded at a rapid tempo. <tips=90>Mr. Chen’s</tips> turn soon came around again.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r80","rowIndex":80,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「これからですよ。これから。やっと目処がついてきたところなんですから」","en":"“It's just getting started. Just getting started. Things are finally beginning to take shape.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r81","rowIndex":81,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ふん、いつも同じことばかり言っていますね」","en":"“Hmph. You say the same thing every time.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r82","rowIndex":82,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　白い顔の<tips=91>ミスター・スミス</tips>は持って来た牌を見て、手を止める。そして<tips=90>ミスター・チェン</tips>が捨てた牌の列を眺めている。","en":"The white-faced <tips=91>Mr. Smith</tips> looks at the tile he has drawn and pauses. Then he studies the row of tiles <tips=90>Mr. Chen</tips> has discarded.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r83","rowIndex":83,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「遅いよ。下手な考え休むに似たりね」","en":"“Too slow. A fool lost in thought might as well be asleep.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r84","rowIndex":84,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=90>ミスター・チェン</tips>がそう煽ると、彼は眉間に皺を寄せ、","en":"At <tips=90>Mr. Chen’s</tips> taunt, he furrows his brow.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r85","rowIndex":85,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「これは通るはずです」","en":"“This tile ought to be safe.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r86","rowIndex":86,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　悩んだ末に結局掴んだ牌を捨てた。","en":"After all that hesitation, Smith discarded the tile he had drawn.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r87","rowIndex":87,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それは当たりの牌ではなかったようで、次の番となる<tips=89>ミスター・アーノルド</tips>が卓の上の牌に手を伸ばす。","en":"The discard appears to be safe, and <tips=89>Mr. Arnold</tips>, whose turn is next, reaches toward the tiles on the table.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r88","rowIndex":88,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>は世代交代をして、<tips=35>フェルナンデス</tips>のところも娘があとを継いだ。そろそろお前にも、重要な役割についてほしいと私たちは思っているんだよ」","en":"“<tips=7>YS</tips> has passed to a new generation, and <tips=35>Fernandes’s</tips> daughter has succeeded him. We think it is time for you to assume an important role as well.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r89","rowIndex":89,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　アーノルドは言うと、持って来た牌を自分の手の牌と取り替えて卓の上に横向きに並べ、自分の引き出しから赤丸ひとつが印字された点棒を一本放り投げる。","en":"As Arnold spoke, he exchanged the tile he had drawn for one in his hand, set the discarded tile sideways upon the table, and tossed a thousand-point stick from his drawer.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r90","rowIndex":90,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「リーチ」","en":"“Riichi.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r91","rowIndex":91,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あいやー、ずいぶんと強気だねー」","en":"“Aiyah, that’s awfully bold of you!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r92","rowIndex":92,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=90>ミスター・チェン</tips>は苦笑しながら牌をとる。","en":"<tips=90>Mr. Chen</tips> drew a tile with a rueful smile.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r93","rowIndex":93,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=67>カミラ</tips>と、ジョン、そしてお前の三人で幹部になるんだ。我々の後継者としてな。この組織は、黒、白、黄色という三人でバランス良くやっていかなきゃいけない。そうでなければ、この街に住む様々な肌の色の<tips=17>タイプB</tips>が、気後れなく参加することは出来ないからな」","en":"“<tips=67>Camilla</tips>, John, and you will become the three officers—our successors. The organization needs three people—Black, white, and yellow—to maintain its balance. Otherwise, <tips=17>Type Bs</tips> of every skin color in this city won't feel free to join.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r94","rowIndex":94,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=89>ミスター・アーノルド</tips>は傍らのサイドテーブルに置いたコーヒーカップを手に取るとそう言った。","en":"<tips=89>Mr. Arnold</tips> picked up the coffee cup on the side table beside him as he spoke.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r95","rowIndex":95,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……そりゃ、手伝いくらいはしますが、そんなに本格的には出来ませんよ。何度も言ってますが」","en":"“...I’ll help out, but I can’t commit myself to anything that serious. I’ve told you that many times.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r96","rowIndex":96,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=10>道夫</tips>が困って頭を掻くと、","en":"<tips=10>Michio</tips> scratches his head, at a loss.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r97","rowIndex":97,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ロン！」","en":"“Ron!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r98","rowIndex":98,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　鋭く発声したのは、<tips=91>ミスター・スミス</tips>であった。","en":"The sharp call came from <tips=91>Mr. Smith</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r99","rowIndex":99,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あっ、テンパイしていたのか！　しかも倍満か？」","en":"“Ah! You were in tenpai? And baiman, too?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r100","rowIndex":100,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　スミスが倒した手牌を見て、その思ったよりも高い得点に頭を抱えたのは振り込む形となった<tips=90>ミスター・チェン</tips>である。","en":"When Smith laid down his hand, the score was far higher than <tips=90>Mr. Chen</tips> had expected. Chen, who had dealt into it, clutched his head.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r101","rowIndex":101,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「降りても良かったし、手代わりを待っても良かったんですが、高いやつを出してくれましたからね。これで今日のトータルは私がトップになりましたね」","en":"“I could have folded or waited for my hand to improve, but you dealt into such a valuable hand. That puts me at the top for the day.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r102","rowIndex":102,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　普段通りの無表情でスミスはそう言った。","en":"Smith says this with his usual blank expression.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r103","rowIndex":103,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「何、これからよ」","en":"“Come on. I’m only getting started.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r104","rowIndex":104,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　チェンは舌打ちをして牌を崩した。","en":"Chen clicked his tongue and broke apart his hand.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r105","rowIndex":105,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　三人は両手を伸ばして今使った牌をじゃらじゃらと卓の中央のくぼみへ落とし込む。そうしてボタンを押すと、新しい牌がすぐゲームを開始できるように二段の列となってせり上がってくるのが全自動卓というものなのだが、何度押しても動かない。","en":"All three men reached forward and swept the used tiles with a clatter into the hollow at the center of the table. Ordinarily, pressing a button would cause new tiles to rise in two-tiered walls, ready for the next hand. But no matter how many times they pressed, the table did not move.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r106","rowIndex":106,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「また故障！　三日前に修理して貰ったばかりなのに！」","en":"“Broken again! We only had it repaired three days ago!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r107","rowIndex":107,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=90>ミスター・チェン</tips>は顔を真っ赤にして卓の端を手のひらで叩く。","en":"Face flushed crimson, <tips=90>Mr. Chen</tips> slapped the edge of the table with his palm.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r108","rowIndex":108,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「今日はもうやめよう。私はすこし疲れた」","en":"“Let us stop for today. I am a little tired.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r109","rowIndex":109,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=89>ミスター・アーノルド</tips>はコーヒーを飲みながら醒めた表情で言う。","en":"<tips=89>Mr. Arnold</tips> said it coolly as he drank his coffee.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r110","rowIndex":110,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「アナタは浮きも沈みもしていないからそれでいいだろうけれど、私はこれでは引っ込みつかないよ……」","en":"“Easy for you to say when you’ve broken even. I can’t possibly leave things like this...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r111","rowIndex":111,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「頭が熱くなったままゲームをたって負けが込むだけだ。それに、どうやるつもりだ？　手積みでは面倒で仕方がない」","en":"“You’ll only lose more while your head is hot. Besides, how would we play? Building the walls by hand would be intolerably tedious.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r112","rowIndex":112,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「勝ったから言うわけではないですが、私ももう十分です。また修理が終わったらやればいいじゃないですか」","en":"“It isn’t because I won, but I’ve had enough too. We can play again once the table is repaired.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r113","rowIndex":113,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　二人に諭されると、<tips=90>ミスター・チェン</tips>は渋々引き下がる他なかった。","en":"With both men urging him to stop, <tips=90>Mr. Chen</tips> has no choice but to back down reluctantly.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r114","rowIndex":114,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「じゃあ、そういうことで、おれも<tips=66>コンタ</tips>一人に店番させてるから、そろそろ……」","en":"“Well, if that settles it, I left <tips=66>Konta</tips> alone to mind the shop, so I should probably be going...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r115","rowIndex":115,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　このタイミングに<tips=10>道夫</tips>はそう言って席を外そうとしたのだが、","en":"<tips=10>Michio</tips> tries to seize the opportunity to excuse himself.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r116","rowIndex":116,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いや、お前には残って貰う。会って貰いたい人間がいるのでな」","en":"“No. You will remain. There is someone we want you to meet.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r117","rowIndex":117,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=89>ミスター・アーノルド</tips>が釘を刺すので、浮かしかけた腰をまた降ろす。","en":"<tips=89>Mr. Arnold’s</tips> warning forced Michio to sit back down just as he had begun to rise.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r118","rowIndex":118,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「『またか』って顔をしているね。そうなんだよ、またなんだ。すまないね」","en":"“Your face says, ‘Again?’ Yes, again. Sorry about that.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r119","rowIndex":119,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=90>ミスター・チェン</tips>は苦笑して言った。","en":"<tips=90>Mr. Chen</tips> says this with a rueful smile.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r120","rowIndex":120,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　まったく、<tips=10>道夫</tips>からすればうんざりするようなやり方である。","en":"From <tips=10>Michio’s</tips> perspective, the whole routine is utterly tiresome.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r121","rowIndex":121,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　はじめから人と会わせたいと言ったら来ないのがわかっているから、顔を見たいだの、体調がよろしくなくて不安だの、人情に訴えかける放っておけない理由をつけて呼び出すのだ。","en":"They knew he would not come if they told him from the outset that they wanted to introduce him to someone. So they would say they wanted to see his face, or that they were in poor health and anxious—some appeal to his sympathy that he could not ignore—and summon him on that pretext.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r122","rowIndex":122,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=10>道夫</tips>はわかっていても、この手の誘い文句には弱い。","en":"Even though <tips=10>Michio</tips> saw through it, he was a sucker for this kind of line.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r123","rowIndex":123,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　可愛い女の子がこういう理由を使うならまだしも、なんだって食えない爺さんどもの見え見えの嘘とわかりながら、のこのこやって来てしまうのか、自分でもそう思いはするのだが。","en":"If a pretty girl used excuses like those, that would be one thing. But why did he come trotting over anyway when he knew perfectly well that these wily old men were telling transparent lies? Even he had to wonder.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r124","rowIndex":124,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そうして、ここのところ何度も人と会わされている。","en":"And so, lately, they had introduced him to one person after another.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r125","rowIndex":125,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　相手は<tips=57>滑走路通り</tips>の商業ビルのオーナーやら、ギャングのお偉いさんやら、銀行の頭取やら様々な社会的地位を持つ人間だ。","en":"The people came from all manner of social positions: the owner of a commercial building on <tips=57>Runway Street</tips>, a senior gang figure, the president of a bank, and so on.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r126","rowIndex":126,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　自分たちがいついなくなってもいいよう、若い会員たちを皆引き合わせるのが目的だと、<tips=22>老人たち</tips>は言うが、こうして引っ張り出されるのは<tips=10>道夫</tips>ばかりであり、どうしても腑に落ちない。","en":"<tips=22>The old men</tips> claimed their aim was to introduce all the younger members to these contacts, so that everything would be in place whenever the elders were gone. Yet <tips=10>Michio</tips> was invariably the only one dragged out for these meetings, a discrepancy he could not understand.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r127","rowIndex":127,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　今日もまたどこぞの名士さまに引き合わされるのかと思うとうんざりする。","en":"The thought of being introduced to yet another local dignitary today is already exhausting.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r128","rowIndex":128,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　早々と諦めてしまった<tips=22>老人たち</tips>をよそに、故障してしまった麻雀卓を隙間からのぞいたり、ドライバーで中をつついたりしてどうにか直らないかと試行錯誤していると、はたしてその人物がやって来た。","en":"While <tips=22>the old men</tips> gave up almost at once, Michio peered through gaps in the broken mahjong table and prodded its innards with a screwdriver, trying one thing after another in hopes of repairing it. Sure enough, the expected visitor arrived.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r129","rowIndex":129,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　幾人ものボディーガードを引き連れて屋敷の玄関をくぐったのは、誰あろう、<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>の第三代<tips=81>龍頭</tips><tips=1>謝亮</tips>であった。高級なスーツを身につけ、屈強な男たちに囲まれた姿はどこからどう見ても若きマフィアの頭目であり、<tips=10>道夫</tips>としてもうかつに声をかけにくい雰囲気があった。","en":"The man who crossed the threshold with a procession of bodyguards was none other than <tips=1>Tse Leung</tips>, the third <tips=81>Longtou</tips> of <tips=7>YS</tips>. In his expensive suit, surrounded by powerfully built men, he looked every inch the young head of a mafia organization. Even <tips=10>Michio</tips> found him difficult to approach casually.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r130","rowIndex":130,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>の方も、<tips=10>道夫</tips>を横目でちらりと見ただけで何も言わない。","en":"<tips=1>Leung</tips> merely glanced at <tips=10>Michio</tips> from the corner of his eye and said nothing.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r131","rowIndex":131,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「やあ、よく来てくれたね」","en":"“Ah, glad you could come.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ミスター・チェン","displayName":"Mr. Chen","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r132","rowIndex":132,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼らを部屋に招き入れると、<tips=90>ミスター・チェン</tips>は目を細めた。","en":"<tips=90>Mr. Chen</tips> narrowed his eyes as he invited the party into the room.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r133","rowIndex":133,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「若き<tips=81>龍頭</tips>どのと、そちらに居るのは馬君のところの倅さんだね。最近随分活躍しているそうじゃないか。若い人が出て来ると頼もしいねえ」","en":"“Our young <tips=81>Longtou</tips>—and the fellow beside you must be Ma's boy. I hear you've been making quite a name for yourself lately. It's reassuring to see the young coming into their own.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ミスター・チェン","displayName":"Mr. Chen","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r134","rowIndex":134,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　丸いテーブルを挟んで、三人の老人と<tips=1>謝亮</tips>が向かい合って座っている。それを取り囲むように<tips=25>馬世傑</tips>と双方のボディーガードが立っていた。いつもの客よりお互いが連れている人間が多く、緊張感がある。","en":"The three elders sat facing <tips=1>Tse Leung</tips> across the round table. <tips=25>Ma Sai-kit</tips> and the bodyguards from both sides stood around them. Each party had brought more people than the elders’ usual visitors, lending the room an air of tension.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r135","rowIndex":135,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=10>道夫</tips>はすこし離れたところに椅子を置いて状況を見守りながら、その不思議な緊張感に首を捻っていた。","en":"<tips=10>Michio</tips> placed his chair at a slight distance and watched. The strange tension left him puzzled.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r136","rowIndex":136,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　最近は饅頭屋の活動に力を入れていて、裏社会の動きをあまり知らない。フェルナンデス一家の殺害や、その犯人の遺体が路上に晒されたことなどは聞いているが、詳細な事情は聞いていない。<tips=21>八龍会</tips>の動きに関しては、<tips=22>老人たち</tips>は極端な秘密主義なので親切に<tips=10>道夫</tips>に説明することはなかった。どこで何をしているのかわからない。","en":"He had recently devoted himself to the Great Hole Bun business and knew little of current movements in the underworld. He had heard about the Fernandes Family murders and the display of the culprits’ bodies in the street, but not the circumstances in any detail. As for the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips>, the <tips=22>elders</tips> were extremely secretive and never took the trouble to explain its activities to <tips=10>Michio</tips>. He had no idea where they went or what they did.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r137","rowIndex":137,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「一体何のつもりで私たちを呼んだ？　何か釈明でもしてもらえるのかな」","en":"“Why did you summon us? Do you intend to offer some explanation?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r138","rowIndex":138,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>の態度は最初からトゲトゲしかった。","en":"<tips=1>Leung’s</tips> manner is prickly from the start.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r139","rowIndex":139,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ほっほっほ、何を釈明しろと」","en":"“Ho ho ho. Explain what?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ミスター・チェン","displayName":"Mr. Chen","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r140","rowIndex":140,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=90>ミスター・チェン</tips>は真っ白い口ひげを撫でながらそう笑う。","en":"<tips=90>Mr. Chen</tips> laughed as he stroked his snow-white mustache.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r141","rowIndex":141,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=10>道夫</tips>は知らなかったが、このとき<tips=21>八龍会</tips>は<tips=9>Y地区</tips>中の有力者たちに<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>を非難する声明文を送りつけていた。","en":"<tips=10>Michio</tips> did not know it, but by then the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips> had sent influential figures throughout <tips=9>Y District</tips> a statement denouncing <tips=7>YS</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r142","rowIndex":142,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その内容は、フェルナンデス一家の殺害事件についてである。","en":"The statement concerned the Fernandes Family murders.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r143","rowIndex":143,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　もとより<tips=1>謝亮</tips>の陰謀説があるこの事件だが、その噂は犯人たちが死亡した後も消えることがなかった。","en":"The case had been dogged from the outset by theories that <tips=1>Tse Leung</tips> was behind it, and the rumors persisted even after the culprits died.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r144","rowIndex":144,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　余りにも早く殺人犯が見つかったことから、この犯人たちは真犯人を隠す替え玉、あるいは<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>に雇われた者たちだという説も生まれた。","en":"Because the killers had been found so remarkably quickly, new theories arose: that they were mere patsies meant to conceal the true culprit, or that they were men hired by <tips=7>YS</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r145","rowIndex":145,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=21>八龍会</tips>の声明は、それらの陰謀説を前提とした形での非難であった。","en":"The <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips> framed its denunciation around those conspiracy theories.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r146","rowIndex":146,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　犯人たちはいずれも<tips=17>タイプB</tips>であり、しかも発症して精神が不安定な状態にあった。","en":"The perpetrators were all <tips=17>Type Bs</tips>, and all had manifested symptoms and were mentally unstable.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r147","rowIndex":147,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>はこれらにつけ込んで、彼らを利用した。","en":"<tips=7>YS</tips> had exploited their condition and used them.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r148","rowIndex":148,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=17>タイプB</tips>を守る立場の<tips=21>八龍会</tips>としては到底これを容認することが出来ない。","en":"As an organization committed to protecting <tips=17>Type Bs</tips>, the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips> could never condone this.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r149","rowIndex":149,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　この街は<tips=17>タイプB</tips>を含めたミュータントとノーマルが協力して支え合って成り立っているのであり、このような非人道的な行いをする<tips=81>龍頭</tips><tips=1>謝亮</tips>は到底許されるものではない。","en":"This city exists because mutants, including <tips=17>Type Bs</tips>, and Normals cooperate and support one another. A <tips=81>Longtou</tips> such as <tips=1>Tse Leung</tips>, who committed an act so inhumane, could never be forgiven.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r150","rowIndex":150,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　というのが<tips=21>八龍会</tips>の言い分である。","en":"Such was the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society’s</tips> position.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r151","rowIndex":151,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「面白いことを言う。釈明するならばアナタの方でしょう？」","en":"“What an interesting thing to say. Surely you are the one who owes an explanation?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ミスター・チェン","displayName":"Mr. Chen","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r152","rowIndex":152,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=90>ミスター・チェン</tips>は笑顔を絶やさずに言う。","en":"<tips=90>Mr. Chen</tips> says this, his smile never wavering.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r153","rowIndex":153,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「馬鹿馬鹿しい」","en":"“Absurd.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r154","rowIndex":154,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>は一顧だにせず吐き捨てた。","en":"<tips=1>Leung</tips> spat the words out without giving the matter a moment’s consideration.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r155","rowIndex":155,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「考えてみたらどうですか？　<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>から離脱した途端にフェルナンデス家に襲撃者が現れ、そしてすぐにそれが発症した<tips=17>タイプB</tips>だと判明する。突き止めたのは<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>だ。これはあまりに出来すぎています」","en":"“Think about it. The moment the Fernandes family withdrew from <tips=7>YS</tips>, attackers appeared at their home, and almost immediately they were identified as symptomatic <tips=17>Type Bs</tips>. And it was <tips=7>YS</tips> that identified them. This is all far too convenient.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ミスター・アーノルド","displayName":"Mr. Arnold","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r156","rowIndex":156,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=89>ミスター・アーノルド</tips>はくすりともせずに言う。","en":"<tips=89>Mr. Arnold</tips> spoke without a trace of amusement.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r157","rowIndex":157,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ただの作り話だね。そういう話でいいなら、私は別の話を知っている」","en":"“That’s just a made-up story. If that’s the sort of tale we’re telling, I know another.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r158","rowIndex":158,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>は不機嫌そうだった。","en":"<tips=1>Leung</tips> looked displeased.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r159","rowIndex":159,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「犯人たちが死んだ後我々も少し調査をしたのだけれど、面白いことがわかったんだ」","en":"“After the culprits died, we did a little investigating of our own, and we learned something interesting.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r160","rowIndex":160,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「面白いこと？」","en":"“Something interesting?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ミスター・チェン","displayName":"Mr. Chen","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r161","rowIndex":161,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=90>ミスター・チェン</tips>が問い返す。","en":"<tips=90>Mr. Chen</tips> repeats the phrase as a question.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r162","rowIndex":162,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どうも不思議なんだ。事件のあとに連中が豪遊していた内容と、残った金を計算すると、<tips=35>フェルナンデス</tips>の屋敷から盗んだ金よりあきらかに多いんだよ。計画前に、武器を買うのさえ借金しなければならないようなすかんぴんどもが、どこにお金を隠していたんだろうねえ」","en":"“There’s something strange here. Add up what they spent living it up after the incident and the money they had left, and the total is clearly more than they stole from the <tips=35>Fernandes</tips> mansion. Before the plan, those penniless bastards had to borrow even to buy weapons. Where could they have been hiding all that money, I wonder?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r163","rowIndex":163,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「何が言いたい」","en":"“What are you suggesting?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ミスター・スミス","displayName":"Mr. Smith","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r164","rowIndex":164,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=91>ミスター・スミス</tips>は額にしわをよせて訊ねた。","en":"<tips=91>Mr. Smith</tips> asks, furrowing his brow.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r165","rowIndex":165,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「誰かが彼らに<tips=35>フェルナンデス</tips>襲撃を依頼していたんじゃないか？　金が多いのは、その報酬を受け取ったのさ。依頼者が誰だとは言わないが、彼らの部屋からは白い薬が大量に見つかっている。この<tips=9>Y地区</tips>で麻薬を扱っている組織はひとつしかない。そして、その組織はつい最近とんでもない新薬を仕入れて街中の会員にばらまいているそうだ」","en":"“Couldn’t someone have hired them to attack <tips=35>Fernandes</tips>? The extra money was their fee. I won’t say who commissioned them, but large quantities of a white drug were found in their rooms. Only one organization deals in narcotics in <tips=9>Y District</tips>. And I hear that very organization recently obtained an extraordinary new drug and distributed it among its members throughout the city.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r166","rowIndex":166,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>は風邪でもひいているのか、鼻を啜る仕草をして、","en":"Perhaps <tips=1>Leung</tips> has caught a cold; he sniffs, then continues.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r167","rowIndex":167,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=17>タイプB</tips>を利用するってさっきあんたは言ったけれども、それにかけちゃもっと歴史の古い組織がこの街には存在すると思うんだがね？」","en":"“You spoke a moment ago about exploiting <tips=17>Type Bs</tips>. I seem to recall that this city contains an organization with a much longer history of doing precisely that.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r168","rowIndex":168,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「これは驚いた！　我々を疑っているんだネ？」","en":"“What a surprise! You suspect us?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ミスター・チェン","displayName":"Mr. Chen","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r169","rowIndex":169,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あんたらの作り話よりは、こちらの方がよっぽど現実味があると思わないかい？」","en":"“Don’t you think our version is far more plausible than the story you people made up?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r170","rowIndex":170,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「言いがかりはやめてもらいたいネ。この街の<tips=17>タイプB</tips>は多かれ少なかれ我々と関わりを持っているものがほとんどだ。我々はどんな素性であっても、<tips=17>タイプB</tips>である限りは拒まないからネ。そのなかには不心得者もいるだろうが、全部我々のせいにされてはたまらない」","en":"“I must ask you to stop these baseless accusations. Almost every <tips=17>Type B</tips> in this city has some connection with us, great or small. Whatever their background, we turn no one away so long as they are a <tips=17>Type B</tips>. There are bound to be some wrongdoers among them, but we cannot have you blaming us for every one of them.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ミスター・チェン","displayName":"Mr. Chen","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r171","rowIndex":171,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=90>ミスター・チェン</tips>は呆れて顔をしかめる。","en":"<tips=90>Mr. Chen</tips> frowns in exasperation.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r172","rowIndex":172,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「何だっていいさ。ただ、この件に関しては徹底的にやるつもりだ。<tips=35>フェルナンデス</tips>は最後こそ離脱したが、まぎれもない<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>の功労者だからね。そして私にとっては父の盟友だ。組織の誇りにかけてでも復讐は果たされねばならない。まだどこかに隠れている真の主謀者は、あのこそ泥たちのように路上で蛆虫の餌になるだろう」","en":"“Call it whatever you like. But I intend to pursue this matter to the bitter end. <tips=35>Fernandes</tips> may have left at the last, but he unquestionably rendered great service to <tips=7>YS</tips>. And to me, he was my father’s ally. On the organization’s honor, he must be avenged. The true mastermind still hiding somewhere will end up as maggot food in the street, just like those petty thieves.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r173","rowIndex":173,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「威勢のいいことだな」","en":"“Bold words.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ミスター・スミス","displayName":"Mr. Smith","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r174","rowIndex":174,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=91>ミスター・スミス</tips>はその白目の多い大きな目を見開いて、ぎろりと<tips=1>亮</tips>の顔を睨み付ける。","en":"<tips=91>Mr. Smith</tips> widens his large, white-rimmed eyes and glares ferociously at <tips=1>Leung</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r175","rowIndex":175,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まあ、まあ、ここは穏やかに。今日は、その話をしたいわけではないんだからネ」","en":"“Now, now. Let’s keep things calm. That isn’t what we mean to discuss today.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ミスター・チェン","displayName":"Mr. Chen","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r176","rowIndex":176,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=90>ミスター・チェン</tips>がそう言って苛立ちが露わになった<tips=91>ミスター・スミス</tips>をとりなす。","en":"<tips=90>Mr. Chen</tips> intercedes to calm <tips=91>Mr. Smith</tips>, whose irritation has become plain.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r177","rowIndex":177,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まず第一に、我々はアナタのことをとても高く評価しているっていうことを理解して欲しいノ」","en":"“First, I want you to understand that we hold you in very high regard.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ミスター・チェン","displayName":"Mr. Chen","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r178","rowIndex":178,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=90>ミスター・チェン</tips>は椅子に座り直すと、穏やかな表情で<tips=1>亮</tips>に語りかける。","en":"<tips=90>Mr. Chen</tips> settles himself in his chair and addresses <tips=1>Leung</tips> with a mild expression.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r179","rowIndex":179,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「もの知らずどもはアナタが突然<tips=81>龍頭</tips>になったと思っているけれど、少し事情に明るい人間はそうじゃないことを知っている。もちろん我々だって<tips=10>道夫</tips>と仲が良かった<tips=1>菅原亮</tips>のことは忘れていない。まあ、当時はあの<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>の子供だと知っていたわけじゃないがネ」","en":"“Ignorant people think you suddenly became <tips=81>Longtou</tips>, but anyone with a little knowledge knows better. Of course, we haven’t forgotten <tips=1>Ryo Sugawara</tips>, who was such a good friend of <tips=10>Michio’s</tips>. Though at the time, we didn’t know he was <tips=3>Chris Tse’s</tips> son.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ミスター・チェン","displayName":"Mr. Chen","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r180","rowIndex":180,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>はチェンの言葉を、少し眠そうな顔で聞いている。この表情は、相手を疑っているときのものだと<tips=10>道夫</tips>は知っている。","en":"<tips=1>Leung</tips> listens with a faintly drowsy expression. <tips=10>Michio</tips> knows that he wears that face when he distrusts someone.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r181","rowIndex":181,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「アナタは子供時代、<tips=81>龍頭</tips>の息子だからという理由で不良少年たちのリーダーになったわけじゃない。アナタは定食屋の息子として、自分の才覚だけで、裏通りの少年なら誰でも知っている存在になった。アナタは生まれながらのギャングなんだ。しかも父親譲りの才能がある」","en":"“As a child, you did not become leader of the delinquents because you were the <tips=81>Longtou’s</tips> son. As the son of a neighborhood diner owner, through your own ability alone, you became a name every boy in the back alleys knew. You were born a gangster. And you have your father’s gift.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ミスター・チェン","displayName":"Mr. Chen","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r182","rowIndex":182,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「老人の話はまわりくどくてたまらないな。お褒め頂いて光栄だが、さっさと本題に入ってもらいたい」","en":"“Old men are intolerably roundabout. I’m honored by the compliment, but get to the point already.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r183","rowIndex":183,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>はそう言って顔を顰めた。","en":"<tips=1>Leung</tips> frowns.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r184","rowIndex":184,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まあ、焦らずゆっくり聞きなさい。私はとても重要な話をしているんだからネ」","en":"“Now, do not rush. Listen patiently. I am telling you something very important.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ミスター・チェン","displayName":"Mr. Chen","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r185","rowIndex":185,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=90>ミスター・チェン</tips>は大げさに肩をすくめてそう言うと、","en":"<tips=90>Mr. Chen</tips> shrugs theatrically, then goes on.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r186","rowIndex":186,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「とにかくネ、<tips=58>パラシュート通り</tips>の<tips=1>菅原亮</tips>を知っている我々のような人間ならば、<tips=81>龍頭</tips>になってからのアナタの活躍も、いまやろうとしている<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>の統合計画も、驚いたりはしないんだよ。アナタは優秀で、とても支配したがりだ。子供の時に路地ごとに分かれていた子供のグループを統一して支配したように、ギャングを効率よく支配しようと考えているんだろう？　父親よりももっと徹底的に」","en":"“In any event, those of us who knew <tips=1>Ryo Sugawara</tips> of <tips=58>Parachute Street</tips> are not surprised by what you have accomplished since becoming <tips=81>Longtou</tips>, or by your present plan to consolidate <tips=7>YS</tips>. You are capable, and you love being in control. Just as you united and dominated the children’s groups that once belonged to separate alleys, you now intend to rule the gangs efficiently, do you not? More thoroughly than your father ever did.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ミスター・チェン","displayName":"Mr. Chen","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r187","rowIndex":187,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>は不本意そうだが、議論の面倒くささが先に立つのか、何も言わずに聞いている。","en":"<tips=1>Leung</tips> looks none too pleased, but perhaps arguing seems too much trouble, for he says nothing and listens.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r188","rowIndex":188,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=90>ミスター・チェン</tips>は遠慮せず話を続ける。","en":"<tips=90>Mr. Chen</tips> continues without holding back.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r189","rowIndex":189,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「確かに、アナタのお父さんの功績は偉大だったヨ。彼が<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>を作って街を支配したおかげで、目に余るような悲惨な話は少なくなった。……しかしもう役割は終わったんだヨ。この街にギャングは必要ない。<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>も、<tips=75>フェルナンデス・ファミリー</tips>も、何もかもネ」","en":"“Certainly, your father’s achievements were great. By creating <tips=7>YS</tips> and taking control of the city, he made the worst of its appalling tragedies far less common. …But that role has run its course. This city no longer needs gangs—not <tips=7>YS</tips>, not the <tips=75>Fernandes Family</tips>, none of them.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ミスター・チェン","displayName":"Mr. Chen","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r190","rowIndex":190,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「驚いたな。それは我々に対する宣戦布告なのかい？」","en":"“Well, that’s a surprise. Is that a declaration of war against us?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r191","rowIndex":191,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>は薄笑いを浮かべて言う。","en":"<tips=1>Leung</tips> says this with a thin smile.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r192","rowIndex":192,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「お前たちギャングはいつもそういう単純な考え方しかできない」","en":"“You gangsters are incapable of thinking beyond such simple terms.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ミスター・スミス","displayName":"Mr. Smith","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r193","rowIndex":193,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=91>ミスター・スミス</tips>は呆れたように溜息をつき、","en":"<tips=91>Mr. Smith</tips> gives an exasperated sigh, then says,","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r194","rowIndex":194,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「これまでのように暴力と恐怖で君臨するのは時代遅れだと言っている。幸い、今やお前らの事業の大部分は合法化されている。誘拐や強盗で稼ぐのは三流の小さな組織だけだ。そのまま大人しくしていればいい。これ以上街を血で汚すのはやめるんだ」","en":"“I am saying that the age of ruling through violence and fear is over. Fortunately, most of your businesses are legal now. Only third-rate little outfits make their money from kidnapping and robbery. Just keep your heads down. Stop staining the city with any more blood.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ミスター・スミス","displayName":"Mr. Smith","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r195","rowIndex":195,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ははは！　これは傑作だ。私たちを表社会に追いやって、街を自分たちの麻薬で染め上げようっていうのかい？　<tips=46>ネオ・ローズ</tips>だかなんだか知らないが、<tips=45>ローズ</tips>のときにやらかしたのをもう忘れたのか」","en":"“Hahaha! That’s rich. You mean to push us out into respectable society so you can saturate the city with your drugs? <tips=46>Neo Rose</tips>, or whatever you call it—have you already forgotten what happened with <tips=45>Rose</tips>?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r196","rowIndex":196,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>が声を立てて嘲笑すると、<tips=91>ミスター・スミス</tips>は鬼のような形相になって彼を睨み付ける。","en":"When <tips=1>Leung</tips> laughs aloud in mockery, <tips=91>Mr. Smith</tips> glares at him with a demonic expression.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r197","rowIndex":197,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その代わりに、<tips=89>ミスター・アーノルド</tips>が口を開いた。","en":"<tips=89>Mr. Arnold</tips> speaks in his place.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r198","rowIndex":198,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いずれ<tips=10>道夫</tips>は我々<tips=21>八龍会</tips>の指導者になります。きみは昔のように<tips=10>道夫</tips>をサポートして、共に<tips=9>Y地区</tips>を率いて行くんですよ」","en":"“In time, <tips=10>Michio</tips> will become the leader of our <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips>. You will support <tips=10>Michio</tips> as you did in the past, and together you will lead <tips=9>Y District</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ミスター・アーノルド","displayName":"Mr. Arnold","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r199","rowIndex":199,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「つまり<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>は<tips=21>八龍会</tips>の支配下におさまれと？」","en":"“In other words, you want <tips=7>YS</tips> to submit to the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society’s</tips> control?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r200","rowIndex":200,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あくまでも我々の良きパートナーとして働いて欲しいというだけですよ。<tips=21>八龍会</tips>は<tips=17>タイプB</tips>以外の入会を認めていないですからね。その、きみたちギャングがやるような吸収とか、上下関係というものではありません」","en":"“We merely want you to work as our valued partner. The <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips> admits no one but <tips=17>Type Bs</tips>, you understand. This isn't about absorbing you or placing you beneath us, the way you gangsters do.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ミスター・アーノルド","displayName":"Mr. Arnold","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r201","rowIndex":201,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「結局同じことだろう。よくそんな話が出来るものだと呆れるね」","en":"“It amounts to the same thing. I am astonished you can make such a demand with a straight face.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r202","rowIndex":202,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>は溜息をついて首を振る。","en":"<tips=1>Leung</tips> sighs and shakes his head.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r203","rowIndex":203,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「勘違いしてはいけませんよ。<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>が<tips=21>八龍会</tips>より強い力を持ったことなど一度もないのです。きみのお父さんもそれをよくわかっていて、実にお行儀が良かった……」","en":"“Do not misunderstand. <tips=7>YS</tips> has never possessed greater power than the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips>. Your father understood that well and was very well behaved...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ミスター・アーノルド","displayName":"Mr. Arnold","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r204","rowIndex":204,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=89>ミスター・アーノルド</tips>は青い目に憂いを浮かべて言う。","en":"A melancholy look enters <tips=89>Mr. Arnold’s</tips> blue eyes as he speaks.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r205","rowIndex":205,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「きみのお父さんは物事の順序というものをよくわきまえていました。それに比べると、きみは少しお行儀が悪すぎるようです。もしお父さんだったら、きみのように身内や年長者を次々と殺したりはしないでしょう。私たちはきみのその若さゆえのお行儀の悪さが少々気にかかっていましてね」","en":"“Your father understood the proper order of things. You, by contrast, seem much too badly behaved. He would never have killed his own people and his elders one after another, as you have done. This youthful misbehavior of yours concerns us somewhat.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ミスター・アーノルド","displayName":"Mr. Arnold","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r206","rowIndex":206,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「私は何よりも争いごとがきらいでね。ただ将来の争いの種を排除しているだけなんだ。あなたたちとも争うつもりはない。妙な挑発はやめてもらおう」","en":"“I hate conflict more than anything. I am merely eliminating the seeds of future conflict. I have no intention of fighting you, either. Stop these strange provocations.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r207","rowIndex":207,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「面白い冗談だ」","en":"“An amusing joke.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ミスター・スミス","displayName":"Mr. Smith","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r208","rowIndex":208,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=91>ミスター・スミス</tips>はそう言って笑う。","en":"<tips=91>Mr. Smith</tips> laughs as he says it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r209","rowIndex":209,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「私たちも、<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>と争うつもりなんか全然ないんだヨ」","en":"“We have absolutely no intention of fighting <tips=7>YS</tips>, either.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ミスター・チェン","displayName":"Mr. Chen","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r210","rowIndex":210,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=90>ミスター・チェン</tips>はにこやかなままだった。","en":"<tips=90>Mr. Chen</tips> remains all smiles.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r211","rowIndex":211,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ただほんのちょっと、我々にとって便利な存在になってくれないかと思ってネ」","en":"“We simply hoped you might make yourself a little useful to us.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ミスター・チェン","displayName":"Mr. Chen","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r212","rowIndex":212,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>謝亮</tips>はそれにはこたえない。無言で立ち上がると、","en":"<tips=1>Tse Leung</tips> offers no answer. He rises in silence.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r213","rowIndex":213,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「時間の無駄だったようだ。失礼する」","en":"“It seems this has been a waste of time. Excuse me.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r214","rowIndex":214,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして部屋のドアへ歩き始めたのだが、","en":"He starts walking toward the door, but—","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r215","rowIndex":215,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「きみのお母さんは<tips=17>タイプＢ</tips>でしたね」","en":"“Your mother was a <tips=17>Type B</tips>, was she not?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ミスター・アーノルド","displayName":"Mr. Arnold","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r216","rowIndex":216,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=89>ミスター・アーノルド</tips>の言葉で足を止める。","en":"<tips=89>Mr. Arnold’s</tips> words stop him in his tracks.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r217","rowIndex":217,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そして、きみの妹さんも<tips=17>タイプＢ</tips>だと聞いています」","en":"“And I hear your younger sister is also a <tips=17>Type B</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ミスター・アーノルド","displayName":"Mr. Arnold","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r218","rowIndex":218,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>は振り返って<tips=89>ミスター・アーノルド</tips>を睨み付ける。今日来てから彼が見せた表情のうちで、あきらかに最も感情のこもった表情だ。","en":"<tips=1>Leung</tips> turns and glares at <tips=89>Mr. Arnold</tips>. Of all the expressions he has shown since arriving that day, this one is clearly the most charged with emotion.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r219","rowIndex":219,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「我々<tips=21>八龍会</tips>は、きみの妹さんのことはいつだって受け入れますよ。その方が、<tips=17>タイプＢ</tips>として確かな人生を送っていけるでしょう。それに、もしきみが今後<tips=17>タイプＢ</tips>になったとしても、遠慮なく相談してください。同じ血をうけたきみにもその可能性はあるわけですからね。……そして、その時は我々もきみのことを新しい家族として歓迎するでしょう」","en":"“The <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips> will always accept your sister. With us, she will be able to lead a secure life as a <tips=17>Type B</tips>. And if you should become a <tips=17>Type B</tips> yourself in the future, please feel free to consult us. As someone who shares the same blood, you too possess that possibility. …And when that day comes, we will welcome you as a new member of our family.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ミスター・アーノルド","displayName":"Mr. Arnold","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r220","rowIndex":220,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>はそう言って微笑を浮かべる<tips=89>ミスター・アーノルド</tips>をしばらく睨み付けた後、","en":"<tips=1>Leung</tips> glares for a while at <tips=89>Mr. Arnold</tips>, who wears a faint smile as he says this, before finally speaking.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r221","rowIndex":221,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「失礼」","en":"“Excuse me.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r222","rowIndex":222,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　とだけ言ってその場を後にした。","en":"With those words alone, he left.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r223","rowIndex":223,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>の姿が見えなくなると、<tips=10>道夫</tips>はそれまでたまっていたものを吐き出すように溜息をつく。","en":"Once <tips=1>Leung</tips> disappears from sight, <tips=10>Michio</tips> lets out a long sigh, as though releasing everything pent up inside him.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r224","rowIndex":224,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼は、この場では一言も言葉を発さなかった。口を挟みたい場面もあったが、裏社会の出来事に対して、どんな形での関与も嫌ったのである。","en":"He did not utter a single word during the meeting. There were moments when he wanted to interject, but he wanted no involvement whatsoever in the affairs of the underworld.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r225","rowIndex":225,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しかし会合がこうして終わってみると、何か口を出すべきだったかもしれないといくらか後悔をしていた。","en":"Now that the meeting has ended, however, he regrets—at least a little—not having spoken up.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r226","rowIndex":226,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　今話されたことは彼にとってこの場で初めて知る新事実ばかりだったが、<tips=22>老人たち</tips>がこのようなことを考え、実行しているとは思わなかった。","en":"Almost everything discussed had been new information to Michio. He had never imagined that <tips=22>the old men</tips> thought in such terms, much less that they had begun acting upon them.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r227","rowIndex":227,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　まさか<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>を公然と非難し、しかもこの様に<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>の<tips=81>龍頭</tips>に直接要求までするとは。","en":"To think they would publicly denounce <tips=7>YS</tips> and even make demands directly of the <tips=81>Longtou</tips> of <tips=7>YS</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r228","rowIndex":228,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>の代が変わって揉めているのは知っているが、<tips=21>八龍会</tips>までもその火中に飛び込もうとしているとは。","en":"He knew that <tips=7>YS</tips> was in turmoil after its change of leadership, but to think even the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips> meant to leap into the flames.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r229","rowIndex":229,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「驚いたかい？」","en":"“Were you surprised?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ミスター・チェン","displayName":"Mr. Chen","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r230","rowIndex":230,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　他の二人は別室に休憩をしに行ってしまったが、一番喋った<tips=90>ミスター・チェン</tips>だけがその場に残り、自動卓の牌を取り出して一人遊びを始めていた。","en":"The other two men have gone into another room to rest. <tips=90>Mr. Chen</tips>, who did most of the talking, remains behind, pulls the tiles from the automatic table, and begins amusing himself with them.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r231","rowIndex":231,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そりゃ驚きますよ。ギャングとはずっとつかず離れずのポジションで行くんじゃなかったんですか？」","en":"“Of course I’m surprised. Weren’t you going to keep the gangs at arm’s length?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫","displayName":"Michio Mido","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r232","rowIndex":232,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　考え込んでしまって帰るタイミングを失っていた<tips=10>道夫</tips>はそう答えた。","en":"Lost in thought and having missed his opportunity to leave, <tips=10>Michio</tips> answered.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r233","rowIndex":233,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ほっほっほ、それは今まで結果的にそうなっていただけなんだよ。<tips=3>クリス</tips>がボスの時は手を出しにくかったからね」","en":"“Ho ho ho. That is merely how things happened to work out until now. It was difficult to make a move while <tips=3>Chris</tips> was boss.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ミスター・チェン","displayName":"Mr. Chen","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r234","rowIndex":234,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「お家騒動で弱体化してるから、チャンスと見たわけですか」","en":"“So you saw your chance because the succession struggle had weakened them?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫","displayName":"Michio Mido","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r235","rowIndex":235,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それもある。が、それだけじゃない。……なあ<tips=10>道夫</tips>、この街は昔に比べて良くなったと思うかい？　悪くなったと思うかい？」","en":"“That is one reason, but not the only one. …Tell me, <tips=10>Michio</tips>: do you think this city has improved since the old days, or grown worse?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ミスター・チェン","displayName":"Mr. Chen","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r236","rowIndex":236,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=90>ミスター・チェン</tips>はそう言って、じっと<tips=10>道夫</tips>の表情をうかがう。","en":"<tips=90>Mr. Chen</tips> says this while studying <tips=10>Michio’s</tips> expression intently.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r237","rowIndex":237,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その質問には何らかの罠がありそうな予感もしたが、<tips=10>道夫</tips>は気にせず思った通りの回答を口にした。","en":"<tips=10>Michio</tips> senses some sort of trap in the question, but ignores it and says exactly what he thinks.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r238","rowIndex":238,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そりゃ良くなったでしょうよ。治安が良くなり<tips=57>滑走路通り</tips>には誰でも気軽に足を踏み入れられるようになった。人種やギャング同士の対立も減った。景気も良くなって、おかしな死に方をするものも減った。まだまだ足りないところはありますが、昔よりは確実に良くなっている」","en":"“Of course it’s improved. The streets are safer, and anyone can walk down <tips=57>Runway Street</tips> without fear. There’s less conflict between racial groups and between gangs. The economy is stronger, and fewer people die bizarre deaths. There’s still plenty that needs improving, but the city is unquestionably better than it used to be.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫","displayName":"Michio Mido","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r239","rowIndex":239,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「オッホッホ、浅いのう」","en":"“Oh ho ho. How shallow.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ミスター・チェン","displayName":"Mr. Chen","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r240","rowIndex":240,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　案の定<tips=90>ミスター・チェン</tips>は小馬鹿にしたように笑う。","en":"Just as expected, <tips=90>Mr. Chen</tips> laughs at him with a patronizing air.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r241","rowIndex":241,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どう浅いって言うんですか」","en":"“What’s shallow about it?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫","displayName":"Michio Mido","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r242","rowIndex":242,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　否定されるのは言う前からわかってはいたが、やはり腹立たしく、<tips=10>道夫</tips>はしかめっ面になった。","en":"He knew before he spoke that his answer would be rejected, but the dismissal irritates him all the same, and <tips=10>Michio</tips> scowls.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r243","rowIndex":243,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「お前の言ってることは、全部ノーマルや<tips=16>タイプA</tips>の世界のことだ。我々龍の血を引く者たちには当てはまらない」","en":"“Everything you’re talking about belongs to the world of Normals and <tips=16>Type As</tips>. It doesn’t apply to those of us with dragon blood.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ミスター・チェン","displayName":"Mr. Chen","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r244","rowIndex":244,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「治安が良くなったり、活気づくのは誰にとってもいいことでしょうよ」","en":"“Surely safer streets and a livelier city are good for anyone.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫","displayName":"Michio Mido","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r245","rowIndex":245,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「違う」","en":"“No.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ミスター・チェン","displayName":"Mr. Chen","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r246","rowIndex":246,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=90>ミスター・チェン</tips>の語調は思いの外に強かった。","en":"<tips=90>Mr. Chen’s</tips> tone is firmer than expected.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r247","rowIndex":247,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「かつてこの街が荒れ果てていたころ、我々はこの優れた肉体によって一定の地位を得ていた。しかし、平和になれば我々はただの厄介ものに過ぎない。さらに、金と一緒によそ者が沢山この街に入り込み、そしてよそ者の価値観が流れ込んできた。よそ者たちは我々を出来損ないとしか思っていない」","en":"“When this city lay in ruins, our superior bodies allowed us to secure a certain position. In times of peace, however, we are nothing but troublemakers. Worse, money has brought outsiders pouring into the city, along with their values. To them, we are simply defective.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ミスター・チェン","displayName":"Mr. Chen","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r248","rowIndex":248,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それは、<tips=10>道夫</tips>にも否定が出来ない事実だ。","en":"It is a fact even <tips=10>Michio</tips> cannot deny.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r249","rowIndex":249,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……ここには子供たちがよく遊びに来るが、昔よりもいじめが増えているようだネ。いくら平和になっても、栄えても、尊厳が踏みにじられ、いわれなく子供がいじめられるような街が良い街だと思うか？　子供だけではない。どこへ行っても、金色の目を見られたらもうおしまいだ。昔はそんなことはなかったというのに……」","en":"“...Children often come here to play, and there seems to be more bullying than there used to be. However peaceful or prosperous a city may be, can you call it a good city when people’s dignity is trampled underfoot and innocent children are bullied for no reason? Nor is it only the children. Wherever you go, the moment someone sees your golden eyes, it’s all over. None of this ever happened in the old days...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ミスター・チェン","displayName":"Mr. Chen","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r250","rowIndex":250,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼は溜息をつき、首を左右に振る。","en":"He sighs and shakes his head.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r251","rowIndex":251,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「尊厳を踏みにじられたら生きてはいけないのだよ。お前は、無垢な瞳でどうして人間扱いされないのかと問う子供に、金のために我慢しろと言えるかい？」","en":"“Once your dignity has been trampled underfoot, you cannot go on living. When an innocent child looks you in the eye and asks why no one treats them like a human being, can you tell them to endure it for the sake of money?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ミスター・チェン","displayName":"Mr. Chen","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r252","rowIndex":252,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=90>ミスター・チェン</tips>は普段笑ってばかりの顔に、別人のようなすさまじい怒りを浮かべている。","en":"Fierce anger transforms <tips=90>Mr. Chen’s</tips> habitually smiling face until he looks like another man entirely.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r253","rowIndex":253,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「言ってることはわかりますが、大げさだな。今だって、街の外よりはずっと居心地の良い場所です。普通に楽しく暮らしてる<tips=17>タイプB</tips>もたくさんいる。よそから来た人が驚くくらいですよ」","en":"“I understand what you’re saying, but you’re exaggerating. Even now, this city is far more comfortable than anywhere outside it. Plenty of <tips=17>Type Bs</tips> lead ordinary, happy lives here—so many that newcomers are surprised.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫","displayName":"Michio Mido","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r254","rowIndex":254,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=10>道夫</tips>は困って溜息をついた。","en":"At a loss, <tips=10>Michio</tips> sighs.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r255","rowIndex":255,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……だから、おれだって頑張ってるんですよ。<tips=17>タイプB</tips>でも誇りを持って働ける場所を作りたくて、今の仕事をやってるんだ」","en":"“...That’s why I’m doing my part too. I chose this line of work because I want to create a place where <tips=17>Type Bs</tips> can take pride in what they do.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫","displayName":"Michio Mido","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r256","rowIndex":256,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それがやくたいもないと言っている」","en":"“And I am telling you that all of that is futile.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ミスター・チェン","displayName":"Mr. Chen","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r257","rowIndex":257,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=90>ミスター・チェン</tips>がきっぱり言うと、<tips=10>道夫</tips>はむっとして顔を顰める。","en":"At <tips=90>Mr. Chen’s</tips> categorical dismissal, <tips=10>Michio</tips> bristles and frowns.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r258","rowIndex":258,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なあ<tips=10>道夫</tips>。我々は混沌のなかでしか生きられないのだよ。ノーマルの作り出す秩序は結局いわれのない差別を生み出す。……こんなことなら、<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>に加担して<tips=18>ローズ・クラブ</tips>や<tips=68>木下組</tips>を追い出すのではなかった」","en":"“Listen, <tips=10>Michio</tips>. We can live only amid chaos. The order Normals create ultimately produces discrimination without cause. ...If this was how things were going to turn out, we should never have helped <tips=7>YS</tips> drive out the <tips=18>Rose Club</tips> and the <tips=68>Kinoshita-gumi</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ミスター・チェン","displayName":"Mr. Chen","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r259","rowIndex":259,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=10>道夫</tips>はその考えには賛同出来ないが、口には出さなかった。","en":"<tips=10>Michio</tips> cannot agree, but keeps his objection to himself.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r260","rowIndex":260,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　今<tips=90>ミスター・チェン</tips>が話している価値観は、彼だけでなく他の<tips=22>老人たち</tips>にも共有されている、いわば<tips=21>八龍会</tips>の核心的な思想と言って良い。<tips=10>道夫</tips>も形をかえて、何度も繰り返し聞かされていた。","en":"The outlook <tips=90>Mr. Chen</tips> is expressing is shared by the other <tips=22>elders</tips>; it can fairly be called the core philosophy of the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips>. <tips=10>Michio</tips> has heard the same ideas, in one form or another, many times before.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r261","rowIndex":261,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>があまりにも大きくなりすぎて、どうにも出来なかった。しかし、今は<tips=46>ネオ・ローズ</tips>がある。これがあれば我々はノーマルや<tips=16>タイプA</tips>どもに全く劣らないどころか、彼らより優れた存在となる。ついにチャンスが訪れたんだよ」","en":"“<tips=7>YS</tips> became too large for us to do anything about. But now we possess <tips=46>Neo Rose</tips>. With it, far from being inferior to Normals and <tips=16>Type As</tips>, we will become superior to them. At last, our opportunity has arrived.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ミスター・チェン","displayName":"Mr. Chen","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r262","rowIndex":262,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=90>ミスター・チェン</tips>は目をぎらぎらさせてそう言った。","en":"<tips=90>Mr. Chen’s</tips> eyes glitter as he speaks.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r263","rowIndex":263,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そういったよくわからないものを過信するのもどうかと思いますがね」","en":"“I’m not sure it’s wise to put so much faith in something we don’t really understand.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫","displayName":"Michio Mido","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r264","rowIndex":264,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「お前はまだそんなことを言うのか？　<tips=10>道夫</tips>、我々は生まれたままでは生きてはいけない存在なんだよ。何らかの方法で欠点を克服しなければ、ノーマルや<tips=16>タイプＡ</tips>と同じスタート地点に立つことも出来ない」","en":"“You’re still saying such things? <tips=10>Michio</tips>, we cannot survive in the state in which we were born. Unless we overcome our defects by some means, we cannot even reach the same starting line as Normals and <tips=16>Type As</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ミスター・チェン","displayName":"Mr. Chen","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r265","rowIndex":265,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「その考えは否定するわけじゃないですが……」","en":"“I’m not rejecting that idea, but...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫","displayName":"Michio Mido","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r266","rowIndex":266,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=10>道夫</tips>が言葉を濁すのが、<tips=90>ミスター・チェン</tips>には不本意なようだった。","en":"The way <tips=10>Michio</tips> hedges seems to displease <tips=90>Mr. Chen</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r267","rowIndex":267,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そんな考え方じゃこまる」","en":"“That kind of thinking won’t do.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ミスター・チェン","displayName":"Mr. Chen","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r268","rowIndex":268,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼は溜息をついて、","en":"He sighs, then says,","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r269","rowIndex":269,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうか、親友の<tips=1>謝亮</tips>と敵対するのがいやなんじゃないか？」","en":"“Or could it be that you don’t want to become enemies with your close friend <tips=1>Tse Leung</tips>?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ミスター・チェン","displayName":"Mr. Chen","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r270","rowIndex":270,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「勿論それはあります」","en":"“Of course that’s part of it.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫","displayName":"Michio Mido","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r271","rowIndex":271,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「気持ちはわかる。お前は友人を大切にするものな。それはとても素晴らしい美徳だ。しかし、<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>の<tips=81>龍頭</tips>となった以上、彼の存在はお前の友人であるというだけでは済まない、重大な意味を持ちすぎてしまったんだ」","en":"“I understand how you feel. You cherish your friends, and that is a fine virtue. But now that he is the <tips=81>Longtou</tips> of <tips=7>YS</tips>, he can no longer be merely your friend. Who he is now carries far too much significance.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ミスター・チェン","displayName":"Mr. Chen","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r272","rowIndex":272,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それも、わかってます」","en":"“I understand that too.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫","displayName":"Michio Mido","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r273","rowIndex":273,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうだろう。まあ、まずはあの小せがれのお手なみ拝見といったところだな。彼はまだ組織をまとめきっておらず、さらに今、我々という心配事まで増えた。なかなか忙しい局面だ。お前もよく見ておけ。彼から学べるところは学ぶんだ」","en":"“No doubt. Well, first let us see what that young whelp can do. He has yet to bring his organization fully under control, and now he has acquired us as another worry. He has a busy time ahead. Watch him closely. Learn what you can from him.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ミスター・チェン","displayName":"Mr. Chen","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r274","rowIndex":274,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=90>ミスター・チェン</tips>はそう言うと、手元に視線を落として一人遊びの続きを行う。その表情からはさきほどの怒りは完全に消えて、いつも通りのおどけた笑みが浮かんでいる。","en":"With that, <tips=90>Mr. Chen</tips> lowers his eyes to his hands and resumes his solitary game. Every trace of his earlier anger has vanished, and his usual clownish grin is back in its place.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r275","rowIndex":275,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=10>道夫</tips>は黙っていた。彼が危惧しているのは友人の<tips=1>亮</tips>が敵にまわるという、それだけではなかった。","en":"<tips=10>Michio</tips> says nothing. The prospect of his friend <tips=1>Leung</tips> becoming an enemy is not his only concern.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r276","rowIndex":276,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　今回の判断そのものに対して、強い疑念がある。","en":"He has grave doubts about the decision itself.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r277","rowIndex":277,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　このような、<tips=22>老人たち</tips>のきなくさい行動は、<tips=21>八龍会</tips>のすべての会員が受け入れられるというようなものではないだろう。その多くは平凡に暮らす市民なのだ。","en":"Such ominous conduct by the <tips=22>elders</tips> is hardly something every member of the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips> can accept. Most of them are ordinary citizens leading ordinary lives.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r278","rowIndex":278,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>のような過激なギャングたちと対立などして、抗争に身を投じるのをよしとするものばかりではないはずだ。このようなことを推し進めれば、八龍会自体に混乱が生まれる。いくらある程度の混沌が必要だとしても、<tips=21>八龍会</tips>のなかで乱れていたらどうにもならない。","en":"Surely not all of them can approve of antagonizing violent gangsters like <tips=7>YS</tips> and plunging into a gang war. If the elders press ahead, they will throw the Society itself into turmoil. However necessary a certain degree of chaos may be, nothing can be accomplished if the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips> is itself in disarray.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r279","rowIndex":279,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そんなこと、<tips=10>道夫</tips>が言わずとも<tips=22>老人たち</tips>だって理解しているはずなのだ。","en":"The <tips=22>elders</tips> must understand that without <tips=10>Michio</tips> having to tell them.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r280","rowIndex":280,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　あまり考えたくはなかったが、彼らはただ焦っているのではないだだろうか？","en":"He would rather not consider it, but are they simply acting out of desperation?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r281","rowIndex":281,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それは老いによる衰えか、<tips=17>タイプB</tips>の発症が近づいているのか。","en":"Is this the decline of old age, or is the onset of <tips=17>Type B</tips> drawing near?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r282","rowIndex":282,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　とにかく何か追い詰められていて、こんな性急な方法を選ぼうとしているように思えてならない。","en":"Whatever the cause, he cannot shake the feeling that something has driven them into a corner and that this is why they are choosing such a hasty course.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r283","rowIndex":283,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"（いや、何かおれにわからない考えがあるのだろう）","en":"(No. They must have something in mind that I don’t understand.)","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r284","rowIndex":284,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=10>道夫</tips>は頭を掻いて、心の中で一人呟く。","en":"<tips=10>Michio</tips> scratches his head and mutters to himself in the privacy of his thoughts.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r285","rowIndex":285,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして憂鬱に黙り込んでしまうと、ふと、背後で誰かが呼んだような気がして後ろを振り向いた。","en":"He lapses into a gloomy silence. Then, suddenly feeling as though someone has called to him from behind, he turns around.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r286","rowIndex":286,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しかしそこには誰もいない。確かに、自分を呼ぶかすれた女の声が聞こえたのに。","en":"But no one is there—even though he could have sworn he heard a woman’s faint, hoarse voice calling to him.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r287","rowIndex":287,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"（疲れてるのかな）","en":"(Maybe I’m tired.)","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r288","rowIndex":288,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=10>道夫</tips>は溜息をつき、椅子に背中をもたれさせる。","en":"<tips=10>Michio</tips> sighs and leans back in his chair.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X9:r289","rowIndex":289,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして眠そうな目で、背中を丸めてしわしわのやせ細った指先で一つ一つ麻雀牌を並べる<tips=90>ミスター・チェン</tips>の姿を眺め続けた。","en":"Through sleepy eyes, he continues watching <tips=90>Mr. Chen</tips> hunch over the table and arrange the mahjong tiles one by one with his thin, wrinkled fingers.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}}]},{"position":28,"code":"X10","unitId":"X10","rows":[{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r1","rowIndex":1,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　まっすぐと伸びた通路の左右にいくつものドアが並んでいる。","en":"A straight corridor stretched ahead, with several doors lining either side.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r2","rowIndex":2,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　天井にも壁にもくすみやシミが目立つ汚れた内装。窓はなく、天井の薄暗い照明がなければ一筋の光も差さない。そして静まりかえっている。","en":"A dingy interior, its ceiling and walls marred by conspicuous stains and discoloration. There were no windows; without the dim lights overhead, not a single ray would have penetrated the place. And it was utterly silent.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r3","rowIndex":3,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=29>アイス</tips>と<tips=28>トーマス・リャオ</tips>はこの人気のない通路で、壁に張り付くようにして並んで立っていた。","en":"In this deserted corridor, <tips=29>Ice</tips> and <tips=28>Thomas Liao</tips> stood side by side, pressed flat against the wall.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r4","rowIndex":4,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　二人の手はしっかりと握られている。","en":"Their hands were clasped tightly together.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r5","rowIndex":5,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　奥から足音がして、Tシャツ姿の屈強な男がやって来る。彼の腰には大口径の拳銃が牛革のホルスターで吊られている。いくら治安の悪いこの街でも、このように銃器を剥き出しにして歩いているのは普通ではない。","en":"Footsteps sounded from farther down the corridor, and a powerfully built man in a T-shirt approached. A large-caliber pistol hung at his waist in a cowhide holster. Even in this crime-ridden city, openly walking around with a firearm like that was far from ordinary.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r6","rowIndex":6,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼は二人の目の前まで来て、そして視線をやることもなくそのまま通り過ぎ、二人のすぐ横にあるエレベーターに乗り込む。","en":"He came directly toward the pair, passed them without so much as a glance, and entered the elevator beside them.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r7","rowIndex":7,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　男の目には二人の姿は映っていない。アイスが透明化の能力を使っているのだ。","en":"The man could not see either of them. Ice was using her ability to make them invisible.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r8","rowIndex":8,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女はしっかりと両目を閉じ、そして二人とも黙っている。","en":"She kept both eyes tightly closed, and neither of them spoke.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r9","rowIndex":9,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=29>アイス</tips>が目を開いたり、二人のどちらかが言葉を発すれば能力は解除されてしまう。つまり、言葉やアイコンタクトで意思の疎通を行うことが出来ないということだ。","en":"If <tips=29>Ice</tips> opened her eyes or either of them uttered a word, the effect would end. In other words, they could communicate neither verbally nor through eye contact.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r10","rowIndex":10,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=28>トーマス</tips>はこの通路の奥に行きたかった。","en":"<tips=28>Thomas</tips> wanted to continue down the corridor.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r11","rowIndex":11,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しかし、通路の向こうの隅にどうやら監視カメラが仕掛けられている。<tips=29>アイス</tips>の能力は肉眼からはその姿を消すことが出来るが、機械の目には効果がなく、カメラを通すとはっきりとその姿が見えてしまう。だから、カメラの視界に入らぬよう、こうして壁の出っ張りの内側に隠れているのだ。","en":"A surveillance camera, however, appeared to have been installed in a corner farther down the corridor. <tips=29>Ice’s</tips> ability could hide them from the naked eye, but it had no effect upon a machine’s eye: through a camera, they remained plainly visible. That was why they were hiding behind this protruding section of wall, outside the camera’s field of view.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r12","rowIndex":12,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　どこかしらのドアの向こうで、ガタガタと物音がし、誰かが囁き声をあげた。","en":"A rattling noise came from behind one of the doors, and someone whispered.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r13","rowIndex":13,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ここは<tips=9>Y地区</tips>の外れに建てられたホテルだった。","en":"This was a hotel on the outskirts of <tips=9>Y District</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r14","rowIndex":14,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　といっても、普通のホテルではなく、いわゆるラブホテルとかブティックホテルというやつである。","en":"Not an ordinary hotel, however, but what was known as a love hotel or boutique hotel.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r15","rowIndex":15,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　男女が、あるいは男同士や女同士がその密やかな楽しみの行為を行うというのが本来の使い方なのだろうが、この街では殺人現場になったり、不法滞在者のたまり場になっていたり、麻薬の回し打ちが行われていたりと、実に用途の幅が広い。","en":"Its proper purpose was presumably to provide a place where women and men, men and men, or women and women could pursue their private pleasures. In this city, however, such hotels boasted a remarkably broad range of uses: as murder scenes, hangouts for undocumented residents, and places to share needles while injecting drugs.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r16","rowIndex":16,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=28>トーマス</tips>たちがいるこのホテルも、今現在そのような特別な用途に使われているようだ。","en":"The hotel <tips=28>Thomas</tips> and his companions had entered also appeared to be serving just such a special purpose at that very moment.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r17","rowIndex":17,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　普通のラブホテルには、銃を剥き出しにした男が部屋に出たり入ったりしてはいないし、あんなふうに目立つ場所に監視カメラがついていたりはしない。盗撮用のカメラが仕掛けられていることはあるが、そういったものは客室の目立たぬ場所に隠されているものだ。そもそも、このホテルでも別の階にはこのようなカメラは設置されていないのだ。この階だけ、このような装置が仕掛けられている。","en":"Ordinary love hotels did not have armed men moving in and out of the rooms with their guns in plain sight, nor did they mount surveillance cameras in conspicuous places like that one. Hidden cameras used to record guests did exist, but those were concealed in unobtrusive corners of the rooms. More to the point, there were no cameras like this on any other floor of the hotel. Only this floor had one.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r18","rowIndex":18,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　出入りする人間を厳しくチェックしなくてはならない何かが、この階にはあるということだ。","en":"Something on this floor required everyone entering or leaving to be checked closely.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r19","rowIndex":19,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　もし、あのカメラの映像に<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>幹部<tips=28>トーマス・リャオ</tips>の姿が残って、それを誰かが見ることになればいらぬ騒ぎになる可能性がある。","en":"If the camera captured <tips=7>YS</tips> senior member <tips=28>Thomas Liao</tips> and someone later saw the footage, it could cause an unnecessary uproar.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r20","rowIndex":20,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=28>トーマス</tips>は迷っていた。","en":"<tips=28>Thomas</tips> hesitated.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r21","rowIndex":21,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼は場数を踏んだ人間ではない。彼はギャングの息子であるという素性からは考えられぬほどまっとうに生きて来た。","en":"He was no seasoned operator. For the son of a gangster, he had led an extraordinarily upstanding life.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r22","rowIndex":22,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　万引きをしたこともなければ、学校を休むのにうその理由を口にしたこともなく、財布が落ちていれば中身も見ずに交番に届けてしまうような、こんな若者が今時いるだろうか。その財布を届けられた警官が自分のポケットにしまいこんでしまうような世の中なのである。","en":"He had never shoplifted or invented an excuse to miss school. If he found a wallet, he would carry it to the nearest police box without even looking inside. Did young people like him still exist? This was a world where the officer he handed it to might pocket it himself.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r23","rowIndex":23,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　だから人を騙したり裏をかいたりというこの世界の人間なら誰でも身につけているはずのテクニックに欠けている。彼もそうした自分をよく自覚している。","en":"He therefore lacked the arts of deception and outmaneuvering others that anyone in this world ought to have acquired. He himself was well aware of this shortcoming.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r24","rowIndex":24,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　だから、このように忍び込むといった場面で、リスクを適切に評価する自信がなかった。","en":"That was why he had no confidence in his ability to judge the risks properly when sneaking into a place like this.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r25","rowIndex":25,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　かつて盗みを生業としていた<tips=29>アイス</tips>には何かアイデアがあるかもしれない。","en":"<tips=29>Ice</tips>, who had once made her living through theft, might have some idea.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r26","rowIndex":26,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しかし、口を開くことが出来ない以上、彼女とは相談が出来ない。一旦引き返して策を練るという手もあるが、それはあまりに情けないのではないだろうかと、<tips=28>トーマス</tips>は考えた。彼の方からここに入ろうと言い出したのである。","en":"But as long as he could not speak, he could not consult her. They could turn back for the moment and devise a plan, but <tips=28>Thomas</tips> wondered whether that would be altogether too pathetic. He was the one who had suggested coming in here.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r27","rowIndex":27,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それに、いくら能力があるとは言え、あまり頻繁に出たり入ったりしているのも危険に思える。<tips=29>アイス</tips>の能力は強力だが、前述のように万能ではないのだ。","en":"Besides, however powerful the ability might be, coming and going too frequently seemed dangerous. <tips=29>Ice’s</tips> ability was powerful, but as noted above, it was not infallible.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r28","rowIndex":28,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　リーダーなのだから適切に決断しなければいけないと、気負うばかりで何のアイデアも出ない。","en":"The more he tells himself that, as their leader, he has to make the right decision, the more pressure he puts on himself—and still not a single idea comes.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r29","rowIndex":29,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　こうして悩んで立ち止まっていること自体が悪手のようにも思う。","en":"Merely standing here worrying like this began to seem like a bad move in itself.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r30","rowIndex":30,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　手慣れた人間ならば、進むにしろ戻るにしろするりと身体を動かしているに違いない。そして、どちらを選んだにしろ、素早い判断というそれ自体が正解になるのかもしれない。","en":"Someone experienced would surely have slipped into motion by now, whether to press on or turn back. Whichever he chose, perhaps the very speed of the decision would make it the right one.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r31","rowIndex":31,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　思わぬ時間そこで立ち止まってしまったわけだが、この状況、目をつぶり手を引かれるままにしている<tips=29>アイス</tips>の気持ちを思うと心が痛む。","en":"He had been standing there for an unexpectedly long time, and his heart ached when he considered how <tips=29>Ice</tips> must feel, eyes closed and letting him lead her by the hand.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r32","rowIndex":32,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　不安ではないだろうか？　それとも、主人の不甲斐なさに内心で溜息をついているだろうか？","en":"Would she not be anxious? Or was she inwardly sighing at her master’s incompetence?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r33","rowIndex":33,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=28>トーマス</tips>も溜息をつきたいような気分だったが、ここで弱気になってはいけない。なんとかして、状況を打開しなくてはいけない。","en":"<tips=28>Thomas</tips> felt like sighing himself, but he could not lose heart here. Somehow, he had to break the impasse.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r34","rowIndex":34,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　もしかしたら、その行動に<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>――いや、この街の運命がかかっているのかもしれないのだから。","en":"The move he made here might determine the fate of <tips=7>YS</tips>—no, of the entire city.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r35","rowIndex":35,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　こんな状況に陥ってしまった発端は、一週間ほど前に遡る。","en":"The events that had brought them to this predicament began approximately one week earlier.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r36","rowIndex":36,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　午前中は<tips=41>グランドタワー</tips>の<tips=1>亮</tips>の執務室で会議が行われていた。","en":"That morning, a meeting had been held in <tips=41>Grand Tower</tips>, in <tips=1>Leung’s</tips> office.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r37","rowIndex":37,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　出席者は、<tips=1>謝亮</tips>、<tips=28>トーマス</tips>、先代の<tips=84>マイケル・ツェー</tips>、そして<tips=4>馬明</tips>と<tips=25>馬世傑</tips>の親子である。部屋の隅の方には<tips=40>天明</tips>、<tips=40>天祥</tips>のサイキック姉妹が待機して常に不意の来訪者を警戒している。","en":"Those present were <tips=1>Tse Leung</tips>, <tips=28>Thomas</tips>, the former Longtou <tips=84>Michael Tse</tips>, and the father and son <tips=4>Ma Ming</tips> and <tips=25>Ma Sai-kit</tips>. In one corner, the psychic sisters <tips=40>Tin-ming</tips> and <tips=40>Tin-cheung</tips> remained on standby, constantly watching for unexpected visitors.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r38","rowIndex":38,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　いつもの面々とでも言うべき顔ぶれで、重要な話をするときはこれに<tips=31>エリー・ホワイト</tips>が加わったり加わらなかったりする。","en":"This was more or less the usual lineup, with <tips=31>Ellie White</tips> joining them for some important discussions but not others.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r39","rowIndex":39,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　話題は、<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>への批判を続ける『<tips=22>老人たち</tips>』の件であった。","en":"The subject was the “<tips=22>Elders</tips>,” who continued to criticize <tips=7>YS</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r40","rowIndex":40,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　会議と言っても、実際は<tips=1>謝亮</tips>が何か考えをまとめたり、自分の考えを通達するための場で、参加者同士の議論で何かを決めるというわけでもない。議論はあくまでも<tips=1>亮</tips>が判断するための材料にすぎない。","en":"Although they called it a meeting, in practice it was a forum for <tips=1>Tse Leung</tips> to organize his thoughts or tell the others what he had in mind. Nothing was actually decided through discussion among the participants; their arguments were merely material for <tips=1>Leung</tips> to consider before reaching his own judgment.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r41","rowIndex":41,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その時はみなで<tips=17>タイプB</tips>への対応を意見しあい、<tips=1>亮</tips>はそれを黙って聞いていた。うつろに目を閉じ、半分居眠りをしているように見える。","en":"At the time, everyone was offering opinions on how to deal with the <tips=17>Type Bs</tips> while <tips=1>Leung</tips> listened in silence. His eyes were closed, his expression vacant; he looked half asleep.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r42","rowIndex":42,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それを見咎めて<tips=4>馬明</tips>が意地悪く質問などをすると、すらすらと答える。学校の授業なども、こうやって眠りながらでも聞くことが出来るタイプなのだろう。自分とは正反対だと<tips=28>トーマス</tips>は思った。","en":"Whenever <tips=4>Ma Ming</tips> caught him at it and spitefully put a question to him, Leung answered with perfect fluency. He must have been the sort who could follow a school lesson even while asleep. <tips=28>Thomas</tips> thought they could not have been more different.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r43","rowIndex":43,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　とにかく<tips=21>八龍会</tips>は危険すぎるという点で、全員の意見は一致している。","en":"On one point, everyone agreed: the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips> was far too dangerous.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r44","rowIndex":44,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=21>八龍会</tips>の会員はどこにでも隠れているし、<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>のなかにもいるだろう。彼らは同じ<tips=17>タイプB</tips>に生まれたという強い繋がりがあり、また、現実的に薬の力で支配されてもいる。たとえ<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>のなかにいようとも、<tips=21>八龍会</tips>の指示があればそれに従うかもしれない。","en":"Members of the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips> lurked everywhere, presumably even within <tips=7>YS</tips>. They shared the powerful bond of having been born <tips=17>Type B</tips>, and in practical terms they were also held under control by the drug. Even those inside <tips=7>YS</tips> might obey an order from the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r45","rowIndex":45,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　つまり<tips=21>八龍会</tips>と敵対するということは、街に潜むすべての<tips=17>タイプB</tips>を敵に回すのと近い。","en":"In other words, opposing the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips> would come close to making enemies of every <tips=17>Type B</tips> hidden throughout the city.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r46","rowIndex":46,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　やはり彼らが独占して麻薬の売買を行っているというのが一番の問題で、それによって金と奴隷の両方を手に入れている。","en":"The single greatest problem was the Eight Dragons Society’s monopoly upon the narcotics trade. Through that business, it secured both money and slaves.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r47","rowIndex":47,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そこを崩さなければ組織としての力を奪うことは出来ない。","en":"Unless they broke that monopoly, they could not strip the organization of its power.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r48","rowIndex":48,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そういった話し合いを、<tips=1>亮</tips>は一言も意見を口にすることなく聞いていた。","en":"<tips=1>Leung</tips> listened to the discussion without expressing a single opinion.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r49","rowIndex":49,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どうにかしなくてはならん。やつらはやる気だ。<tips=35>フェルナンデス</tips>の件だって、裏で糸を引いている可能性もある」","en":"“We have to do something. They’re ready to make their move. They may even have been pulling the strings behind what happened to <tips=35>Fernandes</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬明","displayName":"Ma Ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r50","rowIndex":50,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=4>馬明</tips>がそう言った時、はじめて<tips=1>亮</tips>は意見を口にした。","en":"Only after <tips=4>Ma Ming</tips> said this did <tips=1>Leung</tips> voice an opinion for the first time.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r51","rowIndex":51,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「前にも言ったかもしれないが、あの事件には『<tips=22>老人たち</tips>』は絡んでいない」","en":"“I may have said this before, but the ‘<tips=22>Elders</tips>’ had nothing to do with that incident.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r52","rowIndex":52,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=36>アウロラ</tips>の名前が出ると<tips=28>トーマス</tips>などは事件を思い出して悲しい気持ちになってしまうが、表情を見る限り<tips=1>亮</tips>にはそのような感傷はなさそうだった。その態度の裏では彼も自分と同様悲しんでいるに違いないと<tips=28>トーマス</tips>は思っている。","en":"The mention of <tips=36>Aurora</tips> brought the incident back to <tips=28>Thomas</tips> and made him sad, but judging by <tips=1>Leung’s</tips> expression, he seemed untouched by any such sentimentality. <tips=28>Thomas</tips> believed that beneath the impassive exterior, Leung must be grieving just as he was.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r53","rowIndex":53,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　確証は何もないが。","en":"There was no proof of that.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r54","rowIndex":54,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「誰かの指示があったとは思えない。もしそうだったら、あんなチンピラ、死ぬ前に依頼主を吐いてるさ。一言も言わないで死んでいったんだ。ほぼ間違いないね。<tips=21>八龍会</tips>側には、あわよくばあの件を利用してやろうという下心はあるようだけれど、直接の繋がりはない」","en":"“I don’t think anyone gave them orders. If someone had, punks like that would have given up the client before they died. They went to their deaths without saying a word. I’m almost certain. The <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips> may have designs on turning the incident to its advantage if it can, but there’s no direct connection.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r55","rowIndex":55,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>はよほど自信があるらしく、きっぱりと言った。","en":"Apparently quite confident in his conclusion, <tips=1>Leung</tips> delivered it without equivocation.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r56","rowIndex":56,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そんなに強く言い切れるのか？　<tips=21>八龍会</tips>は昔から陰謀が得意じゃないか。いつもああやって、どこかの組織に仲間を送り込んで『爆発』させるんだよ。おれたちが若い時も大分苦労させられた」","en":"“Can you really be so certain? The <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips> has always been good at conspiracies, hasn’t it? That’s how they always do it: plant one of their people in some organization and make him ‘explode.’ They caused us plenty of trouble that way when we were young.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬明","displayName":"Ma Ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r57","rowIndex":57,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=4>馬明</tips>は疑わしげにそう訊ねる。彼は<tips=1>亮</tips>が<tips=81>龍頭</tips>になってから、最高幹部のなかで一回り年長という立場になったせいか、苦言を呈す役割になることが増えていた。","en":"<tips=4>Ma Ming</tips> asked suspiciously. Since <tips=1>Leung</tips> became <tips=81>Longtou</tips>, Ma had increasingly found himself cast as the voice of criticism, perhaps because he was roughly a dozen years older than the other senior officers.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r58","rowIndex":58,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「だって、意味がないじゃないか。<tips=21>八龍会</tips>としては、<tips=35>フェルナンデス</tips>は健在のまま<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>と対立させた方が都合が良かったはずだ。彼らが襲撃を受けて死んだのは<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>にとってはむしろ都合がいい」","en":"“Because it would serve no purpose. For the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips>, it would have been more convenient to keep <tips=35>Fernandes</tips> alive and set him against <tips=7>YS</tips>. The fact that he and his people were attacked and killed was actually convenient for <tips=7>YS</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r59","rowIndex":59,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>は淡々と説明をする。","en":"<tips=1>Leung</tips> explained matter-of-factly.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r60","rowIndex":60,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「偉大なるカリスマ、<tips=35>ジョゼ・フェルナンデス</tips>が死んで、なんの実績もない<tips=38>リタ</tips>がリーダーじゃ、当面は身内をまとめるので手一杯だ。もつれれば、もう一度<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>に呼び戻す目が出て来るかもしれない。そうなればもう我々には逆らえないだろう。そうはならなくとも、しばらく活動は鈍る。……いずれにしろ、当面は彼らの脅威はなくなったわけだ。<tips=22>老人たち</tips>が僕の仕業だと騒ぎたくなるのもわかる。客観的に見ても僕らがやったと考えたほうが自然なのさ」","en":"“Their great, charismatic leader, <tips=35>José Fernandes</tips>, is dead, and with <tips=38>Rita</tips>—who has no record to speak of—in command, they’ll have their hands full simply holding the group together for the time being. If internal tensions arise, we may have another chance to bring them back into <tips=7>YS</tips>. If that happens, they won’t be able to defy us anymore. Even if it doesn’t, their operations will slow for a while. ...Either way, they no longer pose an immediate threat. I understand why the <tips=22>Elders</tips> want to make a fuss and say it was my doing. Objectively, assuming we did it is the natural conclusion.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r61","rowIndex":61,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まさか本当に<tips=81>龍頭</tips>の差し金ってことはないですよねえ？」","en":"“You really didn’t order it, did you, <tips=81>Longtou</tips>?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬世傑","displayName":"Ma Sai-kit","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r62","rowIndex":62,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=25>世傑</tips>が本気だか冗談のつもりだかわからない中途半端な表情で訊ねる。","en":"<tips=25>Sai-kit</tips> asked with an expression that made it impossible to tell whether he was serious or joking.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r63","rowIndex":63,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ないよ。僕としては円満で合併が最善だったし、その可能性はまだあったんだから。それにね、何度も言うが僕は平和主義なんだよ。人が死なないで済むならそれよりいいことはないじゃないか」","en":"“No. As far as I was concerned, a peaceful merger was the best outcome, and it was still possible. Besides, as I keep telling you, I’m a pacifist. If no one has to die, what could be better than that?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r64","rowIndex":64,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なるほど」","en":"“I see.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬世傑","displayName":"Ma Sai-kit","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r65","rowIndex":65,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=25>世傑</tips>は笑って頷く。この青年にとっては、組織同士の陰謀や勢力争いなどどうでも良く、年下のボスの個性が面白くて仕方がないのだろう。","en":"<tips=25>Sai-kit</tips> smiled and nodded. Conspiracies and contests for power between organizations presumably meant nothing to the young man; perhaps he simply found the personality of his younger boss endlessly entertaining.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r66","rowIndex":66,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「結局、<tips=2>阿亮</tips>はどうするつもりなんだい？　これから、<tips=17>タイプB</tips>を敵にしようとしているのかい？」","en":"“So what do you intend to do, <tips=2>Ah Leung</tips>? Are you planning to make enemies of the <tips=17>Type Bs</tips> from here on?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r67","rowIndex":67,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　と質問したのは<tips=28>トーマス</tips>だった。","en":"It was <tips=28>Thomas</tips> who asked.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r68","rowIndex":68,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼としては、<tips=17>タイプB</tips>はあくまでも不幸な運命を背負った人々であり、彼らと戦うような事態はどうしても気が進まないのだ。","en":"To him, the <tips=17>Type Bs</tips> remained people burdened by an unhappy fate, and he could not welcome the prospect of fighting them.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r69","rowIndex":69,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>は首を振って否定する。","en":"<tips=1>Leung</tips> shook his head.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r70","rowIndex":70,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そんな単純な構図にはならない。<tips=22>老人たち</tips>もよほど愚かじゃなければ、あまり大々的な抗争にはしたくないはずだ。もっとじわじわとコントロールしようとするはずだよ。いくらでもスパイがいるんだからね」","en":"“The situation won’t be that simple. Unless the <tips=22>Elders</tips> are extraordinarily foolish, they won’t want a large-scale conflict. They’ll try to bring us under control more gradually. They have spies everywhere, after all.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r71","rowIndex":71,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そっちの方が厄介だな……。組織内の<tips=17>タイプB</tips>たちに監視を付けるか……」","en":"“That sounds even more troublesome… Should we put the <tips=17>Type Bs</tips> in the organization under surveillance…?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬明","displayName":"Ma Ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r72","rowIndex":72,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=4>馬明</tips>は腕組みをし、難しい顔で言う。","en":"<tips=4>Ma Ming</tips> folded his arms and frowned.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r73","rowIndex":73,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そんなことをしたら、本当に<tips=17>タイプB</tips>全部が敵になってしまう。僕は別に<tips=17>タイプB</tips>と戦いたいわけじゃない。彼らの待遇は今まで通りで何も変えない」","en":"“If we did that, every <tips=17>Type B</tips> truly would become our enemy. I have no desire to fight the <tips=17>Type Bs</tips>. Their treatment will remain exactly as it has been.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r74","rowIndex":74,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「じゃあ、ジジイたちの挑発に対し何の手も打たないってことか？　あそこまで言われて」","en":"“So you’re saying we’ll do nothing about the old men’s provocation? After everything they’ve said?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬明","displayName":"Ma Ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r75","rowIndex":75,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=4>馬明</tips>は渋い顔をする。","en":"<tips=4>Ma Ming’s</tips> expression soured.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r76","rowIndex":76,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「見過ごしはしないよ。……まあ慌てなくていいさ。僕が思うに、これはピンチじゃなくてチャンスなんだよ。なんでだろうな？　みんな勝手に自分たちが有利だと思い込んで軽率なことばかりしてくれている。元<tips=69>義勝</tips>の爺さんたちもそうだし、今回の<tips=22>老人たち</tips>の挑発だってそうさ。僕を舐めているんだろうけど、あんな風に自分の欲望を相手に見せつけるなんて、簡単にしてはいけないのさ」","en":"“I won’t let it pass. ...But there’s no need to panic. The way I see it, this isn’t a crisis—it’s an opportunity. And do you know why? Everyone decides for themselves that they have the advantage, then obligingly does something rash. The old men of the former <tips=69>Yisheng</tips> did it, and this provocation from the <tips=22>Elders</tips> is no different. They must look down on me, but openly displaying your desires to an opponent like that is not a mistake you can afford to make.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r77","rowIndex":77,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>は眠そうに半目を閉じたまま笑って、","en":"<tips=1>Leung</tips> smiles, his drowsy eyes still half closed, and says,","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r78","rowIndex":78,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=22>老人たち</tips>の野心はわかったんだから、見過ごしたりはしない。いつかは決着をつけるつもりだよ。しかし、それには時期がある。その時になったら改めて何か言うよ。当面は僕らも自分の組織を整えよう。うちだってまだごちゃごちゃとしているからね」","en":"“Now that I know the <tips=22>Elders</tips>’ ambitions, I won’t ignore them. I intend to settle things with them someday. But there is a proper time for that. I’ll say more when the time comes. For the present, we should put our own organization in order. Ours is still a mess too.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r79","rowIndex":79,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>はついにあくびを堪えきれなくなって大きな口を開けると、手を振って一同に退出するよう命じた。","en":"At last unable to restrain his yawn, <tips=1>Leung</tips> opened his mouth wide, waved a hand, and ordered everyone to leave.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r80","rowIndex":80,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>は何か考えがあるようで、今は焦る必要がないとも言うが、<tips=28>トーマス</tips>はそう落ち着いてもいられない。","en":"<tips=1>Leung</tips> seemed to have some plan and said there was no need for haste now, but <tips=28>Thomas</tips> could not remain quite so calm.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r81","rowIndex":81,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼の部下には<tips=17>タイプB</tips>も少なくない。祖父の代では関係者は客家人の華僑ばかりだったが、父の<tips=27>廖志明</tips>は国籍や人種、ミュータントかノーマルかにそれほどのこだわりもなく、有能な人間を積極的に採用した。当然反発もあったはずだが、彼がどんな魔術を使って周囲を納得させたのかはわからない。とにかく、結果として<tips=76>旧義勝</tips>などよりはバラエティ豊かな顔ぶれが揃っている。","en":"A considerable number of his subordinates were <tips=17>Type Bs</tips>. During his grandfather’s time, virtually everyone connected to the Family had been a Hakka overseas Chinese. His father, <tips=27>Liao Chi-ming</tips>, cared much less about nationality, race, or whether someone was a mutant or Normal, and actively recruited capable people. Resistance must have existed, though Thomas did not know what magic his father had used to win everyone over. Whatever the means, the result was a far more diverse membership than that of organizations like <tips=76>old Yisheng</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r82","rowIndex":82,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=21>八龍会</tips>との緊張が高まりつつある現在、<tips=28>トーマス</tips>としてはそうした部下たちのことが気になって仕方がないのだ。","en":"With tension rising between YS and the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips>, <tips=28>Thomas</tips> could not stop worrying about those subordinates.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r83","rowIndex":83,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=9>Y地区</tips>には大小さまざまな組織があるが、彼ほど細やかに部下のことを考えているものも少ないだろう。","en":"<tips=9>Y District</tips> contained organizations of every size, but few people gave their subordinates as much careful thought as he did.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r84","rowIndex":84,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼は口に出して言うことはなかったが、部下に対して引け目に近い責任を感じている。その時は父の命を救うためという気持ちが強く、勢いで決めてしまった部分もあるのだが、冷静に考えてみれば<tips=28>トーマス</tips>の行動というのは組織を<tips=1>亮</tips>に売り渡したのと同じことだ。部下たちは何も言わないし、<tips=1>亮</tips>も責任をもって厚遇で迎え入れてくれたが、やはり不満を抱えているものもいるかもしれない。","en":"He never said it aloud, but he felt a responsibility toward his subordinates that bordered on guilt. At the time, the desire to save his father’s life had been overwhelming, and momentum had influenced his decision. In cold retrospect, however, <tips=28>Thomas’s</tips> actions had amounted to selling the organization to <tips=1>Leung</tips>. His people said nothing, and <tips=1>Leung</tips> had taken responsibility for them and welcomed them with generous treatment. Even so, some might harbor dissatisfaction.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r85","rowIndex":85,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>は多くのファミリーの集まりだが、どこも自分のファミリーに誇りがある。<tips=74>廖ファミリー</tips>のものたちも、これまでずっと<tips=28>トミー</tips>の父<tips=27>廖志明</tips>のために頑張って来たのに、彼が追放され<tips=76>香港派</tips>に取り込まれてしまったということで、やるせない思いを抱くものも少なくないはずだ。","en":"<tips=7>YS</tips> was a collection of many Families, and every one of them took pride in its own. The men of the <tips=74>Liao Family</tips> had worked all those years for <tips=28>Tommy’s</tips> father, <tips=27>Liao Chi-ming</tips>, only to see him expelled and themselves absorbed into the <tips=76>Hong Kong faction</tips>. Many of them must have found the outcome deeply frustrating.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r86","rowIndex":86,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　世間の人々は<tips=74>廖ファミリー</tips>は結束が弱いと言うし、実際比較するとそうなのだろうが、しかし<tips=28>トーマス</tips>の目からすると忠誠心が皆無だとも思えない。","en":"People said the <tips=74>Liao Family</tips> possessed weak internal bonds, and by comparison that was probably true. Yet in <tips=28>Thomas’s</tips> eyes, its members did not appear entirely devoid of loyalty.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r87","rowIndex":87,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　なのに、組織を売り渡したこの自分がリーダーになったのに、誰も不平を言わない。","en":"And yet no one complained when he—the man who had sold the organization—became its leader.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r88","rowIndex":88,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>ほどの人物でも、組織の古株や世間にはなかなか評価されずに、小僧扱いされていたりする。なのに、<tips=74>廖ファミリー</tips>の部下はこれまで通り忠実で、父の時と変わらず働いてくれている。","en":"Even someone like <tips=1>Leung</tips> struggled to win recognition from longtime members and the public, who continued to treat him as a boy. And yet the <tips=74>Liao Family’s</tips> men remained as loyal as ever, working for Thomas just as they had for his father.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r89","rowIndex":89,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それに対して、何かのかたちで部下に報いてやらなければいけないと、<tips=28>トミー</tips>はいつも思っているのだ。","en":"<tips=28>Tommy</tips> always felt that he had to repay his subordinates somehow.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r90","rowIndex":90,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そういうわけで彼は、今回の<tips=21>八龍会</tips>との件で、自分の部下たちがどう感じているのかが非常に気になっていた。彼の部下にも、<tips=17>タイプＢ</tips>や、本人がそうでなくとも家族に<tips=17>タイプＢ</tips>を持つものは多い。彼らを後悔させるような決断はしたくない。","en":"For that reason, he was deeply concerned about how his subordinates felt about the current affair with the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips>. Many of his men were <tips=17>Type Bs</tips>, or had <tips=17>Type Bs</tips> in their families even if they were not themselves. He did not want to make a decision they would regret.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r91","rowIndex":91,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=41>グランドタワー</tips>を出るといつものように部下が経営しているヤミ金事務所や輸入乾物店などをまわり、特に<tips=17>タイプB</tips>の声に耳を傾けた。それは直接的な部下だけでなく、取引のある飲食店などにも及んだ。","en":"After leaving <tips=41>Grand Tower</tips>, he made his customary rounds of the loan-shark offices, imported-dry-goods shops, and other businesses operated by his subordinates, paying particular attention to what the <tips=17>Type Bs</tips> among them had to say. His inquiries extended beyond direct subordinates to restaurants and other businesses with which the Family traded.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r92","rowIndex":92,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして数日後に訪れたある店で、驚くべき情報を耳にしたのである。","en":"Several days later, he heard startling information at one such establishment.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r93","rowIndex":93,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「確かに今バーロンが配ってる新薬は<tips=17>タイプB</tips>にいい薬なんでしょうが、あれは個人的にはどうかと思いますねえ」","en":"“The new drug Balong is distributing now may indeed be good medicine for <tips=17>Type Bs</tips>, but personally, I have my doubts.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r94","rowIndex":94,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おしぼりや花代……つまり守り料を納めさせている、違法ガールズバーの店主はそう言って首を捻った。","en":"The owner of an illegal girls’ bar from which Thomas collected ‘towel fees’ and ‘flower charges’—protection money, in other words—tilted his head as he spoke.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r95","rowIndex":95,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=21>八龍会</tips>の新薬『<tips=46>ネオ・ローズ</tips>』は、街全体で話題になっており、<tips=17>タイプB</tips>のみならず関心を集めている。この店主もノーマルではあったが、聞いてもいないのにその話をはじめた。","en":"The <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society’s</tips> new drug, <tips=46>Neo Rose</tips>, had become a subject of discussion throughout the city and was attracting interest far beyond the <tips=17>Type Bs</tips> themselves. The proprietor was a Normal, but began discussing it without being asked.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r96","rowIndex":96,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「うちの女の子なんかも、あれに頼ってる子が何人かいるんですよ。幻覚でどうしようもなくなってた子が、しゃきっとして、今までどんよりとしてた目で死んだような顔だったのが、いきいきと接客してるのを見ると、そりゃ効果は認めなくちゃいけませんが、麻薬は麻薬でしょう？　どうしても『<tips=45>ローズ</tips>』のことを思い出すんですよね」","en":"“Several of my girls rely upon it. Some were completely lost to hallucinations. Now they’re alert. The same girls who once served customers with dull eyes and dead faces look positively alive. I have to admit it works. But a narcotic is still a narcotic, isn’t it? I can’t help remembering ‘<tips=45>Rose</tips>.’”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r97","rowIndex":97,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼は手に持った白い布でグラスを一つ一つ拭いながら言う。","en":"He spoke while polishing the glasses one by one with the white cloth in his hand.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r98","rowIndex":98,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=17>タイプB</tips>が元気になって本来の力を取り戻すってことですよね。本当なら確かに素晴らしい薬ですが、しかしそれでもどうなんですかね。幻覚の世界で遊んでた連中が、突然正気になって、いやそれどころか薬でハイになって、ポジティブな気分でこっちの世界に戻ってくるわけでしょう？　なんだか気持ち悪い感じもしますなあ。……あ、そうだ、リャオさん知ってますか？」","en":"“They say it restores <tips=17>Type Bs</tips> to health and gives them back their natural strength. If that’s true, it certainly is a wonderful drug, but even so, I don’t know. People who had been off playing in a world of hallucinations suddenly come to their senses—no, more than that, they get high on a drug and return to this world full of positivity, don’t they? There’s something unsettling about it. ...Oh, that’s right. Mr. Liao, have you heard?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r99","rowIndex":99,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そこで彼は声を落とし、<tips=28>トーマス</tips>に耳打ちをするように口を近づけると、","en":"He lowers his voice, leans in as though to whisper into <tips=28>Thomas’s</tips> ear, and says,","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r100","rowIndex":100,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「はす向かいの角のあのホテル、あれ、先週か先々週あたりにリャオさんの会社が売ったやつですよね？　売った相手は、<tips=17>タイプＢ</tips>だったでしょう？」","en":"“That hotel on the corner diagonally across from us—your company sold it last week or the week before, didn’t it? The buyers were <tips=17>Type Bs</tips>, weren’t they?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r101","rowIndex":101,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そ、そこまではちょっと、僕にはわからないですね」","en":"“I-I’m afraid I don’t know anything that specific.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r102","rowIndex":102,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あれを買ったの、ついこの間まで路上で寝転がってヘラヘラ笑いながら幻覚と戯れていたような連中なんですよ。それが誰かに<tips=46>ネオ・ローズ</tips>を使って貰って社会復帰したってわけなんですが……どうも良くない噂があるんです」","en":"“Until just recently, the men who bought that place were lying around in the street, grinning and playing with their hallucinations. Then someone gave them <tips=46>Neo Rose</tips> and got them back on their feet—but now there are some ugly rumors going around.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r103","rowIndex":103,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「良くない噂ってなんです？」","en":"“What sort of ugly rumors?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r104","rowIndex":104,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ホテルを買う資金なんて、すぐにためられるわけないでしょう？　それでおかしな仕事をしてると……。どうも、スラムで貧しい家の子供を買って、業者に売りさばいてるとか……」","en":"“You can’t save enough money to buy a hotel overnight, can you? So the story is that they’ve been doing some shady work… Apparently they buy children from poor families in the slums and sell them to brokers…”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r105","rowIndex":105,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それって、つまり、人身売買……！」","en":"“You mean human trafficking...?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r106","rowIndex":106,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=28>トーマス</tips>は驚いて大きな声をあげると、店主は唇に人差し指を当てて静かにするよう促し、","en":"<tips=28>Thomas</tips> cried out in shock. The owner raised an index finger to his lips, urging him to lower his voice.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r107","rowIndex":107,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あくまでも、噂ですがね。でも、深夜に子供をあのホテルに連れ込んでいるところを、うちの女の子も見ているんです。おかしいでしょう。子供をあんなところに……」","en":"“It is only a rumor. But some of my girls have seen them taking children into that hotel late at night. That’s strange, isn’t it? Children in a place like that…”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r108","rowIndex":108,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それだけじゃなんとも言えませんが、何か怪しい感じはしますね。もし人身売買がらみだとしたら、これは大問題です」","en":"“That alone proves nothing, but it certainly sounds suspicious. If human trafficking is involved, this is an extremely serious matter.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r109","rowIndex":109,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>の方針として、人身売買業者の街への立ち入りは許していない。また、そういう業者と関係を持ったものに対しても容赦なく排除するという態度をとっている。","en":"As a matter of policy, <tips=7>YS</tips> did not allow human traffickers into the city. It also ruthlessly expelled anyone who had dealings with them.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r110","rowIndex":110,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　これは初代<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>が<tips=18>ローズ・クラブ</tips>、及び<tips=68>木下組</tips>を街から排除したときにまっさきに決めた街のルールのひとつであった。それ以来ルール違反で処罰されたものはなくはないが、片手で数えられるほどに留まっている。みな<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>を恐れていたのだ。","en":"This was one of the first rules established by the first Longtou, <tips=3>Chris Tse</tips>, when he expelled the <tips=18>Rose Club</tips> and the <tips=68>Kinoshita-gumi</tips> from the city. A few people had been punished for violating it since then, but they could be counted upon one hand. Everyone had feared <tips=7>YS</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r111","rowIndex":111,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それが本当に行われているとすれば、初代が死に、ごたごたが続く<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>の影響力が落ちたのか、それとも店長が言うようにアウトローが<tips=46>ネオ・ローズ</tips>の効果で勢いづいてしまった結果なのかはわからない。とにかく、事実をはっきりさせる必要がある。","en":"If this was truly happening, Thomas did not know whether <tips=7>YS’s</tips> influence had declined amid the turmoil following its founder’s death or, as the proprietor suggested, <tips=46>Neo Rose</tips> had emboldened the city’s outlaws. Whatever the answer, the truth had to be established.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r112","rowIndex":112,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「これはどうすべきか……」","en":"“What should I do...?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r113","rowIndex":113,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　店主との会話を終え路上に出た<tips=28>トーマス</tips>は考え込んでしまった。","en":"After finishing his conversation with the proprietor and stepping back out onto the street, <tips=28>Thomas</tips> fell into thought.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r114","rowIndex":114,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まず<tips=81>龍頭</tips>に報告なさってはいかがでしょう？」","en":"“Perhaps you should begin by reporting it to the <tips=81>Longtou</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アイス","displayName":"Ice","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r115","rowIndex":115,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=29>アイス</tips>がそう提案する。","en":"<tips=29>Ice</tips> suggests.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r116","rowIndex":116,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そりゃ、<tips=2>阿亮</tips>に報告したらいいのかもしれないけど、でも、まだ噂の段階だし……」","en":"“I suppose I could report it to <tips=2>Ah Leung</tips>. But it’s still only a rumor…”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r117","rowIndex":117,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼は首を捻ってから、","en":"He cocks his head in thought, then says,","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r118","rowIndex":118,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「うん、やっぱり<tips=2>阿亮</tips>に頼むのはやめよう。彼はものすごく忙しいし、なんでもかんでも頼むのは間違ってる。僕だってそれなりの立場の人間なんだ。出来ることはやらなきゃいけないよね」","en":"“No. I don’t think I should rely on <tips=2>Ah Leung</tips>. He’s extraordinarily busy, and it would be wrong to bring every little thing to him. I hold a position of some responsibility myself. I need to do what I can.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r119","rowIndex":119,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=28>トーマス</tips>は一人でそう頷くと、自分の美しいボディーガードを振り返り、","en":"<tips=28>Thomas</tips> nods to himself, then turns toward his beautiful bodyguard and says,","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r120","rowIndex":120,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ちょっと、そのホテルを調べてみよう。僕らで。きみも手伝ってくれるかい？」","en":"“Let’s take a look into that hotel. The two of us. Will you help me?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r121","rowIndex":121,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「はい、もちろん。<tips=28>トーマス</tips>様のご命令ならば」","en":"“Yes, of course. If that is your command, Master <tips=28>Thomas</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アイス","displayName":"Ice","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r122","rowIndex":122,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　すぐに返事をしたものの、<tips=29>アイス</tips>の顔は不安げだった。","en":"<tips=29>Ice</tips> answered at once, though her expression was anxious.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r123","rowIndex":123,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その顔を見ながら<tips=28>トーマス</tips>は、こんなとき、こんな表情をされる男であってはいけないと、奮起したものである。","en":"The sight of her face steels <tips=28>Thomas’s</tips> resolve. At a time like this, he cannot be the sort of man who leaves her looking so anxious.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r124","rowIndex":124,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そうと決めると<tips=28>トーマス</tips>はその場で部下に電話をした。","en":"Once he had decided, <tips=28>Thomas</tips> telephoned one of his subordinates on the spot.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r125","rowIndex":125,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=41>グランドタワー</tips>の執務室ではなく、かつて父も使っていた街中の事務所である。不動産の売買などはそちらで管理しており、疑惑のホテルの情報がそこにはあった。","en":"He had called not the office in <tips=41>Grand Tower</tips>, but another office in the city that his father had once used. Real-estate transactions and the like were managed there, so it had the records on the hotel in question.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r126","rowIndex":126,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そのホテルは元々は<tips=9>Y地区</tips>の大地主の一人が所有していたものだが、ギャンブル狂いの当主がカジノで大きな借金を作ってしまったため、債権を買い取った<tips=74>廖ファミリー</tips>の所有となった。<tips=9>Y地区</tips>で金を借りればどんなに良心的に見える窓口であっても、最終的には確実にギャングに売られると考えた方が良い。","en":"The hotel had originally belonged to one of the great landowners of <tips=9>Y District</tips>. When the gambling-addicted head of that family accumulated an enormous casino debt, the <tips=74>Liao Family</tips> purchased the claim and took possession of the property. Anyone borrowing money in <tips=9>Y District</tips> would do well to assume that the debt would eventually be sold to a gang, however reputable the lender might look across the counter.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r127","rowIndex":127,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　もちろんファミリーでホテルを経営するつもりはないから、すぐに新たな買い手を探すことになる。幸いすぐに売却先は見つかった。","en":"Naturally, the Family had no intention of operating a hotel, so it immediately began looking for a new buyer. Fortunately, one was soon found.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r128","rowIndex":128,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　相手の名義はご大層な会社の名前になっているが、現れたのはどこにでもいそうな若者二人で、うさんくさくはあったが現金を持って来たのでファミリーとしては断る理由がなかった。","en":"The buyer of record was a company with an impressively grand name, but the people who appeared were two utterly ordinary-looking young men. The whole thing seemed suspicious, but they brought cash, so the Family had no reason to turn them away.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r129","rowIndex":129,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「その二人は<tips=17>タイプＢ</tips>だったかい？」","en":"“Were the two of them <tips=17>Type Bs</tips>?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r130","rowIndex":130,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"『いやあ、それはちょっとわかりませんでしたね。ただやたらとテンションが高くて、金が出来たから事業をしようと思ったとかなんとか、聞いてもいないのにベラベラと喋っていました』","en":"“I couldn’t say. They were strangely excited, though. Kept chattering without being asked about how they’d come into some money and wanted to start a business.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r131","rowIndex":131,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　売買契約を担当した部下はそのように説明をした。","en":"That was how the subordinate who had handled the sale described them.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r132","rowIndex":132,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　話からすると今<tips=17>タイプＢ</tips>に流行っているという薬の影響のようにも思えるが、これから事業をはじめようとする夢のある青年ならそんなものなのかもしれない。","en":"Their manner sounded like the influence of the drug currently popular among <tips=17>Type Bs</tips>. Then again, perhaps any young men with the dream of starting a business would behave that way.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r133","rowIndex":133,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「金が出来た理由はきいたかい？」","en":"“Did you ask how they’d come by the money?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r134","rowIndex":134,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"『いや、そこまではちょっと……』","en":"“No, I’m afraid I didn’t go that far...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r135","rowIndex":135,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「わかった。ありがとう。この後すぐに、僕の携帯にホテルの見取り図を送って欲しい。それから、その売った相手についてこれから少し調べてくれないか？　素性とか、前にしていた仕事とか」","en":"“I understand. Thank you. Please send the hotel’s floor plan to my phone immediately. And would you look into the buyers for me—their backgrounds and what work they did before?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r136","rowIndex":136,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"『わかりました』","en":"“Understood.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r137","rowIndex":137,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なんだか、いつもごめんね」","en":"“I’m sorry I’m always asking you to do things like this.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r138","rowIndex":138,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"『そんなこと言わないでください。<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>直属になっても、我々のリーダーは<tips=28>トーマス</tips>様だけです』","en":"“Please don’t say that. Even now that we answer directly to <tips=7>YS</tips>, you alone are our leader, <tips=28>Master Thomas</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r139","rowIndex":139,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=28>トーマス</tips>は通話を切ると、首をひねる。","en":"<tips=28>Thomas</tips> ended the call and tilted his head.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r140","rowIndex":140,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼はいつも不思議に思う。どうして自分の部下たちはこれほどに自分を慕ってくれるのだろう？　頼りなすぎて、保護欲を刺激されるとか、そういうやつなんだろうか？　いいことなんか何もしてやったことがない、どころか、迷惑をかけてばかりだ。","en":"The question never ceased to puzzle him: why did his subordinates care for him so deeply? Was he so unreliable that he inspired some protective instinct? He had never done anything good for them. If anything, he caused them nothing but trouble.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r141","rowIndex":141,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　自分の判断ミスで失敗などをしたときも、かわりに<tips=2>阿亮</tips>に叱られてくれたり、うまい言い訳を考えてくれたりする。","en":"Even when one of his bad decisions causes a failure, they take the scolding from <tips=2>Ah Leung</tips> in his place or come up with a convincing excuse for him.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r142","rowIndex":142,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　自分はまわりの人間に恵まれている、と、ただ喜んでいるだけでいいのだろうかこれは？　","en":"Was it really all right for him simply to rejoice in the good fortune of having such people around him?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r143","rowIndex":143,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どうしますか？」","en":"“What will you do?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アイス","displayName":"Ice","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r144","rowIndex":144,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　腕組みをして考え込んでいると、<tips=29>アイス</tips>が訊ねる。","en":"As he stands there with his arms folded, lost in thought, <tips=29>Ice</tips> asks the question.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r145","rowIndex":145,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうだね。思ったより大した情報がなかった。これはやっぱり、直接のりこんで調査しなくちゃいけないと思う。<tips=29>アイス</tips>は手伝ってくれるかい？」","en":"“Right. We learned less than I’d hoped. I think we really will have to go in ourselves and investigate directly. Will you help me, <tips=29>Ice</tips>?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r146","rowIndex":146,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=28>トーマス</tips>様みずからそんなことをするのですか？」","en":"“You intend to do that yourself, <tips=28>Master Thomas</tips>?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アイス","displayName":"Ice","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r147","rowIndex":147,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=29>アイス</tips>は驚いて言った。","en":"<tips=29>Ice</tips> asks in surprise.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r148","rowIndex":148,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうとも、僕らにはきみの特別な能力があるんだし、誰かにやらせるより僕ときみでやったほうがうまく行く」","en":"“Exactly. We have your special ability, and you and I will do a better job than anyone we could send.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r149","rowIndex":149,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=28>トーマス</tips>はにっこりと笑う。","en":"<tips=28>Thomas</tips> smiled brightly.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r150","rowIndex":150,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「でも、私の能力は万能ではなく、欠点もあります。この間も、<tips=81>龍頭</tips>に見破られたばかりではないですか」","en":"“But my ability isn’t foolproof. It has weaknesses. Didn’t the <tips=81>Longtou</tips> see through it just the other day?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アイス","displayName":"Ice","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r151","rowIndex":151,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=2>阿亮</tips>は特別だよ。それに、僕も一回やって学んだから、もっと慎重に動けるはずだ。鏡と、カメラに気をつければいいんでしょ？」","en":"“<tips=2>Ah Leung</tips> is exceptional. Besides, I learned from doing this once before, so I should be able to move more carefully. We only have to watch out for mirrors and cameras, don’t we?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r152","rowIndex":152,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「しかし、調査なら私だけでも……」","en":"“But if it’s an investigation, I could go alone...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アイス","displayName":"Ice","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r153","rowIndex":153,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「女の子を一人で行かせるわけにはいかない。きみは立場上は僕の部下かも知れないが、僕からすれば、かけがえのない世界で一番大事なパートナーなんだ」","en":"“I cannot send a girl in alone. You may technically be my subordinate, but to me, you are irreplaceable—the most important partner in the world.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r154","rowIndex":154,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=28>トーマス</tips>は真顔である。","en":"<tips=28>Thomas</tips> was perfectly serious.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r155","rowIndex":155,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　この場面でこんな言葉を冗談でなく言う人間を、<tips=29>アイス</tips>はどんな言葉で思いなおさせればいいのかを知らない。","en":"<tips=29>Ice</tips> had no idea what she could say to change the mind of a man capable of uttering that, at a moment like this, in perfect seriousness.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r156","rowIndex":156,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　過去の経験的に言っても、こんな時の<tips=28>トーマス</tips>はけして意見を撤回しない。楽観的というか、頑固というか、これは正しいと決めたら絶対に後には引かないのがこのおっとりとした青年の別の一面である。","en":"Past experience has taught her that <tips=28>Thomas</tips> never changes his mind at times like these. Call it optimism or stubbornness: once this mild-mannered young man decides that something is right, he absolutely refuses to back down. It is another side of his character.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r157","rowIndex":157,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それに、僕もこの目でもっと色んな物を見ないとね。思うに僕には経験が必要なんだよ。<tips=2>阿亮</tips>はあとからこの世界に入ったのに、僕よりもずっとテキパキといろんなことをこなしている。<tips=26>劉建志</tips>の襲撃にだって行ったんだよ？　僕にだってこれくらいのことは出来るはずだ。……<tips=29>アイス</tips>は心配しないで大丈夫。うまくやるから」","en":"“Besides, I need to see more things with my own eyes. What I need is experience. <tips=2>Ah Leung</tips> entered this world after I did, yet he handles all kinds of things far more efficiently. He even went along on the attack against <tips=26>Ryu Kenshi</tips>, didn’t he? Surely I can manage this much myself. ...Don’t worry, <tips=29>Ice</tips>. I’ll make it work.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r158","rowIndex":158,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　自信満々の主人の顔をしばらく見つめたのちに、","en":"After gazing at her supremely confident master’s face for a while, she says,","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r159","rowIndex":159,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……わかりました。行きましょう」","en":"“...Very well. Let us go.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アイス","displayName":"Ice","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r160","rowIndex":160,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=29>アイス</tips>からすれば賢明とは言えない冒険に思えたろうが、この愛すべき主人はこう見えて頑固であることを知っている。しつこく反論するのは諦めて、溜息をついた。","en":"To <tips=29>Ice</tips>, the venture must seem anything but wise, but she knows that, appearances notwithstanding, her lovable master is stubborn. She gives up arguing and sighs.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r161","rowIndex":161,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして能力を使う<tips=29>アイス</tips>の手を引いて、<tips=28>トーマス</tips>はホテルの右手の小さなドアから侵入したのであった。","en":"And so, leading <tips=29>Ice</tips> by the hand as she used her ability, <tips=28>Thomas</tips> entered through a small door on the hotel’s right side.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r162","rowIndex":162,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　磨りガラスのはまった重い木のドアを押し開けて足を踏み入れると、こうしたホテルにはよく有る、客同士の顔が視認しにくいほど薄暗い照明だった。","en":"He pushed open the heavy wooden door with its frosted-glass pane and stepped inside. As was common in hotels of this kind, the lighting was dim enough to keep guests from clearly seeing one another’s faces.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r163","rowIndex":163,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その暗くて狭い通路を半分手探りで進むと、ロビーに辿り着く。その右手には部屋を選ぶためのパネルが、左手には受付のカウンターがある。","en":"Half feeling his way through the dark, narrow passage, he reached the lobby. A panel for selecting rooms stood on the right, and the reception counter on the left.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r164","rowIndex":164,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"（ああいうのを見ながら、カップルで部屋を選ぶのか……）","en":"(So couples look at one of those while choosing a room...)","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r165","rowIndex":165,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=28>トーマス</tips>はこの様な場所に足を踏み入れるのが初めてで、このような光景を見るのも当然初めてであった。","en":"<tips=28>Thomas</tips> had never set foot in a place like this, and naturally had never seen such a sight.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r166","rowIndex":166,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　目的は違うが、自分もいま若い女性の手を握ってこの空間にいる。それを思うと、今の任務とは別の意味で緊張し、ごくりと生唾を飲み込んだ。","en":"His purpose might be different, but he too now stood in that space holding the hand of a young woman. The thought made him nervous for reasons having nothing to do with the mission, and he swallowed hard.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r167","rowIndex":167,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ロビーには、受付前が映るように監視カメラが取り付けられているのを知っている。","en":"He knew that a surveillance camera covered the area before the reception desk.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r168","rowIndex":168,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼はそれに映らないように受付の横に回ってバックルームのドアを開け、足を踏み入れた。","en":"Staying outside its field of view, he circled beside the counter, opened the door to the back room, and entered.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r169","rowIndex":169,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　まず彼が最初に調べようと思っているのは、従業員たちが使用するそのスペースである。もちろん今もそこに従業員がいるだろうが、<tips=29>アイス</tips>の力があれば問題なく調査が出来るはずだ。","en":"The space used by the employees was the first place he meant to search. Staff members would surely be present even now, but <tips=29>Ice’s</tips> power ought to allow him to investigate without difficulty.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r170","rowIndex":170,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=29>アイス</tips>を引き入れたあと後手でドアを閉めてふと右を見れば、椅子に座って退屈を持てあますフロント係員の後ろ姿がある。","en":"He drew <tips=29>Ice</tips> in behind him and pulled the door shut with his free hand. Glancing to the right, he saw the back of a bored front-desk clerk seated in a chair.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r171","rowIndex":171,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　薄くなったつむじをこちらに向け、カウンターの裏側に設置された小さなテレビ画面に見入っている。夕方の再放送ドラマがそこには映っていた。去年大ヒットした作品で、<tips=28>トーマス</tips>も知っている。<tips=16>タイプA</tips>の青年が死んだ恋人の幽霊と出会う悲しい物語で、主題歌にはこの街の出身であるムニラの曲が使われている。","en":"The man sat with the thinning crown of his head turned toward Thomas, absorbed in the small television installed behind the counter. It was showing an evening rerun of a drama that had become a tremendous hit the year before, one <tips=28>Thomas</tips> knew. It was the sad story of a <tips=16>Type A</tips> young man who encounters the ghost of his dead lover, and its theme song was by Munira, a native of this city.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r172","rowIndex":172,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ちょうどその曲が流れているところで、従業員は音にあわせて鼻歌をうたっていた。","en":"That song was playing now, and the employee hummed along.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r173","rowIndex":173,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　すぐ後ろでこのような物音を立てれば普通なら気配に気がつくだろうが、彼にはそのような様子がない。<tips=29>アイス</tips>の能力が効いている。いまここで<tips=28>トーマス</tips>が棚の上に置いてある花瓶を掴んで床に叩きつけたとしても、別の理由で彼が振り返るまではそれに気がつかないだろう。","en":"Ordinarily, making such noises directly behind him would have alerted the man to another presence, but he showed no sign of noticing. <tips=29>Ice's</tips> ability was working. Even if <tips=28>Thomas</tips> seized the vase on the shelf and smashed it against the floor, the clerk would not notice until something else made him turn around.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r174","rowIndex":174,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ドラマの映ったテレビの横にはパソコンがあり、入室状況が一覧出来るようになっている。","en":"Beside the television stood a computer displaying the occupancy of every room.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r175","rowIndex":175,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして、さらにその隣には白黒画面のモニターがあった。四分割された画面に監視カメラの映像が表示されている。","en":"Next to that was a black-and-white monitor divided into four surveillance-camera feeds.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r176","rowIndex":176,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　一つは、正面エントランスの映像。もう一つは、受付前の映像。これで、入って来る客の確認と、金銭をやりとりする場所の監視を行っているのだろう。","en":"One displayed the main entrance and another the space before reception. They presumably allowed the staff to inspect arriving guests and monitor the place where money changed hands.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r177","rowIndex":177,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして残り二つはそれぞれ別のエレベーターの内部に取り付けられたものらしく、狭い密室を斜め上から見下ろす構図になっている。","en":"The remaining two feeds came from cameras installed inside separate elevators, each angled down from an upper corner into the cramped car.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r178","rowIndex":178,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　部下にメールで送らせた見取り図で確認をする。売り渡した時点では、この四台がこのホテルの監視カメラのすべてだということになっている。客室や、各階の廊下にはカメラは取り付けられていなかった。","en":"He checked the floor plan his subordinate had sent by email. At the time of the sale, these four were supposedly the only surveillance cameras in the hotel. None had been installed in the guest rooms or the corridors on any floor.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r179","rowIndex":179,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　カメラさえなければ<tips=29>アイス</tips>の力で自由に行き来出来る。最悪一階ずつしらみつぶしに調べることになっても、この能力が機能する限りリスクは低いだろう。もっとも、その時は他人の行為を覗き見することになってしまうから、<tips=28>トーマス</tips>としてはもっと効率的に調べたいところであったが。","en":"As long as there were no cameras, <tips=29>Ice’s</tips> power would let them move freely. Even if, in the worst case, they had to comb through the hotel one floor at a time, the risk would remain low so long as the ability continued to function. That would, however, mean peeping on other people in the act, so <tips=28>Thomas</tips> hoped to investigate more efficiently.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r180","rowIndex":180,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=28>トーマス</tips>は従業員の後ろを通り抜け、まず奥にある事務室兼従業員用休憩室を調べることにした。","en":"<tips=28>Thomas</tips> passed behind the clerk and decided to begin by searching the office and employee break room at the back.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r181","rowIndex":181,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　窓際には事務用の机が置かれ、手前のソファーには仮眠で使うのか毛布が乱雑に折りたたまれていた。その他には、冷蔵庫、金庫、電気ポットなど、オフィス用のものと日常生活用のものが混じり合って設置されている。","en":"A business desk stood by the window. A blanket, perhaps used for naps, lay carelessly folded upon the sofa nearer the door. A refrigerator, safe, electric kettle, and various other objects for office work and daily life shared the space.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r182","rowIndex":182,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=28>トーマス</tips>はまず壁際の棚の前に立ち、そこに並べられたファイルをざっと眺めた。","en":"<tips=28>Thomas</tips> first stood before a shelf against the wall and surveyed the files arranged upon it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r183","rowIndex":183,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その背表紙のラベルにボールペンで書かれた文字を見る限り、アルバイト応募者の履歴書や、従業員の日報など、ごく当たり前の書類しかそこにはしまわれていないようである。下の段の引き出しを開いてみても、机の上に並んだ書類にも、机の引き出しにも怪しいものは何もない。","en":"Judging by the labels written in ballpoint pen upon their spines, they contained nothing more remarkable than résumés from part-time applicants and daily employee reports. The drawers beneath, the papers upon the desk, and the desk drawers themselves likewise held nothing suspicious.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r184","rowIndex":184,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　違法行為でも帳簿のようなものはあるはずだし、その他何でも、何かの手がかりになるものがあれば良かったのだが、見つからない。","en":"Even an illegal operation ought to keep some kind of books. Any clue at all would have been welcome, but he found nothing.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r185","rowIndex":185,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　やはり犯罪の証拠となるようなものは、もっと厳重に扱われているのだろうか？　鍵のかかった引き出しのなかか、金庫のなかか、それとも別の場所にあるのか。データとなってパソコンや記憶媒体のなかにあるという可能性もある。","en":"Perhaps anything that could serve as evidence of a crime was kept under tighter security. It might be inside a locked drawer, in the safe, or somewhere else entirely. It might also be stored as data on the computer or some other storage medium.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r186","rowIndex":186,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　散らかした部屋に立って呆然としていると、廊下側のドアが開き、作業服を着た中年女が顔をタオルで拭いながら入って来た。","en":"As he stood dumbfounded in the office he had thrown into disarray, the corridor door opened. A middle-aged woman in work clothes entered, wiping her face with a towel.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r187","rowIndex":187,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まあ」","en":"“Goodness.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r188","rowIndex":188,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　と、彼女は目を丸くして部屋の惨状に驚いている。","en":"Her eyes widened at the state of the room.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r189","rowIndex":189,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　当然のことだが、二人の姿は見えなくとも散らかった部屋は見えるのだ。","en":"Naturally, she could not perceive Thomas and Ice, but she could see the disorder they had created.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r190","rowIndex":190,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　このまま調査を続けても良かったが、何もしていないのに散らかり続ける部屋を見せて女にショックを与えるのも忍びなかったので、<tips=28>トーマス</tips>は受付に引き返した。","en":"<tips=28>Thomas</tips> could have continued searching. But he could not bring himself to subject the woman to the shock of watching the room grow increasingly disordered without visible cause, so he returned to reception.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r191","rowIndex":191,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　受付の従業員が誰かと言葉を交わしている。","en":"The front-desk clerk was speaking with someone.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r192","rowIndex":192,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　相手はアジア人の若者で、彼は小さな子供を一人連れていた。","en":"The other person was a young Asian man, and he had a small child with him.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r193","rowIndex":193,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼は会話をするだけで、金銭のやりとりをするでも、ルームキーの受け渡しをするでもなく、そのままエレベーターの方へと向かう。","en":"The man did nothing but talk: no money changed hands, no room key was passed over, and then he headed straight for the elevator.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r194","rowIndex":194,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　従業員もパソコンを操作して入室状況などを変更することもなく、元のテレビ鑑賞に戻ってしまう。今の相手は客ではなかったのだ。","en":"The employee made no change to the occupancy display and simply returned to his television. The visitor had not been a guest.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r195","rowIndex":195,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=28>トーマス</tips>は男が乗り込んだエレベーターの模様を映した監視カメラの映像に目をやる。","en":"<tips=28>Thomas</tips> looked toward the surveillance feed from the elevator the man had entered.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r196","rowIndex":196,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　男と子供は二人で並んで立っていた。男の口元が動いているが、子供の顔に動きはない。何か一方的に話しかけている。","en":"The man and child stood side by side. The man’s lips moved, but the child’s face remained still. He appeared to be talking at the child one-sidedly.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r197","rowIndex":197,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして男たちは部屋から出て行った。受付の目の前のエレベーターの電光掲示板を見ると、七階で止まっている。","en":"They left the elevator. The illuminated indicator before reception showed that it had stopped on the seventh floor.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r198","rowIndex":198,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　これは確かめるしかない。","en":"This had to be investigated.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r199","rowIndex":199,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=28>トーマス</tips>は<tips=29>アイス</tips>の手を引いて受付を出かけてから、一旦戻ってモニターの下にあるスイッチに触れた。何度か押していると操作の仕組みがわかったので、二つあるエレベーターの画面に、両方同じエレベーターのカメラ映像を表示させるようにした。これで、もう片方のエレベーターを利用しても姿を記録されることはない。","en":"<tips=28>Thomas</tips> began leading <tips=29>Ice</tips> out of reception, then doubled back and touched the controls beneath the monitor. After several attempts, he understood the mechanism and set both elevator feeds to display the same elevator. They could now use the other one without leaving their image in the recording.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r200","rowIndex":200,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その操作が終わると、モニターの脇のフックにぶら下がった鍵を探って、『客室マスターキー』と書かれたプラスチックタグのついたものを一つポケットに失敬した。","en":"Once the controls were set, he felt through the keys hanging from hooks beside the monitor and helped himself to one with a plastic tag reading “Guest-Room Master Key,” slipping it into his pocket.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r201","rowIndex":201,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして受付を出る。監視カメラの死角に隠れながら、モニターに映らない方のエレベーターの前に辿り着いた。","en":"He left reception. Keeping to the surveillance camera’s blind spot, he reached the elevator whose feed he had removed from the monitor.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r202","rowIndex":202,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　丁度誰かが降りて来るところで、チンと音がなってドアがゆっくりと開く。","en":"Someone happened to be descending. A chime sounded, and the doors slowly opened.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r203","rowIndex":203,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=28>トーマス</tips>は出て来た中年カップルとすれ違うようにエレベーターに入り、『７』の数字を押した。","en":"<tips=28>Thomas</tips> slipped into the elevator past the middle-aged couple who emerged and pressed the button marked 7.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r204","rowIndex":204,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　エレベーターの中には先客の香水の残り香が残っている。<tips=28>トーマス</tips>はそこでふうと溜息をつくと、","en":"The previous occupants had left the fragrance of perfume behind. <tips=28>Thomas</tips> lets out a soft sigh, then says,","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r205","rowIndex":205,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=29>アイス</tips>、子供連れの客を見つけたから、今からそれを追うよ」","en":"“<tips=29>Ice</tips>, I found a guest with a child. We’re going to follow them.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r206","rowIndex":206,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「はい」","en":"“Yes.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r207","rowIndex":207,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=29>アイス</tips>は頷いた。","en":"<tips=29>Ice</tips> nodded.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r208","rowIndex":208,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=28>トーマス</tips>様のことは信じていますが、くれぐれも、無茶はなさらぬよう」","en":"“I trust you, <tips=28>Master Thomas</tips>. But please, whatever you do, don’t be reckless.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r209","rowIndex":209,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「わかってる」","en":"“I understand.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r210","rowIndex":210,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして、エレベーターは七階に到着した。","en":"The elevator arrived at the seventh floor.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r211","rowIndex":211,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　監視カメラを避けて出っ張りの裏に隠れていた時間は実際にはそう長い間ではなかった。","en":"In truth, they had not spent very long hidden behind the protruding section of wall to avoid the camera.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r212","rowIndex":212,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　銃を持った男が通り過ぎたあと、精々一分か二分であろう。<tips=28>トーマス</tips>はカメラに姿を映されても、その時はその時だと開き直り、探索を再開することにした。","en":"Only a minute or two could have passed since the armed man went by. <tips=28>Thomas</tips> decided that if the camera recorded him, then so be it, and resumed the search.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r213","rowIndex":213,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして物陰を出ようとしたところで、携帯電話が胸ポケットのなかで振動した。","en":"Just as he moved to leave cover, his telephone vibrated in his breast pocket.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r214","rowIndex":214,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　部下からのメールを着信している。そこには、ホテルを売り払った者たちのデータがあった。","en":"A message had arrived from his subordinate containing information about the men to whom they had sold the hotel.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r215","rowIndex":215,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　相手は広瀬平太と孝司の兄弟である。年齢は兄の平太が二十五才で、弟の孝司が二十三才。二人は街のチンピラだったが二年前に揃って<tips=17>タイプB</tips>の発症をし、暴力行為や奇異行動を繰り返したため家族に捨てられる。","en":"The buyers were brothers named Heita and Koji Hirose. Heita, the elder, was twenty-five; Koji was twenty-three. Both had been young street toughs before developing <tips=17>Type B</tips> symptoms two years earlier. Repeated violence and bizarre behavior led their family to abandon them.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r216","rowIndex":216,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その後は路地裏をねぐらとして、彼らを古くから知るものから憐れみの小銭などを恵まれたり、ボランティアの炊き出しを与えられるなどして暮らしていたらしい。","en":"Afterward, they apparently made an alleyway their home and survived upon coins offered out of pity by longtime acquaintances and meals distributed by volunteers.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r217","rowIndex":217,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　症状は悪化し続け、三ヶ月前にはもう知人の顔の区別もつかず、言葉もろくに喋れなくなって中空を見ながら笑い、独り言をぶつぶつと呟く姿が目撃されている。典型的な末期症状である。","en":"Their symptoms continued to worsen. Three months earlier, witnesses had seen them unable to distinguish even familiar faces or speak properly, laughing at empty air and muttering to themselves. These were typical terminal-stage symptoms.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r218","rowIndex":218,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それが先月ごろから急に正気に戻って、シャンとして受け答えなどをするようになった。そして、事業を始めるといって<tips=27>廖</tips>たちが所有するホテルを買い取ったのが十二日前のことだ。","en":"Then, around the beginning of the previous month, they abruptly returned to their senses and began carrying themselves smartly and answering people coherently. Twelve days ago, saying they intended to start a business, they purchased the hotel owned by <tips=27>Liao</tips> and his people.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r219","rowIndex":219,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その資金源などは不明だ。彼の家族は貧しく、資産家とつき合いがあるとも思えない境遇であり、たとえヤミ金であっても彼らのような経歴にこれだけの大金を出すとは思えない。","en":"The source of the money was unknown. Their family was poor, and their circumstances made any relationship with a wealthy patron unlikely. Even an illegal lender would not ordinarily advance such a sum to men with their history.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r220","rowIndex":220,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　添付された画像によると、さきほど子供を連れて受付に来ていたのは兄の平太のようだ。","en":"According to the attached photograph, the man who had brought the child to reception appeared to be the elder brother, Heita.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r221","rowIndex":221,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ほんの僅かな時間の間に調べたデータにしては詳細だった。そして、これは<tips=28>トーマス</tips>が指示したわけではなかったが、部下が察してくれたらしく、ホテルに人間を向かわせているとも書いてある。","en":"The information was remarkably detailed for something researched in so little time. <tips=28>Thomas</tips> had given no such order, but his subordinate had apparently anticipated the need and was already sending men to the hotel.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r222","rowIndex":222,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=28>トーマス</tips>はメールの返信で、それらの人員にホテルの出入り口を見張りながら待機するよう指示を出してから、携帯電話をしまった。","en":"<tips=28>Thomas</tips> replied by email, ordering those men to watch the hotel entrances and remain on standby, then put away his phone.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r223","rowIndex":223,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　自分はいい部下に囲まれている。","en":"He truly was surrounded by excellent subordinates.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r224","rowIndex":224,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　若きリーダーは自分の幸運に感謝しながら、<tips=29>アイス</tips>の手を引いて物陰を出た。","en":"Grateful for his good fortune, the young leader led <tips=29>Ice</tips> from cover by the hand.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r225","rowIndex":225,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼は廊下を進むと、先ほどからやたらとゴトゴト音がする部屋の前に立ち、受付から持って来たマスターキーを取り出した。","en":"He proceeded down the corridor and stopped before the room that had been producing so much noise. He took out the master key from reception.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r226","rowIndex":226,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　鍵穴に差し込み、ガチャリと捻ったとき、ドアの向こうからどっと笑い声が聞こえて動作を止める。","en":"He inserted it into the lock. As he turned it with a click, a burst of laughter from beyond the door stopped his hand.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r227","rowIndex":227,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　笑い声は、およそこういったホテルには似つかわしくない、いくつもの子供たちの声であった。実に楽しそうな雰囲気である。","en":"It was the sound of several children laughing, utterly out of place in a hotel of this kind. They sounded genuinely delighted.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r228","rowIndex":228,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=28>トーマス</tips>は戸惑いながらドアを開ける。","en":"Puzzled, <tips=28>Thomas</tips> opened the door.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r229","rowIndex":229,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その向こうは広々としたワンルームとなっている。廊下とはうって変わって明るい場所だ。大きな窓からは日差しが差し込み、健康的な光が室内を満たしている。","en":"Beyond the door was a spacious studio room. In complete contrast with the corridor, it was bright: sunlight streamed through a large window, filling the room with a wholesome glow.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r230","rowIndex":230,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　部屋の手前にはテーブルやらソファーやらがあったが、その奥のスペースはまるで修学旅行のようにいくつもの布団が敷き詰められてあり、その上で子供たちが輪になってカードゲームのようなものに興じていた。彼らのまわりには、ゲーム機や、漫画本、飲みかけの清涼飲料水のペットボトルなどが散らばっている。","en":"A table and sofa stood near the door. Beyond them, the floor was packed with futons like sleeping quarters on a school trip. Children sat in a circle on top of them, absorbed in some kind of card game. Game consoles, comic books, and half-finished bottles of soft drinks lay scattered around them.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r231","rowIndex":231,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そのなかには一人だけ、大人が混じっていた。彼の顔は、先ほど送られたメールに添付されていた画像で見ていた。それは弟である広瀬孝司だった。彼も他の子供たちと同じように、黄色い歯をむきだした笑顔でカードをめくったりしている。","en":"Only one adult sat among them. Thomas recognized his face from the photograph attached to the message: Koji Hirose, the younger brother. Like the children, he bared yellow teeth in a broad smile as he turned over cards.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r232","rowIndex":232,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　確かに子供たちはいる。が、想像していたよりもずっと明るく楽しげな光景である。<tips=28>トーマス</tips>は若干面くらいながら部屋の中に足を踏み入れ、そして、テーブルの上に広げられた書類に視線を落とした。","en":"The children were indeed here, but the scene was far brighter and more cheerful than <tips=28>Thomas</tips> had imagined. Slightly bewildered, he stepped into the room and lowered his eyes toward the documents spread across the table.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r233","rowIndex":233,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　子供の顔をアップにした画像と、全身を写し取った画像が上の方に掲載されており、そして他のスペースには、名前、生年月日、身長と体重、使用可能な言語、両親の人種と職業、性格や得意な運動など、それはまるで、車やパソコンを買うカタログの様に、ことこまかいスペックが書かれていた。いや、実際カタログなのだろう。ここで本当に人身売買が行われているのだとすれば。","en":"Close-up photographs of a child’s face and full body occupied the top of each page. The remaining space listed the child’s name, date of birth, height and weight, languages spoken, parents’ ethnicities and occupations, personality, sports they excelled at, and every other conceivable specification in minute detail—like a catalog for buying a car or computer. No. If human trafficking was truly taking place here, that was exactly what these documents were.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r234","rowIndex":234,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そうしたカタログは何枚もあり、明らかに今この部屋にいる子供の数よりも多かった。すでに売れた子供のカタログもあるのかもしれない。","en":"There were many such catalog sheets, clearly more than the number of children in the room. Some might belong to children already sold.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r235","rowIndex":235,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　カタログのいくつかには、クリップでメモが止めてある。そこには人名と、電話番号、メールアドレス、そして￥マークのついた金額のような数字がボールペンの文字で書かれていた。","en":"Notes had been clipped to several sheets. Written on them in ballpoint pen were names, telephone numbers, email addresses, and numbers that appeared to be monetary amounts, each preceded by a yen sign.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r236","rowIndex":236,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　これは購入者の情報だろうか？","en":"Was this information about buyers?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r237","rowIndex":237,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"（やっぱり！）","en":"(I knew it!)","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r238","rowIndex":238,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　他には、金の出入りを記録する帳簿のような書類もあった。<tips=9>Y地区</tips>でなら一生遊んで暮らせそうなほど、大きな金が動いている。","en":"Other documents resembled ledgers recording money coming in and going out. The sums changing hands were large enough to live a life of leisure in <tips=9>Y District</tips> from then on.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r239","rowIndex":239,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そうした書類を一枚手にとって見ると、下には紙幣の束が無造作に転がっている。","en":"When he picked up one of the pages, he found bundles of banknotes lying carelessly beneath it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r240","rowIndex":240,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"（落ち着け、落ち着くんだ……）","en":"(Stay calm. Calm down...)","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r241","rowIndex":241,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=28>トーマス</tips>は緊張で鼓動が早くなる自分にそう言い聞かせながら、携帯電話を取り出すと、その書類や札束を撮影し、そして遊んでいる子供と広瀬孝司の姿も同じように複数撮った。","en":"<tips=28>Thomas</tips> tried to steady his racing heart. He took out his phone and photographed the documents and money, then took several pictures of the children at play and Koji Hirose.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r242","rowIndex":242,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　画像を確認すると孝司たちの方はぼやけていたので、勇気を出して近づき、すぐ目の前から彼ら一人一人の顔や、今居る場所がわかるよう構図を考えながら撮影をした。","en":"The images of Koji and the children were blurred. Summoning his courage, Thomas approached until he stood directly before them, then carefully composed photographs showing each face and enough of the room to establish their location.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r243","rowIndex":243,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いてっ」","en":"“Ow!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r244","rowIndex":244,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　途中子供が思わぬ動きをしてトーマスにぶつかり、ひどく肝を冷やしたが、子供は不審げにきょろきょろと辺りを見回すだけで、部屋に入り込んだ<tips=28>トーマス</tips>と<tips=29>アイス</tips>には気がつかない。","en":"Along the way, a child moved unexpectedly and collided with Thomas, giving him a terrible fright. The child merely glanced around in confusion, unaware of <tips=28>Thomas</tips> and <tips=29>Ice</tips>, who had slipped into the room.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r245","rowIndex":245,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どうした？」","en":"“What happened?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r246","rowIndex":246,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　孝司が笑いながら訊ねると、","en":"Koji asks with a laugh,","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r247","rowIndex":247,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なんでもないみたい」","en":"“I guess it was nothing.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r248","rowIndex":248,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　子供はそう答え、またゲームに戻った。","en":"With that answer, the child returns to the game.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r249","rowIndex":249,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"（よし、ちゃんと出来てるぞ。やり残しはないか？　こういう緊張している場面って、自分でやったつもりでもうまく出来ていなかったりするからな……）","en":"(Good. It’s working properly. Have I missed anything? When you’re this tense, it’s easy to think you did something properly when you actually didn’t...)","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r250","rowIndex":250,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　トーマスはこの部屋ですべきことはもうないか、心の中で何度も確認してから、そっと部屋を出る。これだけでも彼らの行為を証明するのには充分な証拠となるが、しかし<tips=28>トーマス</tips>は調査をこれで終わりにするつもりはなかった。どうしても、気にかかることがあるのだ。","en":"Thomas repeatedly ran through everything in his mind, checking whether anything remained to be done in the room, then quietly left. The material he had gathered was already sufficient to prove what the brothers were doing. Nevertheless, <tips=28>Thomas</tips> did not intend to end the investigation there. Something continued to trouble him.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r251","rowIndex":251,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　部屋には兄の平太がいなかった。そして、彼が連れていた子供も。","en":"The elder brother, Heita, was absent. So was the child he had brought upstairs.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r252","rowIndex":252,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　兄弟を断罪するのが目的だけなら、これ以上の証拠は必要ないが、兄が何をしているか気になる。いやな胸騒ぎがするのだ。","en":"If Thomas merely wanted the brothers condemned, he needed no further evidence. But he wanted to know what the elder brother was doing. An unpleasant premonition gnawed at him.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r253","rowIndex":253,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　他の部屋も見ておかなくてはならない。","en":"He had to examine the other rooms.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r254","rowIndex":254,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=28>トーマス</tips>はマスターキーを握りしめて一つずつ点検を開始する。","en":"Clutching the master key, <tips=28>Thomas</tips> began checking the rooms one by one.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r255","rowIndex":255,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　すぐとなりの部屋は、照明が切れた真っ暗な部屋で、元々となりの部屋にあったものと思われるベッドなどが乱雑に詰め込まれていた。","en":"The room next door was pitch-dark with the lights off. Beds and other furniture that had presumably once stood in the adjoining room were now piled haphazardly inside.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r256","rowIndex":256,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そこには誰もいない。ここで一旦能力を解除し、<tips=29>アイス</tips>にこれまでの経緯を説明する。彼女は黙って頷き、<tips=28>トーマス</tips>の行動に従う意志を示した。","en":"No one was there. <tips=29>Ice</tips> dropped the ability for the moment, and Thomas explained everything that had happened. She nodded silently, indicating that she intended to follow <tips=28>Thomas’s</tips> lead.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r257","rowIndex":257,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　再び能力を発動させるとゆっくりと部屋を出て、さらにそのとなりの部屋に足を踏み入れる。","en":"Once Ice reactivates the ability, they slowly leave the room and enter the next one along.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r258","rowIndex":258,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そこは広瀬兄弟のどちらかの居住する部屋らしく、衣服や食べかけの弁当が散らばっていた。ここにも何もないようだ。","en":"It appeared to serve as living quarters for one of the Hirose brothers; clothes and half-eaten boxed meals lay scattered around it. There seemed to be nothing here either.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r259","rowIndex":259,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そしてさらに次の部屋で、遂に兄の広瀬平太の姿を見つけた。","en":"In the room beyond that, they finally found the elder brother, Heita Hirose.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r260","rowIndex":260,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その部屋のベッドや内装は、ホテルの設備そのままの普通の客室であったが、まわりにはいくつもの三脚が立てられ、撮影用の照明や、レフ板、そしてベッドの方を向いて固定されたハンディカメラが設置されている。","en":"The bed and furnishings were those of an ordinary hotel room, but several tripods stood around it. Film lights, reflectors, and a handheld video camera fixed in place and aimed toward the bed had been set up.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r261","rowIndex":261,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　暗い部屋のなか、そこだけ明るく照らし出されたベッドの上には先ほど下で見た肌の浅黒い子供がうつろな表情で座っていた。その目の前で広瀬平太がビデオカメラを弄っている。","en":"Upon the brightly illuminated bed in the dark room sat the brown-skinned child Thomas had seen downstairs, wearing a vacant expression. Heita Hirose stood before the child, adjusting the video camera.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r262","rowIndex":262,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　子供は髪が短くてわからなかったが、良く見ると女の子のようであった。","en":"The child’s short hair had made it hard to tell at first, but on closer inspection, she appeared to be a girl.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r263","rowIndex":263,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　どうもここはスタジオのようであるが、わざわざこんな場所を用意するとなれば、普通の撮影ではないのは明白だ。","en":"The room was plainly some kind of studio. No ordinary filming would require the preparation of a place like this.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r264","rowIndex":264,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ベッドと反対側の壁際には、いくつものモニターや編集機材が設置されている。","en":"Several monitors and pieces of editing equipment stood against the wall opposite the bed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r265","rowIndex":265,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=28>トーマス</tips>は近づき、作業台のまわりに散らばっていた写真の一枚を手に取った。そこには、白人の少女が裸で男と絡み合う姿が写し出されている。胸が痛くなる。","en":"<tips=28>Thomas</tips> approached the workbench and picked up one of the photographs scattered around it. It showed a naked white girl intertwined with a man. His heart ached.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r266","rowIndex":266,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「リーサ、薬を飲むか？　少しラクになる」","en":"“Lisa, do you want a pill? It’ll make things a little easier.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r267","rowIndex":267,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　平太がそう話しかけて白い錠剤を差し出すと、少女は無言で首を横に振る。","en":"When Heita offered her a white tablet, the girl silently shook her head.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r268","rowIndex":268,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「金は取らないぞ。サービスだ」","en":"“I won’t charge you. It’s on the house.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r269","rowIndex":269,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　無理矢理押しつけるように錠剤を手渡すと、少女は手のひらの上のそれをしばらく見つめてから、手慣れた仕草で口に放り込み、脇に転がっていたボトルの口を開けて直接唇をつけて水を流し込んだ。","en":"He forced the tablet into her hand. The girl stared at it for a time, then tossed it into her mouth with a practiced motion, opened the bottle lying beside her, and drank directly from it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r270","rowIndex":270,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「OKそれでいい。ちょっとの間だけ我慢すれば、金を持って帰ってお父さんとお母さんを喜ばせられる」","en":"“Okay, that’s good. Endure it for a little while, and then you can take the money home and make your mother and father happy.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r271","rowIndex":271,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　リーサと呼ばれた少女は無表情にその言葉を聞いている。","en":"The girl called Lisa listened without expression.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r272","rowIndex":272,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=28>トーマス</tips>はもうこの場面がどういうものか完全に理解した。今からここでこの少女のポルノビデオを撮影しようというのだ。","en":"<tips=28>Thomas</tips> now understood completely what this scene was. They were about to film a pornographic video of the girl, right here.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r273","rowIndex":273,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼は思わず声をあげそうになった。なんて悲しいことをしようとしているのだろう？　少女が冷淡に受け入れようとしているのが、なおさら絶望的だ。彼女にとってこれはごくあたりまえの現実なのだ。泣いたり騒いだりするようなものではないのだ。","en":"A cry nearly escaped him. What a terribly sad thing they were about to do. The girl’s detached acceptance made it more hopeless still. To her, this was simply ordinary reality—not something to cry or make a fuss about.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r274","rowIndex":274,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　少女の顔つきはまだ幼いのに、そこに浮かんだ表情はもうすべてを失った大人のものである。","en":"Her face remained that of a small child, but its expression belonged to an adult who had already lost everything.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r275","rowIndex":275,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　この街にはこういう顔をした子供が多い。それを見るたび<tips=28>トーマス</tips>は息苦しくなる。","en":"Many children in this city wore faces like hers. The sight left <tips=28>Thomas</tips> unable to breathe.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r276","rowIndex":276,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"（僕は彼らのような苦しみもなく育ってしまったんだ。ただ生まれが違うというだけで）","en":"(I grew up without any of the suffering they endured, for no reason except that I was born into different circumstances.)","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r277","rowIndex":277,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　父と母は離婚した。でもどちらも自分を愛し、母は無理矢理自分をアメリカまでつれて行ったし、父親はそのあとも何度も母を説得して呼び戻した。どちらの家に居るときも、両親は自分を溺愛してくれていた。","en":"His mother and father had divorced, but both loved him. His mother had forcibly taken him all the way to America, and afterward his father repeatedly tried to persuade her to return. Whichever home Thomas occupied, the parent there doted upon him.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r278","rowIndex":278,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　父も母も世間での評判は良くなかったけれど、それでも自分に対しては特別に優しかった。父の<tips=27>廖</tips>は、街を追放された今でも週に一度は連絡をしてきて、「元気にやってるか？」と心配したり、「<tips=2>阿亮</tips>とうまくいっていないなら、お父さんが帰ってやっつけてやる」なんて、本気だか冗談だかわからないことを言う。","en":"Neither possessed a good reputation in the wider world, but both had always treated him with exceptional kindness. Even now, exiled from the city, his father, <tips=27>Liao</tips>, called once a week to ask, ‘Are you doing all right?’ or say, ‘If things aren’t working out with <tips=2>Ah Leung</tips>, your father will come back and beat him up for you.’ Thomas could never tell how much was joke and how much sincerity.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r279","rowIndex":279,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それが<tips=28>トーマス</tips>にとっての家族というものだった。","en":"That was what family meant to <tips=28>Thomas</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r280","rowIndex":280,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=9>Y地区</tips>の子供たちはどうしてなんだろう？　寂しそうな顔をした子供ばかりだ。親が子供を売り、子供が親を時に殺す。それが貧しさというものなのだろうか。でも、それだけではないように思う。","en":"Why were the children of <tips=9>Y District</tips> like this? They all seemed to wear such lonely faces. Parents sold their children, and children sometimes killed their parents. Was that what poverty meant? And yet he felt there had to be more to it than that.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r281","rowIndex":281,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"（たとえば<tips=2>阿亮</tips>だってそうだ）","en":"(Even <tips=2>Ah Leung</tips>, for example.)","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r282","rowIndex":282,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=81>龍頭</tips>の息子という立派な身分だけど、親戚の家に預けられて、父親とはほとんど会うことがなかったし、母親は<tips=17>タイプB</tips>で、忙しい父や<tips=17>タイプB</tips>を嫌悪する親戚たちのかわりに彼は自らその面倒をみたという。<tips=17>タイプB</tips>発作で精神をわずらった母の面倒をみるというのはなんて過酷な運命なんだろう！　<tips=2>阿亮</tips>の強さというのはそこから来ているのかもしれない。","en":"He enjoyed the privileged standing of the <tips=81>Longtou’s</tips> son, yet had been entrusted to relatives and rarely saw his father. Thomas had been told that Leung’s mother was a <tips=17>Type B</tips>, and that in place of his busy father and the relatives who despised <tips=17>Type Bs</tips>, Leung had personally cared for her. What a cruel fate it must have been to care for a mother whose <tips=17>Type B</tips> episodes had left her mentally ill. Perhaps <tips=2>Ah Leung’s</tips> strength came from that experience.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r283","rowIndex":283,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　こうして可哀想な少女を見ていると、<tips=28>トーマス</tips>は何か訳のわからないものに打ちのめされたような気持ちになり、涙がとめどもなくあふれてしまう。","en":"The sight of the unfortunate girl struck <tips=28>Thomas</tips> with some incomprehensible force. Tears poured from his eyes.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r284","rowIndex":284,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして、世界からこんな可哀想な子供が一人もいなくなって、みな幸福にならなければいけないと、強く思うのだ。","en":"He felt with sudden intensity that not one child this miserable should remain in the world—that every one of them had to become happy.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r285","rowIndex":285,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　広瀬はカメラのチェックをしているらしい。背面のモニターを見ながら画質の調整をしていた。","en":"Heita appeared to be checking the camera. Watching its rear monitor, he adjusted the image quality.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r286","rowIndex":286,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そしてそのまま、くるりと後ろに振り返る。どうやらそこに置いてあった飲みかけの缶ビールを取ろうとしたようなのだが、その時彼はおかしなものを見つけてしまった。","en":"Then he turned around. He had apparently meant to retrieve the partly finished can of beer behind him. Instead, he discovered something strange.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r287","rowIndex":287,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　モニターのなかに、手を繋いで目から涙を流す白人の青年と、顔を半分髪の毛で隠したアジア人の若い女が映っているのである。","en":"The monitor showed a white young man with tears streaming from his eyes, holding hands with a young Asian woman whose hair concealed half her face.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r288","rowIndex":288,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　驚いて顔を上げても、そこには誰もいない。","en":"Heita looked up in shock, but no one stood there.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r289","rowIndex":289,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　目をぱちくりさせてもう一度カメラのモニターを見ると、確かにそこに人が映っているというのに。","en":"He blinked repeatedly and looked at the camera monitor again. The two people were unquestionably present upon the screen.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r290","rowIndex":290,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　広瀬は動揺して後ずさる。何度目の前のその空間を見ても、誰もいないのだ。","en":"Shaken, Heita stepped backward. No matter how often he looked at the space directly before him, it remained empty.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r291","rowIndex":291,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　モニターのなかにしか見えないその青年は、ジャケットの胸元に手を入れて、拳銃を取り出すとこちらに向けた。","en":"The young man visible only on the monitor reached inside his jacket, drew a pistol, and aimed it at Heita.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r292","rowIndex":292,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あなたは広瀬平太だね」","en":"“You are Heita Hirose, aren’t you?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r293","rowIndex":293,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その声と共に、<tips=29>アイス</tips>の能力は効果を失って二人は姿を現す。","en":"As the voice spoke, <tips=29>Ice’s</tips> ability ceased to operate, and the pair appeared.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r294","rowIndex":294,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「騒いではいけない。僕は<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>の<tips=28>トーマス・リャオ</tips>。<tips=27>廖志明</tips>の長男と言えばわかるかい？」","en":"“Don’t make a sound. I’m <tips=28>Thomas Liao</tips> of <tips=7>YS</tips>. The name <tips=27>Liao Chi-ming</tips> means something to you, doesn’t it? I’m his eldest son.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r295","rowIndex":295,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　広瀬は突然のことに混乱してしまい、カメラを持ったまま呆然とその場に立ち尽くしている。","en":"Overwhelmed by the sudden turn of events, Heita stands frozen in place, still holding the camera.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r296","rowIndex":296,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「きみら兄弟がやろうとしていることは、はっきりとこの目で見させて貰った。見逃すことは出来ない。変な気を起こしたらいけないよ。きみは本物のギャングのボスの前にいるんだ」","en":"“I’ve seen with my own eyes exactly what you and your brother are trying to do. I can’t overlook it. Don’t try anything foolish. You’re standing in front of a real gang boss.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r297","rowIndex":297,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=28>トーマス</tips>はそう言って目を細める。","en":"<tips=28>Thomas</tips> narrowed his eyes.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r298","rowIndex":298,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　目のまわりはまだ涙で濡れていたが、もう興奮はしていなかった。人に拳銃を向けるのは初めてだが、泣いたせいで、さほど緊張しないのは有り難い。","en":"The skin around Thomas’s eyes remained wet with tears, but his agitation had passed. This was his first time pointing a gun at another person, yet having cried left him unexpectedly calm—a circumstance for which he was grateful.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r299","rowIndex":299,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　隣の<tips=29>アイス</tips>はもう目を見開いており、彼の濡れた横顔を見ている。もう能力もとけており、手を繋いでいる必要はないのだが、彼はそれには気がつかず今も握りしめたままだった。その手のひらが汗だくになっている。","en":"<tips=29>Ice</tips> has opened her eyes and is studying his tear-wet profile. The effect of her ability has already dissolved, so they no longer need to hold hands, but Thomas has not noticed and continues gripping hers. His palm is drenched in sweat.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r300","rowIndex":300,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=29>アイス</tips>は何も言わずに視線を辺りに走らせ、素早く状況を確認すると自分の拳銃を抜いた。","en":"Without a word, <tips=29>Ice</tips> swept her gaze through the room, assessed the situation rapidly, and drew her own pistol.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r301","rowIndex":301,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まず話を聞こう。きみと弟はスラムから子供を連れて来て、ポルノを撮影したり、街の外の人間に売り飛ばしている。……これは間違いがないね？」","en":"“First, I want to hear your side of it. You and your brother bring children here from the slums, film pornography of them, and sell them to people outside the city. ...I have that right, don’t I?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r302","rowIndex":302,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　広瀬はまだ硬直がとけず、ぎょろりと目を剥いたまま黙っている。","en":"Still rigid, Heita stared with bulging eyes and said nothing.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r303","rowIndex":303,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「僕は向こうの部屋で遊んでいる子供たちや、売買の書類も確認している。言い逃れは出来ないよ」","en":"“I have seen the children playing in the other room and checked the documents recording the sales. There is no way for you to talk your way out of this.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r304","rowIndex":304,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ち、違う」","en":"“Th-that isn’t true.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"広瀬平太","displayName":"Heita Hirose","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r305","rowIndex":305,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「何が違うの？　あなたたち兄弟は子供を食い物にしてる。それが事実だよ」","en":"“What isn’t true? You and your brother are preying upon children. That is a fact.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r306","rowIndex":306,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=28>トーマス</tips>は相手を見つめて、いつものおっとりとした口調ながらも彼なりの憤りを込めてはっきりと言った。","en":"<tips=28>Thomas</tips> looks the man in the eye and speaks plainly. His tone remains as mild as ever, but it carries all the indignation he knows how to muster.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r307","rowIndex":307,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「違うんだ。ほらっ、この怪我を見ろ！　この子は毎晩のように<tips=59>暗闇通り</tips>に立って客を取っていた。親の命令でだ。だけど、この撮影を一回やれば三ヶ月は客を取らないで済むだけの金が手に入る」","en":"“You’re wrong. Look—look at these injuries! This girl was out on <tips=59>Darkness Street</tips> seeing clients almost every night because her parents ordered her to. But one shoot here will earn enough money that she won’t have to do that again for three months.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"広瀬平太","displayName":"Heita Hirose","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r308","rowIndex":308,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　広瀬は少女の手を掴んで、その腕についた痣を見せた。","en":"Heita seized the girl’s hand and displayed the bruises upon her arm.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r309","rowIndex":309,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それに、向こうの部屋の子供たちだって、人身売買なんてもんじゃない。ただ、養子が欲しい金持ちに紹介してやっているだけだ。子供たちだって、美味しいものが沢山食べられると聞いて大喜びしているし、親だって大金が手に入る。おれたちは良いことをしてやってるんだよ」","en":"“And the children in the other room aren’t being trafficked. We’re only introducing them to rich people who want to adopt. The children are delighted because they’ve heard they’ll have plenty of delicious food, and their parents receive a fortune. We’re helping them.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"広瀬平太","displayName":"Heita Hirose","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r310","rowIndex":310,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ポルノに関しては難しい問題だね」","en":"“The pornography is a harder question.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r311","rowIndex":311,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=28>トーマス</tips>は顔をしかめる。","en":"<tips=28>Thomas</tips> frowned.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r312","rowIndex":312,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そ、そうだろう？」","en":"“Y-you see?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"広瀬平太","displayName":"Heita Hirose","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r313","rowIndex":313,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「でも、少なくとも養子縁組は間違ってるよ。だって、本当に養子が欲しくて、育てる資格がある人間だったら、正規の手続きをして施設の子を貰うでしょう。なのに、どうしてこの街の、戸籍もないような、書類上存在しないことになってる子供を大金払って買うんだと思う？　善意の人もいるかもしれないけれど、そうでない訳ありの客がいることくらい想像出来るはずじゃないか。きみは誤魔化しを言っているだけだ」","en":"“But the adoptions are wrong, at the very least. Anyone who genuinely wanted to adopt and was fit to raise a child would go through the proper legal channels and adopt one from an institution. Why do you think these clients pay enormous sums to buy children from this city—children with no family registry who do not even exist on paper? Some may have good intentions. But surely you can imagine that others have reasons for avoiding the law. You’re only making excuses.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r314","rowIndex":314,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　広瀬は反論できずに黙り込んでしまう。","en":"Unable to answer, Heita fell silent.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r315","rowIndex":315,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"（……この人、あまりこういう仕事に慣れていないのかな？）","en":"(Perhaps he isn’t accustomed to this kind of work.)","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r316","rowIndex":316,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=28>トーマス</tips>の知っているギャングたちというものは、こんなに簡単にうなだれたりはしない。","en":"The gangsters <tips=28>Thomas</tips> knew did not hang their heads so easily.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r317","rowIndex":317,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　素人なのだろうか？","en":"Was he an amateur?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r318","rowIndex":318,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それに、今言ったのが本当に彼の考えなら、これくらいの反論で諦めてしまうものなのだろうか？","en":"And if he truly believed what he had just said, would one small rebuttal really make him give up so easily?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r319","rowIndex":319,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ねえ、一つ聞きたいんだけど、今の意見、誰かから聞いたの？　なんだか、きみの意見じゃないような気がするんだ」","en":"“Hey, let me ask you something. Did you hear that opinion from somebody else? Somehow, it doesn’t feel like an opinion of your own.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r320","rowIndex":320,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それは……」","en":"“That...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"広瀬平太","displayName":"Heita Hirose","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r321","rowIndex":321,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　広瀬は一旦口ごもったが、すぐにまた言葉を続ける。","en":"Heita falters for a moment, then quickly continues.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r322","rowIndex":322,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「女にそう言われたんだよ」","en":"“That’s what a woman told me.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"広瀬平太","displayName":"Heita Hirose","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r323","rowIndex":323,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「女？」","en":"“A woman?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r324","rowIndex":324,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そう、路上で転がっていたおれたちに『<tips=46>ネオ・ローズ</tips>』を注射してくれたのもそいつだ。そう、何もかもあの女が悪いんだよ！」","en":"“Yes. She was the one who injected us with <tips=46>Neo Rose</tips> when we were lying in the street. That’s right—everything is that woman’s fault!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"広瀬平太","displayName":"Heita Hirose","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r325","rowIndex":325,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　広瀬の顔は感情の高ぶりによって茹でたように赤くなった。","en":"As his emotions surge, Heita’s face turns boiled red.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r326","rowIndex":326,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「頼んでもいないのに、おれたちに薬を使って、正気に戻しやがった！　おかげでおれたちは、人に恵んで貰うことも出来なくなった。かといって、今更まともな仕事も出来やしねえ。それがわかってて、そそのかしたんだ。……おれたちみたいなクズでも、みんなのためになって、誰よりも金持ちになる仕事があるって」","en":"“We never asked her to use that drug on us, but she did it anyway and brought us back to our senses! Because of her, people stopped giving us handouts. But by then we were in no shape to hold down an honest job, either. She knew all that, and she tempted us. ...Said there was a job even scum like us could do—one that would help everybody and make us richer than anyone.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"広瀬平太","displayName":"Heita Hirose","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r327","rowIndex":327,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どんな女なんだい？」","en":"“What sort of woman was she?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r328","rowIndex":328,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「若い女だ。黒い髪のアジア人で、日本語と英語を使ってた。良い服を着て、金を沢山持ってるみたいだった。おれたちに最初の資金を提供してくれたのもそいつだ」","en":"“Young. Asian, with black hair. She spoke Japanese and English. She wore nice clothes and looked like she had plenty of money. She was the one who gave us our start-up money, too.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"広瀬平太","displayName":"Heita Hirose","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r329","rowIndex":329,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　どうにもおだやかじゃない話になってきた。","en":"The account was taking an alarming turn.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r330","rowIndex":330,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「資金を……その女のこと、詳しく教えてくれないか？」","en":"“The money... Could you tell me more about this woman?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r331","rowIndex":331,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「わからない。連絡先は知らせずに、いつも向こうから会いに来る。金のやりとりも、現金を手渡されただけで何の書類もなかった。名前さえ名乗ろうとしない」","en":"“I don’t know. She never gave us any way to contact her—she always comes to us. She handed over the money in cash, and there wasn’t any paperwork. She wouldn’t even tell us her name.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"広瀬平太","displayName":"Heita Hirose","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r332","rowIndex":332,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「その女が、このビルを買い取って、この仕事をやれと指示したのかい？」","en":"“Was she the one who told you to buy this building and go into this business?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r333","rowIndex":333,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そう、そうだ。おれたちはあの女にそそのかされただけなんだよ！　はじめは子供をつかって稼いで……それで金が出来たら、ホテルの営業をやめてビル全体を娯楽施設にするんだって。昔にあった、<tips=18>ローズ・クラブ</tips>みたいな……。子供を売る相手の見つけ方とか、ビデオを市場に流すやりかたとか、全部あの女から教わったんだ！　おれたちだけじゃ、とてもこんな仕事が出来るわけないじゃないか。出鱈目を言ってるんじゃなくて、その女が主謀者なんだよ。おれたちはただ、言いなりになっただけで……」","en":"“Yes, yes! We were only ever talked into it by that woman! She told us to start by making money off the children... then once we had enough, we’d close the hotel and turn the whole building into an entertainment complex. Like the old <tips=18>Rose Club</tips>... She taught us everything—how to find buyers for the children, how to put the videos on the market! There’s no way we could ever have pulled off an operation like this by ourselves. I’m not talking nonsense: that woman was behind it all. We just did whatever she told us...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"広瀬平太","displayName":"Heita Hirose","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r334","rowIndex":334,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　広瀬は昂ぶって、涙を流し始める。","en":"Overcome by emotion, Heita began to weep.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r335","rowIndex":335,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「こんなはずじゃなかったんだ。どうしておれたちを正気にしたんだ？　あのまま狂っていた方が、罪を犯さずに済んだのに……」","en":"“It wasn’t supposed to be like this. Why did she bring us back to our senses? If we’d stayed mad, we never would have ended up committing these crimes...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"広瀬平太","displayName":"Heita Hirose","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r336","rowIndex":336,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　嗚咽をはじめた広瀬を見て、<tips=28>トーマス</tips>は溜息をつく。","en":"Watching Heita dissolve into sobs, <tips=28>Thomas</tips> sighs.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r337","rowIndex":337,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「このビルは僕ら<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>のテリトリーのなかにある。きみと弟がやっていたポルノビデオの制作は我々の領域をおかしており、しかも子供の人身売買は僕らがもっとも嫌っているものだ。それくらい、この街で育ったなら知っているよね？」","en":"“This building stands inside <tips=7>YS</tips> territory. The pornographic videos you and your brother were making violated our turf—and child trafficking is the one thing we despise above all else. You grew up in this city, so you knew that much, didn’t you?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r338","rowIndex":338,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「知っているさ！　知っているけど、そんなの守られてないじゃないか。おれたちだって、子供のころは大人たちに食い物にされて来たんだ。どうして、大人になったからといって、我慢しなくちゃいけないんだい？　あんたにおれたちの気持ちがわかるのか？」","en":"“Of course I knew! But nobody respects that! Adults preyed on us when we were children, too. Why should we have to restrain ourselves just because we’re adults now? Do you have any idea how we feel?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"広瀬平太","displayName":"Heita Hirose","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r339","rowIndex":339,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　広瀬は涙目でそう叫ぶ。","en":"Heita shouted the words through his tears.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r340","rowIndex":340,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=28>トーマス</tips>は口ごもってしまう。","en":"<tips=28>Thomas</tips> found himself at a loss for words.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r341","rowIndex":341,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"（確かに、僕には彼らの気持ちがわからない）","en":"(It’s true. I don’t understand how they feel.)","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r342","rowIndex":342,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼も子供の時は被害者であり続けたのだろう。それが彼らにとって当たり前だったのだ。だから、大人になってそれをするのも『仕方ない』ことで、何が悪いのかわからないかもしれない。","en":"He, too, must have spent his childhood as a victim. To them, that was simply normal. Perhaps that is why, once they became adults, doing the same themselves seemed like something that ‘couldn’t be helped,’ and they no longer understood what was wrong with it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r343","rowIndex":343,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=28>トーマス</tips>は、隣の部屋で子供と楽しそうに遊んでいた男の姿や、今この部屋で少女に気遣いを見せていた広瀬の態度を思い出す。","en":"<tips=28>Thomas</tips> remembers the man happily playing with the children in the next room, and the concern Heita had shown for the girl in this room only moments before.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r344","rowIndex":344,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして、口を開いた。","en":"Then he spoke.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r345","rowIndex":345,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「通例通りならば、こういうケースだと極めて重い罰が与えられる。<tips=81>龍頭</tips>に報告すれば、きみらは間違いなく殺されるだろう」","en":"“If we followed the usual procedure, a case like this would carry an exceptionally severe punishment. If I reported you to the <tips=81>Longtou</tips>, the two of you would undoubtedly be killed.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r346","rowIndex":346,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　広瀬はうなだれたまま無反応に聞いている。","en":"Heita listens without reacting, his head still bowed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r347","rowIndex":347,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「しかし、きみの話にも同情出来るところがある。ある意味きみらもこの街の犠牲者と言えるだろう。これから僕が言う約束を守ってくれるなら、命だけは助けよう」","en":"“But there are parts of your story I can sympathize with. In a sense, the two of you could be called victims of this city as well. If you’ll keep the promise I’m about to ask of you, I will at least spare your lives.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r348","rowIndex":348,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　広瀬はそこで顔を上げる。","en":"At that, Heita raises his head.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r349","rowIndex":349,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　隣の<tips=29>アイス</tips>も驚きを浮かべて、主人の横顔を見る。","en":"Beside him, <tips=29>Ice</tips> looks surprised as she turns to study her master’s profile.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r350","rowIndex":350,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「今すぐ街を出るんだ。そして、もうここに戻って来てはいけない。それを約束できるのなら、この件は僕の胸におさめよう」","en":"“Leave the city at once, and never return. If you can promise me that, I will keep this matter to myself.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r351","rowIndex":351,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ほ、本当かい？」","en":"“Y-you mean it?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"広瀬平太","displayName":"Heita Hirose","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r352","rowIndex":352,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「僕は嘘はつかない」","en":"“I never lie.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r353","rowIndex":353,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あ、ありがとうございますっ……」","en":"“Th-thank you so much...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"広瀬平太","displayName":"Heita Hirose","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r354","rowIndex":354,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして広瀬は<tips=28>トーマス</tips>の足元にひれ伏すようにして泣いた。","en":"Heita falls prostrate at <tips=28>Thomas’s</tips> feet and weeps.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r355","rowIndex":355,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そのあと<tips=28>トーマス</tips>は広瀬を銃で脅しながら、弟孝司が子供と遊んでいた部屋へ行き、驚く彼に同じように説明をする。","en":"Afterward, keeping Heita at gunpoint, <tips=28>Thomas</tips> takes him to the room where Koji had been playing with the children and gives his startled brother the same explanation.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r356","rowIndex":356,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　子供たちは、さすが<tips=9>Y地区</tips>で生まれ育ったと言うべきか、このように銃が出て来る場面での振る舞い方を幼いながらに心得ており、無用に騒いだりせずに黙って大人たちのやりとりを聞いていた。","en":"Young as they are, the children know how to behave in a situation where a gun appears—as one might expect of children born and raised in <tips=9>Y District</tips>. Without making a needless commotion, they quietly listen to the adults’ exchange.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r357","rowIndex":357,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「他に経営に関わった人間はいるかい？」","en":"“Is anyone else involved in running the business?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r358","rowIndex":358,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　説明を終えて、<tips=28>トーマス</tips>はそう訊ねる。","en":"Once he has finished explaining, <tips=28>Thomas</tips> asks the question.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r359","rowIndex":359,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「じ、自分と兄貴だけです。あとはただのアルバイトで、深く関わってはいません」","en":"“J-just my brother and me. The others are only part-timers. They aren’t deeply involved.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"広瀬孝司","displayName":"Koji Hirose","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r360","rowIndex":360,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　すっかり生気を失った兄のかわりに、孝司がビクビクしながらそう答えた。","en":"With his elder brother utterly drained of life, Koji answers in his place, visibly frightened.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r361","rowIndex":361,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「わかった」","en":"“All right.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r362","rowIndex":362,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=28>トーマス</tips>はテーブルの上から札束を一つ掴むと、兄弟の方に向かって放り投げる。","en":"<tips=28>Thomas</tips> snatches up a bundle of banknotes from the table and tosses it toward the brothers.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r363","rowIndex":363,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それを、孝司が取り落としそうになりながらもなんとかキャッチする。","en":"Koji nearly drops it, but somehow manages to catch it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r364","rowIndex":364,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「外に出たら、それを当面の生活費にしてまともな仕事を探すんだ。まだ若いんだし、きっと見つかるはずだよ。役所には<tips=17>タイプB</tips>の支援係があるから、そこで相談するのもいい。この街の役所よりはまともに仕事をしてくれると思うから。わかったね？」","en":"“Once you’re outside the city, use that for living expenses until you can find honest work. You’re still young; I’m sure you’ll find something. The government has support offices for <tips=17>Type Bs</tips>, so you could ask one of them for help. I expect they’ll do a better job than this city’s government office. Understood?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r365","rowIndex":365,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「わ、わかりましたっ」","en":"“I-I understand!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"広瀬孝司","displayName":"Koji Hirose","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r366","rowIndex":366,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　孝司は首の骨が外れたかのように、ガクガクと何度も頭を揺らして頷いた。","en":"Koji nods over and over, his head jerking as though the bones of his neck had come loose.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r367","rowIndex":367,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうしたら、このまままっすぐにこの街を出るんだ。荷物を取りに行ったり、誰かに別れを告げたり、そんな寄り道をしてはいけない。この街でのきみたちは今この瞬間に死んだ。もし少しでも余計なことをしたら、僕の使いがあらわれてきみたちに本来の罰を与えるだろう。それは僕としても悲しい。僕を悲しませないよう、言うことを聞いてくれるね？」","en":"“Then go straight out of the city. Don’t stop to collect your things, say goodbye to anyone, or make any other detours. As of this moment, the two of you are dead in this city. If you do anything you shouldn’t, one of my people will appear and give you the punishment you were meant to receive. That would make me sad, too. You’ll listen to me and make sure that doesn’t happen, won’t you?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r368","rowIndex":368,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=28>トーマス</tips>の言葉に、兄弟は真っ青な顔で頷いた。","en":"At <tips=28>Thomas’s</tips> words, the brothers nod, their faces deathly pale.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r369","rowIndex":369,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　二人が部屋を出て行くと、<tips=28>トーマス</tips>はホテルの近くで待機しているはずの部下に連絡をした。そして、人数のうち半分が街を出て行く兄弟を見届け、のこり半分は兄弟が出て行った後にホテルに入って七階まであがって来るよう指示した。","en":"Once the two men leave the room, <tips=28>Thomas</tips> contacts the subordinates who should be waiting near the hotel. He orders half of them to make sure the brothers leave the city, and the other half to enter the hotel and come up to the seventh floor once they are gone.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r370","rowIndex":370,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　連絡を終えると<tips=28>トーマス</tips>は溜息をついた。","en":"When he finishes making the arrangements, <tips=28>Thomas</tips> sighs.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r371","rowIndex":371,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ひとまずこれで決着はついた。正しいかどうかはわからないが、これが自分のやり方だ。この判断が自分自身をあやうくするかもしれないが、それならそれで仕方ない。きっと、人生何回生まれ変わってこの選択の場面に来ても、同じ選択をするだろう。","en":"For the moment, that settles the matter. He does not know whether it was right, but this is his way. If the decision puts him in danger, then so be it. No matter how many lives he might be born into, if he came to this choice again, he would surely choose the same way every time.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r372","rowIndex":372,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして、子供たちに向き直る。","en":"Then he turns back to the children.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r373","rowIndex":373,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「これから怖いおじちゃんたちがあがってくるけど、心配しないでいい。彼らはきみたちを送り届けるのが仕事だからね」","en":"“Some scary men will be coming upstairs, but you don’t need to worry. Their job is to take all of you home.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r374","rowIndex":374,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼の温和な表情と口調は子供たちに安心感を与えたようだった。","en":"His gentle expression and manner of speaking seem to put the children at ease.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r375","rowIndex":375,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼らはしばし戸惑いお互いの顔を見合って、ボソボソと何か呟いた後、一人の少女が口を開いた。","en":"The children hesitate for a moment, glancing at one another and muttering quietly among themselves. Then one of the girls speaks.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r376","rowIndex":376,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「私たち、家に帰れるの？」","en":"“We can go home?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r377","rowIndex":377,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうだよ。帰るときには少しずつお金を渡す。あと、大事なことだけど、リャオの家の息子に貰ったって言うといい。きみたちはそれぞれいろんな事情があるだろうけど、そうしたら、きみのお父さんもお母さんも、あたたかく受け入れてくれるだろう。そうしたらもう今回のことは終わりだ。全部忘れて、誰にも喋らないようにするんだ」","en":"“That’s right. Before you leave, I’ll give each of you a little money. And this is important: tell your families you got it from a son of the Liao family. I know each of you has your own circumstances, but if you say that, your mothers and fathers should take you back warmly. Then this whole affair will be over. Forget all about it, and don’t tell anyone.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r378","rowIndex":378,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　子供たちはそれでようやく状況を理解したようだった。","en":"Only then did the children seem to understand their situation.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r379","rowIndex":379,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼ら同士で話し合うのをよそに、<tips=28>トーマス</tips>はその子供たちの輪に入れない少女――撮影の現場からつれてきたリーサに向かって話しかける。","en":"While the children confer among themselves, <tips=28>Thomas</tips> addresses Lisa, the girl he brought from the filming room, who still cannot bring herself to join their circle.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r380","rowIndex":380,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「リーサ、きみは家に帰りたくなければ、ここに残ってもいい。そしたら僕が面倒を見よう」","en":"“Lisa, if you don’t want to go home, you may stay here. I’ll look after you.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r381","rowIndex":381,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いいわ。私、家がいい」","en":"“No. I want to go home.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"リーサ","displayName":"Lisa","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r382","rowIndex":382,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　親に虐待されているのを危惧した<tips=28>トーマス</tips>の申し出だったが、少女はきっぱりとそう言った。","en":"<tips=28>Thomas</tips> made the offer because he feared she was being abused by her parents, but the girl answers him firmly.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r383","rowIndex":383,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうか、それなら無理強いはしないよ。きみも立派なレディだからね。意志を尊重しよう。でも、つらいことがあったらいつでも連絡してくれよ」","en":"“I see. Then I won’t force you. You’re a proper lady in your own right, after all, so I’ll respect your decision. But if anything painful happens, you can contact me anytime.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r384","rowIndex":384,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=28>トーマス</tips>はそう言って自分の電話番号をテーブルにあった紙片にメモし、手渡そうとしたが、少女は受け取ろうとせずにこちらをじっと見つめている。","en":"<tips=28>Thomas</tips> writes his telephone number on a scrap of paper from the table and tries to hand it to her, but the girl makes no move to take it. She only stares at him.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r385","rowIndex":385,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あなたたち、さっき、急に出て来たけどユーレイなの？」","en":"“You two appeared all of a sudden before. Are you ghosts?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"リーサ","displayName":"Lisa","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r386","rowIndex":386,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「違うよ。僕は正義のギャング・ヒーローだよ。この街を良い街にするために、いつも姿を消して、みんなの生活を見守っているんだ」","en":"“No. I’m a righteous gangster hero. I’m always hiding myself from sight and watching over everyone who lives here, so that I can make this city a better place.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r387","rowIndex":387,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=28>トーマス</tips>は穏やかに微笑みかけ、","en":"<tips=28>Thomas</tips> smiles gently at her and continues,","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r388","rowIndex":388,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「だから、けっして悪いことをしたらいけないよ。僕はいつだって見張ってるんだから」","en":"“So you must never do anything bad. I’m always watching.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r389","rowIndex":389,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……そんなの嘘だよ」","en":"“...That’s a lie.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"リーサ","displayName":"Lisa","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r390","rowIndex":390,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　少女は眉間に皺を寄せて言った。","en":"The girl frowned as she said it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r391","rowIndex":391,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どうしてそう思う？」","en":"“Why do you think that?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r392","rowIndex":392,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「だって、そうなら、なんで今までずっと助けてくれなかったの……」","en":"“Because if that were true... why haven’t you helped me all this time?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"リーサ","displayName":"Lisa","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r393","rowIndex":393,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　少女はそう言うと、それまで無表情だった顔が急にしわくちゃに崩れて、ボロボロと涙をこぼし、泣き始めた。","en":"As soon as she says it, the face that had been expressionless crumples all at once. Tears spill freely, and she begins to cry.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r394","rowIndex":394,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=28>トミー</tips>、きみは、人身売買というものが、死をもってしか贖えない重い罪だってことを忘れたわけではないよね？」","en":"“<tips=28>Tommy</tips>, you haven’t forgotten that human trafficking is a grave sin that can be atoned for only with death, have you?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r395","rowIndex":395,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=41>グランドタワー</tips>の最上階、<tips=81>龍頭</tips>の執務室で<tips=1>謝亮</tips>は眉一つ動かさぬ冷たい表情のままそう言った。","en":"On the top floor of the <tips=41>Grand Tower</tips>, in the <tips=81>Longtou’s</tips> office, <tips=1>Tse Leung</tips> delivers the words with a cold expression that never so much as flickers.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r396","rowIndex":396,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　目の前には<tips=28>トーマス</tips>が立っている。","en":"<tips=28>Thomas</tips> stands before him.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r397","rowIndex":397,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　かれは日が明けるとすぐここへ訪れて、昨日の広瀬兄弟の件を彼に報告していた。","en":"He had come there as soon as day broke to report the previous day’s matter involving the Hirose brothers.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r398","rowIndex":398,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「もちろん、忘れちゃいないよ」","en":"“Of course I haven’t forgotten.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r399","rowIndex":399,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=28>トーマス</tips>といえども、こうしたかたちで<tips=1>謝亮</tips>の前に立つとなれば萎縮しないわけにはいかなかった。","en":"Even <tips=28>Thomas</tips> cannot help feeling cowed when made to stand before <tips=1>Tse Leung</tips> under circumstances like these.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r400","rowIndex":400,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　この第三代<tips=81>龍頭</tips><tips=1>謝亮</tips>はルールに厳格で、たとえ親しい間柄の血族でも、新しく入ったばかりの下部構成員でも、区別なく公平な判断を下すことはよく知られている。","en":"The third-generation <tips=81>Longtou</tips>, <tips=1>Tse Leung</tips>, is known for his strict observance of the rules and the impartiality of his judgments: close blood relative or newly inducted rank-and-file member, he makes no distinction.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r401","rowIndex":401,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　もちろん、幼なじみである自分に対してもそれは変わらないだろう。","en":"Of course, that would be no different for Thomas himself, childhood friend or not.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r402","rowIndex":402,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　最近皆がこの何かと決断癖のある新しい<tips=81>龍頭</tips>の能力と人格を理解し、畏怖しはじめているが、今<tips=28>トーマス</tips>はその気持ちを肌で感じていた。","en":"Recently, everyone has begun to understand—and stand in awe of—the ability and character of this new <tips=81>Longtou</tips>, with his habit of making decisions at every turn. Now <tips=28>Thomas</tips> feels that awe on his own skin.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r403","rowIndex":403,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"（やっぱり、<tips=2>阿亮</tips>ってこわいな）","en":"(<tips=2>Ah Leung</tips> really is scary.)","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r404","rowIndex":404,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　かつてこの評判の幼なじみを見くびったことはないし、わかっていたつもりではあったが、再確認させられている。","en":"Thomas has never underestimated this much-talked-about childhood friend and thought he understood him well enough, but now he is being made to see it all over again.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r405","rowIndex":405,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>本人にとっては特別な意味のない仏頂面や冷淡な物言いなのだろうし、昔から何一つ変わってはいないのだが、<tips=81>龍頭</tips>となった彼のそういった細かい動作は周囲の人間にとってはいちいち意味のあるものに感じられてしまうのだ。それが、権力のある人間の影響力というものなのだろう。","en":"To <tips=1>Leung</tips> himself, his habitual scowl and cold way of speaking probably mean nothing in particular; neither has changed at all since the old days. But now that he is the <tips=81>Longtou</tips>, every smallest movement he makes seems charged with meaning to the people around him. Perhaps that is what it means for a person to possess power.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r406","rowIndex":406,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　いくらリーダー格といっても、基本的には友だち繋がりである不良グループにいた時とは違う形の人間関係が<tips=81>龍頭</tips>となった<tips=1>亮</tips>のまわりに出来はじめている。彼自身もいずれその効果を理解してゆくのだろうが、この頃はまだそういった自分の存在が自然と生み出す作用について自覚が薄かったのかもしれない。","en":"A different kind of relationship was beginning to form around <tips=1>Leung</tips> now that he was the <tips=81>Longtou</tips>, unlike the delinquent group whose members had essentially been friends no matter who led them. Perhaps he would eventually understand the effect, but at this point he may still have had little awareness of the influence his mere presence naturally exerted.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r407","rowIndex":407,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「本来だったらその兄弟は処刑しなくてはいけないんだ。だから厳密に言えばきみのやったことはアウトだけれど、その謎の女のことが気になる。そんな存在がこの街に潜んでいるなら、広瀬兄弟なんかよりそちらの方が大問題だからね。もしかしたら、今後兄弟の情報が必要になることがあるかもしれない。……つまり、死んだことにして追放したのは悪くない判断だ。咄嗟にそんな機転が利くなんてやるじゃないか」","en":"“Ordinarily, those brothers would have to be executed. So strictly speaking, what you did was out of line. But this mysterious woman concerns me. If someone like that is lurking in the city, she is a far greater problem than the Hirose brothers. We may need information from them later. ...In other words, declaring them dead and banishing them was not a bad decision. Not bad, thinking that quickly on your feet.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r408","rowIndex":408,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>が淡々と言うと、<tips=28>トーマス</tips>は内心で安堵の溜息をつく。","en":"As <tips=1>Leung</tips> delivers this matter-of-factly, <tips=28>Thomas</tips> breathes a private sigh of relief.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r409","rowIndex":409,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「でも、本当に僕もびっくりしたよ。まさか今時<tips=18>ローズ・クラブ</tips>どうこうを言い出す人間がいるだなんて」","en":"“Still, I was surprised myself. I never imagined anyone would start invoking the <tips=18>Rose Club</tips> in this day and age.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r410","rowIndex":410,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうだね」","en":"“True.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r411","rowIndex":411,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>は椅子をぐるりと回して片肘を机につくと、","en":"<tips=1>Leung</tips> swivels his chair around, props one elbow on the desk, and says,","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r412","rowIndex":412,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「今の<tips=9>Y地区</tips>であんな施設を作ろうなんてのは妄想もいいところだけれど、どんな人間が言っているのかは気になる。過去からの亡霊か、それとも、広瀬兄弟みたいに何年かぶりに正気に返った浦島太郎か……」","en":"“Trying to build a place like that in today’s <tips=9>Y District</tips> is pure fantasy, but I am curious what kind of person is proposing it. A ghost from the past, perhaps—or some Urashima Taro who, like the Hirose brothers, has only now come back to his senses after years...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r413","rowIndex":413,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そう言って人の悪い笑みを薄い唇に浮かべる。","en":"As he says it, a malicious smile curls across his thin lips.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r414","rowIndex":414,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「何にしろ想定外だね。これに引っかき回されるようなことになると、僕は非常に困る」","en":"“Whatever it is, we did not account for it. If it ends up throwing everything into chaos, that will be a very serious problem for me.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r415","rowIndex":415,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>は感情の読めないのんびりとした口調で言った。","en":"<tips=1>Leung</tips> says it in a leisurely tone from which no emotion can be read.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r416","rowIndex":416,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まだ何か話があるのかい？」","en":"“Was there still something else you wanted to say?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r417","rowIndex":417,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　一通りの報告を終えたあともまだもじもじとして<tips=1>亮</tips>の前に立っている<tips=28>トーマス</tips>に、彼はそう問いかける。","en":"<tips=1>Leung</tips> puts the question to <tips=28>Thomas</tips>, who remains standing awkwardly before him even though his report is finished.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r418","rowIndex":418,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=2>阿亮</tips>、僕はこの仕事のことをちゃんと理解してなかったのかもしれない」","en":"“<tips=2>Ah Leung</tips>, maybe I never properly understood this job.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r419","rowIndex":419,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=28>トーマス</tips>が重い口調でそう言うと、これから何を言い始めるのかと<tips=1>亮</tips>は怪訝に目を細める。","en":"When <tips=28>Thomas</tips> says this so gravely, <tips=1>Leung</tips> narrows his eyes in puzzlement, wondering what he is about to say.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r420","rowIndex":420,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ただ、父さんの跡を継いで、そして出来ればこの街をよくしたいなと思ってた。ギャングというのは恐ろしい仕事だけど、<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>ならこの街の色んなものを変えられる。それだけしか考えてなかったんだよ」","en":"“I only thought I would follow in my father’s footsteps and, if I could, make this city better. Being a gangster is frightening work, but <tips=7>YS</tips> can change so many things in this city. That was as far as my thinking went.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r421","rowIndex":421,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=28>トーマス</tips>の青みがかった目には、不安と、それに負けない意志の輝きが浮かんでいる。","en":"Anxiety shows in <tips=28>Thomas’s</tips> blue-tinged eyes, but beside it gleams a resolve every bit as strong.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r422","rowIndex":422,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「その理想自体は変わっていない……だけど、今回僕もちゃんと『ギャング』にならなければいけないんだと思った。それが現実を受け止めるってことだと思う。手も汚さなくちゃいけない時もあるんだろう。……それでも、目的さえ忘れなければ、ただのギャングじゃない何かになれると思うんだ。ねえ、僕はこの街のみんなに幸せになってほしいんだよ」","en":"“That ideal itself has not changed... But this time, I realized I have to become a real ‘gangster,’ too. I think that is what it means to accept reality. There will probably be times when I have to dirty my hands. ...Even so, as long as I never lose sight of my purpose, I think I can become something other than just another gangster. You know, I want everyone in this city to be happy.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r423","rowIndex":423,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それは立派な決意だけど、今ここで僕に報告するような話かい？」","en":"“That’s an admirable resolution, but is it something you need to report to me here and now?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r424","rowIndex":424,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>は苦笑を見せる。","en":"<tips=1>Leung</tips> gives him a wry smile.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r425","rowIndex":425,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それは、わからないけど……でも<tips=2>阿亮</tips>にも聞いて欲しかったんだ」","en":"“I don’t know about that… But I wanted you to hear it too, <tips=2>Ah Leung</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r426","rowIndex":426,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=28>トーマス</tips>は気持ちに突き動かされてつい口にしてしまったものの、こうして<tips=1>亮</tips>に指摘されると自分の行動の脈絡のなさに気がつき、恥ずかしそうに俯いた。","en":"Swept along by his feelings, <tips=28>Thomas</tips> had let the words spill out. Only now, when <tips=1>Leung</tips> points it out, does he realize what a complete non sequitur it was, and he hangs his head in embarrassment.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r427","rowIndex":427,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「悩める青年だね」","en":"“You’re a troubled young man.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r428","rowIndex":428,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>は肩をすくめて、","en":"<tips=1>Leung</tips> shrugs and says,","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r429","rowIndex":429,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ま、悩むことが出来るうちは悩めばいいよ」","en":"“Well, as long as you still have the luxury of worrying, you may as well worry.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X10:r430","rowIndex":430,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして、正体不明の苦笑を浮かべた。","en":"Then an enigmatic, rueful smile crosses his face.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}}]},{"position":29,"code":"A6","unitId":"A6","rows":[{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r1","rowIndex":1,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　遠く工場地帯の上空には灰色の大気汚染の雲が浮かんでいる。","en":"A gray cloud of air pollution hangs above the distant factory district.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r2","rowIndex":2,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　あの汚い雲の下で何を作っているのか知りたくて、子供の頃に僕は一人で街を抜け出して自転車であそこまで行った。","en":"When I was a child, I wanted to know what they made beneath those filthy clouds, so I slipped out of the city alone and rode my bicycle all the way there.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r3","rowIndex":3,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　錆びた金網フェンスの破れたところから、広い敷地のなかにはいり、おばけみたいに大きな建物に潜り込む。","en":"Through a breach in the rusty chain-link fence, I entered the sprawling grounds and slipped inside a building as huge as a monster.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r4","rowIndex":4,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　薄暗い工場のなかは焦げ臭いにおいで満ちている。","en":"The dim interior of the factory reeks of something burnt.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r5","rowIndex":5,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　巨大な機械がガチャンガチャンと恐ろしい音を立て上下の往復運動をして、その一往復ごとに横の四角い口から出来上がったばかりの金属部品がじゃらじゃらと吐き出されて、下に置かれたザルのなかにたまってゆく。","en":"A gigantic machine travels endlessly up and down with a terrifying clank-clank, and with every stroke, freshly made metal parts come jangling out of a square mouth in its side and collect in the wire basket below.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r6","rowIndex":6,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その勇猛さというかダイナミックさというか、計り知れないものに心打たれてぼうっと無心で見つめていると、作業着の袖をまくって毛むくじゃらの太い腕を剥き出しにした工員がいつのまにかすぐ近くまで来ており、無言で僕を殴った。僕は謝ったが、男は聞く耳を持たず、もう一度殴った。丸太のような腕で殴られると、脳の奥までしびれてしまう。","en":"Something in its bravery, or its dynamism, or whatever that immeasurable quality was, overwhelms me. I stand staring, dazed and empty of thought, until somehow a factory worker is right beside me. His work sleeves are rolled up, baring thick, hairy arms. Without a word, he punches me. I apologize, but the man will not listen and hits me again. A blow from an arm like a log numbs me to the very depths of my brain.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r7","rowIndex":7,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　このままでは殺されると、僕は反撃をすることにした。","en":"Certain I would be killed if this continued, I decided to fight back.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r8","rowIndex":8,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　落ちていた金属の塊——おそらく何かのパーツだったのだろう——それを拾って相手の頭を殴りつけた。","en":"I picked up a lump of metal lying nearby—probably some sort of part—and smashed it into his head.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r9","rowIndex":9,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　相手は一発で倒れたが、そのまま動かなくなるまで殴り続けた。","en":"He went down with the first blow, but I kept hitting him until he stopped moving.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r10","rowIndex":10,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　胸に耳を当てて死んでいないのを確認してから僕は工場を飛び出し、鼻血塗れの顔で自転車を立ちこぎして急いで街に戻った。","en":"After putting my ear to his chest to make sure he was not dead, I fled the factory, rose onto the pedals, and raced my bicycle back to the city with my face smeared in blood from my nose.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r11","rowIndex":11,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして忘れないうちにさっき見た機械をスケッチブックに描いた。","en":"Then, before I could forget, I drew the machine I had just seen in my sketchbook.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r12","rowIndex":12,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　あれ以来僕はあの工場に一度も足を踏み入れていない。","en":"I have never set foot in that factory since.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r13","rowIndex":13,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　だから、今もまだあの機械は動いているような気がする。","en":"That is why I feel as though that machine is still running even now.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r14","rowIndex":14,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　工員は腕まくりをして倒れているような気がする。","en":"I feel as though the worker is still lying there with his sleeves rolled up.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r15","rowIndex":15,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕が投げ捨てた金属の塊はまだ血に汚れているような気がする。","en":"I feel as though the lump of metal I threw away is still stained with blood.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r16","rowIndex":16,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　——あの時描いたスケッチはどこにいったのだろうか？","en":"—Where did the sketch I drew that day go?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r17","rowIndex":17,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕は窓の外を眺めるのをやめて、また椅子に腰をおろし、鏡を手に取った。眉の上辺りの皮膚がカサカサとしており、指先でつまむと表面が剥がれる。","en":"I stop looking out the window, sit back down, and pick up the mirror. The skin above my eyebrow is dry and rough; when I pinch at it with my fingertips, its surface peels away.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r18","rowIndex":18,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕はそのかさぶたのようなものをティッシュに包んで傍らのくずかごに捨てた。その中には同じようなティッシュがもう三つほど入っている。","en":"I wrapped the scablike piece in a tissue and discarded it in the wastebasket beside me. Three similar tissues already lay inside.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r19","rowIndex":19,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その時、執務室のドアを開けて黒いスーツ姿の男が入って来た。彼は<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>の一員である——ということはつまり僕の部下だ。","en":"At that moment, a man in a black suit opened the office door and entered. He was a member of <tips=7>YS</tips>—which meant, in other words, that he was my subordinate.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r20","rowIndex":20,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕は鏡を机の上に伏せる。","en":"I lay the mirror facedown on the desk.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r21","rowIndex":21,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=81>龍頭</tips>」","en":"“<tips=81>Longtou</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r22","rowIndex":22,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その３７才になる部下は緊張の面持ちで僕を見ている。","en":"My thirty-seven-year-old subordinate looks at me with tension written across his face.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r23","rowIndex":23,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「グエンの件ですが……」","en":"“About Nguyen...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r24","rowIndex":24,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「一人にしてくれと言ったはずだが。急用なら電話を使えとも言った。聞いていなかったのかい？」","en":"“I believe I told you to leave me alone. I also told you to use the telephone if it was urgent. Weren’t you listening?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r25","rowIndex":25,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「す、すみません」","en":"“I-I’m sorry.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r26","rowIndex":26,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　部下の顔は青白くなってその場に凍り付く。別に僕は凄んだわけでもなく、普通に言っただけなのだけれど。","en":"My subordinate’s face goes pale, and he freezes on the spot. I was not trying to intimidate him; I only spoke to him normally.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r27","rowIndex":27,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まあいい。報告してくれ」","en":"“Fine. Give me your report.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r28","rowIndex":28,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　部下は僕の顔色をチラチラと見ながら報告をする。<tips=9>Y地区</tips>内で飲食店を三つ経営するグエンという男が先週からみかじめ料を拒否しており、今回交渉も拒否したということらしい。グエンは父の代から付き合いがあるのだが、<tips=27>廖志明</tips>や<tips=35>フェルナンデス</tips>の件で僕に反感を持っているらしく、今回の件になった。","en":"He makes his report while stealing repeated glances at my expression. A man named Nguyen, who runs three restaurants in <tips=9>Y District</tips>, has apparently refused to pay protection money since last week, and this time he has refused to negotiate as well. Nguyen’s dealings with us go back to my father’s time, but it seems he resents me over the affairs of <tips=27>Liao Chi-ming</tips> and <tips=35>Fernandes</tips>. That resentment is what brought this about.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r29","rowIndex":29,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　まあ、そう多くはないが別にこれが初めてというわけでもない。","en":"It does not happen often, but this is hardly the first time.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r30","rowIndex":30,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それなら仕方ない。グエンの娘をさらおう」","en":"“Then it can’t be helped. We’ll kidnap Nguyen’s daughter.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r31","rowIndex":31,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「はいっ」","en":"“Yes, sir!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r32","rowIndex":32,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「姜浩強にやらせる。作戦のプランを考えて、明日午前１０時にここに来るよう伝えてくれ」","en":"“Have Jiang Haoqiang handle it. Tell him to work out a plan for the operation and come here tomorrow morning at ten.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r33","rowIndex":33,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「はいっ」","en":"“Yes, sir!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r34","rowIndex":34,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それから、僕が一人にしてくれと言ったときは、必ず電話を使うんだ。きみは異動したばかりだから知らないのは仕方ないのかもしれないけれど、前のボスと同じようにしなくてもいい」","en":"“And whenever I tell you I want to be alone, make sure you use the phone. You were only just transferred here, so perhaps it could not be helped that you did not know. But you do not need to treat me the same way you treated the last boss.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r35","rowIndex":35,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「は、はいっ。済みませんでした！」","en":"“Y-yes, sir. I’m sorry!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r36","rowIndex":36,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼は慌てて頭を下げると、退室してゆく。","en":"He bows hastily and retreats from the room.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r37","rowIndex":37,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　こんな若造にどやされて、いい大人が怯えてしまうとは気の毒なことだが、これが組織というものなのだ。僕もわかってはいるが、いやな気分だ。","en":"I feel sorry for a grown man reduced to fear by a youngster like me barking at him, but that is what it means to belong to an organization. I understand that well enough, and still I hate the feeling.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r38","rowIndex":38,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　まあ、普通に言ったつもりだが、無意識のうちに尖った言い方になっているのかもしれない。今日はどうもイライラしているのだ。","en":"I meant to speak normally, but perhaps my words grow sharp without my realizing it. Something has me irritable today.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r39","rowIndex":39,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして時計を見る。予定していた用事の時刻が迫っていた。","en":"I check the clock. The time for the business I have planned is drawing near.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r40","rowIndex":40,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕は上着を着て部屋を出た。さっき退室させた部下が怯えた目で僕を見るが声はかけない。他の部下たちもいちいち何かをたずねない。結構なことだ。","en":"I put on my jacket and leave the room. The subordinate I dismissed a moment ago watches me with frightened eyes but says nothing. None of my other subordinates stops me with needless questions, either. Just as well.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r41","rowIndex":41,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　今日はボディーガードを伴わない。僕は一人でエレベーターに乗り込み、途中エレベーターを乗り換え、そして地下の駐車場に行く。車体を磨いていた運転手に声をかけて、自分一人で行くと伝えた。彼は困惑していたが、無理矢理鍵を受け取って運転席に乗り込む。そうして、久しぶりに車の運転をして<tips=25>馬世傑</tips>の住まいに向かった。","en":"Today I take no bodyguards. I ride the elevator alone, change elevators on the way down, and continue to the underground garage. I tell the driver polishing the car that I am going by myself. He looks bewildered, but I take the keys from him by force and climb behind the wheel. Then I drive for the first time in ages and head for <tips=25>Ma Sai-kit’s</tips> home.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r42","rowIndex":42,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=25>世傑</tips>は車で五分ほど行ったマンションに一人暮らしをしている。場所は知っていたが訪ねるのは初めてだ。","en":"<tips=25>Sai-kit</tips> lives alone in an apartment about five minutes away by car. I know where it is, but this is my first visit.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r43","rowIndex":43,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　部屋番号を押してインターフォンを鳴らすと彼は外に出る格好で出た。僕が一人で来たことにも特に驚くことなくオートロックを開ける。","en":"I enter his apartment number and ring the intercom. He answers already dressed to go out and, without showing any particular surprise that I have come alone, buzzes me in.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r44","rowIndex":44,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　エレベーターで上がって彼の部屋のドアをノックすると、すぐにドアが開いた。","en":"I rode the elevator up and knocked on his door. It opened almost immediately.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r45","rowIndex":45,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=25>世傑</tips>は神妙な顔をして居て無言で部屋へ通す。僕も無言のまま部屋にあがる。","en":"Wearing a solemn expression, <tips=25>Sai-kit</tips> lets me into the apartment without a word. I step inside in the same silence.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r46","rowIndex":46,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼のリビングルームは物が少なく、掃除が行き届いて清潔だった。壁側には祭壇があり、十字架と、写真が並べられている。それは彼が殺人現場でいつもパシャパシャと撮っていたもので、血みどろの死体が映っている。見ているだけで死の臭いが漂って来る。","en":"There are few objects in his living room, and the place is spotless. Against one wall stands an altar bearing a cross and a row of photographs. They are the pictures he is always snapping at murder scenes, images of corpses drenched in blood. Merely looking at them, I can smell death drifting toward me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r47","rowIndex":47,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ろくに聖書を読んだことはないし、特に意味はないのよ。ただ毎日ここで祈らないと、よく眠れないだけ」","en":"“I have barely read the Bible, and this doesn’t mean anything in particular. I simply can’t sleep well unless I pray here every day.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬世傑","displayName":"Ma Sai-kit","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r48","rowIndex":48,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「繊細なもんだな」","en":"“Sensitive soul, aren’t you?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r49","rowIndex":49,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=81>龍頭</tips>、あんたも同じようなことしてるんじゃないの？」","en":"“<tips=81>Longtou</tips>, don’t you do the same sort of thing?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬世傑","displayName":"Ma Sai-kit","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r50","rowIndex":50,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「冗談じゃない。僕はいつだって安眠だよ」","en":"“Don’t be ridiculous. I always sleep soundly.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r51","rowIndex":51,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕が眉を顰め、彼は苦笑する。","en":"I knit my brows, and he gives me a wry smile.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r52","rowIndex":52,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それからソファに座るようすすめられたが僕は長居をする気がなかったので断った。","en":"He invites me to sit on the sofa, but I have no intention of staying long, so I decline.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r53","rowIndex":53,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼は黙って僕を見ている。僕の言葉を待っているのだ。","en":"He watches me in silence. He is waiting for me to speak.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r54","rowIndex":54,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「今日の朝に調査結果が出た」","en":"“The results of the investigation came back this morning.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r55","rowIndex":55,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕は静かに言った。","en":"I say it quietly.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r56","rowIndex":56,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「すべて僕の思っていた通りだった。つまり今日の午後の会議はそういうことになる」","en":"“Everything was exactly as I thought. Which means we both know what this afternoon’s meeting will amount to.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r57","rowIndex":57,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そう」","en":"“I see.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬世傑","displayName":"Ma Sai-kit","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r58","rowIndex":58,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼は一瞬顔を曇らせたが、すぐにいつもの微笑に戻った。","en":"His face clouds for an instant, but his usual smile quickly returns.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r59","rowIndex":59,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「仕方ないわね。アタシのことは気にしないでいいわよ。<tips=81>龍頭</tips>こそ大丈夫なの？」","en":"“It can’t be helped. You don’t need to worry about me. Are you going to be all right, <tips=81>Longtou</tips>?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬世傑","displayName":"Ma Sai-kit","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r60","rowIndex":60,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「何が？」","en":"“About what?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r61","rowIndex":61,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「わざわざ伝えに来るなんて、今まで一度もなかったから」","en":"“You have never gone out of your way to come tell me before.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬世傑","displayName":"Ma Sai-kit","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r62","rowIndex":62,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「僕はどうってことはないさ。<tips=25>世傑</tips>がどんな風に受け止めるのか気になったんだ」","en":"“I’ll be fine. I was wondering how <tips=25>Sai-kit</tips> would take it.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r63","rowIndex":63,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あら、それはご苦労様」","en":"“Oh, how very thoughtful of you.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬世傑","displayName":"Ma Sai-kit","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r64","rowIndex":64,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼は信用していないようだったが、僕としては言葉に嘘はないつもりだ。","en":"He does not seem to believe me, but for my part, I mean every word.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r65","rowIndex":65,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そう。あとそうだ、一度訊いてみたかったんだけど、いいかしら？」","en":"“I see. Oh, yes—there’s something I’ve wanted to ask you. May I?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬世傑","displayName":"Ma Sai-kit","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r66","rowIndex":66,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なに？」","en":"“What is it?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r67","rowIndex":67,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どうしてアタシをこの街に呼び寄せたの？　<tips=81>龍頭</tips>と私は、そんなに親しくはなかったと思うけれど」","en":"“Why did you call me to this city? I don’t remember the <tips=81>Longtou</tips> and me ever being that close.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬世傑","displayName":"Ma Sai-kit","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r68","rowIndex":68,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「もちろん、その能力を見込んでだよ。<tips=17>タイプB</tips>よりも戦闘力があるノーマルなんか<tips=25>世傑</tips>くらいしか知らない」","en":"“Because I was counting on your ability, of course. <tips=25>Sai-kit</tips> is the only Normal I know who can outfight a <tips=17>Type B</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r69","rowIndex":69,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それだけ？」","en":"“Is that all?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬世傑","displayName":"Ma Sai-kit","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r70","rowIndex":70,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まあ、最初からあとで<tips=69>義勝</tips>内の古い爺さんとか幼なじみの連中を殺すことになるのがわかってたからね。この仕事を文句を言わないで、しかも手際よくやってくれそうなのはファミリーのなかじゃ<tips=25>世傑</tips>しかいなかった」","en":"“Well, from the beginning, I knew that eventually I would have to kill some of the old men in <tips=69>Yisheng</tips> and some of my childhood friends. Within the Family, <tips=25>Sai-kit</tips> was the only one who seemed likely to do the job efficiently and without complaint.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r71","rowIndex":71,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そういう言い方なら納得出来るわ」","en":"“Put that way, I can accept it.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬世傑","displayName":"Ma Sai-kit","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r72","rowIndex":72,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=25>世傑</tips>は頷き、","en":"<tips=25>Sai-kit</tips> nods and says,","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r73","rowIndex":73,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それなら任せて頂戴。アタシは仕事には誇りがあるの。誰が相手だって躊躇しないわ。文句を言わず、手際よくね。いい、誰が相手でもよ？　<tips=81>龍頭</tips>もそうあって欲しいわね」","en":"“Then leave it to me. I take pride in my work. Whoever the target is, I will not hesitate. No complaints, clean and efficient. Do you understand? No matter who the target is. I hope the same will be true of the <tips=81>Longtou</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬世傑","displayName":"Ma Sai-kit","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r74","rowIndex":74,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして唇の端を歪めて笑った。","en":"Then one corner of his mouth twists into a smile.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r75","rowIndex":75,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「僕は大丈夫さ。もう全ての覚悟は出来ている」","en":"“I’ll be fine. I’m already prepared for everything.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r76","rowIndex":76,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕がそう言うと、<tips=25>世傑</tips>はそれ以上はもう何も言わず、ただ静かに笑っているだけだった。","en":"At that, <tips=25>Sai-kit</tips> says nothing more. He only smiles in silence.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r77","rowIndex":77,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　さて、もう一つ野暮用がある。僕は車を走らせて<tips=57>滑走路通り</tips>の近くに停めた。","en":"Now, I have one more piece of mundane business. I drive to <tips=57>Runway Street</tips> and park nearby.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r78","rowIndex":78,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕はピザ屋の前の小径に入ってその奥にある診療所の前までやって来た。日光で少し黄ばんだ白いプレートに内科、外科、皮膚科、小児科など、取り扱う診療科の名が青っぽい文字で書かれている。","en":"I turn into the narrow lane in front of the pizza shop and follow it to the clinic at the far end. On a white plaque slightly yellowed by sunlight, the names of its departments—internal medicine, surgery, dermatology, pediatrics, and others—are written in bluish letters.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r79","rowIndex":79,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　住宅街のなかにひっそりとありそうな小さなクリニックで、イメージ通り老年にさしかかった医師が妻とアルバイトの女と三人で切り盛りしている。イメージと少し違うのは、口が固いのと、法的に少し問題のある行為でも積極的に行ってくれるということで、何か後ろめたいことがある人間がよく出入りするということだった。","en":"It is the sort of small, secluded clinic one expects to find tucked into a residential neighborhood, run—just as the image suggests—by a doctor approaching old age, his wife, and a woman employed part-time. What departs slightly from that image is the doctor’s discretion and his willingness to perform even legally questionable procedures. As a result, people with guilty secrets are often coming and going.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r80","rowIndex":80,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その玄関扉を開けようとしたところで、ノブに『休診日』の札がかかっているのに気がつく。","en":"Just as I am about to open the front door, I notice a sign hanging from the knob: CLOSED TODAY.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r81","rowIndex":81,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　看板に書かれた診療時間を確認してみると、間違いなく時間内のはずだが、札は恥ずかしげもなく揺れている。こっちは忙しい仕事の合間を縫って、一人歩きの危険をおかしてやって来たというのに、あの爺さんはサボっているんだろうか。","en":"I check the hours posted on the sign. There is no question that the clinic should be open, yet the placard swings there without a trace of shame. I have carved time out of a busy workday and risked going out alone to come here. Is that old man simply skipping work?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r82","rowIndex":82,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕は顔を顰めて、ドアの横についたインターフォンを押す。","en":"Scowling, I press the intercom beside the door.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r83","rowIndex":83,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　なかなか出ないので時間をあけてもう一度押すと、","en":"When no one answers for some time, I wait a while and press it again,","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r84","rowIndex":84,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"『はい』","en":"“Yes?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r85","rowIndex":85,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　明らかに不機嫌な様子で女が出た。医師の妻だろう。","en":"A woman answers, plainly irritated. Probably the doctor’s wife.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r86","rowIndex":86,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「診てもらいたいんですが」","en":"“I’d like to be examined.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r87","rowIndex":87,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"『無理ですよ。休診日って書いてあるでしょう。日本語でも英語でも中国語でも書いてあります。読めないんですか？』","en":"“That’s impossible. The sign says we’re closed. It says so in Japanese, English, and Chinese. Can’t you read?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r88","rowIndex":88,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　女はにべもない。","en":"The woman was utterly dismissive.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r89","rowIndex":89,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「読めますけど今日がいいんです」","en":"“I can read. But today works best for me.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r90","rowIndex":90,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"『無理です』","en":"“Impossible.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r91","rowIndex":91,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「先週来た時、今日また診て貰うって話をしてたんですよ」","en":"“When I came last week, we talked about my being seen again today.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r92","rowIndex":92,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"『明日か明後日にしてください。とにかく今日は無理です』","en":"“Come back tomorrow or the day after. In any event, today is impossible.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r93","rowIndex":93,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「明日は来られないんですよ」","en":"“I can’t come tomorrow.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r94","rowIndex":94,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"『でも無理なものは無理なんです。鬼が来たって、総理大臣が来たって診られません』","en":"“Impossible means impossible. We couldn’t see you today if you were a demon or the prime minister.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r95","rowIndex":95,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「たとえば<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>の<tips=81>龍頭</tips>でも無理ですか」","en":"“Not even for the <tips=81>Longtou</tips> of <tips=7>YS</tips>?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r96","rowIndex":96,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"『もちろん無理です。だって、先生はぎっくり腰でベッドから起き上がれないんですもの』","en":"“Of course it’s impossible. The doctor threw out his back and can’t get out of bed.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r97","rowIndex":97,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「はあ、じゃあ無理ですね」","en":"“Ah. Then I suppose it is impossible.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r98","rowIndex":98,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"『無理なんです』","en":"“It simply isn’t possible.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r99","rowIndex":99,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　諦めて退散するほかなさそうだった。せっかく一人で出て来たのに残念だ。","en":"It seems I have no choice but to give up and withdraw. A shame, after going to all the trouble of coming out alone.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r100","rowIndex":100,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕は首元に痒みを感じてそこを指先でかいた。するとやはり爪にかさぶたが張り付く。","en":"I feel an itch at my neck and scratch it with my fingertips. Sure enough, a scab sticks beneath my nail.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r101","rowIndex":101,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　大分前から、こんなに眠いのは、いくらなんでもおかしいと思っていたんだ。でも、そうだとは思わなかった。こうしてかさぶたが出て来て、やっとその可能性に思い至った。僕は父さんと同じ病気なのじゃないかと。そうして先日この病院をこっそり訪れたら、やはり思った通りの診断結果が出たというわけだ。","en":"For quite some time, I had thought that being this sleepy simply could not be normal. But I had never imagined it was that. Only when the scabs appeared did the possibility finally occur to me: perhaps I had the same disease as Father. When I secretly visited this hospital the other day, the diagnosis was just what I had feared.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r102","rowIndex":102,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そのうち僕も生きたまま身体が腐って崩れ落ちる。治ることはないが、薬を飲めば少し進行を遅らせることは出来る。","en":"Eventually, my body too would rot and collapse while I was still alive. The disease could not be cured, though medicine could slow its progression somewhat.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r103","rowIndex":103,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　この病気の予後は、現在のデータでは発症から五年後の生存率が八割で、それ以後１０年で５割、１５年で２割と減少してゆく。医療技術の向上でマシになる可能性はあるが、長くても２０年は生きられないと考えた方がいい。","en":"According to the data presently available, the survival rate for this disease was eighty percent five years after onset, fifty percent at ten years, and twenty percent at fifteen, declining as time passed. Medical advances might improve the outlook, but I would be wise to assume that I could not live longer than twenty years.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r104","rowIndex":104,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　常識的に考えれば３０過ぎに僕の寿命も尽きるということか。父さんの場合は最初に発症を確認したのは３０才くらいの時だと聞いているから、それから１５年生きたわけだから平均よりは長く生きられたということになる。僕もそれくらいは生きられるのだろうか？","en":"By any ordinary calculation, then, my life would end sometime after I turned thirty. I had heard that Father’s illness was first confirmed when he was around thirty, meaning he survived another fifteen years—longer than average. Would I live that long too?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r105","rowIndex":105,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　今日明日死ぬ病気ではないが、弱点であることにはかわりない。可能な限り隠した方がいいだろう。","en":"It is not a disease that will kill me today or tomorrow, but that does not make it any less a weakness. I should hide it to the greatest extent possible.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r106","rowIndex":106,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　面倒なことになったな、とは思う。だけれど、これはこれで良かった。つまり、僕は長くともあと２０年頑張ればいいということだ。ちょうどいいんじゃないだろうか？","en":"This has become a complication, I think. But perhaps it is for the best. It means I only have to keep going for another twenty years at most. Is that not just about right?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r107","rowIndex":107,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それにしても、無駄足を使わされた。溜息をつきつつ、僕はまた<tips=57>滑走路通り</tips>に戻る。","en":"Even so, what a wasted trip. With a sigh, I return to <tips=57>Runway Street</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r108","rowIndex":108,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ここで診察を受けるために時間をとってきたのに、急に暇になってしまった。<tips=41>グランドタワー</tips>に戻れば仕事は何かしらあるだろうが、せっかく時間を取って出て来たのに何もせずに戻るのも気が進まない。","en":"I set aside time for an examination here, only to find myself suddenly free. There will surely be work of some kind if I return to <tips=41>Grand Tower</tips>, but after making time to come out, I cannot quite bring myself to go back without doing anything.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r109","rowIndex":109,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　車を置いたまま、少しぶらぶらとすることにした。完全に一人で街を歩くのは滅多にないことだ。ずっと内外の脅威にさらされていたし、引き継いだ仕事の整理に忙殺されていた。","en":"I decide to leave the car where it is and wander for a while. It is rare for me to walk the city entirely alone. I have been exposed to threats both inside and outside the organization, and the work of sorting out everything I inherited has kept me buried.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r110","rowIndex":110,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　危険と言えば危険かもしれないが、まあ、ここで死んだら僕に運がなかったということだろう。それならそれで、気が楽だ。これから先の自分がすることを見ないで済む。","en":"It may be dangerous, but if I die here, that will simply mean I had no luck. In its own way, the thought is a relief. I will be spared having to see what I myself am going to do from this point on.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r111","rowIndex":111,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=57>滑走路通り</tips>には僕と同じくらいの年頃の若者が沢山歩いていて、今日のランチをどこでとるか探し歩いている。その中を歩く僕も、外から見れば彼らと同じように見えるだろうか。こんなスーツ姿では少し浮くだろうか。","en":"<tips=57>Runway Street</tips> is full of young people about my age, walking around in search of somewhere to have lunch. As I move among them, do I look just like one of them from the outside? Or does this suit make me stand out a little?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r112","rowIndex":112,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕の年頃でスーツを着てこんな場所をうろつくのは、大体どこか怪しげな店の従業員であるから、そのように見えているかもしれない。少なくとも、僕を見て立ち止まるような人もいないから、気がつかれてはいないようだ。","en":"Most people my age who loiter around a place like this in suits are employees of one shady establishment or another, so perhaps that is what I look like. At the very least, no one stops in their tracks at the sight of me. It seems nobody has recognized me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r113","rowIndex":113,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　子供の頃から僕は二重生活者だった。","en":"I have led a double life since childhood.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r114","rowIndex":114,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　一方では中華料理屋の日本人夫妻の息子として近くの子供と喧嘩をし、もう一方では中国人ギャングのボスの息子として他のギャングの子供たちとやたらと皿の多い食事会に参加させられた。一方では朝から晩まで酒瓶をかかえて日向で寝転んでいるようなおっさんにクソ餓鬼と罵られ、もう一方では大きな宝石をじゃらじゃらと身につけたいかついギャングに敬語を使われた。そして、大学に行けば仲間や教授と学生らしく喋ったりする。","en":"On one side, I was the son of the Japanese couple who owned a Chinese restaurant, fighting with the neighborhood children. On the other, I was the son of a Chinese gang boss, made to attend dinners with other gangsters’ children where far too many dishes covered the table. On one side, an old drunk who lay in the sun clutching a bottle from morning to night called me a little shit. On the other, intimidating gangsters hung with enormous jewels addressed me in the most respectful language. And when I go to university, I speak to my friends and professors like any other student.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r115","rowIndex":115,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　中華料理屋では一応息子という態で親しくしてもらっていたが客のようにぎこちない場面もあったし、母と妹が暮らす家に行くと歓迎はされるもののやはり客のように扱われた。","en":"At the Chinese restaurant, I was treated warmly enough as their son, but some moments carried the awkwardness of dealing with a customer. When I visited the home where Mother and my sister lived, they welcomed me, yet there too I was treated as something of a guest.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r116","rowIndex":116,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕は何者でもあったし、何者でもなかった。","en":"I was all manner of people, and I was no one at all.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r117","rowIndex":117,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　昔は自分のなかを風が吹き抜けているような虚しさがこわくて、必死で何かになろうとしていた。","en":"In those days, the emptiness frightened me—as though the wind were blowing straight through me—and I desperately tried to become something.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r118","rowIndex":118,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　でも、今となっては何者でもなくて良かったのだと思う。","en":"But now I think it was good that I was nothing.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r119","rowIndex":119,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　たとえば今ここで僕が突然死んだとして、それをもう一人の僕が見ていたとしても、悲しむこともないだろう。","en":"If I were suddenly to die here, and another version of me were watching it happen, even he would probably feel no sadness.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r120","rowIndex":120,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それにしても、<tips=25>世傑</tips>は変わったヤツだ。","en":"Still, <tips=25>Sai-kit</tips> is an odd one.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r121","rowIndex":121,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=25>世傑</tips>は幼いころから父の<tips=4>馬明</tips>に拳法を仕込まれており、それを使って空手の大会で優勝するなどして街では知られた人物だった。","en":"From early childhood, <tips=25>Sai-kit</tips> had been trained in martial arts by his father, <tips=4>Ma Ming</tips>. He used those skills to win karate tournaments and became well known around the city.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r122","rowIndex":122,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=4>馬明</tips>の家の近くではよく野良猫や野良犬が骨を砕かれて死んでいたが、それらはすべて<tips=25>世傑</tips>の仕業だと噂されていた。","en":"Stray cats and dogs were often found dead near <tips=4>Ma Ming’s</tips> home, their bones crushed, and rumor had it that <tips=25>Sai-kit</tips> was responsible for every one of them.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r123","rowIndex":123,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼は父親の<tips=4>馬明</tips>の教えに従って、街の人間と喧嘩をしないよう行動を慎んでいたが、１２才の頃に一度だけ力を用いたことがある。","en":"In obedience to his father <tips=4>Ma Ming’s</tips> teachings, he was careful not to fight people in the city, but once, when he was twelve, he used his strength.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r124","rowIndex":124,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　妹の<tips=24>美美</tips>にしつこくつきまとったチンピラを咎めたところ諍いになって、相手を殴り殺してしまった。それ以来、彼の家のまわりには犬猫の死体が増えたという話だ。","en":"When he confronted a hoodlum who had persistently harassed his sister <tips=24>Meimei</tips>, the dispute turned violent, and he beat the man to death. People said that afterward, more dead dogs and cats appeared around his home.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r125","rowIndex":125,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　もしかしたら、その時彼は死に取り憑かれたのかもしれない。","en":"Perhaps that was when death took possession of him.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r126","rowIndex":126,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼が１８になったとき、運命を変える恋をした。","en":"When he turned eighteen, he fell in love, and the course of his life changed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r127","rowIndex":127,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その頃彼はもう<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>で働きその勇気を認められはじめていた。","en":"By then, he was already working for <tips=7>YS</tips> and had begun to win recognition for his courage.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r128","rowIndex":128,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　恋の相手はその<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>の同僚の王という男の娘だった。あちこちの女と浮き名を流していた<tips=25>世傑</tips>が、初めて本気になった女だったかもしれない。","en":"The object of his love was the daughter of a man named Wang, one of his colleagues in <tips=7>YS</tips>. <tips=25>Sai-kit</tips> had made a name for himself with women here and there, but she may have been the first he ever loved in earnest.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r129","rowIndex":129,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しかし、その恋は仕組まれたものだった。","en":"But the romance had been contrived.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r130","rowIndex":130,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　王は<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>内では禁止されている麻薬の取引を行っていた。幹部であり<tips=81>龍頭</tips>の親友でもある<tips=4>馬明</tips>の長男を籠絡することで、保身を図ったのである。","en":"Wang had been dealing drugs, which was prohibited within <tips=7>YS</tips>. He sought to protect himself by ensnaring the eldest son of <tips=4>Ma Ming</tips>, an officer and close friend of the <tips=81>Longtou</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r131","rowIndex":131,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　やがて<tips=25>世傑</tips>はその事実を知り、王の家族を一晩で皆殺しにしてしまった。彼が愛した女も首の骨を折られて家に転がっていた。","en":"Eventually <tips=25>Sai-kit</tips> learned the truth and slaughtered Wang’s entire family in a single night. The woman he had loved lay in the house as well, her neck broken.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r132","rowIndex":132,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　王のしたことは死に値する罪であったが、その家族まで殺害する必要はない。また<tips=25>世傑</tips>が指示もなく独断でこれほどのことをしでかしてしまうのは、組織の秩序を無視した行動であり、非難の対象にもなる。","en":"What Wang had done was a crime deserving death, but there was no need to kill his family as well. For <tips=25>Sai-kit</tips> to commit an act on this scale on his own initiative, without orders, was a violation of the organization’s order and grounds for censure in itself.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r133","rowIndex":133,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　結局、彼はこのことが原因で<tips=9>Y地区</tips>を去ることになった。","en":"In the end, this incident forced him to leave <tips=9>Y District</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r134","rowIndex":134,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　これが、僕が呼び戻すまでの彼の半生だ。","en":"That was the course of his life up until I called him back.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r135","rowIndex":135,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼は今も犬や猫や、あるいはその辺りの人間を殺しているのだろうか？　今は仕事が多いからその必要はないのだろうか。あまりにもひどいトラブルを起こさず、真面目に仕事さえしてくれれば僕にとってはどちらでもいい。","en":"Does he still kill dogs and cats, or people in the area? Or does all the work he has now mean there is no longer any need? As long as he avoids causing any truly egregious trouble and does his work conscientiously, I do not care either way.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r136","rowIndex":136,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　——ただひとつ気に食わないのは、どうも、あいつが僕のことを自分と同類だと思っているらしいところだ。","en":"—There is only one thing I dislike: somehow, he seems to think I am the same kind of creature he is.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r137","rowIndex":137,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　子供の頃は、将来<tips=25>世傑</tips>と組んで仕事をするとは思わなかったな。","en":"As a child, I never imagined that I would one day work with <tips=25>Sai-kit</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r138","rowIndex":138,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=4>馬明</tips>の家にはよく行ったが、そこではほとんど顔を合わせることがなかった。","en":"I often visited <tips=4>Ma Ming’s</tips> home, but almost never crossed paths with him there.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r139","rowIndex":139,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　一方、彼の妹の<tips=24>美美</tips>は幼い頃から親しくしていた人間の一人なんだ。","en":"His younger sister, <tips=24>Meimei</tips>, on the other hand, is one of the people I have been close to since childhood.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r140","rowIndex":140,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　明るく快活で子供の頃はみなのアイドルだった。けれど、今はよくわからない日本人と結婚して子供を作った。","en":"Bright and spirited, she had been everyone’s idol as a girl. But now she had married some Japanese man I knew nothing about and had a child.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r141","rowIndex":141,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女はギャングの娘とも思えぬ平凡でささやかな幸福を手に入れたというわけだ。それが、今日の後も続いてくれれば嬉しいのだけれど。","en":"She has found the kind of ordinary, modest happiness one would never expect for a gangster’s daughter. I only hope it continues after today.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r142","rowIndex":142,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=25>世傑</tips>は今どんな気持ちなのかな？　想像しようと思ったが、気持ちが暗くなるだけなので、やめた。","en":"How is <tips=25>Sai-kit</tips> feeling now, I wonder? I try to imagine it, but the attempt only darkens my mood, so I stop.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r143","rowIndex":143,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　小腹が空いたので久しぶりに買い食いでもしようかとあちこち見て回っていると、思わぬ人物にでくわした。","en":"A little hungry, I wander around thinking I might buy myself something to eat for the first time in ages, and run into someone I never expected.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r144","rowIndex":144,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あ、<tips=1>リョウ</tips>さん」","en":"“Oh, <tips=1>Ryo</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐松子","displayName":"Matsuko Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r145","rowIndex":145,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕はすっかり驚いてしまった。そこに立っていたのは<tips=55>汐松子</tips>だったからだ。","en":"I am completely taken aback. The person standing there is <tips=55>Matsuko Shio</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r146","rowIndex":146,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　買い物に来たところなのか、まだ物が入っていないぺたりとしたトートバッグを肩にかけている。","en":"Perhaps she is here to shop. A still-flat tote bag with nothing in it hangs from her shoulder.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r147","rowIndex":147,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　久しぶりに見た<tips=55>松子</tips>はなんだかまぶしく見えて、僕は不覚にもドキリとし、その感情を押し隠すために目を細めた。","en":"Seeing <tips=55>Matsuko</tips> again after so long, I find her somehow dazzling. A jolt in my chest catches me off guard, and I narrow my eyes to hide it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r148","rowIndex":148,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「やあ」","en":"“Hey.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r149","rowIndex":149,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　会うどころか、何の連絡もしていない。あの日汐家の地下室で気まずい別れをして以来だった。","en":"I have not seen her, much less contacted her, since our awkward parting that day in the basement of the Shio house.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r150","rowIndex":150,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=55>松子</tips>のことも、あの実験のことも、時折思い出して気にかけてはいたけれど、<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>に来てから命のやりとりばかりしていたのでそちらに何かをさく余裕はなかった。","en":"I have thought from time to time about <tips=55>Matsuko</tips> and the experiment, and worried about both. But since coming to <tips=7>YS</tips>, I have been caught in one exchange of life and death after another, with nothing left to spare for them.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r151","rowIndex":151,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　だからこうして会えたのは嬉しいはずなのに、心の準備もないまま出くわしてしまうと、若干ばつが悪かった。そして、胸がチクチクと痛んだ。","en":"I should be glad to see her like this, yet running into her without any time to prepare leaves me faintly embarrassed. A prickling ache touches my chest.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r152","rowIndex":152,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「元気そうだね。<tips=54>汐さん</tips>は？」","en":"“You look well. How is <tips=54>Mr. Shio</tips>?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r153","rowIndex":153,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「元気です。<tips=1>リョウ</tips>さんはどうですか？」","en":"“He’s well. How about you, <tips=1>Ryo</tips>?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐松子","displayName":"Matsuko Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r154","rowIndex":154,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「僕も元気だよ」","en":"“I’m doing well too.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r155","rowIndex":155,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女はニコニコと笑っている。このような立場になってしまった僕のことをどう思っているのだろう？　まさか知らない、ということはないと思うのだけれど。","en":"She is all smiles. What does she think of me now that I have ended up in this position? Surely she cannot be unaware of it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r156","rowIndex":156,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その場を立ち去ってしまおうかと思ったけれども、こういう時に出会うのも何かの縁なのだろうと考え直した。それに、この機会を逃したら、おそらくもう会うこともないのかもしれないのだから。","en":"I considered walking away, but then decided that meeting at a time like this must be some kind of fate. Besides, if I let this chance pass, I might never see her again.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r157","rowIndex":157,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……いま食事をする場所を探していたんだ。一緒にどう？」","en":"“...I was just looking for somewhere to eat. Would you like to join me?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r158","rowIndex":158,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そう誘うと、","en":"When I invited her,","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r159","rowIndex":159,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「はい」","en":"“Yes,”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐松子","displayName":"Matsuko Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r160","rowIndex":160,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女は屈託なく頷いた。","en":"she said, nodding without hesitation.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r161","rowIndex":161,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　前から行ってみたいレストランがあると言うので、店選びは彼女に任せて僕はそれについて歩いた。","en":"She said there was a restaurant she had wanted to try for some time, so I let her choose and followed her there.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r162","rowIndex":162,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「新しく出来たレストランなんですけれど、私の職場の女の子が、みんな絶讃してるんですよ」","en":"“It’s a new restaurant, and all the girls at work have been raving about it.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐松子","displayName":"Matsuko Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r163","rowIndex":163,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=55>松子</tips>ははしゃいで、何度も振り返りながらそう話す。","en":"Bubbling with excitement, <tips=55>Matsuko</tips> tells me this while repeatedly glancing back.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r164","rowIndex":164,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その態度は以前と変わりなく、僕の立場が変わったことも、連絡が疎遠になっていることも気にしてはいないように見えた。そう振る舞っているだけなのか、誤魔化しのない素直な態度なのか、わかりかねた。","en":"Her manner seemed unchanged from before. She appeared unconcerned by the change in my position or our long silence. Whether she was only acting that way or being as candid as she appeared, I could not tell.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r165","rowIndex":165,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「きみが食べ物のことをどうこう言うようになるなんて、今さらながら驚きだな」","en":"“Even after all this time, it still surprises me to hear you talking about food.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r166","rowIndex":166,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕が言うと、","en":"When I said that,","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r167","rowIndex":167,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「昔のことを思うと、そうかもしれないですね」","en":"“Thinking back to how I used to be, I suppose so.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐松子","displayName":"Matsuko Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r168","rowIndex":168,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=55>松子</tips>はそう苦笑した。","en":"<tips=55>Matsuko</tips> answers with a wry smile.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r169","rowIndex":169,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「普通になれたのは、<tips=1>リョウ</tips>さんと父のおかげです」","en":"“It was thanks to <tips=1>Ryo</tips> and Father that I was able to become normal.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐松子","displayName":"Matsuko Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r170","rowIndex":170,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女が機嫌良さそうにすればするほど、僕はその本心を図りかねた。","en":"The more cheerful she seems, the less able I am to fathom what she truly feels.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r171","rowIndex":171,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=55>松子</tips>が連れて来てくれたレストランはロシア料理を扱う店で、入り口のところには緑青のついた古い銅製のサモワールが飾られていた。サモワールというのはお湯を沸かす道具で、古いロシアの小説でお茶を飲むシーンなどによく登場する。","en":"The restaurant <tips=55>Matsuko</tips> brings me to serves Russian cuisine. Beside the entrance stands an old copper samovar green with verdigris. A samovar is a vessel for boiling water, often found in tea-drinking scenes in old Russian novels.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r172","rowIndex":172,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　日本で活動する外国人マフィアと言えば、中国などと並ぶ存在となるのがロシアンマフィアだが、この街にはロシア人のグループはそう多くない。かつては存在していたけれども、<tips=68>木下組</tips>と強く結びついていたせいで<tips=18>ローズ・クラブ</tips>の撤退と共に姿を消したと聞いている。","en":"When one speaks of foreign mafias operating in Japan, the Russian mafia stands beside the Chinese as one of the foremost examples. Yet there are not many Russian groups in this city. I have heard that they once had a presence here, but disappeared with the withdrawal of the <tips=18>Rose Club</tips> because of their close ties to the <tips=68>Kinoshita-gumi</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r173","rowIndex":173,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　今この街でもっとも力のあるロシア人勢力と言えば、<tips=31>エリー・ホワイト</tips>たちなのかもしれないが彼らはそもそもマフィアというよりも、純粋な商人と言うべき人々だった。彼女たちはまだ吸収を受け入れてはいないが、さほど気にすることはないだろう。僕に従うのがいやというよりも、商人としての顧客情報などを共有によって流出させたくないというのが本心だと思う。","en":"The strongest Russian force in the city at present might have been <tips=31>Ellie White</tips> and her people, but they were merchants in the purest sense, rather than a mafia. They had not yet agreed to be absorbed, though I saw little cause for concern. I believed their true objection was not to obeying me, but to the risk that integration would expose customer information and other commercial secrets.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r174","rowIndex":174,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そんなことをぼんやり考えていると、<tips=55>松子</tips>が僕の方を見ていた。","en":"As I drift through these thoughts, I realize <tips=55>Matsuko</tips> is looking at me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r175","rowIndex":175,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どうしたの？」","en":"“What is it?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r176","rowIndex":176,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どの席がいいかって、店員さんから聞かれているんです」","en":"“The server is asking which table you would prefer.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐松子","displayName":"Matsuko Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r177","rowIndex":177,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=55>松子</tips>はさっきから僕に、窓際の席がいいのか、奥の席がいいのかを訊ねていたらしい。僕はすっかり上の空で無視をしてしまっていた。","en":"Apparently, <tips=55>Matsuko</tips> has been asking me for some time whether I would prefer a table by the window or one farther inside. Lost completely in thought, I have been ignoring her.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r178","rowIndex":178,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「奥がいいかな」","en":"“Farther inside, I think.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r179","rowIndex":179,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　外から丸見えの窓際の席は狙われやすい。もっとも、一人でうろついている時点で僕の安全意識などというものは問題外で、今さら気をつけてどうするのだという感はあるのだが。","en":"A table beside the window, in plain view from outside, made an easier target. Of course, once I had begun wandering alone, any claim I had to security consciousness was already out of the question, so taking precautions now felt rather pointless.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r180","rowIndex":180,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　昼のランチメニューは魚と肉とベジタリアン向けの野菜料理の三種類が選べるそうなので、僕は肉を、彼女は魚を頼んだ。","en":"The lunch menu offered a choice of fish, meat, or a vegetable dish for vegetarians. I ordered the meat and Matsuko the fish.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r181","rowIndex":181,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕らが入った時はまだ席を選べたが、そこから続いて客が入ったために４０席ほどの店内はあっという間に満席になっていた。評判がいいというのは本当らしい。","en":"We could still choose our table when we entered, but customers continued to stream in behind us, and the restaurant’s forty or so seats filled in no time. Apparently, it is true that the place has a good reputation.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r182","rowIndex":182,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「スーツ姿、あんまり見たことなかったですけど似合ってますね」","en":"“I haven’t seen you in a suit very often, but it looks good on you.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r183","rowIndex":183,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「仕方がないよ。僕も『就職』したわけだからね。社会人の面倒くさいところさ」","en":"“It can’t be helped. I’ve ‘found employment’ too, you see. One of the inconveniences of becoming a working adult.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r184","rowIndex":184,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　冗談めかして肩をすくめると、彼女は笑う。","en":"I give a joking shrug, and she laughs.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r185","rowIndex":185,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あんまり変わってないようで安心しました」","en":"“I’m relieved you don’t seem to have changed very much.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r186","rowIndex":186,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そりゃ、人間自体はそうそう変わるものじゃない。立場が変わったとしてもね」","en":"“People themselves don’t change that easily, even when their circumstances do.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r187","rowIndex":187,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕はグラスの水に口をつけてから、","en":"I took a sip from my glass, then asked,","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r188","rowIndex":188,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=54>汐さん</tips>はどうしてる？　全部やりかけのまま、連絡もしていないから、気になっていて」","en":"“How is <tips=54>Mr. Shio</tips>? I left everything unfinished and haven’t even contacted him, so he has been on my mind.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r189","rowIndex":189,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「一人で続きをしているみたいですよ。<tips=1>リョウ</tips>さんのことは、あんまり言いませんけれど、気の毒だって感じのことは言ってました」","en":"“It seems he’s continuing the work on his own. He doesn’t say much about you, <tips=1>Ryo</tips>, but he has said things that made it sound as though he felt sorry for you.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r190","rowIndex":190,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうか」","en":"“I see.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r191","rowIndex":191,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　自分から頼んだ実験も放り出し、彼の嫌いなギャングになってしまって、<tips=54>汐さん</tips>も失望しているだろう。","en":"I had abandoned the experiment I had requested and become one of the gangsters he hated. <tips=54>Mr. Shio</tips> must have been disappointed in me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r192","rowIndex":192,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「多分もう顔を出せないから、好きにして欲しいと伝えてくれないか？」","en":"“I probably won’t be able to show my face there again, so would you tell him he can do whatever he likes?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r193","rowIndex":193,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕の言葉に、彼女は一瞬だけ間を置いてから、","en":"At my words, she pauses for only a moment before answering,","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r194","rowIndex":194,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「はい」","en":"“Yes,”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r195","rowIndex":195,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　と言った。","en":"she says.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r196","rowIndex":196,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして僕らのテーブルには前菜が並べられた。これだけ混雑しているのに、ちゃんと一皿ずつ配るとはなかなか難しいことをしている。店員は忙しくテーブルの間を歩き回っているが笑顔を忘れない、全体として感じのいい店だった。","en":"Then the appetizers are arranged across our table. In a restaurant this crowded, properly serving every diner one plate at a time is no easy feat. The staff bustle between the tables without ever forgetting to smile. All in all, it is a pleasant place.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r197","rowIndex":197,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　胸のネームプレートを見ると店員は日本人ばかりだ。雰囲気からすると、よその地域からここへアルバイトをしに来ているものも多いのだろう。","en":"Judging by the nameplates on their chests, all the servers are Japanese. From the general air of the place, many of them have probably come here from other districts for part-time work.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r198","rowIndex":198,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　昔はこの街でこのような仕事をするのは地元の人間ばかりだったが、時代は変わった。","en":"In the old days, almost everyone doing this kind of work in the city was local. Times have changed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r199","rowIndex":199,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「私、ずっと心配してたんですよ」","en":"“I’ve been worried about you all this time.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r200","rowIndex":200,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　前菜に取りかかりながら、<tips=55>松子</tips>はそう言った。","en":"<tips=55>Matsuko</tips> says this as she begins eating her appetizer.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r201","rowIndex":201,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あんまり危ないことをして、怪我とかして欲しくないなって。無茶はしないでくださいね」","en":"“I don’t want you doing anything too dangerous and getting hurt. Please don’t take reckless chances.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r202","rowIndex":202,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「無茶な注文だな」","en":"“That’s asking the impossible.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r203","rowIndex":203,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕は苦笑して、エビを一つフォークで串刺しにして、口に放り込む。ドレッシングの酸味がちょうどよく、美味かった。","en":"I smile wryly, spear a shrimp with my fork, and pop it into my mouth. The tang of the dressing is just right, and the shrimp is delicious.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r204","rowIndex":204,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうかもしれないですけど……」","en":"“Maybe so, but...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r205","rowIndex":205,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=55>松子</tips>は表情を曇らせる。","en":"<tips=55>Matsuko’s</tips> expression clouds.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r206","rowIndex":206,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それより、実験のことを隠していてすまなかった」","en":"“More importantly, I’m sorry I kept the experiment from you.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r207","rowIndex":207,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そのことは、もう……」","en":"“That’s already...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r208","rowIndex":208,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いや、あれはよくなかった」","en":"“No. That wasn’t right.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r209","rowIndex":209,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕は唇を紙ナプキンで拭い、","en":"I wipe my lips with a paper napkin, then continue,","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r210","rowIndex":210,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「やっぱり、僕たちには、きみを実験に協力させた引け目みたいなのがあって、だから正直に言うことが出来なかったんだ」","en":"“The truth is, we’d always felt guilty about involving you in the experiment. That was why we couldn’t bring ourselves to be honest with you.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r211","rowIndex":211,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……引け目なんか、感じることないのに」","en":"“...You didn’t need to feel guilty.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r212","rowIndex":212,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=55>松子</tips>は小さく呟き、","en":"<tips=55>Matsuko</tips> murmurs,","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r213","rowIndex":213,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「この間も言いましたけれど、そのおかげで私はこうしているんですから。私みたいなわけのわからないもの、普通はいやですよ。あの家に拾ってもらえて、本当に幸運だったと思います。あそこじゃなかったら、こんなふうに人間として生活することなんか出来ていなかった。全部お二人のおかげなんですよ」","en":"“I told you this the other day, but that experiment is why I’m able to be here like this now. Normally, no one would want some incomprehensible thing like me. I was truly fortunate to be taken in by that household. Anywhere else, I would never have been able to live this way as a human being. I owe it all to the two of you.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r214","rowIndex":214,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女はそう言って微笑む。僕はなんとも言えない。","en":"She smiles as she says this. I don’t know what to say.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r215","rowIndex":215,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それより私こそ、あのとき断ってしまって」","en":"“If anything, I’m the one who turned you down then...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r216","rowIndex":216,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女はそう言って真顔で僕の目を見る。僕は何も言わず、その目を見返したまま水を飲む。","en":"Her face turns serious as she says this, and she looks me straight in the eyes. Without a word, I hold her gaze as I drink my water.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r217","rowIndex":217,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あのとき、私も一緒に街を出ると言っていたら、こんな仕事しないで済んだのかもしれないですね。それがわかっていたら、私も……」","en":"“If I had said then that I would leave the city with you, perhaps you would never have had to do this work. If I had understood that, I might have...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r218","rowIndex":218,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いや、それは違うよ」","en":"“No, that isn’t true.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r219","rowIndex":219,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕は途中で割り込んだ。","en":"I cut in before she can finish.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r220","rowIndex":220,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=55>松子</tips>がうんと言ったとしても、きっとこうなっていたと思う。逃れることは出来ないし、逃れてもいけないことなんだろう。僕はこの組織を守らなければいけないし、それに、驕って言うわけじゃないが、これは僕にしか出来ない仕事なんだ。最近そう感じている」","en":"“Even if you had said yes, <tips=55>Matsuko</tips>, I’m sure things would still have turned out this way. It isn’t something I can escape, and probably isn’t something I should escape, either. I have to protect this organization. And I don’t mean this arrogantly, but it’s work only I can do. That’s how I’ve begun to feel lately.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r221","rowIndex":221,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=1>リョウ</tips>さんは、昔からすごかったですものね」","en":"“You always were amazing, <tips=1>Ryo</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r222","rowIndex":222,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=55>松子</tips>は微笑し、","en":"<tips=55>Matsuko</tips> smiles and says,","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r223","rowIndex":223,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そう言えば、実験と言えば……」","en":"“Speaking of the experiment...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r224","rowIndex":224,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そう言いかけたまま、彼女は黙ってしまう。","en":"She trails off and falls silent.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r225","rowIndex":225,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どうしたの？」","en":"“What is it?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r226","rowIndex":226,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いえ、なんでもないです」","en":"“No, it’s nothing.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r227","rowIndex":227,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女は誤魔化すように笑い、","en":"She gives an evasive laugh, then says,","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r228","rowIndex":228,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それより、最近思うんですけれど、人間には、運命というものがあるのかもしれませんね」","en":"“Anyway, lately I’ve found myself wondering whether people might really have such a thing as destiny.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r229","rowIndex":229,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なんだい急に」","en":"“Where did that come from?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r230","rowIndex":230,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「実は、今、自分についていろいろ調べているんです。それで、新しいことがいろいろわかってきて」","en":"“The truth is, I’ve been looking into all sorts of things about myself. I’ve begun to learn a great deal.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r231","rowIndex":231,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「へえ、それはすごいね。何がわかったの？」","en":"“Oh? That’s amazing. What did you find out?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r232","rowIndex":232,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「父が私を拾う前のこととか……。<tips=1>リョウ</tips>さんが最近忙しかったように、私にもあれからとてもいろんなことがあって……全部はっきりしたら、<tips=1>リョウ</tips>さんにも報告したいです」","en":"“Things about the time before Father found me... Just as you’ve been busy lately, <tips=1>Ryo</tips>, a great deal has happened to me since then... Once everything has become clear, I’d like to tell you about it too, <tips=1>Ryo</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r233","rowIndex":233,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「今わかっていることだけでも、教えてよ」","en":"“Then at least tell me what you know so far.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r234","rowIndex":234,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それは駄目ですよー」","en":"“Nope. I can’t do that.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r235","rowIndex":235,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=55>松子</tips>は笑って言う。気になったが、何か考えがあるのだろう。それに、今の僕は彼女にそこまで干渉できる立場でもない。","en":"<tips=55>Matsuko</tips> says with a laugh. I’m curious, but she must have something in mind. Besides, I’m no longer in any position to meddle in her life to that extent.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r236","rowIndex":236,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そう」","en":"“I see,”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r237","rowIndex":237,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　とだけ言った。","en":"is all I say.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r238","rowIndex":238,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「全部がわかったその時は、私も、借りたものを返さなくちゃいけないのかもしれません」","en":"“Once I understand everything, perhaps I will have to return what I borrowed.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r239","rowIndex":239,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女は神妙な面持ちでそう言う。","en":"She says this with a solemn expression.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r240","rowIndex":240,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「私、この<tips=54><tips=54>汐さん</tips></tips>の娘という立場も、<tips=55>汐松子</tips>という名前も、お返ししたほうがいいのかなって思ってるんです。お父さんのことは好きですし、つき合いを変えるとかじゃないんですけど……」","en":"“I’ve been wondering if perhaps I ought to give back both my place as <tips=54><tips=54>Mr. Shio’s</tips></tips> daughter and the name <tips=55>Matsuko Shio</tips>. I love Father, and it’s not that I want anything between us to change, but...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r241","rowIndex":241,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いや、全部わかって、たとえば本当の両親のことがはっきりしたとしても、その必要はないんじゃないかな？　<tips=54><tips=54>汐さん</tips></tips>も本当の娘だと思ってるし、きっと寂しがる」","en":"“Even if you find out everything—who your birth parents are, for instance—I don’t think that means you need to do that. <tips=54><tips=54>Mr. Shio</tips></tips> thinks of you as his own daughter, and I’m sure he’d be lonely.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r242","rowIndex":242,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そういうわけにもいかなそうな気がするんです……」","en":"“I have a feeling it may not be that simple...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r243","rowIndex":243,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=55>松子</tips>の口ぶりからすると、判明しつつある事実が、簡単なものではないのかもしれない。しかしそれは、<tips=18>ローズ・クラブ</tips>のゴミ捨て場から拾った時点で<tips=54><tips=54>汐さん</tips></tips>も理解しているはずだろう。","en":"Judging by the way <tips=55>Matsuko</tips> speaks, the facts now coming to light may be far from simple. But surely <tips=54><tips=54>Mr. Shio</tips></tips> understood as much from the moment he found her in the <tips=18>Rose Club’s</tips> garbage dump.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r244","rowIndex":244,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「考えすぎだよ。考えるのはいいことだけど、考えすぎはよくない。あ、それ、ピクルスも入ってて美味しいよ。食べなよ」","en":"“You’re overthinking it. Thinking is good, but overthinking isn’t. Oh, that one has pickles in it, too. It’s delicious—try it.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r245","rowIndex":245,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あ、はい」","en":"“Ah, yes.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r246","rowIndex":246,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=55>松子</tips>が放置していた自分の皿に慌てて手をつけると、","en":"<tips=55>Matsuko</tips> hurriedly begins eating from the plate she has left untouched.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r247","rowIndex":247,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「美味しい」","en":"“It’s delicious.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r248","rowIndex":248,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　と笑顔を作った。","en":"She forces a smile as she says it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r249","rowIndex":249,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=55>松子</tips>は相変わらず、フォークとナイフを使って何かを食べるとぎこちなくなる。箸の使い方はうまいのに。","en":"As ever, <tips=55>Matsuko</tips> grows awkward whenever she eats with a knife and fork, though she handles chopsticks perfectly well.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r250","rowIndex":250,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「本当に美味しいと思ってる？　さっきも言ったけれど、やっぱり不思議なんだよ。昔はものの味なんか全然わからなかったくせに。覚えてるかな。なんでもぐちゃぐちゃに混ぜてたんだ」","en":"“Do you really think it tastes good? Like I said before, it still seems strange to me. You used to have no sense of taste at all. Do you remember? You would mix everything together into a horrible mess.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r251","rowIndex":251,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あ、あれは、私が未熟だったんです。今は食べるのも楽しいって、わかりますから」","en":"“Th-that was because I was immature. Now I understand that eating can be enjoyable.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r252","rowIndex":252,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=55>松子</tips>は照れて顔を赤くする。","en":"Embarrassed, <tips=55>Matsuko</tips> blushes.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r253","rowIndex":253,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それはよかった」","en":"“I’m glad.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r254","rowIndex":254,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……そう言えば、話はかわりますけど」","en":"“...Changing the subject...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r255","rowIndex":255,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「何？」","en":"“What?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r256","rowIndex":256,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「最近灰上さんたちが何をしているか知ってますか？」","en":"“Do you know what the Haigami sisters have been doing lately?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r257","rowIndex":257,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「本当に話がかわったな」","en":"“That really is a change of subject.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r258","rowIndex":258,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕は肩をすくめて、","en":"I shrug and say,","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r259","rowIndex":259,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「僕は何も知らないよ。あいつらは普通に学生やってるんじゃないのかい？」","en":"“I don’t know anything. Aren’t they just ordinary students now?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r260","rowIndex":260,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうですか……」","en":"“I see...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r261","rowIndex":261,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして考え込む彼女の態度は不審だった。<tips=86>灰上姉妹</tips>のことを、<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>の<tips=81>龍頭</tips>になった僕にわざわざ訊ねたのだ。","en":"There is something suspicious about the way she falls into thought. She has gone out of her way to ask me—the new <tips=81>Longtou</tips> of <tips=7>YS</tips>—about the <tips=86>Haigami sisters</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r262","rowIndex":262,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あいつら、何かおかしなことに足をつっこんだりしてるのか？」","en":"“Have they gotten themselves mixed up in something they shouldn’t have?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r263","rowIndex":263,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いえ、<tips=1>リョウ</tips>さんが知らないなら、それでいいんです」","en":"“No. If you don’t know, <tips=1>Ryo</tips>, then it doesn’t matter.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r264","rowIndex":264,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=55>松子</tips>はそう言って笑うが、何か誤魔化しているように思えた。","en":"<tips=55>Matsuko</tips> smiles as she says this, but I have the sense that she is evading something.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r265","rowIndex":265,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=86>灰上姉妹</tips>は有り余る能力を無駄遣いする問題児で、このままではろくな人生を歩まないだろうと、僕は進学を勧め、彼女たちもそれに従ったはずなのに。","en":"The <tips=86>Haigami sisters</tips> are problem children who squander their abundant talent. Convinced they would never lead decent lives at that rate, I urged them to continue their education, and they were supposed to have taken my advice. And yet...","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r266","rowIndex":266,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「私、仕事やめようかな……」","en":"“Maybe I should quit my job...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r267","rowIndex":267,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　急にそんな事を言うのだけれど、それも何か関係しているのだろうか。","en":"It comes out of nowhere. Could that be connected to all this, too?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r268","rowIndex":268,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「やっぱりあいつらが何かしでかしたんじゃないのかい？　たく、しょうがないやつらだなあ。昔っから問題ばっかり起こす」","en":"“So they have gotten themselves into trouble after all, haven’t they? Honestly, those two are hopeless. They’ve done nothing but cause trouble for as long as I’ve known them.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r269","rowIndex":269,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「い、いえ、そうじゃないんです！」","en":"“N-no, that’s not it!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r270","rowIndex":270,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=55>松子</tips>は慌てて手を振る。","en":"Flustered, <tips=55>Matsuko</tips> waves her hands.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r271","rowIndex":271,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ただ、<tips=1>リョウ</tips>さんはこれから危険な目に一杯遭うかもしれないじゃないですか。そしたら、昔みたいに私がそばに居た方がいいのかなって」","en":"“It’s just... you may be facing all sorts of danger from now on, <tips=1>Ryo</tips>. So I wondered if perhaps I should stay by your side, the way I used to.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r272","rowIndex":272,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「保護者みたいなことを言う」","en":"“You’re talking like my guardian.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r273","rowIndex":273,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いや、あの……」","en":"“No, um...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r274","rowIndex":274,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=55>松子</tips>は狼狽し、","en":"<tips=55>Matsuko</tips> falters,","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r275","rowIndex":275,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「余計なこと言っちゃいましたよね。きっと、周りにはすごい<tips=16>タイプA</tips>の人とかもたくさんいるんでしょうし、今さら私なんかいたって役に立たないですよね」","en":"“I’ve said more than I should have, haven’t I? I’m sure you have plenty of amazing <tips=16>Type A</tips> people around you now, and someone like me would be no help at this point.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r276","rowIndex":276,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そういうわけじゃないよ。きみの力はよく知ってるからね。でも、巻き込みたくないんだ」","en":"“That isn’t it. I know very well what you’re capable of. I just don’t want to drag you into this.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r277","rowIndex":277,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「巻き込むなんて、そんな……何にも気にしないでいいのに……。だって私はすごく身体が丈夫なんですよ？　他の誰よりも」","en":"“Drag me into it? But... you don’t have to worry about me at all... My body is incredibly sturdy, you know? More than anyone else’s.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r278","rowIndex":278,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そういう話じゃないんだ。きみにはそっちの世界にいて、幸せに生きて欲しいんだよ。きみまでこっちに来てしまったら、本当に僕が今までやって来たことが全部無駄になってしまう。僕は……」","en":"“That isn’t what I mean. I want you to stay in that world and live happily. If you came over to this side too, everything I’ve done until now would truly have been for nothing. I...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r279","rowIndex":279,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「じゃ、じゃあっ」","en":"“Th-then...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r280","rowIndex":280,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女は珍しく僕の言葉を遮る。","en":"For once, she interrupts me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r281","rowIndex":281,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そばに居なくても、他のかたちで役に立つことがあったら、遠慮なく言ってください」","en":"“Even if I can’t stay beside you, if there is some other way I can help, please don’t hesitate to ask.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r282","rowIndex":282,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……他のかたち？」","en":"“...Some other way?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r283","rowIndex":283,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女が妙に緊張しているというか、固い感じの態度でそう言ったのが気になった。","en":"The strangely tense—almost rigid—way she says it catches my attention.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r284","rowIndex":284,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ほら、<tips=1>リョウ</tips>さんって今とても危険じゃないですか？　そうしたら、身体ももっと丈夫になった方が良いですよね。父もまだ研究しているので、詳しくわかってくるかもしれないし……。そして、失敗しない方法がわかったら、<tips=1>リョウ</tips>さんも危険な目にあっても大丈夫だし……」","en":"“<tips=1>Ryo</tips>, you’re in a very dangerous position right now, aren’t you? So it would be better if your body were stronger, too. Father is still researching it, so he may learn more... And if he finds a way to make sure it doesn’t fail, then you’d be all right even if something dangerous happened to you, <tips=1>Ryo</tips>...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r285","rowIndex":285,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　要領を得ない話しぶりだったが、僕はその言葉で彼女が何の話をしているのか理解した。","en":"Her explanation is difficult to follow, but at those words I understand what she is talking about.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r286","rowIndex":286,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ああ……」","en":"“Ah...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r287","rowIndex":287,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　思わず溜息が出てしまう。そう、彼女は危険な世界で生きる僕に、自分の『血』が使えないかと言っているのだ。不死身の身体になって、生き続けたらどうかと言っているのだ。","en":"A sigh escapes me. Of course: she is suggesting that I might use some of her “blood” while I live in this dangerous world—that I make my body immortal and go on living.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r288","rowIndex":288,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　考えてもみなかったな。でも確かにそういう手もある。もしうまく行けば、僕は銃弾を受けても倒れない身体になり、この宣告されたばかりの死病も克服出来るかもしれない。","en":"I had never even considered it. But it is certainly an option. If it worked, I might acquire a body that would not fall even after taking a bullet, and perhaps even overcome the fatal disease I have only just been diagnosed with.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r289","rowIndex":289,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「でもそれはいいんだ」","en":"“But no. I’ll pass.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r290","rowIndex":290,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　失敗時の精神的リスクがあるからそう答えたわけじゃない。仮に全てのリスクが克服されたとしても、僕はうんとは言わなかっただろう。","en":"It is not the psychological risk of failure that makes me answer that way. Even if every risk were eliminated, I still do not think I would say yes.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r291","rowIndex":291,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　何十年も、下手すればもっと、殺し合いを続けなくてはいけないだなんて、考えるのもいやだった。——父さんも、こんな気持ちだったのかな？　いや、どうだろう。彼が僕のようなひ弱な精神の持ち主だとは思えない。同じ立場になったからって、理解が出来るとは到底思えないな。","en":"The thought of having to go on killing and being killed for decades—perhaps even longer—is unbearable. —Did Father feel this way, too? No, who knows? I cannot imagine that he possessed a spirit as frail as mine. Simply finding myself in the same position hardly means I could ever understand him.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r292","rowIndex":292,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「僕はこのままでいい。このままで勝負したいんだ。気持ちはありがたいけどね」","en":"“I’m fine as I am. I want to face this fight as I am. But I appreciate the thought.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r293","rowIndex":293,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そう言うと、<tips=55>松子</tips>はがっかりしたように俯き、","en":"At that, <tips=55>Matsuko</tips> lowers her head, looking disappointed,","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r294","rowIndex":294,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうですか。やっぱり私、<tips=1>リョウ</tips>さんの心情を理解するのが下手ですね」","en":"“I see. I really am terrible at understanding how you feel, <tips=1>Ryo</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r295","rowIndex":295,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　と溜息をついた。","en":"and lets out a sigh.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r296","rowIndex":296,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　次々と料理が運ばれてくる。評判になっているだけあって不味くはない。確かに旨かった。量も丁度良い。盛り付けも丁寧で、いかにも女性に人気が出そうな感じがする。","en":"Dish after dish arrives. As one would expect of a place this well regarded, none of it is bad. It is, in fact, delicious. The portions are just right, and every dish is carefully presented—the sort of place that seems bound to be popular with women.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r297","rowIndex":297,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして、コースが進むにつれて、彼女との別れの時間が近づいてくる。","en":"And as the meal progresses from one course to the next, the time for us to part draws closer.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r298","rowIndex":298,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　こんな風に思いながら彼女と話すときが来るとは思わなかったな。僕は彼女がちっぽけな肉片だったときから、いつも自分の一部のように思って守ってきたし、色んなことを教えて来た。僕だって、一生ずっと一緒にいるものだと思っていたんだ。","en":"I never imagined a time would come when I would speak to her with thoughts like these in mind. Ever since she was a tiny scrap of flesh, I have thought of her as a part of myself, protected her, and taught her all manner of things. I, too, had always assumed we would be together for the rest of our lives.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r299","rowIndex":299,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　だが、これでいいのだろう。","en":"But surely this was for the best.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r300","rowIndex":300,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　今の彼女は以前ほど僕を必要とはしない。昔よりもずっと感情を表現出来るようになったし、自分のことは自分で決められて、本人なりの夢も希望も持っている。こんな風に積極的に自分の人生を楽しむようになるだなんて、僕の理想通りじゃないか。","en":"She no longer needs me as much as she once did. She has grown far better at expressing her emotions, can make her own decisions, and has dreams and hopes of her own. That she would come to take such an active pleasure in her own life—isn’t this exactly what I wanted?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r301","rowIndex":301,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　少なくとも今彼女がこうしているということは、僕の夢が一つ叶ったということだ。他の全ての夢が実現しなくとも、僕が何もない世界に行くのだとしても、彼女がこのまま自分の日常生活を送っていけるのならば、全てが無駄だったということにはならない。","en":"At the very least, the fact that she is here like this now means that one of my dreams has come true. Even if none of my other dreams ever come true—even if I am bound for a world with nothing in it—so long as she can go on living her ordinary life, it will mean that not everything was in vain.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r302","rowIndex":302,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　今日食事に誘って良かった。","en":"I’m glad I invited her to lunch today.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r303","rowIndex":303,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　やっとそう思えて来た時、","en":"Just as I’m finally beginning to feel that way,","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r304","rowIndex":304,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……やっぱり私、<tips=1>リョウ</tips>さんが遠くにいると寂しいです」","en":"“...I really do feel lonely when you’re far away, <tips=1>Ryo</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r305","rowIndex":305,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それまで施設の子供たちの笑えるエピソードなどを話していた<tips=55>松子</tips>が、急にそんなことを言い出した。","en":"<tips=55>Matsuko</tips>, who until that moment has been telling me funny stories about the children at her facility, suddenly says this.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r306","rowIndex":306,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　抑えてはいるが、悲痛な声だった。","en":"She tries to hold it in, but the anguish in her voice is unmistakable.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r307","rowIndex":307,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　続きの言葉を待ったがそれだけだ。彼女は少し俯いて、前髪で表情を隠している。","en":"I wait for her to continue, but that is all she says. She bows her head slightly, hiding her expression behind her bangs.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r308","rowIndex":308,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕は彼女のために何かうまい言葉をかけてやりたかったが、そういうセンスは持ち合わせていない。","en":"I want to find some comforting words for her, but I have no talent for that sort of thing.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r309","rowIndex":309,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「今の僕は、きみが離れていた方が安心する」","en":"“As things are now, I feel more at ease when you’re far away.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r310","rowIndex":310,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうですか……」","en":"“I see...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r311","rowIndex":311,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして<tips=55>松子</tips>は顔を上げ、無理矢理笑った。","en":"Then <tips=55>Matsuko</tips> raises her face and forces a smile.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r312","rowIndex":312,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「今日は会えて良かった」","en":"“I’m glad I got to see you today.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r313","rowIndex":313,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕はメインディッシュに使っていたフォークとナイフを置き、<tips=55>松子</tips>の顔を見つめた。","en":"I set down the knife and fork with which I have been eating my main course and look directly at <tips=55>Matsuko</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r314","rowIndex":314,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　すると彼女も僕の目を見つめ返す。","en":"She looks me in the eye in return.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r315","rowIndex":315,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「これが最後だ。これからは他人になる。もし僕をどこかで見かけても、誰かに僕のことを訊かれても、知らない人間として扱うんだ」","en":"“This is the last time. From now on, we will be strangers. If you ever see me somewhere, or if anyone asks you about me, treat me as someone you don’t know.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r316","rowIndex":316,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「え、それは……」","en":"“What? But...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r317","rowIndex":317,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=55>松子</tips>は顔をこわばらせる。","en":"<tips=55>Matsuko’s</tips> face stiffens.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r318","rowIndex":318,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それが僕のためなんだ」","en":"“Doing that would be for my sake.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r319","rowIndex":319,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=55>松子</tips>は戸惑いを浮かべるが、すぐに覚悟を決めたのか、微笑を浮かべ、","en":"<tips=55>Matsuko</tips> looks bewildered, but perhaps she makes up her mind at once, because a faint smile appears on her face,","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r320","rowIndex":320,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=1>リョウ</tips>さんが言うのなら、きっとそれが正しいんでしょうね」","en":"“If you say so, <tips=1>Ryo</tips>, then I’m sure it must be the right thing to do.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r321","rowIndex":321,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いろいろ、申し訳ないと思っている」","en":"“There are so many things I’m sorry for.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r322","rowIndex":322,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「とんでもないですよ。でも、お互い最後にしようと思っても、きっと最後にならないような気がするんだけどな」","en":"“Not at all. But even if we both decide this will be the last time, somehow I don’t think it really will be.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r323","rowIndex":323,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=55>松子</tips>は肩をすくめ、","en":"<tips=55>Matsuko</tips> shrugs.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r324","rowIndex":324,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「これってただの錯覚なんですかね？　私、物心ついたときからずっと<tips=1>リョウ</tips>さんがいたから、最後っていうのがどうしてもよくわからないんですよね。少し時間が経ったら、理解出来るようになるのかな……」","en":"“Is that only an illusion? You’ve always been there, <tips=1>Ryo</tips>, for as long as I can remember, so no matter how I try, I can’t quite grasp what ‘the last time’ means. Maybe, after some time has passed, I’ll come to understand...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r325","rowIndex":325,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その声は震えている。","en":"Her voice trembles.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r326","rowIndex":326,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕は何も言えず、彼女が自分で心の整理をつけるのを待つほかなかった。","en":"Unable to say anything, I can only wait for her to sort through her feelings on her own.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r327","rowIndex":327,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「へんなこと言ってすみません。でも、大丈夫です。ただ、子どもの時から、<tips=1>リョウ</tips>さんとはずっと一緒にいるんだなって、そう思ってたんですよね。だからちょっとだけ……」","en":"“I’m sorry for saying something strange. But I’m all right. It’s just that ever since I was a child, I thought that you and I would always be together, <tips=1>Ryo</tips>. So I’m just a little...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r328","rowIndex":328,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女はまた笑う。そして、笑った拍子に涙がこぼれた。","en":"She smiles again. And as she does, a tear spills from her eye.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r329","rowIndex":329,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「すみません」","en":"“I’m sorry.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r330","rowIndex":330,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　言って、ハンカチで目元を拭う。","en":"she says, dabbing at her eyes with a handkerchief.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r331","rowIndex":331,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕は息苦しさを感じながら、食事を再開する。彼女も恥ずかしそうに照れ笑いをしたあと、フォークを手に取った。","en":"With an oppressive tightness in my chest, I resume eating. She gives a self-conscious little laugh, then picks up her fork as well.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r332","rowIndex":332,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　路上で別れた後、笑って去っていった<tips=55>松子</tips>の気持ちを想像してみた。胸がちくちくと痛んだ。","en":"After we part on the street, I try to imagine what <tips=55>Matsuko</tips> is feeling as she walks away with a smile. A prickling pain runs through my chest.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r333","rowIndex":333,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　これで良かったのだと思う。これで良かったんだろう。","en":"I think this was for the best. It must have been for the best.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r334","rowIndex":334,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そうして<tips=57>滑走路通り</tips>の人混みを歩いていると、いつものひどい眠気が襲ってくる。僕は足を早めて車のところまで戻った。","en":"As I walk through the crowds on <tips=57>Runway Street</tips>, the familiar crushing drowsiness comes over me. I quicken my pace and return to the car.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r335","rowIndex":335,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　携帯電話に目覚ましのアラームの設定をして目を閉じる。","en":"I set an alarm on my phone and close my eyes.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r336","rowIndex":336,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　嗚呼、忙しいのになんということだろう！　今日はまだ<tips=28>トミー</tips>が見つけた人身売買事件の調査について指示を出さなければならなかったし、午後には大事な大事な仕事がある。まぶたのなかの暗闇を見ながら、父さんもこんな風に睡魔と戦いながら仕事をしたのだろうかと想像をした。","en":"Ah, what a time for this, when I’m so busy! I still have to give instructions for the investigation into the human-trafficking case <tips=28>Tommy</tips> discovered, and this afternoon I have very, very important work to do. Staring into the darkness behind my eyelids, I wonder whether Father, too, worked while fighting off sleep like this.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r337","rowIndex":337,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕は彼をこえなくてはいけない。そのためには、今日の午後の大仕事をうまくやり通す必要がある。","en":"I have to surpass him. To do that, I need to pull off the major job I have this afternoon.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r338","rowIndex":338,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そんなことを考えているうちに僕は意識を失うように眠りに落ちた。","en":"As I turn these thoughts over, I fall asleep as if blacking out.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r339","rowIndex":339,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>の幹部が集まるのは習慣的に会食室で食事をとりながらと決まっていたが、今日はその上の階にある会議室に呼び集めた。","en":"The officers of <tips=7>YS</tips> customarily meet over a meal in the dining room, but today I have summoned them to the conference room one floor above.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r340","rowIndex":340,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　O字の机を囲むメンバーはいつもの顔ぶれである。<tips=33>壬生屋タカシ</tips>、<tips=34>ダリオ・ボネット</tips>、<tips=31>エリー・ホワイト</tips>、<tips=28>トーマス・リャオ</tips>。<tips=35>フェルナンデス</tips>の脱退、<tips=33>壬生屋</tips>の吸収などによって組織のかたちも変わってきたので、組織図を書き直したのだが、そのなかで幹部に昇進することが決まったものたちはまだこの場には呼んでいない。","en":"The usual faces sit around the O-shaped table: <tips=33>Takashi Mibuya</tips>, <tips=34>Dario Bonetto</tips>, <tips=31>Ellie White</tips>, and <tips=28>Thomas Liao</tips>. The organization’s structure has changed with the departure of <tips=35>Fernandes</tips>, the incorporation of <tips=33>Mibuya’s</tips> organization, and other developments, so I have redrawn the organizational chart. Those slated for promotion to the officer ranks have not yet been invited to this meeting.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r341","rowIndex":341,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして部屋の壁際には、<tips=25>馬世傑</tips>とその部下たちが立ちならんでいる。彼らは<tips=81>龍頭</tips>である僕の直属の兵隊とも言うべき人間たちで、僕のボディーガードのみならず、執行部の手足となって暴力を行う専門の集団だ。","en":"Along one wall of the room stand <tips=25>Ma Sai-kit</tips> and his subordinates. They are the men one might call my personal soldiers as <tips=81>Longtou</tips>: a specialized group who serve not only as my bodyguards, but as the executive body’s arms and legs in carrying out violence.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r342","rowIndex":342,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　普段の集まりには彼らが勢揃いして部屋に並ぶということはなく、参加者たちは普段との違いに多少の戸惑いを見せている。","en":"They do not ordinarily assemble in full and line the room during these meetings, and the participants show some unease at the departure from routine.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r343","rowIndex":343,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「きょ、今日はなんの集まりなんですか？」","en":"“Wh-what are we meeting about today?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ダリオ・ボネット","displayName":"Dario Bonetto","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r344","rowIndex":344,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=34>ダリオ・ボネット</tips>は脂肪で風船のように膨れた顔をハンカチでせっせと拭い、まわりの<tips=25>世傑</tips>たちを気にしながらそう訊ねた。","en":"<tips=34>Dario Bonetto</tips> busily mops with a handkerchief at his face, swollen like a balloon with fat, as he keeps glancing at <tips=25>Sai-kit</tips> and the others and asks the question.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r345","rowIndex":345,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そのことは、主賓が来てから話す」","en":"“I will explain once our guest of honor arrives.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r346","rowIndex":346,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「はあ、そうですか。何だか物々しいですねえ」","en":"“Ah, I see. This is all rather intimidating.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ダリオ・ボネット","displayName":"Dario Bonetto","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r347","rowIndex":347,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼はそう言って苦笑する。","en":"He says this with a strained smile.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r348","rowIndex":348,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　いつも頼りなく見えるが、<tips=35>フェルナンデス</tips>がいなくなった今となってはこの<tips=34>ダリオ</tips>が幹部のなかで最年長であり、<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>結成前からこの街で様々な経験を積んだ食えない男だ。傘下にはいるよう僕が呼びかけても、承諾も拒絶もしないであいまいな態度を続けている。","en":"<tips=34>Dario</tips> always looks unreliable. Yet now that <tips=35>Fernandes</tips> is gone, he is the oldest of the officers, and a wily operator who has accumulated all manner of experience in the city since before <tips=7>YS</tips> was founded. Ever since I invited him to come under our umbrella, he has maintained an equivocal position, neither accepting nor refusing.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r349","rowIndex":349,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　プロのギャンブラーあがりらしく、好条件を引き出すために時を待っているのだろうか？　それとも何か別の考えがあるのか。現在のところ調査中だ。","en":"Is he biding his time to extract favorable terms, as one might expect from a former professional gambler? Or does he have some other design? For now, the investigation is ongoing.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r350","rowIndex":350,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「じゃあちょっと、今の時間に聞いてもいいですか？　<tips=81>龍頭</tips>にお願いしたいことがあるんですが」","en":"“Then, may I ask you something while we wait? There’s a favor I’d like to ask of you, <tips=81>Longtou</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"壬生屋タカシ","displayName":"Takashi Mibuya","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r351","rowIndex":351,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　と声をあげたのは<tips=33>壬生屋タカシ</tips>。","en":"The one who speaks up is <tips=33>Takashi Mibuya</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r352","rowIndex":352,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　正式に<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>の傘下に入った彼は、現在<tips=85>二路元帥</tips>の地位についたが、普段は<tips=41>グランドタワー</tips>に顔を出さず以前と変わることなく自分の風俗店の経営に専念している。","en":"Now formally under <tips=7>YS</tips>, he holds the rank of <tips=85>Second Route Marshal</tips>. He rarely shows his face at <tips=41>Grand Tower</tips>, however, and, just as before, devotes himself to running his sex businesses.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r353","rowIndex":353,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どうぞ」","en":"“Go ahead.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r354","rowIndex":354,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「へへ、ありがとうございます」","en":"“Heh. Thank you very much.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"壬生屋タカシ","displayName":"Takashi Mibuya","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r355","rowIndex":355,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その白い女のような顔に卑屈な笑みを浮かべる。","en":"A servile smile spreads across his pale, feminine face.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r356","rowIndex":356,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　この売春王の二代目は、父が死んで<tips=84>マイケル・ツェー</tips>が第二代<tips=81>龍頭</tips>をつとめていた頃は周囲に対して尊大な態度をとっていたが、僕が<tips=81>龍頭</tips>になってから、というか正確には<tips=27>廖志明</tips>の件があってから別人のように下手に出て来ている。","en":"This second-generation king of prostitution treated everyone around him arrogantly after his father died, during <tips=84>Michael Tse’s</tips> tenure as the second <tips=81>Longtou</tips>. But since I became <tips=81>Longtou</tips>—or, more precisely, since the matter involving <tips=27>Liao Chi-ming</tips>—he has become so obsequious that he seems like another person.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r357","rowIndex":357,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　あまりにも極端な手のひら返しだが、そういった体面は気にしない性格なのだろう。僕は異常性格者だと感じている。","en":"The about-face is extreme, but perhaps he simply does not care about appearances. I find his character abnormal.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r358","rowIndex":358,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　執行部で殺した<tips=26>劉建志</tips>は彼の幼馴染みで親友だったそうだが、そのことについても態度に出したことはない。もちろん、<tips=26>劉</tips>に同情する態度を見せることで僕らに目をつけられることをおそれ、そう振る舞っているのだろうが、本当に親友の死など歯牙にもかけなそうな雰囲気が彼にはあった。","en":"<tips=26>Ryu Kenshi</tips>, whom the executive body killed, is said to have been his childhood friend and closest companion, yet he has never shown any feeling about it. Of course, he is probably acting that way for fear that showing sympathy for <tips=26>Ryu</tips> would draw our attention. Even so, he has an air about him that suggests he might truly not care in the slightest about his best friend’s death.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r359","rowIndex":359,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕も外から見たら彼と同じように見えるのだろうかと思う時もある。","en":"Sometimes I wonder whether I look the same as him from the outside.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r360","rowIndex":360,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それでは話させてもらいますが、<tips=81>龍頭</tips>はご存じですか？　ほら、最近ジジイどもがやたらとうちらを非難してるじゃないですか。<tips=17>タイプB</tips>の敵だとかなんとかって。あれを真に受けた連中が結構居て、<tips=78>金目</tips>どもがいまごちゃごちゃしてる」","en":"“Then let me explain. Have you heard about this, <tips=81>Longtou</tips>? You know how those old bastards have been denouncing us at every turn lately, calling us enemies of the <tips=17>Type Bs</tips> and whatever else? Quite a few people have taken them seriously, and now the <tips=78>gold-eyes</tips> are in turmoil.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"壬生屋タカシ","displayName":"Takashi Mibuya","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r361","rowIndex":361,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「話は聞いている」","en":"“I’ve heard about it.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r362","rowIndex":362,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それでですね、<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>系列の店に頭のネジがゆるい<tips=78>金目</tips>が嫌がらせとかするんじゃないかって噂がたったり、<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>に味方するやつは<ruby=バーロン><tips=21>八龍会</tips></ruby>から追放するって話が出たりで、うちの女の子や従業員も動揺しちゃってるんですよ。うちはよそと比べて<tips=78>金目</tips>の比率が高いですからねえ。今日も、ナンバーの子がやめるとか言ってきて……。それで、女の子の行き帰りにいちいちボディーガードをつけたり、店の警備も増やしたいのですが、いま私が雇ってる兵隊も<tips=78>金目</tips>ばかりなんですよ……」","en":"“So here’s the problem. Rumors are going around that some screw-loose <tips=78>gold-eyes</tips> may start harassing <tips=7>YS-affiliated</tips> establishments, and there’s talk that Balong—the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips>—will expel anyone who sides with <tips=7>YS</tips>. My girls and the rest of the staff are getting nervous. <tips=78>Gold-eyes</tips> make up a larger share of our people than they do elsewhere, you see. Just today, one of my top girls said she was going to quit... I’d like to give each girl a bodyguard on her way to and from work and increase security at the shops, but almost all the soldiers I employ right now are <tips=78>gold-eyes</tips> themselves...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"壬生屋タカシ","displayName":"Takashi Mibuya","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r363","rowIndex":363,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして笑ったきり、用件をなかなか口にしない。察しろということなのだろう。","en":"He merely smiles and takes his time getting to the request itself. Apparently, he expects me to take the hint.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r364","rowIndex":364,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕は溜息をついて、","en":"I sigh and say,","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r365","rowIndex":365,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「わかった。執行部から人間を出そう」","en":"“All right. I’ll send some men from the executive body.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r366","rowIndex":366,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「さすが<tips=81>龍頭</tips>、話が早い。トップが聰明だと、部下は自分の仕事に専念出来ていいですな」","en":"“That’s our <tips=81>Longtou</tips>—quick on the uptake. When the man at the top is clever, his subordinates are free to concentrate on their own work.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"壬生屋タカシ","displayName":"Takashi Mibuya","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r367","rowIndex":367,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=33>壬生屋</tips>が声を立てて笑うと、隣の<tips=34>ダリオ</tips>が顔を顰める。","en":"<tips=33>Mibuya</tips> laughs aloud, and <tips=34>Dario</tips>, seated beside him, frowns.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r368","rowIndex":368,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=33>タカシ</tips>、お世辞も度を過ぎると下品に聞こえるよ」","en":"“<tips=33>Takashi</tips>, flattery becomes vulgar when overdone.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ダリオ・ボネット","displayName":"Dario Bonetto","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r369","rowIndex":369,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「お世辞じゃない。心から言っているんだ。<tips=34>ダリオ</tips>、あんたも早く<tips=81>龍頭</tips>の言う通りにしたらどうだい？　あんただってもう若くないんだ。いつ倒れるかわからない。そうしたら、跡を継ぐのはあのバカ息子だぜ？　あいつがトップになったら、どうせ潰しちまうんだ。そうなる前に<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>で経営する形にした方がずっと有望だろうよ」","en":"“It isn’t flattery. I mean it from the heart. <tips=34>Dario</tips>, why don’t you hurry up and do as the <tips=81>Longtou</tips> says? You aren’t young anymore. You could keel over any day. Then that idiot son of yours takes over, right? He’ll run the whole operation into the ground the moment he’s in charge. Better to let <tips=7>YS</tips> run it before that happens—give it a real future.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"壬生屋タカシ","displayName":"Takashi Mibuya","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r370","rowIndex":370,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=33>壬生屋</tips>の父と<tips=34>ダリオ・ボネット</tips>は昔は犬猿の仲で全面戦争直前まで行ったという話だが、<tips=33>壬生屋タカシ</tips>と<tips=34>ダリオ</tips>は妙に仲がよく、いつも軽口をたたき合い、お互いの店を行き来して家族ぐるみのつき合いもある。","en":"<tips=33>Mibuya’s</tips> father and <tips=34>Dario Bonetto</tips> were reportedly once like cats and dogs, and came to the brink of all-out war. Yet <tips=33>Takashi Mibuya</tips> and <tips=34>Dario</tips> get along strangely well. They are forever trading jokes, visiting each other’s establishments, and even socializing as families.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r371","rowIndex":371,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そ、その件はまだ検討中なんだよ」","en":"“I-I’m still considering that.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ダリオ・ボネット","displayName":"Dario Bonetto","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r372","rowIndex":372,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=34>ダリオ</tips>は僕の方をチラチラと見ながら、さっきよりも忙しくハンカチで顔を拭う。","en":"<tips=34>Dario</tips> keeps glancing in my direction as he mops his face even more furiously than before.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r373","rowIndex":373,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「さっさと決めなよ。そうしたら、おれがアンタの店も見てやるぜ」","en":"“Decide already. Then I’ll look after your shops, too.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"壬生屋タカシ","displayName":"Takashi Mibuya","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r374","rowIndex":374,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=33>壬生屋</tips>は面白そうに笑っている。","en":"<tips=33>Mibuya</tips> smiles as though amused.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r375","rowIndex":375,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=31>エリー</tips>は二人のやりとりに冷淡な態度を示しながら、テーブルの上に置かれた鉱泉水のグラスに手をつける。","en":"Regarding the exchange with cold indifference, <tips=31>Ellie</tips> reaches for the glass of mineral water on the table.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r376","rowIndex":376,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あんたもそうだよ。どうするつもりなんだい？　<tips=31>ミス・ホワイト</tips>」","en":"“That goes for you, too. What are you planning to do, <tips=31>Miss White</tips>?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"壬生屋タカシ","displayName":"Takashi Mibuya","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r377","rowIndex":377,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=33>壬生屋</tips>は今度は<tips=31>エリー</tips>の方に声をかけた。","en":"This time, <tips=33>Mibuya</tips> addresses <tips=31>Ellie</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r378","rowIndex":378,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=35>ミスター・フェルナンデス</tips>が抜けて、重みのない人ばかりが残ってしまいましたね。結成時はひとかどの人物ばかりが集まっていたはずなのに」","en":"“With <tips=35>Mr. Fernandes</tips> gone, nothing but lightweights remain. I was under the impression that when this organization was founded, it consisted entirely of people of some distinction.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エリー・ホワイト","displayName":"Ellie White","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r379","rowIndex":379,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=31>エリー</tips>はその言葉に直接返事をせず、独り言のようにそう呟き、つぶやいた。","en":"Rather than answer him directly, <tips=31>Ellie</tips> murmurs this as though speaking to herself.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r380","rowIndex":380,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「お姉さん、これが健全なる世代交代ってやつだよ。大体アンタだって二代目だろう？　結成時にはここにいなかったじゃないか。それに、その言い方は<tips=81>龍頭</tips>に対しても失礼になる」","en":"“Now, lady, this is what you call a healthy changing of the guard. You’re second generation yourself, aren’t you? You weren’t here when the organization was founded, either. Besides, talking like that is disrespectful to the <tips=81>Longtou</tips> as well.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"壬生屋タカシ","displayName":"Takashi Mibuya","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r381","rowIndex":381,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　大げさに顔を顰める<tips=33>壬生屋</tips>を無視しながら、<tips=31>エリー</tips>はゆっくり透明な水を飲み干して、グラスをテーブルに置いた。","en":"Ignoring <tips=33>Mibuya’s</tips> exaggerated scowl, <tips=31>Ellie</tips> slowly drains the clear water and sets her glass back on the table.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r382","rowIndex":382,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女だけは今日のこの集まりがどういう目的のものなのかを事前に知っている。その人物について調査をするために、彼女の力を借りたのだ。","en":"She alone knows in advance what today’s gathering is for. I enlisted her abilities to investigate the person in question.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r383","rowIndex":383,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして誰も彼もが話すことをなくし、自然な沈黙がその場を支配し始めた頃、ガチャリと音を立ててその人物が現れた。","en":"Eventually, everyone runs out of things to say. Just as a natural silence begins to settle over the room, the door opens with a click and that person appears.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r384","rowIndex":384,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「こちらへ」","en":"“This way.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r385","rowIndex":385,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ドアを開けた下のものに促され、ゆっくりと姿を現す。","en":"At the urging of the underling holding the door open, he slowly comes into view.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r386","rowIndex":386,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いやあ、みなさんお集まりで。遅れてすみませんな。家を出るところで、車のトラブルがありましてね」","en":"“Well, I see everyone is assembled. My apologies for being late. I had some car trouble just as I was leaving home.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬明","displayName":"Ma Ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r387","rowIndex":387,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そう笑っているのは、<tips=85>二路元帥</tips><tips=4>馬明</tips>だった。","en":"The man smiling as he says this is <tips=85>Second Route Marshal</tips> <tips=4>Ma Ming</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r388","rowIndex":388,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=4>馬明</tips>、そこにかけてくれ」","en":"“<tips=4>Ma Ming</tips>, take that seat.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r389","rowIndex":389,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕はテーブルを挟んで正面の席を指さす。そこが、この集まりの主役である彼のために空けておいた席だ。","en":"I point to the seat directly across the table from me. It is the place we have kept open for him, the central figure in this gathering.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r390","rowIndex":390,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「何の話をしていたんですか？」","en":"“What were you discussing?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬明","displayName":"Ma Ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r391","rowIndex":391,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　椅子に腰掛けると、彼はそう訊ねる。","en":"he asks as he takes his seat.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r392","rowIndex":392,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼には、今日この場では<tips=21>八龍会</tips>への対策会議を行うと告げていた。","en":"I had told him that today’s meeting concerned our response to the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r393","rowIndex":393,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　もちろんそれは、彼をこの場へ招き入れるための嘘であった。","en":"Naturally, that was a lie intended to bring him into this room.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r394","rowIndex":394,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「これから本題に入るところだよ。きみを待っていたんだ」","en":"“We’re just about to get to the matter at hand. We’ve been waiting for you.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r395","rowIndex":395,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕はそう言って、<tips=25>世傑</tips>に目で合図をする。すると彼の部下が僕のところまでやって来て、ファイルから書類を取り出し、僕の目の前に並べる。","en":"I give <tips=25>Sai-kit</tips> a signal with my eyes. One of his subordinates comes over to me, takes the documents from a file, and lays them out before me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r396","rowIndex":396,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「これは恐縮ですな。その資料はなんですか？　ああ、また、<tips=1>謝亮</tips>先生の講義の時間ってわけですな。それなら私が来る前に済ませておいてくれても良かったのに」","en":"“Well, I’m honored. And what might those papers be? Ah, another lecture from Professor <tips=1>Tse Leung</tips>, is it? In that case, you could have got it over with before I arrived.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬明","displayName":"Ma Ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r397","rowIndex":397,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼はおどけて渋い顔をしてみせる。","en":"He pulls a comically sour face.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r398","rowIndex":398,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうはいかない」","en":"“I’m afraid not.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r399","rowIndex":399,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そう、彼が来なくては、何の意味もない。","en":"No. Without him, none of this has any meaning.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r400","rowIndex":400,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「これはきみの不正を調査した資料だ。そして、今日のこの集まりはきみに処分を申し渡すためのものだ」","en":"“These are the documents from our investigation into your misconduct. And today’s gathering is to inform you of the disciplinary action against you.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r401","rowIndex":401,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕の言葉で、<tips=31>エリー・ホワイト</tips>以外の幹部たちの顔に、一斉に驚きの表情が浮かぶ。","en":"At my words, every officer except <tips=31>Ellie White</tips> looks shocked at once.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r402","rowIndex":402,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「不正とは穏やかでないですな」","en":"“Misconduct? That’s a serious word.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬明","displayName":"Ma Ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r403","rowIndex":403,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　驚きから戻った<tips=4>馬明</tips>は、目を細めて威圧的な視線を僕に送る。","en":"Recovering from his surprise, <tips=4>Ma Ming</tips> narrows his eyes and fixes me with an intimidating stare.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r404","rowIndex":404,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　かつて戦いによってこの街を震え上がらせた男らしい、なかなかいい目だった。","en":"It’s quite a look—worthy of a man whose battles once made this city tremble.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r405","rowIndex":405,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どういうことか、説明してもらいましょう」","en":"“Then I’ll have you explain what this is about.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬明","displayName":"Ma Ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r406","rowIndex":406,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「もちろん。そのために呼んだんだ。同席しているみなもよく聞いて欲しい。……最初のきっかけは、金庫の金が足りないことだった」","en":"“Of course. That’s why I called you here. I want everyone else present to listen carefully, too. ...What first set this in motion was the money missing from the safe.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r407","rowIndex":407,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕はそう言って、重ねられた書類を一枚ずつ目の前に並べた。","en":"As I say this, I lay the stack of documents out before me, one page at a time.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r408","rowIndex":408,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「私が<tips=81>龍頭</tips>になった直後、この組織の資産を全部調べたのは知っているだろう？」","en":"“You know that I examined every asset belonging to this organization immediately after becoming <tips=81>Longtou</tips>, don’t you?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r409","rowIndex":409,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そう口にすると、にわかに<tips=4>馬明</tips>の顔色がかわる。","en":"At those words, the color suddenly drains from <tips=4>Ma Ming’s</tips> face.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r410","rowIndex":410,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しかし、どうも言い慣れないな。普段はともかく公的な場では、なるべく『私』という一人称を使うようにしたのだけれど、まだ馴染まず、使うたびに何かを演じているような滑稽さを少し感じる。——まあ、そのうち慣れるだろう。","en":"Still, it doesn’t exactly roll off the tongue. In public settings, I try to use the more formal word for “I” whenever I can, but it has yet to feel natural. Each time I use it, I feel a little ridiculous, as though I were playing a part. —Well, I’ll get used to it eventually.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r411","rowIndex":411,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして僕は言葉を続けた。","en":"I continue,","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r412","rowIndex":412,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「その時、執務室にある金庫の金が、どう考えても説明のつかない減り方をしているのに気がついた。タイミング的には、あのサイキックの子供がここを襲撃した前後さ。<tips=81>龍頭</tips>しか使えない金が、ごっそり減っている。二代目に聞いても覚えがないようだ。襲撃のどさくさにまぎれて誰かが盗んだのだろう。その犯人を見つけるために内偵を進めていたら、思いもかけないことがわかってね」","en":"“At the time, I noticed that the money in the office safe had diminished in a way that simply couldn’t be explained. Judging by the timing, it happened around the attack on this building by that psychic child. A huge amount of money that only the <tips=81>Longtou</tips> could access had vanished. When I asked the second Longtou, he had no recollection of it. Someone must have stolen it amid the chaos of the attack. I began a covert investigation to identify the culprit, and uncovered something I never expected.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r413","rowIndex":413,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　書類のうち三枚をより分けて、<tips=25>世傑</tips>を呼んで彼に渡す。彼はツカツカと足音を立ててその書類を<tips=4>馬明</tips>の前に置く。","en":"I select three pages from among the documents, call <tips=25>Sai-kit</tips> over, and hand them to him. His footsteps ring sharply as he crosses the room and sets the pages before <tips=4>Ma Ming</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r414","rowIndex":414,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=4>馬明</tips>は言われたままに動く息子の顔を睨み付けてから、書類を手に取る。","en":"<tips=4>Ma Ming</tips> glares at his son, who has done exactly as instructed, then picks up the pages.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r415","rowIndex":415,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それはきみに関する調査報告書だ。詳しく書いてあるだろう？」","en":"“That is the report on you. Everything is written there in detail, isn’t it?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r416","rowIndex":416,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　文字を見ている<tips=4>馬明</tips>の眉間に深いしわが浮かぶ。","en":"A deep furrow appears between <tips=4>Ma Ming’s</tips> brows as he reads.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r417","rowIndex":417,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「みなのために説明すると、そこには<tips=4>馬明</tips>が組織の金を盗み、市民を恐喝し、麻薬を経営する飲食店で販売したという証拠が詳細に書かれている。知ってると思うが、どちらもこの組織では言い逃れの出来ない重罪だ。……よって、<tips=4>馬明</tips>。きみは今日、掟に従って死んで貰う」","en":"“For everyone’s benefit, I’ll explain. Those pages set out detailed evidence that <tips=4>Ma Ming</tips> stole the organization’s money, extorted citizens, and sold narcotics at restaurants he runs. As you know, those are grave offenses in this organization, and there is no explaining them away. ...Therefore, <tips=4>Ma Ming</tips>, today you will die in accordance with our rules.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r418","rowIndex":418,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その言葉を発したとき、<tips=4>馬明</tips>の全身が硬直するのが見て取れた。","en":"As I speak those words, I can see <tips=4>Ma Ming’s</tips> entire body stiffen.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r419","rowIndex":419,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「じょ、冗談だよね？」","en":"“Y-you’re joking, aren’t you?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r420","rowIndex":420,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=28>トミー</tips>が顔面蒼白になって僕を見る。","en":"His face deathly pale, <tips=28>Tommy</tips> looks at me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r421","rowIndex":421,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「だって、馬さんは<tips=25>世傑</tips>さんや<tips=24>美美</tips>のお父さんだよ？　<tips=2>阿亮</tips>だって小さい時から可愛がってもらったじゃないか。<tips=81>龍頭</tips>になってからも、どれだけきみの味方をしてくれたか……それを処刑するだなんて……」","en":"“But Mr. Ma is <tips=25>Sai-kit</tips> and <tips=24>Meimei’s</tips> father, isn’t he? And he doted on you from the time you were little, <tips=2>Ah Leung</tips>. Even after you became <tips=81>Longtou</tips>, think how much he supported you... To execute him after all that...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r422","rowIndex":422,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=28>トーマス</tips>、私は初代のようにデタラメな冗談は言わない」","en":"“<tips=28>Thomas</tips>, I don’t tell absurd jokes the way the first Longtou did.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r423","rowIndex":423,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして僕は再び<tips=4>馬明</tips>に向き直り、未だに硬直したままの<tips=4>馬明</tips>に言った。","en":"Then I turn back to <tips=4>Ma Ming</tips> and say to the still-rigid <tips=4>Ma Ming</tips>,","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r424","rowIndex":424,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「きみは自分がしたことがどれだけ重い罪か理解出来るはずだ」","en":"“You must understand how grave a crime you committed.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r425","rowIndex":425,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ふん、よくもまあこんなに調べ上げたものだ。店に毎日部下を送り込んでいたとか、一晩中おれの尾行をさせたとか書いてある。まったく執念深い。しかし、これだけじゃ決定的な証拠とは言えませんぞ」","en":"“Hmph. I have to hand it to you—you investigated all of this thoroughly. It says here that you sent your men into my shops every day and had me followed all night. Truly obsessive. But none of this amounts to conclusive evidence.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬明","displayName":"Ma Ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r426","rowIndex":426,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=4>馬明</tips>はそう言って書類から顔を上げた。","en":"<tips=4>Ma Ming</tips> looks up from the report.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r427","rowIndex":427,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なあ<tips=4>馬明</tips>。もう言い逃れは出来ないんだよ。小柴という名前に心当たりがあるだろう？　きみに麻薬を卸してた人間の名だ。なかなか口が固くて心配だったが、命が絶えるギリギリのところで気持ちよく唄ってくれた。今は<tips=15>ボーダーエリア</tips>の林で、温かい土のなか、ゆっくり休んでもらっているよ」","en":"“Listen, <tips=4>Ma Ming</tips>. There’s no talking your way out of this anymore. The name Koshiba should mean something to you. He’s the man who supplied you with drugs. He was remarkably tight-lipped, which had me worried, but right at the brink of death he sang like a bird. Now he’s resting peacefully in the warm earth beneath a forest in the <tips=15>Border Area</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r428","rowIndex":428,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=4>馬明</tips>が接触していたのは木下組のチンピラだった。<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>の幹部が<tips=68>木下組</tips>のブローカーになって街で麻薬を売るというのは、言うまでもなくただそれだけで死に値する行為である。","en":"The man <tips=4>Ma Ming</tips> was dealing with was a petty member of the <tips=68>Kinoshita-gumi</tips>. It goes without saying that an officer of <tips=7>YS</tips> acting as a broker for Kinoshita and selling drugs in the city is, by itself, an offense punishable by death.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r429","rowIndex":429,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=2>阿亮</tips>、そんな杓子定規なやり方が正解ってわけじゃない」","en":"“<tips=2>Ah Leung</tips>, following the rules so rigidly isn’t necessarily the right answer.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬明","displayName":"Ma Ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r430","rowIndex":430,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=4>馬明</tips>は悪びれもせず僕を見つめる。","en":"Without the slightest sign of shame, <tips=4>Ma Ming</tips> stares at me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r431","rowIndex":431,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「これくらい『融通をきかせる』のは当たり前のことさ。死んだ兄貴だったら内々で処理するだろう。本来はそれで終わりなんだよ。それを、こんな風に皆の前で告発するのはあまり賢明だとは言えないね」","en":"“This much ‘flexibility’ is only natural. If Big Brother were still alive, he’d handle it quietly, behind closed doors. Normally, that would be the end of the matter. But accusing me like this in front of everyone isn’t what I’d call very wise.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬明","displayName":"Ma Ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r432","rowIndex":432,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして<tips=4>馬明</tips>は懐に手を入れた。","en":"Then <tips=4>Ma Ming</tips> slips a hand inside his coat.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r433","rowIndex":433,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それを見た<tips=25>世傑</tips>が素早く銃を取り出し、<tips=4>馬明</tips>に突きつける。","en":"Seeing the movement, <tips=25>Sai-kit</tips> swiftly draws his gun and levels it at <tips=4>Ma Ming</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r434","rowIndex":434,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=25>世傑</tips>……」","en":"“<tips=25>Sai-kit</tips>...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬明","displayName":"Ma Ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r435","rowIndex":435,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=4>馬明</tips>は無表情に銃を構える我が子の姿を見てから苦笑して、","en":"<tips=4>Ma Ming</tips> looks at his own son, who holds the gun on him without a trace of expression, then gives a wry smile,","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r436","rowIndex":436,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうぴりぴりするもんじゃない。小物に見えるぞ。おれはハンカチを取り出すだけだよ。……ほら」","en":"“Don’t be so jumpy. It makes you look small-time. I’m only reaching for a handkerchief. ...See?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬明","displayName":"Ma Ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r437","rowIndex":437,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼はそう言ってジャケットの内側から水色のハンカチをつまみ出すと、ヒラヒラと振って見せる。","en":"With that, he plucks a pale-blue handkerchief from inside his jacket and waves it demonstratively for us to see.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r438","rowIndex":438,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まったく、普段おれが銃を持ち歩かないことはお前も知っているだろうに」","en":"“Honestly, you know perfectly well that I don’t ordinarily carry a gun.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬明","displayName":"Ma Ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r439","rowIndex":439,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして顔から髪のない頭に向かってべろりとやって冷や汗を拭った。","en":"Then, with one long sweep, he wipes the cold sweat from his face all the way over the bald crown of his head.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r440","rowIndex":440,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いま『融通をきかせる』と言ったかい？　それはつまり自分のやったことを認めたということだね」","en":"“Did you just call it ‘flexibility’? In other words, you’re admitting that you did it.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r441","rowIndex":441,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「こんな馬鹿げたことはやめるんだ。おれを殺したら、<tips=69>義勝</tips>がバラバラになるぞ」","en":"“Stop this nonsense. If you kill me, <tips=69>Yisheng</tips> will fall apart.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬明","displayName":"Ma Ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r442","rowIndex":442,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼は僕の言葉に耳を傾けないでこちらを睨み付けている。","en":"He pays no attention to my words and glares at me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r443","rowIndex":443,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=4>馬明</tips>。もう<tips=69>義勝</tips>なんていう組織は存在しないんだよ。ここにあるのは<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>だけなんだ」","en":"“<tips=4>Ma Ming</tips>, no organization called <tips=69>Yisheng</tips> exists any longer. There is only <tips=7>YS</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r444","rowIndex":444,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なあ、どうしてそこまでこだわるんだ？　ファミリーの垣根をなくして、ルールルールと厳しく仲間を追い立ててそれで何になる？　おれにはお前のそのこだわりがどうしても理解出来ないんだよ。今までのやりかたでうまくいっていたんだから、無駄なことじゃないか」","en":"“Why are you so obsessed with this? What do you gain by tearing down the boundaries between Families and hounding your comrades with rules, rules, rules? I simply cannot understand this fixation of yours. The old way has worked perfectly well until now. Isn’t all of this pointless?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬明","displayName":"Ma Ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r445","rowIndex":445,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「何度も説明したはずだが、まだわからないのか？」","en":"“How many times have I explained this to you? Do you still not understand?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r446","rowIndex":446,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕は溜息をついた。","en":"I sigh.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r447","rowIndex":447,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「昔とは状況が変わっている。街の規模が大きくなり、外からやってきて商売する連中も増えた。それによってこの街のすべてのギャングの勢力があきらかに小さくなっている。解散した組織も多い。<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>が今まで採用していたやり方では、この先は行き詰まる」","en":"“The situation is different now. The city has grown, and more outsiders have come here to do business. As a result, every gang in the city has clearly lost power. Many organizations have disbanded. If <tips=7>YS</tips> continues operating the way it has until now, we will hit a dead end.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r448","rowIndex":448,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　部屋はシンとして、みな僕の方を向き、僕の言葉に耳を傾けている。","en":"The room is utterly still. Everyone has turned toward me and is listening.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r449","rowIndex":449,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「街の子供たちも混血や交流が進んで、昔ほど人種の対立もない。もっと、街の実態に即した効率的な強い組織にならなければ、この街で強い存在で居続けることは難しい。逆に<tips=21>八龍会</tips>のように勢力を伸ばしている連中に食われる。そして、立場が違う人間たちを一つにまとめるためには、公平で厳格なルールが必要だ。……単なる思いつきで言っているわけじゃない。すべて必要なことだ。そしてこれが初代には足りなかったところだ。身内ばかりをえこひいきするからね。だが僕は違う。身内だろうと、それまでいきさつのある相手だろうと、平等に扱う。最初からずっとそうしているのだから、きみだってわかっていたはずだ」","en":"“The children of this city are increasingly of mixed heritage and move more freely among one another, so there is less racial conflict than before. Unless we become a more efficient, powerful organization attuned to the city as it now exists, it will be difficult to remain a force here. Instead, expanding outfits like the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips> will devour us. And uniting people in different positions requires impartial, rigorous rules. ...This is not some passing whim. Every part of it is necessary. That is precisely what the first Longtou lacked. He was always favoring his own people. But I am different. Whether they are my own people or someone with whom I have a history, I treat everyone equally. I have done so from the very beginning, so you ought to have known that.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r450","rowIndex":450,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ふん、相変わらず口は達者だな。子供のときからそうだ。しかし、騙されんぞ」","en":"“Hmph. The same silver tongue as ever. You were like that even as a child. But you won’t fool me.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬明","displayName":"Ma Ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r451","rowIndex":451,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=4>馬明</tips>は腕組みをして口をへの字に曲げる。","en":"<tips=4>Ma Ming</tips> folds his arms and pulls his mouth into a hard line.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r452","rowIndex":452,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「クスリのことだって、納得がいかん。<tips=27>廖志明</tips>どのも言っていたが、我々も取り扱うべきだと思う。このまま<tips=22>老人たち</tips>に独占させたままでいいのか？　最近は、新しいクスリも手がけてるそうじゃないか。このさきやつらはどんどん金を貯めて、我々との差をつけるぞ。あの爺さんどもに対抗するというのなら、彼らとの協定は破棄して売買を開始したほうがいい。これはいずれ正式に提案しようと思っていたんだ。だから、そのルートを作るために、自分の店で販売をしてみたってことさ。別に私腹を肥やそうとしたわけじゃない」","en":"“I’m not satisfied with our drug policy, either. As Mr. <tips=27>Liao Chi-ming</tips> said, I think we ought to deal them ourselves. Are we really going to let the <tips=22>Elders</tips> keep their monopoly? I hear they’ve started dealing a new drug lately, too. At this rate, they’ll keep amassing money and widen the gap between us. If we mean to stand against those old men, we should scrap our agreement with them and enter the trade. I was planning to submit a formal proposal eventually. That’s why I tried selling drugs through my own shops—to establish the route. I wasn’t trying to line my own pockets.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬明","displayName":"Ma Ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r453","rowIndex":453,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「確かに麻薬は目先の金銭だけ考えれば魅力的だが、この<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>では扱わない」","en":"“Narcotics may be attractive if all you consider is immediate profit, but <tips=7>YS</tips> will not deal in them.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r454","rowIndex":454,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕はそう言って<tips=4>馬明</tips>の目を見つめた。","en":"As I say this, I look directly into <tips=4>Ma Ming’s</tips> eyes.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r455","rowIndex":455,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「クスリは街を腐らせる。我々はよく街の寄生虫だとバカにされるが、ある意味そのとおりで、我々は宿主がなければ生きていけない。自然界でも、賢い寄生虫は宿主が健康になるために手助けするだろう？　この街が廃人だらけになれば我々は行き場がなくなるんだ。それが、普通のマフィアとは違うところさ。それに、麻薬を扱うとなればどこかから仕入れなくてはいけない。きみはルートを作るといったが、それが問題なんだよ。<tips=68>木下組</tips>と関わるのは間違いだ。彼らはまだこの街に対して野心を持っている」","en":"“Drugs rot the city. People often sneer that we are parasites on it, and in a sense they are right: without a host, we cannot survive. Even in nature, an intelligent parasite helps its host remain healthy, doesn’t it? If everyone in this city is reduced to a wreck, we will have nowhere left to go. That is what sets us apart from an ordinary Mafia. Besides, dealing in drugs means obtaining them from somewhere. You said you were establishing a route, but that is precisely the problem. Getting involved with the <tips=68>Kinoshita-gumi</tips> is a mistake. They still have designs on this city.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r456","rowIndex":456,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……兄貴もよくそんなことを言っていたよ。街があってこそだとな。ただ、兄貴は本当にこの街が好きだったが、<tips=2>阿亮</tips>はそうではない。それが大きな違いだ。いつも言っているが、打算じゃ人は動かせない。お前は優秀だが、このままでは兄貴のようにはなれないな」","en":"“...Big Brother often said the same thing: that we exist only because the city does. But Big Brother truly loved this city, and <tips=2>Ah Leung</tips> does not. That is the crucial difference. As I keep telling you, calculation alone cannot move people. You are capable, but at this rate you will never become a man like Big Brother.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬明","displayName":"Ma Ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r457","rowIndex":457,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=4>馬明</tips>はそう言って溜息をつく。","en":"<tips=4>Ma Ming</tips> says this with a sigh.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r458","rowIndex":458,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=4>馬明</tips>さん、もうやめましょう」","en":"“Mr. <tips=4>Ma</tips>, let’s stop this.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r459","rowIndex":459,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そこで言葉を挟んだのは、意外にも<tips=28>トミー</tips>だった。","en":"The one who unexpectedly cuts in is <tips=28>Tommy</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r460","rowIndex":460,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼はテーブルの上に指を組み、こわばった表情で目の前の空間を見つめている。","en":"His fingers interlaced on the table, he stares with a rigid expression into the empty space before him.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r461","rowIndex":461,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ルールを破ったことを認めてください。素直に謝罪の意志を見せて、もうここで心を入れ替えて二度としないと誓えば、<tips=81>龍頭</tips>だって処刑までは……」","en":"“Please admit that you broke the rules. If you show sincere remorse, swear here and now that you’ll mend your ways, and promise never to do it again, surely even the <tips=81>Longtou</tips> won’t go so far as to execute you...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r462","rowIndex":462,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=28>トミー</tips>は<tips=4>馬明</tips>に視線を向け、少し頬を染めて興奮気味にそう語るが、","en":"<tips=28>Tommy</tips> turns to <tips=4>Ma Ming</tips>, his cheeks faintly flushed as he speaks with growing agitation, but—","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r463","rowIndex":463,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それはないな」","en":"“That won’t happen.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r464","rowIndex":464,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕はそう言って遮った。","en":"I cut him off with those words.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r465","rowIndex":465,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=28>トーマス</tips>。私は何があっても決定を変えるつもりはないよ。……<tips=4>馬明</tips>、きみは偉大なる功績を残した。だから、この裁定に納得し、その人生に相応しい見事な死を遂げて欲しくてこの場を用意したんだよ。詭弁なんか聞きたくない。今の言い訳には失望した」","en":"“<tips=28>Thomas</tips>. Nothing will make me change my decision. ...<tips=4>Ma Ming</tips>, you achieved great things. I arranged this gathering because I wanted you to accept this judgment and meet a magnificent death worthy of the life you led. I do not want to hear sophistry. Your excuses have disappointed me.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r466","rowIndex":466,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕がそう言うと、さすがに<tips=4>馬明</tips>も顔をこわばらせる。","en":"At those words, even <tips=4>Ma Ming’s</tips> face finally stiffens.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r467","rowIndex":467,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……確定死刑囚ってわけか」","en":"“...So I’m a condemned prisoner, then.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬明","displayName":"Ma Ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r468","rowIndex":468,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その声はかたく、かすれていた。","en":"His voice is hard and hoarse.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r469","rowIndex":469,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼はまぶたを閉じてしばらく考えたのち、目を開くと溜息をつく。","en":"He closes his eyes and thinks for a time. Then he opens them and sighs.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r470","rowIndex":470,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「わかった。大人しく受け入れよう。ただ最後に一つだけ願いがある」","en":"“All right. I’ll accept it without a fight. But I have one final request.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬明","displayName":"Ma Ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r471","rowIndex":471,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なんだ？」","en":"“What is it?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r472","rowIndex":472,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「この<tips=4>馬明</tips>ともあろうものが、人の手にかかって死ぬわけにはいかない」","en":"“A man such as <tips=4>Ma Ming</tips> cannot allow himself to die at another’s hand.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬明","displayName":"Ma Ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r473","rowIndex":473,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「わかった。毒を用意しよう」","en":"“Very well. I will prepare poison.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r474","rowIndex":474,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「冗談じゃない。戦いに明け暮れた人間の最後に相応しい道具があるだろう」","en":"“Don’t joke. You know the proper tool for the end of a man who spent his life fighting.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬明","displayName":"Ma Ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r475","rowIndex":475,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=4>馬明</tips>は薄笑いを浮かべた。","en":"A faint smile appears on <tips=4>Ma Ming’s</tips> face.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r476","rowIndex":476,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「銃が欲しいと言っているのか？」","en":"“You want a gun?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r477","rowIndex":477,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=4>馬明</tips>は頷く。","en":"<tips=4>Ma Ming</tips> nods.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r478","rowIndex":478,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いまここで男の死に様というやつを皆にご披露しよう」","en":"“Here and now, I’ll show everyone how a man dies.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬明","displayName":"Ma Ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r479","rowIndex":479,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「危険ですよ。<tips=81>龍頭</tips>。こんな場所で武器を渡すなんてとんでもない」","en":"“That’s dangerous, <tips=81>Longtou</tips>. Giving him a weapon in a place like this is unthinkable.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"壬生屋タカシ","displayName":"Takashi Mibuya","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r480","rowIndex":480,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=33>壬生屋</tips>は真っ青な顔をひきつらせながら言う。","en":"<tips=33>Mibuya</tips> says this as his deathly pale face twitches.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r481","rowIndex":481,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ふん、<tips=33>壬生屋の倅</tips>は臆病ものだな。それに考えが浅い。ここで<tips=2>阿亮</tips>を撃ち殺したってなんにもならない。そのあとここにいる<tips=25>世傑</tips>に蜂の巣にされ、汚名を帯びた死体が残るだけだ。そんな意味のないことをすると思うか？　それとも、目の前で人が死ぬのを見るのがこわいのか？　<tips=33>壬生屋の倅</tips>は喧嘩になると姿が見えなくなると噂されてるぞ」","en":"“Hmph. <tips=33>Mibuya’s boy</tips> is a coward, and none too bright. What would I gain by shooting <tips=2>Leung</tips> here? <tips=25>Sai-kit</tips> would riddle me with bullets the next instant, and all I’d leave behind is a corpse branded with disgrace. You think I’d do something that pointless? Or are you afraid to watch a man die before your eyes? I hear <tips=33>Mibuya’s boy</tips> disappears whenever a fight breaks out.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬明","displayName":"Ma Ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r482","rowIndex":482,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なっ、何を」","en":"“Wh-what are you—”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"壬生屋タカシ","displayName":"Takashi Mibuya","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r483","rowIndex":483,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　真っ青だった<tips=33>壬生屋</tips>が、真っ赤になって<tips=4>馬明</tips>を睨み付ける。","en":"<tips=33>Mibuya</tips>, white as a sheet a moment ago, turns scarlet and glares at <tips=4>Ma Ming</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r484","rowIndex":484,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=2>阿亮</tips>はお前のようには考えない。彼はおれのことを昔からよく知っているし、おれも昔から彼のことは知っている。そうだろう？」","en":"“<tips=2>Leung</tips> won’t see it the way you do. He’s known me well for a long time, and I’ve known him just as long. Isn’t that right?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬明","displayName":"Ma Ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r485","rowIndex":485,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=4>馬明</tips>は僕を見つめて微笑んだ。","en":"<tips=4>Ma Ming</tips> looked at me and smiled.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r486","rowIndex":486,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その顔からは、先ほどまでの憤りが消えている。それは、僕が小さな頃から何度も見た、<tips=24>美美</tips>や亡き妻に向けたものと同じ笑顔だ。","en":"The anger that had been on his face moments before was gone. In its place was the same smile I had seen countless times since I was small, the smile he gave <tips=24>Meimei</tips> and his late wife.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r487","rowIndex":487,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「確かに、私はきみのことはよく知っている」","en":"“It’s true. I do know you well.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r488","rowIndex":488,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕は頷いて、","en":"I nod, then say","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r489","rowIndex":489,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「銃を」","en":"“The gun,”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r490","rowIndex":490,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　と<tips=25>世傑</tips>に言った。","en":"to <tips=25>Sai-kit</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r491","rowIndex":491,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼は怪訝な顔をして僕を見る。","en":"He gives me a puzzled look.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r492","rowIndex":492,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いいんだ。きみの銃が相応しいだろう」","en":"“It’s all right. Yours would be fitting.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r493","rowIndex":493,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕が再度言うと、彼は渋々<tips=4>馬明</tips>に近づき、先ほど<tips=4>馬明</tips>を狙っていた銀色の自動拳銃をその前に置いた。","en":"When I repeat myself, he reluctantly approaches <tips=4>Ma Ming</tips> and sets before him the silver automatic pistol he had aimed at <tips=4>Ma Ming</tips> earlier.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r494","rowIndex":494,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「今をときめく<tips=80>双花紅棍</tips>の、何人もの敵を撃った銃を貸して貰えるとは光栄だ」","en":"“What an honor, to borrow the gun of the celebrated <tips=80>Double Flower Red Pole</tips>—a weapon that has shot so many enemies.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬明","displayName":"Ma Ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r495","rowIndex":495,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=4>馬明</tips>は眉をあげておどけてみせるが、<tips=25>世傑</tips>は苦い顔をしたまま黙っている。","en":"<tips=4>Ma Ming</tips> raises his eyebrows in mock playfulness, but <tips=25>Sai-kit</tips> remains silent, his expression sour.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r496","rowIndex":496,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「さて……」","en":"“Now, then...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬明","displayName":"Ma Ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r497","rowIndex":497,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼はじっと銃を見つめたまま、手を伸ばそうとしない。","en":"He keeps staring at the gun, making no move to reach for it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r498","rowIndex":498,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「おいどうした。威勢がいいのは口だけか。ただ見ていたって弾は出ないぞ」","en":"“Well? Was all that bravado just talk? Merely staring at the gun will not make it fire.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r499","rowIndex":499,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=33>壬生屋</tips>がからかうと、<tips=4>馬明</tips>は横目でチラリと彼を睨む。","en":"At <tips=33>Mibuya’s</tips> taunt, <tips=4>Ma Ming</tips> shoots him a sidelong glare.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r500","rowIndex":500,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そのあと、<tips=25>世傑</tips>の方を見て、そして最後に僕を見つめながら、ゆっくりと銃に手を伸ばした。","en":"Then he looks at <tips=25>Sai-kit</tips>, and finally fixes his eyes on me as he slowly reaches for the gun.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r501","rowIndex":501,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「さて、それでは最後にこの男の生き様というやつを、若い諸君のためにご覧になってもらおう」","en":"“Well, then. Let me give you young gentlemen one final look at the way this man has lived.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬明","displayName":"Ma Ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r502","rowIndex":502,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼は微笑みのまま銃を握りしめ、そして持ち上げると、真正面にいる僕の顔に照準を定めた。","en":"Still smiling, he grips the gun, raises it, and takes aim squarely at my face.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r503","rowIndex":503,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「やめろっ！」","en":"“Stop!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r504","rowIndex":504,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そう叫んだのは<tips=28>トミー</tips>だった。","en":"The shout comes from <tips=28>Tommy</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r505","rowIndex":505,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しかし、その声は<tips=4>馬明</tips>の行動を制止することは出来ない。彼の指が引き金を引く。","en":"But his voice cannot stop <tips=4>Ma Ming</tips>. His finger pulls the trigger.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r506","rowIndex":506,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　すると、カチャリと小さな音がした。","en":"There is only a faint click.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r507","rowIndex":507,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それだけだった。","en":"Nothing more.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r508","rowIndex":508,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼は何度も引き金を引くが、弾はいっこうに飛び出す気配はない。彼は慌てた手つきで弾倉を抜く。そこには一発の銃弾も装填されていない。","en":"He pulls the trigger again and again, but still no shot comes. In a panic, he ejects the magazine. There is not a single round in it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r509","rowIndex":509,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼は驚きで目を丸くしながら僕を見る。","en":"Eyes wide with shock, he looks at me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r510","rowIndex":510,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いまのきみの気持ちはよくわかる。さっき<tips=25>世傑</tips>が自分に向けた銃を、そのまま受け取ったのになぜ弾が出ないのかってね。でも、よく考えればそんな勘違いはしなかったはずだ」","en":"“I know exactly what you’re thinking. You took the very gun <tips=25>Sai-kit</tips> pointed at you earlier, so why wasn’t it loaded? But if you had thought it through, you would never have made that mistake.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r511","rowIndex":511,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕は暗い気持ちになりながらそう説明をする。","en":"I explain, my heart sinking as I speak.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r512","rowIndex":512,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「きみは銃を普段持ち歩かない。それに、持ち歩くときもジャケットの内側には隠さない。太ったきみがそこに隠せばどうやってもぴちぴちのジャケットが膨らんでそうとわかってしまうし、スムーズに取り出すことも出来ないからだ。もちろん<tips=25>世傑</tips>はそんなことは承知している。きみだって、さっきそのことを指摘した筈じゃないか。そこで<tips=25>世傑</tips>の反応に違和感を覚えたんだから、その時気が付くことだって出来たんだよ。<tips=25>世傑</tips>がわざわざ銃を取り出して、これみよがしにつきつけることには別の意味があるんじゃないかって。たとえば、銃弾の入っていない銃を、あたかも弾が入っているかのように見せかけるとかさ」","en":"“You don’t ordinarily carry a gun. Even when you do, you never hide it inside your jacket. If a fat man like you tried that, your already skintight jacket would bulge and give you away, and you’d never be able to draw smoothly. Of course <tips=25>Sai-kit</tips> knows that perfectly well. You pointed it out yourself earlier, didn’t you? Something about <tips=25>Sai-kit’s</tips> reaction struck you as odd. You could have realized it then. You could have asked whether <tips=25>Sai-kit</tips> had some other reason to draw his gun and make such a show of pointing it at you—say, to make an unloaded gun look as if it held bullets.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r513","rowIndex":513,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=4>馬明</tips>は唇を嚙んで僕を睨み付けている。","en":"<tips=4>Ma Ming</tips> bites his lip and glares at me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r514","rowIndex":514,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……このことに即座に気がつくのは難しいかな？　でも、ヒントはそれだけじゃない。もっとシンプルで簡単な考え方で答えに辿り着くことも出来る。この<tips=1>謝亮</tips>が、この場面で弾が入った銃を手渡すなんてどう考えたっておかしいだろう？　どうして私がそんな危険をおかすと思えたんだい？　何か裏があると考えるべきだろう。子供の頃からよく知っている相手なんだから」","en":"“...Perhaps it would have been difficult to notice that immediately. But that was not your only clue. You could also have reached the answer through an even simpler, easier line of reasoning. The idea that I, <tips=1>Tse Leung</tips>, would hand you a loaded gun in these circumstances was absurd from the start, was it not? How could you think I would take such a risk? You should have suspected a trick. You have known me well since I was a child.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r515","rowIndex":515,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……はかったのか」","en":"“...You set me up.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬明","displayName":"Ma Ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r516","rowIndex":516,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そう言う<tips=4>馬明</tips>のはげた頭にはじっとりと脂汗が浮かび、電灯の光を眩しく反射しはじめている。","en":"A film of greasy sweat beads on <tips=4>Ma Ming’s</tips> bald head, which begins to gleam dazzlingly under the electric light.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r517","rowIndex":517,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　こんな真剣な場面で、真剣な表情をして、頭が光り始めるというのは、なんだかひどくユーモラスだ。３０を過ぎたあたりから急に頭髪が抜け落ちていった。僕は、これをいつもからかっていたんだ。","en":"There is something terribly funny about his head beginning to shine while he wears such a solemn expression at such a grave moment. His hair had started falling out rapidly after he turned thirty, and I was always teasing him about it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r518","rowIndex":518,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「とんでもない。チャンスを与えたんだ……」","en":"“Nothing of the sort. I gave you a chance...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r519","rowIndex":519,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　何かが胸にせり上がって、言葉が乱れそうになる。動揺してはいけない。もっと強くならなくてはいけない。これが僕の仕事なんだ。","en":"Something rises in my chest, threatening to throw my words into disarray. I cannot let myself waver. I have to be stronger. This is my job.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r520","rowIndex":520,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕は呼吸を整えてから、","en":"I steady my breathing, then say:","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r521","rowIndex":521,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=4>馬明</tips>、ルールはルールだが、きみには功績がある。もしきみがこの場面で潔く自分の頭に向けて引き金を引くことが出来たのなら『命で責任をとろうとした』と認めてやってもよかった。たとえそれが、誠意ではなく私の意図を読んで弾は出ないと推理した結果だとしてもね。それならそれで自分がまだ使い道のある有用な人間だということを証明したことになるからだ。……でもきみには誠意と能力のどちらもなかった。この組織には相応しくない人間だということだ」","en":"“<tips=4>Ma Ming</tips>, rules are rules, but you have rendered this organization distinguished service. If you had put the gun to your own head and pulled the trigger without hesitation, I might have credited you with trying to answer for your actions with your life—even if you did it not out of sincerity, but because you read my intentions and deduced that the gun would not fire. That in itself would have proved you were still a useful man with something to offer. ...But you had neither sincerity nor ability. You are not fit to belong to this organization.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r522","rowIndex":522,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕が言い終わると、<tips=4>馬明</tips>は唐突に笑い声を上げる。","en":"As soon as I finish, <tips=4>Ma Ming</tips> suddenly bursts out laughing.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r523","rowIndex":523,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ははは、茶番じゃないか！　くどくどとくだらない。<tips=2>阿亮</tips>、お前は喋りすぎる。ボスってのはそんなにぺらぺらと喋るもんじゃない。自信がないのかと侮られるぞ。喋る必要なんかない。おれはお前に向かって引き金を引いた。けれど弾は出なかった。説明しなくたっておれのみじめさは一目瞭然さ！」","en":"“Ha ha ha! What a farce! All this long-winded nonsense. <tips=2>Ah Leung</tips>, you talk too much. A boss isn’t supposed to chatter on and on like that. People will take it for a lack of confidence and look down on you. You don’t need to say a thing. I pulled the trigger at you, and no bullet came out. Anyone can see how pathetic I am without an explanation!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬明","displayName":"Ma Ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r524","rowIndex":524,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼は一頻り笑うと、脱力して肩を落とす。","en":"When his fit of laughter subsides, the strength leaves him and his shoulders sag.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r525","rowIndex":525,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして溜息をついてから、目を閉じ、そして目を開いて僕を見る。","en":"He sighs, closes his eyes, then opens them again and looks at me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r526","rowIndex":526,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「だが、なあ<tips=2>阿亮</tips>、ひとつだけ教えてくれ。おれが銃をよこせと提案することも、お前の計算のうちか？」","en":"“But tell me one thing, <tips=2>Ah Leung</tips>. Did you calculate that I’d ask you to hand over the gun, too?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬明","displayName":"Ma Ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r527","rowIndex":527,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それは違う。僕の方から提案する予定だった。だから、きみが言い出したときは驚いた。……そして、期待もしたんだがね」","en":"“No. I had planned to be the one who suggested it. So you surprised me when you brought it up yourself. ...And you gave me hope.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r528","rowIndex":528,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕は言って、胸元から自分の拳銃を取り出し、弾倉を確認する。<tips=4>馬明</tips>に渡したものと違って、とうもろこしの粒のようにぎっしりとフルメタルジャケットが詰まっている。","en":"With that, I draw my own pistol from inside my coat and check the magazine. Unlike the one I gave <tips=4>Ma Ming</tips>, this one is packed tight with full-metal-jacket rounds, like kernels of corn.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r529","rowIndex":529,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　銃を操作する手が微かに震えている。こんなのは初めてだ。僕はぎゅっと握りしめ、呼吸を整えた。僕は悪逆非道の第三代<tips=81>龍頭</tips>なんだ。まともな感情なんかは持ち合わせておらず、相手が誰だろうと、無表情に、平等に、そう、今までそうして来たように——。","en":"The hand working the gun is trembling faintly. This has never happened before. I tighten my grip and steady my breathing. I am the wicked and inhuman third <tips=81>Longtou</tips>. I have no normal human feelings. Whoever stands before me, I treat them all alike, without a flicker of expression—yes, just as I always have...","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r530","rowIndex":530,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しかし、なかなか今までのようには行かなかった。","en":"But I cannot make it go the way it always has.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r531","rowIndex":531,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　思い出したくもないのに、脳が勝手に思い出す。","en":"I do not want to remember, but the memories rise unbidden.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r532","rowIndex":532,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ちっちゃな頃、母や妹のいる屋敷から追い出され、ひとりぼっちで定食屋で暮らすようになった。","en":"When I was little, they drove me out of the mansion where Mother and my sister lived, and I went to live all alone in a diner.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r533","rowIndex":533,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　あの時、毎日泣きじゃくっていた僕を慰めてくれたのが<tips=4>馬明</tips>だった。","en":"It was <tips=4>Ma Ming</tips> who comforted me then, when I spent every day sobbing my heart out.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r534","rowIndex":534,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=2>阿亮</tips>、兄貴はお前のことが特別に大事だからこうやって避難させたんだよ」","en":"“<tips=2>Ah Leung</tips>, Big Brother sent you here to keep you safe because you mean so much to him.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r535","rowIndex":535,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そう言って僕の頭を撫でる<tips=4>馬明</tips>の胸を、僕は「嘘つき！　嘘つき！」と叫びながら叩いた。——そう、あの頃僕は泣き虫だったんだ。","en":"As <tips=4>Ma Ming</tips> said this and stroked my head, I pounded on his chest, screaming, “Liar! Liar!” That’s right—in those days, I was a crybaby.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r536","rowIndex":536,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=9>Y地区</tips>は滅多に晴れないけれど、<tips=4>馬明</tips>の家の庭は太陽が出るとぽかぽかとして暖かかった。","en":"<tips=9>Y District</tips> rarely saw a clear day, but whenever the sun came out, the garden at <tips=4>Ma Ming’s</tips> house was warm and balmy.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r537","rowIndex":537,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　あの陽の当たる庭で、<tips=24>美美</tips>を泣かしたり泣かされたりしていた光景が、犬とじゃれあってた光景が、<tips=69>義勝</tips>の集まりで父に叱られてしょげていた僕の前にしゃがみ込んで慰めてくれた光景が、母さんが死んだときに泣き虫のはずなのにどうしても泣けなかった僕のかわりに大きな声で泣いてくれていた光景が、目の前に蘇る。","en":"Scene after scene returns before my eyes: <tips=24>Meimei</tips> and me making each other cry in that sunlit garden; the two of us romping with the dog; Ma Ming crouching down to comfort me when Father’s scolding at a <tips=69>Yisheng</tips> gathering left me despondent; Ma Ming weeping loudly in my place when Mother died and I, the supposed crybaby, could not bring myself to shed a single tear.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r538","rowIndex":538,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　なんでこんな時に。昨日こうすることを決めた時には、ちっともそんなことを考えなかったのに。","en":"Why now, of all times? None of this crossed my mind yesterday, when I decided what I would do.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r539","rowIndex":539,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　——どうして僕は、大嫌いな組織のために、大好きな<tips=4>馬明</tips>を殺そうとしているのだろう？","en":"—Why am I trying to kill <tips=4>Ma Ming</tips>, whom I love, for the sake of an organization I hate?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r540","rowIndex":540,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　幹部のみんなが僕を見ている。僕はいつもどおり振る舞わなくちゃいけない。","en":"All the officers are watching me. I have to behave exactly as I always do.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r541","rowIndex":541,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ここにいるのは筋金入りのギャングばかりで、僕はこのなかで一番年下で、一番キャリアがないんだ。<tips=28>トーマス</tips>でさえも、この世界でのキャリアは僕より上だ。","en":"Everyone here is a hardened gangster. I am the youngest among them and have the shortest career. Even <tips=28>Thomas</tips> has spent longer in this world than I have.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r542","rowIndex":542,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕は血のつながりだけでここに居て、みんなそれを内心では馬鹿にしている。いや馬鹿にするとはいかなくても、軽んじている。","en":"I am here on the strength of blood alone, and privately they all think I’m a fool for it. No—even if they do not go that far, they think less of me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r543","rowIndex":543,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　きっと、いまテーブルを囲んだ面々で、本当に僕の能力や才能を心から信じてくれているのは<tips=4>馬明</tips>だけだろう。ずっと僕のことを将来のボスだと褒めてくれて、学校に行くと言ったときも立派な学者になると応援してくれて、帰って来ても協力してくれた。腕っ節も強くなければいけないと、拳法を教えてくれたのも<tips=4>馬明</tips>だ。不良グループの一員になって暴れ回っていたときだって「すごいじゃないか！　サイキックや<tips=78>金目</tips>のやつらも子分にしてるんだって？」と、こっちがびっくりするくらい大喜びしてくれていたのだ。","en":"Of all the men around this table, surely <tips=4>Ma Ming</tips> is the only one who truly believes in my ability and talent with all his heart. He always praised me as a future boss. When I said I was going away to school, he encouraged me, saying I would become a fine scholar; when I came home, he gave me his support. It was <tips=4>Ma Ming</tips> who taught me martial arts, saying I needed strength in my fists as well. Even when I joined a gang of delinquents and ran wild, he was so overjoyed that he took me by surprise: ‘That’s amazing! I hear you’ve even made those psychics and <tips=78>gold-eyes</tips> your underlings.’","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r544","rowIndex":544,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　あの<tips=4>馬明</tips>が、どうして、こんなことをしてしまったんだ？","en":"How could the <tips=4>Ma Ming</tips> I knew have done something like this?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r545","rowIndex":545,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　泣きそうだった。いや、この僕が今更泣き虫に戻ることなんかありえるんだろうか？","en":"I am about to cry. No—can I really be turning back into a crybaby after all this time?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r546","rowIndex":546,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そんなはずはない。","en":"That cannot be.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r547","rowIndex":547,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕はもっと出来るはずだ。","en":"I am better than this.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r548","rowIndex":548,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　感情を殺し、立派に振る舞えるはずだ。","en":"I can smother my feelings and conduct myself with dignity.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r549","rowIndex":549,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕は目を閉じた。","en":"I close my eyes.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r550","rowIndex":550,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　この動作によって、ここにいるみなは僕の心の動きを見ただろう。わかってはいたが目を閉じないわけにはいかなかった。","en":"The gesture must reveal every movement of my heart to everyone here. I know that, but I cannot help closing my eyes.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r551","rowIndex":551,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そんなはずはないけれど、絶対にないけれど、涙を見せるよりはマシだからだ。","en":"It cannot happen. It absolutely cannot. But this is still better than letting them see me cry.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r552","rowIndex":552,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　これが最後だ。これが。","en":"This is the last time. This has to be the last.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r553","rowIndex":553,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　今ここで僕は<tips=4>馬明</tips>と一緒に、自分のなかの別な部分も葬り去る。もうとっくに殺したと思っていた部分を。","en":"Here and now, together with <tips=4>Ma Ming</tips>, I bury another part of myself—the part I thought I had killed long ago.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r554","rowIndex":554,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕は目を開き、標的をまっすぐ見据える。","en":"I open my eyes and stare straight at my target.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r555","rowIndex":555,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=4>馬明</tips>には小さな時から色々なことを教わってきた。今から最後のレッスンを受け、僕は次の段階に進む。それだけのことだ。","en":"<tips=4>Ma Ming</tips> has taught me all manner of things since I was small. Now I will receive one final lesson and move on to the next stage. That is all this is.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r556","rowIndex":556,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　自然にやり遂げるんだ。そう、ホテルの朝食のビュッフェで、スクランブルエッグを一掬い皿に取ったら、次はベーコンのトレイの前に移動するように。","en":"I will carry it out as naturally as anything. Just as, at a hotel breakfast buffet, you spoon a helping of scrambled eggs onto your plate and then move on to the tray of bacon.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r557","rowIndex":557,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いい目だ<tips=2>阿亮</tips>。やっぱり、お前は兄貴以上の<tips=81>龍頭</tips>になるよ。今の素晴らしい表情を兄貴に見せたいぜ」","en":"“That’s a good look in your eyes, <tips=2>Ah Leung</tips>. You really will become an even greater <tips=81>Longtou</tips> than Big Brother. I wish he could see that splendid expression on your face.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r558","rowIndex":558,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼は肩をすくめて笑う。","en":"He shrugs and smiles.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r559","rowIndex":559,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その顔に、僕は銃口を向けた。オーケー、震えはとまっている。","en":"I point the muzzle at his face. Okay. The trembling has stopped.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r560","rowIndex":560,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　目の前にうつっているものは積み上げた西瓜と大差ない。何の感情も動かさない。これが<tips=1>謝亮</tips>という人間だ。","en":"What I see before me is no different from a pile of watermelons. It stirs no emotion in me. This is the man named <tips=1>Tse Leung</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r561","rowIndex":561,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「本当に残念だよ。<tips=4>馬明</tips>」","en":"“I am truly sorry, <tips=4>Ma Ming</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r562","rowIndex":562,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その後僕たちは汚れた会議室を後にして、執務室で今後の話をした。","en":"Afterward, we left the soiled conference room behind and discussed what came next in my office.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r563","rowIndex":563,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=4>馬明</tips>の死の後始末をしなくてはいけない。組織で果たしていた彼の役割を他の幹部に振り分け、彼の犯した罪などを公開し、処分が正しいものであることを速やかに告知する。","en":"We had to deal with the aftermath of <tips=4>Ma Ming’s</tips> death: distribute the roles he had performed within the organization among the other officers, disclose the offenses he had committed, and promptly announce that his punishment had been just.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r564","rowIndex":564,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　これらの処理は、これまで誰かを処刑するたびに行ってきたことで、はじめてというわけではないが、<tips=4>馬明</tips>はこれまで強く僕を支持してくれた経緯があるし、彼は部下によく慕われていたので、その死を受け入れられないものも多いだろう。","en":"We had followed these procedures every time someone was executed, so none of it was new. <tips=4>Ma Ming</tips>, however, had a long history of supporting me staunchly, and his men were deeply attached to him. Many would likely refuse to accept his death.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r565","rowIndex":565,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　適切な告知によって未然に防ぎたいが、最悪の場合、そういったものたちが徒党を組んで反旗を翻すという可能性も考慮しなくてはいけない。","en":"I hoped a proper announcement would forestall trouble, but I also had to consider the worst case: those men might band together and rise in revolt.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r566","rowIndex":566,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まあ、そこで反抗するようなやつらもどうせ、麻薬の売買に加担して旨い汁を吸っていた連中でしょう。この際膿を出し切る意味でも、好きなように暴れさせて、それから処理すればいいんですよ」","en":"“Well, anyone who rebels now will be one of the men who helped with the drug trade and took a share of the profits. We may as well let them run wild to their hearts’ content, then dispose of them. It will give us the chance to drain every last drop of pus.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"壬生屋タカシ","displayName":"Takashi Mibuya","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r567","rowIndex":567,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=33>壬生屋タカシ</tips>は上機嫌だった。","en":"<tips=33>Takashi Mibuya</tips> was in high spirits.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r568","rowIndex":568,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その目がきらきらと輝いている。組織の重鎮がまた一人死んだので、自分の序列が上がることを素直に喜んでいるのだろう。","en":"His eyes positively glittered. Another pillar of the organization was dead, and I supposed he was simply delighted that his own rank would rise.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r569","rowIndex":569,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=34>ダリオ・ボネット</tips>は口数が少なく、他の人間の出方をうかがうような態度を見せていた。","en":"<tips=34>Dario Bonetto</tips> said little and watched closely to see how the others would respond.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r570","rowIndex":570,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=28>トミー</tips>は——彼は、もう<tips=4>馬明</tips>が死んだ時からずっとボロボロと涙をこぼしてみっともなく泣いている。","en":"As for <tips=28>Tommy</tips>—he had been making an undignified spectacle of himself, sobbing helplessly ever since <tips=4>Ma Ming</tips> died.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r571","rowIndex":571,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして<tips=31>エリー</tips>はこの<tips=28>トミー</tips>を尻目に淡々と、これから必要となる処理について質問をしたり、意見を述べていた。","en":"<tips=31>Ellie</tips>, meanwhile, ignored <tips=28>Tommy</tips> and calmly asked questions and offered opinions about the measures we would need to take.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r572","rowIndex":572,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=25>世傑</tips>は会議室に残って、現場の処理と、遺体を自宅へ送り届ける手配などをしている。","en":"<tips=25>Sai-kit</tips> has stayed behind in the conference room to deal with the scene and arrange for the body to be taken home.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r573","rowIndex":573,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕は<tips=39>ジェフリー</tips>の残した道具で<tips=30>レイレイ</tips>が淹れてくれたコーヒーを飲みながら、彼らの意見を聞き、自分の考えている方針を説明した。","en":"Drinking the coffee <tips=30>Leilei</tips> had made with the equipment left behind by <tips=39>Jeffrey</tips>, I listened to their opinions and explained the policy I had in mind.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r574","rowIndex":574,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ほとんど事前に決めていたことを喋るだけのことで、話しながら、まるで他人が喋っているのを聞くような気分で、自分の声を聞いた。","en":"Almost everything I said had been decided in advance. As I spoke, I listened to my own voice with the strange sensation that someone else was speaking.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r575","rowIndex":575,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「じゃあ、今日のところはこれくらいで、また何かあったら後で連絡する」","en":"“That will do for today. I’ll contact you later if anything comes up.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r576","rowIndex":576,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　話し合いが一段落ついたところで、僕はそう言って解散を宣言した。","en":"When the discussion reaches a natural stopping point, I say this and declare the meeting adjourned.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r577","rowIndex":577,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=81>龍頭</tips>、くれぐれも気をつけてくださいね。<tips=4>馬明</tips>の部下たちが、命を狙ってくるかもしれません」","en":"“Please be very careful, <tips=81>Longtou</tips>. <tips=4>Ma Ming’s</tips> men may try to kill you.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"壬生屋タカシ","displayName":"Takashi Mibuya","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r578","rowIndex":578,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ありがとう。でも、<tips=40>天明</tips>と<tips=40>天祥</tips>がいれば大丈夫だよ」","en":"“Thank you. But I’ll be safe with <tips=40>Tin-ming</tips> and <tips=40>Tin-cheung</tips> here.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r579","rowIndex":579,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　白々しく心配をしてみせる<tips=33>壬生屋</tips>を、僕は手を振って追い払う。","en":"I waved away <tips=33>Mibuya</tips> and his transparently insincere show of concern.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r580","rowIndex":580,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=34>ダリオ</tips>は黙って頭を下げてから部屋を出て、<tips=28>トミー</tips>は何か言いたげな顔をしていたが、結局何も言わずに出て行った。","en":"<tips=34>Dario</tips> bowed his head in silence and left the room. <tips=28>Tommy</tips> looked as though he wanted to say something, but in the end, he too departed without a word.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r581","rowIndex":581,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=31>エリー・ホワイト</tips>はなかなか帰ろうとしなかった。","en":"<tips=31>Ellie White</tips> makes no move to leave.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r582","rowIndex":582,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「きみも帰りなよ。<tips=31>エリー</tips>。もうここには用がないはずだ」","en":"“You go home too, <tips=31>Ellie</tips>. There shouldn’t be anything left for you to do here.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r583","rowIndex":583,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　早く一人になりたくて、面倒くさいという態度を前面に出しながら投げやりにそう言ったが、しかし彼女は出て行こうとせず、立ち止まって意味ありげに僕を見ている。","en":"I wanted to be alone as soon as possible, and made no effort to hide my annoyance as I spoke dismissively. Yet she remained where she was, looking at me with a meaningful expression.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r584","rowIndex":584,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なんだよ」","en":"“What?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r585","rowIndex":585,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「さすがの<tips=81>龍頭</tips>でもこたえますか？」","en":"“Was that enough to shake even the <tips=81>Longtou</tips>?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エリー・ホワイト","displayName":"Ellie White","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r586","rowIndex":586,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=31>エリー</tips>はからかうようにそう言った。","en":"<tips=31>Ellie</tips> says this to tease me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r587","rowIndex":587,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうじゃない。でも、後悔はしている。あんな手の込んだことをしないで、他のやつらと同じように殺すべきだった」","en":"“That isn’t it. But I do regret what I did. I should never have gone to such lengths. I should have killed him just like the others.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r588","rowIndex":588,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「後悔しなきゃいけないことなんか、ありましたか？」","en":"“Was there really anything you needed to regret?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エリー・ホワイト","displayName":"Ellie White","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r589","rowIndex":589,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　もちろん、あるに決まっている。","en":"Of course there is.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r590","rowIndex":590,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　特別扱いしてしまったのは僕の甘えだった。あんなことをしたって<tips=4>馬明</tips>が自分の頭に銃を向ける筈がないとわかっていたのに、僕は自分を納得させるために小細工をしてしまった。その時は意識していなかったが、今ならわかる。無意識のうちに、チャンスは与えたという言い訳を欲したのだろう。そして、結局彼を不必要に辱めることになった。","en":"Treating him as a special case was weakness on my part. I knew <tips=4>Ma Ming</tips> would never point the gun at his own head, yet I resorted to that little trick merely to satisfy myself. I was not conscious of it then, but I see it now. Somewhere beneath awareness, I must have wanted the excuse that I had given him a chance. In the end, all I did was humiliate him needlessly.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r591","rowIndex":591,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕の弱さが彼に恥をかかせたんだ。","en":"My weakness made a fool of him.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r592","rowIndex":592,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕は黙ってコーヒーをすすった。","en":"I say nothing and sip my coffee.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r593","rowIndex":593,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女はそんな僕の顔を見て、生意気にも悟ったような態度でフフンと笑うと、","en":"She studies my face, then has the impudence to give a knowing little hum of laughter before saying:","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r594","rowIndex":594,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「たまには感情を見せるのも、良いことですよ。あそこで戸惑いを見せ、それでも実行したのはプラスに働くと思います。あれも計算ならば大したものです」","en":"“It can be beneficial to show emotion from time to time. You hesitated there, yet still carried it through. I believe that will work in your favor. If even that was calculated, then I am thoroughly impressed.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エリー・ホワイト","displayName":"Ellie White","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r595","rowIndex":595,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「冗談はやめてくれ」","en":"“Spare me the jokes.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r596","rowIndex":596,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「今日のことで、はっきりとわかりました。あなたは<tips=3>クリス</tips>様とは違う、<tips=1>謝亮</tips>という新しい<tips=81>龍頭</tips>なんだって」","en":"“Today made one thing perfectly clear. You are not Master <tips=3>Chris</tips>. You are <tips=1>Tse Leung</tips>, a new <tips=81>Longtou</tips> in your own right.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エリー・ホワイト","displayName":"Ellie White","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r597","rowIndex":597,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうかい」","en":"“Is that so?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r598","rowIndex":598,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あと、大事なお話があります。もしかしたらこれから私たちの脅威になるかもしれない者の話です」","en":"“There is also an important matter I must discuss with you. It concerns someone who may become a threat to us.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エリー・ホワイト","displayName":"Ellie White","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r599","rowIndex":599,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「後にしてくれ」","en":"“Later.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r600","rowIndex":600,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「わかりました。……お気を落とさぬよう。これからも、私は引き続きあなたに協力させていただきます」","en":"“Understood. ...Please do not lose heart. I will continue to lend you my full support.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エリー・ホワイト","displayName":"Ellie White","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r601","rowIndex":601,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして彼女は軽く頭を下げると、くるりと背を向けてドアを開けて部屋を出て行った。","en":"She dips her head, spins around, opens the door, and leaves the room.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r602","rowIndex":602,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　すると、僕と<tips=30>レイレイ</tips>、それから亡き<tips=39>ジェフリー</tips>の二人の娘である<tips=40>天明</tips>と<tips=40>天祥</tips>が部屋に残る。","en":"That leaves me in the room with <tips=30>Leilei</tips> and the late <tips=39>Jeffrey</tips> Wong’s two daughters, <tips=40>Tin-ming</tips> and <tips=40>Tin-cheung</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r603","rowIndex":603,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=30>レイレイ</tips>は<tips=4>馬明</tips>の死を知らされたとき酷く動揺していて、いまも落ち着かない表情で僕の机の側に立っている。<tips=16>タイプA</tips>でもないのにひどい畸形があるそうだが、服を着ているとわからない。ただいつも自信なげにしているのは、人と違った身体をもつもの特有の性格だった。","en":"<tips=30>Leilei</tips> was badly shaken when she learned of <tips=4>Ma Ming’s</tips> death, and she is still standing beside my desk with an uneasy look on her face. I have heard that, despite not being <tips=16>Type A</tips>, she has a severe deformity, though one cannot tell while she is dressed. Her habitual lack of confidence is simply the particular disposition of someone born with a body unlike other people’s.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r604","rowIndex":604,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　いつも僕の側にいる<tips=40>天明</tips>と<tips=40>天祥</tips>は事前に情報を聞いていた。聞いた時は二人とも驚きの表情を浮かべていたが、一度も自分の意見や感想は口にしていない。","en":"<tips=40>Tin-ming</tips> and <tips=40>Tin-cheung</tips>, who are always at my side, were told beforehand. They both looked surprised when they heard, but neither has once voiced an opinion or said how she feels.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r605","rowIndex":605,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　父さんの<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>から歴代の<tips=81>龍頭</tips>に仕えてきた彼女たちは、当然<tips=4>馬明</tips>のこともよく知っている。仲良く冗談などを言い合って笑っているのを僕も見ている。異形であり異能である彼女たちはおそれられ、部下たちからも距離を置かれていたが、<tips=4>馬明</tips>はそんなことおかまいなしだった。","en":"The sisters have served every successive <tips=81>Longtou</tips> beginning with my father, <tips=3>Chris Tse</tips>, so naturally they know <tips=4>Ma Ming</tips> well. I have seen them laugh and trade friendly jokes with him. Their unnatural forms and abilities inspire fear, and even our own men keep their distance, but <tips=4>Ma Ming</tips> never cared about any of that.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r606","rowIndex":606,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=40>天明</tips>、<tips=40>天祥</tips>、きみたちも少し休むといい」","en":"“<tips=40>Tin-ming</tips>, <tips=40>Tin-cheung</tips>, you two should take some time to rest.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r607","rowIndex":607,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕はそう声をかけてみた。","en":"I venture the suggestion.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r608","rowIndex":608,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「い、いえ、そんな」","en":"“N-no, we couldn’t...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"黄天祥","displayName":"Wong Tin-cheung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r609","rowIndex":609,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「私たちは大丈夫です」","en":"“We are perfectly all right.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"黄天明","displayName":"Wong Tin-ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r610","rowIndex":610,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「父が死んだ時も、他の時も、動揺して<tips=81>龍頭</tips>様には不甲斐ない姿を見せてしまいました。あんなことはもうありません」","en":"“When Father died, and at other times as well, we lost our composure and showed you how unreliable we could be, <tips=81>Longtou</tips>. It will not happen again.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"黄天祥","displayName":"Wong Tin-cheung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r611","rowIndex":611,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「私たちは<tips=81>龍頭</tips>様を守るためだけに存在する道具なんです。他のことは、気にしないでください」","en":"“We are tools that exist solely to protect you, <tips=81>Longtou</tips>. Please pay no mind to anything else.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"黄天明","displayName":"Wong Tin-ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r612","rowIndex":612,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それに、むしろ<tips=81>龍頭</tips>様こそ……」","en":"“If anything, <tips=81>Longtou</tips>, you are the one who...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"黄天祥","displayName":"Wong Tin-cheung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r613","rowIndex":613,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「何言っているんだ。僕はどうってことない。それにね、きみらは道具なんかじゃないんだ。僕を守るのはただの仕事で、仕事を離れたら幼なじみだろうよ。それに、休暇を与えたっていつも僕に張り付いてるけど、自分の時間はちゃんととってるのかい？　たまには二人で遊びに行ったらどうだ。なんなら僕が街に連れてってやろうか」","en":"“What are you talking about? I’m fine. And you two aren’t tools. Protecting me is just your job. Once you’re off duty, we’re childhood friends, aren’t we? Even when I give you time off, you’re always stuck to my side. Do you ever make time for yourselves? Why not go out and have fun together for once? I could take you into town myself, if you like.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r614","rowIndex":614,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「い、いえ、そんな……」","en":"“N-no, we couldn’t possibly...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"黄天明","displayName":"Wong Tin-ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r615","rowIndex":615,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「勿体ないお言葉です」","en":"“Your words are far too generous.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"黄天祥","displayName":"Wong Tin-cheung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r616","rowIndex":616,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　姉妹は顔を赤らめて俯く。","en":"The sisters blush and lower their heads.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r617","rowIndex":617,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕はそれを見ながら溜息をついた。","en":"I sigh as I watch them.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r618","rowIndex":618,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あ、あの、<tips=81>龍頭</tips>様。私はこれで良かったんだと思います」","en":"“U-um, <tips=81>Longtou</tips>. I think this was for the best.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"レイレイ","displayName":"Leilei","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r619","rowIndex":619,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そう言ったのは<tips=30>レイレイ</tips>だった。","en":"The speaker is <tips=30>Leilei</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r620","rowIndex":620,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女が何か意見するのは珍しい。本人もよほど勇気を振り絞ったらしく、顔を真っ赤にしている。","en":"It is rare for her to offer any opinion. She seems to have summoned a great deal of courage even for this, and her face is bright red.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r621","rowIndex":621,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=4>馬</tips>様は、<tips=3>クリス</tips>様や、<tips=39>ウォン</tips>様のいるところに行きたかったんだと思います。だからあんなことを……」","en":"“I think Master <tips=4>Ma</tips> wanted to go where Master <tips=3>Chris</tips> and Master <tips=39>Wong</tips> are. That's why he did what he did...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"レイレイ","displayName":"Leilei","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r622","rowIndex":622,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「僕を慰めているつもりなのかい？」","en":"“Are you trying to comfort me?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r623","rowIndex":623,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「い、いえ」","en":"“N-no.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"レイレイ","displayName":"Leilei","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r624","rowIndex":624,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕がむっとして言うと、彼女はあわてて否定する。","en":"My irritated response sends her into a panicked denial.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r625","rowIndex":625,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「きみらは僕を落ち込んでることにしたいみたいだけれど、それはありがた迷惑というものだ」","en":"“All of you seem determined to treat me as though I were despondent. That sort of kindness is anything but welcome.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r626","rowIndex":626,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕は立ち上がる。","en":"I rise to my feet.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r627","rowIndex":627,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ちょっと会議室を見てくる。きみはここで電話番をしていてくれ。<tips=40>天明</tips>、<tips=40>天祥</tips>。今日の仕事はもう終わりだ。自室に戻ってくれたまえ」","en":"“I’m going to take a look at the conference room. You stay here and mind the phone. <tips=40>Tin-ming</tips>, <tips=40>Tin-cheung</tips>, your work is done for today. Go back to your rooms.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r628","rowIndex":628,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そう言い残し、部屋を出た。","en":"Leaving those words behind, I walk out of the room.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r629","rowIndex":629,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　エレベーターに乗り、会議室のある階におりる。","en":"I take the elevator down to the floor where the conference room is located.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r630","rowIndex":630,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　日が落ちかけ、窓からはオレンジ色の光が斜めに差し込んで廊下に窓枠の影を落としていた。","en":"The sun was beginning to set. Orange light slanted through the windows, casting the shadows of their frames across the corridor.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r631","rowIndex":631,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それが眩しくて目を細めながら階段を下りると、エレベーターを待っていた二人の少女に気がつくのが少し遅れた。","en":"Squinting against the glare as I descended the stairs, I was slow to notice the two girls waiting for the elevator.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r632","rowIndex":632,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あ、お兄さん」","en":"“Oh, hello.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"熨田さくら","displayName":"Sakura Noshida","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r633","rowIndex":633,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そう声をあげたのは、松葉杖をついた少女だった。","en":"The girl on crutches called out to me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r634","rowIndex":634,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　名前は<tips=51>熨田さくら</tips>。あのテレポート少女にさらわれた<tips=44>筱喬</tips>を取り戻してくれた人物で、空を飛ぶ能力があるサイキックだ。その肌がしっとりと濡れているのは、暑いわけではなくて彼女の<tips=77>特質変異</tips>だと言う。常にねばねばした体液が肌から分泌されているらしい。","en":"Her name is <tips=51>Sakura Noshida</tips>. A psychic with the power of flight, she is the one who rescued <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> from the teleporting girl who abducted her. The damp sheen on Sakura’s skin comes not from the heat but, I am told, from her <tips=77>trait mutation</tips>. Apparently, her skin constantly secretes a sticky bodily fluid.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r635","rowIndex":635,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その隣では<tips=44>筱喬</tips>が、よそ行きの服を着て立っている。僕はその顔を見ると気が重くなった。<tips=4>馬明</tips>は彼女にとっても、子供のころから面倒を見てくれる親しい人間であったのだ。今ここで僕が殺したと知ったら、取り乱してしまうことだろう。しかしいつかは気がつくことなのだ。","en":"Beside her stands <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips>, dressed to go out. The moment I see her face, my heart sinks. <tips=4>Ma Ming</tips> was close to her as well, looking after her since she was a child. If she learned now that I killed him, she would surely be beside herself. But sooner or later, she will find out.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r636","rowIndex":636,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「足の調子はどうだい？」","en":"“How is your leg?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r637","rowIndex":637,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕は<tips=44>筱喬</tips>から目をそらして<tips=51>さくら</tips>にそう言った。","en":"I look away from <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> and say this to <tips=51>Sakura</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r638","rowIndex":638,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まだ痛いですけど、すぐ慣れそうです。見た目もほとんど違和感ないし」","en":"“It still hurts, but I think I’ll get used to it soon. It hardly looks out of place, either.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"熨田さくら","displayName":"Sakura Noshida","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r639","rowIndex":639,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=44>筱喬</tips>救出の際に片足を失った彼女のために、僕は最新の義足をプレゼントしていた。","en":"She had lost a leg during <tips=44>Siu-kiu’s</tips> rescue, so I had given her a state-of-the-art prosthetic leg.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r640","rowIndex":640,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「もう歩くことも出来るんですよ。ほら」","en":"“I can already walk on it. Look.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"熨田さくら","displayName":"Sakura Noshida","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r641","rowIndex":641,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=51>さくら</tips>はそう言うと、松葉杖を持ち上げて二本の足で数歩あるいてみせる。多少ひょこひょことしてはいたが、思ったよりもスムーズに歩けていた。","en":"With that, <tips=51>Sakura</tips> lifts her crutches and takes a few steps on both feet. She walks with a slight bob, but more smoothly than I expected.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r642","rowIndex":642,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まあ、普段は空を飛んでるからあんまり関係ないんですけどね」","en":"“Then again, I usually fly, so it doesn’t make much difference.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"熨田さくら","displayName":"Sakura Noshida","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r643","rowIndex":643,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「このビルのまわりも良く飛んでるみたいだね。この間も、<tips=40>天明</tips>が空から人間が近づいて来ると報告してきたので、見たら、きみが飛んでた」","en":"“You seem to fly around this building quite a lot. Just the other day, <tips=40>Tin-ming</tips> reported that someone was approaching through the air. I looked, and there you were.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r644","rowIndex":644,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あー、見られてたんですか」","en":"“Oh—so you saw me.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"熨田さくら","displayName":"Sakura Noshida","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r645","rowIndex":645,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=51>さくら</tips>は照れくさそうに頭を掻く。","en":"<tips=51>Sakura</tips> scratches her head sheepishly.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r646","rowIndex":646,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「今日はどうしてこんなところに？」","en":"“What brings you here today?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r647","rowIndex":647,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「お昼は一緒に街に買い物に出かけてて、今はこの<tips=41>グランドタワー</tips>のなかを色々案内してもらってたんです。いつも外から見てて、気になってたところがいくつかあったから。この階は、奥の倉庫の段ボールが気になってて」","en":"“Siu-kiu and I went shopping in town around noon, and now she’s been showing me all around the <tips=41>Grand Tower</tips>. I’m always looking at it from outside, and there were a few places I’d wondered about. On this floor, I was curious about the cardboard boxes in the storeroom at the back.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"熨田さくら","displayName":"Sakura Noshida","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r648","rowIndex":648,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=51>さくら</tips>の態度は嘘をついたり、何かを隠しているようには見えない。ということは、さっき会議室で起きたこととは関係なく、彼女の言う通りの理由でここにいるのだ。","en":"Nothing in <tips=51>Sakura’s</tips> manner suggests that she is lying or hiding anything. That means she has nothing to do with what happened in the conference room and is here for exactly the reason she gave.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r649","rowIndex":649,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうか。でも、居住区域以外のフロアはあまり出歩かない方が良いかもしれない」","en":"“I see. Still, it might be best not to wander around floors outside the residential area.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r650","rowIndex":650,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ご、ごめんなさい」","en":"“I-I’m sorry.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"熨田さくら","displayName":"Sakura Noshida","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r651","rowIndex":651,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「別に叱っているわけじゃない。ただここに出入りするのはきみを知っている人間ばかりじゃないから、不用意にこのビルを歩くと、面倒なことに巻き込まれる可能性がある」","en":"“I’m not scolding you. It’s just that not everyone who comes and goes here knows who you are. If you wander around the building without due care, you could get caught up in trouble.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r652","rowIndex":652,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そ、そうですね。気をつけます」","en":"“R-right. I’ll be careful.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"熨田さくら","displayName":"Sakura Noshida","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r653","rowIndex":653,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=51>さくら</tips>はかあっと顔を赤くして俯いた。","en":"<tips=51>Sakura</tips> flushes bright red and lowers her head.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r654","rowIndex":654,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「僕に何かして欲しいことがあったら何でも言ってほしい」","en":"“If there’s anything you want me to do, just tell me. Anything at all.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r655","rowIndex":655,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうなんですか。じゃあ、今度ゲーム一緒にやってください！　私ゲーム好きなんです。三人でチーム組んで遊ぶのがあるんですけど、私と<tips=44>筱喬</tips>の二人じゃ足りなくて」","en":"“Really? Then please play a game with me sometime! I love games. There’s one where you play in teams of three, but <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> and I need one more person.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"熨田さくら","displayName":"Sakura Noshida","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r656","rowIndex":656,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=51>さくら</tips>は遠慮せずに言う。","en":"<tips=51>Sakura</tips> makes the request without a trace of reserve.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r657","rowIndex":657,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その無邪気な望みに、僕も苦笑してしまう。","en":"Her innocent wish makes me smile wryly despite myself.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r658","rowIndex":658,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「良いね」","en":"“That sounds good.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r659","rowIndex":659,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「やったー、ありがとうございます！　ねえ<tips=44>筱喬</tips>、<tips=1>亮</tips>さんが一緒に遊んでくれるんだって」","en":"“Yay! Thank you! Hey, <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips>—<tips=1>Leung</tips> says he’ll play with us!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"熨田さくら","displayName":"Sakura Noshida","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r660","rowIndex":660,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=51>さくら</tips>はそう言って、僕を見つめたまま一言も喋らない<tips=44>筱喬</tips>の肩を叩く。","en":"As she says this, <tips=51>Sakura</tips> taps <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> on the shoulder. Siu-kiu has not said a word and has kept her eyes fixed on me the entire time.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r661","rowIndex":661,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=44>筱喬</tips>は眉間に皺を寄せて首を傾けると、こう言った。","en":"<tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> furrows her brow, tilts her head, and says:","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r662","rowIndex":662,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「お兄ちゃん、何かあったの？　なんか雰囲気がいつもとちがう」","en":"“Leung, did something happen? There’s something different about you.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r663","rowIndex":663,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　あいかわらず勘のいいやつだ。僕はいつもと変わらぬ態度を装っているつもりだったのである。","en":"She is as sharp as ever. I thought I had been putting on exactly the same manner as always.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r664","rowIndex":664,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「別に何もないよ。大丈夫。何も心配することはない」","en":"“Nothing’s wrong. I’m fine. There’s nothing for you to worry about.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r665","rowIndex":665,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕はそう言ったが、彼女は信用しなかったようで、疑いの視線をこちらに向けてくる。","en":"She does not seem to believe me and fixes me with a suspicious stare.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r666","rowIndex":666,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「仕事中なんだ。じゃあ」","en":"“I’m working. See you.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r667","rowIndex":667,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　普段だったらもう少し相手をしても良いのだが、今はとてもそんな気持ちになれなかったのでその場を立ち去った。","en":"Ordinarily, I would not mind staying with them a little longer, but right now I cannot bring myself to do it. I walk away.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r668","rowIndex":668,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ただ、<tips=44>筱喬</tips>にもあとで説明をしなくてはいけないだろう。僕の口から直接話さなければいけない。それが僕の責任なのだ。","en":"Still, I will have to explain it to <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> later. I have to tell her myself. That is my responsibility.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r669","rowIndex":669,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　会議室に足を踏み入れると、<tips=25>世傑</tips>が一人で窓際に立って外に広がる<tips=9>Y地区</tips>の夕景を眺めていた。","en":"When I step into the conference room, <tips=25>Sai-kit</tips> is standing alone by the window, gazing at the evening view spread across <tips=9>Y District</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r670","rowIndex":670,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　部屋の清掃は済み、何事もなかったかのように綺麗に元通りになっている。","en":"The room has been cleaned and restored to pristine order, as though nothing ever happened here.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r671","rowIndex":671,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=81>龍頭</tips>……」","en":"“<tips=81>Longtou</tips>...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬世傑","displayName":"Ma Sai-kit","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r672","rowIndex":672,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=25>世傑</tips>はゆっくりと振り向いた。その表情には憂いはなく、微笑が浮かんでいる。","en":"<tips=25>Sai-kit</tips> slowly turns around. There is no sorrow on his face; instead, he is smiling.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r673","rowIndex":673,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「大体おわりました。遺体も、今頃家族のところに届いているはずです」","en":"“Most of the work is finished. The body should have reached the family by now.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬世傑","displayName":"Ma Sai-kit","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r674","rowIndex":674,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ありがとう」","en":"“Thank you.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r675","rowIndex":675,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いえいえ、仕事ですから」","en":"“No need to thank me. It’s my job.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬世傑","displayName":"Ma Sai-kit","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r676","rowIndex":676,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そう言って、彼はまた窓の外に視線を向ける。","en":"With that, he turns his gaze back outside.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r677","rowIndex":677,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「別に感傷に浸ってるわけじゃないのよ。ちょっと眺めたら、なんだか見入っちゃって。……夕日ってこんなに鮮やかだった？　あまりにも久しぶりに眺めたから、どうも思い出せないわ。子供の時は、しょっちゅう空を眺めていたのに……」","en":"“It’s not as if I’m getting sentimental. I only meant to take a quick look, but somehow I got drawn in. Was the sunset always this vivid? It’s been so long since I watched one that I can’t seem to remember. When I was a child, I looked up at the sky all the time...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬世傑","displayName":"Ma Sai-kit","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r678","rowIndex":678,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=25>世傑</tips>はそう言ってちょっと笑う。","en":"<tips=25>Sai-kit</tips> gives a little laugh as he says this.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r679","rowIndex":679,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「僕は今でも結構眺めるけどね」","en":"“I still look up at the sky fairly often.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r680","rowIndex":680,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕は机に腰をかけると、彼と同じように窓の外を見る。","en":"I sit on the edge of the desk and look out the window as he does.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r681","rowIndex":681,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ごちゃごちゃした<tips=9>Y地区</tips>特有の町並みがあり、その先には<tips=15>ボーダーエリア</tips>の林がある。","en":"Before us lies the jumbled cityscape peculiar to <tips=9>Y District</tips>, and beyond it the woods of the <tips=15>Border Area</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r682","rowIndex":682,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　あの林の向こうには<tips=8>グレートホール</tips>があるのだが、木々に覆われていてここから見ることは出来ない。","en":"The <tips=8>Great Hole</tips> lies beyond those woods, but the trees cover it and make it impossible to see from here.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r683","rowIndex":683,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　さらにずっと向こうには山並みがあり、ギラギラと輝く太陽がその稜線に沈もうとしている。","en":"Farther still is a range of mountains, and the sun, blazing with fierce light, is about to sink behind the ridgeline.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r684","rowIndex":684,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ねえ<tips=25>世傑</tips>、今夜から、死者の祈りに<tips=4>馬明</tips>も付け加えてくれないか？」","en":"“Hey, <tips=25>Sai-kit</tips>. Starting tonight, would you include <tips=4>Ma Ming</tips> in your prayers for the dead?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r685","rowIndex":685,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕はそう言った。","en":"I asked him.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r686","rowIndex":686,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「言われなくてもそうするつもりよ。掃除の前に、ちゃんと写真をとっておいたんだから」","en":"“I was going to, whether you asked me or not. I made sure to take a picture before we cleaned the room.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r687","rowIndex":687,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼は振り返らずにそう答える。","en":"He answers without turning around.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r688","rowIndex":688,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「よく撮影出来たな。やっぱりきみはとんでもなく悪趣味だ」","en":"“You actually managed to take a picture? Your taste really is beyond appalling.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r689","rowIndex":689,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕が溜息をつくと、","en":"I sigh, and he says:","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r690","rowIndex":690,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「褒め言葉だと受け取っておくわ」","en":"“I’ll take that as a compliment.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r691","rowIndex":691,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼は肩をすくめる。","en":"He shrugs.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r692","rowIndex":692,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「アタシね、いつか、自分がこの手であの人のことを殺すんだと思ってたの。１５か、１６くらいの時から、そうなってしまうんじゃないかと思ってた。何か理由があったわけじゃないわ。そういう運命なのだろうって、自然とそう感じていたの。……でも違った。ほっとしてるわ。こんなことを言うのは変だけど、素直にその死を悲しむことが出来て良かった。……あなたは誰か人が死んで悲しんだことある？」","en":"“You know, I always thought that one day I’d be the one to kill him with my own hands. Ever since I was fifteen or sixteen, I had this feeling that was how things would end. There wasn’t any particular reason. It simply felt like fate. ...But that isn’t what happened. I’m relieved. This may sound strange, but I’m glad I can simply be sad that he died. ...Have you ever felt sad when someone died?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r693","rowIndex":693,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕は何も答えなかった。彼も別に答えを必要としているわけではないようだった。","en":"I give no answer. He does not seem to need one.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r694","rowIndex":694,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　太陽が稜線に沈むと、窓の外はみるみるうちに夜の景色へと変わる。","en":"As the sun sinks below the ridgeline, the view outside the window changes before our eyes into a landscape of night.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r695","rowIndex":695,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして<tips=25>世傑</tips>は振り返る。","en":"Then <tips=25>Sai-kit</tips> turns around.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r696","rowIndex":696,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あのさ……」","en":"“Hey...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬世傑","displayName":"Ma Sai-kit","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r697","rowIndex":697,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼が何か言いかけたところで、その胸から電子音が流れ出す。","en":"Just as he starts to say something, an electronic tone sounds from his chest.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r698","rowIndex":698,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それは、携帯電話の着信音だ。","en":"It is the ringtone of his cell phone.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r699","rowIndex":699,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「届いたのかしら」","en":"“I wonder if they’ve arrived.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬世傑","displayName":"Ma Sai-kit","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r700","rowIndex":700,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼はつまらそうな顔で携帯電話のモニターを僕に見せてくれる。それは、<tips=4>馬明</tips>の遺体を家に送り届ける役目の部下からの着信だった。","en":"With an unamused look, he holds up his cell phone so I can see the display. The call is from one of the men assigned to deliver <tips=4>Ma Ming’s</tips> body to his home.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r701","rowIndex":701,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼は着信を取り、そして、数語会話を交わしたあとだった。","en":"He answers the call. After exchanging only a few words—","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r702","rowIndex":702,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「アハハハハハ！」","en":"“Ahahahahaha!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬世傑","displayName":"Ma Sai-kit","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r703","rowIndex":703,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　急に、はじけるように笑い出す。","en":"Without warning, he bursts into peals of laughter.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r704","rowIndex":704,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どうした？」","en":"“What happened?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r705","rowIndex":705,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どうしたもこうしたもないわよ！　ばっかみたい！」","en":"“There’s no ‘what happened’ about it! It’s just so stupid!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬世傑","displayName":"Ma Sai-kit","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r706","rowIndex":706,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼は身体をくの字に曲げ、腹を抱えて笑っている。その目には涙さえ浮かんでいる。","en":"He doubles over, clutching his stomach as he laughs. There are even tears in his eyes.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r707","rowIndex":707,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　一体何を聞かされたのかと問うと、彼はこう言った。","en":"I ask what on earth he has been told, and he says:","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r708","rowIndex":708,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「死んじゃったんだって！　<tips=24>美美</tips>が！」","en":"“They say she’s dead! <tips=24>Meimei</tips>!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬世傑","displayName":"Ma Sai-kit","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r709","rowIndex":709,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　部下は<tips=4>馬明</tips>の遺体を車に積んでその邸宅に到着したとき、対応したのは<tips=24>美美</tips>だった。そこで、その死の理由を説明したところ、彼女はひどく取り乱し、僕らをなじったという。","en":"Our men drove to <tips=4>Ma Ming’s</tips> mansion with his body in the car. <tips=24>Meimei</tips> met them there. When they explained why he had died, she became terribly distraught and berated us, they said.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r710","rowIndex":710,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕と<tips=25>世傑</tips>がグルになって<tips=4>馬明</tips>を殺したのだと。そんな汚名を着せるなんて許せないと。呪ってやる、早く出て行けと泣き叫び、とても手のつけられない有様であったらしい。","en":"She screamed that <tips=25>Sai-kit</tips> and I had conspired to kill <tips=4>Ma Ming</tips>, and that she would never forgive us for smearing his name. Weeping, she threatened to curse us and ordered the men out at once; apparently she was utterly beyond control.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r711","rowIndex":711,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そこで部下たちは一旦引き上げたのだが、門を出てすぐに屋敷から銃声が聞こえた。驚いて引き返すと<tips=24>美美</tips>が銃を持って倒れている。彼女の頭からは血液が流れている。頭を撃ったのだ。赤子だけでも助けようとすぐ病院に連れて行ったが、そちらも助からなかったそうだ。","en":"The men withdrew for the moment, but as soon as they passed through the gate, they heard a gunshot from the mansion. They rushed back in alarm and found <tips=24>Meimei</tips> collapsed with a gun in her hand. Blood was flowing from her head. She had shot herself in the head. They rushed her to a hospital in hopes of saving at least the baby, but the baby reportedly did not survive either.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r712","rowIndex":712,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あの子、最近あんたに対して不信感あったのよね。<tips=35>フェルナンデス</tips>の娘さんの件も、あんたの差し金だって信じてたわ。恐ろしくてしかたなかったんでしょうね。でも、だからって自殺なんかしてどうするの？　次は自分が組織に殺されるとでも思ったのかしら！　アハハハ！　ばっかみたい！」","en":"“She had been suspicious of you lately. She believed you were behind what happened to <tips=35>Fernandes’s</tips> daughter, too. She must have been terrified. But what did she think she would accomplish by killing herself? Did she imagine the organization would kill her next? Ahahaha! It’s so stupid!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬世傑","displayName":"Ma Sai-kit","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r713","rowIndex":713,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=25>世傑</tips>は笑い続けている。濡れた顔をおさえ、気が狂ったかのように、いつまでも笑い続けている。","en":"<tips=25>Sai-kit</tips> goes on laughing. He presses his hands to his wet face and laughs without end, as though he has lost his mind.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A6:r714","rowIndex":714,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その声を聞きながら僕は、今日<tips=55>松子</tips>に別れを告げることが出来たのは本当によかった、と思っていた。","en":"As I listen to his laughter, I find myself thinking how glad I am that I was able to say goodbye to <tips=55>Matsuko</tips> today.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}}]},{"position":30,"code":"E4","unitId":"E4","rows":[{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r1","rowIndex":1,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「少しくらい飲んだ方が、気持ちが晴れるかもしれないわよ」","en":"“A little alcohol might lift your spirits.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"カルロッタ","displayName":"Carlotta","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r2","rowIndex":2,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　カルロッタはそう言って、私の前に透明な液体に満ちたグラスを置いた。","en":"With that, Carlotta set a glass of clear liquid in front of me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r3","rowIndex":3,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は無言でそれを見る。","en":"I looked at it in silence.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r4","rowIndex":4,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「私からのサービスよ。ほんのちょっぴりアルコールが入ってるわ。あなたには水みたいなものだろうけど、空きっ腹には丁度いいでしょ」","en":"“It’s on the house. There’s only the tiniest drop of alcohol in it. It might as well be water to you, but it should be just right on an empty stomach.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"カルロッタ","displayName":"Carlotta","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r5","rowIndex":5,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……欲しくないな」","en":"“...I don’t want it.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r6","rowIndex":6,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そんな気になれないのもわかるけれど、もうすぐ二週間じゃない。前のようにというのは到底無理にしても、少しは元気出さなくっちゃ。まるで廃人になったみたいよ。無精ひげだってそんなに伸ばして」","en":"“I understand that you’re in no mood, but it has been almost two weeks. No one expects you to go back to the way you were before, but you have to pull yourself together a little. You look like a complete wreck. And just look how long you’ve let your beard grow.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"カルロッタ","displayName":"Carlotta","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r7","rowIndex":7,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は言われて自分の顎に手をやる。","en":"At her words, I put a hand to my chin.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r8","rowIndex":8,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　自分では以前と変わらず身だしなみを整えているつもりだったが、何日か忘れていたのか、頬や顎の下には苔のようにびっしりと固いひげが伸びている。","en":"I thought I was keeping up my appearance as carefully as ever, but perhaps I had forgotten for several days: stiff whiskers now carpeted my cheeks and the underside of my jaw like moss.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r9","rowIndex":9,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「体臭だってひどいわよ」","en":"“And you smell awful.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"カルロッタ","displayName":"Carlotta","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r10","rowIndex":10,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうか。それは済まなかったな」","en":"“I see. Sorry about that.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r11","rowIndex":11,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「その腕の骨折は大丈夫？　持ってる痛み止めでも出してあげようか」","en":"“Is that broken arm all right? I could give you some of the painkillers I keep here.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"カルロッタ","displayName":"Carlotta","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r12","rowIndex":12,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ギプスで固定して肩から吊っている左腕を見ながら、カルロッタは言った。","en":"Carlotta said, looking at my left arm in its cast and sling.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r13","rowIndex":13,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いや、必要ない。……しかし、迷惑をかけているようだな」","en":"“No, I don’t need them. ...But it seems I’m making a nuisance of myself.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r14","rowIndex":14,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"『Ｐｕｅｒｔｏ』の店内はそろそろ混み始めていた。私は気を遣って腰を浮かしかけたが、","en":"Puerto was beginning to fill. I started to rise out of consideration for the customers, but—","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r15","rowIndex":15,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そういうつもりで言ったんじゃないわよ。……ほら、そろそろ料理も出来るから、座ってなさい。ご飯も全然食べてないでしょう？」","en":"“That wasn’t why I said it. ...Stay there. Your food is almost ready. You haven’t been eating at all, have you?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"カルロッタ","displayName":"Carlotta","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r16","rowIndex":16,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　カルロッタはそう言うが、私は別段食欲というものを感じなかった。","en":"Carlotta said this, but I felt no particular appetite.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r17","rowIndex":17,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そもそも、この店に来るつもりなどなかったのだ。カルロッタが家までやって来て、無理矢理彼女の店の仕入れを手伝わせられ、そしてそのままこのカウンター席に座らされている。","en":"I had never intended to come here at all. Carlotta had shown up at my house, dragged me along to help buy supplies for the restaurant, and then planted me on this stool at the counter.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r18","rowIndex":18,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あなたがこんなになってるのはじめて見たわ。……本当に、<tips=53>ミユキ</tips>ちゃんのことが好きだったのね」","en":"“I’ve never seen you like this. ...You really did love <tips=53>Miyuki</tips>, didn’t you?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"カルロッタ","displayName":"Carlotta","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r19","rowIndex":19,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　カルロッタはカウンターのなかで細々と作業をしながら、そう溜息をつく。","en":"Carlotta sighed as she busied herself with small tasks behind the counter.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r20","rowIndex":20,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そういうわけじゃないさ」","en":"“That isn’t it.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r21","rowIndex":21,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>たちを追い払った後、全身から力が抜けて虚脱した私は、その血みどろの現場で気絶するようにぐっすりと眠り込み、目覚めると警察が私の周りを取り囲んでいた。","en":"After driving off <tips=20>Koschei</tips> and the others, all the strength went out of me. Drained, I fell asleep amid the blood-soaked scene as abruptly as if I had fainted; when I awoke, I found myself surrounded by police.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r22","rowIndex":22,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして現場検証を行う間、私は警察の車両のなかで事情聴取を受ける。","en":"While they processed the scene, I was questioned inside a police vehicle.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r23","rowIndex":23,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私を聴取したのは<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>捜査本部の刑事たちで、彼らは<tips=48>堂島</tips>と私の協力関係を知っているようだった。彼らは私から詳しく話を聞き出したが、私の方からの質問には何も答えなかった。そして去り際、また連絡をするから、それまでは勝手な動きを慎み、くれぐれも一人で捜査を行わないでくれ、場合によっては処罰の対象となると、念入りに釘を刺してから立ち去っていった。","en":"The detectives who questioned me belonged to the <tips=20>Koschei</tips> task force and appeared to know about my cooperation with <tips=48>Dojima</tips>. They drew a detailed account out of me but answered none of my questions. Before leaving, they warned me in no uncertain terms that they would be in touch, and that until then I was to take no action on my own—least of all investigate alone—or I might find myself subject to punishment.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r24","rowIndex":24,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「気持ちはわかるけど、ぼうっとしている場合じゃないわよ。こういう時こそ、あんたの仕事が忙しくなるんじゃないの？」","en":"“I know how you feel, but you can’t afford to sit around in a daze. Isn’t this exactly the sort of time when your work gets busy?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"カルロッタ","displayName":"Carlotta","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r25","rowIndex":25,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　カルロッタは言いながら、私の目の前にきのこのはいったおじやを置いてくれた。","en":"As she spoke, Carlotta placed a bowl of mushroom rice porridge before me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r26","rowIndex":26,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　リゾットではなく和風のおじやだ。メニューにはない。いつだったか、私の好物だと言ったのを記憶してくれていたのだろうか。","en":"It was Japanese rice porridge, not risotto, and it wasn’t on the menu. Had she remembered me mentioning once that it was one of my favorite foods?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r27","rowIndex":27,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「何も忙しいことなんかない」","en":"“There is nothing to keep me busy.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r28","rowIndex":28,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は湯気のたつおじやを眺めたまま、そう呟いた。","en":"I murmured the words without taking my eyes from the steaming porridge.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r29","rowIndex":29,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「知らないの？　今にも街中で派手な抗争が起きるんじゃないかって、みんな噂しているわよ」","en":"“Haven’t you heard? Everyone’s saying a major gang war could erupt across the city at any moment.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"カルロッタ","displayName":"Carlotta","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r30","rowIndex":30,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　カルロッタの話によると、<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>亡き後の<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>内で、緊張が生まれているらしい。","en":"According to Carlotta, tensions had arisen within <tips=7>YS</tips> after the death of <tips=3>Chris Tse</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r31","rowIndex":31,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　後継者として第二代<tips=81>龍頭</tips>の座についたのは、<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>の伯父にあたる<tips=84>マイケル・ツェー</tips>だった。しかし、この二代目はお飾りのようなもので、実際は先代の腹心である<tips=39>ジェフリー・ウォン</tips>と<tips=4>馬明</tips>が執行部として権力を握っているのだそうだ。","en":"The successor who assumed the position of second <tips=81>Longtou</tips> was <tips=84>Michael Tse</tips>, the uncle of <tips=3>Chris Tse</tips>. This second Longtou, however, was apparently little more than a figurehead; the real power lay with <tips=39>Jeffrey Wong</tips> and <tips=4>Ma Ming</tips>, trusted lieutenants of the previous Longtou who served as the executive leadership.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r32","rowIndex":32,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼らはいずれタイミングを見計らって二代目を引退させ、<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>の実子である<tips=1>謝亮</tips>を第三代<tips=81>龍頭</tips>に据えようといるのは明白だ。","en":"It was obvious that, when the time was right, they intended to force the second-generation leader into retirement and install <tips=3>Chris Tse's</tips> biological son, <tips=1>Tse Leung</tips>, as the third <tips=81>Longtou</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r33","rowIndex":33,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そうした血族内での権力の独占に、<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>の他の幹部たちが反発しているらしい。","en":"The other officers of <tips=7>YS</tips> were apparently opposed to this monopoly of power within a single bloodline.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r34","rowIndex":34,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「特に、<tips=27>廖志明</tips>なんかは全然二代目を認める気がないみたい。謝家と廖家の間で戦争が始まったらどうなるのかって、皆戦々恐々としているわ」","en":"“<tips=27>Liao Chi-ming</tips> in particular doesn’t seem willing to acknowledge the second Longtou at all. Everyone is terrified of what will happen if war breaks out between the Tse and Liao families.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"カルロッタ","displayName":"Carlotta","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r35","rowIndex":35,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうか」","en":"“I see.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r36","rowIndex":36,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「つれないわね。あんたが書こうとしている原稿にとって、格好のネタじゃないの？　調べなくっていいの？」","en":"“You’re awfully indifferent. Wouldn’t this be perfect material for that manuscript you’re planning? Aren’t you going to investigate?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"カルロッタ","displayName":"Carlotta","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r37","rowIndex":37,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「興味がないな」","en":"“I’m not interested.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r38","rowIndex":38,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「その調子だと、<tips=26>劉建志</tips>が殺されたのも知らないようね」","en":"“From the look of you, I suppose you haven’t heard that <tips=26>Ryu Kenshi</tips> was killed either.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"カルロッタ","displayName":"Carlotta","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r39","rowIndex":39,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　カルロッタは呆れて溜息をつく。","en":"Carlotta sighed in exasperation.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r40","rowIndex":40,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうか」","en":"“I see.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r41","rowIndex":41,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「誰がやったと思う？　<tips=27>廖志明</tips>じゃないわよ。例のお坊ちゃん……<tips=1>謝亮</tips>がやったって話よ。<tips=26>劉</tips>は<tips=76>香港派</tips>のはずなのに、<tips=76>香港派</tips>の御曹司に娘もろとも殺されたのよ」","en":"“Who do you think did it? Not <tips=27>Liao Chi-ming</tips>. They say it was that precious young master—<tips=1>Tse Leung</tips>. <tips=26>Ryu</tips> was supposed to be part of the <tips=76>Hong Kong faction</tips>, yet the heir to that very <tips=76>Hong Kong faction</tips> killed him and his daughter together.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"カルロッタ","displayName":"Carlotta","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r42","rowIndex":42,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　カルロッタは大げさなそぶりで説明をするが、私は興味を持てなかった。","en":"Carlotta explained with exaggerated gestures, but I could not bring myself to care.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r43","rowIndex":43,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「新しい執行部は、随分と過激な連中らしいわ」","en":"“It sounds as though the new leadership is quite a radical bunch.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"カルロッタ","displayName":"Carlotta","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r44","rowIndex":44,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「へえ」","en":"“Huh.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r45","rowIndex":45,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　やはり興味は持てなかったが、ふとフルカワのことを思い出した。","en":"I still could not bring myself to care, but then Furukawa came to mind.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r46","rowIndex":46,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私にとって重要な情報源であるそのジャンキー女は、他ならぬその<tips=26>劉建志</tips>の情婦である。","en":"That female addict, an important source of information for me, was none other than <tips=26>Ryu Kenshi’s</tips> mistress.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r47","rowIndex":47,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　パトロンがそんな死に方をしたとなれば、さぞかし困っていることだろう。多少の愛情でもあれば悲しみもしているかもしれない。","en":"With her patron dead in such a fashion, she must be in quite a bind. If she felt even the slightest affection for him, perhaps she was grieving as well.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r48","rowIndex":48,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しかし、そのあたりの関係性は私にはうかがい知れぬところだ。","en":"But the nature of their relationship was beyond my knowing.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r49","rowIndex":49,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まあ、元気があっていいことだ」","en":"“Well, at least they have spirit.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r50","rowIndex":50,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私がそう呟いて、おじやにも酒にも手を付けず、その脇においてあった水の入ったグラスから一口飲むと、カルロッタはもう一度溜息をついた。","en":"I murmured this, touched neither the porridge nor the alcohol, and took a sip from the glass of water beside them. Carlotta sighed once more.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r51","rowIndex":51,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私はゆっくりとグラスの水を飲み続ける。店は忙しくなり、カルロッタは他の客の対応や仕事に追われて話しかけてこなくなった。","en":"I went on slowly drinking my water. As the restaurant grew busier, Carlotta became occupied with customers and other work and stopped trying to talk to me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r52","rowIndex":52,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　水がなくなり、冷え切ったおじやを申し訳程度に一口だけ食べてみたが、まるで高熱が出た時のように舌がばかになっていて、何の味も感じ取ることが出来なかった。","en":"Once the water was gone, I made a token effort at the now-cold porridge and swallowed a single spoonful. But my tongue was as dead as if I were running a high fever, and I could taste nothing at all.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r53","rowIndex":53,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　代金を払おうと胸ポケットに手を突っ込んだが財布が見つからない。ズボンにも入っていない。ツケにしてもらうか、家から取ってくるか――。ふと入り口の方を見ると、ちょうどドアが開いて、新たな客が入って来る。この場に似つかわしくないきっちりとしたスーツを着こなした一組の男女である。","en":"I reached into my breast pocket to pay, but could not find my wallet. It was not in my trousers either. Should I ask her to put it on my tab, or go home and get it—? Glancing toward the entrance, I saw the door open just then and two new customers enter: a man and a woman in immaculate suits entirely out of place here.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r54","rowIndex":54,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「温かいものを作り直す？」","en":"“Want me to make you a fresh bowl while it’s hot?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"カルロッタ","displayName":"Carlotta","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r55","rowIndex":55,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私の振る舞いをカルロッタは目ざとく見ていて、そう声をかけた。","en":"Carlotta had been keeping a close eye on me and immediately noticed what I was doing.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r56","rowIndex":56,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いや、必要ない」","en":"“No. Don’t bother.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r57","rowIndex":57,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は首を左右に振ると、","en":"I shook my head.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r58","rowIndex":58,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「お前はおれがダラダラと家に閉じこもっているのを、絶望に打ちひしがれているだけだと思い込んでいるようだが、そうじゃない。おれは今これまでにないくらいやりたい仕事がある。そのために、待っていたのさ」","en":"“You seem to think I’ve been wasting away at home because I’m crushed by despair, but that isn’t it. There’s work I want to do now more than anything I’ve ever done. That’s what I’ve been waiting for.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r59","rowIndex":59,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「待っていた？」","en":"“Waiting?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"カルロッタ","displayName":"Carlotta","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r60","rowIndex":60,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そう。使者を待っていたんだ。おれが自分の力を取り戻すためにね。……どうやら、やっと訪ねてくれたようだ」","en":"“Yes. I was waiting for a messenger. Someone who could help me get my power back. ...And it seems they’ve finally come.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r61","rowIndex":61,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そう話しながら、私は先ほど入店してきた男女を眺めていた。","en":"As I spoke, I watched the man and woman who had entered a short while ago.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r62","rowIndex":62,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼らはアルバイトがテーブルに誘導しようとするのを断って、店内を見回している。それに向かって手をあげて合図をすると、人混みをかき分けて目の前までやって来た。","en":"They declined when one of the servers tried to show them to a table and instead looked around the restaurant. When I raised a hand to signal them, they made their way through the crowd and came straight over.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r63","rowIndex":63,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いま、お時間大丈夫ですか？」","en":"“Do you have a moment?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"三芳","displayName":"Miyoshi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r64","rowIndex":64,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　女の方が、ショートカットの前髪を直しながらそう言った。","en":"The woman said this while straightening the bangs of her short-cropped hair.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r65","rowIndex":65,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そろそろ来るんじゃないかと思っていたよ」","en":"“I was starting to wonder when you’d come.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r66","rowIndex":66,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私はそう答える。","en":"I answered.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r67","rowIndex":67,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その二人の顔は知っている。二人とも警察官だ。","en":"I recognized them both. They were police officers.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r68","rowIndex":68,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　——そして、<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>捜査本部に所属している。","en":"—And members of the <tips=20>Koschei</tips> task force.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r69","rowIndex":69,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=48>堂島</tips>の旦那が死んだ今、あんたらだけじゃどうしようもないからね」","en":"“With Detective <tips=48>Dojima</tips> dead, the rest of you can accomplish nothing on your own.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r70","rowIndex":70,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は苦笑する。","en":"I gave a wry smile.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r71","rowIndex":71,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私としては単に思った通りに物事が運んだことがおかしかったのだが、女は侮辱されたと感じたらしく、表情を固くしながら、","en":"I was merely amused that events had unfolded precisely as I expected. The woman apparently took my smile as an insult, and her expression stiffened as she said,","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r72","rowIndex":72,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「捜査協力をお願いしに来ました」","en":"“We have come to request your cooperation with the investigation.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"三芳","displayName":"Miyoshi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r73","rowIndex":73,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その傍らで、男は黙って立っている。","en":"The man beside her stood in silence.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r74","rowIndex":74,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　現場で私を事情聴取したのはこの二人。男も若いが、年齢は三十程度ではあるだろう。女はもっと若い。","en":"These were the two who had questioned me at the scene. The man was young, though probably around thirty. The woman was younger still.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r75","rowIndex":75,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しかし、どうやら女の方が警察内での役職は上のようで、捜査本部でも指示を出す側のようだ。","en":"The woman, however, appeared to outrank him and seemed to hold a position of authority within the task force as well.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r76","rowIndex":76,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「詳しい条件は書面にまとめて来ました。あなたの能力の制限については、<tips=48>堂島</tips>刑事と約束をしたように、アンプルを……」","en":"“We have set out the detailed terms in writing. As for the restrictions upon your ability, as agreed with Detective <tips=48>Dojima</tips>, we will provide ampoules...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"三芳","displayName":"Miyoshi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r77","rowIndex":77,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その契約まで知っていたのかと若干意外に思った。<tips=48>堂島</tips>は私には内密の契約だと言っていたが、上にも報告していたということか。","en":"I was mildly surprised that she even knew about that agreement. <tips=48>Dojima</tips> had told me it was confidential; had he reported it to his superiors after all?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r78","rowIndex":78,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いいよ、引き受ける」","en":"“All right. I’ll do it.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r79","rowIndex":79,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……それならサインを」","en":"“...Then please sign.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"三芳","displayName":"Miyoshi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r80","rowIndex":80,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　女は言いながらさっと一枚の紙とペンを取り出す。","en":"The woman swiftly produced a sheet of paper and a pen as she spoke.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r81","rowIndex":81,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「こちらが契約書で、条件について書かれています。今回の契約はあくまでも特例で、その内容についてはけして口外してはいけません。この項に、対象となる事項と、守られなかった場合のペナルティについて……」","en":"“This is the contract. It sets out the terms. The present agreement is an exceptional measure, and you must never disclose its contents. This clause defines the matters covered and the penalties in the event of noncompliance...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"三芳","displayName":"Miyoshi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r82","rowIndex":82,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ここに書けばいいのかい？」","en":"“I sign here?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r83","rowIndex":83,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は指をさしながら説明しようとする女の言葉を遮って、それらしい場所にサインをする。","en":"As the woman pointed across the page and began to explain, I cut her off and signed in the place that looked correct.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r84","rowIndex":84,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「結構です」","en":"“That will do.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"三芳","displayName":"Miyoshi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r85","rowIndex":85,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　女は不興をあらわにして、その紙を仕舞う。","en":"The woman put the document away with her displeasure plain upon her face.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r86","rowIndex":86,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「よし、早速だが中和剤のアンプルを貰おう。能力がなくちゃ何もはじまらない」","en":"“Good. Then let me have an ampoule of neutralizer right away. We can’t even get started without my ability.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r87","rowIndex":87,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「使用する都度渡します。そこは<tips=48>堂島</tips>刑事の時とはやり方を変えて頂きます」","en":"“I’ll give it to you each time you use it. You will have to do things differently than you did with Detective <tips=48>Dojima</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"三芳","displayName":"Miyoshi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r88","rowIndex":88,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「待ってくれよ。一緒に捜査をするつもりかい？」","en":"“Wait a minute. You’re planning to investigate alongside me?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r89","rowIndex":89,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そのつもりですが？」","en":"“That is the plan. Is there a problem?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"三芳","displayName":"Miyoshi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r90","rowIndex":90,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いらないよ。一人で十分だ。中和剤と情報だけくれればいい。きみたちは二人ともノーマルだろう？　はっきり言って足手まといだ」","en":"“I don’t need you. I can manage perfectly well on my own. Give me the neutralizer and the information; nothing else. You are both Normals, aren’t you? To speak plainly, you will only get in my way.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r91","rowIndex":91,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうはいきません。<tips=48>堂島</tips>刑事のような、規約違反は行いませんから」","en":"“That is not possible. We will not violate regulations as Detective <tips=48>Dojima</tips> did.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"三芳","displayName":"Miyoshi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r92","rowIndex":92,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　女は厳しく言い放つ。とりつくしまはないようだった。","en":"The woman delivered the refusal sternly. There appeared to be no opening for negotiation.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r93","rowIndex":93,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　やたらと高圧的な女だ。私はその態度を苦々しく思いながら、","en":"She was absurdly overbearing. Swallowing my resentment at her attitude, I said,","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r94","rowIndex":94,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……それじゃあ、あんたが今から私のパートナーってわけだ」","en":"“...Then I suppose you are my new partner.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r95","rowIndex":95,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「はい。<tips=49>三芳</tips>といいます。こちらは部下の加藤です」","en":"“Yes. My name is <tips=49>Miyoshi</tips>. This is my subordinate, Kato.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"三芳","displayName":"Miyoshi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r96","rowIndex":96,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　女に紹介されて、男は頭を下げる。","en":"At the woman’s introduction, the man bowed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r97","rowIndex":97,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「随分若いね。いくつだい？　何年この仕事をしている？」","en":"“You’re awfully young. How old are you? How long have you been on the job?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r98","rowIndex":98,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「プライベートに関する質問にはお答え出来ません」","en":"“I cannot answer questions about my private life.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"三芳","displayName":"Miyoshi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r99","rowIndex":99,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は肩をすくめ、","en":"I shrugged.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r100","rowIndex":100,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「私はただ、新しい担当者がどういうやつなのか知りたかっただけさ」","en":"“I only wanted to know what sort of person my new handler was.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r101","rowIndex":101,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「私の年齢を知る必要はないでしょう」","en":"“I don’t see why you need to know my age.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"三芳","displayName":"Miyoshi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r102","rowIndex":102,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……そうかい？　我々の相手は、どうにも危険なサイキックだ。何かのはずみで出くわしたら、ギリギリのやりとりをしなくちゃならん。そんなとき、隣にいるやつが、例えば何の役にも立たないど素人だとしたら、命がいくつあっても足りないね。……ま、私も、旦那がやられたときは指をくわえて見ているだけだったが」","en":"“...Is that so? We’re up against an extremely dangerous psychic. If we happen to run into him, we could find ourselves fighting for our lives. And if the person beside me turns out to be, say, a completely useless amateur, nine lives wouldn’t be enough. ...Though when Detective Dojima was killed, all I could do was stand there and watch.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r103","rowIndex":103,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……」","en":"“...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"三芳","displayName":"Miyoshi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r104","rowIndex":104,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=49>三芳</tips>は黙っている。","en":"<tips=49>Miyoshi</tips> remained silent.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r105","rowIndex":105,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あんたは、ここで持っている薬を全部私に渡してさっさと帰った方が身のためだと思うがね」","en":"“You’d be better off handing over every drug you have on you, right here, and hurrying home.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r106","rowIndex":106,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女は黙ったまま不快げに眉間にしわを寄せる。","en":"She said nothing, merely knitting her brow in displeasure.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r107","rowIndex":107,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「その若さでそんな偉そうにしてるってことは、普通のおまわりさんじゃなさそうだな。一年目か二年目の、新米のキャリアさまといったところか？」","en":"“Acting that high-and-mighty at your age, you can’t be an ordinary cop. What are you, some rookie career-track officer in her first or second year?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r108","rowIndex":108,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=49>三芳</tips>は答えない。図星だろう。","en":"<tips=49>Miyoshi</tips> did not answer. I must have hit the mark.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r109","rowIndex":109,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そのお嬢ちゃんが、なんでこんな危険な現場に出て来たんだい。普通は個別の捜査に参加なんかしないはずだぜ。空調の効いた建物でデスクに座っていれば何もしなくたって自動的に出世出来るんだろ？」","en":"“Why is a little girl like you out at dangerous scenes like this? Career-track officers aren’t normally supposed to take part in individual investigations. If you just sit at a desk in an air-conditioned building, you’ll rise through the ranks automatically without lifting a finger, won’t you?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r110","rowIndex":110,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……お答えする必要はありません」","en":"“...There is no need for me to answer.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"三芳","displayName":"Miyoshi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r111","rowIndex":111,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ふん、まあいい。最近の警察はいい加減だから、色々あるんだろう。ただ、私は警告をしたからな。あとでどうなっても苦情は受け付けないぞ」","en":"“Hmph. Fine. The police have been sloppy lately, so I suppose there are all sorts of reasons. But I’ve warned you. Whatever happens later, I won’t hear any complaints.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r112","rowIndex":112,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=49>三芳</tips>は若干戸惑いを浮かべたが、言葉は何も口にしなかった。","en":"<tips=49>Miyoshi</tips> looked slightly taken aback, but said nothing.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r113","rowIndex":113,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうだ、もう一つ確認しておきたいんだが、今回、犯人をその場で殺してもいいんだろう？　<tips=48>堂島</tips>の旦那は状況によっては殺すつもりでいたが、あんたらもそうだよな？」","en":"“Right, there’s one more thing I want to confirm. If the opportunity arises, I’m allowed to kill the culprit on the spot, aren’t I? Detective <tips=48>Dojima</tips> was prepared to kill him if circumstances required it. I assume the two of you are as well.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r114","rowIndex":114,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それは……」","en":"“That...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"三芳","displayName":"Miyoshi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r115","rowIndex":115,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「答えにくいかね。言いたくないことか、言えないことなのか……」","en":"“Hard to answer? Is it something you don’t want to say, or something you can’t...?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r116","rowIndex":116,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「確かに捜査協力を依頼しましたが、あなたには我々と同等の権利があるわけではないのを、お忘れにならないよう」","en":"“...We have indeed requested your assistance, but do not forget that this does not grant you the same rights as the police.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"三芳","displayName":"Miyoshi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r117","rowIndex":117,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「わかってるよ。……じゃあ、さっそく一本中和剤を貰おうか。そしたら、すぐに捜査へ出かけよう。細かい話は歩きながらにする。私は、いても立ってもいられない気持ちを抑えて、ずっと中和剤が来るのを待っていたんだよ」","en":"“I know. ...Now, give me one dose of neutralizer and let’s get moving. You can fill me in on the way. I’ve been holding myself back all this time, desperate to act, waiting for that neutralizer to arrive.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r118","rowIndex":118,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私はそう言って、<tips=49>三芳</tips>に手を差し出した。","en":"With that, I extended a hand toward <tips=49>Miyoshi</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r119","rowIndex":119,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どこへ向かっているのです？」","en":"“Where are we going?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"三芳","displayName":"Miyoshi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r120","rowIndex":120,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　かつかつと靴音を鳴らして歩く私に追いすがるようにしながら<tips=49>三芳</tips>は尋ねる。","en":"<tips=49>Miyoshi</tips> asked as she hurried to keep up with my sharply clacking stride.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r121","rowIndex":121,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=13>ヘドロ団地</tips>だよ」","en":"“The <tips=13>Sludge Housing Complex</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r122","rowIndex":122,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　答える私の身体には力がみなぎっていた。食べていないので栄養不足のはずだが、しかし中和剤を手にしただけで気力が充実してくるのだ。","en":"Strength surged through my body as I answered. I had eaten nothing and ought to have been weak from lack of nourishment, yet merely holding the neutralizer filled me with renewed vitality.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r123","rowIndex":123,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=86>灰上姉妹</tips>の住んでいる？」","en":"“Where the <tips=86>Haigami sisters</tips> live?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"三芳","displayName":"Miyoshi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r124","rowIndex":124,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうだよ。共犯者の住まいだからね。きみらだって、もう調べたろう？」","en":"“That’s right. It’s where the accomplices live. You people have already searched it, haven’t you?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r125","rowIndex":125,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「我々は<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>そのものの捜索を中心に行っています。あの団地も捜査対象として予定されていますが、まだ準備を行っている段階で……」","en":"“Our search is focused primarily on <tips=20>Koschei</tips> himself. The complex is on our list, but we are still making preparations...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"三芳","displayName":"Miyoshi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r126","rowIndex":126,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なんだ、まだ行ってないのか」","en":"“What? You haven’t been there yet?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r127","rowIndex":127,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=49>三芳</tips>は黙ってしまった。","en":"<tips=49>Miyoshi</tips> fell silent.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r128","rowIndex":128,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　まあ、そうかもしれないな。","en":"Well, perhaps so.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r129","rowIndex":129,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=13>ヘドロ団地</tips>は<tips=9>Y地区</tips>ではいくつか存在する危険な地域の一つであると言われているが、ことに警察にとっては、間違いなく最も危険な場所である。ここに調査のために足を踏み入れた警察官が何人も行方不明になっているといういわくつきの場所だ。死体さえ見つからない。","en":"The <tips=13>Sludge Housing Complex</tips> was said to be one of several dangerous areas in <tips=9>Y District</tips>. To the police in particular, however, it was undoubtedly the most dangerous. The place had a history: several officers who entered to investigate had disappeared. Not even their bodies were ever found.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r130","rowIndex":130,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして行方不明にならずとも、住民は著しく非協力的でまったくなんの収穫も得られないのがほとんどだ。","en":"Even when officers returned safely, the residents were so thoroughly uncooperative that investigations almost invariably yielded nothing.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r131","rowIndex":131,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　だから、一般の警察はあまり捜査をしようとしないのだと堂島は言っていた。もちろん<tips=48>堂島</tips>は、必要とあれば足を踏み入れ、収穫を得ていたが。","en":"Dojima had told me that ordinary police therefore avoided investigating the complex whenever possible. <tips=48>Dojima</tips> himself, of course, went in whenever necessary and came back with results.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r132","rowIndex":132,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……リーダーの<tips=14>深沢</tips>に交渉しようとしているのですが、接触がとれていません。かといって、強行捜査となると反発が予想されるので、大がかりな装備などが必要になって来ますし……。しかし、そのかわり、<tips=9>Y地区</tips>から外へ出るすべての道路には人員とカメラを配置して、外部への逃亡を監視しています」","en":"“...We have attempted to negotiate with the leader, <tips=14>Fukazawa</tips>, but have been unable to establish contact. A forced search would provoke resistance and require extensive equipment and preparation. ...In the meantime, we have stationed personnel and cameras on every road leading out of <tips=9>Y District</tips> to watch for anyone attempting to flee.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"三芳","displayName":"Miyoshi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r133","rowIndex":133,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それは賢明だ。きみらのような連中が手を出しても得られるものは何もない。きみらの上司はよく分かっている。きみらの最も重要な仕事は、犯人を捕まえることではなく<tips=9>Y地区</tips>の外に犯罪を持ち出させないことだ。そこに最大の人数を割くという判断はまったく正しいよ」","en":"“That’s wise. People like you would accomplish nothing by meddling there. Your superiors understand the situation perfectly. Your most important job isn’t to catch the culprit, but to keep the crime from spreading beyond <tips=9>Y District</tips>. Committing most of your people to that is absolutely the right decision.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r134","rowIndex":134,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は皮肉交じりにそう言った。","en":"I said it with more than a hint of sarcasm.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r135","rowIndex":135,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……情けないことです。このような、我々の影響力が及ばない場所が存在し、しかも放置されているだなんて」","en":"“It is disgraceful. A place beyond our influence exists in this country, and we simply leave it untouched.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"三芳","displayName":"Miyoshi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r136","rowIndex":136,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=49>三芳</tips>は憤りを露わにして俯く。","en":"<tips=49>Miyoshi</tips> lowered her head, her indignation plainly visible.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r137","rowIndex":137,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「仕方がないね。今のあんたらにはそこまで力はない。それに、あんたらの上司にはあいつらを潰したくない理由もあるだろうしな」","en":"“Can’t be helped. You people don’t have that kind of power anymore. Besides, I’m sure your superiors have their own reasons for not wanting the place wiped out.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r138","rowIndex":138,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=13>ヘドロ団地</tips>の連中はあちこちに賄賂をばらまいている。今や昔ほど健全な組織ではなくなった警察にも鼻薬が効いている。そうでなければ、復讐心の強い警察が、いくら危険だとは言えこうも放置し続けるはずがない。","en":"The people of <tips=13>Sludge Housing Complex</tips> scattered bribes everywhere. Even the police—no longer the clean institution they once were—had been bought off. Otherwise, vengeful officers would never have left them alone for so long, however dangerous they might be.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r139","rowIndex":139,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その言葉には、<tips=49>三芳</tips>はなにも答えない。彼女も知ってはいるのだろう。","en":"<tips=49>Miyoshi</tips> said nothing in reply. I took her silence to mean that she knew it herself.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r140","rowIndex":140,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ま、あんた個人がいくら嘆いたって仕方ないさ。<tips=13>ヘドロ団地</tips>と<tips=15>ボーダーエリア</tips>は、警察どころか街のギャングたちだって簡単には手を出せない特別な地域だ」","en":"“Well, there’s no point in you personally lamenting it. The <tips=13>Sludge Housing Complex</tips> and the <tips=15>Border Area</tips> are special districts that neither the police nor even the city’s gangs can move against lightly.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r141","rowIndex":141,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……<tips=50>路地</tips>さんは、団地の人々とも交流があるのですか？」","en":"“...Do you have connections among the people of the complex, <tips=50>Mr. Roji</tips>?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"三芳","displayName":"Miyoshi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r142","rowIndex":142,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「交流ってほどじゃないが、昔に多少世話をしたりされたりはしている」","en":"“I wouldn’t call it a relationship, but we did help each other out a little, a long time ago.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r143","rowIndex":143,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「探偵をなさっていた頃の話ですね」","en":"“You’re talking about when you were a private detective.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"三芳","displayName":"Miyoshi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r144","rowIndex":144,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=49>三芳</tips>はそこまで知っているのか。","en":"So <tips=49>Miyoshi</tips> knew even that.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r145","rowIndex":145,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それなら、まずリーダーの<tips=14>深沢</tips>に連絡をして、捜査をするむねを伝えて交渉してみるのはどうでしょう？　<tips=50>路地</tips>さんが前もって根回しをして、安全を確保しておけば……」","en":"“In that case, why don’t we first contact their leader, <tips=14>Fukazawa</tips>, tell him we intend to conduct an investigation, and try to negotiate? If you laid the groundwork in advance, Mr. <tips=50>Roji</tips>, and made sure we’d be safe...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"三芳","displayName":"Miyoshi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r146","rowIndex":146,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いや、あの親父を相手にそんなことしたって意味ないさ。どうぞどうぞと許可をしておいて、入っていったら待ち伏せされて行方不明にされちまうかもしれん。ましてや、今回はあいつが可愛がっている<tips=86>双子</tips>の調査だからな。きみらが<tips=14>深沢</tips>と接触しなかったのは、かえってラッキーだよ」","en":"“No. There is no point trying that with the old man. He might grant permission with a smile, only to have us ambushed and made to disappear once we entered. All the more so when we mean to investigate the <tips=86>twins</tips> he dotes upon. You were lucky not to make contact with <tips=14>Fukazawa</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r147","rowIndex":147,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それじゃあ、たとえあなたでも、足を踏み入れること自体が危険なのでは？」","en":"“Then would it not be dangerous even for you to set foot there?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"三芳","displayName":"Miyoshi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r148","rowIndex":148,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なに、<tips=14>深沢</tips>本人やその子分に鉢合わせしなきゃ平気さ。一応やつを盟主にしているが、別に団地全体が一致団結した一つの組織ってわけじゃない。いろんなやつがいる。<tips=14>深沢</tips>をきらってるやつもね。……少人数でさっと入って、さっと調べればいいのさ。私なら、どんな場所でも極めてスマートに出入り出来る」","en":"“No problem, as long as we don’t run into <tips=14>Fukazawa</tips> himself or any of his men. They may recognize him as their leader, but the whole complex isn’t one united organization. All kinds of people live there—including some who hate <tips=14>Fukazawa</tips>. ...A small group can slip in, take a quick look around, and slip right back out. I know how to get in and out of anywhere cleanly.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r149","rowIndex":149,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうですか……」","en":"“I see...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"三芳","displayName":"Miyoshi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r150","rowIndex":150,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そう。だから、本当なら一人の方が楽なんだ。きみらがいるとどうしても目立つ。……まだ遅くないぞ。薬を置いて帰ってくれないか？」","en":"“Exactly. That’s why I’d honestly have an easier time alone. The two of you are bound to draw attention. ...It’s not too late. Why don’t you leave the medicine with me and go home?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r151","rowIndex":151,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それは出来ません。あなたの監視も私の業務ですから」","en":"“I cannot. Monitoring you is part of my job too.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"三芳","displayName":"Miyoshi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r152","rowIndex":152,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「頭の固いやつだ」","en":"“You’re a stubborn one.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r153","rowIndex":153,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は苦笑する。","en":"I gave a wry smile.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r154","rowIndex":154,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それなら、最低限の仕事はしてもらわないとな。きみらは、ちゃんと<tips=16>タイプＡ</tips>の対策をしているかい？　ほら、旦那が持っていたあのサイキック殺しの銃だとか」","en":"“Then I’ll have to make sure you do the bare minimum. Are you properly equipped to deal with <tips=16>Type As</tips>? You know—that psychic-killing gun Detective Dojima carried, for instance.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r155","rowIndex":155,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「UT弾ですか？　捜査員はみな携行しています」","en":"“You mean UT rounds? Every investigator carries them.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"三芳","displayName":"Miyoshi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r156","rowIndex":156,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「何発？　……一発か？」","en":"“How many? ...One?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r157","rowIndex":157,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「え、ええ」","en":"“Y-yes.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"三芳","displayName":"Miyoshi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r158","rowIndex":158,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=49>三芳</tips>は頷く。","en":"<tips=49>Miyoshi</tips> nodded.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r159","rowIndex":159,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……まったく、なんてけちけちしているんだろう！　お嬢さん、知ってるかい？　どこの国でも、<tips=16>タイプA</tips>能力を抑制する装置や薬剤の取り扱いがきわめて慎重なのは、政府に<tips=16>タイプA</tips>のお偉いさんがいるからなんだってさ。薬が一般に流出しそのへんにあふれるようになって、<tips=16>タイプA</tips>が無力化されたら、<tips=17>タイプB</tips>みたいに被差別的な立場に落ちる可能性があるからね。それに怯えているんだと」","en":"“...Honestly, how stingy can they be? Young lady, do you know why every country is so extraordinarily careful with devices and drugs that suppress <tips=16>Type A</tips> abilities? Because every government has <tips=16>Type A</tips> big shots in it. They’re afraid that if those drugs ever reach the public and become commonplace, powerless <tips=16>Type As</tips> might end up suffering the same discrimination as <tips=17>Type Bs</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r160","rowIndex":160,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それはただの噂です」","en":"“That is nothing more than a rumor.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"三芳","displayName":"Miyoshi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r161","rowIndex":161,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうかね？　でも、治安を考えるなら、街中に薬を噴霧して、全部のサイキックの力を消してしまえばいいと思うよ。どんな能力のやつが、何をしでかすかなんてわからないんだからさ。サイキックの私が言うんだから間違いない。サイキックは現代社会の害悪だ」","en":"“Is that so? But if public safety is what matters, I say spray the drug all over the city and wipe out every psychic’s powers. You never know what someone with some strange ability might do. Take it from me—I’m a psychic myself. Psychics are a blight on modern society.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r162","rowIndex":162,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……おっしゃる通り、<tips=16>タイプA</tips>は社会の秩序を乱す存在ですが、だからといってみだりに能力が制限されていいわけではありません。権利がありますから」","en":"“...As you say, <tips=16>Type As</tips> can disturb the social order. That does not mean their abilities may be restricted without cause. They have rights.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"三芳","displayName":"Miyoshi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r163","rowIndex":163,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「お堅いねえ」","en":"“Always so proper.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r164","rowIndex":164,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は肩をすくめ、","en":"I shrugged and said,","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r165","rowIndex":165,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ま、道具があるならいつでも取り出せるよう準備しておくんだ。この状況で<tips=86>灰上たち</tips>がのんきに自宅周辺をうろうろしているとも思えないが、可能性がゼロとは言えない。見かけたら即座に撃て。相手が子供だからって躊躇するな。交渉なんてはじめから選択肢に入れるな。死にたくなければね」","en":"“Well, if you’ve got the weapons, keep them ready to draw. I doubt the <tips=86>Haigamis</tips> are casually wandering around near home under the circumstances, but we can’t rule it out. If you see them, shoot immediately. Don’t hesitate just because they’re children. Don’t even consider negotiation. Not if you want to live.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r166","rowIndex":166,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私が言うと、<tips=49>三芳</tips>はその場に足を止める。顔が蒼白になっている。","en":"At my words, <tips=49>Miyoshi</tips> stopped walking. Her face had gone pale.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r167","rowIndex":167,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「大丈夫かい？」","en":"“Are you all right?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r168","rowIndex":168,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　振り返って私はそう訊ねる。","en":"I turned back to ask her.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r169","rowIndex":169,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なんでもありません」","en":"“It’s nothing.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"三芳","displayName":"Miyoshi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r170","rowIndex":170,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そんなんじゃ困るぜ。新米だって現場に来る以上は銃の撃ち方くらい習ってるんだろう？　それも出来ないなら、本当に何も役に立たない。やっぱり帰った方がいいんじゃないか？」","en":"“That won’t do. Even a rookie sent into the field has learned how to fire a gun, right? If you can’t even manage that, you really are no use at all. Maybe you’d be better off going home after all.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r171","rowIndex":171,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=49>三芳</tips>はキッと強気の表情を見せて、","en":"<tips=49>Miyoshi’s</tips> expression sharpened with defiance.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r172","rowIndex":172,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それはあまりにも失礼です」","en":"“That is terribly rude.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"三芳","displayName":"Miyoshi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r173","rowIndex":173,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「とんでもない。これは優しさだよ」","en":"“Not at all. I’m being kind.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r174","rowIndex":174,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「契約を結んだ以上、我々はビジネスパートナーなんですよ？　信頼してもらわなければ困ります」","en":"“Now that we have a contract, we’re business partners. You’ll have to place some trust in us.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"三芳","displayName":"Miyoshi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r175","rowIndex":175,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ビジネスパートナー？　ただの鍵開け道具だろ？」","en":"“Business partner? I’m just a lockpick, aren’t I?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r176","rowIndex":176,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「違います。そうだ、<tips=50>路地</tips>さん、<tips=13>ヘドロ団地</tips>へ向かう前に、我々はある程度情報を共有すべきですよね。私の個人情報以外の」","en":"“No, you aren’t. Oh, that reminds me, Mr. <tips=50>Roji</tips>: before we head to the <tips=13>Sludge Housing Complex</tips>, we ought to share some information, shouldn’t we? Other than my personal information.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"三芳","displayName":"Miyoshi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r177","rowIndex":177,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして、端末を取り出すと、","en":"She pulled out a terminal.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r178","rowIndex":178,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=86>灰上姉妹</tips>の情報は知っていますか？」","en":"“Are you familiar with the information on the <tips=86>Haigami sisters</tips>?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"三芳","displayName":"Miyoshi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r179","rowIndex":179,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「大体ね。もともと有名人だが、ここ数日間、私の方でも調べた。が、警察の持っている情報も知りたい」","en":"“I know the broad strokes. They were already famous, and I’ve done some digging of my own over the past few days. But I’d like to know what the police have on them.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r180","rowIndex":180,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして、<tips=49>三芳</tips>が取り出す端末を受け取る。","en":"I accepted the terminal <tips=49>Miyoshi</tips> held out.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r181","rowIndex":181,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そこには<tips=86>灰上姉妹</tips>の調査報告書が表示されており、生育環境から、現在の状況や、それぞれの<tips=16>タイプA</tips>・<tips=17>タイプB</tips>能力までが文字によって詳しく記されているようだ。","en":"It displayed an investigative report on the <tips=86>Haigami sisters</tips>. The dense text appeared to cover everything from their upbringing and present circumstances to the details of their respective <tips=16>Type A</tips> and <tips=17>Type B</tips> abilities.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r182","rowIndex":182,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　歩いたままでは揺れて読みにくいので、私は足を止めてその細々とした資料にざっと目を通した。","en":"The movement made the fine text difficult to read as we walked, so I stopped and skimmed the report.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r183","rowIndex":183,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　姉の名は<tips=11>璃映子</tips>。妹の名は<tips=12>江梨子</tips>。一卵性双生児として、靴屋を営んでいた灰上康彦の家庭に生まれる。兄弟は十才離れた兄が一人。","en":"The elder sister was named <tips=11>Rieko</tips>; the younger, <tips=12>Eriko</tips>. Identical twins, they were born into the family of Yasuhiko Haigami, a shoemaker. They had one brother, ten years their senior.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r184","rowIndex":184,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　幼いうちに父母を亡くし、<tips=14>深沢聡</tips>に拾われる。<tips=14>深沢</tips>は<tips=13>ヘドロ団地</tips>のとりまとめ役的な人物で、灰上父と親交があった模様。","en":"Their parents died while they were young, and <tips=14>Satoshi Fukazawa</tips> took them in. <tips=14>Fukazawa</tips> appeared to have been close to their father and served as something of a coordinator for the <tips=13>Sludge Housing Complex</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r185","rowIndex":185,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それ以降、二人は<tips=13>ヘドロ団地</tips>で暮らす。公務員として上京していた兄も職務中の事故によって亡くなってしまったため、彼の遺族年金が現在も支給されている。このため肉親はなく、<tips=14>深沢</tips>の庇護下で生活中。","en":"The two have lived at <tips=13>the complex</tips> ever since. Their brother, a civil servant who had moved to Tokyo, also died in an accident in the line of duty, so they continue to receive his survivor's pension. They therefore have no living blood relatives and currently live under <tips=14>Fukazawa's</tips> protection.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r186","rowIndex":186,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　現在は地域外の学校へ通っている。成績は上。取り立てて問題行動は見られない。街での評判とは裏腹に優等生という評価。しかし、ここ一ヶ月ほどは出席しておらず、連絡もつかない。","en":"They currently attended a school outside the district. Their grades were above average, and they had displayed no behavior of particular concern. Contrary to their reputation in the city, the school regarded them as exemplary students. For approximately a month, however, neither had attended, and neither could be reached.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r187","rowIndex":187,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　姉の<tips=11>璃映子</tips>は<tips=16>タイプA</tips>。能力は、離れたものを触れずに動かすというもの。いわゆる、サイキッカー。大きな力で動かすことは出来ないが、距離に関してはかなり遠くまで影響を及ぼせるようで、<tips=13>ヘドロ団地</tips>七階の自室の窓辺から、路上で遊ぶ子供の玩具を動かし、からかったりしている様子が目撃されている。","en":"The elder sister, <tips=11>Rieko</tips>, was <tips=16>Type A</tips>. Her ability moved distant objects without physical contact—the power commonly called telekinesis. Though unable to exert great force, she appeared to possess considerable range. Witnesses had seen her use it from the window of their seventh-floor apartment in the <tips=13>Sludge Housing Complex</tips> to move toys that children were playing with in the street and tease them.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r188","rowIndex":188,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　肉体に<tips=77>特質変異</tips>は見られないため、妹<tips=12>江梨子</tips>との識別が困難。","en":"No <tips=77>trait mutation</tips> was visible upon her body, making her difficult to distinguish from her younger sister, <tips=12>Eriko</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r189","rowIndex":189,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　妹<tips=12>江梨子</tips>は<tips=17>タイプB</tips>。<tips=72>傾向値</tips>は不明。幻覚、妄想などの症状は現在見られていない。<tips=95>金眼</tips>時の身体能力の向上が著しく、片手で成人男性を投げ飛ばしたり、素手で金属錠を引きちぎって破壊したなどの報告がある。","en":"The younger sister, <tips=12>Eriko</tips>, was <tips=17>Type B</tips>. Her <tips=72>tendency value</tips> was unknown. No symptoms such as hallucinations or delusions were currently evident. Her physical abilities increased dramatically when <tips=95>her eyes turned gold</tips>. Reports stated that she had thrown an adult man with one hand and ripped a metal lock apart with her bare hands.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r190","rowIndex":190,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　二人とも論理的な思考能力を持ってはいるが、精神面では同年代の少女と比較しても不安定であり、特殊な生育環境のせいか価値観の逸脱が見られる。","en":"Both possessed the capacity for logical thought, but the report described them as emotionally unstable even by comparison with girls their own age, and suggested that their unusual upbringing had distorted their values.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r191","rowIndex":191,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　交流関係は、かつては街の不良少年グループに属し、彼らと親しくしていたようだが、高校に進学してからは彼らとのつき合いは薄れている。このグループには<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>のボスの息子<tips=1>謝亮</tips>もいたが、彼は街を出て大学へ進学したため、やはり疎遠となった。","en":"As for their social circle, they had once belonged to a group of juvenile delinquents in the city and appeared close to its members, but contact dwindled after they entered high school. The group also included the <tips=7>YS</tips> boss’s son, <tips=1>Tse Leung</tips>, but he too grew distant after leaving the city for university.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r192","rowIndex":192,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　現在、<tips=48>堂島</tips>刑事殺害の共犯者として逮捕状が発行されている。","en":"Arrest warrants had now been issued for both as accomplices in the murder of Detective <tips=48>Dojima</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r193","rowIndex":193,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なるほど」","en":"“I see.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r194","rowIndex":194,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は端末を<tips=49>三芳</tips>に返した。","en":"I returned the terminal to <tips=49>Miyoshi</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r195","rowIndex":195,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=86>灰上姉妹</tips>は<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>に騙されているんでしょうかね」","en":"“Do you think the <tips=86>Haigami sisters</tips> have been deceived by <tips=20>Koschei</tips>?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"三芳","displayName":"Miyoshi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r196","rowIndex":196,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「可能性はある。相手は百戦錬磨だからな。しかし、だとしても、もう自分の行動に責任をもつべき年齢だ。同情はしないさ。……まあ、この情報は役に立ちそうだ」","en":"“It’s possible. He’s an old hand at this. But even if that’s true, they’re old enough to take responsibility for their own actions. I won’t pity them. ...Still, this information looks useful.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r197","rowIndex":197,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「でしょう？　何もしていなかったわけではないんです。私たちだって、行けるところにはあちこち足を運んで、調べてはいるんです」","en":"“See? It’s not as though we’ve been doing nothing. We’ve gone everywhere we could and investigated whatever we could.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"三芳","displayName":"Miyoshi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r198","rowIndex":198,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それより、<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>の方はどうだ？　<tips=48>堂島</tips>の旦那は能力もわからないと言っていたが、今回の件で多少は情報が拾えたろう。現場をそのままにして逃げたんだからな」","en":"“More importantly, what have you learned about <tips=20>Koschei</tips>? Detective <tips=48>Dojima</tips> told me even his ability was unknown, but you must have picked up at least some information from this incident. He fled without cleaning up the scene, after all.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r199","rowIndex":199,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……トップシークレットだということを、理解して聞いて貰えますか？」","en":"“...Before I tell you, do you understand that this is top secret?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"三芳","displayName":"Miyoshi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r200","rowIndex":200,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「もちろんだ。……探偵はね、依頼者の秘密は絶対に守るもんだ」","en":"“Naturally. ...A detective never betrays a client’s secrets.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r201","rowIndex":201,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　言ってから、私は苦笑した。","en":"After saying it, I gave a wry smile.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r202","rowIndex":202,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　もう廃業してから何年も経つのに、今更探偵と名乗るのもおかしなものだ。","en":"It had been years since I closed my practice. Calling myself a detective now was rather absurd.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r203","rowIndex":203,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=49>三芳</tips>はそんな私の内心とは無関係に、一人逡巡して、そして加藤の方を見る。加藤は、自分の判断することではないという風に肩をすくめる。","en":"Oblivious to my private thoughts, <tips=49>Miyoshi</tips> hesitated to herself, then looked over at Kato. He shrugged as if to say it was not his decision to make.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r204","rowIndex":204,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=49>三芳</tips>は諦めて私に向き直った。","en":"<tips=49>Miyoshi</tips> gave in and faced me again.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r205","rowIndex":205,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=48>堂島</tips>刑事の右目が義眼だったのはご存じですか？」","en":"“Did you know that Detective <tips=48>Dojima’s</tips> right eye was a prosthetic?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"三芳","displayName":"Miyoshi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r206","rowIndex":206,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いいや、初耳だね」","en":"“No, that’s news to me.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r207","rowIndex":207,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……その義眼には、カメラが仕込まれていて、彼が捜査を行っている間、その映像や音声は本署のサーバーに記録されています」","en":"“...There was a camera embedded in the eye. While he was conducting an investigation, its video and audio were recorded on a server at headquarters.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"三芳","displayName":"Miyoshi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r208","rowIndex":208,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ふうん」","en":"“Hmm.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r209","rowIndex":209,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「驚かれないようですね」","en":"“You don’t seem surprised.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"三芳","displayName":"Miyoshi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r210","rowIndex":210,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「二人だけで話したことをあんたが知ってたからね。それに、旦那はやたら一人で行動をしていたし、前からそういった何かがあるだろうとは想像していたよ。そもそもね、旦那レベルのサイキックはたとえ警察官だとしても、いや警察官だからこそ、国家の監視対象になるもんだろう？」","en":"“Because you knew something the two of us had discussed in private. Besides, he was always working alone, so I’d already guessed there must be something of the sort. A psychic on Detective Dojima’s level would be under state surveillance even if he were a police officer—no, precisely because he was one. Isn’t that right?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r211","rowIndex":211,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……私は知りません」","en":"“...I don’t know.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"三芳","displayName":"Miyoshi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r212","rowIndex":212,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうかい。……しかし、旦那もえらい鎖をつけられていたもんだ。まったく、名実ともに国家の犬だったわけだね」","en":"“Is that so? ...They kept him on one hell of a leash. He really was a dog of the state in every sense of the word.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r213","rowIndex":213,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それで、その義眼によって、あなたのアパートに足を踏み入れてから、最後の瞬間まで、すべての映像が記録されていたんです」","en":"“In any event, that prosthetic eye recorded everything from the moment he entered your apartment to the moment he died.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"三芳","displayName":"Miyoshi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r214","rowIndex":214,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……そう言えば、撃ったあとの旦那の様子がおかしかったな。何か、自信なさげだった。……それに、今までの犯行現場と状態が違うと気にしていた」","en":"“...Now that you mention it, Detective Dojima acted strangely after he fired. He seemed uncertain. ...He was also concerned that the state of the scene differed from the earlier crimes.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r215","rowIndex":215,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうでしょうね」","en":"“I would imagine so.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"三芳","displayName":"Miyoshi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r216","rowIndex":216,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……何が映っていたんだ？」","en":"“...What did the recording show?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r217","rowIndex":217,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「時系列からすると、まず<tips=48>堂島</tips>刑事は一人で奥の部屋に足を踏み入れた。すると引き出しなどを物色するものがいて、彼はその人物に対して発砲します。そして相手が倒れたあと、<tips=48>堂島</tips>刑事はリビングに戻ってあなたと会話をし、その最中に背中から刺されるわけですよね？」","en":"“To put it in chronological order: Detective <tips=48>Dojima</tips> first entered the back room alone. Someone was rifling through the drawers, and he fired at that person. After they fell, Detective <tips=48>Dojima</tips> returned to the living room and spoke with you. He was stabbed from behind during that conversation. Correct?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"三芳","displayName":"Miyoshi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r218","rowIndex":218,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうだったはずだが」","en":"“That is how I remember it.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r219","rowIndex":219,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「その時、<tips=48>堂島</tips>刑事を刺し、あなたと会話をしたのは白人青年でしたよね？　しかし、<tips=48>堂島</tips>刑事が最初に部屋に踏み込んだ時に発砲したのは若い金髪の女でした」","en":"“The person who stabbed Detective <tips=48>Dojima</tips> and spoke with you was a young white man, correct? But when Detective <tips=48>Dojima</tips> first entered the room, the person he fired at was a young blonde woman.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"三芳","displayName":"Miyoshi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r220","rowIndex":220,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ふむ……。その映像は見られないのか？」","en":"“Hmm... Can I see the recording?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r221","rowIndex":221,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「この端末からはアクセス出来ません。後でなら……ちなみに、服装は、まったく同じです」","en":"“I can’t access it from this terminal. Perhaps later. ...Incidentally, the two were dressed exactly alike.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"三芳","displayName":"Miyoshi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r222","rowIndex":222,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それなら、ヤツの能力はその短い時間に入れ替わりを可能にするものなのか。それとも……」","en":"“Then his ability allows him to exchange places with another person in that brief interval... or else...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r223","rowIndex":223,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「『変身』をしたか。……こちらの方が自然ですね」","en":"“He ‘transformed.’ That would be the more natural explanation.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"三芳","displayName":"Miyoshi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r224","rowIndex":224,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「断定は出来ないが、可能性は高い」","en":"“We can’t be certain, but it seems likely.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r225","rowIndex":225,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=48>堂島</tips>の旦那は、私が寝た女のタオルの臭いがころころ変化したと言っていた。そのことと、符合するように思える。","en":"Detective <tips=48>Dojima</tips> had told me that the scent upon the towel used by the woman I slept with changed repeatedly. This explanation seemed to accord with that observation.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r226","rowIndex":226,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　つまり、<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>が『変身』するたびに、残り香も変化するんだ。","en":"In other words, each time <tips=20>Koschei</tips> “transforms,” the lingering scent changes as well.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r227","rowIndex":227,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「くそったれめ！」","en":"“Goddamn bastard!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r228","rowIndex":228,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ど、どうしました？」","en":"“Wh-what is it?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"三芳","displayName":"Miyoshi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r229","rowIndex":229,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　もし、想像通り変身がやつの能力だとすれば、あの女がその変身した姿だとすれば、私は、<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>本人と寝たということになる。事件が起こる前とは言え、<tips=48>堂島</tips>と<tips=53>ミユキ</tips>を殺したその張本人と。","en":"If, as I imagined, transformation was his ability—if that woman was one of his assumed forms—then I had slept with <tips=20>Koschei</tips> himself. That had been before the incident, yes—but he was the very man who had killed <tips=48>Dojima</tips> and <tips=53>Miyuki</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r230","rowIndex":230,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いや、なんでもない。なんでもないんだ。……しかし、変身能力を持ったサイキックか……。不死身がどうのと言っていたのも気にかかるな。……ただ言えることは、相手がそういった能力を持っているなら、きみらがいくら道路を監視したところで、相手をこの街に閉じ込めておくのは不可能だということだ」","en":"“No, it is nothing. Nothing at all. ...A psychic with the power of transformation... His talk of immortality concerns me as well. ...One thing is clear: if he possesses such an ability, no amount of watching the roads will keep him trapped within this city.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r231","rowIndex":231,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それは……」","en":"“That...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"三芳","displayName":"Miyoshi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r232","rowIndex":232,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それだけじゃないぞ。我々の全く知らない姿で現れて、一方的に攻撃してくることもあり得る。そうしたら我々は全滅だ。対抗手段は存在しない。おい、生命保険には入っているか？　家族のために今からでも入った方が良いぞ」","en":"“And that’s not all. He could appear in a form we’ve never seen and attack before we can react. We’d be wiped out. There’d be no way to fight back. Hey, do you have life insurance? If not, you’d better get some now, for your family’s sake.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r233","rowIndex":233,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私がそう言うと、<tips=49>三芳</tips>は顔を顰める。","en":"<tips=49>Miyoshi</tips> frowned at my words.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r234","rowIndex":234,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まあ、あれだけの大けがをしたんだ。まだ動いてはいないだろう。それに、<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>は姿を変えられるとしても、<tips=86>双子</tips>の方は不可能だからな。少なくともあいつらはまだこの街にいる。それが確実ならどうにでもなるさ」","en":"“Still, he was badly wounded. He probably hasn’t moved yet. And even if <tips=20>Koschei</tips> can change his appearance, the <tips=86>twins</tips> can’t. At least we know they’re still in the city. As long as that much is certain, we can work with it.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r235","rowIndex":235,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=13>ヘドロ団地</tips>は<tips=9>Y地区</tips>の外縁にある。","en":"The <tips=13>Sludge Housing Complex</tips> stood upon the outer edge of <tips=9>Y District</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r236","rowIndex":236,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=9>Y地区</tips>にまだ基地があった頃は、ごく普通の市民が暮らす住宅として利用されていたが、基地がなくなり今の<tips=9>Y地区</tips>が形作られると、地域の治安の悪化によって、まともな住民は去った。そして代わりに、<tips=9>Y地区</tips>の中心部にも住むことが出来ないようなたちの悪い連中が集まり、もう十年以上不法占拠している。","en":"When a base still existed in <tips=9>Y District</tips>, the buildings served as housing for ordinary citizens. Once the base was gone and <tips=9>Y District</tips> as it is now began to take shape, worsening public safety drove the respectable residents away. In their place came a vicious crowd unable to live even in central <tips=9>Y District</tips>, and they have occupied the buildings illegally for more than a decade.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r237","rowIndex":237,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　建物はひどく老朽化しており、落書きだらけの壁にはひび割れや崩れが見られ、多くの部屋はドアも窓ガラスもすでに失われていた。","en":"The buildings were badly decayed. Cracks and collapsed sections marred walls covered in graffiti, and many of the rooms had already lost both their doors and their windowpanes.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r238","rowIndex":238,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　半分廃墟のようであるが、多くの人間が住み着き、部屋のみならず廊下にも布や紙を敷いて寝転んでいる。建物の周辺も、ゴミが放置され、おかしな髪型と服装をして目を金色に光らせた<tips=17>タイプB</tips>やら、人間とも思えない<tips=77>特質変異</tips>を持った<tips=16>タイプA</tips>やら、一目でまっとうでないとわかる人間がひっきりなしに行き来している。","en":"Though the complex looked half-ruined, large numbers of people had settled there. They lay sprawled on cloth and paper not only in the rooms, but throughout the corridors. Garbage had been left strewn around the buildings, while <tips=17>Type Bs</tips> with bizarre hair and clothing and eyes shining gold, <tips=16>Type As</tips> with <tips=77>trait mutations</tips> that scarcely looked human, and all manner of people who were plainly disreputable at a glance came and went without end.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r239","rowIndex":239,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　まともな人間ならば、遠くからその姿を見ただけでも、恐れをなして離れたくなるような場所であるが、今の<tips=9>Y地区</tips>の危険地域の多くが一見それほど危険とは気がつかない装いをしているのと比べると、見てそうとわかるだけまだマシなのだろう。","en":"Any respectable person would have wanted to turn and flee at the mere sight of it, even from a distance. But compared with the many dangerous parts of present-day <tips=9>Y District</tips> that did not look dangerous at first glance, perhaps this was still better: at least you could tell what it was on sight.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r240","rowIndex":240,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=49>三芳</tips>はその外観が見えたところで足を止め、顔を蒼白にしている。","en":"The moment the complex came into view, <tips=49>Miyoshi</tips> stopped. Her face had gone pale.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r241","rowIndex":241,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　街にまだ慣れぬ彼女も、さすがにこの場所の悪評は散々耳にしているのだろう。","en":"Even she, still new to the city, must have heard the place’s terrible reputation time and again.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r242","rowIndex":242,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女の年齢はどう見ても二十代そこそこといったところで、その年齢で捜査班長を務めているのだから、いわゆるキャリアで、しかも学校を出たての新米に違いない。どうしてそうした身分で現場に出て来ているのかはしらないが、運のないことだ。今回の事件は新米警官でなくとも、ノーマルには少々荷が重い仕事だ。かなりの確率で、命を落とすことになるだろう。","en":"By every appearance, she was only in her early twenties. To serve as an investigative team leader at that age, she had to be a career-track rookie fresh out of school. I did not know why someone of her standing had come into the field, but she was unfortunate. This case would be a heavy burden for any Normal, not merely an inexperienced officer. In all probability, it would kill her.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r243","rowIndex":243,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　もっとも、それは私も同様だが。","en":"The same was true of me, of course.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r244","rowIndex":244,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「行こうか」","en":"“Shall we?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r245","rowIndex":245,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「もう暗いですよ？」","en":"“It’s already dark, you know?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"三芳","displayName":"Miyoshi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r246","rowIndex":246,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「かまやしないさ」","en":"“Doesn’t matter.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r247","rowIndex":247,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私が歩き出そうとしたところで彼女が引き留める。","en":"Just as I started to walk on, she stopped me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r248","rowIndex":248,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ちょっと待ってください」","en":"“Wait a moment.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"三芳","displayName":"Miyoshi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r249","rowIndex":249,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=49>三芳</tips>は言うと、カバンから筆箱ほどの大きさの機械を取り出し、そのスイッチを入れる。それは携帯型の<tips=42>UB波感知器</tips>だった。","en":"With that, <tips=49>Miyoshi</tips> took a device about the size of a pencil case from her bag and switched it on. It was a portable <tips=42>UB-wave detector</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r250","rowIndex":250,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　サイキック能力を感知するという触れ込みの機械だが、実際にはそれほど役に立つものではない。","en":"The machine was advertised as capable of detecting psychic abilities, but in practice it was not especially useful.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r251","rowIndex":251,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　例えば、ミダース・タイプのサイキックは全く感知出来ない。","en":"It could not detect a Midas-type psychic at all, for example.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r252","rowIndex":252,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"『ミダース』というのは、ギリシア神話に登場する王の名前で、彼は「王様の耳はロバの耳」と、「意志によらず触ったものをすべて金に変えてしまう」という能力を授かったことで有名だ。もちろん、後者のエピソードが命名の由来だ。","en":"‘Midas’ was the name of a king from Greek myth, famous both for his donkey’s ears and for the power to turn everything he touched into gold, whether he wished it or not. The class took its name, of course, from the latter story.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r253","rowIndex":253,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　能力を行使しようと特別意識しなくとも、自動的に能力が適応されてしまうタイプのサイキックをミダースと呼ぶ。例えば、<tips=48>堂島</tips>の超嗅覚もそうだし、私の鍵開けもそうだ。","en":"Psychics whose abilities activated automatically, without any conscious attempt to use them, were called Midas types. <tips=48>Dojima’s</tips> superhuman sense of smell belonged to this class, as did my ability to open locks.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r254","rowIndex":254,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=42>UB波感知器</tips>というものは、サイキックが能力を使用するために特殊な集中をしたときに発生する波長をとらえるものである。だから、集中を必要とせずに能力を発動する、ミダース・タイプを発見することは出来ない。","en":"A <tips=42>UB-wave detector</tips> detects the wavelength produced when a psychic enters the special state of concentration required to use an ability. It therefore cannot detect Midas types, whose abilities activate without concentration.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r255","rowIndex":255,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>の能力が、ミダースかどうかはわからない。おそらく<tips=11>灰上璃映子</tips>の能力を感知することは出来るだろうが、感知器はあくまでも効果範囲内のサイキック本人に反応するものであって、能力の作用そのものを感知するものではない。例えば、効果範囲の外にいる<tips=11>璃映子</tips>が、感知器の側の石ころを動かしたとしてもブザーは鳴らないのだ。","en":"I did not know whether <tips=20>Koschei’s</tips> ability was Midas type. The detector could probably register <tips=11>Rieko Haigami’s</tips> ability, but it responded only to the psychic within its effective range, not to the action of the ability itself. If <tips=11>Rieko</tips> stood outside that range and moved a stone beside the detector, for example, the buzzer would remain silent.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r256","rowIndex":256,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「旦那はあんまり使わなかったな」","en":"“Detective Dojima rarely used one of those.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r257","rowIndex":257,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=48>堂島</tips>は不確かな道具に頼るより、自分の超嗅覚や経験から来る直感を重視した。","en":"Rather than rely upon an uncertain device, <tips=48>Dojima</tips> had placed greater trust in his superhuman nose and the intuition born of experience.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r258","rowIndex":258,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「私たちには彼のような特別な能力はありません」","en":"“We do not possess special abilities like his.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"三芳","displayName":"Miyoshi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r259","rowIndex":259,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=49>三芳</tips>が言うのも無理はない。それは分かった上で、なお、そんなものに頼るのは危険だと私には思えた。","en":"<tips=49>Miyoshi</tips> had a point. Even so, relying on such a thing struck me as dangerous.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r260","rowIndex":260,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しかし、それはあえて口にしなかった。","en":"I deliberately kept the thought to myself.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r261","rowIndex":261,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　お守り代わりでも、それで気持ちが落ち着くのならばかまわない。<tips=49>三芳</tips>の様子は、大事な局面において、そんなものでも持っていなければとても使い物にならないほど緊張してしまいそうに、私には思えた。","en":"If it calmed her nerves, there was no harm in letting it serve as a good-luck charm. <tips=49>Miyoshi</tips> looked as though she might become completely useless at a critical moment if she did not have even that much to cling to.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r262","rowIndex":262,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　同行している加藤とかいう刑事は私と似た考えなのか、彼も一応自分の感知器の電源を入れたが、ろくに見もせずにバッグに仕舞った。全く喋ろうとはしないが、こちらはある程度使える人間なのかもしれない。","en":"Perhaps the detective named Kato thought much as I did. He switched on his own detector too, but put it back in his bag without so much as glancing at it. He had yet to say a word, but this one might actually be of some use.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r263","rowIndex":263,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私に対して警戒の色を隠さないのも、ノーマルの身でサイキック担当の刑事を続けるにあたり、私のようなサイキックに痛い目に遭わせられ続けた経験からだろう。","en":"He made no effort to hide his wariness of me. Presumably, a Normal could not keep working as a detective assigned to psychics without learning that caution the hard way from psychics like me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r264","rowIndex":264,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その点<tips=49>三芳</tips>は私に対して無警戒にべらべらと喋りすぎる。自分の年齢はかたくなに隠そうとするくせに。","en":"<tips=49>Miyoshi</tips>, by contrast, spoke far too freely and with far too little caution—even as she stubbornly tried to conceal her age.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r265","rowIndex":265,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「さあ、行きましょう」","en":"“All right, let’s go.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"三芳","displayName":"Miyoshi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r266","rowIndex":266,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=49>三芳</tips>が固い表情でそう促して、我々は再び歩き始めた。","en":"<tips=49>Miyoshi</tips> urged us onward with a rigid expression, and we began walking again.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r267","rowIndex":267,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そうして我々は団地の敷地に足を踏み入れた。薄暗い地べたに座り込んで路上でカードゲームをしている若者たちが、じろじろと不躾な視線を送るのを浴びながら、目の前を通り過ぎる。","en":"And so we entered the grounds of the complex. Young people sat on the dim ground playing cards in the street, and we walked past beneath their rude, unabashed stares.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r268","rowIndex":268,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そんなにビクビクすんなよ。あんたら捜査員は上着の下にケブラーベストやらを身につけているんだろう？　おれなんか、このぺらぺらのジャケット一枚だぞ」","en":"“Stop looking so nervous. You investigators are wearing Kevlar vests under your coats, aren’t you? All I’ve got is this one flimsy jacket.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r269","rowIndex":269,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　からかうと、<tips=49>三芳</tips>はむっとした表情で私を睨み付ける。","en":"When I teased her, <tips=49>Miyoshi</tips> glared at me in annoyance.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r270","rowIndex":270,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まあ、あんな連中、<tips=86>双子</tips>や<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>ほど怖くはないさ。あの三人だって、もし現れてくれれば、きみらがその銃で片付けて、それでこの事件は終了になる。そうなれば、それはそれで簡単でいい」","en":"“Anyway, that lot isn’t as frightening as <tips=86>the twins</tips> or <tips=20>Koschei</tips>. And if those three do show themselves, you can take care of them with those guns and bring the whole case to an end. That would make things nice and simple.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r271","rowIndex":271,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「私たちは射殺するのが仕事ではありません。逮捕が目的なんです」","en":"“Our job isn’t to shoot suspects dead. We’re here to arrest them.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"三芳","displayName":"Miyoshi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r272","rowIndex":272,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=49>三芳</tips>が真面目な顔でそう言うので、私は肩をすくめた。","en":"<tips=49>Miyoshi</tips> delivered the words with a solemn expression. I shrugged.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r273","rowIndex":273,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　もちろん、私には、自分の大事な人間たちをうばった連中を、ただ逮捕するだけで済ませるつもりは毛頭なかった。","en":"Of course, I had not the slightest intention of settling for the arrest of those who had taken the people dearest to me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r274","rowIndex":274,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　今私のジャケットの内側には、<tips=53>ミユキ</tips>たちが殺害された翌日から街を歩き回って手に入れた拳銃が隠されていた。さすがに、どうやっても警察の使うUT弾とやらは手に入れることは出来なかったが、街のチンピラがよく使う、共産圏の国のどこかの農村で組み立てられたような怪しげな銃ではない。正規ルートで販売される筈だった米国製の銃である。<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>に納品されるために密輸されたものを、譲って貰うのは私でも手間が要った。","en":"Inside my jacket was a pistol I had obtained by searching throughout the city since the day after <tips=53>Miyuki</tips> and the others were murdered. No effort of mine could secure the UT rounds used by the police, but this was not one of the dubious guns favored by street thugs, the sort that seemed to have been assembled in a village somewhere in the Communist bloc. It was a proper American firearm meant for legitimate sale. Even I had found it difficult to persuade someone to part with a weapon smuggled into the country for delivery to <tips=7>YS</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r275","rowIndex":275,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　あの日から胸には黒い憎悪がずっと渦巻いており、この銃を握って、<tips=13>ヘドロ団地</tips>だろうが、どこだろうが、<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>たちが居る場所を歩き回って、相手を撃ち殺したいという衝動を抑えるのは並大抵ではなく、食事は喉を通らず、睡眠さえろくにとれなかった。","en":"Black hatred had churned in my chest ever since that day. It took all the restraint I possessed not to seize the gun, scour the <tips=13>Sludge Housing Complex</tips> and every other place <tips=20>Koschei</tips> and his people might be hiding, and shoot them dead. I could not eat. I could hardly sleep.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r276","rowIndex":276,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　カルロッタは私の体調の変化を憔悴と捉えたようだがそれは違う。","en":"Carlotta appeared to regard the change in my condition as grief wearing me down. She was wrong.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r277","rowIndex":277,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は、そうやってひたすら復讐のことだけを考えていたのだ。失った者が戻るわけでも、私の落ち度がそれで解消するわけでもないが、彼らが世の中に存在している限り、どういう場所にも感情を落ち着けることが出来そうになかった。","en":"I had thought of nothing but revenge. It would not restore the people I had lost or undo my own failures. Yet for as long as those people existed in the world, I did not believe I could find peace anywhere within it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r278","rowIndex":278,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ただ、怒ってはいたが、闇雲に銃を持って歩き回るやり方は私のやり方ではないと自制する程度の理性は残っていた。","en":"I was enraged, but retained enough reason to know that roaming blindly with a gun was not my way.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r279","rowIndex":279,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　銃を握って戦うかぎりにおいて私は凡人でしかないが、能力さえ戻れば、どのように隠した情報も暴き、どんな場所にも自由に入り込む、誰にも真似出来ない超人となるのだ。たとえ、私が足踏みしている間にどんなに遠くへ逃げようとも、確実に追跡してみせる。","en":"So long as I fought with a gun, I was merely an ordinary man. Once my ability returned, however, I became a superman without equal: able to expose the most carefully concealed information and enter any place at will. No matter how far they fled while I was held back, I would track them down without fail.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r280","rowIndex":280,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　かくして、私の予想通り警察からのオファーがあり、こうして、この<tips=13>ヘドロ団地</tips>に足を踏み入れた。灰上を辿れば、<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>に辿り着くだろう。そして、この団地にはその灰上の本拠地がある。","en":"And so, precisely as I predicted, the offer came from the police, and here I was entering the <tips=13>Sludge Housing Complex</tips>. The Haigamis would lead me to <tips=20>Koschei</tips>, and this complex contained the Haigamis’ base.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r281","rowIndex":281,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　このすべてが情報化された社会で、それに伴いセキュリティは高度化している。例えば自分の端末から不正侵入して灰上のデータを見つけ出すのは非常に困難だが、灰上の家に届いた通知書とか、彼女たち自身の端末だとか、具体的なものを手に入れることが出来さえすれば、私には困難はない。そして、私の能力をもってすれば、そういった具体的なものが隠された場所に出入りするのも容易なのだ。","en":"In this society, everything had become data, and security had advanced alongside it. Breaking into a system from my own terminal and locating the Haigamis’ data would be extraordinarily difficult. But if I obtained something concrete—a notice delivered to their home, or one of their own devices—I would face no difficulty at all. And my ability made it easy to enter any place where such an object might be hidden.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r282","rowIndex":282,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　やっと、核心に向かって歩き始めている。それを思うと、高揚した。","en":"At last, I had begun walking toward the heart of the matter. The thought exhilarated me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r283","rowIndex":283,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　――あの人殺したちを追い詰めて、八つ裂きにしてやる。","en":"—I would hunt down those murderers and tear them limb from limb.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r284","rowIndex":284,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「こんな、正面から堂々と足を踏み入れて……。裏の方に廻ったりした方が良かったのじゃないですか？」","en":"“Walking straight in through the front like this... Wouldn’t it have been better to go around the back?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"三芳","displayName":"Miyoshi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r285","rowIndex":285,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　隣に並んで歩く<tips=49>三芳</tips>がそう囁く。","en":"<tips=49>Miyoshi</tips> whispered the question as she walked beside me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r286","rowIndex":286,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=13>ヘドロ団地</tips>に裏側から足を踏み入れるだなんて、とんでもない勇気があるもんだ」","en":"“Entering the <tips=13>Sludge Housing Complex</tips> from the rear—now that would take extraordinary courage.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r287","rowIndex":287,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は肩をすくめた。","en":"I shrugged.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r288","rowIndex":288,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　この団地では、一見人目の届かぬような場所こそが最も危険なポイントであり、<tips=14>深沢</tips>とはまた違う、けして人には見つかりたくないような連中に監視されている。私は<tips=14>深沢</tips>より、彼らを刺激する方が厄介だと考えていた。","en":"In this complex, the places that seemed hidden from view were the most dangerous of all. They were watched by people quite separate from <tips=14>Fukazawa</tips>—people who never wanted anyone to find them. I thought provoking that lot would be even more troublesome than provoking <tips=14>Fukazawa</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r289","rowIndex":289,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちが使っているこの開けた道ならば、郵便配達員なども利用することが出来るのだ。","en":"The open road we followed, by contrast, could even be used by postal workers.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r290","rowIndex":290,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　大体、この団地に限らず、危険な地域では狭い路地の方が危ないというのは常識だ。","en":"It was common sense that narrow alleys were more dangerous in any dangerous neighborhood, not just this complex.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r291","rowIndex":291,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ほら、あの棟だ」","en":"“There. That building.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r292","rowIndex":292,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は歩きながら、正面の建物を顎をしゃくって示した。","en":"As I walked, I indicated the structure ahead with a thrust of my chin.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r293","rowIndex":293,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=49>三芳</tips>はそれを見上げ、ごくりとつばを飲む。","en":"<tips=49>Miyoshi</tips> looked up at it and swallowed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r294","rowIndex":294,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=86>灰上姉妹</tips>の部屋は４０２号室だと、<tips=49>三芳</tips>が示した資料に載っていたが、私も前もって調べてある。","en":"The documents <tips=49>Miyoshi</tips> had shown me listed apartment 402 as the <tips=86>Haigami sisters’</tips> home, though I had already learned that much myself.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r295","rowIndex":295,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　建物はヒビだらけだ。足を踏み入れるとひんやりとしている。電灯のほとんどは切れたままで、かろうじて生き残った蛍光灯も寿命が近くチカチカと瞬いていた。","en":"The building was covered in cracks. Its interior was cold. Most of the lights had burned out, and the few surviving fluorescent tubes, nearing the end of their lives, flickered fitfully.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r296","rowIndex":296,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　エレベーターはあったが、","en":"There was an elevator, but—","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r297","rowIndex":297,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「駄目です。壊れてる……」","en":"“It’s no use. It’s broken...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"三芳","displayName":"Miyoshi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r298","rowIndex":298,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=49>三芳</tips>がいくらボタンを押しても何の反応も示さない。","en":"No matter how many times <tips=49>Miyoshi</tips> pressed the button, it gave no response.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r299","rowIndex":299,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女は不安を隠さず私を見上げる。その顔は、蛍光灯の黄色い光のせいで生気なく見える。","en":"She looked up at me without concealing her anxiety. The yellow fluorescent light made her face appear lifeless.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r300","rowIndex":300,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「入ろう。階段は建物の内側にある」","en":"“Let’s go in. The stairs are inside.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r301","rowIndex":301,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……入りますか」","en":"“...We’re going in?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"三芳","displayName":"Miyoshi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r302","rowIndex":302,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=49>三芳</tips>はこの不快な建物の奥に進むのに気が進まなそうだったが、頷いた。","en":"<tips=49>Miyoshi</tips> appeared reluctant to proceed deeper into the unpleasant building, but she nodded.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r303","rowIndex":303,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　エレベーターの脇の通路を奥へ進んで、右手の方に階段がある。電灯はすべて消えており、小さな窓から差し込む太陽の光が頼りだった。薄暗く、半分手探りで進まなければならない。","en":"The passage beside the elevator led to a staircase on the right. Every light was out, leaving us dependent on the sunlight filtering through a small window. It was so dim that we had to feel our way forward.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r304","rowIndex":304,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ひっ」","en":"“Eek!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"三芳","displayName":"Miyoshi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r305","rowIndex":305,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　階段を上がるところに、何者かが段差にもたれるように横たわっていた。","en":"Someone lay across the steps where the staircase began, his body propped against the next rise.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r306","rowIndex":306,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ボロを纏い、ぐったりとしたその姿を、<tips=49>三芳</tips>は死体か何かと勘違いしたのかもしれない。小さく声をあげる。","en":"Wrapped in rags and lying utterly limp, he may have looked like a corpse to <tips=49>Miyoshi</tips>. A small cry escaped her.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r307","rowIndex":307,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　が、それは死体ではなかった。","en":"He was not dead.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r308","rowIndex":308,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちの立てる物音で、その人物は弱々しくまぶたを開く。","en":"At the sound of our approach, the man weakly opened his eyes.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r309","rowIndex":309,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「通して貰うよ」","en":"“Let me through.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r310","rowIndex":310,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は彼にそう告げて、その隣を通り過ぎる。通り過ぎるとき、汗のにおいと、糞尿のにおいのいりまじった悪臭が鼻をつく。","en":"With that, I stepped around him. As I passed, the mingled stench of sweat and human waste struck my nose.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r311","rowIndex":311,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=49>三芳</tips>たちも、男に十分な警戒を払いながら私に続いた。","en":"<tips=49>Miyoshi</tips> and Kato followed, keeping the man under close watch.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r312","rowIndex":312,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……ろ、<tips=50>路地</tips>さん……」","en":"“...M-<tips=50>Mr. Roji</tips>...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r313","rowIndex":313,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　立ち去る私に向かって男は震える声でそう呟いた。","en":"The man murmured after me in a trembling voice.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r314","rowIndex":314,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「やっぱりお前か。なんとなくそう思ったんだ」","en":"“So it is you. I had a feeling.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r315","rowIndex":315,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は立ち止まってそう答える。","en":"I stopped and answered.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r316","rowIndex":316,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「へへ……」","en":"“Heh...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r317","rowIndex":317,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　男はかすれた声で笑った。","en":"The man laughed hoarsely.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r318","rowIndex":318,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ひでえありさまだ……。三日も何も食ってねえんだよ。立てなくなっちまった」","en":"“Look at the state of me... Haven’t eaten in three days. Can’t even stand anymore.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r319","rowIndex":319,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「飯代を貸してやろうか？」","en":"“Want me to lend you some money for food?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r320","rowIndex":320,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いいよ……。どうせ吐いちまう。<tips=50>路地</tips>さんは、仕事かい……？」","en":"“No... I’d only throw it back up. You here on a job, Mr. <tips=50>Roji</tips>...?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r321","rowIndex":321,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうだ」","en":"“I am.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r322","rowIndex":322,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……あんた、また探偵になったのか？」","en":"“...You a detective again?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r323","rowIndex":323,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いや、いまはこの街のくだらない噂話ばかり書いている売文屋だよ」","en":"“No. These days I’m just a hack who writes up nothing but this city’s worthless rumors.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r324","rowIndex":324,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「へえ、この街のことをどこかに載せてくれてるのかい？　それは嬉しいね。世間の連中に、おれたちみたいな生き物もいることを教えてやってくれてるのか。……へっへっへ……。おれも、元気だったら手伝いたいところだが……」","en":"“Huh. You’re putting things about this city out there somewhere? That makes me happy. You’re telling people outside that creatures like us exist. ...Heh heh heh... I’d help if I were well enough...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r325","rowIndex":325,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「気持ちだけで十分だ。動くと毒だぞ。ゆっくり休むといい」","en":"“It’s the thought that counts. Moving around will only make things worse. Get some rest.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r326","rowIndex":326,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私はそう声をかけ、立ち去った。","en":"I left him with those words and walked away.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r327","rowIndex":327,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あれは……？」","en":"“Who was that?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"三芳","displayName":"Miyoshi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r328","rowIndex":328,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　階段を二つ上ったところで、<tips=49>三芳</tips>が私に小さな声で尋ねる。","en":"Once we had climbed two flights, <tips=49>Miyoshi</tips> asked in a low voice.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r329","rowIndex":329,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=45>ローズ</tips>のやり過ぎだよ。末期中毒だ。ああなるともう何をしたって助からないのさ」","en":"“He overused <tips=45>Rose</tips>. Terminal addiction. Once someone reaches that state, nothing can save him.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r330","rowIndex":330,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=45>ローズ</tips>……」","en":"“<tips=45>Rose</tips>...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"三芳","displayName":"Miyoshi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r331","rowIndex":331,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「驚くだろう？　もう誰も使わないようなあんなクソみたいな薬だが、この辺りではまだ濫用してくたばるヤツが多い。何しろ安く簡単に作れるからな。<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>は麻薬の売人を目の敵にしていて、売ることは出来ないが、こっそり作って仲間でまわしあってるのさ。おろかだと思うだろう？　でも、自分の人生に何の価値も感じなくなったやつらは、往々にして小指の先ほどの快楽を得るためだけに全てをぶっこむんだよ」","en":"“Surprising, isn’t it? That miserable drug has fallen out of use everywhere else, but people around here still abuse it until they die. It is cheap and simple to make. <tips=7>YS</tips> treats drug dealers as mortal enemies, making it impossible to sell, so they manufacture it in secret and pass it among their friends. Foolish, wouldn’t you say? Yet once people cease to find any value in their own lives, they often wager everything for a pleasure no larger than the tip of a little finger.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r332","rowIndex":332,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は階段をのぼりつつそうこたえる。<tips=49>三芳</tips>は暗い顔をしてうなだれている。","en":"I explained this as we climbed. <tips=49>Miyoshi</tips> hung her head, her expression dark.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r333","rowIndex":333,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「この街で警察の仕事を真面目にやるつもりなら、そういうやつらばかり相手にすることになるぜ。あんたの想像なんか及ばないような行動ばかりする連中さ」","en":"“If you’re serious about doing police work in this city, those are the kinds of people you’ll be dealing with. They do nothing but things you could never imagine.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r334","rowIndex":334,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私の声に彼女は顔を上げ、","en":"At the sound of my voice, she raised her head and said,","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r335","rowIndex":335,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「彼はあなたの名を……」","en":"“He knew your name...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"三芳","displayName":"Miyoshi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r336","rowIndex":336,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ああ……。ちょっとした知り合いだ。昔はちょっとした事情通でね、よく<tips=13>ヘドロ団地</tips>の情報を売ってくれたんだよ。あんたと同じくらいの年じゃないかな？　当時は売れっ子のゲイボーイで、あちこちの金持ちにちやほやされていたもんだよ。えらい美少年だったんだぜ。ま、今は見る影もないが」","en":"“Yes... We knew each other a little. He used to know the neighborhood well and often sold me information about the <tips=13>Sludge Housing Complex</tips>. He’s probably around your age. Back then he was a popular gay boy, fawned over by wealthy men all over the city. He was quite a beautiful young man. Not that you’d know it to look at him now.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r337","rowIndex":337,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうですか……」","en":"“I see...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"三芳","displayName":"Miyoshi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r338","rowIndex":338,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=49>三芳</tips>はチラと後ろの方を振り返り、そしてまた私の方を見ると、口を開きかけて何か言おうとしたものの、結局言わず、口を閉ざした。","en":"<tips=49>Miyoshi</tips> glanced back, then looked at me once more. She opened her mouth as though to say something, but ultimately closed it without speaking.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r339","rowIndex":339,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　建物のなかは静かだった。","en":"The building was silent.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r340","rowIndex":340,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　誰かと出会ったらややこしくなると考えていたが、最初の男以外は誰ともすれ違うことなく目的のドアの目の前まで辿り着いた。","en":"I had expected an encounter to complicate matters, but apart from the first man, we passed no one before reaching our destination.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r341","rowIndex":341,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　表札は名前を記入したカードを差し込むタイプのもので、一見すると真っ白に見え、近づいて目をこらすと、インクの消えかけた文字で『灰上』と書かれているのが確認出来た。","en":"The nameplate beside the door accepted a written card. From a distance it appeared blank, but upon drawing close and narrowing my eyes, I could make out the fading ink: ‘Haigami.’","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r342","rowIndex":342,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「間違いないな」","en":"“This is the place.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r343","rowIndex":343,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私が呟くと、<tips=49>三芳</tips>の連れの男――加藤がドアに耳をおし当て、中に人気がないのを確認すると私たちに向かって頷いた。そしてドアノブを捻るが、鍵がかかっていて回らない。","en":"When I muttered this, <tips=49>Miyoshi’s</tips> companion—Kato—pressed an ear to the door. After confirming that no one appeared to be inside, he nodded to us, then tried the knob. It would not turn; the door was locked.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r344","rowIndex":344,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　代わりに私がドアノブを握る。中和剤によって能力が解放された私の手にかかれば、たとえ鍵がかかっていようとも、いなくとも、同じようにガチャリと開く。","en":"I took his place and gripped the doorknob. With my ability released by the neutralizer, it opened with the same click beneath my hand whether the door was locked or not.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r345","rowIndex":345,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それを見て、加藤は感心したような、呆れたような視線を私によこす。","en":"Kato looked at me with a mixture of admiration and exasperation.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r346","rowIndex":346,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ドアが開かれると玄関の光景が目に入り、そして、部屋のなかの空気が漏れ出てにおいが微かに鼻先に臭った。","en":"As the door opened, the entryway came into view, and air leaked out from the room, carrying a faint odor to my nose.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r347","rowIndex":347,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私には<tips=48>堂島</tips>ほどの鋭い嗅覚はないけれども、若い女の持つあの独特のにおいであることはわかった。","en":"My sense of smell was nothing like <tips=48>Dojima’s</tips>, yet I recognized the peculiar scent of young women.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r348","rowIndex":348,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ドアの内側には郵便受けがついている。私はまずそこへ手を突っ込んで探ったが、何も入ってはいなかった。","en":"A mail slot was mounted inside the door. I thrust in a hand and searched it first, but found nothing.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r349","rowIndex":349,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　手探りで電源スイッチを入れ、土足のまま廊下へ上がる。","en":"I found the light switch by touch and entered the hallway without removing my shoes.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r350","rowIndex":350,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　このような集合住宅は、大体どの部屋も同じような構造をしているものだ。そしてこの<tips=13>ヘドロ団地</tips>には、一種類の間取りしかない。かつて何度も訪れていた私は前もって調べなくとも、どこにどういった部屋があるのかを知っていた。","en":"Rooms in an apartment building like this generally shared a common plan, and the <tips=13>Sludge Housing Complex</tips> had only one. I had visited it many times in the past and knew the location of every room without any need to investigate in advance.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r351","rowIndex":351,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　玄関を入るとすぐ廊下になっている。足を踏み入れてすぐ右手のドアは６畳の洋室。その奥の突き当たりにはさらに三つのドアがあり、右のドアが１２畳のリビングルーム、正面のドアがもう一つの６畳間、左のドアは浴室とトイレに、それぞれ通じている。","en":"A hallway began immediately beyond the entrance. The door to the right opened into a Western-style room of six tatami mats. Three more doors stood at the end of the hall: the one on the right led to a twelve-mat living room, the one ahead to another six-mat room, and the one on the left to the bathroom and toilet.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r352","rowIndex":352,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私はまず一番手前のドアを開いた。","en":"I opened the nearest door first.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r353","rowIndex":353,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　廊下側の窓からぼんやりとした明かりが差し込んではいるが、薄暗い部屋だった。そこは寝室として使われているらしく、二段ベッドと、二脚の木製の学習机が設置されていた。いずれも使い込まれたもので、子供時代に買い与えられた物を、いまでも使用しているのだろう。そして小さな時と同じように、姉妹で同じ部屋で暮らしているのか。","en":"A faint light entered through the window facing the corridor, but the room was dim. It appeared to serve as a bedroom and contained a bunk bed and two wooden study desks. Both were well worn, presumably the same furniture the sisters had received as children. Did they still share a room now, just as they had when they were small?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r354","rowIndex":354,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　机にミュージシャンの写真が飾られたり、ベッドの上に熊のぬいぐるみなどが置かれているのを見ると、ごく平凡な年頃の少女の部屋という印象を受けた。","en":"Photographs of musicians stood upon the desks, and a stuffed bear rested upon the bed. The place struck me as the room of perfectly ordinary girls their age.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r355","rowIndex":355,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　次に廊下を進んで右側、リビングルームへ通じるドアを開いた。","en":"I proceeded down the hallway and opened the door on the right, which led to the living room.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r356","rowIndex":356,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　大きな窓からレースのカーテン越しに真昼の太陽の光が差し込み、部屋全体を明るく照らし出している。","en":"Midday sunlight entered through lace curtains covering a large window and illuminated the entire room.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r357","rowIndex":357,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　普段の居住スペースとして使われているらしく、食卓やテレビなどが設置されていた。","en":"It appeared to be their ordinary living space and contained a dining table, a television, and other furniture.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r358","rowIndex":358,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　次に突き当たりの六畳間。角部屋であるこの部屋は、こちらの部屋にも窓があり、電灯を付けなくとも部屋の中が明るい。","en":"Next came the six-mat room at the end of the hall. As this was a corner apartment, the room had a window of its own and remained bright without electric light.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r359","rowIndex":359,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　この部屋は、ハンガーラックや全身鏡、棚などがおかれている。物置兼、衣装部屋といったところか。","en":"A garment rack, full-length mirror, shelving, and other furnishings filled it. Perhaps it served as both storage and dressing room.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r360","rowIndex":360,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして最後にバスルームへ繋がるドアを開くと、洗面台の前に置かれたままの化粧道具や、洗濯機の横の籠に脱いだ衣服が突っ込まれているのが見えたが、特別なものはなかった。","en":"Finally, I opened the door leading to the bathroom. Cosmetics had been left before the sink, and discarded clothes had been thrust into a basket beside the washing machine, but nothing appeared remarkable.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r361","rowIndex":361,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私はまずリビングルームから調べることにした。","en":"I decided to begin with the living room.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r362","rowIndex":362,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　部屋のなかは雑然としており、床の上に、スーパーマーケットで買って来たままのレジ袋が置かれていたり、ソファーの上に通学用の革鞄がそのまま投げ出されている。","en":"It was cluttered. Plastic shopping bags sat upon the floor exactly as they had come from the supermarket, and a leather schoolbag lay abandoned upon the sofa.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r363","rowIndex":363,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　すぐ帰って来るつもりで出かけて、そのままになっているといった印象だった。","en":"It gave the impression that the occupants had left meaning to return shortly and never done so.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r364","rowIndex":364,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　テーブルの上にはストローが差し込まれた空のグラスが置かれており、太陽の光が、うっすらとつもった埃を目立たせている。","en":"An empty glass with a straw stood upon the table. Sunlight made the thin layer of dust across it plainly visible.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r365","rowIndex":365,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どう見ても、普通の子の部屋ですね……」","en":"“However one looks at it, this is the room of ordinary girls...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"三芳","displayName":"Miyoshi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r366","rowIndex":366,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=49>三芳</tips>が独り言のように呟いた。","en":"<tips=49>Miyoshi</tips> murmured as though speaking to herself.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r367","rowIndex":367,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　確かに彼女の言う通りで、必要最低限の整理整頓や掃除は行われており、カーテンの柄や、部屋のあちこちに置かれた可愛らしい小物などは、精神に異常な偏りのある少女たちの部屋とは思えない。","en":"She was right. The room had been kept at least minimally clean and tidy, while the pattern on the curtains and the cute little ornaments scattered throughout hardly suggested that it belonged to girls with such abnormally skewed minds.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r368","rowIndex":368,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「履歴を見ても、いたずらは多かったですが、深刻な非行はありませんでしたし、何かたぶらかされて、<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>と行動を共にしているのでしょうか……」","en":"“Their history shows plenty of mischief, but no serious delinquency. Perhaps someone deceived them into joining <tips=20>Koschei</tips>...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"三芳","displayName":"Miyoshi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r369","rowIndex":369,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「さあ、どうだろうね」","en":"“Who can say?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r370","rowIndex":370,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　何にしても、この<tips=86>双子</tips>が、<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>の協力者であることには変わりがない。","en":"Whatever the circumstances, the fact remained that <tips=86>the twins</tips> were <tips=20>Koschei’s</tips> accomplices.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r371","rowIndex":371,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それより、さっさと手がかりを探そう」","en":"“More importantly, let’s hurry up and find a lead.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r372","rowIndex":372,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　タブレットやパソコンなどの端末か、携帯電話の請求書でもいい。その手の個人情報があれば、手っ取り早く必要な情報にアクセス出来る。","en":"A tablet or computer would do, as would a mobile-telephone bill. Any personal information of that kind would give me rapid access to what I needed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r373","rowIndex":373,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　学生ならば、何かしらの電子機器に囲まれ、それらを利用して生活しているはずだ。それらの機器はつねに持ち主の行動を記録しており、そして私はそれらの機器から、持ち主でさえも閲覧出来ないようなデータに触れられる。","en":"As students, they were bound to live surrounded by electronic devices and use them in their daily lives. Those devices constantly recorded their owners’ actions, and through them I could access data that even the owners themselves could not view.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r374","rowIndex":374,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　我々は棚に積まれた<tips=9>Y地区</tips>の若者が発行しているミニコミ誌をめくったり、少女向けキャラクターのステッカーが貼られた棚を開けたりして部屋のあちこちを調べ、そしてテレビの脇に置かれたミント色のトートバッグのなかから、薄型のノートパソコンを見つけた。","en":"We searched the room, leafing through small-circulation magazines published by young people in <tips=9>Y District</tips> and opening cabinets covered in stickers of characters popular with girls. In a mint-colored tote bag beside the television, we found a slim notebook computer.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r375","rowIndex":375,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そのパソコンにも、やたらとシールやらがべたべたと貼られている。学校の優等生と言えばこうした無駄な装飾をしないようなイメージがあったが、<tips=86>双子</tips>はそれには当てはまらないのだろう。部屋もそうだが、少女趣味、というか、どこか幼い印象を覚えていた。","en":"Stickers of every kind covered the computer as well. I had imagined exemplary students as people who avoided such useless decoration, but perhaps <tips=86>the twins</tips> were exceptions. Between the computer and the room, they gave me an impression of girlish tastes—or, more precisely, of something faintly childish.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r376","rowIndex":376,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　バッテリーが切れていて、ボタンを押しただけでは起動しなかったので、電気コンセントにケーブルをつなげて押し直す。","en":"The battery was dead, and pressing the button did nothing. I plugged its cable into an electrical outlet and pressed it again.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r377","rowIndex":377,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　起動して現れた画面は、外装のゴテゴテとした装飾とはうって変わって、フォルダやショートカットが機能的に並べられたデスクトップだった。","en":"The machine booted to a desktop whose practical arrangement of folders and shortcuts contrasted sharply with the gaudy exterior.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r378","rowIndex":378,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　学校のレポートを作成したり、授業のノートをとるのが主な用途らしく、それらのファイルやソフトが入っている。","en":"It appeared to be used chiefly for writing school reports and taking class notes, and contained the expected files and software.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r379","rowIndex":379,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　まったく私用に使っていないのならば、ここから手がかりを得るのは難しい。","en":"If it had never been used for personal purposes, extracting a lead from it would be difficult.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r380","rowIndex":380,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しかし、インストールされたアプリの一覧を表示させたところで、携帯電話との連携機能を使うためのソフトを見つけることが出来た。それを起動させると、本人認証を求める画面が表示される。","en":"When I displayed the list of installed applications, however, I found software designed to synchronize with a mobile telephone. Launching it produced a screen requesting identity verification.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r381","rowIndex":381,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いけそうだ」","en":"“This should work.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r382","rowIndex":382,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　両隣に私を挟むように座って画面をのぞき込んでいる二人の警察官にそう言った。","en":"I addressed the two police officers sitting close on either side of me and peering at the screen.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r383","rowIndex":383,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　この画面が現れるということは、一度でもこのソフトを使ったということだ。となれば、携帯電話が記録しているさまざまな情報に、このパソコンからアクセスすることが出来る。","en":"The appearance of this screen meant the software had been used at least once. If so, the computer could access a variety of information recorded by the mobile telephone.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r384","rowIndex":384,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　このソフトで採用されている認証方式は瞳の虹彩と指の静脈といったバイオメトリクスを利用したもので、本来ならば本人以外が不正にパスするのは困難なものなのだろうが、私に対しては意味がない。パソコンの静脈スキャナーに人差し指を置き、モニター上部に取り付けられたカメラを見つめると、数秒でロックが外れた。","en":"Its authentication system used biometrics—the iris of the eye and the veins of a finger—and would ordinarily have been difficult for anyone but the owner to pass. Such measures meant nothing to me. I placed my index finger upon the computer’s vein reader and looked into the camera mounted above the display. Within seconds, the lock opened.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r385","rowIndex":385,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「よし、これがあれば充分だろう」","en":"“Good. This should be sufficient.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r386","rowIndex":386,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　メニュー画面を開き、携帯電話の位置情報や、通話記録が閲覧可能なのを確認すると、私はパソコンの電源を落とし、上蓋を閉じた。","en":"I opened the menu and confirmed that location data and call records from the mobile telephone were available. Then I powered down the computer and closed its lid.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r387","rowIndex":387,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「退散しよう。長居してもろくなことはない」","en":"“Let’s get out of here. Nothing good will come of staying too long.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r388","rowIndex":388,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　パソコンを小脇に抱えると、<tips=49>三芳</tips>たちに目配せをする。すると彼らも頷きを返す。","en":"I tucked the computer beneath my arm and signaled to <tips=49>Miyoshi</tips> and the others. They nodded in return.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r389","rowIndex":389,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちは部屋を出て、ドアを閉める。","en":"We left the room and shut the door.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r390","rowIndex":390,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　早足で階段を下り、一階まで来ると、さっき会話をかわした男が、さっきと同じような姿勢で階段にもたれてぐったりとしている。","en":"We hurried down the stairs. When we reached the ground floor, the man we had spoken with earlier was slumped against the staircase in the same posture as before.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r391","rowIndex":391,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　今度は先ほどのように話しかけてくることもなく、顔を上げようともしない。","en":"This time, he neither addressed us nor made any attempt to raise his head.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r392","rowIndex":392,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　死んでしまったのか、眠っているだけか、私たち三人は確かめようとはせずに無言でその脇を通り過ぎた。建物を出て、<tips=13>ヘドロ団地</tips>の敷地を出る。さっき路上に居た若者たちはどこかへ行っており、帰りは誰とも出会うことがなかった。","en":"Whether he had died or merely fallen asleep, none of us tried to find out. The three of us passed him in silence, left the building, and departed the grounds of the <tips=13>Sludge Housing Complex</tips>. The young people who had been in the street earlier had gone elsewhere, and we encountered no one on our way out.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r393","rowIndex":393,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　充分に団地を離れたところで<tips=49>三芳</tips>は大きく溜息をついたが、私は気がつかないふりをした。","en":"Once we had put sufficient distance between ourselves and the housing complex, <tips=49>Miyoshi</tips> released a long sigh. I pretended not to notice.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r394","rowIndex":394,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　駅の反対側にある警察署の一室でパソコンの検証作業を行った。","en":"We examined the computer in a room at the police station across from the railway station.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r395","rowIndex":395,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　多くの刑事が私の能力の行使を見に集まってくるのが野次馬のようでわずらわしかったが、気にしている場合ではなかった。","en":"A great many detectives gathered like gawkers to watch me use my ability, which I found irritating. But I had more important things to worry about.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r396","rowIndex":396,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　携帯電話のGPS履歴は端末から手動で消去されていた。現在は機能自体が停止しており所在地を確認出来ない。<tips=86>灰上たち</tips>は万一のことを想定して消したのだろうが、私にとっては意味がなかった。","en":"The GPS history had been deleted manually from the mobile phone. The function itself was now disabled, so its current location could not be determined. The <tips=86>Haigamis</tips> had probably erased the data as a precaution in case anything happened, but that meant nothing to me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r397","rowIndex":397,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　このデータはユーザーが消去しても会社のサーバーにはしばらくの間保存されており、<tips=86>双子</tips>の携帯電話の製造番号さえわかっていれば、私にとっては自分の引き出しを開けてあめ玉を一つ取り出すくらいの手間で閲覧することが出来る。","en":"Even after a user deleted such data, the carrier retained it on its servers for a time. As long as I knew the serial numbers of <tips=86>the twins’</tips> mobile phones, viewing it would take me no more effort than opening one of my own drawers and taking out a piece of candy.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r398","rowIndex":398,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　機能は一週間ほど前に停止したようだが、それまでのGPSの履歴は残されていた。そこから、彼女たちが何度も足を運んでいる場所のうち、学校や、自宅などのすでに明らかになっているものや、飲食店などの利用目的が明白なものを除外すると、一つの場所が浮かび上がる。","en":"The function appeared to have been disabled about a week earlier, but its GPS history until that point remained. From the places the sisters had visited repeatedly, I excluded those already known to us, such as their school and home, as well as restaurants and other establishments whose purpose was obvious. One location emerged.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r399","rowIndex":399,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ここに、何度も足を運んでいるようですね」","en":"“It appears they have visited this place many times.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"三芳","displayName":"Miyoshi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r400","rowIndex":400,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=49>三芳</tips>が画面の一点を指さす。","en":"<tips=49>Miyoshi</tips> pointed to a spot on the screen.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r401","rowIndex":401,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=57>滑走路通り</tips>の北側の地域にある一軒家に、ここ最近の<tips=86>双子</tips>はなぜか頻繁に訪れ、滞在をしている。","en":"For some reason, the <tips=86>twins</tips> had recently made frequent visits to a detached house in the area north of <tips=57>Runway Street</tips> and spent considerable time there.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r402","rowIndex":402,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どうやら、貸家のようですね」","en":"“It appears to be a rental property.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"三芳","displayName":"Miyoshi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r403","rowIndex":403,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その建物を調べた別の警察官がそう報告した。","en":"That was the report of another police officer who had investigated the building.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r404","rowIndex":404,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=9>Y地区</tips>内で営業する不動産管理会社の自社物件で、問い合わせてみると、音楽家の女に一ヶ月ほど前から貸しているのだと言う。","en":"It was owned directly by a property-management company operating within <tips=9>Y District</tips>. When contacted, the company said that it had rented the house to a female musician about a month earlier.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r405","rowIndex":405,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「音楽家の女？」","en":"“A female musician?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r406","rowIndex":406,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私が訊ねると、","en":"When I asked—","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r407","rowIndex":407,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「新堂仁美と名乗ったそうです」","en":"“She reportedly gave her name as Hitomi Shindo.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"三芳","displayName":"Miyoshi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r408","rowIndex":408,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=61>ヒトミ</tips>か……」","en":"“<tips=61>Hitomi</tips>...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r409","rowIndex":409,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=48>堂島</tips>の話である程度の予期はしていたが、ここでこう繋がってしまうと、私も苦々しい思いを隠せなかった。","en":"<tips=48>Dojima’s</tips> account had led me to expect this to some degree, but now that the connection had taken shape before me, I could not conceal my bitterness.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r410","rowIndex":410,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あなたが出会ったことのある女ですね」","en":"“You have met this woman before.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"三芳","displayName":"Miyoshi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r411","rowIndex":411,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=49>三芳</tips>がそう言ったので一瞬驚いた。しかしよく考えれば彼らは<tips=48>堂島</tips>の義眼を通じて彼の見聞きしたものをすべて共有することが出来るのだ。つまり、私が<tips=61>ヒトミ</tips>と寝て、そこで漏らした情報から<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>たちが私の家を襲撃したことも知っているというわけだ。","en":"<tips=49>Miyoshi’s</tips> remark startled me for an instant. On reflection, however, they could share everything <tips=48>Dojima</tips> saw and heard through his prosthetic eye. In other words, they knew that I had slept with <tips=61>Hitomi</tips>, and that the information I let slip to her had enabled <tips=20>Koschei</tips> and the others to attack my home.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r412","rowIndex":412,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「この建物を調査しましょう。<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>の本拠地の可能性があります」","en":"“Let us investigate this building. It may be <tips=20>Koschei’s</tips> base of operations.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"三芳","displayName":"Miyoshi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r413","rowIndex":413,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　次の捜査対象が見つかった<tips=49>三芳</tips>は私の内心の屈託には気づかず、興奮気味にそう言った。","en":"Having found our next target, <tips=49>Miyoshi</tips> said this with some excitement, oblivious to my private discomfort.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r414","rowIndex":414,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「現場の捜査には、<tips=50>路地</tips>さんも同行していただけますね？」","en":"“You’ll accompany us when we search the premises, won’t you, <tips=50>Mr. Roji</tips>?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"三芳","displayName":"Miyoshi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r415","rowIndex":415,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私の方を振り返り、そう念を押す。","en":"She turned toward me and pressed the point.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r416","rowIndex":416,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「もちろんだ」","en":"“Of course.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r417","rowIndex":417,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私はそう頷いた。","en":"I nodded.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r418","rowIndex":418,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　翌日の昼下がり、早速人数と装備が集まったのでその場所へ向かうこととなった。","en":"By early afternoon the following day, the necessary personnel and equipment had already been assembled, and we set out for the location.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r419","rowIndex":419,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　今回は<tips=13>ヘドロ団地</tips>と違って、<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>、及び<tips=86>灰上姉妹</tips>との遭遇が予想される。","en":"Unlike the <tips=13>Sludge Housing Complex</tips>, this operation carried the expectation that we might encounter <tips=20>Koschei</tips> or the <tips=86>Haigami sisters</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r420","rowIndex":420,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　捜査員たちは総勢十五名ほどで、対サイキック用の装備を身につけているが、私としては甚だ心許ない。サイキックと戦うための特殊部隊のようなものは、軍にはあるが警察にはないとのことで、今回の事件では動員の許可が出ていないのだと言う。","en":"The investigative team numbered about fifteen, all equipped to confront psychics, but I found that painfully inadequate. The military possessed something resembling a special unit for fighting psychics, but the police did not, and no authorization to mobilize the military unit had been granted for this case.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r421","rowIndex":421,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そのかわり、私たちでも使用可能なもので、もっとも効果的な装備が与えられています」","en":"“Instead, we’ve been given the most effective equipment that we can use ourselves.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"三芳","displayName":"Miyoshi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r422","rowIndex":422,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=49>三芳</tips>が言うには、UT剤の噴霧器が貸与されているという。それは、私に月一回投与し、UT弾にも使用されている、あのサイキックの能力を封じる薬剤を気体状にして周囲に噴霧する装置である。","en":"According to <tips=49>Miyoshi</tips>, they had been lent sprayers containing the UT agent. The devices dispersed into the surrounding air the same drug used in UT rounds and in the injections I received once a month—the drug that suppressed a psychic’s ability.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r423","rowIndex":423,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　この装置を作動させれば、周辺の<tips=16>タイプA</tips>は一切の能力を使えなくなる。政治家の国際会談の場などでも用いられる非常に高価な道具だ。","en":"Once activated, these devices prevented every <tips=16>Type A</tips> in the vicinity from exercising any ability whatsoever. They were extremely expensive instruments, also employed at events such as international summits.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r424","rowIndex":424,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「素晴らしいが、そんなものを振りまきながら捜査するとなると、私も役立たずになるな。外で大人しく待っていろということかい？」","en":"“Splendid. But if you conduct the search while spraying that everywhere, I will be useless too. Do you mean for me to wait obediently outside?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r425","rowIndex":425,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=50>路地</tips>さんには、マスクを装着して同行していただきます。突入時や、現場の捜査時に、その能力が非常に有用だという話になりまして　……」","en":"“You will accompany us while wearing a mask, <tips=50>Mr. Roji</tips>. We concluded that your ability would be extremely useful during the entry and the search of the premises...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"三芳","displayName":"Miyoshi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r426","rowIndex":426,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「オーケー。それでいい。ここで私を置いていくと判断するようなら、あまりにも無能だと怒ってやるところだった」","en":"“Okay. That will do. If you had decided to leave me behind here, I was prepared to tell you precisely how incompetent you were.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r427","rowIndex":427,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私が苦笑すると、<tips=49>三芳</tips>はあからさまに顔を顰める。","en":"I gave a wry smile, and <tips=49>Miyoshi</tips> scowled openly.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r428","rowIndex":428,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ともあれ、そうして我々は速やかに現場へと向かった。","en":"In any case, we headed straight to the site.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r429","rowIndex":429,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　目的の建物が有る地域には、かつてこの地に基地が出来る前から北沼という地名がついてはいるが現在はそれらしい地形は存在しない。<tips=57>滑走路通り</tips>に近いが、住宅の多い地域である。観光客はあまり入り込まず、住民を相手にした飲食店や日用品店が目につく。","en":"The area containing our destination had borne the place name Kitanuma since before the base was built upon this land, although no terrain resembling a northern marsh remained today. It lay near <tips=57>Runway Street</tips>, but was largely residential. Few tourists ventured into it; the businesses that caught the eye were restaurants and household-goods stores catering to local residents.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r430","rowIndex":430,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちは四台の車に分乗してそこへ向かった。もちろんサイレンなど鳴らしはしない。警察が多数集結しているということを、捜査対象はもとより、<tips=9>Y地区</tips>の住人たちにも出来れば知られたくはなかった。","en":"We traveled there in four vehicles. Naturally, we did not sound any sirens. If possible, we wanted neither the targets of the investigation nor the residents of <tips=9>Y District</tips> to know that the police had assembled there in force.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r431","rowIndex":431,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　四台の車をそれぞれ所定の位置に停めると、捜査員たちは連絡を取り合いながら持ち場へと移動する。","en":"After parking each vehicle in its assigned position, the investigators coordinated with one another and moved to their stations.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r432","rowIndex":432,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　このあたりの建物はごちゃごちゃと入り組んでいて、どこか遠くのビルから目的の建物を観察することも出来ず、その状況を知るには直接近くまで行くしかなかった。","en":"The buildings in this neighborhood formed a dense, tangled jumble. We could not observe our destination from some distant building; to learn what was happening there, we had to approach it directly.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r433","rowIndex":433,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は突入係の捜査員たちと共に居た。","en":"I was with the investigators assigned to make the entry.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r434","rowIndex":434,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　建物は、雰囲気のある大きな洋館で、比較的経済力のある外国人利用者を想定して建設されたものだろう。家賃はそう安くはないようだが、支払いは適切に行われているらしく、<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>は逃亡生活のわりには豊かであるようだった。","en":"The building was a large, atmospheric Western-style mansion, probably constructed with relatively affluent foreign tenants in mind. Its rent did not appear cheap, but payments had apparently been made properly. For someone living as a fugitive, <tips=20>Koschei</tips> seemed prosperous.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r435","rowIndex":435,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　いつ凶悪な<tips=16>タイプA</tips>たちと遭遇するかもしれないという極度の緊張感のなか、捜査員たちはひそやかに建物を包囲する。そして、私が事前に手渡されたガスマスクを装着すると、UT剤の噴霧が始まった。","en":"Under the extreme tension of knowing that we might encounter vicious <tips=16>Type As</tips> at any moment, the investigators silently surrounded the building. Once I donned the gas mask I had received in advance, they began dispersing the UT agent.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r436","rowIndex":436,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その装置は、丁度消火器のような形状をしている。風がない屋内ならば三十秒の散布でおよそ五分間ほどはその場に薬剤が滞留するらしい。三台の噴霧器でそれぞれ別の方向から建物に向かって散布を行ったのち、<tips=49>三芳</tips>が二人の捜査員と共にドアの前へ進み出て、インターフォンを押した。","en":"Each device was shaped much like a fire extinguisher. Indoors and without wind, a thirty-second discharge would apparently leave the agent suspended in the area for approximately five minutes. After three sprayers each discharged toward the building from a separate direction, <tips=49>Miyoshi</tips> advanced to the door with two investigators and pressed the intercom.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r437","rowIndex":437,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　二度押して、誰も出ない。","en":"She pressed it twice. No one answered.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r438","rowIndex":438,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=49>三芳</tips>の合図によって私はドアの前に立ち、他の捜査員たちが懐の拳銃を取り出したのを確認しながら、そっとノブを捻る。","en":"At <tips=49>Miyoshi’s</tips> signal, I stepped up to the door. Once I had confirmed that the other investigators had drawn the pistols beneath their jackets, I carefully turned the knob.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r439","rowIndex":439,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そうして開いたドアの向こうには、鮮やかな模様の絨毯が敷かれた玄関ホールがあった。","en":"Beyond the open door lay an entrance hall carpeted in vivid patterns.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r440","rowIndex":440,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　我々はその都度UT剤を噴霧しながら建物の探索を行った。建物はひっそりと静まりかえり、どの部屋にも人の気配が感じられない。","en":"We searched the building, dispersing more of the UT agent whenever necessary. It stood silent and still, with no sign of anyone in any room.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r441","rowIndex":441,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おそろしくもののない家だった。家具はおそらく備え付けのものだろう。それらの棚はほとんど空っぽで、利用されていない。かといって生活感がないわけではなく、コートハンガーに帽子と上着が掛かっているのを見つけたり、机の上に折りたたまれた英字新聞などを見つけることは出来た。","en":"It was an astonishingly bare house. The furniture had probably come with the property. Its shelves were almost entirely empty and unused. Yet it was not wholly devoid of signs of life: we found a hat and coat hanging from a coat rack, as well as a folded English-language newspaper upon a desk.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r442","rowIndex":442,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ここには誰が住んでいるのだろう？","en":"Who lived here?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r443","rowIndex":443,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　借りたのはあの<tips=61>ヒトミ</tips>という女だが、彼女もここに住んでいるのだろうか。","en":"The house had been rented by the woman called <tips=61>Hitomi</tips>, but did she live here herself?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r444","rowIndex":444,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その疑問は、二階のある部屋のドアを開いた時に解決した。そこは寝室らしく、部屋の中央にベッドがあり、そしてその脇に、大きなスーツケースが転がっている。それはまさしく、あの夜に女が持っていたスーツケースそのものだった。","en":"That question was answered when we opened the door to a room on the second floor. It appeared to be a bedroom, with a bed in its center and a large suitcase lying beside it. It was unmistakably the same suitcase the woman had carried that night.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r445","rowIndex":445,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それは蓋が開いた状態で、中には折りたたまれた黒いスーツがあった。これは、<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>の服だろうか？","en":"Its lid stood open, and a folded black suit lay inside. Did it belong to <tips=20>Koschei</tips>?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r446","rowIndex":446,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　結局、建物はもぬけの殻で、誰とも遭遇することはなかった。しかし、それとは別に、私たちは恐るべきものを見つけた。","en":"In the end, the building proved empty, and we encountered no one. We did, however, discover something dreadful.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r447","rowIndex":447,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　一階の、キッチンに足を踏み入れた時のことである。そこには対面式のカウンターキッチンと、楕円の天板を持つダイニングテーブル、そして壁には食器棚が並んでいた。","en":"It happened when we entered the kitchen on the ground floor. The room contained a counter separating the kitchen from the dining area, a dining table with an oval top, and cupboards lining the wall.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r448","rowIndex":448,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　見た目は清潔だったが生ゴミのような悪臭がうっすらとにおう部屋だった。電灯をつけないと薄暗い部屋で、私たちは懐中電灯で部屋のあちこちを確認していたのだが、食器棚のなかに、いくつもの白い包みが並んでいるのを見つけた。購入した食器を包みのまま仕舞ったようにも見えるが、おそらくその場にいた我々が、全く別のものを想像しただろう。そしてその想像は正しかった。","en":"Although it looked clean, the room carried a faint stench like rotting garbage. Without the electric lights it was dim, and we were examining it by flashlight when we discovered a number of white packages arranged inside a cupboard. They might have been newly purchased dishes put away without being unwrapped, but everyone present probably imagined something else entirely. That suspicion was correct.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r449","rowIndex":449,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　包みは不透明の白いシートで、その中に包まれていたものは、四角く切断された人体の一部分だった。","en":"The wrapping was an opaque white sheet. Inside lay a square-cut piece of a human body.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r450","rowIndex":450,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　包みをといた瞬間、隣の捜査員が「うっ」と呻く。マスクをしていた私にはわからなかったが、ひどい腐敗臭がしたようだ。この部屋にさっきから漂う悪臭の原因はこれらしい。","en":"The moment one of the packages was opened, the investigator beside me groaned. My mask kept me from detecting it, but the odor of decay was apparently overwhelming. This, it seemed, was the source of the stench that had hung in the room.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r451","rowIndex":451,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　食器棚の何段もの棚には、いくつもの包みが整然と並べてあり、下の棚の部分の扉を開くと、そこにも同じようにいくつもの包みがある。そして調べを進めると、カウンターキッチンの後ろ側にある冷蔵庫のなかにも、同じようなカットをされた人体が収納されていた。","en":"Packages had been arranged in orderly rows across several shelves of the cupboard. When we opened the doors covering its lower section, we found still more of the same. As the search continued, we discovered similarly cut human remains stored inside the refrigerator behind the kitchen counter.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r452","rowIndex":452,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　一体何人分の遺体なのか。","en":"How many bodies did they represent?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r453","rowIndex":453,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　黒い肌のものも、白い肌のものもあり、長く黒い髪がはりついたものもあれば、金色の短い髪のものもある。","en":"Some pieces bore dark skin, and some white. Long black hair clung to some; short blond hair to others.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r454","rowIndex":454,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　我々は今まで被害者の自宅や路上で発見された遺体を彼の主たる犯罪だと考えていたが、事件のほとんどはこの部屋で起こり、我々が見つけることが出来たのは例外的な一部分だけだったのかもしれない。","en":"Until now, we had believed that the bodies discovered at the victims’ homes or upon the street represented most of his crimes. Perhaps almost every incident had actually occurred in this room, and what we had managed to find represented only a few exceptions.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r455","rowIndex":455,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　最初は遺体を見つけるたびに小声で言葉を交わし合っていた捜査員たちは、次第に無言になってゆく。そしてその表情に精神の消耗があらわれる。","en":"At first, the investigators exchanged quiet words whenever they discovered another piece. Gradually, they fell silent, and the mental toll began to show upon their faces.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r456","rowIndex":456,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　結局、その建物の中には生きている人間は何者もいなかった。<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>も、そして、<tips=86>灰上姉妹</tips>たちも。ただ、<tips=86>灰上姉妹</tips>に関しては——或いはこの無数の肉片の中に紛れ込んでいるという可能性もある。","en":"Ultimately, there was not a single living person in the building—neither <tips=20>Koschei</tips> nor the <tips=86>Haigami sisters</tips>. As for the <tips=86>Haigami sisters</tips>... it was possible that they were mixed in among those countless pieces of flesh.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r457","rowIndex":457,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まさか」","en":"“Impossible.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"三芳","displayName":"Miyoshi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r458","rowIndex":458,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　と<tips=49>三芳</tips>は私の言葉に反応した。","en":"<tips=49>Miyoshi</tips> reacted to my words.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r459","rowIndex":459,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「共犯者を始末するというのは、用心深い犯罪者にはよくあることだろう？　まあ、それも調べればわかることだ」","en":"“It is hardly unusual for a cautious criminal to dispose of his accomplices, is it? In any case, an examination will tell us.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r460","rowIndex":460,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　すぐに待機させていた鑑識班を呼び込んで現場の調査を行う。我々はその間も建物の周囲を警戒する必要があった。<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>が戻ってこないとも限らないし、そしてこの街ではどういう妨害があるかわからない。","en":"We immediately summoned the forensic team that had been standing by and began the examination of the scene. In the meantime, we still had to keep watch around the building. <tips=20>Koschei</tips> might return, and in this city, there was no telling what interference might occur.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r461","rowIndex":461,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　警察に敵意がある<tips=16>タイプA</tips>や、<tips=17>タイプB</tips>などが、<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>などとは無関係で邪魔をしてくるという可能性もある。現場保存など望むべくもないし、このまま必要な調査はすべて行い、怪しいものは片っ端から運び出さなくてはいけない。","en":"<tips=16>Type As</tips> hostile to the police, <tips=17>Type Bs</tips>, or others might decide to obstruct us despite having no connection to <tips=20>Koschei</tips> at all. Proper preservation of the scene was beyond hope. We would have to complete every necessary examination immediately and carry away anything remotely suspicious.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r462","rowIndex":462,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　警察のトラックが、証拠品を満載して建物の前を去ってゆくのを私は見守っていた。","en":"I watched as a police truck, packed with evidence, pulled away from the building.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r463","rowIndex":463,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「これから署に戻って、集めたデータや押収品のチェックを行います。<tips=50>路地</tips>さんとは、ここで一旦別れましょう」","en":"“We’re returning to the station now to examine the data and evidence we collected. This is where we’ll part ways for the time being, Mr. <tips=50>Roji</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"三芳","displayName":"Miyoshi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r464","rowIndex":464,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　建物の前で<tips=49>三芳</tips>は私にそう言った。","en":"<tips=49>Miyoshi</tips> said this to me outside the building.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r465","rowIndex":465,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ここまで来て、それはないぜ」","en":"“You can’t cut me out now, not after I’ve come this far.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r466","rowIndex":466,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=50>路地</tips>さんの力が要りそうな押収品はありませんでしたからね。また、力を借りたくなったらご連絡します」","en":"“There were no seized items that seemed likely to require your ability, <tips=50>Mr. Roji</tips>. We'll contact you if we need your help again.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"三芳","displayName":"Miyoshi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r467","rowIndex":467,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=49>三芳</tips>は、いままで私がからかった腹いせ、というわけでもないだろうがきっぱりとそう言った。","en":"I doubted this was merely payback for all my teasing, but <tips=49>Miyoshi</tips> stated it with absolute firmness.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r468","rowIndex":468,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あくまでも、これは警察による捜査で、<tips=50>路地</tips>さんには民間人として協力していただいているだけなのです。通常捜査はこちらで行います」","en":"“This is, first and last, a police investigation. You're only assisting us as a private citizen, <tips=50>Mr. Roji</tips>. We will handle the routine investigative work ourselves.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"三芳","displayName":"Miyoshi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r469","rowIndex":469,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　あらがっても無駄のようだ。","en":"There was no point arguing.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r470","rowIndex":470,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は肩をすくめて、","en":"I shrugged and said,","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r471","rowIndex":471,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「わかった。じゃあここで帰ろう」","en":"“All right. I’ll head home, then.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r472","rowIndex":472,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私があっさりと引き下がったのに、<tips=49>三芳</tips>は若干拍子抜けした様子で、","en":"My immediate surrender seemed to take <tips=49>Miyoshi</tips> slightly aback.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r473","rowIndex":473,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……それでは、本日はありがとうございました」","en":"“...In that case, thank you for your assistance today.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"三芳","displayName":"Miyoshi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r474","rowIndex":474,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女は頭を下げ、加藤が待つ車に乗り込んだ。","en":"She bowed and climbed into the vehicle where Kato was waiting.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r475","rowIndex":475,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　車が動き出すのを待たず、私は彼らに背を向けて歩き始めた。","en":"Without waiting for it to pull away, I turned my back upon them and began to walk.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r476","rowIndex":476,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　簡単に折れたのは、何も彼らの言い分に納得したからではない。私は私で、早く彼らと別れて個別の捜査を行いたかった。","en":"I had yielded so easily not because their argument persuaded me, but because I wanted to leave them quickly and conduct an independent investigation of my own.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r477","rowIndex":477,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼らが投与してくれた中和剤の効果が、まだ消えないうちに。","en":"Before the neutralizer they had administered to me wore off.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r478","rowIndex":478,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　署で<tips=86>灰上姉妹</tips>のPCから携帯のデータに侵入したときに、その携帯機器の製造番号をこっそりメモしておいた。これがあれば、署で警察官たちに見せたようにGPSデータを閲覧するだけでなく、もっと直接的な手段を使うことも出来る。","en":"At the station, when I accessed the <tips=86>Haigami sisters</tips>’ phone data through their computer, I secretly noted down the device’s serial number. With that, I could do more than view its GPS data as I had shown the police. I could use far more direct methods.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r479","rowIndex":479,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　例えば、相手がどのような設定を行っていようと、メールを送りつけたり、通話をつなげたり、その他には過去にとった画像や録画、録音を閲覧したりすることなども出来た。","en":"For example, whatever settings the other party had chosen, I could send emails to the device or connect a call. I could also view photographs and recordings—both video and audio—that had been made in the past.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r480","rowIndex":480,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それらは私が探偵をやっていたころに身につけたもので、おそらく今でもある程度は使えるだろう。","en":"These were skills I had acquired in my days as a detective. I could probably still employ them to some degree.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r481","rowIndex":481,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は充分に建物から離れたところ、人気のない路地で、こっそりと自分の携帯端末を取り出した。","en":"Once I had put enough distance between myself and the building, I slipped into a deserted alley and secretly took out my own phone.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r482","rowIndex":482,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それを使って、まずは携帯会社のサーバーに入り込む。そこから、製造番号を使って、相手の電話への通話回線を開く。","en":"First, I used it to break into the carrier’s servers. From there, I used the serial number to open a voice connection to the target phone.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r483","rowIndex":483,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　実は、私は<tips=86>灰上姉妹</tips>の携帯電話の番号はすでに調べ上げており、自分の電話でかけてみたこともあるのだが、知らない番号からの通話をブロックしているらしく、すぐに呼び出し自体が切断された。しかし、この方法ならばどのような設定をしていようとも、相手の携帯電話に呼び出しを行うことが出来る。本来は緊急時などの特別な用途で使われることを想定したホットラインだ。","en":"In fact, I had already tracked down the <tips=86>Haigami sisters</tips>’ phone number and tried calling it from my own phone. They seemed to block calls from unknown numbers, so the call disconnected before the phone even rang. This method, however, could make their phone ring regardless of its settings. It was a hotline intended for special purposes such as emergencies.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r484","rowIndex":484,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は当日のことを何度も思い返し、<tips=86>灰上姉妹</tips>が相手なら、多少は交渉の余地があるのではないかと考えていた。","en":"I had revisited the events of that day many times and concluded that there might be some room to negotiate with the <tips=86>Haigami sisters</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r485","rowIndex":485,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　威勢はよかったが殺人にも抵抗感があるように見えたし、その場の動きも、あらゆる意味で経験の浅さが露呈している。ミュータントでも、勉強が多少出来ても、小娘である。","en":"They had talked boldly, but appeared reluctant to kill, and their actions on the scene had exposed their inexperience in every possible respect. For all that they were mutants and reasonably bright, they were still nothing more than little girls.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r486","rowIndex":486,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　どんな理由で<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>に従っているのかはわからないが、会話をすることによって、何らかのゆさぶりをかけられるだろう。そうなれば、何か動きがあるかもしれない。","en":"I did not know why they followed <tips=20>Koschei</tips>, but a conversation might allow me to unsettle them somehow. That, in turn, might provoke some action.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r487","rowIndex":487,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　多少心配だったがまだ中和剤の効果は続いているようだ。無事セキュリティをくぐりぬけ、私の携帯電話は灰上の電話へのアクセスを開始する。着信したところで相手がとらなければそれまでだが、このホットラインからの呼び出し音は、普段の着信音とは全く違った異様な音がする。サイレント設定にしていてもお構いなしだ。私の経験上、普段電話をとらないような相手でも、何度かかけ直してこの呼び出し音をお見舞いしてやると、おそるおそる出るものだ。","en":"I was a little worried, but the neutralizer still seemed to be working. I made it through the security checks without incident, and my phone began connecting to theirs. If they did not answer when it rang, that would be the end of it. But this hotline used an uncanny ringtone, nothing like an ordinary phone’s. Silent mode made no difference. In my experience, even someone who normally refused to answer would pick up warily after several calls had subjected them to that sound.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r488","rowIndex":488,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私の携帯電話のスピーカーから、ポンという電子音が聞こえた。これが、接続に成功した合図だ。","en":"A soft electronic chime came from my telephone’s speaker, signaling a successful connection.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r489","rowIndex":489,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私が生唾を飲んだ瞬間、ビーというブザーの様な音が、私の頭の後ろから起こった。","en":"The instant I swallowed hard, a buzzer sounded behind my head.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r490","rowIndex":490,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そのけたたましいブザーの音こそが、まさにホットラインからの呼び出し音なのだ。","en":"That deafening buzz was precisely the ringing tone of a call from the hotline.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r491","rowIndex":491,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私ははっと振り返る。","en":"I spun around.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r492","rowIndex":492,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私が背をもたれていた塀の向こうの屋根の上に、夕暮れを浴びた二つの人影があった。","en":"On the roof beyond the wall I had been leaning against stood two figures bathed in the evening light.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r493","rowIndex":493,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それらは、全く同じ姿形をした少女——<tips=86>灰上姉妹</tips>である。","en":"They were girls identical in every feature—the <tips=86>Haigami sisters</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r494","rowIndex":494,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ど、どういうこと？」","en":"“W-what’s going on?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"灰上江梨子","displayName":"Eriko Haigami","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r495","rowIndex":495,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　姉妹の片方が、懐からブザーが鳴り続ける携帯電話をとりだし、画面を見る。","en":"One sister pulled the still-buzzing mobile telephone from inside her clothing and looked at its screen.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r496","rowIndex":496,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私を監視していたというのか？","en":"Had they been watching me?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r497","rowIndex":497,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　こちらの方も突然の出現に取り乱しかけたが、慌てるわけにはいかない。この状況で、話し合いを始めるというわけにもいかないだろう。勢揃いしている<tips=86>双子</tips>と、この距離で向かい合って話しあうのはあまりにも危険だ。","en":"Their sudden appearance nearly threw me too, but I could not afford to panic. There was no way to start a conversation under these circumstances, either. Facing both <tips=86>twins</tips> at once and trying to talk at this distance was far too dangerous.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r498","rowIndex":498,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ジャケットの懐に手を突っ込み、銃を抜いた。そして携帯に驚いている方の少女に照準をあわせる。","en":"I thrust a hand inside my jacket, drew the gun, and aimed at the girl distracted by the telephone.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r499","rowIndex":499,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　あれが姉だか妹だかはわからないが、一人殺しても、もう一人残っていれば情報を聞き出すには十分だ。","en":"I could not tell whether she was the older or younger sister, but even if I killed one, the other would still be enough to get the information I needed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r500","rowIndex":500,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして発砲したが、銃口から轟音が鳴り響いたその瞬間、狙って居なかった方の少女が、携帯を持っている少女の服を掴んで頭を下げさせる。","en":"I fired. At the instant the muzzle erupted in a roar, the girl I had not targeted caught hold of the other’s clothing and pulled her head down.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r501","rowIndex":501,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　銃口は確かに少女の頭を向いていたはずだが、それより早く少女たちの身体は照準の先から消えていた。","en":"The muzzle had certainly been aimed at the girl’s head, but the sisters moved out of its line before the shot could catch them.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r502","rowIndex":502,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　この動きの素早さからすると、携帯の持ち主でない方が妹で<tips=17>タイプB</tips>の<tips=12>江梨子</tips>だったのだろう。そして携帯に慌てていたのが姉でサイキックの<tips=11>璃映子</tips>。もし逆だったら、一人ここでやれていたかもしれない。","en":"Judging by that speed, the sister without the telephone must have been the younger one, the <tips=17>Type B</tips> <tips=12>Eriko</tips>. The one flustered by the telephone must have been the elder sister, the psychic <tips=11>Rieko</tips>. Had their positions been reversed, I might have taken one of them down then and there.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r503","rowIndex":503,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　悔やんで居ても仕方がない。","en":"No use dwelling on it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r504","rowIndex":504,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　相手は屋根から飛び降りたのか、姿を完全に消している。","en":"Perhaps they had jumped down from the roof; both had disappeared completely.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r505","rowIndex":505,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私を追っていたのか？　どこからついてきた？　あの建物からか？　襲撃のチャンスを窺っていたのだろうか？","en":"Had they been following me? From where? From that building? Had they been waiting for an opportunity to attack?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r506","rowIndex":506,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　いずれにしろ、このタイミングで携帯電話を鳴らして、気づくことが出来たのはラッキーだ。","en":"Whatever the answer, I was fortunate that the telephone had rung when it did and alerted me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r507","rowIndex":507,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は路上に取り落としてしまった自分の携帯電話を拾って、<tips=57>滑走路通り</tips>の方へ向かって駆け出した。","en":"I retrieved my own telephone, which I had dropped in the street, and ran toward <tips=57>Runway Street</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r508","rowIndex":508,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　銃を持っているとは言え、このまま二人とやりあうのは得策ではない。が、ただせっかく遭遇出来たのに、ただ逃げるのも意味がない。","en":"Even with a gun, attempting to fight both of them here would be unwise. Yet having encountered them at last, simply fleeing would accomplish nothing.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r509","rowIndex":509,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は角を折れたところに、停車したままの軽トラックを見つけ、そのドアを開けて運転室の足元に隠れた。そして、ハンドルを手動でくるくると回して窓を開ける。","en":"Once around the corner, I found an unattended light truck, opened the door, and hid on the floor of the cab. Then I cranked the window down by hand.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r510","rowIndex":510,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　少女たちがどういうつもりで私を尾行していたのかはわからない。しかし、私に対して用があったのならば追いかけてくる可能性はある。","en":"I did not know why the girls had been following me. If they wanted something from me, however, they might pursue me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r511","rowIndex":511,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そこを待ち伏せして、有利をとる。","en":"I would ambush them and seize the advantage.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r512","rowIndex":512,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　呼吸を整え、車内のミラーの角度を調節して路上を見張れるようにし、耳を澄ませる。最初に窓を開けたのは音を聞くのと、咄嗟に銃口を出せるようにだ。","en":"I steadied my breathing, adjusted a mirror inside the cab so that I could watch the street, and listened. I had lowered the window both to hear them and to thrust the gun barrel through it at a moment’s notice.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r513","rowIndex":513,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　すると、すぐにタタタと乾いた足音が聞こえて来る。","en":"Almost immediately, I heard the dry patter of footsteps.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r514","rowIndex":514,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は身をさらに沈めて大きな身体を縮めて隠す。足音は近くに来て止まる。音の位置は少し高い。塀の上でも走って来たのだろうか？","en":"I sank lower, hunching my large body out of sight. The footsteps drew close, then stopped. They sounded slightly above me. Had she come running along the top of the wall?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r515","rowIndex":515,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しかし、なんて早いのだろう。トラックに身を潜めてすぐのタイミングだった。塀の向こうに落ちたはずなのに、こんなに早く追いつけるものなのか。迎え撃つ気になって隠れていなければ、結局追いつかれていただろう。走っているところを、後ろから発見されたとしたら最悪の捕まり方だ。","en":"But how could anyone be so fast? I had only just hidden inside the truck. She must have dropped beyond the wall, yet she had already caught up with me. Had I not chosen to hide and fight back, she would have overtaken me in the end. Nothing could have been worse than letting her discover me from behind while I ran.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r516","rowIndex":516,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　この早さからすると<tips=17>タイプB</tips>の<tips=12>江梨子</tips>だろう。姉の方は置いてきたのだろうか？","en":"Judging by that speed, it had to be the <tips=17>Type B</tips>, <tips=12>Eriko</tips>. Had she left her elder sister behind?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r517","rowIndex":517,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　妹との一対一なら、まだなんとかなりそうだ。出来れば姉が追いつく前に彼女を始末したい。","en":"If it was just me against the younger sister, I might still have a chance. If possible, I wanted to take her out before the elder one caught up.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r518","rowIndex":518,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　バックミラーには道路の中央が映っている。その鏡の中の狭い視野で警戒していると、上方から人が降ってきて、路上に降り立つ。","en":"The rearview mirror reflected the center of the road. As I kept watch through its narrow field of view, a person dropped from above and landed in the street.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r519","rowIndex":519,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=12>灰上江梨子</tips>だ。","en":"It was <tips=12>Eriko Haigami</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r520","rowIndex":520,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　やはりあいつが追って来たのだ。","en":"Just as I thought, she had come after me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r521","rowIndex":521,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　キョロキョロと辺りを見回している。角を折れてすぐに姿を消したから、このあたりに隠れているのはバレバレだ。","en":"Her eyes darted around. I had disappeared as soon as I turned the corner, so it was obvious I had to be hiding somewhere nearby.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r522","rowIndex":522,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しかし、<tips=9>Y地区</tips>の裏路地はどこもそうだが雑然としていて、身を隠す場所は多い。相手はすぐに、こちらの居場所を特定することが出来ないようだった。すっかり金色になった瞳で辺りを見回している。","en":"Like all the back alleys in <tips=9>Y District</tips>, this one was a cluttered mess with plenty of places to hide. She did not seem able to pinpoint me right away. Her eyes, now completely golden, swept the area.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r523","rowIndex":523,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しかし、こちらが銃を持っているのを知っているくせにいい度胸だ。","en":"Still, she had guts, knowing I had a gun.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r524","rowIndex":524,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　さきほどこちらが発砲したのに対する反応速度を見ると、よほど素早く動けるのだろう。相手からすれば、私の動きなどスローモーションのようなものなのかもしれない。","en":"Judging by how quickly she had reacted when I fired earlier, she must have been incredibly fast. Maybe, from her perspective, I moved in slow motion.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r525","rowIndex":525,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　とは言え、音速に近い速度で発射される弾丸より早くは動けないはずだ。","en":"Even so, she could not possibly move faster than a bullet traveling near the speed of sound.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r526","rowIndex":526,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は躊躇しなかった。<tips=12>江梨子</tips>が向こうを向いた瞬間、起き上がって窓から彼女の背中に発砲した。","en":"I did not hesitate. The instant <tips=12>Eriko</tips> turned her back, I rose and fired through the window at her.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r527","rowIndex":527,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=12>江梨子</tips>は想定よりもさらに素早かった。私が起き上がった物音に反応して、ぴょんと跳躍したのだ。引き金をひいた瞬間に、私はその銃口の先に既に相手がいないのを悟っていた。","en":"<tips=12>Eriko</tips> was even faster than I had anticipated. She reacted to the sound of me rising and sprang into the air. The instant I pulled the trigger, I knew she was already out of my sights.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r528","rowIndex":528,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　軽く飛んだように見えたが、相手の身体は一瞬で三メートルほど上昇している。私は空中の彼女に二発撃ったが、いずれも命中しなかった。","en":"The jump had looked effortless, yet her body rose approximately three meters in an instant. I fired twice at her in midair. Neither shot struck.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r529","rowIndex":529,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女は空中で身体を捻り、チラとこちらの方を見た。間違いない。居場所がバレた。","en":"She twisted in the air and cast a quick glance toward me. There could be no doubt: she had found me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r530","rowIndex":530,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私はすぐにエンジンを作動させた。キーは刺さっていなかったが、私にとっては関係のない話だ。軽トラックを選んだのは、こうやってすぐに逃げるためでもある。","en":"I started the engine at once. There was no key in the ignition, but that meant nothing to me. I had chosen the light truck partly so I could make a quick escape like this.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r531","rowIndex":531,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　エンジンの作動する音を確認するやいなや、アクセルを踏み込んで出発する。","en":"The moment I heard the engine catch, I floored the accelerator and took off.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r532","rowIndex":532,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　走り出してすぐ、バンと音がして、運転席の窓のヘリを白くて細い四本指が掴むのが見えた。","en":"Almost at once, something struck the vehicle with a bang, and four slender white fingers gripped the edge of the driver’s window.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r533","rowIndex":533,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=12>江梨子</tips>が追いついたのだ。","en":"<tips=12>Eriko</tips> had caught up.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r534","rowIndex":534,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私はこれは想定済みで、あらかじめ構えていた銃で、窓から覗こうとする彼女の頭に発砲した。","en":"I had expected this. The gun was already waiting in my hand, and I fired at her head as she tried to peer through the window.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r535","rowIndex":535,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　今度は確実にとらえたつもりだったのだが、彼女の頭が弾丸で吹き飛ぶ場面を見ることは出来なかった。避けたのだ。","en":"This time, I was sure I had her, but I never saw the bullet blow her head apart. She had dodged it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r536","rowIndex":536,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　手を放したのかと、サイドミラーで背後の道路を確認するが何もない。","en":"Wondering whether she had released her grip, I checked the road behind me through the side mirror. There was nothing there.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r537","rowIndex":537,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　道路に落ちたのではない、ということは——。","en":"She had not fallen onto the road. Which meant—","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r538","rowIndex":538,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私がその可能性を思い付いたのとほとんど同じ瞬間、反対側の助手席の窓から何かが飛び込んで来た。","en":"Almost the instant that possibility occurred to me, something hurtled in through the passenger-side window.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r539","rowIndex":539,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それは<tips=12>灰上江梨子</tips>だった。","en":"It was <tips=12>Eriko Haigami</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r540","rowIndex":540,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　運転席の屋根の上か、後ろの荷台の方か、どちらからか回り込んで来たのだ。","en":"She must have circled around from above the cab or across the cargo bed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r541","rowIndex":541,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私はとっさに銃を構えるが、間に合わない。<tips=12>江梨子</tips>が銃を握った腕を無表情で捻り上げる。肘と手首からボキリと、鈍いいやな音がする。","en":"I raised the gun instinctively, but not in time. <tips=12>Eriko</tips> seized the arm holding it and twisted without expression. Dull, sickening cracks came from my elbow and wrist.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r542","rowIndex":542,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女はそのまま私を運転席側のドアに押さえつける。","en":"She kept hold of me and pinned me against the driver’s door.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r543","rowIndex":543,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は掴まれていない方の手を身体の後ろに回し、ドアを開ける。私たちはもつれるようにして路上に放り出される。","en":"With my free hand, I reached behind me and opened the door. We tumbled out into the street in a tangle.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r544","rowIndex":544,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　走り出したばかりの軽トラックが塀に激突するのをよそに、勢いをつけて舗装のはげかけたアスファルトの上に投げ出された私はゴロゴロと回転する。","en":"The light truck, which had only just begun to move, crashed into a wall behind us. I was flung hard onto the peeling asphalt and rolled over and over.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r545","rowIndex":545,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「くそっ……」","en":"“Damn...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r546","rowIndex":546,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　無理矢理地面を蹴飛ばして、どうにか身体を起こすと、むこうに<tips=12>江梨子</tips>が立っているのが見えた。","en":"I kicked hard against the ground and somehow forced myself upright. Over there stood <tips=12>Eriko</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r547","rowIndex":547,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女は車から放り出された瞬間に私から離れ、うまく地面に着地したのだろう。それだけでなく、身体のあちこちが痛むのは、落下の時にどこかを怪我したのかもしれない。","en":"She must have broken away from me the instant we fell from the vehicle and landed cleanly. Meanwhile, my body hurt all over. I must have injured something in the fall.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r548","rowIndex":548,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　一方、相手は汗一つかかずすまし顔で私を見ている。","en":"She, on the other hand, watched me without breaking a sweat, her face perfectly calm.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r549","rowIndex":549,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「おれを殺すつもりなのか？」","en":"“Are you planning to kill me?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r550","rowIndex":550,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私はふらつく足で立ち上がりながら、<tips=12>江梨子</tips>を睨み付けた。その視界の端で、彼女に折られた右腕がぷらぷらと揺れている。","en":"I struggled to my unsteady feet and glared at <tips=12>Eriko</tips>. At the edge of my vision, the right arm she had broken swung loosely.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r551","rowIndex":551,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「先に銃を撃ったのはあなただよ」","en":"“You were the one who fired first.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"灰上江梨子","displayName":"Eriko Haigami","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r552","rowIndex":552,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=12>江梨子</tips>は緊張を押し殺すような声でそう言った。","en":"<tips=12>Eriko’s</tips> voice was tight, as though she were suppressing her tension.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r553","rowIndex":553,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　さっと視線を周囲に走らせるが、落とした銃は見つからない。片腕が動かず、拳銃もないまま、これほどの身体能力の<tips=17>タイプB</tips>とやりあえるだろうか？　姉の能力も恐るべきものだが、妹の<tips=17>タイプB</tips>としての身体能力も、非常に高いレベルなのだ。","en":"My gaze darted around, but I could not find the gun I had dropped. With one arm useless and no pistol, could I take on a <tips=17>Type B</tips> with physical abilities like hers? Her elder sister’s power was terrifying, but the younger sister’s abilities as a <tips=17>Type B</tips> were extraordinarily strong too.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r554","rowIndex":554,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　逃げるにしても、生身の脚力では到底かなわない上に、トラックは壁に激突してしまっている。あれを使うには、よほど時間を稼がなくてはならない。","en":"Even if I fled, I stood no chance against her on foot, and the truck had crashed into the wall. I would have to buy a great deal of time before I could use it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r555","rowIndex":555,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それを言うなら、先に私の友人たちを殺したのはお前たちだ。いつつ……」","en":"“If that’s your argument, you killed my friends first. Ow...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r556","rowIndex":556,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は痛む腰をさするような演技をしながら、左手でズボンの尻ポケットを探り、そこに折りたたみ式のナイフが入っているのを確認した。こんなものがどれだけの役に立つのかはわからないが、ないよりはマシだろう。ポケットのなかで折れていた刃を元の形に戻して準備する。しかし、取り出すのはギリギリになってからだ。先に取り出せば、暴力行為にあまり慣れているとは言えない相手を無用に刺激するだけだろう。","en":"Pretending to rub my aching back, I felt inside the rear pocket of my trousers with my left hand and confirmed that the folding knife remained there. I did not know how useful such a thing could be, but it was better than nothing. Inside the pocket, I unfolded the blade and made it ready. I would not draw it until the last possible moment. Producing it early would only provoke an opponent who did not appear particularly accustomed to violence.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r557","rowIndex":557,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　今日彼女たちが尾行をしていたのは、おそらく、私を監視して、捜査状況などを把握しようとしていたのではないだろうか。追われる身となった彼女たちは、何より<tips=16>タイプA</tips>であり街の事情に詳しい私が気になって仕方なく、危険を冒して観察していたのだ。少なくとも、襲撃が目的ではなかったはずだ。それならば、そのチャンスは沢山あった。","en":"The sisters had probably followed me today to keep watch and find out how the investigation was going. Now that they were fugitives, they could hardly ignore someone like me—a <tips=16>Type A</tips> who knew the city inside and out—and had risked observing me. At the very least, they could not have come here intending to attack me. If they had, they would have had plenty of chances.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r558","rowIndex":558,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　いや、もし襲撃するつもりだったにしても、なかなか踏ん切りがつかなかったのかもしれない。","en":"No—perhaps they had intended an attack, but could not quite bring themselves to commit to it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r559","rowIndex":559,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　どちらにしろ、彼女たちはまだ<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>のような『向こう側の世界』の人間にはなっていないということだ。","en":"Either way, they had not yet crossed over to ‘the other side’ and become people like <tips=20>Koschei</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r560","rowIndex":560,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ここでおれを殺しても意味がないぞ」","en":"“There’s no point in killing me here.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r561","rowIndex":561,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　腕が折れ、何もしなくてもふらついている私を目の前に、言葉とは裏腹になかなか攻撃に移れないでいる金色の目の少女に向かってそう言った。","en":"I addressed the golden-eyed girl who, for all her words, still hesitated to attack a swaying man with one broken arm.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r562","rowIndex":562,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「警察は情報を掴んでいる。いくらでも素性を誤魔化せる<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>はともかく、お前たちはこの先どこへも逃げられない。元々警察の監視対象だったから、多くの情報を掴まれているしな。捕まるのは時間の問題だ。ここで私を殺そうと、殺すまいとな」","en":"“The police know who they’re dealing with now. <tips=20>Koschei</tips> can disguise his identity any number of ways, but you two have nowhere left to run. You were already under surveillance, so the police have plenty of information on you. It’s only a matter of time before they catch you, whether you kill me here or not.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r563","rowIndex":563,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そんなことは、どうでもいいよ」","en":"“I don’t care about any of that.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"灰上江梨子","displayName":"Eriko Haigami","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r564","rowIndex":564,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　少女は吐き捨てるように言う。","en":"The girl spat the words.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r565","rowIndex":565,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あなたが邪魔をするなら、あなたを殺す。それだけだよ」","en":"“If you stand in our way, I’ll kill you. That’s all.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"灰上江梨子","displayName":"Eriko Haigami","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r566","rowIndex":566,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　少女はそして、足元に落ちていた瓦礫を拾い上げる。トラックがブロック塀と接触したときに出来たものだろう。さすがに素手で殺人を犯すのには抵抗があるということか。","en":"She picked up a piece of rubble lying at her feet, probably broken loose when the truck struck the concrete-block wall. Did even she have some aversion to killing with her bare hands?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r567","rowIndex":567,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「私はお前たちには用がない。私が憎んでいるのはあのイカレた人殺しだ。お前たちが共犯者であり続けるのなら、お前たちも敵だが、そうでないのなら興味はない。手を引け。お前たちはまだギリギリ引き返せるはずだ」","en":"“I have nothing against you. It’s that deranged killer I hate. If you keep helping him, you’re my enemies too. If you don’t, I couldn’t care less about you. Walk away. You should still be able to turn back—just barely.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r568","rowIndex":568,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ゆっくり近づいてくる少女を、私はナイフの場所を意識しながら待ち受けた。","en":"Keeping the knife in my pocket firmly in mind, I waited as the girl slowly approached.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r569","rowIndex":569,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「引き返す？　私たちに引き返す場所なんかないんだよ。そんな場所とっくの昔になくなった」","en":"“Turn back? We have nowhere to go back to. Any place like that disappeared a long, long time ago.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"灰上江梨子","displayName":"Eriko Haigami","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r570","rowIndex":570,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あの人殺しがどんな甘言を弄したのか知らんが、おまえたちは騙されているだけだ。<tips=13>ヘドロ団地</tips>で育ったんだろう？　それが理解出来ないほどうぶでもあるまい」","en":"“I don’t know what pretty lies that murderer fed you, but he’s only using you. You grew up in the <tips=13>Sludge Housing Complex</tips>, didn’t you? You can’t be naive enough not to see that.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r571","rowIndex":571,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しかし<tips=12>江梨子</tips>はもう私と話すつもりはないようだった。","en":"<tips=12>Eriko</tips>, however, no longer appeared willing to speak with me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r572","rowIndex":572,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……動かないで。苦しまないようにしてあげる」","en":"“...Don’t move. I’ll make sure you don’t suffer.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"灰上江梨子","displayName":"Eriko Haigami","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r573","rowIndex":573,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　アスファルトを蹴り、一直線に突進してくる。","en":"She kicked off the asphalt and charged straight toward me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r574","rowIndex":574,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私はナイフを抜き取った。しかし、相手の動きが速すぎて、とても狙って切りつけることなど出来ない。無我夢中で身体の前方へ差し出す。","en":"I pulled out the knife. She was moving far too fast for me to aim a slash, so in blind desperation I simply held it out in front of me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r575","rowIndex":575,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あっ」","en":"“Ah!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"灰上江梨子","displayName":"Eriko Haigami","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r576","rowIndex":576,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　声が聞こえた瞬間彼女の身体が目の前から消える。しかしナイフを握る手には何かを切り裂いた感触があった。","en":"The moment I heard her voice, her body vanished from before me. Yet through the hand gripping the knife, I felt the blade cut something.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r577","rowIndex":577,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おそらく横へかわしたのだろう。なかば予測で視線を追わせると、脇腹を押さえて体勢を立て直そうとしている<tips=12>江梨子</tips>の姿が目に入る。","en":"She had probably dodged to the side. I sent my gaze after her, half guessing where she had gone, and spotted <tips=12>Eriko</tips> clutching her flank as she tried to regain her balance.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r578","rowIndex":578,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私はそれに向かってナイフを投げつける。","en":"I threw the knife at her.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r579","rowIndex":579,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　咄嗟の回避行動によって崩れたバランスを回復し切れていない<tips=12>江梨子</tips>は、それでも身をよじりつつ手を振ってナイフを払い落とす。しかし、その後に突進した私の身体までは避けることは出来なかった。","en":"Still off balance from her sudden dodge, <tips=12>Eriko</tips> twisted aside and swept the knife from the air with one hand. But she could not dodge me when I charged after it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r580","rowIndex":580,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私はラグビーのタックルの要領で、頭部の角を相手のみぞおち辺りにぶつけるように突っ込んだ。確かな衝撃を首に感じ、軽い彼女の身体ははじけ飛ぶ。","en":"I drove into her like a rugby tackle, aiming the horn on my head at her solar plexus. The impact jolted through my neck, and her light body went flying.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r581","rowIndex":581,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　他人より頭一つ分大きい私のタックルは、普通の成人男性なら一発で失神させるくらいの威力がある。それをバランスが崩れたところに真正面から急所に喰らっては、さすがの<tips=17>タイプB</tips>と言えどもただではすまないはずだが、失神とまではいかなかった。","en":"I was a full head bigger than most people, and my tackle packed enough force to knock an ordinary grown man unconscious in one hit. Even a <tips=17>Type B</tips> could not take that square in the solar plexus while off balance and come away unscathed. But Eriko had not passed out.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r582","rowIndex":582,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ゲホッ、ゲホッ……」","en":"“Kh—kh...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"灰上江梨子","displayName":"Eriko Haigami","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r583","rowIndex":583,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　尻餅をつく<tips=12>江梨子</tips>は苦悶の表情で咳き込む。","en":"<tips=12>Eriko</tips> landed hard on her backside, coughing with her face twisted in pain.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r584","rowIndex":584,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　相手が<tips=17>タイプB</tips>といえども、不意をつけば通用しないこともないのだ！　私はその間にナイフを拾い、彼女にとどめをさすべく襲い掛かった。","en":"Even against a <tips=17>Type B</tips>, a surprise attack could work! While she struggled, I snatched up the knife and rushed her to finish her off.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r585","rowIndex":585,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しかし、私が優勢なのはそこまでだった。","en":"That was as long as my advantage lasted.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r586","rowIndex":586,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私の足首に何かが絡みつくような感覚があって、転倒する。しかし、その足を見ても何も絡みついてはいない。路上にも何も落ちてはいない。","en":"It felt as though something had wrapped around my ankle, and I went down. But when I looked, there was nothing around my leg. There was nothing lying in the road, either.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r587","rowIndex":587,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　気のせいだったのだろうかと、もう一度立ち上がろうとすると、今度は横合いから細かい砂や石が降り注ぐ。","en":"Wondering whether I had imagined it, I attempted to rise again. This time, a shower of fine sand and stones struck me from the side.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r588","rowIndex":588,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「くっ……」","en":"“Ngh...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r589","rowIndex":589,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は手を上げて、目や鼻を土砂から守る。その時私の背筋が冷たくなっていた。","en":"I raised a hand to shield my eyes and nose from the debris. A chill was already running down my spine.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r590","rowIndex":590,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は、間に合わなかったのだ。","en":"I was too late.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r591","rowIndex":591,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　背後を振り返ると、そこには少女が立っていた。今まさに私が追い詰めようとした人物と、全く同じ姿をした少女……<tips=11>灰上璃映子</tips>である。","en":"When I looked behind me, a girl stood there. She was identical to the person I had just attempted to corner—<tips=11>Rieko Haigami</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r592","rowIndex":592,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　無表情に私を見つめている。","en":"She stared at me without expression.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r593","rowIndex":593,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして、周囲では<tips=16>タイプA</tips>の能力が行使されたことを告げる探知機のサイレンが鳴り響いていた。","en":"Around us, a detector siren wailed, announcing that a <tips=16>Type A</tips> ability had been used.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r594","rowIndex":594,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「おまえらは……」","en":"“You two...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r595","rowIndex":595,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は言いかけたが、<tips=11>璃映子</tips>にはすでに迷いがなかった。","en":"I began to speak, but <tips=11>Rieko</tips> no longer hesitated.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r596","rowIndex":596,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女の手元から夕日をキラリと反射するナイフが飛び出す。私は腕を上げ、手のひらを広げてそれを受け止めようとしたが、ナイフはゆるやかな曲線を描いて、私ののど元に突き刺さった。","en":"A knife sprang from her hand, flashing in the sunset. I raised an arm and spread my palm to intercept it, but the blade traced a gentle curve through the air and buried itself in my throat.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r597","rowIndex":597,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私の腕はほとんど無意識的に動きそれを引き抜こうとしたが、指先がナイフに触れる前に動きを止める。体全体から力が抜けてしまった。私の視界はぐるりと回転して空を見上げる形になり、意識は自分がゆっくりと仰向けに倒れつつあるのを認識してはいたが、どうすることも出来ずにそのままアスファルトに後頭部を打ち付けた。","en":"My arm moved almost unconsciously to pull it out, then stopped before my fingertips reached the knife. All strength left my body. My vision revolved until I was looking up at the sky. I understood that I was slowly collapsing onto my back, but could do nothing, and the back of my head struck the asphalt.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r598","rowIndex":598,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私が完全に倒れてしまうと、首元に刺さっていたナイフは見えない力によってずるりと引き抜かれる。その途端、栓が抜かれてあふれ出した血液が喉の内側の方へも流れ出し、呼吸を苦しくした。","en":"Once I lay flat, an invisible force slid the knife from my throat. The instant it came free, blood welled out as if someone had pulled a stopper. It spilled down the inside of my throat too, choking off my breath.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r599","rowIndex":599,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は残った力を振り絞って身体をねじり、<tips=11>璃映子</tips>の方を見る。彼女は私には視線をくれずに、ナイフをよく振って私の血液を振り落としていた。","en":"I wrung out what little strength I had left, twisted around, and looked toward <tips=11>Rieko</tips>. Without sparing me a glance, she gave the knife a hard flick to shake off my blood.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r600","rowIndex":600,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そいつは助からない。もう行こ」","en":"“He won’t survive. Let’s go.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"灰上璃映子","displayName":"Rieko Haigami","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r601","rowIndex":601,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女がそう呟くと、","en":"When she murmured this—","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r602","rowIndex":602,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「うん」","en":"“Okay.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"灰上江梨子","displayName":"Eriko Haigami","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r603","rowIndex":603,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私の背後で<tips=12>江梨子</tips>が答える。","en":"<tips=12>Eriko</tips> answered behind me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r604","rowIndex":604,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=12>江梨子</tips>は立ち上がって<tips=11>璃映子</tips>の側に行き、話しかける。","en":"<tips=12>Eriko</tips> stood, went to <tips=11>Rieko’s</tips> side, and spoke to her.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r605","rowIndex":605,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ごめん」","en":"“Sorry.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"灰上江梨子","displayName":"Eriko Haigami","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r606","rowIndex":606,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「大丈夫？」","en":"“Are you all right?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"灰上璃映子","displayName":"Rieko Haigami","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r607","rowIndex":607,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「平気。かすっただけだから」","en":"“I’m fine. It only grazed me.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"灰上江梨子","displayName":"Eriko Haigami","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r608","rowIndex":608,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そう」","en":"“I see.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"灰上璃映子","displayName":"Rieko Haigami","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r609","rowIndex":609,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=11>璃映子</tips>はナイフを最後にハンカチで拭って懐にしまうと、ちらりとこちらを見る。","en":"<tips=11>Rieko</tips> gave the knife one final wipe with her handkerchief, tucked it away, and glanced toward me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r610","rowIndex":610,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あ、まだこいつ生きてる」","en":"“Oh. He’s still alive.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"灰上江梨子","displayName":"Eriko Haigami","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r611","rowIndex":611,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「すごいねあんた。すごい生命力だ」","en":"“Wow. You’ve got incredible vitality.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"灰上璃映子","displayName":"Rieko Haigami","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r612","rowIndex":612,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして二人で私の顔を覗き込む。","en":"The two of them leaned over and peered down at my face.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r613","rowIndex":613,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「恋人のためにこんな頑張ってるんでしょ？　メチャクチャかっこいいじゃん」","en":"“You’re trying this hard for the woman you love, right? That’s seriously cool.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"灰上江梨子","displayName":"Eriko Haigami","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r614","rowIndex":614,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「かっこいいね。でも残念ながらあんたの旅はここで終わり」","en":"“Very cool. Too bad your journey ends here.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"灰上璃映子","displayName":"Rieko Haigami","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r615","rowIndex":615,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「先に天国で待っててね」","en":"“Wait for us in heaven, okay?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"灰上江梨子","displayName":"Eriko Haigami","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r616","rowIndex":616,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「またね」","en":"“See you.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"灰上璃映子","displayName":"Rieko Haigami","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r617","rowIndex":617,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「またね」","en":"“See you.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"灰上江梨子","displayName":"Eriko Haigami","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r618","rowIndex":618,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それだけ言うと、二人は並んで<tips=57>滑走路通り</tips>の方へ歩き出す。そしてもう二度と振り返らなかった。","en":"With that, the two walked side by side toward <tips=57>Runway Street</tips>. Neither ever looked back.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r619","rowIndex":619,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は立つことが出来ない。彼女たちを呼び止めようとした声も、ゴボゴボとした音にしかならず、口から赤い液体をあふれさせるだけだった。","en":"I could not stand. I tried to call them back, but my voice emerged only as a gurgle, sending red liquid spilling from my mouth.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r620","rowIndex":620,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は諦めて路上にごろりと横になる。","en":"I gave up and rolled onto my side in the road.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r621","rowIndex":621,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　もう立つことは出来ない。私は一生立つことはないだろう。ここでこのまま死ぬのだ。脳へ行く血管が切断されたわけではなさそうだから暫くは意識があるのかもしれないが、だからといって助かるような出血ではない。","en":"I could no longer stand. I would never stand again. I was going to die right here. The blood vessels leading to my brain did not seem to be severed, so I might remain conscious for a while. But that did not make this bleeding survivable.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r622","rowIndex":622,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　こんな場面で不思議なものだが、私は冷静に自分の状態をそう評価していた。","en":"Strange as it was under the circumstances, I found myself evaluating my condition with perfect calm.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r623","rowIndex":623,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　この雨ばかりの街で晴れた空を見ながら死ねるというのは幸運だろう。","en":"Perhaps I was lucky to die looking up at a clear sky in this city where it did nothing but rain.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r624","rowIndex":624,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そう思ってみたが、ちっとも気は晴れなかった。死ぬとわかった以上、いかなる感情からも解放されてよさそうだがそうはならなかった。私はただただ無念だった。この一生はなんだったのだろう？　ありもしないものをあると信じて死にものぐるいで探し回り、結局何も見つからなかった。そして最後は愛する人々のために何かをしてやることも出来ず、惨めに死んでしまうのか。","en":"I told myself as much, but it brought me no peace. Knowing that I would die might have released me from every emotion, yet it did not. I felt only bitter regret. What had this life amounted to? I had believed in something that never existed and searched for it with every scrap of strength, only to find nothing. Was I now to die miserably, unable in the end to do anything for the people I loved?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r625","rowIndex":625,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　どんな形でも生き延びたい。嗚呼、それは自分のための欲求ではない。ただ、死なせてしまった人々のため、その恨みを晴らすための命が欲しいのだ。これでは、死んでも死にきれない。","en":"I wanted to survive, in any form. Ah, that desire was not for my own sake. I needed my life to avenge those I had let die. I could not rest in death like this.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r626","rowIndex":626,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しかし私は、指一本動かすことさえ出来なかった。","en":"Yet I could not move so much as one finger.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r627","rowIndex":627,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　夕焼け空に浮かぶ雲がぼやけた。溢れ出る涙が温かく頬を伝った。","en":"The clouds in the sunset blurred. Warm tears spilled over and ran down my cheeks.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r628","rowIndex":628,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そうして無力のまま死を待つ私の耳に、何者かの足音が聞こえてきた。","en":"As I lay helplessly awaiting death, I heard someone’s footsteps approaching.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r629","rowIndex":629,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　警報の作動を感知した警察が来るにはまだ早い。<tips=86>双子</tips>がトドメをさすために戻って来たのだろうか。","en":"It was too soon for the police to have detected the alarm and arrived. Had the <tips=86>twins</tips> returned to finish me?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r630","rowIndex":630,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しかし、私の視界に現れたのは別の顔だった。","en":"But a different face came into view.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r631","rowIndex":631,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「酷い……」","en":"“This is awful...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐松子","displayName":"Matsuko Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r632","rowIndex":632,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　夕空を隠したその人物は、見たことのない若い女だった。","en":"The figure blocking out the evening sky was a young woman I had never seen before.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r633","rowIndex":633,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　通りがかりだろうか？　何にしろ、ここに居るのは良くない。<tips=86>双子</tips>はまだ近くにいるだろうし、場合によっては<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>もいるかもしれない。","en":"Was she just passing by? Either way, she needed to get out of here. <tips=86>The twins</tips> were probably still nearby, and <tips=20>Koschei</tips> might be too.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r634","rowIndex":634,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　早くここを離れるんだ。","en":"Get out of here. Quickly.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r635","rowIndex":635,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それを伝えたかったが、唇が少し動いただけで、言葉をつむぐことは出来なかった。","en":"I wanted to tell her, but my lips only stirred slightly and could form no words.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r636","rowIndex":636,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そのままぼんやり唇を動かし続けていると、そこに何かが押し当てられる。唇に触れるなめらかな感触は、どうやら人の皮膚のようだ。その感触は、<tips=53>ミユキ</tips>のことを思い出させた。","en":"As I went on weakly moving my lips, something pressed against them. The smooth surface touching my mouth seemed to be human skin. The sensation reminded me of <tips=53>Miyuki</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r637","rowIndex":637,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「これを、これを飲んでください！　もしかしたら、助かるかもしれないんです！」","en":"“Drink this—please, drink this! It might save you!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐松子","displayName":"Matsuko Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r638","rowIndex":638,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　女はそう言って、私の口に自分の腕を押し当てているようだった。舌で触れたその皮膚には、どうも傷があるようである。","en":"As she spoke, the woman appeared to be pressing her own arm against my mouth. When my tongue touched her skin, I felt what seemed to be a wound.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r639","rowIndex":639,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして私は、どうもこの女は、自分の血液を飲ませようとしているのだと理解した。","en":"I realized that the woman was trying to make me drink her blood.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r640","rowIndex":640,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　一体何を言っているのだろう？　気が狂っているのだろうか？","en":"What in the world was she saying? Had she lost her mind?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r641","rowIndex":641,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　取り乱し、私を見つめるその女の目は、金色に輝いている。","en":"The distraught woman stared at me, her eyes shining gold.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r642","rowIndex":642,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　発症した<tips=17>タイプＢ</tips>が、何かわけのわからない妄想に取り憑かれているのかもしれない。","en":"Perhaps she was a <tips=17>Type B</tips> who had developed symptoms and fallen into the grip of some incomprehensible delusion.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r643","rowIndex":643,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　こんなに若いのに発症しているとは気の毒なことだ。この先の人生を、人間扱いされず、苦しみながら生きることになるのだと、私はいくつもの例から知っている。","en":"It was a pity that she had developed symptoms at such a young age. From the many cases I had seen, I knew what awaited her: she would live the remainder of her life in suffering, treated as less than human.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r644","rowIndex":644,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私の薄れかけた意識はとりとめもなく、夢うつつに<tips=17>タイプＢ</tips>についての様々な思い出を浮かび上がらせた。","en":"As my consciousness faded, my thoughts drifted aimlessly through memories of all sorts of <tips=17>Type Bs</tips>, half waking and half dreaming.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r645","rowIndex":645,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　まったく、<tips=17>タイプＢ</tips>の人生ってやつは、つくづく悲惨なものだ。","en":"A <tips=17>Type B’s</tips> life really was a miserable thing.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E4:r646","rowIndex":646,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私はそんなことを考えながら、意識を失った。","en":"With that thought, I lost consciousness.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}}]},{"position":31,"code":"X4","unitId":"X4","rows":[{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X4:r1","rowIndex":1,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その頃、およそ<tips=9>Y地区</tips>には満たすことの出来ない欲望というものは存在しなかった。","en":"In those days, there was virtually no desire that could not be satisfied in <tips=9>Y District</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X4:r2","rowIndex":2,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　例えば、世界中の麻薬や覚醒剤の味比べをすることも出来たし、あるいは、美しく若い女とベッドを共にすることも出来たし、さらにその女を殺してみたければそれさえも可能だった。","en":"For example, one could sample and compare narcotics and stimulants from around the world, share a bed with a beautiful young woman, and, if one then wished to try killing her, even that could be arranged.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X4:r3","rowIndex":3,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　他にも、思いつく限りの残虐な、あるいは豪華絢爛な欲望を叶えることが出来たのだ。金さえあれば。","en":"Any other cruel or magnificently extravagant desire one could imagine could be fulfilled as well. So long as one had the money.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X4:r4","rowIndex":4,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして、その欲望の総本山とでも言うべき施設が、<tips=9>Y地区</tips>の外れも外れ、<tips=15>ボーダーエリア</tips>を縁取る林と隣接して建設された『<tips=18>ローズ・クラブ</tips>』であった。","en":"The <tips=18>Rose Club</tips> was the grand temple of those desires, built at the uttermost edge of <tips=9>Y District</tips> beside the woods that bordered the <tips=15>Border Area</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X4:r5","rowIndex":5,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　何でも買うことが出来る、ということはすなわち何でも売ることが出来るということでもあった。<tips=9>Y地区</tips>の貧民たちは、我が子を、我が妻を、このクラブに売った。その後どうなるかは、わかっているが想像しようとはしなかった。","en":"That anything could be bought also meant that anything could be sold. The poor of <tips=9>Y District</tips> sold their own children, their own wives, to this club. They knew what would happen afterward, but refused to imagine it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X4:r6","rowIndex":6,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　麻薬の売人たちはこぞって集まり、得意の商品を並べ立てた。警察たちには鼻薬を、それが効かぬものには脅迫が与えられた。","en":"Drug dealers flocked to the opportunity and laid out their finest wares. The police were bribed; those whom bribes could not sway were threatened.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X4:r7","rowIndex":7,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　さらに、こうした欲望装置は、単に売り買いする者たちだけによって支えられているわけではなく、合法、非合法を問わず、様々な職業の者たちが関わっている。","en":"Nor was such an apparatus of desire sustained solely by those who bought and sold. People in a great variety of professions, legal and illegal alike, participated.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X4:r8","rowIndex":8,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　調理師、清掃員、洗濯屋――そしてそのなかでも重要なのは、廃棄物処理――つまりゴミ屋であった。","en":"Cooks, cleaners, launderers—and most important among them, those who disposed of waste: the garbage men.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X4:r9","rowIndex":9,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　この施設は実に沢山のものを廃棄する。残飯などの一般的な廃棄物だけでなく、人の死体、獣の死体、使用済みの注射器など、とても通常の業者には頼むことが出来ない多くのゴミが発生する。","en":"The facility generated an extraordinary amount of waste. Along with ordinary refuse such as leftover food came human corpses, animal carcasses, used syringes, and all manner of garbage that no conventional disposal company could possibly be asked to handle.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X4:r10","rowIndex":10,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それを一手に預かっているのが、『<tips=70>シオクリーン</tips>』の<tips=54>汐健慈朗</tips>である。","en":"<tips=54>Kenjiro Shio</tips> of <tips=70>Shio Clean</tips> took sole charge of it all.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X4:r11","rowIndex":11,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　後に<tips=9>Y地区</tips>を代表する巨大企業となるこの会社は、まだ小さな個人営業の会社であった。","en":"The company that would later become one of <tips=9>Y District’s</tips> leading corporations was still a small, privately run business.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X4:r12","rowIndex":12,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=54>健慈朗</tips>もまだ若く、後に白髪だらけとなる頭髪も黒々として豊かである。","en":"<tips=54>Kenjiro</tips> himself remained young, and the hair that would later turn almost entirely white was thick and black.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X4:r13","rowIndex":13,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その日も、彼は<tips=9>Y地区</tips>特有の雨のなか、ビルの西側にあるゴミ捨て場で、廃棄物をトラックに積み込む作業を四人のアルバイトと共に行っていた。","en":"That day, in the rain so characteristic of <tips=9>Y District</tips>, he and four part-time workers were loading waste into a truck at the dumping ground west of the building.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X4:r14","rowIndex":14,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　手前のゴミ捨て場には残飯を詰めたゴミ袋がうずたかく積み上げられている。その一角には鍵のついた建物があり、鍵の掛かった扉がある。","en":"In the dumping area out front, garbage bags stuffed with leftovers were piled high. In one corner stood a building kept under lock and key.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X4:r15","rowIndex":15,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その扉の先は特別なゴミ捨て場になっていて、やはり黒く分厚いビニールに入ったゴミが積み上げられていた。","en":"Beyond that door was a special dumping room, where more waste in thick black plastic bags was piled high.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X4:r16","rowIndex":16,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　この特別室のゴミの中身は、人間の死体である。","en":"The garbage in this special room consisted of human corpses.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X4:r17","rowIndex":17,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　バラバラにされた女、青年、少年、少女、老女――ありとあらゆる年齢、性別、人種の人間たちが、客の欲望のはけ口となった結果、この湿っぽいコンクリートの部屋に運び込まれ、静かに積み上げられている。","en":"Women, young men, boys, girls, old women—people dismembered without regard to age, sex, or race—had served as outlets for the customers’ desires. Afterward, they were brought to this damp concrete room and silently piled one atop another.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X4:r18","rowIndex":18,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=54>健慈朗</tips>たちは、これを無言でトラックに積み込んでいた。先に積み込んだ残飯と分けることもなく、無造作に積み込んでゆく。","en":"<tips=54>Kenjiro</tips> and the others loaded them into the truck in silence, tossing them in carelessly without separating them from the leftovers they had loaded first.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X4:r19","rowIndex":19,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　実際のところ、彼らはすべてのゴミを一緒くたにして、<tips=8>グレートホール</tips>に投げ込んでしまっている。","en":"In truth, they mixed all the refuse together and threw it into the <tips=8>Great Hole</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X4:r20","rowIndex":20,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"『誰にも絶対に見つからないところに処分します』という彼の会社のうたい文句の正体は、これであった。","en":"That was the truth behind his company’s slogan: “We dispose of anything where absolutely no one will ever find it.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X4:r21","rowIndex":21,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　まあ、嘘ではない。誰も<tips=8>グレートホール</tips>の底には行くことが出来ないのだから。","en":"Well, it was not a lie. No one can reach the bottom of the <tips=8>Great Hole</tips>, after all.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X4:r22","rowIndex":22,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　つまり、トラックで運んで不法投棄するだけの作業なのだが、しかし、誰もが彼の真似を出来るわけではない。<tips=8>グレートホール</tips>の付近はおそろしい汚染地域で、防護服を着ていても、一歩おかしな場所に踏み込めば死を免れない。かつて研究者として<tips=8>グレートホール</tips>及びその近辺の調査を行っていた<tips=54>汐健慈朗</tips>だからこそ、安全に出来る仕事であった。","en":"In other words, the work amounted to hauling it away by truck and dumping it illegally. Yet not just anyone could imitate him. The vicinity of the <tips=8>Great Hole</tips> was a terrifyingly contaminated zone; even in protective clothing, one misstep could mean certain death. Only someone who had once surveyed the <tips=8>Great Hole</tips> and its surroundings as a researcher—<tips=54>Kenjiro Shio</tips>—could perform the job safely.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X4:r23","rowIndex":23,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「社長」","en":"“Boss.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X4:r24","rowIndex":24,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　汗を拭いながら、アルバイトの一人が言った。彼は褐色の肌と、しなやかな筋肉を持った男で、おそらく南米にルーツを持つのだろうと思われるが、本人は明らかにしていない。<tips=9>Y地区</tips>で生まれ育ったとだけ<tips=54>健慈朗</tips>は聞いている。","en":"One of the part-time workers spoke as he wiped away his sweat. He was a man with brown skin and lithe muscles, and appeared likely to have South American roots, though he had never disclosed them himself. <tips=54>Kenjiro</tips> had heard only that he was born and raised in <tips=9>Y District</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X4:r25","rowIndex":25,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「蟻みたいにせこせこ運んで捨てるより、これをネタにゆすった方が金になるんじゃないですか？」","en":"“Wouldn’t we make more money blackmailing them with this than scurrying around like ants, hauling it away and dumping it?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X4:r26","rowIndex":26,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　アルバイトは冗談のつもりで言ったようだが、","en":"The part-timer seemed to mean it as a joke, but Kenjiro replied,","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X4:r27","rowIndex":27,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「バカを言うな」","en":"“Don’t talk nonsense.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X4:r28","rowIndex":28,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=54>健慈朗</tips>は露骨に不機嫌になって首を横に振る。","en":"<tips=54>Kenjiro</tips> grew visibly annoyed and shook his head.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X4:r29","rowIndex":29,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それで一時の金を得たとしても、何になる？　我々はそれで信用を失う。信用を失えば仕事はなくなる。信用さえあればこの街が続く限りやっていけるのに、そんなことをする意味がない」","en":"“What good would a one-time windfall do? We would lose their trust. Lose their trust, and the work dries up. With their trust, we can keep doing business as long as this city lasts. There’s no point in doing something like that.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X4:r30","rowIndex":30,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　職務上知り得た情報は、どんなものであれけして口外しないというのは彼のポリシーであった。","en":"It was his policy never to divulge any information learned through his work, whatever its nature.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X4:r31","rowIndex":31,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　普段から無口で、人と打ち解けないのも、ひとつには彼のこうしたポリシーから来ているものであった。","en":"That policy was one reason he habitually said little and never opened himself to others.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X4:r32","rowIndex":32,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　いついかなる場所で、ぽろりと言ってはいけない秘密が口をついて出て来てしまうかもしれない。","en":"He never knew when or where some secret might carelessly escape his lips.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X4:r33","rowIndex":33,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=54>健慈朗</tips>のこの態度は徹底している。","en":"<tips=54>Kenjiro</tips> maintained this attitude without exception.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X4:r34","rowIndex":34,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　時によっては秘密を喋れと、裏通りのギャングたちが彼を脅迫することもあったが、常に無視をしてきた。それによってひどい拷問を受け、その後遺症が今も残っている。彼はその時でも一言も口をきかず、懇意にしている別のギャングが救出に来なければ、黙ったまま死んでいただろうと噂されている。","en":"At times, backstreet gangs threatened him and demanded that he reveal their secrets, but he always ignored them. He had been brutally tortured for it, and still lived with the damage. Rumor had it that even then he never said a word, and would have died in silence if another gang he was close to had not come to his rescue.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X4:r35","rowIndex":35,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼は常に無口で、そして無表情であり、世間は彼を感情のない人物のように思っていた。","en":"He was invariably taciturn and expressionless, and the public regarded him as a man without feeling.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X4:r36","rowIndex":36,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　共に働くアルバイトたちも、もしかしたらそのような印象を持っていたかもしれない。","en":"Perhaps the part-time workers beside him held the same impression.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X4:r37","rowIndex":37,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しかし、実際はそういったパブリック・イメージとは違う一面も、彼は持ち合わせていた。","en":"In truth, however, he had another side that did not fit that public image.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X4:r38","rowIndex":38,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　元科学者でありながら、彼は信心深かった。人間の遺体を処分したときは、仲間たちを先に行かせると、こっそり念仏を唱えた。そのための数珠をつねにポケットに入れて持ち歩いている。","en":"Despite being a former scientist, he was deeply religious. Whenever he disposed of human remains, he sent his companions ahead and quietly chanted a Buddhist invocation. He always carried prayer beads in his pocket for that purpose.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X4:r39","rowIndex":39,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その日も、<tips=8>グレートホール</tips>の縁までやって来た彼は、作業を終えるとアルバイトたちを先に車に戻し、数珠を取り出した。","en":"That day, after reaching the rim of the <tips=8>Great Hole</tips> and completing the work, he sent the part-time workers back to the vehicle first and took out his beads.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X4:r40","rowIndex":40,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　降りしきる雨が彼の作業着を濡らすが、気にもとめない。","en":"The driving rain soaked his work clothes, but he paid it no attention.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X4:r41","rowIndex":41,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして、幼い頃に祖母に教わった般若心経を唱えようとしたところで、ふと、気がついた。","en":"He was about to recite the Heart Sutra his grandmother had taught him as a child when something caught his attention.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X4:r42","rowIndex":42,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=8>グレートホール</tips>に落とし忘れた黒袋が一つ残っている。","en":"One black bag remained, forgotten before it could be dropped into the <tips=8>Great Hole</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X4:r43","rowIndex":43,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それに手をかけたところで、中でカサカサと音がする。","en":"As he reached for it, something rustled inside.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X4:r44","rowIndex":44,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　虫か？","en":"An insect?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X4:r45","rowIndex":45,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=54>健慈朗</tips>は無性に気になった。<tips=18>ローズ・クラブ</tips>の連中は、ゴミの管理が行き届いていて、袋の中に虫が入り込んでいることなど、これまで一度もなかったからである。","en":"The thought nagged at <tips=54>Kenjiro</tips>. The people at the <tips=18>Rose Club</tips> managed their refuse meticulously, and never once before had an insect made its way into one of the bags.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X4:r46","rowIndex":46,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　気になって、ふと、軍手をはめたままの手でカッターナイフを取り出し、袋のその辺りに切れ目を入れた。","en":"Unable to dismiss it, he drew a utility knife while still wearing his work gloves and cut the bag near the source of the sound.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X4:r47","rowIndex":47,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　鼻をつく悪臭に顔を顰めながら、中を確認する。","en":"The stench assaulted his nose. He grimaced and looked inside.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X4:r48","rowIndex":48,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　人の頭髪だの、臓物だの、グロテスクな廃棄物がどろりと切れ目から流れ出る。そして、それに混じって、妙に小さな手足があった。棒きれでさらにかき回すと、胴体や頭部と思われるパーツも見つかる。","en":"Human hair, viscera, and other grotesque waste oozed from the slit in a viscous mass. Mixed among it were strangely small arms and legs. When he stirred the contents further with a stick, he found what seemed to be parts of a torso and head as well.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X4:r49","rowIndex":49,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　頭のなかでパーツをつなぎ合わせてみると、どうも、幼女のバラバラ死体であるようだ。","en":"When he pieced the parts together in his mind, they seemed to belong to the dismembered corpse of a little girl.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X4:r50","rowIndex":50,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　顔が真ん中で真っ二つに切断され、さらに横に三つに切断されている。眼球はまぶたが閉じずに丸く剥いている。","en":"Her face had been split in two down the middle, then sliced crosswise into thirds. Her eyelids could no longer close, leaving her eyes bulging wide.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X4:r51","rowIndex":51,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　死体を見慣れた<tips=54>健慈朗</tips>もさすがに言葉を失った。","en":"Even <tips=54>Kenjiro</tips>, accustomed though he was to corpses, was struck speechless.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X4:r52","rowIndex":52,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして、その、幼児の死体の真ん中に、カサカサと音を立てていたものの正体を発見したのである。","en":"And there, amid the child’s remains, he discovered the source of the rustling sound.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X4:r53","rowIndex":53,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　思った通り虫ではなかった。","en":"Just as he had suspected, it was not an insect.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X4:r54","rowIndex":54,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しかし、それでは何かと言われても、<tips=54>健慈朗</tips>は即答することが出来ない。形状はアメーバに似ているだろう。しかし、これほど大きなものは見たことがない。むしろナメクジと言った方が近いかもしれない。","en":"But if asked what it was, <tips=54>Kenjiro</tips> could not answer immediately. It was shaped somewhat like an amoeba, though he had never seen one this large. Perhaps a slug was the closer comparison.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X4:r55","rowIndex":55,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　親指ほどの大きさの、ピンク色の塊が、のびたり縮んだりしているのだ。","en":"A pink mass about the size of his thumb was stretching and contracting.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X4:r56","rowIndex":56,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なんだこれは？」","en":"“What is this?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X4:r57","rowIndex":57,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼は感染を恐れ、ポケットから予備のビニール袋を取り出すと、それをハンカチ代わりにして肉片を包みとった。","en":"Fearing infection, he took a spare plastic bag from his pocket and used it like a handkerchief to wrap up and pick up the piece of flesh.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X4:r58","rowIndex":58,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして、雨の上で広げ、観察する。","en":"He opened the bag out beneath the rain and examined it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X4:r59","rowIndex":59,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「生きているのか？」","en":"“Is it alive?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X4:r60","rowIndex":60,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それは雨に打たれながらも、活発に身体を動かしている。これが生命でないとすれば、他の何なのだろう？　機械仕掛けにはとても見えない。しかし、<tips=54>健慈朗</tips>はこのような生物を見たことがなかった。","en":"Even as the rain struck it, the thing moved its body vigorously. If this was not life, what else could it be? It certainly did not look mechanical. Yet <tips=54>Kenjiro</tips> had never seen such an organism.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X4:r61","rowIndex":61,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=18>ローズ・クラブ</tips>は、一体何をしているんだ……」","en":"“What in the world is the <tips=18>Rose Club</tips> doing...?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X4:r62","rowIndex":62,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　この得体の知れない娯楽施設へのおぞましい感情は、すぐに元生物学者としての好奇心に打ち消された。","en":"His horror at this inscrutable entertainment complex was quickly eclipsed by the curiosity of the biologist he had once been.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X4:r63","rowIndex":63,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　この肉片の正体を知りたくてたまらない。彼はそのままそれをビニール袋に包み、ポケットにしまう。そして、残りのゴミを<tips=8>グレートホール</tips>に蹴落とし、般若心経をボソボソと口にする。","en":"He was consumed by the need to know what the piece of flesh was. He kept it wrapped in the plastic bag and slipped it into his pocket. Then he kicked the rest of the refuse into the <tips=8>Great Hole</tips> and muttered the Heart Sutra under his breath.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X4:r64","rowIndex":64,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「遅かったですね。何かあったんですか？」","en":"“You took a while. Did something happen?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X4:r65","rowIndex":65,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　何食わぬ顔をして車に戻ると、アルバイトがそう答えた。","en":"When he returned to the vehicle as though nothing had happened, one of the part-time workers asked him.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X4:r66","rowIndex":66,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「別に。念仏を途中でとちったから、最初からやりなおしただけだ」","en":"“Nothing. I stumbled over the chant midway through, so I started again from the beginning.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X4:r67","rowIndex":67,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　特に理由はなかったが、彼は今そこで奇妙な肉片を拾ったことは隠した。","en":"He had no particular reason, but concealed the fact that he had picked up a strange piece of flesh.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X4:r68","rowIndex":68,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「信心深いことで」","en":"“Such devotion.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X4:r69","rowIndex":69,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　何も知らずにアルバイトは笑う。","en":"Knowing nothing, the part-time worker laughed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X4:r70","rowIndex":70,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=54>汐健慈朗</tips>の自宅には広い地下室があり、そこには生物の実験のための器具が所狭しと並べられている。","en":"The home of <tips=54>Kenjiro Shio</tips> had a spacious basement, every inch of it crowded with equipment for biological experiments.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X4:r71","rowIndex":71,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　最近汚れ仕事が増えてきた彼にとって、ここで秘密の実験を行うのが彼のささやかな心の癒やしであった。","en":"As more of his recent work became dirty work, conducting secret experiments here offered him one small solace.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X4:r72","rowIndex":72,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　普段は<tips=8>グレートホール</tips>周辺でよく見つかる畸形の動物を対象にするのだが、今日は例のゴミ箱から拾った肉片を使う。","en":"His ordinary subjects were deformed animals commonly found around the <tips=8>Great Hole</tips>. Today, however, he used the piece of flesh recovered from the refuse.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X4:r73","rowIndex":73,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　持ち帰ってなおそれは活発に動いており、表面を洗浄すると、くすぐったそうにクネクネと動いた。","en":"It continued moving vigorously even after he brought it home. When he cleaned its surface, it writhed as though tickled.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X4:r74","rowIndex":74,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それをシャーレに閉じ込め、勝手に飛び出さないよう蓋の上に辞書を置いてから、彼はパソコンに向かってデータベースを漁り、似たような生物についての報告がないか調べた。","en":"He confined it inside a petri dish and placed a dictionary upon the lid to keep it from escaping. Then he turned to his computer, searched through databases, and looked for any report of a similar organism.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X4:r75","rowIndex":75,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しかし、それらしいものは見つからない。探し方が悪いのか、未確認の生物なのか。","en":"He found nothing that seemed to match. Was he searching the wrong way, or was this an unknown organism?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X4:r76","rowIndex":76,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　実験室にある装置のうち、対象に影響をあたえずに検査出来る物を使用して解明を試みるが、はっきりしたことは分からない。","en":"He attempted to learn more using the equipment in the laboratory that could examine a subject without affecting it, but reached no firm conclusion.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X4:r77","rowIndex":77,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「細胞であることは間違いないようだが……」","en":"“It certainly appears to be made of cells...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X4:r78","rowIndex":78,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=54>健慈朗</tips>は部屋の片隅にある円筒型の培養器に培養液を満たし、その肉片を入れた。","en":"<tips=54>Kenjiro</tips> filled a cylindrical culture vessel in one corner of the room with culture medium and placed the piece of flesh inside.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X4:r79","rowIndex":79,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しばらく観察してみても肉片に変化はなく、液のなかでくねくねと動き続けている。","en":"Even after he watched for some time, it showed no change, but continued writhing within the fluid.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X4:r80","rowIndex":80,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それを見ながら、汐はなんとも言えない表情で溜息をついた。","en":"Shio watched it with an unreadable expression and sighed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X4:r81","rowIndex":81,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　この地下室は、入り口を巧妙に隠されており、そうと知らなければ部屋の存在にさえ気がつかない。","en":"The entrance to this basement was ingeniously concealed. Unless one knew it existed, one would never notice the room at all.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X4:r82","rowIndex":82,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　本来は<tips=54>汐健慈朗</tips>その人しか足を踏み入れることが出来ないようになっていた。しかし、最近彼の他にもこの部屋を訪れる人物が現れた。","en":"The room had originally been made accessible to no one but <tips=54>Kenjiro Shio</tips> himself. Recently, however, someone else had begun visiting it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X4:r83","rowIndex":83,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「へえ、こんなの見たことがないや……」","en":"“Wow. I’ve never seen anything like this...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮（少年時代）","displayName":"Tse Leung (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X4:r84","rowIndex":84,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　目を輝かせて培養器に張り付くこの少年が、その人物だ。","en":"That visitor was the boy now pressed close to the culture vessel, his eyes shining.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X4:r85","rowIndex":85,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=58>パラシュート通り</tips>にある中華料理店の息子――というのはあくまでも世間に対する仮の姿で、その正体はこの地に根を張るマフィア組織の一つ『義勝』という香港系グループの若きリーダー「<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>」の一人息子である。『<tips=69>義勝</tips>』は元々武力闘争を得意とする組織だが、<tips=3>クリス</tips>が跡を継いでからさらに抗争が増え、息子がたびたび命を狙われることがあったらしく、素性を隠して知人の中華料理店に預けることとなった。","en":"To the world, he was merely the son of a Chinese restaurant owner on <tips=58>Parachute Street</tips>. In truth, he was the only son of <tips=3>Chris Tse</tips>, the young leader of a Hong Kong group called Yisheng, one of the Mafia organizations rooted in this district. <tips=69>Yisheng</tips> had always specialized in armed conflict, but gang wars grew still more frequent after <tips=3>Chris</tips> succeeded to its leadership, and his son was apparently targeted for death time and again. His identity was therefore concealed, and he was left in the care of an acquaintance who ran a Chinese restaurant.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X4:r86","rowIndex":86,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=3>クリス</tips>は生粋の漢人だが、少年の母親は日本人で、妹と一緒に別の場所に暮らしている。少年が別の場所で暮らす理由の一つとして、この母と妹が<tips=17>タイプB</tips>だというのもあるのかもしれないと<tips=54>健慈朗</tips>は思っていた。","en":"<tips=3>Chris</tips> was Han Chinese by birth, but the boy’s mother was Japanese and lived elsewhere with his younger sister. <tips=54>Kenjiro</tips> suspected that his mother and sister both being <tips=17>Type B</tips> might be one reason the boy lived apart from them.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X4:r87","rowIndex":87,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　この事実を知るものは、今現在ほとんどこの街には存在しないだろう。<tips=54>健慈朗</tips>はこの母親と、古い知り合いであったからそれを知っていた。","en":"There was probably almost no one in the city who knew this fact at the time. <tips=54>Kenjiro</tips> knew only because the boy’s mother was an old acquaintance.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X4:r88","rowIndex":88,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　というのも、彼の母親は研究者時代の<tips=54>健慈朗</tips>の下で働いていたのである。","en":"She had, in fact, worked under <tips=54>Kenjiro</tips> during his years as a researcher.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X4:r89","rowIndex":89,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　地方の国立大学を出た、優秀な助手であった。<tips=54>健慈朗</tips>は当時若く美しかった科学者にほのかな慕情を寄せていたという、胸が苦しくなるような思い出があったが、だからといってそれが理由でその息子をこの部屋に招いたわけではない。","en":"A gifted graduate of a regional national university, she had served as his assistant. <tips=54>Kenjiro</tips> retained the painful memory of the quiet affection he had once felt for the young and beautiful scientist. That was not, however, why he invited her son into this room.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X4:r90","rowIndex":90,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「先生、とにかくこの子は特別なんです」","en":"“Professor, I am telling you—this child is exceptional.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X4:r91","rowIndex":91,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　と、彼の母――<tips=56>菅原和美</tips>が目を輝かせて紹介したのがきっかけだった。","en":"It had begun when the boy’s mother, <tips=56>Kazumi Sugawara</tips>, introduced him with her eyes alight.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X4:r92","rowIndex":92,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そう言われて半信半疑で、まだ四つだった少年にいくつかテストを行ってみたが、確かに母親が言うのは単なる親馬鹿ではないようだった。異常なほどに利発で、好奇心が強い。そして何よりも、生物に対して強い興味があるという点が、<tips=54>健慈朗</tips>と共通していた。","en":"Though doubtful, Kenjiro administered several tests to the boy, then only four years old. His mother’s claim proved to be more than a doting parent’s exaggeration. He was extraordinarily precocious and intensely curious. Above all, he shared <tips=54>Kenjiro’s</tips> powerful interest in living things.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X4:r93","rowIndex":93,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　知らず知らず、最近の<tips=54>健慈朗</tips>はかつての孤独な実験を行うことはなくなり、この少年に学ばせるために実験を行うのが楽しみになっていたのである。","en":"Without quite realizing it, <tips=54>Kenjiro</tips> had recently ceased his solitary experiments. He now found pleasure in conducting experiments for the boy’s education.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X4:r94","rowIndex":94,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=1>亮</tips>」","en":"“<tips=1>Ryo</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐健慈朗","displayName":"Kenjiro Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X4:r95","rowIndex":95,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　と、<tips=54>健慈朗</tips>は呼ぶ。","en":"<tips=54>Kenjiro</tips> called to him.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X4:r96","rowIndex":96,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どうやらこれは人間の体細胞らしい」","en":"“Apparently, these are human somatic cells.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐健慈朗","displayName":"Kenjiro Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X4:r97","rowIndex":97,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「えっ、これが？」","en":"“What? This?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮（少年時代）","displayName":"Tse Leung (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X4:r98","rowIndex":98,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>と呼ばれた少年は視線を動き続ける細胞に釘付けにしたまま、うわずった声で言う。","en":"The boy called <tips=1>Ryo</tips> answered in an excited voice without taking his eyes from the ceaselessly moving cells.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X4:r99","rowIndex":99,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「とても若い、と言うよりも幼いと言うべきだろう。三、四才くらいの女の細胞じゃないかと思う。お前の妹くらいの年頃だな」","en":"“They are very young—or perhaps I should say that they come from a child. I think these may be the cells of a three- or four-year-old girl. About your sister’s age.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐健慈朗","displayName":"Kenjiro Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X4:r100","rowIndex":100,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=54>健慈朗</tips>は細胞の発見状況を思い浮かべながらそう言った。","en":"<tips=54>Kenjiro</tips> spoke while recalling the circumstances in which he had discovered the cells.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X4:r101","rowIndex":101,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「検査でそこまでわかるんだ？」","en":"“A test can tell you that much?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮（少年時代）","displayName":"Tse Leung (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X4:r102","rowIndex":102,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まあな」","en":"“More or less.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐健慈朗","displayName":"Kenjiro Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X4:r103","rowIndex":103,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「へえ……そうかあ……。でも、どう見たってこれは人間って感じじゃないけど……」","en":"“Oh... I see... But no matter how you look at this, it doesn’t seem human...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮（少年時代）","displayName":"Tse Leung (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X4:r104","rowIndex":104,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　細胞を眺めながら<tips=1>亮</tips>は顔を顰める。","en":"As he studied the cells, <tips=1>Ryo</tips> frowned.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X4:r105","rowIndex":105,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「でも、人間なら、名前が必要だね……」","en":"“Still, if she’s human, she needs a name...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮（少年時代）","displayName":"Tse Leung (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X4:r106","rowIndex":106,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうだな。お前がつけてみるか？」","en":"“I suppose so. Why don’t you give her one?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐健慈朗","displayName":"Kenjiro Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X4:r107","rowIndex":107,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いいの？」","en":"“Can I?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮（少年時代）","displayName":"Tse Leung (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X4:r108","rowIndex":108,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>は驚いて振り返る。","en":"<tips=1>Ryo</tips> turned in surprise.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X4:r109","rowIndex":109,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いいとも」","en":"“Certainly.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐健慈朗","displayName":"Kenjiro Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X4:r110","rowIndex":110,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=54>健慈朗</tips>が頷くと、<tips=1>亮</tips>は嬉しそうに笑い、","en":"When <tips=54>Kenjiro</tips> nodded, <tips=1>Ryo</tips> smiled with delight.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X4:r111","rowIndex":111,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「じゃあ、マツコにしよう！　木の松に子供の子で<tips=55>松子</tips>！」","en":"“Then let's call her <tips=55>Matsuko</tips>! Matsu as in ‘pine,’ and ko as in ‘child’: Matsuko!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮（少年時代）","displayName":"Tse Leung (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X4:r112","rowIndex":112,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「随分古くさい名前を付けるんだな」","en":"“That is a remarkably old-fashioned name.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐健慈朗","displayName":"Kenjiro Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X4:r113","rowIndex":113,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「松は不老長寿の象徴だからね。こういじましく必死に動いている姿を見ていると、なんだかいつまでも長生きして欲しいような気持ちになってしまうから」","en":"“Pines symbolize eternal youth and longevity. Watching her struggle so desperately to keep moving somehow makes me want her to live forever.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮（少年時代）","displayName":"Tse Leung (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X4:r114","rowIndex":114,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　いつも通りの子供らしくない言葉遣いで、誰よりも子供らしい表情を浮かべる<tips=1>亮</tips>に、<tips=54>健慈朗</tips>は苦笑して、","en":"At odds with his usual unchildlike way of speaking, <tips=1>Ryo</tips> wore the most childlike expression imaginable. <tips=54>Kenjiro</tips> gave a wry smile.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X4:r115","rowIndex":115,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「わかった。じゃあ、今日からこいつは<tips=55>松子</tips>だ」","en":"“Very well. From today, this one is <tips=55>Matsuko</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐健慈朗","displayName":"Kenjiro Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X4:r116","rowIndex":116,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして、白いガムテープに『<tips=55>松子</tips>』と書いて、培養器の下の方に貼った。","en":"He wrote ‘<tips=55>Matsuko</tips>’ upon a strip of white duct tape and affixed it near the bottom of the culture vessel.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X4:r117","rowIndex":117,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=54>汐さん</tips>とこの子だから、<tips=55>汐松子</tips>だね。良かったじゃない。娘が出来て」","en":"“She’s your child, <tips=54>Mr. Shio</tips>, so that makes her <tips=55>Matsuko Shio</tips>. Congratulations—you have a daughter.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮（少年時代）","displayName":"Tse Leung (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X4:r118","rowIndex":118,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>はそう言って、円筒の端をとんとんと人差し指で叩くと、","en":"<tips=1>Ryo</tips> said this, then tapped the side of the cylinder with his index finger.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X4:r119","rowIndex":119,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「やあ、聞いたか。君の名前は<tips=55>松子</tips>だよ。僕が決めたんだ。よろしくね。……あ、ほら、何だか声に反応して動いたみたいだよ？　こいつ、音が聞こえてるんじゃないの？」","en":"“Hey, did you hear that? Your name is <tips=55>Matsuko</tips>. I chose it. Nice to meet you. ...Oh, look! It moved when it heard my voice, didn’t it? Maybe it can hear us.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮（少年時代）","displayName":"Tse Leung (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X4:r120","rowIndex":120,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>は指をさして<tips=54>健慈朗</tips>を振り返る。","en":"<tips=1>Ryo</tips> pointed and looked back at <tips=54>Kenjiro</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X4:r121","rowIndex":121,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そんな器官はないはずだが、振動は感知しているのかもな」","en":"“It shouldn’t have any organ capable of that, but perhaps it can sense vibrations.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐健慈朗","displayName":"Kenjiro Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X4:r122","rowIndex":122,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=54>健慈朗</tips>は顎をなでつつ、目を細めた。","en":"<tips=54>Kenjiro</tips> narrowed his eyes and rubbed his chin.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X4:r123","rowIndex":123,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"『<tips=55>松子</tips>』と名付けられた細胞は、すぐに活動を停止してしまうのではないかという<tips=54>健慈朗</tips>の予想とは裏腹に、生き続けた。","en":"Contrary to <tips=54>Kenjiro’s</tips> expectation that the mass of cells named <tips=55>Matsuko</tips> would soon cease all activity, it lived on.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X4:r124","rowIndex":124,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ただ生きるどころか、栄養を与えると少しずつ大きくなり、成長の様子さえ見せ始めたのである。","en":"Far from merely staying alive, it slowly grew larger when supplied with nutrients and even began to show signs of development.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X4:r125","rowIndex":125,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>はこの僅かずつ変化してゆく『<tips=55>松子</tips>』に完全に夢中になり、<tips=54>健慈朗</tips>が仕事で出かけている最中でもこの実験室に入り込み、培養器に張り付いていた。","en":"<tips=1>Ryo</tips> became utterly absorbed in <tips=55>Matsuko’s</tips> minute changes. Even while <tips=54>Kenjiro</tips> was away at work, he entered the laboratory and remained pressed to the culture vessel.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X4:r126","rowIndex":126,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そんなある日、<tips=54>健慈朗</tips>は重要な仕事を失った。","en":"Then one day, <tips=54>Kenjiro</tips> lost an important job.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X4:r127","rowIndex":127,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=18>ローズ・クラブ</tips>の仕事がなくなったのである。","en":"His work for the <tips=18>Rose Club</tips> was gone.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X4:r128","rowIndex":128,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それは契約を打ち切られたというわけではない。","en":"The contract had not been terminated.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X4:r129","rowIndex":129,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=18>ローズ・クラブ</tips>自体が消滅してしまったのだ。","en":"The <tips=18>Rose Club</tips> itself had ceased to exist.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X4:r130","rowIndex":130,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それも、<tips=1>亮</tips>の父親の<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>によって。","en":"And it was <tips=1>Ryo’s</tips> father, <tips=3>Chris Tse</tips>, who had done it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X4:r131","rowIndex":131,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=18>ローズ・クラブ</tips>というのは、もともと街の人間にとっては非常に評判の悪いものだった。","en":"The <tips=18>Rose Club</tips> had always had an abysmal reputation among the people of the city.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X4:r132","rowIndex":132,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　経営者は<tips=60>ロジャー・アダムス</tips>という白人男性だ。この<tips=9>Y地区</tips>の出身ではなく、またいかなるマフィア組織にも属していない、よそからやってきた人間である。","en":"Its owner was a white man named <tips=60>Roger Adams</tips>. He was an outsider, neither a native of <tips=9>Y District</tips> nor a member of any Mafia organization.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X4:r133","rowIndex":133,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=54>健慈朗</tips>も何度か見かけたことがある。その男は、言ってしまえば風俗店の親玉のような立場であるはずの人間だが、見た目はきっちりと髪の毛を分けて、上等なスーツを着こなした快活な笑顔が印象的な男で、ウォール街のビジネスマンだと言われても何の違和感もない。","en":"<tips=54>Kenjiro</tips> had seen him several times. To put it bluntly, the man was effectively the boss of a sex business. Yet with his hair neatly parted, his fine suits, and his strikingly cheerful smile, he could have passed without question for a Wall Street businessman.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X4:r134","rowIndex":134,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その、さわやかな人物の行っている仕事は、まったくさわやかではなかった。彼の職業は人買い。この<tips=9>Y地区</tips>の人間を買いあさり、よそから来た金持ちに高額の玩具として売り渡し、その利益を独占するというものである。","en":"That wholesome-looking man’s business was anything but wholesome. His trade was human trafficking: he bought up the people of <tips=9>Y District</tips>, sold them as expensive toys to wealthy outsiders, and monopolized the profits.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X4:r135","rowIndex":135,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　当然街での評判が良いはずもなく、元々ここで活動していたマフィアたちは以前からクラブを目の敵にしていた。","en":"Naturally, the club was reviled throughout the city, and the Mafia groups already established there had long treated it as their common enemy.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X4:r136","rowIndex":136,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　この、不満を持つマフィアたちをまとめ上げて一つの大きな勢力にしたのが、<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>である。","en":"<tips=3>Chris Tse</tips> was the man who united these disgruntled Mafia groups into a single powerful force.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X4:r137","rowIndex":137,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　構成員に武装をさせると<tips=18>ローズ・クラブ</tips>に殴り込み、経営者たちを皆殺しにして街から追い払った。","en":"He armed his men and stormed the <tips=18>Rose Club</tips>, slaughtering its operators and driving the organization from the city.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X4:r138","rowIndex":138,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　目の覚めるような大勝利で、これによって、<tips=18>ローズ・クラブ</tips>に売り払われた人々は家に帰り、ため込まれていた富は分配された。","en":"It was a resounding victory. Those sold to the <tips=18>Rose Club</tips> returned home, and the wealth it had hoarded was distributed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X4:r139","rowIndex":139,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　街の人々は大変な喜びようで、若い<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>は瞬く間に街の英雄となった。今後、このサイキックとして生まれた特別な若者がこの街の重要な人物となってゆくのは、この時点で誰の目にも明らかだった。","en":"The people of the city rejoiced, and young <tips=3>Chris Tse</tips> became its hero almost overnight. It was already plain to everyone that this exceptional young man, gifted with psychic powers from birth, would become an important figure in the city’s future.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X4:r140","rowIndex":140,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=18>ローズ・クラブ</tips>との取引は実入りが多く、<tips=54>健慈朗</tips>にとっては痛かったが、しかしそれよりも、これから変化してゆくだろう街のなかでどうやって営業方針を定めてゆくかで非常に悩んでいた。","en":"The <tips=18>Rose Club</tips> account had been lucrative, so its loss hurt <tips=54>Kenjiro</tips>. But he was even more troubled over how to set a course for his business in a city that was bound to change.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X4:r141","rowIndex":141,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　一方、その<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>の御曹司である<tips=1>亮</tips>は、全くそんな事情には無関心である。","en":"Meanwhile, <tips=3>Chris Tse’s</tips> son and heir, <tips=1>Ryo</tips>, was entirely indifferent to such matters.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X4:r142","rowIndex":142,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ねえ<tips=54>汐さん</tips>、こいつ、やっぱり言葉が分かるみたいだよ」","en":"“<tips=54>Mr. Shio</tips>, I really think this thing understands words.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X4:r143","rowIndex":143,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　帰って来た<tips=54>健慈朗</tips>に、目を輝かせてそう伝える。","en":"When <tips=54>Kenjiro</tips> returned, Ryo reported this with shining eyes.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X4:r144","rowIndex":144,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「さすがにそれはないだろう」","en":"“Come on. That can’t be true.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐健慈朗","displayName":"Kenjiro Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X4:r145","rowIndex":145,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=54>健慈朗</tips>は溜息をつきながらも、少年の純真さに癒やされるものを感じてはいた。","en":"<tips=54>Kenjiro</tips> sighed, though the boy’s innocence brought him a measure of comfort.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X4:r146","rowIndex":146,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼は自分の父親の話をすることはなかった。嫌悪しているのか、単に興味がないのかはその態度からは判別出来ない。","en":"Ryo never spoke about his father. His manner revealed neither whether he hated the man nor whether he simply felt no interest in him.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X4:r147","rowIndex":147,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「本当だって」","en":"“It is true.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮（少年時代）","displayName":"Tse Leung (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X4:r148","rowIndex":148,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>は信じようとしない<tips=54>健慈朗</tips>に対して顔を顰める。","en":"<tips=1>Ryo</tips> frowned at <tips=54>Kenjiro</tips> for refusing to believe him.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X4:r149","rowIndex":149,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どうかなあ。気のせいじゃないか？」","en":"“I’m not so sure. Couldn’t it just be your imagination?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐健慈朗","displayName":"Kenjiro Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X4:r150","rowIndex":150,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　音が聞こえる、というのはどうやら間違いないらしい。","en":"It did appear able to hear, at least.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X4:r151","rowIndex":151,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しかし、言葉を理解するというのはまったく別の次元の話だ。<tips=54>健慈朗</tips>はにわかには信じられない。","en":"But understanding language was another matter altogether. <tips=54>Kenjiro</tips> could not readily believe it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X4:r152","rowIndex":152,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「気のせいなんかじゃない。元々言葉を知ってたっていうか、もしかしたら、今少しずつ言葉を学びはじめてるところのかもしれないな。とにかく反応があったんだよ。もしかしたら、僕がいつも話しかけているから、それで学習して……」","en":"“It’s not my imagination. Maybe she doesn’t already know words so much as she’s only now starting to learn them, little by little. Anyway, there was a response. Maybe she’s learning because I’m always talking to her...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮（少年時代）","displayName":"Tse Leung (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X4:r153","rowIndex":153,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「おいおい、じゃあ、こいつに知能があるっていうのかい？　さすがにそれは信じられないな」","en":"“Hold on. Are you saying this thing is intelligent? That’s a little hard to believe.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐健慈朗","displayName":"Kenjiro Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X4:r154","rowIndex":154,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「本当だって。じゃあ、見てなよ……」","en":"“It is true. Here—watch...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮（少年時代）","displayName":"Tse Leung (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X4:r155","rowIndex":155,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>は少女と見間違うほど美しい顔で悪戯っぽく笑うと、『<tips=55>松子</tips>』に向き直り、","en":"With a mischievous smile on his face—so beautiful he could almost be mistaken for a girl—<tips=1>Ryo</tips> turned back to “<tips=55>Matsuko</tips>” and said,","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X4:r156","rowIndex":156,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「おい、<tips=55>松子</tips>！　お前なんか、大嫌いだ！　もう面倒なんかみてやらないぞ！」","en":"“Listen, <tips=55>Matsuko</tips>! I hate you! I won’t take care of you anymore!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮（少年時代）","displayName":"Tse Leung (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X4:r157","rowIndex":157,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その声に反応するかのように『<tips=55>松子</tips>』はねじれる。","en":"As though responding to his voice, <tips=55>Matsuko</tips> twisted.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X4:r158","rowIndex":158,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……ほら見なよ。これは悲しんでるんだ」","en":"“...There, you see? She is sad.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮（少年時代）","displayName":"Tse Leung (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X4:r159","rowIndex":159,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>は小声で<tips=54>健慈朗</tips>に囁く。","en":"<tips=1>Ryo</tips> whispered to <tips=54>Kenjiro</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X4:r160","rowIndex":160,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「じゃあ感情もあるってことになるじゃないか。いやあ、それはどうだろうな……」","en":"“Then that would mean she has emotions too. Well, I’m not so sure about that...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐健慈朗","displayName":"Kenjiro Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X4:r161","rowIndex":161,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「信じられないのはわかるけど、本当なんだよ。……見てて」","en":"“I know it’s hard to believe, but it’s true. ...Just watch.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮（少年時代）","displayName":"Tse Leung (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X4:r162","rowIndex":162,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>は再び培養器に唇がくっつきそうなほど近づくと、","en":"<tips=1>Ryo</tips> leaned toward the culture vessel again, close enough that his lips almost touched it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X4:r163","rowIndex":163,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ごめんね。今のは嘘だよ。あんまり<tips=55>松子</tips>が可愛いから、からかっただけなんだ。本当は大好きだよ。すき！　ねえ聞こえてる？　きみのことを好きって言ったんだよ僕！　……ほら見なよ。今度はトゲトゲになった。これは嬉しいのか、照れてるのか……とにかくそんな感じの反応で間違いないね」","en":"“I’m sorry. That was a lie. I only teased you because you’re so cute, <tips=55>Matsuko</tips>. I really do like you. I like you! Can you hear me? I said I like you! ...Look. This time she turned spiky. Maybe she’s happy, or embarrassed... Whatever it is, that’s definitely a response.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮（少年時代）","displayName":"Tse Leung (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X4:r164","rowIndex":164,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「たまたまだろうよ」","en":"“It was probably just a coincidence.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐健慈朗","displayName":"Kenjiro Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X4:r165","rowIndex":165,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=54>健慈朗</tips>は首を捻る。","en":"<tips=54>Kenjiro</tips> tilted his head.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X4:r166","rowIndex":166,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「こんなにはっきり反応してるのに、まだ信じられないだなんて」","en":"“She’s responding so clearly, and you still won’t believe it!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮（少年時代）","displayName":"Tse Leung (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X4:r167","rowIndex":167,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>は大げさに溜息をつく。","en":"<tips=1>Ryo</tips> heaved an exaggerated sigh.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X4:r168","rowIndex":168,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まあ、もし本当だったら、これはちょっと凄いことになる」","en":"“Well, if it’s true, this could turn out to be quite extraordinary.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐健慈朗","displayName":"Kenjiro Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X4:r169","rowIndex":169,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「でしょう？　それでね、実は僕、もう一つ、これよりもっとびっくりするような<tips=55>松子</tips>の能力を見つけたんだ」","en":"“Isn’t it? And actually, I found one more ability <tips=55>Matsuko</tips> has—something even more astonishing than this.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮（少年時代）","displayName":"Tse Leung (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X4:r170","rowIndex":170,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なんだ？」","en":"“What?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐健慈朗","displayName":"Kenjiro Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X4:r171","rowIndex":171,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「見てなよ。……いいかい<tips=55>松子</tips>？　いつものやつを、お前のパパに見せてやるからね」","en":"“Watch. ...All right, <tips=55>Matsuko</tips>? We’ll show your papa the thing we always do.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮（少年時代）","displayName":"Tse Leung (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X4:r172","rowIndex":172,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>は<tips=55>松子</tips>にそう言い残すと、たたたと足音を立てて実験室の向こうまで行き、両手に籠を抱えて帰って来た。","en":"After saying this to <tips=55>Matsuko</tips>, <tips=1>Ryo</tips> pattered to the other side of the laboratory and returned carrying a basket in both hands.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X4:r173","rowIndex":173,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それはなんだ？」","en":"“What is that?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐健慈朗","displayName":"Kenjiro Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X4:r174","rowIndex":174,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「母さんのところにあった積み木さ。<tips=44>筱喬</tips>が遊んでるやつだよ」","en":"“Some building blocks from Mother’s place. The ones <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> plays with.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮（少年時代）","displayName":"Tse Leung (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X4:r175","rowIndex":175,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>はひとつつまんでみせる。それはどこにでもある木製の積み木で、乱暴に扱ったのか、端の塗料がはげかけていた。","en":"<tips=1>Ryo</tips> held one up. It was an ordinary wooden block. Perhaps it had been handled roughly; the paint at its edges had begun to wear away.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X4:r176","rowIndex":176,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=55>松子</tips>、これだ」","en":"“<tips=55>Matsuko</tips>, look at this.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮（少年時代）","displayName":"Tse Leung (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X4:r177","rowIndex":177,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>はそれを培養器の前に差し出してみせる。","en":"<tips=1>Ryo</tips> held it before the culture vessel for her to see.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X4:r178","rowIndex":178,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼が手に持っているのは、黄色い長方形の積み木だった。","en":"The block in his hand was a yellow rectangular prism.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X4:r179","rowIndex":179,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　どういうことかと<tips=54>健慈朗</tips>が見守っていると、培養液のなかの細胞が、すこしずつ変化し、<tips=1>亮</tips>が手にした積み木と同じような長方形になる。","en":"As <tips=54>Kenjiro</tips> watched without understanding what the boy intended, the cells in the culture medium slowly changed, assuming a rectangular shape like the block <tips=1>Ryo</tips> held.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X4:r180","rowIndex":180,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どう？」","en":"“Well?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮（少年時代）","displayName":"Tse Leung (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X4:r181","rowIndex":181,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>は得意げに振り返る。","en":"<tips=1>Ryo</tips> looked back in triumph.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X4:r182","rowIndex":182,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いや、これは……」","en":"“Well, this is...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐健慈朗","displayName":"Kenjiro Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X4:r183","rowIndex":183,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=54>健慈朗</tips>はにわかには受け入れがたく、首を捻った。","en":"Unable to accept the sight immediately, <tips=54>Kenjiro</tips> tilted his head.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X4:r184","rowIndex":184,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しかし、今度は偶然で片付けられそうもない。<tips=1>亮</tips>が別の積み木を取り出すたびに、細胞は三角、円筒へと姿を変え、そしてジュースのペットボトルを見せるとそのかたちにさえ変化した。","en":"This time, however, chance could not easily explain it away. Whenever <tips=1>Ryo</tips> took out another block, the cells assumed a new form—a triangle, then a cylinder. When he showed them a plastic juice bottle, they even changed into its shape.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X4:r185","rowIndex":185,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「驚いたな……」","en":"“Well, I’ll be...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐健慈朗","displayName":"Kenjiro Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X4:r186","rowIndex":186,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「聴覚だけじゃない。視覚も知性もある。どこで見たり考えたりしいるのかさっぱりわからないけど」","en":"“She can see as well as hear, and she’s intelligent. Though I have no idea what she sees or thinks with.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮（少年時代）","displayName":"Tse Leung (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X4:r187","rowIndex":187,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>は勝ち誇ったように<tips=54>健慈朗</tips>を見つめる。","en":"<tips=1>Ryo</tips> stared at <tips=54>Kenjiro</tips> in triumph.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X4:r188","rowIndex":188,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=54>健慈朗</tips>は今目の前で起こったことがまだ信じられず、うなり声を上げるばかりである。","en":"<tips=54>Kenjiro</tips> still could not believe what had occurred before him and could only groan.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X4:r189","rowIndex":189,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　知性と聴覚があると気がついた<tips=1>亮</tips>は、これから積極的に『松子』に情報を与えることにした。絵本を読み聞かせたり、テレビをわざわざ運んできて見せたり、音楽を聴かせたり――時間さえあればここに来て、熱心に『<tips=55>松子</tips>』に関わった。","en":"Once he realized that <tips=55>Matsuko</tips> could hear and possessed intelligence, <tips=1>Ryo</tips> began actively exposing her to new information. He read picture books aloud to her, went to the trouble of carrying down a television for her to watch, and played her music. Whenever he had time, he came to the laboratory and devoted himself to her.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X4:r190","rowIndex":190,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=54>健慈朗</tips>の見たところ『<tips=55>松子</tips>』は非常に覚えが良く、また<tips=1>亮</tips>とのコミュニケーションを好んでいるようにも見えた。<tips=54>健慈朗</tips>しかいないときと、<tips=1>亮</tips>がいるときとではその反応に違いがあるのだ。","en":"As far as <tips=54>Kenjiro</tips> could tell, <tips=55>Matsuko</tips> learned exceptionally quickly and appeared to enjoy communicating with <tips=1>Ryo</tips>. Her responses differed depending on whether only <tips=54>Kenjiro</tips> was there or <tips=1>Ryo</tips> was present as well.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X4:r191","rowIndex":191,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　こんな細胞でもやはり少女らしい感情があるのかもしれないと想像しかけ、もう一方では、いやそんなばかなことはあるまいと否定する日々が続いた。","en":"Day after day, he would find himself imagining that even these cells might have the emotions of a young girl, only to dismiss the thought from another quarter of his mind as ridiculous.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X4:r192","rowIndex":192,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　一体この細胞はなんなのか？　実際の『<tips=55>松子</tips>』に夢中になった<tips=1>亮</tips>はその問いかけを忘れてしまっているが、<tips=54>健慈朗</tips>はその問いかけを忘れない。","en":"What were these cells? Absorbed in <tips=55>Matsuko</tips> herself, <tips=1>Ryo</tips> had forgotten the question. <tips=54>Kenjiro</tips> did not.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X4:r193","rowIndex":193,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=18>ローズ・クラブ</tips>の死体捨て場に廃棄されていた。ということは間違いなくあのクラブから廃棄されたものである。あそこにいた何者かがそのまま捨てられたのか。それとも、死体として放置されている間に何らかの変成が起きたのか？　あるいは、どこかから奇妙な生物がやってきて、偶然紛れ込んだのか。","en":"The cells had been discarded in the <tips=18>Rose Club’s</tips> dumping ground for corpses. That meant they had unquestionably come from the club itself. Had some living thing from inside simply been thrown away? Had some transformation occurred while a corpse lay abandoned? Or had a strange organism come from elsewhere and found its way into the bag by chance?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X4:r194","rowIndex":194,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=8>グレートホール</tips>に近いこの街では、考えられないような不思議なことが良く起こる。しかし、<tips=54>健慈朗</tips>もこのような例は聞いたことも見たこともなかった。","en":"In this city so close to the <tips=8>Great Hole</tips>, strange things beyond imagining happened all the time. Even <tips=54>Kenjiro</tips>, however, had never heard of or seen anything like this.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X4:r195","rowIndex":195,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=18>ローズ・クラブ</tips>がまだ営業していた頃、『<tips=55>松子</tips>』の正体を知りたくて何度か足を運んだ。その巨大な建物は奥深く、さまざまな要求に応えるための施設と人員が用意されていたが、普通の飲食店としても利用することが出来る。そこで女を買って話を聞いたり、酒を飲んでショーを見たりしたが、アメーバ状の生き物などというものは、まったく出てこなかった。","en":"While the <tips=18>Rose Club</tips> was still in business, his desire to learn the true nature of “<tips=55>Matsuko</tips>” took him there several times. The vast building extended deep within and contained facilities and personnel prepared to satisfy every variety of request, though it could also be used as an ordinary restaurant. He bought women and questioned them, drank liquor, and watched the shows, but never encountered any mention of an amoeba-like organism.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X4:r196","rowIndex":196,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　もっとも、その秘密に包まれた巨大な施設のなかですべての情報を知るのは、客として何度か利用した程度では到底不可能だとはわかっていたが。","en":"Admittedly, he knew that a few visits as a customer could never reveal everything within that enormous facility shrouded in secrecy.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X4:r197","rowIndex":197,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　結局<tips=54>健慈朗</tips>は、『<tips=55>松子</tips>』について、<tips=1>亮</tips>とのやりとりなども含めて得られる情報を記録するだけにとどめ、その解決は後にまわすことにした。","en":"In the end, <tips=54>Kenjiro</tips> limited himself to recording whatever information he could obtain about “<tips=55>Matsuko</tips>,” including her exchanges with <tips=1>Ryo</tips>, and left the question to be resolved later.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X4:r198","rowIndex":198,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　もっと大きな施設で、詳細な検査をすれば、正体にせまることが出来るかも知れない。<tips=54>健慈朗</tips>にはそのコネもあったし、あるいはその結果によっては研究者として返り咲くという可能性だってある。","en":"A detailed examination at a larger facility might bring him closer to the truth. <tips=54>Kenjiro</tips> had the necessary connections, and depending on the results, this might even be his chance to return to research.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X4:r199","rowIndex":199,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　研究者として資金面や成果のなさによって挫折し、ゴミ屋を営んでいる<tips=54>健慈朗</tips>にとって、その想像は胸が痛くなるほど痛切なものだった。","en":"<tips=54>Kenjiro</tips> had failed as a researcher for want of funding and results and ended up running a garbage company. The thought of returning filled him with a longing so keen it made his heart ache.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X4:r200","rowIndex":200,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　確かに、今の仕事をはじめてから非常に羽振りはよくなった。今後の発展も大いに見込める。<tips=9>Y地区</tips>には捨てたいけれども捨てられないものが、あまりにも多い。そのわりには、進んでゴミ捨てを行おうというものも少なく、ただ<tips=8>グレートホール</tips>に投げ込むだけでもこれだけの利益が得られるのだからバカみたいな話だ。","en":"Certainly, he had grown remarkably prosperous since beginning his present work, and the company promised extensive future growth. <tips=9>Y District</tips> contained far too many things that people wished to discard but could not. Remarkably few were willing to handle that disposal, and if merely throwing such things into the <tips=8>Great Hole</tips> yielded profits of this magnitude, the entire business seemed almost absurd.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X4:r201","rowIndex":201,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　こういったものは信用が第一で、街で最初の民間ゴミ処理業者として業務を開始した<tips=70>シオクリーン</tips>は、同業他社を寄せ付けない。<tips=18>ローズ・クラブ</tips>と契約を結べたのも大きい。","en":"Trust mattered above all in work of this kind. <tips=70>Shio Clean</tips>, the first private waste-disposal company to begin operating in the city, left its competitors far behind. Securing the <tips=18>Rose Club</tips> contract had also mattered greatly.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X4:r202","rowIndex":202,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　使っても使っても追いつかないほど金が貯まる、なんて貧乏研究者をやっていたころには想像もつかなかったものだ。かつて振り向かなかったような女が、黙っていていても股を開き、ひっきりなしに人が訪れる。金なんぞまったく使わなくても、『金を持っている』というだけで、貧乏だったころになけなしの金を支払って得たものよりも大きなものが与えられる。","en":"Money accumulated faster than he could spend it, something unimaginable in his days as an impoverished researcher. Women who once would never have looked his way now spread their legs without being asked, and visitors came without cease. He did not have to spend a cent. Merely ‘possessing money’ brought him greater things than those he had once purchased with the last coins of his poverty.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X4:r203","rowIndex":203,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しかし、それでも、挫折した痛みが消えることはなかった。","en":"Even so, the pain of his failure had never disappeared.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X4:r204","rowIndex":204,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　この細胞をもっと正規の機関へ持ち込んで、研究するという考えは何度も頭に浮かんだ。しかし、結局それを実行に移さなかったのは、やはり時間が彼の心を幾分変化させていたのだろう。","en":"The thought of taking these cells to an established research institution occurred to him many times. That he never went through with it in the end perhaps meant that time had changed him after all.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X4:r205","rowIndex":205,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　この粗末な地下室で、聡明な少年と共に、成長してゆく『<tips=55>松子</tips>』に一喜一憂するという生活には、簡単に捨てることが出来ない穏やかな幸福感があった。","en":"There was a quiet happiness in this life—in sharing every joy and worry over <tips=55>Matsuko’s</tips> growth with a brilliant boy in a humble basement—and he could not easily cast it aside.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X4:r206","rowIndex":206,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼も、そんな感情を自分が抱くことがあるなんて想像したことがない。","en":"He had never imagined himself capable of such feelings.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X4:r207","rowIndex":207,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　もし自分が結婚し、子供などを育てていたら、こんな感情で毎日心が満たされていたのだろうか？","en":"Had he married and raised children, would feelings like these have filled his heart each day?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X4:r208","rowIndex":208,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼は若い頃から自分を『世捨て人』だと言い放ち、周囲の人間の家庭や幸福といったものを前提とした生活様式を軽蔑していたが、まさか自分が彼らを理解する日がくるとは。ぬるま湯のなかでとかされるように、自分というものが失われてゆく感じがした。しかもそれは悪い感覚ではないのが、さらなる驚きだった。","en":"Since his youth, he had proclaimed himself a ‘recluse from the world’ and scorned the way those around him built their lives on family and happiness. Never had he imagined a day would come when he understood them. He felt his very self dissolving as though in warm water—and, more astonishing still, it did not feel unpleasant.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X4:r209","rowIndex":209,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　この生活がいつまで続くのだろう？","en":"How long would this life continue?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X4:r210","rowIndex":210,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>は段々成長してゆく。彼はマフィアの御曹司であるから、こんな地下室で閉じこもっているわけにもいかない。","en":"<tips=1>Ryo</tips> was steadily growing older. As the heir to a Mafia family, he could not remain shut away forever in a basement like this.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X4:r211","rowIndex":211,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼の父親の<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>は皆の予想通り着実に勢力を伸ばしている。ここまで大きな人間になってしまっては、息子はどういうつもりでいても、逃れることは出来ない。<tips=1>亮</tips>はいつか自分の運命と直面することになるだろう。","en":"His father, <tips=3>Chris Tse</tips>, was steadily expanding his influence, precisely as everyone had predicted. Now that the man had grown into a figure of such stature, his son could not escape him, whatever the boy himself intended. One day, <tips=1>Ryo</tips> would have to confront his fate.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X4:r212","rowIndex":212,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"『<tips=55>松子</tips>』だって、いつまで培養液のなかで浸っていられるかわからない。","en":"There was no knowing how long <tips=55>Matsuko</tips> could remain immersed in the culture medium.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X4:r213","rowIndex":213,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　いつだって死んでしまう可能性があったし、まったく想像もつかないおぞましい生物に変化を遂げる可能性もある。","en":"She might die at any time, or transform into some hideous life-form beyond all imagination.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X4:r214","rowIndex":214,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そんな風に<tips=54>健慈朗</tips>が思っているなか、『<tips=55>松子</tips>』に、新たな、そしてまったく別の変化が現れた。","en":"As <tips=54>Kenjiro</tips> entertained these thoughts, a new and entirely different change appeared in <tips=55>Matsuko</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X4:r215","rowIndex":215,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その頃、培養液のなかで彼女はスイカ大ほどの大きさに成長していた。そろそろ新しい培養器を買わなければならないと、考え始めたころである。","en":"By then, she had grown within the culture medium to approximately the size of a watermelon. Kenjiro had just begun to consider buying a new culture vessel.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X4:r216","rowIndex":216,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　突如、まるくなったまま、いかなる呼びかけにも反応しなくなったのだ。","en":"Without warning, she curled into a ball and ceased responding to every attempt to reach her.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X4:r217","rowIndex":217,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どうしたんだろう？　これ、死んじゃったのかな……いや、でもモニターは変化ないし……」","en":"“What happened? Is she dead...? No, the monitor hasn’t changed...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮（少年時代）","displayName":"Tse Leung (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X4:r218","rowIndex":218,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>は『<tips=55>松子</tips>』と培養器に取り付けられたモニターの間で視線を行ったり来たりさせながら戸惑いをみせる。","en":"Confused, <tips=1>Ryo</tips> shifted his gaze repeatedly between <tips=55>Matsuko</tips> and the monitor attached to the culture vessel.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X4:r219","rowIndex":219,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「わからん。少し経過を見守るしかないな」","en":"“I don’t know. We’ll just have to wait and see.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐健慈朗","displayName":"Kenjiro Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X4:r220","rowIndex":220,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その夜<tips=1>亮</tips>は普段より遅くまで実験室に残り、そしてようやく帰るときも、<tips=54>健慈朗</tips>に何度もうながされてのことだった。","en":"That night, <tips=1>Ryo</tips> remained in the laboratory later than usual. Even when he finally returned home, he did so only after <tips=54>Kenjiro</tips> urged him repeatedly.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X4:r221","rowIndex":221,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　翌日、<tips=1>亮</tips>は学校へ登校する前、朝早くに実験室にやって来る。","en":"Early the following morning, <tips=1>Ryo</tips> came to the laboratory before attending school.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X4:r222","rowIndex":222,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=54>汐さん</tips>！　どうなった？　まだ生きてる？」","en":"“<tips=54>Mr. Shio</tips>! What happened? Is she still alive?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮（少年時代）","displayName":"Tse Leung (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X4:r223","rowIndex":223,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それがな、実に意外なことになった」","en":"“Well, something completely unexpected happened.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐健慈朗","displayName":"Kenjiro Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X4:r224","rowIndex":224,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　丸くなった『<tips=55>松子</tips>』は、一晩の間に著しい変化を遂げていた。","en":"The curled <tips=55>Matsuko</tips> had undergone a remarkable transformation overnight.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X4:r225","rowIndex":225,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「これは……」","en":"“This is...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮（少年時代）","displayName":"Tse Leung (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X4:r226","rowIndex":226,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>が絶句するのも無理はない。","en":"No wonder <tips=1>Ryo</tips> was speechless.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X4:r227","rowIndex":227,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それは、胎児の姿をしていた。","en":"She had assumed the form of a fetus.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X4:r228","rowIndex":228,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　まだ妊娠から九週がすぎたかどうかといった段階の、ごく初期のものである。","en":"It was at an extremely early stage, perhaps just nine weeks into gestation.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X4:r229","rowIndex":229,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　尻尾がまだ残り、身体全体が半透明で血管と、眼球の黒みが透けている。実際の胎児より遥かに大きなサイズだが、その形状は完全に人間の胎児そのものだった。","en":"A tail still remained, and the entire body was translucent, its blood vessels and the dark orbs of its eyes visible through the flesh. It was far larger than a real fetus at that stage, but its form was unmistakably that of a human fetus.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X4:r230","rowIndex":230,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どういうことなの？」","en":"“What does this mean?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮（少年時代）","displayName":"Tse Leung (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X4:r231","rowIndex":231,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どうもこうもない。こいつは、ホンモノの『人間』になろうとしている」","en":"“There’s no question about it. This thing is trying to become a real ‘human being.’”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐健慈朗","displayName":"Kenjiro Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X4:r232","rowIndex":232,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=54>健慈朗</tips>は別のモニターの前に<tips=1>亮</tips>を座らせ、２４時間記録しているビデオカメラの映像から、昨夜のものを切り取ったものを早送りで見せた。","en":"<tips=54>Kenjiro</tips> seated <tips=1>Ryo</tips> before another monitor and showed him a fast-forwarded excerpt from the previous night’s footage, captured by a video camera that recorded twenty-four hours a day.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X4:r233","rowIndex":233,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ほら、昨日の丸っこいのが受精卵みたいなものだったんだよ。あれから、目まぐるしい速度で細胞分裂や分化を繰り返し、あっという間にここまで成長した」","en":"“Look. That round thing yesterday must have been something like a fertilized egg. From there, its cells divided and differentiated at a dizzying rate, and it grew this far in almost no time.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐健慈朗","displayName":"Kenjiro Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X4:r234","rowIndex":234,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……すごい。どうなってるんだろう」","en":"“...Amazing. How is this happening?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮（少年時代）","displayName":"Tse Leung (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X4:r235","rowIndex":235,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「さっぱりわけがわからん」","en":"“I haven’t the faintest idea.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐健慈朗","displayName":"Kenjiro Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X4:r236","rowIndex":236,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　モニターに釘付けになる<tips=1>亮</tips>の隣で、<tips=54>健慈朗</tips>は溜息をつく。","en":"Beside <tips=1>Ryo</tips>, whose eyes remained fixed upon the monitor, <tips=54>Kenjiro</tips> sighed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X4:r237","rowIndex":237,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼は<tips=1>亮</tips>に比べて落ち着いたように見えているが、内心はこの少年以上に動揺していた。","en":"Compared with <tips=1>Ryo</tips>, he appeared calm, but inwardly he was even more shaken than the boy.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X4:r238","rowIndex":238,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　理由はわからない。朝起きて初めてこの姿を見てから、何か畏怖に似たような感情が彼を支配し、慄然とさせているのである。","en":"He did not know why. Ever since he first saw this form upon waking that morning, something like awe had possessed him and filled him with dread.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X4:r239","rowIndex":239,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　途轍もなく恐ろしいことを、しようとしているのかもしれない。","en":"Perhaps he was attempting something unimaginably terrible.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X4:r240","rowIndex":240,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼は宗教家ではなかった。いかなる神も信仰も信じてはいなかった。しかし、この恐怖は宗教的と言うべきものだろう。","en":"He was not religious and believed in neither gods nor any faith. Yet this fear could only be called religious.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X4:r241","rowIndex":241,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　何か訳の分からないものに触れようとしている――あるいは触れてしまった、そんな恐怖であった。","en":"It was the terror of reaching toward something incomprehensible—or of having already touched it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X4:r242","rowIndex":242,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……なあ<tips=1>亮</tips>。この実験はここで終わりにしないか？」","en":"“...<tips=1>Ryo</tips>. Should we end this experiment here?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐健慈朗","displayName":"Kenjiro Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X4:r243","rowIndex":243,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その言葉で、<tips=1>亮</tips>はびっくりして振り返り、目を見開いた。","en":"<tips=1>Ryo</tips> spun toward him in astonishment, his eyes wide.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X4:r244","rowIndex":244,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「もう充分じゃないか。充分大きくなった。しかしこれから先は、我々の扱える領域ではない気がするよ」","en":"“Hasn’t this gone far enough? She’s grown large enough. But I have a feeling that whatever comes next will be beyond anything we can handle.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐健慈朗","displayName":"Kenjiro Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X4:r245","rowIndex":245,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「駄目だよ！　なんてことを言うんだ」","en":"“No! How can you say that?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮（少年時代）","displayName":"Tse Leung (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X4:r246","rowIndex":246,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>の顔はトマトのように真っ赤に染まる。怒っているようであった。","en":"<tips=1>Ryo’s</tips> face turned as red as a tomato. He looked angry.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X4:r247","rowIndex":247,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「終わりにするって、バカじゃないの？　じゃあこんな風になった『<tips=55>松子</tips>』はどうするのさ？」","en":"“End it? Are you stupid? What do you mean to do with <tips=55>Matsuko</tips> now that she has become like this?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮（少年時代）","displayName":"Tse Leung (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X4:r248","rowIndex":248,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……<tips=8>グレートホール</tips>に返そう。あそこなら、こんな生き物を自然に受け入れてくれるような気がするよ」","en":"“...Let’s return her to the <tips=8>Great Hole</tips>. I feel as though a place like that could accept a creature like this without question.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐健慈朗","displayName":"Kenjiro Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X4:r249","rowIndex":249,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「『<tips=8>グレートホール</tips>教』信者の言い分みたいだ！　ばかばかしい。あそこはただの穴だって教えてくれたのは<tips=54>汐さん</tips>でしょう！　どうしちゃったんだい？　まるで科学者らしくない。そんな世迷い言を口にして……」","en":"“You sound like a believer in the ‘Church of the <tips=8>Great Hole</tips>’! How ridiculous. You were the one who taught me that it’s only a hole, <tips=54>Mr. Shio</tips>! What happened to you? You don’t sound like a scientist at all, talking such nonsense...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮（少年時代）","displayName":"Tse Leung (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X4:r250","rowIndex":250,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>は興奮して、手を口元にやると、爪を噛みちぎる。少し指を噛んで唇に血がついた。","en":"Agitated, <tips=1>Ryo</tips> raised a hand to his mouth and bit at his nails until he caught the finger itself, leaving blood upon his lips.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X4:r251","rowIndex":251,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それは普段中華料理屋の夫婦に窘められている悪癖で、普段は出ないがこんな時には出てしまう。","en":"The couple at the Chinese restaurant often scolded him for the habit. He normally kept it under control, but at times like this it came out.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X4:r252","rowIndex":252,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　本人も気がついて、あわてて手を下ろすと、","en":"Ryo realized what he was doing, hurriedly lowered his hand, and said,","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X4:r253","rowIndex":253,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ここまで来たものを、捨てるなんてどうかしている！　この先を見ようよ。きっと、この子は人間になるんだよ。僕や<tips=54>汐さん</tips>と同じ人間さ。歩いて、泣いたり笑ったりするんだ。どんな子になるか見ようよ。それを途中で捨てるだなんて……生きてるのに。これを捨てるなんて、そんなの科学者じゃなくても、人間として許されないことだよ」","en":"“You’d have to be crazy to throw away something that’s come this far! Let’s see what happens next. I know this child is going to become human—a human being just like me and <tips=54>Mr. Shio</tips>. She’ll walk, cry, and laugh. Let’s see what kind of person she becomes. To throw her away before then... when she’s alive... Scientist or not, doing that would be unforgivable for any human being.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮（少年時代）","displayName":"Tse Leung (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X4:r254","rowIndex":254,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>は椅子を立ち上がると培養器に駆け寄り、","en":"<tips=1>Ryo</tips> sprang from his chair and ran to the culture vessel:","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X4:r255","rowIndex":255,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ほら、みてよ！　もう心臓が動いてる。これを止めようだなんて、本当に言えるの？　<tips=54>汐さん</tips>は？　これは死体とは全然ちがうよ。生きているんだ……」","en":"“Look! Her heart is already beating. Can you really say we should stop it? What about you, <tips=54>Mr. Shio</tips>? This is nothing like a corpse. She’s alive...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮（少年時代）","displayName":"Tse Leung (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X4:r256","rowIndex":256,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして俯いた。","en":"Then he lowered his head.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X4:r257","rowIndex":257,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その様子を見て<tips=54>健慈朗</tips>は、何も言わない<tips=1>亮</tips>も、やはり父親のことを気にしているのだろうと感じた。","en":"Watching him, <tips=54>Kenjiro</tips> felt that although <tips=1>Ryo</tips> never spoke of the matter, the boy must indeed be troubled by thoughts of his father.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X4:r258","rowIndex":258,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=18>ローズ・クラブ</tips>崩壊の前後、確かに街には彼の言うように『死体があふれ』ていたが、その原因は彼の父親<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>が引き起こした抗争と混乱に他ならない。","en":"Before and after the <tips=18>Rose Club’s</tips> fall, the streets had indeed ‘filled with corpses,’ as Ryo said. The cause was none other than the conflict and disorder set in motion by his father, <tips=3>Chris Tse</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X4:r259","rowIndex":259,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「僕はこの子が大きくなるところを見てみたい。<tips=54>汐さん</tips>がいやなら、僕一人だってやる」","en":"“I want to see this child grow. If you refuse, <tips=54>Mr. Shio</tips>, I’ll do it by myself.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮（少年時代）","displayName":"Tse Leung (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X4:r260","rowIndex":260,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして見上げたその瞳には、光るものがにじんでいる。","en":"When he raised his face, moisture shone in his eyes.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X4:r261","rowIndex":261,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　気丈で、およそ泣き顔というものを見せない彼の目に涙が浮かぶのを、<tips=54>健慈朗</tips>ははじめて見た。","en":"Ryo was brave and never showed anything resembling a tearful face. This was the first time <tips=54>Kenjiro</tips> had seen tears gather in his eyes.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X4:r262","rowIndex":262,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「わかった。このまま実験を続けよう。……お前の言う通りだ。おれは、どうも気の迷いにでも囚われていたようだ」","en":"“All right. We’ll continue the experiment. ...You’re right. I must have lost my head for a moment.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐健慈朗","displayName":"Kenjiro Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X4:r263","rowIndex":263,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=54>健慈朗</tips>は諦めて目を閉じた。","en":"Resigned, <tips=54>Kenjiro</tips> closed his eyes.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X4:r264","rowIndex":264,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"『<tips=55>松子</tips>』はそのまま目覚ましいスピードで成長した。","en":"“<tips=55>Matsuko</tips>” continued to develop at a remarkable rate.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X4:r265","rowIndex":265,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　最初は普通の胎児よりはるかに大きく、このままではありえないほど巨大な赤ん坊になるのではと思われたが、ある時点からサイズは徐々に小さくなり、最終的には一般的な人間のものと同じくなった。","en":"At first, she remained much larger than an ordinary fetus, and it seemed she might become an impossibly gigantic infant. Beyond a certain point, however, her size gradually diminished until it ultimately matched that of an ordinary human being.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X4:r266","rowIndex":266,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　いかにも胎児といった姿から、人間の赤ん坊の姿に近づく。音に反応するようになり、手や足を動かす……それらの仕草は、母親の胎内にいる普通の赤ん坊と変わらない。アメーバ状の姿の時に片鱗を見せていた、言語への高い理解は確認出来なかった。","en":"Her fetus-like form approached that of a human infant. She began responding to sound and moving her hands and feet. In those respects, she differed little from an ordinary child within its mother’s womb. The remarkable understanding of language she had hinted at in her amoeba-like form could no longer be confirmed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X4:r267","rowIndex":267,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして、本来なら出産の時期と思われる成長段階に至ったところで、培養器からベビーベッドへと移した。","en":"When her development reached the stage at which birth would ordinarily occur, they moved her from the culture vessel to a crib.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X4:r268","rowIndex":268,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=54>健慈朗</tips>は彼女のために戸籍を偽造し、彼女は正真正銘彼の娘となった。","en":"<tips=54>Kenjiro</tips> forged a family registration for her, and from that moment on she was truly his daughter.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X4:r269","rowIndex":269,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"『<tips=55>松子</tips>』は培養器から取り出したあとももの凄いスピードで成長をしたが、徐々にゆるやかになり、やがて普通に観察しているだけでは他の子供と成長の差を感じなくなった。","en":"<tips=55>Matsuko</tips> continued growing at a tremendous rate after leaving the culture vessel, but the pace gradually slowed. Eventually, simple observation no longer revealed any difference between her growth and that of other children.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X4:r270","rowIndex":270,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　この間、<tips=1>亮</tips>は毎日彼女の世話をし、培養器のなかにいたときと同様、色々なことを教え込んだ。","en":"Throughout this period, <tips=1>Ryo</tips> cared for her every day and continued teaching her all manner of things, just as he had while she remained inside the culture vessel.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X4:r271","rowIndex":271,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=55>松子</tips>は感情の薄い、何事にも反応が鈍い子で、<tips=54>健慈朗</tips>の目にはどこかロボットめいた、いかにも人造人間といった姿に映った。","en":"<tips=55>Matsuko</tips> was a child of muted emotion and slow responses. To <tips=54>Kenjiro’s</tips> eyes, she appeared somehow robotic—the very image of an artificial human.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X4:r272","rowIndex":272,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　最終的に<tips=55>松子</tips>は<tips=1>亮</tips>と同じくらいの肉体年齢になった。","en":"<tips=55>Matsuko</tips> ultimately reached approximately the same physical age as <tips=1>Ryo</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X4:r273","rowIndex":273,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　見かけは全く普通の少女のようだが、実際には少し違う。","en":"To look at her, she was an entirely ordinary girl. In reality, she was not.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X4:r274","rowIndex":274,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　極めて高い<tips=72>傾向値</tips>を持ち、実際<tips=17>タイプB</tips>の金色の目が常に開いているが、その段階に至った<tips=17>タイプB</tips>なら当然困らされるはずの症状が一切出ない。","en":"She possessed an exceptionally high <tips=72>tendency value</tips>. Indeed, her golden <tips=17>Type B</tips> eyes remained open at all times, yet none of the symptoms that should ordinarily afflict a <tips=17>Type B</tips> who had reached that stage ever appeared.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X4:r275","rowIndex":275,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　傷を付けても、すぐに再生する。","en":"Any wound she suffered healed almost immediately.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X4:r276","rowIndex":276,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　身体能力は<tips=17>タイプB</tips>らしく常人離れしている。しかも常に。","en":"As befitted a <tips=17>Type B</tips>, her physical abilities were far beyond those of an ordinary human—and remained so at all times.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X4:r277","rowIndex":277,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しかし、立っているだけでは誰もそれには気がつかない。","en":"Yet no one could tell any of this merely by seeing her stand still.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X4:r278","rowIndex":278,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　この大人しい少女がまさか死体置き場の肉片の変化したものだとは、誰も想像出来るはずもない。","en":"No one could possibly have imagined that this quiet girl had developed from a piece of flesh in a dumping ground for corpses.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X4:r279","rowIndex":279,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=54>健慈朗</tips>が若い時に別れた女のところから帰って来た娘だと説明すれば、誰もがそう信じた。","en":"<tips=54>Kenjiro</tips> told people she was his daughter, newly returned after living with a woman he had left in his youth, and everyone believed him.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}}]},{"position":32,"code":"F2","unitId":"F2","rows":[{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r1","rowIndex":1,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちに住む場所はあったが、そこは帰る場所ではなかった。","en":"We had somewhere to live, but it was no home to return to.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r2","rowIndex":2,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちは、永遠に帰る場所を失ったと考えていた。","en":"We believed we had lost that place forever.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r3","rowIndex":3,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それは、いかなる方法によっても再び手に入れることが出来ない完全な喪失だ。","en":"It was a complete loss, something no means in the world could ever restore to us.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r4","rowIndex":4,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　帰る場所がある、というのはきっと幸福なことだろうと私たちは想像していた。","en":"We imagined that having a place to return to must be a happy thing.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r5","rowIndex":5,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　キッチンで目を覚ました<tips=63>サーシェンカ</tips>は、それまでのことを何も知覚していないようで、彼が目を覚ます寸前まで全く別の男の姿をとっていたということも理解していなかった。","en":"When <tips=63>Sashenka</tips> awoke in the kitchen, he seemed unaware of everything that had happened. He did not understand that, until the instant before he woke, his body had worn the form of an entirely different man.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r6","rowIndex":6,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その男が殺人を行い続けているという事実もしらないようだった。ただ、食器棚に並んだ包みの正体は知っているらしく、それらを眺めると目を細めた。","en":"Nor did he appear to know that the man had continued committing murders. He did seem to know what lay inside the parcels arrayed along the cupboards, however. His eyes narrowed as he looked at them.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r7","rowIndex":7,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いつもこうだ。誰が、どうして、こんなことをするんだろう……？　僕に見せようとしているのか……」","en":"“It’s always like this. Who keeps doing this, and why...? Are they trying to show me all of it...?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"サーシェンカ白シャツ","displayName":"Sashenka (White Shirt)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r8","rowIndex":8,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちは何を説明するべきか迷った。","en":"We did not know what we ought to explain.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r9","rowIndex":9,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼の身体は眠っている間に別の男に変身し、殺人を繰り返している。――今までずっと彼は自分自身のこの事実を知らないでいたようだが、今私たちの手にはそれを報せるかどうかの選択権がある。","en":"While he slept, his body transformed into another man and committed murder after murder. All this time, he had apparently known nothing of what his own body was doing—but now it was up to us whether to tell him.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r10","rowIndex":10,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちの基本的な考え方からすれば、事実というものは常に明らかにされるべきだし、彼にもそれを知る権利と責任があるし、すべてを伝えると約束もした。","en":"By our fundamental way of thinking, facts ought always to be brought into the open. He had both a right and a responsibility to know. We had promised to tell him everything as well.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r11","rowIndex":11,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しかし、簡単に伝えることは出来なかった。彼に今見たありのままの真実を打ち明けた場合、どうなってしまうのか。それを予測するための情報があまりにも欠けていた。彼の背景には、私たちの知らないいくつもの要素が隠されている。","en":"But we could not simply tell him. What would happen if we revealed the truth of what we had just seen, exactly as it was? We knew far too little to predict the answer. Too much about his past remained hidden from us.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r12","rowIndex":12,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なんだか凄く憂鬱な気分だ……。今だけ、一人にしてくれない？　また今度、時間をとってゆっくり話そう……」","en":"“I’m feeling terribly low... Could you leave me alone, just for now? We’ll make time to sit down and talk another day...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"サーシェンカ白シャツ","displayName":"Sashenka (White Shirt)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r13","rowIndex":13,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=63>サーシェンカ</tips>はそう言ってうなだれた。","en":"With those words, <tips=63>Sashenka</tips> let his head hang.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r14","rowIndex":14,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちは大人しくそれに従い、屋敷を後にした。","en":"We did as he asked without protest and left the mansion.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r15","rowIndex":15,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その後、何回かその建物に様子を見に行ったが、<tips=63>サーシェンカ</tips>も、例の男も見つけることが出来なかった。","en":"We returned to the building several times afterward to see how matters stood, but could find neither <tips=63>Sashenka</tips> nor the other man.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r16","rowIndex":16,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちは、<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>という名前について少し調べた。","en":"We looked into the name <tips=20>Koschei</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r17","rowIndex":17,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その名前で調べて出て来るもので、もっとも有名なのはロシアの西部を出身とする連続殺人犯だった。その人物は私たちが建物で見た<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>のように、女性をバラバラに切り刻む殺人鬼だ。","en":"The most famous person we found associated with that name was a serial killer from western Russia. Like the <tips=20>Koschei</tips> we had seen in the building, he murdered women and hacked their bodies to pieces.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r18","rowIndex":18,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"『<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>』というのは、まだ彼の本名が明らかになっていないころに、警察やメディアによってつけられたものだそうだ。","en":"‘<tips=20>Koschei</tips>’ was apparently a name bestowed by the police and the media before his real name became known.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r19","rowIndex":19,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　この『<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>』があの青年と関係しているのだと私たちは考えた。","en":"We believed that this ‘<tips=20>Koschei</tips>’ had some connection to the young man.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r20","rowIndex":20,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しかし、当人ではないのだろう。記録にある彼の活動時期はあまりにも古い。最初の殺人は２０年以上前に行われている。記録からすればこの『<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>』は５０才近くになっていなければおかしいはずで、私たちが見た青年は、そんな年齢ではない。","en":"But he was probably not the man himself. The activity in the record went back far too long: the first murder had occurred more than twenty years earlier. By that account, this ‘<tips=20>Koschei</tips>’ ought to have been nearly fifty. The young man we had seen was nowhere near that age.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r21","rowIndex":21,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　同じ名を名乗る別人だと考えるのが自然だろう。その場合、本物と何か関係があるのか、それともただ名を使っているだけなのか。いや、やっぱりそれとも本人なのか。","en":"The natural conclusion was that he was someone else using the same name. If so, was he connected to the original, or was he merely using the name? No—or was he the man himself after all?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r22","rowIndex":22,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　いずれにしろ私たちにとっては興味深かった。","en":"Whatever the case, we found it intriguing.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r23","rowIndex":23,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼に訊きたいことはあったが、私たちはひとまずその場を引き下がった。","en":"We had questions for him, but for the moment we let the matter rest.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r24","rowIndex":24,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そんな私たちに、また別のニュースが飛び込んで来た。","en":"Then another piece of news came our way.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r25","rowIndex":25,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「おい、お前ら」","en":"“Hey, you two.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"深沢聡","displayName":"Satoshi Fukazawa","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r26","rowIndex":26,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その日、私たちは団地の廊下で呼び止められた。","en":"That day, we were stopped in a corridor of the housing complex.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r27","rowIndex":27,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あ、<tips=14>深沢聡</tips>」","en":"“Oh. <tips=14>Satoshi Fukazawa</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r28","rowIndex":28,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「その呼び方はやめろっていつも言ってるだろ」","en":"“I’m always telling you not to call me that.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r29","rowIndex":29,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼は顔を顰める。","en":"His face twisted into a scowl.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r30","rowIndex":30,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=14>深沢</tips>は父の知り合いで、両親が亡くなったあとは私たちの保護者というかたちになっている男だ。","en":"<tips=14>Fukazawa</tips> had known our father. After our parents died, he became our guardian, or something resembling one.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r31","rowIndex":31,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=14>深沢</tips>は団地内で威張っており、彼に逆らうものはいない。普段の仕事は何をしているかしらない。いつもオーダーメイドのピカピカと艶のあるスーツを着ている。","en":"<tips=14>Fukazawa</tips> threw his weight around inside the housing complex, and no one dared defy him. We had no idea what he did for a living. He always wore gleaming, custom-tailored suits.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r32","rowIndex":32,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>のヤツが死んだぞ。今日、<tips=57>滑走路通り</tips>を<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>の連中が葬列をつくって練り歩くみたいだ。これからこの街に混乱が起きる。混乱が起これば、金が儲かる。なあ、稼ぎ時だぞ！」","en":"“<tips=3>Chris Tse</tips> is dead. It looks like the <tips=7>YS</tips> men are going to form a funeral procession and parade down <tips=57>Runway Street</tips> today. This city is headed for chaos. And when there’s chaos, there’s money to be made. Hey—this is our chance to cash in!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"深沢聡","displayName":"Satoshi Fukazawa","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r33","rowIndex":33,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=14>深沢</tips>は笑いながら言った。","en":"<tips=14>Fukazawa</tips> said it with a laugh.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r34","rowIndex":34,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それでちょっとお前らに頼みがあるんだが、<tips=3>クリス</tips>の息子の<tips=1>ツェー・ルオン</tips>がこの街に戻っているらしいじゃないか。<tips=1>ツェー・ルオン</tips>ってのはおまえらがつるんでいたあの<tips=1>菅原亮</tips>と同一人物だそうだな。なあ、何か連絡手段はあるか？　あれば、今度紹介してほしいんだが……」","en":"“So, I have a little favor to ask of you. I hear <tips=3>Chris’s</tips> son, <tips=1>Tse Leung</tips>, is back in the city. This <tips=1>Tse Leung</tips> is the same person as that <tips=1>Ryo Sugawara</tips> you used to run around with, right? Hey, do you have any way to contact him? If you do, I’d like you to introduce me sometime…”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"深沢聡","displayName":"Satoshi Fukazawa","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r35","rowIndex":35,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=1>菅原亮</tips>の連絡先なんか知らないわ」","en":"“We don’t have <tips=1>Ryo Sugawara’s</tips> contact information.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r36","rowIndex":36,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「私たち、あいつのこと好きじゃないもの」","en":"“We don’t like him.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r37","rowIndex":37,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そう言わずにさ。知らないわけないだろ。昔は毎日のようにつるんでいたじゃないか……」","en":"“Oh, come on. You have to know. You used to run around with him practically every day…”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"深沢聡","displayName":"Satoshi Fukazawa","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r38","rowIndex":38,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しつこく尋ねる<tips=14>深沢</tips>に、私たちは頑として首を縦に振らない。","en":"<tips=14>Fukazawa</tips> kept pressing us, but we steadfastly refused.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r39","rowIndex":39,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「おい、いい加減にしろよ。誰が育ててやったと思ってるんだ」","en":"“Hey, that’s enough. Who do you think raised you?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"深沢聡","displayName":"Satoshi Fukazawa","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r40","rowIndex":40,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　低い声ですごみをきかせて<tips=14>深沢</tips>は言う。","en":"<tips=14>Fukazawa</tips> said it in a low, menacing voice.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r41","rowIndex":41,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちはそれを見て笑った。","en":"We laughed at the sight.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r42","rowIndex":42,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「怒ったところで何が出来るの？」","en":"“What can you do, even if you get angry?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r43","rowIndex":43,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「別にあなたに頼んで育てて貰った覚えはないのに」","en":"“We don’t remember asking you to raise us.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r44","rowIndex":44,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なあ、そう言わないで教えておくれよ」","en":"“Come on. Please, just tell me.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"深沢聡","displayName":"Satoshi Fukazawa","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r45","rowIndex":45,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=14>深沢</tips>は急に弱気になって肩をすくめる。","en":"<tips=14>Fukazawa</tips> abruptly wilted and gave a shrug.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r46","rowIndex":46,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いやだ」","en":"“No.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r47","rowIndex":47,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「遊びに行ってくる」","en":"“We’re going out to play.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r48","rowIndex":48,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちは彼にそう伝えて、その場を後にした。","en":"We told him as much and left.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r49","rowIndex":49,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　天気予報では、一日中雨が降ったり止んだりするということで、外に出て空を見上げるとたしかに厚い雲が空を覆っていた。","en":"The weather forecast said the rain would start and stop throughout the day. Sure enough, when we stepped outside and looked up, thick clouds covered the sky.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r50","rowIndex":50,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　団地内の広場のあちこちで、人が何人かずつ集まって難しい顔で話し込んでいる。彼らはいずれも、<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>の死について話しているようだった。","en":"Small groups had gathered here and there in the housing complex courtyard, talking with grave expressions. All of them appeared to be discussing the death of <tips=3>Chris Tse</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r51","rowIndex":51,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=1>菅原亮</tips>のお父さんが死んだ」","en":"“<tips=1>Ryo Sugawara’s</tips> father is dead.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r52","rowIndex":52,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「これで、血の繋がった本当の親が両方亡くなったってことだね」","en":"“So now both of his biological parents are dead.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r53","rowIndex":53,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あの<tips=1>菅原亮</tips>でも、悲しんだりするのかな？」","en":"“Do you suppose even <tips=1>Ryo Sugawara</tips> feels sad?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r54","rowIndex":54,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どうだろう。……知らないわあんなやつ」","en":"“Who knows? ...I don’t care about a guy like him.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r55","rowIndex":55,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうだね。私たちには関係ない」","en":"“That’s true. It has nothing to do with us.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r56","rowIndex":56,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちはそれで<tips=1>菅原亮</tips>に関する話題を打ち切って、<tips=9>Y地区</tips>の繁華街の方へ足を向けた。","en":"That brought our discussion of <tips=1>Ryo Sugawara</tips> to a close, and we set out for the busy quarter of <tips=9>Y District</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r57","rowIndex":57,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=57>滑走路通り</tips>の沿道には、あきらかに付近の住民と思われる人々が、エプロンや作業着を身につけたままぞろぞろと集まって来ている。そして彼らは囁き合っている。","en":"People who were obviously neighborhood residents streamed toward the sides of <tips=57>Runway Street</tips>, still wearing aprons or work clothes. They whispered among themselves.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r58","rowIndex":58,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「みんな、<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>の葬列を見に来たのかな」","en":"“Do you think they’ve all come to watch <tips=3>Chris Tse’s</tips> funeral procession?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r59","rowIndex":59,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「さあ？　サーカスのパレードでも始まるのかもね」","en":"“Who knows? Maybe a circus parade is about to start.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r60","rowIndex":60,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　今まさにその葬列がやって来るところらしく、向こうからざわめきのような声が沸き起こる。","en":"At that very moment, the procession seemed to be approaching, and a murmur rose from farther down the street.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r61","rowIndex":61,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　せっかくだし見ていこうと、私たちも見物人たちに混じってそこに立ち止まった。","en":"Since we were there, we decided to watch and stopped among the onlookers.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r62","rowIndex":62,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　雨がぽつぽつと降り始め、同時に道の向こうから黒塗りの何台ものオープンカーがやって来た。","en":"Drops of rain began to fall. At the same time, several black open-top cars appeared at the far end of the road.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r63","rowIndex":63,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　オープンカーはのろのろと、まるで周囲に対していかに死者が重要な人物であったかを見せつけるようにゆっくりとこちらへ向かって来る。","en":"The open-top cars crawled toward us, as if their very slowness were meant to impress upon the onlookers just how important the dead man had been.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r64","rowIndex":64,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちは<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>にも<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>にも興味はなかったし、やらなくてはいけないこともあったのに、そこに立ち止まって、その列が来るのを待ってしまった。","en":"We had no interest in <tips=3>Chris Tse</tips> or <tips=7>YS</tips>, and we had things to do, yet we found ourselves standing there, waiting for the procession to arrive.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r65","rowIndex":65,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その先頭の車には見知った顔が黒い喪服を着て座っている。","en":"In the lead car sat someone we recognized, dressed in black mourning clothes.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r66","rowIndex":66,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=1>菅原亮</tips>だよ」","en":"“It’s <tips=1>Ryo Sugawara</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r67","rowIndex":67,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「すまし顔しちゃって」","en":"“Look at him sitting there so prim and proper.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r68","rowIndex":68,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちは顔を顰めた。","en":"We scowled.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r69","rowIndex":69,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あいつ、<tips=14>深沢聡</tips>が言うようにこのままえらくなっちゃって、この街のボスになるつもりなのかしら？」","en":"“Do you think he means to go on climbing the ladder the way <tips=14>Satoshi Fukazawa</tips> said, until he becomes the boss of this city?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r70","rowIndex":70,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうだろうね。いやだな」","en":"“Probably. I don’t like it.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r71","rowIndex":71,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　葬列は長い。スーツを着たいかつい男たちが乗り込んでいて、私たちにはわからないが、その中には幹部もいるのだろう。","en":"The funeral procession was long, its cars filled with intimidating men in suits. We could not tell them apart, but some were probably high-ranking members of the organization.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r72","rowIndex":72,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　もし敵対組織がその気になれば、今こそ狙撃のチャンスかもしれないが、それを承知の上でゆっくりと無防備な行進をしているのが、<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>の権勢というものを誇示しているようだ。","en":"If a rival organization were so inclined, now might be an ideal opportunity for a sniper. Yet their slow, defenseless march in full awareness of that risk seemed calculated to flaunt <tips=7>YS’s</tips> power.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r73","rowIndex":73,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それとも、何か目に見えない防備があるのだろうか。<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>にはサイキックもいると、私たちは聞いている。","en":"Or perhaps they had defenses we could not see. We had heard that <tips=7>YS</tips> even had psychics.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r74","rowIndex":74,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　いつまでものんびりとこの退屈な行列を眺めてはいられない。","en":"We could not stand around forever idly watching this dull procession.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r75","rowIndex":75,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　完全に通り過ぎる前に、私たちは人混みのなかを通り抜け、<tips=63>サーシェンカ</tips>の家へ向かった。","en":"Before the procession had fully passed, we slipped through the crowd and headed for <tips=63>Sashenka’s</tips> house.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r76","rowIndex":76,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　最近ではほとんど日課となっているコースだ。","en":"Lately, this route had become part of our daily routine.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r77","rowIndex":77,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　今日も、館には人の気配がしなかった。","en":"There was no sign of anyone in the mansion today, either.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r78","rowIndex":78,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「引っ越したのかな？」","en":"“Do you think he moved away?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r79","rowIndex":79,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうかもしれない。ここで死体といつまでも暮らすわけにはいかないだろうし」","en":"“Maybe. He couldn’t keep living here with the bodies forever.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r80","rowIndex":80,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「街を出て行ったのかな？」","en":"“Do you think he left the city?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r81","rowIndex":81,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「国を出て行ったかも」","en":"“Maybe he left the country.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r82","rowIndex":82,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そんなことを話し合いながらぐるりと建物の周りを回ると、","en":"We were circling the building as we talked when—","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r83","rowIndex":83,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あっ！」","en":"“Ah!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r84","rowIndex":84,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いた！　変態だ！」","en":"“There he is! The pervert!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r85","rowIndex":85,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちは、あのときキッチンで話した男を見つけた。<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>と名乗ったあの男だ。","en":"We had found the man we spoke to in the kitchen that day—the man who called himself <tips=20>Koschei</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r86","rowIndex":86,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　前と同じ服装で、大きなカバンを持つ彼は私たちの声に振り返ると、顔をしかめる。","en":"He wore the same clothes as before and carried a large bag. At the sound of our voices, he turned and grimaced.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r87","rowIndex":87,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「大きな声を出すな」","en":"“Keep your voices down.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アレクセイ","displayName":"Alexei","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r88","rowIndex":88,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼は人差し指を唇にあて、そう怒る。","en":"He put an index finger to his lips and scolded us.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r89","rowIndex":89,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「やっと見つけたわ」","en":"“We finally found you.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r90","rowIndex":90,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=63>サーシェンカ</tips>にかわって。それが出来ないなら、代わりにいろいろ話して貰う」","en":"“Turn back into <tips=63>Sashenka</tips>. If you can’t, then you can answer all our questions in his place.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r91","rowIndex":91,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「相変わらず偉そうなやつらだな。どうしておれにつきまとうんだ」","en":"“You two are as high-and-mighty as ever. Why do you keep following me around?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アレクセイ","displayName":"Alexei","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r92","rowIndex":92,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あなたたち、とっても面白いよ」","en":"“You two are really funny.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r93","rowIndex":93,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「すごく馬鹿みたいで」","en":"“You both look so incredibly stupid.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r94","rowIndex":94,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「勝手なことを言いやがって。おれはおまえらのようなタイプは好みじゃない」","en":"“You say whatever suits you. Girls like you aren’t my type.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アレクセイ","displayName":"Alexei","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r95","rowIndex":95,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それに、話をしてくれるって約束したのに、結局何も説明してもらってない」","en":"“Besides, you promised to talk to us, and in the end you didn’t explain a thing.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r96","rowIndex":96,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「変態だからって嘘をつくなんて最低だよ」","en":"“Being a pervert is no excuse to lie. You’re the worst.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r97","rowIndex":97,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちが問い詰めると、彼は手を振って追い払うマネをし、","en":"When we pressed him, he made a shooing motion with one hand.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r98","rowIndex":98,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「今日はおまえらに構っている暇はない。用事があるんだ」","en":"“I don’t have time for you two today. I’ve got things to do.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アレクセイ","displayName":"Alexei","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r99","rowIndex":99,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　くるりと私たちに背を向けて、道の向こうへと歩き出した。","en":"He wheeled around and started down the road with his back to us.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r100","rowIndex":100,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ちょっと！」","en":"“Hey!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r101","rowIndex":101,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「待ってよ！」","en":"“Wait!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r102","rowIndex":102,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　後を追う私たちを引き離そうと、彼は駆け足になって路地を曲がった。","en":"He broke into a run to lose us and turned down an alley.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r103","rowIndex":103,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「逃げようだなんて甘いわ！」","en":"“You won’t get away that easily!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r104","rowIndex":104,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=17>タイプB</tips>の力を発動させて一人がその後を追ったが、いまさっきそこを曲がったばかりなのに、もう姿が見えない。","en":"One of us activated her <tips=17>Type B</tips> power and raced after him. Yet although he had only just rounded the corner, he was already nowhere to be seen.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r105","rowIndex":105,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どうしたの？」","en":"“What happened?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r106","rowIndex":106,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　困って立ち止まっていると、もう一人が追いつく。","en":"As she stood there at a loss, the other caught up.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r107","rowIndex":107,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どこにもいないの……」","en":"“He’s nowhere...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r108","rowIndex":108,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そんな……塀を乗り越えたのかしら？」","en":"“That can’t be... Do you think he climbed over the wall?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r109","rowIndex":109,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「でも、なんの物音もしなかったよ」","en":"“But there wasn’t a sound.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r110","rowIndex":110,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちはしばらくあたりを探し回ったが、結局彼を見つけることが出来ず、<tips=57>滑走路通り</tips>へと戻った。","en":"We searched the area for a while, but in the end we could not find him and returned to <tips=57>Runway Street</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r111","rowIndex":111,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=57>滑走路通り</tips>はすでに葬列が過ぎ去り、集まっていた見物人の姿は見えなくなっていた。","en":"The procession had already passed along <tips=57>Runway Street</tips>, and none of the onlookers remained.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r112","rowIndex":112,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　雨は止んだが、まだ空は灰色の雲が覆っている。","en":"The rain had stopped, but gray clouds still covered the sky.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r113","rowIndex":113,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まだ探す？」","en":"“Do we keep looking?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r114","rowIndex":114,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「姿消えちゃったんだもん。どこ行ったかわからないよ。諦めて、ご飯食べようか」","en":"“He vanished. We don’t know where he went. Let’s give up and get something to eat.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r115","rowIndex":115,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうね。そうしよう」","en":"“Yeah. Let’s do that.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r116","rowIndex":116,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　空腹だった私たちは食べ物屋を物色しながら<tips=57>滑走路通り</tips>を歩いていた。すると、見知った顔がいるのを見つけた。","en":"Hungry, we walked down <tips=57>Runway Street</tips> looking for somewhere to eat. Then we spotted a familiar face.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r117","rowIndex":117,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それは私たちの幼なじみで、彼は階段に腰掛けて近くの屋台で売っている軽食のつつみを傍らに置いたままぼんやり考え事をしている。","en":"It was our childhood friend. He sat on a flight of steps, lost in thought, with a wrapped snack from a nearby food stall resting beside him.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r118","rowIndex":118,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あ、<tips=10>見土道夫</tips>」","en":"“Oh. <tips=10>Michio Mido</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r119","rowIndex":119,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「久しぶりに、ちょっとからかおうか？」","en":"“Shall we tease him? It’s been a while.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r120","rowIndex":120,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちは彼に見つからないようそっと建物の脇に回って、反対側から階段をのぼった。","en":"Careful not to let him see us, we quietly went around the side of the building and climbed the steps from the opposite direction.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r121","rowIndex":121,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして『ちから』を使って、その脇の軽食を空中にふわふわと浮かせ、私たちの手元に引き寄せる。","en":"Then we used our ‘power’ to float the snack gently into the air and draw it into our hands.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r122","rowIndex":122,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=42>サイキック探知機</tips>がけたたましく音を立てる。これだけ人がたくさん居る場所ならば、私たちが鳴らしたとは誰にもわからない。","en":"The <tips=42>psychic detector</tips> let out a deafening shriek. In a place this crowded, no one would know that we were the ones who had set it off.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r123","rowIndex":123,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あっ」","en":"“Ah.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫","displayName":"Michio Mido","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r124","rowIndex":124,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=10>見土</tips>は気がついて手を伸ばそうとするが、軽食はそれより早く私たちの手に収まる。","en":"<tips=10>Mido</tips> noticed and reached for it, but the snack landed in our hands before he could catch it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r125","rowIndex":125,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「おい、灰上」","en":"“Hey, Haigami.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫","displayName":"Michio Mido","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r126","rowIndex":126,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼は私たちを睨み付けた。","en":"He glared at us.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r127","rowIndex":127,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=10>見土道夫</tips>はあいかわらず迂闊だな！」","en":"“<tips=10>Michio Mido</tips> is as careless as ever!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r128","rowIndex":128,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちは笑って、包みをとき、中に入っていたパンを半分に分け合った。一口囓ると、中に挟まった甘塩っぱい羊肉の味が口のなかに広がる。","en":"We laughed, opened the parcel, and split the bread inside between us. At the first bite, the sweet and salty flavor of the mutton filling spread through our mouths.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r129","rowIndex":129,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「おい、人の夕飯をかっぱらうなよ。もうガキじゃないのに、まだいつも腹を空かせているのか？」","en":"“Hey, don’t swipe a man’s supper. You two aren’t kids anymore—are you still hungry all the time?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫","displayName":"Michio Mido","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r130","rowIndex":130,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=10>見土</tips>は怒るというよりも困ったようにそう言った。","en":"<tips=10>Mido</tips> sounded more troubled than angry.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r131","rowIndex":131,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうじゃない。あんたがあまりにもぼんやりとした顔で座っているからだよ」","en":"“That’s not why. You were sitting there with such a vacant look on your face.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r132","rowIndex":132,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「言うほどおかしな顔かなあ」","en":"“Did I really look that funny?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫","displayName":"Michio Mido","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r133","rowIndex":133,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼は首を捻る。","en":"He tilted his head.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r134","rowIndex":134,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「見てるだけで笑っちゃう」","en":"“Just looking at you makes me laugh.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r135","rowIndex":135,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして、私たちは奪い取ったパンをすべて食べてしまう。","en":"And with that, we finished all the bread we had stolen.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r136","rowIndex":136,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=10>見土</tips>は怒らない。呆れているだけだ。昔から何度もからかっているけれど、本気で怒った姿を見たことがない。","en":"<tips=10>Mido</tips> did not become angry. He was merely exasperated. We had teased him countless times since childhood, but had never once seen him truly lose his temper.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r137","rowIndex":137,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まあいいや。それにしても、久しぶりだなあ。学校生活はどうだ？　<tips=1>亮</tips>が通っていたのと同じ学校に通ってるんだろ？」","en":"“Never mind. Still, it’s been a while. How’s school? You go to the same school <tips=1>Ryo</tips> attended, right?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫","displayName":"Michio Mido","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r138","rowIndex":138,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「紹介してくれたあいつの性格と同じで、つまらなくて退屈で死にそう」","en":"“It’s just as dreary as the guy who recommended it. I’m bored to death.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r139","rowIndex":139,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=1>菅原亮</tips>にはすっかり騙されたわ。行くんじゃなかった！　毎日毎日、何かを覚えてそれをテストで書くだけの生活なんて、何が面白いのか！」","en":"“<tips=1>Ryo Sugawara</tips> completely deceived us. We never should have gone! Day after day, all we do is memorize something and write it down on a test. What could possibly be interesting about such a life?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r140","rowIndex":140,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちは顔をしかめた。","en":"We scowled.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r141","rowIndex":141,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「親切で紹介してやったんだろうに、あいつも悲しむぞ。あ、そうだ。最近この街にいるみたいだから会ったらどうだ？　懐かしいだろう」","en":"“He was only trying to help. He’d be sad to hear you say that. Oh, right—apparently he’s back in the city now. Why don’t you see him if you get the chance? You must miss him.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫","displayName":"Michio Mido","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r142","rowIndex":142,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼はそう言った。","en":"So he said.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r143","rowIndex":143,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちは、その<tips=1>菅原亮</tips>を先ほど見たばかりだが、その話はしたくなかった。","en":"We had only just seen <tips=1>Ryo Sugawara</tips>, but we did not want to talk about it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r144","rowIndex":144,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうらしいね。でも、いやだよ」","en":"“So we heard. But no.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r145","rowIndex":145,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あいつ気持ち悪いもの」","en":"“He’s disgusting.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r146","rowIndex":146,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>菅原亮</tips>と親友の<tips=10>見土</tips>は溜息をつく。","en":"<tips=10>Mido</tips>, <tips=1>Ryo Sugawara’s</tips> best friend, sighed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r147","rowIndex":147,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>菅原</tips>と<tips=10>見土</tips>は、ずっとこの辺りに住む子供たちのリーダーだった。<tips=1>菅原</tips>は進学のために街を離れたけれど、<tips=10>見土</tips>は引き続き子供時代の仲間と共に新しい仕事をはじめようとしている。","en":"<tips=1>Sugawara</tips> and <tips=10>Mido</tips> had long been the leaders of the neighborhood children. <tips=1>Sugawara</tips> left the city to continue his education, but <tips=10>Mido</tips> remained and was now trying to start a new business with his childhood friends.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r148","rowIndex":148,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=9>Y地区</tips>の新しい土産物を作り出して、仕事がないまま悪事に手を染める地域の若者たちに職を与えようというつもりらしい。","en":"Apparently, they intended to create new <tips=9>Y District</tips> souvenirs and provide work for local young people who, finding themselves unemployed, otherwise turned to crime.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r149","rowIndex":149,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　目的は立派だけれど、商売が軌道にのったとは言えない状況だ。","en":"The aim was admirable, but the business could hardly be said to have found its feet.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r150","rowIndex":150,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そもそも、<tips=10>見土</tips>は中立的な立場のつもりでいるが、『<tips=21>八龍会</tips>』という<tips=17>タイプB</tips>たちの秘密組織の御曹司である彼は、街の大人たちには多少なりとも色眼鏡で見られている。仮に商売がうまくいっても、彼の考えているように街全体の若者に影響を与えるというようなことはないだろう。<tips=17>タイプB</tips>を中心としたものになるはずだ。","en":"<tips=10>Mido</tips> considered himself neutral, but as heir to the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips>, a secret organization of <tips=17>Type Bs</tips>, the city’s adults inevitably viewed him with some prejudice. Even if his business succeeded, it was unlikely to influence young people throughout the city as he imagined. It would inevitably remain centered on <tips=17>Type Bs</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r151","rowIndex":151,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうか……それはともかく、丁度良かった。お前らに聞きたいことがあったんだよ」","en":"“I see... In any case, your timing is perfect. There was something I wanted to ask you.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫","displayName":"Michio Mido","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r152","rowIndex":152,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=10>見土</tips>は奪われた食事のことはもう忘れてくれたようだ。","en":"<tips=10>Mido</tips> seemed to have forgotten about the meal we had stolen from him.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r153","rowIndex":153,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「何？　手短にしてよね」","en":"“What? Make it quick.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r154","rowIndex":154,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=10>道夫</tips>の話って、いつも長すぎるのよ」","en":"“You always talk much too long, <tips=10>Michio</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r155","rowIndex":155,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いいから答えてくれよ。なあ、お前ら。この世界にたくさんいるノーマルたちと、自分たちミュータントの違いについて考えたことはあるか？　なぜ自分たちのような存在がこの世の中に生まれたのかってさ」","en":"“Just answer me. Tell me: have you ever thought about what makes us mutants different from all the Normals in the world? About why people like us were born in the first place?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫","displayName":"Michio Mido","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r156","rowIndex":156,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その質問に、私たちは顔を見合わせてしまう。","en":"The question made us look at each other.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r157","rowIndex":157,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あの<tips=10>見土道夫</tips>が、思春期になりたての子供みたいな哲学的な問いかけをしているわ」","en":"“Imagine <tips=10>Michio Mido</tips> asking philosophical questions like some kid who just hit puberty.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r158","rowIndex":158,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「大丈夫？　頭でも打ったんじゃないの？」","en":"“Are you all right? Did you hit your head?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r159","rowIndex":159,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「おい、たまには真面目におれの話を……」","en":"“Hey, once in a while, you could listen seriously when I—”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫","displayName":"Michio Mido","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r160","rowIndex":160,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それより、私たち、用事があるのよ」","en":"“Never mind that. We have somewhere to be.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r161","rowIndex":161,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そう、こんな寄り道をしている暇はないんだわ！　<tips=10>見土道夫</tips>があんまりからかいたくなる顔をしているから……」","en":"“That’s right! We don’t have time for detours like this! It’s just that <tips=10>Michio Mido</tips> has the kind of face you can’t help making fun of...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r162","rowIndex":162,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「おれのせいなのかよ」","en":"“So this is my fault?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫","displayName":"Michio Mido","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r163","rowIndex":163,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……私たち、とても面白い遊びを見つけたの」","en":"“...We found a really fun game.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r164","rowIndex":164,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「だからもう、<tips=10>見土道夫</tips>とは遊べないんだから。ごめんなさいね」","en":"“So we won’t be able to play with you anymore, <tips=10>Michio Mido</tips>. Sorry.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r165","rowIndex":165,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちが笑うと、<tips=10>見土</tips>は顔を顰める。","en":"We laughed, and <tips=10>Mido</tips> frowned.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r166","rowIndex":166,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ん、どういうことだ？」","en":"“Hm? What do you mean?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫","displayName":"Michio Mido","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r167","rowIndex":167,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それは言えないわ！」","en":"“We can’t tell you!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r168","rowIndex":168,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「用事があるの！　じゃあね！」","en":"“We have somewhere to be! See you!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r169","rowIndex":169,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「お、おい。ちょっと待て」","en":"“H-hey. Wait a moment.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫","displayName":"Michio Mido","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r170","rowIndex":170,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして私たちは、その場を離れた。","en":"And so we left him there.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r171","rowIndex":171,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「やっぱり、<tips=10>見土道夫</tips>をからかうと胸がすっとするね」","en":"“Teasing <tips=10>Michio Mido</tips> really does make us feel better.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r172","rowIndex":172,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうだね」","en":"“It does.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r173","rowIndex":173,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちは顔を見合わせてクスクスと笑った。","en":"We looked at each other and giggled.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r174","rowIndex":174,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その日はもう<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>を探すのを諦めたつもりだった。","en":"We had intended to call off our search for <tips=20>Koschei</tips> for the day.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r175","rowIndex":175,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しかし、知り合いの家を訪ねようと<tips=59>暗闇通り</tips>に足を踏み入れたとき、私たちは今日二度目の<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>との遭遇を果たした。","en":"But when we entered <tips=59>Darkness Street</tips> to visit an acquaintance, we encountered <tips=20>Koschei</tips> for the second time that day.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r176","rowIndex":176,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼は路地の奥の方へ進んでゆく。三丁目の方向だ。","en":"He was making his way farther into the alleys, toward Third Ward.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r177","rowIndex":177,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　今度は声をかけず、気づかれないよう注意しながらそのあとをつけ、彼が今日何をしているのか突き止めることにした。","en":"This time, we did not call out. We followed without letting him notice us, determined to find out what he was up to that day.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r178","rowIndex":178,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちはこの辺りに土地勘があり、一方相手はキョロキョロと辺りを見回しながら歩いて行く。簡単な追跡だと思っていたが、路地を曲がったところで彼の姿を見失った。","en":"We knew the area well, while he walked along looking this way and that. We thought he would be easy to follow, but when he turned into an alley, we lost sight of him.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r179","rowIndex":179,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　行き止まりの袋小路のなかで消えた。","en":"He vanished in a dead-end alley.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r180","rowIndex":180,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なにか、特殊な方法で移動しているのかしら？」","en":"“Do you suppose he has some special way of moving?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r181","rowIndex":181,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「サイキックなのかな？　キッチンで出会った時も何かありそうな口ぶりだったし」","en":"“Could he be psychic? The way he spoke when we met in the kitchen made it sound as though there was something more to him.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r182","rowIndex":182,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「でもあのときは『ちから』を使わなかった……」","en":"“But that time, he didn’t use his ‘power’…”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r183","rowIndex":183,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　どういうことなのかわからないが、私たちは今回は捜索を続行することにした。","en":"We did not know what was going on, but this time we decided to continue the search.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r184","rowIndex":184,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　サイキックの力を使っているのならば、どこかで探知機が鳴るかもしれない。それならば、見つかる可能性が高まる。","en":"If he was using a psychic power, one of the detectors might go off somewhere. That would improve our chances of finding him.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r185","rowIndex":185,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　捜しはじめてしばらくすると、雨がぽつりぽつりと降り始め、やがてジャアジャアと本降りになった。","en":"After we had searched for a while, scattered drops of rain began to fall. Before long, it was pouring.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r186","rowIndex":186,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちは折りたたみ傘を持っていたのでそれを取り出す。","en":"We had a folding umbrella with us, so we took it out.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r187","rowIndex":187,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しかし雨の中ではあまり効果的な捜索は出来そうにない。そろそろ諦めようとしたころ、銃声が聞こえた。","en":"But we could hardly search effectively in the rain. Just as we were about to give up, we heard a gunshot.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r188","rowIndex":188,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　丁度通りかかろうとしていたアパートの二階から音がしたようだった。","en":"It appeared to have come from the second floor of an apartment building we were about to pass.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r189","rowIndex":189,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「銃声がしたときは、聞かなかったふりをして、無関心でいるというのが賢い選択だけど……」","en":"“When you hear a gunshot, the smart thing to do is pretend you didn’t and mind your own business...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r190","rowIndex":190,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「今回は、確かめようか？」","en":"“But should we check this one out?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r191","rowIndex":191,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちは頷きあい、アパートに近づいた。","en":"We nodded to each other and approached the building.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r192","rowIndex":192,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　二階のドアが開きっぱなしになっており、その中から話し合う男たちの声が聞こえる。","en":"A door on the second floor stood wide open. We could hear men talking inside.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r193","rowIndex":193,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その辺りに探知機がないのを知っていたので、私たちは『ちから』を使って足音を立てないよう、空中から直接二階に移動した。私たちの『ちから』は物を持ち上げる力自体はさほど強くないので、二人を二階に上げるには、それなりの時間がかかった。","en":"We knew there were no detectors nearby, so we used our ‘power’ to lift ourselves straight up to the second floor without making a sound. The lifting force of our ‘power’ was not especially strong, and raising both of us took some time.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r194","rowIndex":194,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　無事誰にも気づかれることなく玄関ドアの側に辿り着いた私たちは部屋の中で行われている会話に耳を澄ませた。","en":"Once we had safely reached the front door without being noticed, we listened closely to the conversation inside.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r195","rowIndex":195,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どういうことです？　<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>は始末したんでしょう？」","en":"“What do you mean? You dealt with <tips=20>Koschei</tips>, didn’t you?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r196","rowIndex":196,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　男の声がそう言った。","en":"So said one of the men.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r197","rowIndex":197,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　急に<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>という単語が飛び出て来たので、私たちはぎくりとした。","en":"The sudden mention of <tips=20>Koschei</tips> startled us.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r198","rowIndex":198,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……そうだと思いたいんだがな」","en":"“...I would like to believe so.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r199","rowIndex":199,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　別の男の声がそう答える。部屋の中には男が二人いて、会話をしている。","en":"Another man answered. There were two of them in the room.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r200","rowIndex":200,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　片方の声は酷く弱々しく、感情的になっている。もう片方は冷静だ。","en":"One sounded terribly weak, his voice thick with emotion. The other was calm.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r201","rowIndex":201,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「この現場の状況が、おかしいとは思わないか？」","en":"“Don’t you think there’s something strange about this scene?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r202","rowIndex":202,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　と冷静な方が言った。","en":"the calm one said.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r203","rowIndex":203,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「何がですか？」","en":"“In what way?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r204","rowIndex":204,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「これまでの<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>の現場とは、ちょっと違う気がしないか？」","en":"“Doesn’t it seem a little different from <tips=20>Koschei’s</tips> other crime scenes?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r205","rowIndex":205,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どこがです。同じバラバラ死体じゃないですか。そりゃ綺麗に棚に仕舞われてはいませんが、これからそうするつもりだったんでしょう」","en":"“How? It’s another dismembered body, isn’t it? The pieces haven’t been arranged neatly on the shelves, sure, but he was probably going to do that next.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r206","rowIndex":206,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　感情的な方が、ヒステリックに答える。","en":"The emotional one replied hysterically.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r207","rowIndex":207,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それはそうかもしれないが……」","en":"“That may be true, but...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r208","rowIndex":208,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……なんと言うかね。これまでは、遺体の切断の仕方も、もっと理にかなった、几帳面なものなんだよ。関節にそって垂直に切断し、胴体に対する切断方法も、垂直や水平といった、きっちりとした角度で刃物が入れられている。そして、遺体は長方形に近い形状をとるんだが……今回は、めちゃくちゃだ。実に乱暴だよ」","en":"“…How can I put this? The earlier bodies were cut apart in a much more rational, meticulous fashion. The limbs were severed cleanly along the joints, and the blade entered the torso at precise vertical or horizontal angles. The remains were reduced to shapes approaching rectangles... But this time it’s a mess. Brutal, really.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r209","rowIndex":209,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……単に理由の違いではないですか？　今までは本人の趣味嗜好での解体だったわけじゃないですか。今回はそうじゃない。主目的はこのアパートの調査で、解体はそのついでだから、いつもとは気分が違って……」","en":"“...Couldn’t it simply be a difference in purpose? Before, he was dismembering them to satisfy his own tastes, wasn’t he? Not this time. His main objective was to search this apartment, and the dismemberment was incidental, so perhaps he was in a different frame of mind...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r210","rowIndex":210,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうは思えないな。こうしたタイプは、いつだって、同じようなやり方で解体をするものだ」","en":"“I doubt it. A person of this kind always dismembers a body in the same fashion.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r211","rowIndex":211,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　二人は<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>の犯罪について話し合っている。","en":"The two men were discussing <tips=20>Koschei’s</tips> crimes.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r212","rowIndex":212,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"（ねえ、この部屋のなかにいるのは警察かしら？）","en":"(Do you suppose the men in this room are police?)","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r213","rowIndex":213,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"（そうみたい。そして口ぶりからすると、この部屋のなかが殺人現場になってるみたいだね）","en":"(It sounds that way. And from the way they’re talking, the room itself must be a murder scene.)","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r214","rowIndex":214,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"（用事って、やっぱりそんなことだったんだ……）","en":"(So that really was his important business...)","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r215","rowIndex":215,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちはお互いの耳に交互に唇をあてるようにして囁き合った。","en":"We took turns putting our lips to each other’s ears and whispering.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r216","rowIndex":216,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「でも、実際に<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>を撃ち殺したわけでしょう？」","en":"“But you actually shot <tips=20>Koschei</tips> dead, didn’t you?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r217","rowIndex":217,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その言葉に、私たちはまた驚く。","en":"That startled us once again.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r218","rowIndex":218,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"（撃ち殺したって言った？）","en":"(Did he say they shot him dead?)","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r219","rowIndex":219,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　一人が声を口をそう動かし、もう一人が頷く。","en":"One of us silently shaped the words with her mouth, and the other nodded.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r220","rowIndex":220,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"（どうする？）","en":"(What do we do?)","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r221","rowIndex":221,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"（わからないけど、でも、ここにいるのなら助けよう）","en":"(I don’t know. But if he’s here, we should help him.)","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r222","rowIndex":222,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"（殺されてたら？）","en":"(What if he’s dead?)","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r223","rowIndex":223,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"（死体を回収する）","en":"(We’ll recover the body.)","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r224","rowIndex":224,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そのはずだ。少なくとも、私の嗅いだ匂いは、<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>の現場で嗅いだものと全く同じだった」","en":"“That should be what happened. At least, the scent I picked up was identical to the one at <tips=20>Koschei’s</tips> other crime scenes.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r225","rowIndex":225,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どういうことです？」","en":"“What do you mean?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r226","rowIndex":226,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……実際に遺体を見ればわかる」","en":"“...You will understand when you see the body.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r227","rowIndex":227,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　中で二人が動く物音がした。","en":"We heard the two men move inside.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r228","rowIndex":228,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちは、その動きを確認するために、ドアからそっと部屋の中を覗く。","en":"To see what they were doing, we cautiously peered through the doorway.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r229","rowIndex":229,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　床に血液と、肉片が散らばっていた。解体された人間の姿だった。<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>の行った犯罪の結果だろうと私たちは思った。","en":"Blood and pieces of flesh lay scattered across the floor: what remained of a dismembered human being. We believed it was the result of one of <tips=20>Koschei’s</tips> crimes.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r230","rowIndex":230,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちの一人が、思わず口元を押さえた。","en":"One of us instinctively clapped a hand over her mouth.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r231","rowIndex":231,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"（人間って、きったないね。ゲロ吐きそう）","en":"(Human beings are disgusting. I think I’m going to puke.)","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r232","rowIndex":232,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　蒼白になりながら笑った。","en":"She laughed, her face deathly pale.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r233","rowIndex":233,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"（そうだね）","en":"(They are.)","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r234","rowIndex":234,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　もう一人も同じように笑った。","en":"The other laughed the same way.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r235","rowIndex":235,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちは、どういう場面においても被害者には同情しないことに決めていたし、被害者寄りの立場もとらないことに決めていた。関わるときは、あくまでも第三者か、そうでなければ加害者側か。","en":"We had decided that, whatever the circumstances, we would never sympathize with the victim or take the victim’s side. Whenever we became involved, we would do so strictly as outsiders—or else on the perpetrator’s side.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r236","rowIndex":236,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　今回の場合、私たちは<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>側に立つことに決めている。","en":"This time, we had decided to side with <tips=20>Koschei</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r237","rowIndex":237,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして部屋に足を踏み入れた。","en":"Then we stepped into the room.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r238","rowIndex":238,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　血だまりのなかには角の生えた大男が一人へたり込んでいる。","en":"A huge man with horns sat slumped in a pool of blood.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r239","rowIndex":239,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そしてもう一人は犬の頭に人の身体を持つ人物で、奥の部屋へ向かおうとこちらに背を向けていた。","en":"The other figure had a dog’s head on a human body and stood with his back to us, about to enter the room in the rear.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r240","rowIndex":240,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちのうちの一人はいつも携帯している細いナイフを取り出し、犬頭の方へ投げる。","en":"One of us took out the slim knife she always carried and threw it at the dog-headed man.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r241","rowIndex":241,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「うっ」","en":"“Urgh.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r242","rowIndex":242,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ナイフは『ちから』の補正もうけて、狙った場所に百発百中で刺さるものだ。","en":"Our ‘power’ corrected the knife’s course, ensuring that it struck its target without fail.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r243","rowIndex":243,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その時確かに急所を狙ったはずだが、ナイフは肩に刺さった。心に抵抗感があるのを私たちは気がついていた。","en":"She had certainly meant to aim for a vital point, but the blade sank into his shoulder. We both knew that some part of her had resisted.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r244","rowIndex":244,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　犬頭が肩を押さえて、振り返る。","en":"Clutching his shoulder, the dog-headed man turned.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r245","rowIndex":245,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「灰上！」","en":"“Haigami!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"堂島","displayName":"Dojima","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r246","rowIndex":246,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「鬼と、狼男。まるでお化け屋敷だわ」","en":"“An ogre and a werewolf. It’s like a haunted house.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r247","rowIndex":247,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あなたたちのこと知ってる。サイキックばっかり逮捕するワンコロ刑事さんに、その手下の元探偵さんでしょ」","en":"“We know who you are. You’re the mutt detective who does nothing but arrest psychics, and his ex-detective lackey, right?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r248","rowIndex":248,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちはそう言った。","en":"So we told them.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r249","rowIndex":249,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　威勢良く言ったつもりだったが、その声が微かに震えていることに、お互い気づいていた。","en":"We had meant to sound bold, but each of us noticed the faint tremor in the other’s voice.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r250","rowIndex":250,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「おまえたちが、なぜここに？」","en":"“Why are you two here?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"堂島","displayName":"Dojima","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r251","rowIndex":251,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　犬頭の方がそう言った。","en":"The dog-headed one had asked the question.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r252","rowIndex":252,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼は<tips=9>Y地区</tips>において<tips=16>タイプA</tips>の犯罪者を取り締まる特別捜査官だと私たちは知っている。すべての犯罪者を捕まえていたらキリがないこの街で、社会に対して特に脅威となる犯人を選んで捕まえている。","en":"We knew he was a special investigator charged with cracking down on <tips=16>Type A</tips> criminals in <tips=9>Y District</tips>. In a city where there was no end to the criminals one could arrest, he singled out those who posed an exceptional threat to society.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r253","rowIndex":253,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちは捜査の対象となったことはなかったが、<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>の誰々を彼が逮捕したという噂を聞いたり、街でその姿を見かけたことはあった。サイキックの多くは奇異な身体的特徴を持つが、そのなかでもひときわ目立つその姿は、誰にでもそうとわかりやすい。","en":"We had never been the subject of one of his investigations, but we had heard rumors of this or that <tips=7>YS</tips> member he arrested and had seen him around the city. Many psychics possessed strange physical characteristics, but his appearance stood out even among theirs. Anyone could recognize him at a glance.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r254","rowIndex":254,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちのようなサイキックにとって、天敵というべき存在だった。","en":"To psychics like us, he was a natural enemy.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r255","rowIndex":255,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>と、関わっているのか？」","en":"“...Are you involved with <tips=20>Koschei</tips>?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"堂島","displayName":"Dojima","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r256","rowIndex":256,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼はそう問う。私たちは彼と会話をするつもりはなかった。","en":"He asked us directly. We had no intention of talking to him.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r257","rowIndex":257,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ナイフを一本取り出した。<tips=57>滑走路通り</tips>の雑貨店で売っていた一番小さなペティナイフで、いつも三本持ち歩いている。私たちの片方が『ちから』を使って飛ばしても、もう片方が<tips=17>タイプB</tips>の優れた身体能力で投擲しても役に立つ。","en":"We drew another knife: the smallest paring knife sold by one of <tips=57>Runway Street’s</tips> general stores. We always carried three. It was useful whether one of us sent it flying with her ‘power’ or the other threw it with the superior physical ability of a <tips=17>Type B</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r258","rowIndex":258,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　まだ幼くて、もっと性格が攻撃的だったころには他人を脅すためによく取り出したが、今はもう完全に出番がなく、ただ習慣として持っていた。用途があろうとなかろうと、常に武器を身につけているというのは、私たちにとって非常に重要なことだった。","en":"When we were younger and more aggressive, we had often pulled one out to threaten people. By now the knives had fallen completely out of use, and we carried them only from habit. Whether or not we had any use for one, carrying a weapon at all times was extremely important to us.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r259","rowIndex":259,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちは『ちから』によってふわふわと空中にナイフを浮かす。","en":"We used our ‘power’ to set the knife floating gently in the air.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r260","rowIndex":260,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　昔、人を威圧するときによくつかった手だった。","en":"It was a trick we often used in the old days to intimidate people.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r261","rowIndex":261,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「大人しく退散しなさい。さっきのは警告よ。次は急所を狙う」","en":"“Leave quietly. That was a warning. Next time, I’ll aim somewhere vital.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r262","rowIndex":262,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「馬鹿なことはやめろ。おまえたちがこの殺人鬼に手を貸す理由はないはずだ」","en":"“Stop this nonsense. You have no reason to help this killer.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r263","rowIndex":263,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　犬頭はひるむ様子がなかった。そして、その腕が素早く懐の中に入る。","en":"The dog-headed man showed no sign of flinching. His arm darted inside his coat.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r264","rowIndex":264,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　何かされると察知したので、空中に浮かんでいたナイフを彼に向かって飛ばしたが、彼はそれより早く黒い銃を抜き取って、私たちに向ける。","en":"Sensing an attack, we sent the suspended knife flying at him. He was faster: he drew a black pistol and pointed it at us.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r265","rowIndex":265,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そしてパンと音がして、銃口の奥が光るのが見えた。","en":"Then came a sharp crack, and we saw light inside the muzzle.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r266","rowIndex":266,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「うっ」","en":"“Urgh.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r267","rowIndex":267,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼の銃弾は私たちの片方の肩に命中した。皮膚が破れ、血が流れ、それから少し遅れるように焼け付くような痛みを感じる。","en":"His bullet struck one of us in the shoulder. The skin tore and blood flowed. A moment later came a searing pain.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r268","rowIndex":268,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　集中が途切れ、『ちから』を失ったナイフは床に落ちた。","en":"Her concentration broke. Deprived of the ‘power,’ the knife fell to the floor.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r269","rowIndex":269,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「答えろ！　なぜここにいる！　そして私たちに危害を加える？」","en":"“Answer me! Why are you here? Why are you attacking us?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"堂島","displayName":"Dojima","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r270","rowIndex":270,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　犬頭はそう怒鳴った。","en":"The dog-headed man bellowed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r271","rowIndex":271,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちは躊躇なく発砲を受けたという現実を認識するのに少し時間がかかった。","en":"It took us a moment to comprehend the reality that he had fired without hesitation.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r272","rowIndex":272,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　子供のころにはよく乱暴な場面に立ちあったが、銃で撃たれるようなことはなかったし、最近は団地周辺やこの街で他人同士の争いはよく見るものの、自分が争いごとの当事者になることはなかった。","en":"We had often witnessed violence as children, but we had never been shot. These days, we frequently saw other people fight in the city and around the housing complex, but we were never the ones involved.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r273","rowIndex":273,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　感覚が少し甘くなっていたのだと私たちは実感した。","en":"We realized we had grown a little complacent.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r274","rowIndex":274,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　負傷してよろめく片方を、もう片方が支える。","en":"One of us supported the other as she staggered from her wound.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r275","rowIndex":275,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「やったわね。これで私たちも、容赦する理由がなくなったみたいね……」","en":"“Now you’ve done it. Looks like we don’t have any reason to hold back anymore...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r276","rowIndex":276,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちは気持ちを切り換えながら彼を睨み付けた。","en":"We steeled ourselves and glared at him.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r277","rowIndex":277,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「おかしな真似をするな。それ以上能力を使って危害を加えようとするのならば、私の職権において射殺する」","en":"“Don’t try anything. If you use your abilities again to hurt anyone, I will shoot you dead under my authority as an officer.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"堂島","displayName":"Dojima","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r278","rowIndex":278,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　犬頭は銃口で私たちを脅す。","en":"The dog-headed man kept us at gunpoint.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r279","rowIndex":279,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「必要な警告はもうしたわ。あなたは自分の運命を自分で決めたのよ」","en":"“We’ve already given you all the warning you need. You chose your own fate.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r280","rowIndex":280,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちはそう言いながら、部屋にもう一人いる大男の方をチラと見た。","en":"As we spoke, we glanced at the other man in the room—the giant.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r281","rowIndex":281,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　角が生えたその男も、この街では少し知られた人物だった。異様な姿が示すとおり、彼もサイキックだ。","en":"The horned man was also something of a known figure in the city. As his peculiar appearance suggested, he too was psychic.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r282","rowIndex":282,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼はこわばった表情で床の上に座ったままだった。ここは彼の住まいのようだから、床に散らばった死体は彼の知り合いなのだ。その死のショックで気力を失っているのならば、私たちにとって都合が良かった。","en":"He remained seated on the floor, his expression rigid. This appeared to be his home, which would make the corpse scattered across the floor someone he knew. If the shock of that death had sapped his will, so much the better for us.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r283","rowIndex":283,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　といっても、彼が何もしないとしても、銃を突きつけられたこの状態は私たちにとって有利なものとは言えなかった。","en":"Even if he did nothing, though, having a gun trained on us still left us at a disadvantage.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r284","rowIndex":284,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>とどういう繋がりか、あとでゆっくりと調べさせてもらおうか」","en":"“...We’ll take our time finding out how you’re connected to <tips=20>Koschei</tips> later.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"堂島","displayName":"Dojima","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r285","rowIndex":285,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　犬頭は手に構えた銃を私たちに向けながら、もう片方の手で別の銀色の銃を取り出した。","en":"Keeping the pistol in one hand aimed at us, the dog-headed man drew a second gun, this one silver, with the other.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r286","rowIndex":286,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　こちらが二人だから、一丁ずつ両方に銃口を向けるつもりなのだろうか？","en":"Since there were two of us, did he mean to point one gun at each of us?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r287","rowIndex":287,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちにとって最も有効な行動はすでにわかっている。『ちから』を使って銃口をそらし、その隙にもう一人が素早く駆け寄って押さえつける。<tips=17>タイプB</tips>ならばとっくみあいになっても負けることはない。","en":"We already knew the most effective course of action. One of us could use her ‘power’ to turn the muzzle aside, and in that opening, the other could rush him and pin him down. A <tips=17>Type B</tips> would never lose in a grapple.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r288","rowIndex":288,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　だがリスクがないわけではない。『ちから』は、それほど強いものではなく、彼のような成人男性がその気になれば『ちから』に逆らいながら照準をあわせ、発砲することも出来る。","en":"That did not mean the plan was without risk. Our ‘power’ was not especially strong. If an adult man like him made a determined effort, he could resist it long enough to take aim and fire.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r289","rowIndex":289,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちは動かなかった。この状況をもっと有利に変化させそうな事態が、犬頭の後ろで起こっているのを見つけたからだ。","en":"We did not move. We had noticed something occurring behind the dog-headed man that promised to turn the situation in our favor.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r290","rowIndex":290,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼の後ろには別な部屋がある。そこで、ゆらりと人影が動くのが見えた。","en":"There was another room behind him. Inside it, we saw a human shape sway into motion.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r291","rowIndex":291,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それは胸を真っ赤な血で染めた<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>で、彼は私たちを見るとまず『おや』と驚くような顔をしてから、苦笑した。","en":"It was <tips=20>Koschei</tips>, his chest soaked crimson with blood. When he saw us, he first looked mildly surprised—as if to say, Oh?—then gave a wry smile.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r292","rowIndex":292,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼はナイフを手に持っている。私たちは、彼に気づかないようなふりをして犬頭を睨んでいる。","en":"He held a knife. We kept glaring at the dog-headed man and pretended not to have noticed him.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r293","rowIndex":293,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして彼はそのナイフを犬頭の背中に突き刺した。","en":"Koschei drove the blade into the dog-headed man’s back.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r294","rowIndex":294,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ぐっ」","en":"“Ghh.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r295","rowIndex":295,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　犬頭は床の上に崩れ落ち、そして身体を捻って背後の<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>を見た。","en":"The dog-headed man crumpled to the floor, then twisted around to look at <tips=20>Koschei</tips> behind him.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r296","rowIndex":296,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>……か？　そうなのか？」","en":"“...<tips=20>Koschei</tips>...? Is that you?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r297","rowIndex":297,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　犬頭の声は震えている。","en":"The dog-headed man’s voice trembled.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r298","rowIndex":298,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……そうか。わかったぞ。お前の力の正体が……」","en":"“…I see. I understand now. The true nature of your power…”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r299","rowIndex":299,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうか。だが、ちょっと遅かったな」","en":"“I see. But you’re a little too late.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アレクセイ","displayName":"Alexei","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r300","rowIndex":300,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>は日本語でそう言って、にやりと笑った。","en":"<tips=20>Koschei</tips> said it in Japanese and grinned.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r301","rowIndex":301,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「死んでやれればよかったんだが、気の毒だがおれは死なないんだ。<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>というのは、不死身って意味なんだよ」","en":"“I’d have obliged you by dying if I could, but unfortunately, I don’t die. <tips=20>Koschei</tips> means ‘immortal.’”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アレクセイ","displayName":"Alexei","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r302","rowIndex":302,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼はそして私たちの方を見る。私たちが小さく頷くと、彼は肩をすくめる。","en":"Then he looked at us. We gave a small nod, and he shrugged.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r303","rowIndex":303,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まったく、今日はツイてない。こんな下らない仕事をさせられた上に、こんな穴だらけにされちまって……」","en":"“What rotten luck. First I get saddled with this stupid job, and then I get shot full of holes...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アレクセイ","displayName":"Alexei","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r304","rowIndex":304,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そう溜息をつく<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>の足元にいる犬頭が、急に素早く動いて銀の銃を<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>に向けようとしているのが見えた。","en":"As <tips=20>Koschei</tips> sighed, we saw the dog-headed man at his feet move with sudden speed and try to point the silver gun at <tips=20>Koschei</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r305","rowIndex":305,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちは『ちから』を使ってその腕を押しのける。銀の銃はプシュと音を鳴らして何かを発射させ、それはアパートの壁に突き刺さった。何か液体の入った筒状のものだ。","en":"We used our ‘power’ to shove his arm aside. The silver gun discharged with a soft hiss. Its projectile struck the apartment wall: a cylindrical object filled with some kind of liquid.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r306","rowIndex":306,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　薬剤か何かを私たちに打ち込もうとしたのだろうか？","en":"Had he been trying to inject one of us with some kind of drug?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r307","rowIndex":307,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それを眺めている私たちの視界の端で、これまで床の上でじっとしていた角男が急に動いたのが見えた。","en":"As we looked at it, we caught movement at the edge of our vision. The horned man, who until then had remained motionless on the floor, had suddenly moved.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r308","rowIndex":308,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼は手を動かし、何かをこちらに投げつける。あやうく命中するところだったが、私たちは『ちから』を使ってそれをはねのけた。床にゴトリと音を立てて落ちたのは、重い灰皿だった。","en":"His hand moved, throwing something at us. It nearly struck, but we used our ‘power’ to knock it aside. A heavy ashtray fell to the floor with a clunk.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r309","rowIndex":309,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そしてその間に、私たちのもう一人が角男に駆け寄って、彼につかみかかる。","en":"Meanwhile, the other one rushed the horned man and grabbed hold of him.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r310","rowIndex":310,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「このっ」","en":"“You—!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"路地邦昭","displayName":"Kuniaki Roji","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r311","rowIndex":311,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　角男は見た目も鬼のように屈強だが、腕力も強かった。","en":"The horned man was as powerfully built as the ogre he resembled, and his strength matched his appearance.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r312","rowIndex":312,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼が掴まれた腕を振り回すと、たとえ<tips=17>タイプB</tips>として強い筋力があったとしても体重が増えるわけではないので、軽々と空中に足が浮く。","en":"When he swung the arm she had grabbed, her feet flew easily off the floor. Even a <tips=17>Type B’s</tips> great strength did nothing to increase her body weight.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r313","rowIndex":313,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちの片方は宙に浮かされながらも手を放さず、壁を蹴って、彼を押し倒した。","en":"Though suspended in the air, one of us did not release him. She kicked off the wall and brought him crashing down.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r314","rowIndex":314,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「くそっ」","en":"“Damn.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"路地邦昭","displayName":"Kuniaki Roji","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r315","rowIndex":315,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼がいかに力を振り絞ろうとも<tips=17>タイプB</tips>の力にはかなわない。私たちの片方は彼に馬乗りになって、その動きを封じ込めた。","en":"No matter how hard he strained, he was no match for the strength of a <tips=17>Type B</tips>. One of us straddled him and pinned him down.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r316","rowIndex":316,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そうして角男の方を制圧したのをちらりと確認してから、もう片方は犬頭と<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>の方に視線を戻した。","en":"After a quick glance confirmed that the horned man was subdued, the other turned her attention back to the dog-headed man and <tips=20>Koschei</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r317","rowIndex":317,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>は出血によるものか、朦朧としたまま立っている。そしてその足元に倒れた犬頭は背中を刺されてもまだ死んではいなかった。次の行動をしようとしている。黒い拳銃に手を伸ばす。","en":"<tips=20>Koschei</tips> stood in a daze, perhaps from the blood he had lost. At his feet, the dog-headed man remained alive despite the knife in his back. He was already attempting his next move, reaching for the black pistol.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r318","rowIndex":318,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちのもう片方は、とっさに『ちから』を使ってナイフを舞い上がらせた。","en":"The other of us instinctively used her ‘power’ to send the knife dancing into the air.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r319","rowIndex":319,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「旦那っ！　上だっ！」","en":"“Detective! Above you!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"路地邦昭","displayName":"Kuniaki Roji","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r320","rowIndex":320,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　角男がそう叫ぶと、犬頭も頭上のナイフに気がついた。","en":"At the horned man’s shout, the dog-headed man noticed the knife overhead.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r321","rowIndex":321,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　片方の手を上げて防ごうとするが、それより『ちから』に操られたナイフの方が早く彼の首元に突き刺さる。","en":"He raised one hand to defend himself, but the knife controlled by our ‘power’ was faster. It plunged into his neck.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r322","rowIndex":322,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　わたしたちのもう片方は、その瞬間思わず目を閉じてしまった。そしてすぐに開くと、犬頭の灰色の毛に覆われたのどにナイフが根本まで刺さっているのが見えた。","en":"At that instant, the other one squeezed her eyes shut without meaning to. When she opened them again, the knife was buried to the hilt in the dog-headed man’s gray-furred throat.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r323","rowIndex":323,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「犬ころめ！　人間様に、従順に従えばいいものを！」","en":"“You miserable mutt! You should’ve known your place and obeyed your human masters!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r324","rowIndex":324,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちの片方は、そう怒鳴った。","en":"One of us shouted.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r325","rowIndex":325,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「くそっ」","en":"“Damn.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r326","rowIndex":326,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「無駄よ」","en":"“It’s no use.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r327","rowIndex":327,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　角男が興奮して暴れようとするのを、私たちの片方が押さえつける。相手は身体を動かそうとするが、こちらの方が力は上で、びくともしない。","en":"One of us pinned the horned man down as he grew agitated and tried to thrash free. He tried to move, but we were stronger, and he could not budge.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r328","rowIndex":328,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　これで、一応は相手の制圧は終わったようだ。","en":"For the moment, at least, it seemed we had finished subduing our opponents.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r329","rowIndex":329,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まったく、ひどいケガだ」","en":"“Damn, I’m in bad shape.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アレクセイ","displayName":"Alexei","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r330","rowIndex":330,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　目の前で起きた出来事を眠そうに見つめながら<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>は一歩前へ踏み出した。足元がもつれ、よろめく。","en":"Watching what had happened with sleepy eyes, <tips=20>Koschei</tips> took a step forward. His feet tangled beneath him, and he staggered.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r331","rowIndex":331,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「しっかりしてよ。おかげで、こんなことをするハメになったわ……。あなたと同じ立場だね」","en":"“Pull yourself together. You got us dragged into all this... Now we’re in the same boat as you.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r332","rowIndex":332,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「別に頼んだ覚えはない。おれは女に借りは作らん。……しかし、どこかで休息が必要だな」","en":"“I don’t recall asking. I make it a point not to owe women any favors. ...Still, I need somewhere to rest.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アレクセイ","displayName":"Alexei","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r333","rowIndex":333,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そんなズタボロになっておいて、よく言う」","en":"“Big words for someone in such a sorry state.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r334","rowIndex":334,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「しかし驚いたな。どうしてここがわかったんだ？」","en":"“Still, I’m surprised. How did you find this place?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アレクセイ","displayName":"Alexei","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r335","rowIndex":335,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「探していたら、銃声がきこえてね。まだあなたとの話は終わってないわ」","en":"“We were looking for you when we heard the gunshots. Our business with you isn’t finished.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r336","rowIndex":336,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……まあ、良いタイミングで現れてくれたものだよ。何を考えているのかわからないが、それに関しては、礼を言わなくちゃいけない」","en":"“...Well, you showed up at just the right moment. I don’t know what you two are thinking, but for that, at least, I have to thank you.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アレクセイ","displayName":"Alexei","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r337","rowIndex":337,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうよ。素直になってくれればいいのよ」","en":"“Exactly. You need only be honest.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r338","rowIndex":338,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「やれやれ」","en":"“Good grief.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アレクセイ","displayName":"Alexei","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r339","rowIndex":339,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>は肩をすくめた。","en":"<tips=20>Koschei</tips> shrugged.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r340","rowIndex":340,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「生きていると、こんな奇妙な連中に会うこともあるんだな」","en":"“Live long enough, and you meet some very strange people.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アレクセイ","displayName":"Alexei","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r341","rowIndex":341,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼は歩こうとしたのだが、バランスがとれずに壁に手をついた。","en":"He tried to walk, but lost his balance and put a hand against the wall.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r342","rowIndex":342,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「偉そうな口をきくわりに弱ってるのね」","en":"“You talk awfully big for someone so weak.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r343","rowIndex":343,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……そりゃ、胸に風穴を開けられて弱らなかったら化け物だ」","en":"“...If getting holes blown through your chest didn’t weaken you, you’d be a monster.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アレクセイ","displayName":"Alexei","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r344","rowIndex":344,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「充分化け物でしょうに」","en":"“You’re already enough of a monster.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r345","rowIndex":345,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちの片方は、血の海となった床の汚れていない部分を選びながら部屋を横切り、奥の部屋の<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>に近づき、彼に手を貸した。","en":"One of us crossed the room, picking her way over the patches of floor the sea of blood had not soiled. She went to <tips=20>Koschei</tips> in the rear room and helped him to his feet.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r346","rowIndex":346,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まったく」","en":"“Honestly.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r347","rowIndex":347,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちの片方は、よろめこうとする<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>を手助けしながら、部屋の出口の方へ向かった。","en":"Supporting <tips=20>Koschei</tips> as he stumbled, one of us started toward the exit.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r348","rowIndex":348,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その途中、床に倒れた犬頭の姿が目に入り、そして目をそらすと、私たちのもう片方に組み伏せられたままの角男の姿が目に入る。","en":"On the way, she caught sight of the dog-headed man on the floor. She looked away, only for her eyes to fall on the horned man still pinned beneath her sister.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r349","rowIndex":349,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あの探偵さんはどうしよう？」","en":"“What shall we do about the detective?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r350","rowIndex":350,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その角男は、かつてこの街で探偵業を営んでいた人物だった。","en":"The horned man had once operated a detective agency in the city.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r351","rowIndex":351,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どうでもいい」","en":"“Who cares?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アレクセイ","displayName":"Alexei","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r352","rowIndex":352,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>はそう言った。","en":"<tips=20>Koschei</tips> replied.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r353","rowIndex":353,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どうでもいいって……、彼らはあなたのことを嗅ぎ廻っているんじゃないの？」","en":"“You don’t care...? Aren’t they sniffing around after you?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r354","rowIndex":354,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうだろうね。でもどうだっていいさ。そもそもおれはこんな馬鹿馬鹿しいことはしたくなかった。疑われているからといって、こそこそと家を漁るだなんて、小物っぽくてみっともない話さ。そんなみっともないことをするから、こんなふうに余計な怪我を負ったりするのさ。……あの心配性のジジイのおかげで酷い目にあった。もうおれはやりたいようにやる。……それに、なんだいこのやたらと散らかった場所は？　おれはこういう場所にいると気が狂いそうになるんだ。さっさとここを離れて、どこかでゆっくりと横になって……ああ、つめたく冷やしたグレープフルーツジュースでも飲みたいな」","en":"“Probably. But who cares? I never wanted to do anything this ridiculous in the first place. Sneaking around and rifling through someone’s home just because I’m under suspicion makes me look like some pathetic little man. And it’s because I let myself get dragged into something so disgraceful that I ended up with all these pointless injuries. ...That fretful old man has put me through hell. From now on, I’m doing as I please. ...Besides, what is this absurd mess? Places like this drive me out of my mind. I want to get out of here, find somewhere to lie down in peace... Ah, and have a nice glass of ice-cold grapefruit juice.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アレクセイ","displayName":"Alexei","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r355","rowIndex":355,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちはその返答にあきれた。","en":"His answer left us exasperated.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r356","rowIndex":356,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして、どうでもいいと言われても事情がわからない私たちには判断のしようもなかった。","en":"Yet even if he did not care, we knew too little of the circumstances to judge for ourselves.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r357","rowIndex":357,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ねえ、このままでいいの？」","en":"“Are you sure we can leave it this way?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r358","rowIndex":358,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　もう一度<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>に訊ねる。","en":"We asked <tips=20>Koschei</tips> once more.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r359","rowIndex":359,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いいよ」","en":"“It’s fine.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アレクセイ","displayName":"Alexei","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r360","rowIndex":360,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「でも、このままにしておいたら、色々とまずくない？」","en":"“But won’t leaving things this way cause all kinds of trouble?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r361","rowIndex":361,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そう思うなら、きみらが好きにすればいい。まったく、残酷なやつらだなあ。おれは人を殺したり、乱暴をするのは好きじゃないんだって言ってるだろ」","en":"“If that’s what you think, do whatever you like. Honestly, what a cruel pair you are. I’ve told you, I don’t like killing people or resorting to violence.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アレクセイ","displayName":"Alexei","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r362","rowIndex":362,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なんで、猟奇殺人者にそんなこと言われているのかしら……」","en":"“Why is a gruesome murderer lecturing us about cruelty...?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r363","rowIndex":363,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちは溜息をついた。","en":"We sighed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r364","rowIndex":364,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ねえ、元探偵さん」","en":"“Hey, Mr. Former Detective.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r365","rowIndex":365,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちは角男に話しかける。","en":"We addressed the horned man.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r366","rowIndex":366,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あなたとこうして話すのは初めてだけど、その顔と名前は小さな時から知ってるわ。いつも、<tips=59>暗闇通り</tips>をその角で風を切って歩いていたものね」","en":"“This is the first time we’ve spoken, but we’ve known your face and name since we were little. You were always striding down <tips=59>Darkness Street</tips> with that horn of yours cutting through the wind.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r367","rowIndex":367,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「確か昔は、<tips=50>路地</tips>探偵事務所の探偵さんと言えば、<tips=59>暗闇通り</tips>のみんなを助ける正義の人だったような気がするけど、いつのまにか警察の手先になっちゃって、みじめなものね」","en":"“As we remember it, the detective from <tips=50>Roji</tips> Detective Agency used to be a champion of justice who helped everyone on <tips=59>Darkness Street</tips>. But somewhere along the way you became a police lackey. How pathetic.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r368","rowIndex":368,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　角男は私たちの言葉を無表情で聞いている。","en":"The horned man listened without expression.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r369","rowIndex":369,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「おっしゃるとおりだが、こんなところで殺人鬼の手伝いなんかするよりはマシな生き方だと思うがね」","en":"“You’re right about that, but I’d say it’s still a better way to live than helping a murderer in a place like this.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"路地邦昭","displayName":"Kuniaki Roji","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r370","rowIndex":370,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　路地探偵事務所の<tips=50>路地邦昭</tips>。裏通りの貧民や娼婦のトラブルを専門に解決する探偵だった。誰も引き受けないような事件を進んで調べる人物で、<tips=59>暗闇通り</tips>のヒーローの一人だった。かつては。","en":"<tips=50>Kuniaki Roji</tips> of the Roji Detective Agency. A detective who specialized in helping the poor and the prostitutes of the backstreets with their troubles. He willingly took on cases no one else would touch, and had once been one of the heroes of <tips=59>Darkness Street</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r371","rowIndex":371,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　サイキック能力の不正使用で警察に逮捕されてからは、とんとその噂をきかなくなっている。","en":"After his arrest by the police for the illegal use of a psychic ability, however, we had heard nothing more of him.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r372","rowIndex":372,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「私たちは殺人鬼の手伝いをしているわけじゃないわ」","en":"“We are not helping a killer.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r373","rowIndex":373,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ただ、何か価値のあるものを探しているだけ。人生ってそういうものでしょ？」","en":"“We’re just looking for something worthwhile. That’s what life is about, isn’t it?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r374","rowIndex":374,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちはそう言った。","en":"So we told him.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r375","rowIndex":375,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……お前が<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>ってやつか。資料でみた大昔の写真とまったく姿が変わらないが、どんな秘密があるんだい？」","en":"“...So you’re this <tips=20>Koschei</tips>. You look exactly the same as in those ancient photographs in the files. What’s your secret?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"路地邦昭","displayName":"Kuniaki Roji","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r376","rowIndex":376,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　角男――<tips=50>路地</tips>は私たちを無視して<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>に話しかけた。","en":"Ignoring us, the horned man—<tips=50>Roji</tips>—addressed <tips=20>Koschei</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r377","rowIndex":377,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なんだって、こんなところへやって来て、無関係な女を殺した。いや、こんな質問は頭のイカレた殺人鬼には無意味かな？　お前は狂った頭で、手当たり次第に女を殺し続けるのさ」","en":"“Why did you come here and kill a woman who had nothing to do with any of this? No—maybe there’s no point asking a lunatic murderer. You’re insane, and you just keep killing women at random.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"路地邦昭","displayName":"Kuniaki Roji","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r378","rowIndex":378,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「失礼なやつだな。……そもそも、お前が調べたりするから、この女も死ぬことになった。この女は本来死ぬ必要はなかったんだ。おれはひどく心を痛めている」","en":"“How rude. ...To begin with, this woman only died because you went poking around. She never needed to die at all. It pains me deeply.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アレクセイ","displayName":"Alexei","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r379","rowIndex":379,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……どうして胸を撃たれたのに生きている。それがお前の能力か？」","en":"“...How are you alive after being shot in the chest? Is that your ability?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"路地邦昭","displayName":"Kuniaki Roji","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r380","rowIndex":380,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「会話をするつもりがないのか？　なんだか、面倒だな……」","en":"“You’re not even going to have a conversation? What a pain...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アレクセイ","displayName":"Alexei","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r381","rowIndex":381,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>は溜息をついた。そして、そっぽを向いて誰もいない空間に話しかける。彼の家でみたときと同じだ。","en":"<tips=20>Koschei</tips> sighed. Then he looked aside and spoke into an empty space, just as he had when we saw him at his house.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r382","rowIndex":382,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼はそれまで使っていた日本語ではなく、別の国の言葉で、このように言った。","en":"He spoke not in the Japanese he had used until then, but in the language of another country.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r383","rowIndex":383,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なあ、どうするこいつ？　……始末するか？　しかし、そう簡単に話しやしないだろう。………わかった。わかったが……」","en":"“So, what do we do with this one? ...Dispose of him? He won’t speak easily, though. ...All right. I understand, but...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アレクセイ","displayName":"Alexei","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r384","rowIndex":384,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　静かな部屋に彼の独り言だけが響いている。","en":"Only his one-sided conversation echoed through the quiet room.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r385","rowIndex":385,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「おい、お前ら」","en":"“Hey, you two.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"路地邦昭","displayName":"Kuniaki Roji","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r386","rowIndex":386,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　不意に、<tips=50>路地</tips>が私たちに声をかけた。","en":"<tips=50>Roji</tips> suddenly called to us.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r387","rowIndex":387,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「こいつがどういうやつか、知っていて一緒にいるのか？」","en":"“Do you know what kind of man he is and still choose to stay with him?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"路地邦昭","displayName":"Kuniaki Roji","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r388","rowIndex":388,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうよ」","en":"“Yes.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r389","rowIndex":389,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「大体ね」","en":"“More or less.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r390","rowIndex":390,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　答えると、<tips=50>路地</tips>はうなずきもせずじっと私たちの顔を見た。","en":"At our answers, <tips=50>Roji</tips> merely stared into our faces without so much as a nod.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r391","rowIndex":391,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ここで殺された女が彼とどういう関係なのかはわからなかった。しかし、部屋にこまごまとした飾り付けがされていたり、棚に小さな猫の置物などがあるのを見ると、一緒に暮らす間柄なのは間違いなさそうだ。","en":"We did not know how the murdered woman had been connected to him. But the room was decorated with all manner of small ornaments, including tiny cat figurines on a shelf. They had plainly lived together.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r392","rowIndex":392,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちは、一緒に暮らした異性がバラバラ死体にされたらこんな顔になるのかと思いながら、土気色になった<tips=50>路地</tips>の顔を見ていた。","en":"We watched the deathly color of <tips=50>Roji’s</tips> face and wondered whether we would look the same if a man we lived with were reduced to a dismembered corpse.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r393","rowIndex":393,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　すると、プルルルと大きな音がした。","en":"Then a loud electronic trill sounded.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r394","rowIndex":394,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　まったく不意のことで驚いた。どこからの音が探すと、どうやら、犬男の胸元から鳴っているらしい。","en":"The sudden noise startled us. Looking for its source, we realized it was coming from the dog-headed man’s chest.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r395","rowIndex":395,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちの片方がその胸元に手を伸ばそうとしたとき、視線の端で<tips=50>路地</tips>が動いたのが見えた。","en":"One of us was reaching toward his chest when she caught <tips=50>Roji</tips> moving at the edge of her vision.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r396","rowIndex":396,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　振り返ると、いつの間にか銃を手にしている彼は、それで背中に乗った私たちのもう片方を撃とうとしている。","en":"When she turned, he had somehow gotten hold of a gun and was about to shoot her sister, who was still sitting on his back.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r397","rowIndex":397,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　パンと音が鳴る。","en":"A shot cracked.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r398","rowIndex":398,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あっ！」","en":"“Ah!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r399","rowIndex":399,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちのもう片方が驚きの声をあげながら、<tips=50>路地</tips>の背中から飛び退いた。","en":"Her sister cried out in surprise and leapt clear of <tips=50>Roji’s</tips> back.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r400","rowIndex":400,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=50>路地</tips>は次に<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>に向かって銃を撃ち、彼の胸元に命中した。","en":"<tips=50>Roji</tips> next fired at <tips=20>Koschei</tips>, striking him in the chest.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r401","rowIndex":401,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちが驚いている間に、<tips=50>路地</tips>は私たちから離れ、銃を構えた。私たちのもう片方が目を金色に光らせながらそこに飛びかかろうとしたが、目の前に銃口が現れるとぴたりと動きを止めた。","en":"While we reeled in surprise, <tips=50>Roji</tips> put some distance between us and leveled the gun. Her sister, eyes shining gold, started to spring at him but stopped dead when the muzzle appeared before her face.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r402","rowIndex":402,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして、その顔面に向かって発砲する。","en":"He fired at her face.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r403","rowIndex":403,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちは『ちから』を使ってどうにかその照準をずらした。本当に、すんでのところで間に合った。あと一瞬遅れていたら、私たちのもう片方の顔は、弾丸によって熟した石榴のようにはじけていただろう。","en":"We somehow used our ‘power’ to wrench his aim aside. We barely made it in time. Another instant and the bullet would have burst her face like a ripe pomegranate.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r404","rowIndex":404,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちの片方が抱えている<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>は、すっかり身体から力が抜けて、重い肉の塊になってもたれかかっていた。私たちの片方は支えるのに精一杯だった。こちらはそれほど身体が強いわけでもなく、足がぷるぷると震える。","en":"<tips=20>Koschei</tips> had gone entirely limp in one sister’s arms and sagged against her like a heavy mass of flesh. It took all her strength merely to hold him up. She was not the physically stronger of the two, and her legs quivered beneath his weight.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r405","rowIndex":405,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして、彼の胸に空いた穴からは血液が大量に流れ出し、生暖かく私たちの片方の全身を濡らした。","en":"Blood poured from the holes in his chest and drenched her whole body in its lukewarm flow.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r406","rowIndex":406,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　さすがにもう駄目かも知れない。彼はここに捨てて行くべきなのだろうか。","en":"Even he might be beyond hope now. Were we supposed to abandon him here?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r407","rowIndex":407,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　路地は隙を見せずにすぐにもう一度銃を構えなおしたので、目の前にいるもう片方も飛びかかることが出来なかった。<tips=50>路地</tips>は、今度は両手で、しっかりと銃を構えている。","en":"Roji immediately brought his gun to bear again without leaving an opening, so her sister, right in front of him, could not pounce. This time, <tips=50>Roji</tips> held the gun firmly in both hands.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r408","rowIndex":408,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"『ちから』を使ってその銃を動かそうとしたが、筋骨隆々とした大男がしっかりと握る銃を動かすのは難しかった。","en":"We used our ‘power’ to move the gun, but it was difficult to shift a weapon held firmly by such a powerfully built man.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r409","rowIndex":409,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして彼はもう一度引き金を引いた。","en":"He pulled the trigger again.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r410","rowIndex":410,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ひっ」","en":"“Eek.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r411","rowIndex":411,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　もう片方が悲鳴を上げ、後ずさる。","en":"Her sister shrieked and stumbled backward.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r412","rowIndex":412,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　精一杯『ちから』で銃口を動かしたが、それでも銃弾は頬をかすめて傷つけた。<tips=50>路地</tips>は銃を構えたまま大きく一歩足を前に踏み出し、距離を詰める。","en":"We strained with our ‘power’ to turn the muzzle, but the bullet still grazed and cut her cheek. Keeping the gun trained, <tips=50>Roji</tips> took a large step forward and closed the distance.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r413","rowIndex":413,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼はもう『ちから』を脅威としていない。どうやってこの状況を脱するべきだろう？","en":"He no longer considered our ‘power’ a threat. How could we escape this situation?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r414","rowIndex":414,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　いまここでナイフを刺したところで、彼がそのまま引き金を引けば銃弾は命中する。かといって、彼をたじろがせるような重いものは、私たちの『ちから』では素早く動かすことは出来ない。軽くて、そして瞬時に彼の射撃能力を奪う方法はないか。","en":"Even if we drove a knife into him now, his shot would still hit us the instant he pulled the trigger. But our ‘power’ could not move anything heavy enough to stagger him with sufficient speed. Was there some light object we could use to rob him of the ability to shoot in an instant?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r415","rowIndex":415,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　考える暇はなかった。彼は確実に仕留める三発目を発射しようとしている。","en":"There was no time to think. He was about to fire a third shot and make certain of the kill.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r416","rowIndex":416,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　流しの上に、包丁やまな板、そして野菜などが調理途中のまま置いてあるのに気がつく。被害者となった女は、<tips=50>路地</tips>のために何か料理を作っている最中に<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>の襲撃を受けたのだろう。","en":"We noticed a kitchen knife, cutting board, vegetables, and other things left half-prepared on the counter by the sink. The murdered woman had likely been attacked by <tips=20>Koschei</tips> while she was cooking something for <tips=50>Roji</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r417","rowIndex":417,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私はボウルの横に、封を開けたままの小さな袋が置いてあるのを見つけると、それに『ちから』を使った。","en":"I spotted a small packet lying open beside a bowl and used our ‘power’ on it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r418","rowIndex":418,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　とっさのことで、中に何が入っているのかも把握出来ていない。もし、ほとんど使い切ったあとで、微量しか残っていなければ私たちは助からなかった。","en":"We had acted on instinct and did not even know what it held. If it had already been almost used up, with only a trace left inside, we would not survive.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r419","rowIndex":419,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しかし、幸運が私たちに味方した。","en":"But luck was on our side.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r420","rowIndex":420,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その袋の中身は片栗粉で、新品同様にたっぷりと粉末が残されていた。","en":"The packet contained potato starch and was still practically full.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r421","rowIndex":421,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それを<tips=50>路地</tips>の顔にぶちまける。","en":"We flung its contents into <tips=50>Roji’s</tips> face.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r422","rowIndex":422,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　まともに目くらましを受けた彼は慌てて発砲するが、それは当たらない。","en":"Blinded by a direct hit, he fired in panic. The shot went wide.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r423","rowIndex":423,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「こいつっ！」","en":"“You—!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r424","rowIndex":424,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちのもう片方は、<tips=50>路地</tips>を突き飛ばし、飛びかかろうとする。","en":"Her sister shoved <tips=50>Roji</tips> back and prepared to pounce on him.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r425","rowIndex":425,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いや、ここは逃げよう！」","en":"“No, let’s run!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r426","rowIndex":426,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「う、うんっ！」","en":"“Y-yeah!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r427","rowIndex":427,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちのもう片方は、襲い掛かるのをやめてこちらへ駆けつける。","en":"Her sister broke off the attack and rushed over.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r428","rowIndex":428,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして彼を背負う役を交代する。そして動かなくなった<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>を抱えて、部屋を出ようとした。その物音に反応して<tips=50>路地</tips>が銃を撃つ。弾は当たらない。","en":"They switched who was carrying him. Her sister hoisted the unresponsive <tips=20>Koschei</tips>, and we made for the door. <tips=50>Roji</tips> heard us move and fired. The bullet missed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r429","rowIndex":429,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちのもう片方は、肩に<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>を抱えて、もう片方の手で脇に置いてあった椅子を掴みとると彼に投げつけた。<tips=50>路地</tips>は怯み、その隙に、私たちは部屋を脱出する。","en":"With <tips=20>Koschei</tips> slung over one shoulder, she snatched up a chair with her free hand and hurled it at <tips=50>Roji</tips>. He recoiled, and we used the opening to escape the room.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r430","rowIndex":430,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　外は相変わらずの土砂降りだった。私たちは人気のない路地を駆け、塀を乗り越え、<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>と出会ったあの洋館へ向かった。","en":"The rain outside remained torrential. We raced through empty alleys, climbed over walls, and made for the Western-style mansion where we had first encountered <tips=20>Koschei</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r431","rowIndex":431,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　銃弾がかすめた私たちの頬と、私たちの肩が焼け付くようにジンジンと痛んだ。","en":"The cheek grazed by the bullet and the shoulder that had taken one throbbed with burning pain.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r432","rowIndex":432,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>のポケットから鍵を取り出して洋館の扉を開けた。建物のなかはあいかわらず静かだった。","en":"We took a key from <tips=20>Koschei’s</tips> pocket and opened the mansion door. The interior was as quiet as ever.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r433","rowIndex":433,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちはホールに<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>を横たわらせて傷の具合を確かめた。","en":"We laid <tips=20>Koschei</tips> down in the hall and examined his wounds.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r434","rowIndex":434,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　胸に穴が二つ空いている。肺も心臓も破壊されている。傷の様子からすると、最初に撃たれたのが肺で、あとで撃たれたものが心臓らしい。血はもうほとんど流れない。顔は蒼白になっている。","en":"There were two holes in his chest. Both a lung and his heart had been destroyed. Judging by the wounds, the first shot had struck the lung and the later one the heart. Almost no blood flowed now. His face was deathly pale.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r435","rowIndex":435,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「死んだかな」","en":"“Do you think he’s dead?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r436","rowIndex":436,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「普通なら、そうだね」","en":"“Normally, yeah.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r437","rowIndex":437,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　胸に耳を当てても心臓は動いていない。もちろん呼吸もしていない。体温は失われつつあり、肌に触れても、すでに人間の感触ではなかった。","en":"Putting an ear to his chest revealed no heartbeat. Naturally, he was not breathing, either. His body was losing its warmth. His skin no longer felt human beneath our fingers.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r438","rowIndex":438,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「でも……そうでもないかもしれない」","en":"“But... perhaps he isn’t.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r439","rowIndex":439,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　傷口の破壊された部分が、心なしか、不自然に丸みを帯びている。","en":"The destroyed flesh around the wounds seemed somehow unnaturally rounded.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r440","rowIndex":440,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「再生しかけているのかな？」","en":"“Could it be beginning to regenerate?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r441","rowIndex":441,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「もしかしたら。……さすがに、前の時より遅いけど」","en":"“Maybe. ...It’s much slower than before, though.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r442","rowIndex":442,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「このままにしておけば、立ち上がるかもね……」","en":"“If we leave him this way, he may stand up again...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r443","rowIndex":443,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「『不死身』という名前が伊達じゃなければ」","en":"“If the name ‘Immortal’ is more than an empty boast.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r444","rowIndex":444,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちは彼をバスルームに運ぶと、服を脱がせて傷口を洗い、清潔なものに着替えさせてから、二階の自室のベッドに寝かせた。","en":"We carried him to the bathroom, stripped him, cleaned his wounds, and changed him into clean clothes. Then we laid him on the bed in his room on the second floor.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r445","rowIndex":445,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それが終わってから、自分たちの傷口の手当てをした。頬の傷は大したことがなかったが、肩の傷は小指一本分くらいの肉が削り取られ、完治するのに少し時間がかかりそうだった。","en":"Once that was done, we tended to our own wounds. The cut on the cheek was nothing serious, but the bullet had gouged a piece of flesh the size of a little finger from the shoulder. It would take a while to heal completely.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r446","rowIndex":446,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「医者で縫って貰ったほうがいいよ」","en":"“You should have a doctor stitch that up.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r447","rowIndex":447,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうだね。すぐに行かないと」","en":"“Yeah. We need to go right away.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r448","rowIndex":448,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　分かってはいたが私たちは動く気になれなかった。","en":"We understood, but neither of us could bring herself to move.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r449","rowIndex":449,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　興奮が去り、虚脱のような疲労感が全身を重たくしていた。","en":"The excitement had drained away, leaving a hollow exhaustion that weighed down our entire bodies.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r450","rowIndex":450,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちは<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>の傍らに座って、ぼんやりと雨が降る夜の空を窓ガラスごしに眺めていた。","en":"We sat beside <tips=20>Koschei</tips> and gazed blankly through the window at the rainy night sky.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r451","rowIndex":451,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……殺しちゃったね」","en":"“...We killed him.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r452","rowIndex":452,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……うん、殺しちゃった」","en":"“...Yes. We killed him.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r453","rowIndex":453,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　じっと眺めたまま、一言ずつ言葉を口に出した。","en":"Still staring outward, we spoke one sentence at a time.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r454","rowIndex":454,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ベッドで眠り続ける<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>は、目を離した隙にいつのまにか<tips=63>サーシェンカ</tips>の姿に変化していた。","en":"<tips=20>Koschei</tips> continued sleeping in bed. At some point while our eyes were turned away, he changed into <tips=63>Sashenka</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r455","rowIndex":455,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そしてその肉体は、ものすごい速度で修復していった。","en":"And that body healed at an astonishing speed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r456","rowIndex":456,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　三日目には心臓と肺が動き始め、鼓動と呼吸を取り戻した。","en":"On the third day, his heart and lungs began to function. Pulse and breath returned.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r457","rowIndex":457,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　たった三日でここまで来たのなら、意識を取り戻して動き出すのもすぐかと思われたが、その日はなかなか訪れなかった。","en":"Since his recovery had progressed this far in only three days, we expected him to regain consciousness and move soon afterward, but that day did not come for quite some time.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r458","rowIndex":458,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちは毎日そこに通って彼の回復を見守った。","en":"We went there every day and watched over his recovery.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r459","rowIndex":459,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　排泄物などは最初の数日間は下着を汚したが、何も食べさせていないため、空になってしまうともう何も出てこなかった。","en":"For the first several days, bodily waste soiled his underclothes. But we fed him nothing, and once his body had emptied itself, no more emerged.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r460","rowIndex":460,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　この間、<tips=9>Y地区</tips>では色々と変化があった。","en":"Meanwhile, many changes took place in <tips=9>Y District</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r461","rowIndex":461,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>の跡を継いで、その叔父<tips=84>マイケル・ツェー</tips>が地域最大のマフィア組織<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>のリーダーになった。私たちの知り合いである<tips=1>菅原亮</tips>は、<tips=1>謝亮</tips>という本名で組織の幹部に収まった。頃合いを見て<tips=84>マイケル・ツェー</tips>が引退し、<tips=1>謝亮</tips>が三代目のリーダーになるのだろうと街の誰もが噂している。","en":"<tips=3>Chris Tse’s</tips> uncle, <tips=84>Michael Tse</tips>, succeeded him as leader of <tips=7>YS</tips>, the region’s largest criminal organization. Our acquaintance <tips=1>Ryo Sugawara</tips> took an executive post under his real name, <tips=1>Tse Leung</tips>. Everyone in the city whispered that, when the time was right, <tips=84>Michael Tse</tips> would retire and <tips=1>Tse Leung</tips> would become the third leader.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r462","rowIndex":462,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　このリーダーの交代によって、街の治安は悪くなっていた。","en":"The change in leadership had worsened public safety in the city.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r463","rowIndex":463,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>のなかには沢山の派閥がある。影響力の強い<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>が死んだことで、それらの派閥の代表者たちは自分たちの力を強めるために動き始め、組織の外の、街のチンピラたちも呼応するように活動を活発化させていた。","en":"<tips=7>YS</tips> contained many factions. Once the influential <tips=3>Chris Tse</tips> died, the representatives of those factions began maneuvering to strengthen their positions. The street toughs outside the organization stepped up their own activity in response.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r464","rowIndex":464,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちの住む団地でも、最近は見知らぬ顔を良く見るようになった。","en":"Even in the housing complex where we lived, unfamiliar faces had lately become a common sight.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r465","rowIndex":465,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「この街は、これから面白くなるぞ。街を糞つまらなくしていたあの中国人が死んだからな」","en":"“This city is about to become interesting. That Chinese bastard who made it boring as shit is dead.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"深沢聡","displayName":"Satoshi Fukazawa","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r466","rowIndex":466,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=14>深沢</tips>は嬉々としてそう呟き、私たちに新聞の記事を見せた。そこには、<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>の幹部である<tips=26>劉建志</tips>が部下や娘と共に殺害されたというニュースが掲載されていた。","en":"<tips=14>Fukazawa</tips> muttered with delight and showed us a newspaper article. It reported that <tips=7>YS</tips> executive <tips=26>Ryu Kenshi</tips> had been murdered together with his subordinates and daughter.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r467","rowIndex":467,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ボスが死んで、組織は滅茶苦茶だ。<tips=26>劉</tips>を殺したのは、執行部の香港グループだぜ。死んだボスのペットを扱いきれずに処分するしかなかったんだ。しかし、家族皆殺しとはよくやるな。しかも実に素早い。お前らの友だちだった<tips=1>ツェー・ルオン</tips>も関わってるらしいが、あのガキは相変わらずだな。……おい、本当にもうあいつと連絡とれないのか？」","en":"“With the boss dead, the organization’s a complete mess. It was the Hong Kong faction in the leadership that killed <tips=26>Ryu</tips>. They couldn’t control their dead boss’s pet, so they had no choice but to put him down. Still, wiping out the whole family—that’s ruthless. And fast, too. Sounds like your old friend <tips=1>Tse Leung</tips> was involved. That brat hasn’t changed a bit. ...Hey, you really can’t get in touch with him anymore?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"深沢聡","displayName":"Satoshi Fukazawa","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r468","rowIndex":468,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「知らないよ」","en":"“We don’t know.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r469","rowIndex":469,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「知らない」","en":"“We don’t.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r470","rowIndex":470,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「本当か？」","en":"“Really?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"深沢聡","displayName":"Satoshi Fukazawa","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r471","rowIndex":471,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして私たちの顔をのぞき込むと、","en":"Then he peered into our faces.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r472","rowIndex":472,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「おまえたち、最近ちょっと感じが変わったな。何かあったのか？」","en":"“Something about you two has changed lately. Did something happen?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"深沢聡","displayName":"Satoshi Fukazawa","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r473","rowIndex":473,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　と言った。","en":"So he asked.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r474","rowIndex":474,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　確かに、街は急激に変化しているようだった。しかし私たちにはあまり興味のない話だった。","en":"The city did seem to be changing rapidly. But it did not interest us very much.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r475","rowIndex":475,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちはそれよりも、犬頭の刑事を殺した影響について気にしていた。","en":"We were far more concerned about the consequences of killing the dog-headed detective.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r476","rowIndex":476,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　警察は<tips=9>Y地区</tips>で、地域の住人が殺されてもまず捜査はしない。<tips=9>Y地区</tips>の外からやって来た人間が殺された場合は、ある程度の捜査はするが、深入りはしない。しかし、警察官が殺された場合は可能な限りの捜査を行う。","en":"When a local resident was killed in <tips=9>Y District</tips>, the police generally did not even investigate. If someone from outside <tips=9>Y District</tips> was killed, they would investigate to a point, but never dig too deeply. When a police officer was killed, however, they did everything in their power to solve it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r477","rowIndex":477,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　だから私たちは警戒して、現場となった<tips=50>路地</tips>のマンションの近くを見回ったりして情報収集につとめたが、特に警察が捜査をはじめたというような話は聞かなかった。","en":"We therefore remained wary. We patrolled the vicinity of <tips=50>Roji’s</tips> apartment, the scene of the incident, and tried to gather information, but heard nothing to suggest the police had begun an investigation.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r478","rowIndex":478,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そうして時間が過ぎ、怪我をしてから大体一週間ほど過ぎたある日、<tips=63>サーシェンカ</tips>は目を覚ました。","en":"Time passed. One day, approximately a week after his injuries, <tips=63>Sashenka</tips> awoke.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r479","rowIndex":479,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その朝私たちが家を訪れると、<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>の姿でのんきに歯磨きをしていた。","en":"When we visited the house that morning, we found him in <tips=20>Koschei’s</tips> form, casually brushing his teeth.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r480","rowIndex":480,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なんだ、人の家に勝手に入ってきやがって」","en":"“What the hell? You can’t simply let yourselves into someone else’s house.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アレクセイ","displayName":"Alexei","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r481","rowIndex":481,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まあ、随分な言いぐさだね」","en":"“That’s a fine thing to say.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r482","rowIndex":482,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「私たちがここへ運んで、手当てをしてあげたんだよ」","en":"“We’re the ones who carried you here and patched you up.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r483","rowIndex":483,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ふん、別に必要のないことさ。おれはどうしたって死ぬことはない。『不死身』だからな」","en":"“Hmph. None of that was necessary. No matter what happens to me, I can’t die. I’m ‘immortal,’ after all.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アレクセイ","displayName":"Alexei","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r484","rowIndex":484,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あんな、無抵抗に横たわっててよく言うよ」","en":"“Big words from someone who was lying there completely helpless.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r485","rowIndex":485,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ゴキブリみたいな生命力があっても、あのままじゃ警察に捕まってたわ」","en":"“Even with the vitality of a cockroach, you would have been captured by the police if we’d left you there.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r486","rowIndex":486,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「おれを捕まえておくことなんか出来やしない。おれはお前らの手助けなんかいらないんだ。……だがまあ、ご苦労だったな。そうだ、お前の傷はどうした？　見せてみろ」","en":"“No one could keep me locked up. I don’t need your help. ...Still, good work, I suppose. Ah, yes—how’s that wound of yours? Let me see.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アレクセイ","displayName":"Alexei","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r487","rowIndex":487,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちは彼に言われるまま、袖をまくって撃たれたところを彼に見せた。","en":"We did as he said, rolling up a sleeve to show him the gunshot wound.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r488","rowIndex":488,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まだ生々しいな。これはきっと痕になるぞ。まったく、余計なことをしたもんだ。もういいよ」","en":"“Still looks raw. That’s definitely going to leave a scar. Honestly, you went and did something completely unnecessary. All right, that’s enough.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アレクセイ","displayName":"Alexei","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r489","rowIndex":489,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼は袖を戻すよう言った。","en":"He told her to lower the sleeve again.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r490","rowIndex":490,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼の傷はもう完全にふさがり、もはやどこを撃たれたのかさえ判別がつかなくなっている。","en":"His own wounds had closed completely. It was no longer possible to determine where the bullets had entered.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r491","rowIndex":491,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「おれがやられたあと、どうやってお前らはあそこを脱出したんだ？」","en":"“After I went down, how did you two get out of there?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アレクセイ","displayName":"Alexei","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r492","rowIndex":492,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　三人分の紅茶を彼自ら淹れてくれたあと、そう訊ねて来た。","en":"He asked after personally preparing tea for all three of us.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r493","rowIndex":493,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちは<tips=50>路地</tips>をその場に残して、雨の中逃げて来たことを説明した。","en":"We explained that we had left <tips=50>Roji</tips> there and fled through the rain.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r494","rowIndex":494,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ふうん、あの角野郎は殺さなかったのか」","en":"“Huh. So you didn’t kill that horned bastard.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アレクセイ","displayName":"Alexei","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r495","rowIndex":495,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうだよ」","en":"“That’s right.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r496","rowIndex":496,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「何か悪い？」","en":"“Is something wrong with that?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r497","rowIndex":497,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いや、別に。ただ、そうなのかと思っただけさ」","en":"“No, not really. I was just wondering.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アレクセイ","displayName":"Alexei","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r498","rowIndex":498,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼は肩をすくめて、","en":"He shrugged.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r499","rowIndex":499,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「しかし、おかしなやつらだな。どうしてそこまでする？　……いや、まあ世の中にはたまにはいるよな。おまえたちみたいな連中が。特に日常に飽きた若い女に多い。普段とちょっと違う刺激に出会うと、それをもう運命だと決めつけ、わけのわからない感情に動かされて、理屈抜きでとんでもないことをしてしまうのさ。おれはそういう性質が、いつも女を不幸にしているんだと思うぜ。気をつけた方が良い」","en":"“You two really are strange. Why go this far? ...No, I suppose your type does turn up from time to time. It’s especially common among young women bored with ordinary life. The moment they encounter some excitement outside their routine, they decide it must be fate. Then some emotion they don’t even understand sweeps them along, and they do something outrageous without a thought for reason. I’ve always thought that tendency was what made women unhappy. You’d better be careful.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アレクセイ","displayName":"Alexei","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r500","rowIndex":500,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「女たらしの殺人鬼が言うと説得力があるね」","en":"“Coming from a womanizing murderer, that does sound convincing.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r501","rowIndex":501,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「でも、それは見当違いだわ」","en":"“But you’ve misjudged us entirely.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r502","rowIndex":502,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「じゃあ、どういう理屈でおれにつきまとう？」","en":"“Then what’s your reason for following me around?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アレクセイ","displayName":"Alexei","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r503","rowIndex":503,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あなたを警察に突き出して、そうしたらもうこの話は終わっちゃうでしょ。でも、あなたの味方をすれば、もっと色んなことについて知ることが出来る」","en":"“If we handed you over to the police, the whole business would end there. But if we take your side, we can learn all sorts of other things.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r504","rowIndex":504,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「私たち、世の中に欲しいものは何もないの。ただ、この世界にあるいろんな人間のことを、もっとよく知りたいの」","en":"“There’s nothing we want from the world. We only want to understand all the different people in it more deeply.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r505","rowIndex":505,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「何のために？」","en":"“What for?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アレクセイ","displayName":"Alexei","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r506","rowIndex":506,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それは言いたくない」","en":"“We don’t want to tell you.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r507","rowIndex":507,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「別にこっちだってそこまで訊きたいわけじゃない。だが、取り立てて大したことはないぜ。おれだって、例の趣味以外はごく平凡な人間だ……何か特別な野心を持って行動するでもなく、朝の食卓にはパンとコーヒーを並べ、昼はそのあたりを散歩し、夜はワインの一杯でも飲めれば充分に幸福だ」","en":"“It’s not as though I’m dying to know. But there’s nothing particularly remarkable about me, either. Apart from that hobby of mine, I’m an entirely ordinary man... I’m not driven by any grand ambition. Give me bread and coffee at the breakfast table, a stroll around the neighborhood in the afternoon, and a glass of wine at night, and I’m perfectly content.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アレクセイ","displayName":"Alexei","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r508","rowIndex":508,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>は紅茶にたっぷりの蜂蜜を溶かしてから一口すする。","en":"<tips=20>Koschei</tips> dissolved a generous amount of honey into his tea, then took a sip.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r509","rowIndex":509,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「しかし、趣味が悪いぜ。殺人現場を見て、犬コロ人間を殺した。なかなか出来る体験じゃないのは確かだが、好き好んでやるようなことじゃない」","en":"“Still, that’s a sick idea of fun. You saw a murder scene and killed a mutt-man. It certainly isn’t an experience most people ever have, but it’s hardly something anyone should do for fun.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アレクセイ","displayName":"Alexei","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r510","rowIndex":510,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちの顔を見ると、呆れたように言った。","en":"He looked at us in exasperation as he spoke.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r511","rowIndex":511,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「馬鹿なことをしたもんだ。これで、おれたちのいる世界に足を踏み入れてしまったんだぞ。おれは平凡だが、おれがいるこの世界は、人ではないものたちのいる世界だ」","en":"“What a foolish thing you’ve done. Now you’ve set foot in the world we inhabit. I may be ordinary, but this is a world inhabited by things that are not human.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アレクセイ","displayName":"Alexei","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r512","rowIndex":512,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼は溜息をつく。","en":"He sighed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r513","rowIndex":513,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「この街でそんなかっこつけたって滑稽だよ。それに、私たちはそういう考え方はしない」","en":"“Trying to sound impressive in this city only makes you ridiculous. Besides, that isn’t how we think.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r514","rowIndex":514,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どんな経験をしたって、知識を得たって、それ自体に特別な意味はないわ。行為に引きずられて変化するのは弱い人間だけだよ。世の中には聖人も悪魔もいない」","en":"“No experience or knowledge has any special meaning in itself. Only the weak allow themselves to be dragged along and changed by their actions. There are no saints or devils in this world.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r515","rowIndex":515,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「確かに人を殺すのはつらかったけど、でもつらいってことは、何かを乗り越えたことだ」","en":"“Killing someone was painful, certainly. But pain means we’ve overcome something.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r516","rowIndex":516,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「乗り越えるってことは、自由になるってことだ。私たちは自由になりたいの」","en":"“And to overcome something is to become free. We want to be free.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r517","rowIndex":517,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そもそも、私たちは、こんなの初めてってわけじゃない。馬鹿にしないで」","en":"“Besides, it’s not like this is our first time. Don’t underestimate us.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r518","rowIndex":518,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ふん、そうか……」","en":"“Hmph. I see...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アレクセイ","displayName":"Alexei","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r519","rowIndex":519,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼は私たちを値踏みするようにジロジロとみる。","en":"He looked us up and down as though appraising us.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r520","rowIndex":520,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「本当よ」","en":"“It’s true.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r521","rowIndex":521,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「疑ってるわけじゃないさ。まあ、警察を殺してしまった以上、これから警察に追われるのは間違いない。どうするつもりだ？　さっさと街を出て逃げた方が得策じゃないか？」","en":"“I’m not doubting you. Still, now that you’ve killed a cop, there’s no doubt the police will be after you. What are you going to do? Wouldn’t it be smarter to get out of town fast?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アレクセイ","displayName":"Alexei","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r522","rowIndex":522,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あなたはどうするの？」","en":"“What will you do?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r523","rowIndex":523,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「おれは残るよ。まだここには仕事が残ってるんでね」","en":"“I’m staying. I’ve still got work to do here.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アレクセイ","displayName":"Alexei","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r524","rowIndex":524,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それが賢明ね。そもそも、ここにいた方が安全なんだよ。外で犯罪をおかしてこの街へやって来る人は沢山いるけど、逆なんかありえない」","en":"“That’s smart. You’re safer here to begin with. Plenty of people commit crimes outside the city and come here, but the reverse never happens.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r525","rowIndex":525,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ここにはいろんな人が住んでいるけど、殺人犯を見つけたからって、いちいち警察に通報するような人はいない。ましてや『<tips=13>ヘドロ団地</tips>の<tips=86>灰上姉妹</tips>』を警察に売る人間なんかいないって、断言したっていい」","en":"“All kinds of people live here, but none of them would bother reporting a murderer to the police. And I can say for certain that no one would ever sell out the ‘<tips=86>Haigami Sisters</tips> of the <tips=13>Sludge Housing Complex</tips>’ to them.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r526","rowIndex":526,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうか。まあおれは、別に捕まりたくなくてここにいるわけじゃないんだがな……」","en":"“I see. Well, it’s not like I’m here because I’m afraid of getting caught...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アレクセイ","displayName":"Alexei","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r527","rowIndex":527,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼はそしてカップの紅茶を飲み干した。","en":"He drained the tea from his cup.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r528","rowIndex":528,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「おまえたちは飲まないのか？　さっきから手を付けていない」","en":"“You two aren’t drinking? You haven’t touched your tea.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アレクセイ","displayName":"Alexei","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r529","rowIndex":529,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「私たちカフェインは飲まないの。睡眠がとれなくなって、美容に悪いから」","en":"“We don’t drink caffeine. It keeps us from sleeping, and that’s bad for our looks.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r530","rowIndex":530,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それより、説明してちょうだい」","en":"“Never mind that. Start explaining.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r531","rowIndex":531,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「何を？」","en":"“Explain what?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アレクセイ","displayName":"Alexei","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r532","rowIndex":532,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼はとぼけたように首をかしげる。","en":"He tilted his head as though playing innocent.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r533","rowIndex":533,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「全部だよ。全部」","en":"“Everything. All of it.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r534","rowIndex":534,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ここまで来て喋らないつもりなら、あんたを殺すわ」","en":"“If you still don’t intend to talk after all this, we’ll kill you.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r535","rowIndex":535,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「面白いジョークだ」","en":"“An amusing joke.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アレクセイ","displayName":"Alexei","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r536","rowIndex":536,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼は声を立てて笑って、","en":"He laughed aloud.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r537","rowIndex":537,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いいだろう。確かにおまえたちは他の女どもと違うような気がするな。こんなこと誰にも話したことはないが、おまえたちは特別だ。知りたいことは、出来るだけ話してやる。……聞いて後悔するなよ」","en":"“All right. You really do seem different from other women. I’ve never told anyone any of this, but you two are special. I’ll tell you as much as I can about whatever you want to know. ...You’d better not regret hearing it.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アレクセイ","displayName":"Alexei","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r538","rowIndex":538,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして彼は、薄笑いを顔に貼りつけたまま話し始めた。","en":"Then he began to speak, the faint smile still pasted across his face.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r539","rowIndex":539,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まずおれのことは『<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>』ではなく、<tips=64>アレクセイ</tips>と呼んで貰おう。<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>というのはあくまでも世間がつけた名前だからね。これが、おれの本当の名前だ」","en":"“First, I’d like you to call me <tips=64>Alexei</tips>, not ‘<tips=20>Koschei</tips>.’ <tips=20>Koschei</tips> is only a name the public gave me. This is my real name.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アレクセイ","displayName":"Alexei","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r540","rowIndex":540,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「フルネームはなんて言うの？」","en":"“What’s your full name?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r541","rowIndex":541,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「フルネームなんかないよ。これがおれの名前の全部だ」","en":"“I don’t have a full name. Alexei is my whole name.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アレクセイ","displayName":"Alexei","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r542","rowIndex":542,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そんなはずないでしょう」","en":"“That can’t be true.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r543","rowIndex":543,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ないんだから仕方ない」","en":"“I don’t have one, so there’s nothing I can do about it.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アレクセイ","displayName":"Alexei","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r544","rowIndex":544,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その言葉に、私たちは溜息をつく。","en":"We sighed at that answer.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r545","rowIndex":545,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……さて、まず何から話そうか」","en":"“...Now, where shall I begin?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アレクセイ","displayName":"Alexei","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r546","rowIndex":546,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>――<tips=64>アレクセイ</tips>は、背もたれに身体を預け、足を組んだ。","en":"<tips=20>Koschei</tips>—<tips=64>Alexei</tips>—leaned back and crossed his legs.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r547","rowIndex":547,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まず、<tips=63>サーシェンカ</tips>との関係を教えてほしいわ」","en":"“First, tell us how you’re connected to <tips=63>Sashenka</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r548","rowIndex":548,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「もしかして、あなたのサイキック能力？」","en":"“Could he be your psychic ability?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r549","rowIndex":549,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「その通り。世間ではサイキックだとか、<tips=16>タイプA</tips>だとか言うが、おれたちもそれに属するんだろう。この身体の中には複数の人間が住んでいて、必要に応じて別の人間に変わることができる」","en":"“Exactly. People call us psychics or <tips=16>Type As</tips>, and I suppose that’s what we are. Several people live inside this body, and it can change from one person into another as needed.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アレクセイ","displayName":"Alexei","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r550","rowIndex":550,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「複数？　<tips=63>サーシェンカ</tips>とあなたの他にも姿があるってこと？」","en":"“Several? You have other forms besides <tips=63>Sashenka</tips> and your own?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r551","rowIndex":551,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうとも。何人かいる。まあ、別の姿ですれ違ってもおまえたちは気がつかないだろうよ。姿も性格も違う、まるきりの別人だからな」","en":"“Of course. There are several of us. You could pass me in another form and never notice. We have different appearances and different personalities—we’re completely different people.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アレクセイ","displayName":"Alexei","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r552","rowIndex":552,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どういう人たちがいるの？」","en":"“What kind of people are they?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r553","rowIndex":553,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それは言えないな。なかにはおまえたちのことを快く思っていないやつもいるし、用心深いやつらもいる。いつも苦労してるのはおれだから、あいつらの意見なんか知ったことじゃないと言いたいが、おれも多少は配慮するのさ」","en":"“I can’t tell you that. Some of them aren’t too happy about you, and some are cautious. I’m always the one who gets stuck with the trouble, so I’d like to say I don’t give a damn what they think—but even I try to show a little consideration.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アレクセイ","displayName":"Alexei","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r554","rowIndex":554,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=64>アレクセイ</tips>はそう言って笑う。","en":"<tips=64>Alexei</tips> laughed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r555","rowIndex":555,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あなたはそういうことを色々知っているのね。<tips=63>サーシェンカ</tips>は何も知らなかったみたいだけど……」","en":"“So you know all sorts of things about this. <tips=63>Sashenka</tips> seemed to know nothing...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r556","rowIndex":556,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まあね。人によって出来ることが違うんだよ。<tips=63>サーシェンカ</tips>みたいに何も知らないやつもいるし、他人が表に出てる時も頭のなかに残ってボソボソと話しかけたり出来るヤツもいる。おれは、他人の存在は知っているが、出番じゃないときは眠ってる。その時何をしているかはわからない」","en":"“Well, what each of us can do is different. Some, like <tips=63>Sashenka</tips>, don’t know anything. Others stay in the mind while someone else is out and can mutter to them from inside. I know the others exist, but when it’s not my turn, I’m asleep. I have no idea what they’re doing then.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アレクセイ","displayName":"Alexei","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r557","rowIndex":557,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「時々空に向かって話しかけてるのは、その誰かと喋ってるの？」","en":"“When you talk to thin air like that, are you talking to one of them?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r558","rowIndex":558,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうだ」","en":"“I am.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アレクセイ","displayName":"Alexei","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r559","rowIndex":559,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なんだ。<tips=17>タイプB</tips>を発症してるのかと思った」","en":"“Oh. We thought your <tips=17>Type B</tips> had manifested.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r560","rowIndex":560,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「おれは<tips=17>タイプB</tips>だよ。でも発症してはいないし、おまえたちみたいに化け物じみた怪力もない。悲しき小市民さ」","en":"“I am a <tips=17>Type B</tips>. It just hasn’t manifested, and I don’t have the monstrous strength you two do. I’m just a poor little ordinary citizen.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アレクセイ","displayName":"Alexei","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r561","rowIndex":561,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼は肩をすくめた。","en":"He shrugged.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r562","rowIndex":562,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「次は何を話そうか？」","en":"“What should I tell you about next?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アレクセイ","displayName":"Alexei","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r563","rowIndex":563,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「じゃあ訊くよ」","en":"“Then I’ll ask.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r564","rowIndex":564,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あの異常な再生能力はなに？」","en":"“What exactly is that abnormal regeneration of yours?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r565","rowIndex":565,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「知らないよ。気がついたらそうなってたんだ。お前らだって自分の能力の説明なんか出来るのか？　出来るなら、今すぐ論文にすればノーベル賞をとれるぜ」","en":"“I don’t know. By the time I noticed, I was already like this. Can you two explain how your own powers work? If you can, write a paper on it right now and win yourselves a Nobel Prize.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アレクセイ","displayName":"Alexei","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r566","rowIndex":566,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どの程度の回復力があるの？」","en":"“How much damage can you recover from?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r567","rowIndex":567,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「最悪の思い出だと、爆弾で腰から上を吹っ飛ばされたことがある。あのときは酷いもので、再生に三ヶ月もかかった」","en":"“The worst I can remember is the time a bomb blew away everything above my waist. That was awful—it took me three whole months to regenerate.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アレクセイ","displayName":"Alexei","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r568","rowIndex":568,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「その状態から生き返るなんて、本当に不死身なのね……」","en":"“Coming back from that... You really are immortal.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r569","rowIndex":569,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「警察に撃たれても平気だし、ビルから飛び降りても川に落ちても大丈夫。とにかくその場さえしのげば、まったくの別人になりかわることが出来る……。随分ずさんでいいかげんなやつだと思ってたけど、今まで捕まらないで来られた理由がわかったわ」","en":"“The police can shoot you and you’ll be fine; you can jump off a building or fall into a river and still be all right. As long as you survive the immediate danger, you can turn into a completely different person... We thought you were remarkably sloppy and careless, but now we understand how you’ve avoided capture all this time.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r570","rowIndex":570,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「でも、それだけじゃ足りない。まだ何か能力を持ってるんじゃない？」","en":"“But that isn’t enough. There must be another ability, mustn’t there?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r571","rowIndex":571,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「鋭いな。でも、それは言えない。おれに関することじゃないからね」","en":"“Sharp. But I can’t tell you that. It’s not about me, you see.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アレクセイ","displayName":"Alexei","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r572","rowIndex":572,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あなたのなかの別の誰かが、サイキックってことね」","en":"“So someone else inside you is the psychic.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r573","rowIndex":573,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=64>アレクセイ</tips>は何も言わずに笑っているだけだった。","en":"<tips=64>Alexei</tips> said nothing. He merely smiled.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r574","rowIndex":574,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それにしても、話が本当ならとんでもないことだよ。必要に応じて必要な他人に入れ替わって、八つ裂きにされても死なないで、そしてサイキックもいるわけでしょう？」","en":"“Even so, if what you’re saying is true, that’s incredible. You can switch to whichever person you need, survive being torn to pieces, and one of you is psychic too?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r575","rowIndex":575,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「平凡だっていうけど、どこが平凡なのよ。こんな変態見たことない」","en":"“You call yourself ordinary, but what part of you is ordinary? We’ve never seen a pervert like you.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r576","rowIndex":576,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちは溜息をつく。","en":"We sighed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r577","rowIndex":577,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「おれ個人は平凡だよ。おまえたちのような怪力も念動力もない。……それに、言うほど便利じゃないんだぜ。その辺りにいるノーマルよりも不便で、どうにもならないことだってある……」","en":"“I’m ordinary as an individual. I don’t have your monstrous strength or telekinesis. ...And it’s not as convenient as you make it sound. In some ways I have it worse than the Normals around here, and there are things even I can’t do anything about...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アレクセイ","displayName":"Alexei","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r578","rowIndex":578,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=64>アレクセイ</tips>は目を細める。","en":"<tips=64>Alexei</tips> narrowed his eyes.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r579","rowIndex":579,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それは何？」","en":"“Like what?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r580","rowIndex":580,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……言えないな。全体的に、ちょっと話し過ぎた。……もしかしたらおれも、他人に自分のことを話したい気持ちがあったのかもしれないな」","en":"“...I can’t tell you. All in all, I’ve said a little too much. ...Maybe I wanted to tell someone about myself after all.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アレクセイ","displayName":"Alexei","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r581","rowIndex":581,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=64>アレクセイ</tips>は苦笑して、立ち上がると二杯目の紅茶を淹れるために電気ポットの方へ向かった。","en":"<tips=64>Alexei</tips> smiled wryly. He stood and went to the electric kettle to prepare a second cup of tea.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r582","rowIndex":582,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして彼が再び席に戻って来てから、私たちは別のことを訊ねた。","en":"Once he had returned to his seat, we asked about something else.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r583","rowIndex":583,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　あの<tips=50>路地</tips>の家での出来事だ。","en":"What had happened in <tips=50>Roji’s</tips> home.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r584","rowIndex":584,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あそこに散らばっていた死体は、あなたがやったの？」","en":"“Did you do that to the body scattered all over the room?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r585","rowIndex":585,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「厳密には違う……が、他人からすれば同じようなものだろう」","en":"“Strictly speaking, no. ...Though I suppose it amounts to the same thing to anyone else.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アレクセイ","displayName":"Alexei","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r586","rowIndex":586,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あなたのなかの別の誰かがやったのね」","en":"“Another person inside you did it.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r587","rowIndex":587,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうだ。おれはあんな散らかし方はしない。まったく、臓物をぶちまけて、可哀想なもんだよ。女に対して、あんな殺し方はしてはいけないんだ」","en":"“Yes. I’d never leave a mess like that. Spilling her guts everywhere... Poor woman. You shouldn’t kill a woman that way.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アレクセイ","displayName":"Alexei","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r588","rowIndex":588,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=64>アレクセイ</tips>は忌々しげに舌打ちをした。","en":"<tips=64>Alexei</tips> clicked his tongue in disgust.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r589","rowIndex":589,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あの被害者は誰？」","en":"“Who was the victim?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r590","rowIndex":590,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「知らないよ。まあたぶん、あの<tips=50>路地</tips>ってやつの妻か情婦か、その辺りだろう。彼女を殺すのに意味があったわけじゃない。あの場にいたから殺した。それだけだ」","en":"“I don’t know. Probably <tips=50>Roji’s</tips> wife or mistress, something like that. There wasn’t any reason to kill her. She was killed because she happened to be there. That’s all.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アレクセイ","displayName":"Alexei","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r591","rowIndex":591,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「その女性じゃなくて、あの家に用があったのね」","en":"“So it wasn’t the woman you wanted. It was the house.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r592","rowIndex":592,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうだ。あの<tips=50>路地</tips>ってやつが、どうもおれのことを知っているようだったからね。どの程度知っているか調べようと思ったのさ」","en":"“Yes. That <tips=50>Roji</tips> fellow seemed to know something about me. I wanted to find out how much.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アレクセイ","displayName":"Alexei","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r593","rowIndex":593,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼が言うには、数日前に<tips=50>路地邦昭</tips>が『<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>』のことを知っているという話を聞いたらしい。そして<tips=50>路地</tips>について調べてみると、サイキック能力を持つ元探偵で、今は警察の管理下にあるということが判明した。","en":"According to him, he had heard a few days earlier that <tips=50>Kuniaki Roji</tips> knew something about ‘<tips=20>Koschei</tips>.’ When he looked into <tips=50>Roji</tips>, he discovered that the former detective had a psychic ability and was now under police supervision.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r594","rowIndex":594,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「彼らはこの街でのあなたの猟奇殺人について調べていたってこと？」","en":"“They were investigating your grotesque murders in this city?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r595","rowIndex":595,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうかもしれない。でも、このおれの殺人事件を調べているだけだったら別にどうってことはないんだ。いくらでも誤魔化せるからね。……まあ、とにかく、あいつらがどの程度情報をつかんでいるのか調べるために行ったのさ。おれは気が進まなかったがね。そうしろって言うんだから仕方ない。そして結果はこの通りさ。馬鹿馬鹿しいもんだよ。罪のない女と刑事が死んだ。おまえたちが人殺しになった。……愛のない殺人は最悪だ。何の感情もなく、ただ邪魔だからって殺されるなんて、あまりにも非人間的な話だと思わないか？　みんなに馬鹿にされるがね、おれは愛情ってものをとても大事に考えているんだよ。それが人として正しいことだろう？」","en":"“Maybe. But if they were only investigating my murders, it was nothing to worry about. I could fool them any number of ways. ...Anyway, I went there to find out how much information they had. I didn’t want to, but I was told to, so what choice did I have? And look at the result. It’s ridiculous. An innocent woman and a detective are dead. You two have become murderers. ...Murder without love is the worst. Killing someone without feeling a thing, simply because they’re in the way—don’t you think that’s horribly inhuman? Everyone makes fun of me for it, but love is something I care about very deeply. That’s only right for a human being, isn’t it?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アレクセイ","displayName":"Alexei","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r596","rowIndex":596,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「同意を求められたって困るよ。私たちはあなたみたいな変態じゃないもの」","en":"“It’s a little hard to ask us to agree with you. We’re not perverts like you.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r597","rowIndex":597,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「何だっていいさ。とにかくさ、調べたいなら、好きに調べさせてやればよかったんだよ。おれたちはずっと好き放題やってきたんだ。」","en":"“Whatever. My point is, if they wanted to investigate, we should’ve just let them investigate to their hearts’ content. We’ve always done whatever we pleased.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アレクセイ","displayName":"Alexei","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r598","rowIndex":598,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「つまりさ、あなたのなかにいる、誰かがそう命令したってことなんでしょ。ねえ、その人と直接話せない？」","en":"“What you mean is that someone inside you gave the order. Can’t we speak with that person directly?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r599","rowIndex":599,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どうかな……ふむ、それは無理だって言っている。こいつは心配性で、用心深いやつだからね。いまさら用心深くしたって、何の意味もないだろうとおれは思うんだが。だって、どうせ、もうどうにもなりゃしないんだ……」","en":"“Who knows... Hm. He says that’s impossible. He’s a worrier, and a cautious one. I don’t see what good caution will do at this point, though. After all, nothing can be done anymore...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アレクセイ","displayName":"Alexei","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r600","rowIndex":600,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どういうこと？」","en":"“What does that mean?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r601","rowIndex":601,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「さあね。……まあ、主謀者には、そのうち会えるだろうよ。約束はしないがね。そうだろう？」","en":"“Who knows? ...Well, you’ll probably meet the mastermind eventually. No promises, though. Right?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アレクセイ","displayName":"Alexei","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r602","rowIndex":602,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=64>アレクセイ</tips>の最後の言葉は、誰もいない空間にむかって放たれた。","en":"<tips=64>Alexei</tips> directed his final words toward empty space.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r603","rowIndex":603,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼の頭のなかにいる、その『主謀者』にむけて言ったのだろう。","en":"We assumed he had spoken to the ‘instigator’ inside his mind.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r604","rowIndex":604,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「で、今回はその<tips=50>路地</tips>を残しちゃったけど、どうするの？」","en":"“And what will you do now that we left <tips=50>Roji</tips> alive?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r605","rowIndex":605,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「知らないよ。おれはどうでもいい。どうでもよくないやつが何か考えるだろう」","en":"“I don’t know. I don’t care. Whoever does care will think of something.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アレクセイ","displayName":"Alexei","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r606","rowIndex":606,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=64>アレクセイ</tips>は言いながら、また紅茶に大量に蜂蜜を溶かす。","en":"As he spoke, <tips=64>Alexei</tips> once again stirred an enormous helping of honey into his tea.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r607","rowIndex":607,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　一通りの話を聞いて、私たちは顔を見合わせる。","en":"Once we had heard the whole account, we looked at each other.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r608","rowIndex":608,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なんだか、色んな話を聞いちゃったわね」","en":"“That was... a lot to take in.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r609","rowIndex":609,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「消化が悪くて胸焼けしそう」","en":"“It’s hard to digest. I can feel the heartburn coming on.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r610","rowIndex":610,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　次は何を訊いたらいいのか、私たちは話し合った。","en":"We discussed what we should ask next.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r611","rowIndex":611,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　一遍に大量の情報が与えられたので、少し整理する必要がある。ああでもないこうでもないと言い合っていると、目の前でゆっくり紅茶を啜っていたはずの<tips=64>アレクセイ</tips>が、いつの間にか姿を変えていた。","en":"We had been given a tremendous amount of information all at once and needed time to sort through it. As we went back and forth, <tips=64>Alexei</tips>—who had been slowly sipping tea right before our eyes—somehow changed form without either of us noticing.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r612","rowIndex":612,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なんだこれえ。いくらなんでも甘すぎるよ……」","en":"“What is this? This is way too sweet...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"サーシェンカ白シャツ","displayName":"Sashenka (White Shirt)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r613","rowIndex":613,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　目の前で顔をしかめているのは、","en":"The face grimacing before us belonged to—","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r614","rowIndex":614,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=63>サーシェンカ</tips>……」","en":"“<tips=63>Sashenka</tips>...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r615","rowIndex":615,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ああ、二人揃って、こんにちは」","en":"“Ah, hello, both of you.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"サーシェンカ白シャツ","displayName":"Sashenka (White Shirt)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r616","rowIndex":616,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=63>サーシェンカ</tips>は屈託のない笑顔を浮かべている。","en":"<tips=63>Sashenka</tips> wore an untroubled smile.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r617","rowIndex":617,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「今日は気分がいい目覚めだよ。なんでもない部屋のなかで、きみたち二人と向かい合っているんだ。いつもこんなに平和だったらいいのにねえ……」","en":"“What a pleasant way to wake up. Here I am in an ordinary room, sitting across from the two of you. If only it could always be this peaceful...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"サーシェンカ白シャツ","displayName":"Sashenka (White Shirt)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F2:r618","rowIndex":618,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼の無邪気な表情に、私たちは言葉を失った。","en":"His innocent expression left us speechless.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}}]},{"position":33,"code":"F3","unitId":"F3","rows":[{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r1","rowIndex":1,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちの片方は<tips=17>タイプB</tips>で、少し前から時々発作が起きるようになっている。","en":"One of us is <tips=17>Type B</tips> and has recently begun experiencing occasional episodes.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r2","rowIndex":2,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　聞こえないはずの声が聞こえて、振り返ると誰もいない。","en":"She hears voices that should not be there, then turns around to find no one behind her.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r3","rowIndex":3,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　感情的になりやすく、突然泣き出す。","en":"She is easily overcome by emotion and suddenly bursts into tears.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r4","rowIndex":4,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　脈絡のない独り言を口にする。","en":"She mutters disconnected things to herself.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r5","rowIndex":5,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　症状があらわれたときはクリニックで処方された薬を服用すれば少し落ち着く。","en":"When the symptoms appear, taking the medicine prescribed at the clinic calms her down somewhat.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r6","rowIndex":6,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そのうち、私、もうあなたと一緒にいられなくなっちゃうかもしれない」","en":"“Someday, I might not be able to stay with you anymore.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r7","rowIndex":7,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「大丈夫だよ。ちゃんと薬を飲んでればある程度進行は食い止められるし、もし悪くなっても、ずっと一緒にいてもらうから」","en":"“It’s all right. As long as you keep taking your medicine, we can slow it down to some extent. And even if it gets worse, I’m going to make you stay with me forever.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r8","rowIndex":8,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それでも発作の頻度は少しずつ増加している。","en":"Even so, the episodes are gradually becoming more frequent.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r9","rowIndex":9,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=64>アレクセイ</tips>はまた私たちの前から姿を消した。","en":"<tips=64>Alexei</tips> had disappeared on us again.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r10","rowIndex":10,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=64>アレクセイ</tips>でも<tips=63>サーシェンカ</tips>でもない誰かとして活動しているのかもしれない。彼らのなかには私たちと関わりたくない人もいるのだと聞いている。","en":"Perhaps he was out there as someone who was neither <tips=64>Alexei</tips> nor <tips=63>Sashenka</tips>. We had heard that some of them wanted nothing to do with us.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r11","rowIndex":11,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちは団地へは戻らず、<tips=64>アレクセイ</tips>たちの家や<tips=58>パラシュート通り</tips>にある空き家に勝手に上がり込んで寝泊まりしたりしている。","en":"We have not gone back to the housing complex. Instead, we have been letting ourselves into <tips=64>Alexei</tips> and the others’ place or vacant houses on <tips=58>Parachute Street</tips> and sleeping there without permission.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r12","rowIndex":12,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　団地のなかは簡単に警察が入り込める場所ではないけれど、それでも私たちの住所といえばすぐに出て来る場所だし、<tips=50>路地</tips>や警察と鉢合わせしたくもない。","en":"The housing complex was not an easy place for the police to enter, but it was still the obvious place to look once they checked our address. Besides, we had no desire to run into <tips=50>Roji</tips> or the police.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r13","rowIndex":13,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　時々は足を向けて、団地の皆に尋ねて警察が来ていないかなどをチェックするけれど、それだけだ。","en":"We did go back now and then to ask everyone whether the police had been around and check on things, but that was all.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r14","rowIndex":14,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　学校へは行っていない。もし警察が私たちを逮捕しようとするならば、あそこが一番都合のよい場所になる。","en":"We were not going to school. If the police meant to arrest us, there could be no more convenient place for them to do it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r15","rowIndex":15,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　毎日何もせず、ぼんやりと街をうろついていた。アレクセイを無理に探そうとはしない。他の誰かに変身していれば絶対に見つけることは出来ないし、<tips=64>アレクセイ</tips>と<tips=63>サーシェンカ</tips>には私たちの連絡先を伝えてある。こちらも向こうの連絡先を知っていたけれど、電話をかけてもメールをしてもリアクションはなかった。","en":"We spent each day doing nothing, drifting aimlessly around the city. We did not go out of our way to look for Alexei. If he had transformed into someone else, we would never find him, and we had already given both <tips=64>Alexei</tips> and <tips=63>Sashenka</tips> our contact information. We knew how to reach them too, but neither calls nor messages got a response.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r16","rowIndex":16,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　もしこのまま二度と彼らと関わることがなければ、私たちはただ殺人犯になっただけで終わるだろう。","en":"If we never had anything to do with them again, then all we would have accomplished was becoming murderers.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r17","rowIndex":17,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　けれど私たちは、そうはならないと、特に根拠があるわけではないけれど確信していた。","en":"And yet, with no particular basis for it, we were certain that was not how things would end.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r18","rowIndex":18,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　どういう形であれ、あそこまで自分のことを話した<tips=64>アレクセイ</tips>たちが、私たちをこのままにしておくとも思えない。","en":"Whatever they decided to do, after telling us that much about themselves, we could not imagine <tips=64>Alexei</tips> and the others simply leaving us alone.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r19","rowIndex":19,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ある昼下がり、<tips=64>アレクセイ</tips>たちの建物に向かう途中で車が止まっているのを見つけた。","en":"One afternoon, on our way to the building where <tips=64>Alexei</tips> and the others lived, we spotted a parked car.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r20","rowIndex":20,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その車に何か特徴があったわけではないけれど、私たちは勘のようなもので不審を抱き、家に向かうのをやめて、そっとその周りを調べることにした。","en":"There was nothing distinctive about it, but some instinct made us suspicious. We decided not to approach the building and quietly began checking the area around it instead.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r21","rowIndex":21,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"『ちから』で、そっと掛け金を外して人の家に入り、片方が<tips=17>タイプB</tips>の力をつかって塀をのぼり、もう片方を引き上げる。少し高い建物の屋根に立って辺りを見回すと、木陰や塀の裏側に人が隠れ、<tips=64>アレクセイ</tips>の家の方を窺っているのが見えた。","en":"Using our ‘power,’ we quietly slipped the latch and entered someone’s house. One of us used her <tips=17>Type B</tips> power to climb the wall and pull the other up after her. From the roof of a slightly taller building, we looked around and saw people concealed in the shade of trees and behind walls, watching <tips=64>Alexei’s</tips> building.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r22","rowIndex":22,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　拳銃を取り出し手に持っているものもいる。","en":"Some had drawn handguns and were holding them ready.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r23","rowIndex":23,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「警察かしら？」","en":"“Do you think they’re police?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r24","rowIndex":24,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうかもしれないね」","en":"“They might be.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r25","rowIndex":25,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　こんなに沢山の人員で建物を包囲して、随分大がかりな捜査だ。","en":"With so many people surrounding the building, it was an enormous operation.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r26","rowIndex":26,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それはきっと『<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>』の『ちから』と、そしておそらく私たちの『ちから』を警戒しているのだろう。","en":"They were surely wary of ‘<tips=20>Koschei’s</tips>’ ‘power’—and probably of ours as well.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r27","rowIndex":27,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちの立っている場所からは、建物で何が行われているのかまではわからない。けれども、これ以上近づくのは危険だ。","en":"From where we stood, we could not tell what was happening inside the building. Going any closer, however, would be dangerous.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r28","rowIndex":28,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　もどかしい思いで、ほんの少し移動したりしながら、少しでも多くの情報を得ることにつとめた。","en":"Frustrated, we shifted position little by little, doing what we could to gather as much information as possible.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r29","rowIndex":29,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼らは建物のなかを捜査していて、そしてそれは私たちがここにやって来る大分前から行っていたようだ。","en":"They were searching the building, and seemed to have been at it since long before we arrived.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r30","rowIndex":30,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　建物の出入り口の辺りにトラックが停まっているのが見える。そこに、警察官らしい人々が段ボール箱やビニールの袋を積み込んでいるのが見える。当然、そのなかにはあの食器棚に並べられた腐敗した死体なども含まれているに違いない。","en":"We could see a truck parked near the building’s entrance. People who appeared to be police officers were loading it with cardboard boxes and plastic bags. Naturally, the contents had to include the decomposing bodies that had been arranged in the cupboard.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r31","rowIndex":31,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちは何かあの建物に重要なものを置いて来たのだろうか？　毛髪や指紋のような痕跡は残っているだろうが、それは知られたところで困らない。どうせ、もう既に<tips=50>路地</tips>の家で私たちと『<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>』が一緒に居るところを<tips=50>路地</tips>に見られている。","en":"Had we left anything important behind in that building? There were bound to be traces such as hair and fingerprints, but it would not matter if those were discovered. After all, <tips=50>Roji</tips> had already seen us together with ‘<tips=20>Koschei</tips>’ at <tips=50>Roji's</tips> own house.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r32","rowIndex":32,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「仲間が殺されただけあって、警察は随分本気だね」","en":"“Having one of their own killed certainly made the police take this seriously.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r33","rowIndex":33,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まったくだよ。この街でいくら人が殺されたって、こんなにきっちり調べないくせにね」","en":"“No kidding. No matter how many people get killed in this city, they never investigate this thoroughly.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r34","rowIndex":34,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　捜査は暗くなるまで続いた。","en":"The search continued until dark.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r35","rowIndex":35,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちは捜査員が証拠物件を運び出すだけの光景に緊張感を失い、屋根の上にお互いもたれかかるように座りながら、時々あくびをして眺めていた。","en":"Once it became clear that the investigators were doing nothing but carrying out evidence, our tension faded. We sat leaning against each other on the roof, watching and yawning from time to time.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r36","rowIndex":36,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　空の色が青からオレンジ色にかわるころ、ようやく捜査が終わったらしく、捜査員たちはそれぞれの車に乗り込んで去ってゆく。引き返す彼らに見つからないよう、すっかり緩みきっていた私たちは慌てて移動して身を隠した。","en":"By the time the sky changed from blue to orange, the search at last appeared to be over. The investigators climbed into their cars and drove away. We had let our guard down completely and had to scramble for cover so they would not spot us as they passed on their way back.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r37","rowIndex":37,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どうする？　みんな帰っちゃったから、建物の様子見る？」","en":"“What should we do? Everyone’s gone. Want to see what the building looks like?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r38","rowIndex":38,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「危ないかもしれないけど……どんな風に調べたのかちょっと見たいね」","en":"“It might be dangerous... but I do want to see how they searched it.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r39","rowIndex":39,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちは囁きあいながら路上に出て、そして建物に近づいたところで、","en":"Whispering to each other, we stepped out onto the street and approached the building, when—","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r40","rowIndex":40,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あ、まだ誰か残ってる」","en":"“Oh. Someone’s still here.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r41","rowIndex":41,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「隠れよう」","en":"“Let’s hide.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r42","rowIndex":42,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　もう一度塀をよじ登った。","en":"We climbed the wall again.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r43","rowIndex":43,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　建物の門の前に乗用車がまだ残っており、その前で二人の人影が話している。","en":"A passenger car remained in front of the building’s gate, with two figures talking beside it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r44","rowIndex":44,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　一人は小柄な女性、そしてもう一人は逞しい男の背中をこちらに向けている。","en":"One was a small woman. The other, a powerfully built man, had his back to us.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r45","rowIndex":45,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あれは<tips=50>路地邦昭</tips>だ」","en":"“That’s <tips=50>Kuniaki Roji</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r46","rowIndex":46,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ほんとうだ」","en":"“It really is.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r47","rowIndex":47,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　後ろ姿でも、その額から伸びた角が見えた。","en":"Even from behind, we could see the horn protruding from his forehead.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r48","rowIndex":48,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「やっぱり、あいつも警察と一緒に捜査しているんだね」","en":"“So he really is helping the police investigate.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r49","rowIndex":49,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうだね。ちょっと大変かもしれない」","en":"“Looks like it. This could make things a little difficult.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r50","rowIndex":50,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=50>路地</tips>の家で死んだあの犬頭の刑事もサイキック能力を捜査に用いて普通の警察では突き止めることが出来ないことを暴き出すということで恐れられていたが、かつての<tips=50>路地</tips>もそれに劣らない優秀な探偵だったと聞いている。","en":"The dog-headed detective who died at <tips=50>Roji’s</tips> house was feared for using his psychic abilities in investigations to expose things ordinary police could never uncover, but we had heard that <tips=50>Roji</tips>, in his day, was just as brilliant a detective.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r51","rowIndex":51,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　なにより彼は、刑事と違ってこの街の住人だ。警察相手では口が重くなる人々でも、彼には協力的に振る舞う可能性がある。","en":"More importantly, unlike the detective, he was a resident of this city. People who kept their mouths shut around the police might well cooperate with him.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r52","rowIndex":52,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あいつ、きっと私たちを恨んでるわ」","en":"“He must hate us.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r53","rowIndex":53,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「だろうね。女の人も、犬のおまわりさんも殺しちゃったもの」","en":"“Probably. We killed the woman and the doggie policeman, after all.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r54","rowIndex":54,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=50>路地</tips>と話している相手は車に乗って立ち去り、<tips=50>路地</tips>だけがその場に取り残される。","en":"The person speaking with <tips=50>Roji</tips> got into the car and drove away, leaving only <tips=50>Roji</tips> behind.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r55","rowIndex":55,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼は去りゆく車を見送りもせず、車と逆方向に歩き出す。","en":"He did not watch the car go, but started walking in the opposite direction.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r56","rowIndex":56,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どうしよっか。あいつが捜査に協力するなら、たぶん一番やっかいな人間だよね」","en":"“What should we do? If he helps with the investigation, he’ll probably be our biggest problem.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r57","rowIndex":57,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうだね。それに、こんな風に先手をとれるなんて滅多にないことだし……」","en":"“Yes. And we hardly ever get a chance to make the first move like this...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r58","rowIndex":58,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「でも、<tips=64>アレクセイ</tips>たちは彼に何か聞きたいことがあるんじゃない？」","en":"“But don’t you think <tips=64>Alexei</tips> and the others might want to ask him something?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r59","rowIndex":59,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そのわりには、彼らは<tips=50>路地邦昭</tips>を放置してるけど……」","en":"“If they do, they’ve still left <tips=50>Kuniaki Roji</tips> alone...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r60","rowIndex":60,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　合理的に考えるならば、ここで彼を始末するのが一番自分たちの身の安全にとって有効なのははっきりしていた。","en":"Rationally, it was obvious that disposing of him here would do the most to protect us.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r61","rowIndex":61,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しかし私たちは優柔不断だった。結論を出せないまま、彼を見失わぬように屋根伝いにその姿を追った。","en":"But we could not make up our minds. Unable to reach a decision, we followed him across the rooftops so as not to lose sight of him.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r62","rowIndex":62,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　日は落ちかけていたが、まだ辺りは明るい。彼が顔を上げて振り返れば私たちの姿は見つかっただろうが、普通人はまわりの建物の屋根の上を歩いたりはしない。しかも彼は何か考え事をしているのか、むしろうつむき加減で歩いていた。","en":"The sun was nearly down, but the surroundings were still light. Had he raised his head and looked back, he would have seen us. Ordinary people, however, did not go around walking on the roofs of nearby buildings. Besides, perhaps lost in thought, he kept his gaze lowered as he walked.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r63","rowIndex":63,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　隙だらけの背中を襲うチャンスはいくらでもあったはずだが私たちは決断できないまま彼の歩行を見守っていた。","en":"We had any number of chances to attack his utterly exposed back, yet watched him walk on without ever reaching a decision.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r64","rowIndex":64,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　すると、彼はなぜか行き止まりの路地に向かって足を踏み入れる。そして電話機を取り出した。","en":"Then, for some reason, he turned into a dead-end alley and took out his phone.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r65","rowIndex":65,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どこにかけるのかな？」","en":"“Who’s he calling?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r66","rowIndex":66,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ちょっと、盗み聞きしてみようか」","en":"“Why don’t we listen in?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r67","rowIndex":67,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちは屋根をまわって死角から彼に近づいた。","en":"We circled around the roof and approached him from his blind side.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r68","rowIndex":68,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　すぐ足元に携帯電話を操作する彼の姿が来る位置まで移動した。その瞬間、私たちのポケットのなかで携帯電話がけたたましく鳴った。","en":"We moved until he stood directly beneath us, working his cell phone. At that instant, a cell phone began shrieking inside our pocket.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r69","rowIndex":69,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ど、どういうこと？」","en":"“W-what’s going on?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r70","rowIndex":70,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　携帯電話のサイレントモードを忘れるはずがない。しかも、普段の着信音とは全く違う聞いたことがない音とは。","en":"There was no way we had forgotten to put the phone on silent. Besides, the sound was nothing like our usual ringtone—nothing we had ever heard before.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r71","rowIndex":71,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　慌てて携帯電話を取り出すと、見知らぬ番号が通知されていて、そして確かにサイレントモードに設定されたままだ。","en":"We hurriedly pulled out the phone. It displayed an unfamiliar number, and it was indeed still set to silent.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r72","rowIndex":72,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　この至近距離で大きな音を立てれば当然<tips=50>路地</tips>が気づかないはずがない。彼はくるりとこちらを振り返る。","en":"At this range, there was no way <tips=50>Roji</tips> could fail to notice such a loud sound. He wheeled around to face us.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r73","rowIndex":73,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　動作を起こすのは彼の方が早かった。","en":"He made the first move.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r74","rowIndex":74,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=50>路地</tips>はジャケットの胸元に素早く手を差し入れる。","en":"<tips=50>Roji</tips> swiftly reached inside his jacket.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r75","rowIndex":75,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして引き抜かれたその手には、黒い金属の塊が握られていた。","en":"And when he pulled his hand out, it was gripping a lump of black metal.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r76","rowIndex":76,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それは私たちの片方の顔面にしっかりと照準がつけられ、その銃口の奥まではっきりと見えた。","en":"It was aimed squarely at the face of one of us. We could see straight down the barrel.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r77","rowIndex":77,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そしてその奥で火薬がはじけるところまで見えた。","en":"And we even saw the powder ignite deep inside it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r78","rowIndex":78,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　完全に頭を打ち抜かれたと思ったが、もう片方が路地以上に素早く<tips=17>タイプＢ</tips>のちからを発動させ、もう片方の頭を下げさせた。そしてそのまま屋根の上から転がり落ち、<tips=50>路地</tips>の銃の届く範囲から姿を消した。","en":"We thought the shot had gone clean through her head. But the other moved even faster than Roji, activating her <tips=17>Type B</tips> power and forcing her sister’s head down. Then the two rolled off the roof and disappeared beyond the range of <tips=50>Roji’s</tips> gun.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r79","rowIndex":79,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=17>タイプＢ</tips>の方がうまく支えて二人の身体を音もなく地上に着地させる。私たちは冷や汗のうかんだ顔を見つめ合ってお互い頷いた。","en":"The <tips=17>Type B</tips> sister caught and supported both our bodies, setting us soundlessly on the ground. We stared at each other, cold sweat on our faces, and nodded.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r80","rowIndex":80,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　こうなった以上迷っている暇はないと、私たちは瞬時に理解した。","en":"We understood at once: now that it had come to this, there was no time left for hesitation.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r81","rowIndex":81,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　路上から駆け足の音が聞こえる。<tips=50>路地</tips>が逃げようとしているのだ。","en":"Running footsteps sounded from the street. <tips=50>Roji</tips> was trying to escape.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r82","rowIndex":82,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「捕まえてくる」","en":"“I’ll catch him.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r83","rowIndex":83,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そう言い残すと金色の目のまま跳躍し、ひとっとびで塀の上に飛び乗った。もう片方も、塀を回って遠回りながらもう片方を追う。","en":"Leaving those words behind, she leapt with her eyes still golden and landed atop the wall in a single bound. Her sister went around the wall and followed by the longer route.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r84","rowIndex":84,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　すぐ彼の後を追いかけたのに、角を曲がったところで姿を見失った。塀の上から追っているから見通しが良く、タイミング的に彼が通りの向こうに去っていったのを見逃したとも思えない。","en":"I chased after him at once, but lost sight of him when I rounded the corner. From atop the wall I had a clear view, and given the timing, I could not possibly have missed him leaving at the far end of the street.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r85","rowIndex":85,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　この辺りの通りは住民が放置した粗大ゴミなどで雑然としている。このどこかに隠れたと考えるべきか。","en":"The streets here were cluttered with bulky trash abandoned by the residents. I had to assume he was hiding somewhere among it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r86","rowIndex":86,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　相手は銃を持っている。死角から奇襲されることを考えたが、それでももう一人が追いつくまで待つ気にはなれなかった。","en":"He had a gun. I considered the danger of an ambush from a blind spot, but still could not bring myself to wait for my sister to catch up.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r87","rowIndex":87,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　塀の上から路上に降り立ち、あの大男の姿を探す。","en":"I dropped from the wall to the street and searched for the big man.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r88","rowIndex":88,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼が奇襲をかけるとしたら、私たちが目をそらした瞬間だろう。わざとあやしいところに背を向けるようにしながら、意識も目の前よりも背後に集中させ、あたりを探索した。","en":"If he launched a surprise attack, it would be the instant we looked away. Deliberately turning our back on the most suspicious places, we focused our attention behind us rather than ahead as we searched the area.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r89","rowIndex":89,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　黄金の目が開いている間は、筋力だけでなく聴覚視覚嗅覚もいくらか向上する。軽トラックに背を向けたとき、その方向で衣擦れのような物音が立ったのを感じ取った。誘い込んだ罠にまんまとひっかかったのだ。","en":"While my golden eyes were open, not only my muscles but also my hearing, sight, and sense of smell improved somewhat. When I turned my back on a small truck, I caught a sound from that direction, like clothing brushing against itself. He had walked straight into my trap.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r90","rowIndex":90,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして心のなかで準備していたとおり高く跳躍する。銃声がする。弾丸は私がいたところを素通りして、目の前の青いプラスチックのゴミ箱を破壊する。そして空中でくるりと宙返りしながら相手を確認すると、トラックのなかで<tips=50>路地</tips>が銃を構えているのが見えた。","en":"Just as I had planned, I leapt high. A gunshot cracked. The bullet passed through the space where I had been and shattered the blue plastic trash can in front of me. Flipping in midair, I spotted <tips=50>Roji</tips> inside the truck, aiming his gun.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r91","rowIndex":91,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼は続けざまに二発銃を撃ったが、命中しない。彼は車のなかに引っ込む。","en":"He fired twice more in quick succession, but neither shot struck me. Then he ducked back inside the cab.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r92","rowIndex":92,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　着地してすぐトラックに向かって駆ける。トラックはエンジン音を立て、走り出そうとする。こちらも走る速度を上げる。","en":"The moment I landed, I sprinted for the truck. Its engine roared as it began to move. I pushed myself faster.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r93","rowIndex":93,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そしてジャンプすると、走り出したばかりのトラックの荷台の縁に手が届いた。そこを掴んで、引き寄せ、そのまま片腕の力でトラックの運転席側の窓へ跳躍した。無事運転席の窓縁に手が届き、そしてそこから車内に侵入しようと顔を出したところには<tips=50>路地</tips>が既に拳銃の銃口を用意している。","en":"I jumped and caught the edge of its bed just as it pulled away. Gripping it, I hauled myself toward the cab, then used the strength of one arm to vault toward the driver’s-side window. My hand found the window frame. But when I raised my head to force my way inside, <tips=50>Roji</tips> already had the muzzle of his handgun waiting for me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r94","rowIndex":94,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　顔を出した勢いのまま上方に飛ぶ。彼の銃弾はひゅんと音を立てて空を切る。","en":"Using the same upward momentum, I sprang higher. His bullet whistled through empty air.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r95","rowIndex":95,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そのまま運転席の屋根に足をつき、反対の助手席の窓からのぞき込む。<tips=50>路地</tips>は命中したと勘違いしているらしく、ミラーに視線をやっていた。その隙を逃すまいと、くるりと身体を反転させて助手席から侵入する。","en":"I planted my feet on the roof of the cab and peered in through the passenger-side window. <tips=50>Roji</tips> appeared to think he had hit me; his eyes were on the mirror. I refused to waste the opening, twisting around and diving through the passenger-side window.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r96","rowIndex":96,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　至近距離で銃を向けようとする路地の手首を掴んで捻ると、ボキリと手の中で乾いた音がした。そのまま押さえつけようとしたところで、<tips=50>路地</tips>は掴まれていない方の手で器用にドアを開ける。私たち二人はトラックから放り出される。","en":"He tried to aim at me from point-blank range. I caught his wrist and wrenched it, and a dry crack sounded within my grip. As I moved to pin him down, <tips=50>Roji</tips> deftly opened the door with his free hand. Both of us were thrown from the truck.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r97","rowIndex":97,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　このまま背中からアスファルトに落ちる<tips=50>路地</tips>を掴んだままでいたら、こちらも一緒に転がって怪我をすることになる。","en":"If I kept hold of <tips=50>Roji</tips> as he fell back-first toward the asphalt, I would tumble with him and be injured.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r98","rowIndex":98,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　空中でその腕を放し、身体をコントロールして着地する。靴底のゴムが耐えきれず、少し靴から剥がれたのを感じた。","en":"I released his arm in midair, controlled my body, and landed. I felt the rubber sole of my shoe give way and peel loose a little.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r99","rowIndex":99,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=50>路地</tips>は着地が出来ずに飛び跳ねるようにアスファルトを転がってゆき、運転手を失ったトラックはそのまま塀に激突してもの凄い騒音を立てた。","en":"Unable to land, <tips=50>Roji</tips> bounced and rolled across the asphalt. The driverless truck plowed straight into a wall with a tremendous crash.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r100","rowIndex":100,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　路上に転がった<tips=50>路地</tips>はぴくりとも動かない。死んでしまったのかと眺めていると、彼は生きていたようで、頭だけを少し動かし、私たちを見上げる。","en":"Sprawled in the street, <tips=50>Roji</tips> did not move a muscle. As we watched, wondering whether he was dead, he shifted his head slightly and looked up at us. Apparently, he was alive.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r101","rowIndex":101,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして慌てて立ち上がる。さっき折った右腕が力なく揺れている。銃は握られていない。","en":"Then he scrambled to his feet. The right arm I had broken hung limply at his side. He was no longer holding the gun.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r102","rowIndex":102,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「おれを殺すつもりなのか？」","en":"“Are you planning to kill me?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"路地邦昭","displayName":"Kuniaki Roji","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r103","rowIndex":103,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「先に銃を撃ったのはあなただよ」","en":"“You were the one who fired first.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r104","rowIndex":104,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　どうするべきだろうか？　もう一人が到着するのを待つか。それとも、これだけ大きな音を立ててしまった以上すぐに誰かがやって来る可能性もある。一人でさっさと始末をつけるか。まだ手の中にはさっき骨を折った感触が残っていた。","en":"What should I do? Wait for my sister to arrive? After all the noise we had made, someone else could come at any moment. Or should I settle it myself, right now? I could still feel the sensation of his bone breaking in my hand.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r105","rowIndex":105,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それを言うなら、先に私の友人たちを殺したのはお前たちだ。いつつ……」","en":"“If that’s your argument, you killed my friends first. Ow...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"路地邦昭","displayName":"Kuniaki Roji","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r106","rowIndex":106,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=50>路地</tips>はそう言って顔をしかめた。","en":"<tips=50>Roji</tips> said it with a grimace.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r107","rowIndex":107,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ここでおれを殺しても意味がないぞ」","en":"“There’s no point in killing me here.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"路地邦昭","displayName":"Kuniaki Roji","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r108","rowIndex":108,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=50>路地</tips>はこちらを睨み付けながらそう言った。","en":"<tips=50>Roji</tips> said, glaring at me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r109","rowIndex":109,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「警察は情報を掴んでいる。いくらでも素性を誤魔化せる<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>はともかく、お前たちはこの先どこへも逃げられない。元々警察の監視対象だったから、多くの情報を掴まれているしな。捕まるのは時間の問題だ。ここで私を殺そうと、殺すまいとな」","en":"“The police know who they’re dealing with now. <tips=20>Koschei</tips> can disguise his identity any number of ways, but you two have nowhere left to run. You were already under surveillance, so the police have plenty of information on you. It’s only a matter of time before they catch you, whether you kill me here or not.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"路地邦昭","displayName":"Kuniaki Roji","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r110","rowIndex":110,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そんなことは、どうでもいいよ」","en":"“I don’t care about any of that.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r111","rowIndex":111,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ここで始末してしまおうと、決めた。","en":"I decided to finish him here.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r112","rowIndex":112,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あなたが邪魔をするなら、あなたを殺す。それだけだよ」","en":"“If you stand in our way, I’ll kill you. That’s all.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r113","rowIndex":113,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　足元に丁度良いブロックの塊を見つけて、拾い上げる。","en":"I found a good-sized chunk of concrete at my feet and picked it up.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r114","rowIndex":114,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　これで殴れば、お互い不快感が極力少なく済むはずだ。","en":"Using this should keep the unpleasantness to a minimum for both of us.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r115","rowIndex":115,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「おれはお前たちには用がない。おれが憎んでいるのはあのイカレた人殺しだ。お前たちが共犯者であり続けるのなら、お前たちも敵だが、そうでないのなら興味はない。手を引け。お前たちはまだギリギリ引き返せるはずだ」","en":"“I’ve got no business with you. The one I hate is that deranged killer. If you remain his accomplices, then you’re my enemies too. Otherwise, I’m not interested in you. Walk away. You should still be able to turn back—just barely.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"路地邦昭","displayName":"Kuniaki Roji","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r116","rowIndex":116,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「引き返す？　私たちに引き返す場所なんかないんだよ。そんな場所とっくの昔になくなった」","en":"“Turn back? We have nowhere to go back to. Any place like that disappeared a long, long time ago.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r117","rowIndex":117,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あの人殺しがどんな甘言を弄したのか知らんが、お前たちは騙され、利用されているだけだよ。この街に住んでいて、それが理解出来ないほどうぶでもあるまい」","en":"“I don’t know what sweet lies that murderer fed you, but you’re only being deceived and used. You live in this city—you can’t be naive enough not to understand that.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"路地邦昭","displayName":"Kuniaki Roji","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r118","rowIndex":118,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=50>路地</tips>は少しでも時間を稼ぎ、おのれの命を長引かせるために、必死にそんな話をしているのだろう。その努力が虚しかった。","en":"<tips=50>Roji</tips> was probably saying all this in a desperate effort to buy even a little more time and prolong his life. The effort was wasted.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r119","rowIndex":119,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……うごかないで。苦しまないようにしてあげる」","en":"“...Don’t move. I’ll make sure you don’t suffer.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r120","rowIndex":120,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ブロックを振りかざし、彼に飛びかかる。","en":"I raised the concrete over my head and sprang at him.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r121","rowIndex":121,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そこで彼は予想外の行動を取った。ナイフを握った手を突きつけたのである。","en":"Then he did something I had not expected: he thrust out a hand gripping a knife.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r122","rowIndex":122,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　まったく予期していなかった動きであり、いかに<tips=17>タイプＢ</tips>の感覚からすればスローな動きだとしても、勢いをつけて飛びかかった状態では回避しにくかった。","en":"I had not anticipated the move at all. However slow it appeared to <tips=17>Type B</tips> senses, it was difficult to evade when I had already thrown myself forward with such momentum.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r123","rowIndex":123,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それでも地面を蹴って横へ飛ぶことでなんとか避けたが、ナイフの先端は脇腹を傷つけた。","en":"I still managed to kick off the ground and leap sideways, but the tip of the knife cut my flank.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r124","rowIndex":124,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　触れると、赤い血が指先に触れる。","en":"When I touched the wound, red blood smeared my fingertips.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r125","rowIndex":125,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　血を見たとき、少し目眩のようなものを感じた。","en":"At the sight of the blood, I felt a faint wave of dizziness.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r126","rowIndex":126,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　これは発作の前兆だ。先ほどから続く緊張状態が、症状を刺激した。","en":"It was the warning sign of an episode. The tension that had persisted all this time had aggravated the symptoms.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r127","rowIndex":127,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　いま発作が出たら、困ったことになる。","en":"If an episode began now, I would be in trouble.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r128","rowIndex":128,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そう考えたせいで、目の前に飛んできたナイフに気がつくのが遅れた。","en":"That thought made me slow to notice the knife flying at my face.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r129","rowIndex":129,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　すんでの所で手を払ってそれを叩き落とすと、続けざまに<tips=50>路地</tips>の大きな身体が、頭の角をふりかざしてまるでサイのように飛びかかってくる。","en":"I knocked it away with a sweep of my hand at the last possible moment. Immediately afterward, <tips=50>Roji’s</tips> huge body charged me like a rhinoceros, the horn on his head lowered.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r130","rowIndex":130,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それを回避することが出来ず、角をまともに腹に受けて、はじき飛ばされた。","en":"I could not evade him. The horn struck me squarely in the stomach and hurled me away.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r131","rowIndex":131,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ゲホッ、ゲホッ……」","en":"“Kh—kh...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r132","rowIndex":132,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　呼吸がとまり、咳が出る。そして同時に目眩が強くなる。目の前で<tips=50>路地</tips>が立ち上がり、ナイフを振りかざしているのがわかっていたが、身体の力がぬけて動けなかった。","en":"My breath stopped, and I began to cough. At the same time, the dizziness intensified. I could see <tips=50>Roji</tips> get to his feet before me and raise the knife, but all the strength had left my body. I could not move.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r133","rowIndex":133,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ここで死ぬんだな。そう心の中で呟いたとき、急に目の前で<tips=50>路地</tips>は転んだ。なぜ転んだのか彼自身にもわからなかったようで、慌てふためいて自分の足元を確認している。そうしている彼の顔に、次は大量の土砂があびせられた。","en":"So this is where I die, I thought. Then <tips=50>Roji</tips> suddenly fell in front of me. He himself seemed not to know why he had fallen and frantically checked his feet. As he did, a great mass of dirt and sand struck him in the face.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r134","rowIndex":134,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　目や口に土砂を浴びせられた彼は、呻きながらよろめく。","en":"With dirt and sand in his eyes and mouth, he staggered with a groan.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r135","rowIndex":135,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちのもう片方がその時やっと追いついた。","en":"My sister had finally caught up.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r136","rowIndex":136,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　見つけたときはまさにナイフを振り下ろそうとする<tips=50>路地</tips>の背中が見えており、夢中でその足を『ちから』で引っ張った。","en":"When she found us, <tips=50>Roji</tips> had his back to her and was just about to bring the knife down. Frantically, she used her ‘power’ to pull his feet out from under him.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r137","rowIndex":137,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　間に合わないかと思ったが、どうにか救出がうまくいったようだ。","en":"She had feared she would be too late, but the rescue appeared to have succeeded.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r138","rowIndex":138,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"『ちから』を使ったせいで探知機のサイレンが鳴り響き、<tips=50>路地</tips>は背後に立つもう一人の方を見上げた。","en":"The use of her ‘power’ set a detector’s siren wailing, and <tips=50>Roji</tips> looked up at the other sister standing behind him.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r139","rowIndex":139,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「おまえらは……」","en":"“You two...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"路地邦昭","displayName":"Kuniaki Roji","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r140","rowIndex":140,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　言いかける<tips=50>路地</tips>にナイフを飛ばし、『ちから』によってそののど元に正確に命中させた。","en":"Before <tips=50>Roji</tips> could finish, she sent the knife flying and used her ‘power’ to drive it unerringly into his throat.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r141","rowIndex":141,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼は引き抜くような動作を一瞬見せたが、そのままごぽごぽと口から音を立てながら崩れ落ちた。","en":"For an instant, he made as though to pull it out. Then a wet gurgle rose from his mouth, and he collapsed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r142","rowIndex":142,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　もう動かないのを確認してから、喉のナイフを『ちから』で引き抜き、手元に引き戻す。","en":"Once she had confirmed he was no longer moving, she used her ‘power’ to pull the knife from his throat and draw it back into her hand.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r143","rowIndex":143,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そいつは助からない。もう行こ」","en":"“He won’t survive. Let’s go.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r144","rowIndex":144,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「うん」","en":"“Okay.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r145","rowIndex":145,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　尻餅をついたままの片方はそこでやっと立ち上がって、もう一方の側に駆け寄る。","en":"The sister still sitting on the ground finally stood and ran to the other’s side.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r146","rowIndex":146,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ごめん」","en":"“Sorry.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r147","rowIndex":147,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「大丈夫？」","en":"“Are you all right?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r148","rowIndex":148,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「平気。かすっただけだから」","en":"“I’m fine. It only grazed me.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r149","rowIndex":149,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そう」","en":"“I see.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r150","rowIndex":150,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　辺りにはトラックが激突した時の破片やらが散らばり、けたたましくサイレンが鳴っている。","en":"Debris from the truck’s crash lay scattered all around, and a siren was wailing deafeningly.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r151","rowIndex":151,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　いつまでもここにいることは出来ない。","en":"We could not stay here forever.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r152","rowIndex":152,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=50>路地</tips>を見下ろすと目を見開いたまま喉をゴポゴポ言わせている。まだ生きているようだが、もう残り少ない命なのは間違いない。","en":"We looked down at <tips=50>Roji</tips>. His eyes remained wide open, and his throat was still gurgling. He appeared to be alive, but there was no doubt he did not have long left.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r153","rowIndex":153,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「離れよう。ここに長居はよくない」","en":"“Let’s get away from here. We shouldn’t stay long.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r154","rowIndex":154,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「うん……」","en":"“Okay...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r155","rowIndex":155,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どうしたの？」","en":"“What’s wrong?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r156","rowIndex":156,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「発作が起きそうなの……」","en":"“I think I’m going to have an episode...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r157","rowIndex":157,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　液状の発作止めは切れていた。錠剤はあったが水がなかった。","en":"We had run out of the liquid medication that stopped the episodes. We had tablets, but no water.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r158","rowIndex":158,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちはひとまず死にかけた<tips=50>路地</tips>の側を離れ、その辺りの民家を覗いて使えそうな水道を探す。","en":"For the moment, we left the dying <tips=50>Roji</tips> behind and peered into the nearby houses, looking for a working faucet.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r159","rowIndex":159,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　はじめの家では蛇口から茶色い水が出て、いつまで経っても澄まず、次の家ではそもそも水が出なかった。","en":"At the first house, brown water came from the tap and never ran clear; at the next, no water came out at all.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r160","rowIndex":160,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　三軒目。","en":"The third house.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r161","rowIndex":161,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　アパートの駐車場付近にあった水道からようやく飲めそうな水が出て、それでどうにか薬を飲み込む。","en":"At last, a tap near an apartment building’s parking lot produced water that looked safe to drink, and she managed to swallow the medicine with it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r162","rowIndex":162,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「大丈夫？」","en":"“Are you all right?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r163","rowIndex":163,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「うん。はやく離れなきゃ……」","en":"“Yes. We have to get away quickly...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r164","rowIndex":164,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「少し休もう。あわてなくてもいいよ」","en":"“Let’s rest for a bit. We don’t have to rush.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r165","rowIndex":165,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ふらつく片方を塀のかげに座らせて、もう片方が路上の様子を見る。私たちはいま<tips=50>路地</tips>の倒れている場所から角を一つ曲がった先のアパートの側にいる。あまり人通りのない通りだが、向こうから一人の女性が歩いてくるのが見えた。","en":"One of us sat her unsteady sister down in the shelter of a wall and watched the street. We were beside an apartment building, one corner beyond the place where <tips=50>Roji</tips> had fallen. There was little foot traffic, but we saw a woman approaching from up the street.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r166","rowIndex":166,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あれ……<tips=55>汐松子</tips>じゃないかな……」","en":"“Is that... <tips=55>Matsuko Shio</tips>...?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r167","rowIndex":167,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……どうしたの？」","en":"“...What is it?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r168","rowIndex":168,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=55>汐松子</tips>が通りかかったみたいなの」","en":"“I think <tips=55>Matsuko Shio</tips> just came by.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r169","rowIndex":169,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=55>汐松子</tips>は私たちの子供時代の遊び仲間の一人だ。<tips=70>シオクリーン</tips>社長の娘であり、あの<tips=1>菅原亮</tips>の昔からの恋人だ。","en":"<tips=55>Matsuko Shio</tips> had been one of our childhood playmates. She was the daughter of <tips=70>Shio Clean’s</tips> president, and <tips=1>Ryo Sugawara’s</tips> longtime girlfriend.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r170","rowIndex":170,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　貧民ばかりのグループのなかで資産家の娘という立場は浮き上がっていたし、さらにリーダー格の<tips=1>菅原亮</tips>と親しいということで、仲間たちは気を遣ってほとんど交流を持っていなかった。本人も積極的に他人と話すような社交的な性格ではない。私たちはいくらか気安く話す関係だった。","en":"As the daughter of a wealthy family, she stood out in a group made up almost entirely of the poor. And because she was close to <tips=1>Ryo Sugawara</tips>, one of the group’s leaders, the others were guarded around her and barely spoke to her. She was not the sort to seek people out herself, either. We, however, could speak with her fairly easily.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r171","rowIndex":171,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その<tips=55>汐松子</tips>が角のとこに立って、向こうを見ていた。そして驚いた顔をすると、駆け足になって角を曲がっていった。","en":"<tips=55>Matsuko</tips> stopped at the corner and looked toward the other street. Her expression changed to surprise; then she broke into a run and disappeared around the corner.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r172","rowIndex":172,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=50>路地邦昭</tips>を見つけたみたい」","en":"“I think she found <tips=50>Kuniaki Roji</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r173","rowIndex":173,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……<tips=55>汐松子</tips>が？」","en":"“...<tips=55>Matsuko</tips> did?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r174","rowIndex":174,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「うん。……あの子、まだ<tips=1>菅原亮</tips>と連絡とかとってるのかしら？」","en":"“Yes. ...Do you think she still keeps in touch with <tips=1>Ryo Sugawara</tips>?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r175","rowIndex":175,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……わからない。どうだろう。でも、<tips=70>シオクリーン</tips>は<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>と距離を置いてるはずだよね」","en":"“...I don’t know. Maybe. But <tips=70>Shio Clean</tips> is supposed to keep its distance from <tips=7>YS</tips>, isn’t it?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r176","rowIndex":176,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「もしこれで<tips=1>菅原亮</tips>と繋がるようなことがあったら、ちょっとやだね」","en":"“I don’t like the thought of this somehow reaching <tips=1>Ryo Sugawara</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r177","rowIndex":177,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「確かに……別に、知られたからって何があるわけじゃないけど、あいつが関わったらいや」","en":"“True... It’s not as if anything would happen just because he found out, but I don’t want him involved.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r178","rowIndex":178,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちは顔を合わせて顰め合う。","en":"We looked at each other and grimaced.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r179","rowIndex":179,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そこでようやく薬が効いてきて、私たちは人目を避けながらその場を去った。","en":"At last the medicine began to work, and we left while keeping out of sight.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r180","rowIndex":180,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちは<tips=64>アレクセイ</tips>を探した。","en":"We looked for <tips=64>Alexei</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r181","rowIndex":181,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=50>路地</tips>を始末したことと、もしまだ知らなければ建物が捜索されたこと、この二点を伝える必要がある。","en":"There were two things we needed to tell him: that we had disposed of <tips=50>Roji</tips>, and—if he did not already know—that the building had been searched.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r182","rowIndex":182,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　まず彼のアジトとなる建物に向かう。警察の姿はどこにもなかったが、用心しながら建物内に足を踏み入れた。","en":"First, we went to the building he used as a hideout. There were no police anywhere in sight, but we entered cautiously.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r183","rowIndex":183,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　建物のなかは元々ものが少なかったが、数少ない<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>の所有物は証拠品として根こそぎ持って行かれたようだった。キッチンの棚や冷蔵庫のなかで腐臭を放っていた死体の包みは消えて、すべてのドアが開けっ放しになっている。歯ブラシやコップの類も消えていた。","en":"There had never been much inside the building, and it seemed that the few possessions <tips=20>Koschei</tips> did own had been carried off wholesale as evidence. The wrapped bodies that had been rotting in the kitchen cupboards and refrigerator were gone, and every door had been left open. The toothbrushes, glasses, and other such things had vanished as well.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r184","rowIndex":184,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちはその様子を携帯電話で撮影し、簡単な状況説明の文章と共に<tips=64>アレクセイ</tips>に送った。今彼の身体を誰が操っているか知らないが、これを閲覧してくれれば事態を把握するだろう。","en":"We photographed the scene on our phone and sent the images to <tips=64>Alexei</tips> with a brief account of the situation. We did not know who was currently controlling his body, but if he saw the message, he would understand what had happened.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r185","rowIndex":185,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ただ彼が閲覧出来るかどうかという点については確証がなかった。彼宛に送ったメールは、アレクセイしか閲覧が出来ない。他の誰かに変身していたら、<tips=64>アレクセイ</tips>のメールを見ることが出来ない。もし他の誰かの姿でずっと活動していたら、私たちのメールを目にすることはない。","en":"We had no way of knowing whether he could read it. Only Alexei could access mail sent to Alexei. If the body had changed into someone else, that person would not be able to read <tips=64>Alexei’s</tips> mail. If someone else remained in control indefinitely, our message would never be seen.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r186","rowIndex":186,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして、私たちも街ですれ違ったら相手を見つけることが出来ない。","en":"And if we passed each other in the city, we would have no way to recognize him.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r187","rowIndex":187,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　見分ける方法はこの館に帰って来た場合だけだが、その時だって、単なる不審者なのか<tips=64>アレクセイ</tips>の別の姿なのかまでは、何らかの方法で確認するまで判別が出来ない。","en":"The only chance we had of distinguishing him was if he returned to this house. Even then, until we could verify it somehow, we would have no way to tell whether an intruder was merely an intruder or <tips=64>Alexei</tips> in another form.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r188","rowIndex":188,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして、ここで待つにしても、既にもうここは警察に抑えられた場所なのだ。あまり長く滞在すべき場所ではない。","en":"Yet even if we waited here, this place was already under police control. We should not stay long.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r189","rowIndex":189,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ねえ、そういえばこの携帯電話どうする？」","en":"“Hey, what should we do about this phone?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r190","rowIndex":190,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ああ、さっき変な動作をしたよね。でもあれ、普通の着信じゃないでしょ？　普段鳴らない音だし……」","en":"“Oh, right. It behaved strangely earlier. But that wasn’t a normal call, was it? It made a sound it doesn’t usually make...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r191","rowIndex":191,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「だとしたら、<tips=50>路地邦昭</tips>の能力を使ったのかな？　じゃあ、もうこのまま使っててもいいのかな」","en":"“Then do you think <tips=50>Kuniaki Roji</tips> used his ability on it? If so, is it safe to keep using it now?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r192","rowIndex":192,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうだね。あいつはもう死んだし……」","en":"“Probably. He’s dead now...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r193","rowIndex":193,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そこで私たちは沈黙して、思わぬ時間が空いてしまう。","en":"We fell silent, and the pause stretched longer than either of us expected.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r194","rowIndex":194,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まあ、気持ち悪いから明日他のに買い換えよっか」","en":"“Well, it gives me the creeps. Let’s buy a new one tomorrow.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r195","rowIndex":195,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　沈黙を打ち消すようにそう言った。","en":"She said it as though to erase the silence.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r196","rowIndex":196,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうだね……」","en":"“Okay...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r197","rowIndex":197,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　けれどすぐにまた沈黙があたりを支配する。","en":"But silence immediately settled over us again.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r198","rowIndex":198,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　一通り屋敷の中を確認して、外に出た。","en":"After checking the house from end to end, we went outside.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r199","rowIndex":199,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　今夜はどこで休もうかと考えていると、携帯電話が<tips=14>深沢</tips>からの通話を着信する。","en":"As we wondered where to spend the night, our phone rang with a call from <tips=14>Fukazawa</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r200","rowIndex":200,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"『おい、お前たちの部屋を調べに来たやつがいるらしいぞ』","en":"“Hey. Sounds like somebody came to search your room.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r201","rowIndex":201,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=14>深沢</tips>が言うには、今日の昼頃に普段見かけない二人連れが団地に訪れ、私たちの部屋に入り込んだところを団地の人間が見ていたのだそうだ。","en":"According to <tips=14>Fukazawa</tips>, a pair no one recognized had come to the housing complex around noon, and one of the residents had seen them enter our room.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r202","rowIndex":202,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"『一人は、あの角の生えた男……<tips=50>路地</tips>だっけな？　あいつらしい。もう一人は若い女だそうだ』","en":"“One of them was that horned man... <tips=50>Roji</tips>, was it? Sounds like it was him. The other was a young woman.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r203","rowIndex":203,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　話からすると、<tips=64>アレクセイ</tips>のアジトを捜索するまえに、私たちの団地を捜索したと考えるのが妥当だろう。","en":"Judging by his account, it seemed reasonable to assume they had searched our room at the housing complex before searching <tips=64>Alexei’s</tips> hideout.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r204","rowIndex":204,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして、若い女というのはアジトの前でみかけたあの女だろうと思った。だとすれば警察に違いない。","en":"The young woman was probably the one we had seen in front of the hideout. If so, she must have been with the police.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r205","rowIndex":205,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「部屋の様子を見た？」","en":"“Did you look at the room?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r206","rowIndex":206,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"『まだ見てない。いま報告を受けたところでな。取り急ぎ連絡をしたんだ』","en":"“Not yet. I only just heard about it myself, so I called you straightaway.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r207","rowIndex":207,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「わかった。すぐ帰るから待ってて」","en":"“All right. We’ll be right back. Wait for us.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r208","rowIndex":208,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして私たちは、団地の自室へと戻った。","en":"Then we returned to our room at the housing complex.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r209","rowIndex":209,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=64>アレクセイ</tips>のアジトのように何もかもごっそり持ち去られているというわけではないが、確かに部屋には人が入った形跡があった。あちこちひっくり返されて、乱雑に散らかっている。","en":"It had not been stripped bare the way <tips=64>Alexei’s</tips> hideout had, but someone had clearly entered. Things had been overturned everywhere, leaving the room in disarray.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r210","rowIndex":210,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　なくなっているものを調べると、普段学校に持って行っているノートPCが入れ物ごと持ち去られていたようだ。他には何もなくなっているようには見えないが、細かく重要でないものをもっていかれたとしたらわからないだろう。","en":"When we checked what was missing, it appeared they had taken the laptop we usually carried to school, case and all. Nothing else seemed to be gone, though we would have no way to tell if they had taken small, unimportant things.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r211","rowIndex":211,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「これはひどい有様だな」","en":"“They made one hell of a mess.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"深沢聡","displayName":"Satoshi Fukazawa","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r212","rowIndex":212,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　すぐに<tips=14>深沢</tips>が訪ねて来てそう言った。","en":"<tips=14>Fukazawa</tips> came over almost immediately and said so.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r213","rowIndex":213,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あ、<tips=14>深沢聡</tips>」","en":"“Oh. <tips=14>Satoshi Fukazawa</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r214","rowIndex":214,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「心当たりはあるか？」","en":"“Any idea who did it?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r215","rowIndex":215,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「たぶん警察だね」","en":"“Probably the police.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r216","rowIndex":216,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「警察がこの団地に足を踏み入れるなんてよっぽどのことだぞ。しかも<tips=50>路地</tips>がいるってことは、あの犬の<tips=48>堂島</tips>も一枚噛んでるってことか？　とすれば、<tips=16>タイプA</tips>犯罪だな。……お前たち、一体何をやらかしたんだ」","en":"“It takes something serious for the police to set foot in this complex. And if <tips=50>Roji</tips> was with them, does that mean <tips=48>Dojima</tips>, that dog, had a hand in it too? That would make it a <tips=16>Type A</tips> crime. ...What the hell did you two do?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"深沢聡","displayName":"Satoshi Fukazawa","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r217","rowIndex":217,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちよりも、<tips=14>深沢</tips>の方が動揺しているようだった。","en":"<tips=14>Fukazawa</tips> appeared more shaken than we were.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r218","rowIndex":218,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「大丈夫。心配しないで」","en":"“It’s all right. Don’t worry.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r219","rowIndex":219,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「誰にも迷惑はかけないから」","en":"“We won’t cause trouble for anyone.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r220","rowIndex":220,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうは言うがな……。とにかく、別の部屋を用意しよう。C棟の六階がちょうどいいな。あそこなら、見張りもしやすい。なに、不安に思うことはない。お前たちが何をしたのだとしても、この団地のなかにいれば……」","en":"“You may say that, but... In any case, I’ll arrange another room for you. The sixth floor of Building C should be just right. It’ll be easier to watch over you there. There’s nothing to worry about. No matter what you’ve done, as long as you’re inside this complex...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"深沢聡","displayName":"Satoshi Fukazawa","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r221","rowIndex":221,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「大丈夫だってば！」","en":"“We told you, we’re fine!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r222","rowIndex":222,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「余計なことはしなくていいの。私たち、自分のしたことは自分で責任をとる」","en":"“You don’t need to interfere. We’ll take responsibility for what we did ourselves.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r223","rowIndex":223,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「この部屋のものはもう全部処分していいよ。ここには戻らないから」","en":"“You can throw away everything in this room. We’re not coming back.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r224","rowIndex":224,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして私たちは、引き留めようとする<tips=14>深沢</tips>の目の前で貴重品をバッグに詰め込んで部屋を出た。","en":"Ignoring <tips=14>Fukazawa’s</tips> attempts to stop us, we packed our valuables into a bag before his eyes and left the room.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r225","rowIndex":225,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　建物を出る。もうすっかり夜の闇が辺りを包んでおり、空には月が浮かんでいた。","en":"We left the building. The darkness of night had already swallowed everything around us, and the moon hung in the sky.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r226","rowIndex":226,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして団地の敷地を離れようとしたところで声をかけられる。","en":"As we were about to leave the housing complex grounds, a voice called to us.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r227","rowIndex":227,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……お嬢さんがた、こんな時間にどこへ行くんだ？」","en":"“...Young ladies, where are you going at this hour?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r228","rowIndex":228,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　暗闇の中にだれかが潜んでいる。影に溶け込んでしまって、その姿は見えない。","en":"Someone lurked in the darkness, swallowed so completely by the shadows that we could not make out his figure.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r229","rowIndex":229,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ケンさんね。あなたこそ、こんな時間にそこに寝転がってちゃだめでしょ」","en":"“Ken, is that you? You’re the one who shouldn’t be lying out here at this hour.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r230","rowIndex":230,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「はやく部屋に戻りなよ。夜風に当たってるとまた具合が悪くなるよ。雨が降るかも知れないし」","en":"“Go back to your room. That night air will make you sick again. It might rain, too.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r231","rowIndex":231,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いいんだよ。おれは……こうしている方が気持ちいいんだ。ゴホッ、ゴホッ！」","en":"“It’s all right. I... feel better this way. Cough, cough!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r232","rowIndex":232,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ほら、言わんこっちゃない」","en":"“See? We told you so.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r233","rowIndex":233,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「もう帰りな」","en":"“Go on home.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r234","rowIndex":234,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まあ、まあ、おれのことは良いんだって。それより、お嬢さんがた、そんな大きなバッグを持って、まるで夜逃げじゃないか……。何かあったんじゃないのか？」","en":"“Now, now, never mind me. But look at you two, carrying that enormous bag. You look as though you’re skipping town in the dead of night... Has something happened?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r235","rowIndex":235,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「大丈夫よ」","en":"“We’re fine.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r236","rowIndex":236,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「何もない」","en":"“Nothing happened.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r237","rowIndex":237,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「何かあったんなら、相談してくれよ。……今日警察のガサ入れがあったんだってな。みんな噂してたぜ」","en":"“If something happened, come talk to me. ...I heard the police raided your place today. Everyone was talking about it.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r238","rowIndex":238,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「大したことないよ」","en":"“It’s nothing serious.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r239","rowIndex":239,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうか……それなら良いんだが。だがなあお嬢さんがた……」","en":"“I see... Well, that’s good. But, young ladies...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r240","rowIndex":240,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ケンという呼び名しか知らないその男はそこでゴホゴホと乾いた咳をして、","en":"The man, whose name we knew only as Ken, stopped there to give a dry, hacking cough.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r241","rowIndex":241,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「何かあったら、この団地の連中を頼るんだぞ。あんたがたが何をしたって、みんな、あんたがたの味方だからな……」","en":"“If anything happens, turn to the people in this complex. Whatever you two have done, everyone here is on your side...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r242","rowIndex":242,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ありがとう」","en":"“Thank you.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r243","rowIndex":243,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「でも、ケンさんみたいな病人に言われたって、頼りないね」","en":"“But it’s not very reassuring coming from a sick man like you, Ken.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r244","rowIndex":244,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　言うと、暗闇のなかで何かがかすれたような音がした。彼は笑ったらしい。","en":"At that, a faint rasp came from the darkness. He seemed to be laughing.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r245","rowIndex":245,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちはそこで話を切り上げて、<tips=9>Y地区</tips>の喧噪へと向かった。","en":"We ended the conversation there and headed toward the clamor of <tips=9>Y District</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r246","rowIndex":246,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その後私たちは、<tips=59>暗闇通り</tips>に住む友人の家に泊めて貰った。幼い頃からの遊び仲間の一人で、何も連絡しなくとも嫌な顔ひとつせず受け入れてくれた。","en":"After that, we spent the night at a friend’s house on <tips=59>Darkness Street</tips>. She was one of our childhood playmates, and although we arrived without warning, she took us in without the slightest show of displeasure.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r247","rowIndex":247,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女も子供時代からの友だちの一人で、今は<tips=59>暗闇通り</tips>の飲食店でウエイトレスをしている。ナンシー・リューという名前の、唇が分厚くて肌が浅黒い少女だ。","en":"She too was an old childhood friend. Now she worked as a waitress at a restaurant on <tips=59>Darkness Street</tips>. Her name was Nancy Liu, a dark-skinned girl with thick lips.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r248","rowIndex":248,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　お金が貯まるとすぐに美容整形手術の費用にしてしまうので、会うたびに顔のどこかが変わっている。","en":"Whenever she managed to save any money, she immediately spent it on cosmetic surgery, so some part of her face was different every time we saw her.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r249","rowIndex":249,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「何が良くなってるのかわからない」","en":"“We can’t tell what’s supposed to look better.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r250","rowIndex":250,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちはある時彼女にそう言ったことがある。","en":"We had once said that to her.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r251","rowIndex":251,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「別に良くなってないわ。結局私は自分のことが嫌いでしかたないから、どんな顔になっても自信がもてないの。この旅は私が自分を好きになるまで続くんだよ」","en":"“It isn’t any better. The truth is, I can’t stand myself, so no matter what face I have, I’ll never feel confident. This journey goes on until I learn to like myself.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ナンシー・リュー","displayName":"Nancy Liu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r252","rowIndex":252,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ナンシーはそう言って笑った。","en":"Nancy had said it with a laugh.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r253","rowIndex":253,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちはナンシーのことが好きだった。","en":"We liked Nancy.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r254","rowIndex":254,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女は平日に泊まりに来た私たちを不審に思ったはずだが、それについてはひとことも口にしなかった。","en":"She must have found it strange that we came to stay on a weekday, but she never said a word about it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r255","rowIndex":255,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　朝に私たちの片方が<tips=17>タイプB</tips>の発作におそわれ、それを見た彼女が聞いたことのない話をしてくれた。","en":"One of us suffered a <tips=17>Type B</tips> episode in the morning. When Nancy saw it, she told us something we had never heard before.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r256","rowIndex":256,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「知ってる？　最近、<tips=17>タイプB</tips>用の新しくていい薬が出たんだって。それを、<ruby=バーロン><tips=21>八龍会</tips></ruby>の人たちが安く配ってるんだそうよ」","en":"“Have you heard? They say there’s a good new medicine for <tips=17>Type Bs</tips>. People from the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips> are distributing it cheaply.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ナンシー・リュー","displayName":"Nancy Liu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r257","rowIndex":257,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なにそれ、うさんくさい」","en":"“What? That sounds sketchy.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r258","rowIndex":258,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「でも、すごく評判がいいんだよ。４丁目の方にさー、ずっと症状が良くなくて、柱に繋がれてたおばあちゃんいたでしょ？　いつも訳の分からないことを怒鳴ってる人」","en":"“But people swear by it. You remember the old woman over in the Fourth Block whose symptoms were so bad they kept her tied to a pillar? The one who was always shouting things that made no sense?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ナンシー・リュー","displayName":"Nancy Liu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r259","rowIndex":259,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「李さん？」","en":"“Mrs. Li?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r260","rowIndex":260,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうそう。あの人も、薬貰ったとたんにしゃっきりしちゃって、いまは家事なんかやってるらしいわ」","en":"“That’s right. The moment she got the medicine, she became completely lucid. Apparently she’s doing housework now and everything.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ナンシー・リュー","displayName":"Nancy Liu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r261","rowIndex":261,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……信じがたいわね。あそこまで進行しちゃうと、もう手が付けられないはずよ」","en":"“...That’s hard to believe. Once it gets that far, it’s supposed to be beyond help.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r262","rowIndex":262,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「でも、治ったのよ。……まあ、話くらいは聞いてみたら？」","en":"“But she got better. ...Why not at least ask about it?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ナンシー・リュー","displayName":"Nancy Liu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r263","rowIndex":263,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「考えておく」","en":"“We’ll think about it.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r264","rowIndex":264,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちは<tips=21>八龍会</tips>のことはあまり好きではなかった。","en":"We did not much like the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r265","rowIndex":265,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それは三人の老人がリーダーとなって仕切っている、<tips=17>タイプB</tips>たちの互助組織のようなものだ。","en":"It was a sort of mutual-aid organization for <tips=17>Type Bs</tips>, run by three old men who served as its leaders.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r266","rowIndex":266,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=17>タイプB</tips>用の薬を安く譲り合ったり、集まってお互いの症状の苦しみを語り合ったり、子供などを集めて季節のイベントをしている。","en":"They shared <tips=17>Type B</tips> medication at low prices, gathered to discuss the suffering their symptoms caused, and brought children together for seasonal events.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r267","rowIndex":267,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「信じられないなら、<tips=10>道夫</tips>に詳しく話を聞いたら？　あいつはよく知ってるはずよ」","en":"“If you don’t believe it, why not ask <tips=10>Michio</tips> for the details? He ought to know all about it.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ナンシー・リュー","displayName":"Nancy Liu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r268","rowIndex":268,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　とナンシーは言う。","en":"Nancy said.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r269","rowIndex":269,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「やだよ」","en":"“No way.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r270","rowIndex":270,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なんで」","en":"“Why not?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ナンシー・リュー","displayName":"Nancy Liu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r271","rowIndex":271,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=10>見土道夫</tips>にはそういうことを頼みたくない」","en":"“We don’t want to ask <tips=10>Michio Mido</tips> for that kind of favor.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r272","rowIndex":272,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そう」","en":"“I see.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ナンシー・リュー","displayName":"Nancy Liu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r273","rowIndex":273,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ナンシーはそれで納得してくれたようだった。","en":"Nancy seemed to accept that answer.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r274","rowIndex":274,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まあ、興味があったら六角公園に行きなよ。いつもあそこで売ってるわ」","en":"“Well, if you’re interested, go to Hexagonal Park. They’re always selling it there.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ナンシー・リュー","displayName":"Nancy Liu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r275","rowIndex":275,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　午前中は三人でナンシーのテレビゲームを遊んで、昼にナンシーが仕事のために出て行くと私たちはすることがなくなった。","en":"The three of us played Nancy’s video games all morning. When she left for work at noon, we had nothing to do.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r276","rowIndex":276,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=64>アレクセイ</tips>からの連絡はまだ来ない。ネットニュースを見た限りでは、昨日の<tips=50>路地</tips>の事件もまだ公表されていないようだった。","en":"There was still no word from <tips=64>Alexei</tips>. From what we could see in online news reports, the incident involving <tips=50>Roji</tips> the day before had not yet been made public.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r277","rowIndex":277,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　することがなく、私たちはふらりと街へ出て、そしてそのつもりはなかったが六角公園へ足をむけた。","en":"With nothing else to do, we drifted out into the city and, without quite meaning to, found ourselves heading for Hexagonal Park.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r278","rowIndex":278,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そこは、公園という名ではあるがろくに遊具もない、雑草の生い茂った空き地だった。普段は昼は子供たちがボール遊びに興じ、夜はタチの悪い大人が出入りする。けれど、今日は昼からタチの悪い大人たちが何人かあつまっていた。","en":"It was called a park, but in reality it was a weed-choked vacant lot with hardly any playground equipment. Children ordinarily played ball there by day, while disreputable adults came and went by night. Today, however, several such adults had gathered there in broad daylight.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r279","rowIndex":279,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「よう、<tips=86>灰上姉妹</tips>じゃないか」","en":"“Well, if it isn’t the <tips=86>Haigami sisters</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"田中紺太","displayName":"Konta Tanaka","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r280","rowIndex":280,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちを見るなり声をあげたのは、周りの大人たちに何か説明をしていた黒いスーツ姿の若者だった。","en":"The speaker was a young man in a black suit who had been explaining something to the adults gathered around him.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r281","rowIndex":281,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なんだ、<tips=66>田中紺太</tips>じゃない」","en":"“Oh, it’s you, <tips=66>Konta Tanaka</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r282","rowIndex":282,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なんであんたがここにいるの？　<tips=10>見土道夫</tips>と一緒に饅頭売りをやってるんじゃなかったの？」","en":"“What are you doing here? Weren’t you selling buns with <tips=10>Michio Mido</tips>?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r283","rowIndex":283,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=66>コンタ</tips>とみなに呼ばれているその若者も子供時代の遊び仲間の一人だった。","en":"The young man everyone called <tips=66>Konta</tips> had also been one of our childhood playmates.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r284","rowIndex":284,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　昔から<tips=10>見土道夫</tips>の金魚のフンの様に行動をしている。","en":"He had been <tips=10>Michio’s</tips> tagalong since childhood.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r285","rowIndex":285,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼はベンチの上に薬や注射器を並べ、集まる大人になにか話していたようだった。","en":"He had arranged medicine and syringes on a bench and appeared to have been explaining something to the assembled adults.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r286","rowIndex":286,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「饅頭売りは、いいんだよもうあれは。全然売れないんだもの」","en":"“I’m done with the bun business. They weren’t selling at all.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"田中紺太","displayName":"Konta Tanaka","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r287","rowIndex":287,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まったく、何をやっても長続きしないのね」","en":"“Honestly, you never stick with anything.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r288","rowIndex":288,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「客引きやったり、ヒモやったり、それで今は<ruby=バーロン><tips=21>八龍会</tips></ruby>に拾って貰って薬を売ってるの？」","en":"“You worked as a tout, then lived off women, and now the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips> has taken you in to sell medicine for them?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r289","rowIndex":289,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「人聞きの悪いことを言う。相変わらず顔は綺麗だが口は悪いな。でも、あんたらこそどうなんだよ？　そんな制服姿で昼間っからうろうろして、学校はどうした？　……あっ、斉藤さん、おつりはこれですよ」","en":"“Don’t make me sound so bad. You’re as pretty as ever, but that mouth hasn’t changed. What about you two, though? Wandering around in your uniforms in the middle of the day—shouldn’t you be in school? ...Oh, Ms. Saito, here’s your change.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"田中紺太","displayName":"Konta Tanaka","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r290","rowIndex":290,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=66>コンタ</tips>はやせ細った老婦人の手に紙幣を渡す。老婦人は拝むような仕草を見せて、足早に去っていった。","en":"<tips=66>Konta</tips> handed bills to a gaunt old woman. She made a gesture as though praying to him, then hurried away.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r291","rowIndex":291,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「おれが根気がなくて饅頭売りをやめたような言い方するけどさ、そうじゃないんだよ。饅頭はちょっと今リニューアル中でね、<tips=10>道夫</tips>君が、その間こっちの方を手伝ってくれっていうから……。おっと、マイケル。そいつを欲しいなら、これだ」","en":"“You make it sound like I got bored and quit selling buns, but that isn’t it. We’re revamping them right now, and <tips=10>Michio</tips> asked me to help out here in the meantime... Ah, Michael. If you want that one, it’ll cost you this.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"田中紺太","displayName":"Konta Tanaka","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r292","rowIndex":292,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=66>コンタ</tips>は無精ひげだらけの白人男性に、三本の指を立てて見せた。","en":"<tips=66>Konta</tips> held up three fingers to an unshaven white man.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r293","rowIndex":293,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　白人男性が渋い顔をすると、","en":"The man pulled a sour face.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r294","rowIndex":294,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=21>ドラゴン・クラブ</tips>に入らなければ割引はしないって言ったろ」","en":"“I told you, there’s no discount unless you join the <tips=21>Dragon Club</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"田中紺太","displayName":"Konta Tanaka","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r295","rowIndex":295,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「オー、でも、ワタシの組織は<tips=21>ドラゴン・クラブ</tips>に加入キンシしてるのネ」","en":"“Oh, but my organization forbids joining <tips=21>Dragon Club</tips>, yes.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r296","rowIndex":296,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「じゃあ、組織を抜けるか、組織に黙ってこっそり加入するんだ。それがどうしても嫌なら、定価で買って貰う」","en":"“Then leave your organization, or join ours in secret and don’t tell them. If you absolutely refuse to do either, you’ll have to pay full price.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"田中紺太","displayName":"Konta Tanaka","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r297","rowIndex":297,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=66>コンタ</tips>の言葉に、白人男性はしかめっ面を浮かべながら、財布から紙幣を取り出す。","en":"Scowling at <tips=66>Konta’s</tips> answer, the white man took some bills from his wallet.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r298","rowIndex":298,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ねえ<tips=66>田中紺太</tips>、それが噂の新しい薬？」","en":"“Hey, <tips=66>Konta Tanaka</tips>. Is that the new medicine we’ve been hearing about?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r299","rowIndex":299,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうだとも。あっ、そうか、お前らこれが欲しくて来たんだな。そろそろ<tips=12>江梨子</tips>も発作がきつくなってきたか？」","en":"“Sure is. Oh, I see—you two came here because you wanted some. Are <tips=12>Eriko’s</tips> episodes starting to get bad?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"田中紺太","displayName":"Konta Tanaka","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r300","rowIndex":300,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=66>コンタ</tips>はそう言って笑う。","en":"<tips=66>Konta</tips> said it with a laugh.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r301","rowIndex":301,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「別にそれほどじゃないけど……」","en":"“They aren’t that bad...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r302","rowIndex":302,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　薬を並べている人たちがスペースを空けてくれたので、私たちはそこに入って<tips=66>コンタ</tips>の並べている『商品』を見る。","en":"The people laying out the medicine made room for us. We stepped in and examined <tips=66>Konta’s</tips> ‘merchandise.’","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r303","rowIndex":303,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「こっちの注射キットは一発打てば一ヶ月近く発作が起きずにしゃきっとする。こっちの粉末は頓服用だ。具合が悪い時にパッと飲めばパッと効く」","en":"“One shot from this injection kit keeps you clearheaded and free from episodes for nearly a month. This powder is for when you need it. If you start feeling bad, toss it back and it works in a flash.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"田中紺太","displayName":"Konta Tanaka","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r304","rowIndex":304,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「本当に効くの？」","en":"“Does it really work?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r305","rowIndex":305,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「効くとも。今まで他のどんな薬も効かないで、夢の世界にさまよっていたやつらがみんな帰って来た。おれも信じていなかったが、実際もの凄い効果だね」","en":"“Of course it does. People who wandered through dreamland because no other medicine helped have all come back. I didn’t believe it myself, but the effect is incredible.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"田中紺太","displayName":"Konta Tanaka","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r306","rowIndex":306,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……それ、ちょっと前に似たような売り文句でヒドイ薬が売られてたでしょ」","en":"“...Wasn’t there an awful drug sold not long ago with almost the same pitch?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r307","rowIndex":307,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「『<tips=45>ローズ</tips>』も、最初はそんな触れ込みだったよね」","en":"“They said the same sort of thing about ‘<tips=45>Rose</tips>’ at first.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r308","rowIndex":308,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「さすがだね。これは、その『<tips=45>ローズ</tips>』を改良した『<tips=46>ネオ・ローズ</tips>』だ」","en":"“Sharp as ever. This is ‘<tips=46>Neo Rose</tips>’—an improved version of that ‘<tips=45>Rose</tips>.’”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"田中紺太","displayName":"Konta Tanaka","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r309","rowIndex":309,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そんなのがあるの？」","en":"“There’s such a thing?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r310","rowIndex":310,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なんだ。アンテナの感度が悪いやつらだな。全ての<tips=17>タイプB</tips>の救世主として、世界中で話題になった新薬だぜ？　……といっても、おれも今回知ったんだけどな」","en":"“What, do your antennae not pick up anything? It’s the new drug that caused a worldwide sensation as the savior of every <tips=17>Type B</tips>. ...Though I only just found out about it myself.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"田中紺太","displayName":"Konta Tanaka","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r311","rowIndex":311,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=66>コンタ</tips>は苦笑してから、","en":"<tips=66>Konta</tips> gave a wry smile, then continued.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r312","rowIndex":312,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「とにかく、そんじょそこらじゃ手に入らない特別な薬だ。<tips=45>ローズ</tips>みたいな副作用はほとんどなくて、効果は勝るとも劣らない。<tips=45>ローズ</tips>は最悪の薬だったが、<tips=17>タイプB</tips>症状に対する効き目だけはすごかっただろ？」","en":"“In any case, it’s a special drug you can’t get just anywhere. It has hardly any of <tips=45>Rose’s</tips> side effects, and its effects are at least as strong. <tips=45>Rose</tips> was a terrible drug, but you have to admit it worked wonders on <tips=17>Type B</tips> symptoms, right?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"田中紺太","displayName":"Konta Tanaka","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r313","rowIndex":313,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まあ、あれの副作用が本当になくなったのならすごいけど……」","en":"“Well, if they really eliminated the side effects, that would be incredible...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r314","rowIndex":314,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「でも信じられないわ。そんな特別な薬を、どうしてここで取り扱えるの？」","en":"“But we don’t believe it. How did something so special end up for sale here?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r315","rowIndex":315,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「おれも詳しくは知らないがね、クラブの爺さんたちのところに、売り込みがあったらしい。薬を開発したところの関係者とかなんとか……そんな人間じゃないかな」","en":"“I don’t know the details myself, but apparently someone approached the old men in the Club about selling it. Someone connected with the people who developed the drug, or something... That sort of person, I suppose.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"田中紺太","displayName":"Konta Tanaka","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r316","rowIndex":316,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「うーん、どうにもうさんくさい」","en":"“Hmm. That sounds terribly suspicious.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r317","rowIndex":317,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「騙されてるんじゃないの？　それ、ただの<tips=45>ローズ</tips>でしょ？」","en":"“Aren’t they being conned? That’s just ordinary <tips=45>Rose</tips>, isn’t it?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r318","rowIndex":318,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=9>Y地区</tips>でこうした薬物を売るには<ruby=バーロンフゥイ><tips=21>八龍会</tips></ruby>を通すしかなく、<tips=21>八龍会</tips>の<tips=22>老人たち</tips>は金に細かいことで有名だ。そんな特別な薬ならば、他で売った方がよほど利益がありそうに思える。","en":"In <tips=9>Y District</tips>, drugs like these could only be sold through the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips>. The <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society’s</tips> <tips=22>old men</tips> were notorious for watching every penny. If the medicine was truly so extraordinary, it seemed that selling it elsewhere would have been far more profitable.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r319","rowIndex":319,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「今のところ、<tips=45>ローズ</tips>みたいに中毒になったヤツは出ていないな。だから、そう悪くない薬だと思うぜ。どうだ、試してみないか？　初めての人間には、サンプルとして注射キットと粉の薬を一つずつタダで配っているんだ」","en":"“So far, nobody’s become addicted to it the way people did with <tips=45>Rose</tips>. That makes it a decent enough drug, I’d say. How about giving it a try? First-time customers get one injection kit and one packet of powder free as samples.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"田中紺太","displayName":"Konta Tanaka","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r320","rowIndex":320,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「でもそれ、<tips=21>バーロン</tips>に入らないとだめなんでしょ？」","en":"“But you have to join <tips=21>Balong</tips>, don’t you?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r321","rowIndex":321,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「サンプルは入ってなくても大丈夫だ。次の購入から入っていれば会員価格が適用される」","en":"“You don’t have to be a member for the samples. As long as you join before your next purchase, you’ll get the membership price.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"田中紺太","displayName":"Konta Tanaka","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r322","rowIndex":322,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それって、典型的な、ジャンキーから搾り取る商売のやり方じゃないの」","en":"“Isn’t that the classic way of squeezing money out of junkies?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r323","rowIndex":323,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ほら、どうだ？　<tips=12>江梨子</tips>はまだそれほど必要じゃなさそうだが、まわりにどうしようもない重病人もいるだろ？　そいつらに使ってみたらどうだ？」","en":"“Come on, what do you say? It doesn’t look as though <tips=12>Eriko</tips> needs it badly yet, but there must be some hopelessly sick people around you. Why not try it on them?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"田中紺太","displayName":"Konta Tanaka","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r324","rowIndex":324,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=66>コンタ</tips>は注射キットの小箱と、粉末の入ったポリ袋を手のひらに乗せてこちらに差し出す。","en":"<tips=66>Konta</tips> placed a small box containing an injection kit and a plastic packet of powder on his palm and held them out to us.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r325","rowIndex":325,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いや、やめとくわ。とても信用出来ない」","en":"“No. We’ll pass. There’s no way we can trust that.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r326","rowIndex":326,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それにね、どうもその名前が好きじゃないの」","en":"“Besides, we don’t like the name.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r327","rowIndex":327,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「名前？」","en":"“The name?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"田中紺太","displayName":"Konta Tanaka","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r328","rowIndex":328,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そう、私たちね、薔薇って、世界で一番嫌いな花なの」","en":"“That’s right. Roses are the flowers we hate most in the world.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r329","rowIndex":329,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「花束をプレゼントしてくれるなら、薔薇だけはいれないでね」","en":"“If you ever give us a bouquet, make sure there isn’t a single rose in it.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r330","rowIndex":330,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちが言うと、<tips=66>コンタ</tips>は肩をすくめる。","en":"When we said that, <tips=66>Konta</tips> shrugged.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r331","rowIndex":331,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「わかったよ。覚えておこう」","en":"“Got it. I’ll remember that.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"田中紺太","displayName":"Konta Tanaka","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r332","rowIndex":332,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それから数日、私たちはすることがなかった。<tips=64>アレクセイ</tips>に何度かメールを送ったが返事はない。警察がむきになって私たちを探しているという情報もきかない。","en":"For the next several days, we had nothing to do. We sent <tips=64>Alexei</tips> several messages, but received no reply. Nor did we hear that the police were making a frantic search for us.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r333","rowIndex":333,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　緊張感もなく、毎日ナンシーと遊んだり、彼女がいなければ二人で<tips=57>滑走路通り</tips>をぷらぷらとした。すると昔からの顔なじみなどが声をかけてきて、その人物と食事をしたりする。","en":"With no sense of urgency, we spent each day playing with Nancy or, when she was away, drifting around <tips=57>Runway Street</tips> by ourselves. Old acquaintances would call out to us, and we would go eat with them.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r334","rowIndex":334,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=64>アレクセイ</tips>と出会ってからのあれこれが、まるで嘘だったかのようなだらけた毎日だった。","en":"Our days were so idle that everything that had happened since meeting <tips=64>Alexei</tips> seemed almost like a lie.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r335","rowIndex":335,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ただ街は私たちのだらけぶりとは無関係に緊迫感を増している。","en":"The city, however, was growing tenser regardless of how idle we were.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r336","rowIndex":336,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　街を支配するマフィア<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>のなかでの対立が激しさを増しているそうだ。","en":"Word was that conflict within <tips=7>YS</tips>, the mafia that ruled the city, was growing more intense.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r337","rowIndex":337,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>の本拠地であるグランドタワーが襲撃され、幹部が殺害されるという事件があった。","en":"Grand Tower, <tips=7>YS’s</tips> headquarters, had been attacked, and one of its executives killed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r338","rowIndex":338,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　犯人が誰かははっきりしていないが、内部の有力者が裏で糸を引いているという噂だ。","en":"No one knew for certain who was responsible, but rumor had it that an influential insider was pulling the strings.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r339","rowIndex":339,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　団地の<tips=14>深沢</tips>はこれを喜んでいるだろう。","en":"<tips=14>Fukazawa</tips>, over at the housing complex, was probably pleased about this.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r340","rowIndex":340,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　街が乱れたときに得をするのは、いつだって<tips=13>ヘドロ団地</tips>の住民だ。","en":"Whenever the city fell into turmoil, it was always the residents of the <tips=13>housing complex</tips> who profited.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r341","rowIndex":341,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　することもなくナンシーの部屋に滞在している間。学校からも連絡があった。","en":"While we passed our empty days in Nancy’s room, the school contacted us as well.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r342","rowIndex":342,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"『やっと電話が繋がったわね……あなたたち、一体どうしたんですか？　二人揃って無断欠席を続けて。前から休むことはよくあったけど、今回は中間テストにも出席せずに……』","en":"“I’ve finally gotten through... What in the world has happened to you two? You’ve both been absent without permission all this time. You missed school often enough before, but this time you even missed the midterm exams...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r343","rowIndex":343,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　担任は私たちに学校に来るよう促した。","en":"Our homeroom teacher urged us to come to school.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r344","rowIndex":344,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　基本的にはあまり生徒に執着せず、落ちこぼれたものには冷淡な学校だったが、今回のようなサボタージュを行ってもこんな連絡をしてくるのは、私たちが成績上位者であったからだろう。私たちはそうした学校の態度を今まで利用していたが、そうした特別扱い自体は嫌悪の対象でしかなかった。","en":"As a rule, the school took little interest in its students and treated those who fell behind with indifference. The only reason it would contact us even after we skipped school like this was probably that we ranked among its best students. We had exploited that attitude until now, but the preferential treatment itself had always disgusted us.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r345","rowIndex":345,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しかし、今回の相手の言い分はそれとも違うような気がした。","en":"This time, however, it felt as though the teacher’s concern came from somewhere else.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r346","rowIndex":346,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「私たちはしばらく学校に行くつもりはありません」","en":"“We don’t intend to come to school for a while.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r347","rowIndex":347,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"『しばらくっていつまでですか？　一体、何があったんですか？』","en":"“How long is ‘a while’? What in the world happened?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r348","rowIndex":348,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「私たちの特別な用事です。いまは、学校に行っている場合ではないんです」","en":"“We have private business to attend to. Right now, this is no time for us to be going to school.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r349","rowIndex":349,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"『どういう意味ですか？』","en":"“What do you mean?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r350","rowIndex":350,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そのままの意味です。……ずっと思ってたんですけれど、あの学校は私たちとはあわないと思います。綺麗な校舎も、先生やクラスメートの語る内容も……住む世界が違うというか、薄っぺらくて面白みがないというか……」","en":"“Exactly what we said. ...We’ve always thought that school was wrong for us. The clean building, the things the teachers and our classmates talk about... It’s as though we live in different worlds. Everything there feels shallow and dull...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r351","rowIndex":351,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"『あなたたちが<tips=9>Y地区</tips>に住んでいるということは知っています。でも、それであなたたちの人生を決めつけて、台無しにしてはいけません。将来に夢をもって……』","en":"“I know that you live in <tips=9>Y District</tips>. But you mustn’t let that dictate your lives and ruin them. You need dreams for your future...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r352","rowIndex":352,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その言葉で私は違和に確信を持った。","en":"Those words confirmed what had felt wrong to me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r353","rowIndex":353,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いや、いいんです。私たちはもう決めましたから」","en":"“No, thank you. We’ve already made our decision.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r354","rowIndex":354,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私はそうやって彼女の言葉を遮ってから、","en":"I cut her off, then added,","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r355","rowIndex":355,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「私たちの事情について、全部話しましょうか？　洗いざらい全部喋ってもいいですよ。ただ、知らない方が先生にとっては安全だと思いますが？」","en":"“Would you like us to tell you everything about our circumstances? We can tell you every last detail. But I think you’ll be safer if you don’t know.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r356","rowIndex":356,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そう言うと、教師は沈黙をする。","en":"At that, the teacher fell silent.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r357","rowIndex":357,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私が通話を切ろうと電話を耳から話したところで、また声が聞こえてきた。","en":"I had moved the phone away from my ear and was about to end the call when her voice came again.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r358","rowIndex":358,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"『困ったことがあるなら、なんでも相談にのります。私たちはあなたたちの担任ですもの。とりあえず、一度会って……』","en":"“If you’re in trouble, you can talk to us about anything. We are your teachers, after all. For now, why don’t you come meet with us and...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r359","rowIndex":359,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は最後まできかず、通話を打ち切った。そしてそのまま電話機の電源も切る。","en":"I ended the call without listening to the rest, then switched the phone off altogether.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r360","rowIndex":360,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「やっぱり、この電話はもう処分した方がいいみたい」","en":"“I knew it. We ought to get rid of this phone.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r361","rowIndex":361,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なんて言われた？」","en":"“What did she say?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r362","rowIndex":362,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「多分学校の方にも警察の手が回ってる。探るような電話をかけてきたわ」","en":"“The police have probably gotten to the school too. She was calling to feel us out.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r363","rowIndex":363,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちは翌日<tips=57>滑走路通り</tips>で新しい携帯電話を手に入れ、古いものは粉々に粉砕して捨てた。","en":"The next day, we obtained a new cell phone on <tips=57>Runway Street</tips>, smashed the old one into pieces, and threw it away.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r364","rowIndex":364,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　引き続き<tips=64>アレクセイ</tips>からの連絡はなかった。街をぷらぷらとしても彼の手がかりはない。","en":"There was still no word from <tips=64>Alexei</tips>. However much we wandered the city, we found no sign of him.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r365","rowIndex":365,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=64>アレクセイ</tips>が活動しているとすれば相変わらず女を殺しているはずだが、そういう噂も耳にしない。警察が私たちについて嗅ぎ廻っているという忠告は時々耳にした。しかしどこに行っても彼らは追い返されたり、敵意によって無視されるだけで大した情報は得られていないようだった。","en":"If <tips=64>Alexei</tips> was active, he should still have been killing women, yet we heard no such rumors. From time to time, someone warned us that the police had been snooping around for information about us. Wherever they went, however, people merely drove them away or ignored them with open hostility, and it seemed they had learned little of value.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r366","rowIndex":366,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「事情はよくわからねえけど、サツに嗅ぎ回られて困ってるんなら、今度見かけたらブチ殺しといてやろうか？」","en":"“I don’t really know what’s going on, but if the cops snooping around are giving you trouble, want me to kill the bastards next time I see them?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r367","rowIndex":367,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　古い友人が、金色の目を光らせながらそう言った。","en":"An old friend said it with his golden eyes gleaming.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r368","rowIndex":368,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「別にいいよ。そんなのいつだって出来るし」","en":"“Don’t bother. We can do that whenever we like.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r369","rowIndex":369,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それより、最近調子悪かったんじゃないの？」","en":"“Never mind that—hadn’t you been feeling poorly lately?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r370","rowIndex":370,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いやー、<tips=10>道夫</tips>君のとこで貰った注射つかったら調子よくてさ。今ならなんでも出来そうな気分なんだよ」","en":"“Well, I used an injection I got from <tips=10>Michio</tips>, and now I feel great. Like I could do anything.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r371","rowIndex":371,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そう言って彼は笑った。","en":"He laughed as he said it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r372","rowIndex":372,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=21>ドラゴン・クラブ</tips>が販売する<tips=46>ネオ・ローズ</tips>は地区の<tips=17>タイプB</tips>たちに瞬く間に広がっていた。どこへ行っても悪い噂は聞かない。","en":"The <tips=46>Neo Rose</tips> sold by the <tips=21>Dragon Club</tips> spread among the district’s <tips=17>Type Bs</tips> in the blink of an eye. Wherever we went, we heard nothing bad about it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r373","rowIndex":373,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それが本当に<tips=66>コンタ</tips>が言った通りの薬なら、<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>の世代交代以上の混乱をこの街にもたらすだろうと私たちは思った。だけれどそれは今の私たちには興味のないことだ。","en":"If it truly was the drug <tips=66>Konta</tips> claimed, we thought it would bring greater turmoil to the city than the changing of the guard within <tips=7>YS</tips>. But that held no interest for us now.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r374","rowIndex":374,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　このまま<tips=64>アレクセイ</tips>と連絡がつかないのなら、私たちは別のことをはじめなくてはならなかった。","en":"If we could not make contact with <tips=64>Alexei</tips>, we would have to begin something else.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r375","rowIndex":375,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　団地に戻って、これまで通りの生活を再開する気にはなれない。<tips=9>Y地区</tips>のどこかに部屋を借りて、この人混みのなかで暮らすというのは、前々から考えていたプランの一つではあった。","en":"We had no desire to return to the housing complex and resume our former life. Renting a room somewhere in <tips=9>Y District</tips> and living among its crowds was one plan we had considered for some time.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r376","rowIndex":376,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その日私たちはナンシーの部屋で二人でゲームをしていた。","en":"That day, the two of us were playing a game in Nancy’s room.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r377","rowIndex":377,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「えーい、このー」","en":"“Take that!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r378","rowIndex":378,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「くそー、やったなー」","en":"“Damn it! You got me!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r379","rowIndex":379,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　すると、そこにナンシーがやって来て、私たちのプレイする画面を眺めだした。","en":"Then Nancy arrived and began watching our game.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r380","rowIndex":380,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いつまでも決着つかないわね……。本当に双子ってそっくり」","en":"“You’ll never settle this, will you? Twins really are identical...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ナンシー・リュー","displayName":"Nancy Liu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r381","rowIndex":381,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女は溜息をつく。","en":"She sighed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r382","rowIndex":382,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「よし、私の勝ち！」","en":"“Yes! I win!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r383","rowIndex":383,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あーん、これで８対９になっちゃった……」","en":"“Aww, that makes it eight to nine...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r384","rowIndex":384,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして私たちはナンシーを振り返る。","en":"Then we turned to look at Nancy.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r385","rowIndex":385,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……あっ、そっくりの双子に、違いを発見！」","en":"“...Oh! I found a difference between you identical twins!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ナンシー・リュー","displayName":"Nancy Liu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r386","rowIndex":386,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちの顔を見たナンシーは、私たちの片方のほっぺについていたジャムを人差し指でぬぐって、ぺろりと舐めた。","en":"Looking at our faces, Nancy wiped a smear of jam from one sister’s cheek with her index finger, then licked it clean.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r387","rowIndex":387,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ナンシーの部屋は狭く、寝るときは布団を敷いて川の字になって眠った。","en":"Nancy’s room was small. At bedtime, we laid out the futons and slept three abreast.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r388","rowIndex":388,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「アパートなんか探さなくても、ずっとここに居たっていいんだよ。家族が出来たみたいで楽しいし」","en":"“You don’t have to look for an apartment. You can stay here as long as you like. It’s fun—like having a family.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r389","rowIndex":389,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　明かりを消してからナンシーはそう言った。","en":"Nancy said it after the lights were out.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r390","rowIndex":390,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そもそも、団地に帰ればいいじゃない？　どうして帰ろうとしないの？　何かしたのなら、街にいるよりあそこの方が安全でしょ？」","en":"“Why not go back to the housing complex in the first place? Why won’t you go home? If you did something, you’d be safer there than in the city, wouldn’t you?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r391","rowIndex":391,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちは答えない。ナンシーは溜息をつく。","en":"We did not answer. Nancy sighed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r392","rowIndex":392,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そういえば知ってる？　<tips=1>亮</tips>君がついに<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>のボスになったみたいだよ」","en":"“By the way, have you heard? Apparently <tips=1>Ryo</tips> has finally become the boss of <tips=7>YS</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ナンシー・リュー","displayName":"Nancy Liu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r393","rowIndex":393,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「知らないよ」","en":"“We hadn’t heard.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r394","rowIndex":394,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「興味ないもの」","en":"“We don’t care.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r395","rowIndex":395,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ねえ、見てご覧よこれ」","en":"“Hey, look at this.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ナンシー・リュー","displayName":"Nancy Liu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r396","rowIndex":396,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちが興味がないと言っているのに、ナンシーは無理矢理情報端末の画面を私たちに見せた。","en":"Even though we told her we were not interested, Nancy thrust the screen of her terminal in front of us anyway.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r397","rowIndex":397,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「すごいわね、こんなに立派になっちゃって。まるで別人みたい」","en":"“Amazing—he’s grown so distinguished. He looks like a completely different person.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ナンシー・リュー","displayName":"Nancy Liu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r398","rowIndex":398,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そこにはスーツを身につけた<tips=1>菅原亮</tips>の姿が映っている。","en":"The screen showed <tips=1>Ryo Sugawara</tips> dressed in a suit.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r399","rowIndex":399,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼が三代目の<tips=81>龍頭</tips>となったとき。その就任挨拶は動画として組織の人間限定で公開された。","en":"When he became the third-generation <tips=81>Longtou</tips>, his inaugural address was released as a video restricted to members of the organization.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r400","rowIndex":400,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　今ナンシーが見せてくれているのは、それが外部に流出したものらしい。","en":"The copy Nancy was showing us now had apparently leaked outside the organization.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r401","rowIndex":401,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「こうしてみるとすごくハンサムだね。一緒にいたときは、怖い怖いって感じであんまり意識しなかったけど、少し離れてみると素敵。……あんたたちもそう思わない？」","en":"“Looking at him like this, he really is handsome. When we were together, he was so frightening that I never thought about it, but now that I’m seeing him from a distance, he’s wonderful. ...Don’t you two think so?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ナンシー・リュー","displayName":"Nancy Liu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r402","rowIndex":402,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「思わない」","en":"“No.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r403","rowIndex":403,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「気持ち悪い顔」","en":"“Gross face.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r404","rowIndex":404,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちは動画の方を見ないようにしながらそう言った。","en":"We said so while trying not to look at the video.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r405","rowIndex":405,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どうしてあなたたち<tips=1>亮</tips>君をきらってるの？　学校を紹介してくれたのも彼じゃない」","en":"“Why do you two hate <tips=1>Ryo</tips>? He’s the one who introduced you to that school.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ナンシー・リュー","displayName":"Nancy Liu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r406","rowIndex":406,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「学校なんか、完全に騙されただけだよ」","en":"“We were completely tricked about that school.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r407","rowIndex":407,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「超つまんないもの」","en":"“It’s so boring.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r408","rowIndex":408,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そう……でも、私まだ信じられない。あの<tips=1>亮</tips>君が<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>の頂点に立つなんて、なんだか変な気分……。確かに凄い人だったけど……人を見る目もあるよね。あんたたちに、あんな頭の良い学校行く力があるなんて誰も知らなかった。みんな、仲間内でもバカな子たちだと思ってたんだよ。見抜いていたのは<tips=1>亮</tips>君だけ」","en":"“I see... But I still can’t believe it. <tips=1>Ryo</tips>, standing at the very top of <tips=7>YS</tips>—it feels so strange... He was always amazing, of course... and he had an eye for people too. Nobody knew you two had what it took to attend such a demanding school. Even your friends all thought you were a couple of stupid girls. <tips=1>Ryo</tips> was the only one who saw it.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ナンシー・リュー","displayName":"Nancy Liu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r409","rowIndex":409,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「私たちはバカだよ」","en":"“We are stupid.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r410","rowIndex":410,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「だから誰よりもいろんなことを学ばなくちゃいけない」","en":"“That’s why we need to learn more than anyone else.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r411","rowIndex":411,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「でもさ……」","en":"“But...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ナンシー・リュー","displayName":"Nancy Liu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r412","rowIndex":412,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「もう寝よう。明日こそ引っ越し先を見つけなきゃいけないんだ」","en":"“Let’s go to sleep. Tomorrow we really have to find a new place.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r413","rowIndex":413,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちは目をつむった。","en":"We closed our eyes.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r414","rowIndex":414,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちは小さいころ、一度だけ<tips=1>菅原亮</tips>の母と妹を見たことがある。","en":"When we were little, we saw <tips=1>Ryo Sugawara’s</tips> mother and younger sister just once.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r415","rowIndex":415,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　二人ともとても身なりがよくて、<tips=13>ヘドロ団地</tips>の私たちからすると、まるきり別世界の人間みたいだった。","en":"They were both very well dressed, and to us from the <tips=13>housing complex</tips>, they seemed like people from an entirely different world.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r416","rowIndex":416,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その頃は<tips=1>菅原亮</tips>と名乗って定食屋の夫婦を両親だと偽っていたから、その二人が彼の肉親だと知ったのは後になってからのことだけど。","en":"At the time, he called himself <tips=1>Ryo Sugawara</tips> and passed off the couple who ran the diner as his parents, so it was only later that we learned those two were blood relatives of his.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r417","rowIndex":417,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　まあ、<tips=1>菅原亮</tips>は元の世界に戻ったのだ。","en":"Well, <tips=1>Ryo Sugawara</tips> had returned to the world he came from.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r418","rowIndex":418,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そしてまた、私たちに学校を薦めた時に彼が口にした言葉を思い出した。","en":"We also remembered something he had said when he recommended the school to us.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r419","rowIndex":419,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「お前たちはバカだから僕の言うことを聞いたほうがいい」","en":"“You two are stupid. You’d be better off doing as I say.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r420","rowIndex":420,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　なんだか苛々して、私たちはよく眠れなかった。","en":"For some reason, we were irritated and slept poorly.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r421","rowIndex":421,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>のなかで争いが起き、血生臭い事件が増えつつあるが、<tips=57>滑走路通り</tips>はいつも通りの活況を呈している。","en":"Conflict had broken out within <tips=7>YS</tips>, and bloody incidents were growing more frequent, but <tips=57>Runway Street</tips> remained as lively as ever.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r422","rowIndex":422,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちはそこで不動産屋に紹介されるまま空き部屋を見て回っていた。なかなか思ったような場所が見つからずにくたびれかけたとき、チャンという男に声をかけられた。","en":"We followed a real-estate agent from one vacant room to another there. Just as we were growing exhausted without finding anything that suited us, a man named Chan called out.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r423","rowIndex":423,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼は<tips=14>深沢</tips>の部下で、つまり団地の住人だった。<tips=14>深沢</tips>が私たちのことを探しているのだが、連絡がつかずに困っているのだと言う。","en":"He was one of <tips=14>Fukazawa’s</tips> subordinates, and therefore a resident of the housing complex. <tips=14>Fukazawa</tips> had been looking for us, he said, but had been unable to get in touch.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r424","rowIndex":424,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼の電話で<tips=14>深沢</tips>と話すことになった。","en":"We ended up speaking with <tips=14>Fukazawa</tips> on his phone.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r425","rowIndex":425,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あ、<tips=14>深沢聡</tips>」","en":"“Oh. <tips=14>Satoshi Fukazawa</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r426","rowIndex":426,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"『おい、早く帰って来い。いつまでも街をうろうろしていたって仕方がないだろう』","en":"“Hey, come home already. There’s no point wandering around the city forever.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r427","rowIndex":427,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「もう帰らない。部屋の荷物は不要なら処分してくれていいよ」","en":"“We’re not going back. You can get rid of anything left in the room.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r428","rowIndex":428,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"『ばかっ！　学校にも行かず、何をするつもりだ？』","en":"“Idiots! You aren’t even going to school. What do you plan to do?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r429","rowIndex":429,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「これからは、街で暮らすことにしたんだ。だから、戻らない。いままでありがとう。……じゃ、切るね」","en":"“We’ve decided to live in the city from now on. So we won’t be coming back. Thank you for everything. ...I’m hanging up.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r430","rowIndex":430,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"『おい、待て！』","en":"“Hey, wait!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r431","rowIndex":431,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちが通話終了操作をしようとすると、<tips=14>深沢</tips>は声をあげた。","en":"As we were about to end the call, <tips=14>Fukazawa</tips> raised his voice.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r432","rowIndex":432,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"『お前たち、警察を殺したそうだな』","en":"“I heard you two killed a cop.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r433","rowIndex":433,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……知らないよ」","en":"“...We don’t know what you’re talking about.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r434","rowIndex":434,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"『別に隠す必要はない。そんなのは大したことじゃない。理由を聞こうとも思わない。大体、警察なんてやつらは、全員殺されるべきもんだ。おれが言いたいのはな、そんなことが理由で団地を離れるなら馬鹿馬鹿しいってことだけだ。とにかく一旦帰って来い。話をしよう』","en":"“There’s no need to hide it. That’s nothing serious. I’m not even going to ask your reasons. Hell, every last cop deserves to be killed. All I’m saying is that if you left the housing complex over something like that, it’s ridiculous. Just come home for now. We’ll talk.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r435","rowIndex":435,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=14>深沢</tips>は一方的に言うと、通話を切った。","en":"After delivering that pronouncement without allowing us a word, <tips=14>Fukazawa</tips> hung up.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r436","rowIndex":436,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちは二人で話し合った末、一旦団地に戻ることに決めた。","en":"The two of us discussed it and decided to return to the housing complex for the time being.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r437","rowIndex":437,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　久しぶりに団地に戻り、<tips=14>深沢</tips>の部屋に行く。そのリビングルームには<tips=14>深沢</tips>の他にも三人ほど集まっていた。いずれもこの団地では顔の利く面々だ。","en":"We returned to the housing complex for the first time in a while and went to <tips=14>Fukazawa’s</tips> room. About three other people had gathered in the living room besides <tips=14>Fukazawa</tips>. Every one of them wielded influence within the complex.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r438","rowIndex":438,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「勢揃いしてるね」","en":"“Everyone’s here.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r439","rowIndex":439,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「誰かのお誕生日会なの？」","en":"“Is it somebody’s birthday party?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r440","rowIndex":440,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「違う。お前たちを待っていたんだ。とにかく、そこに座れ」","en":"“No. We were waiting for you. Sit down over there.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"深沢聡","displayName":"Satoshi Fukazawa","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r441","rowIndex":441,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=14>深沢</tips>はソファーを指さしたが、私たちは立ったままでいた。","en":"<tips=14>Fukazawa</tips> pointed to the sofa, but we remained standing.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r442","rowIndex":442,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　このフォーメーションはよくない。子供のころから、私たちが悪戯をするとよくこのメンバーで説教をされたものだ。","en":"This was a bad formation. Ever since we were children, whenever we got into mischief, these were the people who gathered to lecture us.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r443","rowIndex":443,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いやあ、お嬢たちよ、サツをやったんだって？　しかも相当な腕っこきを仕留めたそうじゃないか。実にいいねえ。これであんたらも、一人前だ」","en":"“Well, well, young ladies. I hear you killed a cop—and quite the formidable one at that. Wonderful. Now you’ve made your bones.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r444","rowIndex":444,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　やせぎすでサングラスをかけたその男は<tips=59>暗闇通り</tips>で手下に偽ブランド品を販売しており、中抜きをしたり裏切り行為を働いた部下を拷問するのを何よりの楽しみに過ごしている。","en":"The thin man in sunglasses had his underlings selling counterfeit designer goods on <tips=59>Darkness Street</tips>. His greatest pleasure in life was torturing subordinates who skimmed off the proceeds or betrayed him.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r445","rowIndex":445,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「な、な、なんで、ひ、一言も相談してくれないんだ？　う、う、うまく後始末をしてやったのに……」","en":"“W-why didn’t you c-consult us? W-we could have cleaned everything up for you...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r446","rowIndex":446,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　吃音の大男は腕力自慢の<tips=17>タイプB</tips>で、愚連隊のようなものを率いて飲食店を恐喝したり、逆にボディーガードとして雇われたりして生計を立てている。団地に警察官が入り込んだ時などは、おおむね彼が対応することになっている。私たちの知っている限り、既に六人は殺しており、素手で体中の骨を一本ずつ折って苦痛を与えながらゆっくり殺害することを好んだ。","en":"The stammering giant was a <tips=17>Type B</tips> who prided himself on his strength. He made his living leading what amounted to a street gang, extorting restaurants or, conversely, being hired as a bodyguard. When police officers entered the complex, he was usually the one who dealt with them. To our knowledge, he had already killed at least six. He preferred to kill them slowly with his bare hands, breaking every bone in their bodies one by one to prolong their suffering.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r447","rowIndex":447,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「お嬢たちだってそれくらいのことはよく分かっているはずだ。何か別の理由があって団地を去ったんだろうよ。思春期でもあるし、我々のような大人にはわからないこともあるのさ」","en":"“The young ladies surely understand that much. They must have left the complex for some other reason. They are adolescents, after all. There are things adults like us cannot understand.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r448","rowIndex":448,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　片目に義眼を入れ、つややかな黒髭を長く伸ばしたその男は言った。","en":"So said a man with a glass eye in one socket and a long, lustrous black beard.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r449","rowIndex":449,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼はどこかで人間を買いつけて来て、この街の各所の組織や施設に売るという仕事をしている。つまり人買いだ。","en":"He was in the business of buying people somewhere or other and selling them to organizations and institutions throughout the city. In other words, he was a slave trader.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r450","rowIndex":450,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　アルコール依存症におかされており、手が震え始めたころにトイレに行ってポケットの小瓶からウイスキーを流し込まないと正気を保てない。","en":"He suffered from alcoholism. When his hands began to shake, he had to retreat to the bathroom and pour whiskey from a pocket flask down his throat to remain sane.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r451","rowIndex":451,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「おい、そうなのか？」","en":"“Hey. Is that true?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"深沢聡","displayName":"Satoshi Fukazawa","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r452","rowIndex":452,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　正面に座った<tips=14>深沢</tips>は私たちをまっすぐ見据えてそう言った。","en":"Seated directly before us, <tips=14>Fukazawa</tips> asked the question with his gaze fixed squarely upon us.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r453","rowIndex":453,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いいじゃないそんなこと」","en":"“What does it matter?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r454","rowIndex":454,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「私たちの好きにさせてよ」","en":"“Let us do as we please.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r455","rowIndex":455,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そういうわけにはいかない」","en":"“I can’t allow that.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"深沢聡","displayName":"Satoshi Fukazawa","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r456","rowIndex":456,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=14>深沢</tips>は首を横に振り、","en":"<tips=14>Fukazawa</tips> shook his head.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r457","rowIndex":457,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「お前たちには、<tips=57>滑走路通り</tips>をうろつくクズたちのような人生を送って欲しくない。この団地に戻って、また学校へ通うんだ」","en":"“I don’t want you to live like the scum who loiter on <tips=57>Runway Street</tips>. Come back to this complex and start going to school again.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"深沢聡","displayName":"Satoshi Fukazawa","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r458","rowIndex":458,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そんなの、出来るわけないよ」","en":"“There’s no way we can do that.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r459","rowIndex":459,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「学校の方にも手が回ってるもの」","en":"“The police have already gotten to the school.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r460","rowIndex":460,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「問題ない」","en":"“That’s no problem.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r461","rowIndex":461,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　と口を挟んだのは、サングラスだった。","en":"Sunglasses cut in.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r462","rowIndex":462,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「学校関係者にちょいと『楽しくなる話』をしてやれば、警察の肩を持つ気なんかすぐに消え失せる。その後は今回の捜査を指示しているお偉いさんの嬢ちゃんや坊っちゃんと仲良くなって、この団地で何日かかけてゆっくりとお話を聞けば、すぐに彼らも死んだ警察官のことなんか忘れるさ」","en":"“One little ‘cheerful conversation’ with the people at the school, and they’ll soon lose any desire to side with the police. After that, we make friends with the sons and daughters of the big shots directing this investigation. We bring them here and spend a few days talking things over at our leisure. The police will forget about their dead officer soon enough.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r463","rowIndex":463,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「しかも、お嬢たちがやったのはあのワンコロだそうじゃないか」","en":"“Besides, I hear the one you killed was that mutt.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r464","rowIndex":464,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　人買いがひげを撫でながら言う。","en":"The slave trader stroked his beard as he spoke.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r465","rowIndex":465,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「警察のなかでも、鼻つまみものだよ。他の警官を殺したのとは違う。危険を冒してまで捜査はしないさ。彼は、我々を敵に回すことの恐ろしさは身に染みて知っているはずだ」","en":"“He was despised even among the police. It’s not like you killed an ordinary officer. They won’t risk their lives to investigate. He ought to understand all too well how frightening it is to make enemies of us.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r466","rowIndex":466,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちは溜息をついて、","en":"We sighed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r467","rowIndex":467,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ご厚意はありがたいけど、遠慮しておくよ」","en":"“We appreciate the kindness, but no thank you.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r468","rowIndex":468,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「好きでやってることだから、みんなに迷惑をかけようとは思わない」","en":"“We’re doing this because we want to. We don’t mean to cause trouble for everyone.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r469","rowIndex":469,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「め、め、迷惑なんかじゃないっ！」","en":"“I-it isn’t t-trouble!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r470","rowIndex":470,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　大男が顔を真っ赤にして大声で言った。","en":"The giant shouted, his face bright red.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r471","rowIndex":471,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「み、み、みんな、お嬢たちのために何かしたいんだっ。それだけなんだっ」","en":"“E-everybody wants to d-do something for the young ladies. Th-that’s all!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r472","rowIndex":472,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうだとも」","en":"“Exactly.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r473","rowIndex":473,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　人買いが頷く。","en":"The slave trader nodded.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r474","rowIndex":474,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「意味が分からない。みんながそこまで思ってるだなんて全然知らなかった」","en":"“We don’t understand. We had no idea everyone cared that much about us.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r475","rowIndex":475,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どうして？　どうしてそんなふうに？」","en":"“Why? Why would you feel that way?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r476","rowIndex":476,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちは困惑して尋ね返す。","en":"Bewildered, we asked them.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r477","rowIndex":477,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「お前たちは初めてここへやって来た時から誰も一度も差別しなかった。病気で身体が腐りかけた半分死んだようなやつでも、恐ろしい人殺しでも、レイプ魔でも、<tips=17>タイプＢ</tips>でも、どうしようもないクズでも……平気で話しかけて、平気で仲良くなった」","en":"“From the moment you first came here, you never discriminated against anyone—not once. A sick man whose body was half rotted away, barely alive; a terrifying murderer; a rapist; a <tips=17>Type B</tips>; worthless scum... You spoke to them without a second thought, and became their friends without a second thought.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r478","rowIndex":478,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　サングラスはそう言う。","en":"The man in sunglasses told us.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r479","rowIndex":479,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「お、お、お嬢たちは、何にもとらわれない高貴で美しい心を持っている」","en":"“Th-the young ladies possess n-noble, beautiful hearts, free of all prejudice.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r480","rowIndex":480,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「みなそれに感じ入っているのさ」","en":"“It moved every one of us.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r481","rowIndex":481,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「お嬢たちが来てから団地は変わったっ！　住民同士で殺し合うことがめっきり減った！」","en":"“The complex changed when you young ladies arrived! The residents hardly ever kill one another anymore!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r482","rowIndex":482,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼らは立ったままの私たちを見つめる。","en":"They looked at us as we stood there.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r483","rowIndex":483,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そんなの、たいしたことじゃないわ」","en":"“That’s no big deal.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r484","rowIndex":484,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「当たり前のことだよ」","en":"“It’s only natural.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r485","rowIndex":485,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちは生まれてから一度もかけられたことがない言葉に、困惑して俯いた。","en":"Hearing words no one had ever spoken to us before, we lowered our heads in confusion.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r486","rowIndex":486,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「みんな、頭がおかしくなっちゃったんじゃないの？」","en":"“Has everybody gone crazy?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r487","rowIndex":487,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「正気だよ。お前たちは、我々の本当の仲間になるときがきた。だからこうして話している」","en":"“We’re in our right minds. The time has come for you to become true members of our community. That’s why we’re having this conversation.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"深沢聡","displayName":"Satoshi Fukazawa","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r488","rowIndex":488,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=14>深沢</tips>は私たちを見つめている。父親のような優しい目だと私たちは思った。","en":"<tips=14>Fukazawa</tips> looked at us. We thought his eyes were gentle, like a father’s.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r489","rowIndex":489,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「覚えているか？　うちのコウタが死んだときのことだ。衰弱しきって、最後の方はみんな哀れんだ目で見てたが、お前たちだけは普段と変わらないように接してくれた。……寝たきりの子供に『サッカーやろうぜー』ってな。コウタは『出来るわけないだろバカ』って追い返してたが、お前たちが帰った後に本当の友だちはあいつらだけだって涙ぐんでいたんだぜ……」","en":"“Do you remember when my Kota died? He had wasted away completely, and by the end, everyone looked at him with pity. You two were the only ones who treated him no differently than before. ...You went to a bedridden child and said, ‘Come on, let’s play soccer!’ Kota told you, ‘You idiots know I can’t,’ and sent you away. But after you left, he teared up and said you two were his only real friends...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"深沢聡","displayName":"Satoshi Fukazawa","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r490","rowIndex":490,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あ、あれはただ、あいつとサッカーがしたかっただけだから……」","en":"“W-we only did that because we wanted to play soccer with him...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r491","rowIndex":491,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それって、私たちのバカエピソードじゃない？」","en":"“Isn’t that just a story about how stupid we are?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r492","rowIndex":492,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちは首を横に振って、","en":"We shook our heads.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r493","rowIndex":493,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「大体さー、前から思ってたんだけど、お嬢お嬢って言うのやめてよ」","en":"“Anyway, we’ve been meaning to say this forever: stop calling us ‘young ladies.’”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r494","rowIndex":494,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「私たちはただのみなしごで、お嬢でもなんでもないでしょ！」","en":"“We’re only orphans. We’re not ‘young ladies’ or anything!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r495","rowIndex":495,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　笑ってみたけれども、誰もそれにつき合わないで真剣な顔をしている。","en":"We tried to laugh, but no one joined us. Every face remained serious.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r496","rowIndex":496,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>は息子が跡を継ぎ、<tips=21>ドラゴン・クラブ</tips>の<tips=22>老人たち</tips>も、そう長くはないだろう。世代交代は始まっている。この団地もいつかその時が来るだろう。いつか我々が衰えたら、お嬢たちが団地をおさめるんだ。団地の連中は一癖も二癖もあるやつばかりだが、お嬢たちなら誰も異論はない」","en":"“The son has succeeded his father in <tips=7>YS</tips>, and <tips=22>the old men</tips> of the <tips=21>Dragon Club</tips> cannot have long left either. The old guard is beginning to give way. Someday this complex will face the same moment. When we grow weak, the young ladies will govern it. Every resident here is a difficult character, but no one would object to you two.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r497","rowIndex":497,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　人買いは私たちの目をじっと見つめている。","en":"The slave trader stared into our eyes.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r498","rowIndex":498,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まあ、そんな先の話はいい。将来的にはこんな団地を出て行ってもいい。それはお前たちが選ぶことだ。だが、今は学校へ行き、まっとうな道を歩くんだ。お前たちが自分から学校へ行きたいと申し出た時はどれだけ嬉しかったか……」","en":"“Never mind such distant talk for now. In the future, you can leave a place like this if you choose. That decision is yours. But for now, you will attend school and follow a respectable path. Do you have any idea how happy I was when you came to me yourselves and said you wanted to go?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"深沢聡","displayName":"Satoshi Fukazawa","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r499","rowIndex":499,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=14>深沢</tips>は溜息をつく。","en":"<tips=14>Fukazawa</tips> sighed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r500","rowIndex":500,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あれは、<tips=1>菅原亮</tips>にそそのかされただけで……」","en":"“That was only because <tips=1>Ryo Sugawara</tips> talked us into it...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r501","rowIndex":501,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「急にそんなこと言われたって困る」","en":"“You can’t spring something like this on us all of a sudden.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r502","rowIndex":502,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「前から考えてはいたことなんだ。<tips=12>江梨子</tips>の<tips=17>タイプB</tips>症状も進行している。それをうまく食い止めながら、将来のことを考えるんだ」","en":"“I’ve been thinking about it for some time. <tips=12>Eriko’s</tips> <tips=17>Type B</tips> symptoms are progressing as well. You need to keep them in check while you think about your future.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"深沢聡","displayName":"Satoshi Fukazawa","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r503","rowIndex":503,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=14>深沢</tips>はそう言った。","en":"<tips=14>Fukazawa</tips> said.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r504","rowIndex":504,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そ、そ、そうだよ。お、お嬢たちは、我々の希望なんだ。き、き、希望なんて、もうずっとこの団地にはなかったんだよ」","en":"“Th-that’s right. The young ladies are o-our hope. W-we haven’t had anything like hope in this complex for a very long time.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r505","rowIndex":505,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なあ、わかったら団地に戻ってこい。出て行くのは、もっと先でもいいじゃないか」","en":"“Come on. If you understand, come back to the complex. You can always leave later.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r506","rowIndex":506,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　人買いが言って、そしてみな私たちの返事を待った。","en":"The slave trader spoke, and everyone waited for our answer.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r507","rowIndex":507,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そこで、私たちははっきりと言った。","en":"Then we answered them clearly.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r508","rowIndex":508,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「みんなの助けはいらない」","en":"“We don’t need anyone’s help.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r509","rowIndex":509,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「今までずっとそうやってきたし、これからもずっとそう。自分たち以外の何かに頼るような生き方はしたくないの」","en":"“We’ve always lived that way, and we always will. We don’t want a life that depends on anything but ourselves.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r510","rowIndex":510,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちがきっぱりと言うと、落胆の空気が流れた。","en":"When we stated it without hesitation, disappointment filled the room.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r511","rowIndex":511,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「「でも、ありがとう」」","en":"Together, we said, “But thank you.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F3:r512","rowIndex":512,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そう言ってくれて、とても嬉しいわ」","en":"“It makes us very happy to hear you say that.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}}]},{"position":34,"code":"C3","unitId":"C3","rows":[{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r1","rowIndex":1,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=9>Y地区</tips>内で起きる事件の多くはニュースの記事にはならない。","en":"Many of the incidents that occur within <tips=9>Y District</tips> never become news stories.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r2","rowIndex":2,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　つまりそれは、どんなに刺激的な事件が起きても、その情報が共有されにくいということだ。だから住民であっても、地域のコミュニティに参加していなかったり、裏社会の人間に知り合いもいないような、例えばよそからやって来たばかりの人間は、身のまわりで殺人や強姦が起きてもほとんど知らずに過ごすことになる。","en":"In other words, no matter how sensational an incident may be, information about it does not readily circulate. Thus, even among residents, people who neither participate in the local community nor know anyone in the underworld—new arrivals from elsewhere, for example—can pass their days almost entirely unaware that murders and rapes are taking place around them.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r3","rowIndex":3,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私の勤めている病院でも<tips=9>Y地区</tips>に住んでいる職員が何人かいるが、ある若い医者は「思ったより<tips=9>Y地区</tips>って平和な場所なんですね」と拍子抜けした様子で笑っていた。","en":"Several employees at the hospital where I work live in <tips=9>Y District</tips>. “<tips=9>Y District</tips> is more peaceful than I expected,” one young doctor said with a smile of mild anticlimax.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r4","rowIndex":4,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その認識は確かに間違いとは言い切れず、今のこの街は世間の印象よりは危険ではない。しかし、彼がそう語ったつい三日前に彼のマンションの裏手で若い女の死体が発見されていたのを彼は知らなかった。","en":"That perception could not be called entirely mistaken, and the city today is less dangerous than its public image suggests. Yet he did not know that a young woman’s body had been found behind his apartment building a mere three days before he made the remark.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r5","rowIndex":5,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　幸い私は地域の児童施設をまわって診察を行っているため、職員や子供たちからその手の話を聞く機会は多い。施設の従業員は地元の出身者が多く、そして保護された子供たちと似た境遇のものも多かった。彼らは専門知識には欠けるが情熱はあり、自分たちが苦しい子供時代を送った経験からか、施設の子供に同じような思いをさせたくないという気持ちが感じられる。","en":"Fortunately, because I make rounds examining patients at local children’s facilities, I have many opportunities to hear such stories from the staff and children. Many of the employees were local, and many had grown up in circumstances similar to those of the children in their care. They lacked specialized knowledge but possessed passion, and perhaps because they themselves had endured painful childhoods, one could sense their desire to spare the children at the facilities the same suffering.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r6","rowIndex":6,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=17>タイプB</tips>の職員も少なくはなく、そしてこの街で生まれ育った人間の大半がそうであるように、幼少から成人するまでのあいだに裏社会となんらかの接触を経験している。そもそも、表通りから少し外れて古い住民が暮らす路地に入れば裏も表もなくなってしまうような地域ではあるのだが。","en":"A fair number of the employees were <tips=17>Type B</tips>. Like most people born and raised in this city, they had experienced some form of contact with the underworld between childhood and adulthood. Of course, in a district where stepping off a main street into an alley inhabited by longtime residents erased any distinction between the underworld and ordinary society, that was hardly surprising.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r7","rowIndex":7,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　このような次第であるから、私の耳に入ってくる情報は、街に住む<tips=17>タイプB</tips>のものも多く含まれている。<tips=17>タイプB</tips>たちは独自のネットワークを持っており、街の情報に通じていた。その情報には単なる噂話や出鱈目も含まれているのだろうが、少なくとも、街の新鮮な空気を反映していることは間違いがない。","en":"For these reasons, much of the information that reached me came from the city’s <tips=17>Type B</tips> residents. Those <tips=17>Type B</tips> residents had networks of their own and knew the city well. Some of what they passed along was doubtless mere gossip or nonsense, but it unquestionably carried the fresh air of the streets.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r8","rowIndex":8,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そうしたなかで、この街に不穏な気配が生まれつつあるのを感じている。","en":"Amid all this, I could sense something ominous beginning to stir in the city.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r9","rowIndex":9,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>が死んで一つの時代が終わった。","en":"<tips=3>Chris Tse</tips> had died, bringing one era to an end.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r10","rowIndex":10,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それによって分裂をしたり、暗殺事件があったり、銃撃戦が発生したりと、社会の裏側で様々なゴタゴタがあったようだ。","en":"His death had apparently set off all manner of turmoil behind the scenes: splintering factions, assassinations, and gun battles.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r11","rowIndex":11,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それがギャング同士のなかだけで収まってくれるのならば、無関係な市民にとってはスポーツ選手の試合を見て楽しむような側面もある。","en":"So long as it all remained confined to the gangs themselves, uninvolved citizens could in some respects enjoy it as they might a match between athletes.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r12","rowIndex":12,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ある施設に診察に行った時のことだ。","en":"It was during a visit to examine patients at one of the facilities.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r13","rowIndex":13,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　子供たちを一通り診ると、コーヒーとケーキが振る舞われた。","en":"After I had seen all the children, the staff served me coffee and cake.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r14","rowIndex":14,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その時私の応対をしたのは二人の若い女性職員で、親子ほども年齢が離れた彼女たちと話すこともなく黙って話を聞いていたのだが、話題はもっぱら最近のギャングたちについての評価だった。","en":"Two young female employees attended to me. They were young enough to be my daughters, and I said nothing, merely listening as they talked. Their conversation centered almost entirely on their opinions of the gangs’ recent movements.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r15","rowIndex":15,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「新しい<tips=81>龍頭</tips>のあの人見た？　とっても綺麗な顔してるのよ。私、<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>を断然応援しちゃうわ」","en":"“Have you seen the new <tips=81>Longtou</tips>? He has such a beautiful face. I’m definitely rooting for <tips=7>YS</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r16","rowIndex":16,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　肌が黒く、唇の分厚い職員は彼氏が<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>の傘下の飲食店を経営しているとかで、<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>を支持しているようだった。","en":"The dark-skinned employee with thick lips appeared to support <tips=7>YS</tips> because her boyfriend reportedly ran a restaurant under the <tips=7>YS</tips> umbrella.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r17","rowIndex":17,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「私は<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>はもういいかな。<tips=33>壬生屋</tips>がいるのがいや！　ちっちゃいとき近所に住んでたお姉ちゃんが、どれだけあいつのせいで苦しんだか……」","en":"“I’ve had enough of <tips=7>YS</tips>. I hate that <tips=33>Mibuya</tips> is in it! You have no idea how much an older girl from my neighborhood suffered because of him when I was little...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r18","rowIndex":18,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　茶色い髪とそばかすの多い頬を持った職員は<tips=59>暗闇通り</tips>のそばに住んでいたらしく、<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>の主要組織の一つ<tips=33>壬生屋</tips>家に対して悪い印象があり、<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>外の小さなグループに期待しているらしい。","en":"The employee with brown hair and freckled cheeks had apparently lived near <tips=59>Darkness Street</tips>. She had a poor opinion of the <tips=33>Mibuya</tips> family, one of <tips=7>YS’s</tips> principal organizations, and apparently pinned her hopes on a small group outside <tips=7>YS</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r19","rowIndex":19,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ギャンググループ同士で抗争が始まれば住民にも犠牲者がないとは限らないが、そういった危惧は見えなかった。","en":"If fighting began among the gangs, residents might well become casualties. Yet neither woman showed any sign of concern over that possibility.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r20","rowIndex":20,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　この街の裏通りで生まれ育った人間は、他の場所の常識のなかで暮らしてきたものには想像もつかないくらいしたたかでタフで、物事を明るくとらえることが出来る。彼らの常識からすれば『祭りで人が死ぬのは当然』ということなのかもしれない。","en":"People born and raised in this city’s back streets were canny, tough, and capable of looking on the bright side to a degree unimaginable to anyone raised by the common sense of another place. By their standards, perhaps ‘of course people die at festivals.’","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r21","rowIndex":21,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ただ、そんな彼女たちも話が別の方面に行くと顔色が冴えなくなった。","en":"But even their faces darkened when the conversation turned in another direction.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r22","rowIndex":22,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=17>タイプB</tips>の秘密結社である<tips=21>八龍会</tips>が<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>を公然と批判しているという状況は、彼女たちにとって身近な不安感をかき立てるもののようだ。","en":"The <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips>, a secret organization of <tips=17>Type B</tips> people, had publicly criticized <tips=7>YS</tips>. That development appeared to arouse in the women a more personal kind of anxiety.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r23","rowIndex":23,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その職員たちは二人とも<tips=17>タイプB</tips>だった。","en":"Both employees were <tips=17>Type B</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r24","rowIndex":24,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=21>八龍会</tips>は秘密結社という言葉を使うとものものしいが、この街の<tips=17>タイプB</tips>にとっては団地の生協程度には慣れ親しんだ存在である。","en":"Calling the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips> a secret society made it sound forbidding, but to the <tips=17>Type Bs</tips> of this city, it was about as familiar as a housing-complex cooperative.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r25","rowIndex":25,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それがこのように表立ってギャングにもの申すというのは、これまでとは違う何かを感じさせるに充分だった。","en":"For such an organization to speak out openly against a gang was enough to suggest that something had changed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r26","rowIndex":26,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ああいうの、私はどうかと思う」","en":"“I’m not sure they should be doing something like that.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r27","rowIndex":27,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　色の黒い職員はそう言って顔を曇らせた。","en":"The dark-skinned employee’s expression clouded as she spoke.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r28","rowIndex":28,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「急にあんなことを言い出したから、みんな戸惑っちゃってるよ」","en":"“Everybody’s confused because they came out with it so suddenly.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r29","rowIndex":29,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=21>八龍会</tips>のリーダーである<tips=22>老人たち</tips>の決定に、内部からも反発の声が上がっているらしい。","en":"It appeared that opposition was rising even within the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips> to the decisions of the <tips=22>elders</tips> who led it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r30","rowIndex":30,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ギャングの争いになんか、関わらなきゃいいのに。どうして殺人犯をあんなにかばうのかしら」","en":"“They should stay out of gang disputes. Why go so far to defend murderers?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r31","rowIndex":31,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そばかすの職員も今回の件には批判的なようだった。","en":"The freckled employee, too, appeared critical of the present affair.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r32","rowIndex":32,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　つい先日フェルナンデス一家殺人事件の犯人が処刑され、その遺体が路上に放置された。","en":"Only recently, the perpetrators of the Fernandes Family murders had been executed and their bodies abandoned in the street.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r33","rowIndex":33,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼らは元々<tips=35>フェルナンデス</tips>の部下だったそうで、彼らの犯罪はボス殺しという最大のタブーとして処理された。このタブーは組織の垣根をこえて軽蔑されるものだというのは、私もかつて<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>と共に活動していた頃に<tips=3>クリス</tips>から教わった。あの頃と変わらないこの街のルールだ。","en":"They had apparently been subordinates of <tips=35>Fernandes</tips>. Their crimes were dealt with as the supreme taboo of killing one’s boss. When I once worked alongside <tips=7>YS</tips>, <tips=3>Chris</tips> taught me that contempt for this taboo crossed organizational boundaries. That rule of the city had not changed since those days.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r34","rowIndex":34,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　放置された遺体は通行人から石を投げつけられ、皮膚も肉も破れ、腐敗したところに虫がたかり、悲惨なありさまだった。そして引き取るものもなく、何日間もその場に放置されていた。","en":"Passersby pelted the abandoned bodies with stones. Their skin and flesh split open, insects swarmed over the rotting tissue, and the bodies became a wretched sight. No one claimed them, and they remained there for days.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r35","rowIndex":35,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は深夜診察のときに通りかかって、たまたまこの遺体を片付けるところを目にした。","en":"While making late-night rounds, I happened to pass as someone was finally removing the bodies.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r36","rowIndex":36,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　顔を隠した数人の男女が、人目を盗むように怯えながら作業をした。女の一人はすすり泣いていた。あれはおそらく故人の家族だったのだろう。","en":"Several men and women with their faces concealed worked in fear, taking pains not to be seen. One of the women was sobbing. They were probably relatives of the dead.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r37","rowIndex":37,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そのいたましい光景が、今でも私の目に焼き付いている。","en":"That harrowing sight remains seared into my memory even now.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r38","rowIndex":38,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=21>八龍会</tips>はこの犯人たちが<tips=17>タイプB</tips>で発症していたことから、<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>に利用されたのだと訴えている。その訴えがどの程度妥当性があるのか私には判断することが出来ないし、街の多くの人々にとっても同様だろうが、彼らが<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>に対して公然と批判しているという事実は大きな衝撃を与えたようだ。","en":"Because the perpetrators were <tips=17>Type B</tips> and had manifested symptoms, the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips> claimed that <tips=7>YS</tips> had exploited them. I could not judge how valid the claim was, and most people in the city were likely in the same position. Even so, the fact that the Society was openly criticizing <tips=7>YS</tips> appeared to have caused a profound shock.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r39","rowIndex":39,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「先生はどう思いますか？」","en":"“What do you think, Doctor?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r40","rowIndex":40,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　職員は急に私にそう訊ねてきた。","en":"One of the employees suddenly asked me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r41","rowIndex":41,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どうですかね。私はそういった事情に疎いので」","en":"“I could not say. I know little about such matters.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r42","rowIndex":42,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私はそう言って誤魔化した。","en":"I evaded the subject with that reply.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r43","rowIndex":43,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それよりも、彼らが新しく売り出しはじめたという薬物が気になりますね」","en":"“I am more concerned about the drug they have begun selling.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r44","rowIndex":44,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「『<tips=46>ネオ・ローズ</tips>』ですか？」","en":"“‘<tips=46>Neo Rose</tips>’?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r45","rowIndex":45,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　職員たちにとってもその話題は関心のあるものらしく、すぐに興味を示してきた。","en":"That subject also interested the employees, and they responded at once.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r46","rowIndex":46,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうです」","en":"“Precisely.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r47","rowIndex":47,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なんだか、すごい効き目があるらしいですよ。前の<tips=45>ローズ</tips>みたいに、どんな重い症状も一回で消えてしまって、しかも、副作用がほとんどない」","en":"“They say it works incredibly well. Like the old <tips=45>Rose</tips>, a single dose makes even the most severe symptoms disappear—and it has almost no side effects.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r48","rowIndex":48,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そういう噂ですね。しかし、そんな薬があるとは、にわかには信じがたいです」","en":"“That is the rumor. Even so, it is difficult to believe that such a drug exists.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r49","rowIndex":49,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「もし、ちゃんと効果が認められたら、将来は病院で扱われたりもするんでしょうか？」","en":"“If its effectiveness is properly established, might hospitals eventually use it?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r50","rowIndex":50,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「効果が検証されて認可されれば病院でも扱えるでしょうが……まだそんな段階ではありません。都市伝説とされている薬ですから。そもそも、前の<tips=45>ローズ</tips>だって、未だに出所がよくわからない正体不明の薬なんですよ」","en":"“If its effects were verified and it received approval, hospitals could use it. But matters have not reached that stage. The drug is still regarded as an urban legend. For that matter, even the original <tips=45>Rose</tips> remains a mysterious substance of uncertain origin.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r51","rowIndex":51,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あれはひどかったですね。あれのせいで廃人になっちゃった知り合いが沢山います」","en":"“That one was terrible. I know many people who were reduced to wrecks by it.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r52","rowIndex":52,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そう言ってそばかすの職員は顔をしかめた。","en":"The freckled employee grimaced as she said it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r53","rowIndex":53,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「最初は、ネットでレシピが公開されたんですっけ？　誰が公開したか結局わからずじまいだったんですか」","en":"“Wasn’t its formula first posted online? Did they ever learn who published it?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r54","rowIndex":54,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうです。あれも不思議な事件でした」","en":"“No. That too was a strange affair.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r55","rowIndex":55,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その頃は私も<tips=45>ローズ</tips>を濫用した患者を診る機会が多く、それについて色々と調べたものだ。","en":"At the time, I often treated patients who had abused <tips=45>Rose</tips>, and I investigated the drug from various angles.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r56","rowIndex":56,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あれは肉体に及ぼす効果だけ見るとただの覚醒剤なんですよ。しかも極めて粗悪な。どう調べてもドーパミン作動性神経に対する作用しか確認出来ない。なのに、なぜか<tips=17>タイプB</tips>特有の症状がすっかり消えている。薬の出所どころか、作用機序の一切が不明なんです。ああいうものを作り出せるのは、まだ誰も解明出来ていない<tips=17>タイプB</tips>の秘密を解き明かした天才か、いくつもの研究グループを持ち、膨大な実験を行える機関でしょう。<tips=45>ローズ</tips>でさえも、本来ありえない薬なのですが、その改良版が存在してこのように流通しているだなんて……とても信じられませんね」","en":"“If one considers only its effects upon the body, it is merely a stimulant—and an exceptionally crude one. No matter how it is examined, nothing can be confirmed beyond its action on dopaminergic neurons. And yet, for some reason, the symptoms peculiar to <tips=17>Type B</tips> disappear completely. Not merely the drug’s origin, but its entire mechanism of action is unknown. Only a genius who had unraveled the still-unsolved secret of <tips=17>Type B</tips>, or an institution commanding numerous research groups and the resources to conduct experiments on an enormous scale, could create such a thing. Even <tips=45>Rose</tips> itself ought not to exist. That an improved version should now exist and circulate this way... I find it very difficult to believe.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r57","rowIndex":57,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あの、<tips=17>タイプB</tips>って、そんなに正体不明のものなんですか？　たしか、汚染された食べ物で<tips=72>傾向値</tips>があがったとかなんとか……」","en":"“Is <tips=17>Type B</tips> really that mysterious? I thought contaminated food raised a person’s <tips=72>tendency value</tips>, or something...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r58","rowIndex":58,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　色黒の職員はそう言って首を捻る。","en":"The dark-skinned employee tilted her head as she spoke.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r59","rowIndex":59,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=72>傾向値</tips>が高くなると発症するというのはあくまでも統計的な結論でしかなくて、そのメカニズムは不明です。目の色が変わったり、身体能力が向上したりするメカニズムは判明していません。実際は<tips=16>タイプA</tips>と同じくらい謎が多い現象です。私たちが行っているのは、理屈はともかく、過去の経験から効果がある治療をするというだけのものです。だから、この手の薬というものは実際の患者に投与してどうなったかというデータが非常に重要なんですよ。それを考えると『<tips=46>ネオ・ローズ</tips>』のような、データのわからないものが出回って、安易に人が用いているというのは、とても危険なんです」","en":"“The conclusion that symptoms manifest when the <tips=72>tendency value</tips> rises is purely statistical; the mechanism itself is unknown. Nor do we understand the mechanisms that change the color of the eyes or improve physical ability. In truth, it is a phenomenon with as many mysteries as <tips=16>Type A</tips>. Our treatments amount to using what past experience has shown to be effective, whether or not we understand the theory. That is why data showing what happens when this kind of drug is administered to actual patients are so important. In light of that, it is extremely dangerous for something like ‘<tips=46>Neo Rose</tips>,’ for which no data are available, to circulate and be used casually.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r60","rowIndex":60,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「やっぱり先生はあの薬を使うのには反対なんですね」","en":"“So you really are against people using that drug.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r61","rowIndex":61,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「症状が消える件については興味深いとは思いますし、それでしか解決方法がないと、人が飛びつく気持ちもわかります。しかし私の立場からすると、一時的に幻覚や妄想が消えても、それで身体を壊したり死んでしまっては意味がない」","en":"“I find its reported ability to eliminate the symptoms interesting, and I understand why people would seize upon it if it seemed their only recourse. From my position, however, there is no point in temporarily dispelling hallucinations and delusions if the treatment destroys the body or kills the patient.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r62","rowIndex":62,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「私は、もし発症したら、みっともない状態で生きているより、少しのあいだでも正気を取り戻してから死にたいかな」","en":"“If I developed symptoms, I think I’d rather regain my senses, even for a little while, and then die than go on living in a humiliating condition.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r63","rowIndex":63,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　色黒の職員が苦笑しながらそう言うと、","en":"The dark-skinned employee spoke with a rueful smile.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r64","rowIndex":64,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「私も」","en":"“So would I.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r65","rowIndex":65,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そばかすの職員も同意した。","en":"The freckled employee agreed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r66","rowIndex":66,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうですか。でも、毎日病院で患者と接している私としては、発症しても必ずしも不幸ではないと思うんですがね」","en":"“I see. Yet as someone who works with patients at the hospital every day, I do not believe that people who develop symptoms are necessarily unhappy.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r67","rowIndex":67,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私はそう言ったが、彼女たちは渋い顔をするだけで、納得しようとはしなかった。","en":"I said as much, but they merely looked displeased and showed no sign of being convinced.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r68","rowIndex":68,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　無理もないことだ。<tips=17>タイプB</tips>発症者のイメージは悪すぎる。","en":"It was understandable. The public image of symptomatic <tips=17>Type Bs</tips> was far too bleak.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r69","rowIndex":69,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"『<tips=46>ネオ・ローズ</tips>』は病院内でもよく話題になる。","en":"‘<tips=46>Neo Rose</tips>’ was also a frequent subject of conversation within the hospital.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r70","rowIndex":70,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　重篤な患者や、トラブルばかり引き起こす厄介な患者に試験的に投与してみたいと冗談で言う医者もいるが、実際には到底実施出来るものではない。この病院は様々な実験的な治療が行われている国内で最も先進的な施設の一つだが、街に出回っている出所不明の薬を臨床実験するほどの自由はない。","en":"Some doctors joked that they would like to administer it experimentally to severely ill patients, or to troublesome patients who caused one problem after another. In reality, such a thing was impossible. The hospital was one of the country’s most advanced facilities and conducted a variety of experimental treatments, but even it was not free to conduct clinical trials on a street drug of unknown origin.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r71","rowIndex":71,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しかし、多少の逸脱行為はある。ルールが守れない彼らに集団生活を安全に過ごさせるには必要な逸脱行為もあるし、職員の怠慢や差別意識から逸脱するケースもある。","en":"There were, however, minor departures from the rules. Some were necessary if people incapable of following rules were to live safely in a group; others arose from staff negligence or prejudice.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r72","rowIndex":72,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　前者は理想と現実の溝を埋めるために必要な場合もあるが、後者は悲惨なものだ。","en":"The former could sometimes be necessary to bridge the gulf between ideal and reality. The latter were appalling.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r73","rowIndex":73,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=17>タイプB</tips>患者の多くは、社会に復帰することも出来ず、塀の中で一生を過ごすことになっており、また知能が低下した患者の多くは理不尽を受け入れてしまって告発することも出来ない。言いなりになってしまう。","en":"Many <tips=17>Type B</tips> patients could never return to society and would spend their entire lives confined behind institutional walls. Many whose intelligence had declined simply accepted injustice and were incapable of reporting it. They did as they were told.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r74","rowIndex":74,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　この病院にはどちらの逸脱行為も存在する。どの病院でも<tips=17>タイプB</tips>を取り巻く環境はさほど変わらないだろう。","en":"Both kinds of violation existed in this hospital. The environment surrounding <tips=17>Type Bs</tips> was probably much the same in any hospital.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r75","rowIndex":75,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は他の医者がやっている治療には興味がなかった。業界ではそれなりに名の通った病院から、このような<tips=17>タイプB</tips>を専門に扱う病院に移ってきた私は変わり者のおちこぼれと見られていたが、それも都合が良かった。","en":"I had no interest in the treatments performed by other doctors. I had moved from a hospital of some standing within the profession to one specializing in <tips=17>Type Bs</tips>, and was regarded as an eccentric failure. That suited me as well.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r76","rowIndex":76,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　好奇心でたまに話しかけて来るものはいるにしろ、過度の干渉を受けないで済む。私は根本的に彼らと相容れないものを感じていたが、相手もそれを私に感じているようだった。","en":"Although someone occasionally approached me out of curiosity, I was spared excessive interference. I felt a fundamental incompatibility with them, and they appeared to feel the same toward me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r77","rowIndex":77,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　現在私は<tips=17>タイプB</tips>患者の精神というものにしか興味が持てない。街に出て子供たちを診察しているのは人が言うような慈善的な精神でもなんでもなく、より多くの患者に接したいという、一種のフィールドワークに過ぎない。そもそも、現在の医療では診察したところで気休め程度の治療しか施すことが出来ないのだ。","en":"At present, nothing interested me but the minds of <tips=17>Type B</tips> patients. My visits to children throughout the city arose from no spirit of charity, whatever people might say. They were merely a form of fieldwork driven by my desire to encounter more patients. In any event, all present-day medicine could offer after an examination was little more than token treatment.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r78","rowIndex":78,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　もっとも、私が訪問する施設の方でも、一応の訪問の趣旨である<tips=17>タイプB</tips>の診察よりも、風邪をひいたとか、下痢が止まらないとか、そんな用件で私を頼りにしているようであったが。","en":"For their part, however, the facilities I visited seemed to rely on me more for colds, persistent diarrhea, and the like than for the <tips=17>Type B</tips> examinations that were the ostensible purpose of my visits.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r79","rowIndex":79,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　なんだかとりとめがなくなってしまったが、最近のこの街の状況といえば、このようなものであろう。","en":"I have wandered somewhat from my subject, but this was, more or less, the city’s recent condition.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r80","rowIndex":80,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"『<tips=46>ネオ・ローズ</tips>』の流通と、<tips=21>八龍会</tips>による治安の悪化は、私にとっては重要なニュースであった。","en":"The circulation of ‘<tips=46>Neo Rose</tips>’ and the deterioration of public order brought about by the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips> were important developments to me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r81","rowIndex":81,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　病院での仕事は満足の行くものであり、街で患者を診るという行為も病院の仕事と同じくらい私にとって意味のある行為だった。ここ数年私の生活は充実している。","en":"My work at the hospital was satisfying, and examining patients in the city held as much meaning for me as the work I performed there. For the past several years, my life has been fulfilling.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r82","rowIndex":82,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　これらのニュースはこの私の生活を乱すおそれがあり、不安がかき立てられた。","en":"The possibility that these developments might disrupt that life filled me with anxiety.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r83","rowIndex":83,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　かつて<tips=3>クリス</tips>と共に裏社会の社交場に出入りしていたのはもう過去の話だ。私はもう覆面の『ドクター』ではないし、その事実を知るものはいない。今この街で動き始めようとしている暗いものには、極力目を背けて見ないようにしていた。","en":"The days when I accompanied <tips=3>Chris</tips> into underworld salons belonged to the past. I was no longer the masked ‘Doctor,’ and no one knew I had ever been that figure. I did everything possible to avert my eyes from the darkness now beginning to move within this city.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r84","rowIndex":84,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しかし、そんな私の過去の話を知る、数少ない人間とひょんなことから偶然再会することとなってしまった。","en":"Yet by pure chance, I found myself reunited with one of the few people who knew that part of my past.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r85","rowIndex":85,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それはいつものように、施設に診察に行った日のことだった。","en":"It happened on a day when I went, as usual, to examine patients at a facility.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r86","rowIndex":86,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その日も突然の雨が降り、私はしとどに濡れて施設の裏口から事務室のドアを叩いた。","en":"A sudden rain fell that day as well. Soaked through, I reached the facility’s back entrance and knocked on the office door.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r87","rowIndex":87,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「こんばんは。待っていたんですよ」","en":"“Good evening. I’ve been waiting for you.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"路地邦昭","displayName":"Kuniaki Roji","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r88","rowIndex":88,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　暗い顔でドアを開けてそう言ったのは、施設の職員ではなく、全く別の予想もしていない人物だった。","en":"The person who opened the door with a dark expression was not one of the facility employees, but someone else entirely—someone I had never expected.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r89","rowIndex":89,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=50>路地</tips>君……」","en":"“<tips=50>Roji</tips>...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r90","rowIndex":90,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そこにいたのは元探偵の<tips=50>路地邦昭</tips>だ。","en":"The man before me was <tips=50>Kuniaki Roji</tips>, formerly a detective.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r91","rowIndex":91,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　骨格の発達した長身を安物のジャケットで包み、襟元には下品な柄のシャツが覗いている。","en":"A cheap jacket covered his tall, big-boned frame, and a shirt with a vulgar pattern showed at the collar.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r92","rowIndex":92,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　無精ひげが生え、髪も乱雑で、なにやら異様な雰囲気だったが肌つやはよく健康面での問題はなさそうだった。その姿を見たとき、私は違和感を覚えたが、なんの違和感なのか判断がつかなかった。","en":"He was unshaven, with his hair in disarray, and carried a peculiar air. Yet his complexion was good, suggesting no problem with his physical health. At the sight of him, I felt that something was wrong, but could not determine what.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r93","rowIndex":93,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「訳あって、今はここに住んでいるんです」","en":"“Circumstances have obliged me to live here for the moment.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"路地邦昭","displayName":"Kuniaki Roji","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r94","rowIndex":94,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それは喜ばしいことです。この間までなんとかという殺人鬼を追っていたようですが、ああいったことはやめた方がいい」","en":"“That is welcome news. Until recently, you appeared to be pursuing some murderer or other. You would be better advised to abandon such things.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r95","rowIndex":95,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は上着を脱ぎ、鞄のなかからタオルを取り出すと、濡れた部分を拭った。","en":"I removed my coat, took a towel from my bag, and wiped the rain from myself.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r96","rowIndex":96,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いや、就職したわけじゃありません。ただ宿を借りているだけです。家には戻れない事情がありましてね。殺人鬼は、相変わらず追ってますよ。先生を待ってたのはその話もあるんです。でも一番重要な話はそれとは違うことだ」","en":"“I haven’t found employment here. They’re merely letting me stay. For certain reasons, I can’t go home. I’m still pursuing the murderer. Part of what I need to discuss with you concerns that. But the most important matter is something else.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"路地邦昭","displayName":"Kuniaki Roji","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r97","rowIndex":97,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼は真面目な顔でじっと私を見つめる。","en":"He looked steadily at me with a grave expression.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r98","rowIndex":98,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　いつもと雰囲気が違う。私の能力を知っている彼がこんなふうに視線をまっすぐ向けてくるのは不思議だし、それに、いつもふざけたような笑みを浮かべているのが常だからだ。","en":"Something about him felt different than usual. It was strange that, knowing about my ability, he should look directly at me this way; besides, he ordinarily wore a flippant smile.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r99","rowIndex":99,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　抜き差しならぬ用事があるのはすぐにわかったが、私は気づかぬふりをした。聞けば厄介ごとに巻き込まれるだけだろう。","en":"I immediately understood that his business was both serious and inescapable, but pretended not to notice. Hearing him out would only entangle me in trouble.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r100","rowIndex":100,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あなたの他にだれか職員はいませんか？　体調があまりよくないのに濡れてしまいました。風邪をひかぬうちに診察を済ませたいのです」","en":"“Is there another member of staff here? I am not in especially good health, and now I am wet. I would like to complete the examinations before I catch cold.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r101","rowIndex":101,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「今日はどうしても話をしてもらいますよ。いまとなっては、先生に訊ねるしかないんです」","en":"“You are going to speak with me today. Now there’s no one else I can ask.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"路地邦昭","displayName":"Kuniaki Roji","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r102","rowIndex":102,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は荷物を抱えると<tips=50>路地</tips>の言葉を背中で聞きながら廊下に出て、すぐ隣の小部屋に向かった。","en":"Clutching my things, I stepped into the corridor, ignoring <tips=50>Roji</tips> as he spoke behind me, and made for the small room next door.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r103","rowIndex":103,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　いつも診察に使わせてもらっている『面会室』と札のあるその部屋は、普段は施設の子供が親などの来客と会うときに用いている場所らしい。","en":"A sign marked the room as the ‘Visiting Room.’ I was always permitted to use it for examinations, though it ordinarily appeared to serve as a place for the children to meet parents and other visitors.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r104","rowIndex":104,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ドアの曇りガラスから明かりが漏れている。私が使うために準備をしてくれているのだろう。","en":"Light spilled through the frosted glass in the door. They had probably prepared the room for my use.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r105","rowIndex":105,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「先生」","en":"“Doctor.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r106","rowIndex":106,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=50>路地</tips>が呼びかける声を無視して、ドアを開ける。","en":"Ignoring <tips=50>Roji’s</tips> call, I opened the door.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r107","rowIndex":107,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ああ、もういらしていたんですね」","en":"“Oh, you’re here already.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐松子","displayName":"Matsuko Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r108","rowIndex":108,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　照明の光で満ちた明るい部屋には、見知った女性職員がいて、準備の手を止めて私の方を笑顔で振り返った。","en":"A female employee I recognized stood in the brightly lit room. She stopped her preparations and turned to me with a smile.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r109","rowIndex":109,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=55>シオ</tips>さん、すぐに子供を呼んで頂けませんか？」","en":"“<tips=55>Ms. Shio</tips>, would you bring in the children at once?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r110","rowIndex":110,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　部屋の奥に進んでいつもの机に荷物を置くと、<tips=50>路地</tips>も続けて部屋に入ってくる。","en":"I proceeded into the room and set my things on the customary desk. <tips=50>Roji</tips> followed me inside.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r111","rowIndex":111,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は顔を顰めて彼を振り返った。","en":"I turned back to him with a frown.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r112","rowIndex":112,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「しつこいですよ。私は……」","en":"“You are quite persistent. I...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r113","rowIndex":113,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「きっと、先生も興味がある話だと思いますよ」","en":"“I believe the subject will interest you too, Doctor.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"路地邦昭","displayName":"Kuniaki Roji","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r114","rowIndex":114,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=50>路地</tips>は私の言葉を遮ってそう言うと、机の上のペン立てに入っていたカッターナイフを手に取り、カチカチと音を鳴らして刃を出した。","en":"<tips=50>Roji</tips> cut me off with those words, then took a box cutter from the pen holder on the desk and extended the blade with several clicks.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r115","rowIndex":115,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　思い詰めたあまりそれで私を脅迫でもするのかと思ったが、そうではなかった。","en":"For a moment, I thought desperation had driven him to threaten me with it. That was not his intention.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r116","rowIndex":116,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼はシャツの袖をめくると、明かりの下に太い血管の浮かんだ手首を出して、ナイフの先端ですっと傷をつけたのである。たちまち傷にそって小さな血の塊がふくれあがる。","en":"He rolled up his sleeve, extended a thick-veined wrist beneath the light, and drew the point of the blade across it. A small bead of blood immediately swelled along the cut.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r117","rowIndex":117,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「見てください。ほんの表面を切っただけですが、確かに傷をつけましたよね？」","en":"“Look closely. It was only a shallow cut, but you saw me make it, didn’t you?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"路地邦昭","displayName":"Kuniaki Roji","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r118","rowIndex":118,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「一体何を……」","en":"“What in the world are you...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r119","rowIndex":119,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「気がおかしくなったわけじゃありません。先生がその気になるものをお見せしようというだけです。……まあ、そこの椅子におかけになってくつろいでくださいよ。二、三分はかかりますからね」","en":"“I haven’t lost my mind. I’m merely going to show you something that will convince you to listen. ...Have a seat and make yourself comfortable. It will take two or three minutes.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"路地邦昭","displayName":"Kuniaki Roji","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r120","rowIndex":120,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして彼はようやくいつもの薄笑いを浮かべる。","en":"Then, at last, he gave his usual thin smile.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r121","rowIndex":121,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　不審ではあったが、彼が何を見せようとしているのか気になったのも事実だ。彼の言う通り、私は椅子に腰掛ける。","en":"Suspicious though I was, I did wish to know what he intended to show me. As he suggested, I sat in the chair.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r122","rowIndex":122,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=55>シオ</tips>さん、どうしてこんな男をここに住まわせているのですか？　こんな施設には到底似つかわしくない人間ですよ」","en":"“<tips=55>Ms. Shio</tips>, why are you allowing a man like this to live here? He could hardly be less suited to such a facility.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r123","rowIndex":123,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は部屋の隅で居心地悪そうに様子を見守っている職員にそう尋ねた。","en":"I asked the employee, who had been watching uncomfortably from one corner of the room.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r124","rowIndex":124,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いえ、私がここに運んでもらったんです。普通のお医者様に診せたら、きっと騒ぎになってしまいますから」","en":"“I’m the one who had him brought here. If I took him to an ordinary doctor, it would certainly cause an uproar.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐松子","displayName":"Matsuko Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r125","rowIndex":125,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女は申し訳なさそうに言った。","en":"She spoke apologetically.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r126","rowIndex":126,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　どうも彼女も事情を知っているようだ。どういうことなのだろう？　","en":"Apparently, she knew the circumstances as well. What could this mean?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r127","rowIndex":127,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　いくらなんでも不審であった。私はそっと彼女の目を見る。すると、彼女の感情が私の心に流れ込む。","en":"The situation was far too suspicious. I quietly met her eyes. Then her emotions flowed into my mind.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r128","rowIndex":128,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女の心にあるのは、どうも不思議な感情だ。胸が息苦しく、とても緊張している。<tips=50>路地</tips>が話そうとしていることは、彼女にとってもそんなに重要な事柄なのだろうか？","en":"What I found in her was strange. My chest grew tight, and I felt an intense tension. Was the subject <tips=50>Roji</tips> meant to discuss truly so important to her as well?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r129","rowIndex":129,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私はすぐに目をそらして、じっと考える。","en":"I immediately averted my eyes and considered the matter in silence.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r130","rowIndex":130,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「もういいでしょう。先生、この傷口をよく見てください」","en":"“That should be long enough. Doctor, look carefully at this cut.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"路地邦昭","displayName":"Kuniaki Roji","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r131","rowIndex":131,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=50>路地</tips>はそう言って、今切ったばかりの腕を私の目の前に差し出す。血液のたまは思ったより大きくなっておらず腕にへばりついたままだが、しかしだからといって何か特別な変化が見てとれるわけではなかった。","en":"<tips=50>Roji</tips> held the arm he had just cut directly before my eyes. The bead of blood had grown less than I expected and still clung to the skin. That alone, however, revealed no special change.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r132","rowIndex":132,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「何もおかしなことはありませんよ」","en":"“There is nothing unusual.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r133","rowIndex":133,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それが、実はとてもおかしなことが起きているんですよ」","en":"“In fact, something very unusual is happening.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"路地邦昭","displayName":"Kuniaki Roji","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r134","rowIndex":134,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=50>路地</tips>はハンカチを取り出すと、それで傷口を拭った。それも血液をふき取るだけの優しい拭い方ではなく、指に巻き付けてゴシゴシと腕を擦るのである。","en":"<tips=50>Roji</tips> took out a handkerchief and wiped the cut. He did not gently dab away the blood, but wound the cloth around his finger and scrubbed the skin.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r135","rowIndex":135,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ほら、見てください」","en":"“There. Look.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"路地邦昭","displayName":"Kuniaki Roji","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r136","rowIndex":136,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして拭い終わった腕をまた私の前に差し出した。","en":"When he had finished, he held the arm out before me again.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r137","rowIndex":137,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ふむ」","en":"“Hmm.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r138","rowIndex":138,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼の腕は乱暴にやりすぎて少し赤くなっていたが、血液は完全に除去されている。","en":"His rough scrubbing had reddened the arm slightly, but he had wiped away every trace of blood.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r139","rowIndex":139,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　やはり特におかしなことは起きていない。そう彼に告げようとして、私は気がついた。","en":"Again, nothing appeared unusual. I was about to tell him so when I noticed it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r140","rowIndex":140,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　あれだけ雑に拭ったのなら、すぐに新しい血液が傷口から滲み出てこなくてはおかしいのだ。しかし、いくら待ってもそのような気配がない。","en":"After such careless wiping, fresh blood should immediately have welled from the cut. However long I waited, there was no sign of it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r141","rowIndex":141,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ちょっと、いいですか」","en":"“May I?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r142","rowIndex":142,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は彼の腕に触れて指先で皮膚を確かめた。","en":"I touched his arm and examined the skin with my fingertips.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r143","rowIndex":143,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　やはりそうだ。さっきカッターで切ったばかりの傷が、どこにも見当たらなくなっている。","en":"It was as I thought. The cut he had made with the blade moments earlier could no longer be found anywhere.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r144","rowIndex":144,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「おかしいでしょう？　もう治ってるんですよ。確かに小さな傷ですが、こんなわずかな時間で跡形もなく消えるってのは、医学的常識からはかけ離れているんじゃありませんか？」","en":"“Strange, isn’t it? It’s already healed. The cut was small, certainly, but for it to vanish without a trace so quickly goes against everything medicine tells us, doesn’t it?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"路地邦昭","displayName":"Kuniaki Roji","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r145","rowIndex":145,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は黙ったまま、彼の腕を離した。","en":"Without a word, I released his arm.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r146","rowIndex":146,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「こんな小さな傷だけじゃない。首を切ったって死なねえんだ。こんな人間ありえるんですかねえ？」","en":"“And it isn’t only little cuts like this. Even if someone slits my throat, I don’t die. Can a person like that exist?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"路地邦昭","displayName":"Kuniaki Roji","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r147","rowIndex":147,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼がそう言ったとき、その後ろの職員がなぜか表情を曇らせてうなだれた。","en":"When he said it, the employee behind him lowered her head, her expression clouding for some reason.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r148","rowIndex":148,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「しかも、ただ不死身になっただけじゃない……」","en":"“And immortality isn’t the only change...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"路地邦昭","displayName":"Kuniaki Roji","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r149","rowIndex":149,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=50>路地</tips>は俯くと、目に手を当ててまぶたに何かをした。","en":"<tips=50>Roji</tips> lowered his head, put a hand to his eye, and did something to his eyelid.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r150","rowIndex":150,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして手をどけると、その下の瞳が金色に輝いている。さっきの部屋が暗かったので不覚にも気がつかなかったが、この目を見てからあらためて観察すると、彼の身体には<tips=17>タイプB</tips>特有の変化があらわれていた。","en":"When he removed his hand, the iris beneath it shone gold. The previous room had been dark, and to my chagrin I had failed to notice. Now that I had seen the eye, however, a fresh examination revealed changes peculiar to <tips=17>Type B</tips> throughout his body.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r151","rowIndex":151,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　いつの間に<tips=17>タイプB</tips>になってしまったのだろう？　前はそんな様子はなかったはずなのに。","en":"When had he become <tips=17>Type B</tips>? He had shown no signs of it before.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r152","rowIndex":152,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「金色になったままなおらないんだ。しかし、幻覚もなにも見えないから発症したわけでもない。体調は至って健康だ。いやむしろ健康すぎるくらいだ。五感は前よりはっきりしているし、筋力や反射神経も向上した。そして回復力はご覧の通りだ。<tips=17>タイプB</tips>は<tips=17>タイプB</tips>のようだが、普通とはちょっと違う。……先生、あなたは専門家だ。しかも、ただ専門家というだけじゃない。こういう性質に心当たりがあるんじゃないですか？」","en":"“The eye turned gold and never changed back. But I haven’t seen any hallucinations or anything, so this isn’t the usual onset. I’m in perfect health—too healthy, if anything. My five senses are sharper than before, and both my strength and reflexes have improved. And you can see how quickly I heal. I appear to be <tips=17>Type B</tips>, but I’m not quite an ordinary <tips=17>Type B</tips>. ...You’re an expert, Doctor, and not merely an expert. Don’t these traits sound familiar to you?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"路地邦昭","displayName":"Kuniaki Roji","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r153","rowIndex":153,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その金色の目を見てしまったせいで、瞬間的に、<tips=50>路地</tips>の張り詰めた感情が私のなかに入り込む。","en":"The moment I looked into that golden eye, <tips=50>Roji’s</tips> taut emotions entered me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r154","rowIndex":154,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　すぐにまぶたを閉じて自分の感情を整えてから、","en":"I immediately closed my eyes and composed my own feelings before answering.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r155","rowIndex":155,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「予想通り、ろくでもない話をしようとしているようですね」","en":"“As I expected, you intend to tell me something thoroughly unpleasant.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r156","rowIndex":156,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は溜息をつき、","en":"I sighed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r157","rowIndex":157,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=55>シオ</tips>さん。子供を呼んできてください。いますぐ診察を開始します」","en":"“<tips=55>Ms. Shio</tips>, bring in the children. I will begin the examinations now.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r158","rowIndex":158,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「先生、これはどうしても……」","en":"“Doctor, this is something you must...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"路地邦昭","displayName":"Kuniaki Roji","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r159","rowIndex":159,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=50>路地</tips>は食い下がろうとする。","en":"<tips=50>Roji</tips> tried to press the issue.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r160","rowIndex":160,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あなたの話は、診察が終わってからゆっくりと聞きます。それまで待っていてください」","en":"“Once the examinations are over, I will hear everything you have to say. Wait until then.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r161","rowIndex":161,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私が言うと、<tips=50>路地</tips>は安堵したように大きく溜息をついた。","en":"At that, <tips=50>Roji</tips> let out a great sigh of relief.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r162","rowIndex":162,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして診察が始まった。","en":"Then the examinations began.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r163","rowIndex":163,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　最近少し冷えているせいか、風邪気味の子供が多かった。私はそれぞれの症状にあわせてアセトアミノフェンやセフロキサジンを処方した。内科は専門外だが病院でも患者の体調が悪いと何でも診察させられるため、普段やっていることとあまり変わりはない。","en":"Perhaps because the weather had recently turned colder, many of the children showed signs of a cold. I prescribed acetaminophen or cefroxadine according to their symptoms. Internal medicine was outside my specialty, but at the hospital I was obliged to examine patients for any decline in their condition, so the work differed little from my ordinary duties.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r164","rowIndex":164,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　発症しはじめた<tips=17>タイプB</tips>の子供たちの進行を定期的にチェックしているが、特に変化はみられなかった。幼いうちに発症してしまうとその分症状も深刻なものになりやすく、たとえば七才で発症したとしたらその半分くらいが十五才時には病院などの施設でなければ生活出来ないような状態になっている。","en":"I regularly monitored the progression of the <tips=17>Type B</tips> children whose symptoms had begun to manifest, but observed no particular changes. The younger a child was at onset, the more severe the symptoms tended to become. Of those who developed symptoms at seven, for example, roughly half would by fifteen be unable to live anywhere but a hospital or similar institution.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r165","rowIndex":165,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　子供たちは重い運命を背負っており、本人たちもそれを知っているはずだがみな明るい。","en":"The children bore a heavy fate, and surely knew it themselves. Yet all of them were cheerful.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r166","rowIndex":166,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　職員の<tips=55>シオ</tips>は部屋のなかで子供に付き添い、<tips=50>路地</tips>は部屋の外で他の職員と共に診察予定の子供たちを待たせていた。","en":"<tips=55>Ms. Shio</tips> remained in the room with each child. Together with the other employees, <tips=50>Roji</tips> kept the children awaiting examination outside the room.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r167","rowIndex":167,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　時折廊下から子供の元気のいい笑い声が聞こえてくる。どうやら<tips=50>路地</tips>が冗談を言ったりからかって子供たちを笑わせているようだ。職員とも親しげに会話を交わしている。彼のような男がこの場で受け入れられているのは意外だった。","en":"Now and then, a child’s energetic laughter sounded from the corridor. Apparently, <tips=50>Roji</tips> was making jokes and teasing them. He conversed easily with the employees as well. I had not expected a man like him to be accepted here.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r168","rowIndex":168,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=50>路地</tips>君は、さっきはあんなに深刻そうにしていたのに、今は子供とふざけあっているようですね」","en":"“<tips=50>Roji</tips> seemed so grave a moment ago, yet now he appears to be joking around with the children.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r169","rowIndex":169,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　診察が終わった子供を部屋から出したあとに私が言うと、<tips=55>シオ</tips>は笑って、","en":"I made the observation after sending an examined child from the room. <tips=55>Ms. Shio</tips> laughed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r170","rowIndex":170,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「結構子供好きで、よく遊んで下さってるんですよ。子供の方も『ツノのおじちゃん』なんて言って、懐いています」","en":"“He rather likes children and often plays with them. They’re fond of him too. They call him ‘Uncle Horns.’”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐松子","displayName":"Matsuko Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r171","rowIndex":171,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ふむ」","en":"“Hmm.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r172","rowIndex":172,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「先生と<tips=50>路地</tips>さんは、古くからのつき合いなんですか？」","en":"“Have you and <tips=50>Mr. Roji</tips> known each other long?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐松子","displayName":"Matsuko Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r173","rowIndex":173,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「昔に仕事上の都合で一度会ったことがあって、それから時々街で顔を合わせる程度です。つきあいという程のものはありません」","en":"“We met once through work long ago, and since then have occasionally encountered each other in the city. It amounts to no real association.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r174","rowIndex":174,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうなんですか。お仕事で、ということは<tips=50>路地</tips>さんが病気か何かになったんでしょうか」","en":"“I see. Since you met through work, was <tips=50>Mr. Roji</tips> ill in some way?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐松子","displayName":"Matsuko Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r175","rowIndex":175,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いえ、そういうわけではないのですが」","en":"“No, that was not the nature of it.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r176","rowIndex":176,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女はどの程度事情を知っているのだろう？","en":"How much did she know of the circumstances?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r177","rowIndex":177,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　思えば彼女については前から不審に思っていたのだ。身体にはあきらかに<tips=17>タイプB</tips>の特徴が強く出ているのに、会話をしていてもそれらしい症状が全く見られない。","en":"When I considered it, I had long regarded her with suspicion. Her body plainly displayed pronounced <tips=17>Type B</tips> traits, yet in conversation, she showed none of the corresponding symptoms.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r178","rowIndex":178,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それはちょうど、さっきの<tips=50>路地</tips>と同じように。そして思い返してみると、昔に<tips=18>ローズ・クラブ</tips>で見た三日月の女たちにも同じような特徴があったのだ。当時の私は<tips=17>タイプB</tips>は専門外だったので気づくことが出来なかったが、経験を積んだ今の知識と照らし合わせると、ただ<tips=17>タイプB</tips>だとわかるだけではなく、普通の<tips=17>タイプB</tips>ともどこか違うようにも感じられる。","en":"It was just like <tips=50>Roji</tips> a moment ago. And when I thought back, the Crescents I had seen at the <tips=18>Rose Club</tips> long ago had shared the same characteristics. At the time, <tips=17>Type B</tips> lay outside my specialty, so I failed to notice. But measured against the knowledge experience has since given me, I can do more than identify them as <tips=17>Type B</tips>: they also seem somehow different from ordinary <tips=17>Type Bs</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r179","rowIndex":179,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「もしかして、あなたも<tips=50>路地</tips>君と同じなのではないですか？」","en":"“Could you be the same as <tips=50>Roji</tips>?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r180","rowIndex":180,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は思いきってそう訊ねてみた。そうとしか、思えないのだ。","en":"I ventured to ask. No other explanation seemed possible.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r181","rowIndex":181,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女は少し間を置いてから、複雑に笑った。","en":"She paused for a moment, then gave a complex smile.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r182","rowIndex":182,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「実は、そうなんです。親しい人しか知りませんが」","en":"“In fact, I am. Only those close to me know.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐松子","displayName":"Matsuko Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r183","rowIndex":183,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうですか。その話も、あとで詳しく伺います」","en":"“I see. I would like to hear the details of that later as well.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r184","rowIndex":184,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして私たちは次の子供を迎え入れた。","en":"Then we showed the next child in.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r185","rowIndex":185,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　一通りの診察が済むと、<tips=55>シオ</tips>以外の職員は自分が今夜担当している階に戻ってゆく。そうして誰もいなくなったのを確認してから、再び<tips=50>路地</tips>を部屋に迎え入れる。","en":"Once I had completed the examinations, every employee but <tips=55>Ms. Shio</tips> returned to the floor assigned to them that night. After confirming that no one else remained, we invited <tips=50>Roji</tips> back into the room.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r186","rowIndex":186,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　外の雨は強さを増して、窓ガラスを叩きつける水滴の音が強くなっていた。","en":"The rain outside had grown stronger, and the beat of drops against the window intensified.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r187","rowIndex":187,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=55>シオ</tips>は大きな急須にお茶を汲み、三つの湯飲みに注いでいた。","en":"<tips=55>Ms. Shio</tips> prepared a large pot of tea and poured it into three cups.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r188","rowIndex":188,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「さて、まず何から話しましょうか」","en":"“Now, where should we begin?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"路地邦昭","displayName":"Kuniaki Roji","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r189","rowIndex":189,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=50>路地</tips>は乾いてひび割れた唇をしきりに擦りながら言った。","en":"<tips=50>Roji</tips> spoke while repeatedly rubbing his dry, cracked lips.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r190","rowIndex":190,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「身体が変化した経緯を教えてくれませんか？」","en":"“Would you tell me how your body came to change?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r191","rowIndex":191,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「わかりました」","en":"“All right.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"路地邦昭","displayName":"Kuniaki Roji","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r192","rowIndex":192,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼は頷き、そしてゆっくりと話し始めた。","en":"He nodded and slowly began to speak.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r193","rowIndex":193,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「この間街角で会った時にお話しした通り、おれは連続殺人犯を追っていましてね……」","en":"“As I mentioned when we met on the street recently, I’ve been pursuing a serial killer...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"路地邦昭","displayName":"Kuniaki Roji","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r194","rowIndex":194,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼が調査していたのは、女ばかりを狙い、遺体をバラバラに損壊するという犯罪者だった。","en":"According to Roji, the criminal under investigation targeted only women and mutilated their bodies by cutting them to pieces.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r195","rowIndex":195,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その人物は最初にロシアで逮捕されたが、そこの刑務所を脱獄して以降は、どこで犯罪をしても捕まることなく、世界のあちこちの街で若い女を殺し続けている。それが、最近この街にやって来た。","en":"He said the man had first been arrested in Russia. Since escaping from prison there, he had continued to kill young women in cities throughout the world without being captured, no matter where he committed his crimes. Recently, he had come to this city.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r196","rowIndex":196,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「サイキック能力を使って警察の手を免れているということで、おれはサイキック専門の刑事と組んで調べていたんです。<tips=48>堂島</tips>って知ってますか？　あの犬の頭をした」","en":"“The theory was that he used psychic abilities to evade the police, so I investigated with a detective who specialized in psychic cases. Do you know <tips=48>Dojima</tips>? The one with the dog’s head?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"路地邦昭","displayName":"Kuniaki Roji","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r197","rowIndex":197,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「街で見かけたことはありますね」","en":"“I have seen him around the city.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r198","rowIndex":198,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それでおれは調査をしていたんですが、しくじってしまった」","en":"“So I kept digging, but I screwed up.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"路地邦昭","displayName":"Kuniaki Roji","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r199","rowIndex":199,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=50>路地</tips>は酒場で会った女に<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>のことを話してしまったのだと言う。そうしたら、その相手が<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>と繋がっていた。","en":"<tips=50>Roji</tips> said he had ended up telling a woman he met in a bar about <tips=20>Koschei</tips>, only for her to turn out to have ties to <tips=20>Koschei</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r200","rowIndex":200,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　結果、自分が<tips=50>路地</tips>に調査されていることを知った<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>は、逆に<tips=50>路地</tips>について調べようとでもしたのか、彼が恋人と暮らすアパートにやって来た。<tips=48>堂島</tips>と<tips=50>路地</tips>が足を踏み入れた時にはその恋人はすでに殺された後だったと言う。","en":"As a result, <tips=20>Koschei</tips> learned that <tips=50>Roji</tips> was investigating him. Perhaps hoping to investigate <tips=50>Roji</tips> in return, Koschei came to the apartment Roji shared with his lover. According to Roji, by the time <tips=48>Dojima</tips> and <tips=50>Roji</tips> entered, she had already been killed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r201","rowIndex":201,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そこで<tips=48>堂島</tips>刑事がやつを銃で撃ったんですよ。確かに急所に当たったはずだが、やつは死ななかった。……あとで調べたのですが、<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>ってのはスラヴ神話に出て来る不死身の怪物みたいですな。ロシア出身だから、そう名付けられたんでしょう。とんでもないやつですよ。さらに、不死身なだけでなく、どうもあいつにはサイキック能力があるらしいんだ」","en":"“Detective <tips=48>Dojima</tips> shot him then. I’m certain the bullet struck a vital point, but he didn’t die. ...I looked the name up afterward. <tips=20>Koschei</tips> is apparently an immortal monster from Slavic mythology. Since the man is Russian, I suppose that’s why he was given the name. He’s one hell of a monster. And as if being immortal weren’t enough, he appears to possess a psychic ability.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"路地邦昭","displayName":"Kuniaki Roji","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r202","rowIndex":202,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ほう、どんな能力ですか？」","en":"“Indeed? What sort of ability?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r203","rowIndex":203,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「『変身』です。性別も年齢も体格も人種も、なにもかもまったくべつの人間に姿を変えるのですよ」","en":"“Transformation. He can change everything about his appearance—sex, age, build, race—and become a completely different person.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"路地邦昭","displayName":"Kuniaki Roji","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r204","rowIndex":204,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「随分と非常識な能力ですね。本当にそんなことが出来るのなら、また科学者の頭痛の種が増えます」","en":"“That ability certainly defies all common sense. If such a thing is truly possible, it will give scientists one more headache.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r205","rowIndex":205,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「確定じゃないですがね。状況からするとほぼ間違いないでしょう。別の姿に変身し、おそらく臭いなども変化する。何もかも別人になるんです。やっかいなもんですよ。……で、とにかく、あいつは致命傷を負いながらも蘇って、そこにやって来た<tips=86>灰上姉妹</tips>と一緒に<tips=48>堂島</tips>刑事を殺して逃げていったんです」","en":"“It isn’t certain, but under the circumstances, there can be very little doubt. He transforms into another form, and his scent probably changes as well. He becomes an entirely different person in every respect. He’s a real problem. ...In any case, although he had suffered a fatal wound, he came back to life. Then he and the <tips=86>Haigami sisters</tips>, who arrived at the apartment, killed Detective <tips=48>Dojima</tips> and escaped.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"路地邦昭","displayName":"Kuniaki Roji","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r206","rowIndex":206,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「はいがみ？」","en":"“Haigami?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r207","rowIndex":207,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「サイキックの双子ですよ。<tips=13>溝平B団地</tips>で犯罪者どもに囲われているガキです。どういうわけか、あいつが<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>とつるんでましてね」","en":"“A pair of psychic twins. Children kept by the criminals of the <tips=13>Mizohira B Housing Complex</tips>. For some reason, they’ve taken up with <tips=20>Koschei</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"路地邦昭","displayName":"Kuniaki Roji","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r208","rowIndex":208,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その後別の刑事と組んで調査を続行していた<tips=50>路地</tips>は、<tips=86>灰上姉妹</tips>の襲撃にあって、ナイフで首を切り裂かれたのだと言う。","en":"<tips=50>Roji</tips> said that he continued the investigation with another detective, only to be attacked by the <tips=86>Haigami sisters</tips> and have his throat cut open with a knife.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r209","rowIndex":209,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「やられた時点で致命傷なのはわかりました。そこでぶっ倒れていたおれのところに駆けつけたのが、ここにいるお嬢さんってわけです」","en":"“The instant they got me, I knew the wound was fatal. This young lady here was the one who came running to me as I lay there.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"路地邦昭","displayName":"Kuniaki Roji","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r210","rowIndex":210,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=50>路地</tips>は顎をしゃくって<tips=55>シオ</tips>の方を示した。","en":"<tips=50>Roji</tips> indicated <tips=55>Ms. Shio</tips> with a jerk of his chin.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r211","rowIndex":211,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「こちらのお嬢さんは<tips=55>汐松子</tips>って言う名前で……あの<tips=70>シオクリーン</tips>のご令嬢だそうです。これは言っても良かったんだったね？」","en":"“This young lady’s name is <tips=55>Matsuko Shio</tips>... Apparently she’s the daughter of the president of <tips=70>Shio Clean</tips>. It was all right to mention that, wasn’t it?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"路地邦昭","displayName":"Kuniaki Roji","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r212","rowIndex":212,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「かまいません。私が<tips=50>路地</tips>さんにお話ししたことはすべて話してくださって結構です」","en":"“I don’t mind. You may tell him everything I told you, <tips=50>Mr. Roji</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐松子","displayName":"Matsuko Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r213","rowIndex":213,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=55>シオ</tips>は頷いてそう言う。","en":"<tips=55>Ms. Shio</tips> nodded as she spoke.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r214","rowIndex":214,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ありがとう。……それで、このお嬢さんがね、自分の手を切っておれに血を飲ませたんですよ。そこでおれの記憶は一旦途切れて、次に気がついたのは、ここのベッドだった。行き倒れた子供とかを保護するための部屋があって、<tips=55>汐さん</tips>が職員に連絡してそこに運び込んだんです」","en":"“Thank you. ...So this young lady cut her own hand and made me drink her blood. My memory breaks off there. The next thing I knew, I was in a bed here. They have a room for taking in children who collapse in the street. <tips=55>Ms. Shio</tips> contacted the staff, and they carried me there.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"路地邦昭","displayName":"Kuniaki Roji","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r215","rowIndex":215,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「時々、家がない大人の方とかも保護したりしていたんです。だから、きっと受け入れてくれると思って……。ちゃんと傷口は隠して、そのあたりは誤魔化したんです」","en":"“Sometimes we shelter homeless adults as well. I thought they would surely take him in... I made sure the wound was hidden and glossed over the rest.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐松子","displayName":"Matsuko Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r216","rowIndex":216,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=55>シオ</tips>がそう補足する。","en":"<tips=55>Ms. Shio</tips> added.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r217","rowIndex":217,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「おれはここでは空腹でぶっ倒れたホームレスということになっています」","en":"“Here, I’m supposed to be a homeless man who collapsed from hunger.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"路地邦昭","displayName":"Kuniaki Roji","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r218","rowIndex":218,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=50>路地</tips>は苦笑して、","en":"<tips=50>Roji</tips> smiled wryly.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r219","rowIndex":219,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「点滴を打たれていましたが、治療というほどのものは必要じゃなかった。切り裂かれた首はもうくっついていて、その時点ではもう古傷みたいな感じになっていました。今はもう全然跡形もないでしょう？　おれはさっぱりわけがわからない。そこで、<tips=50><tips=55>汐さん</tips></tips>を捕まえて尋ねたんですよ。一体これは、どういうことなのかと……このあたりは、本人が話した方がいいでしょうね」","en":"“They had me on an IV, but I hadn’t needed anything that could really be called treatment. The slash across my throat had already closed, and by then it looked like an old scar. Now, as you can see, there isn’t a trace left. I had no idea what was happening, so I caught <tips=50><tips=55>Ms. Shio</tips></tips> and demanded an explanation... She should probably tell you this part herself.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"路地邦昭","displayName":"Kuniaki Roji","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r220","rowIndex":220,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=50>路地</tips>が目配せをすると<tips=55>シオ</tips>は頷き、その続きを語る。","en":"<tips=50>Roji</tips> glanced at <tips=55>Ms. Shio</tips>. She nodded and continued the account.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r221","rowIndex":221,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「傷口から直接血を飲ませたり、肉を切り取って与えたりしたら、相手が私と同じような死なない身体になる可能性があると聞いてはいたんです。……ただ確実ではないようですし、やったこともありませんでした。でも、<tips=50>路地</tips>さんが死にかかっているのを見てもしかしたらこれで助かるかもしれないと、無我夢中になってしまって……軽率だったかもしれませんが」","en":"“I had been told that if I made someone drink blood directly from a wound, or cut off a piece of my flesh and fed it to them, there was a possibility that their body would become deathless like mine. ...It did not appear to be certain, and I had never tried it. But when I saw <tips=50>Mr. Roji</tips> dying, I became desperate, thinking it might save him... Perhaps it was reckless.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐松子","displayName":"Matsuko Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r222","rowIndex":222,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「おかげでこうして生きている。感謝してるよ」","en":"“Thanks to you, I’m alive. I’m grateful.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"路地邦昭","displayName":"Kuniaki Roji","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r223","rowIndex":223,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=50>路地</tips>が言うのに<tips=55>シオ</tips>はどこか申し訳なさそうな、複雑な視線をチラと送ってから、","en":"At <tips=50>Roji’s</tips> words, <tips=55>Ms. Shio</tips> gave him a brief, complex glance that seemed almost apologetic.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r224","rowIndex":224,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それで助かった<tips=50>路地</tips>さんから詳しい話を聞いて、驚きました。私もその<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>という犯罪者に会ったことがあるんです」","en":"“Once <tips=50>Mr. Roji</tips> recovered, I heard the details from him and was astonished. I have met the criminal called <tips=20>Koschei</tips> as well.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐松子","displayName":"Matsuko Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r225","rowIndex":225,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>がこの街で起こした二番目の殺人事件の被害者は、ここの職員で、<tips=55>汐さん</tips>の同僚だったんですよ。無断欠席をしていた被害者の様子を見に行ったところで、やつと鉢合わせしたんです」","en":"“The victim of the second murder <tips=20>Koschei</tips> committed in this city worked here. When she failed to turn up for work, her colleague, <tips=55>Ms. Shio</tips>, went to check on her and ran into him.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"路地邦昭","displayName":"Kuniaki Roji","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r226","rowIndex":226,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……その時彼は<tips=64>アレクセイ</tips>と名乗っていて、バラバラにされた遺体を見せられました。彼は私たちも殺すつもりだったんです。そこで、一緒にいた同僚を逃がして私が時間稼ぎに残りました。私なら、死ぬことはありませんから」","en":"“...At the time, he called himself <tips=64>Alexei</tips>, and he showed me the dismembered body. He intended to kill us too. I let the colleague who was with me escape and remained behind to delay him. After all, I cannot die.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐松子","displayName":"Matsuko Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r227","rowIndex":227,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして彼女は殺そうとする<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>にあらがったのだと言う。<tips=17>タイプB</tips>として身体能力に優れている彼女は銃を持ち出した相手にも一方的にやられることはなかった。","en":"She said that she had resisted <tips=20>Koschei</tips> when he tried to kill her. Thanks to her superior <tips=17>Type B</tips> physical abilities, even when he drew a gun, he could not simply overpower her.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r228","rowIndex":228,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「見かけによらず勇敢なお嬢さんで、それどころか相手を傷つけたんだそうですぜ。おれなんかよりよほど強い」","en":"“The young lady is braver than she looks. More than that, she apparently injured him. She’s considerably stronger than I am.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"路地邦昭","displayName":"Kuniaki Roji","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r229","rowIndex":229,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=50>路地</tips>はそう言って肩をすくめる。","en":"<tips=50>Roji</tips> shrugged as he said it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r230","rowIndex":230,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そしてお互いに身体を傷つけあって、それぞれの身体に異様な再生能力があると気がついたところで、警察が突入し、<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>は逃走したのだそうだ。","en":"They apparently wounded each other and discovered that each possessed extraordinary regenerative powers. At that point, the police stormed in, and <tips=20>Koschei</tips> escaped.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r231","rowIndex":231,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「私と同じようなちからがある人は彼が初めてでしたし、それが世界的な犯罪者ということも<tips=50>路地</tips>さんに聞いて、これはどういうことだろうと思って……」","en":"“He was the first person I had ever met with a power like mine. Then <tips=50>Mr. Roji</tips> told me he was an international criminal. I began to wonder what it meant...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐松子","displayName":"Matsuko Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r232","rowIndex":232,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=55>シオ</tips>の表情にはさほど感情の変化がなかったが、ほんの少しだけ眉をひそめた。","en":"<tips=55>Ms. Shio’s</tips> expression changed little, but she frowned ever so slightly.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r233","rowIndex":233,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼らの話を聞きながら、私は十五年前のことを思い出していた。まさか、今になってこんな話を聞くことになるとは夢にも思わなかった。すべてはあの時に完全に終わったのだと思い込んでいた。","en":"As I listened to them, I remembered the events of fifteen years ago. I had never dreamed I would hear such a story after all this time. I had convinced myself that everything had ended completely that day.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r234","rowIndex":234,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しかし、よく考えれば、様々な可能性が残されていて当然だ。終わった気になっていたのは、単に、私個人が『あの死』によって関わる理由を失ったからだろう。","en":"Yet upon reflection, it was only natural that any number of possibilities should have remained. I had imagined it was over simply because ‘that death’ deprived me personally of any reason to remain involved.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r235","rowIndex":235,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=55>シオ</tips>さん。あなたはどうしてそうなったんですか？　生まれつきですか？　それとも、誰かの血液を飲んだんですか？」","en":"“<tips=55>Ms. Shio</tips>, how did you come to be that way? Were you born that way? Or did you drink someone else’s blood?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r236","rowIndex":236,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私はざわざわとする胸騒ぎを抑えつつ、そう質問をしてみた。","en":"I asked, struggling to suppress the restless foreboding in my chest.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r237","rowIndex":237,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「わかりません。少なくとも、発見されたときには、私はもう今のような壊れない身体でした」","en":"“I don’t know. At the very least, my body was already indestructible when I was found.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐松子","displayName":"Matsuko Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r238","rowIndex":238,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「発見されたとき？」","en":"“When you were found?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r239","rowIndex":239,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「はい」","en":"“Yes.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐松子","displayName":"Matsuko Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r240","rowIndex":240,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=55>シオ</tips>は頷き、","en":"<tips=55>Ms. Shio</tips> nodded.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r241","rowIndex":241,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「私は<tips=18>ローズ・クラブ</tips>に捨てられた、動く肉片だったんです。それを、ゴミ処理の契約を結んでいた<tips=70>シオクリーン</tips>の社長の<tips=54>汐健慈朗</tips>が拾って培養し、育て、今の私にしました。<tips=55>汐松子</tips>というのは後になって彼がつけた名前です」","en":"“I was a moving scrap of flesh discarded at <tips=18>Rose Club</tips>. <tips=54>Kenjiro Shio</tips>, the president of <tips=70>Shio Clean</tips>, had a contract to remove its waste. He found me, cultured and raised me, and made me what I am now. <tips=55>Matsuko Shio</tips> is the name he gave me afterward.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐松子","displayName":"Matsuko Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r242","rowIndex":242,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女は冷静だったが、私はそうは行かなかった。","en":"She remained calm. I could not.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r243","rowIndex":243,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=18>ローズ・クラブ</tips>の名を聞いた途端、目眩がした。やはりそうだったか。そこと繋がってしまうのか。血がざわざわとするのを感じる。こんな感情の高ぶりは、いつ以来だったか思い出せない。","en":"The instant I heard the name <tips=18>Rose Club</tips>, I became dizzy. So I had been right after all. It did lead back to that place. I felt my blood begin to stir. I could not remember the last time I had felt such a surge of emotion.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r244","rowIndex":244,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それを聞いておれはピンと来たんですよ。いつだったか、記事になっていたでしょう？　<tips=18>ローズ・クラブ</tips>で殺人ショーが行われていたって。記事が出た当時はただのでっちあげかと思っていましたが、もしそこに本当に切り刻んでも死なない人間がいたのだとしたら、充分あり得る話だ。<tips=55>汐さん</tips>に聞いたら、彼女もその噂は気にしていたと言う。だとしたら、<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>とも何か関係があるのかもしれない。そう思ったんです」","en":"“The moment I heard that, it clicked. There was an article once, wasn’t there? It claimed <tips=18>Rose Club</tips> had been putting on murder shows. When it appeared, I thought the whole thing was fabricated. But if they really did have people who could be cut to pieces without dying, the story becomes entirely plausible. When I asked <tips=55>Ms. Shio</tips>, she said the rumor had troubled her as well. That was when it occurred to me that there might be some connection to <tips=20>Koschei</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"路地邦昭","displayName":"Kuniaki Roji","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r245","rowIndex":245,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=50>路地</tips>の目はらんらんと輝きはじめている。","en":"<tips=50>Roji’s</tips> eyes began to shine with excitement.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r246","rowIndex":246,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それで能力を使って、警察のデータを調べたんですがね、そこには何の記録も残っていなかった。普通の記録とは別の場所に保管してあるんでしょう。まあ、当然でしょうね。<tips=18>ローズ・クラブ</tips>の事件は警察にとってもタブーですから。そしておれは、当時<tips=18>ローズ・クラブ</tips>と密接に関わり、しかも医学的知識もある一人の人物を思い出したってわけです。……それが先生、あなたなんですよ」","en":"“So I used my ability to search the police records, but there was no trace of it. The files must be kept somewhere apart from the ordinary records. Naturally enough—the <tips=18>Rose Club</tips> affair is taboo even within the police. Then I remembered someone who had been closely involved with <tips=18>Rose Club</tips> at the time and also had medical knowledge. ...That someone was you, Doctor.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"路地邦昭","displayName":"Kuniaki Roji","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r247","rowIndex":247,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は内心のざわめきを鎮めつつ、溜息をついた。","en":"I sighed, trying to still the turmoil inside me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r248","rowIndex":248,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「きみの事情はわかりました。それで、何を聞きたいんですか？」","en":"“I understand your circumstances. What is it you wish to ask?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r249","rowIndex":249,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まず一つ目は、当時の<tips=18>ローズ・クラブ</tips>にそのような人間はいたのかということです。つまり、けして死ぬことがない女ですよ」","en":"“My first question is whether there was such a person at <tips=18>Rose Club</tips> in those days. A woman who could never die.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"路地邦昭","displayName":"Kuniaki Roji","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r250","rowIndex":250,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「その答えはイエスです。切っても焼いても死なない女には三日月のかたちをした刺青がつけられ、特別なサービスを行っていました」","en":"“The answer is yes. Women who could survive cutting and burning were marked with crescent-shaped tattoos and used to provide special services.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r251","rowIndex":251,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「やっぱりね。……<tips=55>汐さん</tips>、あんたには三日月の刺青はあるかい？」","en":"“Just as I thought. ...<tips=55>Ms. Shio</tips>, do you have a crescent tattoo?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"路地邦昭","displayName":"Kuniaki Roji","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r252","rowIndex":252,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いえ、ありません。私は見つかったとき、本当に小さな肉片でしたから……」","en":"“No. When I was found, I truly was no more than a tiny scrap of flesh...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐松子","displayName":"Matsuko Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r253","rowIndex":253,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=55>シオ</tips>は首を左右に振る。","en":"<tips=55>Ms. Shio</tips> shook her head.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r254","rowIndex":254,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ふむ。……とりあえず、私から情報を補足すると、さっきから『死ぬことがない』と表現していますが、それは事実とは違います。三日月がついた女たちは、絶対死ななかったというわけではありません。特殊な薬を使うと、三日月マークでも死んでしまいます。<tips=18>ローズ・クラブ</tips>襲撃の日、私はマークのついた人間ばかりが大量に殺されている部屋を見ました。そこには三日月マークをつけられた女や男が死んでいて、我々は生存者を発見することが出来ませんでした」","en":"“Hmm. ...For the moment, let me add one thing. You have been saying they ‘cannot die,’ but that is not strictly true. The women marked with crescents were not absolutely immortal. A special drug could kill even someone bearing the crescent mark. On the day <tips=18>Rose Club</tips> was attacked, I saw a room filled with the bodies of people who bore it. Women and men marked with crescents lay dead there, and we found no survivors.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r255","rowIndex":255,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私がそう言うと、<tips=55>シオ</tips>が驚きの表情を浮かべる。","en":"At this, surprise crossed <tips=55>Ms. Shio’s</tips> face.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r256","rowIndex":256,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=50>路地</tips>は腕組みをしてうんうんと頷き、","en":"<tips=50>Roji</tips> folded his arms and nodded repeatedly.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r257","rowIndex":257,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なるほど、きっと『三日月』をクラブの外に出したくなかったから殺したんでしょうね。……しかし、殺す薬があるとは驚きですね。完全な不死身ではないってことなら、おれも気をつけなくてはいけないな……」","en":"“I see. They must have killed them because they did not want any ‘Crescents’ leaving the club. ...Still, I am surprised there is a drug that can kill them. If that means the immortality is not absolute, I will have to be careful myself...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"路地邦昭","displayName":"Kuniaki Roji","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r258","rowIndex":258,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「『三日月』たちは、儀式として女の血を飲まされることで不死身になっていたようです。おそらくこの血を分け与えていた女も不死だったのでしょう。彼女は重要な情報を知っていそうですが、襲撃の時も、そのあとも、彼女の話は聞きませんね」","en":"“The ‘Crescents’ apparently became immortal through a ritual in which they were made to drink a woman’s blood. The woman who gave them that blood was probably immortal herself. She seems likely to have known something important, but I heard nothing of her during the attack or afterward.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r259","rowIndex":259,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「女ね……その女も<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>と深い関わりがあるんでしょうかね？」","en":"“A woman... Do you suppose she too had a deep connection to <tips=20>Koschei</tips>?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"路地邦昭","displayName":"Kuniaki Roji","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r260","rowIndex":260,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それは私にはわかりません。当時はそのような名前も聞いたことがありません」","en":"“That I cannot tell you. I never heard that name in those days.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r261","rowIndex":261,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうですか。……<tips=50><tips=55>汐さん</tips></tips>も、そこで血を飲まされていたのかな」","en":"“I see. ...Perhaps they made <tips=50><tips=55>Ms. Shio</tips></tips> drink the blood there too.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"路地邦昭","displayName":"Kuniaki Roji","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r262","rowIndex":262,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=50>路地</tips>のつぶやきに、<tips=55>シオ</tips>は何も言わずに唇を結んでいる。","en":"At <tips=50>Roji’s</tips> murmured remark, <tips=55>Ms. Shio</tips> pressed her lips together and said nothing.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r263","rowIndex":263,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まあ、それはわかりました。次の質問をさせて貰います。……ちょっと、煙草が吸いたいな。この部屋は禁煙だったかい？」","en":"“All right, I understand. Let me ask my next question. ...Though I could use a cigarette first. Is this a non-smoking room?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"路地邦昭","displayName":"Kuniaki Roji","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r264","rowIndex":264,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=50>路地</tips>の言葉に<tips=55>シオ</tips>は頷く。","en":"<tips=55>Ms. Shio</tips> nodded at <tips=50>Roji’s</tips> question.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r265","rowIndex":265,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そりゃそうか。我慢するとしよう。いや、少し興奮してしまいましてね。落ち着きたかったんだ」","en":"“I suppose it would be. I’ll have to go without. I got a little worked up and wanted something to calm me down.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"路地邦昭","displayName":"Kuniaki Roji","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r266","rowIndex":266,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=50>路地</tips>は苦笑する。","en":"<tips=50>Roji</tips> smiled wryly.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r267","rowIndex":267,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「その、血を分けていたという女について、詳しい情報はありませんか？」","en":"“Do you have any detailed information about the woman who shared her blood?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"路地邦昭","displayName":"Kuniaki Roji","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r268","rowIndex":268,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「見かけはアジア人で日本語を喋れたようですが」","en":"“She appeared Asian and apparently spoke Japanese.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r269","rowIndex":269,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「他には？」","en":"“Anything else?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"路地邦昭","displayName":"Kuniaki Roji","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r270","rowIndex":270,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ないですね。当時我々はその女を重要人物とは考えてはいませんでしたから、何も調べていません。襲撃当日に死んだかどうか、その場に居たかどうかさえわかりません」","en":"“Nothing. At the time, we did not consider the woman important, so we never investigated her. I do not even know whether she died on the day of the attack, or whether she was there at all.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r271","rowIndex":271,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうでしょうね。しかし、その女のことがわかれば、正解に近づけそうな気がするんですよ。おれにとっては、<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>の正体が、そしてこちらの<tips=55>汐さん</tips>にとっては自分の出生の秘密が、はっきりしそうな気がするんです」","en":"“I expected as much. Still, I have a feeling that learning more about this woman would bring us closer to the truth. It might reveal <tips=20>Koschei’s</tips> true identity to me—and to <tips=55>Ms. Shio</tips>, the secret of her own origins.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"路地邦昭","displayName":"Kuniaki Roji","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r272","rowIndex":272,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=50>路地</tips>は無精ひげの生えた頬を指先で触れながら、","en":"<tips=50>Roji</tips> stroked his stubbled cheek with his fingertips.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r273","rowIndex":273,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「貴重な情報に感謝します。……それで、もう一つ先生にお願いがあるんですが」","en":"“Thank you for the valuable information. I have one more request to make of you, Doctor.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"路地邦昭","displayName":"Kuniaki Roji","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r274","rowIndex":274,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「何ですか？」","en":"“What is it?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r275","rowIndex":275,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「おれはこれからも警察と連携をとりながら<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>の調査を行います。先生にも、協力して頂きたいんです」","en":"“I intend to continue investigating <tips=20>Koschei</tips> in cooperation with the police. I would like your assistance as well.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"路地邦昭","displayName":"Kuniaki Roji","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r276","rowIndex":276,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=50>路地</tips>の言葉に、私は溜息をつく。","en":"I sighed at <tips=50>Roji’s</tips> words.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r277","rowIndex":277,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「勿論、警察には話を通して、先生の今の身分には影響が出ないようにします。これは先生にとってもかなりメリットがある話だと思いますよ。ご存じないかもしれませんが、先生のプロフィールは警察に詳しく記録され、要注意人物としてリストアップされています。いま協力しておいたほうが、後々安泰だと思いますよ。あいつらは、いつも最悪のタイミングで情報を使いますからね」","en":"“Naturally, I’ll clear it with the police and make sure your present position isn’t affected. I think this arrangement has considerable advantages for you as well. You may not know it, but the police have a detailed file on you and have placed you on their watch list. You’ll be safer in the long run if you cooperate now. They always choose the worst possible moment to use the information they have.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"路地邦昭","displayName":"Kuniaki Roji","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r278","rowIndex":278,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=50>路地</tips>は私の能力を恐れずに、じっと目を見つめてくる。その目を見て彼の感情に同化したらおかしなことを言ってしまう可能性がある。私の方が目をそらし、無言でいることで拒否の意をあらわにした。","en":"Unafraid of my ability, <tips=50>Roji</tips> stared directly into my eyes. If I allowed myself to become absorbed in his emotions, I might say something strange. I was the one who looked away, making my refusal plain by remaining silent.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r279","rowIndex":279,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「先生は、<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>と並ぶ<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>の立役者でもあります。<tips=18>ローズ・クラブ</tips>について調べるとなれば、<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>の人間と関わることになるでしょうし、そのためにどうしてもご助力を願いたいんです」","en":"“Doctor, you were one of the driving forces behind <tips=7>YS</tips>, alongside <tips=3>Chris Tse</tips>. If we’re to investigate the <tips=18>Rose Club</tips>, we’ll inevitably have to deal with people in <tips=7>YS</tips>, so I absolutely need your help.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"路地邦昭","displayName":"Kuniaki Roji","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r280","rowIndex":280,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=50>路地</tips>君、私はいまの生活に満足している。連続殺人犯には興味がないし、裏社会と関わりたくもない」","en":"“<tips=50>Roji</tips>, I am satisfied with my present life. Serial killers do not interest me, and I have no desire to become involved with the underworld.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r281","rowIndex":281,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「先生、じゃあ十五年前はなんで関わったんですか？　<tips=18>ローズ・クラブ</tips>を潰す理由があったんでしょう？」","en":"“Then why did you get involved fifteen years ago, Doctor? You must have had some reason to bring down <tips=18>Rose Club</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"路地邦昭","displayName":"Kuniaki Roji","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r282","rowIndex":282,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私はそれに答えず、ただ肩をすくめて見せた。","en":"I did not answer. I merely shrugged.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r283","rowIndex":283,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「しつこいと思われるでしょうが、引き下がりませんよ。おれは絶対にあの野郎への復讐を果たします」","en":"“You probably think I’m being a nuisance, but I’m not backing down. I will have my revenge on that bastard.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"路地邦昭","displayName":"Kuniaki Roji","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r284","rowIndex":284,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=50>路地</tips>は言葉に怒りをにじませ、膝の上の手を握りしめた。","en":"Anger crept into <tips=50>Roji’s</tips> voice, and he clenched the hand resting on his knee.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r285","rowIndex":285,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「大事な人間を失って憤る気持ちはわかります。でも、復讐などしたところで生き返るわけではありません」","en":"“I understand the rage that comes with losing someone dear to you. But revenge will not bring the dead back to life.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r286","rowIndex":286,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「先生にはわからないのでしょうね。おれは女が殺されたんだ。それから友人も。あいつを殺さなければ気が済まない」","en":"“Perhaps you can’t understand. The woman I loved was killed. Then my friend. I can’t rest until I’ve killed him.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"路地邦昭","displayName":"Kuniaki Roji","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r287","rowIndex":287,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「気持ちがわかるかどうかはともかく、確かに私ならそんな風には考えませんね。殺したところで意味がない」","en":"“Whether or not I understand the feeling, I certainly would not think that way. Killing him would accomplish nothing.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r288","rowIndex":288,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=18>ローズ・クラブ</tips>にはまだ明らかにされていない謎がある。<tips=50>路地</tips>と共に調査すれば、<tips=52>ミアオ</tips>がなぜあのように死ななくてはいけなかったのか、わかるかもしれない。","en":"<tips=18>Rose Club</tips> still held mysteries that had never come to light. If I investigated with <tips=50>Roji</tips>, perhaps I would learn why <tips=52>Miao</tips> had been forced to die as she did.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r289","rowIndex":289,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それを知りたいという気持ちもなくはなかったが、けれども、その事を考えると悲しみと虚しさの方が上回る。そう、今さら何かを知ったところで、もう全ては去ってしまったことなのだ。先ほどの胸騒ぎは、ただの気の迷いのようなものだ。","en":"It was not that I felt no desire to know. But whenever I thought of it, grief and emptiness outweighed that desire. Yes—whatever I might learn now, it had all long since passed away. The foreboding I had felt a moment ago must have been nothing more than a momentary lapse.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r290","rowIndex":290,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>を憎んでいるわけじゃないんです。憎んでいるのは、自分の間抜けさ加減でしてね……。殺したってどうにもならないのはわかっているんです。でもやらなきゃいけない。心がそれを求めているんだ。先生、復讐ってのは果たされるべきものなんですよ。よく憎しみの連鎖がどうのという馬鹿がいるが、それは必要なことなんだ。血は血でしか洗い落とせない」","en":"“It isn’t <tips=20>Koschei</tips> I hate. I hate my own damned stupidity. ...I know killing him won’t change anything. But I have to do it. My heart demands it. Doctor, revenge is something that must be carried out. Fools prattle about cycles of hatred, but that cycle is necessary. Blood can only be washed away with blood.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"路地邦昭","displayName":"Kuniaki Roji","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r291","rowIndex":291,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「きみがそう考えるのは自由です。しかし私に押しつけるのは間違っている」","en":"“You are free to think that way. But you are wrong to impose it on me.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r292","rowIndex":292,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私はそう言って首を左右に振って、さらに続けた。","en":"I said this, shook my head, and continued.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r293","rowIndex":293,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=16>タイプA</tips>というものの存在が認知されると、これまで我々が築き上げてきた科学理論というものが根本的に崩れ去ってしまいました。人間の意志や考えだけで、触れてもいないものが動いたり、壁の向こうが見通せたりなんて、あまりにもふざけた話です。そんなものあり得るはずがないんですよ。ただ、夢のなかでならそういうことも起こる」","en":"“Once the existence of <tips=16>Type As</tips> became recognized, the scientific theories we had built collapsed at their very foundations. The idea that human will or thought alone can move an untouched object or see beyond a wall is far too absurd. Such things simply cannot exist. They can happen in dreams, however.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r294","rowIndex":294,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……今のこの世の中は夢が脳内に留まらずに現実にはみ出しています。世界を構成するルールが狂ってしまったのか……あるいは最初からルールなんかなくて、たまたま紛らわしい振る舞いをしていただけなのか……とにかく、こんなでたらめな世界で起こる色々なことにいちいち振り回されていても仕方がありません。受け入れることです。そして必要なものだけを追い求めるべきです」","en":"“...In the present world, dreams no longer remain inside the brain. They spill out into reality. Perhaps the rules that constitute the world have gone mad. Or perhaps there were never any rules, and things merely happened to behave in a deceptively orderly fashion. In any case, there is no use letting each event in such a preposterous world toss you about. You must accept it—and pursue only what you need.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r295","rowIndex":295,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=50>路地</tips>は私の言葉に顔を顰める。","en":"<tips=50>Roji</tips> frowned at my words.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r296","rowIndex":296,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は気にせず続ける。","en":"Ignoring his reaction, I continued.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r297","rowIndex":297,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「知ってますか？　人間は音も光もにおいも、何もない場所に置くと一時間もしないうちに精神が不調を来し、やがてありもしない音が聞こえ、ありもしないものが見えて来るんです。その幻覚や幻聴は、本来自分の内側にあったものの筈なのに、本人を酷く苦しませるんですよ。世界というものは、この闇のなかにうかんだまぼろしのようなものなのだと、最近は思いますね」","en":"“Do you know what happens when a person is placed somewhere devoid of sound, light, scent—of any sensation at all? Within an hour, the mind begins to falter. Before long, they hear sounds that do not exist and see things that are not there. Those hallucinations must originally have lain within them, yet they cause the person terrible suffering. Lately, I have come to think that the world itself is something like a phantom floating in the darkness.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r298","rowIndex":298,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「先生はすっかり世捨て人になってしまった」","en":"“You’ve become a complete recluse, Doctor.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"路地邦昭","displayName":"Kuniaki Roji","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r299","rowIndex":299,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=50>路地</tips>はそう吐き捨てた。","en":"<tips=50>Roji</tips> spat the words.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r300","rowIndex":300,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「とんでもない。捨てたどころか、とても興味をもっています。だから、こんな風に<tips=17>タイプB</tips>の心を見て回っているんです。みながおっしゃるような慈善事業ではなくて、私のためにやっているんです。唯心論のように聞こえるかも知れませんが、少し違います。彼らの心にあるものも、確固とした現実だというのが私の最新の考え方です」","en":"“On the contrary. Far from abandoning the world, I take an intense interest in it. That is why I travel from place to place looking into the minds of <tips=17>Type B</tips> individuals. This is not the charitable work everyone makes it out to be. I do it for my own sake. It may sound like philosophical idealism, but it is not quite the same. My latest view is that what exists within their minds is itself an incontrovertible reality.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r301","rowIndex":301,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「先生、その言い方じゃだれも理解出来ないよ。だれも共感は出来ない」","en":"“Put it that way and no one will understand you, Doctor. No one will be able to relate.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"路地邦昭","displayName":"Kuniaki Roji","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r302","rowIndex":302,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=50>路地</tips>は呆れたように首を振る。","en":"<tips=50>Roji</tips> shook his head in evident exasperation.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r303","rowIndex":303,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は上着をひっかけ、杖と鞄を掴むと椅子を立ち上がった。","en":"I threw on my coat, took up my cane and bag, and rose from the chair.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r304","rowIndex":304,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「もう遅くなりました。今日は帰ります」","en":"“It is getting late. I will be going home now.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r305","rowIndex":305,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=50>路地</tips>は何も言わず、もう私のほうに視線も向けようとはせずに椅子に座っていた。","en":"<tips=50>Roji</tips> said nothing. He remained seated and would not even look in my direction.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r306","rowIndex":306,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=55>シオ</tips>は立ち上がって私のためにドアを開いてくれる。","en":"<tips=55>Ms. Shio</tips> stood and opened the door for me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r307","rowIndex":307,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「今日はありがとうございました。帰りはこれをお使いください」","en":"“Thank you for today. Please use this on your way home.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐松子","displayName":"Matsuko Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r308","rowIndex":308,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女は傘を差し出してくれる。私はカバンを肩に掛けてからそれを受け取った。","en":"She held out an umbrella. I slung my bag over my shoulder, then accepted it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r309","rowIndex":309,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ありがとう。あなたは気を強く持ちなさい」","en":"“Thank you. You must stay strong.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r310","rowIndex":310,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私はそう言って廊下に出てから、振り向かぬまま背後の<tips=50>路地</tips>に向かって言った。","en":"I stepped into the corridor, then addressed <tips=50>Roji</tips> behind me without turning.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r311","rowIndex":311,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「当時の<tips=18>ローズ・クラブ</tips>について詳しい話を聞きたいのなら、<tips=31>エリー・ホワイト</tips>に会いなさい。もし話を渋るようなら私の名前を出して『<tips=32>アサヒ</tips>について知りたい』と言えば、通じるでしょう」","en":"“If you want a detailed account of <tips=18>Rose Club</tips> in those days, go and see <tips=31>Ellie White</tips>. If she is reluctant to speak, give her my name and say, ‘I want to know about <tips=32>Asahi</tips>.’ She will understand.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C3:r312","rowIndex":312,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして歩き始めると後ろで<tips=50>路地</tips>が立ち上がる物音が聞こえたが、私は立ち止まりも振り返りもせずにそのまま歩き続けた。","en":"I started down the corridor. Behind me, I heard <tips=50>Roji</tips> rise to his feet, but I neither stopped nor looked back. I simply kept walking.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}}]},{"position":35,"code":"F4","unitId":"F4","rows":[{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r1","rowIndex":1,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「懲りもせずによくやるもんだ」","en":"“You’d think they’d learn, but they just keep coming.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r2","rowIndex":2,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=14>深沢</tips>は足もとの死体を爪先で蹴った。","en":"<tips=14>Fukazawa</tips> prodded the body at his feet with the toe of his shoe.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r3","rowIndex":3,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　死体は先日「<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>を抜けて逃げて来た」と言ってこの団地にやって来た男だ。","en":"The body belonged to a man who had arrived at the housing complex a few days earlier, claiming to have “fled <tips=7>YS</tips> and escaped here.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r4","rowIndex":4,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　この団地はそういった理由で街にいられなくなった者も積極的に受け入れている。そういった人間には一室が与えられ、リーダー格である<tips=14>深沢</tips>が経歴や能力に応じて適当な仕事を割り振ることになっていた。","en":"The complex made a point of accepting people who could no longer remain in the city for reasons of that kind. They were given rooms, and <tips=14>Fukazawa</tips>, its de facto leader, assigned each of them suitable work according to their background and abilities.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r5","rowIndex":5,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　仕事の内容は誘拐や殺人から金持ちの家のトイレ掃除まで幅広く、街のギャングとなるべく競合しないようなものが選ばれている。","en":"The jobs ranged from kidnapping and murder to cleaning toilets in wealthy homes, and were chosen to avoid competing with the city’s gangs wherever possible.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r6","rowIndex":6,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　男は射撃や格闘技の心得があるということで、ボディーガードとして取引などの護衛を命じられることとなったが、組織に入ってすぐ、警察と連絡をとっているのが発覚した。","en":"The man claimed to know his way around guns and hand-to-hand combat, so he was assigned to serve as a bodyguard, providing security for deals and the like. Soon after he joined the organization, however, it came to light that he was in contact with the police.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r7","rowIndex":7,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　目が見えないかわりに耳がいい、ウォーリーという<tips=17>タイプB</tips>の青年がその超人的な聴覚で、普通なら誰も聞くことが出来ない通話の声を聞いたのだ。裏付けのための調査を行うと、男の正体は警察が団地に送り込んだ潜入捜査員だとわかった。","en":"A blind young <tips=17>Type B</tips> named Wally, whose keen hearing compensated for his lack of sight, had used that superhuman sense to overhear the caller’s voice—something no ordinary person could have heard. An investigation to verify his suspicions revealed that the man was an undercover officer planted in the housing complex by the police.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r8","rowIndex":8,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=14>深沢</tips>は呼び出して薬を打ち、暴行を加え、その目的を白状させたあとに銃で殺した。","en":"<tips=14>Fukazawa</tips> summoned him, injected him with a drug, beat him until he confessed his purpose, and then shot him dead.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r9","rowIndex":9,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　死体は防護服を着た若いものたちが<tips=8>グレートホール</tips>に運んでいって、その深淵に投げ込むことになっている。<tips=9>Y地区</tips>で殺人が行われたときによく使われる処理方法だ。","en":"Some of the younger men, dressed in protective suits, were to carry the body to the <tips=8>Great Hole</tips> and cast it into the depths. It was a method of disposal commonly used after murders in <tips=9>Y District</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r10","rowIndex":10,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=8>グレートホール</tips>の付近は汚染されていて、よほど汚染状況に詳しくなければ防護服を着ていても危険を伴い、例えば<tips=70>シオクリーン</tips>の<tips=54>汐健慈朗</tips>ほどの知識がなければ何度も行って帰るのは自殺行為に近い。一度きりならば健康に影響が出る可能性は低いとは言え、それでも何の影響も出ないとは言いきれない。しかし、金のためにリスクを冒すものは多い。","en":"The area around the <tips=8>Great Hole</tips> was contaminated, and even a protective suit could not make it safe for anyone unfamiliar with the conditions there. Without knowledge comparable to that of <tips=54>Kenjiro Shio</tips>, the president of <tips=70>Shio Clean</tips>, making the trip repeatedly would be nearly suicidal. A single visit was unlikely to damage one’s health, though even that carried no guarantee. Plenty of people were willing to run the risk for money all the same.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r11","rowIndex":11,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=14>深沢</tips>が札束を握って呼びかけると、集まった若い者の半分くらいが「はい」「はい」と大きな声を出して手を挙げた。彼らはいつも酒や女や薬を買う金に困っている。","en":"When <tips=14>Fukazawa</tips> called out with a wad of bills in his hand, about half the young people who had gathered raised their hands and shouted, “Me! Me!” They were always short of money for liquor, women, and drugs.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r12","rowIndex":12,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「随分と執念深いもんだな」","en":"“They’re awfully persistent.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r13","rowIndex":13,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=14>深沢</tips>は銃を上着の下のホルスターに戻し、笑った。","en":"<tips=14>Fukazawa</tips> returned the gun to the holster beneath his jacket and laughed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r14","rowIndex":14,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　捜査員の目的は私たちだった。警察は『<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>』つまり<tips=64>アレクセイ</tips>を探し求めており、その手がかりとして私たちを監視するために捜査員を送り込んだらしい。","en":"We had been the agent’s target. The police were hunting for “<tips=20>Koschei</tips>”—<tips=64>Alexei</tips>, that is—and had apparently planted the man in the complex to watch us for any lead to him.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r15","rowIndex":15,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　最後に<tips=64>アレクセイ</tips>と別れてから二ヶ月、連絡さえとりあっていないのに、ご苦労なことだ。","en":"How very diligent of them, considering that we had parted ways with <tips=64>Alexei</tips> two months ago and had not exchanged so much as a message since.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r16","rowIndex":16,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　今、私たちは学校へは行かず、団地の仕事を手伝っていた。","en":"At this point, we no longer went to school and instead helped with work around the housing complex.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r17","rowIndex":17,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちの本意ではなかった。出来ればこの団地から出たかったし、能力を使えばいくらでも生きてゆく自信はある。だけれど、みなが引き留めるのだ。一度強引に出ようとしたら、<tips=14>深沢</tips>が土下座をした。","en":"It was not what we wanted. We would have left the housing complex if we could, and with our abilities, we were confident we could survive perfectly well on our own. But everyone kept trying to stop us. Once, when we tried to leave by force, <tips=14>Fukazawa</tips> threw himself to the ground before us.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r18","rowIndex":18,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どうか、ここを出て行かないでくれ。おれの一生の頼みだ」","en":"“Please, don’t leave this place. It’s the one favor I’ll ever ask of you.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"深沢聡","displayName":"Satoshi Fukazawa","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r19","rowIndex":19,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちはうんざりしていた。","en":"We were sick of it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r20","rowIndex":20,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そんな格好して情けないと思わないの？」","en":"“Have you no dignity, groveling like that?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r21","rowIndex":21,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「こっちが恥ずかしい。顔を上げてよ」","en":"“You’re embarrassing us. Lift your head.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r22","rowIndex":22,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちは交互に言った。","en":"We said these things in turn.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r23","rowIndex":23,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「頼む！」","en":"“I’m begging you!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"深沢聡","displayName":"Satoshi Fukazawa","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r24","rowIndex":24,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=14>深沢</tips>は顔を上げない。","en":"<tips=14>Fukazawa</tips> did not raise his head.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r25","rowIndex":25,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いや」","en":"“No.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r26","rowIndex":26,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「絶対いや」","en":"“Absolutely not.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r27","rowIndex":27,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちは<tips=14>深沢</tips>をそこに置いて、立ち去ろうとする。","en":"Leaving <tips=14>Fukazawa</tips> where he was, we turned to go.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r28","rowIndex":28,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そこをなんとか！」","en":"“Please, reconsider!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"深沢聡","displayName":"Satoshi Fukazawa","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r29","rowIndex":29,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ぎゃーっ！」","en":"“Eek!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r30","rowIndex":30,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「変態！」","en":"“Pervert!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r31","rowIndex":31,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=14>深沢</tips>が急に立ち上がり、すがりついて来たので、私たちはその顔をひっぱたいて、背中を踏んづけて、他人に行動を縛られるくらいなら死んだほうがマシだと言ったけれど、彼は痣だらけになったままもう一度土下座を続けた。","en":"<tips=14>Fukazawa</tips> suddenly sprang to his feet and clung to us. We slapped his face, stomped on his back, and told him we would rather die than let someone else control our actions. Battered and covered in bruises, he simply went back to prostrating himself.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r32","rowIndex":32,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「はあ」","en":"“Jeez.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r33","rowIndex":33,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「頭おかしい」","en":"“He’s insane.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r34","rowIndex":34,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちは顔を見合わせて溜息をついた。","en":"We looked at each other and sighed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r35","rowIndex":35,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そうして結局ここにいることになった。","en":"And that was how we ended up staying.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r36","rowIndex":36,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　何もしないのは退屈なので、私たちは何か仕事はないかと聞いた。","en":"Doing nothing was boring, so we asked if there was any work for us.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r37","rowIndex":37,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　すると<tips=14>深沢</tips>は、自分の仕事を手伝うよう言った。","en":"At that, <tips=14>Fukazawa</tips> told us to help him with his own work.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r38","rowIndex":38,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その仕事は<tips=14>深沢</tips>が集めてきた仕事を、団地の住人たちに分配するというものだ。","en":"That work consisted of distributing the jobs <tips=14>Fukazawa</tips> brought in among the residents of the housing complex.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r39","rowIndex":39,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちは断った。そんな仕事をすることになれば、団地のなかにこもりっきりになってしまう。","en":"We refused. Taking that job would leave us cooped up inside the housing complex all the time.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r40","rowIndex":40,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちはここではなく、街に出て面白いことをしたかった。","en":"We wanted to go out into the city and do something interesting, not stay here.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r41","rowIndex":41,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「おまえたちはここで、おれの仕事を覚えるんだ。そして悪のエリートに育ててやる」","en":"“You’ll stay here and learn my work. I’ll raise you into the elite of evil.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"深沢聡","displayName":"Satoshi Fukazawa","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r42","rowIndex":42,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=14>深沢</tips>はニヤリとかっこつけて笑ってから、","en":"<tips=14>Fukazawa</tips> put on a rakish grin.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r43","rowIndex":43,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「本当は、まっとうに学校行って欲しかったんだがな……」","en":"“Though to tell you the truth, I wanted you to go to school properly and lead respectable lives...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"深沢聡","displayName":"Satoshi Fukazawa","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r44","rowIndex":44,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　と付け加えた。","en":"he added.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r45","rowIndex":45,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちはここでまた溜息をつくことになった。彼の言う悪のエリートには興味が持てない。","en":"We found ourselves sighing again. We had no interest in what he called the elite of evil.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r46","rowIndex":46,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「よし、おれたちはもう戻っていよう」","en":"“All right, let’s head back.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r47","rowIndex":47,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　潜入捜査員だった死体の搬出が終わる前に<tips=14>深沢</tips>は部屋を出る。","en":"Before they finished carrying out the body of the man who had been an undercover officer, <tips=14>Fukazawa</tips> left the room.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r48","rowIndex":48,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちもそれに従った。","en":"We followed him.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r49","rowIndex":49,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「二人とも顔色が悪いな」","en":"“You two look pale.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"深沢聡","displayName":"Satoshi Fukazawa","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r50","rowIndex":50,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　仕事場になっているその部屋に戻ると、<tips=14>深沢</tips>は煙草をふかしはじめた。","en":"When we returned to the room that served as his office, <tips=14>Fukazawa</tips> began puffing on a cigarette.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r51","rowIndex":51,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「むやみに痛めつけたりするのは好きじゃない」","en":"“We don’t like inflicting pain for no reason.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r52","rowIndex":52,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あいつ、小さな子供がいるって言ってた」","en":"“He said he had a little child.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r53","rowIndex":53,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちは痛みに耐えかねて子供のように泣き叫んだ捜査員の顔を思い出した。","en":"We remembered the face of the investigator, who had screamed and sobbed like a child when he could no longer bear the pain.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r54","rowIndex":54,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いやな気持ちになったかい？　気分が悪いときは、うまく感情をシャットダウンするんだ。なに、すぐに慣れるさ。こういうのは最初の殺しが一番大変なんだが、おまえたちはもうそれは乗り越えているからな。あとは場数を踏めばすぐに何も感じなくなる」","en":"“Did it upset you? When you feel bad, you have to learn to shut down your emotions. Don’t worry—you’ll get used to it soon enough. With this sort of thing, the first killing is the hardest, and you’ve already gotten past that. Once you’ve done it enough times, you’ll stop feeling anything in no time.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"深沢聡","displayName":"Satoshi Fukazawa","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r55","rowIndex":55,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちは沈黙する。<tips=14>深沢</tips>には言葉の真意が伝わりにくいからだ。","en":"We fell silent. The meaning behind our words rarely seemed to get through to <tips=14>Fukazawa</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r56","rowIndex":56,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どうしても無理なら、学校へ行ってまっとうな道へ戻らないか？　適当な身分証を作って別の学校へ潜り込むのは簡単だ」","en":"“If you really cannot stand it, why not go back to school and return to the straight and narrow? It would be easy enough to make you suitable identity papers and slip you into another school.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"深沢聡","displayName":"Satoshi Fukazawa","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r57","rowIndex":57,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「私たちは悪人にもなりたくないし、善人にもなりたくない」","en":"“We don’t want to be bad people, and we don’t want to be good people.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r58","rowIndex":58,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「誰とも仲間になんかならないし、誰とも敵になりたくない」","en":"“We won’t be anyone’s ally, and we don’t want to be anyone’s enemy.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r59","rowIndex":59,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「何にもなりたくないの。何も決めつけたくない。今日何かをいいと感じても、明日は悪いと感じるかもしれないし、どっちかが間違ってるとか、正しいとか決めつけたくない。決めなくちゃ生きていけないっていうのは、弱いことだよ」","en":"“We don’t want to become anything. We don’t want to pin anything down. Something might feel good today and bad tomorrow, and we don’t want to decide that either feeling is wrong or right. Needing to decide before you can go on living is a kind of weakness.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r60","rowIndex":60,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なあ、大人になるというのは何かになることなんだよ」","en":"“Listen. Becoming an adult means becoming something.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"深沢聡","displayName":"Satoshi Fukazawa","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r61","rowIndex":61,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=14>深沢</tips>は顔をしかめた。","en":"<tips=14>Fukazawa</tips> frowned.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r62","rowIndex":62,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「何者でもないことが許されるのは子供のうちだけだ。大人になれば、それまでしたことによって否応なく決定づけられてしまう。おまえたちは学校をやめたことをなんとも思っていないかもしれないが、それも決定のひとつだ。殺人鬼の味方をしたのだって、人を殺したのだって、おまえたちの運命を決めているんだ」","en":"“Only children are allowed to be nobody. Once you become adults, what you have done will define you whether you like it or not. You may think nothing of leaving school, but that too was a choice that defined you. Siding with a murderer, killing a man yourselves—those things are shaping your fate as well.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"深沢聡","displayName":"Satoshi Fukazawa","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r63","rowIndex":63,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そんなのでたらめだよ」","en":"“That’s complete nonsense.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r64","rowIndex":64,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=14>深沢聡</tips>はわかってない。何かにならなくちゃいけないのなら、私たちは生きていられない。私たちは私たちでしかないのだから」","en":"“<tips=14>Satoshi Fukazawa</tips> doesn’t understand. If we have to become somebody, we cannot go on living. We can only ever be ourselves.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r65","rowIndex":65,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「またそんな極端なことを言う」","en":"“There you go saying something so extreme again.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"深沢聡","displayName":"Satoshi Fukazawa","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r66","rowIndex":66,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=14>深沢</tips>は溜息をつき、","en":"<tips=14>Fukazawa</tips> sighed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r67","rowIndex":67,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まあ、そうだとしても、ここに居るのが一番いいだろうな。おれたちは何者でもない。ギャングにもなれなければ、まっとうにも生きていけない、どこにも居場所がないクズみたいな連中だ。それに、ここなら何も心配はいらないぞ。警察にも手出しはさせん」","en":"“Well, even so, staying here is probably best. We’re nobodies. We’re a bunch of scum who can’t make it as gangsters, can’t live honest lives, and have nowhere to belong. Besides, you don’t have anything to worry about here. I won’t let even the police lay a hand on you.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"深沢聡","displayName":"Satoshi Fukazawa","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r68","rowIndex":68,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=14>深沢</tips>は膝を叩いて言う。私たちは浮かない顔をして黙り込む。","en":"<tips=14>Fukazawa</tips> slapped his knee as he spoke. We lapsed into gloomy silence.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r69","rowIndex":69,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ふむ、あのなんとかっていう殺人鬼を待っているのか？」","en":"“Hmm. Are you waiting for that murderer—whatever his name was?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"深沢聡","displayName":"Satoshi Fukazawa","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r70","rowIndex":70,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=14>深沢</tips>は余計な質問をする。","en":"<tips=14>Fukazawa</tips> asked a needless question.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r71","rowIndex":71,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうじゃないってば。私たちはそんなの気にしない」","en":"“We told you, that isn’t it. We don’t care about any of that.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r72","rowIndex":72,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「私たちはただ楽しく生きたいだけなの。あいつが面白いものを見せてくれると思ったのは確かだけど、いないのなら別のことを探すだけ」","en":"“We only want to enjoy being alive. It’s true we thought he would show us something interesting, but if he isn’t here, we’ll just find something else.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r73","rowIndex":73,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ここで仕事手伝ってたって、面白くない。<tips=14>深沢聡</tips>がへんなおじさんと交渉してるの横で黙って見てるだけじゃ気が狂う」","en":"“Helping with the work here isn’t interesting. If all we do is sit silently beside <tips=14>Satoshi Fukazawa</tips> while he negotiates with weird old men, we’ll go insane.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r74","rowIndex":74,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「へんなおじさんと言うな。あいつらはみなひとかどの人間なんだぞ？　顔を覚えておいて損はない。いずれおまえたちも、<tips=1>謝亮</tips>や<tips=10>見土道夫</tips>みたいにこの街の有力者になってゆくんだから……」","en":"“Don’t call them weird old men. Every one of them is someone important, you know. It won’t hurt you to remember their faces. In time, you’re going to become powerful figures in this city yourselves, like <tips=1>Tse Leung</tips> and <tips=10>Michio Mido</tips>...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"深沢聡","displayName":"Satoshi Fukazawa","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r75","rowIndex":75,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「興味ない」","en":"“Not interested.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r76","rowIndex":76,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あいつらがやってることなんかやりたくない」","en":"“We don’t want to do anything they do.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r77","rowIndex":77,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちの言葉に<tips=14>深沢</tips>は顔をしかめた。","en":"<tips=14>Fukazawa</tips> frowned at our words.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r78","rowIndex":78,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼はつけたばかりの煙草をすぐに消し、立ち上がって棚から白い粉が入った小指の先ほどの大きさの瓶を取り出す。そして、ゴム製の蓋を外し、瓶の口を鼻孔に当て、そのままくっと顎を上げる。すると、白い粉は瓶のなかから鼻孔へ、さらさらと流れ落ちる。","en":"He immediately stubbed out the cigarette he had only just lit, rose, and took from a shelf a vial of white powder scarcely larger than the tip of his little finger. Pulling out the rubber stopper, he pressed the vial’s mouth to one nostril and jerked his chin upward. The fine white powder poured from the vial into his nose.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r79","rowIndex":79,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「はあ」","en":"“Ahh.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"深沢聡","displayName":"Satoshi Fukazawa","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r80","rowIndex":80,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　顔を戻すと、<tips=14>深沢</tips>は瓶を傍らのゴミ箱に投げ捨て、白くなった鼻の下をゴシゴシと擦る。","en":"When <tips=14>Fukazawa</tips> lowered his head again, he tossed the vial into the wastebasket beside him and scrubbed vigorously at the white powder beneath his nose.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r81","rowIndex":81,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=14>深沢</tips>はいつもこうやって、のど飴をなめるように気軽に覚醒剤を摂取する。","en":"This was how <tips=14>Fukazawa</tips> always took methamphetamine, as casually as if he were popping a throat lozenge into his mouth.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r82","rowIndex":82,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=14>深沢</tips>は若いときは証券マンで荒稼ぎをしており、その時にこの癖を覚えたと聞いた。ウォール街のエリートビジネスマンなら当たり前のたしなみだと彼は言う。ウォール街の話なんかどこで聞いたのかと尋ねると、映画で観たのだそうだ。でも、私たちが薬に触ろうとしただけでも怒る。","en":"We had heard that <tips=14>Fukazawa</tips> made a fortune as a stockbroker in his youth and acquired the habit then. He claimed it was simply part of the lifestyle for an elite Wall Street businessman. When we asked where he had learned anything about Wall Street, it turned out he had seen it in a movie. Yet he became furious if we so much as touched the drugs ourselves.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r83","rowIndex":83,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=14>深沢聡</tips>も、この団地の人たちも、私たちを変なふうに勘違いしてる」","en":"“<tips=14>Satoshi Fukazawa</tips> and everyone else in this complex have gotten such a strange idea about us.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r84","rowIndex":84,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「人間として見ていない。偶像化してる。それってとても失礼なことだよ？」","en":"“They don’t see us as human. They idolize us. That’s terribly disrespectful, you know.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r85","rowIndex":85,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「難しい言葉を知っているな。しかし、半分あっていて、半分間違っている。誰かの偶像になるには、才能も必要なんだよ。誰でもなれるわけじゃない。おまえたちにはそれがある。だから、おれたちが偶像化したんじゃなくて、おまえたちの素質がそうさせた部分もあるのさ。そして、それを意識して振る舞えば、もっと多くの人間をひきつけるだろう」","en":"“That is quite a word you know. Still, you’re half right and half wrong. It takes talent to become an idol. Not just anyone can do it, and you two have what it takes. So it isn’t simply that we chose to idolize you. Something in you made us do it. Learn to play that part consciously, and you’ll attract even more people.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"深沢聡","displayName":"Satoshi Fukazawa","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r86","rowIndex":86,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「くだらないことを言ってる」","en":"“You’re talking nonsense.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r87","rowIndex":87,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「子供のとき、私たちはいつも下っ端だったよ。リーダーは<tips=10>見土道夫</tips>とか<tips=1>菅原亮</tips>だった」","en":"“When we were children, we were always the underlings. <tips=10>Michio Mido</tips> or <tips=1>Ryo Sugawara</tips> would be the leader.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r88","rowIndex":88,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「私たちは組織に向いていないんだ。向いていたくもないし」","en":"“We aren’t cut out for organizations. Nor do we want to be.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r89","rowIndex":89,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=14>深沢</tips>は私たちの言葉を聞いていない。","en":"<tips=14>Fukazawa</tips> was not listening to us.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r90","rowIndex":90,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なあ、<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>のお家騒動だけじゃなく、<tips=21>八龍会</tips>のジジイどもまで野心を剥き出しにして来たんだ。これから<tips=9>Y地区</tips>は戦国時代になる。おまえたちは、その連中と互角に戦えるようにならないといけないんだ」","en":"“Listen. It isn’t only the power struggle inside <tips=7>YS</tips> anymore. Even the old men of the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips> have begun to bare their ambitions. <tips=9>Y District</tips> is entering its own Warring States era. You two need to become capable of meeting those people on equal terms.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"深沢聡","displayName":"Satoshi Fukazawa","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r91","rowIndex":91,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=14>深沢</tips>の言っていることは私たちには意味がわからなかった。","en":"We could not make any sense of what <tips=14>Fukazawa</tips> was saying.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r92","rowIndex":92,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちはすぐに席を立って部屋を出る。","en":"We rose at once and left the room.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r93","rowIndex":93,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「何が何でもここから出て行った方が良いね」","en":"“No matter what it takes, we’d better leave this place.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r94","rowIndex":94,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「うん、ここにはもういられない」","en":"“Yeah. We can’t stay here anymore.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r95","rowIndex":95,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちは団地の人たちのことは好きだった。だけれど、みんなが作っている組織に入ってそのなかで何かをしたいとは思わなかった。","en":"We liked the people in the housing complex. But we had no desire to join the organization they were building or take part in its work.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r96","rowIndex":96,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=10>見土道夫</tips>や<tips=1>菅原亮</tips>とは私たちは違うもの」","en":"“We’re different from <tips=10>Michio Mido</tips> and <tips=1>Ryo Sugawara</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r97","rowIndex":97,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「期待されても困るよ。好きなことしか出来ないんだから」","en":"“It is no use expecting anything from us. We can only ever do what we want.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r98","rowIndex":98,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「出よう」","en":"“Let’s go.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r99","rowIndex":99,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「出よう」","en":"“Let’s go.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r100","rowIndex":100,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちは頷きあうと、自分たちに与えられている部屋に戻った。","en":"We nodded to each other and returned to the room we had been given.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r101","rowIndex":101,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　前の部屋は探偵の<tips=50>路地邦昭</tips>に侵入されたので、あのまま放置して使っていない。新しい部屋にはほんのわずかな荷物しかない。","en":"The detective <tips=50>Kuniaki Roji</tips> had broken into our old room, so we had left it untouched and no longer used it. There were only a few belongings in the new one.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r102","rowIndex":102,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちはバッグにそれらを詰めて、出て行く準備をした。","en":"We packed them into a bag and prepared to leave.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r103","rowIndex":103,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　すると、電話が鳴った。","en":"Then the phone rang.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r104","rowIndex":104,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちの携帯電話の端末は警察に情報が筒抜けになっているということで、端末をかえて番号だけ前のものを着信するようにしてあった。だから、前から私たちの番号を知っている者は誰でもかけることが出来る。メモリーは引き継いでいるから、知っている相手からの着信なら誰だかすぐにわかる。","en":"We had been told that everything on our mobile phone was exposed to the police, so we had replaced the handset while arranging for calls to our old number to be forwarded. Anyone who already knew that number could therefore still reach us. We had transferred our contacts as well, so we would immediately recognize a call from anyone we knew.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r105","rowIndex":105,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちは二人でその携帯電話の画面を覗き込む。","en":"Together, we peered at the phone’s screen.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r106","rowIndex":106,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そこには見知らぬ番号の羅列がある。登録していない番号からの着信だ。","en":"It showed an unfamiliar string of digits. The call came from a number we had not registered.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r107","rowIndex":107,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちは顔を見合わせてから、おそるおそるその電話を取った。","en":"We looked at each other, then answered the phone apprehensively.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r108","rowIndex":108,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"『<ruby=アリョー>Алё</ruby>』","en":"“Alyo?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r109","rowIndex":109,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　受話器から聞こえて来たのは、私たちの知っている声だった。","en":"The voice from the receiver was one we knew.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r110","rowIndex":110,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"『ねえ、ちゃんと繋がってる？　僕は<tips=63>サーシェンカ</tips>だけど……』","en":"“Hello? Can you hear me properly? It’s <tips=63>Sashenka</tips>...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r111","rowIndex":111,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なんだか前と代わり映えのない家に住んでるのね」","en":"“You’ve moved into a house that hardly looks any different from the last one.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r112","rowIndex":112,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「変化を求めるとか、そういう気持ちがないのかしら」","en":"“Do none of you ever feel the need for a change?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r113","rowIndex":113,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=63>サーシェンカ</tips>に場所を教えられてやって来た彼らの新しいアジトは、前の家と似たような外国人向けの洋館だった。","en":"Following the directions <tips=63>Sashenka</tips> gave us, we arrived at their new hideout: another Western-style mansion built for foreign residents, much like the last one.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r114","rowIndex":114,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　もしかしたら同じ業者が同じ時期に作ったのかもしれない。間取りも内装も部屋の調度もほとんど変わらず、もし間違えて足を踏み入れたとしてもすぐには気づかない。","en":"Perhaps the same developer had built both houses around the same time. The floor plans, interiors, and furnishings were almost identical; even if we walked into the wrong one, we would not realize it at first.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r115","rowIndex":115,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちは玄関を入ってすぐの応接室にあるソファーで向かい合って座っていた。","en":"We sat facing one another on the sofas in a parlor immediately beyond the front door.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r116","rowIndex":116,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ぼ、僕に言われても……。気がついたらここにいたんだよ」","en":"“D-don’t ask me... By the time I realized what was happening, I was already here.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"サーシェンカ白シャツ","displayName":"Sashenka (White Shirt)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r117","rowIndex":117,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=63>サーシェンカ</tips>はもじもじしながら、その灰色の目を細める。","en":"<tips=63>Sashenka</tips> fidgeted and narrowed his gray eyes.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r118","rowIndex":118,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それでメモがあって、電話番号と、その下に『双子の電話』というメモがあったから、かければきみたちに通じると思って……」","en":"“There was a note, with a phone number, and under it someone had written, ‘The twins’ phone.’ So I thought calling it would put me through to you...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"サーシェンカ白シャツ","displayName":"Sashenka (White Shirt)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r119","rowIndex":119,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=64>アレクセイ</tips>がメモを書き残したのかしら？」","en":"“Do you suppose <tips=64>Alexei</tips> left the note?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r120","rowIndex":120,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうかもしれない。でも、この子に連絡させるなんて、なんのつもりなんだろう」","en":"“Maybe. But what could he be thinking, making this boy contact us?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r121","rowIndex":121,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちはそう囁きあった。","en":"We whispered as much to each other.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r122","rowIndex":122,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「で、でも、嬉しいよっ！　また会えて。僕、ずっときみたちに会いたかったんだ。なんだか、きみたちってすごく惹かれるんだよ。こんなの初めてで、どう言ったらいいのかわからないけど……。きっときみたちは本当に『特別』なんだね」","en":"“B-but I’m so happy to see you again! I’ve wanted to see you this whole time. I feel so terribly drawn to the two of you. I’ve never felt anything like it before, and I don’t know how to explain it... You really must be ‘special.’”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"サーシェンカ白シャツ","displayName":"Sashenka (White Shirt)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r123","rowIndex":123,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼は前と同じ白いシャツと黒いズボンを履いている。","en":"He wore the same white shirt and black trousers as before.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r124","rowIndex":124,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「さ、最初に会った時からそう言ってるじゃん！」","en":"“W-we told you that the first time we met!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r125","rowIndex":125,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「い、いまさら言わないでよ！」","en":"“D-don’t say it now!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r126","rowIndex":126,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なんで照れてるの？」","en":"“Why are you embarrassed?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"サーシェンカ白シャツ","displayName":"Sashenka (White Shirt)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r127","rowIndex":127,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そういうのは、自分で言ってるからいいんだよ。人から言われたくない」","en":"“It’s fine when we say it ourselves. We don’t want to hear it from other people.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r128","rowIndex":128,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「だからもう二度と言わないで！」","en":"“So never say it again!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r129","rowIndex":129,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「う、うん……」","en":"“O-okay...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"サーシェンカ白シャツ","displayName":"Sashenka (White Shirt)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r130","rowIndex":130,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼は納得出来ない様子で首を捻ると、","en":"Plainly unconvinced, he cocked his head to one side.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r131","rowIndex":131,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あ、そうだ！　ちょっと待っててね！　きみたちにプレゼントがあるんだ！」","en":"“Oh, that’s right! Wait here a moment! I have a present for you!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"サーシェンカ白シャツ","displayName":"Sashenka (White Shirt)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r132","rowIndex":132,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして彼は駆け出して部屋を出て行く。その無邪気に喜ぶ様子に私たちは溜息をついた。","en":"He dashed out of the room. We sighed at the sight of his innocent delight.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r133","rowIndex":133,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼はすぐに駆け足で帰って来ると、大きな薔薇の花束を持っていた。","en":"He soon hurried back carrying a large bouquet of roses.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r134","rowIndex":134,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「さっき近くを歩いていたら、お花屋さんを見つけて、きみたちのために買って来たんだ。受け取ってよ……気にいるかどうかわからないけど……」","en":"“I found a flower shop when I was walking nearby earlier, so I bought these for you. Please, take them... I don’t know if you’ll like them...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r135","rowIndex":135,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼は私たちの表情を伺うようにしながらそれを差し出す。 黒みがかったその花弁から、甘い匂いが漂ってくる。","en":"He held out the bouquet, watching our faces for a reaction. A sweet fragrance drifted from the dusky petals.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r136","rowIndex":136,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ごめんね、これは受け取れないわ」","en":"“I’m sorry, but we can’t accept these.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r137","rowIndex":137,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どうして？」","en":"“Why not?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r138","rowIndex":138,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=63>サーシェンカ</tips>は驚いて目を丸くする。","en":"<tips=63>Sashenka’s</tips> eyes widened in surprise.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r139","rowIndex":139,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「私たち、薔薇の花って大っ嫌いなの」","en":"“We hate roses.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r140","rowIndex":140,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「え、どうして？　とっても綺麗でいいにおいじゃないか。僕は大好きだよ？」","en":"“Huh? Why? They’re so beautiful, and they smell wonderful. I love them.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r141","rowIndex":141,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「色も、形も、においも、全部。見たくもないわ」","en":"“The color, the shape, the smell—everything. We don’t even want to see them.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r142","rowIndex":142,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「悪いけど、向こうへ持って行ってくれる？　私たちの目が届かないところへ」","en":"“Sorry, but could you take them away? Somewhere we can’t see them.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r143","rowIndex":143,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちが顔を顰めると、彼は悲しそうにうつむき、また部屋を出て行った。","en":"When we grimaced, he lowered his head sadly and left the room again.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r144","rowIndex":144,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして、さっきの浮かれ加減とは対照的にトボトボとうなだれながら帰って来る。","en":"In stark contrast to his earlier exuberance, he came trudging back with his head hung low.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r145","rowIndex":145,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちは少し気の毒に思う。","en":"We felt a little sorry for him.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r146","rowIndex":146,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ねえ<tips=63>サーシェンカ</tips>、聞いてもいい？」","en":"“<tips=63>Sashenka</tips>, can we ask you something?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r147","rowIndex":147,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あなた本当にわからないの？　寝ている間自分に何が起こっているのか。自分のどこが普通と違うのか。これまで生きて来て、気がつかなかったの？」","en":"“Do you truly have no idea what happens to you while you are asleep? How you differ from ordinary people? In all the years you have lived, have you never noticed?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r148","rowIndex":148,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちは咳払いをしてからそう話題を変えた。","en":"We cleared our throats, using the question to change the subject.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r149","rowIndex":149,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=63>サーシェンカ</tips>は困り顔で首を捻る。","en":"<tips=63>Sashenka</tips> tilted his head, looking troubled.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r150","rowIndex":150,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「想像くらいはしたことない？　どんな風になってるのかって」","en":"“Haven’t you ever even imagined what might be happening?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"サーシェンカ白シャツ","displayName":"Sashenka (White Shirt)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r151","rowIndex":151,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……いろいろ考えることは考えるよ。でも、あまりにもしょっちゅう色んなことが起きるし、酷いものもたくさん見るし、とても理解しきれないんだ。何か考えていても、気がつくと、ふっと別の場所にいて、それまでのことがわからなくなっちゃうし……。頭がおかしくなっちゃうし、とても怖くなっちゃうから、なるべく考えないようにしていて……」","en":"“...I do think about all sorts of things. But so many different things happen all the time, and I see so many horrible things, that I can’t possibly make sense of it all. Even when I’m thinking about something, the next thing I know, I’m suddenly somewhere else and don’t know what happened before... It makes me feel like I’m going crazy, and I get so scared that I try not to think about it whenever I can...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r152","rowIndex":152,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=63>サーシェンカ</tips>は泣きそうな顔をする。","en":"<tips=63>Sashenka</tips> looked ready to cry.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r153","rowIndex":153,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ごめんね、別に責めてるわけじゃないの」","en":"“We’re sorry. We aren’t blaming you.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r154","rowIndex":154,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ただちょっとどう思ってるのかなって知りたかったの」","en":"“We only wanted to know what you thought about it.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r155","rowIndex":155,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちは、その言葉から彼には変身している間の記憶が全くないのだと想像した。そして、一度意識を失ってから、次の場所で目を覚ますまでの間に時間が過ぎたという感覚もないのだろうと考えた。","en":"From what he had said, we inferred that he retained no memory at all of the time he spent transformed. He probably had no sense, either, that any time had passed between losing consciousness in one place and awakening in the next.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r156","rowIndex":156,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「きっと、あなたの感覚としては脈絡のない夢が連続でつなぎ合わされてるようなものなんだろうね」","en":"“To you, I suppose it feels like a string of disconnected dreams spliced together.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r157","rowIndex":157,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「うまく想像は出来ないけど、大変そうなのはわかるよ」","en":"“We cannot really imagine what it is like, but we understand how hard it must be.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r158","rowIndex":158,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そりゃ、何かが僕をとても構ってくれているのは知ってるよ。あんなメモをくれたり、他にも時々メッセージを残してくれたりもする。でも、その正体は見たことがないんだ。……きっと、僕は幽霊のようなものに取り憑かれてるんだよ」","en":"“I do know that something pays an awful lot of attention to me. It leaves me notes like that one, and sometimes other messages too. But I have never seen what it is. ...I must be possessed by some kind of ghost.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"サーシェンカ白シャツ","displayName":"Sashenka (White Shirt)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r159","rowIndex":159,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=63>サーシェンカ</tips>は暗い顔で呟いてから、私たちの方を見て、","en":"<tips=63>Sashenka</tips> murmured with a dark expression, then looked toward us.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r160","rowIndex":160,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ねえ知ってる？　人間はみんな、<tips=8>グレートホール</tips>から生まれたんだよ？　あの大きな穴から飛び出して来たんだ。僕はいつかあそこに戻りたいなって思うよ……。僕にはあそこにいたときの記憶があるんだ。とても平和で、穏やかだった気がする……。きっと幽霊が無理矢理僕をあそこから連れ去ったんだ。それで、こんなひどい目に遭わせている……」","en":"“Did you know that every human being was born from the <tips=8>Great Hole</tips>? We all came bursting out of that enormous pit. I want to go back there someday... I remember being there. It feels as though everything was so peaceful and calm... The ghost must have dragged me away by force. That is why it keeps putting me through all these terrible things...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"サーシェンカ白シャツ","displayName":"Sashenka (White Shirt)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r161","rowIndex":161,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼はうわごとのように呟く。","en":"He murmured as if delirious.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r162","rowIndex":162,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちは返事をせず、顔を顰めて黙っている。","en":"We made no reply, but sat silently with furrowed brows.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r163","rowIndex":163,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あなたは教育も受けていないし、ひどい体験をしているし、普通の考え方を持てないのは理解出来る。でも、もっとうまく考えることは出来るはずだよ」","en":"“We understand that you had no education, that you’ve been through terrible things, and that you can’t be expected to think in an ordinary way. But you should be capable of thinking more clearly than this.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r164","rowIndex":164,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まず、事実を知ることだよ。今まであなたにはそれを教える人がいなかったのかもしれない。でも、私たちは知っている。それを教えてあげる」","en":"“First you need to know the facts. Maybe no one has ever been there to teach you. But we know them. We’ll tell you.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r165","rowIndex":165,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「きみたちが？　事実って……」","en":"“You two do? What facts are you talking about...?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"サーシェンカ白シャツ","displayName":"Sashenka (White Shirt)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r166","rowIndex":166,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あなたはとても驚くかもしれない。とても……」","en":"“You may find them very shocking. Very...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r167","rowIndex":167,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「もしかしたら、私たちが言っても信じられないかもしれない」","en":"“You might not believe us even when we tell you.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r168","rowIndex":168,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「信じるよ！　僕は、きみたちのことは本当に信頼しているんだ。幽霊が、こんな風に人と会わせてくれるなんて初めてのことだし。ねえ、教えてよ？　僕は一体どういう存在なの？　こんなおかしなことを、全部説明出来る本当のことって、どんなものなの？」","en":"“I will! I truly trust you. This is the first time the ghost has let me meet anyone this way. Please, tell me. What am I? What kind of truth could explain all these strange things that happen to me?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"サーシェンカ白シャツ","displayName":"Sashenka (White Shirt)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r169","rowIndex":169,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼は私たちを見つめる。","en":"He stared at us.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r170","rowIndex":170,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちは揃って頷き、そして口を開こうとしたその時、彼の『変身』は始まった。","en":"We nodded in unison. Just as we opened our mouths, his “transformation” began.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r171","rowIndex":171,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　急に操り人形の糸が切れたかのようにガクリと全身から力が抜け、ソファーに倒れ込むと、その肉体は変化をしてゆく。","en":"As though the strings of a marionette had suddenly been cut, all strength left him and he collapsed onto the sofa. Then his body began to change.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r172","rowIndex":172,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　まるで庭先に干した梅が梅干しになってゆく過程を早送りしたみたいにその肌はしわしわになり、そしてその頭髪は真っ白に変化してゆく。","en":"His skin shriveled as though we were watching a fast-motion film of plums drying into umeboshi in the yard, and his hair turned pure white.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r173","rowIndex":173,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　老化しているのだ。","en":"He was aging.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r174","rowIndex":174,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「何これ」","en":"“What’s happening?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r175","rowIndex":175,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「浦島太郎？」","en":"“Urashima Taro?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r176","rowIndex":176,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちが驚いて腰を浮かしかけると、","en":"We started to rise in astonishment.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r177","rowIndex":177,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「驚く必要はありまセン」","en":"“There is no need to be alarmed.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r178","rowIndex":178,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼はしわがれた声で日本語の言葉を口にした。","en":"He spoke in Japanese, his voice hoarse.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r179","rowIndex":179,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そしてむっくりと起き上がると、鷲鼻で長い髭を持った老人がそこにいた。","en":"He heaved himself upright, and there before us sat an old man with an aquiline nose and a long beard.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r180","rowIndex":180,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=64>アレクセイ</tips>とも、<tips=63>サーシェンカ</tips>ともかけ離れた姿だ。","en":"His appearance was entirely unlike either <tips=64>Alexei</tips> or <tips=63>Sashenka</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r181","rowIndex":181,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あなたは誰？」","en":"“Who are you?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r182","rowIndex":182,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちは警戒しながらその人物を睨み付けた。","en":"We glared warily at the figure.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r183","rowIndex":183,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「はじめまして、私は<tips=65>エフゲニ・イリイーチ・ヘス</tips>。まあ、このチームの責任者のようなものデス」","en":"“A pleasure to meet you. I am <tips=65>Yevgeny Ilyich Hess</tips>. You might say I am the leader of this team.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エフゲニ・ヘス","displayName":"Yevgeny Hess","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r184","rowIndex":184,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　老人はうっすらと笑みを浮かべてそう自己紹介をする。","en":"The old man introduced himself with a faint smile.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r185","rowIndex":185,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「お嬢さんがた、彼によくしてくれるのは有り難いデスが、余計なことを教えて貰ってはこまりますな」","en":"“Young ladies, I am grateful for the kindness you have shown him, but I cannot allow you to fill his head with matters that do not concern him.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エフゲニ・ヘス","displayName":"Yevgeny Hess","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r186","rowIndex":186,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼が喋るたび、何かいやな臭いがそのあたりに漂う。胃の中で何かが腐っているのだろうかと、私たちは思い切り顔を顰めた。","en":"Each time he spoke, a foul odor drifted through the air around him. Wondering whether something was rotting in his stomach, we screwed up our faces in disgust.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r187","rowIndex":187,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　今日はこの表情をしてばかりで、顔に皺が出来てしまうんじゃないかと私たちは思った。","en":"We had spent so much of the day making that face that we began to worry it might give us wrinkles.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r188","rowIndex":188,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「責任者ってどういうこと？」","en":"“What do you mean, ‘the man in charge’?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r189","rowIndex":189,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「チームって何のチーム？」","en":"“What kind of team is it?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r190","rowIndex":190,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちは臭いを吸わないよう、鼻と口を手で覆いながらそう質問をした。","en":"We asked the questions with our hands over our noses and mouths to keep out the smell.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r191","rowIndex":191,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「気づいていませんか？　この身体は、幾人もの人間で共有しているのデスよ。<tips=98>アレクサンドル</tips>だけでなく、あなたたちがよく知っている<tips=64>アレクセイ</tips>もその一人でして」","en":"“Haven’t you noticed? This body is shared by several people. Not only <tips=98>Aleksandr</tips>—<tips=64>Alexei</tips>, whom you know so well, is also one of us.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エフゲニ・ヘス","displayName":"Yevgeny Hess","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r192","rowIndex":192,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=65>ヘス</tips>はニタリと正体不明の笑顔を浮かべ、","en":"<tips=65>Hess</tips> spread a strange, unreadable grin across his face and continued:","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r193","rowIndex":193,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「で、みなが好き勝手にやっていては滅茶苦茶になってしまうでしょう？　デスから、私が、他の人間に指示を出したり、統一した方針を決めているのデス」","en":"“And if everyone did exactly as they pleased, things would descend into chaos, wouldn’t they? That is why I give the others instructions and establish a single, unified course for us all.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エフゲニ・ヘス","displayName":"Yevgeny Hess","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r194","rowIndex":194,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=98>アレクサンドル</tips>？」","en":"“<tips=98>Aleksandr</tips>?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r195","rowIndex":195,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=98>アレクサンドル・ヤコヴレヴィチ・チェルヌイフ</tips>……あの可哀想な<tips=63>サーシェンカ</tips>の名前デス」","en":"“<tips=98>Aleksandr Yakovlevich Chernykh</tips>... That is the name of poor <tips=63>Sashenka</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エフゲニ・ヘス","displayName":"Yevgeny Hess","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r196","rowIndex":196,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なるほどね」","en":"“I see.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r197","rowIndex":197,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「長くって覚えられないわ」","en":"“It’s too long to remember.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r198","rowIndex":198,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ねえ、責任者で指示を出してるってことは、あなたはいつも見張って、あれこれ言ったり出来るってこと？」","en":"“So, if you’re in charge and give instructions, does that mean you’re always watching and can tell them what to do?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r199","rowIndex":199,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちは言いながら、<tips=64>アレクセイ</tips>がよく何もない空間と会話している姿を思い出していた。","en":"As we spoke, we remembered how often <tips=64>Alexei</tips> seemed to hold conversations with empty air.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r200","rowIndex":200,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうデス。その時、誰に変身するかを選んだり、変身したものの頭に言葉を囁いたり出来マス。こうやって、他のものに指示を出せるのは私だけでしてね。だから、特別なんデスよ。……私たちは、それぞれ性別も人種も年齢もバラバラデスが、チームのなかで出来ることもまったく違うんデス。私は今言ったように仲間のことを把握出来、管理することが出来ますが、<tips=98>アレクサンドル</tips>のように同じ肉体の中に住む他の人々の存在さえ知らないものもいます。他には、限定された何人かの人間しか把握していないものもいるし、完全に間違った風に誤解して理解しているものもいるんデス」","en":"“Indeed. I can choose who we become when the transformation occurs, and I can whisper into the mind of whoever has taken form. I alone can issue instructions to the others in this fashion. That is what makes me special. ...We are of different sexes, races, and ages, and our capabilities within the team differ just as widely. As I said, I can keep track of my companions and manage them. But some, like <tips=98>Aleksandr</tips>, do not even know that other people inhabit the same body. Some are aware of only a select few, while others have formed a completely mistaken understanding of what is happening.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エフゲニ・ヘス","displayName":"Yevgeny Hess","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r201","rowIndex":201,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼が喋るたびに、髭の間の雨の日の壁に張り付くナメクジみたいな唇がぬめぬめ動き、その奥に汚い歯が見えて、顔を背けたくなる。","en":"Every time he spoke, lips like slugs clinging to a wall in the rain writhed wetly between the hairs of his beard, revealing filthy teeth beyond. We wanted to turn away.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r202","rowIndex":202,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちにとって生理的に受け付けないタイプの老人だった。","en":"He was precisely the sort of old man we found viscerally repellent.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r203","rowIndex":203,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「サテ、そうして数多くの人がいるなかでも、<tips=98>アレクサンドル</tips>はとっても重要な子供でしてね。彼は何も知らないが、彼なくしては誰も存在しなかった。つまり、彼がこの肉体における最初の人間なのデスよ。……彼の考えを我々は全部肯定するわけではありませんが、ある程度は尊重しマス。ダカラ、彼がとても気になっているあなた方を、ココにお招きしたわけデス」","en":"“Now then, even among the many people within us, <tips=98>Aleksandr</tips> is an exceedingly important child. He knows nothing, but without him, none of us would exist. In other words, he was the first person in this body. ...We do not agree with everything he thinks, but we do respect his wishes to a certain extent. That is why we invited you here. He has grown extraordinarily fond of you.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エフゲニ・ヘス","displayName":"Yevgeny Hess","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r204","rowIndex":204,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=65>エフゲニ・イリイーチ・ヘス</tips>と名乗った大きな鼻を持つ老人は薄く笑い、","en":"The large-nosed old man who had named himself <tips=65>Yevgeny Ilyich Hess</tips> smiled faintly.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r205","rowIndex":205,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「これはとても珍しいことデスよ。<tips=98>アレクサンドル</tips>は人に心を開くコトなどないのデス。あなたたちは選ばれたという訳デスな。そのような感情に振り回されるのは、私にとっては厄介な話デスが」","en":"“This is exceedingly rare. <tips=98>Aleksandr</tips> never opens his heart to anyone. It would appear that you have been chosen. Personally, I find it troublesome to be at the mercy of such emotions.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エフゲニ・ヘス","displayName":"Yevgeny Hess","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r206","rowIndex":206,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まったく光栄だわ」","en":"“What an honor.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r207","rowIndex":207,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちは皮肉のつもりでそう言った。","en":"We meant it sarcastically.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r208","rowIndex":208,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「でも、どうしてそんなにペラペラと話してくれるの？　そういうタイプには見えないけれど」","en":"“But why are you telling us all this so readily? You don’t seem like the type.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r209","rowIndex":209,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「私だって、出来れば話したくありません」","en":"“If it were up to me, I would rather not tell you anything.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エフゲニ・ヘス","displayName":"Yevgeny Hess","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r210","rowIndex":210,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　老人は肩をすくめ、","en":"The old man shrugged:","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r211","rowIndex":211,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「だが、<tips=98>アレクサンドル</tips>がここまであなたたちを気にいってしまった以上は、こうするしかないのデス。私が責任者といっても、所詮雇われオーナーのようなもので、<tips=98>アレクサンドル</tips>が本当にその気になったら、私が止めることは出来ませんカラ……。それならばせめて、情報を共有しておきませんと、もっと危険デス」","en":"“But now that <tips=98>Aleksandr</tips> has taken such a liking to you, I have no other choice. I may call myself the leader, but in the end I am little more than a hired manager. If <tips=98>Aleksandr</tips> truly sets his mind on something, I cannot stop him... That being so, it would be more dangerous not to share at least some information with you.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エフゲニ・ヘス","displayName":"Yevgeny Hess","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r212","rowIndex":212,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちは顔を見合わせる。この老人の言葉を、信じるか、どうか。何か別の目的があるのか。私たちはどちらも相手の態度をはかりかねていた。","en":"We looked at each other. Could we believe what this old man was saying? Did he have some other purpose? Neither of us could tell what the other made of him.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r213","rowIndex":213,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「さて、じゃあ、この<tips=65>ヘス</tips>の役割をお伝えしたところで、次は何をお話しますかねえ……ソウダ。そちらから、何か聞きたいことはありマスか？」","en":"“Now then, now that I have explained the role of <tips=65>Hess</tips>, what shall I tell you next...? Ah, yes. Is there anything you would like to ask?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エフゲニ・ヘス","displayName":"Yevgeny Hess","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r214","rowIndex":214,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=65>エフゲニ・イリイーチ・ヘス</tips>は金色に光る瞳で私たちを見る。","en":"<tips=65>Yevgeny Ilyich Hess</tips> watched us with eyes that shone gold.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r215","rowIndex":215,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「じゃあ聞くけど、その髪の毛を切ったら、次に変身したときは切った状態になるの？　それとも、切る前の同じ姿に変身するの？」","en":"“All right. If you cut that hair, will it still be cut the next time you transform, or will you return to the same appearance you had before?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r216","rowIndex":216,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ねえどうしてそんなに歯が汚いの？　他の変身の姿では清潔にしていても、そうなるの？　不潔さを共有してるとしたら、<tips=63>サーシェンカ</tips>のことも嫌いになりそう」","en":"“And why are your teeth so filthy? Do they still come out like that when the other forms keep themselves clean? If the filth carries over between all of you, we might start disliking <tips=63>Sashenka</tips> too.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r217","rowIndex":217,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちが矢継ぎ早に言うと、彼はしかめっ面をして、","en":"As we bombarded him with questions, he scowled.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r218","rowIndex":218,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そのようなことを本当に聞きたいのですか？」","en":"“Are those truly the things you wish to ask?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エフゲニ・ヘス","displayName":"Yevgeny Hess","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r219","rowIndex":219,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=65>エフゲニ・イリイーチ・ヘス</tips>さん、私たちはね、あなたの態度が気にいらないのよ」","en":"“<tips=65>Yevgeny Ilyich Hess</tips>, we do not like your attitude.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r220","rowIndex":220,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「もったいぶってるけど、結局あなたはただ自己紹介をしてるだけでしょ？　なのに、さも凄いことを教えてやるというような言い方はなんなの？　私たち、そういう言い方する人嫌い」","en":"“You make such a production of it, but in the end, you’re just introducing yourself, aren’t you? So why do you talk as if you’re about to reveal something astonishing to us? We hate people who talk that way.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r221","rowIndex":221,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「自分のことを話す時の作法を教えてあげる。『退屈かもしれませんが、どうかお聞き下さい』って最初に言うのよ。『何でも聞いてくれたまえ。きみたちは選ばれたのだ』なんて、気色悪い！」","en":"“We will teach you the proper way to talk about yourself. You begin by saying, ‘This may be boring, but please hear me out.’ Not, ‘Ask me anything you please. You have been chosen.’ That is disgusting!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r222","rowIndex":222,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ばっかみたいだねー」","en":"“You look completely ridiculous.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r223","rowIndex":223,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちは顔を見合わせて頷きあう。","en":"We looked at each other and nodded.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r224","rowIndex":224,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼はしかめっ面のまま固まって言葉を発しない。","en":"He remained frozen in a scowl, saying nothing.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r225","rowIndex":225,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　部屋に沈黙が訪れる。","en":"Silence descended upon the room.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r226","rowIndex":226,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　応接室も殺風景で、最低限のソファーとテーブルがあるだけで、花瓶もなければ彫刻の凝った置き時計といったような、こういう洋館にありそうなものもない。本当に何もない。","en":"The parlor itself was barren. It held only the bare minimum of sofas and a table—not even a vase, much less one of the elaborately carved mantel clocks that might have belonged in such a Western mansion. There truly was nothing.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r227","rowIndex":227,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「わかりマシた」","en":"“I understand.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エフゲニ・ヘス","displayName":"Yevgeny Hess","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r228","rowIndex":228,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちが沈黙に飽き始めたとき、彼はやっと口を開いた。","en":"Just as we were growing bored with the silence, he finally spoke.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r229","rowIndex":229,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……じゃあ、言い方を変えましょう。確かに、多少もったいぶっていたかもしれマセンね。それとも、もしかして私タチの事情を見抜いてのことですか？　正直に申し上げましょう。私どもには、あなたがたの協力が必要なのデス。協力者と言えるのはあなた方だけデスから……」","en":"“...Then allow me to put it differently. It is true that I may have been drawing things out a little. Or could it be that you have seen through our circumstances? I shall be frank. We require your cooperation. You are the only people we can call our allies...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エフゲニ・ヘス","displayName":"Yevgeny Hess","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r230","rowIndex":230,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「はじめからそう言えばいいのよ」","en":"“You should have said so from the start.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r231","rowIndex":231,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「素直になったほうがかわいいわ」","en":"“You’re cuter when you’re honest.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r232","rowIndex":232,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「口の悪いお嬢さん方デスね……」","en":"“What foul-mouthed young ladies you are...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エフゲニ・ヘス","displayName":"Yevgeny Hess","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r233","rowIndex":233,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=65>エフゲニ・イリイーチ・ヘス</tips>は困ったように眉間に皺を寄せる。","en":"<tips=65>Yevgeny Ilyich Hess</tips> knitted his brows, looking troubled.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r234","rowIndex":234,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……それでは率直に、とても大事なことをお伝えしまショウ」","en":"“...Then I shall speak frankly and tell you something very important.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エフゲニ・ヘス","displayName":"Yevgeny Hess","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r235","rowIndex":235,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼が言うと、私たちは近くのソファーに座って、言葉を聞く姿勢をとる。","en":"At that, we sat down on a nearby sofa and prepared to listen.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r236","rowIndex":236,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「私はさっき、みなを管理していると言いましたが、ドウモその力が衰えて来ましてネ。最近、私が意図していないのに、勝手に誰かが飛び出してしまうことがあるんデス。……そして、普段なら彼らが見ているものは私にも見え、聞いたものは私にも聞こえていたハズなのに、眠り込んでしまって把握出来ない時間も増えて来ました。……これはトテモ恐ろしいことデス。コノ身体の中にいるものタチは、みな同じ考えを持ち、同じ価値観を共有しているワケではありません。先ほど言ったヨウに、状況を把握していナイものもいるし、そもそも理性的でないモノもいます。つまり、いまこの肉体は、時間帯によっては支離滅裂で統一されたコントロールのきかない状態になったりもするんデスよ」","en":"“A moment ago, I said that I manage everyone, but that power seems to be weakening. Recently, there have been times when someone emerges of their own accord, without any intention on my part. ...Ordinarily, I should be able to see what they see and hear what they hear, yet the periods when I fall asleep and lose all awareness are growing more frequent. ...This is a terrifying thing. The people within this body do not all think alike or share the same values. As I said, some do not understand the situation, while others are not rational beings to begin with. In other words, at certain times, this body now lapses into an incoherent state under no unified control.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エフゲニ・ヘス","displayName":"Yevgeny Hess","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r237","rowIndex":237,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それはお気の毒様ね」","en":"“How unfortunate for you.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r238","rowIndex":238,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「私たちも、知らない間に自分の身体があんな変態に変身して、くだらない殺人とかしてたら絶望するわ」","en":"“We’d despair too if our bodies transformed into a pervert like that without our knowledge and went around committing pointless murders.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r239","rowIndex":239,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうは言わないでくだサイ。<tips=64>アレクセイ</tips>は、アノ趣味はいただけませんが、なかなか器用で人当たりも良く、我々のなかでは優秀な男なんデス……」","en":"“Please, do not speak of him that way. His tastes are regrettable, but <tips=64>Alexei</tips> is quite capable and personable. Among us, he is an excellent man...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エフゲニ・ヘス","displayName":"Yevgeny Hess","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r240","rowIndex":240,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あれで優秀なの？」","en":"“You call that excellent?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r241","rowIndex":241,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「気が遠くなるような人材不足ね」","en":"“The shortage of talent is enough to make your head spin.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r242","rowIndex":242,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちが溜息をつくと、彼は苦笑する。","en":"When we sighed, he gave a strained smile.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r243","rowIndex":243,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ともかく、彼が殊勝な態度に改めたので、私たちも幾分か対応を軟化させることにした。","en":"In any case, now that he had humbled himself and adopted a more commendable attitude, we decided to soften our own treatment of him a little.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r244","rowIndex":244,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「だから私たちをここに呼んだと」","en":"“And that’s why you called us here.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r245","rowIndex":245,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ソウです。<tips=98>アレクサンドル</tips>が会いたがっているという理由も嘘ではありマセン。それに付け加えて、協力を願い出るという理由もありマシタ。アナタがたは前に、刑事に襲われた<tips=64>アレクセイ</tips>を救ってくれましたカラ。あの時犬の刑事はサイキック能力を抑制する薬剤を使おうとしていましたし、危ないところでした」","en":"“Precisely. I did not lie when I said that <tips=98>Aleksandr</tips> wished to see you. But I also hoped to request your cooperation. You previously saved <tips=64>Alexei</tips> when a detective attacked him. The dog-headed detective was attempting to use a drug that suppresses psychic abilities, and it was a close thing.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エフゲニ・ヘス","displayName":"Yevgeny Hess","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r246","rowIndex":246,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼は溜息をつきつつ首を横に振り、","en":"He sighed and shook his head:","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r247","rowIndex":247,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……私たちはいま、さる重大な事業に手をつけているのデスが、肝心の私たち自身が、このような危機的状況なのデス。情けない話デスが、滞りなく遂行するためには絶対に信用出来る誰かが必要だと私は判断しました。あなたタチは若いデスが、強力なサイキック能力と、<tips=17>タイプB</tips>の身体能力がありますカラ……」","en":"“...We are currently engaged in a certain undertaking of great importance, yet we ourselves—the very people it depends on—are in a crisis such as this. Humiliating though it is to admit, I concluded that to carry it out without incident, we require someone we can trust absolutely. You are young, but between you, you possess both a powerful psychic ability and the physical abilities of a <tips=17>Type B</tips>...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エフゲニ・ヘス","displayName":"Yevgeny Hess","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r248","rowIndex":248,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=65>エフゲニ・イリイーチ・ヘス</tips>はポケットからハンカチを取り出すと、額に浮いた脂汗を拭った。","en":"<tips=65>Yevgeny Ilyich Hess</tips> drew a handkerchief from his pocket and wiped the clammy sweat from his brow.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r249","rowIndex":249,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「わかったよ。私たちを呼んだ本当の理由は。……じゃあ、改めて質問させてもらってもいい？」","en":"“All right. Now we understand the real reason you called us. ...May we start our questions over, then?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r250","rowIndex":250,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まず、あなたのことを教えて。あなたって、お爺さんだけのことじゃなくて、<tips=63>サーシェンカ</tips>のことよ？　この子が生まれてからここに来るまで、どうやって生きて来たのか、まずそれを知りたいの」","en":"“First, tell us about you. And by you, we don’t mean only the old man—we mean <tips=63>Sashenka</tips>. Before anything else, we want to know how this boy lived from the day he was born until he came here.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r251","rowIndex":251,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「わかりマシタ……」","en":"“Very well...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エフゲニ・ヘス","displayName":"Yevgeny Hess","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r252","rowIndex":252,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=65>エフゲニ・イリイーチ・ヘス</tips>は頷くと、静かに話し始めた。","en":"<tips=65>Yevgeny Ilyich Hess</tips> nodded and quietly began to speak.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r253","rowIndex":253,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　地球上に七つある<tips=8>グレートホール</tips>のうち、ロシア西部のそれは、最も古い時代に出来たものだった。","en":"According to the account he gave us, the Great Hole in western Russia was the oldest of the seven <tips=8>Great Holes</tips> on Earth.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r254","rowIndex":254,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その<tips=8>グレートホール</tips>のすぐそばには小さな街があり、そこは汚染の影響で寂れていたが、チェルヌイフ家はその数少ない住民たちとも最低限の関わり合いしか持たず、聚落から離れた場所にひっそりと暮らしていた。","en":"A small town stood right beside the <tips=8>Great Hole</tips>. Contamination had left the town in decline, and the Chernykh family lived quietly outside the settlement, maintaining only the barest contact even with its few remaining inhabitants.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r255","rowIndex":255,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　チェルヌイフ家はかつては貴族として広い土地と数多くの農奴を所有していたが、今はその面影はない。かといって平凡な暮らしを送っていたというわけでもなく、街の住民からは非常に疎まれていた。","en":"The Chernykh family had once belonged to the aristocracy, possessing vast lands and many serfs, but no trace of that former grandeur remained. Nor, however, did they lead ordinary lives. The townspeople regarded them with intense loathing.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r256","rowIndex":256,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それは一家にまつわる忌まわしい伝承のせいだった。","en":"The reason was sinister lore about the family.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r257","rowIndex":257,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　チェルヌイフ家は吸血鬼である、と、土地のものは言う。彼らは人の生き血を吸い、それによって特殊な能力を手に入れ、切っても焼いても死なない、不老不死の肉体を持っている。その証拠に彼らは見たこともない金色の目をしているじゃないか、というのである。","en":"The locals said that members of the Chernykh family were vampires. They drank living human blood, gaining special powers and bodies that neither blade nor fire could kill—bodies that never aged and never died. Were their strange golden eyes not proof enough?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r258","rowIndex":258,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「これは、タダの伝説というわけではなく、実際チェルヌイフ家の人々はみな八つ裂きにされても死にません。その再生能力は、お嬢さんがたも目にしたデショウ？」","en":"“This is not merely a legend. In truth, the members of the Chernykh family will not die even if torn limb from limb. You young ladies have witnessed their regenerative power yourselves, have you not?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r259","rowIndex":259,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=65>エフゲニ・イリイーチ・ヘス</tips>が言うには、何代か前のチェルヌイフ家の嫁が、美容と健康のために農奴の息子や娘を殺してその血液を毎食ワイングラスに入れて家族全員の食卓に供していたのだそうだ。","en":"<tips=65>Hess</tips> claimed that, several generations earlier, one bride of the Chernykh family had killed the sons and daughters of serfs for the sake of beauty and health, serving their blood in wine glasses at every meal for the entire family.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r260","rowIndex":260,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その辺りの農作物は後の調査で<tips=72>タイプB傾向値</tips>が高いことが判明している。それを食べている住民の血液には、当然その因子が蓄積されていることになる。この血液を飲むことで<tips=72>傾向値</tips>が上がり、チェルヌイフ家は不老不死の力を手に入れたのだろうということだった。","en":"Later investigation found that the crops grown in the region had high <tips=72>Type B tendency values</tips>. The relevant factors would naturally accumulate in the blood of the people who ate them. According to Hess, by drinking that blood, the Chernykh family raised their own <tips=72>tendency values</tips> and acquired the power of eternal youth and immortality.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r261","rowIndex":261,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「やっぱり、あなたの不思議な力って<tips=17>タイプB</tips>のものなの？」","en":"“So your strange power is a <tips=17>Type B</tips> ability after all?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r262","rowIndex":262,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうとも言えますが、世間の<tips=17>タイプB</tips>のような出来そこないではありません。……まあ、私どもの身体のことは後で話すとしましょう。とにかく、チェルヌイフ家は、地元では大分昔から不死の家系として嫌悪されていたわけデス。それこそ、<tips=17>タイプB</tips>という存在が認知されるよりもずっと前から……」","en":"“One may say so, but we are not defective specimens like the <tips=17>Type Bs</tips> of the wider world. ...Still, we shall discuss our body later. The important point is that, in their homeland, the Chernykh family had long been despised as a family of immortals. This was long before the world even recognized the existence of <tips=17>Type Bs</tips>...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r263","rowIndex":263,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　やがて時代が下ると、世界中で<tips=17>タイプB</tips>が発生し、注目されることになる。","en":"As time passed, <tips=17>Type Bs</tips> began to emerge throughout the world and attract public attention.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r264","rowIndex":264,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　発症すると精神に悪影響をもたらすというデメリットはあったが、常人をこえた身体能力や治癒能力は人間の新たな可能性を感じさせ、様々な国家や企業がその研究に乗り出した。","en":"The condition carried the disadvantage of damaging the mind, but physical and healing abilities beyond those of ordinary people seemed to promise new possibilities for humanity. Governments and corporations around the world embarked on research of their own.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r265","rowIndex":265,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ロシア政府もモスクワに本拠地を構える世界的に有名な（<tips=65>エフゲニ・イリイーチ・ヘス</tips>はその企業の名を明言しなかった）製薬会社と組んで、<tips=17>タイプB</tips>を研究するためのプロジェクトを立ち上げた。","en":"<tips=65>Hess</tips> said that the Russian government joined forces with a world-famous pharmaceutical company headquartered in Moscow—whose name he declined to give—to establish a <tips=17>Type B</tips> research project.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r266","rowIndex":266,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　これが『<tips=19>フセスラフ計画</tips>』であった。","en":"It was called the “<tips=19>Vseslav Project</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r267","rowIndex":267,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"『<tips=17>タイプB</tips>』とか『<tips=16>タイプA</tips>』というミュータントの呼称は今こそ世界中で標準となっているが、その他にも様々なスラングがある。中国の『龍』だったり、北欧の『ベルセルク』だったり、その強靱な肉体と、常軌を逸した精神を例えたものが多い。東ヨーロッパでは『人狼』と呼ばれて悪魔の使いとして弾圧の対象になったりもした。","en":"Hess explained that the mutant designations “Type B” and “<tips=16>Type A</tips>” had since become standard throughout the world, but numerous slang terms existed as well. Many compared the powerful bodies and aberrant mental states of <tips=17>Type Bs</tips> to legendary beings: the Chinese “dragon,” the Norse “berserker,” and others. In Eastern Europe, they were called “werewolves” and sometimes persecuted as servants of the devil.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r268","rowIndex":268,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"『<tips=19>フセスラフ計画</tips>』では、こうして迫害された人狼たちを保護し、研究に協力させた。当時はまだ<tips=17>タイプB</tips>がそれほど多くなく、サンプルも足りなかった。積極的に各地に調査員を派遣し、そこで吸血鬼と呼ばれるチェルヌイフ家に目をつけたのである。","en":"Under the <tips=19>Vseslav Project</tips>, persecuted “werewolves” of this kind were taken into protection and made to cooperate with the research. <tips=17>Type Bs</tips> were not yet numerous, leaving the researchers short of subjects. They actively dispatched investigators to different regions, and thus took notice of the Chernykh family, whom the locals called vampires.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r269","rowIndex":269,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=17>タイプB</tips>差別が活発化していた頃で、これまで以上に社会から疎外されていたチェルヌイフ家はひどく困窮していた。調査員が幾ばくかの謝礼を提示すると、当主のヤーコフは一人息子の<tips=98>アレクサンドル</tips>を売り渡した。","en":"Discrimination against <tips=17>Type Bs</tips> was intensifying, and the Chernykh family, more isolated from society than ever, had fallen into desperate poverty. When the investigators offered a modest payment, the head of the family, Yakov, sold them his only son, <tips=98>Aleksandr</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r270","rowIndex":270,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　前に聞いたとおり、この<tips=98>アレクサンドル</tips>の愛称が「<tips=63>サーシェンカ</tips>」である。","en":"As we had heard before, <tips=63>Sashenka</tips> was the diminutive used for <tips=98>Aleksandr</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r271","rowIndex":271,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　研究所に集められた<tips=17>タイプB</tips>は多かったが、<tips=98>アレクサンドル</tips>は異質だった。","en":"Many <tips=17>Type Bs</tips> were gathered at the laboratory, but <tips=98>Aleksandr</tips> was different from all the rest.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r272","rowIndex":272,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　他の誰よりも高い<tips=72>傾向値</tips>を持ちながら、精神症状は一切現れていない。傷をつけてもその場でみるみるうちに回復してしまうほどの再生能力。筋力などの身体能力は他の<tips=17>タイプB</tips>に譲る面はあるが、それでもノーマルよりは遥かに高いレベルを維持している。","en":"According to the account, his <tips=72>tendency value</tips> exceeded every other subject’s, yet he displayed no psychiatric symptoms whatsoever. Wounds healed before the researchers’ eyes almost as soon as they were inflicted. In some physical abilities, such as muscular strength, other <tips=17>Type Bs</tips> surpassed him; nevertheless, he remained far beyond the level of a Normal.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r273","rowIndex":273,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"『<tips=19>フセスラフ計画</tips>』の最終的な目標は、現在の人間より優れた新しい人間を作り出すことにあった。","en":"The ultimate objective of the <tips=19>Vseslav Project</tips> was to create a new kind of human being superior to humanity as it then existed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r274","rowIndex":274,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そういう観点からすると、重度の精神症状があらわれているようなものはどんなに優れていても使い道がなく、<tips=98>アレクサンドル</tips>の精神の正常性と、異常な治癒能力はまさに理想的なモデルであり、唯一無二の実験材料だった。","en":"From that perspective, no matter how exceptional a subject might be, it was useless if it manifested severe psychiatric symptoms. <tips=98>Aleksandr’s</tips> sound mental condition and extraordinary healing ability made him both the ideal model and an experimental subject without equal.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r275","rowIndex":275,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その結果、<tips=98>アレクサンドル</tips>には非人道的な実験が繰り返されるようになる。","en":"As a result, the researchers subjected <tips=98>Aleksandr</tips> to experiment after inhumane experiment.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r276","rowIndex":276,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼の生命力がほぼ不死身と言って良いレベルにあることが判明すると、致死量の毒が与えられたり、刃物などを用いて身体を様々な方法で破壊されたりもした。もちろん、いくら再生能力があるといっても苦痛がなくなるわけではない。そして、実験の過程で何度も脳が破損したせいもあるだろう。","en":"Once they determined that his vitality approached true immortality, they administered lethal doses of poison and destroyed his body in various ways with knives and other instruments. Regeneration did nothing to spare him pain. And perhaps the repeated damage to his brain over the course of those experiments contributed to what followed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r277","rowIndex":277,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼はほとんどの記憶を失い、人格も崩壊して幼児のようなプリミティブなものへと変化していった。","en":"He lost nearly all his memories, and his personality disintegrated into something primitive and childlike.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r278","rowIndex":278,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「この時の実験や研究で、多くのことがわかりました」","en":"“The experiments and research conducted during this period revealed a great deal.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r279","rowIndex":279,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　不死身とされている通り、<tips=98>アレクサンドル</tips>はどれだけ肉体を損傷しても元の姿に回復すること。","en":"In Hess’s account, the work established that <tips=98>Aleksandr</tips> would return to his original form no matter how badly his body was damaged.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r280","rowIndex":280,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=98>アレクサンドル</tips>の血液を他者に与えれば、研究所の実験では３２％ほどの確率で彼と同様の能力を身につけること。ただ、同様といってもその程度はいくらか劣り、個体差はあるものの再生力は確かに高いが本家のように殺害するのが全く不可能というほどでもない、といった程度に収まるようである。","en":"The experiments also established that administering <tips=98>Aleksandr’s</tips> blood to another person conferred similar abilities in roughly thirty-two percent of cases. Similar did not mean equal: the degree varied from one individual to another, and although their regenerative powers were unquestionably great, none became as utterly impossible to kill as the original.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r281","rowIndex":281,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　こうした能力は、ただ単に強力な<tips=17>タイプB</tips>能力というわけではなく、<tips=16>タイプA</tips>的なサイキック能力が働いている可能性があること。つまり、<tips=98>アレクサンドル</tips>はハイブリッドでもあった。","en":"The researchers further considered the possibility that this was not merely an unusually powerful <tips=17>Type B</tips> ability, but that a <tips=16>Type A</tips> psychic power was at work as well. In other words, <tips=98>Aleksandr</tips> was also a hybrid.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r282","rowIndex":282,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　研究所が特に目をつけたのは、血液によって他者を強化出来るという点だった。３２％は確率としては低く、失敗した場合に発狂したりしてしまうことを考えればリスクが大きい。この確率をいかにして上昇させるかというのが彼らのこれからの研究目標となった。","en":"The laboratory took particular interest in the ability to strengthen other people through his blood. A thirty-two percent success rate was low, especially when failure carried the risk of madness. Raising that probability became the next objective of the research.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r283","rowIndex":283,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　これがほぼ失敗がないというような状態になれば、ノーマルよりも遥かに強靱な肉体と回復能力を持った人間がいくらでも量産出来ることになる。人間を進化させる、魔法の杖を手に入れるようなものだ。","en":"If failures could be virtually eliminated, they believed, human beings with bodies and regenerative powers far beyond those of Normals could be mass-produced without limit. It would be like obtaining a magic wand capable of advancing human evolution.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r284","rowIndex":284,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　この優れた人間は兵隊にしてもいいし、肉体労働の現場でも役に立つだろう。機械やロボットが発達した現代でも、人間の身体能力が有用な場面は数多く存在する。","en":"These superior humans could serve as soldiers or prove useful at sites of manual labor. Even in the modern age of advanced machinery and robotics, there remained countless situations in which the capabilities of the human body were indispensable.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r285","rowIndex":285,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しかしこの計画はすぐに頓挫することになった。","en":"The project soon collapsed, however.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r286","rowIndex":286,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=98>アレクサンドル</tips>に新しい能力が発現し、彼はそれを使って研究員を殺害してそこを去ってしまったのである。","en":"A new ability manifested in <tips=98>Aleksandr</tips>, and he used it to kill the researchers and escape the facility.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r287","rowIndex":287,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「その時私たちは彼の中に宿ったのデスよ。つまり、新しい能力というのは、全く別の人間を自分のナカに住まわせて、それに変身する力のコトです。研究所を脱出したのも、そのウチの一人がとても強いサイキックだったので、その力を使ったわけデスな」","en":"“That was when we came to dwell within him. In other words, the new ability was the power to house entirely different human beings inside himself and transform into them. We escaped because one of those people was an exceptionally powerful psychic, whose ability provided the means.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r288","rowIndex":288,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「サイキック能力って、先天的なものじゃないの？」","en":"“Aren’t psychic abilities something you’re born with?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r289","rowIndex":289,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そう言われていますネ。能力が生まれたというより、生まれつき身に備わっていたモノが、やっと形になったということデショウ」","en":"“So it is said. I suppose the ability was not born at that moment. Rather, something present within him from birth finally took form.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r290","rowIndex":290,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……でも、その時生まれたってことは、あなたにはそれより前の記憶がないの？」","en":"“...But if you were born then, do you have no memories from before that time?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r291","rowIndex":291,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それも不思議なモノで、どういうワケか、私たちには生まれてからこうなるまでの記憶が存在スルんです。私の場合ハ、川辺の街で教師の家庭に生まれて、大学を出て銀行員にナリ、結婚して娘が生まれ、やがて孫が生まれ……と言った具合にネ。しかし、実際ドウ調べても、私の孫や妻は見つからないんデスよ」","en":"“That is another mystery. For some reason, we possess memories extending from birth until the moment we became as we are. In my case, I was born to a teacher’s family in a town beside a river, graduated from university, entered banking, married, had a daughter, and eventually a grandchild... Yet no matter how thoroughly I search, I can find neither my wife nor my grandchild.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r292","rowIndex":292,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「全部偽物の記憶だったってわけ？」","en":"“So all your memories were fake?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r293","rowIndex":293,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そう考えるノガ合理的なのカモしれませんな。デモ、本当にアリアリと思い出せるのデス。妻の優しい笑顔ヤ、子供たちの誕生日を祝った夜の景色が……。あれが全てデタラメだとしたら、余りにも悲シイ」","en":"“Perhaps that is the rational conclusion. And yet I remember it all with perfect clarity: my wife’s gentle smile, the scene on the night we celebrated the children’s birthdays... If every one of those things is a fabrication, it is too terribly sad.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r294","rowIndex":294,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=65>エフゲニ・イリイーチ・ヘス</tips>は寂しそうに笑った。","en":"<tips=65>Yevgeny Ilyich Hess</tips> smiled forlornly.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r295","rowIndex":295,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「アレは確かに現実でした。きっとここ以外にも現実があるのデショウ。或いは、<tips=98>アレクサンドル</tips>が信じるように、<tips=8>グレートホール</tips>の向こう側に世界があって、私タチの過去はそちらにあるのカモしれません」","en":"“It was unquestionably real. Surely realities must exist outside this one. Or perhaps, as <tips=98>Aleksandr</tips> believes, a world lies on the far side of the <tips=8>Great Hole</tips>, and our pasts belong to that place.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r296","rowIndex":296,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　研究所を出た<tips=98>アレクサンドル</tips>は家に戻った。両親はそれを受け入れたが、研究所からは既に連絡が入っており、夜に彼を引き渡すかどうかの口論を行っていた。<tips=98>アレクサンドル</tips>は翌日に、この両親と、二人の姉と、小さな妹を殺した。厳密に言うと、彼のなかの<tips=62>マリア</tips>というサイキックの少女が殺した。彼女は知的レベルが低く、<tips=65>エフゲニ・イリイーチ・ヘス</tips>の声を神の指示だと信じている。研究所を脱出したのも彼女の力によるものだ。","en":"After leaving the laboratory, <tips=98>Aleksandr</tips> returned home. His parents took him in, but the laboratory had already contacted them, and that night they argued over whether to hand him over. The following day, <tips=98>Aleksandr</tips> killed his parents, his two older sisters, and his little sister. More precisely, they were killed by a psychic girl inside him named <tips=62>Maria</tips>. She had low intelligence and believed the voice of <tips=65>Yevgeny Ilyich Hess</tips> to be the command of God. It was also her power that had enabled the escape from the laboratory.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r297","rowIndex":297,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「不死の人間をどうやって殺したの？」","en":"“How did you manage to kill people who were immortal?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r298","rowIndex":298,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちは首を捻ってそう尋ねた。","en":"We tilted our heads as we asked.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r299","rowIndex":299,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「チェルヌイフ家には、不死の力を打ち消す秘密の方法が伝わっているんデスよ」","en":"“A secret method of nullifying their immortality has been passed down through the Chernykh family.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r300","rowIndex":300,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「秘密の？」","en":"“A secret means?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r301","rowIndex":301,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼は頷き、","en":"He nodded.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r302","rowIndex":302,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「オソラク、世界でもそれを知っている人間はごく僅か……あるいはチェルヌイフ家の他には全然いないかもしれません。<tips=8>グレートホール</tips>のすぐそばに沼がアリましてネ。ソコの泥は<tips=17>タイプB</tips>の能力に働きかける力があるんです。発症して精神がおかしくなった<tips=17>タイプB</tips>に与えれば心が元通りになり、我々のようなものに使えば、一定期間再生能力が失われるんデス。チェルヌイフ家は普通では死ねませんカラ、自殺が推奨されていマス。死にたくなったらこの泥を口にしてから、首をつったり、頭を銃で撃ち抜くのだそうデス。<tips=98>アレクサンドル</tips>も子供の頃から教わって知っていました。狂った一族デスよ。まあ、そのおかげで我々も利用するコトが出来たのですがね。……この泥は、薔薇のように赤いので『薔薇泥』と一家は呼んでいまシタ」","en":"“Very few people in the world know of it, I suspect—perhaps no one outside the Chernykh family. Beside the <tips=8>Great Hole</tips> lies a marsh, and the mud there possesses the power to act upon <tips=17>Type B</tips> abilities. Give it to a <tips=17>Type B</tips> driven mad after the onset of symptoms, and that mind returns to normal. Use it upon beings like us, and our regenerative power disappears for a certain period. Because members of the Chernykh family cannot die by ordinary means, suicide is encouraged within the family. Those who wish to die are said to swallow this mud before hanging themselves or putting a bullet through the head. <tips=98>Aleksandr</tips> was taught the method from childhood. A mad family, indeed. Though thanks to that teaching, we were able to make use of it ourselves. ...Because the mud is as red as a rose, the family called it ‘Rose Mud.’”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r303","rowIndex":303,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして私たちは、さっき<tips=63>サーシェンカ</tips>が『好きな花だ』と言って薔薇の花束をプレゼントしようとしていたことを思い出した。","en":"We remembered that <tips=63>Sashenka</tips> had just tried to present us with a bouquet of roses, saying that they were his favorite flower.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r304","rowIndex":304,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「この『薔薇泥』の存在が、後で我々に思わぬ幸運を運んでくれる訳デス」","en":"“The existence of this ‘Rose Mud’ would later bring us an unexpected stroke of good fortune.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r305","rowIndex":305,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　この後、しばらく<tips=98>アレクサンドル</tips>は国内を放浪する。といっても、この時期はほとんど別の誰かの姿になっていた。彼らは見知らぬ少年のなかに突然押し込められたことに混乱しており、自分が表に出ると、勝手な行動ばかりを繰り返した。全てが見えていた<tips=65>エフゲニ・イリイーチ・ヘス</tips>は彼らに自重を求めたが、みな相手にせず、『<tips=98>アレクサンドル</tips>』という存在は複数人のバラバラの意志のせいで支離滅裂な行動を続けた。","en":"After that, <tips=98>Aleksandr</tips> wandered the country for a time. Throughout most of that period, however, the body wore the form of someone else. Those people were bewildered to find themselves suddenly confined within the body of an unknown boy, and whenever one emerged, each acted entirely as he pleased. <tips=65>Yevgeny Ilyich Hess</tips> could see everything and urged them to restrain themselves, but none paid him heed. The being called ‘<tips=98>Aleksandr</tips>’ continued to behave incoherently under the disparate wills of multiple people.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r306","rowIndex":306,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして生まれながらの猟奇殺人鬼である<tips=64>アレクセイ</tips>の犯罪によって、警察に逮捕される。","en":"Eventually, the crimes of <tips=64>Alexei</tips>, whom Hess described as a born serial killer, led to their arrest by the police.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r307","rowIndex":307,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=64>アレクセイ</tips>は警察に追われる過程で、致命傷と思われる銃弾を何度も受けても逃げ延びたことから『<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>』と名付けられた。","en":"During the pursuit, <tips=64>Alexei</tips> survived repeated gunshot wounds that should have been fatal. It was this feat that earned him the name “<tips=20>Koschei</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r308","rowIndex":308,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　政府はすぐに研究所を脱出した<tips=98>アレクサンドル</tips>の変身の一つであることを知ったが、それは公表されなかった。","en":"According to Hess, the government soon learned that Alexei was one of the transformations of <tips=98>Aleksandr</tips>, the escaped laboratory subject, but did not make the fact public.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r309","rowIndex":309,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　この獄中で、人格たちは協力の必要性を感じ、最年長で、なおかつ全てをコントロールする力をもつ出来る<tips=65>エフゲニ・イリイーチ・ヘス</tips>がまとめ役となることが決まった。そして<tips=65>エフゲニ・イリイーチ・ヘス</tips>自身も、この時期に、自分にはただ声を届かせるだけでなく、誰の姿に変身するかを決める力もあることを知る。","en":"In prison, the different persons recognized the need to cooperate. They selected the eldest among them—the capable <tips=65>Yevgeny Ilyich Hess</tips>, who possessed the power to control all the others—as their coordinator. During the same period, <tips=65>Yevgeny Ilyich Hess</tips> himself learned that his ability extended beyond making his voice heard: he could also decide whose form the body would assume.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r310","rowIndex":310,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして<tips=62>マリア</tips>の能力で警察のもとから脱出すると、長い放浪が始まった。","en":"After they escaped from police custody using <tips=62>Maria’s</tips> ability, a long period of wandering began.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r311","rowIndex":311,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「この身体の中には何人もの人間がいるカラ、なかなか普通に暮らすというワケにもいかないのデス。協力をすると決めたモノの、従順なものバカリではないですカラ、私が何でも言うことを聞かせられるというワケでもないのです。<tips=64>アレクセイ</tips>は比較的素直デスが、人殺しだけはやめられマセンし、他にも乱暴モノはいます」","en":"“With so many people inside this body, an ordinary life is scarcely possible. We may have agreed to cooperate, but not all of them are obedient, and I cannot force everyone to heed my every word. <tips=64>Alexei</tips> is comparatively tractable, yet even he cannot stop killing. There are other violent ones among us as well.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r312","rowIndex":312,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　トラブルばかり起こすものだから、どこにも定住出来ず、あちこちを巡り歩くことになる。","en":"They caused trouble wherever they went, so they could settle nowhere and ended up wandering from place to place.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r313","rowIndex":313,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして安住の地として見つけたのが、この<tips=9>Y地区</tips>だそうだ。","en":"The place they eventually found where they might settle in peace was <tips=9>Y District</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r314","rowIndex":314,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼が初めて訪れたのは二十年近く前の、まだ掘っ立て小屋ばかりだった頃だが、すでに様々な人種が住み着いて混沌としており、活気もあり、何より<tips=8>グレートホール</tips>が近かった。","en":"His first visit came nearly twenty years earlier, when the district was still composed largely of shacks. Even then, people of many races had settled there. It was chaotic, full of vitality, and above all, close to the <tips=8>Great Hole</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r315","rowIndex":315,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「二十年？」","en":"“Twenty years?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r316","rowIndex":316,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちはびっくりして大きな声を出した。","en":"We cried out in astonishment.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r317","rowIndex":317,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それくらいになりますね。正確には、十八年くらいでしょうか……」","en":"“Approximately. Eighteen years, to be precise...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r318","rowIndex":318,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……<tips=63>サーシェンカ</tips>って、一体何歳なの……」","en":"“...How old is <tips=63>Sashenka</tips>...?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r319","rowIndex":319,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちが目を丸くしていると、<tips=65>エフゲニ・イリイーチ・ヘス</tips>はクスリと笑って、話を続ける。","en":"As our eyes widened, <tips=65>Yevgeny Ilyich Hess</tips> chuckled and continued his story.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r320","rowIndex":320,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=8>グレートホール</tips>が近いというのは彼にとって絶対条件だった。<tips=8>グレートホール</tips>に異常な感情を持つ<tips=98>アレクサンドル</tips>は、近くにいないと情緒が不安定になる。","en":"For him, proximity to the <tips=8>Great Hole</tips> was an absolute requirement. <tips=98>Aleksandr</tips> had an abnormal attachment to the <tips=8>Great Hole</tips>, and his emotions became unstable whenever he was not near one.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r321","rowIndex":321,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして<tips=65>エフゲニ・イリイーチ・ヘス</tips>はこの<tips=9>Y地区</tips>を自分たち好みの街に作り替えようと、活動を開始する。","en":"<tips=65>Hess</tips> then set to work remaking <tips=9>Y District</tips> into a city more to their liking.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r322","rowIndex":322,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「私どもの仲間には若い女もおりまして、これがなかなか自由奔放なもので、酒場で出会った若い男と親密になったのデスよ。臓器売買ブローカーをしていたのデスが、これがなかなか見込みのある男で、こやつと組んで新しい事業を始めるということになったのデス」","en":"“One of our companions is a young woman, a remarkably free-spirited creature who became intimate with a young man she met in a bar. He worked as a broker in the organ trade and showed considerable promise, so we decided to join forces with him and begin a new enterprise.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r323","rowIndex":323,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　動き出したプロジェクトは、当時<tips=9>Y地区</tips>への進出を狙っていた<tips=68>木下組</tips>と手を組んだあたりから話は大きくなり、そして生まれたのが『<tips=18>ローズ・クラブ</tips>』だと言う。","en":"The undertaking expanded when they joined forces with the <tips=68>Kinoshita-gumi</tips>, which was then seeking to establish itself in <tips=9>Y District</tips>. Hess said that this partnership gave birth to the “<tips=18>Rose Club</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r324","rowIndex":324,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　クラブではチェルヌイフ家の血を使って不死にした女たちを働かせ、他では絶対に提供出来ないサービスを行った。","en":"At the club, they put women rendered immortal with Chernykh blood to work providing services unavailable anywhere else.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r325","rowIndex":325,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その結果、VIPも足を運ぶようになり、それで得た資金と<tips=68>木下組</tips>の武力を背景に<tips=9>Y地区</tips>を支配する一歩手前まで行った。","en":"As a result, VIPs began coming as well, and with the money this brought in and the armed might of the <tips=68>Kinoshita-gumi</tips> behind them, they came within a step of ruling <tips=9>Y District</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r326","rowIndex":326,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「しかしその結果がどうなったかは、ご存じデショウ？」","en":"“But you know how that ended, do you not?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r327","rowIndex":327,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちは頷く。","en":"We nodded.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r328","rowIndex":328,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=18>ローズ・クラブ</tips>は街のギャングの連合によって崩壊し、その若き盟主は街の英雄になった。<tips=9>Y地区</tips>で生まれ育ったものならば誰でも知っている。<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>の初代<tips=81>龍頭</tips><tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>の最もよく知られた武勇伝だ。","en":"The <tips=18>Rose Club</tips> was destroyed by an alliance of the city’s gangs, and its young leader became a hero of the city. Everyone born and raised in <tips=9>Y District</tips> knew the story. It was the best-known exploit of <tips=3>Chris Tse</tips>, the first <tips=81>Longtou</tips> of <tips=7>YS</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r329","rowIndex":329,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あの時は大変デシタ。秘密を知られぬヨウ、不死にした女タチは『<tips=45>ローズ</tips>』を注射して殺し、そしてギャングどもに見つからぬよう逃げました。戦っても良かったのデスが、そんなコトをしても、プロジェクトが失敗したことには変わりません。見つからぬよう逃げて、次のチャンスを狙うコトにしたわけデス。我々の正体は知られてはいないハズでしたから」","en":"“Those were difficult days. To preserve our secret, we injected the women we had made immortal with ‘<tips=45>Rose</tips>’ and killed them, then slipped away before the gangsters could find us. We could have fought, but that would not have changed the fact that the project had failed. We chose instead to escape unseen and wait for our next opportunity. No one should have known our true nature.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r330","rowIndex":330,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ちょっと待って。『<tips=45>ローズ</tips>』を注射して殺したってどういうこと？　『<tips=45>ローズ</tips>』って、あの『<tips=45>ローズ</tips>』？」","en":"“Wait. What do you mean, you injected them with ‘<tips=45>Rose</tips>’ and killed them? Do you mean that ‘<tips=45>Rose</tips>’—the ‘<tips=45>Rose</tips>’ we know?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r331","rowIndex":331,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうデス。……あのクスリは『薔薇泥』の成分を再現したモノで、私が製薬会社に作らせたモノです。あれを使えば、『薔薇泥』と同じように<tips=17>タイプB</tips>の心を正常にし、そして不死の力も奪います。不死の力がなくなれば、普通のやり方で殺すことが出来ます。……私は、あれを<tips=17>タイプB</tips>の特効薬として売って大儲けするつもりだったのデスが、どこかのバカがネットにレシピを流してしまったせいで、思ったより金になりませんでした……」","en":"“Precisely. ...The drug reproduces the active properties of ‘Rose Mud.’ I commissioned a pharmaceutical company to manufacture it. Like the mud itself, it restores a <tips=17>Type B</tips> mind to normal and strips away immortality. Once that immortality is gone, they can be killed by ordinary means. ...I intended to sell it as a miracle drug for <tips=17>Type Bs</tips> and make a fortune, but some fool leaked the formula online, so it proved less profitable than I had expected...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r332","rowIndex":332,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=65>エフゲニ・イリイーチ・ヘス</tips>は肩をすくめる。","en":"<tips=65>Yevgeny Ilyich Hess</tips> shrugged.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r333","rowIndex":333,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あれを反省して、『<tips=46>ネオ・ローズ</tips>』はもっと厳重に情報管理が行われる環境で、ごく少数の限られた人員ダケで開発を進めました。その人員も、今は全員始末済みデス。お陰でこんなに長い時間がかかってしまいましたが、今度こそこのクスリは私タチに永遠の幸福をもたらすデショウ」","en":"“Having learned from that mistake, we developed ‘<tips=46>Neo Rose</tips>’ under far tighter information controls, entrusting the work to only a carefully selected handful of people. Every one of them has since been disposed of. It took us a great deal longer as a result, but this time the drug will surely bring us eternal happiness.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r334","rowIndex":334,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なるほどね。それで、その『<tips=46>ネオ・ローズ</tips>』を手土産に<tips=21>八龍会</tips>のジジイたちをそそのかしてたわけね」","en":"“I see. So you dangled that ‘<tips=46>Neo Rose</tips>’ before the old men of the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips> and used it to spur them on.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r335","rowIndex":335,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それで、にっくき<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>を倒して、過去の思惑通りこの街に自分の王国を作ろうってこと？」","en":"“Then you mean to defeat the hated <tips=7>YS</tips> and build your own kingdom in this city, just as you planned before?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r336","rowIndex":336,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「お察しのいいコトで。私は今度こそ、この街を支配して、行き場のない我々の永住の地としたいのデス」","en":"“How perceptive of you. This time, I intend to rule this city and make it a permanent home for those of us who have nowhere else to go.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r337","rowIndex":337,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼は唇の端を吊り上げて微笑み、","en":"Curling one corner of his mouth into a smile,","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r338","rowIndex":338,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「これで、話は全て終わりです」","en":"“That is the whole story,”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r339","rowIndex":339,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　と言った。","en":"he said.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r340","rowIndex":340,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なんだか、思ったよりつまらない目的ね。がっかり」","en":"“That’s a much more boring objective than we expected. What a disappointment.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r341","rowIndex":341,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「もっと面白いことを考えているんだと思ってた。街のボスになって威張りたいだなんて、その辺にいくらでもいるチンピラたちと同じじゃない」","en":"“We thought you had something more interesting in mind. Wanting to become the boss of the city and lord it over everyone makes you no different from all the cheap thugs on its streets.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r342","rowIndex":342,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「窮屈でつまらない考えだわ」","en":"“What a narrow, dreary little idea.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r343","rowIndex":343,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「奴隷たちが自分を縛り付けている鎖がどれだけ綺麗かって自慢し合うのとかわらないわ」","en":"“It’s no different from slaves boasting to one another about the beauty of the chains that bind them.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r344","rowIndex":344,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちは揃って溜息をつく。","en":"We sighed in unison.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r345","rowIndex":345,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　この反応に<tips=65>エフゲニ・イリイーチ・ヘス</tips>は当惑している。","en":"Our reaction bewildered <tips=65>Yevgeny Ilyich Hess</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r346","rowIndex":346,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ふむ、なかなか共感は得られぬようデスな……」","en":"“Hm. It appears I shall find little sympathy from you...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エフゲニ・ヘス","displayName":"Yevgeny Hess","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r347","rowIndex":347,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「私たち、そういう話にうんざりしてるのよ」","en":"“We’re tired of stories like that.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r348","rowIndex":348,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どこの勢力だとか、なんだとか、ばっかばかしい」","en":"“This faction, that faction—it’s all so stupid.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r349","rowIndex":349,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうデスか。それならば仕方アリません……」","en":"“I see. Then it cannot be helped...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エフゲニ・ヘス","displayName":"Yevgeny Hess","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r350","rowIndex":350,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=65>エフゲニ・イリイーチ・ヘス</tips>は情けなくうなだれる。","en":"<tips=65>Yevgeny Ilyich Hess</tips> let his head droop miserably.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r351","rowIndex":351,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「もう話せるコトはありません。一番大事な秘密も、お話しイタシました」","en":"“There is nothing more I can tell you. I have told you even the most important secret.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エフゲニ・ヘス","displayName":"Yevgeny Hess","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r352","rowIndex":352,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=65>エフゲニ・イリイーチ・ヘス</tips>は深々と溜息をつく。","en":"<tips=65>Yevgeny Ilyich Hess</tips> sighed deeply.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r353","rowIndex":353,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「せっかく目的の薬が出来たのに、皮肉なモノですね……」","en":"“How ironic, now that the medicine we sought is finally complete...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エフゲニ・ヘス","displayName":"Yevgeny Hess","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r354","rowIndex":354,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「天下の<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>が情けない」","en":"“The mighty <tips=20>Koschei</tips>—how pathetic.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r355","rowIndex":355,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そんなに悪い状態なの？」","en":"“Is it really that bad?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r356","rowIndex":356,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちが訊ねると、<tips=65>エフゲニ・イリイーチ・ヘス</tips>は頷く。","en":"When we asked, <tips=65>Yevgeny Ilyich Hess</tips> nodded.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r357","rowIndex":357,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まったく、本当にひどい状態なのデス」","en":"“It is. The situation is truly dire.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エフゲニ・ヘス","displayName":"Yevgeny Hess","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r358","rowIndex":358,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=65>エフゲニ・イリイーチ・ヘス</tips>はまた深いため息をつく。","en":"<tips=65>Yevgeny Ilyich Hess</tips> heaved another deep sigh.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r359","rowIndex":359,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……<tips=64>アレクセイ</tips>は自制が効かずに不用意な殺人を繰り返すし、<tips=98>アレクサンドル</tips>は呼んでもいないのにあらわれて勝手なコトをする。<tips=61>ヒトミ</tips>も夜な夜な街に遊びに出かけているようデスし……。それに、私自身も、前と変わってしまっている。感情がうまくおさえられなくて、本当はもっと慎重に振る舞わないといけないはずなのに、それも出来ず……はあ」","en":"“...<tips=64>Alexei</tips> has no self-restraint and keeps committing murders with no thought for the consequences. <tips=98>Aleksandr</tips> appears without being summoned and does whatever he pleases. <tips=61>Hitomi</tips> seems to slip out into the city night after night in search of amusement... And I myself am no longer as I was. I cannot keep my emotions properly in check. I know I ought to conduct myself with greater caution, yet even that is beyond me... Hah...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r360","rowIndex":360,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=65>エフゲニ・イリイーチ・ヘス</tips>はまたまた溜息をつく。","en":"<tips=65>Yevgeny Ilyich Hess</tips> sighed yet again.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r361","rowIndex":361,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その様子を見て、私たちはなんだかむずむずとしてくる。","en":"Watching him, we began to feel a peculiar itch.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r362","rowIndex":362,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「こうなれば、この肉体はもう滅びるしかないのデショウ。混乱したいくつもの意志に支配されたままでは、結局誰かに捕まるダケです。いくら再生能力があっても、サイキックの力があっても、動かす意志が滅茶苦茶ではどうにもなりません。少し危険な野生動物というだけ。……しかし、これでいいのかもしれまセンね。……アハ、アハハ。……もう終わりなんデス……アハハハ……」","en":"“Now that things have come to this, this body can only perish. So long as it remains ruled by a jumble of conflicting wills, someone will eventually capture it. No matter how powerful its regenerative or psychic abilities, they are useless when the wills directing it are in chaos. It is no more than a slightly dangerous wild animal. ...But perhaps this is for the best. ...Aha, ahaha. ...It is all over now... Ahahaha...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エフゲニ・ヘス","displayName":"Yevgeny Hess","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r363","rowIndex":363,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=65>エフゲニ・イリイーチ・ヘス</tips>は力なく笑う。","en":"<tips=65>Yevgeny Ilyich Hess</tips> laughed feebly.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r364","rowIndex":364,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その様子を見ると、私たちはもう我慢が出来ない。","en":"At the sight of him, we could no longer restrain ourselves.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r365","rowIndex":365,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いいね！　その弱ってる感じ！」","en":"“That’s more like it! You look great all weak and helpless!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r366","rowIndex":366,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちの一人は指を指してそう言った。","en":"One of us pointed at him as she spoke.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r367","rowIndex":367,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「え……」","en":"“Huh...?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エフゲニ・ヘス","displayName":"Yevgeny Hess","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r368","rowIndex":368,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=65>エフゲニ・イリイーチ・ヘス</tips>は動揺している。","en":"<tips=65>Yevgeny Ilyich Hess</tips> was visibly flustered.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r369","rowIndex":369,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「永遠の幸福とか頂点とか言っているより、そうやって正直に打ちひしがれてる方が人間としてずっとチャーミングだわ」","en":"“You are far more charming as a human being when you’re honestly crushed like this than when you’re talking about eternal happiness and reaching the summit.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r370","rowIndex":370,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　別のもう一人がそう言う。","en":"said the other.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r371","rowIndex":371,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして立ち上がると二人で<tips=65>エフゲニ・イリイーチ・ヘス</tips>のそれぞれの手を取って、","en":"Then we rose, and each of us took one of <tips=65>Yevgeny Ilyich Hess’s</tips> hands.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r372","rowIndex":372,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「おじいちゃん。そのなんとかって計画は全然興味ないけど、あなたたちのお守りは面白そうだわ！」","en":"“Grandpa, we have no interest at all in that project or whatever it is, but babysitting all of you sounds like fun!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r373","rowIndex":373,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「私たち、今から何があってもあなたの味方よ。それでいいでしょ？」","en":"“From now on, no matter what happens, we’re on your side. That’s good enough, isn’t it?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F4:r374","rowIndex":374,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　目を白黒させる彼に、私たちはそう宣言をした。","en":"We made this declaration to the man, whose eyes darted in bewilderment.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}}]},{"position":36,"code":"G1","unitId":"G1","rows":[{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r1","rowIndex":1,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私の最も古い記憶は、激しい痛みと絶望でした。","en":"My oldest memory is one of terrible pain and despair.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r2","rowIndex":2,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　何による痛みか、何に対する絶望なのかは分かりません。また、その時の私が痛みや絶望といった感覚を持っていたのかどうかも分かりません。だって、その時の私といったら、そんな高度な感受性があるとは到底信じられないような生き物だったんです。","en":"I do not know what caused the pain, or what the despair was directed toward. Nor do I know whether I was even capable of sensations like pain and despair at the time. You see, what I was then was a creature one could hardly imagine possessing anything so sophisticated as those feelings.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r3","rowIndex":3,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しかし、とにかく私が昔を思い出そうとすると、その記憶の根源に、ただ真っ暗な負の感情と感覚が眠っているのを見つけてしまうのは嘘偽りのない本当のことなのです。","en":"Yet whenever I try to remember the past, I find nothing but pitch-dark, negative emotions and sensations lying dormant at the very root of my memory. That is the unvarnished truth.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r4","rowIndex":4,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その次の記憶は、テレビを見せられたり、図鑑を見せられたりしている光景でした。","en":"My next memories are of being shown things on television and pictures in illustrated encyclopedias.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r5","rowIndex":5,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　目の前に透明な壁があって、その向こうに映像があったり、本のページがあったりします。","en":"A transparent wall stands before me, and images or pages of a book appear beyond it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r6","rowIndex":6,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それらを見せてくれているのは一人の少年でした。","en":"A single boy shows them to me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r7","rowIndex":7,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼は私のために図鑑を持って来て、ページをめくって透明な壁に押しつけてくれたり、またテレビを移動して見えやすいようにしてくれるのです。","en":"He brings illustrated encyclopedias for my sake, turns the pages and presses them against the transparent wall, or moves the television into a position where I can see it more easily.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r8","rowIndex":8,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　テレビ画面の映像や、図鑑に掲載された動物の写真などははっきりと覚えているのですが、なぜかその時の少年の顔はぼんやりとしてはっきりと思い出せません。後になって論理的に考えれば、その少年が誰なのかを状況から推測は出来ます。でも、その推測があったうえでもう一度記憶を呼び戻してみても、そのぼんやり加減はちっとも変わらず、視界のなかにある他のどうでもいいものと同じようにしか思い出せないのです。","en":"I clearly remember the images upon the television and the photographs of animals in the encyclopedias. Yet for some reason, the boy’s face remains blurred and indistinct. Later, by considering the circumstances logically, I could infer who he must have been. But even when I summon the memory again with that inference in mind, the blur does not change in the slightest. I remember his face no better than any of the other inconsequential objects in my field of vision.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r9","rowIndex":9,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　もしかしたら、その頃の私は人の顔というものを特別なものと認識する能力がなかったのかもしれません。","en":"Perhaps I did not yet possess the ability to recognize a human face as something special.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r10","rowIndex":10,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　この頃の記憶は飛び飛びで、その繋がりはさっぱりとわかりません。鳥だとかが描かれた図鑑の1ページを見せられていたかと思えば、次には音楽を聴かされていたり、何にもない真っ暗な部屋を眺めていたり、とりとめもなく、意味もわかりません。","en":"My memories from this period are scattered fragments whose connections escape me completely. One moment, someone is showing me a page about birds in an illustrated encyclopedia; the next, I am listening to music, or staring into a dark and empty room. The fragments have neither sequence nor meaning.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r11","rowIndex":11,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そのうちある程度繋がりをもった記憶が始まるのですが、そうなる前の、最後の断片がとても印象的なのです。","en":"Eventually, my memories acquire a certain degree of continuity. But the final fragment before that change remains exceptionally vivid.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r12","rowIndex":12,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その断片のなかではどこか暗いところに閉じこもり、声だけが聞こえるという不思議な状態でした。","en":"In that fragment, I am shut away somewhere dark, in the peculiar position of being able to hear nothing but voices.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r13","rowIndex":13,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その声は、いつもの少年と、もっと低い声……きっと大人の男性の声でしょう。記憶のなかの私はその低さに怯えていました。","en":"One belongs to the usual boy. The other is deeper—the voice of an adult man, I imagine. In the memory, the low voice frightens me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r14","rowIndex":14,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その少年の声と、大人の男性の声は何か言い争ってます。お互いにとても感情的な声で、少年は何かを育てるよう泣きながら訴え、大人の男性はそれを否定しているのです。何について話しているのかは後になって成長するまでは気づかず、というか、この記憶自体が随分長い間思い返されることはありませんでしたが、私を廃棄するか、育てるかで口論をしていたのです。","en":"The boy and the adult man are arguing about something. Both voices are extremely emotional. The boy tearfully pleads with the man to raise something, while the man refuses. Not until much later, after I had grown, did I realize what they were discussing. Indeed, for many years I did not recall this memory at all. They were arguing over whether to discard me or raise me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r15","rowIndex":15,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　このときに廃棄されていたら、私はどうなっていたのか、ちょっと想像は出来ません。","en":"I cannot quite imagine what would have become of me if they had discarded me then.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r16","rowIndex":16,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　結局少年が口論に勝ったようで、私は無事その部屋で『目覚め』の瞬間を迎えるのでした。","en":"The boy appears to have won the argument in the end, and I was allowed to reach the moment of my “awakening” safely in that room.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r17","rowIndex":17,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ぼんやりとまぶたを開けると……その時私は初めて『まぶた』を獲得したんです。それより前の私は、『まぶた』を持っていませんでした……私はこれまでにないくらい鮮明に身のまわりのさまざまなものを知覚しました。","en":"My eyelids drifted open... That was the first time I had ever acquired “eyelids.” Before then, I had none... The world around me came into focus with a clarity I had never known.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r18","rowIndex":18,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　背中に感じる布団の柔らかい感触。肌に空調が吹き付ける風の感触。そして、見えるものも聞こえるものも、なにもかもが今までよりもくっきりと感じられるのです。","en":"The soft touch of the bedding against my back. The sensation of conditioned air blowing across my skin. Everything I saw and heard felt sharper than it ever had before.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r19","rowIndex":19,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして、辺りを見回すとがちゃがちゃした機械が並んだ地下室の光景。さらに、ほ乳瓶を持って笑っている少年の顔も、いつもよりはっきりとしています。世界というものはこれほどに色鮮やかに輝くものなのかと、私は驚いていたのです。目の前が何もかもきらきらとしていて、うっとりするくらい素敵だったんです。","en":"Looking around, I found myself in a basement cluttered with ungainly machines. The boy’s face was there too, clearer than usual, smiling as he held a baby bottle. I was astonished that the world could shine in such brilliant colors. Everything before my eyes glittered, so lovely that I could only gaze at it in wonder.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r20","rowIndex":20,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その時はただただ感動しただけなのですが、今ならこれがどういった理由で起きた変化なのかがわかります。","en":"At the time, I could only marvel. Now, I understand the reason for the change.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r21","rowIndex":21,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　はじめの、透明の壁に阻まれて風景がぼやけて見えていたのは、培養器のなかで不可思議な肉片として過ごしていた時期で、急に世界がはっきりと感じられたのは、私の姿が肉片から人間に変身し、実験者たちの手で培養器の外に取り出されたからです。","en":"The first period, when the transparent wall made the world look blurred, was the time I spent as a mysterious lump of flesh inside a culture vessel. The world suddenly came into focus because that lump of flesh had transformed into a human body, and the experimenters had removed me from the vessel.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r22","rowIndex":22,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そうなのです。私は普通の人間とは、ちょっと違う状況で成育してきたのです。","en":"You see, I grew up under circumstances a little different from those of an ordinary human being.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r23","rowIndex":23,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　だけど、それに気がつくのはもっともっと後のことでした。幼い頃は自分はどこにでもいる普通の子供だと思っていたし、まわりの人々もそのように扱っていました。","en":"But I would not realize that until much, much later. When I was little, I believed myself an ordinary child like any other, and the people around me treated me that way.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r24","rowIndex":24,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　まわりの人というのは、大きく声の低い大人の人と、大分小さい人でした。","en":"The people around me were a large, deep-voiced adult and another person who was much smaller.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r25","rowIndex":25,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　大きい人は<tips=54>汐健慈朗</tips>という名で私の父だと言い、小さい人は『<tips=1>リョウ</tips>』と名乗りました。私には『<tips=55>汐松子</tips>』という名前があるのだと二人は教えてくれます。","en":"The large man said that his name was <tips=54>Kenjiro Shio</tips> and that he was my father. The smaller one introduced himself as “<tips=1>Ryo</tips>.” Together, they taught me that my name was “<tips=55>Matsuko Shio</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r26","rowIndex":26,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　父は無口だけれど優しい人で、<tips=1>リョウ</tips>さんはよく遊びに来るお兄ちゃんでした。小さな頃は<tips=1>リョウ</tips>さんのことを本当のお兄ちゃんだと思っていたような気がします。もっとも、最初の頃は私の世界にいる人間はその二人しかいなかったので、肉親とそれ以外の区別もついていなかったのですが。","en":"Father was quiet but kind, and <tips=1>Ryo</tips> was an older boy who often came over to play. I think that when I was little, I regarded <tips=1>Ryo</tips> as my real older brother. Of course, at first those two were the only people in my world, so I could not distinguish blood relatives from anyone else.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r27","rowIndex":27,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　まあとにかく、それくらい親密な印象をもっていたということです。","en":"In any case, I simply mean that I felt that close to him.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r28","rowIndex":28,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私はずっと地下室にいて、この二人とだけ関わりました。","en":"I remained in the basement and interacted with no one but those two.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r29","rowIndex":29,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それを不自然なこととは思わなかったのですが、二人は私に世の中のことを色々と教えてくれるので、そのうちおかしいな、と思うことも少しずつ出て来ます。","en":"Nothing about it struck me as unnatural. But as the two of them taught me more and more about the world, little things gradually began to strike me as strange.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r30","rowIndex":30,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　例えば、親には父と母というものがあることを知ったときも驚きました。私には、父はあっても母というものがなかったからです。","en":"For example, I was surprised when I learned that children were supposed to have both a father and a mother. I had a father, but no such thing as a mother.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r31","rowIndex":31,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「私のお母さんは、どこにいるの？」","en":"“Where is my mother?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r32","rowIndex":32,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ある時私は父にそう尋ねました。","en":"One day, I asked Father.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r33","rowIndex":33,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「お母さんはどこか遠くに行ったまま帰ってこないけれど、いつか大人になったら会うことが出来る」","en":"“Your mother went somewhere far away and hasn’t come back. But when you’re grown, you’ll be able to see her.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐健慈朗","displayName":"Kenjiro Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r34","rowIndex":34,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　父はそう言い、私はそれを信じました。","en":"Father told me that, and I believed him.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r35","rowIndex":35,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そうして私の疑いは消えました。","en":"And so my doubt disappeared.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r36","rowIndex":36,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　他にもいくつか疑問となったことはあるのですが、それでも、私をとりまくもっと多くの不思議については、なかなか気がつくことがありませんでした。","en":"A few other questions occurred to me as well. Even so, it was a long time before I noticed the far greater mysteries surrounding my existence.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r37","rowIndex":37,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　たとえば、地下室からまったく出ことがないというのは、普通の子供ではありえないことだと思います。そして、<tips=17>タイプB</tips>として金色の目を持つ自分は、ごく幼い頃から父や<tips=1>亮</tips>さんもよりもずっと力が強く、動きが早いというのも、ちょっとおかしいことでしょう。私は疑うどころか、彼らはわざとゆっくり動いているものだとしばらくの間信じ込んでいるくらいでした。","en":"For example, it can hardly be normal for a child never to leave the basement. Then there was the fact that, as a golden-eyed <tips=17>Type B</tips>, I had been far stronger and faster than Father or <tips=1>Ryo</tips> from a very early age. Surely that was a little strange as well. Far from questioning it, for quite some time I simply believed that they were moving slowly on purpose.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r38","rowIndex":38,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その頃の私の印象を二人に聞くと、口を揃えて無感情で、無反応だったと言います。","en":"When I ask the two of them what I was like in those days, they agree that I was unemotional and unresponsive.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r39","rowIndex":39,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　小さな子供によくあるようにはしゃぎまわったり、騒いだりすることは全くなかったそうです。いつもうつろな目でぼんやりと周囲を眺めているだけで、<tips=1>リョウ</tips>さんと遊んでいても、一緒に何かをやるよりも、彼が一人で遊んでいるのを眺めているのを好み、","en":"Apparently, I never ran about excitedly or made noise as small children commonly do. I merely stared vacantly at my surroundings with empty eyes. Even when I played with <tips=1>Ryo</tips>, I preferred to watch him play alone rather than do anything together.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r40","rowIndex":40,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「退屈じゃない？」","en":"“Aren’t you bored?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮（少年時代）","displayName":"Tse Leung (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r41","rowIndex":41,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　と<tips=1>リョウ</tips>さんが聞いてくれても、","en":"Even when <tips=1>Ryo</tips> asked me that,","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r42","rowIndex":42,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「楽しい」","en":"“I’m having fun,”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r43","rowIndex":43,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　なんて、にこりともせずそう答え、本当に楽しがっているのか、そのたびに首をひねったと言います。","en":"I would answer without so much as a smile. He says that every time I did, he found himself wondering whether I was truly having fun at all.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r44","rowIndex":44,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おかしいことは他にもあって、食べ物にも、まったく執着というものがありませんでした。","en":"There were other peculiarities. I possessed no attachment at all to food.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r45","rowIndex":45,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しょっぱい、甘いといった感覚は人並みにはありますから、味覚異常というわけではないのでしょう。しかし、『美味しい』という意識を持ったことがなく、満腹感はあったがそれで喜びのようなものを感じることはなかったのです。子供というのはとても美味しそうに食べ物を食べられる時期のはずなのに、なんだか随分損をしている気がします。","en":"I could taste saltiness and sweetness as well as anyone, so I doubt there was anything wrong with my sense of taste. Yet I had never thought of anything as “delicious.” I knew when I was full, but felt no pleasure in it. Children are supposed to be able to enjoy their food so wonderfully; I cannot help feeling that I missed out rather badly.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r46","rowIndex":46,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私はもう本当に食べるのが楽しくなくて、だから食事の時間は面倒で仕方がありませんでした。","en":"I truly took no pleasure in eating, and mealtimes were an intolerable chore.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r47","rowIndex":47,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　当時私の食べ物は、ハウスキーパーが毎日作ってくれていました。","en":"At the time, a housekeeper prepared my food every day.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r48","rowIndex":48,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　栄養バランスを考えて、いつも三種類以上のおかずとスープが作られ、当然ながら一品ずつ別の皿に盛られているのですが、私には、それを一々順番に食べるということが、どうにも不必要な作業をしているように感じられ、煩わしかったのです。","en":"With nutritional balance in mind, the housekeeper always prepared at least three side dishes and a soup, naturally serving each in its own dish. To me, eating each one separately, bite after bite, felt like a wholly unnecessary procedure. I found it terribly tiresome.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r49","rowIndex":49,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　だから、人前でやると怒られるのですが、周りに人がいない時には大きな丼を用意して、主食もおかずもスープも一緒くたにし、スプーンでぐちゃぐちゃにかき混ぜてから食べました。","en":"So, although I would be scolded for doing it in front of anyone, whenever I was alone I took out a large bowl, dumped in the staple food, side dishes, and soup together, stirred the whole mess into a mush with a spoon, and ate it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r50","rowIndex":50,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　時には、すべてミキサーにかけてジュース状にしてから大きなストローで飲むこともあったくらいです。","en":"Sometimes I even put everything through a blender until it was liquid, then drank it through a large straw.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r51","rowIndex":51,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　世の中には水を入れて混ぜるだけで必要な栄養素が全てとれるという粉末などもありますが、この街ではなかなか手に入りませんし、父がそういうものを好まなかったので取り寄せて家に置くということもありません。","en":"There are powdered products that provide every necessary nutrient simply by adding water and mixing, but they were difficult to obtain in this city, and Father disliked such things, so he never ordered any to keep at home.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r52","rowIndex":52,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そしてその頃の私はそういったものの存在自体を知りませんでした。ですが、私の考えた食べ方は奇しくもその製品と同じようなかたちになっていたのです。","en":"At the time, I did not even know such products existed. By sheer coincidence, however, the method of eating I devised was much the same as using one of them.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r53","rowIndex":53,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ミキサーを洗ったりする手間は増えるものの、食事をしながら他のことがなんでも出来るので、食事中にいつも感じる退屈感がなく、とても気にいっていたのですが、何かの拍子でそれを<tips=1>リョウ</tips>さんに見つかってしまうと、えらく叱られました。","en":"Washing the blender meant extra work, but I could do anything I pleased while I ate, without the boredom that ordinarily plagued me at mealtimes. I was extremely fond of the method. When <tips=1>Ryo</tips> happened to catch me at it, however, he gave me a tremendous scolding.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r54","rowIndex":54,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　まあ、今の私がそんなふうに食べている子供を見ても、叱りつけると思います。","en":"Still, if I saw a child eating that way now, I imagine I would scold them too.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r55","rowIndex":55,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いつもそんな風にやってるけど、それってどんな味がするのさ？」","en":"“You always do this, but what does it even taste like?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮（少年時代）","displayName":"Tse Leung (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r56","rowIndex":56,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　あるとき、<tips=1>リョウ</tips>さんはそう尋ねました。","en":"One day, <tips=1>Ryo</tips> asked me that.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r57","rowIndex":57,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ちょっとくれる？」","en":"“Can I have a little?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮（少年時代）","displayName":"Tse Leung (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r58","rowIndex":58,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼が興味を持ったので、私は怒られるのを覚悟しながら手渡します。","en":"When he showed interest, I handed it over, bracing myself to be scolded.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r59","rowIndex":59,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼は一口飲むと目を白黒させて、","en":"He took one swallow and his eyes went wide in shock.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r60","rowIndex":60,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「よくこんなものが飲めるね。とても人間の口にするものじゃない」","en":"“How can you drink this? This isn’t something a human being could drink.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮（少年時代）","displayName":"Tse Leung (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r61","rowIndex":61,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　と言いました。","en":"he said.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r62","rowIndex":62,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その日の夕食は、白身魚の西京焼きがメインで、デザートは小さなチーズケーキだったように覚えています。","en":"As I recall, the main course that evening was white fish grilled in Saikyo-style miso, followed by a small cheesecake for dessert.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r63","rowIndex":63,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「みんなが食べているものと同じだよ」","en":"“It’s the same food everyone else eats.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r64","rowIndex":64,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　味というものの善し悪しがわからない私は、<tips=1>リョウ</tips>さんの言うことがわかりません。","en":"Unable to judge whether a flavor was good or bad, I did not understand what <tips=1>Ryo</tips> meant.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r65","rowIndex":65,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「犬や猫は残飯を混ぜても普通に食べるけどさ。きみは人間なんだからもっと味わいとかも気にしなきゃ」","en":"“Dogs and cats will eat leftovers all mixed together, but you’re a human being. You need to care a little more about flavor.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮（少年時代）","displayName":"Tse Leung (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r66","rowIndex":66,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>リョウ</tips>さんはこのように酷評をしましたが、とにかくそれが、当時の私にとっては一番好きな食事の食べ方で、これを飲みながらテレビで映画などをみて「わあ」と目を丸くして驚いたりしている時が最高に幸せな時間でした。","en":"That was <tips=1>Ryo’s</tips> scathing verdict. Even so, it was my favorite way to eat at the time. My happiest moments were spent drinking it while watching a film on television, staring wide-eyed at the screen and exclaiming, “Wow!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r67","rowIndex":67,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　最近も時々やったりしてみるのですが、あの時の<tips=1>リョウ</tips>さんが言ったほど気持ち悪くもなく、案外平気でしたので、味覚というものは結局変化しないものなのでしょう。今でも私は犬か猫みたいなものなのかもしれません。","en":"Even now, I occasionally try eating that way. I do not find it nearly as revolting as <tips=1>Ryo</tips> did, and can manage it surprisingly well, so perhaps one’s sense of taste never changes after all. Perhaps I am still something like a dog or cat even now.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r68","rowIndex":68,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして、私が無頓着だったのは味だけではなく、自分の痛みに対してもそうでした。","en":"Food was not the only thing toward which I was indifferent. The same was true of my own pain.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r69","rowIndex":69,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　たとえば、切り傷などをしてぱっくり開いたところを、無表情に指で弄り続けて血みどろにしたりすることもありました。","en":"For example, I would sometimes stare blankly at a gaping cut and keep prodding it with my finger until I had made a bloody mess of it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r70","rowIndex":70,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　痛みを感じないわけではないのですが、感じたからといってどうとも思わなかったのです。へえ、痛みというものはこんな感じ方をするのか、というような気持ちで、興味深く頷いたりしていた姿を父さんに目撃されています。","en":"It was not that I felt no pain. I simply did not think anything of it when I did. Father once caught me nodding with interest, as if thinking, Oh, so this is what pain feels like.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r71","rowIndex":71,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　これに関しては、今でもまったくかわりません。いよいよ私は成長をしていないのかと、なんだか悲しくなってしまいますね。","en":"In this respect, I have not changed at all. It leaves me rather sadly wondering whether I have grown up at all.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r72","rowIndex":72,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しかも、このことは、もっと重要な他の問題を私のなかに作りました。","en":"Worse, this indifference gave rise to another, far more serious problem.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r73","rowIndex":73,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　自分の痛みを気にしないせいか、他の生命に関しても無頓着だったのです。","en":"Perhaps because I cared so little about my own pain, I was equally indifferent to the lives of other creatures.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r74","rowIndex":74,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　幼い子供の多くは命に対して共感性も理解もなく残酷になりがちな性質があるものですが、私の場合は常軌を逸したところがあったように思います。","en":"Many young children tend toward cruelty because they lack both an understanding of life and sympathy for it. In my case, however, I believe it went beyond all normal bounds.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r75","rowIndex":75,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　例えば、部屋の端をネズミが走っていると素早く追いついてつかみ取り、手の中でポキンと首を折る。それを見た<tips=1>リョウ</tips>さんが驚いて目を丸くしているのに、","en":"If a mouse darted along the edge of the room, for example, I would race after it, snatch it up, and snap its neck in my hand. Though <tips=1>Ryo</tips> stared at me wide-eyed, I merely said,","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r76","rowIndex":76,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「きっとこれがお父さんのおつまみをよく食べてるやつだね」","en":"“This must be the one that keeps eating Father’s snacks.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r77","rowIndex":77,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は平然と言って、何事もなかったようにペダルを踏みゴミ箱の蓋を開けると、ネズミを落とし、手を洗ったそうです。","en":"I am told that I said this quite matter-of-factly, then stepped on the pedal to open the trash can, dropped the mouse inside as though nothing had happened, and washed my hands.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r78","rowIndex":78,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　また、テレビで人や動物が残酷な死に方をするのを見ても、顔色一つ変えなかったと言います。","en":"They also say that my expression did not change when I watched people or animals die gruesome deaths on television.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r79","rowIndex":79,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「生きてるってどういうことかわかる？」","en":"“Do you understand what it means to be alive?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮（少年時代）","displayName":"Tse Leung (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r80","rowIndex":80,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　あるとき<tips=1>リョウ</tips>さんはそう尋ねました。","en":"<tips=1>Ryo</tips> once asked me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r81","rowIndex":81,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……内臓とか、身体の仕組みがちゃんと働いて、動いてる状態？」","en":"“...The organs and other structures of the body are functioning properly, and it can move?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r82","rowIndex":82,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それだけ？」","en":"“Is that all?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮（少年時代）","displayName":"Tse Leung (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r83","rowIndex":83,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「他に何かあるの？　この間教えてくれたのは、そこまでだよ」","en":"“Is there something else? That’s all you taught me last time.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r84","rowIndex":84,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私はそういって首をかしげました。","en":"I said, tilting my head.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r85","rowIndex":85,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　こういった場合、<tips=1>リョウ</tips>さんも父もいちいち指摘はしませんでした。あれが違うこれが違うと指摘するのは、私によくない影響を与えそうだし、家のなかにいる限りは極力個性として受け入れる方針をとっていたのだそうです。","en":"In situations like these, neither <tips=1>Ryo</tips> nor Father corrected me every single time. They later explained that constantly telling me this was wrong and that was wrong might have affected me badly, so while I remained inside the house, their policy was to accept as much of it as possible as part of my individuality.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r86","rowIndex":86,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しかし、いつまでもそうは言っていられません。いずれは家の外に出さなくてはならず、そうしたらよくない目立ち方をしてしまう可能性がある、と二人は判断しました。","en":"But they could not go on that way forever. Eventually, I would have to leave the house, and they decided there was a risk that I might attract the wrong kind of attention.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r87","rowIndex":87,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=54>汐さん</tips>。僕、明日<tips=55>松子</tips>を外に連れ出すよ」","en":"“<tips=54>Mr. Shio</tips>, I’m taking <tips=55>Matsuko</tips> outside tomorrow.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮（少年時代）","displayName":"Tse Leung (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r88","rowIndex":88,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>リョウ</tips>さんは中学生になったばかりの頃、そう父に言ったのだそうです。","en":"<tips=1>Ryo</tips> said this to Father shortly after entering middle school, or so I am told.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r89","rowIndex":89,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼はその一、二年の間にすっかり性格が大人びていました。","en":"Over those one or two years, he had grown markedly more mature in temperament.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r90","rowIndex":90,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それは、彼の置かれた環境にあったのでしょう。","en":"I imagine the cause lay in the circumstances in which he found himself.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r91","rowIndex":91,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼は中華料理屋に預けられていたのですが、その時期は本当の母親の家に帰ることが増えていました。","en":"He had been taken in by the family who ran a Chinese restaurant, but around that time he began spending more and more time at his biological mother’s home.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r92","rowIndex":92,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　なぜかというと、彼のお母さんがついに<tips=17>タイプB</tips>を発症してしまい、妹さんと共にその世話をしていたからです。","en":"That was because his mother had finally developed <tips=17>Type B</tips>, and he and his younger sister were caring for her together.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r93","rowIndex":93,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私や父の前で直接的な話をすることはなかったのですが、ふさぎこんだり、暗い表情をすることが多くなっていました。街でも、悪い子供たちとのつき合いが増えた時期です。睡眠もあまりとれていないらしく、目の下にはいつもクマが浮かんでいました。","en":"He never spoke of the matter directly to Father or me, but he grew withdrawn and increasingly often wore a dark expression. This was also when he began spending more time with the city's delinquent children. Apparently, he was getting very little sleep; there were always dark circles under his eyes.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r94","rowIndex":94,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そういう大変な時期だったのですが、時間を見ては家に来て、私に接してくれていました。","en":"Despite living through such a difficult time, he visited the house whenever he could and spent time with me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r95","rowIndex":95,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして、そんなふうに外に連れ出すという提案までしてくれたのです。その頃には地下室だけでなく、家の中を自由に歩くことを許されていましたが、まだ玄関を出たことはありませんでした。","en":"He even went so far as to propose taking me outside. By then, I was allowed to leave the basement and walk freely through the house, but I had never once crossed the threshold of the front door.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r96","rowIndex":96,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　突然そんなことを言い出したのは、その翌年に私を中学校にあげる予定だったからです。だから<tips=1>リョウ</tips>さんは、それまでに一般的な振る舞い方を私に身につけさせたかったのだと言います。","en":"The reason for his sudden proposal was that I was due to start middle school the following year. <tips=1>Ryo</tips> says he wanted me to learn how ordinary people behaved before then.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r97","rowIndex":97,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「すまないなあ。本当は、おれがやらなきゃならないんだが」","en":"“I’m sorry. I should really be doing this myself.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐健慈朗","displayName":"Kenjiro Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r98","rowIndex":98,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　父はそれを切り出されたとき、申し訳なさそうにしていたと言います。","en":"Father says he felt terribly apologetic when Ryo broached the subject.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r99","rowIndex":99,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いいんだよ。僕には責任があるから」","en":"“It’s all right. I have a responsibility of my own.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮（少年時代）","displayName":"Tse Leung (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r100","rowIndex":100,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「責任？」","en":"“A responsibility?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐健慈朗","displayName":"Kenjiro Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r101","rowIndex":101,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=55>松子</tips>を育てるって言ったのは僕なんだ。だから、絶対一人前にする」","en":"“I’m the one who said we should raise <tips=55>Matsuko</tips>. So I’m going to make absolutely sure she grows into someone who can stand on her own.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮（少年時代）","displayName":"Tse Leung (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r102","rowIndex":102,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=1>亮</tips>……」","en":"“<tips=1>Ryo</tips>...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐健慈朗","displayName":"Kenjiro Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r103","rowIndex":103,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　父は<tips=1>リョウ</tips>さんはとても真剣に私のことを考えてくれていたんだぞ、と、今でもよく口にします。","en":"Even now, Father often tells me that <tips=1>Ryo</tips> took my future very seriously indeed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r104","rowIndex":104,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　はじめて<tips=1>リョウ</tips>さんと二人で家の外に出た日のことを、私はよく覚えています。","en":"I remember very well the first day <tips=1>Ryo</tips> and I went outside together.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r105","rowIndex":105,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=9>Y地区</tips>には珍しい、雲一つなく良く晴れた日でした。","en":"It was a clear day without a cloud in the sky, a rarity in <tips=9>Y District</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r106","rowIndex":106,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　これまで家の中でだけ過ごすことを、私は一度も不満として感じたことはありませんでした。私にとっては他の多くのことがらと同様、その点についても欲求というものを持たなかったのです。まだ出ない方がいいと言われれば、特に疑問もなく従順に従っていました。","en":"I had never once felt dissatisfied with spending all my time inside the house. As with so many other things, I simply had no desire one way or the other. If they told me it would be better not to go out yet, I obediently did as I was told without questioning it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r107","rowIndex":107,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しかし、実際出てみると世界は、私にとっては珍しく『感動』をもたらしました。","en":"When I actually emerged, however, the world did something rare: it moved me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r108","rowIndex":108,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　今にして思えば、雑然とした路地を少し歩いたに過ぎません。","en":"Looking back now, we did no more than walk a short distance through cluttered lanes.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r109","rowIndex":109,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　特別に美しい自然を見に行ったわけでも、荘厳な建造物を見たわけでもないのです。","en":"We had not gone to see some place of extraordinary natural beauty, nor any majestic work of architecture.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r110","rowIndex":110,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　商店に並んだ雑貨を見たり、空き地に咲いたタンポポに触ったりしただけです。テレビではもっと特別な景色を沢山みてきたし、なんなら部屋の窓から見える光景ともさほどかわりません。","en":"All I did was look at the odds and ends arrayed in the shops and touch the dandelions growing in an empty lot. I had seen any number of far more extraordinary sights on television; for that matter, none of this was so very different from the view through my bedroom window.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r111","rowIndex":111,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しかし、実際自分が初めて外に出て見てみると、すべてが新鮮に感じられたのです。","en":"And yet, when I went outside and saw them for myself, everything felt new.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r112","rowIndex":112,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は珍しく興奮し、目をきらきらと輝かせ、顔を真っ赤にしていたそうです。しかし、赤くなっただけで、笑ったり、多弁になったりするわけでもなく、むしろ普段よりさらに無口になってしまっていました。","en":"I am told that I was unusually excited, my eyes sparkling and my face flushed bright red. Yet I did not smile or grow talkative. If anything, I became even quieter than usual.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r113","rowIndex":113,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あれ、熱でも出たの？」","en":"“What’s wrong? Do you have a fever?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r114","rowIndex":114,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　と<tips=1>リョウ</tips>さんが心配してその額に手を当てるほどだったと言います。","en":"<tips=1>Ryo</tips> was concerned enough to lay a hand against my forehead, or so he later told me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r115","rowIndex":115,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>リョウ</tips>さんはその日、空き地で私に『命』というものについて教えてくれました。","en":"That day, in an empty lot, <tips=1>Ryo</tips> taught me about this thing called “life.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r116","rowIndex":116,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　まず彼は空き地の端にクロオオアリの巣を見つけ、私を呼びつけると、それを取り囲むように二人で座ります。","en":"First he found a nest of black carpenter ants at the edge of the lot. He called me over, and together we crouched around it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r117","rowIndex":117,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　はじめて本物のアリが動いているところを見て目を丸くしている私に、<tips=1>リョウ</tips>さんは木の棒を手渡しました。","en":"My eyes widened at my first sight of real ants moving. <tips=1>Ryo</tips> handed me a wooden stick.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r118","rowIndex":118,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「これで蟻を潰してごらん」","en":"“Try crushing the ants with this.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮（少年時代）","displayName":"Tse Leung (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r119","rowIndex":119,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は言われるまま、コンクリートに行列を作って餌を運ぶ蟻を木の棒の先端で潰しました。","en":"I did as I was told and used the tip of the stick to crush the ants marching across the concrete in a line, carrying food.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r120","rowIndex":120,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「もっと、もっと。……うん、それくらいでいい。もう返して」","en":"“More. More... Yes, that’s enough. Give it back now.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮（少年時代）","displayName":"Tse Leung (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r121","rowIndex":121,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ある程度潰したところで<tips=1>リョウ</tips>さんは手をさしのべ、木の棒を受け取ります。","en":"Once I had crushed enough of them, <tips=1>Ryo</tips> held out his hand and took back the stick.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r122","rowIndex":122,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いまきみが潰したこっちの蟻は、もう動かなくなってる。これが『死んでる』ってことだ」","en":"“The ants you crushed have stopped moving. That is what it means to be dead.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮（少年時代）","displayName":"Tse Leung (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r123","rowIndex":123,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　木の棒の先端で、胴体を潰されてコンクリートに貼りついた蟻の死体を指しました。","en":"With the tip of the stick, he pointed to the body of an ant, its torso crushed and flattened against the concrete.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r124","rowIndex":124,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「こうなったら、もう元通り動くようなことはない。このまま他の生き物の餌になるだけだ」","en":"“Once this happens, it will never move the way it did before. Now it can only become food for another living creature.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r125","rowIndex":125,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　言って、<tips=1>リョウ</tips>さんは私の顔を見たそうです。","en":"Having said this, <tips=1>Ryo</tips> looked into my face, or so I am told.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r126","rowIndex":126,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その時私は無表情に棒の先を見つめていたと言います。","en":"He tells me that I stared expressionlessly at the end of the stick.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r127","rowIndex":127,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　何を考えていたのか、はっきりとは思い出せませんが、うまく理解出来ずに混乱していたような気がします。","en":"I cannot clearly remember what I was thinking, but I seem to recall being confused, unable to make sense of it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r128","rowIndex":128,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「蟻はたくさんいる。僕らからするとどれも見分けがつかなくて、一匹殺しても意味なんかないような気がするけれど、きみがいま潰した一匹一匹には、別々の一生がある。卵から幼虫になって、成虫になって、狩りをして……全部、ほかにかわりがない一匹だ。彼らの一生はきみがここで終わらせてしまった。そしてもう誰もこの蟻を元に戻すことは出来ない。潰すのはちょっと棒で押すだけだけど、一度やってしまったら、世界で一番賢い人でも、偉い人でも、取り戻すことは出来ないんだ」","en":"“There are countless ants. To us, they all look alike, and killing one may seem meaningless. But every single ant you just crushed had a life of its own. It hatched from an egg, became a larva, grew into an adult, went out in search of food... Every one was a unique, irreplaceable creature. You brought each of those lives to an end here. And now no one can restore a single one of them. Crushing an ant takes no more than a little pressure from a stick, but once it is done, not even the wisest or most powerful person in the world can bring that life back.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮（少年時代）","displayName":"Tse Leung (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r129","rowIndex":129,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「特別な一匹一匹を、とりもどすことが出来ない……？」","en":"“Each one is special, and none of them can be brought back...?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r130","rowIndex":130,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そこで私ははっとして<tips=1>リョウ</tips>さんの顔を見つめました。彼は頷きを返します。","en":"At that, I looked up sharply and stared into <tips=1>Ryo’s</tips> face. He nodded in reply.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r131","rowIndex":131,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それにね、こちらの潰さなかった方は今は生きているけど、これだってずっと生きているわけじゃなくて、いずれ死ぬんだ。寿命やら、他の生き物に襲われるやらでね。世の中には永遠に生き続けるものなんかない。生物はいつか死んで、この潰れた蟻みたいになるって決まっている。猫や犬だって、人間だって、みんなだ」","en":"“And the ants over here, the ones you didn’t crush, are alive now. But that doesn’t mean they’ll live forever. One day they’ll die of old age or be attacked by another creature. Nothing in this world lives forever. Every living thing is destined to die one day and become like this crushed ant. Cats and dogs, human beings—everyone.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮（少年時代）","displayName":"Tse Leung (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r132","rowIndex":132,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「全員……」","en":"“Everyone...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r133","rowIndex":133,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうさ。僕も、<tips=54>汐さん</tips>も、それにきみだっていつかは倒れる。その死は、知らない人からみれば僕と<tips=54>汐さん</tips>の違いもわからないし、何の意味もないものだろう。僕らがこうして蟻を見ても区別がつかないように……」","en":"“That’s right. One day I’ll die, and so will Mr. <tips=54>Shio</tips>—and you, too. To strangers, there would be no telling the difference between my death and Mr. <tips=54>Shio’s</tips>, and neither would mean anything. Just as we can’t tell these ants apart when we look at them like this...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮（少年時代）","displayName":"Tse Leung (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r134","rowIndex":134,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　言われてまた私は蟻の亡骸に目を向けました。","en":"At his words, I looked down at the dead ants again.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r135","rowIndex":135,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「僕は『生き物を殺すな』と言うつもりはない。そんな馬鹿げたことは言わない。食べるためにも、生きるためにも殺すことは必要だ。身体に入った細菌は退治しなくちゃいけないし、脅威となる敵は排除しなくちゃいけない。それでいいんだ。……僕が言いたいのはそんなことじゃなくて、どんなときでも、自分の行為がどういうものか、ちゃんと考えて欲しいということだけだ。きみがこれから何かの命を奪うときは、奪っている命がどんなものか考えた上でやるといい。それなら僕は文句は言わない」","en":"“I’m not going to tell you never to kill a living thing. I wouldn’t say anything so foolish. We have to kill in order to eat and in order to live. We have to destroy bacteria that enter our bodies, and eliminate enemies that threaten us. There is nothing wrong with that. ...But that isn’t what I’m trying to say. I only want you always to think carefully about what it is you are doing. Whenever you take a life from now on, think first about the life you mean to take. If you do that, I won’t object.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮（少年時代）","displayName":"Tse Leung (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r136","rowIndex":136,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「わかった」","en":"“I understand.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r137","rowIndex":137,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「本当？」","en":"“Do you really?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮（少年時代）","displayName":"Tse Leung (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r138","rowIndex":138,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「うん」","en":"“Yes.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r139","rowIndex":139,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私はこくりと頷きましたが、実際のところよく理解は出来ませんでした。","en":"I nodded once, but in truth, I understood very little.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r140","rowIndex":140,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ただ、<tips=1>リョウ</tips>さんの声のトーンで、何か取り返しのつかないことをしてしまったのだろうと、胸が苦しくなるほど不安になったのは覚えています。","en":"I do remember that the tone of <tips=1>Ryo’s</tips> voice made me fear I had done something irreversible. The anxiety became so intense that my chest hurt.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r141","rowIndex":141,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私にとって<tips=1>リョウ</tips>さんと父は絶対的な存在で、このようなトーンで喋られるだけで、恐ろしくなってしまうのでした。","en":"<tips=1>Ryo</tips> and Father were absolute presences in my world. Merely hearing either of them speak in such a tone was enough to terrify me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r142","rowIndex":142,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　とにかく、これ以降、私は無意味に小動物を殺すことはしなくなったそうです。","en":"In any event, I am told that after this day, I no longer killed small animals for no reason.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r143","rowIndex":143,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　理屈を理解したというよりも、動物を殺すたびにこの不安と恐怖を感じるようになっていったのだと思います。","en":"Rather than understanding his argument, I think I began to experience that anxiety and fear whenever I killed an animal.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r144","rowIndex":144,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　これに関しては、はっきり成長出来たと言っていいでしょう。","en":"In this respect, I think it is fair to say that I had unquestionably grown.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r145","rowIndex":145,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私はもう、平穏な気持ちで何かを殺すことは出来ません。","en":"I can no longer kill anything and remain at peace.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r146","rowIndex":146,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　さて、私はそんなへんてこな子供だったわけですが、こうして、周囲の人の努力によって家の外へ出され、そして地域の子供たちとも遊ぶようになりました。","en":"So I was a peculiar child. Yet through the efforts of those around me, I was brought out of the house and began to play with the other children of the neighborhood.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r147","rowIndex":147,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>リョウ</tips>さんはこのとき私のことを身体が弱くて家から出られなかった汐家の一人娘だと紹介してくれました。私は、身体は同年代と同じくらいに成長していたので、そういう意味では特に違和感は与えなかったと思います。","en":"<tips=1>Ryo</tips> introduced me as the Shio family’s only daughter, a sickly girl who had been unable to leave the house. Physically, I had grown to look about the same age as the other children, so in that respect I doubt I seemed unusual.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r148","rowIndex":148,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ただ、性格はなかなか同じようにとはいかず、突拍子もない行動をしてまわりの子たちを驚かせてばかりだったようです。しかしそれも、私の金色に光る目をみれば、そういうものかと理解してくれたようで、みなが私を仲間として受け入れてくれるまでそう長い時間はかかりませんでした。","en":"My personality, however, was another matter. I apparently startled the other children again and again with my outlandish behavior. Yet the sight of my shining golden eyes seemed to satisfy them that this was simply how I was, and it did not take long for everyone to accept me as one of their own.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r149","rowIndex":149,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=58>パラシュート通り</tips>周辺は商店や飲食店が多く、友だちもそうした店の子ばかりでした。","en":"There were many shops and restaurants around <tips=58>Parachute Street</tips>, and nearly all my friends came from families who ran one of them.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r150","rowIndex":150,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=9>Y地区</tips>はだいたいどこもそうですが他の場所と比べても比較的日本人が少なく、様々な髪や肌の色の子が多い地域でした。","en":"Most of <tips=9>Y District</tips> was like this, but even by its standards our neighborhood had relatively few Japanese residents and many children with all different colors of hair and skin.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r151","rowIndex":151,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　みな家が商売をしていてそれなりに生活が安定しており、裏通りの子たちに比べるとおっとりとしたところがあったのですが、やはり子供というのは荒っぽいもので、よく地域のグループの間で喧嘩がありました。","en":"Every family operated a business and enjoyed some stability, leaving the children gentler than those from the back streets. But children are rough creatures all the same, and neighborhood groups often fought one another.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r152","rowIndex":152,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私もそれに参加したことがあります。だけれど、一度相手に大けがをさせてからは<tips=1>リョウ</tips>さんの側で見ているだけになりました。喧嘩相手のなかには<tips=17>タイプB</tips>の子もたくさんいたのですが、自分とその子たちを比べても、かなり違うことに気がつき始めていたのです。","en":"I took part myself on one occasion. After I badly injured an opponent, however, I did no more than watch from <tips=1>Ryo’s</tips> side. Many of the children we fought were <tips=17>Type Bs</tips>, but by comparing myself with them, I was beginning to notice how greatly I differed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r153","rowIndex":153,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　他の子は興奮したときだけ目が金色になり身体が強くなるけれど、私は２４時間金色のまま力を使えます。","en":"The other children’s eyes turned gold and their bodies grew stronger only when they became excited. My own eyes remained gold around the clock, and I could draw on my strength at any time.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r154","rowIndex":154,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=17>タイプB</tips>は全体的に傷の治りなどが早いと言いますが、それはあくまでも常人と比較してやっとわかるくらいのもので、私のようにみるみる傷口が治ってゆくようなものではありません。","en":"<tips=17>Type Bs</tips> were generally said to recover from wounds more quickly, but the difference was only just noticeable when they were compared with ordinary people. Their wounds did not close visibly before one’s eyes as mine did.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r155","rowIndex":155,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=17>タイプB</tips>の性質は人によってかなり違う、ということですけれど、それでも誰かと誰かは似通った性質を持ったりといったような傾向はあるのです。","en":"People said that <tips=17>Type B</tips> traits varied considerably from one person to another. Nevertheless, patterns existed, and one person’s traits would resemble another’s.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r156","rowIndex":156,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しかし自分は誰とも似ていないのでした。","en":"I resembled no one.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r157","rowIndex":157,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それを恥ずかしく思い、あまり目立つような行動は避け、カラーコンタクトを付けるようになったのもそのころからです。","en":"I was ashamed of that fact. I began avoiding conspicuous behavior and wearing colored contact lenses around the same time.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r158","rowIndex":158,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　暴力を振るうことも、最初は何も感じなかったのですが、次第にとてもいやなものになっていました。","en":"At first, I felt nothing when I used violence, either. Gradually, however, it became deeply unpleasant to me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r159","rowIndex":159,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　人が殴られたり、怪我をすると、あの死のイメージが呼び出され、胸騒ぎが起きるようになってしまったのです。","en":"Whenever someone was struck or injured, that image of death would return, and a nervous dread would stir in my chest.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r160","rowIndex":160,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　こういうとき、例えば自分が殴っている方にも拘わらず、何故だか自分が痛いような気持ちになってしまうのが不思議でした。","en":"At times like this, even when I was the one doing the hitting, I found it strange that I somehow felt as though I myself were in pain.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r161","rowIndex":161,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しかも、それは実際に自分が殴られるのと違って、胸が苦しくなるようなつらさをともなった痛みなのです。","en":"What was more, unlike the pain of actually being hit myself, this pain came with an anguish that made my chest tighten.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r162","rowIndex":162,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は誰とも争うのがいやになり、なるべく彼らと協調することにしました。","en":"I came to hate being at odds with anyone and decided to get along with the others as best I could.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r163","rowIndex":163,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そのために、終始へらへらと笑うようになり、言葉遣いも丁寧にするよう気をつけたのです。","en":"To that end, I began keeping a silly smile plastered on my face and took care always to speak politely.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r164","rowIndex":164,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>リョウ</tips>さんは「嘘臭くて気持ち悪い」と顔を顰めましたが、私は「みんなと仲良くやりたいだけです」と笑うだけでした。","en":"<tips=1>Ryo</tips> grimaced and called it “creepy and fake.” I merely smiled and answered, “I only want to get along with everyone.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r165","rowIndex":165,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　でも、こういう子供の喧嘩は悪いことばかりではなかったように思います。","en":"Yet I do not think those childhood fights were entirely bad.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r166","rowIndex":166,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その結果、新しい友だちも増えました。<tips=59>暗闇通り</tips>の子供たちのリーダーだった<tips=10>見土</tips>さんと知り合ったのも、<tips=1>リョウ</tips>さんが<tips=58>パラシュート通り</tips>のリーダーとして喧嘩の指揮をとるようになってからだと思います。","en":"As a result, I made new friends. I believe I met <tips=10>Michio</tips>, who led the children of <tips=59>Darkness Street</tips>, after <tips=1>Ryo</tips> began directing fights as the leader of <tips=58>Parachute Street</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r167","rowIndex":167,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　最初に<tips=10>見土</tips>さんと会った頃の私はまだ笑わないし、言葉も丁寧ではなかったので、今でも時々<tips=10>見土</tips>さんから「昔はなんだかこわかったよ」とからかわれたりします。","en":"When I first met <tips=10>Michio</tips>, I still never smiled, and I wasn't very polite in the way I spoke, so even now <tips=10>Michio</tips> sometimes teases me: “You were kind of scary back then.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r168","rowIndex":168,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　でもとにかく、私は争いごとがいやになりました。","en":"But in any case, I came to hate conflict.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r169","rowIndex":169,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それを避けるために、笑顔の他にも、たとえば私は他の人よりも多くの小遣いを父から与えられていましたが、それも、言われるままに分け与えてしまいました。","en":"To avoid it, I did more than smile. For example, Father gave me more pocket money than most children, but I would hand even that out to anyone who asked.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r170","rowIndex":170,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　だから、いつも何も持っていませんでした。","en":"Consequently, I never had anything left.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r171","rowIndex":171,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　また、何をされても怒らないようにしていたので、よく騙されて巻き上げられたりもしました。","en":"And because I tried never to become angry, no matter what anyone did to me, people often deceived me and took my money.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r172","rowIndex":172,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　こういうとき、<tips=1>リョウ</tips>さんはあきれて、","en":"At times like these, <tips=1>Ryo</tips> would stare at me in exasperation.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r173","rowIndex":173,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どうしてバカみたいに全部人にやっちゃうんだ？」","en":"“Why do you give everything away like an idiot?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮（少年時代）","displayName":"Tse Leung (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r174","rowIndex":174,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「別に何にも欲しいものなんかないし。お金なんかいらないんです」","en":"“There isn’t anything I particularly want. I don’t need money.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r175","rowIndex":175,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その時も私はヘラヘラと笑っており、<tips=1>リョウ</tips>さんは不思議な顔をしました。","en":"I was smiling foolishly then as well, and <tips=1>Ryo</tips> gave me a peculiar look.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r176","rowIndex":176,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　すると彼は顔を顰め、","en":"Then he frowned.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r177","rowIndex":177,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それはいけない。きみは自己が希薄すぎるんだ。昔からずっとそうだよ」","en":"“That’s no good. You hardly have any sense of self at all. You’ve always been like that.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮（少年時代）","displayName":"Tse Leung (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r178","rowIndex":178,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そう言うので、そうか私は自分というものがないのだと、その言葉によって気づかされるのでした。","en":"It was only when he said this that I realized: so I had no self of my own.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r179","rowIndex":179,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そうやって外に出るようになってから時間が過ぎたある日のことでした。","en":"Then, one day, after I had been going outside for some time, something happened.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r180","rowIndex":180,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　普通なら中学校に行くくらいの年齢だと思いますが、私たちの仲間で学校に行くものはなく、みな自由にしていました。","en":"I believe we were about the age when ordinary children would have started middle school. None of our group attended school, however, and everyone was free to do as they pleased.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r181","rowIndex":181,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>リョウ</tips>さんは<tips=10>見土</tips>さんと共に、喧嘩や荒っぽいことばかりしています。","en":"<tips=1>Ryo</tips> and <tips=10>Michio</tips> did little but fight and engage in other rough behavior.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r182","rowIndex":182,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼は<tips=10>見土</tips>さんと一緒にいるのが本当に楽しかったのでしょう。","en":"He must truly have enjoyed being with <tips=10>Michio</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r183","rowIndex":183,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして、もう喧嘩には参加する気がなくなっていた私は一人で遊びに行くことが増えました。","en":"I had lost all interest in joining their fights, and increasingly went off to play by myself.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r184","rowIndex":184,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その時も、私はミカちゃんという仲の良い友人の家に一人で遊びに行ったのです。","en":"On this particular day, I visited the home of a close friend named Mika by myself.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r185","rowIndex":185,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ミカちゃんは<tips=17>タイプB</tips>で、明るく社交的な少女でした。彼女が一緒にクッキーを作ろうと誘い、私はそれに従ったのです。","en":"Mika was a bright and sociable <tips=17>Type B</tips> girl. She invited me to bake cookies together, and I agreed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r186","rowIndex":186,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私はミカちゃんのことが好きだったので、それはいつもの単なる無抵抗ではなく、楽しみを感じながらのお出かけでした。","en":"I liked Mika, so this was not merely another instance of my usual passive compliance. It was an outing I genuinely looked forward to.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r187","rowIndex":187,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あとはもう焼き上がるのを待つだけだね」","en":"“Now all we have to do is wait for them to bake.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ミカ","displayName":"Mika","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r188","rowIndex":188,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　練って成形した生地をオーブンに入れた後、私たちは紅茶を淹れて焼き上がるのを待ちました。","en":"After putting the dough we had kneaded and shaped into the oven, we made tea and waited for the cookies to finish baking.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r189","rowIndex":189,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「思ったより簡単だったでしょ？」","en":"“It was easier than you thought, wasn’t it?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ミカ","displayName":"Mika","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r190","rowIndex":190,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「はい。……でも、こういう風に食べ物を作るのは、よくやるんですか？」","en":"“Yes. ...But do you often make food like this?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r191","rowIndex":191,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私が紅茶に口をつけると、","en":"As I brought the tea to my lips,","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r192","rowIndex":192,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あっ、お砂糖忘れてるよ」","en":"“Oh! You forgot the sugar,”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ミカ","displayName":"Mika","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r193","rowIndex":193,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　とミカちゃんは言います。","en":"Mika said.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r194","rowIndex":194,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　味に興味がない私は砂糖なんかあってもなくても良かったのですが、そう指摘されると慌てて砂糖を入れました。多く入れすぎて、ミカちゃんを笑わせてしまうほどです。","en":"With no interest in flavor, I cared little whether the tea contained sugar. But once she mentioned it, I hurried to add some. I poured in so much that Mika laughed at me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r195","rowIndex":195,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あのね、クッキー作りはよくやるよー。他のお菓子も作るし、料理も手伝ったりするよ。<tips=55>松子</tips>ちゃんはやらないの？」","en":"“I bake cookies all the time. I make other sweets too, and help with the cooking. Don’t you, <tips=55>Matsuko</tips>?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ミカ","displayName":"Mika","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r196","rowIndex":196,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「私は全然……。そもそも食べ物にあんまり興味がないんです。誰もいないときなんかもう、ご飯全部ミキサーにかけてごくごく飲んじゃうくらいで……」","en":"“Never... I have very little interest in food to begin with. When no one else is there, I put my entire dinner through a blender and gulp it down...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r197","rowIndex":197,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　嘘が苦手だったのでうっかり正直に答えてしまうと、","en":"I was a poor liar, and carelessly let the truth slip.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r198","rowIndex":198,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「えー、ひどいー」","en":"“Eww! That’s awful!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ミカ","displayName":"Mika","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r199","rowIndex":199,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ミカちゃんは思い切りしかめ面を作ります。","en":"Mika pulled an enormous face.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r200","rowIndex":200,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それじゃあ、作った人が可哀想だよ。味つけとかすごい苦労してるはずなのに」","en":"“You should feel sorry for whoever cooked it. They must have worked so hard to get all the seasoning right.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ミカ","displayName":"Mika","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r201","rowIndex":201,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ああ、そういうことは考えてもみませんでした」","en":"“Oh. That never occurred to me.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r202","rowIndex":202,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私が答えるとミカちゃんはおかしそうに笑って、","en":"Mika found my answer amusing and laughed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r203","rowIndex":203,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……あ、そうだ、じゃあ今度から自分でも作ってみたら？　自分で作ればきっと、作る苦労とか、食べる楽しみとかもわかって来ると思うよ？　おうちの人も喜ぶだろうし」","en":"“...Oh, I know! Why don’t you try making food yourself from now on? If you make it yourself, I bet you’ll start to understand how much work it takes—and how much fun it is to eat. I’m sure everyone at home would be happy, too.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ミカ","displayName":"Mika","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r204","rowIndex":204,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「家のものが喜ぶ……ですか」","en":"“The people at home will be happy...?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r205","rowIndex":205,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「うん。<tips=55>松子</tips>ちゃんとこって、お父さんと二人で暮らしてるんでしょ？」","en":"“Yeah. It’s just you and your dad at home, right, <tips=55>Matsuko</tips>?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ミカ","displayName":"Mika","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r206","rowIndex":206,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうですね。今度やってみます」","en":"“That’s right. I’ll try it sometime.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r207","rowIndex":207,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ミカちゃんのお母さんは<tips=58>パラシュート通り</tips>の輸入食品店で働いており、お父さんは<tips=17>タイプB</tips>の症状が悪化して、いつも家で寝込んでいるのだそうです。","en":"Mika had told me that her mother worked at an imported-food shop on <tips=58>Parachute Street</tips>, while her father remained bedridden at home after his <tips=17>Type B</tips> symptoms worsened.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r208","rowIndex":208,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　だから、ミカちゃんは働くお母さんのかわりに積極的に家事を行っているようで、料理の他に、洗濯、掃除なども毎日のつとめとしているのだと言いました。","en":"Mika therefore seemed to take an active role in the housework in place of her working mother. She said that cooking, laundry, and cleaning were among her daily duties.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r209","rowIndex":209,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そのせいか、家は古びていても清潔に保たれていて、家具にはミカちゃんの趣味によるピンク色のクロスなどがかかり、華やかで明るい印象でした。","en":"Perhaps for that reason, although the house was old, it remained clean. Its furniture was draped in pink cloths chosen to Mika’s taste, giving the place a bright, cheerful air.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r210","rowIndex":210,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　この話を聞きながら、私は自分の家ではハウスキーパーを雇い、やらせているのを思い出しました。","en":"As I listened, I remembered that at home we hired a housekeeper to do all those things.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r211","rowIndex":211,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして、自分はあまりにも楽をし過ぎているのではないかと、情けのない思いがしたのを記憶しています。","en":"I remember feeling rather pathetic when it occurred to me that I had been leading far too easy a life.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r212","rowIndex":212,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まあミカちゃん。今日は随分可愛い子を連れて来たのね」","en":"“Why, Mika. You’ve brought such a cute girl home today.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ミカ母","displayName":"Mika's Mother","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r213","rowIndex":213,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ミカちゃんのお母さんが帰って来て、働き先で分けて貰ったというロールケーキを切り分けてテーブルに出してくれました。","en":"Mika’s mother came home and sliced up a Swiss roll she said she had been given at work, then set it on the table for us.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r214","rowIndex":214,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それを三人で食べ始めた時でした。もの凄い足音を立てて、何者かが部屋に入ってきたのです。","en":"We had just begun eating it together when someone entered the room with thunderous footsteps.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r215","rowIndex":215,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あなた！」","en":"“You!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r216","rowIndex":216,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ミカちゃんのお母さんが、耳が痛くなるほどの金切り声で叫びます。","en":"Mika’s mother screamed so shrilly that it hurt my ears.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r217","rowIndex":217,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そこに立っていたのはミカちゃんのお父さんで、目をらんらんと金色に光らせ、口からはよだれをたらしているのが見えました。","en":"The figure standing there was Mika’s father, his eyes blazing gold and drool running from his mouth.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r218","rowIndex":218,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その時は<tips=17>タイプB</tips>の発作かと思ったのですが、実際にはそうではありませんでした。","en":"At the time, I thought he was experiencing a <tips=17>Type B</tips> episode. In fact, that was not the case.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r219","rowIndex":219,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　後で聞いたところによると、彼は少し前からこっそりと売人を自宅に呼び寄せ薬物を購入していたのだそうです。だからこのときは、<tips=17>タイプB</tips>の発作というよりも、薬物のバッドトリップによる妄想・混乱状態だったのでしょう。","en":"I later heard that for some time he had been secretly summoning a dealer to the house and buying drugs. So rather than a <tips=17>Type B</tips> episode, he was probably in a state of delusion and confusion brought on by a bad trip.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r220","rowIndex":220,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　病によって働くことが出来なくなった自分が、妻と娘に負担をかける罪悪の苦しみから逃れるため、そんなことをしてしまったのだと後でみなは噂しました。","en":"People later whispered that he had done it to escape the torment of his guilt: his illness had left him unable to work and made him a burden on his wife and daughter.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r221","rowIndex":221,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　とにかく、そのお父さんは完全に錯乱していました。","en":"Whatever the cause, Mika’s father had entirely lost touch with reality.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r222","rowIndex":222,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　手に拳銃を握っており、それで躊躇うこともなく、立っていたお母さんを撃ったのです。","en":"There was a pistol in his hand. Without the slightest hesitation, he raised it and shot his wife where she stood.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r223","rowIndex":223,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女の頭ははじけ飛び、肉片がべちゃりとロールケーキを潰すさまを私は呆然と見ていました。","en":"Her head burst apart. I stared numbly as pieces of flesh struck the Swiss roll with a wet splatter, crushing it beneath them.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r224","rowIndex":224,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「お母さん！」","en":"“Mother!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r225","rowIndex":225,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　糸が切れたようにその場に倒れ込むお母さんに、ミカちゃんがしがみつこうとします。","en":"Mika tried to cling to her mother as the woman collapsed like a puppet with its strings cut.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r226","rowIndex":226,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　お父さんはその背中にも拳銃を撃ちました。","en":"Her father fired into her back.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r227","rowIndex":227,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ぐえっ」","en":"“Guh!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r228","rowIndex":228,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ミカちゃんはおぞましい声をあげて倒れ込みましたが、急所は外れていたらしく、震えながらお父さんを見上げます。","en":"Mika gave a ghastly cry and collapsed. The shot had apparently missed anything vital, however, and she looked up at her father, trembling.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r229","rowIndex":229,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　お父さんは、無言のままその顔面にさらに二発の銃弾を撃ち込みました。","en":"Without a word, her father fired two more bullets into her face.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r230","rowIndex":230,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は突然のことで凍り付き、身動きすることが出来ませんでした。","en":"The suddenness of it all left me frozen and unable to move.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r231","rowIndex":231,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　お父さんはくるりとこちらを振り返ると、今度は私に銃口を向けます。","en":"Her father spun around to face me and pointed the gun at me next.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r232","rowIndex":232,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　銃口の奥がピカッと光ったかと思うと、胸に衝撃を感じました。","en":"I saw a flash in the depths of the barrel, then felt an impact against my chest.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r233","rowIndex":233,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　続けざまに彼はもう一度引き金を引き、結局私は胸に二発の銃弾を撃ち込まれ、椅子ごと後ろにひっくりかえったのです。","en":"He immediately pulled the trigger again. In the end, two bullets had been driven into my chest, and I toppled backward with the chair beneath me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r234","rowIndex":234,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　お父さんは私がぴくりとも動かないのを確認すると、冷たい銃口を自分の口に突っ込んで、引き金を引きました。","en":"Once Mika’s father had made certain I did not move, he shoved the cold muzzle into his own mouth and pulled the trigger.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r235","rowIndex":235,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　お父さんが倒れると私の視界には天井しかありません。そのシミのついた天井板を眺めながら、私は意識がじわじわと黒く浸食されてゆくのを感じました。","en":"After he fell, the ceiling was all I could see. As I stared at its stained panels, I felt darkness slowly consuming my consciousness.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r236","rowIndex":236,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"（このまま死ぬんだ……）","en":"(So I’m going to die...)","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r237","rowIndex":237,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そう考えながら意識を失ったのですが、結果から言うと私は死にませんでした。","en":"That was my last thought before I lost consciousness. But to skip directly to the outcome, I did not die.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r238","rowIndex":238,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　自室のベッドで目を覚ましました。目の前には、<tips=1>リョウ</tips>さんがいます。","en":"I awoke in my own bed, in my own room. <tips=1>Ryo</tips> was standing before me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r239","rowIndex":239,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「えっ」","en":"“Huh?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r240","rowIndex":240,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私はおどろいてから、少し考え、ほっと安堵の溜息をつきました。","en":"I was startled at first. Then I thought for a moment and breathed a small sigh of relief.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r241","rowIndex":241,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そうだ、これは全部夢だったんだ！　ミカちゃんは殺されてはいないし、私は撃たれてなんかいない。","en":"That was it—it had all been a dream! Mika had not been killed, and I had never been shot.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r242","rowIndex":242,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そんなことが起こるはずがない。","en":"Nothing like that could possibly have happened.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r243","rowIndex":243,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そう信じたのですが、","en":"Or so I believed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r244","rowIndex":244,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いつっ」","en":"“Ouch!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r245","rowIndex":245,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　手を上げて目にかかった前髪をかきあげようとしたとき、胸に激しい痛みを感じたのです。","en":"When I raised a hand to brush the hair from my eyes, intense pain struck my chest.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r246","rowIndex":246,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まだ動いちゃいけない」","en":"“You mustn’t move yet.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮（少年時代）","displayName":"Tse Leung (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r247","rowIndex":247,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>リョウ</tips>さんが静かな声でそう制します。","en":"<tips=1>Ryo</tips> cautioned me in a quiet voice.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r248","rowIndex":248,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は痛みに耐えながら、掛け布団をずらし、自分の胸を確認しました。","en":"Enduring the pain, I shifted the blanket and examined my chest.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r249","rowIndex":249,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私はそのとき上半身に何も着ておらず、ただ包帯がグルグルと胴体に巻き付けてあったのです。","en":"I was naked from the waist up, with nothing but bandages wound around and around my torso.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r250","rowIndex":250,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　一体これはなんだろう？","en":"What was all this?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r251","rowIndex":251,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私はまだなかば夢と信じたままの状態で、それをほどこうとしました。<tips=1>リョウ</tips>さんは何もいわず、目を細めて私の動きを見つめていたように思います。","en":"Still half convinced I was dreaming, I began to unwind them. <tips=1>Ryo</tips> said nothing. I believe he narrowed his eyes and watched my movements.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r252","rowIndex":252,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　包帯をほどくと、ちょうど心臓の上あたりの場所に三つの穴が空いているのが見つかりました。私はそこに指を入れました。その先端が、肺に触れ、心臓に触れます。その心臓は暖かく、そして鼓動していました。","en":"When I removed the bandages, I found three holes directly over my heart. I inserted a finger into one. The tip touched my lung, then my heart. The heart was warm, and it was beating.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r253","rowIndex":253,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そしてゆっくりと指を引き抜くと、血液の代わりに透明な体液がついています。","en":"When I slowly withdrew my finger, it was wet with clear fluid instead of blood.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r254","rowIndex":254,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　横になったまま身体をねじって背中を確認すると、やはり同じ場所に穴が空いているのです。","en":"Still lying down, I twisted around to examine my back and found matching holes there as well.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r255","rowIndex":255,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……これは？」","en":"“...What is this?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r256","rowIndex":256,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私はまだ悪夢のなかにいるような不思議な気持ちで、<tips=1>リョウ</tips>さんにそう尋ねました。","en":"Still overcome by the strange feeling that I remained inside a nightmare, I asked <tips=1>Ryo</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r257","rowIndex":257,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「今日で、撃たれてから五日間が過ぎた。心臓も肺も損傷していたが、昨日やっと動きはじめたんだ」","en":"“It has been five days since you were shot. Your heart and lungs were both damaged, and they only finally started working again yesterday.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮（少年時代）","displayName":"Tse Leung (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r258","rowIndex":258,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>リョウ</tips>さんは冷静にそう答えてくれました。","en":"<tips=1>Ryo</tips> answered with composure.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r259","rowIndex":259,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「心臓が……それなのに、なんで生きているんですか？　私は？」","en":"“My heart... Then how am I still alive? How can I be?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r260","rowIndex":260,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なんでかはわからないが、きみの再生力は、破壊された心臓も修復してしまうらしい。ここまでの回復力だとは僕も<tips=54>汐さん</tips>も知らなかった」","en":"“I don’t know why, but it appears your regenerative power can repair even a destroyed heart. Neither <tips=54>Mr. Shio</tips> nor I knew your power of recovery extended this far.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮（少年時代）","displayName":"Tse Leung (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r261","rowIndex":261,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そんな……」","en":"“That can’t be...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r262","rowIndex":262,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私はくらくらと目眩を感じました。","en":"Dizziness washed over me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r263","rowIndex":263,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ミカちゃんは？」","en":"“What about Mika?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r264","rowIndex":264,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……即死だった。お父さんもお母さんも、家族みんな」","en":"“...She died instantly. So did her father and mother. The entire family.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮（少年時代）","displayName":"Tse Leung (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r265","rowIndex":265,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>リョウ</tips>さんは淡々と告げます。","en":"<tips=1>Ryo</tips> informed me in a flat voice.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r266","rowIndex":266,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……ああ」","en":"“...Oh.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r267","rowIndex":267,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は涙を流して泣きはしませんでしたが、そのかわり虚無感が心にどす黒い影を作るのを感じました。","en":"I did not weep or shed a single tear. Instead, I felt an emptiness spread a pitch-black shadow across my heart.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r268","rowIndex":268,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「残念なことだが、この街ではよくあることだ。……それに、あそこはかなりの借金を抱えていたそうだよ。あのまま生きていたとしても、ミカもその母さんも、もっと恐ろしい地獄を見ていただろう。キレイに死ねて、良かったのかもしれない」","en":"“It is unfortunate, but things like this happen often in this city. ...I also hear the family had taken on considerable debt. If they had continued living, Mika and her mother might have faced a far more terrible hell. Perhaps it was better that they could die cleanly.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮（少年時代）","displayName":"Tse Leung (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r269","rowIndex":269,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その<tips=1>リョウ</tips>さんの言い方は、普段の彼の価値観とは違いました。","en":"What <tips=1>Ryo</tips> had just said was at odds with the values he ordinarily professed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r270","rowIndex":270,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼は『キレイに死ねて良かった』なんて言う人間ではないです。そんな考え方は認めず、どんなかたちでも死は死で、生きなくては意味がないというのが彼の言い分でした。","en":"He was not the kind of person who would ever say someone was fortunate to have “died cleanly.” He rejected that way of thinking. To him, death was death, whatever form it took; only while one remained alive could anything have meaning.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r271","rowIndex":271,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　自分を慰めてくれようとしているのに気がつきましたが、それを素直に受け入れられる心の余裕はありませんでした。","en":"I realized that he was trying to console me, but I was in no state to accept it for what it was.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r272","rowIndex":272,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……<tips=1>リョウ</tips>さんはいつだったか、すべての生物はいつか死ぬものだと教えてくれましたが、じゃあこれはなんなんですか？　心臓を砕かれて、それでもこんな風に生きているだなんて……」","en":"“...<tips=1>Ryo</tips>, you once taught me that every living creature dies eventually. Then what is this? My heart was destroyed, and I am still alive like this...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r273","rowIndex":273,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は言葉を切り、深呼吸をしました。","en":"I broke off and drew a deep breath.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r274","rowIndex":274,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「本当にただの<tips=17>タイプB</tips>なんですか？　お父さんはノーマルで、お母さんは遠くに居るって言うけれど……家にはお母さんのものが何もないし、一枚の写真だって見たことがない。誰もお母さんのことは知らなくて、お父さんも言うことがはっきりとしない。……とても、存在しているとは思えない。うすうすおかしいとは思っていたんです。でも、こんなことされても平気で、こんなふうに喋ってるなんて……。私、なんなんですか？　本当に、ここの娘なんですか？」","en":"“Am I really just an ordinary <tips=17>Type B</tips>? Father is a Normal, and you say Mother lives far away, but... none of her belongings are in our home, and I have never seen a single photograph. No one knows anything about her, and Father never gives a clear answer. ...I find it very difficult to believe she even exists. I had suspected for some time that something was strange. But here I am, perfectly fine after someone did this to me, talking like this... What am I? Am I really this family’s daughter?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r275","rowIndex":275,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　この場でこんなことを聞いたって仕方ないのに、どうしても我慢が出来なくて言ってしまったんです。","en":"I knew there was no point in asking such questions then and there, but I could no longer hold them back.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r276","rowIndex":276,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そしてじっと<tips=1>リョウ</tips>さんを見つめました。","en":"Then I stared intently at <tips=1>Ryo</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r277","rowIndex":277,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼は溜息をつき、","en":"He sighed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r278","rowIndex":278,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……隠してもきっと、不安になるだけだろうね」","en":"“...Even if we kept it hidden from you, it would probably only make you more anxious.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮（少年時代）","displayName":"Tse Leung (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r279","rowIndex":279,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして、すべての事実を打ち明けてくれました。","en":"Then he told me the whole truth.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r280","rowIndex":280,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私はゴミ捨て場で拾われた肉片で、それが培養液のなかで人間の形に変化したものなのだそうです。","en":"Apparently, I had begun as a scrap of flesh found in a garbage dump, and inside a vessel of culture fluid that flesh had transformed into a human being.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r281","rowIndex":281,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ああ、私は汐家の本当の娘でないどころか、聞いたこともないような不気味な生物だったのです。","en":"So not only was I no biological daughter of the Shio family, but I had been an eerie organism of a kind I had never even heard of.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r282","rowIndex":282,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>リョウ</tips>さんと父の調べによると、<tips=17>タイプB</tips>の<tips=72>傾向値</tips>は常人ではあり得ないほどに高く、見たこともない数値を示していたという話も聞きました。","en":"I was also told that, according to <tips=1>Ryo</tips> and Father’s investigation, my <tips=17>Type B</tips> <tips=72>tendency value</tips> was impossibly high for an ordinary human being—a number unlike any they had ever seen.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r283","rowIndex":283,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それはおとぎ話のような、にわかには信じられない話でした。","en":"The story resembled a fairy tale and was difficult to believe upon first hearing.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r284","rowIndex":284,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は冗談かと思ってじっと<tips=1>リョウ</tips>さんの顔を見つめたのですが、いつもみたいに苦笑したりせずに、真剣な顔でこちらを見ています。","en":"Suspecting a joke, I searched <tips=1>Ryo’s</tips> face. He did not give me his usual wry smile, but returned my gaze with complete seriousness.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r285","rowIndex":285,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その顔で冗談ではないと判断した私は、一応その話について真面目に考えてみたのですが、すると、その突拍子もない話と、自分が日常のなかで抱いていたさまざまな違和感が奇妙なほど符合してゆくのです。","en":"Judging from his face that he was not joking, I gave the story serious consideration. As I did, that outlandish account began to accord, with uncanny precision, with the many incongruities I had noticed in everyday life.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r286","rowIndex":286,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「つまり、私は娘どころか、えたいの知れない化け物なわけなんですね」","en":"“So far from being anyone’s daughter, I am some unfathomable monster of unknown origin.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r287","rowIndex":287,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そんな言い方はよくない。今ここにいるきみは間違いなく人間だ」","en":"“You shouldn’t speak of yourself that way. You, here and now, are unquestionably human.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮（少年時代）","displayName":"Tse Leung (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r288","rowIndex":288,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「撃たれた心臓が元通りになっても？　これじゃ、頭を切り落とされたって生きてるかもしれない」","en":"“Even after a bullet shattered my heart and it simply restored itself? At this rate, I might survive even having my head cut off.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r289","rowIndex":289,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は自分で言っておきながら、首がない自分の姿を想像してしまい、うげえと顔を顰めました。","en":"Despite having said it myself, I could not help picturing my own headless body. I pulled a face and went, “Ugh.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r290","rowIndex":290,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それでもだ」","en":"“Even then.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮（少年時代）","displayName":"Tse Leung (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r291","rowIndex":291,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>リョウ</tips>さんはきっぱりと断言します。","en":"<tips=1>Ryo</tips> said it firmly and without hesitation.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r292","rowIndex":292,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「人間なんですか？　元々が、ナメクジのような肉のかたまりだったのに？　そんな人間っているんですか？　どんな図鑑にものってないです」","en":"“Would that still make me human? Even though I began as a sluglike lump of flesh? Are there human beings like that? There is nothing like me in any encyclopedia.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r293","rowIndex":293,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「図鑑にのってることだけが全部じゃない」","en":"“The things written in encyclopedias aren’t all there is.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮（少年時代）","displayName":"Tse Leung (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r294","rowIndex":294,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>リョウ</tips>さんがつらそうな顔をしているのが、ちょっとおかしく思いました。","en":"I found <tips=1>Ryo’s</tips> pained expression a little strange.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r295","rowIndex":295,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……そうですか。……ああ、そうしたら、じゃあ、二人とも、ずっとそのことを私に隠していたんですか？」","en":"“...I see. ...Then did both of you keep this from me all along?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r296","rowIndex":296,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私はそう言って首をひねりました。まだ現実感に乏しく、どういう感情も抱けなかったのです。","en":"I said this with my head tilted. None of it felt real to me yet, and I was unable to summon any particular emotion.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r297","rowIndex":297,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「隠していたわけじゃないよ。……いや、結果的にはそういうことになるのかな。僕らはきみが、昔のことを覚えていないのを知っていて、あえて言わなかったんだから」","en":"“We didn’t mean to hide it. ...No, I suppose that is what we did in the end. We knew you remembered nothing of the past, and deliberately chose not to tell you.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮（少年時代）","displayName":"Tse Leung (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r298","rowIndex":298,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうですか。説明する必要なんかないと思ったわけではないんですね」","en":"“I see. So it wasn’t because you thought I had no need to be told.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r299","rowIndex":299,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そんなことは言わないでくれ」","en":"“Please don’t say that.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮（少年時代）","displayName":"Tse Leung (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r300","rowIndex":300,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>リョウ</tips>さんは悲しそうに私を見つめます。","en":"<tips=1>Ryo</tips> looked at me sadly.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r301","rowIndex":301,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は何のつもりもなく言ったのに、悲しませてしまったことに驚き、そして申し訳なく思いました。","en":"I had not meant anything by the remark, so I was startled to realize that I had saddened him—and sorry that I had.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r302","rowIndex":302,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ごめんなさい。でも、私、いろんなことを理解するちからが足りないんです。今度からは出来れば何でも話して欲しいです。そうすれば、少しはわかるかも知れませんから」","en":"“I’m sorry. But I’m not very good at understanding things. From now on, if you can, I’d like you to tell me everything. Then maybe I’ll understand a little.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r303","rowIndex":303,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「わかった。そうするよ。約束しよう」","en":"“All right. I’ll do that. I promise.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮（少年時代）","displayName":"Tse Leung (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r304","rowIndex":304,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>リョウ</tips>さんはそう言って頷きました。","en":"<tips=1>Ryo</tips> nodded as he spoke.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r305","rowIndex":305,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　この私の生い立ちについては、時間が経つに従って心に染み込み、私を苦しめることになるのですが、このときはミカちゃんのことで心の中がいっぱいでした。","en":"As time passed, the truth of my origins would gradually seep into my heart and begin to torment me. At that moment, however, my thoughts were entirely consumed by Mika.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r306","rowIndex":306,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ミカちゃんはどこへ行ったんだろう……」","en":"“Where did Mika go...?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r307","rowIndex":307,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私が独り言のつもりでぼんやり呟くと、","en":"I murmured dazedly, meaning the words only for myself.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r308","rowIndex":308,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「もういないんだよ。どこにもいない」","en":"“She is gone. She isn’t anywhere now.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮（少年時代）","displayName":"Tse Leung (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r309","rowIndex":309,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どこにも……」","en":"“Not anywhere...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r310","rowIndex":310,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は口の中で繰り返し、いたものがいなくなるという現象をうまく理解しようとしたのですが、やっぱり理解が出来ないのでした。","en":"I repeated the words under my breath, trying to understand the phenomenon of someone who had existed ceasing to exist anywhere at all. I still could not grasp it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r311","rowIndex":311,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　いくら考えても理解出来ないので、何か意識が暗い穴のなかに落下してゆくような気持ちになりました。","en":"No matter how long I thought about it, I could not understand. I felt as though my consciousness were plunging into a dark, bottomless shaft.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r312","rowIndex":312,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　自由落下しているのだけれども、手を伸ばしても足を伸ばしても周囲の壁に届かず、ただ風景が上に流れてゆくのを眺めるような、あんな感じです。","en":"I was in free fall, and however far I stretched my hands or feet, they could not reach the surrounding walls. I could only watch the landscape flow upward past me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G1:r313","rowIndex":313,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ただミカちゃんにもう二度と会えないということを考え、二人で焼いたクッキーを結局食べられなかったことを考え、そして、もし二人であれを食べていたとしたら——その味を想像していると、さらさらとした涙が目からこぼれ落ち、止まらなくなりました。","en":"I thought of how I would never see Mika again, thought of how we had never gotten to eat the cookies we baked together, and then—when I imagined what they would have tasted like if we had eaten them together—tears streamed from my eyes and would not stop.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}}]},{"position":37,"code":"G2","unitId":"G2","rows":[{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r1","rowIndex":1,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　街の子供たちはあまり教育を受けておらず、私も特別興味はなく、小学校にも中学校にも通ってはいなかったのですが、<tips=1>リョウ</tips>さんと父が絶対にそうした方が良いと言うので、高校に進学しました。","en":"The children in the city received little education. I was no exception: I had no particular interest in it and attended neither elementary nor middle school. But <tips=1>Ryo</tips> and my father insisted that I absolutely should, so I went on to high school.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r2","rowIndex":2,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　勉強に関しては普段から<tips=1>リョウ</tips>さんや父に教わっていたので、とりたてて受験勉強というほどのものはしないで済みました。","en":"Since <tips=1>Ryo</tips> and my father had always taught me, I got by without doing anything that could really be called studying for the entrance exam.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r3","rowIndex":3,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして高校生になると、私は学校に通いながら地区内の児童養護施設で働くことにしました。","en":"Then, once I entered high school, I decided to work at a children’s care facility in the district while continuing to attend classes.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r4","rowIndex":4,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　進学すると街の子供たちとは遊ばなくなり、かといって学校の同級生ともあまり話が合わず、別の何かをしたかったのです。その職場を選んだのは、特に理由があったわけではなく、ただよく通る道に求人広告が出ていたからでした。","en":"Once I went on to high school, I stopped playing with the children in the city, but I did not have much in common with my classmates either, and I wanted something else to do. I had no particular reason for choosing that workplace; I had simply seen a help-wanted notice along a road I often took.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r5","rowIndex":5,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　むしろ子供の相手は不向きなような気がしていたのですが、はじめてみると、これが案外やりがいがありました。","en":"If anything, I had felt I was ill-suited to dealing with children, but once I began, the work proved surprisingly rewarding.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r6","rowIndex":6,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　自分のことを考えたり、自分のために何かをするよりも、子供たちのために何かをしている方が、ずっと楽しかったのです。","en":"I found doing things for the children far more enjoyable than thinking about myself or doing anything for my own sake.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r7","rowIndex":7,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　自分について考えるとどうしても思考は出生の場面に辿り着き、なんだか自分に価値がないような気がしてしまうのです。","en":"Whenever I thought about myself, my thoughts inevitably returned to the circumstances of my birth, and I began to feel as though I had no worth at all.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r8","rowIndex":8,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そもそも、自分の存在について考えるというのは、答えのないものでもあり、私には手の余るものでした。その点、子供の面倒などを見ていると相手のことしか考えなくて良いので、子供が笑っていればそれがひとまず答えになるので、私を不安にさせるものはなにもありませんでした。","en":"To begin with, thinking about my own existence meant grappling with something that had no answer, and it was more than I could handle. When I cared for children, however, I had to think only of the child before me; if the child smiled, that was answer enough for the moment, and nothing remained to make me anxious.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r9","rowIndex":9,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　つまりきっかけは、逃避であったということです。","en":"In other words, what first brought me there was the desire to escape.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r10","rowIndex":10,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　思えば、自分の正体を<tips=1>リョウ</tips>さんに聞かされてから、心のどこかでずっと逃避を求めていたのだと思います。そうした私にとって、児童養護施設はまさにぴったりの場所でした。","en":"In retrospect, I think that ever since <tips=1>Ryo</tips> told me what I truly was, some part of me had always been seeking escape. For someone like me, the children’s care facility was exactly the right place.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r11","rowIndex":11,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=9>Y地区</tips>の児童養護施設はどこも常に収容可能人数をオーバーしており、予算もなく貧しいものです。","en":"Every children’s care facility in <tips=9>Y District</tips> was perpetually over capacity, starved for funds, and desperately poor.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r12","rowIndex":12,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　父は街の名士として少なくない額を、様々な福祉施設や公共施設に対して定期的に寄付をしていました。私が勤めた先も、その寄付先の一つでした。","en":"My father was one of the city’s prominent citizens and regularly donated considerable sums to all manner of welfare and public facilities. The place where I worked was one of the recipients.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r13","rowIndex":13,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　父はよく「助けるつもりで金をやっても、かえって滅ぼすことになることは多い」と口にし、寄付などをする場合は入念に相手を調べてから行っていたのですが、それでも、中に入ってみると、それらの資金が必ずしも有効に使われてはいないのを実感しました。","en":"My father often said, “Even when you give someone money intending to help, you may only end up destroying them instead.” Whenever he made a donation, he therefore investigated the recipient with great care. Even so, once I saw matters from the inside, I realized that the funds were not always being put to effective use.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r14","rowIndex":14,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　どこに消えているのかはわかりません。どこかで誰かが目的と違うことに使っていたのかもしれません。","en":"I did not know where the money was disappearing to. Perhaps someone, somewhere, was diverting it to purposes for which it had never been intended.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r15","rowIndex":15,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　末端である私にはよくわかりませんでしたが、父が寄付した金額や時期は知っていたので、帳簿を見ると首を捻りたくなったりもしました。","en":"As a low-ranking worker, I was in no position to know the details. But I did know when my father had donated and how much, so the ledgers sometimes made me cock my head in puzzlement.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r16","rowIndex":16,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　まあ、<tips=9>Y地区</tips>の組織というものはどこもおおむねこのようなものなのかもしれません。","en":"Still, perhaps this was simply how nearly every organization in <tips=9>Y District</tips> operated.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r17","rowIndex":17,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ただ、仕事自体はとても楽しいものでした。","en":"The work itself, however, was a great pleasure.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r18","rowIndex":18,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　期待した通り、職員として自分の手を使い、人々に触れることがやはり私には向いていたのだろうと思います。","en":"Just as I had hoped, being a member of the staff—working with my own hands and coming into contact with people—seemed to suit me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r19","rowIndex":19,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私の働く施設には様々な子供がいました。","en":"All sorts of children lived at the facility where I worked.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r20","rowIndex":20,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　肌の色の目の色も様々で、日本語が喋れなかったり、<tips=17>タイプB</tips>の重い症状があらわれていたり、<tips=16>タイプA</tips>の<tips=77>特質変異</tips>が強かったり。<tips=9>Y地区</tips>のなかでさえもいじめの対象になってしまいそうな子供ばかりでした。","en":"Their skin and eyes came in every color. Some could not speak Japanese; some showed severe symptoms of <tips=17>Type B</tips>; in others, <tips=16>Type A</tips> <tips=77>trait mutations</tips> were pronounced. They were all children who seemed liable to be bullied even within <tips=9>Y District</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r21","rowIndex":21,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして、過酷な境遇から心がねじけて問題行動を頻繁に繰り返す子供も数多くいました。","en":"Many had also been twisted by the cruelty of their circumstances and acted out again and again.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r22","rowIndex":22,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼らの七割はその辺りの街角に捨てられてしまった孤児で、残りの三割ほどが親が育てられずに預けた子供たちです。","en":"Seventy percent were orphans abandoned on street corners nearby. The remaining thirty percent or so had been placed there by parents unable to raise them.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r23","rowIndex":23,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　子供同士の喧嘩はよくあって、彼らが「捨て子」だの「イカレた<tips=78>金目</tips>」だのとののしり合ったりする姿はいたましいものです。","en":"The children often fought, and it was painful to hear them hurl insults like “abandoned brat” and “crazy <tips=78>gold-eyes</tips>” at one another.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r24","rowIndex":24,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　でも、悪いことばっかりじゃありません。彼らが思わぬ優しさや賢さを見せる場面もあり、いや、むしろ感動させられることの方が多いくらいです。","en":"But it was not all bad. There were moments when they showed unexpected kindness or intelligence—no, if anything, they moved me more often than not.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r25","rowIndex":25,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　とにかく、子供は我々の想像以上に逞しいのか、普段は明るく活発で笑いが絶えない施設なのでした。","en":"In any case, perhaps children were tougher than we imagined; ordinarily, the facility was bright and lively, and laughter never ceased.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r26","rowIndex":26,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そうして毎日、すごく良いことと、すごく悪いことを絶え間なく繰り返す子供たちと触れあいながら、いつしか私は、彼らのなかに自分を重ねていることに気がつきました。","en":"Day after day, these children would do very good things and very bad things in endless succession. As I lived and worked among them, I eventually realized that I saw myself in them.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r27","rowIndex":27,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　わけもわからず自傷を繰り返す幼児。他人を思いのままに動かそうと嘘ばかりつく少女。急に石で殴りつけたり、大人がぎょっとするような暴力を笑いながら行う少年。他人の顔色ばかりを窺い、近くで大声を出されただけで泣き出してしまう<tips=16>タイプA</tips>の少年。","en":"A toddler who hurt themself again and again without knowing why. A girl who lied constantly so she could make other people do as she wished. A boy who suddenly struck others with stones, laughing as he committed violence that made even adults recoil. A <tips=16>Type A</tips> boy who watched every face around him and burst into tears at the mere sound of a raised voice nearby.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r28","rowIndex":28,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私はそうした行為を行ったことなどないはずなのに、なぜか、どの子供も自分が幼い時の姿のように感じてしまうのだから不思議なものです。","en":"I had never done any of those things myself—or so I believed—yet strangely, every one of them seemed to me like a vision of myself as a child.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r29","rowIndex":29,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼らはみな人とは違うなにかに押し潰されており、普段はどんなに明るくても、その心のどこかには孤独や悲しみを抱えていました。","en":"Each of them was being crushed by something that set them apart from other people. No matter how cheerful they ordinarily appeared, somewhere inside they carried loneliness or sorrow.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r30","rowIndex":30,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　タコのようにグニャグニャとした両手を持つ<tips=16>タイプA</tips>の少女が、なんで私はこんな醜い姿なんだと泣き出す時、私もまたゴミ捨て場に捨てられていたという自分の姿を思うのです。","en":"Whenever a <tips=16>Type A</tips> girl with two soft, writhing arms like an octopus wept and asked why she had to look so ugly, I too would picture the form in which I had once been discarded at a garbage dump.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r31","rowIndex":31,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　でもそれは一人でいるときに考えてしまうような絶望的なものはなく、その泣いている少女に手をさしのべて慰めることである程度は癒やすことが出来るのです。","en":"Yet the thought held none of the despair it brought when I was alone; by reaching out and comforting the crying girl, I could soothe myself to some degree as well.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r32","rowIndex":32,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　きっと私は彼らと接することで、自分一人では手が届かない心の奥底の癒やしを得ることが出来たのでしょう。","en":"Perhaps by caring for those children, I found healing in the deepest reaches of my heart—places I could never have touched on my own.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r33","rowIndex":33,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それは、これまでの人生で一度も得たことがない心のやすらぎでした。","en":"It was a peace of mind I had never once known in all my life.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r34","rowIndex":34,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　この仕事は天職かもしれない。","en":"This might be my calling.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r35","rowIndex":35,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私ははっきりそう確信して、高校を卒業した後もそのままそこで働き続けました。父や<tips=1>リョウ</tips>さんは大学に進学をして欲しかったようですが、強制はせず、私の意志を尊重してくれました。","en":"Firmly convinced of that, I continued working there after I graduated from high school. My father and <tips=1>Ryo</tips> seemed to want me to attend university, but they did not force me and respected my wishes.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r36","rowIndex":36,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　大学に行けば<tips=1>リョウ</tips>さんと一緒にいられるし、資格を取得して施設で出来ることを増やせるというメリットもあるのですが、信頼関係の出来た子供たちや同僚と別れるのは忍びなく、またこの街の外でやっていける自信もありませんでした。","en":"University had its advantages: I could have stayed with <tips=1>Ryo</tips>, and earning qualifications would have broadened what I could do at the facility. But I could not bear to leave the children and colleagues with whom I had built relationships of trust, nor was I confident I could manage outside this city.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r37","rowIndex":37,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=17>タイプB</tips>が街の外でどういう扱いを受けるかというのは散々聞かされていて、そこには多少誇張もあったにしろ、まるきり真実がないというわけでもないでしょう。","en":"I had heard no end of stories about how <tips=17>Type Bs</tips> were treated outside the city. The stories may have contained some exaggeration, but they could hardly have been wholly untrue.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r38","rowIndex":38,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私の高校は<tips=9>Y地区</tips>の外にありました。","en":"My high school stood outside <tips=9>Y District</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r39","rowIndex":39,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちの街に隣接したごく近い場所だったのですが、それでも、<tips=9>Y地区</tips>外で生まれ育った生徒とつき合うのは居心地のいいものではありませんでした。","en":"It was very close, directly adjoining our city, but even there I found little comfort in associating with students born and raised beyond <tips=9>Y District</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r40","rowIndex":40,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=9>Y地区</tips>の外では<tips=17>タイプB</tips>に出会う機会があまりにも少なくて、偏見も強いのです。<tips=9>Y地区</tips>なら平気でその辺りをうろついているくらい症状が進行したものは、まず居ません。そうした人々はみな施設に入れられ、社会から隔離されてしまうのだそうです。","en":"Outside <tips=9>Y District</tips>, people had so few opportunities to encounter <tips=17>Type Bs</tips> that prejudice ran deep. You simply never saw people there whose symptoms had progressed as far as those who wandered casually through the streets of <tips=9>Y District</tips>. I was told that every such person was confined to an institution and isolated from society.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r41","rowIndex":41,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　こうした背景があるため、彼ら自身がことさら意識的な差別心を持たなくとも、無意識のうちに見下すような価値観がすり込まれており、言葉の端々に顔を覗かせるのです。","en":"Against that background, even people with no consciously discriminatory intent had been steeped in values that taught them to look down on us. Those values revealed themselves in little things they said.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r42","rowIndex":42,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そういうとき、私は胸がチクチクと痛み、<tips=9>Y地区</tips>のみんなのことが懐かしくてたまらなくなるのです。","en":"At such moments, my heart would sting, and I would ache with longing for everyone in <tips=9>Y District</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r43","rowIndex":43,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そこでもし自分の正体が露見したら、という恐怖はありませんでした。","en":"I was not afraid of what might happen if my true nature were exposed there.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r44","rowIndex":44,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私はこの街では、そういう恐怖を持ったことがありません。なるべく隠すようにはしていましたが、それは相手を不快にさせてしまうことを恐れたからで、それによって私が見下されることは恐れませんでした。それは、なんといっても事実なのですから。それでどう思われても当然のことなのですから。","en":"I had never felt that sort of fear in this city. I did try to conceal myself as much as possible, but only because I feared making other people uncomfortable—not because I feared that they would look down upon me. After all, it was the truth. Whatever they thought of me for it was only natural.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r45","rowIndex":45,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　こんなことを考えていると<tips=1>リョウ</tips>さんにバレたら、また「卑屈すぎる」と説教されてしまいそうですが……。","en":"If <tips=1>Ryo</tips> ever found out I thought this way, he would probably lecture me again for “thinking far too little of myself”...","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r46","rowIndex":46,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　もちろん<tips=9>Y地区</tips>でも差別のようなものはあります。","en":"Of course, forms of discrimination existed in <tips=9>Y District</tips> as well.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r47","rowIndex":47,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　特定の人種を嫌っているグループや、国籍、肌の色、宗教、いろんな理由で反発しあう人々がいます。","en":"Some groups hated particular races, and people clashed over nationality, skin color, religion, and any number of other differences.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r48","rowIndex":48,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　けれど、この街に住んでいるのはあまりにも種類の違う人ばかりなので、例えば「<tips=17>タイプB</tips>はみんな嫌い」なんて人がいても、それは単なる個人の好き嫌いだと片付けられることがほとんどです。","en":"Yet the people living in this city were so utterly varied that even if someone said, for example, “I hate every <tips=17>Type B</tips>,” it was usually dismissed as nothing more than that person’s individual likes and dislikes.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r49","rowIndex":49,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　外のように、みんなで<tips=17>タイプB</tips>への軽蔑心を共有するということはありません。","en":"People did not share a collective contempt for <tips=17>Type Bs</tips> as they did outside.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r50","rowIndex":50,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　だって、このでたらめな街に住んでいれば、<tips=17>タイプB</tips>のなかにもいやな人といい人がいるし、肌が白い人でも黒い人でも、クリスチャンでもムスリムでも、人それぞれだということを、知らないまま過ごすのは非常に難しいのですから。","en":"If you lived in this mad jumble of a city, it was almost impossible not to learn that there were unpleasant <tips=17>Type Bs</tips> and good ones, and that whether people were white or Black, Christian or Muslim, each was an individual.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r51","rowIndex":51,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それにそもそも、そんな理由で好き嫌いを言っていたら損ばかりしてしまいます。","en":"Besides, if you decided whom to like or dislike for reasons like those, you would only be depriving yourself.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r52","rowIndex":52,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　たとえば「肌が黒いやつはみんな嫌い。つき合いたくない」なんて言っても、肌が黒い人が誰も居ないグループなんか、本当に限られているのですから。それは<tips=17>タイプB</tips>でも、同じことです。","en":"You might declare, “I hate all Black people. I won’t associate with them,” but groups containing no Black people at all were exceedingly rare. The same went for <tips=17>Type Bs</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r53","rowIndex":53,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=9>Y地区</tips>は利益による対立は非常に多くて、それで人が殺されたりもするのですが、その分パーソナリティでの差別は薄いのです。","en":"<tips=9>Y District</tips> suffered from a great many conflicts over material interests, and those conflicts sometimes got people killed. In exchange, there was less discrimination based on personal characteristics.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r54","rowIndex":54,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　――どっちがいいのかといえば、人殺しなんかないほうが住みやすいのでしょうけれども。","en":"—Though if you ask which was better, I suppose somewhere without all the killing would be easier to live in.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r55","rowIndex":55,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　とにかく、<tips=9>Y地区</tips>の人は他人のパーソナリティにはさほど興味がないのです。","en":"In any case, people in <tips=9>Y District</tips> took little interest in other people’s personal characteristics.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r56","rowIndex":56,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私なんかも、この異常な再生能力のことはごく親しい友人ならばある程度知っています。でも、みんなちょっと強い<tips=17>タイプB</tips>くらいにしか思っていません。","en":"My closest friends knew something of my abnormal regenerative ability. Even they thought of me as no more than a somewhat stronger-than-average <tips=17>Type B</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r57","rowIndex":57,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　さすがに、心臓を撃ち抜かれても生きていられるほど強い生命力だと知っているのは父と<tips=1>リョウ</tips>さんくらいですけれども、でも、他の人が知ったところでそこまで大騒ぎはしないかもしれません。","en":"Only my father and <tips=1>Ryo</tips> knew that my vitality was great enough to survive a bullet through the heart. But even if anyone else found out, perhaps they would not make all that much fuss.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r58","rowIndex":58,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　だって、灰上さんだって、<tips=10>見土</tips>さんだって、誰にも出来ない不思議な力があるのに、個性として受け取られているわけですから。","en":"After all, Ms. Haigami and <tips=10>Michio</tips> both possessed strange powers no one else could wield, yet those powers were accepted as simply part of who they were.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r59","rowIndex":59,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　普通に考えれば、あんなのあり得ないことなんです。だから、私自身が自分の身体を嫌うほど、ここの人は大げさには考えないでしょう。","en":"By any ordinary standard, powers like theirs were impossible. Yet the people here would probably never regard my body with anything like the horror I myself felt toward it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r60","rowIndex":60,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ただ、街の外でこの体質を知られてしまったら、そうはいかないような気がするのです。","en":"But I felt it would be another matter if the nature of my body became known outside the city.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r61","rowIndex":61,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　とにかく、私は<tips=9>Y地区</tips>から出たくはなかったのです。私の友だちでも、街を飛び出しても結局戻って来てしまう人ばかりでした。","en":"At any rate, I did not want to leave <tips=9>Y District</tips>. Every friend of mine who tried to break away from the city eventually ended up coming back.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r62","rowIndex":62,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ここは治安も悪く、汚い場所ではありますが、私たちのような人間にとってはかけがえのない場所なのだと思います。そのなかでも施設は一番の場所でした。だから私は学校の人々はあまり好きでなかったし、街の外で暮らすということも、とても考えられなかったのです。","en":"It was dirty and dangerous, but for people like us, I believed it was irreplaceable. And within the city, the facility was the place dearest to me. That was why I cared little for the people at school, and why I could scarcely imagine living anywhere beyond the city.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r63","rowIndex":63,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そういう意気地なしの私ですから、もっとメリットが大きかったとしても、大学へは進学しなかったと思います。","en":"Coward that I was, I doubt I would have gone to university even if the advantages had been far greater.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r64","rowIndex":64,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　結果としても、街に残ったのは正解でした。","en":"As things turned out, staying in the city proved to be the right choice.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r65","rowIndex":65,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「きみは段々性格が穏やかになってきているような気がする」","en":"“I think you’ve been growing gentler and gentler.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r66","rowIndex":66,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　当初は不満をあらわにしていた<tips=1>リョウ</tips>さんも、そう言って喜んでくれるようになりました。","en":"Even <tips=1>Ryo</tips>, who had openly opposed my decision at first, eventually began saying this with evident pleasure.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r67","rowIndex":67,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は言われるたびに、そこまでかつての自分はとげとげしかったのだろうか？　と考え込んでしまうのですが、彼が言うのなら間違いがないのでしょうし、また彼が喜んでくれるなら私も嬉しかったのです。","en":"Each time he did, I found myself wondering whether I had truly been so prickly before. Yet if he said it, he must have been right, and if it made him happy, then I was happy too.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r68","rowIndex":68,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それに「街から出るのが怖い！」という子供っぽい理由が正当化されたような気もしました。","en":"It also made me feel as though my childish reason—“I’m afraid to leave the city!”—had somehow been vindicated.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r69","rowIndex":69,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　だからもう、その後<tips=1>リョウ</tips>さんに、","en":"And so, whenever <tips=1>Ryo</tips> subsequently told me,","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r70","rowIndex":70,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そろそろ、<tips=9>Y地区</tips>の外に出てみてもいいんじゃないか？」","en":"“Perhaps it’s about time you tried venturing beyond <tips=9>Y District</tips>,”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r71","rowIndex":71,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　というようなことを何度言われても、やっぱりうんと言えなかったのです。","en":"I still could not bring myself to say yes.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r72","rowIndex":72,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　施設での仕事は本当に楽しくて、子供を相手に怒ったり笑ったり泣いたりしているうちに、一年ほどが過ぎました。","en":"The work at the facility was a genuine joy. About a year passed as I scolded, laughed, and cried with the children.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r73","rowIndex":73,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まっちゃん」","en":"“Matsu.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r74","rowIndex":74,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ある時屋上で子供たちの洗濯物を干していると、同僚の<tips=73>リュウカ</tips>さんが上がってきてそう話しかけました。","en":"One day, as I hung the children’s laundry on the roof, my colleague <tips=73>Ryuka</tips> came up and called to me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r75","rowIndex":75,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あ、ごめんなさい。こっちはもうすぐ終わりますんで……」","en":"“Oh, I’m sorry. I’ll be finished over here in just a moment...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r76","rowIndex":76,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「違うのよ。別に用事があるわけじゃないわ」","en":"“That’s not it. I didn’t come up because I needed anything.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r77","rowIndex":77,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=73>リュウカ</tips>さんは苦笑して、端にある丸いすを引き寄せました。そして、ながらく雨ざらしになって表面の合皮がはげかけたその椅子の表面の汚れを手で払ってから、腰をおろしたのです。","en":"<tips=73>Ryuka</tips> gave a rueful smile and pulled over a round stool from the edge of the roof. After brushing the dirt from its surface—the imitation leather had begun peeling after long exposure to the rain—she sat down.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r78","rowIndex":78,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いい天気ね」","en":"“Beautiful day.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r79","rowIndex":79,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女はジーパンとポロシャツといういたって簡素な服装でしたが、その下の身体の豊かな曲線は隠しきれていなくて布がはち切れそうなほどでした。溜息が出るほど素敵なスタイルで、表情なども私の目から見ても色っぽく、いわゆる男好きのする雰囲気を漂わせた人です。","en":"She wore nothing more elaborate than jeans and a polo shirt, but they could not conceal the voluptuous curves beneath; the fabric looked ready to burst. Her figure was lovely enough to draw a sigh, and even to my eyes there was something seductive in her expressions. She exuded what people called the sort of allure men went for.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r80","rowIndex":80,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私とほとんど同じ時期の入職なのですが、彼女の方がずっとベテランに見えるくらい、いつもてきぱきと動いています。<tips=73>リュウカ</tips>さんは明るくおしゃべり好きではありましたが、施設のルールや、間違った行いには厳格で、子供たちには親しむだけでなく恐れられてもいる、こわいお母さんのような存在でした。","en":"She had joined the staff at nearly the same time as I had, yet the brisk efficiency with which she always worked made her look far more experienced. Bright and fond of conversation though she was, <tips=73>Ryuka</tips> was uncompromising about the facility’s rules and any improper behavior. The children felt affection for her, but they feared her too. She was like a formidable mother.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r81","rowIndex":81,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私とは入職の時期が近いということで随分と仲良くして頂きました。だから、この施設で働く前のことなども、ぽつりぽつりと話してくれています。","en":"We had started working here around the same time, and she had always been very friendly toward me. Little by little, she had even told me about her life before coming to the facility.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r82","rowIndex":82,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それによると、ここに来る前の彼女は<tips=59>暗闇通り</tips>で娼婦をしていたのだそうです。これだけ美人で素敵な女性ならば、きっとさぞかし売れっ子だったでしょう。彼女を嫌いになる人がいるとは思えません。子供への接し方や、同僚との関わり方など、本当に尊敬出来るところばかりなのです。","en":"According to her, before coming here she had worked as a prostitute on <tips=59>Darkness Street</tips>. A woman as beautiful and wonderful as she was must have been immensely popular. I could not imagine anyone disliking her. In the way she treated the children and worked with her colleagues, there was nothing about her I did not admire.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r83","rowIndex":83,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「私が男の人だったら、財産が全部なくなるまで通ってましたよ」","en":"“If I were a man, I’d have kept coming until I’d spent every penny I owned.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r84","rowIndex":84,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　とその時真顔で言ったのは本気だったのですが、彼女は笑って相手にはしませんでした。","en":"I had said it with a perfectly straight face, and I had meant every word. She only laughed and paid me no mind.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r85","rowIndex":85,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして、夜の女としてかなり優雅な生活を送っていたそうなのですが、あるとき、このままではいけないとふと気がついたのだそうです。","en":"She had apparently lived quite comfortably as a woman of the night. Then, one day, it suddenly struck her that she could not go on that way.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r86","rowIndex":86,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　自分がやりたいのは、他人の欲望を満たすことではない。それはそれで孤独な男を癒やしたりも出来るわけで、仕事を卑下しているわけではないのだけれど、それよりも他にやることがあるのではないか？","en":"What she wanted was not to satisfy other people’s desires. The work could still bring comfort to lonely men, and she did not mean to disparage it—but might there be something else she was meant to do?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r87","rowIndex":87,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そう思い立つとすぐに夜間高校に入学し、去年卒業すると共にその仕事をやめて、ここで働くようになったとのことです。","en":"The moment she made up her mind, she enrolled in night school. Upon graduating the previous year, she left her old profession and began working here.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r88","rowIndex":88,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「わがままな男の相手してたのが、わがままな子供の相手をするのにかわっただけで、なんか似たようなところもあるけどねー」","en":"“All I’ve really done is trade dealing with selfish men for dealing with selfish kids. In some ways, the jobs aren’t so different.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r89","rowIndex":89,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　と<tips=73>リュウカ</tips>さんはその時笑いました。","en":"<tips=73>Ryuka</tips> had laughed when she said it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r90","rowIndex":90,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まだ若いんだし、もっと色んなことをやってみたい」","en":"“I’m still young. I want to try all kinds of things.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r91","rowIndex":91,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そう言う彼女の年は私より大分上で、見た感じだと二十代半ばくらいなのですが、はっきりとしたことはわかりません。本人も知らないのです。","en":"She was considerably older than I was and looked to be in her mid-twenties, though I could not say for certain. She did not know her own age either.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r92","rowIndex":92,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女もここの子供たちと同様、路上に捨てられた子供でした。従って、親の顔も名も国籍も知らないのです。","en":"Like the children here, she too had been abandoned on the street. She therefore knew neither her parents’ faces nor their names—not even her own nationality.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r93","rowIndex":93,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「やっぱり、気は変わらない？」","en":"“You still haven’t changed your mind?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r94","rowIndex":94,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女は看護師の資格をとるために学校探しを始めたところで、以前から私にも一緒に通おうと誘ってくれていたのです。","en":"She had just begun looking for a nursing school, and had been asking me for some time to enroll alongside her.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r95","rowIndex":95,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうですね。私はまだここで働いていたいですね……」","en":"“No. I think I still want to work here...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r96","rowIndex":96,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は苦笑いを浮かべて答えました。","en":"I answered with an awkward smile.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r97","rowIndex":97,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　看護学校はこの辺りにはないので、どこへ通うにしても街を出ることになってしまうのです。","en":"There were no nursing schools nearby, so attending any of them would mean leaving the city.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r98","rowIndex":98,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そっか。じゃあ仕方ないね」","en":"“I see. Can’t be helped, then.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r99","rowIndex":99,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=73>リュウカ</tips>さんは言いながら手で胸ポケットを探るしぐさをしましたが、すぐにその手を止めて苦笑しました。","en":"As she spoke, <tips=73>Ryuka</tips> made as if to search her breast pocket, only to stop herself at once with a wry smile.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r100","rowIndex":100,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　習慣で無意識に探してしまったものの、禁煙していることを思い出したのでしょう。","en":"She had probably reached for it unconsciously out of habit before remembering that she had quit smoking.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r101","rowIndex":101,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「でもさあ、まっちゃんはこの先どうするつもりなの？　ずっとここにいるの？」","en":"“But what are you planning to do with the rest of your life, Matsu? Stay here forever?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r102","rowIndex":102,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうですね。私は、そのつもりです。……<tips=73>リュウカ</tips>さんは、資格をとったらどこか外の病院にでも行くんですか？」","en":"“Yes. That’s what I intend to do. ...Once you’re qualified, <tips=73>Ryuka</tips>, will you take a job at a hospital outside the city?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r103","rowIndex":103,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「うーん、それもいいかもね。そうすれば、周りの人はみんな私の過去なんか知らないわけだし、人生リセット出来るんだろうけど……」","en":"“Hmm. That might be nice. Nobody there would know a thing about my past, so I suppose I could make a fresh start...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r104","rowIndex":104,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=73>リュウカ</tips>さんは首を捻ってから、","en":"<tips=73>Ryuka</tips> tilted her head, then continued.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r105","rowIndex":105,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「でも、私は、あの<tips=59>暗闇通り</tips>の<tips=73>リュウカ</tips>さんが、立派な看護師になって帰って来たって、みんなに喜んで貰えるほうが楽しいんだよね。変に隠すよりさ、私のことなーんでも知ってる人が一杯いる場所で受け入れて貰う方が『生きがい』って気がしない？」","en":"“But wouldn’t it be more fun to come home as a fine nurse and have everyone celebrate what became of <tips=73>Ryuka</tips> from <tips=59>Darkness Street</tips>? Instead of trying to hide my past, doesn’t being accepted by a place full of people who know everything about me feel more like having something to live for?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r106","rowIndex":106,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そう笑って、","en":"She smiled.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r107","rowIndex":107,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それに私、この街大好きなんだよねー。よそとは比べものにならないくらい治安は悪いし、おかしい人は一杯いるけど、みんな凄く人間らしく生きてるって思う。だから、免許とったらこの街に戻ってくるつもり。まっちゃんが、離れたくない気持ちも本当はよくわかるんだー」","en":"“Besides, I love this city. It’s far more dangerous than anywhere else, and it’s full of strange people, but everyone here seems to live so thoroughly as a human being. So once I have my license, I’m coming back. Truth is, I understand perfectly well why you don’t want to leave, Matsu.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r108","rowIndex":108,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　と、いたずらっぽく指先で自分の鼻をかきました。","en":"She scratched the tip of her nose with one finger, a mischievous look on her face.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r109","rowIndex":109,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「確かに離れたくないというのはありますけど、でも私の場合は違うんですよ。私、<tips=73>リュウカ</tips>さんみたいに前向きに考えてるわけじゃありません」","en":"“I suppose not wanting to leave is part of it. But it’s different for me. I don’t see things positively the way you do, <tips=73>Ryuka</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r110","rowIndex":110,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私はちょっと気まずくなってそう言いました。","en":"I said this, feeling a little awkward.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r111","rowIndex":111,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「この街は好きは好きなんですけど、外がいやだから閉じこもってるという感じもして……なんだかこれも良くない考え方なのかなって気がしてしまって……かといって絶対外には出たくないんですけど……」","en":"“I do love this city, but sometimes I feel as though I’m only hiding here because I can’t bear the world outside... Then I start wondering whether that’s a bad way to think too... Not that I’m willing to leave under any circumstances...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r112","rowIndex":112,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私が肩をすくめると、","en":"I shrugged.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r113","rowIndex":113,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いやー、まっちゃんも悩んでるんだねえ。いつもニコニコしてるその裏で」","en":"“Well, well. So you have your troubles too, Matsu, hiding behind that constant smile.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r114","rowIndex":114,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=73>リュウカ</tips>さんはニヤニヤと笑いました。","en":"<tips=73>Ryuka</tips> grinned at me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r115","rowIndex":115,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まだ若いんだし、思い切り悩めば良いと思うよ。その結果、街に残ったって、街を出ていったって、このお天道様には何の関係もないどうでもいいことなんだからねー」","en":"“You’re still young, so worry as much as you like. Whether you end up staying in the city or leaving it, it makes no difference at all to the sun up there.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r116","rowIndex":116,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして目の上に手のひらでひさしをつくって、空に輝く太陽の方を眺めました。","en":"She raised a hand above her eyes and gazed toward the sun shining in the sky.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r117","rowIndex":117,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「うーん、今日はめずらしく良い天気だ！　さて、じゃあいつまでもサボってないでガキたちの面倒を見に行くかな。あいつら、目を離すとすぐ悪さばっかりするからね」","en":"“Mm, what a beautiful day for once! All right, I’d better stop lazing around and go look after those brats. Take your eyes off them for a second and they’re straight into trouble.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r118","rowIndex":118,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そう言って、<tips=73>リュウカ</tips>さんは椅子を立ち上がり、建物へ戻っていったのです。","en":"With that, <tips=73>Ryuka</tips> rose from her chair and went back inside.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r119","rowIndex":119,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　これが、私にとって彼女と交わした最後の会話となりました。","en":"That was the last conversation I ever had with her.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r120","rowIndex":120,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それから<tips=73>リュウカ</tips>さんは二日間休みを取って、そして三日目の朝に出勤するシフトとなっていたのです。","en":"<tips=73>Ryuka</tips> had the next two days off. Her shift was due to begin on the morning of the third.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r121","rowIndex":121,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しかし、その日彼女は現れませんでした。電話をしても繋がりません。","en":"But that day, she never appeared. When we called, we could not reach her.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r122","rowIndex":122,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　いつも三十分前には職場に到着しており、遅刻も欠勤も一度もしたことがない<tips=73>リュウカ</tips>さんなのです。職場の皆は不審に思い、誰かが見に行こうという話になりました。","en":"<tips=73>Ryuka</tips> always arrived half an hour before her shift and had never once been late or absent. Everyone at the facility knew something was wrong, and we began discussing who should go and check on her.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r123","rowIndex":123,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「私行きます」","en":"“I’ll go.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r124","rowIndex":124,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　と最初に手を上げたのは私でした。心配で、どうしても様子を見たかったのです。","en":"I was the first to volunteer. I was worried and could not bear not knowing how she was.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r125","rowIndex":125,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「じゃあ私も」","en":"“Then I’ll come too.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ハシモト","displayName":"Hashimoto","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r126","rowIndex":126,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　次にハシモトさんが手を上げて、そうして私たち二人で彼女の住まいを訪ねることになりました。","en":"Hashimoto raised her hand next, and the two of us went to visit Ryuka’s home.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r127","rowIndex":127,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=73>リュウカ</tips>さんの住まいは<tips=9>Y地区</tips>でも比較的治安が良く清潔な一角にありました。","en":"<tips=73>Ryuka</tips> lived in a relatively clean and safe corner of <tips=9>Y District</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r128","rowIndex":128,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　この辺りでは高級なマンションで、よそからやって来たばかりの住宅街に住むのに不安な人々や、医師などの生活に余裕のある人々が主に利用しています。","en":"It was an expensive apartment building by local standards, occupied mainly by newcomers who felt uneasy about living in an ordinary neighborhood and by people with money to spare, such as doctors.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r129","rowIndex":129,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=73>リュウカ</tips>さんが裏通りで娼婦をやっていた頃に借りた部屋で、その建物の前まで来たときには「もう昔より収入減っちゃったから、もっと安いところに引っ越さないとねー」と苦笑していたのを思い出しました。","en":"She had rented the apartment back when she worked as a prostitute in the alleys. As we reached the building, I remembered <tips=73>Ryuka</tips> saying with a wry smile, “I don’t make as much as I used to anymore, so I really ought to move somewhere cheaper.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r130","rowIndex":130,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　玄関ホールに足を踏み入れるとおよそ<tips=9>Y地区</tips>らしくないピカピカに磨かれた天然石が敷き詰められて、照明の光を反射しています。","en":"The moment we stepped into the lobby, we found the floor paved in gleaming, immaculately polished natural stone, reflecting the lights above—a sight wholly unlike <tips=9>Y District</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r131","rowIndex":131,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いーなー。私もこんなところに住みたーい。<tips=73>リュウカ</tips>ちゃんみたいな仕事してれば私も住めるのかしら？」","en":"“Oh, how nice. I wish I could live somewhere like this. Maybe I could if I took up the same line of work as <tips=73>Ryuka</tips>?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ハシモト","displayName":"Hashimoto","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r132","rowIndex":132,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そんな風に唇を尖らせるハシモトさんも、<tips=73>リュウカ</tips>さんの前職を知る職員の一人でした。","en":"Hashimoto, who pouted as she spoke, was one of the members of staff who knew about <tips=73>Ryuka’s</tips> former profession.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r133","rowIndex":133,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私はオートロックの前に立ち、彼女の部屋番号を押します。すると、","en":"I stood before the building’s intercom and entered her apartment number. Then—","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r134","rowIndex":134,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"『はーい』","en":"‘Yes?’","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r135","rowIndex":135,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　と声がして、画面に映ったのは見たことがない男性でした。","en":"A voice answered, and an unfamiliar man appeared on the screen.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r136","rowIndex":136,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は男性の歳を当てるのは苦手なのですが、三十才くらいでしょうか？　黒い髪に白い肌、まぶたはくっきりとした二重で、鼻が高い、非常に顔の整った白人男性でした。","en":"I was never good at guessing a man’s age, but I would have put him at around thirty. He was an exceptionally handsome white man, with black hair, pale skin, clearly defined double eyelids, and a high-bridged nose.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r137","rowIndex":137,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私とハシモトさんは顔を見合わせます。","en":"Hashimoto and I exchanged looks.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r138","rowIndex":138,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=73>リュウカ</tips>さんならば恋人の一人や二人いたっておかしくないのですが、彼女がいつも「男なんかもう散々」と溜息をついていたのを聞いていたからです。","en":"There would have been nothing strange about <tips=73>Ryuka</tips> having a lover or two, but we had so often heard her sigh that she had “had more than enough of men.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r139","rowIndex":139,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あの、<tips=73>リュウカ</tips>さんの同僚の汐とハシモトです。今日お仕事を休まれたので、様子を見に来たんです」","en":"“Um, we’re Shio and Hashimoto. We work with <tips=73>Ryuka</tips>. She didn’t come in today, so we came to check on her.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r140","rowIndex":140,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は気になりながらも、とりあえず用件を告げました。","en":"Though my curiosity persisted, I began by explaining why we were there.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r141","rowIndex":141,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"『ああ、そうなの。それはご苦労だね……ふぁあ』","en":"‘Oh, really? Well, thanks for going to the trouble... Aaah.’","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r142","rowIndex":142,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　男性は今まで寝ていたらしく、あくびをします。","en":"The man yawned, apparently having been asleep until then.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r143","rowIndex":143,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あ、あの、お休みだったらすみません。特に何もなく、無事だったらそれでいいんです……」","en":"“Oh, I’m sorry if we woke you. If nothing’s wrong and she’s safe, that’s all we wanted to know...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r144","rowIndex":144,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　もし二人の時間を無粋に邪魔してしまったのだとしたらどうしよう。","en":"What if we had tactlessly intruded upon their time alone?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r145","rowIndex":145,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そう思うと私は恥ずかしくなって、ちょっと顔を伏せながらモニターに話しかけました。","en":"The thought made me blush, and I spoke into the monitor with my face slightly lowered.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r146","rowIndex":146,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"『いや、大丈夫。上がりたいなら上がる？　おれはこの子の友だちに興味もあるし……きっと本人も、きみたちに会いたいだろう。……ちょっと待っててね。いまドアを開けるから』","en":"‘No, it’s fine. If you want to come up, why not? I’m curious to meet this girl’s friends... and I’m sure she’d like to see you too. ...Wait there a moment. I’ll open the door.’","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r147","rowIndex":147,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あの……」","en":"“Um...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r148","rowIndex":148,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私の言葉を待たず、目の前のガラスのドアは音もなくすっと開きました。","en":"Without waiting for my answer, the glass door before us slid soundlessly open.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r149","rowIndex":149,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"『じゃあ待ってるよ』","en":"‘I’ll be waiting.’","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r150","rowIndex":150,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　男性は最後にもう一つあくびをしながら、有無を言わさず通話を切ってしまいました。仕方なく、私たちはそのドアからマンション内に足を踏み入れたのです。","en":"The man gave one final yawn, then ended the call before we could object. Left with little choice, we passed through the door and entered the building.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r151","rowIndex":151,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=55>汐さん</tips>、もしかして、<tips=73>リュウカ</tips>ちゃんは、あのすっごくいい男と一日中楽しんでたのかしら？」","en":"“<tips=55>Ms. Shio</tips>, you don’t suppose <tips=73>Ryuka</tips> spent the whole day having fun with that gorgeous man, do you?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ハシモト","displayName":"Hashimoto","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r152","rowIndex":152,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ハシモトさんは、困惑の表情を浮かべて私を見ます。","en":"Hashimoto looked at me, bewilderment on her face.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r153","rowIndex":153,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　背の低い彼女は見上げるような形になって、顎を上げるときに少しズレた眼鏡を人差し指で直しました。","en":"Short as she was, she had to tilt her head back to look at me, nudging her glasses into place with one forefinger when the motion set them askew.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r154","rowIndex":154,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どうなんでしょう……。でも、あの人はそういう理由で仕事を休む人でもないような……」","en":"“I don’t know... But she doesn’t seem like the sort of person who would miss work for a reason like that...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r155","rowIndex":155,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　普段なら、十分遅刻するだけでも前もって連絡を入れるような責任感のある人なのです。","en":"She was so conscientious that under ordinary circumstances, she would notify us in advance even if she expected to be only ten minutes late.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r156","rowIndex":156,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうね。そうだよね」","en":"“Yes. You’re right.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ハシモト","displayName":"Hashimoto","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r157","rowIndex":157,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ハシモトさんも私の意見に頷いてくれました。","en":"Hashimoto nodded in agreement.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r158","rowIndex":158,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あんなに真面目な子いないもの。……私、最初は馬鹿にしてたんだ。ああいう仕事で荒稼ぎしてきた人が、どうせ長続きするわけないって。でも今では一番尊敬している。私なんかよりずっと年下なのに、ずっと根性があるわ……」","en":"“You won’t find anyone more dependable. ...I used to look down on her, you know. I thought someone who’d made a killing in that line of work could never stick it out here. But now I respect her more than anyone. She’s so much younger than me, yet she has so much more backbone...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ハシモト","displayName":"Hashimoto","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r159","rowIndex":159,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……そうなんですか」","en":"“...I see.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r160","rowIndex":160,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=55>汐さん</tips>も、そうとう根性があると思うけどね」","en":"“You’ve got plenty of backbone yourself, <tips=55>Ms. Shio</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ハシモト","displayName":"Hashimoto","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r161","rowIndex":161,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「わ、私はそんなことないですよ」","en":"“I-I’m nothing of the sort.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r162","rowIndex":162,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　急に話を褒められたので慌てて否定しましたが、ハシモトさんは真顔のままで、","en":"Flustered by the sudden compliment, I hurried to deny it, but Hashimoto’s expression remained perfectly serious.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r163","rowIndex":163,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「でも、もし<tips=73>リュウカ</tips>ちゃんが恋人と遊んでいたのなら、私たち、今日、お邪魔しちゃったのかもしれないね……」","en":"“Still, if <tips=73>Ryuka</tips> really was off enjoying herself with her lover, maybe we’ve intruded on them today...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ハシモト","displayName":"Hashimoto","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r164","rowIndex":164,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そう言って肩をすくめるのです。","en":"She shrugged.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r165","rowIndex":165,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして私たちは<tips=73>リュウカ</tips>さんの部屋に辿り着きました。","en":"Then we arrived at the apartment belonging to <tips=73>Ryuka</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r166","rowIndex":166,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ようこそ、お上がり」","en":"“Welcome. Come in.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アレクセイ","displayName":"Alexei","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r167","rowIndex":167,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ノックをすると、さっきの男性がドアを開け、笑顔で私たちを迎え入れました。","en":"When we knocked, the man from the intercom opened the door and welcomed us inside with a smile.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r168","rowIndex":168,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=73>リュウカ</tips>さんの部屋は、彼女の性格を反映して、清潔でよく片付いていました。","en":"True to <tips=73>Ryuka’s</tips> character, her apartment was clean and neatly kept.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r169","rowIndex":169,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　間取りは３LDKか、ことによってはもっと広かったかもしれません。家具やカーテンは白を基調としてまとめられ、その品質の良さはもちろん、品の選び方も<tips=73>リュウカ</tips>さんのセンスの良さをあらわしていました。","en":"The apartment appeared to be a three-bedroom unit with a combined living and dining room, though it might have been larger still. The furniture and curtains were coordinated around white; both their quality and the taste with which they had been selected spoke to <tips=73>Ryuka’s</tips> discerning eye.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r170","rowIndex":170,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「紅茶でいいかい？　確か、ちょっと良い奴があったと思うんだ」","en":"“Tea all right? I think she had some of the good stuff around here.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アレクセイ","displayName":"Alexei","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r171","rowIndex":171,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちはリビングのテーブルに案内され、男性はキッチンに紅茶を探しに行きます。","en":"He showed us to the table in the living room, then went to the kitchen in search of the tea.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r172","rowIndex":172,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「おれは<tips=64>アレクセイ</tips>って言うんだ。きみたちの名前は？」","en":"“My name’s <tips=64>Alexei</tips>. What are yours?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r173","rowIndex":173,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=64>アレクセイ</tips>と名乗った彼は、棚を探しながらそう尋ねて来ました。","en":"The man who had introduced himself as <tips=64>Alexei</tips> asked as he rummaged through the cupboards.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r174","rowIndex":174,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ハシモトです」","en":"“Hashimoto.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ハシモト","displayName":"Hashimoto","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r175","rowIndex":175,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　男性を前にするといつも挙動不審になってしまうハシモトさんは、かちこちになりながらそう答えました。","en":"Hashimoto, who never knew how to behave around men, answered stiff as a board.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r176","rowIndex":176,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「汐です」","en":"“Shio.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r177","rowIndex":177,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「職場の同僚なんだって？　わざわざ訪ねてくるだなんて偉いもんだ。ちょっと待っててくれよ。すぐに淹れてやるから」","en":"“So you’re her coworkers? Very conscientious of you to come all this way. Give me a minute—I’ll make it for you in no time.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r178","rowIndex":178,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　男性はガタガタとあちこちの引き出しを出したりしまったりしているのですが、なかなか目当てのものを見つけられないようでした。","en":"The man noisily opened and closed one drawer after another, apparently unable to find what he wanted.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r179","rowIndex":179,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あの、そんな、どうぞおかまいなく。<tips=73>リュウカ</tips>さんの顔を見に来ただけですので」","en":"“Oh, please, there’s no need to trouble yourself. We only came to see <tips=73>Ryuka</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ハシモト","displayName":"Hashimoto","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r180","rowIndex":180,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　見かねたハシモトさんがそう声をかけても、男性は首を左右に振ります。","en":"Unable to keep watching him struggle, Hashimoto called out, but the man shook his head.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r181","rowIndex":181,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いやあ、確かにこのへんから出して貰ったんだけどな。必ず見つけるから、ちょっと待ってなよ。……ほら、あったあった。それでカップは、この辺だったような……」","en":"“No, I’m sure she got it out for me from somewhere around here. I’ll find it, so just sit tight... Ah, there it is. Now, I thought the cups were around here too...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r182","rowIndex":182,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そうして男性が苦労の末に見つけたお茶と道具で手ずから淹れてくれた紅茶を中心に、三人でテーブルを挟んで向かい合う格好となりました。","en":"After much difficulty, the man found the tea and everything needed to brew it, then prepared it himself. And so the three of us came to sit around the table, facing one another over our cups.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r183","rowIndex":183,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　窓のレースカーテン越しに差し込む光が男性の横顔を照らしています。","en":"Light filtering through the lace curtains illuminated the man’s profile.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r184","rowIndex":184,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　こうしてみると男性はまるで映画俳優のようにさえ見えました。肌は青磁のように白くなめらかで、目は黒く澄み、睫毛は長く豊かです。唇はうっすらピンク色をしています。","en":"Seen in that light, he might almost have been a film star. His skin was as pale and smooth as celadon, his eyes limpid and black, his lashes long and full. His lips were faintly pink.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r185","rowIndex":185,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　微笑みも魅力的で、多くの女性はそれだけでよろめいてしまうでしょう。","en":"His smile was captivating as well. That alone would have made many women swoon.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r186","rowIndex":186,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　なのになぜか、私の嫌悪感を逆立てるのです。非常に不快な。","en":"And yet, for some reason, the sight of him made my revulsion bristle. It was an intensely unpleasant sensation.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r187","rowIndex":187,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は他人に対して好き嫌いがあまりない方だと思っていたので、初対面の相手にこんな感情を抱いてしまった自分に戸惑いました。","en":"I had always thought myself a person with few strong likes or dislikes, and I was bewildered that I had taken such an instant dislike to someone I had only just met.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r188","rowIndex":188,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　いきなり嫌うだなんて失礼だ、と思いながら私は感情が表に出ないよう努めました。","en":"It was rude to take an instant dislike to someone for no reason, I told myself, and I did my best not to let my feelings show.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r189","rowIndex":189,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あの、<tips=73>リュウカ</tips>さんは？」","en":"“Um, where is <tips=73>Ryuka</tips>?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ハシモト","displayName":"Hashimoto","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r190","rowIndex":190,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ハシモトさんはその美貌に恥じらうように俯きつつ、そう訊ねました。","en":"Overcome with shyness before such beauty, Hashimoto lowered her eyes as she asked.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r191","rowIndex":191,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「うん、すぐに会わせてあげるから、ちょっと待って」","en":"“Yes, I’ll let you see her in a moment. Just wait.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アレクセイ","displayName":"Alexei","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r192","rowIndex":192,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「寝ているんですか？」","en":"“Is she asleep?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r193","rowIndex":193,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私はハシモトさんと対照的に、その<tips=64>アレクセイ</tips>と名乗った男性の目をまっすぐ見つめながら尋ねました。","en":"Unlike Hashimoto, I asked while staring directly into the eyes of the man who had introduced himself as <tips=64>Alexei</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r194","rowIndex":194,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　なんだか信用が出来なかったのです。それは初対面の嫌悪感のせいだけではありません。先ほどから彼の振る舞いや言葉遣いに違和感を覚えて仕方がないのです。","en":"I simply could not trust him. Nor was it only the revulsion I had felt at first sight. Something in his behavior and manner of speaking had struck me as wrong from the beginning, and I could not dismiss it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r195","rowIndex":195,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まあ、そんなものだね……」","en":"“Something like that...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アレクセイ","displayName":"Alexei","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r196","rowIndex":196,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=64>アレクセイ</tips>は紅茶にたっぷりの砂糖を溶かしてから、口を付けます。","en":"<tips=64>Alexei</tips> dissolved a generous amount of sugar in his tea and took a sip.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r197","rowIndex":197,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あ、あの、<tips=64>アレクセイ</tips>さんは、<tips=73>リュウカ</tips>さんとどういうご関係なんですか？」","en":"“U-um, Mr. <tips=64>Alexei</tips>, what exactly is your relationship with <tips=73>Ryuka</tips>?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ハシモト","displayName":"Hashimoto","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r198","rowIndex":198,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ハシモトさんがおずおずと訊ねると、<tips=64>アレクセイ</tips>はふふんと笑って、","en":"When Hashimoto timidly asked, <tips=64>Alexei</tips> gave a self-satisfied little laugh.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r199","rowIndex":199,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そんなに昔からの知り合いってわけじゃないが、意気投合してね。今は彼女のことは深いところまでよく知ってる仲かな」","en":"“We haven’t known each other very long, but we hit it off. By now, you might say I know her very deeply indeed.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アレクセイ","displayName":"Alexei","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r200","rowIndex":200,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ま、まあ」","en":"“Oh my.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ハシモト","displayName":"Hashimoto","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r201","rowIndex":201,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ハシモトさんは顔を赤く染めました。","en":"Hashimoto’s face turned red.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r202","rowIndex":202,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=64>アレクセイ</tips>はフリーのイラストレーターだと自己紹介をしました。あちこちを旅しながらパソコンでイラストを書き、それをメールで出版社に送っているのだと言います。","en":"<tips=64>Alexei</tips> introduced himself as a freelance illustrator. He said that he traveled from place to place, creating illustrations on his computer and sending them to publishing houses by email.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r203","rowIndex":203,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「気楽な一人旅さ。どこでも仕事が出来るからね。……ねえ、そういえばそちらの子は余り喋らないけれど……」","en":"“I travel alone and take it easy. I can work anywhere, after all. ...Speaking of which, the girl over there hasn’t said much.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アレクセイ","displayName":"Alexei","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r204","rowIndex":204,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=64>アレクセイ</tips>はくっきりした二重の目を細めて私の方を見ました。","en":"<tips=64>Alexei</tips> narrowed his clearly double-lidded eyes and looked at me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r205","rowIndex":205,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　目が合うと、ぞくりと悪寒がしました。それも、理由がわかりません。","en":"When our eyes met, a shuddering chill ran through me. Once again, I could not say why.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r206","rowIndex":206,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あの……そろそろ、<tips=73>リュウカ</tips>さんに会わせていただきたいんですが」","en":"“Um... I think it’s time you let us see <tips=73>Ryuka</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r207","rowIndex":207,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私がそう言った時、表情は硬くなっていたと思います。","en":"My expression, I believe, had gone rigid as I spoke.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r208","rowIndex":208,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=73>リュウカ</tips>さんと会って、お話が出来たら今日は帰りますので」","en":"“As soon as we’ve seen <tips=73>Ryuka</tips> and spoken with her, we’ll be on our way.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r209","rowIndex":209,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「わかった。おれの無駄話で引き留めてしまったようだね。今連れてこよう」","en":"“All right. It seems I’ve kept you here with my idle chatter. I’ll go and bring her now.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アレクセイ","displayName":"Alexei","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r210","rowIndex":210,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=64>アレクセイ</tips>は微笑したまま席を立ちます。","en":"Still smiling, <tips=64>Alexei</tips> rose from his seat.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r211","rowIndex":211,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ちょ、ちょっと、<tips=55>汐さん</tips>どうしたの？　なんだか失礼じゃない？」","en":"“H-hey, <tips=55>Ms. Shio</tips>, what’s gotten into you? Don’t you think you’re being rather rude?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ハシモト","displayName":"Hashimoto","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r212","rowIndex":212,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=64>アレクセイ</tips>が奥の部屋に引っ込むと、ハシモトさんがひそひそ声でそう囁きました。","en":"Once <tips=64>Alexei</tips> had disappeared into a room at the back, Hashimoto whispered to me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r213","rowIndex":213,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうですね。でも、なんだかとてもいやな感じがするんです。うまく説明出来ないのですが……」","en":"“I suppose I am. But something about him feels terribly wrong. I can’t explain it very well...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r214","rowIndex":214,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうお？　魅力的な男の人だと思うけど。<tips=55>汐さん</tips>はかわいいから、男の人に厳しいのかしらねえ」","en":"“You think so? I find him charming. Maybe a pretty girl like you can afford to be particular about men, <tips=55>Ms. Shio</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ハシモト","displayName":"Hashimoto","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r215","rowIndex":215,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ハシモトさんが唇をとがらすのに、私は別のことを考えていて答えられませんでした。その時にはもう頭の中は<tips=64>アレクセイ</tips>への疑念で一杯で、あれこれと不安ばかりが雲のようにもくもくと広がって心に充満していたのです。","en":"Hashimoto pouted, but my thoughts were elsewhere, and I could not answer. By then my mind was consumed with suspicion of <tips=64>Alexei</tips>, while one misgiving after another billowed like clouds until my heart was full of them.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r216","rowIndex":216,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そうして、<tips=64>アレクセイ</tips>が白い皿を手に帰って来ました。","en":"Then <tips=64>Alexei</tips> returned carrying a white plate.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r217","rowIndex":217,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いやあ、待たせたね。向こうで少し話し込んでしまって」","en":"“Sorry to keep you waiting. We got a little carried away talking in there.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アレクセイ","displayName":"Alexei","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r218","rowIndex":218,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼はそう言いながら、机の上に皿を置きます。それには、銀色のドーム状の蓋――クロッシュというらしい――が乗せられていました。","en":"As he spoke, he set the plate on the table. Resting over it was a silver dome of a cover—a cloche, I believe it is called.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r219","rowIndex":219,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　何か食べ物を持って来たのでしょうが、とても食べる気になんかなりません。私はチラとそれに視線をやってから、<tips=64>アレクセイ</tips>の目を見据え、","en":"He must have brought us something to eat, but I had no appetite for it. I flicked a glance at it, then fixed my eyes upon <tips=64>Alexei</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r220","rowIndex":220,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=73>リュウカ</tips>さんは、どこですか？　会わせてくれるという話だったはずですが」","en":"“Where is <tips=73>Ryuka</tips>? You said you were going to let us see her.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r221","rowIndex":221,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ちょ、ちょっと……」","en":"“W-wait...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ハシモト","displayName":"Hashimoto","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r222","rowIndex":222,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ハシモトさんは問い詰めるような口調になった私を肘でつつきました。","en":"My tone had become accusatory, and Hashimoto nudged me with her elbow.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r223","rowIndex":223,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「会わせるよ。会いたきゃね。でも、本当に会いたいかい？　おれは気が進まないんだがね。会ったら後悔すると思う」","en":"“I’ll let you see her, if you insist. But do you really want to? I’d rather not show you. I think you’ll regret it if I do.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アレクセイ","displayName":"Alexei","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r224","rowIndex":224,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「構いません。今すぐ会わせてください」","en":"“I don’t care. Let us see her now.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r225","rowIndex":225,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私ははっきりとそう言いました。","en":"I said it plainly.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r226","rowIndex":226,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ふむ、どうしても会わなきゃ引き下がらないという感じだね。それなら、ちょっと会ってみるのもいいかもしれない」","en":"“Hmm. I see you have no intention of leaving until you’ve seen her. In that case, perhaps I ought to let you see her for a moment.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アレクセイ","displayName":"Alexei","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r227","rowIndex":227,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=64>アレクセイ</tips>は言うと、皿の上のクロッシュをつまみとったのです。","en":"With that, <tips=64>Alexei</tips> took hold of the cloche and lifted it from the plate.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r228","rowIndex":228,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ひいいっ！」","en":"“Eeeeeek!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r229","rowIndex":229,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ハシモトさんはつんざくような悲鳴を上げて全身をこわばらせました。","en":"Hashimoto let out a piercing scream, her entire body going rigid.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r230","rowIndex":230,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　皿の上に隠されていたのは料理ではなく、人間の頭部の輪切りだったのです。","en":"What lay hidden beneath the cover was not food, but a crosswise slice of a human head.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r231","rowIndex":231,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　三センチほどの厚さにスライスされ、後ろの方には毛が生え、左右には耳たぶのかけら、そして正面には二つの眼球がぎょろりと並んでこちらを見ていました。その目を見た時、私はすべてを悟りました。","en":"It was some three centimeters thick, with hair growing from the back, pieces of earlobe at either side, and two eyeballs lined up at the front, staring directly at us. The moment I saw those eyes, I understood everything.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r232","rowIndex":232,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は顔を顰め、唇を噛むと、<tips=64>アレクセイ</tips>を睨み付けます。","en":"I grimaced, bit my lip, and glared at <tips=64>Alexei</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r233","rowIndex":233,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼はうっすらと笑っています。","en":"He was smiling faintly.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r234","rowIndex":234,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「残念ながら会話は出来ないけれど、間違いなくこれは……ええと、<tips=73>リュウカ</tips>だっけ？　彼女だよ」","en":"“Unfortunately, conversation is out of the question, but there’s no doubt this is... what was it, <tips=73>Ryuka</tips>? Yes. This is her.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アレクセイ","displayName":"Alexei","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r235","rowIndex":235,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ひっ……あっ……これっ……」","en":"“Ah... Th-this...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ハシモト","displayName":"Hashimoto","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r236","rowIndex":236,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ハシモトさんはすっかり動転して、椅子の上に凍り付いています。","en":"Utterly distraught, Hashimoto sat frozen in her chair.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r237","rowIndex":237,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あなたがやったんですね？」","en":"“You did this, didn’t you?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r238","rowIndex":238,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私の問いに<tips=64>アレクセイ</tips>は答えず、","en":"<tips=64>Alexei</tips> did not answer my question.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r239","rowIndex":239,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「本当はおれは、きみたちにはこのまま無事帰って貰いたいんだけれどね。だって、可哀想じゃないか。人はむやみに死ぬべきじゃない。喜びや悲しみを重ねて築いた素敵な人生を終わらせてしまうのはいつだって心苦しい。でも、他のやつらが反対しているんだ。ごめんね。きみたちはもう家に帰れない」","en":"“The truth is, I’d like you two to go home safe and sound. After all, it would be a shame. People shouldn’t die needlessly. It always pains me to end a wonderful life built out of layer upon layer of joy and sorrow. But the others object. I’m sorry. You won’t be going home anymore.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アレクセイ","displayName":"Alexei","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r240","rowIndex":240,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして彼がポケットに手を入れようとしたところで、私は動きました。","en":"As he moved to put a hand into his pocket, I acted.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r241","rowIndex":241,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　これを見せた時点で、彼が何か仕掛けてくるのは察していたので、思いの外素早く反応出来ました。","en":"From the moment he showed us what lay beneath the cover, I had known he would make a move, so I reacted more quickly than I expected.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r242","rowIndex":242,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私はテーブルの縁を掴んで、<tips=64>アレクセイ</tips>の方にひっくり返します。すると、皿や、紅茶の入ったカップが盛大な音を立てて彼にふりかかりました。","en":"I seized the edge of the table and heaved it over toward <tips=64>Alexei</tips>. The plate and teacups went crashing down upon him, tea and all.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r243","rowIndex":243,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「うわっ！」","en":"“Whoa!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r244","rowIndex":244,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼は驚いて声をあげます。慣れた人ならこれくらいではびっくりしないので、ちょっと意外でした。","en":"He cried out in surprise. That struck me as rather unexpected. Anyone accustomed to violence would not have been startled by so little.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r245","rowIndex":245,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「走ってください！」","en":"“Run!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r246","rowIndex":246,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は驚いているハシモトさんの手を握って、彼女を強引に引っ張るとドアの方へ走ります。","en":"I seized the stunned Hashimoto by the hand and ran for the door, hauling her after me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r247","rowIndex":247,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　恐怖でこわばった彼女の動きは遅く、きっと二人で走って逃げ切るのは難しい。そう判断した私は、ハシモトさんだけを部屋の外へ押し出しました。","en":"Terror had left her rigid and slow. We would never escape if we tried to run together; realizing this, I shoved Hashimoto alone out of the apartment.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r248","rowIndex":248,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そのまま逃げて通報してください！　ここは私が食い止めますから！」","en":"“Keep running and call the police! I’ll hold him here!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r249","rowIndex":249,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「で、で、でも！」","en":"“B-but—but!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r250","rowIndex":250,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ハシモトさんは真っ赤になって動揺しており、眼鏡がずり下がっています。","en":"Hashimoto was flushed scarlet with panic, and her glasses had slipped down her nose.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r251","rowIndex":251,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「私は大丈夫です！　はやく！」","en":"“I’ll be all right! Hurry!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r252","rowIndex":252,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私はその眼鏡を直してから、そう叫びました。","en":"I pushed her glasses back into place, then shouted the words.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r253","rowIndex":253,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おそらく初めて聞いた私の大声に、ハシモトさんはガクガクと頷くと、おぼつかない足で駆けてゆきました。怯えて腰が抜けていたらと心配していたのですが、ちゃんとうまく走れていたので私は安堵の溜息をつき、ドアを閉めました。","en":"It was probably the first time she had ever heard me raise my voice. Hashimoto nodded shakily and set off at a stumbling run. I had feared terror might have robbed her legs of all strength, but she was managing to run; relieved, I closed the door behind her.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r254","rowIndex":254,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして振り返ると、<tips=64>アレクセイ</tips>がテーブルの側に立ち、紅茶で汚れたシャツを気にしている光景が目に入りました。","en":"When I turned, I found <tips=64>Alexei</tips> standing beside the table, preoccupied with his tea-stained shirt.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r255","rowIndex":255,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼は顔を上げて、私を見ます。例の、いやな目で。","en":"He raised his head and looked at me with those same repellent eyes.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r256","rowIndex":256,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「きみも一緒に逃げた方が良かったんじゃないのか？」","en":"“Wouldn’t you have been better off escaping with her?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アレクセイ","displayName":"Alexei","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r257","rowIndex":257,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして不敵に笑ったのですが、私は何も答えませんでした。ただ、思い切り彼の顔を睨み付けていました。いまカラーコンタクトをとれば、私の金色の目がいつも以上にらんらんと輝いていたでしょう。","en":"He gave me a defiant smile, but I did not answer. I only glared at him as fiercely as I could. Had I taken out my colored contacts, my golden eyes would have been blazing brighter than ever.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r258","rowIndex":258,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　興奮するとまるで豆電球みたいに光って見えると、小さい頃、子供同士の喧嘩に参加したときなど、よく<tips=1>リョウ</tips>さんにからかわれたものです。","en":"When I was little, <tips=1>Ryo</tips> often teased me that they glowed like tiny lightbulbs whenever I got worked up—as when I joined in the other children’s fights.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r259","rowIndex":259,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　許さない。","en":"I will never forgive him.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r260","rowIndex":260,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は自分でもどうしていいかわからないほど怒っていました。","en":"I was so furious that I did not know what to do with myself.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r261","rowIndex":261,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　どうして<tips=73>リュウカ</tips>さんは殺されなければならなかったのでしょうか？　何の権利があってこの男は彼女の今までの努力と、将来への夢を、同時に奪ってしまったのでしょうか？　誰よりも生き生きと笑っていた<tips=73>リュウカ</tips>さんの顔が脳裏によぎり、胸が苦しくなりました。まるで空気が薄くなったようで、頭がキリキリとします。","en":"Why did <tips=73>Ryuka</tips> have to be killed? What right did this man have to rob her, all at once, of everything she had worked for and every dream she held for the future? The face of <tips=73>Ryuka</tips>, smiling more radiantly than anyone, flashed through my mind, and pain constricted my chest. It was as though the air had thinned; a sharp ache bored into my head.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r262","rowIndex":262,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして、仲の良かったミカちゃんのことを思い出しました。","en":"Then I remembered little Mika, whom she had been so close to.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r263","rowIndex":263,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は静かに息を吐き、興奮しすぎてしまった自分をなだめました。","en":"I let my breath out slowly and calmed myself, reining in my excessive agitation.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r264","rowIndex":264,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「お前、<tips=17>タイプＢ</tips>だな……」","en":"“You’re <tips=17>Type B</tips>...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アレクセイ","displayName":"Alexei","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r265","rowIndex":265,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=64>アレクセイ</tips>は目を細めます。","en":"<tips=64>Alexei</tips> narrowed his eyes.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r266","rowIndex":266,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=73>リュウカ</tips>さんに何をしたの？」","en":"“What did you do to <tips=73>Ryuka</tips>?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r267","rowIndex":267,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そう言った私の声は、子供の頃によく出していたような冷たい響きになっていました。","en":"My voice had taken on the cold ring it so often carried when I was a child.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r268","rowIndex":268,"pageCtrl":"","jp":" 　実際その時私は、すっと自分の感情が消えてゆくのを感じていました。","en":"And in fact, at that moment I felt every emotion inside me quietly disappear.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r269","rowIndex":269,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「別に、特別なことはしていないさ」","en":"“I didn’t do anything special.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アレクセイ","displayName":"Alexei","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r270","rowIndex":270,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼は笑い、","en":"He laughed, then said,","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r271","rowIndex":271,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「酒を飲んで……ベッドで二人で楽しんで……そして風呂場に一緒に入って、そこでは、まあ、おれが一人で楽しんだってことになるのかな。でも、おれがこの地獄みたいな世界で生きるためにはこれは仕方のないことだし、彼女だってここから解放されたんだから、結果的にはこれで良かったんだよ」","en":"“We drank... had fun together in bed... then went into the bathroom together, where, well, I suppose I was the only one having fun. But this is something I have to do to survive in this hellish world, and she was freed from here too, so in the end, it was for the best.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アレクセイ","displayName":"Alexei","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r272","rowIndex":272,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私はまた胸の中で渦巻こうとしている嫌悪感をおさえつつ、","en":"Suppressing the disgust that was once again beginning to churn inside my chest, I","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r273","rowIndex":273,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……彼女の他の部分は？」","en":"“...Where is the rest of her?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r274","rowIndex":274,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「心配することはない。ちゃんと、冷蔵庫と棚にしまってあるよ。警察がすぐ見つけてくれれば、腐敗しないですむかもしれない。きれいに棚に収まって、とってもチャーミングなんだ。すごくいい。きみも見てみるかい？」","en":"“Don’t worry. I’ve put everything away properly in the refrigerator and on the shelves. If the police find her soon enough, perhaps they can spare her from decay. She fits so neatly on the shelves—absolutely charming. It’s wonderful. Would you like to see?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アレクセイ","displayName":"Alexei","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r275","rowIndex":275,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は何も答えませんでした。<tips=64>アレクセイ</tips>は溜息をついてから、ポケットから小さな銃を取り出します。","en":"I said nothing. <tips=64>Alexei</tips> sighed, then drew a small gun from his pocket.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r276","rowIndex":276,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「これはね、おととい<tips=59>暗闇通り</tips>で買ったんだ。だけど、おれは銃ってのはどうも好きじゃない。ただ殺すだけのつまらない道具だ。これでどれだけ多くの人が悲しんだか……。しかし、便利なのは確かだね。指一本引いただけで人が死ぬんだから、紅茶を淹れるよりもずっと簡単だ。ただ、後始末は少し面倒だけれど」","en":"“I bought this on <tips=59>Darkness Street</tips> the day before yesterday. But I’ve never much cared for guns. They’re dreary tools that do nothing but kill. Think how many people they’ve brought sorrow... Still, there’s no denying how convenient they are. One twitch of a finger and a person dies—far easier than brewing tea. The cleanup is a little troublesome, though.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アレクセイ","displayName":"Alexei","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r277","rowIndex":277,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=64>アレクセイ</tips>はまっすぐこちらに銃口を向け、引き金に指をかけました。","en":"<tips=64>Alexei</tips> pointed the muzzle straight at me and placed his finger upon the trigger.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r278","rowIndex":278,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しかし、そんなものは関係ありません。","en":"But that meant nothing to me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r279","rowIndex":279,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あなたを許さない」","en":"“I will not forgive you.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r280","rowIndex":280,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私の言葉に、彼は肩をすくめ、","en":"At my words, he shrugged, then said,","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r281","rowIndex":281,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それは残念だ。本当は、おれはみんなと仲良くしたいんだがね。でもきみにも誰かを嫌う権利はあるのだから、それは認めよう。……あ、ひとつ忠告だけれど、変に避けない方が良いよ。即死出来ないと苦しんでしまう。こう見えてもおれは女性を苦しませるのは嫌いなんだ。痛みにのたうちまわっているのを見ると、いつも悲しくなってしまう。なんで人は死ななければいけないんだろうね」","en":"“What a shame. I truly wish I could get along with everyone. But you have the right to dislike whomever you please, so I’ll accept it. ...Oh, one word of advice: don’t make the mistake of trying to dodge. If you fail to die instantly, you’ll only suffer. Believe it or not, I hate causing women pain. It always saddens me to see them writhing in agony. Why must people die at all, I wonder?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アレクセイ","displayName":"Alexei","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r282","rowIndex":282,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　言い終わるか終わらないかのうちに彼は引き金を引きました。同時に、私の身体はほとんど自動的に床を蹴って飛んでいます。","en":"Before the last words had quite left his mouth, he pulled the trigger. At the same instant, my body reacted almost by itself, driving off the floor and launching into the air.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r283","rowIndex":283,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　銃弾がふくらはぎを貫いて空中に血を散らすのが見えました。けれど私の身体は勢いを落とすことなく、その一度の跳躍で五メートルほどの距離を飛び、<tips=64>アレクセイ</tips>の頭上まで移動しました。","en":"I saw the bullet tear through my calf, scattering blood through the air. Yet my body lost none of its momentum. That single leap carried me some five meters, bringing me directly above <tips=64>Alexei’s</tips> head.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r284","rowIndex":284,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　瞬時に目の前に現れた私を、<tips=64>アレクセイ</tips>は撃ち落とそうと考えたのでしょう。銃を構えたのですが、私はその手ごとスニーカーの靴底で踏み潰しました。彼の握った銃は、そのまま彼の顔面にめり込みます。","en":"<tips=64>Alexei</tips> must have decided to shoot me down when I appeared before him in an instant. He raised the gun, but I crushed his hand beneath the sole of my sneaker, driving the weapon he held straight into his face.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r285","rowIndex":285,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ぐっ」","en":"“Ghh.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アレクセイ","displayName":"Alexei","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r286","rowIndex":286,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　跳躍の勢いと体重をまともに顔面に受けた<tips=64>アレクセイ</tips>はうめき声を上げながら、後方へ吹き飛び、さっき倒れたテーブルの上でしたたかに背中を打ちました。","en":"Taking the full force of my momentum and weight squarely in the face, <tips=64>Alexei</tips> groaned as he was hurled backward, crashing back-first onto the overturned table.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r287","rowIndex":287,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして運動エネルギーのすべてを彼の身体にぶつけた私は、ふわりとその場に着地します。貫かれたふくらはぎは痛みはしましたが、それは私にとっては何の意味もない刺激です。それよりもむしろ、流れ落ちた血がスニーカーの中にたまって、あしゆびにまとわりつく感覚の方が不快でした。","en":"Having discharged all my kinetic energy into his body, I landed lightly on the spot. The calf pierced by the bullet did hurt, but to me that pain was no more than a meaningless stimulus. Far more unpleasant was the blood running down my leg, pooling inside my sneaker and clinging to my toes.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r288","rowIndex":288,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……はっは、まるでアクションスターだね。大人しそうなくせに喧嘩に慣れてるね？　きみならワイヤーなしで香港映画のヒロインが出来る……」","en":"“...Ha ha. You’re like an action star. You look so meek, but you know your way around a fight, don’t you? You could play the heroine of a Hong Kong movie without any wires...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アレクセイ","displayName":"Alexei","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r289","rowIndex":289,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=64>アレクセイ</tips>はそんな軽口を叩きましたが、頭をあれだけ打った直後ではなかなか身体に力が入らないのでしょう。ガクガクと震える足腰でどうにか身体を支え、立ち上がります。","en":"<tips=64>Alexei</tips> tossed off the joke, but after a blow like that to the head, he evidently could not summon much strength. Somehow he forced himself upright on violently trembling legs.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r290","rowIndex":290,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その顔面は、私が蹴り込んだ銃によって皮膚が裂け、血みどろになっています。","en":"The gun I had kicked into his face had torn open the skin and left him covered in blood.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r291","rowIndex":291,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　自分が傷つけたそのひどい姿を見ても、私はなにも感じませんでした。心が空っぽで、怒りさえありません。ただ、彼をこのままにしてはいけないという意識だけがありました。","en":"Even at the sight of the terrible injuries I had inflicted, I felt nothing. My heart was empty, stripped even of anger. All that remained was the knowledge that I could not let him go on like this.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r292","rowIndex":292,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼は周囲を見回します。銃を探しているのでしょう。","en":"He looked around him, presumably searching for the gun.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r293","rowIndex":293,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　さすがに、あれをまた拾われたら厄介です。私が先にそれを見つけ駆け寄ろうとしたのですが、<tips=64>アレクセイ</tips>は察して床に落ちた皿の破片をこちらに投げつけました。","en":"It would certainly be troublesome if he got hold of it again. I found it first and was about to dart toward it when <tips=64>Alexei</tips> read my intention and hurled a shard of the broken plate at me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r294","rowIndex":294,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それはすんでのところでかわしたのですが、頬の皮一枚切られたようで、血液がにじみ出す感覚がありました。","en":"I evaded it by a hair, though it seemed to have sliced through one thin layer of skin on my cheek. I felt blood begin to bead along the cut.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r295","rowIndex":295,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「はっ、身体能力はきみの方が上のようだな」","en":"“Hah. It seems your physical abilities are superior to mine.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アレクセイ","displayName":"Alexei","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r296","rowIndex":296,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=64>アレクセイ</tips>は言いながら、後ずさります。","en":"<tips=64>Alexei</tips> retreated as he spoke.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r297","rowIndex":297,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その足取りは軽く、先ほど震えていたとは思えません。これは一体どういうことでしょう？","en":"He moved lightly, with no trace of the trembling that had racked him moments before. What could this mean?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r298","rowIndex":298,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　思ったよりダメージを受けていないのでしょうか？　そうは見えなかったのですが。","en":"Had he suffered less damage than I believed? It had not looked that way.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r299","rowIndex":299,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして彼は顔をシャツの袖で拭います。そして血液が拭き取られた顔面には、何の傷もありませんでした。いや、良く見れば細かい傷はあったのですが、そこからは血液が流れ出しては来ません。ついさっきまで、あんなに血みどろになっていたのに。","en":"He wiped his face with his shirtsleeve. When the blood had been cleared away, no injury remained upon it. No—when I looked closely, I could see tiny wounds, but no blood flowed from them. Only moments earlier, his face had been drenched in it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r300","rowIndex":300,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　どう考えたって、この僅か数秒の間に、自動的に出血が止まるような傷ではなかったはずです——普通の人間ならば。","en":"However I looked at it, those were not wounds that could stop bleeding on their own within a matter of seconds—not in an ordinary human being.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r301","rowIndex":301,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……その傷は……」","en":"“Those wounds...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アレクセイ","displayName":"Alexei","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r302","rowIndex":302,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私が言おうとしていた言葉を、先に発したのは向こうでした。","en":"Before I could finish, he voiced the very words I had meant to say.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r303","rowIndex":303,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「その足、どうしてもう血が流れない？　銃弾は貫通していたはずだろう？」","en":"“That leg—why has it stopped bleeding already? The bullet went straight through, didn’t it?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アレクセイ","displayName":"Alexei","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r304","rowIndex":304,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼はじっと私のふくらはぎを見ています。","en":"He stared intently at my calf.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r305","rowIndex":305,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あなたこそ、その回復力はなに？」","en":"“And what about you? What is that healing ability?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r306","rowIndex":306,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なるほど、なるほどね。お前も同じ『血』の持ち主か。これは奇遇だ……」","en":"“I see, I see. So you possess the same ‘blood’ as I do. What an extraordinary coincidence...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アレクセイ","displayName":"Alexei","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r307","rowIndex":307,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=64>アレクセイ</tips>は目を細めます。","en":"<tips=64>Alexei</tips> narrowed his eyes.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r308","rowIndex":308,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　奇遇と言えば、確かにそうなのかもしれません。私と彼は、同じ回復力を持っているのです。","en":"An extraordinary coincidence was perhaps exactly what it was. He and I shared the same regenerative ability.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r309","rowIndex":309,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は驚き、戸惑いました。これまでの人生で、一度もこんな経験はなかったからです。いつも、人との違いを実感してばかりなのに、まさか同じ身体を持った人間と、こんなところで出会うとは。","en":"I was astonished and bewildered. I had never known such an experience in all my life. I was forever being made to feel my difference from other people, yet here, of all places, I had encountered a person with a body like mine.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r310","rowIndex":310,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　もしこのとき相手が拳銃を拾い、襲い掛かってきたら反応出来なかったかもしれません。","en":"If he had picked up the pistol and attacked me at that moment, I might not have managed to react.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r311","rowIndex":311,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しかし相手もそれなりに驚いていたのか、二人向かい合ったまま呆然とそこに立ち尽くしたのです。","en":"But he too appeared to have been taken aback. We simply stood there facing one another, both of us dumbfounded.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r312","rowIndex":312,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その凍り付いた空間を打ち破ったのは、思わぬ闖入者でした。","en":"The frozen moment was shattered by unexpected intruders.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r313","rowIndex":313,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私と<tips=64>アレクセイ</tips>の二人が同時にドアの方に視線を向けると、銃を構えた三人の警察官が部屋になだれ込んできたのです。","en":"<tips=64>Alexei</tips> and I turned toward the door at the same time as three police officers surged into the apartment with guns drawn.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r314","rowIndex":314,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「動くな！」","en":"“Don’t move!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r315","rowIndex":315,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　警察官たちは<tips=64>アレクセイ</tips>を取り囲むと、銃を構えました。","en":"The officers surrounded <tips=64>Alexei</tips> and trained their guns upon him.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r316","rowIndex":316,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「驚いたな。とてつもなく早いじゃないか。これはどういう手品だい？」","en":"“Well, now I’m impressed. That was extraordinarily fast. What sort of magic trick did you use?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アレクセイ","displayName":"Alexei","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r317","rowIndex":317,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=64>アレクセイ</tips>はひゅうと口笛を吹きます。","en":"<tips=64>Alexei</tips> gave a whistle.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r318","rowIndex":318,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「おい！　両手をあげろ！」","en":"“Hey! Hands up!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r319","rowIndex":319,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　警察官は真っ赤な顔で怒鳴りました。","en":"The red-faced officer bellowed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r320","rowIndex":320,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「Ладно……」","en":"“Ладно...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アレクセイ","displayName":"Alexei","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r321","rowIndex":321,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=64>アレクセイ</tips>はめんどくさそうに両手を肩の高さまであげると、顎を上げて、空中に向かってそう異国の言葉で何か呟きはじめたのです。","en":"Looking thoroughly put out, <tips=64>Alexei</tips> raised both hands to shoulder height, tilted up his chin, and began muttering something into the air in that foreign language.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r322","rowIndex":322,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「おい、何をブツブツと喋っている！」","en":"“Hey! What are you muttering about?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r323","rowIndex":323,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　警察官が鋭い声を飛ばしても、<tips=64>アレクセイ</tips>はその独り言をやめません。","en":"Even when the officer barked at him, <tips=64>Alexei</tips> did not stop muttering to himself.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r324","rowIndex":324,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「おい！　質問しているんだぞっ！」","en":"“Hey! I asked you a question!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r325","rowIndex":325,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　興奮して繰り返すと、そこで<tips=64>アレクセイ</tips>はやっと顔を警察官たちの方へ向け、","en":"Only when the officer repeated himself in agitation did <tips=64>Alexei</tips> turn toward the police at last.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r326","rowIndex":326,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「よかったな。逃げろという指示が出た。あんたたちは死なないで済むらしいぞ」","en":"“Lucky you. I’ve been given orders to flee. It appears you people won’t have to die after all.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アレクセイ","displayName":"Alexei","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r327","rowIndex":327,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして、取り囲む警察官に背を向けて奥の部屋へと走り出したのです。","en":"Then, turning his back on the officers who surrounded him, he dashed into the room at the rear of the apartment.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r328","rowIndex":328,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「撃てっ！」","en":"“Fire!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r329","rowIndex":329,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　怒号と共にそれぞれの手にした拳銃が火を噴き、アレクセイの背中に何発かは命中した筈なのですが、彼は血液をまき散らしながらも部屋の向こうへ姿を消しました。","en":"At the shouted command, the pistols in their hands spat flame. Several bullets must have struck Alexei in the back, yet he vanished through the doorway, scattering blood as he went.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r330","rowIndex":330,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　警察官たちはその後を駆け足で追います。","en":"The officers ran after him.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r331","rowIndex":331,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私が走れば警察官たちよりも早く<tips=64>アレクセイ</tips>に追いつけそうでしたが、彼らは相手に銃を向けながら走っているため、その銃口の前に出るのを躊躇ってしまって、結局彼らの後から奥の部屋に足を踏み入れることになりました。","en":"At a sprint, I could probably have caught <tips=64>Alexei</tips> before the officers did. But they were running with their weapons trained ahead, and I hesitated to cross in front of their muzzles. In the end, I entered the rear room behind them.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r332","rowIndex":332,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　すると、驚いたことにそこには誰もいなかったのです。床に<tips=64>アレクセイ</tips>の血液が残るだけで、本人はどこにもいません。","en":"To our astonishment, no one was there. Only the blood of <tips=64>Alexei</tips> remained on the floor; the man himself was nowhere to be seen.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r333","rowIndex":333,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そこは行き止まりの部屋で、そこからどこかへ抜ける廊下などはありません。窓は開いていましたが、その下の地面は遙か遠くです。","en":"The room was a dead end, with no corridor leading anywhere beyond it. The window stood open, but the ground lay far below.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r334","rowIndex":334,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　こんなところから飛び降りたら、どんな回復力があっても、地面の上で無惨な姿になっているでしょう。しかし、そこには何もないのです。","en":"If he jumped from such a height, no amount of regenerative power could have kept him from ending up a mangled wreck on the ground. Yet there was nothing there.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r335","rowIndex":335,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それでも、窓しかない以上はここから逃げたに違いありません。","en":"Even so, since the window was the only possible way out, he must have escaped through it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r336","rowIndex":336,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　警察官たちは狐につままれたような顔で窓から外を眺めたり、クローゼットを覗いたりしたのですが、結局<tips=64>アレクセイ</tips>を見つけることは出来ませんでした。","en":"The police stared out the window and peered into the closet with utterly baffled expressions, but in the end, they could not find <tips=64>Alexei</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r337","rowIndex":337,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私もこれは予想していないことでした。彼が本当に私と同じ身体の持ち主だったら、あれくらいの銃弾を受けたからと言って死ぬことはないと思いますが、しかし出口のない部屋で姿を消したことの説明はつきません。","en":"This was something I had not foreseen either. If he truly possessed the same kind of body as I did, a few bullets like those would not have killed him. But that still could not explain his disappearance from a room with no exit.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r338","rowIndex":338,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　警察官たちより一足先にリビングに戻った私は、呆然とそこに佇むハシモトさんを見つけました。","en":"I returned to the living room a step ahead of the officers and found Hashimoto standing there in a daze.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r339","rowIndex":339,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=55>汐さん</tips>！」","en":"“<tips=55>Ms. Shio</tips>!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ハシモト","displayName":"Hashimoto","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r340","rowIndex":340,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私の顔を見ると彼女は涙ぐんでそう呼びかけました。","en":"When she saw my face, tears sprang to her eyes and she called my name.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r341","rowIndex":341,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「私は平気です」","en":"“I’m all right.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r342","rowIndex":342,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　足の傷口をそれとなく隠しながら私は答えます。","en":"I answered while unobtrusively hiding the wound in my leg.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r343","rowIndex":343,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「でも、取り逃がしてしまったみた……」","en":"“But it seems we let him get aw—”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r344","rowIndex":344,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私がそう答える言葉を最後まで聞かず、ハシモトさんは両手を広げて私の身体を抱きしめました。","en":"Without waiting for me to finish, Hashimoto spread her arms and embraced me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r345","rowIndex":345,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「良かった、良かったよおおおお。<tips=55>汐さん</tips>が、無事でよかったああ。し、<tips=55>汐さん</tips>まで、<tips=55>汐さん</tips>まで死んじゃうんじゃないかって……うああぁ！」","en":"“Thank goodness, thank goodness! I’m so glad <tips=55>Ms. Shio</tips> is safe! I-I thought <tips=55>Ms. Shio</tips>—I thought <tips=55>Ms. Shio</tips> might die too... Waaah!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ハシモト","displayName":"Hashimoto","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r346","rowIndex":346,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ハシモトさんは声をあげて号泣し、私はその背中をそっと撫でました。","en":"Hashimoto broke down in loud sobs, and I gently stroked her back.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r347","rowIndex":347,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　いろいろと疑問はあるし、<tips=73>リュウカ</tips>さんのことを思い出すと気持ちが暗くなるのですが、ひとまず今は彼女が無事だったことに安堵すべきでしょう。","en":"There were countless questions still unanswered, and the thought of <tips=73>Ryuka</tips> darkened my heart. For the moment, though, I should simply be grateful that Hashimoto was safe.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r348","rowIndex":348,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その後、警察の検証によって、冷蔵庫とその脇にあった食器棚に、丁寧にキッチンペーパーに包まれた人体の切断片が発見され、私たちもそれを見ました。<tips=64>アレクセイ</tips>の言った通り、それらは<tips=73>リュウカ</tips>さんのものに違いありません。","en":"During the police examination that followed, pieces of a dismembered human body, each carefully wrapped in paper towels, were discovered in the refrigerator and the cupboard beside it. We saw them as well. Just as <tips=64>Alexei</tips> had said, they could only have belonged to <tips=73>Ryuka</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r349","rowIndex":349,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　警察たちがこれほど早く到着したのは、<tips=64>アレクセイ</tips>が<tips=73>リュウカ</tips>さんの遺体を切断した時の血液がどこかから漏れて下の階の住人が通報したからでした。彼らは丁度下の階の調査を終え、<tips=73>リュウカ</tips>さんの部屋へ向かおうとしているところでハシモトさんと出会い、やって来たのです。","en":"The police had arrived so quickly because blood spilled when <tips=64>Alexei</tips> dismembered the body of <tips=73>Ryuka</tips> had leaked into the apartment below, whose resident reported it. The officers had just finished examining that apartment and were on their way up to <tips=73>Ryuka’s</tips> when they encountered Hashimoto.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r350","rowIndex":350,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ハシモトさんと私はそこから一旦警察に連れて行かれて、そこで事情聴取を受けることになりました。憔悴しきって何も喋れないハシモトさんの代わりに私が質問に答えました。","en":"Hashimoto and I were then taken to the police station, where we were questioned about what had happened. Hashimoto was too distraught to speak, so I answered in her place.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r351","rowIndex":351,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そこではおおむねありのままを喋りましたが、<tips=64>アレクセイ</tips>と格闘をし、お互いの再生能力に気がついたところは、迷った末に言わないでおきました。言えば警察にとってなんらかのヒントになる可能性はありましたが、やはりこうした場所で自分の身体のことを語るのは躊躇われたのです。","en":"I told them almost everything exactly as it had occurred. After some hesitation, however, I omitted the struggle with <tips=64>Alexei</tips> and the moment when we discovered each other’s regenerative powers. Telling them might have provided the police with some clue, but I could not bring myself to speak about my body in a place like that.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r352","rowIndex":352,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして解放された時には夜になっていました。","en":"Night had fallen by the time they released us.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r353","rowIndex":353,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ハシモトさんは家族が迎えに来るというのでそこに残り、私は警察が送ってくれるという親切な言葉を断り、一人で夜道を歩いて自宅へと帰りました。","en":"Hashimoto remained there to wait for her family to collect her. I declined the police officers’ kind offer of a ride and walked home alone through the night.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r354","rowIndex":354,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その夜私は眠れず、死んでいった<tips=73>リュウカ</tips>さんのことを考えたり、自分と<tips=64>アレクセイ</tips>に共通する再生能力について考えたりしました。","en":"I could not sleep that night. My thoughts moved between <tips=73>Ryuka</tips>, who had died, and the regenerative power <tips=64>Alexei</tips> and I appeared to share.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r355","rowIndex":355,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私の身体については、これまで何度も父と<tips=1>リョウ</tips>さんが調べてくれていたので、私もある程度は知っています。","en":"My father and <tips=1>Ryo</tips> had investigated the nature of my body many times before, so I possessed a certain amount of knowledge about it myself.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r356","rowIndex":356,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　高い<tips=72>タイプB傾向値</tips>。向上する身体能力。ほとんど不死身に近い再生能力。そして金色の目。――特徴自体は、普通の<tips=17>タイプB</tips>と共通したものばかりです。ただ、私の場合はその度合いがかけ離れてしまいました。","en":"A high <tips=72>Type B tendency value</tips>. Enhanced physical abilities. Regeneration approaching virtual immortality. And golden eyes. Every feature in itself was shared by ordinary <tips=17>Type Bs</tips>. In my case, however, the degree was in another realm entirely.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r357","rowIndex":357,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　常識的に考えれば、まず第一にこれほどに<tips=72>傾向値</tips>が高いのに精神を正常に保っていられるのがおかしいのだそうです。幻覚が見えたり、妄想にとりつかれたりして、精神が破綻しているべき数値なのだそうです。","en":"I was told that, by any conventional understanding, the first impossibility was my remaining mentally sound despite such a high <tips=72>tendency value</tips>. At a value like mine, I ought to have suffered hallucinations, fallen prey to delusions, and undergone a complete mental collapse.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r358","rowIndex":358,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それでも正常でいられるというのは、単に量的な違いというだけでなく、質的な違いがあるのではないかと<tips=1>リョウ</tips>さんは推測していました。たとえばそこに<tips=16>タイプA</tips>的な超能力が働いている可能性もあるかもしれないと。","en":"Because I remained sound nevertheless, <tips=1>Ryo</tips> suspected that the difference might be qualitative, not merely quantitative—that, for example, some <tips=16>Type A-like</tips> psychic ability might also be at work.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r359","rowIndex":359,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ただ、その領域になるとうちの地下室の設備では正確な判断が出来ないのだそうです。","en":"But once the inquiry reached that level, he said, the equipment in our basement was not sufficient to determine anything accurately.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r360","rowIndex":360,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　正式な研究機関で精密検査すればわかるかもしれないという話でしたが、それは私自身に拒否感があったし、また父や<tips=1>リョウ</tips>さんも前向きではありませんでした。","en":"A thorough examination at a proper research institution might have provided an answer. But I felt a strong aversion to the idea, and neither my father nor <tips=1>Ryo</tips> viewed it favorably.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r361","rowIndex":361,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そもそも私は、自分のこの身体のことなど、忘れていたかったのです。","en":"To begin with, I wanted to forget everything about this body of mine.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r362","rowIndex":362,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しかし、いつかははっきりとさせなければいけないことなのでしょう。","en":"But perhaps the day would come when I had to learn the truth once and for all.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r363","rowIndex":363,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=64>アレクセイ</tips>との出会いを経て、そう考えるようになりました。あの恐ろしい人殺しと自分の間には、なんらかの繋がりがあるに違いない。","en":"Meeting <tips=64>Alexei</tips> led me to think that way. There had to be some connection between me and that dreadful murderer.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r364","rowIndex":364,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　だとしたら、目を背けてはいけない。私にはそれを知る責任があるのです。","en":"If that was so, I could not look away. It was my responsibility to discover the nature of that connection.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r365","rowIndex":365,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そうは考えるものの、自分の不死身の身体のことを考えるのはやっぱり苦手でした。ひどいと、吐き気さえ感じるほどです。","en":"Even so, I still found it terribly difficult to think about my deathless body. At times, the thought of it was enough to make me physically ill.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r366","rowIndex":366,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　考えれば考えるほどいやになります。","en":"The more I considered it, the more I hated it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r367","rowIndex":367,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　命というものは壊れやすく儚いものです。だから美しいとも言えるのだと思います。","en":"Life is a frail and fleeting thing. Perhaps that is precisely why it can be called beautiful.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r368","rowIndex":368,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=73>リュウカ</tips>さんの死に方はとても悲しく、悔しいものですが、ああいう儚く脆い存在である彼女が、あれだけの夢をみて、努力をして、頑張って生きたという事実が美しいのではないのでしょうか。","en":"The manner of <tips=73>Ryuka’s</tips> death was heartbreaking and bitterly unjust. Yet was there not beauty in the fact that, fragile and fleeting as she was, she had dreamed so greatly, labored so earnestly, and fought so hard to live?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r369","rowIndex":369,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おそらく、私だったらあそこまでバラバラにされても死なない。","en":"Had it been me, I probably would not have died even after being torn into so many pieces.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r370","rowIndex":370,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>リョウ</tips>さんたちの予想では、私は元々は形をもった人間で、それが何らかの理由で<tips=18>ローズ・クラブ</tips>のなかでバラバラに損壊され、廃棄されたのだろうということでした。","en":"<tips=1>Ryo</tips> and the others believed that I had once possessed a human form, but for some reason had been mutilated and torn to pieces inside <tips=18>Rose Club</tips>, then thrown away.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r371","rowIndex":371,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は、そこまでバラバラにされて、ほんのひとかけらの肉片になっても、まだ生きていたのです。そして培養液によって再び人間の形を作り出しました。","en":"Even after being reduced to pieces—even to a single tiny scrap of flesh—I had remained alive. With the aid of the culture medium, I formed a human body once more.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r372","rowIndex":372,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　誰が私を殺したのでしょう？　誰が私を捨てたのでしょう？","en":"Who killed me? Who threw me away?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r373","rowIndex":373,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それほど私のことが憎らしかったのでしょうか。まだ幼かったはずなのに。","en":"Did they hate me that much? Even though I must still have been only a child.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r374","rowIndex":374,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その経緯を思うと、自分がひどく不潔なもののような気がします。","en":"Whenever I imagined the circumstances that had brought me there, I felt as though I myself were something hideously unclean.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r375","rowIndex":375,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　少なくとも、他の脆い人々とは立っている場所が違うのは間違いありません。","en":"At the very least, there could be no doubt that I stood in a different place from other, fragile people.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r376","rowIndex":376,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=73>リュウカ</tips>さんの死と、死なない自分のことが、頭のなかをぐるぐると回ります。","en":"The death of <tips=73>Ryuka</tips> and my own inability to die circled endlessly through my mind.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r377","rowIndex":377,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　あの優しかった、かけがえのない、世の中に二人といない<tips=73>リュウカ</tips>さんが死んでしまった。","en":"The gentle, irreplaceable <tips=73>Ryuka</tips>—a woman without equal anywhere in the world—was dead.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r378","rowIndex":378,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして、自分が無感情に殺した蟻たちの死体が思い浮かびます。","en":"Then I pictured the bodies of the ants I had killed without emotion.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r379","rowIndex":379,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>リョウ</tips>さんの怖い声がどこからから鳴り響き、それから、部屋に血みどろで倒れたミカちゃんの家族が、その中で一人生きて平気な顔をしている自分の姿が、思い浮かぶのです。","en":"The terrifying voice of <tips=1>Ryo</tips> rang out from somewhere. Then came the image of Mika’s family sprawled blood-soaked across the room, and of myself among them—the sole survivor, my face perfectly calm.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r380","rowIndex":380,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その他、この街で生きてる間に見てきた、すべての死が脳のなかを駆け巡って……。","en":"Every other death I had witnessed over the course of my life in this city raced through my mind...","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r381","rowIndex":381,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　結局朝まで眠れず、日が昇ってから洗面台の鏡に映った顔を見ると、まぶたが真っ赤に腫れていました。","en":"In the end, I did not sleep at all that night. After sunrise, I looked at my reflection above the washbasin and found my eyelids swollen red.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r382","rowIndex":382,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　この世界は、生まれて初めて外に出て、蟻を殺したあの場所からまったく動いていないように思われました。","en":"It seemed to me that the world had never advanced a single step beyond that spot where I first went outside and killed the ants.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r383","rowIndex":383,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　何の気もなく木の棒で潰したいくつもの蟻の死体の一つ一つが、<tips=73>リュウカ</tips>さんや、ミカちゃん、<tips=1>リョウ</tips>さんなどの顔にかわってゆきます。潰して笑っているのは、私と<tips=64>アレクセイ</tips>です。","en":"One by one, the bodies of the ants I had idly crushed with a stick turned into the faces of <tips=73>Ryuka</tips>, Mika, <tips=1>Ryo</tips>, and the others. <tips=64>Alexei</tips> and I were the ones crushing them and laughing.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r384","rowIndex":384,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ああ、この蟻たちに宿っていた命は、一つ一つ別々の、けっして交換のきかない生命だったのに。","en":"Ah, and yet the life housed in each of those ants had been separate from every other, never to be exchanged or replaced.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r385","rowIndex":385,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　この街で生きれば人の死というものはいやでも肌で実感することになります。街には死がありふれています。","en":"To live in this city was to know the reality of human death in your very flesh, whether you wished to or not. Death was commonplace here.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r386","rowIndex":386,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　何の前触れもなく突然刈り取られてしまう命もあれば、最初から運命づけられ、いかなる努力も甲斐なく失われる命もあるのです。善人でも悪人でも、何か間違いを犯したわけでなくとも、無慈悲な死神は気まぐれに、そして理不尽に人を選びます。","en":"Some lives were cut down suddenly, without the slightest warning. Others were doomed from the beginning and lost despite every effort to save them. Good or evil, even those who had done nothing wrong were chosen by the merciless reaper on a whim, irrationally and without justice.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r387","rowIndex":387,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私はなぜ、その過酷な運命の埒外にいるのか。それは<tips=64>アレクセイ</tips>のように誰かを殺すためなのか？","en":"Why did I stand beyond the bounds of that cruel fate? Was it so that I could kill people as <tips=64>Alexei</tips> did?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r388","rowIndex":388,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　心臓を撃たれたが私は死ななかった。病気や毒にも人並み外れた抵抗力がある。普通の<tips=17>タイプB</tips>のように精神を侵されて廃人になることもない。","en":"I had been shot through the heart and survived. I possessed an extraordinary resistance to sickness and poison. Nor did the condition ravage my mind and reduce me to a living ruin, as it did an ordinary <tips=17>Type B</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r389","rowIndex":389,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　こうした事実に思いをはせると、私には何者かの声が聞こえるのです。","en":"Whenever I dwelled upon those facts, I seemed to hear someone’s voice.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r390","rowIndex":390,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「お前はなぜ死なない？　何の価値があって生き続けている？」","en":"“Why will you not die? What value is there in you that you should be allowed to go on living?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r391","rowIndex":391,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして私は、ずっと先延ばしにしてきた自分の問題と、具体的に立ち向かうべき時がきたのだと思いました。","en":"I decided that the time had come to face squarely the question about myself that I had put off for so long.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r392","rowIndex":392,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私はどのようにして生まれたのか。あの殺人鬼とはどのような関係があるのか。","en":"How had I been born? What relationship did I have to that murderer?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r393","rowIndex":393,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そのことがあったすぐあと、大学へ通うために一人暮らしをしていた<tips=1>リョウ</tips>さんが街に帰って来ました。","en":"Soon after that happened, <tips=1>Ryo</tips>, who lived alone while attending university, returned to the city.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r394","rowIndex":394,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼の幼なじみの結婚式に出席するためです。また、その頃彼の本当の父親である<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>の体調も思わしくなく、その様子を見るという意味もあるようでした。","en":"He had come to attend the wedding of a childhood friend. His biological father, <tips=3>Chris Tse</tips>, was also in poor health at the time, and it seemed he intended to check on him as well.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r395","rowIndex":395,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>リョウ</tips>さんは大学で生物について学んでいます。彼は昔から生命という物に非常に興味がありました。それは、私があの地下室にやって来る前からだそうです。","en":"<tips=1>Ryo</tips> was studying biology at university. He had always been deeply fascinated by life itself, apparently since before I ever arrived in that basement.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r396","rowIndex":396,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　いや、そもそも彼がそういったものに熱中していたからこそ、私は興味の対象となり、いまここにいるのでしょう。","en":"No—perhaps it was precisely because he was so absorbed in such things that I became an object of interest to him and was here now.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r397","rowIndex":397,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　言ってしまえば私は彼にとっての実験動物のようなものですが、そうした考え方は私にとってはむしろ安らぎとなっていました。恋人だとか家族だというのは、なんだかややこしくてうまく考えられないのです。","en":"Put bluntly, I was something like his laboratory animal. That way of seeing our relationship brought me peace, if anything. Calling us lovers or family seemed somehow too complicated for me to consider properly.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r398","rowIndex":398,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　他の誰にも言ったことはないのですが、いつだったか彼は、大学へ進学する目的の一つは私の身体のことをよく知るためだと口にしたことがあります。","en":"I have never told anyone else, but once, long ago, he said that one of his reasons for entering university was to understand my body better.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r399","rowIndex":399,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　酒で酔った時の、勢いで出た言葉でした。その時私はそれほど自分の身体について考えることを避けていたので、複雑な気持ちでした。","en":"He had blurted it out in a rush while drunk. At the time, I had been avoiding all thought of my body so resolutely that the admission left me with deeply mixed feelings.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r400","rowIndex":400,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　もちろん、彼の目的はそれだけではありません。彼は大学へゆくことで、この街から離れられることを期待したのです。彼は父親がボスとして君臨する、死と暴力と貧困に満ちたこの街を嫌っています。この街でしか生きられないと考えている私にとって、彼のこうした感じ方は寂しいものでしたが、彼の気持ちも理解が出来たのでなんとも言えませんでした。","en":"Of course, that was not his only purpose. He had also hoped that attending university would let him escape the city. He hated this place, full of death, violence, and poverty, where his father reigned as boss. For someone like me, who believed she could live nowhere else, the way he felt was lonely to contemplate. Yet I understood him as well, and could find no answer to it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r401","rowIndex":401,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ともあれ、その<tips=1>リョウ</tips>さんが帰って来ると毎日が楽しくなるだろうと、嬉しくなりました。","en":"In any case, I was delighted by the thought that, with <tips=1>Ryo</tips> back, each day would become that much happier.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r402","rowIndex":402,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼は忙しいらしく、滅多に汐家に顔を出すことはなかったのですが、近くにいるというだけで不思議と気持ちが明るくなりました。我ながら単純なもので、自分の身体がどうこうとか、そんなことで悩んでいたのを忘れそうになるほどです。","en":"He seemed to be busy and rarely showed his face at the Shio home, yet the mere knowledge that he was nearby brightened my spirits in some mysterious way. Simple creature that I was, I almost forgot I had ever been worrying over my body at all.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r403","rowIndex":403,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しかし、本当に忘れて、無邪気に喜んでいるわけにもゆきません。","en":"But I could not allow myself simply to forget in earnest and rejoice like an innocent child.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r404","rowIndex":404,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=64>アレクセイ</tips>と名乗ったあの人物の再生能力について、彼に相談するかどうかでひそかに悩んでもいました。相談すればいつものように正しい考え方を示してくれるのだろう、と思う反面、父親が亡くなろうとしているこの時期にするような話題でもないのです。少し迷いましたが、結局言いませんでした。","en":"Privately, I was also agonizing over whether to consult him about the regenerative ability of the man who called himself <tips=64>Alexei</tips>. I felt sure that, as always, he would show me the right way to look at the matter. On the other hand, with his father close to death, it was hardly an appropriate subject to raise. After some hesitation, I ultimately said nothing.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r405","rowIndex":405,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それで良かったのだと思います。その後、彼は本当に大変な事態に巻き込まれてゆくのですから。","en":"I believe that was for the best. In the days that followed, he would become embroiled in a truly dreadful affair.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r406","rowIndex":406,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そんなある日のことです。","en":"Then, one day—","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r407","rowIndex":407,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私がかつて過ごしていたあの地下の実験室は、今でも家にあって、父や<tips=1>リョウ</tips>さんが利用しています。","en":"The underground laboratory where I had once lived still remained in our home, and my father and <tips=1>Ryo</tips> continued to use it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r408","rowIndex":408,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そこは彼らの聖域なので、普段はあまり立ち入らないようにしていたのですが、その日は入り口のところに、重要な実験を行っている最中であることを示す『立ち入り厳禁』のカードがありませんでした。","en":"It was their sanctuary, so I ordinarily avoided entering. But that day, the card reading NO ENTRY, which indicated that an important experiment was underway, was absent from the entrance.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r409","rowIndex":409,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　実験室は基本的に<tips=54>健慈朗</tips>が掃除や整頓を行うことになっているのですが、ずぼらな父ではなかなか目が行き届かずに食べ物がそのまま机の横などに落ちたままひからびていたりすることがあるので、私は時折部屋をチェックすることにしています。","en":"In principle, my father, <tips=54>Kenjiro</tips>, was responsible for cleaning and tidying the laboratory. But he was slovenly and rarely attentive enough to notice everything; sometimes food would remain where it had fallen beside a desk until it dried to a husk. That was why I made a point of checking the room from time to time.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r410","rowIndex":410,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　このところ、<tips=1>リョウ</tips>さんと二人で何かやっているらしく、いつ見てもずっとカードがかかっていたので部屋に入る機会がありませんでした。","en":"Lately, my father and <tips=1>Ryo</tips> seemed to have been working on something together. The card was hanging there every time I looked, so I had found no opportunity to enter.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r411","rowIndex":411,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　このチャンスにたまった汚れを掃除しようと、箒とちりとりを持って地下実験室の階段を下りると、何やら話し声が奥から聞こえて来たのです。","en":"Meaning to seize the opportunity and clean away the accumulated grime, I took a broom and dustpan and descended the stairs to the underground laboratory. From somewhere farther inside came the sound of voices.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r412","rowIndex":412,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>リョウ</tips>さんと、父の声でした。","en":"They belonged to <tips=1>Ryo</tips> and my father.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r413","rowIndex":413,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　何かしているかもしれないなとは思ったのですが、カードがないのならそれほど重要なことでもないのだろうと、何気なく踏み込んだ部屋には予想外の光景が広がっていました。","en":"I suspected they might be doing something, but since the card was absent, I assumed it could not be terribly important. When I casually stepped into the room, an unexpected sight awaited me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r414","rowIndex":414,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　作業台の上に、身体を切断されたネズミの死体が転がっているのです。","en":"The body of a mouse, cut apart, lay upon the workbench.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r415","rowIndex":415,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　死体はボードに固定されており、解剖を行っていたようです。","en":"Its remains had been fixed to a board, apparently for dissection.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r416","rowIndex":416,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それを取り囲んで<tips=1>リョウ</tips>さんと父が何やら興奮して話し込んでいるのでした。","en":"<tips=1>Ryo</tips> and my father stood around it, talking with evident excitement.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r417","rowIndex":417,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……特殊化が……」","en":"“...The specialization...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r418","rowIndex":418,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　と<tips=1>リョウ</tips>さんの言葉が聞き取れました。","en":"I caught that much of what <tips=1>Ryo</tips> was saying.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r419","rowIndex":419,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それで私は何の実験が行われているか悟りました。","en":"That one word told me what experiment they were conducting.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r420","rowIndex":420,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>リョウ</tips>さんたちは、私のこの身体の特徴を『<tips=97>特殊タイプＢ</tips>』と呼んでいます。","en":"<tips=1>Ryo</tips> and the others call the peculiar state of my body ‘<tips=97>special Type B</tips>.’","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r421","rowIndex":421,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして「特殊化」というのは、通常の<tips=17>タイプB</tips>を私のように再生能力のある存在に変化させることです。","en":"And ‘specialization’ means transforming an ordinary <tips=17>Type B</tips> into a being with regenerative abilities like mine.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r422","rowIndex":422,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それは今までにも何度か行っている実験で、かつて私自身も何度かサンプルを提出したことがありました。","en":"They had performed the experiment several times before, and I myself had supplied samples on more than one occasion.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r423","rowIndex":423,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そのことは、私にとって苦い思い出となっています。","en":"Those experiences had become bitter memories for me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r424","rowIndex":424,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　自分の血で狂ってしまう鼠たちを見て、気持ち悪くなってしまい、役に立たなくなってしまったからです。","en":"The sight of the mice going mad from my blood had nauseated me until I became incapable of helping with the experiment.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r425","rowIndex":425,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　あの時迷惑をかけてしまったから、今こんなふうにこそこそと実験をさせてしまっている。これはとても大事な実験のはずなのに。","en":"Because I had caused them trouble then, I had driven them to conduct the experiment furtively now, behind my back. Even though it must have been terribly important.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r426","rowIndex":426,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　気まずい思いでそこに佇んでいると、","en":"I stood there in awkward silence, until—","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r427","rowIndex":427,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「い、いや、これは……」","en":"“N-no, this is...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐健慈朗","displayName":"Kenjiro Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r428","rowIndex":428,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私に気づいた父は申し訳なさそうな顔をしています。","en":"When my father noticed me, he looked apologetic.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r429","rowIndex":429,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「別に隠していたわけじゃないんだ。ただ……」","en":"“It’s not as though we were hiding it from you. It’s just...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐健慈朗","displayName":"Kenjiro Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r430","rowIndex":430,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いえ、いいんです。ただ、私に見せたくないものを見てしまって、すみません……」","en":"“No, it’s all right. I’m sorry I saw something you didn’t want me to see...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r431","rowIndex":431,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は気にしないよう笑顔を作りましたが、ぎこちないものになってしまったかもしれません。","en":"I forced a smile to show them I did not mind, though it may have come out awkwardly.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r432","rowIndex":432,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私の出現でおかしくなってしまった空気のなか、二人は事情を説明してくれました。","en":"With my appearance having turned the atmosphere painfully awkward, the two of them explained what they were doing.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r433","rowIndex":433,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　まず、<tips=1>リョウ</tips>さんが先日<tips=57>滑走路通り</tips>で虎が現れて通学中の児童を食い殺した話をしてくれました。私もその事件自体は噂として聞いていました。けれど、子供がおぞましく食い殺されたなどという話は、施設の子供のことなどを想像してしまって、それだけで気がおかしくなってしまいそうなので、あまり深くは聞いてはいません。","en":"First, <tips=1>Ryo</tips> told me about the tiger that had recently appeared on <tips=57>Runway Street</tips> and eaten a child on the way to school. I had heard rumors of the incident itself. But merely hearing that a child had been killed so horribly made me picture the children at the facility and feel as though I might lose my mind, so I had avoided learning very much.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r434","rowIndex":434,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>リョウ</tips>さんの言うところによると、彼と友人の<tips=10>見土</tips>さんが現場に居合わせており、二人で虎を退治したということでした。そしてその虎が、異常な再生力を持っていたので、これは私のような<tips=97>特殊なタイプＢ</tips>ではないかと考え、バラバラにしても動いている体組織を拾い、この地下室へ持ち帰ったのだそうです。","en":"According to <tips=1>Ryo</tips>, he and his friend <tips=10>Michio</tips> had happened to be at the scene and killed the tiger together. Its regenerative ability was abnormal, so they wondered whether it might be a <tips=97>special Type B</tips> like me. They collected pieces of tissue that continued to move even after the body was torn apart and brought them back to the basement.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r435","rowIndex":435,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　今回の実験は、この体組織を餌としてネズミたちに与えるというものだそうです。","en":"This experiment, he explained, consisted of feeding that tissue to mice.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r436","rowIndex":436,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　以前私が参加したときも、同じように腕から採取した血液をネズミに与えていました。目的は、私の通常ではあり得ないほどに高い傾向値を持った血液によってネズミの<tips=72>傾向値</tips>をあげ、私と同じ<tips=97>特殊なタイプＢ</tips>にするというものです。","en":"When I had participated in the earlier experiment, they similarly fed the mice blood drawn from my arm. The objective was to use my blood, with its impossibly high tendency value, to raise the mice’s <tips=72>tendency values</tips> and transform them into the same kind of <tips=97>special Type B</tips> as I was.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r437","rowIndex":437,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その時は、一匹だけ特殊化に成功したのですが、他のネズミは失敗して狂ってしまいました。非常に成功率の低い結果が出てしまったのですが、今回少しやり方を変えたのだそうです。その結果、私のときより明らかに高い割合で特殊化したネズミが誕生したそうです。","en":"On that occasion, only a single mouse had been successfully specialized. The others failed and went mad. The success rate had therefore been extremely low, but this time they had modified the procedure slightly—and produced specialized mice at a markedly higher rate than with my blood.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r438","rowIndex":438,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「きみの時は、採取した血液を保存してから使用していたよね。保存しても<tips=17>タイプB</tips>の<tips=72>傾向値</tips>が低くなるわけじゃなかったし、数値的には何も変化がないから問題視しなかった。だけど、後々良く考えてみると、特殊化に成功したマウスは、採血したばかりの新鮮な血液を与えたものだったんだ」","en":"“When we experimented with you, we stored the collected blood before using it. Storage didn’t lower its <tips=17>Type B</tips> <tips=72>tendency value</tips>, and the numbers showed no change, so we never regarded it as a problem. But when we reconsidered it later, we realized that the mouse that had successfully become specialized had received fresh blood immediately after it was drawn.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r439","rowIndex":439,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　だから<tips=1>リョウ</tips>さんは新鮮であればあるほどいいと考え、今回は動いている虎の肉を取り分けて与えるのではなく、直接ネズミたちに囓らせたのだと言います。それがもっとも新鮮な状態だからと。","en":"<tips=1>Ryo</tips> had consequently decided that the fresher the tissue, the better. This time, rather than cutting the still-moving tiger flesh into portions to feed the mice, he let them gnaw directly upon it. That, he said, was the freshest state possible.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r440","rowIndex":440,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は動いている体組織をネズミに直接食べさせている光景を想像して、また目眩がしました。きっとその体組織もアメーバ状で、ここへ運ばれたばかりの私と同じような姿だったに違いありません。","en":"I pictured the mice gnawing directly on that still-moving tissue, and another wave of dizziness swept over me. It too must have been an amoeboid mass, wearing the same form I had worn when I was first brought here.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r441","rowIndex":441,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「生体に近いほうが影響力が強いのだろう。もしかしたら、生きている<tips=97>特殊タイプＢ</tips>の肉をそのまま囓らせたら、もっと高確率で<tips=97>特殊タイプＢ</tips>になるのかもしれない。傷口から直接血液を飲ませても同じような結果が出るはずだ」","en":"“A sample’s influence must be stronger the closer it is to a living state. Perhaps if we let a mouse gnaw flesh directly from a living <tips=97>special Type B</tips>, it would have an even greater chance of becoming a <tips=97>special Type B</tips> itself. Letting it drink blood directly from a wound should produce the same result.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r442","rowIndex":442,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それは……相手がネズミじゃなくて、人間でも？」","en":"“Would that... be true if the subject were a human instead of a mouse?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r443","rowIndex":443,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「おそらく。さすがに人体実験は出来ないけれどね」","en":"“Probably. Human experimentation is out of the question, naturally.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r444","rowIndex":444,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>リョウ</tips>さんは肩をすくめて黙ってしまいます。父も申し訳なさそうな顔をしています。","en":"<tips=1>Ryo</tips> shrugged and fell silent. My father, too, looked apologetic.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r445","rowIndex":445,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼らが私に対して罪悪感を抱えているのが、申し訳なくてしかたがありませんでした。でも、私がどう振る舞っても、彼らの表情は明るくなりません。協力するとも言いました。それは彼らの手助けをしようというだけではなく、私自身が私の体質と向き合う必要があるとも思っていたからです。","en":"Seeing the guilt they carried toward me made me feel unbearably guilty in turn. Yet nothing I did could brighten their expressions. I even offered to cooperate—not merely to help with their work, but because I believed that I too needed to confront the nature of my body.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r446","rowIndex":446,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　でも、<tips=1>リョウ</tips>さんはそれも断りました。よほど、前に迷惑を掛けてしまったことが彼らに悪いイメージを与えていたのでしょう。","en":"But <tips=1>Ryo</tips> refused that offer as well. I must have left a terribly bad impression on them when I caused so much trouble during the earlier experiment.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r447","rowIndex":447,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　仕方なく、その場をそそくさとあとにしました。","en":"With no other choice, I hurried away.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r448","rowIndex":448,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして、彼らの前を去ってから、私は思い出しました。今こそ、あの<tips=73>リュウカ</tips>さんの家で見た男のことを話すべきだったのじゃなかったのかしら？","en":"Only after I had left them did the thought return to me: had that not been precisely the moment to tell them about the man I saw at the home of <tips=73>Ryuka</tips>?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r449","rowIndex":449,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼も私と同じ体質を持っていましたし、それは父と<tips=1>リョウ</tips>さんにとって重要な手がかりになるのかもしれません。","en":"He had the same constitution I did, and that might have been an important clue for my father and <tips=1>Ryo</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r450","rowIndex":450,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　すぐに引き返して言うべきだったのかもしれませんが、でも、そうはしませんでした。","en":"Perhaps I should have turned back at once and told them. But I did not.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r451","rowIndex":451,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　だって、あの事件のことを父にはずっと隠していたからです。それは警察から、極秘で捜査を進めているから口外をしてはならないと言われたのもありますが、それだけではありません。","en":"I had, after all, concealed the incident from my father from the beginning. One reason was that the police, proceeding with the investigation in strict secrecy, had ordered me to tell no one. But that was not the whole of it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r452","rowIndex":452,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　言えば父を心配させてしまうし、さらに、そこで戦ったなどということまで知られてしまったら、仕事を辞めさせられてしまうかもしれないと、そんな恐れもあったからです。","en":"I was also afraid that telling him would make him worry, and that if he learned I had even fought there, he might force me to quit my job.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r453","rowIndex":453,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　この時も、その気持ちが引っかかってしまいました。今は父だけじゃなく、<tips=1>リョウ</tips>さんまでいます。そこでこの話をしたら、父以上に怒ってしまうでしょう。","en":"The same fear caught at me now. This time, not only my father but <tips=1>Ryo</tips> was there. If I told the story before him, he would be angrier with me than my father ever could.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r454","rowIndex":454,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それに、ついこの間、「<tips=55>松子</tips>は仕事をするようになってから変わった」と褒められたばかりなのに、前と変わらない乱暴なことをしてしまったのが恥ずかしかったのです。","en":"Besides, he had only just praised me, saying that “<tips=55>Matsuko</tips> has changed since she started working.” I was ashamed to admit that I had resorted to the same violence as before, as though I had never changed at all.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r455","rowIndex":455,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　今となっては、この時に言っておくべきだったのかな、と後悔があります。","en":"Looking back now, I cannot help wondering with regret whether I should have told them then and there.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G2:r456","rowIndex":456,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　まあ、それでも、最終的にはそれほど違いがなかったのかもしれませんが。","en":"Though perhaps in the end it would not have made much difference.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}}]},{"position":38,"code":"G3","unitId":"G3","rows":[{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r1","rowIndex":1,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　実験室で<tips=1>リョウ</tips>さんと父の実験内容を知ってしまった翌日も、私は職場に行って働きました。","en":"Even on the day after I learned what <tips=1>Ryo</tips> and my father had been doing in the laboratory, I went to work.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r2","rowIndex":2,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　子供たちはいつも通りで、忙しくその対応をしていると、昨日の出来事は忘れてしまいました。","en":"The children were their usual selves, and as I busied myself looking after them, I forgot what had happened the day before.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r3","rowIndex":3,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=73>リュウカ</tips>さんがいなくなってしばらく経っています。","en":"Some time had passed since <tips=73>Ryuka</tips> was gone.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r4","rowIndex":4,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　事件当時に行われた職員会議では、死を隠すべきではなく、事実をありのまま伝え悲しみを共有するべきだと訴える職員も何人かはいました。死を教えるというのも、私たち大人の重要な仕事ではないかというのです。","en":"At the staff meeting held after the incident, several employees argued that death should not be hidden: we ought to tell the children the unvarnished truth and share in their grief. Teaching children about death, they said, might itself be one of our important duties as adults.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r5","rowIndex":5,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しかし結局のところ、子供たちには幼いものや<tips=17>タイプＢ</tips>も多く、死を伝えることによって一斉に情緒が不安定になってしまうという事態も考えられ、見送りになりました。","en":"In the end, however, many of the children were either very young or <tips=17>Type B</tips>. Telling them of the death might have destabilized them emotionally all at once, and so the proposal was set aside.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r6","rowIndex":6,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　この街の子供たちはよそよりも死に慣れているとは思いますが、<tips=73>リュウカ</tips>さんは人気の職員でしたし、彼女の死が与える動揺は大変なものになるのは間違いありません。","en":"I do think children in this city are more accustomed to death than children elsewhere, but <tips=73>Ryuka</tips> was a popular member of staff, and there was no question that her death would cause tremendous distress.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r7","rowIndex":7,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　子供たちには彼女は遠くへ引っ越したと嘘を教えました。","en":"We lied to the children and told them she had moved far away.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r8","rowIndex":8,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ただ、完全に隠しきるというのは不可能だったようです。","en":"Still, it seemed impossible to conceal the truth completely.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r9","rowIndex":9,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　どこから話を聞いたのか、何人かの年長の子供たちは事実を知っているようでした。幸い彼らは分別があり、年少者に言いふらすようなことはありませんでしたが。","en":"Somehow, several of the older children had heard what happened and appeared to know the truth. Fortunately, they had enough sense not to spread it among the younger children.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r10","rowIndex":10,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「知ってるよ。<tips=73>リュウカ</tips>さん、殺されたんだよね」","en":"“I know. <tips=73>Ryuka</tips> was murdered, right?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r11","rowIndex":11,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その日も、一人の少年が私に話しかけました。","en":"That day, one of the boys spoke to me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r12","rowIndex":12,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼は十六才の<tips=16>タイプA</tips>で、顔の半分に<tips=77>特質変異</tips>が出ており、それをいつも布で覆って隠しています。","en":"He was a sixteen-year-old <tips=16>Type A</tips>. A <tips=77>trait mutation</tips> had manifested across half his face, and he always kept it hidden beneath a cloth.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r13","rowIndex":13,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　繊細で大人しい性格の子でした。","en":"He was a quiet, sensitive child.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r14","rowIndex":14,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして、<tips=73>リュウカ</tips>に憧れに似た恋心を抱いているのを本人は隠してはいましたが、あまりにも不器用で、子供同士ならともかく、大人である職員の目からすればまったく隠し切れてはいませんでした。","en":"He tried to hide the feelings he harbored for <tips=73>Ryuka</tips>—a youthful love akin to adoration—but he was far too awkward to conceal them completely from the adult staff, whatever the other children may have noticed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r15","rowIndex":15,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その彼がそんなふうに言って来たものだから、私はなんと答えたらいいのか、緊張してしまいました。","en":"When he spoke to me that way, I grew tense, unsure how I ought to answer.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r16","rowIndex":16,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いやいいんだ。おれは誰にも言わないから。だけど、時々チビたちが聞いてくるんだよ。『<tips=73>リュウカ</tips>ちゃん、遠くってどこに行ったの？』って。……そうすると、胸が詰まったみたいに息苦しくなって、何も答えられなくってさ」","en":"“No, it’s okay. I won’t tell anyone. But sometimes the little kids ask me, ‘How far away did <tips=73>Ryuka</tips> go?’ And when they do... it’s like my chest closes up. I can’t breathe, and I can’t answer them.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r17","rowIndex":17,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　少年は寂しそうに笑い、その表情を見た私も胸が痛くなりました。","en":"The boy gave a lonely smile, and the sight of his expression made my heart ache.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r18","rowIndex":18,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そういったことはありながらも、おおむね混乱はなく、子供たちは日常生活を過ごしています。","en":"Even with moments like that, there was little outward turmoil overall, and the children continued with their everyday lives.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r19","rowIndex":19,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　むしろ職員の方が長く引きずっていたかもしれません。","en":"If anything, it may have been the staff who remained in mourning longer.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r20","rowIndex":20,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　みな子供の前ではいつも通り振る舞っていましたが、事務室に戻ると暗い顔をして溜息ばかりついていました。<tips=73>リュウカ</tips>さんはそういう存在だったのです。","en":"Everyone behaved as usual in front of the children, but back in the office, they wore gloomy faces and did nothing but sigh. That was what <tips=73>Ryuka</tips> had meant to us.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r21","rowIndex":21,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女の机はしばらくそのままになっていて、このままじゃ気持ちを切り換えられないと、片付けたのはつい三日前のことです。","en":"Her desk had remained exactly as she left it for some time. Only three days earlier, deciding that otherwise we would never be able to move on, we had finally cleared it away.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r22","rowIndex":22,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そう、気持ちを切り換えなければいけません。人は死んでしまえば否応なく過去になってしまうものですが、私たちにも子供たちにも今日と明日があります。","en":"Yes. We had to turn our feelings toward what came next. Once someone died, they inevitably became part of the past, but both we and the children still had today and tomorrow.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r23","rowIndex":23,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その日も、いろいろな仕事がありました。午前中は<tips=57>滑走路通り</tips>で万引きした子供をケースワーカーと共に引き取りに行き、午後は月に一度行われる誕生日会のための飾り付けを作って、喧嘩で怪我をする子供もいるし、もちろん普段の仕事もあるし、目まぐるしいほどに忙しい一日でした。","en":"There was all manner of work that day as well. In the morning, I went with a caseworker to collect a child caught shoplifting on <tips=57>Runway Street</tips>. In the afternoon, we made decorations for the monthly birthday party. A fight left another child injured, and of course our ordinary duties remained. It was a dizzyingly busy day.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r24","rowIndex":24,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして帰路につくと、ぐったりと身体全体が重く疲労していました。","en":"By the time I set out for home, fatigue had left my whole body heavy and limp.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r25","rowIndex":25,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　好きな仕事による疲労感はいいものです。心に充実と安らぎを与え、明日への活力を満たしてくれます。","en":"There is a goodness to the fatigue earned through work one loves. It fills the heart with fulfillment and peace, replenishing the strength one needs for tomorrow.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r26","rowIndex":26,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しかし、この日の私はもう一つ厄介な仕事を抱えていたので、疲労に心を委ねてゆっくり休んでいるわけには行きませんでした。","en":"That day, however, I had one more difficult task before me, so I could not simply surrender myself to fatigue and take a long rest.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r27","rowIndex":27,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　父に、今まで聞けなかったさまざまな話を聞き出すつもりでいたのです。そして場合によっては、あの<tips=73>リュウカ</tips>さんの家で見たことも話そうと、考えていました。","en":"I meant to draw from my father answers to the many questions I had never been able to ask. And depending on how the conversation went, I was considering telling him what I had witnessed at the home of <tips=73>Ryuka</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r28","rowIndex":28,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　父は時間に正確で、始業時間と就業時間を厳密に守り、ほとんど残業をしません。社員の方々にもそのように指導しているようです。","en":"My father was exacting about time. He observed the beginning and end of working hours strictly and almost never stayed late, apparently instructing his employees to do the same.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r29","rowIndex":29,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして、仕事の後も部下と食事などはせずにすぐに家に帰ります。","en":"After work, he never went out to eat with his subordinates, but came straight home.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r30","rowIndex":30,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　一応運転手を雇ってはいるのですが、それは事務所からどこかへ行くときに使うくらいで、自宅に帰るときは何年前に買ったかわからないあちこちに錆のういた自転車に作業着姿で乗ると決まっています。","en":"He did technically employ a driver, but used him only when traveling from the office to some other destination. To come home, he invariably climbed onto an ancient bicycle in his work clothes—a bicycle so old no one knew when he had bought it, with rust blooming all over the frame.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r31","rowIndex":31,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　まわりの方は、みっともないからやめて欲しいと訴えているのですが、本人はまったく意に介す様子がありません。","en":"The people around him pleaded that it looked disgraceful and asked him to stop, but he showed no sign of caring in the least.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r32","rowIndex":32,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　真夏でも真冬でも同じ姿で自転車をこいで、帰って来ます。「寒くないのですか？」と聞くと唇を震わせて「平気だ」と答え、「暑くないのですか？」と聞けば汗だくで「平気だ」と答えます。","en":"He pedaled home in the same clothes in the height of summer and the depths of winter. If I asked, “Aren’t you cold?” he would answer, “I’m fine,” through trembling lips. If I asked, “Aren’t you hot?” he would answer, “I’m fine,” drenched in sweat.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r33","rowIndex":33,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　父もそうとう変わった人なのです。","en":"My father too was a decidedly strange person.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r34","rowIndex":34,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　父が家のすぐ近くまでやって来て、隣の家の犬が吼えると、必ずチリンチリンとベルを鳴らします。","en":"Whenever my father neared the house and the dog next door began to bark, he would ring his bicycle bell—tring, tring.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r35","rowIndex":35,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そのベルの音で、私は彼の帰りを知るのでした。","en":"The sound of that bell told me he was home.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r36","rowIndex":36,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　最近は私の方が遅く帰ることが多かったのですが、その日はいつもより少し早い帰宅だったので、久しぶりにそのベルの音を聞くことになりました。","en":"Lately, I was usually the one who came home later, but that day I arrived a little earlier than usual and heard the bell for the first time in some while.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r37","rowIndex":37,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「おかえりなさい」","en":"“Welcome home.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r38","rowIndex":38,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　のっそりと部屋に入ってきた父に挨拶をすると、彼はうむと小さく頷きを返します。無言でテーブルにつくその手元に、私も晩酌のウイスキーとグラスを無言で差し出しました。","en":"I greeted my father as he lumbered into the room, and he answered with a quiet grunt and a small nod. He took his seat at the table without a word; just as silently, I set his evening whiskey and glass at his hand.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r39","rowIndex":39,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　父は帰ってすぐに食事をとるということはなく、特に何の用事もないときは、まずウイスキーを氷も水も入れずグラスに注ぎ、舐めるようにゆっくり飲みながらテレビをしばらく眺めます。そして、二杯か三杯飲んで、その後に食事をとると、これもいつも決まっているのでした。","en":"My father never ate immediately after coming home. Unless some particular business demanded his attention, he first poured himself a glass of whiskey—no ice, no water—and watched television for a while, savoring it in slow, tiny sips. Only after two or three glasses would he eat. This too was an immutable part of his routine.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r40","rowIndex":40,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ウイスキーの銘柄も、昔から一度も変えたことがありません。特別高いものでもなく、若い頃からずっと飲み慣れていて、他の味には違和感があるということです。時々もらい物のウイスキーを出すと、一杯はそれを飲むのですが、顔を顰めて結局二杯目からはいつもの銘柄に戻ります。","en":"He had never once changed his brand of whiskey. It was nothing particularly expensive; he had simply drunk it since his youth, and any other flavor felt wrong to him. Whenever I opened a bottle someone had given him, he would drink one glass with a grimace, then return without fail to his usual brand for the second.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r41","rowIndex":41,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「今日は、実験室の方は見なくてもいいんですか？」","en":"“Don’t you need to look in on the laboratory today?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r42","rowIndex":42,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は緊張しながらそう尋ねました。","en":"I asked the question nervously.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r43","rowIndex":43,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「うん、まあな……」","en":"“Mm. I suppose not...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐健慈朗","displayName":"Kenjiro Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r44","rowIndex":44,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　父はこちらを向かずテレビ画面を見ながらそう答えたのですが、私が視線を外した隙に、チラリとこちらを見たのに気がつきました。","en":"My father answered without turning away from the television. Yet the moment I let my own gaze drift aside, I caught him stealing a glance at me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r45","rowIndex":45,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　父は父で、昨日の実験室のことが気にかかっている様子です。","en":"It appeared that the events in the laboratory the previous day were troubling him too.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r46","rowIndex":46,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それなら、ちょっとお話があるんですが」","en":"“Then there’s something I’d like to discuss with you.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r47","rowIndex":47,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……ふむ」","en":"“...Hmm.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐健慈朗","displayName":"Kenjiro Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r48","rowIndex":48,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　父は頷きテレビを消しました。これから私が何を話そうとしているのか、察したのでしょう。","en":"My father nodded and switched off the television. He must have guessed what I intended to discuss.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r49","rowIndex":49,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は自分の心臓がバクバクと、普段より強く鼓動しているのを感じました。","en":"I could feel my heart pounding hard against my chest, far more forcefully than usual.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r50","rowIndex":50,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　口の中がやたらと乾きます。空気が薄く、目眩がしそうなほどの緊張感でした。","en":"My mouth was terribly dry. The air felt thin; I was tense enough to grow dizzy.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r51","rowIndex":51,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　これまで遠ざけていた問題に、自分から踏み込もうというのです。今までは、見えそうな時でも、ずっと見えないような振りをして、理解を拒んでいたのに。","en":"Of my own will, I was about to step into the very problem I had kept at a distance. Until now, whenever it threatened to come into view, I had pretended it was invisible and refused to understand.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r52","rowIndex":52,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=18>ローズ・クラブ</tips>について、教えてください」","en":"“Tell me about <tips=18>Rose Club</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r53","rowIndex":53,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　口の中が乾きすぎて、声がかすれています。","en":"My mouth was so dry that my voice came out hoarse.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r54","rowIndex":54,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「私は<tips=18>ローズ・クラブ</tips>のゴミ捨て場から拾われたと聞きました。小さな肉片として。それならば、私の素性は<tips=18>ローズ・クラブ</tips>と深い関わりがあるはずです。お父さんは業者として<tips=18>ローズ・クラブ</tips>と関わっていたそうですし、何か、世間で言っているよりもっと詳しいことをご存じじゃないんですか？」","en":"“I was told that I was found in the garbage dump at <tips=18>Rose Club</tips>, a tiny scrap of flesh. If so, my origins must be deeply connected to <tips=18>Rose Club</tips>. You had dealings with <tips=18>Rose Club</tips> as a contractor, didn’t you? Surely you know more than what people generally say about it.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r55","rowIndex":55,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうか。知りたいか。初めて聞いてきたな」","en":"“I see. So you want to know. This is the first time you’ve ever asked me.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐健慈朗","displayName":"Kenjiro Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r56","rowIndex":56,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……いつまでも、見て見ぬふりは出来ませんから」","en":"“...I can’t go on pretending not to see forever.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r57","rowIndex":57,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうだな」","en":"“True.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐健慈朗","displayName":"Kenjiro Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r58","rowIndex":58,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　父はそう言って大きく息を吐きました。","en":"My father let out a long breath.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r59","rowIndex":59,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「昨日<tips=1>リョウ</tips>と話していたんだ。もしお前が、おれか<tips=1>リョウ</tips>にその質問をしたら、洗いざらい話そうとな。しかし、おれに来るとはな。てっきり<tips=1>リョウ</tips>に聞くものだと思っていたんだが」","en":"“<tips=1>Ryo</tips> and I discussed it yesterday. We agreed that if you ever put that question to either me or <tips=1>Ryo</tips>, we would tell you the whole truth. I never expected you to come to me, though. I was certain you’d ask <tips=1>Ryo</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐健慈朗","displayName":"Kenjiro Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r60","rowIndex":60,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　父は困っているようでした。","en":"My father looked troubled.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r61","rowIndex":61,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あの、<tips=1>リョウ</tips>さんには、今迷惑をかけたくないですから……」","en":"“Um, I don’t want to trouble <tips=1>Ryo</tips> right now...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r62","rowIndex":62,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あいつは迷惑だなんて思わんさ。……まあ、おれが話すべきなんだろう。お前の父親だからな。……その前に水を」","en":"“He would never consider it a burden. ...Still, I suppose this is mine to tell. I am your father, after all. ...But bring me some water first.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐健慈朗","displayName":"Kenjiro Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r63","rowIndex":63,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は冷蔵庫のミネラルウォーターをコップに注いで持って来ると、父はグビグビと飲み干してしまいました。酔い覚ましのつもりなのでしょうか。","en":"I poured mineral water from the refrigerator into a glass and brought it to him. My father drained it in great gulps. Perhaps he meant to sober himself.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r64","rowIndex":64,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=55>松子</tips>。お前は、<tips=18>ローズ・クラブ</tips>で行われていた『不死身の女』のショーについて聞いたことがあるか？」","en":"“<tips=55>Matsuko</tips>. Have you ever heard of a show called ‘Immortal Woman’ that was performed at <tips=18>Rose Club</tips>?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐健慈朗","displayName":"Kenjiro Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r65","rowIndex":65,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いいえ」","en":"“No.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r66","rowIndex":66,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は首を横に振ります。","en":"I shook my head.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r67","rowIndex":67,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうか。まあ、最近ではもう語るものもいなくなったしな。……じゃあ、<tips=18>ローズ・クラブ</tips>がどんなところかは知っているか？」","en":"“I see. Well, there’s hardly anyone left who speaks of it these days. ...Then do you know what kind of place <tips=18>Rose Club</tips> was?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐健慈朗","displayName":"Kenjiro Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r68","rowIndex":68,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「大体は……。街の人を無理矢理働かせたり、ひどいことをしていたから、潰されてしまったお店ですよね」","en":"“More or less... It forced people from the city to work there and did terrible things to them, so the place was brought down. Isn’t that right?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r69","rowIndex":69,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「無理矢理ってばかりでもないんだがな……まあ、それはいい」","en":"“Not all of them were forced, though... But never mind that.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐健慈朗","displayName":"Kenjiro Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r70","rowIndex":70,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　父はげっぷをすると、","en":"My father belched, then continued.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r71","rowIndex":71,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「とにかく、客のどんな欲望にもこたえる総合施設として有名だったんだ。今のこの街も欲望を叶える街と言われているが、桁が違う。……<tips=18>ローズ・クラブ</tips>は会員のランクによって提供されているサービスが違ってな。一般会員として利用するだけなら、まあ、他の店とそこまで大差はなかった」","en":"“In any case, it was famous as an all-purpose establishment catering to every desire its customers could conceive. Even now, people call this a city where desires come true, but <tips=18>Rose Club</tips> existed on an entirely different scale. ...The services available there varied according to a member’s rank. For an ordinary member, it was not so very different from other establishments.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐健慈朗","displayName":"Kenjiro Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r72","rowIndex":72,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　父は静かな声で語りながら、手の中で空になったグラスを弄んでいます。","en":"My father spoke in a quiet voice, turning the empty glass idly in his hands.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r73","rowIndex":73,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「しかし、ランクがあがると、性質がまったく変わってくる。その最高ランクのプラチナ会員となれば、この世のものとも思えない体験が出来る」","en":"“But as a member rose through the ranks, the nature of the place changed completely. Reach the highest rank—platinum—and you could enjoy experiences that seemed not of this world.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐健慈朗","displayName":"Kenjiro Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r74","rowIndex":74,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そしてそのグラスをトンと音を立ててテーブルの上に置き、一瞬私の表情を確認してから、またグラスを手に取った。","en":"He set the glass upon the table with a small knock, checked my expression for an instant, then picked it up again.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r75","rowIndex":75,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ショー・ルームのブッフェには、ライオンだとかキリンだとか、食べたことがないような食材で作った料理が並んでいる。店員に頼めばいつでもスナック感覚でドラッグを注射してくれる。そして極めつきは、男でも女でも子供でも大人でも、どんな人種でも、好みの人間を選び、好きに出来るんだ。比喩表現じゃない。文字通りなんでも出来る。暴力をふるったり、その手足を切断したり、殺したっていい。……もちろん相応の金は必要だがな」","en":"“The showroom buffet offered dishes made from meats you had never tasted before—lion, giraffe, and the like. Ask an attendant, and at any hour they would inject you with drugs as casually as handing you a snack. And the crowning attraction was this: man or woman, child or adult, whatever their race, you could choose any person who suited your tastes and do with them as you pleased. That is no figure of speech. I mean absolutely anything. You could beat them, sever their limbs, even kill them. ...Provided, of course, that you could pay the corresponding price.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r76","rowIndex":76,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そんなことが……」","en":"“How could such a place...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r77","rowIndex":77,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あるんだよ。まあ、当時はそれらのサービスが広く知れ渡っていたわけじゃない。プラチナ会員になった連中だけのお楽しみさ。噂としては囁かれることはあったが、その全貌が明るみに出ることはなかったよ。<tips=18>ローズ・クラブ</tips>が潰れて何年か過ぎてから、ぽつぽつと語るものが現れたんだ。……まあ、おれは、業者としておびただしい死体などを処理してたから、なんとなくは想像していたがね。だからといって、事実を究明しようとはしなかった。当時、<tips=18>ローズ・クラブ</tips>は一番のお得意様だったからね」","en":"“It existed. Of course, those services were not widely known at the time. They were pleasures reserved for platinum members alone. Rumors circulated in whispers, but the whole truth never came to light. Only years after <tips=18>Rose Club</tips> was destroyed did people begin, one by one, to tell what they knew. ...As a contractor, I disposed of countless corpses for the place, so I had some idea of what was happening. But I made no attempt to uncover the truth. In those days, <tips=18>Rose Club</tips> was my finest customer.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r78","rowIndex":78,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　父は寂しそうに苦笑をし、","en":"My father gave a lonely, rueful smile.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r79","rowIndex":79,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そのプラチナ会員にのみ公開されていたショーの一つに『不死身の女』というものがある」","en":"“One of the shows reserved for those platinum members was called ‘Immortal Woman.’”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r80","rowIndex":80,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"『不死身の女』という言葉を聞いて私はいつのまにか俯いていた顔を上げました。","en":"At the words ‘Immortal Woman,’ I lifted my head, only then realizing that at some point I had begun staring down at the floor.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r81","rowIndex":81,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして父は、客の一人がメディアに独白したという、その世にも残酷なショーの内容を語りはじめたのです。","en":"My father began to describe that appallingly cruel show, as one of its patrons had reportedly recounted it to the media.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r82","rowIndex":82,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まず正面の舞台にね、一人の若い美女が入って来るそうだ。これが『不死身の女』らしい。客の記憶によると、黒髪のアジア人だったようだが、まあ当てにならない。この女がステージの中央で客に深々と挨拶をし、服を脱いで全裸になる。……ここで音楽がスタートし、ショーのはじまりだ」","en":"“First, a beautiful young woman would come onto the stage. She was the ‘Immortal Woman,’ apparently. The patron remembered her as a black-haired Asian woman, though that may not be reliable. She would stand at center stage, bow deeply to the audience, strip completely naked... and then the music would start, and the show with it.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r83","rowIndex":83,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　父が言うには、まず係の人間がやって来て女性の両手を鎖で縛り、ステージ中央のポールに後ろ手で固定するのだそうです。","en":"According to my father, attendants would enter first, bind the woman’s hands in chains, then fasten them behind her back to a pole at center stage.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r84","rowIndex":84,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そうして準備が終わると、筋骨隆々たる上半身を剥き出しにした男がステージに上がります。","en":"Once they had finished their preparations, a muscular man with his upper body bare would step onto the stage.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r85","rowIndex":85,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼は細長い剣を持っていて、これで女性の身体を突き刺すというのです。","en":"He carried a long, slender sword, and with it he would stab the woman through the body.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r86","rowIndex":86,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　普通なら致命傷ですが、しかし女性は死なない。剣を引き抜き、腹を突き刺し、また引き抜いて、次は胸を突き刺しても死なず、しまいには喉を後ろに剣先が貫通するくらい突き刺し、引き抜いても強く血が噴き出すだけで死なない。——その都度女性はマイクによる呼びかけに反応し、足を上げたり、首を横にかしげたりして生きていることをアピールするのだそうです。","en":"Ordinarily, any of the wounds would have been fatal. Yet the woman did not die. He would pull out the sword, stab her in the belly, pull it out again, then stab her in the chest, and still she would not die. At last he would drive it through her throat until the point emerged from the back of her neck. Even when he pulled it free, the wound merely sent blood gushing; she did not die. Each time, the woman would answer a call over the microphone by lifting a leg or cocking her head, demonstrating that she was still alive—or so the story went.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r87","rowIndex":87,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　突き刺しては引き抜くという作業が一通り終わり、血みどろになった女性をその場に残して男はステージを降り、係員がその周りに特注の柵を素早く組み立てます。","en":"Once he had finished stabbing her and pulling the blade free again and again, the man left the blood-drenched woman where she stood and walked offstage. Attendants then hurriedly assembled a specially made enclosure around her.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r88","rowIndex":88,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それが出来上がると、係員が柵の鉄棒を掴んでガチャガチャと揺らして押しても引いても壊れない丈夫なものであることを客に伝えるのだそうです。","en":"Once it was finished, an attendant would seize the iron bars and rattle them, shoving and pulling at the enclosure to show the audience that it was solid and would not give way.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r89","rowIndex":89,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そして、最後にステージに上がるのは虎だ」","en":"“And the last thing to take the stage was a tiger.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r90","rowIndex":90,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「虎？」","en":"“A tiger?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r91","rowIndex":91,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そう、虎なんだよ」","en":"“Yes. A tiger.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r92","rowIndex":92,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ショーのクライマックスになると、鎖を付けられた巨大な虎が女性を閉じ込めた柵のなかに放たれるのだと言うのです。","en":"At the climax of the show, he said, an enormous tiger on a chain would be released into the cage holding the woman.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r93","rowIndex":93,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　虎はよく訓練されており、調教師の命令に従って、女の腹に噛みつきます。","en":"The tiger was well trained. On its handler’s command, it bit into the woman’s abdomen.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r94","rowIndex":94,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして内臓を引きずり出し、それを食べます。その後は、足を食いちぎり——頭を半分食いちぎり——やがて女性はぐったりとして動かなくなってしまいます。","en":"Then it would drag out her organs and devour them. Afterward, it would bite off her leg—and half her head—until at last the woman went limp and ceased to move.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r95","rowIndex":95,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ついに死んだかと客の全員が確信するほどの状態になってから、虎はやっと退場します。","en":"Only once every customer was convinced she had finally died did the tiger leave the stage.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r96","rowIndex":96,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　一番最後に女性だった残骸が黒いゴミ袋に片付けられてゆく——その時、女の手が動いて客に『バイバイ』をするのだと言います。","en":"At the very end, as the remains of what had once been a woman were cleared away into black garbage bags, her hand would move and wave bye-bye to the audience.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r97","rowIndex":97,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　これが『不死身の女』の概要です。","en":"That was the basic outline of “Immortal Woman.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r98","rowIndex":98,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　この女性は、一ヶ月もするとまた元気な姿で客の前に現れるのだというから相当な不死身ぶりです。","en":"A month later, the same woman would apparently appear before the audience alive and well again—which would make her remarkably immortal indeed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r99","rowIndex":99,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ショーの内容はその回ごとに変化し、剣を持った男が首を切り落としたり、性交を交えたり、生きたまま肉を焼いて塩胡椒で味付けして人が食べたりすることもあるそうですが、ひたすら女性を残酷な目に遭わせるという、大まかな流れは決まっているのだそうです。","en":"The contents of the show varied each time. I was told that the swordsman might cut off her head, that the performance might incorporate intercourse, or that people might roast her flesh while she still lived, season it with salt and pepper, and eat it. But the broad pattern—subjecting the woman to unrelenting cruelty—was apparently fixed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r100","rowIndex":100,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ただ、当時これを取り上げた記事はこの『不死身』という点に関しては懐疑的でした。","en":"The article that reported the story at the time, however, was skeptical about the claim of ‘immortality.’","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r101","rowIndex":101,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　同じ姿形の姉妹かなにかを何人も用意しているとか、整形させているとか、そもそもすべてが仕掛けのある手品であるのではないかと、さまざまな推測をしていました。","en":"It speculated on various possibilities: that they had prepared several identical-looking sisters or the like, that they had given them plastic surgery, or that the entire performance might simply be a magic trick with some hidden mechanism.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r102","rowIndex":102,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「しかし、これが本当に死なない女だったとしたら？　切っても刺しても、すぐに治ってしまう人間が存在するのだとしたら？」","en":"“But what if she truly was a woman who could not die? What if a person existed whose wounds healed at once, no matter how often she was cut or stabbed?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐健慈朗","displayName":"Kenjiro Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r103","rowIndex":103,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　父は私の方を見ず、そっぽを向きながらそう言いました。","en":"My father said this with his face turned away, never looking at me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r104","rowIndex":104,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は無意識のうちに生唾を飲み込み、喉からごくりという音がしました。","en":"Without realizing it, I swallowed hard. The gulp sounded in my throat.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r105","rowIndex":105,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　もちろん、私も父もそういう、煮ても焼いても死なないような生き物についてはとてもよく知っています。","en":"Of course, both my father and I knew all too well of a creature that could be boiled or burned and still would not die.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r106","rowIndex":106,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「虎というのは、その……」","en":"“The tiger was, um...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r107","rowIndex":107,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私が言うと父は頷き、","en":"My father nodded as I began.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r108","rowIndex":108,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=57>滑走路通り</tips>の事件のあとに発覚したのだがね、あの虎は<tips=18>ローズ・クラブ</tips>の残酷ショーで使われていた虎なんだよ」","en":"“We learned this after the incident on <tips=57>Runway Street</tips>: that was the tiger they had used in the sadistic shows at <tips=18>Rose Club</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐健慈朗","displayName":"Kenjiro Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r109","rowIndex":109,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……虎はそこで『不死身の女』の肉を食べ、特殊化した……」","en":"“...The tiger ate the flesh of the ‘Immortal Woman’ there and underwent specialization...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r110","rowIndex":110,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そう。そういう推測が成り立つことになる」","en":"“Yes. That would make the theory plausible.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐健慈朗","displayName":"Kenjiro Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r111","rowIndex":111,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　父は水を飲み干して空になっているのを忘れて、グラスを口に付けました。苦い顔で気がついてすぐにテーブルの上に戻します。","en":"My father forgot that he had already drained his glass and raised it to his lips. Realizing his mistake at once, he grimaced and set it back on the table.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r112","rowIndex":112,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「じゃあ、私との関連は……」","en":"“Then my connection to her...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r113","rowIndex":113,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「関連しているとしたら、可能性は大きく三つ考えられるな」","en":"“If there is a connection, I can think of three broad possibilities.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐健慈朗","displayName":"Kenjiro Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r114","rowIndex":114,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　父は私の目の前に三本の指を立てました。","en":"My father raised three fingers before me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r115","rowIndex":115,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まず第一は、その『不死身の女』の肉親であるという可能性。姪か、娘か、姉妹か、まあその辺だろう。傾向値は親から子へ引き継がれるからな」","en":"“First, you may be a blood relative of the ‘Immortal Woman’—a niece, daughter, or sister. Something along those lines. Tendency values pass from parent to child, after all.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐健慈朗","displayName":"Kenjiro Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r116","rowIndex":116,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そう言って、薬指を折り曲げました。","en":"He folded down his ring finger.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r117","rowIndex":117,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「第二は、『不死身の女』の肉を食わされて特殊化したという可能性。お前はクラブのなかで暮らしていた街の女で、何かのショーでその肉を食わせられた」","en":"“Second, you may have specialized after being forced to eat the ‘Immortal Woman’s’ flesh. You may have been one of the city’s women living inside the club, made to eat it as part of some show.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐健慈朗","displayName":"Kenjiro Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r118","rowIndex":118,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして、中指を折り、人差し指だけが残ります。","en":"He lowered his middle finger, leaving only the index finger raised.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r119","rowIndex":119,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そして最後は、『不死身の女』そのものであるという可能性だ。見つかったときは幼児の遺体に混ざっていたが、それはまったくの偶然で、お前自身がそこで働く『不死身の女』だったのかもしれない。……ほかにも思いもよらない理由があるのかもしれないが、今ある材料を結びつけて、お前の正体を想像するとすればおおよそこんなところだ」","en":"“And finally, you may be the ‘Immortal Woman’ herself. When you were found, you were mixed in among the bodies of infants, but that may have been pure coincidence. You yourself may have been the ‘Immortal Woman’ employed there. ...There may be some other explanation we haven’t even imagined. But if I piece together what we know and try to picture what you really are, those are the possibilities I arrive at.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐健慈朗","displayName":"Kenjiro Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r120","rowIndex":120,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　最後に手を開いてひらひらと振ると、父は結局さっきのけたばかりのウイスキーの瓶を手にとってグラスに注ぎました。","en":"Finally, he opened his hand and gave it a loose wave. In the end, my father picked up the bottle of whiskey he had only just pushed aside and poured some into his glass.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r121","rowIndex":121,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は絶句して言葉が出ません。","en":"I was speechless.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r122","rowIndex":122,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……じゃあ、ゴミとして捨てられた理由は？　まだ生きているのに……」","en":"“...Then why was I discarded as garbage? Even though I was still alive...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r123","rowIndex":123,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それはわからないよ。生きていてもゴミとして処理させればいいと思ったのかもしれないし、特殊化しているのに気づかなかったのかもしれないし、何かの手違いかもしれない。なぜ殺したのかもわからないな。事故かもしれないし、ショーのためかもしれないし、接客に使われたのかもしれない。いくらでも考えられる」","en":"“I don’t know. Perhaps they thought they might as well have you disposed of as garbage, alive or not. Perhaps they hadn’t realized you had specialized, or perhaps it was some kind of mistake. I don’t know why they killed you, either. It might have been an accident, part of a show, or something done while you were entertaining a customer. There are any number of possibilities.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐健慈朗","displayName":"Kenjiro Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r124","rowIndex":124,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　父はいつもより早いペースでグラスのウイスキーを飲み干し、さらに継ぎ足そうとしたのですがもう瓶の中身も空でした。","en":"My father drained his whiskey faster than usual and tried to pour himself another, only to find the bottle empty as well.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r125","rowIndex":125,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　これらの事実は私にとっては新しく聞くことばかりでしたが、ある程度は予想していたことで、思ったほどの驚きはありませんでした。","en":"Everything he had told me was new, yet I had anticipated some of it and found myself less surprised than I had expected.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r126","rowIndex":126,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　むしろ抵抗なく自然にすんなりと受け入れられたといった方が、私の印象に近いかもしれません。","en":"It might be more accurate to say that I accepted it all easily, almost as though it were only natural.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r127","rowIndex":127,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それでも、こんなに動揺してしまうのは、やはり心のどこかでは、すべてが嘘や間違いであってほしいという思いがあったからでしょう。","en":"If I was shaken nevertheless, perhaps it was because somewhere in my heart I had still hoped that all of it would prove false or mistaken.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r128","rowIndex":128,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　——これまであれだけの異常な体験をしていて、一体、何に希望をもっていたのかは我ながらさっぱりわからないのですが、人の心というものは不思議なものです。","en":"After all the extraordinary things I had already experienced, even I had no idea what, exactly, I could still have been hoping for. The human heart is a curious thing.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r129","rowIndex":129,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まあ、こんなところだな。他に何か聞きたいことはあるか？」","en":"“Well, that’s about it. Is there anything else you want to ask?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐健慈朗","displayName":"Kenjiro Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r130","rowIndex":130,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　父はもうこの話題を切り上げたいようでした。","en":"My father seemed eager to bring the subject to an end.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r131","rowIndex":131,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それは……」","en":"“Well...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r132","rowIndex":132,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は躊躇しましたが、ここで聞かなければもう聞くことが出来なくなると思い、口を開きました。","en":"I hesitated. But if I did not ask now, I felt I might never be able to ask at all, and so I made myself speak.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r133","rowIndex":133,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「その<tips=18>ローズ・クラブ</tips>には『不死身の男』というのはいなかったのですか？」","en":"“Was there no ‘Immortal Man’ at <tips=18>Rose Club</tips>?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r134","rowIndex":134,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「男？」","en":"“A man?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐健慈朗","displayName":"Kenjiro Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r135","rowIndex":135,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうです。<tips=18>ローズ・クラブ</tips>でなくとも、同じような力をもった男性がこの街に存在したという話は……」","en":"“Yes. Even if he had nothing to do with <tips=18>Rose Club</tips>, have you ever heard of a man existing in this city with the same kind of power?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r136","rowIndex":136,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……なぜそんなことを聞く？」","en":"“...Why do you ask?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐健慈朗","displayName":"Kenjiro Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r137","rowIndex":137,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　何か違和感を覚えたのか、父はそう尋ね返しました。","en":"Perhaps he sensed that something was amiss; my father answered my question with one of his own.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r138","rowIndex":138,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……私、最近、自分と同じような身体を持つ人間と、出会ったんです」","en":"“...Recently, I met another person with a body like mine.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r139","rowIndex":139,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私はここで、ようやく『あの日のこと』を話すことが出来たのです。あの、<tips=73>リュウカ</tips>さんと、彼女を殺害した男のことを。","en":"It was only then that I was finally able to speak about “that day”—about <tips=73>Ryuka</tips> and the man who had murdered her.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r140","rowIndex":140,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どこで？」","en":"“Where?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐健慈朗","displayName":"Kenjiro Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r141","rowIndex":141,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　父にそう尋ねられて、実際話そうとすると、なかなか口が開いてはくれませんでした。","en":"But when my father asked and I actually tried to answer, I found I could not open my mouth.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r142","rowIndex":142,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　言葉が喉に引っかかって、うまく出て来ません。","en":"The words caught in my throat and would not come out properly.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r143","rowIndex":143,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　あの日のことを具体的に思い出すのを、心が拒否しているのです。時間が経ち、それなりに気持ちが整理出来ていると思っていたのに、自分でも驚きました。こんなこともあるのだと。","en":"My mind refused to revisit that day in any concrete detail. Time had passed, and I had thought I had managed to put my feelings in some kind of order. I surprised even myself. So this, too, could happen.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r144","rowIndex":144,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しかし、自分のことを知るためにはここで話さないわけにはゆきません。自分でもいやになるくらいもじもじとしてしまってから、どうにか、<tips=73>リュウカ</tips>さんの部屋であった一部始終を話しました。","en":"But if I was to learn the truth about myself, I had no choice but to speak. After squirming with hesitation long enough to disgust even myself, I somehow managed to tell him everything that had happened in the apartment belonging to <tips=73>Ryuka</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r145","rowIndex":145,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「はあ？　お前は、拳銃を持った男にジャンプキックをしたのか？」","en":"“What? You launched a flying kick at a man with a gun?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐健慈朗","displayName":"Kenjiro Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r146","rowIndex":146,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　父はびっくりして目を丸くします。","en":"My father’s eyes widened in astonishment.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r147","rowIndex":147,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「す、すみません」","en":"“I-I’m sorry.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r148","rowIndex":148,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私はあまりの恥ずかしさで顔が熱くなって、うつむきました。きっと耳まで真っ赤になっていたと思います。","en":"My face burned with embarrassment, and I lowered my head. I was sure even my ears had turned scarlet.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r149","rowIndex":149,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そういうのは子供の時に卒業したんじゃなかったのか……」","en":"“Hadn’t you grown out of that sort of thing when you were a child...?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐健慈朗","displayName":"Kenjiro Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r150","rowIndex":150,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　あきれた父は何か口の中でブツブツと言ってから、溜息をつき、","en":"Utterly exasperated, my father muttered something under his breath, then sighed and said,","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r151","rowIndex":151,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まったく、乱暴なことをする。危ない時は逃げるんだ。いくら再生能力があるといっても傷つけられることはあるし、絶対に死なないわけじゃない。<tips=1>リョウ</tips>が聞いたら機嫌を悪くするぞ」","en":"“Honestly, what a reckless thing to do. When you’re in danger, you run. No matter how powerful your regenerative ability is, you can still be hurt, and you are not absolutely incapable of dying. <tips=1>Ryo</tips> won’t be happy when he hears about this.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐健慈朗","displayName":"Kenjiro Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r152","rowIndex":152,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「すみません。そのことは謝ります。……それで、彼の能力についてですが……」","en":"“I’m sorry. I know I was wrong. ...But about the man’s ability...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r153","rowIndex":153,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私はなんとか話題を戻そうと思ってそう言うと、","en":"I said this in an effort to steer the conversation back on course.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r154","rowIndex":154,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ふむ、それはな……」","en":"“Hmm. Well, that...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐健慈朗","displayName":"Kenjiro Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r155","rowIndex":155,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　何か言うことがありそうなそぶりでしたが、父は結局それを口にせず、","en":"My father gave every sign that something had occurred to him, but in the end he kept it to himself and said,","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r156","rowIndex":156,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「わからない。見当もつかないな。……が、まあ、<tips=97>特殊タイプＢ</tips>が世界にお前だけということもあるまい。いろいろなミュータントが集まるこの街では、そういうこともあるんだろう。もちろん、そいつが<tips=18>ローズ・クラブ</tips>と何かの関係があるという可能性は高いが」","en":"“I don’t know. I haven’t the faintest idea. ...Still, you can hardly be the only <tips=97>special Type B</tips> in the world. This city draws mutants of every imaginable kind; it would be no surprise if there were another. Of course, there is a good chance that fellow has some connection to <tips=18>Rose Club</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐健慈朗","displayName":"Kenjiro Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r157","rowIndex":157,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうですか」","en":"“I see.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r158","rowIndex":158,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あまり気にしない方が良い。一応こちらでも調べておく」","en":"“Best not to worry about it too much. I’ll look into it on my end.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐健慈朗","displayName":"Kenjiro Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r159","rowIndex":159,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「はい。ありがとうございます……」","en":"“All right. Thank you...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r160","rowIndex":160,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　父の物言いは何かを隠しているようにも思えましたが、私はそう頷きました。","en":"Something in the way my father said it made me suspect he was hiding something, but I nodded all the same.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r161","rowIndex":161,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　父の話を聞いても気持ちはもやもやとするばかりでしたが、だからといって私の気持ちがすっきりするまで時間が待ってくれるということはありません。意地悪なものです。","en":"My father’s story only left me with more turmoil inside. But time was not so kind as to wait for my feelings to settle. It can be spiteful that way.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r162","rowIndex":162,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　職場に行けば自分のことなんか考えている暇はないし、休みの日でも家事やらで何だかんだと忙しく、自分と向き合うと決めてはみたものの、結局日々に流されてしまいます。","en":"At work, I had no time to think about myself, and even on my days off, housework and one thing after another kept me busy. I had resolved to face myself at last, yet in the end I simply let the days carry me along.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r163","rowIndex":163,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その日も休みではあったのですが、施設の子供たちの日用品で足りないものがあったので、買い物のために家を出ていました。本来は就業時間中にやるべきことなのですが、<tips=73>リュウカ</tips>さんがいなくなったあとにさらに職員がやめてしまい、ひどい人手不足で買いに行けなかったのです。","en":"That day was another day off, but the facility was running short of daily necessities for the children, so I had gone out shopping. It was something I should ordinarily have done during work hours, but another staff member had quit after <tips=73>Ryuka</tips> was gone, leaving us so desperately understaffed that there had been no time to go.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r164","rowIndex":164,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=58>パラシュート通り</tips>でタオルや歯磨き粉、下着類などを買い込むと、そのまま一旦家に持ち帰るのも手間に思えたので、職場に置きに行くことにしました。","en":"I bought towels, toothpaste, underwear, and other supplies on <tips=58>Parachute Street</tips>. Taking them home only to bring them back later seemed needlessly troublesome, so I decided to leave them at work.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r165","rowIndex":165,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あら、休みの日まで来るなんて、どれだけここが好きなのかしら？」","en":"“My, coming in even on your day off. Just how much do you love this place?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r166","rowIndex":166,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　入り口のところにシスターがいて、両手にふくれあがった買い物袋をぶら下げた私の姿を見ると口に手を当てて笑いました。","en":"A sister was standing at the entrance. At the sight of me with bulging shopping bags hanging from both hands, she covered her mouth and laughed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r167","rowIndex":167,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いや、家に帰るのが面倒で」","en":"“No, going all the way home seemed like too much trouble.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r168","rowIndex":168,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は照れ笑いをすると、庭の方で子供たちが騒ぐ声が聞こえたので、そちらに目をやりました。","en":"I smiled sheepishly, then heard the children making a commotion out in the yard and looked their way.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r169","rowIndex":169,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=10>見土</tips>さんたちが来てくれているのよ」","en":"“<tips=10>Michio</tips> and his friends are here.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r170","rowIndex":170,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　シスターの言う通り、子供たちの中心にいる金髪の青年は<tips=10>見土道夫</tips>さんと、その友人の<tips=66>田中紺太</tips>さんでした。","en":"Just as the sister said, the blond young man at the center of the children was <tips=10>Michio Mido</tips>. His friend <tips=66>Konta Tanaka</tips> was with him.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r171","rowIndex":171,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　二人とも子供の頃からの知り合いですが、最近はそれほどつき合いはありません。私も彼らもお互い仕事が忙しくなったのもありますし、それにどちらかというと私よりも<tips=1>リョウ</tips>さんの方が彼らと親しく、いつも<tips=1>リョウ</tips>さんの側に居る私はそうした繋がりで彼らと関わっていたわけですから、<tips=1>リョウ</tips>さんが街を出ると自然と関わりも薄くなりました。","en":"I had known them both since childhood, but had seen little of them lately. We had all grown busy with work; besides, they had always been closer to <tips=1>Ryo</tips> than to me, and much of my own connection to them had come from always being at <tips=1>Ryo’s</tips> side. Once <tips=1>Ryo</tips> left the city, we naturally drifted apart.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r172","rowIndex":172,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼らはいま、街の名物となるお菓子を作るのだと言って製菓業を営んでいます。最近やっと商品が出来たらしく、<tips=57>滑走路通り</tips>で販売しているのを見かけました。そして彼らは、暇があれば<tips=9>Y地区</tips>内にあるあちこちの施設をまわって、このように売れ残った饅頭を配ったり、遊んでやったりしてくれるのです。","en":"They now ran a confectionery, determined to create a sweet that would become a local specialty. Their product had apparently been finished at last, and I had seen it being sold on <tips=57>Runway Street</tips>. Whenever they found the time, they made the rounds of facilities throughout <tips=9>Y District</tips>, handing out leftover buns and playing with the children just as they were doing now.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r173","rowIndex":173,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　子供たちにまず好きになって貰って、知名度を上げる戦略だなどと<tips=10>見土</tips>さんは言っていましたが、おそらく単に子供と遊ぶための口実でしょう。昔から、子供や老人や病人などの弱い立場の人間に対して非常に思いやりが強い人で、その明るさに私や<tips=1>リョウ</tips>さんも含めた、当時の仲間がどれだけ影響を受けたかわかりません。","en":"<tips=10>Michio</tips> claimed that winning over the children first was his strategy for building name recognition, but I suspected it was merely an excuse to play with them. He had always been extraordinarily considerate toward the vulnerable—children, the elderly, the sick. There was no telling how deeply his brightness had influenced the rest of us in those days, <tips=1>Ryo</tips> and me included.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r174","rowIndex":174,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「お、<tips=55>松坊</tips>じゃないか。今日は休みだと聞いてたから、会えないと思ってたのに」","en":"“Oh, if it isn’t <tips=55>Matsu</tips>. I heard you had the day off, so I thought I wouldn’t see you.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫","displayName":"Michio Mido","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r175","rowIndex":175,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　我先に饅頭を奪い取ろうとする子供たちに笑いながら二人が配る様子を見ていると、<tips=10>見土</tips>さんは私に気がつき、屈託のない笑顔を浮かべて饅頭を一つ放り投げてくれました。両手に買い物袋をぶら下げていた私は、慌てながら咄嗟に手を上げて、人差し指と中指だけでなんとかそれをキャッチします。","en":"I watched the two of them laughing as they handed out buns to the children, each scrambling to snatch one before the others. <tips=10>Michio</tips> noticed me, flashed his easy smile, and tossed a bun my way. With shopping bags hanging from both hands, I threw one hand up in alarm and somehow caught it between my index and middle fingers.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r176","rowIndex":176,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「さすが」","en":"“Impressive.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫","displayName":"Michio Mido","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r177","rowIndex":177,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「もう、びっくりするじゃないですか」","en":"“Honestly, you startled me.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r178","rowIndex":178,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私が怒ると、","en":"When I scolded him,","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r179","rowIndex":179,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ごめんごめん」","en":"“Sorry, sorry.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫","displayName":"Michio Mido","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r180","rowIndex":180,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=10>見土</tips>さんは言葉とは裏腹に、ちっとも悪びれずに笑いました。","en":"Despite his apology, <tips=10>Michio</tips> laughed without looking the least bit sorry.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r181","rowIndex":181,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あっ、<tips=66>コンタ</tips>。おれちょっと抜けるから、ここで子供たちの相手をしていてくれ」","en":"“Hey, <tips=66>Konta</tips>. I’m stepping out for a bit, so keep the children entertained for me.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫","displayName":"Michio Mido","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r182","rowIndex":182,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そう言われた<tips=66>紺太</tips>さんはいやそうな顔をしますが、<tips=10>見土</tips>さんは笑いながら無理矢理その場を彼に押しつけて、私の方へ近づいて来ます。","en":"<tips=66>Konta</tips> pulled a reluctant face, but <tips=10>Michio</tips> laughed, foisted the children on him anyway, and came over to me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r183","rowIndex":183,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「大丈夫なんですか？」","en":"“Will he be all right?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r184","rowIndex":184,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「平気さ。あいつはああ見えて子供好きだからな。いつまで遊んでいたって飽きやしない。……それより、たまには話そうじゃないか。それとも仕事か？」","en":"“He’ll be fine. He may not look it, but he loves children. He could play with them all day and never get bored. ...Anyway, why don’t we have a talk for once? Or are you working?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫","displayName":"Michio Mido","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r185","rowIndex":185,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いや、今日は荷物を置きに来ただけで、仕事ではないんです」","en":"“No, I only came to drop off these supplies today. I’m not working.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r186","rowIndex":186,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「じゃあ丁度良かった。そっちの事務所で話そう。<tips=1>リョウ</tips>じゃなくって悪いけれどもね」","en":"“Then this works out perfectly. Let’s talk in your office. Sorry you’re getting me instead of <tips=1>Ryo</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫","displayName":"Michio Mido","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r187","rowIndex":187,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「別にそんなことはないですけど」","en":"“It’s not as though I mind.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r188","rowIndex":188,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あはは。そうかい」","en":"“Ah ha ha. I see.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫","displayName":"Michio Mido","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r189","rowIndex":189,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして私たちは本舎の方に歩き始めます。","en":"We began walking toward the main building.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r190","rowIndex":190,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　この施設は元々公民館として建てられたもので、それが使われなくなっていたのを改装し、再利用しています。","en":"The facility had originally been built as a community center. After it fell out of use, it was renovated and repurposed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r191","rowIndex":191,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　広い屋外運動場と、三階建ての本舎、それから屋内運動場が、高い金網で囲まれるかたちとなっています。","en":"The broad outdoor playground, three-story main building, and indoor gymnasium were all enclosed by a high chain-link fence.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r192","rowIndex":192,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　本舎には施設の大部分の機能が集中しており、子供たちが寝起きする部屋の他に、食堂、浴室などの生活スペース、それから礼拝堂や職員の事務所や仮眠室などもありました。","en":"Most of the facility’s functions were concentrated in the main building. Besides the rooms where the children slept, it contained living spaces such as the dining hall and baths, along with a chapel, the staff office, and a staff rest room.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r193","rowIndex":193,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　バスケットコート一面分くらいの屋内運動場は、レクリエーションや集会の場として使われています。屋外運動場はかつては公民館の駐車場だった場所で、アスファルトを剥がして土を敷き、子供が遊んでも怪我をしないようになっていました。","en":"The indoor gymnasium, roughly the size of a basketball court, was used for recreation and assemblies. The outdoor playground had once been the community center’s parking lot, but the asphalt had been torn up and covered with soil so the children could play without hurting themselves.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r194","rowIndex":194,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　当時はこの施設にも資金があったのでしょう。","en":"The facility must have been well funded in those days.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r195","rowIndex":195,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=9>Y地区</tips>にある施設としてはかなり規模が大きく、設備の整った場所だと思います。暮らしている子供の数も、この街では一番でしょう。その分トラブルも多いわけですが。","en":"For a facility in <tips=9>Y District</tips>, it was remarkably large and well equipped. It probably housed more children than any other in the city—and with that size came its share of trouble.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r196","rowIndex":196,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちは事務室に足を踏み入れました。そこでは、事務員やヘルパー、ケースワーカーがそれぞれの机で仕事をしています。","en":"We entered the staff office, where clerical employees, aides, and caseworkers sat working at their respective desks.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r197","rowIndex":197,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私の机は入り口のすぐ側で、その上には様々な資料やファイル、子供が作ってくれた折り紙や人形などが山積みになったままでした。","en":"My desk was right beside the entrance, its surface still heaped with all manner of documents and files, as well as origami and dolls the children had made for me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r198","rowIndex":198,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「す、すみません。ここにいるときはほとんど机にいないから、整理する暇もなくてごっちゃりしちゃって……」","en":"“I-I’m sorry. Even when I’m here, I’m almost never at my desk, so I never have time to organize it. It’s gotten completely out of hand...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r199","rowIndex":199,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　散らかしたままでいることをすっかり忘れていました。","en":"I had completely forgotten that I had left it in such disorder.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r200","rowIndex":200,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　恥ずかしく思いながら慌てて片付け始めるのを、<tips=10>見土</tips>さんは苦笑して見ています。","en":"As I hurriedly began tidying up, burning with embarrassment, <tips=10>Michio</tips> watched me with a wry smile.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r201","rowIndex":201,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いいよ別に、そんなに片付けなくても」","en":"“It’s fine. You don’t have to tidy all of that up.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫","displayName":"Michio Mido","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r202","rowIndex":202,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「い、いえ、ちょっと待っていてください。すみません！」","en":"“N-no, please wait just a moment. I’m sorry!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r203","rowIndex":203,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　あらかた片付け終わってから、ようやく私たちは揃って椅子に腰をかけることが出来ました。","en":"Only after I had put away most of the clutter could the two of us finally sit down together.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r204","rowIndex":204,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いやー、<tips=55>松坊</tips>も本当に大人になったもんだなあ」","en":"“Wow, <tips=55>Matsu</tips>. You really are all grown up now.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫","displayName":"Michio Mido","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r205","rowIndex":205,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　隣の牧原さんの椅子を借りている<tips=10>見土</tips>さんは感心したように言います。","en":"Seated in the chair he had borrowed from Makihara at the next desk, <tips=10>Michio</tips> spoke with genuine admiration.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r206","rowIndex":206,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「な、なにがですか？」","en":"“Wh-what makes you say that?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r207","rowIndex":207,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　みっともないところを見られてしまった上でのこの発言に、からかわれているのかと思った私は恥ずかしく思い顔を熱くしながらそう問い返しました。","en":"After letting him see me make such a disgraceful spectacle of myself, I took the remark for mockery and asked the question with my face burning.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r208","rowIndex":208,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「こうして職場に自分の席があって、他の職員の方と『おつかれさまー』と言い合ってるのを見たら、しみじみと感じるよ……」","en":"“Seeing you with a desk of your own, exchanging ‘Good work’ with the other staff... it really brings it home.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫","displayName":"Michio Mido","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r209","rowIndex":209,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ただ挨拶してるだけじゃないですか……」","en":"“But we’re only saying hello...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r210","rowIndex":210,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いやだって、昔は挨拶も出来なかったろう。<tips=1>リョウ</tips>の後ろに黙って突っ立って、こっちが何を話しかけてもジロジロ見てくるだけで……あ、すみません。ありがとうございます」","en":"“But you couldn’t even say hello back then. You would stand there silently behind <tips=1>Ryo</tips>, and no matter what I said to you, all you did was stare at me... Oh, excuse me. Thank you.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫","displayName":"Michio Mido","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r211","rowIndex":211,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=10>見土</tips>さんは、お茶を淹れて運んできてくれたハシモトさんに頭を下げます。","en":"<tips=10>Michio</tips> bowed his head to Hashimoto, who had brewed tea and brought it to us.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r212","rowIndex":212,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　何も頼んでいないのに、さすがハシモトさんです。男性を見逃しません。","en":"Neither of us had asked for tea, but that was Hashimoto for you. A man never escaped her notice.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r213","rowIndex":213,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いえいえ、どういたしまして」","en":"“Not at all. You’re very welcome.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ハシモト","displayName":"Hashimoto","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r214","rowIndex":214,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ハシモトさんはそう言って運んできたお盆を口元に当てます。それで表情を隠したつもりなのかもしれませんが、その興味津々といった感じの好奇心を剥き出しにした笑顔は隠し切れていませんでした。","en":"Hashimoto lifted the tray to cover her mouth. Perhaps she thought it would hide her expression, but it could not conceal the eager smile that laid her curiosity completely bare.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r215","rowIndex":215,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=10>見土</tips>さんと、<tips=55>汐さん</tips>って、どんな関係なんですか？」","en":"“What kind of relationship do you and <tips=55>Ms. Shio</tips> have, <tips=10>Michio</tips>?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ハシモト","displayName":"Hashimoto","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r216","rowIndex":216,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ど、どんな関係って、子供の頃からの遊び仲間ですよ。それだけです」","en":"“Wh-what sort? We’ve been playmates since we were children. That’s all.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r217","rowIndex":217,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私はすぐにそのような考えをするハシモトさんに苦笑しました。","en":"I gave Hashimoto a wry smile for letting her mind go there so quickly.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r218","rowIndex":218,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女は納得出来ないような顔をしていましたが、すぐに元の笑顔に戻ると話題を変えます。","en":"She did not look convinced, but soon recovered her former smile and changed the subject.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r219","rowIndex":219,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あ、そう言えば聞きましたよ。<tips=10>見土</tips>さんって、この辺りの不良少年たちのリーダーだったんですってね。それで、すごい有名人だったって……」","en":"“Oh, that reminds me. I heard you used to lead all the young delinquents around here, <tips=10>Michio</tips>. They say you were quite the celebrity...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ハシモト","displayName":"Hashimoto","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r220","rowIndex":220,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そんな大したもんじゃないけど。ただまわりの仲間が立ててくれただけで」","en":"“It was nothing that impressive. My friends just happened to treat me as their leader.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫","displayName":"Michio Mido","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r221","rowIndex":221,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=10>見土</tips>さんは穏やかに返します。","en":"<tips=10>Michio</tips> answered mildly.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r222","rowIndex":222,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「またまた、謙遜しちゃって。武勇伝聞きましたよ？　バラバラだったいろんなチームを吸収しちゃって、さながら子供版の<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>だったとか。でも、そのお友だちってことは、グループに<tips=55>汐さん</tips>もいたんですね。意外。そんな古いつき合いなら、やっぱり<tips=10>見土</tips>さんと<tips=55>汐さん</tips>は……」","en":"“There you go, playing modest again. I’ve heard the stories, you know. They say you absorbed all the different gangs and became practically a children’s version of <tips=7>YS</tips>. But if <tips=55>Ms. Shio</tips> is an old friend of yours, then she must have been part of the group too. I never would have guessed. And if you’ve known each other for that long, then surely you and <tips=55>Ms. Shio</tips>, <tips=10>Michio</tips>...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ハシモト","displayName":"Hashimoto","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r223","rowIndex":223,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ハシモトさんは疑い深い視線を私に向けました。","en":"Hashimoto turned a deeply suspicious gaze on me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r224","rowIndex":224,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いやいや、本当に変な関係じゃないですよ。彼女には、立派な相手がちゃんといるんですから」","en":"“No, no, there’s honestly nothing like that between us. She already has a perfectly good man of her own.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫","displayName":"Michio Mido","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r225","rowIndex":225,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=10>見土</tips>さんはおどけて、余計なことを言ってくれます。","en":"<tips=10>Michio</tips> made a joke of it and volunteered that wholly unnecessary detail.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r226","rowIndex":226,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ちょ、ちょっと<tips=10>見土</tips>さん」","en":"“W-wait, <tips=10>Michio</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r227","rowIndex":227,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　さすがに黙って聞いていられなくて、私はここで慌てて割り込みました。","en":"Unable to listen in silence any longer, I hastily interrupted.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r228","rowIndex":228,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あら、<tips=55>汐さん</tips>って恋人がいたの？」","en":"“My, do you have a boyfriend, <tips=55>Ms. Shio</tips>?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ハシモト","displayName":"Hashimoto","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r229","rowIndex":229,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ハシモトさんは目を丸くして私の方を見ます。","en":"Hashimoto stared at me wide-eyed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r230","rowIndex":230,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あの、恋人というかなんというか……大事な人なのは確かですけど……」","en":"“Well, I don’t know if ‘boyfriend’ is the right word... but he is certainly someone very important to me...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r231","rowIndex":231,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は恨めしく思い、<tips=10>見土</tips>さんの方を睨みました。","en":"I shot <tips=10>Michio</tips> a resentful glare.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r232","rowIndex":232,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あはは、ごめんごめん！　なんだ<tips=55>松坊</tips>、秘密にしてたのか！」","en":"“Ha ha ha! Sorry, sorry! What, <tips=55>Matsu</tips>, were you keeping it a secret?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫","displayName":"Michio Mido","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r233","rowIndex":233,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼はおおらかに笑って、それからハシモトさんの方を向きました。","en":"He laughed good-naturedly, then turned to Hashimoto.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r234","rowIndex":234,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まあとにかく、そういうわけでおれらは古い友人なんですよ。お互い忙しくって話す機会がないから、久しぶりに話そうかと思いましてね。仕事の邪魔しちゃってますか？」","en":"“Anyway, that’s the story: we’re old friends. We’ve both been so busy that we never get a chance to talk, so I thought we might catch up for once. Are we disturbing your work?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫","displayName":"Michio Mido","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r235","rowIndex":235,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「い、いえ、邪魔だなんてとんでもない！　いつも子供たちにお菓子を頂いているのに、そんな」","en":"“N-no, of course you aren’t! Not when you’re always bringing sweets for the children.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ハシモト","displayName":"Hashimoto","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r236","rowIndex":236,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ハシモトさんは手を振って否定します。","en":"Hashimoto waved her hands in denial.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r237","rowIndex":237,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ごゆっくりどうぞ。そして、よければまた遊びに来てくださいね。ここは男性が少ないので、子供たちも喜びます」","en":"“Please, take your time. And if you’d like, do come visit us again. There are so few men here, and the children love having you.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ハシモト","displayName":"Hashimoto","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r238","rowIndex":238,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「はい、遠慮なく」","en":"“Of course. I’ll gladly take you up on that.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫","displayName":"Michio Mido","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r239","rowIndex":239,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=10>見土</tips>さんが笑いかけると、ハシモトさんは顔を赤らめてそそくさとその場を去りました。","en":"When <tips=10>Michio</tips> smiled at her, Hashimoto blushed and hurried away.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r240","rowIndex":240,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ハシモトさんがあんなに照れてる。やっぱりすごいですね。<tips=10>見土</tips>さんは昔から、どこへ行っても女性に人気がありますね……」","en":"“I’ve never seen Hashimoto blush like that. You really are remarkable, <tips=10>Michio</tips>. Wherever you go, women have always adored you...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r241","rowIndex":241,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そんなんじゃないだろうよ。あ、これはおいしいお茶だねえ」","en":"“I don’t think that was it. Ah, this is excellent tea.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫","displayName":"Michio Mido","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r242","rowIndex":242,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=10>見土</tips>さんは素知らぬていで湯飲みのお茶を一口含むと、すぐにポケットから一つ取り出した饅頭をかじりました。","en":"Putting on an innocent air, <tips=10>Michio</tips> took a sip of tea, then promptly pulled a bun from his pocket and bit into it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r243","rowIndex":243,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「やっぱりあうな」","en":"“They really do go well together.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫","displayName":"Michio Mido","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r244","rowIndex":244,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いつもポケットにいれてるんですか」","en":"“Do you always carry those in your pocket?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r245","rowIndex":245,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　当たり前のようにポケットからお菓子を取り出すその姿に、私はびっくりして目を丸くしました。","en":"My eyes widened at the sight of him producing a sweet from his pocket as though it were the most natural thing in the world.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r246","rowIndex":246,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いつもじゃないよ。少し味を変えたときとか、試作品を持ち歩いてるだけだ」","en":"“Not always. Only when we’re tweaking the flavor, or when I have a prototype to test.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫","displayName":"Michio Mido","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r247","rowIndex":247,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=10>見土</tips>さんはそう言いましたが、私はこらえきれなくてクスクスと笑ってしまいます。","en":"That was <tips=10>Michio’s</tips> explanation, but I could no longer hold back a quiet giggle.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r248","rowIndex":248,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　すると彼はちょっとばつの悪そうな顔をして、またお茶を一口飲み、饅頭の残りを口に放り込みました。","en":"He looked a little sheepish, took another sip of tea, then popped the rest of the bun into his mouth.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r249","rowIndex":249,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「子供の頃の<tips=10>見土</tips>さんが、今のお饅頭屋さんになった<tips=10>見土</tips>さんを見たら驚くでしょうね……」","en":"“The <tips=10>Michio</tips> you were as a boy would be surprised to see the bun seller <tips=10>Michio</tips> has become...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r250","rowIndex":250,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　まだ笑いが収まらないまま私がそう言うと、","en":"I spoke before my laughter had quite subsided.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r251","rowIndex":251,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まあ、バカにするかもしれないな。あの頃のおれは、かっこつけだったからねえ。甘いものなんか食えるかって言ってた。好きなのに」","en":"“Well, he might laugh at me. I was such a poser back then. I used to say, ‘Like hell I’d eat anything sweet’—even though I loved it.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫","displayName":"Michio Mido","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r252","rowIndex":252,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=10>見土</tips>さんは肩をすくめ、","en":"<tips=10>Michio</tips> shrugged.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r253","rowIndex":253,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ま、若気の至りってやつだな。街で好き放題やって、自分たちがこの街の万能の神だと勘違いしていた」","en":"“Well, call it the folly of youth. We ran wild all over the city and imagined we were its almighty gods.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫","displayName":"Michio Mido","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r254","rowIndex":254,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「懐かしいですか？」","en":"“Do you miss those days?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r255","rowIndex":255,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そりゃ懐かしいよ。あの頃はみんな餓鬼で、バカだった。あの<tips=1>リョウ</tips>だってそうさ。でもそれはそれ、これはこれ。今は今で最高に楽しいよ。<tips=55>松坊</tips>はどうだい？」","en":"“Of course I do. We were all stupid kids back then—even <tips=1>Ryo</tips>. But that was then, and this is now. I’m having the time of my life these days too. How about you, <tips=55>Matsu</tips>?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫","displayName":"Michio Mido","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r256","rowIndex":256,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そうやって素直に言えるのは<tips=10>見土</tips>さんの良いところです。<tips=1>リョウ</tips>さんならばこうシンプルにはいかないところでしょう。","en":"That kind of unaffected honesty was one of <tips=10>Michio’s</tips> finest qualities. With <tips=1>Ryo</tips>, nothing was ever quite so simple.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r257","rowIndex":257,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「私も、思っていたより悪くはないですね。最近はこの施設にも色々あって、ちょっと忙しかったですけど」","en":"“Things haven’t been as bad as I expected for me, either. There’s been rather a lot going on at the facility lately, so I have been a little busy.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r258","rowIndex":258,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうだろうねえ。こういうところは、日々何かがありそうだ」","en":"“I can imagine. At a place like this, there must be something happening every single day.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫","displayName":"Michio Mido","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r259","rowIndex":259,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=10>見土</tips>さんはうんうんと頷いてみせる。","en":"<tips=10>Michio</tips> nodded several times.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r260","rowIndex":260,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうですね……あ、でも、今日は<tips=10>見土</tips>さんが来てくれて、良かったです」","en":"“Yes... Oh, but I’m glad you came today, <tips=10>Michio</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r261","rowIndex":261,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「え、何で？」","en":"“Why?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫","displayName":"Michio Mido","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r262","rowIndex":262,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「さっきお茶を運んでくれた、ハシモトさんのことです」","en":"“I mean Hashimoto—the woman who brought us the tea a moment ago.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r263","rowIndex":263,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「彼女が？」","en":"“Her?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫","displayName":"Michio Mido","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r264","rowIndex":264,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうです」","en":"“Yes.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r265","rowIndex":265,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は頷いて、","en":"I nodded.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r266","rowIndex":266,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ちょっといろいろあって、彼女しばらくお休みしてたんです。それで、みんなもう辞めちゃうんじゃないかって噂をしていたんですが、今はもう元通り元気になって」","en":"“She went through a few things and took some time off work. Everyone was starting to whisper that she might quit altogether, but now she’s back to her old cheerful self.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r267","rowIndex":267,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=73>リュウカ</tips>さんの家を訪ねてから、ハシモトさんは一週間無断で仕事を休みました。","en":"After visiting <tips=73>Ryuka’s</tips> home, Hashimoto missed an entire week of work without notifying anyone.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r268","rowIndex":268,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　仕方がないことだと、誰も責めるつもりはなかったと思いますが、これだけの無断欠席となれば放っておくわけにも行きません。","en":"I do not think any of us intended to blame her—we all understood—but an absence that long without word could not simply be ignored.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r269","rowIndex":269,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　主任が様子を聞くつもりで電話をかけると、ハシモトさんは消え入りそうな声で明日出社すると答えました。","en":"When the supervisor called to see how she was, Hashimoto answered in a voice that was barely there and said she would come to work the next day.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r270","rowIndex":270,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　言葉通り彼女は翌日現れたのですが、一目でそうとわかるくらい痩せて、目の下には真っ赤なくまが出来ていました。","en":"True to her word, she appeared the next day, but she had grown so thin that anyone could see it at a glance, and angry red circles had formed beneath her eyes.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r271","rowIndex":271,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　生気というものがまったくなく、唇もカサカサに乾いており、その間から出て来る声は目の前にいる相手にも聞き取れないほどボソボソとした小さなものでした。","en":"There was no life in her at all. Her lips were dry and cracked, and the low mumble that emerged from between them was too faint for even the person standing directly in front of her to make out.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r272","rowIndex":272,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　あまりにもひどい姿で、彼女を出迎えたみなは退職するとでも言うつもりなのかと思い込んでしまったのですが、彼女が口にしていたのはそうではなく、","en":"She looked so wretched that everyone there to welcome her back became convinced she had come to announce her resignation. But that was not what she said.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r273","rowIndex":273,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「無断欠勤してすみませんでした。よろしければ、これからも、ここで働かせてください」","en":"“I’m sorry I was absent without notice. If you’ll allow it, I would like to continue working here.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r274","rowIndex":274,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　という謝罪の言葉でした。","en":"Instead, she offered those words of apology.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r275","rowIndex":275,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それ以降彼女は以前よりも熱心に働いています。以前はどちらかというと、見ていないところで手を抜いたり、いい加減な仕事をするタイプだったのですが、人が変わったようでした。","en":"From that day onward, she worked with greater dedication than before. Previously, she had been the sort to cut corners when no one was watching and perform some tasks carelessly, but now she seemed a different person.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r276","rowIndex":276,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　まるで、<tips=73>リュウカ</tips>さんがいなくなって開いた穴を自分で埋めようとしているかのような働きぶりに、かえってまわりが心配するほどなのです。","en":"She worked as though determined to fill by herself the hole left by <tips=73>Ryuka’s</tips> absence—so hard that the people around her only worried more.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r277","rowIndex":277,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして日が経つにつれて、態度も明るくなり、一見すると以前とかわらないように見えたのですが、みなその笑顔にうつろなものを感じて、かえって心配をしていたのです。そして私の知る限り、復帰してから一度も『<tips=73>リュウカ</tips>』という名を、彼女が口にしたことはありません。","en":"As the days went by, her manner brightened, and at first glance she seemed just as she had before. Yet everyone sensed something hollow in her smile and worried all the more. And as far as I knew, not once since returning had she spoken the name <tips=73>Ryuka</tips> aloud.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r278","rowIndex":278,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　やっぱり、ずっと引きずってはいるんです。","en":"She still had not moved past it after all.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r279","rowIndex":279,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それが今日は、いつもより少し自然な態度で<tips=10>見土</tips>さんと接していました。","en":"Yet that day, she had behaved a little more naturally than usual with <tips=10>Michio</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r280","rowIndex":280,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「だから良かったなあと思って」","en":"“That’s why I thought it was a good thing you came.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r281","rowIndex":281,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そりゃ光栄だね。おれなんか別に何にもしてないとは思うけれども、誰かが元気を取り戻すのに役立てたのなら嬉しいことだ」","en":"“Then I’m honored. I don’t think I did anything in particular, but if I helped someone recover her spirits, that makes me happy.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫","displayName":"Michio Mido","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r282","rowIndex":282,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=10>見土</tips>さんはうんと頷きます。","en":"<tips=10>Michio</tips> nodded firmly.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r283","rowIndex":283,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「この街ではいろんなことがある。それこそ、心が折れそうになることも。……でも、そういうときにくじけずに明るく乗り越えるところを見ると、ああ、この世の中っていうのは、なんとも素晴らしいところなんだなあって実感するよね。それを思うと、理不尽な不幸も愛せそうな気がしてくるから不思議だ。<tips=55>松坊</tips>もそう思わないか？」","en":"“All sorts of things happen in this city—things that can come close to breaking a person’s spirit. ...But when I see someone refuse to be crushed and come through it smiling, it brings home to me what an extraordinary place this world is. And then, strangely enough, I almost feel I could love even its senseless tragedies. Don’t you ever feel that way, <tips=55>Matsu</tips>?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫","displayName":"Michio Mido","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r284","rowIndex":284,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「私は、理不尽なことなんかないほうがいいですけど……」","en":"“I would prefer a world without anything so senseless...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r285","rowIndex":285,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私が苦い顔をして肩をすくめると、<tips=10>見土</tips>さんは笑いました。","en":"I pulled a bitter face and shrugged, making <tips=10>Michio</tips> laugh.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r286","rowIndex":286,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そういえばさ、<tips=55>松坊</tips>に一つ聞きたいんだが」","en":"“That reminds me, <tips=55>Matsu</tips>. There’s something I wanted to ask you.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫","displayName":"Michio Mido","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r287","rowIndex":287,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「えっ、なんですか？」","en":"“Oh? What is it?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r288","rowIndex":288,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「最近、<tips=1>リョウ</tips>のやつとはどうなんだ？　うまくやって……」","en":"“How have things been with <tips=1>Ryo</tips> lately? Are you getting along—”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫","displayName":"Michio Mido","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r289","rowIndex":289,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「みっ<tips=10>見土</tips>さん、ここではその話は……」","en":"“M-<tips=10>Michio</tips>, we can’t talk about that here...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r290","rowIndex":290,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私はあわてて遮りました。","en":"I cut him off in a panic.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r291","rowIndex":291,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　この部屋では、職員たちが何人かデスクワークをしています。","en":"Several other staff members were working at their desks in the same room.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r292","rowIndex":292,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼らは向こうのシマで、広い事務室のなかで私たちとの距離はあるのですけれども、おなじ空間を共有しているから、この会話を聞こうと思えば聞こえてしまうんです。","en":"They occupied another island of desks some distance away across the large office. But we were still sharing the same room; if they chose to listen, they could hear every word.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r293","rowIndex":293,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　もし彼らが見た目通り目の前の仕事に没頭していたら、こちらで話していることなど耳に入るはずもないことですし、一見するとそういう状況に見えるのですが……。","en":"If they were truly as engrossed in the work before them as they looked, our conversation should never have registered. And at first glance, they did appear to be hard at work...","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r294","rowIndex":294,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　普段は、こんな風に静かな事務室ではないのです。職員同士が雑談して、笑い声などが絶えない場所なのです。","en":"But the office was never normally this quiet. The staff were forever chatting among themselves, with laughter sounding from one corner or another.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r295","rowIndex":295,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「これ、絶対、みんな耳を澄ませています……」","en":"“They are all absolutely listening to us...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r296","rowIndex":296,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私が小声で言うと、","en":"I whispered.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r297","rowIndex":297,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうだね」","en":"“It seems so.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫","displayName":"Michio Mido","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r298","rowIndex":298,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=10>見土</tips>さんも苦笑しながら頷きます。","en":"<tips=10>Michio</tips> nodded with a rueful smile.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r299","rowIndex":299,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「みんなそういう話に飢えてますから……じゃ、じゃあ向こうの部屋に……」","en":"“They’re all starved for gossip like this... S-so let’s go into the other room...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r300","rowIndex":300,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私が出口の方を指さすと、<tips=10>見土</tips>さんはうんと頷きました。","en":"I pointed toward the exit, and <tips=10>Michio</tips> nodded.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r301","rowIndex":301,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そしてそれぞれ自分の茶を持って、ゆっくりと席を離れます。静寂のなか、ガラリと引き戸をあけ、そして出て行く自分の背中に、気のせいか背後の職員たちの失望の念がじっとりと触れたような気がしました。","en":"We each took our tea and slowly rose from our seats. In the silence, I slid the door open with a rattle and left. Perhaps it was only my imagination, but I felt the disappointment of the staff behind me settling damply upon my back.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r302","rowIndex":302,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして隣の面会室に移動しました。そこは、施設に預けた子供とその親が会ったり、養子をとりにきた養父母がはじめて子供との対面を行ったりする部屋です。","en":"We moved into the visiting room next door. It was where parents met with children they had placed in the facility, and where prospective adoptive parents were introduced to a child for the first time.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r303","rowIndex":303,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　物の少ない殺風景な部屋で、狭い部屋に長椅子と長机が置かれ、そして正面にホワイトボードがあるのは、面会のないときは職員の会議室としても使っているからです。","en":"It was a cramped, cheerless room with little in it beyond a long bench, a long table, and a whiteboard on the facing wall—the staff used it as a meeting room whenever no visits were scheduled.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r304","rowIndex":304,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それじゃあ、じっくり聞かせて貰おうかな」","en":"“Well then, take your time and tell me all about it.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫","displayName":"Michio Mido","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r305","rowIndex":305,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=10>見土</tips>さんは椅子にどっしりと腰掛けて、そう言いました。","en":"With that, <tips=10>Michio</tips> planted himself solidly in a chair.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r306","rowIndex":306,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　あ、移動しなければよかった。","en":"Oh. I should never have moved us in here.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r307","rowIndex":307,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　と、その時になって私は気がつきました。まわりの職員がいることを理由に、その話を避ければ良かったんです。","en":"Only then did I realize that I could have used the other staff’s presence as an excuse to avoid the subject altogether.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r308","rowIndex":308,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　だけれども後悔先に立たず。<tips=10>見土</tips>さんはニコニコと微笑んで私を見ています。","en":"But it was too late for regrets. <tips=10>Michio</tips> sat smiling brightly at me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r309","rowIndex":309,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=1>リョウ</tips>のやつとうまく行ってないのか？　直接言いにくいことがあったら、おれがかわりに言ってやるよ」","en":"“Are things going badly with <tips=1>Ryo</tips>? If there’s anything you can’t bring yourself to tell him directly, I’ll tell him for you.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫","displayName":"Michio Mido","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r310","rowIndex":310,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いや、そういうことは特にないんです……」","en":"“No, there’s nothing in particular like that...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r311","rowIndex":311,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は別に<tips=1>リョウ</tips>さんとのことを隠しているわけではなく、むしろ逆で、友人や知人にはあまりにも簡単に立ち入ったことを話してしまうくせがあるのです。心のガードが甘い、と、よく<tips=1>リョウ</tips>さんには怒られます。","en":"It was not that I tried to hide my relationship with <tips=1>Ryo</tips>. Quite the opposite: I had a habit of telling friends and acquaintances far too many intimate details far too readily. <tips=1>Ryo</tips> often scolded me for letting my guard down so easily.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r312","rowIndex":312,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それで普通の人ならば二人の間の秘密にするようなこともうっかり喋ってしまうので、私はそれを心配していました。","en":"I was worried that I might carelessly blurt out something an ordinary person would keep secret between the two of them.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r313","rowIndex":313,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　けれども、<tips=10>見土</tips>さんは素知らぬ様子で、","en":"But <tips=10>Michio</tips> went on as if he were none the wiser.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r314","rowIndex":314,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「忙しくって、連絡したり会ったりは出来てないんじゃないか？」","en":"“You’ve both been too busy to meet or even keep in touch, haven’t you?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫","displayName":"Michio Mido","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r315","rowIndex":315,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ど、どうしてそう思うんですか？」","en":"“H-how did you know?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r316","rowIndex":316,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「さっき外で見たとき、<tips=55>松坊</tips>はすごい暗い顔してたからさ。やっぱり、寂しかったりするんだろう？　<tips=55>松坊</tips>がそういう顔してるときは、大体<tips=1>リョウ</tips>のやつと何かあった時だからな」","en":"“When I saw <tips=55>Matsu</tips> outside earlier, you looked awfully down. You’ve been lonely, haven’t you? Whenever <tips=55>Matsu</tips> makes that face, it usually means something has happened with <tips=1>Ryo</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫","displayName":"Michio Mido","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r317","rowIndex":317,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それは自分では気づかない、とても恥ずかしい個性です。","en":"It was a mortifying trait in myself that I had never even noticed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r318","rowIndex":318,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それとも、何か他の問題でもあるのか？　やっぱり、ハシモトさんと同じことで悩んでいるのか？」","en":"“Or is something else bothering you? Are you struggling with the same thing as Hashimoto?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫","displayName":"Michio Mido","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r319","rowIndex":319,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　なかなかに鋭い観察力です。","en":"His powers of observation were remarkably keen.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r320","rowIndex":320,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　全く同じではないのですが、あの<tips=73>リュウカ</tips>さんの一件が発端だという意味では間違っていません。","en":"It was not exactly the same problem, but he was right that everything had begun with the incident involving <tips=73>Ryuka</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r321","rowIndex":321,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「悩んでいるというのとはちょっと違うんです。というか、見て分かるほど落ちてますかね。私？」","en":"“I wouldn’t quite say I’m troubled. More importantly, is it really so obvious just from looking at me?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r322","rowIndex":322,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「おれの目は節穴じゃない。一目見ればわかる。……あ、そう言えば、饅頭の味どうだい？」","en":"“I’m not blind, you know. One look was enough. ...Oh, speaking of which, how’s the bun?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫","displayName":"Michio Mido","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r323","rowIndex":323,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あ、美味しいです」","en":"“Oh, it’s delicious.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r324","rowIndex":324,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼からもらった饅頭を慌てて口にして、そう答えました。","en":"I hurriedly took a bite of the bun he had given me and answered.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r325","rowIndex":325,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうだろう。悩みが吹き飛ぶ味がするはずだ」","en":"“I knew it. That flavor ought to blow all your troubles away.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫","displayName":"Michio Mido","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r326","rowIndex":326,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=10>見土</tips>さんはそう言って笑いました。","en":"<tips=10>Michio</tips> laughed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r327","rowIndex":327,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まあ、あまり考えすぎないことさ。よく食って、よく寝れば、いつのまにか答えなんか浮かんで来るものなんだから。饅頭、もう一個食べるか？」","en":"“Well, don’t think about it too hard. Eat plenty, sleep soundly, and before you know it, the answer will come to you on its own. Want another bun?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫","displayName":"Michio Mido","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r328","rowIndex":328,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私が自分の悩みを言いたくないのを察してくれたのか、彼はそう言って話題を打ち切ろうとしてくれているようでした。","en":"Perhaps he had realized that I did not want to discuss my troubles. It seemed he was tactfully offering to let the subject drop.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r329","rowIndex":329,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いえ、大丈夫です。でも、色んなことがありますね。生きていると。昔は想像もしなかったことが沢山起こります……」","en":"“No, I’m all right. But when you’re alive, all sorts of things happen, don’t they? So many things I could never have imagined before...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r330","rowIndex":330,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　気を遣ってもらったのが申し訳なく、私はうつむいてしまいました。","en":"Feeling guilty for making him handle me so considerately, I lowered my head.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r331","rowIndex":331,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうだね。この先もきっといろいろと変わってゆくよね。おれたちも、そしてこの街も……」","en":"“That’s true. And I’m sure things will go on changing from here—both us and this city...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫","displayName":"Michio Mido","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r332","rowIndex":332,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=10>見土</tips>さんは微笑を崩さないままそう言い、窓の向こうを眺めました。","en":"His smile unbroken, <tips=10>Michio</tips> gazed through the window.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r333","rowIndex":333,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　庭で、<tips=66>紺太</tips>さんとシスターが子供たちに囲まれ、ふざけて笑っているのが見えます。普段はひどく大人びて見えることもある施設の子供たちですが、こうして遊んでいるときは、みな普通の子供にしか見えません。","en":"Out in the yard, <tips=66>Konta</tips> and the sister were surrounded by children, laughing and fooling around with them. The children at the facility could sometimes seem far too grown-up for their years, but when they played like this, they looked like ordinary children and nothing more.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r334","rowIndex":334,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ほら見ろ。<tips=66>コンタ</tips>もなんだかんだで楽しんでる」","en":"“Look at that. <tips=66>Konta’s</tips> enjoying himself after all.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫","displayName":"Michio Mido","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r335","rowIndex":335,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=10>見土</tips>さんは苦笑してから人差し指で自分の鼻を擦ると、","en":"<tips=10>Michio</tips> gave a rueful smile, rubbed his nose with his index finger, and said,","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r336","rowIndex":336,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「変わったと言えば、一番変わったのは<tips=1>リョウ</tips>かもしれないな。あいつは大学生なんかになって……しかも、今度はきっと親父さんの仕事を継ぐんだろ？」","en":"“Speaking of change, <tips=1>Ryo</tips> may have changed more than anyone. He’s gone and become a university student, of all things... and next he’ll surely take over his father’s work, won’t he?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫","displayName":"Michio Mido","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r337","rowIndex":337,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして私の顔を見ますが、私はその話は聞いていません。","en":"He looked to me for confirmation, but this was the first I had heard of it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r338","rowIndex":338,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「い、いえ。そうなんですか？」","en":"“N-no. Is that true?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r339","rowIndex":339,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「本人はそういう話はしないのか？」","en":"“He hasn’t mentioned it himself?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫","displayName":"Michio Mido","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r340","rowIndex":340,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いえ、何も言っていません。でも、学校生活が楽しそうですし、昔からああいう組織がきらいだから、継がないと思いますが……」","en":"“No, he hasn’t said a word. But he seems to be enjoying university, and he has always hated organizations like that, so I don’t think he would take over...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r341","rowIndex":341,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それは<tips=55>松坊</tips>の認識が甘いな。人の心の機微というものをわかってない。それが<tips=55>松坊</tips>のいいところだが」","en":"“That’s naive of you, <tips=55>Matsu</tips>. You don’t understand the finer workings of the human heart. Then again, that’s what I like about <tips=55>Matsu</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫","displayName":"Michio Mido","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r342","rowIndex":342,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=10>見土</tips>さんは笑って言います。","en":"<tips=10>Michio</tips> said with a laugh.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r343","rowIndex":343,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は不服でした。そりゃ、私の情緒には色々と欠点はあるのですが、<tips=1>リョウ</tips>さんとはずっと一緒にいたのです。<tips=10>見土</tips>さんは親友だから色々知っているかもしれませんが、私だって<tips=1>リョウ</tips>さんのことが全然わからないわけじゃないんです。","en":"I took exception to that. Granted, my emotional faculties had their share of defects, but I had spent all these years beside <tips=1>Ryo</tips>. As his best friend, <tips=10>Michio</tips> might know a great deal about him, but that did not mean I understood nothing of <tips=1>Ryo</tips> myself.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r344","rowIndex":344,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　唇を尖らせて黙っていると、","en":"I pursed my lips and kept silent. Then—","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r345","rowIndex":345,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なあ<tips=55>松坊</tips>。あいつはな、親父さんに頼まれたらやるよ。あいつはそういうやつだ」","en":"“Listen, <tips=55>Matsu</tips>. If his father asks it of him, he’ll do it. That’s the kind of person he is.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫","displayName":"Michio Mido","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r346","rowIndex":346,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「でも、お父さんのこと、あまり好きじゃないと言っていたような……」","en":"“But I seem to remember him saying he didn’t much like his father either...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r347","rowIndex":347,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あはは、あいつは言うこととやることが全然ちがうんだ。それはわかってるだろ？」","en":"“Ah ha ha. What he says and what he does are completely different. You know that, don’t you?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫","displayName":"Michio Mido","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r348","rowIndex":348,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「確かにそうですけど……でも、言った通りやるときもありますし……」","en":"“That is true... But there are also times when he does exactly what he says...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r349","rowIndex":349,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「言った通りやるときもあるが、今回はそうじゃない」","en":"“There are times when he does exactly as he says, but this isn’t one of them.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫","displayName":"Michio Mido","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r350","rowIndex":350,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>リョウ</tips>さんの親友である<tips=10>見土</tips>さんが確信を持って言うからにはそうなのでしょうが、やっぱり、私にはぴんと来ません。<tips=10>見土</tips>さんが言うように、<tips=1>リョウ</tips>さんの心理をわかっていないのでしょう。","en":"Since <tips=10>Michio</tips>, <tips=1>Ryo’s</tips> closest friend, said it with such certainty, I supposed he must be right. Yet I still could not make sense of it. Perhaps, just as <tips=10>Michio</tips> said, I truly did not understand <tips=1>Ryo’s</tips> heart.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r351","rowIndex":351,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あいつが街の外でやりたいことがあるってのは嘘じゃないと思うよ。それでも、やつは<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>に入るね。ギャングになる。そうしたら<tips=55>松坊</tips>はどうする？」","en":"“I don’t think he was lying when he said there were things he wanted to do outside the city. Even so, he’ll join <tips=7>YS</tips>. He’ll become a gangster. When that happens, what will you do, <tips=55>Matsu</tips>?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫","displayName":"Michio Mido","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r352","rowIndex":352,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼は試すような目で私を見ます。","en":"He watched me with a probing look, as though testing my answer.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r353","rowIndex":353,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「私は、このままでいいです。ここで、ずっと子供たちの相手をして……」","en":"“I’m content as I am. I want to remain here, caring for the children...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r354","rowIndex":354,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「確かにこの仕事は素晴らしいよ。<tips=55>松坊</tips>にもあってると思う。でも、そうじゃなくてさ」","en":"“Certainly, this is wonderful work. And I think it suits you, <tips=55>Matsu</tips>. But that isn’t what I meant.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫","displayName":"Michio Mido","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r355","rowIndex":355,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=10>見土</tips>さんは苦笑して、","en":"<tips=10>Michio</tips> gave a rueful smile.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r356","rowIndex":356,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=1>リョウ</tips>はゆくゆく<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>のボスになる。あいつのことだから、自分から<tips=55>松坊</tips>をそんな世界に巻き込もうとは思わないだろう。このままだったら<tips=55>松坊</tips>は取り残されることになる。それでいいのかなと思ってさ」","en":"“Sooner or later, <tips=1>Ryo</tips> will become the boss of <tips=7>YS</tips>. Knowing him, he would never willingly drag <tips=55>Matsu</tips> into that world. But if things stay as they are, <tips=55>Matsu</tips> will be left behind. I was wondering whether you’re really content with that.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫","displayName":"Michio Mido","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r357","rowIndex":357,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「え、それは、それでいいです。というか、そもそも、<tips=1>リョウ</tips>さんが何をするかを選ぶのは、自分自身じゃないですか」","en":"“Oh. Yes, I’m fine with that. More importantly, shouldn’t <tips=1>Ryo</tips> decide for himself what he wants to do?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r358","rowIndex":358,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　言っている意味が本当にわからなくて言った私の言葉は、彼に溜息をつかせてしまったようです。","en":"I had answered that way because I truly did not understand what he meant, and my words seemed to draw a sigh from him.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r359","rowIndex":359,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「やっぱりわかってないな。何もわかってない。先が思いやられる。どうしてお前らはそうなんだ？　例えばさ、<tips=1>リョウ</tips>が大学に行くってとき、一緒に街を出ようとは誘わなかったか？」","en":"“You really don’t get it. You don’t understand a thing. I worry about where the two of you will end up. Why are you both like this? Here’s one example: when <tips=1>Ryo</tips> left for university, didn’t he ask you to leave the city with him?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫","displayName":"Michio Mido","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r360","rowIndex":360,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「誘われましたけど……」","en":"“He did, but...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r361","rowIndex":361,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「でも断ったんだろ」","en":"“But you turned him down, didn’t you?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫","displayName":"Michio Mido","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r362","rowIndex":362,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は黙って頷きました。街を出るときと、そしてつい最近帰って来たときも、断ってしまいました。","en":"I nodded silently. I had turned him down when he left the city, and again when he returned just recently.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r363","rowIndex":363,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まったく、どうして一緒にいないんだ。<tips=55>松坊</tips>も、あいつも、それを一番望んでいるはずなのに、素っ気ないよなあ。おれはね、<tips=1>リョウ</tips>が一人で街を離れて大学行くって聞いた時は耳を疑ったぞ。なんで<tips=55>松坊</tips>がついて行かないんだって」","en":"“Honestly, why aren’t the two of you together? It must be what both <tips=55>Matsu</tips> and he want most, yet you’re so maddeningly aloof about it. When I heard <tips=1>Ryo</tips> was leaving the city to attend university all by himself, I couldn’t believe my ears. Why wasn’t <tips=55>Matsu</tips> going with him?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫","displayName":"Michio Mido","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r364","rowIndex":364,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それは……私には街の外で生活する自信がなかったから……それに、まだ街にいたかったし……」","en":"“That was... because I wasn’t confident I could live outside the city... and I still wanted to stay here...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r365","rowIndex":365,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私の言葉に<tips=10>見土</tips>さんは深く溜息をつきます。","en":"<tips=10>Michio</tips> heaved a deep sigh at my answer.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r366","rowIndex":366,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「その辺が、<tips=55>松坊</tips>のマイペースなところだよなあ。まあでも、それが正しいのかもしれん。恋人について街を出て行く、なんて、おれの考えが古いんだろうなあ」","en":"“That’s <tips=55>Matsu</tips> for you—always moving at your own pace. Still, perhaps you’re right. Maybe I’m simply old-fashioned for thinking a woman ought to follow her boyfriend out of the city.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫","displayName":"Michio Mido","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r367","rowIndex":367,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=10>見土</tips>さんの言っていることには納得が出来ませんが、しかしそこには反論をしないことにしました。","en":"I still could not make sense of <tips=10>Michio’s</tips> argument, but I decided not to challenge him on that particular point.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r368","rowIndex":368,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そもそも、<tips=1>リョウ</tips>さんだって、そこまで本気で私と一緒に外に出たいわけじゃないと思いますよ」","en":"“Besides, I don’t think <tips=1>Ryo</tips> was ever all that serious about wanting me to leave the city with him.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r369","rowIndex":369,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どうして？」","en":"“Why not?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫","displayName":"Michio Mido","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r370","rowIndex":370,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「だって、やりたいことが沢山あるし。私なんか邪魔でしょう。ただ、私を可哀想だと思って、誘ってくれただけなんです。なのに真に受けておしかけたら、迷惑ですよ……」","en":"“Because he has so many things he wants to do, and I would only get in his way. He invited me because he felt sorry for me, that’s all. If I took him at his word and forced myself on him, I would be nothing but a nuisance...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r371","rowIndex":371,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「何言ってるんだ」","en":"“What are you talking about?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫","displayName":"Michio Mido","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r372","rowIndex":372,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=10>見土</tips>さんは呆れて笑います。","en":"<tips=10>Michio</tips> laughed in exasperation.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r373","rowIndex":373,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「可哀想って、別に<tips=55>松坊</tips>は可哀想じゃないだろ」","en":"“Felt sorry for you? It’s not as though there’s anything pitiful about <tips=55>Matsu</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫","displayName":"Michio Mido","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r374","rowIndex":374,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうですけど、でも<tips=1>リョウ</tips>さんはそう思ってるのかなって……だって、いつも私のこと不憫だって心配してくれますし……」","en":"“That may be true, but perhaps <tips=1>Ryo</tips> sees me that way... He is always worrying about me as though I were some poor, helpless thing...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r375","rowIndex":375,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まあ、あいつは<tips=55>松坊</tips>には過保護だけど、そうじゃないだろう。ただ来て欲しいと思って、一緒にいたいと思って、誘ったんだよ」","en":"“Well, he is overprotective of <tips=55>Matsu</tips>, but that’s not why. He asked you because he wanted you to come. He wanted to be with you.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫","displayName":"Michio Mido","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r376","rowIndex":376,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そうなのでしょうか？","en":"Could that be true?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r377","rowIndex":377,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>リョウ</tips>さんはいつも私を心配して気に掛けてくれます。でもそれは、私を作り出した責任を感じているからだと思うのです。","en":"<tips=1>Ryo</tips> was always worrying about me and looking out for me. But I believed that was because he felt responsible for creating me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r378","rowIndex":378,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私のことは、とても貴重な研究対象であり大事な存在だと思ってくれているのは感じます。興味も持ってくれているとも思います。それは嬉しいことですし、私の心を満たしてくれます。しかし、世間一般のような――<tips=10>見土</tips>さんの言うような感情があるかと言えば、私にはちょっとわかりません。<tips=10>見土</tips>さんが言うように、私には人の心情がわからないのでしょうか？","en":"I knew he regarded me as an immensely valuable subject of study, and as someone precious to him. I knew, too, that he found me interesting. These things made me happy; they filled my heart. But whether he felt for me what people ordinarily feel—what <tips=10>Michio</tips> meant—I simply could not say. Was <tips=10>Michio</tips> right? Was I incapable of understanding another person’s heart?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r379","rowIndex":379,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まったく、いやになるねえ」","en":"“Honestly, I don’t know what to do with you.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫","displayName":"Michio Mido","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r380","rowIndex":380,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=10>見土</tips>さんは溜息をつきます。","en":"<tips=10>Michio</tips> sighed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r381","rowIndex":381,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「で、でも、仕方ないんですよ」","en":"“B-but there’s nothing I can do about that.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r382","rowIndex":382,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「じゃあさ、たとえば、<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>に行くから一緒に<tips=41>グランドタワー</tips>で暮らさないかと言って来たら、どうする？　街の外に出るわけじゃないぞ」","en":"“Then suppose he said, ‘I’m joining <tips=7>YS</tips>, so why don’t we live together in <tips=41>Grand Tower</tips>?’ What would you do? You wouldn’t be leaving the city.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫","displayName":"Michio Mido","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r383","rowIndex":383,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そ、それは、<tips=1>リョウ</tips>さんがどうしても来てくれと言ったら……」","en":"“I-if <tips=1>Ryo</tips> said he absolutely needed me to come, then...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r384","rowIndex":384,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうじゃなくて、お前さんの気持ちを聞いているんだよ。<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>の人間となっても<tips=1>リョウ</tips>の傍にいられるのか。そうでないか。いや、そもそもどういう気持ちでやつのことを想っているのか」","en":"“That’s not what I’m asking. I want to know how you feel. Can you stay at <tips=1>Ryo’s</tips> side even if it means becoming part of <tips=7>YS’s</tips> world, or can’t you? No—what do you feel for him in the first place?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫","displayName":"Michio Mido","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r385","rowIndex":385,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　言われて、戸惑いました。","en":"The question left me at a loss.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r386","rowIndex":386,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私にはどんな気持ちがあるのか？　そんなことは、考えたことがありません。","en":"What did I feel? I had never given the question any thought.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r387","rowIndex":387,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　自分を客観的に見る力がないのでしょうか。それとも気持ち自体がないのでしょうか。その時その時、いやなものを避けて、なんとなく明るく楽しい方へ向かおうという程度の考えしかありません。","en":"Perhaps I lacked the ability to see myself objectively. Or perhaps the feelings themselves simply were not there. From moment to moment, my thoughts extended no further than avoiding whatever seemed unpleasant and turning vaguely toward whatever seemed brighter and happier.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r388","rowIndex":388,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　いや、気持ちだけではありません。そもそも、私は、自分が何者かもわからないのです。","en":"No—it was not merely my feelings. To begin with, I did not even know what I was.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r389","rowIndex":389,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　世間では汐家の娘ということになっていますが、それは嘘です。","en":"As far as the world was concerned, I was a daughter of the Shio family. But that was a lie.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r390","rowIndex":390,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　じゃあ何だと言われても、ゴミ捨て場に捨てられたよくわからない肉の塊だとしか言えません。","en":"And if anyone asked what I was instead, all I could say was that I was some inexplicable lump of flesh thrown away in a garbage dump.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r391","rowIndex":391,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　なんでこんな不思議な身体なのか。そこにはなにか理由があるのか、ないのか。","en":"Why did I possess such a strange body? Was there some reason for it—or none at all?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r392","rowIndex":392,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なんだか、むつかしいです。でも<tips=1>リョウ</tips>さんが楽しく、やりたいことをやっているのなら、私も幸せです」","en":"“It’s all so difficult. But if <tips=1>Ryo</tips> is happy, doing what he wants to do, then that makes me happy too.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r393","rowIndex":393,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうか。まあそれならそれでいいが、もし一緒にいたいと思ったら、素直にそう伝えるんだぞ」","en":"“I see. Well, that’s fine, then. But if you ever find that you want to be with him, be honest and tell him so.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫","displayName":"Michio Mido","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r394","rowIndex":394,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「はい、もしそういうことがありましたら」","en":"“All right. If I ever feel that way.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r395","rowIndex":395,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……まったく、<tips=55>松坊</tips>と<tips=1>リョウ</tips>は全然違うようで、とてもそっくりなような気もして、かと思えばやっぱり違うような、不思議な関係だな」","en":"“...Honestly, <tips=55>Matsu</tips> and <tips=1>Ryo</tips> seem completely different and yet very much alike—and then again, completely different after all. What a strange relationship.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫","displayName":"Michio Mido","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r396","rowIndex":396,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=10>見土</tips>さんはまた溜息をつきます。今日は彼に何度も溜息をつかせてしまっているようで、申し訳ないです。","en":"<tips=10>Michio</tips> sighed again. I seemed to have made him sigh an extraordinary number of times that day, and I felt rather guilty about it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r397","rowIndex":397,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「おまえたちは、頭はいいんだけど、ちょっと何かが欠けてる。いや、そうじゃなくて過剰なのかな？　純粋だとも言える。もっとも、おれはそういうところが気にいってるんだけどね」","en":"“You’re both intelligent, but there’s something missing in each of you. No, perhaps nothing is missing—perhaps there’s too much of something instead. You might call it purity. Not that I dislike that about you.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫","displayName":"Michio Mido","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r398","rowIndex":398,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=10>見土</tips>さんは笑いました。","en":"<tips=10>Michio</tips> smiled.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r399","rowIndex":399,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あの、<tips=10>見土</tips>さん？」","en":"“Um, <tips=10>Michio</tips>?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r400","rowIndex":400,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私はおずおずと訊ねる。","en":"I asked timidly.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r401","rowIndex":401,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なんだい」","en":"“What is it?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫","displayName":"Michio Mido","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r402","rowIndex":402,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=10>見土</tips>さんは、自分のことがわかりますか？」","en":"“Do you understand yourself, <tips=10>Michio</tips>?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r403","rowIndex":403,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「自分のこと？」","en":"“Myself?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫","displayName":"Michio Mido","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r404","rowIndex":404,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「自分がどういう人間で、何を目的にしていて、その時どんな気持ちなのか……わかるものなのですか？」","en":"“Can a person know what kind of person he is, what purpose he lives for, and what he is feeling at any given moment?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r405","rowIndex":405,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「わかるね。もちろんさ」","en":"“I do. Of course.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫","displayName":"Michio Mido","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r406","rowIndex":406,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=10>見土</tips>さんは頷きました。","en":"<tips=10>Michio</tips> nodded.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r407","rowIndex":407,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「おれは、気持ちのいいことがしたいのさ。自分の周りのみんなが幸せになって、楽しそうにしているところを見たいんだよ。苦しみで泣く子供や母親なんかは見たくないね。だから、見たくない悲しいことをなくすために、こうして饅頭を作っているのさ」","en":"“I want to do things that make people feel good. I want to see everyone around me happy, enjoying themselves. I don’t want to see children or mothers crying in pain. So I make buns, hoping to do away with the sadness I cannot bear to look at.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫","displayName":"Michio Mido","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r408","rowIndex":408,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうですか」","en":"“I see.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r409","rowIndex":409,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　饅頭を作ったら悲しみがなくなるという理屈はよく理解出来ませんでしたが、言いたいことはなんとなくわかりました。","en":"I did not quite understand the logic by which making buns would make sorrow disappear, but I more or less understood what he meant.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r410","rowIndex":410,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「でも、<tips=10>見土</tips>さんは、お父さんやお母さんのことは知らなくて、だから自分のことはわからないですよね。それに、お饅頭屋さんといっても、将来は<tips=21>八龍会</tips>の幹部になるという、しっかりした立場もありますし……」","en":"“But you don’t know anything about your father or mother, <tips=10>Michio</tips>, so how can you know yourself? And even if you call yourself a bun seller, you already have another place laid out for you: one day, you’re expected to become an officer of the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips>...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r411","rowIndex":411,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「おかしなことを言うなあ」","en":"“What a strange thing to say.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫","displayName":"Michio Mido","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r412","rowIndex":412,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=10>見土</tips>さんは奇妙な顔をして、","en":"<tips=10>Michio</tips> gave me a puzzled look and said,","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r413","rowIndex":413,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「親のことなんか知らなくたって、自分のことくらいわかるさ。なあ<tips=55>松坊</tips>、親の正体がなんだったとしても、ここにいるおれの何か変わるわけじゃない。どういう因縁や背景があったって、ここにいるおれがすべてさ。<tips=55>松坊</tips>はお母さんがいないことを気にしてるのかもしれないが、そんなの悩まなくていいことなんだぜ？」","en":"“I can know myself perfectly well without knowing a thing about my parents. Listen, <tips=55>Matsu</tips>. Whatever my parents may have been, it changes nothing about the man standing here now. Whatever fate or history may lie behind me, the self standing here is everything I am. Perhaps not having a mother weighs on you, <tips=55>Matsu</tips>, but it is nothing you need to torment yourself over.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫","displayName":"Michio Mido","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r414","rowIndex":414,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「は、はい。そうですね……」","en":"“Y-yes. I suppose not...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r415","rowIndex":415,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あと、<tips=21>八龍会</tips>の幹部になるとか、そんな話は断固拒否する！　そりゃ、爺さんたちに恩はあるから手伝いはするけれど、深入りはしない。<tips=17>タイプB</tips>のために何かをするのは大事なことだが、<tips=17>タイプB</tips>だけを優先するクラブの考え方はおれにはあわない。この街では<tips=17>タイプＢ</tips>だけが苦しんでるわけじゃない。そもそもおれは、<tips=17>タイプB</tips>とノーマルで分かれるとか、ピンとこないんだよなあ。世の中には人それぞれ色んな個性があるけど、<tips=17>タイプＢ</tips>かどうかなんて、そのうち一つでしかないじゃんか。大げさに気にしすぎなんだよ。<tips=55>松坊</tips>も<tips=17>タイプB</tips>だけど、ノーマルに対して何か考えたりする？」","en":"“And as for becoming an officer of the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips>, I categorically refuse! I owe the old men a great deal, so I’ll lend them a hand, but I won’t let myself get pulled in too deep. Working for <tips=17>Type Bs</tips> matters, but I can’t agree with a society that puts <tips=17>Type Bs</tips> ahead of everyone else. <tips=17>Type Bs</tips> aren’t the only people suffering in this city. To begin with, I’ve never understood this division between <tips=17>Type B</tips> and Normal. Every person in this world has countless different traits. Whether someone is a <tips=17>Type B</tips> is only one of them. People make far too much of it. <tips=55>Matsu</tips> is a <tips=17>Type B</tips> too. Do you ever find yourself thinking anything in particular about Normals?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫","displayName":"Michio Mido","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r416","rowIndex":416,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……私はそういうこと、あんまり。他の<tips=17>タイプＢ</tips>の人とも違いますし」","en":"“...I don’t really think about things that way. And I’m different from other <tips=17>Type Bs</tips> myself.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r417","rowIndex":417,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　こうして他人と話していると、いつも、自分の考えが浅いのが恥ずかしくなってしまいます。","en":"Whenever I spoke with other people this way, I grew ashamed of how shallow my own thinking was.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r418","rowIndex":418,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ま、おれの頭のなかはこの『<tips=71>グレートホール饅頭</tips>』を売ることで一杯なんだ。だからそんな生臭いことは考えたくもないね。少なくとも今はさ」","en":"“Well, my head is full of selling these <tips=71>Great Hole Buns</tips>. I don’t want to think about anything so political and worldly. Not for now, at least.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫","displayName":"Michio Mido","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r419","rowIndex":419,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いまは」","en":"“For now?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r420","rowIndex":420,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まあ、先のことは分からないよ。おれはまだ発症していないし、もしかしたらそれを体験したら考え方が変わってしまうこともあるのかもしれない。変わらないって思いたいが……発症したやつを何人も見てるから、自信がないな。おれも別人になるのかねえ」","en":"“Well, no one knows what lies ahead. I haven’t had my onset yet. Perhaps once I experience it, my whole way of thinking will change. I want to believe it won’t... but I’ve seen it happen to too many people to feel sure. I wonder whether I’ll become someone else as well.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫","displayName":"Michio Mido","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r421","rowIndex":421,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=10>見土</tips>は冗談めかして笑ったが、その目はどこか寂しそうに見えた。","en":"<tips=10>Michio</tips> laughed as though it were a joke, but there was something lonely in his eyes.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r422","rowIndex":422,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ま、今のままだったら、発症する前に、饅頭の食い過ぎで糖尿病になっちまうだろうけどね。<tips=55>松坊</tips>もあんまり考えすぎるなよ。自分に正直になるんだ。そうすりゃ、こんなところで油売ってないで、<tips=1>リョウ</tips>のところへ駆け出したくなるはずさ」","en":"“Still, at this rate, I’ll probably give myself diabetes eating too many buns before my onset ever comes. Don’t overthink everything, <tips=55>Matsu</tips>. Be honest with yourself. Do that, and instead of sitting around here shooting the breeze, you’ll find yourself wanting to run straight to <tips=1>Ryo</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫","displayName":"Michio Mido","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r423","rowIndex":423,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は考えすぎているのでしょうか？　とんでもないという気がします。","en":"Was I truly overthinking things? That seemed altogether impossible.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r424","rowIndex":424,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「私は自分が何ものだかわからないんです。わかったら、<tips=10>見土</tips>さんの言うようになるんでしょうか？　そして、<tips=1>リョウ</tips>さんの心情もよく理解出来るようになるんでしょうか？」","en":"“I don’t know what I am. If I found out, would I become as you say, <tips=10>Michio</tips>? Would I also learn to understand <tips=1>Ryo’s</tips> heart?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r425","rowIndex":425,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうとも。そうすれば全部わかる。そして自分のなかに眠る、真実の愛に気がつくはずだ」","en":"“Absolutely. Then you’ll understand everything, and discover the true love lying dormant within you.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫","displayName":"Michio Mido","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r426","rowIndex":426,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「真実の愛……」","en":"“True love...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r427","rowIndex":427,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　考え込んでしまうと、","en":"I began to contemplate the idea in earnest.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r428","rowIndex":428,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あははっ、その、ヘンに真面目に考えるのがダメだって言ってるんだ。こんなの適当な冗談なんだから、ただ笑ってればいいんだよ」","en":"“Ha ha ha! That’s exactly what I mean—you take things far too seriously in the strangest ways. It was just a silly joke. You were only supposed to laugh.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫","displayName":"Michio Mido","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r429","rowIndex":429,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=10>見土</tips>さんは立ち上がると窓を開け、そして<tips=66>紺太</tips>さんに声をかけると、","en":"<tips=10>Michio</tips> rose, opened the window, and called to <tips=66>Konta</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r430","rowIndex":430,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いやー、青春だねえ。<tips=55>松坊</tips>」","en":"“Ah, young love! Isn’t youth wonderful, <tips=55>Matsu</tips>?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫","displayName":"Michio Mido","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r431","rowIndex":431,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そんな風に笑いながら、ドアを開けて部屋を出て行くのでした。","en":"Still laughing, he opened the door and walked out of the room.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r432","rowIndex":432,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼が去ったあと、私はぼうっとしてしまい、ハシモトさんが部屋に入ってくるまでそんな自分に気づくことさえ出来ませんでした。","en":"After he left, I sat there in a daze, not even aware of my own condition until Hashimoto came into the room.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r433","rowIndex":433,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どうしたの？　告白でもされたの？」","en":"“What’s wrong? Did he confess his love or something?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ハシモト","displayName":"Hashimoto","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r434","rowIndex":434,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ハシモトさんがそうからかうのを笑って受け流し、私も部屋を出て、そして家へ帰ることにしました。","en":"I laughed off Hashimoto’s teasing, then left the room and headed home.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r435","rowIndex":435,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　外に出ると、空はこの地方特有のどんより曇った灰色をしています。","en":"Outside, the sky was overcast, a dull gray peculiar to this region.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r436","rowIndex":436,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　空気はじめじめと湿っぽく、どこかの家庭から流れ出た香辛料の匂いがします。そして、何かを炒める音、布団を叩く音、赤ん坊がぐずつく声——様々な生活音が、<tips=9>Y地区</tips>の住宅街にはいつもあふれています。","en":"The air was warm with clinging damp, and carried the scent of spices drifting from some nearby home. Food sizzling in a pan, a futon being beaten, an infant fussing—sounds of life in all its variety forever filled the residential streets of <tips=9>Y District</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r437","rowIndex":437,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ここにいる自分が全てだ、と言った<tips=10>見土</tips>さんの言葉が思い出されます。","en":"I remembered <tips=10>Michio’s</tips> words: the self standing here was everything he was.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r438","rowIndex":438,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そうなのかもしれません。私の正体が何者であろうとも、この<tips=9>Y地区</tips>に満ちたいろんな光景や臭いや音が、私の精神を作り上げたのでしょう。","en":"Perhaps he was right. Whatever my true identity might be, all the sights and smells and sounds that filled <tips=9>Y District</tips> had surely made my spirit what it was.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r439","rowIndex":439,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　でも、そうだとしても私は、どうしても自分の正体を知らなくてはいけないと、思ったのです。","en":"But even if that were so, I felt that I still had to discover my true identity.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:G3:r440","rowIndex":440,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そうでなければ、スタートラインにも立てないような気がしていたのです。","en":"Without that knowledge, I felt I could not even reach the starting line.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}}]},{"position":39,"code":"E5","unitId":"E5","rows":[{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r1","rowIndex":1,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　夜の診察室で<tips=5>太刀川</tips>医師と出会った次の日のことだ。","en":"This was the day after my nighttime encounter with Dr. <tips=5>Tachikawa</tips> in the examination room.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r2","rowIndex":2,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「もう少しここに居てもいいんですよ？」","en":"“You could stay here a little longer, you know.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ハシモト","displayName":"Hashimoto","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r3","rowIndex":3,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　身のまわりの荷物をまとめていると、職員のハシモトがそう話しかけて来た。","en":"Hashimoto, one of the staff, spoke to me as I gathered my belongings.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r4","rowIndex":4,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　このハシモトという女は、<tips=55>汐</tips>と一緒に<tips=73>リュウカ</tips>の家を訪ねた人物で、警察に通報したのも彼女だ。","en":"This woman, Hashimoto, was the person who visited <tips=73>Ryuka’s</tips> house with <tips=55>Shio</tips>; she was also the one who called the police.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r5","rowIndex":5,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私がこの施設に転がり込めたのは、つくづく幸運だと思う。この強力な肉体を手に入れただけでなく、事件の目撃者と会うことが出来たのだから。","en":"I can only marvel at my good fortune in landing at this facility. Not only did I acquire this powerful body, I was also able to meet a witness to the case.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r6","rowIndex":6,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ハシモトには直接事件のことは聞いていないが、<tips=73>リュウカ</tips>についての話は聞くことが出来た。","en":"I had not questioned Hashimoto directly about the case, but I had gotten her to tell me about <tips=73>Ryuka</tips> herself.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r7","rowIndex":7,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　直接事件の解決に結びつく情報ではないが、被害者の人柄を知れば、事件への怒りはさらに強いものになる。","en":"The information would not lead directly to solving the case, but knowing what the victim was like only sharpened my anger over what had happened.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r8","rowIndex":8,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「すぐ出ていかなくたっていいじゃないですか。まだ病み上がりなんですから」","en":"“You don’t have to leave so soon, do you? You’ve only just recovered.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ハシモト","displayName":"Hashimoto","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r9","rowIndex":9,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そういうわけにはいかない。長居しすぎたくらいだ」","en":"“That won’t do. I’ve stayed too long already.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r10","rowIndex":10,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は今日<tips=55>汐</tips>と共に<tips=31>エリー・ホワイト</tips>を訪ねたら、そのままここには帰って来ないつもりだった。","en":"I intended to visit <tips=31>Ellie White</tips> with <tips=55>Shio</tips> that day, then leave without returning here.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r11","rowIndex":11,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　職員がみな親切で、子供たちの面倒を見ていると気が紛れる部分もあったので居心地が良く、つい長居をしてしまった。","en":"Every member of staff had been kind. Looking after the children helped distract me, and the place was comfortable enough that I had remained longer than intended.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r12","rowIndex":12,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しかし、<tips=55>汐</tips>からはもう情報を聞き終わっているし、昨夜<tips=5>太刀川</tips>にも会うことが出来た。これ以上ここにいる必要はない。むしろ一刻も早く立ち去るべきだろう。万一、私がまだ生きていてここに居ることを<tips=86>灰上</tips>や<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>に嗅ぎつけられたら、襲撃にやって来るかもしれない。可能性は少ないだろうが、確率はゼロではないのだ。そしてその結果子供や職員が巻き添えになるようなことは、絶対にあってはならないことだった。","en":"By now, however, I had heard all the information <tips=55>Shio</tips> had to give, and had also managed to meet <tips=5>Tachikawa</tips> the previous night. I had no reason to remain. If anything, I ought to leave at once. Should <tips=86>the Haigamis</tips> or <tips=20>Koschei</tips> discover that I was alive and staying here, they might come to attack. The odds were low, but not zero. Under no circumstances could I allow the children or staff to be caught in the attack.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r13","rowIndex":13,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いっそのこと、ここに就職しちゃえば良いのに。大歓迎ですよ。子供も喜ぶし、力仕事のときとかも大助かりですもの」","en":"“Why don’t you simply take a job here? We’d be delighted to have you. The children would love it, and you’re an enormous help whenever there’s heavy work to do.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ハシモト","displayName":"Hashimoto","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r14","rowIndex":14,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　自分がどうしてここに来たのか、今どういう状況になるのか、本当のことは<tips=55>汐</tips>にしか話していない。","en":"I had told only <tips=55>Shio</tips> the truth about why I had come here and the situation in which I now found myself.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r15","rowIndex":15,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　表向きには金銭トラブルでアパートを追い出され、行き場をなくしたということになっている。こんな不審な理由を語る人間をこれだけの時間住まわせてくれたのはありがいことだ。いくら感謝をしてもしきれない。","en":"Officially, financial trouble had cost me my apartment and left me with nowhere to go. I could only be grateful that they had allowed a man with such a suspicious story to live here for so long. No amount of thanks would ever be enough.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r16","rowIndex":16,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それもいいかもしれないが」","en":"“That might not be a bad idea, but...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r17","rowIndex":17,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それは本心からそう思う。","en":"I meant it sincerely.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r18","rowIndex":18,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ここは毎日賑やかで、活発すぎる子供たちは毎日なにかしらトラブルを起こす。職員たちは彼らに誠実に向き合って惜しみない愛情を注ぎ、泣いたり笑ったり、人間たちがみな生き生きとしている。","en":"The place was lively every day, and the overactive children caused trouble of one kind or another without fail. The staff met them sincerely and lavished them with affection; everyone here laughed and cried and seemed vibrantly alive.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r19","rowIndex":19,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　このような場所に自分が馴染めるとは想像もつかなかった。事件が起こる前にこういった世界を知っていたら、ハシモトの言うようにしていたかもしれない。――いや、あの事件がなければ私自身が今のようにこの状況を感じることもなかったか。そう考えると、<tips=55>汐</tips>に拾われここに来たのは、何かの巡り合わせだったような気もする。","en":"I could never have imagined myself fitting into such a place. Had I known a world like this before the case, perhaps I might have done as Hashimoto suggested. —No. Without that case, perhaps I would never have felt this way about my circumstances. Seen that way, I could almost believe some turn of fate had led to <tips=55>Shio</tips> taking me in and bringing me here.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r20","rowIndex":20,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ここで暮らすという、それ自体は悪くないアイデアだ。","en":"The idea of living here was not bad in itself.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r21","rowIndex":21,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ただそれは、恐ろしい敵が存在せず、そして私自身にやることがなければ、の話である。","en":"But that was only if there were no terrifying enemy and I had nothing else to do.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r22","rowIndex":22,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　実際にはそうはいかない。私は復讐以外の生活を考えることは出来なかった。身体はどんな傷もすぐ治るようになったようだが、心はそうでもないらしい。毎夜悪夢を見てうなされる。起きると寝汗をかいて全身びっしょりに濡れている。","en":"Reality would not permit it. I could not imagine a life beyond revenge. My body now seemed capable of healing any wound at once, but my heart was another matter. Night after night, I was tormented by nightmares. I woke drenched from head to toe in sweat.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r23","rowIndex":23,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>を見つけ出し、殺す以外に、心には何の目的もない。毎日浴びるように飲んでいた酒も、全く飲まなくなっていた。","en":"My heart had no purpose but to find <tips=20>Koschei</tips> and kill him. I had stopped drinking altogether, though I had once drunk like a fish every day.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r24","rowIndex":24,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=50>路地</tips>さんは、ここを出たら何をするんですか？」","en":"“What will you do after you leave, <tips=50>Mr. Roji</tips>?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ハシモト","displayName":"Hashimoto","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r25","rowIndex":25,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「やりかけの仕事があってね。それを片付けなくちゃいけないんだ。待たせている人もいる」","en":"“I have unfinished work to attend to. People are waiting for me.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r26","rowIndex":26,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうですか。なんだか気になります。<tips=50>路地</tips>さんて、笑ったり冗談を言っていても、どこかかげがあるから……」","en":"“I see. I can’t help wondering about you. Even when <tips=50>you</tips> laugh or joke, there’s always a shadow somewhere...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ハシモト","displayName":"Hashimoto","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r27","rowIndex":27,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そりゃ、この街でこの年まで生きれば誰だって影を背負うことになる。……よし、こんなものだな」","en":"“Anyone who lives to my age in this city winds up with a shadow or two to carry. ...There. That should do it.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r28","rowIndex":28,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　身のまわりのものを全部集めても、スポーツバッグにまだスペースが余る。","en":"Even after I gathered everything I owned, a single sports bag held it all with room to spare.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r29","rowIndex":29,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　着替えや洗面道具を随分買い足し過ぎたようなつもりでいたし、ものがなくて不便な思いをした記憶もなかったから、もっと大荷物だと思っていたので拍子抜けだ。私は、こんなにものを必要としない人間だっただろうか。","en":"I had felt as though I had bought far too many clothes and toiletries. Nothing had been lacking enough to cause me any inconvenience, so I expected a much greater load and found the sight oddly deflating. Had I always needed so little?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r30","rowIndex":30,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「今までありがとう。ハシモトさん」","en":"“Thank you for everything, Ms. Hashimoto.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r31","rowIndex":31,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は名残惜しそうにする彼女にそう告げて、バッグを担いだ。","en":"I said my farewell to Hashimoto, who plainly hated to see me go, and hoisted the bag onto my shoulder.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r32","rowIndex":32,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　部屋を出ると事務室に行き、そこにいた職員たちに挨拶をしてから、子供たちに見つからぬよう裏口からこっそりと施設の外に出る。","en":"I left the room and went to the office. After saying goodbye to the staff there, I slipped out of the facility through the back entrance without letting the children see me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r33","rowIndex":33,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　空は曇り空で、冷たい風が吹いていたが雨が降りそうな気配ではない。","en":"The sky was overcast and a cold wind was blowing, but there was no sign of rain.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r34","rowIndex":34,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　携帯電話を見ると、<tips=55>汐</tips>からもうすぐ到着するという連絡が入っていたので、その近くの喫茶店で時間を潰した。そしてその間、私は刑事の<tips=49>三芳</tips>と連絡をとった。","en":"A message on my phone said <tips=55>Shio</tips> would arrive shortly, so I killed time at a nearby café. While I waited, I contacted Detective <tips=49>Miyoshi</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r35","rowIndex":35,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は怪我をしたあとはただ電話で治療中と伝えただけで、それ以外は警察と連携をとらず単独で行動をしていた。なぜかというと、この自分の身体に起きた変化を警察側に知られたくなかったのだ。今は手を組んでいるとは言え、彼らは私にとって信頼出来るパートナーでもない。","en":"After I was injured, I had merely called to say I was receiving treatment. I had acted alone ever since, without coordinating with the police, because I did not want them to learn what had happened to my body. Even if we were working together for the moment, they were not partners I trusted.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r36","rowIndex":36,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私の身体は切っても突いても死なない異常な再生力を得たが、おそらくその副産物として、重要な変化があった。","en":"My body had acquired an abnormal regenerative power that kept me alive even when cut or stabbed, but it had probably produced another important change as a side effect.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r37","rowIndex":37,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　今の体質になってから、<tips=16>タイプA</tips>能力抑制剤の効果がすぐに消えるようになったのである。","en":"Ever since I acquired this constitution, the effects of the <tips=16>Type A</tips> ability suppressant wore off almost immediately.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r38","rowIndex":38,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　施設に潜伏している間も、役所で書類を貰って病院に抑制剤の注射には行った。そうでなければまた逮捕されてしまうからだ。","en":"Even while hiding at the facility, I obtained the necessary paperwork from the municipal office and went to a hospital for my suppressant injections. Failing to do so would only get me arrested again.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r39","rowIndex":39,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しかし、本来なら二ヶ月は効き目があるはずのその薬が、わずか一週間あまりで効力をなくしてしまったのである。同時にアルコールや煙草の効き目もすぐに消えるようになった。","en":"Yet the drug, which should have remained effective for two months, lost its potency in little more than a week. The effects of alcohol and cigarettes had likewise begun to vanish almost at once.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r40","rowIndex":40,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　再生力があがるとともに解毒能力も向上し、薬が効きにくくなったのだと考えている。","en":"I believed the increase in my regenerative power had also enhanced my ability to purge toxins, making drugs less effective on me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r41","rowIndex":41,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　能力抑制剤が効かない、あるいは通常よりも早く効力が消えてしまうとなれば、サイキック犯罪の前科者である私に警察がどう出るかわかったものではない。","en":"If the ability suppressant ceased to work on me, or lost its potency far sooner than normal, there was no telling how the police might deal with me—a man with a prior conviction for psychic crime.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r42","rowIndex":42,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして、注射後一週間だけ我慢をすれば元通り好きなだけ能力が使えるとなれば、私にとっては警察と組むメリットがそれほど大きくはないのだ。","en":"And if all I had to do was endure one week after each injection before I could use my ability as freely as ever, I had considerably less to gain by cooperating with the police.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r43","rowIndex":43,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　だから警察とは距離を置いていたのだが、もう二ヶ月が過ぎ、通常の回復力でも傷が治っていそうな時間が過ぎた。","en":"That was why I had kept my distance from the police. Two months had passed now, however—enough time for my injuries to have healed even at an ordinary rate.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r44","rowIndex":44,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　これなら、<tips=49>三芳</tips>と会っても異常を気づかれはしないだろうと思い、電話をかけたのである。","en":"I decided I could meet <tips=49>Miyoshi</tips> without her noticing anything abnormal, and so I called her.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r45","rowIndex":45,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「本格的に捜査に復帰しようと思う。新しい情報もいくつか入手している」","en":"“I’m ready to return to the investigation in earnest. I’ve obtained several new pieces of information too.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r46","rowIndex":46,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"『それは有り難いです。もう身体は大丈夫なのですか？』","en":"“That is very welcome news. Have you fully recovered?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r47","rowIndex":47,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ああ。それより、また新しい死体が見つかっているようだが、捜査状況はどうなってる？」","en":"“Yeah. More importantly, it looks like another body has turned up. How’s the investigation going?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r48","rowIndex":48,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"『それは……』","en":"“Well...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r49","rowIndex":49,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　電話の向こうの<tips=49>三芳</tips>は口ごもる。","en":"<tips=49>Miyoshi</tips> faltered on the other end of the telephone.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r50","rowIndex":50,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どうした？」","en":"“What happened?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r51","rowIndex":51,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"『有力な手がかりは得られていません……。それどころか、なかなか捜査の協力が得られない状態で……』","en":"“We have not found any promising leads... In fact, we have barely been able to secure anyone’s cooperation with the investigation...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r52","rowIndex":52,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女は言葉を濁したが、状況は容易に想像が出来た。警察に非協力的な住民ばかりで、情報が集まらないのだろう。","en":"She chose her words carefully, but the situation was easy enough to imagine. The district was full of residents unwilling to cooperate with the police, so the investigators could gather no information.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r53","rowIndex":53,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"『捜査員を増員するという話も出ていますが、今の時点でもかなりの人数が動いているんですよ。それでも、まるで収穫がないんです。やっぱり、<tips=48>堂島</tips>刑事のような特殊能力を持った捜査官を呼ばないといけないのかもしれないですね……。ただああいった捜査員は非常に限られていて……』","en":"“There has been talk of assigning more investigators, but we already have a considerable number working the case. Even so, we have nothing at all to show for it. Perhaps we truly do need to call in an investigator with an unusual ability, someone like <tips=48>Detective Dojima</tips>... But there are very few investigators of that kind...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r54","rowIndex":54,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=49>三芳</tips>は悔しさをにじませながら言った。","en":"<tips=49>Miyoshi’s</tips> frustration seeped into her voice.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r55","rowIndex":55,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……<tips=48>堂島</tips>の旦那は能力だけで捜査していたわけじゃないがな」","en":"“...<tips=48>Dojima</tips> didn’t investigate with his ability alone.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r56","rowIndex":56,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼は普段から街を歩き住民との関係を作ったりしていたし、その他にも合法的とは言えない手段を多く用いていたのだ。","en":"He made a habit of walking the city and building relationships with its residents. He also used many methods that could hardly be called legal.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r57","rowIndex":57,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ちんぴらを脅迫したり、金をばらまいて情報を買ったり、可能なことは何でもしていた。私も探偵時代はそのような手段を使うことはあった。そうでなければ得られない情報というものがあるのだ。","en":"He threatened hoodlums, paid liberally for information, and did anything else he could. I had sometimes used the same methods in my days as a detective. Certain information could be obtained no other way.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r58","rowIndex":58,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　今の捜査員はきっとそこまではしていない。","en":"The investigators working the case now surely did not go that far.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r59","rowIndex":59,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それならば、確かにいくら人を使おうと効率が良い捜査にはならないだろう。この街には、何の得もないのに情報を話すお人好しはそう多くはない。","en":"If not, then no matter how many people they assigned, the investigation would never be efficient. In this city, few people were kindhearted enough to share information with nothing to gain.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r60","rowIndex":60,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"『確かに、私にもっと経験があれば別のかたちになっていたのかもしれませんが……』","en":"“It’s true that things might have gone differently if I had more experience, but...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r61","rowIndex":61,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「随分弱気だな。自信がないならいますぐ辞表を書いて事件からはずれてくれ。迷惑だ」","en":"“That’s remarkably timid of you. If you have no confidence, write your resignation right now and get off the case. You’re a nuisance.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r62","rowIndex":62,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"『そんな……』","en":"“But...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r63","rowIndex":63,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「何を勘違いして、おれにくだらない愚痴を垂れ流している。あんたの挫折だとか悩みだとか、そんなことはどうだって良い。こんな無駄な時間を節約出来るのなら、他の人間が来てくれた方がありがたい」","en":"“What gave you the idea you could pour out your worthless complaints to me? I couldn’t care less about your setbacks or your troubles. If bringing in someone else would spare us this waste of time, I’d be grateful.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r64","rowIndex":64,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　電話の向こうで<tips=49>三芳</tips>は絶句したようだった。","en":"<tips=49>Miyoshi</tips> seemed struck speechless on the other end of the call.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r65","rowIndex":65,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は何も言わずに相手の出方を待つ。","en":"I said nothing and waited to see what she would do.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r66","rowIndex":66,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　別に言葉ほど腹が立っているわけでもなかったが、わざと強く言って発憤を期待するというつもりでもなく、言葉通り時間の無駄だと感じただけのことだ。","en":"I was not nearly as angry as my words suggested, but neither had I spoken harshly in hopes of rousing her. I had meant exactly what I said: this was a waste of time.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r67","rowIndex":67,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"『……ただの現状報告です。不適切な内容があったかもしれませんが、愚痴として言ったわけではありません』","en":"“...I was only reporting the present situation. Some of what I said may have been inappropriate, but I did not intend it as a complaint.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r68","rowIndex":68,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それならかまわん。じゃあ、引き続き具体的な仕事の話をしよう」","en":"“Then that’s fine. Let’s get back to discussing the actual work.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r69","rowIndex":69,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"『……はい』","en":"“...Yes.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r70","rowIndex":70,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　堅い口調の<tips=49>三芳</tips>相手に自分の現在の状況や今後のスケジュールなどを話し、一通り用件が済むと電話を切り溜息をついた。","en":"I told <tips=49>Miyoshi</tips>, whose tone remained stiff, about my present situation and future schedule. Once we had covered our business, I ended the call and sighed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r71","rowIndex":71,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　警察をアテにしていたわけではないが、<tips=48>堂島</tips>の後任があのお嬢さんでは先が思いやられる。","en":"I had never counted on the police, but if that young lady was <tips=48>Dojima’s</tips> replacement, the prospects were bleak indeed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r72","rowIndex":72,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=55>汐</tips>は予告した通りの時間に現れた。","en":"<tips=55>Shio</tips> appeared at precisely the time she had promised.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r73","rowIndex":73,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　カップの底に残ったコーヒーを貧乏くさく啜っていた私は、窓の外でキョロキョロとしている彼女の姿を見つけると、すぐに精算をして外に出た。","en":"I was slurping the dregs of my coffee like a pauper when I spotted her outside the window, looking this way and that. I paid at once and went outside.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r74","rowIndex":74,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「すみません。お昼ご飯を食べた後、少し散歩をしていて」","en":"“I’m sorry. I took a short walk after lunch.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐松子","displayName":"Matsuko Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r75","rowIndex":75,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=55>汐</tips>はそう言って笑う。","en":"<tips=55>Shio</tips> smiled as she spoke.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r76","rowIndex":76,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　夜勤明けで今朝帰ったばかりなのに、疲れは見られない。","en":"She had only returned home that morning after a night shift, yet she showed no fatigue.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r77","rowIndex":77,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「昨日の夜は驚きましたね」","en":"“Last night was quite a surprise.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐松子","displayName":"Matsuko Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r78","rowIndex":78,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　まったく同感だ。","en":"I agreed completely.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r79","rowIndex":79,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　昨夜<tips=5>太刀川</tips>が語った内容は衝撃的だった。","en":"What <tips=5>Tachikawa</tips> had revealed the night before was shocking.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r80","rowIndex":80,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　かつての<tips=18>ローズ・クラブ</tips>には我々のような不死身の肉体を持った人間が何人も存在し、彼女たちはその崩壊と共に処分されていた。そして、その生き残りの一人が、この街でも謎のヴェールに包まれた存在である『<tips=31>エリー・ホワイト</tips>』だと言う。","en":"The former <tips=18>Rose Club</tips> had contained a number of women with deathless bodies like ours. When the club collapsed, those women had been disposed of—and one of the survivors was said to be <tips=31>Ellie White</tips>, a figure shrouded in mystery even within this city.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r81","rowIndex":81,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「私たちのこの体質も、やっぱり、あの『<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>』に由来してるんでしょうか？」","en":"“Do you think this strange constitution of ours ultimately comes from that ‘<tips=20>Koschei</tips>’?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐松子","displayName":"Matsuko Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r82","rowIndex":82,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「その可能性が高い。何にしろ、今日これからはっきりするだろう」","en":"“There’s a strong possibility. Whatever the truth, we should learn it today.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r83","rowIndex":83,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「全部わかるといいですね」","en":"“I hope we find out everything.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐松子","displayName":"Matsuko Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r84","rowIndex":84,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=55>汐</tips>の表情はなんだかすっきりとしていた。","en":"There was something oddly unburdened in <tips=55>Shio’s</tips> expression.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r85","rowIndex":85,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　我々の身体があの殺人鬼『<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>』と関係があるだろうということは、以前から想像はしていた。私が<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>の行った連続殺人について話したとき、彼女は暗い顔をし、それからしばらくは思い悩んでいた。","en":"We had long suspected that our bodies were somehow connected to the serial killer <tips=20>Koschei</tips>. When I told her about the murders <tips=20>Koschei</tips> had committed, her face darkened, and she brooded over it for some time afterward.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r86","rowIndex":86,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　なのに、昨夜<tips=5>太刀川</tips>の話などにより、いよいよその可能性が高いとわかった今、なぜかそれらがさっぱりと消えたようなさわやかな顔をしているのはどういうわけか。","en":"Yet now that <tips=5>Tachikawa’s</tips> account the previous night had made that possibility seem very likely, she wore a clear, bright expression, as if those worries had vanished. Why?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r87","rowIndex":87,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　なにか内心でふっきれたものがあるのだろうか？","en":"Had she come to terms with something inside herself?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r88","rowIndex":88,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女の生い立ちや境遇には同情すべきところがあるが、私も今はそれにかまっている場合ではない。","en":"There was much in her upbringing and circumstances to inspire sympathy, but I was in no position to concern myself with it now.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r89","rowIndex":89,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　雑談はせずに会話を切り上げ、<tips=31>エリー・ホワイト</tips>の家に向かって歩き始めた。","en":"I ended the conversation without indulging in small talk, and we began walking toward <tips=31>Ellie White’s</tips> house.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r90","rowIndex":90,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=55>汐</tips>さん、きみは<tips=31>エリー・ホワイト</tips>のことはどの程度知ってるかい？」","en":"“Ms. <tips=55>Shio</tips>, how much do you know about <tips=31>Ellie White</tips>?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r91","rowIndex":91,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は歩きながらそう訊ねた。","en":"I asked the question as we walked.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r92","rowIndex":92,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「名前は聞いたことがあります。<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>のえらい人だとか……」","en":"“I’ve heard the name. Someone important in <tips=7>YS</tips>, I think...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐松子","displayName":"Matsuko Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r93","rowIndex":93,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そう。<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>結成メンバーの一人で、金さえあれば武器でも爆弾でもなんでも調達する闇商人だ。<tips=9>Y地区</tips>が肉体労働者のたまり場だった頃からこの地に店を構えて商売をしている。<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>の前身である<ruby=イーシェン><tips=69>義勝</tips></ruby>や、<tips=21>八龍会</tips>の連中よりも古い」","en":"“Right. She was one of the founding members of <tips=7>YS</tips>, a black-market dealer who can procure anything from guns to bombs, provided the money is there. She has kept a shop and done business here since <tips=9>Y District</tips> was still a gathering place for manual laborers. She predates both <tips=69>Yisheng</tips>, the organization that became <tips=7>YS</tips>, and the men of the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r94","rowIndex":94,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうなんですか。じゃあ、随分年配の方なんでしょうね」","en":"“Really? Then she must be quite elderly.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐松子","displayName":"Matsuko Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r95","rowIndex":95,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そう思うだろうが、そうじゃない。<tips=31>エリー・ホワイト</tips>は限られた人間としか会わないから広く知られてはいないが、今の彼女は二代目だ。八年前に初代の婆さんが死んで、そのあと若い女が名前と立場を引き継いだ。元の名前と素性は誰も知らない。ホントかどうかは知らないが、この女と<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>の初代<tips=81>龍頭</tips><tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>は男女の仲だったという噂もある」","en":"“That is what you would think, but no. Because <tips=31>Ellie White</tips> meets with only a select few, it is not widely known that the present Ellie is the second to bear the name. The old woman who first held it died eight years ago, and a young woman inherited both her name and her position. No one knows that woman's original name or background. I cannot say whether it is true, but rumor has it that she and <tips=3>Chris Tse</tips>, the first <tips=81>Longtou</tips> of <tips=7>YS</tips>, were lovers.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r96","rowIndex":96,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「その方と、<tips=5>太刀川</tips>先生はどんな繋がりがあるんでしょうか」","en":"“What connection does she have to Dr. <tips=5>Tachikawa</tips>?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐松子","displayName":"Matsuko Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r97","rowIndex":97,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それはおれにもわからない。……けれど、あの先生は、かつては<tips=69>義勝</tips>時代の<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>の相棒だったからな。誰も知らないことを知っていてもおかしくない」","en":"“That I don’t know. ...But the doctor was once <tips=3>Chris Tse’s</tips> partner in the days of <tips=69>Yisheng</tips>. It would be no surprise if he knew things nobody else did.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r98","rowIndex":98,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「その話が、どうしても信じられないんです。あんな温厚で真面目な先生が、そういった組織にいたなんて……」","en":"“I still find that story impossible to believe. That such a gentle, serious doctor belonged to an organization like that...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐松子","displayName":"Matsuko Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r99","rowIndex":99,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=55>汐</tips>は顔を曇らせる。","en":"<tips=55>Shio’s</tips> expression darkened.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r100","rowIndex":100,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あの人はサイキック能力を持ってるんだよ。あの先生の目を見たことはないかい？」","en":"“The man is a psychic. Have you ever seen his eyes?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r101","rowIndex":101,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いえ」","en":"“No.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐松子","displayName":"Matsuko Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r102","rowIndex":102,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あの人は目に<tips=77>特質変異</tips>がある。だから隠しているんだ。……あの人の力はとんでもなくて、他人の心を読み取るというものだ。どんな人間でも、彼の前では自分の感情を偽ることが出来ない。だから、喧嘩は上手だが交渉や謀略が不得意な<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>にとってはうってつけのパートナーだったというわけさ」","en":"“He has a <tips=77>trait mutation</tips> in his eyes. That is why he keeps them hidden. ...His power is extraordinary: he can read other people's minds. No one, no matter who they are, can disguise their feelings in front of him. That made him the perfect partner for <tips=3>Chris Tse</tips>, who was a fine fighter but hopeless at negotiation and intrigue.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r103","rowIndex":103,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なるほど……。大変な人だったんですね」","en":"“I see... He must have been a formidable man.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐松子","displayName":"Matsuko Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r104","rowIndex":104,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　歩きながら<tips=55>汐</tips>は俯く。","en":"<tips=55>Shio</tips> lowered her head as we walked.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r105","rowIndex":105,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どうして若いエリートドクターだった先生が病院を辞めて<tips=69>義勝</tips>にやって来たのかは謎だがね。とにかく、この協力がなければＹＳは生まれなかったろうし、<tips=18>ローズ・クラブ</tips>や<tips=68>木下組</tips>もああいった形で撤退することはなかったろう。もし組織をやめていなければ、今頃<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>の最高幹部……いや、<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>の次の<tips=81>龍頭</tips>に収まっていてもおかしくなかった」","en":"“Why a young elite physician would leave his hospital and join <tips=69>Yisheng</tips> is a mystery. In any case, without that partnership YS would probably never have been born, and <tips=18>Rose Club</tips> and the <tips=68>Kinoshita-gumi</tips> would not have withdrawn as they did. Had he remained in the organization, he could easily be one of <tips=7>YS’s</tips> highest officers today—perhaps even the <tips=81>Longtou</tips> after <tips=3>Chris Tse</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r106","rowIndex":106,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「へえ、そんなに。……それにしても、<tips=50>路地</tips>さんは随分お詳しいんですね」","en":"“Really? That much? ...Still, you know a remarkable amount about all this, Mr. <tips=50>Roji</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐松子","displayName":"Matsuko Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r107","rowIndex":107,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「昔探偵をやっていた頃に、いろいろと調べたんだよ。<tips=18>ローズ・クラブ</tips>に関する仕事をおれも請けていたし、そうでなくともギャングたちと関わることが多かったからな」","en":"“I investigated a great deal in my detective days. I took work involving <tips=18>Rose Club</tips> myself, and even when I wasn’t doing that, I dealt with gangs often enough.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r108","rowIndex":108,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それは知っています。<tips=50>路地</tips>さんは昔、正義の少年探偵だったんですってね。<tips=59>暗闇通り</tips>の貧しい人たちの味方になって、そのせいでサイキック能力を使いすぎて警察に捕まってしまったって……」","en":"“I know. I heard you were once a boy detective—a champion of justice, <tips=50>Roji</tips>. You took the side of the poor people of <tips=59>Darkness Street</tips>, and that the police arrested you for using your psychic powers too freely on their behalf...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐松子","displayName":"Matsuko Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r109","rowIndex":109,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どこで聞いた？」","en":"“Where did you hear that?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r110","rowIndex":110,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「職員の間で噂になってましたよ。<tips=59>暗闇通り</tips>出身の女の子がいて、小さな時<tips=50>路地</tips>さんにはとてもお世話になったって。……ご存じないかもしれないですけど、<tips=50>路地</tips>さんをこれ以上滞在させるのはどうだろうっていう話もあったんです。でもその時の恩返しをしたいって、その女の子が言って」","en":"“The staff were talking about it. One of the young women here is from <tips=59>Darkness Street</tips>, and she said <tips=50>Roji</tips> had done a great deal for her when she was little. ...You may not know this, but there was some discussion about whether <tips=50>Roji</tips> should be allowed to stay any longer. That young woman said she wanted to repay her debt to you.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐松子","displayName":"Matsuko Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r111","rowIndex":111,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なるほどね」","en":"“I see.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r112","rowIndex":112,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　だから、妙に職員たちが自分に優しかったのか。いくら慈善的な施設だとは言え、素性不明の浮浪者を泊めるのはおかしいと思っていたんだ。","en":"So that explained why the staff had been strangely kind to me. Charitable institution or not, I had wondered why they would shelter an unknown vagrant.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r113","rowIndex":113,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「でも、他の職員も別に追い出したかったわけじゃないですよ。<tips=50>路地</tips>さんは子供たちととてもうまくやってたし、私たちでは出来ない仕事を手伝って頂いて……」","en":"“The others didn’t want to throw you out, either. Mr. <tips=50>Roji</tips>, you were wonderful with the children, and you helped with work we couldn’t manage ourselves...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐松子","displayName":"Matsuko Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r114","rowIndex":114,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いや、別に気を悪くはしていない。どんな理由だとしても感謝の気持ちはかわらない。本当に助かった。<tips=55>汐さん</tips>も、おれの身体を変えてしまって妙な責任を感じているようだが、そんな風に思わないでくれ」","en":"“No, I haven’t taken offense. Whatever the reason, my gratitude doesn’t change. You truly saved me. And <tips=55>Ms. Shio</tips>, you seem to feel some strange responsibility for changing my body. Please don’t.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r115","rowIndex":115,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「は、はい」","en":"“Y-yes.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐松子","displayName":"Matsuko Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r116","rowIndex":116,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=55>汐</tips>は浮かない返事だ。彼女はこれまでこの身体に何かコンプレックスを抱いて生きて来たのだろう。あるいは、まだ私の知らない秘密でもあるのかもしれない。","en":"<tips=55>Shio’s</tips> reply lacked conviction. She must have lived all this time with some deep-seated insecurity about this body. Or perhaps there was still some secret I knew nothing of.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r117","rowIndex":117,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しかし、私は彼女を詮索しようとは思わなかった。","en":"But I had no intention of prying into her affairs.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r118","rowIndex":118,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　死ぬはずだった私にもう一度命を与えてくれたことも、その結果この壊れにくい新しい身体を与えてくれたことも、いくら感謝しても足りない。","en":"She had given me life once more when I should have died—and in doing so, given me this new body, one not easily broken. I could never thank her enough for either gift.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r119","rowIndex":119,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ちなみに、このことは秘密にしておいてくれよ。いまの先生は雇われ医者でしかないんだからな。当時は本名を出さず、顔も覆面で隠して活動をしていた。その正体を知っている人間もいなくはないが、ごくわずかだ」","en":"“And keep all this to yourself. These days, the doctor is merely a hired physician. Back then, he never used his real name and always operated behind a mask. There are people who know his true identity, but only a very few.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r120","rowIndex":120,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「もちろん誰にも言いません。……でも、そこまでの人が、今は朝から晩まで誰からも見捨てられたような人たちを診察して暮らしているだなんて……」","en":"“Of course. I won’t tell anyone. ...But for a man of that stature to spend every day now, from morning to night, treating people everyone else has forsaken...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐松子","displayName":"Matsuko Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r121","rowIndex":121,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それがあの先生らしいところだよ。何人もの他人の心に触れたせいで、ちょっと感じ方が違ってしまってるんだろう。強い力を持ったサイキックの人格は、だいたいその能力に影響されているものだからね」","en":"“That is precisely the kind of man he is. Touching the minds of so many others has probably altered the way he perceives the world. The personality of a powerful psychic is generally shaped by the nature of that power.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r122","rowIndex":122,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……<tips=50>路地</tips>さんも、ですか？」","en":"“Does that include you too, Mr. <tips=50>Roji</tips>?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐松子","displayName":"Matsuko Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r123","rowIndex":123,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女は足を止めて振り返る。","en":"She stopped walking and turned toward me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r124","rowIndex":124,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうかもね。このだらしなくて勝手な性格はそのせいかもしれない。おれの世界には、鍵というものがないんだ。まあ、能力が封じられたおかげで昔よりはマシになったとは思うが」","en":"“Perhaps. Maybe that is why I am so slovenly and self-centered. In my world, there is no such thing as a lock. Still, having my ability sealed away may have made me a little better than I used to be.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r125","rowIndex":125,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私はそう顔を顰めた。","en":"I frowned as I said it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r126","rowIndex":126,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>の変身能力も、もしかしたら連続殺人を起こす理由に関わっているのかもしれない。<tips=86>双子</tips>があいつに手を貸すのも、サイキックならではの理由があるのかな」","en":"“<tips=20>Koschei’s</tips> power of transformation might also be connected to why he commits serial killings. Perhaps <tips=86>the twins</tips> have some reason of their own, peculiar to psychics, for helping him.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r127","rowIndex":127,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうですか……あの、<tips=86>双子</tips>と言えば、私、灰上さんたちのこと知ってます」","en":"“I see... Speaking of <tips=86>the twins</tips>, I know the Haigami sisters.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐松子","displayName":"Matsuko Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r128","rowIndex":128,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「へえ、意外だな。どこで噂を聞いたんだい？」","en":"“That’s unexpected. Where did you hear about them?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r129","rowIndex":129,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……噂ではなく、直接知ってるんです。私の子供の頃の仲間の一人でしたから。友人なんです。最近は会っていませんが」","en":"“It wasn’t a rumor. I know them personally. They were among the children I grew up with. They’re my friends, though I haven’t seen them recently.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐松子","displayName":"Matsuko Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r130","rowIndex":130,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あいつらと同じグループだったってことは、<tips=21>八龍会</tips>の<tips=10>見土道夫</tips>とか、今の<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>の<tips=81>龍頭</tips><tips=1>謝亮</tips>のことも知ってるのかい？　確かみんなきみと同世代だったはずだ」","en":"“If you ran with the same group as those two, do you also know <tips=10>Michio Mido</tips> of the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips> and <tips=1>Tse Leung</tips>, the present <tips=81>Longtou</tips> of <tips=7>YS</tips>? You should all be about the same age.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r131","rowIndex":131,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私の問いに、<tips=55>汐</tips>は頷く。","en":"<tips=55>Shio</tips> nodded in answer.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r132","rowIndex":132,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「灰上さんたちは、いろいろ誤解されがちだけど二人ともとても優しい人です。だから、その<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>と行動を共にしているのにも理由があると思うんです」","en":"“The Haigami sisters are often misunderstood, but they are both very kind. I believe they must have some reason for accompanying <tips=20>Koschei</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐松子","displayName":"Matsuko Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r133","rowIndex":133,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうかい。……しかしおれには関係ないな」","en":"“Is that so? ...It makes no difference to me.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r134","rowIndex":134,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>のことを考えると血が昂ぶる。この不死の力を手に入れて、<tips=17>タイプB</tips>に近づいたせいか、どうも以前よりも感情がコントロールしにくくなったような気がする。","en":"The thought of <tips=20>Koschei</tips> made my blood surge. Perhaps gaining this deathless power and moving closer to <tips=17>Type B</tips> had made my emotions harder to control than before.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r135","rowIndex":135,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は煙草に火をつけて、口にくわえた。","en":"I lit a cigarette and put it between my lips.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r136","rowIndex":136,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「灰上はおれにとっては直接のターゲットではないが、もし<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>を守って立ちはだかるようなら容赦はしない。二人とも危険な力を持っているからな。……それに<tips=55>汐</tips>さん、こういうのはね、元々がどんな性格であっても関係ないのさ。凶悪な本性があっても善行しかしなければ善人だし、心優しくたって殺人鬼に手を貸せば犯罪者だ。行動が全てなんだよ。そして、今の灰上はまぎれもなく殺人鬼のパートナーだ」","en":"“The Haigamis are not my direct targets. But if they stand in my way to protect <tips=20>Koschei</tips>, I will show them no mercy. They both possess dangerous powers. ...And Ms. <tips=55>Shio</tips>, in a matter like this, their underlying nature is irrelevant. A person with a vicious heart who performs only good deeds is good; a person with a gentle heart who assists a murderer is a criminal. Actions are everything. And at this moment, the Haigamis are indisputably partners to a murderer.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r137","rowIndex":137,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=55>汐</tips>は表情を曇らせて黙り込んでいる。","en":"<tips=55>Shio’s</tips> expression clouded, and she fell silent.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r138","rowIndex":138,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は吸い込んだ煙を吐いて、","en":"I exhaled the smoke I had drawn in, then said,","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r139","rowIndex":139,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「前はあの<tips=86>双子</tips>にはしてやられたが、あんたのおかげでおれも大分かわった。今度出会ったら簡単にはやられないだろう」","en":"“Those <tips=86>twins</tips> got the better of me last time, but thanks to you, I am a very different man now. When next we meet, they will not take me down so easily.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r140","rowIndex":140,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　歩き出す前に、携帯灰皿のなかに煙草を押しつけて消す。","en":"Before we resumed walking, I ground the cigarette out in my portable ashtray.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r141","rowIndex":141,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「とにかく、今はまず<tips=31>エリー</tips>のところに行かなくてはな。先生の言うことが確かならば、彼女がかつての<tips=18>ローズ・クラブ</tips>で何があったかを知っている。そうしたらおれは<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>の、きみは自分の正体について、何か手がかりが得られるかもしれない」","en":"“In any event, we must first pay <tips=31>Ellie</tips> a visit. If the doctor is right, she knows what happened inside <tips=18>Rose Club</tips> all those years ago. I may find some clue that leads me to <tips=20>Koschei</tips>, while you may learn something of your own true identity.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r142","rowIndex":142,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　施設から<tips=31>エリー・ホワイト</tips>の私邸まで、そう遠くはない。タクシーを捕まえて五分もすれば到着してしまう。","en":"The facility was not far from <tips=31>Ellie White’s</tips> private residence. A taxi could get us there in five minutes.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r143","rowIndex":143,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それは天井の高い洋式建築で建てられており、この街によくある外国人居住者用のための建物であった。古びることによって生まれたその風格は、まるでお化け屋敷のようでもある。実際その主人である『<tips=31>エリー・ホワイト</tips>』は街の住人にとってはお化けと大差がない存在だ。","en":"It was a Western-style house with high ceilings, the sort of building common in this city for foreign residents. Age had lent it a dignity that also made it resemble a haunted house. Indeed, to the people of the city, its owner, <tips=31>Ellie White</tips>, was little different from a ghost.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r144","rowIndex":144,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=9>Y地区</tips>黎明期から街の裏側の流通を支配し、今日まで活動をしている。喪服のような黒い服を着て顔はヴェールで隠している。そもそも滅多に人前に姿を現さない。素性は不明で、その前歴を知る人間はいない。そしてその中身が入れ替わって二代目になっていることも、そう広くは知られていない。","en":"Since the dawn of <tips=9>Y District</tips>, she had controlled the flow of goods through the city's underworld, and remained active to this day. She dressed in mourning black and concealed her face behind a veil. Indeed, she very rarely showed herself in public at all. Her identity was unknown, and no one knew her history. Nor was it widely known that the woman beneath the name had been replaced—that there was now a second Ellie White.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r145","rowIndex":145,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私だって、別人に入れ替わったことは知っていたが、後継者の女がどういう素性の者なのかは全く知らなかった。今回の件で<tips=5>太刀川</tips>が指名したのだから、<tips=18>ローズ・クラブ</tips>に詳しいのだろう。だとすれば<tips=18>ローズ・クラブ</tips>の関係者なのかと考えたくもなるが、クラブを滅ぼした<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>の最高幹部の一人がそのような素性の持ち主だというのはありえるのだろうか。","en":"I too had known that someone else had assumed the identity, but I knew absolutely nothing of the successor's background. Since <tips=5>Tachikawa</tips> had specifically directed me to her in this matter, she presumably knew a great deal about <tips=18>Rose Club</tips>. It was tempting to conclude that she had once been involved with the club—but could one of the highest officers of <tips=7>YS</tips>, the organization that destroyed <tips=18>Rose Club</tips>, truly have come from such a background?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r146","rowIndex":146,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　とまれ、会えばわかることだ。","en":"At any rate, I would find out when I met her.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r147","rowIndex":147,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"『御用ですか？』","en":"“May I ask what you require?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r148","rowIndex":148,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　表札のないその屋敷のインターフォンを押すと、しわがれた男性の声が出て来る。","en":"When I pressed the intercom at the unmarked residence, a man’s rasping voice answered.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r149","rowIndex":149,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「私は<tips=50>路地邦昭</tips>というものだ。当家の主人である<tips=31>エリー・ホワイト</tips>に話があってここへ来た」","en":"“My name is <tips=50>Kuniaki Roji</tips>. I have come to speak with the owner of this house, <tips=31>Ellie White</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r150","rowIndex":150,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"『……家を間違えておられるのではないでしょうか？』","en":"“...Might you have mistaken the address?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r151","rowIndex":151,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「隠さなくても、ここが<tips=31>エリー・ホワイト</tips>の家だというのは承知の上だ。会う約束はしていないが、在宅ならば是非話を聞きたい」","en":"“There’s no need to hide it. I know full well that this is <tips=31>Ellie White’s</tips> house. I have no appointment, but if she is at home, I would very much like to speak with her.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r152","rowIndex":152,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"『何をおっしゃられているのやら……』","en":"“I’m afraid I have no idea what you mean...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r153","rowIndex":153,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ちょっと待った。ここで切ったらアンタがドヤされることになるぜ」","en":"“Hold it. If you hang up, you’re the one who’ll get chewed out.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r154","rowIndex":154,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　相手が通話を打ち切ろうとする気配を見せたので、私は相手が言い終わるのを待たずにそう言った。","en":"I sensed that he was about to end the call, so I cut in before he could finish.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r155","rowIndex":155,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「おれは『ドクター』に言われてここに来たんだ。<tips=31>エリー・ホワイト</tips>から『<tips=32>アサヒ</tips>』の話を聞けとね」","en":"“The Doctor sent me here. He told me to ask <tips=31>Ellie White</tips> about <tips=32>Asahi</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r156","rowIndex":156,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　返事はすぐには返ってこない。","en":"No reply came at once.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r157","rowIndex":157,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　インターフォンのランプが緑色に光っているから受話器を置いたわけではないだろう。つまり、返答に困っているのだ。","en":"The light on the intercom was still green, so he had not replaced the receiver. In other words, he did not know how to answer.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r158","rowIndex":158,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ごく限られた人間しか通さない<tips=31>エリー・ホワイト</tips>の使用人が戸惑うということは、<tips=5>太刀川</tips>から聞いた言葉が特別な効果をもたらしているに違いない。","en":"For a servant of <tips=31>Ellie White</tips>—a woman who admitted only a very select few—to be thrown into confusion, the words <tips=5>Tachikawa</tips> had given me must indeed have carried some special force.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r159","rowIndex":159,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"『……わかりました。お開けします』","en":"“...Very well. I will open the door.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r160","rowIndex":160,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　果たして使用人の低い声が、インターフォンから流れ出た。","en":"At length, the servant’s low voice emerged from the intercom.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r161","rowIndex":161,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　背の高い年老いた白人がドアを開けた。","en":"A tall, elderly white man opened the door.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r162","rowIndex":162,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ようこそ。私がこの屋敷の執事です」","en":"“Welcome. I am the butler here.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r163","rowIndex":163,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　目を警戒で光らせながら伝えたその声はインターフォンから聞こえた声と同じだった。","en":"His eyes gleamed with wariness as he spoke, and his was the same voice I had heard over the intercom.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r164","rowIndex":164,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　薄暗い廊下を通り、応接室に通される。飲み物が出され、主人が来るまで待つよう指示して執事は退室した。そして部屋には私と<tips=55>汐</tips>が残された。","en":"He led us down a dim corridor into a reception room. After serving drinks and instructing us to wait for his mistress, the butler withdrew, leaving <tips=55>Shio</tips> and me alone.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r165","rowIndex":165,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　豪商の応接室だけあって豪奢なものだった。金をあしらった大理石のローテーブル。天井からつり下がったシャンデリア。足元にはペルシャ絨毯。我々が座っているソファーも上質の革が用いられている。全体的にアンティーク風のデザインの物が多く、現代的な家具が一つもないため、タイムスリップしたのかと錯覚しそうな部屋だった。","en":"As one might expect of a wealthy merchant’s reception room, it was sumptuous: a marble low table decorated with gold, a chandelier suspended from the ceiling, a Persian carpet beneath our feet. Even the sofa on which we sat was upholstered in fine leather. Nearly everything followed an antique design, without a single modern furnishing, creating the illusion that we had slipped backward in time.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r166","rowIndex":166,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして目の前には、籐で編まれたピーコックチェア。映画などでは見たことがあるが、実物を目にするのは初めてだ。","en":"Before us stood a peacock chair woven from rattan. I had seen such chairs in films, but never one in person.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r167","rowIndex":167,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　こんな状況に放り込まれて戸惑っているのではないかと思ったが、<tips=55>汐</tips>は落ち着いて静かに座っている。","en":"I had expected the situation to disorient <tips=55>Shio</tips>, yet she sat there, calm and quiet.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r168","rowIndex":168,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　考えてみれば当然か。殺人鬼と遭遇した時でさえ、冷静に同僚を逃がして、一人で立ち向かうような人間なのだ。普通の若い女とは違う。","en":"On reflection, that was only natural. Even when confronted by a murderer, she had calmly helped her colleague escape and faced the killer alone. She was no ordinary young woman.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r169","rowIndex":169,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その肉体的な特異さと数奇な育ちのせいだろう。ゴミ捨て場に捨てられた肉片から生まれ育つという人生は、ちょっと余人には察しがたい。","en":"It was surely the result of her body's singular nature and her extraordinary upbringing. A life in which one was born and raised from a piece of flesh discarded at a garbage dump was not something an ordinary person could readily comprehend.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r170","rowIndex":170,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そう考えるとやはり、今日の最初の態度が不審だった。あれはあきらかにどこかで泣いた後だった。これほどの人間を取り乱させるとは、どんなことがあったのだろう？","en":"Thinking of that, however, made her behavior when I first saw her today seem all the more suspicious. She had plainly been crying somewhere. What could have happened to unsettle a person like her?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r171","rowIndex":171,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　少し気になったが、それについてあれこれ考える前に、ドアが開いて人が入って来た。","en":"It concerned me, but before I could give the matter further thought, the door opened and someone entered.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r172","rowIndex":172,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　先ほどの執事と、そして、黒衣の女だ。","en":"The butler from before—and a woman in black.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r173","rowIndex":173,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　これが、<tips=31>エリー・ホワイト</tips>である。女は私たちに視線をやると小さく頭を下げて、","en":"This was <tips=31>Ellie White</tips>. The woman turned her gaze upon us and inclined her head slightly.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r174","rowIndex":174,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「初めまして。私が<tips=31>ホワイト</tips>です」","en":"“How do you do? I am <tips=31>White</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エリー・ホワイト","displayName":"Ellie White","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r175","rowIndex":175,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　と、言った。","en":"she said.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r176","rowIndex":176,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そしてピーコックチェアに腰をおろし、肘立ての上に片肘を突く。","en":"Then she seated herself in the peacock chair and rested one elbow upon its arm.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r177","rowIndex":177,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「昔探偵をやっていた<tips=50>路地</tips>というものだ」","en":"“My name is <tips=50>Roji</tips>. I used to be a detective.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r178","rowIndex":178,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=54>汐健慈朗</tips>の娘の<tips=55>松子</tips>です」","en":"“I am <tips=55>Matsuko</tips>, daughter of <tips=54>Kenjiro Shio</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r179","rowIndex":179,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私と<tips=55>汐</tips>がそれぞれ名乗る。普段素性を隠す彼女が父の名を名乗ったのは驚きだが、この場ではその方が有効だろう。実際、彼女がそれを口にしたとき、<tips=31>エリー</tips>の身体が少し揺れた。","en":"<tips=55>Shio</tips> and I introduced ourselves in turn. I was surprised that a woman who usually concealed her identity had given her father’s name, but it was likely the more effective choice here. Indeed, <tips=31>Ellie’s</tips> body shifted slightly when she heard it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r180","rowIndex":180,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=31>エリー</tips>の姿は特徴的だ。噂通りの顔を隠す濃いヴェールに、真っ白な肌と真っ赤な唇。喪服のようなその衣装には一体何の意味があるのだろう。","en":"<tips=31>Ellie’s</tips> appearance was unmistakable: the heavy veil concealing her face, just as the rumors described; skin of pure white; lips of vivid red. What possible meaning could there be in attire so reminiscent of mourning dress?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r181","rowIndex":181,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=50>路地</tips>様の名前は耳にしたことがあります。その風貌も。それと<tips=70>シオクリーン</tips>のご令嬢とは、不思議な取り合わせですね」","en":"“I have heard your name, Mr. <tips=50>Roji</tips>, and descriptions of your appearance as well. You and the young lady of <tips=70>Shio Clean</tips> make a curious pair.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r182","rowIndex":182,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　声は若い。そして肌がみずみずしい。","en":"Her voice was young, and her skin had a youthful luster.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r183","rowIndex":183,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　情報が正しければ三十前後のはずで、まあその年齢でも<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>幹部として充分に若いのだが、こうして向かい合った感じでは、もっと若く感じられる。","en":"If my information was correct, she should have been around thirty—certainly young enough for an officer of <tips=7>YS</tips>—but facing her now, I would have guessed younger still.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r184","rowIndex":184,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「取り合わせは奇妙でも、聞きたいことはおれも彼女も共通しているから安心してくれ」","en":"“The combination may be strange, but you may rest easy: she and I have come to ask about the same thing.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r185","rowIndex":185,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私はそう言った。","en":"I said.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r186","rowIndex":186,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「『ドクター』から聞いてここへいらしたとうかがいましたが、それは確かですか？」","en":"“I am told that the Doctor sent you here. Is that true?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r187","rowIndex":187,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そう。大昔にペスト医者の仮面をかぶって<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>と共に活躍をしていた彼だよ」","en":"“Yes. The same man who wore a plague doctor’s mask long ago and worked alongside <tips=3>Chris Tse</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r188","rowIndex":188,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「嘘ではないようですね」","en":"“You do not appear to be lying.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r189","rowIndex":189,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=31>エリー</tips>はヴェールの向こうからおれを観察している。","en":"<tips=31>Ellie</tips> studied me from behind her veil.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r190","rowIndex":190,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あの方と、どこでお会いになったのですか？」","en":"“Where did you meet him?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r191","rowIndex":191,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=9>Y地区</tips>のなか、とだけ言っておこう。あんたに今の情報を知られることを、彼が望んでいるかどうかおれは知らないからね」","en":"“Somewhere in <tips=9>Y District</tips>. That is all I’ll say. I don’t know whether he wants you to know where he is now.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r192","rowIndex":192,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうですか。今も、この街にいらしたのですね……」","en":"“I see. So he is still here in this city...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r193","rowIndex":193,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=31>エリー</tips>は小さく溜息をつく。","en":"<tips=31>Ellie</tips> gave a quiet sigh.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r194","rowIndex":194,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あの方は、お元気でいらっしゃいましたか？」","en":"“Did he appear to be well?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r195","rowIndex":195,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そのように見えたがね。充実した毎日を送っていると本人は言っていたよ」","en":"“He seemed to be. He himself said that he led a fulfilling life.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r196","rowIndex":196,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それは喜ばしいことです。私も久しぶりにお目にかかりたいのですが、そのようにお伝えして頂けますか？」","en":"“That is wonderful to hear. I would very much like to see him again. Would you give him that message?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r197","rowIndex":197,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いつ会えるかどうかはわからないが、機会があれば言っておこう。……しかし、あんた、先生とどういう関係なんだ？」","en":"“I do not know when—or even whether—I will see him again, but if the opportunity arises, I will tell him. ...What exactly is your relationship with the doctor?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r198","rowIndex":198,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=31>エリー</tips>はしばし沈黙した後に、口を開く。","en":"After a brief silence, <tips=31>Ellie</tips> began to speak.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r199","rowIndex":199,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……<tips=5>太刀川</tips>先生は、私の命の恩人なのです」","en":"“...Dr. <tips=5>Tachikawa</tips> saved my life.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r200","rowIndex":200,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「命を……」","en":"“Your life...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r201","rowIndex":201,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それ以上のことはまだお話し出来ません。まずあなた方の話を聞かせて頂きましょうか」","en":"“I cannot tell you anything more just yet. Perhaps I might first hear your side of the story.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r202","rowIndex":202,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ごもっともだ」","en":"“Fair enough.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r203","rowIndex":203,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして私たちは自分たちの事情を順番に説明した。","en":"We explained our circumstances in turn.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r204","rowIndex":204,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=5>太刀川</tips>に話した時と同じような流れで、まず私が<tips=48>堂島</tips>に依頼されて<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>の捜査に携わったところから、<tips=53>ミユキ</tips>の死、そして<tips=55>汐</tips>によって今のような身体になるまで。","en":"We followed much the same sequence as when we had spoken to <tips=5>Tachikawa</tips>: first, my involvement in the investigation of <tips=20>Koschei</tips> at <tips=48>Dojima’s</tips> request, then <tips=53>Miyuki’s</tips> death, and finally my transformation at <tips=55>Shio’s</tips> hands.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r205","rowIndex":205,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　次に<tips=55>汐</tips>が、<tips=18>ローズ・クラブ</tips>のゴミ捨て場で拾われたところから、同僚のマンションで<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>と遭遇し相手の再生能力に気がついたところまでを話す。","en":"Then <tips=55>Shio</tips> told her story, from being found in <tips=18>Rose Club’s</tips> garbage dump through her encounter with <tips=20>Koschei</tips> at her colleague’s apartment and her discovery of his regenerative power.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r206","rowIndex":206,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=31>エリー</tips>は静かに黙って話を聞き、こちらが話し終わると大きく溜息をついた。","en":"<tips=31>Ellie</tips> listened in calm silence. When we had finished, she released a long sigh.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r207","rowIndex":207,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「今になってそのような話を聞かされるとは……まるで過去の亡霊が蘇ったようですね。それにしても、人に話しにくいことを、よく話して頂けました」","en":"“To hear such a story now... It is as though the ghosts of the past have returned. Even so, I am grateful that you were willing to share matters so difficult to speak of.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r208","rowIndex":208,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「こっちも必死なんだよ。次はあんたが話す番だぜ」","en":"“We’re desperate. Now it’s your turn.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r209","rowIndex":209,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「わかりました」","en":"“Very well.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r210","rowIndex":210,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私の言葉に彼女は頷く。","en":"She nodded at my words.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r211","rowIndex":211,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「何から話しましょうか？」","en":"“Where shall I begin?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r212","rowIndex":212,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうだな。まず、あんたが何者なのか教えてもらおう。『ドクター』がなぜあんたに話を聞くよう言ったのか。命の恩人と言ったが、どういういきさつがあったのか」","en":"“Let’s see. First, tell us who you are. Why did the ‘Doctor’ send us to hear your story? You said he saved your life, but how did that come about?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r213","rowIndex":213,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうですね。じゃあ、まず私が何者なのか」","en":"“Very well. Then I shall begin with who I am.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r214","rowIndex":214,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=31>エリー</tips>は落ち着き払っている。","en":"<tips=31>Ellie</tips> remained perfectly composed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r215","rowIndex":215,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「私も、あなたたちや<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>と同じ、死なない身体を持った人間なのです」","en":"“I too am a person with a deathless body, just like you and <tips=20>Koschei</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r216","rowIndex":216,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その答えに、隣で<tips=55>汐</tips>が息を飲んだ。","en":"Beside me, <tips=55>Shio</tips> caught her breath at the answer.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r217","rowIndex":217,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私にとってもそれは予想しない言葉だった。","en":"The words were unexpected even to me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r218","rowIndex":218,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どういうことだい？」","en":"“What do you mean?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r219","rowIndex":219,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「私は子供のころに<tips=18>ローズ・クラブ</tips>に売られ、そこで働いていました。その時、儀式を受け不死の身体になったのです。クラブでは、好みの男女に残虐な行為を行うというサービスも提供していまして、そのために不死の人間が多数用意されていたのです」","en":"“I was sold to <tips=18>Rose Club</tips> as a child and put to work there. While at the club, I underwent a ritual that made my body deathless. Among its services, the club allowed customers to inflict atrocities upon whichever men or women caught their fancy. A great many deathless people were kept there for precisely that purpose.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r220","rowIndex":220,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして彼女は服の襟元をくつろげると、片方の肩を剥き出しにした。その白磁のようななめらかな肌の上には、くっきりと青みがかった黒色の三日月が描かれている。","en":"She loosened the neck of her dress and bared one shoulder. Upon skin smooth and white as porcelain, a blue-black crescent stood out sharply.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r221","rowIndex":221,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「クラブでは、不死となった人間には、このように三日月の刺青が入れられました」","en":"“At the club, anyone made immortal was tattooed with a crescent like this.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r222","rowIndex":222,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちにその刺青を充分に確認させたあと、<tips=31>エリー</tips>は元通り着衣を整える。","en":"Once she had given us ample time to examine the tattoo, <tips=31>Ellie</tips> put her dress back in order.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r223","rowIndex":223,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=3>クリス</tips>様と<tips=5>太刀川</tips>先生が<tips=18>ローズ・クラブ</tips>に乗り込んだとき、『三日月』の従業員はすべて殺されていたという話です。となると、あの店の『三日月』で生き残ったのは、もしかしたら私一人かもしれません。私よりあのクラブに詳しいものはいないでしょう。<tips=5>太刀川</tips>先生は私にそのことを話させるつもりで、あなたたちをよこしたのでしょう」","en":"“I was told that when Lord <tips=3>Chris</tips> and Dr. <tips=5>Tachikawa</tips> entered <tips=18>Rose Club</tips>, every employee bearing the ‘Crescent’ had already been killed. If so, I may be the only ‘Crescent’ from that establishment left alive. No one could know more about the club than I do. Dr. <tips=5>Tachikawa</tips> must have sent you here intending that I tell you of it.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r224","rowIndex":224,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「確かに、クラブで三日月マークの女たちが殺されたというのは先生から聞いた。なるほど、あんたがその最後の生き残りか。これは驚いたな」","en":"“The doctor did tell us that the women with crescent marks had been killed at the club. I see—so you’re the last survivor. That is a surprise.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r225","rowIndex":225,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「私は、<tips=18>ローズ・クラブ</tips>で働いていたところを、<tips=3>クリス</tips>様と先生に助けて頂いたのです。おそらく、あそこで連れ出して頂けずにクラブに残っていたら、私も毒を飲まされて殺されていたでしょうね」","en":"“Lord <tips=3>Chris</tips> and the doctor rescued me from <tips=18>Rose Club</tips> while I was working there. Had they not taken me away, had I remained at the club, I too would probably have been made to drink poison and killed.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r226","rowIndex":226,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「だから『命の恩人』か」","en":"“So that’s what you meant when you said he saved your life.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r227","rowIndex":227,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「はい」","en":"“Yes.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r228","rowIndex":228,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「しかし、先生と<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>の二人で助けたっていうのはどういうことなんだい？　<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>の襲撃の時じゃないのか？」","en":"“But what do you mean, the doctor and <tips=3>Chris Tse</tips> rescued you together? Wasn’t it during <tips=7>YS’s</tips> attack?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r229","rowIndex":229,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それより前のことです。<tips=3>クリス</tips>様は下調べに潜入していて、先生はご友人に連れられてお客としていらしていました。まず先生が私を助けようとしてくださって、途中で出会った<tips=3>クリス</tips>様が協力してくださって……」","en":"“It happened before the attack. Lord <tips=3>Chris</tips> had infiltrated the club to reconnoiter, while the doctor had come as a customer at the invitation of a friend. The doctor was the first to attempt to rescue me, and Lord <tips=3>Chris</tips>, whom we encountered along the way, offered his assistance...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r230","rowIndex":230,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なるほど。それが<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>とドクターの出会いってわけか」","en":"“I see. So that was how <tips=3>Chris Tse</tips> and the Doctor met.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r231","rowIndex":231,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私の言葉に<tips=31>エリー</tips>は頷く。","en":"<tips=31>Ellie</tips> nodded at my words.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r232","rowIndex":232,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「でも、それでどうしてその後も<tips=3>クリス</tips>とドクターが組むようになったんだい？　そりゃ<tips=3>クリス</tips>は<tips=18>ローズ・クラブ</tips>を潰したかったろうが、先生は医者をやめてまでギャングに肩入れする理由はなかったろう」","en":"“But why did <tips=3>Chris</tips> and the Doctor continue working together after that? Of course <tips=3>Chris</tips> wanted to bring down <tips=18>Rose Club</tips>, but the doctor had no reason to quit medicine just to throw in his lot with a gang.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r233","rowIndex":233,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それは……」","en":"“That was...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r234","rowIndex":234,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=31>エリー</tips>は知っているらしい。顔を伏せ、言うかどうか一瞬迷いを見せてから、","en":"<tips=31>Ellie</tips> appeared to know the answer. She lowered her face and, after a moment's hesitation over whether to reveal it, said,","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r235","rowIndex":235,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「先生の行方不明になった想い人が、クラブで働いていたからです。『三日月』を入れられて……。だからそれを助け出そうとして、先生は<tips=3>クリス</tips>様と共に行動することをお選びになりました。……結局女性は殺害されていたそうですが」","en":"“Because the woman the doctor loved, who had disappeared, was working at the club. They had marked her as a ‘Crescent’... He chose to work alongside Lord <tips=3>Chris</tips> to rescue her. ...In the end, however, I am told that she had been killed.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r236","rowIndex":236,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「惚れた商売女を殺されたのか……どこかで聞いた話だな」","en":"“So the whore he loved was murdered... I have heard that story somewhere before.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r237","rowIndex":237,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　思わず苦笑しないわけにはいかなかった。","en":"I could only give a wry smile.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r238","rowIndex":238,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「先生とは今後も仲良くやっていけそうだ」","en":"“I have a feeling the doctor and I are going to get along just fine.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r239","rowIndex":239,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は深呼吸をして、思考を整えた。","en":"I drew a deep breath and ordered my thoughts.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r240","rowIndex":240,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　自分がそれなりに事情通だという自信があったが、彼女が語るのは全く聞いたことがない話だった。","en":"I had been confident that I was fairly well informed about such matters, yet I had never heard any part of the story she was telling us.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r241","rowIndex":241,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=31>エリー・ホワイト</tips>に関してそれほど調べる機会がなかったというのもあるが、おそらく調べてもそうそう知り得るものでもなかったろう。全ては資料として残っているのではなく、当事者の記憶のなかにしかないのだから。","en":"Admittedly, I had never had much cause to investigate <tips=31>Ellie White</tips>. Even if I had, however, these were hardly things I could readily have learned. None of it survived in any written record; it existed only in the memories of those who had been there.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r242","rowIndex":242,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「クラブから救出して頂いた後、私はここに預けられ、それからは当時の<tips=31>エリー・ホワイト</tips>の世話になりました。そして彼女の身体が衰えるとその仕事を代行するようになり、亡くなったあとは私がこうして『<tips=31>エリー・ホワイト</tips>』となったのです」","en":"“After I was rescued from the club, I was entrusted to this household and placed in the care of the <tips=31>Ellie White</tips> of that time. As her health declined, I began to handle her work in her place. After she died, I became <tips=31>Ellie White</tips>, as you see.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r243","rowIndex":243,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「『<tips=32>アサヒ</tips>』って言葉は、どういう意味があるんだ？」","en":"“What does the word ‘<tips=32>Asahi</tips>’ mean?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r244","rowIndex":244,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「私が生まれたときの名前です。今それを知っているのは、<tips=5>太刀川</tips>先生だけでしょう。他の方はみな亡くなってしまいましたから……」","en":"“It was the name I was given at birth. Dr. <tips=5>Tachikawa</tips> is probably the only person alive who knows it now. Everyone else has died...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r245","rowIndex":245,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なるほどね。しかし、十五年前にクラブで働いていたのなら、あんたはもっと年を取っていても良さそうだが、随分若く見える。老化が遅いのも不死の効果かい？」","en":"“I see. But if you were working at the club fifteen years ago, I would expect you to look older. You seem remarkably young. Is slower aging another effect of being deathless?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r246","rowIndex":246,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それもあるかも知れませんが、実際ここに来たときはほんの子供だったので……。おばさまは、何の役にも立たない私に、信じられないくらい良くしてくれました」","en":"“Perhaps. But I truly was only a child when I came here... Auntie treated me with unbelievable kindness when I was of no use to anyone.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r247","rowIndex":247,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=31>エリー</tips>は寂しげに俯く。","en":"<tips=31>Ellie</tips> lowered her head sadly.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r248","rowIndex":248,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あの、<tips=55>汐</tips>さん」","en":"“Um, Ms. <tips=55>Shio</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r249","rowIndex":249,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「は、はい」","en":"“Y-yes?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐松子","displayName":"Matsuko Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r250","rowIndex":250,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　唐突に<tips=31>エリー</tips>に声をかけられて、<tips=55>汐</tips>は緊張した返事をする。","en":"Called on so abruptly by <tips=31>Ellie</tips>, <tips=55>Shio</tips> answered tensely.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r251","rowIndex":251,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「お伺いしたいのですが、あなたはどうやってこの<tips=50>路地</tips>さんを不死にされたのですか？　私も前の<tips=31>エリー・ホワイト</tips>が亡くなるとき、店での儀式のように血を飲ませれば死ななくなるのではないかと、動物などで何度か試してみたんですが、狂ったり死んだりしてしまって、うまくいかなくて……」","en":"“There is something I would like to ask. How did you make Mr. <tips=50>Roji</tips> immortal? When the former <tips=31>Ellie White</tips> was dying, I too wondered whether giving her my blood to drink, as in the club’s ritual, might keep her from death. I tried it several times with animals, but they went mad or died. It simply would not work...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r252","rowIndex":252,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=55>汐</tips>はチラと私の方を見てから答える。","en":"<tips=55>Shio</tips> glanced toward me before answering.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r253","rowIndex":253,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「やり方はそれであってます。傷口から流れる血液を、そのまま飲ませるだけです。ただ私も、これが初めてで、実際にやったことがあったわけではないんですが」","en":"“You had the method right. You simply have them drink blood flowing directly from a wound. But this was my first time, too—I had never actually done it before.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐松子","displayName":"Matsuko Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r254","rowIndex":254,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ふむ、じゃあおれは、そのぶっつけ本番に失敗してたら狂って死んでいたわけか」","en":"“Hmm. So if that improvised first attempt had failed, I would have gone mad and died.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r255","rowIndex":255,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「す、すみません。ただ一応、どうすればその確率が高くなるかとかいう話は聞いていたので、その通りにはしたんですが……」","en":"“I-I’m sorry. But I had been told what conditions would improve the odds, and I did follow those instructions...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐松子","displayName":"Matsuko Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r256","rowIndex":256,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=55>汐</tips>は申し訳なさそうに肩をすくめる。","en":"<tips=55>Shio</tips> hunched her shoulders apologetically.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r257","rowIndex":257,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「責めてるわけじゃない。しかし、あんたの父さんは随分と調べたんだな」","en":"“I’m not blaming you. But your father certainly investigated this thoroughly.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r258","rowIndex":258,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「は、はい……」","en":"“Y-yes...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐松子","displayName":"Matsuko Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r259","rowIndex":259,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「その、確率を高める方法とはなんですか？」","en":"“And what are these conditions that improve the chances of success?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r260","rowIndex":260,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　顎に指をやり、興味深げに訊ねたのは<tips=31>エリー</tips>である。","en":"It was <tips=31>Ellie</tips> who asked, resting a finger thoughtfully against her chin.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r261","rowIndex":261,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「少しでも新鮮な血液であること。採取してすぐ、出来れば傷口から直接与えるくらいがいいそうです。どこか器にとるという時間をおくだけでも、確率は下がるそうです」","en":"“The blood should be as fresh as possible—given immediately after it is drawn, and preferably straight from the wound. Even the time required to collect it in a container apparently lowers the probability.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐松子","displayName":"Matsuko Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r262","rowIndex":262,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そう言えば、クラブで儀式を行う際も、ナイフで傷つけたところに口をつけて、直接血液を飲むよう指示されました」","en":"“Now that you mention it, during the ritual at the club, we were instructed to place our mouths against the knife wound and drink the blood directly.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r263","rowIndex":263,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ふむ、となると、そいつらも『知ってた』わけだな。メカニズムを」","en":"“Hmm. Then they ‘knew’ too—knew how the mechanism worked.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r264","rowIndex":264,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=31>エリー</tips>の言葉に私は頷く。","en":"I nodded at <tips=31>Ellie’s</tips> words.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r265","rowIndex":265,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あともう一つ、個体によってこの再生能力も差があるので、それも成功確率に影響しているのではないかという話でした」","en":"“There was one more theory. Regenerative power differs from one individual to another, and that difference may also affect the odds of success.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐松子","displayName":"Matsuko Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r266","rowIndex":266,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「個体差をどうやって調べた？　不死身が他にもいたのかい？」","en":"“How did they investigate those individual differences? Were there other deathless creatures?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r267","rowIndex":267,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は気になってそう尋ねる。","en":"Curious, I asked the question.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r268","rowIndex":268,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……<tips=18>ローズ・クラブ</tips>で飼われていた虎が肉片になったものを手に入れたんです。けれど、小さな肉片から再生出来た私と違って、その肉片は長くもたずに死んでしまったんです。<tips=72>傾向値</tips>が関係しているのかもしれないって」","en":"“...I obtained a piece of flesh from a tiger kept at <tips=18>Rose Club</tips>. But unlike me, who could regenerate from a tiny scrap, that piece soon died. They thought its <tips=72>tendency value</tips> might have something to do with it.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐松子","displayName":"Matsuko Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r269","rowIndex":269,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そういえば、『三日月』を生きたまま虎に食べさせるショーもあったということです。血液の新鮮さが不死になる条件というのならば、その虎が不死身になっていてもおかしくありませんね」","en":"“Come to think of it, I was told that the club also staged shows in which a ‘Crescent’ was fed alive to a tiger. If fresh blood is one of the conditions for becoming deathless, there would be nothing strange about that tiger having become deathless as well.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r270","rowIndex":270,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=31>エリー</tips>は溜息をつく。","en":"<tips=31>Ellie</tips> sighed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r271","rowIndex":271,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なるほどね。じゃあ、この街には不死身の蚊や寄生虫もいるのかもしれないな」","en":"“I see. Then perhaps this city has immortal mosquitoes and parasites as well.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r272","rowIndex":272,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私がそう口を挟むと、","en":"When I interjected,","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r273","rowIndex":273,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そもそも<tips=17>タイプB</tips>にもならない、あまりにも下等な生物は、変化しないだろうという話ですが……」","en":"“I was told that organisms too primitive even to become <tips=17>Type B</tips> probably would not change...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐松子","displayName":"Matsuko Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r274","rowIndex":274,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=55>汐</tips>は真顔で返す。","en":"<tips=55>Shio</tips> answered with a perfectly straight face.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r275","rowIndex":275,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「冗談だよ」","en":"“I was joking.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r276","rowIndex":276,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は笑いながら、別のことを考えていた。","en":"I laughed, but my thoughts had already moved elsewhere.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r277","rowIndex":277,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　虎といえば、この間<tips=57>滑走路通り</tips>で突如現れた虎に子供が食われたという事件があった。どこかの金持ちが密輸したペットが逃げ出したのだろうと思っていたが、もしかしてあれが<tips=18>ローズ・クラブ</tips>の虎だったのだろうか？","en":"A tiger brought to mind the recent incident in which one had suddenly appeared on <tips=57>Runway Street</tips> and eaten a child. I had assumed some wealthy person’s smuggled pet had escaped. Could it have been the <tips=18>Rose Club</tips> tiger instead?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r278","rowIndex":278,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして、それを退治したのは<tips=10>見土道夫</tips>と、<tips=1>菅原亮</tips>――現<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips><tips=81>龍頭</tips>の<tips=1>謝亮</tips>だったという話だ。<tips=55>汐</tips>は彼らと知り合いだと言っていたし、この噂が事実だとしたら、<tips=54>汐健慈朗</tips>のところに虎を持ち込んだのが彼らだという可能性がある。","en":"According to the story, the men who killed it were <tips=10>Michio Mido</tips> and <tips=1>Ryo Sugawara</tips>—the latter being <tips=1>Tse Leung</tips>, the present <tips=81>Longtou</tips> of <tips=7>YS</tips>. <tips=55>Shio</tips> had said that she knew them both. If the rumor was true, it was possible that they were the ones who had brought the tiger to <tips=54>Kenjiro Shio</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r279","rowIndex":279,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そう言えば<tips=1>謝亮</tips>は学生時代は何を学んでいた？　理系の大学へ行ったのは聞いているが学部は知らない。もしかしたら彼も、<tips=54>汐健慈朗</tips>の実験に参加していたのではないだろうか。","en":"For that matter, what had <tips=1>Tse Leung</tips> studied in his university days? I knew he had gone to a university to study the sciences, but I did not know his field. Perhaps he too had participated in <tips=54>Kenjiro Shio’s</tips> experiments.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r280","rowIndex":280,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そうだとしても、<tips=70>シオクリーン</tips>の令嬢としては<tips=81>龍頭</tips>との関わりをはっきり公言するわけにはいかないはずだ。","en":"Even if that were true, as the heiress to <tips=70>Shio Clean</tips>, she could hardly openly acknowledge an association with the <tips=81>Longtou</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r281","rowIndex":281,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しかし、もし<tips=1>謝亮</tips>が関係しているというのならば、その関わり方によっては面白いことになる。","en":"But if <tips=1>Tse Leung</tips> was involved, then depending on the nature of that involvement, this could become interesting.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r282","rowIndex":282,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　思いがけない活路の発見に興奮しそうになる。私は息を整え、冷静を保つ。","en":"I almost grew excited at this unexpected discovery of a way forward. I steadied my breathing and kept myself composed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r283","rowIndex":283,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　あとで、彼女と<tips=1>謝亮</tips>の関係について調べよう。当時の不良グループのメンバーに当たれば、人間関係を洗い出すのはそう難しくはないはずだ。","en":"Later, I would investigate her relationship with <tips=1>Tse Leung</tips>. By contacting members of their delinquent group from those days, reconstructing the relationships among them should not be especially difficult.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r284","rowIndex":284,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そこで気持ちを切り換え、再び<tips=31>エリー・ホワイト</tips>から情報を引き出すことに集中する。","en":"I shifted gears and once again concentrated on drawing information from <tips=31>Ellie White</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r285","rowIndex":285,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=31>エリー</tips>、あんたのことはよくわかった。じゃあ、これから別の質問をする。……まず、<tips=55>汐</tips>さんから聞くかい？　あんたにも質問があるだろう。おれはそのあとにする」","en":"“<tips=31>Ellie</tips>, I understand your circumstances. Now we have other questions. ...How about we start with you, Ms. <tips=55>Shio</tips>? You have questions of your own, don’t you? I’ll go after you.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r286","rowIndex":286,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私が譲ると<tips=55>汐</tips>は頷き、口を開いた。","en":"At my invitation, <tips=55>Shio</tips> nodded and began.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r287","rowIndex":287,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「私は『三日月』の人たちについて伺います」","en":"“I would like to ask about the people called ‘Crescents.’”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐松子","displayName":"Matsuko Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r288","rowIndex":288,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どうぞ。私の知っていることならばなんでも」","en":"“Please do. I will tell you anything I know.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r289","rowIndex":289,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ありがとうございます。じゃあお聞きします。あの、『三日月』の人たちが酷い目にあわされるというのは私も知っているのですが、たとえばそれで、あまりにも細かく切断されて、そのまま他の死体と混ぜて捨てられるというようなケースはありますか？　そのままというのはつまり、生きたままということです。不死ならば、肉片になっても動いているはずでしょう？」","en":"“Thank you. Then let me ask... I know that the ‘Crescents’ were subjected to terrible things, but was one of them ever cut into pieces so fine that she was mixed in with other corpses and discarded in that state? And by ‘in that state,’ I mean still alive. If she was deathless, even the pieces of her body should have continued to move, should they not?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐松子","displayName":"Matsuko Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r290","rowIndex":290,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=55>汐</tips>は真剣な顔で<tips=31>エリー</tips>を見つめている。","en":"<tips=55>Shio</tips> stared intently at <tips=31>Ellie</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r291","rowIndex":291,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「基本的には接客後の『三日月』は再生されますので、捨てるということはありません。貴重な商品ですから、その後も働かせるのです」","en":"“As a rule, after serving a customer, a ‘Crescent’ was allowed to regenerate rather than thrown away. They were valuable merchandise, so the club put them back to work.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r292","rowIndex":292,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=31>エリー</tips>は静かに答える。","en":"<tips=31>Ellie</tips> answered quietly.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r293","rowIndex":293,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「『三日月』が処分されるのは、重大なルール違反をした時です。スタッフが特別な薬を使うと不死ではなくなるので、その上で死をもって償うことになります。その場合遺体はゴミとして廃棄されます。……しかし、この場合、廃棄される『三日月』は不死ではなくなっているので、やっぱり<tips=55>汐</tips>さんがお尋ねになっている『生きたまま』というのとは違いますね」","en":"“A ‘Crescent’ was disposed of only after committing a serious violation of the rules. The staff would administer a special drug that stripped her of her deathlessness, after which she would atone with her life. Her body would then be discarded as garbage. ...But because a ‘Crescent’ disposed of in this way was no longer deathless, it is not the sort of case you are asking about—someone being discarded while still alive—Ms. <tips=55>Shio</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r294","rowIndex":294,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうですか」","en":"“I see.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐松子","displayName":"Matsuko Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r295","rowIndex":295,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=55>汐</tips>は考え込む。","en":"<tips=55>Shio</tips> fell into thought.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r296","rowIndex":296,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「しかし、そんなに、死なないものなのか？」","en":"“But were they truly that hard to kill?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r297","rowIndex":297,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　気になった私が横合いからそう尋ねると<tips=31>エリー</tips>は頷き、","en":"Curious, I interjected with the question, and <tips=31>Ellie</tips> nodded before replying,","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r298","rowIndex":298,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「例えば客にバラバラにされても、並べて一晩おけば繋がってますから」","en":"“Even if a customer tore one apart, the pieces would rejoin by morning if they were laid out overnight.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r299","rowIndex":299,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そりゃすごい」","en":"“That is impressive.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r300","rowIndex":300,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私はひゅうと口笛を吹く。","en":"I gave a low whistle.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r301","rowIndex":301,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あの、じゃあもう一つ、質問させて下さい」","en":"“Um, then may I ask one more question?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐松子","displayName":"Matsuko Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r302","rowIndex":302,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=55>汐</tips>の問いに、<tips=31>エリー</tips>は黙って頷く。","en":"At <tips=55>Shio’s</tips> request, <tips=31>Ellie</tips> nodded silently.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r303","rowIndex":303,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ありがとうございます。では……あの、『三日月』になった方が、妊娠をするケースというのはありませんか？　そして、それを店に見つからぬよう、こっそりと産み、赤ん坊は切り刻んで処分する、などということはありえるのでしょうか？」","en":"“Thank you. Then... um, were there ever cases in which a woman who became a ‘Crescent’ grew pregnant? Could she have secretly given birth without the club finding out, with the baby then cut apart and disposed of?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐松子","displayName":"Matsuko Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r304","rowIndex":304,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　なかなか生々しい質問だが、<tips=55>汐</tips>は顔色一つ変えずに言った。","en":"It was a gruesomely direct question, but <tips=55>Shio</tips> asked it without the slightest change in expression.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r305","rowIndex":305,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「店で働くものたちは避妊薬を定期的に飲んでいるので、そのようなことはありません。毎月検査して結果をチェックされるので、万が一妊娠をしてもすぐにわかります。その場合、すぐに堕胎させられることになります」","en":"“The people who worked at the club regularly took contraceptives, so nothing of the kind occurred. We were tested every month and the results checked, so any pregnancy would be discovered at once. In that event, we would be made to terminate it immediately.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r306","rowIndex":306,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　対する<tips=31>エリー</tips>も冷静に語る。","en":"<tips=31>Ellie</tips>, for her part, spoke just as calmly.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r307","rowIndex":307,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ただ、客が十ヶ月なりを丸々買い取って子供を産ませるということも出来るそうで、そういう場合は例外的に出産することになるのでしょうが、実際に行われたという話は聞いたことがありません。何しろ、『三日月』を長期間独占するとなれば、とんでもない額の金銭が必要になりますから」","en":"“I was told, however, that a customer could buy the entirety of a ten-month period, keeping a woman exclusively to himself and making her bear a child. Such an arrangement would presumably be an exception in which she was allowed to give birth, but I have never heard of one actually being made. After all, monopolizing a ‘Crescent’ for that length of time would require an extraordinary sum of money.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r308","rowIndex":308,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうですか……」","en":"“I see...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐松子","displayName":"Matsuko Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r309","rowIndex":309,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=55>汐</tips>はそう言って考え込む。","en":"<tips=55>Shio</tips> fell into thought.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r310","rowIndex":310,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「じゃあ、最後の質問ですが、単刀直入に訊きます。……私はそのクラブが出したゴミ袋のなかから見つかったんです。幼児のうちにバラバラにされて、捨てられたところから再生されたんです。これは、どんな経緯でそうなったと思いますか？」","en":"“Then this is my last question, and I’ll ask it plainly. ...I was found in a bag of garbage the club had put out. I regenerated after being cut to pieces as a small child and thrown away. What chain of events do you think could have led to that?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐松子","displayName":"Matsuko Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r311","rowIndex":311,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=31>エリー</tips>はすぐには答えず、じっと<tips=55>汐</tips>の方を向いている。おそらくヴェールの下の目で、<tips=55>汐</tips>のまっすぐな瞳を見つめ返しているのだろう。","en":"<tips=31>Ellie</tips> did not answer at once. She remained facing <tips=55>Shio</tips>, probably returning <tips=55>Shio’s</tips> unwavering gaze with the eyes concealed beneath her veil.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r312","rowIndex":312,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……残念ながら、それは私にはわかりません」","en":"“...I am sorry, but I do not know.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r313","rowIndex":313,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=31>エリー</tips>は申し訳なさそうに首を振って見せる。","en":"<tips=31>Ellie</tips> shook her head apologetically.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r314","rowIndex":314,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そのたびに、黒いヴェールがさらさらと揺れる。","en":"With every movement, the black veil rustled softly.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r315","rowIndex":315,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ただ『三日月』は店側から非常に厳しく管理されています。不始末をして殺される時も、しっかり死を確認した上で廃棄されます。襲撃のときも、一人残らず殺されたという話ですから、クラブの外に不死の人間を出したくない理由があるのでしょう。本当に徹底しているんです。それを考えると、あなたは『三日月』とは違った立場だったのかもしれません」","en":"“I can tell you only that the club kept its ‘Crescents’ under extraordinarily strict control. When one was killed for misconduct, the staff verified her death beyond doubt before disposing of the body. I was told that every last one was killed during the attack as well, so the club must have had some reason for refusing to let a deathless person leave the club alive. Their precautions were absolute. In light of that, perhaps you occupied a position different from that of a ‘Crescent.’”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r316","rowIndex":316,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうですか……。ありがとうございました」","en":"“I see... Thank you.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐松子","displayName":"Matsuko Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r317","rowIndex":317,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=55>汐</tips>の前のめりになっていた身体から力が抜けて、ソファーの背もたれにぐったりともたれ掛かった。","en":"The tension went out of <tips=55>Shio’s</tips> forward-leaning body, and she slumped limply against the back of the sofa.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r318","rowIndex":318,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ごめんなさい。力になれなくて」","en":"“I’m sorry I could not help.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r319","rowIndex":319,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いえ、とんでもない」","en":"“Not at all.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐松子","displayName":"Matsuko Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r320","rowIndex":320,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=55>汐</tips>は言って、かすかに笑みを作ってみせる。","en":"<tips=55>Shio</tips> said, managing to form a faint smile.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r321","rowIndex":321,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「じゃあ次はおれの番だ」","en":"“Then it’s my turn.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r322","rowIndex":322,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　質問を終えた<tips=55>汐</tips>にかわって、私が口を開く。","en":"Now that <tips=55>Shio</tips> had finished her questions, I took over.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r323","rowIndex":323,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「おれの質問はたった一つだ。その儀式を行う女のことが知りたい。知っているかぎり詳しく話してもらおう」","en":"“I have only one question. I want to know about the woman who conducted that ritual. Tell me everything you know about her.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r324","rowIndex":324,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=18>ローズ・クラブ</tips>で不死の女を作り出したその張本人。自身も不死であろうその女の正体こそが、重要な意味を持っている。","en":"The very woman responsible for creating the deathless women of <tips=18>Rose Club</tips>—and who was presumably deathless herself. Her true identity was bound to carry vital significance.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r325","rowIndex":325,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうですね……彼女が店でどういう役職についていたのかは不明です。儀式の時以外に何か仕事をしていたかどうかも知りません。……幹部の人たちに対してもへりくだった態度はとっていなかったので、役員と同じくらいの地位にはあったのかもしれません。私が見た限りでは、<tips=60>ロジャー・アダムス</tips>と親しそうでした。……私たちは儀式の時くらいしかその女性とは会う機会がなかったので、そこまで詳しい情報はないのです」","en":"“Let me see... I do not know what position she held at the club, or whether she performed any work apart from the rituals. ...She never behaved deferentially even toward the executives, so perhaps she held a rank comparable to theirs. From what I saw, she appeared close to <tips=60>Roger Adams</tips>. ...We had almost no occasion to meet her outside the rituals, so I possess little detailed information.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r326","rowIndex":326,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=31>エリー</tips>は遠い記憶を掘り返すように、言葉の合間合間に小首をかしげながら言葉を口にする。","en":"As though excavating a distant memory, <tips=31>Ellie</tips> cocked her head slightly between phrases as she spoke.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r327","rowIndex":327,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……年は、三十才くらいに見えました。とても美しい人物です。……ピアノが上手で、たまにロビーのグランドピアノを演奏していました。名前は……確か<tips=60>ロジャー・アダムス</tips>に『<tips=61>ヒトミ</tips>』と呼ばれていたと思います。綺麗な日本語で喋っていましたし、日本人かもしれません」","en":"“...She appeared to be around thirty years old. She was a woman of extraordinary beauty. ...She was an accomplished pianist and would occasionally play the grand piano in the lobby. Her name... I believe I heard <tips=60>Roger Adams</tips> call her <tips=61>Hitomi</tips>. She spoke impeccable Japanese, so she may herself have been Japanese.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r328","rowIndex":328,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=61>ヒトミ</tips>？」","en":"“<tips=61>Hitomi</tips>?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r329","rowIndex":329,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「はい」","en":"“Yes.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r330","rowIndex":330,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=31>エリー</tips>は頷く。","en":"<tips=31>Ellie</tips> nodded.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r331","rowIndex":331,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ああ、畜生っ……やっぱりそうか！」","en":"“Ah, damn it... I knew it!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r332","rowIndex":332,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私の全身にぞわぞわと鳥肌が立った。","en":"Gooseflesh prickled across my entire body.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r333","rowIndex":333,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ピアノが得意で『<tips=61>ヒトミ</tips>』と名乗った人物を私は知っている。","en":"I knew someone who was skilled at the piano and called herself <tips=61>Hitomi</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r334","rowIndex":334,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「やっぱりそうかっ！」","en":"“I knew it!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r335","rowIndex":335,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私がどんと拳で膝を叩くと、<tips=55>汐</tips>が驚いてこちらを見る。","en":"I brought my fist down hard upon my knee, making <tips=55>Shio</tips> turn toward me in surprise.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r336","rowIndex":336,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どうしました？」","en":"“What is it?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐松子","displayName":"Matsuko Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r337","rowIndex":337,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「おれはつい最近一人の女を見かけたんだ。そいつは<tips=61>ヒトミ</tips>と名乗り、ピアノを演奏していたんだよ。そして、昔この街に住んでいたとも語っていた。これが偶然の一致ってことがあるかい？」","en":"“I saw a woman very recently. She called herself <tips=61>Hitomi</tips>, and she played the piano. She also said that she once lived in this city. Could all of that possibly be coincidence?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r338","rowIndex":338,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ぴったりあってますね……」","en":"“It all fits perfectly...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐松子","displayName":"Matsuko Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r339","rowIndex":339,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そしてね、その<tips=61>ヒトミ</tips>って女は、<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>が『変身』した姿の一つなんだよ」","en":"“And that woman, <tips=61>Hitomi</tips>, was one of the forms <tips=20>Koschei</tips> had assumed.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r340","rowIndex":340,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私の言葉で<tips=55>汐</tips>も顔色を変える。","en":"At my words, <tips=55>Shio’s</tips> expression changed as well.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r341","rowIndex":341,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>は現段階でも、黒髪の青年と、金髪の少女、二つの姿を持っていることが確認されているが、これだけがやつの能力の全てだと決まったわけじゃない。もう一人、女の姿に変身出来たっておかしくないだろう？」","en":"“At this point, we know that <tips=20>Koschei</tips> has two forms: a black-haired young man and a blond girl. But there’s no reason to assume that is the full extent of his ability. It wouldn’t be strange if he could transform into another woman as well, would it?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r342","rowIndex":342,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　二人は沈黙している。","en":"The other two were silent.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r343","rowIndex":343,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は言葉を続ける。","en":"I continued.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r344","rowIndex":344,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「もし<tips=61>ヒトミ</tips>が<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>だったとしたならば……やつが十五年前にこの街に居て、<tips=18>ローズ・クラブ</tips>で血を分け与えていたということになる。そしてクラブの崩壊と共に『三日月』を殺して遠くへ逃げ出し、そして再びこの街に帰ってきた……。何のためだ？　わざわざ帰って来るってことは、何か目的があるんじゃないのか？　ただ殺人を繰り返すために帰って来たとは思えないが……」","en":"“If <tips=61>Hitomi</tips> was <tips=20>Koschei</tips>... then he was in this city fifteen years ago, giving his blood to people at <tips=18>Rose Club</tips>. When the club collapsed, he killed the ‘Crescents,’ fled somewhere far away, and has now returned... Why? Coming back deliberately suggests he has some purpose. I can’t believe he returned merely to resume killing...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r345","rowIndex":345,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　アパートで出会った青年の姿をした<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>は、行き当たりばったりの計画性のない人間にしか見えなかった。『<tips=61>ヒトミ</tips>』は他人の用事でこの街に帰ってきただけで、気が進まないと言っていた。","en":"<tips=20>Koschei</tips>, in the form of the young man I met at the apartment, had seemed incapable of planning, acting only upon impulse. <tips=61>Hitomi</tips> had said that she had returned to the city on someone else’s business and was none too pleased about it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r346","rowIndex":346,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼らは本性を隠していたのか。それとも、他にだれか黒幕がいるのだろうか？","en":"Had they been hiding their true natures? Or was someone else directing them from behind the scenes?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r347","rowIndex":347,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ふむ……しかし、これは<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>としても容易な話じゃないな」","en":"“Hmm... But this will not be a simple matter for <tips=7>YS</tips>, either.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r348","rowIndex":348,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私が言うと、うつむき物思いに耽っていた<tips=31>エリー</tips>が顔を上げる。","en":"At my remark, <tips=31>Ellie</tips>, who had been sitting with her head bowed in thought, looked up.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r349","rowIndex":349,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>の仇敵だった、<tips=18>ローズ・クラブ</tips>側の生き残りが街に帰って来たんだ。しかも、そいつはとんでもないサイキックときている。何も起こらないわけがないだろう」","en":"“A survivor from <tips=18>Rose Club</tips>, once <tips=7>YS’s</tips> mortal enemy, has returned to the city. And this one is a psychic of staggering power. Something is bound to happen.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r350","rowIndex":350,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうですね」","en":"“Yes.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r351","rowIndex":351,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=31>エリー</tips>もそう頷いた。","en":"<tips=31>Ellie</tips> nodded in agreement.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r352","rowIndex":352,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「もし<tips=81>龍頭</tips>に報告するなら、おれのことは話してくれてかまわない。ただ、こっちのお嬢さんのことはうまく隠してくれないか？　我々とは違う世界でまっとうに生きているんだ」","en":"“If you report this to the <tips=81>Longtou</tips>, you may tell him about me. But could you find some way to keep this young lady out of it? She leads a respectable life in a world apart from ours.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r353","rowIndex":353,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私はそう言って<tips=55>汐</tips>に目配せをする。","en":"I gave <tips=55>Shio</tips> a meaningful glance as I spoke.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r354","rowIndex":354,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女が<tips=1>謝亮</tips>と何らかの関係があるのはほぼ間違いないが、彼女は私にはそのことを口にしなかった。何か複雑ないきさつがあるのかもしれない。だとすれば、彼女の名前を<tips=1>謝亮</tips>の耳に入れないほうがいいだろう。","en":"She almost certainly had some connection to <tips=1>Tse Leung</tips>, yet she had said nothing of it to me. Perhaps there was some complicated history between them. If so, it would be better not to let her name reach <tips=1>Tse Leung’s</tips> ears.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r355","rowIndex":355,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=55>汐</tips>は頷きを返す。私の意図を理解してくれたようだ。","en":"<tips=55>Shio</tips> nodded back. She seemed to understand my intent.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r356","rowIndex":356,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「じゃあ、今日はここまでにしよう。おれもこのあと人と会う予定があるのでね。突然の訪問にもかかわらず、時間を貸してくれて感謝している」","en":"“Let’s end here for today. I have someone else to meet afterward. Thank you for giving us your time despite our arriving without notice.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r357","rowIndex":357,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は立ち上がり、<tips=31>エリー</tips>に頭を下げた。","en":"I rose and bowed to <tips=31>Ellie</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r358","rowIndex":358,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それに倣って<tips=55>汐</tips>も礼をする。","en":"<tips=55>Shio</tips> followed my example and bowed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r359","rowIndex":359,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いえ。こちらこそとても有益な情報に触れることが出来ました」","en":"“Not at all. I too have had the opportunity to learn extraordinarily valuable information.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r360","rowIndex":360,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=31>エリー</tips>は座ったままそう答える。","en":"<tips=31>Ellie</tips> answered without leaving her chair.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r361","rowIndex":361,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どうも、またあんたと会うことになりそうな気がするよ。その時は、場所は<tips=41>グランドタワー</tips>で、<tips=81>龍頭</tips>も同席しているだろうな」","en":"“I have a feeling you and I will meet again. When we do, it will probably be in <tips=41>Grand Tower</tips>, with the <tips=81>Longtou</tips> in attendance.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r362","rowIndex":362,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その言葉には<tips=31>エリー</tips>は何も応えない。","en":"<tips=31>Ellie</tips> made no reply.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r363","rowIndex":363,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は口の端だけで笑って、そしてくるりと向きを変えるとふかふかの絨毯を踏みながら出口へ向かう。","en":"I smiled with one corner of my mouth, turned on my heel, and crossed the deep carpet toward the exit.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r364","rowIndex":364,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「今日はありがとうございました」","en":"“Thank you very much for today.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐松子","displayName":"Matsuko Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r365","rowIndex":365,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=55>汐</tips>はちょこんと<tips=31>エリー</tips>に頭を下げてから、小走りで私の後をついて来る。","en":"<tips=55>Shio</tips> gave <tips=31>Ellie</tips> a small bow, then trotted after me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r366","rowIndex":366,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=31>エリー</tips>の屋敷から出ると、日が出て少し暖かくなっていた。","en":"When we emerged from <tips=31>Ellie’s</tips> house, the sun had come out and the air had grown a little warmer.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r367","rowIndex":367,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は目を細めて眩しい太陽を眺めてから、<tips=55>汐</tips>を振り返った。彼女は眉間に皺を浮かべて何事か考えている。","en":"I narrowed my eyes at the dazzling sun, then turned toward <tips=55>Shio</tips>. Her brow was knitted as she contemplated something.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r368","rowIndex":368,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「じゃあ、おれたちもここで」","en":"“Then this is where we part.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r369","rowIndex":369,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私の言葉に、彼女は気がついたように顔を上げ、","en":"At my words, she looked up as though roused from her thoughts.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r370","rowIndex":370,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうですね。今日はありがとうございました。……それにごめんなさい。あなたをそんな身体にしてしまって。今さらですけど……」","en":"“Yes. Thank you for everything today. ...And I am sorry for what I did to your body. I know it is far too late to say so now...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐松子","displayName":"Matsuko Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r371","rowIndex":371,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして頭を下げると、彼女の茶色い髪がさらりとゆれて、白いうなじが太陽の下にあらわになる。","en":"She bowed, and her brown hair slipped softly forward, baring the pale nape of her neck to the sunlight.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r372","rowIndex":372,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「とんでもない。あんたは恩人だ。命を助けてくれて、そして、あんたと会ったおかげで重要なことを知れた。この身体も戦うために役立つだろう」","en":"“Nonsense. You are my benefactor. You saved my life, and meeting you has allowed me to learn something important besides. This body will prove useful in the fight ahead.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r373","rowIndex":373,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……気をつけてくださいね。<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>が<tips=18>ローズ・クラブ</tips>の女性と同一人物だとしたら、私たちのようなものを殺す方法を知っているということですから」","en":"“...Please be careful. If <tips=20>Koschei</tips> and the woman from <tips=18>Rose Club</tips> are the same person, then he knows how to kill people like us.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐松子","displayName":"Matsuko Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r374","rowIndex":374,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「わかってる。しかし、あんたここに自分の素性を知りに来たのに、それがわからなくて残念だったな」","en":"“I know. Still, it is a shame you came all this way to learn who you really are and left without an answer.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r375","rowIndex":375,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　言うと彼女は明るく笑い、","en":"At that, she smiled brightly.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r376","rowIndex":376,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いえ、そんなことありません。今ここで聞いた話だけでも、いろいろわかりました」","en":"“No, not at all. Just from what I heard here, I’ve learned all sorts of things.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐松子","displayName":"Matsuko Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r377","rowIndex":377,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それからすぐに顔を顰めて、","en":"Then, almost immediately, her face tightened into a frown, and she added,","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r378","rowIndex":378,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ただ、私が思った通りだとすると、あまり喜ばしくはない真実になってしまうのが残念ですが……」","en":"“It is only a shame that, if things are as I suspect, the truth will prove none too pleasant...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐松子","displayName":"Matsuko Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r379","rowIndex":379,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　深刻なものを背負っているのは間違いないだろうに、彼女はそれを感じさせない穏やかな態度だった。","en":"She unquestionably carried something grave, yet her gentle manner gave no sign of it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r380","rowIndex":380,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　大体、私が知り合ったときからいつも朗らかに笑っている。考え方も前向きだ。おかしくなっても仕方ないような生活環境で、まっすぐ育ったのだろう。復讐心にまみれた私には、この状況のなかで自然体でいる彼女の姿がひどく眩しくみえた。","en":"Ever since I had met her, she had always smiled cheerfully. Her way of thinking was forward-looking as well. She had grown up straight and true in circumstances that might understandably have driven her mad. To a man steeped in vengeance, the sight of her remaining so completely herself amid all this seemed painfully radiant.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r381","rowIndex":381,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「気にしないことだ」","en":"“Try not to let it trouble you.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r382","rowIndex":382,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は目を細めながらそう言った。","en":"I narrowed my eyes as I said it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r383","rowIndex":383,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうですね。前は、自分のことを知るのが怖くて、そういう情報からずっと目をそらしていたんですよ。でも、知ってしまったら、想像していたような気分じゃないですね。なんであんなに臆病だったのかって不思議なくらい……」","en":"“Yes. I used to be afraid of learning about myself, so I kept looking away from that sort of information. But now that I know, I don’t feel the way I imagined I would. I can hardly understand why I was so frightened...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐松子","displayName":"Matsuko Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r384","rowIndex":384,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「誰だっていやな現実は見たくないさ。言い訳しようのない事実を目の当たりに突きつけられたって否定するやつもいる」","en":"“No one wants to face an unpleasant reality. Some people will deny it even when incontrovertible facts are thrust directly before their eyes.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r385","rowIndex":385,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「探偵さんが言うと説得力がありますね」","en":"“That sounds convincing when a detective says it.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐松子","displayName":"Matsuko Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r386","rowIndex":386,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=55>汐</tips>は苦笑してから、","en":"<tips=55>Shio</tips> smiled wryly, then continued.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r387","rowIndex":387,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「自分のことを調べる過程で、いろんな恐ろしいことを知りました。ショックが全然ないといえば嘘になりますけど、でも良かったです。もしそうだったらと、おそれていた予感が当たってしまったのに、なんだかさっぱりしてます。自分でもびっくりするくらい。開き直るしかないと言うか……」","en":"“In the course of investigating myself, I learned all sorts of frightening things. I would be lying if I said none of it came as a shock. But I am glad to know. The very suspicion I had been dreading proved true, and yet I somehow feel cleansed of it—so much so that I surprise even myself. Perhaps there is simply nothing for me to do but own it...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐松子","displayName":"Matsuko Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r388","rowIndex":388,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女は言葉通り晴れやかな表情をしている。","en":"Her expression was every bit as bright as her words suggested.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r389","rowIndex":389,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そして、なんだか、もっと正直に生きなきゃなと思いました。ついこの間、友だちが『どんな因縁や背景があろうとも、いまここにいる自分が全てだ』なんて言ってたんですが、そうかもしれませんね」","en":"“And it made me feel that I ought to live more honestly. Just the other day, a friend told me, ‘Whatever ties or history lie behind you, the person you are right here and now is everything.’ Perhaps that is true.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐松子","displayName":"Matsuko Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r390","rowIndex":390,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それならいいことだ」","en":"“Then that’s a good thing.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r391","rowIndex":391,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　言って、私は肩をすくめた。","en":"I shrugged.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r392","rowIndex":392,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「私はただ自分のことを語っているだけじゃなくて、<tips=50>路地</tips>さんにも言っているんですよ？」","en":"“I am not only talking about myself, Mr. <tips=50>Roji</tips>. I mean this for you as well.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐松子","displayName":"Matsuko Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r393","rowIndex":393,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どういう意味だ？」","en":"“What do you mean?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r394","rowIndex":394,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私はじろりと彼女の顔を見るが、<tips=55>汐</tips>は怯まない。","en":"I gave her a hard stare, but <tips=55>Shio</tips> did not flinch.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r395","rowIndex":395,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いろいろわだかまりがあるのかもしれませんが、今の自分を大事にした方が良いですよ」","en":"“Whatever unresolved feelings you may have, I think you should value who you are now.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐松子","displayName":"Matsuko Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r396","rowIndex":396,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私が復讐のことばかり言っていることをさしているのだろう。","en":"She was presumably referring to the way I spoke of nothing but revenge.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r397","rowIndex":397,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しかしそれは余計なお世話というものだ。彼らの死に私の責任がある以上、それを無視しては生きてゆくことなど出来るはずもなかった。","en":"But that was precisely what one called unwanted interference. So long as I bore responsibility for their deaths, I could not possibly go on living while pretending that responsibility did not exist.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r398","rowIndex":398,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……<tips=50>路地</tips>さん。本当に、本当に、無茶なことはしないでくださいね？」","en":"“...Mr. <tips=50>Roji</tips>. Please—please don’t do anything reckless.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐松子","displayName":"Matsuko Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r399","rowIndex":399,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「わかってるさ」","en":"“I know.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r400","rowIndex":400,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　本当なら怒鳴りつけたいところだが、屈託のない<tips=55>汐</tips>の顔を見ているとそういう気持ちにもならず、いい加減にうなずいてみせた。","en":"Ordinarily I would have liked nothing better than to shout her down, but the sight of <tips=55>Shio’s</tips> open, untroubled face took the impulse out of me, and I answered with a noncommittal nod.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r401","rowIndex":401,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「復讐のために命を亡くしたら、きっと恋人さんも悲しみます。私だって悲しいです。なんだって、命あってのものだねなんですから。約束ですよ？」","en":"“If you lose your life pursuing revenge, I’m sure your lover will grieve. I would grieve too. As they say, where there’s life, there’s hope. Promise me?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐松子","displayName":"Matsuko Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r402","rowIndex":402,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　施設の子供に言い聞かせるのと同じようなトーンで<tips=55>汐</tips>はそう言った。そのしつこさには私も苦笑する他ない。","en":"<tips=55>Shio</tips> spoke in the same tone she used to admonish a child at the facility. Her persistence left me no choice but to smile wryly.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r403","rowIndex":403,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　よほど信用出来ないのか、彼女はまだ疑うような、少し困ったような顔で視線を私に向けている。","en":"She apparently trusted my answer very little, for she continued to look at me with doubt and a trace of concern.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r404","rowIndex":404,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その顔を見ていると、私は<tips=53>ミユキ</tips>を思い出した。彼女もよくそんな表情をして私を見ていた。","en":"Her expression brought <tips=53>Miyuki</tips> to mind. She too had often looked at me that way.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r405","rowIndex":405,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　思い出すと、急に胸が苦しくなる。","en":"At the memory, my chest suddenly tightened.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r406","rowIndex":406,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「おれより、あんたの方が気をつけなきゃいけない。<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>はあんたの再生能力を知っているし、職場の同僚ということも知っている。そして、<tips=18>ローズ・クラブ</tips>崩壊時に『三日月』を殺したのも<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>だろう。あんたは今非常に危険な立場におかれている可能性がある。職場を変えるとか、誰か信頼出来る人間に保護を頼むとかした方が良い。少なくとも、もう<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>のことは調べるな。……あんたの同僚の仇は、おれがとってやる」","en":"“You need to be more careful than I do. <tips=20>Koschei</tips> knows about your regenerative power, and he knows you worked with his victim. <tips=20>Koschei</tips> was probably also the one who killed the Crescents when <tips=18>Rose Club</tips> fell. You may be in an extremely dangerous position. Change your workplace, or ask someone you trust to protect you. At the very least, stop investigating <tips=20>Koschei</tips>. ...I’ll avenge your colleague for you.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r407","rowIndex":407,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は自分の感情を誤魔化すようにそう忠告した。","en":"I gave her this warning to cover what I was feeling.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r408","rowIndex":408,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いえ、お気遣いだけで充分です。ありがとうございました」","en":"“No. Your concern is more than enough. Thank you.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐松子","displayName":"Matsuko Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r409","rowIndex":409,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「じゃあな」","en":"“Goodbye.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r410","rowIndex":410,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は<tips=55>汐</tips>に背を向ける。","en":"I turned my back on <tips=55>Shio</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r411","rowIndex":411,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　すると、","en":"Then—","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r412","rowIndex":412,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「お元気で！」","en":"“Take care!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E5:r413","rowIndex":413,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　すぐに<tips=55>汐</tips>の元気な声が、歩き始めた私の背中を追いかけて来た。","en":"As I started away, <tips=55>Shio’s</tips> bright voice came chasing after me at once.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}}]},{"position":40,"code":"E6","unitId":"E6","rows":[{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r1","rowIndex":1,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　カルロッタの店で<tips=49>三芳</tips>を待っていた。","en":"I waited for <tips=49>Miyoshi</tips> at Carlotta’s shop.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r2","rowIndex":2,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　この店に来るのは久しぶりで、彼女も聞きたいことはあるだろうが、余計なことを詮索しないでくれている。","en":"It had been some time since my last visit. She must have had questions of her own, but she was kind enough not to pry.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r3","rowIndex":3,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ランチタイムから夜のメニューに切り替わったばかりのまだ早い時刻だが、店内には客がちらほらとおり、カルロッタはそちらの相手をしていた。私の顔つきや態度から察してくれているのだろう。","en":"It was still early, just after the menu changed from lunch to evening service, though a scattering of customers already occupied the shop. Carlotta was attending to them. She must have understood from my face and manner.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r4","rowIndex":4,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　まるきり見ていないわけではなく、テーブルの上の飲み物がなくなったときは、次は何を頼むか訊いて来る。","en":"That did not mean she ignored me completely. Whenever the drink on my table ran out, she asked what I wanted next.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r5","rowIndex":5,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　今日は私は酒ではなくコーヒーを飲んでいた。","en":"Today I drank coffee instead of liquor.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r6","rowIndex":6,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　予定の時刻はもう過ぎた。珍しく<tips=49>三芳</tips>が遅刻している。私はすることもなく、ぼんやりとしていた。","en":"The appointed time had already passed. Unusually, <tips=49>Miyoshi</tips> was late. With nothing to do, I sat in a daze.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r7","rowIndex":7,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　店内は禁煙だから煙草を吸って時間を潰すことも出来ない。手の中で１００円ライターと煙草のソフトパッケージを弄びながら、外に行って一服しようか、それも面倒だなと、迷っているうちにふと思い立ち、ライターの炎で手の甲を炙ってみた。","en":"The shop was nonsmoking, so I could not pass the time with a cigarette. As I toyed with a hundred-yen lighter and a soft pack of cigarettes, wavering between going outside for a smoke and deciding that was too much trouble, an idea suddenly occurred to me. I held the lighter’s flame against the back of my hand.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r8","rowIndex":8,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ほんの僅かな時間だが、たちまち痛みと共に赤く変色し、そこに水ぶくれが出来た。","en":"The exposure lasted only a moment, but pain flared at once as the skin turned red and a blister rose.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r9","rowIndex":9,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その膨らんだてっぺんの皮を親指と人差し指の爪で挟んで小さく穴を開ける。そして指先で押すと、透明でヌルヌルとした液体がその穴から染み出てくる。","en":"I pinched the skin at its swollen crest between the nails of my thumb and forefinger and made a small hole. Then, when I pressed it with my fingertip, clear, slippery fluid seeped from the opening.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r10","rowIndex":10,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　火傷のひりひりした痛みは長くは続かない。赤みもすぐに収まる。","en":"The stinging pain of the burn did not last. The redness subsided almost at once.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r11","rowIndex":11,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　完全に痛みがなくなってから、水ぶくれの皮を剥がすと、下にはもう新しい皮が再生されている。そこに親指を当ててゴシゴシと擦ると、消しゴムのカスのように死んだ表皮がポロポロと落ちる。","en":"Once the pain had disappeared completely, I peeled away the blistered skin. Fresh skin had already regenerated beneath it. When I pressed my thumb to it and scrubbed, dead epidermis crumbled away like eraser shavings.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r12","rowIndex":12,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　最後におしぼりで拭うと、もうどこを焼いたのかわからなくなった。","en":"After a final wipe with the wet towel, I could no longer tell where the burn had been.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r13","rowIndex":13,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は溜息をつく。","en":"I sighed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r14","rowIndex":14,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　まったく、人並み外れた素晴らしい再生力だ。","en":"Truly, a marvelous regenerative power far beyond any ordinary human’s.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r15","rowIndex":15,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それにしても、にっくき敵と共通する特殊な体質を自分が持っているというのは奇妙な気分だ。どこか繋がっているような感覚だ。","en":"Even so, it felt strange to possess the same unusual constitution as my hated enemy. It gave me the sense that we were connected somehow.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r16","rowIndex":16,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ふと見上げるとカルロッタと目が合う。","en":"I happened to look up and meet Carlotta’s eyes.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r17","rowIndex":17,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女は何か言いたそうなそぶりを見せたが、結局何も言わずに調理をする手元に視線を戻す。","en":"She looked as though she wanted to say something, but in the end said nothing and lowered her eyes to the food she was preparing.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r18","rowIndex":18,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　結局私は外に行って一本煙草を吸った。","en":"In the end, I went outside and smoked a cigarette.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r19","rowIndex":19,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それから戻り、すっかり冷えたコーヒーを飲み干したところで、<tips=49>三芳</tips>が店内に入ってきた。","en":"Then I returned, and just as I finished the coffee that had gone entirely cold, <tips=49>Miyoshi</tips> entered.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r20","rowIndex":20,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女は以前ここで会った時と同じ場所に座る私をすぐに見つけてやって来ると、カルロッタにコーヒーを注文し、私の隣の席に腰をかける。","en":"She spotted me at once, sitting where I had when we met here before, and came over. After ordering coffee from Carlotta, she sat beside me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r21","rowIndex":21,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「すみません。会議が長引いて遅れてしまって……」","en":"“I’m sorry. The meeting ran long...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"三芳","displayName":"Miyoshi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r22","rowIndex":22,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「かまわんさ。今日は一人かい？　あの加藤とかいうやつはいないのか」","en":"“Do not worry about it. Are you alone today? That fellow Kato is not with you?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r23","rowIndex":23,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「これは正規の業務ではないですから……」","en":"“This isn’t part of my official duties...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"三芳","displayName":"Miyoshi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r24","rowIndex":24,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうか。まあ、そうだろうな。じゃあ、例のモノを持って来てくれたってわけかい？」","en":"“I see. Well, I suppose that is only natural. So you have brought the item we discussed?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r25","rowIndex":25,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ええ……でも、ここでは……」","en":"“Yes... But not here...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"三芳","displayName":"Miyoshi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r26","rowIndex":26,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=49>三芳</tips>は声を潜めてそう答える。","en":"<tips=49>Miyoshi</tips> lowered her voice.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r27","rowIndex":27,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「この席なら大丈夫。この場所ならカルロッタしか見えないし、あいつは信用してくれていい」","en":"“We are safe at this seat. Carlotta is the only person with a view of us from here, and you can trust her.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r28","rowIndex":28,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうですか……」","en":"“I see...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"三芳","displayName":"Miyoshi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r29","rowIndex":29,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女はキョロキョロと辺りを見回してから、肩からかけていた革のバッグを開くと、中から三角形の分厚い布包みをとりだしてカウンターの上にゴトリと置く。","en":"After darting a look around the room, she opened the leather bag slung over her shoulder, took out a thick triangular bundle wrapped in cloth, and set it on the counter with a heavy thunk.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r30","rowIndex":30,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私はずっしりと重いそれを手にとって、布をずらしてそのなかのものを確認する。","en":"I picked up the weighty bundle and pulled the cloth aside to inspect what lay within.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r31","rowIndex":31,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　銀色に鈍く輝く銃身。<tips=43>APTG</tips>と呼ばれるこの銃は、サイキックをただの人間に変えてしまう特殊な銃弾を撃つための特別な銃だ。どうか一丁くれないかと前から交渉していたのだ。","en":"A gun barrel with a dull silver gleam. The weapon was called an <tips=43>APTG</tips>, a special gun built to fire special rounds that reduced psychics to ordinary human beings. I had been negotiating for some time to get my hands on one.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r32","rowIndex":32,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「弾は？」","en":"“Ammunition?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r33","rowIndex":33,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あります。手を」","en":"“I have some. Hold out your hand.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"三芳","displayName":"Miyoshi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r34","rowIndex":34,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=49>三芳</tips>はジャケットのポケットに手を突っ込んで、差し出した私の手のひらの上に四つの小さな筒を乗せる。","en":"<tips=49>Miyoshi</tips> reached into her jacket pocket and placed four small cylinders upon my open palm.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r35","rowIndex":35,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「先月配備された最新式のやつだろうね？　旧式じゃ困るぜ」","en":"“These are the latest rounds, the ones issued last month, correct? The old type will not do.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r36","rowIndex":36,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「もう旧式は全部送り返してあります」","en":"“We have already sent all the old rounds back.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"三芳","displayName":"Miyoshi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r37","rowIndex":37,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それは助かる。せっかく命中させても、薬の効果が現れるまでに能力を使われて、こっちが返り討ち、なんてことになったら意味がないからな」","en":"“That is a relief. There would be no point in landing the shot if the target could still use an ability before the drug took effect and turn the tables on me.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r38","rowIndex":38,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「セーフティロックの外し方は……」","en":"“As for releasing the safety lock...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"三芳","displayName":"Miyoshi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r39","rowIndex":39,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いや、説明はいらないよ」","en":"“No. I don’t need an explanation.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r40","rowIndex":40,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は断りながら、その包みをベルトと腹の間にねじりこんだ。","en":"Declining the explanation, I forced the wrapped gun between my belt and my stomach.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r41","rowIndex":41,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=49>三芳</tips>は知らないだろうが、今の私は能力がフルに使える状態だ。どんなロックがかかっていたところで、引き金を引けば弾が出る。","en":"<tips=49>Miyoshi</tips> did not know that I could now use my ability at full strength. No matter what safety mechanism the gun possessed, pulling the trigger would fire it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r42","rowIndex":42,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　逆に言えば、安全に持ち運びたいときでもうっかり引き金を引いたら暴発してしまうのだ。","en":"Conversely, even when I wanted to carry it safely, an accidental squeeze would discharge it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r43","rowIndex":43,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　だから私は、銃だとか、ロックを解除して使わなければならない危険な武器を持ち歩くのが好きではないのだが、さすがに今回ばかりはこれに頼らざるを得ない。","en":"That was why I disliked carrying guns and other dangerous weapons that required a lock to be released before use. This time, however, even I had no choice but to rely on one.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r44","rowIndex":44,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　何と言っても、相手がまともではない。まだ能力の全貌が明らかではない<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>と、念動力者の<tips=11>灰上璃映子</tips>という二人の恐るべきサイキックを敵にしているのである。","en":"My opponents were anything but ordinary: <tips=20>Koschei</tips>, whose full array of powers remained unknown, and the terrifying telekinetic <tips=11>Rieko Haigami</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r45","rowIndex":45,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　この最新装備でも足りないくらいだ。","en":"Even this latest weapon might not be enough.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r46","rowIndex":46,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「出来れば、ガスを噴霧するやつの方が欲しかったんだがね」","en":"“I’d have preferred the model that sprays gas, if possible.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r47","rowIndex":47,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あれはどうやっても持ち出すことは出来ません」","en":"“There is no possible way I could smuggle one of those out.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"三芳","displayName":"Miyoshi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r48","rowIndex":48,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ま、これでも上出来さ」","en":"“Well, even this is more than good enough.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r49","rowIndex":49,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「くれぐれも、不要に見せびらかしたりしないでくださいね。もし発覚すれば、私の首が飛びます」","en":"“Please, whatever you do, don’t go showing it off unnecessarily. If this is discovered, I will lose my job.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"三芳","displayName":"Miyoshi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r50","rowIndex":50,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=49>三芳</tips>は緊張した面持ちで言う。","en":"<tips=49>Miyoshi</tips> spoke with a tense expression.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r51","rowIndex":51,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「わかってるよ。……しかし、自分で頼んでおいてなんだが、よくここまでやってくれたもんだ」","en":"“I understand. ...Though it may be strange to say after asking you myself, I’m impressed you managed all this.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r52","rowIndex":52,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……絶対に、<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>を捕まえたいんです。そのためには、あなたを信じるのが一番だと思いましたから……」","en":"“...I am determined to capture <tips=20>Koschei</tips>. I decided that trusting you was the best way to accomplish that...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"三芳","displayName":"Miyoshi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r53","rowIndex":53,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「有り難い話だが、そんなにおれを信用していいのかい？」","en":"“I’m grateful, but are you certain I deserve that much trust?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r54","rowIndex":54,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あなたの探偵時代の経歴は一通り調べました。やり方はともかく、この街の貧しい人や、弱いもののために尽力して来た人です。逮捕された事件だって、依頼人のために行ったことです。警察にもそういう尊敬すべき人はいますが、少なくとも今<tips=9>Y地区</tips>を担当しているもののなかには……。私は経験が足りませんが、彼らには、<tips=9>Y地区</tips>をなんとかしようという情熱が足りません。<tips=48>堂島</tips>刑事は両方持っていた人だと思いますが……。だから、あなたに頼るしかないんです」","en":"“I looked into the broad outlines of your career as a detective. Whatever one may think of your methods, you devoted yourself to the poor and the weak of this city. Even the incident for which you were arrested arose from something you did on a client's behalf. There are police officers worthy of that same respect, but at least among those presently responsible for <tips=9>Y District</tips>... I may lack experience, but they lack any passion to do something about <tips=9>Y District</tips>. Detective <tips=48>Dojima</tips>, I believe, was a man who possessed both... That is why you are the only person I can rely on.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"三芳","displayName":"Miyoshi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r55","rowIndex":55,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「かいかぶりすぎだな。人は変わるものだ。おれももう、探偵時代ほど若くも純粋でもない」","en":"“You give me too much credit. People change. I’m neither as young nor as pure as I was in my detective days.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r56","rowIndex":56,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……ここまで一緒に捜査して来た私の確信です。だから、どうなったとしても私が責任をとります」","en":"“...It is what I have become convinced of over the course of our investigation together. Whatever happens, I will take responsibility.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"三芳","displayName":"Miyoshi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r57","rowIndex":57,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「お嬢さん見直したぜ」","en":"“You have gone up in my estimation, young lady.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r58","rowIndex":58,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「お嬢さん、と呼ぶのはやめてください」","en":"“Please stop calling me young lady.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"三芳","displayName":"Miyoshi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r59","rowIndex":59,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「わかったよ、<tips=49>三芳</tips>さん」","en":"“Very well, Ms. <tips=49>Miyoshi</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r60","rowIndex":60,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女の思い詰めた態度に、私は肩をすくめて苦笑した。","en":"I shrugged and smiled wryly at her grim resolve.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r61","rowIndex":61,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　かつて『<tips=18>ローズ・クラブ</tips>』で働いていたという人物の情報を掴み、会うことになっていた。","en":"We had tracked down someone said to have once worked at the <tips=18>Rose Club</tips> and arranged to meet them.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r62","rowIndex":62,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　たんなる下働きで、<tips=31>エリー・ホワイト</tips>ほど核心的な情報を持っている可能性は低かったが、それでも何かしら<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>の手がかりを得ることが出来るかもしれない。","en":"The person had been no more than a menial worker and was unlikely to know anything as central to the affair as <tips=31>Ellie White</tips> did. Even so, we might still obtain some clue that would lead us to <tips=20>Koschei</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r63","rowIndex":63,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……しかし、<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>が『<tips=18>ローズ・クラブ</tips>』に深く関与していたとなると、大分話が変わってきますね。ただ当局から逃れるためにたまたま訪れたのではなく、この街に何か目的があったのかもしれません」","en":"“...But if <tips=20>Koschei</tips> was deeply involved with the <tips=18>Rose Club</tips>, that changes matters considerably. Perhaps he did not merely happen to come here while fleeing the authorities; perhaps he had some purpose in this city.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"三芳","displayName":"Miyoshi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r64","rowIndex":64,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=49>三芳</tips>には、私が個人的に調査したことをある程度流している。","en":"I had been feeding <tips=49>Miyoshi</tips> some of what my private investigation uncovered.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r65","rowIndex":65,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女の態度が変わったのは、こうして情報を共有するようになってからだ。元々仕事熱心なタイプではあったが、街について知るにつれて何か使命感を帯びているような気がする。","en":"Her attitude had changed after we began sharing information this way. She had always worked hard, but as she learned more about the city, she seemed to acquire a sense of mission.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r66","rowIndex":66,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　警察官としては立派な態度だと褒めたくもなるが、実際彼女の立場からすると、その情熱は危険なものとなるだろう。『<tips=18>ローズ・クラブ</tips>』の件は、警察の上層部としては蒸し返したくない問題のはずだからだ。","en":"As a police officer, her attitude was admirable enough to deserve praise. In practice, however, that passion would be dangerous in her position. The <tips=18>Rose Club</tips> affair was surely something the police leadership wished to leave buried.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r67","rowIndex":67,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　クラブの顧客には大層な肩書きを持つ人々も多く含まれていた。彼らはあのクラブで『特殊な』サービスを受けていたはずだが、結局どういう人間が通っていたのか、詳しいところは今でも明らかにされていない。","en":"The club’s customers had included many people with imposing titles. They must have received “special” services there, yet the details of precisely who frequented the place remained undisclosed even now.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r68","rowIndex":68,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　警察が全く事実を把握していなかったということは考えづらいから、なんらかの力が働いてもみ消されたのだろう。あるいは警察内の誰かが顧客リストに名を連ねていたのかもしれない。当時の警察の『<tips=18>ローズ・クラブ</tips>』への対応を思い出せば、あながち陰謀論とも片付けられない。","en":"It was difficult to believe that the police had grasped none of the truth, so some form of influence had presumably been brought to bear and the affair suppressed. Or perhaps someone within the police had been named on the customer list. Given the police response to <tips=18>Rose Club</tips> at the time, the possibility could not simply be dismissed as a conspiracy theory.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r69","rowIndex":69,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そうでなくとも、あのような残虐クラブを野放しにし、ギャングたちの襲撃を招き、そして結果論とは言え<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>が生まれてしまったのは、警察が本来の職務を果たさなかったからだ。良い思い出のはずがない。","en":"Even setting that aside, the police had failed in their proper duty: they left that place of cruelty to operate unchecked, provoked the gangs into attacking it, and, whatever one might say in hindsight, allowed <tips=7>YS</tips> to be born from the consequences. The affair could hardly be a fond memory for them.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r70","rowIndex":70,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=49>三芳</tips>がいかに情熱を持って真実を明らかにしても、組織のなかで報われることはないだろう。むしろ、彼女の立場を危うくするかもしれない。","en":"However passionately <tips=49>Miyoshi</tips> pursued and revealed the truth, the organization would never reward her. Her efforts might instead endanger her position.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r71","rowIndex":71,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女がそれをどの程度理解しているのかはわからないが、夢中になりすぎてバランスを欠いているのは明白だ。<tips=43>APTG</tips>をくすねて私に渡すなど、それだけでも懲戒免職ものじゃないか。","en":"I did not know how much she understood, but she was plainly too absorbed to keep her perspective. Stealing an <tips=43>APTG</tips> and handing it to me would alone be grounds for dismissal.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r72","rowIndex":72,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　このままじゃ彼女は破滅するだろう。私はそう思ったが、何も言わなかった。","en":"At this rate, she would destroy herself. I thought so, but said nothing.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r73","rowIndex":73,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　たとえ彼女を破滅に追い込むとしても、その情熱は私にとって利用価値があるものだったからだ。","en":"Even if it drove her to ruin, that passion was something I could make use of.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r74","rowIndex":74,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「この街でまた何かしようとしているのでしょうか？　この猟奇殺人にも、深い意味があるのでしょうか？」","en":"“Do you think he intends to do something else in this city? Could these horrific murders have some deeper meaning?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"三芳","displayName":"Miyoshi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r75","rowIndex":75,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女は興奮気味に言う。","en":"Her voice was edged with excitement.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r76","rowIndex":76,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「さあ、どうだろう。そこまではわからないね。ただ、そうだとしたら都合がいい」","en":"“Who can say? I do not know that much yet. But if it is true, all the better for me.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r77","rowIndex":77,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「都合がいい？」","en":"“It suits you?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"三芳","displayName":"Miyoshi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r78","rowIndex":78,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「何か重要な理由があってこの街に帰って来たのなら、少なくとも目的が果たされるまでは街から出て行ったりしないだろう。まあ、逃げたってどこまでも追うつもりだが、ここに居た方が都合が良いからな。ここならば、おれはなんでも出来る」","en":"“If he returned for some important reason, he won’t leave the city until he has accomplished his purpose, at least. I mean to pursue him however far he runs, but it is more convenient if he stays here. In this city, I can do anything.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r79","rowIndex":79,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私がそう言うと、<tips=49>三芳</tips>は顔を顰める。","en":"At my words, <tips=49>Miyoshi</tips> grimaced.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r80","rowIndex":80,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どうした？」","en":"“What is wrong?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r81","rowIndex":81,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いや、いま、<tips=50>路地</tips>さん、とても怖い顔をしたので」","en":"“No—it’s just that, for a moment there, Mr. <tips=50>Roji</tips>, you had a terrifying look on your face.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"三芳","displayName":"Miyoshi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r82","rowIndex":82,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうか？」","en":"“Did I?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r83","rowIndex":83,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「全体的に、前と雰囲気が違うような気がします」","en":"“Your whole manner seems different somehow from before.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"三芳","displayName":"Miyoshi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r84","rowIndex":84,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうかもしれないな。おれは生まれ変わったようなものだから」","en":"“Perhaps I am. You might say I’ve been reborn.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r85","rowIndex":85,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その老婆は、当時『<tips=18>ローズ・クラブ</tips>』で清掃作業に従事しており、<tips=3>クリス</tips>や<tips=5>太刀川</tips>が襲撃作戦を行った時も、その現場にいたと言う。","en":"The old woman had worked as a cleaner at the <tips=18>Rose Club</tips>. She said she had been present when <tips=3>Chris</tips> and <tips=5>Tachikawa</tips> carried out their attack.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r86","rowIndex":86,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「私は裏口で作業をしていたんです。すると真っ黒な服を着た人たちがゾロゾロと入って来て……それが<tips=3>クリス</tips>さまとその部下の方々だったんですよ」","en":"“I was working by the back entrance. Then all these people dressed entirely in black came streaming inside... Lord <tips=3>Chris</tips> and his subordinates, as it turned out.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r87","rowIndex":87,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　今は腰を痛めて働けなくなってしまったその老婆は、揺り椅子に腰掛けていた。","en":"The old woman, now unable to work because of an injured back, sat in a rocking chair.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r88","rowIndex":88,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　娘夫婦は二人とも<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>支配下の飲食店で働いていると言う。Ｔ４通りに建ち並ぶプレハブ小屋の一つであるその家は、狭くはあったが最新式の家電製品が揃い、老婆が生けた生花などもあちこちに飾られており、貧しくは見えなかった。","en":"Her daughter and son-in-law both worked at a restaurant controlled by <tips=7>YS</tips>. Their home, one of the prefabricated huts lining T4 Street, was small but furnished with the latest appliances. Fresh flowers the old woman had arranged stood here and there. The household did not appear poor.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r89","rowIndex":89,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「彼らは私を見つけると、銃で脅しながら押さえつけて来たので、生きた心地がしなくてブルブルと震えてしまったんですが、その中のハンサムな若い人が、優しい声で『命までは奪わない』と言ってくれたもんで、少しラクになりました。あとで知ったんですが、あれが<tips=3>クリス</tips>様だったんですよ」","en":"“When they found me, they held me down at gunpoint. I was so terrified I scarcely felt alive, and I trembled all over. But then a handsome young man among them said gently, ‘We will not take your life,’ and that put me somewhat at ease. I learned afterward that he was Lord <tips=3>Chris</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r90","rowIndex":90,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　老婆はよほど話好きらしく、聞いてもいないのに襲撃の日のことをとめどもなく喋り続けた。","en":"The old woman evidently loved to talk. Without being asked, she continued pouring out memories of the day of the attack.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r91","rowIndex":91,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しかし私たちが聞きたいのはその話ではない。清掃係として施設内のあちこちに入り込み、オーナーである<tips=60>ロジャー・アダムス</tips>や、その周辺で不死の儀式を行っていた『<tips=61>ヒトミ</tips>』についても詳しいと言うからここにやって来たのだ。","en":"That, however, was not the story we had come to hear. Her cleaning work had taken her into every part of the premises, and she claimed to know a great deal about the owner, <tips=60>Roger Adams</tips>, as well as <tips=61>Hitomi</tips>, the woman in his circle who had conducted the rituals that made people deathless.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r92","rowIndex":92,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「婆さん、すまないが、その話はそれくらいにして、本題について話して欲しいんだが」","en":"“Ma’am, I’m sorry, but could we leave that story there and return to the main subject?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r93","rowIndex":93,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まあ、ごめんなさいね。年寄りは話が長くなっちゃって。で、なんの話をすればいいんでしたっけ？」","en":"“Oh, forgive me. Old people do go on. Now, what was I supposed to tell you?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r94","rowIndex":94,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「オーナーの<tips=60>ロジャー・アダムス</tips>と、そのまわりにいた女の……いや、その前にちょっと見て貰いたいものがある。<tips=49>三芳</tips>さんよ、あれを」","en":"“About the owner, <tips=60>Roger Adams</tips>, and the woman around him... No, first there’s something I want you to see. Ms. <tips=49>Miyoshi</tips>, show her.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r95","rowIndex":95,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私が促すと、<tips=49>三芳</tips>はタブレット端末を取り出して、そこに画像を表示して老婆に手渡す。","en":"At my prompting, <tips=49>Miyoshi</tips> took out a tablet, displayed the images, and handed it to the old woman.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r96","rowIndex":96,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女に見せたのは、『<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>』の変身した姿と思われる二枚の写真だ。一枚は、黒髪の青年の姿。もう一枚は、金髪の少女の姿である。どちらも、<tips=48>堂島</tips>の義眼に仕掛けられたカメラがとらえたものだった。","en":"We showed her two photographs believed to depict forms assumed by <tips=20>Koschei</tips>. One showed a black-haired young man; the other, a blond girl. Both images had been captured by the camera concealed in <tips=48>Dojima’s</tips> artificial eye.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r97","rowIndex":97,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どちらも、随分綺麗な顔をしていますねえ……」","en":"“They both have very beautiful faces...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r98","rowIndex":98,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　老眼鏡をかけた老婆は、両手に掴んだタブレットを目一杯遠ざけ、老眼に見やすい距離をとりながら言う。","en":"Wearing reading glasses, the old woman held the tablet in both hands as far from her face as possible, finding the distance at which her aging eyes could focus.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r99","rowIndex":99,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「古いことだから難しいかもしれないが、よく思い出してくれ。このどちらかの顔を、当時クラブのなかで見かけた記憶はないかい？」","en":"“It was long ago, so this may be difficult. Think carefully. Do you remember seeing either of these faces inside the club back then?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r100","rowIndex":100,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「うーん……そうですねえ……」","en":"“Hmm... Let me see...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r101","rowIndex":101,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　老婆は首を捻ってから、","en":"The old woman tilted her head, then said,","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r102","rowIndex":102,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そう言えば、こちらの男の人は、ちらっと見かけたことがあるような……」","en":"“Now that you mention it, I feel as though I caught a glimpse of this young man...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r103","rowIndex":103,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「本当かい？」","en":"“Really?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r104","rowIndex":104,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ええ。たしか、プラチナ・クラスの階で、お客さんでも職員でもない人がいるから誰だろうと思って見ていたんです。すると、目が合ってなんだかニヤニヤと笑って、聞いたことのない言葉を喋っていた気がしますねえ……」","en":"“Yes. I believe it was on the Platinum Class floor. I saw someone who was neither a customer nor an employee and wondered who he might be. Our eyes met, and I think he gave me a strange grin and spoke in a language I had never heard before...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r105","rowIndex":105,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうかい。ありがとう」","en":"“I see. Thank you.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r106","rowIndex":106,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は<tips=49>三芳</tips>と目配せをして、そしてタブレットを引き取った。","en":"I exchanged a glance with <tips=49>Miyoshi</tips>, then took back the tablet.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r107","rowIndex":107,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それから、<tips=60>ロジャー・アダムス</tips>と<tips=61>ヒトミ</tips>について話を聞いた。","en":"Afterward, we asked about <tips=60>Roger Adams</tips> and <tips=61>Hitomi</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r108","rowIndex":108,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=60>ロジャー・アダムス</tips>は皆に優しく評判の良い経営者であったとか、<tips=61>ヒトミ</tips>は彼と睦まじい姿を見せていたなどという話を聞けたが、それらは今の私たちにとってはそれほど重要な話ではない。","en":"We heard that <tips=60>Roger Adams</tips> had been a kind proprietor well regarded by everyone, and that he and <tips=61>Hitomi</tips> had often appeared quite affectionate with one another. None of it was especially important to us now.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r109","rowIndex":109,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　とにかく、『<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>』の姿をクラブのなかで見かけたという、その話を聞けただけでもここに来たかいがあったと言うべきだろう。","en":"In any event, hearing that <tips=20>Koschei</tips> had been seen inside the club made the visit worthwhile by itself.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r110","rowIndex":110,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=61>ヒトミ</tips>は『<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>』の姿の一つであるという私の推測が、いよいよ確実なものになったのだ。","en":"My conjecture that <tips=61>Hitomi</tips> was one of <tips=20>Koschei’s</tips> forms had now become all but certain.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r111","rowIndex":111,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちは老婆の家から路上に出た。","en":"We stepped from the old woman’s house into the street.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r112","rowIndex":112,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　朝から降り続く雨は衰えを見せず、辺りはもう暗くなりはじめている。","en":"The rain that had fallen since morning showed no sign of weakening, and darkness was already beginning to settle.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r113","rowIndex":113,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「喫茶店でも行って、次の聞き込みのための準備をしよう」","en":"“Let’s find a café and get ready for the next interview.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r114","rowIndex":114,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私がそう宣言して歩き出すと、","en":"I declared, and as I started walking,","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r115","rowIndex":115,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あ、待って下さい」","en":"“Wait, please.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"三芳","displayName":"Miyoshi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r116","rowIndex":116,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=49>三芳</tips>が呼び止めて、自分の携帯電話を取り出す。そして数語言葉を交わすにつれて、その顔が青ざめてゆく。","en":"<tips=49>Miyoshi</tips> stopped me and took out her phone. As she exchanged a few words, the color drained from her face.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r117","rowIndex":117,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　町外れの<tips=17>タイプB</tips>専用の閉鎖病院である<tips=6>国立巻河原病院</tips>――通称『<tips=6>タイプＢ収容所</tips>』が武装集団に襲われたという、にわかには信じられない情報が飛び込んできた。","en":"Incredible news suddenly reached us: National <tips=6>Makigawara Hospital</tips>, a secure institution for <tips=17>Type B</tips> patients on the outskirts of the city—commonly called the <tips=6>Type B Internment Center</tips>—had been attacked by an armed group.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r118","rowIndex":118,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　武装集団は出勤していた七十三名の職員のうち、二十名ほどを殺害し、患者たちを解放したらしい。","en":"The group had reportedly killed approximately twenty of the seventy-three employees at work and liberated the patients.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r119","rowIndex":119,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そしてその武装集団は<tips=47>八龍解放軍</tips>と名乗っていたという。","en":"And the armed group had called itself the <tips=47>Hachiryu Liberation Army</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r120","rowIndex":120,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちはすぐに予定を変更して急行する。到着した時はまだ現場がそのままになっていて、管理棟のそばでバラバラになった死体が雨に打たれていた。","en":"We immediately changed our plans and rushed to the scene. When we arrived, it remained untouched, and a dismembered body lay in the rain beside the administration building.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r121","rowIndex":121,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「この辺りの死体は、警備員たちと、見舞いに来た患者の家族の遺体のようです。管理棟では事務職員たちと院長の三名が殺害されています。それ以外の事務職員はロープで縛られてはいるものの、無事です」","en":"“The bodies around here appear to belong to security guards and relatives visiting patients. Three people in the administration building—the director and two clerical workers—were killed. The other clerical workers were tied with rope, but are unharmed.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r122","rowIndex":122,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　先に現場に到着していた加藤刑事は黄色い雨合羽を着ており、<tips=49>三芳</tips>の姿を見つけると報告をはじめる。","en":"Detective Kato had reached the scene before us. Wearing a yellow raincoat, he began his report as soon as he saw <tips=49>Miyoshi</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r123","rowIndex":123,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「他の死亡者は、B棟に集中しています。こちらは出勤していた職員はみな三階のホールに集められて、そこで銃弾を浴びせられたようです。ほぼ皆殺しといって良い状態で、ホールが血の海になっていますよ……」","en":"“The remaining deaths are concentrated in Ward B. It appears that all the staff members on duty there were gathered in the third-floor hall and sprayed with bullets. Nearly every one of them was killed. The hall is a sea of blood...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r124","rowIndex":124,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は死体を調べる監察医にまじって、バラバラ死体のそばにしゃがみ込みながらその報告を聞いていた。","en":"I listened to the report while crouching beside the dismembered body as medical examiners inspected it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r125","rowIndex":125,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちがいる管理棟の玄関先では、まるでミキサーに放り込まれたように切り裂かれた人の手足が散らばっている。ここには警備員一人と、患者の親夫婦、三人分の死体があるそうだ。確かに頭が三つ落ちているが、そうやって一つしかないパーツを数えなければ数もわからないような状態だ。","en":"Outside the entrance to the administration building, human limbs lay scattered as though someone had thrown them into a blender. The remains apparently belonged to one security guard and a patient’s parents: three bodies in all. There were indeed three heads, but unless one counted distinctive parts of that kind, there would have been no way even to determine the number.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r126","rowIndex":126,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「生き残った職員たちには、いま捜査員が手分けして聞き取りを行っています。何しろこれだけの事件ですし、あまりこの街に長時間留まって、じっくり捜査したくはないですからね。署で動けるやつを片っ端から連れてきましたが、人員も車両も応援が来る予定です。なるべく短い時間で現場での捜査を切り上げようって方針だそうです。それで、<tips=49>三芳</tips>さんは、どうしますか？」","en":"“Investigators are dividing the surviving employees among them for interviews now. An incident this large demands it, and we would rather not remain in this city long enough to conduct a painstaking investigation. We brought every available officer from the station, and additional personnel and vehicles are expected. The policy is to finish the work at the scene as quickly as possible. What will you do, Ms. <tips=49>Miyoshi</tips>?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r127","rowIndex":127,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「私は、そうですね……<tips=50>路地</tips>さん、どうしますか？」","en":"“I... Let me see... Mr. <tips=50>Roji</tips>, what should we do?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"三芳","displayName":"Miyoshi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r128","rowIndex":128,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=49>三芳</tips>は自分の意見を言わず、そのまま私に尋ねる。","en":"Without offering an opinion of her own, <tips=49>Miyoshi</tips> passed the question directly to me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r129","rowIndex":129,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そんな風に、部下たちの前で私のような市民にすぐ頼るから、<tips=9>Y地区</tips>捜査班のリーダー的なポジションであるのに、意見も求められずにこんな事後承諾みたいなかたちで捜査内容を知らされることになるんだ。","en":"There, in front of her own subordinates, she had immediately turned for guidance to a civilian like me. That was precisely why, despite occupying what amounted to the leadership position on the <tips=9>Y District</tips> investigation team, no one had sought her opinion and she was being informed of the operation only after the fact.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r130","rowIndex":130,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私はそう思ったが、彼女は事件の衝撃のせいで自分が署の連中にないがしろにされていることを気にかける余裕もないようだった。","en":"That was my thought. Miyoshi herself seemed too shocked by the incident to notice that the people at her station had pushed her aside.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r131","rowIndex":131,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　立ち上がると、<tips=49>三芳</tips>は自分の傘をずぶ濡れになっている私に傾ける。","en":"When I stood, <tips=49>Miyoshi</tips> angled her umbrella over my drenched body.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r132","rowIndex":132,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　折りたたみの小さな傘に私を入れようとすると彼女の肩が濡れるので、私は傘のへりをぐいと押してその好意を断りつつ、","en":"It was a small folding umbrella, and trying to fit me beneath it left her own shoulder exposed to the rain. I firmly pushed the rim back, declining the gesture as I said,","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r133","rowIndex":133,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「とりあえず、病棟の方も見ておこうか。現場はまだもとのままなんだろう？」","en":"“For now, why don’t we take a look at the ward too? The scene’s still untouched, isn’t it?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r134","rowIndex":134,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　加藤に尋ねると、彼は無表情に頷く。","en":"When I asked Kato, he nodded without expression.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r135","rowIndex":135,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「じゃあ決まりだ。行こう」","en":"“Then it’s settled. Let’s go.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r136","rowIndex":136,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は<tips=49>三芳</tips>を促し、歩きはじめる。","en":"I motioned for <tips=49>Miyoshi</tips> to follow and started walking.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r137","rowIndex":137,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「は、はい」","en":"“Y-yes.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"三芳","displayName":"Miyoshi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r138","rowIndex":138,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=49>三芳</tips>がそう頷き私を追うと、加藤もそのあとを付いてきた。","en":"<tips=49>Miyoshi</tips> nodded and hurried after me, and Kato followed behind her.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r139","rowIndex":139,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あのバラバラ死体は、<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>の仕業だな」","en":"“That dismembered body was <tips=20>Koschei’s</tips> work.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r140","rowIndex":140,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　雨に濡れて歩きながら、私は<tips=49>三芳</tips>にそう囁く。","en":"I whispered this to <tips=49>Miyoshi</tips> as we walked through the rain.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r141","rowIndex":141,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>の殺し方には二種類ある。几帳面に四角い肉片に切断するやりかたと、でたらめにバラバラにぶちまけるやり方だ。路地裏で見つかった女の死体は大体前者で、おれのアパートでミユキがやられていたようなのが後者だ。今回は、散らかす方のやり方だな。きっと、時間がないときに使う方法なんだろう。……警察の見立てでは、この遺体はどんな道具を使ってバラバラにされたことになってるんだい？」","en":"“<tips=20>Koschei</tips> kills in two different ways. One is to cut the body meticulously into square chunks of flesh. The other is to tear it apart at random and scatter the pieces everywhere. The women found dead in the back alleys were generally examples of the first; what he did to Miyuki in my apartment was the second. This time, he used the method that leaves a mess. I imagine it is the one he resorts to when short on time. ...What do the police believe was used to dismember this body?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r142","rowIndex":142,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まだ現場検証中ですが、刃物ではなく、サイキックではないかという話です」","en":"“The scene examination is still underway, but they’re saying it was done not with a blade, but with a psychic ability.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"三芳","displayName":"Miyoshi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r143","rowIndex":143,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=49>三芳</tips>がそう言うと、後の加藤が補足する。","en":"After <tips=49>Miyoshi</tips> answered, Kato added from behind us,","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r144","rowIndex":144,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あまりにも短時間のうちに解体されているので、普通の刃物では不可能なんです。……それと、病院の裏のコンクリート塀も同じように切断されています。こちらは襲撃犯たちが侵入するために塀を壊したのだと思われますが、病院の誰に聞いても切断時の物音を耳にしたという証言がなく、やはりこちらもサイキック能力でなければ難しいでしょう」","en":"“They were dismembered in far too short a time for any ordinary blade to have done it. ...And the concrete wall behind the hospital was cut apart in the same fashion. We believe the attackers broke through it to enter, but no one at the hospital reports hearing the cutting. That too would have been difficult without a psychic ability.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r145","rowIndex":145,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そちらも、<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>の仕業なんだろうか……」","en":"“Could that have been <tips=20>Koschei’s</tips> work as well...?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r146","rowIndex":146,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私が呟くと、加藤が言う。","en":"When I murmured this, Kato said,","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r147","rowIndex":147,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「担当捜査官は、<tips=21>八龍会</tips>の<tips=10>見土道夫</tips>という青年によるものだと考えているようです。彼も物を切断するサイキック能力を持っていますから」","en":"“The investigator in charge apparently believes it was done by <tips=10>Michio Mido</tips> of the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips>. He also possesses a psychic ability that cuts through objects.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r148","rowIndex":148,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まあ<tips=47>八龍解放軍</tips>というのがその名の通り<tips=21>八龍会</tips>の組織なら、やつもいたのかもしれないな。しかし、少なくともこっちのバラバラ死体は<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>がやったので間違いないだろう。……しかしそうなると、<tips=21>八龍会</tips>とやつが手を組んだってことになるが、どういう繋がりなのか……」","en":"“Well, if the <tips=47>Hachiryu Liberation Army</tips> is, true to its name, an organization of the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips>, Mido may indeed have been there. But this dismembered body, at least, was almost certainly <tips=20>Koschei’s</tips> work. ...And if that is so, the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips> and Koschei are working together. But what could connect them...?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r149","rowIndex":149,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は首を捻る。","en":"I cocked my head.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r150","rowIndex":150,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「このバラバラ死体も<tips=10>見土</tips>の仕業ってことはないんですかね？　<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>の手口を真似て、捜査を撹乱するのが目的とか」","en":"“Could this dismembered body not be <tips=10>Mido’s</tips> work as well? Perhaps he imitated <tips=20>Koschei’s</tips> methods in order to misdirect the investigation.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r151","rowIndex":151,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　加藤がそう尋ねる。<tips=49>三芳</tips>はその間で、私と加藤の顔を交互に見ている。","en":"Kato asked. Between us, <tips=49>Miyoshi</tips> looked back and forth from his face to mine.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r152","rowIndex":152,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それはないと思うね。<tips=10>見土</tips>の力をこんなにバラバラになるまで使っていたら、時間もかかるし、体力の消耗も激しい。それに、この手口はヤツらしくないんだ」","en":"“I don’t think so. If <tips=10>Mido</tips> used his power enough to reduce someone to this many pieces, it would take time and exhaust him severely. Besides, this method isn’t like him.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r153","rowIndex":153,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は<tips=49>三芳</tips>の方を見て言った。","en":"I said this while looking at <tips=49>Miyoshi</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r154","rowIndex":154,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あの<tips=10>見土</tips>ってのはガキの頃から不良少年たちのリーダーとして有名だったんだよ。他のグループと争うときもボス同士素手で一対一の喧嘩を挑んだり、あきらかに弱いやつは相手にせず見逃したり……なんというか、古風なやつなんだ。殺し自体はしても、こんなふうに遺体を損壊するとは思えない」","en":"“That <tips=10>Mido</tips> has been famous since childhood as a leader of the local delinquents. Even when his group fought another, he would challenge the opposing boss to a bare-knuckle fight, one on one, and let anyone plainly weaker than himself go... He is old-fashioned, you might say. He may be capable of killing, but I cannot imagine him mutilating a body this way.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r155","rowIndex":155,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうなんですか」","en":"“Is that so?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"三芳","displayName":"Miyoshi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r156","rowIndex":156,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まあ、<tips=10>見土</tips>がいたかどうかは、おれたちにとってはそんなに重要な問題じゃない。……<tips=21>八龍会</tips>と<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>が組んで、何を狙っているのか……」","en":"“Whether <tips=10>Mido</tips> was there is not especially important to us. ...What are the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips> and <tips=20>Koschei</tips> after now that they’ve joined forces...?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r157","rowIndex":157,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は殺害現場へ続く階段を上りながら言う。","en":"I said this as I climbed the stairs toward the murder scene.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r158","rowIndex":158,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……厄介なことになりましたね」","en":"“...This has become a real mess.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"三芳","displayName":"Miyoshi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r159","rowIndex":159,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ま、そうとは限らないさ」","en":"“Well, not necessarily.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r160","rowIndex":160,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私はそう答えて、足を早めた。","en":"I answered, then quickened my pace.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r161","rowIndex":161,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　職員たちの殺害現場となったB棟三階のホールは、まさに地獄絵図と呼ぶに相応しい光景だった。","en":"The third-floor hall of Ward B, where the staff had been murdered, was a vision of hell in every sense of the word.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r162","rowIndex":162,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　白衣を着た老若男女が奥の壁の付近に折り重なるようにして倒れている。おそらく、端に集めて銃弾を浴びせかけたのだろう。随分大量の銃弾を使ったようで、頭が砕けて原形を失っていたり、腹が破れて臓物がこぼれ落ちていたりするものも多い。それらが電灯の明かりで煌々と照らし出されている。","en":"Men and women in white coats, young and old, lay in heaps near the far wall. They had presumably been herded to one end of the hall and showered with bullets. A tremendous amount of ammunition had been expended: many had had their heads shattered beyond recognition, or their bellies torn open and their entrails spilled across the floor. The electric lights shone brilliantly upon it all.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r163","rowIndex":163,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そしてなんといっても悪臭がひどかった。","en":"Worst of all was the stench.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r164","rowIndex":164,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　窓ガラスが割れ風が吹き込んでいるにもかかわらず、鼻を覆いたくなるようなどうしようもない臭気がむっと立ちこめている。腹に穴が空けば消化液や内臓のなかの糞も出て来るし、血液そのものも独特の臭いがある。血液に関して言えば、死体たちから夥しく流れ出てホールに赤く大きな水たまりを作っているのだから、それだけでも強烈な臭いだ。","en":"Even with the windows shattered and the wind blowing in, the air was thick with an inescapable stench that made me want to cover my nose. A hole in the abdomen releases digestive fluids and the feces held within the organs, and blood itself has a distinctive smell. An appalling quantity of it had poured from the bodies here, forming a vast red pool across the hall. That alone would have been overpowering.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r165","rowIndex":165,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そのあたりの空気には、そうした全ての臭いが混じり合っているのだ。","en":"The air around us was laden with all those odors mingled together.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r166","rowIndex":166,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　殺人現場でよく嗅ぐ臭いだが、こう大量の死体があると強烈だ。","en":"It was an odor I often encountered at murder scenes, but with so many bodies, it was overpowering.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r167","rowIndex":167,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そうした現場のなかを、監察医が歩き回り、捜査官が手にしたカメラで撮影をしている。","en":"Medical examiners moved through the carnage while investigators photographed it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r168","rowIndex":168,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=49>三芳</tips>はこわばって、ハンカチを顔に当てたままその場に凍り付いている。","en":"<tips=49>Miyoshi</tips> had gone rigid. She stood frozen where she was, a handkerchief still pressed to her face.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r169","rowIndex":169,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は何も感じない。前だったら憤りなり、何なりがあっただろうが、もうそういった感傷は完全に死に絶えてしまったようだ。","en":"I felt nothing. Once, I might have felt outrage or something of the kind, but such sentiment now seemed entirely dead within me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r170","rowIndex":170,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「随分可愛い飾り付けがしてあるじゃないか。パーティでもやっていたのかい？」","en":"“What charming decorations. Were they having a party?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r171","rowIndex":171,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は破れて天井から垂れ下がった輪飾りに触れてみた。","en":"I touched a torn paper chain dangling from the ceiling.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r172","rowIndex":172,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　手に濡れたモノがつき、確認すると血液だった。","en":"Something wet came away on my hand. I looked and saw that it was blood.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r173","rowIndex":173,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「誕生会だったそうです。月に一度、職員が患者のためにやってるんだそうですよ。集まっておやつを食べていて、そこを襲われたようです」","en":"“Apparently it was a birthday party. The staff throws one for the patients every month. They had all gathered for snacks when they were attacked.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r174","rowIndex":174,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　加藤がそう説明をする。","en":"Kato explained.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r175","rowIndex":175,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なるほどねえ」","en":"“I see.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r176","rowIndex":176,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は指先に付着した血液をハンカチで拭った。","en":"I wiped the blood from my fingertips with my handkerchief.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r177","rowIndex":177,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「患者といえば、一人残らず逃げ出して、それっきりなのかい？」","en":"“Speaking of the patients, did every last one of them escape? And none have been seen since?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r178","rowIndex":178,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「二人ほど、逃げ損ねた患者が保護されたという話ですから、詳しい状況は彼らの口から語られるでしょう」","en":"“I’m told two patients who failed to escape were taken into protective custody. They should be able to tell us exactly what happened.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r179","rowIndex":179,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「大丈夫か？　まともに話せる患者なのか？」","en":"“Are they all right? Are they patients who can speak coherently?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r180","rowIndex":180,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ええ、随分しっかりとしていて。どうも、『<tips=46>ネオ・ローズ</tips>』を打たれたようですね」","en":"“Yes. They’re remarkably lucid. It seems they were injected with <tips=46>Neo Rose</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r181","rowIndex":181,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なるほど。……なあ、ちょっといいかな？」","en":"“I see. ...Excuse me, do you have a moment?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r182","rowIndex":182,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は監察医の一人を呼び止める。","en":"I called out to one of the medical examiners.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r183","rowIndex":183,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なんですか？」","en":"“What is it?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r184","rowIndex":184,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　本来ならば私のような民間人に対応する理由もないのだろうが、警察官だと勘違いしたらしく律儀に振り返る。","en":"Ordinarily he would have had no reason to answer a civilian like me, but he appeared to mistake me for a police officer and dutifully turned around.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r185","rowIndex":185,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ここの死体はみな銃でやられてるのかい？　外の死体みたいに、切断されたようなものはなかったかい？」","en":"“Were all the bodies in here shot? Were any of them dismembered like the bodies outside?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r186","rowIndex":186,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まだ全部の遺体を詳しく調べたわけじゃないですが、ざっと見たところ、そういった遺体はありませんね」","en":"“I haven’t examined every body in detail yet, but at a glance, I haven’t seen any like that.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r187","rowIndex":187,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうか。ありがとう」","en":"“I see. Thank you.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r188","rowIndex":188,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして私たちは病棟を一回りしてから、また管理棟に戻った。","en":"After making a circuit of the ward, we returned to the administration building.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r189","rowIndex":189,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　管理棟からは事情聴取のために残されていた職員たちが帰るところだった。","en":"The staff members who had been kept behind for questioning were just making their way out of the administration building.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r190","rowIndex":190,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　精神的ショックが強いものや、けが人などは早い段階で病院へ移送し、この時間まで残っていたのは自主的に協力を申し出た者だけらしいが、それでも五、六人はいる。","en":"Those in severe psychological shock and those who were injured had been transferred to hospitals earlier. Apparently, only those who had volunteered to cooperate remained this late, but there were still five or six of them.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r191","rowIndex":191,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　すでに日が落ち、辺りは真っ暗になっている。","en":"Night had already fallen, leaving the area pitch-dark.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r192","rowIndex":192,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　警察官が懐中電灯で彼らの足元を照らし、入り口のところにはタクシーが停まって待っていた。","en":"Police officers shone flashlights at their feet, and a taxi stood waiting at the entrance.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r193","rowIndex":193,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私はそのうちの一人の事務服を着た女性職員を捕まえて、この病院に勤務しているはずの<tips=5>太刀川</tips>医師について尋ねた。","en":"I stopped one of the women, a clerical worker in uniform, and asked about Doctor <tips=5>Tachikawa</tips>, who was supposed to work at the hospital.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r194","rowIndex":194,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=5>太刀川</tips>先生は、昨夜当直でしたので朝お帰りになりました。事件当時は院内にいらっしゃらなかったはずです」","en":"“Doctor <tips=5>Tachikawa</tips> was on duty last night, so he went home this morning. He should not have been at the hospital when the attack occurred.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r195","rowIndex":195,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　事務員は青ざめてはいたが、はっきりとした口調でそう教えてくれた。","en":"Though pale, the clerk told me this in a clear voice.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r196","rowIndex":196,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「お知り合いですか？」","en":"“Do you know him?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"三芳","displayName":"Miyoshi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r197","rowIndex":197,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その質問を横で見ていた<tips=49>三芳</tips>がそう尋ねる。","en":"<tips=49>Miyoshi</tips>, who had been watching the exchange beside me, asked.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r198","rowIndex":198,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まあね。古い知り合いだよ。今はここで働いているって、ふと思い出したんだ……。それにしても、腹が減ったな。向こうに定食屋があったはずだから、腹ごしらえしよう」","en":"“Yes, an old acquaintance. It just occurred to me that he works here now... Anyway, I’m hungry. There should be a diner across the way. Let’s get something to eat.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r199","rowIndex":199,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「わ、私はいいです。ここでいろいろとすることがありますから」","en":"“I-I’ll pass. There are still several things I need to do here.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"三芳","displayName":"Miyoshi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r200","rowIndex":200,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうか、あんたには立場もあるからな。しかし食わないともたないぞ。今夜は長くなるかもしれない。何しろ<tips=21>八龍会</tips>が動いたんだからな」","en":"“I see. Your position comes with responsibilities. But you won’t hold up if you don’t eat. We may be in for a long night. After all, the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips> is on the move.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r201","rowIndex":201,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……<tips=21>八龍会</tips>が動くというのは、やっぱり、そんなに重大な事件なんですか？」","en":"“...Is it really such a serious matter for the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips> to take action?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"三芳","displayName":"Miyoshi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r202","rowIndex":202,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そりゃそうだよ。今まで影でこそこそやってた連中が、初めてド派手な事件をやらかしたんだ。こりゃあ、街を揺るがす事件だよ。あんたは<tips=21>八龍会</tips>のことはあまり知らないのかい？」","en":"“Of course it is. These people have always kept to the shadows, and now, for the first time, they’ve staged an incident as spectacular as this. It’ll shake the whole city. Don’t you know much about the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips>?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r203","rowIndex":203,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……すみません。<tips=21>八龍会</tips>は私の担当ではなくて……」","en":"“...I’m sorry. The <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips> isn’t part of my assignment...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"三芳","displayName":"Miyoshi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r204","rowIndex":204,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうか……そうかもしれないな。まあ仕方ないことだよ。そもそも警察とか役所は、驚くくらい<tips=17>タイプB</tips>系の犯罪組織について疎いもんだ。あれはやっぱり警察内に潜り込んだ<tips=17>タイプB</tips>だとか、協力する人権団体が何か仕組んでるんだと思うぜ」","en":"“I see... I suppose that may be it. Well, it can’t be helped. The police and government agencies know astonishingly little about <tips=17>Type B</tips> criminal organizations in the first place. I’d wager the <tips=17>Type Bs</tips> who have infiltrated the police, or the human-rights groups that cooperate with them, have contrived things that way.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r205","rowIndex":205,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「とにかく、<tips=17>タイプB</tips>の社会については、アンタッチャブルな面があって……<tips=21>八龍会</tips>については我々とは違う部署では詳しく調べているのかもしれませんが、こちらには情報は入って来ません」","en":"“In any event, certain aspects of <tips=17>Type B</tips> society are treated as untouchable... Perhaps other divisions have investigated the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips> in detail, but none of that information reaches us.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"三芳","displayName":"Miyoshi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r206","rowIndex":206,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なるほどね」","en":"“I see.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r207","rowIndex":207,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あ、あの。やっぱり私も食事に行きます。そして、<tips=21>八龍会</tips>のことを少し教えてください」","en":"“U-um... I think I’ll come with you after all. And please, tell me a little about the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"三芳","displayName":"Miyoshi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r208","rowIndex":208,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「大丈夫か？　ここで仕事があるんじゃないのか？」","en":"“Are you sure? Don’t you have work to do here?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r209","rowIndex":209,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「実際のところ、私がいなくても別の人間が指示を出すから、やることがないんです……」","en":"“The truth is, someone else will give the orders whether I’m here or not, so there isn’t anything for me to do...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"三芳","displayName":"Miyoshi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r210","rowIndex":210,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　やはり殺人現場のショックは大きかったらしく、<tips=49>三芳</tips>は飲み物しか注文せず、しかもそれにも手をつけない。","en":"The murder scene had clearly affected <tips=49>Miyoshi</tips>. She ordered only a drink, and did not even touch it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r211","rowIndex":211,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私はレバニラ定食に単品で鳥のから揚げをつけてもらった。","en":"I ordered the liver-and-chive set meal with a side of fried chicken.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r212","rowIndex":212,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=53>ミユキ</tips>の件があってから食欲は失せていたが、施設で過ごした辺りから大分食事量が戻って来ている。いやむしろ、前よりも多く食べるようになったかもしれない。","en":"I had lost my appetite after what happened to <tips=53>Miyuki</tips>, but by the time of my stay at the facility, I had largely returned to eating my usual amount. If anything, I might now have been eating more than before.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r213","rowIndex":213,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　大怪我から回復するときに消費したエネルギーを取り戻すだけにしては、余りにも長く食欲が持続している。","en":"The appetite had lasted far too long to be explained merely by replenishing the energy consumed in recovering from serious injury.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r214","rowIndex":214,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　不死身になって体質が変わったのか、それとも心境に変化があったのか。","en":"Had becoming deathless altered my constitution, or had some change taken place in my state of mind?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r215","rowIndex":215,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　料理は平凡で、別に旨いとも思わなかったが、単純に飢えを満たす欲求に動かされるまま私は運ばれて来た皿の上のものを胃の中に移した。","en":"The food was unremarkable, and I did not find it particularly good. I simply obeyed the urge to sate my hunger, transferring everything on the plates before me into my stomach.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r216","rowIndex":216,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして食べながら、<tips=49>三芳</tips>に<tips=21>八龍会</tips>のことを説明した。","en":"As I ate, I explained the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips> to <tips=49>Miyoshi</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r217","rowIndex":217,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「連中は社会のあちこちに紛れ込んだ<tips=17>タイプB</tips>と秘密で連絡を取り合って、裏で工作をするのがいままでのやりかたで、そしてそれが強かった。今回みたいに表立って実力行使することなんかなかったんだ。それがこんなことをするなんて、これは一大事だよ」","en":"“Their usual method was to maintain secret contact with <tips=17>Type Bs</tips> embedded throughout society and maneuver behind the scenes. That was where their strength lay. They never resorted to open force the way they did this time. For them to do such a thing is momentous.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r218","rowIndex":218,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「組織の考えが変わったんですか？」","en":"“Has the organization changed its mind?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"三芳","displayName":"Miyoshi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r219","rowIndex":219,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それもあるかも知れないが、そもそもね、今まではこういうことをしたくても出来なかったんだよ。<tips=17>タイプB</tips>ってのはもともと組織や規律のなかで働くのが不得意だからな。どこの国にも<tips=17>タイプB</tips>だけで編成された部隊はない。症状をコントロール出来る精鋭だけが隊に居られる。そもそも<tips=17>タイプB</tips>が軍隊に入れない国も多い。企業だって、喜んで採用したりはしないさ。心理的ストレスに長く晒されるような場面だと、<tips=17>タイプB</tips>の発症率はグンとあがるんだ。そうするとわけがわからなくなる。コントロール出来るやつもいるが、何かの拍子で一人でも発症したら隊は終わりだ。シビアなところじゃ使い物にならないんだよ」","en":"“That may be part of it, but the thing is, until now they couldn’t have done this even if they’d wanted to. <tips=17>Type Bs</tips> have never been good at operating within organizations or under discipline. No country has a unit composed entirely of <tips=17>Type Bs</tips>. Only elite soldiers capable of controlling their symptoms can remain in service; in many countries, <tips=17>Type Bs</tips> cannot join the military at all. Companies aren’t exactly eager to hire them, either. Prolonged psychological stress sends the rate of onset among <tips=17>Type Bs</tips> soaring. Once that happens, there’s no telling what they’ll do. Some can control themselves, but if even one member suffers onset at the wrong moment, the whole unit is finished. They’re no use in a high-stakes situation.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r220","rowIndex":220,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……それが『<tips=46>ネオ・ローズ</tips>』の登場により変わった？」","en":"“...And the appearance of <tips=46>Neo Rose</tips> has changed that?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"三芳","displayName":"Miyoshi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r221","rowIndex":221,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そう。あの薬が、今回の襲撃を可能にしたんだろう。……以前古いほうの『<tips=45>ローズ</tips>』が流行したときも、そんな動きが起こりかけたんだ。だが、あの時は結局使い物になる薬じゃないってことがすぐにわかったからな。今回は違うのかもしれない。少なくともジジイどもはそう判断してるから、こんなことをしたんだ。……もしそうなら大変なことだぜ。症状さえなければ、優れた肉体をそのまま現場で活かせる。単純な喧嘩なら<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>みたいなサイキックを擁するギャング組織とも張り合えるし、それに今まで培ったネットワークが加われば怖いものなしだ」","en":"“Yes. That drug is probably what made this attack possible. ...When the old <tips=45>Rose</tips> came into fashion, a movement like this nearly began then, too. But it soon became clear that the drug was no use after all. This time may be different. At least, those old men must believe it is, or they would never have done this. ...And if they’re right, we’re in serious trouble. Without the symptoms, they can put their superior bodies to full use in the field. In a straight fight, they could hold their own even against a gang like <tips=7>YS</tips> with psychics at its command. Combine that with the network they’ve built over the years, and they’ll have nothing left to fear.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r222","rowIndex":222,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「じゃあ、<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>の位置に<tips=21>八龍会</tips>はとってかわろうとしているのですか？」","en":"“Then is the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips> trying to take <tips=7>YS’s</tips> place?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"三芳","displayName":"Miyoshi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r223","rowIndex":223,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そんな簡単な話じゃないだろうが、その可能性はある。が、警察はどうするんだ？　今後<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>との覇権争いが始まれば街は滅茶苦茶になる。昔の<tips=68>木下組</tips>との争いみたいにだんまりを通すつもりか？　あの時と違って、狭い箱のなかでモンスター同士が殺し合うだけじゃすまないんだぜ？　この街は今や立派な繁華街で、よそからの客もたくさん訪れる。普通の学生だって<tips=57>滑走路通り</tips>を食べ歩いたりしているんだ。ああいうのが死んだら見て見ぬフリは出来ないだろう」","en":"“I doubt it’s that simple, but it is possible. What are the police going to do? If a struggle for supremacy with <tips=7>YS</tips> begins, the city will be torn apart. Do you intend to keep your mouths shut as you did during the old conflict with the <tips=68>Kinoshita-gumi</tips>? Unlike then, this won’t end with monsters killing one another inside some cramped little box. This city is a full-fledged entertainment district now, drawing crowds of visitors from elsewhere. Even ordinary students eat their way down <tips=57>Runway Street</tips>. You won’t be able to look the other way if people like that start dying.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r224","rowIndex":224,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「見て見ぬフリなんかしません！　……きっと」","en":"“We won’t look the other way! ...I’m sure.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"三芳","displayName":"Miyoshi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r225","rowIndex":225,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=49>三芳</tips>は勢いよく言い始めたものの、最後は不安になったのか、うつむいて声も小さくなった。","en":"<tips=49>Miyoshi</tips> began forcefully, but perhaps uncertainty took hold at the end, for she lowered her head and her voice alike.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r226","rowIndex":226,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それから今後の<tips=9>Y地区</tips>の情勢の予測などについて話しているうちに、思いのほか時間を過ごしてしまった。","en":"We went on to discuss what was likely to happen next in <tips=9>Y District</tips>, among other things, and before we knew it far more time had passed than expected.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r227","rowIndex":227,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　現場の様子を見るために病院に戻ると、遺体の搬出作業を行っている。","en":"When we returned to the hospital to see how matters stood, the bodies were being removed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r228","rowIndex":228,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　車両の数は少なく、受け入れ先も一つではとても足りないのでいくつか分散させるそうだから、今日は深夜まで作業が続くだろう。","en":"There were few vehicles, and no single destination could receive them all, so they would be divided among several facilities. The work would apparently continue until late at night.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r229","rowIndex":229,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=49>三芳</tips>はともかく私はここでずっと作業を見守っている必要はない。","en":"<tips=49>Miyoshi</tips> might have reason to remain, but I did not need to stand there watching the work indefinitely.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r230","rowIndex":230,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　警察から借りた懐中電灯を片手に病院内をある程度見回って、病院を出ようとしたところでふと気がついた。","en":"Flashlight borrowed from the police in hand, I spent a while looking around the hospital. Just as I was about to leave, I noticed something.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r231","rowIndex":231,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　搬出される遺体は黒い袋に入れられているのだが、その上にテープで名前らしきものが書かれた紙片が貼り付けられている。","en":"The bodies being carried out had been placed in black bags, and slips of paper bearing what appeared to be names were taped to the outside.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r232","rowIndex":232,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　遺体の様子はひどい有様で、個人の特定さえ難しそうだったのに、どうしてこんなに早く名前が判明したのだろう？　何の気なしに警官に尋ねると、私たちが食事をしている間に<tips=5>太刀川</tips>がやって来て死者の名を教えてくれたのだと言った。","en":"The bodies were in such terrible condition that even identifying the individuals looked difficult. How had the police learned their names so quickly? I asked an officer out of idle curiosity and was told that <tips=5>Tachikawa</tips> had come by while we were eating and identified the dead for them.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r233","rowIndex":233,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なんだ、来たのなら教えてくれれば良かったのに」","en":"“Why didn’t anyone tell me he was here?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r234","rowIndex":234,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　残念に思ったが、警官たちは私と<tips=5>太刀川</tips>の関係など知らないのだから仕方がない。","en":"I was disappointed, but the police had no way of knowing the relationship between <tips=5>Tachikawa</tips> and me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r235","rowIndex":235,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まあいい。先生の様子はどうだった？　さすがの『ドクター』でも、少しは取り乱していたんじゃないか？」","en":"“Well, never mind. How did he seem? Even the ‘Doctor’ himself must have been a little shaken, don’t you think?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r236","rowIndex":236,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「取り乱すというより、随分怒っているようでしたよ」","en":"“Rather than shaken, he seemed extremely angry.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r237","rowIndex":237,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　と警官が言うのは意外だった。","en":"That was not the answer I had expected from the officer.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r238","rowIndex":238,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=5>太刀川</tips>が怒るだと？　夜の施設で会った時は感情が枯れ果てたような物言いをしていたくせに、まだ波打つ感情が残っているのか。","en":"<tips=5>Tachikawa</tips>, angry? When I saw him at the facility that night, he had spoken as though every emotion in him had withered away. Did something still remain that could stir?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r239","rowIndex":239,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　だとしたら、思ったより簡単に事件に引っ張り込めるかもしれないな。","en":"If so, it might be easier than I had expected to drag him into the case.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r240","rowIndex":240,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼をどう言いくるめて仲間に引き入れようか考えながら病院を出ようとすると、後から<tips=49>三芳</tips>が声をかける。","en":"I was on my way out of the hospital, considering how I might cajole him into joining our side, when <tips=49>Miyoshi</tips> called to me from behind.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r241","rowIndex":241,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「今日はもうお帰りですか？」","en":"“Are you going home for the day?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"三芳","displayName":"Miyoshi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r242","rowIndex":242,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まあ、そうだな……」","en":"“Well... I suppose...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r243","rowIndex":243,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=5>太刀川</tips>のことは隠した方がいいのだろうが、私にまっすぐな視線を向ける<tips=49>三芳</tips>の姿を見ると、なんとなく教えたくなった。","en":"I probably ought to have kept <tips=5>Tachikawa</tips> a secret, but something about the directness of <tips=49>Miyoshi’s</tips> gaze made me want to tell her.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r244","rowIndex":244,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　警察内でも居場所がなく、私にまで隠し事ばかりされている真面目な若い警官に、多少は同情のような気持ちがあったのだろう。","en":"Perhaps I felt a measure of sympathy for this earnest young officer, who had no place even within the police and from whom I, too, had done nothing but keep secrets.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r245","rowIndex":245,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いや、これから人に会いに行くんだ」","en":"“No. I’m going to see someone now.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r246","rowIndex":246,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「人に？」","en":"“Someone?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"三芳","displayName":"Miyoshi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r247","rowIndex":247,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=5>太刀川</tips>先生にね」","en":"“Doctor <tips=5>Tachikawa</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r248","rowIndex":248,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ああ、さっき言っていた……でも、こんな時間から事情聴取ですか？」","en":"“Oh, the man you mentioned earlier... But are you going to question him at this hour?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"三芳","displayName":"Miyoshi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r249","rowIndex":249,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうじゃないんだ」","en":"“That isn’t it.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r250","rowIndex":250,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は辺りに聞き耳を立てるものがいないのを確認してから、","en":"After checking that no one nearby was listening,","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r251","rowIndex":251,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「彼はただの医者じゃない」","en":"“He isn’t merely a doctor.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r252","rowIndex":252,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=49>三芳</tips>の耳にそう囁いた。","en":"I whispered it into <tips=49>Miyoshi’s</tips> ear.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r253","rowIndex":253,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「サイキックだっていうのは、警察の資料にもありますが……」","en":"“The police files do say that he’s a psychic...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"三芳","displayName":"Miyoshi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r254","rowIndex":254,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それだけじゃない。……まあ、歩きながら話そう」","en":"“There’s more to it than that. ...Well, let’s talk as we walk.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r255","rowIndex":255,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「マンションまで行くんですか？　それなら、警察の車両を借りた方が……」","en":"“Are you going all the way to his apartment? In that case, we should borrow a police vehicle...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"三芳","displayName":"Miyoshi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r256","rowIndex":256,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　歩き出した私を追いかけながら<tips=49>三芳</tips>は言う。","en":"<tips=49>Miyoshi</tips> spoke as she hurried after me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r257","rowIndex":257,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「おれは免許がない。きみが運転するのか？」","en":"“I don’t have a license. Will you drive?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r258","rowIndex":258,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いえ、誰か同行することになるかと思いますが……」","en":"“No. I think someone else would have to come with us...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"三芳","displayName":"Miyoshi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r259","rowIndex":259,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「じゃあタクシーを拾おう。あんた以外の警官には、この行動を知られたくない」","en":"“Then we’ll hail a taxi. I don’t want any police officer but you to know about this.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r260","rowIndex":260,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=49>三芳</tips>は理由を聞きたがったが、その場ではそれ以上答えなかった。","en":"<tips=49>Miyoshi</tips> wanted to know why, but I said nothing more while we were still there.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r261","rowIndex":261,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして通りに出てタクシーを捕まえ、<tips=5>太刀川</tips>のマンションの前に降りたところで<tips=49>三芳</tips>に説明をした。","en":"We went out to the street and hailed a taxi. Once we had gotten out in front of <tips=5>Tachikawa’s</tips> apartment building, I explained the situation to <tips=49>Miyoshi</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r262","rowIndex":262,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=5>太刀川</tips>は、かつて<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>の相棒として『<tips=18>ローズ・クラブ</tips>』を崩壊に導き、<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>の誕生にも深く関わった『ドクター』であること。","en":"<tips=5>Tachikawa</tips> was the Doctor who had once been <tips=3>Chris Tse’s</tips> partner, helped bring about the collapse of <tips=18>Rose Club</tips>, and played a central role in the birth of <tips=7>YS</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r263","rowIndex":263,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私もその際、探偵として彼に協力したこと。","en":"I too had assisted him then, in my capacity as a detective.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r264","rowIndex":264,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そ、そんな。それじゃ、裏社会の大物中の大物だったんじゃないですか？　それがどうして……」","en":"“Th-then he must have been one of the biggest names in the underworld! So why would he...?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"三芳","displayName":"Miyoshi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r265","rowIndex":265,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「シッ、声が大きい」","en":"“Shh. Keep your voice down.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r266","rowIndex":266,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちは照明のあふれるマンションの玄関ホールにおり、声がよく響く。","en":"We were standing in the brilliantly lit entrance hall of the apartment building, where every sound carried.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r267","rowIndex":267,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……どうして、あんな病院で医者なんかやってるんですか？　<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>の幹部になった方が、ずっといい暮らしが出来るでしょうに……」","en":"“...Why is he working as a doctor at a hospital like that? He could live far better as one of <tips=7>YS’s</tips> senior officers...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"三芳","displayName":"Miyoshi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r268","rowIndex":268,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=49>三芳</tips>は信じられないようであった。","en":"<tips=49>Miyoshi</tips> still appeared unable to believe it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r269","rowIndex":269,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「変わり者なのさ。あれはなかなか尊敬すべき人物だよ」","en":"“He’s an eccentric. But he’s quite a man—one worthy of respect.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r270","rowIndex":270,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私がこんな言い方をしたことも<tips=49>三芳</tips>にとっては意外だったらしく、目を大きく見開いたままこちらを見つめる。","en":"Apparently, hearing such words from me was another surprise to <tips=49>Miyoshi</tips>. She stared at me, her eyes wide.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r271","rowIndex":271,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その前で、私はパネルに<tips=5>太刀川</tips>の部屋番号を入力する。","en":"With her watching, I entered <tips=5>Tachikawa’s</tips> apartment number into the panel.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r272","rowIndex":272,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　インターフォンが鳴るが、相手は出ない。","en":"The intercom rang, but there was no answer.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r273","rowIndex":273,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「仕方ないな。勝手に入ろう」","en":"“No help for it. We’ll let ourselves in.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r274","rowIndex":274,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は病院で彼の電話番号を調べなかったことを後悔しつつ、パネルの横の、奥へと通ずる自動ドアの前にたった。","en":"Regretting that I had not looked up his telephone number at the hospital, I stepped in front of the automatic door beside the panel—the one that led farther into the building.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r275","rowIndex":275,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　本来ならばオートロックがかかっていて、鍵を使うか、住人に解錠操作をしてもらわなければ開かないはずのそのドアは、私の前ではコンビニの自動ドアと変わらない誰に対しても簡単に開くものへと変わる。","en":"Ordinarily, the door’s automatic lock should have kept it closed unless someone used a key or a resident released it from within. In my presence, it became no different from the automatic door of a convenience store: a door that opened readily for anyone.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r276","rowIndex":276,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ろ、<tips=50>路地</tips>さん、薬を飲んでないのにサイキック能力が……」","en":"“M-Mr. <tips=50>Roji</tips>, you haven’t taken any medicine, but your psychic ability...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"三芳","displayName":"Miyoshi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r277","rowIndex":277,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「鍵がかかってなかったんだろう。いくぞ」","en":"“It must not have been locked. Come on.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r278","rowIndex":278,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は騙すつもりもない白々しい嘘を堂々と口にして、足を踏み入れた。","en":"Without the slightest intention of deceiving her, I brazenly delivered that transparent lie and stepped inside.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r279","rowIndex":279,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=5>太刀川</tips>は本当に留守なのか、ドアをノックしても出て来ない。","en":"<tips=5>Tachikawa</tips> truly appeared to be absent; knocking on his door brought no response.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r280","rowIndex":280,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　出直そうかとも思ったが、手ぶらで帰る気にはどうしてもなれず、無許可ながら不在の住居にあがらせて貰うことにした。","en":"I considered coming back another time, but I could not bring myself to leave empty-handed. I decided to let myself into his home in his absence, permission or no permission.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r281","rowIndex":281,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その時も本来ならば施錠されているはずのドアを開けたが、<tips=49>三芳</tips>はもう眉をひそめるだけで指摘はしなかった。","en":"Once again, I opened a door that ought to have been locked. By now, <tips=49>Miyoshi</tips> did no more than frown; she no longer called me on it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r282","rowIndex":282,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　部屋は明かりをつけたままになっている。玄関にはルームシューズが脱ぎ散らかされて、室内のあちこちのドアが開いている。","en":"The lights had been left on. Indoor slippers lay scattered in the entryway, and doors throughout the apartment stood open.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r283","rowIndex":283,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=5>太刀川</tips>の性格からして自室を散らかし放題にするタイプには思えないから、よほどドタバタとしていたのだろうか。","en":"Knowing <tips=5>Tachikawa</tips>, he was hardly the sort of man to leave his apartment in utter disarray. Whatever had happened here, he must have been in a tremendous hurry.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r284","rowIndex":284,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「捜査令状もないのに、押し入るだなんて……」","en":"“Barging in without even a search warrant...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"三芳","displayName":"Miyoshi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r285","rowIndex":285,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=49>三芳</tips>が言うのを無視して私は靴を脱ぎ、部屋にあがった。","en":"Ignoring <tips=49>Miyoshi</tips>, I removed my shoes and entered.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r286","rowIndex":286,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　清潔で一人暮らしにしては広い部屋だが、家具や日用品は最小限しかなく、いかにも<tips=5>太刀川</tips>らしかった。","en":"The apartment was clean and spacious for a man living alone, yet it contained only the bare minimum of furniture and household necessities. It was <tips=5>Tachikawa</tips> through and through.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r287","rowIndex":287,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　リビングには目を引くものがなく、わざわざ不法侵入した甲斐もない。玄関のところにメモでも挟んで帰ろうかと思いながら寝室に入る。","en":"There was nothing of interest in the living room; it hardly seemed worth going to all the trouble of trespassing. Thinking I might leave a note at the entrance and go home, I stepped into the bedroom.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r288","rowIndex":288,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そこも、やはり<tips=5>太刀川</tips>が慌ただしく行動した痕跡が残っていた。","en":"There too remained signs that <tips=5>Tachikawa</tips> had acted in haste.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r289","rowIndex":289,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ベッドの上の布団は起きた時の形のまま乱れ、その上に上着とサングラスが投げ捨ててある。上着の上には、携帯電話が置いてあった。","en":"The bedding lay just as he had left it upon rising, and a jacket and sunglasses had been flung on top. His mobile phone lay upon the jacket.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r290","rowIndex":290,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そしてベッド脇のクローゼットが開いたままになっており、元々そこに仕舞ってあった物だろうか、段ボール箱が無造作に床の上に置かれている。","en":"The closet beside the bed had been left open. A cardboard box, perhaps something ordinarily stored inside, had been left carelessly on the floor.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r291","rowIndex":291,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「随分古くさいな」","en":"“This is certainly old.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r292","rowIndex":292,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　端の方に黴が生えた段ボール箱のなかを覗き込むと、油紙の包みがある。","en":"I peered into the cardboard box, mold growing around its edges, and found a wrapping of oiled paper inside.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r293","rowIndex":293,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私はそれを手に取った。","en":"I picked it up.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r294","rowIndex":294,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「全部出しっぱなしですね。……何が入っていたんでしょう？」","en":"“He left everything out... What did this contain?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"三芳","displayName":"Miyoshi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r295","rowIndex":295,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まて、あとがついているぞ」","en":"“Wait. It’s still got the outline of something.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r296","rowIndex":296,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　油紙は長年何かを包んでいたせいで、包んでいた形に沿って折れ目がついている。ベッドの上でその折れ目をもとに包んでいたときの形を再現すると、それは直角三角形のようなかたちになった。","en":"Years spent wrapped around some object had left the oilpaper creased along its shape. Using those folds to reconstruct the bundle on the bed, I produced something like a right triangle.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r297","rowIndex":297,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「拳銃だな。ほらみろ、これはきっと引き金の部分だ」","en":"“A handgun. Look—this must be where the trigger was.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r298","rowIndex":298,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そうとしか見えない。","en":"It could be nothing else.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r299","rowIndex":299,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=5>太刀川</tips>先生は、病院から帰ってくるとこのクローゼットに隠していた拳銃を取り出し、服を着替え、そのまますぐに出て行ったんだ。電灯も消さず、出したものを片付けることもなく」","en":"“Doctor <tips=5>Tachikawa</tips> came home from the hospital, took the handgun he had hidden in this closet, changed his clothes, and went straight back out. He didn’t even turn off the lights or put away the things he’d pulled out.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r300","rowIndex":300,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして私は玄関の方へ早足で引き返した。","en":"I hurried back toward the entrance.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r301","rowIndex":301,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どこへ行くんですか？」","en":"“Where are you going?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"三芳","displayName":"Miyoshi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r302","rowIndex":302,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「胸騒ぎがする。先生を探そう」","en":"“I have a bad feeling about this. Let’s find the doctor.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r303","rowIndex":303,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「探すって、どこを？」","en":"“Where will we even look?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"三芳","displayName":"Miyoshi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r304","rowIndex":304,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=21>八龍会</tips>のジジイどもの家に行く。先生は病院のことで頭に血が上って、あそこに向かったんだ。先生が直接会って話せば、いかなるものも真実を隠すことが出来ないからな」","en":"“To the homes of the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips> elders. The doctor lost his head over what happened at the hospital and went after them. If he meets someone face-to-face and speaks with them, nothing can keep the truth hidden from him.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r305","rowIndex":305,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「で、でも、そう思う根拠は？」","en":"“B-but what makes you think that?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"三芳","displayName":"Miyoshi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r306","rowIndex":306,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それしか考えられない。おれだったらそうする」","en":"“It’s the only explanation I can think of. It’s what I would do.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r307","rowIndex":307,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=49>三芳</tips>はそれで黙り込み、私は足を早めた。","en":"That silenced <tips=49>Miyoshi</tips>, and I quickened my pace.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r308","rowIndex":308,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=21>八龍会</tips>の本拠である<tips=22>老人たち</tips>の邸宅の場所は、私もよく知っている。","en":"I knew exactly where to find the <tips=22>Elders</tips>’ mansion, the headquarters of the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r309","rowIndex":309,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　休日になれば会員たちは子供を連れていって、バーベキューをやったり、ゲームをしたりして楽しむのだ。<tips=59>暗闇通り</tips>の女たちにも、そこで開かれるレクリエーション会に欠かさず参加しているものもいる。","en":"On holidays, members brought their children there and enjoyed barbecues and games. Some of the women from <tips=59>Darkness Street</tips> never failed to attend the recreational gatherings held there.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r310","rowIndex":310,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　本来<tips=21>八龍会</tips>は、そうした平和的なコミュニティだったはずなのだ。ノーマルたちとも交流をもち、うまくやって来たはずだ。間違っても、あの病院で見たような凄惨な殺人事件を起こす集団ではない。少なくとも、表立った場所では。","en":"The <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips> was supposed to be a peaceful community of precisely that kind. It had maintained ties with Normals and gotten along with them. Under no circumstances was it the sort of organization that would perpetrate a grisly massacre like the one we had seen at the hospital. At least, not out in the open.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r311","rowIndex":311,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　――それが、変わったのだ。","en":"—But now, that had changed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r312","rowIndex":312,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=35>フェルナンデス</tips>殺人事件の犯人の件で<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>を非難したあたりでなんとなくきな臭い感じはしていた。が、今回の事件を想像出来たものはいなかったろう。","en":"When they condemned <tips=7>YS</tips> over the perpetrator of the <tips=35>Fernandes</tips> murder, I had sensed something vaguely ominous. No one, however, could have imagined this.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r313","rowIndex":313,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それは、<tips=5>太刀川</tips>にとっても同じ気持ちに違いない。","en":"The same must have been true of <tips=5>Tachikawa</tips>: he could never have imagined this, either.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r314","rowIndex":314,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼は<tips=9>Y地区</tips>内の児童施設に赴き、一銭にもならぬ深夜診療を続けていた。その彼でさえ、このような残酷な事件が起こるとは予期しなかっただろう。だから、病院で柄にもあわぬ憤りを見せ、銃などを持って雨の街へと飛び出した。","en":"He visited children’s facilities throughout <tips=9>Y District</tips> and continued to provide late-night treatment for no pay at all. Even he would never have anticipated such a cruel incident. I imagined that was why he had shown uncharacteristic fury at the hospital, taken up a gun, and rushed into the rain.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r315","rowIndex":315,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　普段、誰よりも<tips=17>タイプB</tips>を気にかけていた彼が、愛する<tips=17>タイプB</tips>の組織に仲間を殺された気持ちは察するに余りある。","en":"Ordinarily, no one cared more deeply for <tips=17>Type Bs</tips> than he did. I could well imagine what it meant to him to have his colleagues murdered by an organization belonging to the very <tips=17>Type Bs</tips> he loved.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r316","rowIndex":316,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　いやな胸騒ぎがして仕方がない。","en":"I could not rid myself of a terrible foreboding.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r317","rowIndex":317,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は雨でずぶ濡れになりながら、早足で夜の路地を駆けた。<tips=49>三芳</tips>も傘を諦め、私と同じように濡れながら駆けて来る。はあはあと苦しそうに息を弾ませているが、私も彼女を待っている暇はない。","en":"Soaked to the skin, I raced through the nighttime alleys. <tips=49>Miyoshi</tips> gave up on her umbrella and ran after me, growing just as drenched. She was panting painfully for breath, but I had no time to wait for her.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r318","rowIndex":318,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして私の悪い予感は的中した。","en":"My foreboding proved correct.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r319","rowIndex":319,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=59>暗闇通り</tips>はこのくらいの時間だと酔客がひっきりなしに往来しているが、少し路地に入ると雰囲気が変わる。","en":"At this hour, drunken patrons streamed ceaselessly up and down <tips=59>Darkness Street</tips>. But turn even a little way into an alley, and the atmosphere changed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r320","rowIndex":320,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=21>八龍会</tips>の<tips=22>老人たち</tips>と<tips=59>暗闇通り</tips>の中間の町並みは犯罪が頻発する危険地域で、地元の者でもこの時間は滅多に訪れない。","en":"The neighborhood between the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips> <tips=22>elders</tips>’ mansion and <tips=59>Darkness Street</tips> was a crime-ridden danger zone. Even locals rarely ventured there at this hour.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r321","rowIndex":321,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　人気のないその暗い路地に、<tips=5>太刀川</tips>は骸になって雨に打たれていた。","en":"There in the dark, deserted alley, <tips=5>Tachikawa</tips> lay a corpse beneath the beating rain.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r322","rowIndex":322,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　黒い上着、黒い帽子、そして鳥のような嘴のついた黒い仮面をつけた上半身がうつ伏せになって倒れている。","en":"His upper body lay facedown, clad in a black jacket and black hat, with a black, bird-beaked mask covering his face.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r323","rowIndex":323,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そこにあるのはあくまでも上半身だけだ。肉と骨はへその上ですっぱりと断裂し、腸や胃がだらしなく垂れ下がっている。下半身は見当たらない。切断面の鮮やかな切り口を見る限り、<tips=10>見土道夫</tips>か、コシチェイか、どちらかの能力が行使された可能性がある。切断面が若干湾曲しているようだから、<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>か？","en":"And an upper body was all that remained. Flesh and bone had been severed cleanly above the navel, leaving his stomach and intestines dangling slackly from the wound. The lower half was nowhere to be seen. Judging from the sharp, immaculate cut, either <tips=10>Michio Mido’s</tips> ability or Koschei’s might have been used. The cut curved ever so slightly, however. <tips=20>Koschei</tips>, perhaps?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r324","rowIndex":324,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「これは……」","en":"“This is...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r325","rowIndex":325,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　やっと追いついた<tips=49>三芳</tips>がそう言って息をのむ。","en":"Having finally caught up, <tips=49>Miyoshi</tips> began to speak, then caught her breath.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r326","rowIndex":326,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=5>太刀川</tips>先生だよ。『ドクター』として活躍していたころは、こんな風に素顔を隠していたんだ」","en":"“It’s Doctor <tips=5>Tachikawa</tips>. Back when he was active as the ‘Doctor,’ this was how he hid his face.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r327","rowIndex":327,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は手を伸ばして頭を横に向けると、その仮面を外す。","en":"I reached out, turned his head to the side, and removed the mask.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r328","rowIndex":328,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　万が一別の誰かであることを期待したが、やはり<tips=5>太刀川</tips>本人だった。","en":"I had hoped against hope that it might be someone else, but it was indeed <tips=5>Tachikawa</tips> himself.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r329","rowIndex":329,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　青黒い皮膚はすっかり死人のものだ。サングラスのないその瞳は中空を見ている。","en":"The dusky skin was unmistakably that of a dead man. Without his sunglasses, his eyes stared into empty space.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r330","rowIndex":330,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「見なよ。片方の目に、瞳が二つあるだろ。先生はこの瞳で人の心を覗く力があったんだ」","en":"“Look. There are two pupils in one of his eyes. Those pupils gave him the power to peer into another person’s mind.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r331","rowIndex":331,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　死体の顔は思ったよりも穏やかで、口元には微笑みさえ浮かんでいるように見えた。","en":"The face of the corpse was more peaceful than I had expected. There even seemed to be a smile at the corners of his mouth.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r332","rowIndex":332,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「おれは、<tips=48>堂島</tips>の旦那と、この先生は、数少ない同志だと思っていたんだよ」","en":"“Mr. <tips=48>Dojima</tips> and this doctor... I thought they were two of the very few men I could call comrades.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r333","rowIndex":333,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私はそう言って立ち上がる。","en":"With those words, I stood.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r334","rowIndex":334,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「噂によれば『ドクター』は行方不明になった娼婦を探すために<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>に手を貸したんだそうだ。その女は『<tips=18>ローズ・クラブ</tips>』で働いていて、結局助けることが出来ずに死なせてしまった。……この話が事実かどうかは知らないが、彼の情熱を思えば、あながちデタラメでもなかったのかもしれないな」","en":"“According to the rumors, the Doctor lent <tips=7>YS</tips> his help because he was searching for a prostitute who had disappeared. She worked at the <tips=18>Rose Club</tips>, and in the end he was unable to save her before she died. ...I don’t know whether the story is true, but knowing the passion he was capable of, perhaps it wasn’t complete nonsense after all.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r335","rowIndex":335,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=49>三芳</tips>を振り返る。彼女もずぶ濡れになって前髪が顔に張り付いている。","en":"I looked back at <tips=49>Miyoshi</tips>. She too was soaked, her bangs plastered to her face.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r336","rowIndex":336,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>がどういうつもりで活動してるのかは知らんが、<tips=21>八龍会</tips>がやらせたのだとすれば大間違いだぜ。先生をこんなかたちで殺すなんて、この街の<tips=17>タイプB</tips>にとって大きな損失だ。愚かなことをしたもんだ……」","en":"“I don’t know what <tips=20>Koschei</tips> hopes to accomplish with any of this. But if the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips> had him do this, they’ve made a terrible mistake. To murder the doctor in such a fashion is an immense loss to every <tips=17>Type B</tips> in this city. What a foolish thing they’ve done...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r337","rowIndex":337,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=50>路地</tips>さん、涙が……」","en":"“Mr. <tips=50>Roji</tips>, you’re crying...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r338","rowIndex":338,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「馬鹿言うな。雨で濡れているだけだ。それより、下半身を探してやろう」","en":"“Don’t talk nonsense. That’s only the rain. More importantly, let’s find the rest of him.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r339","rowIndex":339,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして顔を上げると、ふと暗闇のなかに人影があるのを発見した。","en":"Then I raised my face and noticed a figure in the darkness.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r340","rowIndex":340,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それは頭の禿げた小太りの中年男で、黒い傘を差してこちらを呆然とした顔で見ている。","en":"It was a balding, slightly overweight middle-aged man. Beneath a black umbrella, he stared at us in a daze.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r341","rowIndex":341,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　白いワイシャツと、黒いスラックス姿で、<tips=59>暗闇通り</tips>の酔客が迷い込んだのだろうか。","en":"He wore a white dress shirt and black trousers. Had some drunken patron from <tips=59>Darkness Street</tips> lost his way and wandered in here?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r342","rowIndex":342,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そ、それは、死体？　あんたがたは、ひ、人を……」","en":"“I-is that a body? You people... y-you killed someone...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r343","rowIndex":343,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ちっ、違います！　私は警察官で、今は捜査中なんです」","en":"“N-no! I’m a police officer. We’re conducting an investigation.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"三芳","displayName":"Miyoshi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r344","rowIndex":344,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=49>三芳</tips>は慌ててバッグから警察手帳を取り出すと、男に突きつける。","en":"In a panic, <tips=49>Miyoshi</tips> pulled her police credentials from her bag and thrust them toward the man.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r345","rowIndex":345,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「け、警察……？　うそつけ。よく見えんぞ……」","en":"“P-police...? You’re lying. I can’t see that properly...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r346","rowIndex":346,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　男は目を細める。この暗闇のなかではよく見えないのだろう。","en":"The man narrowed his eyes. He must have had difficulty seeing in the dark.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r347","rowIndex":347,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「見えなくても、本物です。あなたこそ、こんなところで何をしてるんですか？」","en":"“Even if you can’t see it, it’s genuine. What are you doing in a place like this?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"三芳","displayName":"Miyoshi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r348","rowIndex":348,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「何をって、家に帰ろうとしてるだけで……。で、でも、あんた、警察だなんて嘘をついて、私をその死体と同じようにしようとしてるんじゃないだろうねっ！」","en":"“What do you mean? I’m just trying to get home... B-but you’re lying about being police! You’re planning to do to me what you did to that body, aren’t you?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r349","rowIndex":349,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　男は手帳を確認するどころか、及び腰になって後ずさりしている。","en":"Far from examining her credentials, the man shrank away from them, retreating step by wary step.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r350","rowIndex":350,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「違います。……とにかく、捜査の邪魔はしないでください。こちらには近づかないで」","en":"“No. ...In any event, don’t interfere with the investigation. Stay away from us.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"三芳","displayName":"Miyoshi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r351","rowIndex":351,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=49>三芳</tips>がきつく言うと、男は困ったような顔をしながら、","en":"When <tips=49>Miyoshi</tips> spoke sharply, the man looked troubled and said,","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r352","rowIndex":352,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「わ、わかったよ。家が、そっちの方なんでね……」","en":"“A-all right. My house is that way...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r353","rowIndex":353,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　我々を迂回するようにして、通り抜けようとする。その時、首筋にびっしょりと汗をかいているのが見えた。冷や汗にしては多すぎる。","en":"He tried to pass us by, circling wide around where we stood. As he did, I saw that the back of his neck was drenched in sweat. It was far too much to be explained by nerves alone.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r354","rowIndex":354,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=49>三芳</tips>さん。なんかくさいぞ。この男を少し調べて……」","en":"“Ms. <tips=49>Miyoshi</tips>. Something smells fishy. Check this man out—”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r355","rowIndex":355,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私がそう言いかけたときだ。","en":"Just as I began to say it,","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r356","rowIndex":356,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　銃声が鳴り響き、私は腹に何か熱いものを感じてその場に前のめりに倒れる。","en":"A gunshot rang through the alley. I felt something hot in my abdomen and pitched forward where I stood.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r357","rowIndex":357,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「えっ」","en":"“What?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"三芳","displayName":"Miyoshi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r358","rowIndex":358,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　絶句する<tips=49>三芳</tips>に、中年男は手に握った拳銃を向ける。","en":"The middle-aged man turned the handgun in his fist on <tips=49>Miyoshi</tips>, who was too stunned to speak.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r359","rowIndex":359,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「おっ、お前……ごほっ」","en":"“Y-you... Ggh...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r360","rowIndex":360,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私の言いかけた言葉は、喉の奥からせり上がってきた血液によってかき消される。内臓が撃ち抜かれたらしく、ゴボゴボと咳をするたび口から路上へと血液が吐き出される。","en":"The blood surging up from the depths of my throat drowned out the words I had begun. The bullet appeared to have torn through my organs; every gurgling cough sent another mouthful of blood spilling onto the street.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r361","rowIndex":361,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「死ねっ！」","en":"“Die!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r362","rowIndex":362,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　中年男はうつ伏せに倒れる私に銃口を向け、背中にさらに二回発砲すると、また<tips=49>三芳</tips>に照準を戻した。","en":"The middle-aged man leveled the gun at me as I lay facedown and fired twice more into my back. Then he trained it on <tips=49>Miyoshi</tips> once again.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r363","rowIndex":363,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あんたたち、なんでここにいる？　この仮面の男を追ってきたのかい？　どこまで知っているのか話して貰うよ」","en":"“Why are the two of you here? Did you follow this masked man? You’re going to tell me exactly how much you know.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r364","rowIndex":364,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　男の構える銃は、極度の緊張のせいかブルブルと震えている。","en":"The gun in the man’s hands was trembling violently, perhaps from the extremity of his nerves.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r365","rowIndex":365,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　あまり人を撃った経験がないのかもしれない。さっきの汗はそのせいか。","en":"Perhaps he had little experience shooting people. Was that what all the sweat had been about?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r366","rowIndex":366,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　幸い私は意識を失っていなかった。痛みはすさまじいものだし、失血も尋常ではない。普通なら死亡しているはずだが、不死身の血のおかげか、まだもう少し動けそうだ。","en":"Fortunately, I had not lost consciousness. The pain was tremendous, and the loss of blood anything but ordinary. By rights, I should have been dead. But perhaps thanks to the deathless blood in my veins, I still had a little movement left in me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r367","rowIndex":367,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それでも、この状態で銃を持った相手に襲い掛かっても分が悪いのは間違いがない。","en":"Even so, there was no denying that if I attacked a gunman in this condition, the odds would be badly against me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r368","rowIndex":368,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　言葉からすると、すぐに<tips=49>三芳</tips>を殺すつもりはないようだ。私は死んだふりをしながら、男が隙を作るのを待つことにした。","en":"From what he had said, it seemed he did not intend to kill <tips=49>Miyoshi</tips> immediately. I decided to play dead and wait for him to leave me an opening.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r369","rowIndex":369,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あなたこそ何者？　どうして急に発砲したの？」","en":"“Who are you? Why did you start shooting out of nowhere?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"三芳","displayName":"Miyoshi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r370","rowIndex":370,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ちょっと待ちな。いま、『交代』するからな。おかしなマネするんじゃねえぞ！」","en":"“Just wait. I’m about to ‘switch over.’ Don’t try anything funny!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r371","rowIndex":371,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　男は興奮してそう怒鳴ると、ガクリと俯き、身体がよろける。","en":"The man shouted in agitation, then his head suddenly slumped and his body swayed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r372","rowIndex":372,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そしてそのふらつきから回復するころには、すっかり別人に『変身』していた。","en":"By the time he recovered his balance, he had ‘transformed’ into someone else entirely.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r373","rowIndex":373,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>……」","en":"“<tips=20>Koschei</tips>...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"三芳","displayName":"Miyoshi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r374","rowIndex":374,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=49>三芳</tips>が呻くように呟いた。","en":"<tips=49>Miyoshi</tips> uttered the name in a groan.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r375","rowIndex":375,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　小太りの中年男は、いつのまにかすらりとした美青年に変わっていた。","en":"Before we knew it, the pudgy middle-aged man had become a slender, handsome young man.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r376","rowIndex":376,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それは、私のアパートで<tips=48>堂島</tips>を殺した、私と<tips=49>三芳</tips>とでその画像を何度も人に見せた、あの大量殺人鬼の姿だった。","en":"Before us stood the form of the mass murderer who had killed <tips=48>Dojima</tips> in my apartment—the face <tips=49>Miyoshi</tips> and I had shown to one person after another.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r377","rowIndex":377,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「このツノの男と一緒にいるってことは、あんたは犬のおまわりさんの後継者ってわけか」","en":"“If you’re with the horned man, that makes you the doggie policeman’s successor, does it?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アレクセイ","displayName":"Alexei","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r378","rowIndex":378,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>は薄笑いを浮かべながらそう言う。","en":"<tips=20>Koschei</tips> said this with a thin smile.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r379","rowIndex":379,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あなたに、これ以上好きにはさせない……」","en":"“I won’t let you do as you please any longer...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"三芳","displayName":"Miyoshi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r380","rowIndex":380,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=49>三芳</tips>は歯をギリッと食いしばった。","en":"<tips=49>Miyoshi</tips> ground her teeth.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r381","rowIndex":381,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>のこの姿ならば、さほど恐ろしくはない。","en":"<tips=20>Koschei</tips> was not so terrifying in this form.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r382","rowIndex":382,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おそらく病院で警備員にそうしたように一瞬で殺す能力は、この姿では使えないはずだ。それが出来るのならば、私の部屋で出会った時に、<tips=86>灰上たち</tips>が入って来る前に私と<tips=48>堂島</tips>を始末していたからだ。","en":"He presumably could not use the power to kill someone in an instant as he had killed the security guard at the hospital—not in this body. If he could, he would have disposed of <tips=48>Dojima</tips> and me in my apartment before <tips=86>Haigami and the others</tips> came inside.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r383","rowIndex":383,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　やるなら今しかない。","en":"If I meant to act, it had to be now.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r384","rowIndex":384,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「おい、<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>よ。おれはまだ死んじゃいないぜ」","en":"“Hey, <tips=20>Koschei</tips>. I’m not dead yet.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r385","rowIndex":385,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は立ち上がり、彼の注意を自分に引きつける。","en":"I rose to my feet, drawing his attention to me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r386","rowIndex":386,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　不死身と言えども体中を蜂の巣にされてはこたえるようだ。ふらふらとして、目眩がする。意識を失うのもそう遠くはないだろう。","en":"It seemed that even a deathless body felt the effects of being riddled with bullets. I was swaying on my feet, overcome by dizziness. Unconsciousness could not be far away.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r387","rowIndex":387,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「色男よ。お前で大丈夫なのか？　もっとマシなやつに交代した方が良いんじゃないか？」","en":"“Pretty boy, are you sure you’re up to this? Perhaps you should switch to someone more capable.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r388","rowIndex":388,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　弱っているのを悟られぬよう虚勢を張りながら私がそう笑って見せると、","en":"I forced a smile and put on a bold front, determined not to let him see how weak I was.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r389","rowIndex":389,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ちっ」","en":"“Damn.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アレクセイ","displayName":"Alexei","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r390","rowIndex":390,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>は舌打ちの後に私に向かって銃を撃つ。すると、私の腹から血が噴き出す。","en":"<tips=20>Koschei</tips> clicked his tongue and fired at me. Blood burst from my abdomen.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r391","rowIndex":391,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いくら、撃っても無駄だよ。おれも、お前たちの愉快な世界に足を踏み入れたんだ……」","en":"“No matter how many times you shoot, it won’t do any good. I’ve entered your delightful world myself.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r392","rowIndex":392,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　喋った拍子に、腹からあがってきた血液が唇の端から漏れる。","en":"The act of speaking sent blood welling up from my abdomen and trickling from one corner of my mouth.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r393","rowIndex":393,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「お前、一族の血を受けたな。……そうか、あの女だな！」","en":"“You’ve received blood from the clan. ...I see. That woman!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アレクセイ","displayName":"Alexei","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r394","rowIndex":394,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>は苦々しく叫ぶ。","en":"<tips=20>Koschei</tips> shouted bitterly.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r395","rowIndex":395,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ここでお前と出会えるとは思わなかったが、実にラッキーだ。<tips=5>太刀川</tips>先生が引き合わせてくれたんだろう。ここで終わりにしてやる」","en":"“I never expected to run into you here, but this is one hell of a stroke of luck. Perhaps Doctor <tips=5>Tachikawa</tips> brought us together. I’ll put an end to you right here.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r396","rowIndex":396,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は銀色の<tips=43>APTG</tips>を抜き、目の前で蒼白になる青年に狙いをつけた。しかし、失血のせいかふらふらとして、銃口が上手く定まらない。","en":"I drew the silver <tips=43>APTG</tips> and took aim at the young man paling before my eyes. But perhaps from the loss of blood, I swayed too badly to hold the muzzle steady.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r397","rowIndex":397,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「爺さん、こいつやばいぞ！　<tips=62>マリア</tips>を出してくれ！」","en":"“Old man, this one’s dangerous! Bring out <tips=62>Maria</tips>!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アレクセイ","displayName":"Alexei","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r398","rowIndex":398,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>は一人でそう叫んだ直後、「うっ」と小さく呻いて俯く。","en":"Immediately after shouting this to no one visible, <tips=20>Koschei</tips> gave a small groan and lowered his head.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r399","rowIndex":399,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　別の姿に変身しようというつもりらしい。","en":"He evidently intended to transform into a different body.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r400","rowIndex":400,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は両手で<tips=43>APTG</tips>をしっかりと支えたが、それでもやはり銃口はゆらめいている。私の身体全体がふらついているのだ。","en":"I braced the <tips=43>APTG</tips> firmly with both hands, but the muzzle continued to wander. My entire body was unsteady.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r401","rowIndex":401,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　――頼むぜ、チャンスは一回きりだ。","en":"—Come on. I had only one chance at this.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r402","rowIndex":402,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　この銃は新しい注射筒を装填するのに時間がかかる。外すことは許されない。","en":"Loading a new syringe into this gun took time. I could not afford to miss.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r403","rowIndex":403,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しかし、ゆっくり狙いが定まるのを待ってもいられない。目の前で相手は変身しようとしているのだ。おそらくは、我々を一瞬で葬り去ることが出来る姿へと。","en":"But neither could I wait for my aim to settle. Before my eyes, my opponent was transforming—presumably into a form capable of wiping us out in an instant.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r404","rowIndex":404,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　相手の身体はみるみるうちに小さくなり、その髪の毛は伸びてゆく。","en":"His body rapidly shrank, and his hair grew longer.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r405","rowIndex":405,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"（南無三！）","en":"(Heaven help me!)","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r406","rowIndex":406,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は内心で呟きつつ、引き金を引いた。","en":"Muttering the words inwardly, I pulled the trigger.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r407","rowIndex":407,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しかし、私の銃口から飛び出た注射筒は相手に当たらない。<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>の背後にある壁に当たって跳ね返る音がする。","en":"But the syringe launched from my gun missed him. I heard it strike the wall behind <tips=20>Koschei</tips> and clatter away.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r408","rowIndex":408,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そうしている間に、<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>の変身は完了してしまった。","en":"In that interval, <tips=20>Koschei</tips> finished transforming.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r409","rowIndex":409,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　すっと顔を上げたのは、冷たい顔をした金髪の少女である。","en":"The face that rose smoothly before me belonged to a cold-eyed blonde girl.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r410","rowIndex":410,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私はジャケットのポケットに手を突っ込んで、新しい注射筒を取り出そうとしたが、震える指の間からこぼれ落ち、床の上にバラバラと転がってゆく。","en":"I thrust a hand into my jacket pocket and tried to pull out a fresh syringe, but it slipped between my trembling fingers and went clattering across the ground.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r411","rowIndex":411,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　絶望感に包まれながら目の前の少女を睨み付けた。","en":"Overcome by despair, I glared at the girl before me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r412","rowIndex":412,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「おまえ……」","en":"“You...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r413","rowIndex":413,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　相手が何か言おうとしたが途中でやめ、顎を引いて自分の胸を見る。","en":"My opponent began to speak, stopped, then lowered her chin and looked at her own chest.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r414","rowIndex":414,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そこには注射筒が突き刺さり、そして我々の視線のなかで真っ赤な血液がじんわりと白いシャツに広がってゆく。","en":"A syringe was embedded there. As we watched, vivid red blood slowly spread across her white shirt.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r415","rowIndex":415,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=50>路地</tips>さんっ！」","en":"“Mr. <tips=50>Roji</tips>!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r416","rowIndex":416,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=49>三芳</tips>は両手に<tips=43>APTG</tips>を構えたまま、泣きそうな顔で私を見ている。彼女があの注射筒を撃ったのだ。","en":"Still holding the <tips=43>APTG</tips> in both hands, <tips=49>Miyoshi</tips> looked at me, close to tears. She was the one who had fired that syringe.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r417","rowIndex":417,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「やるじゃねえか」","en":"“Not bad.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r418","rowIndex":418,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は引きつった頬にどうにか笑顔を作った。","en":"I somehow managed to force my contorted face into a smile.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r419","rowIndex":419,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「こんなもの……」","en":"“This thing...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r420","rowIndex":420,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　少女になった<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>はその小さな細い指で注射筒を抜き取ると、地面に叩きつけた。","en":"Now in the shape of a girl, <tips=20>Koschei</tips> pulled the syringe free with her small, slender fingers and slammed it onto the ground.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r421","rowIndex":421,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「かみさまにさからったらいけない。おまえたちはここでめされるんだ」","en":"“You mustn’t go against God. You’ll be called to Him here.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"マリア","displayName":"Maria","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r422","rowIndex":422,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=5>太刀川</tips>先生を殺したのはお前だな？」","en":"“You killed Doctor <tips=5>Tachikawa</tips>, didn’t you?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r423","rowIndex":423,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は意識がなくなりそうになるのをなんとか堪えながら相手を睨み付けた。","en":"Struggling not to lose consciousness, I glared at my opponent.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r424","rowIndex":424,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=43>APTG</tips>に使われている新型の注射薬はとにかく効果が現れるのが早いが、それでも完全に能力を押さえ込むには数十秒はかかると言われている。相手の身体は大分小さくなってくれたものの、それでも瞬間的に能力を封じ込めてはくれないだろう。","en":"The new injectable drug used in the <tips=43>APTG</tips> took effect extraordinarily quickly, but I had heard that completely suppressing an ability still required several dozen seconds. Fortunately, my opponent had transformed into a much smaller body. Even so, the drug could not have sealed her power instantaneously.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r425","rowIndex":425,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「むずかしいことをいわれてもわからない……」","en":"“I don’t understand when you say difficult things...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"マリア","displayName":"Maria","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r426","rowIndex":426,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　少女は顔をしかめた。","en":"The girl frowned.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r427","rowIndex":427,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「お前のしていることはっ……」","en":"“What you’re doing—”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r428","rowIndex":428,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　喋ろうとした口元から血液がこぼれる。私は一瞬意識を失いかけ、ふらふらと揺らめく。<tips=49>三芳</tips>が駆けつけてその私を支えてくれる。","en":"Blood spilled from my lips when I tried to speak. For an instant, I nearly lost consciousness and reeled on my feet. <tips=49>Miyoshi</tips> rushed over and caught me, holding me upright.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r429","rowIndex":429,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「くるしそう」","en":"“You look like you’re hurting.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"マリア","displayName":"Maria","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r430","rowIndex":430,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　少女は悲しそうにそう呟くと、","en":"The girl murmured sadly:","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r431","rowIndex":431,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「たすけてあげる」","en":"“I’ll save you.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"マリア","displayName":"Maria","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r432","rowIndex":432,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして彼女はぴょんとジャンプをすると……その場に着地した。","en":"Then she sprang lightly into the air... and landed on the very spot from which she had jumped.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r433","rowIndex":433,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あれ？」","en":"“Huh?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"マリア","displayName":"Maria","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r434","rowIndex":434,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女は首を捻ってジャンプをする。しかしそこに落ちるだけだ。","en":"Puzzled, she cocked her head and jumped again. Once more, she merely came down in the same place.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r435","rowIndex":435,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あれ？　あれ？」","en":"“Huh? Huh?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"マリア","displayName":"Maria","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r436","rowIndex":436,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　何度も何度もぴょんぴょんとジャンプを繰り返す。そして困惑で顔を歪める。","en":"Again and again she repeated the little jumps, her face twisting with bewilderment.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r437","rowIndex":437,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ばっちり薬が効いたようだな。能力を使おうとしているんだろうが、もうそれは出来ないぜ」","en":"“Looks like the drug worked perfectly. You’re trying to use your ability, aren’t you? You can’t anymore.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r438","rowIndex":438,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どうして？　どうして？　かみさま……とべない！　どうなっているの？」","en":"“Why? Why? God... I can’t fly! What’s happening?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"マリア","displayName":"Maria","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r439","rowIndex":439,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　少女は雨に打たれながら金色の髪を振り乱し、あらぬ方向を向いて呼びかける。","en":"Rain beating down upon her, the girl tossed her golden hair wildly and called out toward empty space.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r440","rowIndex":440,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……きこえない！　こえがきこえない！　どうして？　わたしはみすてられたの？」","en":"“...I can’t hear it! I can’t hear the voice! Why? Have I been abandoned?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"マリア","displayName":"Maria","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r441","rowIndex":441,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「形勢逆転だな。……<tips=49>三芳</tips>、銃をよこせ。<tips=43>APTG</tips>じゃない、普通のやつだ」","en":"“The tables have turned. ...<tips=49>Miyoshi</tips>, give me your gun. Not the <tips=43>APTG</tips>—the regular one.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r442","rowIndex":442,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「え、でも、無力化したのなら逮捕を……」","en":"“But if she’s been neutralized, shouldn’t we arrest her...?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r443","rowIndex":443,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「馬鹿言っちゃいけない。こんなやつを逮捕出来るわけがないだろ？　サイキックとの戦いの鉄則は、殺せるときに殺せ、だ。……はやくよこせ。頭を撃って動かなくしてから、<tips=59>暗闇通り</tips>の死体処理屋に持っていって肉体を全部薬品で溶かすんだ。場所はおれが知ってる。いくら不死身と言ったって、ひとかけらの肉片もなくなれば、さすがに復活も出来ないだろうよ……」","en":"“Don’t talk nonsense. There’s no way we could arrest a creature like this. The iron rule of fighting psychics is simple: when you have a chance to kill one, take it. ...Hurry and give me the gun. We’ll put a bullet through her head so she can’t move, then carry her to the corpse-disposal man on <tips=59>Darkness Street</tips> and have him dissolve her entire body in chemicals. I know where to find him. No matter how deathless she may be, even she shouldn’t be able to come back if there isn’t a single scrap of flesh left...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r444","rowIndex":444,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は自分の身体にほとんど力が入らなくなっているのを感じる。<tips=49>三芳</tips>が支えてくれなければこの場に倒れてしまうだろう。","en":"I felt nearly all strength leave my body. Without <tips=49>Miyoshi</tips> to support me, I would have collapsed where I stood.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r445","rowIndex":445,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「でも、あんな子供を……」","en":"“But she’s a child...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r446","rowIndex":446,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「見た目は子供でも、中身は殺人鬼だ。先生の死体を見ろ」","en":"“She may look like a child, but what’s inside her is a murderer. Look at the doctor’s body.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r447","rowIndex":447,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=49>三芳</tips>は少女の方を見つめながら下唇を噛む。","en":"<tips=49>Miyoshi</tips> bit her lower lip as she stared at the girl.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r448","rowIndex":448,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　相手はすっかり混乱してしまって、目の前の私たちをそっちのけで空中を見上げながら何かぶつぶつと呟いている。","en":"Our opponent was utterly confused. Forgetting the two of us entirely, she stared up into empty air and muttered something under her breath.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r449","rowIndex":449,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　さっさと変身しないところを見ると、やはり変身もサイキック能力だったのだろう。薬によって抑制されているのだ。","en":"If she could have transformed again, she would surely have done it at once. Her failure confirmed that transformation itself was a psychic ability, and the drug was suppressing it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r450","rowIndex":450,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「おれにやらせてくれ。みんな殺されたんだ……。おれは、このためにここまで来たんだ……」","en":"“Let me do it. They killed everyone... This is what I came all this way for...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r451","rowIndex":451,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=49>三芳</tips>は私の顔を見て、ごくりとつばをのむ。一体私はいまどんな表情をしているのだろう？","en":"<tips=49>Miyoshi</tips> looked at my face and swallowed hard. What expression was I wearing?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r452","rowIndex":452,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「わかりました……」","en":"“All right...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r453","rowIndex":453,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そしてごそごそとカバンを探って、黒い拳銃を取り出した。こちらは、フルメタルジャケットを飛ばすオートマチックピストルだ。","en":"She searched through her bag and removed a black handgun. This was an automatic pistol that fired full-metal-jacket rounds.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r454","rowIndex":454,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私はそれをひったくるように奪い取ると、少女に狙いを定める。しかし、銃の重さに腕力がおよばず、銃口が泳いでいる。","en":"I all but tore it from her hand and aimed at the girl. But my arms no longer had the strength to master the gun’s weight, and the muzzle wavered wildly.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r455","rowIndex":455,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その腕を、<tips=49>三芳</tips>は何も言わずに支えて、少女に照準を定めてくれた。","en":"Without a word, <tips=49>Miyoshi</tips> took hold of my arms, steadied them, and brought the sights onto the girl for me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r456","rowIndex":456,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　独り言を続ける少女はそんな私たちに気がつかない。","en":"Still talking to herself, the girl did not notice us.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r457","rowIndex":457,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は引き金を引く。","en":"I pulled the trigger.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r458","rowIndex":458,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　銃声がなり、少女の肩で真っ赤な血がはじける。","en":"A gunshot rang out, and bright red blood burst from the girl’s shoulder.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r459","rowIndex":459,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ひぃっ！」","en":"“Eek!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"マリア","displayName":"Maria","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r460","rowIndex":460,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　少女は尻餅をつき、怯えた顔でこちらを見つめる。","en":"The girl dropped hard onto her backside and stared at us in terror.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r461","rowIndex":461,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　急所を外したようだが、次は外さない。私は力が入りにくくなった足で三歩近づく。","en":"The first shot seemed to have missed anything vital. The next would not. Barely able to put any strength into my legs, I forced myself three steps closer.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r462","rowIndex":462,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして少女の怯えた顔に、照準を合わせる。","en":"I placed the sights over her frightened face.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r463","rowIndex":463,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「やっと、わたしのばんがきたのね……」","en":"“At last, my turn has come...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"マリア","displayName":"Maria","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r464","rowIndex":464,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　少女はそう言うと、なぜか顔から恐怖の色が消え、かわりにうっすらと微笑みが浮かんだ。","en":"When the girl said this, the fear somehow vanished from her face, replaced by the faintest smile.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r465","rowIndex":465,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=49>三芳</tips>が支えてくれた銃口はその顔の中心にぴたりと狙いを定める。","en":"With <tips=49>Miyoshi’s</tips> hands supporting it, the muzzle settled dead center on the girl’s face.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r466","rowIndex":466,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　あとは引き金を引くだけのはずだったが、せっかく狙いをあわせたはずの銃口が、ぐいと横からの力を受けてあらぬ方向に逸れる。","en":"All I had to do was pull the trigger. But some force from the side suddenly wrenched the muzzle away from the target I had so carefully aligned.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r467","rowIndex":467,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=49>三芳</tips>……」","en":"“<tips=49>Miyoshi</tips>...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r468","rowIndex":468,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「わ、私じゃありません！」","en":"“I-it wasn’t me!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r469","rowIndex":469,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女は驚きを隠せない。","en":"Her surprise was plain to see.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r470","rowIndex":470,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ということは……」","en":"“Which means...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r471","rowIndex":471,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は視線を周囲にぐるりまわすと、右手の塀の上に、二人の人影があるのを見つけた。","en":"I swept my gaze around us and found two figures atop the wall to my right.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r472","rowIndex":472,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「やっぱりお前らか」","en":"“I knew it was you.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r473","rowIndex":473,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そこには<tips=11>灰上璃映子</tips>と<tips=12>江梨子</tips>が、傘を差して立っている。","en":"<tips=11>Rieko Haigami</tips> and <tips=12>Eriko</tips> stood there beneath their umbrellas.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r474","rowIndex":474,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いつも、高いところから登場しやがって」","en":"“You always have to make your entrance from somewhere high up, don’t you?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r475","rowIndex":475,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私はそう言って、<tips=49>三芳</tips>から身体を離し、自分の足で立つことにした。","en":"As I spoke, I pulled away from <tips=49>Miyoshi</tips> and made myself stand under my own power.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r476","rowIndex":476,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　やはり膝にも腰にも力が入らない。<tips=55>汐松子</tips>の血液を与えられて以来、<tips=17>タイプB</tips>らしく私の身体能力は向上したが、今はそれも役にたたない。気を抜けば倒れてしまうだろう。","en":"There was still no strength in my knees or hips. Ever since receiving <tips=55>Matsuko Shio’s</tips> blood, my physical abilities had improved to those of a <tips=17>Type B</tips>, but even that availed me nothing now. If I relaxed my concentration for an instant, I would collapse.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r477","rowIndex":477,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……<tips=49>三芳</tips>、装填しろ」","en":"“...<tips=49>Miyoshi</tips>. Reload.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r478","rowIndex":478,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　小声でそう指示を出す。","en":"I gave the instruction in a whisper.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r479","rowIndex":479,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「探偵さん、元気そうでなによりだわ」","en":"“Why, Detective. I’m delighted to see you looking so well.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"灰上璃映子","displayName":"Rieko Haigami","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r480","rowIndex":480,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=86>双子</tips>の一人が塀の上からそう言い、もう一人が相手に傘を手渡すと素早く塀から降りて<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>のそばに駆け寄る。","en":"One of the <tips=86>twins</tips> called down from atop the wall. The other handed her own umbrella to the speaker, leapt swiftly to the ground, and ran to <tips=20>Koschei’s</tips> side.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r481","rowIndex":481,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　降りた方が金色の目をしているから妹の<tips=12>江梨子</tips>か。ということは、塀の上がサイキックの<tips=11>璃映子</tips>だ。","en":"The one who came down had golden eyes, which made her the younger sister, <tips=12>Eriko</tips>. The psychic <tips=11>Rieko</tips> therefore remained above.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r482","rowIndex":482,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「驚いたかい？　念入りに殺してくれたが、おれはまだここにいるんだ」","en":"“Surprised? You certainly made a thorough job of killing me, but here I am all the same.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r483","rowIndex":483,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私の握った拳銃には、<tips=11>璃映子</tips>の能力による力が加わり続けていて、相手に銃口を向けることができない。大した力ではないが、今の私はそれをはねのける力がない。","en":"The force of <tips=11>Rieko’s</tips> ability continued to bear upon the handgun in my grip, preventing me from pointing the muzzle at my opponents. It was no great force, but in my present state, I lacked the strength to throw it off.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r484","rowIndex":484,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=49>三芳</tips>が<tips=43>APTG</tips>の準備を終えるのを待つしかない。","en":"All I could do was wait for <tips=49>Miyoshi</tips> to finish reloading the <tips=43>APTG</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r485","rowIndex":485,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「今更、そんなことくらいじゃ驚かないわ。誰に血を貰ったの？」","en":"“At this point, something like that hardly surprises me. Whose blood did you receive?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"灰上璃映子","displayName":"Rieko Haigami","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r486","rowIndex":486,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　両手に傘を持ったまま<tips=11>璃映子</tips>は言う。","en":"<tips=11>Rieko</tips> spoke while holding an umbrella in each hand.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r487","rowIndex":487,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「詳しいじゃないか。お前らも<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>に飲ませて貰ったのか？」","en":"“You’re well informed. Did <tips=20>Koschei</tips> give you some of his blood to drink, too?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r488","rowIndex":488,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「冗談じゃない」","en":"“Don’t be ridiculous.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"灰上璃映子","displayName":"Rieko Haigami","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r489","rowIndex":489,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=11>璃映子</tips>は苦い顔をして、江梨子の方を見る。<tips=12>江梨子</tips>はもう背中に<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>を背負っている。<tips=86>双子</tips>は視線を合わせ、おたがいに頷く。","en":"<tips=11>Rieko</tips> grimaced and looked toward Eriko. <tips=12>Eriko</tips> already had <tips=20>Koschei</tips> on her back. The <tips=86>twins</tips> met each other’s eyes and nodded.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r490","rowIndex":490,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「出来ればもう二度とその顔を見たくないよ」","en":"“I’d rather never see that face again.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"灰上璃映子","displayName":"Rieko Haigami","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r491","rowIndex":491,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=11>璃映子</tips>がそう言ったところで、<tips=49>三芳</tips>が<tips=43>APTG</tips>を構えて引き金を引いた。しかし、その直前で念動力の妨害を受けたのか、銃口は逸れ、注射筒は雨の降る夜の空に吸い込まれてゆく。","en":"As <tips=11>Rieko</tips> said this, <tips=49>Miyoshi</tips> raised the <tips=43>APTG</tips> and pulled the trigger. Perhaps telekinesis deflected it at the last instant: the muzzle veered aside, and the syringe vanished into the rainy night sky.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r492","rowIndex":492,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「死にたくなければもう私たちの前に姿を現さないで」","en":"“If you don’t want to die, never appear before us again.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"灰上璃映子","displayName":"Rieko Haigami","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r493","rowIndex":493,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=11>璃映子</tips>が無表情にそう言い放つ。","en":"<tips=11>Rieko</tips> delivered the threat flatly, without a trace of expression.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r494","rowIndex":494,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=12>江梨子</tips>は<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>を背負ったまま軽々と塀の上に飛び上がって、<tips=11>璃映子</tips>から傘を受け取る。","en":"Still carrying <tips=20>Koschei</tips>, <tips=12>Eriko</tips> leaped lightly onto the wall and took the umbrella from <tips=11>Rieko</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r495","rowIndex":495,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あなたは不死身だと思ってるかもしれないけど、死ぬときは死ぬよ」","en":"“You may think you’re deathless, but when your time comes, you’ll die like anyone else.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"灰上江梨子","displayName":"Eriko Haigami","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r496","rowIndex":496,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=12>江梨子</tips>は金色の目を光らせながらそう言った。","en":"<tips=12>Eriko</tips> spoke with her golden eyes aglow.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r497","rowIndex":497,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして二人は塀の向こうへ姿を消す。","en":"Then the two disappeared beyond the wall.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r498","rowIndex":498,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私はそこで力尽き、路上の水たまりに顔から倒れ、体中が泥にまみれる。","en":"My strength finally failed, and I fell face-first into a puddle in the street, covering my entire body in mud.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r499","rowIndex":499,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私の心は悔しさで張り裂けそうだった。せっかくここまで追い詰めておきながら、あと一歩で取り逃がしてしまった。","en":"My heart felt ready to burst with frustration. After cornering Koschei so completely, I had let him escape at the very last moment.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r500","rowIndex":500,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=50>路地</tips>さんっ！」","en":"“Mr. <tips=50>Roji</tips>!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r501","rowIndex":501,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=49>三芳</tips>はそんな私に駆けつけ、抱き起こしてくれた。","en":"<tips=49>Miyoshi</tips> rushed to me and lifted me into her arms.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r502","rowIndex":502,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女のグレーのスーツは、私の血液と、泥水で汚れてしまっている。","en":"My blood and the muddy water had stained her gray suit.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r503","rowIndex":503,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=50>路地</tips>さんっ！」","en":"“Mr. <tips=50>Roji</tips>!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r504","rowIndex":504,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女は目から涙をこぼし、それは私の顔を暖かく濡らす。泣いているのだ。","en":"Tears spilled from her eyes and fell warmly upon my face. She was crying.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r505","rowIndex":505,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「大丈夫、大丈夫だ……」","en":"“I’m all right. I’m all right...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r506","rowIndex":506,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は薄れ行く意識のなかそう言った。","en":"I managed the words as my consciousness faded.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r507","rowIndex":507,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「おれは死なない。……<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>と同じ身体なんだ。だから、おおごとにしないで、どこか人気のないところに連れて行ってくれ……」","en":"“I won’t die. ...I have the same kind of body as <tips=20>Koschei</tips>. So don’t make a commotion. Just take me somewhere no one will see us...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E6:r508","rowIndex":508,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それだけ言って、私の意識は闇の中へ落ちていった。","en":"After saying that much, I sank into darkness.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}}]},{"position":41,"code":"X14","unitId":"X14","rows":[{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r1","rowIndex":1,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　最近の<tips=55>汐松子</tips>は頼りになると、同僚の間で評判だった。","en":"Lately, <tips=55>Matsuko Shio</tips> had earned a reputation among her colleagues as someone they could count on.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r2","rowIndex":2,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　以前の彼女が頼りにならなかったというわけではない。真面目で素直であり、よく動いて細かいことにも気がつく。働きものの職員ではあったのだけれども、どこか自信なさげというか、控えめな部分があった。","en":"That did not mean she had been undependable before. She was earnest and straightforward, always on the move and attentive even to small details. She was a hardworking member of staff, but there was something diffident about her—something reserved.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r3","rowIndex":3,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　謙虚と言えばきこえはいいが、仕事の現場であまりにも自信なげな言葉を口にしていると重要なことを任せにくくなるのもまた事実である。","en":"Humility sounded admirable, but the fact remained that someone who spoke with too little confidence on the job was difficult to trust with anything important.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r4","rowIndex":4,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　最近の<tips=55>松子</tips>にはそうした行き過ぎた謙虚さがなくなり、他の職員が対応に困るような場面でも積極的に自分が出て行って引き受けるようになった。すると彼女の本来の美点がますます輝くようになり、同僚たちからはこれまで以上の信頼を得はじめている。","en":"<tips=55>Matsuko</tips> had lately shed that excessive humility. Even in situations the other staff did not know how to handle, she would step forward and take charge. Her natural strengths shone all the brighter, and her colleagues were beginning to place more trust in her than ever.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r5","rowIndex":5,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　上司からも資格をとることを勧められたり、他の職員への指導の仕方を教わったり、将来的に重要な位置につくことを視野にいれたようなアドバイスを受けることが多くなった。","en":"Her supervisors now often encouraged her to earn qualifications, taught her how to instruct other members of staff, and offered advice apparently intended to prepare her for an important position in the future.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r6","rowIndex":6,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　自分が評価されている。このような事実は以前の<tips=55>松子</tips>であったらその持ち前の屈託が阻んで素直に喜べなかったところだが、今は誇らしく感じることが出来た。","en":"She was being valued. In the past, <tips=55>Matsuko’s</tips> habitual anxieties would have kept her from taking simple pleasure in that fact. Now she could feel proud.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r7","rowIndex":7,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　まわりの人に「なにがあったの？」と言われたりもする。","en":"People around her would even ask, “What happened to you?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r8","rowIndex":8,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それくらい、彼女の変化はわかりやすいものだったのだろう。<tips=55>松子</tips>自身も自分の心境が変わってきていることに気がついてはいたが、はっきりとは説明出来ない。","en":"The change in her must have been that obvious. <tips=55>Matsuko</tips> herself had noticed her outlook beginning to shift, though she could not clearly explain why.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r9","rowIndex":9,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ただ、自分の出自についてアクションを起こしたことがなんらかの影響を与えているのだろうとは思った。","en":"She did think that taking action to investigate her origins had influenced her somehow.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r10","rowIndex":10,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=50>路地邦昭</tips>と共に<tips=5>太刀川</tips>医師と話し、<tips=31>エリー・ホワイト</tips>と話した。そのなかで彼女は驚くべき事実をいくつも知った。自分が<tips=18>ローズ・クラブ</tips>となんらかの関係があることは予想していたが、自分のこのあまりにも特殊な不死身の身体がそのクラブの秘密と関わり、さらに<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>という殺人鬼とも関連しているという。","en":"Together with <tips=50>Kuniaki Roji</tips>, she had spoken to <tips=5>Doctor Tachikawa</tips> and <tips=31>Ellie White</tips>, learning several astonishing truths. She had suspected some connection with <tips=18>Rose Club</tips>; what she learned was that her extraordinary, deathless body was bound up with the club’s secret, and even with the murderer known as <tips=20>Koschei</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r11","rowIndex":11,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　まだ自分の完全な解明には至ってはいないが、しかし、これ以上調べる必要はないのではないかというのが彼女の結論だった。","en":"She had not yet uncovered the whole truth about herself. Even so, she had concluded that perhaps there was no need to investigate any further.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r12","rowIndex":12,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　事実が全て明らかになるのを恐れているわけではない。それこそ調べはじめる前までは、むやみに恐れていたが、知ってしまえばそれほどのものではなかった。きっと、この先どんな事実を知ったとしても、冷静に受け入れられるだろう。","en":"It was not that she feared having every fact brought to light. Before she began looking, she had feared it blindly, but knowing the truth had proved less terrible than she expected. Whatever facts she learned from here on, she would surely be able to accept them calmly.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r13","rowIndex":13,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それは、気持ちが過去よりも未来に向けられるようになったからに違いない。――と、本人は自己分析している。","en":"It had to be because her heart had begun to turn toward the future instead of the past—or so she analyzed it herself.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r14","rowIndex":14,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　この短い間に彼女が会った人々――<tips=5>太刀川</tips>にしろ、<tips=50>路地</tips>にしろ、<tips=31>エリー</tips>にしろ、みなそれぞれ形は違うにしろ、深い過去を持ちながら現在に生きていた。","en":"The people she had met in that short span—<tips=5>Tachikawa</tips>, <tips=50>Roji</tips>, and <tips=31>Ellie</tips>—all lived in the present despite the deep and very different pasts they carried.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r15","rowIndex":15,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=50>路地</tips>は<tips=5>太刀川</tips>のことを過去の感傷に浸っているなどと言っていたが、<tips=55>松子</tips>はそうは思わない。忙しい勤務の間を縫って、なんの得にもならない慈善診療を続けるのはただの感傷で出来ることだろうか？　いや、たとえ感傷にしても結果として意味のある行動に結びついている。職員たちが、彼の行為にどれだけ感謝していることか。","en":"<tips=50>Roji</tips> had accused <tips=5>Tachikawa</tips> of wallowing in sentiment over the past, but <tips=55>Matsuko</tips> disagreed. Could mere sentiment sustain charitable treatment that brought him no benefit, carved out between the demands of his regular work? Even if it was sentiment, it had led to action with real value. The staff could not have been more grateful for what he did.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r16","rowIndex":16,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=50>路地</tips>だって、ただの利己的な復讐だのなんだのとうそぶいていたが、そうだろうか？　彼は元々貧者のための探偵だったという話だ。今の行動だって、本人は自嘲してひどくしか言わないが、故人への愛や殺人鬼への正義感がその心にあるのを、少なくとも<tips=55>松子</tips>には感じ取ることが出来た。","en":"<tips=50>Roji</tips> too had dismissed his motives as selfish revenge and so forth, but was that truly all? She had heard that he was once a detective for the poor. However bitterly he mocked his present actions, <tips=55>Matsuko</tips> at least could sense within him love for those he had lost and a desire to bring a murderer to justice.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r17","rowIndex":17,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そしてああした立場にありながらも、自分の秘密を洗いざらい話してくれた<tips=31>エリー・ホワイト</tips>。あの黒衣の麗人は<tips=18>ローズ・クラブ</tips>から身ひとつで逃げ出してから、この街の有力者の一人として他のギャングたちと渡り合っている。","en":"Then there was <tips=31>Ellie White</tips>, who despite her position had told Matsuko every last one of her secrets. That beautiful woman in black had fled <tips=18>Rose Club</tips> with nothing but the clothes on her back, then risen to become one of the city’s leading figures and hold her own against its other gangs.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r18","rowIndex":18,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　自分のことでくよくよ悩んでいていいのだろうか？　自分の正体なんか、どうだっていいじゃないか。得体の知れないなにかだとしても、そんなのは問題じゃない。それを受け入れるのが大事だ。いや、悩んでいても良い。どうしても受け入れられなければ悩んで、だけどその気持ちをなんらかのかたちで現在、そして未来に繋がる行動に変えてゆくのだ。","en":"What good was there in endlessly tormenting herself over who she was? What did her true identity matter? Even if she was something unknowable, so what? Accepting it was what mattered. No—there was nothing wrong with agonizing over it. If she truly could not accept it, then she could agonize. But she would find some way to turn those feelings into action that carried forward into the present and the future.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r19","rowIndex":19,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　幸い<tips=55>松子</tips>の目の前には自分と同じように素性の定かでない子供たちがいた。いままでも彼らに共感はしていたが、その共感によって自分が癒やされるというだけで満足していた。その気持ちをもう一歩進めたらどうだろうか？　境遇の似た自分にしか出来ないことがきっとあるはずだ。","en":"Fortunately, <tips=55>Matsuko</tips> had children before her whose origins were as uncertain as her own. She had always empathized with them, but until now she had been satisfied merely with the healing that empathy brought her. What if she took that feeling one step further? There had to be something only a person who shared their circumstances could do.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r20","rowIndex":20,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そう考えて動くようになると、前よりも多くのことに気がつき、しなければいけないことがわかるようになった。","en":"Once she began acting on that thought, she noticed more than before and better understood what needed to be done.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r21","rowIndex":21,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして自分が動けば、まわりもそれに応えてくれる。これが充実というものなんだろうか？　時々、自分があの殺された<tips=73>リュウカ</tips>のように行動出来ていると感じる時があった。彼女もこんな心境で働いていたのかもしれない。","en":"And when she acted, the people around her responded in kind. Was this what fulfillment felt like? At times, she felt she was acting as the murdered <tips=73>Ryuka</tips> once had. Perhaps this was the spirit in which Ryuka, too, had worked.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r22","rowIndex":22,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=55>松子</tips>の毎日はやりがいに満ちたものになった。だからもう、これ以上過去のことをやけになって追い回す必要はなくなったのだ。","en":"<tips=55>Matsuko’s</tips> days became rich with purpose. That was why she no longer needed to chase her past with desperate abandon.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r23","rowIndex":23,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　勿論全てがうまくいっているというわけではない。失敗や、悲しいアクシデントはどうしてもついてまわる。","en":"Of course, that did not mean everything went well. Failures and tragic accidents were impossible to avoid.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r24","rowIndex":24,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　世の中というものはそういうものだ。","en":"That was the way of the world.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r25","rowIndex":25,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　仕事でもそうだし、プライベートでもそうだ。","en":"It was true in her work and in her private life alike.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r26","rowIndex":26,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>謝亮</tips>のことを考えると胸が痛む。","en":"Her heart ached whenever she thought of <tips=1>Tse Leung</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r27","rowIndex":27,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼は今どうしているのだろうか？　街のどこからでも見える<tips=41>グランドタワー</tips>の天辺を見上げるたび思い出す。子どもの時は仲間たちと共によく喧嘩をしていたが、彼が争いが好きではないのを<tips=55>松子</tips>は知っている。命の大切さを教えてくれたのも彼なのだ。それが、今はたくさんの人を殺しているという。どんな心情でいるのか想像すると、胸が苦しくなる。さぞかしつらいだろう。愚痴をこぼすタイプではないが、近くに誰か話が出来る相手がいればいいが。","en":"What was he doing now? Every time she looked up at the summit of <tips=41>Grand Tower</tips>, visible from anywhere in the city, she thought of him. As a child, he had often fought alongside his friends, but <tips=55>Matsuko</tips> knew he took no pleasure in conflict. He was the one who had taught her the value of life. And now he was said to be killing people by the score. Her chest tightened when she imagined what he must be feeling. How painful it must be. He was not the sort to complain; she only hoped there was someone nearby he could talk to.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r28","rowIndex":28,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　会いたいけれど、会うことは出来ない。","en":"She wanted to see him, but she could not.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r29","rowIndex":29,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　――でもきっと、いつかはまた一緒に暮らせるんだろうな。","en":"Even so, one day they would surely live together again.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r30","rowIndex":30,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=55>松子</tips>は漠然とそう信じていた。","en":"<tips=55>Matsuko</tips> held vaguely to that belief.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r31","rowIndex":31,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　夜、ベッドに潜り込んでから眠りにつくまでの間にも、彼のことをよく考える。","en":"At night, too, between slipping into bed and falling asleep, she often thought about him.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r32","rowIndex":32,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　わざと自分にとって都合が悪いように想像してみても、やはりなんとなく彼と一緒にいるような気がするのだ。それはレストランの時の態度を思い出してもそうだ。あんな風に自分の感情を出すのは、きっと自分といるときだけだろう。<tips=1>亮</tips>は子供の時から、外での態度と自分に対する態度が違う。あの時レストランで見た彼は、子供の時に自分だけに見せた態度と何も変わってはいなかった。","en":"Even when she deliberately imagined the outcome least favorable to herself, she somehow still felt that they would be together. Remembering his behavior at the restaurant only strengthened that impression. Surely he showed his feelings that openly only when he was with her. Ever since childhood, <tips=1>Ryo</tips> had behaved differently toward her than he did in public. The man she saw at the restaurant had been no different from the boy who showed that side of himself to her alone.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r33","rowIndex":33,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　きっといつか収まるべきところに収まるのだろうと考える。それはきっと平和な日常の場だと<tips=55>松子</tips>は考えている。","en":"One day, she thought, things would surely settle where they belonged. And <tips=55>Matsuko</tips> imagined that place as a peaceful, ordinary life.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r34","rowIndex":34,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　もし収まるところが自分の想像と違っていても、それはそれで仕方ない。その時は悲しめば良いだけだ。将来悲しむのを恐れて何も期待しないというのは、あまりにも愚かしい。","en":"If where things settled was different from what she imagined, then so be it. She could grieve when the time came. Refusing to hope for anything because she feared some future sorrow would be far too foolish.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r35","rowIndex":35,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女はいつも、そうやって自分の考えを確認しながら、眠りにつくのだ。","en":"That was how she always fell asleep, going over her convictions once more.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r36","rowIndex":36,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その日、<tips=55>松子</tips>は日が傾きかける頃に出勤した。その日のシフトは夜勤だった。彼女の施設では夜勤者は十七時から翌朝九時までが勤務時間となっていた。","en":"That day, <tips=55>Matsuko</tips> arrived for work as the sun began to sink. She was assigned to the night shift. At her facility, the night shift ran from five in the afternoon until nine the next morning.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r37","rowIndex":37,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　途中三時間の仮眠休憩が与えられており、各階二人ずつの職員が交互に休む。","en":"Each worker received a three-hour nap break, with the two staff members on every floor taking theirs in turns.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r38","rowIndex":38,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=17>タイプB</tips>の子供は突発的な行動を起こすことが多いので、その階に出勤している職員全員が眠ってしまって起きている者が誰もいなくなるような時間は作ってはいけないことになっている。","en":"<tips=17>Type B</tips> children were prone to sudden and unpredictable behavior. The rules therefore forbade any period when every member of staff on a floor was asleep and no one remained awake.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r39","rowIndex":39,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=55>松子</tips>は始業三十分前の十六時半には出勤しており、その日も普段と変わらぬ時間に、一階にある職員室の自席についていた。","en":"<tips=55>Matsuko</tips> arrived at four thirty, half an hour before the beginning of her shift, and took her usual seat in the staff room on the first floor.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r40","rowIndex":40,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「今日は一階だっけ？」","en":"“You’re on the first floor today, right?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ハシモト","displayName":"Hashimoto","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r41","rowIndex":41,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　机の上の整理をしているとハシモトが話しかけてくる。","en":"As Matsuko tidied her desk, Hashimoto spoke to her.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r42","rowIndex":42,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうです。タグチさんと一緒です」","en":"“Yes. I’m working with Taguchi.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐松子","displayName":"Matsuko Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r43","rowIndex":43,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「じゃあ今日はこき使われちゃうねー」","en":"“Then you’ll get worked to the bone today.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ハシモト","displayName":"Hashimoto","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r44","rowIndex":44,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ハシモトさんは日勤でしたか？」","en":"“Were you on the day shift, Ms. Hashimoto?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐松子","displayName":"Matsuko Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r45","rowIndex":45,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ううん、早番。だから、もう帰らせて貰うわ。今日はねー、デートなの」","en":"“No, the early shift. So I get to go home now. I have a date today.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ハシモト","displayName":"Hashimoto","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r46","rowIndex":46,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ああ、この間言っていた人と」","en":"“Oh, with the man you mentioned before.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐松子","displayName":"Matsuko Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r47","rowIndex":47,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そう！　はっきりしない男なんだけどねー。今日こそビシッと言わせてやるわ。絶対あたしのこと好きなんだから」","en":"“That’s right! He’s terribly indecisive, but today I’m going to get a straight answer out of him. I know he likes me.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ハシモト","displayName":"Hashimoto","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r48","rowIndex":48,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「アハハ、楽しそうですね」","en":"“Ahaha. You look like you’re having fun.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐松子","displayName":"Matsuko Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r49","rowIndex":49,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうよ。あなたも仕事ばっかりしてないで遊ばなきゃ」","en":"“I am. You can’t spend all your time working. You need to enjoy yourself too.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ハシモト","displayName":"Hashimoto","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r50","rowIndex":50,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いやあ、私はべつに……」","en":"“Oh, I don’t really...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐松子","displayName":"Matsuko Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r51","rowIndex":51,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「やっぱり、本当は<tips=10>見土</tips>さんとつき合ってるんじゃないの？」","en":"“So you really are dating Mr. <tips=10>Mido</tips> after all, aren't you?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ハシモト","displayName":"Hashimoto","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r52","rowIndex":52,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どうしてそうなるんですか」","en":"“Why would you think that?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐松子","displayName":"Matsuko Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r53","rowIndex":53,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=55>松子</tips>は愛想笑いをしながら話をはぐらかすと、今日は自分の予定で夢中になっているハシモトはいつもほどしつこくなく話題を切り上げ、別の職員を捕まえて同じようなことを話し始めた。","en":"<tips=55>Matsuko</tips> laughed politely and deflected the question. Preoccupied with her own plans, Hashimoto let the subject drop more readily than usual, cornered another colleague, and struck up much the same conversation with her.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r54","rowIndex":54,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　一人になった<tips=55>松子</tips>は、肩をすくめて笑ってから、小さく溜息をつく。","en":"Left alone, <tips=55>Matsuko</tips> shrugged with a smile, then gave a quiet sigh.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r55","rowIndex":55,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　時間になると申し送りがはじまる。","en":"When it was time, the shift handover began.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r56","rowIndex":56,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=55>松子</tips>は児童たちの居住棟の一階に行き、そこの職員室で日勤者からの報告を受けた。","en":"<tips=55>Matsuko</tips> went to the staff room on the first floor of the children’s residence and received the day shift’s report.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r57","rowIndex":57,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　施設内では少し前から風邪が流行っていたが、やっと収束に向かいつつあり、今日は発熱者もなく五名ほどが少し咳込むだけだと言う。十歳の児童に朝から<tips=95>金眼現象</tips>が出ており、朝に薬を飲ませたが落ち着かず、イライラしっぱなしなので観察が必要とのことだった。その他細々とした生活のなかでの変化や、一日に起きたことを聞き、重要なことはメモに取る。","en":"A cold had been spreading through the facility for some time but was finally subsiding. No one had developed a fever today, and only about five children still coughed a little. One ten-year-old had exhibited the <tips=95>golden-eye phenomenon</tips> since morning. The child had been given medication that morning but had not calmed down, remaining irritable and in need of observation. Matsuko listened to the other minor changes and events of daily life and made notes of the important points.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r58","rowIndex":58,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　夜勤者の仕事のはじまりはいつもドタバタとしている。","en":"The beginning of a night shift was always frantic.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r59","rowIndex":59,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　門限になっても帰って来ない児童を探したり、自分勝手に遊んだり喧嘩をしたりする児童たちに席に座って食事を食べさせ、いやがる児童に歯磨きをさせたり、入浴をさせたり、薬の時間にはこっそり捨ててしまう児童を見張ったり、そして障碍のある児童の世話をしたり。","en":"They searched for children who failed to return by curfew; made children who wanted only to play as they pleased or fight with one another sit and eat their meals; made reluctant children brush their teeth and bathe; watched those who secretly threw away their medicine when the hour came; and cared for children with disabilities.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r60","rowIndex":60,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　夜勤者が出勤してから遅番が帰るまでの時間帯は職員の数が最も多くなるが、いくら手があっても足りない。","en":"The interval between the night shift’s arrival and the late shift’s departure put more staff on duty than at any other time, yet there were never enough hands.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r61","rowIndex":61,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　児童をうまく叱れるベテランの職員がいるとそうでもないのだ。しかし今夜のように若く優しい職員ばかりだとなかなか大人しく従ってはくれない。<tips=55>松子</tips>は声をからして叱るが、思春期を迎えた男の子などはかえって面白がるくらいのものだ。甘く見られているのである。","en":"Things were easier when an experienced worker knew how to discipline the children. But on a night like this, when the staff were all young and gentle, the children did not readily obey. <tips=55>Matsuko</tips> scolded until her voice went hoarse, but adolescent boys found even that amusing. They did not take her seriously.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r62","rowIndex":62,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その点、死んだ<tips=73>リュウカ</tips>は子供の扱いがうまかった。子供たちと打ち解けて心を開かせながらも、叱るときは恐ろしく、子供たちはみな彼女を尊敬し、恐れていた。そのような扱いをされるのは所長など一部のベテランと彼女くらいだった。","en":"The late <tips=73>Ryuka</tips> had excelled at handling children. She won their trust and got them to open their hearts, yet was terrifying when she scolded them. Every child respected and feared her. Only the director and a few veteran employees commanded the same response.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r63","rowIndex":63,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして<tips=73>リュウカ</tips>は若い分、ベテランたちよりも子供たちと距離が近く、姉のような雰囲気があった。距離があまりにも近すぎて職員として行き過ぎてしまうこともあり、所長から叱られることもあったが、そう言った面も含めて<tips=55>松子</tips>は彼女を見習っていた。死んだ後、その思いは一層強くなった。","en":"Because she was young, <tips=73>Ryuka</tips> had also been closer to the children than the veteran staff, with something of an elder sister about her. Sometimes she got too close and overstepped the boundaries of her role, earning reprimands from the director. Even with those faults, <tips=55>Matsuko</tips> had taken her as a model. Since Ryuka’s death, that desire had only grown stronger.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r64","rowIndex":64,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=73>リュウカ</tips>さんが生きていたら、どうしたろう？　そんな風に考えて、一人首をひねったりもする。","en":"What would <tips=73>Ms. Ryuka</tips> have done if she were alive? Matsuko sometimes tilted her head and considered the question alone.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r65","rowIndex":65,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　消灯時間を過ぎるとやっと一段落がつく。夜勤者たちは大体この時間に食事をとるのだが、それでもしばしば眠れない児童が訪ねて来て食事を中断させられることも少なくない。この日も自宅で作って来た弁当をもそもそと食べていると、トントンとドアを叩くものがあった。","en":"Once lights-out had passed, things finally settled down. The night staff generally ate at this hour, though children who could not sleep often came by and interrupted them. That night, as Matsuko listlessly worked her way through the boxed lunch she had made at home, someone knocked softly at the door.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r66","rowIndex":66,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あ、私が出ます」","en":"“I’ll get it.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐松子","displayName":"Matsuko Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r67","rowIndex":67,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　同僚のタナベにそう言ってドアを開けると、三人の女子児童が立っている。","en":"She said this to her colleague Tanabe, then opened the door to find three girls standing outside.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r68","rowIndex":68,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どうしたの？」","en":"“What is it?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐松子","displayName":"Matsuko Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r69","rowIndex":69,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=55>汐さん</tips>、テレビを見たいの」","en":"“<tips=55>Ms. Shio</tips>, we want to watch TV.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r70","rowIndex":70,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「テレビ？」","en":"“TV?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐松子","displayName":"Matsuko Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r71","rowIndex":71,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　学校で話題になっている深夜番組があるのだと言う。","en":"They said there was a late-night show everyone at school was talking about.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r72","rowIndex":72,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=55>松子</tips>がどうしてもダメだと言うと、児童たちは「<tips=55>汐さん</tips>のケチ」と捨て台詞を残して去って言った。","en":"When <tips=55>Matsuko</tips> insisted that they could not possibly watch it, the girls left with a parting shot: “You’re so mean, <tips=55>Ms. Shio</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r73","rowIndex":73,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「もっとピシっと言いなさいよ。そんなんだから舐められるのよ」","en":"“You need to be firmer. They walk all over you because you talk like that.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r74","rowIndex":74,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　席に戻ってくるとタナベはそう言って苦い顔をした。","en":"Tanabe grimaced as Matsuko returned to her seat.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r75","rowIndex":75,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうなんですけど、でも、テレビくらい好きに観させてあげたいなって気持ちもあって、なかなか言えないんですよね」","en":"“I know. But part of me thinks they should at least be allowed to watch TV when they want to, so it’s hard for me to be firm with them.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐松子","displayName":"Matsuko Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r76","rowIndex":76,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=55>松子</tips>は困り顔で溜息をつく。","en":"<tips=55>Matsuko</tips> sighed, looking troubled.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r77","rowIndex":77,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そんなこと気にしないでいいのよ。どこの家庭だって、子供の生活に口を出すわ。ルールはルールなんだから、それを崩したらだめ。どうしても見たいなら大人の目を盗んでコソコソ見たらいいのよ。そういうものよ。あなただって子供の頃、そうやってこっそり何かすることはあったでしょ？」","en":"“You don’t need to worry about that. Every family has adults telling children how to live. Rules are rules; you can’t start bending them. If they want to see it that badly, they can sneak behind the adults’ backs and watch. That’s how these things work. You must have snuck around and done something in secret when you were a child too, right?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r78","rowIndex":78,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　タナベの夕食は出勤途中にコンビニエンスストアで購入したスパゲッティナポリタンだった。電子レンジで温めたそれは、部屋中にケチャップの甘い香りを漂わせている。","en":"Tanabe’s dinner was a serving of spaghetti Napolitan purchased at a convenience store on her way to work. Heated in the microwave, it filled the room with the sweet aroma of ketchup.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r79","rowIndex":79,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ええ、まあ」","en":"“Yes, I suppose.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐松子","displayName":"Matsuko Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r80","rowIndex":80,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=55>松子</tips>は深夜番組を見たり、なにか不良行為をしたということはなかったけれども、食べるのが面倒でなんでもミキサーにかけて飲んでいたことを思い出しながらそう頷いた。","en":"<tips=55>Matsuko</tips> had never stayed up to watch late-night television or engaged in any delinquent behavior, but she nodded as she remembered how, finding food troublesome, she used to put everything through a blender and drink it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r81","rowIndex":81,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　大人になって振り返ると、自分はけして威張れるようなものではない、おかしな子供だったのである。","en":"Looking back as an adult, she realized that she, too, had been an odd child, and hardly one with anything to boast about.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r82","rowIndex":82,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なんだか、自分が出来ていなかったことで子供を怒るのは疲れますね。そうしなきゃいけないとはわかっているんですけど」","en":"“It is tiring to scold children for things I failed to do myself. I understand that I have to, though.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐松子","displayName":"Matsuko Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r83","rowIndex":83,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そう言って肩をすくめた。","en":"She shrugged as she said it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r84","rowIndex":84,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そんなの気にしないでいいのよ。私なんか、うちのチビの前ではなんでも出来る完全無欠の人間みたいに振る舞ってるんだから。そうじゃないとやっていけないわ」","en":"“You don’t need to worry about that. In front of my little ones, I act like I’m perfect and can do anything. It’s the only way to get by.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r85","rowIndex":85,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　今年三十歳になるタナベの家には五歳と二歳の子供がいる。彼女が仕事に出ている間は夫が面倒を見ていた。夫は複数の言語を操るベトナム人で、留学生としてやって来て将来を嘱望されたエリートだったらしい。それがどういうわけか<tips=9>Y地区</tips>に流れ着き、今は近所の飲食店のメニューを他の言語に変換したりといった翻訳業のような仕事をしている。ただしあまり熱心でなく、収入が心許ない。","en":"Tanabe, who would turn thirty that year, had two children, aged five and two. Her husband cared for them while she worked. He was Vietnamese and spoke several languages. Apparently, he had come to Japan as an international student and been considered an elite with a promising future. Somehow he had drifted into <tips=9>Y District</tips> and now did something like translation work, rendering the menus of nearby restaurants into other languages. He was not particularly diligent, however, and his income was unreliable.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r86","rowIndex":86,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女と夜勤に入るとその愚痴を延々と聞かされるのがいつものことであった。","en":"Whenever Matsuko worked a night shift with Tanabe, she could count on listening to her complain about him for hours on end.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r87","rowIndex":87,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しかし、夫の怠惰を批判する彼女も腰が重いタイプで、夜勤になるとパートナーに仕事を押しつけてばかりいるのであまり評判はよくない。","en":"Yet for all her criticism of her husband’s laziness, Tanabe was not exactly quick to get moving herself. On night shifts she was forever pushing the work onto her partner, so her reputation was none too good.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r88","rowIndex":88,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ただ一旦動けばテキパキと片付ける方で、子供たちへの愛情も強く、<tips=55>松子</tips>は特別苦手というわけではなかった。","en":"Once she did begin, however, she worked quickly and efficiently. She also loved the children deeply, and <tips=55>Matsuko</tips> did not especially dislike her.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r89","rowIndex":89,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　児童たちが寝入ってしまうと定時の見回りをするくらいで、あとは重要な仕事はない。","en":"Once the children were asleep, there was no important work left beyond making the rounds at the appointed times.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r90","rowIndex":90,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　人によっては日勤時に残った仕事を片付けたり、資格の勉強をしたり、携帯電話でゲームをやったり、事務所の掃除をはじめたり、時間の使い方は人それぞれだが、女性ばかりのこの職場はおしゃべりに費やされることが多かった。","en":"Some used the time to finish work left over from the day shift, study for qualifications, play games on their phones, or start cleaning the office. Everyone spent it differently, but in this all-female workplace, much of it was given over to conversation.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r91","rowIndex":91,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　タナベもそのタイプだが、今日は夫への悪口ではなく、最近職員の間でよく話題になるあるニュースについての話だった。","en":"Tanabe was one of the talkers. Today, however, her subject was not her husband but a recent news story that had become a favorite topic among the staff.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r92","rowIndex":92,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「結局建物を取り壊して、更地にしちゃうんだって」","en":"“In the end, they’re going to demolish the building and clear the entire site.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r93","rowIndex":93,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女が言っているのは、つい一週間ほど前に襲撃された、<tips=6>巻河原病院</tips>のことである。","en":"She meant National <tips=6>Makigawara Hospital</tips>, which had been attacked about a week earlier.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r94","rowIndex":94,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=55>松子</tips>は今度一緒に作ろうと子供達と約束している折り紙を、予習のために本を見て折りながらタナベの相手をしている。","en":"<tips=55>Matsuko</tips> kept Tanabe company while consulting a book and practicing the origami she had promised to make with the children next time.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r95","rowIndex":95,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それで、他の場所に同じような病院を作るらしいわよ。でも、どこに建てるのかしらね。今時どこだって、<tips=17>タイプB</tips>の専門病院なんかいやがるでしょう」","en":"“They'll apparently build another hospital like it somewhere else. But where? These days, no one wants a hospital specializing in <tips=17>Type B</tips> patients nearby.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r96","rowIndex":96,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=55>松子</tips>は意見を述べずに困ったような顔をして黙っている。","en":"<tips=55>Matsuko</tips> offered no opinion, merely falling silent with a troubled expression.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r97","rowIndex":97,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あの夜に診て下さるサングラスの先生も、あの病院に勤めていらっしゃったんでしょ？　ご無事だったのかしら」","en":"“The doctor in sunglasses who comes to see the children at night worked at that hospital too, didn’t he? I wonder if he’s all right.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r98","rowIndex":98,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　タナベはしかめっ面で言い、","en":"Tanabe frowned as she spoke.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r99","rowIndex":99,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「でも、本当にびっくりする事件が起きたものねえ。世の中おかしくなってきたと思わない？　昔みたいな大抗争が起きるなら、引っ越そうかしら……と言っても、他に行くところもないんだけど」","en":"“Still, what a shocking thing to happen. Don’t you think the world is going mad? If another huge gang war breaks out like in the old days, maybe I ought to move away... Not that I have anywhere else to go.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r100","rowIndex":100,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そう溜息をつく。","en":"She sighed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r101","rowIndex":101,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　病院を襲撃したのは<tips=47>八龍解放軍</tips>という、<tips=21>八龍会</tips>が作った新しい組織であることはもう公然の秘密として街の住民の間では知られていた。","en":"The city’s residents already treated it as an open secret that the hospital had been attacked by the <tips=47>Hachiryu Liberation Army</tips>, a new organization created by the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r102","rowIndex":102,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そう言えば、あの、よくうちに来てた饅頭屋さんがあの<tips=47>解放軍</tips>だかのリーダーになったんでしょ？　そんな乱暴な人には見えなかったのにねえ。というか、<tips=17>タイプB</tips>だって知らなかったわ」","en":"“Come to think of it, that bun vendor who used to visit us all the time became the leader of the <tips=47>Liberation Army</tips> or whatever it is, didn’t he? He never looked so violent. I didn’t even know he was a <tips=17>Type B</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r103","rowIndex":103,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女の言葉に、<tips=55>松子</tips>はぎくりとして折り紙を折る手が止まる。","en":"At her words, <tips=55>Matsuko</tips> flinched and stopped folding.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r104","rowIndex":104,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　女性の職場は噂の伝わりが早い。自分がその饅頭屋と知り合いであるということはハシモトなどは知っていることだし、自分がいない間に職員室で話題になっているのではないかと思っている。","en":"Rumors traveled quickly in a workplace full of women. Hashimoto and others knew that Matsuko was acquainted with the bun vendor. She suspected they might have discussed it in the staff room while she was absent.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r105","rowIndex":105,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうなんですか。驚きですねえ」","en":"“Really? That’s surprising.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐松子","displayName":"Matsuko Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r106","rowIndex":106,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　いつそのことを訊かれるのか。","en":"When would they ask her about it?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r107","rowIndex":107,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　訊かれたら誤魔化すのも気が重いなあと、内心おだやかではなかったが、タナベの態度を見る限り彼女はそのことを知らないようだった。","en":"The thought of evading the question weighed upon her, and inwardly she was far from calm. From Tanabe's manner, however, it appeared that she did not know.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r108","rowIndex":108,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まったく怖いわねえ。あの人たちって、入院してた<tips=17>タイプB</tips>の人たちを解放するっていって襲ったんでしょ？　<tips=17>タイプＢ</tips>のアルバイトに何かしたとかで、レストランを壊したりもしたって聞いたわよ。だとしたら、うちも<tips=17>タイプB</tips>の子供を自由にしろって襲われたりしない？」","en":"“It’s terrifying. Those people attacked the hospital saying they were going to free the <tips=17>Type Bs</tips> being treated there, didn’t they? I also heard they wrecked a restaurant over something that happened to a <tips=17>Type B</tips> employee. If that’s true, what if they attack us and demand that we set the <tips=17>Type B</tips> children free?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r109","rowIndex":109,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「さあ、どうでしょうか……」","en":"“I’m not sure...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐松子","displayName":"Matsuko Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r110","rowIndex":110,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そう考えると、もうちょっと門限を緩めてあげたりしないとダメかしら？」","en":"“Should we loosen the curfew a little, then?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r111","rowIndex":111,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　タナベは真顔で首をかしげる。","en":"Tanabe tilted her head with a perfectly serious expression.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r112","rowIndex":112,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それはあんまり関係ないような気がしますが」","en":"“I don’t think that has much to do with it.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐松子","displayName":"Matsuko Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r113","rowIndex":113,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうお？　でも、怖いわねえ」","en":"“You don’t? Still, it’s frightening.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r114","rowIndex":114,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　夜が更け、そろそろ職員の一人が仮眠に入る時間が近づいていた。","en":"The night wore on, and it was nearly time for one of the two workers to take her nap break.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r115","rowIndex":115,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　どちらが先に眠りにつくか相談しはじめたところで、ピンポンとインターフォンが音を立てた。","en":"Just as they began discussing who would sleep first, the intercom chimed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r116","rowIndex":116,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　施設の正面玄関に取り付けられたインターフォンは、普段は管理棟の事務室に繋がっているが夜はこちらの一階職員室でもとれるようになっている。","en":"The intercom at the facility’s main entrance ordinarily connected to the administration office, but at night the staff room on the first floor could answer it as well.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r117","rowIndex":117,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　こんな夜中にはほとんど鳴ることがないが、たまに鳴った時には義父母に引き取られたはずの子供が虐待されて戻ってきたり、のっぴきならない用事であるため、音が鳴ると共に二人は緊張して顔を見合わせる。","en":"It almost never rang so late. On the rare occasions it did, however, the reason might be that a child placed with foster parents had suffered abuse and returned, or some other emergency. The moment it sounded, the two women tensed and exchanged glances.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r118","rowIndex":118,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　すぐに<tips=55>松子</tips>がガタリと音を立てて椅子を立ち上がると、パネルの前に立った。","en":"<tips=55>Matsuko</tips> immediately rose from her chair with a clatter and stood before the panel.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r119","rowIndex":119,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　モニターには、白黒のカメラ映像が映し出されており、心細げな表情をする黒いロングコートを着た白人女性がそこにいるのが確認された。","en":"The monochrome camera image on the monitor showed a white woman in a long black coat, wearing a forlorn expression.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r120","rowIndex":120,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=55>松子</tips>は通話ボタンを押す。","en":"<tips=55>Matsuko</tips> pressed the talk button.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r121","rowIndex":121,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「はい、もしもし」","en":"“Hello?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐松子","displayName":"Matsuko Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r122","rowIndex":122,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　声をかけると、イギリス訛りの英語で返事がきた。この街では英語を母語にする住人も多いが、このアクセントはそう多くない。","en":"When she addressed the visitor, the reply came in English with a British accent. Many residents of this city spoke English as their native language, but this accent was not so common.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r123","rowIndex":123,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"『あの、すみません……。なかに入れて欲しいんです』","en":"“Um, excuse me... I’d like to come inside.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r124","rowIndex":124,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その顔には彼女のこれまでの人生における苦悩を物語るように細かい皺がいくつも刻み込まれ、頬がこけ落ちている。見ようによってはまるで老婆のようにも見える。","en":"Her face was etched with fine lines that seemed to speak of a lifetime's hardships, and her cheeks were hollow. From some angles, she appeared almost elderly.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r125","rowIndex":125,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=55>松子</tips>の目には四十歳くらいに見えたが、もしかしたらもう少し若いかもしれない。","en":"To <tips=55>Matsuko</tips> she looked about forty, though she might have been somewhat younger.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r126","rowIndex":126,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"『ここに私の子供がいると聞きまして、どうしても会いたくて……』","en":"“I was told my child was here, and I simply had to see them...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r127","rowIndex":127,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「すみません。この時間にお通しすることは出来ないんです。明日になってから改めていらしてはいただけませんか？」","en":"“I’m sorry. We cannot admit you at this hour. Would you please come again tomorrow?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐松子","displayName":"Matsuko Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r128","rowIndex":128,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=55>松子</tips>は相手の表情をよく観察しながら英語で言う。","en":"<tips=55>Matsuko</tips> spoke in English, carefully observing the woman’s expression.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r129","rowIndex":129,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　こんな夜中に、そのような用件で訪れるのはいかにも不審だ。薬物中毒のせいで存在しない自分の子を探し求めて施設を訪れた女が過去にいたと、先輩職員から聞いたことがあった。","en":"There was something deeply suspicious about appearing in the middle of the night with such a request. A senior colleague had once told her about a woman whose drug addiction led her to come to the facility in search of a child who did not exist.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r130","rowIndex":130,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それは<tips=59>暗闇通り</tips>の娼婦で、いないと言っても聞き入れず、事務所で暴れて大変な目に遭ったそうだ。","en":"The woman had been a prostitute from <tips=59>Darkness Street</tips>. She would not listen when they told her there was no such child, ran wild through the office, and put the staff through a terrible ordeal.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r131","rowIndex":131,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"『非常識なのはわかっています。でも、どうしても、どうしても今夜でなければならないんです。どうか、特別に開けていただけませんか？　一目見て、少し会話をするだけでいいんです。そうしたら私は満足して帰りますから』","en":"“I know how unreasonable this is. But it has to be tonight—it absolutely has to. Please, couldn’t you make an exception and open the door? Just one look at my child, just a few words, would be enough. Then I promise I’ll be satisfied and leave.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r132","rowIndex":132,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　目は金色ではない。口調はしっかりしている。正気のように見えるが、しかし、話している内容がどうにも信用しきれない。","en":"Her eyes were not golden. Her speech was coherent. She appeared sane, yet Matsuko could not quite believe what she was saying.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r133","rowIndex":133,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「子供たちはもう眠っています。こんな時間に起こして、会って頂くわけにはいかないんですよ」","en":"“The children are already asleep. We can’t wake one of them at this hour just so you can see them.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐松子","displayName":"Matsuko Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r134","rowIndex":134,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"『それなら、職員のかたで構いません。どうか、中に入れて、お話だけでも聞いて下さい』","en":"“Then one of the staff, please. Just let me in and hear what I have to say.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r135","rowIndex":135,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「申し訳ありません。それは出来ないんです」","en":"“I’m sorry. We cannot do that.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐松子","displayName":"Matsuko Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r136","rowIndex":136,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"『どうか、どうかお慈悲を……』","en":"“Please. Please, have mercy...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r137","rowIndex":137,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして女はすすり泣きをはじめる。","en":"Then the woman began to sob.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r138","rowIndex":138,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=55>松子</tips>は戸惑って顔を曇らせる。","en":"<tips=55>Matsuko’s</tips> face clouded with uncertainty.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r139","rowIndex":139,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なんだって？」","en":"“What did she say?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r140","rowIndex":140,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　振り返ると、タナベが眉間にしわを浮かべてこちらを見ていた。","en":"Matsuko looked back. Tanabe was watching her with a deep furrow between her brows.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r141","rowIndex":141,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　夫は語学に堪能だが彼女自身は日本語以外は理解が出来ない。","en":"Her husband was fluent in several languages, but Tanabe herself understood only Japanese.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r142","rowIndex":142,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ここにお子さんがいるからどうしても会いたいと。こんな時間だからとお断りしたんですが、そうしたら、中で話だけでも聞いてくれないかとおっしゃって……」","en":"“She says her child is here and she has to see them. I told her we couldn't admit her at this hour, and then she asked whether we could at least hear her story inside...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐松子","displayName":"Matsuko Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r143","rowIndex":143,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「えーっ」","en":"“What?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r144","rowIndex":144,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　タナベは思い切り顔を顰めると、","en":"Tanabe grimaced openly.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r145","rowIndex":145,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「非常識よ。ほっときなさい」","en":"“That’s outrageous. Just ignore her.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r146","rowIndex":146,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「はあ」","en":"“Right...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐松子","displayName":"Matsuko Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r147","rowIndex":147,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「こんな時間にそんな対応は出来ないわ。それに、どうも怪しいじゃない。薬か病気の可能性もあるわ。存在しない子供を作り出してしまう妄想というのはよくあるし」","en":"“We can't deal with something like that at this hour. Besides, doesn't she sound suspicious? There could be drugs or illness involved. Delusions about children who don't exist are common.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r148","rowIndex":148,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「意識ははっきりしてる感じなんですよ。それに、何か特別な事情があるかもしれませんし……」","en":"“She seems perfectly lucid. And there may be some special circumstance we don’t know about...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐松子","displayName":"Matsuko Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r149","rowIndex":149,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まあ、<tips=55>汐さん</tips>は、ここのルールを破りたくなるくらい、その人のことを信じちゃったの？」","en":"“Goodness, <tips=55>Ms. Shio</tips>, did you believe this woman so completely that you'd be willing to break the rules here for her?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r150","rowIndex":150,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いや、そうじゃありませんけれど、もし万が一本当にここにお子さんがいて、今しかチャンスがなくて二度と会えないとなったら、取り返しのつかないことになってしまうのかなって……」","en":"“No, that isn’t what I mean. But if, by some chance, her child really is here, and tonight is her only chance because they’ll never be able to see each other again, I was wondering whether we might be making a mistake we can never undo...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐松子","displayName":"Matsuko Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r151","rowIndex":151,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ただ困惑したまま態度をはっきりしない<tips=55>松子</tips>に対してタナベは首を左右に振り、","en":"<tips=55>Matsuko</tips> remained confused and would not commit herself. Tanabe shook her head.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r152","rowIndex":152,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どんな事情があったって関係ないの。それに、本当に今しか会えないのなら会わない方が良いわ。そんな言い方をしているなら、引き取ってくれるってわけでもないでしょうし、お互いつらいだけでしょう」","en":"“It doesn’t matter what her reasons are. And if this really is their only chance to meet, they’re better off not doing it. From the way she talks, she isn’t offering to take the child in. A meeting would only be painful for both of them.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r153","rowIndex":153,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうかもしれません」","en":"“Perhaps you’re right.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐松子","displayName":"Matsuko Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r154","rowIndex":154,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「大体、誰のお母さんだって言ってるの？」","en":"“Who does she even claim is her child?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r155","rowIndex":155,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「聞きましょうか？」","en":"“Shall I ask?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐松子","displayName":"Matsuko Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r156","rowIndex":156,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いや、いいわ聞かないで。もう一回、帰るよう言って頂戴」","en":"“No, don’t. Tell her again that she has to leave.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r157","rowIndex":157,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「はい、わかりました」","en":"“All right.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐松子","displayName":"Matsuko Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r158","rowIndex":158,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=55>松子</tips>は浮かない顔でまたパネルに向かう。","en":"With a dispirited expression, <tips=55>Matsuko</tips> turned back to the panel.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r159","rowIndex":159,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　タナベの言っていることは理解出来るし、間違っているとは思わない。いや、むしろ正しいだろう。マニュアルに従って帰って貰うのが正解なのはわかっている。","en":"She understood Tanabe's reasoning and did not believe it mistaken. No—Tanabe was probably right. Matsuko knew that following the manual and sending the woman home was the correct response.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r160","rowIndex":160,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しかし、自分だったらどうだろう？　もし実の親が訪れて、一度だけ会って会話が出来るとなったら、やはり会いたいのではないだろうか？","en":"But what if it were her? If one of her birth parents came and she had a single chance to meet and speak with them, wouldn’t she want to take it?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r161","rowIndex":161,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=55>松子</tips>は割り切れない思いを感じながら通話ボタンを押した。","en":"Her feelings still unresolved, <tips=55>Matsuko</tips> pressed the talk button.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r162","rowIndex":162,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　女はまだそこにいた。<tips=55>松子</tips>はどうしても今日会うことは不可能であるともう一度説明し、帰って出直すよう伝える。","en":"The woman was still there. <tips=55>Matsuko</tips> explained once more that a meeting today was impossible and told her to leave and return another time.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r163","rowIndex":163,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　すると女は取り乱し、","en":"At that, the woman became distraught and—","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r164","rowIndex":164,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"『出直すことなんか出来ないんです！　それならば、ここで待てる限り待たせて頂きます。私には、今しかないんですから。だから、気が変わったら、どうか……』","en":"“I can’t come back another time! Then please let me wait here as long as I can. This is my only chance. So if you change your mind, please...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r165","rowIndex":165,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　カメラに顔を近づけ、画面一杯にその涙で濡れた顔を映しながら泣き声で言った。","en":"She brought her face close to the camera, filling the screen with her tear-soaked features as she pleaded through sobs.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r166","rowIndex":166,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それは出来ないんです。……失礼します」","en":"“We can’t allow that. ...I’m sorry.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐松子","displayName":"Matsuko Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r167","rowIndex":167,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=55>松子</tips>は悲痛な面持ちで通話を切り、席に戻る。","en":"With a grief-stricken expression, <tips=55>Matsuko</tips> ended the call and returned to her seat.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r168","rowIndex":168,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして無言で折り紙をはじめるが、どうも集中出来ず、本を見ているのに間違えてしまう。","en":"She resumed the origami in silence, but could not concentrate. Even with the book before her, she made mistakes.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r169","rowIndex":169,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　タナベが先に仮眠を取ると、一人になった<tips=55>松子</tips>はあれこれと考えてしまう。","en":"Once Tanabe went to take the first nap break, <tips=55>Matsuko</tips> was left alone with her thoughts.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r170","rowIndex":170,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　気を紛らわすために、何かすることはないかと探して、所長から勧められた資格を取るための参考書などを本棚から取り出して目を通すが、一向に頭に内容が入って来ない。","en":"To distract herself, she searched for something to do and took from the shelf a study guide for one of the qualifications the director had recommended. She read through it, but could not absorb a word.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r171","rowIndex":171,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そしてついインターフォンのパネルの前に立ち、カメラの映像を表示させてしまう。","en":"Before she knew it, she was standing in front of the intercom panel and turning on the camera feed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r172","rowIndex":172,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　すると、むこうの塀に寄りかかるようにしてさっきの女が蹲っているのが見える。本当に待っているのだ。","en":"There she saw the woman from earlier, huddled against the wall across the way. She really was waiting.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r173","rowIndex":173,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=55>松子</tips>は胸が苦しくなって画面を消す。","en":"Her chest tightening, <tips=55>Matsuko</tips> switched off the screen.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r174","rowIndex":174,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　これが母の愛というものなのだろうか？","en":"Was this a mother’s love?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r175","rowIndex":175,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=55>松子</tips>には親子の愛情というものがわからない。<tips=54>汐健慈朗</tips>に対して尊敬も愛着もあるが彼は本当の親ではないし、彼女自身もそのことをよく知っている。この感情が、普通の親子と同じものなのかどうか自信がない。","en":"<tips=55>Matsuko</tips> did not understand the love between a parent and child. She respected <tips=54>Kenjiro Shio</tips> and felt affection for him, but he was not her real parent, and she knew that perfectly well. She could not be sure whether her feelings were the same as those between an ordinary parent and child.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r176","rowIndex":176,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=9>Y地区</tips>の子供たちは歪な家庭が多く、親子の感情関係というものは千差万別だった。それでも親と子の繋がりは特別なものがあると言う。<tips=1>亮</tips>が母親の面倒を見て、そして街が嫌いだと出て行って大学まで通っていたのにわざわざ帰って来て<tips=81>龍頭</tips>になったのも親子の繋がりだろう。","en":"Many children in <tips=9>Y District</tips> came from fractured families, and feelings and relationships between parents and children took countless forms. Even so, people said there was something special in the bond between parent and child. <tips=1>Ryo</tips> had cared for his mother; though he hated the city, left it, and even attended university elsewhere, he had deliberately returned to become <tips=81>Longtou</tips>. That too must have come from the bond between parent and child.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r177","rowIndex":177,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=55>松子</tips>にはうまく理解出来なかった。この仕事を行うようになってさらに多くの子供と親の関係を見るようになり、なおさらよくわからなくなった。","en":"<tips=55>Matsuko</tips> could not make sense of it. Since starting this job, she had seen more relationships between children and parents than ever, and understood them less and less.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r178","rowIndex":178,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ただその繋がりは、感情は、人間にとってとても重要で美しいものだと言う。その美しさを知らない自分は何かが欠けているに違いない。","en":"All she knew was that people called the bond, and the feelings within it, profoundly important and beautiful. Something had to be missing from her if she did not know that beauty.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r179","rowIndex":179,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そう感じるからこそ、他人の親子の繋がりを、少しでもとりもってやりたいという思いがある。","en":"Precisely because she felt that way, she wanted to help bring other parents and children together whenever she could.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r180","rowIndex":180,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　このまま帰らせてしまって、本当にいいのだろうか？","en":"Was it truly right to send the woman home like this?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r181","rowIndex":181,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　一時間ほど過ぎて、タナベが不機嫌な顔で仮眠室から出て来た。","en":"About an hour later, Tanabe emerged from the nap room looking disgruntled.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r182","rowIndex":182,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「さっきの人、どう？　帰った？」","en":"“What about that woman from earlier? Did she leave?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r183","rowIndex":183,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=55>松子</tips>と目が合うとぶっきらぼうにそう訊ねる。","en":"Meeting <tips=55>Matsuko’s</tips> eyes, she asked the question brusquely.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r184","rowIndex":184,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いえ、まだ門の前に……」","en":"“No. She’s still outside the gate...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐松子","displayName":"Matsuko Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r185","rowIndex":185,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そう」","en":"“I see.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r186","rowIndex":186,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　タナベは言って、目をゴシゴシと擦る。","en":"Tanabe rubbed her eyes vigorously.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r187","rowIndex":187,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女も外で待つあの女のことが気になっていて、眠れなかったのかもしれないと<tips=55>松子</tips>は思った。","en":"<tips=55>Matsuko</tips> wondered whether Tanabe, too, had been unable to sleep for worrying about the woman outside.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r188","rowIndex":188,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あの、タナベさん。話だけでも聞いたら駄目ですか？　私が応接室で対応しますから、タナベさんはその間ここにいてください。今日私は仮眠はいらないので……」","en":"“Um, Ms. Tanabe... Couldn’t we at least hear her out? I’ll speak with her in the reception room, and you can stay here in the meantime. I won’t need a nap break tonight...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐松子","displayName":"Matsuko Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r189","rowIndex":189,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そう言うと思ったわ」","en":"“I knew you would say that.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r190","rowIndex":190,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　タナベは肩をすくめると、","en":"Tanabe shrugged.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r191","rowIndex":191,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「わかった。そうしましょう」","en":"“All right. Let’s do that.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r192","rowIndex":192,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ありがとうございます！」","en":"“Thank you!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐松子","displayName":"Matsuko Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r193","rowIndex":193,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ただし、私も一緒に行くわ。上の階の人に連絡だけしておけば、ここは少しくらいあけても大丈夫よ」","en":"“But I’m coming with you. As long as we notify the people upstairs, we can leave this room empty for a little while.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r194","rowIndex":194,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　タナベはそう言ってから、あくびをかみ殺した。","en":"After saying this, Tanabe stifled a yawn.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r195","rowIndex":195,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=55>松子</tips>が門を内側から開けると、女はすぐに気がついて立ち上がる。","en":"When <tips=55>Matsuko</tips> opened the gate from inside, the woman noticed at once and stood.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r196","rowIndex":196,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「入ってください。お話だけ伺います」","en":"“Please come in. We’ll hear what you have to say, but that’s all.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r197","rowIndex":197,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=55>松子</tips>の言葉に女は小走りで駆け寄ってくると、","en":"At <tips=55>Matsuko's</tips> words, the woman hurried over to her and—","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r198","rowIndex":198,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ありがとうございます。ありがとうございます」","en":"“Thank you. Thank you so much.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r199","rowIndex":199,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　震える両手で<tips=55>松子</tips>の手を取って泣いた。","en":"She took <tips=55>Matsuko’s</tips> hand between her trembling hands and wept.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r200","rowIndex":200,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　管理棟の応接室に通し、お茶を出す。","en":"They showed her into the reception room of the administration building and served tea.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r201","rowIndex":201,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「すみません。無理を言ってしまって。本当に今日しかないもので」","en":"“I’m sorry for making such an unreasonable request. But it really had to be today.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r202","rowIndex":202,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　女は恐縮して、日本人の風習にあわせるように頭を下げて礼をする。","en":"Abashed, the woman bowed in thanks, following Japanese custom.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r203","rowIndex":203,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　もう泣いてはおらず、朗らかな笑みが顔に浮かんでいた。","en":"She had stopped crying, and a cheerful smile now lit her face.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r204","rowIndex":204,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「子供とはもう何年も会っていないんです。でも、お陰でこうして会うことが出来ました。あなたが今日ここにいてくれたからです。別の日だったらあなたもいなかったし、私は子供に会うことが出来ませんでした」","en":"“I haven’t seen my child in years. But thanks to you, I finally have. It’s because you happened to be here today. If I’d come on any other day, you wouldn’t have been here, and I could never have seen my child.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r205","rowIndex":205,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　女の口調は自然と明るく、早口になっていた。","en":"The woman’s voice brightened, and her words came faster.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r206","rowIndex":206,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いえ、そんな」","en":"“No, I...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐松子","displayName":"Matsuko Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r207","rowIndex":207,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「子供の名前を聞いた？」","en":"“Did you ask the child’s name?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r208","rowIndex":208,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　恐縮する<tips=55>松子</tips>の横で、二人の英語による会話が聞き取れないタナベが囁く。","en":"Unable to follow their conversation in English, Tanabe whispered to the abashed <tips=55>Matsuko</tips> beside her.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r209","rowIndex":209,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=55>松子</tips>は頷き、","en":"<tips=55>Matsuko</tips> nodded.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r210","rowIndex":210,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あの、それでお子さんの名前を教えて頂けませんか？」","en":"“Um, then... Would you please tell us your child’s name?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐松子","displayName":"Matsuko Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r211","rowIndex":211,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ああ、そうですね！　まだその名前を言っていませんでしたね。私のその生き別れになった娘の名前を。いくらあなたといえども、言わなきゃわからないですものね」","en":"“Oh, of course! I still haven’t told you her name, have I? The name of the daughter I was separated from. Even you couldn’t know without my telling you.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r212","rowIndex":212,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　女は上機嫌だ。いくらなんでも上機嫌過ぎるようにも見える。ほとんどはしゃいでいると言ってもいい。","en":"The woman was in high spirits—far too high, perhaps. One could almost call her giddy.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r213","rowIndex":213,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　こんなに嬉しいものなのだろうかと、<tips=55>松子</tips>は違和感を覚えた。","en":"Could a person truly be this delighted? <tips=55>Matsuko</tips> felt a flicker of unease.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r214","rowIndex":214,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ええ、名前を言っていただかないと、お連れ出来ませんし、会うことも出来ません」","en":"“Yes. Unless you tell us her name, we cannot bring her here or let you meet her.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐松子","displayName":"Matsuko Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r215","rowIndex":215,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あはは」","en":"“Ahaha.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r216","rowIndex":216,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　女は唇の両端をつり上げて笑うと、まっすぐ<tips=55>松子</tips>の目を見つめながら言う。","en":"The woman raised both corners of her mouth in a smile and stared directly into <tips=55>Matsuko’s</tips> eyes.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r217","rowIndex":217,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「もうどこへも連れて行かなくて結構。だって、もう子供と出会えたんだから」","en":"“There's no need to take me anywhere else. I've already met my child, after all.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r218","rowIndex":218,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「えっ」","en":"“What?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐松子","displayName":"Matsuko Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r219","rowIndex":219,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「私の子供は、お前だよ」","en":"“You are my child.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r220","rowIndex":220,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　驚く<tips=55>松子</tips>の前で、女はさっと手をあげる。","en":"As <tips=55>Matsuko</tips> stared in shock, the woman quickly raised a hand.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r221","rowIndex":221,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　常に<tips=17>タイプＢ</tips>の覚醒状態である<tips=55>松子</tips>の反射神経は常人より鋭かったが、それでも気づいたときには、女の手のなかの黒光りする拳銃が顔面に突きつけられている。","en":"Because <tips=55>Matsuko</tips> was permanently in an awakened <tips=17>Type B</tips> state, her reflexes were sharper than an ordinary person’s. Even so, by the time she realized what was happening, the gleaming black handgun in the woman’s hand was pressed to her face.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r222","rowIndex":222,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ひっ」","en":"“Eek.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r223","rowIndex":223,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　タナベは小さく悲鳴を上げて凍り付き、<tips=55>松子</tips>は無言で目を細める。","en":"Tanabe gave a tiny scream and froze. <tips=55>Matsuko</tips> narrowed her eyes without a word.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r224","rowIndex":224,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「今はシオマツコと名乗っているんですって？　おかしな名前。ちっとも似合っていないわ」","en":"“I hear you're calling yourself Matsuko Shio now? What an odd name. It doesn't suit you at all.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r225","rowIndex":225,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そう言ったかと思うと、女の顔が蠢きはじめる。","en":"No sooner had the woman spoken than her face began to writhe.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r226","rowIndex":226,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それはまるでクレイアニメーションのようにぐにゃぐにゃと形を変え、やがて全く別人の姿をそこに作り出す。","en":"It warped and changed shape like a figure in clay animation, until an entirely different person had been molded in her place.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r227","rowIndex":227,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あなたは……」","en":"“You’re...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r228","rowIndex":228,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「久しぶりだね。元気そうだ」","en":"“Long time no see. You look well.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r229","rowIndex":229,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そう笑ったのは以前彼女の前で<tips=64>アレクセイ</tips>と名乗った青年――黒髪の殺人鬼<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>であった。","en":"The young man smiling at her was the black-haired killer <tips=20>Koschei</tips>, who had called himself <tips=64>Alexei</tips> when they met before.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r230","rowIndex":230,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"（やってしまった）","en":"(I’ve made a terrible mistake.)","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r231","rowIndex":231,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　自分が引き入れた相手がとんでもないモンスターであったことに気がついた<tips=55>松子</tips>は下唇を噛む。","en":"Realizing that the person she had let inside was a terrible monster, <tips=55>Matsuko</tips> bit her lower lip.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r232","rowIndex":232,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その隣ではタナベが目の前で起きたことが信じられず、まるで彫像のようにそこに固まって身動きひとつしない。","en":"Beside her, Tanabe could not believe what had happened before her eyes. She stood as motionless as a statue.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r233","rowIndex":233,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「感動の場面を邪魔して申し訳ない。だが、こちらも大事な要件なんだ。もっと早く会いたかったんだが、とにかく忙しくてその暇がなくてね。……しかし、このあたりは警報器が多いねえ。おかげで能力が使えなくて、入れて貰うのにこんな面倒な手を使わなくちゃいけなかった。まあ警報器なんか無視してもいいんだが、そうなるともっと乱暴な手段で、手早く済まさなくちゃいけない。それじゃあ、ゆっくり母娘の時間を作ることも出来ないだろう？　だから、門を開けてくれたのは賢明な判断だよ。きみは安心したまえ。何も間違った行動はしていないんだ」","en":"“Sorry to interrupt this touching scene. But I have important business of my own. I wanted to meet you sooner, but I've been so busy I simply had no time. ...There certainly are a lot of alarms around here. They've kept me from using my ability, so I had to resort to this tiresome charade to get you to let me in. I could have simply ignored the alarms, of course, but then I would have had to use more violent means and get things over with quickly. That wouldn't leave us time for a leisurely mother-daughter reunion, would it? So opening the gate was a wise decision. You may rest easy. You did nothing wrong.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r234","rowIndex":234,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=64>アレクセイ</tips>は紅い唇の隙間から白い歯を見せながらそう言葉を吐き出した。","en":"<tips=64>Alexei</tips> spat out the words, baring white teeth between his red lips.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r235","rowIndex":235,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼がわざわざここに来て何やら意味深な言葉を投げかけている。<tips=55>松子</tips>を娘だと言い、名前も知っていた。","en":"He had gone to the trouble of coming here and was making cryptic insinuations. He had called <tips=55>Matsuko</tips> his daughter and known her name.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r236","rowIndex":236,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　この<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>という人物は、<tips=55>松子</tips>の隠された秘密と関係する存在なのは間違いない。","en":"There could be no doubt that this <tips=20>Koschei</tips> was connected to the secret hidden in <tips=55>Matsuko's</tips> past.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r237","rowIndex":237,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　だが、<tips=55>松子</tips>の頭をその時支配していたのはそのことではなく、隣のタナベを、そしてこの施設の人たちをどうやって守るかということだった。","en":"Yet what occupied <tips=55>Matsuko's</tips> mind at that moment was not that secret, but how to protect Tanabe beside her and everyone else in the facility.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r238","rowIndex":238,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　目の前にいるのが非常に危険な人物であることは自分の体験だけでなく、路地などからも聞いて知っている。","en":"Her own experience, as well as what she had heard from Roji and others, told her that the man before her was extremely dangerous.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r239","rowIndex":239,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　主に自分の好みの女性をさらって残虐に殺す快楽型の連続殺人犯ではあるが、必要とあれば<tips=50>路地</tips>の恋人や<tips=48>堂島</tips>刑事にそうしたように、快楽目的以外での殺人もいとわない。ここで誰かを殺させるわけにはいかない。","en":"He was a pleasure-driven serial killer who mainly abducted women he found attractive and murdered them brutally, but when necessary he was equally willing to kill for reasons other than pleasure, as he had done to <tips=50>Roji's</tips> lover and Detective <tips=48>Dojima</tips>. She could not let him kill anyone here.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r240","rowIndex":240,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ここに何をしに来たんですか？」","en":"“Why have you come here?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r241","rowIndex":241,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=55>松子</tips>は背筋に緊張を感じながら、相手の目をじっと見つめた。","en":"Her back rigid with tension, <tips=55>Matsuko</tips> stared steadily into his eyes.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r242","rowIndex":242,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「きみに会いに来たのさ。……しかし、大きくなったものだ。それにとても美人だ。目がくりくりしているのは少しロジャーに似ているな」","en":"“To see you. ...How you’ve grown. You are very beautiful too. Those large, round eyes look a little like Roger’s.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r243","rowIndex":243,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「し、知り合いなの？」","en":"“D-do you know him?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r244","rowIndex":244,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　タナベは緊張で裏返った声で<tips=55>松子</tips>にそう訊ねる。","en":"Tanabe asked <tips=55>Matsuko</tips>, her voice pitched high with tension.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r245","rowIndex":245,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　先ほどから<tips=64>アレクセイ</tips>は日本語で話しており、彼女にも理解することが出来ていた。","en":"<tips=64>Alexei</tips> had been speaking Japanese for some time now, so Tanabe could understand him as well.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r246","rowIndex":246,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……知り合いというか……」","en":"“...I wouldn’t exactly say we know each other...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r247","rowIndex":247,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=55>松子</tips>は言葉を濁したが、","en":"<tips=55>Matsuko</tips> gave an evasive answer, but—","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r248","rowIndex":248,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「はじめまして。おれは<tips=64>アレクセイ</tips>。そこの彼女とはとても親密な仲なんだ。この間も、<tips=73>リュウカ</tips>って子の家で仲良くお喋りしてね」","en":"“Nice to meet you. I’m <tips=64>Alexei</tips>. She and I are very close. Just the other day, we had a nice little chat at the home of a girl named <tips=73>Ryuka</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r249","rowIndex":249,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=64>アレクセイ</tips>は陽気に語りかける。","en":"<tips=64>Alexei</tips> addressed them cheerfully.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r250","rowIndex":250,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「リュ、<tips=73>リュウカ</tips>ちゃん？」","en":"“R-<tips=73>Ryuka</tips>?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r251","rowIndex":251,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そう。知ってる？　とっても良い子だった。内臓まで綺麗だったよ。心が綺麗だと、内臓も綺麗なのかな？　どう思う？」","en":"“Yes. Did you know her? She was such a good girl. Even her organs were beautiful. I wonder, if your heart is pure, are your organs beautiful too? What do you think?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r252","rowIndex":252,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ひええっ」","en":"“Eee!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r253","rowIndex":253,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　タナベは完全に動揺してしまっている。この状態では走って逃げろと指示したとしても腰が抜けて立てないかもしれない。","en":"Tanabe was completely distraught. In this condition, even if Matsuko ordered her to run, her legs might fail beneath her.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r254","rowIndex":254,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　どうやって彼女に冷静さを取り戻そう。","en":"How could she help Tanabe regain her composure?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r255","rowIndex":255,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=55>松子</tips>は横目でちらりとこの先輩職員を眺めながら考えた。","en":"<tips=55>Matsuko</tips> considered the problem as she stole a glance at her senior colleague.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r256","rowIndex":256,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　絶対に家に帰さなくてはならない。そこには二人の子供と、愛する夫が待っているんだ。","en":"She had to get Tanabe home, no matter what. Her two children and beloved husband were waiting for her there.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r257","rowIndex":257,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「私に用があるのなら、二人きりで話をしませんか？　大事な用件なら、他の人がいない場所の方がいいでしょう」","en":"“If you have business with me, why don’t we speak alone? If it is important, somewhere more private would be better.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r258","rowIndex":258,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「必要ないよ。大丈夫。彼女が聞いてくれたってかまわない」","en":"“There is no need. It’s all right. I don’t mind if she hears us.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r259","rowIndex":259,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼が手を振って否定するのを見て、<tips=55>松子</tips>は苦い顔をする。","en":"Alexei dismissed the suggestion with a wave of his hand, and <tips=55>Matsuko’s</tips> expression soured.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r260","rowIndex":260,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　タナベに何を聞かれてもかまわない、というこの男の態度は、<tips=55>松子</tips>にとっては不吉なものでしかない。——つまり、タナベを生かすつもりはないのだ。","en":"To <tips=55>Matsuko</tips>, his indifference to what Tanabe overheard could mean only one ominous thing: he had no intention of letting her live.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r261","rowIndex":261,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あのマンションできみのちからを見た時は驚いた。はじめはクラブの女の生き残りか何かかと思ったよ。でも少し調べたらすぐにわかった。……きみはいま<tips=54>汐健慈朗</tips>の娘として生活しているそうだね」","en":"“I was surprised when I saw your power in that apartment. At first I thought you might be one of the women who survived the club. But once I looked into it, I figured out the truth right away. ...I hear you’re living as <tips=54>Kenjiro Shio’s</tips> daughter now.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r262","rowIndex":262,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=64>アレクセイ</tips>は銃をこちらに向けたまま、もう片方の手でカップをつかみお茶を一口飲む。","en":"Keeping the gun trained upon Matsuko, <tips=64>Alexei</tips> used his other hand to take the cup and sip the tea.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r263","rowIndex":263,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いいね。グリーンティーは好きなんだ……」","en":"“Nice. I like green tea...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r264","rowIndex":264,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　独り言のようにそう呟いてから、","en":"After murmuring this as though to himself, he continued.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r265","rowIndex":265,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それを知ったときピンと来たよ。……きみは知っているか？　彼は昔<tips=18>ローズ・クラブ</tips>のゴミ処理をしていたんだ。きっと、ゴミからきみを拾って育て上げたに違いない。大体、彼には妻も恋人もいないし、預かるような親戚の子だっていないんだ。昔ね、彼と契約を結ぶ際によく調べたから知っている。あの時は、本当に何も持たない人間だったのさ。だからへんな正義感にとらわれることもないだろうと信用して仕事を任せたのに、まさかこんなことになるとはね」","en":"“When I learned that, it all clicked. ...Did you know? He once handled the garbage disposal for <tips=18>Rose Club</tips>. He must have found you among the rubbish and raised you. After all, he had neither wife nor lover, nor any relative’s child he might have taken in. I know because we investigated him thoroughly long ago, when we entered into a contract with him. Back then, he truly had nothing. That was why we trusted him with the work: we thought there was no danger of some strange sense of justice taking hold of him. To think it would come to this.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r266","rowIndex":266,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「さっき、私のことを娘と言いましたが……」","en":"“You called me your daughter just now...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r267","rowIndex":267,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうだよ。この身体のなかに、とある女がいるんだが、きみは彼女の娘なんだよ。さっきからそいつは非常に会いたがっている。あ、さっきの女じゃないよ。あいつは、若いやつを見ると誰でも自分の子供だと思い込んでしまう、哀れな女さ。……大人しくしていれば、本当の母親にも会わせてやれるかもしれないな。おかげさまで、時間はたっぷりあるからね」","en":"“Yes. There's a certain woman inside this body, and you're her daughter. She's been desperate to see you for a while now. Oh, I don't mean the woman from before. She's a pitiful woman who mistakes every young person she sees for her own child. ...If you behave yourself, I may be able to let you meet your real mother as well. Fortunately, we have plenty of time.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r268","rowIndex":268,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=64>アレクセイ</tips>は肩をすくめる。","en":"<tips=64>Alexei</tips> shrugged.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r269","rowIndex":269,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　自分の母親は<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>のなかの一人だった。その言葉には何の証拠もないが、矛盾もなく、<tips=55>松子</tips>には信憑性があるように思えた。","en":"Her own mother had been one of the people inside <tips=20>Koschei</tips>. There was no proof behind his words, but no contradiction either, and <tips=55>Matsuko</tips> found them credible.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r270","rowIndex":270,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　だとすれば<tips=55>松子</tips>が長年探し求めた真実を告げていることになるのだが、不思議と心には何も響かない。彼女はそんな自分に微かな戸惑いを覚えた。","en":"If that was true, he was revealing the truth <tips=55>Matsuko</tips> had sought for years, yet strangely, it stirred nothing within her. That absence troubled her faintly.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r271","rowIndex":271,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　かわりに隣のタナベが大きく驚き、<tips=55>松子</tips>の顔と<tips=64>アレクセイ</tips>の顔を交互に見る。","en":"Tanabe, by contrast, was visibly shocked. Her gaze moved back and forth between <tips=55>Matsuko</tips> and <tips=64>Alexei</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r272","rowIndex":272,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「きみはおれのことを覚えていないかい？　小さい頃、会っているはずなんだがなあ」","en":"“Don’t you remember me? We should have met when you were very small.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r273","rowIndex":273,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「覚えてないですね。あなたのことなんか」","en":"“No. I don’t remember you at all.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r274","rowIndex":274,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=55>松子</tips>は吐き捨てる。","en":"<tips=55>Matsuko</tips> spat the words.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r275","rowIndex":275,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうかい。そうなのか。おれはよく覚えているんだけれどなあ」","en":"“I see. So you don’t. I remember you very well, though.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r276","rowIndex":276,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=64>アレクセイ</tips>は残念そうな顔をして言う。","en":"<tips=64>Alexei</tips> said it with a disappointed look.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r277","rowIndex":277,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「しかし不思議だな。なんで復活したんだろう？　ちゃんと手足を切断したあとに、首筋に薬を打って、失血でこと切れるのを確認してから捨てたんだよ。あれで生き返るはずなんてないんだ。薬が悪かったのかな」","en":"“But it's strange. How did you come back to life? I made sure to inject the drug into your neck after cutting off your arms and legs, and I didn't throw you away until I'd confirmed that you had bled to death. There was no way you should have come back from that. Maybe there was something wrong with the drug.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r278","rowIndex":278,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「手足を切り落として、それから首筋に？」","en":"“After cutting off my arms and legs, you injected me in the neck?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r279","rowIndex":279,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=55>松子</tips>は嫌悪感に顔を顰めながらそう尋ね返す。","en":"<tips=55>Matsuko</tips> repeated the question, her face twisting in disgust.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r280","rowIndex":280,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうだよ。正確には、まず指を切り落として、それから手首足首を切り落として、そして手足を付け根で切り落としてから、注射を打ったんだ。そしたらもう蘇らない筈なんだよ。失血で死ぬに決まってるんだ。知ってるかい？　おれたちは不死身のようで不死身じゃない。ちゃんと死なせる方法があるんだ。だから、変に安心しちゃいけないよ。ここでおれに殺されたらきみはもう蘇らない」","en":"“That's right. To be precise, first I cut off your fingers, then your hands and feet at the wrists and ankles, then your arms and legs where they joined your body, and only then did I give you the injection. Once that's done, you aren't supposed to come back. Of course you'd bleed to death. Did you know? We seem immortal, but we aren't. There is a way to make sure we die. So don’t get complacent. If I kill you here, you won't come back again.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r281","rowIndex":281,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……手足を切り落として、首筋……」","en":"“...Cut off my arms and legs... the back of my neck...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r282","rowIndex":282,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=55>松子</tips>は口の中で小さく反芻する。","en":"<tips=55>Matsuko</tips> repeated the words softly under her breath.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r283","rowIndex":283,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「前は何かの手違いで生き返ったのかもしれないが、二回目はないぜ。きっちり確認してやるからな」","en":"“You may have come back the first time because of some mistake, but there won’t be a second time. I’ll make absolutely sure of that.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r284","rowIndex":284,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=64>アレクセイ</tips>の言葉に<tips=55>松子</tips>はこたえず、","en":"<tips=55>Matsuko</tips> did not answer <tips=64>Alexei</tips>, but instead—","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r285","rowIndex":285,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どうしてここに来たんですか？」","en":"“Why did you come here?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r286","rowIndex":286,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　はっきりと相手を見つめながらそう言った。","en":"She said it while looking him squarely in the eye.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r287","rowIndex":287,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「私に用があるなら、私の家に来ればよかったじゃないですか。こんな場所で、職場の人たちを巻き込んで……」","en":"“If you had business with me, you could have come to my home. Why involve the people at my workplace...?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r288","rowIndex":288,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「今夜きみが自宅にいたならそうしたよ。場所はどこだって良かったんだ。時間が大事だったんだよ。さっきキャシーがきみに言ったのは嘘じゃない。今夜か、それか明後日くらいしか時間がとれなくてね。何しろいまおれは本当に多忙で、まったくいやになっちまう」","en":"“If you’d been home tonight, I would have. I didn’t care where we met. It was the timing that mattered. What Cathy told you earlier wasn’t a lie. Tonight and maybe the day after tomorrow were the only times I could manage. I really am terribly busy right now. I’m thoroughly sick of it.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r289","rowIndex":289,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=64>アレクセイ</tips>は大げさに肩をすくめて溜息をつく。","en":"<tips=64>Alexei</tips> shrugged theatrically and sighed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r290","rowIndex":290,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「こう言うと、きみはまたおれがどこかで女を殺してると思うんだろうね。おれが人殺しだからって、そういう偏見で見る。世間ってのはまったくそういうもんさ。しかし、そうじゃない。何だろう？　社会を変えるとか、なんとか……まあ一種の社会奉仕みたいなものなのかな。おれには全く理解出来ないが……。きみはどうだ？　権力だとか、支配だとか、くだらないと思わないか？　金なんか、うまいワインを飲めて、いい音楽を聴いて、楽しく一日を過ごせるだけあればいい。たまには恋もしてね。人生ってそれ以上は何も必要ないと思わないか？」","en":"“When I say something like that, you probably think I’ve been off somewhere killing women again. Just because I’m a murderer, you see me through that prejudice. That’s how the world is. But no. What is it? Changing society, or something... I suppose it’s a kind of public service. I don’t understand it at all, but... What about you? Don’t you think power and control are ridiculous? All the money anyone needs is enough to drink good wine, listen to good music, and enjoy the day. Fall in love now and then. Don’t you think that’s all life needs?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r291","rowIndex":291,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=55>松子</tips>には相手が何を言っているのかさっぱりわからない。","en":"<tips=55>Matsuko</tips> had no idea what he was talking about.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r292","rowIndex":292,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あなたはわざわざよく分からない人生の話をしに来たんですか？」","en":"“Did you come all this way just to tell me some story about life that I can’t make sense of?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r293","rowIndex":293,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いや、そうじゃない。そうじゃないんだが……最近はどうも感傷的になっていけないね。うふふ、何かと面倒で悩ましいことが多いのさ。本当に、この世界は地獄だよ」","en":"“No, that isn’t it. It isn’t, but... I’ve been getting far too sentimental lately. Heh heh. There are so many tiresome things to worry about. This world really is hell.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r294","rowIndex":294,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=64>アレクセイ</tips>は肩をゆすって笑う。","en":"<tips=64>Alexei</tips> laughed, his shoulders shaking.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r295","rowIndex":295,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　こんなに支離滅裂な喋り方をする男だったろうか？　もっとも、連続殺人鬼にまともさを求める方が間違っているのかもしれないが。","en":"Had he always been a man who spoke this incoherently? Then again, perhaps expecting sanity from a serial killer was the mistake.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r296","rowIndex":296,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　喋っている間になんとか銃口がそれて隙を作ってくれないかと観察していたが、こんな話をしていながらも<tips=64>アレクセイ</tips>の銃口はピタリと<tips=55>松子</tips>の顔面に向いたままだった。前に会った時に痛手を負わされたのを覚えていて、警戒はしているのだろう。","en":"She watched in the hope that the muzzle might drift and expose an opening while he talked. Yet despite the loose conversation, <tips=64>Alexei</tips> kept it trained precisely upon <tips=55>Matsuko’s</tips> face. He must remember how badly she had hurt him at their last meeting and remain on his guard.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r297","rowIndex":297,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そう、ひとつ聞きたいことがあるんだ。いいかな？」","en":"“Oh, right. There’s one thing I wanted to ask you. May I?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r298","rowIndex":298,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なんですか」","en":"“What is it?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r299","rowIndex":299,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=50>路地邦昭</tips>って知ってるね？　ツノの生えた大男だよ」","en":"“You know <tips=50>Kuniaki Roji</tips>, don’t you? The large man with horns.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r300","rowIndex":300,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　この質問にはどう答えるのが正解なのか？","en":"What was the correct answer to that question?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r301","rowIndex":301,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=55>松子</tips>は迷ったが、あまり長く逡巡しているわけにはいかない。<tips=64>アレクセイ</tips>は笑っていない目でこちらの表情を観察している。露骨に迷えばこちらの返答の内容にかかわらず相手に情報を渡すことになるだろう。","en":"<tips=55>Matsuko</tips> hesitated, but could not deliberate for long. <tips=64>Alexei</tips> watched her expression with eyes that did not smile. If she displayed her uncertainty openly, the reaction itself would give him information, no matter how she answered.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r302","rowIndex":302,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ろじさん……ですか？」","en":"“Mr. Roji...?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r303","rowIndex":303,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そう」","en":"“Yes.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r304","rowIndex":304,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ツノの生えた人なら街で見かけたことがありますが……」","en":"“I have seen a man with horns around the city...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r305","rowIndex":305,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ふむ」","en":"“Hmm.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r306","rowIndex":306,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=64>アレクセイ</tips>は小さく首をかしげる。","en":"<tips=64>Alexei</tips> tilted his head slightly.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r307","rowIndex":307,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　即座に否定しないということは、ある程度、こちらの言うデタラメを信じてくれたのだろうか？","en":"The fact that he had not immediately denied it—did that mean he believed at least some of the nonsense she had fed him?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r308","rowIndex":308,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　となると、<tips=50>路地</tips>がここに匿われていたことも知らないのだ。","en":"If so, he did not know that <tips=50>Roji</tips> had been sheltered here.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r309","rowIndex":309,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　思ったよりこちらの事情に詳しくないのかもしれないと、<tips=55>松子</tips>は推測した。","en":"Perhaps he knew less about their circumstances than she had feared, <tips=55>Matsuko</tips> inferred.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r310","rowIndex":310,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「先日久しぶりに会ったんだが、彼、死なないんだよ」","en":"“I ran into him the other day for the first time in ages, and the man just won’t die.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r311","rowIndex":311,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「死なない？」","en":"“He doesn’t die?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r312","rowIndex":312,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「彼に即死になる致命傷を与えたはずなんだが、起き上がった。彼はいつの間にか我々と同じ体質になっていたんだよ。前は違ったように見えたがね。それとも気づかないだけで前からそうだったのか……。もし最近ああなったのなら、きみが関与しているのかと思ったのだが」","en":"“I gave him what should have been an instantly fatal wound, but he got back up. At some point, he’d acquired the same kind of body we have. He seemed different before—or perhaps he was always that way and I simply never noticed. ...If it only happened recently, I thought you might have something to do with it.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r313","rowIndex":313,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=50>路地</tips>との交戦を語り出したので、<tips=55>松子</tips>は内心でドキリとした。","en":"When he began speaking of his fight with <tips=50>Roji</tips>, <tips=55>Matsuko</tips> felt a jolt of alarm.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r314","rowIndex":314,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=50>路地</tips>と<tips=64>アレクセイ</tips>が殺し合いをした。にもかかわらず、<tips=64>アレクセイ</tips>は無事のままここにいる。ならば、あの元探偵はどうなったのか？","en":"<tips=50>Roji</tips> and <tips=64>Alexei</tips> had fought with intent to kill. Yet <tips=64>Alexei</tips> was here, unharmed. Then what had happened to the former detective?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r315","rowIndex":315,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=55>松子</tips>は驚きと不安で鼓動が早くなるのを押し隠しつつ、","en":"Fighting to hide the quickening of her pulse from surprise and fear, <tips=55>Matsuko</tips>—","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r316","rowIndex":316,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どうしてですか？　そのことと、私が何か関係あるんですか？」","en":"“Why? What does that have to do with me?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r317","rowIndex":317,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「きみは知らないのか？」","en":"“You don’t know?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r318","rowIndex":318,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「何をですか？」","en":"“What do you mean?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r319","rowIndex":319,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=64>アレクセイ</tips>が言っているのは、血を分け与えれば相手を不死に出来る能力のことだと<tips=55>松子</tips>は察していたが、表情には出さずとぼけて見せた。","en":"<tips=55>Matsuko</tips> understood that <tips=64>Alexei</tips> meant her ability to make another person immortal by sharing her blood. Keeping that realization from her face, she pretended not to know what he meant.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r320","rowIndex":320,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうか。まあいい。あと……そうだな」","en":"“I see. Well, never mind. And... let’s see.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r321","rowIndex":321,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=64>アレクセイ</tips>が考え込んだところで、横のタナベがこちらを見ていることに<tips=55>松子</tips>は気がついた。","en":"As <tips=64>Alexei</tips> paused to think, <tips=55>Matsuko</tips> noticed Tanabe beside her watching her.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r322","rowIndex":322,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=55>汐さん</tips>あなたって……」","en":"“<tips=55>Ms. Shio</tips>, what are you...?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r323","rowIndex":323,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　いまここで聞かされたことは彼女にとっては驚きの連続だろう。これが施設内で広まれば<tips=55>松子</tips>の今までの生活は崩壊してしまうかもしれない。","en":"Everything Tanabe had heard here must have been one shock after another. If word spread through the facility, <tips=55>Matsuko’s</tips> life as she knew it might fall apart.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r324","rowIndex":324,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しかし、今はそれを心配している状況ではない。目の前に居るのは殺人をなんとも思わない人間なのだ。","en":"But this was no time to worry about it. The person before her thought nothing of murder.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r325","rowIndex":325,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「後で話します」","en":"“I’ll explain later.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r326","rowIndex":326,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　タナベには小さくそう返事をして、また<tips=64>アレクセイ</tips>に視線を戻した。","en":"She gave Tanabe that quiet reply, then returned her gaze to <tips=64>Alexei</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r327","rowIndex":327,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　——彼は私たち二人をこの場で殺害するつもりだろう。そうでなければこんな話し方をするはずがない。","en":"He probably means to kill us both here. Otherwise, he would never speak like this.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r328","rowIndex":328,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　思えば、<tips=31>エリー・ホワイト</tips>の家で<tips=18>ローズ・クラブ</tips>の顛末を聞いた時点で想像するべきだった。<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>が三日月の女たちを殺害してから脱出したのは、この不死身の血を外に出したくなかったからだろう。だとすれば、自分を襲いに来るということも、具体的な問題として想定出来たはずだ。","en":"In retrospect, Matsuko should have seen it coming from the moment she heard the story of the <tips=18>Rose Club</tips> at <tips=31>Ellie White's</tips> home. <tips=20>Koschei</tips> must have killed the Crescent women before escaping because he did not want their immortal blood to reach the outside world. If so, she should have considered the real possibility that he would come after her.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r329","rowIndex":329,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しかし、今更悔いても仕方がない。","en":"But there was no use regretting it now.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r330","rowIndex":330,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼が私に対して話すことがなくなり、最後の仕事に取りかかる前に何か行動を起こさなくては。","en":"She had to act before he ran out of things to say to her and set about his final task.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r331","rowIndex":331,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=55>松子</tips>は焦っていた。","en":"<tips=55>Matsuko</tips> was growing desperate.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r332","rowIndex":332,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　機会をうかがうよりも、自分の<tips=17>タイプB</tips>としての運動能力に賭けて無理矢理こちらから行動を起こした方が良いのか？　それとも、ここは相手の出方を待つべきなのか。決められない。どちらとも決断出来ていない状態が一番悪いのはわかっているのだが。","en":"Rather than wait for an opening, should she gamble on her physical abilities as a <tips=17>Type B</tips> and force the issue herself? Or should she wait to see what her opponent did? She could not decide. She knew the worst thing she could do was remain frozen between the two choices.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r333","rowIndex":333,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>だったらどう判断しただろう？　子供の頃喧嘩に巻き込まれたときは、いつも<tips=1>亮</tips>が正しく判断をしてくれた。今の自分に同じように的確な判断が出来るだろうか？","en":"What would <tips=1>Ryo</tips> have decided? Whenever they were swept into fights as children, <tips=1>Ryo</tips> had always made the correct decision. Could she make an equally sound judgment now?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r334","rowIndex":334,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　とにかく人死にを出してはならない。タナベも、子供たちも、他の誰一人この殺人鬼に手をかけさせてはいけない。そして、出来れば、自分も生き延びるのだ。","en":"Whatever happened, no one could die. She would not allow this murderer to lay a hand on Tanabe, the children, or anyone else. And, if possible, Matsuko herself would survive.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r335","rowIndex":335,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　少し前だったら自分の命を希薄に感じていたかもしれない。でも今は違う。","en":"Not long ago, she might have felt little attachment to her own life. It was different now.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r336","rowIndex":336,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　――私にはまだやることがある。やっと最近自分の命の価値がわかったんだ。","en":"—There are still things I must do. Only recently have I finally understood the value of my life.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r337","rowIndex":337,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　目の前の男は自分を殺す方法を知っているだろうけれど、むざむざと思い通りにさせてはいけない。私も含めて、全員が無事でこの夜を乗り越えるんだ。","en":"The man before her presumably knew how to kill her, but she would not meekly let him have his way. Everyone—including me—will make it safely through this night.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r338","rowIndex":338,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　覚悟を決める<tips=55>松子</tips>の目に強い意志の光があらわれている。","en":"A fierce resolve shone in <tips=55>Matsuko’s</tips> eyes.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r339","rowIndex":339,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　だが<tips=64>アレクセイ</tips>はそれに気がつかなかった。","en":"But <tips=64>Alexei</tips> did not notice it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r340","rowIndex":340,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「よし、じゃあ次の質問だ。きみは……」","en":"“All right, then. Next question. You—”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アレクセイ","displayName":"Alexei","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r341","rowIndex":341,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼がそう言いかけた時だ。","en":"Just as he began to speak—","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r342","rowIndex":342,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「うっ」","en":"“Urgh.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アレクセイ","displayName":"Alexei","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r343","rowIndex":343,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=64>アレクセイ</tips>は急に目を大きく見開いて、そしてガクリと俯く。","en":"<tips=64>Alexei's</tips> eyes suddenly opened wide, then his head dropped.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r344","rowIndex":344,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　何か発作でも起きたかのように身体が揺れ、銃口がブレた。","en":"His body shuddered as though in the grip of some seizure, and the muzzle wavered.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r345","rowIndex":345,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=55>松子</tips>はその隙を見逃さなかった。立ち上がりながらさっと手を伸ばし、相手の銃を掴む。","en":"<tips=55>Matsuko</tips> did not miss the opening. As she rose, she shot out a hand and seized his gun.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r346","rowIndex":346,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「お、お前っ……」","en":"“Y-you...!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アレクセイ","displayName":"Alexei","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r347","rowIndex":347,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　苦悶で皺だらけにした表情で<tips=64>アレクセイ</tips>は<tips=55>松子</tips>を睨み付けた。","en":"<tips=64>Alexei</tips> glared at <tips=55>Matsuko</tips> through features contorted with agony.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r348","rowIndex":348,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その時引き金を引いたようだが、銃口は既に<tips=55>松子</tips>の身体からは大きく外れており、壁に掛かった創立者の顔写真を撃ち抜く。","en":"He appeared to pull the trigger, but the muzzle had already swung far from <tips=55>Matsuko's</tips> body. The bullet pierced a framed photograph of the facility's founder on the wall.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r349","rowIndex":349,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=55>松子</tips>は掴んだ拳銃を<tips=64>アレクセイ</tips>の手の甲の方にねじりあげる。","en":"<tips=55>Matsuko</tips> wrenched the captured gun upward against the back of <tips=64>Alexei’s</tips> hand.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r350","rowIndex":350,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　すると引き金にかかったままの<tips=64>アレクセイ</tips>の人差し指が、トリガーガードに締め上げられる形になって、パキッと割り箸を折ったような乾いた音がする。","en":"Then <tips=64>Alexei's</tips> index finger, still hooked around the trigger, was forced tight against the trigger guard. There came a dry crack, like a wooden chopstick snapping in two.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r351","rowIndex":351,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「くっ」","en":"“Ghh...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アレクセイ","displayName":"Alexei","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r352","rowIndex":352,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=64>アレクセイ</tips>は苦痛に顔を歪める。人差し指の骨が折れたのだ。","en":"<tips=64>Alexei’s</tips> face contorted in pain. His index finger was broken.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r353","rowIndex":353,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　松子はもう片方の手で、拳銃を握る彼の手首を握りしめ、そのまま彼の腕を関節と逆向きにねじる。","en":"With her other hand, Matsuko seized his gun wrist and twisted his arm the wrong way at the joint.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r354","rowIndex":354,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　痛みから逃れるにはその回転に逆らわずに<tips=55>松子</tips>の手の動きに従うしかない。そうなれば、彼の身体は完全に<tips=55>松子</tips>の制圧下に置かれるはずだった。","en":"To escape the pain, he would have no choice but to move with <tips=55>Matsuko’s</tips> hand instead of resisting the twist. That should have brought his body completely under <tips=55>Matsuko’s</tips> control.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r355","rowIndex":355,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　これは子供の頃<tips=1>亮</tips>から教わった護身術だった。使うのは久しぶりだが、身体はまだ覚えている。","en":"<tips=1>Ryo</tips> had taught her this method of self-defense when they were children. It had been a long time since she had used it, but her body still remembered.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r356","rowIndex":356,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しかし<tips=64>アレクセイ</tips>は<tips=55>松子</tips>の腹の辺りを蹴って力任せに腕を引き抜く。肘や肩から鈍い音がし、彼はそのまま後ろに転がった。テーブルの上から転がり落ちたカップが音を立てて床ではじける。","en":"<tips=64>Alexei</tips> kicked <tips=55>Matsuko</tips> in the abdomen and wrenched his arm free by brute force. Dull cracks sounded from his elbow and shoulder as he tumbled backward. A cup rolled off the table and shattered noisily on the floor.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r357","rowIndex":357,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ぐあっ……うっ……」","en":"“Gwaa... Urgh...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アレクセイ","displayName":"Alexei","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r358","rowIndex":358,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=64>アレクセイ</tips>は床の上で折れた腕の痛みにのたうちまわりながらも、銃は手放さない。","en":"Writhing on the floor in pain from the broken arm, <tips=64>Alexei</tips> still refused to release the gun.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r359","rowIndex":359,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しりもちを付いた<tips=55>松子</tips>は立ち上がり、攻撃しようとしたが、彼は無事な方の手で銃を掴んで銃口で彼女を制す。絶体絶命の状況で、彼は躊躇せずにすぐに引き金に指をかけるが、しかしまた発作のように身体が揺れた。","en":"<tips=55>Matsuko</tips> rose from where she had landed and tried to attack. He seized the gun with his uninjured hand and held her at bay with the muzzle. Even in this desperate condition, he did not hesitate to put his finger to the trigger. Then his body shuddered again as though in another seizure.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r360","rowIndex":360,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして彼はその姿を変えた。","en":"And his form changed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r361","rowIndex":361,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「はあ……はあ……」","en":"“Hah... hah...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r362","rowIndex":362,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　肩を揺らしてそこで荒い呼吸をするのは、長い黒髪の女性であった。","en":"The figure there, shoulders heaving with ragged breaths, was a woman with long black hair.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r363","rowIndex":363,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女はゆらりと立ち上がり、そして手の中の銃を見ると、床に投げ捨てた。","en":"She rose unsteadily. When she saw the gun in her hand, she threw it onto the floor.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r364","rowIndex":364,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「くっ」","en":"“Ghh...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r365","rowIndex":365,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　変身しても怪我は残るようで、折れた方の腕を動かそうとして顔を顰める。","en":"The injuries appeared to persist across transformations. She tried to move the broken arm and grimaced.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r366","rowIndex":366,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして彼女は顔を上げて、こちらを見た。","en":"Then she raised her face and looked at Matsuko.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r367","rowIndex":367,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女は東洋人で、三十になるかならないかといった年齢の美しい女だった。","en":"She was a beautiful East Asian woman, perhaps just under or just over thirty.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r368","rowIndex":368,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ああ……ミシェル……」","en":"“Oh... Michelle...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r369","rowIndex":369,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そう呟くと、女の目に涙が溢れた。","en":"As she murmured the name, tears filled the woman’s eyes.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r370","rowIndex":370,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　新たに現れた<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>の三番目の姿を<tips=55>松子</tips>は呆然と眺めている。","en":"<tips=55>Matsuko</tips> stared, stunned, at the third form of <tips=20>Koschei</tips> now before her.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r371","rowIndex":371,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ミシェル……あなたが生きていたなんて……」","en":"“Michelle... You’re alive...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r372","rowIndex":372,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　女は顔中を涙で濡らしながらゆらりと<tips=55>松子</tips>に近づく。<tips=55>松子</tips>は警戒してその分下がる。","en":"Her face drenched in tears, the woman swayed toward <tips=55>Matsuko</tips>. Wary, <tips=55>Matsuko</tips> backed away by the same amount.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r373","rowIndex":373,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どうか触らせて頂戴……お母さん、もう一度あなたに会えるなんて、夢にも思わなかった……」","en":"“Please, let me touch you... Your mother never dreamed she would see you again...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r374","rowIndex":374,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……お母さん？」","en":"“...My mother?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r375","rowIndex":375,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうよ。……私があなたを産んだの。守ってあげられなくてゴメンね……」","en":"“Yes. ...I gave birth to you. I’m sorry I couldn’t protect you...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r376","rowIndex":376,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　女は<tips=55>松子</tips>に向かって手を伸ばす。<tips=55>松子</tips>はそれを避けて駆け足で女の後にまわりこみ、銃を拾う。","en":"The woman reached out toward <tips=55>Matsuko</tips>. <tips=55>Matsuko</tips> dodged the hand, darted around behind her, and picked up the gun.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r377","rowIndex":377,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いいわ。それで私を撃ちなさい。そうしたら、すぐに私の上着のポケットから注射器を取り出してそれを私の身体に打つの。そうすれば、二度と生き返ることはないわ」","en":"“Good. Shoot me with it. Then take the syringe from my coat pocket at once and inject it into me. If you do, I’ll never come back to life.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r378","rowIndex":378,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　女は<tips=55>松子</tips>を追うことを諦め、そう言った。","en":"The woman stopped trying to follow <tips=55>Matsuko</tips> and said this.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r379","rowIndex":379,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どうしてそんなことを教えてくれるんですか？」","en":"“Why are you telling me this?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r380","rowIndex":380,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=55>松子</tips>は両手で銃を構えながら訊ねる。","en":"<tips=55>Matsuko</tips> asked, keeping the gun trained on the woman with both hands.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r381","rowIndex":381,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　冷静な顔をしていたが、心臓の鼓動が早まり、じっとりとしたおかしな汗を掻いていた。","en":"Her face remained calm, but her heart raced and her skin was slick with unnatural sweat.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r382","rowIndex":382,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　目の前の女は母親だと名乗っている。<tips=55>松子</tips>の直感はそれは真実であると告げていた。","en":"The woman before her claimed to be her mother. <tips=55>Matsuko's</tips> intuition told her it was true.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r383","rowIndex":383,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しかし自分たちに脅威を与えようとしている<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>の一部であることも間違いないのだ。","en":"Yet the woman was undeniably also one part of <tips=20>Koschei</tips>, who had come here to threaten them.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r384","rowIndex":384,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ミシェル、私はあなたを守ろうとしたの。愛する<tips=60>ロジャー</tips>との間に出来たあなたを。……でもみんなは肉親を持つことを許さなかった。そして、この殺人鬼に命じてあなたを殺させたのよ……うるさいわ！　もうあなたの言葉なんか聞かない！」","en":"“Michelle, I tried to protect you—the child I bore with my beloved <tips=60>Roger</tips>. ...But the others would not permit us to have families of our own. They ordered this murderer to kill you... Be quiet! I won’t listen to you anymore!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r385","rowIndex":385,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女は急にそっぽを向くと、誰もいない空間にそう怒鳴った。","en":"She suddenly turned aside and shouted into empty space.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r386","rowIndex":386,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そしてすぐに<tips=55>松子</tips>の方を向くと、頭痛に耐えるように頭を抑え、顔を顰めながら言う。","en":"She immediately faced <tips=55>Matsuko</tips> again, clutched her head as though enduring a headache, and spoke through a grimace.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r387","rowIndex":387,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ミシェル。……残念だけどあまり時間がないみたい。早く私を撃ちなさい。みんなが、私を引きずりおろそうとしている。こんなことを言うとは思っていなかったんだわ」","en":"“Michelle... I'm sorry, but it seems I have very little time. Shoot me quickly. They are trying to drag me down. I never thought I would say something like this.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r388","rowIndex":388,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=55>松子</tips>は今すぐ女の言う通り今すぐ引き金を引くべきだと頭では理解していたが、指がどうしても動かず、銃口が震えた。","en":"<tips=55>Matsuko</tips> understood rationally that she should pull the trigger at once, exactly as the woman asked. But her finger would not move, and the muzzle trembled.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r389","rowIndex":389,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……あなたは今、私を助けてくれたんですか？」","en":"“...Did you just save me?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r390","rowIndex":390,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　唾液がなくなってカラカラに乾いた口でそう言った。","en":"Her mouth was parched as she forced out the words.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r391","rowIndex":391,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「早く……早く撃ちなさい……」","en":"“Hurry... Hurry and shoot me...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r392","rowIndex":392,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　女は頭を抱えたままゆらりと揺らめいた。また、別の誰かに変身しようとしているのだ。","en":"Still holding her head, the woman swayed unsteadily. She was beginning to transform into someone else again.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r393","rowIndex":393,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　――母だと名乗る女が、自分を撃てと言っている。自分を助けるために、殺せと言っている。","en":"—The woman claiming to be her mother was telling her to shoot. Telling her to kill her own mother to save herself.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r394","rowIndex":394,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=55>松子</tips>は脳が痺れるような感覚に襲われた。必死で下唇を噛み、銃を構え直す。そして、その照準を女の胸の辺りに当てる。","en":"A sensation like her brain going numb swept over <tips=55>Matsuko</tips>. She desperately bit her lower lip and raised the gun again, aiming at the woman’s chest.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r395","rowIndex":395,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その女は顔を顰め、喘ぐように口で呼吸をしていた。","en":"The woman grimaced and breathed through her mouth in gasps.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r396","rowIndex":396,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　――この人がくれたこのチャンスを無駄にしてはいけない。大体、私はこんな人全然知らないじゃないか！","en":"—I can’t waste the chance this woman has given me. Besides, I don’t know her at all!","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r397","rowIndex":397,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=55>松子</tips>は心中で自分に向かってそう叫んだが、引き金にかけた人差し指はまるで誰か他人のものになってしまったかのように動かない。","en":"<tips=55>Matsuko</tips> screamed the words at herself in her mind, but her index finger on the trigger would not move, as though it belonged to someone else.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r398","rowIndex":398,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「早く……」","en":"“Hurry...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r399","rowIndex":399,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　女はまぶたをぎゅっと閉じ、涙を流している。","en":"The woman squeezed her eyes shut and wept.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r400","rowIndex":400,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女も平気なわけじゃない。撃たれる恐怖を感じてなお、そう言っているのだ。","en":"This was not easy for her either. She was afraid of being shot, yet continued to ask for it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r401","rowIndex":401,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=55>松子</tips>は肩をふるわせながら銃を彼女に向けている。","en":"Her shoulders trembling, <tips=55>Matsuko</tips> kept the gun trained on her.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r402","rowIndex":402,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　落ち着くために、口を開き、音が聞こえるくらい深く呼吸をする。","en":"Trying to calm herself, she opened her mouth and drew a slow, audible breath.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r403","rowIndex":403,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　目元がじんわりとして、あたたかい涙が頬をこぼれ落ちる。","en":"Her eyes grew moist, and warm tears spilled down her cheeks.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r404","rowIndex":404,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして、人差し指を引こうとしたが、やはりどうしても動いてくれない。","en":"She tried to squeeze the trigger, but still her index finger refused to move.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r405","rowIndex":405,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=55>松子</tips>はだらりと拳銃をおろした。","en":"<tips=55>Matsuko</tips> let the gun hang limply at her side.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r406","rowIndex":406,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「だめだ……撃てない。撃てないよお母さん……」","en":"“I can’t... I can’t shoot you, Mom...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r407","rowIndex":407,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=55>松子</tips>の涙声で女はハッと目を開き、顔をあげる。","en":"At the sound of <tips=55>Matsuko’s</tips> tearful voice, the woman’s eyes flew open and she raised her head.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r408","rowIndex":408,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そしてその涙で曇った目で、目の前の娘が自分と同じように涙を流しているのを見た。","en":"Through eyes clouded with tears, she saw the daughter before her weeping just as she was.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r409","rowIndex":409,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ミシェル……いまお母さんて……」","en":"“Michelle... Did you just call me Mom...?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r410","rowIndex":410,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　言いかけたところで、彼女は頭を押さえて前のめりに倒れた。","en":"Before she could finish, she clutched her head and pitched forward.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r411","rowIndex":411,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「お母さんっ！」","en":"“Mom!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r412","rowIndex":412,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=55>松子</tips>はほとんど無意識に倒れる母に駆け寄り、そして目の前で立ち止まった。","en":"Almost without thinking, <tips=55>Matsuko</tips> rushed to her falling mother, then stopped short in front of her.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r413","rowIndex":413,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　女の身体はみるみるうちに膨れ上がり、服が内側から押し上げられパンパンに表面が張っている。","en":"The woman’s body swelled before her eyes. Her clothing was thrust outward from within, its surface drawn taut.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r414","rowIndex":414,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　また次の変身が始まろうとしている。","en":"Another transformation was about to begin.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r415","rowIndex":415,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しかしこれはなんと禍々しい能力なのだろう。人間が、人格も体格も全く違う別の人間に入れ替わってしまうとは。","en":"But what a sinister power this was. To think one human being could be replaced by another, utterly different in both personality and build.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r416","rowIndex":416,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=50>路地</tips>から話には聞いていたが、こうして目の当たりにしても信じることが出来ない。まるで夢を見ているようだ。","en":"<tips=50>Roji</tips> had told her about it, but even witnessing it with her own eyes, she could not believe it. It was as though she were dreaming.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r417","rowIndex":417,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　サイキックとは、或いは夜明けに見る支離滅裂な悪夢を現実の世界に呼び出す能力なのかもしれない。","en":"—Perhaps psychic power was the ability to summon the disjointed nightmares one dreams at dawn into the waking world.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r418","rowIndex":418,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「くっ」","en":"“Ghh...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐松子","displayName":"Matsuko Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r419","rowIndex":419,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=55>松子</tips>は我を取り戻し、銃を構える。もう躊躇している暇はない。相手の頭辺りに銃を向けると、目をつぶって引き金にかけた人差し指に力を込めた。","en":"<tips=55>Matsuko</tips> recovered herself and raised the gun. There was no longer time to hesitate. Pointing it toward her opponent's head, she closed her eyes and squeezed the trigger.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r420","rowIndex":420,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　この時彼女が握っているのは、<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>が独自ルートで入手した中国製の拳銃だった。","en":"The weapon in her hands was a Chinese-made pistol that <tips=20>Koschei</tips> had obtained through his own private channels.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r421","rowIndex":421,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=31>エリー・ホワイト</tips>が密輸しているものよりも大分質が劣る。パーツ製造の精度が低く、しばしばトラブルが発生し、病院襲撃の際も故障する銃が見られた。","en":"It was considerably inferior to the weapons <tips=31>Ellie White</tips> smuggled. Its parts were manufactured with poor precision and frequently malfunctioned; some guns had failed during the attack upon the hospital as well.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r422","rowIndex":422,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　この時もそれが起こった。","en":"It happened again now.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r423","rowIndex":423,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　引き金が固く、<tips=55>松子</tips>の力でもビクともしない。動転して二度、三度引いたが同じことだ。","en":"The trigger was so rigid that not even <tips=55>Matsuko’s</tips> strength could move it. Distraught, she pulled a second time, then a third. The result remained the same.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r424","rowIndex":424,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　排莢がうまくいかなくて、銃のなかで先ほど撃った弾の薬莢が詰まっている。これではいくら引き金を引こうとしたところで弾は発射されない。","en":"The spent casing from the previous shot had failed to eject and was lodged inside the pistol. No matter how often she pulled the trigger, it could not fire.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r425","rowIndex":425,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=55>松子</tips>は銃器には疎く、もちろんそんなことは知るよしもない。突然のトラブルに呆然としていると、何か黒いものが視界を覆った。","en":"<tips=55>Matsuko</tips> knew little about firearms and naturally had no way of understanding any of this. She stared blankly at the sudden problem, and something black filled her vision.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r426","rowIndex":426,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　次の瞬間、彼女は咄嗟に手をあげて守ったが、そのまま身体が空中に吹き飛ばされた。","en":"In the next instant, she instinctively raised a hand to defend herself, but her body was sent flying through the air.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r427","rowIndex":427,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　変身を終えた<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>は、筋骨隆々たる大男になっており、立ち上がりながらその拳を横薙ぎにして、手の甲の部分――いわゆる裏拳で殴りつけたのだ。","en":"<tips=20>Koschei</tips> had completed the transformation into a huge, powerfully muscled man. As he stood, he swept one fist sideways and struck her with the back of his hand—a backfist.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r428","rowIndex":428,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　これによって<tips=55>松子</tips>の身体はピンボールの玉のようにはじけ飛び、背後にあった棚に激突し、それを壊した。戸に使われていたガラスが砕け散り、パラパラと<tips=55>松子</tips>の身体に降り注ぐ。","en":"This sent <tips=55>Matsuko</tips> flying like a pinball. She slammed into the cabinet behind her and smashed it. The glass in its doors shattered and pattered down over <tips=55>Matsuko</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r429","rowIndex":429,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=55>汐さん</tips>っ！」","en":"“<tips=55>Ms. Shio</tips>!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r430","rowIndex":430,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　タナベが叫ぶ。","en":"Tanabe screamed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r431","rowIndex":431,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=55>松子</tips>の意識は危ういところで繋ぎ止められていた。","en":"<tips=55>Matsuko</tips> barely clung to consciousness.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r432","rowIndex":432,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　痛みに顔を顰めながら薄目をあけると、部屋の向こう側に山のような巨体を持つ大男が立っているのが見えた。膨れ上がった筋肉で服は破れ、ほとんど全裸のようになっている。","en":"Wincing, she cracked open her eyes and saw a gigantic man built like a mountain standing across the room. His swollen muscles had torn his clothes until he was nearly naked.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r433","rowIndex":433,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼はこちらに横顔を向けながら、毛むくじゃらの身体にまとわりつくぼろきれとなった服を指先で引きちぎっていた。","en":"With his face turned partly toward her, he used his fingertips to rip away the tatters clinging to his hairy body.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r434","rowIndex":434,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　相手とは少し距離がある。さっきの腕の一振りで彼女の身体は部屋の端から端へはじき飛ばされたのだ。","en":"There was some distance between them. That single swing of his arm moments ago had flung her body from one end of the room to the other.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r435","rowIndex":435,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　化け物じみた腕力である。衝撃を受けた右手が動かない。こちらは骨折しただろう。そして、肩も脱臼したのかやたらと痛む。","en":"His strength was monstrous. Her right arm would not move after the blow; it was probably broken. Her shoulder was in terrible pain as well, perhaps dislocated.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r436","rowIndex":436,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　背中にはガラスの破片が突き刺さっているのか、こちらも全面がやけどを負ったように激しく熱く痛んだ。","en":"Shards of glass seemed to be embedded in her back, which burned all over as though badly scalded.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r437","rowIndex":437,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　銃はどこかへ落としたらしく手の中になかった。いや、たとえあったとしても故障したままじゃ役に立たない。","en":"She seemed to have dropped the gun somewhere; it was no longer in her hand. Even if she still had it, it was useless while jammed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r438","rowIndex":438,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　この相手にどう対処するか？","en":"How could she deal with this opponent?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r439","rowIndex":439,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　相手は明らかに自分よりパワーがある。<tips=64>アレクセイ</tips>を相手にするようにはいかない。まだこちらの身体は動くようだが、素手でやりあったら到底分があるとは思えない。","en":"He was plainly stronger than she was. She could not fight him the way she had <tips=64>Alexei</tips>. Her body could still move, but she could not imagine standing a chance against him unarmed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r440","rowIndex":440,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=55>松子</tips>は目を閉じ、そして手だけを動かして手のひらのなかに沢山のガラスの破片を集めた。","en":"<tips=55>Matsuko</tips> closed her eyes and, keeping the rest of her body still, used one hand to gather a heap of glass fragments into her palm.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r441","rowIndex":441,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　こちらが目を開けたとき、相手はよそを見ていた。意識を失ったふりをすれば信じるだろう。そうしたら、きっととどめをさしに来るはずだ。タナベが怯えてすすり泣く声がするが、無力な彼女よりこちらを優先するだろう。","en":"When she had opened her eyes moments earlier, the man had been looking elsewhere. If she pretended to be unconscious, he would believe it. Then he would surely come closer to finish her. She could hear Tanabe sobbing in fear, but he would come for Matsuko before the helpless woman.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r442","rowIndex":442,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　あの男がある程度近づいたところで、この手のなかのガラスの破片を顔面に投げつけ、目潰しをする。そうして怯んだ隙に起き上がってタナベのところに駆けつけ、彼女を抱えて逃げる。","en":"Once the man drew near enough, she would hurl the glass into his face and blind him. While he recoiled, she would rise, rush to Tanabe, carry her, and escape.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r443","rowIndex":443,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　――とにかく、一旦体制を立て直すことが必要だ。","en":"—First of all, she had to regroup.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r444","rowIndex":444,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=55>松子</tips>は目を閉じながら、意識を聴覚に集中した。","en":"Keeping her eyes closed, <tips=55>Matsuko</tips> focused all her attention on what she could hear.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r445","rowIndex":445,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　身体に窮屈にまとわりついた布を剥がし、自由に動けるようになった<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>がこちらにむかって歩きはじめる。","en":"<tips=20>Koschei</tips> finished tearing away the cloth that clung tightly to his body and began walking toward her, able to move freely now.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r446","rowIndex":446,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その足が、部屋に散らばった様々なものを踏みつけ、ジャリジャリと音を鳴らす。","en":"His feet crunched over the debris scattered across the room.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r447","rowIndex":447,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　この足音だけを頼りに距離を測るのだ。","en":"She would judge the distance by those footsteps alone.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r448","rowIndex":448,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　遠すぎても近すぎてもいけない。相手が避けにくい程度には近く、けれど相手の手が届かないギリギリの距離で目を開き、即座にこのガラス片を投げつける。","en":"Neither too far nor too close. She would open her eyes at the very edge of his reach—near enough that he would find it difficult to evade her attack, but not quite near enough to touch her—and immediately hurl the glass fragments.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r449","rowIndex":449,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=55>松子</tips>の心からは先ほどの感傷は消え、別人のような冷静さが支配していた。本人は気がついてはいないが、この感情の切り替えの早さこそが彼女が人とは違うところだ。","en":"The sentimentality that had filled <tips=55>Matsuko</tips> earlier was gone, replaced by a calm that made her seem another person. She herself did not realize it, but this speed in changing from one emotion to another was precisely what set her apart.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r450","rowIndex":450,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　足音がゆっくりと近づいてくる。それを聞きながら<tips=55>松子</tips>はタイミングを計る。","en":"The footsteps slowly approached. Listening, <tips=55>Matsuko</tips> timed her move.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r451","rowIndex":451,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そしてもう少しというところで、音が消えた。その場で相手が立ち止まったのだ。","en":"Then, just before he reached her, the sound vanished. He had stopped where he stood.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r452","rowIndex":452,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=55>松子</tips>は緊張をした。もし相手に十分な警戒心があり、こちらに近づかずに何か投げつけて来ようもののなら、それにも対応しなくてはいけない。","en":"<tips=55>Matsuko</tips> tensed. If he was wary enough not to approach and tried to throw something at her instead, she had to be ready for that too.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r453","rowIndex":453,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　一層の注意を聴覚に傾けていると、布を破る音が聞こえた。まだからだにまとわりついた衣服の残骸があったようだ。","en":"She listened even more intently and heard cloth tearing. Some remnant of his clothing must still have been clinging to him.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r454","rowIndex":454,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それを捨てると、相手はまた近づく。シュウシュウと空気が抜ける呼吸の音が鮮明になる。","en":"After casting it aside, he approached again. The hiss of air escaping with each breath grew clearer.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r455","rowIndex":455,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　――ここだ。","en":"—Now.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r456","rowIndex":456,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=55>松子</tips>はぱっと目を見開くと、目の前に迫ったその男の位置を確認し、動く方の腕を振るう。","en":"<tips=55>Matsuko’s</tips> eyes snapped open. She sighted the man looming before her and swung her good arm.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r457","rowIndex":457,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ぐおおっ！」","en":"“Gwoaah!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r458","rowIndex":458,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　不意をつかれ至近距離で投げつけられたガラスのつぶては、いかに優れた<tips=17>タイプB</tips>といえども避けることは出来ないようだ。","en":"Even an exceptional <tips=17>Type B</tips> seemed unable to dodge a volley of glass hurled from point-blank range when caught off guard.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r459","rowIndex":459,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　獣のような呻き声を上げてのけぞる男の姿を横目で確認しながら<tips=55>松子</tips>は素早く立ち上がり、タナベの方へ駆けた。","en":"As the man reeled backward with an animal groan, <tips=55>Matsuko</tips> caught the movement from the corner of her eye, sprang to her feet, and ran to Tanabe.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r460","rowIndex":460,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　タナベは顔を涙にぐちゃぐちゃにしたまま放心してかたまっている。","en":"Tanabe sat frozen in a daze, her face wet and distorted with tears.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r461","rowIndex":461,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=55>松子</tips>を見ると、「<tips=55>汐さん</tips>……」と何か言おうとしたが、聞かずに肩に抱え上げる。","en":"When Tanabe saw <tips=55>Matsuko</tips>, she started to say, “<tips=55>Ms. Shio</tips>...” but Matsuko did not stop to listen; she hoisted Tanabe onto one shoulder.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r462","rowIndex":462,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　背後ではガラスの破片がよほどうまく命中したらしく、<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>が空気が震えんばかりの大きな苦しみの声をあげていた。","en":"The glass fragments must have struck home: behind them, <tips=20>Koschei</tips> roared in agony loudly enough to shake the air.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r463","rowIndex":463,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　いま攻撃したら勝てるだろうか？　いや、たとえ相手の視界が多少ぼやけていても、あの怪力に近づいて、確実な勝ち目があるとは思えない。それよりもまずタナベを逃がしたほうがいい。","en":"Could Matsuko beat him if she attacked now? No. Even with his vision blurred, she could not be sure of victory if she ventured within reach of that monstrous strength. Better to get Tanabe to safety first.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r464","rowIndex":464,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=55>松子</tips>は<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>を尻目にドアを開けて廊下へ飛び出す。","en":"Leaving <tips=20>Koschei</tips> behind, <tips=55>Matsuko</tips> opened the door and burst into the corridor.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r465","rowIndex":465,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　廊下を走って裏口から外へ出た。","en":"She ran down the corridor and out through the rear exit.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r466","rowIndex":466,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　空には月が浮かんでいる。","en":"The moon hung in the sky.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r467","rowIndex":467,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　建物のなかの喧噪とは裏腹に、世界はいつも通り平常運行をしていた。いや、こういった血みどろの争いも、世界の平常のなかに収まるものなのだろう。","en":"In contrast to the chaos inside the building, the world continued its ordinary course. Or perhaps a blood-soaked struggle like this too fell within the world's ordinary course.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r468","rowIndex":468,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　この世界は我々からするとどんなに異常と感じられるものでも当たり前のような顔で売り場に並べている。","en":"This world placed even the things we found most abnormal on its shelves as though they were perfectly ordinary.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r469","rowIndex":469,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　――<tips=55>松子</tips>は月を見ながら、この緊急の場にはおよそそぐわぬことを考えながら、タナベを降ろす。","en":"—Looking at the moon and thinking thoughts wholly unsuited to the emergency, <tips=55>Matsuko</tips> set Tanabe down.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r470","rowIndex":470,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「し、<tips=55>汐さん</tips>、あなた傷だらけで……」","en":"“M-<tips=55>Ms. Shio</tips>, you’re covered in wounds...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r471","rowIndex":471,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=55>松子</tips>の顔をみてタナベが顔を顰める。","en":"Tanabe grimaced at the sight of <tips=55>Matsuko’s</tips> face.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r472","rowIndex":472,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　確かに彼女の言う通り、片腕はまるきり使えないし背中はガラスの破片が突き刺さって血みどろだし、そしてさっきはそれほどでもなかったが顔面も腫れて膨れ上がり、ほとんど片目が見えないほどになっている。","en":"Tanabe was right. One arm was entirely unusable; Matsuko's back was blood-soaked and studded with glass; and though it had not been so severe at first, her face had now swollen until one eye was almost closed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r473","rowIndex":473,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その姿はまるで番町皿屋敷のお岩の如く、コメディで笑いを取るために大げさにメイクしたらこうなるのだろうかといった案配だ。","en":"She looked like Oiwa from The Dish Mansion at Banchō, or perhaps like a performer made up with such exaggeration for a comedy.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r474","rowIndex":474,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「私は大丈夫です。タナベさん、ここからは一人で避難してください」","en":"“I’m all right. Ms. Tanabe, you need to get away from here on your own.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r475","rowIndex":475,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「一人で？」","en":"“Alone?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r476","rowIndex":476,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「はい。私は戻ってあいつの相手をします」","en":"“Yes. I’m going back to face him.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r477","rowIndex":477,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「な、何を言っているの……。一緒に逃げて、警察が来るのを待って……」","en":"“Wh-what are you saying? Come with me. We can wait for the police...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r478","rowIndex":478,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それじゃダメなんです。あいつの目的は私です。私の姿が見えなくなれば、何をするか……」","en":"“That won't work. I'm his target. If I disappear, there's no telling what he'll do...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r479","rowIndex":479,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「でも、相手はもう目が見えないでしょう？　だから安全なところで待ってればきっと」","en":"“But he can’t see anymore, can he? If we wait somewhere safe, surely...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r480","rowIndex":480,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あれくらい、すぐ治ります。そういう身体なんです。あいつも、私も……」","en":"“An injury like that will heal in no time. His body works that way. So does mine...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r481","rowIndex":481,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=55>松子</tips>はタナベの手を握って、","en":"<tips=55>Matsuko</tips> took Tanabe’s hand.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r482","rowIndex":482,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「私も死ぬつもりはありません。どんな手を使っても生き延びます。そのためにはタナベさんの協力が必要です」","en":"“I don’t intend to die either. I will survive by any means necessary. To do that, I need your cooperation.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r483","rowIndex":483,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「わ、わたしが？」","en":"“M-my cooperation?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r484","rowIndex":484,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ええ」","en":"“Yes.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r485","rowIndex":485,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=55>松子</tips>はタナベを落ち着かせるために痛みで脂汗が浮かんだ顔に微笑みを浮かべると、","en":"To calm Tanabe, <tips=55>Matsuko</tips> forced a smile across her pain-twisted face, slick with clammy sweat.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r486","rowIndex":486,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ちょっとだけなかに戻って、必要なものを持って来ます。そこに隠れて待っていて下さい」","en":"“I’m going back inside just long enough to retrieve something I need. Hide there and wait for me.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r487","rowIndex":487,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして立ち上がり、今出たばかりの建物のなかに引き返した。","en":"Then she stood and returned to the building she had only just left.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r488","rowIndex":488,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　一方部屋に残された<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>は床の上に蹲り顔を押さえている。","en":"Meanwhile, <tips=20>Koschei</tips> remained crouched upon the reception-room floor, holding his face.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r489","rowIndex":489,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　右目はほとんど損傷してはいなかったが、左目の方は鋭い破片が直撃して完全に視覚を失っている。そしてとにかくひどい激痛だ。","en":"His right eye was almost entirely unharmed, but a sharp fragment had struck the left and left it completely blind. More than anything, the pain was excruciating.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r490","rowIndex":490,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼は皮膚や骨の痛みには強かったが、こうした急所の痛みに耐えることが出来なかった。","en":"He could tolerate pain in his skin and bones, but not pain in a vulnerable spot like this.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r491","rowIndex":491,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その混乱する頭のなかでは<tips=65>ヘス</tips>による指示がひっきりなしに飛んでいる。","en":"Inside his confused mind, <tips=65>Hess’s</tips> orders came thick and fast.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r492","rowIndex":492,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"『追え！　痛がる暇はないぞ！　腰抜け！』","en":"“Go after her! You have no time to whimper! Coward!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r493","rowIndex":493,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　辛辣な言葉は、そのまま<tips=65>ヘス</tips>の彼に対する不信感を表していた。","en":"Those harsh words spoke plainly of <tips=65>Hess’s</tips> distrust of him.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r494","rowIndex":494,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼の名前はエミール・ブラーエ 。チェコ出身のプロレスラーということになっている。プロレスラー時代に頭を打った影響で舌に麻痺があり、言葉がうまくでない。性格は粗暴で反逆的。知能は低い。自分が『<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>』を構成する一人であることに対する理解も曖昧で、頭のなかで鳴り響く<tips=65>ヘス</tips>の声には従ったり逆らったり、不安定である。","en":"His name was Emil Brahe. Officially, he was a professional wrestler from the Czech Republic. A blow to the head during his wrestling career had paralyzed his tongue, making speech difficult. He was violent, defiant, and none too bright. His understanding that he was one of the individuals who made up <tips=20>Koschei</tips> was hazy, and his obedience to <tips=65>Hess’s</tips> voice inside his head was erratic: sometimes he obeyed, and sometimes he resisted.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r495","rowIndex":495,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　自制心に乏しく気分の赴くままに殴り、殺し、強姦し、奪う。犯行を隠蔽しようともしない。彼が表に出ると問題ばかりを起こし、<tips=65>ヘス</tips>は滅多に彼を呼び出すことはない。","en":"With almost no self-control, he beat, killed, raped, and robbed whenever the impulse took him. He made no attempt to conceal his crimes. Whenever he emerged, he caused nothing but trouble, so <tips=65>Hess</tips> rarely called him forth.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r496","rowIndex":496,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　が、その肉体は頑健で、<tips=17>タイプB</tips>としての身体能力増強効果も大きく、素手による戦闘能力はずば抜けていた。","en":"His body, however, was exceptionally robust, and the effects of <tips=17>Type B</tips> enhancement were especially pronounced in him. His ability in unarmed combat was extraordinary.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r497","rowIndex":497,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　本来戦闘は<tips=62>マリア</tips>が最も適任なのだが、彼女の能力で相手の肉体をバラバラにしたら破片を飛び散らせてしまう。そこで万一ひとかけらでも見落としたならば、また復活の可能性を残すことになる。","en":"Ordinarily, <tips=62>Maria</tips> was the best suited for combat, but if her power tore her opponent's body apart, it would scatter fragments everywhere. If even one fragment were overlooked, the possibility of another resurrection would remain.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r498","rowIndex":498,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　かといって<tips=55>松子</tips>の身体能力は高く、生半可な人間を呼び出しても<tips=64>アレクセイ</tips>のように返り討ちにあう可能性が高い。","en":"Yet <tips=55>Matsuko’s</tips> physical abilities were formidable; anyone less capable called forth against her would likely be beaten just as <tips=64>Alexei</tips> had been.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r499","rowIndex":499,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そのため、エミールを呼び出すことになった。","en":"For that reason, Emil was called forth.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r500","rowIndex":500,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=65>ヘス</tips>は言うことをきかぬこの男を出してしまったことを後悔しかけたが、しかし、指示が出来なくとも今エミールの心は自分にこの苦痛を与えた<tips=55>松子</tips>への憎悪で満ちており、目的は達成出来なくはなさそうだ。","en":"<tips=65>Hess</tips> had begun to regret calling forth a man who refused to obey, but even if he could no longer direct him, Emil's mind was full of hatred for <tips=55>Matsuko</tips>, who had inflicted this pain upon him. It seemed the objective might still be achieved.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r501","rowIndex":501,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しばらく部屋で蹲っていると持ち前の治癒力で痛みが少しずつ治まってゆく。","en":"As he crouched there, his innate healing gradually dulled the pain.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r502","rowIndex":502,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　完全に破損した右の眼球は二日や三日では再生しないだろうが、痛み自体は耐えられる程度まで治まってきている。","en":"The ruined eye would not regenerate in a mere two or three days, but the pain itself had already subsided to a level he could bear.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r503","rowIndex":503,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして彼はようやく立ち上がり、<tips=55>松子</tips>の姿を探した。","en":"At last he stood and searched for <tips=55>Matsuko</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r504","rowIndex":504,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　応接室は様々なものが砕けて足元にはガラスや棚の破片などが散乱している。","en":"Various objects had been shattered in the reception room, leaving glass and pieces of the cabinet scattered across the floor.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r505","rowIndex":505,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その上に、ポツポツと赤黒い血が部屋の電灯で照らされているのを彼は見つけた。","en":"Amid the wreckage, he spotted drops of dark red blood glinting under the room’s electric lights.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r506","rowIndex":506,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それを追って廊下に出る。","en":"He followed them into the corridor.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r507","rowIndex":507,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　廊下は消灯しており、非常灯の緑色の明かりだけが頼りだった。それでも、一つの目をギロギロとこらせば血を辿ってゆくことが出来る。","en":"The corridor lights had been extinguished, leaving only the green glow of the emergency lamps. Even so, by straining his one remaining eye, he could follow the blood.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r508","rowIndex":508,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　血の跡は裏口の方へ続いており、それを追って歩く。全裸に近いエミールの足の裏がひたひたと音を立てる。","en":"The trail continued toward the rear exit, and he followed it. The bare feet of the nearly naked Emil slapped softly against the floor.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r509","rowIndex":509,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして扉を開いた。ドアの外の地面はコンクリートで舗装されており、月明かりで黒い血液の雫が見える。しかし、そこからどの方向を見ても、血の痕跡を見つけることが出来ない。","en":"He opened the door. The ground outside was paved with concrete, and the moonlight revealed drops of black blood. But whichever way he looked, he could find no blood trail beyond that point.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r510","rowIndex":510,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　困っていると、","en":"As he stood at a loss,","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r511","rowIndex":511,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"『中だ。建物の中に戻ったんだ。すぐに引き返せ』","en":"“Inside. She went back inside the building. Turn around at once.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r512","rowIndex":512,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　頭のなかで<tips=65>ヘス</tips>の言葉が響き、エミールも今回はそれに従った。","en":"<tips=65>Hess’s</tips> words echoed within his head, and this time Emil obeyed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r513","rowIndex":513,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　床を見ながら戻ると、確かに血の跡が途中で分岐しているのに気づく。","en":"Watching the floor as he retraced his steps, he saw that the blood trail did indeed branch off midway.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r514","rowIndex":514,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　廊下の左右にはいくつかのドアがならんでおり、そのうちひとつのドアの前にも血が落ちている。おそらく相手は一旦裏口まで行った後、戻って来てこの部屋に入ったのだ。ドアの上には職員室と書かれたプレートがかかっているが、彼には日本語が読めなかった。","en":"Several doors lined both sides of the corridor, and drops of blood lay before one of them. His opponent had probably gone as far as the rear exit, then doubled back and entered this room. A plaque above the door bore the Japanese characters for “Staff Room,” but he could not read them.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r515","rowIndex":515,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"『部屋の中へ入るな。ここで脅せ。出て来なければ子供を殺すと叫ぶんだ』","en":"“Do not go into the room. Threaten her from here. Shout that if she refuses to come out, you will kill the children.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r516","rowIndex":516,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　日本語が喋れないエミールに英語でそう言うよう<tips=65>ヘス</tips>は伝えた。","en":"<tips=65>Hess</tips> told him to say the words in English, since Emil could not speak Japanese.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r517","rowIndex":517,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しかし、怒り狂ったエミールはその言葉を守らなかった。","en":"But Emil, crazed with anger, did not obey.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r518","rowIndex":518,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　丸太のような足を振り上げ、ドアを蹴破る。鍵のかけられた引き戸は中央で二つに折れて吹っ飛ぶと、奥に並んだ机をなぎ倒して盛大な音を立てた。","en":"He raised a leg as thick as a log and kicked the door in. The locked sliding door snapped in half and flew inward, mowing down the desks beyond it with a tremendous crash.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r519","rowIndex":519,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　部屋のなかは廊下よりもさらに暗い。","en":"The room was darker still than the corridor.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r520","rowIndex":520,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　エミールは恐れずそのなかへ足を踏み入れた。","en":"Emil entered without fear.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r521","rowIndex":521,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そこで待ち構えていた<tips=55>松子</tips>が襲い掛かる。","en":"<tips=55>Matsuko</tips>, lying in wait, sprang at him.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r522","rowIndex":522,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女は入り口のそばの棚の上に潜んでいて、彼が部屋に足を踏み入れると同時に頭上から飛び降りたのだ。","en":"She had concealed herself atop a shelf beside the entrance and jumped down from above the moment he stepped inside.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r523","rowIndex":523,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その右手には白い布で包丁を縛り付けている。包丁は、職員室の奥の給湯室に常備されたものだった。普段、誰かが持って来た果物やお菓子を切り分けるために使われているそのセラミックの白い刃を振りかざし、エミールの首もとに向かって体重を込めて振り下ろす。","en":"A white cloth bound a kitchen knife to her right hand. The knife was ordinarily kept in the kitchenette at the back of the staff room, where it was used to cut up fruit or sweets someone had brought in. Raising its white ceramic blade, Matsuko drove it toward Emil’s neck with all her weight.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r524","rowIndex":524,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　これが<tips=55>松子</tips>の命を賭けた一撃だった。首筋に鋭い刃が突き刺されば大量の出血は免れることが出来ず、松子と相手との体力差を埋めるだろう。そうして戦闘不能にしたら、相手の持ち物を探れば、きっと注射器が見つかるはずだ。かつて<tips=18>ローズ・クラブ</tips>で三日月の女たちを殺すために使った薬が。<tips=55>松子</tips>に使うために用意したその薬を、逆に<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>に使ってやるのだ。そうすれば、彼は二度と復活しない。","en":"This was the blow on which <tips=55>Matsuko</tips> staked her life. If the sharp blade sank into his neck, massive blood loss would be unavoidable, offsetting the disparity in strength between her and her opponent. Once she had incapacitated him, a search of his belongings ought to turn up a syringe containing the drug once used to kill the Crescent women at <tips=18>Rose Club</tips>. She would use against <tips=20>Koschei</tips> the very drug he had prepared for <tips=55>Matsuko</tips>. Then he would never come back to life.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r525","rowIndex":525,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　これが<tips=55>松子</tips>のプランだった。","en":"That was <tips=55>Matsuko's</tips> plan.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r526","rowIndex":526,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しかし、エミールの人間離れした反応能力の前にはその完全な不意打ちさえも通用しなかった。","en":"Yet even an attack that caught him completely unawares was no match for Emil’s inhuman reflexes.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r527","rowIndex":527,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼は巨体に見合わぬ素早さでうしろに飛び退く。包丁の刃はどこかの肉を切り裂き、血が飛び散ったが、到底致命傷というには及ばなかった。","en":"With speed that belied his huge body, he leaped backward. The blade cut into flesh somewhere and sent blood flying, but the wound was far from fatal.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r528","rowIndex":528,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　エミールは職員室の闇の中に姿勢を低くして自分を襲ってきた相手を見据える。廊下から差し込む緑の光の下に、白い包丁を持って無表情にこちらを見る<tips=55>松子</tips>の姿があった。折れた方の腕はだらりと下げられている。","en":"Emil crouched low in the darkness of the staff room and fixed his gaze on his attacker. Beneath the green light spilling in from the corridor stood <tips=55>Matsuko</tips>, staring back without expression, a white knife in her hand. Her broken arm hung limply at her side.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r529","rowIndex":529,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　最初の襲撃に失敗したが、彼女は冷静だった。感情がないと言われていた子供の頃とまったく同じ表情だった。","en":"Her first attack had failed, but she remained calm. It was exactly the expression she had worn as a child, when others said she possessed no emotion.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r530","rowIndex":530,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　エミールが一息つく間も与えず、すぐに飛びかかった。身体ごと包丁を突き出す。しかしその刃はエミールに届かない。","en":"Without allowing Emil even a breath, Matsuko lunged again, thrusting the knife with her entire body. The blade never reached him.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r531","rowIndex":531,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　素早さにおいて圧倒的な差があった。","en":"The difference in their speed was overwhelming.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r532","rowIndex":532,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　エミールの手は<tips=55>松子</tips>に見えないほどの早さで、包丁を握る手首を握った。","en":"Emil's hand moved too quickly for <tips=55>Matsuko</tips> to see as it seized the wrist holding the knife.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r533","rowIndex":533,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして次の瞬間にはくるりと捻られて、手首と肘からバキバキと骨の折れる音がした。","en":"In the next instant he twisted it sharply, and bones cracked in her wrist and elbow.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r534","rowIndex":534,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=55>松子</tips>はそれでも怯まない。頭突きの要領で頭をエミールに突き出そうとしたが、その動きも彼に咎められる。","en":"Even then <tips=55>Matsuko</tips> did not flinch. She tried to drive her head into Emil in a headbutt, but he stopped that attack as well.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r535","rowIndex":535,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼のもう片方の手が、<tips=55>松子</tips>の白い喉を正面から掴んだ。","en":"His other hand closed around <tips=55>Matsuko’s</tips> pale throat from the front.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r536","rowIndex":536,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ぐっ……」","en":"“Ggh...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r537","rowIndex":537,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=55>松子</tips>の口から声が漏れる。","en":"A strangled sound escaped <tips=55>Matsuko’s</tips> lips.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r538","rowIndex":538,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その顔はやはり無表情で、恐怖も絶望も感じてはいないようだった。","en":"Her face remained expressionless. She appeared to feel neither fear nor despair.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r539","rowIndex":539,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　エミールは首を掴んで振り回すと側面の壁に<tips=55>松子</tips>の身体をドンと押しつけてその動きを制限すると、もう片方の手で髪の毛を掴み、手前に強く引いた。","en":"Emil seized her by the neck and swung her around, slamming <tips=55>Matsuko</tips> against the wall beside them to pin her in place. With his other hand, he grabbed her hair and yanked it hard toward himself.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r540","rowIndex":540,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ゴキッと音がして<tips=55>松子</tips>の頸椎が砕ける。そして手足がビクリと動き、そのあと静かになった。","en":"There was a hard crack as <tips=55>Matsuko’s</tips> cervical vertebrae shattered. Her limbs jerked once, then fell still.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r541","rowIndex":541,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　エミールはそうして髪の毛を掴んだまま頭をグリグリと回す。首の骨が完全に砕けて皮だけで繋がっている頭部はなんの抵抗もなく、手を離すとだらりとあり得ない形にぶら下がった。","en":"Still gripping her hair, Emil wrenched her head around and around. With the bones of her neck completely shattered and her head attached only by skin, it offered no resistance. When he let go, it sagged at an impossible angle.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r542","rowIndex":542,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その目は見開かれ、半開きになった唇の間から唾液が糸を引いて落ちる。","en":"Her eyes stared wide, and a thread of saliva trailed from between her half-parted lips.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r543","rowIndex":543,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　首を押さえた手も離すと、糸の切れた操り人形のように<tips=55>松子</tips>の身体は床の上に崩れ落ちた。","en":"When he released her throat as well, <tips=55>Matsuko</tips> collapsed onto the floor like a puppet whose strings had been cut.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r544","rowIndex":544,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　完全に息がないのを確認すると、エミールはその身体を肩に担いで応接室に戻った。","en":"After confirming that she was no longer breathing, Emil lifted the body onto his shoulder and returned to the reception room.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r545","rowIndex":545,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして、破れた衣服のなかから『<tips=46>ネオ・ローズ</tips>』の薬液が入った注射器を取り出すと、<tips=55>松子</tips>の身体に針を突き刺した。","en":"From among his torn clothes, he removed a syringe filled with a <tips=46>Neo Rose</tips> solution and drove the needle into <tips=55>Matsuko’s</tips> body.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r546","rowIndex":546,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そのあとズボンと下着を脱がし、だらりと力のない足を掴んで<tips=55>松子</tips>の股を開かせる。","en":"Afterward, he stripped off her trousers and underwear, took hold of her limp legs, and spread <tips=55>Matsuko's</tips> thighs.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r547","rowIndex":547,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それから三十分後。部屋は完全に静寂を取り戻し、タナベがおそるおそる戻ってくる。","en":"Thirty minutes later, the room had fallen completely silent, and Tanabe cautiously returned.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r548","rowIndex":548,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女は武器のつもりか、手に金属バットを構えている。ぶるぶる肩をふるわせながら、怯える顏つきであたりを見回すと、変わり果てた<tips=55>松子</tips>の姿を見つけた。","en":"Perhaps intending it as a weapon, she held a metal bat at the ready. Shoulders trembling, she looked around fearfully—and saw what had become of <tips=55>Matsuko</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r549","rowIndex":549,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　タナベがかけより揺さぶったが、<tips=55>松子</tips>はもう動かない。完全に冷たくなったその身体にすがりつき、声を立てて泣いた。","en":"Tanabe rushed over and shook her, but <tips=55>Matsuko</tips> no longer moved. She clung to the stone-cold body and sobbed aloud.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r550","rowIndex":550,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ひとしきり泣き、そしてまたバットを握って立ち上がったところで彼女は背後に物音を聞いた。","en":"After weeping for some time, she gripped the bat and stood again. Then she heard a sound behind her.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r551","rowIndex":551,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　さっきの大男が戻ってきたのかと思い、彼女は全身を固くする。","en":"Thinking the huge man had returned, her whole body went rigid.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r552","rowIndex":552,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しかし今は恐怖よりも怒りの方が上回っていた。","en":"But now her anger outweighed her fear.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r553","rowIndex":553,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　バットを振りかぶりながら振り返ると、そこには想像と違った人物がいた。","en":"She raised the bat and turned. Someone entirely different stood there.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r554","rowIndex":554,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　相手は一人ではなかった。姿形が全く同じ二人の少女が入り口のそばに立っている。","en":"The newcomer was not alone. Two girls identical in appearance stood near the entrance.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r555","rowIndex":555,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「何もする気はないわ」","en":"“We have no intention of doing anything to you.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"灰上璃映子","displayName":"Rieko Haigami","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r556","rowIndex":556,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「その死体を見せて」","en":"“Show us the corpse.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"灰上江梨子","displayName":"Eriko Haigami","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r557","rowIndex":557,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　二人は交互にそう言った。","en":"They spoke in turn.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r558","rowIndex":558,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女たちは張り詰めた表情をしているが、敵意は感じられない。タナベはその静かな口調に促されて、彼女たちのために道を空けた。","en":"Their faces were taut, but Tanabe sensed no hostility. Prompted by their quiet voices, she moved aside for them.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r559","rowIndex":559,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ありがとう」","en":"“Thank you.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"灰上璃映子","displayName":"Rieko Haigami","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r560","rowIndex":560,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ありがとう」","en":"“Thank you.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"灰上江梨子","displayName":"Eriko Haigami","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r561","rowIndex":561,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　二人は軽く頭を下げると、<tips=55>松子</tips>に近づく。","en":"The two bowed their heads slightly and approached <tips=55>Matsuko</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r562","rowIndex":562,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして二人は両腕が折れ、顔は腫れ上がり、身体のあちこちはガラスが突き刺さって血みどろになり、下半身の衣服は脱がされている無惨なその遺体を見た。","en":"They looked upon the mutilated body: both arms broken, the face swollen, glass embedded throughout the blood-soaked flesh, and the clothing removed from the lower body.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r563","rowIndex":563,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　手を伸ばし、その首のあたりに触れる。","en":"They reached out and touched her neck.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r564","rowIndex":564,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「冷たいね」","en":"“She’s cold.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"灰上璃映子","displayName":"Rieko Haigami","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r565","rowIndex":565,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「冷たい」","en":"“Cold.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"灰上江梨子","displayName":"Eriko Haigami","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r566","rowIndex":566,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=86>双子</tips>は小さな声で囁きあう。","en":"<tips=86>The twins</tips> whispered softly to each other.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r567","rowIndex":567,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして、二人の目からは同時に大粒の涙がぽろぽろと落ち、彼女たちはそれを袖で拭った。","en":"Large tears spilled from both girls’ eyes at once, and they wiped them away with their sleeves.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r568","rowIndex":568,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あなたたち、なんなの？」","en":"“Who are you two?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r569","rowIndex":569,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　タナベはまだバットを構えたまま二人にそう尋ねる。","en":"Tanabe asked the pair, still holding the bat at the ready.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r570","rowIndex":570,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　二人はゆっくりとタナベを振り返った。","en":"The two slowly turned toward her.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r571","rowIndex":571,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「私たちは何者でもないわ」","en":"“We are no one.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"灰上璃映子","displayName":"Rieko Haigami","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r572","rowIndex":572,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　一人がそう言い、","en":"One of them said.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r573","rowIndex":573,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「この子とは友だちだったの」","en":"“I used to be friends with this girl.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"灰上江梨子","displayName":"Eriko Haigami","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X14:r574","rowIndex":574,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　もう一人がそう言った。","en":"The other said.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}}]},{"position":42,"code":"B3-1","unitId":"B3-1","rows":[{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-1:r1","rowIndex":1,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　良い天気ってわけじゃないが、雨が降ってるわけでもない。","en":"It was not what anyone would call fine weather, but at least it was not raining.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-1:r2","rowIndex":2,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　こんなに低い雲が垂れ込めていては気持ち晴れやかにとはいかないが、これくらいの空模様ならばまあよしとしなければいけないのは、天気も人生も同じだ。","en":"With clouds hanging this low, there was little chance of feeling cheerful. Still, in weather as in life, one sometimes had to accept things when they were no worse than this.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-1:r3","rowIndex":3,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おれは朝早く起きると自転車に乗って、その日出来たばかりの饅頭を店に届けに行く。ついに完成した<tips=71>グレートホール饅頭</tips>はなかなか好評で、知り合いのいくつかの店が棚においてくれることになった。店頭でもそこそこ売れてくれているらしい。","en":"I rose early that morning, got on my bicycle, and delivered the day’s freshly made buns to the shops. At last, the finished <tips=71>Great Hole Buns</tips> were proving quite popular. Several stores run by people I knew had agreed to give them shelf space, and apparently they were selling reasonably well.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-1:r4","rowIndex":4,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　まだ大ヒット商品というわけにはいかないけれど、なかなか順調だと思わないか？　このまま売り上げが伸びれば、もっと従業員も雇えるようになるし、生産体制も強化出来る。人を増やすときは、なるべく他で雇ってはもらえなさそうな<tips=17>タイプB</tips>を選んで雇うって決めてるんだ。そしたらおれは念願の『社長』を名乗れるだろう。","en":"They were not a smash hit yet, but don’t you think things were going well? If sales kept growing, I could hire more employees and strengthen our production system. I had already decided that when I expanded the staff, I would give preference to <tips=17>Type Bs</tips> who were unlikely to find work anywhere else. Then at last I could claim my long-coveted title of ‘president.’","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-1:r5","rowIndex":5,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　『<tips=10>見土</tips>社長』――ああ、なんて甘美な響きだ！","en":"‘President <tips=10>Mido</tips>’... Ah, what a delicious sound!","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-1:r6","rowIndex":6,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　といっても、今はやっと売り上げだけで従業員の給料が払えるようになって来たって段階なんだけれどね。でもそれでも、最低限遊びじゃなくて仕事だと言えるスタートラインには立てた気がするよ。","en":"Admittedly, we had only just reached the point where sales alone could cover our employees’ wages. Even so, I felt we had at least reached the starting line, where I could call this work rather than play.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-1:r7","rowIndex":7,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　少しずつでもいいから、とにかくこのままだ。このまま売り上げを伸ばし続けないと。","en":"A little at a time was fine. We just had to keep this up—keep our sales growing.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-1:r8","rowIndex":8,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　さて、そうして一通りの配達が終わって工場、と呼ぶにはちょっと大げさな気がするようなこぢんまりとしたおれたちのアジトに帰って来ると、ちょうど<tips=66>コンタ</tips>が出て来たところで、路上で出くわすこととなった。","en":"Once I finished my rounds, I returned to our little hideout—calling it a factory still felt somewhat grandiose—and happened to meet <tips=66>Konta</tips> just as he came out into the street.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-1:r9","rowIndex":9,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=10>道夫</tips>君」","en":"“<tips=10>Michio</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"田中紺太","displayName":"Konta Tanaka","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-1:r10","rowIndex":10,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おやと思ったのは、なんだか切迫した顔つきで、喋り方も焦っている感じだったからだ。","en":"What made me pause was the urgency in his expression and the flustered edge to his voice.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-1:r11","rowIndex":11,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　仲間がこういう顔をしているとドキッとする。","en":"Seeing one of our own with a look like that always gave me a jolt.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-1:r12","rowIndex":12,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　我々<tips=17>タイプB</tips>にはいつ何時どんなトラブルが発生するかわからないし、しかも現在は爺さんたちが何か陰謀を張り巡らしている。おれたちの店の人間は全員<tips=17>タイプB</tips>で、そして<tips=21>八龍会</tips>の所属だ。それこそ、考え得る限りどんな最低のアクシデントが発生してもおかしくない。","en":"For us <tips=17>Type Bs</tips>, any kind of trouble could strike at any time. Worse, the Elders were busy weaving some sort of conspiracy. Everyone at our shop was <tips=17>Type B</tips>, and every one of us belonged to the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips>. There was no catastrophe so appalling that we could safely rule it out.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-1:r13","rowIndex":13,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どうしたんだい？　血相を変えて」","en":"“What is it? Why the panic?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-1:r14","rowIndex":14,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　こういうときは落ち着かせるのがおれの役目だ。","en":"At moments like this, it was my job to calm him down.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-1:r15","rowIndex":15,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ゆったりと微笑してみせて、彼の肩をぽんと叩く。","en":"I gave him an easy smile and clapped him on the shoulder.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-1:r16","rowIndex":16,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「レナちゃんが、キちゃったみたいなんだ」","en":"“Looks like Rena’s been Hit.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"田中紺太","displayName":"Konta Tanaka","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-1:r17","rowIndex":17,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「レナが？」","en":"“Rena?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-1:r18","rowIndex":18,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それは我々の仲間である十九才のシングルマザーで、飲食店のウェイトレスとかけもちで働いてくれている。","en":"She was one of our companions, a nineteen-year-old single mother who worked for us while also waiting tables at a restaurant.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-1:r19","rowIndex":19,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　元々<tips=13>溝平B団地</tips>に住んでいた子だが、十六才のときに子供を連れて街中に引っ越している。","en":"She had originally lived in the <tips=13>Mizohira B Housing Complex</tips>, but at sixteen she moved into the city with her child.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-1:r20","rowIndex":20,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「向こうの店で働いてる時にキたんだよ。工場の固定回線に向こうの店長さんから電話があった」","en":"“She got Hit while she was working at the other place. Their manager called us on the factory landline.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"田中紺太","displayName":"Konta Tanaka","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-1:r21","rowIndex":21,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=66>コンタ</tips>がキちゃっただの、キただのと言っているのは、つまり<tips=17>タイプB</tips>の症状が発露して異常な行動をとってしまったということだ。","en":"When <tips=66>Konta</tips> said that someone had “gotten Hit,” or that it had “Hit” them, he meant that their <tips=17>Type B</tips> symptoms had manifested and caused them to behave abnormally.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-1:r22","rowIndex":22,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　直接的な表現を避けるために、昔からこういう言い方でそれを表現している。","en":"This was how it had always been expressed when people wanted to avoid saying it directly.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-1:r23","rowIndex":23,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうか」","en":"“I see.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-1:r24","rowIndex":24,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　レナはもう去年に発症自体はしており、病院に通って幻覚や幻聴を消す薬を飲みながら生活をしていた。","en":"Rena had already suffered her onset the previous year. Since then, she had been living on medication from the hospital to suppress her auditory and visual hallucinations.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-1:r25","rowIndex":25,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　もちろんそれは症状を和らげるためのもので、それによって回復するわけじゃない。だから、さらに悪化、進行してそれが効かなくなったんだ。","en":"The medicine could only ease the symptoms; it could not make her recover. Her condition had progressed still further, until the drugs no longer worked.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-1:r26","rowIndex":26,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「病院に行くつもり？」","en":"“Are you taking her to the hospital?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-1:r27","rowIndex":27,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「もう病院には行った後なんだって。保険にも入ってないし、もし入院となったら治療費が払えないから、注射だけしてもらって自宅に帰って来たんだ。店の人たちが送り届けてくれたんだけど、彼らも店に戻らなくちゃいけないから、これからおれがバトンタッチしようかと」","en":"“Apparently she’s already been to the hospital. She doesn’t have insurance, and if they admitted her, she couldn’t pay the bill. So all they did was give her an injection, and then she came home. The people from the restaurant brought her back, but they have to return to work, so I’m about to take over from them.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"田中紺太","displayName":"Konta Tanaka","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-1:r28","rowIndex":28,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　レナは小さな娘と二人暮らしだ。付き添ってくれた店の人が帰ったら、錯乱した母親と幼い娘の二人きりになる。それを避けるために、<tips=66>コンタ</tips>が手助けに行くと言うんだ。","en":"Rena lived alone with her young daughter. Once the restaurant staff who had stayed with her left, the delirious mother and her little girl would be alone together. To prevent that, <tips=66>Konta</tips> said he was going over to help.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-1:r29","rowIndex":29,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「わかった。じゃあ、おれも行こう」","en":"“All right. I’ll come too.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-1:r30","rowIndex":30,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　自転車の後ろに<tips=66>コンタ</tips>を乗せて、おれたちはレナの家へ向かった。","en":"With <tips=66>Konta</tips> riding on the back of my bicycle, we set off for Rena’s home.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-1:r31","rowIndex":31,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「こんなのよく有ることだけどさ。やっぱり、自分たちより年下が先に悪くなっちゃうと、気持ちが暗くなっちゃうよね」","en":"“This sort of thing happens all the time, but it still gets you down when someone younger than us gets worse before we do.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"田中紺太","displayName":"Konta Tanaka","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-1:r32","rowIndex":32,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　後ろの<tips=66>コンタ</tips>の言葉には、まったくおれも同感だ。","en":"I could not have agreed more with <tips=66>Konta</tips>, sitting behind me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-1:r33","rowIndex":33,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　でも、おれたちの気持ちが暗くなったって仕方がないからね。","en":"But there was nothing to be gained by letting it get us down.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-1:r34","rowIndex":34,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それに、<tips=17>タイプB</tips>の症状ってのは、強いストレスや暗く抑圧された感情に誘発されやすいんだ。だから、おれたちはいつだって明るく、楽しく、夢をみていかなくちゃいけない。だから、みんなをそういう気持ちにさせてやりたいんだおれは。","en":"Besides, <tips=17>Type B</tips> symptoms were easily triggered by severe stress and dark, suppressed emotions. That was why we always had to keep cheerful, enjoy ourselves, and go on dreaming. I wanted to help everyone else feel that way too.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-1:r35","rowIndex":35,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　レナの家に上がり込むと、彼女はベッドに縛り付けられていた。両手両足は大の字に広げられてベッド柵にロープで結びつけられている。","en":"When we entered Rena’s apartment, we found her tied to the bed. She lay spread-eagled, her wrists and ankles bound to the bed rails with rope.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-1:r36","rowIndex":36,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　この街では暴れて手がつけられなくなった<tips=17>タイプB</tips>発症者によくやる措置だ。本当は体幹も固定した方がより安全なのだが、間に合わなかったのだろう。","en":"This was a common measure in the city for restraining <tips=17>Type Bs</tips> who had grown violent and uncontrollable. It would have been safer to immobilize her torso as well, but there had probably been no time.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-1:r37","rowIndex":37,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　付き添ってくれた二人の男性店員も<tips=9>Y地区</tips>の出身で、身内に<tips=17>タイプB</tips>がいて扱いに慣れているのだと言う。","en":"The two male restaurant employees who had accompanied her were also from <tips=9>Y District</tips>. They told us they had <tips=17>Type Bs</tips> in their own families and were accustomed to handling such situations.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-1:r38","rowIndex":38,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いやあ、ここに来るまでは大人しかったんですけど、部屋に入った途端スイッチがはいったみたいに暴れましてね。いまは、薬が効いたのかすこし大人しくなりました」","en":"“She was quiet enough until we got here. The moment we stepped into the room, though, it was as if someone flipped a switch. She went wild. Maybe the medicine’s finally doing something, because she’s calmed down a little now.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-1:r39","rowIndex":39,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そう笑った店員の腕にはひっかき傷が出来ていた。押さえつけるときに傷つけられたに違いない。","en":"The employee laughed as he spoke, though there were scratches on his arm. Rena must have given them to him when they pinned her down.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-1:r40","rowIndex":40,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして部屋も、その格闘を物語るように、棚が倒れて小物が床に散らかり、カーテンが引っ張られたのか、半分レールから外れてぶらさがっている。","en":"The room testified to the struggle. A shelf had fallen, scattering small objects across the floor, and a curtain hung loose with half of it torn from the rail.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-1:r41","rowIndex":41,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　レナ本人はじっと天井を見つめたまま、口元で独り言をブツブツとつぶやき、そして時々「あっははは」と声を立てて笑った。典型的な<tips=17>タイプB</tips>の症状が出ている。","en":"Rena stared fixedly at the ceiling, muttering under her breath and occasionally bursting into a loud “Ah-ha-ha-ha.” She was displaying the classic symptoms of a <tips=17>Type B</tips> episode.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-1:r42","rowIndex":42,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「じゃあすいませんけど、帰ります。三人もシフトから抜けちゃってるから、店がきっとメチャクチャになってるんで」","en":"“Sorry, but we’d better get back. Three of us left the shift, so the restaurant must be in chaos by now.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-1:r43","rowIndex":43,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あ、ありがとうございます！」","en":"“Oh, thank you very much!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-1:r44","rowIndex":44,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　部屋を出て行こうとするふたりの店員におれは腰を折って頭を下げた。","en":"I bent deeply at the waist and bowed to the two employees as they made for the door.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-1:r45","rowIndex":45,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いえ。レナちゃんを、よろしくお願いしますね」","en":"“It’s nothing. Please take care of Rena for us.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-1:r46","rowIndex":46,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　店員たちはさわやかに笑いながら出て行く。","en":"They smiled cheerfully and left.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-1:r47","rowIndex":47,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=10>道夫</tips>君、このレナなんだけどさ……」","en":"“<tips=10>Michio</tips>, about Rena...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-1:r48","rowIndex":48,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ちょっと、その前に」","en":"“Wait. Before that.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-1:r49","rowIndex":49,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　言いかける<tips=66>コンタ</tips>を遮って、おれは部屋の隅の方で膝小僧を抱えている少女の前に座り込んだ。","en":"Cutting <tips=66>Konta</tips> off as he began to speak, I sat down in front of the little girl huddled in a corner with her knees drawn to her chest.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-1:r50","rowIndex":50,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　レナが十四才で生んだその子供は、今年で五才になった。髪の毛はモジャモジャの天然パーマで、肌は浅黒い。それらの特徴は母のレナにはなく、今はどこにいるのか誰も知らない父から受け継いだのだろう。","en":"Rena had given birth to her at fourteen, and the child was now five. Her hair was a mass of natural curls, and her skin was a dusky brown. Rena possessed neither trait; the girl had presumably inherited them from her father, though no one knew where he was now.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-1:r51","rowIndex":51,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女の肩は小さく震えている。母親の変貌に怯えているんだ。","en":"The girl’s little shoulders trembled. Her mother’s transformation had terrified her.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-1:r52","rowIndex":52,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女の服は清潔で、髪の毛からはシャンプーの良い匂いがする。部屋のあちこちには、数字やひらがな、アルファベットを学ぶための張り紙がしてある。部屋のいろんなものに、子供が好みそうなこまごまとした飾り付けがされている。","en":"Her clothes were clean, and her hair smelled pleasantly of shampoo. Sheets for learning numbers, hiragana, and the alphabet were posted throughout the room. All around her, the furnishings had been adorned with the sort of small, cheerful decorations a child would love.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-1:r53","rowIndex":53,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　仕事に行く前、そう、ほんの数時間前までのレナは、やさしくて子供の面倒を良く見る素晴らしい母親だったんだ。","en":"Before she left for work—yes, until only a few hours ago—Rena had been a wonderful mother, kind and attentive to her child.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-1:r54","rowIndex":54,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女がどれだけ大事に娘を育てていたのかは、おれたちもよく知っている。","en":"We knew very well how dearly she had cherished her daughter.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-1:r55","rowIndex":55,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それが、今は完全な別人になってしまった。","en":"But now she had become a completely different person.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-1:r56","rowIndex":56,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おれはしゃがみこんで娘の頭に手を置いた。彼女はびくりと驚き、ゆっくり顔をあげて警戒の目でおれを見る。その目のまわりには、黒い痣が出来、顔中が涙で濡れていた。","en":"I crouched down and placed a hand upon the girl’s head. She gave a frightened start, then slowly raised her face and looked at me warily. A black bruise ringed one eye, and tears had soaked her entire face.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-1:r57","rowIndex":57,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　これもレナがやったのか？　だとすれば、生まれて初めて母親に殴られたに違いない。","en":"Had Rena done this too? If so, this must have been the first time in the child’s life that her mother had struck her.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-1:r58","rowIndex":58,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　胸が痛くなる。おれはとりわけ子供とか老人には弱いんだ。","en":"My heart ached. I had a particular soft spot for children and old people.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-1:r59","rowIndex":59,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おれはその頭をなでてやりながら、","en":"Stroking her head, I asked,","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-1:r60","rowIndex":60,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「大変だったね。おれのことは覚えてる？」","en":"“That was awful, wasn’t it? Do you remember me?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-1:r61","rowIndex":61,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　すると彼女は頷き、","en":"She nodded.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-1:r62","rowIndex":62,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「みっちゃん」","en":"“Mitchan.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-1:r63","rowIndex":63,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　震える唇で言った。","en":"She spoke through trembling lips.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-1:r64","rowIndex":64,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いやあ、こんな美人に名前を覚えて貰えて嬉しいよ」","en":"“Well, I’m honored that such a beautiful lady remembers my name.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-1:r65","rowIndex":65,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　さすがに、こんな冗談では今の彼女はクスリともしない。","en":"Even that joke could not coax the smallest smile from her now.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-1:r66","rowIndex":66,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「今日は大変だったね。怖かったでしょう？」","en":"“Today was hard, wasn’t it? Were you scared?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-1:r67","rowIndex":67,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おれの言葉に彼女はゆっくり首を横にふる。","en":"She slowly shook her head.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-1:r68","rowIndex":68,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「こわくない……。おかあさんのことすきだから、ぜんせんこわくないの……」","en":"“I’m not scared... I love Mommy, so I’m not scared at all...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-1:r69","rowIndex":69,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ああ、もうなんて素晴らしいことを言う子供なんだろう！　こんな言葉を聞くと、いつだって涙が出てしまいそうになる。","en":"Oh, what a wonderful thing for a child to say! Hearing words like that always brought me to the verge of tears.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-1:r70","rowIndex":70,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうだね。おれたちも、おかあさんのこと好きだから、平気だよ」","en":"“That’s right. We love your mommy too, so everything will be all right.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-1:r71","rowIndex":71,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おれはくしゃっと彼女の頭を撫でると、","en":"I tousled her hair affectionately.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-1:r72","rowIndex":72,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「じゃあ、今日きみはたくさん頑張ったから、向こうの部屋で休んでよう。お母さんのことは、みっちゃんたちが見てるから心配しないでいいよ」","en":"“You’ve been very brave today, so go rest in the other room. Mitchan and the others will look after your mommy. You don’t have to worry.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-1:r73","rowIndex":73,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そしておれはその子を隣の部屋につれてゆく。寂しくないように棚から玩具や絵本を取り出して彼女の前に並べ、そして部屋に戻ってきた。","en":"I took her into the next room, arranged toys and picture books from the shelves before her so that she would not feel lonely, and returned.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-1:r74","rowIndex":74,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　一人で残すのは心配ではあったが、それ以上に今の母親を見せたくはなかった。","en":"I was worried about leaving her alone, but more than that, I did not want her seeing her mother in this state.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-1:r75","rowIndex":75,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして、これからは大人の時間だ。","en":"Now it was time for the grown-ups to talk.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-1:r76","rowIndex":76,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「状態はどうだい？」","en":"“How is she?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-1:r77","rowIndex":77,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ベッドの側でレナと何か会話をしていた<tips=66>コンタ</tips>に尋ねると、彼は難しい顔で首を横に振る。","en":"<tips=66>Konta</tips> had been trying to speak with Rena beside the bed. When I asked, he shook his head grimly.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-1:r78","rowIndex":78,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「反応はあるけど、会話は成立しない」","en":"“She responds, but I can’t get a conversation going.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-1:r79","rowIndex":79,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうか」","en":"“I see.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-1:r80","rowIndex":80,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　言いながらおれも近づき、彼女の様子を見る。","en":"As I answered, I went closer to see how she was doing for myself.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-1:r81","rowIndex":81,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　レナは汗をかき、額に前髪がはりついていた。美人という感じではないが、ほっそりして愛嬌のある顔立ちをしており、みんなに好かれている。","en":"Rena was sweating, her bangs plastered to her forehead. She was not what one would call beautiful, but her face was fine-boned and engaging, and everyone liked her.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-1:r82","rowIndex":82,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　普段は真っ黒なその瞳はぎらぎらとした金色に輝き、落ち着きなくぴくぴくと眼球が動いていた。","en":"Her ordinarily black irises now shone a glaring gold, and her eyes darted restlessly from side to side.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-1:r83","rowIndex":83,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そしておれの顔を認めると、","en":"When she recognized my face,","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-1:r84","rowIndex":84,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ああ、みっちゃんじゃない！　こんにちは！」","en":"“Oh, it’s Mitchan! Hello!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-1:r85","rowIndex":85,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　普段の彼女ではありえない異常に高いテンションでそう言い、手を動かそうとしてロープがピンと張り、柵とベッドを止めている金具がガシャッと音を立てる。","en":"She said it with a feverish excitement utterly unlike her usual self, then tried to move her hand. The rope snapped taut, and the fitting securing the rail to the bed clattered.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-1:r86","rowIndex":86,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　さすがに凄い力だ。","en":"That was some incredible strength.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-1:r87","rowIndex":87,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女はそのロープの方を不思議そうに見る。","en":"She stared at the rope in puzzlement.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-1:r88","rowIndex":88,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「何だか知らないけど、これで縛られてるの。変でしょ？　とってくれない？」","en":"“I don’t know why, but I’m all tied up. Isn’t that strange? Will you take these off?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-1:r89","rowIndex":89,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女は子供みたいに唇をとがらせ、縛られた手を動かせる範囲で振る。あまりに強く動かしすぎて、ロープが触れた手首がすりむけている。本来は間にハンカチなどを挟ませていたようだが、それはもう落ちていた。","en":"She pouted like a child and waved her bound hand as far as the rope allowed. She had pulled so violently that the rope had rubbed her wrist raw. Someone appeared to have placed a handkerchief beneath it, but that had already fallen away.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-1:r90","rowIndex":90,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そう言うなよなー。これ、お前を保護するためにやってるんだぜ。落ち着いたらすぐとれるんだから」","en":"“Come on, don’t be like that. We only did this to protect you. We’ll take it off as soon as you calm down.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-1:r91","rowIndex":91,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おれはそう言いながら、ハンカチを元通りにしようとその腕に触れたが、","en":"As I spoke, I touched her arm to replace the handkerchief.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-1:r92","rowIndex":92,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「やめて！　さわらないで！」","en":"“Stop! Don’t touch me!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-1:r93","rowIndex":93,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女が体中をもの凄い力でよじって怒鳴り声を上げたので、おれは慌てて手を引っ込めた。","en":"She twisted with astonishing force and screamed, making me snatch my hand away.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-1:r94","rowIndex":94,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ごめんね、怒る気はなかったの。でもそれはいけないのよ。私は国に帰らなきゃけないんだから」","en":"“I’m sorry. I didn’t mean to be angry. But you mustn’t do that. I have to return to my country.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-1:r95","rowIndex":95,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「国？」","en":"“Your country?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-1:r96","rowIndex":96,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おれが言ったが、彼女はそれに反応を示さずに一方的に話を続ける。","en":"She gave no response to my question and continued talking at me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-1:r97","rowIndex":97,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いつまでこの生活が続くの？　私は姫なのに。どうして国に帰らせてくれないのかしら。私をこんなところに縛り付けて……」","en":"“How long is this life going to last? I’m a princess. Why won’t anyone let me return to my country? Keeping me tied up in a place like this...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-1:r98","rowIndex":98,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女は焦点の合わぬ目であらぬ方向を見つめて、つぶやき続けている。","en":"Her unfocused eyes stared into empty space while she continued to murmur.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-1:r99","rowIndex":99,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「嗚呼、本当にいやらしい！　あなた、きのうの夜私に乱暴したでしょ？　拒んだのに、何度も何度も……。そして嘘ばっかりついて……こんな不誠実な人、みたことがないわ」","en":"“Oh, you’re disgusting! You raped me last night, didn’t you? I refused, but you did it over and over... And all you ever do is lie... I’ve never met anyone so deceitful.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-1:r100","rowIndex":100,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　完全に精神が妄想に囚われてしまっている。","en":"Her mind was completely in the grip of delusion.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-1:r101","rowIndex":101,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　どうしてこんなに苦労人で、頑張ってる女の子がこんなに若く発症しなければいけないんだろう？","en":"Why did a girl who had endured so much and worked so hard have to suffer her onset at such a young age?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-1:r102","rowIndex":102,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「レナ」","en":"“Rena.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-1:r103","rowIndex":103,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=66>コンタ</tips>がそう呼びかけると、チラとこちらを見たが、またぶつぶつと一方的な妄想を語り、その合間には脈絡のない笑顔を浮かべる。","en":"When <tips=66>Konta</tips> called her name, she glanced toward us, then resumed her one-sided stream of delusion, now and then smiling for no discernible reason.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-1:r104","rowIndex":104,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「薬が効いていない」","en":"“The medicine isn’t working.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-1:r105","rowIndex":105,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=66>コンタ</tips>はそう溜息をついた。","en":"<tips=66>Konta</tips> sighed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-1:r106","rowIndex":106,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=10>道夫</tips>君、おれ今『<tips=46>ネオ</tips>』を持ってるんだ。こいつを使ってもいいか？」","en":"“<tips=10>Michio</tips>, I’ve got some ‘<tips=46>Neo</tips>’ with me. Can I use it on her?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-1:r107","rowIndex":107,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　真剣な顔をしている。おれが『<tips=46>ネオ・ローズ</tips>』に対して否定的なことを知っているからだ。","en":"His expression was serious. He knew how strongly I opposed ‘<tips=46>Neo Rose</tips>.’","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-1:r108","rowIndex":108,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「これじゃあどんな治療も効かないぜ。レナには身内がいないんだから、ほったらかしていたら親子共々のたれ死にだ。……それよりは『<tips=46>ネオ</tips>』を使ったほうがいいんじゃないか？」","en":"“With her like this, no treatment is going to work. Rena has no family to turn to, so if we leave her be, she and her daughter will both die in the gutter. ...Wouldn’t using ‘<tips=46>Neo</tips>’ be better than that?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-1:r109","rowIndex":109,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おれはすぐには答えられない。","en":"I could not answer at once.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-1:r110","rowIndex":110,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=66>コンタ</tips>の言っていることはわかる。でも、おれローズの件がどうしても頭をよぎるんだ。","en":"I understood <tips=66>Konta’s</tips> point. But no matter how I tried, I could not stop thinking about Rose.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-1:r111","rowIndex":111,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　あの時も<tips=17>タイプB</tips>の症状を改善することが出来ると、爆発的に流行ったが、その結果は到底「<tips=45>ローズ</tips>を使わないよりはマシ」とは言えない結果を招いた。","en":"That drug, too, had swept through the city on the promise that it could relieve <tips=17>Type B</tips> symptoms. Yet the outcome could hardly be called “better than going without <tips=45>Rose</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-1:r112","rowIndex":112,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その頃おれはガキだったが、街中を覆っていた異常な雰囲気は肌ではっきりと感じ取れた。","en":"I was only a child at the time, but I could feel in my very skin the unnatural atmosphere that hung over the whole city.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-1:r113","rowIndex":113,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「前のやつとは違うんだよ。もう使い始めて二ヶ月以上経つけど、なんのトラブルも出ていない。そりゃ、まだ早すぎるっていう<tips=10>道夫</tips>君の考えもわかるけど、安全だってはっきりわかるまでレナをこのままにしておけるのか？　娘はどうする？」","en":"“This isn’t the old drug. People have been using it for more than two months now without a single problem. ...I know you think that’s still much too soon, <tips=10>Michio</tips>. But can we leave Rena like this until we know for certain that it’s safe? What about her daughter?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-1:r114","rowIndex":114,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=66>コンタ</tips>も感情的になっていた。彼なりに仲間のことを心から思ってそう提言しているんだ。それはおれにもわかっている。","en":"<tips=66>Konta</tips> was becoming emotional. He was proposing this out of heartfelt concern for one of our own. I knew that.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-1:r115","rowIndex":115,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「わかった」","en":"“All right.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-1:r116","rowIndex":116,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おれが頷くと、<tips=66>コンタ</tips>はすぐに上着のポケットから道具を取り出し、注射の準備をはじめる。","en":"When I nodded, <tips=66>Konta</tips> immediately took his equipment from his jacket pocket and began preparing the injection.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-1:r117","rowIndex":117,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「静脈注射用のアンプルを使おう。落ち着いたら今夜にでもデポを打つ」","en":"“I’ll use an ampoule for intravenous injection. Once she’s calm, we’ll give her the depot formulation tonight.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-1:r118","rowIndex":118,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　アルバイトとして<tips=22>老人たち</tips>の下で『<tips=46>ネオ・ローズ</tips>』の販売を手伝っている<tips=66>コンタ</tips>が薬の種類に詳しいのは当然だろうが、元薬物中毒者なのでその手つきも慣れている。","en":"<tips=66>Konta</tips> helped the <tips=22>Elders</tips> sell <tips=46>Neo Rose</tips> as a part-time job, so naturally he knew its formulations. As a former drug addict, he was practiced in handling a needle as well.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-1:r119","rowIndex":119,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　アンプルはちょうどこけしの頭が尖ったようなガラス瓶である。","en":"The ampoule was a small glass vial shaped like a kokeshi doll with a pointed head.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-1:r120","rowIndex":120,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=66>コンタ</tips>はこれを片手で握り、まず軽く回して頭部にたまった薬液を身体の部分に落とす。次にアルコール綿でアンプル全体を拭いたあと、その綿をこけしの首の部分に指で押し当てつつ、もう片方の手でアンプルの頭を掴んで横に力を加える。","en":"<tips=66>Konta</tips> held it in one hand and gave it a light twirl, sending the liquid trapped in the head down into the body. Then he wiped the ampoule with an alcohol swab, pressed the cotton against the doll’s neck with one finger, grasped the head in his other hand, and bent it to the side.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-1:r121","rowIndex":121,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　パキリと音がしてこけしが首の部分で切断される。","en":"With a snap, the kokeshi broke at the neck.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-1:r122","rowIndex":122,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そのアンプルをテーブルの上に置くと、個別包装された使い捨ての針付き注射器を取り出し、開封する。","en":"He set the ampoule on the table, took out an individually wrapped disposable syringe with a needle attached, and opened the package.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-1:r123","rowIndex":123,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして注射針をアンプルに触れないよう首の部分から差し込み、ゆっくりと押子を引くと注射筒のなかに透明な薬液が吸い出されてゆく。","en":"Taking care not to touch the ampoule with the needle, he inserted it through the neck and slowly drew back the plunger. The clear liquid rose into the barrel.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-1:r124","rowIndex":124,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　薬液を吸い出したところで、注射器を上向きにして窓からの光に透かす。","en":"Once he had drawn up the medicine, he pointed the syringe upward and held it against the light from the window.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-1:r125","rowIndex":125,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　下の方に気泡が入っていたらしく、指先ではじいてそれを上に追い出す。その後で、ゆっくり押子を押し上げて注射筒上部にたまった空気をすべて吐き出させる。","en":"An air bubble appeared to have collected near the bottom. He flicked the barrel with a fingertip until it rose, then slowly advanced the plunger and expelled all the air gathered at the top.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-1:r126","rowIndex":126,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　普通のヤク中はもっといい加減な手順だが、彼は看護師の女とつき合っていたとかで、ある程度は事故の少ない正しいやり方を踏襲しているらしい。そしてそれを、販売した客にも教えているそうだ。","en":"Most junkies were far sloppier about it. But he had apparently once dated a nurse, and so followed a reasonably proper procedure that reduced the risk of accidents. I heard he taught the same method to his customers.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-1:r127","rowIndex":127,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=66>コンタ</tips>はそしておれを振り返った。","en":"<tips=66>Konta</tips> turned to me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-1:r128","rowIndex":128,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=10>道夫</tips>君、押さえてくれる？」","en":"“<tips=10>Michio</tips>, will you hold her down?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-1:r129","rowIndex":129,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おれは無言で頷き、ベッドに腰をおろすと、","en":"I nodded silently and sat on the bed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-1:r130","rowIndex":130,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「レナ、不安で落ち着かないだろ？　気持ちが楽になる注射をするよ。ちょっとチクっとするけれど、これでこわいのなくなるからな」","en":"“Rena, you’re anxious and can’t settle down, right? I’m going to give you an injection that will make you feel better. It will sting a little, but then you won’t be frightened anymore.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-1:r131","rowIndex":131,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「近寄らないで！　変態！　あっちに行け！」","en":"“Don’t come near me! Pervert! Get away!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-1:r132","rowIndex":132,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女は身体をよじって手足をばたつかせる。","en":"She twisted her body and thrashed her arms and legs.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-1:r133","rowIndex":133,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「わるいな。ちょっと我慢してくれ」","en":"“I’m sorry. Bear with it for a moment.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-1:r134","rowIndex":134,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おれは柔道の袈裟固めのような格好でレナの上半身を押さえつける。","en":"I pinned down Rena’s upper body in something like a judo scarf hold.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-1:r135","rowIndex":135,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「やめて！　殺される！　たすけてえええ！」","en":"“Stop! They’re going to kill me! Help meee!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-1:r136","rowIndex":136,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　金色の目になってしまうと、女でもものすごい力を発揮する。すでに暴れ続けて疲労し、病院で鎮静剤を打たれているにもかかわらず、まるで暴れ馬の背にのっているように彼女は激しく動き、おれはその上でぐらぐらと揺れていた。","en":"Once their eyes turned gold, even women could display extraordinary strength. Rena was already exhausted from struggling and had received a sedative at the hospital, yet she bucked so violently that it felt as though I were riding an untamed horse. I rocked precariously on top of her.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-1:r137","rowIndex":137,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　このままでは振り落とされてしまう。","en":"At this rate, she would throw me off.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-1:r138","rowIndex":138,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　やむなくおれも<tips=17>タイプB</tips>の力を解放した。","en":"With no other choice, I unleashed my <tips=17>Type B</tips> strength as well.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-1:r139","rowIndex":139,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　興奮状態や、忘我状態に陥ると<tips=17>タイプB</tips>は自動的に目が金色になり、強力な力を発揮するが、ある程度の才能と訓練があれば任意の瞬間に発動させることが出来る。","en":"When <tips=17>Type Bs</tips> enter a state of excitement or frenzy, their eyes automatically turn gold and they wield tremendous strength. With a certain amount of talent and training, however, they can trigger it at any moment they choose.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-1:r140","rowIndex":140,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　軍隊などの<tips=17>タイプB</tips>部隊には必須のスキルらしいが、コントロール出来るようになると発症自体を遅らせられるそうなので、おれはみんなに訓練を勧めているのだけれど、習得するのは案外難しいようだ。","en":"Apparently the skill was mandatory for <tips=17>Type B</tips> units in the military and similar organizations, and people said that learning such control could delay onset itself. I encouraged everyone to train, but mastering it seemed surprisingly difficult.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-1:r141","rowIndex":141,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おれは小さい時に<tips=22>老人たち</tips>に指導されて、この技術を身につけた。","en":"The <tips=22>Elders</tips> trained me when I was little, and that was how I acquired the technique.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-1:r142","rowIndex":142,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　これでこちらの筋力も増強されるが、自分が傷付くのも相手が傷付くのも考慮せずにバタバタと暴れる人間を完全におさえつけるのは難しい。","en":"That increased my own strength, but it was still difficult to restrain someone thrashing about with no regard for injuries to herself or anyone else.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-1:r143","rowIndex":143,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それでも上になったまま彼女の動きを封じていると、相手は段々疲労してゆく。","en":"Even so, as I remained on top of her and kept her from moving, she gradually exhausted herself.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-1:r144","rowIndex":144,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「レナ、大丈夫だから。大丈夫」","en":"“Rena, you’re all right. Everything’s all right.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-1:r145","rowIndex":145,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おれは彼女の身体にぴったり密着しながら耳元にそう囁く。","en":"I pressed myself tightly against her and whispered into her ear.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-1:r146","rowIndex":146,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女は汗ばみ、体中から女のにおいが立ち上っている。","en":"Her skin was damp with sweat, and a woman’s scent rose from her whole body.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-1:r147","rowIndex":147,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「はあ……はあ……」","en":"“Hah... hah...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-1:r148","rowIndex":148,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　レナは荒い呼吸となり、やがて完全に動きを止めた。","en":"Rena’s breath came in ragged gasps. At last she stopped moving entirely.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-1:r149","rowIndex":149,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　すると<tips=66>コンタ</tips>は近づき、レナに腕を伸ばさせると、その内側をアルコール綿で拭く。何もしなくても、静脈がうかんでいる。","en":"<tips=66>Konta</tips> approached and had Rena extend her arm, then wiped the inside of it with an alcohol swab. Her veins stood out without any coaxing.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-1:r150","rowIndex":150,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「刺すぞ」","en":"“Needle going in.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-1:r151","rowIndex":151,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そう声をかけると、<tips=66>コンタ</tips>は素早く血管に針を刺し、ゆっくりと薬剤を押し込む。","en":"After warning her, <tips=66>Konta</tips> swiftly inserted the needle into a vein and slowly injected the drug.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-1:r152","rowIndex":152,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　すべて投与したところで針を抜き、血がじんわりとにじむ傷口にアルコール綿を押し当てた。","en":"Once he had administered all of it, he removed the needle and pressed the swab against the puncture where blood had begun to seep.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-1:r153","rowIndex":153,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「もう大丈夫」","en":"“All done.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-1:r154","rowIndex":154,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=66>コンタ</tips>の合図でおれはレナの身体の上を離れる。","en":"At <tips=66>Konta’s</tips> signal, I lifted myself off Rena.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-1:r155","rowIndex":155,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女はぐったりとして、天井をぼんやり見つめていた。その口元は小さく動き、何か独り言を囁き続けている。","en":"She lay limp, staring vaguely at the ceiling. Her lips continued to move as she whispered something under her breath.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-1:r156","rowIndex":156,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「五分くらいで効いてくるんだ」","en":"“It’ll start working in about five minutes.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-1:r157","rowIndex":157,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=66>コンタ</tips>は後片付けをしながらそう言った。","en":"<tips=66>Konta</tips> spoke while cleaning up.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-1:r158","rowIndex":158,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「これで元通りのレナになる」","en":"“This will make Rena herself again.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-1:r159","rowIndex":159,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「元通りね……」","en":"“Back to her old self...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-1:r160","rowIndex":160,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おれが特別な意味もなく呟いた言葉に、<tips=66>コンタ</tips>は気を悪くしたようだった。","en":"I had only repeated the words without any particular implication, but <tips=66>Konta</tips> seemed to take offense.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-1:r161","rowIndex":161,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=10>道夫</tips>君。そろそろこの現実を受け入れないといけない日が来てるんだと思うよ。<tips=10>道夫</tips>君が考えているように、事業をおこして生活を立て直そうってのはすごくまっとうで、最終的にはそれを目指すべきだけどさあ。でも、おれたちには生活があるんだから……」","en":"“<tips=10>Michio</tips>, I think the time is coming when we have to accept reality. Rebuilding our lives by starting a business, the way you envision it, is perfectly sound, and ultimately it’s what we should aim for. But we have to live in the meantime, <tips=10>Michio</tips>...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-1:r162","rowIndex":162,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「わかった<tips=66>コンタ</tips>」","en":"“I understand, <tips=66>Konta</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-1:r163","rowIndex":163,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼の言葉を遮って、","en":"Interrupting him, I said,","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-1:r164","rowIndex":164,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いろいろと心配させて済まない。その話はあとで聞くよ」","en":"“I’m sorry I’ve made you worry about so much. I’ll hear you out later.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-1:r165","rowIndex":165,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おれは立ち上がりドアを開けて隣の部屋へ入った。","en":"I rose, opened the door, and entered the next room.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-1:r166","rowIndex":166,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そこでは娘が広げてやった玩具や絵本に手をつけずに座り込んでおり、不安げな目でおれを見上げる。","en":"The girl still sat without touching any of the toys or picture books I had spread before her. She looked up at me anxiously.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-1:r167","rowIndex":167,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「一人にしてごめんね。もうすぐ、いつものお母さんが帰ってくるからな」","en":"“I’m sorry I left you alone. Your mommy will be herself again soon.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-1:r168","rowIndex":168,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そしておれは人形をひとつ手にとって、彼女の前でふざけてみせた。","en":"I picked up one of the dolls and made it act silly for her.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-1:r169","rowIndex":169,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　薬は１０分ほどで効果を現し、レナは普段の落ち着きを取り戻した。","en":"After about ten minutes, the medicine took effect and Rena regained her usual composure.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-1:r170","rowIndex":170,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ごめんなさい。取り乱してしまって」","en":"“I’m sorry. I lost control of myself.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-1:r171","rowIndex":171,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ベッドへの拘束が解けたレナはロープの跡がつく手首をさすりながら謝った。","en":"Freed from the restraints, Rena rubbed the rope marks on her wrists as she apologized.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-1:r172","rowIndex":172,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その顔つきや物言いは先ほど狂乱していた時とはまるで別人で、すっかり憑き物が落ちたようになっている。","en":"Her expression and manner of speech were completely different from the frenzy of moments before. It was as though some possessing spirit had left her.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-1:r173","rowIndex":173,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　これがこの薬の力か。","en":"So this was the power of the drug.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-1:r174","rowIndex":174,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=45>ローズ</tips>の時もそうだった。人格が完全に荒廃し、言葉もろくにあやつれず、ほとんど動物みたいな行動しかとれなかった重病人でも、薬を打った途端晴れやかな顔で歩き始めてしまうのだから、それを目の当たりにした人間ならば誰もが奇跡の薬だと叫ぶだろうね。","en":"<tips=45>Rose</tips> had been the same. Even gravely ill people whose personalities had completely deteriorated, who could scarcely use language and behaved little better than animals, would receive the drug and immediately begin walking about with radiant faces. Anyone who witnessed it would have called the substance miraculous.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-1:r175","rowIndex":175,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　レナの目はまだ金色だが、これもやはり<tips=45>ローズ</tips>で症状を抑えたときと同じ現象だ。この薬の作用は、精神は正常に戻すが目の色は戻さず、向上した身体能力もそのままなんだ。つまり、症状が去り、メリットだけが残るという寸法だ。","en":"Rena’s eyes remained gold, just as they had when <tips=45>Rose</tips> suppressed the symptoms. The drug returned the mind to normal without restoring the color of the eyes, and it left the enhanced physical abilities intact. In other words, the symptoms vanished and only the advantages remained.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-1:r176","rowIndex":176,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=45>ローズ</tips>の場合は猛烈な副作用と依存性があったが、ネオの方はそれがないという。その触れ込みが本当ならば、今度こそ本当に奇跡の薬があらわれたと言うことになる。","en":"<tips=45>Rose</tips> had caused savage side effects and was fiercely addictive, but Neo supposedly suffered from neither defect. If that claim was true, then this time a genuinely miraculous drug had finally appeared.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-1:r177","rowIndex":177,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　この街は<tips=17>タイプB</tips>や<tips=77>特質変異</tips>のある<tips=16>タイプA</tips>への偏見が少ないと、世間では言われている。","en":"The wider world considered this city relatively free of prejudice against <tips=17>Type Bs</tips> and <tips=16>Type As</tips> with <tips=77>trait mutations</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-1:r178","rowIndex":178,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　確かにそれはある一面では間違いじゃない。<tips=17>タイプB</tips>はありふれているし、他の場所みたいに<tips=17>タイプB</tips>だってバレただけで魔女狩りみたいにつるし上げられることはない。","en":"In one respect, that was true. <tips=17>Type Bs</tips> were commonplace here, and unlike elsewhere, no one was subjected to a witch hunt merely for being exposed as a <tips=17>Type B</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-1:r179","rowIndex":179,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　だからって、まるきり平等に扱われるというわけでもない。差別用語はよそよりももっと頻繁に、そして気軽に使われるし、給料で差をつけられるのも当たり前だ。そういった差別はされる方もする方も当たり前になっているから、みな慣れてしまっただけだ。","en":"That did not mean they received equal treatment. Slurs were used more frequently and more casually than elsewhere, while wage discrimination was taken for granted. Both those who discriminated and those subjected to it had come to regard such treatment as ordinary. Everyone was simply accustomed to it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-1:r180","rowIndex":180,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　もっとも、これは<tips=17>タイプB</tips>だから差別する、というよりも、基本的にこの街が弱者や能力のないものに対してシビアだというだけのことかもしれない。","en":"Then again, perhaps it was not so much that the city discriminated against <tips=17>Type Bs</tips> as that it was simply harsh toward the weak and incapable.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-1:r181","rowIndex":181,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=17>タイプB</tips>であるということはやはりハンディキャップと見なされ、安く買いたたかれる。はっきり言って、身体障害者や、人種的なマイノリティもここでは”平等に差別される”。","en":"Being <tips=17>Type B</tips> was still regarded as a handicap, and our labor was bought on the cheap. Bluntly put, people with physical disabilities and racial minorities were also “discriminated against equally” here.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-1:r182","rowIndex":182,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　こういった構造はノーマルには気づきにくいだろう。<tips=1>亮</tips>のような聡明なやつでも、そのあたりを肌では理解していないように思う。","en":"That structure was probably difficult for Normals to notice. Even someone as intelligent as <tips=1>Ryo</tips> did not seem to understand it in his bones.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-1:r183","rowIndex":183,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ましてや発症した<tips=17>タイプB</tips>なんか、人間扱いされなくても文句は言えない。","en":"And once a <tips=17>Type B</tips> had suffered onset, they had no standing to complain even when they were no longer treated as human.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-1:r184","rowIndex":184,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"『<tips=46>ネオ・ローズ</tips>』がなければ、レナのように身寄りのない人間など生きるゴミのようにしか扱われなかったろう。","en":"Without ‘<tips=46>Neo Rose</tips>,’ someone like Rena who had no family would probably have been treated as nothing more than living refuse.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-1:r185","rowIndex":185,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　この薬がもたらす奇跡というのはつまりそういうことだ。","en":"That, in other words, was the miracle this medicine performed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-1:r186","rowIndex":186,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「レナ。症状が治ったわけじゃない。これからが大事なんだ」","en":"“Rena, your symptoms haven’t been cured. What happens from here is what matters.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"田中紺太","displayName":"Konta Tanaka","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-1:r187","rowIndex":187,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=66>コンタ</tips>は穏やかにそう話す。","en":"<tips=66>Konta</tips> spoke gently.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-1:r188","rowIndex":188,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼が今使った薬は効き目が出るのは早いが効果の持続は短い。これからずっと薬に頼って症状を抑え続けるには、持続性の注射を使うべきで、それをどこで手に入れいつ使ったらいいのかを、彼は詳しく説明した。","en":"The medicine he had just used took effect quickly but did not last long. If she meant to rely upon medication from now on and keep suppressing her symptoms, Konta said, she should use the long-acting injection instead. He explained in detail where she could obtain it and when she ought to use it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-1:r189","rowIndex":189,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　レナは神妙な顔で頷きながら聞いていた。","en":"Rena listened with a solemn expression, nodding as he spoke.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-1:r190","rowIndex":190,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ホントに、みんなに迷惑かけちゃって……。私、これでお店もクビかしら？」","en":"“I’ve caused so much trouble for everyone... Do you think the restaurant will fire me?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-1:r191","rowIndex":191,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おかしくなっていた頃の記憶はあるらしく、彼女は顔を顰める。","en":"Apparently she retained some memory of the episode. She grimaced.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-1:r192","rowIndex":192,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そおんなわけないよ！　レナみたいなとびきりの看板娘をクビになんかしやしないさ。店の人たちもそんなに悪い顔してなかったし、あとでおれからも話しておいてやるよ」","en":"“Of course they won’t! No one would fire a star waitress like you. The people from the restaurant didn’t look too upset, and I’ll speak to them myself later.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-1:r193","rowIndex":193,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おれは冗談めかしてレナの肩を叩く。","en":"I gave her shoulder a playful pat.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-1:r194","rowIndex":194,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ありがとうみっちゃん……」","en":"“Thank you, Mitchan...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-1:r195","rowIndex":195,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それより。ほら」","en":"“More importantly—look.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-1:r196","rowIndex":196,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　言っておれは、向こうに立ってこちらを見ている娘の方を示した。","en":"I pointed toward her daughter, who stood at a distance watching us.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-1:r197","rowIndex":197,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女はまだ母親の回復を完全に信じ切っていないらしく、半信半疑の上目遣いで母親を見ている。","en":"The girl was not yet fully convinced that her mother had recovered. She peered up at Rena with a doubtful, searching expression.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-1:r198","rowIndex":198,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ああ、ユリカ、びっくりさせてゴメンね」","en":"“Oh, Yurika. I’m sorry I frightened you.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-1:r199","rowIndex":199,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　レナが笑顔で両手を広げてみせると、","en":"Rena smiled and spread her arms.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-1:r200","rowIndex":200,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ままぁ」","en":"“Mommy!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-1:r201","rowIndex":201,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　涙をボロボロと流しながら少女は駆け寄ってきて、そして母子はお互いを抱きしめあった。","en":"Tears streaming from her eyes, the little girl ran to her, and mother and child embraced.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-1:r202","rowIndex":202,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ごめんね。もうこんなことしないからね。本当にごめんね……」","en":"“I’m sorry. I’ll never do anything like this again. I’m so sorry...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-1:r203","rowIndex":203,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　レナも娘に負けないくらい大量の涙を流している。","en":"Rena wept every bit as hard as her daughter.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-1:r204","rowIndex":204,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あやまらないで。大丈夫だから。今度ママが病気になったら、私が守ってあげる……」","en":"“Don’t say sorry. It’s all right. The next time you get sick, Mommy, I’ll protect you...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-1:r205","rowIndex":205,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なんていい娘だろう！」","en":"“What a wonderful daughter!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-1:r206","rowIndex":206,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　母子水入らずの場面だが、おれはうっかり声を出してしまった。","en":"It was an intimate moment between mother and child, but I inadvertently spoke aloud.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-1:r207","rowIndex":207,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「自分もつらいのに、よく言ったね。きみがそう思っているのなら、誰もお母さんを傷つけることなんか出来ないはずだ」","en":"“Even though you’re hurting too, that was a brave thing to say. If that’s how you feel, then no one will ever be able to hurt your mother.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-1:r208","rowIndex":208,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ほんとうに、ほんとうに……」","en":"“Truly... truly...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-1:r209","rowIndex":209,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おれの場の空気を読まない言葉に、レナは何度も頷いた。","en":"Despite my failure to read the room, Rena nodded over and over.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-1:r210","rowIndex":210,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして親子は泣きながらいつまでも抱きしめあう。","en":"Mother and child held each other for a long time, both of them weeping.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-1:r211","rowIndex":211,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そろそろ、おれたちも退散したほうが良さそうだ。感動的な場面に、取り出したハンカチで目を何度も拭いている<tips=66>コンタ</tips>の肩をつついて、おれたちはこっそりとその場を去った。","en":"It seemed best to leave the two of them alone. <tips=66>Konta</tips>, overcome by the sight, kept dabbing at his eyes with a handkerchief. I nudged his shoulder, and together we slipped quietly away.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-1:r212","rowIndex":212,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=10>道夫</tips>君。薬が好きじゃないのはわかるけど、おれが<tips=46>ネオ</tips>を持っていなければレナを回復させることが出来なかった」","en":"“<tips=10>Michio</tips>, I know you don’t like drugs, but if I hadn’t had <tips=46>Neo</tips> with me, I couldn’t have brought Rena back.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"田中紺太","displayName":"Konta Tanaka","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-1:r213","rowIndex":213,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おれは自転車を押して歩き、<tips=66>コンタ</tips>は隣を歩いている。","en":"I walked my bicycle while <tips=66>Konta</tips> kept pace beside me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-1:r214","rowIndex":214,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼の目元はこすりすぎて赤かった。こんな、どう見てもその辺りのチンピラにしか見えない姿をしているが、存外に情に厚く涙もろい男なのである。","en":"He had rubbed the skin around his eyes until it was red. He looked for all the world like an ordinary street thug, yet he was surprisingly tenderhearted and quick to cry.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-1:r215","rowIndex":215,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「副作用とか依存性を心配するのはわかるけど、使った人間を見てると、<tips=45>ローズ</tips>とは違うような気がするんだよなあ」","en":"“I understand why you’re worried about side effects and addiction. But when I look at the people who’ve used it, I can’t help feeling this is different from <tips=45>Rose</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"田中紺太","displayName":"Konta Tanaka","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-1:r216","rowIndex":216,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　確かにおれは<tips=45>ローズ</tips>の時のように大量に廃人を作り出すことも心配しているが、実はそれだけじゃない。","en":"Certainly, I worried that it might turn vast numbers of people into human wrecks, as <tips=45>Rose</tips> had. But that was not my only concern.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-1:r217","rowIndex":217,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　薬の効果とはまた別の部分に、とても複雑な問題がある。","en":"The drug’s effects were not the only issue. There was another, very complicated problem.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-1:r218","rowIndex":218,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それは、<tips=46>ネオ</tips>の方が本物の奇跡の薬で、人を廃人にするような副作用がなかったとしても同じことだ。","en":"The same problem would remain even if <tips=46>Neo</tips> were a genuine miracle drug, free of any side effects that destroyed the people who used it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-1:r219","rowIndex":219,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　一度発症した<tips=17>タイプB</tips>は、これがなくては生きていけないことになるだろう。結局依存するしかなくなる。","en":"Once a <tips=17>Type B</tips> had suffered onset, they would no longer be able to live without it. In the end, they would have no choice but to depend on it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-1:r220","rowIndex":220,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　特効薬というものはそういうもので、それ自体が悪いわけではないんだけれど、問題は他にある。","en":"That was simply the nature of a drug that worked. There was nothing inherently wrong with that; the real problem lay elsewhere.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-1:r221","rowIndex":221,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それは、現在この薬を販売出来るのは<tips=21>八龍会</tips>しかない、ということだ。","en":"The issue was that, at present, only the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips> could sell the medicine.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-1:r222","rowIndex":222,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それはつまり、<tips=21>八龍会</tips>が<tips=17>タイプB</tips>に対して今まで以上の支配力を持つということになる。","en":"That meant the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips> would possess even greater control over <tips=17>Type Bs</tips> than it had before.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-1:r223","rowIndex":223,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　前回ローズが流行っていた時は少し事情が違った。ローズはレシピが公開されていたので家庭用製剤器があれば誰でも作ることが出来たし、副作用が酷くてすぐに使い物にならない廃人になってしまう。その点、<tips=46>ネオ・ローズ</tips>を取り巻く環境は、<tips=21>八龍会</tips>が<tips=17>タイプB</tips>を支配するためのすべての条件が揃っている。","en":"Things had been somewhat different during the previous Rose epidemic. Rose’s formula was public, so anyone with a home compounding machine could make it. Its side effects were also so terrible that users quickly became useless wrecks. With <tips=46>Neo Rose</tips>, by contrast, every condition was in place for the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips> to control the <tips=17>Type Bs</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-1:r224","rowIndex":224,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　いずれこの薬の製造法も広まるのかもしれないが、それまでの間なら、<tips=21>八龍会</tips>は街の<tips=17>タイプB</tips>たちに、どんなことでもさせることが出来るだろう。","en":"The method for manufacturing the medicine might eventually spread, but until it did, the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips> could make the city’s <tips=17>Type Bs</tips> do anything it wanted.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-1:r225","rowIndex":225,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=22>老人たち</tips>が『今がチャンス』と言っていたのは、この意味も含まれているはずだ。","en":"This too must have been what the <tips=22>Elders</tips> meant when they said that now was their chance.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-1:r226","rowIndex":226,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「薬自体はもしかしたら良いものなのかもしれない。でもなあ……」","en":"“Maybe the medicine itself is a good thing. But still...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-1:r227","rowIndex":227,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　結局この薬は街の<tips=17>タイプB</tips>たちを、<tips=21>八龍会</tips>の奴隷にしてしまう。そして<tips=22>老人たち</tips>もそれを利用しようとしている。","en":"In the end, this medicine would reduce the city’s <tips=17>Type Bs</tips> to slaves of the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips>. And the <tips=22>Elders</tips> were planning to take advantage of that as well.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-1:r228","rowIndex":228,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それは、ギャングが人を麻薬漬けにして売春させたり金を搾り取ったりするのと何の違いがあるのか？　<tips=21>八龍会</tips>はギャングとは違うんじゃなかったのか？","en":"How was that any different from a gang keeping people hooked on drugs, then forcing them into prostitution or bleeding them of money? Wasn’t the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips> supposed to be something other than a gang?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-1:r229","rowIndex":229,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　だから、今この薬を使うのはいやなんだ。レシピが公開されて、ありふれた存在になって、本当に副作用がないことが確認されてからなら何の問題もない。","en":"That was why I was so reluctant to use the medicine now. Once the formula was public, the drug commonplace, and its freedom from side effects firmly established, I would have no objection at all.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-1:r230","rowIndex":230,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　でも、この状況で手を出すのは危険だ。","en":"But using it under these circumstances was dangerous.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-1:r231","rowIndex":231,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しかし、しかしだ。","en":"But. But even so.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-1:r232","rowIndex":232,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　だからって使うことをやめろとは言えない。そもそも、おれだって、この先苦しんでいる人間を見たときに使わずに見捨てることなんかできるだろうか？　レナと娘のさっきの喜びようを見たか？　何の手も打たなければ、一生まともに喋ることも働くこともできないんだぞ？","en":"Even so, I could not tell people to stop using it. If I encountered someone suffering like this again, could I truly withhold the drug and abandon them? Had I not just seen how overjoyed Rena and her daughter were? If we did nothing, she would spend the rest of her life unable to speak coherently or work.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-1:r233","rowIndex":233,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　家族や親しい人が別人になってしまって、それを元に戻したいという気持ちがあるかぎり、我々<tips=17>タイプB</tips>は薬の奴隷でありつづけるしかないのかもしれない。","en":"As long as we wanted to restore family and friends who had become completely different people, perhaps we <tips=17>Type Bs</tips> would have no choice but to remain slaves to the medicine.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-1:r234","rowIndex":234,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=10>道夫</tips>君。さっき言いかけたことだけどさ……」","en":"“<tips=10>Michio</tips>, about what I started to say earlier...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"田中紺太","displayName":"Konta Tanaka","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-1:r235","rowIndex":235,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おれが考えていると、<tips=66>コンタ</tips>は言った。","en":"<tips=66>Konta</tips> spoke while I was lost in thought.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-1:r236","rowIndex":236,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そう言えば、続きを聞くって言ってたな」","en":"“That’s right. I said I’d hear the rest.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-1:r237","rowIndex":237,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そう。……饅頭屋はいいと思うよ？　でも、成功するまでまだ時間もお金もかかると思う。だから、一旦中止して、手っ取り早く稼げることをまずやって、資金を増やした方がいいんじゃないかな？」","en":"“Yes. ...I think the bun shop is a good idea. But it will still take time and money before it succeeds. So maybe we should suspend it for a while, do something that earns money quickly, and build up our capital first.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"田中紺太","displayName":"Konta Tanaka","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-1:r238","rowIndex":238,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=66>コンタ</tips>は前を見ながらそう話す。","en":"<tips=66>Konta</tips> kept looking ahead as he spoke.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-1:r239","rowIndex":239,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「何かアイデアがあるのか？」","en":"“Do you have something in mind?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-1:r240","rowIndex":240,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼の言い出すことは大体予想がついたが、おれはそう尋ねた。","en":"I could already guess what he would say, but I asked the question.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-1:r241","rowIndex":241,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「うちの工場にも『<tips=46>ネオ・ローズ</tips>』が作れる製剤機を置こうよ」","en":"“Let’s put a compounding machine in our factory so we can make ‘<tips=46>Neo Rose</tips>’ too.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"田中紺太","displayName":"Konta Tanaka","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-1:r242","rowIndex":242,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=66>コンタ</tips>、いくら小麦粉が高いからって、『<tips=46>ネオ・ローズ</tips>』じゃ<tips=71>グレートホール饅頭</tips>は作れないよ」","en":"“<tips=66>Konta</tips>, however expensive flour gets, you can’t make <tips=71>Great Hole Buns</tips> out of ‘<tips=46>Neo Rose</tips>.’”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-1:r243","rowIndex":243,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=10>道夫</tips>君、おれは冗談を言ってるわけじゃないんだよ……」","en":"“<tips=10>Michio</tips>, I’m not joking...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"田中紺太","displayName":"Konta Tanaka","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-1:r244","rowIndex":244,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=66>コンタ</tips>は顔をしかめる。","en":"<tips=66>Konta</tips> frowned.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-1:r245","rowIndex":245,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「わかってるよ。饅頭屋から麻薬屋になったらどうかって言うんだろ？　<tips=21>八龍会</tips>では『<tips=46>ネオ・ローズ</tips>』の生産が追いついてないって聞いてるからね。だからお偉いさんは工場を増やそうと考えてるってわけだ」","en":"“I know. You’re asking whether we should stop selling buns and start selling drugs, aren’t you? I hear the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips> can’t make enough ‘<tips=46>Neo Rose</tips>’ to meet demand. So the people at the top want to add more production facilities.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-1:r246","rowIndex":246,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そう」","en":"“Yes.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"田中紺太","displayName":"Konta Tanaka","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-1:r247","rowIndex":247,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=66>コンタ</tips>はうなずく。","en":"<tips=66>Konta</tips> nodded.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-1:r248","rowIndex":248,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そりゃあ、どっちも白い粉を扱う仕事だけれどさ……」","en":"“I admit both jobs involve white powder, but...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-1:r249","rowIndex":249,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「確実に金になるよ。この薬を欲しがる人はたくさんいる。もちろん<tips=21>八龍会</tips>の仲間から金は取れないけど、外のやつらに売るだけでぼろ儲けさ。……そうしたら、レナとか、他の掛け持ちで働いているみんなも、安心して生活して行けるようになる。それで事業資金を増やしてから、みんなでまた饅頭作りを再開すればいいじゃないか」","en":"“It’s guaranteed money. Plenty of people want this medicine. Of course we can’t charge our fellow members of the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips>, but we’ll make a killing just selling it to outsiders. ...Then Rena and everyone else working multiple jobs will be able to make a secure living. Once we’ve built up more business capital, we can all go back to making buns together, can’t we?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"田中紺太","displayName":"Konta Tanaka","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-1:r250","rowIndex":250,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そういう<tips=66>コンタ</tips>の顔に、濃い疲労の色が浮かんでいるのに気がついた。","en":"I noticed the deep exhaustion written across <tips=66>Konta’s</tips> face.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-1:r251","rowIndex":251,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　この疲労は、先の見えない饅頭作りと、仕事を二つ並行しているオーバーワークによるものだろう。","en":"That fatigue probably came from making buns with no end in sight while working a second job at the same time.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-1:r252","rowIndex":252,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　なんだか雰囲気もぴりぴりとしているし、はっきりそう言わないけれど、追い詰められている。","en":"There was something raw and tense about him. He did not say so directly, but he had been driven into a corner.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-1:r253","rowIndex":253,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　きっと、他の従業員も同じような状態なのかもしれない。レナが発症したのも、このストレスが関係しているのだろう。","en":"Perhaps the other employees were in much the same state. That stress might even have contributed to Rena’s onset.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-1:r254","rowIndex":254,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「わかった。少し考えさせてくれ」","en":"“All right. Let me think about it for a while.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-1:r255","rowIndex":255,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そう返事をすると、<tips=66>コンタ</tips>はもう気が済んだという風に表情をゆるめて溜息をつく。","en":"At my answer, <tips=66>Konta’s</tips> expression softened as though that alone had satisfied him, and he let out a sigh.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-1:r256","rowIndex":256,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=10>道夫</tips>君、一緒に頑張ろうよ。みんな<tips=10>道夫</tips>君のこと大好きなんだからさ」","en":"“<tips=10>Michio</tips>, let’s keep at it together. Everyone loves you, <tips=10>Michio</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"田中紺太","displayName":"Konta Tanaka","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-1:r257","rowIndex":257,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=66>コンタ</tips>はそう言ってくれる。おれは複雑だった。","en":"That was what <tips=66>Konta</tips> told me. I did not know how to feel about it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-1:r258","rowIndex":258,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おれだって、本当はもう全部わかっているんだ。意地を張って追い続けてきたこの夢は、そろそろ終わりが近づいている。","en":"The truth was, I understood all of it already. The dream I had gone on chasing out of sheer stubborn pride was nearing its end.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-1:r259","rowIndex":259,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　もし今から急に売り上げが伸びたとしても、おそらくその運命は変わらない。","en":"Even if our sales suddenly took off now, that fate would probably remain unchanged.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-1:r260","rowIndex":260,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　時代が変わろうとしているんだ。","en":"The times were about to change.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}}]},{"position":43,"code":"B3-2","unitId":"B3-2","rows":[{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r1","rowIndex":1,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おれたちは食事をとるために<tips=59>暗闇通り</tips>を歩いて店を探した。","en":"We walked along <tips=59>Darkness Street</tips> in search of somewhere to eat.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r2","rowIndex":2,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　この辺りを昼にブラブラするのは久しぶりだが、少し雰囲気が変わってはいないか？　客引きや街娼があからさまに減っている。","en":"It had been a long time since I strolled around this neighborhood by day, but hadn’t the atmosphere changed a little? There were plainly fewer touts and streetwalkers.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r3","rowIndex":3,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=33>壬生屋</tips>が<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>の本体に取り込まれたからねえ……」","en":"“That’s because <tips=33>Mibuya</tips> was absorbed into <tips=7>YS</tips> proper...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"田中紺太","displayName":"Konta Tanaka","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r4","rowIndex":4,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おれがふと感想を口にすると、<tips=59>暗闇通り</tips>出身の<tips=66>コンタ</tips>がそう言った。","en":"When I casually voiced the observation, <tips=66>Konta</tips>, who came from <tips=59>Darkness Street</tips>, supplied the answer.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r5","rowIndex":5,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それがどう影響するんだ？　所属がかわったって、経営してるのは相変わらず<tips=33>壬生屋</tips>だろ？」","en":"“What difference does that make? Even if its affiliation changed, <tips=33>Mibuya</tips> is still running it, right?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r6","rowIndex":6,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「元々<tips=59>暗闇通り</tips>は<tips=33>壬生屋</tips>のテリトリーで立ちんぼは禁止なんだが、半グレの連中は気にせず女を立たせてた。だって、<tips=33>壬生屋</tips>は<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>の幹部といっても、中枢の人間じゃないし、どっちかと言うと舐められてたからね。それが、正式に<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>の本体に組み込まれたんだ。となると、今後やつらと揉めると<tips=76>旧義勝</tips>の怖い連中が顔を出してくるかもしれない。ほら、今話題の三代目<tips=81>龍頭</tips>は身内にも容赦しない厳しいやつだって恐れられてるしさ。実際、本当に<tips=76>旧義勝</tips>が来るとは限らないが、それを試そうというやつはいないだろう。揉めたくない連中はみんな他の通りへ移動したのさ」","en":"“<tips=59>Darkness Street</tips> was <tips=33>Mibuya</tips> territory to begin with, and streetwalking was prohibited there, but the quasi-gangsters ignored that and put women out on the street anyway. See, even though <tips=33>Mibuya</tips> belonged to the upper ranks of <tips=7>YS</tips>, it wasn’t part of the inner circle. If anything, people looked down on it. But now it’s been formally incorporated into <tips=7>YS</tips> proper. That means if they cross them from now on, some of the frightening men from <tips=76>old Yisheng</tips> might show up. You know how the third <tips=81>Longtou</tips> everyone’s talking about is feared as a hard man who shows no mercy even to his own people. There’s no guarantee <tips=76>old Yisheng</tips> would actually come, but nobody’s going to test that. Everyone who wants to avoid trouble has moved to other streets.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"田中紺太","displayName":"Konta Tanaka","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r7","rowIndex":7,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なるほど。さすがもと業界人だけあって詳しいな」","en":"“I see. You really do know your stuff, being an old hand in the business.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r8","rowIndex":8,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そんなの、誰だってわかるさ。……しかし、<tips=1>亮</tips>のやつがリーダーになってから色々と街が動いてるな。そう言えば、爺さんたちはどうするんだろうね？　なんだか最近キナ臭いじゃないか。<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>のやることにケチ付けたりしてさ。<tips=21>八龍会</tips>はそれでいいのかねえ。<tips=10>道夫</tips>君は何か聞いてない？」","en":"“Anyone could figure that much out. Still... all sorts of things have been happening in the city since <tips=1>Ryo</tips> became the leader. Come to think of it, I wonder what the Elders are going to do. Things have been feeling dangerous lately, haven’t they? They’ve been picking holes in everything <tips=7>YS</tips> does. I wonder if the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips> is really all right with that. Have you heard anything, <tips=10>Michio</tips>?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"田中紺太","displayName":"Konta Tanaka","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r9","rowIndex":9,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「何も」","en":"“Nothing.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r10","rowIndex":10,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうか。でも、<tips=21>八龍会</tips>と<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>で争うようなことになったらきっついな」","en":"“I see. But if the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips> and <tips=7>YS</tips> come to blows, that’ll be ugly.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"田中紺太","displayName":"Konta Tanaka","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r11","rowIndex":11,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=66>コンタ</tips>はそう言って溜息をつく。","en":"<tips=66>Konta</tips> sighed as he said it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r12","rowIndex":12,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=59>暗闇通り</tips>は夜は賑やかだが昼は看板をしまっている飲食店も多く、目当てのラーメン屋も臨時休業をしていたのでそのまま<tips=57>滑走路通り</tips>の方まで歩いて『Ｐｕｅｒｔｏ』というスペイン風バルの店に足を踏み入れた。","en":"<tips=59>Darkness Street</tips> was lively at night, but many of its restaurants put away their signs during the day. The ramen shop we had wanted was temporarily closed, so we continued to <tips=57>Runway Street</tips> and entered a Spanish-style bar called Puerto.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r13","rowIndex":13,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　夜は酒飲みが集まる店だが、昼はランチメニューを提供しており、これがなかなか評判がいい。スペイン在住経験がある店主の手によるオリーブオイルをふんだんに使ったスペイン風料理がメインだが、生まれ故郷であるタイの料理も取り扱っている。","en":"Drinkers gathered there at night, while at midday it served a well-regarded lunch menu. The owner had lived in Spain, and his principal offerings were Spanish-inspired dishes prepared with abundant olive oil, though he also served food from his native Thailand.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r14","rowIndex":14,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ランチメニューにもグリーンカレーとレッドカレーがあり、おれは鳥肉とタイ産の茄子が入っているグリーンの方を、<tips=66>コンタ</tips>はエスニック料理が苦手なのでエビとムール貝が入ったシーフードパエリアを注文した。","en":"The lunch menu included both green and red curry. I ordered the green, made with chicken and Thai eggplant. <tips=66>Konta</tips> disliked what he called exotic food, so he chose a seafood paella with shrimp and mussels.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r15","rowIndex":15,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　なかなかオシャレな店だけあって、店内には若い客が多かったが、年配の客もちらほらといる。肌や髪の色は多様で、<tips=16>タイプA</tips>の<tips=77>特質変異</tips>らしい風変わりな容姿の客もいる。よそからの観光客よりも地元の住民が多そうだ。","en":"As one might expect of such a fashionable place, most of the customers were young, though a scattering of older people sat among them. They displayed a great variety of skin and hair colors, and a few had the unusual features of <tips=77>trait mutations</tips> in <tips=16>Type As</tips>. Most appeared to be local residents rather than tourists.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r16","rowIndex":16,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そうしてぼんやり店内を見渡しながら料理を待っていると、ドアを開けて意外な顔ぶれが入って来る。","en":"As I idly surveyed the room while waiting for our food, an unexpected pair entered through the door.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r17","rowIndex":17,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　年が同じくらいの二人組の女の子で、片方は雨も降っていないのに身体を隠すレインコートを着ており、顔が汗をかいたように濡れている。もう一人のほっそりとした方は白い服をみにつけ、帽子をかぶっている。","en":"They were two girls of approximately the same age. Although it was not raining, one wore a raincoat that concealed her body, and her face was wet as though with sweat. The slenderer girl wore white clothes and a hat.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r18","rowIndex":18,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女たちは視線をめぐらして空席を探すと、おれの姿を見つけた。","en":"They looked around for an empty table and spotted me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r19","rowIndex":19,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「よう」","en":"“Hey.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r20","rowIndex":20,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　と手を挙げると、二人は歩いて近づいてくる。レインコートの方は松葉杖をつき、ひょこひょこと頼りない歩き方をしていた。","en":"I raised a hand, and they came over. The girl in the raincoat was on crutches and moved with an unsteady, hopping gait.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r21","rowIndex":21,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「お久しぶりです」","en":"“It has been a long time.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r22","rowIndex":22,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　白い服の方がそう言って、頭を下げると、もう一人もそれにあわせて慌てて頭を下げた。","en":"The girl in white bowed as she spoke. Her companion hurriedly followed suit.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r23","rowIndex":23,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あの時以来だね、<tips=44>シウ</tips>ちゃん。それと……<tips=51>さくら</tips>ちゃんだっけ？」","en":"“Not since that day, <tips=44>Siu</tips>. And... <tips=51>Sakura</tips>, wasn’t it?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r24","rowIndex":24,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そう、そこに入って来たのは<tips=1>亮</tips>の妹である<tips=44>謝筱喬</tips>と、その友人である<tips=51>熨田さくら</tips>だった。","en":"Yes—the two who had entered were <tips=1>Ryo’s</tips> younger sister, <tips=44>Siu-kiu Tse</tips>, and her friend <tips=51>Sakura Noshida</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r25","rowIndex":25,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　二人と会うのは病院以来だ。あれは二ヶ月前……もう二ヶ月も過ぎているのだと思うとその早さに愕然とするが……<tips=41>グランドタワー</tips>を襲撃したサイキック少女に誘拐された<tips=44>シウ</tips>を、やはりサイキックである<tips=51>さくら</tips>が救出に向かい、<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>のギャングたちが束になっても敵わなかったその相手から、見事奪還に成功したのだ。","en":"I had not seen them since the hospital, two months ago. Realizing that two whole months had already passed was startling. A psychic girl had abducted <tips=44>Siu</tips> during the attack on the <tips=41>Grand Tower</tips>, and <tips=51>Sakura</tips>, herself a psychic, had gone to rescue her. Sakura succeeded in wresting Siu back from an opponent whom even a whole gang of <tips=7>YS</tips> men had been unable to defeat.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r26","rowIndex":26,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ただし無傷というわけにも行かず、彼女は足の一本を失い、また落下により体中を打ってしまうこととなったのだ。","en":"She had not escaped unscathed, however. She lost one of her legs, and the fall left her battered all over.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r27","rowIndex":27,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　まったく勇気のある女の子である。","en":"She was a courageous girl indeed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r28","rowIndex":28,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「知り合い？」","en":"“You know them?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"田中紺太","displayName":"Konta Tanaka","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r29","rowIndex":29,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=66>コンタ</tips>がきょとんとした顔でおれと二人の顔を交互に見る。","en":"<tips=66>Konta</tips> stared blankly from me to the two girls and back again.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r30","rowIndex":30,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　子供の頃は定食屋の息子として通していた<tips=1>亮</tips>は、その実の妹のことを仲間には話していない。<tips=66>コンタ</tips>も当然この目の前の少女が<tips=1>亮</tips>の妹だとは気がつかない。","en":"As a child, <tips=1>Ryo</tips> had passed himself off as the son of a diner owner and never told his companions about his real sister. Naturally, <tips=66>Konta</tips> had no idea that the girl before him was <tips=1>Ryo’s</tips> sister.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r31","rowIndex":31,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　かといって、今ここでおれが話すわけにもいかないよな？　あの<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>が常に手元に置いていた愛娘であり、現在街を騒がしている新<tips=81>龍頭</tips>の妹であると、いくらなんでもここで言うわけにはいかないもの。","en":"But I could hardly say so here, could I? I could not possibly announce in a public restaurant that she was the beloved daughter <tips=3>Chris Tse</tips> had always kept close and the sister of the new <tips=81>Longtou</tips> who now had the whole city talking.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r32","rowIndex":32,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　見たところ警備のものも居るわけでもないし、こっそりお忍びで<tips=41>グランドタワー</tips>を出て来たんだろう。その正体を、たとえ<tips=66>コンタ</tips>とは言え教えるわけにはいかないよな。そんなの絶対だめに決まっている。","en":"I saw no security personnel, so the two of them had probably slipped out of the <tips=41>Grand Tower</tips> incognito. Even <tips=66>Konta</tips> could not be told who she really was. Absolutely not.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r33","rowIndex":33,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「おれは<tips=66>田中紺太</tips>。この<tips=10>見土</tips>君とは昔からの友だちなんだけど……きみたちのことは、一度も見たことないな」","en":"“I’m <tips=66>Konta Tanaka</tips>. <tips=10>Michio</tips> and I go way back, but... I’ve never seen either of you before.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"田中紺太","displayName":"Konta Tanaka","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r34","rowIndex":34,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=66>コンタ</tips>が首を捻りながら言うと、","en":"<tips=66>Konta</tips> tilted his head as he introduced himself.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r35","rowIndex":35,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「初めまして。私、<tips=44>謝筱喬</tips>といいます。<tips=1>謝亮</tips>の妹です」","en":"“A pleasure to meet you. My name is <tips=44>Siu-kiu Tse</tips>. I am <tips=1>Tse Leung’s</tips> younger sister.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r36","rowIndex":36,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=44>シウ</tips>はあっさり答えた。","en":"<tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> answered without hesitation.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r37","rowIndex":37,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　えっ、言ってもいいの？","en":"Oh. So it was all right to say it?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r38","rowIndex":38,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ちょ、ちょっと<tips=44>筱喬</tips>。そんなに詳しく自己紹介しちゃって……」","en":"“W-wait, <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips>! You can’t introduce yourself in that much detail...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"熨田さくら","displayName":"Sakura Noshida","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r39","rowIndex":39,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=51>さくら</tips>は慌てている。やっぱりダメらしい。そりゃそうだろう。","en":"<tips=51>Sakura</tips> was flustered. Apparently it wasn’t all right after all. Of course it wasn’t.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r40","rowIndex":40,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「えっ、<tips=1>謝亮</tips>の妹って……」","en":"“What? <tips=1>Tse Leung’s</tips> sister...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"田中紺太","displayName":"Konta Tanaka","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r41","rowIndex":41,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=66>コンタ</tips>は放心して固まっている。やはりかつての友人とは言え、<tips=81>龍頭</tips>の妹をこんなに間近で発見したのはショックだったようだ。","en":"<tips=66>Konta</tips> stood frozen in a daze. Former friend or not, finding himself face-to-face with the <tips=81>Longtou’s</tips> sister had evidently come as a shock.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r42","rowIndex":42,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そ、そうなんだ。おれは子供の頃から知ってたんだけど、<tips=66>コンタ</tips>が会うのは初めてだよな。なかなかややこしい立場なんだから、あんまり大きな声は出さないでやってくれよ。そして、普段通り自然にするんだ」","en":"“Y-yeah. I’ve known her since we were kids, but this is your first time meeting her, <tips=66>Konta</tips>, right? She’s in a rather complicated position, so try not to raise your voice. Just act naturally.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r43","rowIndex":43,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しかしおれの言葉は<tips=66>コンタ</tips>の耳には入らないようで、相変わらず石像のように凍り付いている。","en":"But my words did not seem to reach <tips=66>Konta</tips>. He remained frozen like a stone statue.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r44","rowIndex":44,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　少なくとも大きな声を出す心配はなさそうだ。","en":"At least I no longer had to worry about him raising his voice.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r45","rowIndex":45,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まあ、二人ともそこに座りなよ。相席だけどいいかな？」","en":"“Why don’t you both sit down? Would you mind sharing our table?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r46","rowIndex":46,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あ、はい」","en":"“Ah, yes.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r47","rowIndex":47,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「じゃあ遠慮なく」","en":"“Then we’ll take you up on the offer.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"熨田さくら","displayName":"Sakura Noshida","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r48","rowIndex":48,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おれが<tips=66>コンタ</tips>の隣に移動して、テーブルをはさんで向かいの二つの席を彼女たちにゆずる。","en":"I moved beside <tips=66>Konta</tips> and offered them the two seats across the table.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r49","rowIndex":49,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=51>さくら</tips>は片足を気遣いながらの着席で、手間取りながら椅子に腰をおろした。","en":"Mindful of her leg, <tips=51>Sakura</tips> took some time maneuvering herself into the chair.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r50","rowIndex":50,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「足の調子はどうだい？」","en":"“How’s your leg?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r51","rowIndex":51,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「すごくいいですよ。今の技術ってすごいんですね。切断してすぐ義肢つけたのに全然痛くないし」","en":"“It’s great. Modern technology is amazing, isn’t it? They fitted me with a prosthesis right after the amputation, and it doesn’t hurt at all.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r52","rowIndex":52,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=51>さくら</tips>は脇に立てかけてあったランチメニューを手に取りながら答える。","en":"<tips=51>Sakura</tips> answered as she took up the lunch menu propped beside her.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r53","rowIndex":53,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　若い女の子があんな怪我をして家族はなんとも言わなかったのかとか、ちゃんと<tips=1>亮</tips>に支払って貰っているのかとか、聞きたいことは色々あったが、あまり根掘り葉掘り尋ねても鬱陶しいだけかな。","en":"I had all sorts of questions—what her family had said about a girl so young suffering an injury like that, whether <tips=1>Ryo</tips> had seen that she was properly compensated—but prying into every detail would probably only annoy her.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r54","rowIndex":54,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あ、こっちの子は<tips=51>熨田さくら</tips>ちゃん。<tips=44>シウ</tips>ちゃんの友だちなんだ。おれもこの間初めて会ったんだけど、えーと、普段は何をしてる子なんだっけ？　学生？」","en":"“Oh, this is <tips=51>Sakura Noshida</tips>, <tips=44>Siu-kiu’s</tips> friend. I only met her myself the other day. Um... what do you usually do, Sakura? Are you a student?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r55","rowIndex":55,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=66>コンタ</tips>に紹介しようと思ったが、おれもほとんどこの子については詳しいことを知らない。","en":"I meant to introduce her to <tips=66>Konta</tips>, but in truth, I knew almost nothing about this girl myself.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r56","rowIndex":56,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「えー、あのー、私、学生じゃないです」","en":"“Um, well... I’m not a student.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r57","rowIndex":57,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「じゃあ働いてるの？」","en":"“Then do you work?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r58","rowIndex":58,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「い、いえ……働いてもいません」","en":"“N-no... I don’t work either.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r59","rowIndex":59,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=51>さくら</tips>は引きつった笑顔を浮かべて顔を横に振り、","en":"<tips=51>Sakura</tips> shook her head with a strained smile.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r60","rowIndex":60,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あ、あのー、普段は主に自宅に閉じこもってゲームなどを楽しんでおります」","en":"“Um... I ordinarily spend most of my time shut inside my home, enjoying video games and similar pursuits.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r61","rowIndex":61,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なるほど！　ゲーマーか。おれ、ああいうのすぐ頭が痛くなっちゃってダメなんだよ。でも好きな人は好きだよな。よく眠りもしないで長時間遊んでる人の話とか聞くけど、集中力がすごい」","en":"“I see! A gamer. Those things give me a headache right away, so I’m no good at them. But the people who like them really love them, don’t they? You hear about people playing for hours without even sleeping. Their powers of concentration are incredible.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r62","rowIndex":62,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おれが微笑みかけると、<tips=51>さくら</tips>はますます引きつって、","en":"I smiled at her, and <tips=51>Sakura’s</tips> smile grew more strained still.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r63","rowIndex":63,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あ、ありがとうございます……」","en":"“Th-thank you...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r64","rowIndex":64,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　と言った。","en":"That was her answer.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r65","rowIndex":65,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=44>シウ</tips>と<tips=51>さくら</tips>は肩をくっつけあって仲良く一つのメニューを見て、ああでもないこうでもないと言っている。","en":"<tips=44>Siu</tips> and <tips=51>Sakura</tips> sat shoulder to shoulder over a single menu, companionably going back and forth over what to choose.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r66","rowIndex":66,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=44>シウ</tips>は何だか暗い感じで、<tips=51>さくら</tips>はそれを気遣う様子を見せている。不自然な様子だったので<tips=44>シウ</tips>の顔をよく見ると、目の縁が少し赤くなり、まぶたがちょっと腫れぼったい。まるで泣いたあとのように見えた。","en":"There was something dark about <tips=44>Siu’s</tips> mood, and <tips=51>Sakura</tips> appeared solicitous toward her. Their behavior struck me as odd, so I took a closer look at <tips=44>Siu’s</tips> face. The rims of her eyes were slightly red and her eyelids a little swollen. She looked as though she had been crying.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r67","rowIndex":67,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　一体これは何だろう？","en":"What in the world had happened?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r68","rowIndex":68,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=1>亮</tips>に、こんな凄い美人の妹がいたんだね……」","en":"“I never knew <tips=1>Ryo</tips> had a sister this beautiful...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r69","rowIndex":69,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　さっきまで硬直して何も言えなかった<tips=66>コンタ</tips>が、おれにそう耳打ちする。","en":"<tips=66>Konta</tips>, who until then had been too petrified to speak, leaned over and whispered to me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r70","rowIndex":70,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「変な気を起こすのはやめとけよ。<tips=1>亮</tips>はこの妹を溺愛してるからな。ヤツを敵に回すのをいとわないというなら好きにすればいい」","en":"“Don’t get any ideas. <tips=1>Ryo</tips> dotes on his sister. If you don’t mind making an enemy of him, do whatever you like.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r71","rowIndex":71,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いや、ちょっとやめとくよ……」","en":"“No. I think I’ll pass...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r72","rowIndex":72,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=66>コンタ</tips>は情けない顔をして言う。<tips=1>亮</tips>を怒らせた時の相手に対するおそろしい仕打ちを想像したに違いない。","en":"<tips=66>Konta</tips> said it with a pitiful look on his face. He must have imagined the terrible things <tips=1>Ryo</tips> would do to anyone who made him angry.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r73","rowIndex":73,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　昔の仲間なら、きっと誰でも<tips=66>コンタ</tips>と同じような反応をするだろう。","en":"Anyone from our old group would probably have reacted much as <tips=66>Konta</tips> did.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r74","rowIndex":74,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　苦笑しているところへ、店員がおれと<tips=66>コンタ</tips>の料理を運んできた。","en":"As I smiled wryly, a server brought over the food <tips=66>Konta</tips> and I had ordered.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r75","rowIndex":75,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あ、二人とも注文は決まったか？」","en":"“Have you two decided what to order?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r76","rowIndex":76,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　受け取りながら尋ねると、","en":"I asked while accepting the dishes.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r77","rowIndex":77,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「私はレッドカレーをお願いします。<tips=44>筱喬</tips>はランチセットAで」","en":"“I’ll have the red curry, please. <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> will have lunch set A.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r78","rowIndex":78,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=51>さくら</tips>が二人分を注文した。","en":"<tips=51>Sakura</tips> ordered for them both.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r79","rowIndex":79,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　やはり<tips=44>シウ</tips>は表情が暗い。運ばれた水にも手をつけず、ぼんやりそっぽを眺めている。","en":"<tips=44>Siu</tips> still looked despondent. She did not touch the water they brought, but stared blankly off to one side.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r80","rowIndex":80,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「今日は二人で何をしていたんだ？」","en":"“What were the two of you doing today?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r81","rowIndex":81,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おれは彼女の気持ちをほぐすためにそう話しかけたのだが、","en":"I meant the question to lighten her mood.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r82","rowIndex":82,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あ、あの、今日は、友だちの服を買ってあげようと<tips=57>滑走路通り</tips>を歩いていて。あの……」","en":"“Um... today we were walking down <tips=57>Runway Street</tips> because I wanted to buy my friend some clothes. Um...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r83","rowIndex":83,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=44>シウ</tips>はなんとか答えようとしてくれるのだが、途中で言葉を詰まらせてしまう。","en":"<tips=44>Siu</tips> tried her best to answer, but faltered halfway through.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r84","rowIndex":84,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　これはよほどのことだな。","en":"This had to be something serious.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r85","rowIndex":85,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=44>筱喬</tips>の調子が良くなかったのに、私が無理矢理連れ出しちゃったんです。それでかえって疲れさせちゃったみたいでー。私空気読めないんですよねー」","en":"“<tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> wasn’t feeling well, but I dragged her out with me anyway. It looks like all I did was wear her out even more. I really can’t read the room, can I?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r86","rowIndex":86,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=51>さくら</tips>が苦笑しながらそう説明する。","en":"<tips=51>Sakura</tips> explained with an awkward smile.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r87","rowIndex":87,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ねえ<tips=44>筱喬</tips>、今日はご飯食べたらもう帰ろっか？　<tips=40><tips=40>天明</tips>と<tips=40>天祥</tips></tips>のかわいい洋服選びは、今度にしよう。あの子たちの誕生日まで、まだもうちょっと時間あるし」","en":"“<tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips>, why don’t we go home after we eat today? We can choose cute clothes for <tips=40><tips=40>Tin-ming</tips> and <tips=40>Tin-cheung</tips></tips> another time. There’s still a little while before their birthday.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r88","rowIndex":88,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……ご、ごめんなさい。<tips=51>さくら</tips>だって大変ななか、元気づけようとしてくれてるのに……」","en":"“...I-I’m sorry. You’re having a hard time yourself, <tips=51>Sakura</tips>, and you came to cheer me up...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r89","rowIndex":89,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=44>シウ</tips>は申し訳なさそうに俯いた。","en":"<tips=44>Siu</tips> lowered her eyes apologetically.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r90","rowIndex":90,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「私は全然大変じゃないから。何度も同じこと言ってると、スカートめくるよ？」","en":"“I’m not having a hard time at all. If you keep repeating yourself, I’ll lift your skirt.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r91","rowIndex":91,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=51>さくら</tips>は笑って欲しくてそう言ったのだろうが、","en":"<tips=51>Sakura</tips> had probably said it in the hope of making her laugh.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r92","rowIndex":92,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「うん、ごめん……」","en":"“Yes. Sorry...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r93","rowIndex":93,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=44>シウ</tips>は乗って来ない。","en":"<tips=44>Siu</tips> did not play along.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r94","rowIndex":94,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「一体何があったんだ？　ただごとじゃないぞ？」","en":"“What on earth happened? This is clearly serious.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r95","rowIndex":95,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　見るに見かねておれがそう尋ねたが、","en":"Unable to watch any longer, I asked her directly.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r96","rowIndex":96,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「すみません。そんな、大したことじゃないんです」","en":"“I’m sorry. It is nothing so serious.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r97","rowIndex":97,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　と笑ってみせるが、あきらかに無理をしている表情である。","en":"She smiled, but the strain upon her face was obvious.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r98","rowIndex":98,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　会食は終始そんな調子で、おれや<tips=51>さくら</tips>が道化に徹して冗談を飛ばしても変に上滑りするばかりだし、<tips=66>コンタ</tips>は気を遣って黙りがちになっているし、どうにもならなかった。","en":"The entire meal went that way. <tips=51>Sakura</tips> and I played the fool and kept cracking jokes, but every one of them landed strangely flat. <tips=66>Konta</tips>, trying to be considerate, hardly spoke at all. Nothing helped.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r99","rowIndex":99,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「申し訳ないです。今日は、私がいるせいで暗くなっちゃって……」","en":"“I’m sorry. I made everything so gloomy today just by being here...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r100","rowIndex":100,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　店の外に出てから、<tips=44>筱喬</tips>はそう頭を下げる。","en":"Once we were outside, <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> bowed as she apologized.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r101","rowIndex":101,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「私だめなんです。感情がすぐ出ちゃう。いやな気分になると暗くなっちゃうし、悲しいときは顔に出ちゃう。お兄ちゃんにはよく我慢が足りないって言われます」","en":"“I’m hopeless. Everything I feel comes out at once. When something upsets me, I grow gloomy, and whenever I’m sad, it shows on my face. My brother is always telling me I need to learn some self-control.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r102","rowIndex":102,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「謝る理由なんかなにもないよ。おれは楽しかった。久しぶりに<tips=44>シウ</tips>の顔が見られたからな」","en":"“You have no reason to apologize. I enjoyed myself. I hadn’t seen your face in a long time, <tips=44>Siu</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r103","rowIndex":103,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おれはそう言って微笑んでみせると、","en":"I smiled at her.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r104","rowIndex":104,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「誰にだって暗く落ち込むときはあるんだ。気にしないでいい。<tips=51>さくら</tips>ちゃんだって、つらいなかこうして<tips=44>シウ</tips>が来てくれただけで嬉しいはずだよ。<tips=1>亮</tips>の言うことは話半分に聞いておけばいいんだ」","en":"“Everyone gets gloomy and depressed sometimes. You don’t need to hold it against yourself. Even with everything she’s going through, <tips=51>Sakura</tips> must be glad that <tips=44>Siu</tips> came out with her. And you should only ever take half of what <tips=1>Ryo</tips> says seriously.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r105","rowIndex":105,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おれの言葉に、<tips=51>さくら</tips>は無言でうんうんと頷いている。","en":"At my words, <tips=51>Sakura</tips> silently nodded again and again.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r106","rowIndex":106,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そ、そうだよ。きみのお兄ちゃんは普通の人とはちょっと違うんだから。悪い奴じゃないんだけど、ズレてるっていうか……あっ、これはお兄ちゃんには内緒だからね」","en":"“Th-that’s right. Your brother is a little different from ordinary people. He isn’t a bad man, but he’s rather... out of step. Oh, but don’t tell him I said that.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"田中紺太","displayName":"Konta Tanaka","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r107","rowIndex":107,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=66>コンタ</tips>が慌ててそう口止めすると、<tips=44>シウ</tips>はやっとちょっと笑い、","en":"When <tips=66>Konta</tips> hurriedly swore her to secrecy, <tips=44>Siu</tips> finally gave a small laugh.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r108","rowIndex":108,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ありがとうございます」","en":"“Thank you.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r109","rowIndex":109,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　と、頭を下げた。","en":"She bowed her head.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r110","rowIndex":110,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　一体何があったのだろう？　おれは何度か尋ねてみたが、結局彼女は理由を一言も話さずじまいである。","en":"What in the world had happened? I tried asking several times, but in the end, she never said a word about why she was upset.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r111","rowIndex":111,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>で起こったことだったら、立場上言えないのかもしれない。","en":"If it concerned something within <tips=7>YS</tips>, perhaps her position prevented her from speaking.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r112","rowIndex":112,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　気になりながら迎えた別れ際、<tips=51>さくら</tips>がふっと浮かんで飛んできて、おれの袖を掴むと、","en":"The question still troubled me when it came time to part. <tips=51>Sakura</tips> suddenly floated over, caught my sleeve, and said,","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r113","rowIndex":113,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あの、連絡先交換させてもらえます？　<tips=44>筱喬</tips>のことで相談したいことがあるんです」","en":"“Um, could we exchange contact information? There’s something I’d like to talk to you about concerning <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"熨田さくら","displayName":"Sakura Noshida","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r114","rowIndex":114,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　取り出した携帯電話を片手に小声でおれに耳打ちしてきた。","en":"Phone in hand, she leaned close and whispered to me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r115","rowIndex":115,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「もちろん」","en":"“Of course.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r116","rowIndex":116,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おれは携帯電話を取り出す。","en":"I took out my own phone.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r117","rowIndex":117,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「助かります。他に、<tips=44>筱喬</tips>とお兄さん両方と親しい人がいなくて……」","en":"“Thank you. I don’t know anyone else who’s close to both <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> and her brother...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"熨田さくら","displayName":"Sakura Noshida","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r118","rowIndex":118,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=51>さくら</tips>はさっきみなで喋っているときとは違った深刻なトーンで言う。","en":"<tips=51>Sakura’s</tips> tone was far more serious than it had been during the group conversation.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r119","rowIndex":119,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そしておれたちは通信機能でお互いの連絡先を、お互いの端末に記憶させ、またポケットにしまった。","en":"Using the phones’ wireless link, we transferred our contact details to each other’s devices, then slipped them back into our pockets.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r120","rowIndex":120,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「じゃあ、またあとで」","en":"“I’ll speak to you later.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"熨田さくら","displayName":"Sakura Noshida","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r121","rowIndex":121,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=51>さくら</tips>はまたふっと飛ぶと、向こうでこちらを不審げに見ている<tips=44>シウ</tips>の側に着地し、顔にさっきまでの剽軽な笑顔を浮かべる。そして恥ずかしがって避けようとする<tips=44>シウ</tips>に抱きつくと、そのまま二人で空に舞い上がった。","en":"<tips=51>Sakura</tips> rose lightly into the air again and landed beside <tips=44>Siu</tips>, who was watching us suspiciously from a distance. Her earlier playful grin returned; when <tips=44>Siu</tips> bashfully tried to dodge her, Sakura caught her in an embrace and swept them both into the sky.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r122","rowIndex":122,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それを見ていた周囲から、「おお」と驚きの声が上がる。","en":"People nearby raised cries of astonishment.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r123","rowIndex":123,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女たちが空の向こうの小さな点になってしまうと、おれも、目を丸くして彼女たちの背中をみつめている<tips=66>コンタ</tips>の肩を叩いて、別の方向に歩き出す。","en":"Once they had dwindled to a speck in the distance, I clapped the wide-eyed <tips=66>Konta</tips> on the shoulder, and we walked away in another direction.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r124","rowIndex":124,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　夜、部屋に帰る。","en":"That night, I returned to my apartment.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r125","rowIndex":125,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その日は、昼食のあと、いつも通り饅頭の営業のためにサンプルを持ってあちこち歩き回った。","en":"That day, after lunch, I set out with samples and made my usual round of sales calls for our buns.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r126","rowIndex":126,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　可能性が高い場所は初期のうちにあらかたまわってしまったので、最近は新規開拓する場所もなくなって、<tips=58>パラシュート通り</tips>の洋服屋などにも足を運ぶ始末だ。もちろん置いては貰えなかった。","en":"We had exhausted most of the promising prospects early on. Lately there was nowhere new left to canvass, and I had been reduced to calling even on clothing shops along <tips=58>Parachute Street</tips>. Naturally, none of them agreed to stock the buns.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r127","rowIndex":127,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　今日は新しく契約を結べた店はゼロ。つまりまったくの徒労だったというわけだ。","en":"The number of new contracts I secured that day: zero. In other words, it had all been an utter waste of time.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r128","rowIndex":128,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　こうなると普段よりも一段と重く疲労が身体にのしかかる。玄関をはいるとそのまま着替えもせずに街の埃で汚れた姿のままソファーに横になった。――ああ疲れた。頭のなかにグルグルと思考やイメージが飛び回る。やたらとハラも減る。そう言えば、今日は昼以来何も食べていない。","en":"At times like this, fatigue weighs on the body even more heavily than usual. As soon as I stepped inside, I lay down on the sofa without even changing, still covered in the dust of the city. —God, I’m tired. Thoughts and images went spinning round and round inside my head. I was ravenously hungry, too. Come to think of it, I hadn’t eaten anything since lunch.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r129","rowIndex":129,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　じりじりと事業が軌道に乗り始めてはいるものの、それ以上に初期の頃からつき合ってくれたみんなの疲労も限界に達しつつある。今は堪え忍ぶときと言ったが、その『今』がいつまで続くのか誰も確答は出来ない。","en":"The business was grinding its way onto a stable course, but the companions who had supported me from the beginning were reaching the limits of their endurance even faster. I had called this a period we needed to weather. Yet no one could say with certainty how long ‘this period’ would last.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r130","rowIndex":130,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　レナのような例もある。はっきりそうだとは断言出来ないが、発症の原因の一端はオーバーワークにあるだろう。","en":"There was Rena’s case as well. I could not state it as fact, but overwork had probably been one of the factors behind her onset.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r131","rowIndex":131,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女も初期の頃からおれの考えに賛同し、今はそれほどでもないが随分無理をさせた時期もあった。","en":"She had agreed with my ideas from the early days. Things were not as bad now, but there had been periods when I demanded far too much from her.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r132","rowIndex":132,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　シングルマザーとして子育てもしなければならないわけだし、日々の生活に追われてたまった疲れを回復させる時間もなかったはずだ。","en":"She also had to raise a child as a single mother. With every day consumed by the necessities of life, she could have had no time to recover from her accumulating exhaustion.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r133","rowIndex":133,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　早い段階でああいった協力者には充分な休みと報酬を手渡したいが、今日明日に出来るというようなことでもない。","en":"I wanted to give supporters like her sufficient rest and pay as soon as possible, but that was not something I could accomplish tomorrow, or the day after.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r134","rowIndex":134,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　溜息が出てしまう。","en":"A sigh escaped me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r135","rowIndex":135,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　いかんね。これはどうも。","en":"This was no good. No good at all.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r136","rowIndex":136,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おれはソファーの上でごそごそと芋虫のように動いて、うつぶせから仰向けに姿勢を変更する。","en":"I wriggled over the sofa like a caterpillar and turned myself from my stomach onto my back.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r137","rowIndex":137,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　……それにしても、レナは大変だ。","en":"...Still, Rena had it terribly hard.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r138","rowIndex":138,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　あのアパートに辿り着いて縛られている姿を見たとき、おれは昔のことを思い出した。","en":"When I reached that apartment and saw her tied up, I remembered the past.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r139","rowIndex":139,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　世間ではおれはほとんど赤ん坊の頃にどこかに捨てられて、<tips=21>八龍会</tips>の<tips=22>老人たち</tips>に拾われたように思われているが、実際はもう少し大きくなってからのことだ。","en":"Most people believed I had been abandoned somewhere as an infant and found by the <tips=22>Elders</tips> of the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips>. In reality, I had been somewhat older.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r140","rowIndex":140,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　五才くらいまでは母親のところで育ち、母親が育てられなくなってから施設に預けられた。<tips=55>松坊</tips>だって知らないが、おれはたった三ヶ月くらいだと思うけれども施設も経験しているのである。すぐに<tips=22>老人たち</tips>に拾われ、彼らのもとで育てられるようになったが、もしおれが<tips=16>タイプA</tips>でなければそのまま施設にいただろう。","en":"My mother raised me until I was approximately five. When she could no longer do so, I was placed in a children’s institution. Not even <tips=55>Matsu</tips> knew, but I had spent time in one myself, though I believed it was only about three months. The <tips=22>Elders</tips> soon found me and began raising me among them. Had I not been <tips=16>Type A</tips>, I would probably have remained in the institution.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r141","rowIndex":141,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おれのサイキック能力は便利ではあるが、そこまで大したものではない。が、<tips=22>老人たち</tips>は「<tips=17>タイプB</tips>でありながらはっきりしたサイキック能力がある」というだけで、何か特別なものを感じてくれたらしい。","en":"My psychic ability was useful, but hardly overwhelming. Nevertheless, the mere fact that I was ‘a <tips=17>Type B</tips> who possessed a clear psychic ability’ apparently convinced the <tips=22>Elders</tips> that I was something special.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r142","rowIndex":142,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　あと、おれの誕生日やらなにやらが、中国の占いで非常に優れたリーダーとしての資質をあらわしているんだそうだ。意外と彼らはオカルトチックなんだよね。<tips=90>ミスター・チェン</tips>の本職は占い師だったと思う。","en":"They also said that my birthday and various other details marked me, in Chinese fortune-telling, as possessing the qualities of an exceptional leader. The Elders were more given to the occult than one might expect. I believe <tips=90>Mr. Chen</tips> was actually a fortune-teller by trade.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r143","rowIndex":143,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ということで、五才までの間は母親がいた。スラムで朝から酒を飲んで路上で寝転がっているような連中を当たれば当時のおれたちの暮らしを知る人もいるだろうが、仲間たちには話したことがない。ただ<tips=1>亮</tips>だけが本当のことを知っている。","en":"In any event, my mother was there until I turned five. If one questioned the people who spent their mornings drinking and lying in the streets of the slums, someone might remember how we lived. I never spoke of it to my companions. <tips=1>Ryo</tips> alone knew the truth.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r144","rowIndex":144,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　あまり言いたくない話だから、滅多なことじゃ口にしなかったんだ。","en":"It was not a subject I liked discussing, so I very rarely did.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r145","rowIndex":145,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>はもっと小さい時の記憶でもはっきり覚えているそうだが、おれはそれほど物覚えがいい人間でもないらしく、五才まで過ごした割には思い出が少ない。それでも、まるきり記憶がないというわけじゃない。","en":"<tips=1>Ryo</tips> claimed to remember even earlier childhood with perfect clarity. I did not seem to possess such a good memory. Considering that I lived there for five years, I recalled remarkably little. That did not mean I remembered nothing.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r146","rowIndex":146,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=59>暗闇通り</tips>か、他のどこかか、住所ははっきりとはわからないが、ボロボロのアパートに住んでいた。母さんが一人、子供はおれ一人。父親はいなかった。家には大人の男が何人か出入りしていて、もしかしたらそのうちの誰かが父親だったのかもしれないが、そんな感じでもない。","en":"We lived in a decrepit apartment, perhaps on <tips=59>Darkness Street</tips>, perhaps somewhere else; I no longer know the address. There was Mother, and there was me. No father. Several grown men came and went. One of them might have been my father, but it never felt that way.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r147","rowIndex":147,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おれの記憶のなかでは母さんはいつもベッドにヒモで縛り付けられていた。金色の目をぎらぎらとさせて、一人でブツブツと喋ったり笑ったりしている。調子が良いときはおれのことが息子だってわかるようだが、それ以外は部屋に出入りする男たちと同じようなものだと認識していた。","en":"In my memory, Mother was always tied to her bed with cords. Her golden eyes glittered as she muttered and laughed to herself. On her better days, she seemed to recognize me as her son. Otherwise, she regarded me as no different from the men who entered the room.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r148","rowIndex":148,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　丁度、今日のレナのような具合だったのさ。それが毎日続くんだ。","en":"She was in much the same condition as Rena that day—except it continued every day.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r149","rowIndex":149,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　今思うと、あの状態の母さんが働けるはずもないから、おれたちの生活費は、出入りする男たちのうち誰かが払ってくれたのだろう。遺産などの個人資産はなかったと思う。男たちはおれに優しく、食べ物をくれたり服をくれたりするので好きだった。","en":"Looking back, Mother could not possibly have worked in that state. I suppose one or another of the men who came and went must have paid our living expenses. I do not think she had an inheritance or any other money of her own. The men were kind to me and gave me food and clothes, so I liked them.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r150","rowIndex":150,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おれの右腕の力が何かの役に立つと思って手懐けただけかもしれないけれど、それだけでもなかったと思うよ。","en":"They might have been taming me because they thought the power of my right arm would prove useful, but I do not believe that was all there was to it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r151","rowIndex":151,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　母さんは本当にやかましくて、しかも人の悪口ばっかり言う。ご飯を食べさせてやっても、排泄物を処理してやっても、憎々しく悪口ばかり言う。そして金切り声で叫ぶものだからたまらない。いくら話しかけてなだめようとしても無駄だ。","en":"Mother was terribly loud and did nothing but abuse people. They could feed her or clean away her waste, and still she spat hateful insults at them. Then she screamed in a shrill voice no one could endure. Speaking gently or trying to calm her accomplished nothing.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r152","rowIndex":152,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　だから、母さんのベッドの横には木製のバットが一本置いてあり、あまりにもうるさいときは男がそれで殴った。だからバットには血がこびりついていた。おれもその殴る光景を見ていたけれど、男たちの方がいつもおれに優しかったし、母さんのうるさいのにも閉口していたから、なんとも思わなかった。","en":"That was why a wooden bat stood beside Mother’s bed. Whenever she grew unbearably loud, one of the men beat her with it. Blood was crusted on the bat. I watched them do it, but the men were always kind to me, and I was sick of Mother’s screaming myself, so I felt nothing at all.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r153","rowIndex":153,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「お前も、本当にうるさかったら使っていいんだぞ」","en":"“If she gets too loud for you, you can use it too.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r154","rowIndex":154,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　と男たちはおれに言ったが、臆病だったおれは自分で棒を手にとったことはなかった。","en":"The men told me that, but I was a timid child and had never picked up the bat myself.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r155","rowIndex":155,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その日が訪れるまでは。","en":"Not until that day.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r156","rowIndex":156,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　テレビではお気に入りのアニメが放送されていて、五才のおれは床に座ってそれを見ていた。","en":"My favorite anime was playing on television, and at five years old I sat watching it on the floor.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r157","rowIndex":157,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　なんのアニメだったかな？　超能力者が活躍するやつだったと思う。おれは変身ものとか、特殊な能力をもった人間が活躍する作品がちっちゃなときから大好きだったんだ。","en":"Which anime was it? I think it was one where psychics were the heroes. Ever since I was little, I had loved transformation stories and shows about people with special powers.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r158","rowIndex":158,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それを見ていると、母さんが騒ぎはじめた。最初は我慢していたのだけれど、声がどんどん大きくなる。","en":"As I watched, Mother began making noise. At first I endured it, but her voice grew steadily louder.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r159","rowIndex":159,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　何を言っても聞いてくれないのはわかっていたが、","en":"I knew she would not listen to anything I said, but I tried anyway.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r160","rowIndex":160,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「うるさいよ！」","en":"“You’re too loud!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r161","rowIndex":161,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　一応言う。けれども母さんは、何かぎゃあぎゃあと言っている。","en":"I tell her so, at least. But Mother just keeps yelling something or other.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r162","rowIndex":162,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ほとんど言葉になっていないけれど、よく聞くとどうも水を飲みたいと言っているらしい。","en":"Almost none of it formed words, but listening closely, I gathered that she wanted water.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r163","rowIndex":163,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おれは立ち上がってキッチンに行くと吸い飲みに蛇口から水を汲んで、ベッドの側までやって来た。","en":"I stood, went to the kitchen, filled a feeding cup from the tap, and brought it to the bed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r164","rowIndex":164,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ろくに風呂にも入れられていない母さんの側に来ると、酸っぱいような汗の臭いと、便や尿の臭いがする。これが、おれが母さんを思い出すといつも感じ取れる臭いだ。","en":"When I came close to Mother, who hardly ever got a bath, I could smell sour sweat, feces, and urine. Whenever I remember her, this is the smell I remember.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r165","rowIndex":165,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　男たちはたまには風呂に入れたり身体を洗ったりしてくれるのだが、すぐにこの臭いに変わってしまう。人間ってのは、みんなが思ってるよりずっとにおいやすいものなんだ。","en":"The men would bathe her or wash her down once in a while, but it never took long for the smell to come back. People start to stink a lot more easily than everyone thinks.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r166","rowIndex":166,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　母さんの髪の毛は油で固まってべとべとで、乾いてひび割れた唇のなかには黄色いカスがべっとりとついた歯が見える。ゲッソリとコケ落ちた白い頬。目のまわりは落ちくぼみ、真っ黒なクマが浮かんでいる。まぶたはこれ以上ないくらい大きく見開かれ、まばたきをほとんどしない。白目は充血し、瞳は金色にらんらんと輝き、ぎょろりと動くとおれの顔を見る。","en":"Mother’s hair was stiff with grease and clung together. Behind dry, cracked lips, her teeth were coated in yellow grime. Her pale cheeks were hollow and wasted, her eyes sunken into deep black circles. She held her eyelids open as wide as they could go and almost never blinked. The whites were bloodshot, while the irises blazed gold. Her eyes rolled toward me and fixed upon my face.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r167","rowIndex":167,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　発症する前は美人で大人しい人だったそうだがその面影は完全に消えている。","en":"They say she was a beautiful, quiet woman before onset, but every trace of the woman she had been was gone.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r168","rowIndex":168,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おれは無言で吸い飲みを差し出し、その唇の端に先端を触れさせる。","en":"Without speaking, I offered the feeding cup and placed its spout against the corner of her mouth.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r169","rowIndex":169,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　母さんは吸おうとはせず、おれの顔を見ながら言葉にならない言葉をまくし立てる。","en":"Mother made no attempt to drink. She stared at my face and rattled off a stream of words that made no sense.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r170","rowIndex":170,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それでも飲ませようと、先端を口に少し差し入れると、首を振ってそれを拒否し、","en":"I inserted the tip a short distance into her mouth, still trying to make her drink. She shook her head, refused it, and cried,","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r171","rowIndex":171,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なんてことするんだ！　死ね！　死ね！」","en":"“What are you doing? Die! Die!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r172","rowIndex":172,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　と繰り返す。","en":"She repeated the words.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r173","rowIndex":173,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　もう慣れきったおれにはその言葉は何も響かない。最初の頃はもっと敏感に反応したらしい。泣いてすがりついたり、興奮したり……そう、今日のレナの娘のような……でも、毎日繰り返されれば人は慣れるものだ。どんなことにも。","en":"By then I was so used to those words that they did not touch me at all. It seems I had been more sensitive at first—crying, clinging to her, getting worked up... like Rena’s daughter today. But repeat anything day after day and a person gets used to it. Anything at all.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r174","rowIndex":174,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　もし慣れることが出来なければ、淘汰されてしまう。外の街からやって来て、適応することが出来ずに死んでいった者も、これまで何度も見てきた。","en":"Those who could not adapt were selected out. I had watched many people come from the outer city, fail to adjust, and die.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r175","rowIndex":175,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　とにかく、そのときのおれは、ただ、早くアニメの続きが見たいのにと、そんなことを考えている。","en":"All I was thinking then was that I wanted to hurry up and get back to my anime.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r176","rowIndex":176,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　だから、初めてだというのに、そのバットを手に取る動きもスムーズで、迷いも葛藤もなかった。","en":"Even though it was my first time, I reached for the bat smoothly, without a moment’s hesitation or inner conflict.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r177","rowIndex":177,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　他の大人がやっているようにやればいい。","en":"I only had to do what the other adults did.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r178","rowIndex":178,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　……当時このようにして<tips=17>タイプＢ</tips>の患者をしつけるのは当たり前の方法だった。今でもやっている人はいる。","en":"...Back then, disciplining <tips=17>Type B</tips> patients this way was considered perfectly normal. Some people still do it today.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r179","rowIndex":179,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　誰にも罪悪感なんかないのは、たとえば熱が出たら解熱剤を飲ませたり、のどに魚の小骨が刺さった時にご飯を飲み込ませたりするのに誰も罪の意識を覚えないのと同じだ。","en":"No one feels any guilt about it, just as no one feels guilty about giving someone a fever reducer or making them swallow rice when a fish bone is stuck in their throat.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r180","rowIndex":180,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おれはバットを振りかぶって、母さんの胸の上に振り下ろした。やせ細ってほとんど肉のない母さんの身体を叩くと、直接骨をバットで叩いたような感触があった。","en":"I raised the bat and brought it down upon Mother’s chest. Her body was so wasted that almost no flesh covered it, and the impact felt as though I had struck bone directly.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r181","rowIndex":181,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「げっ」","en":"“Guh.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r182","rowIndex":182,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　と咳き込むような悲鳴のような声をあげて、母さんは黙り込む。そして怯えた目でおれを見る。","en":"Mother gave a sound somewhere between a cough and a scream, then fell silent. She looked at me in terror.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r183","rowIndex":183,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おれはやっと静かになったと、またテレビアニメに戻った。","en":"Relieved that she was finally quiet, I went back to watching my anime.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r184","rowIndex":184,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しかし、どういうわけか、そうまでしてせっかく得られたアニメの時間を楽しむことが出来ないんだ。","en":"But for some reason, after everything I had done to win myself that precious time with my anime, I could not enjoy it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r185","rowIndex":185,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　台詞が耳に入らなくて、内容がうまく理解出来ない。","en":"None of the dialogue registered, and I could not follow what was happening.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r186","rowIndex":186,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　胸がざわついて、たまらなかった。","en":"My chest churned unbearably.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r187","rowIndex":187,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　――そのときはっきりと自覚したわけじゃないんだが、これが罪の意識ってやつなんだ。母さんを殴ってしまったのが、恐ろしくて仕方なかったんだ。","en":"—I did not recognize it clearly at the time, but that was what they call a guilty conscience. The fact that I had hit Mother frightened me more than I could bear.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r188","rowIndex":188,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　慣れてすれっからしになってしまったようなおれの心にも、まだ普通の子供みたいな部分が残っていたってことだ。それはきっと本能のように魂に刻みつけられたものなのかもしれない。","en":"Even in a heart as hardened and jaded as mine had become, some part of an ordinary child still remained. Perhaps it was something engraved upon the soul, almost like an instinct.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r189","rowIndex":189,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おれは泣き出してしまって、母さんのところに戻った。","en":"I began to cry and returned to Mother.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r190","rowIndex":190,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　母さんは怒っていない。少し正気を取り戻していたのかもしれない。","en":"She was not angry. Perhaps she had regained some measure of lucidity.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r191","rowIndex":191,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おれを穏やかな目で見て、","en":"She looked at me with gentle eyes and said,","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r192","rowIndex":192,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=10>道夫</tips>。このロープをとって。縛られているところが痛いの……」","en":"“<tips=10>Michio</tips>. Take off these ropes. They hurt where they bind me...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r193","rowIndex":193,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　と静かに言うんだ。","en":"Her voice was quiet.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r194","rowIndex":194,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おれはうなずき、右腕の力を使ってロープを切断した。","en":"I nodded and used the power of my right arm to sever the ropes.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r195","rowIndex":195,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　母さんは縛られたところをさすると、ふらつく身体で立ち上がった。","en":"Mother rubbed the places where she had been tied, then rose unsteadily.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r196","rowIndex":196,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ここを出よう。もっと素敵な場所で二人で幸せに暮らそう」","en":"“Let’s leave this place. We’ll live happily together somewhere much nicer.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r197","rowIndex":197,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　母さんはそう言っておれに微笑み、おれは引き込まれるように頷いたんだ。","en":"Mother smiled at me. Drawn in, I nodded.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r198","rowIndex":198,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そしておれたちはアパートを出た。母さんは裸足だった。そして楽しそうに笑っていた。","en":"We left the apartment. Mother was barefoot, and she laughed with delight.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r199","rowIndex":199,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それはもう妄想の笑いだったのかもしれないけど、仮に楽しいのは症状のせいだったとしても、久しぶりに人間らしい顔を見たから楽しかった。","en":"Perhaps it was already the laughter of someone lost in delusion. But even if her happiness came only from her symptoms, I was happy because it was the first time in ages I had seen a human expression on her face.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r200","rowIndex":200,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それに、母さんと手を繋いで街を歩くなんて、生まれて初めてだったんだ。","en":"And besides, it was the first time in my life that I had walked through the city holding Mother’s hand.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r201","rowIndex":201,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おれたちはそのまま<tips=57>滑走路通り</tips>まで歩いて、そこで母さんは倒れ込んで警察に保護された。","en":"We walked all the way to <tips=57>Runway Street</tips>, where Mother collapsed and was taken into police care.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r202","rowIndex":202,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　倒れ込んだのが<tips=57>滑走路通り</tips>でなければ母さんはアパートへ逆戻りしていただろう。だけど、<tips=57>滑走路通り</tips>は街の人間だけじゃなく、外からやって来た人間も多い。彼らは発症した<tips=17>タイプＢ</tips>に慣れていない。だから通報なんていうおおげさな事態になり、警察が出動し、そして母さんにはこの街の外のルールが適用されたというわけなんだ。","en":"If she had collapsed anywhere but <tips=57>Runway Street</tips>, Mother would have been sent straight back to the apartment. But <tips=57>Runway Street</tips> was frequented not only by people from the city, but by plenty of outsiders as well. They were not accustomed to <tips=17>Type B</tips> patients who had suffered onset. And so it escalated into something as drastic as calling the authorities: the police came, and Mother was treated according to the rules of the world outside this city.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r203","rowIndex":203,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そのまま母さんは<tips=17>タイプB</tips>のための病院施設へ入院させられ、そのあと何度か転院を繰り返したあと、行方不明になった。","en":"Mother was admitted directly to a hospital facility for <tips=17>Type B</tips> patients. After being transferred several times, she disappeared.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r204","rowIndex":204,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そしておれは児童養護施設へ引き取られ、その後は<tips=21>八龍会</tips>の爺さんたちの保護をうけることになったのさ。","en":"And I was taken in by a children’s home, after which I came under the protection of the Elders of the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r205","rowIndex":205,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　こんなの、別に珍しい境遇じゃない。このあたりの路地ではよくあることさ。","en":"There was nothing particularly unusual about circumstances like mine. That sort of thing happened all the time in the alleys around here.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r206","rowIndex":206,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ガキのころに仲間になった連中は似たような育ち方をしたやつばかりだ。","en":"The friends I fell in with as a kid had all grown up much the same way.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r207","rowIndex":207,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=66>コンタ</tips>だって、<tips=86>灰上の姉妹</tips>だって、<tips=1>亮</tips>だって……。","en":"<tips=66>Konta</tips>, the <tips=86>Haigami sisters</tips>, <tips=1>Ryo</tips>...","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r208","rowIndex":208,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　特に、<tips=1>亮</tips>とはそっくりかもしれないな。そう思ったからあいつにだけおれは母親を殴ったことを話したし、あいつもそれを感じたから、おれだけは家に連れて行ってくれたのかもしれない。","en":"I may have had more in common with <tips=1>Ryo</tips> than anyone. That was why he was the only one I told about hitting my mother, and perhaps because he felt it too, I was the only one he ever took home with him.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r209","rowIndex":209,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　初めて彼の母さんに会わせて貰った時のことを、おれはよく覚えている。","en":"I remember very clearly the first time he let me meet his mother.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r210","rowIndex":210,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ベッドの上に横たわり、あの病気特有の笑顔を浮かべていた。","en":"She lay on the bed with the peculiar smile of that illness on her face.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r211","rowIndex":211,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>は会話の出来ない母さんにおれを紹介すると、それまで見たこともない優しい顔でご飯を食べさせてやっていたんだ。","en":"<tips=1>Ryo</tips> introduced me to his mother, who could no longer carry on a conversation, then fed her with a gentle expression I had never seen on him before.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r212","rowIndex":212,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　発症した母親を見せてくれるってことは、<tips=1>亮</tips>はそれだけおれのことを信頼してるんだなって思って、ひどく嬉しかった。","en":"I thought that if <tips=1>Ryo</tips> was willing to show me his mother after her onset, he must trust me that deeply. It made me tremendously happy.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r213","rowIndex":213,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　色々と昔のことを思い出しているうちに、ますます睡魔が遠ざかってしまった。","en":"As I went on remembering one thing after another from the past, sleep receded even farther.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r214","rowIndex":214,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　どうも寝付けそうになく、おれは立ち上がって酒を探す。普段はほとんど家では飲まないが、確か、このあいだ<tips=91>ミスター・スミス</tips>がくれたウイスキーがあったはずだ。","en":"Sleep now seemed impossible. I stood and searched for alcohol. I almost never drank at home, but there should have been a bottle of whiskey <tips=91>Mr. Smith</tips> had given me recently.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r215","rowIndex":215,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして氷を入れたグラスと瓶をテーブルの上に置いたところで、昼間連絡先を教えた<tips=51>さくら</tips>から着信があった。","en":"I had just placed the bottle and an ice-filled glass upon the table when my telephone rang. It was <tips=51>Sakura</tips>, to whom I had given my contact information that afternoon.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r216","rowIndex":216,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「突然押しかけてすみませんでした」","en":"“I’m sorry for arriving so suddenly.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"熨田さくら","displayName":"Sakura Noshida","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r217","rowIndex":217,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　部屋にあがった<tips=51>さくら</tips>は若干恐縮したように言う。","en":"Now inside my apartment, <tips=51>Sakura</tips> said this with a slightly apologetic air.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r218","rowIndex":218,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あの、失礼かなとは思ったんですけれど、電話って苦手なんで。直接話したほうが話が早いかなと思って」","en":"“I thought it might be rude, but I’m bad with telephones. Talking in person seemed faster.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"熨田さくら","displayName":"Sakura Noshida","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r219","rowIndex":219,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ソファーにちょこんと座った彼女はぼうっとしてつかみ所のない表情をしている。","en":"Perched neatly upon the sofa, she wore a vague, elusive expression.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r220","rowIndex":220,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その顔は汗だくになったように濡れている。病院ではこの濡れ具合を見て、異常な汗をかいていると看護師や医者が驚いていたが、<tips=44>シウ</tips>がサイキックである彼女の<tips=77>特質変異</tips>なのだと説明していた。","en":"Her face was so wet that she looked drenched in sweat. At the hospital, the nurses and doctors had seen how soaked she was and reacted with alarm, thinking she was perspiring abnormally, but <tips=44>Siu</tips> explained that it was her <tips=77>trait mutation</tips> as a psychic.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r221","rowIndex":221,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　部屋にあがったのにレインコートを着ているのも、濡れた肌を隠すためなのだろう。","en":"Presumably she kept her raincoat on even indoors to conceal her wet skin.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r222","rowIndex":222,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「別に失礼じゃないけどさ。こんな時間に女の子一人で出かけて大丈夫なの？」","en":"“It isn’t rude, but is it safe for a girl to go out alone at this hour?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r223","rowIndex":223,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おれは眠気覚ましのコーヒーを飲みながらそう尋ねた。","en":"I asked while drinking coffee to keep myself awake.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r224","rowIndex":224,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「大丈夫です。夜出かけるのは慣れてますから」","en":"“I’ll be fine. I’m used to going out at night.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"熨田さくら","displayName":"Sakura Noshida","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r225","rowIndex":225,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=51>さくら</tips>は素っ気ない態度でそう言った。","en":"<tips=51>Sakura</tips> answered curtly.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r226","rowIndex":226,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「家族とかは？」","en":"“What about your family?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r227","rowIndex":227,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「窓から飛んできたから気づかれてません」","en":"“I flew out through my window. They didn’t notice.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"熨田さくら","displayName":"Sakura Noshida","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r228","rowIndex":228,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「でも、このあいだあんな怪我をしたばかりだし、大丈夫なのかい？」","en":"“But you were injured so badly only the other day. Are you sure this is safe?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r229","rowIndex":229,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　すると、彼女はちょっと嫌な顔をして、","en":"Her face tightened with displeasure.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r230","rowIndex":230,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あのときは親は泣きましたけど……。ひきこもりが急に家を留守したと思ったら足をなくして帰って来たって言うんで。でも、しょうがないんです。足より大事なものを守るためだから」","en":"“My parents cried at the time... Their shut-in daughter suddenly disappeared from home and came back missing a leg. But it couldn’t be helped. I had to protect something more important than my leg.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"熨田さくら","displayName":"Sakura Noshida","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r231","rowIndex":231,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「もう家から出さないとか言われなかった？」","en":"“Didn’t they say they’d never let you leave home again?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r232","rowIndex":232,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「言われました。なんだか全寮制の学校へ行くのを勧められたりもしました。でもそれは私の望みじゃないんです。両親の気持ちもわかりますけど、私も理解して欲しかったから、説得しました。一ヶ月かかったけど、なんとか納得してもらって今に至ります」","en":"“They did. They even tried to persuade me to attend some sort of boarding school. But that wasn’t what I wanted. I understood how my parents felt, but I wanted them to understand me too, so I talked them around. It took a month, but somehow I got them to accept it, and that brings us to now.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"熨田さくら","displayName":"Sakura Noshida","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r233","rowIndex":233,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　本当に納得していたなら窓からこっそり出なくてもいいんじゃないかな？","en":"If they had truly accepted it, surely she would not have needed to slip out through the window.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r234","rowIndex":234,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そうは思ったが、おれは言わなかった。","en":"I thought it, but said nothing.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r235","rowIndex":235,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　なんというか、複雑な気持ちである。彼女は<tips=9>Y地区</tips>の外に住んでおり、両親もどうやら普通の仕事をしているらしい。","en":"My feelings were complicated. She lived outside <tips=9>Y District</tips>, and apparently both her parents held ordinary jobs.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r236","rowIndex":236,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そんな両親からすれば、娘がこんな<tips=9>Y地区</tips>にまでふらふらと飛んできて、ギャングのボスの妹と親友になり、彼女を救うために恐ろしいサイキックと戦って、足一本なくすだなんて、失神して倒れたくなるようなものだろうね。","en":"From her parents’ perspective, their daughter had gone flitting all the way to a place like <tips=9>Y District</tips>, befriended a gang boss’s little sister, fought a terrifying psychic to save her, and lost an entire leg. It must have been enough to make them faint dead away.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r237","rowIndex":237,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>は何か補償はしてやったろうけれど、たとえば大金を渡されたとしたって、かわいい娘の足とは引き替えにはならないんじゃないか？　それどころか、その金を見てますます恐ろしくなるに違いない。","en":"<tips=1>Ryo</tips> had probably compensated her somehow. But even if her parents had been handed a fortune, that could not make up for their beloved daughter’s leg, could it? If anything, the sight of that money would surely have frightened them even more.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r238","rowIndex":238,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しかし本人はけろりとしたもので、まったく後悔した様子も、気にする様子も見えない。","en":"Sakura herself remained perfectly unconcerned. I saw no sign that she regretted the loss or even thought much about it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r239","rowIndex":239,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=9>Y地区</tips>の良いところも悪いところも知っているおれとしては、せっかく平和な暮らしがあるんだから深入りをやめて帰りなよと言いたい気持ちもある。が、そう言ったところで聞く気なんかないんだろうなあ。","en":"Having seen both the good and bad of <tips=9>Y District</tips>, part of me wanted to tell her that she already had a peaceful life and ought to go home rather than involve herself more deeply. But I doubted she would listen.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r240","rowIndex":240,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　なんたって、ろくに面識もないおれのところに、こうして夜一人で来るような女の子なんだもの。しかも用件は、<tips=44>シウ</tips>に関することだそうで、自分のためでさえないのだ。","en":"After all, this was a girl who would come alone at night to the apartment of a man she barely knew. And apparently she had come about <tips=44>Siu</tips>, no less—not even for her own sake.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r241","rowIndex":241,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「きみは不思議な子だなあ」","en":"“You really are a strange girl.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r242","rowIndex":242,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おれが溜息をつくと、","en":"I sighed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r243","rowIndex":243,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=10>見土</tips>さん、人は何のために生きるんだと思います？」","en":"“<tips=10>Mr. Mido</tips>, what do you think people live for?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"熨田さくら","displayName":"Sakura Noshida","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r244","rowIndex":244,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=51>さくら</tips>は唐突に奇妙な質問をしてきたのでおれは思わず苦笑してしまう。","en":"<tips=51>Sakura</tips> abruptly posed the peculiar question, and I could not help smiling wryly.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r245","rowIndex":245,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「やっぱり、幸福だとかを求めるためじゃない？」","en":"“To seek happiness, I suppose.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r246","rowIndex":246,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　とりあえずそう答えると、","en":"It was the best answer I could offer on the spot.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r247","rowIndex":247,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうですか。まあ、普通の考えですね」","en":"“I see. A fairly ordinary answer.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"熨田さくら","displayName":"Sakura Noshida","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r248","rowIndex":248,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=51>さくら</tips>の言葉には、悪気はなさそうだ。","en":"There appeared to be no malice in <tips=51>Sakura’s</tips> words.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r249","rowIndex":249,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「私はわからないんです。いろんな欲望とか欠けてるものはあって、それを満たすところを想像するとうっとりするけど、じゃあそのために生きるのかって言われたらそれはちょっとめんどくさいですよね。情熱がないのかもしれない」","en":"“I don’t know. I have all kinds of desires and all kinds of things I lack, and imagining what it would be like to satisfy them is intoxicating. But if you ask whether I live for that, it seems like kind of a bother, doesn’t it? Maybe I just don’t have any passion.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"熨田さくら","displayName":"Sakura Noshida","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r250","rowIndex":250,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「でもきみは、<tips=44>シウ</tips>ちゃんを命がけで守ったじゃないか」","en":"“But you risked your life to protect <tips=44>Siu</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r251","rowIndex":251,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうなんです。それは<tips=44>筱喬</tips>のことが好きだから。でもこれって確かなものですか？　そんなのわからないですよね。ただの性欲かもしれない。あんな美人で可愛い子会ったことないし……。みんな足をなくしたからすごいことをしたみたいに言うんでしょうけど、これだって別に何とも思わない。ただ、こっちだけ大けがさせられたってことで、なんだかあいつに負けたみたいでイライラはするけど。もう一回あのテレポート女に会ったらやり返してやりたいです」","en":"“I did. Because I love <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips>. But is that feeling even real? There’s no way to know, is there? Maybe it’s nothing but lust. I’ve never met another girl so beautiful and adorable... Everyone acts as if I did something incredible because I lost a leg, but I don’t feel anything about that either. It does irritate me that I was the only one who got badly hurt, though. It feels like I lost to her. If I ever meet that teleporting woman again, I want to get even.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"熨田さくら","displayName":"Sakura Noshida","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r252","rowIndex":252,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=51>さくら</tips>は思い出したらしく、怒ったような表情をする。","en":"The memory appeared to anger <tips=51>Sakura</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r253","rowIndex":253,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=44>筱喬</tips>は、世の中のことを沢山知りたいってよく言うんです。よく知って、世界のことを好きになってから死にたいって。いろんなものを好きになるっていうのが彼女の目標だったり、人生の価値なんでしょう。<tips=17>タイプB</tips>だったり、近くの人がすぐ死んだり、大人たちの思惑に振り回されたりで、彼女のまわりには受け入れられないものばかりだから……それはいいなあとは思いますけど、私には共有出来ません。私は嫌いなものは嫌い」","en":"“<tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> often says she wants to learn as much as possible about the world. She wants to understand it, then die after coming to love it. Perhaps learning to love many things is her goal, or the value she finds in life. She’s <tips=17>Type B</tips>, people close to her keep dying, and she’s pushed around by adults with their own designs. The world around her is full of things she can’t accept... I think her way is admirable, but I can’t share it. The things I hate, I hate.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"熨田さくら","displayName":"Sakura Noshida","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r254","rowIndex":254,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=51>さくら</tips>は真顔で言う。確かに、彼女は嫌いなものはどうあっても嫌いそうだ。","en":"<tips=51>Sakura</tips> said it with a perfectly straight face. She certainly seemed like the sort who would go on hating whatever she hated, no matter what.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r255","rowIndex":255,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=44>筱喬</tips>と違って、私は自分のことが知りたい。私は何者なのか。何が出来るのか。この空を飛ぶ能力は使い道があるのか。この人の人生に何か目的があるのか。……だから、良いと思ったらなんでもクビを突っ込むし、すぐ実行することにしてるんです。しないと忘れちゃうかもしれないし、飽きちゃうかもしれないから。……ここまでやって飽きちゃったら最低でしょう？　私それはいやなんですよねー。カッコつけたがりだから」","en":"“Unlike <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips>, I want to understand myself. What am I? What can I do? Is there any use for this power of flight? Does this person’s life have some purpose? ...So if something seems good to me, I stick my nose into it and act right away. If I don’t, I might forget, or I might get bored. ...It would be awful to come this far and then get bored, wouldn’t it? I don’t want to do that. I’m the kind of person who likes to look cool.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"熨田さくら","displayName":"Sakura Noshida","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r256","rowIndex":256,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして彼女は顔を顰める。","en":"She grimaced.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r257","rowIndex":257,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「だから今日もこうしてすぐに来たんです。へんな怪しい企みとかはないです。個人的な思想に基づく行動です。<tips=10>見土</tips>さんって、<tips=17>タイプB</tips>のへんな組織の人なんでしょ？　だから、ちゃんと説明しておかないと、私も<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>側だから誤解を招くんじゃないかと思って……」","en":"“That’s why I came straight here today. I don’t have any strange, suspicious scheme in mind. I’m acting on my own personal beliefs. <tips=10>Mr. Mido</tips>, you’re with that strange <tips=17>Type B</tips> organization, aren’t you? And I’m on the <tips=7>YS</tips> side, so I thought you might misunderstand unless I explained myself properly...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"熨田さくら","displayName":"Sakura Noshida","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r258","rowIndex":258,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あはは、そんなことを心配してくれたのか！　確かにおれは<tips=17>タイプB</tips>のへんな組織と関わりが深いけど、そんなこと思いもしなかったな。親友の妹についての相談となれば、これはもう一大事だなあって、それしか考えてなかったよ」","en":"“Hahaha! So that’s what you were worried about! I certainly do have deep ties to a strange <tips=17>Type B</tips> organization, but the thought never even crossed my mind. All I thought was, if this is about my best friend’s little sister, it must be serious.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r259","rowIndex":259,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ああ、そうですか……」","en":"“Oh. I see...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"熨田さくら","displayName":"Sakura Noshida","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r260","rowIndex":260,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=51>さくら</tips>はなぜか困ったような顔をする。","en":"For some reason, <tips=51>Sakura</tips> looked uncomfortable.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r261","rowIndex":261,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どうしたの？」","en":"“What is it?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r262","rowIndex":262,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「すみません。私、そういうさわやかな言い方ってどうしても嘘臭くて信用出来ないんです。心が歪んでるから」","en":"“Sorry. I just can’t trust people when they put things in that clean, wholesome way. It always sounds fake to me. My heart is twisted.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"熨田さくら","displayName":"Sakura Noshida","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r263","rowIndex":263,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　つくづく変わった子である。やっぱりサイキックってのは変人が多いのかね？","en":"She really was an odd girl. Were psychics all oddballs, I wondered?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r264","rowIndex":264,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　と、おれは自分を差し置いて思ってみたり。","en":"So I found myself wondering, conveniently ignoring the fact that I was one myself.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r265","rowIndex":265,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ともあれ、頭の良い子だ。そうでなければ、あんな危険なことを成功させられるはずもないのだろうが。","en":"In any event, she was intelligent. Without intelligence, she could hardly have succeeded at anything so dangerous.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r266","rowIndex":266,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それで、<tips=44>シウ</tips>ちゃんに関する相談ってのはなんだい？　確かに今日は随分と暗かったようだが」","en":"“So what was it you wanted to discuss about <tips=44>Siu</tips>? She certainly did seem awfully down today.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r267","rowIndex":267,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おれが笑いで誤魔化しつつそう言うと、彼女は頷き、","en":"I said it with a laugh, trying to smooth things over. She nodded.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r268","rowIndex":268,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「昨日、<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>の幹部が一人処刑されたんです。<tips=41>グランドタワー</tips>で」","en":"“Yesterday, an officer of <tips=7>YS</tips> was executed inside the <tips=41>Grand Tower</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"熨田さくら","displayName":"Sakura Noshida","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r269","rowIndex":269,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「処刑とは……急におだやかじゃない話になったね」","en":"“Executed? This has suddenly become a very grim conversation.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r270","rowIndex":270,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おれは言って頭を指先で掻いた。","en":"I scratched my head with my fingertips.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r271","rowIndex":271,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　正直おれはもっと乙女らしい悩みを想像していたんだ。","en":"To be honest, I had imagined some more conventionally girlish problem.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r272","rowIndex":272,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　なのに<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>の処刑の話ときたもんだ。これは確かに、<tips=51>さくら</tips>が事前に前置きをして自分の立場を表明したくなるような話題だ。","en":"Instead, she brought me an execution within <tips=7>YS</tips>. No wonder <tips=51>Sakura</tips> had felt the need to declare her position beforehand.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r273","rowIndex":273,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「殺されたのは<tips=4>馬明</tips>という人で……知ってますか？」","en":"“The man who was killed was named <tips=4>Ma Ming</tips>... Do you know him?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"熨田さくら","displayName":"Sakura Noshida","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r274","rowIndex":274,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「もちろん。いや……でも、驚いたな。それは本当かい？」","en":"“Of course. But... I’m astonished. Is that true?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r275","rowIndex":275,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=4>馬明</tips>と言えば先代<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>の義兄弟にして、<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>の大幹部中の大幹部だ。<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>を劉備に例えるならば、張飛にあたる人物であり、そして、<tips=1>亮</tips>が<tips=81>龍頭</tips>になってから後見人的な役割をになっていたという噂だ。","en":"<tips=4>Ma Ming</tips> was the sworn brother of the former leader <tips=3>Chris Tse</tips> and one of the very highest-ranking officers in <tips=7>YS</tips>. If <tips=3>Chris Tse</tips> were Liu Bei, Ma Ming would be Zhang Fei. Rumor had it that after <tips=1>Ryo</tips> became <tips=81>Longtou</tips>, Ma Ming served as his guardian and adviser.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r276","rowIndex":276,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「本当なんです。禁制になっている麻薬取引をしたり組織のお金を横領したりしていたのを<tips=44>筱喬</tips>のお兄さんが見つけて、大幹部を集めた会議室で詰問し、本人もそれを認めたそうです」","en":"“It’s true. <tips=44>Siu-kiu’s</tips> brother discovered that Ma Ming had been dealing in prohibited narcotics and embezzling the organization’s money. He confronted him in a conference room where the senior officers had been assembled, and apparently Ma Ming admitted it himself.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"熨田さくら","displayName":"Sakura Noshida","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r277","rowIndex":277,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なるほどね。そりゃ<tips=44>シウ</tips>ちゃんも落ち込むわけだ」","en":"“I see. No wonder <tips=44>Siu</tips> is so down.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r278","rowIndex":278,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>はそういったことを語りたがらないから直接聞いたわけではないけれど、<tips=4>馬明</tips>の立場を考えれば彼が謝家の兄妹と幼いころから親しくしていたのは簡単に想像がつく話だ。","en":"<tips=1>Ryo</tips> did not like to talk about such things, so I had never heard it from him directly. But given <tips=4>Ma Ming’s</tips> position, it was easy enough to imagine that he had been close to the Tse siblings ever since they were children.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r279","rowIndex":279,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それを兄が処刑したとなれば、平気でいられるほうがおかしい。","en":"Anyone would be shaken if her brother executed such a person.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r280","rowIndex":280,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それだけじゃなくて、<tips=4>馬明</tips>さんの娘さんも、それを受けて怒りのあまり自殺したんです。まだ新婚で、お腹にはもうすぐ生まれる子供がいたのに……。<tips=44>筱喬</tips>は、<tips=4>馬明</tips>さんともこの娘さんとも小さい時から仲良かったから、とても動揺していて……」","en":"“That wasn’t all. <tips=4>Ma Ming’s</tips> daughter was so overcome with anger at what happened that she killed herself. She had only just married, and she was carrying a child who was almost due... <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> had been close to both <tips=4>Ma Ming</tips> and his daughter since she was little, so she was terribly shaken...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"熨田さくら","displayName":"Sakura Noshida","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r281","rowIndex":281,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ふむ」","en":"“Hmm.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r282","rowIndex":282,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　どうも壮絶な話になってきた。","en":"This was turning into a harrowing story.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r283","rowIndex":283,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しかし、<tips=4>馬明</tips>が激しい人物だというのはよく知られていたが、娘も負けず劣らずの気性の持ち主だったということか。妊婦の身で憤死するとは。","en":"It was well known that <tips=4>Ma Ming</tips> was a fierce man, but perhaps his daughter had a temper every bit as violent as his. To think she died of rage while pregnant.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r284","rowIndex":284,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「彼女はお兄さんのことが世界で一番大好きだったから、なおさら混乱してしまって、受け入れようとしても受け入れられないで苦しんでるんです。私もなんとかしてあげたいんですが、<tips=4>馬明</tips>さんのこともお兄さんのことも詳しくないから……<tips=10>見土</tips>さんは、お兄さんととても親しかったんですよね？」","en":"“She loves her brother more than anyone else in the world, so it’s left her even more confused. She’s trying to accept it, but she can’t, and it’s tearing her apart. I want to do something for her, but I don’t know much about <tips=4>Ma Ming</tips> or her brother... <tips=10>Mr. Mido</tips>, you were very close to her brother, weren’t you?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"熨田さくら","displayName":"Sakura Noshida","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r285","rowIndex":285,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうだよ。今でも親しいつもりだよ」","en":"“Yes. I still consider us close.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r286","rowIndex":286,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「お兄さんはどういう人なんでしょう？　<tips=81>龍頭</tips>になって、変わったんですかね。それとも、そういうわけじゃないのかな？　<tips=44>筱喬</tips>はそこも悩んでいるようなんです」","en":"“What kind of person is he? Do you think becoming <tips=81>Longtou</tips> changed him? Or perhaps it didn’t? <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> seems troubled by that too.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"熨田さくら","displayName":"Sakura Noshida","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r287","rowIndex":287,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=81>龍頭</tips>になってから全然会ってないおれが言うのもなんだけれど」","en":"“I admit I haven’t seen him once since he became <tips=81>Longtou</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r288","rowIndex":288,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おれは肩をすくめて、","en":"I shrugged.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r289","rowIndex":289,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まあ、<tips=44>シウ</tips>ちゃんはあいつを信じて良いと思うよ。あいつはいつだって家族のことを大事に考えてる。だから、自分がそういう乱暴なことをすれば<tips=44>シウ</tips>ちゃんが傷つくのも想像したはずさ。それでも行為に及んだってのは、その方が結果として<tips=44>シウ</tips>ちゃんにとってプラスだからだよ」","en":"“Still, I think <tips=44>Siu</tips> can trust him. He has always cared about his family above all else. He must have known that doing something so violent would hurt <tips=44>Siu</tips>. If he went through with it anyway, it was because he believed that, in the end, it would be better for <tips=44>Siu</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r290","rowIndex":290,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「でも、今は昔とは全然立場が違うでしょう？　生活も全然変わってるし、人が変わってしまうこともありそうな気がするんです」","en":"“But his position is completely different now, isn’t it? His life has changed entirely. It seems possible that he could change as a person.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"熨田さくら","displayName":"Sakura Noshida","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r291","rowIndex":291,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あいつに限って、そんなことは絶対にないよ。悩むことはあるだろうけど、おかしくなったりはしない。断言出来る。子供の時からのつき合いだからね」","en":"“Not him. That could never happen. He may have his doubts and troubles, but he won’t go off the deep end. I can promise you that. I’ve known him since we were kids.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r292","rowIndex":292,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうですか……」","en":"“I see...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"熨田さくら","displayName":"Sakura Noshida","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r293","rowIndex":293,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=51>さくら</tips>は腕組みをして首を捻る。腑に落ちないのだろう。","en":"<tips=51>Sakura</tips> folded her arms and tilted her head. Plainly, the answer did not satisfy her.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r294","rowIndex":294,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「誤解されやすいやつなのさ。冷酷でクールな人間みたいに言われてるけど、全然クールじゃないよ。短気だし、調子にのったりもする。冷酷さ……はちょっとあるかもしれないけど、必要なときだけさ」","en":"“He’s easy to misunderstand. People make him out to be coldhearted and coolheaded, but he isn’t coolheaded at all. He’s short-tempered, and he gets carried away. Coldhearted... well, maybe he can be a little, but only when he has to be.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r295","rowIndex":295,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ふむ……」","en":"“Hmm...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"熨田さくら","displayName":"Sakura Noshida","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r296","rowIndex":296,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=51>さくら</tips>は何度も何度も首を捻ってから、","en":"<tips=51>Sakura</tips> tilted her head again and again.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r297","rowIndex":297,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうかな。そうなのかな……」","en":"“I wonder. Is that really true...?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"熨田さくら","displayName":"Sakura Noshida","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r298","rowIndex":298,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「納得出来ない？」","en":"“You don’t believe me?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r299","rowIndex":299,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうじゃなくて……」","en":"“That isn’t it...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"熨田さくら","displayName":"Sakura Noshida","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r300","rowIndex":300,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=51>さくら</tips>は顎に手を当て、考え考え、言葉を選ぶようにして言った。","en":"<tips=51>Sakura</tips> placed a hand beneath her chin. She considered the matter and selected her words with care.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r301","rowIndex":301,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「この街の人ってもしかしたら普通とは感覚がズレてるのかもしれないけど、あんな、人間を何人も殺すだなんて極限状態ですよ？　もし警察に逮捕されたら三人前くらい死刑判決が出そうなことやってます。……お兄さんは、子供の時は組織とはすこし離れてて、外の街で大学生とかやってたんですよね？　それが急にそんな立場について、血で手を染めるような状況になったら、誰だって正気じゃなくなるような気がする……」","en":"“Maybe the people in this city have a different sense of what’s normal, but killing that many people is an extreme situation. If the police arrested him, he’s done enough to earn three people’s worth of death sentences. ...Her brother kept some distance from the organization when he was younger, and he even attended college in the outer city, didn’t he? If anyone were suddenly thrust into a position like that and forced into circumstances where they had to stain their hands with blood, I think they might lose their mind...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"熨田さくら","displayName":"Sakura Noshida","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r302","rowIndex":302,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ああ、<tips=51>さくら</tips>ちゃんはまっとうな人間だな」","en":"“Ah, <tips=51>Sakura</tips>, you really are a normal, decent person.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r303","rowIndex":303,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おれは笑って、","en":"I laughed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r304","rowIndex":304,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「言われてみればその通りだ。相手が誰だろうと、そもそも当たり前に殺人を犯してること自体がとんでもない大犯罪だよ！　まったく耳の痛い話だが、ここの連中はみんな普通とは感覚がズレてるんだ」","en":"“Now that you say it, you’re absolutely right. No matter who the other person is, the very fact that people here commit murder as a matter of course is an outrageous crime! It’s painful to admit, but everyone in this place has a warped sense of what’s normal.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r305","rowIndex":305,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　あっさりと肯定されたことに、<tips=51>さくら</tips>はきょとんとしている。","en":"<tips=51>Sakura</tips> stared, bewildered by the ease with which I agreed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r306","rowIndex":306,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「昔誰かが言ってたな。この街の子供は、生まれた時点でみな魂の半分を悪魔とリース契約させられるんだよ。貧乏な家の男の子はみんなそのうち人殺しになると思ってるし、女の子は身体を売ることになると思ってる。おれはそれを変えたかったんだがね」","en":"“I remember someone saying that every child in this city is forced at birth to lease half of his soul to a devil. Every boy from a poor family grows up expecting that one day he’ll kill someone. Every girl expects that she’ll sell her body. I wanted to change that.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r307","rowIndex":307,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おれは肩をすくめるしかない。","en":"I could only shrug.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r308","rowIndex":308,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ま、人ごとじゃない。みんな最初から正気じゃなかったのかもしれないね。<tips=1>亮</tips>もそうだし、おれも、<tips=44>シウ</tips>ちゃんも、誰も彼もね。みな知らず知らず心に狂気を忍び込ませている。これは自覚しないといけないよ」","en":"“This isn’t someone else’s problem. Maybe none of us was sane to begin with—<tips=1>Ryo</tips>, me, <tips=44>Siu</tips>, any of us. Madness creeps into every heart without its owner even realizing. We have to be conscious of that.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r309","rowIndex":309,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「べ、別に非難してるわけじゃないです。それに、ズレって言ったのは、あくまでも環境が違うから感覚が違うっていう相対的な意味でしかないんです。外の街の人たちとは適応しなきゃいけないものが違うんだから、違いがあって当然なんです。適応というのは狂気とは違う……いくら殺し合ってても、みんなまっとうに見えます。外の人よりずっと……」","en":"“I-I wasn’t condemning anyone. And by different, I only meant the relative difference created by a different environment. People here have to adapt to something different from what people in the outer city do. Of course they turn out differently. Adaptation isn’t madness... However much killing goes on among them, everyone looks perfectly sane. Much more so than people outside...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"熨田さくら","displayName":"Sakura Noshida","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r310","rowIndex":310,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=51>さくら</tips>はなぜか照れてうつむく。","en":"For some reason, <tips=51>Sakura</tips> blushed and lowered her head.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r311","rowIndex":311,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「とにかく……こんど三人で一緒にゲームをする約束をしたんで、その時自分の目でお兄さんがどんな人か確かめてみます」","en":"“In any event... the three of us have promised to play a game together next time. I’ll see what her brother is like with my own eyes.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"熨田さくら","displayName":"Sakura Noshida","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r312","rowIndex":312,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ゲームするの？」","en":"“You’re going to play a game together?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r313","rowIndex":313,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「はい、とても楽しみです。あの美形兄妹に挟まれてゲームすると想像するだけで鼻血が出そうで眠れません」","en":"“Yes. I’m really looking forward to it. Just imagining myself playing games sandwiched between those gorgeous siblings is enough to give me a nosebleed. I can’t sleep.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"熨田さくら","displayName":"Sakura Noshida","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r314","rowIndex":314,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=51>さくら</tips>は真顔でうなずいた。","en":"<tips=51>Sakura</tips> nodded with a perfectly serious face.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r315","rowIndex":315,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いいんじゃないか？　<tips=1>亮</tips>のやつもたまには息抜きが必要だろう」","en":"“Why not? <tips=1>Ryo</tips> needs a break once in a while too.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r316","rowIndex":316,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>がそういう遊びに参加するかどうかわからないが、おれは適当にそう言った。","en":"Whether <tips=1>Ryo</tips> would take part in that kind of fun was another question, but I tossed the suggestion out anyway.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r317","rowIndex":317,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まあでも、<tips=51>さくら</tips>ちゃん、あまり危ないことをしちゃいけないよ」","en":"“Still, <tips=51>Sakura</tips>, you really shouldn’t do anything too dangerous.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r318","rowIndex":318,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「え、急に何の話ですか？」","en":"“Huh? What brought that on?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"熨田さくら","displayName":"Sakura Noshida","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r319","rowIndex":319,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いや、あまりにも自分をかえりみないからさ。まあ、サイキックと戦ったのは好きな人間を救うためだからわかる。でも、足がなくなっても平気そうにしたり、今日だってこんな時間に一人でおれのところを訪ねるなんて、本当はよくないんだぜ」","en":"“No, it’s just that you have far too little regard for yourself. I understand why you fought a psychic—you were saving someone you love. But acting as if losing a leg doesn’t bother you, and coming here alone to see me at this hour tonight... those really aren’t good things to do.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r320","rowIndex":320,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=10>見土</tips>さんは良い人ですから」","en":"“Because you’re a good person, <tips=10>Mr. Mido</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"熨田さくら","displayName":"Sakura Noshida","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r321","rowIndex":321,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=51>さくら</tips>は軽い戸惑いを浮かべる。","en":"<tips=51>Sakura</tips> looked mildly puzzled.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r322","rowIndex":322,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「きみは自分を粗末にしすぎなんだ。このまんまじゃそのうち死んじゃうよ。そうなったらおれはちょっと悲しいな」","en":"“You don’t value yourself nearly enough. At this rate, you’ll end up dead one of these days. If that happened, I’d be a little sad.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r323","rowIndex":323,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうですか……」","en":"“I see...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"熨田さくら","displayName":"Sakura Noshida","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r324","rowIndex":324,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=51>さくら</tips>は言ってから、少し考えたのちに口を開く。","en":"After saying that, <tips=51>Sakura</tips> paused to think for a moment before speaking again.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r325","rowIndex":325,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まあ、悲しむ必要はないですよ。別に私が死んだって<tips=10>見土</tips>さんのせいじゃないんですし。それに、自分で決めて自分で勝手にやってるだけなんですから本人としては満足ですし、すぐに忘れればいいんです。私は別にそれでいいんです。好きでやってるだけなんですから」","en":"“Well, there’s no need to be sad. Even if I die, it won’t be your fault, <tips=10>Mr. Mido</tips>. Besides, I make my own decisions and do as I please, so I’ll have been satisfied with it myself. You can just forget me right away. That’s perfectly fine with me. I’m only doing what I want to do.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"熨田さくら","displayName":"Sakura Noshida","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r326","rowIndex":326,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=51>さくら</tips>は冷たい声で淡々と言う。その言葉の背景には、彼女が自分の頭のなかで何度も考えた深い思索があるのを感じる。","en":"<tips=51>Sakura</tips> delivered the words evenly, in a cold voice. I could sense behind them a deeply considered conviction—something she had gone over again and again in her own mind.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r327","rowIndex":327,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「さて、そろそろ帰ります」","en":"“Well then, I should be heading home.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"熨田さくら","displayName":"Sakura Noshida","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r328","rowIndex":328,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おれが黙っていると、<tips=51>さくら</tips>は立ち上がり、上着を羽織る。そして窓の方へ向かって歩き出す。","en":"When I said nothing, <tips=51>Sakura</tips> stood, put on her coat, and walked toward the window.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r329","rowIndex":329,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「きみは寂しい人なんだな」","en":"“You really are a lonely person.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r330","rowIndex":330,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おれの言葉に<tips=51>さくら</tips>は振り返り、苦笑をすると、","en":"<tips=51>Sakura</tips> turned at my words and gave a wry smile.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r331","rowIndex":331,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「人間って本質的にそういうものですよ？」","en":"“That’s what people are like by nature, you know.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"熨田さくら","displayName":"Sakura Noshida","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r332","rowIndex":332,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして鍵を外して窓を開けると、外から冷たい夜の風が部屋に吹き込んできた。","en":"She unfastened the lock and opened the window. A cold night wind blew into the room from outside.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r333","rowIndex":333,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女は窓枠に片足をかけ、半身を窓の向こうへ乗り出す。","en":"She set one foot upon the frame and leaned half her body out the window.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r334","rowIndex":334,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「明日は雨ですね。風が湿ってるし、おぼろ月が出てる」","en":"“It looks like rain tomorrow. The wind is damp, and the moon is hazy.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"熨田さくら","displayName":"Sakura Noshida","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r335","rowIndex":335,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=44>シウ</tips>ちゃんのこと、頼むぜ。おれにとっても親友の大事な妹なんだ」","en":"“Take care of <tips=44>Siu</tips> for me. She’s my best friend’s precious little sister, too.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r336","rowIndex":336,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「わかってます。じゃあ」","en":"“I know. See you.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"熨田さくら","displayName":"Sakura Noshida","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r337","rowIndex":337,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=51>さくら</tips>は振り向かずにそう言うと、窓枠を蹴って夜空へ飛び出していった。","en":"Without looking back, <tips=51>Sakura</tips> kicked off from the window frame and flew out into the night sky.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r338","rowIndex":338,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おれは月に向かって飛んで行く少女の幻想的な姿をしばらく眺めてしまい、","en":"For a while, I could only gaze at the otherworldly figure of the girl flying toward the moon.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r339","rowIndex":339,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「はっくしょん！」","en":"“Aaachoo!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B3-2:r340","rowIndex":340,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　うっかり身体を冷やしてしまったので、くしゃみをひとつし、窓を閉めた。","en":"I had let myself get chilled without noticing. After one sneeze, I shut the window.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}}]},{"position":44,"code":"E7","unitId":"E7","rows":[{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r1","rowIndex":1,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　夢のない昏い眠りの後に、朝日の刺激で目が覚めた。","en":"After a dark, dreamless sleep, the morning sun woke me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r2","rowIndex":2,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　薄く窓が開いているのか、レースのカーテンがさらさらと揺れて、チュンチュンと小鳥の鳴く声がする。","en":"Perhaps the window stood slightly open. The lace curtains rustled, and I heard little birds chirping.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r3","rowIndex":3,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　思いのほかに明るくて、まぶしさで目が痛い。すぐにまた目を閉じて寝返りをうつ。身体は重いが痛みはしない。","en":"The room was brighter than I expected, and the glare hurt my eyes. I immediately closed them again and turned over. My body felt heavy, but there was no pain.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r4","rowIndex":4,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　身体にまとわりつくシーツのやわらかい感触が、否応なく気持ちを平和にする。","en":"The soft feel of the sheets clinging to my body put my mind at peace whether I wanted it or not.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r5","rowIndex":5,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　――なんとか生き延びたようだ。","en":"—It seemed I had somehow survived.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r6","rowIndex":6,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　安堵の気持ちが心に生まれるのが、なんだか不快だった。","en":"Somehow, the feeling of relief arising within me was unpleasant.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r7","rowIndex":7,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ほっとしている場合じゃない。安心している場合じゃない。死体の山を乗り越えてきた自分には、しなければならないことがある。","en":"This was no time to feel relieved. No time to let my guard down. Having climbed over a mountain of corpses, I had things I had to do.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r8","rowIndex":8,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　自分を気負い立たせようとするが、身体にはまだうまく力が入らず、布団の柔らかい魔力が気力を奪う。まぶたが重く、なかなか開かない。","en":"I tried to goad myself into action, but I still could not put any strength into my body, and the soft spell of the covers drained away my will. My eyelids were heavy and refused to open properly.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r9","rowIndex":9,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　怪我のせいで随分深く眠っていたようだ。こんなに心の芯から眠りこけたのはいつ以来だろう？　そしてこの疲れた身体が布団に包まれる感触は、今までの様々な幸福の記憶を呼び出そうとする。このまま目を閉じていると、全てが夢だったような気がする。","en":"It seemed my injuries had let me sleep remarkably deeply. When had I last slept so soundly, from the very core of my being? And the sensation of the covers wrapping around this exhausted body began calling up one happy memory after another. If I kept my eyes closed like this, it felt as though everything had been a dream.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r10","rowIndex":10,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ここは私のあのアパートで、目を開いて辺りを見回せば、<tips=53>ミユキ</tips>が朝ご飯を作っている後ろ姿が見えるかもしれない。","en":"This was my apartment, and if I opened my eyes and looked around, perhaps I would see <tips=53>Miyuki</tips> with her back to me, making breakfast.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r11","rowIndex":11,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そんなばかな考えを信じたくなってしまうくらい、安らかな目覚めなのだ。","en":"The awakening was peaceful enough to make me want to believe such foolish thoughts.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r12","rowIndex":12,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして、実際否定しながらも頭のどこかではそんな展開を期待していたのだろう。意を決してまぶたを開き、そこが自分のアパートではないと知ってしまうと、思いのほかに私は失望を感じていた。","en":"Indeed, even as I denied the possibility, some part of my mind must have expected it. When I summoned my resolve, opened my eyes, and discovered that this was not my apartment, I felt more disappointed than I had imagined.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r13","rowIndex":13,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　やはり全ては現実だったのだ。<tips=53>ミユキ</tips>が死に、<tips=48>堂島</tips>が死に、そして<tips=5>太刀川</tips>が死んだ。私は追いかけたがあの医者を助けることが出来なかった。","en":"It had all been real after all. <tips=53>Miyuki</tips> was dead. <tips=48>Dojima</tips> was dead. And <tips=5>Tachikawa</tips> was dead. I had given chase but failed to save the doctor.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r14","rowIndex":14,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ベッドの上で上半身を起こす。ここは確かに私の部屋ではない。","en":"I sat up in bed. This was certainly not my room.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r15","rowIndex":15,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ピンク色の天井。ピンク色の枕カバー。そして、ピンク色のベッドカバーには、小さな兎だの星だのが散らばっている。","en":"A pink ceiling. A pink pillowcase. And over the bed, a pink cover scattered with little rabbits and stars.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r16","rowIndex":16,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　なんてファンシーなベッドカバーなのだろう！","en":"What an incredibly cutesy bedspread!","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r17","rowIndex":17,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　この布団のなかに、私のような毛むくじゃらでツノの生えた大男が寝転んでいるのである。","en":"And there beneath it lay a great hairy man with horns—me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r18","rowIndex":18,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　何もしていないのにもかかわらず、犯罪を犯してしまったような罪悪感を覚えた。","en":"Though I had done nothing at all, I felt guilty, as if I had committed a crime.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r19","rowIndex":19,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　気まずい思いをしながら辺りを見回すと、傍らの床に毛布にくるまって寝息を立てる<tips=49>三芳</tips>の姿を発見した。","en":"Looking around in discomfort, I discovered <tips=49>Miyoshi</tips> asleep upon the floor beside the bed, wrapped in a blanket.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r20","rowIndex":20,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　パジャマにも着替えず、ブラウスとスカートのままである。","en":"She had not even changed into pajamas, but still wore her blouse and skirt.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r21","rowIndex":21,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ここは彼女の部屋なのだろうか？　でもそうだとすると、あまりに可愛らしすぎる部屋ではないか？　やたらとピンク色と、ヒラヒラのレースばかりがあしらってある。そしてぬいぐるみやら、子供向けのキャラクターグッズやらが並んでいる。<tips=53>ミユキ</tips>も少女趣味だったが、これはその上を行っている。","en":"Was this her room? If so, wasn’t it far too cute? Pink and fluttering lace were everywhere. Stuffed animals and merchandise bearing children’s characters lined the room. <tips=53>Miyuki</tips> had girlish tastes too, but this surpassed even hers.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r22","rowIndex":22,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　部屋だけ見せられたら女子中学生、いや、女子小学生が住んでいると言われても信じてしまうだろう。まさかキャリアの警察官の部屋とは思うまい。","en":"Shown the room alone, I could have believed it belonged to a girl in middle school—no, even elementary school. I would never have imagined it was the room of an elite-track police officer.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r23","rowIndex":23,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　人というものは見かけによらないものだな。","en":"You really could not judge a person by appearances.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r24","rowIndex":24,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は尿意を感じ、トイレを探すためにベッドを抜け出そうとして気がついた。","en":"Needing to urinate, I started to climb out of bed and look for the bathroom. That was when I noticed something.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r25","rowIndex":25,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は何も服を着ていない。下着すらだ。そのかわりに上半身にはグルグルと包帯が巻かれ、下半身には紙おむつが穿かされている。","en":"I wore no clothes. Not even underwear. Instead, my upper body was wrapped in layer after layer of bandages, and an adult diaper had been put on my lower half.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r26","rowIndex":26,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=49>三芳</tips>がやってくれたのだろうか？　それとも誰か人の手を借りたのだろうか。","en":"Had <tips=49>Miyoshi</tips> done this? Or had she asked someone to help?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r27","rowIndex":27,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そう言えば、泥水のなかに血みどろになって倒れたはずだが、身体は清潔だった。頭に手をやると髪の毛も汚れていない。","en":"Come to think of it, I had collapsed into muddy water, covered in blood, yet my body was clean. I touched my head and found no dirt in my hair either.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r28","rowIndex":28,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　随分世話の行き届いたことだ。","en":"I had been looked after with remarkable thoroughness.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r29","rowIndex":29,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そっと紙おむつを外して中を見ると、汚れてはいなかった。今穿いているものがたまたま汚れていないからといって、自分が今までここで粗相をしなかったという証拠にはならないが、とりあえずほっとした。","en":"I quietly removed the disposable diaper and looked inside. It was clean. The fact that the one I happened to be wearing now was clean did not prove that I had not soiled myself here before now, but for the moment I was relieved.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r30","rowIndex":30,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=49>三芳</tips>にそんな世話をさせたとは考えたくない。","en":"I did not want to think that I had made <tips=49>Miyoshi</tips> take care of me that way.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r31","rowIndex":31,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「う……ん……」","en":"“Mmm... nn...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r32","rowIndex":32,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私の物音に反応したのか、<tips=49>三芳</tips>はそう呻いて寝返りを打った。","en":"Perhaps reacting to the sounds I made, <tips=49>Miyoshi</tips> groaned and turned over.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r33","rowIndex":33,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その拍子にブラウスの裾がめくれて、へそがあらわになる。胸元のボタンもいつもより一つ多く開いており、下着の端が見えている。","en":"As she moved, the hem of her blouse rode up and exposed her navel. Her blouse was also open one button farther than usual at the chest, and the edge of her underwear was visible.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r34","rowIndex":34,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「おい」","en":"“Hey.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r35","rowIndex":35,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　いつまでも無防備な姿を見ているのも気の毒に思え、私はそう声をかけた。","en":"I felt bad for her, lying exposed like that while I continued to stare, so I called out.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r36","rowIndex":36,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=49>三芳</tips>、起きろ」","en":"“<tips=49>Miyoshi</tips>. Wake up.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r37","rowIndex":37,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ん……」","en":"“Mm...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r38","rowIndex":38,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=49>三芳</tips>はゴシゴシと目を擦り、ゆっくりと目を開いた。","en":"<tips=49>Miyoshi</tips> rubbed her eyes and slowly opened them.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r39","rowIndex":39,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あ……」","en":"“Ah...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r40","rowIndex":40,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私の姿を認めると、目を細める。","en":"When she saw me, her eyes narrowed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r41","rowIndex":41,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=50>路地</tips>さん、おはようございまふ……」","en":"“G’morning, Mr. <tips=50>Roji</tips>...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r42","rowIndex":42,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　言葉の最後はあくびにかき消された。","en":"The end of her greeting vanished into a yawn.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r43","rowIndex":43,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ごめんなさい。なにか、飲み物でものみますかぁ？」","en":"“Sorry. Would you like something to dri-i-ink?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r44","rowIndex":44,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　まだ半分寝ぼけた態度でそう言った。","en":"She spoke while still half asleep.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r45","rowIndex":45,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いやいい。それより教えてくれ。あれからどうなった？　ここは、あんたの部屋なのか？」","en":"“No, I’m fine. Tell me what happened instead. And is this your apartment?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r46","rowIndex":46,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうです。ここは、私のマンションなんでふ」","en":"“Yes. This is my apartment.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r47","rowIndex":47,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=49>三芳</tips>はまたあくびをし、そして目に浮かんだ涙を擦る。目のまわりの化粧が擦れてひどい顔になった。","en":"<tips=49>Miyoshi</tips> yawned again, then rubbed away the tears in her eyes. The motion smeared the makeup around them and left her face a mess.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r48","rowIndex":48,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「大変だったんですよ？　最初は病院に連れて行こうと思ったんですが、もう血が止まってるし、でも心臓は動いてて、ああ本当に言ったとおり不死身になったのかなって。でも、そうじゃなかったら医者に連れて行かなかったら私が死なせたことになっちゃうなって、すごく悩んで……」","en":"“It was quite an ordeal, you know. At first I thought I should take you to a hospital, but the bleeding had already stopped and your heart was still beating, so I wondered if you really had become immortal, just like you said. But if you hadn’t, and I failed to take you to a doctor, then I would have been the one who let you die. I agonized over what to do...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r49","rowIndex":49,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=49>三芳</tips>は半目のまま語り、片手をブラウスの裾からもぐりこませると、脇腹をボリボリと掻いた。","en":"<tips=49>Miyoshi</tips> explained with her eyes half closed. She slipped one hand beneath the hem of her blouse and scratched vigorously at her side.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r50","rowIndex":50,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「結局タクシーに乗せて、ここに運んだんです」","en":"“In the end, I put you in a taxi and brought you here.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r51","rowIndex":51,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=5>太刀川</tips>先生の遺体はどうした？」","en":"“What did you do with <tips=5>Dr. Tachikawa’s</tips> body?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r52","rowIndex":52,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ちゃんと連絡して、捜査員を呼びましたよ。大体ありのままを喋りましたけど、嘘をついちゃいました。<tips=50>路地</tips>は<tips=86>灰上姉妹</tips>と交戦後、追いかけていって、そのまま行方不明になったって……。だからいまもあなたは行方不明になってる設定です。他にもいくつか誤魔化しました。全部本当のことを喋ったら、懲戒免職ですからね。……いつかバレるんじゃないかって、今でもひやひやしてますよ」","en":"“I made the proper report and called in investigators. I told them more or less what had happened, but I told a lie too. I said that after <tips=50>Roji</tips> engaged the <tips=86>Haigami sisters</tips>, he pursued them and disappeared... So officially, you’re still listed as missing. I fudged a few other things too. If I’d told them the whole truth, I’d have been fired for misconduct. ...Even now, I’m terrified it’ll all come out someday.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r53","rowIndex":53,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして三度目のあくびをする。","en":"Then she yawned for a third time.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r54","rowIndex":54,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうか、それは済まなかったな。この手当てもあんたがしてくれたのか？」","en":"“I see. Sorry to put you through all that. Were you the one who bandaged me up, too?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r55","rowIndex":55,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうですよ。当たり前じゃないですか」","en":"“Of course I did.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r56","rowIndex":56,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「身体を清潔にしてくれたのも？」","en":"“You cleaned my body as well?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r57","rowIndex":57,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「気にしないでください。実家に寝たきりのお祖父ちゃんがいて、慣れてますから」","en":"“Please don’t worry about it. My grandfather back home is bedridden, so I’m accustomed to doing that.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r58","rowIndex":58,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=49>三芳</tips>は平然としたものだ。","en":"<tips=49>Miyoshi</tips> remained perfectly matter-of-fact.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r59","rowIndex":59,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうか。……色々と世話になったな」","en":"“I see. ...I owe you a great deal.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r60","rowIndex":60,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それよりも、<tips=50>路地</tips>さん……」","en":"“More importantly, <tips=50>Mr. Roji</tips>...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r61","rowIndex":61,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=49>三芳</tips>は漸く眠気が抜けてきたのか、そこでやっと表情を引き締めて、","en":"Perhaps the drowsiness was finally beginning to leave her. Only now did <tips=49>Miyoshi’s</tips> expression grow serious.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r62","rowIndex":62,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「知っていることを、全て話してください。その身体は一体何なのか。あまりにも不自然すぎますよ。<tips=86>灰上姉妹</tips>と争いになって負傷したとは聞きましたが、それだけで、そんなふうになるものなんですか？　なんだか、私の知らないことも沢山知っているようですし、それも教えてください」","en":"“Please tell me everything you know. What in the world is that body of yours? It’s far too unnatural. I heard that you were wounded fighting the <tips=86>Haigami sisters</tips>, but would that alone make your body like this? You seem to know a great many things that I don’t, so please tell me about those as well.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r63","rowIndex":63,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ふむ」","en":"“Hmm.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r64","rowIndex":64,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　確かに私は彼女に数多くの隠し事をしている。","en":"I had certainly concealed a great deal from her.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r65","rowIndex":65,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　まず灰上との交戦で致命傷を負った後、<tips=55>汐松子</tips>の血液によって不死の身体になったことからして彼女には言っていない。","en":"To begin with, I had not told her that after being mortally wounded in my fight with Haigami, <tips=55>Matsuko Shio’s</tips> blood had transformed my body into an immortal one.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r66","rowIndex":66,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして、その後<tips=5>太刀川</tips>や<tips=31>エリー・ホワイト</tips>から聞いた<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>と<tips=18>ローズ・クラブ</tips>の関係。","en":"Nor had I told her what <tips=5>Tachikawa</tips> and <tips=31>Ellie White</tips> subsequently revealed about the connection between <tips=20>Koschei</tips> and <tips=18>Rose Club</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r67","rowIndex":67,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　実際私はこの事件の真相に大分近づいていると思うのだが、その核心については何も語っていない。","en":"I believed I had drawn quite close to the truth of this case, but I had said nothing about its heart.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r68","rowIndex":68,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=55>汐松子</tips>や<tips=31>エリー・ホワイト</tips>の正体に関わる話であるし、警察にはおいそれと言えるようなものではないのだ。","en":"The information touched upon the identities of <tips=55>Matsuko Shio</tips> and <tips=31>Ellie White</tips>. It was not something I could readily share with the police.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r69","rowIndex":69,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「隠し事をするなんてあんまりです。私だって、ばれたらクビになるようなことまでして、この仕事に打ち込んでいるんですよ？　相手はとても危険なサイキックですし、このまま何も知らないで死んだら、あまりにも私は滑稽だと思いませんか？」","en":"“Keeping secrets from me is too much. I’ve thrown myself into this investigation so completely that some of what I’ve done would get me fired if it came out. We’re facing an extremely dangerous psychic. Don’t you think it would be utterly absurd if I died without ever knowing any of this?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r70","rowIndex":70,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうだな……」","en":"“You’re right...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r71","rowIndex":71,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は悩んだ挙げ句、","en":"After some deliberation, I said,","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r72","rowIndex":72,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「もう廃業したとは言え、おれは元々探偵だった。情報源のプライバシーにかかわることは言えない。それ以外なら話そう。それでいいな？」","en":"“I may have closed my business, but I was a detective once. I cannot disclose anything that compromises the privacy of my sources. I will tell you everything else. Will that satisfy you?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r73","rowIndex":73,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「わかりました。それでお願いします」","en":"“Understood. Please do.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r74","rowIndex":74,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おれは考えて話す順序をまとめると、まず目からカラーコンタクトをとりだし、そして常時金色から戻らなくなってしまった瞳を見せる。","en":"I considered the order of my account. First I removed the colored contacts from my eyes and showed her the irises that had turned permanently gold.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r75","rowIndex":75,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=49>三芳</tips>はそれを見て、はっと息をのむ。","en":"<tips=49>Miyoshi</tips> saw them and drew a sharp breath.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r76","rowIndex":76,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まず、この街には<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>の他に、最低二人不死身の人間がいる。この二人の名前は言えないが、おれはそのうち一人から血を分けてもらって、この新しい身体を手に入れたんだ」","en":"“Besides <tips=20>Koschei</tips>, at least two immortal people live in this city. I can’t tell you their names, but one shared their blood with me, and that gave me this new body.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r77","rowIndex":77,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そう言って、話し始めた。","en":"With that, I began my account.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r78","rowIndex":78,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「とても、信じられません……」","en":"“I just can’t believe it...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"三芳","displayName":"Miyoshi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r79","rowIndex":79,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=49>三芳</tips>は溜息をついた。","en":"<tips=49>Miyoshi</tips> sighed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r80","rowIndex":80,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は、<tips=55>汐松子</tips>と、<tips=31>エリー・ホワイト</tips>の素性以外の部分は大体ありのままを伝えた。","en":"I told her nearly everything exactly as it was, apart from the identities of <tips=55>Matsuko Shio</tips> and <tips=31>Ellie White</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r81","rowIndex":81,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>は今回初めてこの街にやって来たのではなく、どうやら<tips=18>ローズ・クラブ</tips>の時代にも存在し、そこで不死身の女たちを沢山作って三日月の刺青をいれていたこと。私に血を与えた者も、どうもクラブに関係があるということ。","en":"That this was not <tips=20>Koschei’s</tips> first time in the city. Apparently he had been here during the days of the <tips=18>Rose Club</tips> as well, creating numerous immortal women there and marking them with crescent-moon tattoos. And that the person who gave me blood also appeared to have some connection to the club.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r82","rowIndex":82,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　不死身といっても完全な不死身ではなく、<tips=18>ローズ・クラブ</tips>崩壊のときには三日月の女たちがみな殺されていたこと。","en":"That even “immortal” did not mean absolutely immortal, and that when the <tips=18>Rose Club</tips> collapsed, all the women with crescent moons had been killed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r83","rowIndex":83,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あのとき不死身の女たちを殺したのは、おそらく<tips=18>ローズ・クラブ</tips>内にいた<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>だろう。理由はわからんが、この特殊な力を外部に漏らさないためにやったのかもしれない。……まあ、とにかく、<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>は不死の者を簡単に殺す方法を知っているということだ。毒のようなものを使うらしい。おれも永遠に生きなきゃならんわけじゃなくて安心したぜ」","en":"“I suspect the immortal women were killed back then by <tips=20>Koschei</tips>, who was inside the <tips=18>Rose Club</tips>. I don’t know why, but perhaps he did it to keep this special power from leaking into the outside world. ...Anyway, the point is that <tips=20>Koschei</tips> knows an easy way to kill immortals. Apparently he uses something like poison. I’m relieved I won’t have to live forever either.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r84","rowIndex":84,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>に対してもそれが使えるわけですね？」","en":"“Then that method could be used against <tips=20>Koschei</tips> too?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"三芳","displayName":"Miyoshi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r85","rowIndex":85,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「何の薬だかわかればね。……ま、とにかくそういうわけで、次から<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>がおれを相手にするときはその毒やらを使ってくるだろうな。今回みたいに生還するのは難しくなるだろう。しかしこちらには、<tips=43>APTG</tips>もある。何ならガスをばらまくことも出来る。条件は悪くはないさ」","en":"“If we knew what the drug was. ...In any case, <tips=20>Koschei</tips> will probably use that poison or whatever it is the next time he faces me. Surviving as I did this time will be difficult. But we have an <tips=43>APTG</tips> on our side. We could even fill the area with gas if necessary. Our position isn’t a bad one.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r86","rowIndex":86,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……その<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>が、今は<tips=21>八龍会</tips>に協力しているわけですね」","en":"“...And now <tips=20>Koschei</tips> is cooperating with the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"三芳","displayName":"Miyoshi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r87","rowIndex":87,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=49>三芳</tips>は暗い顔で呟く。","en":"<tips=49>Miyoshi</tips> murmured with a grim expression.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r88","rowIndex":88,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そう言えば、病院の防犯カメラに襲撃時の様子は映っていたのかい？」","en":"“By the way, did the hospital security cameras capture what happened during the attack?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r89","rowIndex":89,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「はい。……<tips=21>八龍会</tips>のメンバーに、あの金髪の少女が同行していました」","en":"“Yes. ...That blond girl was accompanying members of the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"三芳","displayName":"Miyoshi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r90","rowIndex":90,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「予想通りだな。他には、めぼしいやつはいたか？」","en":"“Just as I expected. Did you see anyone else of interest?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r91","rowIndex":91,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「顔が出ている者は、ある程度身元が判明しています。まったくこっちで把握出来ない顔もありましたが、たとえば<tips=10>見土道夫</tips>、<tips=67>カミラ・ノーサム</tips>などが仲間に指示を出しているのが確認されています」","en":"“We have identified some of the people whose faces were visible. There were also faces entirely unknown to us, but we confirmed, for example, that <tips=10>Michio Mido</tips> and <tips=67>Camilla Northam</tips> were giving orders to their companions.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"三芳","displayName":"Miyoshi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r92","rowIndex":92,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=21>八龍会</tips>のイキのいい若手が参加してるってわけか」","en":"“So some promising young members of the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips> are taking part.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r93","rowIndex":93,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　いま<tips=49>三芳</tips>があげた名前は、<tips=21>八龍会</tips>の将来の幹部と噂されている若者たちだ。その名前からすると、<tips=47>八龍解放軍</tips>というのは組織のなかの汚れ役というつもりでもなく、主流的な組織という位置づけなのだろう。","en":"The people <tips=49>Miyoshi</tips> had just named were all young members rumored to be future leaders of the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips>. Judging by their involvement, the <tips=47>Hachiryu Liberation Army</tips> was not meant to be some deniable unit for the organization’s dirty work. It must have been positioned as a central, legitimate arm of the organization itself.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r94","rowIndex":94,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「やつらは本気でドンパチやるみたいだな。……警察はどうするんだ？」","en":"“It looks as though they’re serious about starting a war. ...What will the police do?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r95","rowIndex":95,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「さすがに動かないわけには行きません」","en":"“We can hardly do nothing.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"三芳","displayName":"Miyoshi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r96","rowIndex":96,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そりゃそうだが、実際に本気で<tips=21>八龍会</tips>とやりあうつもりか？　社会のあちこちに入り込む<tips=17>タイプB</tips>の秘密組織と戦えるのか？　いつもみたいに、表面上は捜査をしたフリをして、実際には見て見ぬっていう、お得意のやつじゃないか？」","en":"“That’s true, but do you seriously intend to take on the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips>? Can you fight a secret <tips=17>Type B</tips> organization embedded throughout society? Or are you going to pull your usual trick—make a show of investigating while actually turning a blind eye?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r97","rowIndex":97,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「少なくとも、私はそうは聞いていません。武装集団が国立施設を襲撃するというのは、未曾有のテロ行為です。まだ決定はしていませんが、特殊部隊の大量動員も検討しています」","en":"“At least, that isn’t what I’ve been told. An armed group attacking a national facility would constitute an unprecedented act of terrorism. No decision has been made yet, but a large-scale deployment of special forces is under consideration.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"三芳","displayName":"Miyoshi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r98","rowIndex":98,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=49>三芳</tips>の言葉は歯切れが悪く、自信なさげであった。","en":"<tips=49>Miyoshi</tips> spoke haltingly, without confidence.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r99","rowIndex":99,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「へえ、もしそれが実現したら、この街では初めてのことだな。警察の特殊部隊とこの街の<tips=17>タイプB</tips>やサイキックどもが殺し合うのか。ギャングと一般市民の区別なんかほとんどないような街なのに、どうやって戦うつもりだい？　指導者を何人か暗殺したって何も終わりはしない。警察には街を戦場にする覚悟があるのか？」","en":"“Oh? If that happens, it will be a first for this city. Police special units and the city’s <tips=17>Type Bs</tips> and psychics killing one another. In a place where there is scarcely any distinction between gangsters and civilians, how do you mean to fight? Assassinating a few leaders won’t end anything. Are the police prepared to turn the city into a battlefield?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r100","rowIndex":100,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=49>三芳</tips>は沈黙したまま返事をしない。","en":"<tips=49>Miyoshi</tips> remained silent and made no reply.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r101","rowIndex":101,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どうせいつもと同じだろうよ。<tips=18>ローズ・クラブ</tips>の時は、警察は武装して襲撃した<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>たちを黙認したじゃないか。それどころか、<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>の誕生会などにお偉方をよこしていたな。この間の二代目<tips=81>龍頭</tips>のお披露目パーティの時にも来てたって話だぜ。こういうときこそ、長年の関係を活かして<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>に<tips=21>八龍会</tips>退治をさせたらどうだ？」","en":"“It’ll be the same as always. When the <tips=18>Rose Club</tips> fell, the police stood by and let the armed members of <tips=7>YS</tips> launch their attack. Not only that, police higher-ups used to attend events like <tips=3>Chris Tse’s</tips> birthday parties. I hear they even came to the second <tips=81>Longtou’s</tips> unveiling party the other day. Why not make use of that long-standing relationship at a time like this and have <tips=7>YS</tips> eliminate the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips> for you?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r102","rowIndex":102,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「よくご存じですね」","en":"“You know quite a lot about this.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"三芳","displayName":"Miyoshi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r103","rowIndex":103,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「当たり前だよ」","en":"“Naturally.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r104","rowIndex":104,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いま、警察の評判が悪いのは私も知っています。汚職やら、検挙率の低下やら。でも、警察官がみな意欲がないわけではないんです。起きる犯罪が常識で手に負えるレベルを完全にこえてしまっていて……サイキックやら、<tips=17>タイプB</tips>やら、とても対応しきれません。そうした解明不可能な事件に対する無力感が全体に蔓延していて……」","en":"“I know the police have a bad reputation at present. Corruption, declining clearance rates, and so on. But it isn’t true that every police officer lacks motivation. The crimes we’re facing have gone far beyond what common sense can handle... Psychics, <tips=17>Type Bs</tips>—we simply cannot keep up. A sense of helplessness before cases that cannot be explained has spread through the entire force...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"三芳","displayName":"Miyoshi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r105","rowIndex":105,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そんな話はいいんだ。それより、いま警察は<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>とどんな関係にあるのか教えてもらいたいもんだな」","en":"“Enough of that. Tell me what relationship the police currently have with <tips=7>YS</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r106","rowIndex":106,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……第三代<tips=81>龍頭</tips>の<tips=1>謝亮</tips>とは、まだほとんど接触をとっていないようです。<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>の死後、<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>内部がゴタゴタしていたようですし。現状は、我々も<tips=1>謝亮</tips>という人物がどういう人間で、どんな方針で<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>を動かそうとしているのか調査している段階です」","en":"“...It seems there has been almost no contact with <tips=1>Tse Leung</tips>, the third <tips=81>Longtou</tips>, as yet. <tips=7>YS</tips> was apparently in turmoil after <tips=3>Chris Tse</tips> died. At present, we too are still investigating what sort of man <tips=1>Tse Leung</tips> is and what direction he intends to take <tips=7>YS</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"三芳","displayName":"Miyoshi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r107","rowIndex":107,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なるほどね」","en":"“I see.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r108","rowIndex":108,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は溜息をついて、またベッドに横になった。","en":"I sighed and lay down upon the bed again.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r109","rowIndex":109,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　傷はほとんど回復しているようだが、体力はまだ万全ではないようだ。もっとも、あれほど失血しておいてこんなにピンピンしているこのあまりにも頑丈な肉体に、これ以上注文をつけるのは贅沢というものだが。","en":"My wounds seemed almost completely healed, but my strength had not yet returned in full. Still, after losing that much blood, this outrageously sturdy body was already up and running. Asking anything more of it would have been sheer greed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r110","rowIndex":110,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そう言えば、おれの服はどこにいったんだ？」","en":"“By the way, where are my clothes?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r111","rowIndex":111,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ボロボロだったので処分しました。貴重品は、そちらの籠に入っています。新しい服は私が見繕いました。サイズは捨てたものを参考にしたので、着られないことはないはずです」","en":"“They were in tatters, so I threw them away. Your valuables are in that basket over there. I picked out some new clothes for you. I used the ones I discarded to judge the size, so they should at least fit.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r112","rowIndex":112,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「万事ぬかりなしというわけか。はじめてあんたが優秀な人材だってことを実感しているよ」","en":"“So you really did think of everything. For the first time, I’m beginning to appreciate just how capable you are.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r113","rowIndex":113,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は天井を見つめながら言った。","en":"I spoke while staring at the ceiling.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r114","rowIndex":114,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そ、そんなことはありませんが」","en":"“I-I’m nothing of the sort.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r115","rowIndex":115,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あんたがいなければあのままおれは<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>に殺されていただろう。今まで素人扱いして悪かった」","en":"“Without you, <tips=20>Koschei</tips> would have killed me there. I’m sorry I treated you like an amateur until now.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r116","rowIndex":116,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「い、いえ。あの、私は……」","en":"“N-no. I, um...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r117","rowIndex":117,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=49>三芳</tips>がいいかけたところで、私の腹がぐうと大きな音を立てた。","en":"As <tips=49>Miyoshi</tips> began to reply, my stomach gave a tremendous growl.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r118","rowIndex":118,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それはお互いの耳に入ってしまう。","en":"Both of us heard it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r119","rowIndex":119,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「面目ない」","en":"“My apologies.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r120","rowIndex":120,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「い、いえ、何か食べものを用意してきます。待ってて下さい」","en":"“N-no, I’ll find you something to eat. Please wait here.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r121","rowIndex":121,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女は言うと、小走りで部屋を出て行った。","en":"With that, she trotted out of the room.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r122","rowIndex":122,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しばらく過ぎて部屋に戻ってきた<tips=49>三芳</tips>は部屋着に着替え、メイクも落ち、こざっぱりとしている。シャワーでも浴びたのだろう。近づくとボディソープのにおいがした。","en":"When <tips=49>Miyoshi</tips> returned some time later, she had changed into casual clothes and removed her makeup, leaving her neat and fresh. She must have taken a shower. When she approached, I caught the scent of body wash.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r123","rowIndex":123,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女が用意してくれた食事は一人用土鍋に入った粥だった。黄色い溶き卵が混じって味付けは塩だけ。付け合わせの小鉢には梅干しと、数きれの漬物が用意されている。","en":"The meal she prepared was rice porridge in a small earthenware pot for one. Yellow ribbons of beaten egg ran through it, and it was seasoned only with salt. A small side dish held a pickled plum and several pieces of pickled vegetables.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r124","rowIndex":124,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は粥は余り好きではないし、量はこれでは物足りない。もっとこってりとしたものを大量に食べたかったが、<tips=49>三芳</tips>は断食していた人間に急にそんなものは出せないと言う。","en":"I was not particularly fond of rice porridge, and this amount would never satisfy me. I wanted a huge helping of something much richer, but <tips=49>Miyoshi</tips> insisted she could not suddenly serve food like that to someone who had gone without eating.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r125","rowIndex":125,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「これを食べてみて、調子が悪くなかったらお昼は外に出てしっかりしたものを食べましょう」","en":"“Try this. If it doesn’t make you feel ill, we can go out for a substantial lunch.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"三芳","displayName":"Miyoshi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r126","rowIndex":126,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　と譲らなかった。","en":"She would not budge.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r127","rowIndex":127,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　渋々レンゲを手に取ったが、思いのほか粥が旨かった。","en":"I reluctantly picked up the spoon, but the porridge was unexpectedly delicious.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r128","rowIndex":128,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「何か良い材料を使っているのか？」","en":"“Did you use some especially fine ingredient?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r129","rowIndex":129,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「とんでもない。スーパーで売ってる普通のものですよ。身体が欲しているから、美味しく感じるんです」","en":"“Not at all. Everything came from an ordinary supermarket. It tastes good because your body needs it.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"三芳","displayName":"Miyoshi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r130","rowIndex":130,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そんなものなのかな……」","en":"“Does it really work that way...?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r131","rowIndex":131,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　温かく薄味の粥は滋味深く身体に染み込んで、細胞の隅々までその養分が行き渡るような気がした。","en":"The warm, lightly seasoned porridge was deeply nourishing and soaked into my body. I felt as though its nutrients were reaching every last cell.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r132","rowIndex":132,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　食べ終わってみれば、はじめの食欲の割には十分な満足を感じられた。","en":"Once I had finished, I found myself thoroughly satisfied despite how ravenous I had been at the start.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r133","rowIndex":133,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　自分で思っているよりも、まだ胃腸の調子はよくないのかもしれない。","en":"Perhaps my stomach and intestines were in worse condition than I realized.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r134","rowIndex":134,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それを証明するかのように、食べてすぐ後に身体が重くなり、猛烈な睡魔が意識に押し寄せてきた。","en":"As though to prove it, my body grew heavy immediately after the meal, and an overwhelming wave of drowsiness flooded my consciousness.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r135","rowIndex":135,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私はそれに身を委ねて泥のような眠りについた。","en":"I surrendered and sank into a leaden sleep.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r136","rowIndex":136,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　目が覚めるとカーテンが朱色に染まっており、黄昏時を報せてくれる。","en":"When I woke, the curtains had turned vermilion, announcing the twilight hour.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r137","rowIndex":137,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　これも粥の効果なのか、すっかり身体全体が軽くなっており、頭もすっきりと冴えていた。","en":"Perhaps this too was an effect of the porridge. My whole body felt light, and my mind was perfectly clear.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r138","rowIndex":138,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「これなら、素直に病気の時は粥などを食っていれば良かった。どうしても好きになれなくて、これまでの人生で一口か二口しか食ったことがない。今日食べた分で、昨日までの総量をこえたと思う」","en":"“I should have obediently eaten porridge whenever I was sick. I could never bring myself to like it, so before today I had eaten no more than one or two bites in my entire life. Today’s bowl probably exceeded the sum of everything I’d eaten before.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r139","rowIndex":139,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=49>三芳</tips>の用意してくれた服に袖を通し、外出の準備を終えてからそう言った。","en":"I said this after putting on the clothes <tips=49>Miyoshi</tips> had prepared and making myself ready to leave.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r140","rowIndex":140,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「普段病気になると何を食べていたんですか？」","en":"“What did you normally eat when you were ill?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"三芳","displayName":"Miyoshi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r141","rowIndex":141,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「大体肉だな。焼肉とか、ステーキとか。裏のババアがすっぽんを持って来てくれたりしたこともある」","en":"“Usually meat. Yakiniku, steak, things like that. Sometimes the old woman behind my place brought me softshell turtle.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r142","rowIndex":142,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まあ、病中に、そんなものをよく食べられましたね」","en":"“Goodness. You could eat things like that while you were sick?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"三芳","displayName":"Miyoshi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r143","rowIndex":143,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「吐き気がしても無理して食ったよ。とにかく、栄養がたっぷりあるものを食えばすぐに治ると思っていたんだよ」","en":"“I forced them down even when I felt nauseated. I thought I’d recover at once if I ate something packed with nutrition.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r144","rowIndex":144,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私が自分の粗末な治療方法を話すと、<tips=49>三芳</tips>を呆れさせてしまった。","en":"My account of my crude method of treatment left <tips=49>Miyoshi</tips> appalled.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r145","rowIndex":145,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=49>三芳</tips>の住まいは<tips=9>Y地区</tips>の隣のT市にあった。","en":"<tips=49>Miyoshi</tips> lived in T City, which bordered <tips=9>Y District</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r146","rowIndex":146,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　隣と言っても、<tips=9>Y地区</tips>と周辺の街は全くの別世界である。","en":"Neighboring or not, <tips=9>Y District</tips> and the cities around it were entirely different worlds.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r147","rowIndex":147,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=57>滑走路通り</tips>ではそこらじゅうで見かけるミュータントだが、一歩街を出るとまず見かけなくなる。存在しないわけではないのだろうが、<tips=16>タイプA</tips>は徹底して<tips=77>特質変異</tips>を隠し、或いは手術で取り除いて街に溶け込んでいるし、<tips=17>タイプB</tips>は見てわかるような状態ならばほぼ確実に施設に入れられるから、<tips=9>Y地区</tips>のように独り言を呟きながらその辺りをうろつきまわったりはしない。","en":"Mutants were everywhere on <tips=57>Runway Street</tips>, but once one left town, they were almost nowhere to be seen. Not that none existed. <tips=16>Type As</tips> thoroughly concealed their <tips=77>trait mutations</tips>, or had them surgically removed, and blended into the city; any <tips=17>Type B</tips> whose condition was obvious on sight was almost invariably institutionalized. They did not wander around muttering to themselves as they did in <tips=9>Y District</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r148","rowIndex":148,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私のこの姿もあまりに目立ちすぎるということでハンチング帽をかぶらされることになった。ツノが隠れるほどの大きさということで、サイズが大きく少し歩いただけでも斜めに傾くのでそのたびに指先で押し上げなくてはいけない。","en":"My appearance was deemed far too conspicuous as well, so I was made to wear a flat cap. It had to be large enough to cover my horns, and after only a little walking it would tilt to one side, forcing me to push it back into place with my fingertips each time.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r149","rowIndex":149,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私はこのように<tips=77>特質変異</tips>を隠して振る舞うのは<tips=16>タイプA</tips>としての尊厳を否定するようで好きではなかったが、保護してくれた<tips=49>三芳</tips>に迷惑がかからぬようにするためだと、渋々自分を納得させた。","en":"I disliked having to conceal my <tips=77>trait mutations</tips> like this; it felt like denying my dignity as a <tips=16>Type A</tips>. But I reluctantly convinced myself it was necessary to keep from causing trouble for <tips=49>Miyoshi</tips>, who had protected me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r150","rowIndex":150,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　どうしても焼肉が食いたいと伝えたので、<tips=49>三芳</tips>は近くの専門店に案内してくれる。","en":"I told her that I absolutely had to have yakiniku, so <tips=49>Miyoshi</tips> took me to a nearby yakiniku restaurant.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r151","rowIndex":151,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　和風の雰囲気が良い高級店で、私には持ち合わせがないと言うと彼女の方が出すと言った。","en":"It was an expensive restaurant with an attractive Japanese atmosphere. When I told her I did not have enough money on me, she said she would pay.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r152","rowIndex":152,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「さすがキャリアは若くても高給を貰ってるんだな。<tips=48>堂島</tips>の旦那はみみっちく小遣いを計算していたもんだが」","en":"“I suppose even young officers on the elite track draw high salaries. Mr. <tips=48>Dojima</tips> used to count every last yen of his measly allowance.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r153","rowIndex":153,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私としては何の気なしに口にしたつもりだったが、結果として皮肉にしかきこえない言葉となり、彼女は嫌な顔をした。","en":"I had made the remark without thinking anything of it, but it ended up sounding purely sarcastic. She pulled a face.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r154","rowIndex":154,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　個室制の焼き肉屋で、私たちは畳の部屋に通された。あぐらをかきながら食べるのはいやだなと思ったが、テーブルの下が掘りごたつのようになっており足が伸ばせる作りになっていた。","en":"The yakiniku restaurant consisted of private rooms, and we were led into one with tatami flooring. I disliked the thought of sitting cross-legged as I ate, but the space beneath the table had been recessed like a sunken kotatsu, allowing us to extend our legs.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r155","rowIndex":155,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私はそこで久しぶりに酒を頼んだ。","en":"There I ordered alcohol for the first time in a while.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r156","rowIndex":156,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=5>太刀川</tips>先生への別れの酒だよ」","en":"“A farewell drink for <tips=5>Doctor Tachikawa</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r157","rowIndex":157,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　別に<tips=49>三芳</tips>に何か言われたわけでもないが、自分に対する言い訳のようにそう言ってから、最初のビールに口をつけた。","en":"<tips=49>Miyoshi</tips> had said nothing, but I offered the words like an excuse to myself before taking my first sip of beer.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r158","rowIndex":158,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は意識を失って丸々二日間眠りこけていたそうだ。その間の警察の捜査の進捗状況を彼女に聞いた。","en":"Apparently I had lost consciousness and slept for two full days. I asked her how the police investigation had progressed in that time.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r159","rowIndex":159,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「相手が相手なので、対策は協議中ですね。ただ、さっき言った通り具体的なメンバーの情報はそろって来ています」","en":"“Given the nature of the opponent, countermeasures are still under discussion. But as I said earlier, information about specific participants is beginning to come together.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"三芳","displayName":"Miyoshi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r160","rowIndex":160,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=49>三芳</tips>も赤ワインを飲んで少し頬が赤くなっている。","en":"<tips=49>Miyoshi</tips> had been drinking red wine as well, and her cheeks were faintly flushed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r161","rowIndex":161,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=5>太刀川</tips>先生の事件については？」","en":"“And what about the case involving Dr. <tips=5>Tachikawa</tips>?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r162","rowIndex":162,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は網の上のロースをトングでひっくり返しつつそう尋ねた。","en":"I asked as I turned a slice of loin upon the grill with the tongs.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r163","rowIndex":163,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「特別な事件だとは思われていません。警察は、<tips=5>太刀川</tips>医師が過去にギャングの仲間として活躍されてたという話は把握していませんし、<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>と<tips=18>ローズ・クラブ</tips>の関係も掴んでいませんから」","en":"“It isn’t considered an unusual case. The police don’t know that Dr. <tips=5>Tachikawa</tips> was once active as a member of a gang, and they haven’t uncovered the connection between <tips=20>Koschei</tips> and the <tips=18>Rose Club</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"三芳","displayName":"Miyoshi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r164","rowIndex":164,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なるほどね。……これは焼けてるな」","en":"“I see. ...This one is ready.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r165","rowIndex":165,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私はロースを一枚トングで掴んで、<tips=49>三芳</tips>の小皿に乗せてやる。","en":"I picked up one slice of loin with the tongs and placed it on <tips=49>Miyoshi’s</tips> small plate.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r166","rowIndex":166,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「す、すみません」","en":"“Th-thank you.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"三芳","displayName":"Miyoshi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r167","rowIndex":167,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=49>三芳</tips>は恐縮して軽く頭を下げると、豆板醤をといた辛口のタレに、ちょんと肉をつけてから食べた。","en":"<tips=49>Miyoshi</tips> gave an abashed little bow, dipped the meat lightly into a spicy doubanjiang sauce, and ate it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r168","rowIndex":168,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私はたっぷりのニンニクをいれたタレを肉から滴り落ちるほど絡め、それを白米に乗せてかき込むと、ビールで押し流す。","en":"I smothered my meat in garlic-laden sauce until it dripped, laid it over white rice, shoveled it all into my mouth, and washed it down with beer.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r169","rowIndex":169,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……<tips=50>路地</tips>さんは、まだこの捜査を続けるんですか？」","en":"“...<tips=50>Mr. Roji</tips>, do you still intend to continue this investigation?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"三芳","displayName":"Miyoshi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r170","rowIndex":170,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「当然だ。やめる理由がない」","en":"“Of course. I have no reason to stop.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r171","rowIndex":171,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ありますよ。もうただの殺人事件でなく、組織を巻き込んだ大げさなものになってしまいました。警察でもトップの人たちまでやってきて大騒ぎをしています。<tips=50>路地</tips>さんは仕事ってわけではないし、こちらから協力の報酬は出ますが、とても危険で割に合わないと思うのですが」","en":"“There is. This isn’t a simple murder case anymore; it has grown into an enormous affair involving entire organizations. Even the people at the very top of the police have come in, and it’s caused a tremendous uproar. This isn’t your job, <tips=50>Mr. Roji</tips>. We can compensate you for cooperating, but it’s far too dangerous for what you would get in return.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"三芳","displayName":"Miyoshi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r172","rowIndex":172,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=49>三芳</tips>は箸を止めて俯いている。","en":"<tips=49>Miyoshi</tips> stopped eating and looked down, her chopsticks motionless.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r173","rowIndex":173,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「割には合ってるさ。おれの命なんぞそんなに高いものじゃない」","en":"“It is worth it. My life isn’t worth all that much.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r174","rowIndex":174,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私はトングで肉をひっくり返し、焼けたものをそれぞれの皿に取り分けながら答えた。","en":"I answered while turning the meat with the tongs and dividing the cooked pieces between our plates.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r175","rowIndex":175,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「やっぱり、なくなった人たちのためだから頑張ってるんですよね。<tips=50>路地</tips>さんは凄いですね。若い時から探偵をして、弱い人たちの味方をして……。本来私たち警察がしなくちゃいけないことを、街でやってくれていたのに、警察はその<tips=50>路地</tips>さんから能力をうばって……」","en":"“You’re still fighting because of the people we lost, aren’t you? You’re amazing, <tips=50>Mr. Roji</tips>. You became a detective when you were young and stood on the side of the vulnerable... You were doing out in the city what we police should have been doing ourselves, <tips=50>Mr. Roji</tips>, and the police responded by taking your power away...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"三芳","displayName":"Miyoshi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r176","rowIndex":176,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「その解釈は間違ってる」","en":"“That interpretation is wrong.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r177","rowIndex":177,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「え」","en":"“What?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"三芳","displayName":"Miyoshi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r178","rowIndex":178,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「おれはそんな立派なもんじゃない」","en":"“I’m nothing so admirable.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r179","rowIndex":179,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は溜息をついて、","en":"I sighed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r180","rowIndex":180,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「死んだやつらのために、なんて考えたことはないね。そもそも、そんなことは出来やしないのさ。死んだ人間は何をしたって喜びも悲しみもしないんだから」","en":"“I’ve never once thought I was doing this for the people who died. Such a thing is impossible in the first place. No matter what you do, the dead feel neither joy nor sorrow.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r181","rowIndex":181,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それはそうですが……」","en":"“That may be true, but...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"三芳","displayName":"Miyoshi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r182","rowIndex":182,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「もしおれが心優しい人間だったら、最初からこんなことは起きなかったんだぜ？　<tips=53>ミユキ</tips>が死んだのは、結局のところおれが余計な女と寝て余計なことを話したせいだ。そして<tips=48>堂島</tips>の旦那も死に、<tips=5>太刀川</tips>先生も死んだ。どちらも助けられたかもしれない。なのに、おれは死人を尻目にここでビールを飲み、この脂がしたたる上等の焼肉を食っている。実に旨い肉だ。死者に対して本当に何かを感じていたら、こんなことが出来ると思うか？」","en":"“If I were a kindhearted man, none of this would have happened in the first place. <tips=53>Miyuki</tips> died because, in the end, I slept with a woman I had no business sleeping with and told her things I had no business telling her. Then Mr. <tips=48>Dojima</tips> died, and Dr. <tips=5>Tachikawa</tips> died too. Maybe both of them could have been saved. And yet here I sit, heedless of the dead, drinking beer and eating this fine grilled meat with fat dripping from it. Damn good meat. Do you think I could do this if I truly felt anything for the dead?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r183","rowIndex":183,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……それは違うと思います」","en":"“...I don’t think that’s true.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"三芳","displayName":"Miyoshi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r184","rowIndex":184,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いや、違わないね。おれは死んだ連中のためじゃなくて、むしゃくしゃする自分の気持ちをはらすためだけにやつを追ってるのさ。自分の感情のままに動いているだけなんだよ。探偵時代だってそうさ。路上で泣くガキや女を見るたび、人を食い物にしているクズを見るたび、腹が立った。むかついて仕方なかったんだ。だから、選ばれたサイキックであるおれがそれをやっつけてやろうと思ったわけさ。スカっとするからな」","en":"“No, it is. I’m not pursuing him for the people who died. I’m pursuing him solely to vent my own frustration. I’m just acting on my feelings. I was the same in my detective days. Every time I saw a kid or a woman crying on the street, every time I saw scum preying on people, I got angry. I couldn’t stand it. So I decided that I, a chosen psychic, would take them down. Because it felt good.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r185","rowIndex":185,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私はそして焼肉を頬張ったが、少し生焼けだった。","en":"Then I stuffed another piece of grilled meat into my mouth, only to find it slightly raw.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r186","rowIndex":186,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「その感情が、良心というものではないでしょうか？　<tips=50>路地</tips>さんは悪く言いますけど、それは卑下するようなことじゃないんですよ。胸を張って誰にでも自慢できます」","en":"“Isn’t that feeling precisely what we call a conscience? You speak of it as though it were something bad, <tips=50>Mr. Roji</tips>, but it isn’t anything to belittle yourself over. You could hold your head high and be proud of it before anyone.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"三芳","displayName":"Miyoshi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r187","rowIndex":187,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ばかばかしい。おれはただ、何事に対しても我慢が足りないのさ。やりたいことしかしないで生きて来た。<tips=48>旦那</tips>のように黙々と職務を果たしたり、<tips=5>先生</tips>のように寝る間も惜しんで病人を診察したり、<tips=53>ミユキ</tips>みたいに誰かに尽くしたりすることもない。もしおれの心が、たとえば女を殺したら喜ぶように出来ていたら、きっと<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>のようになっていたろうよ」","en":"“Absurd. I simply don’t have the patience to endure anything. I’ve lived my whole life doing only what I felt like doing. I never silently carried out my duties like <tips=48>Mr. Dojima</tips>, gave up sleep to tend the sick like <tips=5>the doctor</tips>, or devoted myself to another person the way <tips=53>Miyuki</tips> did. If my heart happened to be made so that killing women brought me joy, I would surely have become someone just like <tips=20>Koschei</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r188","rowIndex":188,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は丼の白米を全て食べ終え、ビールも飲み干した。テーブル脇のパネルを操作して、新しいものを注文する。","en":"I finished all the white rice in my bowl and drained my beer. Then I operated the panel beside the table and ordered more.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r189","rowIndex":189,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「サイキックは、心のかたちが出ると聞いたことがあります。きっと<tips=50>路地</tips>さんはそうやって自由に生きているから、何も鍵がない世界になったんでしょうね」","en":"“I’ve heard that a psychic power takes the shape of the heart. Perhaps because you live so freely, <tips=50>Mr. Roji</tips>, your power creates a world with no locks.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"三芳","displayName":"Miyoshi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r190","rowIndex":190,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しばらく黙っていたかと思ったら、<tips=49>三芳</tips>はぽつりと言った。","en":"After a long silence, <tips=49>Miyoshi</tips> spoke in a murmur.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r191","rowIndex":191,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そんないいもんじゃない」","en":"“It isn’t anything so fine.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r192","rowIndex":192,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そこで店員が私が注文をしたものを運んで来る。","en":"At that moment, a server brought what I had ordered.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r193","rowIndex":193,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　目の前に置いてくれた白米からいいにおいがする。今朝目が覚めたときは僅かなお粥で満ち足りてしまったが、あれで内臓が正常化したのか、いくら食べても足りない感じだ。","en":"The white rice placed before me smelled wonderful. That morning, a small portion of porridge had left me satisfied, but perhaps it had restored my organs to normal. Now I could eat and eat without feeling full.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r194","rowIndex":194,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=55>汐</tips>に血を分け与えられて目を覚ました後も、しばらくそのような異常な食欲が続いた。","en":"After I awoke from being given <tips=55>Shio’s</tips> blood, that same abnormal appetite had persisted for quite some time.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r195","rowIndex":195,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　いくら不死身の身体だと言っても、失ったものは食事として取り戻す必要があるのだろう。","en":"Even with an immortal body, I probably had to replace through food whatever I had lost.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r196","rowIndex":196,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「私は、警察官になるのが子供の頃からの夢だったんです」","en":"“It was my dream from childhood to become a police officer.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"三芳","displayName":"Miyoshi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r197","rowIndex":197,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　店員が去ると、<tips=49>三芳</tips>は憂愁を帯びた表情のまま口を開いた。","en":"Once the server departed, <tips=49>Miyoshi</tips> began to speak, her expression melancholy.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r198","rowIndex":198,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「小さな頃、旅行先で迷子になって……駐車場で見かけた猫を追いかけて、そのまま帰り方がわからなくなっちゃったんですね。そうして途方に暮れて泣いているところでミニパトに乗った女性の警察官が通りかかって、車に乗せてくれたんです」","en":"“When I was little, I got lost while we were away on a trip... I chased after a cat I saw in a parking lot, and then I could no longer find my way back. I was standing there at a loss, crying, when a policewoman in one of those little patrol cars happened to drive by and let me in.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"三芳","displayName":"Miyoshi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r199","rowIndex":199,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　手をつけようとしない<tips=49>三芳</tips>の小皿にも、私は無断で焼き上がった肉をどんどん積み重ねてゆく。","en":"As <tips=49>Miyoshi</tips> made no move to eat, I kept piling freshly grilled meat onto her small plate without asking.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r200","rowIndex":200,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「苺味の飴をくれて落ち着かせてくれて、私の話から推測して両親のところまで送り届けてくれました。<tips=16>タイプＡ</tips>だったらしくて、特質変異が強くて、ちょっと人とは違う姿をしていたんですけれど、初めて見た<tips=16>タイプＡ</tips>のことが私は全然怖くなくて、むしろとてもかっこいいと思って、それで警察官に憧れて勉強を頑張ったんです」","en":"“She gave me a strawberry candy to calm me down, figured out where my parents were from what I told her, and took me back to them. She was apparently a <tips=16>Type A</tips>, with pronounced trait mutations, and looked a little different from other people. But I wasn’t afraid at all of the first <tips=16>Type A</tips> I’d ever seen. If anything, I thought she looked incredibly cool. That was why I came to admire police officers and studied so hard.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"三芳","displayName":"Miyoshi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r201","rowIndex":201,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ちょっと頑張りすぎたな」","en":"“You worked a little too hard.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r202","rowIndex":202,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「本当ですよ。制服警官になりたかったのに……。なんだか不本意な立場を与えられているような気がします」","en":"“Exactly. I wanted to be a uniformed officer... It feels as though I’ve been given a position I never wanted.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"三芳","displayName":"Miyoshi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r203","rowIndex":203,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=49>三芳</tips>は苦笑する。","en":"<tips=49>Miyoshi</tips> smiled wryly.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r204","rowIndex":204,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まあいいじゃないか。両親も鼻が高いだろう。将来は警察官僚かい？」","en":"“Well, there’s nothing wrong with that. Your parents must be proud. Will you become a police bureaucrat someday?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r205","rowIndex":205,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は言いながら、先ほどと同じように焼けた肉で白米を食べた。今回のものは炊きたてなのか、米にみずみずしいような味わいがある。","en":"As I spoke, I ate white rice with grilled meat just as before. Perhaps this rice had just been cooked; the grains tasted especially fresh and moist.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r206","rowIndex":206,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「さあ、どうでしょう。……私、今回の事件が終わったら、退職しようかなって思い始めていて」","en":"“Who knows? ...I’ve begun to consider resigning after this case is over.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"三芳","displayName":"Miyoshi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r207","rowIndex":207,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「やりたくないなら辞めればいいさ」","en":"“If you don’t want to do it, then quit.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r208","rowIndex":208,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私はビールや白米と一緒に追加注文していたタン塩を網の上にならべた。厚めに切られていて、実に旨そうだ。","en":"I arranged the thickly sliced salted beef tongue I had ordered with the beer and rice upon the grill. It looked exceedingly good.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r209","rowIndex":209,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そんな私の態度に<tips=49>三芳</tips>は溜息をついて、","en":"<tips=49>Miyoshi</tips> sighed at my attitude.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r210","rowIndex":210,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「とにかく、今回の仕事はなんとか無事に成し遂げましょう。これ以上<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>に犯罪を起こさせるわけにはいきません」","en":"“In any case, let’s make sure we see this job through safely. We can’t allow <tips=20>Koschei</tips> to commit any more crimes.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"三芳","displayName":"Miyoshi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r211","rowIndex":211,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「無理をしないことだね。あんたにとってはただの仕事の筈だ。ほら、焼いてやったんだから食えよ」","en":"“Don’t overdo it. For you, this is supposed to be nothing more than a job. Here, I grilled that for you, so eat it.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r212","rowIndex":212,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「だけど……」","en":"“But...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"三芳","displayName":"Miyoshi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r213","rowIndex":213,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=49>三芳</tips>は肉に手をつけようとしない。","en":"<tips=49>Miyoshi</tips> made no move to touch the meat.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r214","rowIndex":214,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あと、正直に言うがね、おれは<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>を逮捕するなんてつもりはさらさらないんだ」","en":"“And to be honest, I have no intention whatsoever of arresting <tips=20>Koschei</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r215","rowIndex":215,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は言って、焼けたタン塩をレモン汁の小皿に浸す。","en":"As I spoke, I dipped a piece of grilled tongue into the small dish of lemon juice.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r216","rowIndex":216,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「え、どういうことですか？」","en":"“What do you mean?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"三芳","displayName":"Miyoshi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r217","rowIndex":217,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私はそのタン塩をビールで流し込んでから、チラと彼女の顔を見て、","en":"I washed the tongue down with beer, then glanced at her face.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r218","rowIndex":218,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「おれは殺すつもりだよ。警察はああいうサイキックは研究対象として欲しがるだろうがね、でもおれは殺す。身柄を警察に引き渡すつもりはない」","en":"“I mean to kill Koschei. The police probably want a psychic like that as a research subject, but I will kill him. I have no intention of handing him over to the police.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r219","rowIndex":219,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それは……」","en":"“That...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"三芳","displayName":"Miyoshi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r220","rowIndex":220,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「大体、あいつを捕らえたところでどうせ逃げ出されるのがオチだよ。それじゃ、あまりに報われないと思わないか？　あいつに殺された被害者も、捜査員も……」","en":"“Even if we captured him, the only way it would end is with him escaping again. Wouldn’t that leave the people he killed—and the investigators who pursued him—far too cruelly unrewarded...?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r221","rowIndex":221,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私がそう言うと<tips=49>三芳</tips>は黙り込んで俯いてしまう。","en":"At those words, <tips=49>Miyoshi</tips> fell silent and lowered her head.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r222","rowIndex":222,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「もう腹一杯なら貰うぜ」","en":"“If you’re full, I’ll take it.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r223","rowIndex":223,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女はいつまで経っても食べようとしないので、皿の上で冷えはじめた肉を箸でつまんだ。","en":"When she still made no move to eat, I used my chopsticks to pick up the meat that had begun to cool on her plate.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r224","rowIndex":224,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=49>三芳</tips>が会計を済ませるのを、一足先に外に出て、路上で待っていた。","en":"I went outside ahead of <tips=49>Miyoshi</tips> and waited in the street while she settled the bill.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r225","rowIndex":225,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　日が落ち、空には月が浮かんでいる。そしてとてつもなく静かだ。どこか遠くで鳴く犬の声が聞こえてくる程度で、あとはほとんど物音がしない。<tips=9>Y地区</tips>ではこんなに静かな夜はない。","en":"The sun had set, and the moon hung in the sky. It was extraordinarily quiet. I could hear only a dog barking somewhere far away; otherwise, there was almost no sound at all. A night in <tips=9>Y District</tips> was never this silent.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r226","rowIndex":226,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ほとんど<tips=9>Y地区</tips>の外へ出ない私にとっては、隣とは言え他の街は珍しく感じられた。","en":"I almost never left <tips=9>Y District</tips>, so even a city directly next door felt unfamiliar and novel to me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r227","rowIndex":227,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「お待たせしました」","en":"“Sorry to keep you waiting.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"三芳","displayName":"Miyoshi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r228","rowIndex":228,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=49>三芳</tips>が少しふらつく足取りで店を出て来る。それほどアルコールを飲んでいたようには見えないが、弱いのだろう。","en":"<tips=49>Miyoshi</tips> emerged from the restaurant with a slight unsteadiness in her steps. She had not appeared to drink very much, but perhaps she had little tolerance for alcohol.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r229","rowIndex":229,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「本当に今から街へ帰るんですか？」","en":"“Are you truly returning to the city now?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"三芳","displayName":"Miyoshi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r230","rowIndex":230,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうするよ。これ以上女の一人暮らしに泊まるのは気が進まないし、街に戻ってまた調査をしたい」","en":"“I am. I don’t care to stay another night in the apartment of a woman who lives alone, and I want to return to the city and resume my investigation.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r231","rowIndex":231,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「わかりました。お気をつけて。……今日はなんだか余計なことを喋ってしまったような気がしますが、忘れてください」","en":"“Understood. Please be careful. ...I feel as though I told you things today that I shouldn’t have. Please forget them.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"三芳","displayName":"Miyoshi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r232","rowIndex":232,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なんのことだ？　おれは何も聞いていないぜ？」","en":"“Forget what? I didn’t hear a thing.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r233","rowIndex":233,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は肩をすくめて、","en":"I shrugged.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r234","rowIndex":234,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「じゃあ、ごちそうさま」","en":"“Thank you for the meal.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r235","rowIndex":235,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それで去ろうかと思ったが、ふと、あることを思い出した。","en":"I was about to leave when I suddenly remembered something.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r236","rowIndex":236,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そう言えば、あんたに提案があるのを忘れていた」","en":"“Come to think of it, I forgot I had a suggestion for you.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r237","rowIndex":237,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「何でしょうか？」","en":"“What is it?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"三芳","displayName":"Miyoshi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r238","rowIndex":238,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「おれは近いうちに<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>の<tips=41>グランドタワー</tips>を訪ねて<tips=1>謝亮</tips>に会って、<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>のことを話そうと思う」","en":"“Sometime soon, I intend to visit <tips=7>YS’s</tips> <tips=41>Grand Tower</tips>, meet with <tips=1>Tse Leung</tips>, and tell him about <tips=20>Koschei</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r239","rowIndex":239,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>に？」","en":"“<tips=7>YS</tips>?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"三芳","displayName":"Miyoshi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r240","rowIndex":240,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そう、<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>は『<tips=18>ローズ・クラブ</tips>』に関係している上に、今は<tips=21>八龍会</tips>に協力している。<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>の連中をうまく巻き込めるんじゃないかと思うんだ」","en":"“Yes. <tips=20>Koschei</tips> is connected with the ‘<tips=18>Rose Club</tips>’ and, on top of that, is now cooperating with the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips>. I think we may be able to find a way to draw the people at <tips=7>YS</tips> into this.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r241","rowIndex":241,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=49>三芳</tips>には話していないが、<tips=31>エリー・ホワイト</tips>という存在もいる。おそらく彼女もこの件については私に協力的な立場をとるのではないかと想像していた。","en":"There was also <tips=31>Ellie White</tips>, whose existence I had not revealed to <tips=49>Miyoshi</tips>. I imagined that she, too, would probably be inclined to cooperate with me in this matter.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r242","rowIndex":242,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そのとき、あんたも同席してくれるとありがたい」","en":"“When the time comes, I’d appreciate having you there too.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r243","rowIndex":243,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「私が、ですか？」","en":"“Me?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"三芳","displayName":"Miyoshi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r244","rowIndex":244,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=49>三芳</tips>は動揺を見せる。<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>の本拠地に乗り込むというのは、彼女にとっては恐怖が先立つアイデアであるはずだ。","en":"<tips=49>Miyoshi</tips> was visibly shaken. The thought of walking into <tips=7>YS</tips> headquarters must have filled her first and foremost with fear.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r245","rowIndex":245,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうとも。上に話しても、あんたが独断で来てもいい。好きにすればいい。警察だって、出来れば<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>を利用したいだろう。恐ろしいなら、無理にとは……」","en":"“Exactly. You can speak to your superiors, or you can come on your own initiative without telling them. Do whichever you like. The police would surely prefer to make use of <tips=7>YS</tips> if possible. If you’re afraid, I won’t force you to—”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r246","rowIndex":246,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「い、行きます！」","en":"“I-I’ll go!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"三芳","displayName":"Miyoshi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r247","rowIndex":247,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=49>三芳</tips>は大きな声を私の発言に被せた。","en":"<tips=49>Miyoshi</tips> raised her voice over the end of my sentence.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r248","rowIndex":248,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「わかった。あとでまた連絡をする」","en":"“Understood. I’ll contact you later.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r249","rowIndex":249,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は苦笑を残し、今度こそ、その場を立ち去った。","en":"I gave her a wry smile and, this time, finally left.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r250","rowIndex":250,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　夜空に浮かんだ月を見上げながらゆっくり歩いて<tips=9>Y地区</tips>へ向かう。","en":"Gazing up at the moon suspended in the night sky, I walked slowly toward <tips=9>Y District</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r251","rowIndex":251,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　胃の腑が満ち足り、脳にはアルコールがまわっている。肉体的にはとても良い気分だが、気持ちは優れない。","en":"My stomach was full, and the alcohol had gone to my head. Physically, I felt exceedingly good. My spirits were another matter.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r252","rowIndex":252,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=49>三芳</tips>と別れてから、やはり頭に浮かんで来るのは<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>のことだった。","en":"After parting from <tips=49>Miyoshi</tips>, my thoughts inevitably returned to <tips=20>Koschei</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r253","rowIndex":253,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　これからあいつをどうやって追い詰めてやるか。","en":"How would I corner him from here?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r254","rowIndex":254,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それを考えながら歩いていると、","en":"As I walked, thinking it over, I heard a voice.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r255","rowIndex":255,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=50>邦昭さん</tips>……」","en":"“<tips=50>Kuniaki</tips>...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r256","rowIndex":256,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　小さな声で、誰かがそう囁く。","en":"Someone whispered softly.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r257","rowIndex":257,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　こんなところで私を呼ぶものがいる筈がない。しかもこの声で、こんな呼び方で。","en":"There should have been no one here who would call out to me—and certainly no one with that voice, addressing me that way.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r258","rowIndex":258,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　気のせいだろうと通り過ぎようとしたが、","en":"I tried to dismiss it as my imagination and keep walking.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r259","rowIndex":259,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=50>邦昭さん</tips>……」","en":"“<tips=50>Kuniaki</tips>...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r260","rowIndex":260,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　声は先ほどよりもはっきりと聞こえた。間違いなく、聞き覚えのあるあの声である。","en":"The voice came more clearly than before. There was no mistaking it: it was that voice I knew so well.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r261","rowIndex":261,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は立ち止まり、辺りを見回す。","en":"I stopped and looked around.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r262","rowIndex":262,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　すると、左手にある住宅と住宅の間の暗がりのなかに、うっすら白く光るようにその人物がいた。","en":"There, in the darkness between two houses to my left, stood someone who seemed to glow faintly white.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r263","rowIndex":263,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=53>ミユキ</tips>……」","en":"“<tips=53>Miyuki</tips>...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ミユキ","displayName":"Miyuki","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r264","rowIndex":264,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その名前が無意識に口をついて出た。","en":"The name left my mouth without conscious thought.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r265","rowIndex":265,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そう、目の前で笑っているのは、アパートで無惨なバラバラ死体となった<tips=53>ミユキ</tips>その人であった。","en":"Yes. The person smiling before me was <tips=53>Miyuki</tips> herself—the woman who had become a gruesomely dismembered corpse in my apartment.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r266","rowIndex":266,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私の背筋は冷たく凍り付き、肌が粟立つ。","en":"My spine froze, and gooseflesh rose upon my skin.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r267","rowIndex":267,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=50>邦昭さん</tips>……とっても疲れているのね……」","en":"“<tips=50>Kuniaki</tips>... you look so very tired...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ミユキ","displayName":"Miyuki","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r268","rowIndex":268,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=53>ミユキ</tips>はそう言った。","en":"<tips=53>Miyuki</tips> spoke.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r269","rowIndex":269,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　こうして向かい合っているだけで、彼女特有のあの甘いなんとも言えないにおいさえ感じ取れる。","en":"Merely standing face-to-face with her, I could even smell that indescribably sweet scent peculiar to her.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r270","rowIndex":270,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　死んだ人間は蘇らない。幻覚なのはわかっている。しかし、こうして面と向かっていくら観察してみても、実体をもった<tips=53>ミユキ</tips>と何ら変わるところがない。いやむしろ、本物の<tips=53>ミユキ</tips>以上に<tips=53>ミユキ</tips>らしく感じられた。","en":"The dead do not come back to life. I knew this was a hallucination. And yet, no matter how closely I studied her face-to-face like this, she was no different from <tips=53>Miyuki</tips> in the flesh. If anything, she felt even more like <tips=53>Miyuki</tips> than the real <tips=53>Miyuki</tips> did.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r271","rowIndex":271,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私の脳が都合良く作り上げたのだから、当然と言えば当然なのかもしれない。","en":"Perhaps that was only natural. My brain had created her to suit itself.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r272","rowIndex":272,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「私もね、<tips=50>邦昭さん</tips>みたいに生き返ったの……。これからはずっと一緒ね」","en":"“I came back to life too, just like you, <tips=50>Kuniaki</tips>... From now on, we’ll always be together.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ミユキ","displayName":"Miyuki","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r273","rowIndex":273,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そんなはず、あるわけがない。完全に、バラバラになっていた。あの状態で誰かが血液を与えても、生き返りなどしないだろう。","en":"That was impossible. She had been completely torn apart. Even if someone gave her blood in that condition, surely it could not bring her back to life.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r274","rowIndex":274,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　――いや、考えて見れば私が全てを知っているというわけでもない。もしかしたら、何か特別な方法があるのだろうか？　あるいは、あのアパートの場面こそ、何かの思い違いだったとしたら？","en":"—Then again, I did not know everything. Perhaps some special method existed. Or what if I had misunderstood what I saw in the apartment?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r275","rowIndex":275,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は目の前の<tips=53>ミユキ</tips>を見ながらこれが現実である可能性を模索してみた。しかし、どう考えても合理的に自分を納得させる説明を思いつけなかった。","en":"As I watched <tips=53>Miyuki</tips> standing before me, I searched for some possibility that this was real. But however I considered it, I could think of no rational explanation that would convince me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r276","rowIndex":276,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　考えながら、私は自分が冷静であることに気がついた。はじめこそ驚かされたが、それだけだ。別に恐怖でもなんでもない。むしろ、もう二度とその姿を見ることが出来ないと思っていた彼女の姿をもう一度目の当たりにすることが出来て、嬉しかった。","en":"While I thought, I noticed how calm I was. The sight had startled me at first, but that was all. I felt no fear. On the contrary, I was glad to see once more the form of someone I had believed I would never see again.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r277","rowIndex":277,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しかしその喜びもつかの間、瞬きをすると消えてしまった。","en":"But that happiness was brief. I blinked, and she vanished.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r278","rowIndex":278,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　馬鹿げた幻覚を見たものだ。","en":"What a ridiculous hallucination.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r279","rowIndex":279,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして私は背中を丸めて歩き出す。","en":"I hunched my back and began walking again.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r280","rowIndex":280,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しかし、この幻覚はなんだったのだろう。ただの疲れなのだろうか？　それとも、<tips=17>タイプB</tips>が見るという、あれじゃないのか？　<tips=55>汐松子</tips>は、自分には<tips=17>タイプB</tips>の症状は一切出ないと言っていたはずだが。","en":"But what had that hallucination been? Was it merely exhaustion? Or was it one of those visions <tips=17>Type Bs</tips> were said to see? <tips=55>Matsuko Shio</tips> had told me that she herself never exhibited any <tips=17>Type B</tips> symptoms at all.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r281","rowIndex":281,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　――もしかしたら、自分は失敗したのかもしれない。血液を与えても必ずしも成功するとは限らず、ただの<tips=17>タイプB</tips>になって発症してしまうと、<tips=55>汐</tips>も<tips=31>エリー・ホワイト</tips>も言っていた。幻覚に驚くことなく、自然と受け入れてしまったのも症状のせいで感覚が鈍っているからかもしれない。","en":"—Perhaps I was one of the failures. <tips=55>Shio</tips> and <tips=31>Ellie White</tips> had both said that giving someone the blood did not guarantee success: the recipient might simply become <tips=17>Type B</tips> and suffer onset. Perhaps I had accepted the hallucination so naturally, without surprise, because the symptoms were already dulling my judgment.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r282","rowIndex":282,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そうだとすると私は、このまま狂ってしまうのかもしれないな。<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>への復讐も忘れて、ただぼんやりと幻想の世界の住人になってしまうのだ。いや、『<tips=46>ネオ・ローズ</tips>』を使えばそれを防止出来るのか？　あの<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>と組んでいる<tips=21>八龍会</tips>が販売しているそれを買って、正気を保つのか？","en":"If so, perhaps I would go mad at this rate. I would forget my revenge against <tips=20>Koschei</tips> and become a dazed inhabitant of a fantasy world. Or could “<tips=46>Neo Rose</tips>” prevent that? Would I buy it from the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips>, now in league with <tips=20>Koschei</tips>, to keep myself sane?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r283","rowIndex":283,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　馬鹿馬鹿しい。","en":"Absurd.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r284","rowIndex":284,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「フフ……フフフ……」","en":"“Heh... hehehe...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r285","rowIndex":285,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　なぜか、おかしな笑いがこみ上げてきた。","en":"For some reason, strange laughter welled inside me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r286","rowIndex":286,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は肩を揺すり、笑いながら、<tips=9>Y地区</tips>への道を歩く。酔っ払いとすれ違うと、怪訝な顔で振り返った。きっと、私が発症したと思っただろう。いや、もしかしたら、正真正銘いまの自分は発症しているのかもしれない。こんなときに笑いが出て、おかしくておかしくてたまらないなんて。","en":"My shoulders shook with laughter as I walked the road back to <tips=9>Y District</tips>. A drunk who passed me turned and stared with a puzzled look. He must have thought I had suffered onset. No—perhaps at that very moment I truly had. To start laughing at a time like this, to find it all so funny that I could not contain myself...","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:E7:r287","rowIndex":287,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私はこれまでに出会った様々な発症者を思い浮かべた。世の中では毛嫌いされる連中だが、自分は彼らをまったく嫌いではなかった。――その自分の気持ちを思い出すと、発症しても、別に、恐れるようなことはなにもないのだというような気がした。","en":"I thought of the many people I had met who had suffered onset. The world regarded them with disgust, but I had never disliked them in the slightest. —When I remembered that feeling of mine, it seemed to me that even if I had suffered onset, there might not be anything to fear after all.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}}]},{"position":45,"code":"B4-1","unitId":"B4-1","rows":[{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r1","rowIndex":1,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　物事のはじまりにはいつだって前兆というものがある。","en":"Whatever is about to begin, there is always some sign of it first.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r2","rowIndex":2,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ただ、それは必ずしも人の目につく場所にあらわれているとは限らず、誰の目にもつかないところでゆっくりと進行し、突然目の前に現れて重大な影響を及ぼすというケースもある。","en":"But those signs do not necessarily appear where anyone can see them. Some advance slowly out of sight, then burst into view without warning and exert a profound influence on what follows.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r3","rowIndex":3,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そういうとき、人は不条理を感じたり、とんでもない偶然のように思ったり、不意を打たれたように感じてしまうんだろう。みんな無意識のうちに、明日も今日と同じような日が来ると考えているからなおさらだ。","en":"When that happens, people probably find it senseless, take it for some outrageous coincidence, or feel as though they have been caught completely off guard. All the more so because everyone unconsciously assumes that tomorrow will be another day just like today.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r4","rowIndex":4,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　この街みたいな混乱だらけの場所に住んでいたってそうさ。いくら人の命が安い街だと言っても、みんながみんな大事な人が明日死ぬなんてことを恐れながら暮らしているわけじゃない。結構のほほんと生きている。","en":"That remains true even when you live in a place as full of chaos as this city. However cheap life may be here, not everyone passes each day afraid that someone dear to them will die tomorrow. Most people live surprisingly carefree lives.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r5","rowIndex":5,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そしてうかうかと前兆を見逃し、実際死んでしまってから、なんて不幸で不条理なことがおきるんだ！　と呪うのさ。","en":"And so they blithely overlook the signs, then wait until someone is actually dead to cry, ‘How could anything so cruel and senseless happen!’ and curse their fate.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r6","rowIndex":6,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　世の中から少しでも不条理を減らしたければ、注意深く色々な情報に触れ、物事の理屈というものを理解しなくちゃいけない。――もっとも、本当に恐ろしい悲劇というものは、人間のそういった能力を軽々と超えて起きてしまうんだけれど。","en":"If you want to rid the world of even a little of that senselessness, you have to take in all kinds of information with care and understand the logic of how things happen. —Though truly terrible tragedies can sweep past those human faculties with ease.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r7","rowIndex":7,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　世界ってのはあまりにも雑然とした情報に満ちあふれすぎていて、そのなかから必要な情報だけ的確につまみとるなんて、砂浜でなくした恋人のピアスを探すよりも難しいということだろう。","en":"The world is so overrun with a jumble of information that plucking out only what you need, and getting it exactly right, is probably harder than finding an earring your lover lost on the beach.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r8","rowIndex":8,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　さらに言えば、あらかじめ予期出来たとしても、絶対に回避出来ず、いつかは必ず来てしまう運命というものもある。","en":"And then there are fates you may foresee but can never escape—fates that are certain to arrive one day.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r9","rowIndex":9,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　例えば、<tips=17>タイプＢ</tips>の発症もそうだ。あれもわかっていても避けることが出来ない。だから、発症が近づいて来た<tips=17>タイプB</tips>は常にそんな予感を覚えながら毎日を過ごすことになるのさ。","en":"<tips=17>Type B</tips> onset is one example. Even when you know it is coming, there is no avoiding it. And so a <tips=17>Type B</tips> nearing onset must live each day with that premonition.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r10","rowIndex":10,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　あの『発症』ってのは、本人でも自覚できるものらしい。自分が段々おかしくなって、正気をぶら下げているロープが少しずつちぎれて細くなってゆくのが見えるんだそうだ。そして、ぷつりと切れて落下したらもうおしまい。","en":"Apparently, even the person undergoing onset can tell it is happening. They can feel themselves gradually going wrong and watch the rope from which their sanity hangs fray strand by strand, growing thinner all the while. Once it snaps and they plunge, it is all over.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r11","rowIndex":11,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そしてその日おれに訪れたものも、この最後のパターンの悲劇、つまり、予期出来た運命ってやつだった。","en":"And what visited me that day was a tragedy of this final kind—in other words, what you might call a foreseeable fate.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r12","rowIndex":12,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　朝に<tips=21>八龍会</tips>の爺さんたちから連絡があって、昼前におれと<tips=66>コンタ</tips>で彼らの家に訪れた。","en":"The old men of the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips> contacted us that morning, and before noon <tips=66>Konta</tips> and I went to see them at their estate.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r13","rowIndex":13,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　雨がぽつりぽつりと降っているが、傘は要らない程度のものだ。","en":"Rain fell in scattered drops, but not enough to require an umbrella.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r14","rowIndex":14,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　電話をかけてきたのは爺さんたちの秘書で「重大な話があるから絶対に来てください」という、いつになく緊張感のある言い方で、ただならぬ用件だと想像出来た。だから<tips=66>コンタ</tips>は口数が少なく、おれがいつも通り軽口をたたいても表面上つき合うだけですぐに黙りがちになってしまう。","en":"It was the old men’s secretary who had called. ‘There is something important we need to discuss, so you absolutely must come,’ he had said, with a tension I had never heard from him before. We knew it could be no ordinary matter. That left <tips=66>Konta</tips> unusually quiet. Even when I joked around as always, he only went through the motions of playing along before lapsing back into silence.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r15","rowIndex":15,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　屋敷にあがると、秘書が出て来て爺さんたちはいつものリビングルームで待っていると言った。そこに足を運ぶと、三人の老人と、そして見慣れぬ一人の男の姿があった。","en":"When we entered the residence, the secretary came out and told us the Elders were waiting in their usual living room. There we found the three old men—and one unfamiliar man.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r16","rowIndex":16,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あんたは」","en":"“You’re...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r17","rowIndex":17,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ソファーにふんぞり返って足を組んだその人物の顔に、おれは見覚えがあった。","en":"I recognized the face of the man lounging arrogantly upon the sofa with his legs crossed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r18","rowIndex":18,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「よう、あんたが<tips=10>見土道夫</tips>か。噂は知ってるよ」","en":"“Hey. You’re <tips=10>Michio Mido</tips>, right? I’ve heard about you.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エリオット・ネス","displayName":"Eliot Ness","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r19","rowIndex":19,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　よれよれのジャケットを身につけたその金髪碧眼の白人男性は、無精ひげの生えた口元に火のついた煙草をくわえている。","en":"The blond, blue-eyed white man wore a rumpled jacket and held a lit cigarette between his lips, his jaw rough with stubble.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r20","rowIndex":20,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ガキのころは<tips=1>謝亮</tips>をさしおいて、ナンバーワンだったそうだな。サイキックも使えるんだろ？」","en":"“I hear that when you were a kid, you were number one—even ahead of <tips=1>Tse Leung</tips>. You can use psychic powers too, can’t you?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エリオット・ネス","displayName":"Eliot Ness","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r21","rowIndex":21,"pageCtrl":"","jp":" 　彼が喋ると口の辺りからアルコールのにおいが漂った。そう意識して観察すると頬がほんのり赤く、酒をひっかけてからここに来ているらしい。","en":"When he spoke, the smell of alcohol drifted from his mouth. Now that I looked for it, his cheeks were faintly red. Apparently he had stopped for a drink before coming here.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r22","rowIndex":22,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「おれのはただの大道芸さ。……しかし驚いたね。あんた、<tips=23>エリオット</tips>だろ？」","en":"“What I do is just a street-corner trick. ...Still, this is a surprise. You’re <tips=23>Elliott</tips>, aren’t you?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r23","rowIndex":23,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おれはこの人物を知っていた。","en":"I knew this man.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r24","rowIndex":24,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　かつてどこかの軍隊に所属していたという腕っこきの<tips=17>タイプB</tips>で、その優れた射撃の腕前を示すエピソードには事欠かない。<tips=27>廖志明</tips>がその能力に惚れ込んで破格の条件で自分のボディーガードに雇った人物だ。","en":"He was a highly capable <tips=17>Type B</tips> who had once belonged to some military or other, and there was no shortage of stories demonstrating his superb marksmanship. <tips=27>Liao Chi-ming</tips> had been so taken with that ability that he hired Elliott as his bodyguard on extraordinary terms.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r25","rowIndex":25,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　以前に偶然出くわしたことがある。――あれはいつだっけな？　ボディーガードになったばかりの頃だったか、一度、どこかの酒場でチンピラにからまれているのを見た。","en":"I had encountered him once by chance. —When had that been? Not long after he became the bodyguard, perhaps. I saw some hoodlum picking a fight with him in a bar.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r26","rowIndex":26,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　からんでいたのは『鉄拳のフリット』。<tips=34>ダリオ・ボネット</tips>が主催している賭けボクシングの選手だ。","en":"The aggressor was ‘Iron Fist Fritt,’ a boxer in the gambling matches organized by <tips=34>Dario Bonetto</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r27","rowIndex":27,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　街で一番てわけじゃないがなかなか優秀な<tips=17>タイプB</tips>のボクサーだった。普段は大人しく無口なやつだったがとにかく酒癖が悪く、飲むとやたらとまわりの人間に喧嘩をふっかけ、しょっちゅう問題を起こしている。だからそいつが店に入ってくると他の客はみんな離れるか、店を出て行ってしまう。","en":"He was not the best in the city, but he was a fairly accomplished <tips=17>Type B</tips> boxer. Ordinarily he was quiet and mild, but alcohol changed him completely. Whenever he drank, he started fights with everyone around him and caused trouble without end. The moment he entered a bar, every other customer either moved away or left.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r28","rowIndex":28,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そのときもやつがドアから入って来るとそれに気がついた何人かの客はこそこそと会計を済ませて逃げていった。","en":"That time too, several customers who noticed him come through the door quietly paid their checks and fled.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r29","rowIndex":29,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　エリオットはカウンターで一人で座っていて、ウイスキーの入ったグラスと火のついた煙草を交互に口にしている。フリットはその隣に座る。<tips=23>エリオット</tips>がそちらをチラと見ただけでなんの反応もなかったのは、多分フリットのことを知らなかったんだろう。","en":"Elliott sat alone at the counter, alternating between a glass of whiskey and a lit cigarette. Fritt sat beside him. <tips=23>Elliott</tips> merely glanced his way and showed no other reaction, probably because he had no idea who Fritt was.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r30","rowIndex":30,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おれは<tips=66>コンタ</tips>や他の仲間と一緒に飲んでいたが、何か起こるんじゃないかと思ってチラチラと様子を見ていたんだ。","en":"I was drinking with <tips=66>Konta</tips> and some other friends, but I kept glancing over, expecting something to happen.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r31","rowIndex":31,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　で、フリットは二、三杯ビールを飲んだらもう顔が真っ赤になって、<tips=23>エリオット</tips>にからみはじめたというわけさ。","en":"Sure enough, two or three beers were enough to turn Fritt’s face bright red, and then he began harassing <tips=23>Elliott</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r32","rowIndex":32,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=23>エリオット</tips>は相手をしないが、フリットはとにかくしつこい。脅したり、罵倒してあざ笑ってみたり、最初っから喧嘩をするつもりでからんでいるんだよなあれは。もうその時点で興奮して、目が金色に輝いている。マスターも変に口を出せばとばっちりを喰らうから、苦々しい顔で見ることしか出来ない。","en":"<tips=23>Elliott</tips> paid him no mind, but Fritt simply would not let up. He threatened him, hurled abuse, jeered at him—the man had plainly started in on Elliott looking for a fight from the outset. By that point he was already worked up, his eyes shining gold. The bartender knew that one wrong word would drag him into it too, so all he could do was look on with a sour expression.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r33","rowIndex":33,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　店内に響くような怒鳴り声を上げた時点で、おれは立ち上がった。フリットを止めようと思ったんだ。","en":"When Fritt finally shouted loudly enough to ring through the bar, I stood. I meant to stop him.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r34","rowIndex":34,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　あいつはおれのことを恐れていたからね。サイキックが怖くて怖くて仕方ないんだよ。実際殴り合いになればおれが勝てるか怪しいもんだが、<tips=77>特質変異</tips>の真っ黒な手を見せて脅せば言うことを聞く。その時おれは絡まれている方があの有名な<tips=23>エリオット</tips>と知らなかったから、おれがなんとかしなきゃ大けがをすると思ったんだ。","en":"He was afraid of me, you see. My psychic power terrified him. In a straightforward fistfight I doubt I could have beaten him, but if I threatened him with the pitch-black hand produced by my <tips=77>trait mutation</tips>, he obeyed. At the time I did not know that his victim was the famous <tips=23>Elliott</tips>, so I thought someone had to intervene before the man was seriously injured.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r35","rowIndex":35,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おれが立ち上がったと同時に、<tips=23>エリオット</tips>も立ち上がった。そしてフリットと二人で表に出て行く。","en":"At the same instant I stood, <tips=23>Elliott</tips> stood as well. He and Fritt went outside together.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r36","rowIndex":36,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おれはその後ろを追いかけた。途中ウェイトレスとぶつかって、ちょっとやりとりをしたから遅れてしまって、そうして外に出た頃にはもう全てが終わっていた。","en":"I hurried after them. On the way I collided with a waitress, and the brief exchange that followed held me up. By the time I made it outside, everything was already over.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r37","rowIndex":37,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　フリットが道路の上にひっくりかえって白目を剥いている。<tips=23>エリオット</tips>はくわえ煙草をしたまましかめっつらで右手をぷらぷらと振っている。","en":"Fritt lay flat on his back in the road, eyes rolled up white. <tips=23>Elliott</tips> stood over him with a cigarette still in his mouth, frowning as he shook out his right hand.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r38","rowIndex":38,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　近くにいたやつに聞くと、そいつもよくわかっていなかった。フリットがボクシングの構えから殴りかかったその瞬間、ゴキッと音がして逆にひっくり返っていたらしい。","en":"I asked someone nearby what had happened, but he had not really understood what he had seen either. Apparently, the instant Fritt swung from his boxing stance, there had been a sickening crunch—and Fritt himself had gone flying backward.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r39","rowIndex":39,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「慣れないことするもんじゃねえな。しびれちまった」","en":"“Never pays to try something you’re not used to. Damn hand’s gone numb.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エリオット・ネス","displayName":"Eliot Ness","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r40","rowIndex":40,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おれと目が合うと、<tips=23>エリオット</tips>はそう笑ってまた右手をぷらぷらと振る。きっとこの手でフリットを殴ったに違いない。","en":"When our eyes met, <tips=23>Elliott</tips> said this with a grin and shook out his right hand again. He must have used that hand to hit Fritt.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r41","rowIndex":41,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「無事か？」","en":"“You all right?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r42","rowIndex":42,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「おれはね。相手はわからん。兄ちゃん、良かったら医者でも呼んでやってくれよ」","en":"“I’m fine. Other guy, who knows. Hey, kid—if you don’t mind, call a doctor for him.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エリオット・ネス","displayName":"Eliot Ness","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r43","rowIndex":43,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　言われてフリットの様子を見ると完全に失神している。顎が歪んで、口の端から血が流れていた。あとで聞いたら顎が骨折していたらしく、フリットはこれ以降ちょっとでも顎を殴られるとダウンするようになって、リングを去ったんだ。","en":"I looked down as he suggested and found Fritt completely unconscious. His jaw was crooked and blood ran from one corner of his mouth. I later heard that it had been fractured. From then on, even a light blow to the jaw knocked him down, and Fritt left the ring.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r44","rowIndex":44,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　医者を呼んでから店内に戻ると、<tips=23>エリオット</tips>は何事もなかったようにカウンターで酒を飲み、煙草を吸っていた。","en":"After I summoned a doctor and returned inside, <tips=23>Elliott</tips> was back at the counter drinking and smoking as though nothing had happened.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r45","rowIndex":45,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　あとでマスターに聞いて、それがあの<tips=23>エリオット</tips>だとおれは知ったってわけだ。","en":"It was only later, when I asked the bartender, that I learned the man was <tips=23>Elliott</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r46","rowIndex":46,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　素手でもこれほど強いのに、噂の射撃技術はどんなものなのかと驚いたものさ。","en":"If he was this formidable with his bare hands, I could only marvel at what the marksmanship of legend must be like.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r47","rowIndex":47,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<ruby=リャオ><tips=27>廖</tips></ruby>と一緒に街を出ていったかと思ってたよ」","en":"“I thought you’d left the city with <tips=27>Liao</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r48","rowIndex":48,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「お払い箱になったのさ。肝心のときに役に立たなかったからね」","en":"“He gave me the boot. I was no use when it mattered.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エリオット・ネス","displayName":"Eliot Ness","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r49","rowIndex":49,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=23>エリオット</tips>は肩をすくめておどけた。","en":"<tips=23>Elliott</tips> shrugged theatrically.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r50","rowIndex":50,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼はあの時のことを覚えていないようだった。","en":"He did not appear to remember our earlier encounter.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r51","rowIndex":51,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まあ、立ってないで座りなさい」","en":"“Well, don’t stand there. Sit down.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ミスター・チェン","displayName":"Mr. Chen","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r52","rowIndex":52,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=90>ミスター・チェン</tips>は頬にいつもどおりの笑顔を貼りつけてそう言う。","en":"<tips=90>Mr. Chen</tips> said this with his usual smile plastered across his face.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r53","rowIndex":53,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「オッホッホ、アナタたちが来るのを待っていたんだよ。三人そろって話を聞いて欲しくてね」","en":"“Ohoho. We were waiting for you. We wanted all three of you to hear what we have to say.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ミスター・チェン","displayName":"Mr. Chen","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r54","rowIndex":54,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼の口ぶりからすると、<tips=23>エリオット</tips>もおれたちと同じように爺さんたちに呼び出されたのだろう。","en":"Judging from the way he spoke, <tips=23>Elliott</tips> had probably been summoned by the Elders, just as we had.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r55","rowIndex":55,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おれと<tips=66>コンタ</tips>が座ったのを見計らって、ハウスキーパーの佐藤さんがいつも通りお茶を運んできてくれる。おれは軽く頭を下げて、早速そのコップに口をつけた。今日のお茶はいつもより少し高級のものらしく、香りが違う。","en":"Once <tips=66>Konta</tips> and I were seated, their housekeeper, Mr. Sato, brought us tea as usual. I gave him a small bow and immediately raised the cup to my lips. Today’s tea seemed a little finer than what he normally served. Even the fragrance was different.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r56","rowIndex":56,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「きみたちも知っているように、この街に住む<tips=17>タイプB</tips>たちに、今大きな変革が起きはじめています」","en":"“As all of you know, a great transformation has begun among the <tips=17>Type Bs</tips> who live in this city.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r57","rowIndex":57,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そう話し始めたのは<tips=89>ミスター・アーノルド</tips>だった。","en":"<tips=89>Mr. Arnold</tips> was the one who opened the discussion.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r58","rowIndex":58,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「『<tips=46>ネオ・ローズ</tips>』によってあの忌まわしき精神の病に悩まされることはなくなり、ベッドに縛られたり鍵のかかった部屋に閉じ込めるしかなかったものたちも、みなかつての知性を取り戻すことが出来るようになりました。これは実に素晴らしいことです。しかし、同時に新しい問題もいくつか増えてしまいましてね」","en":"“Thanks to ‘<tips=46>Neo Rose</tips>,’ our people need no longer suffer from that accursed illness of the mind. Even those we once had no choice but to strap to beds or shut away in locked rooms can now regain their former intelligence. It is a truly wonderful thing. At the same time, however, it has given rise to several new problems.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r59","rowIndex":59,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「考えてもみろ。何年もずっと正気を失っていたものが、急に我を取り戻して、全員が全員社会復帰出来ると思うか？」","en":"“Think about it. Do you really imagine that every last person who has spent years out of his mind can suddenly come to his senses and reintegrate into society?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r60","rowIndex":60,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=89>ミスター・アーノルド</tips>の言葉を引き継いだのは<tips=91>ミスター・スミス</tips>だった。","en":"<tips=91>Mr. Smith</tips> took over from <tips=89>Mr. Arnold</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r61","rowIndex":61,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「家族の支えがあったり、手に職があるならばスムーズに正常な生活を取り戻せるだろう。しかし、そうでないものも多い。何年もの空白期間が完全に社会との断絶を作ってしまったり、病気のときに迷惑行為ばかりをしてまわりに嫌われてしまったり。受け入れる環境がないものも多い。そのうちの何人かは、くだらない犯罪に手を染めたり、酒や薬におぼれたりしている。……これでは、何のために正気に戻してやったのかわからない」","en":"“With family support or a useful trade, one might smoothly resume an ordinary life. Many possess neither. Years of absence may have severed them entirely from society, while the trouble they caused during their illness may have earned the hatred of everyone around them. Many have nowhere that will accept them. Some have turned to petty crime, alcohol, or drugs. ...It makes one wonder why we bothered to restore their sanity at all.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r62","rowIndex":62,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=91>ミスター・スミス</tips>は額の皺を少しも動かさずに低い声で言う。","en":"<tips=91>Mr. Smith</tips> spoke in a low voice without so much as disturbing one of the furrows in his brow.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r63","rowIndex":63,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「何人かは『<tips=46>ネオ・ローズ</tips>』の製造を手伝わせたり、どこかツテを頼って仕事先を見つけてやった。けれど、どうしてもそういった労働が向かないものもいる」","en":"“We have put some to work helping manufacture ‘<tips=46>Neo Rose</tips>,’ and found jobs for others through our connections. Some people, however, simply aren’t suited to that kind of work.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r64","rowIndex":64,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「一言で言うと、ロクデナシってやつネ。もう、何をやらせてもイヤとか、ダメばっかり！　『<tips=46>ネオ・ローズ</tips>』は病は取り去ってくれるけど、元々ねじ曲がった性格は直してくれない！」","en":"“In a word, they’re good-for-nothings! No matter what we ask them to do, it’s always ‘I don’t want to’ or ‘I can’t’! ‘<tips=46>Neo Rose</tips>’ may cure the illness, but it cannot straighten out a personality that was twisted from the start!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r65","rowIndex":65,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　次に口を開いたのは<tips=90>ミスター・チェン</tips>だ。","en":"<tips=90>Mr. Chen</tips> was the next to speak.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r66","rowIndex":66,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そういうヤツは『<tips=46>ネオ・ローズ</tips>』なんかやらずに見捨てた方が利口なのかもしれないけど、どんなロクデナシだとしても、苦しんでる同胞を解放しないわけにはいかないでしょう？　それが我々の役目だから。でも、ちょっと数が多くてネ。困ってしまった。そこで、私たちは彼らに相応しい仕事を考えたネ」","en":"“Maybe it would be smarter to abandon people like that instead of giving them ‘<tips=46>Neo Rose</tips>.’ But no matter what worthless bastards they may be, we can hardly refuse to liberate our suffering comrades, can we? That is our duty. But there are rather too many of them, you see. It has become a problem. So we have thought of a job suited to them.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r67","rowIndex":67,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼はもったいぶったように笑みを浮かべたまま、おれたちを見回してから、","en":"Still wearing that self-important smile, he paused to look around at each of us before continuing.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r68","rowIndex":68,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「これから我々は、この街で<tips=17>タイプB</tips>の権利をどんどん広げて行こうと思っているわけでしょ？　そうなれば、当然ギャングだのとのいざこざも増えてくる。だけど我々は基本的には普段は普通の生活をしているからネ、そういう物騒なことをやる専門の人間はいない。……それを、このロクデナシたちで作ったらどうかと思ってネ」","en":"“From now on, we intend to keep expanding <tips=17>Type B</tips> rights throughout this city, yes? Naturally, that will mean more trouble with gangs and so forth. But most of us live ordinary lives most of the time. We have no specialists for that dangerous work. ...So why not create a force from these good-for-nothings?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r69","rowIndex":69,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「私たちはこれを『<tips=47>八龍解放軍</tips>』と名付けるつもりです」","en":"“We intend to name it the ‘<tips=47>Hachiryu Liberation Army</tips>.’”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r70","rowIndex":70,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=89>ミスター・アーノルド</tips>はその青い目で、おれの目をじっと見つめると、","en":"<tips=89>Mr. Arnold</tips> fixed his blue eyes directly upon mine.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r71","rowIndex":71,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=10>道夫</tips>。お前にはそのリーダーをつとめて貰いたいのです。<tips=66>コンタ</tips>はサブリーダーとしてそれを補佐してもらいましょう」","en":"“<tips=10>Michio</tips>. We would like you to serve as its leader. <tips=66>Konta</tips> will support you as deputy leader.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r72","rowIndex":72,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして次に<tips=23>エリオット</tips>を見ると、","en":"Then he looked at <tips=23>Elliott</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r73","rowIndex":73,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「きみには顧問として隊員に戦闘技術を教えていただきたいのです。どうですか？」","en":"“We would like you to serve as adviser and teach the soldiers combat skills. What do you say?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r74","rowIndex":74,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ふむ」","en":"“Hmm.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r75","rowIndex":75,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=23>エリオット</tips>は咥えていた紙巻き煙草を灰皿に押し潰して、","en":"<tips=23>Elliott</tips> took the cigarette from his mouth and crushed it into the ashtray.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r76","rowIndex":76,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=47>解放軍</tips>、とはねえ。随分と勇ましい名前だ」","en":"“The <tips=47>Liberation Army</tips>, eh? Quite the valiant name.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r77","rowIndex":77,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「この街で虐げられる全ての同胞を苦しみから解放してあげなくちゃいけないからね。素晴らしいでしょ？」","en":"“We must liberate every one of our oppressed comrades in this city from suffering. A wonderful thing, don’t you think?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r78","rowIndex":78,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=90>ミスター・チェン</tips>は、おほほと笑い、","en":"<tips=90>Mr. Chen</tips> laughed, ohoho.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r79","rowIndex":79,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「私たちは最終的にはこの街を<tips=17>タイプB</tips>のものにしようと思っているんだ。これは世界初の試みかもしれない。だって、そんな街聞いたことないでしょ？　<tips=17>タイプＢ</tips>は大体社会の下の方で生きるものだからね。まあ、上にはなれない。いろいろと弱点があるから。でも、『<tips=46>ネオ・ローズ</tips>』ならそれが実現出来る。これがあれば、我々はノーマルと変わらない秩序を作り、そしてノーマルよりも優れた肉体を持つことになるんだから。これはもう、彼らより上の存在ってことなのヨ。その名誉ある仕事を、アナタに請け負って貰いたい。もちろん報酬ははずむヨ」","en":"“In the end, we mean to make this city the <tips=17>Type Bs</tips>’ own. It may be the first undertaking of its kind in the world. You have never heard of such a city, have you? <tips=17>Type Bs</tips> generally live at the bottom of society. They cannot rise to the top—not with all their weaknesses. But ‘<tips=46>Neo Rose</tips>’ can make it possible. With it, we can build a society as orderly as the Normals’ while possessing bodies superior to theirs. That would make us the superior beings. We want you to take responsibility for that honorable work. Naturally, we will compensate you handsomely.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r80","rowIndex":80,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「残念だが、おれは興味ねえな」","en":"“Sorry, but I’m not interested.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r81","rowIndex":81,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=23>エリオット</tips>は苦い顔で肩をすくめた。","en":"<tips=23>Elliott</tips> pulled a sour face and shrugged.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r82","rowIndex":82,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=17>タイプB</tips>全体の社会的地位がどうとか、そんな話は興味ねえのさ。おれはおれ個人にとって面白いことしかしない。<tips=17>タイプＢ</tips>ってだけの理由で誰かの味方をしようって気にはなれないな」","en":"“I’m not interested in all this talk about the social standing of <tips=17>Type Bs</tips> as a whole. I only do what interests me personally. Being a <tips=17>Type B</tips> isn’t enough by itself to make me take someone’s side.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r83","rowIndex":83,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=27>廖志明</tips>のボディーガードはそんなに楽しい仕事だったか？」","en":"“Was working as <tips=27>Liao Chi-ming’s</tips> bodyguard so entertaining?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r84","rowIndex":84,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=91>ミスター・スミス</tips>は黒い顔に並んだ特有のぎょろりとした目つきで<tips=23>エリオット</tips>を見る。","en":"The characteristically bulging eyes in <tips=91>Mr. Smith’s</tips> dark face fixed themselves on <tips=23>Elliott</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r85","rowIndex":85,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あのおっさんは面白いよ。みんな気づいてないだけでさ。報酬も良かったけれど、それだけじゃ引き受けやしなかったさ」","en":"“That old man is interesting. Most people just don’t notice it. The pay was good, but money alone wouldn’t have persuaded me.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r86","rowIndex":86,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=23>エリオット</tips>、それがきみの本心とは思えませんね」","en":"“<tips=23>Elliott</tips>, I do not believe that is what you truly think.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r87","rowIndex":87,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=89>ミスター・アーノルド</tips>はいつもの不機嫌そうな顔で言う。","en":"<tips=89>Mr. Arnold</tips> spoke with his customary displeased expression.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r88","rowIndex":88,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「我々がきみをスカウトしたのは、もちろん実力を評価してのことなのですが、もう一つ別の理由もあります」","en":"“Naturally, we sought to recruit you because we valued your abilities. But there is another reason as well.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r89","rowIndex":89,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「何の理由さ」","en":"“What reason?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r90","rowIndex":90,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「経歴を調べさせてもらいました」","en":"“We took the liberty of looking into your background.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r91","rowIndex":91,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=89>ミスター・アーノルド</tips>がそう言うと、<tips=23>エリオット</tips>は目を細め、警戒した様子を見せる。","en":"At those words from <tips=89>Mr. Arnold</tips>, <tips=23>Elliott</tips> narrowed his eyes and became wary.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r92","rowIndex":92,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「巷では軍隊出身という出所不明の噂が流れていますが、それは間違いじゃなかったようですね。ハイスクール卒業後にすぐアメリカ海兵隊に所属しています。そこではなかなか優秀な成績を収めていたようですが、今から八年前に不名誉除隊になっています。理由は、ジャスティン・スワン殺人事件に関与したという疑いがあったからです」","en":"“Rumors of uncertain origin have long circulated that you came from the military, and it seems they were correct. You joined the United States Marine Corps immediately after high school. Your service record appears to have been quite distinguished, but eight years ago you were dishonorably discharged on suspicion of involvement in the Justin Swan murder case.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r93","rowIndex":93,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=89>ミスター・アーノルド</tips>は言葉を切ってじっと見つめるが、<tips=23>エリオット</tips>は何も答えない。","en":"<tips=89>Mr. Arnold</tips> broke off and stared at him, but <tips=23>Elliott</tips> said nothing.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r94","rowIndex":94,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=10>道夫</tips>。ジャスティン・スワン殺人事件のことは知ってるね？」","en":"“<tips=10>Michio</tips>. You know about the Justin Swan murder case, yes?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r95","rowIndex":95,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=90>ミスター・チェン</tips>が尋ねたので、おれは頷く。","en":"<tips=90>Mr. Chen</tips> asked, and I nodded.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r96","rowIndex":96,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……<tips=10>道夫</tips>君、それはなに？」","en":"“...<tips=10>Michio</tips>, what’s that?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r97","rowIndex":97,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=66>コンタ</tips>は当惑しながら小声でそう囁いた。","en":"<tips=66>Konta</tips> whispered the question in confusion.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r98","rowIndex":98,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「九年ほど前に起きた有名な殺人事件のことネ。ジャスティン・スワンという上院議員が誘拐されたあとに他殺体となって見つかったの」","en":"“A famous murder from about nine years ago. A senator named Justin Swan was kidnapped, then found murdered.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r99","rowIndex":99,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=90>ミスター・チェン</tips>が説明をすると、<tips=66>コンタ</tips>はばつの悪い顔をする。","en":"When <tips=90>Mr. Chen</tips> explained, <tips=66>Konta</tips> looked embarrassed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r100","rowIndex":100,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「スワンは<tips=17>タイプＢ</tips>差別主義者で、軍隊から<tips=17>タイプＢ</tips>を排除する法案を議会に認めさせようとしていた。当時は世界的に<tips=17>タイプＢ</tips>に対する不安が強かったから、彼の発言は人々を勢いづけた。けれど、もう基地にいる方からすればたまったもんじゃない。怒り狂った<tips=17>タイプB</tips>の海兵隊たちが彼を拉致して、倉庫で射殺したのよ」","en":"“Swan was a bigot who was trying to push a bill through Congress expelling <tips=17>Type Bs</tips> from the military. The whole world was deeply uneasy about <tips=17>Type Bs</tips> at the time, and his rhetoric emboldened the public. But to <tips=17>Type Bs</tips> already serving on military bases, it was intolerable. A group of enraged <tips=17>Type B</tips> Marines abducted him and shot him dead in a warehouse.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r101","rowIndex":101,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「はあ、その事件に、この<tips=23>エリオット</tips>さんが……」","en":"“Oh. And Mr. <tips=23>Elliott</tips> was involved in that case...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r102","rowIndex":102,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=66>コンタ</tips>はおそるおそる隣の<tips=23>エリオット</tips>を眺める。","en":"<tips=66>Konta</tips> stole a nervous glance at <tips=23>Elliott</tips> beside him.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r103","rowIndex":103,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そう。実行犯ではないが、協力者の一人として名前があげられていたんです」","en":"“Yes. He was not one of the perpetrators, but his name appeared among their accomplices.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r104","rowIndex":104,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=89>ミスター・アーノルド</tips>は<tips=23>エリオット</tips>の顔から視線を離さないまま続ける。","en":"<tips=89>Mr. Arnold</tips> continued without taking his eyes from <tips=23>Elliott’s</tips> face.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r105","rowIndex":105,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「本来なら裁判にかけられるところですが……そうはなりませんでした。捜査の手が及ぶ前に国外に脱出してしまったんですよ。その手引きをしたのは『ブラッド』」","en":"“Ordinarily, you would have stood trial. ...But you did not. You escaped the country before the investigation reached you. ‘Blood’ arranged it.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r106","rowIndex":106,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あ、それなら知ってる」","en":"“Oh, I’ve heard of them.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r107","rowIndex":107,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=66>コンタ</tips>が嬉しそうに頷くけれど、まあ、<tips=17>タイプB</tips>でその組織の名前を知らないものは少ないだろう。というか、ジャスティン・スワン殺人事件を知らない時点で、<tips=66>コンタ</tips>はちょっと問題があると思う。","en":"<tips=66>Konta</tips> nodded happily, though there probably are not many <tips=17>Type Bs</tips> who have never heard the organization’s name. More to the point, I think <tips=66>Konta</tips> has a bit of a problem if he has never even heard of the Justin Swan murder case.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r108","rowIndex":108,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　こいつは頭は悪くないのだけれど、ニュースというものにまったく関心がないのだ。","en":"He was not stupid, but he had absolutely no interest in the news.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r109","rowIndex":109,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「有名なテロ組織でしょ？　世界中でいろんな事件を起こしてる。ほら、空港を爆破したり、ビルを爆破したり……」","en":"“They’re that famous terrorist organization, aren’t they? They’ve caused all kinds of incidents around the world. You know—blowing up airports, blowing up buildings...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r110","rowIndex":110,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「彼らは<tips=17>タイプB</tips>の解放を目指す勇敢な戦士たちだ」","en":"“They are courageous warriors who fight to liberate <tips=17>Type Bs</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r111","rowIndex":111,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=91>ミスター・スミス</tips>は苦い顔で言う。","en":"<tips=91>Mr. Smith</tips> spoke with a bitter expression.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r112","rowIndex":112,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=23>エリオット</tips>、きみはそのあと五年間『ブラッド』の軍事教官として、若者たちを訓練しました。時に実戦で自ら銃を手に取ることもありましたね。そこでは大変な活躍をしたと聞いています。たくさんの差別主義者たちを処刑したのですね？」","en":"“<tips=23>Elliott</tips>, you then spent five years as a military instructor for ‘Blood,’ training its young people. At times you took up a gun yourself in actual combat. I hear you performed splendidly. You executed a great many segregationists, did you not?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r113","rowIndex":113,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=89>ミスター・アーノルド</tips>の問いに、<tips=23>エリオット</tips>は苦笑しながら溜息をついて肩をすくめるだけだ。","en":"<tips=23>Elliott</tips> merely smiled wryly, sighed, and shrugged in response to <tips=89>Mr. Arnold’s</tips> question.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r114","rowIndex":114,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「きみは同胞の自由のために命をかけて戦った誇り高き戦士です。それが、我々がきみを高く評価し、こうして重要なポストをつとめて貰おうと思った最大の理由なのですよ」","en":"“You are a proud warrior who risked his life fighting for the freedom of his comrades. That, more than anything, is why we hold you in such high regard and want you to assume this important post.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r115","rowIndex":115,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「知らないね。そんな話は。だれかと間違えているんじゃないか？」","en":"“Never heard of any of that. Maybe you’ve got me confused with somebody else.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r116","rowIndex":116,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「その『ブラッド』の軍事教官はケビンと名乗っていたそうです。そして、君の名前は『<tips=23>エリオット</tips>』」","en":"“The military instructor for ‘Blood’ reportedly called himself Kevin. And your name is ‘<tips=23>Elliott</tips>.’”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r117","rowIndex":117,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それに何の意味が？」","en":"“So?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r118","rowIndex":118,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「映画『アンタッチャブル』のなかで主人公のエリオット・ネスを演じた俳優の名前を知っていますか？」","en":"“Do you know the name of the actor who played the protagonist, Eliot Ness, in the film The Untouchables?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r119","rowIndex":119,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=89>ミスター・アーノルド</tips>のその質問に、","en":"In answer to <tips=89>Mr. Arnold’s</tips> question,","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r120","rowIndex":120,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ケビン・コスナーだね！」","en":"“Kevin Costner!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r121","rowIndex":121,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　コンタが得意げに答える。","en":"Konta answered with evident pride.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r122","rowIndex":122,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「我々は『ブラッド』とも親しい関係にある。隠そうとしたって無駄だ。……それとも、本名や家族の経歴まで話してみせようか？」","en":"“We have a close relationship with ‘Blood.’ There is no use attempting to hide it. ...Or would you like us to discuss your real name and your family’s history?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r123","rowIndex":123,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=91>ミスター・スミス</tips>が言うと、<tips=23>エリオット</tips>は大きく溜息をつく。","en":"At <tips=91>Mr. Smith’s</tips> words, <tips=23>Elliott</tips> heaved a great sigh.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r124","rowIndex":124,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「わかったよ、わかった。もうたくさんだ」","en":"“All right, all right. I’ve heard enough.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r125","rowIndex":125,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「きみは<tips=17>タイプＢ</tips>差別主義者たちを憎んでいる。<tips=27>廖志明</tips>のところで働いたのだって、彼が<tips=17>タイプＢ</tips>や異国人を積極的に採用する人間だと知っていたからだろう？　<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>で<tips=17>タイプＢ</tips>に理解があるのは、<tips=27>廖</tips>と<tips=4>馬明</tips>くらいだったからな。今は二人とも組織からいなくなってしまったが……第三代<tips=81>龍頭</tips>は、よほど<tips=17>タイプB</tips>のことが嫌いらしい」","en":"“You hate people who discriminate against <tips=17>Type Bs</tips>. You went to work for <tips=27>Liao Chi-ming</tips> because you knew he actively hired <tips=17>Type Bs</tips> and foreigners, didn’t you? At <tips=7>YS</tips>, <tips=27>Liao</tips> and <tips=4>Ma Ming</tips> were about the only people who had any understanding of <tips=17>Type Bs</tips>. They have both left the organization now, though… The third-generation <tips=81>Longtou</tips> apparently hates <tips=17>Type Bs</tips> with a passion.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r126","rowIndex":126,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=91>ミスター・スミス</tips>はそう言って苦笑する。","en":"<tips=91>Mr. Smith</tips> said this with a bitter smile.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r127","rowIndex":127,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>はそんなやつじゃない。おれは異論があったが、ここで口論をしてもややこしくなるだけなので黙っていた。","en":"<tips=1>Tse Leung</tips> wasn’t like that. I disagreed, but arguing about it here would only make things more complicated, so I kept quiet.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r128","rowIndex":128,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なかなか想像がたくましいね。だが現実は想像通りとは限らない。……まあ、とにかくだ」","en":"“That’s quite an imagination you’ve got. But reality doesn’t always match what you imagine. ...Anyway.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r129","rowIndex":129,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=23>エリオット</tips>はテーブルの上に置かれた箱から新しい煙草を取り出しかけたが、途中で思いとどまって、ジャケットの内ポケットにしまう。","en":"<tips=23>Elliott</tips> started to take a fresh cigarette from the pack on the table, thought better of it halfway through, and slipped the cigarette into an inner pocket of his jacket.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r130","rowIndex":130,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「過去どういう活動をしていたにしろ、今はもうそんな考えはまったく持っていない。悪いがこの仕事は引き受けられないな」","en":"“Whatever causes I may have served in the past, I don’t hold any of those beliefs now. Sorry, but I can’t take the job.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r131","rowIndex":131,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どうしても、ですか？」","en":"“Your decision is final?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r132","rowIndex":132,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どうしてもだ」","en":"“It is.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r133","rowIndex":133,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=89>ミスター・アーノルド</tips>の問いに即座に答えてから、<tips=23>エリオット</tips>は立ち上がる。","en":"After answering <tips=89>Mr. Arnold’s</tips> question without hesitation, <tips=23>Elliott</tips> stood up.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r134","rowIndex":134,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ご大層な大義名分を語る人間は好きじゃないんだ。それならまだストレートに欲望を語ってくれたほうがよほどスカッとするよ。……おれはここで帰らせて貰うぜ」","en":"“I don’t like people who spout grand causes. Give me someone who speaks plainly about what he wants any day. ...I’ll be leaving.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エリオット・ネス","displayName":"Eliot Ness","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r135","rowIndex":135,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして一旦は部屋を出ようとしたが、途中で何かを思い出したような仕草をしてくるりと振り返る。","en":"He started to leave the room, but partway there he turned around as though something had occurred to him.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r136","rowIndex":136,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうだ、一つだけ質問させてくれるか？」","en":"“Actually, mind if I ask one question?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エリオット・ネス","displayName":"Eliot Ness","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r137","rowIndex":137,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なんだい？」","en":"“What is it?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ミスター・チェン","displayName":"Mr. Chen","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r138","rowIndex":138,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　答えたのは<tips=90>ミスター・チェン</tips>だ。","en":"<tips=90>Mr. Chen</tips> answered.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r139","rowIndex":139,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=27>廖</tips>の旦那の家に訪れたり、<tips=41>グランドタワー</tips>を襲撃して<tips=39>ジェフリー・ウォン</tips>を殺したあのサイキックのガキは、あんたらが雇ったのか？」","en":"“That psychic kid who showed up at Mr. <tips=27>Liao’s</tips> house, then attacked <tips=41>Grand Tower</tips> and killed <tips=39>Jeffrey Wong</tips>—did you hire her?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エリオット・ネス","displayName":"Eliot Ness","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r140","rowIndex":140,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ガキ？」","en":"“Kid?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ミスター・チェン","displayName":"Mr. Chen","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r141","rowIndex":141,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ほら、金髪で、瞬間移動するガキだよ」","en":"“You know. Blond kid. Teleports.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エリオット・ネス","displayName":"Eliot Ness","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r142","rowIndex":142,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=23>エリオット</tips>は返答を急かすが、<tips=22>老人たち</tips>は黙ったままだ。","en":"<tips=23>Elliott</tips> pressed them for an answer, but <tips=22>the old men</tips> remained silent.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r143","rowIndex":143,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「何のことを言っている？」","en":"“What are you talking about?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ミスター・チェン","displayName":"Mr. Chen","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r144","rowIndex":144,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=90>ミスター・チェン</tips>は大げさに首を捻りながらそう答える。","en":"<tips=90>Mr. Chen</tips> made an exaggerated show of cocking his head.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r145","rowIndex":145,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「知らないのか？　あのガキは誰かの命令で<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>を狙ってたみたいだったからな。てっきりあんたらが裏で糸を引いているのかと思ったが……」","en":"“You don’t know? The kid looked like she was targeting <tips=7>YS</tips> on somebody’s orders. I figured you were pulling the strings from behind the scenes...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エリオット・ネス","displayName":"Eliot Ness","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r146","rowIndex":146,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=23>エリオット</tips>は疑いの目で<tips=22>老人たち</tips>を観察したが、結局しらばっくれているのか、本当に知らないのかどちらにも確信が持てないようだった。","en":"<tips=23>Elliott</tips> studied <tips=22>the old men</tips> with suspicion, but in the end he seemed unable to decide whether they were pretending ignorance or genuinely knew nothing.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r147","rowIndex":147,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そうだろう。ずっと一緒にいるおれからしても、この爺さんたちの考えていることを、その表情から読むことなんか出来ないんだ。","en":"No wonder. Even after all the time I had spent with them, I still could not read what these old men were thinking from their faces.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r148","rowIndex":148,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まあ、もし知ってるなら、今すぐ関係を絶つことだな。あいつはやばいぜ。ぶっ飛んでるのは能力だけじゃなくて、頭も完全にイカレちまってる。ああいうのは、コマとしても使い物にならないんだよ。関わらないのが一番だ。……<tips=27>廖</tips>の旦那が止めたが、あの時殺しておけばよかったと後悔しているよ」","en":"“Well, if you do know her, cut ties with her now. She’s bad news. Her powers aren’t the only thing that’s off the rails—she’s completely out of her mind too. Someone like that isn’t even useful as a pawn. Best not to get involved. ...Mr. <tips=27>Liao</tips> stopped me, but I regret not killing her then.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エリオット・ネス","displayName":"Eliot Ness","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r149","rowIndex":149,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「忠告をありがとう。そういうものは知らないが、今後見かけることがあったら注意しておくヨ」","en":"“Thank you for the warning. We know nothing of anyone like that, but if we should ever encounter her, we will be on our guard.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ミスター・チェン","displayName":"Mr. Chen","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r150","rowIndex":150,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それがいい」","en":"“Good.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エリオット・ネス","displayName":"Eliot Ness","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r151","rowIndex":151,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=23>エリオット</tips>は言うと、くるりと踵を返し、そして今度は振り返ることなくそのまま出て行った。","en":"<tips=23>Elliott</tips> turned on his heel and left. This time he never looked back.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r152","rowIndex":152,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして沈黙がそこに残される。","en":"He left silence behind him.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r153","rowIndex":153,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おれはエリオットが最後に言ったことについて考えていた。<tips=23>エリオット</tips>が言ったのは、<tips=44>筱喬</tips>をさらい、<tips=51>さくら</tips>と戦った少女のことに違いない。瞬間移動し、<tips=41>グランドタワー</tips>で沢山の人間を殺したというのは聞いている。――しかし、その容姿については聞いていなかった。","en":"I thought about what <tips=23>Elliott</tips> had said at the end. He could only have meant the girl who abducted <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> and fought <tips=51>Sakura</tips>. I had heard that she teleported and killed many people at <tips=41>Grand Tower</tips>. —But I had heard nothing about her appearance.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r154","rowIndex":154,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　金髪の少女、と聞いておれはあの時点ですぐに気がついていただろうか？　いや、それはちょっと自信がないな。だって、それは簡単に結びつくようなものではないからだ。ここで、<tips=23>エリオット</tips>が<tips=22>老人たち</tips>に質問しなければ、今後も思い出すことはなかったかもしれない。","en":"Would the words blond girl alone have made me realize it immediately? I doubted it. The two things simply did not connect so easily. Had <tips=23>Elliott</tips> not asked <tips=22>the old men</tips> his question here, I might never have remembered at all.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r155","rowIndex":155,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　いつだったか、おれは確かにこの家の前で金髪の少女に会い会話をしている。この辺りでは見かけない顔で、引っ越して来たばかりなのかとその時は思ったが、考えてみればあれから一度もその顔を見ていない。","en":"At some point, I had indeed met and spoken with a blond girl outside this house. I thought then that she had recently moved here, since hers was not a face one saw around the neighborhood. Yet when I considered it now, I had not seen her once since.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r156","rowIndex":156,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　金髪の少女なんか珍しくはないし、何の関係もないのかもしれないが、疑おうと思えば疑える。","en":"There was nothing unusual about a blond girl, and the one I had met might have had nothing to do with any of this. Still, if I wanted grounds for suspicion, they were there.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r157","rowIndex":157,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=22>老人たち</tips>がずっと<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>を敵視していたことを、おれはよく知っているんだ。サイキックを使って何か攻撃をしかけるなんて、いかにもやりそうなことだ。","en":"I knew perfectly well that <tips=22>the old men</tips> had always regarded <tips=7>YS</tips> as their enemy. Launching some kind of attack with a psychic sounded exactly like something they would do.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r158","rowIndex":158,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それじゃあ、<tips=10>道夫</tips>」","en":"“Now then, <tips=10>Michio</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ミスター・チェン","displayName":"Mr. Chen","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r159","rowIndex":159,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おれが考えていると、<tips=90>ミスター・チェン</tips>が話しかけて来る。","en":"As I sat thinking, <tips=90>Mr. Chen</tips> addressed me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r160","rowIndex":160,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「次はお前が返事をする番だヨ」","en":"“It is your turn to answer.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ミスター・チェン","displayName":"Mr. Chen","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r161","rowIndex":161,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼の口元は笑っているが、目は真顔でおれの反応を観察している。","en":"His mouth was smiling, but his eyes watched my reaction in perfect seriousness.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r162","rowIndex":162,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「迷う理由はないはずです。『<tips=47>八龍解放軍</tips>』の隊長を引き受けて貰いますよ」","en":"“There should be no reason to hesitate. You will accept command of the ‘<tips=47>Hachiryu Liberation Army</tips>.’”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ミスター・アーノルド","displayName":"Mr. Arnold","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r163","rowIndex":163,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=89>ミスター・アーノルド</tips>はくすりともせずにおれを見つめている。","en":"<tips=89>Mr. Arnold</tips> stared at me without the slightest smile.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r164","rowIndex":164,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　残った<tips=91>ミスター・スミス</tips>は、自分のカップに手をつけて、茶をすする。","en":"<tips=91>Mr. Smith</tips>, the remaining Elder, lifted his cup and sipped his tea.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r165","rowIndex":165,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「わかりましたよ」","en":"“All right.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r166","rowIndex":166,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おれの答えは決まっている。","en":"My answer was already decided.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r167","rowIndex":167,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「引き受けます」","en":"“I’ll do it.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r168","rowIndex":168,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　他に選べる道は、もうなかった。","en":"There was no other choice left to me now.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r169","rowIndex":169,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=66>コンタ</tips>は驚きを浮かべておれを見る。","en":"<tips=66>Konta</tips> stared in surprise.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r170","rowIndex":170,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「さすが<tips=10>見土道夫</tips>だ。そう言ってくれると信じていたヨ」","en":"“That’s <tips=10>Michio Mido</tips> for you. I knew you would say yes.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ミスター・チェン","displayName":"Mr. Chen","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r171","rowIndex":171,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=90>ミスター・チェン</tips>は今度は顔全体で笑う。","en":"This time <tips=90>Mr. Chen</tips> smiled with his entire face.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r172","rowIndex":172,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=66>コンタ</tips>はどうするネ？」","en":"“What will you do, <tips=66>Konta</tips>?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ミスター・チェン","displayName":"Mr. Chen","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r173","rowIndex":173,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「お、おれもやります。よろしくお願いしまっす！」","en":"“I-I’m in too. You can count on me!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"田中紺太","displayName":"Konta Tanaka","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r174","rowIndex":174,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ぼうっとおれを見ていた<tips=66>コンタ</tips>は、急に<tips=90>ミスター・チェン</tips>に確認されてしまい慌てながら頭を下げた。","en":"<tips=66>Konta</tips> had been staring blankly at me. Caught off guard when <tips=90>Mr. Chen</tips> suddenly asked him directly, he hurriedly bowed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r175","rowIndex":175,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それで、何をすればいいんですか？　その、『<tips=47>八龍解放軍</tips>』ってのは」","en":"“What are we supposed to do, though? This ‘<tips=47>Hachiryu Liberation Army</tips>,’ I mean.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r176","rowIndex":176,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「文字通り、<tips=17>タイプB</tips>の解放だヨ。そして、最終的には<tips=47>解放軍</tips>が主軸になって<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>とこの街の覇権を争うんだ」","en":"“Liberate <tips=17>Type Bs</tips>, precisely as the name says. Ultimately, the <tips=47>Liberation Army</tips> will take the central role in challenging <tips=7>YS</tips> for supremacy over this city.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ミスター・チェン","displayName":"Mr. Chen","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r177","rowIndex":177,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「覇権を争うとは、物騒な話ですな。だが、今おれはそういうこと聞いているんじゃなくって、もっと具体的な話なんですよ。どこかで訓練をするとか、メンバーを集めるとか」","en":"“Fighting for supremacy—that’s an ominous thing to hear. But it isn’t what I was asking about. I mean the practical details. Are we going to train somewhere? Recruit members?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r178","rowIndex":178,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「最初にやるべきことは決まっているらしいですよ」","en":"“It appears your first task has already been decided.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ミスター・アーノルド","displayName":"Mr. Arnold","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r179","rowIndex":179,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=90>ミスター・チェン</tips>のかわりに<tips=89>ミスター・アーノルド</tips>が答えた。","en":"<tips=89>Mr. Arnold</tips> answered in <tips=90>Mr. Chen’s</tips> place.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r180","rowIndex":180,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「らしいってのはどういうことですか？　アンタたちが決定することでしょうに」","en":"“What do you mean, ‘it appears’? You’re the ones who decide that, aren’t you?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r181","rowIndex":181,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「難しい事情があるんですよ。……それについて話す前に、お前には今の状況を知ってもらわなければいけないでしょうね。饅頭売りなどに専念しているから、まだ知らない情報も多いでしょうし」","en":"“The circumstances are complicated. ...Before we explain, you must learn about the present situation. You have been so devoted to selling buns that there must still be a great deal you do not know.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ミスター・アーノルド","displayName":"Mr. Arnold","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r182","rowIndex":182,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　確かにその通りだ。彼らは<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>などを相手にするつもりらしいし、そのために裏で様々な工作をしているだろう。どのような動きがあるのか全く知らない。","en":"He was right. They apparently meant to take on <tips=7>YS</tips> and the other powers in the city, and they must have been making all kinds of moves behind the scenes toward that end. I knew nothing at all about what they had been doing.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r183","rowIndex":183,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「我々にはいま、重大な問題がある」","en":"“We presently face a grave problem.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ミスター・スミス","displayName":"Mr. Smith","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r184","rowIndex":184,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=91>ミスター・スミス</tips>が渋い顔で言う。","en":"<tips=91>Mr. Smith</tips> spoke with a grim expression.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r185","rowIndex":185,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「問題ってなんですか？」","en":"“What problem?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r186","rowIndex":186,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=65>エフゲニ・ヘス</tips>のことだ」","en":"“<tips=65>Yevgeny Hess</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ミスター・スミス","displayName":"Mr. Smith","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r187","rowIndex":187,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼が厳かに名を呼んだその人物は、<tips=21>八龍会</tips>に『<tips=46>ネオ・ローズ</tips>』をもたらしたあの老人のことだ。","en":"The man whose name he intoned so solemnly was the old man who had brought ‘<tips=46>Neo Rose</tips>’ to the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r188","rowIndex":188,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おれはあの最初の時に会って以来、その姿を見ていない。彼が指揮をして薬を製造させているようだが、話として聞くだけだ。","en":"I had not seen Hess since our first meeting. Apparently he was overseeing the drug’s manufacture, though I had only heard about it secondhand.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r189","rowIndex":189,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「我々にとって今最も大事なのものは『<tips=46>ネオ・ローズ</tips>』であることはもちろん理解していますよね？　あれがあるから我々は欠点を克服出来たし、他の<tips=17>タイプB</tips>組織への交渉材料にもなっています。資金源にもなるでしょう。このおかげで、我々はこの街を牛耳るギャングどもと戦える力を身につけたんですよ。それでね、我々はあれをもっと安価に製造したい。ですが、あのユダヤ人が高いマージンを取っているからそれが出来ないでいるのです。交渉にも乗ろうとしません。それならば自分たちだけで製造すればいいのですが、レシピは相変わらず不明です」","en":"“You naturally understand that ‘<tips=46>Neo Rose</tips>’ is presently our single most important asset. It has allowed us to overcome our weakness, given us leverage in negotiations with other <tips=17>Type B</tips> organizations, and may also become a source of funds. Thanks to that drug, we have acquired the power to fight the gangs that rule this city. We therefore want to manufacture it more cheaply. But that Jew takes such a large margin that we cannot. He refuses to negotiate. We might simply manufacture it ourselves, but the formula remains unknown.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ミスター・アーノルド","displayName":"Mr. Arnold","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r190","rowIndex":190,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=89>ミスター・アーノルド</tips>は溜息をついて首を左右に振る。","en":"<tips=89>Mr. Arnold</tips> sighed and shook his head.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r191","rowIndex":191,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「製剤機に入力するデータは暗号化されていて読み取れないし、材料を運んでくる業者も<tips=65>ヘス</tips>が雇った連中で、彼らは自分が何を運んでいるのかもしらない。材料の袋にはAとかBとか書かれているだけなんだヨ。これらは解析して成分が判明したんだけれども、でもレシピがわからないと作りようがない。……これはとてもこわい状況ネ。もし<tips=65>ヘス</tips>の気分が変わって、仕事を引き上げるとなれば、我々は元の弱点のある存在に戻ってしまう。尾行させれば途中で姿を消すし、どこをねぐらにしているのかも掴めないし、どうやってもレシピは盗み出せない……」","en":"“The data fed into the compounding machine is encrypted and cannot be read. Even the contractors who deliver the ingredients are men hired by <tips=65>Hess</tips>, and they do not know what they themselves are carrying. The bags are marked with nothing but A or B, you see. We have analyzed their contents and identified the ingredients, but without the recipe, we still cannot make the drug. ...It is a frightening position to be in. If <tips=65>Hess</tips> changes his mind and withdraws his services, we will revert to our former, flawed condition. If we have him followed, he vanishes along the way; we cannot even locate his hideout. No matter what we try, we cannot steal the recipe...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ミスター・チェン","displayName":"Mr. Chen","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r192","rowIndex":192,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=90>ミスター・チェン</tips>は困った顔で肩をすくめた。","en":"<tips=90>Mr. Chen</tips> shrugged with a troubled expression.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r193","rowIndex":193,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼はまるで<tips=65>ヘス</tips>が悪いかのように言うけれども、<tips=65>ヘス</tips>本人からしてみれば当然だろうな。『<tips=46>ネオ・ローズ</tips>』が本当に<tips=17>タイプB</tips>を解放する夢の薬なら、世界を変えるほどの大発明だ。レシピを独占したいに決まっている。","en":"He made it sound as though <tips=65>Hess</tips> were the one at fault, but from <tips=65>Hess’s</tips> own perspective, those precautions were only natural. If ‘<tips=46>Neo Rose</tips>’ truly is a wonder drug capable of liberating <tips=17>Type Bs</tips>, it is a world-changing invention. Of course he would want to keep the recipe to himself.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r194","rowIndex":194,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「その<tips=65>ヘス</tips>にね、この<tips=47>解放軍</tips>を設立すると言ったら、えらく乗り気になったんだヨ。そして、そういう組織を作るならぜひやって欲しいことがあると言ってきた」","en":"“When we told <tips=65>Hess</tips> that we were establishing this <tips=47>Liberation Army</tips>, he became extremely enthusiastic. He said that if we were creating such an organization, there was a task he very much wanted it to perform.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ミスター・チェン","displayName":"Mr. Chen","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r195","rowIndex":195,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なるほど話が見えてきました。つまり、<tips=47>解放軍</tips>はまず<tips=65>ヘス</tips>の立案した作戦を実行するという訳ですか」","en":"“I see where this is going. So the <tips=47>Liberation Army</tips> will begin by carrying out an operation <tips=65>Hess</tips> devised.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r196","rowIndex":196,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おれの言葉に<tips=90>ミスター・チェン</tips>は頷き、","en":"<tips=90>Mr. Chen</tips> nodded at my words.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r197","rowIndex":197,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「詳しい話は<tips=65>ヘス</tips>本人に聞いて欲しいネ。彼は向こうの部屋にいて、今は<tips=67>カミラ</tips>が相手をしている」","en":"“You should hear the details from <tips=65>Hess</tips> himself. He is in the next room; <tips=67>Camilla</tips> is keeping him company for the moment.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ミスター・チェン","displayName":"Mr. Chen","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r198","rowIndex":198,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……みなさんはその作戦の内容をもう聞いていますか？」","en":"“...Have all of you already heard what the operation entails?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r199","rowIndex":199,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まあ、大体ね」","en":"“More or less.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ミスター・チェン","displayName":"Mr. Chen","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r200","rowIndex":200,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=90>ミスター・チェン</tips>は複雑な表情で頷く。","en":"<tips=90>Mr. Chen</tips> nodded, looking distinctly conflicted.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r201","rowIndex":201,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「率直に言って、賛成ですか？　それとも、彼の機嫌を損なうわけにはいかないから、渋々従っているんですか？」","en":"“Honestly—do you support it? Or are you reluctantly going along because you can’t afford to displease him?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r202","rowIndex":202,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おれの質問に答えたのは<tips=91>ミスター・スミス</tips>だった。","en":"<tips=91>Mr. Smith</tips> answered my question.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r203","rowIndex":203,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「プラン自体に異存はない。……そもそも我々は、相手が誰であっても、むざむざと言いなりになったりはしない」","en":"“We have no objection to the plan itself. ...In the first place, we do not meekly submit to anyone’s every demand, whoever they may be.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ミスター・スミス","displayName":"Mr. Smith","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r204","rowIndex":204,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　どうだか。","en":"I had my doubts.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r205","rowIndex":205,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しかし、このプライドが高い爺さんとしてはそういうことにしたいんだろう。","en":"Still, a proud old man like him would naturally prefer to believe it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r206","rowIndex":206,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=10>見土</tips>サン、あなたがリーダーを引き受けてくれたんデスね。これは良かった。私もあなたがリーダーになるべきだと思っていたんデスよ。いや、<tips=67>カミラ</tips>さんも優秀なんデスがね、こちらはサポート役の方が実力を発揮するタイプデス」","en":"“<tips=10>Mr. Mido</tips>, I am pleased that you accepted the leadership. I too believed you should be leader. <tips=67>Camilla</tips> is very capable, of course, but she is the sort whose abilities are best used in a supporting role.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エフゲニ・ヘス","displayName":"Yevgeny Hess","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r207","rowIndex":207,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　別室に移動して向かい合った<tips=65>ヘス</tips>は、以前と同じ黒ずくめで、以前と同じように唇がめくれると黄色い乱杭歯が目立った。真っ白の髪の毛も縮れている。黒いスーツは小綺麗でしゅっとしているのに、どうして自分の身体はこう手入れが甘いのだろうか。","en":"We moved to another room and sat facing <tips=65>Hess</tips>, who was dressed in the same unrelieved black as before. When his lips drew back, the same uneven yellow teeth stood out; his snow-white hair was a mass of frizz. His black suit was neat and sharply cut, so why was the man inside it so poorly kept?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r208","rowIndex":208,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　やっぱり、見れば見るほど、そして考えれば考えるほどうさんくさい人物である。なぜ『<tips=46>ネオ・ローズ</tips>』のレシピを知っているのか？　そしてなぜこの街で<tips=21>八龍会</tips>にあれほどの薬を売らせているのか？　<tips=22>老人たち</tips>はマージンが高いと愚痴っていたが、やり方次第ではもっと莫大な利益を上げられる薬なんだぜ。金以外の何かの目的があるとしか思えない。それはなんなのか。一体その正体は何なのか。おれは、それが気になって仕方ない。","en":"The more I looked at him—and the more I thought about him—the shadier he seemed. Why did he know the recipe for ‘<tips=46>Neo Rose</tips>’? And why was he entrusting a drug of such extraordinary value to the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips> here in this city? The <tips=22>Elders</tips> had complained about his steep margin, but marketed differently, the drug could have earned him an incomparably greater fortune. He had to be pursuing something other than money. What was it? What in the world was he, really? I could not put the question out of my mind.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r209","rowIndex":209,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ので、率直にそれを尋ねてみた。","en":"So I asked him directly.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r210","rowIndex":210,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そんなに不自然デス？」","en":"“Does it really strike you as so strange?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エフゲニ・ヘス","displayName":"Yevgeny Hess","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r211","rowIndex":211,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=65>ヘス</tips>は大げさにおどけて見せる。","en":"<tips=65>Hess</tips> made an exaggerated show of playing the innocent.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r212","rowIndex":212,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「前にも言いましたが、私はこの街が好きなんデスよ。<tips=8>グレートホール</tips>も近いし、金色の目をした人も多い。私の故郷によく似ている……。それに、<tips=21>八龍会</tips>の老人がたのおっしゃることも共感出来ます。この街にはギャングもノーマルもいらない。我々<tips=17>タイプB</tips>は解放されなくてはいけないんです。そして、<tips=17>タイプB</tips>のための街が本当に出来るとしたら、それはとても素晴らしいことデスからね。世界に類がありません。それに協力出来るのならば、光栄です。レシピをお教え出来ないのは申し訳ないのですが、レシピを渡した途端、もうあんなうるさい老人なんか用済みだ……なんてことになったら困りますからね。この何も持たない流浪の老人が、あなたたちのかけがえのない同志として発言権を持つためにはどうしても必要なんデスよ。ご理解ください」","en":"“As I have said before, I like this city. The <tips=8>Great Hole</tips> is near, and many people here have golden eyes. It greatly resembles my homeland... I also sympathize with what the Elders of the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips> have to say. This city needs neither gangs nor Normals. We <tips=17>Type Bs</tips> must be liberated. And if a city truly can be built for <tips=17>Type Bs</tips>, it will be a marvelous thing. Nothing like it exists anywhere in the world. I would be honored to help. I regret that I cannot give you the formula, but imagine what might happen the instant I did. ‘We have no further use for that troublesome old man!’ That would place me in a difficult position. If a wandering old man with nothing to his name is to possess a voice as your irreplaceable comrade, the formula is indispensable. I ask for your understanding.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エフゲニ・ヘス","displayName":"Yevgeny Hess","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r213","rowIndex":213,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼は穏やかに笑うけれども、どうも信用出来ないのはおれが疑い過ぎなだけだろうか？","en":"He smiled gently. Was it only because I was too suspicious that I still could not trust him?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r214","rowIndex":214,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　世間には、そういった理想を求める<tips=17>タイプB</tips>が多いのは知っている。<tips=65>ヘス</tips>もその一人だというだけなのかもしれない。","en":"I knew there were many <tips=17>Type Bs</tips> in the world who pursued such ideals. Perhaps <tips=65>Hess</tips> was simply one of them.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r215","rowIndex":215,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　だがおれは不審だった。さっきの<tips=23>エリオット</tips>のセリフじゃないが。いっそ金と権力のためだと、ストレートに欲望を語ってくれたほうがまだ信用出来た。","en":"But I remained suspicious. To borrow <tips=23>Elliott’s</tips> line from earlier, I might have trusted Hess more if he had spoken plainly of naked greed for money and power.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r216","rowIndex":216,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……おっしゃることは理解出来ました。じゃあ、どうしてこんな薬の作り方を知っているのですか？　幻の薬じゃないですか」","en":"“...I understand what you mean. Then how do you know how to make a drug like this? It’s practically mythical.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r217","rowIndex":217,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「前にも説明しませんでしたっけ？　私は、以前そういった薬を研究する機関に所属してましてね。普通の人が知らないことでも通じているのデスよ。……今は失業してしまって、気ままな旅をしながら、小銭稼ぎをしているだけデス」","en":"“Did I not explain before? I once belonged to an institute that researched drugs of this sort, so I am familiar with things ordinary people know nothing about. ...These days I am out of work. I simply wander wherever the mood takes me and earn a little pocket money along the way.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エフゲニ・ヘス","displayName":"Yevgeny Hess","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r218","rowIndex":218,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「わかりました」","en":"“Understood.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r219","rowIndex":219,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　と言うしかない。疑わしいが、具体的に疑義を突きつけるだけの根拠はないのだ。","en":"There was nothing else I could say. He was suspicious, but I had no concrete grounds on which to challenge him.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r220","rowIndex":220,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おれの隣には<tips=66>コンタ</tips>と<tips=67>カミラ</tips>が座っている。","en":"<tips=66>Konta</tips> and <tips=67>Camilla</tips> sat beside me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r221","rowIndex":221,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=67>カミラ</tips>は<tips=59>暗闇通り</tips>にある不動産屋の娘だ。美人だがキツイ性格で、<tips=17>タイプＢ</tips>至上主義というか――まあ考え方としては爺さんたちと近いものがある。<tips=17>タイプB</tips>以外は敵と見なしているような女だ。自分からリーダーになりたがるタイプで、今回おれの補佐的なポジションを与えられたのもちょっと気にいらないらしく、ずっと表情が硬い。","en":"<tips=67>Camilla</tips> was the daughter of a real-estate agent on <tips=59>Darkness Street</tips>. She was beautiful but severe, a <tips=17>Type B</tips> supremacist—or rather, her thinking was much like the Elders’. She seemed to regard everyone but <tips=17>Type Bs</tips> as enemies. She was the sort who wanted to be the leader herself, and she apparently resented being assigned to support me this time. Her expression had remained rigid throughout.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r222","rowIndex":222,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それにしても、<tips=21>八龍会</tips>のミナサンが、こうして戦うためのチームを作ってくれたのは、私としてもとても嬉しいデス。今までの何でも秘密でやるのも良い方法デスが、真の自由というものは、みなが見える場所で戦って勝ちとらなければいけないのデスからね。その妥当さを、さっきまで<tips=67>カミラ</tips>さんに話していたのデスよ」","en":"“Even so, I am very happy that everyone in the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips> has formed a team to fight like this. Doing everything in secret, as before, is also a good method. But true freedom must be fought for and won in a place where everyone can see. Until just now, I was explaining the soundness of this principle to <tips=67>Camilla</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エフゲニ・ヘス","displayName":"Yevgeny Hess","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r223","rowIndex":223,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうでしたか。……それで、あなたがこの<tips=47>解放軍</tips>にやって欲しい仕事というのは何なのですか？　爺さんたちに提案したものがあると聞いたんですが」","en":"“I see. ...What is the job you want this <tips=47>Liberation Army</tips> to perform? I heard you had made a proposal to the Elders.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r224","rowIndex":224,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「オー、そうデス。その話をするために、私は今日ここへ来たのデス。失礼……」","en":"“Oh, yes. I came today precisely to discuss it. Excuse me...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エフゲニ・ヘス","displayName":"Yevgeny Hess","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r225","rowIndex":225,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=65>ヘス</tips>はジャケットの内ポケットからハンカチを取り出すと、その大きな鷲鼻に当て、音を立てて鼻をかんだ。","en":"<tips=65>Hess</tips> took a handkerchief from an inner pocket of his jacket, pressed it to his great aquiline nose, and blew his nose noisily.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r226","rowIndex":226,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そしてハンカチを折りたたんでまたポケットに戻す。","en":"Then he folded the handkerchief and returned it to his pocket.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r227","rowIndex":227,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=10>見土</tips>サン、街のハズレにある古い病院を知っていますか？」","en":"“<tips=10>Mr. Mido</tips>, do you know the old hospital on the outskirts of the city?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エフゲニ・ヘス","displayName":"Yevgeny Hess","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r228","rowIndex":228,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「病院なら、いくつかあると思いますが……」","en":"“There are several hospitals that might describe, I think...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r229","rowIndex":229,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「高い塀で囲まれた、<tips=17>タイプB</tips>専用の病院施設デスよ」","en":"“The institution exclusively for <tips=17>Type Bs</tips>, surrounded by high walls.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エフゲニ・ヘス","displayName":"Yevgeny Hess","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r230","rowIndex":230,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ああ『<tips=6>タイプＢ収容所</tips>』ですか」","en":"“Oh, the ‘<tips=6>Type B Internment Center</tips>’?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r231","rowIndex":231,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうデス！　それデス！　あそこは本当におぞましい場所なんデスよ。<tips=10>見土</tips>サンはそれをご存じデスか？」","en":"“Precisely! That one! It is a truly appalling place. Did you know that, <tips=10>Mr. Mido</tips>?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エフゲニ・ヘス","displayName":"Yevgeny Hess","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r232","rowIndex":232,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「よくある<tips=17>タイプB</tips>用の閉鎖病院じゃないんですか？　珍しくもない」　","en":"“Isn’t it just an ordinary secure hospital for <tips=17>Type Bs</tips>? There’s nothing unusual about it.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r233","rowIndex":233,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ああ、<tips=10>見土</tips>さんもすっかり騙されている」","en":"“Ah, they have deceived <tips=10>you</tips> completely.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エフゲニ・ヘス","displayName":"Yevgeny Hess","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r234","rowIndex":234,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=65>ヘス</tips>はがっくりうなだれて溜息をつく。","en":"<tips=65>Hess</tips> hung his head and sighed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r235","rowIndex":235,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あそこではね、世にも恐ろしい人体実験が行われているのデスよ」","en":"“They are conducting human experiments in there of a truly horrifying kind.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エフゲニ・ヘス","displayName":"Yevgeny Hess","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r236","rowIndex":236,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=65>ヘス</tips>はがさごそと黒いバッグをあさって、中から写真を取り出してテーブルの上に並べる。","en":"<tips=65>Hess</tips> rummaged through a black bag, removed some photographs, and laid them across the table.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r237","rowIndex":237,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「今時こんなアナクロなもので申し訳ないんデスが、どうも画像データより紙の写真で資料を保管する方が落ち着きまして」","en":"“Forgive me for using something so anachronistic. For some reason, I feel more at ease keeping my records as paper photographs than as image data.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エフゲニ・ヘス","displayName":"Yevgeny Hess","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r238","rowIndex":238,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼が我々によく見えるよう、その枯れ枝のような指で写真を押し出した。","en":"He pushed the pictures toward us with fingers like withered branches, arranging them where we could see.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r239","rowIndex":239,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　あまりカメラの技術がないものが撮影したのか、全体的にぼやけてはいたが、そこには確かに衝撃的な光景が収められていた。","en":"The photographer appeared to have possessed little skill, for every image was blurred. Even so, they unquestionably captured shocking sights.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r240","rowIndex":240,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　天然光の差し込まない薄暗い部屋で、照明は画面には映っていないがその青白い色からすると蛍光灯か何かだろう。狭苦しいコンクリートの壁と床は、あちこちに細かい文字や絵のようなものが刻み込まれている。","en":"A dim room received no natural light. The light source itself was outside the frame, but judging by its pale blue color, it came from a fluorescent lamp or something similar. Tiny letters and drawings had been scratched all across the concrete walls and floor of the cramped space.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r241","rowIndex":241,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その部屋の中央にはベッドがあり、その上に横たわる人物は四肢と胴体を鎖で拘束されていた。彼は浴衣のような薄い衣服を身につけており、その前ははだけてあばらの浮かんだ胸が浮かんでいる。そして腰の辺りを白く覆うのは、おむつだろう。","en":"At the center of the room stood a bed. The person lying upon it was bound by chains around all four limbs and the torso. He wore a thin garment like a hospital yukata, open in front to expose a chest whose ribs stood out sharply. Something white covered his waist, probably a diaper.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r242","rowIndex":242,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼の肌はひっかき傷のようなものが無数に浮かび、所々青あざも浮かんでいる。手首や足首の拘束には摩擦を防ぐタオルが噛ませてあったが、赤黒い血を吸って汚れていた。","en":"Countless marks like scratches stood out upon his skin, together with bruises here and there. Towels had been inserted beneath the restraints at his wrists and ankles to prevent chafing, but they were stained with dark red blood.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r243","rowIndex":243,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　頭には電極がテープで貼りつけられ、傍らの機械に繋がっている。機械には黒と緑のメーターがあって、何か波形のようなものを写し出していた。","en":"Electrodes had been taped to his head and connected to a machine beside him. Its black-and-green display showed what appeared to be waveforms.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r244","rowIndex":244,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　口元はぽってりと膨れたマスクで覆われ、そこからホースが繋がっている。","en":"A thick, bulging mask covered his mouth, with a hose running from it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r245","rowIndex":245,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　血走った目はぎょろりと剥かれており、撮影者の方を見つめている。","en":"His bloodshot eyes were peeled grotesquely wide, staring straight at the photographer.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r246","rowIndex":246,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　写真は六枚あったが、若い女や老女など、様々な人物が写っていたがいずれも同じように鎖で拘束され、計器に繋がれていた。","en":"There were six photographs. They showed several different people, including a young woman and an old one, but every person was similarly chained down and connected to instruments.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r247","rowIndex":247,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　あとから<tips=65>ヘス</tips>はさらに二枚の写真を追加する。そこの人物はベッドに繋がれてはいないものの、マットと便器しかないコンクリートの部屋のなかから、全裸でこちらを睨み付けている。彼のまわりには、無数の紙片が散らばっていた。","en":"<tips=65>Hess</tips> then added two more photographs. The person shown in them was not chained to a bed, but stood stark naked, glaring at the camera from inside a concrete room containing nothing but a mat and a toilet. Countless scraps of paper were scattered around him.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r248","rowIndex":248,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おれは説明を受けなくとも、それらが重度の症状があらわれた<tips=17>タイプB</tips>患者であることがわかる。","en":"I needed no explanation to recognize them as <tips=17>Type B</tips> patients in whom severe symptoms had manifested.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r249","rowIndex":249,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「病院の地下には檻のついた部屋があって、そこではこのように我々の同胞が非人道的な扱いをされているのデス」","en":"“Beneath the hospital are barred rooms in which our comrades receive treatment as inhumane as this.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r250","rowIndex":250,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=65>ヘス</tips>はその灰色がかったカラーコンタクトを乗せた瞳でおれたちの表情を観察しながら、しわがれ声で言う。","en":"<tips=65>Hess</tips> watched our reactions through gray-tinted contacts and spoke in his hoarse voice.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r251","rowIndex":251,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「これは治療ではありませんよ。新薬を試したり、珍しい症状の観察記録をとられているだけデス。ほら、コチラの患者の頭を見てください。縫合の痕があるでしょう？　脳に手術を受けているのですよ。<tips=17>タイプB</tips>に対する脳外科手術による治療はあまりに非人道的だということで禁止されているのに。……つまり、人体実験が行われているのデスな。非合法の」","en":"“This is not treatment. They are merely used to test new drugs and to compile observation records of unusual symptoms. Here, look at this patient’s head. You see the sutures? They operated on the brain. And yet surgical treatment of <tips=17>Type Bs</tips> has been banned as far too inhumane. ...In other words, they are conducting human experiments. Illegal ones.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エフゲニ・ヘス","displayName":"Yevgeny Hess","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r252","rowIndex":252,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「確かに縛り付けられていますね。……でも、あなたの言うように非合法な行為が行われているかどうかは、これだけじゃわからない。<tips=17>タイプB</tips>を扱う病院は大体こんなもんでしょう？　<tips=17>タイプB</tips>なんてものは治しようがないし、腕力ではノーマルの手には負えないんですから、管理するにはそれ相応の手段が必要だ」","en":"“They certainly are tied down. ...But these pictures alone don’t tell us whether anything illegal is happening, as you claim. Aren’t most hospitals that handle <tips=17>Type Bs</tips> like this? There is no way to cure <tips=17>Type Bs</tips>, and a Normal cannot physically manage them, so measures like these are necessary to keep them under control.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r253","rowIndex":253,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おれは写真から顔を上げて、","en":"I looked up from the photographs.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r254","rowIndex":254,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「こんな写真、どうやって撮影したんですか？」","en":"“How did you take pictures like these?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r255","rowIndex":255,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「潜入が非常に得意な協力者がいるんデス。その人物にやってもらいました。……彼女とは、<tips=10>見土</tips>さんもいずれ会うでしょう。この写真は、そちらで持ってくださって結構デス」","en":"“I have an associate exceptionally skilled at infiltration. She took them for me. ...You will meet her in due time, <tips=10>Mr. Mido</tips>. You are welcome to keep the photographs.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エフゲニ・ヘス","displayName":"Yevgeny Hess","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r256","rowIndex":256,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=65>ヘス</tips>はパタリとバッグを閉じて足元に置くと、","en":"<tips=65>Hess</tips> snapped the bag shut and placed it by his feet.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r257","rowIndex":257,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どこの病院でもやっていることだと<tips=10>見土</tips>さんは言いましたが、ソモソモ、もうこんな患者を苦しめるだけの施設は必要ないんデスよ。我々は全ての仲間の苦しみを取り除く手段を持っているんデスから」","en":"“Mr. <tips=10>Mido</tips>, you said every hospital does this, but facilities that do nothing but make patients suffer are no longer needed in the first place. We possess the means to take away all our comrades’ suffering.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エフゲニ・ヘス","displayName":"Yevgeny Hess","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r258","rowIndex":258,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼はぬめぬめと濡れた舌で、乾燥してひび割れた唇を舐める。","en":"He passed a slick, wet tongue across his dry, cracked lips.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r259","rowIndex":259,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ここまで聞いて、この老人が<tips=47>八龍解放軍</tips>に何をやらせようとしているのか、おれにもなんとなくわかってきた。","en":"By then, I had begun to understand what the old man wanted the <tips=47>Hachiryu Liberation Army</tips> to do.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r260","rowIndex":260,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そこで<tips=10>見土</tips>さんにはね、彼らを解放して欲しいんデスよ。こうして縛られている仲間だけでなく、病院に閉じ込められている可哀想な全ての同胞を」","en":"“And so, <tips=10>Mr. Mido</tips>, I want you to liberate them. Not only the comrades bound in this way, but every one of our suffering comrades imprisoned within that hospital.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エフゲニ・ヘス","displayName":"Yevgeny Hess","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r261","rowIndex":261,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どうやって？　彼らは塀の中にいる」","en":"“How? They’re behind walls.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r262","rowIndex":262,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「世界で一番シンプルな方法ですよ。……私は武器を買いつけました。ソレを<tips=47>八龍解放軍</tips>にプレゼントします。火器を用いれば、病院の貧弱な警備などものともしないでしょう。私は強力なサイキックを一人貸しますし、<tips=10>見土</tips>さんの切断する能力も役に立つ筈です」","en":"“The simplest method in the world. ...I have procured a supply of weapons, which I will present to the <tips=47>Hachiryu Liberation Army</tips>. With firearms at your disposal, the hospital’s feeble security will pose no obstacle. I will also lend you a powerful psychic, and <tips=10>Mr. Mido’s</tips> severing ability should prove useful as well.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エフゲニ・ヘス","displayName":"Yevgeny Hess","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r263","rowIndex":263,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そ、そんな乱暴なこと、出来っこないでしょう？　警備員が逆らったら？　医者や看護師が患者を出せないと言ったらどうするんですか？」","en":"“W-we can’t do anything that violent! What if the security guards resist? What if the doctors and nurses say they can’t release the patients? What do we do then?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"田中紺太","displayName":"Konta Tanaka","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r264","rowIndex":264,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=66>コンタ</tips>はつばを飛ばして抗議をする。","en":"<tips=66>Konta</tips> protested so forcefully that he sprayed saliva.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r265","rowIndex":265,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それに答えたのは<tips=65>ヘス</tips>じゃなかった。","en":"It was not <tips=65>Hess</tips> who answered him.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r266","rowIndex":266,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そのときのために、彼は銃を貸してくれると言っているんです」","en":"“He says he’ll lend us guns for just such an occasion.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"カミラ","displayName":"Camilla","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r267","rowIndex":267,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=67>カミラ</tips>は平然と言い放つ。――彼女の普段の言動からすれば、こういった<tips=65>ヘス</tips>の意見に賛成するのはわかりきったことだ。","en":"<tips=67>Camilla</tips> delivered the answer without batting an eye. —Given everything she normally said and did, it was a foregone conclusion that she would agree with <tips=65>Hess</tips> on something like this.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r268","rowIndex":268,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「この街を変えてゆくのに、まず手始めに我々を人間扱いしない人々の象徴であるあの病院を打ち壊し、仲間を解放するというのはとてもいいプランだと思います」","en":"“If we are to change this city, destroying that hospital—the symbol of everyone who refuses to treat us as human—and liberating our comrades seems an excellent first step.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"カミラ","displayName":"Camilla","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r269","rowIndex":269,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女の容赦ない言葉に<tips=66>コンタ</tips>はむっとした顔つきをする。","en":"<tips=66>Konta</tips> scowled at her merciless words.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r270","rowIndex":270,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「相変わらず過激派だねえ。<tips=67>カミラ</tips>ちゃん」","en":"“Still a radical, eh, <tips=67>Camilla</tips> dear?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r271","rowIndex":271,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　場の空気をやわらげなきゃいけないと、そんな冗談を言ってみたら、<tips=67>カミラ</tips>は表情をかたくしておれを見る。","en":"I tried that little joke to soften the atmosphere, but <tips=67>Camilla’s</tips> face tightened as she looked at me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r272","rowIndex":272,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=10>見土</tips>さん……いや、リーダーはどうお考えですか？」","en":"“And what do you think, <tips=10>Mr. Mido</tips>—or rather, Leader?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"カミラ","displayName":"Camilla","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r273","rowIndex":273,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　何かの皮肉のつもりか『リーダー』の部分を強調して言う。","en":"Perhaps as some form of sarcasm, she stressed the word leader.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r274","rowIndex":274,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　この子のそういう気の強いところは嫌いじゃないけれど、こういう場面ではちょっと困ったりもする。","en":"I did not dislike that strong-willed side of her, but at times like this, it did make things difficult.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r275","rowIndex":275,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どうもこうも……」","en":"“What do I think...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r276","rowIndex":276,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おれは両手を軽く上げて、どうしようもない、というような仕草をしてから、","en":"I lightly raised both hands in a gesture of helplessness, then said,","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r277","rowIndex":277,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「爺さんたちはこの作戦を支持している。……この<tips=47>八龍解放軍</tips>ってのは、まあ要するに<tips=21>八龍会</tips>の軍隊なわけだろう？　だとしたら、独自の判断をすべきではないと考えるね。トップの意向に従い、与えられた目標を達成するだけだ」","en":"“The Elders support this operation. ...This <tips=47>Hachiryu Liberation Army</tips> is, in essence, the military arm of the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips>, isn’t it? If so, I don’t think it should make decisions on its own. It should simply follow the leadership’s wishes and achieve the objectives it is given.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r278","rowIndex":278,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=10>道夫</tips>君……」","en":"“<tips=10>Michio</tips>...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"田中紺太","displayName":"Konta Tanaka","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r279","rowIndex":279,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=66>コンタ</tips>はおれを見る。","en":"<tips=66>Konta</tips> looked at me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r280","rowIndex":280,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そんな驚いたような、悲しいような目でおれを見ないでくれ。","en":"Don’t look at me with those eyes—half shocked, half wounded.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r281","rowIndex":281,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「本心では気が進まないような口ぶりですね」","en":"“You sound as though you are reluctant.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"カミラ","displayName":"Camilla","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r282","rowIndex":282,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=67>カミラ</tips>は冷ややかに言う。細かい女だ。","en":"<tips=67>Camilla</tips> spoke coldly. What a fussy woman.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r283","rowIndex":283,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そりゃ気持ちよく取りかかれる仕事じゃない。が、やると言っている。……ただ、あらかじめ聞いておきたいんだけれど……いいですか？」","en":"“Of course it isn’t a job I can feel good about. But I’ve said I’ll do it. ...There is just one thing I want to ask beforehand... May I?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r284","rowIndex":284,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おれは<tips=65>ヘス</tips>の方を見ながら、","en":"I turned toward <tips=65>Hess</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r285","rowIndex":285,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「症状で苦しむ彼らを『<tips=46>ネオ・ローズ</tips>』で解放するのはいいでしょう。しかし、そのあとどうします？　あの病院で治療を受けている患者には、帰るったって帰る場所もない人だって多いでしょう」","en":"“Freeing them from their symptoms with ‘<tips=46>Neo Rose</tips>’ is all very well. But what happens afterward? Many of the patients being treated at that hospital must have no home to return to.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r286","rowIndex":286,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「その件に関しては<tips=21>八龍会</tips>で引き取るということで、あのお三人とも合意しています。丁度人手不足だそうですし、この先、人はいくらいても足りなくなるでしょう」","en":"“As for that matter, I have already agreed with those three that the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips> will take them in. I hear they are short-handed, and from here on, there will be no such thing as too many hands.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エフゲニ・ヘス","displayName":"Yevgeny Hess","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r287","rowIndex":287,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「もう一ついいですか」","en":"“May I ask one more question?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r288","rowIndex":288,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どうぞ」","en":"“Please.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エフゲニ・ヘス","displayName":"Yevgeny Hess","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r289","rowIndex":289,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「このような襲撃をしたら、ノーマルの反感を買いますよ。そうしたら、<tips=17>タイプB</tips>に対する風当たりが強くなるでしょう。街で迫害を受けるかもしれない。そのことについてはどうお考えで？」","en":"“An attack like this will provoke the Normals’ hostility. Then the backlash against <tips=17>Type Bs</tips> will grow worse. They may face persecution throughout the city. What do you think about that?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r290","rowIndex":290,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=10>見土</tips>さん、そんなコトにならないよう、ノーマルたちを怯えさせ、同胞が勇気を取り戻すくらい、徹底的にやるのがあなた方<tips=47>八龍解放軍</tips>の仕事でしょう？　……この街を支配するためには、彼らをおそれさせ、従属させるのが絶対に必要なんデスから、それをよく理解してもらわないと。<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>の<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>がそうしたように、人々を<tips=21>八龍会</tips>の前にひれふさせるのデス」","en":"“<tips=10>Mr. Mido</tips>, preventing that is precisely the task of your <tips=47>Hachiryu Liberation Army</tips>: strike so thoroughly that the Normals are terrified and our comrades regain their courage. ...If we are to rule this city, it is absolutely necessary that they fear us and submit to us. You must understand that. Just as <tips=3>Chris Tse</tips> of <tips=7>YS</tips> did, you will make the people grovel before the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エフゲニ・ヘス","displayName":"Yevgeny Hess","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r291","rowIndex":291,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=65>ヘス</tips>はうっすらと笑みを浮かべる。","en":"<tips=65>Hess</tips> wore a faint smile.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r292","rowIndex":292,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「他に質問はありますか？」","en":"“Do you have any other questions?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エフゲニ・ヘス","displayName":"Yevgeny Hess","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r293","rowIndex":293,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……今はないです」","en":"“...Not at present.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r294","rowIndex":294,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「わかりました。それじゃあ、これからのことを具体的に話し合いましょうか」","en":"“Very well. Shall we discuss the particulars?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エフゲニ・ヘス","displayName":"Yevgeny Hess","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r295","rowIndex":295,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そしておれたちは、現在<tips=47>解放軍</tips>はどれくらいの人数を動かせるのか、<tips=65>ヘス</tips>がどういった武器を購入していつ手渡すつもりなのか、そして病院を襲撃する日取りはどの時期になるのか……その他様々な事柄において話し合い、その日は終わった。","en":"We discussed how many people the <tips=47>Liberation Army</tips> could presently mobilize, what weapons <tips=65>Hess</tips> had purchased and when he meant to hand them over, when the hospital operation would take place, and many other details. That brought the day’s business to an end.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r296","rowIndex":296,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　全ての用事が終わって外に出ると、外はもう暗くなっており、雨足も強くなっていた。","en":"By the time we completed everything and went outside, darkness had fallen and the rain had grown heavier.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r297","rowIndex":297,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おれと<tips=66>コンタ</tips>は傘を借りて、帰路を歩き始める。","en":"<tips=66>Konta</tips> and I borrowed umbrellas and began walking home.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r298","rowIndex":298,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=10>道夫</tips>君、本当に、あんな滅茶苦茶なことを実行するつもりなの？」","en":"“<tips=10>Michio</tips>, do you really mean to go through with something that insane?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"田中紺太","displayName":"Konta Tanaka","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r299","rowIndex":299,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼は浮かない顔で言う。","en":"He said it with a downcast look.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r300","rowIndex":300,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　先ほどの<tips=65>ヘス</tips>や<tips=67>カミラ</tips>を交えた打ち合わせのときも、その顔でほとんど口をきかなかった。","en":"He had scarcely spoken during the earlier conference with <tips=65>Hess</tips> and <tips=67>Camilla</tips>, and his expression had remained the same throughout.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r301","rowIndex":301,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「おれだって、<tips=21>八龍会</tips>の仕事をやった方が良いとは思っていたけど、あれはちょっと想像を超えていたよ。これじゃ、ギャングたちと何も変わらないじゃないか」","en":"“I thought it would be better for us to work for the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips> too, but this goes far beyond anything I imagined. It makes us no different from the gangs.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"田中紺太","displayName":"Konta Tanaka","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r302","rowIndex":302,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=66>コンタ</tips>は溜息をつく。","en":"<tips=66>Konta</tips> sighed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r303","rowIndex":303,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=66>コンタ</tips>。おれだって、わかっちゃいるんだ。本心を言えば饅頭屋を続けたかった。やっと売れてきたところだしね。でもそれじゃ助からないんだ。……長く続けていればみんなを助けられたかもしれないが、それじゃ間に合わないんだよ。<tips=21>八龍会</tips>はもう戦争に足を踏み入れている。<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>にああいう態度で喧嘩を売った時点で後戻りは出来ない。<tips=1>亮</tips>はもうこっちを完全に敵と見なしているだろうよ。もともと<tips=21>八龍会</tips>ってのは、<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>にとって邪魔な存在だったから、この機会で完全に潰しにかかるだろう。<tips=21>八龍会</tips>が生き残るには、戦って勝つしかないんだ」","en":"“<tips=66>Konta</tips>. I know. If I had my way, I’d keep running the bun shop. Business had finally begun to improve. But that won’t save us. ...If we had enough time, perhaps we could save everyone that way. We don’t. The <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips> has already stepped into a war. The moment it took that attitude and challenged <tips=7>YS</tips>, there was no going back. <tips=1>Tse Leung</tips> must regard us entirely as enemies now. The <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips> was an obstacle to <tips=7>YS</tips> from the beginning, so they’ll use this opportunity to crush it completely. If the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips> is to survive, we have no choice but to fight and win.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r304","rowIndex":304,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「戦うって……相手はあの<tips=1>亮</tips>だよ？　戦えるのかい？」","en":"“Fight...? But we’re talking about <tips=1>Tse Leung</tips>. Can you fight him?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"田中紺太","displayName":"Konta Tanaka","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r305","rowIndex":305,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=1>亮</tips>は大事な親友だよ。でも、爺さんたちや、<tips=21>八龍会</tips>のみんな、そしてこの街で苦しむ<tips=17>タイプB</tips>たちはおれの家族なんだ。<tips=67>カミラ</tips>も、そこの部分は同じだ。……おれと<tips=67>カミラ</tips>の性格は全然違うけど、だからきっと、あいつともうまくやっていけると思うな」","en":"“<tips=1>Tse Leung</tips> is a dear friend. But the Elders, everyone in the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips>, and the suffering <tips=17>Type Bs</tips> of this city are my family. <tips=67>Camilla</tips> feels the same about that. ...Our personalities are completely different, but that’s why I think I can work well with <tips=67>Camilla</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r306","rowIndex":306,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「お、おれだって、みんなのことは大事だけど……でも争いを避ける方法もあるんじゃないのかい？」","en":"“E-even I care about everyone... But there must still be some way to avoid a conflict.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"田中紺太","displayName":"Konta Tanaka","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r307","rowIndex":307,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　子供の頃から暴力ごとが苦手な<tips=66>コンタ</tips>は真っ青になっている。","en":"<tips=66>Konta</tips> had never been able to stomach violence, even as a child, and now he had gone white as a sheet.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r308","rowIndex":308,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……おれはね、大事なものがあって、それを守るために対立したり、戦ったりするのは人間として誇り高いことだと思ってる。しかも、相手が最も尊敬している親友で、全力で力比べが出来るとなればこれはもう男冥利に尽きるじゃないか」","en":"“...When you have something precious, I think there is a certain human nobility in standing against others and fighting to protect it. And when the person facing you is the friend you respect above all others, someone against whom you can test your full strength—well, there is no greater privilege for a man.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r309","rowIndex":309,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=10>道夫</tips>君、少年漫画とか好きだもんね……」","en":"“You do love shonen manga, <tips=10>Michio</tips>...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"田中紺太","displayName":"Konta Tanaka","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r310","rowIndex":310,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「変な言い方するな。……まあでも、<tips=1>亮</tips>がこの街に帰ってきた時から、こんな日が来るんじゃないかと思ってはいたんだよ。いや、はじめてあいつが<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>の息子だと知ったときから、うっすら感じていたのかもな」","en":"“Don’t put it like that. ...Still, ever since <tips=1>Tse Leung</tips> came back to this city, part of me had wondered whether a day like this might come. No—perhaps I had sensed it dimly ever since I first learned that he was <tips=3>Chris Tse’s</tips> son.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r311","rowIndex":311,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まあ、<tips=10>道夫</tips>君の言うこともわかるよ」","en":"“I understand what <tips=10>you</tips> mean, at least.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"田中紺太","displayName":"Konta Tanaka","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r312","rowIndex":312,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=66>コンタ</tips>はうつむき、","en":"<tips=66>Konta</tips> lowered his head.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r313","rowIndex":313,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「でも、前の仕事をやめるとき、おれは思ったんだよ。もう誰かを傷つけたり、騙したり、そういうことはしたくないって……」","en":"“But when I left my old work, I decided I didn’t want to hurt or deceive anyone anymore...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"田中紺太","displayName":"Konta Tanaka","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r314","rowIndex":314,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=66>コンタ</tips>、それは素晴らしい考えだよ」","en":"“<tips=66>Konta</tips>, that’s an admirable way to think.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r315","rowIndex":315,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おれは笑って<tips=66>コンタ</tips>の肩を軽く叩いて、","en":"I smiled, gave <tips=66>Konta</tips> a light pat on the shoulder, and","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r316","rowIndex":316,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「お前は襲撃に来なくていい。事務処理とか、内部の人事調整とか、そういう内向きの仕事をやればいい。そっちの方が向いてるしな。そして一通りの争いが終わって、街が平和になったら、お前が『<tips=71>グレートホール饅頭</tips>』のプロジェクトを再開するんだ」","en":"“You don’t have to come on the raid. Handle paperwork, internal personnel arrangements, and other duties within the organization. Those suit you better. Then, once all this fighting is over and the city is at peace, you can restart the ‘<tips=71>Great Hole Bun</tips>’ project.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r317","rowIndex":317,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なんでおれが？」","en":"“Why me?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"田中紺太","displayName":"Konta Tanaka","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r318","rowIndex":318,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「おれはこのままだと、<tips=21>八龍会</tips>のなかでどんどん出世しちゃうからな。饅頭屋なんかやってられなくなる」","en":"“At this rate, I’ll keep climbing the ranks of the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips>. I won’t have time to run a bun shop.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r319","rowIndex":319,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おれが胸を張って言ってやった。すると、<tips=66>コンタ</tips>は苦い顔をして、","en":"I puffed out my chest as I spoke. <tips=66>Konta</tips> grimaced.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r320","rowIndex":320,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ダメだよ。おれなんかじゃ……」","en":"“I can’t. Someone like me...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"田中紺太","displayName":"Konta Tanaka","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r321","rowIndex":321,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「何言ってるんだよ！　お前なら出来るさ！　みんなに信頼されている。自信を持てよ」","en":"“What are you talking about? Of course you can! Everyone trusts you. Have some confidence!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r322","rowIndex":322,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おれが背中を叩いても、<tips=66>コンタ</tips>は顔を上げない。","en":"I slapped him on the back, but <tips=66>Konta</tips> still did not look up.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r323","rowIndex":323,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……無理だよ……本当に……」","en":"“...I really can’t... I mean it...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"田中紺太","displayName":"Konta Tanaka","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r324","rowIndex":324,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そこでやっと彼は顔を上げ、おれを見つめる。","en":"At last he raised his face and looked at me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r325","rowIndex":325,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして意を決したような表情をして、何を言うかと思えば、","en":"Then his face took on a look of determination, and just when I wondered what great declaration was coming—","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r326","rowIndex":326,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「だって、おれ、本当は甘いものきらいなんだ。<tips=10>道夫</tips>君がやってたみたいに毎日試食してたら死んじゃう」","en":"“The truth is, I hate sweets. If I tasted them every day the way <tips=10>you</tips> did, I’d die.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"田中紺太","displayName":"Konta Tanaka","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-1:r327","rowIndex":327,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　と、半分涙声で言うのだった。","en":"he confessed, sounding half ready to cry.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}}]},{"position":46,"code":"B4-2","unitId":"B4-2","rows":[{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-2:r1","rowIndex":1,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　もうすぐ日付が変わろうという時刻、その電話は何の前触れもなくかかってきた。","en":"The call came without warning, shortly before midnight.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-2:r2","rowIndex":2,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=47>八龍解放軍</tips>での仕事を引き受けてから三日目となる今日は、朝から晩までコンタや<tips=67>カミラ</tips>と一緒にかけずり回り、新しく部下となったものたちと会ったり、<tips=21>八龍会</tips>の様々な人に挨拶をしたり、これから実行される作戦についてのプランを練ったりしていたので、おれはすっかりへとへとだった。","en":"This was my third day working for the <tips=47>Hachiryu Liberation Army</tips>, and I had spent it racing around with Konta and <tips=67>Camilla</tips> from morning till night—meeting my new subordinates, introducing myself to all kinds of people in the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips>, and drawing up plans for the coming operation. I was utterly exhausted.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-2:r3","rowIndex":3,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　どうでもいい相手だったら無視するところだが、着信相手の名前を見ると『<tips=51>熨田さくら</tips>』と書いてある。","en":"I would have ignored the call if it had been from anyone unimportant, but the name on the screen was <tips=51>Sakura Noshida</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-2:r4","rowIndex":4,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　あの子は何の用もないときにかけてくるような人間ではないから、きっと急な用件なのだろう。そして、あの鉄砲玉のような子の急用ならば、とんでもない重大な話に違いない。","en":"She was not the sort to call without a reason, so this had to be urgent. And an emergency for a human bullet like her could only mean something truly serious.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-2:r5","rowIndex":5,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それにしても、いつもあの子はおれが疲れた時に連絡をして来るなあと、内心苦笑しながら電話を耳に当てると、予想通り切羽詰まった<tips=51>さくら</tips>の声がスピーカーから飛び出して来る。","en":"She always calls just when I’m exhausted, I thought, smiling wryly to myself. The moment I put the phone to my ear, <tips=51>Sakura’s</tips> desperate voice burst from the speaker, exactly as expected.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-2:r6","rowIndex":6,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"『<tips=10>見土</tips>さんっ、今大丈夫？』","en":"‘<tips=10>Mr. Mido</tips>! Can you talk?’","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-2:r7","rowIndex":7,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「へーきだよ。どうしたの？」","en":"“Sure. What’s wrong?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-2:r8","rowIndex":8,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おれは彼女を落ち着かせようと、わざととぼけた声でそう返事をする。","en":"I deliberately answered in a breezy, nonchalant voice to calm her down.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-2:r9","rowIndex":9,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"『<tips=44>筱喬</tips>の様子がおかしいの……』","en":"‘Something’s wrong with <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips>...’","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-2:r10","rowIndex":10,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女は冷静になろうと努めているようだが、その声は微かに震えている。","en":"She was trying to remain calm, but her voice trembled faintly.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-2:r11","rowIndex":11,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　この子がこんな感情を露わにするとは珍しい。案の定、ただごとではないようだ。","en":"It was unusual for her to show her feelings this openly. Sure enough, this was no ordinary situation.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-2:r12","rowIndex":12,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どうした？」","en":"“What happened?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-2:r13","rowIndex":13,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おれは方針を変えて、真剣な声でもう一度問い直した。","en":"I changed tack and asked again, this time in a serious voice.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-2:r14","rowIndex":14,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"『今日彼女の部屋に泊まりに来てたんだけれど、さっきから急にうわごとみたいなことを呟き出して……何か妄想に取り憑かれているみたいで、今はクローゼットに閉じこもって泣いてる』","en":"‘I came to spend the night in her room, but a little while ago she suddenly started muttering things that sounded like delirium... It’s as if some delusion has taken hold of her. Now she’s shut herself in the closet and she’s crying.’","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-2:r15","rowIndex":15,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……何か彼女が動揺するようなことはあったかい？」","en":"“...Did anything happen that might have upset her?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-2:r16","rowIndex":16,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"『なかったと思う。それまでは、本当に普通に話してたんだ。急に目が金色になったと思ったら、誰もいないところに話しかけて、一人でケタケタと笑って……』","en":"‘I don’t think so. We were having a perfectly normal conversation until then. Suddenly her eyes turned gold, and she started talking to empty space, laughing all by herself...’","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-2:r17","rowIndex":17,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　まさか、発症したのだろうか？","en":"...Could she be developing symptoms?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-2:r18","rowIndex":18,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"『まだ誰にも言っていないの。お母さんのこともあって、<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>の人たちは、<tips=44>筱喬</tips>とお兄さんが「そうなる」のをすごく警戒しているって聞いていたから……教えたらややこしくなってしまうと思って……』","en":"‘I haven’t told anyone yet. I heard that because of what happened to her mother, the people in <tips=7>YS</tips> are extremely wary of <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> or her brother “becoming that way”... I thought telling them might make everything complicated...’","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-2:r19","rowIndex":19,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　はっきりとは言わないが、彼女も<tips=44>シウ</tips>が発症したことに気づいているようだ。","en":"She was not saying it outright, but she too seemed to realize that <tips=44>Siu</tips> had begun showing symptoms.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-2:r20","rowIndex":20,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"『ごめんなさい。<tips=10>見土</tips>さんの立場を考えると、こんな連絡するのは迷惑かもしれないけど……』","en":"‘I’m sorry. Given your position, Mr. <tips=10>Mido</tips>, I know it may be unfair to drag you into this, but...’","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-2:r21","rowIndex":21,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その言葉で、おれは今自分が『<tips=47>八龍解放軍</tips>』の隊長になってしまったことを思い出した。","en":"Her words reminded me that I had now become commander of the <tips=47>Hachiryu Liberation Army</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-2:r22","rowIndex":22,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おれは、<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>とは敵対する関係になってしまっているんだ。","en":"<tips=7>YS</tips> and I had ended up on opposing sides.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-2:r23","rowIndex":23,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その事実はまだ世間には公開していないから、<tips=51>さくら</tips>はそのことを言ったのではないだろうけれど。","en":"That fact was not public knowledge yet, though, so it probably was not what <tips=51>Sakura</tips> meant.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-2:r24","rowIndex":24,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　この立場からすれば、<tips=81>龍頭</tips>の妹が発症したというのは利用すべき事実だ。そんなのはわかってる。わかっているんだが――でも、そんなこと、できっこないだろう？","en":"Given my position, the fact that the <tips=81>Longtou’s</tips> sister had developed symptoms was something I ought to exploit. I knew that. Of course I did. And yet—there was no way I could do such a thing, was there?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-2:r25","rowIndex":25,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なぁに言ってるんだい。きみの判断はベストだよ。なんたって、おれはその道の専門家だからね。だから安心するんだ」","en":"“What are you talking about? You made the best possible choice. I’m an expert in this sort of thing, after all. So don’t worry.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-2:r26","rowIndex":26,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おれは彼女を不安にさせないよう、早口にならないようわざとほがらかにそう言った。","en":"I deliberately kept my voice cheerful and measured, careful not to speak so quickly that I made her more anxious.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-2:r27","rowIndex":27,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"『ありがとう』","en":"‘Thank you.’","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-2:r28","rowIndex":28,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「今からすぐ薬を持って近くまで行く。きみはそこで<tips=44>シウ</tips>ちゃんの様子を見ていてくれ。もし刃物や、危険なものがあったら隠しておくんだ。それで、もし暴れたりするようなら、無理に止めようとしたらいけない。<tips=78>金目</tips>が出たら<tips=44>シウ</tips>ちゃんでも素手で男一人を捻り殺せるくらいの力を出せるかもしれない」","en":"“I’ll bring the medicine and get as close as I can right away. Stay there and keep an eye on <tips=44>Siu</tips>. Hide any knives or other dangerous objects, and if she becomes violent, don’t try to restrain her. If the <tips=78>golden eyes</tips> appear, even <tips=44>Siu</tips> might be strong enough to wring a man’s neck with her bare hands.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-2:r29","rowIndex":29,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おれは携帯を肩と頭で挟み、自由になった両手で外出のために上着を身につける。","en":"I pinned the phone between my shoulder and head and used both free hands to put on a jacket.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-2:r30","rowIndex":30,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"『わかった。……ほかに守らなきゃいけないことは？』","en":"‘Understood. ...Is there anything else I need to remember?’","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-2:r31","rowIndex":31,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「妄想で話しかけて来たら、肯定も否定もしたらいけないよ。肯定したらますます夢の世界にはまりこむし、否定したら逆上するだけだからね。ただ、自分には<tips=44>シウ</tips>ちゃんが見たり聞いたりしたものが感じられないことは伝えていい。いつも通りの、優しい言葉でだ」","en":"“If she starts talking to you about her delusions, do not agree with her or contradict her. If you agree, she will sink even deeper into the dream world; if you contradict her, she will only fly into a rage. You can tell her, though, that you cannot sense the things <tips=44>Siu</tips> sees and hears. Just use the same gentle words you always do.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-2:r32","rowIndex":32,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　携帯に向かって言いながらリビングルームに向かい、引き出しから『<tips=46>ネオ・ローズ</tips>』のキットをつかみ取ってバッグのなかに仕舞う。","en":"Still speaking into the phone, I entered the living room, seized the ‘<tips=46>Neo Rose</tips>’ kit from a drawer, and put it into my bag.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-2:r33","rowIndex":33,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"『……難しそうだけど、やってみる』","en":"‘...That sounds difficult, but I’ll try.’","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-2:r34","rowIndex":34,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「本人はいま恐ろしいものが見えたり、感じたりして怯えてる。もし攻撃的な態度をとっても、恐怖のせいだと考えるんだ。きみに対して悪意があるわけじゃない。……そんなことはないと思うが、もし万が一暴れて手がつけられなくなったら、人を呼び、<tips=1>亮</tips>に連絡をつけるんだ。わかったね？」","en":"“Right now she’s frightened because she sees or feels something terrifying. If she becomes aggressive, remember that it’s because she’s afraid. She doesn’t bear you any malice. ...I don’t expect it, but if she does become violent and you can’t manage her, call for help and get in touch with <tips=1>Ryo</tips>. Understood?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-2:r35","rowIndex":35,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"『うん』","en":"‘Yes.’","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-2:r36","rowIndex":36,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「じゃあ、近くについたら連絡する。そう時間はかからない」","en":"“I’ll call when I’m nearby. It won’t take long.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-2:r37","rowIndex":37,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして通話を終えると、もう出発の準備は整っている。","en":"When I ended the call, I was already prepared to leave.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-2:r38","rowIndex":38,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おれは靴を突っかけてドアを飛び出すと、鍵もかけないまま廊下を走り、もどかしくエレベーターを待つ。","en":"I shoved my feet into my shoes and burst through the door. Without even locking it, I ran down the hall and waited impatiently for the elevator.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-2:r39","rowIndex":39,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　地下一階についてエレベーターのドアが開ききるのも待てずに三分の一ドアが開いた時点で身体を横にして隙間を通り抜けると、コンクリートの駐車場だ。照明の青白い光のなか車の間をすり抜けるようにして駆け、奥のバイク置き場に行くと、最近あまり乗っていないせいで埃をかぶったカバーを取りのける。","en":"It descended to the first basement level. I could not wait for the doors to open fully; the moment a third of the space was clear, I turned sideways and slipped through into the concrete parking garage. I ran between the cars beneath the pale blue lights. At the motorcycle spaces in the back, I stripped away the dust-coated cover from a machine I had hardly ridden lately.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-2:r40","rowIndex":40,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　十七才の時にボーダー・エリアから拾って修理したそのバイクは、おれの入念な手入れによって新品のようにツヤツヤと照明を跳ね返す。","en":"I had found the motorcycle in the Border Area and rebuilt it when I was seventeen. My meticulous care made it gleam under the lights as though it were new.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-2:r41","rowIndex":41,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　バッテリーが上がっていないか不安だったが、鍵をひねると一発でエンジンがかかり、獣のうなり声のような音を立てる。","en":"I worried the battery might be dead, but one turn of the key brought the engine to life with a sound like an animal’s growl.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-2:r42","rowIndex":42,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　慌ててアクセルをフカしてしまったので、前輪が浮き上がってうっかりひっくり返りそうになる。","en":"In my haste I revved the throttle too hard. The front wheel leapt upward, and I nearly flipped the motorcycle.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-2:r43","rowIndex":43,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「くそっ！」","en":"“Damn it!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-2:r44","rowIndex":44,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おれは身体全体でなんとかバイクを押さえつけ、するとタイヤはどうにか路面をつかんでくれて、その摩擦力が推進力にかわる。","en":"I threw my whole weight over the motorcycle and somehow forced it back down. The tires caught the pavement, their friction turning into forward drive.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-2:r45","rowIndex":45,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そしておれは、深夜の街へと走り出す。","en":"Then I rode out into the midnight city.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-2:r46","rowIndex":46,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　――まったく、大変なことになった。","en":"—What an awful situation.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-2:r47","rowIndex":47,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　どうしてこんなことになった？　この間会った時にはそんな兆候は見えなかった。彼女の年齢で発症するのはそう多いことではない。……だけど、<tips=1>亮</tips>が大事な人を殺して悲しんでいたと言っていたな。そのショックが大きすぎたのか？","en":"How had it happened? When I saw her the other day, I noticed no warning signs. Onset at her age was not especially common. ...But I had been told that she was grieving because <tips=1>Ryo</tips> had killed someone dear to her. Had the shock been too great?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-2:r48","rowIndex":48,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　知り合いが発症する場面には何度も立ちあったが、やはり慣れることは出来ない。","en":"I had been there many times when someone I knew began showing symptoms, but I could never get used to it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-2:r49","rowIndex":49,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　いまは確かに『<tips=46>ネオ・ローズ</tips>』がある。でも出来ればこれは使いたくないんだ。おれはまだそれを完全に信用しきっていない。","en":"True, we had ‘<tips=46>Neo Rose</tips>’ now. Even so, I wanted to avoid using it if at all possible. I still did not trust the drug completely.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-2:r50","rowIndex":50,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　でもだからって、<tips=44>シウ</tips>をこのまま狂わせてしまうことも出来ない。","en":"But that did not mean I could simply let <tips=44>Siu</tips> go mad.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-2:r51","rowIndex":51,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おれはぎゅっと唇を噛む。","en":"I bit down hard on my lip.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-2:r52","rowIndex":52,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ごちゃごちゃとした中心街をバイクで進むのは得策じゃない。<tips=51>さくら</tips>と<tips=44>シウ</tips>がいる<tips=41>グランドタワー</tips>に向かうには少し遠回りになってしまうが、地区の外側の国道を使って向かうのが一番早いだろう。おれはこの街の道路のことなら誰よりもよく知っているんだ。","en":"Taking a motorcycle through the tangled city center was unwise. The national highway around the district’s edge would mean a slight detour, but it was still the fastest route to <tips=41>Grand Tower</tips>, where <tips=51>Sakura</tips> and <tips=44>Siu</tips> were. When it came to the roads of this city, no one knew them better than I did.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-2:r53","rowIndex":53,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　風と共に雨の粒が顔にぶつかり、まともに目を開けていられない。こんなことならゴーグルを持って来れば良かった。このまま事故でも起こしたらシャレにならない。","en":"Raindrops struck my face with the wind, making it nearly impossible to keep my eyes open. I should have brought goggles. If I crashed now, it would be no laughing matter.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-2:r54","rowIndex":54,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　街のなかでもずば抜けて背の高い<tips=41>グランドタワー</tips>は、暗い夜空にとけそうな真っ黒な巨大な壁となってそびえている。この時間でもいくつかの窓には明かりが灯り、まるで街を監視しているみたいだ。","en":"<tips=41>Grand Tower</tips> rose far above every other building in the city, a vast black wall that seemed about to dissolve into the dark sky. Even at this hour, lights shone in several windows. The building appeared to be watching the city.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-2:r55","rowIndex":55,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　思えば<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>という組織は長らくこの夜の<tips=41>グランドタワー</tips>のような存在だった。一見すると、街のあちこちにいるギャングや、たちの悪いものとあまり変わらないように見えるが、組織としてはとても強く、固く、圧倒的にそびえ立っている。その巨大な壁は外からやってくる脅威を防いでいたけれど、街の人々にも圧迫感を与えた。","en":"Come to think of it, <tips=7>YS</tips> had long been like <tips=41>Grand Tower</tips> at night. At first glance, it seemed little different from the gangs and other dangerous outfits scattered throughout the city. Yet the organization was immensely strong and solid, towering over everything around it. That colossal wall kept outside threats at bay, but it also bore down upon the people of the city.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-2:r56","rowIndex":56,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それは、<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>という個人の人格を反映しているんだろう。おれも子供の時は知らなかったが、<tips=21>八龍会</tips>の仕事などをちょくちょくこなすようになってその偉大さというか、影響力を知った。","en":"That probably reflected the character of one particular man: <tips=3>Chris Tse</tips>. I had never understood it as a child, but once I began taking the occasional job for the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips>, I came to appreciate his greatness—or rather, the extent of his influence.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-2:r57","rowIndex":57,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　あの傲慢な爺さんたちだって、相手が<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>だってことで手を出せなかった。おそれていたというだけでなく、どこか魅了されていたような気がするよ。おれは同時代じゃないからちょっとピンと来ないんだが、古い人々はみな同じような気持ちを持っているらしい。","en":"Even those arrogant old men had not dared make a move against <tips=3>Chris Tse</tips>. It felt as though they had not only feared him, but been fascinated by him as well. I had not lived through his era, so I could not quite grasp it, but all the old-timers seemed to feel much the same way.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-2:r58","rowIndex":58,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>はあとを継いで頑張ってはいるけれど、あの偉大な創業者のようにうまく行くか、どうか。――まあ、対立する立場になったおれが心配するのも滑稽だけどね。でも別に今だって、あいつのやってることに憎しみも敵意もないんだ。","en":"<tips=1>Ryo</tips> was doing his best after taking over, but whether he could do as well as that great founder was another question. Then again, it was absurd for me to worry now that I stood opposed to him. Still, even now, I felt no hatred or hostility toward what he was doing.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-2:r59","rowIndex":59,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　爺さんたちは『<tips=46>ネオ・ローズ</tips>』が手に入ったから行動を起こしたと言ったけれども、もし<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>が生きていたらあんな野望は持たなかったと思う。","en":"The Elders said they acted because ‘<tips=46>Neo Rose</tips>’ had entered their hands. But had <tips=3>Chris Tse</tips> still been alive, I doubted they would ever have conceived such ambitions.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-2:r60","rowIndex":60,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おれはその<tips=41>グランドタワー</tips>を見上げながら、<tips=51>さくら</tips>に電話をした。","en":"As I looked up at <tips=41>Grand Tower</tips>, I called <tips=51>Sakura</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-2:r61","rowIndex":61,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　きっと、これがおれが<tips=1>亮</tips>たちに友人としてしてやれる最後の手助けになるだろう。","en":"This would probably be the last thing I could do for <tips=1>Ryo</tips> and the others as their friend.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-2:r62","rowIndex":62,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　自分の場所を説明すると、ビルの上の方の窓から黒い豆粒みたいなものが飛び出したのが見える。それはもの凄い速度でこちらの方へ飛んで来たんだけれども、正確な位置がわからないのか頭上をぐるぐるとまわっている。","en":"Once I explained my position, I saw a black speck the size of a bean shoot from a window high upon the building. It flew toward me with extraordinary speed, but apparently unable to determine my exact location, it began circling overhead.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-2:r63","rowIndex":63,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おれはペンライトを手に持って両手を大きく振った。雨のなか見上げていると、雫が目や口のなかに入る。","en":"I held up a penlight and waved both arms wide. As I peered into the rain, water ran into my eyes and mouth.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-2:r64","rowIndex":64,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　相手はすぐに気がついて、ひゅんと急降下してくると目の前にすとんと着地する。","en":"The figure noticed me at once, swooped down with a whoosh, and landed lightly in front of me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-2:r65","rowIndex":65,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「格好いいな」","en":"“Cool.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-2:r66","rowIndex":66,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おれがそう笑ってみたが、","en":"I tried saying it with a smile, but—","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-2:r67","rowIndex":67,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ありがとう。きてくれて」","en":"“Thank you for coming.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"熨田さくら","displayName":"Sakura Noshida","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-2:r68","rowIndex":68,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=51>さくら</tips>は乗らず、張り詰めた表情でおれを見ている。","en":"<tips=51>Sakura</tips> did not take the bait, but only stared at me, her expression taut.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-2:r69","rowIndex":69,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　灰色のレインコートを着ているが、フードをかぶっていないせいで頭からずぶ濡れになっている。空を飛んで冷えたせいか、それとも事態に緊張しているのか、顔は青白くなっていた。杖は持っていないが、義足でしっかりと立っている。","en":"She wore a gray raincoat, but with the hood down she was drenched from the head down. Her face had gone pale, whether from the chill of flying or the tension of the situation. She carried no cane, but stood firmly on her prosthetic leg.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-2:r70","rowIndex":70,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「状態は？」","en":"“How is she?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-2:r71","rowIndex":71,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ずっとクローゼットのなかで泣いたまま何か喋ってる。変に話しかけたらいけないかなと思って、私はずっと見てたんだ……何かした方がよかったのかもしれないけど……」","en":"“She’s still in the closet, crying and talking about something. I was afraid that speaking to her the wrong way would make things worse, so I’ve only been watching... Maybe I should have done something...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"熨田さくら","displayName":"Sakura Noshida","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-2:r72","rowIndex":72,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いや、それで大丈夫だ。おれを部屋まで連れて行ってくれるかい？　それとも、薬だけ渡そうか？」","en":"“No, you did the right thing. Can you take me to her room? Or would you rather I only give you the medicine?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-2:r73","rowIndex":73,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「一緒に来て欲しい。私一人じゃ不安なの」","en":"“I want you to come with me. I’m frightened to do this alone.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"熨田さくら","displayName":"Sakura Noshida","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-2:r74","rowIndex":74,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女はそう言っておれの手を取る。","en":"With that, she took my hand.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-2:r75","rowIndex":75,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「運べるのかい？　<tips=44>シウ</tips>ちゃんみたいに軽くはないぜ」","en":"“Can you carry me? I’m not as light as <tips=44>Siu</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-2:r76","rowIndex":76,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「大丈夫。乗って」","en":"“It’s all right. Climb on.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"熨田さくら","displayName":"Sakura Noshida","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-2:r77","rowIndex":77,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　言うなり彼女はおれに背中を向けた。部屋に残して来た<tips=44>シウ</tips>が心配で、早く戻りたくて仕方がないのだ。","en":"The moment she said it, she turned her back on me. She was worried about <tips=44>Siu</tips>, whom she had left in the room, and could not bear to delay her return.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-2:r78","rowIndex":78,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　足の悪い、華奢な女の子におぶさるのはちょっと抵抗感があったけれども、躊躇している場合じゃない。ゆっくりその背中にしがみつくと、","en":"I felt a little awkward climbing onto the back of a slight girl with a bad leg, but this was no time to hesitate. I eased myself onto her back and held on.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-2:r79","rowIndex":79,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「んっ」","en":"“Nnh.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"熨田さくら","displayName":"Sakura Noshida","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-2:r80","rowIndex":80,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=51>さくら</tips>の身体は一瞬よろけて沈み込みそうになったが、次の瞬間にはふわりと浮かんでいた。","en":"<tips=51>Sakura</tips> staggered for an instant, and her body seemed about to sink. The next moment, however, we floated gently upward.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-2:r81","rowIndex":81,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「すごいな」","en":"“Incredible.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-2:r82","rowIndex":82,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　と思わず言ってしまうくらい、宙に浮くというのは不思議な感覚だった。","en":"The sensation of floating in midair was so strange that the word slipped out before I could stop it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-2:r83","rowIndex":83,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「しっかり掴まってて」","en":"“Hold on tight.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"熨田さくら","displayName":"Sakura Noshida","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-2:r84","rowIndex":84,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女がそう言ったかと思うと、おれたちは急上昇をした。","en":"The instant she spoke, we shot upward.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-2:r85","rowIndex":85,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　まるでジェットコースターのようなスピードだ。しかも、ジェットコースターと違ってレールもなにもないのである。その手の乗り物が苦手なおれにとっては、これ以上怖いものもない。そもそも高いところが苦手なのだ。股間の辺りがどうもキュンキュンとする。背中がぞくぞくとする。加速で引き剥がされそうになるのを、必死で彼女にしがみついてなんとかこらえる。","en":"We were moving at roller-coaster speed, except that unlike a roller coaster, we had no rails beneath us. For someone like me, who hated those rides and heights to begin with, nothing could have been more terrifying. My groin kept twinging, and shivers ran up my spine. As the acceleration threatened to tear me away, I clung to her for dear life and somehow held on.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-2:r86","rowIndex":86,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　身体が硬直するおれの目の前を<tips=41>グランドタワー</tips>の窓が凄い勢いで下に流れてゆく。足元を見れば遠ざかる地面が見えてしまうだろう。","en":"As my body went rigid, the windows of <tips=41>Grand Tower</tips> streamed downward before my eyes. If I looked below, I would see the ground dropping away beneath my feet.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-2:r87","rowIndex":87,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そちらの方に視線をやらないように、上だけを見つめることにした。","en":"I decided to keep my eyes fixed overhead so they would not stray in that direction.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-2:r88","rowIndex":88,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そしてビルの大分上の方まで来るとベランダがあって、<tips=51>さくら</tips>はその手すりをこえて内側に着地する。","en":"When we reached a point fairly high up the building, we came to a balcony. <tips=51>Sakura</tips> cleared its railing and landed inside.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-2:r89","rowIndex":89,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　白いテーブルと椅子が置かれた広めのベランダである。こんな高いところにあるベランダで快適に過ごせるものなのだろうか。","en":"It was a broad balcony furnished with a white table and chairs. Could anyone possibly relax upon a balcony at such a height?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-2:r90","rowIndex":90,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「大丈夫？　顔が真っ青だよ？」","en":"“Are you all right? Your face has gone completely pale.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"熨田さくら","displayName":"Sakura Noshida","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-2:r91","rowIndex":91,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　背中から降りて床に足をつくと、ふらりと身体が揺れて<tips=51>さくら</tips>を心配させてしまった。","en":"When I slid off her back and set my feet on the floor, I swayed badly enough to alarm <tips=51>Sakura</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-2:r92","rowIndex":92,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「へ、平気だよ。少し冷えただけだ」","en":"“I-I’m fine. I just got a little chilled.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-2:r93","rowIndex":93,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おれは強がって笑って見せる。","en":"I put on a brave smile for her.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-2:r94","rowIndex":94,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「で、<tips=44>シウ</tips>ちゃんはどこかな？」","en":"“So, where is <tips=44>Siu</tips>?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-2:r95","rowIndex":95,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……こっち」","en":"“...This way.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"熨田さくら","displayName":"Sakura Noshida","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-2:r96","rowIndex":96,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おれは<tips=51>さくら</tips>の案内に従ってガラスの扉から部屋に足を踏み入れる。","en":"Following <tips=51>Sakura</tips>, I stepped through a glass door into the apartment.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-2:r97","rowIndex":97,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そこは広いリビングルームで、照明に照らされた部屋のなかは明るかった。家庭的な温かみのあるその柔らかな光は、あちこちに飾られた兎や猫の置物や、家具の上に敷かれた色鮮やかなクロスなどを照らし出し、普段だったらとても可愛らしい女の子の部屋だと思えるのだろうが、今は壁紙の一部が剥がれたり、床の上に割れたティーカップなどが散乱したりと、可愛らしさを台無しにするミスマッチな光景が同居している。","en":"It opened into a broad living room, brightly lit from above. Ordinarily, the soft light with its domestic warmth, the rabbit and cat figurines decorating the room, and the vivid cloths laid across the furniture would have made this seem an exceedingly sweet, girlish apartment. Now, however, part of the wallpaper hung torn from the wall, broken teacups lay scattered over the floor, and the mismatch destroyed its charm.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-2:r98","rowIndex":98,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「これも彼女が？」","en":"“Did she do this too?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-2:r99","rowIndex":99,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そう、壁の中に誰かいるとか、壁の模様が動くとか、そんなことを言って……」","en":"“Yes. She said someone was inside the wall, that the patterns on it were moving, and things like that...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"熨田さくら","displayName":"Sakura Noshida","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-2:r100","rowIndex":100,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なるほどね」","en":"“I see.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-2:r101","rowIndex":101,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=44>シウ</tips>はここで一暴れしたあと、寝室に駆け込んでクローゼットで泣いているのだそうだ。","en":"Sakura told me that after her outburst here, <tips=44>Siu</tips> had run into the bedroom and was now crying in the closet.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-2:r102","rowIndex":102,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おれは<tips=51>さくら</tips>のあとをついて、その部屋に足を踏み入れる。","en":"I followed <tips=51>Sakura</tips> into the room.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-2:r103","rowIndex":103,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　部屋の中には大きなベッドが一つ、電灯の明るい光でその布団のピンクの鮮やかさが目に染みる。","en":"A large bed stood inside. Beneath the bright electric light, the vivid pink of its covers hurt my eyes.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-2:r104","rowIndex":104,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その右手の壁の全面がクローゼットになっている。ドアは取っ手を横に引っ張るとくの字に折りたたまれながら開く――折れ戸と言うんだっけ？　あの形状のもので、今はぴったりと閉まっていた。","en":"The closet occupied the entire wall to the right. Pulling sideways upon its handles folded the doors into an angled shape as they opened... Were they called bifold doors? Whatever the name, they were presently shut tight.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-2:r105","rowIndex":105,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そしてその閉まったドアのなかから、<tips=44>シウ</tips>の声が聞こえるのだが、くぐもっていて、何と言っているかよくわからない。時々笑い声が混じって、なんだか明るい様子でひたすらブツブツと呟いている。","en":"From behind the closed door came <tips=44>Siu’s</tips> voice, too muffled for me to make out the words. She muttered on and on, laughter breaking through every so often, and sounded strangely cheerful.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-2:r106","rowIndex":106,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=44>シウ</tips>ちゃん」","en":"“<tips=44>Siu</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-2:r107","rowIndex":107,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おれが呼びかけると、その声はぴたりと止まった。","en":"The voice stopped the moment I called.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-2:r108","rowIndex":108,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=10>見土</tips>だ。<tips=44>シウ</tips>ちゃんの調子がちょっと悪いみたいだから、様子を見に来たんだ。……何か頭のなかで声が聞こえたりしてるんじゃないか？　だからそこに閉じこもってるんだろう？　頭のなかが賑やかすぎて落ち着かないからね。そういうことっておれたち<tips=17>タイプB</tips>にはよくあるんだ」","en":"“It’s <tips=10>Mido</tips>. I heard you haven’t been doing so well, <tips=44>Siu</tips>, so I came to check on you. …You’re hearing some kind of voice in your head, aren’t you? That’s why you’ve shut yourself in there, right? Your head is so noisy that you can’t settle down. That sort of thing happens to us <tips=17>Type Bs</tips> all the time.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-2:r109","rowIndex":109,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おれは近くの棚の上にバッグを置き、注射の用意をしながらそう話しかける。<tips=66>コンタ</tips>みたいに手際よくは出来ないが、やり方は知っている。","en":"As I spoke, I placed my bag upon a nearby shelf and prepared the injection. I was not as deft as <tips=66>Konta</tips>, but I knew the procedure.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-2:r110","rowIndex":110,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そんな狭いところによく入り込んだね。いつもと違うから不安かもしれないけど、そんなところにいたら身体を悪くしちゃうかもしれない。出て来なよ。おれ、<tips=44>シウ</tips>ちゃんの顔見たいな」","en":"“I’m impressed you managed to squeeze into such a small space. You may feel anxious because things aren’t as usual, but staying somewhere like that might make you sick. Come on out. I want to see your face, <tips=44>Siu</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-2:r111","rowIndex":111,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　呼びかけた後、少し待ったが彼女は返事をしない。","en":"After calling out to her, I waited a moment, but she did not answer.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-2:r112","rowIndex":112,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　薬剤の用意が出来た注射器を<tips=51>さくら</tips>に手渡し、おれはクローゼットに近づく。","en":"Once the syringe was prepared, I handed it to <tips=51>Sakura</tips> and approached the closet.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-2:r113","rowIndex":113,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……いい薬を持って来たんだ。開けるよ？」","en":"“...I brought some excellent medicine. I’m going to open the door, all right?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-2:r114","rowIndex":114,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして戸の取っ手に手をかけたとき、中で<tips=44>シウ</tips>が声をあげた。","en":"When I placed my hand upon the handle, <tips=44>Siu</tips> raised her voice inside.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-2:r115","rowIndex":115,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「薬なんかいらない！」","en":"“I don’t need any medicine!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-2:r116","rowIndex":116,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　はっきりした大きな声である。","en":"The words were loud and clear.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-2:r117","rowIndex":117,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そんなの必要ないわ！　だって、何にも悪いところなんかないんですもの。悪いけど、<tips=10>見土</tips>さんは帰って下さい。私は大丈夫ですから」","en":"“I don’t need anything like that! There’s nothing wrong with me. I’m sorry, but please go home, <tips=10>Mr. Mido</tips>. I’m perfectly fine.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-2:r118","rowIndex":118,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「気持ちはわかるけど、そういうわけにはいかないんだな」","en":"“I understand how you feel, but I’m afraid I can’t do that.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-2:r119","rowIndex":119,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おれは言って、戸を開ける。","en":"With that, I opened the door.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-2:r120","rowIndex":120,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　するとすぐ目の前に、膝小僧を抱えてパジャマ姿で小さく座っている<tips=44>シウ</tips>がいた。","en":"<tips=44>Siu</tips> sat immediately before me in her pajamas, curled into a small figure with her knees clasped to her chest.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-2:r121","rowIndex":121,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女は目だけを動かしておれの方を見る。その瞳は金色に輝いている。頬は紅く染まっている。呼吸も少し荒いようで、肩が上下している。","en":"Only her eyes moved as she looked at me. They shone gold. Her cheeks were flushed, and her breathing appeared somewhat rough, making her shoulders rise and fall.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-2:r122","rowIndex":122,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「随分興奮してるじゃないか。部屋をメチャメチャにしたみたいじゃないか。<tips=51>さくら</tips>ちゃんも驚いてたよ」","en":"“You’re awfully worked up. It looks like you made a mess of the room. You startled <tips=51>Sakura</tips> too.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-2:r123","rowIndex":123,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おれはそう言って笑いかけた。","en":"I smiled as I spoke.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-2:r124","rowIndex":124,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「別にどうってことないんです。馬おじさんが私の様子を見に来て、<tips=24>美美</tips>ちゃんが私に会いたがってるって言うから……。可愛い女の子が生まれたんですよ？　本当に可愛くて、ほら、そこで笑ってる。ずっと……うふふ」","en":"“It’s nothing at all. Uncle Ma came to check on me and said <tips=24>Meimei</tips> wanted to see me... A darling little girl was born, you know? She’s truly adorable. Look, she’s laughing right there. All this time... heehee.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-2:r125","rowIndex":125,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=44>シウ</tips>は抑揚のない早口で言うと、何もない空間を指さして笑っている。","en":"<tips=44>Siu</tips> spoke rapidly without inflection, then pointed into empty space and laughed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-2:r126","rowIndex":126,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「残念だが、おれにはその子は見えないな」","en":"“I’m sorry, but I can’t see her.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-2:r127","rowIndex":127,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「何でそんなこと言うんですか？　いるじゃないですか？　嘘ばっかりついて……」","en":"“Why would you say that? She’s right there, isn’t she? You keep telling lies...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-2:r128","rowIndex":128,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=44>シウ</tips>は眉間に怪訝そうなしわを寄せておれを見た。","en":"<tips=44>Siu</tips> looked at me, a puzzled crease forming between her brows.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-2:r129","rowIndex":129,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ああ、もう、お兄ちゃんはうるさい！」","en":"“Oh, Brother, be quiet!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-2:r130","rowIndex":130,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　急にそっぽを向いたかと思うとそう怒鳴り、","en":"She suddenly turned away and shouted.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-2:r131","rowIndex":131,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いやんなっちゃう！　お兄ちゃんが、さっきからずっと私に変なことをしようとするんです。いやらしい……」","en":"“I can’t stand it! My brother has been trying to do strange things to me all this time. It’s disgusting...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-2:r132","rowIndex":132,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=44>シウ</tips>ちゃん。そんなこと言ったら、<tips=1>亮</tips>が悲しむよ。きみのことを一番よく考えてくれてる人じゃないか」","en":"“<tips=44>Siu</tips>. Saying that would make <tips=1>Ryo</tips> sad. No one thinks more about what’s best for you than he does.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-2:r133","rowIndex":133,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「違うわ！　ああ、そうなんですね。<tips=10>見土</tips>さんも、お兄ちゃんと同じことしようとしに来たんだ。あっちへ行って下さい！」","en":"“That’s not true! Oh, I understand now. You’ve come to do the same thing as my brother, haven’t you, <tips=10>Mr. Mido</tips>? Go away!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-2:r134","rowIndex":134,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=44>シウ</tips>は興奮して足を蹴り出し、おれを追い払おうとする。","en":"Growing agitated, <tips=44>Siu</tips> kicked at me to drive me away.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-2:r135","rowIndex":135,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ちがうよ。<tips=44>シウ</tips>ちゃん。きみはいま体調が悪くて、普段と違う感じになっている。それをおさえるために薬を……」","en":"“No, <tips=44>Siu</tips>. You aren’t feeling well right now, and that makes everything feel different from usual. I brought medicine to suppress it...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-2:r136","rowIndex":136,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いやっ！　やめてっ！　こないでっ！　いつもそんなことばっかり！」","en":"“No! Stop! Don’t come near me! You always do this!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-2:r137","rowIndex":137,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=44>シウ</tips>はすっかり錯乱してしまっている。これは注射を納得させるのは難しそうだ。","en":"<tips=44>Siu</tips> was completely beside herself. There seemed little chance of talking her into the injection.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-2:r138","rowIndex":138,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おれは溜息をつくと、彼女ににじり寄った。","en":"I sighed and edged toward her.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-2:r139","rowIndex":139,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「な、何っ、何をするの？」","en":"“W-what? What are you going to do?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-2:r140","rowIndex":140,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女は涙を溜めた目をおれに向ける。その顔は恐怖にひきつっている。","en":"She stared at me through tear-filled eyes, her face twisted with fear.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-2:r141","rowIndex":141,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　こうなってしまっては、力づくで注射をするしかない。おれは自分にスイッチをいれる。すると、鼓動が早くなり、身体がかあっと熱くなる。おれの目は今<tips=44>シウ</tips>と同じ金色に染まっているだろう。","en":"At this point, I had no choice but to give her the injection by force. I switched myself on. My heartbeat accelerated, and heat flared through my body. My eyes had probably turned the same gold as <tips=44>Siu’s</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-2:r142","rowIndex":142,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして彼女の腕をつかんだ。","en":"Then I seized her arm.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-2:r143","rowIndex":143,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いやあっ！　人殺しっ！　殺されるーっ！」","en":"“No! Murderer! He’s going to kill me!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-2:r144","rowIndex":144,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　叫んでジタバタと手足を暴れさせる彼女を床の上にうつぶせに押さえつける。","en":"She screamed and thrashed her arms and legs, but I forced her facedown upon the floor.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-2:r145","rowIndex":145,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「失礼」","en":"“Excuse me.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-2:r146","rowIndex":146,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　相手の耳にはこちらの言葉は届いていなそうだったが、一応そう言ってから指先を彼女のパンツのゴムに引っかけ、パジャマのズボンと一緒にずり下ろす。すると、白い尻が照明の下に現れる。","en":"She did not seem to hear me, but I said it anyway, then hooked my fingers under the waistband of her underwear and pulled it down together with her pajama bottoms. Her pale buttocks came into view beneath the light.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-2:r147","rowIndex":147,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「やめてっ！　やめてええっ！」","en":"“Stop! Stooop!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-2:r148","rowIndex":148,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=44>シウ</tips>は凄い勢いで暴れる。この状態で針を刺すのはさすがに危ない。","en":"<tips=44>Siu</tips> struggled with tremendous force. In that condition, inserting a needle would have been dangerous.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-2:r149","rowIndex":149,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おれは柔道の袈裟固めに少し似た押さえつけ方で、彼女の上に乗っている。この体勢だと下側になった者が無理に暴れても体力を消費するばかりなのだが、発症した<tips=17>タイプB</tips>の体力は無尽蔵だ。暴れる彼女の上で、まるでロデオのようになっている。","en":"I straddled her and held her down with something like a judo scarf hold. In this position, anyone underneath who struggled by brute force would only exhaust themselves—but the stamina of a <tips=17>Type B</tips> after onset was inexhaustible. With her thrashing beneath me, it was like a rodeo.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-2:r150","rowIndex":150,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=44>シウ</tips>は尻を出しながらバタバタと暴れて近くにあったゴミ箱などを蹴り飛ばす。<tips=78>金目</tips>状態になった<tips=17>タイプB</tips>のキックは猛烈なもので、ゴミ箱はもの凄いスピードですっ飛んで向こうの壁にぶつかり中身を派手にまき散らした。","en":"Her buttocks still exposed, <tips=44>Siu</tips> thrashed and kicked a wastebasket and other nearby objects aside. A kick from a <tips=17>Type B</tips> in the <tips=78>gold-eyed</tips> state was ferocious. The wastebasket flew at extraordinary speed, struck the far wall, and scattered its contents in a spectacular mess.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-2:r151","rowIndex":151,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しばらくそうしていると、ようやく体力が限界に近づいたのか、彼女は徐々に大人しくなる。","en":"After this went on for a while, perhaps her stamina was finally nearing its limit, because she gradually quieted down.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-2:r152","rowIndex":152,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「はあ……はあ……」","en":"“Hah... hah...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-2:r153","rowIndex":153,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　観念したのか、荒い息をつきながらぐったりとしている。パジャマがしっとりとして、彼女の全身が汗まみれになっているのを感じる。","en":"Perhaps she had resigned herself. She lay limp, breathing heavily. Her pajamas had grown damp, and I could feel that her entire body was covered in sweat.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-2:r154","rowIndex":154,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おれは少し体勢を変えて、片手を<tips=51>さくら</tips>の方に伸ばした。すると成り行きを見守っていた彼女はすぐに察して、注射器を手渡してくれる。","en":"I shifted my position slightly and held one hand out toward <tips=51>Sakura</tips>. She had been watching the whole struggle and understood at once, handing me the syringe.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-2:r155","rowIndex":155,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おれは場所を何度も確認してから、臀部への筋肉注射を行った。","en":"After checking the injection site several times, I gave her an intramuscular injection in the buttock.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-2:r156","rowIndex":156,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　針を刺した瞬間彼女の身体はぴくっと震えたが、もう暴れ出すことはなかった。","en":"Her body twitched when the needle entered, but she did not begin struggling again.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-2:r157","rowIndex":157,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「もう終わったよ」","en":"“All done.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-2:r158","rowIndex":158,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おれは彼女の身体の上から離れると、ズボンを直してやる。","en":"I climbed off her body and pulled her clothes back into place.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-2:r159","rowIndex":159,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　けれども<tips=44>シウ</tips>はそのままの姿勢でぐったりとして動かない。ちょっと心配になって顔を見ると、まぶたを最大まで見開いた彼女と目が合ってぎょっとした。てっきり目を閉じていると思ったからだ。","en":"But <tips=44>Siu</tips> remained limp and motionless in the same position. Growing a little worried, I looked at her face—and recoiled when I met her gaze, her eyelids stretched as wide as they would go. I had assumed her eyes were closed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-2:r160","rowIndex":160,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いやあ、なんだかすさまじい顔をしているねえ」","en":"“Goodness, that’s quite a face you’re making.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-2:r161","rowIndex":161,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おれは笑って、汗と涙でぐちゃぐちゃになった彼女の顔に張り付いた髪を指先で横に追いやって、その綺麗な顔が全部出るようにしてやる。","en":"I smiled and brushed the hair plastered to her face by sweat and tears off to one side, uncovering her beautiful face.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-2:r162","rowIndex":162,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……何の注射を打ったんですか？」","en":"“...What did you inject?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"熨田さくら","displayName":"Sakura Noshida","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-2:r163","rowIndex":163,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「落ち着く薬だよ。……具体的に言うと、<tips=17>タイプB</tips>発症時の諸症状を抑える薬だ。少し休んでいれば、普段通りに戻る。もっとも、今の<tips=44>シウ</tips>ちゃんには自分が普段どんなだったか思い出せないかもしれないけど」","en":"“Something to calm you down. ...More specifically, it’s a drug that suppresses the symptoms of a <tips=17>Type B</tips> onset. Get some rest and you’ll be back to normal. Although right now, <tips=44>Siu</tips>, you may not remember what normal feels like.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-2:r164","rowIndex":164,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=44>シウ</tips>は答えない。じっとおれを見ている。おれの言葉がどの程度理解出来たかはわからないが、もう暴れるつもりはないようだ。","en":"<tips=44>Siu</tips> did not answer. She stared fixedly at me. I could not tell how much of my explanation she understood, but she no longer seemed inclined to struggle.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-2:r165","rowIndex":165,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして彼女は手を床につき、立ち上がろうとしたが、よろよろとして倒れそうになる。おれはそれを腕で支えて、","en":"She put her hands on the floor and tried to stand, but swayed and nearly fell. I caught her with one arm.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-2:r166","rowIndex":166,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「疲れてるんだ。セーブ出来ないで力を出し切っちゃったからね。ベッドで少し横になろう。一眠りしたら世界が良くなっているから」","en":"“You’re exhausted. You burned through all your strength because you couldn’t hold back. Let’s get you into bed. Once you’ve had some sleep, the world will look better.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-2:r167","rowIndex":167,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おれはそして彼女を抱え上げ、ベッドの上に降ろした。すると、<tips=51>さくら</tips>がその身体に布団を掛けてくれる。","en":"I lifted her into my arms and laid her on the bed. <tips=51>Sakura</tips> pulled the covers over her.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-2:r168","rowIndex":168,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「もう大丈夫だよ。私たちを信じて」","en":"“Everything is all right now. Trust us.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"熨田さくら","displayName":"Sakura Noshida","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-2:r169","rowIndex":169,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=51>さくら</tips>は真剣な顔でそう語りかける。","en":"With a serious expression, <tips=51>Sakura</tips> spoke to her.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-2:r170","rowIndex":170,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=44>シウ</tips>はうつろな目で<tips=51>さくら</tips>をぼんやり眺めたあと、静かにまぶたを閉じた。","en":"<tips=44>Siu</tips> gazed hazily at <tips=51>Sakura</tips> through vacant eyes for a moment, then quietly closed them.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-2:r171","rowIndex":171,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「よし、もう向こうに行こう」","en":"“All right. Let’s go into the other room.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-2:r172","rowIndex":172,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=44>シウ</tips>が穏やかな寝息を立てたのを確認してから、おれは<tips=51>さくら</tips>に小声でそう囁く。","en":"Once I heard <tips=44>Siu’s</tips> breathing settle into the gentle rhythm of sleep, I whispered to <tips=51>Sakura</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-2:r173","rowIndex":173,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「さっきの注射は、どれくらいで効いてくるの？」","en":"“How long will that injection take to work?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"熨田さくら","displayName":"Sakura Noshida","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-2:r174","rowIndex":174,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女は小声でそう返す。","en":"She whispered in reply.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-2:r175","rowIndex":175,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「早ければ五分、遅くとも三十分くらいだな。一回効けば二週間はもつ。……さあ、出よう。彼女はもう大丈夫。寝てる間に、きみに教えたいことがあるんだ」","en":"“As little as five minutes, but no more than thirty. Once it takes effect, it’ll last two weeks. ...Come on, let’s go. She’s all right now. While she sleeps, there’s something I want to tell you.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-2:r176","rowIndex":176,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おれは名残惜しそうにする<tips=51>さくら</tips>を促してドアの方へゆくと、","en":"I coaxed the reluctant <tips=51>Sakura</tips> toward the door, then said,","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-2:r177","rowIndex":177,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「おやすみ」","en":"“Good night.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B4-2:r178","rowIndex":178,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　照明を落とし、ドアを閉めた。","en":"I turned off the light and closed the door.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}}]},{"position":47,"code":"X11","unitId":"X11","rows":[{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r1","rowIndex":1,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=9>Y地区</tips>の歴史にはいくつかの転換点がある。","en":"The history of <tips=9>Y District</tips> has several turning points.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r2","rowIndex":2,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　たとえば<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>結成の日。そしてその盟主<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>の死の日も間違いなくその一つに数え上げられるであろうし、その息子<tips=1>謝亮</tips>が<tips=81>龍頭</tips>となった日も他の日と区別する必要があるだろう。","en":"For example, the day <tips=7>YS</tips> was founded. The day its leader, <tips=3>Chris Tse</tips>, died would unquestionably be counted among them, and the day his son, <tips=1>Tse Leung</tips>, became <tips=81>Longtou</tips> must likewise be set apart from all other days.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r3","rowIndex":3,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そしてその日、新たにもう一つの転換点が生まれようとしていた。","en":"And on that day, one more turning point was about to be born.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r4","rowIndex":4,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　朝からこの街特有の雨が降り続き、<tips=57>滑走路通り</tips>や教会通りといったメインストリートにはカラフルな傘の花が咲き乱れ、裏通りに張り巡らされた未舗装の路地はぬかるんでいた。","en":"The rain so characteristic of this city had been falling since morning. Colorful umbrellas bloomed like flowers along main thoroughfares such as <tips=57>Runway Street</tips> and Church Street, while the web of unpaved back alleys had turned to mud.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r5","rowIndex":5,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　街の中心地から少し離れた<tips=6>国立巻河原病院</tips>の、長い年を経てくすんだ色のコンクリートの外壁にも糸のような雨が蕭々と降り付けていた。","en":"Fine threads of rain swept mournfully against the concrete outer walls of <tips=6>National Makigawara Hospital</tips>, a little way from the city center—walls dulled by the passage of many years.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r6","rowIndex":6,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　患者たちの何人かはぼんやりと窓辺に立ち、外の景色を見る。","en":"Several patients stood at the windows, gazing blankly outside.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r7","rowIndex":7,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"『<tips=6>タイプＢ収容所</tips>』という悪名で知られるこの病院の周辺には、雑木林とまばらな民家があった。人はあまり通らないが、たまに通りかかると、患者は手を振ったりする。あるいはほんの少ししか開かない窓を開けて呼びかけたりする。彼は、何の面識もない通行人を、最愛の家族や、にっくき仇敵と思い込んでしまう時があるのだ。","en":"Around the hospital, notorious as the ‘<tips=6>Type B Internment Center</tips>,’ lay patches of mixed woodland and a scattering of houses. Few people passed by, but when someone did, a patient might wave—or force open a window that gave only a narrow crack and call out. Sometimes they mistook a complete stranger for a beloved family member or a hated enemy.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r8","rowIndex":8,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　高い塀の奥にあるこの病棟の小さな窓から手を振られても気がつく通行人はほとんどいないが、叫び声ならば聞こえることもある。一聴すれば正気から出たものではないとすぐわかるその調子外れの声に、大抵のものは肩をすくめて早足で通り過ぎる。","en":"Almost no passerby noticed a hand waving from one of the ward’s small windows beyond the high wall, though they might hear a shout. One listen to the strange cadence of the voice was enough to know it had not come from a sane mind, and most people merely shrugged and hurried on.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r9","rowIndex":9,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　看護師やヘルパーといった身のまわりの世話をする職員は、気づけばそれをたしなめるが、忙しければ気がつかないことも多い。","en":"If a nurse, assistant, or other member of the care staff noticed, they admonished the patient. Often, however, they were too busy to notice at all.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r10","rowIndex":10,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その日三階の女子病棟では月に一度の誕生会の日で、その月に生まれた患者たちを祝うため、ホールでは職員たちが準備を行っていた。","en":"That day, the third-floor women’s ward was holding its monthly birthday party, and the staff were preparing the hall to celebrate the patients born that month.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r11","rowIndex":11,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その目の前で窓を開けて叫び出したものだから、職員はすぐに気がついてやめさせた。","en":"Then, right in front of them, someone opened a window and began shouting, so the staff noticed at once and put a stop to it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r12","rowIndex":12,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　こういったイベントのある日は、患者たちはどこかそわそわとして普段と違った行動を取るものだ。","en":"On days with events like this, the patients tended to become restless and behave differently from usual.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r13","rowIndex":13,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　午前だけで廊下で便失禁をするものが二人も出て、昼食時には普段むせたことのない患者が喉に食事を詰まらせて、吸引処置を行ったりもした。","en":"Two patients had already lost control of their bowels in the corridor that morning. At lunch, a patient who had never choked before got food caught in her throat and had to be suctioned.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r14","rowIndex":14,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　イベントの準備に加えてこういったトラブルが続出するものだから、職員たちはほとんどてんてこ舞いである。","en":"With one mishap after another on top of the party preparations, the staff were almost beside themselves.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r15","rowIndex":15,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　いっそ、誕生会などはもうとりやめよう、あるいは減らそうという意見も少なくはないのだが、変化のない毎日を送る患者たちにとっては数少ない楽しみであり、それを奪いたくないという職員たちの声が反対意見を上回ったので今も続けられている。","en":"There were plenty who argued that perhaps birthday parties should be abolished, or at least held less often. But they were one of the few pleasures available to patients whose days otherwise never changed, and the voices of staff unwilling to take that pleasure away outweighed the objections. Thus the parties continued.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r16","rowIndex":16,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　栄養科も特別に小さなケーキを用意してくれており、十五時のおやつの時間にそれを食べることになっていた。","en":"The dietetics department had even prepared small cakes for the occasion, to be eaten at three o’clock with the afternoon snack.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r17","rowIndex":17,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　いつもと同じ、代わり映えのない一日。みんなそのように思っていた。","en":"Another day just like all the rest, with nothing to distinguish it. That was what everyone thought.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r18","rowIndex":18,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その日この病院に襲い掛かる悲劇について、この時点で想像出来たものは一人もいない。","en":"At this point, no one could have imagined the tragedy that would befall the hospital that day.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r19","rowIndex":19,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=47>八龍解放軍</tips>のメンバーは１４時に病院から少し離れた雑居ビルの一室に集結していた。","en":"At two that afternoon, the members of the <tips=47>Hachiryu Liberation Army</tips> assembled in a room of a mixed-use building a short distance from the hospital.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r20","rowIndex":20,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そこは今はもう営業をしていない不動産屋の事務所で、オフィス用の灰色の机や椅子は壁際に積み重ねられている。そのかわりにぽっかりと空いた空間で、彼らは床に座り込んで武器の点検を行ったり、興奮剤の『ピーク』を服用したりしていた。手にしているのは旧共産圏で生産された拳銃や、自動小銃である。この街の裏流通は全て<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>の幹部<tips=31>エリー・ホワイト</tips>の監視下にあったが、これらの武器は<tips=65>ヘス</tips>が独自のルートを用いて彼女に感知されぬよう入手したものである。あの老人はそのようなことまで出来るのかと、<tips=21>八龍会</tips>の人々は彼への評価と警戒を同時に高めることになった。","en":"The room had once housed a real-estate agency, now out of business. Gray office desks and chairs were stacked against the walls, leaving a broad empty space where the members sat on the floor, checking their weapons and taking doses of the stimulant Peak. They carried pistols and automatic rifles made in the former Eastern Bloc. Every channel of illicit trade in the city was monitored by <tips=31>Ellie White</tips>, a senior <tips=7>YS</tips> officer, but <tips=65>Hess</tips> had obtained these weapons through a private route without alerting her. That the old man could manage even this raised the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips> members’ estimation of him—and their wariness in equal measure.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r21","rowIndex":21,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　さて、隊長である<tips=10>見土道夫</tips>は、自分の準備は既に終えて隊員たちと談笑をしていた。","en":"<tips=10>Michio Mido</tips>, the commander, had already finished his own preparations and was chatting with his troops.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r22","rowIndex":22,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼の態度はいつも通り朗らかで、緊張の色もなく、とてもこれから荒事を行おうとしている人間のようには見ない。昔からの顔見知りばかりの隊員たちを相手に軽口を叩いたりしている。","en":"As always, he was cheerful. There was no sign of tension in him; he hardly looked like a man preparing for violence. He traded jokes with the members, nearly all old acquaintances.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r23","rowIndex":23,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　どうやら彼は緊張している隊員を見つけては自分から話しかけているようで、今この場での自分の仕事を仲間たちの気持ちをほぐすことだと心得ているらしい。","en":"Whenever he noticed someone looking nervous, he seemed to make a point of going over and striking up a conversation. He saw his job here as putting his companions at ease.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r24","rowIndex":24,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=47>八龍解放軍</tips>に組み込まれているのは、元々肩で風を切って繁華街を歩いていたようなちんぴらや、『<tips=46>ネオ・ローズ</tips>』によって正気を取り戻したものの受け入れられる場所がないつまはじき者ばかりで、暴力沙汰に耐性があるものばかりだったが、そうではないものもいる。","en":"Most of the <tips=47>Hachiryu Liberation Army’s</tips> ranks consisted of petty thugs who had once swaggered through the downtown entertainment district or outcasts who had regained their senses through <tips=46>Neo Rose</tips> but had nowhere that would accept them. Nearly all were accustomed to violence. But there were exceptions.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r25","rowIndex":25,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　街で暮らす<tips=17>タイプB</tips>のために身体を張ろうという意識を持って志願した青年や、少年の頃に<tips=10>道夫</tips>のグループで仲間だった若者たちである。彼らは顔見知り同士、二人か三人ずつ集まって無言で軽食をとったり、道具を点検したりと思い思いの形で準備の作業を行っていた。","en":"Some were young men who had volunteered to put themselves on the line for the <tips=17>Type Bs</tips> living in the city. Others had belonged to <tips=10>Michio’s</tips> group as boys. They gathered silently with familiar faces in twos or threes, eating light meals or inspecting equipment, each preparing in his own way.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r26","rowIndex":26,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼らは、犯罪者やそれに類するアウトローたちと一緒くたになってしまうのに抵抗があるようだ。","en":"They seemed uncomfortable being lumped together with criminals and similar outlaws.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r27","rowIndex":27,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=10>道夫</tips>は隊員間の溝のようなものを多少気にしてはいたが、そのための特別なことはしなかった。いずれ共に活動を行ってゆくうちに解消されるだろうと考えていた。少年の頃彼は敵対する様々なグループを吸収したが、その時もそうやって彼らをまとめ上げた。","en":"<tips=10>Michio</tips> was somewhat concerned by the divide among his troops, but did nothing special to bridge it. He assumed it would disappear as they continued working together. As a boy, he had absorbed various hostile groups into his own, and that was how he had united them then.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r28","rowIndex":28,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　トップに立つものが適切なリーダーシップを発揮して雰囲気良く組織を運営すれば、いがみ合っているものたちも自然と一致団結するようになるというのが彼の考え方だった。","en":"He believed that if the person at the top showed sound leadership and kept morale high, even people at one another’s throats would naturally close ranks.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r29","rowIndex":29,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　少年時代も、彼はこの体験から学んだ組織論を口にしたことがある。","en":"Back when he was a boy, he had once put into words the theory of organization he had drawn from that experience.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r30","rowIndex":30,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そりゃ、お前は人柄で他人を引っ張るタイプだからね。どこででも通用するもんじゃないよ」","en":"“That’s because you’re the sort who leads people by force of personality. It won’t work everywhere.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r31","rowIndex":31,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　やはり少年だった<tips=1>謝亮</tips>などは、<tips=10>道夫</tips>の意見に対し、おもしろくもなさそうに言ったものだ。","en":"<tips=1>Tse Leung</tips>, also still a boy at the time, had replied to <tips=10>Michio’s</tips> theory with an unmistakably unimpressed air.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r32","rowIndex":32,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"（まあでも、案外通用するものだぜ）","en":"(Well, it works better than you’d think.)","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r33","rowIndex":33,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=10>道夫</tips>は当時を思い出し、そう心中で呟いた。","en":"<tips=10>Michio</tips> thought, remembering those days.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r34","rowIndex":34,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　今この部屋に集まっているのは<tips=10>道夫</tips>を含めて十七人。ほぼ準備は出来てはいたが、あと二人が作戦に参加することになっていたので、それを待っていた。","en":"Seventeen people, <tips=10>Michio</tips> included, had assembled in the room. They were almost ready, but two more participants were expected, and so they waited.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r35","rowIndex":35,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　あの<tips=65>ヘス</tips>老人が用意したサイキックの助っ人を、<tips=67>カミラ</tips>が迎えに行っている。","en":"<tips=67>Camilla</tips> had gone to collect the psychic <tips=65>Hess</tips> had arranged to send as reinforcement.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r36","rowIndex":36,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　もう集合時刻を過ぎていたが、助っ人の準備が手間取っており、あと十五分ほど遅れると連絡があった。","en":"The appointed hour had already passed. Word came that the reinforcement’s preparations were taking longer than expected and they would be about fifteen minutes late.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r37","rowIndex":37,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　たとえば軍隊だったら、作戦の最初からこんな形で時間がずれるというのはあり得ないことだろうが、その点彼らはおおらかだった。","en":"In an army, perhaps, a delay from the very beginning of an operation would have been inconceivable. They, however, took it in stride.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r38","rowIndex":38,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そもそも作戦計画自体が、それほど緻密に決められたものではない。ギャングたちがよくやる”カチコミ”や、不良少年が喧嘩を仕掛ける時と大差のないもので、おおまかな役割分担と目標が定められているだけだった。","en":"The operation itself had never been planned with much precision. It scarcely differed from the raids gangs commonly launched or a fight started by juvenile delinquents. Only broad objectives and divisions of labor had been established.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r39","rowIndex":39,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　軍事顧問として<tips=23>エリオット</tips>を招聘するのに失敗した<tips=47>八龍解放軍</tips>は、<tips=10>道夫</tips>が不良少年たちを率いていたのと同じやりかたで運営されていたのである。隊員の素性などを考えても、ほとんど愚連隊と言って良い集団だった。","en":"Having failed to recruit <tips=23>Elliott</tips> as a military adviser, the <tips=47>Hachiryu Liberation Army</tips> was run in the same fashion as the band of delinquents <tips=10>Michio</tips> had once led. Considering the backgrounds of its members as well, it could fairly be called a roughneck crew.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r40","rowIndex":40,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=10>道夫</tips>も充分にそのことを認識していた。が、彼がもっとも不安に思っていたのはそれではない。","en":"<tips=10>Michio</tips> understood that perfectly well. Yet it was not what troubled him most.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r41","rowIndex":41,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=67>カミラ</tips>たちを待つ間に意外な人物がドアを開けて入って来た。","en":"While they waited for <tips=67>Camilla</tips> and the others, an unexpected visitor opened the door and walked in.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r42","rowIndex":42,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　腕に銀色のアクセサリーをじゃらじゃらとつけている、目の細い若者だ。<tips=59>暗闇通り</tips>にいくつも営業している女性向けの飲食店で働いていそうなこの青年は、<tips=66>田中紺太</tips>であった。","en":"He was a narrow-eyed young man, his arms jangling with silver jewelry. He looked as though he worked at one of the many establishments catering to women on <tips=59>Darkness Street</tips>. His name was <tips=66>Konta Tanaka</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r43","rowIndex":43,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「や、やあ」","en":"“H-hey.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"田中紺太","displayName":"Konta Tanaka","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r44","rowIndex":44,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=66>紺太</tips>は<tips=10>道夫</tips>の近くまで歩いてくると、気まずそうにしながらそう挨拶をした。","en":"<tips=66>Konta</tips> walked over to <tips=10>Michio</tips> and offered the awkward greeting.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r45","rowIndex":45,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「やっぱりおれも今日参加するよ。仲間たちだけに危険なことをさせるってのは、気がひけるからね……」","en":"“I’ve decided I’m coming today after all. Letting everyone else do something dangerous while I stay behind... it doesn’t sit right with me.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"田中紺太","displayName":"Konta Tanaka","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r46","rowIndex":46,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうか」","en":"“I see.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫","displayName":"Michio Mido","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r47","rowIndex":47,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=10>道夫</tips>は笑っただけで、それ以上は何も聞かなかった。","en":"<tips=10>Michio</tips> merely smiled and asked nothing more.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r48","rowIndex":48,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　あらかじめ連絡で聞いた通りの時間に<tips=67>カミラ</tips>たちはやって来る。","en":"<tips=67>Camilla</tips> and the others arrived exactly when they had said they would.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r49","rowIndex":49,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　立て付けの悪いドアをギイと押し開けて入って来た<tips=67>カミラ</tips>の後ろから、ちょこんと姿を現したのは、<tips=10>道夫</tips>の予想通りいつか<tips=22>老人たち</tips>の家の前で出会ったあの美しい少女であった。","en":"<tips=67>Camilla</tips> pushed open the ill-fitting door with a creak. Behind her, a slight figure appeared: the beautiful girl <tips=10>Michio</tips> had once encountered outside the <tips=22>Elders</tips>’ house, exactly as he had expected.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r50","rowIndex":50,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　はっと息をのむほど艶やかな金色の髪に黒いレインコート。あの時は裸足だったが、今日は編み上げのブーツを履いている。そして<tips=10>道夫</tips>を見上げるその瞳は、金色に輝いていた。前に見た時は青色だったが、あのときはカラーコンタクトをしていたのかもしれない。","en":"Glossy golden hair beautiful enough to steal one’s breath spilled over a black raincoat. She had been barefoot before, but today wore lace-up boots. The eyes that looked up at <tips=10>Michio</tips> shone gold. They had been blue when he last saw her; perhaps she had been wearing colored contacts then.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r51","rowIndex":51,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"（やはり、この子が<tips=41>グランドタワー</tips>を襲撃し、<tips=51>さくら</tips>ちゃんと戦ったサイキックなんだろうか……）","en":"(So this really is the psychic who attacked <tips=41>Grand Tower</tips> and fought <tips=51>Sakura</tips>...?)","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r52","rowIndex":52,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　こうして面と向かっていると、とてもそんな恐ろしいサイキックだとは思えない。","en":"Face-to-face with her, he could hardly believe she was such a terrifying psychic.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r53","rowIndex":53,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　少女は部屋のあちこちにいる大人たちを気にして、あたりをきょろきょろと見回している。テレポーテーション少女は<tips=41>グランドタワー</tips>を一人で血の海に変えたそうだが、この少女に出来るのだろうか？","en":"The girl kept glancing nervously around at the adults scattered throughout the room. The teleporting girl had supposedly turned <tips=41>Grand Tower</tips> into a sea of blood all by herself. Could this girl truly have done it?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r54","rowIndex":54,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「この子かい？」","en":"“Is this her?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫","displayName":"Michio Mido","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r55","rowIndex":55,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「はい」","en":"“Yes.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"カミラ","displayName":"Camilla","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r56","rowIndex":56,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=10>道夫</tips>の問いかけに<tips=67>カミラ</tips>は頷いた。","en":"<tips=67>Camilla</tips> nodded in answer to <tips=10>Michio’s</tips> question.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r57","rowIndex":57,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　黒髪と黒い目をもつ彼女はいつも通り緊張感のあるきつい表情をして彼の前に立っている。","en":"Black-haired and black-eyed, she stood before him wearing the same taut, severe expression as always.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r58","rowIndex":58,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「こう見えて、経験豊かな凄腕の殺し屋だそうです」","en":"“She may not look it, but I’m told she’s an experienced, first-rate assassin.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"カミラ","displayName":"Camilla","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r59","rowIndex":59,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「殺し屋ねえ。そんな言葉を聞いたのも、実物を見るのも初めてだよ。思ったのとは大分違うな……ねえ」","en":"“An assassin, huh? I’ve never even heard the word used in real life, let alone met one. You’re nothing like I imagined... Hey.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫","displayName":"Michio Mido","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r60","rowIndex":60,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=10>道夫</tips>は少女の前にかがみ込むと、そう声をかけた。","en":"<tips=10>Michio</tips> crouched in front of the girl as he spoke.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r61","rowIndex":61,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　少女は表情のない顔で<tips=10>道夫</tips>を見る。","en":"The girl regarded <tips=10>Michio</tips> without expression.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r62","rowIndex":62,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「きみとは一度会ったことがあるね。……名前は？」","en":"“We’ve met once before. ...What’s your name?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫","displayName":"Michio Mido","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r63","rowIndex":63,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女は一旦そっぽを向いてからひとりで頷く。","en":"She looked away, then nodded once to herself.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r64","rowIndex":64,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"（幻聴が聞こえているのか？　てことは、発症してるんじゃないか？）","en":"(Is she hearing voices? Then are her symptoms active?)","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r65","rowIndex":65,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=10>道夫</tips>が眉をひそめると、彼女はまたこちらに視線を戻し、","en":"When <tips=10>Michio</tips> frowned, she returned her gaze to him.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r66","rowIndex":66,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……<tips=62>まりあ</tips>」","en":"“...<tips=62>Maria</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"マリア","displayName":"Maria","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r67","rowIndex":67,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　と、ピンク色の唇を小さく動かしてそう言った。","en":"Her pink lips moved slightly as she gave the answer.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r68","rowIndex":68,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=62>マリア</tips>ちゃんて言うのか。よろしくね」","en":"“<tips=62>Maria</tips>, is it? Nice to meet you.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫","displayName":"Michio Mido","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r69","rowIndex":69,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=10>道夫</tips>が笑いかけても、彼女は返事をしない。","en":"Even when <tips=10>Michio</tips> smiled at her, she did not respond.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r70","rowIndex":70,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そのかわりに、手をあげて人差し指で<tips=10>道夫</tips>の顔を指さすと、","en":"Instead, she raised one hand and pointed at <tips=10>Michio’s</tips> face,","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r71","rowIndex":71,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「うそつき！」","en":"“Liar!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"マリア","displayName":"Maria","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r72","rowIndex":72,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　と言った。","en":"she declared.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r73","rowIndex":73,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「何で嘘つきなんだよ？」","en":"“Why am I a liar?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫","displayName":"Michio Mido","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r74","rowIndex":74,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「うそをおしえた。えびをなか……なんとかって言った」","en":"“You taught Maria a lie. You called shrimp... naka... something.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"マリア","displayName":"Maria","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r75","rowIndex":75,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「おいおい」","en":"“Come on.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫","displayName":"Michio Mido","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r76","rowIndex":76,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=10>道夫</tips>は苦笑する。","en":"<tips=10>Michio</tips> gave a wry smile.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r77","rowIndex":77,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「知り合いだったんですか？」","en":"“You knew one another?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"カミラ","displayName":"Camilla","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r78","rowIndex":78,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=67>カミラ</tips>は意外そうに首を捻った。","en":"<tips=67>Camilla</tips> tilted her head in surprise.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r79","rowIndex":79,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いや、一度街で見かけたことがあってね。そのとき少し話したんだ」","en":"“No, I happened to see her around town once. We spoke for a moment then.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫","displayName":"Michio Mido","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r80","rowIndex":80,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=10>道夫</tips>は立ち上がる。すると、その顔を指さしていた<tips=62>マリア</tips>の腕も連動するように上がる。","en":"<tips=10>Michio</tips> stood up, and <tips=62>Maria’s</tips> arm rose with him as though linked to his movement, her finger still pointed at his face.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r81","rowIndex":81,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「しかし、大丈夫なのかね」","en":"“Still, are you sure about this?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫","displayName":"Michio Mido","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r82","rowIndex":82,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「腕は確かだそうですよ」","en":"“I’m told she knows what she’s doing.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"カミラ","displayName":"Camilla","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r83","rowIndex":83,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうは見えないな。随分自由な感じじゃないか。この調子でちゃんとおれたちと一緒にやれるんだろうか……」","en":"“She doesn’t look it. She seems awfully free-spirited. Can she really work properly with us when she’s like this...?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫","displayName":"Michio Mido","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r84","rowIndex":84,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「シンパイいらない」","en":"“No need to worry.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"マリア","displayName":"Maria","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r85","rowIndex":85,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=62>マリア</tips>はそこでやっと手を下ろし、","en":"At last <tips=62>Maria</tips> lowered her hand.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r86","rowIndex":86,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「かみさまがタスけろと言った。うそつきもたすけてやる」","en":"“God said to help. Maria will help the liar too.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"マリア","displayName":"Maria","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r87","rowIndex":87,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　無表情のままそう言い放った。","en":"She delivered the words without expression.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r88","rowIndex":88,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=10>道夫</tips>たちが採用した作戦は、実にシンプルなものだった。","en":"The plan <tips=10>Michio</tips> and the others had settled on was simplicity itself.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r89","rowIndex":89,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　襲撃の目標である病院は高いコンクリートの塀に囲まれており、出入り口は正門と裏門があったが、彼らはどちらも使わない。","en":"The hospital they meant to attack was enclosed by a high concrete wall. It had a front gate and a rear gate, but they would use neither.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r90","rowIndex":90,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　病院の西側の塀に穴を開け、そこから突入し、なかで人員を分けて病院の各所を制圧してゆくという手はずになっている。","en":"They would cut an opening through the wall on the hospital’s western side, enter there, then divide their forces and seize control of the grounds section by section.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r91","rowIndex":91,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　塀に穴を開けるのは、爆薬でもドリルでもなく<tips=10>道夫</tips>のサイキック能力である。彼の何でも切断する能力を用いることで、音もなくコンクリートの塀はくりぬかれ、警備員たちを騒がせることなく侵入することが出来るという寸法だ。","en":"They would breach the wall not with explosives or a drill, but with <tips=10>Michio’s</tips> psychic ability. His power to sever anything would let him cut through the concrete without a sound and get them inside without alerting the guards.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r92","rowIndex":92,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　病院にも警備員は居たが、彼らは患者の離院を防ぐためのもので、当然ながらこのような武装集団の襲撃に対応することは出来ない。武器も精々が警棒だのさすまただのを振り回す程度のものである。ただ彼らの通報によって警察が駆けつけるまでの時間を稼ぐために、少しでも気づかれるのを遅らせたかった。","en":"The hospital did employ guards, but their job was to keep patients from leaving; naturally, they were in no position to repel an armed assault. Their weapons amounted to little more than batons and man-catchers. Even so, the attackers wanted to delay discovery as long as possible and buy time before the guards could alert the police.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r93","rowIndex":93,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　雨の降りしきるなか、一行は二台のワゴンに分乗して病院の裏側につける。普段は幼稚園の送迎用として園児たちを運んでいる、うさぎやねこのイラストが書かれた可愛らしい車のなかで、武装した人相の悪い男たちが金色の目をぎらぎらさせている姿はいかにも異様であった。","en":"Through the pouring rain, the party split between two vans and drove to the rear of the hospital. Ordinarily used to ferry kindergarten children, the cute little vehicles were decorated with pictures of rabbits and cats. Inside, rough-looking armed men sat with golden eyes gleaming. The sight could hardly have been stranger.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r94","rowIndex":94,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　三階病棟のFという四十代の女性患者は、いつも一人窓辺に佇んで、外を眺める習慣があった。","en":"F, a female patient in her forties on the third-floor ward, habitually stood alone at the window and watched the world outside.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r95","rowIndex":95,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女は、その停車するところを見ていた。そして車から男たちがぞろぞろと降りるところも目の当たりにしていたが、普段とかわらぬぼんやりとした表情で、特別変化を見せない。","en":"She watched the vans stop and the men file out, yet showed no particular reaction; her expression remained as blank as ever.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r96","rowIndex":96,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　もし彼女がこの時点で職員に異常を報告していたら、事態の結末は少しは変化していたかもしれない。しかし彼女はそんなことよりも、男たちが腕にくくりつけた敵味方を識別するための赤いスカーフがヒラヒラと揺れるのに心を奪われていた。","en":"Had she reported the anomaly to the staff at that moment, the outcome might have changed, at least a little. But the fluttering red scarves tied around the men’s arms so they could tell friend from foe captivated her far more.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r97","rowIndex":97,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　突入は、まず別働隊による電話線の切断によって開始される。別働隊は<tips=10>道夫</tips>の本隊が定位置に到着するより前に、別の場所にある電柱のそばに待機している。彼らは電線工事の業者を装っており、警備員に偽装したものが何食わぬ顔で通行人の交通整理なども行った。そして到着のしらせを受けると、ツナギ姿の隊員が電柱によじのぼり、解体屋から借りて来たケーブルカッターで病院へと繋がる電話線を切断するのだ。","en":"The incursion began when a separate team cut the telephone lines. They were already waiting beside a utility pole elsewhere before <tips=10>Michio’s</tips> main force reached its position. Disguised as electrical workers, they even had a man dressed as a guard blandly directing passing traffic. When word of the main force’s arrival came, a member in coveralls climbed the pole and used cable cutters borrowed from a demolition contractor to sever the telephone line leading to the hospital.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r98","rowIndex":98,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　これと同時に<tips=10>道夫</tips>たちは突入を開始する。その真っ黒な右手をあらわにし、コンクリートの塀に当て、少し気合いを込めるとピシリと小さな音がする。肉眼ではその切れ目が見えないが、それだけで手を中心にした上下五十センチほどの塀が切断されている。角度と位置を変えて数度同じように繰り返し、まず腕一本通るほどの小さな輪を作ると、ゆっくりと向こうに押し込んだ。","en":"At the same moment, <tips=10>Michio’s</tips> group began its entry. He exposed his pitch-black right hand, pressed it against the concrete wall, and concentrated slightly. A faint crack sounded. No cut could be seen with the naked eye, but the wall had been cut for roughly fifty centimeters vertically, centered on his hand. After repeating this several times at different angles and positions, he cut a small circle just wide enough for an arm and slowly pushed the plug through to the other side.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r99","rowIndex":99,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　くりぬかれたコンクリートのかたまりは、ゴトリと鈍い音を立てて壁の向こう側の土の上に落ちる。","en":"The severed lump of concrete fell onto the earth beyond the wall with a dull thud.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r100","rowIndex":100,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そうして出来た穴の周りに<tips=10>道夫</tips>は手を当て、さっきと同じような作業を繰り返す。","en":"<tips=10>Michio</tips> then pressed his hand against the wall around the hole and repeated the same process as before.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r101","rowIndex":101,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それが済むと、力自慢が最初の穴に腕を突っ込んで、ゆっくり引っ張る。すると、人一人が通れるくらい大きく塀がくりぬかれているのがわかる。","en":"Once that was done, one of the stronger men thrust an arm through the first hole and pulled slowly. A section of wall large enough for a person to pass through came free.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r102","rowIndex":102,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それを音を立てぬように数人で抱えながら床の上に引き倒す。","en":"Several men held it so that it made no noise as they lowered it to the ground.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r103","rowIndex":103,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=62>マリア</tips>の空間移動能力を使えばもっと手っ取り早く侵入出来ていたろうが、あまり連携がとれておらず、本人も言い出さなかった。","en":"<tips=62>Maria’s</tips> spatial-translocation ability could have brought them inside far more quickly, but they coordinated poorly and she never suggested it herself.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r104","rowIndex":104,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼らはその穴を通って病院の裏庭に足を踏み入れる。<tips=10>道夫</tips>を先頭に、女だてらに突入隊に加わった<tips=67>カミラ</tips>がそのあとに続く。","en":"They passed through the opening and entered the hospital’s rear garden. <tips=10>Michio</tips> led; <tips=67>Camilla</tips> followed directly behind him, joining the entry force despite being a woman.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r105","rowIndex":105,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=62>マリア</tips>は一番後ろから集団についてゆく。","en":"<tips=62>Maria</tips> brought up the rear of the group.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r106","rowIndex":106,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　夜は警備装置が働いて誰かが侵入するだけで病院内の管理室に自動的に通知が行く仕掛けになっていたが、日中は職員などが通行する際の誤動作を避けるためにオフにされていた。<tips=10>道夫</tips>たちはそれを知っていたので、この白昼堂々の強襲になった。","en":"At night, a security system automatically notified the control room when anyone entered the grounds. During the day it was disabled to prevent false alarms as staff came and went. <tips=10>Michio’s</tips> people knew this, which was why they launched their assault in broad daylight.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r107","rowIndex":107,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　この時点では<tips=10>道夫</tips>には職員を殺傷したり、危害を与えるつもりはなかった。あくまでも目標は患者の解放である。病院内に侵入して部隊を展開させたあとは、武器を見せれば職員は容易に従う予定だった。その上で患者たちに『<tips=46>ネオ・ローズ</tips>』を投与してゆけば、彼らは自我を取り戻し、本来の人生に戻るだろう。","en":"At this point, <tips=10>Michio</tips> had no intention of killing or injuring the staff. His sole objective was to liberate the patients. Once they were inside and had deployed their forces, the staff were expected to submit at the sight of their weapons. They would then administer <tips=46>Neo Rose</tips> to the patients, who would regain their sense of self and return to the lives they were meant to lead.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r108","rowIndex":108,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　丸腰のまま、銃を持った集団に逆らうものなどいるだろうか。<tips=10>道夫</tips>としてはうまく行けば無血での目標達成も見込めるだろうと考えていた。","en":"Who would defy a group with guns while unarmed? <tips=10>Michio</tips> believed that, if all went well, they might even achieve their objective without bloodshed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r109","rowIndex":109,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　だがその目論見は、侵入した直後に潰えることとなる。","en":"That hope was dashed the moment they entered.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r110","rowIndex":110,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　裏庭に足を踏み入れたあとは三つの班に分かれて病院の各所を制圧に向かった。<tips=10>道夫</tips>は<tips=66>紺太</tips>、<tips=62>マリア</tips>を含む六人の仲間と共に管理棟の方向へ足を進める。","en":"Once inside the rear garden, they divided into three teams and set off to seize different parts of the hospital. <tips=10>Michio</tips> advanced toward the administration building with six companions, including <tips=66>Konta</tips> and <tips=62>Maria</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r111","rowIndex":111,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　降りしきる雨の粒は小さく変化していて、霧雨のように視界を白っぽく煙らせていた。","en":"The falling rain had grown finer, turning to a drizzle that smoked the air white and blurred their vision.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r112","rowIndex":112,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　裏庭から病棟の脇をぐるりまわって管理棟へ向かう彼らの足元は泥土となってぬかるみ、一歩あるくたびに茶色い飛沫がはねて、みなズボンの膝の上まで汚してしまっている。病院の建物から建物へ、コンクリートの舗装路が蜘蛛の糸のように張り巡らされているのは、この土地の土質がこのような柔らかいものだからに違いない。","en":"They circled around the ward building from the rear garden toward administration. The earth underfoot had turned to mire, and every step sent brown mud splashing up until all their trousers were stained above the knees. Concrete paths linked the hospital buildings like a spiderweb, surely because the local soil was so soft.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r113","rowIndex":113,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　なるべく不必要な職員との遭遇を避けるために迂回しながら管理棟へ向かったのだが、その目前まで来れば全く誰とも出会わないわけにはいかなかった。","en":"They took a roundabout route toward administration to avoid unnecessary encounters with staff, but as they approached the building, avoiding contact altogether proved impossible.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r114","rowIndex":114,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　丁度管理棟から人が出て来る場面に出くわしてしまう。","en":"They arrived just as several people emerged.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r115","rowIndex":115,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　紺色の制服を着た警備員らしい男と、白髪だらけの年老いた男女。患者の見舞いに来た老夫婦といったところだろうか。","en":"One was a man in a dark blue uniform, apparently a guard. The others were an elderly, gray-haired man and woman—perhaps a married couple visiting a patient.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r116","rowIndex":116,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼らは入り口のところの屋根の下で、何事か会話を交わしていたが、すぐに不審な集団がそばに居ることに気がついた。","en":"They had been talking beneath the entrance canopy, but soon noticed the suspicious-looking group nearby.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r117","rowIndex":117,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あなたたちは……」","en":"“Who are you...?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r118","rowIndex":118,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　言いかけた警備員の前で、<tips=10>道夫</tips>は拳銃を抜き一歩前に進み出る。","en":"Before the guard could finish, <tips=10>Michio</tips> drew his pistol and stepped forward.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r119","rowIndex":119,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼は職員たちを殺すのではなく、銃で脅して最初の人質にしたかったのだが、その場には彼の意向を気にしない人間がいた。","en":"He wanted to threaten the staff at gunpoint and make them his first hostages, not kill them. But someone there paid no heed to his wishes.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r120","rowIndex":120,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=10>道夫</tips>が口を開くよりも早く、金髪の少女はぽんとジャンプをする。","en":"Before <tips=10>Michio</tips> could open his mouth, the blond girl made a small leap.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r121","rowIndex":121,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　次の瞬間、警備員の上半身がなくなって、かわりに金髪の少女がそこにあらわれていた。ということは、警備員の身体は少女の居た場所に移動したということになる。なんの前触れもなく、目の前に血を噴く人間の身体が現れたわけだから、隊員たちの混乱といったらない。口々に驚きの言葉を上げながら返り血を浴びることになる。","en":"The next instant, the guard’s upper body vanished and the blond girl appeared in its place. That meant his body had been transported to where she had been standing. With no warning, a human body spraying blood materialized before the members’ eyes, throwing them into utter confusion. They cried out as the blood spattered over them.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r122","rowIndex":122,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「やめろ！」","en":"“Stop!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r123","rowIndex":123,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　さすがの<tips=10>見土道夫</tips>は他の隊員たちのように取り乱すことなく、<tips=62>マリア</tips>に鋭い声を投げかけたが、それは彼女の殺意を制止するには至らなかった。","en":"Unlike the other members, <tips=10>Michio Mido</tips> did not lose his head. He barked the command at <tips=62>Maria</tips>, but it failed to stop her killing.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r124","rowIndex":124,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　二度、三度、彼女が瞬きながら移動をするたび、老夫婦たちの身体はバラバラになって宙を舞い、管理棟の玄関先には大量の血液と内臓がまき散らされる。見るものみなを戦慄させる、一瞬の惨劇であった。","en":"Twice, then three times, she vanished and reappeared in a blink. The elderly couple’s bodies came apart and flew through the air, spraying the administration entrance with a mass of blood and entrails. In a single instant, a horrifying spectacle unfolded before them.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r125","rowIndex":125,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　全身血みどろになった少女はもう動くものがないのをざっと見回すと、","en":"Drenched head to foot in blood, the girl swept her eyes around for anything still moving.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r126","rowIndex":126,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「こい」","en":"“Come,”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"マリア","displayName":"Maria","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r127","rowIndex":127,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　と<tips=10>道夫</tips>たちに呼びかけた。","en":"she called out to <tips=10>Michio</tips> and the others.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r128","rowIndex":128,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「おい、いきなり仕掛けて貰っちゃ困るじゃないか」","en":"“Hey, you can’t simply attack without warning us.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫","displayName":"Michio Mido","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r129","rowIndex":129,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=10>道夫</tips>は駆け足で<tips=62>マリア</tips>に近づくと、管理棟の中の人々に気づかれぬよう小声で言った。","en":"<tips=10>Michio</tips> hurried over to <tips=62>Maria</tips> and spoke under his breath so no one inside the administration building would overhear.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r130","rowIndex":130,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なにが？　このひとたちはテキだよ？」","en":"“Why? These people are enemies.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"マリア","displayName":"Maria","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r131","rowIndex":131,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=62>マリア</tips>は怪訝な顔をする。","en":"<tips=62>Maria</tips> looked genuinely puzzled.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r132","rowIndex":132,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「むやみやたらに殺して貰ったら困る。こっちはこっちで作戦があるんだ」","en":"“You can’t kill everyone indiscriminately. We have an operation to carry out.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫","displayName":"Michio Mido","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r133","rowIndex":133,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=10>道夫</tips>が厳しい顔で言い放つと、<tips=62>マリア</tips>は顔をくちゃくちゃに歪め、","en":"When <tips=10>Michio</tips> answered sternly, <tips=62>Maria’s</tips> face crumpled.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r134","rowIndex":134,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なんで？　テキをたおしたのにどうしておこってる……」","en":"“Why? Maria defeated the enemy. Why are you angry...?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"マリア","displayName":"Maria","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r135","rowIndex":135,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　雨で濡れているにもかかわらずそうとわかる大粒の涙がポロポロとこぼれる。","en":"Great tears, visible even through the rain upon her face, began to fall.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r136","rowIndex":136,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どうしたらいいかオシエテ？　かみさまがおまえをてつだえと言った。<tips=62>マリア</tips>なんでも言ってくれないとわからない……」","en":"“Tell me what I’m supposed to do. God said to help you. <tips=62>Maria</tips> won’t know unless you tell her everything...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"マリア","displayName":"Maria","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r137","rowIndex":137,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　これには<tips=10>道夫</tips>も面食らってしまう。","en":"This took even <tips=10>Michio</tips> aback.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r138","rowIndex":138,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　見かけと違う冷酷無比の殺人マシーンかと思えば、これではまるっきり見かけ通りの童女じゃないか。","en":"He had taken her for a merciless killing machine hidden behind a child’s appearance, but she was exactly what she looked like: a little girl.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r139","rowIndex":139,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「とにかく、指示を出すまでは何もしないでくれ。能力を使わず、おれたちのあとをついて来るんだ」","en":"“For now, do nothing until I give you an order. Don’t use your ability. Just follow us.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫","displayName":"Michio Mido","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r140","rowIndex":140,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……わかった」","en":"“...All right.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"マリア","displayName":"Maria","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r141","rowIndex":141,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=62>マリア</tips>は俯くと、いじけたように足元に転がる誰かの指を蹴飛ばした。","en":"<tips=62>Maria</tips> lowered her head and sulkily kicked aside someone’s finger lying at her feet.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r142","rowIndex":142,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「しかし、ひどい有様だな」","en":"“What a mess.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫","displayName":"Michio Mido","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r143","rowIndex":143,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=10>道夫</tips>は辺りを見回して溜息をつく。","en":"<tips=10>Michio</tips> sighed and looked around.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r144","rowIndex":144,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　バラバラになった人体がメチャクチャに散らばり、むっとするような血の臭いと、排泄物の臭いが鼻をつく。酸鼻という他ない。","en":"Pieces of dismembered bodies lay strewn everywhere. The cloying reek of blood and the stench of excrement filled the air. The scene was nothing short of ghastly.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r145","rowIndex":145,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=10>道夫</tips>君。あいつ、とんでもないガキだね」","en":"“<tips=10>Michio</tips>. That kid is unbelievable.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"田中紺太","displayName":"Konta Tanaka","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r146","rowIndex":146,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　いつの間にか近くに来ていた<tips=66>紺太</tips>が真っ青な顔でそう囁く。","en":"<tips=66>Konta</tips> had come up beside him unnoticed and whispered, his face deathly pale.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r147","rowIndex":147,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「こいつはきっと、<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>を襲撃したというサイキックだよ。一人で<tips=41>グランドタワー</tips>に乗り込んで百戦錬磨のギャングたちを大量に殺し、大幹部の<tips=39>ジェフリー・ウォン</tips>の命まで奪ったというのも、このすさまじい能力なら頷ける話だ。……全く、敵じゃなくてよかったよ」","en":"“She must be the psychic who attacked <tips=7>YS</tips>. They say she entered <tips=41>Grand Tower</tips> alone, slaughtered a great many battle-hardened gangsters, and even took the life of senior officer <tips=39>Jeffrey Wong</tips>. With a power this terrible, I can believe it. ...Thank God she isn’t our enemy.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"田中紺太","displayName":"Konta Tanaka","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r148","rowIndex":148,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=10>道夫</tips>は苦い顔で首を振った。","en":"<tips=10>Michio</tips> shook his head grimly.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r149","rowIndex":149,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　世にも恐ろしい力を持つこの少女は確かに今は味方だ。しかしいつまでもそうとは限らない。","en":"For the moment, the girl with this terrifying power was indeed an ally. There was no guarantee she would remain one.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r150","rowIndex":150,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　マリアは<tips=10>道夫</tips>に対してこのように従うのは<tips=65>ヘス</tips>の指示があったというそれだけの理由であるに違いない。「かみさま」と言ったのが<tips=65>ヘス</tips>のことを意味するのかどうかはわからないが、とにかく、もし<tips=65>ヘス</tips>が自分たちを殺せと命じたら、この少女は躊躇なくそれを実行するはずだ。<tips=65>ヘス</tips>が持っていたあの縛られた患者の写真も、きっとこの<tips=62>マリア</tips>の能力で忍び込んで撮影したものだろう。","en":"The only reason Maria obeyed <tips=10>Michio</tips> like this had to be that <tips=65>Hess</tips> had instructed her to. There was no way to know whether the “God” she had spoken of meant <tips=65>Hess</tips>, but in any case, if <tips=65>Hess</tips> ordered her to kill them, the girl would surely carry it out without hesitation. As for that photograph <tips=65>Hess</tips> had of the bound patient, <tips=62>Maria</tips> had probably used her power to sneak into the hospital and take it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r151","rowIndex":151,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"『<tips=46>ネオ・ローズ</tips>』の秘密を独占し、これほど強力なサイキックを使いこなす<tips=65>ヘス</tips>というものは何者なのか。最終的な目標はなんなのか。その正体を正確に突き止めなければ、<tips=21>八龍会</tips>に災いが降りかかるように思う。いや、もう足を片一方踏み込んでいるのかもしれない。","en":"Who was this man <tips=65>Hess</tips>, who monopolized the secret of ‘<tips=46>Neo Rose</tips>’ and commanded a psychic this powerful? What was his ultimate goal? Unless they learned exactly who he was, disaster seemed certain to befall the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips>. No—perhaps they had already stepped halfway into it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r152","rowIndex":152,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=10>道夫</tips>は少し考えたが、今はそれに思い巡らしている場合ではない。","en":"<tips=10>Michio</tips> considered the question briefly, but this was no time to dwell upon it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r153","rowIndex":153,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　仲間を振り返り、次の指示を出そうと振り返ると、隊員たちは断裂した警備員の死体を取り囲んでなにか話し合っている。","en":"He turned to issue his next orders and found the members gathered around the severed body of the guard, talking among themselves.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r154","rowIndex":154,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どうした？」","en":"“What is it?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫","displayName":"Michio Mido","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r155","rowIndex":155,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=10>道夫</tips>が近づいて話しかけると、","en":"<tips=10>Michio</tips> approached them.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r156","rowIndex":156,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「隊長。これを見てくれよ……」","en":"“Commander. Look at this...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r157","rowIndex":157,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　無精ひげの隊員が、一丁の拳銃を<tips=10>道夫</tips>の前に差し出した。","en":"An unshaven member held out a pistol to <tips=10>Michio</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r158","rowIndex":158,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「これがどうしたんだい？」","en":"“What about it?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫","displayName":"Michio Mido","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r159","rowIndex":159,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「これ、おれたちのじゃねえんだ。よく見なよ。血に濡れてるだろう？　……こいつ、銃で武装してやがったんだよ」","en":"“It isn’t one of ours. Look closely. See the blood on it? ...This bastard was armed.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r160","rowIndex":160,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「えっ」","en":"“What?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫","displayName":"Michio Mido","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r161","rowIndex":161,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=10>道夫</tips>は思わず絶句する。","en":"<tips=10>Michio</tips> was momentarily lost for words.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r162","rowIndex":162,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「胸元が変に膨らんでるからさ、調べてみたらこいつが入ってやがったんだ」","en":"“There was a strange bulge under his jacket, so I checked—and found this tucked inside.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r163","rowIndex":163,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　銃で武装しているとは全く予想外だった。ということは見かけ通りのただの警備員ではなく、警察か何かが化けた姿なのかもしれない。","en":"They had never expected him to carry a gun. Perhaps he was no ordinary guard at all, but a police officer or someone similar in disguise.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r164","rowIndex":164,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「これってさ、ここの患者が逃げ出したり反抗をしたら、場合によっては射殺するつもりだったってことなんだろ？　ひでえ話じゃねえか。今時、他に、そんな扱いをうける患者なんかいるか？」","en":"“That means if one of the patients tried to escape or fight back, he was ready to shoot them, doesn’t it? That’s monstrous. Who treats patients that way anymore?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r165","rowIndex":165,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　隊員は怒りを顔に浮かべてそう言った。他の隊員たちも、同じような怒りを共有しているらしい。","en":"The member’s face showed his anger. The others appeared to share it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r166","rowIndex":166,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"（この調子じゃ、流血を避けるなんてのは夢のまた夢だな……）","en":"(At this rate, avoiding bloodshed is nothing but a pipe dream...)","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r167","rowIndex":167,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=10>道夫</tips>は困ったように頭をポリポリと掻いてから、","en":"<tips=10>Michio</tips> scratched his head uneasily, then said,","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r168","rowIndex":168,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どういうつもりで拳銃を所持しているのかはわからんが、被害が出る前に武装していることがわかったのは僥倖だ」","en":"“I don’t know why he was carrying a pistol, but it’s a stroke of luck we found out they were armed before any of us were hurt.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫","displayName":"Michio Mido","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r169","rowIndex":169,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そしてすぐに無線で他のチームにも連絡をし、警戒を呼びかけた。","en":"He immediately used the radio to warn the other teams.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r170","rowIndex":170,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　病院には常時、三、四人の警備員がいるらしいが、他の者たちもみな銃で武装していると考えるべきだろう。さらに言えば、拳銃よりも強力な武器が存在する可能性もある。","en":"The hospital apparently kept three or four guards on duty. They would have to assume that every one of them was armed. There might also be weapons more powerful than handguns.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r171","rowIndex":171,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　この情報が共有されることで、病院の職員はただの無力な一般市民ではなく、脅威をもった敵として全ての隊員に認識されることとなった。","en":"Once that information had been shared, every member ceased to see the hospital staff as helpless civilians and began to regard them as dangerous enemies.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r172","rowIndex":172,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　つまり、もはや殺戮は避けられないということである。","en":"In other words, slaughter could no longer be avoided.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r173","rowIndex":173,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　さて、新たな緊張と共に<tips=10>道夫</tips>たちはすぐに次の行動に移った。","en":"With this new tension hanging over them, <tips=10>Michio</tips> and the others immediately moved on to the next phase.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r174","rowIndex":174,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　目の前の管理棟こそ彼らの目的の場所だ。呼吸を合わせると勢いよくドアを開けて中になだれ込む。","en":"The administration building before them was their objective. Moving together, they threw open the door and poured inside.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r175","rowIndex":175,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　入ってすぐは待合室になっており、左側の壁に小さな窓口がある。","en":"Immediately beyond the entrance was a waiting room, with a small service window in the left wall.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r176","rowIndex":176,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そのとき窓口にいたのは奥山という二十五才の女性職員で、ここに勤めてからまだ半年しか経っていなかった。専門学校を出て一旦アパレル企業で働いたものの、肌が合わずに医療事務の資格をとってここに就職したのである。","en":"The woman at the window was a twenty-five-year-old employee named Okuyama, only six months into her work there. After graduating from vocational school, she had taken a job with an apparel company, found that it did not suit her, earned a qualification in medical administration, and joined the hospital.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r177","rowIndex":177,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女はバンドマンの貧乏な恋人がいて、将来の見えない彼との交際をどう続けてゆくのかが最近の悩みだった。","en":"Her boyfriend was an impoverished musician in a band. Recently, she had been preoccupied with whether and how to continue a relationship that appeared to have no future.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r178","rowIndex":178,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　今もそのことを考えて溜息をついており、今さっき出ていった警備員と老夫婦が無惨な死体になったことなどついぞ知らない。","en":"Even now she was thinking of it and sighing, entirely unaware that the guard and elderly couple who had left moments before were now mutilated corpses.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r179","rowIndex":179,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その平穏を打ち破ったのが、銃を握り足音荒く駆け込んで来た集団である。奥山は飲もうとしていた湯飲みを取り落とし、広げていた書類をびしょびしょにしてしまった。","en":"A group stamped through the door with guns in hand and shattered her peace. Okuyama dropped the teacup she had been about to drink from and drenched the documents spread before her.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r180","rowIndex":180,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「し、しずかにしろ！　おかしなマネをしたら撃つぞ！」","en":"“K-keep quiet! Try anything and I’ll shoot!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"田中紺太","displayName":"Konta Tanaka","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r181","rowIndex":181,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　うわずった声で銃を突きつけたのは<tips=66>紺太</tips>だった。","en":"<tips=66>Konta</tips> leveled his gun at her, his voice high with nerves.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r182","rowIndex":182,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　奥山は背後にいる同僚たちに異変を伝えようとしたかったが、その言葉で凍り付いた。","en":"Okuyama wanted to warn the colleagues behind her, but the words froze her in place.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r183","rowIndex":183,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　待合室と窓口は、壁とドアによって完全に仕切られている。ドアの上には事務室というプレートがあった。あまりにも厳重に区別されているのは、患者やその家族を事務室に乱入させないためだろう。","en":"The waiting room was completely separated from the reception office by a wall and door. A plaque above the door read ADMINISTRATION OFFICE. The formidable partition was probably meant to keep patients and their families from forcing their way inside.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r184","rowIndex":184,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　残りの隊員は、この事務室のドアを開けようとしたが、鍵がかかっている。ここでは<tips=10>道夫</tips>の能力を使うまでもなく、力任せにドアを蹴破った。","en":"The remaining members tried the office door and found it locked. There was no need for <tips=10>Michio</tips> to use his ability here; they simply kicked the door open by brute force.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r185","rowIndex":185,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　事務所には十人近くの職員がいて、<tips=10>道夫</tips>たちが侵入すると悲鳴を上げて立ち上がる。","en":"Nearly ten employees occupied the office. When <tips=10>Michio’s</tips> group entered, they screamed and rose from their seats.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r186","rowIndex":186,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「動くな！」","en":"“Don’t move!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r187","rowIndex":187,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=10>道夫</tips>は拳銃を天井に向けて発砲すると、高らかにこう宣言をした。","en":"<tips=10>Michio</tips> fired his pistol into the ceiling, then announced in a ringing voice:","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r188","rowIndex":188,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「我々は<tips=47>八龍解放軍</tips>だ！　これより、この病院は我々の支配下におく！」","en":"“We are the <tips=47>Hachiryu Liberation Army</tips>! As of this moment, this hospital is under our control!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r189","rowIndex":189,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ひっ！」","en":"“Eek!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r190","rowIndex":190,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　パニックを起こし、男性職員が立ち上がって奥の扉へ逃げようとする。","en":"A male employee panicked, leapt to his feet, and tried to escape through a door at the rear.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r191","rowIndex":191,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　眼鏡をかけたその生真面目を絵に描いたような男は、若松という三十二才の職員である。去年結婚をし、妻の腹には一人目の子供がいた。先月検査で女の子だということが判明したばかりで、義父が考えた古くさい名前をどうやって断り、そしてどんな名前をつけるのかということばかり考えていたので、今日の仕事が手につかないでいた。","en":"The bespectacled man, the very picture of earnestness, was a thirty-two-year-old employee named Wakamatsu. He had married the year before, and his wife was carrying their first child. An examination only last month had revealed that the baby was a girl. He had spent the entire day wondering how to turn down the old-fashioned name his father-in-law had suggested and what they ought to call her instead, leaving him unable to concentrate on his work.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r192","rowIndex":192,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その若松の必死の逃亡は、しかし、覚醒し<tips=78>金目</tips>となった<tips=17>タイプＢ</tips>の反射神経の前ではスローモーションのようなものだ。","en":"Yet Wakamatsu’s desperate flight was like slow motion to the reflexes of an awakened, <tips=78>gold-eyed</tips> <tips=17>Type B</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r193","rowIndex":193,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　隊員の銃が即座に火を吹いた。","en":"One of the members’ guns immediately spat fire.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r194","rowIndex":194,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　若松の眼鏡は砕け、顔面から血を噴き出しながら倒れる。そしてピクリとも動かなかった。","en":"Wakamatsu’s glasses shattered, blood burst from his face, and he fell. He did not move again.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r195","rowIndex":195,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　部屋の事務員たちは恐怖で引きつった顔で、同僚の突然の死を見つめていた。","en":"The office workers stared at their suddenly slain colleague, their faces contorted with terror.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r196","rowIndex":196,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「勝手な行動はゆるさない！」","en":"“No one moves without my permission!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r197","rowIndex":197,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=10>道夫</tips>は眉間に皺を寄せながらそう怒鳴る。","en":"<tips=10>Michio</tips> shouted the command with a deep furrow between his brows.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r198","rowIndex":198,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「我々の目的は、ここに囚われている哀れな同胞たちを一人残らず解放することだ！　それに刃向かうならば、君らもその男のあとを追うことになるだろう。しかし、大人しく協力すれば、いつも通りに家に帰ることが出来るし、奥さんが冷蔵庫に作りおいてくれたチャーハンを食べることだって出来る。賢明な諸君なら、どちらが得か、考えるまでもないはずだ」","en":"“Our objective is to liberate every last one of our unfortunate brethren imprisoned here! Stand against us, and you’ll share that man’s fate. But cooperate and do as you’re told, and you can go home just as usual. You can even eat the fried rice your wife left for you in the refrigerator. Sensible people like you shouldn’t need me to tell you which is the better bargain.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r199","rowIndex":199,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　目の前で知り合いを殺された職員たちはすっかり怯え、逆らおうとするものはいなかった。","en":"Having watched someone they knew murdered before them, the employees were thoroughly cowed. No one attempted to resist.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r200","rowIndex":200,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=10>道夫</tips>たちは部屋の片隅に彼ら全員を集めると、隊員を見張りのために取り囲むように立たせる。そしてロープを渡し、職員同士で後ろ手に縛らせた。","en":"<tips=10>Michio’s</tips> group gathered all of them in a corner of the room, stationed members around them as guards, then supplied rope and ordered the employees to bind one another’s hands behind their backs.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r201","rowIndex":201,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「しっかりと結べよ。あとで調べるからな。簡単に手が引っこ抜けるようなら、非協力的行為と見なして、縛った方も縛られた方も両方射殺する」","en":"“Tie those knots tight. We’ll check them afterward. If anyone can slip their hands free, we’ll treat it as a refusal to cooperate and shoot both the person who tied them and the person who was tied.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r202","rowIndex":202,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ひげの隊員が銃で脅しながらそう伝えると、職員たちは真っ青な顔で作業に取りかかる。女子職員の何人かは、しくしくと泣き、涙を拭いながらロープを握っていた。","en":"A bearded member delivered the threat at gunpoint. Their faces drained of color, the employees set to work. Several of the women wept quietly, clutching the rope as they wiped away their tears.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r203","rowIndex":203,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=10>道夫</tips>はそうした連中を尻目に、隊員二人を連れてさらに奥の部屋に進む。<tips=62>マリア</tips>はその場に残し、もし警備員の者たちがやって来て彼らが銃を抜いた場合のみ能力を使っていいと言い含めた。","en":"Leaving them behind, <tips=10>Michio</tips> took two members and continued into the inner rooms. He ordered <tips=62>Maria</tips> to remain. Only if the guards arrived and drew their guns was she permitted to use her ability.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r204","rowIndex":204,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=10>道夫</tips>たちはまず事務長室ではげ頭の事務長が机の下で怯えているのを発見した。","en":"<tips=10>Michio</tips> and the others first found the bald administrative director cowering under his desk in his office.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r205","rowIndex":205,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それを銃を突きつけながら事務室の人質の集団に加えると、もう一階には誰もおらず、そのまま階段に向かった。二階には、医者たちが過ごす医局や院長室などがある。","en":"After threatening him at gunpoint and adding him to the hostages in the administration office, they found no one else on the first floor and proceeded to the stairs. The doctors’ office, the hospital director’s office, and similar rooms occupied the second floor.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r206","rowIndex":206,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　階段をのぼろうとすると上から下りてくる足音があった。一同銃を手に待ち構えていると、姿を現したのは白衣を着た白髪交じりの男だった。それは、騒ぎに気がついて様子を見に来た富川医師だった。","en":"As they started up the stairs, footsteps came down from above. They waited with guns ready, and a gray-haired man in a white coat appeared. It was Dr. Tomikawa, who had noticed the commotion and come to investigate.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r207","rowIndex":207,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「き、きみたちは……」","en":"“W-who are you...?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r208","rowIndex":208,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　富川医師は恐怖で唇を震わせ、泡を飛ばしながら口を開く。","en":"Dr. Tomikawa opened his trembling lips, spittle flying as he tried to speak.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r209","rowIndex":209,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「静かに」","en":"“Quiet.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r210","rowIndex":210,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=10>道夫</tips>は銃口を突きつけながら低い声で言った。","en":"<tips=10>Michio</tips> leveled the gun at him and spoke in a low voice.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r211","rowIndex":211,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「上にはあと何人いる？」","en":"“How many people are still upstairs?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r212","rowIndex":212,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ど、どうするつもりだ……」","en":"“W-what are you planning...?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r213","rowIndex":213,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　富川医師の顔には早くも脂汗がにじみ出し、全体がてらてらと照りを帯びてくる。","en":"Greasy sweat was already beading across Dr. Tomikawa’s face, leaving it glistening all over.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r214","rowIndex":214,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「質問にこたえろ。嘘をついたら命はないぞ」","en":"“Answer the question. Lie, and you die.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r215","rowIndex":215,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=10>道夫</tips>は富川医師の腹に銃を突きつけた。","en":"<tips=10>Michio</tips> pressed the pistol into Dr. Tomikawa’s belly.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r216","rowIndex":216,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「おい。言うんだ」","en":"“Come on. Tell me.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r217","rowIndex":217,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ワイシャツを内側から押し出すその脂肪を銃口でグリグリと刺激すると、","en":"He ground the muzzle into the fat bulging beneath the doctor’s dress shirt.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r218","rowIndex":218,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ひっ……」","en":"“Eek...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r219","rowIndex":219,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　富川医師が小さく悲鳴を上げると、みるみるうちにその茶色いズボンの股間の辺りに黒いしみが広がって、やがて足の内側を伝わって足元に黄色い水たまりを作る。","en":"Dr. Tomikawa gave a small shriek. A black stain spread rapidly across the crotch of his brown trousers, then ran down the insides of his legs and formed a yellow puddle at his feet.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r220","rowIndex":220,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「おいおい」","en":"“Oh, come on.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r221","rowIndex":221,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=10>道夫</tips>は広がる水たまりを踏まないよう後ずさって、顔を顰めた。","en":"<tips=10>Michio</tips> grimaced and stepped backward to avoid the widening puddle.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r222","rowIndex":222,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それを見て他の隊員たちがクスクスと笑う。","en":"The other members snickered at the sight.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r223","rowIndex":223,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あああ……」","en":"“Ahhh...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r224","rowIndex":224,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　富川医師は顔を羞恥で真っ赤にして、その目からは涙がこぼれ落ちる。","en":"Dr. Tomikawa’s face burned crimson with shame, and tears spilled from his eyes.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r225","rowIndex":225,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　自尊心を損なわれた富川医師はもはや抵抗する意志も喪失してしまったらしく、問われるままに喋った。上にはあと二人の医師がいるらしい。院長室で執務を行っていた田川院長が医局にやって来て、法条医師と共に富川医師が下の様子を報告するのを待っているのだそうだ。そして銃などの武器の有無を尋ねると、そんなもの見たこともないと言った。","en":"His self-respect wounded, Dr. Tomikawa appeared to have lost all will to resist and answered every question put to him. There were apparently two more physicians upstairs. Director Tagawa had been working in his office, but had come to the doctors’ office and was waiting there with Dr. Hojo for Tomikawa to report what was happening below. When asked whether there were guns or other weapons, Tomikawa said he had never seen any.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r226","rowIndex":226,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=10>道夫</tips>はそれだけ聞き出すと、鼻水と涙でべちゃべちゃの顔になった富川医師に自分のハンカチを手渡し、隊員を一人つけて事務室へ送らせた。そして自分は仲間と共に残った二人の医師の確保に向かう。","en":"Once <tips=10>Michio</tips> had gotten that much out of him, he handed his own handkerchief to Dr. Tomikawa, whose face was a sodden mess of snot and tears, and had one of the members escort him to the administration office. Then he and the others headed off to secure the two remaining doctors.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r227","rowIndex":227,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　隊員たちはいまの富川医師の醜態を小声で話し合って忍び笑いをするが、<tips=10>道夫</tips>は笑えない。","en":"His companions quietly discussed Tomikawa’s disgrace and laughed under their breath. <tips=10>Michio</tips> could not.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r228","rowIndex":228,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　この状況で怯えるのは自然な人間の反応だ。あの医師は<tips=9>Y地区</tips>出身ではないだろうし、これまでまっとうな道を歩んで来たに違いない。順調に積み重ねて生きて来た人間なのだ。そのような人物が、引き金をひとつ引いただけで築いた全てが失われるという場面に陥れば、あのように取り乱すのも無理はない。","en":"Fear was a natural human response in a situation like this. The doctor was probably not from <tips=9>Y District</tips>; he had surely followed a respectable path and spent his life steadily building something for himself. When a man like that found himself facing the loss of everything at the mere pull of a trigger, it was hardly surprising that he would fall apart.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r229","rowIndex":229,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼らもたまたま勤務先がこの病院だっただけで、好き好んでこのようなことをしていたわけでもない。この場でそんな感情が禁物なのはわかっていたが、彼に対する同情を禁じ得ない。<tips=10>道夫</tips>は複雑な感情のまま、階段をのぼりきった。","en":"They too had merely happened to take jobs at this hospital; it was not as though they had chosen to do such things because they wanted to. <tips=10>Michio</tips> knew such feelings had no place here, yet he could not help sympathizing with the doctor. With those conflicting emotions, he reached the top of the stairs.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r230","rowIndex":230,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　富川医師から聞いていた通り、二階には田川院長と法条医師の二人がいた。<tips=10>道夫</tips>たちが部屋に入ると彼らは動揺を見せたが、富川医師ほど取り乱しはしなかった。","en":"As Dr. Tomikawa had said, Director Tagawa and Dr. Hojo were on the second floor. They showed alarm when <tips=10>Michio’s</tips> group entered the room, but did not fall apart as Tomikawa had.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r231","rowIndex":231,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　もう人がいないのを確認してから下に戻ると、富川医師が隊員によって暴行されている場面に出くわした。","en":"After confirming that no one else remained, the group returned downstairs and found members assaulting Dr. Tomikawa.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r232","rowIndex":232,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「おい！　ふざけんなよ！　おれたちの仲間を、こんなところで人体実験に使いやがって！」","en":"“Hey! What the hell is wrong with you? You used our people for human experiments in a place like this!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r233","rowIndex":233,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　倒れた富川医師をブーツを履いた足で蹴飛ばしたのは、ジョー・ヒラヤマというパン屋の息子である。彼は自分から志願して<tips=47>解放軍</tips>に入った青年で、<tips=67>カミラ</tips>の仲間であった。ということはつまり、<tips=17>タイプB</tips>への同胞意識が強く、差別などに対して人一倍強烈な嫌悪感を持っているということだ。","en":"The man driving his boot into the fallen doctor was Joe Hirayama, a baker’s son. He was a young man who had volunteered for the <tips=47>Liberation Army</tips> and belonged to <tips=67>Camilla’s</tips> circle. In other words, he felt a powerful solidarity with his fellow <tips=17>Type Bs</tips> and an exceptionally fierce loathing of discrimination against them.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r234","rowIndex":234,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ひっ、ひいっ！」","en":"“Eek! Eeeek!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r235","rowIndex":235,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　富川医師はせっかく<tips=10>道夫</tips>がハンカチを渡したのに、また涙と鼻水と、そして今回はさらに鼻血がプラスされてぐちゃぐちゃの顔になっている。","en":"<tips=10>Michio’s</tips> handkerchief had been for nothing. Tears and mucus once again covered Dr. Tomikawa’s face, now joined by blood from his nose.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r236","rowIndex":236,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「おい、どうしたんだ」","en":"“Hey, what happened?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫","displayName":"Michio Mido","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r237","rowIndex":237,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=10>道夫</tips>が問いただすと、ジョーは鼻息荒く振り返る。","en":"When <tips=10>Michio</tips> demanded an explanation, Joe turned with nostrils flaring.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r238","rowIndex":238,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「さっき、檜垣さんのチームから連絡があったんですよ。そしたら、本当にまだ許可が出てないような薬を使っていたって……」","en":"“Higaki’s team just radioed us. They said this hospital really has been using drugs that haven’t even been approved...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r239","rowIndex":239,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あ、あれは、日本ではまだ認可されていないだけで、世界ではそれなりの臨床実績が……」","en":"“I-it simply hasn’t been approved in Japan yet. Internationally, it has a respectable clinical track record...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r240","rowIndex":240,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「うるさいっ！」","en":"“Shut up!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r241","rowIndex":241,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ジョーは富川医師の言い訳を許さずその腹を蹴りつける。","en":"Joe refused to hear Dr. Tomikawa’s explanation and kicked him in the belly.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r242","rowIndex":242,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　檜垣というのは、Ｃ棟に向かったチームのリーダーの名前である。元薬剤師の四十がらみの男で、発症したあとは家族に暴力を振るって家を追い出されて路上生活者になっていた。このたび『<tips=46>ネオ・ローズ</tips>』で正気を取り戻したが、帰るべき家がなく<tips=47>解放軍</tips>に参加することとなった。","en":"Higaki was the leader of the team sent to Building C. A former pharmacist around forty, he had assaulted his family after developing symptoms, been thrown out of the house, and become homeless. <tips=46>Neo Rose</tips> had now restored his senses, but with no home to return to, he had joined the <tips=47>Liberation Army</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r243","rowIndex":243,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　職業柄薬剤に詳しく、最近の<tips=17>タイプＢ</tips>治療の動向についてもよく勉強をしていたため、例の<tips=65>ヘス</tips>が写真で見せた『縛られ虐待される患者』がいるＣ棟制圧チームのリーダーとなったのだ。","en":"His profession had left him knowledgeable about medication, and he had studied recent developments in <tips=17>Type B</tips> treatment. He was therefore made leader of the team assigned to seize Building C, where the ‘bound and abused patients’ in <tips=65>Hess’s</tips> photographs were located.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r244","rowIndex":244,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼らはついさっき、Ｃ棟の地下に足を踏み入れて、牢屋のような檻のなかにいる患者たちの解放に成功したのだそうだ。これから上の階に移動しながら他の患者たちを解放してゆくと、連絡をしてきたのだと言う。","en":"A short while ago, they had entered the basement of Building C and successfully freed patients kept in cells like a prison. Their radio message said they would now move upward through the building, liberating the other patients floor by floor.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r245","rowIndex":245,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ジョー。感情的になっちゃだめだぜ。今は冷静になって、作戦を成功させることだけ考えるんだ」","en":"“Joe. Don’t let your emotions get the better of you. Stay calm and focus on making this operation a success.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫","displayName":"Michio Mido","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r246","rowIndex":246,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=10>見土</tips>さん。わかってますが、でも、おれ絶対許せないですよ。こんな連中……」","en":"“<tips=10>Mr. Mido</tips>, I understand, but I can never forgive people like this...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r247","rowIndex":247,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして震わせたジョーの肩を<tips=10>道夫</tips>はぽんと叩き、","en":"<tips=10>Michio</tips> gave Joe’s trembling shoulder a light pat.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r248","rowIndex":248,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「正しいことのために戦ってるんだろう？　それなら、誇り高く振る舞わなければいけない」","en":"“You’re fighting for what is right, aren’t you? Then you must conduct yourself with pride.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫","displayName":"Michio Mido","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r249","rowIndex":249,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そう笑いかけた。","en":"He smiled at him.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r250","rowIndex":250,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=10>道夫</tips>のチームは管理棟を制圧したあとは最低限の見張りを残しＡ棟へ向かった。","en":"Once <tips=10>Michio’s</tips> team had secured the administration building, they left behind only the minimum number of guards and headed for Building A.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r251","rowIndex":251,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その移動の途中<tips=10>道夫</tips>は銃声を聞いた。それも、一つや二つではなく、断続的な銃の音が、Ｂ棟からもＣ棟からも聞こえてくるのである。そしてざわざわとした悲鳴も。","en":"Along the way, <tips=10>Michio</tips> heard gunfire. Not one or two shots, but intermittent reports from Buildings B and C alike. A swelling murmur of screams rose with them.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r252","rowIndex":252,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=10>道夫</tips>にはその音が、自分の人生が暗く不吉な道へ迷い込んだことを盛大に祝うファンファーレのように聞こえた。","en":"To <tips=10>Michio</tips>, the sound resembled a grand fanfare celebrating the moment his life had strayed onto a dark and ominous road.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r253","rowIndex":253,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼は苦い顔をしながら前を向き、足を早める。","en":"He faced forward grimly and quickened his pace.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r254","rowIndex":254,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　Ｂ棟に向かった<tips=67>カミラ</tips>たちは、見かける職員を全て殺傷しながら進んでいた。隊員がみな荒っぽい性格であるというのもあったが、相手に銃があるかもしれないという思いがその攻撃性を歯止めがきかぬものにしていた。","en":"<tips=67>Camilla’s</tips> team, sent to Building B, advanced while killing or wounding every member of staff they encountered. The members were rough people by nature, but the belief that their opponents might have guns sent their aggression entirely beyond control.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r255","rowIndex":255,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして訓練の足りない彼らの暴力は、あまり精度の良いものとは言えなかった。","en":"Their violence, unrefined by training, was far from precise.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r256","rowIndex":256,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　例えば階段をのぼるとき、手すりにつかまるようにして降りてくる老人と、それに付き添う若い看護師を見かけた。その瞬間、隊員たちは<tips=67>カミラ</tips>の指示も待たずに手持ちの武器で発砲する。","en":"Climbing one staircase, for example, they saw an old woman descending with one hand upon the rail, attended by a young nurse. The moment they appeared, the members opened fire without waiting for an order from <tips=67>Camilla</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r257","rowIndex":257,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　看護師は悲鳴も上げる間もなく射殺されるが、何発かは老人にも当たり、二人の死体はもつれるようにして階段を落ちていった。","en":"The nurse was killed before she could scream. Several bullets also struck the old woman, and the two corpses tumbled down the stairs entangled together.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r258","rowIndex":258,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「何をしているんですか！　こっちのお祖母ちゃんは我々の同胞ですよ！」","en":"“What are you doing? This old woman is one of our own!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"カミラ","displayName":"Camilla","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r259","rowIndex":259,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=67>カミラ</tips>が血相を変えて叱責したが、隊員たちは心外という顔をして、","en":"<tips=67>Camilla</tips> rounded on them in fury, but the members only looked aggrieved and replied,","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r260","rowIndex":260,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「確かにそうだが、仕方がないじゃないか。相手は武器を持ってるかもしれないんだぜ？　おれたちは銃の達人ってわけじゃないから、戦おうとすればこうなるさ」","en":"“She is, sure, but it couldn’t be helped. The other side might be armed. We aren’t master marksmen. If we have to fight, this is what happens.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r261","rowIndex":261,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　と悪びれる風もなかった。","en":"He showed no remorse.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r262","rowIndex":262,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=67>カミラ</tips>の言うことなどはなから聞くつもりがないのだ。彼女は唇を噛んで怒りを抑える他ない。","en":"They had never intended to heed <tips=67>Camilla</tips> in the first place. All she could do was bite her lip and suppress her anger.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r263","rowIndex":263,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　もともとこのチームは人間的に問題があるものばかりで構成されており率いるのが難しいのはわかっていた。だから当初は<tips=10>道夫</tips>がリーダーとなると言っていたのだが、<tips=67>カミラ</tips>が半ば無理矢理その役割を奪い取ったのだ。","en":"She had known from the outset that this team, composed entirely of men with serious defects of character, would be difficult to lead. <tips=10>Michio</tips> had initially said that he would command them, but <tips=67>Camilla</tips> had more or less seized the role by force.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r264","rowIndex":264,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「こんな無法は許されないわ。私たちはギャングじゃないのよ？」","en":"“We can’t allow this kind of lawlessness. We’re not gangsters, you know.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"カミラ","displayName":"Camilla","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r265","rowIndex":265,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　会のなかでは過激派として知られている<tips=67>カミラ</tips>だが、現実の殺人となれば、しかも無抵抗な相手を殺害したとなれば、さすがに冷静ではいられなかった。動かなくなった二人の死体を眺めるその横顔は血の気が引いて青ざめている。","en":"<tips=67>Camilla</tips> was known as an extremist within the Society. But confronted with actual murder—particularly the murder of a defenseless person—even she could not remain calm. All color had drained from her profile as she stared at the two motionless corpses.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r266","rowIndex":266,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　隊員はそれを笑い、","en":"The member laughed at her.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r267","rowIndex":267,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「お嬢ちゃん、言い争いをしてる場合じゃないんだよ。相手は銃を持ってるかもしれないから、職員はみな殺してゆくって決めたじゃないか。だから……」","en":"“Young lady, this is no time to argue. We decided we’d kill every member of staff because they might have guns. So—”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r268","rowIndex":268,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そう言ったところで、銃声を聞きつけたのか、男性看護師が二人階段から降りてきて姿を現す。","en":"Before he could finish, two male nurses, perhaps drawn by the shots, appeared as they descended the stairs.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r269","rowIndex":269,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「な、なにをっ……」","en":"“W-what are you—”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r270","rowIndex":270,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　驚愕している看護師のうち、一人は一番近くにいた隊員が振り回す鉈で額を割られ、もう一人は逃げようとして背を向けたところを隊員たちの銃弾によって蜂の巣にされる。","en":"One of the astonished nurses had his forehead split by a machete swung by the nearest member. The other turned to flee and was riddled with bullets from the members’ guns.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r271","rowIndex":271,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「行くぞお嬢ちゃん。一気にやらなきゃ逃げられる」","en":"“Come on, young lady. If we don’t take them all at once, they’ll get away.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r272","rowIndex":272,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　隊員たちはみな銃を構えて階段を駆け上がり、<tips=67>カミラ</tips>はそのあとを追う格好になった。","en":"The members raised their guns and raced up the stairs, leaving <tips=67>Camilla</tips> to follow behind them.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r273","rowIndex":273,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　Ｂ棟の制圧はまず放送設備のある二階から行うことに決めていた。階段から看護室へ入る扉は換気のためか開けっ放しになっていて、隊員たちはそこから部屋に駆け込むと、呆然と立ち尽くしていた看護師たちに鉛の弾を浴びせかけた。","en":"They had decided to begin the seizure of Building B on the second floor, where the broadcasting equipment was located. Perhaps for ventilation, the door from the stairs into the nurses’ station stood open. The members burst through it and poured bullets into the nurses frozen inside.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r274","rowIndex":274,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼らのうち三人はサブマシンガンを持っており、彼らの銃が火を吹くと、轟音と共に机の上に置かれていた書類は舞い上がり、パソコンは火花を散らしてはじけ飛び、夕方の薬のために用意されていた水のコップがいくつも乗ったお盆は砕け散った。","en":"Three carried submachine guns. When those weapons opened fire, papers upon the desks leapt into the air with the thunderous noise. Computers erupted in sparks. A tray holding several cups of water prepared for the evening medication shattered.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r275","rowIndex":275,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　呆然と立っていた四人の看護師は最初はパニックを起こして絶叫していたが、三人の弾倉が空になるころには穴だらけになって無言で床に倒れ伏している。","en":"The four nurses had screamed in panic at first. By the time the three magazines were empty, their bodies were full of holes and they lay silent upon the floor.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r276","rowIndex":276,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「無茶苦茶よ！　放送機器が壊れていたらどうするの？」","en":"“This is insanity! What if you destroyed the broadcasting equipment?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"カミラ","displayName":"Camilla","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r277","rowIndex":277,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=67>カミラ</tips>は相変わらず血の気が引いた青白い顔のまま看護師たちの死体を横目に通り過ぎると、向かいの壁にかかった受話器を手に取る。","en":"Still deathly pale, <tips=67>Camilla</tips> passed the nurses’ bodies with a sidelong glance and picked up the receiver mounted on the opposite wall.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r278","rowIndex":278,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そしてふと目をやると、病棟と看護室を区切るアクリルパネルのところに、何人かの患者が張り付いてこちらを見ているのと視線があった。","en":"Her gaze happened to fall on the acrylic partition between the nurses’ station and the ward. Several patients were pressed against it, watching her, and their eyes met.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r279","rowIndex":279,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ここは女性病棟だから女しかいない。彼女たちは老いているものも若いものもみなやせ細り、とろりとした生気のない目をしていた。頭には転倒事故防止のピンク色のヘッドギアをかぶったものもいる。","en":"As this was a women’s ward, every patient was female. Old and young alike were wasted thin, with languid, lifeless eyes. Several wore pink protective headgear to prevent injury in a fall.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r280","rowIndex":280,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　病院のなかで平和に暮らす<tips=17>タイプＢ</tips>は、街で発症したものとは違う雰囲気があった。あらゆる刺激から守られ、生活を全て職員に依存している彼らは皆どこかおっとりとしている。<tips=67>カミラ</tips>は彼らに共通する顔つきに、なぜだか嫌悪感を覚えながら、操作パネルに向かい合った。","en":"The <tips=17>Type Bs</tips> who lived peacefully inside the hospital had a different air from those who developed symptoms in the city. Protected from every stimulus and dependent upon staff for every part of their lives, all seemed somehow placid. <tips=67>Camilla</tips> felt an inexplicable disgust at the look they shared, then faced the control panel.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r281","rowIndex":281,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　パネルの下の方に並んだいくつものボタンのうち、『Ｂ棟全館』と書かれたものを押し、そして受話器に向かって呼びかける。","en":"Among the many buttons arranged along its lower portion, she pressed the one labeled ALL OF BUILDING B and spoke into the receiver.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r282","rowIndex":282,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"『今の騒音で驚かせて申し訳ありません。私たちは<tips=47>八龍解放軍</tips>というものです。この病院で不自由な生活を送られている<tips=17>タイプＢ</tips>の皆さんのために、特別な薬を用意しましたので、驚かずにそのままお待ちください。……なお、我々は武器を持っています。職員の皆様は、無駄な抵抗などなさらず、看護室で待機してください。逃げようとしても、外にいる同志が見ています。怪我などをしたくなければ、あくまでも余計なことはなさらぬよう……』","en":"‘We apologize if the recent noise alarmed you. We are the <tips=47>Hachiryu Liberation Army</tips>. We have brought a special medicine for the <tips=17>Type B</tips> patients living with limited freedom in this hospital. Please remain where you are and do not be afraid. ...We are armed. Members of staff will refrain from pointless resistance and wait in the nurses’ station. Our comrades outside are watching, so do not attempt to escape. If you wish to avoid injury, take no unnecessary action of any kind...’","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r283","rowIndex":283,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　作戦計画時に用意した文面を二度繰り返すと、受話器を置く。","en":"She repeated the prepared text twice, then replaced the receiver.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r284","rowIndex":284,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして溜息をつき、隊員たちを振り返った。","en":"With a sigh, she turned toward the members.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r285","rowIndex":285,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ぼやぼやしているわけには行きません。対応される前に、ノーマルを排除しましょう」","en":"“We cannot afford to dawdle. Let us eliminate the Normals before they can respond.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"カミラ","displayName":"Camilla","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r286","rowIndex":286,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　うわずった声でそう言うと、隊員たちはにやりと笑い、","en":"She delivered the order in a strained, high-pitched voice, and the members grinned.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r287","rowIndex":287,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そう来なくっちゃな！」","en":"“Now you’re talking!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r288","rowIndex":288,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「お嬢ちゃん、わかってるじゃねえか」","en":"“Looks like you get it after all, little lady.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r289","rowIndex":289,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　と口々に誉め称え、<tips=67>カミラ</tips>もこわばった笑みを浮かべた。","en":"They showered her with approval, and <tips=67>Camilla</tips> managed a stiff smile in return.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r290","rowIndex":290,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　事前の打ち合わせでは<tips=10>道夫</tips>が管理棟でやったように職員は一カ所に集めて監視することになっていた。しかし彼女たちは別の行動をとった。","en":"Their prior agreement had been to gather the staff in one place and keep them under guard, as <tips=10>Michio</tips> had done in the administration building. Camilla’s team chose another course.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r291","rowIndex":291,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　放送を終えたあと、すぐに三人ずつに分かれて半分は二階の制圧、残りは上の階に向かう。<tips=67>カミラ</tips>は二人の部下と共に三階へ上がった。","en":"Immediately after the announcement, they divided into groups of three. Half began securing the second floor, while the rest went upstairs. <tips=67>Camilla</tips> took two subordinates to the third floor.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r292","rowIndex":292,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　三階は丁度誕生会の真っ最中で看護師も看護助手も、病棟のスタッフはみなホールに出払っており、看護室には<tips=94>吉田主任</tips>だけが残り看護サマリーを書いていた。","en":"The third floor was right in the middle of a birthday party. All the nurses, nursing assistants, and other ward staff were gathered in the hall, leaving only <tips=94>Chief Yoshida</tips> in the nurses’ station, writing a nursing summary.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r293","rowIndex":293,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　誕生日を迎えた三人の患者が挨拶をし、音楽に合わせてみなで誕生日の歌を歌い、そしてこれからケーキを食べようというところだった。","en":"The three patients whose birthdays they were celebrating had each said a few words, everyone had sung the birthday song along with the music, and they were just about to eat the cake.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r294","rowIndex":294,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　この病棟は、ものを飲み込むのに困難がある老人や重病人ばかりなので、食事の場合はなるべく多くの職員がホールに出てその様子を見守ったり、実際にスプーンを持って食べさせてやったりしている。食事の前に歌をうたったり、体操をして少しでも誤嚥を少なくするのだが、それでもむせかえったり、事故が起こってしまうのがこの病棟の患者たちである。食事は患者たちにとって一番の楽しみであると同時に、最も危険な場面だとも言える。","en":"This ward housed mostly elderly or severely ill patients who had difficulty swallowing. At mealtimes, as many staff as possible entered the hall to watch them, or held spoons and fed them directly. They sang or exercised before eating in hopes of reducing aspiration even slightly. Still, these patients frequently choked, and accidents occurred. Food was at once their greatest pleasure and the most dangerous part of their day.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r295","rowIndex":295,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　二階での銃撃戦はまさにそうした摂食の時間に行われた。","en":"The shooting on the floor below began during just such a meal.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r296","rowIndex":296,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　階下からただならぬ銃声が響いて来る。職員と、まだ多少理性の働く患者たちは騒然として顔を見合わせたが、症状の進んだものは周囲の変化にまったく無頓着で、目の前のケーキに夢中になっている。","en":"Unmistakable gunshots rang from below. The staff and the patients who retained some reason looked around in agitation. Those whose symptoms had progressed, however, were utterly indifferent to the change around them and remained absorbed in the cake before their eyes.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r297","rowIndex":297,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　やがて銃声が収まると、今度は館内放送で穏やかでない<tips=67>カミラ</tips>の発言が流される。","en":"When the shots finally ceased, <tips=67>Camilla’s</tips> alarming announcement came over the hospital speakers.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r298","rowIndex":298,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　さすがにこれはただ事ではないと、職員たちははっきりと気がついた。","en":"The staff now understood beyond doubt that something was terribly wrong.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r299","rowIndex":299,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「みなさーん、業務を中断して、看護室に集まってください！」","en":"“Everyone, stop what you’re doing and gather in the nurses’ station!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"吉田主任","displayName":"Chief Yoshida","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r300","rowIndex":300,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　看護室のドアを開けて、顔を真っ青にした<tips=94>吉田主任</tips>がかたい声で皆にそう叫ぶと、すぐに引っ込んだ。そして机に戻ると、電話機の受話器を手に取る。","en":"Her face drained of color, <tips=94>Chief Yoshida</tips> opened the nurses’ station door and called out to everyone in a tight voice, then immediately ducked back inside. She returned to her desk and picked up the telephone receiver.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r301","rowIndex":301,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　中断しろと命令されても、すぐに患者たちを放り出せるような状況ではない。職員たちが戸惑っていると、","en":"Even when ordered to suspend their work, the staff were in no position to abandon their patients at once. They hesitated.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r302","rowIndex":302,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ケーキはここまでにしましょう。介助の人はまだ食べ終わってないですが、冷蔵庫に入れてまたあとでということで」","en":"“Let’s call an end to the cake for now. The patients who need help eating haven’t finished yet, but we can put the rest in the refrigerator and give it to them later.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"林田雄一","displayName":"Yuichi Hayashida","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r303","rowIndex":303,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　この病棟の数少ない男性である看護助手の<tips=93>林田</tips>は顔を曇らせてそう言った。","en":"<tips=93>Hayashida</tips>, a nursing assistant and one of the few men on the ward, spoke with a troubled expression.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r304","rowIndex":304,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それがいいですね」","en":"“I agree.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"能見美紗","displayName":"Misa Nomi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r305","rowIndex":305,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　看護師の<tips=83>能見美紗</tips>はすぐに同意を示して頷く。","en":"Nurse <tips=83>Misa Nomi</tips> immediately nodded.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r306","rowIndex":306,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……みなさーん、ちょっと看護師さんたちは急用が出来たので誕生会は中止にします。まだ食べ途中の人は、こちらで預かりますから手を止めてくださいね。ほら、ゆうちゃんも食べるのやめて。あなた、誰かが見てないと危ないから。この間も喉に詰まらせてひっくり返ったでしょう」","en":"“Everyone, the nurses have something urgent to attend to, so we’re ending the party. If you haven’t finished eating, we’ll keep the rest for you. Stop eating now, please. Yuu, that means you too. It’s dangerous if no one is watching you. You choked and fell over only the other day, remember?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"能見美紗","displayName":"Misa Nomi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r307","rowIndex":307,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=83>美紗</tips>は苦い顔をしながら、言葉を無視して食べ続けようとする老婆の皿を奪った。","en":"With a grimace, <tips=83>Misa</tips> took the plate from an old woman who ignored her and tried to keep eating.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r308","rowIndex":308,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「何するんだ！　人殺し！」","en":"“What are you doing? Murderer!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r309","rowIndex":309,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「もう、いつもそんな汚いことばっかり言うんだから」","en":"“Honestly, you always say such nasty things.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"能見美紗","displayName":"Misa Nomi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r310","rowIndex":310,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=83>美紗</tips>は苦い顔で窘める。普段なら説教の一つでも言うところだが、今はそんな悠長な時間はない。","en":"<tips=83>Misa</tips> admonished her with a grimace. Ordinarily she would have given her a proper lecture, but there was no time for that now.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r311","rowIndex":311,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　職員たちは自分たちに恐ろしい危機が迫っていることを実感していたが、毎日家族よりも多くの時間を過ごした患者たちをそのままにしておくことは出来なかった。","en":"The staff understood that a terrible danger was closing upon them. Yet they could not simply abandon patients with whom they spent more time each day than with their own families.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r312","rowIndex":312,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　手分けして要介助者のケーキを取り上げたり、歩行困難者をベッドに誘導したりする。重度の患者は状況に納得出来ずに癇癪を起こし、事態を把握出来る患者は不安を看護師に訴える。","en":"They divided the work: taking cake from those who needed assistance, guiding patients who struggled to walk back to bed. The severely impaired threw tantrums because they could not accept what was happening, while those who understood the situation voiced their anxiety to the nurses.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r313","rowIndex":313,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　にわかに慌ただしくなったホールで、","en":"The hall had suddenly become a scene of frantic activity.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r314","rowIndex":314,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あっ、だめっ！」","en":"“Ah! No!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"水村","displayName":"Mizumura","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r315","rowIndex":315,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　看護師の<tips=92>水村</tips>が叫んだ。","en":"Nurse <tips=92>Mizumura</tips> cried out.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r316","rowIndex":316,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どうしたの？」","en":"“What happened?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"能見美紗","displayName":"Misa Nomi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r317","rowIndex":317,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=83>能見</tips>さんっ！　御手洗さんが、とりあげようとしたケーキを一遍に飲み込んじゃって！」","en":"“Ms. <tips=83>Nomi</tips>! When I tried to take Ms. Mitarai’s cake away, she swallowed the whole piece at once!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"水村","displayName":"Mizumura","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r318","rowIndex":318,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=92>水村ナース</tips>は動揺している。黄色いヘッドガードをかぶったその老婆は、身動きをせずにその場に固まって目を細めている。","en":"<tips=92>Nurse Mizumura</tips> was shaken. The old woman in yellow protective headgear remained completely rigid where she was, eyes narrowed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r319","rowIndex":319,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　苦しむ様子は見せていないが、だからといって安心出来るわけではないことをこの病棟のスタッフなら誰もが知っていた。症状が進み、老い、強い薬を飲んでいる患者は、喉が詰まってもむせ込むこともなく、苦しみを表現したりもしないことが多い。骨が折れても平気でいるような、痛覚の麻痺した人々なのである。喉にものを詰まらせても外から見ても何の変化もなく、青くなって倒れてから気づくということも多い。","en":"She did not appear distressed. Every member of this ward’s staff knew that this was no reason for comfort. Patients whose symptoms had progressed, who had grown old, and who took powerful medication often failed to cough even when their throats were obstructed and frequently could not express pain. Some appeared unconcerned even with a broken bone, their sense of pain blunted. Food could lodge in a patient’s throat without any visible change, and no one would notice until she turned blue and collapsed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r320","rowIndex":320,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「掃除機とってきます！」","en":"“I’ll get the suction unit!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"林田雄一","displayName":"Yuichi Hayashida","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r321","rowIndex":321,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=93>林田</tips>はそう言ってすぐに処置室に向かって駆け出す。","en":"With that, <tips=93>Hayashida</tips> immediately ran toward the treatment room.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r322","rowIndex":322,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=92>水村ナース</tips>と<tips=83>美紗</tips>は患者に付き添って、その背中をさする。","en":"<tips=92>Nurse Mizumura</tips> and <tips=83>Misa</tips> stayed with the patient, rubbing her back.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r323","rowIndex":323,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「御手洗さん、喉つまってない？　声を出してみてちょうだい」","en":"“Ms. Mitarai, is something stuck in your throat? Try making a sound for me.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"能見美紗","displayName":"Misa Nomi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r324","rowIndex":324,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=83>美紗</tips>がそう尋ねるが、当の本人はじっと<tips=83>美紗</tips>の顔を見つめるだけだ。もともと、会話が成立しにくく、こっちの言葉が理解出来ているかどうかもわからないし、言っていることも常に支離滅裂な老婆なのである。","en":"<tips=83>Misa</tips> asked the question, but the old woman merely stared at <tips=83>Misa’s</tips> face. Even under ordinary circumstances, it was difficult to hold a conversation with her: no one could tell whether she understood what was said to her, and what she herself said was always incoherent.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r325","rowIndex":325,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あーって、ほら、言えますか？」","en":"“Say ‘ah.’ Can you do that?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"能見美紗","displayName":"Misa Nomi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r326","rowIndex":326,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=83>美紗</tips>の再度の問いかけにも無反応だ。","en":"<tips=83>Misa’s</tips> second question received no response.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r327","rowIndex":327,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=83>能見</tips>さん！　掃除機です！　ほら御手洗さん口を開けて！」","en":"“Ms. <tips=83>Nomi</tips>! Here’s the suction unit! Come on, Ms. Mitarai, open your mouth!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"林田雄一","displayName":"Yuichi Hayashida","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r328","rowIndex":328,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　特別なノズルがついた吸引専用の掃除機を持って来た<tips=93>林田</tips>が、あくまでも反応を示さない御手洗の歯がない口に手を突っ込み、開かせようと知ったその時、看護室の方から銃声があがった。","en":"<tips=93>Hayashida</tips> returned with a dedicated suction unit fitted with a special nozzle. He put a hand into Mitarai’s toothless mouth and was trying to open it when a gunshot sounded from the direction of the nurses’ station.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r329","rowIndex":329,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「きゃーっ！」","en":"“Aaaah!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"藤原","displayName":"Fujiwara","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r330","rowIndex":330,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　藤原ナースが金切り声で悲鳴を上げる。","en":"Nurse Fujiwara let out a piercing scream.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r331","rowIndex":331,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=83>美紗</tips>も立ち上がり、自分の目で透明のアクリルボード越しに看護室を見た。","en":"<tips=83>Misa</tips> rose and looked through the transparent acrylic partition into the nurses’ station.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r332","rowIndex":332,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　看護室のなかには見知らぬ三人の人物がいた。彼らはそれぞれの手に銃を持ち、そのうちのたった一人の女性である、若い女が握る拳銃からうっすらと煙が上がっている。","en":"Three strangers stood inside, each holding a gun. The only woman among them was young, and a faint thread of smoke rose from her pistol.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r333","rowIndex":333,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　さっき看護室に引っ込んだはずの<tips=94>吉田主任</tips>の姿はない。かわりに、彼女の席のまわりは鮮血が飛び散っている。","en":"<tips=94>Chief Yoshida</tips>, who should have gone back into the nurses’ station moments earlier, was nowhere to be seen. Instead, fresh blood was spattered around her desk.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r334","rowIndex":334,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　下から上ってきた<tips=67>カミラ</tips>が撃ったのだ。頭を銃弾で撃ち抜かれた<tips=94>吉田主任</tips>の身体はホールからは見えない足元に倒れていた。","en":"<tips=67>Camilla</tips>, who had come up from below, was the one who shot her. The body of <tips=94>Chief Yoshida</tips>, shot through the head, lay on the floor where it could not be seen from the hall.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r335","rowIndex":335,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=67>カミラ</tips>は<tips=94>吉田主任</tips>が動かないのを確認してから顔を上げ、そしてホールからこちらを見つめている藤原ナースの顔を見る。","en":"After confirming that <tips=94>Chief Yoshida</tips> was not moving, <tips=67>Camilla</tips> raised her head and saw Nurse Fujiwara staring her way from the hall.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r336","rowIndex":336,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ひっ！　ひいっ！！」","en":"“Eek! Eeeek!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"藤原","displayName":"Fujiwara","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r337","rowIndex":337,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　藤原ナースは怯えて腰が抜け、這うようにしてその場から離れた。","en":"Nurse Fujiwara’s legs gave way in terror. She crawled away.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r338","rowIndex":338,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=93>林田</tips>さんっ！　主任が！」","en":"“Mr. <tips=93>Hayashida</tips>! The chief!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"能見美紗","displayName":"Misa Nomi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r339","rowIndex":339,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=83>美紗</tips>は口を開けようとしない御手洗とまだ格闘している<tips=93>林田</tips>にそう叫んだ。","en":"<tips=83>Misa</tips> shouted to <tips=93>Hayashida</tips>, who was still struggling to force Mitarai’s mouth open.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r340","rowIndex":340,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「くそっ、わけがわからないが、とにかくこっちを……」","en":"“Damn it, I don’t know what’s happening, but help me with this first...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"林田雄一","displayName":"Yuichi Hayashida","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r341","rowIndex":341,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=93>林田</tips>は苦渋の表情に汗を浮かべながら<tips=83>美紗</tips>に手伝うよう促す。","en":"Sweat beading on his anguished face, <tips=93>Hayashida</tips> urged <tips=83>Misa</tips> to help.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r342","rowIndex":342,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「は、はいっ」","en":"“Y-yes!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"能見美紗","displayName":"Misa Nomi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r343","rowIndex":343,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=83>美紗</tips>の手は震えていたが、掃除機を握ると少し落ち着いた。","en":"<tips=83>Misa’s</tips> hands were trembling, but once she took hold of the suction unit, she calmed down a little.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r344","rowIndex":344,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　あの恐ろしい襲撃者のことを考えると何をしていいのかわけがわからなくなるが、患者を助けるという自分の業務のなかならば、いつでも落ち着いて対応出来るのはまだ若いながらも看護師として様々な状況に立ちあった経験がなせるわざだった。","en":"Thinking about the terrifying attackers left her with no idea what to do. Yet within her own work—the task of saving a patient—she could still respond calmly. Though young, she had already faced many situations as a nurse, and that experience now bore fruit.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r345","rowIndex":345,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=93>林田</tips>がどうにか開かせた御手洗の口のなかに、<tips=83>美紗</tips>はノズルを突っ込んでスイッチを押す。","en":"<tips=93>Hayashida</tips> finally forced Mitarai’s mouth open. <tips=83>Misa</tips> inserted the nozzle and switched on the suction.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r346","rowIndex":346,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「出ましたか？」","en":"“Did anything come out?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"林田雄一","displayName":"Yuichi Hayashida","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r347","rowIndex":347,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　御手洗を押さえつけている<tips=93>林田</tips>がそう尋ねるのに、掃除機の透明なプラスチックで覆われたタンクを見つめている<tips=83>美紗</tips>は首を振る。","en":"<tips=93>Hayashida</tips> asked while holding Mitarai in place. <tips=83>Misa</tips> peered into the suction unit’s clear plastic tank and shook her head.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r348","rowIndex":348,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「動くなっ！」","en":"“Don’t move!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r349","rowIndex":349,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ホールに響き渡るだみ声の主は、看護室から飛び出して来たひげ面の男だった。","en":"The gravelly voice ringing through the hall belonged to a bearded man who had emerged from the nurses’ station.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r350","rowIndex":350,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼とその仲間たちは銃を構えながら、あたりを睨み付けている。","en":"He and his companions raised their guns and glared around them.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r351","rowIndex":351,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「職員は全員ホールに集まれ！　指示に従わないものはこの場で射殺するっ！　おい、そこの看護婦っ！　奥まで行って他の職員を呼んで来いっ」","en":"“All staff, get into the hall! Anyone who disobeys will be shot on the spot! You there, nurse! Go to the back and bring the rest of the staff out here!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r352","rowIndex":352,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「は、はいっ」","en":"“Y-yes!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"藤原","displayName":"Fujiwara","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r353","rowIndex":353,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　怒鳴りつけられた藤原ナースは、へっぴりごしで立ち上がると、ホールを出て病室の方へヨタヨタと歩いて行った。","en":"Nurse Fujiwara rose at the shouted command, bent awkwardly at the waist, then tottered out of the hall toward the patient rooms.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r354","rowIndex":354,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そこ。何をしているの」","en":"“You there. What are you doing?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"カミラ","displayName":"Camilla","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r355","rowIndex":355,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ホールの片隅で御手洗の吸引を行っている<tips=83>美紗</tips>たちに鋭い声を発したのは<tips=67>カミラ</tips>だった。","en":"It was <tips=67>Camilla</tips> who called sharply to <tips=83>Misa</tips> and Hayashida as they worked to suction Mitarai in a corner of the hall.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r356","rowIndex":356,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ふたりでお婆ちゃんをおさえつけるなんて、どういうこと？」","en":"“Why are the two of you holding that old woman down?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"カミラ","displayName":"Camilla","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r357","rowIndex":357,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女は歩み寄りながら銃をあげ、<tips=83>美紗</tips>の頭に狙いをつけた。","en":"She approached, lifting her pistol and aiming at <tips=83>Misa’s</tips> head.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r358","rowIndex":358,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「誤嚥したので吸引を行っているんです！」","en":"“She’s aspirated some food, so we’re suctioning it out!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"能見美紗","displayName":"Misa Nomi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r359","rowIndex":359,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=83>美紗</tips>は銃を向けられているのに気がついていたが、作業はとめず、振り返りもしない。","en":"<tips=83>Misa</tips> knew a gun was pointed at her, but neither stopped working nor looked back.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r360","rowIndex":360,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ごえん？」","en":"“Aspirated?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"カミラ","displayName":"Camilla","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r361","rowIndex":361,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ケーキをのどに詰まらせてるんだよ！　あんたらが来たからこんなことになったんだ！」","en":"“The cake is stuck in her throat! This happened because of you people!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"林田雄一","displayName":"Yuichi Hayashida","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r362","rowIndex":362,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=93>林田</tips>は真っ赤な顔でそう怒鳴る。","en":"<tips=93>Hayashida’s</tips> face turned scarlet as he shouted.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r363","rowIndex":363,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=67>カミラ</tips>はその剣幕に気圧されて一旦怯みをみせるが、すぐに舌打ちをして気を取り直し、銃口を<tips=83>美紗</tips>のこめかみにつけて、再度命じる。","en":"<tips=67>Camilla</tips> faltered for a moment under his fury. She clicked her tongue, recovered, pressed the muzzle against <tips=83>Misa’s</tips> temple, and repeated her order.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r364","rowIndex":364,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「乱暴はやめなさい！　嫌がってるでしょう？」","en":"“Stop hurting her! She clearly doesn’t want this.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"カミラ","displayName":"Camilla","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r365","rowIndex":365,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「邪魔しないでください。何か詰まっていたら、大変なことになってしまうこともあるんです」","en":"“Please don’t interfere. If something is lodged there, the consequences could be terrible.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"能見美紗","displayName":"Misa Nomi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r366","rowIndex":366,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　恐ろしい状況のはずだが、<tips=83>美紗</tips>は患者の様子をみるのに精一杯で、不思議とそこまでの恐怖を感じなかった。","en":"The situation should have terrified her, but <tips=83>Misa</tips> was too absorbed in the patient’s condition to feel nearly as frightened as she ought to have been.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r367","rowIndex":367,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「おい、お嬢ちゃん、どうした？」","en":"“Hey, young lady, what’s going on?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r368","rowIndex":368,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　部下が遠くから近づいて来る。","en":"One of her subordinates came over from across the hall.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r369","rowIndex":369,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いえ、なんでもないわ。向こうを見ていて」","en":"“It’s nothing. Keep watch over there.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"カミラ","displayName":"Camilla","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r370","rowIndex":370,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=67>カミラ</tips>は手を振って追い払う。","en":"<tips=67>Camilla</tips> waved him away.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r371","rowIndex":371,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その時、<tips=83>美紗</tips>の握っているノズルの先端がブルブルと震え、そして何かを吸い込んだ。","en":"At that moment, the tip of the nozzle in <tips=83>Misa’s</tips> hand began to shudder, then sucked something up.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r372","rowIndex":372,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あっ」","en":"“Ah!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"能見美紗","displayName":"Misa Nomi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r373","rowIndex":373,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それはホースを伝い、タンクに入ってグルグルと回転する。その黄色い塊は、ケーキのスポンジ部分だろう。","en":"It traveled through the hose, entered the tank, and spun around. The yellow lump was probably part of the cake’s sponge layer.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r374","rowIndex":374,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=93>林田</tips>さん、出ました！」","en":"“Mr. <tips=93>Hayashida</tips>, it’s out!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"能見美紗","displayName":"Misa Nomi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r375","rowIndex":375,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=83>美紗</tips>の報告に<tips=93>林田</tips>は無言で頷く。","en":"<tips=93>Hayashida</tips> answered <tips=83>Misa’s</tips> report with a silent nod.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r376","rowIndex":376,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それからしばらく吸ったが何も出ない。<tips=83>美紗</tips>はノズルを引き抜いて、そして机の上に置いてあったお手ふきでよだれまみれの老婆の口のまわりを拭った。","en":"She continued suctioning for a while, but nothing else emerged. <tips=83>Misa</tips> withdrew the nozzle, then used a wet towel lying upon the table to wipe the saliva from around the old woman’s mouth.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r377","rowIndex":377,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「血が出てるじゃない」","en":"“She’s bleeding.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"カミラ","displayName":"Camilla","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r378","rowIndex":378,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　お手ふきにピンク色のものが付着したのを見て、<tips=67>カミラ</tips>が呟く。","en":"<tips=67>Camilla</tips> murmured when she saw a pink stain upon the towel.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r379","rowIndex":379,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「御手洗さん。どう？　声が出る？」","en":"“Ms. Mitarai, how do you feel? Can you speak?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"能見美紗","displayName":"Misa Nomi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r380","rowIndex":380,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=83>美紗</tips>は<tips=67>カミラ</tips>を無視して御手洗にそう話しかける。","en":"Ignoring <tips=67>Camilla</tips>, <tips=83>Misa</tips> addressed Mitarai.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r381","rowIndex":381,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　御手洗は<tips=83>美紗</tips>に視線をやると、","en":"Mitarai turned her eyes toward <tips=83>Misa</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r382","rowIndex":382,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=83>能見</tips>さん、折り紙ちょうだいよ」","en":"“Ms. <tips=83>Nomi</tips>, give me some origami paper,”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r383","rowIndex":383,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　と、懇願した。","en":"she pleaded.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r384","rowIndex":384,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それは明瞭な声で、<tips=83>美紗</tips>と<tips=93>林田</tips>がほっと溜息をつくのが重なる。","en":"Her voice came out clearly, and <tips=83>Misa</tips> and <tips=93>Hayashida</tips> sighed in relief at the same time.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r385","rowIndex":385,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「折り紙ちょうだい。今日はお父さんが迎えに来るから鶴を折らなきゃいけないんだ」　","en":"“Give me some origami paper. My father is coming to pick me up today, so I have to fold him a crane.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r386","rowIndex":386,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　眉間に皺を寄せて、唇を細めて子供のように訴える御手洗の頭を<tips=83>美紗</tips>はくしゃっと撫でて、","en":"Mitarai pleaded like a child, brow furrowed and lips pursed. <tips=83>Misa</tips> tousled her hair.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r387","rowIndex":387,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あとであげるから、お部屋に戻っててね」","en":"“I’ll give you some later. Go back to your room for now.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"能見美紗","displayName":"Misa Nomi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r388","rowIndex":388,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　御手洗が何事もなかったように歩いて行くのを見守って、<tips=83>美紗</tips>は苦笑して立ち上がる。","en":"<tips=83>Misa</tips> watched Mitarai walk away as though nothing had occurred, then rose with a wry smile.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r389","rowIndex":389,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　本来ならば血圧や体温なども測りたいところだが、あれだけしっかりしていれば大丈夫だろうし、さすがにこの状況では難しい。","en":"Ordinarily, she would have wanted to take the patient’s blood pressure and temperature as well. But a woman who could speak that clearly was probably all right, and the present situation made it impossible in any case.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r390","rowIndex":390,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「おい、どこへ行くつもりだ」","en":"“Hey. Where do you think you’re going?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"カミラ","displayName":"Camilla","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r391","rowIndex":391,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=67>カミラ</tips>は銃を突きつけたまま低い声でそう脅す。","en":"<tips=67>Camilla</tips> kept the pistol trained upon her as she issued the threat in a low voice.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r392","rowIndex":392,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「掃除機を片付けてノズルを洗浄するんです」","en":"“I’m putting away the suction unit and washing the nozzle.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"能見美紗","displayName":"Misa Nomi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r393","rowIndex":393,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そうしてまっすぐ<tips=67>カミラ</tips>を見た<tips=83>美紗</tips>は、そこではじめて相手が金色の目をしていることに気がつく。","en":"When <tips=83>Misa</tips> looked directly at <tips=67>Camilla</tips>, she noticed for the first time that the other woman’s eyes were gold.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r394","rowIndex":394,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そんなことはしなくていい。この病院は今日で閉鎖するんだから」","en":"“There’s no need. This hospital is being shut down today.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"カミラ","displayName":"Camilla","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r395","rowIndex":395,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どういうことなんだ？　あんたたちは一体何がしたいんだ？　こんな滅茶苦茶なことをして……」","en":"“What do you mean? What are you people trying to accomplish after wreaking all this havoc...?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"林田雄一","displayName":"Yuichi Hayashida","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r396","rowIndex":396,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=93>林田</tips>は憤りを露わにして詰め寄った。<tips=67>カミラ</tips>は<tips=83>美紗</tips>に向けていた銃口をそちらに向け、","en":"<tips=93>Hayashida</tips> advanced with open indignation. <tips=67>Camilla</tips> swung the muzzle from <tips=83>Misa</tips> toward him.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r397","rowIndex":397,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「近づいたら撃つ」","en":"“Come any closer and I’ll shoot.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"カミラ","displayName":"Camilla","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r398","rowIndex":398,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして一歩下がって距離をとると、","en":"She took a step back to put some distance between them, then said,","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r399","rowIndex":399,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「さっき放送で言ったとおりよ。私たちはこの街で不当に虐げられている<tips=17>タイプB</tips>を救うために活動を行っている。今日は、ここに囚われている同胞たちを解放しに来たの」","en":"“It’s just as I said over the speakers. We’re fighting to save the <tips=17>Type Bs</tips> who are unjustly oppressed in this city. Today, we came to liberate our brethren imprisoned here.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"カミラ","displayName":"Camilla","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r400","rowIndex":400,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「解放って、何を言っているんですか？　ここの患者さんたちは、誰かの助けを借りなくてはとても生きていけない人ばっかりなんですよ？　意味もなく鍵のかかった病棟に入れているわけじゃありません。これは保護なんです」","en":"“Liberate? What are you talking about? None of the patients here could possibly live without someone’s help. We don’t keep them in a locked ward for no reason. We’re protecting them.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"能見美紗","displayName":"Misa Nomi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r401","rowIndex":401,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「私たちは大量の『<tips=46>ネオ・ローズ</tips>』を用意してきた」","en":"“We brought a large supply of <tips=46>Neo Rose</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"カミラ","displayName":"Camilla","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r402","rowIndex":402,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=67>カミラ</tips>は冷たく言い放ち、興奮気味に訴える<tips=83>美紗</tips>に銃口を戻す。","en":"<tips=67>Camilla</tips> delivered the words coldly and swung her gun back toward <tips=83>Misa</tips>, who had been pleading with growing agitation.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r403","rowIndex":403,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「みな理性を取り戻し、人間に戻るわ。そうなれば、もうお前らに動物のように飼育される必要はない」","en":"“They’ll all regain their reason and become human again. Then they won’t need you keeping them like animals anymore.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"カミラ","displayName":"Camilla","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r404","rowIndex":404,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして<tips=67>カミラ</tips>は銃口をしゃくって部屋の隅に行くよう指示し、","en":"Then <tips=67>Camilla</tips> jerked the muzzle of her gun toward a corner of the room, ordering them over there,","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r405","rowIndex":405,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そこで待っていろ。変な動きをしたらすぐに射殺する」","en":"“Wait over there. Make one suspicious move and I’ll shoot you dead on the spot.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"カミラ","displayName":"Camilla","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r406","rowIndex":406,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　言い捨てて、仲間たちの方へ歩いて行った。","en":"With that, she walked back toward her companions.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r407","rowIndex":407,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=83>美紗</tips>と<tips=93>林田</tips>は目線を合わせると無言で頷きあい、<tips=67>カミラ</tips>に言われた通りのろのろとホールの隅の方へ移動する。","en":"<tips=83>Misa</tips> and <tips=93>Hayashida</tips> met one another’s eyes and nodded without speaking. As <tips=67>Camilla</tips> had ordered, they moved slowly toward the corner of the hall.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r408","rowIndex":408,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その時、ちらと看護室の方へ目をやると、やはり血みどろの光景が目に入る。<tips=94>吉田主任</tips>はやっぱり死んでしまったんだろうか？　なんだか頭の一部が麻痺したようで、何もかもに現実感が感じられず、まるで悪夢を見ているような気分だった。","en":"When she stole a glance toward the nurses’ station, the same blood-soaked scene confronted her. Was <tips=94>Chief Yoshida</tips> really dead? Part of her mind seemed to have gone numb. Nothing around her felt real; it was as though she were trapped in a nightmare.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r409","rowIndex":409,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　職員たちは全員ホールに集められた。看護師も、看護助手も、たまたま診察をしていた医師も。三階だけではない。二階と四階の職員も、銃で脅されながらここへやって来た。中には肩を撃ち抜かれて血みどろになっている職員などもいる。別の看護師が、応急処置をしたいと訴え出たがその意見は黙殺された。","en":"Every member of staff was gathered in the hall: nurses, nursing assistants, even a doctor who happened to be examining patients. And not only those from the third floor. Staff from the second and fourth had been marched there at gunpoint. One had been shot through the shoulder and was covered in blood. Another nurse asked to provide first aid, but her request was ignored.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r410","rowIndex":410,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　六人の襲撃者もこのホールに全員集合している。彼らは<tips=67>カミラ</tips>を中心になにかこそこそと話し合っている。患者たちにはホールに来ないよう言っていたが、彼女たちはいってわかるような相手ではなく、しばしばホールに入って来ようとするのを襲撃者たちは怒鳴って追い返しながら相談を続けた。何を話しているのかはこちらまで届かない。","en":"All six attackers had assembled in the hall as well. They whispered together around <tips=67>Camilla</tips>. They had ordered the patients not to enter, but many were incapable of following such an instruction and repeatedly tried. The attackers shouted them back while their discussion continued. Their words did not carry to the staff.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r411","rowIndex":411,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　これからどうするつもりなのだろうかと<tips=83>美紗</tips>は思った。恐怖よりも困惑が心を支配していた。一方、隣では<tips=92>水村ナース</tips>が顔を両手で覆って泣いている。","en":"<tips=83>Misa</tips> wondered what they meant to do next. More than fear, it was bewilderment that had taken hold of her. Beside her, <tips=92>Nurse Mizumura</tips> covered her face with both hands and wept.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r412","rowIndex":412,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　他の階では<tips=94>吉田主任</tips>の他にも人死にが出ているらしい。彼らは殺人を躊躇しないのだ。襲撃者たちはずっと金色の目を保っているが、症状が出ているようではない。おそらく彼らも『<tips=46>ネオ・ローズ</tips>』を使っているのだろう。","en":"Apparently, <tips=94>Chief Yoshida</tips> was not the only one who had died; people had been killed on the other floors as well. These attackers did not hesitate to kill. Their eyes had remained gold the entire time, yet they showed no sign of symptoms. They too were probably using ‘<tips=46>Neo Rose</tips>.’","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r413","rowIndex":413,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=17>タイプB</tips>を正気に戻す魔法の薬。そういうものが街で流行しはじめていることは<tips=83>美紗</tips>も知っている。","en":"A magic medicine that restored <tips=17>Type Bs</tips> to sanity. <tips=83>Misa</tips> knew that something of the kind had begun to spread through the city.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r414","rowIndex":414,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　とるべき手段はない。<tips=95>金眼現象</tips>があらわれているときは筋力も反射神経も上昇し、おまけに銃まで持っている。これでは、いくら相手が少ないとは言えノーマルが束になってもかなわない。逃げ出しても無駄だろう。","en":"There was nothing to be done. When the <tips=95>gold-eye phenomenon</tips> appeared, muscular strength and reflexes increased—and these people carried guns besides. However few their number, even all the Normals together could not overcome them. Escape would surely be futile.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r415","rowIndex":415,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　やがて襲撃者たちの話がまとまったらしく、<tips=67>カミラ</tips>が職員たちの方を振り返った。","en":"At last the attackers appeared to reach a decision. <tips=67>Camilla</tips> turned toward the staff.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r416","rowIndex":416,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして何か言おうとしたとき、廊下の向こうからパタパタと足音がして、太った患者が入って来た。","en":"Just as she was about to speak, quick footsteps sounded in the corridor and an overweight patient entered.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r417","rowIndex":417,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　三十五才の、この病棟では比較的知性が残っている「優等生グループ」の一人廣田真奈美である。","en":"She was Manami Hirota, thirty-five years old and a member of the ward’s comparatively intelligent ‘model-patient group.’","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r418","rowIndex":418,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=82>内田</tips>さんが、う、う、<tips=82>内田</tips>さんが……」","en":"“Ms. <tips=82>Uchida</tips>... U-U... Ms. <tips=82>Uchida</tips>...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"廣田真奈美","displayName":"Manami Hirota","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r419","rowIndex":419,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　廣田は廊下の向こうを指さしながら、職員の方に向かって同じことを繰り返した。","en":"Hirota pointed down the corridor and repeated the words to the staff.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r420","rowIndex":420,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どうしたの？」","en":"“What happened?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"カミラ","displayName":"Camilla","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r421","rowIndex":421,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=67>カミラ</tips>が尋ねると、廣田はそちらに向き直って、","en":"At <tips=67>Camilla’s</tips> question, Hirota turned to face her.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r422","rowIndex":422,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「む、むこうでうんち漏らしちゃってるんです！」","en":"“Sh-she pooped herself over there!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"廣田真奈美","displayName":"Manami Hirota","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r423","rowIndex":423,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「うんち！？」","en":"“Poop?!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"カミラ","displayName":"Camilla","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r424","rowIndex":424,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=67>カミラ</tips>は驚きの声をあげる。","en":"<tips=67>Camilla</tips> cried out in surprise.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r425","rowIndex":425,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そ、それで、落ち着かなくて泣いちゃって、どうしようもなくて……」","en":"“A-and she can’t settle down, and she’s crying, and no one can do anything...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"廣田真奈美","displayName":"Manami Hirota","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r426","rowIndex":426,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「すみません！」","en":"“Excuse me!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"能見美紗","displayName":"Misa Nomi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r427","rowIndex":427,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　声をあげたのは、<tips=83>美紗</tips>だ。","en":"It was <tips=83>Misa</tips> who raised her voice.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r428","rowIndex":428,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=82>内田広美</tips>は彼女の受け持ちの患者だった。","en":"<tips=82>Hiromi Uchida</tips> was one of the patients assigned to her care.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r429","rowIndex":429,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=82>内田</tips>さんは人見知りが強くって、三階の職員以外だと暴れるんです。私が処置していいですか？」","en":"“Ms. <tips=82>Uchida</tips> is extremely shy around strangers. She becomes violent with anyone except the third-floor staff. May I take care of her?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"能見美紗","displayName":"Misa Nomi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r430","rowIndex":430,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「何もしなくていいわ。その人見知りも症状なんでしょう？　それなら、『<tips=46>ネオ・ローズ</tips>』を使えばすぐに正気に戻るはず」","en":"“Do nothing. That shyness is another symptom, isn’t it? <tips=46>Neo Rose</tips> should restore her sanity immediately.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"カミラ","displayName":"Camilla","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r431","rowIndex":431,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あなたたちに、便まみれの患者を落ち着けて、身体を清潔にしてあげながら、注射を打つことが出来るんですか？」","en":"“Can you calm a patient covered in excrement, clean her body, and give the injection at the same time?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"能見美紗","displayName":"Misa Nomi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r432","rowIndex":432,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=83>能見</tips>が食い下がると、<tips=67>カミラ</tips>たちはさすがに口ごもって顔を顰める。","en":"At <tips=83>Misa’s</tips> challenge, <tips=67>Camilla</tips> and the others fell silent and grimaced.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r433","rowIndex":433,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「わかった。作業をする人だけこっちに来なさい」","en":"“Fine. Only the people who’ll be helping her may come over here.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"カミラ","displayName":"Camilla","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r434","rowIndex":434,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「私一人じゃ無理です」","en":"“I can’t do it alone.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"能見美紗","displayName":"Misa Nomi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r435","rowIndex":435,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それなら、あと二人来て良いわ。はやくして」","en":"“Then two more of you can go. Hurry up.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"カミラ","displayName":"Camilla","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r436","rowIndex":436,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=67>カミラ</tips>の言葉に<tips=83>美紗</tips>は振り返り、<tips=92>水村ナース</tips>の方を見る。彼女も、普段通りの仕事を指示すれば少しは落ち着くだろうか？","en":"At <tips=67>Camilla’s</tips> answer, <tips=83>Misa</tips> turned toward <tips=92>Nurse Mizumura</tips>. Perhaps giving her the familiar routine of her usual work would help her calm down.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r437","rowIndex":437,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=92>水村</tips>さん、一緒に来て。……それから、<tips=93>林田</tips>さんも」","en":"“Ms. <tips=92>Mizumura</tips>, come with me. ...And you too, Mr. <tips=93>Hayashida</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"能見美紗","displayName":"Misa Nomi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r438","rowIndex":438,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「わかった」","en":"“All right.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"林田雄一","displayName":"Yuichi Hayashida","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r439","rowIndex":439,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=93>林田</tips>は頷くが、<tips=92>水村ナース</tips>は返事をしない。その肩を叩くと、びくっと身体全体を震わせる。","en":"<tips=93>Hayashida</tips> nodded, but <tips=92>Nurse Mizumura</tips> did not answer. When Misa tapped her on the shoulder, her entire body jerked in fright.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r440","rowIndex":440,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=92>水村</tips>さん、<tips=82>ヒロちゃん</tips>がやらかしちゃったの。一緒に来て」","en":"“Ms. <tips=92>Mizumura</tips>, <tips=82>Hiro’s</tips> gone and done it. Come with me.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"能見美紗","displayName":"Misa Nomi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r441","rowIndex":441,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=83>美紗</tips>はその手を握り、半ば引っ張るようにして彼女と共に駆け出す。","en":"<tips=83>Misa</tips> took her hand and ran, half dragging her along.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r442","rowIndex":442,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どこ？」","en":"“Where is she?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"能見美紗","displayName":"Misa Nomi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r443","rowIndex":443,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「の、<tips=83>能見</tips>さん、あっちです」","en":"“M-Ms. <tips=83>Nomi</tips>, over there.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"廣田真奈美","displayName":"Manami Hirota","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r444","rowIndex":444,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　廣田が指さすと、廊下の上に座り込んでいる<tips=82>広美</tips>の姿が目に入った。","en":"Following Hirota’s finger, they saw <tips=82>Hiromi</tips> sitting in the corridor.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r445","rowIndex":445,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=83>美紗</tips>たち三人がそちらへ向かうと、<tips=67>カミラ</tips>も一緒について来る。","en":"When <tips=83>Misa</tips> and the other two headed that way, <tips=67>Camilla</tips> came with them.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r446","rowIndex":446,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=82>内田広美</tips>はまだ十代の、この階でもっとも若い患者だ。本来ならば花も恥じらう年頃であるが、その症状は重く、精神状態はよくない。下半身がまったくの裸という状態で廊下の上に座り込んでいる。リノリウムの床の上にも、脱ぎ散らかしたズボンとパンツにも、彼女の尻や足にもべっとりと便が付着していた。そして、泣きながら両手で粘土のように便を練っている。","en":"<tips=82>Hiromi Uchida</tips> was still in her teens, the youngest patient on the floor. She should have been at an age when even flowers blushed before her beauty, but her symptoms were severe and her mental state profoundly disturbed. She sat in the corridor naked from the waist down. Excrement clung thickly to the linoleum, the trousers and underwear she had cast aside, her buttocks, and her legs. As she wept, she kneaded it between her hands like clay.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r447","rowIndex":447,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=67>カミラ</tips>はそれを見て、露骨に顔を顰めた。","en":"At the sight, <tips=67>Camilla</tips> made no attempt to hide her grimace.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r448","rowIndex":448,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=82>ヒロちゃん</tips>。うんち触っちゃだめだよ。汚れちゃうから」","en":"“<tips=82>Hiro</tips>, don’t touch the poop. You’ll get dirty.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"能見美紗","displayName":"Misa Nomi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r449","rowIndex":449,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=83>美紗</tips>はポケットにいつも何枚か入れている使い捨てのゴム手袋を手に装着しながら彼女の前にかがみ込んだ。","en":"<tips=83>Misa</tips> crouched before her while pulling on a pair of the disposable rubber gloves she always carried in her pocket.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r450","rowIndex":450,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「おれ、紙と着替えをとってくるよ」","en":"“I’ll get wipes and clean clothes.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"林田雄一","displayName":"Yuichi Hayashida","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r451","rowIndex":451,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そこは丁度倉庫の前だったので、<tips=93>林田</tips>はポケットから鍵を取り出すとそのドアを開けて中へ入って行く。","en":"They were directly in front of a supply room. <tips=93>Hayashida</tips> took a key from his pocket, opened the door, and went inside.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r452","rowIndex":452,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その間に<tips=83>美紗</tips>と<tips=92>水村ナース</tips>は<tips=82>広美</tips>の衣服を脱がしにかかる。","en":"Meanwhile, <tips=83>Misa</tips> and <tips=92>Nurse Mizumura</tips> began removing <tips=82>Hiromi’s</tips> clothes.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r453","rowIndex":453,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「全部ダメ？」","en":"“All of them?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"水村","displayName":"Mizumura","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r454","rowIndex":454,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ダメです。脱がせましょう」","en":"“They’re all soiled. Take everything off.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"能見美紗","displayName":"Misa Nomi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r455","rowIndex":455,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=92>水村ナース</tips>はまだ涙顔だったが、その手はテキパキと動いている。<tips=93>林田</tips>の動きも素早く、倉庫から汚物を捨てるためのゴミ袋、『ケーヨーヘルパー』という湿らせて使う身体ふきを一箱、新聞紙、消毒液の入ったスプレー、それから<tips=82>広美</tips>の着替えの上下一式を持って来ると手に取りやすい場所に置いてくれた。","en":"<tips=92>Nurse Mizumura’s</tips> face was still wet with tears, but her hands moved briskly. <tips=93>Hayashida</tips> was equally quick. He emerged from the supply room with a garbage bag for the waste, a box of Keiyo Helper body wipes to be moistened before use, newspaper, a spray bottle of disinfectant, and a complete change of clothing for <tips=82>Hiromi</tips>. He placed everything within easy reach.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r456","rowIndex":456,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　全ての衣服を脱ぎ全裸になった<tips=82>広美</tips>に、<tips=83>美紗</tips>と<tips=92>水村ナース</tips>の二人で話しかけ落ち着かせながら湿らせた身体ふきで肌に付着した便を拭い、汚れた身体ふきは広げた新聞紙の上に捨て、次々と新しいものに取り替える。","en":"Once <tips=82>Hiromi</tips> was naked, <tips=83>Misa</tips> and <tips=92>Nurse Mizumura</tips> spoke gently to settle her while wiping the excrement from her skin with the dampened body wipes. They discarded each soiled wipe upon spread-out newspaper and continually replaced it with a fresh one.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r457","rowIndex":457,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=93>林田</tips>は身体ふきをつかって床を汚す便をかきあつめ、ゴミ袋に捨てて行く。この大きく丈夫な身体ふきは割合高価なもので、掃除などに使ってあまりにも大量に消費するとコストがかかると事務の方から怒られたりもするのを<tips=83>美紗</tips>は思い出したが、今更そんなことを気にしてもしかたないと内心で苦笑した。","en":"<tips=93>Hayashida</tips> used the same wipes to gather the excrement from the floor and put it in the garbage bag. They were large and durable, but relatively expensive. <tips=83>Misa</tips> remembered being scolded by the administrative staff whenever they used too many for cleaning. There was no point worrying about cost now, though, and she smiled wryly to herself.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r458","rowIndex":458,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　現場には生々しい臭気が立ち上り、<tips=67>カミラ</tips>は顔を顰めている。彼女は顔を上げてふとまわりを見るが、この光景を見ているのはわずかのまともそうな患者だけで、他の多くは襲撃者にも失禁にも興味がなさそうに自室のベットの上で歌をうたったり、絵を描いたり、好きなことをしている。","en":"The raw stench rose around them, and <tips=67>Camilla</tips> kept grimacing. She lifted her head and glanced about. Only a handful of the more lucid patients watched. Most showed no interest in either the attackers or the incontinence. They remained upon their beds, singing, drawing pictures, and doing whatever else they pleased.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r459","rowIndex":459,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　汚物を完全に拭いとり、新しい清潔な衣服に着替えさせると、<tips=83>美紗</tips>と<tips=92>水村ナース</tips>は溜息をついた。<tips=93>林田</tips>は汚物がのった新聞紙を丸めるとゴミ袋の上に捨て、その口を縛る。そして消毒液を床の上にスプレーしはじめた。","en":"Once they had wiped away all the waste and changed her into fresh, clean clothes, <tips=83>Misa</tips> and <tips=92>Nurse Mizumura</tips> sighed. <tips=93>Hayashida</tips> rolled up the soiled newspaper, dropped it into the garbage bag, tied the bag closed, and began spraying the floor with disinfectant.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r460","rowIndex":460,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　最後に消臭スプレーをあたりにふりまくと、廊下も患者もすっかり元の状態に戻る。","en":"After a final spray of deodorizer, both the corridor and the patient looked almost exactly as they had before.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r461","rowIndex":461,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「慣れたもんだね」","en":"“You’ve clearly had practice.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"カミラ","displayName":"Camilla","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r462","rowIndex":462,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=67>カミラ</tips>は言いながら、『<tips=46>ネオ・ローズ</tips>』の注射キットを<tips=83>美紗</tips>に差し出す。","en":"As she spoke, <tips=67>Camilla</tips> held out a <tips=46>Neo Rose</tips> injection kit to <tips=83>Misa</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r463","rowIndex":463,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「このままでは注射出来ません。手を洗わせてください」","en":"“I can’t give the injection like this. Please let me wash my hands.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"能見美紗","displayName":"Misa Nomi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r464","rowIndex":464,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=67>カミラ</tips>が頷くと、<tips=83>美紗</tips>は立ち上がってすぐそばにあった洗面所で手を拭い、手の指に消毒用アルコールをなすりつけた。","en":"<tips=67>Camilla</tips> nodded. <tips=83>Misa</tips> rose, went to the nearby sink, wiped her hands, and disinfected her fingers with alcohol.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r465","rowIndex":465,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「これが『<tips=46>ネオ・ローズ</tips>』……」","en":"“So this is <tips=46>Neo Rose</tips>...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"能見美紗","displayName":"Misa Nomi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r466","rowIndex":466,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　こんな得体の知れぬものを患者に打っていいのか抵抗があったが、","en":"She recoiled at the thought of injecting a patient with something so completely unknown, but—","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r467","rowIndex":467,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「はやく打ちな。あなたたちもそれで、自分たちのこれまでの治療が間違っていたと理解するだろう」","en":"“Hurry and give it to her. Then even you will understand that everything you called treatment until now was wrong.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"カミラ","displayName":"Camilla","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r468","rowIndex":468,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　銃口を向けて脅されては実行するほかなかった。","en":"With a gun pointed at her, Misa had no choice but to obey.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r469","rowIndex":469,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いやだ、いやだ、いやだ！」","en":"“No! No! No!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"内田広美（入院金目）","displayName":"Hiromi Uchida (Hospitalized, Golden-Eyed)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r470","rowIndex":470,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　注射の準備をすると<tips=82>広美</tips>が暴れ出す。","en":"When Misa prepared the injection, <tips=82>Hiromi</tips> began to struggle.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r471","rowIndex":471,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どうしたんだ？」","en":"“What’s wrong with her?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"カミラ","displayName":"Camilla","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r472","rowIndex":472,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「珍しいですね。普段、注射には無反応なのに……いつもと雰囲気が違うのを理解しているのかしら……」","en":"“That’s unusual. She ordinarily shows no reaction to injections... Perhaps she understands that something feels different today...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"能見美紗","displayName":"Misa Nomi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r473","rowIndex":473,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いいから。無理矢理にでも注射しろ」","en":"“It doesn’t matter. Give it to her by force if you must.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"カミラ","displayName":"Camilla","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r474","rowIndex":474,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=67>カミラ</tips>は苦々しく顔を歪めて言った。","en":"<tips=67>Camilla’s</tips> face twisted bitterly as she spoke.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r475","rowIndex":475,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それに従い、<tips=93>林田</tips>が押さえつけて<tips=83>美紗</tips>が静脈に注射をする。看護師になって最初の職場であった循環器科でみっちりしこまれた彼女は若いながらに全ての手技に同僚からの定評があったが、注射や採血も手早い。あっという間に注射をやりとげてしまう。","en":"In obedience, <tips=93>Hayashida</tips> restrained Hiromi while <tips=83>Misa</tips> administered the drug intravenously. Her first job as a nurse had been in cardiology, where the technique had been drilled into her thoroughly. Despite her youth, her colleagues praised all of her practical skills, and she was especially quick with injections and blood draws. The procedure was over almost immediately.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r476","rowIndex":476,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「これで三十分もすれば、この子はもう症状から解放されているはずだ」","en":"“Within thirty minutes, this girl should be free of her symptoms.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"カミラ","displayName":"Camilla","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r477","rowIndex":477,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=67>カミラ</tips>は笑顔を浮かべて言う。","en":"<tips=67>Camilla</tips> smiled as she said it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r478","rowIndex":478,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=83>美紗</tips>にはどうしても信じられない。不治の病と言われ、医療者にはどうすることも出来なかった病気なのだ。この<tips=82>内田広美</tips>は症状が重く、人格が荒廃してほとんど人間離れしてしまっている。","en":"<tips=83>Misa</tips> simply could not believe it. The disease was said to be incurable, something medicine had been powerless to remedy. <tips=82>Hiromi Uchida</tips> suffered from severe symptoms; her personality had deteriorated so profoundly that she hardly seemed human anymore.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r479","rowIndex":479,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　もし彼女が正気だったら、どんな性格で、どんな人柄だったのか——それを想像したことはこれまで何度もあったが、それがこんな注射一本で叶ってしまうものなのだろうか？","en":"Misa had often imagined what Hiromi might have been like in her right mind. Could one injection truly make that vision real?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r480","rowIndex":480,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あの、処置室に行ってこれ捨てて来ていいですか？」","en":"“May I go to the treatment room and dispose of these?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"能見美紗","displayName":"Misa Nomi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r481","rowIndex":481,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=83>美紗</tips>は使い終わった注射器とアンプルの瓶を見せてそう尋ねた。","en":"<tips=83>Misa</tips> held up the used syringe and ampoule and asked what she should do with them.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r482","rowIndex":482,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「その辺りのゴミ箱に捨てればいいじゃないか」","en":"“Throw them into one of the garbage cans around here.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"カミラ","displayName":"Camilla","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r483","rowIndex":483,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「患者さんが悪戯するから、病棟のゴミ箱には捨てられません。医療廃棄物は専用のボックスがあるんです」","en":"“We can’t use the ward cans because the patients might play with them. Medical waste has a dedicated container.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"能見美紗","displayName":"Misa Nomi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r484","rowIndex":484,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「今更そんなことを気にしても仕方ないでしょうに」","en":"“What does any of that matter now?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"カミラ","displayName":"Camilla","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r485","rowIndex":485,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=67>カミラ</tips>は苦い顔をしたが、結局許可を出した。","en":"<tips=67>Camilla</tips> looked displeased, but finally granted permission.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r486","rowIndex":486,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　見張りの<tips=67>カミラ</tips>と共に処置室に足を踏み入れる。針は専用のボックスにいれ、残りのシリンジやアンプルの瓶はペダルを踏んで、医療廃棄物用のゴミ箱に投げ入れた。","en":"With <tips=67>Camilla</tips> guarding her, Misa entered the treatment room. She placed the needle in the dedicated sharps box, then stepped upon a pedal and threw the remaining syringe and ampoule into the medical-waste bin.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r487","rowIndex":487,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「これで終わりだね。ホールに戻りな」","en":"“You’re finished. Go back to the hall.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"カミラ","displayName":"Camilla","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r488","rowIndex":488,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あと、もう一つ」","en":"“There’s one more thing.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"能見美紗","displayName":"Misa Nomi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r489","rowIndex":489,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なんだ？」","en":"“What?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"カミラ","displayName":"Camilla","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r490","rowIndex":490,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「注射したあと落ち着かなかったから、ヒロミちゃんに頓服の薬を飲ませたいんです」","en":"“She remained agitated after the injection. I want to give Hiromi her PRN medication.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"能見美紗","displayName":"Misa Nomi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r491","rowIndex":491,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「すぐに『<tips=46>ネオ・ローズ</tips>』が効くから必要ないわ」","en":"“<tips=46>Neo Rose</tips> will begin working soon. She doesn’t need it.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"カミラ","displayName":"Camilla","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r492","rowIndex":492,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「でもあの子、一度便失禁すると立て続けにやらかす癖があって。水を飲ませるだけでも気持ち的に落ち着いてよくなるんです」","en":"“But once she soils herself, she has a habit of doing it again and again. Even just giving her some water helps her calm down, and then she usually gets better.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"能見美紗","displayName":"Misa Nomi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r493","rowIndex":493,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……わかった」","en":"“...Very well.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"カミラ","displayName":"Camilla","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r494","rowIndex":494,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　先ほどの廊下の惨状を思い出したのか、<tips=67>カミラ</tips>は顔を顰めて頷いた。","en":"Perhaps remembering the earlier scene in the corridor, <tips=67>Camilla</tips> grimaced and nodded.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r495","rowIndex":495,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして<tips=83>美紗</tips>は処置室から、隣の看護室に移動する。そこではじめて彼女は、<tips=94>吉田主任</tips>の死体を直接見ることとなった。","en":"<tips=83>Misa</tips> moved from the treatment room into the adjoining nurses’ station. It was there that she saw <tips=94>Chief Yoshida’s</tips> corpse directly for the first time.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r496","rowIndex":496,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ああ……」","en":"“Oh...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"能見美紗","displayName":"Misa Nomi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r497","rowIndex":497,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　息が止まりそうな衝撃で、そして涙がぽろぽろとこぼれ落ちた。","en":"The shock took her breath away, and tears spilled one after another down her cheeks.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r498","rowIndex":498,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　あんなに優しく、みなのことをよく考えていた主任がどうしてこんなことに。","en":"How could this have happened to the chief, when she had always been so kind and thoughtful toward everyone?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r499","rowIndex":499,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　嗚咽しながら、震える手でカウンターの下の棚から<tips=82>広美</tips>の落ち着かない時のために処方されている薬を一包取り出した。","en":"Sobbing, Misa reached a trembling hand into the cabinet beneath the counter and removed one packet of the medicine prescribed for <tips=82>Hiromi’s</tips> periods of agitation.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r500","rowIndex":500,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして<tips=82>広美</tips>のところへ戻った。","en":"Then she returned to <tips=82>Hiromi</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r501","rowIndex":501,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女の目の前でコップの水道水に液状の薬を混ぜてやると、<tips=83>美紗</tips>が何も言う前から奪うようにコップを奪い取り、ごくごくと喉を鳴らして飲んだ。食べ物でも、薬でも、口から入るものを与えられるとなんでも夢中で飲み込むのが彼女の癖だ。","en":"Right in front of Hiromi, <tips=83>Misa</tips> mixed the liquid medicine into a cup of tap water. Before Misa could say anything, Hiromi snatched the cup and gulped it down noisily. Whenever she was given anything by mouth—food or medicine—Hiromi would swallow it eagerly; it was a habit of hers.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r502","rowIndex":502,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「これでおわり。あとはお部屋に帰って大人しくしてなさい」","en":"“That’s all. Go back to your room and behave now.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"能見美紗","displayName":"Misa Nomi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r503","rowIndex":503,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　差し出すコップを受け取りながら<tips=83>美紗</tips>が言うと、<tips=82>広美</tips>は頷いて自分の病室へ戻っていった。","en":"<tips=83>Misa</tips> said this as she took back the cup <tips=82>Hiromi</tips> held out to her. Hiromi nodded and returned to her room.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r504","rowIndex":504,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「じゃあ、仲間のところへ戻るぞ」","en":"“Now go back to the others.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"カミラ","displayName":"Camilla","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r505","rowIndex":505,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=67>カミラ</tips>の言葉で、二人は廊下をホールの方へ歩き出す。","en":"At <tips=67>Camilla’s</tips> words, the two of them started down the corridor toward the hall.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r506","rowIndex":506,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あの子はいつもあんな感じなの？」","en":"“Is that girl always like this?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"カミラ","displayName":"Camilla","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r507","rowIndex":507,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうです。今日はまだマシなほうで……。普段は保護室を出たり入ったりしていますから」","en":"“Yes. She isn't even that bad today... Usually she's in and out of the seclusion room.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"能見美紗","displayName":"Misa Nomi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r508","rowIndex":508,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「哀れなことだ。でも、それは今日でおしまいだ。これからは普通の子のように外で生活することが出来る。もうこんな病院は必要ないんだ」","en":"“Poor thing. But that ends today. From now on, she'll be able to live outside like an ordinary girl. There won't be any need for a hospital like this anymore.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"カミラ","displayName":"Camilla","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r509","rowIndex":509,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうでしょうか」","en":"“Will she?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"能見美紗","displayName":"Misa Nomi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r510","rowIndex":510,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　意を決して<tips=83>美紗</tips>が立ち止まると、<tips=67>カミラ</tips>は振り返った。","en":"<tips=83>Misa</tips> stopped, gathering her resolve. <tips=67>Camilla</tips> turned back toward her.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r511","rowIndex":511,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「『<tips=46>ネオ・ローズ</tips>』が本当に症状を消し去るなら、それで元の生活に戻る患者さんがたくさんいるのはわかります。でも、すぐに解決出来るとは思えません。<tips=82>ヒロちゃん</tips>はちっちゃい頃からここにいて、外の世界のことなんか何もしりませんから……」","en":"“If <tips=46>Neo Rose</tips> truly eliminates the symptoms, I understand that many patients will be able to return to their former lives. But I don’t believe everything will be solved immediately. <tips=82>Hiro</tips> has lived here since she was little. She knows nothing about the world outside...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"能見美紗","displayName":"Misa Nomi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r512","rowIndex":512,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「だからって、ここに閉じ込めておこうというのか？」","en":"“So you mean to keep her locked in here?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"カミラ","displayName":"Camilla","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r513","rowIndex":513,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうじゃないんです。出たあとのことをちゃんと考えているのか、知りたいんです。<tips=82>ヒロちゃん</tips>だけじゃありません。ここで何十年も暮らしたお婆ちゃんとかはどうなるんですか？　彼女たちは<tips=17>タイプB</tips>の症状だけじゃなく、認知症を患っているし、やっぱり世間のことなんか全然わからない。<tips=17>タイプB</tips>以外の病気に罹ってるひともたくさんいます。そうした人たちが社会に復帰するためには、どうしたって誰かの手伝いがいるんです。それに復帰が出来ないひとだって……そういうことをちゃんと考えているんですか？　そんな、銃なんか振り回して、全部をメチャクチャにして……」","en":"“That’s not what I mean. I want to know whether you’ve really thought about what happens after they get out. This isn’t just about <tips=82>Hiro</tips>. What will happen to the old women who’ve lived here for decades? They don’t just have symptoms of <tips=17>Type B</tips>; they also suffer from dementia, and they don’t know anything about the outside world. Many of them have illnesses besides <tips=17>Type B</tips>. If people like that are going to return to society, they’ll need someone’s help, no matter what. And some of them won’t be able to return at all... Have you really thought through any of this? Waving guns around and turning everything into a complete mess...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"能見美紗","displayName":"Misa Nomi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r514","rowIndex":514,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ごちゃごちゃとうるさいね」","en":"“Enough of this prattle.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"カミラ","displayName":"Camilla","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r515","rowIndex":515,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=67>カミラ</tips>は首を横に振り、溜息をつく。","en":"<tips=67>Camilla</tips> shook her head and sighed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r516","rowIndex":516,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして真剣な顔で<tips=83>能見</tips>の額に銃を当て、","en":"Then she pressed her gun against <tips=83>Misa’s</tips> forehead, her expression serious.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r517","rowIndex":517,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「私たちはもう決めたの。何があってもノーマルの手は借りないって」","en":"“We've already made our decision. Whatever happens, we won't accept any help from Normals.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"カミラ","displayName":"Camilla","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r518","rowIndex":518,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして彼女は引き金を引いた。銃声が鳴り響き、ホールでは悲鳴が上がる。","en":"She pulled the trigger. A shot rang out, and screams rose from the hall.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r519","rowIndex":519,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　襲撃者たちは残りの職員を一人残らず殺害したあと、動揺する患者たちを捕まえて『<tips=46>ネオ・ローズ</tips>』の投与をはじめた。","en":"The attackers killed every last remaining member of staff, then began capturing the agitated patients and administering <tips=46>Neo Rose</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r520","rowIndex":520,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　A棟に向かった<tips=10>道夫</tips>たちのチームは打ち合わせ通りの行動をとった。","en":"<tips=10>Michio’s</tips> team in Building A followed the agreed plan.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r521","rowIndex":521,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　制圧して職員たちを一カ所に集めると、彼らに『<tips=46>ネオ・ローズ</tips>』のアンプルを渡して患者たちに投与させた。患者の扱いや注射の技術になれた彼らを使うことで、事態はスムーズに行われる。作業中に患者が妄想などに取り憑かれてパニックを起こしても、彼らはなだめるすべを知っていた。","en":"After securing the building and gathering the staff in one place, they gave them ampoules of <tips=46>Neo Rose</tips> and ordered them to administer it to the patients. Using people accustomed to handling patients and giving injections allowed the work to proceed smoothly. When a patient panicked in the grip of a delusion, the staff knew how to calm them.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r522","rowIndex":522,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それを見ながら<tips=10>道夫</tips>は、職員たちと患者の間にもある種の信頼関係が生まれているのを感じた。もちろん、病院や職員を憎むものもいたが、そうでないものも少なくはない。","en":"Watching, <tips=10>Michio</tips> sensed that a certain trust had formed between the staff and patients. Some patients hated the hospital and its employees, of course, but many did not.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r523","rowIndex":523,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「地下室で拘束されていたような連中はともかく、ここの全員を解放する必要はあったのかな？　なんだか患者に対して、おれらが酷いことをしているみたいじゃないか」","en":"“The people they had tied up in the basement are one thing, but did we really need to set everyone here free? It feels like we're the ones doing something terrible to the patients.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫","displayName":"Michio Mido","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r524","rowIndex":524,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼は傍らの<tips=66>紺太</tips>にぼんやりそう呟いた。","en":"He murmured this absently to <tips=66>Konta</tips>, who stood beside him.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r525","rowIndex":525,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それは、まだ彼らが症状にとらわれてるからじゃない？　『<tips=46>ネオ・ローズ</tips>』の効き目が出始めれば彼らも喜ぶって」","en":"“Isn’t that because they’re still trapped by the symptoms? Once <tips=46>Neo Rose</tips> starts working, they’ll be happy too.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"田中紺太","displayName":"Konta Tanaka","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r526","rowIndex":526,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうかな。散々使っておいてなんだけど、おれはまだどうも、この薬を信じ切れないんだよなあ」","en":"“Will they? It’s rich for me to say after using so much of it, but I still can’t bring myself to trust this medicine completely.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫","displayName":"Michio Mido","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r527","rowIndex":527,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=10>道夫</tips>は溜息をつく。今更迷っていても仕方ないとは、わかっているのだが。","en":"<tips=10>Michio</tips> sighed. There was no point in wavering now—he understood that.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r528","rowIndex":528,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　全員の患者に投与が終わると、職員たちはみな縛り上げて、管理棟に連れて行きそこで一カ所にまとめて見張ることになっている。そうして患者たちが『<tips=46>ネオ・ローズ</tips>』によって自分を取り戻すのを待ち、目覚めたら彼らと共に病院を脱出する。それが事前に決めた計画だった。","en":"When all the patients had received the medicine, the plan was to bind the staff, take them to administration, and keep them under guard in one place. They would wait for <tips=46>Neo Rose</tips> to restore the patients’ sense of self, then leave the hospital with those who awakened. That was the arrangement made beforehand.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r529","rowIndex":529,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　雨の中銃を突きつけて移動を終えたが、他のチームはまだ誰も職員をこちらに移動させていない。無線で連絡を取り、そこで<tips=10>道夫</tips>は他のチームが事前の作戦とは違う行動をとったことを知った。","en":"They completed the move through the rain at gunpoint, yet neither of the other teams had brought any staff to administration. <tips=10>Michio</tips> radioed them and learned that they had departed from the plan agreed upon beforehand.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r530","rowIndex":530,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　暴力的な患者を収容するC棟に向かった檜垣のチームは、制圧の際に患者がまとまって脱走をしたりし、それの対処をするのに手間取ったが、そろそろ終わる頃合いだそうだ。一方、女子病棟のB棟に向かった<tips=67>カミラ</tips>のチームは先に職員を殺してしまって、患者たちがパニックを起こして制御出来ず、遅々として薬の投与が進まないと言う。","en":"Higaki's team had gone to Building C, which housed the violent patients. Groups of them had escaped during the takeover, and dealing with that had cost the team time, but they reported that they were nearly finished. <tips=67>Camilla's</tips> team, meanwhile, had gone to Building B, the women's ward, and killed the staff first. The patients had panicked beyond their control, and they were making scarcely any progress administering the medicine.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r531","rowIndex":531,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なんでそんなことをしたんだい？　それじゃあ時間がかかるに決まってるだろう」","en":"“Why would you do that? Of course it was going to take longer this way.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫","displayName":"Michio Mido","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r532","rowIndex":532,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=10>道夫</tips>はめまいを感じながら<tips=67>カミラ</tips>にそう言った。","en":"<tips=10>Michio</tips> felt dizzy as he spoke to <tips=67>Camilla</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r533","rowIndex":533,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"『他に方法はありません。彼らは非協力的でした』","en":"‘There was no alternative. They refused to cooperate.’","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r534","rowIndex":534,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=67>カミラ</tips>はあくまで正当性を主張して譲らない。","en":"<tips=67>Camilla</tips> remained adamant that her actions had been justified.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r535","rowIndex":535,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=10>道夫</tips>は言い争うつもりはなかったので、すぐに仲間を何人か連れて応援に向かうことにした。","en":"<tips=10>Michio</tips> did not intend to argue. He immediately took several companions and set off to assist her.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r536","rowIndex":536,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「おい、お前は来なくて良いんだよ」","en":"“Hey. You don’t need to come.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫","displayName":"Michio Mido","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r537","rowIndex":537,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=10>道夫</tips>は付いてこようとする<tips=62>マリア</tips>に向かってそう言った。","en":"<tips=10>Michio</tips> said this to <tips=62>Maria</tips>, who was trying to follow him.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r538","rowIndex":538,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「大丈夫、こっちはもうダレもこないから」","en":"“It’s all right. No one else will come here.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"マリア","displayName":"Maria","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r539","rowIndex":539,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=62>マリア</tips>はにっこり笑って言う。","en":"<tips=62>Maria</tips> smiled broadly.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r540","rowIndex":540,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なんで？」","en":"“Why not?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫","displayName":"Michio Mido","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r541","rowIndex":541,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ケイビインがクルといけないから<tips=62>マリア</tips>のこれって言ったんでしょ？　それなら、あいつらがいなければいいと思って、みんなやっつけてきた。<tips=62>マリア</tips>かしこいからほめろ」","en":"“You said <tips=62>Maria</tips> could use this because it would be bad if the guards came, right? So Maria thought everything would be fine if they were gone, and took them all out. <tips=62>Maria</tips> is clever. Praise her.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"マリア","displayName":"Maria","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r542","rowIndex":542,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=10>道夫</tips>は呆れ、溜息をつき、彼女を説得するのを諦めた。","en":"<tips=10>Michio</tips> stared in disbelief, sighed, and abandoned the attempt to reason with her.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r543","rowIndex":543,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして駆けつけたB棟は目を覆いたくなるような地獄絵図だった。ホールには白衣を着た男女の射殺体が折り重なって転がり、遺体から流れ出た血液が床の大半を真っ赤に染めている。壁には誕生日会の飾り付けが銃弾で破壊されてぶらさがっている。病棟のあちこちから、女性患者が泣き叫ぶ金切り声と、隊員の怒声が聞こえてくる。そして顔を覆いたくなるほどの悪臭。","en":"When he reached Building B, he found a hellscape almost too terrible to look upon. The bodies of men and women in white coats lay shot dead in heaps across the hall, their blood staining most of the floor bright red. Birthday decorations hung in tatters from the walls where bullets had torn through them. From every corner of the ward came the piercing screams of female patients and the angry shouts of the unit's fighters. And over it all hung a stench that made him want to cover his face.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r544","rowIndex":544,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして良く見ると、職員たちの死体のなかに老婆が一人混じっている。近づいてみると、それも胸に銃弾を受けていた。","en":"Looking more carefully, Michio saw an old woman mixed among the bodies of the staff. When he approached, he found that she too had been shot through the chest.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r545","rowIndex":545,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=10>道夫</tips>が呆然と眺めているところに<tips=67>カミラ</tips>がやって来る。","en":"As <tips=10>Michio</tips> stood staring in shock, <tips=67>Camilla</tips> came over.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r546","rowIndex":546,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いくら薬の効き目を説明しても理解しない患者が手こずらせています」","en":"“Patients who refuse to understand the benefits of the medicine are causing considerable difficulty.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"カミラ","displayName":"Camilla","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r547","rowIndex":547,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そりゃ理解出来ないから入院してるんだろうに。……しっかし、随分派手にやったな。解放すべき患者さんまで殺してるじゃないか」","en":"“Of course they don’t understand—that’s why they’re in the hospital. ...Still, you really went overboard. You even killed patients we were supposed to liberate.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫","displayName":"Michio Mido","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r548","rowIndex":548,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ただの事故です。自分から射線に飛び込んで来たんですよ」","en":"“It was only an accident. She threw herself into the line of fire.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"カミラ","displayName":"Camilla","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r549","rowIndex":549,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「職員を殺さないでくれって、かばおうとしたんじゃないか？」","en":"“Wasn’t she trying to protect the staff and asking you not to kill them?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫","displayName":"Michio Mido","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r550","rowIndex":550,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「知りませんよ。発症者の考えることなんか……」","en":"“I have no idea. Who knows what someone in the grip of symptoms is thinking...?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"カミラ","displayName":"Camilla","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r551","rowIndex":551,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=67>カミラ</tips>が顔を歪める。","en":"<tips=67>Camilla’s</tips> face twisted.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r552","rowIndex":552,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　——こいつ。","en":"—Damn her.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r553","rowIndex":553,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　腹が立ったが、ここで争っても仕方がない。<tips=10>道夫</tips>たちも逃げ惑う患者を追いかけ、捕まえて、むりやりその腕に『<tips=46>ネオ・ローズ</tips>』の注射を行った。","en":"It made him angry, but there was no point in starting a fight here. <tips=10>Michio</tips> and the others joined in chasing down the fleeing patients, catching them, and forcibly injecting their arms with <tips=46>Neo Rose</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r554","rowIndex":554,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「逃げちゃだめだよ」","en":"“You mustn’t run away.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"マリア","displayName":"Maria","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r555","rowIndex":555,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=62>マリア</tips>もその能力を活かして、逃げる患者の前に回り込んだりして作業を手伝う。","en":"<tips=62>Maria</tips> put her ability to use as well, circling ahead to cut off fleeing patients and helping with the operation however she could.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r556","rowIndex":556,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そうしている間に、他の棟の患者には薬が効き始めたという連絡が<tips=10>道夫</tips>の元に届いた。そして患者たちは次々と病院を出て行く。行く場所がある患者は好きにさせ、どこにも行けない患者は<tips=21>八龍会</tips>でひきとることになっている。患者の三分の一程度は帰る場所がなくこのまま隊員と行動を共にすることになったようだ。","en":"While this was going on, <tips=10>Michio</tips> received word that the medicine had begun to take effect on the patients in the other wings. The patients then left the hospital one after another. Those with somewhere to go were free to do as they pleased, while the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips> would take in those who had nowhere to go. About a third of the patients had no home to return to and apparently would remain with the unit for the time being.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r557","rowIndex":557,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして<tips=10>道夫</tips>が応援に駆けつけたB棟の患者たちも、次々とその本来の人格を取り戻してゆく。最初に正気に戻ったのは、誰よりも早く注射を打たれることとなった<tips=82>内田広美</tips>だった。","en":"The patients in Building B, where <tips=10>Michio</tips> had come to help, began regaining their true selves one after another. The first to return to her senses was <tips=82>Hiromi Uchida</tips>, who had also been the first among them to receive an injection.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r558","rowIndex":558,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女は裸足のままホールまでやって来る。その目は相変わらず金色ではあったが、先ほどまでと違って理性による敏捷な動きを見せている。","en":"She came into the hall barefoot. Her eyes were still gold, but unlike before, there was a keen, rational alertness in her movements.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r559","rowIndex":559,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ああ……なんてこと……」","en":"“Oh... how terrible...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"内田広美（入院金目）","displayName":"Hiromi Uchida (Hospitalized, Golden-Eyed)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r560","rowIndex":560,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　職員たちの死体の山を見ると、魂が抜かれたような放心の表情でそうつぶやいた。職員の死に衝撃を受けているのだ。","en":"She stared at the heap of staff corpses and murmured with the vacant expression of someone whose soul had left her body. The sight of their deaths had stunned her.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r561","rowIndex":561,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=10>道夫</tips>は声をかけることが出来ず、いたましい気持ちでその横顔を見ていた。","en":"<tips=10>Michio</tips> could find no words for her. He could only watch her grief-stricken profile, his heart aching.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r562","rowIndex":562,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=82>広美</tips>は遺体のなかからひとつ、若い女性看護師の姿を見つけると、そこに駆け寄る。","en":"Among the bodies, <tips=82>Hiromi</tips> found a young female nurse and hurried toward her.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r563","rowIndex":563,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=83>能見</tips>さん……」","en":"“Ms. <tips=83>Nomi</tips>...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"内田広美（入院金目）","displayName":"Hiromi Uchida (Hospitalized, Golden-Eyed)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r564","rowIndex":564,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女はかがみ込んで手を伸ばすと、額に銃弾による穴の開いた<tips=83>美紗</tips>の頬に触れた。","en":"She crouched, reached out, and touched the cheek of <tips=83>Misa</tips>, whose forehead had been pierced by a bullet.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r565","rowIndex":565,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　もう冷たくなっており、肌も土気色に変色しはじめている。それは人のかたちをしているが、こう変わり果ててしまうとなにか別の物にしか見えない。","en":"The body was already cold, and its skin was beginning to turn an earthen gray. It still had a human shape, but in such a terribly altered state, it looked like something else entirely.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r566","rowIndex":566,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=82>広美</tips>はポタポタと涙を落とす。","en":"Tears dripped steadily from <tips=82>Hiromi's</tips> eyes.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r567","rowIndex":567,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どう、本来の自分を取り戻した気分は？」","en":"“How does it feel to have your true self back?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"カミラ","displayName":"Camilla","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r568","rowIndex":568,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=67>カミラ</tips>がそう声をかけると、<tips=82>広美</tips>は立ち上がり、きっとこちらを睨み付ける。","en":"At <tips=67>Camilla’s</tips> question, <tips=82>Hiromi</tips> rose and glared fiercely at her.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r569","rowIndex":569,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あなたは誤解しているわ。そこに転がっている連中は、あなたを治すことも出来ないのに、閉じ込めていたのよ？」","en":"“You misunderstand. Those people lying there locked you away even though they were incapable of curing you.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"カミラ","displayName":"Camilla","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r570","rowIndex":570,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「絶対に許さない……」","en":"“I will never forgive you...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"内田広美（入院金目）","displayName":"Hiromi Uchida (Hospitalized, Golden-Eyed)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r571","rowIndex":571,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=82>広美</tips>は聞く耳を持たず、らんらんと光る目で、<tips=67>カミラ</tips>と<tips=10>道夫</tips>を交互に睨む。","en":"<tips=82>Hiromi</tips> refused to listen. Her blazing eyes moved between <tips=67>Camilla</tips> and <tips=10>Michio</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r572","rowIndex":572,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=67>カミラ</tips>は溜息をついて、","en":"<tips=67>Camilla</tips> sighed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r573","rowIndex":573,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あなたはね……」","en":"“You see—”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"カミラ","displayName":"Camilla","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r574","rowIndex":574,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そう口を開いた時だった、<tips=67>カミラ</tips>は視線に気がついて背後を振り返る。","en":"Just as she began to speak, <tips=67>Camilla</tips> sensed someone’s gaze and turned to look behind her.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r575","rowIndex":575,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　するとそこには、六人ほどの患者たちが並んでこちらに視線を向けていた。まだ彼女たちの表情はゆるみ、目つきもどこかおかしく、『<tips=46>ネオ・ローズ</tips>』の効き目は現れていないように見えた。","en":"About six patients stood there in a row, looking toward them. Their faces remained slack and something about their gazes was strange. <tips=46>Neo Rose</tips> did not yet appear to have taken effect.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r576","rowIndex":576,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あなたたち、もう注射は終わった？　終わってないなら、ここに注射があるから……」","en":"“Have all of you had your injections? If not, we have medicine here...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"カミラ","displayName":"Camilla","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r577","rowIndex":577,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=67>カミラ</tips>の言葉に患者たちは反応を示さず、じっと死体を見つめ続ける。そのうち、一人が手を合わせて念仏を唱えはじめると、その隣も同じように手を合わせ、見よう見まねでむにゃむにゃとやりはじめた。","en":"The patients gave no sign that they had heard <tips=67>Camilla</tips> and continued staring fixedly at the bodies. Before long, one of them pressed her hands together and began chanting a Buddhist prayer. The woman beside her followed suit, putting her own hands together and mumbling along as best she could.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r578","rowIndex":578,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「やめなさいよ！」","en":"“Stop that!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"カミラ","displayName":"Camilla","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r579","rowIndex":579,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=67>カミラ</tips>は近づいて、あわせた手を横からはたく。","en":"<tips=67>Camilla</tips> approached and struck the clasped hands aside.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r580","rowIndex":580,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ひっ、こわいっ」","en":"“Eek! You're frightening!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r581","rowIndex":581,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　叩かれた老人は<tips=67>カミラ</tips>を怯えた目で見て、","en":"The old woman whose hands had been struck looked at <tips=67>Camilla</tips> in terror.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r582","rowIndex":582,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あんたたち、地獄から来た悪魔だね！　私たちを地獄にツレに来たんだ！」","en":"“You’re demons from hell! You’ve come to take us away to hell!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r583","rowIndex":583,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　とヒステリックに叫ぶ。","en":"she shrieked hysterically.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r584","rowIndex":584,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　すると隣のヘッドガードをかぶった中年女がその袖を引き、","en":"The middle-aged woman beside her, who wore a protective helmet, tugged at her sleeve.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r585","rowIndex":585,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「違うよ。ロンドンから私を迎えに来たんだよ。私は女王なんだから」","en":"“That isn’t right. They came from London to collect me. I’m the queen.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r586","rowIndex":586,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　と窘めた。","en":"she admonished her.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r587","rowIndex":587,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あははは、おもしろーい」","en":"“Ahahaha! That’s funny!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"マリア","displayName":"Maria","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r588","rowIndex":588,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そう笑ったのは、いつの間にか部屋の隅の方の椅子に腰掛けて様子を眺めていた<tips=62>マリア</tips>である。","en":"The one laughing was <tips=62>Maria</tips>, who had apparently taken a seat in a corner of the room at some point and was watching the scene unfold.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r589","rowIndex":589,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いいから、二人ともこっちに来なさい！」","en":"“Enough. Both of you, come here!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"カミラ","displayName":"Camilla","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r590","rowIndex":590,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=67>カミラ</tips>は二人の首根っこを掴むと、そのまま病室で注射を打っている仲間たちの方へ歩きはじめる。","en":"<tips=67>Camilla</tips> seized both women by the scruffs of their necks and began dragging them toward her comrades, who were administering injections in the patient rooms.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r591","rowIndex":591,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その途中で首をねじって<tips=10>道夫</tips>の方を振り返ると、","en":"Along the way, she looked back over her shoulder toward <tips=10>Michio</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r592","rowIndex":592,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ほら、<tips=10>見土</tips>さんたちもぼんやり見てないで、手伝ってください！　その人たちがもう『<tips=46>ネオ・ローズ</tips>』を打ったのかどうか、確認して、まだだったら打ってください」","en":"“<tips=10>Mr. Mido</tips>, you and the others—stop standing there and help! Find out whether those people have received <tips=46>Neo Rose</tips>. If they haven’t, inject them.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"カミラ","displayName":"Camilla","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r593","rowIndex":593,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　感情的になってそう命じた。","en":"She issued the order in an agitated voice.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r594","rowIndex":594,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「わかったよ」","en":"“All right.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫","displayName":"Michio Mido","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X11:r595","rowIndex":595,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=10>道夫</tips>はまだこちらを睨み付けている<tips=82>広美</tips>の方をチラと見てから溜息をつき、そしてホールの入り口のところでぼうっと立ったままの患者たちの方へ向かって歩きはじめた。","en":"<tips=10>Michio</tips> stole a glance at <tips=82>Hiromi</tips>, who was still glaring at him, and sighed. Then he started toward the patients who remained standing in a daze by the entrance to the hall.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}}]},{"position":48,"code":"D3","unitId":"D3","rows":[{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r1","rowIndex":1,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　あの発症の夜から<tips=44>筱喬</tips>がおかしい。","en":"Something has been strange about <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> ever since the night she suffered onset.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r2","rowIndex":2,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　いや、<tips=17>タイプB</tips>特有のあのエキセントリックな症状的な意味でおかしいというのではない。あのネオなんちゃらという薬は本当によく出来たもので、幻聴だの妄想だのといった<tips=17>タイプＢ</tips>の症状は完全におさまってしまった。","en":"No, I don’t mean strange in the sense of those eccentric symptoms peculiar to a <tips=17>Type B</tips>. That Neo-whatever drug is astonishingly effective. The auditory hallucinations, delusions, and other symptoms of <tips=17>Type B</tips> onset have disappeared completely.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r3","rowIndex":3,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　テレビのドキュメンタリー番組などで、医者は深刻な顔で治るものではないと重苦しく言ったり、発症した人の親などが号泣している場面を見たことがあり、いやあ、<tips=17>タイプB</tips>ってのは実に深刻なものなのだなあ。悲惨なものなのだなあ。世の中ってなかなかキビシいもんですね。などと、私は一人テレビの前で他人の不幸に勝手に共感して勝手に世界のおそろしさを味わっていたのだけれど、あのドキュメンタリーってなんだったの一体？　注射一本で治るじゃん。ともう、本当に馬鹿馬鹿しくなるくらい症状が完全に消えている。いや、いいことなんだけれどもね。","en":"I’d seen those television documentaries where doctors put on grave faces and somberly announced that there was no cure, or the parents of someone who had suffered onset sobbed uncontrollably before the cameras. So this <tips=17>Type B</tips> business really is serious, I’d thought. How tragic. The world is a cruel place, isn’t it? Sitting alone in front of the television, I’d taken it upon myself to sympathize with complete strangers and savor the terrors of the world. But seriously, what were those documentaries even about? One injection and she’s cured! Her symptoms have vanished so utterly that the whole performance now seems ridiculous. Which is a good thing, of course.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r4","rowIndex":4,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=44>筱喬</tips>も最初のうちは、発症してしまったという事実を悲しみ、そして、いつか薬が効かなくなって症状がぶり返してしまうんじゃないかと怯え、私はよしよし可哀想になあと捨てられた子猫ちゃんにそうするように頭などなでてやったものなんだが、三日も経てばその不安感も薄れ、今となってはもうすっかり症状を恐れる様子を見せない。薬の副作用もないようだ。","en":"At first, <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> grieved over having suffered onset. Then she grew frightened that one day the drug might stop working and the symptoms come back. I would pet her head and coo, There, there, poor little thing, as though she were some abandoned kitten. But give it three days and even that anxiety began to fade. By now, she no longer shows the slightest fear of her symptoms, and the drug does not seem to have any side effects, either.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r5","rowIndex":5,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　というわけで、<tips=17>タイプB</tips>の症状に関しては去ったと言っていいのだろうと思うが、かわりに別の病の症状が彼女には現れているのだ。","en":"So I thought it fair to say that the <tips=17>Type B</tips> symptoms were gone. In their place, however, symptoms of another illness had appeared.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r6","rowIndex":6,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　いつものように二人で食事をしていたり、雑談などをしている真っ最中に、急に黙りこんでぼんやりとどこかあらぬ方向を見つめる。しまいには「はー」と溜息をつく。","en":"We’ll be eating together as usual, or right in the middle of some idle conversation, when she suddenly falls silent and gazes vacantly off in some random direction. Eventually, out comes a great sigh: “Haaah.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r7","rowIndex":7,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　目の前にいる私のことをすっかり忘れてしまったかのように、いかにも心ここにあらずといった様子で何か物思いに耽っている。ここにはない何か別のものが彼女の心を四六時中惹きつけてやまないのだ。","en":"As though she has completely forgotten that I’m sitting right in front of her, she loses herself in thought, her mind plainly somewhere else. Something not present in this room has captured her heart and refuses to release it, morning, noon, or night.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r8","rowIndex":8,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　今日もそうだ。","en":"It happened again today.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r9","rowIndex":9,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　いつも女らしさなどまったく見せない、<tips=40>黄姉妹</tips>に、とんでもなく女の子らしい洋服をプレゼントして、無理矢理着させてみようという悪巧みの話を二人でしている最中のことだ。","en":"The two of us were in the middle of plotting to give the <tips=40>Wong sisters</tips>—who ordinarily displayed no femininity whatsoever—some outrageously girlish clothes and force them to wear them.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r10","rowIndex":10,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「やっぱりさー、セクシー路線もいいけど、フリフリがついた可愛いやつの方が……」","en":"“I mean, sexy could work, but something cute with lots of frills would be more...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r11","rowIndex":11,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　と、私は話しかけたところで、また彼女は別のものに気をとられて、こっちの言葉など全然聞いていないのに気づいてしまう。","en":"As I spoke to her, I realized that her attention had wandered again and she was not listening to a word I said.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r12","rowIndex":12,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　失礼なやつだ。さすがに私も聞いていない相手に話し続けるような趣味もない。話を途中でやめて黙ると、","en":"How rude. Even I don’t make a hobby of talking to someone who isn’t listening. When I abandoned the sentence halfway through and fell silent,","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r13","rowIndex":13,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あ、えっと。なになに？」","en":"“Oh, um... What were you saying?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r14","rowIndex":14,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=44>筱喬</tips>は取り繕うように苦笑いをしてこちらを見る。","en":"Trying to cover for herself, <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> turned to me with an awkward smile.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r15","rowIndex":15,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「もういいよー。諦めた」","en":"“Never mind. I give up.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r16","rowIndex":16,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「え、そんなあ。ごめんなさい。……気を悪くした？」","en":"“Aww, come on. I’m sorry. ...Are you mad at me?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r17","rowIndex":17,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私が唇を尖らせると、<tips=44>筱喬</tips>はシュンとして申し訳なさそうに肩をすくめる。","en":"When I stuck out my lower lip, <tips=44>Siu-kiu’s</tips> shoulders drooped, and she shrank into herself apologetically.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r18","rowIndex":18,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　くそう、こういう素直なところは相変わらず可愛いな。","en":"Damn it. That honest side of her was as adorable as ever.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r19","rowIndex":19,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「気は悪くしてないよ。ただ、また症状が出たなと思って」","en":"“I’m not mad. I was only thinking, There’s that symptom again.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r20","rowIndex":20,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「えっ、症状が？　全然気がつかなかった！　しかも『また』って……」","en":"“My symptoms? I didn’t notice anything at all! And what do you mean, ‘returned’...?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r21","rowIndex":21,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　慌てふためく彼女に、私は首を横に振ってみせてからこう言った。","en":"I shook my head at her flustered panic, then said,","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r22","rowIndex":22,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「たしかにそれは難病であることには違いないけど、<tips=44>筱喬</tips>が思ってる病気とは違うかもね。他にも症状があるでしょう？　わけもなく胸がドキドキしたり、苦しくなったりする病気だよきっと」","en":"“Oh, it’s certainly a serious condition—but perhaps not the disease you’re imagining, <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips>. You’ve had other symptoms too, haven’t you? Your heart starts racing for no reason; suddenly your chest aches... That kind of disease.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r23","rowIndex":23,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「えっ、心臓病？」","en":"“What? Heart disease?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r24","rowIndex":24,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「違う」","en":"“No.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r25","rowIndex":25,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は彼女の目をじっと見つめて、","en":"I gazed deep into her eyes and said,","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r26","rowIndex":26,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あなた、好きな人が出来たでしょ」","en":"“There’s someone you’ve come to like, isn’t there?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r27","rowIndex":27,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そう、彼女が最近やたらと症状を見せているというのは『恋の病』のことだ。","en":"Yes—the condition whose symptoms Siu-kiu had been displaying so incessantly of late was lovesickness.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r28","rowIndex":28,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そっ、そっ、そんなことないよっ！」","en":"“N-no! N-nothing like that!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r29","rowIndex":29,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　むきになって否定する<tips=44>筱喬</tips>は、顔だけでなく首まで真っ赤に染めている。","en":"<tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> protested with suspicious vehemence, not only her face but even her neck turning bright red.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r30","rowIndex":30,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　まったく、こんなにわかりやすいやつがいるだろうか？","en":"Honestly, could anyone possibly be more obvious?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r31","rowIndex":31,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　あの夜、<tips=10>見土道夫</tips>が助けに来てからずっと様子がおかしいのである。","en":"She had been strange ever since <tips=10>Michio Mido</tips> came to her rescue that night.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r32","rowIndex":32,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　無理もないと言えば、そうなのかもしれない。正気をうしない、そして回復することのないと言われていた『発症』は<tips=44>筱喬</tips>にとってあまりにも絶望的で、これまでの彼女の人生全体を重苦しい悲劇の色調に染め上げていた。それがついに彼女の精神を捕らえ混乱の泥沼に突き落としたところで、颯爽と現れたあの男が引き上げてくれたのである。","en":"Perhaps it was only natural. For <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips>, “onset”—the loss of sanity from which she had been told there could be no recovery—was a source of such absolute despair that it cast her entire life in the oppressive hues of tragedy. And just when it finally seized her mind and plunged her into a mire of confusion, that man came dashing in and pulled her free.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r33","rowIndex":33,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しかも、この<tips=41>グランドタワー</tips>という、<tips=10>見土</tips>にとってはあまりにも危険なギャングの巣窟に単身乗り込んで来たのだ。ただ、彼女を助けるためだけに。何の見返りもないのに。","en":"What was more, he had entered <tips=41>Grand Tower</tips> alone—a den of gangsters that posed extraordinary danger to Mr. <tips=10>Mido</tips>—for no reason but to save her. He had nothing whatsoever to gain.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r34","rowIndex":34,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　むしろ、これで気にならないほうがおかしいじゃないか。あまりにも卑怯なシチュエーションである。世間の女性百人を同じ状況に立たせたら、八割くらいは惚れてしまうんじゃないか？","en":"It would have been stranger if she had felt nothing. The situation was grossly unfair. Put one hundred women in her place, and perhaps eighty would fall in love.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r35","rowIndex":35,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　もっとも、まあ、卑怯と言えば私だって卑怯だった。部屋から出られなかった<tips=44>筱喬</tips>を、外に連れ出してやると言って近づいたのだからね。それはわかっている。だが、わかっていたってさ、自分がやってることは許せて、他人がやると不快なのは、これはもう仕方ないよね。","en":"Granted, if anyone had been underhanded, I had been too. I had approached <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> when she could not leave her room and promised to take her outside. I understood that. But you know how it is: I can forgive myself for something that disgusts me when anyone else does it. There is no helping that.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r36","rowIndex":36,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　恋は人を変えるものらしいが、それにしても、変貌するにもほどがある。四六時中ぽーっとしちゃってさ。ちょっと前まで、暇さえあれば人生だのなんだのって話ばかりして、絶望して、暗くなっていたのに。<tips=4>馬明</tips>という人が殺されてからはホントウに酷かった。なのに、男に惚れるとこうなってしまうのか。","en":"They say love changes a person, but there ought to be limits. She spends every waking hour mooning around in a daze! Until just recently, any idle moment had her talking about life and whatever else, despairing and sinking into gloom. After a man named <tips=4>Ma Ming</tips> was killed, she became truly unbearable. And now one man catches her heart and this is what she turns into?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r37","rowIndex":37,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まあ、健全なことではあるよ。暗く落ち込んでるよりはマシだよ。ここのところずっと塞ぎ込んでたからね」","en":"“Well, it is healthy, at least. Better than sinking into gloom. You’ve been moping around for ages now.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r38","rowIndex":38,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は溜息をつく。","en":"I sighed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r39","rowIndex":39,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=51>さくら</tips>の言ってることはわかるけど、でも、私が考えていたのはそれじゃないの」","en":"“I understand what you’re saying, <tips=51>Sakura</tips>, but that isn’t what I was thinking about.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r40","rowIndex":40,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=44>筱喬</tips>はそう言って首を振る。","en":"<tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> said this and shook her head.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r41","rowIndex":41,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=51>さくら</tips>。ちょっと自分のことを話すから、聞いて」","en":"“<tips=51>Sakura</tips>. I want to tell you a little about myself. Listen, okay?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r42","rowIndex":42,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　もちろん私は頷く。","en":"Of course, I nodded.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r43","rowIndex":43,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……私はずっと、自分のことを存在してはいけない人間のような気がしてたの。だから、なんでも我慢するしかないって思ってたの」","en":"“...All my life, I’ve felt as though I were someone who should not exist. I thought that meant I had to endure everything.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r44","rowIndex":44,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　最近私が気がついたのは、<tips=44>筱喬</tips>というのは何か喋るとき、いつもせわしなく手を動かす癖があるということだ。","en":"One thing I had noticed about <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> lately was that her hands were always in restless motion whenever she spoke.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r45","rowIndex":45,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　今もテーブルの上で組んだ手の親指が、もじもじと動いている。それは、頭の中で考えたことがうまく言葉にならず、もどかしさとなって手に出ているように見えた。そんなに強く他人に伝えたい何かがある彼女のことを、いつもうらやましく感じる。私はややこしいことは、最初から誰にも伝わるはずがないと、話す気もおきない。たとえ相手が<tips=44>筱喬</tips>だとしてもだ。","en":"Even now, the thumbs of her clasped hands were fidgeting atop the table. It was as though the thoughts in her head refused to take shape as words, and the frustration had escaped into her hands instead. I always envied her for having something she wanted so badly to make another person understand. The moment anything got complicated, I assumed no one would understand anyway and lost all desire to talk about it—even when that person was <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r46","rowIndex":46,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「お兄ちゃんともお父さんとも別れて、<tips=44>シウ</tips>とお母さんだけが暮らしてた本当の理由、<tips=51>さくら</tips>に話したことあったっけ？」","en":"“Have I ever told <tips=51>Sakura</tips> the real reason <tips=44>Siu</tips> and Mother lived alone, apart from my brother and Father?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r47","rowIndex":47,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「はっきりと聞いたことはないね」","en":"“You’ve never told me outright.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r48","rowIndex":48,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あのね、安全上の問題だとか、いろいろあったけど、本当は<tips=44>シウ</tips>とお母さんが<tips=17>タイプB</tips>だったっていうのが一番の原因なの」","en":"“There were security concerns and all sorts of other reasons, but the biggest one was that <tips=44>Siu</tips> and Mother were <tips=17>Type B</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r49","rowIndex":49,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それは……」","en":"“Well...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r50","rowIndex":50,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　センシティブな話になったので、私は言葉をうまく選べずに口ごもってしまう。","en":"The subject had turned sensitive, and, unable to choose my words properly, I faltered.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r51","rowIndex":51,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　一方<tips=44>筱喬</tips>はその曇りのない瞳で、私の目をまっすぐ見つめている。彼女は人と話すとき、よくそうやって正面から見つめる。人に目を見つめられると思わず目をそらしたくなるという、どうしようもない私からすると、そのまっすぐさが眩しい。","en":"Meanwhile, <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> gazed straight into my eyes, her own perfectly clear. She often looked people squarely in the eye when she spoke to them. To a hopeless case like me, who could never help wanting to look away when someone met my gaze, that directness was dazzling.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r52","rowIndex":52,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……お父さんの方の親戚の人たちが、<tips=17>タイプB</tips>はうつるって信じてたの。だから、お兄ちゃんやお父さんのそばにいたらいけないって。お兄ちゃんはもしかしたら、自分が追い出されたんだと感じてるんだろうけど、本当は私とお母さんがあの家に隔離されていたの」","en":"“Father’s relatives believed <tips=17>Type B</tips> was contagious. They said Mother and I had to stay away from my brother and Father. My brother may feel that he was the one driven out, but the truth is, Mother and I were quarantined in that house.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r53","rowIndex":53,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「えーっ、それ、何十年前の迷信よ？　確かに大昔はそんな言われ方もあったけど、とっくにそんなのは出鱈目だって判明してるじゃない」","en":"“What? How many decades out of date is that superstition? Sure, people said things like that a very long time ago, but we’ve known for ages that it’s complete nonsense.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r54","rowIndex":54,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうだけど……でも、お年寄りには、どこで証明されたとか、そんなの関係ないんだよきっと」","en":"“I know... But I’m sure old people don’t care what’s been proven where.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r55","rowIndex":55,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女は深く溜息をつく。","en":"She let out a deep sigh.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r56","rowIndex":56,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「だから、私とお母さんは<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>の人たちから嫌われてたんだ。お母さんが死んで、お父さんがここに呼んでくれた時も、みんなの反対を押し切ってのことなの。私は大事な娘だからって。そこまでしてくれたから、私もお父さんのために色んなことを我慢しなきゃいけないって……」","en":"“That’s why people in <tips=7>YS</tips> hated Mother and me. Even when Mother died and Father brought me here, he had to defy everyone’s objections. He said I was his precious daughter. He went that far for me, so I thought I had to endure all sorts of things for his sake...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r57","rowIndex":57,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なるほどね」","en":"“I see.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r58","rowIndex":58,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「今も私のことを嫌いな人は沢山いる。<tips=17>タイプB</tips>のくせにお父さんの血を引いてるから、死んで欲しいと思ってる人もいると思う。だから、私が発症しちゃって、<tips=21>八龍会</tips>の薬を使ってるってことが知られたら、また何か言われて、お兄ちゃんにも迷惑がかかる」","en":"“There are still plenty of people who hate me. Some of them probably want me dead because a <tips=17>Type B</tips> like me carries Father’s blood. If they find out I’ve suffered onset and I’m using medicine from the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips>, they’ll start saying things again, and that will cause trouble for my brother too.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r59","rowIndex":59,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=44>筱喬</tips>は少しうつむき、その声は少し震えている。私は、彼女がこれから何か大事なことを言おうとしているのだと予感した。","en":"<tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> lowered her head slightly, and a faint tremor entered her voice. I sensed that she was about to tell me something important.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r60","rowIndex":60,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして彼女は強い意志を表情に浮かべてからまた顔を上げ、私をまっすぐ見た。","en":"Then resolve settled over her face. She raised her head again and looked straight at me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r61","rowIndex":61,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「私はここに居るべきじゃないかもしれない。このビルを出て、外で暮らしたい。<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>ともお兄ちゃんとも関係ない場所で」","en":"“Perhaps I don’t belong here. I want to leave this building and live outside, somewhere with no connection to <tips=7>YS</tips> or my brother.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r62","rowIndex":62,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「本気？」","en":"“Are you serious?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r63","rowIndex":63,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「本気だよ。<tips=10>見土</tips>さんが来てから、ずっとそのことを考えてたの。私が考えていたのは、そのこと。<tips=51>さくら</tips>のお話聞かないでごめんなさい」","en":"“I am. I’ve been thinking about it ever since Mr. <tips=10>Mido</tips> came. That was what I had on my mind. I’m sorry I wasn’t listening to your story, <tips=51>Sakura</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r64","rowIndex":64,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いや、それはいいけど……」","en":"“No, that’s fine, but...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r65","rowIndex":65,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　突然の言葉に、私は戸惑っていた。一方彼女はよく考えての発言らしく、興奮も見せず、落ち着いている。","en":"Her sudden declaration had left me bewildered. She, on the other hand, had clearly thought it through. She was perfectly calm, without the slightest sign of agitation.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r66","rowIndex":66,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「この街では、<tips=17>タイプB</tips>の人たちが、お互いを支え合いながら生きているんでしょ？　私もそこに行きたい。そして私も、ただ可哀想な<tips=17>タイプＢ</tips>の娘としてこんなところに匿われているだけじゃなくて、誰かを助けたり、人の役に立ったりしたいの。もっと色んな人と、対等につき合いたいの。<tips=51>さくら</tips>と友だちになったみたいに」","en":"“In this city, <tips=17>Type B</tips> people live by supporting one another, don’t they? I want to go there too. I don’t want to stay hidden away in a place like this as nothing more than some poor <tips=17>Type B</tips> girl. I want to help people. I want to be useful to someone. I want to form relationships with all sorts of people as an equal, the way I became friends with <tips=51>Sakura</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r67","rowIndex":67,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「私みたいに？」","en":"“Like me?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r68","rowIndex":68,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そう。<tips=51>さくら</tips>は素敵なことをたくさん教えてくれた」","en":"“Yes. <tips=51>Sakura</tips> has taught me so many wonderful things.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r69","rowIndex":69,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女は恥ずかしげもなく私を見つめる。","en":"She held my gaze without a hint of self-consciousness.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r70","rowIndex":70,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ふ、ふーん」","en":"“O-oh.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r71","rowIndex":71,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「照れないで。本当のことだよ」","en":"“Don’t be embarrassed. It’s true.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r72","rowIndex":72,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は曖昧な態度でかわそうとしたのだが、<tips=44>筱喬</tips>はまっすぐ詰めてくる。","en":"I tried to wriggle out of it with a noncommittal response, but <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> came straight at me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r73","rowIndex":73,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「て、照れてなんかいないけど……」","en":"“I-I’m not embarrassed...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r74","rowIndex":74,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は頑張ってまっすぐ彼女の目を見つめ返す。","en":"I made myself look her straight in the eyes.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r75","rowIndex":75,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「でも、それって、<tips=21>八龍会</tips>に行くってこと？」","en":"“But does that mean you’re going to the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips>?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r76","rowIndex":76,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どうなるかはわからない」","en":"“I don’t know what will happen.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r77","rowIndex":77,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「でも、<tips=17>タイプB</tips>が街でやってゆくには、それしかないんじゃないの？」","en":"“But isn’t that the only way for a <tips=17>Type B</tips> to make a life in this city?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r78","rowIndex":78,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=10>見土</tips>さんを頼ろうと思うの。一番良い方法を教えてくれると思う」","en":"“I’m going to ask Mr. <tips=10>Mido</tips> for help. I think he’ll tell me the best way.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r79","rowIndex":79,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いや、あの人<tips=21>八龍会</tips>の人だよ？」","en":"“But he’s with the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips>, you know?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r80","rowIndex":80,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「でも、きっと<tips=10>見土</tips>さんなら、<tips=21>八龍会</tips>の一人としてではなく、個人として助けてくれると思う。迷惑だったら、一人でもなんとか生きるよ」","en":"“But I’m sure Mr. <tips=10>Mido</tips> would help me as himself, not as a member of the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips>. If that would be too much trouble for him, I’ll find some way to live on my own.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r81","rowIndex":81,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「信じられるの？　もし、<tips=10>見土</tips>さんがあなたを<tips=21>八龍会</tips>の人質にしようとしたらどうするつもり？」","en":"“Can you really trust him? What will you do if Mr. <tips=10>Mido</tips> tries to take you hostage for the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips>?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r82","rowIndex":82,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「その時は死ぬよ。元々<tips=10>見土</tips>さんが助けてくれなかったら、まともには生きられなかったんだから」","en":"“Then I’ll die. I wouldn’t have been able to live anything like a normal life in the first place if Mr. <tips=10>Mido</tips> hadn’t helped me.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r83","rowIndex":83,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=44>筱喬</tips>の顔には決意の色がある。","en":"There was resolve in <tips=44>Siu-kiu’s</tips> face.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r84","rowIndex":84,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　確かに彼女の言うとおり、<tips=10>見土道夫</tips>なら請け負ってくれるかもしれない。私もそうは思うのだが、","en":"She did have a point: <tips=10>Michio Mido</tips> might well agree to help her. I thought so myself, but","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r85","rowIndex":85,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あなたの覚悟はわかったわ。でも、理由は本当にそれだけなの？」","en":"“I understand your resolve. But are those really your only reasons?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r86","rowIndex":86,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それだけ……って？」","en":"“My only... reasons?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r87","rowIndex":87,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ここが自分の居場所じゃないとか、お兄さんに迷惑をかけるとか、それだけ？　本当は<tips=10>見土</tips>さんのところに行きたいとか、そう思ってるんじゃないの？」","en":"“You don’t belong here, you’re causing trouble for your brother—is that really all? Isn’t the truth that you want to go to Mr. <tips=10>Mido</tips>?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r88","rowIndex":88,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そ、そ、それは……」","en":"“Th-that, I...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r89","rowIndex":89,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　言った途端、<tips=44>筱喬</tips>の顔はゆでだこみたいに真っ赤に染め上がる。","en":"The instant I said it, <tips=44>Siu-kiu’s</tips> face flushed as red as a boiled octopus.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r90","rowIndex":90,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=44>シウ</tips>にはわかんない。うまく区別出来ないの……でも、もっと仲良くなりたいなあとは思う……」","en":"“<tips=44>Siu</tips> doesn’t know. I can’t really tell the feelings apart... but I do think I want to grow closer to him...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r91","rowIndex":91,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女はしどろもどろになりながら身体を揺らす。","en":"She rocked back and forth as she stumbled over her words.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r92","rowIndex":92,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ふーん、なるほどね」","en":"“Mm-hmm. I see.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r93","rowIndex":93,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=44>シウ</tips>だって、いけないってわかってるよ。<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>と<tips=21>八龍会</tips>はいまなかが良くないし、<tips=10>見土</tips>さんを困らせちゃうだろうし、全部間違ってるんだと思うけど……」","en":"“<tips=44>Siu</tips> knows she shouldn’t. <tips=7>YS</tips> and the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips> aren’t getting along right now, and I’d only cause Mr. <tips=10>Mido</tips> trouble. I know everything about this is wrong, but...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r94","rowIndex":94,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まるで、ロミオとジュリエットみたいね」","en":"“Just like Romeo and Juliet.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r95","rowIndex":95,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は溜息をついて、","en":"I sighed, then","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r96","rowIndex":96,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「とにかく、心から行きたいんだね？　<tips=10>見土</tips>さんのところに」","en":"“Anyway, is that where your heart truly wants to go? To Mr. <tips=10>Mido</tips>?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r97","rowIndex":97,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「うん」","en":"“Yes.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r98","rowIndex":98,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ジュリエットはあっさりと即答して、頷いた。","en":"Juliet answered at once and nodded.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r99","rowIndex":99,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=10>見土</tips>さんのところに行きたい」","en":"“I want to go to Mr. <tips=10>Mido</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r100","rowIndex":100,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　迷いなくそう答える。","en":"She answered without hesitation.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r101","rowIndex":101,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　自分から質問をして、そして予想通りの答えが返って来ただけなのに、何故だか私の胸がチクリとした。","en":"I had asked the question myself, and all she had done was give me the answer I expected. So why did I feel that tiny stab in my chest?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r102","rowIndex":102,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「でもね、もし<tips=10>見土</tips>さんのことがなくても、それでもここにいたらいけないと思う。それだけはもうはっきりと心に決まってるんだ。だって、私がここにいると、お兄ちゃんが苦労してばっかりなんだもの……」","en":"“But even if it weren’t for Mr. <tips=10>Mido</tips>, I still don’t think I should stay here. That much is already settled in my heart. With me here, all my brother ever does is suffer...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r103","rowIndex":103,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それは違うよ」","en":"“That’s not true.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r104","rowIndex":104,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私はその言葉は否定したかった。","en":"That, at least, I wanted to deny.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r105","rowIndex":105,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=1>亮</tips>さんがあなたのために苦労をしてるのなら、それは、そうしたいからなんだよ。だから、<tips=1>亮</tips>さんのことを考えるのなら、ここにいた方がいいと思う」","en":"“If <tips=1>Ryo</tips> is going to such trouble for you, it’s because he wants to. So if you’re thinking of <tips=1>Ryo</tips>, I think you should stay here.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r106","rowIndex":106,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「でも、私がいなかったら、もう<tips=81>龍頭</tips>をやめられるんじゃない？　組織に入りたくなかったのに、戻って来て、そしていろんな人をたくさん殺して、それは全部私のせいなんでしょ？　私がここに人質にとられているから、みんなの反対を押し切って入った学校をやめて、あんな恐ろしいことばっかりしてるんでしょ？　<tips=4>馬明</tips>さんまで殺して……私、もう見ていられないの」","en":"“But if I weren’t here, couldn’t he finally stop being <tips=81>Longtou</tips>? He never wanted to join the organization, but he came back and killed so many people, and that’s all because of me, isn’t it? Because they’re holding me hostage here, he quit the school he had fought everyone to attend and started doing one terrible thing after another. He even killed Mr. <tips=4>Ma Ming</tips>... I can’t bear to watch any longer.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r107","rowIndex":107,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=44>筱喬</tips>は悲しげに顔を歪める。","en":"<tips=44>Siu-kiu’s</tips> face twisted with sorrow.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r108","rowIndex":108,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……私は<tips=1>亮</tips>さんがどういう気持ちでいるのかわからない。もしかしたらあなたの言う通りの理由なのかもしれない。でも、もしいま<tips=44>筱喬</tips>がいなくなっても、元に戻ることなんか出来ないんだよ」","en":"“...I don’t know how <tips=1>Ryo</tips> feels. Maybe his reasons really are what you say. But even if <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> left now, there would be no going back to how things were before.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r109","rowIndex":109,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「でも……」","en":"“But...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r110","rowIndex":110,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=44>筱喬</tips>は戸惑いながら、","en":"<tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> hesitated, then","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r111","rowIndex":111,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それでも、もうここにはいられないの。ねえ<tips=51>さくら</tips>、私を逃がして？」","en":"“Even so, I can’t stay here any longer. Please, <tips=51>Sakura</tips>. Will you help me escape?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r112","rowIndex":112,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして私を潤んだ目で見つめる。","en":"She gazed at me with tears in her eyes.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r113","rowIndex":113,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「簡単なことじゃないのはわかってる。でも、<tips=51>さくら</tips>にしかこんなことは頼めないの」","en":"“I know it won’t be easy. But you’re the only person I can ask for something like this, <tips=51>Sakura</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r114","rowIndex":114,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は溜息をついた。","en":"I sighed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r115","rowIndex":115,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　自分の言っていることが正しいと思うのなら、逃げるなんていう強硬手段をとらなくとも、兄に説明してビルから出して貰えばいい。<tips=1>亮</tips>さんは何が何でも閉じ込めたいという感じではなさそうだし、許可を得られないわけでもないだろう。でも、<tips=44>筱喬</tips>はそれじゃだめなんだ。","en":"If she truly believed what she was saying was right, there should have been no need for anything as drastic as an escape. She could explain it to her brother and ask him to let her leave the building. <tips=1>Ryo</tips> did not seem determined to keep her locked up at any cost, so obtaining his permission should not have been impossible. But that would not do for <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r116","rowIndex":116,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　だって、<tips=10>見土</tips>さんのところへ行きたいのだから。さすがの<tips=1>亮</tips>さんも、それは許可が出せない。だから、説明せずに脱走するしかないということだ。","en":"Because what she wanted was to go to Mr. <tips=10>Mido</tips>. Even <tips=1>Ryo</tips>, indulgent as he was, could hardly give her permission for that. Which meant she would have to run away without explaining anything.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r117","rowIndex":117,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　困ったな。","en":"Now this was a problem.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r118","rowIndex":118,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=44>筱喬</tips>の言うことは聞いてやりたいが、こればかりはどうだろう？　<tips=81>龍頭</tips>の妹を脱走させるというのは<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>を敵に回すことになるんだろうけれど、まあそれはそれとして、なんで彼女の恋の手助けをしてやらなきゃいけないんだ。","en":"I wanted to do as <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> asked, but this might be going a little far. Helping the <tips=81>Longtou’s</tips> sister escape would probably make an enemy of <tips=7>YS</tips>—but never mind that. Why should I have to help her love life along?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r119","rowIndex":119,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私としてはちっとも面白くないのだけれど、かといって即座に断ることも出来ず、結局その場では返事が出来なかった。","en":"None of this was the least bit amusing to me. But I could not bring myself to refuse her on the spot, either, and in the end I left without giving her an answer.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r120","rowIndex":120,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　夜。自宅のベッドの上で、悶々として眠れない。","en":"That night, I lay awake in my bed at home, stewing.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r121","rowIndex":121,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　いつもよりも身体が分泌する粘液が多いみたいで、服のなかがやたらとねちゃねちゃしたけれど、風呂に入る気にも、着替える気にもなれなかった。","en":"My body seemed to be secreting more mucus than usual, leaving the inside of my clothes horribly sticky, but I could not bring myself to take a bath or even change.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r122","rowIndex":122,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　部屋のなかはシンとしている。ベッドにぐったり横たわっているとエアコンの作動する低い音と、ゲームをしながら冷たい飲み物を飲むための小さな冷蔵庫の作動音が聞こえる。","en":"The room was utterly still. Lying limp upon the bed, I could hear the low hum of the air conditioner and the little refrigerator I kept for cold drinks while I played games.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r123","rowIndex":123,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　失恋というのとはちょっと違う。彼女が私のことを仲の良い友だちとしか思っていないのは、大分前からよく知っている。","en":"This was not quite the same thing as heartbreak. I had known for a long time that she thought of me as nothing more than a close friend.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r124","rowIndex":124,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そもそも、私は自分のことが全然好きじゃないので、もし仮に自分を好きになられても不安や恐怖でしかない。それどころか、自分を好きになるというそいつの人間性を疑って幻滅したりしてしまうので、好きになって欲しくない。適度な距離を持つのが必要なんだ。","en":"To begin with, I did not like myself at all. Even if someone did happen to fall for me, it would only fill me with anxiety and fear. Worse, I would start questioning the character of anyone capable of liking me and end up disillusioned with them, so I did not want anyone to like me. A healthy amount of distance was essential.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r125","rowIndex":125,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　だから、<tips=44>筱喬</tips>が誰かを好きになって、私はその親友ポジションに収まるというのは冷静に考えれば最高にいい立場じゃないかとも思う。ずっと、そうであったらいいなあと思っていた良い感じの距離のとりかたじゃないかね、<tips=51>さくら</tips>さん。","en":"So, viewed calmly, <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> falling for someone while I settled comfortably into the best-friend position ought to have been the finest arrangement imaginable. Wasn’t this precisely the nice, comfortable distance you had always hoped for, Ms. <tips=51>Sakura</tips>?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r126","rowIndex":126,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　と、頭では思うのだが、身体はなかなか頭についていかずに胸が苦しい。不思議なことだ。自分を好きになって欲しくないくせに、誰か別の人を好きになると苦しいのである。","en":"That was what my head thought, but my body refused to follow its lead, and my chest ached. How strange. I did not want her to like me, yet it hurt when she fell for someone else.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r127","rowIndex":127,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しかも相手が<tips=10>見土道夫</tips>って。","en":"And of all people, it had to be <tips=10>Michio Mido</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r128","rowIndex":128,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=10>見土</tips>さんは悪い人ではないが、女の人にモテそうで、異性関係にもだらしなそうだ。でも、<tips=44>筱喬</tips>はきっとそんなのどうでもいいのだろう。心が広いものな。なんたって、別の意味でだらしない私にも文句一つ言わない。","en":"Mr. <tips=10>Mido</tips> was not a bad person, but he looked like the sort who was popular with women and hopelessly casual about his affairs. <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> probably would not care about any of that, though. She was broad-minded that way. After all, she never uttered a word of complaint about me, and I was hopelessly lax in an entirely different sense.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r129","rowIndex":129,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　たとえば先日も、彼女の部屋で遊んでいて、私は自宅のようにうっかり散らかしてしまってしかも無自覚だった。彼女とは<tips=57>滑走路通り</tips>に出来たケーキ屋さんかなんかの話をしていたのだけど、なぜか不意に立ち上がって散らかったのを片付けはじめたので、私はそこではじめて自分が部屋を散らかしたのに気がついたという案配だ。その時彼女は別に私にあてつけるでもなく、普通に雑談を続けて笑いながら自然と身体を動かして片付けていた。もうそういう動きが身体に染みついているんだろう。私が無意識に散らかすように、無意識に片付けてしまうのだ。","en":"Only the other day, for example, I had been visiting her room and unconsciously made the same mess I would at home. We were discussing some cake shop that had opened on <tips=57>Runway Street</tips> when, for no apparent reason, she stood and began tidying. Only then did I realize that I had made a mess. She was not doing it to make a point. She simply continued our conversation, laughing and putting things away as naturally as breathing. The motion was probably ingrained in her body. As unconsciously as I scattered things, she put them in order.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r130","rowIndex":130,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　子供の頃、お母さんと二人暮らしだったというからそこで身についたに違いない。一方私は小さいころは、お母さんやお父さんが片付けてくれたから散らかすことだけ覚えて、何も身につかなかったのである。その他にも、普通なら身につくべきはずのことが何も身についていない。挙げ句の果てには足を一本なくしてしまった。私はそんなものなかろうがあろうが本当に全然どうでもいいんだけれど、さすがに両親には気まずかった。","en":"She had lived alone with her mother as a child, so she must have picked up the habit then. I, on the other hand, had Mother and Father to clean up after me when I was little, so I learned only how to make messes and picked up no useful habits whatsoever. Nor had I acquired any of the other things an ordinary person was supposed to. To cap it all off, I had even lost a leg. Personally, I truly did not care in the slightest whether I had one or not, but I did feel rather guilty around my parents.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r131","rowIndex":131,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　両親がおいおいと泣いている姿を見て、もう今後はこのような親不孝ばかりしていないで、心を入れ替えて真面目な子になろうと心に誓ったものだ。――まあ、すぐに忘れて<tips=41>グランドタワー</tips>に入り浸るようになったけれど。","en":"Seeing my parents sob their hearts out, I solemnly vowed to stop being such an unfilial daughter, turn over a new leaf, and become a good, responsible girl. —Though, well, I promptly forgot and went right back to spending all my time at <tips=41>Grand Tower</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r132","rowIndex":132,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>さんなんかは私を褒めてくれるんだよな。というか、<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>の人は結構良くしてくれる。あの変なサイキックの子から<tips=44>筱喬</tips>を奪い返した件がメチャクチャ評価されているらしい。――あ、そうだ。みんな、両親の前で褒めてくれないかしら？　<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>のボスや幹部がこぞって誉め称えてくれれば、お父さんお母さんも刮目して私を見直し評価を改めてくれるかもしれぬ。道は確かに極道であれども、その世界の一流の人々から賞賛されているという事実。我が娘ながらすごい。ただゲームをやって夜遊びをして無駄飯を食うだけのしょうもないニートじゃなかったんだね。方向はおかしいが本人なりに頑張っていたのだ。出来る人間、価値ある人間だったんだ。よかったよかった。産んでよかった。そしてお父さんとお母さんは、この間とは意味の違うあたたかい涙を流すのだ。","en":"<tips=1>Ryo</tips> praises me, you know. In fact, the people at <tips=7>YS</tips> treat me quite well. Apparently, everyone was wildly impressed when I rescued <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> from that strange psychic girl. —Oh, I know! Why don’t they all praise me in front of my parents? If the boss and every senior officer of <tips=7>YS</tips> gathered to sing my praises, Mother and Father might open their eyes, see me anew, and revise their entire estimation of me. True, the path she chose was the criminal underworld—but here she stood, acclaimed by the finest people in that world. Our daughter is incredible! She was not some pathetic, good-for-nothing NEET who did nothing but play games, stay out all night, and eat us out of house and home. Her direction may have been peculiar, but she was working hard in her own way. She was capable. She had worth. Thank goodness. We are so glad we had her. And then Mother and Father would shed warm tears whose meaning was entirely different from those other tears.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r133","rowIndex":133,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　あれ、私は何を言いたかったのかな？","en":"Wait. What was I trying to say?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r134","rowIndex":134,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そうそう、<tips=44>筱喬</tips>はつまり他人のルーズさは気にしないからきっと<tips=10>見土</tips>さんが女の人にだらしなく手を出しまくっても、「<tips=44>シウ</tips>のことさえ好きって言ってくれればいいの。ここに帰って来てくれればいいの」なんて言いそうだ。純粋な女と都合の良い女は紙一重。目に浮かぶようである。","en":"That was it: <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> did not mind other people’s lax ways. Even if Mr. <tips=10>Mido</tips> went around carelessly sleeping with woman after woman, she would probably say, “As long as you tell <tips=44>Siu</tips> you love her. As long as you come home to her.” There was a paper-thin line between a pure-hearted woman and one who made herself altogether too convenient for a man. I could see the whole thing perfectly.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r135","rowIndex":135,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それに、<tips=1>亮</tips>さんはどう思うだろう？　大事にしてきた妹が、自分を離れてライバル組織の人間のところへ行ってしまうのである。","en":"Besides, what would <tips=1>Ryo</tips> think? The little sister he had cherished would leave him and go to a man in a rival organization.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r136","rowIndex":136,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おそろしく残酷なことをしているなと思うのだけれど、<tips=44>筱喬</tips>は気づいていないのかしら。気づいているのかもしれないけれど、どうしようもないんだろうな。人を好きになるということは、そういうことなんだろうきっと。もう、<tips=10>見土</tips>さんのことしか考えていないんだ……。","en":"It seemed to me that she was doing something terribly cruel, but did <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> not realize it? Perhaps she did and simply could not help herself. That must be what it meant to fall in love. Mr. <tips=10>Mido</tips> was the only thing on her mind now...","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r137","rowIndex":137,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ああ、いけない！　具体的に想像していると、どんどん辛くなってきた。もう知らない。好きにすればいい。私はもう何も考えない！","en":"Oh, no! The more concretely I pictured it, the more it hurt. I didn’t care anymore. She could do whatever she liked. I wasn’t going to think about any of it ever again!","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r138","rowIndex":138,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は自分に向かってそう宣言し、目をぎゅっとつぶった。","en":"I declared as much to myself and squeezed my eyes shut.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r139","rowIndex":139,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=51>さくら</tips>、良い？　ジェニファーが入って来たらね、ちゃんと怯えたフリをするんだよ」","en":"“<tips=51>Sakura</tips>, are you ready? When Jennifer comes in, you have to pretend you’re frightened.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r140","rowIndex":140,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=44>筱喬</tips>は上着を身に纏い、当面必要なものは大きな旅行鞄に詰めて、もうすっかり出かける準備を整えていた。そして手には、彼女の華奢な身体にはいかにも重そうなオートマチックのピストルが握られている。","en":"<tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> had put on her jacket and packed everything she would need for the time being into a large traveling bag. She was completely ready to go. In one hand she gripped an automatic pistol that looked far too heavy for her slender frame.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r141","rowIndex":141,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「私は平気だけど、あなたこそ大丈夫？　ものすごーく、緊張してるみたいだけど？」","en":"“I’m fine, but are you? You look awfully nervous, you know?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r142","rowIndex":142,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女の顔は少し紅く火照り、目はギラギラとしている。呼吸も荒く、何か運動をしたわけでもないのに肩を上下させてハァハァ言っている。冷や汗も顔に浮かんでいる。何か病気の発作でも起こしているのかと心配になるほどなのだ。","en":"Her face was flushed and her eyes were glittering. She was breathing so hard that her shoulders heaved up and down, panting despite having done nothing strenuous at all. Cold sweat stood out on her face. She looked so bad that I began to worry she might be suffering some sort of medical episode.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r143","rowIndex":143,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しかし彼女はそのままニヤリと笑い、","en":"Yet even in that state, she grinned.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r144","rowIndex":144,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「大丈夫。ちっとも心配ないよ。……でも、なんだかワクワクして楽しいね。<tips=44>シウ</tips>ね、こんなことするの初めてだよ」","en":"“I’m all right. There’s nothing to worry about. ...But this is exciting, isn’t it? Fun. <tips=44>Siu</tips> has never done anything like this.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r145","rowIndex":145,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そりゃあ、こんなことする人あんまりいないと思うけど……」","en":"“Well, I don’t think many people ever do anything like this...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r146","rowIndex":146,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私が言いかけたとき、ドアが外側からノックされる。","en":"Before I could finish, someone knocked on the door from outside.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r147","rowIndex":147,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「来たわ！」","en":"“She’s here!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r148","rowIndex":148,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=44>筱喬</tips>は忍び声でそう言うと、素早く片手で旅行鞄の取っ手をつかみ、もう片方の手で銃を握って私につきつける。","en":"<tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> whispered it, swiftly seized the handle of her traveling bag with one hand, and pointed the gun at me with the other.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r149","rowIndex":149,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私も、申し訳程度に両手を上げて脅されてるような姿勢をとった。","en":"I raised both hands in the most perfunctory imitation of someone under threat.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r150","rowIndex":150,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「三時になりましたのでおやつとお茶をお持ちしました。失礼します」","en":"“It is three o’clock, so I have brought your tea and afternoon snack. Pardon me.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r151","rowIndex":151,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ドアの外からそう声が聞こえたかと思うと、ドアが開き、お茶とおやつを乗せた使用人のジェニファーが部屋に入ってくる。","en":"No sooner had the voice come through the door than it opened, and Jennifer, the servant, entered carrying the tea and afternoon snack.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r152","rowIndex":152,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女こそが、これから私と<tips=44>筱喬</tips>が演じる芝居のたった一人の観客だった。","en":"She was the sole audience for the performance <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> and I were about to give.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r153","rowIndex":153,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「えっ、これは……」","en":"“Oh! What is...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r154","rowIndex":154,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ジェニファーは部屋のただならぬ光景を目にした途端、足を止めて絶句する。","en":"The moment Jennifer took in the alarming scene inside the room, she stopped dead, speechless.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r155","rowIndex":155,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女が見たものは、私に銃を突きつける<tips=44>筱喬</tips>。","en":"What she saw was <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> pointing a gun at me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r156","rowIndex":156,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=51>さくら</tips>、あなたが何を言おうと、私を外に連れ出してもらうわ！」","en":"“No matter what you say, <tips=51>Sakura</tips>, you are taking me outside!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r157","rowIndex":157,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=44>筱喬</tips>の声はうわずり、そして前もって用意した台詞は棒読みであったが、その棒読み加減はとりかたによっては緊張感を表現している――かな？","en":"<tips=44>Siu-kiu’s</tips> voice came out high and strained, and she recited her carefully prepared line in a wooden monotone. Then again, depending on how one looked at it, perhaps that very woodenness conveyed tension—maybe?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r158","rowIndex":158,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ダ、ダメよ！　あなたはそうやって、私を銃で脅してまでして、無理矢理この<tips=41>グランドタワー</tips>から逃げ出したいのかもしれないけれど、私はサイキック能力を使ってそれに協力することは出来ないわ！」","en":"“N-no! You may want to threaten me with a gun and force your way out of <tips=41>Grand Tower</tips>, but I cannot use my psychic power to help you escape!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r159","rowIndex":159,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=44>筱喬</tips>が考えた、やたらと説明的かつ、普段の私の口調とはちょっと違う台詞を私は口にする。","en":"I recited the line <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> had written: absurdly expository and not quite how I ordinarily spoke.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r160","rowIndex":160,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あなたがいくら反対しても、私を外まで運んで貰うよ！　この銃はアナタの頭に狙いをつけてるんだからね。この一生のお願いを聞いてくれないのなら、し、親友とは認めない！」","en":"“No matter how much you object, you are carrying me outside! This gun is aimed right at your head, you know. If you won’t grant me this once-in-a-lifetime request, then I-I refuse to consider you my best friend!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r161","rowIndex":161,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=44>筱喬</tips>は引きつった顔で言った。","en":"<tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> delivered the line with a strained expression.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r162","rowIndex":162,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私を向いた銃口は震えている。撃たないとわかっていても、こうして銃を向けられるのはこわい。緊張しすぎて、何かの間違いで引き金をひいちゃったりしないだろうか？　そもそも、弾は入ってるんだろうか？","en":"The muzzle trained upon me trembled. I knew she would not shoot, but having a gun pointed at me was still frightening. What if she got so nervous that she pulled the trigger by mistake? Was it even loaded in the first place?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r163","rowIndex":163,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「お、お嬢様、一体なにを……」","en":"“M-Miss, what in the world are you...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r164","rowIndex":164,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ジェニファーは漸く我を取り戻して<tips=44>筱喬</tips>に呼びかける。","en":"At last Jennifer recovered her senses enough to call out to <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r165","rowIndex":165,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ジェニファー、あなたも止めないで！　私はこのビルから出て行くの！　もう<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>にはうんざりしてるんだから。さくらの空飛ぶ力で運んで貰おうと思ったけど、どうしてもそれは出来ないって言うから銃をつきつけてるんだよ！　<tips=51>さくら</tips>は絶対反対で、私の独断なんだから！」","en":"“Jennifer, don’t you try to stop me! I’m leaving this building! I’ve had enough of <tips=7>YS</tips>. I wanted Sakura to fly me out, but she insisted she could never do such a thing, so now I’m holding her at gunpoint! <tips=51>Sakura</tips> is completely opposed to this. I’m acting entirely on my own!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r166","rowIndex":166,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　このあまりにも不自然な台詞でもわかるとおり、このなんとも言えない微妙な茶番は、彼女の脱出に協力した私があとで責任を問われないように、<tips=44>筱喬</tips>が私を脅迫しているという光景をジェニファーに見せつけるのが目的の茶番劇なのである。","en":"As that preposterously unnatural line ought to make clear, the entire purpose of this painfully awkward little farce was to make Jennifer witness <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> threatening me, so that no one could hold me responsible afterward for helping her escape.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r167","rowIndex":167,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　言い出したのは<tips=44>筱喬</tips>だ。","en":"The idea had been <tips=44>Siu-kiu’s</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r168","rowIndex":168,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>さんをこんなやりかたで騙せるとはとても思えないのだけれど、私にプランを語る<tips=44>筱喬</tips>本人はやたらと自信満々だった。","en":"I could not imagine deceiving <tips=1>Ryo</tips> with a trick like this, yet <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> had been brimming with confidence when she explained the plan to me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r169","rowIndex":169,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女は街で自分の兄がどんな評判なのか知らないのであろうか？　度重なる部下たちの陰謀などをひとつ残らず発見して粛清する、冷酷で恐ろしい人物として知られているのだよ？","en":"Did she not know the reputation her brother had in the city? He was known as a cold-blooded and terrifying man who uncovered every last one of his subordinates’ repeated conspiracies and purged those responsible.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r170","rowIndex":170,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　本人にとっては、優しいお兄ちゃんでしかないのかもしれないが、世間ではそうではないのだよ。","en":"To her, he might be nothing more than a kind older brother, but that was not how the world saw him.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r171","rowIndex":171,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　あの<tips=4>馬明</tips>さんを処刑した件で、あなたはすごく驚いていたけれど、世間にとってはイメージ通りの行動だった。そして、私だって別に驚きはしなかった。というかね、そういう残酷なところも含めてあの人の魅力なのである。<tips=44>筱喬</tips>はよくわかっていない。","en":"You were terribly shocked when he executed Mr. <tips=4>Ma Ming</tips>, but to the rest of the world he had acted exactly in character. I was not particularly surprised myself. In fact, that cruel side of him was part of his appeal. <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> simply did not understand.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r172","rowIndex":172,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ちなみに私は<tips=44>筱喬</tips>と同じくらいあのお兄さんが好きだ。","en":"For that matter, I liked her brother about as much as I liked <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r173","rowIndex":173,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　残酷なところも、妙に妹には甘いところも、若いのにビシビシと命令をして組織を運営しているところも、それに、なんと言っても顔が良いのだよね。","en":"The cruelty. The peculiar way he went soft on his little sister. The way he ran an entire organization at his age, barking out orders without a moment’s hesitation. And above all else, of course, that face of his.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r174","rowIndex":174,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　まあ、それはとにかく、<tips=44>筱喬</tips>は<tips=1>亮</tips>さんを舐めているように思う。","en":"But never mind that. <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> seemed to underestimate <tips=1>Ryo</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r175","rowIndex":175,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　こんな茶番、すぐ見抜かれてしまうんじゃないかしら。","en":"Wouldn’t he see through a farce like this at once?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r176","rowIndex":176,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「お嬢様、そんな……」","en":"“Miss, you can’t...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r177","rowIndex":177,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ジェニファー、言うことを聞いて。<tips=44>筱喬</tips>は本気みたい」","en":"“Jennifer, do as she says. <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> seems serious.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r178","rowIndex":178,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は気が進まなかったが、やると決めた以上はセリフを口にするしかない。","en":"I was not eager to do it, but now that I had decided to, I had no choice but say my lines.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r179","rowIndex":179,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうよ私は本気なの！　だから、おかしなことはしないで。私を止めようとしたり、外へ行って誰かを呼んでもだめ。そこに立って、私たちが出て行くのを見守るの」","en":"“I am serious! So no funny business. Don’t try to stop me, and don’t go outside to call anyone. Just stand there and watch us leave.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r180","rowIndex":180,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=44>筱喬</tips>はなんだか楽しそうである。いや、実際楽しんでいるのかもしれない。","en":"<tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> seemed to be having fun. No, perhaps she truly was enjoying herself.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r181","rowIndex":181,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして、かわいそうなジェニファーは泣きそうな顔をしてその場に釘付けになっている。","en":"And poor Jennifer stood rooted to the spot, looking ready to cry.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r182","rowIndex":182,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=44>筱喬</tips>は顎をしゃくってベランダの方へ出るよう指示する。私は頷き、彼女の銃口に怯えるふりをしながらドアを開け、ベランダに出る。","en":"<tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> jerked her chin toward the balcony, ordering me out. I nodded, opened the door while pretending to fear her gun, and stepped onto the balcony.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r183","rowIndex":183,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そうしたらあとは<tips=44>筱喬</tips>を背負って空に飛び立つだけだ。","en":"All that remained was to hoist <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> onto my back and take to the sky.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r184","rowIndex":184,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「じゃあ、お願い」","en":"“All right, please.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r185","rowIndex":185,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　背中に乗った<tips=44>筱喬</tips>が囁き、私は無言で頷く。","en":"<tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> whispered from my back, and I nodded without a word.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r186","rowIndex":186,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そしてふわっと飛び上がってベランダの手すりをこえたところで振り返る。ジェニファーはこわばった顔でこちらを見ている。すっかり混乱している。人に伝えるなと言った<tips=44>筱喬</tips>の言葉に縛られつつも、このままにしてはいけないという思いもあり、パニックになってどうしようもなくっているのだろう。","en":"Then I floated into the air, cleared the balcony rail, and looked back. Jennifer was staring after us, her face rigid with confusion. <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> had ordered her not to tell anyone, yet she knew she could not simply leave matters as they were. Trapped between the two, she must have panicked so completely that she no longer knew what to do.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r187","rowIndex":187,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それを見ながら、私は飛び立った。","en":"Watching her, I took flight.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r188","rowIndex":188,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私はジェニファーの態度に複雑な思いを抱いていたら、","en":"As I wrestled with my mixed feelings about Jennifer’s reaction,","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r189","rowIndex":189,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ジェニファーには可哀想なことをしちゃった。今度何かの形で埋め合わせてあげないと……」","en":"“That was a cruel thing to do to Jennifer. I’ll have to make it up to her somehow...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r190","rowIndex":190,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　と背中の<tips=44>筱喬</tips>が耳元で呟いた。","en":"<tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips>, clinging to my back, murmured into my ear.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r191","rowIndex":191,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女が優しくて良かった。私はそう思いながら、","en":"I was glad she was such a kind person. Thinking that,","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r192","rowIndex":192,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「大丈夫だよ。あの子も<tips=44>筱喬</tips>のことが好きだから、動揺しているだけ。そのうちきっとわかってくれるはず」","en":"“It’ll be all right. She loves you too, <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips>. She’s only shaken up. I’m sure she’ll understand eventually.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r193","rowIndex":193,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　と慰めた。","en":"I comforted her.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r194","rowIndex":194,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　上空を飛ぶと、すぐに目的地についた。","en":"Once we were airborne, we reached our destination in no time.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r195","rowIndex":195,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そこは<tips=10>見土</tips>さんのマンションで、私たちは屋上に降りた。彼にはあらかじめ連絡をしてあったので、そこから電話をするとすぐに迎えに来てくれた。","en":"Our destination was Mr. <tips=10>Mido’s</tips> apartment building, and we landed on its roof. I had contacted him in advance, so the moment I called from up there, he came to meet us.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r196","rowIndex":196,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「疲れてるんですか？」","en":"“Are you tired?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r197","rowIndex":197,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=10>見土</tips>さんの目の下にうっすらくまが浮かんでいたので、私はそう尋ねた。","en":"I asked because there were faint shadows beneath Mr. <tips=10>Mido’s</tips> eyes.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r198","rowIndex":198,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いや、ここ数日色々とバタバタしていて忙しくてね。出て来る時トラブルはなかったかい？」","en":"“No. Things have been hectic these past few days, and I’ve been busy. Did you run into any trouble getting out?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫","displayName":"Michio Mido","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r199","rowIndex":199,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「おかげさまで。<tips=51>さくら</tips>がすごくよくやってくれたんです」","en":"“No, fortunately. <tips=51>Sakura</tips> handled everything wonderfully.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r200","rowIndex":200,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=44>筱喬</tips>のこたえに<tips=10>見土</tips>さんはいつも通り微笑んではいたけれど、その心中は簡単なものではないだろう。","en":"Mr. <tips=10>Mido</tips> greeted <tips=44>Siu-kiu’s</tips> answer with his usual smile, but his feelings could hardly have been so simple.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r201","rowIndex":201,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　何と言ったって、<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>の<tips=81>龍頭</tips>の妹を預かるというのだ。これはヘタをするとこの街の裏社会の勢力図を変えてしまうほどの重要な出来事だ。","en":"After all, he was taking custody of the <tips=81>Longtou</tips> of <tips=7>YS’s</tips> sister. One wrong move, and this could become an event momentous enough to alter the balance of power in the city’s underworld.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r202","rowIndex":202,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　例えば、八龍会が<tips=44>筱喬</tips>を人質にとって<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>に何かを要求する可能性もあるし、<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>内に潜在的にたくさん存在すると思われる反<tips=1>謝亮</tips>派への工作に使うという手もある。<tips=10>見土</tips>さん自身が<tips=21>八龍会</tips>の幹部であるから、彼がそのように企むことだってあるわけだ。――私はそのことについて事前に彼に質問をしていた。もし<tips=44>筱喬</tips>を預かったとして、そのように利用するつもりはあるのか？　<tips=44>筱喬</tips>は彼を信じていたけれど、私はそれほどではない。","en":"The Eight Dragons Society might, for example, take <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> hostage and make demands of <tips=7>YS</tips>. Or it might use her in some operation aimed at the many latent anti–<tips=1>Tse Leung</tips> factions I assumed existed within <tips=7>YS</tips>. Mr. <tips=10>Mido</tips> was himself an officer of the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips>, so there was every possibility that he might be plotting something of the sort. —I had questioned him about this beforehand. If he agreed to take <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> in, did he intend to exploit her that way? <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> trusted him, but my own faith did not go nearly so far.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r203","rowIndex":203,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その時<tips=10>見土</tips>さんは絶対にありえないと言った。彼は自分を信じてくれた人を裏切ったことがないと言う。<tips=44>筱喬</tips>はおそらく<tips=21>八龍会</tips>で保護することになるが、<tips=81>龍頭</tips>の妹であるという身分は絶対に隠すと約束してくれた。それに、もし身分が露見することがあっても、<tips=21>八龍会</tips>は一度仲間になったものを人質などにはしないと言う。","en":"Mr. <tips=10>Mido</tips> had told me that was absolutely out of the question. He had never betrayed anyone who put their trust in him, he said. <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> would probably have to be placed under the protection of the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips>, but he promised to keep her identity as the <tips=81>Longtou’s</tips> sister an absolute secret. Even if that identity somehow came to light, he said, the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips> would never take someone hostage once she had become one of their own.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r204","rowIndex":204,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=21>八龍会</tips>はね、<tips=17>タイプB</tips>の仲間は絶対に裏切らないんだ。それを今までずっと守ってたからこそ、<tips=21>八龍会</tips>は強い繋がりを築けている。<tips=21>八龍会</tips>のメンバーはいろんな組織のなかに潜り込んでいるが、そのみんながいざとなれば<tips=21>八龍会</tips>のために動いてくれるのは、この繋がりがあるからだ。一度でも仲間を売るようなことをしたら、この繋がりは崩壊するだろう。そうしたら、最大の武器を失う。だから、<tips=21>八龍会</tips>は、たとえ敵対者の妹でも入会した以上は身内として保護せざるを得ない。おれを信じなくてもいいが、理屈はわかるだろう？」","en":"“The <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips> never betrays a fellow <tips=17>Type B</tips>. It is only by honoring that rule all these years that the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips> has forged such strong bonds. Members of the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips> have infiltrated all manner of organizations, but when the time comes, every one of them will act for the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips> because those bonds exist. Sell out a comrade even once, and those bonds will collapse. Then we'd lose our greatest weapon. So once even an enemy's sister has joined, the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips> has no choice but to protect her as one of its own. You don't have to trust me, but you see the logic, don't you?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫","displayName":"Michio Mido","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r205","rowIndex":205,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼の言っていることに、少なくとも私は説得力を感じた。","en":"At least, I found his argument convincing.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r206","rowIndex":206,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　さらに<tips=10>見土</tips>さんはしばらく考えた後、こう言った。","en":"After thinking for a moment, Mr. <tips=10>Mido</tips> added:","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r207","rowIndex":207,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「おれ自身は、<tips=44>シウ</tips>ちゃんはあのビルにいるより、こっちに出て来た方がずっと安全だと思っている。だから、本人がそう言うなら協力は惜しまない」","en":"“Personally, I think <tips=44>Siu</tips> will be far safer out here than in that building. So if that is what she wants, I’ll spare no effort to help.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫","displayName":"Michio Mido","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r208","rowIndex":208,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それは<tips=21>八龍会</tips>に<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>を攻撃する予定があるのか、それとも一般論なのか。私には判別がつかなかったけれど、その顔はあくまでも真剣で、少なくとも私の目には何かを企んでいるようには見えなかった。だから私は信じることにした。","en":"Whether that meant the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips> planned to attack <tips=7>YS</tips>, or whether he was speaking in generalities, I could not tell. But his expression was utterly serious. To my eyes, at least, he did not appear to be plotting anything, so I decided to trust him.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r209","rowIndex":209,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　こうしたやりとりは<tips=44>筱喬</tips>には伝えていない。私が彼女に言ったのは「<tips=10>見土</tips>さんは協力してくれるって」という一言だけだった。それでもう<tips=44>筱喬</tips>は薔薇の花が咲いたみたいにぱあっと表情を明るくさせ、喜んだ。","en":"I told <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> none of this. All I said was, “Mr. <tips=10>Mido</tips> said he’d help.” At that alone, <tips=44>Siu-kiu’s</tips> face lit up as though a rose had suddenly blossomed, and she was delighted.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r210","rowIndex":210,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちは部屋に移動する。私は二度目だけれども、それを悟られないよう初めての振りをする。やましいことがあるわけではないけれど、先に私が訪れていると知ったらいやな気分になるのではないかと思ったからだ。だけれど、そんな必要はなかったかもしれない。<tips=44>筱喬</tips>はすっかり緊張してカチコチになって、私の態度を観察する余裕なんか全然ないみたいだ。","en":"We moved into his apartment. This was my second visit, but I pretended it was my first so she would not realize. It was not as though I had anything to feel guilty about; I simply thought she might be upset if she learned I had come here before her. Perhaps the act had been unnecessary. <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> was so stiff with nerves that she seemed to have no attention to spare for my behavior.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r211","rowIndex":211,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　あの夜私が座ったソファーに二人で腰掛けると、<tips=10>見土</tips>さんもあの夜と同じ場所に座る。そして、じっと<tips=44>筱喬</tips>の顔を見つめた。","en":"The two of us sat on the same sofa where I had sat that night, while Mr. <tips=10>Mido</tips> settled into the same place he had occupied before. Then he studied <tips=44>Siu-kiu’s</tips> face in silence.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r212","rowIndex":212,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=44>シウ</tips>ちゃん。きみが<tips=21>八龍会</tips>に入るというのなら、おれは歓迎するよ。ただ、そのためには条件がある」","en":"“<tips=44>Siu</tips>. If you mean to join the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips>, I’ll gladly welcome you. But there is one condition.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫","displayName":"Michio Mido","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r213","rowIndex":213,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「条件？」","en":"“A condition?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r214","rowIndex":214,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　いつにない<tips=10>見土</tips>さんの真面目な調子に圧倒されながら<tips=44>筱喬</tips>は問い返す。","en":"Overwhelmed by Mr. <tips=10>Mido’s</tips> uncharacteristically serious tone, <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> repeated the word as a question.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r215","rowIndex":215,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「知っての通り、今おれたち<tips=21>八龍会</tips>ときみの兄である<tips=1>亮</tips>の<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>の関係は緊張感のあるものに変化しつつある。そうした状況で、きみが<tips=21>八龍会</tips>の一員になることの意味はわかってるね？」","en":"“As you know, relations between our <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips> and <tips=7>YS</tips>, led by your brother <tips=1>Ryo</tips>, are growing increasingly tense. You understand what it would mean for you to join the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips> under these circumstances, don’t you?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫","displayName":"Michio Mido","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r216","rowIndex":216,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「はい……」","en":"“Yes...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r217","rowIndex":217,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>の娘が入会すれば、いろいろとややこしい問題が出て来るだろう。それはきみも望まないだろうし、おれも望まない。そしてきっと、<tips=51>さくら</tips>ちゃんもね」","en":"“If <tips=3>Chris Tse’s</tips> daughter joins, all sorts of complications are bound to arise. You don’t want that. Neither do I. And I’m sure <tips=51>Sakura</tips> doesn’t, either.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫","displayName":"Michio Mido","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r218","rowIndex":218,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=10>見土</tips>さんがチラとこちらに視線をくれたので頷きを返す。","en":"Mr. <tips=10>Mido</tips> flicked a glance in my direction, and I nodded back.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r219","rowIndex":219,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「だから、おれはややこしくならない方法を考えたんだ」","en":"“That’s why I’ve thought of a way to avoid the complications.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫","displayName":"Michio Mido","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r220","rowIndex":220,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=10>見土</tips>さんの言葉に、<tips=44>筱喬</tips>は緊張でごくりとつばを飲む。","en":"At Mr. <tips=10>Mido’s</tips> words, <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> gulped nervously.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r221","rowIndex":221,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「申し訳ないが、きみには<tips=44>謝筱喬</tips>であることをやめて貰う」","en":"“I’m sorry, but I need you to stop being <tips=44>Siu-kiu Tse</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫","displayName":"Michio Mido","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r222","rowIndex":222,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「え」","en":"“What?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r223","rowIndex":223,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=44>筱喬</tips>は唇を開いて驚く。","en":"<tips=44>Siu-kiu’s</tips> lips fell open in surprise.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r224","rowIndex":224,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「何でもいい。誰か別の名前を名乗るんだ。そして、きみは<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>とは何の関係もない人間として生活してゆく。たとえば日本人の名前を使ったりしてもいいな。まあ、細かい設定とかはあとで自然で無理のないものを考えるとして、とにかく、そうして別人になりすまして、ここにいる三人以外、たとえ<tips=21>八龍会</tips>の他の仲間たちにも絶対に本当のことを知られないようにするんだ。面倒に巻き込まれたくなければそうするしかない」","en":"“Any name will do. You’ll call yourself someone else and live as a person with no connection whatsoever to <tips=7>YS</tips>. You could even use a Japanese name. We can work out a natural, convincing history for you later. The point is that you must assume another identity and never let anyone beyond the three of us in this room learn the truth—not even our other comrades in the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips>. If you want to stay out of trouble, it’s the only way.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫","displayName":"Michio Mido","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r225","rowIndex":225,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「別人として……」","en":"“As someone else...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r226","rowIndex":226,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=44>筱喬</tips>はこんな提案を予想してはいなかったらしく、眉間に皺を寄せる。","en":"<tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> had plainly never imagined such a proposal. Her brow furrowed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r227","rowIndex":227,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「この条件を受け入れて貰わなければ、おれは力を貸すことは出来ない。ただ、飲んでくれたら出来る限りのことはすると約束しよう」","en":"“Unless you accept this condition, I cannot help you. But if you do, I promise to do everything within my power.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫","displayName":"Michio Mido","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r228","rowIndex":228,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　本当に隠し通すことが出来るか、というのが私としては気になるところだけれど、残念ながら判断する材料がない。","en":"What troubled me was whether the truth could really be kept hidden, but unfortunately I had no basis on which to judge.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r229","rowIndex":229,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　結局のところ、この話が妥当かどうかというのは、最終的には<tips=10>見土</tips>さんを信じるかどうかという話でしかない。そしてそれを判断する権利があるのは、<tips=44>筱喬</tips>本人だけだ。","en":"Ultimately, whether this proposal was acceptable came down to one question: whether she trusted Mr. <tips=10>Mido</tips>. And the only person with the right to answer that question was <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> herself.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r230","rowIndex":230,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女にしてみれば自分の名も過去も、そして兄も捨てるということになる重大な判断だが、そう長く考えることなく、結論を口にした。","en":"For her, this was a momentous decision—one that meant abandoning her name, her past, and even her brother. Yet she did not think for long before giving her answer.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r231","rowIndex":231,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「わかりました」","en":"“All right. I accept.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r232","rowIndex":232,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そうだろうね。","en":"I knew you would.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r233","rowIndex":233,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ああいう形で<tips=41>グランドタワー</tips>を出て来た以上、彼女にとっては戻るという選択肢はない。いや、この計画を立てた時点で既に彼女の頭からそんな考えは消えていたはずだ。","en":"Having left <tips=41>Grand Tower</tips> in that fashion, she no longer had the option of returning. No—by the time she formed the plan, the idea must already have vanished from her mind.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r234","rowIndex":234,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして、彼女が<tips=10>見土</tips>さんを疑ったり断ったりするはずがない。彼女は私のことだって、一度も疑うことなく全ての言葉を信じてくれたのだ。","en":"And there was no possibility that she would doubt Mr. <tips=10>Mido</tips> or turn him down. After all, she had believed every word I ever told her without doubting me once.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r235","rowIndex":235,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ありがとう。……<tips=51>さくら</tips>ちゃんはどう思う？」","en":"“Thank you. ...What do you think, <tips=51>Sakura</tips>?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫","displayName":"Michio Mido","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r236","rowIndex":236,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「本人がこう言った以上、私の意見は必要ないです」","en":"“Now that she’s made her decision, my opinion hardly matters.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r237","rowIndex":237,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は肩をすくめて溜息をつく。","en":"I shrugged and sighed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r238","rowIndex":238,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうかい。保護者のように見えたからね」","en":"“Is that so? You looked rather like her guardian.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫","displayName":"Michio Mido","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r239","rowIndex":239,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=10>見土</tips>さんは苦笑する。","en":"Mr. <tips=10>Mido</tips> gave a rueful smile.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r240","rowIndex":240,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ねえ、新しい名前が決まったら、うっかり自分を呼ぶ時に『<tips=44>シウ</tips>』って言っちゃダメだからね」","en":"“Listen. Once you have a new name, you mustn’t accidentally call yourself ‘<tips=44>Siu</tips>,’ all right?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r241","rowIndex":241,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私の横顔を見つめている<tips=44>筱喬</tips>にそう念を押すと、","en":"I reminded <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> of that one last time as she gazed at me in profile.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r242","rowIndex":242,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「うん」","en":"“All right.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r243","rowIndex":243,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女はそう言って頷いた。","en":"She nodded.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r244","rowIndex":244,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして私は彼女を残し、その場を去ることにした。<tips=44>筱喬</tips>はここで全く別の人間として、<tips=21>八龍会</tips>のなかで生きてゆくことになる。私は<tips=17>タイプB</tips>ではないから、当然<tips=21>八龍会</tips>には入れない。","en":"And so I left her there. From this point on, <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> would live within the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips> as an entirely different person. I was not <tips=17>Type B</tips>, so naturally I could not follow her into the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r245","rowIndex":245,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　まあ別に<tips=21>八龍会</tips>に入ったからといって私との関係の何かを変える必要もないのだけれども、でも望む望まざるにかかわらず変わってゆくのだろうな。そんな予感がする。そしてまた、そうでなくてはいけないんだ。――そこまで考えてから、彼女への気持ちが若干さめているのに気づいた。ああ、私は、今回の彼女の判断にあんまり納得出来ないでいるんだな。気持ちが離れて来ているんだ。そう思うと、なぜか急に胸が苦しくなった。","en":"Of course, simply joining the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips> did not mean that anything in our relationship had to change. And yet, whether either of us wished it or not, it probably would. I could feel it. More than that: things had to change. —It was only after following the thought that far that I noticed my feelings for her had cooled a little. Ah. So I really could not accept the choice she had made. My heart was beginning to pull away from her. The instant I put that into words, my chest suddenly tightened with pain.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r246","rowIndex":246,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「じゃあね」","en":"“See you.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r247","rowIndex":247,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　部屋を出る間際、玄関まで見送ってくれた<tips=44>筱喬</tips>に私は無愛想にそう言った。","en":"At the threshold, I said it curtly to <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips>, who had come to see me off.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r248","rowIndex":248,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「うん。今日はありがとう」","en":"“Okay. Thank you for today.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r249","rowIndex":249,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=44>筱喬</tips>はこれからの希望にあふれた笑顔でそう言った。","en":"<tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> answered with a smile overflowing with hope for all that lay ahead.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r250","rowIndex":250,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「私、<tips=51>さくら</tips>と友だちになれてよかった。<tips=51>さくら</tips>がいなければ、きっと何も出来ないで部屋で泣いているだけの人生だったと思う」","en":"“I’m glad I became your friend, <tips=51>Sakura</tips>. Without <tips=51>Sakura</tips>, I think I would have spent my life doing nothing but crying in my room.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r251","rowIndex":251,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そんなことないよ」","en":"“That isn’t true.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r252","rowIndex":252,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　と私が言ったのは嘘じゃない。私がいなくとも、彼女はきっと何らかのかたちで行動を起こしていただろう。彼女は弱そうに見えて、強い意志の持ち主だ。それは、お父さんやお兄さんと似ているのかもしれない。","en":"What I had said was not a lie. Even without me, she surely would have acted in some fashion. She looked weak, but possessed a strong will. Perhaps in that respect she resembled her father and brother.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r253","rowIndex":253,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私はそのことについて細かく説明しようと思ったけれど、どうしてもその場にいられない事情があったので、素っ気なくそう返すことしか出来なかった。","en":"I wanted to explain all of that to her properly. But for reasons of my own, I could not bear to remain there another moment, so that brusque reply was all I could manage.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r254","rowIndex":254,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「じゃ」","en":"“Bye.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r255","rowIndex":255,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は言って彼女に背を向ける。","en":"I turned my back upon her.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r256","rowIndex":256,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「またね」","en":"“See you again.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r257","rowIndex":257,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「また」","en":"“See you.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r258","rowIndex":258,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　背中越しにそう答えて歩きはじめると、必死で堪えていたものを少し緩めた。すると、涙がぽろぽろとあふれて止まらない。","en":"I answered over my shoulder and started walking. Then I relaxed, just slightly, the desperate effort with which I had been holding everything in. Tears immediately began to spill down my face, one after another, and would not stop.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r259","rowIndex":259,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　嗚咽を堪え、後ろから見られても泣いているのがわからぬよう、必死で顔に力を入れながら歩く。前から見たらものすごい姿になっていたはずだが、後ろから見る分にはそうはっきりとはわからなかったはずだ。いや、そもそも、もうそんなに詳しく私のことを観察してなかったのかもしれない。","en":"I fought back my sobs and kept walking, desperately screwing up my face so she would not be able to tell from behind that I was crying. From the front I must have looked absolutely dreadful, but from behind it surely could not have been all that obvious. Or perhaps she was no longer looking at me closely enough to notice in the first place.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r260","rowIndex":260,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私の後ろでパタンとドアを閉める音がする。私は我慢出来ず、肩を震わせて泣いた。","en":"The door clicked shut at my back. I could bear it no longer, and wept with shaking shoulders.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r261","rowIndex":261,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　屋上に上り、そこから空に飛び立つ。つい先日まで雨が降っていたのに、こんな日に限って晴れている。","en":"I climbed to the roof and took flight. It had been raining until only a few days ago, yet of all days, this one was clear.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r262","rowIndex":262,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は地上から見られないよう、なるべく空高くを飛んだ。正面に月が浮かんでいる。あの月に向かって飛んでやろう。月のことだけを考えて、他のどんな感情も排除してやる。","en":"I flew as high as I could so that no one on the ground would see me. The moon floated straight ahead. I would fly toward it. I would think only of the moon and exclude every other feeling.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r263","rowIndex":263,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　心を固く閉ざしたかったが、その隙間から水が染み込むように感情が侵入してくる。","en":"I wanted to seal my heart shut, but emotion seeped through the cracks like water.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r264","rowIndex":264,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私はあふれてくる涙を拭った。嗚咽の声も止まらない。でもきっと、地上には届かないだろう。これだけ高く飛べば、だれひとりだって私の顔を見ることなんか出来ないし、声も聞こえないし、ましてやその心のなかのことなんかわかりやしないんだ。","en":"I wiped at the tears that would not stop overflowing. Neither would the sound of my sobs. But surely none of it could reach the ground. Flying this high, there was not a single person who could see my face or hear my voice—much less know what was happening inside my heart.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r265","rowIndex":265,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は自分の感情に当惑していた。まったく正体不明だった。","en":"My own feelings bewildered me. I had no idea what they even were.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r266","rowIndex":266,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私の心は思考と必ずしも足並みを揃えてくれなくて、予兆もなく突然やって来る。泣くほどのことではないはずなのになぜ？　私は何を感じて、何を思ったのだろう。","en":"My heart did not always keep in step with my thoughts. It would come upon me suddenly, without the slightest warning. This should not have been anything worth crying over, so why was I crying? What had I felt? What had gone through my mind?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r267","rowIndex":267,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は自分の考えていることについては、一から十まで全部説明出来るつもりだけれど、感じていることについてうまく説明することはいつだって出来ない。支離滅裂になってしまう。人間には、意識の奥に自分でもわからない考えと感情がある。それは真っ黒で、とても恐ろしく神聖なものだ。そこから薄められほんの少し表面に滲み出たものが、悲しみとか幸福とかになって心を覆う。私は嵐のなかで揺れる林の木々のように黙って耐えるしかない。","en":"I believed I could explain everything I thought from first to last, but I could never adequately explain what I felt. The words always became incoherent. Human beings have thoughts and feelings buried beneath consciousness that even they do not understand. That place is utterly black, terrifying, and sacred. What seeps up to the surface, faint and diluted, covers the heart as sorrow or happiness. I could only endure in silence, like the trees of a wood tossing in a storm.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r268","rowIndex":268,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　泣きながら私はいろいろと考える。感情に揺さぶられたまま頭を使うと思考はまとまりのないものになる。","en":"I thought about one thing after another as I cried. When I tried to use my head while my emotions still tossed me about, my thoughts scattered in every direction.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r269","rowIndex":269,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　こんなに苦しいのは、<tips=44>筱喬</tips>への感情が薄れてしまったせいだろうか？　せっかく見つけた宝物みたいな感情が、いつのまにか輝きを失っていた。それが寂しくて仕方がないのかもしれない。","en":"Did it hurt this much because my feelings for <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> had faded? The treasure-like feeling I had gone to such lengths to find had lost its radiance before I even noticed. Perhaps the loneliness of that loss was simply more than I could bear.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r270","rowIndex":270,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　結局私にとって全てのものは、透明な壁の向こう側にあるんだ。","en":"In the end, everything lay on the far side of a transparent wall from me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r271","rowIndex":271,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=44>筱喬</tips>は自分の道を見つけた。<tips=10>見土</tips>さんは何か仕事をもっている。ギャングたちは争ったり、欲望を満たしたりしている。裏通りの貧民たちは生きるのに必死だ。観光客たちは刺激を求めて<tips=57>滑走路通り</tips>を歩いている。私は空高く飛んで全てを遠くから眺めている。いつも遠くから眺めている。今回は近づきたかったけれど、結局同じことを繰り返した。","en":"<tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> had found her own path. Mr. <tips=10>Mido</tips> had work of his own. The gangsters fought one another and pursued their desires. The poor in the back alleys struggled desperately to stay alive. Tourists walked down <tips=57>Runway Street</tips> in search of stimulation. And I flew high in the sky, watching all of them from far away. I was always watching from far away. This time I had wanted to come closer, but in the end I only repeated the same old pattern.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r272","rowIndex":272,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は当事者だったはずなのに、最後は傍観者のような気持ちになっていた。<tips=44>筱喬</tips>のやっていることに納得が出来なかったけれど、はっきり反対しようともせず、気持ちが薄れ、ただ彼女の言う通りのことをした。単なる善良な友人のように<tips=44>筱喬</tips>に対して振る舞った。","en":"I should have been one of the people involved, yet by the end I felt like nothing but a spectator. I could not accept what <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> was doing, but I never tried to oppose her outright. My feelings simply ebbed away, and I did exactly as she asked. I treated <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> as though I were merely some decent, well-meaning friend.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r273","rowIndex":273,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=10>見土</tips>さんは忙しくて大変だろうに、<tips=44>筱喬</tips>の頼みに全力でこたえ、面倒ごとを自ら背負った。","en":"Mr. <tips=10>Mido</tips> must already have been terribly busy, yet he gave <tips=44>Siu-kiu’s</tips> request everything he had and willingly shouldered the trouble himself.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r274","rowIndex":274,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　これが私と他の人との違いだ。私はいつも遠く離れている。――毎夜望遠鏡を持って人のセックスを覗いていた時と何が違うのだろう？　何も違いやしないじゃないか。ほとほと自分に呆れる思いだ。","en":"That was the difference between me and other people. I was always far away. —What difference was there between this and those nights I spied on people having sex through a telescope? None at all. I was utterly disgusted with myself.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r275","rowIndex":275,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は部屋に戻ってパソコンのスイッチをいれた。そしてゲームをやった。時々涙を拭いながら。そして、身体からとめどもなく流れる粘液も。何も考えたくなかった。","en":"I went back to my room, turned on my computer, and played games. Every so often, I wiped away my tears. And the mucus that streamed endlessly from my body. I did not want to think about anything.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r276","rowIndex":276,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして夕方になって、携帯電話にメールや通話の着信がいくつも入っているのに気がついた。知らない番号と、知らないメールアドレス。メールの内容を見ると『<tips=1>謝亮</tips>だ。』と一行目に書いてあった。","en":"It was evening before I noticed the several missed calls and messages on my phone. They had come from a number and an email address I did not recognize. The first line of the email read, ‘This is <tips=1>Tse Leung</tips>.’","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r277","rowIndex":277,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=44>筱喬</tips>がいなくなったことをジェニファーから伝えられた<tips=1>亮</tips>さんが、私に連絡をしたのだった。","en":"Jennifer had told <tips=1>Ryo</tips> that <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> was gone, and he had contacted me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r278","rowIndex":278,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　もう自宅にいることをメールで伝えると、すぐに本人から電話がかかってくる。","en":"I messaged him that I was already home, and he called me at once.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r279","rowIndex":279,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　見抜かれてしまったんだろうか？","en":"Had he seen through us?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r280","rowIndex":280,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　心の準備が出来ていなかったので着信をとれずにいると、もう一度メールが来た。至急<tips=41>グランドタワー</tips>に来るよう書かれている。さらに、必要ならば家まで車で迎えに来てくれるとも記されている。どうあっても、私を逃さないつもりみたいだ！","en":"I was not prepared to face him, so I could not bring myself to answer the call. Then another message arrived, ordering me to come to <tips=41>Grand Tower</tips> at once. He added that, if necessary, he would even send a car to collect me from home. Apparently, he had every intention of making sure I could not get away!","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r281","rowIndex":281,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　こうなったら度胸が据わるほうだ。緊張感が消え、私は覚悟を決めた。迎えは断り、自分からそちらへ向かうとメールを出した。","en":"I was the sort who found her nerve once it came to this. My tension vanished, and I steeled myself. I declined the ride and messaged him that I would make my own way there.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r282","rowIndex":282,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そのあと私はシャワーで軽く身体の表面のぬめりを落とすと、新しい服に着替え、窓から飛び出す。","en":"Afterward, I took a quick shower to rinse the slick mucus from my skin, changed into fresh clothes, and flew out the window.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r283","rowIndex":283,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　いつの間にか月が隠れて、真っ暗になっていた。","en":"Before I knew it, the moon was hidden and the night had gone pitch-dark.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r284","rowIndex":284,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私はぼうっとして何も考えなかった。","en":"My mind went blank. I thought of nothing.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r285","rowIndex":285,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　こういう場合、本来ならばいつも相手がどんなことを聞いて来るかを綿密かつ周到に、いくつものパターンを想定し、それぞれの答えを用意しておく。ましてや今回のような、隠すべき秘密があるときはなおさらなのだけれども、何にも準備しなかった。","en":"Ordinarily, in a situation like this, I would carefully and methodically anticipate any number of ways the other person might question me, preparing a separate answer for every possibility. That was all the more essential when, as now, I had a secret to hide. Yet this time I prepared nothing.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r286","rowIndex":286,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　どうなったって、知ったことではない。破れかぶれみたいなものなのだよね。","en":"Whatever happened now, I did not care. I had practically thrown caution to the wind.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r287","rowIndex":287,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　――とにかく大事なことは、ただ一つ。本当のことは絶対に話さないということだけ。もしこっちの嘘がばれても、矛盾点を突きつけられたとしても、情報は漏らさない。","en":"—In any case, only one thing mattered: I must never tell the truth. Even if my lie was exposed, even if he confronted me with contradictions, I would divulge nothing.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r288","rowIndex":288,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=41>グランドタワー</tips>に到着し、入り口の前に着陸をする。扉を入ると警備の人たちがいる。彼らは私の顔を知っていて、そして<tips=1>亮</tips>さんから指示もあったんだろう。私が何かを言うまでもなく、先導してエレベーターまで連れて行ってくれる。","en":"I reached <tips=41>Grand Tower</tips> and landed before the entrance. Security men waited beyond the doors. They knew my face and had probably received instructions from <tips=1>Ryo</tips>. Without a word from me, they took the lead and escorted me to the elevator.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r289","rowIndex":289,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして彼らに従って、私は最上階に行き、<tips=1>亮</tips>さんの部屋に足を踏み入れた。","en":"I followed them to the top floor and stepped into <tips=1>Ryo’s</tips> room.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r290","rowIndex":290,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　正面の机のところに<tips=1>亮</tips>さんは浮かない顔で座っている。その右側には<tips=40>天明</tips>と<tips=40>天祥</tips>。二人ともそわそわとしていて、入って来た私に心配するような視線を送ってきてくれている。彼女たちはこのビルで、<tips=44>筱喬</tips>の次に親しい人々だ。","en":"<tips=1>Ryo</tips> sat at the desk before me with a gloomy face. <tips=40>Tin-ming</tips> and <tips=40>Tin-cheung</tips> stood to his right. Both were restless, and when I entered, they gave me looks of concern. After <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips>, they were the people in this building closest to me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r291","rowIndex":291,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>さんを挟んで反対側には<tips=25>馬世傑</tips>。私はあんまり喋ったことがないけれども、この間殺された<tips=4>馬明</tips>の息子で、いつも<tips=1>亮</tips>さんのそばに居るボディーガードである。<tips=1>亮</tips>さんとはタイプが違うがなかなかの優男で、その容姿と裏腹に、もの凄く腕の立つ人物らしい。変なオカマ言葉で喋るので、ゲイかと思ったけどそうでもないようだ。私は直接喋ったことはないが、彼がよく周囲の人間に軽口を叩いているのはよく目にする。冗談を言っているときも、笑っているときも、いつも目が怖いのであんまり好きじゃない。","en":"On <tips=1>Ryo’s</tips> other side stood <tips=25>Ma Sai-kit</tips>. I had hardly ever spoken to him, but he was the son of <tips=4>Ma Ming</tips>, the man killed the other day, and served as the bodyguard who was always at <tips=1>Ryo’s</tips> side. He was a handsome, soft-featured man, though of a very different type from <tips=1>Ryo</tips>, and despite that delicate appearance he was apparently an extraordinarily formidable fighter. His peculiar, effeminate manner of speaking had made me assume he was gay, but apparently he was not. I had never spoken with him directly, though I often saw him trading quips with the people around him. Even when he was joking or laughing, his eyes were always frightening, so I did not much care for him.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r292","rowIndex":292,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「よく来てくれた」","en":"“Thank you for coming.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r293","rowIndex":293,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>さんはまずそう言った。","en":"Those were <tips=1>Ryo’s</tips> first words.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r294","rowIndex":294,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=44>筱喬</tips>に銃で脅されたんだって。怪我はないかい？」","en":"“I hear <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> threatened you with a gun. Are you hurt?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r295","rowIndex":295,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「別に怪我はないです。あの子は、人を傷つけるような子じゃないですから」","en":"“I’m not hurt. She isn’t the kind of girl who would ever hurt another person.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r296","rowIndex":296,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうか。何もないなら良かった。迷惑をかけてしまってすまないね」","en":"“I see. If nothing happened, I’m glad. I’m sorry she caused you trouble.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r297","rowIndex":297,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>さんは眠そうに目を半開きにしながら言う。声にも抑揚がなく、感情と意図が読めない。","en":"<tips=1>Ryo</tips> spoke with his eyes half-lidded, as though he were sleepy. His voice was equally flat, leaving me unable to read either his feelings or his intentions.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r298","rowIndex":298,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いえ、それは別に。私こそ、彼女を外に連れ出すことになって申し訳ありません」","en":"“No, that doesn’t matter. I’m the one who should apologize for taking her outside.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r299","rowIndex":299,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あやまる必要はないよ。あいつは、一度決めたらなかなか頑固なところがあるからね」","en":"“You have no need to apologize. Once she makes up her mind, she can be remarkably stubborn.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r300","rowIndex":300,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼はどういうふうに事態をとらえているのだろう？","en":"What did he make of the situation?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r301","rowIndex":301,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=44>筱喬</tips>の脱走に怒っているのかも、私を疑っているのかも、今回の件を重大なものと考えているのかすら、そのたたずまいから推測することが出来ない。私は人の顔色を見て、雰囲気から気持ちを読み取ることにはすこし自信があったんだけれども、彼にはまったく通用しないようだ。","en":"Nothing in his bearing allowed me to guess whether <tips=44>Siu-kiu’s</tips> escape had angered him, whether he suspected me, or even whether he considered the incident serious at all. I had always been somewhat confident in my ability to watch people’s faces and read their feelings from the atmosphere around them, but none of it seemed to work on him.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r302","rowIndex":302,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は<tips=44>筱喬</tips>のことを隠す。彼はそれを知りたがる。となると、私と彼の対決ということになるのだな。","en":"I was going to conceal the truth about <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips>. He would want to know it. That meant a confrontation between him and me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r303","rowIndex":303,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　この街で最も勢力のあるギャングのリーダーと、そんなふうに対決出来るなんて、なかなか面白いような気もするよ。普通に生きていたらまず体験出来ないことだ。","en":"There was something rather interesting about getting to confront the leader of the most powerful gang in the city this way. It was the sort of experience one could hardly ever have while living an ordinary life.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r304","rowIndex":304,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ビルを出た後のことを、詳しく教えてくれないか？」","en":"“Would you tell me in detail what happened after you left the building?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r305","rowIndex":305,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「はい」","en":"“Yes.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r306","rowIndex":306,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は頷く。","en":"I nodded.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r307","rowIndex":307,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　心臓がバクバクとする。緊張しているのだ。これから彼に対し、嘘をつかなければいけないのだから。","en":"My heart was pounding. I was nervous, because now I would have to lie to him.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r308","rowIndex":308,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「つまり、<tips=57>滑走路通り</tips>のそばで<tips=44>筱喬</tips>と別れ、そのあとのことは知らないって言うんだね」","en":"“So you parted with <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> near <tips=57>Runway Street</tips> and know nothing of what happened afterward. Is that what you’re saying?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r309","rowIndex":309,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私がでっち上げたストーリーを語り終わると、彼はそう確認する。","en":"Once I had finished telling him my fabricated story, he repeated its conclusion back to me for confirmation.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r310","rowIndex":310,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「はい」","en":"“Yes.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r311","rowIndex":311,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　頷きながらも、不自然な感じがする作り話であることには自分でも気がついている。","en":"Even as I nodded, I could hear for myself how unnatural the story sounded.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r312","rowIndex":312,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　だって、普段の粘着質な私の性格と<tips=44>筱喬</tips>への偏愛からすれば、もっとしつこく<tips=44>筱喬</tips>のあとをついてまわるに決まってる。なのに、そこですぐに引き返して、何も知らないなんてことになるはずがない。","en":"Given my usual clingy obsessiveness and my single-minded adoration of <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips>, anyone would expect me to keep following stubbornly after <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips>. There was simply no chance that I would turn back at once and end up knowing nothing.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r313","rowIndex":313,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そこをつつかれたらなんて返そうか？　銃を向けられたショックで混乱していて、少し一人で静かになりたかったとか？　――嘘というものはなるべく事実に近いほうがバレにくいという原則を踏まえると、「彼女の考えを尊重してあえて引き下がった」という方が自然かもしれない。実際、<tips=10>見土</tips>さんの許に置いて来るとき、それに近い気持ちは私のなかにあった。","en":"What would I say if he pressed me on that point? That the shock of having a gun aimed at me had left me confused, and I wanted to be alone somewhere quiet? —There was an old rule that lies were hardest to expose when kept as close to the truth as possible. By that logic, ‘I respected her decision and deliberately stood aside’ might sound more natural. When I left her with Mr. <tips=10>Mido</tips>, there really had been something close to that in my heart.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r314","rowIndex":314,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そんなふうに次の質問に備えていたのだけれども、彼の反応は拍子抜けするものだった。","en":"I prepared myself for the next question, but his response was an anticlimax.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r315","rowIndex":315,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうか、それは大変だったね。うちの妹のわがままにつき合わせて申し訳なかった」","en":"“I see. That must have been difficult. I’m sorry my sister’s selfishness dragged you into it.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r316","rowIndex":316,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　というだけで、それ以上何かを質問するふうでもない。","en":"That was all he said. He appeared to have no further questions.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r317","rowIndex":317,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　沈黙が生まれてしまう。","en":"Silence settled between us.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r318","rowIndex":318,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あ、あの」","en":"“U-um...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r319","rowIndex":319,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おかげで、私の方がその静寂に焦って口を開くことになった。","en":"The silence got to me, and I ended up being the one to speak.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r320","rowIndex":320,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「彼女は彼女なりに、思いがあったんです。だから、変な風に思わないでください」","en":"“She had reasons of her own. So please don’t think badly of her.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r321","rowIndex":321,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「変な風って？」","en":"“What do you mean, think badly of her?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r322","rowIndex":322,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……たとえば、<tips=1>亮</tips>さんのやり方に反抗してとか、そういう意味はないと思います。むしろ全然逆で、<tips=17>タイプB</tips>の自分が迷惑をかけてしまうんじゃないかって、いつも申し訳なさそうにしていました」","en":"“...I mean, I don’t think she did it to rebel against the way <tips=1>Ryo</tips> does things, or anything like that. If anything, it was exactly the opposite. She always seemed terribly apologetic, worrying that being <tips=17>Type B</tips> would only make her a burden to you.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r323","rowIndex":323,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「きみは優しいな」","en":"“You’re very kind.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r324","rowIndex":324,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼はくすりと笑う。","en":"He gave a quiet laugh.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r325","rowIndex":325,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その思いがけない笑顔に、私は不覚にもドキリとして視線を下にそらしてしまった。顔が少し紅くなったかもしれない。恥ずかしい。","en":"That unexpected smile made my heart leap despite myself, and I lowered my eyes. My face might have reddened slightly. How embarrassing.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r326","rowIndex":326,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「僕は、妹やきみのことを責めるつもりはない。あいつは昔からどうも、臆病っていうか、義務感が強いというか、自分で自分を台無しにしてしまうところがある。いつもうじうじとネガティブなことばかり考えてしまって、だから、やりたいことを好きにやったほうがいいと常々言っていたんだ。友だちに銃をつきつけて脱走するだなんて、なかなか面白いと思うね。それでこそ僕の妹だ」","en":"“I have no intention of blaming either my sister or you. She has always had a tendency to sabotage herself—perhaps because she is timid, or perhaps because her sense of obligation is too strong. She does nothing but brood and fret over one negative thought after another, so I have always told her she would be better off doing whatever she truly wanted. Pointing a gun at her friend and making her escape—that is rather interesting. Now that is my sister.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r327","rowIndex":327,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……心配じゃないんですか？」","en":"“...Aren’t you worried?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r328","rowIndex":328,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そりゃ、心配だよ。……そう言えばきみは知ってるかい？」","en":"“Of course I’m worried. ...By the way, have you heard about it?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r329","rowIndex":329,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「何をですか？」","en":"“Know what?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r330","rowIndex":330,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=21>八龍会</tips>のことだよ」","en":"“About the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r331","rowIndex":331,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その言葉で、私はドキリとした。","en":"At that name, my heart gave a jolt.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r332","rowIndex":332,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「もう五日ほど前だったかな。町外れにある病院が襲撃されたんだ。そこは発症した<tips=17>タイプB</tips>を専門に扱う病院でね。ここを襲撃したのはどうやら<tips=21>八龍会</tips>のメンバーらしい。職員を大量に殺し、病院に閉じ込められた<tips=17>タイプB</tips>のお仲間を助け出したそうなんだよ。<tips=47>八龍解放軍</tips>とかいう武装チームを作ったらしくてね。そのリーダーは<tips=10>見土道夫</tips>。……街では騒ぎになったし、我々もここ数日はその対応のことばかり考えていたんだが、きみは知らなかったのかい？」","en":"“It was about five days ago now, I believe. A hospital on the outskirts of the city was attacked. It was a hospital specializing in <tips=17>Type B</tips> patients who had suffered onset. Apparently, the attackers were members of the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips>. They killed a great many members of staff and liberated their fellow <tips=17>Type B</tips> patients who had been confined there. It seems they formed an armed unit called the <tips=47>Hachiryu Liberation Army</tips>, led by <tips=10>Michio Mido</tips>. ...The city has been in an uproar. We, too, have spent the past several days thinking of little but how to respond. Had you not heard about any of this?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r333","rowIndex":333,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「い、いえ、知りませんでした。<tips=44>筱喬</tips>も知らなかったと思います。街には出なかったし、<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>が何をしてるかなんて教えてくれる人もいないですし……」","en":"“N-no, I didn’t. I don’t think <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> knew either. We never went into the city, and no one tells us what <tips=7>YS</tips> is doing...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r334","rowIndex":334,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼の言葉は二重の意味でショッキングだった。","en":"His words shocked me in two different ways.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r335","rowIndex":335,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　まず、<tips=21>八龍会</tips>がそんな恐ろしいことをして、しかも<tips=10>見土</tips>さんが指揮をとっていたなんて！　<tips=44>筱喬</tips>のことを相談するために連絡したときも、さっき会ったときも、ちっともそんなことは言わなかった。顔色が悪かったような気がしたけれど、そんな事件のあとだったからだろうか？","en":"First, the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips> had done something so terrible—and Mr. <tips=10>Mido</tips> had been in command! He had not said a word about it when I contacted him to discuss <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips>, or when I saw him earlier. I remembered thinking he looked unwell. Was it because this incident had happened only days before?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r336","rowIndex":336,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そしてもう一つ、今の<tips=1>亮</tips>さんの言葉には『<tips=21>八龍会</tips>』、『<tips=10>見土道夫</tips>』など、<tips=44>筱喬</tips>の今の状況に関する重要なワードがちりばめられている。これは、どういうことなんだろう？","en":"And then there was the second shock. <tips=1>Ryo’s</tips> remarks just now had been studded with names like ‘<tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips>’ and ‘<tips=10>Michio Mido</tips>’—crucial words connected with <tips=44>Siu-kiu’s</tips> present situation. What was that supposed to mean?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r337","rowIndex":337,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　全てを知った上で何か私を試しているの？　それとも当てずっぽうにカマをかけているのだろうか。あるいは、別のことを言おうとして偶然そのワードが出ただけなのか。","en":"Did he know everything, and was he now testing me somehow? Was he making a blind guess to draw me out? Or had those words merely surfaced by coincidence while he meant to say something else?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r338","rowIndex":338,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　緊張して冷や汗が出るのを感じる。こういうときは私の体質が便利だ。少しくらい汗をかいても、<tips=77>特質変異</tips>でべっちゃりと身体が濡れるのと区別がつかないだろう。","en":"I felt a nervous sweat break out over me. At times like this, my constitution came in handy. No one would be able to distinguish a little sweat from the way my <tips=77>trait mutation</tips> left my body soaking wet.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r339","rowIndex":339,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「とにかく、そういう大事件があったんだよ。<tips=21>八龍会</tips>はすっかり過激な組織に豹変してしまった。この先、街の人間が<tips=17>タイプB</tips>に向ける視線も変わるだろう。だから、<tips=44>筱喬</tips>は大変なときに街に出ていったわけだ。……まったくあいつは間が悪いというか、タイミングの悪いやつだ。昔からそうなんだよな」","en":"“In any case, that’s the major incident that took place. The <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips> has completely transformed into an extremist organization. From now on, the way people in the city look at <tips=17>Type Bs</tips> will change too. So <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> has gone out into the city at a very difficult time. ...Honestly, she has bad luck—or rather, terrible timing. She’s always been that way.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r340","rowIndex":340,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>さんは溜息をついて、","en":"<tips=1>Ryo</tips> sighed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r341","rowIndex":341,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「だから、心配は心配だよ。世間並みにね。……でも、だからといってこのビルに居させるのがいいとも思わないからね。ここにならこの素晴らしく頼りになる<tips=40>黄姉妹</tips>もいるし、僕もいるから、この先どんなことがあっても安全だとは思う。だけれども行動が制限されるのも間違いない。この先<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>は<tips=17>タイプＢ</tips>との戦いになるだろうけれど、そうしたらますます<tips=44>筱喬</tips>は不自由になる。……人生なんて、長けりゃ良いって訳じゃない。あいつは自分の人生を選んだだけだ。きっとその先にあいつの幸福があると思ったんだろう。ならば、この先どうなってもそれはあいつの責任だ。だから、きみは少しも気にすることはない。……今日ここに来たのは、事情を聞きたかったのもあるが、それをきみに直接伝えたかったからだよ。<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>の<tips=81>龍頭</tips>としてではなく、<tips=44>筱喬</tips>の兄として、妹の恩人であり親友であるきみにね」","en":"“So yes, I am worried. As worried as any ordinary person would be. ...But that does not mean I believe keeping her in this building is the right thing to do. Here she has the wonderfully dependable <tips=40>Wong sisters</tips>, and she has me. I am confident that we could keep her safe no matter what happens from now on. But there is no question that her freedom would be restricted. From this point onward, <tips=7>YS</tips> will probably find itself at war with <tips=17>Type B</tips>, and if that happens, <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> will be less free than ever. ...A life is not good simply because it is long. She has done nothing more than choose her own life. She must have believed that happiness awaited her on the path ahead. If so, whatever happens from here is her own responsibility. So you need not let any of it trouble you. ...I asked you here partly because I wanted to hear the circumstances from you. But I also wanted to tell you that directly—not as the <tips=81>Longtou</tips> of <tips=7>YS</tips>, but as <tips=44>Siu-kiu’s</tips> brother, speaking to the benefactor and dearest friend of my little sister.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r342","rowIndex":342,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　やっぱり、彼は真実をほとんど理解した上で言っているんじゃないのか？","en":"He really did understand almost everything that had happened, didn’t he?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r343","rowIndex":343,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　だからこんなことが私に言えるのだろう。","en":"That had to be why he could say such things to me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r344","rowIndex":344,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「でも、いなくなるのはお兄さんにとって困ったことじゃないんですか？」","en":"“But isn’t her disappearance a problem for you as her brother?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r345","rowIndex":345,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は顔を上げてそう言った。","en":"I raised my head and asked him.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r346","rowIndex":346,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「たとえば、あの子がどこかのギャングに捕まって駆け引きに利用されるとか、人質にされるとか、そういうことだって考えられるわけで……」","en":"“For example, another gang might capture her and use her as leverage, or take her hostage. Things like that could happen...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r347","rowIndex":347,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　この際だからと開き直って、私が気にしていたことをそのまま質問してやった。","en":"Now that I had gone this far, I simply asked the question that had been troubling me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r348","rowIndex":348,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「大丈夫」","en":"“It will be all right.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r349","rowIndex":349,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>さんは笑ったまま、","en":"Still smiling, <tips=1>Ryo</tips> continued.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r350","rowIndex":350,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そんなことをしたって、何にもならない。その時、世間とその不埒者は、はっきりと理解するだろうね。この<tips=1>謝亮</tips>を脅迫するという愚行はまったく意味のないもので、それがどれだけ恐ろしい結果を招くのか」","en":"“Nothing would be gained by doing such a thing. In that moment, both the world and the insolent offender would come to understand with perfect clarity that the foolish act of threatening <tips=1>Tse Leung</tips> is utterly meaningless—and exactly how terrible its consequences can be.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r351","rowIndex":351,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その自信に満ちた暗い微笑に、私は背筋がゾクリとする。","en":"His dark smile overflowed with confidence, and a chill ran down my spine.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r352","rowIndex":352,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　これがあのほんわかした<tips=44>筱喬</tips>と同じ血が流れる人間なのだろうか？　それとも、私が気づいていないだけで、何か共通点があるのだろうか。","en":"Could this man truly share blood with that soft and gentle <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips>? Or did they possess some resemblance I had simply failed to notice?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r353","rowIndex":353,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まあ、あいつも謝家の人間ならば、誇りを持って自分の生き死にを決めるだろう」","en":"“Well, if she too is a member of the Tse family, she will take pride in choosing for herself how she lives and how she dies.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r354","rowIndex":354,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして私の顔を見るが、私は度肝を抜かれて言うべき言葉が見つからない。","en":"Then he looked at me, but I was so thunderstruck that I could find no words.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r355","rowIndex":355,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「用事はそれだけだ。わざわざ来て貰って悪かったね。……お客様がお帰りだ」","en":"“That is all I needed. I’m sorry to have made you come all this way. ...Our guest is leaving.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r356","rowIndex":356,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼が言うと、後ろで彼の部下がドアを開ける音がした。","en":"At his words, I heard one of his men open the door behind me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r357","rowIndex":357,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「言い忘れたが、<tips=44>筱喬</tips>がいなくなってもきみへの感謝は変わらない。足に関するケアで費用がかかったりしたら、その時は請求してくれ。約束通り生涯補償しよう」","en":"“I nearly forgot: my gratitude to you will not change simply because <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> is gone. If your leg ever requires treatment or care that costs you money, send the bill to me. As promised, I will cover those expenses for the rest of your life.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r358","rowIndex":358,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あ、ありがとうございます」","en":"“Th-thank you.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r359","rowIndex":359,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「じゃ、ご苦労さん」","en":"“All right, then. Thank you for coming.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r360","rowIndex":360,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>さんはそう言うと、急に興味を失ったように私から視線を外し、隣の<tips=25>馬世傑</tips>に何か小声で話し始めた。","en":"With that, <tips=1>Ryo</tips> turned his eyes from me as though abruptly losing interest and began murmuring something to <tips=25>Ma Sai-kit</tips> beside him.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r361","rowIndex":361,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は踵を返し、部屋を出て行こうとした。しかし、何かが私をその場に引き留めた。","en":"I turned on my heel to leave the room. But something held me there.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r362","rowIndex":362,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　これで出て行ったら、きっともうこのビルに来ることもなくなる。そうして私はどうする？　<tips=44>筱喬</tips>にくっついて行くのか？　彼女は自分の新しい居場所を見つけようとしているというのに？　私はそれをずっと見守ることが出来るんだろうか？　もう前ほどの興味もないのに。","en":"If I walked out now, I would probably never come to this building again. Then what would I do? Attach myself to <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips>? When she was trying to find a new place of her own? Could I stand by and watch that forever, when I was not even as interested in her as before?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r363","rowIndex":363,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　目を閉じると、まぶたのうらに、失意のまま部屋でゲームをしている自分の姿が思い浮かんだ。そう、<tips=44>筱喬</tips>と出会う前のように。","en":"When I closed my eyes, I saw myself in my mind’s eye: back in my room, dejectedly playing games. Just as I had before I met <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r364","rowIndex":364,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どうしたんだい？」","en":"“What is it?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r365","rowIndex":365,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　動き出そうとしない私に<tips=1>亮</tips>さんが尋ねる。","en":"<tips=1>Ryo</tips> asked when I made no move to go.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r366","rowIndex":366,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私はもう一度彼に向き直って言った。","en":"I turned back to him and spoke.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r367","rowIndex":367,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「私を、<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>に入れてください」","en":"“Please let me join <tips=7>YS</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r368","rowIndex":368,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「えっ」","en":"“What?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r369","rowIndex":369,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　さすがの若き<tips=81>龍頭</tips>も私の提案は全く予期していなかったようで、びっくりして声をあげる。","en":"Even the normally unflappable young <tips=81>Longtou</tips> had plainly never anticipated my proposal. A startled cry escaped him.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r370","rowIndex":370,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　やった、<tips=1>亮</tips>さんを一泡吹かせることが出来たぞ。私は俄然調子づいて続けた。","en":"Yes! I had actually managed to throw <tips=1>Ryo</tips> for a loop. Emboldened all at once, I pressed on.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r371","rowIndex":371,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ここで、働きたいんです。正式なメンバーにしてください！」","en":"“I want to work here. Make me a full member!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r372","rowIndex":372,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ダメだよ。きみみたいな女の子は入れられない。我々はおままごとをやっているわけじゃないんだ」","en":"“No. I cannot bring a girl like you into the organization. We are not playing house here.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r373","rowIndex":373,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「普通の女の子ならそうかもしれませんが、私はサイキックですよ。サイキックならいいんでしょう？　だって、<tips=40><tips=40>天明</tips>や<tips=40>天祥</tips></tips>がいるじゃないですか。それに、<tips=28>トーマス</tips>さんのところの<tips=29>アイス</tips>さんも」","en":"“Maybe that would be true if I were an ordinary girl, but I’m a psychic. Psychics are allowed, aren’t they? You already have <tips=40><tips=40>Tin-ming</tips> and <tips=40>Tin-cheung</tips></tips>. And there’s <tips=29>Ice</tips>, who works for Mr. <tips=28>Thomas</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r374","rowIndex":374,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「彼女たちときみは違う。<tips=40><tips=40>天明</tips>と<tips=40>天祥</tips></tips>は幹部の娘だし、<tips=29>アイス</tips>だってまっとうな道を生きて来たわけじゃない」","en":"“You are different from them. <tips=40><tips=40>Tin-ming</tips> and <tips=40>Tin-cheung</tips></tips> are the daughters of one of our officers, and <tips=29>Ice</tips> has hardly led what anyone could call a respectable life.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r375","rowIndex":375,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「私は役に立ちませんか？　この力、使えると思いますけど？」","en":"“Wouldn’t I be useful? I think this power could come in handy.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r376","rowIndex":376,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>さんは答えず、机に頬杖をついたまま苦い顔で私を見ている。","en":"<tips=1>Ryo</tips> did not answer. He remained at the desk with his cheek propped against one hand, regarding me with a bitter expression.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r377","rowIndex":377,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「空飛ぶだけじゃ、<tips=40><tips=40>天明</tips>たち</tips>ほど便利じゃないかもしれないですけど、私だけに出来ることだってあるんです。例えば、私以外の誰かだったら<tips=44>筱喬</tips>を助けられたと思いますか？」","en":"“The ability to fly may not be as useful as <tips=40><tips=40>Tin-ming</tips> and the others</tips> are, but there are still things only I can do. For example, do you think anyone else could have helped <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips>?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r378","rowIndex":378,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　すると彼は溜息をつき、","en":"At that, he sighed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r379","rowIndex":379,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=81>龍頭</tips>としての僕はきみの能力に使い道を見いだすことが出来る。だが、これはきみの友人の兄として言っているんだ」","en":"“As <tips=81>Longtou</tips>, I can certainly find uses for your ability. But I am speaking to you now as the brother of your friend.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r380","rowIndex":380,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それなら<tips=81>龍頭</tips>として決断してください。使えるか、使えないか。それなら結論ははっきりしているはずです」","en":"“Then decide as <tips=81>Longtou</tips>. Useful or useless. The answer ought to be obvious when you put it that way.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r381","rowIndex":381,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「強情だな。きみにとって、ここはそんなに魅力的な世界とは思えないがね。このビルに出入りするようになっていろんなものを見ただろう？」","en":"“You’re stubborn. I cannot imagine this world holds such appeal for you. You have seen all sorts of things since you began visiting this building, haven’t you?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r382","rowIndex":382,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「見た結果の答えです。なんでもやります。最初は新人がやるような雑用でもいいです。高いところの窓掃除とか、きっと誰よりも得意ですよ？」","en":"“I have seen them, and this is still my answer. I’ll do anything. I don’t mind starting with the sort of odd jobs you give a new recruit. I bet I could clean windows at impossible heights better than anyone.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r383","rowIndex":383,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そんなもの業者にやらせるから必要ない。それに、さっきも言ったように、これからこの街は緊張状態になる。きみみたいな素人は命を落とす可能性が高い」","en":"“We have contractors do that, so there is no need. And as I said before, this city is entering a period of heightened tension. An amateur like you would run a very high risk of losing her life.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r384","rowIndex":384,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「死にません。私はうまくやりますから。そういうの意外と得意なんですよ」","en":"“I won’t die. I’ll manage. I’m surprisingly good at that sort of thing.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r385","rowIndex":385,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は強く言ったが、彼は無言で首を横に振る。","en":"I said it firmly, but he silently shook his head.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r386","rowIndex":386,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　けれど私はここで引き下がるわけにはいかなかった。","en":"But I could not back down now.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r387","rowIndex":387,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「私は特別な力を持って産まれました。でも、この街以外じゃそれを活かし切ることが出来ません。それどころか、なるべく使うなといわれるんです。だけど、ここでは違う」","en":"“I was born with a special power. But outside this city, I can never make full use of it. Far from it—they tell me to avoid using it. Here, though, it’s different.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r388","rowIndex":388,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私はしっかり<tips=1>亮</tips>さんの目を見つめて、","en":"I looked <tips=1>Ryo</tips> steadily in the eyes and continued:","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r389","rowIndex":389,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「能力を使って、<tips=44>筱喬</tips>に頼りにされたり、ここの皆さんに一目置かれるようになって、私はやっと自分の価値みたいなものを理解し始めて来たんです。……それに龍頭。私を味方につけないと損をしますよ？　私はここで断られてもこの街で仕事を見つけるつもりですし、そうなったら<tips=81>龍頭</tips>と対立する立場になるかもしれない。この街にはサイキックが欲しい組織は他にもありますよね」","en":"“By using my ability—by becoming someone <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> could depend on, and earning a measure of respect from everyone here—I’ve finally begun to understand something like my own worth. ...Besides, <tips=81>Longtou</tips>, it would be your loss not to have me on your side. Even if you turn me down here, I intend to find work in this city, and that might put me in opposition to you. There are other organizations in this city that want a psychic, aren’t there?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r390","rowIndex":390,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>さんの表情に変化はないけれど、私は続ける。","en":"<tips=1>Ryo’s</tips> expression did not change, but I continued.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r391","rowIndex":391,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「客観的に自分で見て思うんですが、私にはこの世界で生きてゆく才能があります。これを買って下さい」","en":"“Looking at myself objectively, I believe I have what it takes to survive in this world. I want you to buy what I have to offer.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r392","rowIndex":392,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その言葉に、<tips=1>亮</tips>さんではなく、その後ろの<tips=25>世傑</tips>がニヤリと笑った。","en":"At those words, it was not <tips=1>Ryo</tips> but <tips=25>Sai-kit</tips> behind him who grinned.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r393","rowIndex":393,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「おもしろいお嬢ちゃんじゃないですか。<tips=81>龍頭</tips>がいらないのなら、私が部下にしていいですか？　確か、今の私には自分の部下を採用する人事権があるんですよね」","en":"“Now, isn’t she an interesting young lady? If the <tips=81>Longtou</tips> has no use for her, may I take her on as my subordinate? If I recall correctly, I presently have the authority to hire my own people.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬世傑","displayName":"Ma Sai-kit","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r394","rowIndex":394,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「きみのところに入ったら、殺し屋になるしかないじゃないか」","en":"“If she joins you, she’ll have no choice but to become an assassin.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r395","rowIndex":395,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>さんは苦い顔をして、","en":"<tips=1>Ryo</tips> grimaced.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r396","rowIndex":396,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「わかったよ。そこまで言うなら買おう。ただし、特別扱いはしないよ」","en":"“All right. If you’re that determined, I’ll buy what you’re selling. But don’t expect special treatment.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r397","rowIndex":397,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ありがとうございます！」","en":"“Thank you!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D3:r398","rowIndex":398,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私がそう言って腰を勢いよく曲げて頭を床に付きそうなくらい下げたあとも、<tips=1>亮</tips>さんの苦虫を噛みつぶしたような表情は変わらなかった。","en":"I snapped forward at the waist and bowed so deeply that my head nearly struck the floor. Even after that, <tips=1>Ryo’s</tips> expression remained as sour as if he had bitten down on something bitter.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}}]},{"position":49,"code":"B5","unitId":"B5","rows":[{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r1","rowIndex":1,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　窓辺の席に座るおれたちを太陽の温かい光が照らしている。","en":"Warm sunlight shines upon us where we sit beside the window.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r2","rowIndex":2,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ぽかぽかとして、このまま昼寝が出来れば最高なのに。しかしそうはいかないのだよね。","en":"It is lovely and warm. If only I could take a nap right here, everything would be perfect. No such luck, though.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r3","rowIndex":3,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ここのところずっと良い天気だ。","en":"The weather has been good for some time now.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r4","rowIndex":4,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　この街には季節というものがなく、年がら年中雨ばかり降るが、こんな風に乾いた日が続くこともある。","en":"This city has no seasons and sees rain throughout the year, but now and then we do have a run of dry days like these.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r5","rowIndex":5,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ソファーの上であくびをしていると、アルバイトの女の子が席までやって来た。","en":"As I yawn upon the sofa, a young waitress approaches our table.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r6","rowIndex":6,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「こ、こ、こ、こちらが、と、特製ブレンドになります」","en":"“C-c-c-coffee—your s-special blend.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r7","rowIndex":7,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女は真っ青な顔で、手が震えるのかお盆の上のコーヒーカップがカタカタと音を鳴らしている。","en":"Her face is deathly pale, and her hands must be trembling, because the coffee cups rattle upon the tray.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r8","rowIndex":8,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「コッコッコッて、鶏じゃないんだから」","en":"“C-c-c? You’re not a chicken.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r9","rowIndex":9,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おれが笑ってみても彼女は表情を和らげない。","en":"Even when I laugh it off, her expression does not soften in the slightest.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r10","rowIndex":10,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それも仕方のないことである。","en":"Which is understandable.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r11","rowIndex":11,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　今この喫茶店のなかは、この窓から差し込むのどかなお日様の光とは対照的に、とんでもなく異様な状態だった。","en":"At that moment, the inside of this café was in an utterly bizarre state, in stark contrast to the peaceful sunlight streaming in through the window.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r12","rowIndex":12,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ホールの奥のほうのテーブルや椅子はひっくり返り、食器などが割れて一面に散らばっていた。その上で、店長が全裸の上に血だらけになって正座させられている。","en":"At the back of the dining area, tables and chairs lay overturned, and broken dishes and the like were scattered across the floor. Amid it all, the manager had been stripped naked, covered in blood, and forced to kneel formally.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r13","rowIndex":13,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　正座をさせているのは我々<tips=47>八龍解放軍</tips>である。この店長が<tips=17>タイプB</tips>のアルバイトの子にセクハラやパワハラなど、差別を行ったということで『解放』しにやって来たのだ。『解放』って言葉はいやだな。どうも。やっていることは結局暴行で、我々は愚連隊のようである。いや、愚連隊そのものかな。","en":"We of the <tips=47>Hachiryu Liberation Army</tips> are the ones who made him kneel there. We came to ‘liberate’ the <tips=17>Type B</tips> girl working here after hearing that this manager had subjected her to sexual harassment, workplace bullying, and other forms of discrimination. I do not much like that word, ‘liberate.’ I really don’t. What we are doing amounts to assault in the end, and we look like nothing so much as a band of street thugs. No—perhaps that is exactly what we are.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r14","rowIndex":14,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　けれども、か弱き同胞の少女がいじめられたとなれば、<tips=47>八龍解放軍</tips>所属であるおいらの立場としては彼女を救うためにこうしなければいけない。ということになっている。新しい<tips=21>八龍会</tips>のガイドラインでは。だから、出来ればこの街の人々はもっと<tips=17>タイプB</tips>を大事にしてほしいっていうのに、この手のタレコミは次から次へと舞い込んで来る。","en":"Still, when a frail young comrade has been bullied, my position as a member of the <tips=47>Hachiryu Liberation Army</tips> supposedly obliges me to do this in order to save her. According to the new <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips> guidelines, anyway. I wish the people of this city would simply treat <tips=17>Type Bs</tips> better, but reports like this keep pouring in one after another.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r15","rowIndex":15,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　で、目の前で店長がボコボコにされたアルバイトの女の子は、完全に怯えきってしまっているというわけ。","en":"And so the waitress who saw the manager beaten to a pulp before her eyes is now thoroughly terrified.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r16","rowIndex":16,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　こわばる手つきでカップを運んでくれるのだけど、その手が余りにも震えるものだから、コーヒーの水面が波打って、飛沫がテーブルの上にこぼれる。","en":"She brings me the cup with rigid hands, but they tremble so badly that the surface of the coffee ripples and droplets spill onto the table.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r17","rowIndex":17,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「す、すみませんっ！」","en":"“I-I’m so sorry!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r18","rowIndex":18,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ああ、そんなに恐怖に引きつった顔をしちゃって。","en":"Ah, look at her face, all twisted with fear.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r19","rowIndex":19,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いや、気にしないでいいよ」","en":"“No, don’t worry about it.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r20","rowIndex":20,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おれが言うと、恐縮しながら頭を下げ、そしてもう一杯のコーヒーをおれの正面に座る仏頂面の<tips=67>カミラ</tips>の前に置いた。","en":"At my words, she bows apologetically, then sets the other coffee before the sour-faced <tips=67>Camilla</tips> sitting opposite me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r21","rowIndex":21,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「浮かない顔ですね」","en":"“You look rather glum.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"カミラ","displayName":"Camilla","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r22","rowIndex":22,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=67>カミラ</tips>は自分で注文したくせに、コーヒーに手をつけようとしない。","en":"Though <tips=67>Camilla</tips> ordered the coffee herself, she makes no move to touch it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r23","rowIndex":23,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いや、別に普通の顔だろう？　それとも、もっと楽しそうに笑えばいいか？　こんな感じ？」","en":"“No, this is my ordinary face, isn’t it? Or should I smile and look happier? Like this?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r24","rowIndex":24,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おれが目一杯の笑顔を作って見せると、","en":"When I give her the broadest smile I can manage,","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r25","rowIndex":25,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……やめてください。馬鹿に見えます」","en":"“...Please stop. You look like an idiot.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"カミラ","displayName":"Camilla","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r26","rowIndex":26,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　せっかく場を明るくしようとしたおれの試みも虚しく、彼女にぴしゃりと否定されてしまう。","en":"My attempt to brighten the mood goes to waste. She rejects it flatly.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r27","rowIndex":27,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「わかってますよ。隊長がこういう仕事に乗り気じゃないのは。暴力を行使するのが不本意なんですよね」","en":"“I understand that you have no enthusiasm for this sort of work, Commander. Having to use violence is distasteful to you, isn’t it?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"カミラ","displayName":"Camilla","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r28","rowIndex":28,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いや、まあ……ちょっとやり過ぎじゃないか？　さすがに、ここまでやったら恨みを買うぜ。市民の支持を得られなくなってしまう」","en":"“Well... don’t you think this is going a little too far? If we carry on like this, we’ll earn the public’s resentment. We’ll lose their support.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r29","rowIndex":29,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「仕方ないじゃないですか、隊員たちはみな差別に憤っているんです」","en":"“It cannot be helped. Every soldier is outraged by the discrimination.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"カミラ","displayName":"Camilla","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r30","rowIndex":30,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そうだろうか？","en":"Are they?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r31","rowIndex":31,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　先日病院から解放した連中のうち、イキがいいのを<tips=47>解放軍</tips>に組み込み、今日もここに来ている。","en":"We folded the most vigorous of the people liberated from the hospital the other day into the <tips=47>Liberation Army</tips>, and they have come along today as well.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r32","rowIndex":32,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そのほとんどが、犯罪をおかし、警察を経て病院に入っていた連中だ。<tips=67>カミラ</tips>や<tips=22>老人たち</tips>は、症状のせいで過ちを起こした可哀想なやつらだと言う。――そういう事情のやつも確かにいるだろう。けれども、症状があろうとなかろうと、人間性が原因で犯罪を起こしてたやつもいるんじゃないかと、おれの目には見える。","en":"Most of them had committed crimes and been sent to the hospital after passing through police custody. <tips=67>Camilla</tips> and the <tips=22>Elders</tips> say they are poor souls driven into error by their symptoms. —And some of them surely do fit that description. But to my eyes, at least a few had committed crimes because of the people they were, whether they had symptoms or not.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r33","rowIndex":33,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　とにかくやたらと楽しそうに暴力をふるうのである。","en":"At any rate, they take tremendous pleasure in violence.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r34","rowIndex":34,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　隊員の一人に、「昔に罪を犯したと聞いたけど、なんの犯罪をしたの？」と聞いてみたら強姦だのなんだのと言っていた。本人は幻覚のせいで仕方なかったんだおれは本当は善良な人間なんだと語っていたし、実際裁判では責任能力なしということになったようだけれども、彼はさっき誰よりも楽しそうに店長の肛門にペッパーミルを突っ込んでいた。","en":"I asked one of the soldiers, ‘I heard you committed a crime once. What did you do?’ He said rape, among other things. He insisted that his hallucinations had left him no choice and that he was truly a good person. Apparently, the court had indeed found him not criminally responsible. Yet only moments ago, he had gleefully shoved a pepper mill into the manager’s anus—and enjoyed it more than anyone else.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r35","rowIndex":35,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=17>タイプB</tips>であればどんな人間でも受け入れるというのが<tips=21>八龍会</tips>の方針ではあるけれども、個人的には友だちになりたくない感じである。","en":"The <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips> may have a policy of accepting anyone who is <tips=17>Type B</tips>, whatever kind of person they are, but personally, I have no desire to be his friend.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r36","rowIndex":36,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それはともかく、おれのことを隊長って言うのやめてくれない？」","en":"“Setting that aside, would you stop calling me Commander?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r37","rowIndex":37,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あなたは隊長なのですからそれは無理です」","en":"“You are the commander, so that is impossible.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"カミラ","displayName":"Camilla","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r38","rowIndex":38,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=67>カミラ</tips>は取りつく島がなく、おれは溜息をついた。","en":"<tips=67>Camilla</tips> gave me no opening whatsoever. I sighed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r39","rowIndex":39,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「きみ少し変わったねえ。病院以来」","en":"“You’ve changed a bit since what happened at the hospital, haven’t you?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r40","rowIndex":40,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「自分ではわかりませんが、もしそうだとしたら、この仕事についた自覚と責任感が前よりも強く出て来たんだと思います」","en":"“I cannot tell for myself. But if I have changed, I believe it is because I now feel a stronger sense of purpose and responsibility in this work.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"カミラ","displayName":"Camilla","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r41","rowIndex":41,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうかな？」","en":"“Is that so?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r42","rowIndex":42,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女が言ったような理由もあるのかもしれないが、おれが感じているのはそこではなく、前よりもこの仕事に対して神がかり的になってしまったというか、何か宗教を強く信仰する人によくあるような落ち着きと自信が生まれている。目が妙にギラギラと輝いている。","en":"What she says may be part of it, but that is not the change I mean. She has developed an almost religious fervor for this work—or perhaps it is the calm and confidence one often sees in a person of unshakable faith. There is a strange gleam in her eyes.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r43","rowIndex":43,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　人を大量に殺して一線を越えてしまったことが彼女に作用しているのかな、と想像したりする。","en":"I find myself wondering whether killing so many people and crossing that line affected her somehow.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r44","rowIndex":44,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ただ仲間たちにとっては今の彼女の方が魅力的らしく、隊内では人気が出て来ている。特に病院襲撃時に一緒に行動していた連中は妙に懐いていた。","en":"Her comrades seem to find this new version of her more compelling, though, and she has been gaining popularity within the unit. The ones who accompanied her during the hospital attack have grown especially fond of her.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r45","rowIndex":45,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　やる前は隊員に舐められているような感じで心配していたのだけれども。","en":"Before the operation, I had been worried that the others did not take her seriously.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r46","rowIndex":46,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ま、最もおれはその変化を非難するつもりなんかない。ちょっと危うい感じはするけれども、それだけだ。","en":"Not that I mean to condemn the change. It feels a little dangerous, perhaps, but that is all.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r47","rowIndex":47,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　何よりも、これからこの仕事を最後までやり遂げるには、変わっていかなくてはならないのだろう。おれも。","en":"More than anything, if we are going to see this job through to the end, we will have to change. Me included.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r48","rowIndex":48,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「隊長は、率直に言ってこの活動をどう思っているんですか？」","en":"“Commander, frankly, what do you think of this movement?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"カミラ","displayName":"Camilla","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r49","rowIndex":49,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どうって？」","en":"“What do I think?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r50","rowIndex":50,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「心の中では間違っていると感じていて、イヤイヤやってるんじゃないですか？　本当はこんなことしたくないって」","en":"“Deep down, don’t you believe what we’re doing is wrong? Aren’t you forcing yourself to go along with it even though you want no part of it?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"カミラ","displayName":"Camilla","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r51","rowIndex":51,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=67>カミラ</tips>はそう言っておれを問い詰める。","en":"<tips=67>Camilla</tips> presses me with the question.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r52","rowIndex":52,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そんなことないよ。みんなどう思ってるか知らないけど、おれは爺さんたちには義理だけじゃなくて愛情も感じてる。この会のことも大好きだし、<tips=67>カミラ</tips>のことだって好きだよ？」","en":"“Not at all. I don’t know what everyone else thinks, but it isn’t mere obligation that binds me to the Elders. I care about them. I love this society, and I like you too, <tips=67>Camilla</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r53","rowIndex":53,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そ、そうなんですか」","en":"“I-is that so?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"カミラ","displayName":"Camilla","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r54","rowIndex":54,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=67>カミラ</tips>は動揺して頬を赤くする。意外と可愛いところもあるのである。","en":"Flustered, <tips=67>Camilla</tips> blushes. She can be surprisingly cute sometimes.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r55","rowIndex":55,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「だからみんなが正しいと思ってるならおれはそのために頑張るさ。昔からそういうことをごちゃごちゃ考えるのは苦手なんだよ。信頼出来る頭のいいやつが決めてくれれば、おれはそれを信じて行動するだけだ」","en":"“So if everyone believes this is right, I’ll work for it. I’ve never been good at tying myself in knots over these things. If someone intelligent whom I trust makes the decision, all I need to do is believe them and act.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r56","rowIndex":56,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「かつては<tips=1>謝亮</tips>がその立場だったんですね」","en":"“And <tips=1>Tse Leung</tips> used to be that person for you.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"カミラ","displayName":"Camilla","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r57","rowIndex":57,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まあね」","en":"“More or less.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r58","rowIndex":58,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「彼は今は敵です。過去の感情や関係は忘れないといけませんね」","en":"“He is the enemy now. You must put your old feelings and your past relationship behind you.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"カミラ","displayName":"Camilla","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r59","rowIndex":59,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=67>カミラ</tips>は当然のことのように言うが、おれは驚いた。","en":"<tips=67>Camilla</tips> says it as though it were obvious, but I am astonished.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r60","rowIndex":60,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なぜだい？」","en":"“Why?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r61","rowIndex":61,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なぜって、昔とは立場が違うのだし……」","en":"“Why? Because your positions are different now...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"カミラ","displayName":"Camilla","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r62","rowIndex":62,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「おれはそうは思わないな。立場が違えば利害が違うのはわかるよ。利害が異なれば戦わなくてはいけないこともある。でも、憎む必要はあるのかい？」","en":"“I don’t agree. I understand that different positions mean different interests. When their interests conflict, there are times when people must fight. But must they hate one another?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r63","rowIndex":63,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「でも、相手が間違ったことをしていれば……」","en":"“But when the other person is doing something wrong...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"カミラ","displayName":"Camilla","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r64","rowIndex":64,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「我々から見たら間違っていても、相手にすればそうとは限らない。立場が変われば善悪も変わるんだ。おれはガキの頃から色んなヤツと喧嘩して来たし、卑劣なこともされたけど、一度も相手を憎んだことはないね。怒ったことはあるけれど」","en":"“It may look wrong to us, but that doesn’t mean it looks wrong to them. Good and evil change with where you stand. I’ve fought all kinds of people since I was a kid, and some of them fought dirty, but I never hated a single one. I’ve been angry, sure.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r65","rowIndex":65,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……<tips=17>タイプB</tips>を差別するノーマルなど、弱い者を虐げるような卑劣な人々も憎まないと？」","en":"“...You would not hate even Normals who discriminate against <tips=17>Type Bs</tips>, or other vile people who prey upon the weak?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"カミラ","displayName":"Camilla","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r66","rowIndex":66,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうだよ。もちろん好き嫌いはあるけど、憎みはしないな。嫌うのと憎むってのは違うものだろう？　なあ<tips=67>カミラ</tips>、人間ってのはね、はたから見ればどんな異常でとんでもない行動でも、本人にしてみればやむを得なかったり、筋が通っていたりするんだよ」","en":"“That’s right. Naturally, I like some people and dislike others, but I don’t hate them. Disliking and hating are different things, aren’t they? Listen, <tips=67>Camilla</tips>. However abnormal or outrageous an action may look from the outside, to the person acting, it can be unavoidable—or perfectly reasonable.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r67","rowIndex":67,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「その考え方には賛同出来ませんね……。なんだか、あまりにも理想的というか、楽観的というか……」","en":"“I cannot agree with that way of thinking... It seems far too idealistic—or perhaps too optimistic...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"カミラ","displayName":"Camilla","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r68","rowIndex":68,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうかなあ」","en":"“You think so?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r69","rowIndex":69,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=67>カミラ</tips>はそう言うけど、おれはおれなりに現実を見てきた結果こう考えるようになったんだ。","en":"That may be what <tips=67>Camilla</tips> thinks, but I arrived at this view by looking at reality in my own way.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r70","rowIndex":70,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　自分には優しくしてくれていた人がひどい犯罪をして誰かを死なせたり、その逆があったり、一人の人間をいい人だとか悪い人だとか決めつけることなんか出来ないんだって。この街には色んな人がいて、色んな悲劇も喜劇もある。どれが良いとか悪いとかじゃなくて、みんな自分の性（さが）や立場に従って行動しているだけなんだ。それはとても素晴らしいことだし、おれは全力で肯定したい。","en":"Someone who treated me kindly might commit a terrible crime and cause another person’s death, or the reverse might be true. There is no way to declare any one person simply good or bad. This city is full of different people, and full of tragedies and comedies. None of them is inherently good or bad. Everyone is simply acting according to their own nature and circumstances. I find that wonderful, and I want to affirm it with everything I have.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[{"start":128,"end":133,"base":"性","reading":"さが"}],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r71","rowIndex":71,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それを上手く伝えたいけれど、<tips=67>カミラ</tips>にどう話したらいいのか？　それに、おれの考えなんか押しつける必要があるのか？","en":"I want to convey this properly, but how am I to explain it to <tips=67>Camilla</tips>? And is there any need to impose my beliefs upon her?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r72","rowIndex":72,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「おれは自分の考え方を強要するつもりはないよ。みんなは敵を憎まないと戦ったり殺したり出来ないんだろう？　じゃあ憎めばいいよ。でもおれは憎まなくても戦える。自分が信じるもののために戦うのは、お互いの尊厳をかけた聖なる行為なんだよ。おれは誇り高く生きたいんだ」","en":"“I’m not going to force my way of thinking on anyone. The rest of you can’t fight and kill unless you hate the enemy, can you? Then hate them if you need to. But I can fight without hatred. To fight for what you believe in is a sacred act, with the dignity of both sides at stake. I want to live with pride.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r73","rowIndex":73,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それならば、相手が<tips=1>謝亮</tips>や、他の誰か親しい人間だとしても殺せるんですか？　憎みもせずに」","en":"“Then could you kill <tips=1>Tse Leung</tips>, or someone else close to you—without even hating them?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"カミラ","displayName":"Camilla","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r74","rowIndex":74,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「もちろん」","en":"“Of course.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r75","rowIndex":75,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「妊婦の腹を引き裂いたり、老人を殴り殺すことも？」","en":"“Could you tear open a pregnant woman’s belly, or beat an old person to death?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"カミラ","displayName":"Camilla","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r76","rowIndex":76,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「必要ならばね。でもそれが本当に必要になるような状況なんかあるのかな？」","en":"“If it were necessary. Though could such a thing ever truly become necessary?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r77","rowIndex":77,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おれが言うと、<tips=67>カミラ</tips>は首を振り、","en":"At my answer, <tips=67>Camilla</tips> shakes her head and says,","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r78","rowIndex":78,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「私には理解出来ません。隊長の言葉は取りようによっては差別を肯定する問題発言にも聞こえます」","en":"“I cannot understand you. Depending on how one takes what you’ve said, it could even sound like a problematic endorsement of discrimination.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"カミラ","displayName":"Camilla","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r79","rowIndex":79,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうじゃないんだ<tips=67>カミラ</tips>。そういうレベルの話をしてるんじゃない。もっと本質的な……つまりね、この世界はとても寂しい場所で、同時に賑やかで素敵な場所なんだ。おれの言ってることわかるかい？　……このあまりにも壮大な舞台の上では、人間同士がお互い殺し合うとか、そんなことはちっぽけな問題なんだよ。だって、たとえ殺し合わなくたって人間はいつか死ぬんじゃないか？　大事なことは、この短い人生のなかで自分の意志で何かを選択して行動するってことだ。何かを愛し、恐れるものに対しては勇気を振り絞って立ち向かう。それは本当に素晴らしいことで、その結果殺し合いになったって、軽く笑えるジョークみたいなもんだよ」","en":"“That isn’t what I mean, <tips=67>Camilla</tips>. I’m not talking about anything on that level. I mean something more fundamental... You see, this world is a terribly lonely place, yet at the same time it is bustling and wonderful. Do you understand what I’m saying? ...On a stage this impossibly vast, people killing one another is a tiny matter. After all, even if we don’t kill one another, won’t we all die someday? What matters is that, in the short lives we have, we choose something of our own free will and act upon it. We love something, and summon the courage to face what we fear. That is truly wonderful. If it ends with us killing one another, well, that is no more than a little joke we can laugh at.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r80","rowIndex":80,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=67>カミラ</tips>は溜息をつき、","en":"<tips=67>Camilla</tips> sighs and says,","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r81","rowIndex":81,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「論点をそらして誤魔化すのがうまいですね。もしかしたら宗教家になる素質があるのかもしれません」","en":"“You’re very good at changing the subject and talking your way out of things. Perhaps you have the makings of a religious leader.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"カミラ","displayName":"Camilla","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r82","rowIndex":82,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それはいいね！　神様神様ってちやほやされてみたかったんだ。今度<tips=10>見土</tips>教ってのを作ってみるかな」","en":"“That sounds great! I’ve always wanted people fawning over me and calling me a god. Maybe I’ll start a religion called <tips=10>Midoism</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r83","rowIndex":83,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「皮肉です」","en":"“I was being sarcastic.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"カミラ","displayName":"Camilla","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r84","rowIndex":84,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=67>カミラ</tips>は冷たく言い放つ。","en":"<tips=67>Camilla</tips> says coldly.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r85","rowIndex":85,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まあとにかく、私情を挟むつもりがないのならそれでいいです。なんといっても、次の私たちのターゲットは、<tips=41>グランドタワー</tips>なんですからね」","en":"“In any case, so long as you don’t intend to let personal feelings intrude, that is all that matters. After all, our next target is <tips=41>Grand Tower</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"カミラ","displayName":"Camilla","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r86","rowIndex":86,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　さて、おれたちはこんな無駄話をするためだけにこの荒れ果てた喫茶店に留まっていたわけではない。","en":"Now then, we are not lingering in this wrecked café merely to make idle conversation.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r87","rowIndex":87,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　コーヒーを飲み終わる頃、やっと待っていた人物が到着した。","en":"By the time we finish our coffee, the person we have been awaiting finally arrives.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r88","rowIndex":88,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いやあ、顔を合わせるのがいやだって言うから、説得に時間がかかっちゃって」","en":"“She said she didn’t want to face him, so it took me a while to persuade her.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"田中紺太","displayName":"Konta Tanaka","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r89","rowIndex":89,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　連れてきた<tips=66>コンタ</tips>は頭をかきながら言い訳をする。","en":"Having finally brought her here, <tips=66>Konta</tips> scratches his head and makes excuses.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r90","rowIndex":90,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「来たくなかったら、無理に連れて来なくたって良かったのになあ」","en":"“If she didn’t want to come, you didn’t need to force her.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r91","rowIndex":91,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おれは<tips=66>コンタ</tips>の隣で俯いている中国人の女の子を見ながら言う。","en":"I speak while looking at the Chinese girl standing beside <tips=66>Konta</tips> with her head lowered.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r92","rowIndex":92,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そう、やって来たのはこの店で働き、そして店長から嫌がらせを受けていたという<tips=17>タイプＢ</tips>の子である。","en":"Yes, the person who has arrived is the <tips=17>Type B</tips> girl who worked at this café—the one the manager is said to have harassed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r93","rowIndex":93,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　店長のこのみっともない姿を見せ、そして本人から直接謝罪させて今回の件は一件落着というのが<tips=67>カミラ</tips>が提案した筋書きだった。","en":"<tips=67>Camilla’s</tips> plan for bringing this whole affair to a close is to show the girl the manager in his present disgraceful state, then make him apologize to her in person.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r94","rowIndex":94,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　俯いたまま一言も喋らないその子を早速店長に引き合わせる。","en":"We promptly bring the silent, downcast girl before the manager.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r95","rowIndex":95,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　店長は隊員に取り囲まれるようにして一糸まとわぬ姿で床の上に正座をしている。さらに、その白い肌のあちこちに傷や痣が出来ていて、顔なんかは別人のように腫れ上がっている。女の子はそれを見てギョッとしたようだ。そりゃこれだけショッキングなものを見せられれば無理もない話である。","en":"The manager is sitting formally on his knees in the middle of the floor, stark naked and surrounded by our men. His pale skin is covered here and there with cuts and bruises, and his face has swollen almost beyond recognition. The sight gives the girl a start. Hardly surprising, when this is what we have brought her here to see.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r96","rowIndex":96,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　店長は隊員に促されるまま床に頭をこすりつけるように土下座をする。涙声で許しを乞う。それに対する女の子も、涙をボロボロとこぼして「も、もういいです……」と蚊の鳴くような声で呟いた。","en":"At our men’s prompting, the manager drops into a prostration so deep that he grinds his forehead against the floor. He begs her forgiveness through his tears. The girl, too, begins shedding tears in great drops and murmurs, “I-it’s all right now...” in a voice as faint as a mosquito’s hum.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r97","rowIndex":97,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　かくして今回の仕事は終わり。最後に隊員が店長の頭を蹴飛ばすと、彼は「ぐえっ」とヒキガエルのような声をあげて失神した。","en":"And with that, our work here is done. For good measure, one of our men kicks the manager in the head. He lets out a toadlike croak—‘Gueh!’—and passes out.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r98","rowIndex":98,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　女の子はしくしくと泣きながら店を出て行く。<tips=67>カミラ</tips>はそれについて行って、何か語りかけている。<tips=21>八龍会</tips>のどこかの施設で働くよう誘うと言っていたっけ。","en":"The girl leaves the café, weeping softly. <tips=67>Camilla</tips> follows her out and says something to her. Hadn’t she said she would invite the girl to work at some facility run by the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips>?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r99","rowIndex":99,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして<tips=67>カミラ</tips>と女の子が出て行くと、<tips=66>コンタ</tips>が近づいて指先でつまんだ小さな金属をおれに見せて来る。","en":"Once <tips=67>Camilla</tips> and the girl are gone, <tips=66>Konta</tips> approaches and shows me a small piece of metal pinched between his fingers.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r100","rowIndex":100,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なんだそれ。バッジか？」","en":"“What is that, a badge?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r101","rowIndex":101,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=47>解放軍</tips>のしるしだよ。隊員はみんな胸につけるんだ。何か目印が必要だって、上の人たちも言ってたでしょ」","en":"“It’s the insignia of the <tips=47>Liberation Army</tips>. Every member is going to wear one on their chest. The higher-ups said we needed something to identify us, remember?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"田中紺太","displayName":"Konta Tanaka","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r102","rowIndex":102,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=66>コンタ</tips>が手渡したそれをよく見る。","en":"I examine what <tips=66>Konta</tips> has handed me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r103","rowIndex":103,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そこには薔薇と龍をかたどったようなレリーフが施されている。","en":"Its face bears a relief fashioned in the shapes of a rose and a dragon.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r104","rowIndex":104,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=21>八龍会</tips>のマークと、『<tips=46>ネオ・ローズ</tips>』のマークを組み合わせたんだ。結構かっこいいでしょ？」","en":"“I combined the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips> emblem with the ‘<tips=46>Neo Rose</tips>’ emblem. It looks pretty cool, right?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"田中紺太","displayName":"Konta Tanaka","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r105","rowIndex":105,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうだな。悪くない」","en":"“It does. Not bad.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r106","rowIndex":106,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　デザインのことはちっともわからないが、<tips=66>コンタ</tips>が嬉しそうに言うのでおれは頷いた。","en":"I know nothing at all about design, but <tips=66>Konta</tips> looks delighted, so I nod.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r107","rowIndex":107,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして彼は店内にいる他の隊員たちにも配りはじめる。","en":"Then he begins distributing the badges to the other soldiers inside the cafe.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r108","rowIndex":108,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おれはしばらくその模様をじっと眺めてから、ポケットにしまった。","en":"I gaze at the design for a while, then slip the badge into my pocket.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r109","rowIndex":109,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　バッジが行きわたり、そろそろこの場を退散しようという段になって、外から<tips=67>カミラ</tips>の声が聞こえて来る。","en":"Once everyone has received a badge and we are about to leave, <tips=67>Camilla’s</tips> voice comes from outside.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r110","rowIndex":110,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「何か言い争ってるね」","en":"“It sounds like an argument.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"田中紺太","displayName":"Konta Tanaka","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r111","rowIndex":111,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=66>コンタ</tips>が不審げに顔を曇らせる。","en":"<tips=66>Konta</tips> frowns in puzzlement.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r112","rowIndex":112,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「出よう」","en":"“Let’s go out.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r113","rowIndex":113,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして玄関から外に出ると、店の前で<tips=67>カミラ</tips>が五人の男たちに取り囲まれていた。","en":"We step out through the front door and find five men surrounding <tips=67>Camilla</tips> in front of the café.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r114","rowIndex":114,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　黒いスーツを着ていたり、上下ジャージだったり、年もおれより若そうなやつから四十過ぎくらいまで、男たちの服装にも年齢にも統一感がなくちぐはぐだったが、彼らの表情に共通する雰囲気からすぐにその素性が察せられた。","en":"Some are dressed in black suits, others in tracksuits. Their ages range from younger than me to somewhere past forty. Nothing about their clothes or ages matches, but the look common to all five faces tells me at once what sort of men they are.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r115","rowIndex":115,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>のやつらです」","en":"“They’re from <tips=7>YS</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"カミラ","displayName":"Camilla","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r116","rowIndex":116,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　振り返った<tips=67>カミラ</tips>の目は、興奮して金色に輝いている。","en":"<tips=67>Camilla</tips> looks back at us, her eyes glittering gold with excitement.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r117","rowIndex":117,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どうしたのさ。こんなところで女一人を囲むなんてあんまり格好のよい姿じゃないぜ」","en":"“What’s going on? Five men surrounding one woman like this isn’t a very good look.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r118","rowIndex":118,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼らが何の用でこんなことをしているのかは一目瞭然だったが、おれは<tips=67>カミラ</tips>と彼らの間に割り込んでそう尋ねた。","en":"Their purpose is obvious at a glance, but I step between them and <tips=67>Camilla</tips> and ask anyway.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r119","rowIndex":119,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「きみは<tips=10>見土道夫</tips>だね。この店で何かゴタゴタが起きていると連絡があったものでね」","en":"“You are <tips=10>Michio Mido</tips>, I believe. We received word that some trouble had occurred at this establishment.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r120","rowIndex":120,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　最年長らしいスーツ姿の男がそう言った。","en":"The man who appears to be the oldest, dressed in a suit, is the one who answers.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r121","rowIndex":121,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　雰囲気からすると彼がこのグループでのリーダーだろう。<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>の組織内の役割で言うと<tips=80>紅棍</tips>かな？","en":"From his bearing, he is probably the leader of the group. In the hierarchy of <tips=7>YS</tips>, would that make him a <tips=80>Red Pole</tips>?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r122","rowIndex":122,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ゴタゴタと言えばまあそうだが……でも、よくおれの顔と名前を知っているもんだね。知り合いじゃあないはずだが」","en":"“Trouble is one word for it... But you know my face and name surprisingly well, considering we aren’t acquainted.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r123","rowIndex":123,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そりゃ知っているとも。なんと言っても我々が今もっとも注目している<tips=47>八龍解放軍</tips>の若きリーダーなのだから。そしてそっちは副隊長の<tips=67>カミラ</tips>で、向こうが<tips=66>田中紺太</tips>だ。私だけじゃない。<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>の者なら、誰でも知っているだろう」","en":"“Of course we know you. You are the young leader of the <tips=47>Hachiryu Liberation Army</tips>—the organization we are watching more closely than any other at present. And that is your deputy commander, <tips=67>Camilla</tips>, while the man over there is <tips=66>Konta Tanaka</tips>. It is not only me. Anyone in <tips=7>YS</tips> would recognize you.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r124","rowIndex":124,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　末端のこうしたメンバーまで解放軍の人員を把握しているのは驚きだ。<tips=47>解放軍</tips>はまだ出来たばかりだし、そんな情報はどこにも公表していないっていうのにね。","en":"I’m amazed that even rank-and-file members like these know who belongs to the <tips=47>Liberation Army</tips>. We have only just been formed, and we have not made that information public anywhere.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r125","rowIndex":125,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そうだった、これが<tips=1>亮</tips>のやりかただ。","en":"Right. This was how <tips=1>Ryo</tips> operated.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r126","rowIndex":126,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ガキの頃から一緒だったからあいつの方針はよく知っている。<tips=17>タイプB</tips>のような身体能力があるわけでもなく、<tips=16>タイプA</tips>のような超能力があるわけでもない<tips=1>亮</tips>の武器は勇気と情報だ。","en":"We grew up together, so I know his methods well. <tips=1>Ryo</tips> possesses neither the physical abilities of a <tips=17>Type B</tips> nor the psychic powers of a <tips=16>Type A</tips>. His weapons are courage and information.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r127","rowIndex":127,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　よく頭の回転が速いとか、ひらめきがあるように言われている。それも優れているんだろうけれど、実際あいつが徹底しているのは計画性だ。","en":"People often talk about how quickly his mind works, or what a gift he has for sudden inspiration. He is exceptional in those respects too, no doubt, but what he pursues more thoroughly than anything is careful planning.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r128","rowIndex":128,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　徹底的に調べて、勝つべくして勝つ。そして一旦自分で計画したら迷いなく断行する。","en":"He investigates everything exhaustively, then wins because he has made victory inevitable. And once he has devised a plan, he executes it without hesitation.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r129","rowIndex":129,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　こういうの、孫子の兵法って言うんだっけ？　あいつがそういうものを参考にしているかどうかは知らないが、まあ、結果的に似たようなことになったのだろう。","en":"Is that what they call Sun Tzu’s Art of War? I don’t know whether he has ever taken inspiration from anything like that, but I suppose he arrived at something similar in the end.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r130","rowIndex":130,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　味方にいるときはこいつは喧嘩相手のことなんでも知っていてもの凄く頼りになりやがるなあと思っていたが、敵に回すと気持ちが悪いったらありゃしない。ほとんどストーカーのように監視しているのかもしれないな。必要とあらばおれのケツの毛の本数まで調べ上げそうだ。","en":"When he was on my side, I used to think how damned reassuring it was that the bastard knew everything about whoever we were fighting. Now that he is the enemy, it is creepy beyond belief. Maybe he has us under the kind of surveillance a stalker would use. If he thought it necessary, he would probably find out exactly how many hairs I have on my ass.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r131","rowIndex":131,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「この店は我々の保護下にあるわけでね。そういう話があったら確かめに来ないわけにはいかない。……ちょっと、中を見せて貰えないか？」","en":"“This establishment is under our protection. When we receive such a report, we cannot simply ignore it. ...Would you let us look inside?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r132","rowIndex":132,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　黒スーツは警戒心を露わにしながら言う。彼らもおれたちが武装して病院を襲撃しているのを知っているだろうし、だとしたら、相応の準備を整えてここへやって来たわけだ。相手は武器を隠し持っているか――あるいは、サイキックが紛れ込んでいるかもしれない。","en":"The man in the black suit speaks with open caution. They must know that we launched an armed attack on the hospital, which means they will have come prepared accordingly. They may be carrying concealed weapons—or there may even be a psychic among them.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r133","rowIndex":133,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「わざわざその目で確認するまでもなく、私がご説明してさしあげましょう」","en":"“There is no need to go to the trouble of seeing it with your own eyes. I shall explain it to you.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"カミラ","displayName":"Camilla","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r134","rowIndex":134,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=67>カミラ</tips>は声は緊張でうわずっているが顔には微笑みを浮かべている。","en":"<tips=67>Camilla’s</tips> voice is pitched high with tension, but there is a smile on her face.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r135","rowIndex":135,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「このなかには店長が我々の制裁をうけて倒れています。彼は愚かにも我々の同胞を理不尽に傷つけたのです。これは我々の正当な権利です。親愛なる<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>の方々は、よもやこの行動を咎めるなんてことはありませんよね？」","en":"“Inside, the manager lies where he fell after receiving our punishment. The fool subjected one of our comrades to unjust harm. We were exercising our legitimate rights. Surely our dear friends in <tips=7>YS</tips> would never dream of censuring us for that?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"カミラ","displayName":"Camilla","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r136","rowIndex":136,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　まったくどうしちまったって言うんだ。前は口こそ過激で達者だが、出来の良い優等生タイプで、こんなところで笑ってタンカを切るようなたまじゃなかったのに。","en":"What the hell has happened to her? She always had a sharp tongue and radical things to say, but at heart she was the capable model-student type. She was never the sort of person who could stand here smiling and throw down a challenge like that.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r137","rowIndex":137,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……どういう理由であれ、ここは我々<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>のテリトリーだ。そこで狼藉を働いたのならば相応の責任をとって貰う他ない」","en":"“...Whatever your reasons, this is <tips=7>YS</tips> territory. If you commit outrages here, you will have to answer for them.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r138","rowIndex":138,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「これは呆れました。ＹＳは我々<tips=17>タイプＢ</tips>が理不尽な仕打ちをされても黙って見過ごせと？　よく考えて発言なさってください。あなたの発言ひとつで、<tips=21>八龍会</tips>と<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>の関係が壊れることだってあるんですよ」","en":"“I’m appalled. Does YS expect us <tips=17>Type Bs</tips> to stand silently by even when we’re subjected to unjust treatment? Please think carefully before you speak. A single remark from you could even destroy the relationship between the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips> and <tips=7>YS</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"カミラ","displayName":"Camilla","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r139","rowIndex":139,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「我々とあんたたちは、お互いに干渉をしないということでこれまでやって来た筈だ。もしあんたの言うような事実があったのなら、まず我々に相談するのが筋というものだ。突然押し込んで店長をリンチするなど、無法にもほどがある」","en":"“Until now, our two groups have operated on the understanding that neither would interfere with the other. If what you claim is true, the proper course would have been to consult us first. Bursting in without warning and beating up the manager is beyond lawless.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r140","rowIndex":140,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「アハハ！　お前らみたいなちんぴらに無法と言われちゃ世話ねえや」","en":"“Ha ha! It’s rich hearing thugs like you call anyone lawless.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r141","rowIndex":141,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　うしろで聞いていた隊員たちがそうはやし立てる。","en":"The unit members listening behind us take up the jeer.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r142","rowIndex":142,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ちんぴらだと！」","en":"“Thugs?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r143","rowIndex":143,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>の連中はその言葉に色めき立つが、黒スーツは冷静にそれを抑え、","en":"The men from <tips=7>YS</tips> bristle at the word, but the man in the black suit calmly holds them back, then says,","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r144","rowIndex":144,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=10>見土道夫</tips>。隊長の意見を聞かせて貰おうか」","en":"“<tips=10>Michio Mido</tips>. Let us hear the commander’s opinion.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r145","rowIndex":145,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おれの方を見てそう言った。","en":"He turns to me as he speaks.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r146","rowIndex":146,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その言葉で、一同の視線がおれに集まる。――おい<tips=67>カミラ</tips>、そんな不安そうな視線をこちらに送るな。しっかりやるって。","en":"At those words, every eye turns toward me. —Hey, <tips=67>Camilla</tips>, don’t give me that anxious look. I said I’d do this right.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r147","rowIndex":147,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ふむ。そうだね、<tips=47>解放軍</tips>隊長の不肖<tips=10>見土道夫</tips>としましては……」","en":"“Hmm. Well, speaking as the unworthy <tips=10>Michio Mido</tips>, commander of the <tips=47>Liberation Army</tips>...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r148","rowIndex":148,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おれは辺りを見回すと、玄関の角っちょに立っている道路標識を見つけ、その支柱部分に右手で触れる。","en":"I look around and spot a road sign standing off to one side of the entrance. I place my right hand against its post.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r149","rowIndex":149,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あんたらの言い分はわかるよ。みかじめ料を巻き上げてる縄張りのなかで、白昼堂々店が荒らされました、じゃメンツが丸つぶれだからね。そしてギャングってのはメンツが何よりも大事だ。舐められたら食っていけない」","en":"“I understand your position. If a shop gets wrecked in broad daylight, right in the territory where you collect protection money, you lose face completely. And for a gang, face matters more than anything. Once people think they can walk all over you, you can’t make a living.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r150","rowIndex":150,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おれが言うと、<tips=67>カミラ</tips>は眉をひそめる。","en":"<tips=67>Camilla</tips> frowns as I speak.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r151","rowIndex":151,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「だけれどそりゃあんたらの都合で、こっちにはこっちの都合ってもんがある。目の前で不当な扱いをされている仲間がいたら、絶対に見過ごさない。それがおれたちのルールだ。それを邪魔するのなら、<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>だろうが、他のどの組織だろうが、容赦しない」","en":"“But that is your concern. We have concerns of our own. When one of our comrades is being treated unjustly before our eyes, we never look the other way. That is our rule. Anyone who tries to stop us will receive no mercy, whether they belong to <tips=7>YS</tips> or any other organization.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r152","rowIndex":152,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おれの言葉で、<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>のやつらには緊張感が走る。そして<tips=67>カミラ</tips>は驚きの表情をする。おいおい、本当に信用がないんだな。","en":"My words send a jolt of tension through the men from <tips=7>YS</tips>. <tips=67>Camilla</tips>, meanwhile, looks astonished. Come on—does she really have that little faith in me?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r153","rowIndex":153,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それはつまり……」","en":"“Which means...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r154","rowIndex":154,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そう、<tips=67>カミラ</tips>副隊長と同じ意見だ。<tips=21>八龍会</tips>は設立以来、誰の制約も受けない組織だ。そして知ってるかい？　おれたち<tips=47>解放軍</tips>は、<tips=21>八龍会</tips>を邪魔するやつらを実力で排除するために結成されたんだぜ」","en":"“That’s right. I share Deputy Commander <tips=67>Camilla’s</tips> opinion. Ever since its founding, the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips> has answered to no one. And did you know? Our <tips=47>Liberation Army</tips> was formed for the express purpose of removing by force anyone who stands in the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society’s</tips> way.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r155","rowIndex":155,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おれは支柱に触れている右手の力を使う。支柱は音もなく切断され、その力を感知した<tips=42>サイキック探知機</tips>のブザーが鳴り響く。","en":"With my right hand still touching the post, I use my power. The post is severed without a sound, and the buzzer of the <tips=42>psychic detector</tips> begins to blare as it registers what I have done.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r156","rowIndex":156,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そしておれは倒れようとする支柱をそのまま右手で握りしめ、その場で軽く振るとひゅんと音が鳴る。力を使ったときに右手を覆う手袋は切り裂かれている。道路標識を振り回した拍子に、それがズルリと落ちておれの漆黒の腕が露わになった。","en":"I close that same right hand around the falling post and give it an easy swing, drawing a sharp whoosh through the air. The glove over my right hand has been torn apart by the use of my power; the motion of swinging the road sign sends its remains sliding away, exposing my pitch-black arm.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r157","rowIndex":157,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　もちろん、ノーマルのままの腕力では、交通標識をこう軽々と振り回すことなんか出来るわけがない。おれはもう、スイッチを入れていた。","en":"Naturally, with my arm strength while still Normal, I could never swing a road sign around so effortlessly. I had already switched on.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r158","rowIndex":158,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あんたらが立ち塞がるなら、おれたちはその使命を果たすだけだ」","en":"“If you stand in our path, we will simply fulfill our mission.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r159","rowIndex":159,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そう言って<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>の連中の方を振り返る。相手はきっと、金色にらんらんと輝くおれの瞳を見たはずだ。そしておれの好戦的な笑いの浮かんだ表情も。","en":"With that, I turn back toward the men from <tips=7>YS</tips>. They must see my eyes blazing gold—and the belligerent grin upon my face.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r160","rowIndex":160,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　声にならない恐怖が彼らの顔に浮かぶ。この様子を見ると、どうも相手にはサイキックは紛れ込んでいないっぽいな。ということは、最初からおれと戦うつもりはなかったのかもしれない。","en":"A terror beyond words rises in their faces. From the look of them, I would guess there is no psychic mixed in among their group after all. Which might mean they never came here intending to fight me in the first place.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r161","rowIndex":161,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「おい、どうするよ？　メンツをかけておれたちと戦うか、こちらの言い分に快く納得して帰って貰うか。こっちはどっちでもいいんだぜ。……なあみんな？」","en":"“Well? Are you going to stake your reputation on a fight with us, or see things our way and go home quietly? We’re happy with either choice. ...Right, everyone?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r162","rowIndex":162,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　仲間を振り返ると、隊員たちは口々に「おう！」だとか「そうだ！」とか叫ぶ。乱暴者だがノリのいい連中である。","en":"I look back at my comrades, and the unit members answer from all sides with shouts of ‘Yeah!’ and ‘That’s right!’ They may be a rough bunch, but they know how to play along.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r163","rowIndex":163,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「さあどうする。この<tips=10>見土道夫</tips>と戦ってみるか？　どんな武器を使ってもいいぜ。こちらも全ての力を使わせて貰うからな」","en":"“Come on, what’s it going to be? Want to try your luck against <tips=10>Michio Mido</tips>? Use any weapon you like. I’ll be using every bit of my power too.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r164","rowIndex":164,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おれは黒い右手を見せつけるようにしながら、黒スーツににじり寄る。","en":"Making sure he gets a good look at my black right hand, I begin to stalk toward the man in the suit.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r165","rowIndex":165,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　黒スーツは額に脂汗をにじませながら、","en":"With greasy sweat beading on his forehead, the man in the suit mutters,","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r166","rowIndex":166,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「わかった……」","en":"“All right...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r167","rowIndex":167,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　苦々しくそう呟いた。","en":"The words come out bitterly.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r168","rowIndex":168,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……我々はおまえたちと戦うよう指示されてはいない。が、勘違いするなよ。おまえたちのこんな無茶苦茶なやりかたは、この街では通用しない」","en":"“...We have received no order to fight you. But do not misunderstand. Methods this outrageous will not be tolerated in this city.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r169","rowIndex":169,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「おい、負け惜しみか！」「この腰抜けが！」","en":"“Listen to those sour grapes!” “Coward!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r170","rowIndex":170,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　隊員がまた面白おかしくはやし立てる。","en":"The unit members gleefully take up the jeering again.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r171","rowIndex":171,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「お利口さんで助かるぜ」","en":"“I’m glad you can be sensible.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r172","rowIndex":172,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おれはそう言って道路標識を投げ捨てる。道路標識はガランガランと音を立ててアスファルトの上を跳ねる。","en":"I throw the road sign aside. It clatters and bounces across the asphalt.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r173","rowIndex":173,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それじゃあ、道を空けて貰おうか。……ほら、どけって言ってるんだよ」","en":"“Now clear the way for us. ...Come on. I said move.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r174","rowIndex":174,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　最後にドスを効かせて睨み付けると、<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>の連中は左右に分かれておれたちの通り道を作ってくれた。","en":"I put a menacing growl into those last words and glare at them. The men from <tips=7>YS</tips> part to either side, opening a path for us.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r175","rowIndex":175,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その間を我々は悠々と通り過ぎる。隊員たちは道の左右に立って苦い顔をしている<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>の連中に嘲笑を浴びせる。<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>の連中は顔を真っ赤にして歯を食いしばる。そんなに怒ったら、頭の血管が切れちゃうぜ。","en":"We pass between them at our leisure. The unit members shower the bitter-faced men from <tips=7>YS</tips> on either side with ridicule. The <tips=7>YS</tips> men go scarlet and grind their teeth. Careful, boys. Get that angry and you’ll burst a blood vessel.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r176","rowIndex":176,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　通り過ぎたところでおれはスイッチを切り、<tips=95>金眼</tips>モードを解除した。","en":"Once we’re past them, I flip the switch off and disengage <tips=95>gold-eye</tips> mode.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r177","rowIndex":177,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　まったく、やれやれと言ったところだよ。","en":"Honestly. What a relief.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r178","rowIndex":178,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　まあ戦いにはならないだろうという予想のもとでの威嚇ではあっただけれども、こちとら<tips=1>亮</tips>みたいに何もかも事前に把握ずみってわけにはいかないんだ。ギャンブルであるのは間違いない。ヘタすりゃ街中で殺し合いをおっぱじめるところだったと思うとぞっとするぜ。","en":"Granted, I made the threat because I expected it probably would not come to a fight. But unlike <tips=1>Ryo</tips>, I do not have everything figured out in advance. There is no denying that I took a gamble. When I think that one wrong move could have started a bloodbath in the middle of the city, I shudder.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r179","rowIndex":179,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　いやあ、殺し合いにならないでよかった。","en":"God, I’m glad it didn’t turn into a bloodbath.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r180","rowIndex":180,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　内心でほっと安堵の溜息をついていると、<tips=66>コンタ</tips>が追いついてきて、キラキラとした目でおれを見る。","en":"While I breathe a silent sigh of relief, <tips=66>Konta</tips> catches up with me, his eyes shining with admiration.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r181","rowIndex":181,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「よかった！　今の、サイコーだよ！」","en":"“That was amazing! The best!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"田中紺太","displayName":"Konta Tanaka","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r182","rowIndex":182,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうかい」","en":"“Was it?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r183","rowIndex":183,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おれは苦笑を返す。","en":"I return a rueful smile.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r184","rowIndex":184,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>の連中を脅してる姿は、こっちまでブルっちまうくらい怖かった。まるで昔の無敵の<tips=10>道夫</tips>君が戻って来たみたいだ！　なあ、おれたちの青春ってやっぱこれなんだよ！　不味い饅頭なんか売ってる場合じゃなかったんだ！」","en":"“You were so terrifying when you threatened those men from <tips=7>YS</tips> that even I started trembling. It was like the invincible <tips=10>Michio</tips> from the old days had finally come back! This is what being young was all about for us! We never should have wasted our time selling those disgusting manju!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"田中紺太","displayName":"Konta Tanaka","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r185","rowIndex":185,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　この野郎、さらっと不味いと言いやがった。なんということだ。この馬鹿野郎、おれが心血を注いだ<tips=71>グレートホール饅頭</tips>をそんな風に思っていたのか。","en":"The bastard just slipped in ‘disgusting’ as if it were nothing. How could he? You idiot—is that what you thought of the <tips=71>Great Hole Bun</tips> I poured my heart and soul into?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r186","rowIndex":186,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おれは軽い目眩を覚える。","en":"A slight dizziness comes over me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r187","rowIndex":187,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=47>解放軍</tips>って正直どうかと思ってたけど、なんだか楽しくなってきたよ。やっぱ<tips=10>道夫</tips>君はいいな。これからもよろしくね！」","en":"“To be honest, I wasn’t sure about this whole <tips=47>Liberation Army</tips> business, but now I’m starting to enjoy myself! You really are something, <tips=10>Michio</tips>. I’m counting on you from here on out!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"田中紺太","displayName":"Konta Tanaka","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r188","rowIndex":188,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「お、おう。よろしくね」","en":"“Y-yeah. You can count on me.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r189","rowIndex":189,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　やたらとはしゃぐ<tips=66>コンタ</tips>におれは複雑な心境でそう返事をし、内心でもう一つ溜息をついた。","en":"I give that answer to the absurdly excited <tips=66>Konta</tips> with decidedly mixed feelings, then heave another silent sigh.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r190","rowIndex":190,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「おかえりなさいませっ！」","en":"“Welcome home!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r191","rowIndex":191,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　すっきりしない気持ちでマンションに帰ると<tips=44>筱喬</tips>が玄関までやって来て満面の笑みでおれを出迎えた。","en":"I return to the apartment with my feelings still unsettled, and <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> comes all the way to the door to greet me with a radiant smile.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r192","rowIndex":192,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　いやあ、家でかわいい女の子が待っているというのは素晴らしいものだねえ。その屈託のない表情で、おれの心のもやもやはいくらかは軽減するというものだ。","en":"Ah, there really is nothing like having a pretty girl waiting for you at home. Her perfectly carefree expression lifts at least some of the haze from my mind.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r193","rowIndex":193,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ただいま。……なんだか良い香りがするねえ」","en":"“I’m home. ...Something smells wonderful.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r194","rowIndex":194,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おれはそう言って鼻をクンクンとしてみせる。家の奥の方から、なんだか醤油っぽい香りがするのだ。","en":"I sniff ostentatiously. Something that smells like soy sauce drifts from deeper inside the apartment.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r195","rowIndex":195,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「今日は和食かな？」","en":"“Japanese food tonight?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r196","rowIndex":196,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「はい、今作ってたところなんですっ」","en":"“Yes! I was just making it!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r197","rowIndex":197,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　と言うとおり、彼女はエプロン姿であった。","en":"True to her words, she is standing there in an apron.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r198","rowIndex":198,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「もうすぐ出来るから待っててくださいね。それとも先にお風呂に入りますか？」","en":"“It will be ready soon, so please wait. Or would you like to take a bath first?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r199","rowIndex":199,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「飯にしてくれるかな？　おれ、お腹空いちゃってさあ」","en":"“Could we eat? I’m getting hungry.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r200","rowIndex":200,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「わかりましたっ。じゃあ、手を洗ってキッチンで待っててくださいね」","en":"“Of course! Wash your hands and wait in the kitchen, please.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r201","rowIndex":201,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女はくるりと踵を返すと、スリッパをパタパタ言わせてキッチンへ戻ってゆく。","en":"She turns upon her heel and patters back to the kitchen in her slippers.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r202","rowIndex":202,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ああ、いいなあ。まるで新婚夫婦のような会話じゃないか。","en":"Ah, this is wonderful. Why, that sounded just like a conversation between newlyweds.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r203","rowIndex":203,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おれはちょっとくすぐったいような、それでいてウキウキとする明るい気持ちで靴を脱ぎ、そしてジーパンのベルトにねじこんでいた拳銃を靴箱のなかに隠した。","en":"Feeling a little self-conscious but buoyant with happiness, I take off my shoes. Then I pull the pistol wedged into the waistband of my jeans and hide it in the shoe cabinet.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r204","rowIndex":204,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　手を洗って食卓に付き、そわそわしながら待っていると彼女がやってきて次々とテーブルの上に皿を並べはじめる。","en":"I wash my hands, sit at the table, and wait restlessly. She soon arrives and begins setting one dish after another before me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r205","rowIndex":205,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　今日のメニューは、まずたっぷりの大根おろしを添えた秋刀魚の塩焼き。そして牛肉を使った肉じゃが。さらにじゃこの混じった小松菜のおひたしに、レタスとトマトたっぷりのフレンチドレッシングがかかったサラダ。味噌汁の具はなめこと豆腐で、細かく切った葱が散らしてある。","en":"Tonight’s menu begins with salt-grilled Pacific saury accompanied by a generous mound of grated daikon. Then comes beef nikujaga; komatsuna steeped in seasoned broth with dried baby sardines; and a salad heaped with lettuce and tomato beneath French dressing. The miso soup contains nameko mushrooms and tofu, scattered with finely chopped scallions.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r206","rowIndex":206,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「簡単なものばかりで恥ずかしいですけど」","en":"“It’s embarrassing that everything is so simple.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r207","rowIndex":207,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　と彼女は照れている。","en":"She looks bashful.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r208","rowIndex":208,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いやあ素晴らしいよ。こんなに沢山皿が並ぶだけでも感激しちゃう。秋刀魚の焼き加減は完璧だし、肉じゃがの色も良いね。じゃあさっそくいただきます」","en":"“No, this is fantastic. Just seeing this many dishes laid out is enough to move me. The saury is grilled perfectly, and the nikujaga has a beautiful color. Well then, time to dig in.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r209","rowIndex":209,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして彼女が反応を注目するなか、おれは肉じゃがから手をつけた。","en":"With her watching closely for my response, I begin with the nikujaga.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r210","rowIndex":210,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「うまいっ！　うまいよこれ。……あっ、味噌汁もうまい！　これ出汁は煮干しと昆布かい？　手間かかってるねえ。いやあ、すごいなあ」","en":"“Delicious! This is really good. ...Oh, the miso soup is delicious too! Did you make the stock with dried sardines and kombu? You really put some work into this. Wow, I’m impressed.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r211","rowIndex":211,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そんな大げさな……」","en":"“You’re exaggerating...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r212","rowIndex":212,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ホントだって。いやあ、和食を食べるの久しぶりだなあ。この街って、色んな食べ物があるけど、家庭的な和食はあんまりないからね。特におれなんかいつも適当な外食ばかりだし、なんだか安心しちゃうよ。おれが子供の頃住んでたところはさ、いつも和食だったからねえ」","en":"“I mean it. God, it’s been a long time since I had Japanese food. You can find every kind of cuisine in this city, but hardly any ordinary home-style Japanese cooking. And I’m always eating whatever I can find outside, so a meal like this puts me strangely at ease. The place where I lived as a kid served Japanese food every day.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r213","rowIndex":213,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　お世辞で言っているわけではない。肉じゃがをつまみ、そして秋刀魚で白米をかき込み、最後にズズッと味噌汁をすすると、なんとも言えないほっこりするような幸せを感じるのだ。こんな街に住んでいると遠ざかってしまうが、これぞ日本の食卓といった味である。","en":"I am not merely flattering her. I pick at the nikujaga, devour white rice with bites of saury, then finish by slurping down the miso soup. The meal fills me with an indescribable, deeply comforting happiness. Life in this city has carried me far away from food like this, but these are the flavors of the Japanese family table itself.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r214","rowIndex":214,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いやあうまい。お店の定食よりずっと美味しいよこれ！」","en":"“This is so good. Much better than a set meal at a restaurant!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r215","rowIndex":215,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=10>見土</tips>さんって、褒め上手ですね」","en":"“You certainly know how to flatter a person, Mr. <tips=10>Mido</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r216","rowIndex":216,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そう言いながらも、おれの褒めちぎる様子と食べっぷりがおかしいのか、まんざらでもなく笑っている。","en":"Even as she says it, she smiles with evident pleasure, perhaps amused by the extravagance of my praise and the vigor of my appetite.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r217","rowIndex":217,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=41>グランドタワー</tips>ではお嬢様扱いだったんじゃないの？　これは作ってた人の料理だよ。お母さんから教わったの？」","en":"“Weren’t you treated like a princess at <tips=41>Grand Tower</tips>? This food tastes like it was made by someone who has been cooking for years. Did your mother teach you?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r218","rowIndex":218,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いえ、お兄ちゃんからなんです」","en":"“No. My brother did.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r219","rowIndex":219,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=1>亮</tips>から？」","en":"“<tips=1>Ryo</tips>?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r220","rowIndex":220,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女はこくりと頷き、","en":"She gives a small nod.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r221","rowIndex":221,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「お母さんの具合が悪くなったあと、お兄ちゃんが家に帰って来て、一緒に暮らしながら二人でお母さんの面倒をみていた時期があるんです。そのとき料理も、洗濯も、家事のやりかたぜーんぶお兄ちゃんが教えてくれたんですよ。母は日本人なので、料理はいつも和食で」","en":"“After Mother’s condition grew worse, my brother came home. For a while, the two of us lived together and took care of her. He taught me how to cook, how to do the laundry—absolutely everything about keeping house. Mother was Japanese, so we always cooked Japanese food.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r222","rowIndex":222,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「へえ、定食屋で料理は教わってたのは知ってるけど、他の家事も出来るんだ」","en":"“I knew he’d learned to cook at the diner, but I didn’t know he could do the rest of the housework too.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r223","rowIndex":223,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうみたいです。何があっても自分のことは全部出来るようにって。それでかわりばんこに家事をやってたんですよ」","en":"“It seems so. He wanted me to be able to take care of myself completely, no matter what happened. So we took turns with the housework.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r224","rowIndex":224,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「えらいねえ」","en":"“That’s impressive.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r225","rowIndex":225,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おれは頷いて、食事を進める。","en":"I nod and continue eating.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r226","rowIndex":226,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あの時は大変だったけど、今思うと楽しかったなあ。お兄ちゃんが一緒に居て、お母さんも調子が良いときは会話が出来たし……お父さんはたまにしか来なかったけど、でも、家族が三人も揃って一緒に暮らすだなんて、あの時だけだったからなあ……」","en":"“It was hard at the time, but looking back on it now, I was happy. My brother was there, and whenever Mother was feeling well enough, the three of us could talk... Father only came by occasionally, but even so, that was the one time in my life when three members of my family all lived under the same roof...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r227","rowIndex":227,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女はその当時を思い出すかのように首を傾け、おれはその仕草を横に見ながら食事を続ける。","en":"She tilts her head as if gazing back into those days. Seated beside her, I watch the gesture out of the corner of my eye and continue eating.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r228","rowIndex":228,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ということは、これが菅原家の味なのか。家族の味なのか。","en":"Then this must be the flavor of the Sugawara household—the flavor of family.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r229","rowIndex":229,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おれにはそういったものは縁がないはずなのに、言われて見るとなんだか懐かしいような気分になるから不思議だ。","en":"I ought to have no connection to anything like that, yet now that she has told me, I find myself feeling strangely nostalgic.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r230","rowIndex":230,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あ、ビールもありますけど出しますか？」","en":"“Oh, we have beer too. Would you like one?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r231","rowIndex":231,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「気が利くねえ」","en":"“How thoughtful.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r232","rowIndex":232,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おれは満面の笑みを浮かべて、うんと頷く。","en":"I beam and nod vigorously.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r233","rowIndex":233,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ビールを運んでくると、彼女も手を合わせて「頂きます」と言ってから自分の分を食べ始めた。","en":"After bringing me the beer, she presses her palms together, gives thanks for the food, and begins eating her own meal.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r234","rowIndex":234,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　名前は完全な中国人だが、その仕草はまったく日本人そのものである。","en":"Her name is entirely Chinese, yet the gesture is Japanese through and through.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r235","rowIndex":235,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　小さい頃、日本人の母親と二人きりで過ごしていたからそういったものが身についているんだろうなきっと。","en":"She spent her early childhood alone with her Japanese mother, so she must have absorbed these habits then.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r236","rowIndex":236,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>も日本人夫婦に育てられたから、完全に日本人にしか見えない。実際、<tips=1>菅原亮</tips>と名乗っていた当時、彼の父親が中国人で、しかも<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>だなんて誰も想像もしなかったもの。","en":"<tips=1>Ryo</tips> was raised by a Japanese couple and looks completely Japanese as well. Indeed, when he called himself <tips=1>Ryo Sugawara</tips>, no one imagined that his father was Chinese—much less <tips=3>Chris Tse</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r237","rowIndex":237,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　だから彼女だってきっと、誰からも疑われることはあるまい。","en":"Surely no one will suspect that she is anything but Japanese either.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r238","rowIndex":238,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女は今後、篠田<tips=44>詩由子</tips>と名乗ることになっている。","en":"From now on, she is to call herself <tips=44>Shiyuko</tips> Shinoda.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r239","rowIndex":239,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　最初は本名と全くかけ離れた名前をつけたのだが、ふとしたときに自分の名前を「<tips=44>シウ</tips>」と呼んでしまう癖がどうしても抜けないので、そう呼んでも違和感が少ないよう「しゆこ」というあまり見ない名前に変えた。「しゆ」がなまって「<tips=44>シウ</tips>」というニックネームになったという設定である。","en":"At first, we gave her a name with no resemblance whatsoever to her real one. But she simply could not break the habit of occasionally calling herself ‘<tips=44>Siu</tips>,’ so we changed it to the unusual name Shiyuko, from which ‘Siu’ would not sound too unnatural. The story is that a slurred pronunciation of ‘Shiyu’ gave rise to the nickname ‘<tips=44>Siu</tips>.’","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r240","rowIndex":240,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　本名に近い名前を使うのはリスクがないとは言えない。","en":"Using a name close to her real one is not entirely without risk.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r241","rowIndex":241,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ただ、<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>に娘がいるというのは有名だとしても、その名前まではあまり知られていないし、その顔を知っている者となれば、本人の知り合い以外いないんじゃないだろうか？","en":"But although it is widely known that <tips=3>Chris Tse</tips> has a daughter, her name is much less familiar, and who besides personal acquaintances would know her face?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r242","rowIndex":242,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　何しろ彼女は小さい時は母親と二人でボディーガードが守る家の中で暮らし、母親が亡くなってからは<tips=41>グランドタワー</tips>に閉じ込められるようにして過ごしていた、筋金入りの箱入り娘なのである。","en":"As a child, she lived alone with her mother in a house guarded by bodyguards. After her mother died, she spent her days virtually confined within <tips=41>Grand Tower</tips>. Hers is as sheltered an upbringing as anyone could possibly have.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r243","rowIndex":243,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　例えばおれなんかがうっかり「<tips=44>シウ</tips>」と呼んだとしても、おいそれと素性が知られることはないだろう。――もちろん、「<tips=44>詩由子</tips>」と呼ぶつもりではいるが。","en":"Even if someone like me carelessly calls her ‘<tips=44>Siu</tips>,’ her identity is unlikely to be discovered so readily. ...Naturally, I intend to call her <tips=44>Shiyuko</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r244","rowIndex":244,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=44>筱喬</tips>――改め<tips=44>詩由子</tips>は静かに食事をとっている。その箸使いも丁寧で、育ちの良さをうかがわせる。","en":"<tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips>—now <tips=44>Shiyuko</tips>—quietly eats her meal. Even the way she handles her chopsticks is refined and speaks to her excellent upbringing.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r245","rowIndex":245,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女がここに来てから四日が過ぎた。はじめの二日は部屋のなかで過ごし、鍵を渡して自由に外へ出られるようになったのが昨日からだ。今日は料理を作りたいと朝から言っていたので材料を買う金を渡した。彼女自身には所持金がない。","en":"Four days have passed since she came here. She spent the first two inside the apartment; it was only yesterday that I gave her a key and let her begin going out freely. She had been saying since this morning that she wanted to cook, so I gave her money for ingredients. She has no money of her own.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r246","rowIndex":246,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　かわりに、家から持って来た宝石やアクセサリーをおれに預けている。誕生日や何かの記念日のたびに父親やまわりの大人がプレゼントしてくれたものだそうだ。本人はまったく知識がなかったが、おれがみてもそうとわかるような有名ブランドの高級品ばかりで、それだけで一財産ある。","en":"In their place, she has entrusted me with the jewelry and accessories she brought from home. Apparently, her father and the other adults around her gave them to her for birthdays and commemorative occasions. She herself knows nothing about jewelry, yet every piece is an expensive product from a famous brand recognizable even to me. Together, they amount to a small fortune.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r247","rowIndex":247,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おれは何かの時のために自分で持っているよう言ったけれども、迷惑代として必要なら使って欲しいと譲らず、押しつけるようにして渡されてしまった。","en":"I told her to keep them herself in case she ever needed them, but she refused, saying she wanted me to use them if necessary as compensation for the trouble she had caused, and practically forced them upon me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r248","rowIndex":248,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　もちろん、おれが使えるわけもない。手つかずであとで返すつもりだ。本人は気づいていないのかもしれないが、こういうものが本当に頼りになる場面というものは誰にでも訪れるのだから。","en":"Of course, I could never use them. I mean to return them later, untouched. She may not realize it, but everyone eventually encounters a time when things like these are truly useful.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r249","rowIndex":249,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女はこの四日間いつもニコニコとしていて、いまも穏やかな顔をしているが、心中は穏やかではないだろう。","en":"She has smiled throughout these four days and wears a calm face even now, but her heart can hardly be calm.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r250","rowIndex":250,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　薬で抑えているとは言え、発症してしまった。唯一の肉親である兄と離れ、こんな親しいとは言えない男のマンションに転がり込んでいる。しかもその男は、どうも今後兄と敵同士になるらしい。そして自分も、その敵の組織に入ろうというのだ。","en":"The medicine may be keeping it under control, but she has suffered onset. She is separated from her brother, her only living relative, and has moved into the apartment of a man she can hardly call close. Worse, that man now appears likely to become her brother’s enemy—and she herself intends to join his organization.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r251","rowIndex":251,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　心細いと言えば、これほど心細いこともないはずだ。","en":"It would be difficult to imagine a more frighteningly uncertain position to find oneself in.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r252","rowIndex":252,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おれはまだ彼女を<tips=21>八龍会</tips>の連中に紹介はしていない。","en":"I have not yet introduced her to anyone in the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r253","rowIndex":253,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　本人の気が変わるかもしれないと様子をみているのだが、<tips=44>詩由子</tips>は今のところそんなそぶりを見せない。となると話を進めるべきなのだろうけれど、本当に<tips=21>八龍会</tips>に彼女を入れていいのか――というところでおれは今更ちょっと迷っている。","en":"I have been waiting to see whether she might change her mind, but so far <tips=44>Shiyuko</tips> has shown no sign that she will. In that case, I ought to move matters forward. And yet, rather late in the day, I have begun to wonder whether bringing her into the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips> is truly the right thing to do.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r254","rowIndex":254,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=51>さくら</tips>の話では<tips=1>亮</tips>が<tips=4>馬明</tips>を殺した時に大層腹を立てたそうだが、ここに来てからの言動を観察する限りでは<tips=1>亮</tips>に対する隔意のようなものは感じられない。むしろ兄に対する限りない愛情ばかりが見て取れる。","en":"According to <tips=51>Sakura</tips>, she was furious when <tips=1>Ryo</tips> killed <tips=4>Ma Ming</tips>. Yet in everything she has said and done since coming here, I have sensed no reserve toward <tips=1>Ryo</tips> at all. On the contrary, what I see is a boundless love for her brother.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r255","rowIndex":255,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それを<tips=21>八龍会</tips>に入れてしまっては、この先彼女が傷つくことになるのではないだろうか？","en":"If I bring her into the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips>, won’t she only end up getting hurt? ","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r256","rowIndex":256,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　我々と<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>との関係がどのように決着するのか、<tips=22>老人たち</tips>の頭には最終的な姿が想像出来ているのかもしれないが、現状おれの方には入って来ていない。今までのやり方だと、どこかの組織と揉めても、相手のボスを殺したりといった直接的なことはせず、陰謀を駆使し、影響力を見せつけて言うことを聞かせるというやり方だった。","en":"The <tips=22>Elders</tips> may already have some final outcome in mind for our relationship with <tips=7>YS</tips>, but if they do, none of it has reached me. Until now, whenever they came into conflict with another organization, they avoided direct measures such as killing its boss. They preferred to weave plots, demonstrate their influence, and compel the other side to obey.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r257","rowIndex":257,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　だが、今回は違うだろう。こんな<tips=47>解放軍</tips>を作って、街で暴力事件を起こさせているのだから、いずれ直接的な対決はあるはずだ。その先に、何があるのか。","en":"This time, however, must be different. The Elders have created a <tips=47>Liberation Army</tips> like ours and set it loose to commit acts of violence throughout the city. Sooner or later, a direct confrontation is bound to come. What awaits us on the other side of it?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r258","rowIndex":258,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おれと<tips=1>亮</tips>のどちらかが死ぬということもあるかもしれない。どちらの場合でも、彼女は苦しむことになる。","en":"Either <tips=1>Ryo</tips> or I may die. Whichever it is, she will suffer.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r259","rowIndex":259,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　もしかしたら、<tips=21>八龍会</tips>ではなく、<tips=9>Y地区</tips>を出て別の<tips=17>タイプB</tips>互助組織に紹介したほうがいいのではないかという気がしている。そこならば、<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>と対立するということもないし、万が一、兄のもとに戻りたくなったときにも都合がいいだろう。","en":"I am beginning to think that, rather than bring her into the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips>, I should help her leave <tips=9>Y District</tips> and introduce her to some other <tips=17>Type B</tips> mutual-aid organization. She would not be drawn into a conflict with <tips=7>YS</tips> there, and if she ever wanted to return to her brother, it would be far easier for her to do so.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r260","rowIndex":260,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しかし、それも簡単ではない。現在<tips=21>八龍会</tips>は近隣の組織とは軒並み関係を悪化させている。","en":"But even that would not be easy. The <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips> has soured its relations with virtually every neighboring organization.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r261","rowIndex":261,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　八龍会が持つ『<tips=46>ネオ・ローズ</tips>』は他の<tips=17>タイプＢ</tips>組織もノドから手が出るほど欲しいものだが、現状はこれを独占しており、よその組織には一切流していない。再三その要求があるけれども、<tips=22>老人たち</tips>は完全に突っぱねている。その結果として、よその組織を抜けて<tips=21>八龍会</tips>にやって来る者が増えた。これが狙い、というわけでもないだろうが、結果そうなっている。","en":"Every other <tips=17>Type B</tips> organization wants the <tips=46>Neo Rose</tips> possessed by the Eight Dragons Society badly enough to reach down its own throat for it. At present, however, the Society maintains an absolute monopoly and refuses to provide any to outside groups. The requests have been repeated, and the <tips=22>Elders</tips> have rejected every one outright. As a result, increasing numbers of people are abandoning their old organizations and coming to the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips>. That may not have been the plan, but it is what has happened.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r262","rowIndex":262,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　このような事情があって、近隣の組織のほとんどがカンカンに怒ってしまった。付き合いをやめると言い出す組織もある。","en":"Under these circumstances, nearly all the neighboring organizations have become furious. Some have even announced that they are cutting off relations.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r263","rowIndex":263,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そうした相手に、<tips=21>八龍会</tips>でそれなりの地位にいるおれが紹介する、というのはちょっと難しい。下手をすれば、おれの大事な人間だということで人質にとられる可能性もある。よほど信頼出来る相手を探すか、誰か人を介さなければいけないが、そんな都合のいい人間はすぐには見つからない。","en":"Given all that, it would be difficult for someone in my position within the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips> to approach one of those groups and introduce her. If things went badly, they might decide that someone important to me would make a useful hostage. I would need to find a person I could trust absolutely, or arrange the introduction through someone else—and a person that perfectly suited to my needs will not be easy to find on short notice.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r264","rowIndex":264,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ぼんやりと彼女の顔を見つめていると、目が合って、おれに微笑みかけて来る。","en":"As I stare absently at her face, our eyes meet, and she smiles at me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r265","rowIndex":265,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　なんだかおれはドギマギして、慌てて食事を再開した。","en":"For some reason I grow flustered and hastily resume my meal.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r266","rowIndex":266,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「最近体調はどうだい？　薬の副作用とか出てないかい？」","en":"“How have you been feeling lately? The medicine hasn’t given you any side effects, has it?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r267","rowIndex":267,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　お互い食べ終わってから、おれは二本目のビールを飲みながらそう尋ねた。","en":"Once we have both finished, I ask while drinking my second beer.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r268","rowIndex":268,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「全然。これ、本当に凄い薬ですね……」","en":"“None at all. This truly is an incredible medicine...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r269","rowIndex":269,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=44>詩由子</tips>は感心したように溜息をつく。","en":"<tips=44>Shiyuko</tips> sighs in wonder.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r270","rowIndex":270,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=17>タイプB</tips>というもののあり方を、完全に変えてしまいます。今までの私の一生って、ずっとずっと発症を怖がってきて、そのことばかりを考え続けていろんな本を読んだり、知識を集めたり、どうしようもなくて沢山泣いたりしてきたのに注射一本で解決しちゃうなんてなんだか馬鹿みたい」","en":"“It is going to change completely what it means to be a <tips=17>Type B</tips>. I spent my entire life terrified that I would suffer onset. I thought about it constantly, read all kinds of books, gathered every scrap of knowledge I could, and cried so many times because nothing could be done. And now a single injection solves everything. It makes my whole life seem almost ridiculous.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r271","rowIndex":271,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「苦しんだり学んだりしたことはムダにはならないさ」","en":"“Everything you suffered and everything you learned will not go to waste.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r272","rowIndex":272,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうかもしれません。でも、ほんと、いろいろ考えちゃうんですよね……」","en":"“Perhaps not. But I truly find myself thinking about all sorts of things...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r273","rowIndex":273,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=44>詩由子</tips>は食後の緑茶の入った湯飲みを自分の両手で包み込むようにしている。","en":"<tips=44>Shiyuko</tips> cups her after-dinner teacup of green tea between both hands.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r274","rowIndex":274,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いままで苦しんだり、死んでいった人とかも、今だったら注射ひとつで元気になっちゃうんでしょう？　たとえば私のお母さんも、この薬さえあればあんな悲しい人生を送る必要なんかなかった。なんだかこの薬が出来たせいで、あの悲劇がコメディみたいになっちゃってません？」","en":"“All the people who suffered and died in the past—today, one injection would make them healthy again, wouldn’t it? Take my mother. If only she had had this medicine, there would have been no reason for her life to be so terribly sad. Now that the medicine exists, doesn’t it almost turn her tragedy into a comedy?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r275","rowIndex":275,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それは考え方が逆じゃないかな」","en":"“I think you may have that backward.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r276","rowIndex":276,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おれは苦笑して、","en":"I give her a rueful smile and say,","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r277","rowIndex":277,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「こんな薬が生まれてくれたおかげで、あれほどおそろしい悲劇がなくなって良かったって、喜ぶところじゃないか。そりゃお母さんに間に合わなかったのは残念だけど、だからこそ繰り返しちゃいけないって思える。だって、そんなこと考えたって時間は絶対に巻き戻しは出来ないんだからさ」","en":"“Isn’t this something to be happy about? Thanks to this medicine, tragedies as terrible as that one will disappear. It’s sad that it did not come in time for your mother, but that is exactly why we can tell ourselves it must never happen again. No matter how long we think about what might have been, we can never turn back time.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r278","rowIndex":278,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「うむー」","en":"“Hmmm.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r279","rowIndex":279,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=44>詩由子</tips>は腕組みをして、","en":"<tips=44>Shiyuko</tips> folds her arms and says,","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r280","rowIndex":280,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうなんですけど、それはわかるんですけど……。私ってやっぱり、考え方が極端で、視野がせまいのかな？　お兄ちゃんに、そんなふうに言われたんです……」","en":"“I know. I do understand that, but... Maybe my thinking really is too extreme. Maybe I can’t see beyond my own narrow point of view. My brother said something like that to me...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r281","rowIndex":281,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　眉間にしわをよせて難しい顔をする。","en":"She knits her brow, her face turning pensive.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r282","rowIndex":282,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「きっと私、あるとき神様か何かが現れて『これから全人類の苦しみをなくし、現世を永遠の幸福の世界にします』なんて言ったとしても、『じゃあこれまでの人々の苦しんだのはなんなの？　そんな風に急にルール変えるのズルくない？』って憤慨しちゃうような人間なんですよ」","en":"“I’m probably the sort of person who, even if God or someone appeared one day and announced, ‘From this moment onward, I shall end all human suffering and transform this world into a place of eternal happiness,’ would get angry and say, ‘Then what was the point of everything people suffered until now? Isn’t it cheating to change the rules all of a sudden?’”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r283","rowIndex":283,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あはは、<tips=44>シウ</tips>ちゃんはきっと、人の苦しみや、世の中の悲劇にも、価値を見いだせるタイプなんだろうね」","en":"“Ha ha. I think you must be the sort of person who can find meaning even in human suffering and the tragedies of the world, <tips=44>Siu</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r284","rowIndex":284,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうかな？　自分では全然逆だと思ってますけど……。どうやっても世の中悲劇ばっかりでくだらないと感じちゃう……。ああ、どうも、矛盾してる！」","en":"“Am I? I think I’m exactly the opposite... However I look at it, the world seems full of nothing but pointless tragedy... Oh, I’m contradicting myself!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r285","rowIndex":285,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それにしても<tips=44>詩由子</tips>は賑やかな子だ。","en":"<tips=44>Shiyuko</tips> is a lively girl, to say the least.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r286","rowIndex":286,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　表情がくるくると動いて、どれも強い感情に満ちている。","en":"Her expressions change from moment to moment, each overflowing with powerful emotion.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r287","rowIndex":287,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　妹が家にいるってこういう気分なんだろうか？　おれは兄弟というものがいなかったからわからないな。","en":"Is this what it feels like to have a younger sister at home? I have never had siblings, so I cannot know.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r288","rowIndex":288,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あ、そうだ。これ食べる？　緑茶にあうよ」","en":"“Oh, that’s right. Would you like one of these? They go well with green tea.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r289","rowIndex":289,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おれは食後の甘味として今日出来上がった<tips=71>グレートホール饅頭</tips>の改良版を差し出した。","en":"For dessert, I offer her the latest improved version of the <tips=71>Great Hole Bun</tips>, finished only today.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r290","rowIndex":290,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おれたちの饅頭工場は解散し、プロジェクトは停止状態になってしまい、従業員たちのほとんどは<tips=21>八龍会</tips>の仕事を手伝うことになったのだけれども、ギャングまがいの活動へと方針をかえた<tips=21>八龍会</tips>に賛同出来ないものも何人かいる。彼らは別の場所で働きながら、いつか事業の再開を目指してまだ饅頭の改良や、新商品の開発などを行ってくれているのだ。","en":"Our manju factory has been dissolved, the project itself has ground to a halt, and most of the employees have gone to help with the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society’s</tips> work. A few, however, could not support the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society’s</tips> new course of action, which amounts to little more than gang activity. They now work elsewhere, but continue improving the manju and developing new products in the hope that someday the business can be revived.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r291","rowIndex":291,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あ、すごい！　これ美味しいですねっ！」","en":"“Oh, wonderful! This is delicious!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r292","rowIndex":292,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=44>詩由子</tips>は頬張ると目をくりくりと見開いてそう喜んだ。","en":"<tips=44>Shiyuko</tips> takes a large bite, then opens her round eyes wide in delight.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r293","rowIndex":293,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうでしょ美味しいでしょ？　いいと思うんだけどなあ」","en":"“It is, isn’t it? Delicious, right? I think it’s good...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r294","rowIndex":294,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　昼に「まずい」と言った<tips=66>コンタ</tips>のことを思い出すと、おれはどうもしかめっつらになってしまう。","en":"Remembering <tips=66>Konta</tips> calling it awful at lunch pulls my face into a scowl.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r295","rowIndex":295,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「これ、<tips=10>見土</tips>さんが<tips=57>滑走路通り</tips>で売ってたおまんじゅうですよね。今もまだ売ってるんですか？」","en":"“This is the manju you used to sell on <tips=57>Runway Street</tips>, isn’t it, Mr. <tips=10>Mido</tips>? Are you still selling them?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r296","rowIndex":296,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いや、いまは一時営業停止中なんだ」","en":"“No, business is temporarily suspended.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r297","rowIndex":297,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そっかー。また落ち着いたら、営業再開してくださいね。私お得意さんになっちゃう」","en":"“Oh, I see. Once things settle down, please start the business again. I promise I’ll be one of your best customers.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r298","rowIndex":298,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうだね。またいつか再開したいね」","en":"“Yes. I hope we can reopen someday.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r299","rowIndex":299,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　と言ったものの、その日はいつになるのか。その日が来ることがあるのか。","en":"I say it, but when will that day come? Will it ever come at all?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r300","rowIndex":300,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　二人が食べ終わり、おれは料理を作ってくれたお礼のために片付けると申し出た。","en":"After we both finish, I offer to clean up in thanks for the meal.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r301","rowIndex":301,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ダメですよ！　私がやります」","en":"“You mustn’t! I’ll do it.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r302","rowIndex":302,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　立ち上がったおれを押しとどめるように彼女も立ち上がる。","en":"The moment I rise, she springs to her feet as if to block me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r303","rowIndex":303,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「これくらいおれがやるよ」","en":"“I can do this much.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r304","rowIndex":304,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ダメです！　お世話になってるの私なんですから。それに<tips=10>見土</tips>さんは昼はお仕事してるんですし……」","en":"“No! I’m the one who owes you. Besides, you have work during the day, Mr. <tips=10>Mido</tips>...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r305","rowIndex":305,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=44>詩由子</tips>はおれの前に立ち塞がって、こちらを見上げたまま動く様子がない。","en":"<tips=44>Shiyuko</tips> plants herself before me and looks up without any sign that she means to move.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r306","rowIndex":306,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そのままおれたちは、見つめ合ってしまうかたちになる。","en":"We end up staring into one another’s eyes.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r307","rowIndex":307,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「わかった。じゃあ、二人で一緒に洗い物しよっか」","en":"“All right. Then shall we wash the dishes together?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r308","rowIndex":308,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おれが仕方なく苦笑すると、彼女は渋々承知してくれた。","en":"I surrender with a rueful smile, and she reluctantly agrees.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r309","rowIndex":309,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　食器はざっと洗い流して食洗機へ。使った鍋や魚を焼く網などは二人でシンクの前に並んで分担作業で洗った。おれがスポンジに洗剤をつけて皿を洗い、<tips=44>詩由子</tips>がそれをよくすすぐ。普段おれはインスタント食品を調理するくらいにしか使わないこのキッチンだが、ダブルシンクの本格的なものだったから二人で並ぶと効率が良かった。","en":"We give the dishes a quick rinse and load them into the dishwasher. The pots we used and the rack from the fish grill have to be washed by hand, so we stand side by side at the sink and divide the work between us. I put detergent on the sponge and scrub; <tips=44>Shiyuko</tips> rinses everything clean. Ordinarily, I use this kitchen for little more than preparing instant food, but it happens to have a proper double sink, making the two-person arrangement surprisingly efficient.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r310","rowIndex":310,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なんだか、こうして並んで洗ってると新婚さんみたいですね」","en":"“Standing here side by side, washing dishes together... It almost feels as though we’re newlyweds.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r311","rowIndex":311,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=44>詩由子</tips>はそう言って、","en":"When <tips=44>Shiyuko</tips> says that,","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r312","rowIndex":312,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうだねー」","en":"“Yeah, it does.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r313","rowIndex":313,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　とおれは笑った。","en":"I laugh in agreement.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r314","rowIndex":314,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=10>見土</tips>さんってモテるってお兄ちゃんが昔言ってましたけど、女の人と暮らしたりとかしなかったんですか？」","en":"“My brother told me once that women found you very attractive, Mr. <tips=10>Mido</tips>. Have you ever lived with a woman?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r315","rowIndex":315,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　リビングに戻ってきて休憩をしていると<tips=44>詩由子</tips>は興味津々に語りかけてくる。","en":"Once we have returned to the living room to rest, <tips=44>Shiyuko</tips> asks me the question with unconcealed curiosity.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r316","rowIndex":316,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「遊びに来ることはあるけど、暮らしたことはないねえ。彼女とか居た時でも、そういう風に誘ったこともないな」","en":"“Women have come over to visit, but I’ve never lived with one. Even when I had a girlfriend, I never once asked her to move in with me.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r317","rowIndex":317,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どうしてですか？　好きなら、一緒に暮らしたいと思ったりしません？」","en":"“Why? When you love someone, don’t you want to live together?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r318","rowIndex":318,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「うーん、どうしてだろう？　そうだなあ。どうもおれ、誰かと二人で暮らすっていうのが、どうもピンと来ないんだよねえ。言われてみて気がついたけど、そういう発想自体がないんだ。みんなでわいわい暮らすならいいけど」","en":"“Hmm. Why not? Let me see... I just can’t quite picture living alone with one other person. Now that you ask, I realize the thought itself has never occurred to me. I wouldn’t mind living in a lively group, though.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r319","rowIndex":319,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「大工さんのところで暮らしてたんですっけ」","en":"“You lived at the carpenter’s place, didn’t you?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r320","rowIndex":320,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そう。……それより昔は母親と二人で暮らしてたけど、発症しててずっとベッドに縛り付けられてた。うちはきみのところみたいに優しくは扱ってなかったからさ。子供のころのおれはずーっとそれを見てて……あんまり良い思い出じゃないんだよね」","en":"“That’s right. ...Before then, I lived alone with my mother. She had suffered onset and spent all her time strapped to a bed. My household did not treat her with the kindness yours did. As a child, I watched it day after day... They are not exactly happy memories.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r321","rowIndex":321,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おれは苦笑した。","en":"I give a rueful smile.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r322","rowIndex":322,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　真面目に考えたことがなかったので、いままではっきりそうと意識したわけではないけれど、おれが誰かと一対一で暮らすのを避けているのは、あの母親を殴って黙らせた重苦しい生活のせいかもしれない。","en":"I have never given the matter serious thought, so until now I had not been consciously aware of it. But perhaps I avoid living alone with one other person because of the suffocating life I once led—beating my mother to make her quiet.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r323","rowIndex":323,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ご、ごめんなさい。変なこと聞いて」","en":"“I-I’m sorry. That was a strange thing to ask.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r324","rowIndex":324,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=44>詩由子</tips>はしゅんとして俯いてしまう。","en":"<tips=44>Shiyuko</tips> wilts and lowers her head.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r325","rowIndex":325,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「別に謝ることはないよ。おれが勝手に話したんだし。でも、おれはきっと家族とかは持たない方が良いんだろうねえって気がするよ」","en":"“You don’t need to apologize. I brought it up myself. But I suspect I’m better off never having a family.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r326","rowIndex":326,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そんなことないっ！」","en":"“That isn’t true!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r327","rowIndex":327,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女は前のめりになって主張する。","en":"She leans forward to protest.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r328","rowIndex":328,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「きっと<tips=10>見土</tips>さんは素敵な奥さんを貰って、可愛い子供を沢山作って、賑やかに暮らすんです」","en":"“I’m sure you’ll marry a wonderful woman, Mr. <tips=10>Mido</tips>, and have lots of adorable children and a lively home together.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r329","rowIndex":329,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ほんとかなあ」","en":"“Do you truly think so?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r330","rowIndex":330,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ほんとです！」","en":"“I do!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r331","rowIndex":331,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「じゃあ、もし誰も相手がいなかったら、きみがお嫁さんに来てよね。言った責任をとってさ」","en":"“Then if no one else will have me, you can come and be my bride. You’ll have to take responsibility for making such a promise.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r332","rowIndex":332,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おれがそう言うと、<tips=44>詩由子</tips>は真っ赤になって固まったきり、動かなくなった。","en":"At my words, <tips=44>Shiyuko</tips> turns scarlet and freezes completely.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r333","rowIndex":333,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　シャワーを浴びて自室に行くと、ごろんとベッドのうえに横になる。","en":"After showering, I go to my room and flop onto the bed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r334","rowIndex":334,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　身体がぽかぽかして心地よい。それに気分もあたたかく平和だ。これはきっと<tips=44>詩由子</tips>のお陰なんだろうね。","en":"My body feels pleasantly warm, and my mood is warm and peaceful too. I suppose that must be thanks to <tips=44>Shiyuko</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r335","rowIndex":335,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　いつもだったら仕事の後、一人で部屋に帰り、むっつりと買って来た飯でも食って、一人静かに考えごとなどをしている時刻だ。","en":"Ordinarily, this is the hour when I return to my room alone after work, glumly eat whatever food I have bought on the way, and sit in silence with my thoughts.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r336","rowIndex":336,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　人と暮らすのがこんなに心安らぐものだなんて知らなかった。","en":"I never knew living with another person could be so calming.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r337","rowIndex":337,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　だけれども、いつまでもこのままじゃいけないな。彼女が結局<tips=21>八龍会</tips>に入るにしろ、どこかよその地域でしがらみと無縁で暮らすにしても、ここでおれと暮らしているのは良くない。安全ならばどこでもいいから、とにかく他の場所に移るんだ。それを提案しようと思っていたはずなのに、言いそびれてしまった。","en":"But we cannot go on like this forever. Whether she ultimately joins the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips> or moves to another region and lives free of all these entanglements, continuing to live here with me cannot be good for her. Anywhere else will do, so long as it is safe. She needs to move. I had meant to suggest exactly that tonight, yet somehow I let the opportunity pass.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r338","rowIndex":338,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　なんといっても、おれはこれから激しい戦いに身を投じてゆくわけだからね。しかも彼女の兄の組織と。","en":"After all, I am about to throw myself into a violent struggle—with her brother’s organization, no less.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r339","rowIndex":339,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ベッドのなかで目をつぶる。","en":"I close my eyes in bed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r340","rowIndex":340,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　最近あまりよく眠れないんだ。<tips=44>詩由子</tips>と楽しく話した余韻が消えてしまうと、冷え冷えとした感情がおれにのしかかってくる。","en":"I have not been sleeping well lately. Once the warmth left behind by my happy conversation with <tips=44>Shiyuko</tips> fades away, a bleak chill settles over me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r341","rowIndex":341,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　これはなんなのだろう。あまり落ち込んだり、悩んだりはしない性質のはずなんだが。","en":"What is this feeling? I have never been the sort of person who sinks into depression or broods over his troubles.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r342","rowIndex":342,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　照明を落とし、ベッドの上でごろんごろんと寝返りを打って、それでもどうしても眠れない。","en":"I turn off the lights and roll back and forth upon the bed, but sleep will not come.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r343","rowIndex":343,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　真っ暗な部屋のなか、ギンギンになった目でぼんやりとどこでもない場所を見つめている。","en":"In the pitch-dark room, my eyes painfully wide awake, I stare blankly at nothing at all.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r344","rowIndex":344,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ドアの外からは水道の音が聞こえる。<tips=44>詩由子</tips>が睡眠前の歯磨きをしているんだ。磨き終わるとキュッと蛇口を捻り、廊下をひたひたと裸足で歩く音がする。そして彼女は自室のドアをガチャリと開き、中に入ってからパタンと閉じる。隣の部屋でなにかごそごそとしている。今日は昼は<tips=51>さくら</tips>と街に出かけて本を買ったと言っていたっけ。タイトルは忘れたけれど小説だと言っていたな。こういうときでも、彼女が部屋で小説の世界を楽しんでくれるなら、それはとても素晴らしいことだ。","en":"Beyond my door, I hear water running. <tips=44>Shiyuko</tips> must be brushing her teeth before bed. When she finishes, the faucet squeaks shut, and I hear the soft slap of her bare feet along the hallway. Her bedroom door opens with a click and closes behind her with a quiet thud. Something begins rustling in the room next door. She mentioned going into the city with <tips=51>Sakura</tips> during the day to buy a book. I have forgotten the title, but she said it was a novel. If, even at a time like this, she can lose herself in a fictional world there in her room, that is something truly wonderful.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r345","rowIndex":345,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　明日も朝が早い。眠らなければいけないのだが眠れない。最近こんなのばかりだ。こうなるとやっぱり眠剤でも処方してもらったほうがいいのか？　――やっぱり、病院のあのことがいけなかったのかな。一人でじっとしているとあのホールの血液と死体の山、そしてなんとも言えない悪臭が蘇るんだ。","en":"I have to be up early tomorrow. I need to sleep, but I cannot. Lately, every night is the same. Maybe I really should have someone prescribe me sleeping pills. —Was it what happened at the hospital after all? Whenever I lie here alone and still, the blood in that hall returns to me, along with the heaps of corpses and that indescribable stench.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r346","rowIndex":346,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　慣れなくちゃいけない。これからおれは何度も戦って、そして全て勝たなくてはいけないんだ。迷いや憂鬱は戦意を鈍らせる。","en":"I must grow accustomed to it. From now on, I have to fight again and again—and win every time. Doubt and gloom will dull my fighting spirit.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r347","rowIndex":347,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　時間はよくわからない。最後に時計を確認した時は二時を少しこえていた。おれはちょっとうとうととして、そして物音で目を覚ました。","en":"I have no idea what time it is now. The last time I checked the clock, it was a little past two. At some point I begin to doze, only to be awakened by a sound.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r348","rowIndex":348,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あれ、どうしたの？」","en":"“Oh. What is it?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r349","rowIndex":349,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ドアを開けてそこに立っていたのは<tips=44>詩由子</tips>だった。暗くて表情が良く見えない。無言でおれを見ている。","en":"<tips=44>Shiyuko</tips> stands in the open doorway. It is too dark to see her expression clearly. She looks at me without a word.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r350","rowIndex":350,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「悪い夢でもみたのかな？　それとも寂しくなった？」","en":"“Did you have a bad dream? Or did you get lonely?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r351","rowIndex":351,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おれが苦笑すると、彼女は首を横に振り、","en":"I give her a rueful smile, but she shakes her head and says,","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r352","rowIndex":352,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=10>見土</tips>さんこそ……」","en":"“I’m more worried about you, Mr. <tips=10>Mido</tips>...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r353","rowIndex":353,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それはおれを心配する声だった。","en":"Her voice is full of concern for me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r354","rowIndex":354,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「夜になるといつもうなされて、大きな声を出してる……」","en":"“Every night you have nightmares. You cry out so loudly in your sleep...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r355","rowIndex":355,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「おれが？」","en":"“Me?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r356","rowIndex":356,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女は頷く。","en":"She nods.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r357","rowIndex":357,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いつも？」","en":"“Every night?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r358","rowIndex":358,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女はもう一度頷く。","en":"She nods again.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r359","rowIndex":359,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「大きな声って……」","en":"“What do I shout?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r360","rowIndex":360,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「怒鳴ったり、何か怖がってる悲鳴のような……」","en":"“Shouting angrily... sometimes screaming as though you’re frightened...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r361","rowIndex":361,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あちゃー」","en":"“Whoops.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r362","rowIndex":362,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おれは自分の頭をかいて、","en":"I scratch my head.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r363","rowIndex":363,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ごめんねー。それじゃあ起きちゃうよね。おれちょっと、外で簡易宿泊所でも探して……」","en":"“Sorry about that. No wonder I keep waking you up. I’ll go out and find some cheap place to stay...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r364","rowIndex":364,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　起き上がろうとするのと、彼女がベッドに近づいておれを覗き込もうとした動作が重なって、思いのほか急接近してしまう。","en":"I start to sit up at the same moment she steps closer to the bed and bends down to look at me. Our faces end up far closer than either of us expected.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r365","rowIndex":365,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女のパジャマの胸元から石けんのにおいがして、おれの頭はくらくらとする。","en":"The scent of soap drifts from the open neckline of her pajamas, and my head begins to spin.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r366","rowIndex":366,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　でも彼女はいつものように驚いたり照れたりせず、真剣におれの顔を見ている。","en":"Yet she neither startles nor blushes as she ordinarily would. She only gazes intently into my face.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r367","rowIndex":367,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうじゃないんです。<tips=10>見土</tips>さん、何かとてもつらいんじゃないかなって思って」","en":"“That isn’t why I came. I thought you might be suffering terribly from something, Mr. <tips=10>Mido</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r368","rowIndex":368,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いやべつに……」","en":"“No, nothing...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r369","rowIndex":369,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「仕事のことは私に言えないのはわかります。でも、何か出来ることがあったら教えてください」","en":"“I understand that you cannot tell me about your work. But if there is anything I can do, please tell me.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r370","rowIndex":370,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=44>詩由子</tips>の口調は強く、そして眉はキッと引き締められて強い意志を感じさせる。梃子でも引き下がりそうにない。この辺りの強さはやっぱり、お父さんや兄貴に似ているのだろうかな？","en":"<tips=44>Shiyuko’s</tips> voice is firm, and the sharp set of her brows speaks to an equally firm resolve. She does not look as though anything could make her back down. Perhaps this strength of hers comes from her father and brother after all.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r371","rowIndex":371,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「おれのことよりもさ、<tips=44>シウ</tips>ちゃんに聞きたいことがあるんだ」","en":"“Never mind me. There’s something I want to ask you, <tips=44>Siu</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r372","rowIndex":372,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そう、おれはおれの理由ばかり考えていたけれど、本人の意志を確認していなかったんだっけ。","en":"Come to think of it, I have been considering only my own reasons. I never stopped to confirm what she herself wanted.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r373","rowIndex":373,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「私に、ですか？」","en":"“Me?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r374","rowIndex":374,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おれは頷きを返し、","en":"I nod back, then say,","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r375","rowIndex":375,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=44>シウ</tips>ちゃんを<tips=21>八龍会</tips>に入れようって話していたけれど、おれはちょっとそれはどうかなって思い始めていてね」","en":"“<tips=44>Siu</tips>, we’d been talking about having you join the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips>, but I’m starting to wonder whether that’s really the best idea.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r376","rowIndex":376,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「え？」","en":"“What?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r377","rowIndex":377,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=21>八龍会</tips>じゃなくて、別の<tips=17>タイプＢ</tips>グループに紹介しようかなと。街の外で暮らすんだ」","en":"“I’m thinking I might introduce you to a different <tips=17>Type B</tips> group instead of the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips>. You would live outside the city.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r378","rowIndex":378,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それは……」","en":"“But...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r379","rowIndex":379,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女はすっかり<tips=21>八龍会</tips>に入るつもりだったらしく、びっくりして目を見開いている。","en":"She must have been completely resolved to join the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips>, because her eyes open wide in genuine surprise.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r380","rowIndex":380,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=10>見土</tips>さんも、一緒に来てくれるんですか？」","en":"“Would you come with me too, Mr. <tips=10>Mido</tips>?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r381","rowIndex":381,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まさか。それは出来ないよ」","en":"“Of course not. I can’t do that.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r382","rowIndex":382,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おれは笑って、","en":"I smile and say,","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r383","rowIndex":383,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「きみの立場的なものを考えると、そっちの方がより安全かもしれない。それに、<tips=21>八龍会</tips>に入れば、やっぱり<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>とのごちゃごちゃを目の当たりにすることになるからね。ただ、おれも迷っているんだ。ここに居ればおれが事情がわかっているからいいが、外の組織だとそうじゃない。もちろん信頼出来る人を探すつもりだけれど、それでもやっぱり目が届きにくい部分があるからね。だから、本人の意見もきいて……」","en":"“Given your position, living elsewhere may be safer. If you join the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips>, you will inevitably be forced to witness our conflict with <tips=7>YS</tips> firsthand. But I’m still unsure. If you remain here, I understand the situation and can keep an eye on you. With an outside organization, I can’t. Of course I would find someone trustworthy, but even then there would be things beyond my reach. That’s why I wanted to hear what you—”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r384","rowIndex":384,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「私は、ここにいたいです」","en":"“I want to stay here.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r385","rowIndex":385,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女はおれの言葉が終わる前に言った。そして、まっすぐおれの目を見つめる。","en":"She speaks before I can finish, then looks me straight in the eyes.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r386","rowIndex":386,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……ここがいいです。<tips=10>見土</tips>さんが決めることですし、それが一番良いと思うんですが、私の意見を言えというのならば……もし、<tips=10>見土</tips>さんがいやじゃなければ、ここにいたいです」","en":"“...This is where I want to be. The decision is yours, Mr. <tips=10>Mido</tips>, and I know it is best that you make it. But if you truly want my opinion... If having me here would not trouble you, Mr. <tips=10>Mido</tips>, then I want to stay.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r387","rowIndex":387,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして、その目が潤むのが見えた。","en":"Then I see her eyes fill with tears.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r388","rowIndex":388,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうか」","en":"“I see.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r389","rowIndex":389,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　考えてみれば、当然の返事かも知れない。彼女はずっと<tips=41>グランドタワー</tips>で人に囲まれて生きて来たんだ。見知らぬ街で、見知らぬ人に囲まれて暮らすなんて、不安で仕方がないだろう。たとえ頭では外の方が安全だとわかっていたとしても。","en":"When I think about it, her answer may be only natural. She has spent her entire life within <tips=41>Grand Tower</tips>, always surrounded by familiar people. The prospect of living in an unfamiliar city among complete strangers must fill her with anxiety, even if she understands in her head that she would be safer there.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r390","rowIndex":390,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　いま本人の意見を聞くのは、間違っていたかも知れない。だけど、もう聞いちゃったんだよね。撤回は出来ない。","en":"Perhaps it was a mistake to ask what she wanted right now. But I’ve asked her already, haven’t I? There is no taking the question back.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r391","rowIndex":391,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どうしても？」","en":"“You’re absolutely sure?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r392","rowIndex":392,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女は潤んだ目のままこくりと頷く。","en":"Her eyes still wet, she gives a small nod.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r393","rowIndex":393,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おれは溜息をつく。","en":"I sigh.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r394","rowIndex":394,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうか。……まだ少し考えたいが、もしここに残るとなった場合、一つだけ約束してくれ」","en":"“All right. ...I still want a little time to think, but if you do end up staying here, promise me one thing.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r395","rowIndex":395,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なんですか？」","en":"“What is it?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r396","rowIndex":396,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……もし、おれか<tips=1>亮</tips>のどちらかがどちらかを殺すことになっても、どちらも恨まないでくれ」","en":"“...If either <tips=1>Ryo</tips> or I end up killing the other, promise you won’t resent either of us.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r397","rowIndex":397,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=44>詩由子</tips>は息をのみ、目を大きく見開く。","en":"<tips=44>Shiyuko</tips> gasps, her eyes opening wide.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r398","rowIndex":398,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「お互い憎しみあってるわけじゃないが、それぞれ背負ってるものがある。だからおれたちは……」","en":"“We don’t hate one another, but each of us carries burdens of his own. And so we may have to...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r399","rowIndex":399,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=10>見土</tips>さん」","en":"“Mr. <tips=10>Mido</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r400","rowIndex":400,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女の唇の間から出た声は、思いのほか落ち着いている。","en":"Her voice is calmer than I expected.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r401","rowIndex":401,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「大丈夫です」","en":"“I’ll be all right.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r402","rowIndex":402,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そう言った表情は、驚いたり動揺したりはしていなかった。","en":"As she says this, her expression betrays neither surprise nor agitation.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r403","rowIndex":403,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「私も、そんなに馬鹿じゃないです。あそこを出ると決めた以上、いろんなことは覚悟しています。もし、私自身がお兄ちゃんに殺されたって恨んだりしません」","en":"“I’m not so foolish... Once I decided to leave that place, I prepared myself for all sorts of things. Even if my own brother were to kill me, I wouldn’t hold it against him.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r404","rowIndex":404,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=44>シウ</tips>ちゃん……」","en":"“<tips=44>Siu</tips>...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r405","rowIndex":405,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　今度はおれが驚く番だった。","en":"This time, it is my turn to be surprised.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r406","rowIndex":406,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「私、これでも<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>の娘なんですよ。普通の子とは違うんです。頼りないですけど」","en":"“I am <tips=3>Chris Tse’s</tips> daughter, after all. I may not be very dependable, but I’m not an ordinary girl.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r407","rowIndex":407,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして彼女は微笑する。","en":"Then she smiles.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r408","rowIndex":408,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうか……。そうだね、これは、おれが失礼した」","en":"“I see... You’re right. That was rude of me.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r409","rowIndex":409,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おれは頭をかいて誤魔化すように笑い、","en":"I scratch my head and laugh, trying to cover my embarrassment, then say,","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r410","rowIndex":410,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「じゃあ、わかった。とりあえず、きみのその意見を聞いた上で、もうちょっと考えさせてくれないか？」","en":"“All right, then. Now that I’ve heard what you think, could you give me a little longer to consider it?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r411","rowIndex":411,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「はい」","en":"“Yes.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r412","rowIndex":412,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=44>詩由子</tips>は頷き、そしておれはもう言うことがなくなった。お互い黙って見つめあうと、なんだか照れくさかった。","en":"<tips=44>Shiyuko</tips> nods, leaving me with nothing more to say. We gaze at each other in silence, and the moment grows strangely awkward.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r413","rowIndex":413,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「じゃ、そろそろ寝るかな」","en":"“Well, I guess it’s about time I got some sleep.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r414","rowIndex":414,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女の顔から視線を外しながらおれはそう言う。","en":"I say it as I avert my eyes from her face.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r415","rowIndex":415,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「もう、うなされないですか？」","en":"“Do you think the nightmares will stop now?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r416","rowIndex":416,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どうだろう？　わかんないな。添い寝でもしてくれたら落ち着くかもしれないね」","en":"“Who knows? I’m not sure. I might calm down if you slept beside me.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r417","rowIndex":417,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おれは軽やかに笑いながらそう言った。","en":"I say it with a light laugh.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r418","rowIndex":418,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　もちろん冗談である。男女のこととなるとすぐに羞恥で耳の先まで真っ赤になる<tips=44>詩由子</tips>の弱点をついたセクハラジョークだ。","en":"Of course I am joking. It is a bit of sexual harassment aimed squarely at <tips=44>Shiyuko’s</tips> weakness: the slightest suggestion of anything between a man and a woman turns her red to the tips of her ears.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r419","rowIndex":419,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女の思いがけない覚悟に思わず圧倒されてしまったことに対するささやかな反撃のつもりだったのだが、しかし、おれのアテは完全に外れてしまう。","en":"I mean it as a small counterattack after finding myself overwhelmed by her unexpected resolve. My calculation, however, misses the mark completely.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r420","rowIndex":420,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「わかりました」","en":"“All right.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r421","rowIndex":421,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女は平然と言うと、おれのベッドに潜り込もうとしはじめたのだ。","en":"She says this with perfect composure—and then starts climbing into my bed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r422","rowIndex":422,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「えっ、えっ、冗談だって！」","en":"“What? What? I was joking!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r423","rowIndex":423,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おれは慌ててそう言ったが、彼女はもぞもぞとおれの体温であたたまった布団のなかに侵入してくる。その膝とおれの膝が触れる。","en":"I speak in a panic, but she wriggles beneath the covers warmed by my body. Her knee touches mine.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r424","rowIndex":424,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いやあ、本当に、そんなことしないでいいんだって。そもそも大したことじゃないし……」","en":"“No, truly, you don’t need to do that. It isn’t anything serious in the first place...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r425","rowIndex":425,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「私も小さい時、夜眠れないとお母さんがこうやって添い寝をしてくれたんです」","en":"“When I couldn’t sleep as a child, Mother would lie beside me like this.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r426","rowIndex":426,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=44>詩由子</tips>はそう言ってぴったりおれにくっついた。","en":"<tips=44>Shiyuko</tips> presses herself snugly against me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r427","rowIndex":427,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女の体温が、においが、おれの本能を稲妻のように刺激する。これはやばいヤツだ。","en":"Her body heat and her scent strike my instincts like lightning. This is bad news.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r428","rowIndex":428,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「だからもう何も心配しないで下さい。きっと、よく眠れますから」","en":"“So please don’t worry about anything now. I’m sure you’ll sleep well.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r429","rowIndex":429,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いや、しかし……これは……」","en":"“But... this is...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r430","rowIndex":430,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おれはうろたえてしまうが、彼女はもう取り合うつもりはないようだった。無言で目を閉じている。","en":"I begin to panic, but she apparently has no intention of engaging with my objections. She lies there in silence, her eyes closed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r431","rowIndex":431,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　これはまずい。これはまずいですよ。","en":"This is bad. This is very bad.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r432","rowIndex":432,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　年頃の女の子の、良い匂いがして温かい身体がすぐそこにあるのである。","en":"The warm, sweet-smelling body of a young woman lies immediately beside me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r433","rowIndex":433,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして自慢じゃないけれどもおれは誘惑には弱いほうだ。","en":"And not to boast, but I have always been rather weak in the face of temptation.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r434","rowIndex":434,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　安心して落ち着くどころか、目が冴えて冴えて仕方がない。とても眠るどころじゃない。","en":"Far from feeling safe or calm, I am more wide awake by the second. Sleep is out of the question.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r435","rowIndex":435,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それを素直に言ってお引き取り願おうか？　しかし、それはもったいないと本能が告げている。ダメだとわかっているのに。ここにいるのは親友の妹で、しかも身寄りなくおれを頼ってきた可哀想な預かり人なのだぞ？　他のときならいざしらず、弱みにつけ込むようになってしまうこの状況では男らしくない。","en":"Should I tell her the truth and ask her to go back to her room? Yet my instincts tell me that would be an awful waste. I know I must not. She is my best friend’s little sister—a poor girl with no family to turn to, who came here relying on me and has been placed in my care. Whatever I might do under other circumstances, taking advantage of her vulnerability now would be beneath any man.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r436","rowIndex":436,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　――いや、しかしこの子だってもう子供じゃないんだ。これは理解した上での行動なんじゃないか？　つまり、おれを誘っているんだ。だとすれば、このまま手を出さなければ彼女に恥をかかせる。そうだ。そうかもしれない――って、いかんぞ。劣情が都合良く屁理屈をこねておれを説得しようとしている！","en":"...No, she is no child. Perhaps she knows exactly what she is doing. In other words, she is inviting me. If so, refusing to touch her would humiliate her. Yes. Perhaps that is it... No! My lust is inventing convenient sophistry to persuade me!","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r437","rowIndex":437,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そうだ、ここは心を無にしよう。","en":"Yes. I must empty my mind.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r438","rowIndex":438,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おれは石だ。性欲も感情もない石だ。雨に打たれ苔むした、悠久の時を変化なく存在し続ける石だ。石ならば隣に女の子がいたって何も感じるはずなどない。そのいいにおいをかいでも、なんの反応も示さない。","en":"I am a stone. A stone without desire or emotion. A stone beaten by rain and overgrown with moss, existing unchanged through eternity. A stone would feel nothing with a girl beside it. It would show no response even to her lovely scent.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r439","rowIndex":439,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そうしておれはしばらく自分に石だと言い聞かせたが、結論からいうと無理でした。","en":"I spend a while telling myself that I am a stone. To skip ahead to the conclusion: it is impossible.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r440","rowIndex":440,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そもそも、こうしたときに我慢などしたことはないし、気持ちのままに行動して後悔したこともない。なに、うまくやれば女の子は怒ったりしないんだ。慣れない我慢などするから余計疲れる。まずやることをやって、そしてうまくフォローすればいいのだよね。そうだ。そうしよう。","en":"For that matter, I have never once restrained myself in a situation like this, and I have never regretted following my desires. As long as you handle things well, a girl will not get angry. Trying to exercise a kind of restraint I am unused to will only wear me out. First do what has to be done, then make sure to smooth everything over afterward. Yes. That is what I will do.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r441","rowIndex":441,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そしておれは意を決して<tips=44>詩由子</tips>の肩に手をかけた。","en":"Having made up my mind, I lay a hand on <tips=44>Shiyuko’s</tips> shoulder.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r442","rowIndex":442,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「し、しゆ……」","en":"“Sh-Shiyu...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r443","rowIndex":443,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　と言いかけて、彼女がもう眠りこけてしまっているのに気がつく。","en":"I begin to speak, then realize she is already fast asleep.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r444","rowIndex":444,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　すうすうと、穏やかな寝息を立てて。","en":"Her breath coming soft and even.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r445","rowIndex":445,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　なんて純粋な顔をしているんだろう？　おれを信じ切っているんだ。おれが守ってくれると思って。","en":"How innocent she looks in her sleep. She trusts me completely. She believes I will protect her.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r446","rowIndex":446,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そのあどけない寝顔を見ていると、不思議とおれのはち切れんばかりに膨れ上がっていた性欲が静まりかえってゆくのを感じた。","en":"As I gaze at that innocent sleeping face, I feel, strangely enough, the lust that had swollen almost to bursting quietly subside.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r447","rowIndex":447,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おれは溜息をつき、彼女から手を離す。","en":"I sigh and take my hand from her.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r448","rowIndex":448,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして目を閉じた。こんなにあたたかなものに触れていたら心地よく眠れるだろうかと思ったけれど、なんだか変に胸が苦しくなって来た。","en":"Then I close my eyes. I thought that lying against something so warm might help me sleep peacefully, but instead my chest begins to feel strangely tight.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r449","rowIndex":449,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　いや、性欲はもう感じない。それとはちょっと別な感じだ。","en":"No, it is not lust. Not anymore. This is something different.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r450","rowIndex":450,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　自分のことでさえ不安いっぱいの筈の彼女がおれの不安を気遣ってこんな風にしてくれるのだと考えると、なんだかひどく愛おしいような、ちょっと胸が苦しいような、だけれどもひどく幸福な感じがする。――これはなんだろう？","en":"She must be consumed with anxieties of her own, and yet here she is worrying about me and doing this for my sake. When I think of that, I feel such overwhelming tenderness for her that my chest aches—and at the same time, an overwhelming happiness. What is this feeling?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r451","rowIndex":451,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　誰かがこのような感覚について語っているのを聞いたことがある。","en":"I have heard someone describe a feeling like this.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r452","rowIndex":452,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　あれはなんだったろう。","en":"What was it?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B5:r453","rowIndex":453,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　少し考えて、もしかしたらおれは、恋をしようとしているのではないかと気が付いた。","en":"After thinking for a moment, it dawns on me that perhaps I am on the verge of falling in love.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}}]},{"position":50,"code":"A7","unitId":"A7","rows":[{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A7:r1","rowIndex":1,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=31>エリー・ホワイト</tips>が説明をする静かな声が、<tips=41>グランドタワー</tips>最上階のこの執務室に響き渡っている。","en":"<tips=31>Ellie White's</tips> quiet voice echoes throughout this office on the top floor of <tips=41>Grand Tower</tips> as she explains the situation.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A7:r2","rowIndex":2,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　これからここに警察官と<tips=50>路地邦昭</tips>というフリーライターのサイキックが訪れることになっていた。<tips=21>八龍会</tips>について話があるらしい。","en":"A police officer and a psychic named <tips=50>Kuniaki Roji</tips>, a freelance writer, are due to visit us here shortly. Apparently they want to talk about the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A7:r3","rowIndex":3,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　この奇妙な来訪者と僕の仲介を行ったのがこの<tips=31>エリー</tips>で、こうなるまでの経緯を説明してくれているというわけだ。","en":"<tips=31>Ellie</tips> is the one who arranged for these strange visitors to meet me, and she is now explaining how it all came about.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A7:r4","rowIndex":4,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女は随分昔の話から語り起こしてくれたが、思いのほかに重要で興味深い話だった。","en":"She began far back in the past, but the story proved more important and interesting than I had expected.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A7:r5","rowIndex":5,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕の父さんが壊滅させた<tips=18>ローズ・クラブ</tips>に不死の女たちが働いており、<tips=31>エリー</tips>もその一人であったこと。","en":"That immortal women had worked at the <tips=18>Rose Club</tips>, which my father destroyed, and that <tips=31>Ellie</tips> had been one of them.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A7:r6","rowIndex":6,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その時<tips=18>ローズ・クラブ</tips>で不死の女たちを作り出していた女が<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>というサイキックで、今はこの街に舞い戻り、暗躍しているということ。","en":"That the woman who had created the immortal women at the <tips=18>Rose Club</tips> was a psychic called <tips=20>Koschei</tips>, who had now returned to this city and was working behind the scenes.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A7:r7","rowIndex":7,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しかも、<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>はいま<tips=21>八龍会</tips>に協力している。これを報告したのは、かつて父の相棒であったという『ドクター』だそうだ。","en":"Moreover, <tips=20>Koschei</tips> is now helping the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips>. The report apparently came from ‘the Doctor,’ who had once been my father's partner.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A7:r8","rowIndex":8,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>の変身の姿の一つが金髪のサイキック少女なのだそうだ。ここを襲撃し、<tips=39>ジェフリー</tips>を殺し、<tips=44>筱喬</tips>をさらったあいつだろう。彼女は病院の襲撃に参加していたと言う。","en":"One of <tips=20>Koschei's</tips> transformations is apparently a blond psychic girl. She must be the one who attacked this place, killed <tips=39>Jeffrey</tips>, and kidnapped <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips>. They say she took part in the attack on the hospital.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A7:r9","rowIndex":9,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>はこの街に戻ってきてからも多くの人を殺し、そのなかには刑事や路地の恋人もいるという。だから<tips=50>路地</tips>は復讐のために警察と手を組んで<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>を追い回し、その一環として何か僕に話があるらしく、この<tips=41>グランドタワー</tips>までやって来るのだという。","en":"I was told that since returning to this city, <tips=20>Koschei</tips> had killed many people, including a detective and Roji’s lover. <tips=50>Roji</tips> had therefore joined forces with the police to hunt <tips=20>Koschei</tips> down for revenge and, as part of that effort, was coming all the way to <tips=41>Grand Tower</tips> because he apparently had something to tell me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A7:r10","rowIndex":10,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　全てを聞いた後、僕はふうと溜息をついた。","en":"After hearing the whole story, I breathe out a sigh.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A7:r11","rowIndex":11,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　なんとも壮大な話じゃないか。父の代から現在まで、ありとあらゆる登場人物が出て来る。まさか、あの『ドクター』まで出て来るとは思わなかった。","en":"What an epic story. It has every conceivable character in it, from my father's time down to the present. I never imagined even ‘the Doctor’ would figure into it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A7:r12","rowIndex":12,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まさか、あの金髪のお嬢さんがそんな因縁深い相手だったとはね」","en":"“Who would have thought that blond young lady had such deep ties to all of this?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A7:r13","rowIndex":13,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　だとすれば、無理にでもあそこで殺しておくべきだったのかもしれない。今さら言っても仕方のないことだが。","en":"If so, perhaps I should have killed her back there, whatever it took. No use saying so now, though.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A7:r14","rowIndex":14,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「血を介して伝わる不死身の力と言われても、夢のようなおとぎ話と思われるかもしれませんが……」","en":"“I realize that a form of immortality transmitted through blood may sound like something out of a fairy tale...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エリー・ホワイト","displayName":"Ellie White","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A7:r15","rowIndex":15,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=31>エリー</tips>は僕の前に立ち、いつも通りの黒いヴェールで顔を隠している。","en":"<tips=31>Ellie</tips> stands before me, her face concealed as ever behind a black veil.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A7:r16","rowIndex":16,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いや、信じるよ」","en":"“No, I believe you.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A7:r17","rowIndex":17,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕は言ってから、苦笑した。その不死身の力のことならば、僕だって、とてもよく知っている。","en":"After saying this, I smile wryly. As for the power of immortality, I know it all too well myself.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A7:r18","rowIndex":18,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ふと、<tips=55>松子</tips>のことを思い出した。<tips=18>ローズ・クラブ</tips>のゴミ捨て場で捨てられた彼女にとっても、この話は重大な価値を持つだろう。――彼女のことを思い出したのは久しぶりで、僕はなんだか苦しくなった。","en":"I suddenly remembered <tips=55>Matsuko</tips>. This story would be of great importance to her too, abandoned as she had been at the <tips=18>Rose Club's</tips> garbage dump. It had been a long time since I had thought of her, and something in me began to ache.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A7:r19","rowIndex":19,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「しかし、驚いたな。きみにそんな過去があったとは知らなかったよ」","en":"“Still, this is a surprise. I never knew you had a past like that.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A7:r20","rowIndex":20,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　気持ちを紛らわせながらそう言う。","en":"I say this to distract myself from what I am feeling.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A7:r21","rowIndex":21,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「このことを知っているのは<tips=3>クリス</tips>様と先生の他には、<tips=4>馬明</tips>や<tips=39>ジェフリー・ウォン</tips>くらいのものです」","en":"“Aside from Master <tips=3>Chris</tips> and the Doctor, only <tips=4>Ma Ming</tips> and <tips=39>Jeffrey Wong</tips> know about it.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エリー・ホワイト","displayName":"Ellie White","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A7:r22","rowIndex":22,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それに、そんな重大な過去を、今ここで明かしてくれるのも驚きだ。<tips=50>路地</tips>を僕に会わせるために、ずっと隠していたことを話してくれるなんて。なぜそこまで肩入れするんだい？」","en":"“And I'm surprised you're willing to reveal such a momentous part of your past here and now. That you'd tell me what you've kept hidden all this time just so <tips=50>Roji</tips> can meet me. Why are you so determined to help him?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A7:r23","rowIndex":23,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　これには<tips=31>エリー</tips>は即答せず、少し間を置いた後、","en":"<tips=31>Ellie</tips> does not answer at once. After a brief pause, she says:","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A7:r24","rowIndex":24,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……あの<tips=18>ローズ・クラブ</tips>の亡霊が舞い戻って<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>の脅威になるのだとすれば、話さないわけにはゆきません」","en":"“...If that specter of the <tips=18>Rose Club</tips> has returned to threaten <tips=7>YS</tips>, I cannot keep silent.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エリー・ホワイト","displayName":"Ellie White","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A7:r25","rowIndex":25,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうか」","en":"“I see.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A7:r26","rowIndex":26,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　言葉を鵜呑みにするつもりはなかったが、しかし今はその話は重要ではない。","en":"I have no intention of taking her words at face value, but for now, that question is not important.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A7:r27","rowIndex":27,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ちょっと聞きたいんだが、その『ドクター』は今どうしているんだい？　出来れば連絡を取りたいんだが」","en":"“There's something I'd like to ask. What is ‘the Doctor’ doing now? I'd like to contact him, if possible.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A7:r28","rowIndex":28,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……<tips=50>路地邦昭</tips>の話によると、先生は私の家にいらした後で、<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>に殺害されたようです。彼はその現場にいて<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>と遭遇したようですが、取り逃がしたと言っていました」","en":"“...According to <tips=50>Kuniaki Roji</tips>, the Doctor was apparently murdered by <tips=20>Koschei</tips> after visiting my home. Roji was at the scene and seems to have encountered <tips=20>Koschei</tips> himself, but he said she escaped.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エリー・ホワイト","displayName":"Ellie White","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A7:r29","rowIndex":29,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ここまでなんの感情も出さないでいた<tips=31>エリー</tips>は、その死を語るところではじめて声色が変わる。","en":"Up to this point, <tips=31>Ellie</tips> has shown no emotion. Only when she speaks of his death does her tone change.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A7:r30","rowIndex":30,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なるほどね。残念だ。聞きたいことがたくさんあったのだが」","en":"“I see. That’s a shame. There were so many things I wanted to ask him.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A7:r31","rowIndex":31,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕は言って、溜息をついた。","en":"I sigh as I say it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A7:r32","rowIndex":32,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　いま執務室にいるのは、僕と<tips=31>エリー</tips>の他には<tips=40>黄姉妹</tips>だけだった。<tips=30>レイレイ</tips>は<tips=57>滑走路通り</tips>に買い物に行っている。","en":"At present, the only people in the office besides <tips=31>Ellie</tips> and me are the <tips=40>Wong sisters</tips>. <tips=30>Leilei</tips> has gone shopping on <tips=57>Runway Street</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A7:r33","rowIndex":33,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　大した用もないのにやたらとやって来る<tips=33>壬生屋</tips>も<tips=28>トミー</tips>も今日はいない。<tips=47>八龍解放軍</tips>の結成以来<tips=17>タイプB</tips>たちはざわついていて、組織の空気が落ち着きを失っている。そのため、自分の組織に<tips=17>タイプＢ</tips>が多い彼らは忙しくなっていた。","en":"Even <tips=33>Mibuya</tips> and <tips=28>Tommy</tips>, who are forever dropping by without much reason, are absent today. Ever since the <tips=47>Liberation Army</tips> was formed, the <tips=17>Type Bs</tips> have been restless, and the mood within the organization has lost its calm. That has kept those two busy, since their own organizations have so many <tips=17>Type Bs</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A7:r34","rowIndex":34,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　まだ表面的には彼らと我々が対立しているというわけではないが、実質的にはもう戦争が始まっていると言っても過言じゃない。","en":"We are not openly at war with them yet, but for all practical purposes, the war has already begun.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A7:r35","rowIndex":35,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　いま<tips=59>暗闇通り</tips>の裏手や、今富町の路地に行けば、壁面にベタベタと貼りつけられたビラを誰でも見ることが出来るだろう。やれ、<tips=1>謝亮</tips>は差別主義者で<tips=17>タイプB</tips>を嫌っているとか、<tips=17>タイプB</tips>の部下ばかり危険な仕事をさせているとか、この街をその独裁によって滅ぼそうとしているだとか、将来的には<tips=17>タイプB</tips>をどこかの隔離施設に追いやるつもりだとか。――なんだかアドルフ・ヒットラーにでもされたような気分だな。","en":"Go behind <tips=59>Darkness Street</tips> or into the alleys of Imatomi-cho now, and anyone can see the walls plastered with handbills: <tips=1>Tse Leung</tips> is a bigot who hates <tips=17>Type Bs</tips>; he sends only his <tips=17>Type B</tips> subordinates on dangerous assignments; his dictatorship will destroy the city; eventually, he means to drive the <tips=17>Type Bs</tips> into some sort of internment facility. I feel as if they've turned me into Adolf Hitler.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A7:r36","rowIndex":36,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　なんの根拠もないデタラメなのだが、意外と世間では信じるものもいるらしい。ということは、僕自身がそういうイメージで見られているというわけか。身内が<tips=17>タイプＢ</tips>だらけで、発症した母が親戚に嫌われていたのを苦々しく思いながら育って来た僕が、そんな風に思われているなんて皮肉なものだ。","en":"It's all baseless nonsense, yet apparently a surprising number of people believe it. Does that mean this is how people see me? What bitter irony that they should think such things of me, when my own family is full of <tips=17>Type Bs</tips> and I grew up resenting how our relatives shunned my mother after she became symptomatic.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A7:r37","rowIndex":37,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　街の人々だけでなく、<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>内の人間たちも落ち着きを失っている。もし<tips=21>八龍会</tips>と本格的な争いになれば、この<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>の<tips=17>タイプB</tips>たちがどういった立場になるのか、見えない探り合いが始まっているようだ。何も変わらないから、今からくだらない心配はやめろと僕は何度も言っているが、あまり効果はない。仕方がないことなのか、僕の言葉の影響力がまだ足りないのか。","en":"Not only the people of the city, but those within <tips=7>YS</tips> have lost their calm as well. If we enter into full-scale conflict with the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips>, the <tips=17>Type Bs</tips> in <tips=7>YS</tips> apparently have begun quietly sounding one another out about where that would leave them. I have told them time and again that nothing will change and they should stop worrying about such foolishness before anything has even happened, but it has had little effect. Perhaps that is inevitable. Or perhaps my words still do not carry enough weight.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A7:r38","rowIndex":38,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　いずれにしろ、溜息の出るような話だ。","en":"Whatever the case, it is enough to make me sigh.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A7:r39","rowIndex":39,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕の考えだと、今の<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>にとって<tips=21>八龍会</tips>はそれほど脅威のある存在ではないのだが。","en":"In my view, the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips> poses no great threat to <tips=7>YS</tips> at present.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A7:r40","rowIndex":40,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「すみません。お伝えするのが遅れまして」","en":"“I’m sorry I didn’t tell you sooner.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エリー・ホワイト","displayName":"Ellie White","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A7:r41","rowIndex":41,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　と<tips=31>エリー</tips>は謝る。","en":"With that, <tips=31>Ellie</tips> apologizes.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A7:r42","rowIndex":42,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いや、助かるよ。きみにとっては話しにくい内容もあるからね。言ってくれただけでも感謝している。おかげで色々と謎が解けたよ。きみが父に対して強い感情を持っていた理由もね」","en":"“No, this helps. Some of it cannot have been easy for you to discuss. I'm grateful you told me at all. Thanks to you, several mysteries have been cleared up—including why you felt so strongly about my father.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A7:r43","rowIndex":43,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「先生と<tips=3>クリス</tips>様は、文字通り私を救ってくれた方ですから。そして先代の<tips=31>エリー・ホワイト</tips>、この三人が私に人間の暮らしを与えてくれたんです」","en":"“The Doctor and Master <tips=3>Chris</tips> quite literally saved me. Together with the previous <tips=31>Ellie White</tips>, those three gave me a human life.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エリー・ホワイト","displayName":"Ellie White","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A7:r44","rowIndex":44,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「てっきり、世間が言うように愛人関係なのだと思っていたよ」","en":"“I had assumed the rumors were true and you were his mistress.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A7:r45","rowIndex":45,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕がからかってもさすが<tips=31>エリー</tips>は感情を乱さず、","en":"Even when I tease her, <tips=31>Ellie</tips>, true to form, does not let her emotions waver:","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A7:r46","rowIndex":46,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「とんでもない。<tips=81>龍頭</tips>様ともあろう人でも、正しい情報を知らず、風聞に惑わされることもあるのですね」","en":"“Certainly not. So even a <tips=81>Longtou</tips> of your stature can be led astray by rumor when he lacks accurate information.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エリー・ホワイト","displayName":"Ellie White","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A7:r47","rowIndex":47,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　さらりとそうやり返す。","en":"She returns the thrust without missing a beat.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A7:r48","rowIndex":48,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「知らないことばっかりさ。だから毎日朝から晩まで忙しく働いているんだ」","en":"“There’s so much I don’t know. That’s why I work from morning till night, every day.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A7:r49","rowIndex":49,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕は苦笑をして、","en":"I give a wry smile.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A7:r50","rowIndex":50,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ただね、よく調べて何か必要以上に詳しいところをひとつふたつ披露すると、みんな勝手に何でも知ってると勘違いしてくれるのさ。そして、一度過大評価してくれれば、それをつかって行動や思考を制限したり誘導したり出来る。これが僕のやりかたの種明かしだね。つまり、ただのペテンだよ」","en":"“The thing is, if you investigate carefully and show off one or two facts you know in far more detail than anyone expects, people decide on their own that you must know everything. And once they've overestimated you, you can use that to constrain or steer their actions and thoughts. That's the secret of my method. In other words, it's just a con.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A7:r51","rowIndex":51,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「私にはその種明かしこそがペテンのように感じられますが」","en":"“That explanation of the trick strikes me as the true con.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エリー・ホワイト","displayName":"Ellie White","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A7:r52","rowIndex":52,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「アハハ、慎重なのはいいことだ」","en":"“Ah ha ha. Caution is a good thing.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A7:r53","rowIndex":53,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして僕は椅子の上で足を組み替えると、","en":"Then I switch which leg is crossed and say:","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A7:r54","rowIndex":54,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まあとにかく、『<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>』の能力がそういうものだとすると、色々と辻褄があうな。<tips=21>八龍会</tips>に<tips=46>ネオ・ローズ</tips>をもたらした<tips=65>ヘス</tips>って爺さんがいるだろう？　もしかしたら、あいつも『<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>』の変身した姿の一つなんじゃないか？　<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>の対抗馬として<tips=21>八龍会</tips>に手を貸したんだろう。あいつについて調べさせてもちっともわからなかったのは、必要な時だけ出て来る仮の姿の一つだったからだろうね」","en":"“Anyway, if that’s how ‘<tips=20>Koschei’s</tips> ability works, it makes a number of things fall into place. You know that old man <tips=65>Hess</tips>, who brought <tips=46>Neo Rose</tips> to the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips>? Could he have been another of ‘<tips=20>Koschei’s</tips> transformations? She probably lent the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips> a hand as a rival to <tips=7>YS</tips>. The reason our investigation of him turned up nothing must be that he was only a temporary guise she assumed when needed.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A7:r55","rowIndex":55,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうかもしれません」","en":"“That may be so.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エリー・ホワイト","displayName":"Ellie White","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A7:r56","rowIndex":56,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうだとすればわかりやすいな。<tips=21>八龍会</tips>を敵に回す上で、彼が唯一の不確定要素だったんだ。それも正体がわかればどうってことはない。<tips=21>八龍会</tips>のことはすぐに片付くだろう」","en":"“If that’s true, it simplifies things. He was the one unknown in going up against the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips>. Now that I know what he is, he presents no great problem. The <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips> will soon be dealt with.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A7:r57","rowIndex":57,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「相手を甘く見すぎではないですか？　彼らは油断出来る相手ではなかったはずです。我々の組織にも<tips=17>タイプB</tips>はいるわけですし、きっと<tips=21>八龍会</tips>と通じているものも……」","en":"“Aren't you underestimating them? Surely they were never an opponent we could afford to take lightly. Our own organization has <tips=17>Type Bs</tips>, and surely some of them have ties to the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips>...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エリー・ホワイト","displayName":"Ellie White","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A7:r58","rowIndex":58,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「相手にスパイがいるのはお互いさまさ。彼らもやがてそのことを知ることになるだろう」","en":"“Both sides have spies in the other's camp. They'll learn that in time.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A7:r59","rowIndex":59,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「こちらからも、何か仕掛けているのですか？」","en":"“Have you set something in motion from our side as well?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エリー・ホワイト","displayName":"Ellie White","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A7:r60","rowIndex":60,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=31>エリー</tips>は驚いた様子だった。","en":"<tips=31>Ellie</tips> looks surprised.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A7:r61","rowIndex":61,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そりゃそうだよ。相手にだけ裏工作をさせてたまるか」","en":"“Naturally. I'm not about to let them be the only ones working behind the scenes.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A7:r62","rowIndex":62,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「秘密主義ですね。幹部の誰にも伝えずにそんなことを……」","en":"“You really are secretive. Doing something like that without telling any of the executives...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エリー・ホワイト","displayName":"Ellie White","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A7:r63","rowIndex":63,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その言葉に僕は肩をすくめて、","en":"I shrug at that.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A7:r64","rowIndex":64,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「とにかく、<tips=21>八龍会</tips>は近いうちに滅びるだろう。あいつらはいま<tips=47>解放軍</tips>みたいな暴力的な組織を作っていい気になっているようだが、もっと他のことに注力すべきだね。あんな病院なんか襲って、勝手に<tips=21>八龍会</tips>の悪評を街中にまき散らすだなんて、僕らを有利にするために頑張っているようなもんだ。その間に、<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>は組織のなかの膿を出し切って随分すっきりとした。『<tips=46>ネオ・ローズ</tips>』みたいな切り札があるんだから、僕が彼らのリーダーだったらもっとうまく<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>を苦しめることが出来たのに、智恵が足りないというのは悲しいものさ」","en":"“At any rate, the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips> will probably be destroyed before long. They seem very pleased with themselves for creating a violent organization like the <tips=47>Liberation Army</tips>, but they ought to have devoted their energies elsewhere. Attacking a hospital like that and spreading the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society's</tips> bad name across the city all on their own—they might as well be working to give us the advantage. In the meantime, <tips=7>YS</tips> has drained all the pus from the organization and is much cleaner for it. With a trump card like ‘<tips=46>Neo Rose</tips>,’ I could have made life far more difficult for <tips=7>YS</tips> if I were their leader. How sad it is to lack the wit.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A7:r65","rowIndex":65,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「今日は随分と饒舌ですね」","en":"“You are unusually talkative today.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エリー・ホワイト","displayName":"Ellie White","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A7:r66","rowIndex":66,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「憂鬱なんだよ。もう全部片付いてしまったようなものだからね。僕が何か特別なことをしたわけじゃなくて、みんなが愚かだからこうなってしまったんだ。まるで、おままごとみたいな気分さ。……だけど、これで本当に人が死ぬんだから、実に酸鼻だよ。アハハハ」","en":"“I'm melancholy. Everything is as good as finished. It's not that I did anything extraordinary; everyone else was simply so foolish that things turned out this way. It feels like playing house. ...And yet real people die over it. It is truly ghastly. Ah ha ha ha.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A7:r67","rowIndex":67,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕が笑ったせいで、<tips=31>エリー</tips>を困惑させてしまったようだ。","en":"It seems my laughter has left <tips=31>Ellie</tips> bewildered.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A7:r68","rowIndex":68,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうですか……でも、<tips=21>八龍会</tips>と戦うのは<tips=81>龍頭</tips>としてもおつらいところですね」","en":"“I see... Still, it must be painful for you as <tips=81>Longtou</tips> to fight the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エリー・ホワイト","displayName":"Ellie White","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A7:r69","rowIndex":69,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女は気を取り直すようにそう話題を変える。","en":"She changes the subject as though collecting herself.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A7:r70","rowIndex":70,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「何が？」","en":"“What is?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A7:r71","rowIndex":71,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=47>解放軍</tips>のリーダーは<tips=10>見土道夫</tips>じゃないですか」","en":"“But isn't <tips=10>Michio Mido</tips> the leader of the <tips=47>Liberation Army</tips>?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エリー・ホワイト","displayName":"Ellie White","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A7:r72","rowIndex":72,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いや、それは問題ないね。彼はリーダーとしては優れているけれど、今の環境じゃ活かせないだろう。それに僕は彼のことはよく知っている。遅れをとることはないはずだ」","en":"“Oh, that poses no problem. He is an able leader, but these circumstances will not let him make use of his abilities. Besides, I know him well. He shouldn’t get the better of me.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A7:r73","rowIndex":73,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうではなくて……」","en":"“That is not what I meant...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エリー・ホワイト","displayName":"Ellie White","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A7:r74","rowIndex":74,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どういうこと？」","en":"“Then what did you mean?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A7:r75","rowIndex":75,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「彼は、<tips=81>龍頭</tips>様の友人だったと伺っていますが」","en":"“I understand he was a friend of yours, <tips=81>Longtou</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エリー・ホワイト","displayName":"Ellie White","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A7:r76","rowIndex":76,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ああ、そういう意味か……」","en":"“Ah. That’s what you meant...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A7:r77","rowIndex":77,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕は肩をすくめて、","en":"I shrug.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A7:r78","rowIndex":78,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「何も心配することはないよ。相手が誰であろうと僕の目が曇ったり、判断を誤るということはない」","en":"“There is nothing to worry about. No matter who stands against me, my vision will not cloud and my judgment will not fail.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A7:r79","rowIndex":79,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それは心配していません。ただ、お気持ちが……」","en":"“That is not what concerns me. I meant your feelings...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エリー・ホワイト","displayName":"Ellie White","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A7:r80","rowIndex":80,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「つらいだろうって？」","en":"“You think this is painful for me?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A7:r81","rowIndex":81,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「はい」","en":"“Yes.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エリー・ホワイト","displayName":"Ellie White","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A7:r82","rowIndex":82,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それはどっちだろう。よくわからないな。ただ、いずれにしたって結果に影響はない。影響がないってことは、そのことについて考える必要がないってことさ。<tips=10>見土道夫</tips>は近いうちに死ぬだろう。僕がどういう感情であるかに関わらず。……そもそも、失礼だと思わないか？」","en":"“I wonder which it is. I really don't know. Either way, it will have no effect on the outcome. And if it has no effect, there's no need to think about it. <tips=10>Michio Mido</tips> will probably be dead before long, regardless of how I feel. ...Besides, don't you find it disrespectful?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A7:r83","rowIndex":83,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「申し訳ありません。<tips=81>龍頭</tips>様ほど強い意志の方が感情に流されるなど……」","en":"“My apologies. To suggest that someone with a will as strong as yours, <tips=81>Longtou</tips>, might be swept away by emotion...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エリー・ホワイト","displayName":"Ellie White","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A7:r84","rowIndex":84,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうじゃない。僕に対してじゃない。だってさ、僕は今までたくさんの人間を死に追いやったけれども、そのうち一人だって憎いとか嫌いだから殺したわけじゃないんだ。むしろ人殺しなんか全然したくないね。ただ、必要だから殺したんだ。それだけだよ。心情がつらい、つらくないなんて、本当に些細な問題なんだ。生命という貴いものを奪うおそるべき重罪の前ではね。そんな話をすること自体失礼というものさ。死んでいったやつらに対してじゃなくて、生命そのものに対してね。……だからきみは今後僕の心情については何も想像しなくていいんだ。僕は僕の心情とは無関係に、今後も<tips=81>龍頭</tips>としての務めを果たしてゆくだろう。我々は罪深い生き物なんだよ」","en":"“That's not what I mean. Not disrespectful to me. You see, I have driven many people to their deaths, but I never killed a single one because I hated or disliked them. In fact, I'd much rather not kill anyone at all. I killed only because it was necessary. Nothing more. Whether it hurts me or not is truly a trivial question in the face of the terrible crime of taking something as precious as life. To discuss such a thing at all would be disrespectful—not to the people who died, but to life itself. ...So from now on, you needn't imagine anything about my feelings. Regardless of how I feel, I will continue to fulfill my duty as <tips=81>Longtou</tips>. We are sinful creatures.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A7:r85","rowIndex":85,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そう言って僕は笑って見せたが、<tips=31>エリー</tips>は何も言わず黙ったままだった。","en":"I smile as I say it, but <tips=31>Ellie</tips> remains silent.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A7:r86","rowIndex":86,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=50>路地</tips>が来るまでもう少しあったので、<tips=31>エリー</tips>と<tips=40>黄姉妹</tips>を自室に下がらせた。","en":"There was still some time before <tips=50>Roji</tips> was due to arrive, so I sent <tips=31>Ellie</tips> and the <tips=40>Wong sisters</tips> back to their rooms.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A7:r87","rowIndex":87,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　執務室に一人きりになり、僕は<tips=30>レイレイ</tips>が買ってくる新しいコーヒーを楽しみに待っていた。","en":"Alone in the office, I wait eagerly for the fresh coffee <tips=30>Leilei</tips> will bring back.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A7:r88","rowIndex":88,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　朝にコーヒーが切れているのを気づいた<tips=30>レイレイ</tips>が買いに行くと言い出したとき、どうせシェフが毎日食材を買い出しに行くのだからついでに買わせれば良いし、それくらい我慢出来るからわざわざ行かなくてもいいんだよと言っていた僕だが、「それだと夕方になりますから」と案外強情な<tips=30>レイレイ</tips>が僕の意見を無視して出て行くと、無性に飲みたくなってそわそわしてしまうのだからおかしなものだ。","en":"When <tips=30>Leilei</tips> noticed this morning that we were out of coffee and offered to buy some, I told her there was no need to make a special trip. The chef went shopping for ingredients every day anyway, so he could pick it up while he was out, and surely I could wait that long. But the unexpectedly headstrong <tips=30>Leilei</tips> ignored me and left with a ‘That would mean waiting until evening.’ No sooner had she gone than I began craving coffee so badly I could hardly sit still. Strange how that works.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A7:r89","rowIndex":89,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　父の代から<tips=81>龍頭</tips>に仕える彼女は非常に真面目で、よく働いてくれている。これは僕に対して特別な感情があるとかではなく、他の誰が<tips=81>龍頭</tips>であったとしても同じように尽くすのだろう。彼女は自分がここに拾われたことに心から感謝しており、仕事を愛している。そして生まれながらにして心に善意を多めに持っているようだ。僕と意見が違っても、正しいと思ったことは断行する。これはおそらく、脳の神経がそういう配線になっているとか、そういった肉体のつくりから来ているものなのだろう。こういった他意のない善意はいいものだ。","en":"She has served the <tips=81>Longtou</tips> since my father's time, and she is exceptionally conscientious and hardworking. It is not that she feels anything special for me; she would probably devote herself in the same fashion no matter who held the title of <tips=81>Longtou</tips>. She is sincerely grateful that she was taken in here, and she loves her work. She also seems to have been born with more goodwill in her heart than most. Even when she disagrees with me, she carries out whatever she believes is right. That probably comes from something physical—the way the nerves in her brain are wired, perhaps. There is something pleasant about goodwill with no ulterior motive.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A7:r90","rowIndex":90,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そういう彼女が買いに行き淹れてくれるコーヒーだから、僕はいまこんなに飲みたくなっているのかもしれない。少し疲れているのを実感している。","en":"Perhaps I want it so badly because she is the one buying the coffee and brewing it for me. I realize I am a little tired.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A7:r91","rowIndex":91,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　仕事は毎日山積みだった。今日は<tips=50>路地</tips>の件の他にも、<tips=59>暗闇通り</tips>の顔役と会ったり、父の代からの知り合いの爺さんの葬式に行ったり、用事がいろいろとあった。","en":"Every day brings another mountain of work. Besides my business with <tips=50>Roji</tips>, today I have to meet one of the leading figures of <tips=59>Darkness Street</tips>, attend the funeral of an old man I have known since my father's time, and deal with various other matters.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A7:r92","rowIndex":92,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　楽しくはないが、まあまあうまくやっているんじゃないかな？　<tips=21>八龍会</tips>のことだって、みなが恐れるほど僕は心配していない。もう全ての手はずは整えている。<tips=31>エリー</tips>に語ったのは別にはったりでもなんでもない。よほどイレギュラーなことが起きなければ、<tips=27>廖志明</tips>と争った時のように、僕自身が危険を犯す必要もなく解決するはずだ。","en":"It may not be enjoyable, but I suppose I am doing reasonably well. I am not as worried about the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips> as everyone else is. All the arrangements are already in place. What I told <tips=31>Ellie</tips> was no bluff. Unless something highly irregular occurs, it should all be resolved without my personally taking any risks, just as when I contended with <tips=27>Liao Chi-ming</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A7:r93","rowIndex":93,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=21>八龍会</tips>の<tips=22>老人たち</tips>にしては待ちに待った覇権争いのチャンスだったろうが、結局ありもしないチャンスだったということだ。哀れなものだと思うが、これも人の運命というものだろう。","en":"For the <tips=22>old men</tips> of the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips>, this must have seemed the long-awaited opportunity to challenge us for supremacy. In the end, there was never any opportunity at all. I pity them, but perhaps this too is simply human fate.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A7:r94","rowIndex":94,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　もちろん、勝利は確信しているとは言え、油断をしているわけではない。諜報のために人をばらまいているが、今のところ予想外のことが起きそうな報告はない。まあ、このまま進むのだろう。こうして結末のわかりきった状況を待っていると、研究室に入ったばかりの頃のことを思い出す。先生に言われて、結果のわかりきった実験を観察させられるばかりの毎日だった。今もあのときと同じ気分だ。","en":"Of course, even though I am certain of victory, I have not let down my guard. I have agents scattered everywhere gathering intelligence, but so far there have been no reports suggesting that anything unforeseen is likely to happen. I expect matters will proceed as they are. Waiting for a situation whose conclusion is already obvious reminds me of my earliest days at the laboratory. The Doctor made me spend every day observing experiments whose results were obvious in advance. I feel exactly as I did then.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A7:r95","rowIndex":95,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　少し眠い。僕はあくびをする。","en":"I am a little sleepy. I yawn.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A7:r96","rowIndex":96,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それから、もうすぐ到着するコーヒーのことを考え、そして、ふと<tips=44>筱喬</tips>のことを考えた。","en":"Then I think about the coffee that will be here soon—and, quite suddenly, about <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A7:r97","rowIndex":97,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　あいつは元気にしてるかな？","en":"I wonder if she's doing well.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A7:r98","rowIndex":98,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕が<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>に入ることを決めた理由の何割かはあの妹の存在があったのは事実だ。だから、勝手に出て行ったという報告を受けたときは最初腹が立ったが、少し考えてから、そう悪くはないと思い直した。","en":"It is true that my little sister was part of the reason I decided to join <tips=7>YS</tips>. So when I was told she had gone off on her own, I was angry at first; but after thinking it over, I decided it might not be so bad.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A7:r99","rowIndex":99,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　これから僕は多くの人間の憎しみを集めるだろう。そうなった場合、唯一の肉親である<tips=44>筱喬</tips>が標的になるということもありうる。それを防ぐためには、結局父の時代のように彼女の生活を不自由なものにする必要がある。いや、それ以上に厳重な警備が要るかも知れない。僕は父ほど組織内での人気があるわけではなく、敵が組織の内側に現れるリスクも高い。本人には、そのうちもっと自由にさせてやるとは言っていたが、正直なところ実現は難しい。","en":"From now on, I will draw the hatred of many people. If that happens, my only living relative, <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips>, could become a target. To prevent that, I would ultimately have to restrict her life as my father did. No—she might need even tighter security. I am not as popular within the organization as my father was, and there is a greater risk of enemies emerging inside it. I told her I would give her more freedom someday, but honestly, that would be difficult to achieve.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A7:r100","rowIndex":100,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それに、もし僕が死んだらどうなるだろう？","en":"And what would happen if I died?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A7:r101","rowIndex":101,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　父が死んだ時とはまた少し状況が違う。あの頃は、<tips=44>筱喬</tips>を担ぎ上げようという意見もありえたかもしれないが、僕が組織の空気を変えてしまった。幹部たちのファミリーを解体し、派閥によらない合理的な人事に切り換えようとしている。もし僕が死んだならば、次の<tips=81>龍頭</tips>は実力でその座を勝ち取ることになるだろう。","en":"The situation is somewhat different from when my father died. Back then, there might have been calls to put <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> forward, but I have changed the atmosphere of the organization. I am dismantling the families under the executives and trying to switch to rational, faction-neutral appointments. If I die, the next <tips=81>Longtou</tips> will have to win the position on merit.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A7:r102","rowIndex":102,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その時、<tips=44>筱喬</tips>の立場は随分ややこしいものになるはずだ。何の権力もないとは言え、カリスマであった初代<tips=81>龍頭</tips>の血を引くというのは、新しい<tips=81>龍頭</tips>にとって邪魔な存在になるかもしれない。利用されるか、排除されるか、その時になってみないとわからないが、いずれにしろ、僕がいなければもう彼女を守るものはいない。本来彼女の味方となるべき<tips=76>旧義勝</tips>の連中は、<tips=4>馬明</tips>に特別な慈悲をかけずに処刑したり、その他の連中も容赦なく粛清してしまったために、僕にいい感情は持っていない。彼女は自分の力で自分を守らなくてはいけなくなるが、果たしてそんなことが出来るのだろうか？","en":"At that point, <tips=44>Siu-kiu’s</tips> position would be extremely complicated. Though she would have no power of her own, her descent from the charismatic First <tips=81>Longtou</tips> might make her an obstacle to the new <tips=81>Longtou</tips>. Whether she would be used or eliminated, I cannot know until the time comes; either way, without me there would be no one left to protect her. The members of <tips=76>old Yisheng</tips>, who by rights ought to be her allies, bear me no goodwill: I executed <tips=4>Ma Ming</tips> without showing him any special mercy, and purged the others just as ruthlessly. She would have to protect herself—but could she really do that?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A7:r103","rowIndex":103,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして、僕は病気のためにそう長くは生きられない。","en":"And I will not live much longer because of my illness.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A7:r104","rowIndex":104,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　つまり、いずれはその日がやって来るのだ。","en":"In other words, sooner or later, that day will come.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A7:r105","rowIndex":105,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　このままここで暮らしていると、不自由な生活を強いられた上に、結局はひとりぼっちでギャングの群れに放り出されることになる。","en":"If she continues living here, she will be forced to live under restrictions, only to be cast alone among a pack of gangsters in the end.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A7:r106","rowIndex":106,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　――それなら、早い内に<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>と縁を切って、どこかで暮らした方がまだ幸せな人生を送れるのかもしれない。","en":"—In that case, she might have a happier life if she cut ties with <tips=7>YS</tips> sooner rather than later and lived somewhere else.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A7:r107","rowIndex":107,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=44>筱喬</tips>が今居る場所についてはある程度予想がついている。もしそれが当たっていれば――当たっていて欲しくはないのだが、まあとにかく僕が思っている場所にいるのなら、ずっとはいられない場所だからあとで何かしら手を打たなきゃいけないが、それはそのときに考えよう。僕から見て今の居場所が悪かったとしても、それは<tips=44>筱喬</tips>が自分で決めた場所なのだ。","en":"I have a fair idea where <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> is now. If I am right—and I hope I am not, but in any case, if she is where I think she is—then she cannot remain there forever, and sooner or later I will have to do something. I will think about that when the time comes. Even if I consider her present refuge a bad one, it is a place <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> chose for herself.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A7:r108","rowIndex":108,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そう、彼女は自分で自分の人生を決めればいい。","en":"Yes. She should decide for herself how to live her life.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A7:r109","rowIndex":109,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そう割り切ってしまうと、僕は少し身軽になったのを感じた。大事な人間がいなくなればなるほどラクになる。","en":"Once I settled on that view, I felt a little lighter. The fewer people I hold dear, the easier life becomes.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A7:r110","rowIndex":110,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=55>松子</tips>に別れを告げた後もそうだし、<tips=4>馬明</tips>ももう死んでしまった。というか僕が殺した。そして娘の<tips=24>美美</tips>もそれが原因でお腹の子供とともに自殺した。父さんはいない。母さんはずっと昔に死んだ。僕を育ててくれた定食屋の夫婦は――今どうしているんだろうな。とにかく、誰もいなくなった。","en":"It was the same after I said goodbye to <tips=55>Matsuko</tips>. <tips=4>Ma Ming</tips> is dead too—or rather, I killed him. That drove his daughter <tips=24>Meimei</tips> to take her own life, together with the child in her womb. Father is gone. Mother died long ago. The couple from the diner who raised me—what has become of them, I wonder? At any rate, no one remains.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A7:r111","rowIndex":111,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そうしたら、僕はもう余計なことを考える必要がなくなった。ただ、<tips=81>龍頭</tips>としての仕事をこなせばいい。","en":"After that, I no longer had to think about anything else. I needed only do my work as <tips=81>Longtou</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A7:r112","rowIndex":112,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　部下の作った報告書を読み、無感動に人を殺したり欺いたりしている。きっと、こういう生き方が僕にはあっているのだろう。もっと早くこうしていれば、人生をもっともっとラクに生きていられたのかもしれない。","en":"I read the reports my subordinates prepare and dispassionately kill or deceive people. Perhaps this way of living suits me. Had I begun sooner, life might have been so much easier.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A7:r113","rowIndex":113,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それにしてもコーヒーが楽しみだ。","en":"Still, I am looking forward to that coffee.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A7:r114","rowIndex":114,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕は椅子に立ったり座ったりしている。","en":"I keep rising from my chair, then sitting down again.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A7:r115","rowIndex":115,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　執務室は襲撃後に修理したけれど、以前とさほどかわらない内装で、以前とかわらない家具が置かれている。","en":"The office was repaired after the attack, but its decor has changed very little, and it is furnished much as it was before.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A7:r116","rowIndex":116,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ソファーとローテーブルの応接セットがあり、コーヒーなどを淹れられるカウンターがあり、この執務机がある。","en":"There is a sofa and low table for receiving visitors, a counter where coffee and the like can be prepared, and this desk of mine.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A7:r117","rowIndex":117,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　まったく、無駄に広い部屋だ。","en":"Really, it is a pointlessly vast room.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A7:r118","rowIndex":118,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　この部屋で一人でいると、僕は時々死者に囲まれて見つめられているような感覚をおぼえる。","en":"When I am alone here, I sometimes have the sensation that the dead surround me and stare.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A7:r119","rowIndex":119,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それは<tips=17>タイプB</tips>の症状のように幻覚として見えるというわけではなく、目には見えないけれども、そういう存在を肌に実感するのだ。","en":"It is not that I see them as hallucinations, as one might with <tips=17>Type B</tips> symptoms. They are invisible to my eyes, but I feel their presence against my skin.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A7:r120","rowIndex":120,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　例えばあの壁のそばには胎児を大事そうにかかえた<tips=24>美美</tips>がいつも立ってこちらを恨めしそうに見ているような気がするし、その隣には頭に穴が開いた<tips=4>馬明</tips>が笑っている。","en":"For example, I always feel as though <tips=24>Meimei</tips> is standing beside that wall, tenderly cradling her fetus and gazing at me resentfully, while <tips=4>Ma Ming</tips> smiles beside her with a hole in his head.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A7:r121","rowIndex":121,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　コーヒーセットのそばには<tips=39>ジェフリー</tips>が難しい顔をして立っていて、その向こうでは父さんと母さんが何か談笑している。","en":"<tips=39>Jeffrey</tips> stands by the coffee service wearing a grave expression. Beyond him, Father and Mother chat together about something.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A7:r122","rowIndex":122,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　床では子供の頃に飼っていた猫が走り回り、トラックに轢かれて死んだ幼なじみのヨウ君がそれを追いかけている。","en":"The cat I kept as a child races across the floor, pursued by my childhood friend Yo, who was run over and killed by a truck.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A7:r123","rowIndex":123,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　向こうの窓際で憎々しくこちらを睨んでいるのはこの間殺した<tips=26>劉建志</tips>だ。ほら、近くで泣いているのはその娘だろう？","en":"The man glaring hatefully at me from the window over there is <tips=26>Ryu Kenshi</tips>, whom I killed the other day. And look—the girl crying nearby is his daughter, isn't she?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A7:r124","rowIndex":124,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その他、裏切りを画策して死んだ浩一家など、その他名前ももう覚えていない、僕が殺した、僕の身のまわりで死んだ、いろんな連中がいる。この短い間に、随分たくさんの人間が死んだもんだ。","en":"Then there are the Hao family, who plotted betrayal and died, and all the others whose names I no longer remember: the people I killed, and the people who died around me. An astonishing number of people have died in this short time.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A7:r125","rowIndex":125,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=10>道夫</tips>も近いうちにこの集団に加わるのだろう。僕の思ったとおりに物事が運べばそうなる。彼は正々堂々僕と戦いたいと願っているだろうけれど、残念ながらその機会を持たないまま死ぬことになる。僕は暴力に時間をかけるのは好きじゃない。――なあ<tips=10>道夫</tips>、そうなっても、恨まないでくれ。もし僕の考えが全部うまくいかずに、逆の立場になっても、お前を恨んだりはしないから。僕らは舞台に上がってしまったんだ。","en":"<tips=10>Michio</tips> will probably join this company before long. If events unfold as I expect, he will. He may wish to fight me openly and fairly, but unfortunately he will die without ever getting the chance. I do not like wasting time on violence. —<tips=10>Michio</tips>, when that happens, don't resent me. If all my plans fail and our positions are reversed, I won't resent you either. We've stepped onto the stage.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A7:r126","rowIndex":126,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　死者をこんなに身近に感じる。彼らと僕の間の境界線がひどく曖昧になっているように感じる。少しおかしくなっているのかな？　だからといって、<tips=25>世傑</tips>のように死者たちを祭壇に飾って弔う気にもなれない。","en":"The dead feel so close to me. The boundary between them and me seems to have grown terribly indistinct. Am I going a little mad? Even so, I cannot bring myself to display the dead upon an altar and mourn them as <tips=25>Sai-kit</tips> does.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A7:r127","rowIndex":127,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕は何も感じない。死者たちを恐れることもなく、死なせたことの罪悪感も覚えない。むしろ気軽に話しかけたいような親近感がある。このまともにつき合うのはいささか厄介な世界に生まれ、苦しみ、戦い、そして目一杯楽しんで来たんだ。僕らは同じショーに参加した役者であり、観客であり、オーナーだ。僕も近いうちに誰かが夢に見る亡霊になるのだろう。誰かに殺されるか、病気が進行するか、いずれにしろ死ってのは生まれた時に予約済なんだ。大騒ぎするようなことじゃない。","en":"I feel nothing. I do not fear the dead, nor do I feel guilty for having caused their deaths. If anything, I feel a fond familiarity, as though I would like to speak to them casually. We were born into this world—a world rather troublesome to take seriously—and suffered, fought, and enjoyed ourselves to the fullest. We are the actors, the audience, and the owners of the same show. Before long, I too will become a specter in somebody's dream. Perhaps someone will kill me; perhaps my illness will advance. In any event, death is a reservation made at birth. It is hardly worth making a commotion over.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A7:r128","rowIndex":128,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　この世の中に、罪というものは存在しない。それは僕が神を信じないからだろう。この終わりなくいつまでも続くお祭り騒ぎのなかで、一体なにをしたら罪になるっていうんだろう？","en":"Sin does not exist in this world. Perhaps that is because I do not believe in God. Amid this endless revel, what could one possibly do that would count as a sin?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A7:r129","rowIndex":129,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　誰かの頭に小さな鉛玉を撃ち込む前の人間と、撃ち込んで誰かを殺した後の人間が、そんなに違うってことはありえるのかい？　その行為はそんなに大げさなことかい？　撃たれた方にしたって、穴が開いて少し風通しがいいくらいのものだろうに。","en":"Can a person before he fires a tiny lump of lead into someone's head really be so different from that same person after he fires it and kills someone? Can the act itself truly be so momentous? Even for the one who gets shot, all that happens is that a hole opens up and his head becomes a little better ventilated.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A7:r130","rowIndex":130,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　つい先日なんとかという頭の狂った聖職者がやってきてこの執務室で長々と泣きながら僕に「赦しを求めなさい。赦しを求めなさい」と非難したが、ああいうのがしあわせなんだろう。","en":"Just the other day, some deranged clergyman or other came to this office and spent an age weeping as he condemned me: ‘Seek forgiveness. Seek forgiveness.’ Perhaps people like that are happy.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A7:r131","rowIndex":131,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　この世界には神は存在せず、赦しもないのだから、つまりはじめから罪も罰も存在しない。強いて言えば、人間はみな生まれながらにして自由という罰を受けている。そして、その真っ青な空の下の砂漠のような世界で、ただ生き、ただ死ぬのだ。","en":"There is no God in this world, and no forgiveness; therefore, neither sin nor punishment has ever existed. If anything, every human being is punished from birth with freedom. And beneath that deep blue sky, in a world like a desert, we merely live and merely die.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A7:r132","rowIndex":132,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それにしてもコーヒーはまだなんだろうか？　僕はこんなにも<tips=30>レイレイ</tips>が彼女の肉体に基づく純粋な善意から淹れてくれたコーヒーを欲しているというのに。","en":"And yet, is the coffee not here yet? I am positively desperate for a cup brewed by <tips=30>Leilei</tips> out of the pure goodwill hardwired into her body.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A7:r133","rowIndex":133,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　さて、そうして<tips=30>レイレイ</tips>が帰って来たのはいいのだけれども、すると下から連絡があって、予定よりも少し早く<tips=50>路地</tips>たちがやって来たと伝えてくる。","en":"Eventually <tips=30>Leilei</tips> does return, but no sooner has she arrived than word comes from downstairs: <tips=50>Roji</tips> and his companions have appeared slightly ahead of schedule.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A7:r134","rowIndex":134,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　コーヒーを楽しむためだけの時間はとれず、野暮な話をしながら飲むことになってしまったようだ。","en":"It seems I have ended up with no time to enjoy the coffee for its own sake. I will have to drink it while discussing tedious business.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A7:r135","rowIndex":135,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　すぐに<tips=50>路地</tips>を通し、<tips=31>エリー</tips>や<tips=40>黄姉妹</tips>を執務室に来させるよう伝えた。","en":"I tell them to show <tips=50>Roji</tips> in at once, and to summon <tips=31>Ellie</tips> and the <tips=40>Wong sisters</tips> to the office.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A7:r136","rowIndex":136,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして、間もなく<tips=50>路地</tips>と警察官は部屋に姿を現した。","en":"Before long, <tips=50>Roji</tips> and the police officer enter the room.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A7:r137","rowIndex":137,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=50>路地</tips>のことはよく知っている。僕は子供の頃サイキックマニアだったので、街中のサイキック情報を集めたのだけれども、<tips=50>路地</tips>は当時最も有名なサイキックの一人だった。","en":"I know a great deal about <tips=50>Roji</tips>. I was a psychic fanatic as a child and collected information about psychics throughout the city. <tips=50>Roji</tips> was one of the most famous psychics of the time.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A7:r138","rowIndex":138,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　サイキック能力を貧しい者たちのために使う正義の名探偵。そんな触れ込みだったはずである。いつの間にか探偵をやめてフリーライターになったらしいが、なるほど、当時の噂通り鬼のような角が生えた大男だ。噂は知っていたが、こうして本人を目の当たりにするのは初めてだ。","en":"A champion of justice, a great detective who used his psychic ability for the sake of the poor—that was how he was billed, if memory serves. At some point he apparently abandoned detective work and became a freelance writer. And sure enough, he is a massive man with horns like an ogre, just as the old rumors said. I knew the rumors, but this is my first time seeing the man himself.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A7:r139","rowIndex":139,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして、もう一人はまだ若い女性の警官だった。以前は<tips=48>堂島</tips>という犬の頭をした刑事と<tips=50>路地</tips>はつるんでいたそうだが、<tips=48>堂島</tips>が死に、この女がその後釜になったのか。警察でもかなりの地位にあるものがくると聞いていたので、中年男を勝手に想像していたのだが違った。どうやらキャリア組らしい。本来なら警察官僚になるような雲の上の人間がどうして現場に来て<tips=50>路地</tips>のような胡散臭い人間とコンビを組んでいるのか。個人的な興味はあったが、今この場面ではさして重要な疑問ではないだろう。","en":"His companion is a female police officer, still quite young. I understand that <tips=50>Roji</tips> once went about with a dog-headed detective named <tips=48>Dojima</tips>. Did this woman take his place after <tips=48>Dojima's</tips> death? I had heard that someone of considerable rank within the police was coming, so I arbitrarily pictured a middle-aged man. Evidently she is on the elite career track. Why would someone from the rarefied heights of the police bureaucracy come into the field and partner with someone as dubious as <tips=50>Roji</tips>? The question interests me personally, but it hardly matters here.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A7:r140","rowIndex":140,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　まあ、この胡散臭い街には胡散臭い警察官がお似合いというわけか。彼女は少し疲れた顔をしている。","en":"Then again, perhaps a dubious police officer is just the thing for a dubious city like this. She looks slightly weary.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A7:r141","rowIndex":141,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「はじめまして、<tips=49>三芳</tips>です」","en":"“A pleasure to meet you. My name is <tips=49>Miyoshi</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"三芳","displayName":"Miyoshi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A7:r142","rowIndex":142,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=50>路地</tips>だ」","en":"“<tips=50>Roji</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"路地邦昭","displayName":"Kuniaki Roji","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A7:r143","rowIndex":143,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その警官は丁寧に、一方<tips=50>路地</tips>はぶっきらぼうに、そう名乗った。","en":"The police officer gives her name politely, while <tips=50>Roji</tips> gives his with brusque simplicity.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A7:r144","rowIndex":144,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　我々は応接セットに向かい合って座っている。それぞれの前には<tips=30>レイレイ</tips>が買って来てくれたばかりのコーヒーが置いてある。","en":"We sit facing one another around the reception table. Before each of us stands a cup of the coffee <tips=30>Leilei</tips> has only just brought back.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A7:r145","rowIndex":145,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「私が<tips=1>謝亮</tips>です」","en":"“I am <tips=1>Tse Leung</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A7:r146","rowIndex":146,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そう言ってから僕はコーヒーを一口飲んだ。","en":"After introducing myself, I take a sip of coffee.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A7:r147","rowIndex":147,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　念願のコーヒーだったけれども、こんな連中と向かい合ってでは案の定あまり美味しくはない。","en":"It is the coffee I have been longing for, but predictably, it does not taste nearly as good with people like these sitting opposite me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A7:r148","rowIndex":148,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「話は<tips=31>エリー</tips>から聞いていますよ。随分と大変な目に遭われたようですね」","en":"“<tips=31>Ellie</tips> has explained matters to me. You appear to have been through a great deal.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A7:r149","rowIndex":149,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうか。それならば話が早い」","en":"“I see. Then we can get to the point.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"路地邦昭","displayName":"Kuniaki Roji","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A7:r150","rowIndex":150,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=50>路地</tips>はコーヒーには手をつけず、無精髭だらけの顔でこちらをじっと見つめている。","en":"<tips=50>Roji</tips> leaves his coffee untouched and stares fixedly at me, his face covered in unkempt stubble.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A7:r151","rowIndex":151,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その目はまるで何かに取り憑かれたような怪しい輝きに満ちている。これが復讐の炎に燃えるってやつなのだろう。僕も何度か見たことがある。殺した裏切り者の家族と会ったときなどだ。そしてこの目をした連中はその次の瞬間には大抵死んだ魚のような濁った目にかわり、ピクリとも動かなくなっている。復讐心は良くない。冷静な判断力を奪うからだ。","en":"His eyes possess a strange gleam, as though something has taken hold of him. Perhaps this is what they mean by burning with the fires of revenge. I have seen it several times myself—when meeting the families of traitors I killed, for example. The next moment, people with that look in their eyes are usually staring cloudily like dead fish, no longer twitching at all. Revenge is a bad thing. It robs one of cool judgment.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A7:r152","rowIndex":152,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「警察はあんたの組織と連携をとって<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>の逮捕、<tips=47>八龍解放軍</tips>の鎮圧を望んでいる」","en":"“The police want to coordinate with your organization to arrest <tips=20>Koschei</tips> and suppress the <tips=47>Hachiryu Liberation Army</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"路地邦昭","displayName":"Kuniaki Roji","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A7:r153","rowIndex":153,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それは警察の総意ですか？」","en":"“Is that the consensus of the police?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A7:r154","rowIndex":154,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕が<tips=49>三芳</tips>の方に尋ねると彼女は頷く。","en":"When I direct the question to <tips=49>Miyoshi</tips>, she nods.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A7:r155","rowIndex":155,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「わかりました。しかし、連携といっても何かしてくれるわけではないんですよね？　それは結局、我々をけしかけて<tips=21>八龍会</tips>と争わせようというわけですか」","en":"“I understand. But by ‘working together,’ you don’t mean you’ll actually do anything for us, do you? In the end, you’re just trying to sic us on the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips> and make us fight them.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A7:r156","rowIndex":156,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「勿論表立っての協力は出来ませんが、協力していただければあなたたち<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>には特別な便宜がはからわれるでしょう。このことは、上の者もはっきり約束しています」","en":"“Naturally, we cannot assist you openly. But if you cooperate, <tips=7>YS</tips> will receive special consideration from the police. My superiors have given me their explicit promise on that point.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"三芳","displayName":"Miyoshi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A7:r157","rowIndex":157,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=49>三芳</tips>は硬い口調で言う。","en":"<tips=49>Miyoshi</tips> says firmly.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A7:r158","rowIndex":158,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「特別な便宜ね」","en":"“Special consideration.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A7:r159","rowIndex":159,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕は思わず笑ってしまった。今更警察からご大層にそんなものを貰わなくたって、充分に好き勝手にやって来たのだ。","en":"I cannot help laughing. We have managed to do exactly as we pleased without the police magnanimously granting us any such thing.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A7:r160","rowIndex":160,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>に殺された『ドクター』は、あんたからすれば父親の親友だ。<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>にとっての恩人でもある。黙って見ている手はないだろう。それに、いずれにしろ<tips=21>八龍会</tips>とは争いを避けられない状況だ。警察と組むのが悪い話だとは思えない。……それとも、このまま<tips=21>八龍会</tips>に好き勝手させているつもりか？」","en":"“The ‘Doctor’ killed by <tips=20>Koschei</tips> was your father’s closest friend. He was a benefactor to <tips=7>YS</tips> as well. You can hardly stand by in silence. Besides, conflict with the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips> is unavoidable for you in any case. I don’t see how working with the police could be a bad proposition. ...Or do you intend to let the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips> go on doing whatever it pleases?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"路地邦昭","displayName":"Kuniaki Roji","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A7:r161","rowIndex":161,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そんな簡単な話ではありません」","en":"“It is not so simple as that.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A7:r162","rowIndex":162,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕は溜息をついて見せた。","en":"I make a show of sighing.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A7:r163","rowIndex":163,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「相手には危険なサイキックもいます。我々は以前そいつにこのビルに乗り込まれて、優秀な人材を多数亡くしているんです。戦うとなれば、被害は甚大でしょう」","en":"“They have a dangerous psychic on their side. That psychic once stormed this building and cost us many highly capable people. If we fight, our losses will be enormous.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A7:r164","rowIndex":164,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そう言った時、<tips=31>エリー</tips>はこちらを見た。僕はもうあのサイキックへの対策を済ませており、脅威とは感じていない。彼女はそれを知っている。そして何より、僕自身はもう<tips=21>八龍会</tips>と戦うつもりだと決めていることも知っている。つまり僕が言っているのはまるきり本心ではないでたらめだ。","en":"At those words, <tips=31>Ellie</tips> looks at me. I have already prepared countermeasures against that psychic and no longer consider her a threat. She knows that. More importantly, she also knows that I have already decided to fight the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips>. In other words, everything I have just said is a fabrication, none of it what I truly think.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A7:r165","rowIndex":165,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女はもちろんこれが交渉のための駆け引きだと理解はしているだろうが、この場面で僕が駆け引きをするとは思っていなかったのかもしれない。","en":"She must have understood that this was a negotiating tactic, but perhaps she had not expected me to resort to one in this situation.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A7:r166","rowIndex":166,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ただ僕は厳密には駆け引きをするつもりではなかった。","en":"Strictly speaking, however, I am not actually trying to bargain.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A7:r167","rowIndex":167,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「良いですか？　被害というのはとりもなおさず人が死ぬということです。我々は自分の血を流して戦うわけだ。私は貴重な部下の血を、あなたたちの都合で流させるつもりはないんですよ。……あなたたちと連携をとるのはいいが、なんの指図も受けるつもりはないとまず言っておきましょう。頂いた情報を元に、私たちは独自の判断で動かせて頂く。<tips=21>八龍会</tips>と戦うのも、手を結ぶのも、その時にベストと思われる手段を選ぶだけの話だ」","en":"“Do you understand? Losses mean people dying. We are the ones who will shed our blood in battle. I have no intention of letting my valued subordinates bleed to serve your purposes. ...We can coordinate with you, but let me make one thing clear at the outset: we have no intention of taking orders from you. We will act on the information you provide according to our own judgment. Whether we fight or join forces with the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips>, we will simply choose whichever course seems best at the time.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A7:r168","rowIndex":168,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そう言うと、<tips=49>三芳</tips>が露骨に顔を顰めた。","en":"<tips=49>Miyoshi</tips> scowls openly.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A7:r169","rowIndex":169,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「相手は危険なサイキックです。被害を覚悟なさるのは結構ですが、あなたたちだけで勝てるとお思いですか？　我々の要望を受け入れて頂ければこちらの対サイキック用の各種装備を……」","en":"“Your opponent is a dangerous psychic. It is all well and good to prepare yourself for casualties, but do you truly believe you can win on your own? If you accept our request, we can furnish you with various kinds of anti-psychic equipment...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"三芳","displayName":"Miyoshi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A7:r170","rowIndex":170,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いらない。この街のことは我々が我々の力だけで解決する」","en":"“We don’t need it. We will settle this city’s affairs with nothing but our own strength.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A7:r171","rowIndex":171,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうは言いますが、そもそもあなたたちギャングというものは……」","en":"“You say that, but the fact remains that you people are gangsters...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"三芳","displayName":"Miyoshi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A7:r172","rowIndex":172,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=49>三芳</tips>が言いかけたのを<tips=50>路地</tips>が手を上げて遮って、","en":"<tips=50>Roji</tips> raises a hand to cut <tips=49>Miyoshi</tips> off.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A7:r173","rowIndex":173,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まあ、いいじゃないか。……それでかまわないよ。どっちにしろ同じことだからね」","en":"“Oh, let it go. ...That’s fine. It comes to the same thing either way.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"路地邦昭","displayName":"Kuniaki Roji","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A7:r174","rowIndex":174,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　苦笑すると<tips=49>三芳</tips>の方を振り返り、","en":"He smiles ruefully and turns to <tips=49>Miyoshi</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A7:r175","rowIndex":175,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=49>三芳</tips>さん。あんたは上司に『<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>は動いた』とだけ報告すればいいんだ。なに、このお兄さんはこれ以上おれたちがごちゃごちゃ言わなくても、やるべきことはやってくれるさ。おれたちは自分の仕事をするだけだ。なあそうだろ？」","en":"“Ms. <tips=49>Miyoshi</tips>, all you need to tell your superiors is that ‘<tips=7>YS</tips> has begun to move.’ Don’t worry. Even if we stop pestering this young fellow, he’ll do what needs doing. We just have to do our own work. Isn’t that right?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"路地邦昭","displayName":"Kuniaki Roji","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A7:r176","rowIndex":176,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=50>路地</tips>の問いに、僕は肩をすくめて見せる。","en":"I answer <tips=50>Roji’s</tips> question with a shrug.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A7:r177","rowIndex":177,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>の<tips=81>龍頭</tips>は誰の指示も受けない。あんたの親父さんでも、きっと今みたいな返事をしただろうな。あんたはそれでいいのさ。……あんたはわかってるはずだ、今この街で主役になれるのは自分しかいないって。何しろ最大の暴力を持っているのはあんたなんだ。警察はもっと力があるが腰が重くて動けないし、おれにいたっては蚤かシラミのようなもんさ。ま、蚤には蚤の人生がある。誇りをもっているがね」","en":"“The <tips=81>Longtou</tips> of <tips=7>YS</tips> takes orders from no one. I imagine your father would have answered just as you did. That’s as it should be. ...You already understand that you are the only man who can take the leading role in this city now. After all, you possess the greatest capacity for violence. The police are more powerful, but too ponderous to move. As for me, I’m no more than a flea or a louse. Still, even a flea has a life of its own—and takes pride in it.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"路地邦昭","displayName":"Kuniaki Roji","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A7:r178","rowIndex":178,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=50>路地</tips>はそう言っておかしそうに身体を揺する。","en":"<tips=50>Roji</tips> rocks with amusement as he speaks.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A7:r179","rowIndex":179,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その目の色がおかしいことに、そのときはじめて気がついた。これは、金色の目を隠すカラーコンタクトの色だ。そう言えば、身体の動きなども、普通とちょっと違う。これは常人より優れた身体能力をもつ<tips=17>タイプB</tips>ならではのキビキビとした動きだ。","en":"Only then do I notice something odd about the color of his eyes. Those must be colored contacts concealing golden eyes. Now that I consider it, his physical movements are also slightly unlike those of an ordinary person. They have the brisk precision unique to a <tips=17>Type B</tips> whose physical abilities exceed a Normal's.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A7:r180","rowIndex":180,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=95>金眼</tips>になっているのに、興奮しているわけでもなく、症状が出ているわけでもない。<tips=10>道夫</tips>のように自分でスイッチを入れている状態ともまた違う。普段からこの状態なんだ。――おそらく、特殊化した<tips=17>タイプB</tips>だな。そうでなければ辻褄があわない。","en":"He has <tips=95>golden eyes</tips>, yet he is not excited and shows no symptoms. This is different again from <tips=10>Michio's</tips> state when he switches himself on. He is like this all the time. —He is probably a specialized <tips=17>Type B</tips>. Nothing else would make sense.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A7:r181","rowIndex":181,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ああ、彼も誰かの血をもらって変化したんだな。<tips=31>エリー</tips>は隠していたのか、知らなかったのか――多分隠したのだろう。まったく、随分不死身の連中が次から次へと現れるもんだ。","en":"Ah, so someone gave him blood and changed him too. Did <tips=31>Ellie</tips> conceal it, or did she not know? —She probably concealed it. Good grief. Immortal people certainly do keep turning up one after another.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A7:r182","rowIndex":182,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それにしても僕の観察力は前よりすこし鋭くなったのかもしれない。前は、こんなにはっきりとカラーコンタクトを見破ることが出来なかったのに。最近のは、とてもよく出来ていてわかりにくいはずなんだ。","en":"Perhaps my powers of observation have grown a little sharper than they were. In the past, I could never have spotted colored contacts this clearly. Modern ones are so well made that they should be difficult to detect.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A7:r183","rowIndex":183,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そんなことを考えながら、僕は喋る<tips=50>路地</tips>を見ていた。","en":"I watch <tips=50>Roji</tips> talk as I consider these things.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A7:r184","rowIndex":184,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼を不死身にしたのは誰か。<tips=31>エリー・ホワイト</tips>か？　その可能性もなくはない。<tips=31>エリー</tips>自身も人から血を与えられて特殊化しているから、<tips=72>傾向値</tips>はそこまでではないはずだが、可能性がゼロというわけじゃない。他に考えられるのは、<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>――まあそれはないだろう。それか、<tips=55>松子</tips>。あるいは、僕の全く知らない人間か。そうなると、他にも不死の人間がいるということになるが。――そもそも、いつ特殊化したのかもわからない。ずっと昔かもしれない。","en":"Who made him immortal? <tips=31>Ellie White</tips>? It is not impossible. <tips=31>Ellie</tips> herself was given blood by someone and became specialized, so her <tips=72>tendency value</tips> should not be particularly high; still, the possibility is not zero. Another possibility is <tips=20>Koschei</tips>—though that seems unlikely. Or <tips=55>Matsuko</tips>. Or someone entirely unknown to me. In that case, there would be other immortal people as well. —For that matter, I do not even know when he became specialized. It might have been long ago.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A7:r185","rowIndex":185,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=50>路地</tips>さん」","en":"“Mr. <tips=50>Roji</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A7:r186","rowIndex":186,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕は彼の話を遮って、","en":"I cut him off.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A7:r187","rowIndex":187,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あんた、誰の血を飲んだ？」","en":"“Whose blood did you drink?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A7:r188","rowIndex":188,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　と言った。","en":"I asked.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A7:r189","rowIndex":189,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=50>路地</tips>は目を細め、","en":"<tips=50>Roji</tips> narrows his eyes.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A7:r190","rowIndex":190,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「突然何のことやら」","en":"“Now where did that come from?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"路地邦昭","displayName":"Kuniaki Roji","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A7:r191","rowIndex":191,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　と、不敵に笑った。","en":"He smiles defiantly.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A7:r192","rowIndex":192,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ま、いいでしょう」","en":"“Well, never mind.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A7:r193","rowIndex":193,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕はそれ以上追及しなかった。どうせ聞いてもシラを切るだけだろうし、調べればわかることだ。","en":"I pressed him no further. He would only feign ignorance no matter what I asked, and I could find out by investigating.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A7:r194","rowIndex":194,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「じゃ、続けさせてもらいますよ」","en":"“Then let me continue.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A7:r195","rowIndex":195,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それから<tips=50>路地</tips>は今後の事務的な話などをして、それが終わると帰ってゆく。","en":"<tips=50>Roji</tips> then goes over the administrative details of what comes next and leaves when he is finished.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:A7:r196","rowIndex":196,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕は静かになった執務室で冷たくなったコーヒーを一気に飲み干し、すぐに<tips=30>レイレイ</tips>に新しいものを作ってもらって、熱いそれを、今度は時間をかけてゆっくりと飲んだ。","en":"In the quiet office, I drained my cold coffee in a single gulp. I immediately had <tips=30>Leilei</tips> brew another cup, and this time I drank it hot, slowly and at leisure.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}}]},{"position":51,"code":"C4","unitId":"C4","rows":[{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r1","rowIndex":1,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　当直を終えたあと、<tips=59>暗闇通り</tips>の朝から営業している居酒屋で少し酒を飲んでから、家に帰った。","en":"After finishing my night shift, I stopped for a drink at one of the bars on <tips=59>Darkness Street</tips> that open in the morning, then went home.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r2","rowIndex":2,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　身体はあまり疲れていない。","en":"Physically, I am not especially tired.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r3","rowIndex":3,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　C棟の若い患者が不穏で、病棟に呼び出されたが大したことはなく、薬を与えて少し話を聞けば収まった。他には一時診察の依頼もなく、緊急入院もなく、いたって平和な夜だった。","en":"A young patient in Building C became agitated, and I was called to the ward, but it proved nothing serious. A dose of medication and a little time spent listening were enough to settle the patient. There were no other calls for an unscheduled examination, no emergency admissions—an entirely peaceful night, all told.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r4","rowIndex":4,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　夜に薬をたっぷり盛るこの病院では、このように何も起こらない夜も多く、当直室で寝てしまう医師もいるようだったが、私は眠らない。厳格に規則を守っているというわけではなく、単に寝ようと思っても眠れないだけだ。昔から病院では寝付きが悪くなる性質だった。","en":"At this hospital, where patients are liberally dosed with medication at night, uneventful nights like this are common. Some doctors apparently sleep in the duty room, but I never do. This is not because I observe the rules with any particular rigor. I simply cannot sleep there, however I try. I have always found it difficult to fall asleep in a hospital.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r5","rowIndex":5,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　若い頃にいた病院の当直医はもっと忙しく、まともに休憩する暇もないほどで、むしろ時間があるならば積極的に仮眠をとることが推奨されていたが、私はそれでも眠らなかった。何かあったとき、寝起きの頭で患者に当たることを気にしてしまうのだ。","en":"At the hospital where I worked in my younger days, the doctor on call was far busier, often without time for a proper break. We were actively encouraged to nap whenever the opportunity arose. Even then, I never did. I could not stop worrying that an emergency might leave me treating a patient while my mind was still fogged with sleep.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r6","rowIndex":6,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　この<tips=6>巻河原病院</tips>では緊急性が求められる状況は少ない。仮にあったとして、その結果患者が死亡したとしても、責任を問われることはまれだ。","en":"At <tips=6>Makigawara Hospital</tips>, situations demanding an urgent response are rare. Even if one did arise and a patient died as a result, it would be unusual for anyone to be held responsible.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r7","rowIndex":7,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　患者は症状のせいで家族に迷惑をかけているのが普通で、犯罪者も多い。社会から追い出されて、この病院にやって来た人々なのだ。その生活や医療の費用は家族が支払うか、それが出来なければ税金でまかなわれており、言い方は悪いが周囲に死を望まれている患者も少なくない。","en":"Patients typically cause trouble for their families because of their symptoms, and many are criminals. They are people who have been cast out of society and ended up at this hospital. Their living and medical expenses are paid by their families, or, if their families cannot afford them, by taxes. It is an ugly thing to say, but more than a few are patients whom those around them would rather see dead.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r8","rowIndex":8,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そういった事情から、彼らの生命を軽く見ている医師が存在するのもまた事実だ。","en":"Given those circumstances, it is also true that some doctors regard these patients’ lives lightly.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r9","rowIndex":9,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しかしそれでも私は眠る気にはなれない。その夜は当直室のパソコンで新しい論文に目を通したり、今月から処方できるようになった新薬のデータなどを眺めながら時間を過ごした。","en":"Even so, I cannot bring myself to sleep. That night I passed the time at the duty-room computer, reading the latest papers and examining data on a new drug approved for prescription as of that month.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r10","rowIndex":10,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=17>タイプB</tips>の治療技術の発展は現在完全に停滞していて、発表される論文はどこかで見たような退屈なものか、およそありえない空想的なものばかり。","en":"Progress in the treatment of <tips=17>Type B</tips> has now ground to a complete halt. Every paper published is either some tedious reworking of material I have seen before or a flight of fancy with no plausible basis in reality.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r11","rowIndex":11,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　毎年のように新薬が生まれるが、それらは製薬会社の大げさなセールストークで喧伝されるほど、過去の薬との違いはない。","en":"New drugs appear almost every year, but for all the grandiose sales talk with which the pharmaceutical companies promote them, they differ little from older medications.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r12","rowIndex":12,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　有用な情報は何もなかった。","en":"There was no useful information at all.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r13","rowIndex":13,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　これでは時間を無駄に浪費してしまったようなもので、身体的にはさほどの疲れはないものの、精神的には消耗させられた。","en":"I had done little more than squander my time. I was not especially tired in body, but mentally I felt depleted.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r14","rowIndex":14,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　こういうときは、往々にしておかしな夢を見るものだ。","en":"At times like these, strange dreams have a way of coming.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r15","rowIndex":15,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「よう」","en":"“Hey.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー（過去・青年）","displayName":"Chris Tse (Past, Young)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r16","rowIndex":16,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　声をかけられて目を覚ますと、閉めたはずの遮光カーテンを開けて、光のなかに誰かが立っている。私は目を細めてそれを見た。","en":"I wake at the greeting to find someone standing in the light, having opened the blackout curtains I was certain I had closed. I narrow my eyes and look.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r17","rowIndex":17,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「随分お疲れのようじゃないか。ドクター」","en":"“You look worn out, Doctor.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー（過去・青年）","displayName":"Chris Tse (Past, Young)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r18","rowIndex":18,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そこで笑っているのは、<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>だった。ただし、最後に<tips=41>グランドタワー</tips>で見た病でボロボロになったあの姿ではない。初めて<tips=18>ローズ・クラブ</tips>で出会った頃の、まだ青年の姿をした<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>である。","en":"The man smiling there is <tips=3>Chris Tse</tips>. Not the figure I last saw at <tips=41>Grand Tower</tips>, his body ruined by illness, but <tips=3>Chris Tse</tips> as a young man, just as he was when we first met at the <tips=18>Rose Club</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r19","rowIndex":19,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼はあの頃よく着ていた裾のすり切れたブラウンのジャケットを肩に引っかけ、履き古したデニムのズボンを穿き、革で出来たマウンテンブーツを履いていた。","en":"Slung over his shoulders is the brown jacket with the frayed hem that he so often wore in those days. He has on a well-worn pair of jeans and leather hiking boots.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r20","rowIndex":20,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　顔は少し青白く、口元には薄い笑みが浮かび、そして額の第三の目が私を見つめている。","en":"His face is a little pale, a faint smile plays at the corners of his mouth, and the third eye on his forehead stares into me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r21","rowIndex":21,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「朝から晩まで人のために働き過ぎなんだよ。少し自分のために養生した方が良い。もう若くはないんだぜ。無理をすれば寿命を縮める。おれが言うんだから間違いない」","en":"“You work for other people from morning till night. Try taking care of yourself for a change. You’re not young anymore. Push yourself too hard and you’ll shorten your life. Take it from me.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー（過去・青年）","displayName":"Chris Tse (Past, Young)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r22","rowIndex":22,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　返事をしてはいけないのだろうか？　これは夢か幻覚だろう。だとすれば、それに返事をしてまともに相手をしてしまうと、そちらに引きずり込まれてしまいそうだ。――いや、そんな風に身構えてしまうことに何の意味がある？　これが夢でも、幻覚でも、私は自然に振る舞えばいい。実際の所、夢や幻覚に何か答えたところで引きずり込まれるなんてことはありはしないのだし、もし引きずり込まれるのなら、私はとっくに引きずり込まれている。","en":"Perhaps I should not answer. This is probably a dream or a hallucination, and if I respond—if I treat it as real—I feel as though I may be drawn over to the other side. No. What purpose is served by guarding myself in that way? Whether this is dream or hallucination, I need only behave naturally. Answering one cannot truly draw me in, and if I can be drawn in at all, then surely I have been already.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r23","rowIndex":23,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=3>クリス</tips>、なぜきみは今ここにいるんですか？　きみは死んだ筈じゃないですか。私は自分の幻想じゃないかと疑っているんですがね」","en":"“<tips=3>Chris</tips>, why are you here? You are supposed to be dead. I rather suspect you are a fantasy of my own.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r24","rowIndex":24,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は目の前の男にそう語りかけた。","en":"I address the man standing before me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r25","rowIndex":25,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そんなこと言われたって困るね。……あんたは、自身が誰かの幻想ではないって確信があるかい？　そんなもの、どうやって確かめればいいんだ？」","en":"“Don’t ask me. ...Are you certain you’re not somebody else’s fantasy? How could you ever find out?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー（過去・青年）","displayName":"Chris Tse (Past, Young)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r26","rowIndex":26,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=3>クリス</tips>は苦笑し、私は肩をすくめる。まったく、彼の言う通りだ。","en":"<tips=3>Chris</tips> smiles wryly, and I shrug. He is entirely right.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r27","rowIndex":27,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その目を見ても、私の能力は働かず、彼のイメージは何ひとつ私の心には入ってこなかった。","en":"Even when I look into his eye, my ability does not function. Not a single image of his flows into my mind.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r28","rowIndex":28,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ナンセンスな質問だよ。おれはあんたの幻想かもしれないし、そうでないかもしれない。もしかしたら、本当に幽霊かもしれないよ。この世の中ってやつは、サイキックみたいなとんでもないものが存在するってことを考えれば、幽霊くらい、あながちあり得ない話じゃない。しかも、この街は<tips=8>グレートホール</tips>の隣にあるんだ。<tips=8>グレートホール</tips>は人の魂を呼び寄せるという。呼び寄せられた魂が幽霊になって歩き回ったって、不思議なことじゃない」","en":"“It’s a nonsensical question. Maybe I’m your fantasy, and maybe I’m not. I might even be a real ghost. When you consider that this world contains things as outrageous as psychics, ghosts aren’t so implausible. And this city stands beside the <tips=8>Great Hole</tips>. They say the <tips=8>Great Hole</tips> draws in human souls. It would hardly be strange if those souls became ghosts and wandered the streets.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー（過去・青年）","displayName":"Chris Tse (Past, Young)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r29","rowIndex":29,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　若い頃と同じ、人を煙にまくような話し方をする。","en":"He speaks just as he did when he was young, spinning words that leave the listener lost in smoke.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r30","rowIndex":30,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そう渋い顔をするなよ。あんたは状況をもっと素直に受け入れるべきだ。なんたって、あんたは毎日狂った頭を覗き、昔に死んだ女の面影ばかり探している。もう半分こちらの世界に足を踏み込んでいるようなものだよ」","en":"“Don’t look so sour. You ought to accept the situation more honestly. You spend every day peering into deranged minds and searching for traces of a woman who died years ago. You might as well have one foot in this world already.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー（過去・青年）","displayName":"Chris Tse (Past, Young)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r31","rowIndex":31,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は呆れて溜息をつく。","en":"I sigh in exasperation.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r32","rowIndex":32,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「嘘じゃない。おれの目には、あんたの顔は青ざめて半分腐って、ゾンビになっちまってるように見えるぜ。鏡を持って来てやろうか？　こぼれ落ちて神経でぶら下がった眼球が揺れてるのが見えるはずだ」","en":"“I’m not lying. To me, your face looks pale and half-rotten. You’ve turned into a zombie. Shall I fetch you a mirror? You’ll see your eyeball swinging where it fell out, dangling by the nerve.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー（過去・青年）","displayName":"Chris Tse (Past, Young)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r33","rowIndex":33,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「医者の不養生と言うけれど、私も知らないうちに疲れていたのでしょうね。こんな馬鹿げたものが見えるだなんて……」","en":"“They do say doctors are the worst at looking after themselves. I suppose I must have exhausted myself without noticing. To think I should begin seeing something so absurd...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r34","rowIndex":34,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「おれをただの幻覚として片付けたいならそれでもいいさ。でもあんたにそれは出来ないね。現実を捨てて、心の世界に逃げ込んだあんたには、たとえおれが幻だとしても否定することは出来ない。それもまた、今のドクターにとっては現実だからさ。あんたが<tips=52>ミアオ</tips>を目の前に蘇らせようとしているのは、つまりこういうことなんだぜ？」","en":"“If you want to dismiss me as a mere hallucination, be my guest. But you cannot do it. You abandoned reality and fled into the world of the mind. Even if I am an illusion, you have no power to deny me, because to the man you are now, Doctor, I too am reality. This is what it means to try to resurrect <tips=52>Miao</tips> before your very eyes.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー（過去・青年）","displayName":"Chris Tse (Past, Young)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r35","rowIndex":35,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……<tips=3>クリス</tips>、きみは私のところに来てそんな世迷い言を言う理由はないはずだ。仕事をやりきって満足して死んだはずじゃないか」","en":"“...<tips=3>Chris</tips>, you have no reason to come to me and spout such nonsense. You finished what you set out to do and died content, did you not?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r36","rowIndex":36,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ドクター、おれはあなたを助けに来たんだよ。あんたにはまだこの現実の世界でやることがある。夢と幻の世界なんか、死んでからいくらでも楽しめばいい。おれはもう死んだが、あんたにはまだ身体と魂がある。それを使わないなんて、贅沢な話だぜ……」","en":"“Doctor, I came to help you. You’ve still got things to do in the real world. You can enjoy dreams and illusions as much as you like once you’re dead. I’m dead already, but you still have a body and a soul. Letting them go unused would be a terrible waste...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー（過去・青年）","displayName":"Chris Tse (Past, Young)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r37","rowIndex":37,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼の言葉はどうということのないありふれた批判のはずだが、なぜか鋭く私の胸をえぐった。私は全身に冷や汗を掻き、ガタガタと歯の根が合わぬほど震える。この過剰な精神の反応も、夢の世界ならではだろう。","en":"His words ought to be nothing more than a commonplace rebuke, yet for some reason they cut deep into my heart. Cold sweat breaks out all over my body, and I shake so violently that my teeth chatter. This excessive reaction of the mind, too, must be peculiar to the world of dreams.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r38","rowIndex":38,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=3>クリス</tips>。そうじゃない！　私は……」","en":"“<tips=3>Chris</tips>, that isn’t it! I...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r39","rowIndex":39,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ドクター、もう一度蘇るんだ。あんたにはまだ、輝く魂があるじゃないか。それを腐らせておくなんて、罪だぜ」","en":"“Doctor, come back to life once more. You still have a shining soul. Leaving it to rot would be a sin.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"クリス・ツェー（過去・青年）","displayName":"Chris Tse (Past, Young)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r40","rowIndex":40,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　だんだん視界全体が暗くなり、それと共に彼の声が遠くなる。","en":"My entire field of vision gradually darkens, and with it, his voice grows distant.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r41","rowIndex":41,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「今まであんたが見て来た人間は、みんなここにいる。だからドクター、あんたは、何も寂しくなんかないんだ……」","en":"“Every person you have seen in your life is here. So you see, Doctor, you are not alone at all...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r42","rowIndex":42,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　全てが闇に包まれ、音が消える間際、ほとんど聞き取れないくらい小さな声で彼の声がこう囁いた。","en":"As everything is swallowed by darkness and sound itself dies away, his voice whispers one last thing, so softly that I can scarcely make it out.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r43","rowIndex":43,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「気楽に行こうぜ、どうせおれたちは黒い羊だ。誰に導かれることもなく、群れることもなく、罰を与えられることもない……」","en":"“Let’s take it easy. We are black sheep, after all. No one to guide us, no flock to gather in, no punishment to be handed down...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r44","rowIndex":44,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして全ての感覚が遮断された。","en":"Then all my senses are cut off.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r45","rowIndex":45,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は電話の着信音で目を覚ます。","en":"The ringing of my phone wakes me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r46","rowIndex":46,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　全身にぐっしょりと汗を掻いている。時計は十八時半を過ぎており、もう日が落ちていた。夢だったか、と溜息をつくと、おかしなことに気がついた。遮光カーテンが開き、その外側の白いレースのカーテンが風に揺れているのである。そして雨の音が聞こえる。どうして開いているのだろう？　私は、必ずカーテンを閉めてから寝るはずなのに。そして間違っても窓など開けるはずがないのに。","en":"My whole body is drenched in sweat. The clock reads past six-thirty in the evening, and the sun has already set. I sigh at the thought that it was only a dream—then notice something strange. The blackout curtains stand open, and beyond them the white lace curtains stir in the wind. I can hear rain. Why are the curtains open? I never go to sleep without closing them. And there is no possibility that I left the window open by mistake.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r47","rowIndex":47,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　不可解な気持ちのまま、枕元の携帯電話に手を伸ばした。","en":"Still baffled, I reach for the phone beside my pillow.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r48","rowIndex":48,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それは見知らぬ番号で、出るとキビキビとした男の声で自分が警察官であると名乗った。そしてその警官は、私が勤務する<tips=6>国立巻河原病院</tips>に武装集団による襲撃があったことを伝えた。","en":"I do not recognize the number. When I answer, a brisk male voice identifies himself as a police officer. He informs me that an armed group has attacked <tips=6>National Makigawara Hospital</tips>, where I work.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r49","rowIndex":49,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　B棟の三階ホールにはその日出勤していた職員たちが射殺体となって並べられている。まるで魚河岸でセリを待つ冷凍マグロのように。","en":"The staff who were on duty that day lie in rows across the third-floor hall of Building B, every one of them shot dead. Like frozen tuna waiting to be auctioned at the wholesale fish market.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r50","rowIndex":50,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　病院を襲撃したテロリストたちは各建物に分散して行動を行った。他の建物では人質にされて彼らの手伝いをさせられたりしたものの、ほとんど死傷者はいない。だが、このB棟はそうはいかなかったようだ。","en":"The terrorists who attacked the hospital divided their forces among the different buildings. In the others, staff were taken hostage and forced to assist them, but there were almost no casualties. Building B, however, appears to have been another matter.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r51","rowIndex":51,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　建物全体の職員がこの場所に一挙に集められ、射殺されたのだという。","en":"I am told that every employee in the building was assembled here at once and shot.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r52","rowIndex":52,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　職員の生き残りは存在しない。警察が足を踏み入れたときは、彼らの遺体は端の方に山となって積み上げられていたらしいが、今は現場検証が進んだので、職員の身元の割り出しのためにこうして規則正しく整列されている。","en":"Not a single member of staff survived. When the police first entered, the bodies had apparently been heaped against one side of the hall. Now, as the crime-scene examination proceeds, they have been laid out in orderly rows so that each member of staff can be identified.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r53","rowIndex":53,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「これは<tips=92>水村舞子</tips>……看護師ですね。こちらは<tips=93>林田雄一</tips>、看護助手です」","en":"“This is <tips=92>Maiko Mizumura</tips>... A nurse. And this is <tips=93>Yuichi Hayashida</tips>, a nursing assistant.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r54","rowIndex":54,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私が遺体の顔を見て名前を言うと、警察官はそれをメモ帳に書いて破り、テープで胸の辺りに貼りつけてゆく。","en":"As I look into each dead face and give a name, the police officer writes it in his notebook, tears out the page, and tapes it across the corpse’s chest.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r55","rowIndex":55,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　病院へ駆けつけた私は、警察からの事情聴取が終わったあと、どうしても現場をこの目で見たいと申し出た。そうしたら、この身元確認作業の手伝いをさせられることになった。","en":"Once the police finished questioning me after I rushed to the hospital, I insisted that I had to see the scene with my own eyes. They responded by putting me to work identifying the bodies.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r56","rowIndex":56,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　襲撃時に生き残りの職員たちは現在警察署や病院に運ばれて詳しい事情聴取や治療を受けているし、死んだ職員の多くは名札をつけていない。","en":"The staff who survived the attack have been taken to the police station or a hospital for detailed questioning or treatment. Most of the dead were not wearing their name badges.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r57","rowIndex":57,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　名前を確認出来るものがなく、警察官も困っていたらしい。","en":"With nothing on the bodies to establish their names, the police had apparently been at a loss.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r58","rowIndex":58,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「名前がすらすらと出て来て、素晴らしいですね。医者の先生というのは、スタッフ全員の名前を覚えているものなんですか？」","en":"“Remarkable—you produce every name without a moment’s hesitation. Do doctors generally remember the names of everyone on staff?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r59","rowIndex":59,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「さあ、どうでしょうね」","en":"“Who can say?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r60","rowIndex":60,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そう答えたが、実際にはフルネームで覚えているのは私くらいのものだろう。","en":"That is my answer, but in truth, I am probably the only one who remembers their full names.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r61","rowIndex":61,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　年配の医師などは、主任クラスの看護師でさえも『きみ』とか『おい』などと呼び、名字さえ記憶していない様子なのをよく目にする。","en":"I often see older doctors address even senior nurses with nothing more than “you there” or “hey,” plainly unable to remember so much as their surnames.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r62","rowIndex":62,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それに、さすがに落ち着いていらっしゃる。普通の人なら、こんな場面では取り乱してしまいますよ」","en":"“And you are impressively composed. Most people would be beside themselves in a place like this.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r63","rowIndex":63,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その言葉には私は何も応えなかった。","en":"I make no reply.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r64","rowIndex":64,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　確かに落ち着いているように見えるかもしれない。私はさほど表情に動揺などが出るタイプではない。それに、私はこのような場面を目の当たりにするのは初めてではない。","en":"Perhaps I do look composed. I am not the sort whose agitation readily shows upon his face. Nor is this the first time I have witnessed such a scene.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r65","rowIndex":65,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しかし、だからといって内心ではそれほど冷静なわけではない。そんな筈があるわけがない。","en":"But that does not mean I am remotely calm inside. How could I be?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r66","rowIndex":66,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　人質の証言によると、襲撃したものたちは『<tips=47>八龍解放軍</tips>』と名乗ったそうだ。名前からして『<tips=21>八龍会</tips>』に所属する組織なのは間違いないだろう。その名は私も知っている。かつて<tips=3>クリス</tips>と共にそのアジトを訪れたこともある。","en":"According to the hostages’ testimony, the attackers called themselves the <tips=47>Hachiryu Liberation Army</tips>. Their name makes it all but certain that they belong to the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips>. I know the name. I once visited their hideout with <tips=3>Chris</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r67","rowIndex":67,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　街の様々な場所で暮らす<tips=17>タイプB</tips>たちを結びつける秘密結社――私が知っている彼らは、あくまでも影の組織であって、表立った行動は避けていたはずだ。それが、武装してこのような事件を起こすとは。","en":"A secret society linking <tips=17>Type Bs</tips> scattered throughout the city—that was the organization I knew. They operated strictly in the shadows and avoided any action that would bring them into the open. And now they have taken up arms and committed an attack like this...","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r68","rowIndex":68,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=47>解放軍</tips>は患者に『<tips=46>ネオ・ローズ</tips>』を投与し、症状を取り除いて彼らを連れ去ったらしい。館内放送で<tips=17>タイプB</tips>を解放すると宣言したそうだ。B棟にいた職員全部と、C棟の六人、管理棟では事務員が一人と院長が射殺されていた。さらに、建物の近辺では四人の警備員と、面会に来ていた患者の両親がバラバラ遺体となり雨ざらしとなっていたのを発見されている。","en":"Apparently, the <tips=47>Liberation Army</tips> administered <tips=46>Neo Rose</tips> to the patients, freed them of their symptoms, and took them away. Over the hospital’s public-address system, they reportedly declared that they were liberating the <tips=17>Type Bs</tips>. They shot every member of staff in Building B, six in Building C, and an office worker and the director in the administration building. Near the buildings, four security guards and the parents of a visiting patient were found dismembered, their remains left exposed to the rain.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r69","rowIndex":69,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「これは、<tips=83>能見美紗</tips>。看護師です」","en":"“This is <tips=83>Misa Nomi</tips>. A nurse.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r70","rowIndex":70,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　この若い看護師のことを、私はよく覚えている。","en":"I remember this young nurse well.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r71","rowIndex":71,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　仕事熱心で、いつも患者のことを考えていた。私の深夜回診につき合って共に児童養護施設に行ったこともある。","en":"She was devoted to her work and always thinking of the patients. She once accompanied me on late-night rounds and came with me to the children’s home.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r72","rowIndex":72,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　事切れた彼女の目は見開いたままになっていた。それを見ても、かつてのように彼女の情熱あふれるイメージは私の心に流れ込んで来ない。もうその目の奥にはいかなる精神も宿ってはいないのだ。","en":"Her eyes remain wide open in death. Yet when I look into them, none of the passionate images that once poured from her enter my mind. No trace of any consciousness remains behind those eyes.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r73","rowIndex":73,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は手を伸ばしてそのまぶたを閉ざす。","en":"I reach out and close her eyelids.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r74","rowIndex":74,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　一通り確認作業を終えると、それから警察の車両が来て暗いなか遺体の搬出作業が始まった。私はそれにはつき合わず、一旦自分のマンションへと戻った。","en":"Once we finish the initial round of identifications, police transport vehicles arrive and the work of removing the bodies begins in the dark. I do not stay for that. Instead, I return to my apartment for the time being.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r75","rowIndex":75,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　寝室にあるクローゼットの上の棚の奥に、段ボール箱がひとつある。私は杖を置き、踏み台を使ってそれを取り出す。","en":"At the back of the upper shelf in my bedroom closet is a cardboard box. I set down my cane and use a step stool to take it out.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r76","rowIndex":76,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　埃まみれになっており、思わず咳込んでしまうがなんとか箱を取り落とさぬようしっかりとつかみ、床におろした。","en":"It is covered in dust, and I cannot help coughing, but I keep a firm grip upon the box and manage to lower it to the floor.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r77","rowIndex":77,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そしてカッターナイフを取り出して、梱包のガムテープに切れ目を入れる。","en":"Then I take out a utility knife and make a cut in the packing tape.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r78","rowIndex":78,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　切れ目が入ると、中から饐えたようなにおいがした。十五年前の私の汗が腐敗したのだろうか、それとも気のせいだろうか。","en":"The moment I break the seal, a sour, stale odor issues from within. Could it be my sweat from fifteen years ago, gone rancid? Or is it only my imagination?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r79","rowIndex":79,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　中には嘴のようなものがついた黒いマスクと、油紙の包みが入っている。","en":"Inside are a black mask fitted with something resembling a beak and a package wrapped in oiled paper.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r80","rowIndex":80,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は手を差し入れて、慎重にマスクを取り出す。固定するゴム紐は経年劣化でボロボロと崩れ落ちたが、マスク本体に目立った劣化は見られなかった。","en":"I reach inside and carefully lift out the mask. The elastic straps crumble away with age, but the mask itself shows no visible sign of deterioration.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r81","rowIndex":81,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　次にずっしりと重い油紙を取り出し、それを解く。黒光りする拳銃が姿を現す。電灯の光に当ててみても錆は浮いていないようだが、引き金を引いてこれがまともに機能して無事銃弾が発射されるかどうかは、まあ運試しのようなものだろう。","en":"Next I lift out the heavy oiled-paper parcel and unwrap it. A black handgun gleams beneath the paper. Held up to the electric light, it appears free of rust, but whether it will function properly and fire when I pull the trigger is, I suppose, a matter of luck.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r82","rowIndex":82,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私はそれを一旦絨毯の上に置き、さらにクローゼットの奥から、黒いコートを取り出す。","en":"I set it down on the carpet for the moment, then reach farther into the closet and draw out a black coat.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r83","rowIndex":83,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　クリーニング屋のビニールを引きちぎるようにして破り、それを身体に纏った。これを着るのも十五年ぶりだが、前のボタンをしめるとほんの少し腹が窮屈になるだけで、ほとんど身につけた感じはかわらない。","en":"I tear away the cleaner’s plastic and put it on. It has been fifteen years since I last wore it, but when I fasten the buttons, it feels almost exactly as it did then. It is only slightly tight around my stomach.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r84","rowIndex":84,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そのコートの内側には拳銃を取り付けることが出来る輪っかがある。私はそれに拳銃をしまい、マスクのゴム紐を新しいものに取り替えてから、再び杖を手に取って外に出た。","en":"A loop sewn inside the coat serves to secure the handgun. I slip the weapon into it, replace the mask’s decayed elastic with a new strap, take up my cane again, and go outside.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r85","rowIndex":85,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　外はまだ雨が降っている。私は傘を差さないまま、帽子のつばで顔を隠すようにしてマンションを離れると、暗がりでマスクを装着した。そして夜の街を歩きはじめる。","en":"The rain is still falling outside. Without opening an umbrella, I leave the apartment with my face hidden beneath the brim of my hat, don the mask in the darkness, and begin walking through the city at night.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r86","rowIndex":86,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　賢明な行動とは言えないのかもしれない。そんなことは百も承知だ。しかし私は自分の感情を押し殺すことが出来なかった。","en":"Perhaps this is not a wise course of action. I am perfectly aware of that. But I cannot suppress what I feel.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r87","rowIndex":87,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　血が逆流しそうなほどの憤りであり、そのあたりの壁を素手で殴りつけたくなる衝動を抑えるのが精一杯だった。こんな激情がまだ自分の心に残っているとは。思いのほかに、病院のスタッフたちに対して愛着がわいていたのだろうか。殺すことはなかった。襲撃者たちは患者たちに怪しげな薬を投与して解放するというやりかたを正義だと信じて行ったのだろうが、医師である私からすれば患者のためにさえなっていない。そんな独善的な正義のために、愛情あるスタッフたちは殺されたのだ。","en":"I am so incensed that I feel as though my blood might reverse its course. It takes all my strength to resist punching the nearest wall with my bare fist. To think such violent passion still remained in me. Had I grown more attached to the hospital staff than I realized? There was no need to kill them. The attackers must have believed that administering some dubious drug to the patients and setting them free was an act of justice. From my perspective as a doctor, however, it did not even benefit the patients. Caring members of staff were murdered for the sake of that self-righteous justice.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r88","rowIndex":88,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私が病院で患者たちと向かい合うのをサポートしてくれたのは彼らだった。","en":"They were the ones who supported me in my work with the hospital’s patients.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r89","rowIndex":89,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　時に私は過酷な要求をすることもあったがそれにこたえてくれた。私の患者に対する偏執的な感情を理解し、受け入れてくれたのだ。それをあんな風に一カ所に集めて銃弾を浴びせかけるなど、とても許せるものではない。遺体にあいた弾痕を見ている間、その無惨な光景が脳裏に浮かんで仕方がなかった。","en":"At times I made punishing demands of them, and they met those demands. They understood and accepted the obsession I brought to the care of my patients. To herd them all into one place and shower them with bullets is beyond forgiveness. As I examined the bullet holes in their bodies, I could not stop picturing the scene of their slaughter.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r90","rowIndex":90,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　激情が身体を支配している。先日、復讐心に燃える<tips=50>路地邦昭</tips>を偉そうにに窘めたが、私にはその資格がなかったということだろう。","en":"Violent emotion has taken control of my body. The other day, I pompously admonished <tips=50>Kuniaki Roji</tips> for allowing revenge to consume him. It seems I possessed no right to do so.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r91","rowIndex":91,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=21>八龍会</tips>の本部は三人の老人が暮らすありふれた邸宅である。昔、<tips=3>クリス</tips>と共に訪れたその場所を、私は記憶していた。そこに行って何かがどうにかなるという具体的な考えがあったわけではないが、幹部である彼らを問い詰めなければ気が済まなかった。","en":"The headquarters of the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips> is an ordinary house inhabited by three old men. I remember the place from a visit I made there with <tips=3>Chris</tips> long ago. I have no concrete notion that going there will accomplish anything, but I cannot rest until I confront the organization’s leaders and demand an explanation.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r92","rowIndex":92,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼らと<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>の間には協定があったはずだ。","en":"There was supposed to be an agreement between them and <tips=7>YS</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r93","rowIndex":93,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　かつて<tips=21>八龍会</tips>と<tips=3>クリス</tips>の間で、<tips=21>八龍会</tips>の活動はあくまでも裏側で行われるものだから、けして<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>とは競合しないと約束した。","en":"Long ago, the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips> gave <tips=3>Chris</tips> its word that the activities of the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips> would remain strictly behind the scenes and would never bring it into conflict with <tips=7>YS</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r94","rowIndex":94,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　だから彼らはこの街のなかで薬物を販売することを特別に許されていたのだ。","en":"That was why they had been granted special permission to sell drugs in this city.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r95","rowIndex":95,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　降りしきる雨も私の昂ぶる心を冷ましてはくれなかった。<tips=59>暗闇通り</tips>を通り過ぎるとき、傘を差した人間とすれ違う。彼らはずぶ濡れになって早足でゆく黒ずくめの私を振り返った。","en":"Even the driving rain cannot cool my fevered mind. As I pass <tips=59>Darkness Street</tips>, I meet people carrying umbrellas. They turn to look at the black-clad figure hurrying along, drenched to the skin.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r96","rowIndex":96,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして、建物の目の前まで来たときだ。","en":"And then, just as I arrive in front of the building—","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r97","rowIndex":97,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　玄関のドアが開き、一人の男が姿を現した。","en":"The front door opens, and a man appears.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r98","rowIndex":98,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は咄嗟に姿を隠そうとしたが、間に合わず、お互いに顔をつきあわせることとなった。","en":"I reflexively try to hide, but it is too late. We come face-to-face.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r99","rowIndex":99,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　帽子をかぶり、黒いコートを着て、私と似た姿をしている。髪の毛は白く、口元にも白い髭が生い茂っている。つんと突き出た鷲鼻が印象的だ。","en":"In his hat and black coat, he is dressed rather like me. His hair is white, and a thick white beard grows around his mouth. Most striking of all is his sharply projecting aquiline nose.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r100","rowIndex":100,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼は傘を手に持ったままそこに立ち、私の顔をじっと見つめている。私は躊躇なくその目を見つめる。","en":"He stands holding an umbrella and stares into my face. Without hesitation, I stare into his eyes.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r101","rowIndex":101,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼の心は驚きに満ちていた。そう、その人物は私のことを知っているようなのである。黒い帽子とコートに身を包み、仮面をつけた今の私のこの姿を。今から十五年前にほんの僅かの間だけ活動をしたこの姿を。","en":"His mind is filled with surprise. Yes—this man appears to recognize me. Not merely me, but this guise: the black hat and coat, the face concealed behind a mask. The guise in which I operated for only a brief period fifteen years ago.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r102","rowIndex":102,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　当時私の姿を知るものはごく限られていたはずである。そして私は彼の姿に見覚えがない。","en":"Very few people should have known what I looked like then. And I do not recognize him.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r103","rowIndex":103,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼は何者か？","en":"Who is he?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r104","rowIndex":104,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私はコートの胸元に手を突っ込み、銃のグリップを握りしめた。","en":"I thrust a hand inside the breast of my coat and close it around the gun’s grip.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r105","rowIndex":105,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「オマエは……。おお、こんなところで出会うとは……」","en":"“You... Ah, to meet you here, of all places...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エフゲニ・ヘス","displayName":"Yevgeny Hess","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r106","rowIndex":106,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　老人は呻くように言って、そして頭を抱える。視線を外したので、感情のシンクロが途絶えた。","en":"The old man groans the words and clutches his head. When his gaze breaks from mine, our emotional synchronization is severed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r107","rowIndex":107,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　頭を下げた拍子に帽子がズルリと傾いて床に落ち、その毛のない頭頂部があらわになる。","en":"As he lowers his head, his hat slides askew and falls to the ground, exposing a bald crown.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r108","rowIndex":108,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そしてみるみるうちに、その禿げた部分に黒い毛が生え始めたのだ。いや、変化したのはそこだけではない。頭頂部のまわりを囲むように生えていた白い髪も、黒くつややかなものに変化してゆく。","en":"Black hair begins to grow across the bare skin before my eyes. No, that is not the only thing changing. The white hair ringing his crown turns sleek and black as well.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r109","rowIndex":109,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　さらにその体つきも、痩せた枯れ枝のような姿だったものが、やわらかな曲線を持ったものになる。","en":"His physique changes as well. The body that had been gaunt as a withered branch fills out into soft curves.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r110","rowIndex":110,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そしてもう一度顔を上げた時には、老人は全く別の姿になっていた。","en":"By the time he raises his face again, the old man has assumed a wholly different form.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r111","rowIndex":111,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　いや、もはや老人ではない。それはしわがなく潤った柔らかな肌と、紅い唇を持つ若い女であった。さらに人種も変わっている。その女の顔つきは完全にアジア人のものだが、先ほどまではどう見ても白人だったのだ。","en":"No—this is no longer an old man at all, but a young woman with smooth, supple skin untouched by wrinkles and vivid red lips. Even her apparent ethnicity has changed. Her face is now unmistakably East Asian, though only moments ago she looked entirely white.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r112","rowIndex":112,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「お前は『ドクター』だな？」","en":"“You’re ‘the Doctor,’ aren’t you?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r113","rowIndex":113,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ネイティブスピーカーのような違和感のない日本語でその女は言う。","en":"The woman speaks in Japanese so natural that she might be a native speaker.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r114","rowIndex":114,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　こわばったその目をのぞき込んだ時、私に流れ込んできたものは、激しい憎しみであった。","en":"When I peer into her hard, tense eyes, a torrent of violent hatred flows into me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r115","rowIndex":115,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「おい、その姿、お前は『ドクター』だろう？　かつて<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>の一味だった、あいつだろう？　いや、あれから長い時間が経っている。ということは、同じ服装をした別人かな？　いずれにしろ、関わりのある人間にはちがいない」","en":"“Hey, that getup—you’re ‘the Doctor,’ aren’t you? The one who used to run with <tips=3>Chris Tse</tips>, right? No, a long time has passed since then. Perhaps you are someone else dressed the same way. Either way, you must have some connection to him.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r116","rowIndex":116,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「私にそのように反応する、お前こそ何者だ？　なぜその建物から出て来た？」","en":"“Who are you, that the sight of me provokes such a reaction? Why have you come out of that building?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r117","rowIndex":117,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ほう、本人か。まさかこんなところで会えるとはね。……嬉しいよ。この長い間、<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>とお前に対する憎しみを忘れたことはない……」","en":"“Oh, so you are the real thing. Never did I imagine I would meet you here... I am delighted. Not once in all these years have I forgotten my hatred for <tips=3>Chris Tse</tips>—or for you...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r118","rowIndex":118,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そう笑う女の心に、黒雲のように殺意がわき上がる。それは非常に具体的なもので、まさに目の前の私を殺そうというものだった。","en":"As the woman smiles, murderous intent billows through her mind like a black cloud. It is no vague hostility, but something terribly specific: she means to kill me where I stand.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r119","rowIndex":119,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は先手をとって銃を抜き、彼女に向ける。しかし相手も素早く上着の内側から何かを取り出そうとしていた。","en":"I draw first and point my gun at her. But she is already moving quickly to take something from inside her jacket.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r120","rowIndex":120,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　二つの銃声が、ほぼ同時に雨音をつんざく。","en":"Two gunshots tear through the sound of the rain almost simultaneously.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r121","rowIndex":121,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は右腕に激痛を感じ、銃を取り落とした。","en":"Agony erupts in my right arm, and I drop my weapon.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r122","rowIndex":122,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　一方こちらの運試しは成功したらしく、整備もしていない私の拳銃から銃弾はまっすぐ飛んでくれた。しかし、射手の技術のつたなさのせいか、弾丸はどこにもあたらず相手は無傷だった。","en":"My own gamble, meanwhile, appears to have paid off: a bullet flies straight from my unmaintained handgun. Owing perhaps to my poor marksmanship, however, it strikes nothing, and my opponent remains unscathed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r123","rowIndex":123,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「残念ね」","en":"“Too bad.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r124","rowIndex":124,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　相手は笑みを浮かべながらこちらを睨み付ける。その殺意がダイレクトに私の心に伝わって来る。彼女は銃を握った腕を上げる。その時、彼女のギラギラと輝く目から、ある一つのイメージが浮かんできた。","en":"A smile on her lips, my opponent glares at me. Her murderous intent strikes directly into my mind. She raises the arm holding the gun—and at that moment, a single image comes to me through her glittering eyes.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r125","rowIndex":125,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そのイメージに驚いたが、モタモタしている場合ではない。また、拳銃を拾っている猶予もない。私は地面を蹴って横に身をかわし、屋敷の塀に身を隠すように身体を動かす。古傷のある膝が不安だったが、思いのほか乱暴な扱いにも耐えてくれるようだ。","en":"The image astonishes me, but this is no time to stand gawking. There is no chance to retrieve my gun, either. I kick off the ground and throw myself sideways, moving to put the estate wall between us. I fear for my injured knee, but it endures the abuse better than I expected.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r126","rowIndex":126,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　再度相手の手元から発射された銃弾は、何もない空を切る。","en":"Her next bullet cuts through empty air.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r127","rowIndex":127,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私はそのまま屋敷と女に背を向け、暗闇に向かって走り出す。背後から銃声がするが、相手もさほど射撃の心得があるわけではないらしく、当たらない。なんとかその場を逃れることが出来た。","en":"Without stopping, I turn my back on both the house and the woman and run into the darkness. Gunshots crack behind me, but she appears no more skilled a marksman than I am, and none finds its target. Somehow, I escape the scene.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r128","rowIndex":128,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　相手のことが気になったが、このままでは戦えない。追跡を振り切るつもりで角をいくつも曲がって駆けた。傷のある方の膝がガクガクとして、そして運動不足の身体はすぐに息が上がり、胸が苦しく、目の前がふらふらとする。もうこれ以上走れない。","en":"I am curious about my opponent, but I cannot fight in this condition. Intent upon losing any pursuit, I sprint around corner after corner. My injured knee begins to buckle, and my unfit body soon has me gasping for air. My chest aches, the world reels before my eyes, and I can run no farther.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r129","rowIndex":129,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　駆け足から歩きになった。振り切れていなければおしまいだが、何度も後ろを振り向いたが私を追うものはいなかった。夜の闇と、黒い服が手助けしてくれたのだろう。","en":"My run slows to a walk. If I have not shaken her, I am finished, but although I look behind me repeatedly, no one follows. The darkness of night and my black clothing must have helped me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r130","rowIndex":130,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は血の流れる腕を押さえ、荒い呼吸を整えながら、歩き続けた。","en":"Pressing my bleeding arm, I continue walking as I try to bring my ragged breathing under control.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r131","rowIndex":131,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　女が二発目の射撃をするときに浮かんだ具体的なイメージ。それは、どこかあたたかく、おだやかな感情に包まれた一つの場面だった。赤を基調とした高級な内装の部屋で、一人の男性が微笑みを浮かべている。","en":"The concrete image that surfaced as the woman fired her second shot was a single scene suffused with strangely warm and peaceful emotion. In a luxurious room appointed in shades of red, a man is smiling.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r132","rowIndex":132,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その男の顔を私は知っていた。そして、その部屋にも見覚えがある。","en":"I know the man’s face. I recognize the room as well.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r133","rowIndex":133,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　男の名は、<tips=60>ロジャー・アダムス</tips>。あの夜、私と<tips=3>クリス</tips>が殺した<tips=18>ローズ・クラブ</tips>のオーナーだ。そして部屋は、<tips=18>ローズ・クラブ</tips>の一室に違いない。","en":"The man is <tips=60>Roger Adams</tips>, owner of the <tips=18>Rose Club</tips>—the man <tips=3>Chris</tips> and I killed that night. And the room can only be one of the rooms inside the <tips=18>Rose Club</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r134","rowIndex":134,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私はその情報を元に考えた。彼女が一体何者で、そしてその正体がどういう意味を持つのか。そして彼女が見せた『変身』。様々な情報を総合すると、ひとつの事実が浮かびはじめる。","en":"I think through the information before me: who she could be, what that identity would mean, and the ‘transformation’ I witnessed. As I bring the pieces together, a single fact begins to emerge.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r135","rowIndex":135,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　腕がジンジンと痛み思考を邪魔するのを、歯を食いしばってなんとかこらえる。","en":"My arm throbs so sharply that it interferes with my thoughts. I grit my teeth and endure it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r136","rowIndex":136,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そうやって私が足を進め、向かっているのは、やはり十五年ぶりの懐かしい場所だった。","en":"The destination toward which I continue, as it happens, is another place I remember well and have not visited in fifteen years.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r137","rowIndex":137,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　一軒の邸宅である。そこに住んでいるのは、かつて私と<tips=3>クリス</tips>が救い出した少女。今は大人になり、<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>の重要な幹部の一人となっている。","en":"It is a mansion, home to a girl whom <tips=3>Chris</tips> and I once rescued. She is a grown woman now, and one of the key leaders of <tips=7>YS</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r138","rowIndex":138,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　出会ったときは<tips=32>アサヒ</tips>と名乗り、新しい主人には<tips=87>ベルーハ</tips>という名を与えられ、いまは亡き主人の名を継いで<tips=31>エリー・ホワイト</tips>と呼ばれるその人物の家だ。","en":"When we met, she called herself <tips=32>Asahi</tips>. Her new mistress gave her the name <tips=87>Belukha</tips>. Now she has inherited the name of her late mistress and is known as <tips=31>Ellie White</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r139","rowIndex":139,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「マスクをお取りになればいいのに。久しぶりにお会いしたのですから、お顔を拝見させてくださいな」","en":"“You might take off your mask. It has been so long since last we met—please, let me see your face.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エリー・ホワイト","displayName":"Ellie White","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r140","rowIndex":140,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=31>エリー</tips>は微笑みを浮かべながらそう言った。","en":"<tips=31>Ellie</tips> smiles as she speaks.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r141","rowIndex":141,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いや、いいんですこれで。私は今日は十五年前の『ドクター』として貴女を訪ねたのですから」","en":"“No, this is as it should be. I have come to you today as ‘the Doctor’ of fifteen years ago.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r142","rowIndex":142,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　マスクを取れば痛みで脂汗が浮かんだ顔を彼女に見せてしまうだろう。そうすれば、腕の傷を気づかれることになる。私は無用の心配をかけたくもなかったし、騒ぎにもしたくなかった。","en":"If I remove the mask, she will see my face beaded with clammy sweat from the pain, and the wound in my arm will give itself away. I do not wish to cause her needless concern or create a commotion.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r143","rowIndex":143,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「本当に、お飲み物もいらないのですか？」","en":"“Are you certain you will have nothing to drink?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エリー・ホワイト","displayName":"Ellie White","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r144","rowIndex":144,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「結構です」","en":"“Quite certain.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r145","rowIndex":145,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「とても嬉しいですわ。こうして先生と向かい合っていると、まるで子供の頃に戻ったよう。ちょっと前に<tips=50>路地</tips>さんがいらしたときから、またお会い出来るだろうと、楽しみに思っておりました」","en":"“I am so very happy. Sitting face-to-face with you like this, I feel almost as though I were a child again. Ever since Mr. <tips=50>Roji</tips> visited me not long ago, I have been looking forward to the thought that I might see you again.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エリー・ホワイト","displayName":"Ellie White","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r146","rowIndex":146,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　かつてこの屋敷の主人だった年老いた<tips=31>エリー・ホワイト</tips>と全く同じ黒い喪服を着た<tips=31>エリー</tips>は言葉通り童女じみたはしゃいだ表情を浮かべて、厚いヴェールの向こうから私を見ている。私はその感情を盗むのを失礼に思い、彼女の顔から視線をそらしている。","en":"<tips=31>Ellie</tips> wears the same black mourning dress as the old <tips=31>Ellie White</tips> who once owned this house. True to her words, her expression is as delighted as a little girl’s as she looks at me through the heavy veil. It would feel discourteous to steal that emotion, and so I avert my gaze.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r147","rowIndex":147,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「彼が押しかけて、迷惑ではありませんでしたか？」","en":"“Did his showing up uninvited cause you any trouble?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r148","rowIndex":148,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いえいえ、とんでもない。……可愛いお嬢さんと共にいらして。ちょうど先生がお座りになっているそのソファーから、『<tips=18>ローズ・クラブ</tips>』と『<tips=20>殺人鬼</tips>』のことをおたずねになられましたよ。ですから、私の知っていることを全て話しました」","en":"“No, no, nothing of the sort... He came in the company of a charming young lady, and from the very sofa on which you now sit, he asked me about the <tips=18>Rose Club</tips> and the <tips=20>killer</tips>. So I told him everything I knew.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エリー・ホワイト","displayName":"Ellie White","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r149","rowIndex":149,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　お嬢さんというのは、<tips=55>シオ</tips>のことだろう。","en":"The young lady must have been <tips=55>Shio</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r150","rowIndex":150,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　児童養護施設の職員で、<tips=97>特殊なタイプＢ</tips>の血液を持ち、<tips=50>路地</tips>を不死身の身体にしたあの女性だ。","en":"She is an employee at the children’s home, the woman whose <tips=97>special Type B</tips> blood gave <tips=50>Roji</tips> his undying body.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r151","rowIndex":151,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それは、ありがとうございます」","en":"“Thank you.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r152","rowIndex":152,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「先生のご紹介となれば断れませんから。それにしても、何も私の昔の名を伝えなくてもいいのに。あれは、もう捨てた名なのですから」","en":"“I could hardly refuse someone you had introduced. Still, you need not have told him my old name. That is a name I discarded long ago.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エリー・ホワイト","displayName":"Ellie White","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r153","rowIndex":153,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「すみません。その名を言えば、確実に私からの客だとわかるだろう思ったのです」","en":"“My apologies. I thought that invoking the name would make it perfectly clear that he had come at my recommendation.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r154","rowIndex":154,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私が言うと、<tips=31>エリー</tips>は溜息をついて肩をすくめる。","en":"<tips=31>Ellie</tips> sighs and shrugs at my answer.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r155","rowIndex":155,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「積もる話はありますが、残念ながら今日はそれほど時間があるわけではないのです。大事な話があるのです」","en":"“There is much we might say to one another, but regrettably, I do not have a great deal of time today. I have come to discuss an important matter.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r156","rowIndex":156,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ええ、それはわかっています。そうでなければ、先生が私のような裏社会の人間をお訪ねになるはずがありませんものね」","en":"“Yes, I understand. Otherwise, you would hardly pay a visit to someone from the underworld like me.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エリー・ホワイト","displayName":"Ellie White","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r157","rowIndex":157,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「話というのは、前に<tips=50>路地</tips>君が話したことと同じ、『<tips=18>ローズ・クラブ</tips>』と『<tips=20>殺人鬼コシチェイ</tips>』のことです。貴女には、<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>の最高幹部の一人として聞いて頂きたい」","en":"“It concerns the same matters <tips=50>Roji</tips> discussed with you: the ‘<tips=18>Rose Club</tips>’ and ‘<tips=20>Koschei</tips> the Killer.’ I need you to hear this as one of the highest-ranking officers of <tips=7>YS</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r158","rowIndex":158,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「承知いたしました」","en":"“Understood.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エリー・ホワイト","displayName":"Ellie White","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r159","rowIndex":159,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=31>エリー</tips>は背筋を正すと、そう頷く。","en":"<tips=31>Ellie</tips> sits straighter and gives a grave nod.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r160","rowIndex":160,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私の腕は相変わらず痛み続けている。","en":"My arm continues to ache.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r161","rowIndex":161,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そう深くはなかったはずだが、予想外だ。その痛みに、油断すれば意識が遠ざかりそうになる。","en":"The wound should not be especially deep, but the pain is beyond anything I anticipated. If I let down my guard for even an instant, I feel my consciousness begin to recede.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r162","rowIndex":162,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　普段患者の傷を縫ってやったりしながら、あなたならきっと痛みに耐えられるなどと軽々しい言葉を口にしたものだが、これほど痛むものだとも知らずによく言ったものだ。","en":"I have often said lightly to patients, even while stitching their wounds, ‘I’m sure you can bear the pain.’ What right had I to speak so blithely when I never knew it could hurt this much?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r163","rowIndex":163,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は態度で怪我を気づかれぬよう気をつけながら、言葉を続ける。","en":"Taking care that nothing in my manner betrays the injury, I continue.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r164","rowIndex":164,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「今日、町外れの<tips=6>巻河原病院</tips>が武装集団に襲われたのは知っていますか？」","en":"“Have you heard that an armed group attacked <tips=6>Makigawara Hospital</tips> on the outskirts of the city today?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r165","rowIndex":165,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「え、いや、存じ上げません」","en":"“What? No, I have not.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エリー・ホワイト","displayName":"Ellie White","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r166","rowIndex":166,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ついさっきのことです。今夜には街中に知れ渡るでしょう。職員が殺され、患者は『<tips=46>ネオ・ローズ</tips>』を打たれて連れ去られました。犯行を行ったのは『<tips=47>八龍解放軍</tips>』。……知ってますか？」","en":"“It happened only a short while ago. By tonight, the entire city will know. The staff were killed, and the patients injected with <tips=46>Neo Rose</tips> and taken away. The group responsible calls itself the <tips=47>Hachiryu Liberation Army</tips>... Does the name mean anything to you?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r167","rowIndex":167,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いえ、初耳です。でも、名前からすると<tips=21>八龍会</tips>と関係があるような……」","en":"“No. This is the first I’ve heard of them. But judging by the name, they seem to have some connection to the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips>...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エリー・ホワイト","displayName":"Ellie White","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r168","rowIndex":168,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「その通りです。彼らが暴挙に出ました。これから本気で<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>とやりあうつもりなのかもしれませんな。その活動の手始めとして、病院を襲撃し、同胞の<tips=17>タイプB</tips>を……彼らの言葉を使うならば『解放』したわけですな」","en":"“Precisely. They have embarked upon open violence. They may mean to take on <tips=7>YS</tips> in earnest. As the first act of their campaign, they attacked the hospital and—in their own words—‘liberated’ their fellow <tips=17>Type Bs</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r169","rowIndex":169,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私の言葉に、<tips=31>エリー</tips>は絶句する。","en":"<tips=31>Ellie</tips> is struck speechless.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r170","rowIndex":170,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>の幹部としては、仮想の競争相手である<tips=21>八龍会</tips>がこのような暴力を用いるというのは容易ならざる事態だろう。","en":"For an officer of <tips=7>YS</tips>, the fact that the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips>, a potential rival, would resort to violence like this must be a grave development.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r171","rowIndex":171,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「私は実はその病院に勤務していましてね。たまたま夜勤明けで自宅で眠っているところを、警察からの連絡で事件を知らされたわけです」","en":"“As it happens, I work at that hospital. I had just come off the night shift and was asleep at home when the police informed me of the attack.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r172","rowIndex":172,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まあ、そんな近くで働いていたなんて……」","en":"“Goodness. To think you were working so near...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エリー・ホワイト","displayName":"Ellie White","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r173","rowIndex":173,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「素晴らしいスタッフを殺されてしまいました。それがどうしても納得がいかずに、話を聞いてやろうと<tips=21>八龍会</tips>の本部に向かったんです。この格好なら、彼らも私のことを思い出すでしょうしね。……そこで予想外の出会いがありました」","en":"“They murdered some exceptional members of staff. I could not let that stand, so I set out for the headquarters of the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips> to demand an explanation. Dressed like this, I thought they would be certain to remember me... Instead, I encountered someone I had never expected to meet.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r174","rowIndex":174,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私はそして、今さっき体験したばかりのことを、自分が撃たれたというところだけ省略して彼女に伝えた。","en":"I relate what happened only moments ago, omitting just one detail: that I was shot.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r175","rowIndex":175,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「その老人は『変身』して、女性になったのですね？」","en":"“The old man ‘transformed’ into a woman?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エリー・ホワイト","displayName":"Ellie White","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r176","rowIndex":176,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女の問い返す言葉に私は頷く。","en":"I nod at Ellie’s question.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r177","rowIndex":177,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうです。<tips=50>路地</tips>君が語った能力とぴったり一致する。あの老人と女もきっと『<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>』の別の姿なのでしょう。そして、あの女は<tips=60>ロジャー・アダムス</tips>の記憶を持っていた」","en":"“Yes. It corresponds exactly to the ability <tips=50>Roji</tips> described. Both the old man and the woman must be forms assumed by <tips=20>Koschei</tips>. And the woman possessed <tips=60>Roger Adams’s</tips> memories.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r178","rowIndex":178,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「つまり、私と同じ、あの『<tips=18>ローズ・クラブ</tips>』の生き残り……」","en":"“Then she survived the ‘<tips=18>Rose Club</tips>,’ just as I did...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エリー・ホワイト","displayName":"Ellie White","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r179","rowIndex":179,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そう。そしておそらくは、貴女や他の女に自分の血を飲ませて『三日月』に仕立て上げていた女と同一人物でしょうな」","en":"“Yes. And in all probability, she is the same woman who made you and the other women drink her blood and turned you into ‘Crescents.’”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r180","rowIndex":180,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ああ、そんなことが……」","en":"“Oh... How can that be...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エリー・ホワイト","displayName":"Ellie White","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r181","rowIndex":181,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=31>エリー</tips>は頭を抑えて手すりにもたれかかる。","en":"<tips=31>Ellie</tips> puts a hand to her head and leans against the armrest.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r182","rowIndex":182,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「女は私を見て激しい憎悪を燃やしていた。……直接会ったことはないはずですが、私が当時の<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>に居て、<tips=3>クリス</tips>と協力して<tips=18>ローズ・クラブ</tips>を崩壊に導いた張本人であることを知っているんです。彼女は<tips=60>ロジャー・アダムス</tips>と親しい関係にあったようですから、ロジャーを殺し、クラブを滅ぼした私や<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>に対する激しい復讐の感情があるのでしょう」","en":"“The moment she saw me, the woman burned with violent hatred... I do not believe we ever met face-to-face, yet she knows that I belonged to <tips=7>YS</tips> at the time and that, together with <tips=3>Chris</tips>, I was chiefly responsible for the destruction of the <tips=18>Rose Club</tips>. She appears to have been close to <tips=60>Roger Adams</tips>. It would explain her fierce desire for revenge against me and <tips=7>YS</tips> for killing Roger and destroying the club.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r183","rowIndex":183,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「つまり、古い恨みを晴らすために、この街に舞い戻って来て<tips=21>八龍会</tips>と手を組んだということですか？」","en":"“So she came back to this city and joined forces with the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips> to settle that old grudge?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エリー・ホワイト","displayName":"Ellie White","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r184","rowIndex":184,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「心情まではわかりませんが」","en":"“I cannot claim to know her motives.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r185","rowIndex":185,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「きっとそうです！　『<tips=46>ネオ・ローズ</tips>』の製造法を<tips=21>八龍会</tips>に伝えたのは、年老いたユダヤ人だという噂です。先生が玄関前で見た変身前の姿と一致します」","en":"“I am certain of it! There is a rumor that an elderly Jewish man taught the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips> how to manufacture <tips=46>Neo Rose</tips>. That description matches the figure you saw before the transformation, just outside their door.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エリー・ホワイト","displayName":"Ellie White","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r186","rowIndex":186,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして彼女は、最近この街で発覚した、少年少女の人身売買や児童ポルノの話をした。<tips=17>タイプB</tips>の青年たちがその実行犯だったのだが、彼らをそそのかしたのが若いアジア人の女だというのだ。","en":"She then tells me about the trafficking of boys and girls and the child pornography recently uncovered in this city. The direct perpetrators were young <tips=17>Type Bs</tips>, but a young Asian woman was said to have incited them.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r187","rowIndex":187,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「もしかしたらあれも、あの儀式の女と同一人物だったのかもしれません。<tips=18>ローズ・クラブ</tips>の再現をしようとして、あんなことを……」","en":"“Perhaps she was the same person as the woman from that ritual. Perhaps she did those things in an attempt to recreate the <tips=18>Rose Club</tips>...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エリー・ホワイト","displayName":"Ellie White","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r188","rowIndex":188,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それは私にはなんとも言えませんが、そうかもしれませんな」","en":"“I cannot say anything definite about that, but it is possible.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r189","rowIndex":189,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は頷いた。手がかすかに震えている。痛みのせいだ。","en":"I nod. My hand is trembling slightly from the pain.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r190","rowIndex":190,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「とにかく、<tips=47>解放軍</tips>のことなども含めて、あの<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>をマークすることが必要です。あなたはこの情報を<tips=3>クリス</tips>の息子に伝えてください」","en":"“In any event, <tips=20>Koschei</tips> must be placed under close surveillance, along with the <tips=47>Liberation Army</tips> and everything connected to it. Please convey this information to <tips=3>Chris’s</tips> son.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r191","rowIndex":191,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　手を隠しながらそう言った。","en":"I say this while keeping my trembling hand out of sight.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r192","rowIndex":192,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「先生はどうなさるんですか？」","en":"“And what will you do, Doctor?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エリー・ホワイト","displayName":"Ellie White","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r193","rowIndex":193,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「私は私のやりかたで<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>を追い詰めます。あれは不死身だそうですが、まず、その身体の秘密を解き明かすことが必要でしょう。そして、幸い私は医者です。そしてサイキックの専門家です。研究機関のツテもある。サンプルを手に入れれば、何かしら有益な結果が引き出せるでしょう。……彼らをこのままにはさせませんよ」","en":"“I will pursue <tips=20>Koschei</tips> in my own way. Koschei is said to be immortal, but first we must unravel the secret of that body. Fortunately, I am a doctor. And I am an expert on psychics. I also have connections at research institutions. If I can obtain a sample, I should be able to produce some useful result. ...I will not let them go on like this.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r194","rowIndex":194,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　痛みはもう限界だった。私はそう言って立ち上がる。","en":"I have reached the limit of what I can bear. With that, I rise to my feet.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r195","rowIndex":195,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それじゃあ今日はここまでにしましょう。また進展があったら、連絡します」","en":"“That will have to be all for today. I will contact you if there are any developments.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r196","rowIndex":196,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　立ち去ろうとすると、","en":"As I turn to leave—","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r197","rowIndex":197,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「先生……」","en":"“Doctor...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エリー・ホワイト","displayName":"Ellie White","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r198","rowIndex":198,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=31>エリー</tips>は立ち上がって私を呼び止めた。","en":"<tips=31>Ellie</tips> rises to her feet and calls for me to stop.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r199","rowIndex":199,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=41>グランドタワー</tips>に来て、先生の口から<tips=81>龍頭</tips>に直接お伝え頂けませんか？　そして出来れば、<tips=81>龍頭</tips>にお力を貸して下さい。<tips=3>クリス</tips>様のかけがえのない友人であった先生が味方になれば、<tips=81>龍頭</tips>はどれだけ心強いことか……。それに組織と手を組んだ方が、先生も安全です。<tips=3>クリス</tips>様も、きっと先生を守ってくださるでしょう……」","en":"“Would you come to <tips=41>Grand Tower</tips> and tell the <tips=81>Longtou</tips> in person? And if you can, please lend the <tips=81>Longtou</tips> your strength. You were Lord <tips=3>Chris’s</tips> irreplaceable friend. To have you as an ally would bring the <tips=81>Longtou</tips> immeasurable reassurance... You yourself would be safer allied with the organization. And I am certain Lord <tips=3>Chris</tips> would protect you as well...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エリー・ホワイト","displayName":"Ellie White","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r200","rowIndex":200,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　名前を口にしたので、私はさっき見た<tips=3>クリス</tips>の幻影を思い出した。","en":"At the sound of <tips=3>Chris’s</tips> name, I remember the apparition I saw only a short while ago.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r201","rowIndex":201,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼がおおげさな言い方で、私には「やるべきこと」があると言ったのは、自分の息子を守れという意味だったのか？","en":"When he told me in his grandiose way that I had ‘something I must do,’ did he mean that I was to protect his son?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r202","rowIndex":202,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　だとすれば、いかにも<tips=3>クリス</tips>らしい物言いだ。もしかしたら、本当に幽霊だったのかもしれないな。","en":"If so, it would be entirely like <tips=3>Chris</tips> to put it that way. Perhaps he truly was a ghost after all.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r203","rowIndex":203,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　内心苦笑したい思いだったが、激痛は限界に来ている。","en":"Inwardly, I want to smile at the thought, but the agony is nearing the limit of what I can bear.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r204","rowIndex":204,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=3>クリス</tips>のことを考えれば協力してやりたいところですが、それは出来ません。私は一人で行動します。……その方がいいでしょう。今更『ドクター』がうろちょろしたら、<tips=1>亮</tips>君にしてもやりにくいでしょうし、私もギャングの争いに組み込まれるのは気が進まない。これは私的な復讐でしかないのですから」","en":"“For <tips=3>Chris’s</tips> sake, I would like to lend my help. But I cannot. I will act alone... That will be for the best. If ‘the Doctor’ began prowling around again after all these years, it would only make matters difficult for <tips=1>Leung</tips>. Nor do I care to be absorbed into a conflict between gangs. What I am pursuing is private revenge, and nothing more.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r205","rowIndex":205,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　外に出ると私は雨に打たれながらマンションに向かって歩いた。","en":"Once outside, I set off toward my apartment with the rain beating down on me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r206","rowIndex":206,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　とにかく止血をして、痛み止めも打たなくては。そして<tips=50>路地</tips>に連絡をしよう。やっときみの気持ちが理解出来たと。","en":"First I must stop the bleeding and administer a painkiller. Then I will contact <tips=50>Roji</tips> and tell him that at last I understand how he feels.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r207","rowIndex":207,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　あの鬼のようなツノを持った大男と情報を共有し、彼と共に戦うのだ。倒すべき相手は同じだったのだ。一度断ったものを自分から言うのはどうかとも思うが、あの根はお人好しの大男は快く受け入れてくれるだろう。","en":"I will share what I know with that hulking, ogre-horned man and fight at his side. We have been pursuing the same enemy all along. It may be rather shameless to approach him now after refusing him once, but beneath it all the big man is too good-natured for his own good. I expect he will welcome me readily enough.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r208","rowIndex":208,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼と私のサイキック能力が組み合わされば、他の誰にも出来ないことが成し遂げられるはずだ。<tips=3>クリス</tips>と、そうしたように。それに、彼の身体をサンプルにして不死身の秘密を解き明かすことも出来る。","en":"If his psychic ability and mine are combined, we should be able to accomplish something no one else could, just as <tips=3>Chris</tips> and I once did. And I can use his body as a sample to uncover the secret of immortality.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r209","rowIndex":209,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>、そう呼ばれる存在が<tips=21>八龍会</tips>を武装させて病院のスタッフを殺させた。そして何よりも、『<tips=18>ローズ・クラブ</tips>』幹部の生き残りなのだ。このまま生かしておくわけにはいかない。","en":"The entity called <tips=20>Koschei</tips> armed the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips> and had them murder the hospital staff. Above all, she is one of the surviving leaders of the <tips=18>Rose Club</tips>. I cannot permit her to go on living.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r210","rowIndex":210,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=52>ミアオ</tips>……」","en":"“<tips=52>Miao</tips>...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r211","rowIndex":211,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　我知らず、その名が口から出ていた。","en":"The name escapes my lips before I realize it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r212","rowIndex":212,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そしてその言葉が出ると、体中が熱くなって、傷の痛みなどほとんど感じなくなった。","en":"As soon as it does, heat floods my entire body, and I can scarcely feel the pain of the wound.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r213","rowIndex":213,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そのかわりに、締め付けるような苦しい感情が胸に沸き起こる。","en":"In its place, a painful emotion wells up and tightens around my chest.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r214","rowIndex":214,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=52>ミアオ</tips>……」","en":"“<tips=52>Miao</tips>...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r215","rowIndex":215,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　もう一度、今度は自分の意志で呟くと、目から熱いものがこぼれ落ちた。","en":"I whisper her name once more, this time of my own will, and something hot spills from my eyes.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r216","rowIndex":216,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私には、まだ彼女のために出来ることがある。――そう思うと、体中に充満していた黒いガスが抜け、代わりに光が差し込むような喜びがあった。もう認めなくてはいけない。――私はずっと何かを彼女にしてやりたくて、してやりたくて仕方なかったのだ。病院で見た患者たちに、施設で見た子供たちに、どこか<tips=52>ミアオ</tips>の面影を見ていた。<tips=60>ロジャー・アダムス</tips>を殺し、クラブを燃やし、そしてもう彼女のためにすることがなくなってしまったのを受け入れがたくて、ずっとしがみついていた。","en":"There is still something I can do for her. At the thought, the black gas that had filled my body drains away, replaced by a joy like light streaming in. I must admit it now. All this time, I have wanted to do something for her—wanted it so desperately I could scarcely bear it. In the hospital patients and the children at the home, I had always been searching for some trace of <tips=52>Miao</tips>. After killing <tips=60>Roger Adams</tips> and burning the club, I could not accept that nothing remained for me to do on her behalf. I had clung to that refusal ever since.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r217","rowIndex":217,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=52>ミアオ</tips>、お前の仇はまだ生き残っていた。今度こそ息の根をとめてやる。きっとそのために私は今日まで生きていたのだ。<tips=3>クリス</tips>の言葉を借りれば、「半分死んだようになって」。","en":"<tips=52>Miao</tips>, your enemy is still alive. This time I will finish her. Surely this is why I have survived until today—“half-dead,” to borrow <tips=3>Chris’s</tips> words.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r218","rowIndex":218,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は立ち止まり、マスクをとって濡れた顔を手のひらでごしごしと拭った。","en":"I stop, remove my mask, and scrub my rain-soaked face with my palm.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r219","rowIndex":219,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　すると、トンと、何かが目の前で落ちた音がする。","en":"Then, directly ahead, I hear something land with a soft thump.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r220","rowIndex":220,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　目を開くと、さっきまで誰もいなかったその場所に、黒いレインコートを着て、ほとんど白い金髪を持った、世にも美しい少女がいた。","en":"When I open my eyes, a girl of unearthly beauty stands where no one stood a moment before, wearing a black raincoat, her blond hair almost white.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r221","rowIndex":221,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女は金色に光る目で私の顔を見上げる。","en":"She looks up into my face with eyes glowing gold.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r222","rowIndex":222,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あなたはおイシャさんね？　おイシャさんって、いいヒトよ。ビョウキをなおしてくれるんだもの。だからほんとうはこんなコトしたくないの……」","en":"“You’re a doctor, right? Doctors are nice people. They make sick people all better. So I really don’t want to do this...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"マリア","displayName":"Maria","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r223","rowIndex":223,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女は困ったように小首をかしげる。","en":"She tilts her head with a troubled look.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r224","rowIndex":224,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　目と目が合ったが、なんの感情も私のなかに流れ込まない。","en":"Our eyes meet, but no emotion flows into me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r225","rowIndex":225,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　これはどういうことだ？","en":"What does this mean?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r226","rowIndex":226,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　能力が作用していないわけじゃない。確かに、心はシンクロしている。だけれど、どんな感情も存在しないのだ。","en":"It is not that my ability is failing to work. Our minds are unquestionably synchronized. And yet there is no emotion there at all.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r227","rowIndex":227,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「でも、かみさまがいうんだ。だからごめんなさいね」","en":"“But God told me to. So I’m sorry, okay?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"マリア","displayName":"Maria","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r228","rowIndex":228,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　感情のない少女はニコリと笑って、私の手を掴んだ。","en":"Utterly empty of emotion, the girl gives me a bright smile and takes my hand.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r229","rowIndex":229,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして次の瞬間、彼女の背景が変わる。","en":"In the next instant, the background behind her changes.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r230","rowIndex":230,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それまでは薄暗い路地裏だったはずなのに、急に真っ暗な空に切り替わった。","en":"Until an instant ago, there had been a dim alley behind her. Now it has been replaced by a pitch-black sky.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r231","rowIndex":231,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「えっ」","en":"“Huh?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r232","rowIndex":232,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は辺りを見回し、そして気がついた。","en":"I look around and realize what has happened.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r233","rowIndex":233,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私と少女は空中高く浮かんでいた。風景が変わったのではなく、瞬時に空に移動したのだ。","en":"The girl and I are suspended high in the air. The scenery did not change at all—we ourselves were transported into the sky in an instant.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r234","rowIndex":234,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<ruby=バイバイ>До　свидания</ruby>」","en":"“Do svidaniya—bye-bye.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"マリア","displayName":"Maria","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r235","rowIndex":235,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　少女はそう呟くと手を離し、パッと電灯が消えるかのように姿を消した。","en":"With that whisper, the girl releases my hand and vanishes as suddenly as an electric light blinking out.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r236","rowIndex":236,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして私の身体は落下を始める。","en":"My body begins to fall.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r237","rowIndex":237,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　手をばたつかせても、どこにも掴まるものがない。このままアスファルトに落下する。","en":"I flail my arms, but there is nothing anywhere to grasp. At this rate, I will plunge straight into the asphalt.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r238","rowIndex":238,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その恐怖で瞬時に背筋が凍り付いたが、すぐに落下以上に恐ろしいことが自分の身体に起きていることに気がついた。","en":"The terror freezes my spine in an instant. Almost immediately, however, I realize that something even more horrifying than the fall has happened to my body.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r239","rowIndex":239,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　驚くべきことに、この空へ移動したのは私の上半身だけだったのだ。","en":"Astonishingly, only the upper half of my body has been transported into the sky.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r240","rowIndex":240,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　下半身はどこかへ消えてなくなっていた。へその下辺りでスッパリと切断され、その断面から血液があふれ、腸や胃などがこぼれ出している。","en":"The lower half of my body has vanished. I have been severed cleanly just below the navel. Blood pours from the cross-section, and my intestines, stomach, and other organs spill out.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r241","rowIndex":241,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私はグルグルと回転しながら落下する。それと共に、はみ出した内臓たちが遠心力でブラブラと空中に揺れている。","en":"I fall spinning round and round, my spilled organs swinging through the air under the centrifugal force.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r242","rowIndex":242,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　これは致命傷だ。私は助からない。自分の内臓を眺めながらそう診断した。","en":"The injury is fatal. There is no saving me. I make this diagnosis while gazing at my own organs.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r243","rowIndex":243,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　仮に私が医師でなかったとしても、一目でわかることだろう。","en":"Even if I were not a physician, anyone could see it at a glance.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r244","rowIndex":244,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして、意識が急速に薄れてゆく。視界が暗闇に閉ざされ、自分のピンク色の内臓も見えなくなる。","en":"My consciousness rapidly begins to fade. Darkness closes over my vision until even my own pink entrails disappear from sight.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r245","rowIndex":245,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私はこのまま即死する。やっと自分の本当の気持ちに気がついた瞬間に死ぬなんて滑稽だが、それも私らしいのかもしれない。","en":"At this rate, I will die instantly. There is something absurd in dying at the very moment I finally recognize my true feelings, but perhaps it is only fitting for a man like me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r246","rowIndex":246,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=3>クリス</tips>のように手際よく欲しいものに手を伸ばすことなんか出来ない。うじうじ考えて、やっと少し動けるだけの男なのだ。復讐を果たせないのは残念だが、もしそれをしたって、何もかえってこないのはわかっている。<tips=52>ミアオ</tips>がとっくに死んでいることには変わらないのだから。","en":"I could never reach out and seize what I wanted with the deftness of <tips=3>Chris</tips>. I am a man who frets and broods until at last he manages one faltering step. I regret that I will not complete my revenge, but I know that even if I did, it would restore nothing. <tips=52>Miao</tips> would still have been dead for years.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r247","rowIndex":247,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　復讐を実行し、その後に来る絶望を考えればここで死ねるのは幸福だろう。","en":"Considering the despair that would come after I carried out my revenge, perhaps I should count myself fortunate to die here.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r248","rowIndex":248,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　――頭の奥が痺れる。","en":"Something deep in the back of my head goes numb.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r249","rowIndex":249,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　脳内物質が大量に分泌されているのだ。","en":"My brain is releasing a flood of chemicals.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r250","rowIndex":250,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　これはありがたい。なんの痛みも感じないで済む。","en":"This is a blessing. I will not have to feel any pain.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r251","rowIndex":251,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして目を閉じようとしたとき、暗闇のなかに微笑みかける女の顔が浮かんだ。","en":"As I am about to close my eyes, a woman’s smiling face takes shape in the darkness.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r252","rowIndex":252,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女はとても幸せで、満ち足りた表情で、私に手を伸ばしている。","en":"Her expression is one of perfect happiness and contentment as she reaches out to me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r253","rowIndex":253,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　どうしてそんな表情が出来るのだろうか？","en":"How could she wear an expression like that?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r254","rowIndex":254,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　安い売春宿で客をとり、そのあとは<tips=18>ローズ・クラブ</tips>でバラバラにされていた。","en":"She took customers in a cheap brothel, and afterward she was cut apart in the <tips=18>Rose Club</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r255","rowIndex":255,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　客観的に見て、彼女の人生にいいことなんかほとんどないはずなのに。","en":"By any objective measure, almost nothing good can ever have happened in her life.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r256","rowIndex":256,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　でもいつも幸せそうな顔をしている。","en":"And yet she always wears that look of happiness.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r257","rowIndex":257,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私なんかよりもずっと。","en":"Far happier than I ever was.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r258","rowIndex":258,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　最初に会ったときから、それが不思議でたまらなかった。","en":"It had mystified me from the very first time we met.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r259","rowIndex":259,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　またきみに会いたかったんだ。長い間、とても強く、強く、そのことだけを考えていたんだ。","en":"I wanted to see you again. For so long, I thought of nothing else—wanting it so fiercely, so fiercely.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r260","rowIndex":260,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして、笑顔の秘密を教えて欲しかった。","en":"And I wanted you to tell me the secret of that smile.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r261","rowIndex":261,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それを言葉で伝え、そして手を伸ばして彼女の手を掴みたかったが、今の私にはどちらも出来ない。","en":"I want to tell her all of this in words, then reach out and take her hand—but in my present state, I can do neither.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r262","rowIndex":262,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=52>ミアオ</tips>……」","en":"“<tips=52>Miao</tips>...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r263","rowIndex":263,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ただ、その名を呟くのが精一杯だった。","en":"All I can manage is to whisper her name.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r264","rowIndex":264,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　闇に浮かんだその顔が、段々薄くなってゆく。","en":"The face floating in the darkness gradually fades.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r265","rowIndex":265,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　やっとこれで全てが終わる。","en":"At last, everything will be over.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r266","rowIndex":266,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　――ああ、違うな。これは全然違う。私の死の感情は、彼女が死ぬ時に心を満たしていたその感情と、全然違う。","en":"Ah, no. This is different—completely different. The emotions I feel as I die are nothing like those that filled her heart at the moment of her death.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r267","rowIndex":267,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女の死の間際、私に流れ込んで来た感情は、鮮烈なほどの幸福感。","en":"In her final moments, what poured into me was a happiness of almost painful vividness.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r268","rowIndex":268,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　いつ会っても笑い、楽しそうに弾んでいた<tips=52>ミアオ</tips>の心は、生命が消え去る瞬間に一番の幸福を感じていた。","en":"<tips=52>Miao</tips>, who greeted every meeting with a smile and always seemed to dance with delight, felt the greatest happiness of her life at the instant that life vanished.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r269","rowIndex":269,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして一方、私自身は彼女が死んでしまうという絶望を感じていた。","en":"I, meanwhile, felt only the despair of knowing that she was dying.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r270","rowIndex":270,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　流れ込むミアオの幸福感と、私のなかの絶望。相容れない感情にひどく混乱し、気を失ってしまったんだ。","en":"The happiness pouring in from Miao, and the despair inside me. Those irreconcilable emotions threw me into such confusion that I lost consciousness.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r271","rowIndex":271,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　どうして、あの瞬間まで幸福を感じていたんだ？　きみの心は壊れていたのだろうか？　<tips=18>ローズ・クラブ</tips>で切り刻まれていた日々が、死を幸福と感じるほど、きみをこわしていたんだろうか？","en":"Why did you feel happy right up to that moment? Was your mind broken? Had the days you spent being cut apart at the <tips=18>Rose Club</tips> broken you so completely that death felt like happiness?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r272","rowIndex":272,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　とにかくきみは、最後の最後に、この世界は地獄だというメッセージを私に残して去って行った。","en":"Whatever the reason, at the very end you left me a message that this world was hell, and then you were gone.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r273","rowIndex":273,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　あれ以来、ずっと死の世界から私を呼んでいたような気がする。","en":"Ever since then, I have felt as though you were calling to me from the world of the dead.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r274","rowIndex":274,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　でも、この瞬間を迎えた私の感情はきみとは違う。幸福は感じない。ただ、奇妙な安堵感はある。","en":"But now that my own moment has come, my feelings are different from yours. I feel no happiness. I do feel a strange sense of relief.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r275","rowIndex":275,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　これは――なんだろう？","en":"This feeling—what is it?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r276","rowIndex":276,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　小学校のマラソン大会で、運動が苦手な私がへとへとになって、やっとゴールに辿り着いたような、穏やかな気持ちだ。","en":"It is the quiet feeling I knew as a child, hopeless at sports, when I finally staggered across the finish line of a school marathon utterly exhausted.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r277","rowIndex":277,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そのゴールには、もう二度と会えないと思っていた、たくさんの懐かしい顔が待っているのだろう。","en":"Perhaps, at that finish line, all the dear faces from long ago that I thought never to see again are waiting for me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r278","rowIndex":278,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そう考えれば、何も寂しくはないのかもしれない。","en":"If I think of it that way, perhaps I am not alone at all.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r279","rowIndex":279,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　だけど、その安堵感だけじゃないんだ。","en":"But that sense of relief is not all I feel.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r280","rowIndex":280,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私には、もっと強い別の感情があるんだ。","en":"There is another, stronger emotion in me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r281","rowIndex":281,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=52>ミアオ</tips>、私は生が惜しいよ。","en":"<tips=52>Miao</tips>, I am not ready to let go of life.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r282","rowIndex":282,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　たとえ毎日目を覆いたくなることばかり起きるこの世界でも、きみがいない味気ないこの世界でも、私は惜しいんだ。","en":"Even in this world where every day brings sights from which I want to turn my eyes, even in this joyless world without you, I cannot bear to let life go.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r283","rowIndex":283,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ああ、<tips=52>ミアオ</tips>。","en":"Oh, <tips=52>Miao</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:C4:r284","rowIndex":284,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　やはり我々は、あまりにも――","en":"After all, we are far too—","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}}]},{"position":52,"code":"B6","unitId":"B6","rows":[{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r1","rowIndex":1,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おそらく今日は運命の日になるだろう。","en":"Today will probably be a fateful day.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r2","rowIndex":2,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=47>解放軍</tips>が出来てからというもの、運命の日ばかりが続いてまったくいやになるが、そのなかでも今日はとびっきりの運命の日だ。","en":"Ever since the <tips=47>Liberation Army</tips> came into being, every day has been another fateful day, and frankly I am sick of it. Even by those standards, however, today promises to be exceptionally fateful.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r3","rowIndex":3,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=10>道夫</tips>さん、もう一枚トーストを焼きますか？　サラダもまだありますよ」","en":"“Would you like another slice of toast, <tips=10>Michio</tips>? There is still some salad.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r4","rowIndex":4,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おれがよほど腹が減っているように見えたのか、食べ終わった後に<tips=44>詩由子</tips>がそう聞いてきた。しかし、どうもこの名前にはまだ慣れないな。<tips=44>筱喬</tips>って呼びたくなる。","en":"I must have looked ravenous, because <tips=44>Shiyuko</tips> asks me this the moment I finish eating. I still cannot quite accustom myself to that name. Some part of me wants to call her <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r5","rowIndex":5,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「大丈夫。朝はこれくらいでちょうどいいんだ。それよりコーヒーをもう一杯もらえるかな？」","en":"“No, this is just the right amount for breakfast. But could I have another cup of coffee?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r6","rowIndex":6,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「はい」","en":"“Of course.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r7","rowIndex":7,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そう言って、<tips=44>詩由子</tips>は席を立つ。","en":"<tips=44>Shiyuko</tips> rises from her chair.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r8","rowIndex":8,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　窓から差し込む清浄の白い日差し。目が覚めるともう愛しい女性が起きていて朝ご飯の用意をしてくれている。部屋に漂うトーストの焼けるにおいと、コーヒーのにおい。おれが寝ぐせがついたままうすぼんやりと席に着けば、まるでホテルみたいに朝食の白い皿が並べられる。まず湯気がたつ香ばしいコーヒーを寝起きの身体に一口、そしてミルクを二口、そしてサラダから食べはじめる。なんて素晴らしい朝だろう！","en":"Pure white morning light streams through the window. By the time I wake, the woman dear to me is already up and preparing breakfast. The aromas of browning toast and fresh coffee drift through the room. I stumble to the table half asleep, my hair still wild from bed, and white breakfast plates appear before me as though I were a guest at a hotel. First one sip of fragrant, steaming coffee to rouse the body, then two swallows of milk, and only then the salad. What a glorious morning!","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r9","rowIndex":9,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　こんな朝がおれにも来るとは思わなかった。しんみりとしてしまう。何よりも驚きなのはまだおれは彼女を抱いてはいないということだ。なのにこんなに晴れやかで、何かが通じ合った気持ちになれるなんて。これが幸福ってやつなんだろうか？","en":"I never imagined a morning like this would come to me. The thought leaves me strangely tender. Most astonishing of all, I have not even slept with her yet. And still I feel so light, so radiant, as though something has passed between us and joined us together. Is this what people mean by happiness?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r10","rowIndex":10,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　思えばおれは今まで知り合った女性とは表面的なつき合いだった。彼女たちとはベッドを共にしたが、<tips=44>詩由子</tips>のように一緒に暮らそうとは思わなかった。","en":"When I think about it, every relationship I have had with a woman until now was superficial. I shared their beds, but never wanted to live with any of them as I do with <tips=44>Shiyuko</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r11","rowIndex":11,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　人間誰でもそうだが、第一印象というものはルックスだとか、グループ内での地位とか、人当たりのよさとか、そういったもので好感を持つ。おれはその辺りではまあまあお眼鏡に適うらしく、ウケは悪くない。しかし、表面的なつき合い以上のことは出来なかった。何故といって、そこまで近くこられてしまっては彼女たちがおれに抱いている虚像が崩れ、その本当の人格に失望してしまうんじゃないかという恐怖があったからだ。それはお互いにとって不幸にしかならない。","en":"As with anyone, first impressions are built from appearances, status within the group, an agreeable manner, and things of that sort. By those measures, I apparently pass inspection well enough; I have never lacked for favorable attention. But I could never carry a relationship beyond the surface. If a woman came too close, I was afraid the image she had formed of me would collapse and the person underneath would disappoint her. That could only end in unhappiness for us both.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r12","rowIndex":12,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その点<tips=1>亮</tips>は全くおれとは正反対だった。あいつもあの顔であの能力だから相当女には人気があったのに、全く相手にしなかった。それはやっぱり、<tips=55>松坊</tips>がいたからだろう。","en":"In that respect, <tips=1>Leung</tips> was my complete opposite. With his looks and his abilities, he too was tremendously popular with women, yet he paid none of them the slightest attention. That must, after all, have been because he had <tips=55>Matsu</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r13","rowIndex":13,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　当時おれはその関係を随分羨ましく思ったものだけれども、まさかこうして自分にもそのチャンスが訪れるとは夢にも思わなかった。一生そんな相手はいないと思ってた。","en":"I envied their relationship a great deal at the time, but I never dreamed that an opportunity like this would come to me. I thought I would go my entire life without such a person.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r14","rowIndex":14,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しかもそれが親友である<tips=1>亮</tips>の妹とは。","en":"And now that person has appeared in the little sister of my best friend, <tips=1>Leung</tips>, of all people.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r15","rowIndex":15,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　嬉しさ半分、恥ずかしさ半分といった気分じゃないか。","en":"Half delighted and half embarrassed—that seems to describe it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r16","rowIndex":16,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「お行儀が悪いですね」","en":"“That is very poor table manners.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r17","rowIndex":17,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ニヤニヤしながら指先についたバターをなめていると、丁度戻って来た<tips=44>詩由子</tips>に見られてしまった。","en":"I am grinning and licking butter from my fingertips when <tips=44>Shiyuko</tips> returns and catches me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r18","rowIndex":18,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「育ちが悪いもんでね」","en":"“Afraid I had a rough upbringing.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r19","rowIndex":19,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　苦笑するおれの空になったカップに、<tips=44>詩由子</tips>は新しいコーヒーをポットから注いでくれる。","en":"While I answer with a rueful smile, <tips=44>Shiyuko</tips> refills my empty cup from the coffee pot.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r20","rowIndex":20,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=44>詩由子</tips>が来る前からうちにあったコーヒーなのに、一人で慌ただしく淹れたときとは別のものみたいに良い香りがするのはどうしてなんだ？　人生の幸せというものは、言うなればこの朝のコーヒーの香りのなかに集約されるのだと、おれは断然主張しちゃうね。","en":"This is the same coffee I had in the apartment before <tips=44>Shiyuko</tips> arrived, so why does it smell like an entirely different thing from the cups I used to brew for myself in a hurry? I, for one, will insist that all the happiness of human life can be distilled into the fragrance of this morning’s coffee.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r21","rowIndex":21,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「今日は遅くなるんですか？」","en":"“Will you be home late today?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r22","rowIndex":22,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「わからない。あとで連絡をするよ」","en":"“I don’t know. I’ll let you know later.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r23","rowIndex":23,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「わかりました。待ってます」","en":"“All right. I’ll wait for you.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r24","rowIndex":24,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=44>詩由子</tips>はそして笑う。仕事の内容について聞いて来たりはしないし、ましてやこれから<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>とどうなるかなんていう話はしない。気にしていないはずがないのに、気にしていないように振る舞ってくれている。おれたちは海に浮かぶ船のなかにいるようなもので、お互い穏やかな顔をしているが、おれたちがいる場所から床板一枚隔てた下では波が不穏に荒れ狂おうとしている。","en":"And then <tips=44>Shiyuko</tips> smiles. She does not ask what my work entails, much less speak of what is to become of us and <tips=7>YS</tips>. It cannot possibly be far from her mind, yet for my sake she behaves as though it were. We might be aboard a ship at sea, each wearing a tranquil face while, no farther beneath us than a single floorboard, the waves gather themselves into a violent and ominous swell.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r25","rowIndex":25,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女の内心の悲しみを思うとおれも胸が苦しくなるが、しかしやらねばならぬのだ。彼女もそれを覚悟したから、ここにいる。","en":"When I think of the sadness she carries inside, my own chest aches, but it has to be done. She is here because she, too, has steeled herself for it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r26","rowIndex":26,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　朝食を終え、身支度を整えて出発するおれを<tips=44>詩由子</tips>は玄関まで見送ってくれる。","en":"After breakfast, I get ready to leave, and <tips=44>Shiyuko</tips> sees me to the front door.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r27","rowIndex":27,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=10>道夫</tips>さん」","en":"“<tips=10>Michio</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r28","rowIndex":28,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　と言って靴を履いたおれを振り返らせると、にこりと微笑んで、顔を近づけおれの頬にちゅっとキスをしてくれる。","en":"Her call makes me turn around just after I have put on my shoes. She gives me a bright smile, brings her face close to mine, and kisses me lightly on the cheek.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r29","rowIndex":29,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いってらっしゃい」","en":"“Have a good day.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r30","rowIndex":30,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　照れくさそうに笑い、","en":"She smiles shyly.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r31","rowIndex":31,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「行ってきます」","en":"“I’m off.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r32","rowIndex":32,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おれはそう答えるのだ。","en":"And that is what I say in reply.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r33","rowIndex":33,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ここのところ毎日これをしてくれるが、頬がゆるんで仕方ない。廊下を歩き、エレベーターで降りるおれはデレデレとひどくしまりのない顔をしていただろう。さすがにこのまま仕事に行くわけにはいかない。","en":"She has done this every day lately, and I cannot keep my cheeks from relaxing into a grin. I must have worn a terribly slack, besotted expression as I walked down the corridor and rode the elevator. I can hardly go to work with a face like this.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r34","rowIndex":34,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　マンションを出たところでおれは両手で頬をバシッと叩いて気合いを入れた。","en":"Once outside the apartment building, I slap both cheeks sharply and force myself back into fighting form.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r35","rowIndex":35,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　今日は本当に、大事な一日なのだ。これからやることを思うと、さすがのおれでも胸が痛む。","en":"Today truly is a momentous day. Even a man like me feels his heart ache at the thought of what I am about to do.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r36","rowIndex":36,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=10>見土</tips>隊長。覚悟はいいですね？」","en":"“Commander <tips=10>Mido</tips>. You are prepared, I trust?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"カミラ","displayName":"Camilla","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r37","rowIndex":37,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　車が止まると、<tips=67>カミラ</tips>が真剣な顔で確認をする。","en":"When the car comes to a stop, <tips=67>Camilla</tips> asks the question with a grave expression.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r38","rowIndex":38,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「念押しはいらんよ」","en":"“You don’t need to ask again.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r39","rowIndex":39,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おれはそう言うと、ドアを開けた。","en":"I say it and open the door.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r40","rowIndex":40,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　目の前にあるのは、<tips=21>八龍会</tips>指導部……つまりあの三人がいる民家だった。","en":"Before me stands the headquarters of the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips> leadership—or, to put it plainly, the ordinary private house where those three men live.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r41","rowIndex":41,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　子供の時から何度も訪れたこの場所に、今日おれはいつもとは違う目的でやって来ている。","en":"I have visited this place countless times since I was a child. Today I have come for a very different purpose.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r42","rowIndex":42,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おれが車を降りると、もう一台の車からもぞろぞろと男たちが降りた。彼らもまた<tips=47>八龍解放軍</tips>のメンバーだった。その中には<tips=66>コンタ</tips>もいて、笑って隣のやつに何か冗談を言っている。緊張を紛らわしているんだろう。","en":"When I step out of the car, men file one after another from a second vehicle. They too are members of the <tips=47>Hachiryu Liberation Army</tips>. Among them is <tips=66>Konta</tips>, grinning as he cracks some joke to the man beside him. No doubt he is trying to take the edge off his nerves.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r43","rowIndex":43,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おれと<tips=67>カミラ</tips>が先頭に並んでインターフォンを押すと、ハウスキーパーの佐藤さんが予定外の訪問に泡を食った顔で出迎えた。","en":"<tips=67>Camilla</tips> and I stand together at the head of the group and ring the intercom. Mr. Sato, the housekeeper, comes to meet our unannounced visit wearing an expression of pure alarm.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r44","rowIndex":44,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=10>道夫</tips>さん、どうしたんですか？」","en":"“<tips=10>Michio</tips>, what is the matter?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r45","rowIndex":45,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「騒がせてすまないね。爺さんたちに大事な話があるんだ」","en":"“Sorry for the commotion. I need to discuss something important with the old men.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r46","rowIndex":46,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「今日の午前中は人と会う約束があって……」","en":"“They have an appointment with someone this morning...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r47","rowIndex":47,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「本当に大事な用なんだ。悪いけれど、その約束は断ってもらおう。……じいさんたちはどこにいる？」","en":"“It really is important business. Sorry, but you’ll have to cancel that appointment. ...Where are the old men?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r48","rowIndex":48,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ま、麻雀室に……」","en":"“I-in the mahjong room...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r49","rowIndex":49,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　動揺する佐藤さんには脇にどいて貰って、おれたちはぞろぞろと徒党を組んで屋敷に入る。みな胸にバラと龍をかたどったバッジを輝かせ、カーキ色をした軍服に似せた服を身につけていた。","en":"We have the shaken Mr. Sato step aside, then file into the house like an organized mob. Rose-and-dragon badges gleam on every chest, and every one of us is dressed in khaki clothing cut to resemble a military uniform.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r50","rowIndex":50,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　じいさんたちは朝っぱらから麻雀に興じていた。麻雀室は中庭に面しており、全面ガラス張りのサッシは開かれて、朝のさわやかなそよ風と太陽の光を部屋に招き入れている。","en":"The old men have been amusing themselves with mahjong since first thing in the morning. The mahjong room faces the courtyard, its full wall of glass sliding doors thrown open to invite in the fresh morning breeze and sunlight.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r51","rowIndex":51,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おれたちが足を踏み入れると肌の色の異なる三人は、それらのもともとしわだらけの顔を、さらにしわだらけにして怪訝な表情を作った。","en":"When we enter, the three men, each with a different color of skin, wrinkle their already wrinkled faces still further into expressions of suspicion.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r52","rowIndex":52,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どうしたの？　みんなそんな怖い顔で勢揃いをして。今日は遠足にでもいくノ？」","en":"“What’s all this? Everyone lined up together with such frightening faces. Are you going on a field trip today?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ミスター・チェン","displayName":"Mr. Chen","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r53","rowIndex":53,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=22>老人たち</tips>も百戦錬磨だ。おれたちの雰囲気からこれが普通の状況ではないことを察しているだろうが、<tips=90>ミスター・チェン</tips>は道化を装ってそうからかう。","en":"<tips=22>The old men</tips> have survived a hundred battles. They must know from the air around us that this is no ordinary visit, yet <tips=90>Mr. Chen</tips> puts on the clown’s mask and greets us with mockery.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r54","rowIndex":54,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まあ、遠足と言えば遠足のようなもんですな。今日を境に、この<tips=21>八龍会</tips>というものが楽しい遠足に出るんですよ」","en":"“Well, if you care to call it a field trip, then I suppose it is one. Beginning today, this institution we call the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips> will be setting out on a most enjoyable excursion.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r55","rowIndex":55,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=10>道夫</tips>の冗談は相変わらずヘタネ」","en":"“Your jokes are as bad as ever, <tips=10>Michio</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ミスター・チェン","displayName":"Mr. Chen","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r56","rowIndex":56,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=90>ミスター・チェン</tips>はそう言って低く笑う。","en":"<tips=90>Mr. Chen</tips> gives a low laugh.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r57","rowIndex":57,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「単刀直入に言います」","en":"“I will be blunt.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"カミラ","displayName":"Camilla","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r58","rowIndex":58,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　と<tips=67>カミラ</tips>は宣言をして、","en":"<tips=67>Camilla</tips> declares,","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r59","rowIndex":59,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「お三方は、今日をもって引退して下さい。そしてこの街から出て行ってください」","en":"“As of today, the three of you will retire. And you will leave this city.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"カミラ","displayName":"Camilla","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r60","rowIndex":60,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　本当にこれ以上ないくらい単刀直入に言った。","en":"She could scarcely have been more direct.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r61","rowIndex":61,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「何を言っているのかわかっているのか？」","en":"“Do you understand what you are saying?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ミスター・スミス","displayName":"Mr. Smith","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r62","rowIndex":62,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=91>ミスター・スミス</tips>は黒い顔に不快感を隠しもせずに言う。","en":"<tips=91>Mr. Smith</tips> speaks without the slightest attempt to conceal the displeasure on his dark-skinned face.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r63","rowIndex":63,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……これはクーデターのつもりですか？」","en":"“...Is this intended to be a coup?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ミスター・アーノルド","displayName":"Mr. Arnold","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r64","rowIndex":64,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=89>ミスター・アーノルド</tips>は白い顔に呆れたような表情を浮かべていた。","en":"<tips=89>Mr. Arnold</tips> wears an incredulous, almost exasperated look on his pale face.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r65","rowIndex":65,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「こういうものがあります」","en":"“There is something I would like you to see.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"カミラ","displayName":"Camilla","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r66","rowIndex":66,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=67>カミラ</tips>は答えず、麻雀卓の上に用意した書類の束を置いた。","en":"Rather than answer, <tips=67>Camilla</tips> places a prepared sheaf of papers upon the mahjong table.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r67","rowIndex":67,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いやあ、なにやらごちゃごちゃと細かい字で書いてあるネー。私たちおじいちゃんの老眼じゃ、とても読めないヨ」","en":"“Goodness, so many tiny words jumbled together. Our poor old eyes could never read this.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ミスター・チェン","displayName":"Mr. Chen","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r68","rowIndex":68,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=90>ミスター・チェン</tips>は肩をすくめる。","en":"<tips=90>Mr. Chen</tips> shrugs.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r69","rowIndex":69,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それは、お三方の体組織の<tips=72>傾向値</tips>を調べたものです」","en":"“These are the results of tests measuring the <tips=72>tendency values</tips> in tissue samples taken from all three of you.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"カミラ","displayName":"Camilla","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r70","rowIndex":70,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=67>カミラ</tips>の言葉で、三人は露骨に表情を変えることはなかったが、場の空気が一瞬にしてかわったのを感じた。","en":"None of the three permits any overt change of expression, yet at <tips=67>Camilla’s</tips> words I feel the atmosphere in the room alter in an instant.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r71","rowIndex":71,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「これによると、お三方とも<tips=72>傾向値</tips>が非常に低く、これで<tips=17>タイプB</tips>ということはありえないということでした」","en":"“According to these results, all three of you possess extremely low <tips=72>tendency values</tips>. It is impossible for any of you to be <tips=17>Type B</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"カミラ","displayName":"Camilla","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r72","rowIndex":72,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「またくだらぬ話を持ち出したものです。おかしな風聞に惑わされたのか……」","en":"“So you have dragged out that ridiculous story again. Have you allowed some absurd rumor to mislead you...?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ミスター・アーノルド","displayName":"Mr. Arnold","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r73","rowIndex":73,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=89>ミスター・アーノルド</tips>は苦々しい顔で傍らのテーブルに置かれたお茶のカップを手に取り、一口すする。","en":"With a bitter expression, <tips=89>Mr. Arnold</tips> lifts a cup of tea from the table beside him and takes a sip.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r74","rowIndex":74,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「信頼出来る機関に検査を依頼しました。体組織は、この屋敷で採取させていただいたものを複数提出しています。間違いなく、あなたがたはノーマルです。<tips=17>タイプB</tips>ではありえません。……そしてこちらの資料もご覧下さい」","en":"“I commissioned a trustworthy institution to perform the tests. We submitted multiple tissue samples collected here at this estate. There is no mistake: you are Normals. You cannot possibly be <tips=17>Type B</tips>. ...And now, please examine these records as well.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"カミラ","displayName":"Camilla","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r75","rowIndex":75,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=67>カミラ</tips>はブリーフケースから先ほどよりは薄い書類の束を取り出して、また麻雀卓の上に置いた。","en":"<tips=67>Camilla</tips> removes a thinner sheaf of papers from her briefcase and places it upon the mahjong table with the first.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r76","rowIndex":76,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「こちらはあなたがたの個人的な銀行口座の出納の記録と、『<tips=46>ネオ・ローズ</tips>』の製造や売買に関する金銭の動きを纏めた帳簿です。こちらを見れば、あなたたちが『<tips=46>ネオ・ローズ</tips>』の売り上げの一部を私財にしていることが明白です。そして、あなたたちが言っていた、高率のマージンを<tips=65>ヘス</tips>に支払っているという事実もありません」","en":"“These are transaction records from your personal bank accounts, together with ledgers tracing the flow of money connected to the manufacture and sale of <tips=46>Neo Rose</tips>. They demonstrate clearly that you have been diverting a portion of the proceeds from <tips=46>Neo Rose</tips> into your private assets. Nor is there any truth to your claim that you were paying <tips=65>Hess</tips> a high percentage as commission.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"カミラ","displayName":"Camilla","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r77","rowIndex":77,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=67>カミラ</tips>がよどみなく朗々と説明するのを、<tips=22>老人たち</tips>はあるいは不快げに、あるいは皮肉な笑みを浮かべて、あるいは人ごとのように関心のない顔で聞いているが、誰一人として反論はしない。","en":"<tips=67>Camilla</tips> delivers the explanation in a clear, ringing voice without the slightest hesitation. <tips=22>The old men</tips> listen—one openly displeased, another wearing a sardonic smile, the third as indifferent as though none of this concerned him—but not one offers a word of rebuttal.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r78","rowIndex":78,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「つまり、あなたたちはノーマルでありながら<tips=17>タイプB</tips>であると偽り、長年に渡って会員のみなを欺き、私腹を肥やしていたわけです。本来ならば死に値する罪ですが、指導者としての功績も少なくありません。それに免じて、穏便に済ませようと思います。財産を没収し、追放させて頂きます。表向きには引退というかたちで、自ら一線を退くと会員に通達してください」","en":"“In other words, though you are Normals, you passed yourselves off as <tips=17>Type Bs</tips>, deceived the entire membership for many years, and enriched yourselves at their expense. By rights, these are crimes worthy of death. Your achievements as leaders, however, are considerable. In recognition of those services, I intend to settle the matter quietly. Your property will be confiscated, and you will be exiled. To the outside world, this will be presented as retirement. Inform the membership that you have chosen of your own accord to withdraw from active affairs.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"カミラ","displayName":"Camilla","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r79","rowIndex":79,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……<tips=10>道夫</tips>も同じ考えかい？」","en":"“Does <tips=10>Michio</tips> believe the same?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ミスター・チェン","displayName":"Mr. Chen","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r80","rowIndex":80,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=90>ミスター・チェン</tips>の顔からはもう笑顔が消えている。","en":"The smile has now vanished from <tips=90>Mr. Chen’s</tips> face.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r81","rowIndex":81,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　こんな状態の彼らを見るのはつらかったが、おれは言わなければならない。","en":"It pains me to see them reduced to this, but the words must be said.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r82","rowIndex":82,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ああ。同志に対する裏切りは何よりも重い罪だ。それは、あんたらが教えてくれたことだぜ。それに、他にどういうかたちで収まりをつける？　このまま事実が表沙汰になればあんたらは八つ裂きにされてもおかしくない。おれからも隠居を勧めるね。どこかで静かに暮らすんだ。ノーマルなら<tips=9>Y地区</tips>の外でも暮らしていけるだろう」","en":"“I do. Betrayal of your comrades is the gravest crime of all. You taught me that yourselves. And how else do we bring this to an end? If the truth becomes public, it would hardly be surprising if they tore you limb from limb. I recommend retirement too. Go live quietly somewhere. As Normals, you should be able to live outside <tips=9>Y District</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r83","rowIndex":83,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おれが言うと三人は黙り込む。","en":"At my answer, all three fall silent.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r84","rowIndex":84,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ほんの小さな頃からのつき合いだ。おれの顔を見れば、これがたちの悪い冗談でもなければ、確信のないブラフでもないことを理解するだろう。","en":"They have known me since I was a very small child. One look at my face will tell them this is neither some vicious joke nor a bluff I lack the conviction to carry through.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r85","rowIndex":85,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そう、残念ながらこれは抜き差しならない事実なんだ。","en":"Yes. Unfortunately, there is no getting around this fact.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r86","rowIndex":86,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まさか、<tips=10>道夫</tips>にこんなことを言われることになるとは……」","en":"“To think I would ever hear words like these from you, <tips=10>Michio</tips>...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ミスター・アーノルド","displayName":"Mr. Arnold","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r87","rowIndex":87,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=89>ミスター・アーノルド</tips>が溜息とともに吐き出した。","en":"<tips=89>Mr. Arnold</tips> expels the words with a sigh.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r88","rowIndex":88,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「驚かされたのはこっちですよ。目を疑ったが、揺るぎのない事実だ。認めてもらいますよ」","en":"“I am the one who was shocked. I could scarcely believe what I was seeing, but the facts are beyond dispute. You will acknowledge them.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r89","rowIndex":89,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　三人の顔を見回すが、沈黙したままだれも答えない。","en":"I look from one face to the next, but no one breaks the silence.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r90","rowIndex":90,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　この静寂は、事実を認めるものに違いない。","en":"This silence must mean they admit the truth.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r91","rowIndex":91,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そう、この人たちはノーマルなんだ。","en":"Yes. These people are Normals.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r92","rowIndex":92,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　はっきりそう結論が出たとき、おれの全身に鳥肌が立った。","en":"When I reached that conclusion with certainty, gooseflesh rose all over my body.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r93","rowIndex":93,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　いや、専門家の結論なのだから、疑問を差し挟む余地がないのはわかっていたはずじゃないか。なのに今こんなにゾワゾワとするってのは、やはりどこかで否定して欲しいという気持ちが残っていたということなのか？　――いや違うな。もっと違うなにか特別な感情だ。","en":"No. The conclusion came from experts; I knew there was no room left for doubt. Why, then, is my skin crawling so violently now? Does some part of me still want them to deny it? No, that is not it. This is some other emotion altogether—something singular.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r94","rowIndex":94,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おれは子供の頃に初めてこの屋敷に招かれ、<tips=22>老人たち</tips>に取り囲まれた時のことを思い出していた。","en":"I remember the first time I was invited into this house as a child, with the <tips=22>old men</tips> gathered around me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r95","rowIndex":95,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ガリガリで腹を減らしていたおれに、山ほど料理を出してくれた。ガツガツそれを夢中で食うおれを、黙って笑いながら見ていた。","en":"I was painfully thin and hungry, and they brought me a mountain of food. As I devoured it in a frenzy, they watched in silence and smiled.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r96","rowIndex":96,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　あれから長い時間が過ぎて、色々なことがあった。","en":"A long time has passed since then, and many things have happened.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r97","rowIndex":97,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　三人とおれは考え方は違ったが、ずっと恩を返したいと思っていたんだ。","en":"The three of them and I saw things differently, but I had always wanted to repay what I owed them.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r98","rowIndex":98,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=47>解放軍</tips>に参加したのだって、この爺さんたちのためだったんだ。それが、こうして三人を追い詰め、しょぼくれた表情をさせることになるとは思わなかった。","en":"Even my decision to join the <tips=47>Liberation Army</tips> had been made for the sake of these old men. Never did I imagine it would end with me cornering all three and putting those broken expressions on their faces.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r99","rowIndex":99,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「今になって言われるとはな。どうして疑った？　きっかけなどなかったろうに」","en":"“To think we would hear this from you after all these years. What made you suspect us? There should have been nothing to prompt it.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ミスター・スミス","displayName":"Mr. Smith","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r100","rowIndex":100,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=91>ミスター・スミス</tips>の岩のように厳めしい顔はいつもとは違って気が抜けたようになっていた。初めてみた表情だ。","en":"<tips=91>Mr. Smith’s</tips> rocklike, forbidding face has gone strangely slack. It is an expression I have never seen him wear before.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r101","rowIndex":101,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おれはその顔を見たくなかったが、目をそらしてもいけない。まっすぐ見届けるのがおれの責任だ。","en":"I do not want to see his face, but neither can I look away. It is my responsibility to witness this directly.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r102","rowIndex":102,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そりゃ、古くから知ってるものは誰も疑うはずもないだろうね。あんたらは、まったくよくやってくれた。この街がまだこんなに発達する前から、好きなように利用されるだけでどうしようもなかった<tips=17>タイプB</tips>を組織化し、助け合うような仕組みを作ったんだ。この街の<tips=17>タイプB</tips>はみなあんたらの世話になってるし、あんたらが仲間たちのためにどれだけノーマルの連中とやり合ってきたかも知ってる。……そりゃ誰も発症してないってのは多少は不自然だが、年取っても発症しないやつなんかごまんといるからね。そのことだけで本気でノーマルなのかと疑うやつはいなかったろうよ。事実、おれだってこれまで一度も疑ったことはなかったさ。あんたらは本当に<tips=17>タイプＢ</tips>の味方だったのさ」","en":"“Of course no one who had known you for years would ever think to suspect you. You did remarkable work. Before this city had grown into what it is today, you organized the <tips=17>Type Bs</tips> who had been helpless to resist exploitation and built a system through which they could support one another. Every <tips=17>Type B</tips> in this city owes you a debt, and everyone knows how often you fought the Normals on behalf of your comrades. True, it was somewhat unusual that not one of you ever suffered onset—but there are countless people who reach old age without doing so. No one would seriously suspect you of being Normals on that basis alone. I certainly never did. You truly stood on the side of the <tips=17>Type Bs</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r103","rowIndex":103,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「じゃあなぜ」","en":"“Then why?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ミスター・スミス","displayName":"Mr. Smith","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r104","rowIndex":104,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=91>ミスター・スミス</tips>の言葉に、<tips=67>カミラ</tips>が応える。","en":"<tips=67>Camilla</tips> answers <tips=91>Mr. Smith</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r105","rowIndex":105,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「密告があったんですよ。あなたたちがノーマルであると、証拠つきでね」","en":"“Someone informed on you—and brought evidence that you were Normals.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"カミラ","displayName":"Camilla","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r106","rowIndex":106,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=67>カミラ</tips>も<tips=22>老人たち</tips>には随分と世話になり、幼い頃から影響を受けた人間の一人の筈だ。","en":"<tips=67>Camilla</tips>, too, owes <tips=22>the old men</tips> a great deal. She is another of those whose lives they have shaped since childhood.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r107","rowIndex":107,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女はこの話が持ち込まれたときからかたくなに感情を排斥した態度をとっている。内心穏やかではないはずだろうが、その本心はわからない。","en":"From the moment this accusation was brought to us, she has maintained a rigid attitude of excluding emotion altogether. She cannot possibly be tranquil within, yet I have no way of knowing her true feelings.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r108","rowIndex":108,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「病院関係者ですか？」","en":"“Someone connected to the hospital?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ミスター・アーノルド","displayName":"Mr. Arnold","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r109","rowIndex":109,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=89>ミスター・アーノルド</tips>が物憂げに問うと、","en":"<tips=89>Mr. Arnold</tips> asks wearily.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r110","rowIndex":110,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ご名答です」","en":"“Precisely.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"カミラ","displayName":"Camilla","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r111","rowIndex":111,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=67>カミラ</tips>は無表情に頷いた。","en":"<tips=67>Camilla</tips> nods without expression.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r112","rowIndex":112,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　三人は自分たちの素性を知っている医者にかかると特別扱いされるからいやだという名目をつけて、街から離れた病院をかかりつけにしている。","en":"The three use a hospital well outside the city for their regular medical care. Their stated reason is that they dislike the special treatment they receive from doctors who know their identities.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r113","rowIndex":113,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そこの職員を名乗るものから告発があったのだ。","en":"Then an accusation came from someone claiming to be a staff member there.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r114","rowIndex":114,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　職員はどこかで三人がこの街の大物であることを知ったらしく、組織の根幹を揺るがす秘密があると<tips=47>解放軍</tips>に連絡をとってきた。どうにも胡散臭かったが、街までやって来て直接話す覚悟があるというので、もし嘘だったらどうにでも出来るだろうということで話だけを聞いた。","en":"The staff member had somehow learned that the three were powerful figures in this city and contacted the <tips=47>Liberation Army</tips>, claiming to know a secret that would shake the organization to its foundations. The approach reeked of suspicion, but the informant was prepared to enter the city and speak to us face-to-face. We agreed to hear the story on the reasoning that, if it proved a lie, we could dispose of the liar however we pleased.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r115","rowIndex":115,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　とても信じられない内容だったが、その職員は病院の血液の検査データを持っており、無視することは出来なかった。","en":"The story was almost impossible to believe, but the employee had brought the hospital’s blood-test data, and we could not ignore it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r116","rowIndex":116,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その後、ブラシの頭髪などから<tips=22>老人たち</tips>の体組織を採取し、それを解析に出してみたら、このような結果になったというわけだ。","en":"Afterward, we collected tissue from the <tips=22>old men</tips>—hair left in their brushes and similar traces—and sent the samples out for analysis. The results are what you see before you.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r117","rowIndex":117,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　データは弁護士の手に預けられ、おれや<tips=67>カミラ</tips>に何かあった場合は自動的に公表されることになっている。","en":"The data has been entrusted to a lawyer, with instructions that it be released automatically if anything happens to <tips=67>Camilla</tips> or me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r118","rowIndex":118,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　今これから<tips=22>老人たち</tips>が何かを企んだとしても、もう全てが手遅れだ。準備万端でこの宣告の場面にやって来ているのである。","en":"Whatever the <tips=22>old men</tips> might attempt from this moment on, it is already too late. We have come to deliver this sentence only after putting every possible safeguard in place.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r119","rowIndex":119,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なぜ、そんな告発を……。秘密は永久に守られる筈だったのに……」","en":"“Why would anyone make such an accusation...? The secret was supposed to be safe forever...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ミスター・スミス","displayName":"Mr. Smith","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r120","rowIndex":120,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=91>ミスター・スミス</tips>は力なくうなだれた。","en":"All strength gone from him, <tips=91>Mr. Smith</tips> lets his head droop.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r121","rowIndex":121,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　議論の余地がない証拠を突きつけられれば、<tips=22>老人たち</tips>も観念するしかなかった。そして、おれたちの提案に従うことを了承した。","en":"Confronted with evidence that admitted no argument, the <tips=22>old men</tips> had no choice but to resign themselves to defeat. They agreed to accept our terms.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r122","rowIndex":122,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　一週間後に、<tips=21>八龍会</tips>のネットワークに年齢を理由とした引退を発表する。後任は<tips=47>八龍解放軍</tips>の指導部がそのまま兼任する。つまり、おれがリーダーとなり、<tips=67>カミラ</tips>や<tips=66>コンタ</tips>が補佐を行ってゆくというわけだ。","en":"In one week, they will announce their age-mandated retirement across the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips> network. The command of the <tips=47>Hachiryu Liberation Army</tips> will assume the society’s leadership concurrently. In other words, I will become its leader, with <tips=67>Camilla</tips> and <tips=66>Konta</tips> serving as my deputies.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r123","rowIndex":123,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まあ、気を落とすことはないさ。あんたたちだっていずれおれをボスにするつもりだったんだろう？　少し時期が早くなっただけじゃないか」","en":"“Come on, don’t be discouraged. You meant to make me boss eventually anyway, didn’t you? It’s just happening a little sooner than planned.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r124","rowIndex":124,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おれが最後に言ったが、三人は一言も口をきかなかった。","en":"I make this final attempt at consolation, but not one of the three utters a word.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r125","rowIndex":125,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「さすがですね」","en":"“I should have expected no less.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"カミラ","displayName":"Camilla","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r126","rowIndex":126,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　車に戻ると、<tips=67>カミラ</tips>が関心したように言った。","en":"Once we return to the car, <tips=67>Camilla</tips> speaks with admiration.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r127","rowIndex":127,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「何がだい？」","en":"“What is?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r128","rowIndex":128,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　いつもおれに対してトゲのある言葉ばかり投げかけるこの女が、珍しく褒めるようなことを言ったのでおれは若干調子を狂わせながらそう問い返した。","en":"This woman ordinarily hurls nothing but barbed remarks in my direction. Hearing her offer something like praise for once throws me slightly off balance as I ask the question.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r129","rowIndex":129,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=22>老人たち</tips>に対して、あれほど冷静に振る舞えるとは思いませんでした。隊長とはあれほど親密でしたのに」","en":"“I did not expect you to remain so composed before <tips=22>the old men</tips>. You were very close to them.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"カミラ","displayName":"Camilla","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r130","rowIndex":130,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ああ、それか……」","en":"“Oh, that...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r131","rowIndex":131,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=67>カミラ</tips>はどうしてこう素直になっちまったんだろう？　妙に照れくさい。おれは鼻をかいて、","en":"Why has <tips=67>Camilla</tips> gotten so honest all of a sudden? It is strangely embarrassing. I scratch my nose and say,","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r132","rowIndex":132,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ああいう場面で、言い渡すおれの方がおどおどしていたら、かえって相手にも失礼というものさ」","en":"“In a situation like that, if the man passing sentence were the one trembling and uncertain, it would only insult the people receiving it.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r133","rowIndex":133,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=10>見土</tips>隊長はいつも堂々としていますよね。危険な場面でも率先して前に立ち、怯えたところはけして見せない……みなが信頼してリーダーにしたがる理由が最近少しずつわかってきたような気がします」","en":"“Commander <tips=10>Mido</tips>, you always carry yourself with such confidence. Even in danger, you take the lead and stand at the front. You never show fear... Recently, I feel as if I have gradually begun to understand why everyone trusts you and wants you as their leader.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"カミラ","displayName":"Camilla","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r134","rowIndex":134,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「何かおかしなものでも食べたのかい？　今日はいつもと違うじゃないか」","en":"“Did you eat something strange? You’re not yourself today.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r135","rowIndex":135,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「私は認めるところは認めます。私もこれから成長しなくてはいけないのですから」","en":"“I acknowledge what deserves acknowledgment. I too must continue to grow.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"カミラ","displayName":"Camilla","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r136","rowIndex":136,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=67>カミラ</tips>は目を輝かせている。彼女は、自分たちが組織のリーダーになったことが単純に誇らしいのだろう。","en":"<tips=67>Camilla’s</tips> eyes shine. Perhaps she is simply proud that we now stand at the head of the organization.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r137","rowIndex":137,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ま、あんまり張り詰めないことだよ」","en":"“Just try not to get too wound up.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r138","rowIndex":138,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　一方おれはそんな浮かれた気持ちにはなれなかった。","en":"Meanwhile, I could not share in that elation.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r139","rowIndex":139,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それより、早速次の仕事にとりかかろうじゃないか。我々には休んでいる暇などないんだ」","en":"“More importantly, let us begin the next job at once. We have no time to rest.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r140","rowIndex":140,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうですね。<tips=65>ヘス</tips>を始末し、そしたら次は<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>の<tips=1>謝亮</tips>です。我々を恐れ戦いを避けているあの臆病ものを倒しましょう。いくら<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>が抗争に強いといっても、弱点を克服した我々とは生物としての能力が違いすぎます。……しかし、あの<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>を相手に堂々と立ち向かうものがあらわれるなど、誰が想像出来ましたか？　これが我々の真の力なのです。今までは虐げられていましたが、これからは、もう誰に対しても怯える必要なんかない……」","en":"“Yes. First we dispose of <tips=65>Hess</tips>, and after him comes <tips=1>Tse Leung</tips> of <tips=7>YS</tips>. We will defeat the coward who fears us and hides from battle. <tips=7>YS</tips> may excel at gang warfare, but now that we have overcome our weakness, the difference in our capabilities as living organisms is simply too great. Who could ever have imagined that a force would arise to confront <tips=7>YS</tips> openly? This is our true power. Until now, we were the oppressed. From this moment on, there is no one left for us to fear...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"カミラ","displayName":"Camilla","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r141","rowIndex":141,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=67>カミラ</tips>は興奮で息を荒らげている。おれはそれを横目に溜息をつく。","en":"<tips=67>Camilla’s</tips> breath comes fast with excitement. I watch her from the corner of my eye and sigh.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r142","rowIndex":142,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　運転席に座った部下がアクセルを踏むと、車が静かに発進する。","en":"When the subordinate in the driver’s seat steps on the accelerator, the car pulls away quietly.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r143","rowIndex":143,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　今<tips=67>カミラ</tips>が口にしたが、今日はこのほかにも大事な仕事がある。","en":"As <tips=67>Camilla</tips> has just said, there is another important task awaiting us today.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r144","rowIndex":144,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=65>エフゲニ・ヘス</tips>……『<tips=46>ネオ・ローズ</tips>』をもたらしたあの髭の老人を始末する。","en":"<tips=65>Yevgeny Hess</tips>... We are going to eliminate the bearded old man who brought us ‘<tips=46>Neo Rose</tips>.’","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r145","rowIndex":145,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　爺さんたちへの引退勧告と同時に進めていた計画である。爺さんたちがこんな形で引退するという情報が広がる前にけりをつける必要があった。","en":"We had advanced this plan in parallel with the ultimatum forcing the old men into retirement. It had to be concluded before word spread of the circumstances in which they were stepping down.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r146","rowIndex":146,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　以前から、『<tips=46>ネオ・ローズ</tips>』の製法を明かそうとしない<tips=65>ヘス</tips>と今後どうつき合ってゆくかというのは、<tips=21>八龍会</tips>のテーマだった。","en":"For some time, what to do about <tips=65>Hess</tips>, who refused to reveal the manufacturing process for ‘<tips=46>Neo Rose</tips>,’ had been a standing concern for the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r147","rowIndex":147,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　我々<tips=17>タイプＢ</tips>の明るい未来は『<tips=46>ネオ・ローズ</tips>』なくしてはありえない。","en":"Our bright future as <tips=17>Type Bs</tips> is impossible without ‘<tips=46>Neo Rose</tips>.’","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r148","rowIndex":148,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その製法を<tips=65>ヘス</tips>が明かさず独占してるということは、すなわち彼に常に急所を押さえられているってことだ。","en":"So long as <tips=65>Hess</tips> conceals and monopolizes the manufacturing process, he keeps a hand permanently closed around our vital point.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r149","rowIndex":149,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　これは組織にとって非常に危険な状況である。","en":"This is an extremely dangerous situation for the organization.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r150","rowIndex":150,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　うちの爺さんたちも、どうにかその秘密を盗み出そうとしていたが、なかなか手が出せなかった。","en":"Our old men had been trying somehow to steal the secret, but they could never make a move.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r151","rowIndex":151,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=65>ヘス</tips>は非常に用心深く、尾行をつけてもうまくまかれてしまう。そして、下手なことをすれば金の卵を産む鶏を殺すことになりかねないから、こちらも強硬な手段をとることが出来ない。","en":"<tips=65>Hess</tips> is extraordinarily cautious; whenever we place a tail on him, he shakes it with ease. At the same time, one clumsy move could kill the goose that lays the golden eggs, leaving us unable to employ harsher measures.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r152","rowIndex":152,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　だから今まで彼の言いなりになるしかなかったのだけれど、たとえ無茶でも行動を起こさなくてはいけない理由が先日出来た。","en":"Until now, therefore, we had no choice but to submit to his demands. Then, several days ago, something happened that left us no alternative but to act, however reckless the attempt.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r153","rowIndex":153,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　――ちょうど<tips=47>解放軍</tips>が出来たその日、つまり病院を襲撃した日の夜のことだ。","en":"—It was the very day the <tips=47>Liberation Army</tips> was formed: the night of the hospital attack.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r154","rowIndex":154,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=65>ヘス</tips>は爺さんたちのところに挨拶に来ていたのだけれども、その帰り、それは起きた。","en":"<tips=65>Hess</tips> had come to pay his respects to the old men. As he was leaving, it happened.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r155","rowIndex":155,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　爺さんの家にはカメラが仕掛けてある。普通防犯カメラは目立つところにつけて悪い気持ちを起こさないようにするもんだけれども、こいつは防犯が目的ではなく、来訪者の姿を記録するといういやらしい目的で設置されていた。ドアの上についている照明のそばに小さな穴があって、そこから玄関の前を撮影しているのだけれども、まあ知ってなければまず存在に気がつかないだろう。","en":"A camera is hidden at the old men’s house. Ordinarily, security cameras are mounted where they can be seen, discouraging anyone from entertaining criminal ideas. This device, however, was installed not for prevention but for the rather nasty purpose of recording visitors without their knowledge. Beside the light above the door is a tiny aperture through which it films the entrance. Unless you know to look for it, you would almost certainly never notice it at all.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r156","rowIndex":156,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そのカメラが一部始終を捉えたんだ。","en":"That camera captured the entire affair.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r157","rowIndex":157,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　まず、用事を終えて玄関を出て来た<tips=65>ヘス</tips>の姿が映る。","en":"First, the footage shows <tips=65>Hess</tips> emerging from the entrance after finishing his business.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r158","rowIndex":158,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼は帰宅するために歩き出すが、すぐにその足が止まる。彼の正面、門の向こう側にもう一人別の人間が現れたのだ。","en":"He starts walking home, but quickly stops. Another person has appeared directly ahead of him, beyond the gate.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r159","rowIndex":159,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　真っ黒なコートと、真っ黒な帽子と、真っ黒なマスクをかぶったいかにも怪しいヤツだが、そのマスクの鳥の嘴を見れば、わかるやつはすぐにわかるだろう。そいつがかつて<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>と共に<tips=18>ローズ・クラブ</tips>を滅ぼし、<tips=68>木下組</tips>を撤退させた『ドクター』だって。","en":"The figure in the pitch-black coat, pitch-black hat, and pitch-black mask could scarcely look more suspicious. Yet anyone who recognizes the bird’s beak on that mask will understand at once. This is “the Doctor,” the man who once joined <tips=3>Chris Tse</tips> in destroying the <tips=18>Rose Club</tips> and driving the <tips=68>Kinoshita-gumi</tips> out of the city.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r160","rowIndex":160,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　まあ、これだけじゃ同じ格好をした別人かもしれないが、とにかくその『ドクター』の姿をした人物が目の前に立ちはだかり、さっとコートの胸元に手を突っ込む。","en":"The costume alone, of course, leaves open the possibility that this is some other person dressed the same way. Regardless, the figure in the guise of “the Doctor” bars Hess’s path and darts a hand inside the front of the coat.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r161","rowIndex":161,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　明らかに銃を抜こうとするその人物を前に、<tips=65>ヘス</tips>はこう声をあげるわけだ。","en":"Faced with the figure, who is plainly about to draw a gun, <tips=65>Hess</tips> cries out:","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r162","rowIndex":162,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「オマエは……。おお、こんなところで出会うとは……」","en":"“You... Ah, to meet you here, of all places...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r163","rowIndex":163,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして<tips=65>ヘス</tips>がかがみ込むと、帽子が落ちる。そしてヤツは変身したんだよ。若い黒髪の女に。","en":"<tips=65>Hess</tips> bends forward and the hat tumbles off. And then the bastard transforms—into a young woman with black hair.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r164","rowIndex":164,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「お前は『ドクター』だな？」","en":"“You’re ‘the Doctor,’ aren’t you?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r165","rowIndex":165,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　女になった<tips=65>ヘス</tips>はそう呼びかける。<tips=65>ヘス</tips>もまた、『ドクター』のことを知っているんだ。","en":"Now in the form of a woman, <tips=65>Hess</tips> addresses him by that name. <tips=65>Hess</tips>, too, knows of “the Doctor.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r166","rowIndex":166,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「おい、その姿、お前は『ドクター』だろう？　かつて<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>の一味だった、あいつだろう？　昔とそっくり同じ姿をしているぞ」","en":"“Hey. That disguise—you are ‘the Doctor,’ aren’t you? The one who ran with <tips=3>Chris Tse</tips>. You look exactly as you did then.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r167","rowIndex":167,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「私にそのように反応する、お前こそ何者だ？　なぜその建物から出て来た？」","en":"“Who are you, that the sight of me provokes such a reaction? Why have you come out of that building?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r168","rowIndex":168,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ほう、本人か。まさかこんなところで会えるとはね。……嬉しいよ。この長い間、<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>とお前に対する憎しみを忘れたことはない……」","en":"“Oh, so you are the real thing. Never did I imagine I would meet you here... I am delighted. Not once in all these years have I forgotten my hatred for <tips=3>Chris Tse</tips>—or for you...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r169","rowIndex":169,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　二人はそう言葉をかわす。何か因縁があるのは間違いない。そしてお互い銃を抜いて撃ち合うんだが、『ドクター』の弾は当たらず、女の弾は相手の腕に命中する。そして『ドクター』は逃げる。女は銃を撃ちながら追いかけようとするが、サイズの合わない男物のスーツ姿ではどうも勝手が違うらしく、転ぶ。","en":"That is the exchange between them. There can be no question that some history lies between the two. They draw almost together and trade shots, but “the Doctor” misses while the woman’s bullet strikes him in the arm. “The Doctor” flees. The woman attempts to pursue him, firing as she goes, but the oversized man’s suit moves differently from the body she now inhabits, and she trips and falls.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r170","rowIndex":170,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして諦めて戻ってくると、口の中で独り言をぶつぶつとつぶやきながら、もう一度姿を変える。――次の姿は、その日おれたちと一緒に行動したあの<tips=62>マリア</tips>とかいう金髪のガキなんだよ。","en":"When she gives up and returns, she mutters something under her breath and transforms again. ...Her next form is the blond brat called <tips=62>Maria</tips> who acted alongside us that day.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r171","rowIndex":171,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　いや驚いたね。どういう関係なのかと思っていたが、まさか同一人物の変身した姿だったとは。","en":"That came as a surprise. I had wondered what their relationship could be, but I never imagined they were forms assumed by the same person.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r172","rowIndex":172,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　で、<tips=62>マリア</tips>になったそいつは、その場で服をするすると脱ぐ。そして全裸のまま、撃ち合う前に地面に落とした鞄のところにしゃがみこみ、開けようとしたところで、急に顔を上げた。","en":"Then, after turning into <tips=62>Maria</tips>, the figure slips out of her clothes on the spot. Still stark naked, she crouches by the bag she dropped on the ground before the gunfight and starts to open it—then suddenly looks up.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r173","rowIndex":173,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　これは、何か物音を聞いたんだろうね。","en":"She must have heard something.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r174","rowIndex":174,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　玄関先で銃声が鳴り響いたものだから、家の中の爺さんたちも驚いた。爺さんたちは奥の部屋へ避難し、若い衆に玄関の様子を見に行かせたんだ。<tips=62>マリア</tips>がそのとき聞いたのは、若い衆が開けたドアの音だったんだよ。","en":"The gunshots at the entrance startled the old men inside the house. They evacuated to a room farther in and sent one of their young men to inspect the entrance. What <tips=62>Maria</tips> heard then was the door the young man opened.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r175","rowIndex":175,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　急に背後に現れた人物に<tips=62>マリア</tips>はすっかり驚いてしまったらしく、鞄を掴んだままぴょんとジャンプして、姿を消した。例の瞬間移動能力を使ったのさ。","en":"The sudden appearance of someone behind her apparently startles <tips=62>Maria</tips> out of her wits. Still clutching the bag, she gives a little hop and vanishes. She has used that teleportation ability of hers.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r176","rowIndex":176,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　――カメラに映っていたのはこれだけ。","en":"—That was all the camera captured.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r177","rowIndex":177,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その後、すぐ近くの路上で仮面をかぶった『ドクター』の切断された死体が発見された。そして、おれたちはすぐに<tips=62>マリア</tips>――つまり<tips=65>ヘス</tips>の仕業だとわかった。追いかけていって、切断したのさ。<tips=51>さくら</tips>の足をすっぱりやったみたいにさ。","en":"Soon afterward, the severed corpse of the masked “Doctor” was discovered on a nearby street. We knew at once that <tips=62>Maria</tips>—which is to say, <tips=65>Hess</tips>—was responsible. She must have pursued him and cut him apart, just as she had sliced clean through <tips=51>Sakura’s</tips> legs.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r178","rowIndex":178,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　この『ドクター』の正体は<tips=5>太刀川</tips>先生らしいね。おれたちが襲ったあの病院に勤務していて、夜は施設の子供の診察をしていた、評判のいい医者だ。","en":"The ‘Doctor’ appears to have been Dr. <tips=5>Tachikawa</tips>. He worked at the hospital we attacked and was a well-regarded doctor who treated children at a facility by night.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r179","rowIndex":179,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼が本当に昔の『ドクター』なのか、単にその姿をマネしたのかは結局定かじゃないが、多分本物だろう。『ドクター』は<tips=16>タイプA</tips>のサイキックだったそうだし、<tips=5>太刀川</tips>先生の死体にも<tips=77>特質変異</tips>があったらしいからね。まあどちらにしろ、せっかく病院の襲撃から生き延びることが出来たのに、気の毒なことさ。","en":"We never established whether he truly was the Doctor of old or merely someone imitating the appearance, but in all probability he was genuine. The Doctor was said to be a <tips=16>Type A</tips> psychic, and Dr. <tips=5>Tachikawa’s</tips> corpse apparently displayed a <tips=77>trait mutation</tips>. Either way, it is a sad business. After surviving our attack on the hospital, the poor man met his death here instead.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r180","rowIndex":180,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　まあ、彼のことはいい。おれたちにとって重要なのは<tips=65>ヘス</tips>の方だ。","en":"Well, never mind him. The one who matters to us is <tips=65>Hess</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r181","rowIndex":181,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=65>ヘス</tips>は、『ドクター』を知っていて、並々ならぬ憎悪があった。<tips=62>マリア</tips>として<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>の<tips=41>グランドタワー</tips>を襲撃した。彼がもたらす薬の名が『<tips=46>ネオ・ローズ</tips>』。――ここで情報が結びつく。","en":"<tips=65>Hess</tips> knew the Doctor and bore him an extraordinary hatred. In the form of <tips=62>Maria</tips>, Hess attacked the <tips=41>Grand Tower</tips> of <tips=7>YS</tips>. And the drug brought to us bears the name <tips=46>Neo Rose</tips>. Here, at last, the separate pieces lock together.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r182","rowIndex":182,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　やつは、『<tips=18>ローズ・クラブ</tips>』の関係者なんだ。そう考えれば不自然な点がいろいろと解決する。ほぼ間違いないだろう。","en":"He was involved with the ‘<tips=18>Rose Club</tips>.’ That assumption resolves a number of otherwise strange details. There can be little doubt.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r183","rowIndex":183,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　我々<tips=21>八龍会</tips>にとって、『<tips=18>ローズ・クラブ</tips>』ってのは、誰よりも――あの<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>よりも憎い敵でね。かつて多くの<tips=17>タイプB</tips>を、発症してわけのわからなくなってるものまで、騙して連れ去り、店では奴隷のように扱ったんだ。","en":"For the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips>, the <tips=18>Rose Club</tips> is a more hated enemy than any other—even <tips=7>YS</tips>. It deceived and carried off countless <tips=17>Type Bs</tips>, including people rendered helpless and incoherent by onset, then treated them as slaves inside the club.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r184","rowIndex":184,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その憎しみは今でも消えていない。","en":"That hatred has not faded even now.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r185","rowIndex":185,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　さて、この事実が発覚してから、<tips=47>解放軍</tips>で彼についての議論が行われたんだが、意見は割れた。","en":"Now, after this fact came to light, the <tips=47>Liberation Army</tips> debated what to do about him, but opinions were divided.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r186","rowIndex":186,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=65>ヘス</tips>が『<tips=18>ローズ・クラブ</tips>』の関係者なら<tips=21>八龍会</tips>の仇敵だ。当時家族を亡くしたものも会にはたくさん存在する。とても生かしておくことは出来ない。考えてみれば、彼は現在も我々を利用している。<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>へ我々をけしかけようとしているのも、彼の復讐のためだろう。もしかしたらヤツは、『<tips=18>ローズ・クラブ</tips>』を復活させようとしているのではないか？　そして、今のように『<tips=46>ネオ・ローズ</tips>』を握られていては、我々はまた彼によって搾取されることになる。今すぐ殺すべきだ。『<tips=46>ネオ・ローズ</tips>』の製法はその後で彼の荷物などをあさって入手すればいい。","en":"If <tips=65>Hess</tips> was involved with the <tips=18>Rose Club</tips>, then Hess is the sworn enemy of the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips>. Many members of the society lost family in those days. We cannot possibly allow such a person to live. And when one thinks about it, Hess is exploiting us even now. The attempt to set us against <tips=7>YS</tips> is probably being made in service of a private revenge. Perhaps the ultimate intention is to resurrect the <tips=18>Rose Club</tips> itself. So long as Hess controls <tips=46>Neo Rose</tips>, we will only be exploited again. We should kill Hess at once. Afterward, we can search the belongings and recover the manufacturing method for <tips=46>Neo Rose</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r187","rowIndex":187,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それに対する反対意見はこうだ。","en":"The opposing argument went like this.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r188","rowIndex":188,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=65>ヘス</tips>に何か企みがあるにしろ、<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>を敵としている点に関しては利害が一致している。手を組むことが出来る。過去のことはおいて、彼をコントロールし、利用するべきではないのか？　そもそも、我々はまだ『<tips=46>ネオ・ローズ</tips>』のレシピを入手していない。彼を殺しても製法を発見出来なければ、『<tips=46>ネオ・ローズ</tips>』は永遠に失われてしまうわけで、そうなれば我々はまたか弱い存在に逆戻りするだけだ。","en":"Whatever <tips=65>Hess</tips> may be plotting, our interests coincide in treating <tips=7>YS</tips> as an enemy. An alliance remains possible. Should we not set the past aside, bring Hess under our control, and make use of that power? Above all, we do not yet possess the formula for <tips=46>Neo Rose</tips>. If we kill Hess only to fail in discovering the production method, <tips=46>Neo Rose</tips> will be lost forever, and we will return to being weak and vulnerable.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r189","rowIndex":189,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼と手を組むか、排除するか、『<tips=46>ネオ・ローズ</tips>』のことを考えるとなかなか難しい問題だったが。結局議論は後者でまとまった。やはり<tips=65>ヘス</tips>は殺す。このまま関係を維持するにはあまりにも危険な人物だ。仮に彼が『<tips=18>ローズ・クラブ</tips>』と関係のない人間であったとしても、あのサイキック能力は脅威である。","en":"Whether to join forces with him or eliminate him was a difficult question given ‘<tips=46>Neo Rose</tips>.’ In the end, however, the debate settled on the latter. We will kill <tips=65>Hess</tips> after all. He is far too dangerous a man for us to maintain this relationship. Even if he has no connection to the ‘<tips=18>Rose Club</tips>,’ his psychic power is a threat.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r190","rowIndex":190,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　まあ妥当な意見だろう。","en":"A reasonable conclusion, I think.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r191","rowIndex":191,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ちなみにおれは議論が苦手なので、議論のあいだは意見を言わずにうんうんと頷きながら見て、大体流れが決まったところで「こちらで決定しよう」と、偉そうに断言しただけだ。","en":"As it happens, I am no good at debate. While the others argued, I offered no opinion at all; I merely watched, nodding along with a solemn “mm-hmm” now and then. Once the tide had more or less settled in one direction, I announced grandly, “Then this is our decision.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r192","rowIndex":192,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　子供の時からおれは大体このやり方である。<tips=66>コンタ</tips>とか<tips=1>亮</tips>とか賢い連中が意見を述べるのを聞いて、最後に決めるだけ。そして間違った時には責任をとる。まったくボスというのは楽なものだ。","en":"That has been my method since childhood. I listen while clever fellows like <tips=66>Konta</tips> and <tips=1>Leung</tips> give their opinions, and at the end I do nothing but choose. If the choice proves wrong, I take responsibility. Really, being the boss is the easiest job in the world.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r193","rowIndex":193,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　で、そうして<tips=65>ヘス</tips>を殺す作戦が立てられたのだが、別に複雑なものじゃない。","en":"And so we devised a plan to kill <tips=65>Hess</tips>, but it was nothing complicated.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r194","rowIndex":194,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　まず<tips=65>ヘス</tips>を呼び出す。","en":"First, we lure <tips=65>Hess</tips> to a place of our choosing.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r195","rowIndex":195,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　用心深いヤツも、『<tips=46>ネオ・ローズ</tips>』の新しい製造工場を作ると言えばやって来るだろう。","en":"Even a cautious man will come if we tell him we are establishing a new manufacturing plant for ‘<tips=46>Neo Rose</tips>.’","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r196","rowIndex":196,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　製造工場は<tips=65>ヘス</tips>の許可がないと新設が出来ない。だから、こちらで候補地を見つけたら<tips=65>ヘス</tips>に確認してもらうことになっている。彼はいつも、敷地をぐるりと回って、材料の運搬車が入るスペースや、建物の構造などを確認してから許可を出す。","en":"No new plant can be established without <tips=65>Hess’s</tips> permission. Whenever we identify a candidate site, <tips=65>Hess</tips> must therefore be brought in to inspect it. Hess always makes a full circuit of the grounds, checks the access space for trucks delivering materials, examines the building’s structure, and grants approval only afterward.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r197","rowIndex":197,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　今回は<tips=21>八龍会</tips>の支援者が所有している空き倉庫のひとつを工場にすると言ってあった。遅刻をしない<tips=65>ヘス</tips>は予定時間通りに姿を現す。そこを射殺するというわけだ。","en":"This time, we had told him we meant to convert one of the empty warehouses owned by a supporter of the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips>. <tips=65>Hess</tips>, who is never late, appears at the appointed time. Then we shoot him dead.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r198","rowIndex":198,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼と決めた時間はそれほど先のことではない。おれたちは爺さんたちの家を出発すると、段取り通りそのまま次の作戦の舞台となるその工場へと向かった。","en":"The time we had arranged with him was not far off. After leaving the old men’s house, we followed the plan and headed straight for the factory that would serve as the stage for our next operation.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r199","rowIndex":199,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　現地には襲撃のための別働隊がすでに準備を終えており、彼らと合流すると、弁当を食いながら、作戦の最終確認を行う。","en":"A separate assault team has already completed its preparations at the site. After joining them, we conduct the final operational review over boxed lunches.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r200","rowIndex":200,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　やって来た<tips=65>ヘス</tips>を出迎えるのは清水という、『<tips=46>ネオ・ローズ</tips>』の製造を統括している男だ。<tips=47>解放軍</tips>のメンバーが出迎えれば警戒されるということで、普段から<tips=65>ヘス</tips>と共に仕事を行っている彼に協力してもらって、一芝居打って貰うことにした。","en":"The man who will receive <tips=65>Hess</tips> is Shimizu, the person responsible for overseeing ‘<tips=46>Neo Rose</tips>’ manufacture. A member of the <tips=47>Liberation Army</tips> might make <tips=65>Hess</tips> suspicious, so we enlisted Shimizu, who works with him regularly, to help us put on an act.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r201","rowIndex":201,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　清水は元ギャングであったが、さすがに爺さんたちがノーマルであることや、我々が<tips=65>ヘス</tips>を殺そうと思っていることを伝えたときはその角張ってゴツゴツとした顔を真っ青にしていた。今も緊張しているのか、弁当に手をつけようとしない。","en":"Shimizu used to be a gangster, but even his square, rugged face went deathly pale when we told him the old men were Normals and that we intended to kill <tips=65>Hess</tips>. He still appears too nervous to touch his lunch.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r202","rowIndex":202,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=66>コンタ</tips>が調達してくれたその弁当は、近くのベトナム料理店が昼時に販売している本格的な生春巻きやらから揚げやらスパイシーな炒め物やらたくさんのおかずが付いた人気の弁当で、いつも長い行列が出来ていておいそれとは食えないシロモノである。","en":"The boxed lunches <tips=66>Konta</tips> procured come from a nearby Vietnamese restaurant. It is a popular lunch set packed with authentic fresh spring rolls, fried chicken, spicy stir-fries, and any number of other dishes. The place always draws a long line at noon, making these boxes no easy thing to obtain.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r203","rowIndex":203,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「清水さん。リラックスだよ。リラックス。こういうときこそ食い物を楽しまなきゃ」","en":"“Relax, Mr. Shimizu. Relax. Times like these are precisely when you need to enjoy your food.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r204","rowIndex":204,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「はあ……」","en":"“Right...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"清水（シミズ）","displayName":"Shimizu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r205","rowIndex":205,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　清水は申し訳程度に箸をのばすが、一口二口囓った程度でまた手を止めてしまう。","en":"Shimizu reaches for his chopsticks as a gesture of compliance, but after nibbling once or twice, he stops again.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r206","rowIndex":206,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そんなに食欲がなくなるものなのかい？　おれはこれからいっちょやってやるぞって時こそ、ものがうまく感じたり、気持ちがあがってくるんだけどね。今朝だって二回も飯をおかわりしちゃったよ」","en":"“Does a thing like this really destroy your appetite? Me, whenever I’m about to go out and do something big, food tastes better and my blood starts pumping. I went back for seconds twice just this morning.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r207","rowIndex":207,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そりゃあんなかわいい女の子が手料理作ってくれれば食欲も出るよ」","en":"“Naturally you’d have an appetite when a girl that cute cooks for you.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"田中紺太","displayName":"Konta Tanaka","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r208","rowIndex":208,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=66>コンタ</tips>が苦笑しながら言う。<tips=44>詩由子</tips>と面識がありその正体も知っている彼は、彼女がこれからうちで暮らすと打ち明けたとき、はじめは驚いていたが事情を話すと納得してくれた。やはり持つべきは子供の頃からの友人である。","en":"<tips=66>Konta</tips> says this with a wry smile. He has met <tips=44>Shiyuko</tips> and knows her true identity. When I confided that she would be living with me from then on, he was surprised at first, but understood once I explained the circumstances. At times like these, nothing beats a friend one has known since childhood.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r209","rowIndex":209,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それに、<tips=10>道夫</tips>君の精神構造はちょっとおかしいのさ。昔からやばいときこそテンションあがる。最後に絶対勝つって信じてるのは、やっぱり漫画の読み過ぎなのかな？　自分のことを主人公だと思ってるんだよ。昔なんかさ、喧嘩でパンチをするときとか、自分で考えた技名を叫びながら殴るんだよ？　そんなやつ他に見たことないよ。しかも大体叫んだせいで隙が出来て空振りしたり、カウンターもらったりするんだ。みんな恥ずかしくて仕方がなかった」","en":"“Besides, <tips=10>Michio’s</tips> mind is wired a little strangely. The worse the danger, the more excited he gets. Maybe he read too many comics and came to believe he is guaranteed to win in the end. He thinks he is the protagonist. When we were children, he would actually shout names he had invented for his special moves every time he threw a punch. Have you ever seen anyone else do that? Usually the shout left such a wide opening that he either swung at empty air or ate a counterpunch. The rest of us were mortified.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"田中紺太","displayName":"Konta Tanaka","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r210","rowIndex":210,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　前言撤回。ガキのころの過ちをいつまでも覚えてるようなやつとつるむべきじゃない。","en":"I retract what I just said. A man should never keep company with someone who remembers his childhood humiliations forever.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r211","rowIndex":211,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しかし、そのおかげで清水はちょっと笑ってくれた。","en":"It does at least make Shimizu laugh a little.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r212","rowIndex":212,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　なかなか良い雰囲気じゃないの、と思っていたら、","en":"I am thinking that we have created quite a pleasant mood when Camilla intervenes.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r213","rowIndex":213,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「田中副隊長。仮にも隊長を馬鹿にするような発言は慎んで下さい。士気にかかわります」","en":"“Deputy Commander Tanaka. Please refrain from remarks that ridicule the commander, even in jest. They will affect morale.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"カミラ","displayName":"Camilla","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r214","rowIndex":214,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=67>カミラ</tips>が冷たく言い放つ。せっかくあたたまった雰囲気に水をかけるような所業である。","en":"<tips=67>Camilla</tips> delivers the rebuke coldly, pouring a bucket of water over the warmth we had worked so hard to create.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r215","rowIndex":215,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「別にそれくらいいいって」","en":"“It doesn’t matter. Let him say that much.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r216","rowIndex":216,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いけません。隊長も自覚してください。これからは<tips=47>解放軍</tips>だけでなく、<tips=21>八龍会</tips>の代表となるんですよ？」","en":"“That won’t do. You need to be mindful of your position too, Commander. From now on, you’ll represent not only the <tips=47>Liberation Army</tips> but the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips> as well.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"カミラ","displayName":"Camilla","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r217","rowIndex":217,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=67>カミラ</tips>はおれのことをさほど認めてはいないのはわかっているが、立場上こんな言葉が出て来るのだろう。","en":"I know <tips=67>Camilla</tips> does not think especially highly of me, but her position must compel her to say such things.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r218","rowIndex":218,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いやあ、おれは昔からこういうタイプだからねえ。堅苦しくすることは出来ないのよ。それとも、<tips=67>カミラ</tips>が隊長をやるかい？」","en":"“I’ve always been this sort of man. I can’t make myself stiff and formal. Would you rather be commander, <tips=67>Camilla</tips>?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r219","rowIndex":219,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……私では誰も納得しません。隊長が適任なんです」","en":"“...No one would accept me. You are the one suited to command.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"カミラ","displayName":"Camilla","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r220","rowIndex":220,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=67>カミラ</tips>は顔を顰めながら言う。自分の口でこんなことを認めるのはいやなんだろう。","en":"<tips=67>Camilla</tips> grimaces as she says it. Acknowledging such a thing aloud must displease her.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r221","rowIndex":221,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　この性格だから、彼女を嫌う人も多い。本人はそれをいやというほど自覚しているからこんな台詞になるんだろうけど、おれからすれば彼女でも充分隊長は務まると思っている。嫌われている反面、彼女の潔癖さを愛している人間が多いのも知っているからね。","en":"A personality like hers inspires plenty of dislike. She herself is painfully aware of that, which must be why she answers as she does. To my mind, however, she would be more than capable of serving as commander. For every person who dislikes her, I know another who loves that incorruptible severity in her.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r222","rowIndex":222,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　特に、病院襲撃のときに彼女が率いた荒くれ者どもはあれ以来妙になついている。","en":"The rough men she led in the hospital attack, in particular, have grown strangely attached to her ever since.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r223","rowIndex":223,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=67>カミラ</tips>もそういう自分の長所に気づけばもっとラクに生きられるんだろうが。","en":"If <tips=67>Camilla</tips> recognized that strength in herself, she might find life easier.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r224","rowIndex":224,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　いつかは彼女にリーダーの座を譲り、おれは饅頭売りに戻って、<tips=44>詩由子</tips>と二人で小さな店を<tips=59>暗闇通り</tips>の端にでも構えたいなあというのが今の夢である。これだけのことをしておいて、そんな平和な生活を望むのは虫が良すぎるだろうか？　けれどまあ、夢は夢だからね。","en":"My dream now is that one day I will hand the leadership over to her, return to selling manju, and open a little shop with <tips=44>Shiyuko</tips> somewhere on the edge of <tips=59>Darkness Street</tips>. After everything I have done, perhaps it is shamelessly self-serving to wish for such a peaceful life. But then, a dream is only a dream.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r225","rowIndex":225,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　さて、そうして食事を終えてから最後の打ち合わせをすると、おれたちは持ち場についてその時間を待った。","en":"Once we finish eating and complete the final briefing, we take our positions and wait for the appointed time.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r226","rowIndex":226,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　倉庫では清水が待ち、<tips=66>コンタ</tips>をはじめとする<tips=47>解放軍</tips>の襲撃部隊の三人は倉庫のあちこちに隠れる。そしておれと<tips=67>カミラ</tips>は別室で、倉庫内に仕掛けられたカメラがとらえる映像を見ながら彼らに指示を下すのだ。","en":"Shimizu waits in the warehouse, while the three members of the <tips=47>Liberation Army</tips> assault team, including <tips=66>Konta</tips>, hide throughout it. <tips=67>Camilla</tips> and I remain in another room, watching the feed from cameras concealed inside the warehouse and issuing instructions.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r227","rowIndex":227,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=65>ヘス</tips>はボディーガードのようなものを持たず、いつも一人で行動をしている。だから、本来ならば老人一人をだまし討ちにして殺すだけの簡単な仕事ではあるのだが、今回は油断は禁物だ。相手は普通の老人ではなく変身能力のあるサイキックで、しかもその変身する姿のひとつはたった一人で<tips=41>グランドタワー</tips>を恐怖に陥れた化け物のような力を持っている。","en":"<tips=65>Hess</tips> keeps nothing resembling a bodyguard and always moves alone. Ordinarily, ambushing and killing a solitary old man would be simple work. This time, however, there can be no carelessness. Our opponent is not an ordinary old man but a shapeshifting psychic, and one of the available forms possesses the monstrous power that single-handedly plunged <tips=41>Grand Tower</tips> into terror.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r228","rowIndex":228,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その力を出させる前に倒すのだ。","en":"We have to take him down before he can unleash that power.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r229","rowIndex":229,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=47>解放軍</tips>のメンバーは<tips=17>タイプＢ</tips>の力によってすぐれた身体能力を手にしている。奇襲を掛ければサイキックと言えどもひとたまりもないとは思うのだが、やはり不気味な相手であることは間違いない。","en":"The members of the <tips=47>Liberation Army</tips> have gained superior physical abilities through the power of <tips=17>Type B</tips>. I think even a psychic would be helpless against a surprise attack, but there is no question that he remains an unsettling opponent.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r230","rowIndex":230,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　だから、おれたちは事前に一人の男に協力を依頼してみた。","en":"That is why we tried asking one man for help in advance.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r231","rowIndex":231,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その人物は、軍人としての豊富な実戦経験と、テロ組織『ブラッド』の軍事教官としてのキャリアを持つ男――<tips=23>エリオット</tips>その人である。","en":"That man was <tips=23>Elliott</tips> himself, a soldier with extensive combat experience and a former military instructor for the terrorist organization Blood.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r232","rowIndex":232,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「冗談じゃない。おれは殺し屋じゃないんだ」","en":"“You must be joking. I am no assassin.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エリオット・ネス","displayName":"Eliot Ness","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r233","rowIndex":233,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼の行きつけの飲み屋で声をかけたとき、その答えは早かった。","en":"When I approached him at his regular bar, his answer came quickly.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r234","rowIndex":234,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=27>廖志明</tips>の屋敷で恥をかかされたそうじゃないか。やり返したくはないのか？」","en":"“I hear you were humiliated at <tips=27>Liao Chi-ming’s</tips> estate. Do you not want to return the favor?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r235","rowIndex":235,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おれはそう挑発してみた。","en":"I tried provoking him that way.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r236","rowIndex":236,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「餓鬼じゃあるまいし」","en":"“I’m not a child.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エリオット・ネス","displayName":"Eliot Ness","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r237","rowIndex":237,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼は酒臭い口元に笑みを浮かべながら言う。","en":"He says it with a smile, his breath heavy with alcohol.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r238","rowIndex":238,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　まあ、こんな安っぽい挑発には乗らないのはわかっていた。けれど、なんとかして手を貸して欲しかった。彼のキャリアが噂通りならば、これほど頼りになる人間はいない。","en":"I knew he would not rise to such a cheap provocation. But I had to find some way to get his help. If his career was anything like the rumors said, no one could be more dependable.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r239","rowIndex":239,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そんなこと言って、本音は恐ろしいんじゃないか？　あのサイキックと戦うのが」","en":"“You say that, but the truth is you are frightened, are you not? Frightened of fighting that psychic.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r240","rowIndex":240,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おれはダメ元でもう一度挑発してみたが、","en":"Knowing it was probably hopeless, I try provoking him once more, but—","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r241","rowIndex":241,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうかもしれないな」","en":"“Maybe I am.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エリオット・ネス","displayName":"Eliot Ness","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r242","rowIndex":242,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　やはり笑っているだけだった。","en":"As expected, he only laughed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r243","rowIndex":243,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あんたの力が欲しいんだ。どうしても無理なのか？　報酬は充分なものを用意するつもりだが」","en":"“I need your strength. Is there no way you’ll do it? I intend to offer you ample compensation.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r244","rowIndex":244,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「悪いね。金の話じゃないんだ。そういう気分じゃないんだよ」","en":"“Sorry. It’s not about money. I’m just not in the mood for that.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エリオット・ネス","displayName":"Eliot Ness","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r245","rowIndex":245,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「わかった。もう諦めよう。しかし、最後にひとつだけ教えてくれないか？　それを聞いたら帰るよ」","en":"“All right. I give up. But will you tell me one last thing? Once I hear it, I’ll leave.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r246","rowIndex":246,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「よし、わかった。特別だぜ？　今日は酔い心地がいいからな。言ってみな」","en":"“All right, fine. But I am making a special exception, understand? I have a very comfortable buzz going today. Go on, ask.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エリオット・ネス","displayName":"Eliot Ness","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r247","rowIndex":247,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あんたがもう一回やつと戦うとしたらどうする？　何かサイキック能力を防ぐ方法はないか？　もしあるなら、その方法を教えてくれ」","en":"“If you had to fight that psychic again, what would you do? Is there any way to defend against psychic powers? If there is, tell me.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r248","rowIndex":248,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いいぜ」","en":"“All right.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エリオット・ネス","displayName":"Eliot Ness","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r249","rowIndex":249,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=23>エリオット</tips>は琥珀色の液体をグラスから口に注ぎ、ぐびりと喉を鳴らして飲み込んでから、","en":"<tips=23>Elliott</tips> pours the amber liquid from the glass into his mouth, swallows with an audible gulp, and says,","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r250","rowIndex":250,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「おれがいたところの対サイキックマニュアルではガスを戦場にばらまくことになってる。サイキック能力を使えなくなるガスだよ。だが、経験的に言えばあれはあまり実戦的じゃない。サイキックってのは想像を超えた力があるし、思ったようにガスを吸わせられないんだ。あのガキの能力ともあまり相性が良くないだろうな。そもそも、お前らがガスを用意するのは無理だろうが」","en":"“The anti-psychic manual used where I served calls for flooding the battlefield with a gas that prevents the use of psychic abilities. In my experience, however, the method is not especially practical. Psychics can do things beyond imagination, and getting them to inhale the gas as intended is another matter entirely. It would be a poor match for that brat’s ability in particular. Besides, I doubt you people could obtain the gas in the first place.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エリオット・ネス","displayName":"Eliot Ness","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r251","rowIndex":251,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「じゃあ実戦的にはどうするんだ？」","en":"“Then what would you do in practice?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r252","rowIndex":252,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ぷはぁ」","en":"“Ahh!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エリオット・ネス","displayName":"Eliot Ness","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r253","rowIndex":253,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=23>エリオット</tips>はおれにくさい息を吐きかけてから、両手で長い銃を構える仕草をして、","en":"<tips=23>Elliott</tips> breathes his stinking breath into my face, then mimes holding a long gun in both hands.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r254","rowIndex":254,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なに、実にシンプルなものさ。狙撃するんだよ。できるだけ遠くに隠れて、射程に入ってきたら頭を一発、それでおしまいさ。ばぁんっ」","en":"“It’s very simple. Snipe her. Hide as far away as possible, and the moment she enters your range, put one bullet through her head. Finished. Bang.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エリオット・ネス","displayName":"Eliot Ness","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r255","rowIndex":255,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=23>エリオット</tips>は人差し指を曲げて、引き金を引くふりをすると、けけけと笑った。","en":"<tips=23>Elliott</tips> crooks his index finger, miming a pull of the trigger, then cackles.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r256","rowIndex":256,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なんだ、それだけか」","en":"“What, is that all?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r257","rowIndex":257,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうさ。これより効果的な方法はない。ほとんどのサイキックに通用する戦法だ。大体、サイキックなんて言ったって所詮ただの人間なんだぜ？　偶然狙撃に対抗する能力があれば別だが、大抵はそんな便利な能力を備えちゃいないのさ。<tips=81>龍頭</tips>の<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>はなかなかいい能力を持っていたが、<tips=27>廖</tips>の旦那がもしおれに命令していたら仕留めていたね。おれならやつの第三の目よりも、<tips=40>黄姉妹</tips>のレーダーよりも遠くから頭を撃ち抜くことが出来る」","en":"“That is right. There is no more effective method. It works against almost any psychic. Call them psychics if you like—in the end, they are only human. Unless one happens by chance to possess an ability that counters a sniper, most have nothing so convenient. The <tips=81>Longtou</tips>, <tips=3>Chris Tse</tips>, had a useful ability, but if Mr. <tips=27>Liao</tips> had given the order, I could have killed him. I can put a bullet through a man’s head from beyond the reach of that third eye—or the radar of the <tips=40>Wong sisters</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エリオット・ネス","displayName":"Eliot Ness","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r258","rowIndex":258,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「言うだけなら何でも言えるさ」","en":"“You can say anything when it’s just talk.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r259","rowIndex":259,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　陽気な<tips=23>エリオット</tips>に、おれは苦笑しながらそう言うと、彼はおれの肩をバンバンと何度も叩きながら笑った。","en":"I answer the cheerful <tips=23>Elliott</tips> with a wry smile. He laughs and repeatedly slaps me upon the shoulder.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r260","rowIndex":260,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうさ。言うだけなら自由だよ。しかもおれは酔っ払いだ！　酔っ払いが自由にものを言えなくなったら、いよいよこの世界には生きる値打ちがひとかけらもないってことになる。わかるか<tips=10>見土</tips>、<tips=21>ドラゴン・クラブ</tips>だの<tips=17>タイプB</tips>だの、そんな話よりも、酒場で自由に喋れることのほうがずっと大事なのさ」","en":"“That’s right. Talk is free. And I’m a drunk! If drunks lose the freedom to say whatever they want, this world will finally have not a scrap of value left. Do you understand, <tips=10>Mido</tips>? Being able to speak freely in a bar matters far more than all that talk of the <tips=21>Dragon Club</tips> and <tips=17>Type Bs</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エリオット・ネス","displayName":"Eliot Ness","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r261","rowIndex":261,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ということで、我々の依頼は断られてしまった。","en":"And so he turned down our request.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r262","rowIndex":262,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして、結局我々でカタを付けるしかなくなった。そして、この時の<tips=23>エリオット</tips>の意見をそのまま採用したというわけではないけれど、やはりライフルを用いた狙撃が最も有効だろうという話に落ち着いた。","en":"In the end, we were left to settle matters ourselves. It is not as though we simply adopted <tips=23>Elliott’s</tips> opinion wholesale, but we did conclude that a rifle shot from concealment would be the most effective approach.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r263","rowIndex":263,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　倉庫はまだ片付けられておらず、処分し損なった商品や棚がそのままになって雑然としている。そのなかに、ライフルを持った隊員を忍ばせ、清水と話して油断しているはずの<tips=65>ヘス</tips>を狙うのだ。","en":"The warehouse remains uncleared and chaotic, filled with shelving and merchandise no one succeeded in disposing of. We will conceal a soldier with a rifle amid the clutter and have him shoot <tips=65>Hess</tips>, who should be off guard while talking with Shimizu.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r264","rowIndex":264,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　隊員には射撃の腕前の優れたものを選んだ。そりゃ<tips=23>エリオット</tips>ほどの筋金入りのプロというわけにはいかないが、<tips=47>解放軍</tips>のなかでは一番腕がいいやつだ。倉庫内で狙撃するくらいなら問題ない精度で撃てるはずだ。","en":"We selected a man of proven skill with a firearm. Naturally, he is no hardened professional of <tips=23>Elliott’s</tips> caliber, but he is the best shot in the <tips=47>Liberation Army</tips>. At warehouse range, his accuracy should present no problem.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r265","rowIndex":265,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それでも<tips=65>ヘス</tips>の能力は気になるが、まあ実際あのよっぱらいのおっさんが口にした言葉は事実なのだ。サイキックといえども所詮ただの人間。――たとえばおれの能力なんか、狙撃の前じゃまったく役に立たないもんな。そして、子供の頃の<tips=1>亮</tips>も似たようなことを言っていたのを思い出すよ。","en":"<tips=65>Hess’s</tips> ability still troubles me, but the drunken old man spoke the truth. A psychic is only human in the end. An ability like mine, for example, would be utterly useless before a sniper. I remember <tips=1>Leung</tips> saying much the same thing when we were children.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r266","rowIndex":266,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「みんなサイキックを恐れすぎる。世の中の超能力のほとんどはただの曲芸じゃないか」","en":"“Everyone is far too afraid of psychics. Most supernatural powers in the world amount to parlor tricks.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r267","rowIndex":267,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ことあるごとにそううそぶいていたっけ。しかしまあ、その<tips=1>亮</tips>も<tips=41>グランドタワー</tips>では、あの<tips=62>マリア</tips>にけちょんけちょんにされたようだが。","en":"He used to make that boast whenever the slightest occasion arose. Though it appears that even <tips=1>Leung</tips> was thoroughly trounced by <tips=62>Maria</tips> at <tips=41>Grand Tower</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r268","rowIndex":268,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　今回も相手が<tips=62>マリア</tips>だったら厄介だが、今回ヤツは爺さんの姿でやって来るはずだ。映像を見る限り、変身も一瞬で出来るというわけじゃない。このまま順当にことが運べば、そもそも<tips=62>マリア</tips>が現れる前に倒すことが出来るだろう。ただ問題は、<tips=65>ヘス</tips>に未知のサイキック能力があった場合と、おれたちが何らかの理由で狙撃を外した場合だ。","en":"It would be troublesome if our opponent were <tips=62>Maria</tips> this time, but he should arrive in the form of the old man. From the footage, transformation does not appear to be instantaneous. If everything proceeds as expected, we should be able to finish him before <tips=62>Maria</tips> appears at all. The only problems would be if <tips=65>Hess</tips> possesses some unknown psychic ability, or if for some reason our shot misses.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r269","rowIndex":269,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　前者だとしても、よほど強力な能力が隠されていなけりゃ使う前に仕留められるだろうが、後者の可能性――弾を外すという事態はなくはない。","en":"Even in the former case, unless he is concealing an extraordinarily powerful ability, we should finish him before he can use it. But the latter possibility—a missed shot—cannot be dismissed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r270","rowIndex":270,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「気をつけな！　相手はプロだからチャンスは一回こっきりだ。外したらお前らは皆殺しにされるぜ」","en":"“Be careful! He’s a professional, so you only get one chance. Miss, and he’ll slaughter every one of you.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r271","rowIndex":271,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　別れ際、<tips=23>エリオット</tips>は実に陽気に、実に縁起の悪いことを言ってくれたもんだ。","en":"Thus did <tips=23>Elliott</tips> offer us, at parting, a warning delivered with extraordinary cheer and extraordinarily bad omens.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r272","rowIndex":272,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=65>ヘス</tips>はいつも時間に正確だ。その日も予定時間の三分前に姿を現す。","en":"<tips=65>Hess</tips> is always punctual. That day, too, he appears three minutes before the appointed time.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r273","rowIndex":273,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　倉庫のシャッターの横にあるドアから入って来たのは、帽子をかぶった<tips=65>ヘス</tips>。顔の半分を覆う大きな眼帯で片目を隠している。そして続いて二人、別の人間が入って来る。<tips=65>ヘス</tips>の連れだ。","en":"Through the door beside the warehouse shutter comes <tips=65>Hess</tips>, wearing a hat and a large eyepatch that covers half the face and conceals one eye. Two more people enter close behind—<tips=65>Hess’s</tips> companions.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r274","rowIndex":274,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あいつら……」","en":"“Those two...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"田中紺太","displayName":"Konta Tanaka","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r275","rowIndex":275,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　連れの二人の顔を見て、<tips=66>コンタ</tips>が目を丸くして驚いた。","en":"At the sight of the companions’ faces, <tips=66>Konta’s</tips> eyes widen in astonishment.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r276","rowIndex":276,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おれだって思わず「あっ」と声をあげそうになったくらいだ。","en":"Even I nearly cry out in surprise.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r277","rowIndex":277,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=65>ヘス</tips>と共におれたちの前に姿を現したのは、学校の制服を着た二人の少女。二人とも全く同じ顔をしていて、そして、おれも知っている――。","en":"The two who appear before us with <tips=65>Hess</tips> are girls in school uniforms. Their faces are perfectly identical—and I know them too.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r278","rowIndex":278,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「灰上……」","en":"“Haigami...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"田中紺太","displayName":"Konta Tanaka","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r279","rowIndex":279,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=66>コンタ</tips>がそう呟いた通りだ。","en":"They are precisely who <tips=66>Konta</tips> murmurs them to be.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r280","rowIndex":280,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=10>道夫</tips>君。これはどういうこと？」","en":"“<tips=10>Michio</tips>. What’s going on?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"田中紺太","displayName":"Konta Tanaka","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r281","rowIndex":281,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=66>コンタ</tips>は驚いて訊ねて来るけれども、もちろんおれだってどうしてこんなことになったのかわからない。","en":"<tips=66>Konta</tips> asks me in shock, but of course I have no more idea how this happened than he does.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r282","rowIndex":282,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　とにかく、起きて欲しくないイレギュラーが発生してしまったのは確かだ。普段はいつも一人なのに、今日に限ってなぜ？　しかもよりによってあの二人を？","en":"Whatever the explanation, the operation has unquestionably suffered the one thing we did not want: an unforeseen contingency. Hess always comes alone. Why choose today of all days to bring company—and why, of all people, those two?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r283","rowIndex":283,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「清水さん。その二人がどういう関係か聞いてみてくれないか」","en":"“Mr. Shimizu, could you ask what those two have to do with him?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r284","rowIndex":284,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おれは清水の耳の穴のなかにとりつけられた小型スピーカーに繋がっているマイクにそう話しかけた。","en":"I speak into the microphone linked to the miniature receiver fitted inside Shimizu’s ear canal.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r285","rowIndex":285,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"『あいかわらず時間ぴったりだね。ミスター<tips=65>ヘス</tips>。そっちの可愛いお嬢さんがたはなんなんだい？　いつも一人で行動しているあんたにしちゃ珍しいじゃないか』","en":"‘Punctual as ever, Mr. <tips=65>Hess</tips>. Who are the pretty young ladies with you? It’s unusual for a man who always works alone.’","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"清水（シミズ）","displayName":"Shimizu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r286","rowIndex":286,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"『助手ですヨ。今ちょっと、私の目がこの有様でね。心細いので付いてキテ貰いマシタ』","en":"‘They are my assistants. As you can see, my eye is in a rather unfortunate condition at present. I felt uneasy, so I asked them to accompany me.’","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エフゲニ・ヘス","displayName":"Yevgeny Hess","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r287","rowIndex":287,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"『助手？　こんなに若いお嬢さんがたが』","en":"‘Assistants? Girls this young?’","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"清水（シミズ）","displayName":"Shimizu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r288","rowIndex":288,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"『こう見えて、なかなか優秀な力を持ったお嬢ちゃんたちなんですよ』","en":"‘Appearances aside, these young ladies possess quite remarkable powers.’","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エフゲニ・ヘス","displayName":"Yevgeny Hess","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r289","rowIndex":289,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　モニターのなかのやりとりを聞きながら、おれと<tips=66>コンタ</tips>は絶句してしまう。","en":"Listening to the exchange through the monitor, <tips=66>Konta</tips> and I can only stare in speechless disbelief.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r290","rowIndex":290,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いつも単独行動なのに、人を連れて来るなんて珍しいですね。しかも、あんな娘を……」","en":"“It is unusual for him to bring anyone when he always works alone. And girls like those...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"カミラ","displayName":"Camilla","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r291","rowIndex":291,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=67>カミラ</tips>はそう言ってから、硬直しているおれたちに気がつく。","en":"<tips=67>Camilla</tips> says it, then notices that the two of us have gone rigid.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r292","rowIndex":292,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「二人ともどうしたんですか？」","en":"“What’s wrong with you two?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"カミラ","displayName":"Camilla","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r293","rowIndex":293,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　二人のことを知らない彼女は、普通の少女を連れて来たと思っているらしく、おれたちとは受け取り方が違うようだ。","en":"She does not know the two of them. Apparently she assumes he has brought ordinary girls, so she seems to read the situation differently from us.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r294","rowIndex":294,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いや、あいつら知り合いなんだ。……ちっちゃい頃からね。<tips=86>灰上姉妹</tips>って聞いたことがないかい？」","en":"“We know them. ...We’ve known them since we were little. Have you ever heard of the <tips=86>Haigami sisters</tips>?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"田中紺太","displayName":"Konta Tanaka","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r295","rowIndex":295,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=66>コンタ</tips>が苦々しげに答える。","en":"<tips=66>Konta</tips> answers bitterly.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r296","rowIndex":296,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ああ、名前はどこかで……。<tips=16>タイプA</tips>と<tips=17>タイプB</tips>の双子でしたっけ？」","en":"“Ah, I have heard the name somewhere... The twins, one <tips=16>Type A</tips> and one <tips=17>Type B</tips>?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"カミラ","displayName":"Camilla","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r297","rowIndex":297,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうだよ。両方ともなかなか強力な能力を持ってる。どうしてあいつらがヤツと一緒にいるんだ。しかもよりによってこんなときに」","en":"“That’s right. Both of them have quite powerful abilities. What are they doing with him? And why now, of all times?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"田中紺太","displayName":"Konta Tanaka","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r298","rowIndex":298,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=66>コンタ</tips>は言って爪を噛んだ。","en":"As he speaks, <tips=66>Konta</tips> begins biting at a fingernail.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r299","rowIndex":299,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「確かその姉妹は、ヘドロ団地の<tips=14>深沢</tips>と繋がりがあるという噂ですが……。<tips=65>ヘス</tips>は<tips=13>ヘドロ団地</tips>と繋がろうとしているんでしょうかね？」","en":"“I have heard rumors that the sisters have connections to <tips=14>Fukazawa</tips> at the Sludge Housing Complex... Could <tips=65>Hess</tips> be attempting to establish ties with the <tips=13>Sludge Housing Complex</tips>?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"カミラ","displayName":"Camilla","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r300","rowIndex":300,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=67>カミラ</tips>は心配げにおれの方を見る。","en":"<tips=67>Camilla</tips> looks at me anxiously.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r301","rowIndex":301,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「その可能性は低いと思うんだがな。あいつらはそういう組織とのかかわりで動くタイプじゃないはずだ。ガキの頃も、おれたちのグループとつるんでいたが集団行動はきらいだった。それに、<tips=14>深沢</tips>が<tips=86>双子</tips>にそんな指示を出すとも思えない。気持ち悪いくらい可愛がってるのは有名だからね」","en":"“I doubt it. They aren’t the kind to act on behalf of an organization. They spent time around our group when we were children, but they hated doing anything as a group. And I can’t imagine <tips=14>Fukazawa</tips> giving <tips=86>the twins</tips> an order like that. Everyone knows he dotes on them to an almost disturbing degree.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r302","rowIndex":302,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「じゃあどういう繋がりなのでしょう？」","en":"“Then what is their connection?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"カミラ","displayName":"Camilla","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r303","rowIndex":303,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「わからないな……。だが、あいつらのことだから、深い理由があるとも限らない。気まぐれかもしれないな。何かで知り合って、気にいったんだろう……」","en":"“I don’t know... But knowing them, there may not be any profound reason. It could be a whim. They probably met him somehow and took a liking to him...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r304","rowIndex":304,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そう言えば、つい最近街で偶然会ったときに何か面白いものを見つけたと言っていたな。もしかしたらあれが<tips=65>ヘス</tips>のことだったんだろうか？","en":"Come to think of it, when I ran into them in town recently, they said they had found something interesting. Could they have meant <tips=65>Hess</tips>?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r305","rowIndex":305,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「変身するサイキックなんて、まさにあいつらが好みそうなネタだ。遊び半分で付き合ってるんだろう」","en":"“A shape-shifting psychic is exactly the kind of thing they would find irresistible. They’re probably hanging around him for fun.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r306","rowIndex":306,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そんなの、子供じゃないですか」","en":"“That’s just childish.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"カミラ","displayName":"Camilla","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r307","rowIndex":307,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「自由人なんだよ」","en":"“They’re free spirits.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r308","rowIndex":308,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「しかし、参ったな。<tips=10>道夫</tips>君、どうする？　予想外の邪魔が入っちまったもんだよ」","en":"“This is a problem. What do we do, <tips=10>Michio</tips>? An obstacle we never anticipated has wandered straight into the operation.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"田中紺太","displayName":"Konta Tanaka","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r309","rowIndex":309,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=66>コンタ</tips>は深々と溜息をつく。","en":"<tips=66>Konta</tips> heaves a deep sigh.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r310","rowIndex":310,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……予定は変えられませんよ。こんな場所を用意出来て、呼び出せるようなチャンスがこの先あるとは限りませんから」","en":"“We cannot alter the plan. There is no guarantee we will ever have another chance to prepare a site like this and lure Hess into it.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"カミラ","displayName":"Camilla","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r311","rowIndex":311,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=67>カミラ</tips>はきつい視線でおれと<tips=66>コンタ</tips>を牽制する。","en":"<tips=67>Camilla</tips> pins <tips=66>Konta</tips> and me with a hard stare.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r312","rowIndex":312,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　普段は考え事はまわりのやつに任せているおれだが、こういう場面では責任を持って決断しなくてはいけないのはわかっている。が、すぐには考えがまとまらない。かといって、ぐずぐずしていても、清水が間をもたせられなくなる。","en":"Ordinarily I leave the thinking to those around me, but I know that in a moment like this the responsibility for deciding must be mine. No answer comes together at once. At the same time, if I continue to hesitate, Shimizu will soon run out of ways to keep them occupied.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r313","rowIndex":313,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼もこちらが戸惑っているのを察してくれたのか、<tips=65>ヘス</tips>に飲み物などを手渡して時間を稼いでくれているが、そうそう引き延ばせるわけでもないだろう。","en":"Perhaps sensing our hesitation, Shimizu buys us time by offering <tips=65>Hess</tips> drinks and other courtesies, but there is a limit to how long he can prolong the charade.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r314","rowIndex":314,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「予定通り今日やる。狙撃犯はあらかじめ決めておいた通り、<tips=65>ヘス</tips>を狙撃してくれ」","en":"“We proceed today as planned. Sniper, take the shot at <tips=65>Hess</tips>, just as we agreed in advance.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r315","rowIndex":315,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おれはひとまずそう言った。こんな風に狙撃に使える場所を用意して呼び出すというのは、そう何度も使える手ではない。それに、我々<tips=47>解放軍</tips>が<tips=21>八龍会</tips>の実権を握ったことを知られる前に仕留めたかった。","en":"For the moment, that is the decision I give. The trick of luring Hess into a site prepared for a sniper is not one we can use repeatedly. More importantly, I want Hess dead before word spreads that we of the <tips=47>Liberation Army</tips> have seized control of the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r316","rowIndex":316,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=86>双子</tips>はどうする？」","en":"“What about the <tips=86>twins</tips>?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"田中紺太","displayName":"Konta Tanaka","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r317","rowIndex":317,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=66>コンタ</tips>は不安げな視線をおれに向ける。","en":"<tips=66>Konta</tips> turns an anxious gaze on me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r318","rowIndex":318,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それは……」","en":"“That...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r319","rowIndex":319,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「考えることはないですよ」","en":"“There is nothing to consider.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"カミラ","displayName":"Camilla","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r320","rowIndex":320,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=67>カミラ</tips>はおれより先に口を開く。","en":"<tips=67>Camilla</tips> speaks before I can.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r321","rowIndex":321,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「二人の従者も、始末するべきです。彼女たちが<tips=14>深沢</tips>と連携をとっているにしろ、そうでないにしろ、ここで命を絶っておいたほうが禍根を残さないですむはずです。死体を処理すれば表沙汰になることもないでしょう。最悪なのは、逃げられてこの計画を外に漏らされることです」","en":"“We should dispose of both attendants as well. Whether or not they are coordinating with <tips=14>Fukazawa</tips>, killing them here should prevent future trouble. If we dispose of the bodies, the matter should never become public. The worst possible outcome would be allowing them to escape and expose this plan.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"カミラ","displayName":"Camilla","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r322","rowIndex":322,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「随分あっさりと言うねえ」","en":"“You make that sound very easy.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r323","rowIndex":323,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おれの言葉に<tips=67>カミラ</tips>は呆れたように溜息をつく。","en":"<tips=67>Camilla</tips> sighs at my remark as though exasperated.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r324","rowIndex":324,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「当然です。隊長。さっき見直したばかりなのに、がっかりしました。よく考えて下さい。<tips=65>ヘス</tips>が連れてきたのが知り合いじゃなければどうしていましたか？　迷う余地なんかありましたか？　そもそも、<tips=65>ヘス</tips>の一味である時点で彼女たちは私たちにとって敵なのです」","en":"“Of course. Commander, I had only just revised my opinion of you, and already you disappoint me. Think carefully. What would you have done if the people <tips=65>Hess</tips> brought had not been acquaintances of yours? Would there have been any room for hesitation? The fact that they are part of <tips=65>Hess’s</tips> group already makes them our enemies.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"カミラ","displayName":"Camilla","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r325","rowIndex":325,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうは言うがね、おれは出来るだけ無駄な殺人はしたくないんだ。フェルナンデス家を襲撃したときは使用人などの一般人を死なせてしまったし、病院でも無用の殺生があったが、あれがベストの手段だったとは思っていない」","en":"“You may say that, but I want to avoid needless killing wherever I can. When we attacked the Fernandes family, we caused the deaths of civilians, including their servants, and there was needless bloodshed at the hospital as well. I do not believe either was the best course we could have taken.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r326","rowIndex":326,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あれは避けられない被害でした。そもそも、私たちの敵に荷担してる時点で全く無関係とは言えません。今回の件は隊長の知り合いかもしれませんが、私情は捨ててください」","en":"“Those casualties were unavoidable. Once they assisted our enemies, they could not be considered wholly uninvolved in any case. These two may be your acquaintances, Commander, but you must put aside your personal feelings.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"カミラ","displayName":"Camilla","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r327","rowIndex":327,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「私情を捨てろって？」","en":"“Put aside my personal feelings?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r328","rowIndex":328,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「もちろんです。我々は全ての私情を捨て去って、合理的な判断を下さないといけないのです。我々が行おうとしている戦いは、とても厳しいものなんですから。そんな余裕はありません」","en":"“Of course. We must cast aside all personal feeling and make rational decisions. The struggle ahead of us will be merciless. We have no room to indulge ourselves.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"カミラ","displayName":"Camilla","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r329","rowIndex":329,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「言うことはわかるがね。でも、私情を捨てろってのは困ったなあ」","en":"“I understand your point. Still, being told to cast aside my personal feelings troubles me.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r330","rowIndex":330,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=67>カミラ</tips>も彼女なりの強い思いがあってそう言っているのはわかっているし、こんな状況でする話ではないのはわかっていたが、おれは言ってしまった。","en":"I knew that <tips=67>Camilla</tips> had strong feelings of her own behind what she said, and that this was no time for such a discussion, but I said it anyway.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r331","rowIndex":331,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そもそも、おれは私情の強い人間でね。だが、それは悪くないと思っている。友人とか、家族とか、身近にいるものを愛する心は重要だよ」","en":"“The truth is, I’m a deeply partial man. But I don’t believe that is a bad thing. The love we bear our friends, our families, and those closest to us matters.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r332","rowIndex":332,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「何言ってるんですか。そのせいで、組織を犠牲にするようなことがあったらどうするんですか？」","en":"“What are you talking about? What if those feelings cause you to sacrifice the organization?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"カミラ","displayName":"Camilla","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r333","rowIndex":333,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=67>カミラ</tips>は、おれが珍しく真っ向から論戦を仕掛けたことにやや戸惑っているようだ。","en":"<tips=67>Camilla</tips> seems somewhat disconcerted that, for once, I am challenging her head-on.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r334","rowIndex":334,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「もちろん、仲間を犠牲にしてはいけないさ。だけど、その仲間を愛する感情ってのも、おれにとっては私情なんだよなあ。<tips=67>カミラ</tips>が<tips=17>タイプB</tips>のために頑張ってるのも私情じゃないのか？」","en":"“Of course, we mustn’t sacrifice our comrades. But the love I feel for those comrades is a personal attachment too. And <tips=67>Camilla</tips>, isn’t your working so hard for <tips=17>Type Bs</tips> personal too?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r335","rowIndex":335,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……私は、我々の正しい権利のために戦ってるんです」","en":"“...I am fighting for the rights that are rightfully ours.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"カミラ","displayName":"Camilla","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r336","rowIndex":336,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それも、言ってしまえば私情だよ。でも、それはいいことだと思うんだ。我々は誰だって常に自分が愛するもののために生きるべきだからね」","en":"“Call it what you will, that too is personal feeling. And I believe that is a good thing. Every one of us ought to live for what we love.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r337","rowIndex":337,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「こんなときに、煙に巻こうとしないでください」","en":"“Don’t try to confuse the issue at a time like this.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"カミラ","displayName":"Camilla","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r338","rowIndex":338,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そう聞こえるかもしれないし、こんな時に話すことでもないかもしれないが、一回言っておこうと思ってね」","en":"“It may sound that way, and perhaps now isn’t the time. But I thought I should say it once.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r339","rowIndex":339,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おれは苦笑して、","en":"I smile wryly.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r340","rowIndex":340,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「最近よく考えるんだ。おれたちは血で血を洗う殺し合いをおっぱじめたわけだが、この殺人という恐ろしい行為をどんな気持ちで受け止めなければならないのかってね。<tips=67>カミラ</tips>は感情をなくしたロボットになって戦おうとしているみたいだが、それは違う。……そうだな、あのさ、人間は単純でいい加減なものなんだよ。偶然誰かの子供として生まれれば親を愛し、偶然近所に住んでいた女を好きになればそいつに愛を捧げたりする。それは理屈としては正しくもなんともないが、一生ってのはそれでいいんだと思う。よく考えて見ろよ。おれたちが<tips=17>タイプB</tips>に生まれたのも偶然みたいなもんじゃないか？　なあ<tips=67>カミラ</tips>、もしお前が<tips=17>タイプB</tips>じゃなくても、同じ意見をもち、<tips=21>八龍会</tips>でこんなことをしていたか？」","en":"“I’ve been thinking about it a great deal lately. We have begun a struggle in which blood answers blood, and I keep wondering what we must feel as we confront the terrible act of killing. <tips=67>Camilla</tips>, you seem determined to fight by turning yourself into an emotionless machine, but that is not the answer. ...Human beings are simple, haphazard creatures. Chance makes us someone’s child, and we love our parents. Chance puts a woman in the house next door, and if we fall in love with her, we devote ourselves to her. There is nothing rationally correct about any of it, but I think a human life is allowed to be built on such things. Consider this: wasn’t it little more than chance that we were born <tips=17>Type B</tips>? Tell me, <tips=67>Camilla</tips>—if you had not been born a <tips=17>Type B</tips>, would you still hold the same convictions? Would you still be doing this within the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips>?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r341","rowIndex":341,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=67>カミラ</tips>は呆れて溜息をつき、","en":"<tips=67>Camilla</tips> sighs in exasperation.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r342","rowIndex":342,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なんで今こんな話を……」","en":"“Why are we discussing this now...?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"カミラ","displayName":"Camilla","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r343","rowIndex":343,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「我々が戦いを続けてゆくために大事なことなんだ。答えてくれよ」","en":"“Because it’s important if we’re going to continue fighting. Answer me.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r344","rowIndex":344,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「わかりました。……確かにもし私が<tips=17>タイプB</tips>でなければ意見は違ったかもしれません。でもそれは、ノーマルでは<tips=17>タイプB</tips>の置かれている境遇を痛感する機会がないだろうからであって……。まあとにかく、隊長は幼なじみのあの少女は特別扱いして手にかけられないというわけですね？」","en":"“Very well. ...I admit that if I were not a <tips=17>Type B</tips>, I might think differently. But that would only be because a Normal would have no occasion to feel the plight of <tips=17>Type Bs</tips> so keenly... In any case, Commander, your point is that you cannot bring yourself to kill that girl because she was your childhood friend?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"カミラ","displayName":"Camilla","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r345","rowIndex":345,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうじゃない。そういうことが言いたいんじゃない」","en":"“No. That isn’t what I’m trying to say.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r346","rowIndex":346,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おれは首を横に振った。","en":"I shake my head.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r347","rowIndex":347,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あのな、おれは偶然この街で、あのおかしな母親の息子の<tips=17>タイプB</tips>として生まれ、<tips=21>八龍会</tips>に拾われた。おれはあの母親のことも愛しているし、自分を育ててくれたこの会や、同じ境遇の仲間のことも愛している。もちろんお前もその一人に入っているんだから、あまり無茶はしないでくれよ。いつも心配だぜ」","en":"“Listen. By chance, I was born in this city as a <tips=17>Type B</tips>, the son of that eccentric mother of mine, and then the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips> took me in. I love my mother. I love this organization that raised me, and the comrades who share my lot. Naturally, you are one of them—so please, don’t be too reckless. I worry about you all the time.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r348","rowIndex":348,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そ、そんなことはどうでもいいんです。結局、何がいいたいんですか？」","en":"“Th-that is irrelevant. What are you ultimately trying to say?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"カミラ","displayName":"Camilla","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r349","rowIndex":349,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その言葉におれは苦笑して、","en":"I smile wryly at her response.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r350","rowIndex":350,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「我々は、あくまでも人間だってことさ。……相手が誰であれ、暴力を振るったり、殺したりするのはとても恐ろしいことだ。そのたびに心が傷つくし、目を背けたくなる。でも、忘れちゃいけない。おれたちは、一人の血も涙もあるちっぽけな人間として、手の届く、大事な人々のために戦ってるんだ。だから、いくら恐ろしい行為に手を染めても、心をなくしてはいけない」","en":"“That we remain human, to the very end. ...No matter who the other person may be, to hurt or kill them is a terrifying thing. Each time, it wounds us and makes us want to turn away. But we must never forget: each of us fights as one small human being, with blood in his veins and tears in his eyes, for the precious people within his reach. However terrible the deeds we commit, we must not surrender our hearts.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r351","rowIndex":351,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「だから、あの<tips=86>双子</tips>を助けたいと？」","en":"“And therefore you want to save <tips=86>the twins</tips>?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"カミラ","displayName":"Camilla","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r352","rowIndex":352,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そりゃ出来れば助けたいよ。だが、<tips=65>ヘス</tips>は恐ろしいサイキックだし、ここで生かしておくことは出来ない。<tips=86>双子</tips>がその<tips=65>ヘス</tips>の一味として出て来た以上、彼らを助けようとするのは我々にとって大変なリスクとなる」","en":"“Naturally, I’d like to save them if I could. But <tips=65>Hess</tips> is a terrifying psychic, and we cannot allow him to live. Now that the <tips=86>twins</tips> have appeared as <tips=65>Hess’s</tips> associates, trying to spare them would pose a tremendous risk to us.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r353","rowIndex":353,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「つまり？」","en":"“Meaning?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"カミラ","displayName":"Camilla","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r354","rowIndex":354,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おれの顔を探るような目で見る<tips=67>カミラ</tips>の目を見つめ返し、おれははっきりと口にした。","en":"I meet <tips=67>Camilla’s</tips> searching gaze and state my decision clearly.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r355","rowIndex":355,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=65>ヘス</tips>とその二人の助手には、ここで死んで貰う」","en":"“<tips=65>Hess</tips> and his two assistants will die here.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r356","rowIndex":356,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=66>コンタ</tips>は隣で息をのむ。","en":"Beside me, <tips=66>Konta</tips> gasps.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r357","rowIndex":357,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「私と同じ意見なら、ごちゃごちゃ言わなくても良かったんじゃないですか？」","en":"“If your opinion is the same as mine, you could have spared us the speech.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"カミラ","displayName":"Camilla","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r358","rowIndex":358,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=67>カミラ</tips>はうんざりとした顔で言う。","en":"<tips=67>Camilla</tips> looks thoroughly weary of me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r359","rowIndex":359,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「結論が同じでも、過程が違うのさ」","en":"“The conclusion may be the same, but the path to it is different.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r360","rowIndex":360,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　偉そうに言ったが、<tips=67>カミラ</tips>の言う通りごちゃごちゃと言う必要はないことだったかもしれないな。","en":"I deliver the line with great authority, though perhaps <tips=67>Camilla</tips> is right that I needn’t have gone through all that rigmarole.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r361","rowIndex":361,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　きっとおれは、自分に言い聞かせてもいたんだ。","en":"I am sure I was trying to convince myself as well.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r362","rowIndex":362,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おれは状況変化による細かい作戦の変更を伝えながら、ぼうっと考えた。","en":"As I relayed the minor changes to the plan required by the shifting situation, my thoughts drifted.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r363","rowIndex":363,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=47>解放軍</tips>に入ってから、どれだけ人を殺したろう？　病院の襲撃もそうだし、<tips=17>タイプB</tips>を虐待しているという噂を聞いてその相手を殺したこともある。先日、<tips=75>フェルナンデス・ファミリー</tips>と揉めた時は、ボスの<tips=38>リタ・フェルナンデス</tips>の家に押し入り、沢山のギャングと使用人を殺した。そして逃げ出した<tips=38>リタ・フェルナンデス</tips>も最終的には首を切断された無惨な死体となり、おれはそれを路上にさらした。可愛い女の子も首切り死体となったらろくなもんじゃなかった。フェミニストで知られた<tips=10>見土</tips>さんのすることじゃないぜ。","en":"How many people have I killed since joining the <tips=47>Liberation Army</tips>? There was the hospital raid. There was the time we heard a rumor that someone was abusing <tips=17>Type Bs</tips>, and killed him for it. Then, when we clashed with the <tips=75>Fernandes Family</tips>, we stormed the home of their boss, <tips=38>Rita Fernandes</tips>, and killed a great many gangsters and servants. <tips=38>Rita Fernandes</tips> escaped, but in the end she too became a hideously mutilated corpse with her head cut off—and I put it on display in the street. A pretty girl doesn’t amount to much once she’s a headless corpse. Hardly what you’d expect of Mr. <tips=10>Mido</tips>, who’s known for treating women so well.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r364","rowIndex":364,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　まったく、自分がこんなことをするなんて、ほんのちょっと前、饅頭を売っていたときは考えもしなかった。","en":"Honestly, when I was selling manju such a short time ago, I never imagined I would do anything like this.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r365","rowIndex":365,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そりゃ<tips=21>八龍会</tips>の幹部になるだろうとは思っていたが、『<tips=46>ネオ・ローズ</tips>』が入って来るまではこんな過激な行動をする組織じゃなかったんだ。爺さんたちがその魔力に取り憑かれて、そして爺さんたち自身が追放されることになった。","en":"I figured I would become an officer of the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips> eventually, sure, but before ‘<tips=46>Neo Rose</tips>’ came along, this wasn’t an organization that did anything so extreme. The old men fell under its spell, and then they themselves ended up being cast out.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r366","rowIndex":366,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　いや、他人ごとじゃないな。爺さんたちを追放したおれ自身も、あの薬の効果で狂わされた人間の一人ってわけだろう。","en":"No, I cannot pretend that has nothing to do with me. I expelled the old men. That must make me another person driven mad by the drug’s effects.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r367","rowIndex":367,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その証拠に、今おれはこれからその薬を持ち込んだ本人を殺し、薬を独占しようとしてるじゃないか。そして幼なじみの女二人も殺す。","en":"The proof is that I am now about to kill the man who brought the drug here and monopolize it for myself. And kill two girls I’ve known since childhood along with him.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r368","rowIndex":368,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=67>カミラ</tips>はこの街を<tips=17>タイプB</tips>の街にすると言っている。確かに<tips=47>解放軍</tips>は増えて、街の<tips=17>タイプB</tips>には<tips=21>八龍会</tips>を支持する声も広がっている。もうこれから<tips=9>Y地区</tips>はギャングが支配する街じゃない、<tips=17>タイプＢ</tips>の街になる――という声も聞こえて来る。爺さんたちも完全にそれを信じていた。<tips=21>八龍会</tips>の人間は、皆目をきらきらさせている。","en":"<tips=67>Camilla</tips> says she will make this a city of <tips=17>Type Bs</tips>. The <tips=47>Liberation Army</tips> has indeed grown, and support for the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips> is spreading among the city’s <tips=17>Type Bs</tips>. Voices are already proclaiming that <tips=9>Y District</tips> will no longer be a city ruled by gangs; from now on, it will belong to <tips=17>Type Bs</tips>. The old men believed it absolutely. Everyone in the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips> has a gleam in their eyes.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r369","rowIndex":369,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　寝たきりだった亭主が薬のお陰で誰よりも働き者になった。発症し、これまでノーマルからの視線がきつかったが、薬のおかげでもう自分の方が全ての面で優れている。<tips=17>タイプB</tips>に生まれて良かった。これからは自分たちが彼らの上に立つ時代だ。――みなが同じ夢を見て熱狂している。","en":"A husband once confined to bed has become the hardest worker of them all, thanks to the drug. Someone who suffered onset and endured the merciless stares of Normals now surpasses them in every respect, thanks to the drug. I’m glad I was born <tips=17>Type B</tips>. The age when we stand above them is about to begin.—The same dream has seized them all, and they are wild with excitement.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r370","rowIndex":370,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おれはどこか醒めた気分だ。","en":"Some part of me remains detached.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r371","rowIndex":371,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=46>ネオ・ローズ</tips>に対しては前ほど不信感はない。まだ油断は出来ないとは言え、<tips=45>ローズ</tips>のころのようなどぎつい副作用の話は聞かない。それで、みんなが症状を克服して喜んでいるのもわかる。いいことだろう。","en":"I distrust <tips=46>Neo Rose</tips> less than I once did. We still cannot let down our guard, but I have heard none of the stories about vicious side effects that surrounded <tips=45>Rose</tips>. I also understand why everyone is so happy to have overcome their symptoms. It is a good thing.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r372","rowIndex":372,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　でも、症状があった頃をあまりにひどく言い過ぎじゃないかなって、変な話だがちょっと思うんだ。","en":"But strange as this may sound, I cannot help feeling that people speak far too harshly about the days when they still had those symptoms.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r373","rowIndex":373,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　症状に悩まされていた頃の<tips=17>タイプB</tips>は、出来損ないで、異常で、なんの役にも立たないまわりを不幸にするだけの存在だったって、今はみんなが言うけれども、でもそれって『<tips=46>ネオ・ローズ</tips>』が入る前に心ない差別主義者が言っていたことじゃないか？　そんなことはないって、症状におかされていても価値のある人間なんだって、必死で反発してきたのに、あれは嘘だったのかい？","en":"Everyone now says that a <tips=17>Type B</tips> suffering from symptoms was defective, abnormal, useless, and capable only of making the people around them miserable. But isn’t that precisely what heartless bigots said before <tips=46>Neo Rose</tips> arrived? We fought them desperately, insisting it was not true—that we remained human beings of value even while suffering from our symptoms. Was that a lie?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r374","rowIndex":374,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おれは、みんなが明るい顔で「これからは我々の時代だ」「暗黒時代は終わった」と言うたびに、あのカビ臭い畳が敷き詰められた、あのボロアパートを思い出すんだ。","en":"Whenever someone declares with a radiant face that ‘our age has come’ or ‘the dark age is over,’ I remember that decrepit apartment, its floor laid wall to wall with mildew-reeking tatami.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r375","rowIndex":375,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　母さんがベッドに縛り付けられていて、汗と糞尿の臭いがする。おれはそれに背を向けてTVゲームをする。そして金切り声で叫び出すと、その時家にいた大人の誰かが殴ったり、おれが殴ったりする。","en":"My mother is strapped to the bed, amid the stink of sweat, shit, and piss. I sit with my back to her and play video games. When she begins shrieking, whichever adult happens to be home hits her—or I do.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r376","rowIndex":376,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　最近気がついたんだ。あんな状況だったけど、もしかしたらおれは母さんのことを愛していたし、母さんもおれのことを愛していたのかもしれない。","en":"I realized something recently. Despite the way we lived, perhaps I loved my mother. Perhaps she loved me too.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r377","rowIndex":377,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　みんなが<tips=46>ネオ・ローズ</tips>によって全て良くなったって絶讃するのがどうにも引っかかっていたのは、あの時のおれたちの全てを否定されるような気がするからなのかなって。","en":"Perhaps the reason it bothers me so much when everyone proclaims that <tips=46>Neo Rose</tips> made everything better is that it feels like a denial of everything we were then.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r378","rowIndex":378,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そりゃ、あんなクソみたいな状況は否定されて当然なんだろうけれど。","en":"Though I suppose a situation that shitty deserves to be rejected in its entirety.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r379","rowIndex":379,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=10>道夫</tips>君。おれは、良い判断だと思うよ」","en":"“<tips=10>Michio</tips>. I think you made the right decision.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"田中紺太","displayName":"Konta Tanaka","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r380","rowIndex":380,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=86>灰上姉妹</tips>登場による作戦変更を持ち場についた部下たちに伝え終わり、自分も現場に向かう準備を始めたところで、<tips=66>コンタ</tips>が深刻な顔でそう言った。","en":"Once I finish relaying the changes prompted by the <tips=86>Haigami sisters</tips>’ arrival to the men in position, I begin preparing to go in myself. It is then that <tips=66>Konta</tips> speaks, his expression grave.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r381","rowIndex":381,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=10>道夫</tips>君も、<tips=1>亮</tips>も、あいつらには昔から言ってたじゃないか。余計なことに首突っ込むと身を滅ぼすって。<tips=1>亮</tips>なんか学校に行くよう勧めて勉強まで見てやったのに、あんな<tips=65>ヘス</tips>みたいなやつに関わって……自業自得だよ。だから、心配しなくていいよ。<tips=10>道夫</tips>君は正しい」","en":"“You and <tips=1>Leung</tips> always warned them, didn’t you, <tips=10>Michio</tips>? You told them that sticking their noses where they didn’t belong would be the ruin of them. <tips=1>Leung</tips> even encouraged them to go to school and helped them with their studies, but still they became involved with someone like <tips=65>Hess</tips>... They brought it on themselves. So don’t torment yourself over it. You made the right decision, <tips=10>Michio</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"田中紺太","displayName":"Konta Tanaka","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r382","rowIndex":382,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼は俯いている。きっと、おれ以上にあの<tips=86>双子</tips>のことで心を痛めているんだろう。","en":"He looks down. I am sure the thought of <tips=86>the twins</tips> pains him even more than it does me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r383","rowIndex":383,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　元々暴力が苦手で優しいヤツなんだ。","en":"He has always been a kind man who hates violence.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r384","rowIndex":384,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「大丈夫だよ<tips=66>コンタ</tips>。おれには迷いはない」","en":"“It’s all right, <tips=66>Konta</tips>. I have no doubts.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r385","rowIndex":385,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おれは拳銃に装填された弾丸を確認しながら<tips=66>コンタ</tips>に向かって微笑んだ。","en":"I smile at <tips=66>Konta</tips> while checking the rounds loaded into my pistol.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r386","rowIndex":386,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それより、お前に頼みがある。外にまわって、ドアの鍵をかけてくれ。そしたらそのまま近くに隠れて、出入り口を見張ってくれ」","en":"“More importantly, I need you to do something. Go around outside and lock the door. Then stay hidden nearby and keep watch over the entrance.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r387","rowIndex":387,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「他のヤツに頼みなよ。おれだって、一応副隊長なんだぜ。ここで全体を見てなくちゃ」","en":"“Ask somebody else. I’m the deputy commander, you know. I need to stay here and keep an eye on the whole operation.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"田中紺太","displayName":"Konta Tanaka","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r388","rowIndex":388,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=66>コンタ</tips>は不満そうだが、おれはどうしてもこの仕事を彼にやって欲しかった。","en":"<tips=66>Konta</tips> looks dissatisfied, but I am determined that he should be the one to perform this task.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r389","rowIndex":389,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「適材適所だよ。冷静に指示を出すのは<tips=67>カミラ</tips>の方が向いてるし、今ここにいるメンバーで一番銃がヘタなのはお前だからな」","en":"“Right man for the right job. <tips=67>Camilla</tips> is better suited to issuing calm instructions, and you’re the worst shot among the people we have here.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r390","rowIndex":390,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ちぇ、信用ないんだな」","en":"“Tch. Nice to know you trust me.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"田中紺太","displayName":"Konta Tanaka","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r391","rowIndex":391,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=66>コンタ</tips>は渋々頷いた。","en":"<tips=66>Konta</tips> reluctantly nods.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r392","rowIndex":392,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それでおれは少しほっとした。","en":"And I feel a little relieved.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r393","rowIndex":393,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　こいつには、おれが<tips=86>灰上姉妹</tips>を殺すところを見せたくなかったんだ。","en":"I did not want him to watch me kill the <tips=86>Haigami sisters</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r394","rowIndex":394,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　変更した作戦はこうだ。","en":"This is the revised plan.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r395","rowIndex":395,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　まず、最大の脅威であり目標である<tips=65>ヘス</tips>を最優先で仕留めるという方針は変わらない。","en":"Our first priority remains eliminating <tips=65>Hess</tips>, the principal threat and our target.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r396","rowIndex":396,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　清水がうまく誘導して、狙撃の目標ポイントとして設定してあるいくつかの場所のうちひとつに<tips=65>ヘス</tips>を立たせ、それを棚の最上部、天井付近の物陰に隠れている狙撃手が撃つ。そのあと狙撃手は連続して<tips=86>双子</tips>を狙うが、標的が物陰に隠れるなどして倒しきれない場合は無理をせず、おれを含めた三人の別働隊が地上から攻撃する。別働隊は武装しており、おれは拳銃、部下の二人は小さなマシンガンを使う。","en":"Shimizu will guide <tips=65>Hess</tips> onto one of several preselected firing points. The sniper hidden in the shadows atop a shelf near the ceiling will shoot him, then immediately turn his fire on the <tips=86>twins</tips>. If they take cover or he otherwise fails to finish them, he will not press the attempt. A separate three-man assault team, including me, will attack from ground level. I have a pistol; my two men carry compact machine guns.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r397","rowIndex":397,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おれは司令室となっている小部屋を出て、他の二人の部下と一緒に足音に気をつけながら静かに移動し、倉庫に足を踏み入れる。","en":"I leave the little room serving as our command post and move quietly with my two subordinates, taking care not to make any sound as we enter the warehouse.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r398","rowIndex":398,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　息を殺して物陰に潜み、すると、<tips=65>ヘス</tips>と清水が話す声が聞こえてくる。","en":"Holding our breath, we conceal ourselves behind cover. Then I hear <tips=65>Hess</tips> and Shimizu talking.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r399","rowIndex":399,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=65>ヘス</tips>ってのはどうにも几帳面な爺さんで、新しく工場を作るたびに自分でその設備を確認し、設置する機械の台数などを自ら決定しないと気が済まない。『<tips=46>ネオ・ローズ</tips>』の生産量を正確に把握したいのかもしれないが、ご苦労なことだ。おれだったらそんなものは他のやつに任せてしまうところだが、『管理したがり』なのかもしれないな。","en":"<tips=65>Hess</tips> is an incorrigibly meticulous old man. Whenever a new factory is built, nothing will satisfy him but inspecting the facilities himself and personally deciding how many machines are to be installed. Perhaps he wants an exact grasp of ‘<tips=46>Neo Rose</tips>’ production, but it is an impressive amount of trouble to take. I would leave the whole business to someone else. Maybe he simply cannot bear not to have everything under his control.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r400","rowIndex":400,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　だから<tips=65>ヘス</tips>の視察は念入りだ。倉庫のあちこちに足を踏み入れ、いちいち立ち止まってその手帳にメモをとる。清水から聞いた話によると、窓の位置やコンセントの場所や数もメモをするらしい。","en":"<tips=65>Hess</tips> is therefore meticulous in his inspection. He steps into every part of the warehouse, stopping each time to write in his notebook. Shimizu tells me that he even records where the windows and electrical outlets are, and how many outlets there are.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r401","rowIndex":401,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　この倉庫の所有者は建設関係の資材などを扱っていたようで、端の方にコンクリートの袋が積み上げられたり、棚には塗料の缶が並べられたり、ビニールをかぶったバスタブなどがほったらかしにしてある。","en":"The owner of this warehouse appears to have dealt in building materials. Bags of cement are piled at one end, cans of paint line the shelves, and bathtubs shrouded in plastic lie abandoned here and there.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r402","rowIndex":402,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　実際にはここは『<tips=46>ネオ・ローズ</tips>』の工場にするわけではなく、所有者はこの後別の商売をするそうだから、これらの資材はこれから売り払うのかもしれない。とにかくごちゃごちゃとした場所で、おれたち襲撃隊が隠れる場所には事欠かなかった。","en":"The building is not truly going to become a ‘<tips=46>Neo Rose</tips>’ factory. Apparently its owner intends to start some other business afterward, so perhaps he plans to sell all these materials. Whatever the case, the place is a chaotic mess with no shortage of hiding places for our assault team.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r403","rowIndex":403,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ただ、心配なのは<tips=86>双子</tips>の動きだ。あいつらは昔から好奇心が強い。普通のボディーガードや助手のようにぴったり<tips=65>ヘス</tips>にくっついていてくれればいいが、勝手に動き出してその辺を覗き込んだりひっぺがしたりされると計画が台無しになる可能性もある。","en":"My one concern is what the <tips=86>twins</tips> will do. They have always been intensely curious. If they remain close to <tips=65>Hess</tips> like ordinary bodyguards or assistants, we will be fine. But if they wander away, peering beneath things and tearing off covers, they may ruin the plan.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r404","rowIndex":404,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　というわけでおれたちは極力近づかず、倉庫に入ってすぐの壁に立てかけてあった大きな板の裏に隠れた。<tips=86>双子</tips>がこちらに近づいてくるようなら、空いたままのドアからすぐ外に退避出来る位置である。","en":"For that reason, we keep our distance and hide behind a large panel propped against the wall just inside the warehouse. If the <tips=86>twins</tips> come our way, the open door beside us will let us slip outside at once.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r405","rowIndex":405,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　むさ苦しく男三人、寄り添うように小さくしゃがみ込んで息を殺している。あまりにも距離があるから、ここからは<tips=65>ヘス</tips>たちの様子が全くわからない。何にもしていなくとも、こういう状況は神経がすり減るものだ。","en":"The three of us—an unlovely huddle of grown men—crouch small and close together, holding our breath. We are so far away that we cannot see what <tips=65>Hess</tips> and the others are doing at all. Even with nothing happening, this sort of situation grinds the nerves to dust.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r406","rowIndex":406,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"『間もなく<tips=65>ヘス</tips>は第二ポイントにつきます。そこで狙撃を行います』","en":"‘<tips=65>Hess</tips> will reach Point Two shortly. We will take the shot there.’","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r407","rowIndex":407,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ヘッドセットから<tips=67>カミラ</tips>の報告が入る。いよいよか。おれたちにも緊張が走る。","en":"<tips=67>Camilla’s</tips> report comes through my headset. So it is finally time. Tension runs through us.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r408","rowIndex":408,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ラジャー。おれたちも移動する」","en":"“Roger. We’ll move too.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r409","rowIndex":409,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ヘッドセットのマイクの部分を手で覆い、小声でそう返事をすると、おれたちは板の裏を出て、音を立てないように物陰をつたいながら移動する。まったくゴキブリになったような気分だ。","en":"I cover the headset microphone with one hand and reply in a whisper. We emerge from behind the board and move from cover to cover without making a sound. I feel like a cockroach.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r410","rowIndex":410,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　第二ポイントは、倉庫の一番奥の、コンクリートの土嚢が積み上げられているところの前のポジションだ。","en":"The second point lies at the far end of the warehouse, before a stack of cement sacks.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r411","rowIndex":411,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　小さな台が置いてある。<tips=65>ヘス</tips>はいつも最後に自分のメモの写しを作り、こちらに渡す。この台を使ってそれを書いているところを狙い撃とうというわけだ。同様に、他の二つのポイントにも書くのに丁度良いような台を用意してあり、状況に応じて清水が誘導することになっていた。","en":"A small writing stand has been placed there. <tips=65>Hess</tips> always makes a copy of his notes at the end and hands it to us. We plan to shoot him while he is writing the copy on this stand. We placed similarly convenient writing stands at the other two points as well, and Shimizu was to guide him toward one according to the circumstances.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r412","rowIndex":412,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　焦れば物音が立って気づかれる。遅すぎれば現場とあまりにも離れてしまって、狙撃の後スムーズに襲撃が出来ない。","en":"If we rush, we will make a sound and be discovered. If we move too slowly, we will be too far from the scene to launch a smooth attack after the shot.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r413","rowIndex":413,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　変な汗が出そうになりながら、おれは清水たちから棚ひとつ隔てたすぐ近くまで移動した。","en":"Breaking into a strange, nervous sweat, I move until only a single shelf separates me from Shimizu and the others.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r414","rowIndex":414,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なかなか良い場所だろう？　見つけるのに苦労したんだ」","en":"“It’s quite a good site, isn’t it? It took us a lot of trouble to find.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"清水（シミズ）","displayName":"Shimizu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r415","rowIndex":415,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　隙間からこっそり覗くと、清水がそう言ってメモの写し用に自分の手帳を<tips=65>ヘス</tips>に手渡すところだった。","en":"Peering furtively through a gap, I see Shimizu say it as he hands <tips=65>Hess</tips> his own notebook for the copy.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r416","rowIndex":416,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「少し大きすぎますネ」","en":"“It is a little too large.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エフゲニ・ヘス","displayName":"Yevgeny Hess","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r417","rowIndex":417,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=65>ヘス</tips>はあまり気乗りしない様子でその手帳を受け取った。","en":"Looking less than enthusiastic, <tips=65>Hess</tips> accepts the notebook.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r418","rowIndex":418,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「これからは、これくらいの設備も必要だと思うんだがね」","en":"“I think we’ll need facilities of this size from now on.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"清水（シミズ）","displayName":"Shimizu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r419","rowIndex":419,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　清水の声は事前の緊張のわりには自然にきこえる。","en":"Despite his nerves beforehand, Shimizu’s voice sounds natural.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r420","rowIndex":420,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=86>双子</tips>は<tips=65>ヘス</tips>のすぐ向こうの鉄パイプの束の上に腰掛け、つまらなそうにやりとりを眺めていた。そのよく見知ったあどけない横顔を見ると、おれはさすがに胸が苦しくなり、口の中が乾いた。","en":"The <tips=86>twins</tips> sit on a bundle of iron pipes just beyond <tips=65>Hess</tips>, watching the exchange with bored expressions. The familiar, innocent profiles make my chest ache and my mouth go dry.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r421","rowIndex":421,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　本当にやるのか？　出来るのだろうか？　間もなく現実になるだろうその場面を、どうしても今の瞬間と地続きにあるもののように感じられない。","en":"Are we really going to do it? Can I? The scene that will become reality in another moment refuses to feel as though it belongs to the same unbroken world as the present.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r422","rowIndex":422,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　なんだか、悪い夢を見ているような気分だ。そう、実際おれは人を殺す夢をよく見る。","en":"It feels as though I am having a nightmare. I do, in fact, often dream of killing people.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r423","rowIndex":423,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　小さな頃からだ――いつからだったろうな？　ボロアパートにいたときはよく見たもんだ。母親を殺す夢を。そしてそのあとは、世話になった修吾さんを殺す夢を見たり、奥さんを殺す夢を見たり、<tips=1>亮</tips>を殺す夢を見たり、<tips=66>コンタ</tips>を殺す夢を見たり、<tips=86>双子</tips>を殺す夢をみたこともある。最近では<tips=44>詩由子</tips>を殺す夢を見た。","en":"Ever since I was little—but when did it begin? I used to have them often in that shabby apartment: dreams of killing my mother. After that came dreams of killing Shugo, the man who had taken me in; of killing his wife; of killing <tips=1>Leung</tips>, or <tips=66>Konta</tips>, or even the <tips=86>twins</tips>. Recently I dreamed of killing <tips=44>Shiyuko</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r424","rowIndex":424,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おれは無感情で、血みどろになった死体を見下ろしている。大体、その時おれは右手の超能力で相手をバラバラにしているんだ。その夢の一つが、こうして現実になろうとしてるんだ。いや、現実になる夢は一つだけじゃないかもしれない。","en":"In them, I feel nothing as I look down at a corpse drenched in blood. Usually I have torn the other person to pieces with the power in my right hand. Now one of those dreams is about to come true. No—perhaps not only one.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r425","rowIndex":425,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　感傷的になってはいけない。今はそんな悠長な場面じゃないんだ。","en":"I must not become sentimental. This is no time to indulge in it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r426","rowIndex":426,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　相手は無力な子羊じゃない。","en":"My opponents are not helpless lambs.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r427","rowIndex":427,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　一人でギャングのアジトで殺戮を繰り広げる恐ろしいサイキックと、それぞれ優れた力を持った二人が相手だ。うまく不意打ちが決まらなければ、純粋な戦闘力ではおれたちの勝ち目は薄い。","en":"We face a terrifying psychic who massacred an entire gang hideout alone, and two people who each possess formidable powers. Unless our surprise attack succeeds, our chances in a contest of pure combat ability are poor.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r428","rowIndex":428,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　戦いのことだけを考えろ。戦いでどうやって勝つか。集中するんだ。","en":"Think only of the battle. Think of how to win it. Concentrate.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r429","rowIndex":429,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　この世界では、戦いというものが一番正直だ。お互いが持っているものを全て出し合って、最後に立っているものが生き残るだけ。そこには善も悪もなく、どんな解釈もなく、ただ現実だけがある。","en":"In this world, nothing is more honest than battle. Both sides bring forth everything they possess, and whoever remains standing at the end survives. There is no good or evil, no interpretation—only reality.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r430","rowIndex":430,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　もしこの現実が神によって作られたものならば、まさにその現実のなかで明白な結果が出る闘争というものほど神聖なものはない。","en":"If God created this reality, then nothing could be more sacred than a struggle that produces an unequivocal result within that very reality.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r431","rowIndex":431,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　灰上よ、おれたちはこれから戦うんだ。","en":"Haigami, you and I are about to fight.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r432","rowIndex":432,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おまえたちは哀れな獲物ではない。<tips=65>ヘス</tips>のような人間に関わるのならば、当然いつだって警戒心を持っていなくてはいけないし、それがこの街で生き残るために必要な能力だ。ボディーガードとして付き従っているのなら、もっと周囲に気を配るべきだ。なんだその油断そのものの態度は。もしおまえたちがおれたちに簡単に殺されるのだとしたら、ここで生きる能力が欠けていたということになるんだぜ。","en":"You are not helpless, pitiable prey. Anyone who involves herself with a man like <tips=65>Hess</tips> must keep her guard up at all times; that is one of the abilities survival in this city demands. If you mean to accompany him as bodyguards, you ought to be watching your surroundings more carefully. What is this picture of perfect carelessness? If we kill you with ease, it will only mean that you lacked what it takes to survive here.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r433","rowIndex":433,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　まさか、おまえたちがそんな無力なはずがないだろう？","en":"Surely you cannot be so helpless.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r434","rowIndex":434,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おれはおまえたちをリスペクトしている。だから哀れむなんて失礼なことはしない。この街で生きる対等な獣として、油断せず、最も確率の高いやり方でおまえたちを倒そう。","en":"I respect you. I will not demean you with anything so insulting as pity. I will face you without lowering my guard, as beasts who live as equals in this city, and bring you down by whatever method offers the greatest chance of success.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r435","rowIndex":435,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　――やっと、心が落ち着いて来た。","en":"—At last, my heart begins to settle.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r436","rowIndex":436,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　メモ用紙を受け取った<tips=65>ヘス</tips>は、胸ポケットから取り出したペンを片手に台の前に立ち、帽子を脱いでその上に置いた。そして自分のメモ帳と用紙を並べて書き写しをはじめる。清水はそれとなく後退して<tips=65>ヘス</tips>と距離をとった。<tips=86>双子</tips>は相変わらず興味なさげに腰掛けたまま足をぶらつかせている。","en":"After accepting the sheet of notepaper, <tips=65>Hess</tips> stands before the writing stand with a pen from his breast pocket in one hand, takes off his hat, and sets it on the stand. Then he places his own notebook beside the sheet and starts copying. Shimizu unobtrusively backs away, putting some distance between himself and <tips=65>Hess</tips>. The <tips=86>twins</tips> remain seated as before, idly swinging their legs.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r437","rowIndex":437,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"『準備が出来ました。そちらは大丈夫ですか？』","en":"‘Everything is ready. Are you in position?’","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r438","rowIndex":438,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ヘッドセットから流れる<tips=67>カミラ</tips>の声に、おれは無言で親指を立てて見せる。これはカメラの映像越しに<tips=67>カミラ</tips>に伝わり、そして背後の狙撃手にも見えているだろう。","en":"At <tips=67>Camilla’s</tips> voice through the headset, I silently raise my thumb. The camera will show the gesture to <tips=67>Camilla</tips>, and the sniper behind me will presumably see it as well.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r439","rowIndex":439,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　いよいよ、その時が始まる。","en":"At last, it begins.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r440","rowIndex":440,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おれは銃を両手で構え、その瞬間を待った。『スイッチ』をいれて<tips=95>金眼</tips>の力を発動させると、体中にざわざわと血が通って火照るような感覚がある。もう雑念は心に存在しない。","en":"I grip my pistol in both hands and wait. I throw the ‘switch,’ activating the power of my <tips=95>golden eyes</tips>, and feel blood course restlessly through my body as heat suffuses it. Not a single stray thought remains in my mind.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r441","rowIndex":441,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　銃弾の速度は音より速い。","en":"A bullet travels faster than sound.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r442","rowIndex":442,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　集中によって高まったおれの目には、音が来るよりも先に飛来する銃弾が見えた。","en":"My eyes, heightened by concentration, see the bullet arrive before its report.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r443","rowIndex":443,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　回転する銃弾が<tips=65>ヘス</tips>の耳の上辺りに着弾すると、その衝撃が、まるで雫が落ちた水面のように、たるんだ頬の皮膚を振動させる。","en":"When the spinning bullet strikes <tips=65>Hess</tips> just above the ear, the impact makes the loose skin of his cheek ripple like water struck by a drop.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r444","rowIndex":444,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして弾が貫通して向こう側に抜けていった後に、<tips=65>ヘス</tips>の頭の上半分が、プリンを撃ったように崩れ飛ぶ。","en":"Then the bullet punches through and emerges from the other side, and the upper half of <tips=65>Hess’s</tips> head bursts apart as though someone had fired into a pudding.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r445","rowIndex":445,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そうした光景のあと、発砲の轟音がやっと追いついて、あたりの空気を震わせる。","en":"Only after that sight does the thunder of the shot finally catch up and shake the air around us.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r446","rowIndex":446,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　今日のおれはいつもより調子がいいみたいだ。","en":"I seem to be in better condition than usual today.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r447","rowIndex":447,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　こんなにはっきりと一瞬の出来事を認識出来るとは。","en":"To think I can perceive a single instant with such clarity.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r448","rowIndex":448,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　フェルナンデス家を襲った時もこんな感覚だった。危険によって分泌された脳内物質と<tips=17>タイプB</tips>としての力が結びついて、相乗効果となっているのかもしれない。","en":"It felt like this when we attacked the Fernandes house as well. Perhaps the chemicals released in my brain by danger combine with my power as a <tips=17>Type B</tips> and amplify one another.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r449","rowIndex":449,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それとも、単に本格的な発症が近づきおれの<tips=17>タイプB</tips>傾向が強まっているのか。","en":"Or perhaps I am simply approaching full-blown onset, and my <tips=17>Type B</tips> traits are growing stronger.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r450","rowIndex":450,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　仰向けに倒れてゆく<tips=65>ヘス</tips>を横目におれは物陰から飛び出し、<tips=86>双子</tips>の方に銃口を向けた。先にサイキックの<tips=11>璃映子</tips>の方を片付けたかったが、物陰からいくら観察してもどっちがどっちだかわからなかった。だから左の方を撃つと決めていた。","en":"<tips=65>Hess</tips> falls backward at the edge of my vision. I burst from cover and point my pistol toward the <tips=86>twins</tips>. I wanted to eliminate the psychic <tips=11>Rieko</tips> first, but no matter how carefully I watched from hiding, I could not tell them apart. So I had decided in advance to shoot the one on the left.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r451","rowIndex":451,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　迷わずそちらに銃を構えると、相手の目がキラリと金色に変化するのが見える。ということはおれの勘はハズレだ。こっちが妹の<tips=12>江梨子</tips>だったか。","en":"I aim at her without hesitation and see her eyes flash gold. My guess was wrong. This one is the younger sister, <tips=12>Eriko</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r452","rowIndex":452,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　もう片方の<tips=11>璃映子</tips>は<tips=65>ヘス</tips>に気をとられてそちらの方を振り返ったが、<tips=12>江梨子</tips>は<tips=17>タイプＢ</tips>の素早い反応でおれの存在に気が付き、まっすぐこちらを見ていた。","en":"The other twin, <tips=11>Rieko</tips>, turns toward <tips=65>Hess</tips>, distracted by his fall. But <tips=12>Eriko</tips> notices me with the swift reactions of a <tips=17>Type B</tips> and looks directly at me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r453","rowIndex":453,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　今からでも<tips=11>璃映子</tips>に狙いを変えて撃った方が確実か？　そんな考えが一瞬頭によぎったが、おれは方針をかえずそのまま引き金を引いた。","en":"Would I have a surer shot if I changed targets and fired upon <tips=11>Rieko</tips>, even now? The thought crosses my mind for an instant, but I hold to the plan and pull the trigger.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r454","rowIndex":454,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　少し離れて隠れていたので、おれの銃口から標的までは十メートルほどの距離がある。この口径の小さな拳銃じゃ弾の早さもたかが知れているから、俊敏な<tips=17>タイプB</tips>に真正面から撃っても仕留められるとは限らない。もし、狙われたのがおれならば急所を外すくらいのことは可能だろうが、完全に避けきることは難しい。重傷を負うか、少しでも反応が遅れれば急所に直撃を喰らう可能性だってある。","en":"We had hidden some distance away, leaving nearly ten meters between my muzzle and the target. A small-caliber pistol can only drive a bullet so fast; fired head-on at an agile <tips=17>Type B</tips>, it is not certain to kill. If I were the target, I could probably twist far enough to save my vital organs, but dodging the shot entirely would be difficult. I would still risk a serious wound—and the slightest delay in reacting could put the bullet straight through a vital point.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r455","rowIndex":455,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=12>江梨子</tips>はどの程度出来るのか。","en":"How capable is <tips=12>Eriko</tips>?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r456","rowIndex":456,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　マジかよ！　引き金を引ききった瞬間、もう相手が動き始めるのが見えた。","en":"You’ve got to be kidding me! The very instant I finish pulling the trigger, I can already see her moving.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r457","rowIndex":457,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=12>江梨子</tips>は地面を蹴って横に飛び、隣の姉を抱きかかえるようにして鉄パイプの向こうに倒れ込む。弾丸はその肩の辺りをかすめたようだが、命中したかどうかは視認できなかった。いくらなんでも完全に避けきってはいないよな？　たぶん、肩に穴を開けるくらいは出来たのではないだろうか。いずれにしろ、致命傷にほど遠いのは間違いない。","en":"<tips=12>Eriko</tips> kicks off the ground and hurls herself sideways, gathering her elder sister into her arms as they fall behind the iron pipes. The bullet seems to skim the vicinity of her shoulder, but I cannot see whether it struck. Surely not even she could have evaded it completely. I probably managed to put a hole through her shoulder, at least. Either way, there is no question that the wound is nowhere near fatal.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r458","rowIndex":458,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　続けざまに仲間のライフルの弾丸が飛んでくるが、それは余りにも遅く、彼女が座っていた場所の鉄パイプにバチンと穴を開けただけだった。","en":"One of my comrades’ rifle rounds follows immediately, but it comes far too late. It merely punches through an iron pipe where she was sitting.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r459","rowIndex":459,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そこでやっと、おれと一緒に隠れていた相棒が銃を構えた。飛び出した瞬間はおれとほとんど変わらなかったが、動作はおれの方が早かったのだ。","en":"Only then does the partner who had been hiding with me bring his weapon to bear. He burst out almost at the same instant I did, but I moved faster.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r460","rowIndex":460,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「もう狙撃は必要ない。おれたちでやる」","en":"“No more sniping. We’ll do this ourselves.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r461","rowIndex":461,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おれは銃口を二人が消えた方に向けながら、ヘッドセットのマイクに呟く。","en":"Keeping my gun trained on the place where the two disappeared, I murmur into the headset microphone.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r462","rowIndex":462,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=65>ヘス</tips>の方を横目でチラリと見ると、床の上に仰向けにひっくりかえったままピクリともしない。まあ、頭を吹き飛ばされて動き回るようなやつはいないというわけだ。","en":"I glance sideways at <tips=65>Hess</tips>. He remains on his back on the floor without a twitch. Apparently, no one runs around after having his head blown away.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r463","rowIndex":463,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=86>灰上姉妹</tips>は鉄パイプの束の向こう側に隠れている。二人の仲間にこの位置で銃を構えて待つよう指示し、自分は左側に移動した。","en":"The <tips=86>Haigami sisters</tips> are concealed beyond the bundle of iron pipes. I tell my two comrades to hold this position with their weapons ready, then move to the left.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r464","rowIndex":464,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　いつ相手が何をしてきても対応出来るように、銃を構えながらゆっくりと移動する。","en":"I advance slowly with my pistol raised, prepared to respond no matter what the enemy attempts.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r465","rowIndex":465,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　すると、サラサラと乾いたものがこぼれ落ちるような音がする。","en":"Then I hear a dry, whispering sound, like loose material spilling out.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r466","rowIndex":466,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　鉄パイプの束の脇には、コンクリート用のセメントがビニールの袋に詰められた形で積み上げられていたのだが、その一つに切れ目が入って、そこから中の粉末が流れ落ちている。","en":"Beside the bundle of iron pipes, plastic sacks of cement for making concrete are stacked up. One has split open, and powder is streaming from the cut.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r467","rowIndex":467,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　切れ目はとても自然に割けたものとは思えない。そしてあの位置は、銃弾が当たるような場所でもない。なんで急に破れたんだ？　じっと見ると、その切れ目のそばにきらりと光るものが見えた。","en":"There is no conceivable way the slit could have torn open naturally, and it is nowhere a bullet could have struck. Why did it suddenly split? When I stare closely, I see something glittering beside the cut.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r468","rowIndex":468,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それは、ガラスの破片だった。小さなガラスの破片が空中を勝手に動いて袋を切り裂き、今もその切れ目を拡大しているのだ。","en":"A shard of glass. The little fragment is moving through the air by itself, slicing the sack and lengthening the opening even now.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r469","rowIndex":469,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あっ」","en":"“Ah!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"清水（シミズ）","displayName":"Shimizu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r470","rowIndex":470,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　と声をあげたのは遠巻きに戦闘をながめていた清水だった。","en":"The one who cries out is Shimizu, who has been watching the battle from a distance.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r471","rowIndex":471,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　我々の見ている前で、そのセメントの袋が見えない糸で引っ張られるように、上空に舞い上がったのである。","en":"Before our eyes, the sack of cement rises high into the air as though pulled by an invisible string.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r472","rowIndex":472,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「くそっ！　なんだっ！」","en":"“Shit! What is that?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"清水（シミズ）","displayName":"Shimizu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r473","rowIndex":473,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　頭上からセメントの粉末がまき散らされ、相棒も清水も頭を覆う。","en":"Cement powder scatters from overhead, and both my partner and Shimizu cover their heads.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r474","rowIndex":474,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「目に入れるな！　失明するぞ！」","en":"“Keep it out of your eyes! You’ll go blind!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r475","rowIndex":475,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おれは言いながら、片方の手で目の上にひさしを作り、<tips=86>双子</tips>が隠れている鉄パイプの束のほうを見た。","en":"As I shout, I make a visor over my eyes with one hand and stare toward the bundle of iron pipes concealing <tips=86>the twins</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r476","rowIndex":476,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　この目くらましの隙に脱出しようというのなら、そこを撃ってやる！","en":"If they try to use this smokescreen to escape, I’ll shoot them!","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r477","rowIndex":477,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しかし、相手はおれが思っていたよりも戦闘に対して積極的だった。","en":"My opponents, however, are far more aggressive than I had expected.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r478","rowIndex":478,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　煙のように視界を覆う粉末のなかで、何か黒い影が動いたような気がしてそちらに銃を向けた瞬間、銃を構えた腕の肘に激痛を感じた。","en":"Within the powder obscuring my vision like smoke, I sense a black shadow move. The instant I turn my pistol toward it, violent pain pierces the elbow of my gun arm.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r479","rowIndex":479,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　見ると、細いナイフが突き刺さっている。<tips=11>璃映子</tips>がいつも護身用に用意しているものだ。","en":"A slender knife is buried in the joint—the knife <tips=11>Rieko</tips> always keeps ready for self-defense.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r480","rowIndex":480,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しかもただ突き刺さっただけではなく、回転しながらぐりぐりと肉の内側に食い込もうとしている。あいつは、逃げるためではなく、このナイフの軌道を隠すためにセメントをまき散らしたのだ。","en":"And it is not merely embedded. It rotates, grinding deeper into my flesh. She scattered the cement not to escape, but to conceal the knife’s trajectory.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r481","rowIndex":481,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ぐっ」","en":"“Guh!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r482","rowIndex":482,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おれはそれをもう片方の手でつかみ取ると、床に投げ捨てた。","en":"I seize it with my other hand and throw it to the floor.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r483","rowIndex":483,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして顔を上げると、煙幕のなかをもう一本の長細いものがグルグルと飛び回っているのが見える。飛んでいるのが今見えているあの一本とも限らないだろう。相手は向こうに隠れたまま見えにくいナイフを飛ばしてくる。こちらが銃を撃つには、これをかいくぐって近づかなくてはいけない。","en":"When I raise my head, I see another long, slender object spinning through the smokescreen. There is no reason to assume the one I can see is the only one. My opponent remains hidden on the far side, sending knives we can barely see flying toward us; to get close enough for a shot, we will have to thread our way through them.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r484","rowIndex":484,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　お互い視力が効かないという同じ条件でも、相手の方が有利なわけか。","en":"Even under equal conditions, when neither side can rely on sight, the advantage belongs to them.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r485","rowIndex":485,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おれは一端後ずさって、粉末ですっかり全身を灰色に染めて咳込んでいる仲間たちのところに戻った。","en":"I retreat for the moment, returning to my companions, who are coughing with their bodies completely coated gray.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r486","rowIndex":486,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=67>カミラ</tips>、こっちは視界が悪い。もしそっちで<tips=86>双子</tips>が逃げるのが見えたら教えてくれ」","en":"“<tips=67>Camilla</tips>, visibility is poor here. Tell me if you see <tips=86>the twins</tips> escaping from your side.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r487","rowIndex":487,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　カメラに頼らず自分の目で確認したいところだが、頭上では二つ目のコンクリートの袋が舞っている。","en":"I would prefer to confirm it with my own eyes rather than rely upon the cameras, but a second sack of cement is floating overhead.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r488","rowIndex":488,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　辺りはもうもうとして、目や鼻にも容赦なく入り込もうとしてくる。とてもここで戦闘を継続出来るような状況じゃない。清水と部下を促し、後退を余儀なくされた。","en":"The air is thick with powder, forcing its way mercilessly into our eyes and noses. There is no possibility of continuing the battle here. I urge Shimizu and my subordinate back, and we are forced to retreat.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r489","rowIndex":489,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　拳銃もすっかりセメントの粉を浴びてしまった。こんな状態でまともに動作するだろうか？　甚だ不安だが仕方ない。","en":"My pistol is thoroughly coated in cement powder as well. Will it operate properly in this condition? I have grave doubts, but there is nothing else I can do.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r490","rowIndex":490,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おまじないにしかならないが、表面のセメントを手で払い、ガチャリと上部を払うとふーっと息を吹き込んでみたりした。","en":"It can amount to no more than a superstitious gesture, but I brush the cement from its surface, rack the slide with a clack, and blow into it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r491","rowIndex":491,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ど、どうしますか？」","en":"“Wh-what do we do?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r492","rowIndex":492,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　相棒がおれにそう訊ねる。真っ白な顔に、涙の通ったあとだけセメントが濡れて黒っぽくなっている。","en":"My partner asks me. His face is perfectly white, except for the dark, damp trails his tears have drawn through the cement.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r493","rowIndex":493,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ここで見張ってれば、相手もおいそれとは動けない。焦らず追い詰めるんだ」","en":"“As long as we hold watch here, they won’t be able to move freely either. We’ll take our time closing the net.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r494","rowIndex":494,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「し、しかし、あの能力は……」","en":"“B-but with that power of theirs...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r495","rowIndex":495,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「不安かい？」","en":"“Worried?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r496","rowIndex":496,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　相棒の顔には明らかに怯えが浮かんでいる。無理もない。ああいう能力を初めて見せられれば誰だって戸惑うし、おれのこの傷口からダラダラと流れる血を見たら不安にもなる。","en":"Fear is written plainly across my partner’s face. Small wonder. Anyone would be bewildered the first time he saw a power like that, and the blood streaming steadily from my wound gives him every reason to be afraid.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r497","rowIndex":497,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「相手は素手の<tips=17>タイプB</tips>と、念動力使いの二人。こちらは拳銃もちのおれと、マシンガンを持ってるお前と、ライフルを持って隠れたスナイパー三人の<tips=17>タイプB</tips>。カメラの映像を見る係もいる。不意打ちは失敗したが、分の悪い勝負じゃないと思うがね」","en":"“They have an unarmed <tips=17>Type B</tips> and a telekinetic—two opponents. We have three <tips=17>Type Bs</tips>: me with a pistol, you with a machine gun, and a concealed sniper with a rifle. We also have someone watching the camera feeds. Our ambush failed, but I wouldn’t say the odds are against us.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r498","rowIndex":498,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そう話したところで銃声が鳴った。狙撃手が引き金を引いたのだ。","en":"The moment I finish, a shot cracks. The sniper has pulled his trigger.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r499","rowIndex":499,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「やったか？」","en":"“Did he get one?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r500","rowIndex":500,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"『外しました。左の煙が薄い方から抜けようとしたところを撃ったんですが、すぐにひっこんで……』","en":"‘Missed. One tried to slip out where the smoke is thinner on the left. I fired, but she ducked back immediately...’","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r501","rowIndex":501,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうか、それなら念のため……」","en":"“I see. Then, just in case...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r502","rowIndex":502,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　場所を移動しろ、と言いかけたところで、収まりつつある煙から煌めくものが飛び出すのが見えた。","en":"I am about to tell him to change positions when I see something glittering fly out of the settling smoke.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r503","rowIndex":503,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あれは……」","en":"“Is that...?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"清水（シミズ）","displayName":"Shimizu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r504","rowIndex":504,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　清水がそう呟く。","en":"Shimizu murmurs.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r505","rowIndex":505,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ナイフは一直線に飛翔して、我々の頭上を通り過ぎ、背後にある一番背の高い棚の上に吸い込まれるように飛んで行く。","en":"The knife flies in a straight line, passes over our heads, and streaks as though being drawn into the top of the tallest shelf behind us.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r506","rowIndex":506,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　あの方向は、まずい。","en":"That direction is trouble.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r507","rowIndex":507,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「避けろっ！」","en":"“Dodge!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r508","rowIndex":508,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おれはすぐにマイクに向かって叫んだが、もう遅い。","en":"I shout into the microphone at once, but it is already too late.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r509","rowIndex":509,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"『あっ！』","en":"‘Ah!’","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r510","rowIndex":510,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ヘッドセットから呻き声が聞こえ、そしてその後に何かガサガサと衝撃音が聞こえたかと思うと、向こうの棚の方でドサリと何かが落ちる音がした。","en":"A cry of pain comes through the headset. There follows a confusion of scraping and impacts, and then, from beyond the shelf, the heavy thud of something striking the floor.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r511","rowIndex":511,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"『シュウ！』","en":"‘Shu!’","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r512","rowIndex":512,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=67>カミラ</tips>が狙撃手の名を呼ぶ声がする。しかし、それに応える声はない。","en":"<tips=67>Camilla</tips> calls the sniper’s name. No voice answers.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r513","rowIndex":513,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　やりやがった。きっと、逃げ出すふりをしたのは、狙撃手に撃たせてその場所をあぶり出すためにわざと釣ったんだろう。","en":"Damn them. They must have deliberately feigned an escape, baiting the sniper into firing so they could locate him.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r514","rowIndex":514,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　大胆なことをする。囮になったのは素早い<tips=12>江梨子</tips>の方だろうが、いくら<tips=17>タイプB</tips>でも暗闇の奥から飛び出すライフルの銃弾を見てかわすのは不可能だ。そして<tips=11>璃映子</tips>の方も良く見ている。一発で狙撃手の場所を確認して、見事あてやがった。流石、泣く子も黙る<tips=86>灰上姉妹</tips>、といったところか。餓鬼の頃によく喧嘩をした経験が活きているな。","en":"That took nerve. The decoy must have been the quick-footed <tips=12>Eriko</tips>, but not even a <tips=17>Type B</tips> could see and evade a rifle bullet fired out of the darkness. <tips=11>Rieko</tips> kept a sharp watch herself: one shot was enough for her to locate the sniper, and she struck him beautifully. No less than I’d expect from the fearsome <tips=86>Haigami sisters</tips>—the kind whose very name could silence a crying child. All the fighting they did as brats is serving them well.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r515","rowIndex":515,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　狙撃手のシュウが死んだかどうかはわからない。ただ無事だとしても、あそこから落っこちては戦闘に復帰させるのは無理だろう。","en":"I do not know whether Shu, our sniper, is dead. Even if he survived unharmed, a fall from up there will have left him in no condition to rejoin the fight.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r516","rowIndex":516,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　これで、こちらの戦力がひとつなくなったってわけだ。やっぱり全然哀れむ必要なんかなかったね。おれは嬉しいぜ。","en":"And just like that, one piece of our fighting strength is gone. So I truly never had the slightest reason to pity them. Good. I’m glad.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r517","rowIndex":517,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「隊長。これからおれはどうすれば……」","en":"“Commander. What should I do now...?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r518","rowIndex":518,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ここで待っていろ」","en":"“Wait here.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r519","rowIndex":519,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おれはそう言って、立ち上がる。","en":"I say it and rise.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r520","rowIndex":520,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「銃を構えて、そっちを向いて、そう。あいつらがこっちに逃げてくるようだったらそれで狙い撃ちするんだ。間違ってもおれを撃つんじゃねえぞ」","en":"“Keep your weapon raised and face that way. Yes. If they try to escape toward us, shoot them. And whatever you do, don’t shoot me.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r521","rowIndex":521,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「た、隊長は？」","en":"“Wh-what about you, Commander?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r522","rowIndex":522,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ちょっと行って来るよ」","en":"“I’m just going out for a moment.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r523","rowIndex":523,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　軽く言って笑ってやったが、","en":"I make it sound casual and smile at him.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r524","rowIndex":524,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"『やめてください！　これから<tips=21>八龍会</tips>を率いる<tips=10>見土</tips>隊長に何かあるくらいなら、最悪あの<tips=86>双子</tips>は逃がしてもいいんです！　こちらがカメラで状況を見て、指示を出しますから隊長はそこで……』","en":"‘Please stop! If anything happens to Commander <tips=10>Mido</tips>, who is about to lead the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips>, then in the worst case, we can allow the <tips=86>twins</tips> to escape! We will watch the situation through the cameras and issue instructions, so please remain—’","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r525","rowIndex":525,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=67>カミラ</tips>が耳が痛くなるくらい大きな声を出しやがった。","en":"<tips=67>Camilla</tips> damn near shouts my ear off.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r526","rowIndex":526,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=67>カミラ</tips>、始末出来る時にやっておくんだ。そうでなければ次はこっちが死体になる」","en":"“<tips=67>Camilla</tips>, when we can dispose of them, we do it. Otherwise, we’ll be the corpses next time.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r527","rowIndex":527,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"『しかし、今回は……』","en":"‘But on this occasion—’","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r528","rowIndex":528,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おれはまだ何かうるさく言っているヘッドセットを外して、清水の方に放り投げた。","en":"I remove the headset, through which she is still noisily protesting, and toss it to Shimizu.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r529","rowIndex":529,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして、煙が晴れようとしているその場所へゆっくりと歩き出す。おれたちは棚の裏まで退避していたが、その向こう、鉄パイプの束の裏側に彼女たちはまだいるだろう。","en":"Then I walk slowly toward the place where the smoke is beginning to clear. We had retreated behind the shelf, but the twins should still be beyond it, behind the bundle of iron pipes.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r530","rowIndex":530,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　仲間たちには悪いが、一人のほうがずっとやりやすいんだ。誰も守らないで自由に動けるからな。そして戦う相手にだけ集中出来る。","en":"I feel bad for my companions, but working alone is far easier. I can move freely without protecting anyone. I can concentrate solely on the opponents before me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r531","rowIndex":531,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　感覚を研ぎ澄ませ。<tips=17>タイプB</tips>の汚れた血のおかげで精度が上がった感覚を限界まで活かすんだ。肌で空気の動きを感じ取るんだ。ゆっくり呼吸をして、ヘモグロビンに少しでも多くの酸素を運ばせろ。","en":"Sharpen your senses. Make full use of the perceptions honed by the tainted blood of a <tips=17>Type B</tips>. Feel the movement of the air on your skin. Breathe slowly and make your hemoglobin carry as much oxygen as possible.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r532","rowIndex":532,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　子供の頃、毎日どうやれば喧嘩で強くなれるのか考えていた、あの時の感覚を思い出せ。","en":"Remember how it felt as a child, when every day you thought about how to become stronger in a fight.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r533","rowIndex":533,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そうして一歩一歩確かめるように歩き、棚のところを越える。","en":"Testing each step as I advance, I pass the shelf.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r534","rowIndex":534,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　すると目の前に、そこら中にセメントの粉がぶちまけられた、まるで火山灰でも降り注いだような光景が広がった。","en":"Beyond it lies a landscape smothered in cement powder, as though volcanic ash had rained down upon the warehouse.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r535","rowIndex":535,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　もう空中にセメントの袋は舞っておらず、新しい煙幕をばらまいてはいない。静かな光景だ。","en":"The bags of cement are no longer flying through the air, scattering fresh smokescreens. The scene is still.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r536","rowIndex":536,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=86>双子</tips>はもう隠れていなかった。倒れた<tips=65>ヘス</tips>を取り囲むように立って、見下ろしている。","en":"The <tips=86>twins</tips> are no longer in hiding. They stand around the fallen <tips=65>Hess</tips>, looking down at him.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r537","rowIndex":537,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　不意打ちをかけるか？　いや、さすがに相手も気づいているだろう。ならば、真っ向から戦うんだ。それがおれには一番あっている。","en":"Should I catch them by surprise? No, surely they know I'm here by now. Then I'll fight them head-on. That suits me best.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r538","rowIndex":538,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　声をかけようとして、気がついた。","en":"I am about to call to them when I notice it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r539","rowIndex":539,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　倒れている<tips=65>ヘス</tips>の姿がさっきと違う。一回り小さくなっている。しわだらけだった首筋が、白く細いつややかな肌に変わっている。そして、長い金色の髪が床の上にちらばっていた。","en":"The fallen <tips=65>Hess</tips> no longer looks as he did moments ago. His body seems to have shrunk by a size. The wrinkled neck has become slender and white, its skin smooth and lustrous, and long golden hair lies strewn across the floor.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r540","rowIndex":540,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「最後の力で変身したってわけか」","en":"“So he used his last strength to transform.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r541","rowIndex":541,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おれが言うと、<tips=86>双子</tips>は振り返った。","en":"When I speak, the <tips=86>twins</tips> turn around.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r542","rowIndex":542,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=10>見土道夫</tips>」","en":"“<tips=10>Michio Mido</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r543","rowIndex":543,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どうしてこいつを撃った」","en":"“Why did you shoot him?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r544","rowIndex":544,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=86>双子</tips>は相次いで口を開く。<tips=95>金眼</tips>でなければどちらがどちらだか未だに区別がつかない。どちらにも怪我一つないところを見ると、さっきのおれの射撃は完全に回避されたようだ。","en":"The <tips=86>twins</tips> speak in quick succession. Without their <tips=95>Golden Eyes</tips>, I still can't tell which is which. Neither has so much as a scratch, so they seem to have dodged my earlier shot completely.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r545","rowIndex":545,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おいおい、本当かよ。そんなことって出来るのか？　前はそこまで素早くはなかったはずだが、あいつの症状も進行しているってことか。これじゃあ、<tips=55>汐松子</tips>と同じくらいの動きが出来るんじゃないか？","en":"Come on, seriously? Is that even possible? She wasn't that fast before. Does that mean her symptoms are progressing too? At this rate, couldn't she move as fast as <tips=55>Matsuko Shio</tips>?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r546","rowIndex":546,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「お前らこそ、どうしてそいつと一緒にいるんだよ。そいつは得体の知れない化け物だぞ。さっきと全然姿が違うじゃないか。どういう仕組みなんだ？」","en":"“Why are the two of you with that thing? It’s some inscrutable monster. Look at it—it bears no resemblance to what it was a moment ago. What in the world is going on?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r547","rowIndex":547,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=86>双子</tips>との距離は十メートルより少し遠い。十二メートルくらいか？　さっきは十メートルの距離でかわされた。<tips=12>江梨子</tips>を確実に仕留めるなら五メートル――いや、三メートルに近づく必要があるな。その距離なら、念動力で邪魔されても無理矢理弾を当てることが出来る。いや、動きが鈍く、やっかいなサイキック能力がある<tips=11>璃映子</tips>を先に仕留めた方がいいんじゃないか？　そのあとで全力で<tips=12>江梨子</tips>と戦う。<tips=12>江梨子</tips>と先に戦うのは――ちょっと危険すぎるな。その場合、二人のうちどちらも殺せないでおれだけが死ぬ可能性がある。そうなると、仲間がやばい。やはり先に<tips=11>璃映子</tips>か――。","en":"The <tips=86>twins</tips> are a little over ten meters away. Twelve, maybe? She dodged me from ten meters before. To take <tips=12>Eriko</tips> down for certain, I'll have to get within five meters—no, three. At that range, I can force a bullet into her even if telekinesis interferes. No, shouldn't I take out <tips=11>Rieko</tips> first? She's slower, and she has that troublesome psychic ability. Then I can fight <tips=12>Eriko</tips> with everything I've got. Fighting <tips=12>Eriko</tips> first would be—too dangerous. In that case, I might die without killing either of them. Then my companions would be in trouble. It has to be <tips=11>Rieko</tips> first, then—","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r548","rowIndex":548,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　標的を<tips=11>璃映子</tips>に定めたものの、いずれにしたって見分けがつかないんじゃはじまらない。","en":"I've settled on <tips=11>Rieko</tips> as my target, but none of that matters if I can't tell them apart.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r549","rowIndex":549,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>はどういうわけか二人をすぐに見分けられるが、あれはどこを見ていたのか。ちゃんと聞いておけばよかったな。","en":"Somehow <tips=1>Leung</tips> can tell them apart at a glance. What does he look for? I should have made a point of asking him.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r550","rowIndex":550,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「こいつは馬鹿なやつだよ」","en":"“He’s a fool.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r551","rowIndex":551,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=86>双子</tips>は足元の<tips=65>ヘス</tips>に視線をやって言う。","en":"The <tips=86>twins</tips> look down at <tips=65>Hess</tips> at their feet, then speak.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r552","rowIndex":552,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「生まれ持った業が深いんだ。<tips=10>見土道夫</tips>とちょっと似ている」","en":"“He was born under the weight of terrible karma. In that respect, he is rather like you, <tips=10>Michio Mido</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r553","rowIndex":553,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「おれと？」","en":"“Like me?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r554","rowIndex":554,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうだよ」","en":"“That’s right.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r555","rowIndex":555,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=10>見土道夫</tips>は暴力に取り憑かれている。一時は離れようとしていたけれど、結局戻って来たね」","en":"“<tips=10>Michio Mido</tips> is possessed by violence. He tried to leave it behind for a while, but in the end, he came back.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r556","rowIndex":556,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「暴力に取り憑かれている、ねえ」","en":"“Possessed by violence, huh?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r557","rowIndex":557,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　否定するつもりはない。","en":"I have no intention of denying it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r558","rowIndex":558,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「争いをするときの顔は生き生きしているよ」","en":"“Your face comes alive when you fight.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r559","rowIndex":559,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「今もすごい幸せそうだよ。私たちを殺そうとしているんだろう？　殺意を感じるもの」","en":"“You look terribly happy even now. You mean to kill us, don’t you? We can feel your murderous intent.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r560","rowIndex":560,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=86>双子</tips>は薄く笑っている。けれどその緊張は隠せず、声が少し震え、こわばっている。","en":"The <tips=86>twins</tips> wear thin smiles, but they cannot conceal their tension: their voices are faintly trembling, their throats tight.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r561","rowIndex":561,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……最後にチャンスをやろう。おまえたち、<tips=21>八龍会</tips>に入っておれたちと共に戦わないか？　おまえたちはメチャクチャだが、約束をやぶったり裏切ったりしないことは知っている。<tips=12>江梨子</tips>はもともと入会資格があるし、<tips=11>璃映子</tips>はその家族だから準会員として迎え入れることが出来る」","en":"“...I'll give you one last chance. Will you join the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips> and fight beside us? You're both a complete mess, but I know you don't break promises or betray people. <tips=12>Eriko</tips> already qualifies for membership, and since <tips=11>Rieko</tips> is family, we can take her in as an associate member.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r562","rowIndex":562,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「冗談じゃない」","en":"“You must be joking.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r563","rowIndex":563,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「私たちはどんな組織にもはいらない」","en":"“We won’t join any organization.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r564","rowIndex":564,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　冷たく吐き捨てるその言葉は予想が付いていた。","en":"The words, spat out coldly, are exactly the answer I expected.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r565","rowIndex":565,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　昔からこいつらはどんなグループにも入ろうとしない。昔だって、おれたちとつるんではいたが仲間にはならなかった。そして、この場をやり過ごすために嘘をつくようなことも出来ない。","en":"They've never wanted to join any group. Even back then, they hung around with us but never became one of us. And they aren't capable of lying just to get through this situation.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r566","rowIndex":566,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それなら、逃がすことは出来ないようだな。……お前らとは何回か喧嘩したが、泣いても笑ってもこれが最後だ」","en":"“Then it seems I can’t allow you to leave. ...We’ve fought each other any number of times, but come what may, this will be the last.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r567","rowIndex":567,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　もう何も話すことはない。あとは戦いで決着をつけるだけだ。","en":"There is nothing more to discuss. We will settle it in battle.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r568","rowIndex":568,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=86>双子</tips>は黙っておれのほうを見ている。おれは一歩足を踏み出す――ふりをして、頭上を見上げた。","en":"The <tips=86>twins</tips> gaze at me without a word. I make as though to step forward—then snap my eyes upward.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r569","rowIndex":569,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=86>双子</tips>の緊張がいくらなんでも不審だった。何か不意打ちでも企んでいるのだろうと思っていたんだ。","en":"The <tips=86>twins</tips> had been far too tense, even for the circumstances. I suspected that they must be preparing an attack of their own.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r570","rowIndex":570,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして、不意打ちを狙うとしたら<tips=11>璃映子</tips>の念動力で死角から攻撃するはずだ。会話をしながらそれとなく周囲を観察していたのだけれど、ナイフを潜ませるのにしっくり来る場所がない。とすれば、音もなく空中に漂わせているのか？　そうだとしたら、影が落ちないよう電灯との位置関係に気をつけて浮かべているだろう。","en":"And if they were planning an ambush, <tips=11>Rieko</tips> would use her telekinesis to attack from my blind spot. I've been casually surveying the area as we talk, but there isn't anywhere that feels right for concealing a knife. Then is she suspending one soundlessly in midair? If so, she'll have positioned it with the lights in mind so it casts no shadow.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r571","rowIndex":571,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そうアタリをつけて真っ先に見たその場所に、ビンゴ、浮かんでいるじゃないか。","en":"Following that hunch, I look there first. Bingo—there it is, floating.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r572","rowIndex":572,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　が、浮かんでいるものが思ったよりも凶悪だった。","en":"But the floating object is considerably more vicious than I expected.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r573","rowIndex":573,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　例の投げナイフを使うと思っていたんだが、そうじゃない。空中に浮かんでおれを狙っているのは、それは、小さなオートマチックの拳銃だった。","en":"I thought she'd use one of those throwing knives, but no. The thing floating in midair, aimed at me, is a small automatic pistol.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r574","rowIndex":574,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「くっ」","en":"“Ghk!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r575","rowIndex":575,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　引き金が動くのが見えたので、おれは咄嗟に身体を横に飛ばす。","en":"I see the trigger move and fling myself sideways.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r576","rowIndex":576,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　この距離じゃおれの能力ではかわすのは難しい筈だが、照準自体がそこまで正確ではないのか、当たらなかった。パンと音が鳴って、足元で灰色の粉末が空中に舞う。","en":"At this distance, my ability should not be enough to evade the bullet, but perhaps her aim itself is imprecise, because it misses. A shot cracks, and gray powder leaps from the floor near my feet.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r577","rowIndex":577,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そうか、この手もあるんだな！　いつも<tips=11>璃映子</tips>は刃物や石ころを飛ばしていたから、なんとなくそうするものだと思い込んでいた。この銃は、<tips=65>ヘス</tips>が隠し持っていたのか？","en":"So that's another trick she can pull! <tips=11>Rieko</tips> always sent knives and stones flying, so I just assumed that was what she'd do. Did <tips=65>Hess</tips> have this gun hidden on him?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r578","rowIndex":578,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おれは棚の影に隠れたが、拳銃は空中をゆらりと飛んでおれを追いかけてくる。さらにおれは別の物陰に隠れる。","en":"I duck behind a shelf, but the pistol drifts lazily through the air after me. I take cover behind something else.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r579","rowIndex":579,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　威勢良く出て来たわりにいきなり逃げ回ることになったのがなんとも情けない。","en":"For all the vigor with which I marched out, being reduced immediately to running away is rather pathetic.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r580","rowIndex":580,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　が、隠し球がこれだけなら脅威とは言えない。照準をつけているのは<tips=11>璃映子</tips>の方だ。","en":"But if this is the only trick up their sleeve, it isn't much of a threat. <tips=11>Rieko</tips> is the one doing the aiming.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r581","rowIndex":581,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　あいつの身体能力じゃ、素早く動いたおれを捕捉するのは難しいだろう。","en":"With her physical ability, she'll have trouble tracking me when I move fast.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r582","rowIndex":582,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　さて、どうするか。銃を無視して<tips=86>双子</tips>の方に突っ込んでやるか？　いや、それは厳しいな。そうすると江梨子が出て来て、<tips=11>璃映子</tips>の方は仲間を撃つ可能性がある銃を捨てて別のやり方でおれを妨害するはずだ。そうなれば、さすがにおれも自信がない。さっきの感じだと、どうも今の<tips=12>江梨子</tips>はおれを身体能力で上回っているっぽいからな。だとすると、この拳銃プラス、右手の力を使ったとしてもちょっと心許ない。仲間のマシンガンと交換してもらえばよかったかな？","en":"Now, what do I do? Ignore the gun and charge the <tips=86>twins</tips>? No, that's too much. Eriko would come at me, while <tips=11>Rieko</tips> would ditch the gun rather than risk shooting her companion and interfere some other way. Even I'm not confident I could handle that. From what I saw earlier, the current <tips=12>Eriko</tips> seems to surpass me physically. In that case, even this pistol, plus the power in my right hand, doesn't feel like quite enough. Maybe I should've traded weapons with my companion and taken his machine gun.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r583","rowIndex":583,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　さて、どうするか。とりあえず、<tips=86>双子</tips>のどっちがどっちなのか確認したい。逃げれば<tips=12>江梨子</tips>が追ってきてくれないかと思ったが、相手も無理はしない。","en":"Now, what do I do? For starters, I want to figure out which of the <tips=86>twins</tips> is which. I thought <tips=12>Eriko</tips> might chase me if I fled, but they aren't taking any risks.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r584","rowIndex":584,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　銃は銃口をおれに向けながら空中をふわふわとただよっている。まわりこんで撃って来ようとしないのは、弾の消費を嫌ってのことか？　おれをここに釘付けにしようとしているのかもしれない。","en":"The gun drifts weightlessly in the air, its muzzle trained on me. Is she not trying to circle around and fire because she wants to conserve ammunition? Maybe she's trying to keep me pinned here.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r585","rowIndex":585,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　悪くない選択だが、このままじゃ決着がつかないぞ？　どうするつもりなのか。空中に浮かぶ銃の向こう側にいる<tips=86>双子</tips>の方を見ると、二人はおれの様子を見ながら<tips=65>ヘス</tips>の――今は<tips=62>マリア</tips>となったその死体を抱き起こしていた。頭の上半分吹っ飛んだ首がカクカクと揺れている。ちょっとここから銃で撃ってやろうと顔を出すと、空中の拳銃がゆらっと動いて、おれはすぐに顔を引っ込める。さすがにこの至近距離で撃たれたら避けきれない。","en":"Not a bad choice, but this will never settle matters. What do they intend to do? I look past the pistol floating in midair toward the <tips=86>twins</tips>. Keeping watch on me, they are lifting <tips=65>Hess’s</tips> body—or rather, the corpse that has now become <tips=62>Maria</tips>. With the upper half of the head gone, the neck lolls grotesquely. I show my face, thinking I might shoot them from here, but the floating pistol drifts toward me and I duck back at once. At such close range, I could never evade its bullet completely.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r586","rowIndex":586,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　二人は逃げるつもりなのかな？　空飛ぶ拳銃でおれをここから前に出られないようにして、その間に脱出しようとしているのか？","en":"Are the two of them planning to run? Are they using the flying pistol to keep me from advancing while they make their escape?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r587","rowIndex":587,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　とりあえず、おれを突破させてはいけない。後ろに残して来た二人じゃ、この<tips=86>双子</tips>を止めることは出来ないだろう。おれがここで決着をつけるんだ。","en":"First, I can't let them get past me. The two I left behind won't be able to stop the <tips=86>twins</tips>. I have to settle this here.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r588","rowIndex":588,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　さて、どうやって仕掛けるか。","en":"Now, how should I make my move?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r589","rowIndex":589,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　棚の裏に隠れたまま、ポケットからエチケットブラシを取り出し、その裏側の鏡に映して、<tips=86>双子</tips>の様子を見る。<tips=86>双子</tips>の片方が<tips=62>マリア</tips>を背負ったようだ。背負っているほうが<tips=12>江梨子</tips>か？　いやそうとは限らない。<tips=95>金眼</tips>になっていないところをみると、カモフラージュかもしれない。","en":"Remaining behind the shelf, I take a lint brush from my pocket and use the mirror on its back to observe the <tips=86>twins</tips>. One of the <tips=86>twins</tips> appears to have hoisted <tips=62>Maria</tips> onto her back. Is the carrier <tips=12>Eriko</tips>? No—not necessarily. Her eyes are not <tips=95>golden</tips>, but that itself may be a disguise.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r590","rowIndex":590,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　とりあえず、ちょっと、しかけてみるか？","en":"For now, maybe I'll try making a move.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r591","rowIndex":591,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ごちゃごちゃと考えているより、身体を動かすほうが得意だ。おれは物陰から身体を出す。","en":"I'm better at moving my body than tying myself in knots thinking. I step out from cover.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r592","rowIndex":592,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　さてサーカスの時間だ。","en":"Now for the circus.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r593","rowIndex":593,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　まずおれは自分の拳銃で、浮かんだ銃を狙い、引き金をひく。","en":"First, I aim my own pistol at the floating gun and pull the trigger.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r594","rowIndex":594,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ここで外れたらどうにもならない。","en":"If I miss here, I've got nothing.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r595","rowIndex":595,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　射撃は特別得意ではなく、揺れてる銃に当てるのはいささか自信がなかったが、うまく命中してくれた。","en":"Shooting isn't a particular strength of mine, and I wasn't especially confident I could hit a swaying gun, but fortunately, I hit it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r596","rowIndex":596,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　バチッと音がして、銃がはじけ飛ぶ。<tips=11>璃映子</tips>の念動力は力自体は大したことがない。強い力を与えれば、一時的に制御が出来なくなるんだ。","en":"A sharp crack rings out and the pistol goes flying. <tips=11>Rieko’s</tips> telekinesis cannot exert much force of its own; strike the object hard enough, and she temporarily loses control of it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r597","rowIndex":597,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　今回の場合、弾かれた銃はすぐ後の壁にぶつかってバウンドする。そして落下しかけたところでようやく念動力が働いて空中でふわっと浮かぶ。","en":"In this case, the pistol I knocked away strikes the wall behind it and rebounds. It nearly falls before telekinesis finally takes hold again, leaving it suspended softly in midair.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r598","rowIndex":598,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おれは発砲と同時に弾いた銃に向かってダッシュし、壁にぶつかった瞬間にジャンプした。そして真っ黒な右手を空中に浮かんだばかりの銃に伸ばす。","en":"The instant I fire, I dash toward the gun I've knocked away, then jump the moment it strikes the wall. I reach my pitch-black right hand toward the gun, which has only just floated back into the air.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r599","rowIndex":599,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　やっと<tips=11>璃映子</tips>の操作を取り戻した銃は一瞬逃れるような動きをしたが、しかしそれよりもおれの手の動きの方が早かった。","en":"The pistol, only just restored to <tips=11>Rieko’s</tips> control, makes one sudden movement to escape—but my hand is faster.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r600","rowIndex":600,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おれは右手でそれを掴むと同時に能力を発動させる。拳銃は音もなく切断され、ただのガラクタへと変わる。","en":"The instant I seize it with my right hand, I activate my power. The pistol is severed without a sound and becomes nothing more than junk.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r601","rowIndex":601,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　これで相手の武器を潰してほっと一息、というわけにはいかない。相手に次の手を考える時間を与えてはいけない。","en":"Destroying the enemy’s weapon does not afford me a moment to breathe. I cannot give them time to devise their next move.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r602","rowIndex":602,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おれは着地したときにはすでに次の行動を開始している。","en":"By the moment I land, I am already beginning my next action.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r603","rowIndex":603,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　破壊したばかりの拳銃を投げ捨てながら、悠長に<tips=62>マリア</tips>の死体を担いで出口へ移動している<tips=86>双子</tips>に向かって駆け出す。","en":"Casting aside the pistol I have just destroyed, I sprint toward the <tips=86>twins</tips>, who are taking their sweet time carrying <tips=62>Maria’s</tips> corpse toward the exit.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r604","rowIndex":604,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　まず狙うのはサイキックの<tips=11>璃映子</tips>。どちらかはわからないが、こうして襲い掛かればたまらず何らかの形で正体を現すだろう。その瞬間に仕留めてやる。","en":"My first target is the psychic <tips=11>Rieko</tips>. I do not know which one she is, but once I attack, she will be forced to reveal herself somehow. I will kill her in that instant.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r605","rowIndex":605,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　散らばったセメントのせいで足元がすべる。それでもおれは粉を巻き上げながら全力で走った。","en":"The scattered cement makes the floor slippery. Even so, I run with all my strength, throwing up clouds of powder.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r606","rowIndex":606,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　腿の筋肉が、ふくらはぎの筋肉が、ひきつりそうな悲鳴を上げる。おそらく人生で一番真剣に走ったろう。外から見たら銀面を走るスノーモービルみたいに見えたかもしれない。","en":"The muscles of my thighs and calves shriek on the verge of seizing. I have probably never run with such desperate purpose in my life. From outside, I might look like a snowmobile racing across a silver-white plain.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r607","rowIndex":607,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　十メートル……五メートル……おれはもう拳銃を使うつもりはなかった。当てたとしても急所じゃなければ一発で相手を止められない。そして相手に<tips=12>江梨子</tips>がいる以上、致命傷を与えるのは難しい。殺しきれなければ、次は二人がかりの反撃が待っている。その点、この右手ならばどこかに触れれば真っ二つだ。その時点で一人は戦闘不能に出来る。","en":"Ten meters... five... I no longer intend to use my pistol. Even if I hit her, a single round won't stop her unless I strike a vital point. And with <tips=12>Eriko</tips> among my opponents, landing a fatal wound will be difficult. If I fail to kill one of them, the two of them will counterattack next. But with this right hand, one touch anywhere will split her in two. That will put one of them out of the fight on the spot.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r608","rowIndex":608,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=62>マリア</tips>を背負っていた方が、それを降ろして上着の内側からナイフを取り出したのが見えた。その動きはのろい。","en":"The twin carrying <tips=62>Maria</tips> lowers the body and draws a knife from inside her jacket. Her movements are slow.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r609","rowIndex":609,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　やっぱり、カモフラージュか！","en":"So it was camouflage after all!","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r610","rowIndex":610,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　もう少し引きつければおれも迷ったかもしれない。だが、<tips=11>璃映子</tips>が動くのが早すぎた。このタイミングならおれはスムーズに<tips=11>璃映子</tips>の方へ攻撃出来る。おれは、走って来た勢いのまま右手を伸ばした。","en":"If she'd waited a little longer, even I might have hesitated. But <tips=11>Rieko</tips> moved too soon. Now I can redirect my attack toward <tips=11>Rieko</tips> without breaking stride. I thrust out my right hand with all the momentum of my charge.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r611","rowIndex":611,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ノーマルでは目にもとまらぬような速度で、きっと<tips=11>璃映子</tips>には反応することも出来ない――はずだった。","en":"At a speed too fast for a Normal's eyes to follow, surely <tips=11>Rieko</tips> would have no time to react—or so I thought.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r612","rowIndex":612,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女の瞳は直前で金色に輝き、それまでのスローモーションとうって変わって、まるでコマ落とししたように素早くその左手が動き、おれの真っ黒な右手首を掴んだ。","en":"At the last instant, her eyes shine gold. In a complete transformation from her previous slow motion, her left hand moves with the abrupt speed of missing frames and catches my black right wrist.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r613","rowIndex":613,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=12>江梨子</tips>が、<tips=11>璃映子</tips>のふりをしてやがったんだ！","en":"<tips=12>Eriko</tips> had been pretending to be <tips=11>Rieko</tips>!","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r614","rowIndex":614,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　驚いている場合じゃない。ナイフを持った<tips=12>江梨子</tips>の右手が素早く動く。それに対応しなければいけない。","en":"There is no time for surprise. The knife in <tips=12>Eriko’s</tips> right hand is already moving with terrifying speed. I have to answer it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r615","rowIndex":615,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　やはり、今の<tips=12>江梨子</tips>はおれよりも少し動きが速かった。そのナイフの軌道をおれの目がとらえることが出来ない。","en":"As I suspected, <tips=12>Eriko</tips> is now a little faster than I am. My eyes can't track the knife's path.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r616","rowIndex":616,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　とにかく胴体で刃物をまともに受け止めてしまっては致命的だ。おれは銃を握った左腕でなんとかそれを受け止めようと、ほとんど勘だけで振り回した。","en":"If I take the blade squarely in the torso, the wound will be fatal. Guided almost entirely by instinct, I swing my left arm, still gripping the pistol, in an effort to intercept it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r617","rowIndex":617,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　今回はおれがついていたらしい。","en":"It seems that luck favors me this time.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r618","rowIndex":618,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ナイフがおれの肘の下あたりに突き刺さり、その先端が肘に装着したプロテクターを貫通し、ガッと骨につき刺さる感覚があった。","en":"The knife plunges into my arm just below the elbow, and I feel its point punch through the protector strapped there and bite hard into bone.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r619","rowIndex":619,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　プロテクターをしていなければ、骨ごと腕一本持って行かれていただろう。普通ならこれだって飛び上がるほど痛いに違いないが、今はそれはまったくなく、相手の攻撃を防いだという快感がゾクゾクと背筋を駆け上るのしか感じない。","en":"Without the protector, it would probably have taken my whole arm off, bone and all. Ordinarily, even this would hurt enough to make me jump. Now I feel no pain at all—only the thrill of having blocked her attack shivering up my spine.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r620","rowIndex":620,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして、おれの身体にはまだ走って来た勢いが残っている。","en":"And my body still carries the momentum of my charge.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r621","rowIndex":621,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それを利用して膝を出すと、<tips=12>江梨子</tips>のみぞおちのあたりに命中し、体重の軽い彼女はそのまま後方に吹き飛び、セメント塗れになった。","en":"I pour that momentum into a rising knee, driving it into <tips=12>Eriko’s</tips> solar plexus. Her light body is hurled backward, straight into the cement powder.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r622","rowIndex":622,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おれは着地しながら地面に足を踏ん張り、もう一人の方を見る。","en":"As I land, I plant my feet and look toward the other twin.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r623","rowIndex":623,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=11>璃映子</tips>は<tips=17>タイプB</tips>同士の素早いやりとりに完全についていけていない。棒立ちのままこちらを見ている。","en":"<tips=11>Rieko</tips> has been completely unable to follow the rapid exchange between two <tips=17>Type Bs</tips>. She stands frozen, staring at me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r624","rowIndex":624,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おれは負傷した左手の銃を右手に持ち替え、彼女に向ける。","en":"I transfer the pistol from my wounded left hand to my right and aim at her.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r625","rowIndex":625,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そこで漸く相手の表情に変化があり、狙った銃に念動力が加わるのがわかる。しかしそれは大した力ではない。いつだったか<tips=11>璃映子</tips>は言っていた。念動力を使う時、透明な人間の姿を思い浮かべて、それが掴んだり持ち上げたりすることによって力が発動するのだという。その透明人間の腕力はだいたい<tips=11>璃映子</tips>と同じくらいだそうだ。","en":"Only then does her expression change. I feel telekinetic force seize the pistol I am aiming, but it is not very strong. <tips=11>Rieko</tips> once told me that when she uses her power, she imagines an invisible person who activates it by grasping or lifting the object. The invisible person’s strength, she said, is roughly equal to <tips=11>Rieko’s</tips> own.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r626","rowIndex":626,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=11>璃映子</tips>の力でも、銃を構えているところを横から思い切りぐいと押せば照準を外すには十分だろうが、しかしもう遅い。","en":"Even <tips=11>Rieko’s</tips> strength would be enough to wrench a leveled pistol sideways and throw off its aim. But she is too late.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r627","rowIndex":627,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　完全に力がかかりきる前に引き金を二度引くと、<tips=11>璃映子</tips>の胸に二つの穴が空き、血を吐きながらひっくり返った。","en":"Before her power can exert its full force, I pull the trigger twice. Two holes open in <tips=11>Rieko’s</tips> chest, and she pitches backward, vomiting blood.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r628","rowIndex":628,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　一人片付けた。のこるは<tips=12>江梨子</tips>だけだ。","en":"That's one down. Only <tips=12>Eriko</tips> remains.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r629","rowIndex":629,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　素早くそちらを振り返る。彼女は蒼白な顔で歯を食いしばり、立ち上がろうとはしているが、まだ尻餅をついたままだ。","en":"I whirl toward her. Her face is deathly pale, and she is gritting her teeth and trying to stand, but she is still sitting where she fell.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r630","rowIndex":630,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　この体勢と距離で避けられたらもう拍手ものだぜ。","en":"If you can dodge from that posture at this range, you deserve applause.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r631","rowIndex":631,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おれは彼女に向かって引き金を三回引く。","en":"I pull the trigger three times at her.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r632","rowIndex":632,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　轟音と共に銃口が火を吹き、一発目は右の乳房の下。二発目はみぞおちのすこし上。三発目は左側の鎖骨の下あたりに命中する。そして、彼女は糸が切れた操り人形のようにドサリと仰向けに倒れた。","en":"The muzzle spits fire with each thunderous report. The first round hits beneath her right breast, the second slightly above her solar plexus, and the third beneath her left collarbone. Then she topples onto her back with a thud, like a marionette whose strings have been cut.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r633","rowIndex":633,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして銃声の反響が完全に途絶えると、あたりに静寂が訪れた。","en":"When the echoes of the gunshots finally die away, silence descends upon the warehouse.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r634","rowIndex":634,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=11>璃映子</tips>も<tips=12>江梨子</tips>もぴくりとも動かない。目を剥いて仰向けに倒れている。","en":"Neither <tips=11>Rieko</tips> nor <tips=12>Eriko</tips> moves in the slightest. They lie upon their backs with eyes wide open.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r635","rowIndex":635,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「おい、やったぞ！　もう敵はいない！」","en":"“Hey, I did it! There are no enemies left!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r636","rowIndex":636,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おれは倉庫の向こうにいる仲間たちに向かってそう呼びかけると、作業を始めた。","en":"I call it toward my companions across the warehouse, then begin my work.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r637","rowIndex":637,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　このまま<tips=86>双子</tips>の無惨な死体をみんなの前に晒すのがなんとなく忍びない。","en":"For some reason, I cannot bear to leave the <tips=86>twins</tips>’ mutilated bodies on display for everyone to see.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r638","rowIndex":638,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　倒れている<tips=11>璃映子</tips>の死体を担ぎ上げた。死体から流れるまだ温かい血液がおれの身体を濡らし、歩くたび手足と頭が力なくぐらぐらと揺れる。","en":"I hoist <tips=11>Rieko’s</tips> body from the floor. The still-warm blood flowing from it drenches me, while her arms, legs, and head swing limply with every step I take.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r639","rowIndex":639,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それを倒れている<tips=12>江梨子</tips>の隣にならべて仰向けに寝かせた。そして、二人の開いたままのまぶたを閉じさせる。","en":"I lay her on her back beside the fallen <tips=12>Eriko</tips>, arranging the two bodies side by side. Then I close their open eyes.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r640","rowIndex":640,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「大丈夫ですか？　血だらけじゃないですか？」","en":"“Are you all right? You’re covered in blood.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"清水（シミズ）","displayName":"Shimizu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r641","rowIndex":641,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　清水がそう言うのに、","en":"Shimizu says it, and I reply.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r642","rowIndex":642,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「これはほとんど返り血だ。おれは腕を怪我しただけだ。それより、ブルーシートを持って来てくれないか」","en":"“Most of this is their blood. The only wound I took is to my arm. More importantly, could you bring me a tarp?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r643","rowIndex":643,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そう指示すると、清水はその辺りの資材にかかっていたブルーシートを剥がして手渡してくれる。","en":"At my instruction, Shimizu strips a blue tarp from some materials nearby and hands it to me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r644","rowIndex":644,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おれはそれを遺体の上にかけようとして、その手を止めた。<tips=62>マリア</tips>の死体が、ピクッと手足を動かしたような気がしたのだ。","en":"I am about to draw it over the bodies when my hand stops. For an instant, I could swear that <tips=62>Maria’s</tips> corpse twitched its arms and legs.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r645","rowIndex":645,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なんだいまの？」","en":"“What was that?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r646","rowIndex":646,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「えっ、どうしたんですか？」","en":"“What? Is something wrong?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"清水（シミズ）","displayName":"Shimizu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r647","rowIndex":647,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　清水ももう一人の仲間も変化に気がつかないようだった。","en":"Neither Shimizu nor my other companion appears to have noticed the change.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r648","rowIndex":648,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　だが確かにそれは動いていたのだ。","en":"But the body certainly moved.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r649","rowIndex":649,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おれは近づき、その身体に触れる。","en":"I approach and touch it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r650","rowIndex":650,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まだあたたかい……」","en":"“It’s still warm...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r651","rowIndex":651,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　死体にのこるほのかな体温ではなく、生きている人間のそれであった。","en":"Not the faint residual warmth of a corpse. This is the warmth of a living human body.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r652","rowIndex":652,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そのあどけない少女の手首を指で掴むと、動脈に拍動を感じる。次に死体のそばに跪いて胸に耳を当てると、心臓がまだ動いている。","en":"I close my fingers around the childlike girl’s wrist and feel the artery pulse beneath them. Then I kneel beside the body and put my ear to her chest. Her heart is still beating.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r653","rowIndex":653,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　信じられないが、まだ生きているんだ。","en":"Impossible though it seems, she is alive.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r654","rowIndex":654,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「うそだろ……」","en":"“You’ve got to be kidding...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r655","rowIndex":655,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おれは吹き飛ばされた頭を確認する。確かに、鼻から上がなくなっているのだが、良く見ると血みどろの傷口のところどころにピンク色の新しい皮膚が再生しつつあった。","en":"I inspect what remains of the head. Everything above the nose is indeed gone, yet a closer look reveals islands of fresh pink skin beginning to grow across the blood-soaked wound.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r656","rowIndex":656,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それを見て、おれはいつだったか<tips=57>滑走路通り</tips>に現れた虎のことを思い出した。殺しても、ピクピクと肉片が動き続けた虎。<tips=1>亮</tips>はそれを<tips=70>シオクリーン</tips>の地下の実験室へ持っていって社長と何か語っていたっけ。","en":"The sight reminds me of the tiger that once appeared on <tips=57>Runway Street</tips>—the tiger whose pieces of flesh went on twitching after we killed it. <tips=1>Leung</tips> carried the remains to the underground laboratory at <tips=70>Shio Clean</tips> and talked something over with the president there.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r657","rowIndex":657,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おれは念のため<tips=86>双子</tips>の方も確認したが、そちらはもう呼吸をしておらず完全な死体となっている。","en":"To be certain, I examine the <tips=86>twins</tips> as well. Neither is breathing. They are unmistakably dead.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r658","rowIndex":658,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"『よくやりましたね。お疲れ様です』","en":"‘Well done. Good work.’","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r659","rowIndex":659,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　受け取ったヘッドセットを装着すると、若干疲労の見える<tips=67>カミラ</tips>の声が聞こえた。","en":"When I put on the returned headset, <tips=67>Camilla’s</tips> voice sounds somewhat fatigued.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r660","rowIndex":660,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=67>カミラ</tips>、明日業者が来たら<tips=86>双子</tips>の遺体を引き取って貰え。<tips=65>ヘス</tips>の方はこちらで回収しよう」","en":"“<tips=67>Camilla</tips>, when the disposal contractors arrive tomorrow, have them take away the <tips=86>twins</tips>’ bodies. We’ll recover <tips=65>Hess</tips> ourselves.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r661","rowIndex":661,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"『えっ』","en":"‘What?’","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r662","rowIndex":662,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「こいつ、まだ生きているんだよ。心臓が動いている。死なないんだ」","en":"“This thing is still alive. Its heart is beating. It doesn’t die.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r663","rowIndex":663,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"『そんなばかな……』","en":"‘That’s impossible...’","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r664","rowIndex":664,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「でも事実なんだ。前にもそういう生き物を見たことがある。切り刻んでも肉片がピクピク動くんだよ」","en":"“But it's true. I've seen a creature like that before. Even after it's cut to pieces, the scraps of flesh keep twitching.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r665","rowIndex":665,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　あの虎と同じだ。<tips=1>亮</tips>と<tips=54>汐さん</tips>が研究していたっけ。何か繋がりがあるのかもしれない。","en":"It is exactly like that tiger. <tips=1>Leung</tips> and <tips=54>Mr. Shio</tips> were studying it, weren’t they? Perhaps there is some connection.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r666","rowIndex":666,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まあ、かえって好都合だ。薬のレシピも聞き出さないといけないしな。死ぬことがないのなら、口を割らせる方法はいくらでもある。……なに、いざとなれば酸にでもつけて骨まで溶かせばもう再生は出来ないはずさ。だから、すぐにこいつを隠す場所を見つけてくれないか？」","en":"“Well, that may be more convenient for us. We still have to extract the drug formula from this thing, and if it cannot die, there are any number of ways to make it talk. ...Oh, don’t worry. If the worst comes to the worst, we can soak it in acid until even the bones dissolve. It shouldn’t be able to regenerate after that. So will you find us somewhere to hide it immediately?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r667","rowIndex":667,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"『わ、わかりました』","en":"‘U-understood.’","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r668","rowIndex":668,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=67>カミラ</tips>と会話を終えてヘッドセットを外す。","en":"I end the conversation with <tips=67>Camilla</tips> and remove the headset.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r669","rowIndex":669,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　興奮が去るのと入れ替わりにおれの全身にずっしりと重い疲労がのしかかって、右腕の傷がじんじんと痛み出す。","en":"As the excitement recedes, crushing fatigue settles over my entire body, and the wound in my right arm begins throbbing.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r670","rowIndex":670,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おれは近くの棚にもたれて、","en":"I lean against a nearby shelf.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r671","rowIndex":671,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ふう」","en":"“Phew.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r672","rowIndex":672,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　と胸にたまった淀んだ空気を全部吐き出した。","en":"I expel every trace of stagnant air from my chest.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r673","rowIndex":673,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その後おれはかかりつけの病院で傷口を診て貰った。想像通りの深い傷で、入院したほうがいいと言われたが最低限の処置だけしてもらって家に帰った。","en":"Afterward, I have the wound examined at my usual hospital. It is as deep as I imagined, and they advise me to be admitted, but I have them perform only the minimum treatment and return home.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r674","rowIndex":674,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おれはいつも通り「ただいま」と言って、いつも通り<tips=44>詩由子</tips>の作った料理を食べたんたが、彼女はいつもほど話しかけてこずに気を遣ったような笑顔を浮かべていた。","en":"I say ‘I’m home’ as though everything were normal, and as though everything were normal, I eat the meal <tips=44>Shiyuko</tips> has made. But she speaks to me less than usual and wears a solicitous smile.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r675","rowIndex":675,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おれがいつも通りに振る舞っていたつもりでも、全然いつも通りではなかったのかもしれない。気を遣わせてしまったのだとすれば情けない。今度ちゃんと埋め合わせをしないといけないな。","en":"I thought I was behaving normally, but perhaps nothing about me was normal at all. If I made her tiptoe around me, that is pathetic. I will have to make it up to her properly.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r676","rowIndex":676,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　遊園地に一度も行ったことがないと言っていたから、連れて行ってあげよう。二人で電車に乗って。遠くの街ならば、おれたちはきっと年相応のなんでもないカップルに見えるはずだ。","en":"She said she has never visited an amusement park, so I will take her. The two of us will ride a train together. In a distant city, we should look like an ordinary couple our age.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r677","rowIndex":677,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　二人でソフトクリームを食べて、ジェットコースターや観覧車に乗って――。たまにはそういう一日を過ごした方が良いんだ。","en":"We will eat soft-serve ice cream together and ride a roller coaster and Ferris wheel... It will be good for us to spend a day like that once in a while.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r678","rowIndex":678,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ベッドに潜り込んだおれは、遊園地ではしゃぐ二人の姿を想像しながら眠りについた。","en":"I crawl into bed and fall asleep imagining the two of us enjoying ourselves at the amusement park.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r679","rowIndex":679,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そうして、おれの長い長い一日が終わった。","en":"And so my long, long day comes to an end.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r680","rowIndex":680,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それから二日後、予定を早めて爺さんたちの引退と、おれが正式に<tips=21>八龍会</tips>のリーダーとなることが発表され、その祝いの宴が開かれた。","en":"Two days after that, the schedule is moved up: the old men’s retirement and my formal assumption of the leadership of the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips> are announced, and a banquet is held to celebrate.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r681","rowIndex":681,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　場所は<tips=21>八龍会</tips>本部――つまり爺さんたちの住んでいた家だ。爺さんたちは急病で入院ということになっていたのでその場にはいない。かわりにでっちあげた彼らからのビデオメッセージが、リビングのTVで繰り返し繰り返し流されている。","en":"The venue is <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips> headquarters—the house where the old men lived. The cover story has the old men hospitalized after suddenly falling ill, so none of them is present. In their place, a fabricated video message from them plays over and over on the living-room TV.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r682","rowIndex":682,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　縁側のサッシを全部取り払って解放し、庭にも部屋にもテーブルが設置され、その上に料理が並べられている。これらの料理は会員の主婦やお姉ちゃんたちが和気藹々と楽しく作ってくれたものだ。","en":"All the glass doors along the veranda have been removed, leaving it open. Tables stand both inside and in the garden, covered with food. The organization’s housewives and young women prepared all of it together in cheerful harmony.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r683","rowIndex":683,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その豪勢さにおいては、たとえば<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>のパーティーなどとは比ぶべくもないが、いかにも<tips=21>八龍会</tips>らしい家庭的な雰囲気だ。子供たちが走り回っていて、その唇やら口のまわりやらはから揚げのオイルでギラギラに光ってるぜ。","en":"For sheer splendor it cannot begin to compare with one of <tips=7>YS’s</tips> parties, but its warm, domestic atmosphere could belong to no one but the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips>. Children tear about with their lips and the skin around their mouths glistening with oil from the fried chicken.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r684","rowIndex":684,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　一応おれは今日の主役ということで着慣れない正装で突っ立っているが、そんなものそっちのけで料理やら雑談やらに興じている連中ばっかりだ。今日の会は会員ならだれでも自由参加だったから、飯だけ食いに来たようなやつも多い。","en":"As the guest of honor, I stand around in formal clothes I am unaccustomed to wearing. But almost everyone ignores me in favor of the food and conversation. Any member was free to attend today’s gathering, so many seem to have come simply to eat.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r685","rowIndex":685,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=67>カミラ</tips>は招待制にしようと言ったが、おれはこれだけは譲れなかったんだ。","en":"<tips=67>Camilla</tips> wanted to make it invitation-only, but on this one point, I refused to yield.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r686","rowIndex":686,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　こうやってガキが走り回ったり、おばちゃんがぎゃははって笑ってるのがおれの好きな<tips=21>八龍会</tips>だったからね。","en":"Kids racing around and middle-aged women guffawing—that was the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips> I loved.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r687","rowIndex":687,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そうした喧噪のなか、どこかのギャングのボスやらどこぞの組織の大物やらが、アイスクリームを持って走り回るガキから高級なお召し物を困り顔で守りながら、おれのところに来て挨拶をする。この感じがなんとも楽しくて素晴らしい。","en":"Amid the clamor, gang bosses and important figures from various organizations come to greet me, struggling to protect their expensive clothes from children running around with ice cream. The whole atmosphere is wonderfully entertaining.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r688","rowIndex":688,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　楽しく過ごす子供やおばちゃん。居心地悪そうなお偉いさん。仏頂面で警備をしている<tips=47>解放軍</tips>。<tips=67>カミラ</tips>は向こうに立って食事も会話もしていない。<tips=66>コンタ</tips>はすっかり酔っ払って女の子にからんでいる。おれも少し飲み過ぎたようだ。","en":"Children and women enjoying themselves. Important guests looking uncomfortable. <tips=47>Liberation Army</tips> soldiers standing guard with sullen faces. <tips=67>Camilla</tips> stands on the other side of the room, neither eating nor speaking. <tips=66>Konta</tips> is completely drunk and pestering girls. I seem to have drunk a little too much myself.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r689","rowIndex":689,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　リビングにある、いつも<tips=91>ミスター・スミス</tips>が座っていた籐椅子に腰掛けて休んでいると、<tips=47>解放軍</tips>の部下が真面目くさった顔でやって来た。","en":"I am resting in the wicker chair in the living room where <tips=91>Mr. Smith</tips> always used to sit when a <tips=47>Liberation Army</tips> subordinate approaches with a solemn expression.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r690","rowIndex":690,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「隊長。報告が」","en":"“Commander. I have a report.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r691","rowIndex":691,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なんだい？」","en":"“What is it?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r692","rowIndex":692,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「死体が消えていたんだそうです」","en":"“Apparently, a body disappeared.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r693","rowIndex":693,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「死体って……」","en":"“A body...?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r694","rowIndex":694,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「倉庫の<tips=86>双子</tips>です」","en":"“It's the <tips=86>twins</tips> from the warehouse.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r695","rowIndex":695,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼が言うには、昨夜頼んでいた業者が遺体を処理しにやって来たところ、<tips=86>双子</tips>のうち片方の死体が消えていて、一体しかなかったのだそうだ。","en":"He explains that when the contractors we had engaged arrived last night to dispose of the bodies, one of the <tips=86>twins</tips>’ corpses had vanished. There was only a single body left.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r696","rowIndex":696,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……盗まれたのか？」","en":"“...Was it stolen?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r697","rowIndex":697,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どうでしょう。わかりません。とにかく、消えていたのは事実なんです」","en":"“I don’t know. Whatever the cause, it did disappear.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r698","rowIndex":698,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「鍵はしていたはずだよな」","en":"“The building was locked, wasn’t it?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r699","rowIndex":699,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「はい。ですが、どこもこじ開けた様子もなくて……」","en":"“Yes. But there were no signs that anything had been forced open...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r700","rowIndex":700,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「消えたのは死体のうちどっちだ？　つまり、北側においてあったものか。南側のものか……」","en":"“Which corpse disappeared? I mean, was it the one on the north side, or the one on the south...?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r701","rowIndex":701,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いや、わかりません。報告では、一つになっていたとだけ」","en":"“We don’t know. The report said only that one remained.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r702","rowIndex":702,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうか。じゃあ、あとでおれが直接業者にあって話を聞く。……ちなみに、残った一つはちゃんと処分出来たか？」","en":"“I see. Then I’ll speak to the company myself later. ...And the remaining body was disposed of properly?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r703","rowIndex":703,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「はい。今頃は、どこかの飼育場で豚の餌になっているはずです」","en":"“Yes. By now, it should be pig feed at some livestock farm.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r704","rowIndex":704,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「わかった。もういいぞ」","en":"“Understood. You can go.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r705","rowIndex":705,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そう言って去らせてから、最後の質問は聞かなきゃ良かったと後悔した。","en":"After I dismiss him, I regret asking that last question.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r706","rowIndex":706,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　我々が雇った業者の処理方法は、確か全裸にして長い毛は剃って、骨も何もかも細かくミンチにして豚の飼料に混ぜて食わせるというものだった。<tips=86>双子</tips>のどちらかは知らないが、そうなったんだろう。","en":"As I recall, the contractors we hired strip the corpse naked, shave off any long hair, grind everything—bones and all—into fine mince, mix it into pig feed, and let the animals eat it. I do not know which of the <tips=86>twins</tips> it was, but that must have been her fate.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r707","rowIndex":707,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そしておれは今日、おばちゃんが作ったハンバーグを沢山食べていた。","en":"And today, I ate a great many hamburg steaks prepared by the women here.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r708","rowIndex":708,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しかし死体はどこへいったのだろう？　<tips=11>璃映子</tips>のものか、<tips=12>江梨子</tips>のものか。それは調べればわかるだろうが、なぜ盗む必要があったのか。まさか蘇ったとか？　<tips=65>ヘス</tips>のように？　しかし、確かに息をしていないのを確認したはずだ。","en":"But where did the corpse go? Was it <tips=11>Rieko’s</tips>, or <tips=12>Eriko’s</tips>? An investigation should tell us that much—but why would anyone steal it? Could she actually have returned to life, like <tips=65>Hess</tips>? No. I am certain I confirmed that neither of them was breathing.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r709","rowIndex":709,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　死体が歩き出したとしたら、そんなのゾンビ映画になっちまうじゃないか。","en":"If the corpse stood up and walked away, this would be a zombie movie.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r710","rowIndex":710,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　まったく不可解な話だ。","en":"It is utterly inexplicable.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r711","rowIndex":711,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　溜息をつくと、自分の呼吸がアルコール臭い。","en":"When I sigh, my breath reeks of alcohol.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r712","rowIndex":712,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　不可解と言えば、<tips=65>ヘス</tips>のほうもそうだ。","en":"For that matter, <tips=65>Hess</tips> is equally inexplicable.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r713","rowIndex":713,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　あいつは<tips=21>八龍会</tips>の持っている建物の一室で管理しているんだが、放っておくと傷が塞がってもりもりと失った頭を再生しようとしやがる。そのたびにハンマーで叩き潰している。完全に復活されてサイキック能力を使われたらたまらないからね。","en":"We have him confined in a room in one of the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society’s</tips> buildings. Leave him alone, however, and the wound closes as he vigorously begins growing back the missing head. Every time that happens, we crush it with a hammer. We cannot risk allowing him to revive completely and use his psychic power.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r714","rowIndex":714,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=47>解放軍</tips>のなかでもとびっきりのサディストをこの作業の担当にしてやったんだが、頭がおかしくなりそうだと愚痴っていた。","en":"I assigned the most extreme sadist in the <tips=47>Liberation Army</tips> to the job, but even he complained that it was driving him insane.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r715","rowIndex":715,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　あの再生力は、あの虎と――そして、<tips=55>松坊</tips>もやたらと傷の治りが早かった。あいつも、もしかしたら不死身だったのかもしれないな。だから、<tips=54>汐さん</tips>と<tips=1>亮</tips>であの虎を調べていたんだ。<tips=55>松坊</tips>のために。","en":"That regenerative power is the same as the tiger’s—and <tips=55>Matsu’s</tips> wounds healed preposterously quickly as well. Perhaps she too was immortal. That must be why <tips=54>Mr. Shio</tips> and <tips=1>Leung</tips> were studying the tiger: for <tips=55>Matsu’s</tips> sake.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r716","rowIndex":716,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　とすると、あの気色悪い<tips=65>ヘス</tips>には、何か意味があるような気がするぜ。これから、おれが<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>と――いや、<tips=1>亮</tips>との戦いにおいて。","en":"If so, I have a feeling that repulsive thing, <tips=65>Hess</tips>, may yet have some purpose. In the struggle to come between me and <tips=7>YS</tips>—no, between me and <tips=1>Leung</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r717","rowIndex":717,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ああ、それにしても気持ちが悪い！　どうも飲み過ぎて、目の前がグルグルとする！","en":"Ah, but I feel sick! I've clearly had too much to drink—the whole world is spinning!","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r718","rowIndex":718,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どこへ行くんですか？」","en":"“Where are you going?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"カミラ","displayName":"Camilla","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r719","rowIndex":719,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　立ち上がると、<tips=67>カミラ</tips>がそう声をかけた。","en":"<tips=67>Camilla</tips> calls to me when I stand.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r720","rowIndex":720,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「酔い覚ましだよ。風に当たってくる」","en":"“To sober up. I’m going to get some air.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r721","rowIndex":721,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「酔っ払ったままふらふらと遠くへ行かないでくださいね」","en":"“Please don’t wander far while you’re drunk.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"カミラ","displayName":"Camilla","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r722","rowIndex":722,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「二階のバルコニーに行くだけだよ」","en":"“I’m only going to the balcony upstairs.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r723","rowIndex":723,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おれはそう言い残すと、階段の方へ向かった。","en":"With that, I leave her and make my way toward the stairs.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r724","rowIndex":724,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　板張りのバルコニーは、よく晴れた日には麻雀卓と椅子を持ち出して爺さんたちが太陽の光を浴びながらゲームに興じていたが、今は何もない。","en":"On clear days, the old men used to bring a mahjong table and chairs onto the wooden balcony and enjoy a game in the sunlight. Now it is empty.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r725","rowIndex":725,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おれは手すりにもたれかかった。眼下には庭があり、パーティに興じる声が聞こえて来る。子供たちは頭上のおれを見つけると笑顔で指さすので、手を上げてこたえてやった。","en":"I lean against the railing. The garden lies below, and I hear the voices of people enjoying the party. When the children spot me overhead and point with smiles, I raise a hand in reply.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r726","rowIndex":726,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　今日はこの街には珍しい、いい天気だ。","en":"Today has brought fine weather, a rarity in this city.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r727","rowIndex":727,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　柔らかいそよ風が、雑多な人々の生活で生まれる雑多なかおりを運んでくれる。この街特有の、他のどこにもないにおいだ。よそから来たやつは、くさいくさいとよく貶す。でもおれはいいにおいだと思う。","en":"A gentle breeze carries the jumble of scents produced by the jumbled lives of its people. A smell found nowhere else, unique to this city. Outsiders often disparage it as a stink. I think it smells wonderful.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r728","rowIndex":728,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　目を閉じてのんびり風を浴びていると、「<tips=10>見土</tips>さんは？」と訊ねる女の子の声が階段の下から聞こえた。「上にいるわ」と答えるのは<tips=67>カミラ</tips>の声だ。","en":"I close my eyes and relax in the breeze. From below the stairs, I hear a girl's voice ask, ‘Where is Mr. <tips=10>Mido</tips>?’ <tips=67>Camilla</tips> answers, ‘He's upstairs.’","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r729","rowIndex":729,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そしてあがってきたのは、両手で抱えるような大きな花束を持ち、ドレスで正装した黒髪の女の子だった。","en":"The person who climbs the stairs is a black-haired girl wearing a formal gown and carrying an enormous bouquet in both arms.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r730","rowIndex":730,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あ、あの、いいですか？」","en":"“U-um, may I?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"内田広美（患者のＵ）","displayName":"Hiromi Uchida (Patient U)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r731","rowIndex":731,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　緊張して口にしたのはイントネーションのきれいな日本語だった。その目は金色に輝いているが、『<tips=46>ネオ・ローズ</tips>』を投与されているらしく症状は落ち着いているように見える。","en":"The nervous words come out in beautifully accented Japanese. Her eyes shine gold, but she has evidently been given <tips=46>Neo Rose</tips>, and her symptoms appear stable.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r732","rowIndex":732,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なんだい？」","en":"“What is it?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r733","rowIndex":733,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おれは微笑んでそう答える。","en":"I answer with a smile.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r734","rowIndex":734,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「わ、私、病院にいたんです。それでこれ、病院のみんなから……」","en":"“I-I was in the hospital. And this is from everyone there...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"内田広美（患者のＵ）","displayName":"Hiromi Uchida (Patient U)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r735","rowIndex":735,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　少女は緊張でこわばった顔でおずおずと花束を差し出す。","en":"Her face stiff with tension, the girl timidly holds out the bouquet.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r736","rowIndex":736,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「これを、おれに？」","en":"“This is for me?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r737","rowIndex":737,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おれはおどけて花束を指さし、そして自分の顔を指さした。","en":"I point playfully at the bouquet, then at my own face.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r738","rowIndex":738,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　少女はうんと頷く。","en":"The girl nods emphatically.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r739","rowIndex":739,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あ、あそこから、解放して頂いてありがとうございます」","en":"“F-for freeing us from that place... thank you very much.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"内田広美（患者のＵ）","displayName":"Hiromi Uchida (Patient U)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r740","rowIndex":740,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ああ、ありがとう。病院の人がそう言ってくれると嬉しいよ。あの時はおれもいろいろと思って……」","en":"“Oh, thank you. I’m happy to hear that from someone who was at the hospital. I had all sorts of thoughts about what we did then...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r741","rowIndex":741,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おれはその花束に両手を伸ばし、それを受け取る。","en":"I reach out with both hands and accept the bouquet.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r742","rowIndex":742,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　すると、カチャ、カチャと花束のなかで乾いた音がした。","en":"Then—click, click—a pair of dry sounds comes from inside the bouquet.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r743","rowIndex":743,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　なんの音だろう？　とにかくこれをちゃんと受け取って……そこで下半身に急に力が入らなくなり、おれは床の上に尻餅をついた。だけでなく、その拍子にうしろの壁に頭をぶつけ、目の前に星が散る。","en":"What was that? Never mind—first I need to take the bouquet properly... At that instant, all strength vanishes from my lower body and I drop heavily onto the floor. The fall sends my head into the wall behind me, and stars explode across my vision.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r744","rowIndex":744,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「つっ……」","en":"“Tch...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r745","rowIndex":745,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　飲み過ぎたかな。","en":"Did I drink too much?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r746","rowIndex":746,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　いや、痛いのは頭だけじゃない。腹のほうにも熱いものを押しつけられたような感覚があった。","en":"No. My head is not the only thing that hurts. It feels as though something hot has been pressed against my abdomen.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r747","rowIndex":747,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ああ、おれはこの感覚を知っている。熱い部分に手で触れると、せっかくの正装がびしょびしょに生ぬるい液体で濡れているのがわかった。","en":"Ah. I know this feeling. When I touch the burning place, I find my hard-won formal clothes drenched in tepid liquid.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r748","rowIndex":748,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　撃たれたんだ。","en":"I’ve been shot.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r749","rowIndex":749,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　花束から、うっすらと煙が立ち上り、硝煙の焦げ臭いにおいが鼻をつく。可憐な花びらの隙間に、微かに黒いものが見える。そうか。この大きな花束に銃を隠して来たんだ。おれを殺すために。","en":"Faint smoke rises from the bouquet, and the scorched odor of gunsmoke assails my nose. Through a gap between the delicate petals, I glimpse something black. I see. She hid a gun in this enormous bouquet. She came to kill me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r750","rowIndex":750,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　目の前の少女はあいかわらず緊張した顔でおれを見下ろしている。","en":"The girl before me continues looking down with the same nervous expression.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r751","rowIndex":751,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「きみ……」","en":"“You...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r752","rowIndex":752,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　言おうとした口から血液が溢れ出た。","en":"Blood pours from my mouth when I try to speak.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r753","rowIndex":753,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　下半身だけでなく、全身から急速に力が抜けてゆく。そして、視界がぐるんと横に回転をした。","en":"The strength drains rapidly now not only from my lower body, but from all of me. My whole field of vision wheels onto its side.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r754","rowIndex":754,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　腰が抜けて壁にもたれていた上半身が、横に倒れたのだろう。","en":"My legs had given out, leaving my upper body propped against the wall. I must have toppled sideways.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r755","rowIndex":755,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　もうあがく気はしない。腹に触れたとき、いや、下半身から力が抜けたときにもうはっきりとわかった。","en":"I no longer feel any desire to struggle. When I touched my abdomen—no, from the moment the strength left my lower body—I understood with perfect clarity.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r756","rowIndex":756,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　これは「助からないやつ」だ。","en":"This is one of the wounds you do not survive.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r757","rowIndex":757,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そう思うと、なんだかすっきりした気持ちになった。こんなところで倒れたら申し訳ないような気もするが、<tips=67>カミラ</tips>や<tips=66>コンタ</tips>ならうまくやってくれるだろう。色んな人が沢山死んで、ついにおれの番がやって来た。そういうものなんだ。これはもう誰にも逆らえないって、おれは子供の時からよく知っている。","en":"Once I accept that, an oddly clean feeling comes over me. Part of me is sorry to collapse in a place like this, but <tips=67>Camilla</tips> and <tips=66>Konta</tips> will manage well enough. So many people have died, and now, at last, my turn has come. That is the way of things. I have known since childhood that this is something no one can resist.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r758","rowIndex":758,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おれは震える手を伸ばして、目の前の花束を顔に寄せた。","en":"I extend a trembling hand and draw the bouquet before me closer to my face.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r759","rowIndex":759,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　視界いっぱいの花の数々。","en":"Flowers fill my entire field of vision.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r760","rowIndex":760,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　これはなんだろうな。赤いのはゼラニウムで――この紫色のはフリージアか。こっちの白いのはなんだろう？","en":"What are these? The red ones are geraniums—and these purple ones, freesias? What are the white ones?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r761","rowIndex":761,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>がやたらと植物や昆虫に詳しくて、昔によく教えて貰ったんだけど、ちっとも名前が思い出せないな……。","en":"<tips=1>Leung</tips> knew a ridiculous amount about plants and insects. He taught me their names often enough when we were young, but now I cannot remember this one at all...","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r762","rowIndex":762,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　でも、ものすごく良い匂いだ。","en":"They smell magnificent.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r763","rowIndex":763,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　こんな夢のような景色の中、こんな素敵な匂いを嗅ぎながら死ねるだなんて。","en":"To think I can die amid such a dreamlike scene, breathing in such a wonderful fragrance...","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r764","rowIndex":764,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　——こんな幸せなことがあるだろうか？","en":"—Could there be a happier way to die?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r765","rowIndex":765,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　あんなにひどいことを沢山してきたのに。","en":"After all the terrible things I've done...","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r766","rowIndex":766,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　上出来だ。最後は夜道で殺されて、死体をドブ川にでも放り込まれるんじゃないかと思っていたんだ。","en":"This is a better end than I deserve. I always imagined I would be murdered on some dark road and have my corpse thrown into a drainage canal.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r767","rowIndex":767,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　——嗚呼、それにしても良い匂いだ。","en":"Ah, what a wonderful fragrance.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r768","rowIndex":768,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　むせかえるような甘い香りを楽しんでいると、急速に視界が暗くなってくる。","en":"As I savor the overwhelming sweetness, my vision rapidly darkens.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r769","rowIndex":769,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　もう終わりなんだろう。悪くない人生だった。","en":"This must be the end. It was not a bad life.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r770","rowIndex":770,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「母さん……」","en":"“Mother...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r771","rowIndex":771,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　最期におれはそう呟いた。","en":"That is the final word I murmur.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r772","rowIndex":772,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　あの人にも、一度くらい埋め尽くすほどの花を贈ってやればよかった。","en":"I wish that, just once, I had given her more flowers than she knew what to do with.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:B6:r773","rowIndex":773,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　きっと、喜んでくれただろうに。","en":"I am sure she would have been happy.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}}]},{"position":53,"code":"D5","unitId":"D5","rows":[{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r1","rowIndex":1,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>に入れて貰ってしばらく経ったけれども、なんの仕事も与えて貰えないので、はっきり言って腐っている。腐敗している。","en":"It has been a while since <tips=7>YS</tips> took me in, but they still haven’t given me any work, so frankly, I’m rotting away. Decomposing.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r2","rowIndex":2,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　平穏かつ太平で組織自体に何もやることがないというのならわかる。しかし、実際にはそうではない。例の八龍解放なんちゃらとかいう組織が台頭し街で傍若無人に振る舞い、組織の権益を食い荒らしている。組織はその対応に追われている。","en":"I could understand it if peace and tranquility had left the organization itself with nothing to do. But that is not remotely the case. That Eight Dragons Liberation-whatever-it-is has risen to prominence, running roughshod over the city and gobbling up the organization’s interests. The entire organization is scrambling to deal with it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r3","rowIndex":3,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　先だっても<tips=57>滑走路通り</tips>でいざこざがあったばかりだし、<tips=59>暗闇通り</tips>でもよく従業員の待遇を改善せよだとかなんだとか言って衝突しているようだし、表面上はっきりと争いが起きているわけではないけれど、はっきり言ってもう敵対しているのと同じだよね。","en":"There was a clash on <tips=57>Runway Street</tips> only recently. Apparently they also keep causing trouble on <tips=59>Darkness Street</tips>, demanding improved treatment for employees and I don’t know what else. No conflict has broken out openly upon the surface, but let’s be honest: we’re enemies already.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r4","rowIndex":4,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　実際<tips=1>亮</tips>さん――いや、<tips=81>龍頭</tips>をはじめとした幹部の皆さんは敵対組織として認識し、組織はそのように動いているんだ。上から下まで、多数の構成員が組織のために緊張感ある仕事をしているんだ。","en":"In fact, Mr. <tips=1>Leung</tips>... no, the <tips=81>Longtou</tips> and the other executives recognize them as a hostile organization, and YS is acting accordingly. From top to bottom, countless members are performing tense, important work for the organization.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r5","rowIndex":5,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　こういう状態のなか、私にはなんの指示もない。","en":"And amid all of this, no one gives me a single instruction.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r6","rowIndex":6,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「何かやることありますか？」","en":"“Is there anything I can do?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r7","rowIndex":7,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私はまるで模範的な新入社員のように自ら仕事を貰いにいったりしているのだが、","en":"Like a model new hire, I have even taken to asking for work on my own initiative.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r8","rowIndex":8,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ああそう。じゃあ、レオナルドの家族の部屋の窓が汚れてるからちょっと掃除してもらえないか」","en":"“Oh, all right. The windows in the apartment where Leonardo’s family lives are dirty. Could you clean them?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r9","rowIndex":9,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　なんて、<tips=81>龍頭</tips>はしれっと言うのである。","en":"That is the sort of thing the <tips=81>Longtou</tips> says with a perfectly straight face.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r10","rowIndex":10,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そりゃ、掃除でもなんでもしますって言ったよ？　でもだからって本当に掃除させられると思ってたわけじゃないでしょう。あれはそれくらいやる気がありますっていう自己アピールであって、心底掃除がしたいならそれだけがしたいならはじめから清掃会社に就職しているに決まっている。","en":"Yes, I said I would clean or do anything else they needed. But that didn’t mean I expected them to actually make me clean. That was self-promotion meant to demonstrate the depth of my motivation. If I truly wanted to clean—if that were all I wanted to do—naturally, I would have joined a cleaning company in the first place.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r11","rowIndex":11,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　いや、さすがに清掃会社よりは収入はマシではあるか。<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>は月給制で、毎月手渡しか振り込みか選択出来るようになっていて、私は振り込みで貰っている。家族の誰も知らない秘密の口座に振り込まれる給料は、基本給にサイキックとしての特殊手当なども加算されており、並の清掃会社に就職したら到底貰えないような額が支給されている。しかも、清掃会社よりもいい加減な仕事ぶり、かつ、疲れたら途中で放り出しても文句を言われないというきわめて安易な労働である。","en":"No, the pay is better than a cleaning company would offer. <tips=7>YS</tips> pays a monthly salary, and employees can choose cash in hand or a bank transfer. I chose the transfer. My salary enters a secret account unknown even to my family, and it includes a basic wage plus a special psychic allowance and other additions, bringing it to a sum no ordinary cleaning company could possibly pay me. Moreover, I can do shoddier work than a real cleaning company would tolerate, and if I grow tired and abandon the job halfway through, no one complains. It is labor of breathtaking ease.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r12","rowIndex":12,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　だからまあ、普通の清掃会社よりはずっと好待遇なのは確かだけれど、そんなことで誤魔化される私ではない。もっとやりがいが欲しいのだ。","en":"So yes, the conditions are unquestionably far better than at an ordinary cleaning company. But I will not be bought off by such things. I want a sense of purpose.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r13","rowIndex":13,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=81>龍頭</tips>は賢い人だから私のそんな願望をわかっているくせに、一向に指示が出ない。","en":"The <tips=81>Longtou</tips> is an intelligent man. He knows perfectly well what I want, yet still refuses to give me instructions.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r14","rowIndex":14,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　なんていけずな人なのだろう。そもそも、<tips=81>龍頭</tips>は清掃は業者にやらせると言っていたのに。私を騙したのか。","en":"What a cruel tease. Besides, the <tips=81>Longtou</tips> said they had contractors do the cleaning. Did he trick me?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r15","rowIndex":15,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　と内心では<tips=81>龍頭</tips>のすまし顔に悪態をついていながらも、","en":"I curse the <tips=81>Longtou’s</tips> composed face inside my head, and yet—","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r16","rowIndex":16,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「はい、わかりました」","en":"“Yes. Understood.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r17","rowIndex":17,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　とか言っちゃって素直に雑巾を使って窓をふきふきしているのだ。ああ、腐る、腐る、心が腐る。","en":"And after all that talk, here I am meekly wiping and wiping the windows with a rag. Ah, I’m rotting, rotting—my heart is rotting.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r18","rowIndex":18,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そりゃ私は小娘かもしれない。しかし、それをおぎなってあまりある特殊能力と、生まれ持った度胸、および銃でもってお互い殺し合うゲームで身につけた実戦感覚と、<tips=41>グランドタワー</tips>のみなを恐怖のどん底に叩き落としたサイキックと一対一で渡り合ったという実績があるのだ。","en":"Yes, I may be a mere slip of a girl. But I possess a supernatural power more than sufficient to compensate, natural-born courage, combat instincts honed in games where players shoot one another to death, and the proven achievement of having fought one-on-one against the psychic who plunged everyone in <tips=41>Grand Tower</tips> into the very depths of terror.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r19","rowIndex":19,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　こういう時などは、敵対組織の<tips=21>八龍会</tips>の誰々のアジトなどを上空から見張ってくれないか、とか、どこそこの警戒が厳しいから空中から支援してくれないか、など、いろいろと私にしか出来ない任務もありそうなものだ。なのにこうして拭き掃除とは、しかも「別にやりたくなければ、自由にしてていいよ」などと、その掃除さえさほど求められていない様子。","en":"At times like this, you would think there would be all sorts of missions only I could perform—keeping watch from the air over the hideout of some member or other of the hostile <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips>, or providing airborne support somewhere with especially tight security. And yet here I am, wiping things down. Worse, when they say, ‘If you don’t feel like it, you’re free to do whatever you want,’ they hardly seem to want even that cleaning from me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r20","rowIndex":20,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しかも、本来だったら掃除をしろと命令されたらふてくされてサボってしまう私なのだが、しかし、こうやってもやらなくてもどっちでもいいと言われると逆にやってやろうじゃないかとむきになる自分のアマノジャクな性格がいやだ。たとえば私は子供の頃からトマトジュースが大嫌いなのだけれど、「飲んでも飲まなくてもいいよ」と言われながら目の前になみなみと赤い液体のつがれたグラスを置かれたら、きっと一息で飲み干してしまうだろう。","en":"Ordinarily, if someone ordered me to clean, I would sulk and shirk the work. But when they tell me it makes no difference whether I do it, my contrary nature makes me determined to show them I will. I hate that about myself. I have despised tomato juice since childhood, for example. Yet if someone filled a glass to the brim with red liquid, set it before me, and said, ‘Drink it or don’t; either is fine,’ I would probably drain it in one breath.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r21","rowIndex":21,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　というわけで、空をふわふわと飛びながら窓にへばりつき、確かにトリのふんなどで汚れているそのガラスを、洗剤を吹きかけながら端から端までピカピカにしているのである。深夜番組のＣＭで見たアメリカ製のとっても良く落ちる洗剤や、特殊な形状のブラシなどを見かけるたび、<tips=30>レイレイ</tips>に頼んで購入し次々と実戦投入している。さらに、ネット動画で窓をピカピカにする裏テクなんかを見つけるたび試し、一番効率的な方法を見つけ出したりもしてしまった。","en":"And that is how I come to be floating through the air, clinging to windows indisputably dirtied by bird droppings, spraying cleaner and polishing every inch of glass until it sparkles. Whenever I spot some astonishingly effective American cleaner from a late-night infomercial, or a brush with a special shape, I ask <tips=30>Leilei</tips> to buy it and promptly deploy it in the field. Whenever I find an online video promising a secret trick for brilliantly clean windows, I try that too, and have even discovered the most efficient method.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r22","rowIndex":22,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そうして毎日贅沢な掃除をして、ああ、なんてことでしょう。いつのまにか、ハマってしまっているじゃないか！","en":"And so, day after day, I clean in ever more extravagant fashion until—oh, what a turn of events! Somewhere along the way, I have become completely hooked!","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r23","rowIndex":23,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　不覚である。迂闊にも私は清掃労働を愛してしまうところだった。このままじゃ掃除が大好きになってしまう！　しかし、自分を見失ってはいけない。冷静でいなくてはいけない。好きになってはいけない。そう、私、清掃くんとはお付き合い出来ないの。","en":"A humiliating blunder. Through sheer carelessness, I nearly fell in love with manual cleaning labor. At this rate, I’ll come to adore it! But I mustn’t lose myself. I must remain calm. I mustn’t fall for him. No, Mr. Cleaning, you and I can never be together.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r24","rowIndex":24,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　あ、もしかしてこれが<tips=81>龍頭</tips>の狙いなのだろうか？　凝り性の私の性格を見抜き、一見単調だが実は奥の深い清掃という仕事を与え、本来の目的を忘れさせるつもりだったのだろうか？","en":"Wait. Could this be the <tips=81>Longtou’s</tips> plan? Did he discern my obsessive nature, give me the seemingly monotonous yet secretly bottomless work of cleaning, and intend to make me forget my original purpose?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r25","rowIndex":25,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ふう、あぶない、あぶない。なんて恐ろしい罠だ。私がクレバーだから回避出来たものの、そうでなければまんまと奸計によって自分を見失うところだった。","en":"Phew. That was close. What a terrifying trap. My cleverness allowed me to evade it, but a lesser woman would have lost herself completely to his wicked scheme.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r26","rowIndex":26,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　とにかく、そう言うわけで、これじゃいかんのです。心が腐る。腐る。","en":"In any case, for all those reasons, this will not do. My heart is rotting. Rotting.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r27","rowIndex":27,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　一体私はなんのためにギャングになったのか。ニートからギャングへの華麗なる転身。","en":"Why did I become a gangster in the first place? My dazzling transformation from NEET to gangster.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r28","rowIndex":28,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　この人いきれのむせかえる活力の溢れた街で、様々な人種が、様々な立場の人間が、欲望を剥き出しにして自分が主役の人生を送っている。私もその登場人物の一人になりたかったのだ。そりゃ清掃が大好きになったら、労働が大好きになったら、見事社会復帰が出来て、お父さんもお母さんも大喜びするだろうけれど、私は健全な社会人になんかなりたくないんだ。ごめんなさいお父さんお母さん。私は自分にしかできない自分だけのスペシャルな人生を送りたい。","en":"In this city, overflowing with the suffocating vitality of the human crush, people of every race and every station bare their desires and live lives in which they are the protagonists. I wanted to be one of those characters. Yes, if I fall in love with cleaning—if I fall in love with labor—I will make a splendid return to society, and my father and mother will be overjoyed. But I don’t want to become a wholesome working adult. I’m sorry, Mother and Father. I want to live a special life of my own that only I can live.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r29","rowIndex":29,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=44>筱喬</tips>だってお人形さんではなく、<tips=41>グランドタワー</tips>を出て自分の人生を歩きはじめた。兄のところから逃げ出すのはいかがなものかと思ったが、当の兄がそれでいいと言ってるのだから口を出せない。まあ確かに、自分の人生を選ぶのはいいことだ。私だって、何か自分のことをしなくてはいけない。でもそれは普通の社会復帰じゃない。","en":"<tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips>, too, ceased to be a doll. She left <tips=41>Grand Tower</tips> and began walking her own path through life. I had my doubts about her running away from her brother, but if the brother in question says it is all right, I can hardly object. And yes, choosing one's own life is a good thing. I, too, must do something that is mine. But that cannot be an ordinary return to society.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r30","rowIndex":30,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　大体、普通に社会復帰するならとっくの昔に職業訓練所に行くとか、資格がとれる学校に行くとか、親が喜ぶような選択肢をとっていた。でも私はそれを拒んできた。いや、別に職業訓練所っていう言葉の響きがあまりにも地味でリアリティがありすぎて、現実に絶望した夢見がちなニートの私の心を傷つけるからっていうだけの理由ではない。","en":"If I wanted an ordinary return to society, I would have gone to a vocational training center long ago, or attended a school where I could earn qualifications, or chosen any of the other paths my parents would welcome. But I refused. And no, it wasn’t only because the words ‘vocational training center’ sounded so drab and oppressively realistic that they injured the heart of a dreamy NEET who had despaired of reality.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r31","rowIndex":31,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は　”あえて”　行かなかったんだ。","en":"I ‘chose’ not to go.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r32","rowIndex":32,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　真面目な話で恐縮だが、この世界はノーマルのもので、私のようなサイキックには居場所がない。能力はみだりに使ってはいけないものとなっており、使えば奇異の目で見られる、どころかヘタをすれば通報される。これが私の唯一にして最大の個性なのに、どうして発揮しちゃいけないんだろうって、どころかそのせいで疎まれるのだろうってずっと思っていた。","en":"Forgive me for turning serious, but this world belongs to Normals. There is no place in it for a psychic like me. Our powers are treated as things never to be used lightly; use them, and people stare at us as freaks—or, with one wrong move, report us to the authorities. Yet this power is my one and only, my greatest individuality. Why am I forbidden to express it? Why, instead, must it make others shun me? I had wondered that for years.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r33","rowIndex":33,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私にはこの大空を自由に飛ぶちからがあるのに、飛んじゃいけないなんて、そうしたら残るものはナメクジみたいにヌルヌルした<tips=77>特質変異</tips>のある身体だけだ。","en":"I have the power to fly freely across the open sky, yet I am told I must not fly. Take that away, and all I have left is a body with a <tips=77>trait mutation</tips>, slick and slimy as a slug.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r34","rowIndex":34,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　たとえば美人が一生顔を隠して生きなくちゃいけないとか、足が早い人が一生人前で運動しちゃいけないとか、勉強出来る人がテストを禁止されたら悲しいでしょう。私もきっと悲しかったんだろう。そんなことで悲しむのは、なんだか負けたみたいで、弱いみたいで、あまり認めたくはないけれど、認めるしかなかった。私の持ってるものはこの社会では望まれていなくて、それがつらいって。","en":"Imagine if a beautiful woman had to hide her face for her entire life, or a fast runner could never exercise in front of anyone, or a brilliant student were forbidden to take tests. It would be sad, wouldn’t it? I suppose I was sad too. Grieving over something like that felt like admitting defeat and weakness, so I did not much want to acknowledge it. But I had no choice. This world did not want what I possessed, and that hurt.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r35","rowIndex":35,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　でも、この<tips=9>Y地区</tips>だけはそうではない。","en":"But <tips=9>Y District</tips> alone is different.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r36","rowIndex":36,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そりゃ大通りの近くで飛べば警報が鳴ったりはするけれど、だからといってそんなに大事にはならないし、私以外のサイキックもよく鳴らしている。","en":"Yes, flying near the main thoroughfare sets off the alarms. But it rarely becomes a major incident, and other psychics besides me set them off all the time.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r37","rowIndex":37,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=77>特質変異</tips>がキツイ人間だかそうでないんだかよくわからない人を見かけることもあるし、発症した<tips=17>タイプB</tips>も平気でうろついているし、不法入国した外国人もいるし、人殺しや泥棒もたくさんいる。全てを受け入れるこの街で、自由に空を飛ぶのが好きだったんだ。そして、素直に自分の持ってる力が好きだって、この街でなら言えたんだ。","en":"You sometimes see people and cannot quite tell whether they have severe <tips=77>trait mutations</tips> or not. Symptomatic <tips=17>Type Bs</tips> wander around without a care. There are undocumented foreigners, murderers, and thieves everywhere. I loved flying freely in the sky above a city that accepted everything. Here, I could say honestly that I loved the power I possessed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r38","rowIndex":38,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　思えば、ひたすら他人の性交を覗き見ていたのだって、本当は性欲なんかこれっぽっちもなくて、ただ空を飛ぶ口実が欲しかったのかもしれない。――いや、それは嘘です。性欲はありました。みなさんに嘘をついてしまって、大変申し訳ない気持ちで一杯です。","en":"Looking back, perhaps my ceaseless spying on other people having sex was never driven by the slightest trace of lust. Perhaps I simply wanted an excuse to fly.—No. That was a lie. I did feel lust. I am overcome with remorse for having lied to you all.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r39","rowIndex":39,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　まあとにかく私は自由が欲しかったんだ。かごの鳥の<tips=44>筱喬</tips>を見て、ひどく気になったのは、そりゃ彼女がとても綺麗だったってことやとても可愛らしい性格をしているからだけれども、その境遇に惹かれたのもあるだろう。","en":"In any case, I wanted freedom. When I saw <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips>, a bird in a cage, her beauty and her terribly sweet personality naturally attracted my attention. But I must also have been drawn to her circumstances.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r40","rowIndex":40,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　自分の不自由さを直視出来ないながらも心の底でとらわれていた私は、彼女をビルの外へ連れ出し解放の喜びを味わわせ、それに共感することで、自分もなんだか解放されたような気になるというひどく歪んだやりかたで自分を慰めていたのだね。","en":"Unable to face my own lack of freedom yet bound by it in the depths of my heart, I comforted myself through a horribly twisted method: I took her outside the building, let her taste the joy of liberation, shared it with her, and thereby felt as though I too had somehow been freed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r41","rowIndex":41,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それはそれで良かったんだろう。","en":"And perhaps that was for the best, in its own way.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r42","rowIndex":42,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　でも、<tips=44>筱喬</tips>が離れていってしまった今、気づかないわけにはいかないんだ。自分が本当は何に苦しんでいたのか。","en":"But now that <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> has left me, I can no longer avoid recognizing what truly caused me pain.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r43","rowIndex":43,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>というのはギャングだ。","en":"<tips=7>YS</tips> is a gang.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r44","rowIndex":44,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ちょっと調べたんだけれど、元々この街のギャングは移民が混沌のなかで生きてゆくために暴力や犯罪を行って出来たものと、よその地域から移り住んできたギャングたちがあるらしい。先だって離脱した<tips=75>フェルナンデス・ファミリー</tips>は典型的な前者で、<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>の主流派である香港グループは、香港の<tips=69>義勝</tips>というチャイニーズマフィアがそのまま引っ越して来たものだ。","en":"I did a little research. Apparently, the gangs in this city come from two different sources: some arose when immigrants turned to violence and crime to survive amid the chaos, while others moved in from elsewhere. The <tips=75>Fernandes Family</tips>, which recently broke away, is a typical example of the former. The Hong Kong faction at the heart of <tips=7>YS</tips>, meanwhile, is a Chinese mafia known as <tips=69>Yisheng</tips> that relocated here wholesale from Hong Kong.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r45","rowIndex":45,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　今の<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>はそういった素性の違うグループが、地域に進出しようとしたヤクザと争い、その息のかかった<tips=18>ローズ・クラブ</tips>とかいう売春組織を倒すために手を組んで出来たものらしい。その時の盟主が初代<tips=81>龍頭</tips><tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>。","en":"Apparently, the present <tips=7>YS</tips> was created when groups with those differing origins joined forces to fight yakuza attempting to expand into the district, and to destroy the <tips=18>Rose Club</tips>, a prostitution organization under yakuza influence. Their leader at the time was the First <tips=81>Longtou</tips>, <tips=3>Chris Tse</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r46","rowIndex":46,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　この<tips=18>ローズ・クラブ</tips>というのは街の人々を散々食い物にしたおそろしい娯楽施設だったようで、だから<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>は住民たちに支持されていた。","en":"The <tips=18>Rose Club</tips> was apparently a fearsome den of vice that preyed mercilessly on the people of the city. That was why the residents supported <tips=7>YS</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r47","rowIndex":47,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　時間が経ち、最近はただのばかでかいギャング組織といった感じだけれども、元々は仲間を守るための組織だったというわけだ。","en":"Time passed, and lately YS feels like nothing more than an absurdly enormous gang. Originally, however, it was an organization founded to protect its own people.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r48","rowIndex":48,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　この経緯だけを見ればいわゆる必要悪ってやつなのかもしれない。かといってもちろん<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>もギャングであるわけだから、市民を恫喝して縄張り料やらをとったり、暴力を背景に不動産屋を安く買ったり、武器を売ったり、密入国の手伝いをしたり、売春の元締めをしたり、一通りの悪事は働いている。けして正義の味方ではない。","en":"Judged solely by that history, it might qualify as what people call a necessary evil. But of course <tips=7>YS</tips> is still a gang. It intimidates citizens and shakes them down for protection money, uses the threat of violence to buy real estate on the cheap, sells weapons, facilitates illegal immigration, runs prostitution—the whole usual catalog of crime. It is certainly no champion of justice.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r49","rowIndex":49,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　もっとも、私はものごとを善とか悪とかで考えるのは好きじゃない。性善説も性悪説もばかばかしい。そんなものは見る立場で形がかわる影のようなもので、なんの本質もついてはいない。人間は善でも悪でも割り切れない、もっと素晴らしいものだと思う。","en":"Still, I dislike dividing things into good and evil. Theories of innate human goodness and innate human wickedness are equally absurd. Good and evil are like shadows that change shape with the observer’s position. They say nothing essential. Human beings cannot be neatly divided into good and evil. I think they are something more wonderful than that.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r50","rowIndex":50,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　まあとにかくそういうわけで、<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>の人間が特にかっこいいとか、やっていることが正しいと思ったわけじゃないんだ。個人的な好き嫌いで言わせて貰えば、いやなことも沢山している。","en":"So anyway, it isn’t that I thought the people in <tips=7>YS</tips> were especially admirable or that their actions were right. Speaking only of my personal likes and dislikes, they do many things I hate.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r51","rowIndex":51,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　でもここでなら、きっと私の力が活かせる。","en":"But here, I can surely put my power to use.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r52","rowIndex":52,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ずっと使うな使うなと言われ、まるで持ってることが悪いようなこの力が、存分に活かせるのだ。<tips=44>筱喬</tips>を助けたことで、ここのみんなはもの凄く褒めてくれた。イカツイ顔のおっさんや、偉そうな人も、口を揃えて私を褒めるのだ。お前は凄い。あの化け物と渡り合って<tips=44>筱喬</tips>を取り戻すなんて、素晴らしい。こんなにちやほやされたこと、私の人生で今まであっただろうか？　仕事の内容はつまらないが、この環境は素晴らしい。","en":"All my life, I was told not to use this power, over and over, as though possessing it were itself a sin. Here, I can put it to work to my heart’s content. Everyone praised me to the skies for rescuing <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips>. Burly, hard-faced men and exalted personages alike joined in: “You’re incredible. To go toe-to-toe with that monster and bring <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> back—magnificent!” Have I ever been fêted like this before in all my life? The work itself is dull, but this place is wonderful.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r53","rowIndex":53,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そりゃ、この組織に手を貸したせいで誰か力のない人を苦しめるかも知れない、やはりギャングであるから、人に迷惑をかけることもあるだろう。単なる迷惑より、もっと恐ろしいこともある。","en":"Of course, by lending this organization a hand, I may cause some powerless person to suffer. It is a gang, after all, so I will probably cause people trouble. I may do things far worse than merely trouble them.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r54","rowIndex":54,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しかしそうだとしても、私はこの力をここで存分に使いたい。だって、せっかく生まれた時に与えられたものなのだから。","en":"Even so, I want to use this power here to the fullest. After all, it is something I was given at birth.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r55","rowIndex":55,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　結局のところ、人間というものは自分の持っているものを肯定されることが心の安らぎなのだろう。だから自分を受け容れてくれる相手を探し、受け容れてくれる場所を探し続けるのだ。","en":"Ultimately, perhaps human beings find peace when something they possess is affirmed. That is why we keep searching for people who accept us and places where we are accepted.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r56","rowIndex":56,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ああ<tips=44>筱喬</tips>。あなたはそういう人間を見つけたんだね。それは兄でも私でもなかった。","en":"Ah, <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips>. You found such a person, didn’t you? And that person was neither your brother nor me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r57","rowIndex":57,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そのことを思うと心が痛くなるが、かわりに私はあなたを助けたり外に連れ出すことで自分の力を活かす喜びを知り、その場所にやって来たんだよ。","en":"It pains me to think of that. But in exchange, helping you—taking you out into the world—taught me the joy of putting my power to use, and it was that joy that brought me here.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r58","rowIndex":58,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　――ただ今のところは、その能力の使い道は窓掃除でしかないけれど。","en":"...Though at present, window cleaning is the only use anyone has found for that ability.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r59","rowIndex":59,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ああもうやってられるか！　どうだピカピカだぞ！","en":"Oh, to hell with this! Well? Look at them gleam!","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r60","rowIndex":60,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は風に吹かれ服をはためかせながら掃除をやりとげてやったのだ。こんな面倒な、ギャングの仕事とも言えぬ仕事をやりとげるなんて、なんて意志の強い女性なのでしょう。素敵な女性なのでしょう。第三代<tips=81>龍頭</tips>もその曇った眼でしっかりとご照覧あれ。私は出来る女なのだ。","en":"And so, with the wind whipping at me and my clothes streaming behind, I brought the cleaning to completion. What a woman of indomitable will I must be, to see through a tedious chore that can hardly even be called gangster work. What a splendid woman! O Third <tips=81>Longtou</tips>, gaze well upon me through those clouded eyes of yours. I am a woman who gets things done.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r61","rowIndex":61,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　屋上から<tips=41>グランドタワー</tips>のなかに戻ることにして、私はそこから上昇した。","en":"I decide to reenter <tips=41>Grand Tower</tips> through the roof, and rise from where I float.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r62","rowIndex":62,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　最上階は<tips=81>龍頭</tips>の執務室。そこをひょいと飛び越えればヘリポートのある屋上に出る。","en":"The <tips=81>Longtou’s</tips> office occupies the top floor. A quick flight over it brings me to the rooftop helipad.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r63","rowIndex":63,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　普段<tips=81>龍頭</tips>にはみだりに部屋のなかを覗くなと言われている私であるが、そう言われれば興味がなくとも覗きたくなる性分だということは前に述べた。今回もその伝にのっとって、特に何か見たいわけでもないが窓の端の方からこっそり部屋のなかの様子をうかがったのである。","en":"The <tips=81>Longtou</tips> habitually orders me not to peer indiscriminately into his room. As I noted before, however, forbidding me to do something makes me want to do it even if it holds no interest for me. In accordance with that principle, I once again have no particular desire to see anything, but furtively peek into the room from the edge of the window.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r64","rowIndex":64,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　いつも<tips=81>龍頭</tips>は窓を背中にして物憂げに執務席についているのだけれども、今日はそこには居なかった。向こうの向かい合ってソファーが設置された応接セットで栗色のくるくるとしたくせっ毛を持つちょっと太った青年と話している。彼は<tips=28>トーマス・リャオ</tips>だ。私は彼を<tips=28>トミー</tips>さんと呼んでいる。父親の組織を引き継いで幹部となった、若いながらにこの<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>でもかなり偉い人なのだけれども、どうも面と向かうと貫禄というかそういうものを感じなくて、つい気軽に呼んでしまうのだ。","en":"The <tips=81>Longtou</tips> usually sits pensively at his desk with his back to the window, but today the chair is empty. Instead, he is over in the reception area, talking across a pair of facing sofas with a slightly plump young man whose chestnut hair curls in little ringlets. This is <tips=28>Thomas Liao</tips>. I call him <tips=28>Tommy</tips>. He inherited his father’s organization and became one of the leadership; young though he is, he ranks quite highly even within <tips=7>YS</tips>. Yet in person, he simply lacks that air of dignity, and I cannot help addressing him casually.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r65","rowIndex":65,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それから、まるでゲイカップルみたいにいつも<tips=81>龍頭</tips>のそばににいるボディーガードの<tips=25>世傑</tips>さん。年がよく分からないけど大人の色気たっぷりのめちゃくちゃ美人な<tips=31>エリー・ホワイト</tips>さん。それから、愛想笑いをしてもいつも目が笑わない<tips=33>壬生屋</tips>さんがいる。","en":"Then there is <tips=25>Sai-kit</tips>, the bodyguard who is always at the <tips=81>Longtou’s</tips> side as though they were a gay couple. There is <tips=31>Ellie White</tips>, an astonishing beauty of indeterminate age, overflowing with adult allure. And there is <tips=33>Mibuya</tips>, whose eyes never smile even when his mouth does.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r66","rowIndex":66,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ちなみにこの<tips=33>壬生屋</tips>さんは多分本当のゲイだと思う。<tips=59>暗闇通り</tips>の売春屋の元締めだそうだけれども、女性に対する目つきと男性に対する目つきがあきらかに違う。二代目ながらそっちの仕事はかなりのやり手だそうだが、女性に対して私情がないから冷静に商品として評価出来るんだろうか？","en":"Incidentally, I suspect <tips=33>Mibuya</tips> truly is gay. I hear he controls the brothels on <tips=59>Darkness Street</tips>, but the eyes with which he looks at women are plainly different from the eyes with which he looks at men. Apparently, although he inherited the business, he is extremely capable at it. Could the absence of personal feeling toward women let him evaluate the merchandise with cool objectivity?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r67","rowIndex":67,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ただ、本人は自分のセクシャルを公言していないし、他の皆も彼のことをそんな風には思ってはいないようだ。私だけが感じてるのだろうか？　それとも勘違いなのかしらん。その態度はあからさまだと思うのだけれど。","en":"Still, the man himself has never announced his sexuality, and no one else seems to think of him that way. Am I the only one who sees it? Or am I mistaken? His manner seems so obvious to me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r68","rowIndex":68,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして彼らの背後で見守っているのが<tips=40>黄姉妹</tips>。","en":"Watching over all of them from behind are the <tips=40>Wong sisters</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r69","rowIndex":69,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　いつも<tips=81>龍頭</tips>の身辺にその能力でレーダーを張り巡らしている彼女たちはもちろん、私がここでこっそり見ていることに気がついている。","en":"They keep a constant radar screen of psychic power around the <tips=81>Longtou</tips>, so naturally they know I am spying through the window.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r70","rowIndex":70,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　妹の<tips=40>天祥</tips>がこちらを振り返って、ちょっと慌てながら両手でばってんを作って見せる。","en":"The younger sister, <tips=40>Tin-cheung</tips>, looks toward me and crosses both arms in an X with a little flurry of alarm.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r71","rowIndex":71,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　何者であろうと<tips=81>龍頭</tips>に近づくものは報告しなければならない、というのが彼女たちの仕事であるから、本来は私がここにいることも伝えなければいけないのだ。","en":"Their duty requires them to report anyone who approaches the <tips=81>Longtou</tips>, whoever that person may be. Ordinarily, they would have to announce my presence as well.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r72","rowIndex":72,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　でも、あなたは私の友だちだよね？　そういう気持ちを込めて私がにっこりと微笑みを返すと、彼女は苦い顔をする。","en":"But we are friends, aren’t we? I beam back at her with that sentiment in my smile, and her face turns sour.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r73","rowIndex":73,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　最近私は彼女たちと結構仲が良い。<tips=44>筱喬</tips>がいない今、一番良く話す相手かもしれない。","en":"The sisters and I have become fairly close lately. Now that <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> is gone, they may be the people I speak to most often.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r74","rowIndex":74,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　いつも仕事ばかりをして可哀想だと、<tips=44>筱喬</tips>と一緒にプレゼントをあげたのが最初に話すようになったきっかけで、<tips=44>筱喬</tips>がいなくなり私がここに出入りするようになってから交流が増えた。","en":"That was how we first came to talk: <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> and I felt sorry for them, forever doing nothing but work, and brought them presents. After <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> left and I began coming here regularly, the sisters and I spent more and more time together.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r75","rowIndex":75,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　あんな格好をしているけれど、二人とも中身は普通の女の子で、甘い物とアイドルタレントに目がない。身近に<tips=81>龍頭</tips>みたいなその辺りのアイドルなど及ばぬような美形がいるのにどうしてそんなものが好きなのかと不思議なのだが、二人にとっては<tips=81>龍頭</tips>はそういう対象ではなく、恐れ多く偉大な主人としか感じられないのだそうだ。私などはなんの抵抗もなくそういう対象として見られるのだが。","en":"Despite the way they dress, both are ordinary girls inside, mad about sweets and pop idols. With someone as beautiful as the <tips=81>Longtou</tips> close at hand—a man who leaves any idol in the dust—I cannot understand why they like such things. But the sisters say they do not see the <tips=81>Longtou</tips> that way. To them, he is only a great and awe-inspiring master. I, for one, have no trouble seeing him as an object of attraction.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r76","rowIndex":76,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　まあそういうわけで、彼女たちがなかなか行けない<tips=9>Y地区</tips>の外で仕入れたグッズや、お菓子などをよく差し入れしているうちに、お互い不快な<tips=77>特質変異</tips>のあるサイキックだという共通点もあったせいだろう、立ち入った話などもするようになった。","en":"At any rate, I kept bringing them merchandise and sweets from beyond <tips=9>Y District</tips>, where they rarely had a chance to venture themselves. Before long, we were confiding more personal things to one another—perhaps because the three of us also shared the bond of being psychics afflicted with unpleasant <tips=77>trait mutations</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r77","rowIndex":77,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女たちはサイキックであり幼い頃からその能力で組織に仕えている。初代<tips=81>龍頭</tips>の時から同じ仕事をしていたそうだ。もちろん普通の生活など出来ず、さぞかし欲求がたまっているだろうかと思ったのだが、聞いてみると全くそんなことはなく、やりがいと責任を感じ、少しでも<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>のために役立てることが幸せだと言う。","en":"They are psychics and have served the organization with their abilities since childhood. Apparently, they had been doing the same work since the time of the first <tips=81>Longtou</tips>. Naturally, they could never live ordinary lives. I assumed they must have accumulated a great many frustrated desires, but when I asked, I discovered nothing of the kind. They find purpose and responsibility in their work and say that being of even the slightest use to <tips=7>YS</tips> makes them happy.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r78","rowIndex":78,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私はそんな人間がこの世に存在するなんて信じられなかったので、いろんな方法でボロを出させようとしたのだけれども二人の受け答えは完璧で一点の曇りもなく、かえってそんな純粋なものを信じられない私の歪んだ精神が恥ずかしくなってしまった。","en":"I could not believe people like that existed in this world, so I tried all sorts of methods to make their masks slip. Every answer the sisters gave was perfect and utterly unclouded. In the end, I grew ashamed of my own twisted mind for being incapable of believing anything so pure.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r79","rowIndex":79,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　あのテレポーテーションをする少女の襲撃によって父を失ったが、<tips=81>龍頭</tips>を守るためにそうなったことを誇りに思っていると、そう語ったときはほんの少しだけ寂しさを露わにしたけれどこれもやはり本心なんだろう。","en":"They lost their father in the attack by that teleporting girl, but said they were proud that he died protecting the <tips=81>Longtou</tips>. They revealed the smallest trace of loneliness when they spoke, but their words must have been sincere too.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r80","rowIndex":80,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　いや、仕事のために命をかけようとするなんておよしなさいよ。くだらない。と私は思ったが、まあそう言ってしまうと彼女たちの父を中傷したようにとられかねないし、それは本意ではなかったので、あなたたちは女の子なんだからもっと他に何か見つけてもいいでしょうと私は言った。けれどそういう言い方でも彼女たちは納得出来ないようだった。","en":"Don’t go risking your lives for a job, I thought. How absurd. But if I said that aloud, they might take it as an insult to their father, which was not at all what I meant. So instead, I told them they were girls and surely ought to be able to find something else in life. Even put that way, however, they could not seem to understand me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r81","rowIndex":81,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は、年が自分とさほど変わらないのに、このような責任感を持って仕事をしている彼女たちを、凄いなあ、自分とはまったく違う人種だなあと、ほとんど畏敬の目で見てるのだけれども、彼女たちも彼女たちで、例のサイキックから<tips=44>筱喬</tips>を取り戻した件で私をうやまってくれている。","en":"They are not so different from me in age, yet approach their work with this degree of responsibility. I regard them almost with awe, marveling that they are a completely different species of human being. For their part, they admire me because I recovered <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> from that psychic.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r82","rowIndex":82,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「我々が全員でかかっても好き放題されてしまったのに、一人で立ち向かって目的を達成するなんてすごいです」","en":"“All of us together were completely at her mercy, yet you faced her alone and accomplished your objective. It was incredible.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r83","rowIndex":83,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　と弾んだ声で言われると、照れくさかった。","en":"When she says it in such a buoyant voice, I feel embarrassed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r84","rowIndex":84,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そういうわけで、世間知らずの二人にいろいろといい加減なことを偉そうに話しているうちに、何かしらんけれども私のことを姉のように慕ってくれるようになったので、今も『まずいですよ』というような表情とジェスチャーを送ってくれているが、<tips=81>龍頭</tips>には伝達しないでくれているのだ。","en":"And so, as I held forth with great authority on all manner of dubious nonsense for the benefit of these sheltered girls, they somehow came to look up to me as an elder sister. Even now, they are sending me looks and gestures that say, “You really shouldn’t be doing this,” yet they are kind enough not to report me to the <tips=81>Longtou</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r85","rowIndex":85,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　さて、そうして<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>幹部たちは何かしかめっつらで話をしている。","en":"Meanwhile, the <tips=7>YS</tips> executives continue their discussion with grave faces.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r86","rowIndex":86,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　あの太っちょの<tips=34>ダリオ・ボネット</tips>さんは来ていない。そして、抜けた<tips=35>フェルナンデス</tips>のかわりに新しい幹部が加わったのだけれどその人たちも来ていないから、幹部勢揃いというわけでもないけれど、しかし幹部のなかでも<tips=81>龍頭</tips>の側近といって良いメンバーは軒並み集まっているからよほど重要な話なのだろう。","en":"Fat <tips=34>Dario Bonetto</tips> is not here. The new executives appointed in place of the departed <tips=35>Fernandes</tips> are absent as well, so this is not a gathering of every officer. Even so, nearly all the executives who could fairly be called the <tips=81>Longtou’s</tips> closest aides are present. They must be discussing something extraordinarily important.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r87","rowIndex":87,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　やっぱり、<tips=21>八龍会</tips>関係のことなんだろうか？　特別な動きがあったのかもしれない。だとすれば、<tips=44>筱喬</tips>や<tips=10>見土</tips>さんたちにも影響があるのかもしれない。いよいよ本格的な争いになるのだとしたら――妹と兄でわかれることになるのかな？","en":"Could this be about the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips> after all? Something unusual may have happened. If so, it may affect <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips>, <tips=10>Mr. Mido</tips>, and the others as well. If a full-scale conflict is finally about to begin—will the younger sister and older brother end up on opposite sides?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r88","rowIndex":88,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その時、私はどうすればいいのか。もちろん<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>の一員となったからにはこちらで働くつもりではいるけれども、今は仕事がないわけだし、ここで<tips=10>見土</tips>さんと<tips=44>筱喬</tips>に何か頼まれたら正直きっぱりと断る自信はない。もっとも、一番可能性が高いのは、どっちからもお呼びがかからないで傍観者になるということなんだけれども。","en":"What would I do then? Of course, now that I have joined <tips=7>YS</tips>, I mean to work for this side. But as things stand, they have given me no work at all, and honestly, if <tips=10>Mr. Mido</tips> and <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> were to ask something of me, I am not sure I could refuse them outright. Though the most likely outcome is that neither side calls for me and I end up watching the whole affair from the sidelines.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r89","rowIndex":89,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=40>黄姉妹</tips>のジェスチャーを無視して会議の様子を眺めていると、急に<tips=81>龍頭</tips>が振り返る。そして、目があった。","en":"I ignore the <tips=40>Wong sisters</tips>’ gestures and continue watching the meeting. Suddenly, the <tips=81>Longtou</tips> turns. Our eyes meet.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r90","rowIndex":90,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼は目を細めて怪訝な表情でこちらを見る。","en":"He narrows his eyes and regards me with a puzzled expression.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r91","rowIndex":91,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「うげっ」","en":"“Ugh!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r92","rowIndex":92,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　思わず変な声が出て、慌てて窓から離れたけれどもう遅い。","en":"A strange sound escapes my throat, and I hurry away from the window, but it is already too late.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r93","rowIndex":93,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ポケットの携帯電話が鳴り、見てみると相手は<tips=81>龍頭</tips>自身だった。","en":"The cell phone in my pocket rings. When I check, the caller is the <tips=81>Longtou</tips> himself.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r94","rowIndex":94,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あ、あの、掃除が終わったんで……」","en":"“U-um, I finished cleaning, so...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r95","rowIndex":95,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は言い訳をしようとしたけれど、","en":"I attempt an excuse.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r96","rowIndex":96,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"『いいから十分後に執務室に来てくれ』","en":"‘Never mind that. Come to my office in ten minutes.’","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r97","rowIndex":97,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　と、クールな声で言われたので急にお腹が痛くなってきた。","en":"He delivers the order in such a cool, collected voice that my stomach abruptly begins to ache.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r98","rowIndex":98,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　トイレに行った後もまだ十分には足りなかったので、ビルのなかをふわふわとうろついている。","en":"Even after I visit the bathroom, ten minutes have not passed, so I drift aimlessly through the building.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r99","rowIndex":99,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　本当は義足でも自然に歩けるように慣れなくてはいけないのだろうけれども、どうも面倒でつい力を使ってしまう。飛んで移動する方がずっとラクなのだし、ここでは能力を隠す必要がないから、どうしてもこうなってしまう。","en":"I should probably practice until I can walk naturally upon my prosthetic leg. But it is a nuisance, so I invariably use my power. Flying is far easier, and here there is no need to conceal my ability. I cannot help ending up this way.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r100","rowIndex":100,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　すれ違う<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>の人たちも、最初はギョッとしていたけれども、今はもう慣れっこだ。今日もすれ違うと、","en":"The <tips=7>YS</tips> members I pass in the halls were startled at first, but by now they are thoroughly used to the sight of me. Today, too, whenever I float past someone—","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r101","rowIndex":101,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「お、今日も浮いてるな」","en":"“Ah, floating again today.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r102","rowIndex":102,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　とか、","en":"Or:","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r103","rowIndex":103,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「水もしたたる良い女だね」","en":"“Looking dripping gorgeous today.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r104","rowIndex":104,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　などと、顔見知りの何人かがわけのわからぬ挨拶をしてくる。","en":"—some familiar face or other greets me with nonsense like that.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r105","rowIndex":105,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　泣く子も黙る<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>の構成員と言えども、その恐ろしいイメージのわりには気さくなおじさんやお兄さんが多い。少し前はどのファミリーに属するかで雰囲気が変わり、同じ<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>のなかでも随分とピリピリしていたらしいが、今の<tips=81>龍頭</tips>になって垣根がなくなってから風通しがよくなったという噂である。ギャング組織としてそれがいいことなのか悪いことなのかはよくわからないが。ただ彼らも、仕事となれば<tips=81>龍頭</tips>の指示で冷酷なことをしているんだろう。特に<tips=41>グランドタワー</tips>上層で出会う人々の多くは、重要な仕事についている人間が多いはずだ。こうしていると想像もつかないが、みんな偉くて恐ろしい人なのだろう。","en":"Even members of the dreaded <tips=7>YS</tips>—the sort whose name silences crying children—are often easygoing older and younger men, contrary to their terrifying image. Until recently, the atmosphere supposedly changed according to the family one belonged to, and the tension remained severe even within <tips=7>YS</tips>. Rumor says that after the present <tips=81>Longtou</tips> tore down those barriers, things became more open. I have no idea whether that is good or bad for a gang. Of course, when work requires it, these men must commit ruthless acts upon the <tips=81>Longtou’s</tips> orders. Many of the people one encounters upon <tips=41>Grand Tower’s</tips> upper floors must hold important posts. It is difficult to imagine while meeting them this way, but they must all be important and frightening men.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r106","rowIndex":106,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　最近では町外れの用水路で飲食店オーナーの死体が入ったスーツケースが見つかったが、これは上納金を渋った彼に対する<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>の制裁だと言われている。真相は私も知らない。<tips=47>八龍解放軍</tips>が出来てから、このように<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>に対して反抗的な問題が増えているらしい。こういう事件にも、彼らが関わっているのかしらん。","en":"Recently, a suitcase containing the body of a restaurant owner was discovered in an irrigation channel at the edge of town. The killing is said to have been a punishment by <tips=7>YS</tips> after he balked at paying tribute. I do not know the truth. Apparently, since the <tips=47>Hachiryu Liberation Army</tips> was formed, acts of defiance toward <tips=7>YS</tips> like this have grown more frequent. I wonder whether they, too, had a hand in incidents like this.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r107","rowIndex":107,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　まあとにかく、<tips=81>龍頭</tips>はルール違反には厳しく容赦がないが、それさえ守っていれば、わけのわからぬ礼儀や因習のようなものは振りかざさないということで、なかなか評判が良いようだった。","en":"At any rate, the <tips=81>Longtou</tips> is strict and unforgiving when anyone breaks the rules. So long as the rules are observed, however, he does not impose a lot of pointless formalities or hidebound customs. That seems to have made him quite popular.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r108","rowIndex":108,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それにしても、ついこの間までニートだった私が、黒人のいかついスキンヘッドのお兄さんや、顔にひどい向こう傷のあるおじさんと、こんな風に気軽に交流がとれるようになっているとは想像もつかなかった。","en":"I was a NEET until such a short time ago. I never imagined I would casually socialize like this with fearsome Black men with shaved heads or older men whose faces bear terrible scars.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r109","rowIndex":109,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しかし、いつまでもこのままでいられるとは限らない。彼らが優しいのは、前述のとおり<tips=44>筱喬</tips>奪還を果たしたからで、その効力は時間と共に薄れてゆくだろう。早い内に次の仕事で成果を挙げなくては。やはり、人間は仕事なのだ。経歴も素性も関係ない。デキるものこそ必要とされる。","en":"But I cannot count on things remaining this way forever. As I said, they are kind to me because I succeeded in bringing <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> back, and the credit from that achievement will fade with time. I must deliver results on my next assignment, and soon. In the end, it is the work that makes the person. Résumé and pedigree have nothing to do with it. What people need is someone who can deliver.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r110","rowIndex":110,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　はやく、掃除より重要な仕事をしたい。私の力は何かしら有効な使い道があるはずなのだ。そこでさらなる活躍をすれば、デキる女としてますますもてはやされるに違いない。ちやほやされるに違いない。そして将来は<tips=31>エリー・ホワイト</tips>みたいに大幹部になっちゃったりするのだろうか？","en":"I want a real assignment, and soon—something more important than cleaning. There must be some genuinely useful application for my power. Once I distinguish myself there, everyone is sure to make an ever greater fuss over me as a woman who gets things done. They are sure to pamper me and shower me with praise. And then, one day, might I even find myself a senior leader like <tips=31>Ellie White</tips>?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r111","rowIndex":111,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そう考えると胸も躍るが、いまはそんな空想に浸っている場合ではなかった。<tips=81>龍頭</tips>に呼び出されている。一体どんなおそろしいことを言われてしまうのだろうか。","en":"The thought makes my heart leap, but this is no time to indulge in fantasy. The <tips=81>Longtou</tips> has summoned me. What terrifying thing is he going to say?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r112","rowIndex":112,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「今日はひとつニュースがあった」","en":"“There was a development today.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r113","rowIndex":113,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　時間になって執務室に入ると、いつもの執務席に戻っている<tips=81>龍頭</tips>は私の覗き見を咎めるでもなくいきなりそう話しはじめた。","en":"At the appointed time, I enter the office. The <tips=81>Longtou</tips> is back at his usual desk, and without rebuking me for peeping, immediately begins to speak.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r114","rowIndex":114,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「きみも知っておいた方がいいと思ってね」","en":"“I thought it best that you know as well.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r115","rowIndex":115,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「な、なんですか？　わ、わざわざ呼んで伝えるってことは、私に関係があることなんですか？」","en":"“Wh-what is it? I-if you summoned me specially to tell me, does it concern me?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r116","rowIndex":116,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　後ろめたい私はまだ責められているわけでもないのにやたらと挙動不審になってしまう。","en":"My guilty conscience makes me act absurdly shifty even though he has not accused me of anything.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r117","rowIndex":117,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　さっきの幹部たちはもう退室しており、ここに居るのは私と<tips=81>龍頭</tips>の他には<tips=40>黄姉妹</tips>と<tips=30>レイレイ</tips>だけだった。","en":"The executives from before have already left. Apart from the <tips=81>Longtou</tips> and me, only the <tips=40>Wong sisters</tips> and <tips=30>Leilei</tips> remain.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r118","rowIndex":118,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして、コーヒーの残り香がかすかに漂っている。","en":"And the faint fragrance of coffee lingers in the room.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r119","rowIndex":119,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「我々の組織に関係がある話だから、そういう意味ではきみにも関係がある。もしかしたら個人的な意味での関係もあるかもしれないが、それはきみ次第だ」","en":"“It concerns our organization, so in that sense, it concerns you too. There may also be another, more personal sense in which it concerns you, but that is for you to decide.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r120","rowIndex":120,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=81>龍頭</tips>にしては珍しくもったいぶった言い方だった。","en":"The <tips=81>Longtou</tips> rarely draws matters out like this.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r121","rowIndex":121,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　でも、これはどうも本当に私の覗き見に何か言おうとしているのではなく、全く別の何か重要なことを話そうとしているようだ。","en":"But he truly does not seem to have summoned me in order to complain about my peeping. He is about to tell me something important and completely unrelated.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r122","rowIndex":122,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ちょっといやな予感がする。私は怒られると覚悟していた時とはまた違った緊張を感じながら、もう一度訊ねた。","en":"A faint sense of dread comes over me. Now tense in an altogether different way from when I was merely bracing for a scolding, I ask him again.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r123","rowIndex":123,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「何があったんですか？」","en":"“What happened?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r124","rowIndex":124,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=47>解放軍</tips>のリーダーである<tips=10>見土道夫</tips>が殺された」","en":"“<tips=10>Michio Mido</tips>, the leader of the <tips=47>Liberation Army</tips>, has been killed.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r125","rowIndex":125,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=81>龍頭</tips>は静かな声でそう言った。","en":"The <tips=81>Longtou</tips> says it in a quiet voice.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r126","rowIndex":126,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「え……」","en":"“What...?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r127","rowIndex":127,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　何かの聞き間違いじゃないかと思った。","en":"For a moment, I think I must have misheard him.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r128","rowIndex":128,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「昨日彼は<tips=22>老人たち</tips>の後継者として<tips=21>八龍会</tips>の指導者となり、そのお披露目のパーティを主催していたんだが、その最中に殺害されたらしい。事件直後に一報があり、追跡調査をさせた結果事実とわかった。犯人は例の病院襲撃のときに解放した患者の一人で、十代の少女だそうだ。パーティに紛れ込んで花束に隠した銃で殺した。少女は追っ手を二人殺して現場から逃走し、姿をくらましている。おそらくプロの協力者がいるんだろう。どの勢力のものかはわからないが、その背景次第ではまたややこしくなる。今きみが覗き見していた会議はそのためのものだったんだ」","en":"“Yesterday, he succeeded the <tips=22>old men</tips> as leader of the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips> and hosted a party to mark his public debut. Apparently, he was murdered in the middle of it. We received an initial report immediately afterward and had the matter investigated; the report has now been confirmed. The killer is said to be one of the patients freed in the hospital raid, a teenage girl. She infiltrated the party and shot him with a gun concealed in a bouquet, killed two pursuers while escaping the scene, and has since vanished. She presumably had help from a professional. We do not know what force lies behind her, but depending on the answer, matters may become complicated again. That was the subject of the meeting you were spying on just now.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r129","rowIndex":129,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　淡々と話すその言葉の内容がなかなか頭に入ってこない。","en":"Though he delivers the report without a trace of emotion, I cannot seem to take in what he is saying.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r130","rowIndex":130,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=10>見土</tips>さんとは最近はこういう立場になったため会っていないけれども、<tips=44>筱喬</tips>から今日はこんな話をしたとか、こんな料理を褒めて貰ったとか、生活の様子は耳に入っているし、つい先日も二人で映っている画像を送りつけられたばかりだ。そのあまりにも幸せ一杯の画像に、思わず「死ね」と声に出して呟いてしまったのは事実であるが、現実にそのような事態を念頭に置いていたわけではない。","en":"Because of my present position, I have not seen <tips=10>Mr. Mido</tips> lately. But <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> told me about their life—what they discussed that day, what dish he praised—and only recently sent me a picture of the two of them together. The picture overflowed with such complete happiness that I actually muttered, ‘Die,’ aloud. But I did not remotely imagine that such a thing would truly happen.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r131","rowIndex":131,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そりゃ、あのような仕事をしているのだし、こんな唐突な事態が起こる可能性もあると想像はついたのかもしれないが。","en":"Given his line of work, perhaps I ought to have realized that something this sudden could happen.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r132","rowIndex":132,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「し、死んだんですか」","en":"“H-he’s dead?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r133","rowIndex":133,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私の声は自分で聞いてもなるほど動揺している。","en":"Even I can hear how shaken my voice is.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r134","rowIndex":134,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=81>龍頭</tips>は頷き、","en":"The <tips=81>Longtou</tips> nods.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r135","rowIndex":135,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=47>解放軍</tips>の副リーダーだった<tips=67>カミラ・ノーサム</tips>が暫定的に<tips=21>八龍会</tips>全体を指揮することになるようだ。彼女は<tips=10>見土道夫</tips>よりも積極的なタイプだから、おそらくこれまでよりも直接的な手段を多用するだろう。まあ、我々にとっては与しやすい相手だが、これで人死にが避けられなくなったことを思うと喜んでもいられないな」","en":"“It appears that <tips=67>Camilla Northam</tips>, formerly the <tips=47>Liberation Army’s</tips> deputy commander, will assume interim command of the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips> as a whole. She is a more aggressive sort than <tips=10>Michio Mido</tips>, so she will probably employ direct methods more often than he did. She will be easier for us to deal with. Even so, now that deaths are almost certain, this is hardly grounds for celebration.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r136","rowIndex":136,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼は普段通り冷静に見えた。","en":"He looks as calm as ever.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r137","rowIndex":137,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　今『<tips=10>見土道夫</tips>』と、他人事のように呼んだが、少年時代からの友人だと聞いている。","en":"He just said ‘<tips=10>Michio Mido</tips>’ as though speaking of a stranger, but I heard they had been friends since boyhood.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r138","rowIndex":138,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼はその死をなんとも思っていないのだろうか？　お互いが対立する立場になった時点で想定していたことではあるだろうし、もっとひどい決着のつきかたもあり得た。直接殺し合うかたちになるよりはマシだったのかもしれない。","en":"Does he feel nothing about his death? He must have anticipated it from the moment they found themselves upon opposing sides, and the conflict might have ended in a still more terrible manner. Perhaps this is better than if the two had killed one another directly.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r139","rowIndex":139,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それでも、実際に死んだとなれば何かは感じるはずだ。私の病室で二人が顔を合わせた時も、仲がよさそうだったじゃないか。情が薄いのか、こらえているのか、この人の内心は正直私には計りがたいけれども、冷静な態度をまったく崩さないのはさすがだと思った。","en":"Even so, now that his friend is actually dead, he must feel something. The two of them certainly seemed close when they met in my hospital room. Is he simply coldhearted, or is he holding it all in? I honestly cannot fathom what goes on inside this man. Still, the fact that he never once loses his composure is impressive in its own right.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r140","rowIndex":140,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　一方私はそうはいかない。","en":"I cannot say the same.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r141","rowIndex":141,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　全身に変な汗をかいている。いや、ヌルヌル濡れてるのはいつものことだけど、それ以外の冷や汗も流れ出ているんだ。目の前がぐるぐるする。<tips=10>見土</tips>さんが、<tips=10>見土</tips>さんが、と、心のなかで意味のない言葉が繰り返される。きっと血圧もあがっているに違いない。","en":"I’m breaking out in a strange sweat all over. I mean, being wet and slimy is normal for me, but now another kind of sweat—a cold sweat—is pouring out too. Everything before my eyes is spinning. <tips=10>Mr. Mido</tips>... <tips=10>Mr. Mido</tips>... The meaningless words repeat inside my head. My blood pressure must be rising too.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r142","rowIndex":142,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「大丈夫かい？」","en":"“Are you all right?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r143","rowIndex":143,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　よほどひどかったらしく、<tips=81>龍頭</tips>は怪訝な顔で心配してくれる。","en":"I must look terrible, because the <tips=81>Longtou</tips> gives me a puzzled, concerned look.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r144","rowIndex":144,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「だ、大丈夫ですっ」","en":"“I-I’m fine!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r145","rowIndex":145,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　言いながら私はドキドキと拍動が乱れている胸に手を当て、深呼吸をする。","en":"As I speak, I press a hand to my chest, where my heart is hammering out an erratic rhythm, and take a deep breath.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r146","rowIndex":146,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そう、落ち着かなくちゃいけない。一体何を動揺しているというんだい？　死んだ人間が生き返ったのなら驚かなくちゃいけないけれど、生きているものが死ぬのは当然のことだ。この地球のどこかでは、こうしている一分一秒にも人がばたばたと死んでいる。小さな子供から、老人まで。それが、たまたま自分の近くで起こっただけじゃないか。","en":"Yes. I have to calm down. What am I so shaken about? If a dead person returned to life, surprise would be warranted. But living things die. That is natural. Somewhere upon this earth, people are dropping dead with every passing minute and second, from tiny children to the elderly. This death merely happened close to me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r147","rowIndex":147,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そりゃ<tips=10>見土</tips>さんは会話も交わしたし、いろいろと助けてもらったし、好感も持っている。でも、私にそんなに動揺する権利があるだろうか？　そんなに親しかったろうか？","en":"Yes, I spoke with Mr. <tips=10>Mido</tips>, received all kinds of help from him, and liked him. But do I have the right to be this upset? Were we truly so close?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r148","rowIndex":148,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そもそも<tips=10>見土</tips>さん自身も<tips=47>解放軍</tips>のリーダーとして、沢山の人の死に関わっている。彼が襲った病院の人に殺されたというのなら、単に因果がめぐっただけのことだ。例えば隣の家の火事が延焼して巻き添えで死ぬような理不尽なケースよりも、よほど理屈にあっている。","en":"Besides, as leader of the <tips=47>Liberation Army</tips>, Mr. <tips=10>Mido</tips> was himself implicated in many deaths. If someone from the hospital he attacked killed him, then cause and consequence have merely come full circle. It is far more comprehensible than some senseless misfortune, like dying when a fire spreads from the house next door.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r149","rowIndex":149,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　病院襲撃だけじゃない。フェルナンデス家の襲撃でだってリーダーを務めた。その活躍を伝え聞く限りでは、そこで少なくとも四人は殺している。これが彼の全ての戦果だとしても、1デスで4キルならばキルレ的にはとても優秀な結果だ。しかも、実際には多分これよりもっと高くなる。数値的に考えても褒められこそすれ悲しむような戦果じゃない。去年のクラン戦の私は1．8でもかなり活躍したほうだったもんな。――って、私はなんの話をしているんだ？","en":"The hospital attack was not the only one. He also led the assault on the Fernandes family. From the reports of his exploits there, he killed at least four people. Even if that represented his entire record, four kills to one death is an excellent K/D. In reality, the ratio is probably higher still. Considered numerically, his performance deserves praise, not grief. I did quite well in last year’s clan match, and my K/D was only 1.8.—What in the world am I talking about?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r150","rowIndex":150,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　動揺している場合じゃない。<tips=10>見土</tips>さんの死は、単なる悲しみや感傷のほかにも、もっと大事な意味があるはずだ。そのことをよく考えなきゃいけない。","en":"This is no time to sit here reeling. <tips=10>Mr. Mido’s</tips> death must have consequences more important than my own grief and sentiment. Those are what I need to think through.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r151","rowIndex":151,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そうやって、普遍化してみたり、思考の焦点をずらしてみたり、いろいろしているうちに少し落ち着いて来た。","en":"By universalizing it, shifting the focus of my thoughts, and trying one thing after another, I gradually begin to calm down.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r152","rowIndex":152,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　呼吸が整いはじめ、心は冷静さを取り戻す。","en":"My breathing steadies, and my mind recovers its composure.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r153","rowIndex":153,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私の精神がもともと薄情に出来ていて助かった。あの笑顔の素敵な<tips=10>見土</tips>さんが死んだのは確かに悲しいが、しかしもっと大事な、そう、<tips=44>筱喬</tips>のことをまず考えなきゃいけないんだ。","en":"Luckily, my mind was built coldhearted from the start. The death of <tips=10>Mr. Mido</tips>, with that lovely smile of his, is undeniably sad. But first, I have to think about something more important. Yes—<tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r154","rowIndex":154,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=10>見土</tips>さんが死んで彼女はとても悲しんでいるに違いない。そして、それだけじゃない。<tips=10>見土</tips>さんが最大の保護者だったから、単なる感情の問題だけではないんだ。","en":"She must be terribly grieved by <tips=10>Mr. Mido’s</tips> death. And that isn’t all. <tips=10>Mr. Mido</tips> was her principal protector, so this is not merely an emotional problem.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r155","rowIndex":155,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あの、そういえば、<tips=81>龍頭</tips>……」","en":"“Um, now that I think of it, Lord <tips=81>Longtou</tips>...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r156","rowIndex":156,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は顔をあげて彼の方を見た。","en":"I raise my face toward him.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r157","rowIndex":157,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=81>龍頭</tips>は教科書の太宰治の写真みたいに机に頬杖をついて、私の様子を物憂げに見守っている。","en":"The <tips=81>Longtou</tips> rests his cheek upon one hand like the familiar textbook photograph of Osamu Dazai and watches me with melancholy.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r158","rowIndex":158,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「前に私は<tips=44>筱喬</tips>を外に連れ出したあとどこへ行ったか知らないって言ったんですが、本当は、知っているんです」","en":"“I told you before that after I took <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> outside, I didn’t know where she went. The truth is, I do know.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r159","rowIndex":159,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その言葉に、<tips=81>龍頭</tips>は目を細める。","en":"The <tips=81>Longtou</tips> narrows his eyes at that.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r160","rowIndex":160,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あの子、<tips=10>見土</tips>さんのことが好きになっちゃって、そ、それで、あの、<tips=10>見土</tips>さんの住んでるところにいるんです」","en":"“She fell in love with Mr. <tips=10>Mido</tips>, a-and, um, she’s living at Mr. <tips=10>Mido’s</tips> place.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r161","rowIndex":161,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しどろもどろになってしまう私に、<tips=81>龍頭</tips>は眉間にしわを寄せながら、","en":"As I stumble over my words, the <tips=81>Longtou</tips> furrows his brow and—","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r162","rowIndex":162,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「やっぱりそうか……」","en":"“So I was right...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r163","rowIndex":163,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　と、口のなかで小さく呟いた。思ったより驚きが小さい。というか、「やっぱり」？","en":"he murmurs under his breath. He seems much less surprised than I expected. But wait—“right”?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r164","rowIndex":164,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「とりあえず、順を追って話して貰えるかい？」","en":"“For now, could you start at the beginning and tell me what happened?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r165","rowIndex":165,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=81>龍頭</tips>は冷静に促す。","en":"The <tips=81>Longtou</tips> calmly prompts me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r166","rowIndex":166,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「は、はい」","en":"“Y-yes.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r167","rowIndex":167,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は言うべきことを頭のなかで整理してから、もう一度口を開いた。","en":"I organize what I need to tell him inside my head, then begin again.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r168","rowIndex":168,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あの、実はあの子はもう発症しているんです。私と二人でいるときに突然おかしくなっちゃって、でも<tips=81>龍頭</tips>の妹が発症したということが<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>の人たちに知られたらまずいというのは聞いていたから、<tips=10>見土</tips>さんに相談して……いや、<tips=10>見土</tips>さんが<tips=21>八龍会</tips>の人だっていうのは知っていたんですけれど、当時は別に幹部ではなかったし、きっと<tips=17>タイプB</tips>に詳しいと思ったので……」","en":"“Um, the truth is, she’s already developed symptoms. She suddenly started acting strangely while it was just the two of us, but I’d heard it would be dangerous if the people in <tips=7>YS</tips> learned that the <tips=81>Longtou’s</tips> sister had developed symptoms, so I went to <tips=10>Mr. Mido</tips> for advice... I mean, I did know <tips=10>Mr. Mido</tips> was with the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips>, but he wasn’t an officer at the time, and I thought he was bound to know a great deal about <tips=17>Type Bs</tips>...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r169","rowIndex":169,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=81>龍頭</tips>は表情一つ変えずに聞いている。妹が発症していたという衝撃の事実をどう受け止めたのかはわからない。","en":"The <tips=81>Longtou</tips> listens without the slightest change of expression. I cannot tell what he makes of the shocking revelation that his sister had already developed symptoms.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r170","rowIndex":170,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は続ける。","en":"I continue.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r171","rowIndex":171,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうしたら<tips=10>見土</tips>さんが状態を見てくれるということになって、私が雨の中ひとっ飛びして彼を<tips=44>筱喬</tips>の部屋まで連れて来て……」","en":"“<tips=10>Mr. Mido</tips> agreed to examine her condition, so I made one quick flight through the rain and brought him to <tips=44>Siu-kiu’s</tips> room...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r172","rowIndex":172,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして私は、彼が『<tips=46>ネオ・ローズ</tips>』を投与して<tips=44>筱喬</tips>の正気を取り戻してくれたことを説明した。","en":"Then I explain how he administered <tips=46>Neo Rose</tips> and restored <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> to sanity.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r173","rowIndex":173,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そのときのことがきっかけで、あの子は<tips=10>見土</tips>さんのことが好きになっちゃって……」","en":"“That was what made her fall in love with <tips=10>Mr. Mido</tips>...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r174","rowIndex":174,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「わかった。それできみと一芝居うって、このビルを飛び出し、あいつのところに転がり込んだというわけだね」","en":"“I see. So the two of you staged that little performance, she fled the building, and then went straight to him for shelter.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r175","rowIndex":175,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「お察しのとおりです」","en":"“Exactly.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r176","rowIndex":176,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は肩をすくめた。","en":"I shrug.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r177","rowIndex":177,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>の<tips=81>龍頭</tips>の肉親を、敵対組織である<tips=21>八龍会</tips>の人間に売り渡すようなことをしてしまったわけです。ひどいことをしてしまったのは理解しています。罰があるならなんでも受けます」","en":"“What I did amounted to selling a blood relative of <tips=7>YS’s</tips> <tips=81>Longtou</tips> into the hands of a member of the hostile <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips>. I understand that I did something terrible. If I must be punished, I will accept any punishment.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r178","rowIndex":178,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「確かに<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>の人間がやったのなら問題だが、そのときのきみは我々の組織とはなんの関係もなく、ただ<tips=44>筱喬</tips>の友人としてその望みをかなえただけだ。私が罰する筋合いはない」","en":"“It would certainly be a problem if a member of <tips=7>YS</tips> had done so. But at the time, you had no connection whatsoever to our organization. You merely fulfilled <tips=44>Siu-kiu’s</tips> wish as her friend. I have no grounds to punish you.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r179","rowIndex":179,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　龍頭はそう言った。<tips=44>筱喬</tips>や親しい人間の前では”僕”を使う彼が、“私”という一人称を使うのは<tips=81>龍頭</tips>として発言をしていることを意味している。","en":"The Longtou speaks those words in his official capacity. Around <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> and others close to him, he refers to himself with the familiar “boku.” His choice of the more formal “watashi” here means that he is speaking as the <tips=81>Longtou</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r180","rowIndex":180,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そして<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>に入った今、こうして自分から話してくれた。不問にするが、このことが他の者に知られれば面倒なことになる。ここは私の胸に納めておくことにする。きみもけして口外するな」","en":"“And now that you have joined <tips=7>YS</tips>, you have told me of your own accord. I will let the matter pass, but if anyone else learns of it, things will become troublesome. I will keep this to myself. You must never disclose it either.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r181","rowIndex":181,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「わかりました。……でも、さっき『やっぱり』とおっしゃいましたけど、<tips=10>見土</tips>さんのところにいると予想してたんですか？」","en":"“Understood. ...But you said ‘So I was right’ just now. Did you suspect she was staying with Mr. <tips=10>Mido</tips>?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r182","rowIndex":182,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そりゃね。そういう可能性もあると思ったから、きみを呼んでわざわざ<tips=10>見土</tips>の死を伝えたんだ」","en":"“Of course. I thought that was a possibility, which is why I called you here specifically to tell you of <tips=10>Mido’s</tips> death.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r183","rowIndex":183,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼は溜息をつき、","en":"He sighs,","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r184","rowIndex":184,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=17>タイプB</tips>がこの街で生きて行こうとすれば必然的に<tips=21>八龍会</tips>に近づくことになるだろうし、そうしたら<tips=10>見土道夫</tips>とも接触するだろう。そして彼に相談すれば、その性格からして自分で匿うと言うはずだ。それに、きみは行方不明になった<tips=44>筱喬</tips>の心配をするそぶりを見せなかった。ということは、きみは<tips=44>筱喬</tips>のいる場所を知っていて、そこがよほど安全だということだろう。まあ、予想出来なくはないのさ。出来ればそうであって欲しくなかったけれどね」","en":"“If a <tips=17>Type B</tips> tried to make a life in this city, she would inevitably gravitate toward the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips>, which would bring her into contact with <tips=10>Michio Mido</tips>. And knowing his character, if she went to him for advice, he would insist on sheltering her himself. Then there was you: you showed no sign of concern for the missing <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips>. That could only mean you knew where <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> was and believed her to be somewhere exceptionally safe. It was not so difficult a possibility to infer. I only wish it had not been the truth.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r185","rowIndex":185,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=81>龍頭</tips>は呆れたように肩をすくめ、","en":"The <tips=81>Longtou</tips> shrugs in exasperation and—","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r186","rowIndex":186,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それで、<tips=44>筱喬</tips>はやつのところに転がり込んで、今はどういう状況で生活をしているんだ？　まさか、<tips=81>龍頭</tips>の妹だとあきらかにして暮らしているわけでもあるまい」","en":"“So <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> went to him for shelter. Under what circumstances has she been living there? Surely she has not been openly presenting herself as the <tips=81>Longtou’s</tips> sister.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r187","rowIndex":187,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そこで私は彼に問われるまま<tips=44>筱喬</tips>の状況を説明した。","en":"I answer his questions and explain <tips=44>Siu-kiu’s</tips> present circumstances.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r188","rowIndex":188,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　と言っても、語るべきことはそれほど多くはない。名前を変え、素性を隠し、日本人の<tips=17>タイプB</tips>として<tips=10>見土</tips>さんの家で生活を送っていること。ほかの<tips=21>八龍会</tips>のメンバーとはさほど交流もなく、同じマンションですれ違ったりするときに挨拶をする程度であること。最近は、<tips=10>見土</tips>さんの恋人として認識されはじめているらしいこと。二人は仲睦まじく、私に送ってくるメールにもそれがあらわれている。","en":"There is not, in fact, all that much to tell. That she changed her name, hid her background, and is living as a Japanese <tips=17>Type B</tips> in <tips=10>Mr. Mido’s</tips> home. That she has little contact with the other members of the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips>, merely exchanging greetings when they pass one another in the apartment building. That recently, she apparently has begun to be recognized as <tips=10>Mr. Mido’s</tips> girlfriend. The two are deeply affectionate, and it shows even in the emails she sends me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r189","rowIndex":189,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まるで新婚夫婦のように、だって？」","en":"“Like newlyweds, you said?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r190","rowIndex":190,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私の言った言葉を繰り返す<tips=81>龍頭</tips>に、うなずいてみせる。","en":"The <tips=81>Longtou</tips> repeats my words, and I nod.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r191","rowIndex":191,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まったく、いい気なもんだ」","en":"“Honestly. Must be nice.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r192","rowIndex":192,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　頭痛を堪えるようにこめかみをおさえた。","en":"He presses his temple as though enduring a headache.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r193","rowIndex":193,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あの子はきっと、いまとても取り乱しているはずです。これ以上何もなければ、すぐに駆けつけたいんですが……。いいですか？」","en":"“She must be terribly distraught now. If there is nothing else, I’d like to go to her immediately. May I?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r194","rowIndex":194,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうだろうね。そう言うと思っていた。それで、私からきみに一つ頼みがあるんだが」","en":"“I thought so. I knew you would say that. So I have one request of you.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r195","rowIndex":195,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なんでしょう？」","en":"“What is it?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r196","rowIndex":196,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　やっぱり冷静だな、と思いながら問い返す。","en":"Still marveling at his composure, I ask him what it is.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r197","rowIndex":197,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「これは<tips=81>龍頭</tips>としての命令ではあるが、むしろ個人的な頼みに近いかもしれない。つまり、断るのは自由だ」","en":"“This is an order from me as <tips=81>Longtou</tips>, but it may be closer to a personal request. In other words, you are free to refuse.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r198","rowIndex":198,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「わかりました。伺います」","en":"“Understood. I’m listening.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r199","rowIndex":199,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「うん」","en":"“Yes.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r200","rowIndex":200,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼は頷き、","en":"He nods, then—","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r201","rowIndex":201,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=44>筱喬</tips>を<tips=10>道夫</tips>のマンションから連れ出してやって欲しい。そして、ここへ連れて来るんだ」","en":"“I want you to take <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> away from <tips=10>Michio’s</tips> apartment. And bring her here.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r202","rowIndex":202,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……わかりました。<tips=44>筱喬</tips>はまたここで暮らすんですね？」","en":"“...Understood. <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> will be living here again, then?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r203","rowIndex":203,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いや、違う」","en":"“No. That is not what I mean.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r204","rowIndex":204,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼は首を横に振り、","en":"He shakes his head.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r205","rowIndex":205,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「彼女には、街の外で暮らして貰う」","en":"“I mean to have her live outside the city.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r206","rowIndex":206,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「えっ」","en":"“What?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r207","rowIndex":207,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私はうっかり大きな声を出してしまったのに気付き、トーンを落としてから、","en":"I realize I have carelessly raised my voice, lower it, and—","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r208","rowIndex":208,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「やっぱり、追放とかそういう……？」","en":"“You mean she’s being banished, or something like that...?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r209","rowIndex":209,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうじゃない。元々、このビルで暮らすのはよくないと思っていたんだ。あいつは街の外で組織とは無関係に生きた方が良い」","en":"“No. I had always thought living in this building was bad for her. She would be better off living outside the city, with no connection to the organization.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r210","rowIndex":210,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「でも、どこへ……？」","en":"“But where...?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r211","rowIndex":211,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「その場所は決めてある。あとで伝える」","en":"“I have already decided on the place. I will tell you later.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r212","rowIndex":212,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=81>龍頭</tips>の声は冷たく響く。もしかして、私が考えていたより、妹がかわいくないのだろうか？","en":"The <tips=81>Longtou’s</tips> voice rings cold. Perhaps his sister is less dear to him than I thought?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r213","rowIndex":213,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「本来なら僕が説得するのが筋かもしれないけれど、おそらく僕が話したら逆効果だろう。それに、そうでなくても僕の言い方だといつもあいつの神経を逆なでしてしまうんでね。きみの言うことなら素直に聞くかもしれない」","en":"“Perhaps I ought to be the one to persuade her, but speaking to her myself would probably have the opposite effect. Even at the best of times, the way I put things only gets on her nerves. She may be willing to listen to you without digging in her heels.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r214","rowIndex":214,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「私の説得にも応じてくれるかわかりませんけど。……頑固な子ですから」","en":"“I don’t know whether she’ll listen to me either. ...She’s a stubborn girl.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r215","rowIndex":215,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「わかってる。でも、きみしか頼める相手がいないんだ」","en":"“I know. But there is no one else I can ask.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r216","rowIndex":216,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=81>龍頭</tips>はそう言って、溜息をついた。","en":"The <tips=81>Longtou</tips> says it and sighs.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r217","rowIndex":217,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　どういうつもりなのかな？　と思いながらその顔をじっと見ていると、その目の下が不自然な肌色になっていることに気がついた。目の下に何かファンデーションのようなものを塗っている？","en":"Wondering what he is really thinking, I study his face and notice that the skin beneath his eyes has an unnatural flesh tone. Has he applied something like foundation there?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r218","rowIndex":218,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　くまでも隠しているのだろうか？　そう言えば、顔つきがどこかやつれているようにも思える。","en":"Is he concealing dark circles? Come to think of it, his face seems somewhat haggard.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r219","rowIndex":219,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　いつも通りに見えていて、<tips=81>龍頭</tips>のような強い人でも消耗しているのかもしれない。意外な弱さを見た気がして、少しどきっとした。","en":"He appears the same as ever, yet perhaps even someone as strong as the <tips=81>Longtou</tips> is being worn down. The unexpected glimpse of vulnerability gives me a small jolt.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r220","rowIndex":220,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=44>シウ</tips>にも<tips=44>シウ</tips>の人生がある。あまりああしろこうしろと言いたくないが、どうか説得してほしい。頑固なやつだから、骨が折れるかもしれないけれど」","en":"“<tips=44>Siu</tips> has a life of her own. I do not want to keep telling <tips=44>Siu</tips> what she should or should not do, but please—try to persuade her. She is stubborn, so it may not be easy.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r221","rowIndex":221,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=81>龍頭</tips>はいつも通りの冷静な声ではあるが、言っている内容はいつものような歯切れの良いものではない。私にこんなふうに頼むなんて、よっぽどのことだ。","en":"The <tips=81>Longtou’s</tips> voice is as calm as ever, but his words lack their usual clean decisiveness. For him to plead with me this way, he must be at the end of his rope.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r222","rowIndex":222,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ああ、やっぱり妹は特別なんだな。","en":"Ah. So his sister really is special to him.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r223","rowIndex":223,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　こんな風に話す彼を見たのははじめてで、私はそう実感した。","en":"This is the first time I have seen him speak this way, and it brings the truth home to me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r224","rowIndex":224,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「わかりました」","en":"“Understood.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r225","rowIndex":225,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は頷き、","en":"I nod.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r226","rowIndex":226,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ただ、一つだけ相談が……」","en":"“There is just one thing I would like to discuss...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r227","rowIndex":227,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして私は、今思い付いたことを彼に提案した。","en":"And then I put to him an idea that has only just occurred to me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r228","rowIndex":228,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=81>龍頭</tips>との会談が終わると、私はすぐに<tips=41>グランドタワー</tips>の屋上から飛び立った。","en":"When my meeting with the <tips=81>Longtou</tips> ends, I immediately take off from the roof of <tips=41>Grand Tower</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r229","rowIndex":229,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　よく晴れており、地上の人が見上げれば容易に私を見つけることが出来るだろう。だけれど私は少しでも早く<tips=44>筱喬</tips>のもとに駆けつけて、彼女に会いたかった。","en":"The sky is perfectly clear; anyone on the ground need only look up to spot me. But I want to reach <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips>—to see her—even one moment sooner.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r230","rowIndex":230,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=81>龍頭</tips>の話を聞いて胸騒ぎがしている。","en":"The <tips=81>Longtou’s</tips> story has filled me with foreboding.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r231","rowIndex":231,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=10>見土</tips>さんがいなくなって、彼女の立場がどう変わるのか、それは私にもわからない。","en":"Now that Mr. <tips=10>Mido</tips> is gone, I do not know how her position will change.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r232","rowIndex":232,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=44>筱喬</tips>は<tips=21>八龍会</tips>の重要人物が多く住むマンションに暮らしている。彼らとは頻繁に挨拶をし、うまくやっているようだけれど、突然やってきた謎の女性に少なからず不思議な印象はあるだろう。<tips=10>見土</tips>さんがこうして死んでしまえば、その不思議が不審に変わるかも知れない。そして何よりも、今の<tips=21>八龍会</tips>には<tips=44>筱喬</tips>の素性を知る人物がいる。<tips=10>見土</tips>さんや<tips=81>龍頭</tips>の友人であり、<tips=21>八龍会</tips>の一員でもある<tips=66>田中紺太</tips>だ。彼がまっさきに<tips=44>筱喬</tips>を疑うかもしれない。","en":"<tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> lives in an apartment building that is home to many important figures in the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips>. She frequently exchanges greetings with them and seems to get along well, but a mysterious woman who appeared out of nowhere must have left them at least somewhat puzzled. Now that <tips=10>Mr. Mido</tips> has died, that puzzlement may turn to suspicion. More importantly, the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips> now has someone who knows <tips=44>Siu-kiu’s</tips> true identity. A friend of <tips=10>Mr. Mido</tips> and the <tips=81>Longtou</tips>, and himself a member of the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips>: <tips=66>Konta Tanaka</tips>. He may be the first to suspect <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r233","rowIndex":233,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=81>龍頭</tips>が<tips=21>八龍会</tips>に<tips=44>筱喬</tips>を置いておきたくないと言った真意はそれとは違うかも知れないが、確かに、<tips=44>筱喬</tips>をこのままあそこに置いておくのは心配だ。私は<tips=10>見土</tips>さんが死んだという事実へのショックが大きすぎて、さっきはわからなかったが、改めて考えるとよくわかる。あの子は、<tips=10>見土</tips>さんがいた<tips=21>八龍会</tips>に残りたいと言うかも知れないけれど、頑張って説得して、連れ出さなければ。","en":"The <tips=81>Longtou’s</tips> true reason for wanting <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> out of the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips> may be different, but there is no denying the danger of leaving <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> where she is. The shock of learning that <tips=10>Mr. Mido</tips> was dead kept me from seeing it a moment ago; now that I consider the matter again, it is obvious. She may insist on remaining with the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips> because it was <tips=10>Mr. Mido’s</tips> home, but I must do everything I can to persuade her and get her out.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r234","rowIndex":234,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　――それにしても、あの<tips=81>龍頭</tips>があんなに困った顔をしているのを見たのは初めてだな。","en":"Still, I had never seen the <tips=81>Longtou</tips> look so troubled.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r235","rowIndex":235,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>の問題について語ったり、指示を下すときはどんな内容でも冷静で、時に薄笑いすら浮かべているのに。苦り切ったあの顔は、どこにでもいる普通のお兄ちゃんだった。まあ、私はそんなに普通のお兄ちゃんを見たことがないけれども。","en":"When discussing <tips=7>YS’s</tips> problems or issuing instructions, he remains calm no matter the subject, sometimes even wearing a faint smile. That bitter face belonged to an ordinary older brother one could find anywhere. Admittedly, I have not seen very many ordinary older brothers.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r236","rowIndex":236,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　とりあえず、さっきの彼は、<tips=44>筱喬</tips>がよく語っていた『優しいお兄ちゃん』と合致する。","en":"At any rate, the way he was just now matches the “kind older brother” <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> often described.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r237","rowIndex":237,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　あれが、普段妹に見せている顔なんだろう。","en":"That must be the face he ordinarily shows his sister.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r238","rowIndex":238,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　考えてみれば、あの兄妹はお父さんもお母さんも死んじゃって、二人きりの肉親なんだな。","en":"Now that I think about it, both their father and mother are dead. Brother and sister are one another’s only remaining blood relatives.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r239","rowIndex":239,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そしてお兄さんは命を狙ってくるようなたくさんの敵に囲まれながらお父さんの仕事を一人で切り盛りし、妹は不治の病に冒されている。","en":"And the older brother manages their father’s work alone while surrounded by countless enemies seeking his life, while the younger sister suffers from an incurable disease.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r240","rowIndex":240,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　両親が老舗のそば屋を経営し、どう転んでも最後はあの部屋にひきこもればいい私とは対等のステージで生きていないのだ。こうして<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>に入ったからと言って、私の本質は変わったようには思えない。おままごとをしているようなものだ。","en":"They and I do not live on anything like the same plane. My parents run a long-established soba restaurant, and no matter how badly things turn out, I can always retreat to that room and shut myself away again. Merely joining <tips=7>YS</tips> does not seem to have changed what I am. Compared with them, I am only playing make-believe.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r241","rowIndex":241,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=10>見土</tips>さんも、殺されてしまった。","en":"<tips=10>Mr. Mido</tips> was killed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r242","rowIndex":242,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しかも暗殺だと言う。彼が死ぬことを誰かが強く願い、それが実行されたということだ。","en":"Assassinated, they say. Someone wanted him dead intensely enough to make it happen.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r243","rowIndex":243,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そんなこと、普通に生きていて滅多に遭遇することじゃない。","en":"It is not the sort of thing one expects ever to encounter in the course of an ordinary life.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r244","rowIndex":244,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　でも、ここではそれが現実なんだ。人は銃をとって殺し合う。私は確かに戦って、足を一本なくした。<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>のみんなはそれを褒めてくれるけど、でもスタートラインにも立っていないような気がする。","en":"But here, it is reality. People take up guns and kill one another. I truly fought and lost one leg. Everyone in <tips=7>YS</tips> praises me for it, yet I feel as though I have not even reached the starting line.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r245","rowIndex":245,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　殺し合うというのはどんな気持ちで臨めばいいのだろう？","en":"What state of mind does one need in order to kill and be killed?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r246","rowIndex":246,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は毎日銃で殺し合うゲームで遊んでいた。よくああいうのをやると、現実と区別がつかなくなって簡単に争うようになるというけれども、私はそうは思わなかった。","en":"Every day, I played games in which people killed one another with guns. People often say those games make players unable to distinguish fantasy from reality and quick to resort to violence, but I never believed that.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r247","rowIndex":247,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　リアル系のゲームでは、本当にちょっとした不注意で死んでしまうことがある。そして、どんなにうまいプレイヤーでも死ぬときは簡単に死ぬ。ゲームだったらやり直せば良いが、現実では一回死んだら終わりだ。","en":"In realistic games, the slightest carelessness can kill you. And no matter how skilled a player may be, sometimes they die with absurd ease. In a game, you simply start again. In reality, death happens only once, and then it is over.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r248","rowIndex":248,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　リアルの戦場になんか絶対に行きたくない、とゲームをやりながらつくづく思ったものだ。","en":"As I played, I often thought with perfect sincerity that I never, ever wanted to enter a real battlefield.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r249","rowIndex":249,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　でも気がついたら、そのリアルの戦場に迷い込んでいる。そして殺したり殺されたりする人たちと関わっている。なぜか不思議と怖くない。私は少しおかしいのだろうか？　<tips=10>見土</tips>さんが死んだことも、早くも過去の出来事になりつつある――。","en":"Yet before I knew it, I had wandered onto that real battlefield. Now I am involved with people who kill and are killed. Strangely, I feel no fear. Is there something a little wrong with me? <tips=10>Mr. Mido’s</tips> death is already beginning to recede into the past.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r250","rowIndex":250,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　もし<tips=44>筱喬</tips>がひどい目にあって、それでも私はすぐに慣れてしまうのだろうか。そうだとしたら、それはとても悲しいことだ。","en":"If something terrible happened to <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips>, would I quickly grow accustomed to that too? If so, it would be terribly sad.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r251","rowIndex":251,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　人は錯覚の世界に住んでいる。いや違うな。正確には『どんなやりかたでも確証を得ることの出来ない感覚の世界に住んでいる』。","en":"Human beings live in a world of illusion. No, that is not correct. More precisely, we live in ‘a world of sensation in which no method can provide certainty.’","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r252","rowIndex":252,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その観念が私の心を芯まで侵蝕している。よくある懐疑主義や冷笑主義のなれのはてでダサいってわかってるんだけれども振り払えない。これをうまく忘れないと、私は心から悲しんだり喜んだりすることが出来ないのかもしれない。","en":"That idea has eaten its way into the very core of my heart. I know it is nothing but the embarrassingly trite endpoint of skepticism and cynicism, yet I cannot shake myself free of it. Unless I can learn to forget it when I need to, perhaps I will never be able to grieve or rejoice with my whole heart.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r253","rowIndex":253,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　とめどもなく余計なことを考えてしまうのは私のよくないところだ。およそ今の状況に似つかわしくない。ハマってない。もっと状況にあったことを考えていかないと、自分の人生を生きることが出来ないな。だって、目の前のことを考えないってことは、それはもう妄想だけに囲まれていても同じってことになってしまう。","en":"One of my worst habits is letting needless thoughts run on without end. They are utterly out of place in my present situation. I am out of step with it. Unless I turn my mind to what my actual circumstances demand, I will never manage to live my own life. After all, refusing to think about what is right in front of me is no different from shutting myself away among fantasies again.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r254","rowIndex":254,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　好きでも嫌いでもせっかく自分として生まれついたのに、それもやっぱり悲しいことだ。","en":"For better or worse, I was born as myself. It would be terribly sad if I failed even to live that life as my own.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r255","rowIndex":255,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そんなことを考えながら、私は<tips=44>筱喬</tips>のいるマンションに辿り着いた。","en":"Thinking about such things, I arrive at the apartment building where <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> lives.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r256","rowIndex":256,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=10>見土</tips>さんの――今は主人がいなくなったその部屋の窓にはカーテンが掛かっている。外から窓ガラスをトントンと叩いても内側から返事がない。<tips=44>筱喬</tips>は気づかないんだろうか。余り長い間ここでふわふわと浮いていて、外から見つかってしまうのを考えると気分は良くない。サイキックが能力を使うと不穏な印象を与えてしまうのは、サイキックが多いこの町でも同じだ。<tips=21>八龍会</tips>の誰かに見られたら、不必要な警戒心を呼び起こさせてしまうだろう。","en":"The curtains are drawn across the windows of <tips=10>Mr. Mido’s</tips> apartment—the apartment that has now lost its master. I tap lightly on the glass from outside, but no answer comes. Has <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> not noticed me? I do not relish the thought of hovering here long enough for someone outside to spot me. Even in this city, where psychics are common, seeing one openly use a power inspires unease. If someone from the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips> saw me, I might put them needlessly on guard.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r257","rowIndex":257,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は屋上に移動してそっと着地する。屋上の固い床材の感触がスニーカー越しに足の裏に伝わる。","en":"I drift up to the roof and touch down gently. Through my sneaker, I feel the hardness of the rooftop beneath the sole of my foot.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r258","rowIndex":258,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　最近飛んで移動過ぎるのになれすぎたせいで足で体重を支えることにむしろ違和感がある。そして義足での歩行はもどかしい。マンション内では能力を隠した方が良いとは思うのだけれど、結局そのもどかしさに負けて少し身体を浮かせることにした。","en":"Lately, I have grown so accustomed to flying everywhere that supporting my weight upon my feet feels stranger. Walking with the prosthesis is painfully slow. I think it best to conceal my ability inside the apartment building, but in the end, impatience defeats me, and I float my body slightly above the floor.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r259","rowIndex":259,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　地上すれすれをすーっと移動するのは自分でも白昼の幽霊になったような気分だ。知らない人が見たら驚くだろう。","en":"Gliding barely above the floor makes me feel like a ghost in broad daylight. A stranger would be startled to see me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r260","rowIndex":260,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　鍵がかかっていたら面倒なことになると思っていたが、屋上から室内に入るドアはガチャリとノブをひねるとそのまま開いてくれる。","en":"I expected trouble if the door were locked, but when I turn the knob with a click, the door from the rooftop into the building opens normally.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r261","rowIndex":261,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして建物のなかへ。","en":"And inside I go.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r262","rowIndex":262,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=21>八龍会</tips>の重鎮が多く住まう、<tips=21>八龍会</tips>濃度の高いその場所に足を踏み入れるのは、正式に<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>に入れて貰ってからはじめてのことだ。","en":"So many senior figures of the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips> live here that the whole place is positively saturated with the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips>. This is the first time I have ventured inside since formally joining <tips=7>YS</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r263","rowIndex":263,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　誰かと出会い、そして私のその正体が知られればとんでもないことになるだろう。でも、私の姿を見て即座に<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>のものだと思う人もそうはいないはずだ。――と思いたいが、どうだろう？　なんと言ってもサイキックは目立つ。<tips=41>グランドタワー</tips>の近くをふわふわ飛んでいる姿を見られていたとしたら、私のことを知られていてもおかしくない。少なくとも<tips=21>八龍会</tips>にうちの<tips=81>龍頭</tips>みたいな人間がいたら、確実にその顔写真がプロフィール付きで組織の主だったものに配られているだろう。","en":"If I run into someone and they learn who I really am, it would be disastrous. Still, there can’t be many people who would take one look at me and immediately think I was with <tips=7>YS</tips>.—Or so I’d like to believe. But who knows? Psychics stand out, after all. If anyone has seen me drifting through the air near <tips=41>Grand Tower</tips>, it would be no surprise if they knew who I was. At the very least, if the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips> has someone like our <tips=81>Longtou</tips>, a photograph of my face, complete with a profile, will certainly have been circulated among the organization’s leading members.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r264","rowIndex":264,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　やっぱり能力を使わないで歩いたほうがいいかな？　とも思ったけれど、もし情報が行き渡っているなら顔を見られた時点でバレる可能性もあるんだし同じことだ。","en":"Perhaps I should walk without using my power after all. But if that information is already widespread, the moment someone sees my face, they may recognize me anyway. It makes no difference.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r265","rowIndex":265,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ああ、なんだか、考えが行ったり来たりしているなあ！","en":"Ah, my thoughts keep going back and forth!","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r266","rowIndex":266,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　とにかく誰にも会わなければいい。私は狭い廊下を壁にぶつかりそうになりながらすっ飛び、階段を急降下し、そして無事誰にも会わずに部屋の前に到着した。","en":"I simply have to avoid everyone. I rocket along the narrow corridor, nearly striking the walls, plunge down the stairs, and reach the apartment safely without meeting anyone.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r267","rowIndex":267,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ドアをノックする。そしてそっと耳を当ててみるけれども物音がしない。","en":"I knock on the door. Then I gently press my ear against it, but hear no sound.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r268","rowIndex":268,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　悲しみにくれて動けないのか、留守なのか、どっちにしろ冗談じゃない。せっかくここまで来て会えないんじゃたまらない。","en":"Is she too lost in grief to move, or is she away? Either possibility is intolerable. I came all this way. I cannot bear to miss her.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r269","rowIndex":269,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　声を出して呼びかけようか？　けれど、見知らぬ私の声が呼びかけているのをとなりの部屋などや廊下の向こうに知られたくない。しかし、ここでいつまでもドアを叩いていてもそのうち誰かが来てしまう。<tips=21>八龍会</tips>の誰かが。","en":"Should I call out? But I don’t want anyone in the neighboring apartments or farther down the hall to hear an unfamiliar voice calling. Still, if I keep knocking on this door, someone will eventually come. Someone from the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r270","rowIndex":270,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は冷や汗をかきながら、携帯電話でドアの前に来ていると<tips=44>筱喬</tips>にメールを送り、そしてまたノックした。","en":"Breaking into a cold sweat, I take out my phone and email <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> to say that I am outside her door. Then I knock again.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r271","rowIndex":271,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　すると部屋のなかでガタガタと人の動く気配がして、カチャリとノブが音を立ててドアがゆっくりと開く。","en":"At last, I hear someone moving noisily within. The knob clicks, and the door opens slowly.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r272","rowIndex":272,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ごめん、寝てたわけじゃないんだけど、少しぼうっとしてて……」","en":"“Sorry. I wasn’t sleeping, but I was a little dazed...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r273","rowIndex":273,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私を部屋に招き入れた<tips=44>筱喬</tips>は目の周りが腫れぼったくむくみ、赤くなっていた。","en":"When <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> lets me into the apartment, I see that the skin around her eyes is puffy, swollen, and red.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r274","rowIndex":274,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　部屋のなかはカーテンを閉め切った上に電灯もつけず、薄暗いままだった。こんなところに一人でいたらますます気が滅入る一方だ。私はスイッチを押し、照明で影を追い払った。","en":"The curtains are shut tight and not a single light is on, leaving the apartment in gloom. Staying alone in a place like this will only make her sink deeper into despair. I flip the switch, and the light drives the shadows away.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r275","rowIndex":275,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「アイスコーヒーがあるよ。椅子に座ってそこで待ってて」","en":"“There’s iced coffee. Sit in a chair and wait there.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r276","rowIndex":276,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女は微笑をする。その無理をした感じが痛々しい。","en":"She gives me a smile. The forced quality of it is painful to see.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r277","rowIndex":277,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いらない。それより、荷物をまとめてここを出る準備をして」","en":"“I don’t want any. More importantly, pack your things and prepare to leave.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r278","rowIndex":278,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私が立ったまま言った声は自分でも分かるくらい焦りが出ていた。","en":"I remain standing. Even I can hear the urgency in my voice.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r279","rowIndex":279,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　だけど<tips=44>筱喬</tips>は私の態度も言葉もどこ吹く風で、相変わらず微笑みを浮かべたまま、ゆらゆらとした緩慢な足取りでキッチンの方へ向かうと飲み物の準備をはじめる。","en":"But <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> pays no heed to either my manner or my words. Still wearing the same smile, she drifts toward the kitchen with slow, wavering steps and begins preparing the drink.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r280","rowIndex":280,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ねえ<tips=44>筱喬</tips>。<tips=10>見土</tips>さんがこういう形でいなくなった以上、ここにいるのは良くないの。暗殺ってことは、きっとスパイを疑うわ。そしたら、最近同居しはじめたあなたのことは絶対に調べられるし、そうしたら素性も知られて……」","en":"“Listen, <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips>. Now that Mr. <tips=10>Mido</tips> is gone this way, you shouldn’t remain here. An assassination is bound to raise suspicions of a spy. They will certainly investigate the woman who recently began living with him, and when they do, they’ll discover who you are...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r281","rowIndex":281,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=51>さくら</tips>、あのね。このコーヒー水出しなんだよ。<tips=10>見土</tips>さんが昔に買ったけど面倒で使ってなかったのを、私が引っ張り出して使ってるの」","en":"“<tips=51>Sakura</tips>, listen. This coffee is cold-brewed. <tips=10>Mr. Mido</tips> bought the equipment a long time ago, but it was too much trouble and he never used it. I dug it out and started using it.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r282","rowIndex":282,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=44>筱喬</tips>は私の言葉など聞こえないかのように、笑顔を浮かべたまま黒い液体の入ったグラスを持って来る。","en":"As though she cannot even hear me, <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> returns still smiling, carrying a glass filled with black liquid.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r283","rowIndex":283,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「抽出するのに何時間もかかるんだけど、<tips=10>見土</tips>さんは美味しい美味しいってがぶがぶ飲むから、すぐになくなっちゃうんだ」","en":"“It takes hours to brew, but <tips=10>Mr. Mido</tips> always said it was delicious and gulped it down, so it disappeared immediately.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r284","rowIndex":284,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=44>筱喬</tips>、ショックなのはわかるけど……」","en":"“<tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips>, I understand that you’re in shock, but...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r285","rowIndex":285,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「私、そんな名前じゃないよ」","en":"“That isn’t my name.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r286","rowIndex":286,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=44>筱喬</tips>の顔は笑い、穏やかな言葉遣いだけれど、感情は感じられなかった。","en":"<tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> is still smiling, and her manner of speaking remains gentle, yet I can sense no emotion behind either one.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r287","rowIndex":287,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女が私にそんな声色を使ったことはなく、私は氷を首筋にあてられたような気持ちになったが、ここで引き下がるつもりはない。私にも覚悟がある。","en":"She has never used that tone with me. It feels like ice pressed to the back of my neck, but I have no intention of retreating. I have made up my mind too.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r288","rowIndex":288,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……あなたがこのままここで<tips=44>詩由子</tips>として生きてゆくのは不可能だよ。<tips=10>見土</tips>さんが用意しようとしてくれた場所を捨てるのはいやかもしれないけど、<tips=10>見土</tips>さんだってそんなのは望んでない」","en":"“...You can’t go on living here as <tips=44>Shiyuko</tips>. You may hate to abandon the place Mr. <tips=10>Mido</tips> tried to prepare for you, but Mr. <tips=10>Mido</tips> wouldn’t want this either.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r289","rowIndex":289,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私が真顔で言うと<tips=44>筱喬</tips>は困ったような顔をして、","en":"When I say it with a serious face, <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> looks troubled.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r290","rowIndex":290,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=51>さくら</tips>はお兄ちゃんに言われてここへ来たのね？」","en":"“<tips=51>Sakura</tips>, my brother told you to come here, didn’t he?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r291","rowIndex":291,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その言葉に、私は口ごもってしまう。どう答えれば良いのだろう？　今ここで誤魔化しても、どうせすぐにばれることだ。","en":"The question makes me falter. How am I supposed to answer? There is no point trying to evade it now; the truth will come out soon enough.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r292","rowIndex":292,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　言葉が出ないでいると、彼女は続ける。","en":"As I remain speechless, she continues.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r293","rowIndex":293,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=51>さくら</tips>、私はここにいるよ。都合が悪くなったからってころころとあっちへ行ったりこっちへ行ったりはしない。……私は<tips=44>詩由子</tips>としてここで生きるよ。<tips=41>グランドタワー</tips>を出るって決めた時に決めたの。もう<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>とかお兄ちゃんの力は借りないって。そして、<tips=51>さくら</tips>にも頼らない。それをはっきり言おうと思ってた。……こんなかたちで言うことになるとは思わなかったけど」","en":"“<tips=51>Sakura</tips>, I am staying here. I will not go flitting back and forth from one place to another every time circumstances turn against me. ...I am going to live here as <tips=44>Shiyuko</tips>. I made that choice when I chose to leave <tips=41>Grand Tower</tips>: I would no longer depend on <tips=7>YS</tips> or my brother. And I would stop depending on you too, <tips=51>Sakura</tips>. I had been meaning to tell you so plainly. ...I never imagined I would have to say it under circumstances like these.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r294","rowIndex":294,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=44>筱喬</tips>は笑おうとしたが、涙がポロリとこぼれ、あわてて目を拭う。","en":"<tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> tries to smile, but a tear spills from her eye, and she hurriedly wipes it away.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r295","rowIndex":295,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ねえ<tips=51>さくら</tips>。どうして私の大事な人ってみんなすぐ死んじゃうのかなあ？」","en":"“Tell me, <tips=51>Sakura</tips>... Why does everyone I love always have to die so soon?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r296","rowIndex":296,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女は引きつった顔で俯いている。","en":"Her face drawn tight, she looks down.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r297","rowIndex":297,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ねえ<tips=44>筱喬</tips>。冷静に考えて？　あなたは一度決めたことを変えたくないのかもしれないけど、今はそれよりも安全を確保して。さっき言った通り、あなたは難しい立場になったのよ。きっと<tips=66>紺太</tips>さんあたりも疑うわ。あの人は<tips=44>筱喬</tips>の正体を知ってるからね。<tips=10>見土</tips>さんが言ったように<tips=21>八龍会</tips>にちゃんと入ればまた違ったかもしれないけど、まだだったんでしょ？　あなたは部外者で、<tips=21>八龍会</tips>はなんのためらいもなくあなたを敵に出来るの」","en":"“Listen, <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips>. Think about this calmly, all right? You may not want to change a decision once you have made it, but securing your safety matters more right now. As I said, you are in a difficult position. I’m sure even <tips=66>Konta</tips> will suspect you. He knows who <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> really is. Things might have been different if you had formally joined the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips> as Mr. <tips=10>Mido</tips> suggested, but you had not yet, had you? You are an outsider, and the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips> can make you an enemy without the slightest hesitation.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r298","rowIndex":298,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=44>筱喬</tips>は頷いてはくれなかった。涙を拭うと顔をぶんぶんと子供のような仕草で左右に振る。","en":"<tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> refuses to agree. Wiping away her tears, she shakes her head vigorously from side to side in a childlike gesture.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r299","rowIndex":299,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「もし<tips=66>紺太</tips>さんが来ても、私は本当のことを全部言うだけだよ。それで信じてくれないのなら仕方ない。だって、本当に何もしてないんだから。……それにね、ここで逃げたらかえって自分が怪しいって言うようなものじゃない。そうしたら、みんな私がスパイだったって思うでしょ？　そうしたら、私を引き入れた<tips=10>見土</tips>さんの名誉を傷つけることになる」","en":"“Even if <tips=66>Konta</tips> comes, I’ll simply tell him the whole truth. If he doesn’t believe me, then so be it. I truly haven’t done anything. ...Besides, if I run now, won’t that only make me look suspicious? Everyone will think I was a spy, won’t they? That would tarnish Mr. <tips=10>Mido’s</tips> honor for having taken me in.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r300","rowIndex":300,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そんなの<tips=10>見土</tips>さんは気にしないわ。あの人だって、きっとあなたが安全な道を選ぶことを望んでる」","en":"“Mr. <tips=10>Mido</tips> wouldn’t care about that. I’m sure he would want you to choose the safe path.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r301","rowIndex":301,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　死者の意見を勝手に代弁するのは卑怯だとは思ったけれど、今はこれしか思い付かなかった。","en":"I know it is underhanded of me to put words in a dead man’s mouth, but at that moment, it is the only argument I can think of.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r302","rowIndex":302,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=10>見土</tips>さんはあなたを守るために、色んなことをたくさんしてくれたんだよ。だから、その思いをしっかり受け止めないと……」","en":"“Mr. <tips=10>Mido</tips> did so many things to protect you. You have to honor what that meant...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r303","rowIndex":303,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「確かに<tips=10>見土</tips>さんが生きていたら望まないと思う」","en":"“You’re right. If Mr. <tips=10>Mido</tips> were alive, he wouldn’t want this.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r304","rowIndex":304,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「じゃあ……」","en":"“Then...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r305","rowIndex":305,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「でも、私はそうしたいの。<tips=10>見土</tips>さんが何を望もうと。だって、<tips=10>見土</tips>さんは死んだのだし、私にもプライドがあるんだから」","en":"“But this is what I want, whatever Mr. <tips=10>Mido</tips> might have wanted. Mr. <tips=10>Mido</tips> is dead, after all, and I have my pride too.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r306","rowIndex":306,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=44>筱喬</tips>の強い口調は意外だった。その言い分は、どことなく<tips=1>亮</tips>さんを思い出させる。ああ、やっぱりこの子はこんなようでも謝家の娘なんだ。","en":"<tips=44>Siu-kiu’s</tips> forceful tone surprises me. Something about her argument reminds me of <tips=1>Leung</tips>. Ah, however she may seem, she really is a daughter of the Tse family.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r307","rowIndex":307,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は彼女を見直させられるような思いがしたが、しかし、屈するわけにはいかない。","en":"I feel newfound respect for her, but I cannot yield.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r308","rowIndex":308,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……ねえ、もしかして、<tips=10>見土</tips>さんが殺されたのはお兄さんの仕業だと思ってる？」","en":"“...Tell me, do you perhaps think your brother had Mr. <tips=10>Mido</tips> killed?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r309","rowIndex":309,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私はじっと見つめて言った。<tips=44>筱喬</tips>は言葉をつまらせる。","en":"I stare directly at her as I say it. <tips=44>Siu-kiu’s</tips> words catch in her throat.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r310","rowIndex":310,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それで、お兄さんに怒ってるんじゃない？　だから、その部下になった私の言葉を聞きたくないんだ」","en":"“You’re angry with your brother over it, aren’t you? That’s why you don’t want to listen to me now that I work for him.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r311","rowIndex":311,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女の図星をついたらしい。","en":"I seem to have hit the mark.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r312","rowIndex":312,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=44>筱喬</tips>は困ったような顔をしながら口を開く。","en":"Looking deeply troubled, <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> finally answers.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r313","rowIndex":313,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「こういう状況だから、その可能性もあるよね。<tips=51>さくら</tips>は否定出来る？」","en":"“Given the situation, it is possible, isn’t it? Can you deny it, <tips=51>Sakura</tips>?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r314","rowIndex":314,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そう問われると、私も首を横には振れない。実際、私もその可能性を少しは考えていた。","en":"Confronted with the question, I cannot deny it. In truth, the same possibility had crossed my own mind.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r315","rowIndex":315,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……誤解しないでね。もしそうだとしても、お兄ちゃんを責める気はないの。でも、お兄ちゃんの言う通りには出来ない」","en":"“...Don’t misunderstand me. Even if he did it, I don’t intend to blame my brother. But I cannot do as he says.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r316","rowIndex":316,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=44>筱喬</tips>、そうとは限らないよ。だって、さっき<tips=1>亮</tips>さんと話したときは、犯人のことは知らないような感じだったし」","en":"“<tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips>, that is not necessarily so. When I spoke with <tips=1>Leung</tips> earlier, he seemed not to know who the culprit was.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r317","rowIndex":317,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ねえ<tips=51>さくら</tips>、お兄ちゃんがそう言ったとしても、その通りだとは限らないよ……」","en":"“Listen, <tips=51>Sakura</tips>. Even if my brother said that, it doesn’t necessarily mean it was true...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r318","rowIndex":318,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=44>筱喬</tips>は顔を歪めて俯く。確かに彼女の言うとおりだと、私も認めざるを得ない。","en":"<tips=44>Siu-kiu’s</tips> face contorts as she lowers her eyes. Painful though it is, I have to admit that she is right.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r319","rowIndex":319,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=44>筱喬</tips>は泣いてはいないが、苦しみを顔に浮かべている。彼女にとっては兄もまた大事な人物に違いないのだ。","en":"<tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> is not crying, but anguish shows on her face. Her brother must be someone precious to her too.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r320","rowIndex":320,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　胸が張り裂けるような思いをしている、とその顔つきから想像することは出来たが、同じ境遇になったことがない私は、例えば指先を切ったり熱湯に触れて火傷をしたときのありふれた痛みのように具体的に共感することが出来ない。","en":"From her expression, I can imagine that her heart is being torn apart. But having never endured anything like her circumstances, I cannot feel that pain with the same concrete immediacy as the ordinary sting of a cut fingertip or a burn from boiling water.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r321","rowIndex":321,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それにしても、こう拒否されたらどうすればいいのか。","en":"Even so, what am I supposed to do when she refuses like this?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r322","rowIndex":322,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　実際ここに残っても、<tips=21>八龍会</tips>で彼女がやってゆけるという可能性もゼロではないのだろう。でも、その場合でも、<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>との全面戦争になればどういう危険が待っているのかわからない。そもそも、<tips=44>筱喬</tips>自身も、残った方が危険だと考えていて、あえてそちらを選んでいるようにも見えた。兄に対する反発か、それとも<tips=10>見土</tips>さんが死んだことでやけっぱちになっているのか、それともその両方なのか。","en":"It is not entirely impossible that she could remain here and find a way to survive within the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips>. But even then, if full-scale war with <tips=7>YS</tips> breaks out, there is no telling what dangers will await her. Indeed, <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> herself seems to understand that staying is the more dangerous choice and to be choosing it for precisely that reason. Is this defiance toward her brother, despair over <tips=10>Mr. Mido’s</tips> death—or both?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r323","rowIndex":323,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　とにかく、私の意見は<tips=1>亮</tips>さんと同じで、彼女はここにいてはいけないと思う。最悪のケースを想定すると、こうしている間にも、<tips=66>田中紺太</tips>が仲間に<tips=44>筱喬</tips>のことを話し、武装してこのマンションにやって来るという可能性だってありえる。ここでモタモタしていたっていいことはない。","en":"Whatever the reason, I agree with <tips=1>Leung</tips>: she cannot be allowed to stay here. In the worst case, even as we speak, <tips=66>Konta Tanaka</tips> may be telling his comrades about <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips>, and they may already be arming themselves to come to this apartment. Every moment we waste here only makes matters worse.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r324","rowIndex":324,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　なんとしても<tips=44>筱喬</tips>を説得しなきゃいけないのに、彼女の意志は固く、それを覆すだけの説得力のある言葉が思いつかなかった。","en":"I have to persuade <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips>, no matter what it takes. Yet her resolve is firm, and I cannot find words persuasive enough to change her mind.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r325","rowIndex":325,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ねえ<tips=51>さくら</tips>。私はお兄ちゃんやみんなを裏切って<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>を出て来たんだよ。<tips=10>見土</tips>さんにも無理を言って、助けてもらった。そしていま<tips=10>見土</tips>さんが死んだからといって、お兄ちゃんに助けてもらうことなんか出来ない。私の言ってること、わかるよね？」","en":"“Listen, <tips=51>Sakura</tips>. I betrayed my brother and everyone else to leave <tips=7>YS</tips>. I imposed on Mr. <tips=10>Mido</tips> and had him help me. And now that Mr. <tips=10>Mido</tips> is dead, I cannot turn to my brother for help. You understand what I’m saying, don’t you?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r326","rowIndex":326,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　わかる。","en":"I do.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r327","rowIndex":327,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　まったくその通りだ。私だって、同じように思うだろう。<tips=44>筱喬</tips>が<tips=1>亮</tips>さんを裏切ったことを重く受け止めていて良かったというのも、偽らざる感想である。","en":"She is absolutely right. I would feel the same way. And my honest reaction is that I am glad <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> takes betraying <tips=1>Leung</tips> so seriously.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r328","rowIndex":328,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それでも、私は一緒に逃げてほしかった。ここにいるのは、どう考えたって危ないんだ。","en":"Even so, I want her to run away with me. No matter how I look at it, staying here is dangerous.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r329","rowIndex":329,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「お願い<tips=44>筱喬</tips>。あなたの気持ちは理解出来る。でも、聞いて欲しいの」","en":"“Please, <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips>. I understand how you feel. But please—hear me out.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r330","rowIndex":330,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　もう最後の手段しかない。理屈でだめなら、自分の感情を正直に伝えるしかない。","en":"Only my final resort remains. If logic will not work, I have to express my feelings honestly.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r331","rowIndex":331,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　普段はこんなやり方は好きじゃない。人に自分の赤裸々な感情をぶつけるなんていやなんだ。何故といって、あまりにもスマートじゃないし、怖いじゃないか。","en":"Ordinarily, I dislike this approach. I hate throwing my naked feelings at another person. Why? Because it isn’t remotely elegant, and because it is frightening.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r332","rowIndex":332,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ほら、<tips=44>筱喬</tips>の目を見つめる私の目は少し潤んでいる。声もちょっと震えている。これを演技と思うかい？　説得のためにそうしてるって？　でも、実際はそうじゃない。本当に緊張しているからだ。やり慣れないやりかたを初めてやって、びびってるってことなんだよね。","en":"Look. My eyes grow slightly wet as I stare into <tips=44>Siu-kiu’s</tips>. My voice trembles a little. Do you think I’m acting? That I’m performing for the sake of persuasion? But I’m not. I’m genuinely tense. I’m terrified because I am trying an unfamiliar method for the first time.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r333","rowIndex":333,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「私はあなたには無事であって欲しい。他の何かを傷つけたり、裏切ったとしても。それだけは絶対にいやなんだ！　<tips=1>亮</tips>さんも同じ気持ちだと思う。だから、私にこんなふうにこっそり頼んだんだよ。もしあなたに何かあったら、私、どうなっちゃうかわからないよ。この間まであんなに元気だった<tips=10>見土</tips>さんが死んで、あなたも同じようになるって想像したら、怖くてたまらないんだ。だから、お願い、私のためだと思って言うことを聞いて」","en":"“I want you to be safe, even if that means hurting or betraying something else. The one thing I absolutely cannot bear is anything happening to you! I think <tips=1>Leung</tips> feels the same way. That is why he secretly asked me to do this. If something happened to you, I don’t know what I would become. Mr. <tips=10>Mido</tips> was so full of life until just recently, and then he died. Imagining the same thing happening to you terrifies me. So please—do as I say, if only for my sake.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r334","rowIndex":334,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私はそうやって私にはありえなくらい真剣に彼女を見つめる。見つめ続ける。","en":"And so, with a seriousness almost impossible for me, I stare at her. I keep staring.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r335","rowIndex":335,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=44>筱喬</tips>は目をそらし、","en":"<tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> averts her eyes.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r336","rowIndex":336,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ごめんなさい」","en":"“I’m sorry.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r337","rowIndex":337,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　と言った。","en":"That is what she says.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r338","rowIndex":338,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ほら、やっぱりダメだった！　私が感情をぶつけたところで、誰も動いてはくれないんだ！","en":"See? I knew it wouldn’t work! No one will move merely because I throw my feelings at them!","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r339","rowIndex":339,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は恥ずかしくて顔が真っ赤になり、そして全身から脱力した。","en":"My face burns crimson with shame, and all strength leaves my body.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r340","rowIndex":340,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そうだ、私はこれじゃいけないんだ。私のやり方でやろう。自分の感情をぶつけて他人を動かすなんてのは、愛情の世界にすんでいる魅力的な人間がやる方法だ。私はいわば砂漠の住人で、限界的な環境を智恵と観察をフルに活かして抜け目なくやらなきゃ生き残れない。――そんなことわかっていた筈なのに、どうして今こんなやり方をしたのだろうね。","en":"Yes. This will never do. I must proceed in my own way. Moving another person by laying one’s feelings bare is a method reserved for charming people who inhabit the world of love. I, by contrast, am a creature of the desert. To survive at the limits of habitability, I must bring every scrap of wit and observation to bear and never leave myself exposed. —I knew all of that perfectly well. So why did I try such a method now?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r341","rowIndex":341,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は萎えかけた心を冷静に立て直し、もう一度口を開いた。","en":"I calmly gather up the remnants of my faltering resolve and begin again.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r342","rowIndex":342,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　今度はやり方を変えよう。もっと私の得意なやり方で。","en":"This time I will change my approach. I will use a method I know better.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r343","rowIndex":343,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あなたは間違ってる」","en":"“You’re wrong.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r344","rowIndex":344,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　オーケー。この私の言葉は、さっきとは別人のように冷たく落ち着いている。ちゃんと私にコントロールされた声だ。","en":"Okay. Unlike before, my words are cold and composed, as though they came from a different person. This is a voice I control properly.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r345","rowIndex":345,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=44>筱喬</tips>もその声のトーンのかわりように驚いたようにそらしていた視線を戻して私の表情を確かめる。","en":"Surprised by the sudden change in my tone, <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> returns the gaze she had averted and examines my expression.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r346","rowIndex":346,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そこには鉄仮面みたいな冷たい顔があるはずだ。","en":"She should find a cold face like an iron mask.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r347","rowIndex":347,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「急に自分で自分のことを決めようとしているけれど、あなたにはそんな権利はないんだよ」","en":"“You have suddenly decided that your life is yours alone to determine—but you have not earned that right.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r348","rowIndex":348,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私の強い言葉に<tips=44>筱喬</tips>は驚きを浮かべる。","en":"My forceful word brings surprise to <tips=44>Siu-kiu’s</tips> face.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r349","rowIndex":349,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ねえ、考えてみて。あなたは覚悟を決めて大事な決断をしたように言ってるけど、ただみんなの優しさに甘えてわがままをしただけ。だから、ここで断る権利なんかないの」","en":"“Think about it. You make it sound as though you steeled yourself and made a momentous decision, but all you did was selfishly take advantage of everyone’s kindness. That is why you have no right to refuse now.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r350","rowIndex":350,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……どういうこと？」","en":"“...What do you mean?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r351","rowIndex":351,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まずね、<tips=81>龍頭</tips>は知っていたのよ？　あの脱出があなたと私の茶番で、私が協力者だって。そして、私があなたの居場所を知ってるって。さらに、<tips=10>見土</tips>さんのところに身を寄せてるのもなんとなく想像してたみたい。それなのに、こうなるまで私に確認しようともしなかったんだよ。<tips=10>見土</tips>さんが死んで、初めて、私を呼んで事情を聞いたの。きっと、状況が悪くなったら助けようって決めてたんだよ。あなたに裏切られたのに」","en":"“First of all, the <tips=81>Longtou</tips> knew. He knew our escape was a charade, that I had helped you, and that I knew where you were. He even seems to have guessed that you had taken refuge with <tips=10>Mr. Mido</tips>. Yet until this happened, he never once tried to make me confirm any of it. Only when <tips=10>Mr. Mido</tips> died did he summon me and ask for the truth. I am certain he had resolved to help you if your situation ever became dangerous—even after you betrayed him.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r352","rowIndex":352,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=44>筱喬</tips>は何も言わないが、露骨に動揺を見せている。おそらく、完全に兄を騙せているつもりだったのだろう。","en":"<tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> says nothing, but she is visibly shaken. She must have thought she had fooled her brother completely.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r353","rowIndex":353,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「正直に言うけど、私、あなたがさっき指摘したように<tips=81>龍頭</tips>の指示で来てるの。心配だから助け出してくれって。私の言うことなら聞くだろうって。私にしか頼めないんだって、そこまで言ったのよ。あの<tips=81>龍頭</tips>が」","en":"“I’ll tell you the truth. Just as you pointed out, I came here on the <tips=81>Longtou’s</tips> orders. He asked me to get you out because he was worried, and said you might listen to me. He went so far as to say I was the only person he could ask. The <tips=81>Longtou</tips> himself said that.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r354","rowIndex":354,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「お兄ちゃんがそう言ったとしても、私は……」","en":"“Even if my brother said that, I...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r355","rowIndex":355,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=44>筱喬</tips>は弱々しく言って、また俯く。","en":"<tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> speaks weakly and looks down again.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r356","rowIndex":356,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いい加減にして」","en":"“Enough.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r357","rowIndex":357,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私はぴしゃりと言ってから、","en":"I cut her off sharply.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r358","rowIndex":358,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=1>亮</tips>さんはあなたのことをずっと大事に思ってた。それに、<tips=10>見土</tips>さんだって、敵対組織のあなたのために、色々してくれた。発症したら敵地の<tips=41>グランドタワー</tips>まで来て薬を届けてくれたし、逃げ出したら家に置いてくれた。それは、あなたに無事でいてほしいから。あなたは二人の気持ちに甘えて、わがままをやって来ただけ。なのに、ここでも<tips=1>亮</tips>さんと<tips=10>見土</tips>さん両方を裏切ろうと言うの？」","en":"“<tips=1>Leung</tips> has always cared deeply about you. And Mr. <tips=10>Mido</tips> did all kinds of things for you even though you belonged to a hostile organization. When you had an episode, he came all the way into enemy territory at <tips=41>Grand Tower</tips> to bring you medicine, and when you ran away, he gave you a home. They did those things because they wanted you safe. You have done nothing but indulge your selfishness by taking advantage of how they felt. And now you mean to betray both <tips=1>Leung</tips> and Mr. <tips=10>Mido</tips> here too?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r359","rowIndex":359,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「違うっ……。そうじゃない！」","en":"“No! That’s not it!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r360","rowIndex":360,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　叫ぶ<tips=44>筱喬</tips>の目にかすかに敵意の光が浮かぶ。","en":"A faint spark of hostility appears in <tips=44>Siu-kiu’s</tips> eyes as she cries out.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r361","rowIndex":361,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は心が痛かったが、それを叩き潰すようにさらに言葉を重ねる。","en":"My heart hurts, but I pile on more words as though crushing that spark.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r362","rowIndex":362,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「違わないわ。あなたは格好付けていろんな理屈を並べたけれど、本心は違う。私を騙すことは出来ないよ。あなたは投げやりになってるだけ。<tips=10>見土</tips>さんが死んだショックを受け止められなくて、もう死んじゃおうと思って、そうして<tips=10>見土</tips>さんのあとを追おうとしてるだけだわ」","en":"“Yes, it is. You dressed it up with all sorts of reasons, but none of that is how you truly feel. You cannot fool me. You have simply stopped caring what happens to you. You cannot come to terms with the shock of <tips=10>Mr. Mido’s</tips> death, so you have decided to die and follow <tips=10>Mr. Mido</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r363","rowIndex":363,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=51>さくら</tips>は誤解してるよ。私は、そんなつもりはないのにっ」","en":"“<tips=51>Sakura</tips>, you misunderstand. I don’t mean that!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r364","rowIndex":364,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「もう言い訳はきかない」","en":"“No more excuses.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r365","rowIndex":365,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は涙ぐむ<tips=44>筱喬</tips>にぴしゃりと言って、","en":"I snap at the tearful <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips>, then say—","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r366","rowIndex":366,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あなたは<tips=1>亮</tips>さんに対して責任をとるべきだわ。大体、<tips=1>亮</tips>さんがやりたくもない<tips=81>龍頭</tips>をやってるのは、あなたがいたからでしょ？　あなたのせいで人を沢山殺すことになったのよ。<tips=4>馬明</tips>さんだってそう。きっと<tips=1>亮</tips>さんはああいうのがいやで街を出ていたんだよ。帰って来たのは、お父さんが死んだらあなたを守る人が誰もいなくなるから。……わかってるでしょ？」","en":"“You should take responsibility for what you’ve put <tips=1>Leung</tips> through. The whole reason <tips=1>Leung</tips> is serving as <tips=81>Longtou</tips> when he never wanted the job is that you were here, isn’t it? Because of you, he has had to kill a great many people. <tips=4>Ma Ming</tips> was one of them. I’m sure <tips=1>Leung</tips> left the city because he hated doing things like that. He came back because once your father died, no one else would be left to protect you. ...You know that, don’t you?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r367","rowIndex":367,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その言葉で、<tips=44>筱喬</tips>ははっと顔色を変え、唇を噛んで俯いた。","en":"At those words, <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> goes pale. She bites her lip and lowers her head.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r368","rowIndex":368,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は残酷なことを言ったのを自覚している。いやわざと言ったんだ。","en":"I know that what I said was cruel. No—I said it deliberately.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r369","rowIndex":369,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　実際に<tips=81>龍頭</tips>がどういう理由で組織を継いだのかなんて私は知らない。今口にした理由は、他でもない<tips=44>筱喬</tips>が推測し、そして気に病んでいたことだ。それを聞いていたから本人に刃として突きつけたんだ。きっと<tips=44>筱喬</tips>が<tips=1>亮</tips>さんに逆らえなくなるだろうと思って。まったく趣味の悪いやり方で、自分でもいやになる。","en":"In truth, I have no idea why the <tips=81>Longtou</tips> took over the organization. What I just told her was nothing more than <tips=44>Siu-kiu’s</tips> own suspicion—the very thing she had been tormenting herself over. I had heard it from her, and now I turned it into a blade and held it to her, knowing it would make <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> unable to defy <tips=1>Leung</tips>. It is a vile way to go about this. I disgust even myself.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r370","rowIndex":370,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=1>亮</tips>さんはきっとこれからもたくさん辛い目に遭うわ。それも、あなたのせいなのよ。でも文句一つ言わない。そして、今もあなたを助けてくれと言っている。さっきなんか泣きそうな顔をしていて、あんなにつらそうな<tips=1>亮</tips>さんを見たことがない。なのに、あなたはそんな残酷な仕打ちをして苦しめるの？　何も、<tips=10>見土</tips>さんがいた<tips=21>八龍会</tips>を裏切って<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>につけと言うんじゃない。街を出て、どちらにもかかわらないようにしろってだけ。ここにいたら<tips=1>亮</tips>さんにとっても迷惑だわ。あの人はこれから<tips=21>八龍会</tips>と戦うんだから。あなたが死んだらそれで終わりかもしれないけど、利用される可能性だってあるのよ。……それもわからないのなら、あなたにはがっかり」","en":"“<tips=1>Leung</tips> is certain to suffer a great deal from now on, and that will be your fault too. Yet he will not breathe a word of complaint. Even now, he is asking me to save you. Just before, he looked ready to cry. I have never seen <tips=1>Leung</tips> in such pain. And after all that, you would do something this cruel to him and make him suffer even more? No one is asking you to betray the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips>, where <tips=10>Mr. Mido</tips> belonged, and join <tips=7>YS</tips>. All you have to do is leave the city and stay out of both sides’ affairs. If you remain here, you will only be a burden to <tips=1>Leung</tips>. He is about to go to war with the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips>. If you die, perhaps that will be the end of it—but you may just as easily be used against him. ...If you cannot understand even that, then I am disappointed in you.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r371","rowIndex":371,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私はわざとらしく肩をすくめて溜息をつく。","en":"I shrug theatrically and sigh.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r372","rowIndex":372,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=44>筱喬</tips>の顔は蒼白になっている。","en":"<tips=44>Siu-kiu’s</tips> face is deathly pale.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r373","rowIndex":373,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　口がゆっくりと開いて何か言いかけ、そしてそこでしばらく止まってから、また動き、弱々しく震える声で彼女はようやく言葉を口にする。","en":"Her mouth opens slowly to say something, stops for a long moment, then moves again. At last, she speaks in a weak, trembling voice.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r374","rowIndex":374,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……<tips=51>さくら</tips>の言う通りだ」","en":"“...You’re right, <tips=51>Sakura</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r375","rowIndex":375,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女の眉間にはしわがより、悲痛な表情をつくりあげている。","en":"A crease between her brows completes an expression of anguish.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r376","rowIndex":376,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「私がここにいるのは、お兄ちゃんには迷惑だね……」","en":"“My being here only causes trouble for my brother.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r377","rowIndex":377,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女はいつも自分の居場所のなさや、存在意義のなさに悩んでいる。そこに不必要で迷惑な存在だからこうしてくれと言えば、<tips=44>筱喬</tips>は苦しみながらそれをのむしかない。それはもう彼女の心にしみついたどうしようもないメカニズムなのだ。","en":"She is forever tormented by the thought that she has no place to belong and no reason to exist. Tell her that she is unwanted, that her presence is a burden, and that she must therefore do as she is told, and <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> can only swallow the pain and obey. That mechanism is already so deeply embedded in her heart that she is powerless against it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r378","rowIndex":378,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　自分でしむけた予想通りの反応とは言え、その苦しむ顔を見るのは痛々しかった。","en":"The response is precisely what I engineered and predicted. Even so, looking at her anguished face hurts.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r379","rowIndex":379,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「じゃあ、一緒に来てくれる？」","en":"“Then will you come with me?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r380","rowIndex":380,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私が言うと、<tips=44>筱喬</tips>は無言のまま頷く。","en":"When I ask, <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> nods in silence.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r381","rowIndex":381,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いい子ね。おりこうさん」","en":"“Good girl. Such a clever girl.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r382","rowIndex":382,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私はそう言って、にっこりと微笑みかけた。","en":"I say it and smile brightly at her.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r383","rowIndex":383,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　服や日用品など、あとでいくらでも買い直せるものは置いて行くことに決めると、彼女が必要とする私物はそれほど多くなかった。大事な思い出の品をいくつかカバンに詰め込み、すぐに出発の準備は整う。","en":"Once we decide to leave behind the clothing, daily necessities, and other things she can replace later, there is very little she absolutely needs to take. We pack several treasured mementos into a bag, and she is immediately ready to depart.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r384","rowIndex":384,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして私たちは窓辺から飛び立った。","en":"Then we fly from the window.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r385","rowIndex":385,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　背中の<tips=44>筱喬</tips>は、さっきからずっと黙っていて何一つ口にしない。でも何も言わなくとも、相変わらずのこわばった表情が全部を物語っている。何も言いたくない気持ちはよくわかる。かといって私は彼女の気持ちをほぐすような言葉を口にするでもなく、彼女と同じように黙っていた。","en":"<tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> has been silent on my back ever since. She has not uttered a single word. She does not need to: the same rigid expression tells me everything. I understand perfectly why she has nothing to say. Yet I offer no words to put her at ease. I remain silent, just as she does.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r386","rowIndex":386,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　結果的に<tips=44>筱喬</tips>を連れ出すことが出来た。<tips=1>亮</tips>さんからの任務は成功だ。でも私の心は晴れやかではない。ひきかえに、彼女の心を罪悪感で縛って囚人にしてしまった。さしずめ今の私は囚人を運ぶ檻つきの馬車といったところだ。","en":"In the end, I succeed in getting <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> out. The mission <tips=1>Leung</tips> gave me is a success. Yet I feel no relief. I accomplished it by binding her heart with guilt and making her my prisoner. At this point, I am little more than a prison wagon carrying its captive.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r387","rowIndex":387,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ひどいことをしてしまったな。どうして他のやりかたが出来ないんだろう？　助かって欲しいっていう本当の気持ちが伝わらなかったんだろう？　任務には成功したけれど、こんな脅すようなやりかたでは、人間としての私は敗北してしまったということだ。わかっていた敗北とは言え、それをこうして現実に突きつけられると胸が苦しかった。泣きそうになった。何か喋ると恨み言を言ってしまいそうだったので、黙って<tips=41>グランドタワー</tips>に飛んだ。","en":"I have done something terrible. Why could I not find another way? Why could I not make her understand that I truly wanted her to live? The mission may have succeeded, but if this was the only way I could do it—by all but threatening her—then I have failed as a human being. I knew this defeat was coming. Even so, having the reality of it thrust before me makes my chest ache. I am close to tears. If I speak, I feel that only bitter words will come out, so I fly to <tips=41>Grand Tower</tips> in silence.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r388","rowIndex":388,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　すっかり自罰的になってしまった<tips=44>筱喬</tips>はあわせる顔がないからと屋上に留まることを選んだので、私は一人で<tips=81>龍頭</tips>に報告に行った。","en":"Now thoroughly bent on punishing herself, <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> chooses to remain on the roof, saying she cannot face him, so I go alone to report to the <tips=81>Longtou</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r389","rowIndex":389,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ありがとう。これからのことは本人にも伝えているかい？」","en":"“Thank you. Have you told her what comes next?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r390","rowIndex":390,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　一通りの経緯を報告すると、いつもの椅子に腰掛けた<tips=81>龍頭</tips>はそう訊ねる。","en":"Once I have given him the entire account, the <tips=81>Longtou</tips> asks me this from his customary chair.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r391","rowIndex":391,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「はい、本人も納得してます」","en":"“Yes. She agrees.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r392","rowIndex":392,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「でも、きみは本当にそれでいいのか？」","en":"“But are you really all right with that?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r393","rowIndex":393,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「はい」","en":"“Yes.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r394","rowIndex":394,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は頷いた。<tips=81>龍頭</tips>が言っているのは、<tips=44>筱喬</tips>の身柄を、私の実家で預かるということだ。","en":"I nod. The <tips=81>Longtou</tips> is asking whether I am truly willing to have my family take <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> in.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r395","rowIndex":395,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　計画を説明してくれた<tips=81>龍頭</tips>に、私が提案したのはそのことだった。","en":"When the <tips=81>Longtou</tips> explained his plan to me, taking her in at my family home was the solution I proposed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r396","rowIndex":396,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=81>龍頭</tips>は一般家庭に<tips=44>筱喬</tips>を預けることについて渋っていたが、私はその方がいいと思う理由を説明した。","en":"The <tips=81>Longtou</tips> was reluctant to entrust <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> to an ordinary household, but I explained why I thought it was better.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r397","rowIndex":397,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　まず私の家ならば、将来的に<tips=9>Y地区</tips>の誰かが<tips=44>筱喬</tips>の居場所を探しても、発見が困難だろうということ。","en":"First, if she stayed with my family, even someone from <tips=9>Y District</tips> searching for <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> later would have great difficulty finding her.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r398","rowIndex":398,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>に入ったとは言え、窓掃除ばかりで何の仕事もしていない。こういう人間が<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>にいるとは、<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>のほとんどの人間は知らない。しかも、ここで私が連れ去れば、その事実は私と彼しか知らないということになる。これならば、まず<tips=44>筱喬</tips>のところまでたどり着くのは不可能だと思う。<tips=81>龍頭</tips>が場所を用意するとなれば<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>の人間を使うことが必要になるし、さらにそこで素性を誤魔化して生活するとなれば、他の人の手も借りなくてはいけなくなる。その点、うちならば自分と両親だけが納得すればいい。両親は私が説得してみせる。","en":"Although I have joined <tips=7>YS</tips>, I have done nothing but clean windows—no real work at all. Almost no one in <tips=7>YS</tips> even knows that someone like me belongs to <tips=7>YS</tips>. Better still, if I am the one who takes her away, only he and I will know that I did so. It should then be virtually impossible for anyone to trace <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> to her hiding place. If the <tips=81>Longtou</tips> arranged somewhere for her to stay, he would have to involve other people from <tips=7>YS</tips>. Concealing her identity while she lived there would require help from still others. At my home, by contrast, only my parents and I need to agree. I will see to persuading them.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r399","rowIndex":399,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それに、私といつも一緒にいれば、私が彼女を守ることが出来る。私が誰よりも真剣に彼女を守ることは、<tips=1>亮</tips>さんもよく知ってるはずだ。","en":"Besides, if she is always with me, I can protect her. <tips=1>Leung</tips> should know perfectly well that no one will take protecting her more seriously than I will.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r400","rowIndex":400,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　この私の言葉に納得してくれたのかどうかはわからないが、<tips=1>亮</tips>さんが私にした質問はただ一つ。「きみは本当にそれでいいのか？」ということだけで、私はもちろん胸を張って頷いた。","en":"I do not know whether my argument convinces him, but <tips=1>Leung</tips> asks me only one question: “Are you really all right with that?” Naturally, I square my shoulders and nod.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r401","rowIndex":401,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　――そうして、彼は、私の提案を受け入れてくれたのだ。","en":"—And that was how he came to accept my proposal.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r402","rowIndex":402,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=81>龍頭</tips>こそ、本当にいいんですか？　大事な妹さんを私の家であずかっても」","en":"“But are you sure you are all right with this, <tips=81>Longtou</tips>? With letting my family look after your precious sister?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r403","rowIndex":403,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私はちょっと心配になってそう聞いてみた。","en":"The thought makes me a little uneasy, so I ask.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r404","rowIndex":404,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「もちろん」","en":"“Of course.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r405","rowIndex":405,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼は頷き、","en":"He nods, then says—","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r406","rowIndex":406,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「きみは自分で言ったじゃないか。誰よりも<tips=44>シウ</tips>を真剣に守ってくれるって。その人間に預けるよりも、<tips=44>シウ</tips>にとって良い場所なんかないよ」","en":"“You said it yourself: no one will be more devoted to protecting <tips=44>Siu</tips> than you. And there could be no better place for <tips=44>Siu</tips> than with someone like that.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r407","rowIndex":407,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そう言ってくれたので、私は泣きそうになった。","en":"His words bring me close to tears.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r408","rowIndex":408,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「もし何かが起こりそうなときは、僕が責任をもって安全を保障する」","en":"“If it ever looks as though trouble is coming, I will take responsibility for keeping you safe.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r409","rowIndex":409,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「信用してます」","en":"“I trust you.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r410","rowIndex":410,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「しかし、本当に、僕の方からご両親に説明しなくても本当に大丈夫なのかい？」","en":"“But are you really sure—truly sure—I don’t need to explain anything to your parents myself?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r411","rowIndex":411,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「平気です。私がなんとかします。<tips=81>龍頭</tips>が話したらきっとびっくりして内容が全然耳に入らないと思いますから。……それより、本人が病気のことを心配しているんですが……」","en":"“It’ll be fine. I’ll manage somehow. If the <tips=81>Longtou</tips> spoke to them, they would be so shocked that none of the explanation would sink in. ...More importantly, she’s worried about her illness...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r412","rowIndex":412,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それは心配しなくていい。<tips=46>ネオ・ローズ</tips>はこっちで調達して、定期的に送るよう手配する」","en":"“There is no need to worry about that. We’ll procure the <tips=46>Neo Rose</tips> here and arrange to have it sent regularly.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r413","rowIndex":413,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あと……」","en":"“And...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r414","rowIndex":414,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は言いかけて口ごもる。","en":"I begin to speak, then falter.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r415","rowIndex":415,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なんだい？」","en":"“What is it?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r416","rowIndex":416,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼に促され、私は続ける。","en":"At his prompting, I continue.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r417","rowIndex":417,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……本当にこのまま<tips=44>筱喬</tips>をつれて行っていいんですか？　会わなくてもいいんですか？」","en":"“...Are you really all right with me taking <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> away like this? You don’t need to see her?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r418","rowIndex":418,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いいんだ。その方がいい。今ここにいるのは彼女の兄じゃなくて、第三代<tips=81>龍頭</tips>だからね」","en":"“I am. This is better. The person standing here now is not her brother, but the Third <tips=81>Longtou</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r419","rowIndex":419,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そんなこと、ないと思いますけど」","en":"“I don’t think that’s true.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r420","rowIndex":420,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いいんだよ。それに、会わなくたって、あいつの気持ちは充分わかってるんだ」","en":"“It is all right. Besides, I do not need to see her to know exactly how she feels.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r421","rowIndex":421,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=81>龍頭</tips>がそう言って少し微笑んだ顔は、これまで見たことがないくらい優しい顔つきだった。","en":"The <tips=81>Longtou</tips> smiles faintly as he says it, and his expression is gentler than any I have ever seen from him.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r422","rowIndex":422,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　やっぱりこの兄妹は強い愛情で結ばれているんだろう。私はそれを感じるとまた胸が苦しくなった。","en":"The bond between this brother and sister must be one of deep love after all. The thought makes my chest hurt again.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r423","rowIndex":423,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=51>さくら</tips>さん」","en":"“<tips=51>Sakura</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"黄天祥","displayName":"Wong Tin-cheung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r424","rowIndex":424,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=81>龍頭</tips>との話を終え、部屋を出ようとすると、<tips=40>黄姉妹</tips>が駆け寄ってきた。","en":"When my conversation with the <tips=81>Longtou</tips> is over and I turn to leave the room, the <tips=40>Wong sisters</tips> come running over.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r425","rowIndex":425,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「しばらくここへは来ないんですよね」","en":"“You won’t be coming here for a while, will you?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"黄天明","displayName":"Wong Tin-ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r426","rowIndex":426,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は頷いた。<tips=44>筱喬</tips>を匿うという立場上、<tips=9>Y地区</tips>に足を踏み入れるのは控えなくちゃいけない。","en":"I nod. Now that I will be sheltering <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips>, I have to avoid setting foot in <tips=9>Y District</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r427","rowIndex":427,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「じゃあ、これ」","en":"“Then take this.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"黄天祥","displayName":"Wong Tin-cheung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r428","rowIndex":428,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=40>天祥</tips>が渡してくれたのは、紐の付いた小さな布袋だった。","en":"<tips=40>Tin-cheung</tips> hands me a small cloth pouch on a cord.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r429","rowIndex":429,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「これ、お守りなんです」","en":"“It’s a protective charm.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"黄天明","displayName":"Wong Tin-ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r430","rowIndex":430,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　受け取る私に<tips=40>天明</tips>が笑顔でそう説明してくれる。","en":"As I accept it, <tips=40>Tin-ming</tips> explains with a smile.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r431","rowIndex":431,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なかには霊木が入っていて、災いから身を守ってくれるんです。父が昔母と旅行に行ったときに、買って来てくれたものです。家族全員に一つずつ買って、これは亡くなった母のものです」","en":"“Inside is a piece of sacred wood that protects its bearer from misfortune. Our father bought them long ago, when he went traveling with our mother. He bought one for each member of the family, and this one belonged to our mother, who passed away.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"黄天明","displayName":"Wong Tin-ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r432","rowIndex":432,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そ、そんなの受け取れないよ」","en":"“I-I can’t accept something like that.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r433","rowIndex":433,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私が突き返そうとすると姉妹は笑い、","en":"When I try to give it back, the sisters smile.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r434","rowIndex":434,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いいんです。持ち主がないまま置いてあっても仕方がないですから」","en":"“It is all right. There is no point leaving it here when there is no one to carry it.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"黄天祥","displayName":"Wong Tin-cheung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r435","rowIndex":435,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「受け取ってください。<tips=51>さくら</tips>は私たちの友だちです」","en":"“Please accept it. You are our friend, <tips=51>Sakura</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"黄天明","displayName":"Wong Tin-ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r436","rowIndex":436,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「で、でも」","en":"“B-but...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r437","rowIndex":437,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「はじめて出来た友だちなんです」","en":"“You’re the first friend we’ve ever made.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"黄天祥","displayName":"Wong Tin-cheung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r438","rowIndex":438,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いやじゃなければ、持っていてください」","en":"“If you don’t mind, please keep it.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"黄天明","displayName":"Wong Tin-ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r439","rowIndex":439,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　姉妹に取り囲まれてそう言われると、私も断るわけにはいかず、ポケットにそれを仕舞った。","en":"With the sisters surrounding me and insisting, I can hardly refuse. I slip the charm into my pocket.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r440","rowIndex":440,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　屋上に戻ると<tips=44>筱喬</tips>は膝を抱えてしゃがみ込んで空を見上げている。","en":"When I return to the roof, <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> is crouched with her knees drawn to her chest, looking up at the sky.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r441","rowIndex":441,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　同じように顎をあげて彼女の視線の先を追うと灰色の雲の切れ間に小さく青空が浮かんでいるのが見えた。","en":"I raise my chin as she has and follow her gaze. In a break between the gray clouds, I see a tiny patch of blue sky.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r442","rowIndex":442,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　でも風の流れが速く、すぐにそれは形を変えた雲に塞がれて見えなくなった。","en":"But the wind is moving quickly, and clouds of another shape soon close over it and hide it from view.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r443","rowIndex":443,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いこう」","en":"“Let’s go.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r444","rowIndex":444,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私が言うと、彼女は無言で頷いた。","en":"When I say it, she nods without a word.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r445","rowIndex":445,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「お兄ちゃんは私についてなにか言ってた？」","en":"“Did my brother say anything about me?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r446","rowIndex":446,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　飛び始めてから、彼女は背中で小さく言葉を発した。","en":"After we begin to fly, she speaks softly from my back.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r447","rowIndex":447,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=44>筱喬</tips>の気持ちはわかるって」","en":"“He said he understood how <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> felt.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r448","rowIndex":448,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「他には？」","en":"“Anything else?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r449","rowIndex":449,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それだけ。それだけ言ってただ嬉しそうに微笑んでた」","en":"“That was all. He just said that, then smiled—and he looked so happy.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r450","rowIndex":450,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そう……」","en":"“I see...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r451","rowIndex":451,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そしてまた沈黙に戻る。どんな顔をしてるのか見たくて首をねじったけれど、背中の<tips=44>筱喬</tips>の表情は見えなかった。","en":"Then she falls silent again. I twist my neck, wanting to see what expression she is wearing, but I cannot see <tips=44>Siu-kiu’s</tips> face behind me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r452","rowIndex":452,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=81>龍頭</tips>の気持ちは届いてないのか。やはり、私が言葉で追い詰めた暗い気持ちのまま義務的に同行しているだけなのだろうか。","en":"Did the <tips=81>Longtou’s</tips> feelings fail to reach her? Is she still only accompanying me out of obligation, trapped in the dark feelings my words drove her into?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r453","rowIndex":453,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私がぼんやりそんなことを考えていると、","en":"As I turn the question over vaguely in my mind—","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r454","rowIndex":454,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「今度、ちゃんとお兄ちゃんとあわなくちゃいけないな」","en":"“Next time, I need to face my brother properly.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r455","rowIndex":455,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=44>筱喬</tips>はぽつりとそう言った。","en":"<tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> murmurs the words.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r456","rowIndex":456,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　この兄妹は、なんだかんだで通じ合ってるのだろう。<tips=10>見土</tips>さんの気持ちも、結局は<tips=44>筱喬</tips>に届いたんだ。","en":"One way or another, these siblings must understand each other after all. In the end, Mr. <tips=10>Mido’s</tips> feelings reached <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> too.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r457","rowIndex":457,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それがいいよ」","en":"“That would be good.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r458","rowIndex":458,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　と私は答えた。","en":"I answer.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r459","rowIndex":459,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その声は、我ながら感情のない声だった。でも、こればかりは許されると思う。私だって、今回は頑張ったのだから。","en":"Even to my own ears, my voice is empty of emotion. But surely I can be forgiven this much. I did my best this time too, after all.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r460","rowIndex":460,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は街の端へ向かって飛んでいる。その方向は、地上に<tips=81>龍頭</tips>が人を出していてくれるそうだから、安全に飛ぶことが出来るだろう。","en":"I am flying toward the edge of the city. The <tips=81>Longtou</tips> has apparently stationed people on the ground in that direction, so we should be able to make the flight safely.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r461","rowIndex":461,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そのまま<tips=9>Y地区</tips>を離れれば、<tips=44>筱喬</tips>は危険な場所から離れ、平穏な生活を送る。<tips=81>龍頭</tips>は<tips=21>八龍会</tips>との戦いに専念出来る。いいことばっかりだ。つまり私はいいことをしたのだ。","en":"Once we leave <tips=9>Y District</tips>, <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> will be out of danger and able to live in peace. The <tips=81>Longtou</tips> will be free to concentrate on his war with the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips>. It is all for the best. Which means that what I did was good.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r462","rowIndex":462,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　でも、なんだか私は急に虚しい気持ちになっていた。こんなに虚しいのはなんでだろう？　いや、疑問形にしたけれども、その理由はもちろんわかっているのだよね。","en":"But all at once, I am overcome by a sense of emptiness. Why do I feel so empty? No—I put it as a question, but of course I know why, do I not?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r463","rowIndex":463,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　胸の中を様々な感情が去来する。目の前がぼやけて、飛行の軌道がふらりと揺れた。","en":"A welter of emotions passes through my chest. My vision blurs, and my flight path sways unsteadily.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r464","rowIndex":464,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=51>さくら</tips>……」","en":"“<tips=51>Sakura</tips>...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r465","rowIndex":465,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　後の<tips=44>筱喬</tips>が驚いたような声をあげる。","en":"Behind me, <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> cries out in surprise.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r466","rowIndex":466,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「泣いてるの？」","en":"“Are you crying?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r467","rowIndex":467,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そりゃ泣くよ！」","en":"“Of course I’m crying!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r468","rowIndex":468,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　もう限界だ。感情が抑えきれず、はじけてしまう。","en":"I have reached my limit. I can no longer contain my emotions, and they burst free.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r469","rowIndex":469,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「だって、こんなのってひどいよ……」","en":"“Because this is awful...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r470","rowIndex":470,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その声は自分でもあきらかにそうとわかる泣き声になっていた。","en":"My voice has become a sob, so unmistakable that even I can hear it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r471","rowIndex":471,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「みんな仲よさそうに信じあってるのに、どうして私は誰ともわかりあえないの？　私だって本当に<tips=44>筱喬</tips>には逃げて欲しいって思ったのに、伝わらなかった」","en":"“Everyone else seems so close. They trust one another; they understand one another. Why can I never reach that kind of understanding with anyone? I truly wanted <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> to escape, but I could not make her understand that.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r472","rowIndex":472,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=51>さくら</tips>……」","en":"“<tips=51>Sakura</tips>...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r473","rowIndex":473,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「だからあんな言い方をして、追い詰めないといけなかったんだからね。<tips=44>筱喬</tips>のことを傷つけたくなんかないのに……でも仕方なかったから……」","en":"“That is why I had to speak to you that way—why I had to corner you. I never wanted to hurt you, <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips>... But I had no other choice...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r474","rowIndex":474,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ここでネタばらしをしたら全部台無しになるかもしれない。でも、一度溢れ出てしまった感情も言葉も自分ではとめることが出来ない。どうしようもない高ぶりが、嗚咽と涙となって身体から溢れ出た。","en":"Revealing the ruse now may ruin everything. But once my feelings and words have begun to overflow, I cannot stop them. The uncontrollable surge spills out of my body as sobs and tears.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r475","rowIndex":475,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ただでさえヌルヌルとした粘液だらけの私が、さらに涙と鼻水などをたらして、もう本当にみっともない。みにくい。","en":"As if being covered in slick mucus were not bad enough, now tears and snot are running down my face too. I look absolutely wretched. Hideous.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r476","rowIndex":476,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　感情が乱れると飛行が安定しない。ふらふらと酔っ払いのように揺れると、背後の<tips=44>筱喬</tips>がぎゅっと私に強くしがみつく。","en":"When my emotions are in turmoil, my flight becomes unstable. As I lurch from side to side like a drunk, <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> clings tightly to me from behind.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r477","rowIndex":477,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「揺らしてゴメン。大丈夫、落ちないから……」","en":"“Sorry I’m wobbling. It’s all right, you won’t fall...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r478","rowIndex":478,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうじゃないの」","en":"“That’s not why.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r479","rowIndex":479,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=44>筱喬</tips>は言って、私にさらに強くしがみつく。","en":"<tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> says it and holds me even tighter.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r480","rowIndex":480,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=51>さくら</tips>、ごめんね。あそこまで言わせちゃって……」","en":"“I am sorry, <tips=51>Sakura</tips>. I drove you to say all those things...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r481","rowIndex":481,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そう呟く<tips=44>筱喬</tips>の声も涙声になっていた。","en":"<tips=44>Siu-kiu’s</tips> murmuring voice has become tearful too.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r482","rowIndex":482,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「でも、すぐわかったんだよ。<tips=51>さくら</tips>が、もうどうしようもなくなって、必死でああいうこと言ってたんだって。私のために言ってくれてるんだって。それはちゃんと伝わったよ。ごめんね、私が気づくのが遅くて……」","en":"“But I did understand. I could tell that you had run out of every other way to reach me—that you were saying those things in desperation, for my sake. That much came through to me. I am sorry it took me so long to see it, <tips=51>Sakura</tips>...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r483","rowIndex":483,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……もっと謝ってよ。私、大好きな<tips=44>筱喬</tips>にひどいことをたくさん言ったせいで心が痛いの」","en":"“...Then say you are sorry some more. My heart hurts after saying all those terrible things to <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> when I love her so much.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r484","rowIndex":484,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は鼻声のままそう拗ねた。","en":"I say it sulkily through my stuffy nose.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r485","rowIndex":485,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ごめんね。本当にごめんね」","en":"“I’m sorry. I’m truly sorry.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r486","rowIndex":486,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=44>筱喬</tips>は優しくそう言った。","en":"<tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> says it gently.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r487","rowIndex":487,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして街の端まで来て、ビルの陰に私たちは降りた。","en":"When we reach the edge of the city, we descend in the shadow of a building.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r488","rowIndex":488,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　さすがにもう涙は止まっていたけれど、私の目の周りは泣きはらして真っ赤だった。そして<tips=44>筱喬</tips>も同じように腫れぼったいまぶたをしている。私たちは手鏡でそれぞれ自分の情けない顔を確認してから、二人で笑った。","en":"My tears have finally stopped, but my eyes are swollen and bright red from crying. <tips=44>Siu-kiu’s</tips> eyelids are just as puffy. We each inspect our own sorry face in a hand mirror, then laugh together.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r489","rowIndex":489,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちは国道のそばにやって来た。この道の向こうは<tips=9>Y地区</tips>の外だ。ここから先は、白昼堂々能力を使うわけにはいかない。私の家までは歩いて行かなければいけないのだ。","en":"We reach the national highway. Once we cross it, we will be outside <tips=9>Y District</tips>. Beyond this point, we cannot very well use our abilities in full view of everyone in broad daylight. We will have to walk the rest of the way to my house.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r490","rowIndex":490,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「私、大人の人たちがいないで<tips=9>Y地区</tips>を出るのは生まれて初めて」","en":"“This is the first time in my life I’ve left <tips=9>Y District</tips> without any adults.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r491","rowIndex":491,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　横断歩道で車が来なくなるのを待つ間、<tips=44>筱喬</tips>は小さく呟いた。","en":"As we wait at the crossing for the traffic to clear, <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> murmurs softly.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r492","rowIndex":492,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　国道を越えたところには駐車場の広いコンビニエンスストアがある。","en":"On the other side of the highway stands a convenience store with a broad parking lot.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r493","rowIndex":493,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ちょっと、トイレ借りてくるね」","en":"“I’m going to use the restroom.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r494","rowIndex":494,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=44>筱喬</tips>がパタパタと駆け足でコンビニに入ってゆくのを見届けてから、私は縁石の上に腰掛ける。","en":"I watch <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> patter into the store, then sit down on the curb.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r495","rowIndex":495,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　道の向こう、<tips=9>Y地区</tips>側に小学生低学年くらいの子供がいるのが目に入る。","en":"Across the road, on the <tips=9>Y District</tips> side, I notice a child who looks to be in the first few years of elementary school.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r496","rowIndex":496,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　子供はしゃがみ込んで電信柱の根本のあたりを指でいじっている。蟻か何かにいたずらしているのかな。","en":"The child is crouched at the base of a utility pole, prodding at something with one finger. Is he tormenting ants or something?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r497","rowIndex":497,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=9>Y地区</tips>の貧民の子だろうか？　その子供は色あせたTシャツを着て、膝小僧にはかさぶたがあった。顔つきは東洋人にしては少し濃く、別の血が混ざっているのかもしれない。","en":"Is he a child from one of the poor families in <tips=9>Y District</tips>? His T-shirt is faded, and his knees are scabbed. His features are somewhat stronger than those of most East Asians; perhaps he is of mixed ancestry.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r498","rowIndex":498,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　あの子も今は夢中で遊んでいるけれど、いつまでも無邪気なままではいられないんだろう。人間は誰でも年をとって必要なことも不必要なことも知ってゆき、変わってゆく。それは<tips=9>Y地区</tips>でも他の場所でも同じことだ。","en":"He is absorbed in his play now, but I suppose he cannot remain innocent forever. Every human being grows older, learns both necessary and unnecessary things, and changes. That is the same in <tips=9>Y District</tips> as it is anywhere else.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r499","rowIndex":499,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　親しい人が死ぬこともあるし、想像していたより興ざめでつまらないと幻滅することもある。思っていたより楽しく素敵なものを見つけることもある。みな、この同じ世界を共有しているはずなのに、感じ方はいろいろだ。","en":"People close to us die. Things we imagined turn out to be dull and tedious, leaving us disillusioned. We find other things more wonderful and delightful than we expected. We all ought to share this one world, and yet each of us experiences it differently.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r500","rowIndex":500,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　あの子が大人になって、この場所をどんなふうに感じるのか？　いまのまま素敵な場所として思えるのか。それとも存在するだけで血を吐きたくなるような苦しくつらい場所と思ってしまうのか。","en":"When that child grows up, how will this place feel to him? Will he still think of it as somewhere wonderful? Or will he find it such a painful and cruel place that merely existing there makes him want to vomit blood?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r501","rowIndex":501,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　どうなるんだろうなあと、お岩さんみたいにむくんだまぶたに圧迫された細い視界でぼんやりと眺めながら考えていた。","en":"I wonder how he will turn out. I gaze absently at him through the narrow slits left by my eyelids, swollen like Oiwa’s.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r502","rowIndex":502,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　すると、<tips=44>筱喬</tips>が帰ってくる。","en":"Then <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> returns.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r503","rowIndex":503,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どうしたの？　何を見てるの？」","en":"“What’s wrong? What are you looking at?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r504","rowIndex":504,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そう訊ねる彼女に私は首を振る。","en":"I shake my head at her question.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r505","rowIndex":505,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なんでもない。行こう」","en":"“Nothing. Let’s go.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r506","rowIndex":506,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして立ち上がると、義足だということを忘れて以前と同じような力の入れ方をしてしまって、ぐらりと身体が揺れた。","en":"I rise, forgetting that one of my legs is prosthetic, and put my weight into the movement just as I used to. My body lurches sideways.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r507","rowIndex":507,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=44>筱喬</tips>は慌ててそれを支えてくれる。","en":"<tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> catches me in alarm.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:D5:r508","rowIndex":508,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は照れくさく笑い、そして自分の力で身体を支えると。パンパンとお尻をはたいて服に付着した砂を払った。","en":"I laugh in embarrassment, then steady myself on my own. I slap my backside several times, brushing the sand from my clothes.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}}]},{"position":54,"code":"X15-1","unitId":"X15-1","rows":[{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r1","rowIndex":1,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=82>内田広美</tips>は埼玉県某市のごく平凡な家庭に生まれた。","en":"<tips=82>Hiromi</tips> Uchida was born into an entirely ordinary family in a certain city in Saitama Prefecture.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r2","rowIndex":2,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　父親は都内の食品メーカーに勤め、母親はピアノ教師をして生計の手助けをしていた。","en":"Her father worked for a food manufacturer in Tokyo, while her mother supplemented the household income by teaching piano.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r3","rowIndex":3,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　どちらも特に<tips=72>傾向値</tips>が高いということもなく、<tips=82>広美</tips>のあとに生まれた二つ年下の妹もノーマルだった。両方の祖父母にも異常があらわれたものはいない。","en":"Neither parent had a particularly high <tips=72>tendency value</tips>, and the younger sister born two years after <tips=82>Hiromi</tips> was a Normal. Neither set of grandparents had shown any abnormalities, either.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r4","rowIndex":4,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　つまり、その家系ではただ一人<tips=82>内田広美</tips>だけが<tips=17>タイプB</tips>として生まれたのだった。","en":"In other words, <tips=82>Hiromi</tips> Uchida alone in her entire family line was born <tips=17>Type B</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r5","rowIndex":5,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　母が妊娠時に口にしたものがよくなかったのかもしれない。あるいは何か偶然のいたずらによるものだったのかもしれない。","en":"Perhaps it was something her mother had eaten during pregnancy. Or perhaps it was nothing more than a caprice of chance.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r6","rowIndex":6,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　何が決定的な要因となったのか定かではないのだが、このような<tips=17>タイプB</tips>となんの縁もない夫婦の間に<tips=17>タイプB</tips>が生まれるという例は世の中にも一定数存在する。ただ、<tips=82>広美</tips>が生まれたころにはこうした現象は一般的な知識にはなっておらず、<tips=17>タイプB</tips>のいる血族に新たな<tips=17>タイプB</tips>が生まれるとされていた。","en":"The decisive cause remains unknown, but a certain number of <tips=17>Type B</tips> children are born to couples with no <tips=17>Type B</tips> connection anywhere in their families. When <tips=82>Hiromi</tips> was born, however, this phenomenon was not yet widely known. The accepted belief was that new <tips=17>Type Bs</tips> appeared only in bloodlines that already contained a <tips=17>Type B</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r7","rowIndex":7,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　胎児の時点で検査を受ければかなり高い精度で<tips=17>タイプB</tips>を判別することが可能だ。","en":"Prenatal testing could determine with considerable accuracy whether a fetus was <tips=17>Type B</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r8","rowIndex":8,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　だから、身内に<tips=17>タイプB</tips>がいる夫婦などはよくその検査を受け、<tips=17>タイプB</tips>が宿っているとわかればその時点で人工中絶手術を受ける夫婦も少なくない。が、この夫婦は自分たちの新しい家族が<tips=17>タイプB</tips>だとは夢にも思わず、出生前の検査は行われなかった。","en":"Consequently, couples with a <tips=17>Type B</tips> relative often underwent the test, and quite a few chose to terminate the pregnancy if the fetus proved to be <tips=17>Type B</tips>. This couple, however, never dreamed that the new member of their family would be <tips=17>Type B</tips>, so no prenatal testing was performed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r9","rowIndex":9,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして、出生直後の検査で<tips=82>広美</tips>の<tips=72>傾向値</tips>が規準をこえていることが判明し、産科医が家にやって来る新しいメンバーが<tips=17>タイプB</tips>であることを告知すると、夫婦の目の前は真っ暗になった。今よりも忌まれていた時代である。","en":"Tests immediately after the birth revealed that <tips=82>Hiromi’s</tips> <tips=72>tendency value</tips> exceeded the threshold. When the obstetrician informed the couple that the newest member of their family was a <tips=17>Type B</tips>, the world went black before their eyes. This was an age when Type Bs were even more reviled than they are today.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r10","rowIndex":10,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　とは言え、発症さえしなければ<tips=17>タイプB</tips>も普通の子供とかわらない。","en":"Even so, a <tips=17>Type B</tips> child is no different from any other child as long as symptoms never appear.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r11","rowIndex":11,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　はじめのショックさえ乗り越えてしまえば、将来の不安こそ残るものの、目の前の娘の愛らしさがネガティブな感情を上回った。","en":"Once the couple overcame their initial shock, anxiety about the future remained, but the little girl before them was adorable enough to outweigh those negative feelings.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r12","rowIndex":12,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　このまま一生発症しなければ、ノーマルと変わらない一生を送れる。そうした<tips=17>タイプB</tips>もけして少なくない。","en":"If she could go her entire life without developing symptoms, she could live a life no different from that of a Normal. Nor were such <tips=17>Type Bs</tips> especially rare.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r13","rowIndex":13,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　夫婦は食べ物や環境に気をつけ、少しでも<tips=72>傾向値</tips>のあがらない生活を心がけたが、結局その努力をあざ笑うかのような現実が彼らの前に現れることになる。","en":"The couple watched her diet and environment, striving to live in a way that would keep her <tips=72>tendency value</tips> from rising even slightly. In the end, however, a reality that seemed to mock their efforts would confront them.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r14","rowIndex":14,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　中学校にあがったころから兆候が少しずつ姿を見せ始めた。","en":"The first signs began to emerge little by little around the time she entered middle school.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r15","rowIndex":15,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それまでどちらかと言えばおっとりしていた<tips=82>広美</tips>は神経質になり、独り言が増える。","en":"<tips=82>Hiromi</tips>, who had always been rather easygoing, grew nervous and began talking to herself more often.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r16","rowIndex":16,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　はじめは思春期特有の不安定な精神によるものだと思いたかったが、すぐにそれでは説明しきれない現象が我が子に発生していることを認めざるをえなくなった。","en":"At first, her parents wanted to believe it was merely the emotional instability peculiar to puberty. They soon had no choice but to admit that something was happening to their daughter which puberty alone could not explain.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r17","rowIndex":17,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　存在しない声に責められた<tips=82>広美</tips>は暴れ回り、その時彼女の目は金色になって、父親の力でも抑えきれないほどの腕力を発揮する。医者に診せると、ついに<tips=17>タイプB</tips>性の精神病が発症したと診断された。その言葉は夫婦にとって死刑宣告のように響いた。","en":"Tormented by voices that did not exist, <tips=82>Hiromi</tips> flew into violent fits. At those times, her eyes turned gold and she displayed strength beyond even her father’s ability to restrain. When her parents took her to a doctor, she was diagnosed at last with psychosis associated with <tips=17>Type B</tips> onset. To the couple, the words sounded like a death sentence.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r18","rowIndex":18,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　覚悟はしていたが、我が子だけはきっと発症しないのではないかという希望も同じくらい持っていた。それが無惨にも打ち砕かれたわけである。","en":"They had braced themselves for it, but they held out just as much hope that their own child, at least, might never develop symptoms. That hope was cruelly shattered.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r19","rowIndex":19,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　信じたくなかったが、事実を受け入れるしかない。","en":"They did not want to believe it, but they had no choice except to accept the fact.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r20","rowIndex":20,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　発症したらどうなるのか？　あらかじめ学習はしていたが、実感は出来なかった。","en":"What would happen once symptoms appeared? They had learned about it in advance, but could not imagine what it would truly be like.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r21","rowIndex":21,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　一般的には発症した<tips=17>タイプB</tips>というものは街中でそうそう見かける存在ではない。そもそも<tips=17>タイプB</tips>自体がひっそりと隠れて暮らしているものだ。彼らは自らカラーコンタクトで目を隠し、素性を隠しながら生きている。そして発症すると、今度は家族や近しいものの手によって病院や施設などに送り込まれ、隠されることになる。","en":"Generally, people rarely see a symptomatic <tips=17>Type B</tips> out on the streets. <tips=17>Type Bs</tips> tend to live quietly, hidden away. They conceal their eyes with colored contacts and go through life hiding who they are. Once symptoms appear, their families or others close to them send them to hospitals or institutions, where they are hidden away all over again.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r22","rowIndex":22,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　普通に暮らしていれば<tips=17>タイプB</tips>と認識して接することはあまりなく、街中で見かけるとすれば突発的な発作で目を金色に光らせて暴れ回る人間に遭遇するくらいだろう。実際多くの人は症状がないか、薬によって押さえ込めている<tips=17>タイプB</tips>と出会っているのだが、その場合はそうと気づかない。<tips=17>タイプB</tips>だとはっきりわかるときは、このように迷惑行為をしたときと決まっており、そのせいで、多くの人々の偏見を助長する結果になっている。","en":"In the course of ordinary life, people seldom interact with someone while knowing they are a <tips=17>Type B</tips>. About the only time one sees one on the street is when someone suffers a sudden episode, their eyes shining gold, and goes on a rampage. In fact, most people do encounter <tips=17>Type Bs</tips> who either have no symptoms or are keeping them under control with medication, but in those cases they never realize it. Whenever someone is unmistakably a <tips=17>Type B</tips>, it is invariably because they have caused a public disturbance like this, and that only reinforces widespread prejudice.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r23","rowIndex":23,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　夫婦にとっても<tips=17>タイプB</tips>といえば派手な症状のことがまず念頭に思い浮かび、はじめから恐怖があった。そして実際、妄想にとりつかれ、わけのわからぬことを騒ぎ立てる娘の姿を見るとその思いは強まった。","en":"For the couple too, the words <tips=17>Type B</tips> brought dramatic symptoms immediately to mind, so they were afraid from the outset. When they actually saw their daughter possessed by delusions and shouting incomprehensible things, that fear only intensified.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r24","rowIndex":24,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　病院に数日入院し、薬が効いて落ち着いた状態で戻ってきたが、しかし元に戻ったとは到底言いがたい姿であった。","en":"After several days in the hospital, she returned home once the medication had calmed her down; even so, she could hardly be said to be back to her old self.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r25","rowIndex":25,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　効き目の強すぎる向精神薬で一日中ぼうっとして、ろくに会話もしない。小さな声でブツブツと話し、ひとりでうっすらと笑う。文字を書くことも出来なくなった。","en":"Overpowering psychotropic medication left her dazed all day and scarcely capable of conversation. She muttered under her breath and smiled faintly to herself. She could no longer even write.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r26","rowIndex":26,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　以前のおしゃべり好きで、物覚えがいいと褒められた<tips=82>広美</tips>の姿はどこにもなかった。","en":"Nothing remained of the talkative <tips=82>Hiromi</tips> who had once been praised for her excellent memory.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r27","rowIndex":27,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そうしたある日、<tips=82>広美</tips>は夜中に突如起き出して自宅に火をつけてしまう。幸い家族はみな脱出することが出来たが、飼っていた犬が死に、妹にあとが残るような火傷を負わせてしまった。","en":"Then one night, <tips=82>Hiromi</tips> rose abruptly and set fire to the family home. Fortunately, everyone escaped, but the family dog died, and her younger sister suffered burns that left permanent scars.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r28","rowIndex":28,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なんてことをするのっ！」","en":"“How could you do this?!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r29","rowIndex":29,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　母親は泣いて<tips=82>広美</tips>の頬を力任せに殴った。","en":"Her mother wept as she struck <tips=82>Hiromi</tips> across the cheek with all her strength.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r30","rowIndex":30,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=82>広美</tips>は混乱し、泣きわめく。","en":"Bewildered, <tips=82>Hiromi</tips> wailed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r31","rowIndex":31,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「やめてよ！　偽物のくせに！　本当のお母さんを返してっ！」","en":"“Stop it! You’re an impostor! Give me back my real mother!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r32","rowIndex":32,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　放火は彼女の妄想によるものだった。家族が偽物に入れ替わっていると信じ込み、燃やせば本当の家族が帰って来ると思って火を付けたのだ。","en":"The arson was born of her delusion. Convinced that her family had been replaced by impostors, she had set the fire in the belief that if she burned them, her real family would come back.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r33","rowIndex":33,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　こうした事件を起こしてしまえばもう社会では暮らせない。","en":"Once she had caused an incident like this, she could no longer live in society.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r34","rowIndex":34,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　これがきっかけに彼女は半ば強制的に入院させられることになり、やがて症状がさらに悪化すると特に重度のものが収容される<tips=6>巻河原病院</tips>へ転院することとなった。","en":"The incident led to her being hospitalized against her will in all but name. When her condition deteriorated still further, she was eventually transferred to <tips=6>Makigawara Hospital</tips>, an institution reserved for especially severe cases.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r35","rowIndex":35,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ここが『<tips=6>タイプＢ収容所</tips>』と呼ばれる悪名高い施設であることを、両親は知らなかった。","en":"Her parents did not know that this was an infamous institution known as the “<tips=6>Type B Internment Center</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r36","rowIndex":36,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それから三年間、<tips=9>Y地区</tips>の外れにあるこの古びた建物のなかで、<tips=82>内田広美</tips>は十代の貴重な時間を過ごした。","en":"For the next three years, <tips=82>Hiromi Uchida</tips> spent precious years of her adolescence inside that aging building on the outskirts of <tips=9>Y District</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r37","rowIndex":37,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　若さのわりにあまりにも症状の進行が早く、人格は完全に崩壊し、自分の身のまわりのことは排泄や入浴さえ介助がなければまともに出来ず、ほとんど誰とも会話を成立させることが出来なかった。","en":"Her illness had progressed with extraordinary speed for someone so young. Her personality had completely disintegrated; without assistance, she could not properly manage even her own toileting or bathing, and she could scarcely carry on a coherent conversation with anyone.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r38","rowIndex":38,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それが、病院を襲撃した<tips=21>八龍会</tips><tips=47>解放軍</tips>に『<tips=46>ネオ・ローズ</tips>』を投与された途端、にわかに年相応の心と理性を取り戻したのである。","en":"All that changed the moment the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips> <tips=47>Liberation Army</tips> that had attacked the hospital administered <tips=46>Neo Rose</tips> to her: she suddenly regained the mind and reason of someone her age.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r39","rowIndex":39,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女はしばらく、自分の身に起きた奇跡を理解することが出来なかった。","en":"For some time, she could not comprehend the miracle that had befallen her.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r40","rowIndex":40,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それまで彼女の心のなかを満たしていた妄想と幻覚が去って、正しく現実と向き合った。そのとき最初に彼女が感じたのは、むせかえるような血の臭いだった。","en":"The delusions and hallucinations that had filled her mind receded, allowing her to see reality as it was. The first thing she sensed was the choking smell of blood.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r41","rowIndex":41,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女はホールの片隅の壁に寄りかかって座り込んでいた。その向こうには、白衣の人々の折り重なった死体があり、そこから流れ出る真っ赤な血液が小さな池を作っている。","en":"She sat in one corner of the hall with her back against the wall. Beyond her lay a heap of bodies in white coats, and the vivid red blood flowing from them had formed a small pool.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r42","rowIndex":42,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その顔の多くは、彼女の知っていたものばかりだ。","en":"Most of the faces were familiar to her.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r43","rowIndex":43,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　症状に冒されていた間の記憶は、全く失われたわけじゃない。彼らと会話したり、一緒に遊んだことは覚えている。それがこうして変わり果てた姿になり、かわりに銃を持ったいかめしい顔つきの人々が闊歩している。","en":"Her memories of the time her symptoms had consumed her were not entirely gone. She remembered talking and playing with these people. Now here they were, reduced to this terrible state, while grim-faced people carrying guns strode about in their place.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r44","rowIndex":44,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その光景はまるで夢のようで、自分から妄想が去り、現実に戻って来たことを理解するまでに時間がかかった。","en":"The sight was so dreamlike that it took her some time to understand that her delusions had left her and she had returned to reality.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r45","rowIndex":45,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　自分の手を握ったり開いたりして、ぼんやりとそれを眺めている。","en":"She opened and closed her hands, staring at them vaguely.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r46","rowIndex":46,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"（ぐー。ぱー。ぐー。ぱー……）","en":"(Clench. Open. Clench. Open...)","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r47","rowIndex":47,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　心のなかで呟きながら見るその白く細い指先の爪は綺麗に切り揃えられている。それは、いまは目の前で遺体の一つとなっている看護助手の乗田みやこが一昨日切ってくれたものだ。","en":"As she repeated the words inside her head, she gazed at the neatly trimmed nails on those slender white fingers. They had been cut only the day before yesterday by Miyako Norita, the nursing assistant who now lay among the corpses before her.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r48","rowIndex":48,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"（ぐー。ぱー。ぐー。ぱー……）","en":"(Clench. Open. Clench. Open...)","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r49","rowIndex":49,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　うつろな表情で握ったり開いたりを繰り返していると、３０８号室の方から男の荒々しい怒鳴り声が聞こえて来る。","en":"As she continued opening and closing her hands with a vacant expression, a man’s furious shout came from the direction of Room 308.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r50","rowIndex":50,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=47>解放軍</tips>の男が、患者たちに集まるよう呼びかけている。","en":"A <tips=47>Liberation Army</tips> man was calling for the patients to gather.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r51","rowIndex":51,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　長年の病院暮らしですっかり従順になっていた<tips=82>広美</tips>は、その言葉によってほとんど自動的に立ち上がると、夢遊病者のような足取りで声の方向へ向かった。","en":"Long years in the hospital had made <tips=82>Hiromi</tips> completely obedient. At his words, she rose almost automatically and moved toward the voice with the steps of a sleepwalker.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r52","rowIndex":52,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　畳敷きのその大部屋には<tips=46>ネオ・ローズ</tips>の効果によって本来の人格と知性を取り戻し、<tips=82>広美</tips>が知っているものとは違うきりりとした顔つきになった患者たちが集まり、不安げな表情で口々に何かを囁きあっている。<tips=82>広美</tips>はその端のほうにちょこんと正座をした。","en":"Patients had gathered in the large tatami room, their original personalities and intellects restored by <tips=46>Neo Rose</tips>. Their alert, composed faces bore little resemblance to the ones <tips=82>Hiromi</tips> knew, and they exchanged anxious whispers. <tips=82>Hiromi</tips> tucked herself into seiza at the very edge of the group.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r53","rowIndex":53,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　前には銃を持った<tips=47>解放軍</tips>のメンバーが立っている。そしてそのなかでただ一人の女性が話し始めた。","en":"<tips=47>Liberation Army</tips> members carrying guns stood before them. The only woman among them began to speak.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r54","rowIndex":54,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女はまず副隊長の<tips=67>カミラ・ノーサム</tips>と名乗った。","en":"She began by introducing herself as Deputy Commander <tips=67>Camilla Northam</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r55","rowIndex":55,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「我々は<tips=47>八龍解放軍</tips>です。あなたたちをこの恐ろしい場所から解放するためにやって来ました」","en":"“We are the <tips=47>Hachiryu Liberation Army</tips>. We have come to liberate you from this horrific place.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"カミラ","displayName":"Camilla","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r56","rowIndex":56,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=67>カミラ</tips>はよく通る声で、朗々と自分たちの趣旨を説明した。","en":"In a clear, ringing voice, <tips=67>Camilla</tips> proclaimed the purpose of their organization.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r57","rowIndex":57,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「みなさんご存じですか？　この病院は、街では『<tips=6>タイプＢ収容所</tips>』と呼ばれていることを。みなさんに対して治療と称して行っていたのは、治りもしない薬を投与して心を鈍らせ、この鍵のかかった場所に閉じ込めて家畜のように飼うという、恐るべき人権侵害です。我々はみなさんがそのように扱われている状況に、どうしても納得がいかなかったのです」","en":"“Do you know what people in the city call this hospital? The ‘<tips=6>Type B Internment Center</tips>.’ What they did to you in the name of treatment was a terrible violation of your human rights. They dulled your minds with drugs that could never cure you, locked you inside this place, and kept you like livestock. We could not abide the way you were being treated.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"カミラ","displayName":"Camilla","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r58","rowIndex":58,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=82>広美</tips>は他の患者がどのようにこの言葉を聞いているのか気になって、チラチラと表情を盗み見た。","en":"Curious how the other patients were receiving these words, <tips=82>Hiromi</tips> stole glances at their faces.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r59","rowIndex":59,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　多くの患者たちは<tips=82>広美</tips>と同じように、状況を受け止めきれずにまだ困惑しているようだった。","en":"Most of the patients, like <tips=82>Hiromi</tips>, still seemed bewildered, unable to take in what was happening.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r60","rowIndex":60,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「今まで我々の心は、一度病気がはじまってしまったら二度と治らないと言われていました。しかし、私たち<tips=21>八龍会</tips>は、みなさんがいま実感されているように、病を取り除く薬を持っています。医者たちが与える、私たちから自由を奪うだけのおぞましい薬ではなく、本当に人間らしく生きるための薬です。これがあれば、私たちはもう誰からも自由をおかされることがなく、対等に……いや、私たちのこの優れた身体があれば、ノーマル以上の存在として生きてゆくことが出来るのです。今日からみなさんも、それをはっきりと自覚してください。もう、みなさんは他人から蔑まれたり、哀れまれたりする存在ではないんです」","en":"“We had been told that once our minds became ill, they could never recover. But as all of you can feel for yourselves now, we of the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips> possess medicine that removes the illness. This is not the hideous medicine doctors give us merely to rob us of our freedom. It is medicine that allows us to live as true human beings. With this, no one can violate our freedom again. We can live as equals... No. With these superior bodies of ours, we can live as beings greater than Normals. From this day forward, every one of you must recognize that clearly. You are no longer creatures for others to scorn or pity.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"カミラ","displayName":"Camilla","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r61","rowIndex":61,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=67>カミラ</tips>の顔にはうっすらと笑みが浮かんでいる。","en":"A faint smile rests upon <tips=67>Camilla’s</tips> face.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r62","rowIndex":62,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"（どうしてあんな顔をしているんだろう？）","en":"(Why does she have that look on her face?)","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r63","rowIndex":63,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=82>広美</tips>は言葉の意味自体は理解出来たが、情熱的に話すその態度にはピンと来ず、むしろ何か怖いようなものを感じた。","en":"<tips=82>Hiromi</tips> understood the words themselves, but Camilla’s passionate delivery failed to resonate with her. If anything, she found it somehow frightening.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r64","rowIndex":64,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「さあ、それではみなさんはこの忌まわしい牢獄から出ましょう！　そしてここを出たあとは、もちろん何をなさっても自由です。ご家族のもとへ戻ったり、仕事をしたり……今までやりたくても出来なかったことが、いろいろとあるでしょうが、全て自由です」","en":"“Now then, everyone, let us leave this accursed prison! And once you are out of here, of course, you are free to do whatever you wish. You may return to your families, find work... There must be all sorts of things you have wanted to do but could not. You are free to do any of them.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"カミラ","displayName":"Camilla","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r65","rowIndex":65,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ただ、その前に一旦私たちと一緒に<tips=21>八龍会</tips>の施設に来て頂きます。みなさんをいま正常にしている薬は、今後も飲み続けなければいけないものなので、それについて簡単にご説明いたします。そうしたら、あとはもう自由です。もし行く場所がない方がいたら……あるいは、ご家族のところへ行ったあとで思ったような状況と違うと感じられた後でも、いつでも構いません。いついかなるときも、全ての方を、我々<tips=21>八龍会</tips>は大歓迎します」","en":"“But before that, you will accompany us briefly to a facility operated by the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips>. The medicine that is keeping you normal now is something you will have to continue taking, so we will give you a brief explanation of it. After that, you will be entirely free. If any of you have nowhere to go... or even if, after returning to your families, you find that things are not as you had hoped, you may turn to us at any time. At any time and under any circumstances, we of the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips> will welcome every one of you with open arms.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"カミラ","displayName":"Camilla","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r66","rowIndex":66,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「皆優しくて、家族のように迎え入れてくれます。週末はレクリエーションをしてみんなで料理を食べてお酒を飲んだり、みんなで温泉旅行に行くこともあります。楽しいですよ？　そして将来的には、私たち<tips=21>八龍会</tips>はこの街を我々<tips=17>タイプB</tips>のための楽園にしようと考えています！　まあ、そのことはあとで詳しく説明するとして、とにかく、ここをさっさと出ましょう！　この忌まわしい牢獄を！」","en":"“Everyone is kind and will welcome you like family. On weekends, we have recreational activities, eat and drink together, and sometimes take group trips to hot springs. It is fun, you know? And in the future, we of the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips> intend to make this city a paradise for us <tips=17>Type Bs</tips>! Well, I can explain that in detail later. For now, let us get out of here at once! Out of this accursed prison!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"カミラ","displayName":"Camilla","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r67","rowIndex":67,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=67>カミラ</tips>と<tips=47>解放軍</tips>たちの指示によって患者たちはぞろぞろと列を作って移動をはじめる。その言葉が患者たちにどの程度浸透したのか、<tips=82>広美</tips>は知りたかったがみな無言でわからなかった。いずれにしろ、銃を持って殺戮を繰り広げたものたちの言葉に逆らおうとするものがいないのは確かだった。","en":"At the direction of <tips=67>Camilla</tips> and the <tips=47>Liberation Army</tips>, the patients formed a straggling line and began moving. <tips=82>Hiromi</tips> wanted to know how thoroughly their words had sunk in, but everyone remained silent, so she could not tell. In any case, one thing was certain: no one attempted to defy the people with guns who had carried out the slaughter.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r68","rowIndex":68,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ホールの死体の山の隣を通り過ぎるときは、顔色を変えるものが多かった。ひっと悲鳴をあげて恐怖を露わにするものもいた。","en":"Many of them went pale as they passed the heap of bodies in the hall. Some gave little shrieks and displayed their fear openly.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r69","rowIndex":69,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"（あの人、前は何があっても無反応だったのに……）","en":"(That person never reacted to anything before...)","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r70","rowIndex":70,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　怯える老人の姿に<tips=82>広美</tips>はそんな感慨をもったが、彼女自身、そんな風に他人を観察して感想をもつなどという知的作業が以前は出来ず、症状の改善によって今出来ているということには気がついていなかった。","en":"The sight of the frightened old man stirred that thought in <tips=82>Hiromi</tips>. What she did not realize was that before today, she had been incapable of anything so intellectual as observing another person and reflecting on what she saw. She could do it now only because her symptoms had receded.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r71","rowIndex":71,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　一行には老人も多く、階段では手すりにしがみつくようにして震えながら降りるものもいた。<tips=82>広美</tips>はその肩を支えて一緒に降りた。","en":"There were many elderly people in the group. Some clung to the railing and trembled as they descended the stairs. <tips=82>Hiromi</tips> supported one woman by the shoulder and went down beside her.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r72","rowIndex":72,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ありがとう。でも、まさか<tips=82>広美</tips>ちゃんに肩を貸して貰えるとはねえ」","en":"“Thank you. I never expected that you would be the one lending me a shoulder, <tips=82>Hiromi</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r73","rowIndex":73,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その上品な老女は小林という患者で、病棟内ではしっかりしている方で、<tips=82>広美</tips>に異変があるとよく職員に連絡してくれた。","en":"The refined old woman was a patient named Kobayashi. She had been one of the more lucid patients on the ward, and whenever she noticed something amiss with <tips=82>Hiromi</tips>, she would alert the staff.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r74","rowIndex":74,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ほら、ヨウコちゃんもあんなにしゃっきりしちゃって。本当に夢みたい。こんなことがあるなんて……」","en":"“Look at Yoko too. She’s so alert now. It truly feels like a dream. Who could imagine such a thing...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r75","rowIndex":75,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　小林は言ってから溜息をつき、","en":"Kobayashi sighs after speaking.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r76","rowIndex":76,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「でも、私たちどうなるのかしら。あんな、平気で人を殺すような人たちなんて、こわくてしかたないわ」","en":"“But what is going to happen to us? Those people kill others without a second thought. I’m frightened to death of them.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r77","rowIndex":77,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　前を行く<tips=47>解放軍</tips>のものたちに聞こえぬよう、<tips=82>広美</tips>の耳元で囁いた。","en":"She whispers into <tips=82>Hiromi’s</tips> ear so the <tips=47>Liberation Army</tips> members ahead cannot hear.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r78","rowIndex":78,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　病棟から出た<tips=82>広美</tips>が見た光景は、曇天からとめどもなく降り落ちる雨だった。迂闊に一歩を踏み出すと、介護シューズを履いた足がぬかるんだ泥を踏み、中に水が沁みた。","en":"When <tips=82>Hiromi</tips> emerged from the ward, she found rain streaming without end from an overcast sky. She took an unwary step. Her care shoe sank into the mud, and water seeped inside.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r79","rowIndex":79,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どうだ、久しぶりに見る外の景色だろう？」","en":"“Well? Been a long time since you saw the world outside, has it?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r80","rowIndex":80,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=47>解放軍</tips>のひげもじゃの男が患者たちを振り返ってそう言った。","en":"A bearded <tips=47>Liberation Army</tips> man looks back at the patients and speaks.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r81","rowIndex":81,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しかし、患者たちは彼らが思っているほど徹底的に閉じ込められていたわけではなく、春の桜の季節や天気のよい日などは職員に連れられて敷地内を散歩したりしていた。本当に病棟から出たことがないのは散歩を面倒がるごく数人で、ほとんどのものにとっては目新しいものではない。その男の笑いは虚しく響いた。","en":"However, the patients had not been confined nearly as thoroughly as the Liberation Army seemed to think. During cherry-blossom season and on fine days, the staff had taken them for walks around the grounds. Only a very few who found the walks too much trouble had truly never left the ward; for most of them, the sight was nothing new. The man’s laughter rang hollow.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r82","rowIndex":82,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　雨の中、足元を泥だらけにしながら門をくぐる。ここから外は、患者の多くにとってはまさに数年ぶり、人によっては数十年ぶりとなる世界だった。","en":"They passed through the gate in the rain, their feet coated with mud. The world beyond it was one most of the patients had not entered for years—and some, for decades.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r83","rowIndex":83,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しかし彼らにはその余韻に浸っている時間はない。出口の側には四台のマイクロバスが止まっており、患者たちはそこに乗るよう指示された。","en":"But they had no time to savor the moment. Four minibuses waited beside the exit, and the patients were instructed to board them.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r84","rowIndex":84,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　この作業は時間に追われてのもののようで、老人ばかりの集団がのろのろと乗り込んでいると、<tips=47>解放軍</tips>の男たちは「おそいぞ！」「早くしろ！」などと怒鳴り声を上げた。","en":"The operation appeared pressed for time. As the group, composed mostly of elderly people, shuffled slowly aboard, the <tips=47>Liberation Army</tips> men shouted, ‘Too slow!’ and ‘Hurry up!’","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r85","rowIndex":85,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=82>広美</tips>はその声を非常に恐ろしく聞きながらバスに乗り込んだ。","en":"Terrified by the men’s shouts, <tips=82>Hiromi</tips> climbed aboard the bus.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r86","rowIndex":86,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ああ、また外に出られる日が来るなんて信じられないわ！」","en":"“Oh, I can’t believe the day has come when I can go outside again!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r87","rowIndex":87,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=82>広美</tips>の隣に座った本田という中年の女性患者は、ピンク色のパジャマを雨に濡らしながら興奮している。","en":"The middle-aged patient beside <tips=82>Hiromi</tips> is a woman named Honda. Rain has soaked her pink pajamas, but she is beside herself with excitement.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r88","rowIndex":88,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ああ、もう、こんなものいらないわ！」","en":"“Oh, I don’t need this thing anymore!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r89","rowIndex":89,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女は頭部を覆っていたピンク色のヘッドガードを脱ぎ捨てると、","en":"She tears off the pink protective headguard covering her head and throws it down.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r90","rowIndex":90,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「病院の連中は、私にこんなみっともないものをつけさせて。まったく、死んでせいせいしたわ」","en":"“The people at the hospital made me wear this humiliating thing. Honestly, I’m glad they’re dead.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r91","rowIndex":91,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そう言って、サンダルの足で踏みにじる。","en":"She tramples it beneath her sandaled foot.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r92","rowIndex":92,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そんなこと言うもんじゃないわ。みんなよくしてくれたじゃない」","en":"“You shouldn’t say such things. They treated us well.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r93","rowIndex":93,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　本田の向こうに座った鳶野という老いた患者が渋い顔で窘めた。","en":"An elderly patient named Tobino, seated on Honda’s other side, frowns as she rebukes her.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r94","rowIndex":94,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なにが良くしてくれたって？　治りもしない苦しい薬を飲ませて、威張ってただけじゃない。こうやって<tips=47>解放軍</tips>の人たちが来てくれなかったら、わたしたち一生あのままだったのよ？」","en":"“What do you mean, they treated us well? All they did was force us to take painful drugs that never cured us and lord it over us. If the <tips=47>Liberation Army</tips> hadn’t come, we would have stayed that way for the rest of our lives!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r95","rowIndex":95,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それはそうかもしれないけど……」","en":"“That may be true, but...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r96","rowIndex":96,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　本田にもの凄い剣幕でまくし立てられると、鳶野も口ごもる。","en":"Confronted by Honda’s furious barrage, Tobino falters.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r97","rowIndex":97,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=82>広美</tips>ちゃんだって、そう思うでしょ？　そうよね？　……ほら、そうだって言ってる」","en":"“You feel the same, don’t you, <tips=82>Hiromi</tips>? Of course you do. ...See? She says she agrees.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r98","rowIndex":98,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=82>広美</tips>が何も答えないうちに、本田は勝手に頷く。","en":"Before <tips=82>Hiromi</tips> can answer, Honda nods on her behalf.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r99","rowIndex":99,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そりゃそうよね。<tips=82>広美</tips>ちゃんなんか、本当にペットみたいに扱われていたもの。それがどう？　今は顔つきからして全然違うわ。これならどこにだしても恥ずかしくないお嬢さんよ」","en":"“Well, of course. You especially, <tips=82>Hiromi</tips>—they truly did treat you like a pet. And look at you now! Even your face is completely different. Now you are a perfectly presentable young lady.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r100","rowIndex":100,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まあ、<tips=82>広美</tips>ちゃんやあなたみたいな若い子にはありがたい話だろうね。私みたいなおばあちゃんには、もうどっちでもいいけど……。それより、あんな恐ろしいもの見せられちゃったら、きっとしばらく眠れないわ。それに、これから先のことを考えると不安で不安で……」","en":"“Well, I suppose this is a blessing for young people like you and <tips=82>Hiromi</tips>. For an old woman like me, it hardly matters either way... More importantly, after seeing something so horrible, I doubt I’ll sleep for some time. And when I think about what comes next, I feel more and more frightened...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r101","rowIndex":101,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　鳶野はしわだらけの枯れ木のような顔に、深い憂愁を浮かべて溜息をつく。","en":"Tobino sighs, deep melancholy settling upon her wrinkled face, withered like an old tree.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r102","rowIndex":102,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「何が不安なのよ」","en":"“What are you frightened of?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r103","rowIndex":103,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「だって、私は子供のときから病院暮らしで、外のことなんかもう覚えていないのよ。頼る家族だっていないし……」","en":"“But I have lived in hospitals since I was a child. I cannot remember anything about the world outside anymore, and I have no family to turn to...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r104","rowIndex":104,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「家族なんか私だっていないわ！　……いや、いるけど、会いたくない。だから<tips=21>八龍会</tips>に頼らせて貰うつもりよ。あなたもそうすればいいじゃない」","en":"“I don’t have any family either! ...No, I do, but I don’t want to see them. That’s why I’m planning to turn to the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips> for help. Why don’t you do the same?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r105","rowIndex":105,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……こんな老人が、なんの役に立つものかい。本当に、おそろしいことをしてくれたもんだねえ。天罰が下るよきっと。ナンマンダブ、ナンマンダブ……」","en":"“...What use could an old woman like me possibly be? They have done a truly dreadful thing. Divine punishment will fall upon them, surely. Namu Amida Butsu, Namu Amida Butsu...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r106","rowIndex":106,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　鳶野は両手を合わせて、拝む仕草をする。","en":"Tobino presses her palms together in prayer.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r107","rowIndex":107,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まあ！　そんな迷信じみたことして、まだ症状が消えてないんじゃないの？」","en":"“Goodness! Carrying on with such superstition—perhaps your symptoms haven’t gone away after all.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r108","rowIndex":108,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　本田は呆れて大げさに溜息をつくと、<tips=82>広美</tips>の方を向いた。","en":"Honda gives an exaggerated sigh of disbelief, then turns toward <tips=82>Hiromi</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r109","rowIndex":109,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ねえ、あなたはどうするの？　あなたも一緒に<tips=21>八龍会</tips>に入りましょうよ」","en":"“What are you going to do? Come on—let’s join the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips> together.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r110","rowIndex":110,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「私は……あの……」","en":"“I... um...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r111","rowIndex":111,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どうするの？　家族のところにでも行くっていうの？」","en":"“Well? Are you planning to go to your family or something?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r112","rowIndex":112,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=82>広美</tips>は何かはっきりと決めていたわけではなかったが、本田にそう詰め寄られるとそれが自分のほんとうの気持ちのように思えて、おずおずと頷いた。","en":"<tips=82>Hiromi</tips> had not made any definite decision, but when Honda pressed her this way, the idea began to feel like her own true desire. She nodded timidly.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r113","rowIndex":113,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「驚いた。そんなのしたって、いいことなんかないわよ？　あなたの家族も<tips=17>タイプB</tips>？　ノーマルでしょ。だったら、受け入れてなんかくれないわ。ノーマルはね、絶対に私たちのことなんか受け入れてくれないんだって。私はここに来る前はちゃんとした会社にいたんだけど、そこでもいじめられてたのよ。発症なんかしてなかったのに……あなたもいやな思いをするだけよ」","en":"“I’m astonished. Nothing good will come of that. Is your family <tips=17>Type B</tips> too? They’re Normals, aren’t they? Then they won’t accept you. Normals will never accept people like us. Before I came here, I worked for a perfectly respectable company, but they bullied me there too. Even though I hadn’t developed symptoms... You’ll only be hurt.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r114","rowIndex":114,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうでしょうか……」","en":"“Do you think so...?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r115","rowIndex":115,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうに決まってる！　さっき、あの人たちはこの街を私たちのものにするって言ってたでしょう。それが実現したらとても素敵なことだと思わない？　私たちが表で暮らして、逆にノーマルの人たちをどこかに閉じ込めるのよ。これまでされたことを、全部やりかえしてやるんだから」","en":"“Of course! Those people said they were going to make this city ours, didn’t they? Wouldn’t that be wonderful? We would live openly, and this time we would lock the Normals away somewhere. We will do every last thing they did to us right back to them.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r116","rowIndex":116,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　本田は興奮し、何度もむけてかさぶただらけとなった唇から唾液を飛ばして語る。","en":"Honda grows more excited as she speaks, spraying spittle from her repeatedly split, scab-covered lips.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r117","rowIndex":117,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=82>広美</tips>はその態度に閉口しながら首を捻り、","en":"Disconcerted by her manner, <tips=82>Hiromi</tips> tilts her head.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r118","rowIndex":118,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「でも私、お母さんとかお父さんとか、妹に会ってみたいんです……」","en":"“But I want to see my mother and father, and my little sister...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r119","rowIndex":119,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そう、それなら仕方ないわね」","en":"“I see. Then I suppose it can’t be helped.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r120","rowIndex":120,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　本田は急に冷淡な表情になってぴしゃりとそう言うと、今度は前の席に座った別の患者の頭をつついて、また自分の考えをまくしたてた。","en":"Honda’s face abruptly turns cold as she snaps the words. Then she prods the head of another patient in the seat before her and begins bombarding that person with her ideas instead.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r121","rowIndex":121,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　車は<tips=9>Y地区</tips>の市街の奥まった地域に入ってゆく。","en":"The bus travels deeper into the urban center of <tips=9>Y District</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r122","rowIndex":122,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ずっと病院にいた<tips=82>広美</tips>は、ほんのすぐそばにあるこの有名な繁華街を実際に目にするのは初めてのことだ。","en":"<tips=82>Hiromi</tips> had spent all those years inside the hospital. This was her first time actually seeing the famous entertainment district lying so close beside it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r123","rowIndex":123,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　異国情緒漂う景色を、目をきらきらさせながら物珍しく眺めているうちに、マイクロバスは目的の場所に到着した。","en":"As she gazes with sparkling eyes at the unfamiliar, exotic streets, the minibus reaches its destination.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r124","rowIndex":124,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それは、細かい路地の折り重なった住宅街の奥にあるアパートの前だった。これも<tips=21>八龍会</tips>のメンバーが所有するもので、患者たちはいくつかの建物に別れて生活し、薬の使い方を覚えたり、次の生活のための準備を行うことになっているのだという。","en":"It stops in front of an apartment building deep within a residential neighborhood where narrow alleys form a tangled maze. This building, too, is said to belong to a member of the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips>. The patients will live divided among several buildings, where they are to learn how to use their medicine and prepare for the next stage of their lives.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r125","rowIndex":125,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　バスを降りると、各自がこれからどうするつもりかを訊ねられた。家族の居場所がわかっていたり、どこか他に行く場所が決まっているものはこの時点で<tips=46>ネオ・ローズ</tips>といくばくかの交通費を受け取って帰ることが出来るようだった。","en":"After leaving the bus, each patient is asked what they intend to do. Anyone who knows where their family lives or has already decided upon another destination appears free to depart at this point with a supply of <tips=46>Neo Rose</tips> and a little money for transportation.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r126","rowIndex":126,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「私、家族のところへ戻りたいんです」","en":"“I want to go back to my family.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"内田広美（患者のＵ）","displayName":"Hiromi Uchida (Patient U)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r127","rowIndex":127,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　患者たちは列をつくって順番にノートと鉛筆を手にした<tips=47>解放軍</tips>の前に並び、<tips=82>広美</tips>は自分の順番が来るとそう言った。","en":"The patients form a line before <tips=47>Liberation Army</tips> members holding notebooks and pencils. When her turn arrives, <tips=82>Hiromi</tips> speaks.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r128","rowIndex":128,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それはいいけど、あなた名前は？」","en":"“That is fine. And your name?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"カミラ","displayName":"Camilla","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r129","rowIndex":129,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=82>広美</tips>の担当となったのは<tips=67>カミラ</tips>である。","en":"<tips=67>Camilla</tips> is the one assigned to <tips=82>Hiromi</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r130","rowIndex":130,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=82>内田広美</tips>です……」","en":"“<tips=82>Hiromi</tips> Uchida...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"内田広美（患者のＵ）","displayName":"Hiromi Uchida (Patient U)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r131","rowIndex":131,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「年は？」","en":"“Your age?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"カミラ","displayName":"Camilla","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r132","rowIndex":132,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=67>カミラ</tips>はノートから顔を上げるとジロリと<tips=82>広美</tips>の顔を見て言った。","en":"<tips=67>Camilla</tips> lifts her face from the notebook and gives <tips=82>Hiromi</tips> a sharp look.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r133","rowIndex":133,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「わかんないですけど、多分、十六とか、十七とか、十八……もしかしたらもっとかも……」","en":"“I don’t know. Maybe sixteen, or seventeen, or eighteen... Maybe even older...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"内田広美（患者のＵ）","displayName":"Hiromi Uchida (Patient U)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r134","rowIndex":134,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　周りのいかつい男たちから副隊長と呼ばれているその女性を前に、<tips=82>広美</tips>はおどおどしてしまう。","en":"Before this woman whom the fierce men around her address as deputy commander, <tips=82>Hiromi</tips> cannot help shrinking into herself.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r135","rowIndex":135,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「わかった。あとで調べておくわ。……それで、あなたの希望は家族のもとへ帰ることなのね？」","en":"“Understood. I’ll look it up later. ...And your wish is to return to your family?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"カミラ","displayName":"Camilla","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r136","rowIndex":136,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「はい、出来れば……」","en":"“Yes, if I can...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"内田広美（患者のＵ）","displayName":"Hiromi Uchida (Patient U)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r137","rowIndex":137,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「住所はわかってる？　……その調子じゃわからなそうね。必要ならば調べるけど……でも、家族との関係はどうなの？」　","en":"“Do you know their address? ...Judging by that answer, I suppose you do not. We can look it up if necessary, but... what sort of relationship do you have with your family?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"カミラ","displayName":"Camilla","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r138","rowIndex":138,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「関係、というと……？」","en":"“What do you mean by relationship...?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"内田広美（患者のＵ）","displayName":"Hiromi Uchida (Patient U)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r139","rowIndex":139,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「お父さんお母さんとは仲が良いの？　普段から面会に来てくれてたりしてた？」","en":"“Do you get along well with your mother and father? Did they come to visit you regularly?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"カミラ","displayName":"Camilla","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r140","rowIndex":140,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いえ、こっちに来てからは一度も……」","en":"“No. Not once since I came here...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"内田広美（患者のＵ）","displayName":"Hiromi Uchida (Patient U)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r141","rowIndex":141,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そう」","en":"“I see.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"カミラ","displayName":"Camilla","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r142","rowIndex":142,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=67>カミラ</tips>は溜息をつくと、<tips=82>広美</tips>の目をまっすぐ見つめ、","en":"<tips=67>Camilla</tips> sighs, then looks directly into <tips=82>Hiromi’s</tips> eyes.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r143","rowIndex":143,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「これは私の意見だけど、それなら無理に会おうとしない方がいいわ。きっとあなたのご家族も、今更あなたに帰って来られても困るはずよ」","en":"“This is only my opinion, but in that case, I think it would be better not to force a reunion. If you suddenly came home after all this time, your family would surely find your return a burden.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"カミラ","displayName":"Camilla","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r144","rowIndex":144,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうでしょうか」","en":"“Do you think so?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"内田広美（患者のＵ）","displayName":"Hiromi Uchida (Patient U)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r145","rowIndex":145,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「おそらくね。行ってもあなたが傷つくだけだわ。それより、新しいあなたの人生をここで見つけた方がずっと有意義だと思う。ここなら友だちも出来るわ。家族の顔を知らない子や、ずっと疎まれて育った、あなたと似た境遇の子も沢山いるから……」","en":"“Probably. Going there will only hurt you. I think it would be far more meaningful to find a new life for yourself here instead. You can make friends here. There are many children who never knew their families’ faces, or who grew up unwanted, in circumstances much like your own...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"カミラ","displayName":"Camilla","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r146","rowIndex":146,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=82>広美</tips>は自分の目を見る<tips=67>カミラ</tips>の目を、盗むようにそっと見返した。","en":"<tips=82>Hiromi</tips> timidly steals a glance back into <tips=67>Camilla’s</tips> eyes.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r147","rowIndex":147,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"（この人は優しい人なのかもしれない）","en":"(Perhaps she is a kind person.)","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r148","rowIndex":148,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　なんとなくそう直感したが、考えを改めるには至らない。","en":"Some instinct gives Hiromi that impression, but it is not enough to change her mind.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r149","rowIndex":149,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　申し訳ない気持ちで首を左右に振ると、","en":"Feeling apologetic, she shakes her head.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r150","rowIndex":150,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そう。じゃあ、こちらで住所を調べておくわ。でも、気が変わったらいつでもいってちょうだいね」","en":"“I see. Then we’ll investigate the address for you. But if you change your mind, tell me at any time.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"カミラ","displayName":"Camilla","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r151","rowIndex":151,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=67>カミラ</tips>はそう言って、ノートにさらさらと何かを書き込んだ。","en":"<tips=67>Camilla</tips> speaks, then swiftly writes something in her notebook.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r152","rowIndex":152,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そしてその場で部屋割りが作られた。<tips=82>広美</tips>はいま目の前にあるアパートではなく、同じ住宅街にある別のアパートに振り分けられた。徒歩で三分ほどの距離にあるということで、他の患者たちと共にゾロゾロと列を作って移動することになる。","en":"Room assignments are made upon the spot. <tips=82>Hiromi</tips> is assigned not to the apartment building before her, but to another one in the same neighborhood. It is said to be about three minutes away on foot, so she and the other patients form another straggling line and move on.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r153","rowIndex":153,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　雨の中の移動であり、短い距離とは言え患者たちの口からはバスを使わせてくれればいいのにと不満が漏れた。列を引率する<tips=21>八龍会</tips>の男――アパートで待機していた人物で、どうやら<tips=21>八龍会</tips>ではあっても<tips=47>解放軍</tips>のメンバーではないらしい。その人の良さそうな中年男は困り顔で「バスはまだ他で使うんですよ」と申し訳なさそうに弁解していた。","en":"They had only a short distance to go, but they were walking through the rain, and the patients grumbled that they could at least have been allowed to use the bus. The <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips> man leading the line—the man who had been waiting at the apartments—apparently belonged to the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips> but was not a member of the <tips=47>Liberation Army</tips>. Looking troubled, the good-natured middle-aged man apologized: “The buses are still needed elsewhere.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r154","rowIndex":154,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　移動した先にはさっきのアパートと代わり映えのしない古びた建物が並んでおり、そしてその前には男たちの集団があった。彼らも<tips=82>広美</tips>たちと同じように雨に濡れており、パジャマ姿のものや、ヘッドガードをかぶったままだったので、すぐに自分たちと同じ元患者なのだとわかった。他の病棟から連れてこられたものたちだろう。","en":"At their destination stand several aging buildings no different from the first apartment, and before them waits a group of men. Like <tips=82>Hiromi</tips> and the others, they are wet from the rain. Some wear pajamas, and some still have protective headguards on, making it immediately clear that they too are former patients. They must have come from other wards.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r155","rowIndex":155,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　男の患者と同じアパートに住むのかと一瞬ざわついたが、そういうわけではなく、<tips=82>広美</tips>たちは彼らの使う建物とは道を挟んだ反対がわのアパートを使うらしい。そこには一般の居住者はなく、建物全部を<tips=82>広美</tips>たちのために提供しているのだそうだ。","en":"A momentary murmur ran through the women at the thought of sharing an apartment with male patients. That was not the arrangement, however. <tips=82>Hiromi’s</tips> group appeared to be using the building across the street from the men’s. No ordinary tenants lived there; the entire building had reportedly been made available to <tips=82>Hiromi’s</tips> group.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r156","rowIndex":156,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　話を聞くと、さっきの中年男がこの建物のオーナーで、一階の一室に住んでいるという。","en":"From what they are told, the middle-aged man owns the building and lives in one of the ground-floor apartments.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r157","rowIndex":157,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「困ったことや分からないことがあれば、私に連絡してください。出来ることならすぐに対処しますし、そうでなくとも<tips=21>八龍会</tips>の本部に伝えますのですぐに解決するでしょう。……とにかく、何も心配せずに、部屋で休んでください。必要なものは用意してあります」","en":"“If anything troubles you or there is anything you don’t understand, please contact me. If it is within my power, I’ll deal with it at once; even if it isn’t, I will inform the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips> headquarters, and I’m sure it will be resolved quickly. ...In any event, don’t worry about a thing. Go rest in your room. Everything you need has been provided.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r158","rowIndex":158,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして男と、その妻らしい女の指示で患者たちはそれぞれの部屋に割り振られる。その建物は二階建て八室で、<tips=82>広美</tips>は二階の２０３号室だった。","en":"Following directions from the man and a woman who appears to be his wife, the patients are divided among the available rooms. The building has two floors and eight apartments; <tips=82>Hiromi</tips> is assigned to Room 203 on the second floor.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r159","rowIndex":159,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それじゃあ、ごゆっくり」","en":"“Please make yourselves at home.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r160","rowIndex":160,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　男から鍵を受け取って部屋に足を踏み入れると、小さなキッチンと古畳の敷かれた六畳間になっている。冷蔵庫や電子レンジなど最低限の家具はそろっており、六畳間のちゃぶ台の上には弁当とペットボトルのお茶が二人分用意されていた。","en":"Hiromi accepts the key from the man and steps inside. The apartment consists of a small kitchen and a six-tatami room laid with worn mats. It has a refrigerator, a microwave, and the bare minimum of other furnishings and appliances. Two boxed meals and two bottles of tea have been set out on the low table.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r161","rowIndex":161,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あっ、こっちにTシャツとズボンがあるわ。ほら、<tips=82>広美</tips>ちゃん。さっさと着替えよう。このままじゃ風邪ひいちゃう」","en":"“Oh, there are T-shirts and pants over here. Come on, <tips=82>Hiromi</tips>, let’s get changed. We’ll catch cold if we stay like this.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r162","rowIndex":162,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=82>広美</tips>と同室になったのは細井という三十がらみの比較的若い人物で、部屋の端に並べてあった衣服を見つけると、未開封のTシャツのパッケージを一つ<tips=82>広美</tips>に投げてよこした。","en":"<tips=82>Hiromi’s</tips> roommate is Hosoi, a relatively young woman of about thirty. When Hosoi discovers the clothes arranged at the edge of the room, she tosses <tips=82>Hiromi</tips> one of the unopened T-shirt packages.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r163","rowIndex":163,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　部屋割りは基本的には病院で同室だった同士が一緒になるように作られており、<tips=82>広美</tips>と細井もここ半年くらい同じ病室で過ごした仲である。","en":"As a rule, the room assignments place people together who shared rooms in the hospital. <tips=82>Hiromi</tips> and Hosoi have spent the past six months or so in the same room.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r164","rowIndex":164,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ほら、なにぼーっとしてるの？　自分で着られるでしょう」","en":"“Well? Why are you standing there? You can dress yourself, can’t you?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r165","rowIndex":165,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　一日中パジャマのままでいることが多かった<tips=82>広美</tips>が、濡らしたり汚したりすると、着せ替えを手伝ってくれたりしたのがこの細井である。そうした更衣の補助は職員がやることになっていて、患者はやらなくていいと口を酸っぱくして言われていたのだが、症状のせいかその言葉は細井の耳に入らず、しばしば<tips=82>広美</tips>にお節介をやいてくれていた。","en":"<tips=82>Hiromi</tips> often spent the entire day in her pajamas, and whenever she wet or soiled them, Hosoi would help her change. The staff were supposed to handle such assistance; the patients had been told until everyone was sick of hearing it that they need not help one another. Perhaps her symptoms kept the rule from ever registering, for Hosoi persistently took it upon herself to fuss over <tips=82>Hiromi</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r166","rowIndex":166,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それとも、また着させてあげないと駄目？」","en":"“Or do I have to dress you again?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r167","rowIndex":167,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　細井が苦笑するのに<tips=82>広美</tips>は首を左右に振り、","en":"Hosoi smiles wryly. <tips=82>Hiromi</tips> shakes her head.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r168","rowIndex":168,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「大丈夫です。自分で着られます」","en":"“It’s all right. I can dress myself.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"内田広美（患者のＵ）","displayName":"Hiromi Uchida (Patient U)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r169","rowIndex":169,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そしてのろのろと服を脱ぎはじめた。","en":"Then she slowly begins removing her clothes.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r170","rowIndex":170,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　二人とも同じくらい痩せていたが細井は背が高く、<tips=82>広美</tips>はそれほどではない。用意された服は<tips=82>広美</tips>には丁度よかったが、細井には短くてズボンの裾からくるぶしが出ていた。","en":"The two women are equally thin, but Hosoi is considerably taller than <tips=82>Hiromi</tips>. The clothes provided fit <tips=82>Hiromi</tips> perfectly; on Hosoi they are too short, leaving her ankles bare below the trouser cuffs.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r171","rowIndex":171,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まあ、ギリギリはけるわね。でも、私の趣味じゃないわ」","en":"“Well, I can just barely wear them. They aren’t my taste, though.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r172","rowIndex":172,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　病院ではいつも凝ったデザインの服を身につけていた細井は、無地の白いTシャツとストレッチの効いたデニムパンツはお気に召さないようで、部屋の端の姿見にうつった自分の姿を見て苦笑した。","en":"Hosoi, who had always worn clothes with elaborate designs in the hospital, seems displeased with the plain white T-shirt and stretch denim pants. She gives a rueful smile at her reflection in the full-length mirror at the side of the room.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r173","rowIndex":173,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　もう日が暮れている。","en":"It is already dark.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r174","rowIndex":174,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　外からは子供たちが騒ぐ声が聞こえて来る。","en":"The clamor of children at play drifts in from outside.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r175","rowIndex":175,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=82>広美</tips>は窓のガラス戸を開けた。","en":"<tips=82>Hiromi</tips> slides open the glass window.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r176","rowIndex":176,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　病院の窓は事故防止のためにストッパーがかかっておりほんの僅かしか開かなかった。それに慣れていた<tips=82>広美</tips>は、目一杯開くドアに新鮮な気持ちを覚えながら外を眺めた。","en":"For safety, the hospital windows had stops and opened only the tiniest crack. Accustomed to that, <tips=82>Hiromi</tips> gazes outside, filled with a fresh sense of wonder at a window that opens all the way.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r177","rowIndex":177,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　建物の隙間に道路が見え、そこで子供たちが集まっているのが見えた。まだ雨がふっているなか傘もささず、白いボールをぶつけ合ってはしゃいでいる。","en":"Through a gap between the buildings, she sees a road where children have gathered. Although the rain continues, they carry no umbrellas and shriek with delight as they throw a white ball at one another.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r178","rowIndex":178,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それが通り過ぎ声が聞こえなくなると、別の方から赤ん坊が泣く声が聞こえた。そしてどこかで男が叫ぶ声。","en":"Once they pass and their voices fade, a baby begins crying somewhere else. Then a man shouts in the distance.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r179","rowIndex":179,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=9>Y地区</tips>の住宅街は雑然とした生活の音に溢れており、<tips=82>広美</tips>の胸をざわつかせた。","en":"The residential streets of <tips=9>Y District</tips> overflow with the disorderly sounds of life, stirring something in <tips=82>Hiromi’s</tips> chest.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r180","rowIndex":180,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"（ああ、私は本当に病院から出て来たんだ）","en":"(Oh. I truly have left the hospital.)","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r181","rowIndex":181,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　塀で区切られた病院のなかは患者や職員の声が飛び交う賑やかな場所だったが、様々な人々が暮らす街のなかの音とは違う。","en":"The hospital within its enclosing walls had been a lively place, filled with the voices of patients and staff. But its noise was nothing like the sound of a city where all manner of people made their lives.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r182","rowIndex":182,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　街全体が生き物のようで、人間の一人一人はその生き物を構成する細胞のように感じられた。自分もその一つに戻ったのだ。","en":"The entire city feels like a living creature, and each individual human being like one cell composing its body. Hiromi has returned to being one of those cells.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r183","rowIndex":183,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"（それとも、私の感じ方が違うのかな）","en":"(Or perhaps it is the way I perceive things that has changed.)","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r184","rowIndex":184,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　症状が起きていた時の感覚がうまく思い出せない。目の前の人が喋っているものと同じ声が聞こえ、心や感情が不思議なオブジェのように歪んだ形のまま固定化されていた。何か悪魔のようなものに思考や感覚が玩具にされていたような気がする。そして悪魔が去った今、当時の不確かでおぼろげな感覚が、正常となった新しい心が感じる圧倒的に確かな感覚によって上書きされ、みるみるうちに忘却されてゆく。","en":"She cannot properly remember what perception was like while she was symptomatic. She would hear voices indistinguishable from the speech of the person before her, while her mind and feelings seemed frozen into warped shapes like strange sculptures. It was as if some demon had made toys of her thoughts and senses. Now that the demon has left, the hazy, uncertain sensations of that time are being overwritten by the overwhelming solidity of the world perceived by her new mind, vanishing rapidly into oblivion.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r185","rowIndex":185,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"（何か黒くて深いものをいつも感じていたような……）","en":"(I think I always felt something black and deep...)","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r186","rowIndex":186,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=82>広美</tips>が考え込んでいると、","en":"As <tips=82>Hiromi</tips> loses herself in thought—","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r187","rowIndex":187,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どうしたの？　ご飯食べようよ」","en":"“What’s wrong? Let’s eat.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r188","rowIndex":188,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　背後で細井が呼びかける。","en":"Hosoi calls from behind her.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r189","rowIndex":189,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「もう病院じゃないんだからさ。お腹が空いたら食べたいときに食べていいんだよ」","en":"“This isn’t the hospital anymore. When you’re hungry, you can eat whenever you like.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r190","rowIndex":190,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　いつの間にか彼女は二人分のお茶をいれていて、ちゃぶ台の前に座布団を敷いて座っていた。","en":"Without Hiromi noticing, she has poured tea for them both and seated herself upon a cushion before the low table.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r191","rowIndex":191,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あ、はい。ちょっと考え事をしていて……」","en":"“Oh, yes. I was thinking about something...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"内田広美（患者のＵ）","displayName":"Hiromi Uchida (Patient U)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r192","rowIndex":192,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=82>広美</tips>は窓を閉めて細井の向かいに座る。","en":"<tips=82>Hiromi</tips> closes the window and sits across from Hosoi.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r193","rowIndex":193,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「症状がなくなって、なんだか変な感じがしませんか？」","en":"“Doesn’t it feel strange now that the symptoms are gone?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"内田広美（患者のＵ）","displayName":"Hiromi Uchida (Patient U)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r194","rowIndex":194,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　先に食べ始めていた細井にそう訊ねると、彼女は笑って、","en":"When Hiromi asks, Hosoi, who has already begun eating, laughs.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r195","rowIndex":195,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「何言ってるの。今が正常で、症状があったときが変だったのよ」","en":"“What are you talking about? This is normal. Having symptoms was what felt strange.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r196","rowIndex":196,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　と、至極もっともなことを言い、<tips=82>広美</tips>は自分がおかしなことを口にしてしまったことが恥ずかしく、頬を赤くして俯いた。","en":"It is an eminently reasonable answer. Ashamed of having said something so foolish, <tips=82>Hiromi</tips> blushes and lowers her head.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r197","rowIndex":197,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まあ、あなたは人生の多感な時期を症状のなかで育ったからそう感じるのかもね。でも、すぐに慣れるよ」","en":"“Well, you grew up through the most formative years of your life inside those symptoms, so perhaps that is why it feels this way. You’ll get used to it soon.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r198","rowIndex":198,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　細井の優しい言葉は<tips=82>広美</tips>の羞恥心をさらに刺激し、","en":"Hosoi’s gentle words only deepen <tips=82>Hiromi’s</tips> embarrassment.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r199","rowIndex":199,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「は、はい……」","en":"“Y-yes...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"内田広美（患者のＵ）","displayName":"Hiromi Uchida (Patient U)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r200","rowIndex":200,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　さらに深く俯かせるのだった。","en":"She lowers her head still further.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r201","rowIndex":201,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　用意された弁当はどこかの仕出し屋に注文した幕の内弁当で、煮物や焼き魚の切り身、エビフライなど様々な具が所狭しと詰め込まれていた。","en":"The meal provided is a makunouchi bento ordered from some caterer, its compartments crowded with simmered dishes, a fillet of grilled fish, fried shrimp, and all manner of other morsels.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r202","rowIndex":202,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　症状があった時は嚥下がよくなかった<tips=82>広美</tips>は、病院ではいつもミキサーにかけられたドロドロの食事をとっていたので、このような固形の食べ物を口にするのは久しぶりで緊張してしまう。","en":"<tips=82>Hiromi</tips> had difficulty swallowing while she was symptomatic and always ate food blended into a thick slurry at the hospital. It has been so long since she put solid food like this into her mouth that the prospect makes her tense.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r203","rowIndex":203,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「急にこれじゃこわいよね。細かくほぐしてあげよっか？」","en":"“This must be frightening all of a sudden. Want me to break it up into little pieces for you?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r204","rowIndex":204,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　細井が心配げに言うのを、","en":"Hosoi asks with concern.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r205","rowIndex":205,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「い、いえ、大丈夫です」","en":"“N-no, it’s all right.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"内田広美（患者のＵ）","displayName":"Hiromi Uchida (Patient U)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r206","rowIndex":206,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　首を横にふって断り、エビフライに添付のビニール袋のソースをたっぷりかけると、おそるおそる口にする。","en":"Hiromi shakes her head, pours plenty of sauce from the accompanying plastic packet over a fried shrimp, and timidly brings it to her mouth.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r207","rowIndex":207,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　前歯で三分の一ほど囓りとり、よく咀嚼してごくりと喉を鳴らして飲み込む。そこで、<tips=82>広美</tips>は目を大きく見開き、口元に手の平をやった。","en":"She bites off roughly one third with her front teeth, chews it thoroughly, and swallows with an audible gulp. Then <tips=82>Hiromi’s</tips> eyes fly open, and she presses a palm to her mouth.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r208","rowIndex":208,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　やっぱり喉に詰まらせてしまったのかと、細井は慌てかけるがそうではなかった。","en":"Hosoi starts to panic, thinking the food has caught in Hiromi’s throat after all. But that is not what happened.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r209","rowIndex":209,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=82>広美</tips>は細井の方を見ると、身体をぷるぷると震わせている。","en":"<tips=82>Hiromi</tips> looks toward Hosoi, her whole body trembling.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r210","rowIndex":210,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「おいしいです……」","en":"“It’s delicious...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"内田広美（患者のＵ）","displayName":"Hiromi Uchida (Patient U)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r211","rowIndex":211,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そう言うと、感極まったように目をうるませた。","en":"As she says it, her eyes moisten with overwhelming emotion.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r212","rowIndex":212,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「確かに病院の食事よりは美味しいけど、そ、そんなに？　目がきらきらしてるよ？」","en":"“It’s certainly better than the hospital food, but th-that good? Your eyes are sparkling.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r213","rowIndex":213,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=82>広美</tips>はこくこくと頷き、次の一口を運ぶ。","en":"<tips=82>Hiromi</tips> nods rapidly and takes another bite.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r214","rowIndex":214,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　衣はサクサクとしていて、大ぶりのエビは弾力があってみずみずしく、甘味と塩味と海鮮のうま味がはっきりと感じられる。","en":"The crust is crisp. The large shrimp within is springy and succulent, and she can distinctly taste sweetness, salt, and the savory flavor of seafood.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r215","rowIndex":215,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ミキサー食と固形という差はあるし、病院の食事は限られた予算のなかで作られたものだったというのもあるだろうし、そもそも薄めの味付けだったということもある。","en":"Part of it was surely the difference between puréed food and solid food. The hospital meals had also been prepared on a limited budget and lightly seasoned to begin with.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r216","rowIndex":216,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しかし、それだけで説明がつくものではない。きっと、彼女自身の味覚がほとんど機能していなかったのだ。病院にいたころは食事で胃が満たされる満足感こそあったものの、味覚の喜びというものは全く存在しなかった。","en":"But none of that was enough to explain it. Surely her own sense of taste had been almost entirely nonfunctional. In the hospital, meals had given her the satisfaction of a full stomach, but she had felt no pleasure in their taste whatsoever.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r217","rowIndex":217,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　生臭いとか、しょっぱいとか、甘いとか、大雑把な刺激しか感じ取れなかった。","en":"All she could perceive were crude stimuli: something fishy, salty, or sweet.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r218","rowIndex":218,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"（ものを味わうって、こんなことだったんだ）","en":"(So this is what it means to taste something.)","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r219","rowIndex":219,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それはほとんど感動的なほどに幸福な体験だった。","en":"The experience is so joyous that it nearly overwhelms her.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r220","rowIndex":220,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"（そう言えば、私は昔は食べるのが大好きだったんだ）","en":"(Come to think of it, I used to love eating.)","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r221","rowIndex":221,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　忘れていたけれど、家にいたときは確かにそうだった。小さい頃は色んなものを味わって、そして喜びを感じていたんだ。いつのまにかその喜びも完全に失っていた。","en":"She had forgotten, but this was certainly true when she lived at home. As a small child, she tasted all kinds of things and felt joy in them. At some point, that joy had disappeared completely.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r222","rowIndex":222,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　症状におかされていたときは、自分にそんな時代があったこともすっかり忘れていた。そして味覚と共に記憶が蘇ると、おかしな涙があふれそうになる。","en":"While consumed by her symptoms, she had completely forgotten that such a time in her life had ever existed. Now, as memory returned along with her sense of taste, strange tears threatened to spill over.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r223","rowIndex":223,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"（やっぱり、家族のみんなと会いたい！）","en":"(I do want to see my family again!)","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r224","rowIndex":224,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=82>広美</tips>は涙をこらえながら無我夢中で弁当をかき込み、しまいには細井が残したポテトサラダと梅干しまで平らげた。","en":"Holding back her tears, <tips=82>Hiromi</tips> devours the bento with total abandon. In the end, she even finishes the potato salad and pickled plum Hosoi leaves behind.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r225","rowIndex":225,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　食事が終わると二人であれこれ話しながらテレビを見て、そして就寝の時間となる。","en":"After the meal, the two women watch television and talk about one thing after another. Then it is time for bed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r226","rowIndex":226,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　部屋の隅に畳んであった布団を並べて敷き、それぞれの布団に潜り込んだ。明日の朝にミーティングを行うという話だったから早く眠らなければいけなかったのだが、<tips=82>広美</tips>はなかなか眠りにつけない。隣の細井も同様らしく、布団のなかでしばらくもぞもぞしてから立ち上がった。","en":"They unfold the futons stacked in one corner, lay them side by side, and crawl beneath their covers. They have been told there will be a meeting tomorrow morning, so they need to sleep early. But <tips=82>Hiromi</tips> cannot drift off. Hosoi seems equally wakeful. After shifting about under her blanket for some time, she rises.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r227","rowIndex":227,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ちょっと水を飲むね」","en":"“I’m just going to get some water.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r228","rowIndex":228,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=82>広美</tips>と目が合うと、細井はそう答えた。","en":"When her eyes meet <tips=82>Hiromi’s</tips>, Hosoi explains.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r229","rowIndex":229,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あなたも飲む？」","en":"“Would you like some?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r230","rowIndex":230,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いえ」","en":"“No, thank you.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"内田広美（患者のＵ）","displayName":"Hiromi Uchida (Patient U)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r231","rowIndex":231,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　細井が部屋を出て行くと、キッチンの方でカチャカチャとグラスを探す音がして、そして水の音がし、キュッと蛇口をしめる音がする。<tips=82>広美</tips>は目を閉ざしながらそれを聞いていた。","en":"After Hosoi leaves the room, <tips=82>Hiromi</tips> hears the clink and clatter of her searching for a glass in the kitchen, then running water, then the squeak of the tap being shut. She listens with her eyes closed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r232","rowIndex":232,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　細井は戻って来ると布団に潜り、","en":"Hosoi returns and slips beneath her covers.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r233","rowIndex":233,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「もう寝た？」","en":"“Are you asleep?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r234","rowIndex":234,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　小さな声で訊ねるのに<tips=82>広美</tips>は小さく首を横にふってからまぶたを開いた。","en":"At the whispered question, <tips=82>Hiromi</tips> gives a tiny shake of her head, then opens her eyes.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r235","rowIndex":235,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「眠れないね」","en":"“It’s hard to sleep.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r236","rowIndex":236,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　細井は黙っていてもお構いなしに話しかけてくる。","en":"Hosoi keeps talking to her, entirely unbothered by the silence.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r237","rowIndex":237,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうですね」","en":"“It is.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r238","rowIndex":238,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=82>広美</tips>はそうこたえた。","en":"<tips=82>Hiromi</tips> answered.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r239","rowIndex":239,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「病院ではいつも眠剤飲んでたからね。また貰いたいな」","en":"“We always took sleeping pills at the hospital. I’d like to get some again.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r240","rowIndex":240,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「言えばきっとくれますよ」","en":"“I’m sure they’ll give them to you if you ask.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r241","rowIndex":241,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうだね。……でも、こうして<tips=82>広美</tips>ちゃんと喋ってるなんて嘘みたい。あなた、本当はちゃんとした子だったんだね。症状のときは赤ちゃんみたいだったけど」","en":"“Probably. ...But it feels unreal to be talking with you like this, <tips=82>Hiromi</tips>. You really were a perfectly sensible girl. When you had symptoms, you were like a baby.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r242","rowIndex":242,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……自分でも驚きです」","en":"“...I’m surprised myself.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r243","rowIndex":243,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あはは。でもみんなそうだよね。ユリコさんも、川本さんも、みんなまるきり別人みたいだった。顔つきも全然ちがっちゃって。前は人間というより獣じみていたのに……今ならきっと、普通の服着てたらノーマルと区別つかないよ。きっと私も別人になってるんだろうな」","en":"“Ahaha. But everyone’s the same, aren’t they? Yuriko, Kawamoto—every one of them looked like a completely different person. Even their faces changed. Before, they were more like beasts than human beings... Now, if they wore ordinary clothes, I doubt anyone could distinguish them from Normals. I’m sure I’ve become a different person too.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r244","rowIndex":244,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「細井さんはそうでもないです。もともとちゃんとしてましたし」","en":"“You haven’t changed that much, Ms. Hosoi. You always seemed to have it together.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r245","rowIndex":245,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あはは、ちゃんとしてたらあそこにいるわけないじゃない」","en":"“Ahaha. If I’d had it together, I wouldn’t have been in a place like that, would I?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r246","rowIndex":246,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　細井は乾いた声で笑う。","en":"Hosoi laughs dryly.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r247","rowIndex":247,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そういえば、<tips=82>広美</tips>ちゃんは家族のところに戻りたいって、あの<tips=47>解放軍</tips>の人に言ってたね」","en":"“Come to think of it, <tips=82>Hiromi</tips>, you told that woman from the <tips=47>Liberation Army</tips> you wanted to return to your family.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r248","rowIndex":248,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「はい、住所もわからないですけど……」","en":"“Yes. Though I don’t know the address...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r249","rowIndex":249,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それはきっと大丈夫よ。多分病院の記録を調べるんだと思うんだけど、そうしたら明日にでもすぐにわかるはずだわ。病院には家族の連絡先とか、全部あるはずだからね。家族と疎遠な患者でも、連絡先と住所はちゃんと記録してあるものだもの」","en":"“I’m sure it’ll be fine. They’ll probably check the hospital records, and then they should know as soon as tomorrow. The hospital must have all your family’s contact details. Even when a patient was estranged from their family, the hospital kept a proper record of the address and contact information.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r250","rowIndex":250,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「はい、そうですね。きっとすぐわかると思います」","en":"“Yes. I think they’ll find it quickly.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r251","rowIndex":251,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=82>広美</tips>は天井を見ながら頷く。","en":"<tips=82>Hiromi</tips> nods as she looks at the ceiling.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r252","rowIndex":252,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「でも、警察とかってどうなんでしょう？」","en":"“But what about the police?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r253","rowIndex":253,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「警察って？」","en":"“The police?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r254","rowIndex":254,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「こんな滅茶苦茶な形で病院を飛び出したんだから、きっと警察から私たちの家族にも連絡が行くんじゃないですか？　もしかしたら待ち構えているかもしれない。そうしたら、どうなるのか……。また別の病院にいれられちゃうかもしれない」","en":"“We broke out of the hospital in such a terrible mess. Won’t the police contact our families? They may even be waiting for us. And then what will happen...? They might put us in another hospital.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r255","rowIndex":255,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「警察なんか、関係ないでしょう」","en":"“The police have nothing to do with it.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r256","rowIndex":256,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　細井はきっぱりと言った。","en":"Hosoi answers firmly.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r257","rowIndex":257,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「だって私たちは病気の治療のために病院にいたんだよ？　そして治療のために行動を制限されてただけ。もう症状がないんだから、誰にも私たちを閉じ込める正当性なんかないんだよ」","en":"“We were in the hospital to receive treatment, weren’t we? Our actions were restricted only for the sake of treatment. Now that we have no symptoms, no one has any legitimate reason to lock us away.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r258","rowIndex":258,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「でも、人が沢山死んで……」","en":"“But so many people died...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r259","rowIndex":259,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「乱暴をしたのは私たちじゃなくて、<tips=21>八龍会</tips>の人でしょ。私たちがやったわけじゃない。事件の参考人として事情くらいは聞かれるかもしれないけど、それだけだわ。……ねえ、この社会ではね、理由がなければ人を閉じ込めることなんか出来ないの。私たちは自由なの。あなたは行動を制限されるのになれ過ぎちゃって、考えがいびつになってるわ。……まあでも、無理もないか。<tips=82>広美</tips>ちゃんは親の言うことをきかなきゃいけない年齢のうちに病院に来て、本当の自由を手に入れたことがないんだから」","en":"“We weren’t the ones who used violence. That was the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips>. We didn’t do it. The police might question us as witnesses to the incident, but that’s all. ...Listen. In this society, you can’t lock people away without a reason. We’re free. You’ve grown so used to having your actions restricted that it’s warped the way you think. ...Though I suppose you can’t help it. You came to the hospital while you were still young enough to have to obey your parents, <tips=82>Hiromi</tips>. You’ve never had real freedom.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r260","rowIndex":260,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「はあ……」","en":"“I see...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r261","rowIndex":261,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「だから、あなたが会いに行きたいのなら、私はそうするのはいいことだと思うよ。きっと、うまくいくと思う」","en":"“So if you want to go and meet them, I think you should. I’m sure it will go well.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r262","rowIndex":262,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　細井は勇気づけるように言ってくれる。その優しさは、病院内で面倒を見てくれたときと変わらなかった。","en":"Hosoi says it encouragingly. Her kindness is no different from when she cared for Hiromi inside the hospital.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r263","rowIndex":263,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　まだ雨が降っているらしく、窓からは雨の音が聞こえる。そして車の通る音や、ときおり誰かが叫ぶような音も。","en":"The rain seems to be continuing; Hiromi can hear it against the window. Cars pass outside, and every so often, someone seems to shout.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r264","rowIndex":264,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　病院の夜は驚くほど静かになるが、ここはそうではないらしい。いつも何かしら音がきこえている。","en":"The hospital became astonishingly quiet at night. This place is apparently different. There is always some sound or another.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r265","rowIndex":265,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「細井さんは、お子さんに会わないんですか？」","en":"“Aren’t you going to see your child, Ms. Hosoi?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r266","rowIndex":266,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ああ、子供ね……」","en":"“Oh. My child...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r267","rowIndex":267,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　細井は言葉を濁す。そして、彼女の布団の方から、もぞもぞと動くような音が聞こえた。","en":"Hosoi evades the question. From her futon comes the rustle of her shifting beneath the covers.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r268","rowIndex":268,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女は病院でいつも子供の幻覚を見ていた。誰もいない廊下を大きくなった娘が走っていると言ったり、その日は誰とも面会などしていないのに娘が会いに来たと言ったり。職員が誰も来ていないと説明すると、顔を真っ赤にして金切り声を上げていた。","en":"At the hospital, she was forever seeing visions of her child. She would say that her grown daughter was running down an empty corridor, or that her daughter had come to visit on a day when no one had visited her at all. When the staff explained that no one had come, her face would turn scarlet and she would shriek at them.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r269","rowIndex":269,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　症状によって外界の情報には疎いまま過ごしていた<tips=82>広美</tips>にも、繰り返されるその言葉を聞いた覚えがある。","en":"Even <tips=82>Hiromi</tips>, who had passed those years cut off from outside information by her symptoms, remembers hearing those repeated claims.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r270","rowIndex":270,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「産んだのよ。本当に産んで、子供はいるの。……でも、見た覚えがないの。男か女かもしらない」","en":"“I gave birth. I truly did. I have a child... But I don’t remember seeing the baby. I don’t even know whether it was a boy or a girl.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r271","rowIndex":271,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どうして……」","en":"“Why not...?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r272","rowIndex":272,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「その頃私はもうおかしくなりかかってて、抱かせて貰えなかった。出産後にすぐに<tips=17>タイプB</tips>用の病院に行くことになって……今はどうしているのかもわからないわ。もしかしたら施設にでも入れたのかもしれない」","en":"“I was already beginning to lose my mind by then, so they wouldn’t let me hold the baby. Immediately after giving birth, I was sent to a hospital for <tips=17>Type Bs</tips>... I don’t know where the child is now. Perhaps they placed it in some institution.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r273","rowIndex":273,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……お父さんは？」","en":"“...What about the father?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r274","rowIndex":274,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それも誰だかわからない。それっぽい人は何人かいるけど」","en":"“I don’t know who he is either. There are several men it might have been.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r275","rowIndex":275,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　細井は乾いた声で笑った。","en":"Hosoi laughs dryly.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r276","rowIndex":276,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「だから会いたいけど、会えないわ。きっと私の親はどうなったか教えてくれないし……それに、今更どんな顔をして会えばいいかわからないもの」","en":"“So I want to meet the child, but I can’t. My parents would never tell me what happened... And after all this time, I have no idea how I could face the child.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r277","rowIndex":277,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その暗い声色に<tips=82>広美</tips>は戸惑った。<tips=82>広美</tips>からすれば、会いたいのなら会えばいいのではないかと単純にそう思う。さっきバスのなかでいろいろと言われたが、いまひとつピンと来なかった。確かに昔は病気だったからいろいろと迷惑をかけたこともあるかもしれないが、今はもう完全に元に戻ったのだ。その姿を見せればいいはずだ。","en":"The darkness in her voice leaves <tips=82>Hiromi</tips> perplexed. From <tips=82>Hiromi’s</tips> perspective, if Hosoi wants to see the child, she should simply do so. People had told her all sorts of things on the bus earlier, but none of it had quite sunk in. It was true that she had been ill and might have caused everyone a great deal of trouble. But now she was completely back to normal. Surely all she had to do was let them see her as she was now.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r278","rowIndex":278,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　だが、大人は大人で少し事情が違うのかもしれない。","en":"Perhaps circumstances are a little different for adults.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r279","rowIndex":279,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「だから私はしばらくここにいるわ。<tips=21>八龍会</tips>ってのに入るかどうかはわからないけど、みんなと一緒の方が気楽に過ごせるかもしれない。長年一緒だし。……でも、変なもんだよね。正直ね、他の患者さんたちって好きじゃなかった。一刻もはやく離れたいと思ったけど、いざこうなるとなんだか一番信用出来るような気がして……。<tips=82>広美</tips>ちゃんのことも面倒な子だって思ってたけど、今はそうでもないわ」","en":"“So I’ll stay here for a while. I don’t know whether I’ll join the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips>, but perhaps I can relax more easily with everyone else. We were together for years. ...It is strange, though. Honestly, I didn’t like the other patients. I wanted to escape them as soon as possible. But now that this has happened, somehow I feel as though I can trust them more than anyone... I thought you were a difficult child too, <tips=82>Hiromi</tips>, but I don’t feel that way now.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r280","rowIndex":280,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうですか……」","en":"“I see...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r281","rowIndex":281,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ずっと一緒にいたけれど、こんな風に話したのは初めてだし、なんだかびっくりしちゃった。……ねえ、ご両親の住所がわかっても、すぐに出ていかないで、何日かここで暮らさない？　ブランクがあるから少し世間に慣れてから親御さんと会った方がいいかもしれないし、他の患者さんたちと話して、みんなが本当はどんな人だったのか知るのもいいと思う」","en":"“We’ve been together all these years, but this is the first time we’ve ever talked like this. I’m sort of amazed. ...Listen, even when they find your parents’ address, why not stay here for a few days instead of leaving right away? You’ve been out of society for a while, so it might be better to get used to the world again before you see your parents. And I think it would be good to talk to the other patients and find out what everyone was really like.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r282","rowIndex":282,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=82>広美</tips>が横目で細井の方を見ると、彼女は身体ごと向きを変えてこちらの方を見ていた。","en":"<tips=82>Hiromi</tips> glances toward Hosoi. The other woman has turned her entire body and is looking back at her.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r283","rowIndex":283,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「私、どう受け入れたらいいかわからないんです」","en":"“I don’t know how to come to terms with any of it.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r284","rowIndex":284,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=82>広美</tips>は正直に口にした。","en":"<tips=82>Hiromi</tips> answers honestly.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r285","rowIndex":285,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あの人たちが私たちの病気を治してくれたみたいですけど、あんなに乱暴なことをして……いい人たちなのか、悪い人たちなのかわからなくて……」","en":"“Those people seem to have cured our illness, but they did something so violent... I don’t understand whether they’re good people or bad people...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r286","rowIndex":286,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ああ、あなた職員に可愛がられてたものねえ。特に担当の<tips=83>能見</tips>さんとか、本当に妹みたいにしてくれてたもんね」","en":"“Oh, the staff were fond of you. Especially Ms. <tips=83>Nomi</tips>, your assigned nurse. She truly treated you like a little sister.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r287","rowIndex":287,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　具体的に名前を出されると、<tips=82>広美</tips>の脳裏にあの血みどろのホールの映像が浮かんだ。","en":"Hearing the specific name brings the image of that blood-soaked hall back into <tips=82>Hiromi’s</tips> mind.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r288","rowIndex":288,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　あの時はぼんやりといていて、はっきりと知覚していなかったが、あらためて思い出して見ると確かにそこには看護師の<tips=83>能見美紗</tips>も倒れていた。","en":"She had been dazed then and did not perceive the scene clearly. Looking back upon it now, however, the nurse <tips=83>Misa Nomi</tips> was indeed lying there.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r289","rowIndex":289,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　目を見開き、真っ白なナース服を血の赤に染めて。","en":"Eyes staring wide, her snow-white nurse’s uniform dyed red with blood.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r290","rowIndex":290,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「覚えてる。あなた、粗相したりいじめられたりすると、泣きながら『ノミさん、ノミさん』って呼んでたのよ？　もう口癖みたいになってて、まーた<tips=82>広美</tips>ちゃんの『ノミさん、ノミさん』がはじまったってみんな笑ってたんだから」","en":"“I remember. Whenever you had an accident or someone bullied you, you cried and called, ‘Ms. Nomi, Ms. Nomi.’ It became almost a catchphrase. Everyone used to laugh and say, ‘There goes <tips=82>Hiromi</tips> with her Ms. Nomi, Ms. Nomi again.’”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r291","rowIndex":291,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あんまり、覚えてないです……」","en":"“I don’t remember it very well...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r292","rowIndex":292,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　自分はそんなに甘えていたのか？　<tips=82>広美</tips>は恥ずかしくなって、顔が熱くなるのを感じた。","en":"Had she depended upon the woman so completely? <tips=82>Hiromi</tips> grows embarrassed and feels heat gather in her face.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r293","rowIndex":293,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ま、職員の人たちとのつき合いは長いからね。複雑な気持ちになるのはわかるわ。でも、あれは仕方ないことだったのよ」","en":"“Well, we’d known the staff for years. I understand why you have mixed feelings. But there was no helping what happened.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r294","rowIndex":294,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　細井は溜息まじりに言う。","en":"Hosoi speaks through a sigh.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r295","rowIndex":295,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あの<tips=47>解放軍</tips>っていうのは、つまり革命家なのよ。これまでとは違う、全く新しい<tips=17>タイプB</tips>のための社会を作るための革命をしているの。革命には流血がつきものだわ。確かに病院にはいい人も沢山いたし、治りもしない治療をしてたことだって、それは彼らの医学が限界だっただけで、悪気があったわけじゃない。でも、彼らがああいう治療をして、私たちを閉じ込めていたのは今のノーマルの社会を守るためなんだからね。<tips=47>解放軍</tips>はそのノーマルの社会を壊そうとしてるわけだから、<tips=83>能見</tips>さんたちは最初に死ななくちゃいけなかったの」","en":"“The <tips=47>Liberation Army</tips>—they’re revolutionaries, in other words. They’re carrying out a revolution to create a completely new society for <tips=17>Type Bs</tips>, unlike anything that came before. Revolutions always entail bloodshed. There certainly were many good people at the hospital. Even when they gave us treatments that could never cure us, it was only because their medicine had reached its limits. They meant no harm. But the reason they treated us that way and kept us confined was to protect today’s Normal society. The <tips=47>Liberation Army</tips> is trying to destroy that Normal society, so Ms. <tips=83>Nomi</tips> and the others had to be the first to die.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r296","rowIndex":296,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……細井さんは、頭がいいんですね」","en":"“...You’re very intelligent, Ms. Hosoi.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r297","rowIndex":297,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ちゃんと学校出たんだから。短大だけど」","en":"“I did graduate from school. It was only a junior college.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r298","rowIndex":298,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　細井は自嘲するように笑ったが、<tips=82>広美</tips>にはその笑いの意味がわからなかった。","en":"Hosoi gives a self-deprecating laugh. <tips=82>Hiromi</tips> does not understand its meaning.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r299","rowIndex":299,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして翌朝、患者たちは部屋に運ばれた弁当で朝食をとったあと、近くの公民館のような場所に集められて改めて説明が行われた。","en":"The next morning, after eating bento delivered to their rooms, the patients are gathered inside a nearby building resembling a community hall and given another explanation.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r300","rowIndex":300,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　『<tips=46>ネオ・ローズ</tips>』の効果や、その使い方が実物を使って話され、そしてその薬が今どうやって作られているのか。リーと名乗ったその人の良さそうな人物の中国語なまりの男の言葉によれば、地域内のあちこちのアパートや民家が工場となり、<tips=21>八龍会</tips>のメンバーが製造やパッケージ詰めをしているという。機械は家庭用製材機を用いた簡単なもので、患者のうち行き場がなくここで働きたいというものは、この作業に参加することになるだろうということだった。","en":"They are shown the actual drug while its effects and the use of <tips=46>Neo Rose</tips> are explained, followed by an account of how it is now produced. According to the amiable-looking man with a Chinese accent who introduces himself as Lee, apartments and private homes throughout the district have been turned into workshops where members of the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips> manufacture and package it. The equipment is simple, consisting of household pharmaceutical compounding machines. Patients with nowhere else to go who wish to work here will apparently take part in the operation.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r301","rowIndex":301,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それから患者のこれからの生活のために必要な物品が配布されていた。","en":"Next, the patients are issued the things they will need for life from now on.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r302","rowIndex":302,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　患者たちは私物のほとんどを病院に置いてきているし、所持金なども決まりによって病院の事務所に預けている。<tips=47>解放軍</tips>は襲撃の時に病院の事務所から略奪を行っていたので、衣服などの私物はともかく、金銭は持ち主の手に戻すことが出来た。","en":"They left almost all their personal possessions in the hospital, while rules required them to deposit money with the hospital office. During the attack, the <tips=47>Liberation Army</tips> looted that office. Although clothing and other possessions could not readily be restored, they were able to return the money to its owners.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r303","rowIndex":303,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　何も持たない患者にはいくばくかの小遣いが与えられた。洗面道具などの日用品はアパートの部屋に置かれているもので足りなかったら、その小遣いで賄うか、相談すれば調達してくれるということだった。","en":"Patients who possessed nothing receive a little spending money. Toiletries and other daily necessities have been placed in the apartments. If anything is missing, they can buy it with this allowance or request that it be procured.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r304","rowIndex":304,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それから、希望者は<tips=21>八龍会</tips>の有志から集められた古着などから選んで持って帰ってよいということで、配布会が行われた。","en":"They then held a giveaway where anyone who wished could choose and take home used clothing and other items donated by volunteers from the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r305","rowIndex":305,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その日の説明会には<tips=47>解放軍</tips>のものは参加しておらず、<tips=21>八龍会</tips>の通常メンバーがあたっていた。","en":"No members of the <tips=47>Liberation Army</tips> took part in that day’s briefing; ordinary members of the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips> handled it instead.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r306","rowIndex":306,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　年齢は、二十代から三十代くらいの若者たちで、男もいれば女もおり、肌が黒いものもいれば白いものもいた。","en":"They are young people in their twenties and thirties, both men and women, some dark-skinned and some light-skinned.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r307","rowIndex":307,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼らはみな親切で、症状がなくなったとは言え特殊な環境下で生活したせいか常識にかけるところのある元患者たちの質問や不満にも、丁寧に対応した。","en":"All of them are kind. Although their symptoms are gone, years in an unusual environment have left some former patients unfamiliar with ordinary social norms. The Eight Dragons Society members respond patiently even to their questions and complaints.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r308","rowIndex":308,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして<tips=82>広美</tips>には、昨夜細井が予測した通り、この場で家族の住所が伝えられた。","en":"And as Hosoi predicted the previous night, <tips=82>Hiromi</tips> receives her family’s address there.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r309","rowIndex":309,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「でも、すぐ帰るのはどうかと思うよ」","en":"“But I’m not sure you should go home immediately.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r310","rowIndex":310,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　書類を見せてくれた係員の男性がそう首を捻る。","en":"The male coordinator showing her the document tilts his head.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r311","rowIndex":311,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どうしてですか？」","en":"“Why not?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"内田広美（患者のＵ）","displayName":"Hiromi Uchida (Patient U)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r312","rowIndex":312,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「向こうもびっくりするだろうしね。とりあえずきみはここで生活して、僕たちの方からご家族にうまく説明し、会う約束をとりつけるというのはどうだろう？」","en":"“They will be startled too. How would this sound? For now, you live here while we explain the situation properly to your family and arrange a meeting.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r313","rowIndex":313,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　東南アジア系の血でも混ざっているのか、日本人にしてはどことなく顔つきの濃い係員は優しげにそう言った。","en":"Perhaps he has some Southeast Asian ancestry; his features are somewhat pronounced for a Japanese man. He speaks gently.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r314","rowIndex":314,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　裏があるようには見えないし、<tips=82>広美</tips>としても本心から善意のつもりで言ってくれているのだとは思う。そうわかってはいても、どうにもここに自分を引き留めようとしているように感じられ、<tips=82>広美</tips>の態度は頑なになってしまう。","en":"He does not appear to have any ulterior motive, and <tips=82>Hiromi</tips> believes that he is speaking out of sincere goodwill. Even knowing that, she cannot shake the feeling that he is trying to keep her here, and <tips=82>Hiromi</tips> grows obstinate.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r315","rowIndex":315,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いえ、すぐに行きます。出来れば今日にでも」","en":"“No. I’m going at once. Today, if possible.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"内田広美（患者のＵ）","displayName":"Hiromi Uchida (Patient U)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r316","rowIndex":316,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　うつむき視線を合わせないまま、はっきりと言い切った。","en":"She speaks firmly without raising her face or meeting his eyes.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r317","rowIndex":317,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　係員は溜息をつき、結局翌日の朝にここを出発するということで話を進めることになった。","en":"The coordinator sighs, and in the end they settle on having Hiromi leave the following morning.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r318","rowIndex":318,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　朝の会合が終わると自由行動となるが、ずっと病院で過ごして急に正常な精神と自由を与えられた患者たちは一晩明けた今日となってもみな動揺を隠せなかった。<tips=82>広美</tips>と同じアパートに振り分けられた元患者のうち、その日に家族と連絡が付き、無事街を出ていったのは入院時から比較的症状が軽く、病院生活もまだ浅く、家族と良好な関係を持つ一名だけだった。","en":"Once the morning meeting ends, the patients are free to do as they please. Yet after spending so long in the hospital and then abruptly regaining lucid minds and their freedom, they remain visibly unsettled even on this second day. Among the former patients assigned to <tips=82>Hiromi’s</tips> building, only one contacts her family that day and safely leaves the city. She had experienced relatively mild symptoms even before admission, had spent little time in the hospital, and maintained a good relationship with her family.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r319","rowIndex":319,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　あとのものはそれぞれ複雑な事情があり、連絡を思いとどまったり、そもそも家族と関わるつもりがないものばかりだった。","en":"Everyone else has complicated circumstances of one kind or another. They either think better of making contact or have no intention of dealing with their families at all.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r320","rowIndex":320,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「急に症状がなくなったと言って信じて貰えると思う？　それに、たとえ受け入れてくれたとしても、今まで散々ひどいことを言われたのに、治ったら急に手のひらをかえされたって、いやな気持ちだわ」","en":"“Do you really think they’ll believe us if we suddenly announce that our symptoms are gone? And even if they accept me, after all the cruel things they said before, it would only feel horrible if they reversed themselves the moment I was cured.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r321","rowIndex":321,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　田村という五十がらみの人物はその半生のほとんどを病院や施設で過ごして来た人物だが、子供の頃家庭でに弟にいじめられていたことや、面会にほとんど来ない両親のことを恨んでいる。","en":"A woman of about fifty named Tamura has spent nearly her entire life in hospitals and institutions. She resents the younger brother who bullied her at home when she was a child, and the parents who almost never visited.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r322","rowIndex":322,"pageCtrl":"","jp":" 　彼女は症状に冒されていた頃は童女のように無邪気でいつも空笑していたが、こうして知性を取り戻すとやたらと愚痴っぽく、陰気な表情で何かの悪口ばかり言うようになっていた。","en":"While in the grip of her symptoms, she had been as innocent as a little girl, forever laughing vacantly. Now that her intelligence has returned, she complains incessantly, glowering as she speaks ill of one person or another.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r323","rowIndex":323,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あの人、病気の時のほうが可愛かったね」","en":"“She was cuter when she was sick, wasn’t she?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r324","rowIndex":324,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　と細井が<tips=82>広美</tips>に耳打ちした。<tips=82>広美</tips>にしても同感だったけれども、頷くのは残酷に思えて返事が出来なかった。","en":"Hosoi whispers this into <tips=82>Hiromi’s</tips> ear. <tips=82>Hiromi</tips> agrees, but it feels cruel to nod, so she cannot answer.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r325","rowIndex":325,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=82>広美</tips>も含め、多くの重症患者は<tips=21>八龍会</tips>から与えられた薬によって大きく変化していたが、そうでないものもいた。","en":"Many of the severe patients, <tips=82>Hiromi</tips> among them, had changed dramatically under the medicine provided by the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips>. But some had not.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r326","rowIndex":326,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=46>ネオ・ローズ</tips>は<tips=17>タイプB</tips>の症状は取り除くが、他の病には効き目がない。年老いて認知症が進行したものや、その他の精神疾患が併発しているものは、以前と変わったようには見えなかった。","en":"<tips=46>Neo Rose</tips> removes the symptoms of <tips=17>Type B</tips>, but has no effect upon other illnesses. Elderly patients with advanced dementia and those suffering concurrently from other mental illnesses did not appear any different from before.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r327","rowIndex":327,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そういった、治療が必要な人々は<tips=21>八龍会</tips>の人々によってどこかへ連れて行かれた。近くの病院に入院するのだという。","en":"People like these who still need treatment are taken somewhere by members of the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips>. They are apparently to be admitted to a nearby hospital.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r328","rowIndex":328,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=21>八龍会</tips>としては、特にこの先の目的がない人々には、この街に残り、同志として活動をしてほしいようだった。","en":"The <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips> apparently wants people with no particular plans for what comes next to remain in the city and work as comrades.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r329","rowIndex":329,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　当面ここで生活をすることを決めた元患者たちに、近くのスーパーマーケットなどの生活に必要な施設の場所を説明する傍らで、この<tips=9>Y地区</tips>が<tips=17>タイプB</tips>にとっていかに住みやすい場所かを伝え、<tips=21>八龍会</tips>の活動を伝えた。","en":"While showing the former patients who have decided to stay for the time being where to find nearby supermarkets and other facilities essential to daily life, the members also tell them how hospitable <tips=9>Y District</tips> is to <tips=17>Type Bs</tips> and promote the work of the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r330","rowIndex":330,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　近くでそれを聞いていた<tips=82>広美</tips>は、彼らが目をきらきらと輝かせて語る『<tips=17>タイプB</tips>の解放』だとか『差別のない社会』という言葉にはどうにも興味が持てず、そのために活動をしているという彼らの情熱も理解出来なかった。彼女からすれば、たとえば病院に数多くいた、妄想について楽しそうに語る患者を眺めているのと同じ気分である。美味しいご飯の話をしたり、面白いテレビ番組の話をして楽しくなるのはわかるけれど、彼らの言っていることはわからない。","en":"Listening nearby, <tips=82>Hiromi</tips> cannot make herself care about phrases such as ‘the liberation of <tips=17>Type Bs</tips>’ and ‘a society without discrimination,’ which make their eyes shine. Nor can she understand their passion for such work. To her, it feels like watching patients at the hospital happily describe their delusions. She can understand growing excited about delicious food or an entertaining television program. She cannot understand what these people are saying.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r331","rowIndex":331,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして、そんなよくわからない理屈のために、あの血みどろの病院の光景を作りだしたり、赤の他人である自分たちを救い出してこのように手厚く保護するという常軌を逸した行動をするのも、なにやら病気じみている。","en":"That they would create the blood-soaked scene at the hospital for such incomprehensible ideas, then rescue complete strangers and protect them so carefully, strikes her as behavior with something pathological about it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r332","rowIndex":332,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=82>広美</tips>にも、それを口にしたら彼らの感情を害するだろうと想像するくらいの分別はあったので、黙っていた。","en":"<tips=82>Hiromi</tips> possesses enough discretion to imagine that saying so aloud would hurt their feelings, and therefore remains silent.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r333","rowIndex":333,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして翌日、<tips=82>広美</tips>が出発するときがやって来た。","en":"Then the day of <tips=82>Hiromi’s</tips> departure arrives.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r334","rowIndex":334,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「本当に一人で大丈夫かい？　誰か一緒について行かせようか？」","en":"“Are you truly certain you’ll be all right alone? Shall I send someone with you?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r335","rowIndex":335,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　昨日も会話をした<tips=21>八龍会</tips>のそのメンバーは、一通りの説明を終えた後に心配げにそう訊ねた。","en":"After finishing his explanations, the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips> member who also spoke with her yesterday asks her this with concern.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r336","rowIndex":336,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ろくに世間を知らない<tips=82>広美</tips>に、その場所までたどり着けるとはとても思えなかったのだろう。","en":"He probably cannot imagine that <tips=82>Hiromi</tips>, who knows almost nothing of the outside world, will manage to reach the address.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r337","rowIndex":337,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「大丈夫です。この携帯電話の使い方も教えて貰ったし」","en":"“I’ll be all right. You taught me how to use this phone.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"内田広美（患者のＵ）","displayName":"Hiromi Uchida (Patient U)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r338","rowIndex":338,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=21>八龍会</tips>が与えてくれた携帯電話の地図アプリには実家の住所を登録してもらってある。","en":"The address of her family home has been entered into the map application on the phone the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips> gave her.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r339","rowIndex":339,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それに、小さいころ電車にのった記憶はなんとなくあります。わからなかったら、駅の人に聞けば大丈夫なんですよね」","en":"“And I vaguely remember riding trains when I was small. If I don’t understand something, I can ask someone at the station, can’t I?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"内田広美（患者のＵ）","displayName":"Hiromi Uchida (Patient U)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r340","rowIndex":340,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それはそうだけど……」","en":"“That is true, but...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r341","rowIndex":341,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼は浮かない顔で<tips=82>広美</tips>の幼さの残る顔をまじまじと見る。","en":"With a troubled expression, he studies <tips=82>Hiromi’s</tips> still-childish face.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r342","rowIndex":342,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ご家族に事前に連絡はしたほうがいいんじゃないか？」","en":"“Shouldn’t you contact your family in advance?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r343","rowIndex":343,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「要りません。きっと、電話をしても私が良くなったって信じてくれないです。昨日鈴木さんも信じて貰えなくて泣いてたじゃないですか。あれを見て、直接行って病気が治った姿を見て貰ったほうがいいと思ったんです。そうすれば、私がもう悪い子じゃないって、一目でわかってくれると思います」","en":"“There’s no need. Even if I call, they won’t believe I’m better. Ms. Suzuki was crying yesterday because they wouldn’t believe her, remember? When I saw that, I thought it would be better to go in person and let my family see me cured. Then they’ll know at a glance that I’m not a bad child anymore.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"内田広美（患者のＵ）","displayName":"Hiromi Uchida (Patient U)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r344","rowIndex":344,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=82>広美</tips>はそう言って微笑んだ。","en":"<tips=82>Hiromi</tips> smiles as she speaks.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r345","rowIndex":345,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうしたらきっと、私が病気になる前の、私のことが大好きだったお父さんとお母さんに戻ってくれます」","en":"“Then I’m sure they’ll go back to being the mother and father who loved me before I got sick.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"内田広美（患者のＵ）","displayName":"Hiromi Uchida (Patient U)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r346","rowIndex":346,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　相手は答えず、難しい顔で<tips=82>広美</tips>を見下ろしたままだ。","en":"The man does not answer. He only keeps looking down at <tips=82>Hiromi</tips>, his expression grave.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r347","rowIndex":347,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それより、私が家に帰ってから、警察とかが聞きに来たらどう言えばいいですか？　病院のこととか、みなさんのこととか、聞かれると思うんですが……」","en":"“More importantly, after I go home, what should I say if the police come to question me? I think they’ll ask about the hospital and all of you...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"内田広美（患者のＵ）","displayName":"Hiromi Uchida (Patient U)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r348","rowIndex":348,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=82>広美</tips>の言葉に相手は苦笑して、","en":"<tips=82>Hiromi’s</tips> words draw a wry smile from the man, who says,","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r349","rowIndex":349,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そんなの、気にすることはないよ。全部ありのままを言えばいい。この街で今はじまろうとしていることは、警察には止められないんだから」","en":"“You don’t need to worry about that. Tell them everything exactly as it happened. The police cannot stop what is beginning in this city.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r350","rowIndex":350,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=82>広美</tips>はそんなものかとその言葉を疑問なく受け入れた。","en":"<tips=82>Hiromi</tips> accepts his words without question, assuming that must be how things are.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r351","rowIndex":351,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　もっとも、実際にはこの<tips=21>八龍会</tips>員の自信ほど、彼らに勢いがあったかといえばそれは疑問だ。","en":"That said, whether they truly possess as much momentum as this <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips> member’s confidence suggests is doubtful.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r352","rowIndex":352,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=46>ネオ・ローズ</tips>の効果によって優れた身体能力を活かせるようになったタイプBたちは確かにかつての欠点を克服した存在となっていたし、<tips=9>Y地区</tips>のあちこちの場所に会員を潜ませている<tips=21>八龍会</tips>は確かに脅威には違いない。しかし、それはあくまでもこの地域内限定の話である。地域外の<tips=17>タイプB</tips>の秘密組織は警察の監視下にあったし、そもそも、『<tips=46>ネオ・ローズ</tips>』の利益を独占したい<tips=21>八龍会</tips>は外の地域との関係が悪化しはじめており連携が難しかった。","en":"Under the effects of <tips=46>Neo Rose</tips>, Type Bs had indeed become able to capitalize on their superior physical abilities and had overcome their former weakness. The <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips>, with members planted throughout <tips=9>Y District</tips>, was unquestionably a threat. But that was true only within this region. Secret organizations of <tips=17>Type Bs</tips> outside the region were under police surveillance. Moreover, the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society’s</tips> desire to monopolize the profits from <tips=46>Neo Rose</tips> had begun to damage its relations beyond the region, making cooperation difficult.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r353","rowIndex":353,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=9>Y地区</tips>ではあまりにも警察の力は弱かったが、外はそうではないのだ。病院襲撃のようなことを地域の外で行ったならば、すぐに手痛い報復を受けていただろう。","en":"The police were extraordinarily weak inside <tips=9>Y District</tips>. Outside it, they were not. Had the Eight Dragons Society attempted an attack like the one upon the hospital beyond the district, it would likely have met swift and painful retaliation.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r354","rowIndex":354,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=21>八龍会</tips>の幹部たちには正しい認識があったはずだが、しかし彼のような末端の会員はそこまで冷静に状況を把握しているわけではなかった。","en":"The executives of the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips> must have understood the situation correctly. But rank-and-file members like him did not necessarily assess it with the same composure.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r355","rowIndex":355,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=67>カミラ</tips>などが説く理想を真に受け、自分たちの力を過信していた。","en":"They took the ideals preached by <tips=67>Camilla</tips> and others at face value and overestimated their own power.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r356","rowIndex":356,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　もちろんそれは彼らが特別に悪いと言うわけではなく、長年彼らをおびやかしていた発症の恐怖や、ノーマルに対する劣等感が、奇跡のように消えてなくなってしまったのだから当然の反応なのだろう。","en":"Of course, this did not mean they were especially at fault. The fear of onset that had haunted them for years, and their sense of inferiority toward Normals, had vanished as if by a miracle. Their reaction was only natural.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r357","rowIndex":357,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=21>八龍会</tips>の、特に若い者たちはみな輝ける将来への期待に胸を躍らせていた。","en":"The members of the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips>, especially the younger ones, were all thrilled at the prospect of a shining future.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r358","rowIndex":358,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しかしその情熱は、病院で衣食に困らない平和な生活を長年送っていた元患者たちにはあまりピンとこないものだったようだ。細井のように理解を示す人間は少なく、ほとんどが<tips=82>広美</tips>のように、わけのわからないことを言っていると受け止めた。","en":"That passion, however, appears not to have resonated much with the former patients, who had spent years living peacefully in the hospital without worrying about food or shelter. Few understood it as Hosoi did. Most, like <tips=82>Hiromi</tips>, received the members’ words as incomprehensible nonsense.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r359","rowIndex":359,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　解放さえすればみな感謝して<tips=21>八龍会</tips>に協力してくれると、<tips=67>カミラ</tips>をはじめとする幹部たちは随分単純に考えていたようだが、その思惑は外れることとなる。","en":"The executives, with <tips=67>Camilla</tips> foremost among them, apparently made the remarkably naive assumption that merely liberating people would make everyone grateful and willing to cooperate with the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips>. Their calculation would prove mistaken.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r360","rowIndex":360,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　いずれにせよ、<tips=21>八龍会</tips>が細かい注文をつけてこないのは<tips=82>広美</tips>にとっては有り難いことだった。","en":"In any event, <tips=82>Hiromi</tips> is grateful that the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips> makes no detailed demands of her.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r361","rowIndex":361,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　話が終わると早速出発の準備をした。といっても、身ひとつのまま病院から脱出してきた<tips=82>広美</tips>にはさしたる荷物はない。<tips=21>八龍会</tips>から借りた携帯電話と身につけた衣服、細々としたものを入れる小さなポシェットひとつ。現金は病院に預けていたおやつ代の五千円と、さらに一万円を<tips=21>八龍会</tips>が貸してくれた。<tips=82>広美</tips>の家族が住む街まで電車で千円ほどしか使わないが、何かあったときのためだということだ。","en":"As soon as the conversation ends, she begins preparing to leave. Not that <tips=82>Hiromi</tips>, who escaped the hospital with nothing but the clothes on her back, has much luggage. A phone borrowed from the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips>, the clothes she is wearing, and one small shoulder bag for odds and ends. Her cash consists of five thousand yen in snack money the hospital had been holding, plus another ten thousand yen lent to her by the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips>. The train to the city where <tips=82>Hiromi’s</tips> family lives will cost only about one thousand yen, but they say the extra is for emergencies.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r362","rowIndex":362,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして金色に輝く目を隠すため、カラーコンタクトをつけようとしたのだが、こういったものを目に入れたことがなく、自分だと怖くてつけられない。","en":"She also tries to insert colored contacts to hide her shining golden eyes. Having never put anything like them into her eyes before, however, she is too frightened to manage it alone.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r363","rowIndex":363,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　細井につけて貰おうと、部屋を出てその姿を探そうとしたが見つからず、近くにいた他の元患者に聞くと街に買い物をしにいったということだった。アパートに残ったのは<tips=82>広美</tips>と親しくないものしかいないようだった。仕方なく部屋に戻って涙をぼろぼろとこぼしながらコンタクトをつけて、部屋に細井へ別れの挨拶を書いた手紙を置いてドアを開けた。","en":"She leaves the room to find Hosoi and have her put in the contacts, but cannot locate her. Another former patient nearby says Hosoi has gone shopping in town. Only people who are not close to <tips=82>Hiromi</tips> seem to remain in the apartment building. With no other choice, she returns to her room and puts in the contacts herself, tears streaming down her face. She leaves Hosoi a farewell letter in the room and opens the door.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r364","rowIndex":364,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　外はしくしくと静かに雨が降っている。","en":"Outside, the rain falls softly, almost as though weeping.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r365","rowIndex":365,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　透明なビニール傘をさし、敷地から出ようとしたところで、向こうから金髪の青年がやって来た。","en":"Holding a transparent plastic umbrella, Hiromi is about to leave the grounds when a blond young man approaches from ahead.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r366","rowIndex":366,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「やあ。一人でどこへ行くんだい？」","en":"“Hey. Where are you off to all by yourself?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫","displayName":"Michio Mido","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r367","rowIndex":367,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　すれ違おうというとき、相手がそう声をかけたのでビクリとして立ち止まる。","en":"As she tries to pass, he calls out. Hiromi flinches to a stop.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r368","rowIndex":368,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あ、あの、親のところへ帰ろうと思って……」","en":"“U-um, I was thinking of going home to my parents...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"内田広美（患者のＵ）","displayName":"Hiromi Uchida (Patient U)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r369","rowIndex":369,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　黒い傘をさして立つその青年は<tips=82>広美</tips>からすると見上げるほどに背が高く、ギョッとしながらそう答えた。","en":"The young man standing beneath a black umbrella is tall enough that <tips=82>Hiromi</tips> has to crane her neck to look at him. Startled, she gives her answer.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r370","rowIndex":370,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうか。それは素敵だね！　きっと喜んで迎え入れてくれるよ！」","en":"“I see. That’s wonderful! I’m sure they’ll welcome you with open arms!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫","displayName":"Michio Mido","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r371","rowIndex":371,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　青年は<tips=82>広美</tips>の動揺を意に介さずに笑うと、手にしたビニール袋から何かを取り出して<tips=82>広美</tips>の手に無理矢理柔らかいものを持たせる。","en":"Ignoring <tips=82>Hiromi’s</tips> distress, the young man smiles, takes something from the plastic bag he is carrying, and forces the soft object into <tips=82>Hiromi’s</tips> hand.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r372","rowIndex":372,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それは透明なフィルムでパッケージされたまんじゅうだった。","en":"It is a manju wrapped in transparent film.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r373","rowIndex":373,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「餞別だよ。おれはこれをみんなに配ろうと思ってここに来たんだ。うまいんだぜ」","en":"“A little farewell gift. I came by to hand these out to everyone. They’re good.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫","displayName":"Michio Mido","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r374","rowIndex":374,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼はそれだけ言うと、そのままアパートの方へ歩いて行ってしまう。","en":"With nothing more than that, he walks on toward the apartments.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r375","rowIndex":375,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=82>広美</tips>は困惑した面持ちでその背中を眺めた後、まんじゅうをポシェットにしまって歩きはじめた。","en":"<tips=82>Hiromi</tips> watches his back with a bewildered expression, then slips the manju into her shoulder bag and continues walking.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r376","rowIndex":376,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その人物は<tips=47>解放軍</tips>のリーダー<tips=10>見土道夫</tips>で、病院の襲撃の時にも居たのだが、結局<tips=82>広美</tips>はそのことに気がつかなかった。","en":"The man was <tips=10>Michio Mido</tips>, leader of the <tips=47>Liberation Army</tips>. He had also been present during the attack upon the hospital, but <tips=82>Hiromi</tips> never realized either fact.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r377","rowIndex":377,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=21>八龍会</tips>の世話係が一番心配していたのは<tips=9>Y地区</tips>から出るまでの道のりで、右も左もわからない世間知らずの少女一人では、駅に辿り着くまでに地区内の不埒ものにちょっかいを出されてしまうかもしれない。","en":"The greatest concern of the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips> caretaker was the journey out of <tips=9>Y District</tips>. A sheltered girl traveling alone, knowing nothing of the world, might be accosted by some local lowlife before she even reached the station.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r378","rowIndex":378,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ということで、<tips=21>八龍会</tips>の人間が駅まで送ってくれることになっていた。","en":"For that reason, someone from the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips> had been assigned to escort her there.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r379","rowIndex":379,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　アパートを出てすぐ斜め向かいにあるアパートもまた元患者たちが暮らす建物になっており、そこの管理人室を訪ねると話を聞いていた中年女性が車を出して駅まで送り届けてくれた。","en":"Another apartment building diagonally across the road from Hiromi’s houses former patients as well. When she visits its manager’s office, a middle-aged woman who has been told the situation brings out her car and drives Hiromi to the station.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r380","rowIndex":380,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その女性には<tips=82>広美</tips>と同じくらいの年頃の娘がいるらしく、小さな時からずっと病院で暮らしていると言うとひどく同情してくれて、ハンカチで何度も目元を拭っていた。それが運転しながらのことだったので、<tips=82>広美</tips>はどうにも落ち着かなかった。","en":"The woman apparently has a daughter about <tips=82>Hiromi’s</tips> age. When Hiromi tells her that she has lived in the hospital since she was little, the woman is deeply sympathetic and repeatedly dabs at her eyes with a handkerchief. Since she does this while driving, <tips=82>Hiromi</tips> cannot relax.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r381","rowIndex":381,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして駅につくと<tips=82>広美</tips>の行き先を聞き出し、頼みもしないのにそこまでの切符を買ってくれる。","en":"At the station, the woman gets <tips=82>Hiromi</tips> to tell her where she is going and, without even being asked, buys her a ticket all the way there.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r382","rowIndex":382,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「帰ったら、思う存分ご両親に甘えるのよ」","en":"“When you arrive, let your parents spoil you to your heart’s content.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r383","rowIndex":383,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　別れ際に真っ赤な目で手を握ってくるその女性に、<tips=82>広美</tips>はぎこちない微笑みを返した。","en":"As they part, the woman, her eyes bright red, clasps her hand, and <tips=82>Hiromi</tips> returns an awkward smile.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r384","rowIndex":384,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ガラガラの電車に乗り込むと、<tips=82>広美</tips>はさっき貰った饅頭を食べながらぼんやり窓の外を見た。","en":"After boarding the nearly empty train, <tips=82>Hiromi</tips> eats the manju she was given and gazes absently out the window.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r385","rowIndex":385,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　流れゆく景色を眺めていると昔のことを思い出す。","en":"The passing landscape calls back memories of long ago.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r386","rowIndex":386,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　小さな頃、よく両親に連れられて電車で出かけたものだ。","en":"When she was small, her parents often took her on outings by train.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r387","rowIndex":387,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=82>広美</tips>はバンザイするような格好で、右手では母親の手を握り、左手はまだ赤ん坊だった妹をおぶった父親の手を握っている。そして満面の笑みを浮かべて、とめどもなく何かを喋っていたんだ。興奮のまま、ただでさえ幼児特有のとりとめのない言葉が、ますます本人以外にはわからないものになって、「ねえ？　ねえ？」と訊ねるたび両親は答えられずに苦笑していた。","en":"<tips=82>Hiromi</tips> stood with both arms raised as if cheering, holding her mother’s hand in her right and her father’s in her left, while her father carried her baby sister on his back. She beamed from ear to ear and chattered away endlessly about something. In her excitement, the already disjointed speech peculiar to small children became even harder for anyone but her to understand. Every time she asked, “Right? Right?” her parents, unable to answer, could only smile helplessly.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r388","rowIndex":388,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　あれはどこへ行こうとしていたんだろう？　遊園地だったっけな。そうだ、あの時はどの乗り物よりも、どのキャラクターよりも、甘いキャラメルのかかったポップコーンを買って貰って食べるのが楽しみで仕方なかった。それから白とピンクで綺麗に飾られた棒付きの飴。","en":"Where had they been going that day? Was it an amusement park? Yes. More than any ride or character, she had been beside herself with anticipation for the sweet caramel-coated popcorn they would buy her. And then there was the beautifully decorated white-and-pink lollipop.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r389","rowIndex":389,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　あの頃は不安も恐ろしいものもなく、何もかも輝いて見えていたっけ。","en":"In those days, she had known no anxiety and nothing frightening. Everything had seemed to shine.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r390","rowIndex":390,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　誕生日とクリスマスもとても楽しかった。","en":"Birthdays and Christmas had been wonderful too.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r391","rowIndex":391,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　大好きな苺の乗ったケーキにローソクを立てて吹き消して、砂糖菓子で出来た人形や、メッセージの書かれたチョコレートは全部独占して、そうすると妹が泣くので半分だけ分けてあげて、母が作った骨のところを銀紙で覆って掴めるようにした鶏の唐揚げを食べて、サイダーを飲んで。","en":"She would put candles into a cake topped with her beloved strawberries and blow them out; claim all the sugar figures and the chocolate plaque with its written message; give half to her little sister when that made her cry; eat the fried chicken her mother prepared, each bone wrapped in foil to make it easy to hold; and drink soda.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r392","rowIndex":392,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　自分にそんな記憶があったのをすっかり忘れていた。病院にいるときはちっとも思い出さなかった。毎日真っ白な建物のなかで、恐ろしいものが見えて、恐ろしい声が聞こえて、調子が悪いとトイレにも行けなくなってそのあたりに粗相をしてしまったり、特別な鍵がないと脱ぐことが出来ない服を着せられたりして、でもそれが当たり前だった。","en":"She had completely forgotten that such memories existed within her. Not once had she recalled them inside the hospital. Every day, inside that perfectly white building, she saw frightening things and heard frightening voices. When her condition was poor, she could not even reach the bathroom and would soil herself wherever she stood. They dressed her in clothing she could not remove without a special key. Yet all of it had felt ordinary.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r393","rowIndex":393,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　家族のことも、ほとんど思い出すこともなかった。","en":"She had scarcely remembered her family either.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r394","rowIndex":394,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それは全部病気のせいで、今はもうそれが治った。ポシェットのなかには、二週間後にうつ薬と注射を入れて貰った。使ったらまた貰いに行って、使い続けていればもうずっと病院に戻らなくて済むそうだ。","en":"That had all been the illness, and now it was cured. Inside her shoulder bag, they had placed a dose of medicine to inject two weeks later and a syringe. Once she uses it, she can return for another. They told her that if she continues using it, she will never have to return to the hospital.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r395","rowIndex":395,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"（私は、本当の自分に戻れるんだ……）","en":"(I can return to my real self...)","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r396","rowIndex":396,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　また学校にも行きたい。症状が頻発するようになってからいじめられるようになったが、それまでは楽しくやっていたし、学校が好きだった。嫌いな授業はなかったし、給食の時間は楽しかった。友だちと一緒に帰るのも楽しかった。この年から行ける学校はあるんだろうか？","en":"She wants to go to school again. The other children had begun bullying her once her episodes became frequent, but before then she had been happy there. She had loved school. There was no subject she disliked; lunchtime was fun, and so was walking home with her friends. Was there a school she could enter at her age?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r397","rowIndex":397,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　電車の振動が、車窓から見える景色が、彼女の心を刺激するのか。まるでパンドラの箱を開けたかのように次から次へと子供時代の記憶が飛び出してくる。","en":"Perhaps the vibrations of the train and the landscape beyond the window stimulate her mind. As if she had opened Pandora’s box, memories of childhood spring forth one after another.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r398","rowIndex":398,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　めくるめく感情と記憶の奔流にほとんど目眩を感じてくらくらしているうちに、<tips=82>広美</tips>は目指す駅に辿り着いていた。","en":"Almost dizzy beneath the dazzling torrent of emotion and memory, <tips=82>Hiromi</tips> finds that she has arrived at her destination.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r399","rowIndex":399,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　家族は昔<tips=82>広美</tips>が住んでいた頃から引っ越していない。駅前の風景にはところどころ見覚えがあった。","en":"Her family has not moved since the days long ago when <tips=82>Hiromi</tips> lived with them. Here and there, the streets around the station look familiar.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r400","rowIndex":400,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　いつもお菓子を買って貰っていたコンビニエンスストアー。買い物のついでに季節の衣類をよく出していたクリーニング店には、あのころとほとんど変わらないきついパーマのかかった無愛想な女店員が立っている。","en":"There is the convenience store where her parents always bought her sweets. At the dry cleaner where they often dropped off seasonal clothing while out shopping, the same unfriendly woman with the tight perm stands behind the counter, looking almost unchanged from those days.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r401","rowIndex":401,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　はじめは携帯の地図を頼りに歩いていたが、家に近づくにつれてもやがはれるように記憶が鮮明になり、必要がなくなった。","en":"At first, Hiromi walks with the map on her phone as a guide. As she approaches her house, however, her memories sharpen as though a fog has lifted, and she no longer needs it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r402","rowIndex":402,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　友だちと泥遊びをした公園の前を通り過ぎ、虫を捕まえた空き地は今はマンションになっていて、その前の角を曲がる。<tips=82>広美</tips>は早足になり、胸の鼓動は興奮で高鳴った。","en":"She passes the park where she made mud pies with her friends. The vacant lot where she caught insects has become an apartment building. She turns at the corner beyond it. <tips=82>Hiromi</tips> quickens her pace, her heart pounding with excitement.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r403","rowIndex":403,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして、記憶のなかの自分の家の前に辿り着いて立ち止まると、手に握りしめた携帯電話から『目的の場所に到着しました』というアナウンスが流れる。","en":"Then she reaches the house from her memories and stops before it. From the phone clenched in her hand comes an announcement: ‘You have arrived at your destination.’","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r404","rowIndex":404,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　建物は<tips=82>広美</tips>の記憶とは変わっていたが、その表札にはしっかりと『UCHIDA』という文字があった。","en":"The building has changed from what <tips=82>Hiromi</tips> remembers, but the nameplate clearly reads ‘UCHIDA.’","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-1:r405","rowIndex":405,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=82>広美</tips>はゴクリと喉を鳴らして生唾を飲み込んだ。","en":"<tips=82>Hiromi’s</tips> throat works as she swallows nervously.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}}]},{"position":55,"code":"X15-2","unitId":"X15-2","rows":[{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r1","rowIndex":1,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=9>Y地区</tips>の憂鬱な曇り空に慣れた<tips=82>広美</tips>にとって、その青空と太陽の輝きはあまりにも鮮やかに目に沁みた。","en":"After growing accustomed to the dreary overcast skies of <tips=9>Y District</tips>, <tips=82>Hiromi</tips> found the blue sky and the brilliance of the sun almost painfully vivid.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r2","rowIndex":2,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　アスファルトの上に濃い影をくっきりと作り出す強い日差しの下、彼女はそろそろと手を持ち上げて、インターフォンのボタンにその指先を触れる。","en":"Beneath the fierce sunlight, which cast dense, sharp-edged shadows upon the asphalt, she slowly raised her hand and touched the tip of one finger to the intercom button.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r3","rowIndex":3,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　プラスチックの艶やかな感触を人差し指に感じる。","en":"She felt the sleek plastic against the tip of her index finger.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r4","rowIndex":4,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　この目の前の、どこにでもある普通の一軒家のなかに、<tips=82>広美</tips>にとってたったひとつの家庭がある。","en":"Inside the ordinary detached house before her—one like any other—was the one and only home <tips=82>Hiromi</tips> had.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r5","rowIndex":5,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　もう何年も、全く別の生活を送ってきた彼らだが、身体に流れる血のつながりと、昔の思い出は共有しており、誰にも拭い去ることは出来ない。","en":"They had lived entirely separate lives for years now, but they shared the blood in their veins and the memories of long ago, and no one could wipe those away.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r6","rowIndex":6,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　今この指にほんの少しの力を入れるだけで、それぞれの生活を隔てて来た見えない壁が崩れ去り、お互いの生活のなかにお互いが姿を現すのだ。","en":"The slightest pressure from this finger would bring down the invisible wall that had divided their lives. Each would appear once more within the life of the other.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r7","rowIndex":7,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=82>広美</tips>は緊張して喉をごくりとならしたが、口の中はからからに乾いて飲み込むものはなかった。","en":"<tips=82>Hiromi</tips> swallowed nervously, though her mouth was so dry that there was nothing to swallow.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r8","rowIndex":8,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　風が吹き、木の葉がざわざわと擦れ合う音が聞こえる。車が通り過ぎるエンジンの音が聞こえる。","en":"The wind blew, and she heard leaves rustling against one another. She heard the engine of a passing car.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r9","rowIndex":9,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=82>広美</tips>は指をインターフォンから離し、溜息をついた。","en":"<tips=82>Hiromi</tips> drew her finger away from the intercom and sighed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r10","rowIndex":10,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　さっきまであんなに楽しみにしていたのに、いざとなると勇気が出ない。","en":"Only moments ago, she had been looking forward to this so eagerly. Now that the moment has come, she cannot summon the courage.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r11","rowIndex":11,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女はまったく、今の家族たちの様子を知らないのだ。少し、どんな風だか見てみようと、敷地を取り囲む生け垣に沿って歩きながら家の様子をうかがった。","en":"She knew nothing at all about what her family was like now. Thinking that she would take just a brief look, Hiromi walked along the hedge surrounding the property and peered toward the house.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r12","rowIndex":12,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　側面にまわったところで背伸びをして覗き込むと、庭の光景が目に入る。","en":"When she reached the side, she stood on tiptoe and looked over it. The garden came into view.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r13","rowIndex":13,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　一畳ほどの小さな家庭菜園があって、ミニトマトが実っている。庭の隅にこんもりと小さく盛り上がった上に『クロ』と書かれた板が刺さっているのはペットの墓でもつくったんだろうか。縁側に上がるところには、サンダルが二足ならんでいる。","en":"There is a little vegetable patch, no larger than a single tatami mat, where cherry tomatoes grow. In one corner of the garden, a board marked ‘KURO’ sticks out of a small, gently rounded mound. Had they made a grave for a pet? Two pairs of sandals stand side by side at the step up to the veranda.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r14","rowIndex":14,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そしてガラスのサッシの向こうには、リビングルームの様子が見えた。","en":"Beyond the glass doors, she could see into the living room.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r15","rowIndex":15,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　はっきりした木目が浮かび上がったキャメルのフローリングに白い壁のシンプルな洋室。大きな液晶テレビ。ニスで艶光りする木製の棚の上には、写真立てが並べられている。壁に掛かった賞状は妹が学校でとったものだろうか。ここからではその文字までは読めない。","en":"It was a simple Western-style room, with white walls and camel-colored flooring whose grain stood out clearly. There was a large flat-screen television. Framed photographs lined the top of a varnished wooden cabinet. Had her sister won the certificate hanging on the wall at school? Hiromi could not read the words from here.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r16","rowIndex":16,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして中央に設置された六人掛けのテーブルの上には、サラダの入った大きなボウルと、口のところが銀紙のようなものでパッケージされた飲み物の瓶とグラス、そして白いホールケーキがあった。","en":"On the six-seat table in the center of the room sit a large bowl of salad; glasses and a bottle with silver foil around its mouth; and a whole white cake.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r17","rowIndex":17,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それを見た時<tips=82>広美</tips>の胸はざわついた。","en":"The sight sent a restless stirring through <tips=82>Hiromi’s</tips> chest.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r18","rowIndex":18,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　誰かの誕生日パーティをやろうとしているのだろうか。それは、父親か、母親か、それとも妹か。","en":"Were they about to hold a birthday party for someone? Was it her father, her mother, or her sister?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r19","rowIndex":19,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　思い出そうとしてみたけれど、今日が何日かわからない。携帯電話で確認してから、それ以前に家族の誕生日を誰一人として知らないことに気がついた。","en":"She tried to remember, but she did not know the date. After checking it on her phone, she realized that she did not know the birthday of a single member of her family in the first place.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r20","rowIndex":20,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　誰もいなかったその部屋に、奥のキッチンから一人の人物が現れた。","en":"A person emerged from the kitchen at the back of the empty room.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r21","rowIndex":21,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それは紛れもない母の姿だった。髪型を変え、少し老けて印象が変わっていたが一目でそうとわかった。","en":"It was unmistakably her mother. She had changed her hairstyle and aged a little, altering her appearance, but Hiromi knew her at a glance.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r22","rowIndex":22,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　母は両手にお盆を持ち、その上に今日の料理を盛った皿を乗せていた。","en":"Her mother carried a tray in both hands, with plates laden with food for the occasion arranged upon it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r23","rowIndex":23,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　予期していたはずなのに、それはあまりにも突然の邂逅に感じられた。<tips=82>広美</tips>は心臓が止まりそうな思いをしながらとっさに姿を生け垣に隠し、その葉の隙間からなかの様子をこっそりと覗く。","en":"Although <tips=82>Hiromi</tips> should have expected it, the encounter felt overwhelmingly sudden. Her heart nearly stopped. She ducked behind the hedge on instinct and secretly watched the room through the gaps between its leaves.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r24","rowIndex":24,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　母はこちらに気づくことなく、皿をテーブルの上に並べている。","en":"Her mother noticed nothing and began arranging the plates upon the table.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r25","rowIndex":25,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そしてすぐにもう一人の人物が別のドアを開けて部屋のなかに入って来た。","en":"Then, almost immediately, another person opened a different door and entered the room.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r26","rowIndex":26,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　少し腹が突き出て、頭髪が寂しくなっているがそれは間違いなく父だ。","en":"His belly protruded a little and his hair had thinned, but he was unmistakably her father.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r27","rowIndex":27,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　父は両手にリボンでラッピングされた箱を持っており、母に見せると二人で笑い合う。","en":"Her father held a ribbon-wrapped box in both hands. When he showed it to her mother, the two of them laughed together.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r28","rowIndex":28,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　言葉を交わしたのちに、箱をテレビの裏に隠した。","en":"After exchanging a few words, he hid the box behind the television.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r29","rowIndex":29,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　あれで、今日の主役を驚かせようと言うのだ。","en":"They meant to use it to surprise the guest of honor today.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r30","rowIndex":30,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そう、今日は妹の誕生日で、家族はそれを盛りあげるための準備をしているに違いない。","en":"Yes—today must be her sister’s birthday, and the family must be preparing to celebrate.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r31","rowIndex":31,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　父は落ち着かない様子のままソファーに座り、新聞を手に取ったり戻したりしていた。","en":"Her father sat restlessly on the sofa, picking up the newspaper only to put it down again.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r32","rowIndex":32,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その足元にはいつのまにか部屋に入っていた小さな毛むくじゃらの犬がじゃれつき、父はそれを抱き上げる。","en":"A little shaggy dog that had slipped into the room at some point frisked around his feet, and he lifted it into his arms.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r33","rowIndex":33,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=82>広美</tips>は凍り付いたようにそのガラスを隔てた絵に描いたような平和な光景に見入っていた。","en":"<tips=82>Hiromi</tips> stood frozen, staring through the glass at a scene of perfect peace, as though it had been painted there.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r34","rowIndex":34,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それは、<tips=82>広美</tips>が発症する前にこの家にあった光景だ。そして、<tips=82>広美</tips>が発症してからはこのように完全にくつろいだ光景はなかった。本来ならここに自分も居たのだろうか？　いや、あのまま自分がここにいたら、彼らはこのように笑う日は来なかったかもしれない。自分がいなくなることで、彼らはこの幸福を作れたのだろう。でも、今の自分なら？","en":"It was the kind of scene this house had held before <tips=82>Hiromi’s</tips> onset. After <tips=82>Hiromi’s</tips> onset, there had never again been such a scene of complete ease. By rights, would she have been there among them? No. If she had stayed, perhaps the day would never have come when they could smile this way. Perhaps they had built this happiness because she was gone. But what if it were her as she was now?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r35","rowIndex":35,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　胸がどきどきとして、おかしな汗がこめかみを伝う。","en":"Her heart pounds, and an unfamiliar trickle of sweat runs down her temple.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r36","rowIndex":36,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　母はケーキの上に小さな蝋燭を並べ、父がそれにライターで火をつける。全ての着火が終わると、部屋の電気は消され、カーテンが閉められた。そして、妹を呼ぶ父の声が聞こえる。","en":"Her mother arranged small candles upon the cake, and her father lit them with a lighter. Once every flame was burning, they switched off the lights and closed the curtains. Then she heard her father call for her sister.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r37","rowIndex":37,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=82>広美</tips>は閉め出されたような格好でしばらくそこに立っていたが、すぐに移動して部屋のなかを見られる場所を探す。","en":"<tips=82>Hiromi</tips> stood there for a moment as though she had been shut out. Then she moved at once, searching for somewhere else from which she could see into the room.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r38","rowIndex":38,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　別の壁に小さな窓があり、生け垣の土台となっているブロックの上に上れば、なんとかそこからテーブルの近くを見ることが出来た。","en":"There was a small window in another wall. By climbing onto the blocks forming the hedge’s foundation, she could just manage to see the area around the table.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r39","rowIndex":39,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして、ちょうど自分の席に座ろうとしている妹の姿が見えた。","en":"There she saw her sister, just as the girl was about to take her seat.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r40","rowIndex":40,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女は、一目でそうとわかった両親とは違い、記憶のなかよりもずっと成長して、まるで別人のようだった。街で偶然見かけてもその顔立ちだけでは気がつかないかもしれない。でも、もしかしたら、と振り返りはするだろう。","en":"Unlike her parents, whom Hiromi recognized at once, her sister has grown so far beyond the child in her memory that she seems almost another person. If they happened to pass on the street, Hiromi might not recognize her from her face alone. Even so, something might make her turn for a second look.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r41","rowIndex":41,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　なぜなら、幸せそうに目を輝かせる彼女の顔の半分には、この幸福そのものの光景にはあまりにも不似合いなみにくい火傷のあとがあったからだ。","en":"For half of that happy face, its eyes alight, bore an ugly burn scar terribly out of place in this picture of happiness.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r42","rowIndex":42,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あっ」","en":"“Ah—”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r43","rowIndex":43,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=82>広美</tips>の身体ががくがくと震え、その拍子に足をすべらせてブロック塀から落ちてアスファルトに尻餅をつく。","en":"<tips=82>Hiromi’s</tips> body begins to shake violently. In the trembling she loses her footing on the blocks and lands hard on her backside on the asphalt.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r44","rowIndex":44,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして立ち上がると、駆け出した。どこへ行こうというつもりもなく、とにかくこの場を離れたかった。その顔は蒼白で、引きつっていた。","en":"Then she rose and ran. She had no destination in mind; she simply had to get away. Her face was bloodless and drawn tight.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r45","rowIndex":45,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　インターフォンなど押せるわけがない。自分が、あの幸せな誕生日パーティを邪魔出来るだろうか？　あのささやかな幸せを取り戻した家庭に戻れるだろうか？　あの妹の顔に消えない痣を作ったのは自分なのだ。","en":"She could never press that intercom. How could she intrude upon that happy birthday party? How could she return to a family that had recovered this modest happiness? She was the one who had left that permanent scar upon her sister’s face.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r46","rowIndex":46,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"（どうして忘れていたんだろう？　どうしてなの？　戻れるわけなんかないじゃないか！）","en":"(How could I have forgotten? How? Of course I can never go back!)","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r47","rowIndex":47,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　走る<tips=82>広美</tips>の目に涙が浮かんで丸いたまとなり、それが崩れるようにボロボロと頬の上を流れ落ちた。","en":"Tears swelled into round drops as <tips=82>Hiromi</tips> ran, then broke loose and streamed down her cheeks.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r48","rowIndex":48,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　家で暮らしていた最後の日々、<tips=82>広美</tips>は完全に別の世界の住人となっていた。","en":"During her final days at home, <tips=82>Hiromi</tips> had become a resident of another world entirely.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r49","rowIndex":49,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　一緒に住む二人の大人と一人の幼児は、見た目は家族にそっくりだが、その正体はまったく別の恐ろしいものだ。きっと宇宙人に違いない。いつのまにか入れ替わって、自分をいつも見張っている。そして大事なものを奪おうとしているんだ。","en":"The two adults and the small child who lived with her looked exactly like her family, but beneath those appearances they were something else—something terrible. They had to be aliens. At some point they had replaced her real family and begun watching her constantly. They meant to take away everything precious to her.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r50","rowIndex":50,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　宇宙人は火に弱いと、別の声が教えてくれる。その声はいつも優しくて、<tips=82>広美</tips>を肯定してくれる天使の声だから信用出来る。火を使って、宇宙人を追い出せば優しい両親と、かわいい妹が帰ってきてくれるんだ。早くあの懐かしい家族に会いたい！","en":"Another voice tells her that aliens are weak against fire. The voice is always gentle, always affirms <tips=82>Hiromi</tips>, and is the voice of an angel, so she can trust it. If she uses fire to drive out the aliens, her kind parents and adorable little sister will come back. She wants to see that beloved family again as soon as she can!","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r51","rowIndex":51,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　夜にこっそり起き出すと雑誌をちぎって紙切れをうずたかく山にした。<tips=82>広美</tips>の症状が出るようになってからライターはみな鍵付きの戸棚に仕舞われていたが、この日のために来客がハンガーにかけたジャケットからひとつ抜き取ってある。それを使って、紙くずに火をつけた。さっき父親が蝋燭に火をつけたように。メラメラと炎があがり、臭い煙が立ち上って部屋に充満する。火災警報器がけたたましい音を立てる。恍惚の表情で炎を眺めていた<tips=82>広美</tips>はその音でビクッと肩をふるわし、部屋を飛び出る。","en":"At night she had slipped out of bed, torn magazines to pieces, and heaped the scraps high. Since <tips=82>Hiromi’s</tips> symptoms first appeared, every lighter in the house had been locked in a cabinet, but in preparation for this day she had taken one from a visitor’s jacket left on a hanger. She used it to set the paper scraps alight, just as her father had lit the candles moments earlier. Flames leapt up, and foul-smelling smoke rose and filled the room. The fire alarm shrieked. <tips=82>Hiromi</tips> had been gazing at the flames in rapture, but the sound made her shoulders jerk and sent her bolting from the room.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r52","rowIndex":52,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あの音を止めて！　宇宙語で私の悪口を言っているの！」","en":"“Make that noise stop! It’s saying terrible things about me in alien language!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r53","rowIndex":53,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　一度も思い出したことがないその光景が、ありありと<tips=82>広美</tips>の脳裏に蘇った。その夜すこし肌寒かったことや、隣の犬が狂ったように吠えていたことも思い出した。","en":"The scene, which had never returned to her before, came back to <tips=82>Hiromi</tips> with perfect clarity. She even remembered that the night had been slightly cold and that the neighbor’s dog had barked like mad.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r54","rowIndex":54,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そうだ自分は散々迷惑をかけて、その挙げ句に焼き殺そうとしたんだ。結果妹は顔に消えない痣を作った。女の子が顔にあんな痣を作って、どれだけつらい人生を送ってきたのだろうか。全て自分がやったんだ。","en":"Yes. She had caused them endless misery and then, at the end of it all, tried to burn them to death. Her sister had been left with a permanent scar across her face. What kind of painful life must a girl have endured with a scar like that? Hiromi had done all of it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r55","rowIndex":55,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　たとえ病気のせいとは言え、言い訳出来るようなものではない。もう症状が消えましたと、何食わぬ顔で家に戻ることなんか出来るはずもない。","en":"Even if her illness had caused it, that was no excuse. She could not simply go home as though nothing had happened and announce that her symptoms were gone.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r56","rowIndex":56,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　あの頃みたいに、妹は怯えて引きつった顔でこちらを見、両親は何かあるたびまた無茶苦茶なことをするのではないかとビクビクと怯えて暮らすことになるのだろう。","en":"Her sister would look at her with the same frightened, rigid expression as before. Her parents would spend their lives cowering, afraid that every small event might drive her to do something senseless again.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r57","rowIndex":57,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そもそも本当に症状が消えたのか？　こんな大事なことを忘れて、すっかり元通りになれると信じていただなんて、どう考えたって普通じゃない。","en":"Were her symptoms truly gone in the first place? She had forgotten something this important, yet believed completely that she could simply return to how she had been. No matter how she considered it, that was not normal.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r58","rowIndex":58,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=82>広美</tips>は泣きながら、やみくもに走った。","en":"<tips=82>Hiromi</tips> ran blindly, weeping.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r59","rowIndex":59,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それから先自分がどこをどう行動したのか覚えていない。","en":"She remembered nothing of where she went or what she did afterward.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r60","rowIndex":60,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ただ気がつけば雨でびしょ濡れになって、<tips=9>Y地区</tips>に居た。うなだれ、どこともわからない通りを歩いている。酔っ払った客が時々何か下品な言葉をかけてくるが、世界の果てで囁いているようで耳に入ってこない。いまの<tips=82>広美</tips>にとって、周囲で起きている全てのことが地球の裏側の出来事のように遠かった。","en":"When she next became aware of her surroundings, she was drenched by rain and back in <tips=9>Y District</tips>. Her head bowed, she walked down a street she did not recognize. Drunken customers occasionally called something vulgar to her, but their words seemed to be whispered at the end of the world and never reached her ears. Now, to <tips=82>Hiromi</tips>, everything happening around her felt as remote as events on the other side of the earth.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r61","rowIndex":61,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　動揺はしていない。気持ちはもう大分落ち着いていた。","en":"She was no longer distraught. Her emotions had already settled considerably.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r62","rowIndex":62,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　結局、自分のことばかり考えていたんだ。相手のことを考えたり、想像したりすることが出来なかった。だから実際相手の暮らしを見るまで何も気づかなかった。","en":"In the end, she had thought only of herself. She had been unable to consider the other people involved, or even imagine their lives. Not until she saw those lives for herself had she understood anything.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r63","rowIndex":63,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼らの暮らしは自分とは余りに違った。病院でわがままに暮らし、そして世話してくれた人たちの血みどろの亡骸をそれほどの感情もなく踏み越え、今度は家族と元通り幸せに暮らそうだなんて、そんな都合のいいことがどうして思えよう？","en":"Their lives were too different from hers. She had lived selfishly in the hospital, stepped over the blood-soaked bodies of the people who cared for her with scarcely any emotion, and then imagined that she could return to a happy life with her family as though nothing had happened. How could she ever have entertained such a convenient fantasy?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r64","rowIndex":64,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"（ああ、本当に、私は恩知らずだった）","en":"(Oh, I truly was ungrateful.)","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r65","rowIndex":65,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そう、病院では本当に優しくしてもらえていたんだ。症状でひどいことをたくさんして、だけどみんな笑って許してくれた。親だってもう見捨てた私なのに。その彼らがあんな無惨に殺されて、ちょっとショックだったけれど、その程度しか悲しまないのはいくらなんでもおかしい。","en":"Yes—the people at the hospital truly had treated her kindly. Her symptoms had made her do so many terrible things, yet they had all smiled and forgiven her, even after her own parents had abandoned her. Now those people had been slaughtered so horribly, and she had felt a little shocked, but no more than that. Surely there was something terribly wrong with grieving so little.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r66","rowIndex":66,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ノミさん、ノミさん」","en":"“Ms. No-mi, Ms. No-mi.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r67","rowIndex":67,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=82>広美</tips>はことあるごとにそう呟いて看護師の<tips=83>能見美紗</tips>を頼った。その名前を呼べば、つらくて怖いときでも何でもしてくれると思ったからだ。","en":"Whenever anything happened, <tips=82>Hiromi</tips> murmured those words and turned to the nurse <tips=83>Misa Nomi</tips>. She believed that if she called the name, Ms. Nomi would do anything for her whenever she was suffering or afraid.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r68","rowIndex":68,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ノミさん、ノミさん」","en":"“Ms. No-mi, Ms. No-mi.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r69","rowIndex":69,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ノミじゃないって。の・う・み」","en":"“Not No-mi. No-o-mi.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r70","rowIndex":70,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その日は一日中調子が悪く、ずっとその名を繰り返していた。<tips=83>能見</tips>はそのたびにやって来て、苦笑いをしながらそう訂正する。","en":"Hiromi had been unwell all day and had repeated the name without end. Each time, <tips=83>Nomi</tips> came to her and corrected her with a wry smile.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r71","rowIndex":71,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ノミさん、ノミさん……」","en":"“Ms. No-mi, Ms. No-mi...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r72","rowIndex":72,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=82>広美</tips>はあふれでる涙を拭いながらそう訴える。現実に何かされたとか、そういうわけではないのだ。恐ろしいものが見えて、恐ろしい声が聞こえて、ただ怖くてたまらない。","en":"<tips=82>Hiromi</tips> pleaded with her that way as she wiped away overflowing tears. No one had actually done anything to her. She saw terrifying things and heard terrifying voices, and she was simply too frightened to bear it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r73","rowIndex":73,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あのね、の・うぅ・み」","en":"“Listen. No-oo-mi.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r74","rowIndex":74,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ノミさん……」","en":"“Ms. No-mi...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r75","rowIndex":75,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=83>能見</tips>は<tips=82>広美</tips>が繰り返す言葉に、溜息をついて訂正を諦めた。","en":"<tips=83>Nomi</tips> sighed at the word <tips=82>Hiromi</tips> repeated and gave up correcting her.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r76","rowIndex":76,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そうやって<tips=83>能見</tips>が接している間は少し落ち着くが、離れれば声が高く大きくなって、それに耐えかねた患者たちが苦情をいれる。","en":"While <tips=83>Nomi</tips> attended to her this way, she calmed down a little. But whenever Nomi stepped away, her voice grew higher and louder until the other patients could bear it no longer and complained.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r77","rowIndex":77,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それを何度か繰り返していると、医師の<tips=5>太刀川</tips>が病室までやって来た。そうして、興奮状態の<tips=82>広美</tips>の目をチラリと見ると、","en":"After this happens several times, Dr. <tips=5>Tachikawa</tips> comes to the ward. He gives the agitated <tips=82>Hiromi</tips> a single glance in the eyes.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r78","rowIndex":78,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「駄目ですね。拘束の準備をしてください」","en":"“No. This won’t do. Prepare the restraints.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"太刀川良馬","displayName":"Ryoma Tachikawa","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r79","rowIndex":79,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　と、助手の<tips=93>林田</tips>に指示を出した。","en":"He gave the order to his assistant, <tips=93>Hayashida</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r80","rowIndex":80,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして<tips=82>広美</tips>は病室から観察室へつれてゆかれると、ベッドにベルトで手足を縛り付けられ、点滴の針を刺される。点滴には<tips=17>タイプB</tips>の精神症状に効果があると言われている新薬が含まれている。<tips=82>広美</tips>は点滴を自分で引き抜いてしまうため、いつも拘束が必要だった。","en":"<tips=82>Hiromi</tips> was taken from her hospital room to the observation room, where her arms and legs were strapped to a bed and an IV needle inserted. The drip contained a new drug said to be effective against the psychiatric symptoms of <tips=17>Type B</tips>. Because <tips=82>Hiromi</tips> would pull the IV out herself, restraints were always necessary.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r81","rowIndex":81,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=82>広美</tips>はそうされている間、特に抵抗はしない。何度も拘束されている<tips=82>広美</tips>は特に拘束を嫌がる気持ちもなかったし、そもそも自分が縛られているということを理解出来る状況でもなかった。","en":"While this was being done to her, <tips=82>Hiromi</tips> offered no particular resistance. Having been restrained so many times, <tips=82>Hiromi</tips> felt no particular aversion to it; indeed, she was in no condition even to understand that she was tied down.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r82","rowIndex":82,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　観察室は患者たちの居住するスペースとは鍵の付いたドアで隔てられており、看護室のすぐ隣にある。","en":"A locked door separated the observation room from the patients’ living area. It stood immediately beside the nurses’ station.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r83","rowIndex":83,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　部屋には予備のマットレスなどが積まれているが、他にはなにもなく、静かで情報量の少ない部屋だ。そこで二時間ほど過ごすと薬の効果もあったのか大分落ち着いて来たが、<tips=5>太刀川</tips>の指示では明日まで点滴を続けるということだったのでそのまま観察室で一晩を過ごすことにになっている。","en":"Spare mattresses and similar items were stacked inside, but otherwise the room was empty, quiet, and nearly free of stimulation. After about two hours, perhaps partly because of the medicine, Hiromi had settled considerably. <tips=5>Tachikawa’s</tips> instructions called for the IV to continue until the following day, however, so she was to spend the night in the observation room.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r84","rowIndex":84,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして、退勤間際の<tips=83>能見</tips>が様子を見にやって来た。彼女は汗の噴き出た<tips=82>広美</tips>の顔を固く絞ったひんやりとするタオルで拭い、それからおむつを確認すると便が付着していたので交換した。","en":"Just before the end of her shift, <tips=83>Nomi</tips> came to check on her. She wiped <tips=82>Hiromi’s</tips> sweating face with a cool, tightly wrung towel, then checked her diaper. Finding that it was soiled, she changed it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r85","rowIndex":85,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ありがとう、ノミさん……」","en":"“Thank you, Ms. No-mi...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"内田広美（入院）","displayName":"Hiromi Uchida (Hospitalized)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r86","rowIndex":86,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=82>広美</tips>が言うと、","en":"When <tips=82>Hiromi</tips> said this, Nomi replied,","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r87","rowIndex":87,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「大分よくなったみたいだね。よかった」","en":"“You seem much better now. I’m glad.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"能見美紗","displayName":"Misa Nomi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r88","rowIndex":88,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=83>能見</tips>は嬉しそうに笑った。","en":"<tips=83>Nomi</tips> smiled happily.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r89","rowIndex":89,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ノミさん。のどかわいた。ジュースが飲みたい」","en":"“Ms. No-mi. I’m thirsty. I want juice.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"内田広美（入院）","displayName":"Hiromi Uchida (Hospitalized)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r90","rowIndex":90,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まあ、落ち着いたと思ったらすぐそんなこと言って。……ジュースはないから、お水でもいい？」","en":"“My, the moment you calm down, you start asking for things. We don’t have juice. Would water do?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"能見美紗","displayName":"Misa Nomi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r91","rowIndex":91,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=82>広美</tips>が頷くと、<tips=83>能見</tips>は吸い飲みに水を入れて飲ませてくれる。","en":"When <tips=82>Hiromi</tips> nodded, <tips=83>Nomi</tips> filled a feeding cup with water and helped her drink.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r92","rowIndex":92,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=82>広美</tips>ちゃん、ひとつお願いがあるんだ」","en":"“<tips=82>Hiromi</tips>, there’s one thing I’d like you to do for me.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"能見美紗","displayName":"Misa Nomi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r93","rowIndex":93,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　水を飲み終わった<tips=82>広美</tips>の顔を見つめながら、<tips=83>能見</tips>は語りかけるように言った。","en":"<tips=83>Nomi</tips> gazed into <tips=82>Hiromi’s</tips> face once she had finished drinking and spoke to her gently.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r94","rowIndex":94,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ずっと先、私がお婆ちゃんになって、死んじゃったりしたらね。そしたらお葬式に来て、泣いてくれない？　それで、<tips=83>能見</tips>さんは本当に頑張って仕事をしてくれたいい人だって、嘘でもいいから褒めてほしいの」","en":"“A long, long time from now, when I’m an old woman and I die... will you come to my funeral and cry for me? And I want you to praise me—say Ms. <tips=83>Nomi</tips> was a good person who worked really hard—even if it’s a lie.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"能見美紗","displayName":"Misa Nomi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r95","rowIndex":95,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=83>能見</tips>がそんなことを言うのは初めてだった。","en":"<tips=83>Nomi</tips> had never said anything like this before.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r96","rowIndex":96,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=82>広美</tips>は目をぱちくりさせて聞いている。","en":"<tips=82>Hiromi</tips> listened, blinking in surprise.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r97","rowIndex":97,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=83>能見</tips>さんの家族はね、私がこの仕事をやるのをあんまり喜んでないの。だから、<tips=82>広美</tips>ちゃんが仕事頑張ってたんですよーって褒めて泣いてくれればね。ああ、あいつも立派な仕事してたんだなって思ってくれるかなって」","en":"“You see, Ms. <tips=83>Nomi’s</tips> family isn’t very happy about me doing this work. So if <tips=82>Hiromi</tips> cried for me and praised me, telling them, ‘She worked so hard at her job,’ maybe they’d think, ‘Oh, so she did respectable work after all.’”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"能見美紗","displayName":"Misa Nomi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r98","rowIndex":98,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=83>能見</tips>は微笑みながら言う。","en":"<tips=83>Nomi</tips> spoke with a smile.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r99","rowIndex":99,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「私はこうやってみんなのために働くのは素敵な仕事だと思ってるんだけど、みんなは誤解してて……だから、少しだけ理解して欲しいの」","en":"“I think working for everyone this way is a wonderful job, but everyone misunderstands... so I want them to understand just a little.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"能見美紗","displayName":"Misa Nomi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r100","rowIndex":100,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そう言ってから、じっと<tips=82>広美</tips>の顔を見つめると、","en":"After saying this, she gazed steadily into <tips=82>Hiromi’s</tips> face.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r101","rowIndex":101,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あはは、無茶なこと言ってるよね。でも、今日は私一日中<tips=82>広美</tips>ちゃんにつきっきりだったんだから、これくらい言わせてもらうからね」","en":"“Ahaha. I’m asking the impossible, aren’t I? But I’ve spent the whole day right here with <tips=82>Hiromi</tips>, so I’m allowed to ask this much of you.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"能見美紗","displayName":"Misa Nomi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r102","rowIndex":102,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　最後に<tips=82>広美</tips>の頭を撫でて、彼女は部屋を出て行った。","en":"She stroked <tips=82>Hiromi’s</tips> head one last time, then left the room.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r103","rowIndex":103,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女は仕事だったから優しくしてくれたのかもしれない。でも、あんな状態になった自分のことは、家族だって見捨てたんだ。学校でもいじめられた。","en":"Perhaps Nomi had been kind only because it was her job. But even Hiromi’s family had abandoned her once she became that way. At school, she had been bullied.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r104","rowIndex":104,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　職員にはいじわるで嫌いな人もいたけれども、優しくしてくれた人もたくさん居たんだ。","en":"Some members of staff had been cruel, and Hiromi had hated them. Many others, however, had treated her with kindness.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r105","rowIndex":105,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"（でも、もうみんな死んでしまった）","en":"(But now they’re all dead.)","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r106","rowIndex":106,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　目を剥いて血の海に倒れていた<tips=83>能見</tips>の姿を思い出すと、また涙が溢れ出た。","en":"When she remembered <tips=83>Nomi</tips> lying wide-eyed in a pool of blood, the tears spilled out once more.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r107","rowIndex":107,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=82>広美</tips>はよろめくような足取りで街の外れまで歩き、病院を見た。入り口は閉鎖されて入れなくなっている。人気はなく、灰色の建物がじっと雨に打たれている。","en":"<tips=82>Hiromi</tips> staggered to the edge of the district and found herself before the hospital. Its entrance had been sealed, and she could no longer enter. No one was there. The gray building stood motionless beneath the rain.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r108","rowIndex":108,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それをじっと見上げてから、また街の方へ戻った。","en":"After gazing up at it for some time, she turned back toward the city.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r109","rowIndex":109,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=21>八龍会</tips>は何かあったら連絡をしてくれと言っていたが、今更患者の皆が暮らしているアパートに行こうとは思わない。","en":"The <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips> had told her to contact them if anything happened, but at this point she had no intention of going to the apartments where all the other patients lived.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r110","rowIndex":110,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　病気から救ってくれるつもりだったのだろうけれど、そのためにあんなにたくさんの人を殺す必要はあったんだろうか？　そんなにいい薬があるのなら、病院の人に説明して使って貰えばよかったじゃないか。","en":"Perhaps they had meant to save everyone from illness. But had that truly required killing so many people? If they possessed medicine that good, why couldn’t they have explained it to the hospital staff and asked them to use it?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r111","rowIndex":111,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"（そもそも、病気なんか治らなくたって良かったんだ。それなら、いやなことを思い出して、こんなにつらくならないで済んだのに）","en":"(I never needed to be cured at all. Then I wouldn’t have remembered all those awful things or had to suffer like this.)","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r112","rowIndex":112,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　歩き疲れた<tips=82>広美</tips>は塀を背に座り込んだ。そういえば、食事もとっていない。現金はいくらか残っているはずだが、買うのも食べるのも億劫だった。","en":"Exhausted from walking, <tips=82>Hiromi</tips> sat with her back against a wall. Come to think of it, she had eaten nothing. She should still have had some cash, but buying food and eating it both felt like too much trouble.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r113","rowIndex":113,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"（このままずっと薬を貰いに行かなければ、また病気になるっていってたっけ。きっと私はそれでいいんだ。こんなにいろいろと考える頭なんかいらない。ばかのままでいればいいんだ）","en":"(They said I’d become ill again if I never went back for more medicine, didn’t they? Maybe that would be best. I don’t need a mind that makes me think about all of this. I’m better off staying stupid.)","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r114","rowIndex":114,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=82>広美</tips>はめそめそと失われたもののことばかりを考えた。","en":"<tips=82>Hiromi</tips> wept as her thoughts circled around everything she had lost.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r115","rowIndex":115,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　もう前向きに動くための一切の原動力が失われていた。","en":"She had lost every impulse that might have moved her forward.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r116","rowIndex":116,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そこに、一人の人物が声をかけたのだ。","en":"It was then that someone spoke to her.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r117","rowIndex":117,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「おいどうした。お嬢ちゃん、こんなところで座り込んでいたら風邪をひくぜ」","en":"“Hey, what’s wrong? You’ll catch a cold sitting out here, kid.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r118","rowIndex":118,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　顔を上げるとひげ面の白人男性が酒臭い息を漂わせている。","en":"When she raised her face, a bearded white man stood over her, his breath reeking of alcohol.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r119","rowIndex":119,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女が今座っているのは暗黒通りの片隅だった。<tips=9>Y地区</tips>でももっともたちの悪い地域のひとつに、こんな無防備な姿でへたり込んでいることを<tips=82>広美</tips>自身は知らなかった。そもそも他人を警戒するという習慣自体が彼女には薄かった。","en":"<tips=82>Hiromi</tips> was sitting in a corner of Darkness Street. She did not know that she had collapsed utterly defenseless in one of the worst parts of <tips=9>Y District</tips>. The habit of guarding herself against other people had scarcely developed in her at all.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r120","rowIndex":120,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いいんです。風邪なんかひいたって。死にたいくらいだもの」","en":"“It’s fine. I don’t care if I catch a cold. I feel like dying anyway.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"内田広美（患者のＵ）","displayName":"Hiromi Uchida (Patient U)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r121","rowIndex":121,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうか。それは邪魔をしたな」","en":"“I see. Sorry to disturb you.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r122","rowIndex":122,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　男は案外あっさりとしたもので、それだけで引き下がると目の前を去っていった。","en":"Surprisingly, that was all it took. The man backed down and walked away.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r123","rowIndex":123,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=82>広美</tips>はまた顔を伏せる。すると、目の前でまた足音が聞こえた。さっきの男が帰って来たのかと思ったが、そうではなかった。","en":"<tips=82>Hiromi</tips> lowered her head again. Then she heard footsteps in front of her once more. She thought the man from before had come back, but it was someone else.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r124","rowIndex":124,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ほら、立てよ」","en":"“Come on. Get up.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r125","rowIndex":125,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　不意に、ぐいと腕を掴まれた。","en":"Without warning, a hand seized her arm and pulled.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r126","rowIndex":126,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　見ると髪の毛を金色に染めた背の高い男が自分の腕を掴んでいる。<tips=82>広美</tips>は突然のことで声が出ない。男の身体は服の上からわかるほど分厚い筋肉がついている。<tips=82>広美</tips>は<tips=17>タイプB</tips>であり、<tips=46>ネオ・ローズ</tips>によってその力が解放されてはいた。それでも、もともとが病院で育ったひょろひょろの身体であり、今は衰弱してもいる。確かにみかけよりはずっと力が強かったがとても目の前の男の腕力にはかなわなかった。そして何より、全力を振り絞れるような気力が失われている。","en":"She looked up to find a tall man with dyed blond hair gripping her arm. The shock left <tips=82>Hiromi</tips> speechless. Even through his clothes she could see how heavily muscled he was. <tips=82>Hiromi</tips> was <tips=17>Type B</tips>, and <tips=46>Neo Rose</tips> had released her strength. But she still had the scrawny body of someone raised in a hospital, and by now she was exhausted as well. She was far stronger than she looked, certainly, but no match for the man’s raw power. More than anything else, she no longer had the will to summon her full strength.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r127","rowIndex":127,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いや……」","en":"“No...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"内田広美（患者のＵ）","displayName":"Hiromi Uchida (Patient U)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r128","rowIndex":128,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　声を出そうとすると、その丸太のような腕がとんで<tips=82>広美</tips>の頬を殴った。","en":"When she tried to call out, his loglike arm lashed out and struck <tips=82>Hiromi</tips> across the cheek.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r129","rowIndex":129,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「声を出したら殺すぞ」","en":"“Make a sound and I’ll kill you.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r130","rowIndex":130,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　男はそう吐き捨てて、無理矢理腕を引っ張って<tips=82>広美</tips>を立たせると、ぐいぐいと引っ張りながら歩きはじめる。","en":"The man spat out the threat. He hauled <tips=82>Hiromi</tips> to her feet by the arm and began walking, dragging her forcefully after him.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r131","rowIndex":131,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして近くの狭い路地に入ると、もう人通りもなく彼らを見咎めるものものいなかった。","en":"Once he turned into a narrow alley nearby, there were no passersby left to see them and challenge him.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r132","rowIndex":132,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　いかに世事に疎い<tips=82>広美</tips>でも、自分が恐ろしい窮地に陥っているのははっきりとわかった。ここは病院ではないし、家族ももう自分のことを守ってはくれない。自力では抵抗するすべはないだろう。殴られてチカチカとする視界で状況を見ながらそう思った。","en":"However little <tips=82>Hiromi</tips> knew of the world, she understood perfectly well that she was in terrible danger. This was not the hospital, and her family would no longer protect her. She had no way to resist on her own. That much was clear even through the sparks still flashing across her vision from the blow.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r133","rowIndex":133,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　人間は完全に自分が無力であることを悟ったとき、逆らうことをやめる。","en":"When people realize they are utterly powerless, they stop resisting.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r134","rowIndex":134,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　従順にふるまうことで相手に刺激を与えることを避け、少しでも苦痛を減らしてしのごうとする本能だろう。野生動物でも突然無抵抗になってしまうものもいる。","en":"Perhaps it is an instinct to submit rather than provoke an aggressor, and thus endure with as little pain as possible. Some wild animals, too, will suddenly cease all resistance.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r135","rowIndex":135,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=82>広美</tips>もこのときそんな心理が働いて、諦めと同時に抵抗をやめ、男に引かれるまま歩いた。","en":"That same instinct took hold of <tips=82>Hiromi</tips>. As she surrendered to despair, she stopped resisting and let the man lead her along.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r136","rowIndex":136,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しかし、この本能は一体どの程度の意味があるものなのだろう。無抵抗になった動物はそのまま捕食者に食われるものだし、今回の<tips=82>広美</tips>の場合もあまり良い判断だったとは言えない。","en":"But what purpose does this instinct really serve? An animal that stops resisting is simply eaten by its predator, and in <tips=82>Hiromi’s</tips> case, too, it could hardly be called a sound decision.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r137","rowIndex":137,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　相手の男はこの近くに住み、日雇いで肉体労働を行っているものだが、このように女性を強引に連れ去っては乱暴をするのを常習していた。","en":"The man lived nearby and worked as a day laborer. He had made a habit of forcibly carrying women off this way and sexually assaulting them.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r138","rowIndex":138,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　考える能力が足りない彼は、脅した女が従順になるのを見て「女は殴られるのが好きだ」とごく自然に信じていた。女がどんなに逆らっても、殴りつけて、脅して、そうすれば自分を好きになる。恐怖から逃れるために男のために愛想笑いをし、進んで喜ぶことをし、好意があるような態度をとっているなど想像もしなかった。","en":"Poor at reasoning, he would see a woman become submissive after he threatened her and quite naturally conclude that “women like being hit.” No matter how fiercely a woman resisted, he believed that if he beat and threatened her, she would come to love him. It never occurred to him that she might give him a placating smile, willingly do things to please him, and act affectionate solely to escape her fear.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r139","rowIndex":139,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　この<tips=9>Y地区</tips>においては彼のような人間が特別少ないというわけではない。また現実に、こうした行為を繰り返した結果女の方も男に対する依存心が生まれ、そのまま結婚してしまうというような救いのない例もある。","en":"In <tips=9>Y District</tips>, men like him were not especially uncommon. There were also real, hopeless cases in which repeated abuse caused the woman to develop a dependency on the man and ultimately marry him.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r140","rowIndex":140,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　人間の精神の仕組みの悲しさというべきものだろう。","en":"Such was the tragedy of the human mind and its workings.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r141","rowIndex":141,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　だから男はこの時も自分を疑いはしなかった。","en":"And so, here too, the man never doubted himself.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r142","rowIndex":142,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=82>広美</tips>の態度の軟化を見て、てっきり受け入れられたと感じ、","en":"Seeing <tips=82>Hiromi’s</tips> manner soften, he took it for granted that she had accepted him.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r143","rowIndex":143,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「心配するな。すぐにお前もおれのことを好きになる」","en":"“Don’t worry. You’ll like me soon enough.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r144","rowIndex":144,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　と言ったのは、嘘でも脅しでもない思ったままの言葉だったのである。","en":"The words expressed exactly what he thought. They were neither a lie nor a threat.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r145","rowIndex":145,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　さて、このままあと十数メートル歩けば彼の住まいに辿り着く。もしそれに連れ込まれていたら、<tips=82>広美</tips>はこの街ではごくありふれた不幸を体験することになっていただろう。彼女の不幸続きの人生においてはそうなっても何も不自然はなかったが、今回は奇跡的な幸運が訪れた。","en":"Another dozen-odd meters would have brought them to his home. Had he dragged her inside, <tips=82>Hiromi</tips> would have suffered a misfortune all too common in this city. Nothing about that would have seemed strange in a life beset by one misfortune after another. This time, however, miraculous good fortune came to her aid.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r146","rowIndex":146,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ちょっと待ちな」","en":"“Hold it right there.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r147","rowIndex":147,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　と声をかけたのは、さきほどの白人男性だった。","en":"The speaker was the white man from moments before.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r148","rowIndex":148,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　やはり心配になって引き返したところで引きずられてゆく<tips=82>広美</tips>を見つけたのだろう。","en":"Perhaps concern had drawn him back, and he had found <tips=82>Hiromi</tips> being dragged away.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r149","rowIndex":149,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なんだお前」","en":"“Who the hell are you?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r150","rowIndex":150,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　こちらの男はドスを効かせた声で相手を威圧した。","en":"The man tried to intimidate the other with a menacing growl.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r151","rowIndex":151,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　相手の白人は何がおかしいのかやたらとニヤニヤしている。","en":"The white man grinned as though he found something hilarious.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r152","rowIndex":152,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「その子はおれが先約ずみなんだ。返してもらうぜ」","en":"“That girl was already spoken for—by me. Hand her over.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r153","rowIndex":153,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼はそう言ったが、こちらは訊ねておきながらもとより会話をするつもりはなかったようだ。","en":"That was his answer, but despite having asked the question, the blond man had evidently never intended to converse.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r154","rowIndex":154,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その言葉が終わるのも待たずに、またその太い腕を振り回して相手に襲い掛かる。","en":"Before the white man had even finished speaking, he swung his thick arm again and lunged at him.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r155","rowIndex":155,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　相手の白人もけしてひ弱というわけではなかったが、こちらのゴリラのような男に比べれば大分見劣りする。見た目だけなら到底勝てる見込みはなさそうだが、結果は見た目通りにはならなかった。","en":"The white man was by no means frail, but beside this gorilla of a man he looked far less imposing. Judged by appearances alone, he had no chance. Appearances proved deceptive.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r156","rowIndex":156,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　二人が近づいた瞬間、ゴツッと鈍い音がして、崩れ落ちたのはこちらの男の方だった。すぐそばにいた<tips=82>広美</tips>にも何が起きたのかわからない。筋肉のかたまりのような男が、白目をむいてひっくりかえっている。","en":"The instant they came together, there was a dull crack. It was the blond man who collapsed. Even <tips=82>Hiromi</tips>, standing immediately beside them, had not seen what happened. The mountain of muscle lay flat upon his back, the whites of his eyes showing.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r157","rowIndex":157,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「おっと、死んではいないよな」","en":"“Whoops. I didn’t kill him, did I?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エリオット・ネス","displayName":"Eliot Ness","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r158","rowIndex":158,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　白人は倒れた男に息があるのを確認してから、その身体を引きずって雨の当たらない場所に運ぶ。","en":"The white man checked that the fallen man was breathing, then dragged him somewhere out of the rain.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r159","rowIndex":159,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=82>広美</tips>はへたりこんだままその作業を見ていて、逃げるという気持ちも起きなかった。彼女に人並みの警戒心があったなら、ここで逃げるべきだったろう。新しく現れた人物が、彼女にとって信頼出来るものであるという保証などどこにもないのだ。","en":"<tips=82>Hiromi</tips> remained sitting where she had fallen and watched the work, never thinking to flee. Had she possessed an ordinary degree of caution, this would have been the moment to escape. Nothing guaranteed that the newcomer was someone she could trust.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r160","rowIndex":160,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　白人は<tips=82>広美</tips>の前に戻ってくると、手を差し伸べた。","en":"The white man returned to <tips=82>Hiromi</tips> and extended his hand.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r161","rowIndex":161,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=82>広美</tips>は一瞬戸惑ったが、結局その手を握る。","en":"<tips=82>Hiromi</tips> hesitated for a moment, but finally took the hand.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r162","rowIndex":162,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　白人は映画で見るようなキザな動作で<tips=82>広美</tips>を立たせると、","en":"With a showy gesture like something from a movie, the white man helped <tips=82>Hiromi</tips> to her feet.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r163","rowIndex":163,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「お嬢ちゃんツイてるな。おれは普段ならこういった真似はしないんだぜ。キリがないし、そんな良心は持ち合わせていないからな。でも今日は特別だ。ちょっと誰かに優しくしたい気分だったのさ。どういうわけか、おれは月に一度くらいそういう日があってね。……そう怯えることはない。安心しな、きっちりとパパとママがいるあったかいところへ送ってやるぜ」","en":"“You’re in luck, kid. Normally I wouldn’t do a thing like this. There’d be no end to it, and I was never blessed with that kind of conscience. But today is special. I happened to feel like being kind to someone. For some reason, I get a day like this about once a month. ...You don’t have to be so scared. Relax. I’ll see you safely to someplace warm, with a real mommy and daddy waiting for you.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エリオット・ネス","displayName":"Eliot Ness","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r164","rowIndex":164,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　結果として、<tips=82>広美</tips>は本当に幸運だったのだろう。男は笑い、そして<tips=23>エリオット・ネス</tips>と名乗った。","en":"In the end, perhaps <tips=82>Hiromi</tips> truly had been fortunate. The man smiled and introduced himself as <tips=23>Eliot Ness</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r165","rowIndex":165,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=82>広美</tips>はその名前の意味がわからない。","en":"<tips=82>Hiromi</tips> did not understand what the name meant.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r166","rowIndex":166,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ただ俯くと、また涙を流す。家族のあの光景を見てから、沢山の涙を流したはずだがまだ枯れ果ててはいないのだ。","en":"She merely bowed her head and began to cry again. She should have shed countless tears since witnessing that scene with her family, yet they still had not run dry.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r167","rowIndex":167,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「私には、戻るところなんか、ない……」","en":"“I... don’t have anywhere to go back to.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r168","rowIndex":168,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　震える声でそう言うと、声をあげて泣き出した。","en":"The words trembled from her, and then she began to sob aloud.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r169","rowIndex":169,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　さて、この<tips=23>エリオット・ネス</tips>と名乗った人物は、勿論<tips=27>廖志明</tips>のボディーガードを務めていたあの<tips=23>エリオット</tips>である。","en":"Now, the man who had introduced himself as <tips=23>Eliot Ness</tips> was, of course, the man who had served as <tips=27>Liao Chi-ming’s</tips> bodyguard: <tips=23>Elliott</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r170","rowIndex":170,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　アメリカ海兵隊で優秀な成績を収め、国内でテロ事件に関与したのちに、<tips=17>タイプB</tips>系のテロ組織『ブラッド』の軍事教官をつとめ、自らも戦闘員として活動をしてきたといういかにも恐ろしげな経歴を持つ彼であるが、<tips=59>暗闇通り</tips>の片隅で朝から晩まで酒を飲む酔っ払いでしかなかった。","en":"His résumé sounded fearsome enough: an outstanding record in the US Marine Corps, involvement in a domestic terrorist incident, then service as both military instructor and combatant for Blood, a <tips=17>Type B</tips> terrorist organization. Yet now he was nothing more than a drunk who spent every waking hour in some corner of <tips=59>Darkness Street</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r171","rowIndex":171,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　以前サイキックである<tips=62>マリア</tips>には後れをとったものの、その経験と実績はよく知られており、<tips=21>八龍会</tips>をはじめとして様々な組織から仕事を依頼されたが、この頃は全て断ってあてのない生活をしている。","en":"Though the psychic <tips=62>Maria</tips> had once gotten the better of him, his experience and achievements were well known. The <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips> and all manner of other organizations offered him work, but in those days he refused every approach and drifted through life without a destination.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r172","rowIndex":172,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　自堕落な生活ですっかり腕はさび付き、それが露見するのを恐れてこのように仕事から逃げ回っているのだ、などと陰で囁かれたりもする。その一方で彼をこの街で最も強力な個人であると評価するものも少なくない。","en":"People whispered that his dissolute life had left his skills hopelessly rusted, and that he avoided work for fear the truth would come out. Yet more than a few still judged him the most powerful individual in the city.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r173","rowIndex":173,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　実戦経験が豊富で元々優秀な兵士である彼は、さらにその優れた<tips=17>タイプB</tips>能力が軍隊の特殊訓練によって鍛えられ、『<tips=46>ネオ・ローズ</tips>』などを使用しなくともその力を発揮出来た。","en":"Already an exceptional soldier with extensive combat experience, Elliott had further honed his <tips=17>Type B</tips> ability through specialized military training and could exercise its power without <tips=46>Neo Rose</tips> or any similar drug.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r174","rowIndex":174,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼が得意なのは戦闘だけではなかった。頭脳もまた人並みより優れていた。","en":"Combat was not his only strength. He was intellectually gifted as well.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r175","rowIndex":175,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　記憶力にすぐれ、いくつもの暗号を難なく使いこなした。言語の習得も早く、ヨーロッパの言葉だけでなく、中国語や日本語もすぐに使えるようになった。人の嘘を見破ったり、自分が嘘をつくのがうまかった。痛みに強く、どんな困難にも耐えた。急な状況の変化にも、冷静に素早く適応することが出来た。テロリストとして必要なものは全て備えていたといって良い。","en":"He possessed an excellent memory and handled several codes without difficulty. Languages came quickly to him; he soon acquired not only European languages, but Chinese and Japanese as well. He was skilled both at detecting lies and telling them. He endured pain and every form of hardship. To sudden changes in circumstances, he adapted swiftly and calmly. One might fairly say that he possessed every quality required of a terrorist.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r176","rowIndex":176,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　こうした彼の能力は、<tips=17>タイプB</tips>やサイキックがひしめくこの<tips=9>Y地区</tips>でも傑出したもので、後に勃発した大抗争において遺憾なく発揮され街の全ての住人の知るところとなるのだが、それはこの物語が終わって月日が過ぎた後のことであり、この稿では扱わない。","en":"Even in <tips=9>Y District</tips>, teeming with <tips=17>Type Bs</tips> and psychics, his abilities stood apart. He would display them to the fullest in the great conflict that later erupted, making them known to every resident of the district. But that came well after the end of this story and will not be treated in these pages.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r177","rowIndex":177,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　とにかく、この時期の<tips=23>エリオット</tips>はそのありあまった能力をたまに酒場でのいざこざに用いる程度のもので、重要な場面には一切姿を現さず、街の表舞台からは完全に見捨てられた存在であった。","en":"At any rate, in those days <tips=23>Elliott</tips> squandered his prodigious abilities on little more than the occasional barroom scuffle. He appeared at none of the crucial moments and had been abandoned entirely by the city’s public stage.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r178","rowIndex":178,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そうして世捨て人のように暮らしていた時期の<tips=23>エリオット</tips>が唯一<tips=9>Y地区</tips>の運命に関与する事件の発端こそが、この<tips=82>内田広美</tips>との邂逅であった。","en":"His meeting with <tips=82>Hiromi</tips> Uchida was the beginning of the one affair through which <tips=23>Elliott</tips>, during these years of near-reclusion, became involved in <tips=9>Y District’s</tips> fate.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r179","rowIndex":179,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しかし、彼がこの時行き場がなく雨の下泣く<tips=82>内田広美</tips>を拾ったのは、彼とすれば珍しい行動であった。","en":"Yet it was unlike him to take in <tips=82>Hiromi</tips>, stranded with nowhere to go and weeping in the rain.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r180","rowIndex":180,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼は自らを冷酷だと<tips=82>広美</tips>に伝えたが、その言葉はあながち嘘ではない。","en":"Elliott had described himself to <tips=82>Hiromi</tips> as coldhearted, and the description was not entirely false.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r181","rowIndex":181,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　下卑た冗談を口にし、女をからかう姿なども目撃されていたが、実際には女を買うこともほとんどなく、自分の生活に立ち入らせることもなかったようである。","en":"He had been seen making vulgar jokes and teasing women, but apparently rarely paid for sex or allowed a woman into his private life.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r182","rowIndex":182,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　社会の裏側で長年活動を続けてきた彼にとって、女というものはしばしば組織に利用され、思わぬ危機を招く警戒すべき対象であった。","en":"After long years operating in society’s shadows, he regarded women as a danger to be treated with caution: organizations often used them, and they could invite crises from wholly unexpected quarters.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r183","rowIndex":183,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼は現在名を隠し素性を捨てて生活をしているが、その正体を知ればこれまでの経歴で得た情報を知りたがったり、或いは憎み殺意を抱く者はいくらでも現れるはずだ。","en":"He was now living under a hidden name, having discarded his former identity. Were that identity discovered, any number of people might appear—some seeking information acquired over the course of his career, others driven by hatred and a desire to kill him.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r184","rowIndex":184,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そんな彼にとって、異性は容易に近づけるべきものではなかったのである。そして生来情の薄い方で、異性と関わることの喜びよりも、面倒という気持ちの方が先に立つタイプの男だ。『ブラッド』に所属していた頃、任務のために敵対組織の支配する地域に潜入したことがあり、その時現地の女と知り合い共に生活をしたのだが、任務終了時にはその女を殺害してから街を出ている。","en":"For Elliott, then, women were not people he could readily allow close. He was also cold by nature, the sort of man for whom the prospect of trouble came to mind before any pleasure in a woman’s company. During his time with Blood, he once infiltrated territory controlled by an enemy organization. There he met a local woman and lived with her, but when the mission ended, he killed her before leaving the city.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r185","rowIndex":185,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　まだ若く、テロリストとして毎日のように人殺しをしていた時期のことであり、今となっては多少彼の心境にも変化があるのかもしれないが、そうだとしても見知らぬ少女を理由もなく救うというのは彼にしては考えられない。","en":"He had still been young then, killing people almost daily as a terrorist. Perhaps his outlook had changed somewhat in the years since. Even so, for him to rescue a girl he did not know, for no reason at all, was almost unthinkable.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r186","rowIndex":186,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しかしこの突飛な行動が、<tips=9>Y地区</tips>の勢力図に少なからず影響を与える結果になるのだから世の中というのは数奇なものである。","en":"And yet this unexpected act would affect the balance of power within <tips=9>Y District</tips> to no small degree. The world follows strange courses.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r187","rowIndex":187,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　もし彼がここで<tips=82>広美</tips>を助けなければ、この街の運命は変わっていただろうか？　——いや、現実として起きたことに対して『もし』を考えるほど意味のないことはない。","en":"Would the fate of this city have changed if he had not saved <tips=82>Hiromi</tips> here?—No. Nothing is more meaningless than asking ‘what if’ of what has already happened.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r188","rowIndex":188,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　どんな些細なことでも、そこに至るには膨大な原因があり、全てが必然で出来て居る。","en":"Even the most trivial event arises from a vast accumulation of causes, and all of it is made of necessity.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r189","rowIndex":189,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　つまり、ここで彼が<tips=82>広美</tips>を助けたのも気まぐれのようでいて、誰にも変えることが出来ない確固とした根拠が積み重なった末の行動なのである。","en":"In other words, although his saving <tips=82>Hiromi</tips> here appeared to be a whim, the act was the end result of solid reasons piled one upon another, none of which anyone could have changed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r190","rowIndex":190,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　だから我々人間は既に起きてしまった事実には謙虚になり、まだ見ぬ未来に対しては大胆になるべきなのだ。","en":"By that reasoning, we human beings ought to meet accomplished fact with humility and the unseen future with boldness.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r191","rowIndex":191,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　さて、泣きじゃくる<tips=82>広美</tips>は<tips=23>エリオット</tips>に誘われるまま彼の住まいへと向かった。","en":"<tips=82>Hiromi</tips>, still sobbing, went with <tips=23>Elliott</tips> to his home.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r192","rowIndex":192,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　日が暮れるころに辿り着いた彼のマンションは、<tips=27>廖志明</tips>に与えられた場所に引き続き住んでいるものだったが、到底それほど長く暮らしているとは思えないほどに物が少なかった。","en":"Around sunset, they reached the apartment <tips=27>Liao Chi-ming</tips> had given Elliott, where he still lived. It held so few possessions that no one would have guessed he had occupied it for so long.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r193","rowIndex":193,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　つい先日、この街にやって来たばかりだと言われても信用してしまいそうなくらいだ。越してきた時から備え付けられていたベッドや机や椅子などの調度品以外のものを全て集めても旅行鞄ひとつに収まってしまいそうに思える。","en":"One could easily have believed that he had arrived in the city only days ago. Aside from the bed, desk, chairs, and other furnishings already there when he moved in, everything he owned looked as though it would fit into a single suitcase.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r194","rowIndex":194,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　3DKの間取りのうち、寝室とダイニングのテーブルまわり以外はまるきり使っていないようで、残り二つの部屋には白い埃がつもっていた。","en":"Of the apartment’s three rooms and dining kitchen, he seemed to use only the bedroom and the space around the dining table. White dust covered the other two rooms.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r195","rowIndex":195,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「悪いが掃除してくれるか」","en":"“Sorry, but would you mind cleaning the place?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エリオット・ネス","displayName":"Eliot Ness","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r196","rowIndex":196,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　呆然とする<tips=82>広美</tips>に、<tips=23>エリオット</tips>は掃除機を押しつけてぶっきらぼうにそう言った。","en":"<tips=23>Elliott</tips> thrust a vacuum cleaner into the bewildered <tips=82>Hiromi’s</tips> hands and spoke brusquely.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r197","rowIndex":197,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　掃除機は病院での掃除にも使われていて、<tips=82>広美</tips>は触ったことがなかったが職員がいじっていたのを見て覚えている。部屋の埃を全て吸い取り終わると<tips=23>エリオット</tips>が毛布を持ってやって来た。","en":"The hospital staff had used vacuum cleaners, and although <tips=82>Hiromi</tips> had never touched one herself, she remembered watching them operate it. Once she had removed all the dust from the room, <tips=23>Elliott</tips> appeared with a blanket.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r198","rowIndex":198,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=82>広美</tips>はてっきりそれを使って寝ろということかと思ったが、","en":"<tips=82>Hiromi</tips> assumed he meant her to sleep under it, but he said,","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r199","rowIndex":199,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「今シーツをかえたからお前はベッドを使え。おれは今晩はこっちで寝る」","en":"“I just changed the sheets, so you take the bed. I’ll sleep in here tonight.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エリオット・ネス","displayName":"Eliot Ness","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r200","rowIndex":200,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　と、床の上に茶色の毛布を乱暴に投げ出した。","en":"With that, he flung the brown blanket roughly onto the floor.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r201","rowIndex":201,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「大分濡れてるな。むこうにバスルームがあるからシャワーを使うといい。服は洗濯機にいれてボタンを押せば明日には乾いている。朝になったらそれを着てここを出るんだ」","en":"“You’re soaked. There’s a bathroom over there, so take a shower. Put your clothes in the washing machine and press the button. They’ll be dry tomorrow. In the morning, put them on and leave.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エリオット・ネス","displayName":"Eliot Ness","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r202","rowIndex":202,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「は、はい」","en":"“Y-yes.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"内田広美（患者のＵ）","displayName":"Hiromi Uchida (Patient U)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r203","rowIndex":203,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「今ピザを頼んだ。シャワーから出て来る頃には届いているだろう。チェーン店のヤツと違う本物のイタリアンピザだぜ。今日はそれを食って寝るんだ」","en":"“I just ordered pizza. It should be here by the time you get out of the shower. Real Italian pizza, not the stuff from a chain. Eat that and get some sleep tonight.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エリオット・ネス","displayName":"Eliot Ness","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r204","rowIndex":204,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それからバスルームに案内されてシャワーの使い方と、新しいタオルの場所を教わった。","en":"He took her to the bathroom and explained how to use the shower and where to find a fresh towel.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r205","rowIndex":205,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　長年人の指示に従って生活することに慣れていた<tips=82>広美</tips>は従順に頷いて聞いていた。","en":"After so many years of living by other people’s instructions, <tips=82>Hiromi</tips> was accustomed to obedience. She listened and nodded along dutifully.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r206","rowIndex":206,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして彼が出て行くと言われたとおりに服を脱ぎ、それを洗濯機に入れてボタンを押す。ドラム式の洗濯機のなかで水の音がしはじめて、思わず驚く。ドアについた透明な窓に顔を近づけ、中に水がたまってゆくのをしばらく眺めてから、バスルームに移動した。","en":"Once he left, she undressed as instructed, put her clothes into the washing machine, and pressed the button. She started at the sound of water entering the front-loading drum. Pressing her face close to the clear window in its door, she watched the water collect inside for a while, then moved on to the shower.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r207","rowIndex":207,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　これが病院を出てから初めての入浴だ。","en":"It was her first bath since leaving the hospital.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r208","rowIndex":208,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　鑑の前のプラスチックの椅子に腰掛けると目の前に大きな鏡があり、全裸の自分と向かい合わせられた。幼い頃より発達してまるで大人のような身体になっているのに今更ながら驚く。症状が出ている間もその成長を見ていたはずだが、目の前にあったのにまるで認識していなかったから、間をすっとばして急にこの身体が現れたような気がした。","en":"She sat on the plastic stool before the mirror and found herself confronted by her own naked body in the great sheet of glass. Only now did she marvel at how it had developed since childhood into the body of an adult. She must have watched it grow even while her symptoms were present, but though it had been before her eyes, she had never truly perceived it. It felt as if all the years between had been skipped and this body had appeared at once.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r209","rowIndex":209,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"（ちゃんと洗えるかな……）","en":"(Will I be able to wash myself properly...?)","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r210","rowIndex":210,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　シャワーのお湯の温度を指先で確認しながら、<tips=82>広美</tips>は不安だった。","en":"Anxiously, <tips=82>Hiromi</tips> tested the shower water with her fingertips.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r211","rowIndex":211,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　病院にいるときはいつも職員に身体も頭も洗って貰っていた。病院に来る前は母親が洗っていた。さらにその前の、症状が出る前は自分で洗っていたときもあるような気がするが、もう大分昔のことだ。","en":"At the hospital, a member of staff had always washed both her body and her hair. Before she entered the hospital, her mother had washed her. Before even that, prior to the onset of her symptoms, she felt that she might sometimes have washed herself—but that was very long ago.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r212","rowIndex":212,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ここには職員も母親もいない。職員は死んでしまったし、母親はもう会うことが出来ない。それを思うと涙が溢れ出てまた泣いてしまいそうだったが下唇を噛んで堪えた。","en":"There were no staff members here, and no mother. The staff were dead. She could never see her mother again. The thought brought tears surging up and nearly made her cry once more, but she bit her lower lip and held them back.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r213","rowIndex":213,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　バスルームを出てタオルで身体を拭くときになって、髪の毛にまだ泡がついているのに気がついた。その他にも本人は気がつかなかったがボディソープとシャンプーを間違って使ったりもしていた。しかし、それ以外のことはおおむねミスもなく入浴をすませることが出来た。","en":"Only after leaving the shower and beginning to dry herself did she notice that suds still remained in her hair. She also confused the body wash and shampoo without realizing it. Aside from these mistakes, however, she managed the rest of the bath without serious trouble.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r214","rowIndex":214,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=23>エリオット</tips>が用意してくれた着替えは白無地のＴシャツと、綿で出来たベージュのズボンだった。彼が普段身につけているものらしく、いずれもあまりにも大きく、ズボンの裾を何度も折り返さなくてはならなかった。","en":"The change of clothes <tips=23>Elliott</tips> had provided was a plain white T-shirt and a pair of beige cotton pants. They appeared to be clothes he normally wore, and both were far too large; she had to roll up the cuffs of the pants several times.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r215","rowIndex":215,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　下着はなくあちこちがすうすうとしていたが、思春期を病院で過ごした<tips=82>広美</tips>は女性的な羞恥心に疎く、なんとも思わなかった。","en":"There was no underwear, and she felt a draft everywhere. But having spent her adolescence in the hospital, <tips=82>Hiromi</tips> had little sense of feminine modesty and thought nothing of it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r216","rowIndex":216,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　バスルームを出るとダイニングのテーブルの上にはピザがもう届いている。<tips=23>エリオット</tips>の姿が見えなかったが、<tips=82>広美</tips>のたてた物音を聞きつけたのか向こうの部屋からやって来た。手にはウイスキーの入ったグラスがあり、その顔は赤く染まっていた。","en":"When she came out of the bathroom, the pizza had already arrived and was waiting on the dining table. <tips=23>Elliott</tips> was nowhere in sight, but perhaps he heard <tips=82>Hiromi</tips> moving about, for he soon emerged from the other room with a glass of whiskey in his hand and his face flushed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r217","rowIndex":217,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「冷めないうちに食いなよ。ピザが嫌いってことはないんだろ？」","en":"“Eat before it gets cold. You don’t hate pizza, do you?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エリオット・ネス","displayName":"Eliot Ness","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r218","rowIndex":218,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=82>広美</tips>は頷き、テーブルについた。","en":"<tips=82>Hiromi</tips> shook her head and sat at the table.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r219","rowIndex":219,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　勝手に開けていいのかわからずに座ったままじっとしていたが、<tips=23>エリオット</tips>は酒を飲んでぼんやりと携帯電話をいじるだけで何もしない。","en":"Unsure whether she was permitted to open the box, she remained motionless in her seat. <tips=23>Elliott</tips> merely drank and idly played with his phone, doing nothing.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r220","rowIndex":220,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おずおずと手を伸ばして見たけれども彼に咎められる様子はなかったので、そのまま蓋を開いた。","en":"She reached out hesitantly. When he gave no sign of reproach, she opened the lid.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r221","rowIndex":221,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　トマトソースとチーズの香りが漂う。具の沢山のった丸いピザがそこにあった。","en":"The aromas of tomato sauce and cheese drifted through the air. A round pizza piled high with toppings sat there.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r222","rowIndex":222,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それほど空腹を覚えてはいなかったが、病院でも指示をされればその通り食事をしていた<tips=82>広美</tips>は機械的に手を動かして、チーズの糸を引くピザを一切れとった。そして一口囓って飲み込むと、自分でも思っていなかったほどの食欲があとからあとから沸いて来た。","en":"She had not felt especially hungry. At the hospital, however, <tips=82>Hiromi</tips> had always eaten mechanically whenever instructed, and habit set her hand moving now. She took one slice, trailing strings of cheese, bit into it, and swallowed. Only then did an appetite greater than she had imagined surge up, wave after wave.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r223","rowIndex":223,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　今日一日様々なことがあって心は傷ついていたが、彼女の身体は若く生命力に満ち溢れており、疲労したぶんだけ栄養を求めていたのだ。","en":"All that had happened that day had wounded her heart, but her body was young and brimming with life, and it craved nourishment in proportion to its exhaustion.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r224","rowIndex":224,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「食べないんですか？」","en":"“Aren’t you going to eat?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"内田広美（患者のＵ）","displayName":"Hiromi Uchida (Patient U)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r225","rowIndex":225,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　瞬く間に半分ほど食べてしまった<tips=82>広美</tips>は、気を遣って<tips=23>エリオット</tips>に訊ねた。","en":"After devouring nearly half the pizza in moments, <tips=82>Hiromi</tips> remembered her manners and asked <tips=23>Elliott</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r226","rowIndex":226,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「おれは夜は酒だけでいいんだよ。最近はろくにトレーニングもしていないし、太って仕方ない。……しかし、えらい食いっぷりだな」","en":"“Liquor is enough for me at night. I hardly train anymore, and I can’t stop getting fat. You can really put it away, though.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エリオット・ネス","displayName":"Eliot Ness","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r227","rowIndex":227,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　携帯をいじっていたはずの<tips=23>エリオット</tips>は、いつの間にか<tips=82>広美</tips>の食べる様子に目を奪われており、呆れたように言った。","en":"<tips=23>Elliott</tips> was supposed to have been occupied with his phone, but somewhere along the way he had become transfixed by the sight of <tips=82>Hiromi</tips> eating. He spoke in disbelief.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r228","rowIndex":228,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「美味しくって……」","en":"“It’s so good...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"内田広美（患者のＵ）","displayName":"Hiromi Uchida (Patient U)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r229","rowIndex":229,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　さっきまで泣いていたのにこんなに食べている姿を見せてしまって、恥ずかしく俯いた拍子にげっぷが出てしまったのでなおさら恥ずかしい思いをした。","en":"She hung her head in embarrassment at letting him see her eat so much after all her tears, only to let out a belch and embarrass herself even more.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r230","rowIndex":230,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ピザと一緒に置いてあったペットボトルのコーラの炭酸が悪さをしたのだろう。","en":"The fizz in the bottle of cola that came with the pizza was presumably to blame.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r231","rowIndex":231,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ピザもコーラも、病院ではほとんど口にする機会がなかったものだ。","en":"Pizza and cola were both things she had scarcely ever tasted at the hospital.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r232","rowIndex":232,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「さっき戻るところがないと言っていたな。お前さんにもいろいろあるんだろうが、詳しい事情は聞かないぜ。お互いその方がいいだろう。さっき言った通り、一晩寝たら明日の朝ここを出て行くんだ。だから、それまでにどうするか決めておくんだな」","en":"“You said you had nowhere to go back to. I’m sure you’ve got your reasons, but I won’t ask for the details. Better for both of us that way. Like I said, you can sleep here tonight, but you’re leaving tomorrow morning. Decide what you’re going to do by then.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エリオット・ネス","displayName":"Eliot Ness","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r233","rowIndex":233,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=23>エリオット</tips>はニコリともしないでそう言った。<tips=82>広美</tips>を連れて来たことを後悔した、というわけでもないようだが言葉通りこれ以上の深入りをするつもりはなさそうな冷淡な表情をしている。","en":"<tips=23>Elliott</tips> said this without the faintest smile. He did not appear to regret bringing <tips=82>Hiromi</tips> home, but his expression was cold and suggested that, true to his words, he meant to involve himself no further.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r234","rowIndex":234,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「はい、わかりました」","en":"“Yes. I understand.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"内田広美（患者のＵ）","displayName":"Hiromi Uchida (Patient U)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r235","rowIndex":235,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　もとより<tips=82>広美</tips>にも世話になろうという思いがあったわけでもなく、自然にそう答えて頷く。","en":"<tips=82>Hiromi</tips> had never intended to depend upon him in the first place, and so she answered and nodded without hesitation.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r236","rowIndex":236,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　この態度には、<tips=23>エリオット</tips>の方が若干拍子抜けをしたようだった。","en":"Her response appeared to take <tips=23>Elliott</tips> slightly aback.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r237","rowIndex":237,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　一般的に言って不幸な状況にある少女に突き放すような言葉を投げかければ、すがりつこうとするか、落胆して暗い表情を見せるかしそうなものだが、<tips=82>広美</tips>はどちらでもなくあまりにもあっさりとしている。そしてまたピザに手を伸ばしはじめたのである。","en":"Ordinarily, when a girl in unhappy circumstances is met with words that push her away, one expects her either to cling to the speaker or to fall visibly dejected. <tips=82>Hiromi</tips>, however, did neither. She accepted it with astonishing ease and reached for the pizza again.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r238","rowIndex":238,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=23>エリオット</tips>は溜息をつき、","en":"<tips=23>Elliott</tips> sighed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r239","rowIndex":239,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どんなときでも食えるときにたくさん食うってのは、生き延びるやつの条件だ。お前さんはきっと長生きするぜ」","en":"“Anyone who can eat their fill whenever they get the chance has what it takes to survive. I bet you’ll live a long life.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エリオット・ネス","displayName":"Eliot Ness","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r240","rowIndex":240,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そう言って、部屋を去っていった。","en":"With that, he left the room.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r241","rowIndex":241,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そのあとも一人で食べ続けた<tips=82>広美</tips>は結局全てをたいらげた。","en":"Left alone, <tips=82>Hiromi</tips> kept eating and ultimately finished everything.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r242","rowIndex":242,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　残ったゴミを捨てようと、箱をもってうろうろとしたが部屋の片隅のくず入れにはサイズが小さくて、一旦は折りたたんで無理に突っ込んだものの、とりやめて引っ張り出すと捨てるのを諦めテーブルの上に放置したまま寝室に引っ込んだ。","en":"She picked up the box and wandered around looking for somewhere to dispose of the rubbish, but it was too large for the wastebasket in the corner. She folded it and forced it in, then thought better of it and pulled it out again. At last she gave up, abandoned it on the table, and withdrew to the bedroom.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r243","rowIndex":243,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　さて、先に部屋に戻っていた<tips=23>エリオット</tips>である。","en":"<tips=23>Elliott</tips>, meanwhile, had returned to his room first.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r244","rowIndex":244,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　明かりを消した暗い部屋で横になっていたが眠れず、仕方なく瓶から直で寝酒のつもりで飲んでいたウイスキーも空になってしまった。","en":"He lay awake in the unlit room. With nothing else to do, he drank his nightcap straight from the whiskey bottle until that too was empty.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r245","rowIndex":245,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　マンションに若い女を連れて来るのは久しぶりのことだったが、彼はそのことを少しも意識していない。どころか、<tips=82>広美</tips>のことさえ考えていない。彼は、彼女を拾う原因となった事件のことを考えていた。","en":"It had been a long time since he had brought a young woman to his apartment, but this fact did not occupy his mind in the least. Nor, indeed, was he thinking about <tips=82>Hiromi</tips> herself. His thoughts were with the incident that had caused him to take her in.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r246","rowIndex":246,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それはひとつの事件ではない。いくつもの出来事が連鎖してひとつのイメージを作り出している。","en":"It was not one event. Many incidents linked together to form a single image.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r247","rowIndex":247,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　かつて『ブラッド』で仕事をしていたとき、彼は多くの人間を手にかけた。そのなかには子供や女も少なくはない。","en":"While working for Blood, he had killed many people. Women and children had by no means been rare among them.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r248","rowIndex":248,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　たとえば<tips=17>タイプB</tips>の子供がある差別的な扱いによって命を落としたとする。一般的な<tips=17>タイプB</tips>の市民団体などは抗議の声をあげ、とりまく環境の変化を訴える。一方『ブラッド』は施政者の家族をむごたらしく殺害することで抗議の手段とする。","en":"Suppose, for example, that a <tips=17>Type B</tips> child dies because of some discriminatory treatment. An ordinary <tips=17>Type B</tips> citizens’ group might raise its voice in protest and call for changes to the conditions surrounding them. Blood, by contrast, would make its protest by brutally murdering the governing official’s family.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r249","rowIndex":249,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　この有名なテロ組織は、特定の国家や民族によるものではない。その支援者は<tips=17>タイプB</tips>だけではなく、リベラルな思想を持つノーマルなども多く含まれている。","en":"The famous terrorist organization belonged to no particular nation or ethnic group. Its supporters included not only <tips=17>Type Bs</tips>, but also many Normals of liberal persuasion.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r250","rowIndex":250,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　富裕者は金銭によって、学者などの知識人は思想を理論化し、有名人はメッセージを発信するかたちで組織を支援する。そのメンバーは公開されていないが、組織の上部にいるのはみな地位のある人間であるという。彼らは純粋な平等の思想を掲げているが、それだけでなく、支援をすることで一定の恩恵を組織から受け取っているという。","en":"The wealthy supported the organization with money; scholars and other intellectuals formulated its ideology into theory; celebrities broadcast its message. Its membership was not public, but those at the top were said to be people of high standing. They proclaimed a pure ideal of equality, but were also said to receive certain benefits from the organization in exchange for their support.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r251","rowIndex":251,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　たとえば、前述の家族を殺された施政者は、実は『ブラッド』を支援するある政治家の政敵であったというのはただの偶然だろうか？","en":"For example: was it truly coincidence that the official whose family had been murdered was the political enemy of a politician who supported Blood?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r252","rowIndex":252,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その能力によって重宝され、上層部の事情を知ることとなった<tips=23>エリオット</tips>はその構造に疑問を持っていたが、彼は自分の考えの一切を口にせず淡々と仕事を続けた。","en":"<tips=23>Elliott’s</tips> abilities made him valuable and brought him close enough to learn how the leadership actually operated. He had doubts about the structure, yet voiced none of them and continued performing his work with perfect composure.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r253","rowIndex":253,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ぬいぐるみを抱えて震える幼子の首を絞め、手のひらのなかにその頸動脈の拍動が止まるのを感じる瞬間も、顔色ひとつ変えなかった。","en":"His expression had not changed even as he strangled a trembling little child clutching a stuffed animal and felt the pulse in its carotid artery stop beneath his palm.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r254","rowIndex":254,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　くだらない仕事だと思っていた。かつて若き兵士だった頃は<tips=17>タイプB</tips>の理想に燃え、その結果軍を追われることになったが、『ブラッド』に対してはただ自分の技術を高く買ってくれる相手という以外なんの感情もなかった。<tips=17>タイプB</tips>をとりまくいかなる感情的な議論も、彼の身体を通り過ぎるだけで心には何も残さなかった。そして、任務において自分の両手がいかにおぞましい行為をしようとも、何も感じなかったのだ。","en":"He considered it pointless work. As a young soldier, he had burned with idealism about the <tips=17>Type B</tips> cause and been driven out of the military as a result. Toward Blood, however, he felt nothing; to him it was merely an outfit willing to pay well for his skills. Every emotional argument surrounding <tips=17>Type Bs</tips> passed through his body without leaving anything in his heart. No matter how appalling the acts his own hands performed on a mission, he felt nothing.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r255","rowIndex":255,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その時は。","en":"Not then.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r256","rowIndex":256,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そしてしばらくは自分がそんなことをしていたという事実もほとんど忘れかけていた。","en":"For a while, he had almost forgotten that he used to do such things.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r257","rowIndex":257,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　組織を抜けた今となっても、罪悪感などは特に感じていない。あれは単なる仕事であったし、子供と言えども時間が経てばすぐに大人になるだけの『まだ小さい人間』でしかなく、世間がよく天使やなにかに例えたりするような感覚は彼にはなかった。","en":"Even now, after leaving the organization, he felt no particular guilt. It had merely been work. To him, even a child was only ‘a person who is still small,’ one who would soon enough grow into an adult. He had none of the sentiment that led people to compare children to angels.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r258","rowIndex":258,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しかし、どういうわけだろう？　時々、子供たちを殺す夢を見るのだ。","en":"Yet for some reason, he sometimes dreamed of killing the children.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r259","rowIndex":259,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そこに現れる被害者は子供だけではない。腹の出た妊婦。妻をかばう病気の男。命乞いをする老婆。彼が様々な仕事で殺害したもののうち、いずれも弱く善良な人々である。彼はもう一度そのあわれな人々を現実と同じやり方で殺してゆく。次から次へと場面が変わって、果てしなく。ただそれだけの夢だ。","en":"Children were not the only victims who appeared. A pregnant woman with a swollen belly. A sick man shielding his wife. An old woman begging for her life. All were weak and decent people whom he had killed in the course of various assignments. He murdered those pitiable people again, exactly as he had in reality. Scene followed scene without end. That was all the dream contained.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r260","rowIndex":260,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼はその夢を見ても何も感じない。悲しくも苦しくもない。――しかし、目が覚めるとひどく気怠いのに気がつく。","en":"He felt nothing while dreaming it. Neither sorrow nor pain. And yet, when he woke, he found himself terribly listless.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r261","rowIndex":261,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そしていつもよりほんの少し酒の味が薄く感じられ、ほんの少し酔い方が悪い。","en":"His liquor tasted just a shade thinner than usual, and even his drunkenness sat just a shade less pleasantly.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r262","rowIndex":262,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　色もくすんで見え、テーブルに飾られた花を嗅いでも、音楽を聴いてもいつもより薄い。","en":"Colors seemed dull. Whether he smelled the flowers arranged upon a table or listened to music, every sensation was fainter than usual.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r263","rowIndex":263,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　まるで、全ての感覚に灰色のフィルターがかかってしまったように。","en":"It was as though a gray filter had fallen across every sense.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r264","rowIndex":264,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それで困るというわけでもないが、すっきりしない一日だった。その時雨のなかでうなだれている<tips=82>広美</tips>を見つけた。その横顔に、ふと殺してきた女や子供の顔が重なって、気づけば話しかけていた。","en":"It caused him no particular trouble, but the whole day felt vaguely wrong. That was when he saw <tips=82>Hiromi</tips> slumped in the rain, her head hanging. For an instant, her profile merged with the faces of women and children he had killed. Before he knew it, he had spoken to her.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r265","rowIndex":265,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　今彼は毛布のなかで、今度は夢ではなくはっきりと自分の意志でその場面を思い出している。別に動揺はしない。ただ乾いた感じがするだけだ。","en":"Now, beneath the blanket, he recalled those scenes clearly and by his own will, not through a dream this time. They did not disturb him. He felt only dry inside.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r266","rowIndex":266,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　殺し合いの場で心に深い傷を負って使い物にならなくなる人間を何人も見てきた。唇を震わせ、真っ青な顔で、あからさまにおかしくなるやつもいたが、本人にはなんの自覚もなく、一見するとまわりからもわからないが、話してみると確かに壊れているという人間もいた。","en":"He had seen many people suffer deep psychological wounds amid deadly combat and become unable to function. Some trembled at the lips and turned deathly pale, plainly deranged. Others were unaware of any change, and nothing appeared wrong from the outside, yet conversation revealed that something in them had certainly broken.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r267","rowIndex":267,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おれも知らないうちに、どこかおかしくなっているのかもしれないな。","en":"(Maybe something in me has gone wrong without my knowing it.)","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r268","rowIndex":268,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　心のなかでそう呟いてみた。そうだとしても、別に悲しくもなかった。","en":"He murmured the thought inwardly. Even if it were true, he did not find it sad.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r269","rowIndex":269,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その回想に導かれるように、昔のさまざまな情景が脳裏に浮かび上がってくる。自分を愛してくれた女。彼女も結局自分で殺すことになった。","en":"As though beckoned forth by that recollection, scenes from long ago rose one after another in his mind. A woman who had loved him. In the end, he had killed her himself.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r270","rowIndex":270,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　仲間の一人が情報を売っていて、泣いて命乞いしているのを証拠の撮影をしながらもう片方の手に握った銃で手足から撃ち抜いていった。","en":"One of his comrades had sold information. While the man wept and begged for his life, Elliott filmed the scene as evidence and, with the gun in his other hand, shot through each of his arms and legs in turn.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r271","rowIndex":271,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　砂漠のキャンプで、まだ幼さの残る子供たちに戦い方を教えた。毎日同じテントで眠り、同じ食事をした。","en":"At a desert camp, he had taught children with childhood still lingering in their faces how to fight. Day after day, they slept in the same tent and ate the same food.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r272","rowIndex":272,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　いつの間にか眠りについており、そして物音で目が覚めた。","en":"At some point he fell asleep, and a noise woke him.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r273","rowIndex":273,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　回想のせいですっかり当時の感覚に戻っていた彼は、反射的に当時いつも枕元に置いていた銃の場所に手を伸ばし、虚しく空を探ることになる。","en":"The memories had returned him so thoroughly to the sensations of that time that his hand darted by reflex toward the place where he had always kept a gun beside his pillow, only to search empty air.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r274","rowIndex":274,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そしてすぐに今自分はそんなに神経を張り詰めて生活する必要がないことを思い出した。それと同時にドアを開けて立っている<tips=82>広美</tips>を見つける。彼女は<tips=23>エリオット</tips>の大きなシャツのなかで身体を泳がせている。","en":"He quickly remembered that he no longer needed to live with every nerve drawn taut. At the same moment, he noticed <tips=82>Hiromi</tips> standing in the open doorway, all but lost inside <tips=23>Elliott’s</tips> enormous shirt.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r275","rowIndex":275,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どうした？」","en":"“What is it?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エリオット・ネス","displayName":"Eliot Ness","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r276","rowIndex":276,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「お腹がすいて……」","en":"“I’m hungry...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"内田広美（患者のＵ）","displayName":"Hiromi Uchida (Patient U)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r277","rowIndex":277,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「冷蔵庫に何か入ってる。何でも使っていいから適当に食え」","en":"“There’s something in the refrigerator. Use whatever you like and make yourself something.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エリオット・ネス","displayName":"Eliot Ness","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r278","rowIndex":278,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「冷蔵庫に？」","en":"“In the refrigerator?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"内田広美（患者のＵ）","displayName":"Hiromi Uchida (Patient U)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r279","rowIndex":279,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「卵かベーコンがあったかな。目玉焼きくらい作れるだろ。キッチンにフライパンは出したままになっていたはずだ」","en":"“I think there are eggs or bacon. You can at least fry an egg, can’t you? The frying pan should still be out in the kitchen.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エリオット・ネス","displayName":"Eliot Ness","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r280","rowIndex":280,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　さすがの<tips=23>エリオット</tips>も昨日は飲み過ぎてしまったらしく、喋ると頭がズキズキと痛んで顔を顰める。","en":"Apparently even <tips=23>Elliott</tips> had drunk too much the night before. Speaking made his head throb, and he grimaced.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r281","rowIndex":281,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「はあ……」","en":"“Oh...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"内田広美（患者のＵ）","displayName":"Hiromi Uchida (Patient U)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r282","rowIndex":282,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「食ったら好きなところへ行け。挨拶はいらないからな。おれはもう少し眠る」","en":"“Once you’ve eaten, go wherever you like. No need to say goodbye. I’m sleeping a little longer.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エリオット・ネス","displayName":"Eliot Ness","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r283","rowIndex":283,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=23>エリオット</tips>はぶっきらぼうに言うと、またごろりと横になって毛布にくるまった。","en":"<tips=23>Elliott</tips> spoke brusquely, rolled over, and wrapped himself in the blanket again.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r284","rowIndex":284,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そしてもう一度眠りについた。","en":"Then he returned to sleep.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r285","rowIndex":285,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　次に目が覚めたのは、喉の渇きによってだった。","en":"The next time he woke, thirst was what roused him.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r286","rowIndex":286,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　起き上がるとまだ頭痛がし、腹のあたりはまるで内臓が腐ったかのような不快感が残っている。毎日飲んでいる<tips=23>エリオット</tips>にとって二日酔いは少なくないが、今日はいつもよりきつい。","en":"When he got up, his head was still aching, and a sickening sensation lingered in his gut, as though his organs had rotted. Hangovers were hardly unusual for <tips=23>Elliott</tips>, who drank every day, but today’s was worse than usual.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r287","rowIndex":287,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　普段ならこのまま出かけて迎え酒と行くところだが、今日は何よりもまず水を飲みたかった。","en":"Ordinarily, he would have gone out and met it with another drink. Today, more than anything, he wanted water first.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r288","rowIndex":288,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして部屋を出たところで彼は焦げ臭いにおいを感じる。キッチンの方から音がする。","en":"When he left the room, he smelled something burning. Noises came from the kitchen.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r289","rowIndex":289,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=82>広美</tips>はまだ帰っていなかったのか。それとも、自分が思っているほど長い二度寝ではなかったのか。","en":"Had <tips=82>Hiromi</tips> not left yet? Or had he slept less the second time than he imagined?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r290","rowIndex":290,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　痛む頭を抱えながらキッチンに向かうと、予想していない光景にでくわした。","en":"Clutching his aching head, Elliott went to the kitchen and encountered something he had not anticipated.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r291","rowIndex":291,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=23>エリオット</tips>は知るよしもなかったことだが、たとえ目玉焼きといえども<tips=82>広美</tips>に料理など出来るはずもない。それどころか、火を扱わせてもらえず、実家にいたときもコンロのそばに近づくことさえ許されなかった彼女には、見よう見まねで調理を見た記憶もない。","en":"<tips=23>Elliott</tips> had no way of knowing it, but <tips=82>Hiromi</tips> was no more capable of frying an egg than of cooking anything else. She had never been allowed to handle fire; even while living at home, she was forbidden to go near the stove. She had not so much as a memory of watching someone cook and learning by imitation.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r292","rowIndex":292,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　病院のテレビでは時々調理シーンなども流れていたはずだが、知能が落ちてテレビの内容も理解出来なかった彼女は画面に興味を持つこともなかった。","en":"Cooking scenes must occasionally have appeared on the hospital television, but her intelligence had declined so far that she could not understand the programs, and she had taken no interest in the screen.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r293","rowIndex":293,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　つまり、大変なことになっていたのである。","en":"In short, a disaster had occurred.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r294","rowIndex":294,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　卵はパックがそのまま冷蔵庫に入っていたはずだが、ほとんど割るのに失敗して、三つほどが床の上で潰れ、残りのいくつかは流しに飲み込まれたようだ。","en":"A full carton of eggs had been in the refrigerator, but she had failed to crack nearly all of them. About three lay smashed on the floor, and several of the rest appeared to have vanished down the sink.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r295","rowIndex":295,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ボウルにどうにか二つの卵が入っているようだが、黄身はやぶけ、細かい殻の破片が混ざっている。","en":"She had somehow managed to get two eggs into a bowl, but their yolks were broken and flecks of shell were mixed throughout.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r296","rowIndex":296,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そしてコンロもはじめは火の付け方さえよくわからなかったところから、時間をかけた試行錯誤の上になんとか点火し、そしてフライパンをそこにくべるところまでは良かったのだが油をひくことまでは思考がまわらなかった。","en":"At first, she had not even known how to ignite the stove. After prolonged trial and error, she managed to produce a flame and set the frying pan upon it. So far, so good. It never occurred to her to add oil.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r297","rowIndex":297,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しかもこの家のフライパンはテフロンではなく、くっつきやすい銀色のステンレス製だったのである。","en":"Worse, this house’s frying pan was not Teflon-coated but made of silver-colored stainless steel, to which food readily stuck.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r298","rowIndex":298,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　最初に炒めたベーコンはこびりつき、ヘラで剥がすのに手間取っているうちに、焦げて煙が立ち上った。換気扇がどういうものかも知らなかったから、その煙は部屋に漂ってあの焦げ臭い臭いとなったのである。","en":"The bacon she tried first stuck fast. While she struggled to scrape it free with a spatula, it burned and began releasing smoke. She did not know what the range hood was, either. The smoke drifted through the room as the charred odor Elliott had detected.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r299","rowIndex":299,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その光景を一目見て、<tips=23>エリオット</tips>は状況を把握した。","en":"A single glance at the scene was enough for <tips=23>Elliott</tips> to grasp the situation.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r300","rowIndex":300,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　涙ぐんでこちらを振り返る<tips=82>広美</tips>にかわってコンロの前に立つと、黒い炭になったベーコンを捨てる。","en":"<tips=82>Hiromi</tips> turned toward him with tears in her eyes. He took her place at the stove and threw away the bacon, now charred black.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r301","rowIndex":301,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ご、ごめんなさい」","en":"“I-I’m sorry.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"内田広美（患者のＵ）","displayName":"Hiromi Uchida (Patient U)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r302","rowIndex":302,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「大丈夫。おれが悪かったんだ」","en":"“It’s all right. This was my fault.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エリオット・ネス","displayName":"Eliot Ness","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r303","rowIndex":303,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=23>エリオット</tips>は苦い顔をして、慣れた手つきでフライパンにこびりついた汚れを削り落とし、そしてコンロの上に置いた。","en":"<tips=23>Elliott</tips> grimaced, scraped the burned residue from the pan with practiced movements, and set it back upon the stove.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r304","rowIndex":304,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「料理、出来なかったんだな」","en":"“You didn’t know how to cook.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エリオット・ネス","displayName":"Eliot Ness","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r305","rowIndex":305,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　グラスの水を飲み、溜息をついてから<tips=23>エリオット</tips>はそう言った。","en":"<tips=23>Elliott</tips> said this after drinking a glass of water and sighing.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r306","rowIndex":306,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=82>広美</tips>は、目玉焼きにしようとしていた卵から殻を取り除いてスクランブルエッグにしてくれた卵と炒めたベーコンをトーストの上に乗せたものをもそもそと食べながら頷く。","en":"<tips=82>Hiromi</tips> nodded and chewed slowly. Elliott had picked the shell from the eggs she meant to fry, turned them into scrambled eggs, cooked fresh bacon, and laid both upon toast.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r307","rowIndex":307,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「したことがないんです。指示にしたがって、出て来たものを食べるだけでしたから」","en":"“I’ve never done it. I only followed instructions and ate whatever they brought me.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"内田広美（患者のＵ）","displayName":"Hiromi Uchida (Patient U)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r308","rowIndex":308,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ママが作ったのを見たこともないのかい？」","en":"“You’ve never even seen your mom make one?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エリオット・ネス","displayName":"Eliot Ness","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r309","rowIndex":309,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……お母さんと暮らしていた時はキッチンに入れて貰えなかったですし、それ以降はずっと出来上がったものがトレイで運ばれて来るだけでしたから」","en":"“...When I lived with my mother, she wouldn’t let me into the kitchen, and after that, the food always just came to me already prepared on a tray.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"内田広美（患者のＵ）","displayName":"Hiromi Uchida (Patient U)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r310","rowIndex":310,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうか。しかし、目玉焼きであそこまでめちゃくちゃにするやつは初めて見たぜ」","en":"“I see. Still, I’ve never watched anyone make that big a disaster out of frying an egg.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エリオット・ネス","displayName":"Eliot Ness","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r311","rowIndex":311,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=23>エリオット</tips>は煙草に火をつけると、呆れて苦笑する。","en":"<tips=23>Elliott</tips> lit a cigarette and gave an incredulous, wry smile.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r312","rowIndex":312,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「す、すみません」","en":"“I-I’m sorry.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"内田広美（患者のＵ）","displayName":"Hiromi Uchida (Patient U)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r313","rowIndex":313,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ただの家出娘だと思っていたが、少し違うようだな。……昨日は何も聞かないと言っておいてすまないが、良かったら事情を話してくれないか？」","en":"“I thought you were just a runaway, but it seems there’s more to it. ...I know I said yesterday that I wouldn’t ask, and I’m sorry to go back on that, but if you’re willing, would you tell me what happened?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エリオット・ネス","displayName":"Eliot Ness","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r314","rowIndex":314,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=82>広美</tips>は無言で頷いた。","en":"<tips=82>Hiromi</tips> nodded in silence.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r315","rowIndex":315,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女にとっては順序立てて話すのは難しかったが、<tips=23>エリオット</tips>の質問に促されながらどうにか自分のこれまでの生活を全て説明することが出来た。","en":"It was difficult for her to tell the story in order, but with <tips=23>Elliott’s</tips> questions to guide her, she somehow managed to recount her entire life up to that point.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r316","rowIndex":316,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なるほどね。あの病院の患者だったのか」","en":"“I see. You were a patient at that hospital.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エリオット・ネス","displayName":"Eliot Ness","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r317","rowIndex":317,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=23>エリオット</tips>も先日の病院襲撃事件の話は聞いている。いや、この街で知らないものはいないだろう。ギャングなどの闇社会のものたちの争いではなく、国の施設が襲撃されたのだ。前代未聞——というわけではないが、少なくとも<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>が支配するようになってからはそのようなことは起きていない。","en":"<tips=23>Elliott</tips>, too, had heard about the recent attack on the hospital. Indeed, there could scarcely have been anyone in the city who had not. This was no struggle among gangs or other denizens of the underworld, but an assault on a state facility. It was not entirely unprecedented, but nothing similar had happened since <tips=7>YS</tips> took control.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r318","rowIndex":318,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そしてその実行犯が最近街で我が物顔でうろついている<tips=47>八龍解放軍</tips>なのも、公表されているわけではなかったがもはや秘密とも言えない明白な事実として認識されていた。","en":"No official statement identified the perpetrators as the <tips=47>Hachiryu Liberation Army</tips>, whose members had lately swaggered around the city as though they owned it. Nevertheless, the conclusion was recognized as such an obvious fact that it could no longer be called a secret.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r319","rowIndex":319,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　どうやら<tips=21>八龍会</tips>は本気で<tips=17>タイプB</tips>以外の全てを敵に回そうとしているらしいと、人々は噂したものである。","en":"People said that the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips> was apparently intent on making an enemy of everyone who was not <tips=17>Type B</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r320","rowIndex":320,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=23>エリオット</tips>もそうした噂は酒場で耳にしている。","en":"<tips=23>Elliott</tips> had heard rumors of that kind in bars.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r321","rowIndex":321,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　が、それほど詳しいわけではない。確かに<tips=21>八龍会</tips>に誘われたりもしたが、それだけのことだ。","en":"But he knew little more. True, the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips> had invited him to join, but that was all.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r322","rowIndex":322,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ここ数ヶ月の変化というものはすさまじく、<tips=27>廖志明</tips>の元で働いていた頃の情報はもう古くなってしまっているのも自覚している。","en":"The changes of the past several months had been staggering, and he knew that whatever intelligence he retained from his service under <tips=27>Liao Chi-ming</tips> was already out of date.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r323","rowIndex":323,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「で、どうするんだ？　一晩考えたんだろう？　<tips=21>八龍会</tips>の世話になるのかい？　それとも勇気を出してもう一度家族に会いに行くか？　おれは、ちゃんと家族と話をするのが一番だと思うがね。……ああ、湿ってやがる」","en":"“So what are you going to do? You had all night to think. Will you let the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips> take care of you? Or summon your courage and go see your family again? I think your best course is to sit down and talk to them properly. ...Ah, damn, this one’s damp.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エリオット・ネス","displayName":"Eliot Ness","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r324","rowIndex":324,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　一本の煙草を吸い終わり、新しく取り出したもう一本を苦々しげに灰皿の底に押しつぶした。","en":"Having finished one cigarette, he pressed the next against the bottom of the ashtray with a bitter expression.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r325","rowIndex":325,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「家族のところへは行きません」","en":"“I won’t go to my family.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"内田広美（患者のＵ）","displayName":"Hiromi Uchida (Patient U)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r326","rowIndex":326,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=82>広美</tips>は顔を上げてきっぱりと断言した。","en":"<tips=82>Hiromi</tips> raised her head and stated the decision firmly.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r327","rowIndex":327,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あの人たちは新しい幸せのなかにいます。あの幸せを守ることが、今の私が出来る最大の恩返しなんです。……どういう理由だろうと私はあの人たちを傷つけてしまったわけですから。人を傷つけるということは、許されるものではないと思うんです」","en":"“They have a new happiness now. Protecting that happiness is the greatest way I can repay them. ...Whatever the reason, I did hurt them. And I don’t think hurting another person is something that can be forgiven.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"内田広美（患者のＵ）","displayName":"Hiromi Uchida (Patient U)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r328","rowIndex":328,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうかい」","en":"“I see.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エリオット・ネス","displayName":"Eliot Ness","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r329","rowIndex":329,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=23>エリオット</tips>は箱のなかの残りの煙草も湿っているのを見て舌打ちしながら握りつぶすと、テーブルの上に無造作に投げ出されていた使いかけのカートンから新しい煙草を取り出した。","en":"<tips=23>Elliott</tips> found the remaining cigarettes in the pack damp as well. He clicked his tongue, crushed the pack in his fist, and tossed it onto the table. Then he took a fresh cigarette from the half-used carton lying there.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r330","rowIndex":330,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「じゃあ、<tips=21>八龍会</tips>に頼るのか？」","en":"“So you’ll turn to the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips>?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エリオット・ネス","displayName":"Eliot Ness","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r331","rowIndex":331,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それはもっといやです」","en":"“I want that even less.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"内田広美（患者のＵ）","displayName":"Hiromi Uchida (Patient U)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r332","rowIndex":332,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=82>広美</tips>は強い口調で首を振る。","en":"<tips=82>Hiromi</tips> shook her head, her voice forceful.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r333","rowIndex":333,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「やっぱり、あの人たちは許せません。……みんなをあんな風に殺したりして。職員の人たちは普通に暮らしていただけなのに。あの人たちだって、大事な家族がいたのに。それに、とっても私に優しくしてくれたし……」","en":"“I can’t forgive them after all. Killing everyone that way... The staff were only living ordinary lives. They had precious families of their own. And they were so very kind to me...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"内田広美（患者のＵ）","displayName":"Hiromi Uchida (Patient U)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r334","rowIndex":334,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうかい。まあ、<tips=21>八龍会</tips>と関わらないのは正解だろうよ」","en":"“I see. Well, staying away from the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips> is probably the right choice.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エリオット・ネス","displayName":"Eliot Ness","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r335","rowIndex":335,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=23>エリオット</tips>は新しい煙草に火をつけ、肺一杯に煙を吸い込む。","en":"<tips=23>Elliott</tips> lit the new cigarette and drew smoke deep into his lungs.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r336","rowIndex":336,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「お前さんたちに使った薬は今はあの連中が独占してるが、どうせすぐ世間に出回るようになる。……だが、当面は苦しいだろうな。<tips=21>八龍会</tips>に入らないにしても、薬の入手法はおさえておいたほうがいい」","en":"“The drug they used on all of you is monopolized by them for now, but it’ll be in general circulation soon enough. ...Still, things will be hard for you in the meantime. Even if you don’t join the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips>, you’d better make sure you know how to get hold of the drug.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エリオット・ネス","displayName":"Eliot Ness","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r337","rowIndex":337,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「薬のことは、いいんです。……別に、症状がなくなったからって良くなったことなんか何もないし」","en":"“I don’t need the medicine. ...It isn’t as though anything got better just because my symptoms disappeared.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"内田広美（患者のＵ）","displayName":"Hiromi Uchida (Patient U)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r338","rowIndex":338,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=82>広美</tips>は唇を噛んで俯く。<tips=23>エリオット</tips>は煙草をふかしたまま何も言わない。","en":"<tips=82>Hiromi</tips> bit her lip and lowered her head. <tips=23>Elliott</tips> continued smoking without a word.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r339","rowIndex":339,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ここに居座ろうと思ってるんならそれは困るぜ」","en":"“If you’re planning to plant yourself here, that’s a problem.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エリオット・ネス","displayName":"Eliot Ness","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r340","rowIndex":340,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうは考えていません」","en":"“I’m not.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"内田広美（患者のＵ）","displayName":"Hiromi Uchida (Patient U)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r341","rowIndex":341,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「じゃあどうするんだい？」","en":"“Then what will you do?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エリオット・ネス","displayName":"Eliot Ness","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r342","rowIndex":342,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　気のない<tips=23>エリオット</tips>の質問に、<tips=82>広美</tips>はすっと顔を上げ、","en":"At <tips=23>Elliott’s</tips> indifferent question, <tips=82>Hiromi</tips> lifted her face sharply.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r343","rowIndex":343,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「私、病院で殺された人の仕返しをします」","en":"“I’m going to avenge the people who were killed at the hospital.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"内田広美（患者のＵ）","displayName":"Hiromi Uchida (Patient U)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r344","rowIndex":344,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「え？」","en":"“What?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エリオット・ネス","displayName":"Eliot Ness","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r345","rowIndex":345,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=47>解放軍</tips>だとかいう人たちをやっつけます。それが、私がしなくちゃいけないことなんです。だって、最後まで私のことを心配してくれてたんですよ？　鉄砲でおどされながら、おしめもかえてくれて……。それは仕事ってだけじゃないはずです。私はその気持ちにこたえなきゃいけない……」","en":"“I’m going to beat those people they call the <tips=47>Liberation Army</tips>. That’s what I have to do. The staff kept worrying about me right to the very end, you know. Even with guns pointed at them, they changed my diaper... That couldn’t have been just a job. I have to answer what they felt for me...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"内田広美（患者のＵ）","displayName":"Hiromi Uchida (Patient U)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r346","rowIndex":346,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「お、おいおい」","en":"“H-hey, hold on.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エリオット・ネス","displayName":"Eliot Ness","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r347","rowIndex":347,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=23>エリオット</tips>は思わず唇の端から落としかけた煙草を空中でキャッチして、またくわえなおすと、","en":"The cigarette nearly fell from the corner of <tips=23>Elliott’s</tips> mouth. He caught it in midair without thinking, put it back between his lips, and said,","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r348","rowIndex":348,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「仕返しってどういうことだ？　やっつけるって何をするつもりだよ」","en":"“What do you mean, avenge them? What exactly are you planning to do when you say ‘defeat’ them?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エリオット・ネス","displayName":"Eliot Ness","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r349","rowIndex":349,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「刃物でも、なんでも……とにかく、病院の人たちにしたことをするんです。命をかけて。それが私がいましなくちゃいけない一つのことなんです」","en":"“With a knife, or anything... I’ll do to them what they did to the people at the hospital. I’ll stake my life on it. It’s the one thing I have to do now.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"内田広美（患者のＵ）","displayName":"Hiromi Uchida (Patient U)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r350","rowIndex":350,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=82>広美</tips>は言うと、目に涙をにじませる。","en":"Tears gathered in <tips=82>Hiromi’s</tips> eyes as she spoke.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r351","rowIndex":351,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「出来なくて、逆に殺されてしまうかもしれないけど、それでもいいんです。もう決めたんですから。とにかく、やるってことが大事なんです」","en":"“Maybe I won’t manage it and they’ll kill me instead. But I don’t care. I’ve already decided. What matters is making the attempt.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"内田広美（患者のＵ）","displayName":"Hiromi Uchida (Patient U)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r352","rowIndex":352,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「本気か？」","en":"“You’re serious?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エリオット・ネス","displayName":"Eliot Ness","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r353","rowIndex":353,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「本気です」","en":"“I am.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"内田広美（患者のＵ）","displayName":"Hiromi Uchida (Patient U)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r354","rowIndex":354,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あきれたな」","en":"“Unbelievable.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エリオット・ネス","displayName":"Eliot Ness","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r355","rowIndex":355,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=23>エリオット</tips>は肩をすくめる。","en":"<tips=23>Elliott</tips> shrugged.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r356","rowIndex":356,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「絶対に無理ですか？」","en":"“Is it absolutely impossible?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"内田広美（患者のＵ）","displayName":"Hiromi Uchida (Patient U)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r357","rowIndex":357,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「無理だ……と言ってやってもいいが、嘘は好きじゃないんだ。……正直に言ってやろう。誰をやりたいのか知らないが、やり方次第でどうにでもなる。はっきり言って人を殺すことなんて簡単なんだ。まさか<tips=21>八龍会</tips>の連中もお前が殺しに来るだなんて思っちゃいないだろうし、そもそも、あいつらは素人だからな」","en":"“I could tell you it’s impossible... but I don’t like to lie. ...So I’ll be honest. I don’t know who it is you want dead, but the right method can make almost anything manageable. To put it plainly, killing a person is easy. The <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips> would never dream that you were coming to kill one of them, and besides, they’re amateurs.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エリオット・ネス","displayName":"Eliot Ness","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r358","rowIndex":358,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「本当ですか？　じゃあ、そのやり方を教えてください！　かわりに出来ることがあったら、何でもしますから……」","en":"“Really? Then please teach me the method! If there’s anything I can do for you in return, I’ll do it—anything...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"内田広美（患者のＵ）","displayName":"Hiromi Uchida (Patient U)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r359","rowIndex":359,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=82>広美</tips>はまっすぐ<tips=23>エリオット</tips>の目を見つめて言う。","en":"<tips=82>Hiromi</tips> spoke while looking directly into <tips=23>Elliott’s</tips> eyes.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r360","rowIndex":360,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　客観的に見れば今の<tips=23>エリオット</tips>の言葉も相当無茶な話に聞こえるはずだが、彼女には人を疑うという発想自体がなく、そのまま信じてしまうのだ。","en":"Objectively speaking, what <tips=23>Elliott</tips> had just told her should have sounded every bit as outrageous. But the very idea of doubting another person did not exist for Hiromi, and she simply believed him.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r361","rowIndex":361,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=23>エリオット</tips>は苦い顔をし、","en":"<tips=23>Elliott</tips> grimaced.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r362","rowIndex":362,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「一応言っておくが、人殺しなんかくだらないぜ。殺せたっていいことなんかない」","en":"“For the record, killing people is pointless. Nothing good comes of it even if you succeed.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エリオット・ネス","displayName":"Eliot Ness","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r363","rowIndex":363,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「でも」","en":"“But—”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"内田広美（患者のＵ）","displayName":"Hiromi Uchida (Patient U)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r364","rowIndex":364,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なあ、この社会で人を殺すってことはな、自分も人に殺されてもいいような存在になるってことなんだよ。人を殺した時点でそいつの命の価値はゴミクズになる。殺人者ってのはそういうもんだ」","en":"“Listen. In this society, when you kill someone, you become the kind of thing other people are free to kill. The moment someone takes a life, their own becomes worth no more than trash. That’s what a killer is.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エリオット・ネス","displayName":"Eliot Ness","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r365","rowIndex":365,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……正しい理由があっても？」","en":"“...Even with a just reason?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"内田広美（患者のＵ）","displayName":"Hiromi Uchida (Patient U)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r366","rowIndex":366,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「正しかろうが悪かろうが一緒だよ。たとえ自分の身を守るための殺人でも、その殺しで英雄と讃えられようとね。これは道徳の話じゃない。やむをえない状況だとしても、自分の手が誰かを殺せるってことを知ってしまった時点でそいつの本質は変わるんだ」","en":"“Right or wrong, it’s the same. Even if you kill to protect yourself. Even if the killing makes people hail you as a hero. This isn’t about morality. However unavoidable the situation, the instant you learn that your own hands are capable of killing someone, your essential nature changes.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エリオット・ネス","displayName":"Eliot Ness","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r367","rowIndex":367,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「よく、わかりません」","en":"“I don’t really understand.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"内田広美（患者のＵ）","displayName":"Hiromi Uchida (Patient U)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r368","rowIndex":368,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「だろうね。でも、わかってからじゃ遅いのさ」","en":"“I didn’t expect you to. Once you understand, though, it’s too late.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エリオット・ネス","displayName":"Eliot Ness","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r369","rowIndex":369,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……あなたは、人を殺したことがあるんですか？」","en":"“...Have you killed someone?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"内田広美（患者のＵ）","displayName":"Hiromi Uchida (Patient U)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r370","rowIndex":370,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ああ、あるとも。だからおれも人殺しのゴミクズだ。……そんなおれの目から見れば、お前さんの命はピカピカ輝いているように見えるぜ。それを大事にすべきだと思うね。どうせ<tips=47>解放軍</tips>の連中は何もしなくてもこの先どんどん死んでゆく。この街はゴミクズだらけだからな。そうやってゴミクズ同志が永遠に殺し合ってればいいのさ。お前さんはどこかでひっそり暮らしてその馬鹿げた争いを笑って見ていれば、それで充分な復讐じゃないか」","en":"“Of course I have. And that makes me a piece of murdering trash, too. ...To someone like me, your life looks bright and spotless, almost dazzling. I think you ought to treasure it. Those <tips=47>Liberation Army</tips> people will keep dying whether you do anything or not. This city is full of trash. Let the trash go on killing one another forever. Live quietly somewhere else and laugh at their stupid struggle. Wouldn’t that be revenge enough?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エリオット・ネス","displayName":"Eliot Ness","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r371","rowIndex":371,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そんなの、いやです」","en":"“I don’t want that.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"内田広美（患者のＵ）","displayName":"Hiromi Uchida (Patient U)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r372","rowIndex":372,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=82>広美</tips>は<tips=23>エリオット</tips>の忠告に従うつもりはないようだった。","en":"<tips=82>Hiromi</tips> appeared to have no intention of following <tips=23>Elliott’s</tips> advice.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r373","rowIndex":373,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　絶対に復讐をすると言ってきかない。","en":"She insisted that she would have her revenge.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r374","rowIndex":374,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いいんです。もしあなたの言う通りだとしても、どうせ私には最初から価値なんかなかったんですから」","en":"“I don’t care. Even if you’re right, I never had any value in the first place.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"内田広美（患者のＵ）","displayName":"Hiromi Uchida (Patient U)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r375","rowIndex":375,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　最後は涙目になってそう言った。","en":"Her eyes were wet with tears by the time she finished.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r376","rowIndex":376,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「馬鹿言うな。この世の中には最初から価値がない人間なんかいやしない」","en":"“Don’t talk nonsense. There isn’t a person in this world who has no value from the start.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エリオット・ネス","displayName":"Eliot Ness","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r377","rowIndex":377,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=23>エリオット</tips>は火をつけたばかりの煙草を灰皿に押しつける。","en":"<tips=23>Elliott</tips> ground the cigarette he had only just lit into the ashtray.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r378","rowIndex":378,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「わかった。好きにすればいい。だが、このままじゃお前はただ自殺しに行くようなもんだぞ」","en":"“Fine. Do as you like. But as you are now, you’d merely be going there to kill yourself.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エリオット・ネス","displayName":"Eliot Ness","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r379","rowIndex":379,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「さっきは、出来るかもしれないって……」","en":"“You just said it might be possible...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"内田広美（患者のＵ）","displayName":"Hiromi Uchida (Patient U)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r380","rowIndex":380,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それは、しかるべき準備をすればの話だ。プロが計画を立て、何日か簡単な訓練をすれば難しくない。……そのあてがあるのか？　あるわけないよな」","en":"“That’s only if the proper preparations are made. If a professional designs the plan and gives you a few days of basic training, it won’t be difficult. ...Do you have access to anything like that? Of course not.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エリオット・ネス","displayName":"Eliot Ness","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r381","rowIndex":381,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……でも……」","en":"“...But...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"内田広美（患者のＵ）","displayName":"Hiromi Uchida (Patient U)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r382","rowIndex":382,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=82>広美</tips>は涙でキラキラと光る目を<tips=23>エリオット</tips>に向ける。彼はニヤリと笑って、","en":"<tips=82>Hiromi</tips> raised eyes shining with tears toward <tips=23>Elliott</tips>. He grinned.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r383","rowIndex":383,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それなら、ここにいるプロが指導してやろう。この見知らぬ外国人を信じるか？　信じないか？　選ぶのはお前さん次第で……」","en":"“In that case, the professional right here will teach you. Do you trust this foreign stranger, or don’t you? The choice is yours to—”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エリオット・ネス","displayName":"Eliot Ness","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r384","rowIndex":384,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「お願いしますっ！」","en":"“Please!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"内田広美（患者のＵ）","displayName":"Hiromi Uchida (Patient U)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r385","rowIndex":385,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=23>エリオット</tips>の言葉が終わらないうちに、<tips=82>広美</tips>はテーブルに額がつきそうなくらい頭を下げてそう言った。","en":"Before <tips=23>Elliott</tips> could finish, <tips=82>Hiromi</tips> bowed until her forehead nearly struck the table.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r386","rowIndex":386,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=23>エリオット</tips>がこのときどういった心境でこんな提案をしたのかは推測する他ない。","en":"We can only speculate about what <tips=23>Elliott</tips> felt when he made this proposal.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r387","rowIndex":387,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　単なる同情か、それともこのあまりにも純粋な少女を玩具に暇つぶしをするつもりだったのか、あるいは、夢の子供たちを想起させる<tips=82>広美</tips>に殺人を犯させることで、何かを乗り越えようとしたのか。","en":"Was it simple sympathy? Did he intend to pass the time by turning this impossibly innocent girl into a toy? Or did he hope to overcome something by making <tips=82>Hiromi</tips>, who reminded him of the children in his dreams, commit murder herself?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r388","rowIndex":388,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それともいくつかの感情が入り交じった一見理由がないように見える感情の流れがあったのか。","en":"Perhaps several emotions mingled into a current that appeared, at first glance, to have no reason at all.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r389","rowIndex":389,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　人間の行動は、いつでもはっきりとした言葉で説明が出来る根拠が存在するとは限らない。","en":"Human actions do not always have reasons that can be put clearly into words.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r390","rowIndex":390,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ただ、この<tips=23>エリオット</tips>の提案が、この後に起きる<tips=10>見土道夫</tips>暗殺事件を実現し、<tips=47>八龍解放軍</tips>の方針を変え、<tips=9>Y地区</tips>の勢力争いにいくばくかの影響を及ぼしてゆくのである。","en":"What can be said is that <tips=23>Elliott’s</tips> proposal made possible the later assassination of <tips=10>Michio Mido</tips>, altered the course of the <tips=47>Hachiryu Liberation Army</tips>, and exerted some influence upon the struggle for power in <tips=9>Y District</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r391","rowIndex":391,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　さて、久しぶりに酒を飲んで寝る以外の行動をすることとなった<tips=23>エリオット</tips>は、まず情報集めを行った。","en":"Now doing something besides drinking and sleeping for the first time in quite a while, <tips=23>Elliott</tips> began by gathering intelligence.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r392","rowIndex":392,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=27>廖志明</tips>の部下であった時代の同僚たちは今は跡を継いだ一人息子<tips=28>トーマス・リャオ</tips>の部下として活動している。<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>は間違いなく<tips=47>解放軍</tips>をマークしているはずであり、彼らに聞けば情報を手に入れるのも難しくなかったろうが彼はその手段は用いなかった。","en":"The men who had once served beside him under <tips=27>Liao Chi-ming</tips> now worked for <tips=28>Thomas Liao</tips>, Liao’s only son and successor. <tips=7>YS</tips> was undoubtedly watching the <tips=47>Liberation Army</tips>. Elliott could presumably have obtained information without difficulty by asking them, but he did not use that route.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r393","rowIndex":393,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　一つには情報を集めているというのを知られたくなかったのであろうし、もう一つは<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>と関わり合いを持ちたくないという気持ちもあっただろう。","en":"One reason was likely that he did not wish anyone to know he was gathering intelligence. Another may have been a desire to avoid any renewed involvement with <tips=7>YS</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r394","rowIndex":394,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　かわりに、朝に<tips=59>暗闇通り</tips>の喫茶店に行って新聞を広げたり、酒場に行く時間を変えたりした。それらの場所には夜の女たちが集まっており、<tips=23>エリオット</tips>の顔なじみもいる。彼女たちは事情に詳しく、雑談をしていれば自然と情報が集まった。","en":"Instead, he went to a café on <tips=59>Darkness Street</tips> in the morning and spread out a newspaper, or varied the hours when he visited the bars. Women of the night gathered in such places, and some were acquainted with <tips=23>Elliott</tips>. They knew what went on in the district, and ordinary conversation brought the information to him naturally.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r395","rowIndex":395,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　また彼は普段<tips=21>八龍会</tips>と距離をとっていたが、彼自身も<tips=17>タイプB</tips>であるために、酒場で親しくなったものたちも<tips=17>タイプB</tips>ばかりで、<tips=21>八龍会</tips>に所属していたりする。彼らにそれとなく話題をふればやはりぺらぺらと喋り出した。彼らの何人かは<tips=21>八龍会</tips>が<tips=23>エリオット</tips>を欲しがっていることを知っており、積極的に話してくれるものもいる。","en":"He generally kept his distance from the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips>, but because he himself was <tips=17>Type B</tips>, the people he befriended in bars were all <tips=17>Type B</tips> as well, and some even belonged to the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips>. When he casually steered the conversation their way, sure enough, they would begin chattering. Some knew that the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips> was eager to recruit <tips=23>Elliott</tips>, which made them all the more forthcoming.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r396","rowIndex":396,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　こうして、<tips=23>エリオット</tips>は普段とほとんど生活をかえることなく<tips=21>八龍会</tips>の情報を集めたのである。誰も彼がそんな調査をしていることなど気がつかなかった。","en":"In this way, <tips=23>Elliott</tips> gathered information on the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips> with virtually no change to his daily routine. No one realized that he was conducting such an investigation.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r397","rowIndex":397,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　一方、<tips=82>広美</tips>への教育も同時に行った。","en":"At the same time, he trained <tips=82>Hiromi</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r398","rowIndex":398,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　小型の拳銃を与え、その使い方を教えた。実際の射撃は<tips=9>Y地区</tips>を離れた林のなかで行った。","en":"He gave her a small handgun and taught her to use it. They conducted the actual shooting in woods beyond <tips=9>Y District</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r399","rowIndex":399,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　若く飲み込みが早い<tips=82>広美</tips>は、すぐに五メートルほどの距離なら空き缶を撃ち落とせるようになった。","en":"Young and quick to learn, <tips=82>Hiromi</tips> soon became able to knock down an empty can from about five meters away.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r400","rowIndex":400,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「よし、大体使い方を覚えたようだな。これだけ出来れば十分だ。実際はもっと近づいてから撃つような計画を立てるから、当てること自体は簡単だ。……ただ、人間を冷静に撃ち抜くことは慣れが必要だ。次からは慣れるための訓練を行う」","en":"“Good. Looks like you’ve more or less learned how to use it. That’s good enough. The actual plan will have you fire from much closer, so hitting the target itself will be easy. ...But calmly putting a bullet through a human being takes practice. From now on, you’ll train to get used to that.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エリオット・ネス","displayName":"Eliot Ness","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r401","rowIndex":401,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　はしゃぐ<tips=82>広美</tips>に、<tips=23>エリオット</tips>はそうやってたしなめ、その次からは空き缶ではなく人型を描いた板の中心部分を撃ち抜く練習に切り換えた。","en":"<tips=23>Elliott</tips> cautioned the excited <tips=82>Hiromi</tips> in this way. From the next session on, he replaced the empty cans with boards painted with human silhouettes and had her practice shooting them in the center.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r402","rowIndex":402,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そうやって着々と準備を進めていると、思わぬ出会いがあった。","en":"As they proceeded steadily with their preparations, they had an unexpected encounter.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r403","rowIndex":403,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　酒場で飲んで情報収集をしている時のことである。ターゲットである<tips=10>見土道夫</tips>の方が仲間を引き連れてやって来た。","en":"It happened while Elliott was drinking in a bar and gathering information. Their target, <tips=10>Michio Mido</tips>, came in with several companions.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r404","rowIndex":404,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼は、とあるサイキックの命を狙っていて、それを倒すために手伝って欲しいと依頼をしに来たのであった。","en":"Michio had come to ask for Elliott’s help in killing a certain psychic.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r405","rowIndex":405,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=23>エリオット</tips>は内心おかしかったが、それを態度には出さずに対応した。","en":"<tips=23>Elliott</tips> was privately amused, but allowed none of it to appear in his manner.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r406","rowIndex":406,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"（これは何か大きな動きがあるな）","en":"(Something big is afoot.)","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r407","rowIndex":407,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=10>道夫</tips>の張り詰めた態度を見て彼が予測したことは当たっていた。","en":"The tension in <tips=10>Michio’s</tips> manner told him that his hunch was right.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r408","rowIndex":408,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それから数日後に、<tips=10>見土道夫</tips>と彼の<tips=47>解放軍</tips>はクーデターを行い、それまで<tips=21>八龍会</tips>を牛耳っていた<tips=22>老人たち</tips>を追放し、かわって自分がリーダーとなった。","en":"Several days later, <tips=10>Michio Mido</tips> and his <tips=47>Liberation Army</tips> staged a coup, expelled the <tips=22>old men</tips> who had controlled the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips> until then, and took over with Michio as leader.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r409","rowIndex":409,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして、そのすぐ後に、<tips=10>道夫</tips>の就任を祝うパーティが行われるという情報が<tips=21>八龍会</tips>じゅうに出回ったのを掴んだ。<tips=23>エリオット</tips>はこれをチャンスと考え、パーティ会場の見取り図を手に入れ、作戦をたてた。","en":"Soon afterward, word of a party celebrating <tips=10>Michio’s</tips> appointment circulated throughout the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips>. <tips=23>Elliott</tips> saw his opportunity, obtained a floor plan of the venue, and devised the operation.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r410","rowIndex":410,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「狙いは<tips=10>見土道夫</tips>ただ一人だ。病院襲撃のリーダー、つまり、あんたの大好きなノウミさんとやらの死はこいつに全責任がある。現場には他にもむかつくやつがいるかもしれないが、それには目もくれるな。標的を仕留めたらすぐに脱出しろ。でなければお前が生還することは不可能だ」","en":"“Your one and only target is <tips=10>Michio Mido</tips>. He led the attack on the hospital, so he bears full responsibility for the death of that beloved Ms. Nomi of yours. There may be other people there who piss you off, but don’t even look at them. Once you’ve taken out the target, get out immediately. Otherwise, you won’t make it back alive.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エリオット・ネス","displayName":"Eliot Ness","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r411","rowIndex":411,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=23>エリオット</tips>はその図面を広げながら<tips=82>広美</tips>に説明をした。","en":"<tips=23>Elliott</tips> spread out the floor plan as he explained it to <tips=82>Hiromi</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r412","rowIndex":412,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　作戦を立て、訓練はするが当日は手を貸さないという約束である。","en":"Their agreement was that he would design the operation and train her, but provide no assistance upon the day itself.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r413","rowIndex":413,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「特別な設備のない普通の住宅だ。周りには高い建物もいくつかある。本来ならばそこから狙撃をするのがベストだがお前さんにはその技術がない。なかに潜入して至近距離でやるのが一番確実だ」","en":"“It’s an ordinary house with no special facilities. There are several tall buildings nearby. Ideally, you’d snipe him from one of them, but you don’t have the skill. Infiltrating the house and doing it at close range will be the surest way.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エリオット・ネス","displayName":"Eliot Ness","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r414","rowIndex":414,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　初めて具体的な作戦を聞かされ、<tips=82>広美</tips>は緊張しながらごくりと生唾を飲み込んだ。","en":"Hearing the concrete plan for the first time, <tips=82>Hiromi</tips> swallowed nervously.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r415","rowIndex":415,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=21>八龍会</tips>には街を出ていったものたちを調査する能力がなく、患者たちのその後のことは把握していない。だからお前さんは、無事家族のところへ戻れたから、その感謝のために<tips=10>見土道夫</tips>に花束を渡しに来たという設定で会場に入る。その花束のなかに拳銃を仕込むんだ」","en":"“The <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips> has no way to investigate people who have left the city, so it has no idea what became of the patients. You’ll enter the venue claiming that you made it safely back to your family and came to present <tips=10>Michio Mido</tips> with a bouquet in gratitude. You’ll hide the handgun inside it.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エリオット・ネス","displayName":"Eliot Ness","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r416","rowIndex":416,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=82>広美</tips>と対照的に<tips=23>エリオット</tips>は普段と変わらないゆったりとした態度で、煙草をくゆらせながら話している。","en":"In contrast to <tips=82>Hiromi</tips>, <tips=23>Elliott</tips> spoke with his usual easy manner, smoking a cigarette as though nothing had changed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r417","rowIndex":417,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「誰かが花束を預かると言っても、絶対に<tips=10>見土道夫</tips>に直接渡したいと主張するんだ。何しろ大切な恩人への感謝の気持ちだからな。そうして渡す場面になったら引き金を引く。銃はその場で捨てろ。銃はおれの独自ルートで仕入れるから、拾われても足はつかない」","en":"“Even if someone offers to take the bouquet, insist that you absolutely must give it directly to <tips=10>Michio Mido</tips>. After all, it’s your expression of gratitude to an important benefactor. When the moment comes to hand it over, pull the trigger. Drop the gun there. I’ll acquire it through a private channel of my own, so even if they recover it, they won’t be able to trace it.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エリオット・ネス","displayName":"Eliot Ness","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r418","rowIndex":418,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それから彼は図面を指でさして、逃走のためのルートを伝える。","en":"Then he pointed to the floor plan and explained the escape route.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r419","rowIndex":419,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「こういうゆるい場所への潜入は目的達成まではそう難しくないが、警備の決まり事がない分紛れが多く安全な脱出が難しい。いくつかルートはあるが、そのなかから最適と思われるルートをその場で判断するんだ。状況ごとの判断基準はこれからみっちりとたたき込むからな。……そして建物を出たらそのまま街を出ろ。信頼出来る人間を用意している。そいつが安全なところまで送ってくれるから、あとは好きに暮らすんだ」","en":"“Getting into a loosely secured place like this and accomplishing your objective isn’t especially difficult. But with no set security procedures, there’s more room for the unexpected, which makes getting out safely harder. There are several routes. You’ll have to judge the situation on the spot and choose whichever seems best. I’ll drill the criteria for every situation into you before then. ...And once you’re out of the building, leave the city immediately. I’ve arranged for someone trustworthy. They’ll take you somewhere safe. After that, live however you like.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エリオット・ネス","displayName":"Eliot Ness","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r420","rowIndex":420,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「安全なところって？」","en":"“Somewhere safe?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"内田広美（患者のＵ）","displayName":"Hiromi Uchida (Patient U)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r421","rowIndex":421,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「その時になればわかる」","en":"“You’ll know when the time comes.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エリオット・ネス","displayName":"Eliot Ness","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r422","rowIndex":422,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……」","en":"“...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"内田広美（患者のＵ）","displayName":"Hiromi Uchida (Patient U)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r423","rowIndex":423,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「おれは当日会場を見下ろせる場所から<tips=10>見土</tips>の動きを見て、お前さんが潜入するタイミングを指示する。手を貸すのはそこまでだ。そこから先は一人でやるんだ。たとえ失敗しても何もしない。お前さんの復讐だからな」","en":"“On the day itself, I’ll watch <tips=10>Mido</tips> from a place overlooking the venue and tell you when to infiltrate. That’s the limit of my help. From there, you’re alone. Even if you fail, I’ll do nothing. This is your revenge.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エリオット・ネス","displayName":"Eliot Ness","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r424","rowIndex":424,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「大丈夫です。こんなにいろいろしてくれて、ありがとうございます」","en":"“I’ll be all right. Thank you for doing so much for me.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"内田広美（患者のＵ）","displayName":"Hiromi Uchida (Patient U)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r425","rowIndex":425,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=82>広美</tips>が礼儀正しく頭を下げると、<tips=23>エリオット</tips>は無表情のまま鼻を掻き、","en":"When <tips=82>Hiromi</tips> bowed politely, <tips=23>Elliott</tips> scratched his nose, his face expressionless.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r426","rowIndex":426,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「最終確認だ。失敗すれば死ぬ。成功しても得るものはなく、殺人者の肩書きを得るだけのばかげた作戦だ。おれならこんなことはしないが、それでもやるんだな？」","en":"“One final confirmation. If you fail, you die. Even if you succeed, you gain nothing but the title of murderer. It’s an absurd operation. I wouldn’t do it. You’re still going through with it?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エリオット・ネス","displayName":"Eliot Ness","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r427","rowIndex":427,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「はい」","en":"“Yes.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"内田広美（患者のＵ）","displayName":"Hiromi Uchida (Patient U)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r428","rowIndex":428,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=82>広美</tips>は間をおかずに<tips=23>エリオット</tips>の目を見つめながらそう答えた。","en":"<tips=82>Hiromi</tips> answered without a moment’s pause, looking directly into <tips=23>Elliott’s</tips> eyes.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r429","rowIndex":429,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「無意味なことをするもんだ。後悔するぜ」","en":"“What a meaningless thing to do. You’ll regret it.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エリオット・ネス","displayName":"Eliot Ness","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r430","rowIndex":430,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「変なこといいますね」","en":"“That’s a funny thing for you to say.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"内田広美（患者のＵ）","displayName":"Hiromi Uchida (Patient U)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r431","rowIndex":431,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=82>広美</tips>は首をかしげる。","en":"<tips=82>Hiromi</tips> tilted her head.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r432","rowIndex":432,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「何が」","en":"“What is?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エリオット・ネス","displayName":"Eliot Ness","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r433","rowIndex":433,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=23>エリオット</tips>さんだって、なんの得もないのに、私にこうまでしてくれてるじゃないですか」","en":"“You’ve done all this for me even though there’s nothing in it for you either, <tips=23>Elliott</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"内田広美（患者のＵ）","displayName":"Hiromi Uchida (Patient U)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r434","rowIndex":434,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ふん」","en":"“Hmph.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エリオット・ネス","displayName":"Eliot Ness","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r435","rowIndex":435,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=23>エリオット</tips>はつまらなそうに肩をすくめて、","en":"<tips=23>Elliott</tips> shrugged, looking bored.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r436","rowIndex":436,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「おれはいいのさ。バーで朝から酒を飲むのも、こうしてお前さんの自殺を手伝うのも、どっちも大して変わりはしないからな」","en":"“I’m different. Drinking in a bar from morning on, helping you kill yourself like this—it’s all much the same to me.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エリオット・ネス","displayName":"Eliot Ness","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r437","rowIndex":437,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そしてその運命の日がやって来た。","en":"And so the fateful day arrived.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r438","rowIndex":438,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=21>八龍会</tips>が若きリーダーを祝福するその会場で、その時何が起きたのかは改めて詳細を記すまでもないだろう。","en":"There is presumably no need to give another detailed account of what occurred at the celebration for the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society’s</tips> young leader.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r439","rowIndex":439,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　近くの連れ込み宿で目的の部屋の女を指名した<tips=23>エリオット</tips>は、女に手をつけずに酒ばかり飲みながらチラチラと雨の降る窓の外の景色ばかり気にしていた。","en":"At a nearby brothel, <tips=23>Elliott</tips> requested the woman assigned to the room he needed. He never touched her. He merely drank, his eyes repeatedly straying toward the rain beyond the window.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r440","rowIndex":440,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「もう、何しに来たんですか？」","en":"“Why did you even come here?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r441","rowIndex":441,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　呆れる女にチップを握らせて黙らせると、今度は携帯電話を手に取ってどこかへメールを送る。","en":"He pressed a tip into the exasperated woman’s hand to silence her, then picked up his cell phone and sent a message to someone.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r442","rowIndex":442,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　これが<tips=82>広美</tips>への合図だった。","en":"This was the signal for <tips=82>Hiromi</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r443","rowIndex":443,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　パーティに参加をするための華やかな服を着た<tips=82>広美</tips>は、花束を握ったまま、受付に向かう。","en":"Dressed in finery for the party, <tips=82>Hiromi</tips> approached the reception desk with the bouquet in hand.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r444","rowIndex":444,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　特に疑われることもなくなかに通されると、付近の人間に場所を聞いて、標的となる<tips=10>見土道夫</tips>を探した。","en":"She was admitted without arousing any particular suspicion. After asking someone nearby where to find him, she went in search of her target, <tips=10>Michio Mido</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r445","rowIndex":445,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼は建物の二階で一人休んでいるということだった。","en":"She was told that he was resting alone on the second floor of the building.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r446","rowIndex":446,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　建物に入るころまでは心臓がバクバクし、目眩がしそうだったが、実際<tips=10>道夫</tips>の目の前に立つと思いのほか冷静だった。","en":"Her heart had pounded so violently on the way into the building that she nearly grew dizzy. Once she stood before <tips=10>Michio</tips> himself, however, she was calmer than expected.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r447","rowIndex":447,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=23>エリオット</tips>が前もって教育したいくつもの注意点を頭のなかで反芻し、そのとおり実行するのに集中していたおかげで、余計なことを考えないで済んだのだろう。","en":"She mentally rehearsed the many precautions <tips=23>Elliott</tips> had drilled into her beforehand and focused on carrying them out exactly as instructed. That was probably what kept her from thinking about anything else.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r448","rowIndex":448,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　花束のなかの音のしない拳銃で言われたとおり二回連続で引き金を引く。","en":"As instructed, she pulled the trigger of the silenced pistol inside the bouquet twice in quick succession.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r449","rowIndex":449,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　消音や小型化のために機能の大半を割いたその武器は、威力は高くはないが、手の届くような距離から二回胴体に命中させれば充分殺傷力を発揮する。","en":"Most of the weapon’s design had been devoted to suppressing its report and reducing its size, so it was not especially powerful. But two shots to the torso from within arm’s reach were more than lethal enough.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r450","rowIndex":450,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　前のめりに倒れて動かなくなった<tips=10>見土道夫</tips>の身体の下からじんわりと血がにじむのを確認してから、花束ごと銃を捨ててその場を去る。誰にも見られなかったし、まだ殺害を悟られてはいないはずだ。","en":"After confirming that blood was slowly spreading beneath <tips=10>Michio Mido</tips>, who had slumped forward and stopped moving, she discarded the gun with the bouquet and left. No one had seen her, and no one should yet have realized that a murder had taken place.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r451","rowIndex":451,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　こういうときは異変を気づかれぬよう、駆け出したりしないで自然に歩いたほうがいいと<tips=23>エリオット</tips>から何度も念を押されている。","en":"<tips=23>Elliott</tips> had impressed upon her again and again that at a time like this, she must not break into a run; she should walk naturally so no one sensed anything amiss.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r452","rowIndex":452,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　殺人を終えても<tips=82>広美</tips>は取り乱してはいなかった。","en":"<tips=82>Hiromi</tips> did not lose control after the killing.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r453","rowIndex":453,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　なぜか、子供のときに映画などで見た殺人のシーンを思い出した。冷静な殺し屋や、気が動転して手がプルプルと震える女など、いろいろなパターンがあったが、実際にやってみるとそんな劇的な変化は自分に訪れなかった。","en":"For some reason, she remembered murder scenes from movies she had seen as a child. There had been all kinds: coolheaded killers, distraught women whose hands trembled uncontrollably. But now that she had actually done it, no such dramatic change came over her.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r454","rowIndex":454,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"（案外簡単だな。<tips=23>エリオット</tips>さんの言う通りだった）","en":"(That was surprisingly easy. <tips=23>Elliott</tips> was right.)","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r455","rowIndex":455,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　というのが<tips=82>広美</tips>の感想だった。","en":"This was <tips=82>Hiromi’s</tips> reaction.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r456","rowIndex":456,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして、こんな簡単なことで親しかったあの職員たちの命が奪われ、彼らはもう永遠に笑うことも喋ることも美味しいお菓子を食べることもペットの散歩をすることも夏の暑さに悩まされることも出来なくなったのかと思うと、人間というか、世の中の何もかもがすべて馬鹿馬鹿しいような気持ちになった。","en":"Such a simple act had taken the lives of those staff members she had known so well. Never again would they laugh or talk, eat delicious sweets, walk their pets, or suffer through the summer heat. The thought made all of humanity—or rather, everything in the world—seem utterly absurd.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r457","rowIndex":457,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　階段を下りたところで、<tips=47>解放軍</tips>の女幹部であり、あの日も病院にいた人物――<tips=67>カミラ</tips>が立っていた。","en":"At the foot of the stairs stood <tips=67>Camilla</tips>, a senior female officer of the <tips=47>Liberation Army</tips> who had also been at the hospital that day.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r458","rowIndex":458,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「花束は渡せた？」","en":"“Were you able to give him the flowers?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"カミラ","displayName":"Camilla","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r459","rowIndex":459,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=67>カミラ</tips>がそう訊ねるのに、","en":"<tips=67>Camilla</tips> asked.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r460","rowIndex":460,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「はい、喜んでくれました」","en":"“Yes. He was very pleased.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r461","rowIndex":461,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=82>広美</tips>は平然とした笑顔で言った。","en":"<tips=82>Hiromi</tips> answered with a perfectly composed smile.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r462","rowIndex":462,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　誰がどう見ても、いま人を殺したとは思えない表情だった。","en":"No one looking upon that face would have imagined that she had just killed a man.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r463","rowIndex":463,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その顔をいくら見ても、誰にも彼女が嘘をついているとは見抜けなかっただろう。しかし、<tips=82>広美</tips>は一つミスをしていた。自分の白いスカートの端に<tips=10>道夫</tips>の血が付着しているのに気がついていなかったのだ。","en":"No matter how closely anyone studied her face, they would never have detected the lie. But <tips=82>Hiromi</tips> had made one mistake: she had failed to notice <tips=10>Michio’s</tips> blood on the hem of her white skirt.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r464","rowIndex":464,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=67>カミラ</tips>はそれを見て顔色を変える。","en":"The moment <tips=67>Camilla</tips> saw it, the color left her face.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r465","rowIndex":465,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=82>広美</tips>はその表情の変化を見て、それによって視線の先の血に気がつき、すぐに駆け出す。","en":"<tips=82>Hiromi</tips> saw Camilla’s expression change, followed her gaze, and noticed the blood. She immediately broke into a run.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r466","rowIndex":466,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「誰か、その子を捕まえて！」","en":"“Someone catch that girl!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"カミラ","displayName":"Camilla","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r467","rowIndex":467,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=67>カミラ</tips>はそう叫んでから、自分は階段の上の<tips=10>道夫</tips>の元へ向かった。","en":"After shouting the order, <tips=67>Camilla</tips> herself hurried upstairs toward <tips=10>Michio</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r468","rowIndex":468,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　部下たちがその突然の叫びに反応し、会場がにわかに騒然としたときには、<tips=82>広美</tips>の身体は玄関の外へ飛び出そうとしている。","en":"Camilla’s subordinates reacted to her sudden shout, and by the time the venue erupted into confusion, <tips=82>Hiromi</tips> was already bursting through the front door.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r469","rowIndex":469,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　部下たちは金色の目を光らせ、<tips=46>ネオ・ローズ</tips>によって引き出された<tips=17>タイプB</tips>の脚力で<tips=82>広美</tips>を追う。単純な脚力では<tips=82>広美</tips>の方が劣ったが、人混みのなか玄関から外へ出て、入り口をくぐり抜けるまでは身体が小さく小回りがきく<tips=82>広美</tips>の方が有利だった。","en":"The subordinates’ eyes shone gold as they chased <tips=82>Hiromi</tips> with the <tips=17>Type B</tips> speed brought out by <tips=46>Neo Rose</tips>. In a straight race <tips=82>Hiromi</tips> was slower, but in the crush between the front door and the entrance, <tips=82>Hiromi’s</tips> small size and agility gave her the advantage.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r470","rowIndex":470,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　けれど、通りに出て直線になるとそれもかなわない。","en":"Once she reached the open street and the route became straight, however, that advantage disappeared.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r471","rowIndex":471,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　身体の小ささを活かして狭い裏路地に逃げ込む。","en":"Using her small size to advantage, she fled into a narrow back alley.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r472","rowIndex":472,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そうしてアスファルトの上、息を弾ませて走る<tips=82>広美</tips>に、<tips=47>解放軍</tips>の二人の男がついに追いついて、その肩に手をかけた。","en":"As <tips=82>Hiromi</tips> ran panting over the asphalt, two men from the <tips=47>Liberation Army</tips> finally caught up with her and grabbed her by the shoulder.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r473","rowIndex":473,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「やめてっ！」","en":"“Stop!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"内田広美（患者のＵ）","displayName":"Hiromi Uchida (Patient U)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r474","rowIndex":474,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　振り払おうとする<tips=82>広美</tips>の手はもう一人の男に捕まれ、取り押さえられる。","en":"<tips=82>Hiromi</tips> tried to shake them off. One of the men seized her hand, and together they restrained her.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r475","rowIndex":475,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「おい、お前……」","en":"“You...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r476","rowIndex":476,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　男が血走った目を<tips=82>広美</tips>に向けたとき、その顔面で血がはじけた。","en":"As one man turned his bloodshot eyes on <tips=82>Hiromi</tips>, blood burst from his face.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r477","rowIndex":477,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして次の瞬間には、もう一人の男も血を吹いて倒れている。","en":"An instant later, the other man too spurted blood and collapsed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r478","rowIndex":478,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　二人がドサリとその場に倒れた。","en":"Both bodies struck the ground heavily.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r479","rowIndex":479,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「よくやったじゃないか」","en":"“You did well.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エリオット・ネス","displayName":"Eliot Ness","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r480","rowIndex":480,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その声で前を見ると、いつの間にか姿を現した<tips=23>エリオット</tips>が銃を握って笑っていた。","en":"At the sound of his voice, she looked ahead and saw <tips=23>Elliott</tips>, who had appeared from nowhere, smiling with a gun in his hand.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r481","rowIndex":481,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=23>エリオット</tips>さん、やりました！　私、やりとげたんです！」","en":"“<tips=23>Elliott</tips>, I did it! I really did it!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"内田広美（患者のＵ）","displayName":"Hiromi Uchida (Patient U)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r482","rowIndex":482,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=82>広美</tips>は<tips=23>エリオット</tips>に駆けつけると、飛び上がってその身体に抱きついた。","en":"<tips=82>Hiromi</tips> ran to <tips=23>Elliott</tips>, leapt, and flung her arms around him.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r483","rowIndex":483,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「人生で、なにかを成功させたのはじめて！」","en":"“This is the first time in my life I’ve ever succeeded at anything!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"内田広美（患者のＵ）","displayName":"Hiromi Uchida (Patient U)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r484","rowIndex":484,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女は返り血で汚れる顔に、今初めての殺人を犯したばかりとは思えない屈託のない笑みを浮かべた。","en":"Her face was spattered with blood, yet she wore a carefree smile no one would have expected from someone who had just committed her first murder.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r485","rowIndex":485,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「お前、意外とセンスがあるのかもな」","en":"“You may have more of a gift for this than I expected.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エリオット・ネス","displayName":"Eliot Ness","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r486","rowIndex":486,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=23>エリオット</tips>は苦笑しながら、子犬のように顔を擦り付けようとする<tips=82>広美</tips>の額を手のひらで押して、その身体を引きはがすと、","en":"With a wry smile, <tips=23>Elliott</tips> planted a palm on <tips=82>Hiromi’s</tips> forehead and peeled her off him as she tried to nuzzle him like a puppy.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r487","rowIndex":487,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ようこそ、全てに価値がない世界へ」","en":"“Welcome to a world where nothing has value.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エリオット・ネス","displayName":"Eliot Ness","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r488","rowIndex":488,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　あらためて<tips=82>広美</tips>に左手をさしのべた。","en":"He extended his left hand to <tips=82>Hiromi</tips> once more.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r489","rowIndex":489,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ありがとう」","en":"“Thank you.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"内田広美（患者のＵ）","displayName":"Hiromi Uchida (Patient U)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r490","rowIndex":490,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女は笑みを崩さぬまま、その上に自分の細く小さな指を乗せた。","en":"Her smile never faltered as she laid her slender little fingers in his hand.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X15-2:r491","rowIndex":491,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そしてそのまま二人は歩き出し、<tips=9>Y地区</tips>の雑踏のなかへ消えて行った。","en":"Then the two walked off together and disappeared into the crowds of <tips=9>Y District</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}}]},{"position":56,"code":"a8","unitId":"a8","rows":[{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r1","rowIndex":1,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　画面には自室で椅子に座る<tips=34>ダリオ・ボネット</tips>の姿が捉えられている。","en":"The screen shows <tips=34>Dario Bonetto</tips> seated in a chair in his own room.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r2","rowIndex":2,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　顎の下にたっぷり脂肪を蓄えた、そのイタリア人は沈鬱な表情でカメラを見つめていた。","en":"The Italian, with a generous store of fat beneath his chin, stares gloomily into the camera.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r3","rowIndex":3,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ニスで艶やかな光沢を放つ木目の机の上に置かれた手のそばには拳銃がある。","en":"A pistol lies beside the hand resting upon a wood-grain desk whose varnish shines with a rich gloss.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r4","rowIndex":4,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　これはつい先ほど自殺した彼が最後に残した映像だった。","en":"This is the final recording left by the man who killed himself only moments ago.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r5","rowIndex":5,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「先ほど<tips=81>龍頭</tips>から<tips=41>グランドタワー</tips>に来るよう連絡がありました。おそらく、計画があきらかになってしまったのでしょう。……まったく、三代目<tips=81>龍頭</tips>のお手並みというのは鮮やかなものです。こんなに早く情報を抜かれたのは初めてです。それとも、年をとって私の手腕が衰えたのか。……まあいずれにしろ、我々の時代は終わったということです」","en":"“A short while ago, I received word from the <tips=81>Longtou</tips> to come to <tips=41>Grand Tower</tips>. I imagine the plan has been discovered. ...Truly, the Third <tips=81>Longtou’s</tips> work is remarkably deft. Never before has my information been compromised so quickly. Or perhaps age has dulled my abilities. ...At any rate, our era has come to an end.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r6","rowIndex":6,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=34>ダリオ</tips>はそう言って不敵に笑った。","en":"With that, <tips=34>Dario</tips> gives a defiant smile.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r7","rowIndex":7,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　普段は落ち着きがなく大した人物にも見えない男だが、今の彼はかつて暗黒街を謀略と暗殺でのし上がったという経歴どおりの人間に見えた。おそらくこちらが本来の彼の姿なのだろう。","en":"Ordinarily he is a restless man who scarcely looks like anyone of consequence. Now, however, he appears every inch the figure who reportedly climbed through the underworld by intrigue and assassination. This is probably his true self.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r8","rowIndex":8,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして彼が口にしている『計画』というのもその経歴通りのもので、つまり三代目<tips=81>龍頭</tips>であるこの僕を殺害するというものだった。","en":"The ‘plan’ of which he spoke was equally true to that history: the assassination of me, the Third <tips=81>Longtou</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r9","rowIndex":9,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=34>ダリオ・ボネット</tips>が裏で<tips=21>八龍会</tips>と連絡を取り、何かこそこそとした動きをしているようだ、という情報は同じ<tips=59>暗闇通り</tips>を根城にする<tips=33>壬生屋タカシ</tips>が初めにもたらした。","en":"The first report that <tips=34>Dario Bonetto</tips> was in covert contact with the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips> and appeared to be furtively plotting something came from <tips=33>Takashi Mibuya</tips>, who also made his base on <tips=59>Darkness Street</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r10","rowIndex":10,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　この若い幹部――といっても僕より年上だが――は、以前より<tips=34>ダリオ</tips>とは不仲であったが、さすがにこの時ばかりはライバルの失脚を喜ぶ様子は見せなかった。","en":"This young officer—young, though still older than I am—had long been on bad terms with <tips=34>Dario</tips>, but even now he showed no pleasure at his rival’s downfall.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r11","rowIndex":11,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ロクなやつじゃないんですよ。父も、あいつだけは信用してはいけないとよく言っていたものです。……しかし、<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>に対してこんな裏切りをするとは思いませんでした」","en":"“He’s no good. My father was always telling me that Dario was the one man I must never trust. ...But I never imagined he would betray <tips=7>YS</tips> like this.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r12","rowIndex":12,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　もちろん、この<tips=33>壬生屋</tips>の報告が全てだったわけではない。<tips=21>八龍会</tips>との関係が悪化し始めてから、組織内の人物の動向、特に<tips=17>タイプB</tips>とのかかわりが深いものについては監視を強化している。そうした方面からも、<tips=34>ダリオ</tips>の動きについてはいくつかの報告が入っていた。","en":"Of course, <tips=33>Mibuya’s</tips> report was not our only evidence. Ever since relations with the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips> began to deteriorate, we had intensified our surveillance of people within the organization, particularly those with close ties to <tips=17>Type B</tips>. Several reports on <tips=34>Dario’s</tips> movements had also come in through those channels.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r13","rowIndex":13,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それを元に<tips=25>世傑</tips>を使ったり、<tips=40>黄姉妹</tips>や他の何人かのサイキック能力を用いたりして調査を進め、最終的には<tips=34>ダリオ</tips>の腹心であるラパロという男を捕まえ、暴力を用いてその口から語らせた言葉によって、計画の全てが明るみに出ることになる。<tips=41>グランドタワー</tips>に住む幹部の家族たちを用いた巧妙な毒殺計画で、念のはいった仕掛けに僕も感心したものだが、ただ感心してばかりもいられない。<tips=81>龍頭</tips>としてしかるべき処置もとらねばならなかった。","en":"Using that information as our starting point, I put <tips=25>Sai-kit</tips> to work and employed the psychic abilities of the <tips=40>Wong sisters</tips> and several others to advance the investigation. At last we captured a man named Laparo, one of <tips=34>Dario’s</tips> closest confidants, and used violence to make him talk, bringing the entire plan to light. It was an ingenious assassination-by-poison scheme using the families of the officers who lived in <tips=41>Grand Tower</tips>. Its thoroughness impressed even me, but I could not simply stand there admiring it. As <tips=81>Longtou</tips>, I had to take the appropriate measures.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r14","rowIndex":14,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして、<tips=34>ダリオ</tips>に召喚のメッセージを送ったのである。","en":"And so I sent <tips=34>Dario</tips> the summons.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r15","rowIndex":15,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「他の暗殺計画者のように、その寝込みを襲撃するのではなく、こうして<tips=41>グランドタワー</tips>に呼び出して頂けたのは、幹部としての私の立場に対する配慮というわけですかな？」","en":"“Was I summoned here to <tips=41>Grand Tower</tips>, rather than attacked in my sleep like the other conspirators, out of consideration for my position as an officer?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r16","rowIndex":16,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　映像のなかの<tips=34>ダリオ</tips>は薄く笑ったが、さすがに緊張でどこか引きつっている。","en":"<tips=34>Dario</tips> wears a faint smile in the recording, though even he looks somewhat drawn by tension.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r17","rowIndex":17,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「罪人のように撃ち殺されるのではなく、尊厳によって自分の足で出頭しろということですか。なかなか痛み入る配慮ですが、わざわざそちらまで死刑宣告を聞きに行くのも癪だ。かといって、我々が<tips=81>龍頭</tips>と正面切って戦う力がないのもわかりきっています。だから、もっと誇り高き手段を選ぶことにしました」","en":"“Rather than have me shot down like a criminal, you offer me the dignity of presenting myself on my own two feet—is that it? I am deeply obliged by such consideration, but I have no desire to go all that way merely to hear my death sentence. At the same time, I understand perfectly well that we lack the strength to face the <tips=81>Longtou</tips> openly. I have therefore chosen a prouder course.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r18","rowIndex":18,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そこまで言って<tips=34>ダリオ</tips>はチラとテーブルの上の拳銃に視線をやったが、まだ手を伸ばしはしなかった。","en":"Having said that, <tips=34>Dario</tips> glances at the pistol on the table but does not yet reach for it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r19","rowIndex":19,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして再び視線をカメラに戻し、","en":"Then he returns his gaze to the camera and continues:","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r20","rowIndex":20,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ＹＳは一体どこへ行こうとしているのでしょうか？　元々この組織は、やくざと手を組んだ<tips=18>ローズ・クラブ</tips>という、<tips=9>Y地区</tips>全体を揺るがす恐ろしい脅威に対抗するため、初代<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>が呼びかけて生まれたものでした。今はさしたる脅威もありません。本来ならもう役目を終えて、故<tips=35>フェルナンデス</tips>氏がそうしたように、<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>を離脱してそれぞれのファミリーの元の姿に戻るべきなのです。しかし、<tips=81>龍頭</tips>は組織そのものを変えて、一つの大きなファミリーにしようとしているわけですな……」","en":"“Where, exactly, is YS trying to go? This organization was originally born when its first leader, <tips=3>Chris Tse</tips>, called for resistance against the <tips=18>Rose Club</tips> and its yakuza allies—a terrible threat to the whole of <tips=9>Y District</tips>. Now, no grave threat remains. Properly speaking, our purpose has ended; we should follow the late Mr. <tips=35>Fernandes’s</tips> example, leave <tips=7>YS</tips>, and return to our original form as separate Families. Yet the <tips=81>Longtou</tips> is trying to transform the organization itself into one vast Family...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r21","rowIndex":21,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=34>ダリオ</tips>は顔を不快げに歪める。","en":"<tips=34>Dario’s</tips> face twists with displeasure.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r22","rowIndex":22,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=81>龍頭</tips>はあまりにも多くの仲間を殺し過ぎました。ご自身の親戚や、初代の義兄弟だった<tips=4>馬明</tips>までも処刑するとは、正気の沙汰じゃない。……私もずいぶんと手を汚してきましたが、しかし、自分のファミリーを手にかけたことはありません。あなたは身内ばかり殺している。自分の理念のために。……ほとんど潔癖症と言うべきでしょう。それじゃあ、この先長続きしません。<tips=81>龍頭</tips>は多少目端は利くようですが、いかんせん経験が足りないようですな」","en":"“The <tips=81>Longtou</tips> has killed far too many of his own comrades. Executing even his own relatives and <tips=4>Ma Ming</tips>, who was the First Longtou’s sworn brother, is sheer madness. ...I have dirtied my hands plenty myself, but I have never killed anyone in my own Family. You kill nothing but your own people. For the sake of your ideals. ...One might almost call it an obsession with purity. You will not last long that way. The <tips=81>Longtou</tips> may have a reasonably sharp eye, but he plainly lacks experience.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r23","rowIndex":23,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=34>ダリオ</tips>は何度も何度も頭を振って溜息をつく。","en":"<tips=34>Dario</tips> shakes his head again and again, sighing.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r24","rowIndex":24,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「初代のやり方が、私にはあっていたんですよ。……<tips=9>Y地区</tips>は活気づき、<tips=59>暗闇通り</tips>にも娯楽施設が増え、私のカジノも昔ほどは利益を生み出さなくなりました。ご存じの通り、<tips=59>暗闇通り</tips>には<tips=17>タイプB</tips>が多く、私の組織は<tips=21>八龍会</tips>を敵にまわしてはやっていけません。いやむしろ、<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>よりも古く長いつき合いなのです。それが、ここへきて<tips=21>八龍会</tips>との関係の悪化。……初代はこの組織が連合であることを理解し、我々の細かい事情を考えて組織の方針を決めてくれたものですが、<tips=81>龍頭</tips>はそうではありません。そもそも、<tips=21>八龍会</tips>と敵対するなど愚かなことです。確かに目先の争いでは負けることはないでしょうが、長い目で見れば組織を滅ぼすことになるでしょうね。……こう言うと、なぜ会議の場で言わなかったと言われそうですが、言っても無駄だと思いましてね」","en":"“The First Longtou’s methods suited me. ...<tips=9>Y District</tips> has flourished, entertainment venues have multiplied on <tips=59>Darkness Street</tips>, and my casinos no longer yield the profits they once did. As you know, <tips=59>Darkness Street</tips> is home to many <tips=17>Type Bs</tips>, and my organization cannot survive with the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips> as its enemy. In fact, our relationship with them is older and longer-standing than our relationship with <tips=7>YS</tips>. Yet now our relations with the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips> have deteriorated to this. ...The First Longtou understood that this organization was an alliance. He considered the particular circumstances of each of us when deciding its policy. The present <tips=81>Longtou</tips> does not. Indeed, antagonizing the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips> is foolish. We will undoubtedly win the immediate struggle, but in the long term, it will destroy the organization. ...I imagine you will ask why I said none of this in council. I believed that speaking would accomplish nothing.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r25","rowIndex":25,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=34>ダリオ</tips>は皮肉めいた笑みを浮かべる。","en":"<tips=34>Dario</tips> smiles sardonically.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r26","rowIndex":26,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「この辺りのダラダラ喋ってる部分は、公開版ではカットだな」","en":"“We’ll cut this part where he rambles on and on from the public version.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r27","rowIndex":27,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕はパソコンを操作する部下に指示を下した。このメガネをかけた金髪の青年はジャン・バラスコというまだ二十歳の人物で、<tips=59>暗闇通り</tips>に住む映画監督志望の若者だ。路上でクラック済みの無料通話が出来る携帯電話を販売したため<tips=33>壬生屋</tips>たちとトラブルになっていたが、なかなか有能そうなので組織に引き入れた。","en":"I give the instruction to the subordinate operating the computer. The bespectacled young blond man is Jean Balasco, a twenty-year-old aspiring film director who lives on <tips=59>Darkness Street</tips>. He ran into trouble with <tips=33>Mibuya’s</tips> people after selling cracked mobile phones capable of making free calls on the street, but he seemed talented enough that I brought him into the organization.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r28","rowIndex":28,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「名監督さん、不自然じゃないようにうまく繋いでくれよ」","en":"“Mr. Great Director, splice it so the cut looks natural.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r29","rowIndex":29,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ジャンは手元のメモにそれを書き込む。","en":"Jean jots that down in his notes.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r30","rowIndex":30,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼はギャングの手伝いをすることに不満もあるだろうが、僕のそばにいればショウビジネスの業界人と知り合う機会もあるから、そう損な役割でもないはずだ。","en":"He probably has his objections to helping gangsters, but staying close to me also gives him opportunities to meet people in show business. It can hardly be an entirely thankless position.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r31","rowIndex":31,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それにしても、<tips=34>ダリオ</tips>ってのは思った以上に女々しい男だね」","en":"“Still, <tips=34>Dario’s</tips> more of a whining coward than I ever imagined.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r32","rowIndex":32,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕はまだ組織への恨み辛みを語っている<tips=34>ダリオ</tips>の顔を見ながら顔をしかめる。","en":"I frown as I watch <tips=34>Dario</tips> continue airing his every grievance against the organization.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r33","rowIndex":33,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「陰湿でしつこいから、表で抗争せずに暗殺計画ばっかり立てて来たんでしょうきっと。若い連中は<tips=81>龍頭</tips>の方針にシビれてますよ。確かに厳しいですが、カッコイイですからね。それにあんたの下なら出世しやすいし」","en":"“All that brooding spite is probably why he’s always plotted assassinations instead of fighting openly. The young men are wild about your policies, <tips=81>Longtou</tips>. They’re harsh, yes, but they’re impressive. And under you, it’s easy to rise through the ranks.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r34","rowIndex":34,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=25>世傑</tips>は隣で無表情に立っていた。","en":"<tips=25>Sai-kit</tips> stands beside me without expression.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r35","rowIndex":35,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そうして眺めているうちに、画面のなかの一人舞台はクライマックスにさしかかろうとしている。","en":"As we watched, the one-man show on the screen approached its climax.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r36","rowIndex":36,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……どちらにせよ、もう私に逃げ道はありません。<tips=41>グランドタワー</tips>に出向いても、殺されるか、自殺を迫られるだけでしょう。そのような屈辱を受けるつもりはありません」","en":"“...In any event, I have nowhere left to run. If I go to <tips=41>Grand Tower</tips>, I will either be killed or compelled to take my own life. I do not intend to suffer such humiliation.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r37","rowIndex":37,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=34>ダリオ</tips>は顔を真っ赤にして拳銃を握りしめる。その手はブルブルと震えているのが見て取れた。","en":"His face crimson, <tips=34>Dario</tips> clutches the pistol. His hand is visibly trembling.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r38","rowIndex":38,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　唇をほとんど紫色になるほどぎゅっと引き結び、目を大きく丸く剥いて、そして相変わらず震え続けて落ち着かない銃口をこめかみに当てた。","en":"He presses his lips together until they have nearly turned purple, opens his eyes wide and round, and brings the still-shaking, wandering muzzle to his temple.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r39","rowIndex":39,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「さあ、幕を引け！　喜劇は終わりだ！」","en":"“Draw the curtain! The farce is played!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r40","rowIndex":40,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼は泡のような唾液を飛ばしながらフランソワ・ラブレーの名言を叫び、引き金を引く。","en":"Spraying foamy saliva, he shouts the saying attributed to François Rabelais and pulls the trigger.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r41","rowIndex":41,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　パンと音と共に銃口とこめかみの間が光って、頭の反対側から血が噴き出した。身体全体からだらんと力が抜け、仰向けにそった身体は一旦は背もたれの上でとどまりかけるが、摩擦はその体勢を保持するほどの力を持てず、結局ズルリと椅子の上から崩れ落ちて画面から消える。","en":"A sharp report sounds, and light flashes between the muzzle and his temple. Blood bursts from the opposite side of his head. His whole body goes slack. His backward-arching form seems for an instant to catch on the backrest, but friction is not enough to hold him there. He slides from the chair, collapses out of the frame, and disappears from the screen.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r42","rowIndex":42,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして、床に落下するドサリという音がきこえた。","en":"Then came the heavy thud of his body striking the floor.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r43","rowIndex":43,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　すぐに録画を停止するものがその場にいなかったらしく、その後も何もいない静かな空間を映し続けている。背後の壁は、バケツでぶちまけたように大量の血液が付着していた。","en":"Apparently, no one is there to stop the recording immediately, and it continues to show the silent, empty room. The wall behind him is drenched in blood as though someone had thrown a bucketful across it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r44","rowIndex":44,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「この十五分後に妻が部屋に入って来て悲鳴を上げ、ガヤガヤと使用人やら部下やらが動転している様子が続きます」","en":"“Fifteen minutes after this, his wife comes into the room and screams, followed by a great commotion among the servants and subordinates.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ジャン・バラスコ","displayName":"Jean Balasco","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r45","rowIndex":45,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ジャンはそう報告する。","en":"Jean reports.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r46","rowIndex":46,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「わかった。もう止めていい。自殺する瞬間の前後だけ切り取って公開用にしてくれ」","en":"“Understood. You can stop it. Use only the footage immediately before and after the suicide in the release version.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r47","rowIndex":47,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「わかりました」","en":"“All right.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ジャン・バラスコ","displayName":"Jean Balasco","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r48","rowIndex":48,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「悲惨な死を迎えるその表情をしっかり見せてやるんだ。もう誰も刃向かう気が起きないようにね」","en":"“Make sure they see his face as he meets that miserable death. That way, no one else will ever feel like defying us.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r49","rowIndex":49,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「はい」","en":"“Yes.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ジャン・バラスコ","displayName":"Jean Balasco","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r50","rowIndex":50,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そしてジャンは部屋を出て行った。彼がうまく動画を編集してくれたら、それを<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>のメンバーに送りつける。本来だったら反逆による死は全てのメンバーに告知されるところだが、今回は一応潔く自決という形をとったので一定の階級以上のものでいいだろう。","en":"Then Jean left the room. Once he had edited the video properly, we would send it to the members of <tips=7>YS</tips>. Ordinarily, every death for treason was announced to the entire membership. Dario had at least made a reasonably clean end of it by taking his own life, however, so distribution to those above a certain rank would suffice.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r51","rowIndex":51,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　これまでもこうした事件が起きるたびに、何度も繰り返し行ってきた手続きだ。<tips=34>ダリオ</tips>ほどの幹部となれば多少はざわつくかもしれないが大きな騒ぎにはならないだろう。彼のファミリーは既に大分縮小しており、すでに過去の人物と見られていた。","en":"This was a procedure I had followed time and again whenever such an incident occurred. The death of an officer as senior as <tips=34>Dario</tips> might create some stir, but probably no great disturbance. His Family had already shrunk considerably, and he was regarded as a man of the past.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r52","rowIndex":52,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　大半の関心は、彼のいた場所に誰が収まるかということに集まるはずだ。","en":"Most attention was bound to focus on who would take his place.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r53","rowIndex":53,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=34>ダリオ</tips>の死で一つ席が空いたわけだが、その席にはまた新たなものがつく。僕は縁故で人を昇進させないことは皆知っているから、自分の仕事に自信がある連中はみな期待して告知を待つことになるだろう。","en":"<tips=34>Dario’s</tips> death has left one seat vacant, but someone new will soon occupy it. Everyone knows that I do not promote people through personal connections, so all those confident in their work will wait eagerly for the announcement.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r54","rowIndex":54,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　今までもそうだった。<tips=35>フェルナンデス</tips>、<tips=4>馬明</tips>、<tips=39>ジェフリー</tips>といった、すでに姿を消した最高幹部の席にはもう新しい別の人物が就任し、違ったやりかたで組織を動かしはじめている。","en":"It had always been that way. New people had already taken the seats of vanished senior officers such as <tips=35>Fernandes</tips>, <tips=4>Ma Ming</tips>, and <tips=39>Jeffrey</tips>, and had begun directing the organization in different ways.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r55","rowIndex":55,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　気が付けば、父の頃とは幹部のメンツがガラリと変わってしまっている。","en":"Before I knew it, the entire roster of officers had changed completely since Father’s time.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r56","rowIndex":56,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=33>壬生屋タカシ</tips>と<tips=31>エリー・ホワイト</tips>は父の代からの幹部だが、彼らは僕には逆らわない。","en":"<tips=33>Takashi Mibuya</tips> and <tips=31>Ellie White</tips> have been officers since Father’s time, but neither of them opposes me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r57","rowIndex":57,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして新しく選ばれたメンツは、僕に抜擢されたことを誇りに思い、強い忠誠を誓っている。少なくとも今のところは。","en":"The newly selected officers, meanwhile, take pride in having been chosen by me and have pledged me their unwavering loyalty. At least for now.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r58","rowIndex":58,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　このメンバーなら、今までの古い連中のように僕を軽んじたりはしない。これでやっと僕は自分のチームを手に入れ、思うように仕事が出来るようになったというわけだ。","en":"With these people, I will not be treated lightly as I was by the old guard. At last, I have my own team and can work as I please.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r59","rowIndex":59,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ジャンがいなくなった後、<tips=41>グランドタワー</tips>最上階の僕の執務室に残ったのは、<tips=25>世傑</tips>と<tips=30>レイレイ</tips>と<tips=40>黄姉妹</tips>だった。彼らは僕が組織に加わった直後から支えてくれた、信頼出来る仲間たちだ。","en":"After Jean left, the only people remaining in my office on the top floor of <tips=41>Grand Tower</tips> were <tips=25>Sai-kit</tips>, <tips=30>Leilei</tips>, and the <tips=40>Wong sisters</tips>. They were trusted companions who had supported me from the moment I joined the organization.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r60","rowIndex":60,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕の喉が渇いたのを見計らって、<tips=30>レイレイ</tips>が湯気の立つコーヒーを運んでくれる。","en":"Noticing that I was thirsty, <tips=30>Leilei</tips> brought me a cup of steaming coffee.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r61","rowIndex":61,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　まだ日が高く、もちろん今日の仕事はこれで終わりではない。<tips=10>見土道夫</tips>が死んで、この街の情勢はまた変化しようとしている。それに対応して僕の仕事は増えていたし、いまの<tips=34>ダリオ</tips>の件のような<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>内部の仕事もある。簡単に片付くものもあれば、そうでないものもある。","en":"The sun was still high, and of course my work for the day was nowhere near finished. <tips=10>Michio Mido’s</tips> death was about to transform the situation in the city yet again. My workload had grown in response, and there was internal <tips=7>YS</tips> business like <tips=34>Dario’s</tips> affair as well. Some of it could be settled easily. Some could not.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r62","rowIndex":62,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しばらくして、氷川という日本人の青年が入って来た。彼もジャンのようにノートパソコンを小脇に抱えている。そう、彼には別の動画の編集を依頼していたのだ。","en":"After a while, a young Japanese man named Hikawa entered. Like Jean, he carried a laptop beneath one arm. I had asked him to edit a different recording.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r63","rowIndex":63,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　まったく、僕はいつから動画制作者になったのだろうか？","en":"Really, when exactly did I become a video producer?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r64","rowIndex":64,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しかし、今度の動画は今の<tips=34>ダリオ</tips>の動画よりもよほど重要で、そして慎重に扱わなくてはいけないものだった。","en":"This recording, however, was far more important than <tips=34>Dario’s</tips> and demanded far more careful treatment.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r65","rowIndex":65,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　氷川は執務室の机にパソコンを開き、画面を僕に見えるようにする。","en":"Hikawa opened the computer on the desk in my office and turned the screen where I could see it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r66","rowIndex":66,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そこに映っているのは、どこかの広い部屋である。壁は白く、床には赤い絨毯が敷かれている。窓は軽く開かれレースのカーテンが涼しげに揺れている。そして絨毯と同じ赤い色のソファーに、三人の老人が腰掛けている。","en":"It showed a spacious room somewhere. The walls were white; a red carpet covered the floor. A window stood slightly open, and lace curtains stirred in the cool breeze. Three old men sat on a sofa of the same red as the carpet.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r67","rowIndex":67,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　一番背の高い老人は痩せて白い肌と青い瞳を持ち、一番がっちりとした体格の老人は真っ黒な肌に大きな目をぎょろつかせ、一番小さな老人は黄土色の肌に口ひげを生やしている。","en":"The tallest was thin, with white skin and blue eyes. The broadest had jet-black skin and large, bulging eyes. The smallest had ocher-colored skin and a mustache.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r68","rowIndex":68,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼らはつい数日前まで、この街で最も勢力のある組織の一つを支配していた。","en":"Until only a few days ago, they had controlled one of the most powerful organizations in the city.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r69","rowIndex":69,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そう、彼らは<tips=21>八龍会</tips>の『<tips=22>老人たち</tips>』である。","en":"Yes: they are the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society’s</tips> “<tips=22>elders</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r70","rowIndex":70,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　この部屋は<tips=41>グランドタワー</tips>の一室、そして撮影は今日の午前中に、僕の立ち会いのもとで行われた。","en":"The room was in <tips=41>Grand Tower</tips>, and the recording had been made that morning in my presence.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r71","rowIndex":71,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「やあ諸君、元気ですか？」","en":"“Hello, everyone. How are you?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ミスター・アーノルド","displayName":"Mr. Arnold","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r72","rowIndex":72,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　真っ白な<tips=89>ミスター・アーノルド</tips>が渓谷の岸壁のように深いしわのきざまれた貫禄ある顔で、カメラに向かって語りかけた。","en":"The white-skinned <tips=89>Mr. Arnold</tips>, his commanding face scored by wrinkles as deep as ravine walls, addressed the camera.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r73","rowIndex":73,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「我々は元気だヨ。ピンピンしている。前に体調不良で仕事をおりたというような話があったが、あれは、真っ赤な嘘だからネ。信じちゃだめヨ」","en":"“We are well. Fit as fiddles. There was a story before that ill health had forced us to retire, but that was a great big lie, you see. You mustn’t believe it.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ミスター・チェン","displayName":"Mr. Chen","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r74","rowIndex":74,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　黄色い<tips=90>ミスター・チェン</tips>は目の笑っていない笑顔で言う。","en":"<tips=90>Mr. Chen</tips>, the yellow elder, spoke with a smile that never reached his eyes.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r75","rowIndex":75,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……今日は、みなに大事な話があって、この撮影をさせてもらった」","en":"“...We asked to make this recording because there is something important we must tell everyone.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ミスター・スミス","displayName":"Mr. Smith","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r76","rowIndex":76,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　真っ黒な<tips=91>ミスター・スミス</tips>はまるで怒っているかのようなむすっとした態度で言った。","en":"The black-skinned <tips=91>Mr. Smith</tips> says this with a sullen look, as though he is angry.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r77","rowIndex":77,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　こうして、三人がそれぞれかわるがわる言葉を口にする形で動画は進行してゆく。","en":"The recording continued in this fashion, the three of them speaking by turns.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r78","rowIndex":78,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そこで語られるのは、まず第一に<tips=22>老人たち</tips>の辞任劇の真相である。","en":"The first subject they addressed was the truth behind the <tips=22>elders</tips>’ supposed retirement.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r79","rowIndex":79,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あれは、<tips=47>解放軍</tips>のクーデターでした」","en":"“It was a coup by the <tips=47>Liberation Army</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ミスター・アーノルド","displayName":"Mr. Arnold","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r80","rowIndex":80,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=89>ミスター・アーノルド</tips>が沈鬱な表情で語ったのは、<tips=47>解放軍</tips>の幹部たちが銃を手に彼らの屋敷に乗り込んで来た日の一部始終だ。","en":"With a gloomy expression, <tips=89>Mr. Arnold</tips> described everything that had happened on the day the <tips=47>Liberation Army’s</tips> officers stormed their residence with guns in hand.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r81","rowIndex":81,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「彼らは銃で私たちを脅しながら、会から離れるよう強要したノ。そして、もし言うことを聞かなければ、私たちが本当は<tips=17>タイプＢ</tips>じゃなくて、ノーマルだったというデタラメを流すと言うのヨ」","en":"“They threatened us with firearms and forced us to leave the Association. Then they said that if we refused, they would spread the outrageous lie that we had never really been <tips=17>Type Bs</tips> at all, but Normals.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ミスター・チェン","displayName":"Mr. Chen","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r82","rowIndex":82,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=90>ミスター・チェン</tips>は肩をすくめて溜息をつく。","en":"<tips=90>Mr. Chen</tips> shrugs and sighs.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r83","rowIndex":83,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「もしかしたら、みんなのなかにもそんな噂を聞いた人がいたかもしれない。でも、それは私たちを陥れる真っ赤な嘘。私たちはネ、いまも、前も、ずっとみんなの仲間ヨ」","en":"“Perhaps some of you have heard that rumor. But it is a brazen lie intended to bring us down. We were your comrades before, we are your comrades now, and we always will be.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ミスター・チェン","displayName":"Mr. Chen","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r84","rowIndex":84,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=90>ミスター・チェン</tips>はなんて悲痛な顔をしているのだろう。僕が本当のことを知らなければ、信じてしまったかもしれない。","en":"What anguish there is in <tips=90>Mr. Chen’s</tips> face. Had I not known the truth, I might have believed him.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r85","rowIndex":85,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「とにかくショックを受けたし、悲しかったネ。<tips=10>道夫</tips>のことは小さな時から我が子のように大事に育てて来たのに、あのような過ちを犯してしまうなんて。あんなことをしなくとも、時間がたてば彼は正式に<tips=21>八龍会</tips>のリーダーとなれたのに、何を血迷ったのか……。<tips=10>道夫</tips>が悪い奴ではないのはわかってる。ただ、魔が差したんだろうネ。そして彼自身あのような形で死んでしまったのもその報いと言うべきか……とにかく悲しいネ」","en":"“More than anything, it shocked and saddened us, you see. Ever since he was small, we had raised <tips=10>Michio</tips> with loving care as if he were our own child, only for him to make such a terrible mistake. If he had simply waited, he would have become the official leader of the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips> in time. What madness possessed him...? We know <tips=10>Michio</tips> was not an evil man. He must have given in to a moment of temptation. And perhaps the way he died was the punishment for it... In any event, it is terribly sad.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ミスター・チェン","displayName":"Mr. Chen","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r86","rowIndex":86,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=47>解放軍</tips>のやったことは、簒奪と言うほかありません。卑劣な乗っ取り行為であります。私たちは断固これに抗議します」","en":"“What the <tips=47>Liberation Army</tips> did can only be called usurpation—a cowardly seizure of power. We protest it in the strongest possible terms.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ミスター・アーノルド","displayName":"Mr. Arnold","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r87","rowIndex":87,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=89>ミスター・アーノルド</tips>はゆっくりとした言葉に怒りを浮かべて言う。<tips=90>ミスター・チェン</tips>もそうだが、この<tips=22>老人たち</tips>はなかなかの役者で、いずれも迫真の演技である。","en":"<tips=89>Mr. Arnold</tips> speaks slowly, anger showing in every word. Like <tips=90>Mr. Chen</tips>, the <tips=22>elders</tips> are remarkably capable actors; each gives a thoroughly convincing performance.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r88","rowIndex":88,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「解放軍のリーダー<tips=67>カミラ</tips>を信じてはいけません。いま<tips=21>八龍会</tips>は彼ら<tips=47>解放軍</tips>によって支配されていますが、正当な根拠は何もないのです。あれは、裏切り者たちによる偽の権力です。彼らはただの血に飢えた獣でしかない。みなを騙し、みなを破滅に導こうとしています」","en":"“Do not trust <tips=67>Camilla</tips>, leader of the Liberation Army. The <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips> is presently ruled by the <tips=47>Liberation Army</tips>, but they possess no legitimate authority whatsoever. Theirs is a counterfeit power created by traitors. They are nothing more than beasts thirsting for blood. They mean to deceive you all and lead you to ruin.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ミスター・アーノルド","displayName":"Mr. Arnold","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r89","rowIndex":89,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=89>ミスター・アーノルド</tips>は青い目をまっすぐカメラに向け、画面のこちらを見つめるようにしながら続ける。","en":"<tips=89>Mr. Arnold</tips> continues, fixing his blue eyes directly on the camera as though staring at us through the screen.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r90","rowIndex":90,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「この動画をみたみなさん。この瞬間から、彼らに従うのをやめるのです。彼らに追い立てられて銃を持ち、ついこの間まで仲良くやっていた<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>と戦うのはあまりにも苦しくはないですか？　……私たちは再びこの街に戻ってきました。もう一度、私たちと共に平和で豊かな生活を目指しましょう」","en":"“All of you watching this video: from this moment on, cease obeying them. Is it not agonizing to be hounded into taking up arms and fighting <tips=7>YS</tips>, with whom you were on friendly terms until only recently? ...We have returned to this city. Let us strive together once more for lives of peace and prosperity.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ミスター・アーノルド","displayName":"Mr. Arnold","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r91","rowIndex":91,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=21>八龍会</tips>が武闘派路線に舵を切ったのは、そもそもこの<tips=22>老人たち</tips>の指示だったのに、よくもまあそんなことが言えるものである。","en":"The <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips> had embarked on its militant course at the instruction of these very <tips=22>elders</tips>, yet here they were saying such things with a straight face.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r92","rowIndex":92,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうは言っても、私たちは失脚したからもうなんの力もないだろうって？　いや、それは違うんだナ」","en":"“You think that because we have fallen from power, we have no strength left? No, that is where you are mistaken.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ミスター・チェン","displayName":"Mr. Chen","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r93","rowIndex":93,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=90>ミスター・チェン</tips>は道化めいた口調で言う。","en":"<tips=90>Mr. Chen</tips> speaks in a clownish tone.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r94","rowIndex":94,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いくら<tips=47>解放軍</tips>が間違っていても、私たちに力がなければどうすることも出来ない。それを私たちもわかっていたから、今まで黙っていたのネ。だけど、その具体的な手段が見つかった。だからこうしてみなさんの前に姿を現した」","en":"“However wrong the <tips=47>Liberation Army</tips> may be, there is nothing we can do if we possess no strength. We understood that, and so we kept silent until now, you see. But we have found a practical means of acting. That is why we have appeared before you today.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ミスター・チェン","displayName":"Mr. Chen","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r95","rowIndex":95,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=90>ミスター・チェン</tips>はニヤっと笑い、","en":"<tips=90>Mr. Chen</tips> grins.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r96","rowIndex":96,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「我々は<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>と協力しあうことにしたノ。いや、別にこれまでのやり方を変えるとか、そういうわけではないのネ。先日、<tips=81>龍頭</tips>どのとよく話し合う機会があって、私たちの間には重大な誤解があったことがはっきりした。だからもう憎み合う必要なんか何もないのヨ。もともと我々は、ずっと長くやっていたわけだしね。元に戻るだけ。……詳しいことについては、本人の口から聞いて頂戴ネ」","en":"“We have decided to cooperate with <tips=7>YS</tips>. No, no—this does not mean that we are abandoning our former principles. We recently had an opportunity to speak at length with the esteemed <tips=81>Longtou</tips>, and it became clear that a serious misunderstanding had existed between us. So there is no longer any need for us to hate one another. We had worked together for many years to begin with, after all. We are merely returning to the way things were. ...But you should hear the details from the man himself.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"ミスター・チェン","displayName":"Mr. Chen","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r97","rowIndex":97,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その言葉のあと、カメラが右へパンして、隣で椅子に腰掛けて座っていた僕を写し出す。","en":"At those words, the camera pans right and reveals me seated in a chair beside them.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r98","rowIndex":98,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「私のところはいい」","en":"“You can skip my part.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r99","rowIndex":99,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕は氷川に言って自分の喋った部分を早送りさせる。","en":"I tell Hikawa to fast-forward through my speech.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r100","rowIndex":100,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そこで僕が喋ったのは老人たちの言葉を後押しするような内容で、つまり<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>も<tips=17>タイプＢ</tips>の境遇を憂う立場であり、<tips=9>Y地区</tips>の変化を望んでいるということだった。そして<tips=22>老人たち</tips>の目的と自分たちの目的が変わらないことを確認したため、今後は彼らと協力して<tips=47>解放軍</tips>の排除にあたると宣言をした。","en":"What I said supported the <tips=22>elders</tips>’ account: <tips=7>YS</tips> too was concerned about the circumstances of <tips=17>Type Bs</tips> and desired change in <tips=9>Y District</tips>. Having confirmed that our purposes did not differ from theirs, I declared that from then on we would cooperate with them to remove the <tips=47>Liberation Army</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r101","rowIndex":101,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それからもう一つ、<tips=46>ネオ・ローズ</tips>のレシピを我々<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>が解明し、今後<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>が製造して必要な者に提供するという告知もした。","en":"Then I made one further announcement: we at <tips=7>YS</tips> had deciphered the recipe for <tips=46>Neo Rose</tips>, and henceforth <tips=7>YS</tips> would manufacture it and provide it to those who needed it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r102","rowIndex":102,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　この動画の内容は全体的に衝撃をもって受け止められるだろうが、特にこの最後の発言は重要な意味を持つだろう。","en":"The video as a whole was certain to be received with shock, but that final statement would carry particular weight.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r103","rowIndex":103,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　何しろ<tips=17>タイプＢ</tips>を解き放つ幻の薬『<tips=46>ネオ・ローズ</tips>』を持っていると表立って宣言した組織はこれがはじめてだ。今まで<tips=21>八龍会</tips>が密やかに配布してはいたが、それはあくまでも近隣の地域での噂に留まっていた。","en":"We were the first organization openly to declare possession of <tips=46>Neo Rose</tips>, the legendary drug that sets <tips=17>Type Bs</tips> free. The <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips> had distributed it in secret, but word of that had remained no more than a rumor in the surrounding area.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r104","rowIndex":104,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それがこうして公開されれば、街の内外の<tips=17>タイプＢ</tips>のみならず、全世界の<tips=17>タイプＢ</tips>が、そしてそれにまつわる様々な機関や組織が衝撃を受けるのは間違いない。もちろん警察だって驚愕するだろう。僕の口からは何も言っていないし、彼らもまだ察知していなかった事実のはずだ。","en":"Once the fact became public, it was certain to shock not only <tips=17>Type Bs</tips> within and beyond the city, but <tips=17>Type Bs</tips> throughout the world—and the many agencies and organizations concerned with them. The police, of course, would be astonished as well. I had told them nothing, and they should not yet have caught wind of it themselves.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r105","rowIndex":105,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　この動画の公開によって、我々<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>の新しい時代が始まる。","en":"The release of this video would usher in a new era for <tips=7>YS</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r106","rowIndex":106,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　将来的にはおそろしいほどの変化が訪れるだろうが、当面は<tips=9>Y地区</tips>内の<tips=17>タイプＢ</tips>たちを支配するのに役に立つ。","en":"Terrifying changes would come in the future, but for the time being, this would help us control the <tips=17>Type Bs</tips> of <tips=9>Y District</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r107","rowIndex":107,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼らはいま解放軍の支配下にあるが、それももう終わりだ、<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>には『<tips=46>ネオ・ローズ</tips>』があるが、<tips=47>解放軍</tips>にはそれを作る能力がない。この時点でもうこの街の<tips=17>タイプＢ</tips>たちがどちらを選ぶかは明白だ。もうすでに<tips=46>ネオ・ローズ</tips>なしではやっていけない人間が沢山いる。彼らには最初から選択肢などない。","en":"They are under the Liberation Army’s rule now, but that is about to end. <tips=7>YS</tips> has <tips=46>Neo Rose</tips>; the <tips=47>Liberation Army</tips> cannot make it. It is already obvious which side the city’s <tips=17>Type Bs</tips> will choose. Many can no longer function without <tips=46>Neo Rose</tips>. They never had any choice to begin with.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r108","rowIndex":108,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おまけに裏切られた<tips=22>老人たち</tips>の元に戻るという形になるわけだから、感情の面でも抵抗が少ないだろう。","en":"Moreover, they would merely be returning to the <tips=22>elders</tips> who had been betrayed. Emotionally, too, there should be little resistance.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r109","rowIndex":109,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そりゃこの間まで<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>を仇敵のように煽って、街を牛耳ると息巻いていた<tips=22>老人たち</tips>が急に<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>と手を組むというのは人としてはまったく筋が通っちゃいないけれど、一夜にして敵が味方になったり、味方が敵になったりするのはよくあることだ。","en":"Granted, it is utterly indefensible on a human level for the <tips=22>elders</tips>—who until very recently were whipping up hostility against <tips=7>YS</tips> as though we were their mortal enemy and boasting that they would rule the city—to join hands with <tips=7>YS</tips> so suddenly. Yet allies become enemies and enemies become allies overnight all the time.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r110","rowIndex":110,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　むしろ、利益になるとわかれば瞬時に豹変出来るものこそ有能とされるのがこの街である。――僕はあまり好きな考えではないが、要するに、こんなことでごちゃごちゃと文句をつけるやつはいないのだ。そもそも、一体どれくらいの数の<tips=21>八龍会</tips>員が<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>と戦うことを望んでいただろうか？","en":"Indeed, in this city, anyone who can change his colors the instant he sees an advantage is considered capable. I do not much care for the philosophy, but the point is that no one will quibble over a thing like this. How many members of the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips> ever truly wanted to fight <tips=7>YS</tips>?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r111","rowIndex":111,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして、<tips=67>カミラ</tips>には人望がない。","en":"And <tips=67>Camilla</tips> commanded no personal loyalty.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r112","rowIndex":112,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=10>道夫</tips>が生きていたらまだわからないが、元々<tips=21>八龍会</tips>にいたほとんどの連中は、<tips=67>カミラ</tips>よりも<tips=22>老人たち</tips>につきたいだろう。律儀に忠義立てして<tips=47>解放軍</tips>の側に残るのは――ほとんどいないような気がするが、もしいても僅かなものだろう。","en":"If <tips=10>Michio</tips> were alive, the outcome might still be uncertain, but most former members of the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips> would rather side with the <tips=22>elders</tips> than with <tips=67>Camilla</tips>. I can hardly imagine anyone remaining with the <tips=47>Liberation Army</tips> out of stubborn loyalty—but even if some do, there will be very few.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r113","rowIndex":113,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕の言葉が終わると、またカメラには<tips=22>老人たち</tips>の姿が写し出される。これから、しめのシーンとなるわけだ。","en":"Once my speech ends, the recording returns to the <tips=22>elders</tips>. Now comes the closing scene.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r114","rowIndex":114,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「私たちと<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>でお互いに非礼があったことを謝罪しあいました。しかしこれからは手を取り合ってゆきましょう。それが我々の真の発展のためなのです」","en":"“We have exchanged apologies with <tips=7>YS</tips> for the discourtesies on both sides. From this day forward, however, let us proceed hand in hand. That is the path to our true advancement.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r115","rowIndex":115,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=89>ミスター・アーノルド</tips>はそう言った後、数日以内に<tips=41>グランドタワー</tips>内に新しい本部を設け、新体制を発足することを発表する。","en":"After saying this, <tips=89>Mr. Arnold</tips> announces that a new headquarters will be established inside <tips=41>Grand Tower</tips> within several days and that a new administration will begin its work.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r116","rowIndex":116,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　最後は三人の老人と僕が手を重ね合わせ、それで動画は終わりだ。","en":"The recording ends with the three elders and me stacking our hands together.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r117","rowIndex":117,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕はふうと溜息をついた。","en":"I breathe out a sigh.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r118","rowIndex":118,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いかがでしょう？」","en":"“What do you think?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r119","rowIndex":119,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　氷川は僕を振り返る。","en":"Hikawa turns to me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r120","rowIndex":120,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いいよ。このまま行こう」","en":"“It’s good. We’ll go with it as is.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r121","rowIndex":121,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕が言うと、氷川はほっと溜息をついた。","en":"At my words, Hikawa sighs with relief.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r122","rowIndex":122,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「良く出来た動画でしたな。みなさんお上手で」","en":"“That was a very well-made video. Everyone gave such a fine performance.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬世傑","displayName":"Ma Sai-kit","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r123","rowIndex":123,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そばに立つ<tips=25>世傑</tips>がからかうように言う。","en":"<tips=25>Sai-kit</tips>, standing nearby, says this teasingly.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r124","rowIndex":124,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「茶番だよ」","en":"“It was a charade.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r125","rowIndex":125,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕は肩をすくめると、背筋の力を抜いて椅子の背もたれに身体をあずけた。","en":"I shrugged, let the tension drain from my back, and settled into the chair.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r126","rowIndex":126,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　この動画は、あとで<tips=57>滑走路通り</tips>に大型モニターを出して、そこで群衆に披露する。そして同時に動画と同じ内容をまとめたビラをまく。","en":"Later, we would set up a large screen on <tips=57>Runway Street</tips> and show the video to the crowd. At the same time, we would distribute leaflets summarizing its contents.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r127","rowIndex":127,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　――自分があんな風に喋っているのを皆に見られると思うとぞっとしないが、仕事だから仕方がない。","en":"I do not relish the thought of everyone watching me speak that way, but it is part of the job and cannot be helped.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r128","rowIndex":128,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「しかし、よくあのプライドの高い<tips=22>老人たち</tips>がこの提案をのんでくれたものですね」","en":"“Still, I’m surprised those proud <tips=22>elders</tips> accepted the proposal.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬世傑","displayName":"Ma Sai-kit","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r129","rowIndex":129,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=25>世傑</tips>は信じられないといった顔をしている。","en":"<tips=25>Sai-kit</tips> wears a look of disbelief.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r130","rowIndex":130,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「だって、こんなの、実際のところ<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>の軍門に下るのと同じことじゃないですか。お爺ちゃんたちだって全部わかってるでしょう？　だったら、屈辱的じゃないんですかね。そもそも、彼らが失脚するきっかけとなった<tips=72>傾向値</tips>のデータを<tips=47>解放軍</tips>に渡したのは……」","en":"“But this is effectively the same as submitting to <tips=7>YS</tips>, isn’t it? The old men understand all of that, surely. Wouldn’t they find it humiliating? And to begin with, the one who gave the <tips=47>Liberation Army</tips> the data on <tips=72>tendency scores</tips> that led to their downfall was...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬世傑","displayName":"Ma Sai-kit","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r131","rowIndex":131,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=25>世傑</tips>、それは事実じゃない」","en":"“<tips=25>Sai-kit</tips>, that isn’t what happened.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r132","rowIndex":132,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕が言うと、<tips=25>世傑</tips>は怪訝な顔をする。","en":"At my words, <tips=25>Sai-kit</tips> looks puzzled.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r133","rowIndex":133,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「事実はさっき映像で老人たちが言った通りさ。虚偽のデータを<tips=10>見土道夫</tips>がでっちあげ、<tips=22>老人たち</tips>はノーマルだという濡れ衣をきせられ、追放されたんだ。それ以外の何ものでもない。あの爺さんたちからそう言い出したんだから、それでいいじゃないか」","en":"“The facts are exactly as the old men said in that recording. <tips=10>Michio Mido</tips> fabricated false data, and the <tips=22>elders</tips> were falsely accused of being Normals and driven out. That is the whole truth. The old geezers were the ones who proposed that version in the first place, so let it stand.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r134","rowIndex":134,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まったく、みんな悪い人たちね」","en":"“Really, you’re all such awful people.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬世傑","displayName":"Ma Sai-kit","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r135","rowIndex":135,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=25>世傑</tips>はあきれたように溜息をつく。","en":"<tips=25>Sai-kit</tips> sighs in exasperation.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r136","rowIndex":136,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「馬鹿言っちゃいけない。この結果<tips=47>解放軍</tips>は崩壊して、失われるはずだったいくつもの命が助かるんだ。人の命ってのは何よりもかけがえのないものだ。これほどの善人はいないよ」","en":"“Don’t be absurd. The <tips=47>Liberation Army</tips> will collapse as a result, saving any number of lives that would otherwise have been lost. Nothing is more irreplaceable than human life. You won’t find a more virtuous man than me.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r137","rowIndex":137,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「わかりました。……でも、<tips=81>龍頭</tips>。<tips=22>老人たち</tips>と組むのは危険じゃないですか？　彼らをこの<tips=41>グランドタワー</tips>で引き取るのは監視にはいいけれど、こっちだって何をされるかわからない。『<tips=46>ネオ・ローズ</tips>』のレシピだって、いつ盗まれるか……そうしたら彼らはもう私たちに束縛される理由はなくなる」","en":"“I understand. ...But <tips=81>Longtou</tips>, isn’t an alliance with the <tips=22>elders</tips> dangerous? Taking them into <tips=41>Grand Tower</tips> will make them easier to watch, but there’s no telling what they might do to us. They could steal the <tips=46>Neo Rose</tips> recipe at any moment... and then they would have no reason to remain bound to us.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬世傑","displayName":"Ma Sai-kit","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r138","rowIndex":138,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なに、彼らも今から<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>と争うという気にはならないさ」","en":"“Come now, they won’t be in any mood to pick a fight with <tips=7>YS</tips> after this.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r139","rowIndex":139,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうだといいけれど」","en":"“I hope you’re right.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬世傑","displayName":"Ma Sai-kit","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r140","rowIndex":140,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=25>世傑</tips>は苦い顔をして、","en":"<tips=25>Sai-kit</tips> grimaces.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r141","rowIndex":141,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「『<tips=46>ネオ・ローズ</tips>』を得た彼らは完全にノーマルを見下してるわ。そして実際彼らは肉体的には完全に上回ってる。絶対に心から服従なんかしない。獅子身中の虫ってことにならなきゃいいけど」","en":"“Now that they have <tips=46>Neo Rose</tips>, they look down on Normals completely. And physically, they really are entirely superior. They will never submit in their hearts. I only hope they don’t become an enemy within our own ranks.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬世傑","displayName":"Ma Sai-kit","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r142","rowIndex":142,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「天下の<tips=25>馬世傑</tips>が随分心配性じゃないか」","en":"“The great <tips=25>Ma Sai-kit</tips> is quite the worrier.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r143","rowIndex":143,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕は苦笑する。","en":"I smile wryly.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r144","rowIndex":144,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「心配性じゃないとノーマルの身でこの仕事は務まりませんからね」","en":"“If I weren’t a worrier, I couldn’t do this job as a Normal.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬世傑","displayName":"Ma Sai-kit","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r145","rowIndex":145,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「でも大丈夫。一緒に仕事をすれば<tips=22>老人たち</tips>もすぐに理解するだろう。僕らと組むのがいかに頼もしいかということと、そして、敵に回すのがいかに恐ろしいかということをね」","en":"“But it will be fine. Once they work beside us, the <tips=22>elders</tips> will quickly understand how reassuring it is to have us as allies—and how terrifying it would be to make us enemies.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r146","rowIndex":146,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「相変わらず自信過剰ね。まあいいわ。そこまで言うのなら。……じゃあ行くわね。サウルちゃんに会いに行かなくちゃ」","en":"“Still as overconfident as ever. Oh, fine. If you insist. ...I’m going, then. I have to go see little Saul.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬世傑","displayName":"Ma Sai-kit","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r147","rowIndex":147,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=25>世傑</tips>はちょっと笑って、そして部屋を出て自分の仕事へ戻っていった。","en":"<tips=25>Sai-kit</tips> gives a small laugh, then leaves the room and returns to his work.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r148","rowIndex":148,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=34>ダリオ・ボネット</tips>にはサウルという一人息子がいる。彼もまた二世として僕らと交流があり、<tips=28>トミー</tips>や<tips=25>世傑</tips>、そして死んだ<tips=24>美美</tips>や<tips=36>アウロラ</tips>たちと同じように子供の頃からのつき合いだった。","en":"<tips=34>Dario Bonetto</tips> had a single son, Saul. Like us, Saul belonged to the second generation, and we had known him since childhood, just as we had <tips=28>Tommy</tips>, <tips=25>Sai-kit</tips>, and the late <tips=24>Meimei</tips> and <tips=36>Aurora</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r149","rowIndex":149,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　父が死んだ今、彼の意思を確認する必要がある。サウルは女と美食にうつつを抜かしていて仕事に関してはさほど熱心ではなかったが、こうなった以上は彼がボネット・ファミリーのボスであり、決定を下さなくてはならない。","en":"Now that his father is dead, we need to learn his intentions. Saul has always been far more interested in women and fine food than in work, but under the circumstances, he is the boss of the Bonetto Family and must make a decision.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r150","rowIndex":150,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　父の無念を晴らすために<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>に立ち向かうか、それとも大人しく組織に従うか。どっちだろう？","en":"Would he oppose <tips=7>YS</tips> to avenge his father, or submit quietly to the organization? Which would it be?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r151","rowIndex":151,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼の腹心たちはおそらく従うよう新しいボスに助言するだろうが、本人がどう判断するかは僕にも読めない。それを確認するために、<tips=25>世傑</tips>は今から彼のところへ行くのだ。","en":"His closest men would probably advise their new boss to submit, but even I could not predict Saul’s decision. To find out, <tips=25>Sai-kit</tips> was going to see him now.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r152","rowIndex":152,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　もちろん僕はそれをぼんやり待っているわけではなく、他にもいろいろな仕事があった。","en":"I did not, of course, sit idly waiting for his return. There was a great deal of other work.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r153","rowIndex":153,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　今日完成した映像を見せる準備についても指示をしなくてはいけないし、依然として<tips=47>解放軍</tips>とのトラブルは継続している。<tips=46>ネオ・ローズ</tips>製造と販売についてのプランも練らなくてはいけない。","en":"I have to give instructions for showing the video completed today, and the trouble with the <tips=47>Liberation Army</tips> continues. I also have to develop a plan for the manufacture and sale of <tips=46>Neo Rose</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r154","rowIndex":154,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　細々とした作業は部下に投げてしまうが、それでも僕が決定しなくてはいけないことは多い。","en":"I hand the minor tasks off to my subordinates, but even so, there are many decisions only I can make.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r155","rowIndex":155,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そうしてデスクワークをしていると、出発した<tips=25>世傑</tips>から電話が来た。","en":"As I work at my desk, a call comes from <tips=25>Sai-kit</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r156","rowIndex":156,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"『ぜーんぜん、話にならないわ』","en":"‘There was absolutely no talking to him.’","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r157","rowIndex":157,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　話は簡潔だった。サウルは父の死によってすっかり逆上しており、銃弾でもって<tips=25>世傑</tips>を出迎えたのだそうだ。","en":"The account was brief. Saul had apparently gone beside himself with rage over his father’s death and greeted <tips=25>Sai-kit</tips> with gunfire.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r158","rowIndex":158,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　こちらもそれに応戦し、彼の自宅を制圧。サウル自身と五人の部下、そしてサウルの妹と母を殺害したとのことだ。これで事実上ボネットの家族は消滅したことになる。","en":"Sai-kit’s men returned fire and took control of the house. He reported that they had killed Saul, five of his subordinates, Saul’s sister, and his mother. For all practical purposes, the Bonetto family had ceased to exist.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r159","rowIndex":159,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ボネット・ファミリーのほかの幹部たちは？」","en":"“What do the Bonetto Family’s other officers say?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r160","rowIndex":160,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"『サウルの愚かな判断には冷淡ですね。組織ごと<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>に吸収されることを望んでいます』","en":"‘They have no sympathy for Saul’s foolish decision. They want the entire organization absorbed into <tips=7>YS</tips>.’","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r161","rowIndex":161,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なるほど」","en":"“I see.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r162","rowIndex":162,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おおよそ思った通りの結果になったようだ。","en":"The outcome appeared to be much as I had expected.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r163","rowIndex":163,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕はそのあとの処理を指示して<tips=25>世傑</tips>との通話を切ると、別の部下に連絡してボネット・ファミリーを組織に組み入れるためのいくつかの準備について伝えた。","en":"I instructed <tips=25>Sai-kit</tips> on the cleanup and ended the call. Then I contacted another subordinate and described several preparations for incorporating the Bonetto Family into the organization.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r164","rowIndex":164,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その指示が一通り終わると、思わず溜息が漏れた。","en":"Once I finish giving those instructions, a sigh escapes me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r165","rowIndex":165,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=30>レイレイ</tips>が新しいコーヒーを淹れて僕の前に置いてくれる。","en":"<tips=30>Leilei</tips> brews fresh coffee and sets it before me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r166","rowIndex":166,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ありがとう。だが、今日はもうカフェインはやめておこうと思うんだ」","en":"“Thank you. But I think I’ve had enough caffeine for today.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r167","rowIndex":167,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あっ、すみませんでした。じゃあ別の飲み物をお持ちします」","en":"“Oh, I’m sorry. I’ll bring you something else.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"レイレイ","displayName":"Leilei","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r168","rowIndex":168,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　慌ててコーヒーを下げる<tips=30>レイレイ</tips>の姿をぼんやり眺めながら、僕は小さく咳をした。","en":"I gaze absently at <tips=30>Leilei</tips> as she hurriedly clears away the coffee, then cough softly.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r169","rowIndex":169,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　最近あまり眠れない。","en":"I have not been sleeping well lately.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r170","rowIndex":170,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　父と同じ病気を宣告されてから、免疫力を高める必要があるということで栄養バランスに気を遣ったり、酒を控えたりしているが、眠って休養がとれなければなんの意味もない。眠剤でも処方してもらったほうが良いかもしれない。僕に残された寿命は短くとも、それとは無関係に目の前には<tips=81>龍頭</tips>としての仕事が山積みになっている。少しでも多く片付けねば。こんな仕事が、もう時間のない僕を忙殺すると考えるとうんざりするが。","en":"Ever since I was told that I have the same disease as Father, I have watched the balance of my diet and cut back on drinking to strengthen my immune system. None of it means anything if I cannot sleep and recover. Perhaps I should ask for sleeping pills. My remaining life may be short, but quite apart from that, a mountain of work as <tips=81>Longtou</tips> stands before me. I have to finish as much as I can. It sickens me to think that work like this is consuming what little time I have left.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r171","rowIndex":171,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　父さんもこんな気持ちで執務をしていたんだろうか？　いや、彼の場合は自分で作り上げた組織だから、また違うやりがいがあったろう。僕は、ただ受け継いだだけであるからいけないのだな。守るべき人も全て僕の元を去った以上、本当にすることがなくなった。しかし、僕は僕で何かやりがいを見つけなくてはいけない。","en":"Did Father feel this way as he worked? No. In his case, he built the organization himself, and that must have given the work a different sense of purpose. The trouble is that I merely inherited it. Now that everyone I was meant to protect has left me, I truly have nothing else to do. Still, I have to find some purpose of my own.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r172","rowIndex":172,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　椅子の背もたれに寄りかかり、しばしばする目を閉じた。こうしていると眠い。なのに、寝ようとするとイライラして眠れない。そして疲れの残るからだで仕事ばかりしている。","en":"I lean back in the chair and close my smarting eyes. Sitting like this makes me drowsy. And yet when I try to sleep, irritation keeps me awake. So I do nothing but work in a body that never recovers from its fatigue.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r173","rowIndex":173,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕の仕事のほとんどは、この部屋から人に命令するだけだ。その結果、誰かを殺したり殺されたりすることも少なくない。","en":"Most of my work consisted of giving people orders from this room. As a result, it was hardly rare for someone to kill or be killed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r174","rowIndex":174,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　サウルの顔を思い浮かべる。また、昔からの知り合いを一人殺してしまった。まったく、殺してばっかりだ。――そう言えば、子供の頃、<tips=55>松子</tips>に蟻を殺させて命がどうだとえらそうなことを説いたっけな。","en":"I picture Saul’s face. I have killed yet another person I knew from long ago. Really, all I ever do is kill. That reminds me: when I was a child, I once made <tips=55>Matsuko</tips> kill ants and gave her some pompous lecture about life.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r175","rowIndex":175,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ふん、いま僕がやっていることは、あの時の<tips=55>松子</tips>がやっていたことと変わらない。逆らう力もない弱いものをぷちぷちと殺しているだけだ。","en":"Hmph. What I am doing now is no different from what <tips=55>Matsuko</tips> was doing then. I am simply picking off the weak, one after another—people with no power to resist.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r176","rowIndex":176,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕はなんでも思い通りにしてきたような勘違いをしていたけれど、自分の行動だけは全く思い通りになっていない。","en":"I had been under the illusion that I made everything go my way, yet my own actions are the one thing that never do.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r177","rowIndex":177,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　一人でちょっと笑って、そして目を開くと部屋の隅の方の<tips=40>黄姉妹</tips>が心配そうに僕を見ている。","en":"I give a little laugh to myself, then open my eyes to find the <tips=40>Wong sisters</tips> watching me anxiously from a corner of the room.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r178","rowIndex":178,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「お疲れですか？」","en":"“Are you tired?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"黄天祥","displayName":"Wong Tin-cheung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r179","rowIndex":179,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=40>天祥</tips>がそう訊ねる。","en":"<tips=40>Tin-cheung</tips> asks.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r180","rowIndex":180,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いや別に……」","en":"“Not particularly...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r181","rowIndex":181,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕はうっかりあくびをしかけたが、すぐに噛みつぶして肩をすくめ、","en":"I nearly yawn without thinking, but quickly bite it back, shrug, and say,","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r182","rowIndex":182,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なんだか最近仕事が面倒だなって」","en":"“Work’s just been feeling like such a chore lately.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r183","rowIndex":183,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ご多忙ですからね」","en":"“You are terribly busy.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"黄天明","displayName":"Wong Tin-ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r184","rowIndex":184,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そういうわけじゃないんだが」","en":"“That’s not what I mean.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r185","rowIndex":185,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕が言うと、<tips=40>天明</tips>が首をひねる。","en":"At my answer, <tips=40>Tin-ming</tips> tilts her head.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r186","rowIndex":186,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「大事な時期だし、もっと集中しなきゃいけないとは、わかっているんだけどね。どうも身が入らないんだ。……そうだ、きみたちは納豆を食べるかい？」","en":"“I know this is an important time and that I ought to concentrate more. I simply can’t seem to apply myself. ...Tell me, do the two of you eat natto?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r187","rowIndex":187,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その問いに、<tips=40>黄姉妹</tips>は不意を突かれたようにきょとんとしている。","en":"The question catches the <tips=40>Wong sisters</tips> off guard, and they stare at me blankly.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r188","rowIndex":188,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いえ」","en":"“No.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"黄天祥","displayName":"Wong Tin-cheung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r189","rowIndex":189,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あんまり食べませんが……」","en":"“Not very often...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"黄天明","displayName":"Wong Tin-ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r190","rowIndex":190,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうかい。僕は子供の頃から好物なんだ。……納豆を食べるときはみんなまずかき混ぜると思うんだけれど、僕は小さい時からどうも力の加減がヘタクソでね。買ったままの発泡スチロールのなかでかき混ぜるとどうしても箸で突きやぶってしまう。だから、皿にいれてかき混ぜるようにしてたんだ」","en":"“I see. I’ve loved it since I was a child. ...I imagine everyone stirs natto before eating it, but ever since I was small, I’ve been terrible at controlling my strength. Whenever I stirred it in the foam container it came in, I would inevitably pierce the bottom with my chopsticks. So I used to put it on a plate before stirring.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r191","rowIndex":191,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「はあ」","en":"“Uh-huh.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"黄天祥","displayName":"Wong Tin-cheung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r192","rowIndex":192,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　姉妹は戸惑いを浮かべたまま生返事をかえす。彼女らの気持ちはわかるけれど、僕は喋りたかったので勝手にそのまま続ける。","en":"The sisters give noncommittal answers, still looking bewildered. I know exactly how they feel, but I want to talk, so I continue anyway.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r193","rowIndex":193,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「でも一人暮らしをするようになったある日にね、洗い物が増えるのが面倒だったから、ケースのなかでかき混ぜてみたんだ。そんなのいつ以来だかわからないくらいだったんだけど、そうしたら、破らないでうまく混ぜられたんだよ。子供のときはどうしてもうまく出来なかったけど、大人が慎重にやればね、別にそんな難しいことじゃなかったんだ。そういうことってあるだろう？」","en":"“Then one day, after I began living alone, I couldn’t be bothered to dirty another dish. I tried stirring it in the container. I had no idea how many years it had been since the last time, but I managed to mix it without tearing anything. I could never do it properly as a child, but for an adult exercising a little care, it really wasn’t difficult. You know how that happens sometimes?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r194","rowIndex":194,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ええ、まあ……」","en":"“Yes, well...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"黄天明","displayName":"Wong Tin-ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r195","rowIndex":195,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「おそらく」","en":"“Probably.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"黄天祥","displayName":"Wong Tin-cheung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r196","rowIndex":196,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「だけど、それで皿を使うのをやめるってことにはならなかった。薬味を入れるなら大きな皿の方がやりやすいし、それに僕は気がついたんだけど、慎重に丁寧にかき混ぜるより、皿のなかで思いっきりかき混ぜる方が爽快感があって好きなんだよ。だからそれからはいつも、皿を使うか使わないか考えるようになった。自分はいまダイナミックにかき混ぜたい気分なのか、皿を洗う面倒がそれを上回るのか。……でも今は、皿なんか全部人が洗ってくれる。それどころか頼めばシェフが綺麗にかき混ぜて持って来てくれるし、なんならスプーンで口まで運ばせることだって出来る。なんといっても僕は<tips=81>龍頭</tips>だからね。ここでは王様みたいなものさ。くだらない」","en":"“But that didn’t mean I stopped using plates. A large plate is more convenient when you want to add condiments. And I realized that I preferred the exhilaration of whipping the natto about as hard as I could on a plate to the careful work of stirring it gently. After that, I began deciding each time whether to use a plate. Did I feel like giving it a vigorous stir today, or did the trouble of washing a plate outweigh that desire? ...Now, of course, other people wash every dish for me. If I ask, a chef will even stir it beautifully before bringing it in. I could even have someone spoon-feed me. I am the <tips=81>Longtou</tips>, after all. I’m practically a king here. How absurd.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r197","rowIndex":197,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕は困惑する姉妹の前ではあと溜息をつき、","en":"I let out a long sigh before the bewildered sisters, then continued,","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r198","rowIndex":198,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……それでしばらくその葛藤を忘れていたんだけど、この間一人のとき納豆ご飯を作って食おうと思ったときにね、ふと昔の悩みが蘇ったんだよ。皿で混ぜようかなあ、そのまま混ぜようかなあって悩んでたんだ。二、三分は迷ったかな。随分長いだろう？　僕は仕事のことだったらそんなに優柔不断になったりしないのにおかしいと思わないかい？　人が死ぬか死なないかって決定をあっさり下すのに、納豆の皿を使うか使わないかで悩むんだ。人間の価値観ってのは面白いものだなと思ったよ。結局さ、我々の行動なんてものは……」","en":"“...I forgot all about that little conflict for some time. Then, the other day, I was alone and decided to make myself natto over rice. The old question suddenly came back to me. Would I mix it on a plate, or mix it right in the container? I must have spent two or three minutes deciding. That’s a remarkably long time, isn’t it? I never become that indecisive over my work. Don’t you find it strange? I decide in an instant whether a person lives or dies, yet agonize over whether to use a plate for natto. It made me think how strange the human sense of priorities is. In the end, our actions are...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r199","rowIndex":199,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　話はまだ途中だったが、喋ってる途中で急につまらなくなって溜息をついた。","en":"I had not finished, but midway through speaking I suddenly lost interest and sighed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r200","rowIndex":200,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ま、どうでもいいや」","en":"“Well, whatever.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r201","rowIndex":201,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……やっぱり、お疲れなんでしょうか？」","en":"“...You really are tired, aren’t you?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"黄天明","displayName":"Wong Tin-ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r202","rowIndex":202,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「少しお休みになられては」","en":"“Perhaps you should rest for a while.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"黄天祥","displayName":"Wong Tin-cheung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r203","rowIndex":203,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　姉妹は二人して僕を心配してくれる。","en":"Both sisters are worried about me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r204","rowIndex":204,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ありがとう。でもその必要はない」","en":"“Thank you, but there is no need.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r205","rowIndex":205,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そう断ったところで<tips=30>レイレイ</tips>が別の飲み物を持って来た。爽やかな香りがするハーブティーだった。","en":"Just as I decline, <tips=30>Leilei</tips> returns with another drink: an herbal tea with a refreshing fragrance.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r206","rowIndex":206,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「このお茶、胃腸にいいんですって」","en":"“I hear this tea is good for the stomach.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"レイレイ","displayName":"Leilei","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r207","rowIndex":207,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=30>レイレイ</tips>は意味ありげな視線を僕に向ける。","en":"<tips=30>Leilei</tips> gives me a meaningful look.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r208","rowIndex":208,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　同じ病気で死んだ父の末期に付き添った彼女は何か感づいているのかもしれない。","en":"She cared for Father through the final stage of the same disease. Perhaps she suspects something.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r209","rowIndex":209,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　まあ、身のまわりにいる人間に隠し通すのは不可能なんだろうな。そのうち、彼女には伝えておかなければいけない。","en":"Well, it is probably impossible to keep the truth hidden from the people around me forever. I will have to tell her eventually.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r210","rowIndex":210,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　早ければ早いほどいいのだろうけれど、やはり抵抗感がある。自分だけで抱えて周りの誰もそうと知らずに接してくれているうちは、なんだか悪い夢のような感覚でいられるが、人と話して周りがそれを意識することで否応なく現実の一部になってしまうような気がする。","en":"The sooner the better, probably, but I still resist. As long as I keep it to myself and everyone around me goes on treating me without knowing, it can remain something like a bad dream. Once I speak of it, once everyone around me becomes conscious of it, I feel it will inevitably become part of reality.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r211","rowIndex":211,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　これは僕の弱さだな。","en":"This is weakness on my part.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r212","rowIndex":212,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そう思いながら一口飲み、","en":"With that thought, I take a sip.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r213","rowIndex":213,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「何も気にしないで良い。僕はきっとこの仕事が向いている。なんといってもあの<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>の息子だからね。こんなに一生懸命働いてるんだから、彼も地獄で喜んでいるだろう」","en":"“There is no cause for concern. I’m sure this work suits me. I am the son of <tips=3>Chris Tse</tips>, after all. I’ve been working so hard that he must be delighted in hell.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r214","rowIndex":214,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　と言った。","en":"That is what I tell her.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r215","rowIndex":215,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　十九時まで執務を行うと乾いた咳が出た。","en":"When I finished working at seven that evening, a dry cough escaped me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r216","rowIndex":216,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕の身体を蝕む病気が進行すれば、やがて内部の組織からボロボロと崩れ、咳に肉片や血が混じって来る。現時点で僕の症状がそこまで進行していることはありえないのだけれど、口元にあてたハンカチをつい確認してしまう。","en":"As the disease consuming my body progresses, the tissues inside me will eventually begin to crumble, and pieces of flesh and blood will mingle with my coughs. My disease could not possibly have advanced that far yet, but I still find myself checking the handkerchief I raised to my mouth.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r217","rowIndex":217,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その時もじっとハンカチを見つめていると、用事のために訪れていた<tips=28>トミー</tips>が、","en":"Just then, as I stared fixedly at the handkerchief, <tips=28>Tommy</tips>, who had come on business, said,","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r218","rowIndex":218,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「風邪ですか？　気をつけないとだめですよ。<tips=81>龍頭</tips>が倒れたらかわりはいないんですから」","en":"“Have you caught cold? You need to take care of yourself. If the <tips=81>Longtou</tips> goes down, there is no one to replace you.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ","displayName":"Thomas Liao","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r219","rowIndex":219,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　と心配そうに言ってくる。最初はぎこちなかった僕への敬語もだいぶこなれたものだ。","en":"He sounded concerned. The respectful language he had initially found so awkward with me now came much more naturally.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r220","rowIndex":220,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕はなんでもないと答えたが、実際には大分身体が重かった。今日はそこで仕事を切り上げることにして、スーツから私服へと着替えた。","en":"I answered that it was nothing, but in truth my body felt quite heavy. I decided to end my work there and changed from my suit into ordinary clothes.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r221","rowIndex":221,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「またおでかけですか？　誰かお連れになられた方が……」","en":"“Are you going out again? Perhaps someone should accompany you...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"黄天祥","displayName":"Wong Tin-cheung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r222","rowIndex":222,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　一人で外へ出ようとする僕を<tips=40>黄姉妹</tips>が心配するが、僕は無言で肩をすくめてそれを断った。","en":"The <tips=40>Wong sisters</tips> worry about my going out alone, but I silently shrug off their concern.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r223","rowIndex":223,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕がゾロゾロと人を引き連れて歩くのが好きではないことを彼女たちは知っているからそれ以上は何も言わなかった。","en":"They knew that I disliked walking about with a procession behind me, so they said nothing more.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r224","rowIndex":224,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　雨は降っていなかったが、夜風が少ししめっている。","en":"It was not raining, but the night wind carried a little dampness.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r225","rowIndex":225,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕は裏の小さな通用口から<tips=41>グランドタワー</tips>を出ると、夜道を歩いた。","en":"I left <tips=41>Grand Tower</tips> through the small service entrance at the rear and walked into the night.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r226","rowIndex":226,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　変装にもならない気休めとして帽子と眼鏡を掛けてはいるけれども、不用心と言えば確かにその通りかもしれない。外歩きが好きな<tips=28>トミー</tips>でさえもいつもサイキックの<tips=29>アイス</tips>をそばに置く。これが僕の悪い癖なのは自覚している。しかし、これくらいは好きなことをしたっていいじゃないか。――そう、やっと執務から解放されたのだ。これからはやっと自分のために時間を使える。そう思うと、にわかに元気になってくるのだから現金なものだ。","en":"I wear a hat and glasses as a token precaution that scarcely qualifies as a disguise, but perhaps this really is as careless as it seems. Even <tips=28>Tommy</tips>, who loves going out, always keeps the psychic <tips=29>Ice</tips> beside him. I know this is a bad habit of mine. Still, surely I am entitled to do this one thing I enjoy. At last, I am free of my official duties. Now I can finally spend time on myself. The thought puts a sudden spring in my step. How mercenary of me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r227","rowIndex":227,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ここ数日、僕には仕事の他に、個人的に興味をもって行っていることもある。いや、仕事に繋げられることではあるのだが、今のところはまだそこまで具体的に考えてはいない。趣味の範疇といっていいだろう。秘密裏に行っていることだから、<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>の誰かを伴いたくはない。","en":"For the past few days, I have also been pursuing something that interests me personally, apart from my work. No—it might eventually lead to work, but I have not yet considered anything so concrete. For now, it could fairly be called a hobby. I am doing it in secret, so I do not want to bring anyone from <tips=7>YS</tips> along.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r228","rowIndex":228,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それに、今日向かっている場所の主は、ギャングと関わり合うことを嫌っている。だから僕もそこへ向かうときは、三代目<tips=81>龍頭</tips>ではなく、一個人としての<tips=1>謝亮</tips>――或いは<tips=1>菅原亮</tips>として訪れることになるのだ。","en":"Besides, the owner of the place I was visiting today disliked any involvement with gangsters. Whenever I went there, therefore, I did so not as the Third <tips=81>Longtou</tips>, but as the private individual <tips=1>Tse Leung</tips>—or perhaps <tips=1>Ryo Sugawara</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r229","rowIndex":229,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　今日はそこへ訪れる前に、用事があって<tips=57>滑走路通り</tips>に寄った。","en":"Before visiting that place today, I stopped on <tips=57>Runway Street</tips> to take care of an errand.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r230","rowIndex":230,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　日本でも有数の繁華街であるこの通りには、平日も週末も関係がなく、この時間は人であふれている。","en":"On this street, one of Japan’s foremost entertainment districts, weekdays and weekends made no difference. At this hour, it overflowed with people.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r231","rowIndex":231,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　夜の闇に無数のネオンが眩しく輝き、その艶やかな光が人々の顔を極彩色に濡らしている。","en":"Countless neon signs shone brilliantly in the darkness, their lustrous light drenching every face in dazzling colors.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r232","rowIndex":232,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しょっちゅう事件が起きるこの通りに、よくもまあ恐れもせずこれだけの人々が足を運ぶものだ。まるで誘蛾灯につられて集まる羽虫のように。危険そのものも人を惹きつけるのだろうか？　まあ、理屈にあわぬことをしているという点では僕も同じなので、あまり偉そうなことは言えないが。","en":"Incidents occurred constantly on this street, yet all these people came without the slightest fear. They were moths gathering around a lamp. Did danger itself attract them? Then again, I was no different in acting against all reason, so I could hardly speak too loftily.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r233","rowIndex":233,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　結局の所、人間というものはどんなに賢いふりをしたって、自ら誘蛾灯に近づいてしまうものなのだろう。","en":"In the end, however wise human beings pretend to be, perhaps we all make our own way toward the lamp.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r234","rowIndex":234,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　自分を賢明だと勘違いしている人間が、自滅してゆく人々をあざ笑う。しかし、笑っている方だって、彼らが大事にしているものにそれほどの価値があるわけでもない。命だって、一番大事なものとは限らない。水の入ったグラスを鍵のついた金庫にしまったところでいつか蒸発して消えてしまうのと同じように、何にも使わなかったとしても命はそのうち消えるのだ。","en":"People who mistake themselves for wise laugh at those who go willingly to their destruction. Yet the things the ones doing the laughing hold dear are not necessarily worth so very much, either. Even life is not always the most important thing. Lock a glass of water inside a safe, and one day it will still evaporate and disappear. Even if a life is never spent on anything, it too will disappear in time.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r235","rowIndex":235,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=57>滑走路通り</tips>の雑踏は僕にとっては居心地がいい。人混みに入ってしまえばもう誰かが僕に気がつく可能性はほとんどなくなる。僕は名もなき群衆に同化してしまうのだ。何者でもなくなる。だから、僕は昔からこうして雑踏を歩くのが好きだ。いろいろなしがらみがからみついた、自分ではなくなって、顔のない背景に、そしてこの街に同化したような気がする。この街のことが好きじゃなかったのに、なぜそれが心地よかったのか。おかしな話だ。こうしているとその頃のことを思い出す。","en":"The bustle of <tips=57>Runway Street</tips> puts me at ease. Once I enter the crowd, there is almost no chance anyone will notice me. I merge into an anonymous multitude. I become no one. That is why I have always loved walking through crowds this way. The self entangled in every kind of obligation falls away, and I seem to merge into a faceless background—into the city itself. I did not even like this city, so why did that feel so pleasant? A strange thing. Walking this way brings those days back to me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r236","rowIndex":236,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　屋台で売る声と買う声が聞こえる。雑然とした街中で自分の声を届かせようと客も店員も双方荒っぽい大きな声で会話をする。北京語の断片が聞こえる。英語の断片が聞こえる。広東語の断片が聞こえる。韓国語の断片が聞こえる。","en":"I hear the cries of stallholders selling and customers buying. Customers and staff alike speak in loud, rough voices, struggling to make themselves heard above the disorder of the street. Fragments of Mandarin reach me. Fragments of English. Fragments of Cantonese. Fragments of Korean.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r237","rowIndex":237,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　花屋の前を通ると、見かけた顔が店先にあった。前髪を垂らして顔を隠したその女店員は、子供時代の仲間の一人だ。","en":"As I passed a flower shop, I recognized a familiar face outside. The saleswoman, whose bangs hung down to hide her face, had been one of my childhood companions.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r238","rowIndex":238,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　元々<tips=10>道夫</tips>やコンタたちのグループにいた子で、手癖が悪い上に要領も悪く、ちょいちょい店先のものを盗んでは見つかって殴られていた。前髪の下には<tips=77>特質変異</tips>による変形があり、それが原因で家族から忌まれていたため、ほとんど家に帰ることがなかった。僕らのグループが大きくなり始めた頃に、彼女の家には新しい父親がやって来た。いい父親だったらしく、彼によって学校に通えるようになり、僕らのところにはあまり顔を出さなくなった。","en":"She had originally belonged to <tips=10>Michio</tips> and Konta’s group. She had sticky fingers and no knack for getting away with anything, so she would steal things from storefronts only to be caught and beaten. A <tips=77>trait mutation</tips> had deformed the face beneath her bangs. Her family despised her for it, and she scarcely ever went home. Around the time our group began to grow, a new father came into her life. He was apparently a good man, and through him she was able to attend school. After that, she seldom came to see us.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r239","rowIndex":239,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　だから、その姿を見るのは、実に少年の頃以来なのだが――こんなところで働いていたのか。","en":"I have not seen her since we were children—and she works here now?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r240","rowIndex":240,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　黒っぽいポロシャツにデニムのズボン、足元はスニーカーという動きやすそうな服装に、店のロゴが入ったエプロンをしている。そして、ドレスを着た女の客と何か話していた。","en":"She wears practical clothes: a dark polo shirt, denim trousers, and sneakers, with an apron bearing the shop’s logo over them. She is speaking with a woman in a dress.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r241","rowIndex":241,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕は声をかけようと思って、けれど考えてみたら別段話すことなど何もないことに気がついた。","en":"I consider calling out to her, then realize there is nothing in particular for us to discuss.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r242","rowIndex":242,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　今の僕がこんなところで出し抜けに声をかけても驚かせるだけだろう。","en":"If I suddenly called out to her here, out of nowhere, I would only startle her.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r243","rowIndex":243,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そのまま立ち去ろうとしたとき、彼女がこちらをチラと見て、口を丸く開いて気づいたそぶりをしたのがかすかに見えた。けれど何も言わない。僕はそのまま歩き去った。","en":"As I turn to leave, she glances my way, and I catch the faintest glimpse of her mouth falling open in recognition. But she says nothing, and I continue on my way.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r244","rowIndex":244,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そしてすぐ近くの雑貨店に入ると、白いチョークを購入した。そう、これが重要なのだ。","en":"I enter a general store nearby and buy a stick of white chalk. Yes. This is the important part.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r245","rowIndex":245,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「何か食うか？」","en":"“Want something to eat?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐健慈朗","displayName":"Kenjiro Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r246","rowIndex":246,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=70>シオクリーン</tips>の社長、<tips=54>汐健慈朗</tips>は無言で僕を部屋に招いた後ぽつりとそう訊ねた。","en":"<tips=54>Kenjiro Shio</tips>, president of <tips=70>Shio Clean</tips>, ushers me into the room without a word, then quietly asks the question.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r247","rowIndex":247,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「大丈夫。さっき<tips=57>滑走路通り</tips>の屋台で食べてきたんだ」","en":"“I’m fine. I ate at one of the stalls on <tips=57>Runway Street</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r248","rowIndex":248,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕は眼鏡をケースに仕舞いながら答えた。かけなれない眼鏡のせいでフレームの当たった鼻の付け根のあたりが痛み、人差し指と親指でつまんでもみほぐす。","en":"I answer as I put my glasses away in their case. I am unused to them, and the frame has made the bridge of my nose ache. I pinch the spot between my index finger and thumb and rub it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r249","rowIndex":249,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=54>汐さん</tips>はくるりと背を向けて廊下を進む。僕はそれについて歩く。","en":"<tips=54>Mr. Shio</tips> turns on his heel and proceeds down the hall. I follow.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r250","rowIndex":250,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「よく気づかれなかったな」","en":"“I’m surprised no one noticed you.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐健慈朗","displayName":"Kenjiro Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r251","rowIndex":251,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　歩きながら、<tips=54>汐さん</tips>はそう訊ねる。","en":"<tips=54>Mr. Shio</tips> asks as we walk.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r252","rowIndex":252,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「みんな明るいネオンに気をとられてるんだ。他人の顔をじろじろ見る人なんかいないよ。それより『預けもの』の様子はどうだい？」","en":"“Everyone’s distracted by the bright neon. No one goes around studying other people’s faces. More importantly, how is the ‘deposit’?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r253","rowIndex":253,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「相変わらずだ。知りたいことはデータを見てくれ」","en":"“Unchanged. Look at the data if you want details.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐健慈朗","displayName":"Kenjiro Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r254","rowIndex":254,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=54>汐さん</tips>はドアを開けて、奥の部屋に入る。僕はそのあとに続く。","en":"<tips=54>Mr. Shio</tips> opens a door and enters the room beyond. I follow him inside.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r255","rowIndex":255,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　男一人所帯になったこの家は、以前よりも掃除が行き届かず乱雑にものが散らばっている。テーブルの上にはウイスキーの瓶が三本並び、うち二本は空になっていた。さっきまでそこで飲んでいたらしく、グラスにも琥珀色の液体が注がれている。","en":"Now that Mr. Shio lives alone, the house is less carefully cleaned than before, with clutter scattered everywhere. Three whiskey bottles stand on the table, two of them empty. He was apparently drinking there until moments ago; the glass still holds an amber liquid.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r256","rowIndex":256,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そしてその隣にはアルバムが開いたままになっていた。そこに貼り付けられていたのはこの家の前で撮った写真で、珍しく笑顔の<tips=54>汐さん</tips>と、無表情の僕と<tips=55>松子</tips>が写っている。まだ小さな僕と<tips=55>松子</tips>は手を繋ぎ、後に立った<tips=54>汐さん</tips>が二人の肩に手を置いていた。","en":"An album lies open beside it. The photograph pasted there was taken in front of this house. It shows <tips=54>Mr. Shio</tips> smiling, a rarity, with <tips=55>Matsuko</tips> and me wearing expressionless faces. <tips=55>Matsuko</tips> and I are still small in the picture, holding hands, while <tips=54>Mr. Shio</tips> stands behind us with one hand on each of our shoulders.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r257","rowIndex":257,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　こんな写真をいつ撮ったのか、なんで撮ったのか、僕はちっとも覚えていない。","en":"I do not remember at all when we took this photograph, or why.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r258","rowIndex":258,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=54>汐さん</tips>はそのアルバムをぱたんと閉じ、椅子に腰掛けるとまたグラスを手に取った。","en":"<tips=54>Mr. Shio</tips> snaps the album shut, sits down, and picks up his glass again.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r259","rowIndex":259,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「おれはもうすぐ出かけなくちゃいけないが、お前は好きなときに帰ればいい」","en":"“I have to go out shortly, but you can leave whenever you like.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐健慈朗","displayName":"Kenjiro Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r260","rowIndex":260,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=54>汐さん</tips>はポケットに手を突っ込むと、カードキーを僕に向かって放り投げた。酔いによる手元の狂いと、繋がれたキーホルダーが重心を狂わせて、あらぬ方向へ飛んで行くそれを、僕は右手を伸ばしてどうにかキャッチする。","en":"He reaches into his pocket and tosses me a keycard. Drink spoils <tips=54>Mr. Shio’s</tips> aim, and the attached keychain throws off its balance, sending it in an entirely different direction. I stretch out my right hand and somehow catch it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r261","rowIndex":261,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「帰る時は郵便受けに入れておいてくれ。……お前も飲むか？」","en":"“Put it through the mail slot when you leave. ...Want a drink?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐健慈朗","displayName":"Kenjiro Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r262","rowIndex":262,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　これから仕事の筈だが、その息は酒臭かった。","en":"He is supposed to be going to work, but his breath reeks of alcohol.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r263","rowIndex":263,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いや、いらない。そんなに酔っ払って仕事は出来るのかい？」","en":"“No, thank you. Can you really work when you’re that drunk?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r264","rowIndex":264,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「平気さ。どうせ向こうでも飲むんだ。今日は接待を受けるだけなんだ。気が進まないが、これも仕事だからな。女も用意してくれるらしい。うんざりするよ」","en":"“It’s fine. I’ll only be drinking there as well. All I have to do today is be entertained. I have no desire to go, but this too is part of the job. Apparently they’ll provide women, too. I’m sick of it.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐健慈朗","displayName":"Kenjiro Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r265","rowIndex":265,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=70>シオクリーン</tips>は順調に事業を拡大し、<tips=9>Y地区</tips>外に拠点を移すらしい。その際、<tips=9>Y地区</tips>での業務を売却、或いは委託するのではないかと噂になっている。<tips=70>シオクリーン</tips>はこの街だけでも相当な利益をあげており、その業務を受け継ぐとなれば瞬く間に地域の資産家の仲間入りだ。表社会の人間も、裏通りの人間も、多少資金があるものは我こそはと血眼になっているようだ。","en":"<tips=70>Shio Clean</tips> is steadily expanding its operations and reportedly plans to move its base outside <tips=9>Y District</tips>. Rumor has it that, when it does, it may sell or contract out its operations in <tips=9>Y District</tips>. <tips=70>Shio Clean</tips> earns considerable profits in this city alone. Anyone who takes over that business will join the ranks of the district’s wealthy almost overnight. Everyone with even a little capital, whether from respectable society or the backstreets, seems frantic to claim the opportunity.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r266","rowIndex":266,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕は話を聞いた時すぐにそのことが思い浮かんだ。","en":"That possibility had occurred to me the instant I heard the rumors.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r267","rowIndex":267,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=81>龍頭</tips>としては何か言うべきだったろう。でもそんな気持ちになれるはずもなく、そのまま聞き流した。","en":"As <tips=81>Longtou</tips>, I probably ought to have said something. I could not possibly bring myself to do so, however, and let the matter pass.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r268","rowIndex":268,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「最近は少し動いただけで節々が痛む。年はとりたくないものだな」","en":"“These days, every joint aches after the slightest movement. Growing old is a miserable business.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐健慈朗","displayName":"Kenjiro Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r269","rowIndex":269,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=54>汐さん</tips>は顔を顰めながら腰のあたりを叩き、そうぼやいた。","en":"<tips=54>Mr. Shio</tips> grumbles, grimacing as he pats his lower back.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r270","rowIndex":270,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「少しアルコールを減らしたらどうだい？」","en":"“Why not drink a little less?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r271","rowIndex":271,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕の言葉に彼は無言で首を横に振ると、グラスに唇をつけた。","en":"He silently shakes his head at my suggestion and puts the glass to his lips.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r272","rowIndex":272,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　元々彼は酒が好きで、若い頃に研究者をやめた直接的なきっかけも酒によるトラブルだったと聞いている。まあ、何も起こさなくても続けられる仕事ではなかったろうから、それが運命を変えたということにはならないだろうけれど。","en":"He had always loved alcohol. I had heard that a drunken incident was the immediate cause of his departure from research as a young man. In all likelihood, though, he could not have continued in that work even if nothing had happened, so it would be wrong to claim the incident changed the course of his fate.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r273","rowIndex":273,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=55>松子</tips>がいなくなってから止める者もいなくなり、ますます量が増えたようだった。","en":"With <tips=55>Matsuko</tips> gone and no one left to restrain him, the amount he drinks seems to have increased further.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r274","rowIndex":274,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　勤め先で<tips=55>松子</tips>が襲撃に遭ったことが彼の心にどういう影響を与えたのかは僕も知らない。彼女がいなくなってから、僕は以前のようにちょくちょくここに来るようになっていたが、一度もそのことを話題にしたことがなかったからだ。","en":"I do not know what effect the attack on <tips=55>Matsuko</tips> at her workplace had on him. Since her disappearance, I have resumed visiting the house as often as I once did, but I have never once raised the subject.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r275","rowIndex":275,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼にとって<tips=55>松子</tips>というものは元々拾ってきた不思議な肉片でしかなく、父親のフリをすることになったのも行きがかり上のことで望んだものではなかったろうが、しかし、<tips=55>松子</tips>といるときは本当に父親のように見えた。そして不思議なもので、彼女がいなくなった今はちっとも父親らしくなく、初老の独身男にしか見えなくなった。","en":"To Mr. Shio, <tips=55>Matsuko</tips> was originally no more than a mysterious piece of flesh he had picked up. Circumstances forced him to play her father, rather than any desire of his own. Yet whenever he was with <tips=55>Matsuko</tips>, he truly looked like a father. It is strange: now that she is gone, there is nothing fatherly about him. He looks like nothing more than an aging bachelor.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r276","rowIndex":276,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「お前こそ、目の下のクマがひどいぞ。眠れていないんじゃないか？」","en":"“Look at you. The shadows beneath your eyes are terrible. Haven’t you been sleeping?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐健慈朗","displayName":"Kenjiro Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r277","rowIndex":277,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そんなことないよ。陰の具合でそう見えるだけさ」","en":"“That’s not it. The light only makes them look that way.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r278","rowIndex":278,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうか」","en":"“I see.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐健慈朗","displayName":"Kenjiro Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r279","rowIndex":279,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕は無言で酒を飲み始めた<tips=54>汐さん</tips>をその場に残し、地下室へ向かう。","en":"I leave <tips=54>Mr. Shio</tips> there, drinking in silence, and head for the basement.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r280","rowIndex":280,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして歩きながら、あの夜のことを思い出した。","en":"As I walk, I remember that night.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r281","rowIndex":281,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　夜遅く、<tips=40>黄姉妹</tips>も<tips=30>レイレイ</tips>も帰らせた執務室で一人うつらうつらしていた時のことだ、警察からの連絡で目が覚めた。","en":"It was late at night. I had sent the <tips=40>Wong sisters</tips> and <tips=30>Leilei</tips> home and was dozing alone in my office when a call from the police woke me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r282","rowIndex":282,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　あの<tips=50>路地</tips>の訪問以来、<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>に関することで<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>と警察は連絡を取り合うことになっており、用件を聞く前からすぐにそのことだと気がついた。またどこかで新しい殺人を犯したのだろう。","en":"Since <tips=50>Roji’s</tips> visit, <tips=7>YS</tips> and the police had been exchanging information concerning <tips=20>Koschei</tips>. Before I even heard the purpose of the call, I realized that it must concern him. He had probably committed another killing somewhere.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r283","rowIndex":283,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　電話を掛けてきたのは、あのとき<tips=50>路地</tips>とともに訪れた<tips=49>三芳</tips>という女性警官だった。彼女の言葉は途中まで僕の思ったとおりの内容を述べていたけれども、<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>が事件を起こした場所に触れ、被害者の名を告げたところで僕は凍り付いた。","en":"The caller was a policewoman named <tips=49>Miyoshi</tips>, who had accompanied <tips=50>Roji</tips> on that earlier visit. Her report followed precisely the course I had expected—until she named the place where <tips=20>Koschei</tips> had caused the incident and then the victim. I froze.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r284","rowIndex":284,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"『場所は児童養護施設。被害者は当直の職員一名です。<tips=55>汐松子</tips>という女性職員で……』","en":"‘The location is a children’s home. There is one victim, a female member of staff who was on night duty. Her name was <tips=55>Matsuko Shio</tips>...’","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r285","rowIndex":285,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　体中の血管からさっと血の気がひく、その存在するはずのない音さえ聞こえそうなほどの驚きだった。","en":"The shock was so great that I could almost hear blood draining from every vessel in my body.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r286","rowIndex":286,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まだ現場はそのままですか？　今から私が行きます。見せてください」","en":"“Has the scene been left untouched? I’m coming now. Let me see it.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r287","rowIndex":287,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕は言葉が終わる前にそう言った。","en":"I said this before she could finish speaking.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r288","rowIndex":288,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"『え、それは……』","en":"‘What? That would be...’","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r289","rowIndex":289,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「見せてくれないのなら、<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>は今後一切警察と協力しませんよ」","en":"“If you refuse, <tips=7>YS</tips> will cease all cooperation with the police from this day forward.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r290","rowIndex":290,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕は携帯電話を片手にそう喋りながら立ち上がり、もう片方で上着を掴んでいた。","en":"I was already on my feet as I spoke, the phone in one hand and my coat in the other.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r291","rowIndex":291,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"『しかしそれは……』","en":"‘But that...’","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r292","rowIndex":292,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=49>三芳</tips>は戸惑ったらしくそこで言葉を途絶えさせる。","en":"<tips=49>Miyoshi</tips> seemed uncertain and broke off there.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r293","rowIndex":293,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　受話器の向こうでかすかに喋る声がする。近くにいると誰かと相談しているらしい。相手は低い男の声で……どうやらそれは<tips=50>路地</tips>のようだった。","en":"I heard a faint voice speaking at the other end. She seemed to be consulting someone nearby. The other speaker had a low male voice... apparently <tips=50>Roji’s</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r294","rowIndex":294,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"『わかりました』","en":"‘Understood.’","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r295","rowIndex":295,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　相手がようやくそう答えたとき、僕はもうすでに部屋を出てエレベーターのボタンを押していた。","en":"By the time she finally answered, I had already left the room and pressed the elevator button.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r297","rowIndex":297,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その辺にいた部下を捕まえ車を運転させて、現場に辿り着いた僕を出迎えたのは<tips=49>三芳</tips>と<tips=50>路地</tips>の二人だった。","en":"I caught a subordinate nearby and made him drive. <tips=49>Miyoshi</tips> and <tips=50>Roji</tips> were waiting when I reached the scene.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r298","rowIndex":298,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕が来るということで、現場検証を一時中断させ、捜査員をよそへ行かせてくれたらしい。僕と警察の付き合いは、全ての警察官が知っているわけではないのか、それとも僕に気を遣ってくれたのかはわからない。","en":"Apparently, because I was coming, they had temporarily suspended the examination and sent the investigators elsewhere. I could not tell whether my relationship with the police was unknown to some officers or whether they had simply gone out of their way to accommodate me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r299","rowIndex":299,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　現場となったのは施設内の管理棟の応接室だそうだ。ここで暮らす子供たちはまだ異変に気づかず眠っているようで、施設のなかは静まりかえっていた。","en":"I was told that the scene was a reception room in the facility’s administration building. The children who lived there seemed not yet to have noticed anything and remained asleep. The entire facility was utterly silent.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r300","rowIndex":300,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　事件時当直をしていた職員たちは警察のパトカーのなかで事情聴取を受けていると<tips=49>三芳</tips>が言った。そのうち一人の田辺という職員は<tips=55>松子</tips>と共に訪れた<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>に出会っており、彼女の口から事件の概要があきらかになったのだそうだ。","en":"<tips=49>Miyoshi</tips> said that the members of staff on duty during the incident were being interviewed inside police cars. One of them, a woman named Tanabe, had encountered <tips=20>Koschei</tips> together with <tips=55>Matsuko</tips>. It was from her account that the police had learned the outline of what happened.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r301","rowIndex":301,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>は最初女の姿であらわれた。インターフォンを押し、児童の母親だと名乗り面会を求めた。時間外だからと一度は断ったが門の前から動こうとせず、仕方なく施設内の応接室に招き入れる。そこで相手は例によって変身し、二人を驚かせた。本性を見せた<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>は二人に襲い掛かり、<tips=55>松子</tips>は田辺だけを建物の外に逃がすと部屋に引き返したそうだ。","en":"<tips=20>Koschei</tips> had initially appeared in the form of a woman. He pressed the intercom, claimed to be a child’s mother, and requested a visit. The staff had refused because visiting hours were over, but the woman would not move from the gate. At last they admitted her to a reception room. There, the visitor transformed in the manner we had come to expect and startled both of them. Once <tips=20>Koschei</tips> revealed his true form, he attacked. <tips=55>Matsuko</tips> helped Tanabe escape from the building, then apparently returned to the room alone.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r302","rowIndex":302,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しばらくたって、何の音もしなくなってから田辺はバット片手に管理棟に戻り、そこで変わり果てた姿になった<tips=55>松子</tips>を発見したという。","en":"After some time had passed and every sound had ceased, Tanabe returned to the administration building carrying a baseball bat and found <tips=55>Matsuko</tips> in a horrifying state.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r303","rowIndex":303,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そのタナベって職員はすごい勇気だな。<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>にバットで立ち向かおうとしたのか」","en":"“That employee Tanabe has remarkable courage. Did she mean to confront <tips=20>Koschei</tips> with a bat?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r304","rowIndex":304,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　応接室までの道すがら説明してくれた<tips=49>三芳</tips>に対して、僕は冗談めかしてそう言ったつもりだったが、自分でも驚くくらい苛立った声になってしまった。","en":"I had meant it as a joke in response to <tips=49>Miyoshi’s</tips> explanation, but it came out with an irritation that surprised even me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r305","rowIndex":305,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……正義感の強い女性のようです。そして、部屋に戻った彼女はそれから……」","en":"“She appears to be a woman with a strong sense of justice. After she returned to the room, she...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"三芳","displayName":"Miyoshi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r306","rowIndex":306,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「もういいです。続きは、見たあとで聞きます」","en":"“That’s enough. I will hear the rest after I’ve seen it.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r307","rowIndex":307,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕はそう遮った。もう僕らは殺人現場となった応接室の前に到着していた。","en":"I interrupted her. We had already arrived outside the reception room where the murder had taken place.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r308","rowIndex":308,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あまりさわらないでください。鑑識がある程度は見ていますが、まだ完全に終わってはいないんです」","en":"“Please don’t touch anything you don’t have to. The forensic team has had a preliminary look, but they aren’t finished yet.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"三芳","displayName":"Miyoshi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r309","rowIndex":309,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=49>三芳</tips>は懐中電灯と白い手袋を手渡しながらそう言った。","en":"<tips=49>Miyoshi</tips> said this as she handed me a flashlight and white gloves.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r310","rowIndex":310,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕は返事をせず、だまってそれを受け取ると自らの手にはめる。そして彼女が持っていた懐中電灯を借りると、自ら応接室のドアを開いた。","en":"I gave no answer. I silently pulled on the gloves, took the flashlight she had been carrying, and opened the door to the reception room myself.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r311","rowIndex":311,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　まっさきに目に飛び込んできたのは、部屋の中央のローテーブルの上で仰向けに倒れる女の姿だった。","en":"The first thing that met my eyes was a woman lying on her back atop the low table at the center of the room.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r312","rowIndex":312,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　下半身には何も身につけておらず、真っ白な足が左右に大きく開かれており、その陰部がちょうどこちらの入り口の方を向いていて、懐中電灯の光の輪で照らすとテラテラと液体が漏れ出ているのが見えた。","en":"She wore nothing upon the lower half of her body. Her white legs had been spread widely apart, her genitals facing the entrance. When the circle of my flashlight passed over them, I saw liquid glistening as it leaked out.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r313","rowIndex":313,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ああ、この服装には見覚えがある。","en":"Ah. I recognized these clothes.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r314","rowIndex":314,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それに気がついた瞬間、僕は数秒そこで立ち止まってしまった。頭の奥がツンと麻痺して、ほとんどなにも考えられなくなったのだ。","en":"The instant I recognized them, I stood frozen for several seconds. Something deep within my head went sharply numb, leaving me nearly unable to think.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r315","rowIndex":315,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　吐き気がする。身体のまわりを取り囲む空気が、ピシピシと音を立ててひび割れてしまいそうだ。","en":"Nausea rose through me. The air enclosing my body seemed ready to crack apart with a brittle sound.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r316","rowIndex":316,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕はまるで深海の底に突き落とされてしまったような圧迫感を全身に感じながら、ぎこちなく身体を動かしてその女に近づく。靴底にジャラリとガラスのようなものを踏む感触があり、そこではじめて僕は部屋がおそろしく荒れ果てているのに気がついた。","en":"Feeling as though the pressure of the deepest sea had closed over my entire body, I moved stiffly toward the woman. Something like glass shifted and grated beneath my sole. Only then did I realize how terribly the room had been wrecked.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r317","rowIndex":317,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　近づいて、仰向けに天井を見つめている被害者の顔にライトの光を当てる。","en":"I came closer and turned the flashlight on the victim’s face as she stared sightlessly at the ceiling.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r318","rowIndex":318,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　服装や体つきでほとんど確信してはいたが、その顔を見たことで、もう完全に他のどんな可能性も存在しないことを認めざるをえなかった。","en":"Her clothing and build had already left me almost certain. Seeing her face forced me to admit that no other possibility remained.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r319","rowIndex":319,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　死んでいるのは<tips=55>汐松子</tips>だった。","en":"The dead woman was <tips=55>Matsuko Shio</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r320","rowIndex":320,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女はここで<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>に殺され、そして死体を陵辱されたのだ。","en":"<tips=20>Koschei</tips> had killed her here, then violated her corpse.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r321","rowIndex":321,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>は自分が<tips=55>汐さん</tips>の母だと名乗ったらしい。そして女の姿になって彼女と会話を交わしたそうだ。おそらく<tips=18>ローズ・クラブ</tips>にいた東洋人の女だろう。おれが出会った女だ」","en":"“It seems <tips=20>Koschei</tips> claimed to be <tips=55>Ms. Shio’s</tips> mother. Apparently he took a woman’s form and spoke with her. The form was probably that of the Asian woman from the <tips=18>Rose Club</tips>—the woman I encountered.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r322","rowIndex":322,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　いつの間にか<tips=50>路地</tips>が僕に並んで遺体を見下ろしていた。","en":"Before I knew it, <tips=50>Roji</tips> was standing beside me, looking down at the body.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r323","rowIndex":323,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「さわるな、と言われましたが……」","en":"“They told me not to touch anything, but...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r324","rowIndex":324,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕はジャケットを脱いで、<tips=55>松子</tips>の下半身を隠してやった。いくらなんでもこの格好はあまりにもあわれだ。","en":"I removed my jacket and covered <tips=55>Matsuko’s</tips> lower body. This was too pitiful a state to leave her in.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r325","rowIndex":325,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「すまない」","en":"“I’m sorry.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r326","rowIndex":326,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=50>路地</tips>は感情を抑えた声で言う。","en":"<tips=50>Roji</tips> spoke in a voice held tightly in check.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r327","rowIndex":327,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=55>汐さん</tips>と<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>に何かの関わりがあるのはおれも知っていた。彼女にもっと気をつけるよう言っておけば、あるいは……」","en":"“I knew that <tips=55>Ms. Shio</tips> and <tips=20>Koschei</tips> had some kind of connection. If only I’d warned her to be more careful, perhaps...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r328","rowIndex":328,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その言葉を僕は遮る。","en":"I cut him off.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r329","rowIndex":329,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それは私も同じですよ。少し考えれば襲撃は想定出来ましたし、何か忠告も言えたでしょう。……でも、話によると彼女は逃げられたのに舞い戻って決着をつけようとしたそうじゃないですか。それならば、結局何を忠告したところで結果はそうかわらなかったかもしれません。こいつは妙なところが頑固でしたから」","en":"“The same is true of me. If I’d stopped to think, I could have anticipated the attack and offered some warning. ...But according to the account, she escaped and then went back to settle matters herself. If that is true, no warning might have changed the outcome very much. She was stubborn about the strangest things.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r330","rowIndex":330,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕は振り返って苦笑してみせた。","en":"I turned back and gave him a wry smile.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r331","rowIndex":331,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あなたと被害者の関係は<tips=50>路地</tips>さんから伺いました。子供のときから親しかったんですね。こんなことになってしまって、何とお悔やみを申し上げていいのやら……」","en":"“Mr. <tips=50>Roji</tips> told me about your relationship with the victim. You were close from childhood, weren’t you? After something like this... I hardly know what to say.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r332","rowIndex":332,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=49>三芳</tips>が少し離れた場所から僕を見ている。","en":"<tips=49>Miyoshi</tips> watched me from a short distance away.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r333","rowIndex":333,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「悪いが、彼女との関係は調べさせてもらった」","en":"“I’m sorry, but I looked into your relationship with her.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r334","rowIndex":334,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=50>路地</tips>は妙に目をギラギラと光らせて僕を見ている。","en":"<tips=50>Roji</tips> stared at me, his eyes shining with a strange, fierce light.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r335","rowIndex":335,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「別に悪くはないですよ。それが探偵の仕事ですからね」","en":"“There’s nothing wrong with that. It’s what detectives do.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r336","rowIndex":336,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕は肩をすくめ、","en":"I shrugged and said,","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r337","rowIndex":337,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それよりも、問題は、彼女がどうやって死んだのかってことです。この<tips=55>汐松子</tips>っていうのはね、普通のやりかたじゃ死ぬはずがないんだ。……父が<tips=18>ローズ・クラブ</tips>を襲撃したとき、不死身のはずの女たちが大量に殺されていたといいます。同じ手を使ったんだと思いますが……それが、なんなのか……」","en":"“More importantly, the question is how she died. You see, this woman named <tips=55>Matsuko Shio</tips> should not have been able to die by ordinary means. ...They say that when my father attacked the <tips=18>Rose Club</tips>, many women who should have been immortal were killed. I believe Koschei used the same method. But what was it...?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r338","rowIndex":338,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あんたは冷静だな」","en":"“You’re awfully calm.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r339","rowIndex":339,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=50>路地</tips>はその血走る目で僕を見ながら言う。","en":"<tips=50>Roji</tips> said this, staring at me with bloodshot eyes.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r340","rowIndex":340,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「大事な人間を亡くしたのに、そんな風に振る舞うことが出来るのか。おれは、とてもそんなふうには……」","en":"“Can you really behave that way after losing someone dear to you? I could never...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r341","rowIndex":341,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　語尾が感情で乱れた。","en":"His voice faltered with emotion at the end.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r342","rowIndex":342,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕はそのときはじめて、彼の目の奥に溢れ出てきそうなほどの憎悪と怒りが渦巻いているのを感じた。きっとさっきからこの表情をしていただろうけれど、僕は目の前のことに夢中でまったく気がつかなかったのだ。","en":"Only then did I sense the hatred and rage swirling behind his eyes, so fierce they seemed ready to overflow. He had probably looked this way all along, but I had been consumed by what stood before me and never noticed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r343","rowIndex":343,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうですか。冷静に見えますか。それならよかった」","en":"“I see. Do I look calm? Good.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r344","rowIndex":344,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕は薄く笑って見せた。","en":"I give him a thin smile.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r345","rowIndex":345,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　世の中に、肉親のようにずっと暮らして来た大事な人間がこんな目にあって平気でいられる人間などいるのだろうか？","en":"Could anyone in the world remain unmoved when someone precious, someone with whom they had lived as family, was reduced to this?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r346","rowIndex":346,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=4>馬明</tips>の時に僕は大分こういった感情に慣れたつもりだったが、全然ダメだ。","en":"I had thought <tips=4>Ma Ming’s</tips> death had accustomed me to feelings like these. It had done nothing of the kind.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r347","rowIndex":347,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　口の中が乾き、こめかみのあたりがジンジンとする。<tips=55>松子</tips>をこんなふうにした。<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>のことを思うだけで、ドロドロと暗い暴力的な感情がわく。僕は滅多に他人にこんな感情を持つことはないが、これが憎悪なのだろう。","en":"My mouth was dry, and my temples throbbed. Koschei had done this to <tips=55>Matsuko</tips>. At the mere thought of <tips=20>Koschei</tips>, a dark, violent emotion welled up inside me, thick and viscous. I very rarely felt anything like this toward another person, but perhaps this was hatred.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r348","rowIndex":348,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　こういった感情が態度に出ていないのは良かったと思う。僕はギャングのボスで、沢山の罪もない抗争相手を殺している。身内が死んだからといってめそめそ泣いていたら人は侮るだろう。――いや、父さんならば、身内が死ねば涙を流して泣き、敵を殺せば大いに喜んでいたのだろうか？　そういうやりかたもリーダーの魅力になるのだろうが、僕は出来ない。","en":"Perhaps it was fortunate that none of these feelings showed in my manner. I was the head of a gang. I had killed many innocent opponents in our conflicts. If I wept because one of my own had died, people would look down on me. No—when one of his own died, Father would probably weep openly, then rejoice extravagantly when he killed an enemy. That sort of emotional display might itself be part of a leader’s charisma, but I could not do it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r349","rowIndex":349,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「お前は可愛げがないな」","en":"“You haven’t got a lovable bone in your body.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r350","rowIndex":350,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　小さな頃、たまに会う父さんがそう顔を顰めたのを思い出した。僕は家族と離れても、一言も寂しいと言ったことはなかった。","en":"I remembered Father scowling and saying that during one of his occasional visits when I was small. Even after being separated from my family, I had never once said that I was lonely.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r351","rowIndex":351,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「良かったら、その田辺という人の話を聞かせてもらえませんか？　いろいろと確かめたいことがある」","en":"“If you don’t mind, could I hear Tanabe’s account? There are several things I need to confirm.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r352","rowIndex":352,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕はそう言って、最後に<tips=55>松子</tips>の髪を撫でてから、その痛ましい現場から顔を背けた。","en":"With that, I stroked <tips=55>Matsuko’s</tips> hair one final time, then turned away from the harrowing scene.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r353","rowIndex":353,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして入り口の方へ数歩あるいたところで、爪先に何かを蹴飛ばす。","en":"After taking several steps toward the entrance, I kicked something with the toe of my shoe.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r354","rowIndex":354,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　拾い上げると、それは白濁したプラスチックで出来た使い捨ての小さな注射器だった。","en":"I picked it up. It was a small disposable syringe made of milky-white plastic.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r355","rowIndex":355,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　先端には細い針が取り付けられ、微かに薬液が残っている。この施設には似つかわしくないものだから、事件と関係したものだろう。鑑識が見落としたのだろうか？　無能というより、僕が訪れるということでバタバタとさせてしまったのかもしれない。","en":"A fine needle was attached to its tip, and a trace of liquid remained inside. Such an object did not belong in this facility, so it was probably connected to the incident. Had forensics overlooked it? Perhaps it was less incompetence than the confusion I had caused by insisting on a visit.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r356","rowIndex":356,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どうしました？」","en":"“What is it?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"三芳","displayName":"Miyoshi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r357","rowIndex":357,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=49>三芳</tips>が僕に尋ねる。懐中電灯を持っているのは僕だけで、何をしているのかよく見えなかったのだろう。","en":"<tips=49>Miyoshi</tips> asked. I alone held a flashlight, so she probably could not see what I was doing.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r358","rowIndex":358,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ボタンがとれて」","en":"“A button came off.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r359","rowIndex":359,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕はそう誤魔化し、針を刺さぬよう気をつけながら注射器をポケットに隠し、部屋を出た。","en":"I lied, carefully hid the syringe in my pocket without pricking myself, and left the room.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r360","rowIndex":360,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕はすぐに<tips=54>汐さん</tips>を訪ねた。","en":"I immediately went to see <tips=54>Mr. Shio</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r361","rowIndex":361,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕の立場からすればそう頻繁に訪れるべきではない場所だが、<tips=55>松子</tips>がこうなってしまった以上、忌避している場合ではない。","en":"Given my position, it was not a place I ought to visit so frequently, but with <tips=55>Matsuko</tips> reduced to this, I could no longer afford to avoid it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r362","rowIndex":362,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕は警察に見せられたものについて話し、そして、注射器に入っていた薬液の成分を二人で調べた。すると、それが『<tips=46>ネオ・ローズ</tips>』であると判明した。","en":"I told him what the police had shown me, and together we analyzed the liquid inside the syringe. It proved to be <tips=46>Neo Rose</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r363","rowIndex":363,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>が現場で使用したのだろうかと当初は思ったが、注射針についた血液を解析するとまったく別の状況が明らかになった。","en":"At first, I wondered whether <tips=20>Koschei</tips> had used the syringe at the scene. Analysis of the blood on its needle, however, revealed an entirely different situation.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r364","rowIndex":364,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　この血液の正体を突き止めるには警察のデータと照合するなど、なかなか手のかかる作業があるのではないかと考えていたが、その必要はなかった。万が一のことを考えて、最初に手持ちのデータと照合したら、その時点で誰の血液なのか判明してしまったのである。","en":"I had assumed identifying the blood would be a laborious business—cross-checking it against police records and the like—but none of that proved necessary. On the off chance, we began by comparing it with the data we already had. That alone told us whose blood it was.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r365","rowIndex":365,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そう、それは、<tips=55>松子</tips>のものだった。この汐邸の地下室のコンピュータに保存された遺伝子情報と、寸分違わず一致したのである。","en":"Yes. It belonged to <tips=55>Matsuko</tips>. It was an exact match for the genetic data stored on the computer in the basement of the Shio residence.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r366","rowIndex":366,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　現場で<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>は<tips=55>松子</tips>に<tips=46>ネオ・ローズ</tips>を使用したのだ。その目的はいくつか考えられたが、僕と<tips=54>汐さん</tips>の予測は一致していた。","en":"<tips=20>Koschei</tips> had administered <tips=46>Neo Rose</tips> to <tips=55>Matsuko</tips> at the scene. We could think of several possible reasons, but <tips=54>Mr. Shio</tips> and I had reached the same conclusion.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r367","rowIndex":367,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　つまり、この<tips=46>ネオ・ローズ</tips>こそが、<tips=55>松子</tips>の再生能力を奪い、死に至らしめるための道具なんじゃないか？","en":"Could <tips=46>Neo Rose</tips> be the very thing that had robbed <tips=55>Matsuko</tips> of her regenerative power and killed her?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r368","rowIndex":368,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　この薬が、<tips=17>タイプB</tips>の様々な症状を取り除くことは知られている。それがどういう理屈で作用しているのか、その機序はまったく不明なのだけれど、再生能力がもし<tips=17>タイプB</tips>の症状の一つであるならば、あるいはそれを打ち消すことも出来るのかもしれない。","en":"It was known that this drug eliminated a range of <tips=17>Type B</tips> symptoms. No one knew how it worked; its mechanism remained completely obscure. But if regenerative ability was itself one of the symptoms of <tips=17>Type B</tips>, perhaps the drug could negate that as well.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r369","rowIndex":369,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　この仮説は、すぐに証明する機会が訪れた。","en":"An opportunity to test the hypothesis soon presented itself.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r370","rowIndex":370,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　地下室に足を踏み入れる。","en":"I step into the basement.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r371","rowIndex":371,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　明かりがないと部屋のなかは真っ暗だが、ところどころに装置のランプが光り、低い作動音を鳴り響かせている。","en":"Without the lights, the room is pitch-black, but indicator lamps glow here and there on the equipment, and a low mechanical hum reverberates through the darkness.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r372","rowIndex":372,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　何度足を運んだかわからないこの部屋で、照明のスイッチの場所を身体は覚えていて、ほとんど無意識に人差し指が探り当ててパチリと押し込む。","en":"I have been here more times than I can count, and my body remembers where the light switch is. Almost unconsciously, my forefinger finds it and snaps it on.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r373","rowIndex":373,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　青みがかった光の照らされたその部屋は、あちこちに書類が開いたままになっていたり、片付け忘れた器具が机の上に置いたままになっていたが、それでも上のリビングルームよりは片付いていた。","en":"In the bluish light, papers lie open here and there, and instruments someone forgot to put away remain scattered across the desks. Even so, the room is tidier than the living room upstairs.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r374","rowIndex":374,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　奥の方に、かつて<tips=55>汐松子</tips>を肉片から再生した培養器が設置されている。あまり頻繁に使われることのないその大きな装置に、今は作動中を示す赤いランプが点灯し、ときおりごぽごぽと気泡が音を立てていた。","en":"At the back stands the culture tank once used to regenerate <tips=55>Matsuko Shio</tips> from a scrap of flesh. The huge machine sees little use, but now its red operating light is on, and every so often bubbles gurgle inside it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r375","rowIndex":375,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その中に、彼はいた。いや、あるいは彼女と言おうか？　いくつもの姿をもつその人物の性別を問うのは無意味かもしれない。今は金色の髪とほっそりとした白い肌を持つ少年の姿で、胎児のように膝を抱えて丸くなった姿で培養器のなかで目を閉じている。","en":"There he is. Or should I call him she? Perhaps it is meaningless to ask the sex of someone with so many forms. At the moment, he wears the form of a slender boy with golden hair and pale skin, curled up with his knees to his chest like a fetus, eyes closed inside the tank.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r376","rowIndex":376,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=98>アレクサンドル・ヤコヴレヴィチ・チェルヌイフ</tips>――というのがその名らしい。調査結果の内容が正しければ、これが顔のない不死身の殺人鬼『<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>』のオリジナルとされている姿だ。","en":"<tips=98>Aleksandr Yakovlevich Chernykh</tips>—that appears to be his name. If the findings of our investigation are correct, this is supposedly the original form of the faceless, immortal killer known as <tips=20>Koschei</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r377","rowIndex":377,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　先代エリー・ホワイトは元々ロシアで活動しており、今の<tips=31>エリー・ホワイト</tips>もそのスタッフとコネクションを受け継いでいる。つまりロシアの裏社会とは少なからず繋がりがあり、必要とあれば銃や弾薬などの物品だけでなく、情報も調達することが出来た。","en":"The former Ellie White had originally operated in Russia, and the present <tips=31>Ellie White</tips> inherited her staff and contacts. That leaves her with considerable ties to the Russian underworld: when necessary, she can procure not only guns, ammunition, and other goods, but information as well.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r378","rowIndex":378,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その情報によると、<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>はあの『<tips=19>フセスラフ計画</tips>』の被検体であったという。","en":"According to that information, <tips=20>Koschei</tips> had been a subject of the <tips=19>Vseslav Project</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r379","rowIndex":379,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"『<tips=19>フセスラフ計画</tips>』というのは、ミュータントの解明、および利用のためにロシア政府と製薬会社が共同して立ち上げたプロジェクトのことで、常に人体実験の黒い噂がつきまとう悪名高いものであった。","en":"The <tips=19>Vseslav Project</tips> was a joint undertaking established by the Russian government and a pharmaceutical company to understand mutants and put them to use. It was notorious, dogged at every turn by sinister rumors of human experimentation.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r380","rowIndex":380,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　とっくの昔に計画は中止され、今となっては半ば都市伝説のようになっており、ロシアで異常なミュータントが生まれるたびに何の根拠もなく関係が取り沙汰されたりもする。<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>に関しても、そのたぐいの、世間の好奇心が生んだ噂でしかないのかもしれないが、しかしいくつか具体的な情報も含まれていた。","en":"The project was discontinued long ago and has since become half urban legend. Whenever some aberrant mutant appears in Russia, people invoke Vseslav without a shred of evidence. The rumors surrounding <tips=20>Koschei</tips> may likewise be nothing more than a product of public curiosity. And yet the intelligence contained several concrete details.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r381","rowIndex":381,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"『<tips=98>アレクサンドル・ヤコヴレヴィチ・チェルヌイフ</tips>』という名も、その情報の一つである。","en":"The name <tips=98>Aleksandr Yakovlevich Chernykh</tips> was one such detail.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r382","rowIndex":382,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　世間で知られている『<tips=19>フセスラフ計画</tips>』のあらましはこうだ。","en":"What the public knows of the <tips=19>Vseslav Project</tips> goes like this.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r383","rowIndex":383,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　――かつて、ロシアの田舎町に『チェルヌイフ家』という一家が住んでいた。その家族は不死身の吸血鬼で、古い時代では領主として権力をふるい、地域では大層恐れられていた。その一家に『<tips=98>アレクサンドル</tips>』という子供がいて、これが街から連れ去られ、政府の研究所で被検体として実験に使われることになった。これが後に『<tips=19>フセスラフ計画</tips>』と命名された――というのだ。一種の伝説であろう。","en":"Long ago, a family called the Chernykhs lived in a provincial Russian town. They were immortal vampires. In ages past they had ruled as feudal lords, inspiring great fear throughout the region. Among them was a child named <tips=98>Aleksandr</tips>, who was abducted from the town and made a test subject at a government laboratory. This undertaking would later be christened the <tips=19>Vseslav Project</tips>—or so the story went. A legend of sorts, presumably.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r384","rowIndex":384,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　不死身の吸血鬼というのは、僕と<tips=54>汐さん</tips>が調べた『<tips=97>特殊タイプＢ</tips>』の性質と似通ったものがあるし、いかにもそれらしい物語である。","en":"This business of immortal vampires bears a certain resemblance to the traits <tips=54>Mr. Shio</tips> and I found in ‘<tips=97>special Type Bs</tips>,’ which gives the story a convincing ring.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r385","rowIndex":385,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　が、実際に詳しく調べさせたところ、そのチェルヌイフ家の存在を発見することは出来なかった。","en":"Yet when I had the matter investigated in detail, no evidence that the Chernykh family had existed could be found.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r386","rowIndex":386,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　伝説によると、チェルヌイフ家はロシア西部のグレートホール近辺の街に存在したということになっている。しかし、現実にはそのあたりは人の出入りが激しい新興住宅地で、<tips=8>グレートホール</tips>が生まれる前まで遡っても、繰り返された内戦によって住人が何度も入れ替わり、その都度街の有力者は処刑されている。そもそも、当地においてはチェルヌイフ家に限らず、中世から続く貴族の家系というようなもの自体が存在しないのだ。","en":"According to the legend, the Chernykh family lived in a town near the Great Hole in western Russia. In reality, the area is a new residential district with a highly transient population. Even if we go back to before the <tips=8>Great Hole</tips> appeared, repeated civil wars replaced the inhabitants time and again, and each time the town’s leading figures were executed. The region has no aristocratic lines stretching back to the Middle Ages at all, Chernykh or otherwise.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r387","rowIndex":387,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>が不死身の一族の末裔というのは結局ただの物語だったと考えるのが自然だろう。一族の話が嘘だとしても、その土地の出身であるというようなかたちでの繋がりはあるのかもしれないが、それに関しては証明するものが何もない。","en":"The natural conclusion is that <tips=20>Koschei’s</tips> descent from a family of immortals is nothing more than a story. Even if the family itself is fiction, he may still have some other connection to the region—perhaps he came from there—but there is nothing to prove it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r388","rowIndex":388,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しかし、だからと言って<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>自体が<tips=19>フセスラフ計画</tips>と全く無関係だったとは断言出来ない。いやむしろ、彼のサイキックとしても異質な能力や、<tips=46>ネオ・ローズ</tips>という一般には知り得ない薬の製法を知っていることを思うと、関わっていたと考えた方が自然かもしれない。","en":"That does not, however, allow us to say that <tips=20>Koschei</tips> had nothing whatsoever to do with the <tips=19>Vseslav Project</tips>. On the contrary: given abilities aberrant even by psychic standards, and his knowledge of how to manufacture <tips=46>Neo Rose</tips>—a secret no ordinary person could possibly possess—it may be more natural to assume that he was involved.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r389","rowIndex":389,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=19>フセスラフ計画</tips>は、そのプロジェクトにかかわるものは研究者から掃除係まで、全ての役職において積極的にミュータントを採用していたという事実がある。「<tips=19>フセスラフ計画</tips>は差別を受けているミュータントの地位向上のためのプロジェクトである」というのが政府の建前で、その一環としてミュータントを多くとっていたのだ。","en":"The <tips=19>Vseslav Project</tips> is known to have actively recruited mutants for every position connected with it, from researchers to cleaners. The government’s official line was that the <tips=19>Vseslav Project</tips> existed to improve the standing of mutants who faced discrimination, and hiring mutants in large numbers formed part of that policy.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r390","rowIndex":390,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>がどういう立場だったのかはわからないが、計画には関わっていたのだろう。僕たちも調べてみたけれど、さすがに国家の極秘プロジェクトの詳しい内情までは知ることが出来なかった。","en":"I did not know what position <tips=20>Koschei</tips> had held, but he had probably been involved in the project. We investigated, but even we could not uncover the inner workings of a top-secret government program.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r391","rowIndex":391,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　なんにしろ、チェルヌイフ家のストーリーが崩れてしまった以上、<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>のオリジナルが『<tips=98>アレクサンドル・ヤコヴレヴィチ・チェルヌイフ</tips>』という名前であるという話さえ信用出来なくなってくる。その姿も、彼の想像が作り出した変身先の一つなのかもしれない。","en":"In any case, once the story of the Chernykh family falls apart, even the claim that <tips=20>Koschei’s</tips> original bore the name <tips=98>Aleksandr Yakovlevich Chernykh</tips> becomes difficult to trust. That appearance, too, may be merely one more transformation conjured by his imagination.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r392","rowIndex":392,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　つまり、結局『<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>』は正体不明の怪人のままでしかないということだ。","en":"In the end, then, <tips=20>Koschei</tips> remains a mysterious figure whose true identity is unknown.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r393","rowIndex":393,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　オリジナルの姿は結局どれなのかわからない。<tips=65>ヘス</tips>と名乗る<tips=21>八龍会</tips>に近づいたユダヤ人風の老人なのか、<tips=64>アレクセイ</tips>という快楽殺人鬼の白人青年か、恐るべきサイキック能力を持った少女<tips=62>マリア</tips>か、<tips=60>ロジャー・アダムス</tips>をそそのかした<tips=61>ヒトミ</tips>という東洋人の女か、それとも噂通り<tips=98>アレクサンドル</tips>少年なのか、確定させる情報はない。","en":"Which of his forms was the original remains unknown. Was it the old man who looked Jewish, who approached the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips> under the name <tips=65>Hess</tips>? The young white man <tips=64>Alexei</tips>, a thrill killer? <tips=62>Maria</tips>, the girl with terrifying psychic powers? The Asian woman <tips=61>Hitomi</tips>, who incited <tips=60>Roger Adams</tips>? Or was it, as rumor has it, the boy <tips=98>Aleksandr</tips>? There is no evidence that settles the question.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r394","rowIndex":394,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　生まれた時にそれが男であったか女であったのかもわからない。あるいは最初から複数の姿をもっていたのかもしれない。いつ生まれたのかもわからない。それこそ五十年どころか、もっと遠い昔に生まれたのかもしれない。","en":"We do not even know whether that being was male or female at birth. Perhaps it possessed multiple forms from the very beginning. Nor do we know when it was born. It may have been born not merely fifty years ago, but in some far more distant past.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r395","rowIndex":395,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その何ともしれない存在が、いまこのガラスの筒のなかで眠っている。","en":"That unknowable being now lies asleep inside this glass cylinder.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r396","rowIndex":396,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕はこれにどう接するべきだろう？","en":"What am I to do with it?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r397","rowIndex":397,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　こいつは<tips=39>ジェフリー</tips>や<tips=55>松子</tips>、そして多くの部下たちを殺したにっくき仇敵である。この手で引き裂いたって飽き足らない。ここであらゆる実験の対象としていたぶり続け、僕の復讐心と、そしてギャングになってからは久しく忘れていた科学的好奇心を同時に満たす玩具とするのもいい。","en":"This is the hated enemy who killed <tips=39>Jeffrey</tips>, <tips=55>Matsuko</tips>, and so many of my men. Even tearing him apart with my own hands would not be enough. I could keep him here, torment him with every experiment imaginable, and make him a plaything to satisfy both my thirst for revenge and the scientific curiosity I have all but forgotten since becoming a gangster.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r398","rowIndex":398,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　約束通り警察に引き渡すつもりはなかった。","en":"I have no intention of turning him over to the police as promised.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r399","rowIndex":399,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　警察は今でこそこのような協定を結んでいるけれど、将来的にはこの関係は崩れてしまうだろう。今回、僕らは<tips=21>八龍会</tips>という長らく最大の反抗勢力だった組織を取り込もうとしている。これが無事に成功すれば、<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>の支配力はかつてないほどに強固なものとなり、<tips=9>Y地区</tips>での争いは激減する。つまりそれは、<tips=9>Y地区</tips>の繁華街としての価値をさらに高めるということだ。そうなれば、これまで躊躇していた企業や組織も、この街に進出しようとするだろう。","en":"The police may have entered into this arrangement with us for now, but sooner or later the relationship will break down. We are currently trying to bring the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips>—the organization that for years represented the greatest resistance to us—into the fold. If we succeed, <tips=7>YS’s</tips> control will be stronger than ever, and conflict in <tips=9>Y District</tips> will decline sharply. In other words, <tips=9>Y District’s</tips> value as an entertainment district will rise still further. Companies and organizations that have held back until now will begin looking to move into the city.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r400","rowIndex":400,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして、そうした一般企業が街に入り込めば、最初はいいだろうが、いずれ<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>の存在が邪魔になるはずだ。その時警察がどちらの味方につくかなんて、想像するまでもないことだ。今<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>を売ったからといって、恩義に感じて判断を変えてくれるような連中でもあるまい。","en":"Once ordinary businesses begin moving in, things may go well at first, but sooner or later <tips=7>YS’s</tips> presence will become an obstacle to them. Which side the police will take then hardly needs imagining. And handing over <tips=20>Koschei</tips> now will not make them feel indebted enough to decide otherwise.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r401","rowIndex":401,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それに、警察に売り渡すより、もっといい条件で取引出来る相手はいくらでも存在する。なんといっても、彼は『<tips=46>ネオ・ローズ</tips>』の秘密を知る貴重な存在であり、その肉体自体にもミュータントの秘密がつまっているのだ。ただ、おかしなところに売りつければ<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>は自らの力で脱出し、再び僕らの脅威として現れることになるだろうから、相手選びは慎重にしなくてはいけないが。","en":"Besides, there are any number of buyers who would offer better terms than the police. He is a precious asset who knows the secret of <tips=46>Neo Rose</tips>, and his body itself is a repository of mutant secrets. I will have to choose the buyer carefully, though. Sell him to the wrong party, and <tips=20>Koschei</tips> will escape by his own power and reappear as a threat to us.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r402","rowIndex":402,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕は椅子に腰掛け、眠るように水中に浮かんでいる<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>の姿をぼんやりと眺めた。","en":"I sat in a chair and gazed absently at <tips=20>Koschei</tips> floating in the fluid as though asleep.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r403","rowIndex":403,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　いろいろと考えてはいたが、実際にはまだ<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>には大したことはしていない。<tips=21>八龍会</tips>の<tips=46>ネオ・ローズ</tips>工場で回収してから、ずっと培養器のなかで寝かせている。","en":"I have considered all sorts of possibilities, but in truth we have yet to do much to <tips=20>Koschei</tips>. Ever since we recovered him from the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society’s</tips> <tips=46>Neo Rose</tips> factory, we have kept him asleep inside the culture tank.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r404","rowIndex":404,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おそらく<tips=46>ネオ・ローズ</tips>のレシピを吐かせるために行われたと思われる拷問の傷跡は、もうすっかり癒えている。目を覚まされては面倒なので、微量の麻酔薬を投与し続け、眠らせたままデータをとっている。","en":"The marks left by what was presumably torture intended to make him surrender the <tips=46>Neo Rose</tips> formula have completely healed. Letting him wake would be troublesome, so we keep him under with a continuous trace dose of anesthetic and collect data while he sleeps.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r405","rowIndex":405,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　今のところ、<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>に行った実験は一つだけだ。","en":"So far, we have performed only one experiment on <tips=20>Koschei</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r406","rowIndex":406,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=46>ネオ・ローズ</tips>が本当に不死の力を奪うのか、その確認である。","en":"We wanted to determine whether <tips=46>Neo Rose</tips> truly robbed its subject of immortality.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r407","rowIndex":407,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=55>松子</tips>の遺体の傍で<tips=46>ネオ・ローズ</tips>入りの注射器を拾った時、僕と<tips=54>汐さん</tips>はこの薬が不死を奪うのではないかと予想し、そしてたまたま目の前にこの<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>がいた。だから仮説の確認のために、<tips=46>ネオ・ローズ</tips>を彼に投与したのだ。","en":"When we found a syringe of <tips=46>Neo Rose</tips> beside <tips=55>Matsuko’s</tips> body, <tips=54>Mr. Shio</tips> and I suspected the drug might rob a person of immortality. And as it happened, we had <tips=20>Koschei</tips> right there in front of us. So we administered <tips=46>Neo Rose</tips> to him and put our hypothesis to the test.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r408","rowIndex":408,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その結果はドンピシャだった。","en":"The result was dead on.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r409","rowIndex":409,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　投与する前はどんなに深い傷もあっという間に再生してしまっていたのに、投与後に腕の甲につけた切り傷は、今でもまだ治っていない。","en":"Before the dose, even the deepest wound regenerated in an instant. But the cut we made on the back of his forearm afterward has yet to heal.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r410","rowIndex":410,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　やはり、<tips=46>ネオ・ローズ</tips>は再生力を奪うのだ。僕らの仮説は正しく、<tips=55>松子</tips>を確実に殺すためにこの薬は使われたのである。","en":"So <tips=46>Neo Rose</tips> did strip away regenerative power. Our hypothesis was correct: the drug had been used to ensure that <tips=55>Matsuko</tips> died.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r411","rowIndex":411,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それともう一つ、<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>には変化があった。","en":"There was one other change in <tips=20>Koschei</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r412","rowIndex":412,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼は培養液のなかで眠りながら、女の姿やら老人の姿やら、その姿をめまぐるしく変化させていたのだ。だが、<tips=46>ネオ・ローズ</tips>を投与した途端それがなくなって、投与時の<tips=98>アレクサンドル</tips>少年のまま固定されている。","en":"As he slept in the culture fluid, his form had shifted at dizzying speed—a woman, an old man, one figure after another. The instant we administered <tips=46>Neo Rose</tips>, however, the transformations ceased. Ever since, he has remained fixed in the form he wore at the moment of the dose: the boy <tips=98>Aleksandr</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r413","rowIndex":413,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=46>ネオ・ローズ</tips>の効果が本当に<tips=17>タイプＢ</tips>の症状を消すというものならば、その変身能力も、彼の<tips=17>タイプB</tips>としての性質から生まれたものだったのかもしれない。","en":"If <tips=46>Neo Rose</tips> truly worked by eliminating <tips=17>Type B</tips> symptoms, perhaps his power of transformation too arose from his nature as a <tips=17>Type B</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r414","rowIndex":414,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そのうち<tips=46>ネオ・ローズ</tips>の効果が切れ、また彼は変身をするようになるだろう。そうしたら、今度はかつてこの街に蔓延した旧<tips=45>ローズ</tips>の方を使ってみたい。おそらく、同じような結果が出るだろうと考えている。かつて<tips=18>ローズ・クラブ</tips>で不死の筈の女が大量に殺されていた時に使われていたのは、時代的に考えると<tips=46>ネオ</tips>ではなく旧<tips=45>ローズ</tips>の方でしかありえないからだ。","en":"In time, the effects of <tips=46>Neo Rose</tips> will wear off, and he will begin transforming again. When that happens, I want to try the old <tips=45>Rose</tips> that once flooded this city. I expect much the same result. Given the period, the drug used when so many supposedly immortal women were killed at the <tips=18>Rose Club</tips> can only have been the old <tips=45>Rose</tips>, not <tips=46>Neo Rose</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r415","rowIndex":415,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　この<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>を実験材料として使えば、<tips=97>特殊タイプＢ</tips>に関する様々な事実を解明することが出来るだろう。","en":"With <tips=20>Koschei</tips> as a test subject, we should be able to uncover all manner of facts about <tips=97>special Type Bs</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r416","rowIndex":416,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　もしかしたら、この使い方が、<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>のために交渉材料とするよりも、よほど正しい<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>の使い道なのかもしれない。<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>によって、僕らは<tips=55>松子</tips>のことをより深く理解するのだ。これより正しい復讐の仕方もないだろう。それに、何より、こいつは失われた<tips=55>松子</tips>の仇であるとともに、肉親なのだ。このままここで、そばに置いておくのも悪くない。","en":"Perhaps this is a far more proper use for <tips=20>Koschei</tips> than turning him into a bargaining chip for <tips=7>YS</tips>. Through <tips=20>Koschei</tips>, we will come to understand <tips=55>Matsuko</tips> more deeply. What form of revenge could be more fitting? Above all, this man is both the enemy who killed <tips=55>Matsuko</tips> and a blood relative of hers. Keeping him here, close at hand, may not be so bad.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r417","rowIndex":417,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ちょっと前までそう考えていたのだが、しかし、今の僕は、研究材料にするでも、交渉材料にするでもない第三の使い道のことを考えていた。","en":"That was what I thought until a short while ago. Now, however, I am considering a third use for him—neither as a test subject nor as a bargaining chip.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r418","rowIndex":418,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それは実現する可能性がどの程度あるのかもわからない、おぼろげなプランである。もしかしたら、ただの妄想で全く実現の余地などないのかもしれない。","en":"It is only a hazy plan, and I have no idea what chance it has of succeeding. Perhaps it is nothing but a fantasy, with no possibility of realization at all.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r419","rowIndex":419,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　他のことならどんなことでも、実現性を確率として予測できるのだけれど、これに関してはまったく通用しない。","en":"With anything else, I can put a number on the odds of its happening. But when it comes to this, that faculty fails me completely.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r420","rowIndex":420,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　推測する材料がないからじゃない。いつも通りならある程度の推測は出来る状況だと思うのだが、どうも、今回ばかりは自信がない。","en":"Not for lack of material to go on. Under ordinary circumstances, I would say there is enough here to make some sort of estimate. But this once, I simply have no confidence in it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r421","rowIndex":421,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それは、僕の思考に、強烈な感情が濃密に絡みついているからだ。","en":"Because powerful emotions have wound themselves thickly around my thoughts.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r422","rowIndex":422,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　人間というものは、完全に理性的にはなれない。私情が入ると、冷静に判断しているつもりでも、どうしても普段と違ってしまう。","en":"Human beings can never become perfectly rational. Once personal feelings enter into things, however calmly we may believe we are judging, we inevitably judge differently than we ordinarily would.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r423","rowIndex":423,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　知らず知らず甘い予測をしてしまったり、逆に悲観的になって、まったくそんなことはありえないと思ったりしてしまう。","en":"Without realizing it, we make our predictions too rosy—or swing the other way into pessimism and convince ourselves that something has no chance at all.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r424","rowIndex":424,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　今まで聡明な人間が愚劣な過ちを繰り返すのを何度も見て来た。学生時代、地位も名声もある学者が若い女の肉体に溺れて全てを失ったのを見たり、この仕事についてからも、いつも冷静な人間が家族一人失っただけでほとんど自殺同然の行動で死んでゆくのを見た。どんな人間でも感情にまとわりつかれたら判断力を奪われてしまう。","en":"Time and again, I have watched intelligent people repeat the most foolish mistakes. When I was a student, I saw a scholar of status and renown lose everything after becoming enthralled by a young woman’s body. Since entering this business, I have seen an ordinarily levelheaded man lose a single member of his family, then die in an act all but indistinguishable from suicide. No matter who we are, once emotion coils around us, it robs us of judgment.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r425","rowIndex":425,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　自分だけは違うと言いたいが、それこそ科学的ではない思い込みだ。僕も、ほかの人々と同じように不合理な感情の獣だと考えるべきだろう。","en":"I would like to say that I alone am different, but that very assumption is unscientific. I ought to consider myself what everyone else is: a beast of irrational emotion.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r426","rowIndex":426,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　で、いま僕の思考にどんな感情が絡みついているのかというと、ああ、まったく、なんということだろう。ただただ、子供のようにそうなって欲しいと言う願望ばかりが心を一杯にしているのだ。","en":"And what emotion is entangled with my thoughts now? Ah, honestly—what has come over me? My heart is full of nothing but a child’s wish for it to come true.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r427","rowIndex":427,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それについて考えるだけで、胸がさざめき立って、落ち着いていられなくなる。日中はなるべくこのことを考えないようにして、<tips=81>龍頭</tips>としての仕事に没頭しているが、こうしてオフになるともうダメだ。まったく落ち着かない。","en":"The mere thought of it sends a flutter through my chest and leaves me unable to sit still. During the day, I do my best not to think about it and bury myself in my duties as <tips=81>Longtou</tips>. But once I am off duty like this, it is hopeless. I cannot settle down at all.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r428","rowIndex":428,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　上手くいくように、僕もいろいろと手を打ったが、ちゃんと思い通りになってくれるだろうか？　それとも、やっぱり駄目なのだろうか？　試験の後はいつも、もう済んでしまったことだからあとは結果を待つだけだと冷淡でいられたのに、どうしても同じようには振る舞えない。","en":"I have taken all manner of measures to make sure it goes well, but will everything truly turn out as I intend? Or is it no good after all? After an exam, I could always remain detached: what was done was done, and all that remained was to wait for the results. Yet I cannot make myself behave the same way now.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r429","rowIndex":429,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　まあ、なんでもいいさ。やるべきことはやったんだ。僕の予測とやりかたが確かならば、それは今夜にも実現するはずだ。","en":"Well, whatever. I have done what needed to be done. If my prediction and my methods are sound, it should happen as soon as tonight.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r430","rowIndex":430,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　今夜何も起こらなくてもまた明日、そして次の日もある。","en":"If nothing happens tonight, there is always tomorrow. And the day after that.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r431","rowIndex":431,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　――あきらめやしない。","en":"I will not give up.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r432","rowIndex":432,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕は、机にかじりついてパソコンのモニターに映るデータを眺めていた。特別な変化はないが、とにかく目がしょぼしょぼとして画面がにじむ。","en":"I hunched over the desk, staring at the data on the computer monitor. There was no particular change, but my eyes were so bleary that the screen swam.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r433","rowIndex":433,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ここのところずっと寝たくとも眠ることなど出来ないのに、眠りたくないときに眠気がやってくるものだ。","en":"Lately, sleep never came when I wished to sleep. When I had no desire for it, drowsiness arrived.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r434","rowIndex":434,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕はインスタントコーヒーを作って一口すする。湿気った味がする。","en":"I made myself some instant coffee and took a sip. It tasted stale.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r435","rowIndex":435,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　この不味い味が懐かしい。子供の頃は、<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>の会合で出されるどんなうまいご馳走よりも、この地下で飲む不味いインスタントコーヒーが何より美味しく感じたっけ。","en":"This awful taste takes me back. When I was a child, the terrible instant coffee I drank down here tasted better to me than any delicacy served at a <tips=7>YS</tips> gathering.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r436","rowIndex":436,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　――思えば、ここから全てがはじまったんだ。","en":"When I think about it, this is where everything began.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r437","rowIndex":437,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ここで僕は<tips=54>汐さん</tips>からいろんなことを教わり、<tips=55>松子</tips>と出会い、みんなで街で遊んで――いつからこんなことになってしまったんだろう？","en":"This is where <tips=54>Mr. Shio</tips> taught me so many things, where I met <tips=55>Matsuko</tips>, where all of us went out and had fun around town—and when did it all turn into this?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r438","rowIndex":438,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　順を追って考えようとしたけれど、考えがまとまらなくなる。カフェインが大して効いていないみたいだ。睡魔が思考の隙間をこじ開けて入り込もうとしている 。","en":"I tried to think it through step by step, but my thoughts would not come together. The caffeine did not seem to be doing much. Drowsiness was prying open the gaps between my thoughts, trying to force its way inside.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r439","rowIndex":439,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕はなんとか抵抗しようとしたけれど、うつらうつら、まぶたを閉じて開くたびに時間が飛んで、そして何回か飛んだあとに、目の前に一人の人物が現れていた。","en":"I did what I could to resist, but kept drifting off. Every time my eyelids closed and opened again, time skipped ahead. After several such skips, someone was standing in front of me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r440","rowIndex":440,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　待っていた人物が、現れてくれたんだ。","en":"The person I had been waiting for had finally appeared.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r441","rowIndex":441,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「やあ」","en":"“Hey.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r442","rowIndex":442,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕はその人物に声をかけた。","en":"I called out to the figure.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r443","rowIndex":443,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「よく来たね。でも、随分と感じが変わったじゃないか」","en":"“I’m glad you came. You’ve changed a great deal, though.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r444","rowIndex":444,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　部屋の向こうに立ち、じっとこちらを見つめている少女に、眠い目をこすりながらそう言った。","en":"Rubbing my drowsy eyes, I spoke to the girl who stood across the room and stared at me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r445","rowIndex":445,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　長い髪の毛は最近あまり手入れがされていないのか、乱れている。僕が情報で確認している限り、倉庫から逃げ出したときは違う服装だったはずだが、どこかで間に合わせたのかゆったりとした服を着て、そして、金色の目を光らせていた。","en":"Her long hair is disheveled, perhaps because she has not been caring for it lately. According to the intelligence I have seen, she was wearing different clothes when she escaped from the warehouse. She must have made do with something she found along the way: now she wears loose-fitting clothes, and her eyes gleam gold.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r446","rowIndex":446,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ここが秘密基地なの？」","en":"“Is this the secret base?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r447","rowIndex":447,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　少女はそう口を開く。","en":"The girl speaks.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r448","rowIndex":448,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうだよ。僕と<tips=54>汐健慈朗</tips>さん、そして<tips=55>松子</tips>もここで過ごしていた時期があったんだ。とっても懐かしい気分だ。それに<tips=12>江梨子</tips>、お前を見るのもなんだか久しぶりだな。いつ以来だ？」","en":"“That’s right. There was a time when <tips=54>Mr. Kenjiro Shio</tips>, <tips=55>Matsuko</tips>, and I all spent our days here. It brings back so many memories. And <tips=12>Eriko</tips>, it feels like ages since I last saw you too. How long has it been?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r449","rowIndex":449,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……<tips=12>江梨子</tips>？」","en":"“...<tips=12>Eriko</tips>?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r450","rowIndex":450,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=12>灰上江梨子</tips>は怪訝な顔で言う。","en":"<tips=12>Eriko Haigami</tips> says it with a puzzled look.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r451","rowIndex":451,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「違うのか？　でも、どう見たって<tips=12>江梨子</tips>じゃないか」","en":"“Am I wrong? You look unmistakably like <tips=12>Eriko</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r452","rowIndex":452,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「違うわ。私たちは私たちだよ。だってここには二人いるんだから。一人にしか見えなくても、二人いるのよ」","en":"“No. We’re us. There are two of us here, after all. You may only see one, but there are two of us.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r453","rowIndex":453,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女は戸惑いながら言うが、僕には何を言っているのかよく分からない。","en":"She says this in some confusion, but I cannot make sense of what she means.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r454","rowIndex":454,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「一人にしか見えないよ。でも、お前は二人でいるように感じているってこと？」","en":"“I can only see one person. But you’re saying you feel as if there are two of you?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r455","rowIndex":455,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「だって、私、サイキックの力が使えるし、<tips=17>タイプB</tips>の腕力もある。これって、二人が一人になったからでしょう？」","en":"“I mean, I can use psychic power, and I have the strength of a <tips=17>Type B</tips>. That’s because the two of us became one, isn’t it?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r456","rowIndex":456,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そんなことはありえないよ。二人が一人に合体するなんて……まあ、こんな世の中じゃそういうことが起きても不思議じゃないけれど」","en":"“That can’t be. Two people merging into one... though I suppose, in a world like this, it wouldn’t be surprising if something like that happened.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r457","rowIndex":457,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕は苦笑してから、","en":"I give a wry smile, then continue:","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r458","rowIndex":458,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「だけど、すくなくとも僕にはお前は<tips=12>江梨子</tips>にしか見えない。だから、<tips=11>璃映子</tips>が死んだ時にサイキック能力が使えるようになったんだろう。それとも、元々能力が抑えられていたのが解放されたのか。まあ、何だっていいさ」","en":"“But at least to me, you look like no one but <tips=12>Eriko</tips>. So I suppose you became able to use psychic power when <tips=11>Rieko</tips> died. Or perhaps your power was there all along, suppressed until now. Well, it doesn’t matter.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r459","rowIndex":459,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「何を言っているんだ。そんなことないよ。……ああ、でも、そうかもしれない。本当にどうなってるかよくわからないの。だから、<tips=1>菅原亮</tips>が言ってることが全部正しいのかもしれない」","en":"“What are you talking about? That’s not true. ...Oh, but perhaps it is. I really don’t know what’s going on. So maybe everything <tips=1>Ryo Sugawara</tips> says is right.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r460","rowIndex":460,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「やけに素直だな。お前らしくない。前だったら、僕が双子のどちらかを言い当てるたびに、気持ち悪い、気持ち悪いって怒ってたろう」","en":"“You’re awfully agreeable. That’s not like you. Before, every time I correctly told you which twin you were, you’d get angry and call me creepy over and over.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r461","rowIndex":461,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　からかってみても、彼女は乗ってこない。そんな気分じゃないのだろうか？　いや、こんな場面でこんな風にからかう僕のほうがおかしいんだ。","en":"I try teasing her, but she does not take the bait. Is she in no mood for it? No—I am the strange one for teasing her like this at a time like this.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r462","rowIndex":462,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　今の僕と彼女はそんな軽口を叩くような間柄じゃない筈だ。","en":"She and I are not supposed to be on the kind of terms where we can trade banter like this anymore.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r463","rowIndex":463,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それにしても、よく僕のメッセージがわかったね」","en":"“Still, I’m impressed that you understood my message.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r464","rowIndex":464,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「わかるよ。でも、私たち以外の人が見つけたらどうするつもりだったの？」","en":"“Of course we did. But what were you going to do if someone other than us found it?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r465","rowIndex":465,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あれだけの情報で、他の誰が来ると言うんだい？」","en":"“Who else could possibly have found their way here from so little information?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r466","rowIndex":466,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕らが話しているのは、今日僕がここに来る前に<tips=57>滑走路通り</tips>に寄って仕掛けた暗号のことだった。","en":"We are talking about the coded message I planted on <tips=57>Runway Street</tips> before coming here today.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r467","rowIndex":467,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　かつて僕らが不良少年だった頃、全てのメンバーが携帯電話などの連絡手段を持っているわけではないという理由と、単純に子供がそういうものを好んだという理由で、よく自分たちにしかわからない暗号を用いていた。","en":"When we were young delinquents, not every member had a mobile phone or another means of contact. For that reason—and simply because children liked such things—we often used codes that only we understood.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r468","rowIndex":468,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　街角の決まった場所に、チョークでマークを書いて集合場所を決めるというのもその一つである。","en":"One method was to choose a meeting place by drawing a mark in chalk at one of several fixed locations around the city.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r469","rowIndex":469,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　集まるべき場所と、指示を出した人間の二つの内容を示すマークを書いて、チームメンバーに集合を呼びかけるんだ。","en":"We would draw a mark encoding two pieces of information—the meeting place and the person issuing the summons—and use it to call the team together.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r470","rowIndex":470,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　きまったタイミングに伝達することが出来ないから、あまり合理的な方法ではなかったけれど、たとえば一日中空き地を使って何かをするような、いつでも来て良いような場合になら使えないこともなかった。","en":"It was not a very rational system, since there was no way to deliver a message at any predetermined time. But if, say, we were going to spend all day doing something in a vacant lot and people could show up whenever they pleased, it was usable enough.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r471","rowIndex":471,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　今回僕がしかけた暗号は、場所は<tips=55>汐松子</tips>の家、呼びかけ人は<tips=1>亮</tips>という内容のものだ。","en":"The code I planted this time gives the location as <tips=55>Matsuko Shio’s</tips> house and the caller as <tips=1>Ryo</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r472","rowIndex":472,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　当時のチームメンバーなら呼びかけ人が僕であることは読み取れるが、この場所をしめすマークは見たこともないだろう。<tips=55>松子</tips>の家を示すマークは作るだけ作ってみてから、すぐに使用禁止にしたのだ。それは<tips=54>汐さん</tips>に迷惑がかかってもいやだからと、僕が決めた。だから、実際には一度も使われていない。このマークを知っているのは、作った時にその場にいた人間だけだ。","en":"Anyone who belonged to the team back then can read that the caller is me, but none of them will ever have seen the mark for this place. We did create a mark for <tips=55>Matsuko’s</tips> house, but I immediately prohibited its use. I decided that myself because I did not want to cause <tips=54>Mr. Shio</tips> any trouble. So in fact, the mark was never used even once. The only people who know it are those who were present when we created it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r473","rowIndex":473,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして、そのときそこに居たのは僕と<tips=10>道夫</tips>と、それと、チームメンバーでもなく呼んでもいないのに勝手にやって来ていた<tips=86>灰上姉妹</tips>だ。","en":"And the people there at the time were <tips=10>Michio</tips> and me, along with the <tips=86>Haigami sisters</tips>, who were not even team members and had simply invited themselves along.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r474","rowIndex":474,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　つまり、<tips=10>道夫</tips>がいない今、僕の出した暗号を解読出来るのはこの<tips=12>灰上江梨子</tips>しかいないことになる。<tips=12>江梨子</tips>は、自分しか知らないことを忘れていたようだが、マークの意味は覚えていてくれてよかった。","en":"So, now that <tips=10>Michio</tips> is gone, the only person who can decipher the message I left is <tips=12>Eriko Haigami</tips>, standing here before me. <tips=12>Eriko</tips> seems to have forgotten that she alone knows it, but I am glad she remembered what the mark meant.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r475","rowIndex":475,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それにしても、正直来るとは思わなかったよ。僕がお前をおびき寄せる罠だと思わなかったのか？」","en":"“Even so, to be honest, I didn’t expect you to come. Didn’t you think it was a trap I had set to lure you out?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r476","rowIndex":476,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=1>菅原亮</tips>と知恵比べをするつもりはないわ。どうせ勝てないし。それに、私たちも会いたかったから」","en":"“I have no intention of matching wits with <tips=1>Ryo Sugawara</tips>. I’d never win anyway. Besides, we wanted to see you too.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r477","rowIndex":477,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうか、それは良かった。……でも、もっと早く来て欲しかったよ。眠くてたまらない」","en":"“I see. That’s good to hear. ...But I wish you’d come sooner. I’m so sleepy I can barely stand it.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r478","rowIndex":478,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　すっかり目が覚めた今は本当に眠いわけではなかったけれど、そう言って笑ってみせた。","en":"Now that I am wide awake, I am not actually sleepy at all, but I smile as I say it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r479","rowIndex":479,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　さて、大事なのはこれからだ。僕は確かに彼女に用があって呼び寄せた。だが、<tips=12>江梨子</tips>が例のものを持っていなければ、まったく無意味なことをしたことになる。","en":"Now comes the important part. I did summon her here because I need something from her. But if <tips=12>Eriko</tips> does not have the item in question, then everything I have done will have been utterly pointless.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r480","rowIndex":480,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　――警察に呼ばれ、<tips=55>松子</tips>の無惨な遺体を見たその場所で、僕は田辺という従業員に話を聞いた。","en":"—At the place where the police had summoned me and shown me <tips=55>Matsuko’s</tips> horribly mutilated body, I spoke with an employee named Tanabe.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r481","rowIndex":481,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女は<tips=55>松子</tips>によって助けられたが、別れの時に<tips=55>松子</tips>に手渡されたものがあった。それは、田辺にとっては全く意味不明で、しかもギョッとするようなものだった。","en":"<tips=55>Matsuko</tips> had saved her, and when they parted, <tips=55>Matsuko</tips> had placed something in her hands. To Tanabe, it was utterly incomprehensible—and startling to behold.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r482","rowIndex":482,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「もしかしたら、後でこれが動き出すかもしれない。そしたら、私に何かがあったということです。その時は、絶対にここには戻らないで、これをお父さんに渡してください」","en":"“Perhaps this will start moving later. If it does, that means something has happened to me. If that happens, do not come back here under any circumstances. Give this to my father.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r483","rowIndex":483,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=55>松子</tips>は最後にそう言ったが、田辺には理解が出来なかった。それは、勝手に動き出すようなものではなかったからだ。","en":"That was what <tips=55>Matsuko</tips> said at the end, but Tanabe could not understand her. It simply was not the sort of thing that could start moving on its own.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r484","rowIndex":484,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そのあと田辺は施設を出て、近くの家に飛び込んで電話を借り、警察に通報した。そして一息ついて預かった物を見ると、本当にそれが動き出していた。田辺は「動いたら何かがあったということだ」という言葉を思い出し、他のことを忘れてしまった。<tips=55>松子</tips>に何かがあったのなら助けなければならないと、それで頭の中が一杯になり、その家でバットを借りて施設に舞い戻ってしまう。","en":"Afterward, Tanabe left the facility, rushed into a nearby house, borrowed the telephone, and called the police. Once she had caught her breath, she looked at the object entrusted to her—and it really had begun to move. Remembering the words “If it moves, something has happened,” Tanabe forgot everything else. Her mind filled with the need to save <tips=55>Matsuko</tips> if something had happened to her, so she borrowed a bat from the people in the house and raced back to the facility.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r485","rowIndex":485,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして殺人現場となった応接室に足を踏み入れ、<tips=55>松子</tips>の死体を発見した。そこで茫然自失となっていると、見知らぬ<tips=86>双子</tips>が部屋に入ってきた。","en":"She entered the reception room that had become a murder scene and found <tips=55>Matsuko’s</tips> body. As she stood there in a daze, a pair of unfamiliar <tips=86>twins</tips> entered the room.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r486","rowIndex":486,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=86>双子</tips>は<tips=55>松子</tips>の遺体を見て涙を流し、<tips=55>松子</tips>の友人だと言った。田辺はそれを信じ、彼女たちとの会話のなかで<tips=55>松子</tips>から預かった遺品のことを話し、それをそのまま引き渡してしまったのだという。","en":"The <tips=86>twins</tips> wept when they saw <tips=55>Matsuko’s</tips> body and said they were friends of <tips=55>Matsuko</tips>. Tanabe believed them. In the course of their conversation, she mentioned the keepsake <tips=55>Matsuko</tips> had entrusted to her, then handed it over to them on the spot.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r487","rowIndex":487,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そう、僕が気にしている例のものとは、つまり<tips=55>松子</tips>が田辺に手渡し、そして田辺がこの<tips=12>江梨子</tips>に手渡したはずのもののことだ。","en":"Yes. The object I have in mind is the very thing <tips=55>Matsuko</tips> gave Tanabe, and that Tanabe in turn should have handed to <tips=12>Eriko</tips>, standing here before me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r488","rowIndex":488,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=12>江梨子</tips>はその遺品の意味を理解出来るはずだから、ここに持って来ているか、そうでなくとも何らかの交渉の材料にして来ると思うのだが。","en":"<tips=12>Eriko</tips> should be capable of understanding what the keepsake means, so I expect she has brought it with her—or at the very least intends to use it as leverage in some negotiation.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r489","rowIndex":489,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「これは……生きてるの？」","en":"“Is this... alive?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r490","rowIndex":490,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕の背後の培養液に目をやっている<tips=12>江梨子</tips>はそう呟いた。","en":"<tips=12>Eriko</tips> murmurs, her eyes on the culture fluid behind me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r491","rowIndex":491,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　もし持っていたとして、彼女はタダでは僕に渡さないだろう。この<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>ならば、その駆け引きの材料になるかもしれない――これが、<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>のために売り飛ばすのでもなく、僕の復讐のために実験材料にするわけでもない、<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>の第三の使い方だった。","en":"Even if she has it, she is unlikely to hand it over for nothing. <tips=20>Koschei</tips> may give me the leverage I need. This is the third use I have found for <tips=20>Koschei</tips>: neither selling him off for <tips=7>YS’s</tips> sake nor making him a test subject for my revenge.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r492","rowIndex":492,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　だけれど、想定していたものとは少し状況が違うようだ。","en":"But the situation seems to differ somewhat from what I anticipated.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r493","rowIndex":493,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　今彼女は元々の<tips=17>タイプB</tips>の力の他に、サイキックの力も手に入れたと言っていた。そのことは、彼女が脱出した倉庫のシャッターの破損の状況でもしやとは思っていたけれど、実際そうとわかってしまった。だとすれば厄介だ。それほど強力な力を持った人間が、素直に交渉に応じるか、どうか。","en":"She has just said that, in addition to her original strength as a <tips=17>Type B</tips>, she has acquired psychic powers. The damage to the shutter at the warehouse she escaped from made me suspect as much; now I know it for a fact. That makes matters difficult. Will someone who possesses such overwhelming power agree to negotiate without resistance?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r494","rowIndex":494,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「生きてるよ。問題なくね。薬で眠っちゃいるが、健康なものさ」","en":"“Alive and well. The drugs are keeping him asleep, but he’s perfectly healthy.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r495","rowIndex":495,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そう」","en":"“I see.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r496","rowIndex":496,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　どう切り出そうか考えている僕の目の前で、彼女は無造作にポケットに手を突っ込むと、何かを空中に放り投げた。","en":"As I consider how to broach the subject, she casually thrusts a hand into her pocket and tosses something into the air.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r497","rowIndex":497,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それは落下することなく放物線の頂点のあたりでピタリと止まり、そのあとはゆっくり空中を浮遊して僕の目の前でくるんと回ってから着陸する。","en":"It does not fall. Near the apex of its arc, it stops dead; then it drifts slowly through the air, turns once before my eyes, and lands.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r498","rowIndex":498,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女が放り投げたのは、小さな小瓶。そのなかに、白い肉片が動いているのが見えた。","en":"What she tossed is a tiny vial. Inside it, I can see a white scrap of flesh moving.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r499","rowIndex":499,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕は心臓をわしづかみにされたような驚きと共に、彼女の顔を見た。","en":"Shock seizes my heart like a closing fist, and I look up at her face.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r500","rowIndex":500,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それが欲しいから私たちを呼んだんでしょ」","en":"“That’s what you called us here to get, isn’t it?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r501","rowIndex":501,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=12>江梨子</tips>はなんでもなさそうに言う。","en":"<tips=12>Eriko</tips> says it as though it were nothing.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r502","rowIndex":502,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕は興奮を隠しながら小瓶に手を伸ばし、そして手元でそれを確認した。","en":"Concealing my excitement, I reach for the vial and examine it in my hands.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r503","rowIndex":503,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　間違いない。これこそが、田辺が最後に<tips=55>松子</tips>から受け取ったものだ。そして、かつて<tips=54>汐さん</tips>が<tips=18>ローズ・クラブ</tips>のゴミ捨て場で拾ったものも、このようなかたちをしていたのだろう。","en":"There is no mistaking it. This is the very thing Tanabe received from <tips=55>Matsuko</tips> at the end. The object <tips=54>Mr. Shio</tips> once picked up in the <tips=18>Rose Club’s</tips> garbage dump must have looked much like this.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r504","rowIndex":504,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕は<tips=55>松子</tips>の遺体を見た時に気がついた。その指の一本が欠けていることを。","en":"When I saw <tips=55>Matsuko’s</tips> body, I noticed that one of her fingers was missing.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r505","rowIndex":505,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして田辺に確認をすると、案の定<tips=55>松子</tips>は最後に自分で切り取った指を彼女に差し出したとわかった。","en":"When I confirmed it with Tanabe, I learned that, just as I suspected, <tips=55>Matsuko</tips> had handed her a finger she had cut off herself before they parted.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r506","rowIndex":506,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=55>松子</tips>は<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>との戦いを前に保険を掛けたのだろう。最悪の場合でも、切り離した組織から再生出来るようにと。","en":"Before facing <tips=20>Koschei</tips>, <tips=55>Matsuko</tips> must have taken out an insurance policy of her own: if the worst came to pass, she meant to regenerate from the tissue she had cut away.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r507","rowIndex":507,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　再生のメカニズムは、まだ不確かにしかわかっていないのに無茶をする。生き残れなかったらどうするつもりだったんだ。","en":"We still understand the mechanism of regeneration only imperfectly, and yet she tries something this reckless. What did she think she would do if the severed tissue failed to survive?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r508","rowIndex":508,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　というか、僕が知っているのは、特殊化した<tips=17>タイプＢ</tips>をいくつに分断しても、生き残る細胞は一つで、他の組織はただの肉片になってしまうということだけだ。だから、生前に切り離した小指は、ただの肉片であるはずなのだ。だって、本体がまだ生きているのだから。","en":"Or rather, all I knew was that no matter how many pieces a specialized <tips=17>Type B</tips> was divided into, only one cluster of cells would survive; all the other tissue would become mere scraps of flesh. So a little finger severed while she was alive should have been nothing but a scrap of flesh. The main body was still alive, after all.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r509","rowIndex":509,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　職員から小指が動いていたという話を聞いても、何かの見間違いなのではないかと思ったくらいだ。","en":"Even when the employee told me that the little finger had been moving, I thought she must have been mistaken about what she saw.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r510","rowIndex":510,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　だが実際はこうして組織が生きて動いている。ということはつまり、切り離したあとに本体の方が完全に死亡したら、切り離された方が本体になるわけだ。これは、<tips=45>ローズ</tips>をつかって本体の方を完全に殺す方法を知らなかった僕らには検証出来なかった事実だ。","en":"Yet here the tissue is, alive and moving. That means that if the main body dies completely after a piece has been cut away, the severed part becomes the main body in its place. This is a fact we had been unable to verify, because we did not know how to use <tips=45>Rose</tips> to kill the original body completely.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r511","rowIndex":511,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おそらく何か条件はあるのだろう。そうでなければ、<tips=45>ローズ･クラブ</tips>の時も、薬を打たれて娼婦たちが殺されたあとに、ブラシについた髪の毛などから再生していてもおかしくないはずだが、そういう話は聞いていない。まあもっとも、<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>の血によって<tips=97>特殊タイプＢ</tips>になった女達と、生まれつき<tips=97>特殊タイプＢ</tips>だった<tips=55>松子</tips>とではその時点で条件は違うのだが。","en":"There must be some other condition. Otherwise, after the prostitutes at the <tips=45>Rose Club</tips> were injected with the drug and killed, there would be nothing strange about their regenerating from hairs caught in a brush or the like. Yet I have heard no such stories. Of course, the women who became <tips=97>special Type Bs</tips> through <tips=20>Koschei’s</tips> blood and <tips=55>Matsuko</tips>, who was born a <tips=97>special Type B</tips>, differed in their underlying conditions from the outset.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r512","rowIndex":512,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しかし<tips=55>松子</tips>はこのことを知っていたのだろうか？　それとも知らずに、僕らの実験の結果を誤解して理解していたせいで、こんなことを思い付いたのだろうか？","en":"But did <tips=55>Matsuko</tips> know this? Or had she come up with the idea without knowing, because she had misinterpreted the results of our experiments?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r513","rowIndex":513,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そのあたりはわからないが、とにかく<tips=55>松子</tips>がまだ生きていて、僕の目論見どおりこれが目の前に届いたのは事実だ。","en":"I do not know the answer. But in any case, two facts remain: <tips=55>Matsuko</tips> is still alive, and the tissue has made its way to me exactly as I planned.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r514","rowIndex":514,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それが<tips=55>汐松子</tips>だよ。<tips=1>菅原亮</tips>なら、そこからなんとか出来るんでしょ？」","en":"“That is <tips=55>Matsuko Shio</tips>. <tips=1>Ryo Sugawara</tips> can do something with that, can’t he?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r515","rowIndex":515,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どうしてこんなに簡単に僕に渡すんだ？」","en":"“Why are you giving it to me so easily?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r516","rowIndex":516,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「簡単じゃないよ。……手に入れてから何日も、どうしようか迷ったけど、でも、もうごちゃごちゃ考えるのがいやになっただけ。それに、私たちは<tips=1>菅原亮</tips>に借りがあるから」","en":"“It wasn’t easy. ...For days after we got it, we couldn’t decide what to do. We just got tired of thinking ourselves in circles. Besides, we owe <tips=1>Ryo Sugawara</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r517","rowIndex":517,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「借り？」","en":"“A debt?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r518","rowIndex":518,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうだよ……」","en":"“That’s right...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r519","rowIndex":519,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=12>江梨子</tips>はそこで一旦言葉を切ってから、","en":"<tips=12>Eriko</tips> pauses for a moment, then continues:","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r520","rowIndex":520,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=1>菅原亮</tips>は昔、私たちがお兄ちゃんを殺したことにならないよう、自分でトドメをさした」","en":"“Long ago, <tips=1>Ryo Sugawara</tips> delivered the final blow himself so that we wouldn’t be the ones who killed Big Brother.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r521","rowIndex":521,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　突然思わぬことを言ったので、僕は言葉を失った。","en":"The sudden, unexpected remark left me speechless.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r522","rowIndex":522,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=12>江梨子</tips>は興奮して僕を見つめながら続ける。","en":"<tips=12>Eriko</tips> continues, staring at me as she grows worked up.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r523","rowIndex":523,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そのせいで人殺しになっちゃったんだよ。それでおかしくなっちゃったんだ。だから、あんなにギャングが嫌いだったのに、ギャングになって、今みたいにわけもわからず殺し合いをすることになってる。全部私たちのせいなんだ」","en":"“That turned you into a killer. That’s what broke you. That’s why, even though you hated gangs so much, you became a gangster and ended up caught in senseless killing like this. It’s all our fault.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r524","rowIndex":524,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「おかしなことを言う」","en":"“What a strange thing to say.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r525","rowIndex":525,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕は笑った。","en":"I laugh.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r526","rowIndex":526,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まず、僕は父のあとを継いだだけで、こうなることは運命のようなものだったんだ。僕は元々こういう人間だったんだよ」","en":"“First of all, I merely inherited my father’s position. Ending up this way was practically fate. This is the kind of person I have always been.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r527","rowIndex":527,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「違う」","en":"“No.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r528","rowIndex":528,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=12>江梨子</tips>は首を横に振る。","en":"<tips=12>Eriko</tips> shakes her head.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r529","rowIndex":529,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「歯車が狂っちゃったんだよ。私たちのせいで……。それに、<tips=55>松子</tips>が死んだのだって私たちのせいじゃないか。<tips=55>松子</tips>は関係ないただの友だちなんだから、<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>にあんなことをさせないようにしなきゃいけなかった。……だから、私たちは<tips=55>汐松子</tips>を届けなきゃいけないの。ねえ、<tips=55>汐松子</tips>を蘇らせられるんでしょ？　そうしたら、一緒に暮らしなよ、そしたら、<tips=1>菅原亮</tips>も少しは昔に戻れるかもしれない」","en":"“The gears went wrong because of us... And <tips=55>Matsuko’s</tips> death was our fault too, wasn’t it? <tips=55>Matsuko</tips> had nothing to do with any of this. She was just our friend. We should have kept <tips=20>Koschei</tips> from doing that to her. ...That’s why we have to deliver <tips=55>Matsuko Shio</tips>. You can bring <tips=55>Matsuko Shio</tips> back to life, can’t you? Then live with her. Maybe that will let <tips=1>Ryo Sugawara</tips> go back, just a little, to who he used to be.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r530","rowIndex":530,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そのおとぎ話みたいな<tips=12>江梨子</tips>の言葉を一笑に付したかったが、僕の顏はひきつって笑えなかった。","en":"I want to laugh off <tips=12>Eriko’s</tips> fairy-tale talk, but my face only twitches. I cannot laugh.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r531","rowIndex":531,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「渡すのが遅れてごめんね。すぐに届けなきゃいけないのはわかってたけど、でも<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>や私たちのことだけ考えたら、そうしたらいけないのかなっていうのもあったし、それに忙しかったから……」","en":"“Sorry we took so long to bring her. We knew we had to deliver her right away. But when we thought about what that would mean for <tips=20>Koschei</tips> and for us, part of us wondered if maybe we shouldn’t. And we’ve been busy...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r532","rowIndex":532,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=12>江梨子</tips>は申し訳なさそうに言う。","en":"<tips=12>Eriko</tips> says apologetically.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r533","rowIndex":533,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「でもどうするんだ？　お前はこの僕の後ろにいる怪物を引き取りたいんじゃないのか？　交渉の材料になるはずの<tips=55>松子</tips>をただで渡してしまっては、僕が<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>をお前に引き渡す理由はないぞ。それとも、一旦渡したことで義理を果たしたことにして、今から力ずくで奪うつもりかい？」","en":"“But what are you going to do now? Don’t you want to take the monster behind me with you? If you simply give me <tips=55>Matsuko</tips>, who should have been your bargaining chip, I have no reason to hand <tips=20>Koschei</tips> over. Or do you figure that handing her over fulfills your obligation, and now you mean to take him by force?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r534","rowIndex":534,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そんなヘンテコなことはしないよ」","en":"“We wouldn’t do anything that weird.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r535","rowIndex":535,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=12>江梨子</tips>は顔を横に振る。","en":"<tips=12>Eriko</tips> shakes her head.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r536","rowIndex":536,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ただ、お願いするだけ」","en":"“We’ll just ask.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r537","rowIndex":537,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕の目を見て、そう訴えた。","en":"She looks me in the eye as she makes her appeal.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r538","rowIndex":538,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「お願い？」","en":"“Ask?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r539","rowIndex":539,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「うん。もう渡せるものは何にもないけど、どうか、その子をそこから出してあげてほしい。もう私たちがずっとそばにいて、あんな人殺しはさせないから。借りを返したすぐあとに、新しい借りを作るのは癪だけど、こうするしかないんだ」","en":"“Yes. We don’t have anything left to give you, but please let that child out of there. We’ll stay by his side from now on, and we won’t let him kill anyone like that ever again. It irks me to take on a new debt right after repaying the old one, but this is the only thing we can do.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r540","rowIndex":540,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あはは」","en":"“Ahaha!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r541","rowIndex":541,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕は笑わずにはいられない。","en":"I cannot help laughing.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r542","rowIndex":542,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そんなことをして、僕になんのメリットがある？　こいつはかつて<tips=18>ローズ・クラブ</tips>を作って父さんを悩ませ、最近は僕の仲間を沢山殺したとんでもなく危険なやつだ。親子二代の仇敵といっても良い。それに、こいつの気色悪い能力は人類にとって価値のある研究対象だ。使い道はいろいろとある。それを、何のメリットもないのにお前に引き渡せだって？」","en":"“What do I stand to gain from that? This creature once created the <tips=18>Rose Club</tips> and tormented my father; more recently, he killed a great many of my people. He is monstrously dangerous. You could call him the sworn enemy of two generations, father and son. And his grotesque abilities make him a valuable subject for humanity to study. I have any number of uses for him. Yet you want me to hand him over to you for nothing?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r543","rowIndex":543,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「うん」","en":"“Yes.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r544","rowIndex":544,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=12>江梨子</tips>は頷いた。","en":"<tips=12>Eriko</tips> nodded.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r545","rowIndex":545,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「きっと引き渡してくれると思う。<tips=1>菅原亮</tips>はいつも年下から頼まれるとノーとは言えなかったもの。よく面倒を見ていて、私たちが勉強出来るなんて自分たちでも知らなかったのに、なぜか知っていて学校を薦めてくれて……そういうところに、私たちはいつも負けたような気がして、気持ち悪かったんだ」","en":"“I’m sure you’ll hand him over. <tips=1>Ryo Sugawara</tips> could never say no when someone younger asked him for something. You always looked after us. Even we didn’t know we were capable of studying, but somehow you did, and you encouraged us to go to school... That side of you always made us feel as though we had lost. It was creepy.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r546","rowIndex":546,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女はうつむき加減のままそこに立ち尽くしている。","en":"She stands there motionless, her head still slightly bowed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r547","rowIndex":547,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕は机の下でリモコンを握った。そのボタンを一つ押せば、部屋の隅に仕掛けられたノズルからガスが噴き出す仕掛けになっている。ガスは色もにおいもない。吸わされた方は薬を盛られたことに気づかないまま意識がなくなって、そのまま眠りにつく。","en":"Beneath the desk, I grip a remote control. Pressing a single button will send gas pouring from nozzles rigged in the corners of the room. The gas is colorless and odorless. Anyone made to inhale it will lose consciousness and slip into sleep without ever realizing they have been drugged.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r548","rowIndex":548,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　これが、僕が<tips=12>江梨子</tips>を呼び出すことを想定してしかけておいた罠だった。","en":"This is the trap I laid ahead of time in case I decided to summon <tips=12>Eriko</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r549","rowIndex":549,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>の共犯者であり、<tips=13>ヘドロ団地</tips>でみなの子供のように可愛がられている彼女にも、また有益な使い道というものがある。このまま会話を続けながら、ガスを効かせる。そうすれば、僕と<tips=12>江梨子</tips>の二人ともが眠りにつくことになるが、ボタンはガスの噴出と同時に<tips=25>世傑</tips>への指示を出すようになっている。訪れた彼とその部下が、適切に処理をしてくれるだろう。","en":"She is <tips=20>Koschei’s</tips> accomplice, and everyone at the <tips=13>Sludge Housing Complex</tips> dotes on her as though she were their own child. She, too, has her useful applications. I will keep the conversation going while the gas takes effect. <tips=12>Eriko</tips> and I will both fall asleep, but the button is designed to send instructions to <tips=25>Sai-kit</tips> at the same moment it releases the gas. He and his men will come and dispose of matters appropriately.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r550","rowIndex":550,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そう、この小瓶を無事受け取るという一番厄介な部分を無事に終えたいま、このボタンを押すだけで全ては終わるんだ。","en":"Yes. Now that the hardest part—taking possession of the vial without incident—is safely over, a single press of this button will end everything.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r551","rowIndex":551,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……どうしてお前は、この<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>にそこまでこだわるんだ？　そのために片割れが死んでしまったのに、まだこんなふうに助け出そうとしている」","en":"“...Why are you so attached to this <tips=20>Koschei</tips>? Your other half died for his sake, yet you are still trying to rescue him like this.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r552","rowIndex":552,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕はリモコンを握ったままそう尋ねた。","en":"I ask, still gripping the remote.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r553","rowIndex":553,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女は俯いたまま口を開く。","en":"Without lifting her bowed head, she begins to speak.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r554","rowIndex":554,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=63>サーシェンカ</tips>は何も知らない、可哀想なやつだ。<tips=64>アレクセイ</tips>は頭のおかしい人殺しだけど、やっぱり可哀想なんだ。<tips=65>エフゲニ・イリイーチ・ヘス</tips>だってそうだ。誰も味方なんかいなそうだから、私たちくらい味方になってやったっていいかなって思ったんだ……」","en":"“<tips=63>Sashenka</tips> doesn’t know anything. He’s a poor thing. <tips=64>Alexei</tips> is a mad killer, but he’s pitiful too. The same goes for <tips=65>Yevgeny Ilyich Hess</tips>. It seemed like none of them had anybody on their side, so we thought maybe at least we could be.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r555","rowIndex":555,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それだけか？」","en":"“Is that all?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r556","rowIndex":556,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=12>江梨子</tips>は頷き、顔を上げて僕を見る。","en":"<tips=12>Eriko</tips> nods, then lifts her face and looks at me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r557","rowIndex":557,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「意味がないことだし、馬鹿馬鹿しいのはわかってる。でも、<tips=1>菅原亮</tips>だって、昔はそういうことをたくさんして来たじゃないか」","en":"“I know it’s pointless. I know it’s stupid. But <tips=1>Ryo Sugawara</tips> used to do plenty of things like that too.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r558","rowIndex":558,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　熱を帯びたその言葉に、僕は溜息をつく。","en":"Her words carry a sudden heat. I sigh.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r559","rowIndex":559,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「お前は僕を誤解している。それは全然違うんだ。僕はあのときだってお前たちを可哀想だと思ってあんなことをしたわけじゃない。お前たちがトドメをさしたということになればとても悲しいだろうけど、僕がやればなんとも思わない。つまり、僕が殺せば世の中から悲しみの総量が減るってことだ。お前たちがどうこうって話じゃない。僕はただうんざりしていたんだよ、このクソみたいな街で、クソみたいなことばかり起きることに」","en":"“You have me wrong. It wasn’t like that at all. Even then, I didn’t do it because I felt sorry for you. If you had been the ones to deliver the final blow, you would have been terribly sad. If I did it, I would feel nothing. In other words, if I killed him, the total amount of sadness in the world would decrease. It wasn’t about you one way or the other. I was simply sick and tired of all the shitty things that kept happening in this shitty town.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r560","rowIndex":560,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「今も同じことをしているんだね。そうやって、自分がやれば平気だからと勘違いして、やりたくないことばかりやってるんだね。<tips=1>菅原亮</tips>はバカだよ。誰かの悲しみの総量を減らすかわりに、自分の悲しみを増やしてばっかりだ。やりたくもないことばかりやって。でも、それじゃ誰も幸せにならないし、<tips=55>汐松子</tips>だってそんな小さくなっちゃった」","en":"“You’re still doing the same thing now. You fool yourself into thinking you’ll be fine as long as you’re the one who does it, and then you do nothing but things you don’t want to do. <tips=1>Ryo Sugawara</tips> is an idiot. All you ever do is add to your own sadness in exchange for reducing someone else’s. You keep doing things you don’t even want to do. But that doesn’t make anybody happy. Even <tips=55>Matsuko Shio</tips> ended up that tiny.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r561","rowIndex":561,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まったく、冗談じゃない」","en":"“You’ve got to be kidding me.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r562","rowIndex":562,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕は呆れて笑った。","en":"I laugh in disbelief.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r563","rowIndex":563,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「僕は全部自分で決めてやっている。お前こそどうなんだよ？　<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>に騙されてるんじゃないか？」","en":"“I make all my own decisions. What about you? Aren’t you the one being deceived by <tips=20>Koschei</tips>?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r564","rowIndex":564,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「私たちは自分の心に従ってるだけ。それで死んだって後悔なんかしない。<tips=1>菅原亮</tips>は迷いがあるんじゃない？　だから、そんなふうに下で何か握ってるくせに、作動させられなくて私たちにこんな無駄話をしかけているんでしょう？」","en":"“We’re only following our own hearts. Even if it kills us, we won’t regret it. Doesn’t <tips=1>Ryo Sugawara</tips> have doubts? You’re holding something under the desk, but you can’t bring yourself to activate it. That’s why you’re keeping us here with all this pointless chatter, aren’t you?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r565","rowIndex":565,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ふん」","en":"“Hmph.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r566","rowIndex":566,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕はしかめっつらをして、リモコンを握っている手を机の上に出した。","en":"I scowl and bring the hand clutching the remote up onto the desk.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r567","rowIndex":567,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「気づいていたのか」","en":"“You noticed?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r568","rowIndex":568,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「もともと耳はいいけど、<tips=63>サーシェンカ</tips>の血で生き返ってからもっともっとよくなったの。この地下室を見つけたのだって、音が聞こえたからだよ」","en":"“Our hearing was always sharp, but ever since <tips=63>Sashenka’s</tips> blood brought us back to life, it’s grown much, much sharper. We found this basement because we heard it.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r569","rowIndex":569,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どうする？　お前は不死身のハイブリッドで、僕はただのノーマルだ。その気になれば僕を殺して<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>を連れ去ることも出来る」","en":"“What are you going to do? You’re an immortal hybrid, and I’m just a Normal. If you wanted, you could kill me and take <tips=20>Koschei</tips> away.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r570","rowIndex":570,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕は投げやりにそう言った。","en":"I say it with reckless indifference.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r571","rowIndex":571,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「私たちは友だちは殺さない。たとえ本人がそれを望んでいたとしても」","en":"“We do not kill our friends. Not even when they want us to.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r572","rowIndex":572,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「何をバカな……」","en":"“Don’t be absurd...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r573","rowIndex":573,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それに、子供の頃から<tips=1>菅原亮</tips>には一度も勝ったことがないから、どうせ負けるよ。<tips=10>見土道夫</tips>にも、結局勝てなかったもん」","en":"“Besides, we’ve never beaten <tips=1>Ryo Sugawara</tips> once, ever since we were kids, so we’d just lose anyway. We never did manage to beat <tips=10>Michio Mido</tips> either.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r574","rowIndex":574,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=12>江梨子</tips>は肩をすくめ、","en":"<tips=12>Eriko</tips> shrugs.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r575","rowIndex":575,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「だからお願いしてるの。その子を返してほしい」","en":"“That’s why we’re asking. We want you to give that child back.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r576","rowIndex":576,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕の目を、その金色の瞳でじっと見つめる。","en":"She holds my gaze with those golden eyes.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r577","rowIndex":577,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「わかったよ。僕の負けだ」","en":"“All right. I lose.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r578","rowIndex":578,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しばらく見つめ合ってから、僕はそう溜息をついた。","en":"After we stare at each other for a while, I say it with a sigh.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r579","rowIndex":579,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「良かったな。<tips=86>灰上姉妹</tips>の初勝利じゃないか。こんなやつ、どこにでも連れて行けばいい。でも、こいつと二人で逃げるってことは、いろんなやつらから狩られる立場になるってことだ。精々遠くまで逃げるんだな。僕はもうお前たちと関わりたくない」","en":"“Good for you. The <tips=86>Haigami sisters</tips> finally win one. Take this thing wherever you want. But if the two of you run, all kinds of people will be hunting you. You’d better get as far away as you can. I want nothing more to do with either of you.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r580","rowIndex":580,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「こういうやり方で<tips=55>汐松子</tips>が困らせてるのを見たことあったから、一度使おうと思ってたんだ」","en":"“I saw <tips=55>Matsuko Shio</tips> put you on the spot this way once, so I’ve been meaning to try it myself.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r581","rowIndex":581,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=12>江梨子</tips>はそう言うと、いたずらっぽく微笑んだ。","en":"With that, <tips=12>Eriko</tips> gives me a mischievous smile.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r582","rowIndex":582,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　培養器の排水口を開けてカプセルを満たす液体を抜き、<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>を出してやった。","en":"I open the culture tank’s drain, empty the liquid filling the capsule, and let <tips=20>Koschei</tips> out.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r583","rowIndex":583,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=98>アレクサンドル</tips>……<tips=12>江梨子</tips>の呼び方を踏襲するならば、<tips=63>サーシェンカ</tips>の姿をしたその少年の裸体をバスタオルで包むと、彼女はそれを背負う。","en":"<tips=12>Eriko</tips> wraps the naked body of <tips=98>Aleksandr</tips>—or, to follow her lead, the boy in <tips=63>Sashenka’s</tips> form—in a bath towel, then hoists him onto her back.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r584","rowIndex":584,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ぐったりしてるけど、大丈夫？」","en":"“He’s completely limp. Is he all right?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"灰上江梨子","displayName":"Eriko Haigami","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r585","rowIndex":585,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「すぐに目が覚める。……それよりも、しばらくこいつは何の能力も使えないから気をつけろ。変身も出来ないし、再生もしない」","en":"“He’ll wake up soon. ...More importantly, be careful. For a while, he won’t be able to use any of his abilities. He can’t transform, and he won’t regenerate.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r586","rowIndex":586,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どうして？」","en":"“Why?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"灰上江梨子","displayName":"Eriko Haigami","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r587","rowIndex":587,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=46>ネオ・ローズ</tips>を使うと、一定期間特別な<tips=17>タイプＢ</tips>の力がなくなるんだ。お前も<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>の血で蘇ったのなら、気をつけるんだな」","en":"“Using <tips=46>Neo Rose</tips> temporarily strips a special <tips=17>Type B</tips> of their powers. If <tips=20>Koschei’s</tips> blood brought you back to life, you’d better be careful too.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r588","rowIndex":588,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕が言うと、<tips=12>江梨子</tips>はニヤニヤと笑う。","en":"At that, <tips=12>Eriko</tips> grins.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r589","rowIndex":589,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どうした？」","en":"“What is it?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r590","rowIndex":590,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=1>菅原亮</tips>は相変わらず口は悪いけど親切だ」","en":"“<tips=1>Ryo Sugawara</tips> is as foul-mouthed as ever, but he’s kind.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"灰上江梨子","displayName":"Eriko Haigami","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r591","rowIndex":591,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「馬鹿馬鹿しい」","en":"“Ridiculous.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r592","rowIndex":592,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕は苦々しく顔を顰め、","en":"I grimace bitterly.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r593","rowIndex":593,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「僕だって、誰も死なないで済むならそのほうがいいって思ってるよ。いつだってね」","en":"“Even I would rather no one had to die. I always have.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r594","rowIndex":594,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「知ってるよ」","en":"“I know.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"灰上江梨子","displayName":"Eriko Haigami","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r595","rowIndex":595,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=12>江梨子</tips>はうなずくと、","en":"<tips=12>Eriko</tips> nods.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r596","rowIndex":596,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「じゃあね」","en":"“See you.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"灰上江梨子","displayName":"Eriko Haigami","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r597","rowIndex":597,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女は軽くそう言って、立ち去ろうとした。","en":"She says it lightly and turns to leave.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r598","rowIndex":598,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=12>江梨子</tips>」","en":"“<tips=12>Eriko</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r599","rowIndex":599,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕はその名を呼んで彼女を引き留める。","en":"I call her name, stopping her.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r600","rowIndex":600,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「何？」","en":"“What?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"灰上江梨子","displayName":"Eriko Haigami","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r601","rowIndex":601,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「一日だ。二十四時間だけ待つ。その間、僕は誰にもなんの指示も出さない。だが、それを過ぎてこの街にいるようだったら<tips=81>龍頭</tips>として本来の仕事をさせてもらう。睡眠薬は明日の昼頃には消えて動けるようになるだろう。ただ、変身だとか全部の能力が戻るには三日くらいかかる」","en":"“One day. I’ll wait twenty-four hours, no more. During that time, I won’t issue a single order. But if you’re still in this city after that, I’ll do the job I’m supposed to do as <tips=81>Longtou</tips>. The sleeping drug should wear off around noon tomorrow, and he’ll be able to move again. But it will take about three days for all of his abilities—including transformation—to return.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r602","rowIndex":602,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それだけあれば充分だよ」","en":"“That will be enough.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"灰上江梨子","displayName":"Eriko Haigami","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r603","rowIndex":603,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>には、二度と<tips=9>Y地区</tips>に足を踏み入れないよう言っておけ。僕に復讐しようとしても、能力は全てあきらかになっているからもう通用しないぞ。そして、お前は団地に戻れ。あの場所で暮らしている限り、誰にも手出しされることはないだろう」","en":"“Tell <tips=20>Koschei</tips> never to set foot in <tips=9>Y District</tips> again. Even if he tries to take revenge on me, all of his abilities are known now. They won’t work on me anymore. And you should go back to the housing complex. As long as you live there, no one will touch you.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r604","rowIndex":604,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ありがとう。親切すぎて気持ち悪いな。でも、どうするかはこの子が起きてから相談して決める。ただ意見は伝えておくよ。じゃあね」","en":"“Thank you. You’re so kind it’s creepy. But we’ll wait until this child wakes up, talk it over, and decide what to do. I’ll tell him what you said, though. See you.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"灰上江梨子","displayName":"Eriko Haigami","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r605","rowIndex":605,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「待て。あと一つ」","en":"“Wait. One more thing.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r606","rowIndex":606,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕は行こうとする<tips=12>江梨子</tips>を再度呼び止めた。","en":"Once again, I call <tips=12>Eriko</tips> back as she tries to leave.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r607","rowIndex":607,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「目撃者から聞いたんだけど、<tips=55>松子</tips>の死体を見た時、二人で泣いてくれたそうだね」","en":"“A witness told me the two of you cried when you saw <tips=55>Matsuko’s</tips> body.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r608","rowIndex":608,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そ、それがどうしたの？」","en":"“S-so what?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"灰上江梨子","displayName":"Eriko Haigami","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r609","rowIndex":609,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　少し顔を赤くして彼女は言う。","en":"She says it with a slight blush.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r610","rowIndex":610,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ありがとう。それを聞いた時、とても嬉しかった」","en":"“Thank you. Hearing that made me very happy.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r611","rowIndex":611,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「バ、バカ！　それに、<tips=55>汐松子</tips>は死んでいないぞ！　そこに生きてるじゃないか！」","en":"“I-idiot! And <tips=55>Matsuko Shio</tips> isn’t dead! She’s alive right there!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"灰上江梨子","displayName":"Eriko Haigami","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r612","rowIndex":612,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=12>江梨子</tips>はそう言い捨てると、まるで人一人背負っているとは思えない軽やかな足取りで階段をのぼっていった。","en":"With that parting shot, <tips=12>Eriko</tips> bounds up the stairs with footsteps so light that no one would guess she has a whole person on her back.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r613","rowIndex":613,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　一人になった僕は溜息をつく。","en":"Left alone, I sigh.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r614","rowIndex":614,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　なんとか<tips=12>江梨子</tips>一人でも生き残れる道を選択してくれればいいが。<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>と行動を共にするようならば、助かる可能性は限りなくゼロに近い。","en":"I can only hope she somehow chooses a path that lets at least <tips=12>Eriko</tips> survive. If she stays with <tips=20>Koschei</tips>, however, her chances are vanishingly close to zero.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r615","rowIndex":615,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　まあ、本人もそれはわかっているはずだ。わかった上で選択をするのならば、僕にはどうすることも出来ない。","en":"Well, she must understand that herself. If she makes her choice knowing it, there is nothing I can do.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r616","rowIndex":616,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　緊張が去ると、代わりに疲労がどっと身体にのしかかった。小瓶のなかの<tips=55>松子</tips>の組織をシャーレに移したあとに、洗浄し、培養液をスポイトで垂らすところまでやったら、もう身体が動かない。","en":"When the tension passes, exhaustion comes crashing down on me in its place. I transfer <tips=55>Matsuko’s</tips> tissue from the vial to a Petri dish, wash it, and use a dropper to add the culture medium. Once I get that far, my body refuses to move.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r617","rowIndex":617,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>が入っていた培養器の洗浄と、<tips=55>松子</tips>のための準備は明日で良いだろう。","en":"Cleaning the tank <tips=20>Koschei</tips> occupied and preparing it for <tips=55>Matsuko</tips> can wait until tomorrow.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r618","rowIndex":618,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　すぐに寝た方がいいと思うのだけれど、シャーレのなかでいじましく動くその細胞をじっと見つめてしまう。","en":"I know I ought to go straight to sleep, but I find myself staring at the cells as they make their brave little movements inside the dish.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r619","rowIndex":619,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それは確かに生きている。ここから再生しても、きっともう僕たちの思い出は何一つ残ってはいないだろうけど、それでも生きているんだ。それに、今となっては記憶なんかない方がいいのかもしれない。","en":"They are unquestionably alive. Even if she regenerates from these cells, she probably will not retain a single memory of our time together. Even so, she is alive. And now, perhaps it would be better if she had no memories at all.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r620","rowIndex":620,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　とにかく、彼女がここに生きている。","en":"Whatever else may be true, she is here, alive.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r621","rowIndex":621,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　眺めていると、手の甲に温かいものが落ちた。見ると、水滴がその部分を濡らしている。","en":"As I watch, something warm falls onto the back of my hand. I look and see a drop of water wetting that spot.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r622","rowIndex":622,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　――なんだこれは？","en":"—What is this?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:a8:r623","rowIndex":623,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕はそっと自分の頬を触ってみた。そこもしっとりと濡れている。","en":"I gently touch my own cheek. It is damp too.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}}]},{"position":57,"code":"F5","unitId":"F5","rows":[{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r1","rowIndex":1,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　夢を見ていたような気がする。","en":"I think I was dreaming.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r2","rowIndex":2,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　でも思い出せない。とても楽しい夢――何を見ていたんだろう？","en":"But I could not remember it. It had been such a happy dream... What had I been dreaming about?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r3","rowIndex":3,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　目を覚ましてからも、しばらく目の前の光景が現実だと思えなくて、そのままじっとしていた。そうしていれば、この悪夢が覚めると思ったからだ。","en":"Even after waking, I lay perfectly still for some time, unable to believe the sight before me was real. I thought that if I stayed that way, I would wake from this nightmare.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r4","rowIndex":4,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　目を覚ます前に見ていた夢はとても楽しかったのに、そのとき私の目の前にある光景は、とても信じられないくらい恐ろしいものだった。","en":"The dream I had seen before waking had been so happy. What lay before me now was so terrible I could scarcely believe it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r5","rowIndex":5,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は冷たいコンクリートの上に横たわっている。その目の前で私がもう一人横たわっている。その私はマネキンのように動かない。","en":"I was lying on cold concrete. Directly before me, another me lay there too. That me was as motionless as a mannequin.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r6","rowIndex":6,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　死んでいるように見える。","en":"She looked dead.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r7","rowIndex":7,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちは産まれてからずっと私たちだったから、目の前で私が死んでいたら、当然私も死んでいるはずだった。そうでないということを今まで想像したこともなかった。","en":"We had been us ever since we were born. If I lay dead before my own eyes, then naturally I ought to be dead too. I had never imagined that it could be otherwise.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r8","rowIndex":8,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　だから、目の前の私が死んでいても、もう一方のこちらの私は生きているということに気がつくまで時間がかかった。","en":"That was why it took me so long to realize that even if the me before me was dead, this other me was still alive.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r9","rowIndex":9,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　気がつきたくなかった。いや、本当の意味では気がつけていないのかもしれない。","en":"I did not want to realize it. Or perhaps, in the truest sense, I still had not.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r10","rowIndex":10,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私が死んでいるような気がする。私たちは生きているような気がする。両方の気持ちがうまく分けられない。","en":"I felt as though I were dead. I felt as though we were alive. I could not separate one feeling cleanly from the other.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r11","rowIndex":11,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちの上には青いビニールシートがかかっていた。私たちは同じビニールシートの下に横たわっていた。","en":"A blue plastic sheet covered us. We lay together beneath the same sheet.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r12","rowIndex":12,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして、地面のコンクリートの上には血がべっとりと水たまりを作っていた。","en":"Blood lay pooled thickly across the concrete floor.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r13","rowIndex":13,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　血は乾いて、私の頬がコンクリートに張り付いている。","en":"It had dried, sticking my cheek to the concrete.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r14","rowIndex":14,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　顔を動かすと、べりりとはがれた。","en":"When I moved my face, it peeled away with a tacky rip.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r15","rowIndex":15,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私の目の前にはもう一人の私がこちらを見ている。","en":"The other me lay before me, looking back at me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r16","rowIndex":16,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　目はうつろで死んだ魚みたいに濁っていた。","en":"Her eyes were vacant, clouded like those of a dead fish.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r17","rowIndex":17,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　もう一人の私は血みどろだった。そして私も血みどろだった。口のなかもひどい血のあじがして、べっと吐き出そうとしたけれど乾いてうまく吐けない。","en":"The other me was drenched in blood. So was I. My mouth tasted horribly of it. I tried to spit, but everything was dry and nothing came out properly.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r18","rowIndex":18,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は生きているの？　本当は死んでいて、ゾンビかなにかなのかもしれない。それとも、死体に思念かなにかが残っていて、幽霊になっているのに生きていると勘違いしただけかもしれない。","en":"Am I alive? Perhaps I was actually dead and had become some kind of zombie. Or perhaps some remnant of consciousness lingered in the corpse, and I was only a ghost who mistakenly believed I was alive.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r19","rowIndex":19,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　試しに身体を動かしてみたら、胸がズキズキ痛む。その痛みには生の実感がある。本当に生きているんだろうか。","en":"I tried moving my body. My chest throbbed with pain, and that pain carried the sensation of life. Was I really alive?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r20","rowIndex":20,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そうだ、この血だまりは私ともう一人の私の血液だけのものじゃない。","en":"That’s right. This pool of blood did not belong only to me and the other me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r21","rowIndex":21,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=64>アレクセイ</tips>、<tips=63>サーシェンカ</tips>、<tips=65>エフゲニ・イリイーチ・ヘス</tips>――なんと呼んだらいいのか、あの、へんてこな殺人鬼も<tips=10>見土道夫</tips>に頭を吹き飛ばされて夥しい血液を垂れ流していた。","en":"<tips=64>Alexei</tips>, <tips=63>Sashenka</tips>, <tips=65>Yevgeny Ilyich Hess</tips>—whatever I was supposed to call him, that strange killer had also had his head blown off by <tips=10>Michio Mido</tips>, spilling a tremendous amount of blood.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r22","rowIndex":22,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は少しずつ思い出して来た。","en":"Little by little, I began to remember.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r23","rowIndex":23,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちは二人とも<tips=10>見土道夫</tips>との戦いに負けて撃たれた。そしてこの血液の海に倒れた。","en":"Both of us had lost our fight with <tips=10>Michio Mido</tips> and been shot. Then we had fallen into this sea of blood.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r24","rowIndex":24,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　倒れた私の目の前に、小さく砕けた肉の破片が散らばっていた。誰のものなのかわからないけれど、あの殺人鬼の血液には他人を不死身にするちからがあるというのを思い出した。","en":"Small fragments of mangled flesh had been scattered before me where I fell. I did not know whose they were, but I remembered that the killer’s blood was said to possess the power to make other people immortal.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r25","rowIndex":25,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　薄れかけた意識のなか、その肉の破片を口に含んで飲み込んだんだ。人の肉と血の味だと思うとひどく気持ち悪かった。","en":"As my consciousness faded, I put one of those pieces of flesh into my mouth and swallowed it. The knowledge that I was tasting human flesh and blood made me terribly sick.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r26","rowIndex":26,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　間に合う確信はなかったけれど、とにかくそれで私は生き残ったのだろう。私も彼のような殺人鬼になったんだろうか。","en":"I had no idea whether it would work in time, but that must be how I survived. Had I become a killer like him?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r27","rowIndex":27,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　だとすれば、もう一人の私も本当は生きているのかもしれない。","en":"If so, perhaps the other me was actually alive as well.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r28","rowIndex":28,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちはいつも同じようなことを考えていたんだ。だから同じように彼の身体の一部を口に含んだんだ。","en":"We had always thought the same sorts of things. So she too must have put part of his body into her mouth.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r29","rowIndex":29,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は手を伸ばして目の前の顔に触れた。","en":"I reached out and touched the face before me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r30","rowIndex":30,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　頬に触れた。眼球に触れた。唇に触れた。唇の間から口の中に指を一本入れると、悲しいほど冷たかった。","en":"I touched her cheek. Her eyeball. Her lips. I slipped one finger between them and into her mouth. The cold inside was heartbreaking.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r31","rowIndex":31,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　何の反応も示さない。やっぱり死んでいるのだ。死んでしまったのだ。その感触の冷たさは何よりも死に現実感を与える。もう生き物ではなく物になってしまったんだと実感させる。","en":"She gave no response at all. She really was dead. She had died. More than anything else, that coldness made death real. It made me realize that she was no longer a living being, but an object.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r32","rowIndex":32,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は落ちているガラスの破片で自分の手を刺す。そしてそこからながれる血液を指先に伝わらせて、それをもう一度彼女の口のなかにいれた。<tips=65>エフゲニ・イリイーチ・ヘス</tips>の話が正しければ、私の血液にも不死身の力が宿っているはずだし、それは他人に伝染するもののはずだ。","en":"I stabbed my hand with a shard of glass from the floor. I let the blood run along my finger to its tip, then put the finger into her mouth again. If <tips=65>Yevgeny Ilyich Hess</tips> had spoken the truth, my blood ought to carry the power of immortality too, and that power ought to be transmissible to others.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r33","rowIndex":33,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女の身体のなかに確かに私の血液ははいりこんだはずだけど、うんともすんとも言わない。完全に死んでしまったら、効き目はないんだろう。","en":"My blood had unquestionably entered her body, but she did not stir in the slightest. Perhaps it had no effect once someone was completely dead.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r34","rowIndex":34,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして私の身体はまだ温かい。私は生きているんだ。","en":"And my body was still warm. I was alive.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r35","rowIndex":35,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ビニールシートをめくった。そこは私たちが倒れた倉庫のなかで、照明はつけっぱなしだった。","en":"I pulled back the plastic sheet. I was inside the warehouse where we had fallen, and the lights had been left on.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r36","rowIndex":36,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　起き上がろうとすると、立ちくらみがしてよろよろとする。貧血の症状と同じだがもっとひどく、吐き気がする。胸を撃たれてたくさん出血したのだから当然だ。というか、生きて立ち上がれるほうがおかしいんだ本当は。","en":"When I tried to rise, dizziness sent me staggering. It felt like anemia, only much worse, and nausea came with it. Of course it did. I had been shot in the chest and lost an enormous amount of blood. The truly unnatural thing was that I could stand at all.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r37","rowIndex":37,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　一緒にいたはずの<tips=65>エフゲニ・イリイーチ・ヘス</tips>の死体はない。もっとも、あいつは今の私と同様そう簡単には死なない。きっと、<tips=21>八龍会</tips>の人たちがそれに気がついてどこかへ連れて行ったんだろう。私たちは死んだと思われて、ここに捨て置かれたんだ。そのうち死体回収の業者なりが来るんだろう。そういう商売をする奴らがいるんだこの街には。昔は<tips=55>汐松子</tips>のお父さんがその元締めで、今は小さな業者がいくつもある。","en":"The body of <tips=65>Yevgeny Ilyich Hess</tips>, who should have been there with us, was gone. Then again, like me now, he did not die easily. The people from the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips> must have realized that and taken him somewhere. They had assumed we were dead and abandoned us here. Eventually some corpse-collection service would probably come. People made a business of that in this city. <tips=55>Matsuko Shio’s</tips> father had once controlled the trade, but now it had splintered among numerous small operators.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r38","rowIndex":38,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちの団地でもそういう仕事をしている連中が何人もいる。昔は<tips=8>グレートホール</tips>に投げ捨てていたみたいだけど、今は近くに行くと汚染されるということを皆知ってるのと、死体の価値というものを知ってるから、色んな形でお金にする。","en":"Several people in our housing complex do that kind of work too. Apparently they used to dump the bodies into the <tips=8>Great Hole</tips>, but now everyone knows that going near it will contaminate you—and what a corpse is worth—so they profit from the dead in all sorts of ways.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r39","rowIndex":39,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それにしても頭が痛い。喉の奥がひりひりするほど乾く。胸が痛くて苦しい。","en":"My head hurt terribly. My throat was so dry that it burned deep inside. My chest hurt, and breathing was difficult.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r40","rowIndex":40,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そしてブンブンと虫が飛び回っているのはなに？","en":"And what were all those insects buzzing around me?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r41","rowIndex":41,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　辺りを見回してみたけれど、なんにもいない。でもおかしいな。沢山の虫がはばたくブーンブーンという音がきこえるんだ。なのになんにもいない。","en":"I looked around, but there was nothing there. Strange. I could hear the bzz-bzz of countless beating wings. And yet there was nothing there.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r42","rowIndex":42,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ああきっとコレは耳鳴りか何かなんだろう。こんな体調じゃ、そんなものが聞こえても仕方ない――というか、はばたく音の合間に、何かぶつぶつと喋っている人の声まで聞こえる。私はこれを知っている。<tips=17>タイプB</tips>が発症する兆候のひとつだ。","en":"Ah, it was probably tinnitus or something. In my condition, hearing such a thing would hardly be surprising... Except that amid the wingbeats, I could even hear human voices muttering. I knew what that was. It was one of the warning signs of <tips=17>Type B</tips> onset.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r43","rowIndex":43,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は発症するんだろうか。もう発症しているんだろうか。発症しているのだとしたら、もしかしたら今見えている世界は妄想と混じり合った現実でない世界かもしれないな。でもそれはもうどっちでもいいんだ。","en":"Was I going to develop symptoms? Had they already begun? If they had, perhaps the world before my eyes was not reality at all, but a world intermingled with delusion. It no longer mattered either way.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r44","rowIndex":44,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　とにかくここを出なくちゃいけない。<tips=21>八龍会</tips>とか<tips=65>エフゲニ・イリイーチ・ヘス</tips>のこととか<tips=10>見土道夫</tips>のこととか、死んだ私のもう片方のことも考えなきゃいけないはずだけど頭が回らない。ぼーっとする。圧倒的に血と肉が足りない。","en":"I had to get out of here. I should have been thinking about the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips>, <tips=65>Yevgeny Ilyich Hess</tips>, <tips=10>Michio Mido</tips>, and my other half, the one who had died, but my mind would not work. I felt dazed. I was desperately short of blood and flesh.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r45","rowIndex":45,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　一歩、一歩、歩くたびに身体がよろける。それになんだかとても眠くなって来た。まぶたがとろんと下がってくっつきそうだ。でもここで寝たらきっといけないんだろう。<tips=21>八龍会</tips>の人が帰ってくるかもしれないし、彼らに見つかったら――見つかったら、あまりいいことは起きないんだろう。きっと。","en":"My body swayed with every step. I was also becoming terribly sleepy. My eyelids drooped, nearly sealing themselves shut. But I probably wasn’t supposed to fall asleep here. Someone from the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips> might return, and if they found me—if they found me, nothing very good would happen. Probably.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r46","rowIndex":46,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　辺りはシンとして誰もいない。私の呼吸の音だけがきこえる。はあはあと、私はこんなに荒い呼吸をしているのか。","en":"The place was utterly still and empty. I could hear only my own breathing. Panting, ragged breaths—was I really breathing that hard?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r47","rowIndex":47,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　目の前にシャッターがあった。しっかりと閉ざされている。もし私が元気ならば、こんなの<tips=17>タイプB</tips>の力でこじ開けてしまえるのに、今はちょっと無理そうだ。","en":"A shutter stood before me, firmly closed. If I had been well, I could have forced something like this open with <tips=17>Type B</tips> strength. But in my present state, that looked a little beyond me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r48","rowIndex":48,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　他に出口はないか。","en":"Was there another way out?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r49","rowIndex":49,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　見回すために頭をふるだけで、脳がゆれてもの凄く気分が悪くなる。","en":"Simply turning my head to look around made my brain shift inside my skull and sent a violent wave of nausea through me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r50","rowIndex":50,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ここから出られればいいのに。","en":"If only I could get out of here.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r51","rowIndex":51,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　もともと私たちには手を使わずに物を動かす力があった。見えない透明人間を想像して、それに何かを触れさせると、本当に実体があるものが触れたかのように動かすことが出来るんだ。","en":"We had always possessed the power to move objects without using our hands. If I imagined an invisible person touching something, I could move it just as though a real, solid body had touched it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r52","rowIndex":52,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私はなんとなくそれをやってみた。","en":"For no particular reason, I tried it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r53","rowIndex":53,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　自分の姿と全く同じ透明人間がシャッターの下に指をかけ、そして引っ張り上げる。","en":"An invisible person identical to me hooked her fingers beneath the shutter and pulled upward.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r54","rowIndex":54,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　すると、本当に出来てしまった。","en":"And it actually worked.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r55","rowIndex":55,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　シャッターのあちこちから金属のきしむもの凄い音がして、まるでアルミホイルを握りつぶしたみたいに、しわだらけになりながらシャッターがめくり上がり、そして外の太陽の光がその隙間から差し込んだ。","en":"Metal shrieked from every part of the shutter. It wrinkled and crumpled like a sheet of aluminum foil being crushed in a fist as it peeled upward, and sunlight streamed through the opening beneath it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r56","rowIndex":56,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　あれ？　どうして出来るんだろう？","en":"Huh? How was I able to do that?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r57","rowIndex":57,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そしてふと思い出して見ると、私は自分がどっちなのか、はっきり自覚できていないことに気がついた。","en":"Then, when I tried to remember, I realized that I had no clear awareness of which one I was.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r58","rowIndex":58,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　さっき撃たれた場面では、両方が撃たれて血が飛び散る場面が映像として記憶に残っているけれど、どちらも客観的に見た感じの映像だ。頭がぼんやりしているから、本当の記憶と想像がごっちゃになっているのかもしれない。","en":"My memory of the shooting was an image of both of us being hit, blood flying—but I saw each of us from an outside perspective. Maybe, with my head so foggy, real memories and imagination had become mixed together.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r59","rowIndex":59,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　昔のことを思い出そうとしても、二人が並んで何かをしている映像ばかりで、どっちがどっちかわからない。そもそも、私たちはいつも一緒だったから、別々の思い出なんかないんだ。トイレとかは別々だったけど、トイレに入ってる自分の姿を思い出しても、どっちだかわからないな。","en":"When I tried to remember the past, all I saw were images of the two of us doing things side by side. I could not tell which was which. We had always been together, so we had no separate memories in the first place. We did use the toilet separately, but even when I pictured myself in there, I could not say which one I was.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r60","rowIndex":60,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は何か自分の顔が映るものがないか探して、近くの資材の金属パーツがよく磨かれているのを見つけた。そこに顔を映すと、目が金色になっている。私が<tips=17>タイプB</tips>なのは間違いない。","en":"I searched for something that would reflect my face and found a well-polished metal component among the materials nearby. In its surface, I saw that my eyes had turned gold. There was no question that I was a <tips=17>Type B</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r61","rowIndex":61,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=17>タイプB</tips>で、そしてサイキックも使えて――これじゃもうどっちがどっちかわからない。顔を見たって、区別がつきやしないんだ。","en":"A <tips=17>Type B</tips> who could also use psychic powers... Now I had no idea which of us was which. Even our faces gave me no way to tell.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r62","rowIndex":62,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　何を言っているんだろう？","en":"What am I talking about?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r63","rowIndex":63,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　区別なんかつける必要ないじゃないか。これはだって、ここにいるのは私たちなんだ。そういうことなんだろう。ああ、そうなんだ。誰も死んではいなかったんだ！","en":"There was no need to tell us apart. Because this—what was here was us. That was all it meant. Yes. That was right. No one had died!","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r64","rowIndex":64,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　とにかく、出口が出来た。","en":"In any event, we had made an exit.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r65","rowIndex":65,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちはそこから出ることにした。","en":"We decided to leave through it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r66","rowIndex":66,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　身をかがめてくぐったところで、ふと振り返った。","en":"After ducking beneath the opening, we happened to look back.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r67","rowIndex":67,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　半分めくれたシートからはみ出した私たちの死体が見える。あれはこのまま置いていっていいのだろうか？","en":"Our corpse protruded from beneath the half-peeled-back sheet. Was it all right simply to leave that there?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r68","rowIndex":68,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　置いていったら、好きなようにメチャクチャにされてしまう。","en":"If we did, people would do anything they liked to it and ruin it completely.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r69","rowIndex":69,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ああでも、それでいいのか。私たちにはもう、アレは必要なくなったんだし。誰かが利用してくれるならそれは、省エネっていうか、エコっていうか、無駄のないことだ。","en":"Ah, but maybe that was all right. We did not need it anymore. If someone could put it to use, that was energy-saving, or eco-friendly, or... anyway, it was not wasteful.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r70","rowIndex":70,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちは前を向いて歩き出す。","en":"We faced forward and began to walk.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r71","rowIndex":71,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　明るい太陽が背中をやわらかく温めて、うつむき加減になったアスファルトにくっきりとした私たちの影を落とす。","en":"The bright sun warmed our back gently and cast our sharply defined shadow on the asphalt beneath our lowered gaze.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r72","rowIndex":72,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　虫の羽音のようなざわめきはずっと聞こえている。","en":"The murmur like insect wings continued without pause.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r73","rowIndex":73,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　とにかくお腹が空いた。","en":"Anyway, we were starving.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r74","rowIndex":74,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　頭のなかもお腹のなかも空っぽで、ほとんどなんにも考えていなかったけれど、子供の時から街をうろついていたせいですっかり地理は身体に染み込んでいて、気づいたら私たちは『シンディーマート』という大きな看板のかかった店の前にいた。","en":"Our mind and stomach were both empty, and we were scarcely thinking at all. Yet after wandering the city since childhood, its geography was ingrained in our body. Before we knew it, we stood in front of a store beneath a large sign reading CINDY MART.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r75","rowIndex":75,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちが小さな頃はコンビニみたいな小さな店舗で、薬と、お菓子や保存食料品などを売っていたけれど、今は真っ黒なアスファルトの敷かれた広い駐車場と、真夜中でもまわりが明るくなるくらい強烈な照明で広い店内を照らしている大きな店となって、薬も生鮮食品もそれぞれの専門店と同じくらい豊富に扱うようになっている。","en":"When we were little, it had been a tiny shop like a convenience store, selling medicine, sweets, preserved foods, and the like. Now it had become a large establishment, with a broad parking lot paved in jet-black asphalt and powerful lights that illuminated its spacious interior brightly enough to light the neighborhood even at midnight. Its selections of medicine and fresh food rivaled those of specialty stores.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r76","rowIndex":76,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　この街のお店らしく、輸入食品も多くて、私たちはここでよくクッキーだとかお菓子を買っていた。そしてそれを食べながら、この辺りを歩いていたんだ。","en":"Like so many stores in this city, it carried a great many imported foods. We often bought cookies and other sweets here, then ate them as we walked around the neighborhood.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r77","rowIndex":77,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　マットを踏むとガラスのドアが音もなく開く。","en":"When we stepped upon the mat, the glass doors opened soundlessly.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r78","rowIndex":78,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　入り口のところにあったカートを押して食品コーナーの方へ歩く私たちを、通り過ぎる客がジロジロと見る。","en":"The customers we passed stared openly at us as we pushed a cart from the entrance toward the food section.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r79","rowIndex":79,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そう言えば私たちの胸は血みどろに汚れていたんだ。","en":"Come to think of it, our chest was soaked in blood.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r80","rowIndex":80,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　顔もきっと同じように血と埃で汚れているに違いない。","en":"Our face must have been similarly caked with blood and dust.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r81","rowIndex":81,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　髪の毛を手のひらで触ってみると、血液でかたまって手ぐしが通らなかった。","en":"When we ran a palm over our hair, the blood had hardened it so completely that our fingers would not pass through.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r82","rowIndex":82,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　すごい格好だな。――別にいいか。","en":"We were quite a sight. ...Well, never mind.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r83","rowIndex":83,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　食品コーナーには業務用の食材も沢山おいてある。私たちは身体の求めるまま、必要なものをカゴに放り込んだ。","en":"The food section carried plenty of commercial-size provisions as well. We followed our body’s demands, tossing everything it needed into the cart.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r84","rowIndex":84,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　丸のままのハムを二本、牛乳を四リットル、オリーブオイルを一瓶、キャベツを三個、生卵を五パック、ニンジンとピーマンを一袋、フランスパンを三本、レンジで温めるご飯を5パック、冷凍のアジの干物を六枚、コーラのペットボトルを一本、チョコレートを八枚――。そして石けんと歯ブラシとバスタオルと生理用品——あとは何を入れたかよく憶えていない。","en":"Two whole hams; four liters of milk; one bottle of olive oil; three heads of cabbage; five cartons of raw eggs; one bag of carrots and bell peppers; three baguettes; five packs of microwaveable rice; six frozen dried horse mackerel; one bottle of cola; eight bars of chocolate—and soap, a toothbrush, a bath towel, and sanitary products. I do not clearly remember what else we put in.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r85","rowIndex":85,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　カートに積み上げたのを崩さないようレジへ向かう。","en":"We headed for the register, taking care not to topple everything piled in the cart.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r86","rowIndex":86,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　レジのところには太っちょで髭を生やしたおじさんの店員さんが携帯電話をいじっていた。","en":"A portly, bearded clerk was at the register, fiddling with his phone.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r87","rowIndex":87,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「すみません」","en":"“Excuse me.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r88","rowIndex":88,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　声をかけると、顔を上げて露骨に顔を顰める。","en":"When we called to him, he looked up and made no effort to hide his grimace.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r89","rowIndex":89,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「これを下さい」","en":"“We’d like these, please.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r90","rowIndex":90,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「こんなに？」","en":"“All of that?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r91","rowIndex":91,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうです。これ全部です」","en":"“Yes. Everything here.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r92","rowIndex":92,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「怪我してるのかい？　顔色も死人みたいにあおっちろいじゃないか。それに、目がギンギラに金色になってる。そんなんじゃ売れないよ」","en":"“Are you hurt? You’re pale as a corpse, and your eyes are shining bright gold. I can’t sell to someone like that.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r93","rowIndex":93,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　店員さんはレジを打とうとしないで、えらそうに腕組みをしている。","en":"The clerk folded his arms self-importantly and made no move to operate the register.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r94","rowIndex":94,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「お金を払いますから売ってください」","en":"“We will pay. Please sell them to us.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r95","rowIndex":95,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちは無視して財布を取り出そうとしたけれど、財布が見つからない。","en":"Ignoring him, we tried to take out our wallet—but we could not find it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r96","rowIndex":96,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　上着のポケットに確かに入れていたはずなのに。きっと<tips=21>八龍会</tips>の人たちに抜き取られたんだろう。","en":"It should definitely have been in our jacket pocket. The people from the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips> must have taken it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r97","rowIndex":97,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ほら、金も持ってないじゃないか。もう帰ってくれ。商品はおれが戻しておくから。……まったく、面倒くさい」","en":"“See? You don’t even have any money. Go home. I’ll put all this back. ...Honestly, what a nuisance.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r98","rowIndex":98,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　身につけた服のポケットを上からポンポンと叩いていると店員さんは舌打ちをする。","en":"As we patted each pocket of our clothing, the clerk clicked his tongue.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r99","rowIndex":99,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「お金はないみたいです。でも私たちは食べ物が必要なんです」","en":"“It appears we have no money. But we need food.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r100","rowIndex":100,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そんなのおれの知ったことじゃないよ。おうちに帰ってお父さんかお母さんに頼んで買って貰うんだね」","en":"“That’s none of my business. Run home and have your mommy or daddy buy it for you.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r101","rowIndex":101,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「お金は払いません。でも、袋詰めしてください」","en":"“We won’t be paying. But please bag everything for us.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r102","rowIndex":102,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「話が全然通じないな。これだから<tips=78>金目</tips>は……」","en":"“There’s no getting through to you. This is why <tips=78>Gold-Eyes</tips> are...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r103","rowIndex":103,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　店員さんは私たちに見せつけるように、さっきよりも大きく舌打ちをして、","en":"The clerk clicked his tongue even louder than before, making a point of letting us hear it, then said:","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r104","rowIndex":104,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「お前じゃ話にならない。保護者はいるのかい？　その連絡先を……」","en":"“There’s no talking to you. Do you have a parent or guardian? Give me their contact information—”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r105","rowIndex":105,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いません。はやく袋詰めしてください。とてもだるくて……」","en":"“We do not. Please hurry and bag everything. We feel terribly weak...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r106","rowIndex":106,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「冗談じゃないよ！」","en":"“Don’t be ridiculous!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r107","rowIndex":107,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　店員さんは顔を真っ赤にして私たちを睨み付ける。","en":"The clerk’s face went crimson as he glared at us.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r108","rowIndex":108,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「さっさと出て行くんだ。そうでなければ警察を呼ぶぞ？　それとも、病院の方がいいかもしれんな……」","en":"“Get out of here, now, or I’ll call the police. Or perhaps I’d better call a hospital...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r109","rowIndex":109,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　店員さんはカウンターの後ろにある電話の受話器を握りしめた。","en":"The clerk seized the telephone receiver behind the counter.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r110","rowIndex":110,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その時、私たちにだけ聞こえる虫の羽音と人の声は一層大きくなった。","en":"At that moment, the wingbeats and human voices that only we could hear grew louder still.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r111","rowIndex":111,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ああもう、うるさいっ！","en":"“Oh, shut up already!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r112","rowIndex":112,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　すると店内のどこに設置してあったのか<tips=42>サイキック探知機</tips>特有のあのけたたましい警報が鳴り響き、店員さんの背後にあった煙草の棚がベキッと乾いた音を立てて、並べてあったカートンの箱ごと潰れる。","en":"Then, from somewhere in the store, the unmistakable, earsplitting alarm of a <tips=42>psychic detector</tips> began to blare. The cigarette display behind the clerk gave a dry crack and collapsed, crushing the cartons arrayed on it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r113","rowIndex":113,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちはこんなところで能力なんか使うつもりじゃなかったのに。イライラしてついやってしまった。","en":"We had not meant to use our power in a place like this. Irritation had made us do it without thinking.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r114","rowIndex":114,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　店員さんは目を丸くしながら、割れて鋭い破片を剥き出しにしている棚を振り返る。","en":"His eyes round, the clerk turned to stare at the shattered shelf and the sharp fragments now jutting from it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r115","rowIndex":115,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「店員さん、こちらを見て私たちの話を聞いて下さい」","en":"“Sir, please look at us and listen to what we have to say.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r116","rowIndex":116,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　頭痛のするこめかみを抑えながら私たちはなるべく冷静に店員さんに言う。","en":"Pressing a hand to our aching temple, we addressed the clerk as calmly as we could.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r117","rowIndex":117,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　背中におかしな冷や汗をかいている。変な興奮が、胸をドキドキとさせ、息をハアハアとさせる。","en":"A strange cold sweat broke out across our back. A strange excitement set our heart pounding and left us panting.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r118","rowIndex":118,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……」","en":"“...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r119","rowIndex":119,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　店員さんも私たちと同じように冷や汗をかきながらこちらを振り向いた。","en":"Sweating just as we were, the clerk turned back toward us.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r120","rowIndex":120,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しばらくこめかみを抑えていると、段々頭痛が治まり、耳鳴りも小さくなった。そのかわり、なんともいえない気だるさが身体にのしかかる。","en":"After we held our temple for a while, the headache gradually subsided and the tinnitus diminished. In its place, an indescribable weariness settled heavily upon our body.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r121","rowIndex":121,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　今私たちの身体と心は、なんて不安定なんだろう。まるで波の上にいるみたいだ。","en":"How unstable our body and mind were now. It was as though we were bobbing on the waves.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r122","rowIndex":122,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「このハム何で出来ているか知ってますか？」","en":"“Do you know what this ham is made from?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r123","rowIndex":123,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちは億劫な手を上げてカートの上のハムを指さした。","en":"With a leaden hand, we pointed to the ham atop the cart.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r124","rowIndex":124,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「これは豚ですよね。私たちは、たくさんの豚を繁殖させ、工場みたいな狭い場所に閉じ込めて育て、殺してその肉を剥がしとっています。なんでかっていうと、私たちより豚が弱いからです。私たちは豚の他にもいろんな生き物を産ませたり殺したり食べたりしていますが、みんな納得してるわけじゃなくて、弱いから意志なんか関係ないんです」","en":"“This came from a pig, didn’t it? We breed pigs in great numbers, shut them up and raise them in cramped places like factories, then kill them and strip away their flesh. Do you know why? Because pigs are weaker than we are. We make all kinds of living creatures breed, and we kill them and eat them too. It isn’t as though they all consented. They are weak, so what they want does not matter.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r125","rowIndex":125,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちが喋っている後ろで、何かいろんなものが割れたり、倒れたりしたみたいで、もの凄い音がして、もの凄い悲鳴が聞こえる。","en":"Behind us as we spoke, all manner of things seemed to break and topple. There were tremendous crashes and terrible screams.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r126","rowIndex":126,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちはわざとそんなのをやったわけじゃないけど、でも本当にイライラしてるから、きっと私たちのせいなんだろう。","en":"We were not doing it deliberately, but we truly were irritated, so it was probably our fault.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r127","rowIndex":127,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「だから、本当だったら私たちはあなたの意志なんか無視して、あなたを殺して奪って行くのが自然なのかもしれません。でも、私たちは出来れば誰も殺したくないんです。それに、袋詰めも面倒そうだし……」","en":"“By that logic, it might be natural for us to ignore your will, kill you, and take what we want. But we would prefer not to kill anyone. Besides, putting all of this into bags looks rather troublesome...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r128","rowIndex":128,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　店員さんは青白い顔になってしまっていて、その震える手をカウンターの下にのばす。彼は多分ものすごく必死で、素早くその動作を行っているんだろうけど、なんだかスローモーションみたいにゆっくり見えておかしい。","en":"The clerk had gone deathly pale and was reaching a trembling hand beneath the counter. He was probably moving as quickly as he could in his desperation, but to us he looked so slow, as though moving in slow motion, that it was almost funny.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r129","rowIndex":129,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼がカウンターの下から取り出したのはショットガンだ。","en":"He pulled a shotgun from beneath the counter.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r130","rowIndex":130,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　強盗撃退用のその武器を、私たちに向ける。","en":"He pointed the weapon, kept there to fend off robbers, directly at us.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r131","rowIndex":131,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして何か言おうと唇を開く。その拍子に唾液の飛沫がたまになってくるくる回転しながら飛んで行くのが見える。","en":"He opened his mouth to say something. As he did, we watched flecks of spittle gather into beads and spin away through the air.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r132","rowIndex":132,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「おい、お前……」","en":"“Hey, you...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r133","rowIndex":133,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　今度は私たちはちゃんと意識して力を使った。","en":"This time, we used our power consciously.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r134","rowIndex":134,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　すると、ショットガンの銃身がぐにゃりと飴細工のように曲がる。","en":"The shotgun barrel bent and sagged like taffy.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r135","rowIndex":135,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　店員さんはあんぐりと口をひらいて言いかけた言葉を飲み込む。","en":"The clerk’s mouth fell open, and he swallowed the words he had begun to speak.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r136","rowIndex":136,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　硬直して動けなくなった店員さんに私たちは言った。","en":"We spoke to the clerk, who had gone rigid and could no longer move.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r137","rowIndex":137,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ねえ、暴力はやめましょうよ。私たちはお互い賢くて素晴らしい人間なんだから、言葉を使ってコミュニケーションがとれるじゃないですか。それを使って平和的に解決したほうが素敵だと思いませんか？　どうします？　……なんだか、私たち、こうやって考えるのも喋るのもだんだんダルくなって来たんですけど」","en":"“Look, let’s stop with the violence. We are both intelligent, wonderful human beings, so we can communicate with words, can’t we? Wouldn’t it be nicer to use them and settle this peacefully? What do you say? ...Though all this thinking and talking is getting more and more tiring for us.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r138","rowIndex":138,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして私たちは溜息をついた。","en":"Then we sighed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r139","rowIndex":139,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　店員さんはとても丁寧に袋詰めをしてくれた。","en":"The clerk bagged everything with the utmost care.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r140","rowIndex":140,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　大きめのレジ袋が六つ、食材でパンパンに膨らんでいる。カートで駐車場の端まで運んで、そこでタクシーを止め運転手さんの手を借りてトランクや後部座席に積み込んだ。","en":"Six large shopping bags bulged with food. We pushed them in the cart to the edge of the parking lot, hailed a taxi there, and enlisted the driver’s help to load them into the trunk and back seat.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r141","rowIndex":141,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>が隠れ家にしていたあの洋館まで運んで貰った。支払いは、シンディーマートのレジから拝借したお金を使った。","en":"We had him take us to the old mansion <tips=20>Koschei</tips> had used as a hideout. We paid the fare with money borrowed from Cindy Mart’s register.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r142","rowIndex":142,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　この建物の近くの<tips=42>サイキック探知機</tips>は<tips=65>エフゲニ・イリイーチ・ヘス</tips>が取り外してある。私たちは誰の目も気にすることなく、能力をつかって透明人間に六つの袋を運ばせた。","en":"The <tips=42>psychic detectors</tips> near this building had been removed by <tips=65>Yevgeny Ilyich Hess</tips>. Without worrying about anyone watching, we used our power and made the invisible person carry all six bags.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r143","rowIndex":143,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　財布をとられていたけれど鍵はそのままポケットに入っていたので、それで玄関のドアを開けた。","en":"Our wallet had been taken, but the key was still in our pocket, so we used it to open the front door.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r144","rowIndex":144,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そうして私たち三人が暮らしていたその建物にやっと帰って来ると、身体の疲労がいっぺんに襲ってきてもうそれ以上一歩も歩ける気がしなかった。","en":"When we finally returned to the building where the three of us had lived, exhaustion swept over our body all at once. We felt as though we could not take another step.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r145","rowIndex":145,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ドアから入ったすぐのところにへたり込む。そして、袋の中のものをその辺りにまき散らして、手づかみで食事をはじめた。","en":"We sank to the floor just inside the door, emptied the bags around us where we sat, and began eating with our hands.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r146","rowIndex":146,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　牛乳をパックの口を破ってごくごくと飲む。牛乳がこぼれて胸元を汚したけれどいまさら気にしてなんかいられない。","en":"We tore open the top of a carton and gulped down the milk. It spilled across our chest, but at that point we could hardly care.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r147","rowIndex":147,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして、ラップを剥がしてキャベツを洗わないまま剥がして口につめこみ、そしてまるごとのハムを包んである網のようなものを破ってからかじりつき、オリーブオイルを瓶に直接口をつけて流し込む。","en":"We stripped the wrapping from a cabbage, tore off its leaves without washing them, and stuffed them into our mouth. Then we ripped through the netting around one of the whole hams and bit into it, and finally pressed our lips directly to the bottle of olive oil and poured it down our throat.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r148","rowIndex":148,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それらが喉の奥を通り過ぎて胃に辿り着くと、食欲のわりには内臓の方はまだそんなに充分に機能していないみたいだった。ものすごい勢いで逆流して、私たちはうわっとその場に詰め込んだばかりのものを口から吐き出してしまう。","en":"Once all of it passed down our throat and reached our stomach, it appeared that despite our appetite, our organs were not yet functioning well enough. Everything surged back with incredible force, and with a cry, we vomited what we had just crammed into our mouth all over the floor.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r149","rowIndex":149,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　もったいないことをした。これじゃ、身体が回復しない。","en":"What a waste. At this rate, our body would never recover.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r150","rowIndex":150,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちはもう一度同じように牛乳を飲み、キャベツをつめこみ、ハムを囓り、オリーブオイルを飲む。また吐き気がしたけれど、今度はちゃんと心の準備をしていたから吐くことはなかった。","en":"We drank milk again, stuffed cabbage into our mouth, gnawed at the ham, and swallowed olive oil. Nausea returned, but this time we had prepared ourselves and did not vomit.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r151","rowIndex":151,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　両手で口を押さえ、下からせり上がって来たものを無理矢理飲み込む。そうすると、やっと内臓が我を取り戻してくれたようで消化を開始してくれた。","en":"We covered our mouth with both hands and forced down everything rising from below. At last, our organs seemed to regain their senses and began digesting the food.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r152","rowIndex":152,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　一旦内臓が動き出すと、食べたものが身体に取り込まれて行く不思議な恍惚感が心を支配する。","en":"Once our organs began working, a strange ecstasy took possession of our mind as the food was absorbed into our body.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r153","rowIndex":153,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちは生卵の殻を割って立て続けに三つ飲み込み、ピーマンを種もヘタもとらずにそのままむさぼり、咀嚼もあいまいなまま牛乳で流し込んだ。","en":"We cracked three raw eggs and swallowed them in rapid succession. We devoured a bell pepper without removing either seeds or stem, scarcely chewed it, and washed it down with milk.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r154","rowIndex":154,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　顔も服も食べ物でドロドロに汚しながら食べ続け、途中で途轍もなく眠くなったので少しまどろみ、起きたら食べ、そしてまた眠り、尿意で目が覚めてトイレで済ませてから戻ってくるとまた食べた。そうしている間に、窓が明るくなったり暗くなったりしていた。","en":"We continued eating, smearing our face and clothes with food. Partway through, we became impossibly sleepy and dozed for a while. When we woke, we ate; then we slept again. The need to urinate woke us, so we went to the toilet, returned, and resumed eating. As this continued, the windows brightened and darkened around us.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r155","rowIndex":155,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　何日過ぎたのかわからない。三日くらいだと思う。もしかしたら五日くらい過ぎたのかな？　目が覚めると、すっかり身体が軽くなって、気分がよくなっているのを感じた。","en":"We did not know how many days had passed. Perhaps three. Or could it have been five? When we woke, our body felt wonderfully light, and we felt well.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r156","rowIndex":156,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　全身が血と埃と食べ物で汚れて悪臭を放っている。","en":"Our whole body was caked in blood, dust, and food, and it reeked.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r157","rowIndex":157,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　バスルームに行って買ったばかりの石けんでよく全身を洗い、ムダ毛を処理して、そしてバスタブに張った湯につかると生まれ変わったような気持ちになった。","en":"We went to the bathroom, scrubbed ourselves all over with the soap we had just bought, shaved, and sank into a hot bath. We felt reborn.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r158","rowIndex":158,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　文字通り、本当に生まれ変わったようだ。銃で撃たれた場所はもう塞がって痕跡がなく、少し耳鳴りや幻聴はするけれども、身体の隅々まで力が行き渡って充実した気分だった。","en":"Quite literally, we truly seemed to have been reborn. The place where the bullet had struck was already closed, without a trace left behind. Our ears still rang a little, and we still heard things that were not there, but strength reached every corner of our body. We felt whole.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r159","rowIndex":159,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　鏡を見ると、瞳は相変わらず金色のままだ。","en":"When we looked into the mirror, our eyes remained gold.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r160","rowIndex":160,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=55>松子</tips>や<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>のように、興奮しなくてもずっと金色のままでいられるようになったのだろう。","en":"Perhaps, like <tips=55>Matsuko</tips> and <tips=20>Koschei</tips>, they had become permanently gold even when we were not excited.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r161","rowIndex":161,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　あるいは発症しているのかな？","en":"Or had our symptoms manifested?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r162","rowIndex":162,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　でも、発症したらもっとありえない幻覚が見えて、わけのわからない世界に囚われるんじゃないかしら？","en":"But if they had, wouldn’t we be seeing even more impossible hallucinations? Wouldn’t we be trapped in some incomprehensible world?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r163","rowIndex":163,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そうなってないから発症はしていないと思うんだけど、でも、ああいうのってきっと自覚が出来ないものだから自信がない。","en":"Since nothing like that had happened, we did not think our symptoms had manifested. Then again, it was surely the kind of thing you could not recognize in yourself, so we could not be certain.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r164","rowIndex":164,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　まあ、すがすがしい気持ちなのは間違いないのだから、どっちでもいいんだろう。","en":"Well, there was no doubt that we felt refreshed. The distinction probably did not matter.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r165","rowIndex":165,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　とにかく、これからのことを考えなくちゃいけない。","en":"In any event, we had to decide what to do next.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r166","rowIndex":166,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちは戦いに負けた。その結果片方が死んで、<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>は行方不明だ。","en":"We had lost the fight. As a result, one of us was dead, and <tips=20>Koschei</tips> was missing.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r167","rowIndex":167,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちはいま<tips=17>タイプB</tips>の身体能力と、<tips=16>タイプA</tips>の念動力の両方が使える。","en":"We could now use both the physical powers of a <tips=17>Type B</tips> and the psychokinesis of a <tips=16>Type A</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r168","rowIndex":168,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　あと、念動力は前よりもずっと強い力が使えるようにになったらしい。","en":"Our psychokinesis also appeared to have grown far stronger than before.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r169","rowIndex":169,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　だって、そうじゃなければ倉庫のシャッターをこじ開けたり、シンディーマートで鉄砲の銃身を曲げたり出来るはずがないもの。あの時は頭が朦朧としていてそうした力の変化に全く気がつかなかったけれども、今思うとあきらかにおかしい。","en":"Otherwise, we could never have forced open the warehouse shutter or bent the gun barrel at Cindy Mart. Our mind had been so clouded at the time that we never noticed the change in our strength, but in retrospect it was clearly abnormal.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r170","rowIndex":170,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちの透明人間の腕力は、大体私たちと同じくらいの腕力だった。前はノーマルだったからノーマルなりの力しか出せなかったけど、今は<tips=17>タイプB</tips>としての力がそのまま透明人間にも反映されているんだと思う。いや、それ以上なのかな？　あんな鉄の棒をひん曲げるなんて、前も<tips=78>金目</tips>になっても出来ることじゃなかったし――腕力も強くなっているのかしら？　<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>の血肉のおかげで、<tips=72>傾向値</tips>が上がったんだろう。","en":"The invisible person’s physical strength had always been about the same as our own. Before, we were Normal, so it could exert only a Normal person’s strength. But now, we thought, our strength as a <tips=17>Type B</tips> must be reflected directly in it. Or was it even stronger than that? We could never have bent an iron bar like that before, not even after becoming <tips=78>Gold-Eyes</tips>—had our physical strength increased too? Our <tips=72>tendency value</tips> must have risen thanks to <tips=20>Koschei’s</tips> blood and flesh.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r171","rowIndex":171,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　なんにしろ、私たちの力はこれまでとは別物だということだ。","en":"Whatever the case, our power had become something altogether different.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r172","rowIndex":172,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　これなら、<tips=10>見土道夫</tips>とやりあっても負けないのかな？　そうだとしたら、行動の幅が大分広がる――。","en":"Could we fight <tips=10>Michio Mido</tips> now without losing? If so, we had far more options...","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r173","rowIndex":173,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　これから何をするか考えよう。","en":"Let’s think about what to do next.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r174","rowIndex":174,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>は多分<tips=21>八龍会</tips>に捕獲されている。あの人たちは<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>の正体や、その能力をどの程度詳しく知っているのか――。正確にはわからないけれど、多分<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>を本当に殺す方法を詳しく知ってるということはないと思う。","en":"<tips=20>Koschei</tips> had probably been captured by the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips>. How much did those people know about <tips=20>Koschei’s</tips> true identity and abilities—? We could not be sure, but they probably did not possess detailed knowledge of how to kill <tips=20>Koschei</tips> for good.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r175","rowIndex":175,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　まあ、知っていたとしても、すぐには殺さない。","en":"Well, even if they did know, they would not kill him right away.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r176","rowIndex":176,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　だって、<tips=21>八龍会</tips>の人たちは『<tips=46>ネオ・ローズ</tips>』の作り方を知らないんだもの。どこかに閉じ込めて、拷問だとか、色々なことをして聞き出そうとするんじゃないかな？","en":"After all, the people of the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips> do not know how to make <tips=46>Neo Rose</tips>. Wouldn’t they lock him up somewhere and torture him, or do all sorts of things to make him tell them?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r177","rowIndex":177,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちだったらそうする。何て言ったって『<tips=46>ネオ・ローズ</tips>』が彼らの生命線なのは明白なのだから。あれがなければ、<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>と戦うことも、この街を<tips=17>タイプB</tips>のものにすることも出来やしない。","en":"That is what we would do. After all, <tips=46>Neo Rose</tips> is clearly their lifeline. Without it, they cannot fight <tips=7>YS</tips> or make this city belong to the <tips=17>Type Bs</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r178","rowIndex":178,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>もすぐには言わない――というか、レシピを知らない人に変身しちゃえばどうやっても言えないんだ。","en":"And <tips=20>Koschei</tips> will not tell them right away either—or rather, if he transforms into someone who does not know the recipe, he cannot tell them no matter what they do.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r179","rowIndex":179,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　だから、時間はまだある――。","en":"So we still had time—","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r180","rowIndex":180,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>の服が残っていた。白いロングＴシャツは袖をまくればいい。黒いズボンは裾を切った。それを身につけながら考えた。","en":"<tips=20>Koschei’s</tips> clothes were still here. We could simply roll up the sleeves of the white long-sleeved T-shirt. We cut down the legs of the black trousers. As we dressed, we continued to think.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r181","rowIndex":181,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　頭はすっきりとして、調子がいい。あんな傷を負っていたのにすごい。休養と、補給をすればこんなに回復出来るんだ、いまの私たちの身体は。","en":"Our head was clear, and we felt good. It was amazing after wounds like those. With rest and nourishment, this body of ours could recover this much.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r182","rowIndex":182,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　――それにしても、このタイミングで<tips=21>八龍会</tips>が裏切ってくるとは。","en":"—Even so, for the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips> to betray us at precisely this moment...","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r183","rowIndex":183,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=65>エフゲニ・イリイーチ・ヘス</tips>も警戒してはいたんだ。レシピを独占している以上、あの人たちに快く思われることはないって。でも、<tips=21>八龍会</tips>も今は<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>を相手にしたり、難しい時期だし、何かあるとしてももっと先だと思ってた。","en":"<tips=65>Yevgeny Ilyich Hess</tips> had been wary of them. He knew that, as long as he monopolized the formula, the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips> would resent him. But they were already dealing with <tips=7>YS</tips>, and it was a difficult time for them. Even if something did happen, we had expected it much later.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r184","rowIndex":184,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それが、今やって来るなんて。","en":"For it to happen now...","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r185","rowIndex":185,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　レシピもわからないのに、襲われた<tips=65>エフゲニ・イリイーチ・ヘス</tips>が不死身じゃなくて、本当に死んじゃったらどうするつもりなんだろう？　<tips=46>ネオ・ローズ</tips>がなければ<tips=47>解放軍</tips>も維持出来ないし、完全に終わりになっちゃうのに。","en":"They did not even know the formula. What did they mean to do if <tips=65>Yevgeny Ilyich Hess</tips> turned out not to be immortal and their attack actually killed him? Without <tips=46>Neo Rose</tips>, they could not even maintain the <tips=47>Liberation Army</tips>. It would be the end of everything.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r186","rowIndex":186,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　何か情報を掴んでいたのか。――それとも、<tips=10>見土道夫</tips>はあんまり頭がよくないのかな？","en":"Had they gotten hold of some information? Or was <tips=10>Michio Mido</tips> simply not very bright?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r187","rowIndex":187,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　まあそれはいいか。","en":"Well, never mind that.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r188","rowIndex":188,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちは立ち上がって、二階の奥の部屋に行き、壁際にかかっている鏡の裏に手を突っ込んだ。","en":"We stood up, went to the room at the back of the second floor, and reached behind the mirror hanging on the wall.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r189","rowIndex":189,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あったあった」","en":"“There it is.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r190","rowIndex":190,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そこには私たちが隠したものがある。手でぎゅっと握れるくらいの小さな小瓶だ。そのなかでは、白い物が動いている。","en":"That was where we had hidden it: a tiny vial small enough to close tightly in one hand. Something white was moving inside.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r191","rowIndex":191,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　――ずっと迷っていたけれど、やっぱり、これも渡さなくちゃいけない。","en":"—We had hesitated over it for a long time, but after all, we had to hand this over too.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r192","rowIndex":192,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それに、<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>の救出もしなくちゃいけない。なんだか、やらなきゃいけないことが一杯あるな。","en":"Besides, we had to rescue <tips=20>Koschei</tips>. Somehow, there were so many things we had to do.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r193","rowIndex":193,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　まず、情報を集めなくちゃ。いろんなことを確認しないといけない。どうやったらあいつにこれを届けることが出来るのか。<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>はどこにいるのか。ここで私たちがのんきに食べて寝ている間、<tips=21>八龍会</tips>が何をしたのか。携帯電話も没収されてしまったみたいでなくなったから、調べる手段は限られているけれど。","en":"First, we had to gather information. There were all sorts of things we needed to find out: how we could get this to him, where <tips=20>Koschei</tips> was, and what the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips> had done while we were here blithely eating and sleeping. Our phone seemed to have been confiscated too, which left us with few ways to investigate.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r194","rowIndex":194,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　夕方になってから私たちは建物を出る。目指すは<tips=59>暗闇通り</tips>。","en":"That evening, we left the building. Our destination was <tips=59>Darkness Street</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r195","rowIndex":195,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　女の人と遊ぶ店ばかりが有名なその通りには、飲み屋さんも沢山建ち並んでいる。そのすぐ近くの、薄暗い人の入りにくい路地には地元の人間しか行かないような小さな店がいくつかあって、<tips=21>八龍会</tips>の人たちがよく集まる店がそこにあることも知っている。","en":"The street was famous primarily for establishments offering female company, but it was also lined with bars. Nearby, in dim alleys that discouraged strangers, stood several small places patronized almost exclusively by locals. We knew that one of them was a regular gathering place for members of the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r196","rowIndex":196,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　はじめはその近くの暗がりに潜んで、<tips=21>八龍会</tips>の誰かが出て来るのを待っていた。出て来たら、その人を拉致して話を聞こうと思ったんだ。だけど、じっと待つというのはどうにも性にあわない。","en":"At first, we hid in the darkness nearby and waited for someone from the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips> to emerge. Once someone did, we intended to abduct them and question them. Sitting and waiting, however, was not in our nature.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r197","rowIndex":197,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　こんな小さな店なら、どうせ大した人数もいないだろう。","en":"A little establishment like this could hardly contain very many people.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r198","rowIndex":198,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ということで、私たちは待ちきれなくなって正面のドアを開いた。","en":"And so, unable to wait any longer, we opened the front door.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r199","rowIndex":199,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　この街にはいろんな異国の雰囲気を模して売り出す飲食店が多いけれど、そこはとりたてて個性のない店だ。強いて言えばイギリス風のパブに似ているのかもしれない。","en":"Many restaurants in this city marketed themselves by imitating the atmosphere of one foreign country or another, but this place had no particular character. If anything, it might have resembled a British pub.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r200","rowIndex":200,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　薄暗い店内にはテーブル席とカウンターがあり、お酒とおつまみを提供している。お酒を飲まないで食事だけでもOKらしい。実際に店内に入るのは初めてだけれど、カレーなんかも美味しいという話だ。","en":"The dim interior held tables and a counter and served alcohol and bar snacks. Apparently it was fine to come just for a meal without drinking. This was our first time inside, but we had heard that the curry was good.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r201","rowIndex":201,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　店内に足を踏み入れた私たちを、カウンターでドリンクを作っている白いワイシャツ姿のひげもじゃの店員さんが見る。愛想のない人で、いらっしゃいとも何とも言わない。そして、私たちの素性にも気がつかなかったらしく、","en":"As we entered, a shaggy-bearded clerk in a white dress shirt looked up from mixing drinks behind the counter. He was an unfriendly man who offered neither welcome nor greeting. Nor did he appear to recognize us.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r202","rowIndex":202,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「カウンター席へどうぞ」","en":"“Please take a seat at the counter.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r203","rowIndex":203,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　とだけ素っ気なく声をかけた。","en":"That was all he said, and he said it flatly.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r204","rowIndex":204,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　今私たちは変装のつもりで屋敷にあった帽子と眼鏡をつけている。眼鏡は<tips=65>エフゲニ・イリイーチ・ヘス</tips>が使っているもので、きつい度が入っているからレンズを通すとぼやけて見えた。私たちはそれをずり下げて、レンズの上から店内を見回す。","en":"As our attempt at a disguise, we wore a hat and glasses found in the mansion. The glasses belonged to <tips=65>Yevgeny Ilyich Hess</tips>. Their powerful prescription made everything blur when we looked through the lenses, so we slid them down our nose and surveyed the room over their upper rims.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r205","rowIndex":205,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　店内は賑わっていて、男たちが酒を酌み交わし、談笑している。そのうちの半分くらいは目が金色に輝いている。症状はなさそうだ。ということは、多分<tips=46>ネオ・ローズ</tips>の使用者だろう。","en":"The place was lively, with men drinking together and chatting. Roughly half of them had eyes shining gold. They showed no symptoms. They were probably users of <tips=46>Neo Rose</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r206","rowIndex":206,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ここにいるのはほとんど<tips=21>八龍会</tips>の人間だろうし、その辺の誰かに話しかければいいのだろうけれど、誰に訊くのがいいんだろう。一番えらそうにしている人がいいのかな？","en":"Almost everyone here likely belonged to the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips>, and we could presumably question anyone nearby. But who should we ask? Perhaps whoever looked the most important?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r207","rowIndex":207,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　入り口の側で立ったまま物色していると、","en":"While we stood near the entrance, sizing up the people in the room—","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r208","rowIndex":208,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「お姉ちゃん」","en":"“Hey, sweetheart.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"フルカワショウジ","displayName":"Shoji Furukawa","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r209","rowIndex":209,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　無精髭を生やした男がアルコールで真っ赤にそまった顔にだらしない笑顔を浮かべて私たちに話しかけてくる。","en":"An unshaven man spoke to us, a loose grin spread across his drink-reddened face.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r210","rowIndex":210,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「誰か、人探しか？　まだ来てないんじゃないのか。それなら一緒に飲んで待とうじゃないか」","en":"“Looking for someone? Doesn’t seem like they’ve arrived yet. Why don’t you have a drink with me while you wait?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"フルカワショウジ","displayName":"Shoji Furukawa","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r211","rowIndex":211,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　酒臭い息を浴びせてくるのでうつむいて避けると、相手の胸に小さなバッジが光っているのが目に入った。","en":"He breathed alcohol fumes at us, so we ducked our head to avoid them and noticed a small badge gleaming on his chest.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r212","rowIndex":212,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あなた、<tips=47>解放軍</tips>の人？」","en":"“Are you with the <tips=47>Liberation Army</tips>?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r213","rowIndex":213,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「おお、そうとも。よくわかったな。今をときめく<tips=47>八龍解放軍</tips>のフルカワショウジと言えばおれのことだ」","en":"“I certainly am. Well spotted. When people speak of Shoji Furukawa of the celebrated <tips=47>Hachiryu Liberation Army</tips>, they mean me.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"フルカワショウジ","displayName":"Shoji Furukawa","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r214","rowIndex":214,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　自慢げに言うけれど、そんな名前は聞いたことがない。","en":"He said it proudly, but we had never heard the name.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r215","rowIndex":215,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「偉い人なの？」","en":"“Are you important?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r216","rowIndex":216,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「えらいとも。病院襲撃のときも、<tips=35>フェルナンデス</tips>をやったときも、大活躍したんだぜ。隊長の<tips=67>カミラ</tips>って知ってるだろ？　今でこそえらそうにしてるが、最初は臆病でひどいもんだった。病院襲撃のときにピシっと言ってやったのがおれさ」","en":"“Of course I am. I played a major part in the hospital attack and when we got <tips=35>Fernandes</tips>. You know our commander, <tips=67>Camilla</tips>, don’t you? She puts on airs now, but she was a terrible coward at first. I’m the one who set her straight during the hospital attack.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"フルカワショウジ","displayName":"Shoji Furukawa","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r217","rowIndex":217,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ふーん」","en":"“Uh-huh.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r218","rowIndex":218,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「信じてないのか？　じゃあ、おれがどんな風に活躍してたか詳しく話してやろう。丁度今も、向こうの席でみんなに話してやっていたところでな……」","en":"“You don’t believe me? Then I’ll tell you all about my exploits. I was just regaling everyone at that table over there with the story...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"フルカワショウジ","displayName":"Shoji Furukawa","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r219","rowIndex":219,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　フルカワショウジは私たちの肩に手を回す。","en":"Shoji Furukawa put an arm around our shoulder.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r220","rowIndex":220,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　倉庫には<tips=10>見土道夫</tips>もいた。つまり、私たちを襲ったのは<tips=47>八龍解放軍</tips>なのだろう。とすれば、酒臭いフルカワショウジも役に立つかもしれない。","en":"<tips=10>Michio Mido</tips> had been at the warehouse too. In other words, it was probably the <tips=47>Hachiryu Liberation Army</tips> that attacked us. If so, the alcohol-reeking Shoji Furukawa might prove useful.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r221","rowIndex":221,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「信じるよ。私たちも<tips=47>解放軍</tips>の人に会いたかったんだ」","en":"“We believe you. We wanted to meet someone from the <tips=47>Liberation Army</tips> ourselves.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r222","rowIndex":222,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうか。それなら話が早い。じゃあ、この店じゃなくて二人きりで少し話でもするか」","en":"“Then that makes things easy. Why don’t the two of us leave this place and talk in private?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"フルカワショウジ","displayName":"Shoji Furukawa","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r223","rowIndex":223,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　男はそう言って、店の奥の裏口を顎で示す。あそこから出ると確か狭い裏路地に抜けて、連れ込み宿が建ち並ぶ通りに出るんだ。","en":"As he spoke, the man indicated the rear exit with his chin. If memory served, it opened into a narrow back alley leading to a street lined with love hotels.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r224","rowIndex":224,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「わかったよ」","en":"“All right.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r225","rowIndex":225,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「とびっきりの面白い話があるんだ」","en":"“I’ve got one hell of a story for you.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"フルカワショウジ","displayName":"Shoji Furukawa","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r226","rowIndex":226,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それは楽しみだね」","en":"“Can’t wait.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r227","rowIndex":227,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして混雑する店内を通り抜け、裏口へ出ようとしたんだけれども、その途中で呼び止められた。","en":"We began threading our way through the crowded bar toward the back door, but someone stopped us before we reached it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r228","rowIndex":228,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あっ、お前は！」","en":"“Ah! You!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"清水（シミズ）","displayName":"Shimizu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r229","rowIndex":229,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　トイレから出て来た男が、私たちの顔を見て大きな声を出したのだ。","en":"A man coming out of the toilet saw our face and shouted.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r230","rowIndex":230,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「間違いない、あの時の！」","en":"“There’s no mistake! You’re the one from before!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"清水（シミズ）","displayName":"Shimizu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r231","rowIndex":231,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　あの時とはどの時だろう？","en":"Which time did he mean?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r232","rowIndex":232,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　きょとんとしてその顔を見上げると、そうだ、この人はあの時倉庫にいたやつじゃないか。","en":"We looked up at his face in blank confusion. Then we remembered. This man had been in the warehouse.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r233","rowIndex":233,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　確か名前をシミズと言ったはずだ。","en":"His name had been Shimizu, if memory served.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r234","rowIndex":234,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=46>ネオ・ローズ</tips>の管理をする<tips=21>八龍会</tips>側の人間で、<tips=65>エフゲニ・イリイーチ・ヘス</tips>のビジネスパートナーだ。","en":"He represented the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips> in managing <tips=46>Neo Rose</tips> and was <tips=65>Yevgeny Ilyich Hess’s</tips> business partner.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r235","rowIndex":235,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「おい、そんなやつ放っておいていこうぜ」","en":"“Hey, forget that bastard. Let’s go.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"フルカワショウジ","displayName":"Shoji Furukawa","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r236","rowIndex":236,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　フルカワショウジが肩に手を置くのを私たちは振り払ってシミズに向き直る。","en":"We brushed Shoji Furukawa’s hand from our shoulder and turned to face Shimizu.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r237","rowIndex":237,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あんた、私たちをはめたね」","en":"“You set us up.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r238","rowIndex":238,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「おい、どうやって生き返ったんだ？　確かに胸を撃たれて死んだはずだ。おれは、ちゃんと心臓が止まってるのを確認したんだぞ？」","en":"“How the hell did you come back to life? You were shot in the chest. You were dead—I checked that your heart had stopped myself!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"清水（シミズ）","displayName":"Shimizu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r239","rowIndex":239,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　シミズは顔を真っ青にして金切り声をあげる。","en":"Shimizu’s face went white as he shrieked the words.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r240","rowIndex":240,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「おい、どういうことだよ？　知り合いなのか？」","en":"“Hey, what’s this about? You know each other?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"フルカワショウジ","displayName":"Shoji Furukawa","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r241","rowIndex":241,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　フルカワショウジは怪訝な顔で言う。","en":"Shoji Furukawa spoke with a puzzled expression.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r242","rowIndex":242,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ごめん、あなたとの話は後にする。先にこの人に話を聞く」","en":"“Sorry. I’ll talk to you later. First, we’re going to question this man.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r243","rowIndex":243,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あぁっ？」","en":"“Huh?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"フルカワショウジ","displayName":"Shoji Furukawa","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r244","rowIndex":244,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　フルカワショウジは顔を思い切り歪めて大声を張り上げ、私に向かってすごんでみせる。","en":"Shoji Furukawa contorted his face, bellowed, and tried to intimidate me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r245","rowIndex":245,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　子供のときから不思議なんだけど、この手の人たちはどうしてこんなに即座に怒ることが出来るんだろう？　この、ちょっといやなことがあっただけで即座に沸騰して目一杯威圧的な行動をとる、という技術はみなどこで学ぶんだろうか。威圧の仕方も大体同じような感じだもの。そういう学校があるのかな？","en":"We had wondered about people like him since childhood. How could they become angry so instantly? Where did they all learn the trick of boiling over at the slightest displeasure and immediately behaving with the maximum possible menace? Even their methods of intimidation were broadly alike. Was there a school that taught it?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r246","rowIndex":246,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「うるさいなあ」","en":"“You’re so loud.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r247","rowIndex":247,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちはフルカワショウジに言って、その胸を透明人間の手でどんと突き飛ばす。","en":"We said it to Shoji Furukawa, then shoved him sharply in the chest with the invisible person’s hand.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r248","rowIndex":248,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「えっ、えっ……」","en":"“What? What...?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"フルカワショウジ","displayName":"Shoji Furukawa","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r249","rowIndex":249,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　フルカワショウジは数歩うしろによろけながら目を丸くしている。何が自分を押したのか、彼にわかるはずもない。","en":"Shoji Furukawa staggered several steps backward, his eyes wide. There was no way he could know what had pushed him.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r250","rowIndex":250,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「シミズ、あなたは<tips=10>見土道夫</tips>と組んで、<tips=65>エフゲニ・イリイーチ・ヘス</tips>と私たちのもう片方を穴だらけにしたんだ」","en":"“Shimizu, you joined forces with <tips=10>Michio Mido</tips> and shot <tips=65>Yevgeny Ilyich Hess</tips> and the other half of us full of holes.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r251","rowIndex":251,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そんなに怒ってはいないつもりだったけれど、こうして実行犯の一人を目の当たりにすると腹が立った。","en":"We had not thought we were especially angry. But now that we stood face-to-face with one of the people who had done it, we found ourselves getting angry after all.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r252","rowIndex":252,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「知ってることを全部話してもらうからね」","en":"“You are going to tell us everything you know.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r253","rowIndex":253,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「くっ！」","en":"“Damn it!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"清水（シミズ）","displayName":"Shimizu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r254","rowIndex":254,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　シミズは懐に手を入れると、拳銃を取り出す。","en":"Shimizu reached into his coat and drew a handgun.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r255","rowIndex":255,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"『<tips=46>ネオ・ローズ</tips>』で発症をコントロールされている彼はノーマルよりは動きが速いが、私たちからすればそれほどではない。","en":"With his symptoms controlled by <tips=46>Neo Rose</tips>, he moved faster than a Normal, but not especially fast from our perspective.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r256","rowIndex":256,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちは力を使って、その銃を抜いた右手を外側にねじる。","en":"Using our power, we wrenched his gun hand outward.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r257","rowIndex":257,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ぐあっ」","en":"“Gah!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"清水（シミズ）","displayName":"Shimizu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r258","rowIndex":258,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　思わず唸るのはシミズ。","en":"Shimizu groaned despite himself.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r259","rowIndex":259,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　銃口をそらすだけのつもりが、力が入りすぎて、彼の肘と手首から乾いた音が鳴った。","en":"We had intended only to turn the muzzle aside, but we used too much force, and dry cracks came from his elbow and wrist.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r260","rowIndex":260,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「うっ、あああっ……」","en":"“Ngh—aaagh...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r261","rowIndex":261,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その手から銃が落ちるのを、私たちは空中でキャッチする。","en":"The gun fell from his hand, and we caught it in midair.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r262","rowIndex":262,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　シミズが落としたのはリボルバー式のかっこいい拳銃だ。この街の人は弾を沢山撃ちたがるからオートマチックの拳銃ばっかり使うけど、私たちは昔から映画とかでよく見るこっちの方が断然好きだ。","en":"What Shimizu had dropped was a cool revolver. People in this city liked to fire a great many rounds and therefore used automatic pistols almost exclusively. We had always preferred revolvers by far, having so often seen them in films.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r263","rowIndex":263,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「おいっ！　何をしている！　お前は何者だッ！」","en":"“Hey! What are you doing? Who the hell are you?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"フルカワショウジ","displayName":"Shoji Furukawa","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r264","rowIndex":264,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　フルカワショウジがそう怒鳴る。","en":"Shoji Furukawa shouted the question.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r265","rowIndex":265,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それで気がついたのだけれど、店内にたくさんいるお客さんたちはみな私たちとシミズに注目している。みんながいっぺんに黙ってしまったから、店内に流れるどこかで聞いたことのある古い曲がよく聞こえる。","en":"Only then did we notice that the many customers in the bar were watching Shimizu and us. They had all fallen silent at once, making the familiar old song playing inside remarkably clear.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r266","rowIndex":266,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「私たちは灰上」","en":"“We are Haigami.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r267","rowIndex":267,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　自分を見つめるいくつもの目を見渡しながら私たちは言った。","en":"We spoke while surveying the many eyes fixed upon us.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r268","rowIndex":268,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あなたたちが利用して裏切った<tips=65>エフゲニ・イリイーチ・ヘス</tips>の友だちだよ」","en":"“We are friends of <tips=65>Yevgeny Ilyich Hess</tips>, whom you used and then betrayed.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r269","rowIndex":269,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=65>ヘス</tips>……」","en":"“<tips=65>Hess</tips>...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r270","rowIndex":270,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=65>ヘス</tips>だと……」","en":"“Did she say <tips=65>Hess</tips>...?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r271","rowIndex":271,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちの言葉で、お客さんたちの何人かがざわつきはじめる。","en":"Our words set several of the patrons murmuring.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r272","rowIndex":272,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あなたたちに、私たちのもう一人は殺された。でもそれはどうでもいい。あの臭いお爺ちゃんの話をきかせて。知りたいことを全部教えてくれたら何もしないわ」","en":"“You killed the other one of us. But that does not matter. Tell us about that stinky old man. If you tell us everything we wish to know, we will do nothing to you.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r273","rowIndex":273,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「何もしないだってさ」","en":"“She says she won’t do anything.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r274","rowIndex":274,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「へ、多少超能力が使えるのかもしれないが、ずいぶんと大きく出たもんだ」","en":"“Heh. Maybe you can use a little psychic power, but that’s some mighty big talk.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r275","rowIndex":275,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　人混みのなかから笑い声が漏れる。","en":"Laughter rose from the crowd.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r276","rowIndex":276,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「もし私たちの邪魔をするのなら、その時は……」","en":"“If you interfere with us, then...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r277","rowIndex":277,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　言いかけたとき、右手の人混みから誰かが飛び出してくる。","en":"Before we could finish, someone sprang from the crowd to our right.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r278","rowIndex":278,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　金色の目を光らせて手を伸ばしたその人が狙ったのは、私たちが握っている拳銃だ。身体能力には自信があるらしく、思ったより速く彼の手が動き、拳銃を掴まれてしまう。","en":"The golden-eyed man reached for the handgun in our grasp. Evidently confident in his physical abilities, he moved faster than expected and caught hold of it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r279","rowIndex":279,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　腕力は私たちより強い。銃口は彼の力で無理矢理天井を向けさせられる。ここで引き金を引いてももう誰にも当たらない。","en":"He was physically stronger than we were. By sheer force, he turned the muzzle toward the ceiling. Even if we pulled the trigger now, we could hit no one.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r280","rowIndex":280,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「へっ」","en":"“Heh.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r281","rowIndex":281,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　男は勝ち誇った表情を浮かべる。その頭を、私たちは捻った。","en":"The man looked triumphant. We twisted his head around.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r282","rowIndex":282,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　バキッとひときわ大きな音を立ててその人の首はほとんど真後ろを向く。","en":"With an exceptionally loud crack, his head turned almost completely backward.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r283","rowIndex":283,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして糸が切れた人形のように全身から力が抜けて、彼は床の上に倒れた。","en":"All strength left his body like a puppet whose strings had been cut, and he collapsed upon the floor.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r284","rowIndex":284,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「これを……」","en":"“Look at—”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r285","rowIndex":285,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちが言おうとしたとき、今度は左手のほうの暗闇で一瞬何か光り、パンと音がした。誰かが拳銃を撃ったのだ。","en":"As we began to speak, something flashed for an instant in the darkness to our left. A sharp report followed. Someone had fired a handgun.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r286","rowIndex":286,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちの右胸に穴が空き、喉の奥から血が這い上ってくる。","en":"A hole opened in the right side of our chest, and blood crept up the back of our throat.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r287","rowIndex":287,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　目をこらすと、銃を握って怯えた目でこちらを見ている男の顔が見えたので、その首も捻った。","en":"Peering into the darkness, we made out the face of a man clutching a gun and staring at us with frightened eyes, so we twisted his neck too.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r288","rowIndex":288,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼の首もゴキッと骨の砕ける音を鳴らして、その場に倒れる。","en":"His neck gave a crunch of breaking bone, and he collapsed on the spot.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r289","rowIndex":289,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちは喉からせり上がって来た血をそのままべしゃっと床の上に吐いてから言った。","en":"We spat the blood rising through our throat onto the floor with a wet splatter, then spoke.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r290","rowIndex":290,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「これを見ろっ！　死んだ人たちを！　もう生き返らないんだぞ！　二度とお酒を飲めないし、笑うこともない。永久にだ！　私たちにこれ以上人殺しをさせるな！　私たちは話を聞きたいだけなんだ……」","en":"“Look at this! Look at the people who died! They will never live again! They will never drink or laugh again. Never! Do not make us kill anyone else! We only want to ask you questions...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r291","rowIndex":291,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　言っているうちにまた血がのぼってきたので、それも吐いた。","en":"As we spoke, more blood climbed our throat, and we spat that out as well.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r292","rowIndex":292,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それで私たちを見ているものたちの空気が変わったような気がする。みんな私たちに対して怯えている。多分、みんながみんな好戦的な性格ってわけでもないんだろう。普通の人もたくさんいるのかもしれない。","en":"The atmosphere among the people watching us seemed to change. They were all afraid of us. Perhaps they were not all combative by nature. There might have been many ordinary people among them.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r293","rowIndex":293,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　フルカワショウジも顔を真っ青にして、壁に背をこすりつけるようにして立っている。さっきはもう少し近くにいたのに。怖くて後ろに下がっちゃったのかな。","en":"Shoji Furukawa had gone deathly pale and stood with his back pressed hard against the wall. He had been closer a moment ago. Had fear made him retreat?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r294","rowIndex":294,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　シミズも折れた腕を押さえ、顔にもの凄い量の脂汗を流し、唇を震わせ、私たちを見ている。","en":"Shimizu clutched his broken arm. Clammy sweat poured down his face, and his lips trembled as he stared at us.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r295","rowIndex":295,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　人に怯えた目で見られるのは、子供の時から慣れている。","en":"People had looked upon us with frightened eyes ever since we were children. We were accustomed to it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r296","rowIndex":296,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちはちょっとほっとした。","en":"That was a little reassuring.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r297","rowIndex":297,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　いくら撃たれて死なないと言っても、痛いことは痛いし、頭でも撃たれれば多分倒れて意識を失って復活まで時間がかかるだろうし、いいことなんかないので、諦めてくれるならそれはそれで嬉しい。","en":"Even if a bullet could not kill us, it still hurt. A shot to the head would probably knock us down and render us unconscious, and it would take time for us to revive. None of that would do us any good, so we were glad enough if they meant to give up.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r298","rowIndex":298,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それに、人を殺すのは好きじゃないんだ。こんなのを喜んでやる<tips=64>アレクセイ</tips>はどうかしている。死体なんか、どう考えたって生きている人間よりつまらないのに。","en":"Besides, we did not like killing people. There was something wrong with <tips=64>Alexei</tips> for doing this with pleasure. However one looked at it, a corpse was far less interesting than a living person.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r299","rowIndex":299,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「じゃあ質問をさせてもらうよ。本当に、私たちは質問するだけなんだからね。それだけのことをさせてくれれば最初から暴力なんかふるわなかったし、誰も死ななかったのに、まったく馬鹿みたい」","en":"“Now let us ask our questions. We really are only going to ask questions. If you had just let us do that in the first place, we would never have used violence, and no one would have died. It’s all so stupid.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r300","rowIndex":300,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちはそして、激痛で震えているシミズを見た。それだけで、彼は怯えてびくっとする。","en":"Then we looked at Shimizu, who was trembling with intense pain. That alone made him flinch in terror.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r301","rowIndex":301,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まずシミズさん。あの日のことを教えて。あなたたちは最初から私たちを罠にハメるつもりだったの？」","en":"“First, Mr. Shimizu. Tell us what happened that day. Had you been planning to trap us from the start?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r302","rowIndex":302,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　シミズは首をガクガクと痙攣させるように頷く。","en":"Shimizu nodded so violently that his head seemed to convulse.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r303","rowIndex":303,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あ、あの<tips=65>ヘス</tips>だけをやるつもりだったんだ。あんたたちがついて来るとは知らなかったから、予定とは違ったが……」","en":"“W-we only meant to get <tips=65>Hess</tips>. We didn’t know you were coming with him, so that part wasn’t in the plan...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"清水（シミズ）","displayName":"Shimizu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r304","rowIndex":304,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「主謀者は<tips=10>見土道夫</tips>？」","en":"“Was <tips=10>Michio Mido</tips> the ringleader?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r305","rowIndex":305,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「誰かはわからないが、<tips=47>解放軍</tips>の幹部で相談して決めたらしい」","en":"“I don’t know who started it, but apparently the officers of the <tips=47>Liberation Army</tips> discussed it and made the decision.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"清水（シミズ）","displayName":"Shimizu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r306","rowIndex":306,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「幹部って、具体的に誰？」","en":"“Which officers, specifically?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r307","rowIndex":307,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=10>見土</tips>さん、<tips=67>ノーサム</tips>さん、<tips=66>田中</tips>さんの三人だと思う。その場におれがいたわけじゃないからわからないが……」","en":"“I think it was Mr. <tips=10>Mido</tips>, Ms. <tips=67>Northam</tips>, and Mr. <tips=66>Tanaka</tips>. I wasn’t there myself, so I don’t know for sure...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"清水（シミズ）","displayName":"Shimizu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r308","rowIndex":308,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なんで<tips=65>エフゲニ・イリイーチ・ヘス</tips>を裏切ったの？　まだ協力してた方がいいんじゃないかと思うんだけど？」","en":"“Why did you betray <tips=65>Yevgeny Ilyich Hess</tips>? Wouldn’t it have been better to keep working with him?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r309","rowIndex":309,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なんでも、<tips=65>ヘス</tips>には変身能力やら、恐ろしいサイキック能力があるから危険だって……」","en":"“They said <tips=65>Hess</tips> was dangerous—that he had the power to transform and some terrifying psychic ability...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"清水（シミズ）","displayName":"Shimizu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r310","rowIndex":310,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なるほど、その辺りのことを全部知ってたわけだね」","en":"“I see. So you knew all about those things.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r311","rowIndex":311,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　だとすれば話はわかりやすい。","en":"If that was true, then it all made sense.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r312","rowIndex":312,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　サイキックが必要以上に恐れられ、信用されないというのはよくあることだ。","en":"Psychics were often feared beyond reason and distrusted.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r313","rowIndex":313,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それにしても、<tips=65>エフゲニ・イリイーチ・ヘス</tips>は自分の能力は<tips=21>八龍会</tips>には知られていないとうそぶいていたけれど、やっぱりバレてたんじゃないか。偉そうなことばかり言っているけれど、本当に駄目なお爺ちゃんだ。ボケてるのか、それとも発症しちゃってるんじゃないの？","en":"Still, <tips=65>Yevgeny Ilyich Hess</tips> had boasted that the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips> knew nothing of his power, but they had found him out after all. He did nothing but talk big, but he truly was a hopeless old man. Was he senile, or had his symptoms manifested?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r314","rowIndex":314,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「でもやっぱり、<tips=10>見土道夫</tips>が決めたんだろうね。たぶん。今度会った時、ちゃんとあいつにも仕返しをしないと……」","en":"“Still, I suppose <tips=10>Michio Mido</tips> was the one who decided it. Probably. The next time we see him, we’ll have to pay him back properly too...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r315","rowIndex":315,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あんた、知らないのか？」","en":"“You don’t know?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r316","rowIndex":316,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　横合いからお爺ちゃんがそう言葉を挟んだ。","en":"An old man interjected from beside us.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r317","rowIndex":317,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=10>道夫</tips>君にはもう会うことは出来んぞ」","en":"“You won’t be able to see <tips=10>Michio</tips> again.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r318","rowIndex":318,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=47>八龍解放軍</tips>の隊長がどれだけ偉いのか知らないけど、会いたくないと言ったって、こっちから勝手に会いに行くよ」","en":"“I don’t care how important the commander of the <tips=47>Hachiryu Liberation Army</tips> is. Even if he says he won’t see us, we’ll just go to him ourselves.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r319","rowIndex":319,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうじゃない。彼は死んだんだ」","en":"“That isn’t what I mean. He’s dead.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r320","rowIndex":320,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「えっ」","en":"“What?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r321","rowIndex":321,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「大騒ぎになったのに、知らなかったのかい？」","en":"“It caused an enormous commotion. You didn’t know?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r322","rowIndex":322,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……順を追って話してちょうだい。嘘を言ったらあとでひどいよ」","en":"“...Tell us what happened, in order. If you lie, it’ll be awful for you later.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r323","rowIndex":323,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちはそう言って睨み付けると、お爺ちゃんはしわがれた声で訥々と説明してくれた。","en":"We glared at him as we spoke. In a hoarse voice, the old man haltingly explained.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r324","rowIndex":324,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なんだか、全てが変わっちゃったんだね……」","en":"“Everything’s changed somehow...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r325","rowIndex":325,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちが身体を治すために洋館に閉じこもっている間、<tips=21>八龍会</tips>を取り巻く状況は随分と変化していた。","en":"While we secluded ourselves in the mansion to heal, the situation surrounding the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips> had changed enormously.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r326","rowIndex":326,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　まず、私たちがあの倉庫に行った日に、<tips=10>見土道夫</tips>がクーデターを起こしてあの有名な三人のお爺ちゃんたちを追い出していたことさえ知らなかった。","en":"To begin with, we had not even known that on the day we went to the warehouse, <tips=10>Michio Mido</tips> had staged a coup and driven out those three famous old men.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r327","rowIndex":327,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その足で<tips=10>見土道夫</tips>は私たちと戦ってお爺ちゃんたちの次に邪魔な<tips=65>エフゲニ・イリイーチ・ヘス</tips>を倒し、そして自分が名実ともに<tips=21>八龍会</tips>のリーダーになった。","en":"Without pausing, <tips=10>Michio Mido</tips> had then fought us and defeated <tips=65>Yevgeny Ilyich Hess</tips>, the next greatest obstacle after the old men. He had become the leader of the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips> in both name and fact.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r328","rowIndex":328,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しかしそれもつかの間、ボスとなった<tips=10>見土道夫</tips>のお披露目会で、殺されてしまったんだという。やったのは一人の女の子で、花束に銃を隠して撃ったとのことだ。","en":"But that too was short-lived. Apparently, <tips=10>Michio Mido</tips> was killed at the reception where he was being introduced as the new boss. His killer was a girl who had hidden a gun in a bouquet and shot him.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r329","rowIndex":329,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「その女の子って何者？」","en":"“Who was that girl?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r330","rowIndex":330,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=10>道夫</tips>君たちが解放した病院の入院患者だったらしい。でも、どうしてそんなことをしたのかはわからない。まだ捕まっていないんだ」","en":"“Apparently she was a patient at the hospital <tips=10>Michio</tips> and the others liberated. But no one knows why she did such a thing. They still have not caught her.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r331","rowIndex":331,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……そう、そうなんだ。<tips=10>見土道夫</tips>が死んだんだ」","en":"“...I see. I see. <tips=10>Michio Mido</tips> is dead.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r332","rowIndex":332,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　あの<tips=10>見土道夫</tips>が死んだ。<tips=10>見土道夫</tips>が死んだんだ。","en":"<tips=10>Michio Mido</tips> himself was dead. <tips=10>Michio Mido</tips> had died.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r333","rowIndex":333,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あっははは！　ばっかじゃないの？　余計なお世話をしてやった相手に殺されたって？　子供の時からいっつも、街のためとか、みんなのためとかくっさいこと言ってたのに、同じ<tips=17>タイプB</tips>に殺されたって？　あっはははは！」","en":"“Ah-ha-ha-ha! What an idiot! He went out of his way to help someone who never asked, and she killed him for it? Ever since we were children, he was always spouting that corny garbage about doing it for the city, doing it for everyone—and another <tips=17>Type B</tips> killed him? Ah-ha-ha-ha-ha!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r334","rowIndex":334,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちはなんだか笑いが止まらなかった。","en":"For some reason, we could not stop laughing.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r335","rowIndex":335,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　笑いすぎて目からにじんだ涙を拭い、","en":"We wiped away the tears that had gathered in our eyes from laughing too hard.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r336","rowIndex":336,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「じゃあ、<tips=10>見土道夫</tips>が死んで<tips=47>解放軍</tips>はだれが隊長になったの？」","en":"“Then who became commander of the <tips=47>Liberation Army</tips> after <tips=10>Michio Mido</tips> died?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r337","rowIndex":337,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「カ、<tips=67>カミラ</tips>って子が、隊長になったようだよ」","en":"“A-a girl named <tips=67>Camilla</tips> seems to have become commander.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r338","rowIndex":338,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　お爺ちゃんは私たちの態度に動揺しながら答える。","en":"The old man answered, visibly unsettled by our manner.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r339","rowIndex":339,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そう。じゃあ今は<tips=67>カミラ・ノーサム</tips>が<tips=21>八龍会</tips>のリーダーってわけね。……それじゃあ、最後の質問をするよ」","en":"“I see. So <tips=67>Camilla Northam</tips> is now the leader of the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips>. ...In that case, we’ll ask our final question.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r340","rowIndex":340,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　またシミズの方を見ると彼はまたビクッと身体を震わせる。どれだけ恐れているんだろう？","en":"When we looked at Shimizu again, his whole body gave another frightened jerk. Just how afraid of us was he?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r341","rowIndex":341,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=65>エフゲニ・イリイーチ・ヘス</tips>はどこ？　死んだなんて言わないでね。あいつは死なないってわかってるんだから。どこかにいるんでしょう？」","en":"“Where is <tips=65>Yevgeny Ilyich Hess</tips>? Don’t tell us he died. We know he can’t die. He’s somewhere, isn’t he?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r342","rowIndex":342,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そ、それは知らないっ」","en":"“I-I don’t know!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"清水（シミズ）","displayName":"Shimizu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r343","rowIndex":343,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　シミズは首をぶんぶんと左右に振る。","en":"Shimizu shook his head violently from side to side.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r344","rowIndex":344,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「隠したり、嘘をつこうもんなら……」","en":"“If you’re hiding anything, or if you try to lie...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r345","rowIndex":345,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ほっ、本当にしらないんだっ！」","en":"“I-I truly don’t know!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"清水（シミズ）","displayName":"Shimizu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r346","rowIndex":346,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　シミズは金切り声をあげて両手で頭を抱え込む。","en":"Shimizu shrieked and clutched his head in both hands.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r347","rowIndex":347,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　どうも嘘をついている様子じゃない。","en":"He did not appear to be lying.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r348","rowIndex":348,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「誰か！　このなかに知ってる人はいないの？　ここが一番知りたかったことなんだよ？　もし誰も知らないって言うなら、ここに来た意味がないんだから。本当に誰も知らないのなら……ああもうっ！　うるさいなあ！」","en":"“Someone! Doesn’t anyone here know? This is what we wanted to know most. If no one knows, there was no point in coming here. If no one really knows... Oh, shut up already!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r349","rowIndex":349,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　また虫の羽音の耳鳴りがしてきたので、私たちは音の方向を怒鳴りつけてから、","en":"The insect-wing tinnitus returned. We yelled toward the sound, then continued:","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r350","rowIndex":350,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「とにかく、何も知らないのなら、みんなは何の役にも立たないってことでしょ？　私たちは一人殺されてるってことは、みんなと敵同士なんだよね？　役に立たない敵なんか、ここで一人残らず……」","en":"“Anyway, if none of you knows anything, that means none of you is useful, right? You killed one of us, so that makes all of you our enemies, doesn’t it? And useless enemies can be dealt with right here, every last one of you...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r351","rowIndex":351,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「しっ、知ってる！」","en":"“I-I know!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r352","rowIndex":352,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　声をあげたのは列の後ろの方にいた、まだ十代くらいの男の子だった。","en":"The voice belonged to a boy still in his teens who stood near the back of the group.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r353","rowIndex":353,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「東陽町の工場だよ！　あそこに地下室があるから、そこに閉じ込めるって……」","en":"“The Toyocho factory! It has a basement. They said they were going to lock him up there...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r354","rowIndex":354,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちはその発言をした男の子をじっと見つめる。","en":"We stared fixedly at the boy who had spoken.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r355","rowIndex":355,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼は汗だくになって唇を震わせていた。","en":"Sweat drenched him, and his lips were trembling.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r356","rowIndex":356,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ほっ、本当だよ！　おれは<tips=58>パラシュート通り</tips>のチャーリーだ。もし嘘だったら、おれの家に来て殺してくれたってかまわない。だから、ここにいる人をこれ以上殺さないでっ」","en":"“I-it’s true! I’m Charlie from <tips=58>Parachute Street</tips>. If I’m lying, you can come to my house and kill me. So please don’t kill anyone else here!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r357","rowIndex":357,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　チャーリーと名乗った少年は言うだけ言うと、肩をふるわせて荒い呼吸をしている。","en":"Having blurted out everything he had to say, the boy who called himself Charlie stood with his shoulders shaking and his breath coming hard.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r358","rowIndex":358,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そう」","en":"“All right.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r359","rowIndex":359,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちは彼をじっと見つめながら言った。","en":"We spoke while continuing to stare at him.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r360","rowIndex":360,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「信じるよ。チャーリー」","en":"“We believe you, Charlie.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r361","rowIndex":361,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　この言葉で、チャーリーは腰が抜けたのか近くの机にもたれかかる。","en":"At those words, Charlie’s legs appeared to give way, and he leaned heavily against a nearby table.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r362","rowIndex":362,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「じゃあ私たちの用件は終わり。思ったより被害が少なくてよかった。それじゃあこれで……あ、フルカワショウジ」","en":"“That takes care of what we came for. I’m glad there was less damage than we expected. We’ll be going, then... Oh, Shoji Furukawa.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r363","rowIndex":363,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちはすっかり大人しくなってしまったそのひげ面の男の名前を呼ぶ。","en":"We called the name of the bearded man, who had become completely docile.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r364","rowIndex":364,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「さっき言ってた、とびっきりの面白い話ってなに？」","en":"“What was that particularly entertaining story you mentioned?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r365","rowIndex":365,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「も、もういいよ」","en":"“N-never mind.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"フルカワショウジ","displayName":"Shoji Furukawa","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r366","rowIndex":366,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　フルカワショウジは慌てて首を横に振る。","en":"Shoji Furukawa hurriedly shook his head.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r367","rowIndex":367,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そう。じゃあね。みんなさよなら」","en":"“Okay. See you. Goodbye, everyone.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r368","rowIndex":368,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして私たちはそのまま裏口から店を出た。","en":"And with that, we walked out of the bar through the back door.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r369","rowIndex":369,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"『東陽町の工場』の場所は私たちも知っている。","en":"We knew where the place called ‘the Toyocho factory’ was.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r370","rowIndex":370,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=65>エフゲニ・イリイーチ・ヘス</tips>は<tips=46>ネオ・ローズ</tips>の管理には本当に神経質で、しょっちゅうそのことばかり話していた。そこは普通の民家を改造した場所で、四台の製剤機を稼働させパッケージまで行っているそうだ。","en":"<tips=65>Yevgeny Ilyich Hess</tips> had been extremely particular about the management of <tips=46>Neo Rose</tips> and talked about it constantly. Apparently, the facility was an ordinary house that had been converted to run four drug-manufacturing machines and handle everything through packaging on-site.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r371","rowIndex":371,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　地下があるとは知らなかったけれど、きっとあるんだろう。あそこは<tips=21>八龍会</tips>の本部からもそう遠くないし、周りも<tips=17>タイプB</tips>の<tips=21>八龍会</tips>のメンバーばかりだからあのお爺ちゃんを閉じ込めるには丁度良いのかもしれない。","en":"We had not known there was a basement, but evidently there was. The place stood fairly close to the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips> headquarters and was surrounded by <tips=17>Type B</tips> members of the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips>. Perhaps it was ideally situated for imprisoning the old man.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r372","rowIndex":372,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　うまく<tips=62>マリア</tips>の力を使えば自力でも脱出は簡単だろうけど、そうでないならば、きっと、<tips=46>ネオ・ローズ</tips>のレシピを聞き出すためにひどい拷問を受けてるんだろうな。あいつはいくら拷問されても死ぬことがないから、さぞかし苦しいだろう。","en":"If he used <tips=62>Maria’s</tips> power effectively, he could probably escape on his own. If not, he was surely being subjected to terrible torture to extract the <tips=46>Neo Rose</tips> formula. Nothing they did could kill him, so he must be suffering greatly.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r373","rowIndex":373,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　あの偉そうなお爺ちゃんが苦しんでいるところを想像すると、可哀想な気もするけれど、ざまあみろという気もする。きらいってわけじゃないけれど。","en":"Imagining that arrogant old man in pain made us feel a little sorry for him and a little pleased that he had gotten what he deserved. It was not as though we hated him.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r374","rowIndex":374,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　バーの人たちは、私たちが去った後に<tips=21>八龍会</tips>に連絡したろうか？　だとすれば、<tips=47>解放軍</tips>の人たちが待ち構えているんだろうな。","en":"Would the people in the bar have contacted the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips> after we left? If so, members of the <tips=47>Liberation Army</tips> would presumably be waiting for us.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r375","rowIndex":375,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=10>見土道夫</tips>がいなくなって、私たちと対抗出来る人はいるのかな？","en":"With <tips=10>Michio Mido</tips> gone, was there anyone left who could stand against us?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r376","rowIndex":376,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それにしても、結局一生一度も<tips=10>見土道夫</tips>に勝てないまま死なれてしまった。子供の頃はよく喧嘩をして負けて泣かされて「お前らなんか一生おれに勝てないんだからやめとけ」とよく馬鹿にされたけれど、その通りになってしまった。今ならきっと私たちが勝つのに。","en":"And after all that, <tips=10>Michio Mido</tips> had died without letting us beat him once in our whole lives. When we were children, we fought him all the time. He would beat us until we cried and jeer, “You two will never beat me as long as you live, so give it up.” And that was exactly how it turned out. We would win now. We were sure of it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r377","rowIndex":377,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　まったく、随分つまらない死に方をしたものだ。いや、人間なんかそんなものなんだろう。もしあの不死の血がなければ、私たちは両方ともあそこで命を落としていたんだ。","en":"What a boring way to die. Though perhaps that was simply how it was for human beings. Without that immortal blood, both of us would have died there too.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r378","rowIndex":378,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ああ、いつもならこんなとき二人で何か感想を言い合えるのに、今は心の中で延々と呟くことしか出来ないんだな。私たちのもう一方はどこへ行ったのか。本当に消えてなくなったのか？　それまで存在していたものが、消えてなくなるなんてありえるんだろうか。みんな近くにいるような気がするよ。私たちのもう片方も、お兄ちゃんも、お父さんも、お母さんも。","en":"Ah, at a time like this, the two of us would ordinarily have traded our thoughts. Now we could do nothing but murmur on and on inside our mind. Where had the other one of us gone? Had she truly vanished? Could something that had existed simply disappear? It felt as though everyone were nearby: the other half of us, our brother, our father, and our mother.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r379","rowIndex":379,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それにしても、羽音がうるさい。人のブツブツがうるさい。あんまり寂しいから、このブツブツと会話をしようか？","en":"Still, the wingbeats were loud. The muttering voices were loud. We were so lonely—maybe we should try talking to them.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r380","rowIndex":380,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして私たちはその工場の近くまでやって来た。","en":"We arrived near the factory.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r381","rowIndex":381,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　工場とはいっても、知らなければどうってことのないごくありふれた民家である。辺りはもうすっかり真っ暗だけれど、その窓には明かりが灯っていた。","en":"Despite the name, it was an utterly ordinary house that no one would have found remarkable without knowing its purpose. The neighborhood was now completely dark, but light shone from its windows.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r382","rowIndex":382,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　まだ作業中なのか、それとも、連絡を受けて私たちを待ち受けているのか。","en":"Were they still working, or had someone warned them and they were waiting for us?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r383","rowIndex":383,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちは近くの建物の塀から屋根へと飛び移り、上から侵入することにした。","en":"We leaped from the wall of a nearby building to its roof and decided to enter from above.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r384","rowIndex":384,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　明かりが灯っているのは一階だけで、二階は暗い。敷地内には人影がない。窓にはレースのカーテンが掛かっているけれど、内側に明かりがあるから、ある程度は見える。――何かが動いている様子はないな。強化された私たちの聴覚にも物音は聞き取れない。","en":"Only the first floor was lit; the second was dark. There was no one visible anywhere on the grounds. Lace curtains hung at the windows, but since the lights were on inside, we could see to some extent. Nothing seemed to be moving. Even our enhanced hearing detected no sound.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r385","rowIndex":385,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=65>エフゲニ・イリイーチ・ヘス</tips>の話によれば、たしかここは庭には侵入を防ぐセキュリティシステムが張り巡らされているはずだ。","en":"According to <tips=65>Yevgeny Ilyich Hess</tips>, the grounds ought to be protected by a security system intended to prevent intrusion.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r386","rowIndex":386,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちはそれを避けるため、塀を蹴って工場の屋根に飛び移る。そして屋根を伝ってぐるりと窓のなかを確認しながら移動するけれど、やはり人影は見えない。","en":"To avoid it, we kicked off the wall and leaped onto the factory roof. We followed the roof around the house, examining each window, but still found no trace of anyone.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r387","rowIndex":387,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　柵を乗り越えベランダに入ると正面にガラス戸がある。","en":"We climbed over the railing onto the balcony, where a glass door stood directly in front of us.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r388","rowIndex":388,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　子供の時、よくこういうガラス戸を破って中に入った。サムターンの近くのガラスを割って鍵を開けるといいんだ。サッシとガラスの隙間にドライバーを差し込むと、音もなくガラスにひびが入る。それを何回か繰り返すと静かにガラスが割れる。そしたら手を突っ込んでサムターンを回せばいい。<tips=66>田中紺太</tips>がやたらと上手だった。そして<tips=10>見土道夫</tips>は右手の力を使って一番静かに開けることが出来た。","en":"As children, we had often broken through glass doors like this to get inside. You only had to break the glass near the thumbturn and unlock the door. Inserting a screwdriver between the sash and the glass made the glass crack without a sound. Repeating the process several times let you break it quietly. Then you could reach through and turn the thumbturn. <tips=66>Konta Tanaka</tips> had been exceptionally good at it. And <tips=10>Michio Mido</tips> could use the power of his right hand to open one more quietly than anyone.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r389","rowIndex":389,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　でも私たちはそんなことせずに、もっと上手に開けられる。","en":"We had no need to do any of that. We could open it more elegantly.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r390","rowIndex":390,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　まずそのまえに下準備。ガラスに顔をぺったりくっつける。すると、部屋の奥の壁にセキュリティシステムのパネルが見える。念動力を使ってパスコードを入力して、セキュリティを解除しようとしたのだが、いくらボタンを押しても画面が何も変わらない。","en":"But first, some preparation. We pressed our face flat against the glass. A security-system panel was visible on the far wall. We tried using psychokinesis to enter the passcode and disable the system, but no matter how many buttons we pressed, the screen did not change.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r391","rowIndex":391,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　何度かためしてみて、そして最初から解除されていることに気がついた。帰るときにセットしわすれたのだろうか？","en":"After several attempts, we realized that it had been disabled from the beginning. Had they forgotten to arm it when leaving?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r392","rowIndex":392,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　とにかく、防犯設備が作動していないのならあとは鍵を開けるだけだ。","en":"In any event, with the security equipment inactive, we needed only to unlock the door.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r393","rowIndex":393,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちにはもちろんドライバーなんかいらない。念動力でガラス戸のサムターンをくるりと回せば何も壊さずに部屋に入ることが出来る。","en":"Of course, we did not need a screwdriver. We could simply use psychokinesis to spin the thumbturn on the glass door and enter the room without breaking anything.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r394","rowIndex":394,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　部屋のなかはシンとしている。","en":"The room was silent.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r395","rowIndex":395,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　二階は元の住宅設備の家具がそのままで、革張りのソファーや大きなテレビが置かれ、壁には名画の複製がかかっている。元の住人がどんな人だったかはわからないけれど、この街でこういった暮らしが出来るのはそれなりに裕福な部類に入る。ギャング関係か、商売人か。","en":"The second floor retained the house’s original furnishings. Leather sofas and a large television stood there, and reproductions of famous paintings hung upon the walls. We did not know what sort of people the former residents had been, but anyone able to live this way in this city would have counted as reasonably wealthy. Perhaps they had belonged to a gang, or owned a business.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r396","rowIndex":396,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その部屋は電灯が消えていて暗く、窓からうっすらと差し込む外の明かりを頼りに進む。","en":"The lights were out. We moved forward by the faint exterior light filtering through the windows.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r397","rowIndex":397,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　階段のところの壁にそっと身を寄せて一階の様子をうかがうけれども、やはりそちらにも人の気配がない。","en":"We eased up against the wall by the stairs and peered down to check the first floor, but there was no sign of anyone there either.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r398","rowIndex":398,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　セキュリティがそのままなのといい、電気がつけっぱなしの部屋があるのといい、何か異変を感じさせる。それとも、普段からここはこんなにいい加減なんだろうか？　そりゃ発症した<tips=17>タイプB</tips>ばっかりならそれくらい杜撰でもおかしくないけれど、みんな薬でしゃっきりしているはずなのにそれは考えにくい。","en":"The inactive security system and the room with its lights left on suggested that something unusual had happened. Or was the place always managed this carelessly? If it were staffed entirely by <tips=17>Type Bs</tips> whose symptoms had manifested, such negligence might have been unsurprising. They should all have been clearheaded on medication, however, so that seemed unlikely.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r399","rowIndex":399,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　不審に思いながらソロソロ階段を下りると、自分の予感が当たっていたのを知った。","en":"With our suspicion growing, we crept down the stairs and discovered that our intuition had been correct.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r400","rowIndex":400,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　蛍光灯に煌々と照らされた部屋は、まるで空き巣にあった後のような有様だった。棚や引き出しは開け放たれ、書類のようなものがまるで見当たらない。パソコンがあったとおぼしき机の上には、引っこ抜かれたケーブルだけが残されている。","en":"The room, brilliantly lit by fluorescent lamps, looked as though it had been burglarized. Shelves and drawers stood open. Not a single document remained. Only yanked-out cables lay upon the desk where a computer appeared to have stood.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r401","rowIndex":401,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして壁には銃弾の痕。","en":"And there were bullet marks upon the walls.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r402","rowIndex":402,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しかし血液などは床の上に流れていない――ということは交戦はしなかったんだろうか？　侵入した何者かはここで威嚇射撃を行い、作業員たちを脅しながら工場の書類などを持ち去ったんだ。","en":"But there was no blood on the floor... Did that mean there had been no firefight? Whoever broke in must have fired warning shots, threatened the workers, and carried off the factory’s records.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r403","rowIndex":403,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=21>八龍会</tips>の全員が戦闘要員ではないとはいっても、警備員などはいたろうし、抵抗もせずに従わせるのは簡単ではない。","en":"Not every member of the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips> was a combatant, but there must at least have been guards. Forcing everyone to comply without resistance could not have been easy.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r404","rowIndex":404,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　つまり、相手は抵抗する気力がなくなるほどのもの――身内の過激派による造反か、それか、<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>かな？　――<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>のような気がする。クーデターが起きたり、新しいリーダーである<tips=10>見土道夫</tips>が死んだりして、<tips=21>八龍会</tips>はきっとゴタゴタしているだろうし、その状況をあの抜け目ない<tips=1>菅原亮</tips>が利用しない筈がない。","en":"In other words, the intruders had been so formidable that resistance seemed hopeless—had radical insiders rebelled, or had this been <tips=7>YS</tips>? We suspected <tips=7>YS</tips>. The <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips> must have been in turmoil after the coup and the death of its new leader, <tips=10>Michio Mido</tips>. That shrewd <tips=1>Ryo Sugawara</tips> would never fail to exploit such circumstances.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r405","rowIndex":405,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　壁際に四台並んだ製剤機はまだそのままだ。これは大きいから運び出せずに、後で取りに来るつもりなのかもしれない。そう言えばまだ辺りには硝煙のにおいが立ちこめている。それほど時間が経っていないのだろう。","en":"The four drug-manufacturing machines lined up against the wall were still there. They were too large to carry off, so perhaps the intruders meant to come back for them later. Come to think of it, the smell of gunpowder still hung in the air. It could not have been long since they left.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r406","rowIndex":406,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それはともかく、あの生意気なお爺ちゃんはどこにいるのか。","en":"That aside, where was the insolent old man?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r407","rowIndex":407,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　何の音もしないのがやっぱり気になるが、考えていても仕方がない。邸内を散策すると、キッチンの横に地下へ降りる階段を見つけた。そしてその階段は血で汚れている。","en":"The continued silence troubled us, but there was no purpose in thinking without acting. As we searched the house, we discovered a staircase beside the kitchen leading underground. Blood stained its steps.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r408","rowIndex":408,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ぽつぽつとこぼれ落ちた血の雫を、靴で踏みにじったようなあとだった。","en":"It looked as though someone’s shoes had trampled through the scattered drops of blood.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r409","rowIndex":409,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それを見た時点でこの先にあるものが大体想像が付いたが、確認するために階段を下りる。","en":"The sight gave us a fair idea of what lay ahead, but we descended to confirm it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r410","rowIndex":410,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　分厚いドアを開けると、むっと血の臭いがした。部屋のなかは真っ暗で、ドアの側で小さなランプが点灯しているスイッチを押す。","en":"When we opened the heavy door, the thick smell of blood met us. The room was completely dark. We pressed a switch beside the door whose small indicator lamp was glowing.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r411","rowIndex":411,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　地下室は本来ホームシアターとして使われていたものらしく、壁際には大きなスクリーンモニターがあり、部屋の四方には本格的なスピーカーセットが設置されていた。","en":"The basement appeared to have originally served as a home theater. A large screen stood against one wall, with a full-scale speaker setup installed around the room.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r412","rowIndex":412,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おそらく昔は部屋の中央にソファーか何か、ゆっくりくつろいで鑑賞するための家具が置かれていたんだろうけれど、今はそこには不格好な鋼鉄のベッドが置かれている。<tips=17>タイプB</tips>用の頑丈なやつだ。そして、解きほどかれた拘束用の鎖がその上に落ちている。","en":"In the past, a sofa or some other furniture for watching in comfort had probably occupied the center. Now an ungainly steel bed stood there instead—a heavy-duty model intended for <tips=17>Type Bs</tips>. Unfastened restraint chains lay atop it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r413","rowIndex":413,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ベッドの上は夥しい血で溢れていて、階段から続く血の跡はそこに続いていた。","en":"The bed was awash with blood, and the trail from the stairs led straight to it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r414","rowIndex":414,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>はここで囚われ、<tips=21>八龍会</tips>によって拷問を受けていたに違いない。<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>か、他の誰かかわからないが、襲撃者は彼も連れ出したんだろう。襲撃者がどの組織に属しているかによって、彼の運命は大きく変わる。","en":"<tips=20>Koschei</tips> must have been imprisoned and tortured here by the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips>. Whether the attackers belonged to <tips=7>YS</tips> or some other force, they had probably taken him as well. His fate would differ enormously depending upon which organization they belonged to.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r415","rowIndex":415,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　とにかく、目的の人物がいないとなればもう長居をする必要はない。","en":"In any event, with the person we sought no longer here, there was no reason to remain.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r416","rowIndex":416,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　階段をのぼり、そして玄関から外に出たところで思わぬ人物に出くわした。","en":"We climbed the stairs and left through the front entrance. Outside, we encountered someone unexpected.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r417","rowIndex":417,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=66>田中紺太</tips>！」","en":"“<tips=66>Konta Tanaka</tips>!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r418","rowIndex":418,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちはびっくりしてその名を呼んだ。","en":"Startled, we called his name.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r419","rowIndex":419,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「は、はいがみっ！？」","en":"“H-Haigami!?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"田中紺太","displayName":"Konta Tanaka","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r420","rowIndex":420,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　丁度入り口から入ろうとしていたのは、三人ほど仲間を率いている<tips=66>田中紺太</tips>だった。","en":"The person about to enter was <tips=66>Konta Tanaka</tips>, leading three or so companions.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r421","rowIndex":421,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ど、どうしてここに？」","en":"“W-why are you here?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"田中紺太","displayName":"Konta Tanaka","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r422","rowIndex":422,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼は目を丸くして私たちを見ている。","en":"He stared at us, his eyes wide.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r423","rowIndex":423,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その反応からすると、酒場の誰かから私たちの情報を聞きつけてやって来たというわけではないようだ。","en":"Judging by his reaction, he had not come after hearing about us from someone at the bar.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r424","rowIndex":424,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あなたたちがさらったあのお爺ちゃんを連れ戻しに来たんだよ。……ちょっと、遅かったみたいだけど」","en":"“We came to recover the old man you abducted. ...It appears we were a little late.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r425","rowIndex":425,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちはそう言って溜息をついた。","en":"We sighed as we said it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r426","rowIndex":426,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「やっ、やる気かっ？」","en":"“A-are you looking for a fight?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"田中紺太","displayName":"Konta Tanaka","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r427","rowIndex":427,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あなたと喧嘩する気はないわ。意味がないし」","en":"“We have no intention of fighting you. It would be meaningless.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r428","rowIndex":428,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そ、そうか……。なんでお前が生きているかわからんが、なんだか、悪いことをしたな……」","en":"“I-I see... I don’t know how you’re alive, but... I guess we did you wrong.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"田中紺太","displayName":"Konta Tanaka","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r429","rowIndex":429,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=66>田中紺太</tips>は冷や汗を袖で拭いつつ、","en":"<tips=66>Konta Tanaka</tips> wiped the cold sweat from his face with his sleeve.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r430","rowIndex":430,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なあ、おれたちも好きでやったわけじゃないんだよ。あの爺さんは、どうしても危険だったから……」","en":"“Look, it’s not as if we wanted to do it. That old man was just too dangerous...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"田中紺太","displayName":"Konta Tanaka","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r431","rowIndex":431,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「言い訳はしないで。思い出すと、殺したくなるから」","en":"“Do not make excuses. Remembering it makes us want to kill you.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r432","rowIndex":432,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そ、そうだよな。……中はどうなってる？」","en":"“R-right. ...What’s it like inside?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"田中紺太","displayName":"Konta Tanaka","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r433","rowIndex":433,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「自分の目で見たら」","en":"“See for yourself.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r434","rowIndex":434,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　言って私たちは彼に道を譲る。","en":"With that, we stepped aside to let him pass.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r435","rowIndex":435,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼の部下たちは警戒心を露わにするが、<tips=66>田中紺太</tips>は気にせずずかずかと足を進めていって、部屋の惨状を見ると溜息をつく。","en":"His subordinates displayed open wariness, but <tips=66>Konta Tanaka</tips> ignored them and strode inside. When he saw the devastation, he sighed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r436","rowIndex":436,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「地下室にとじこめていたお爺ちゃんもいなくなってるよ」","en":"“The old man you imprisoned in the basement is gone too.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r437","rowIndex":437,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちは後ろからそう声をかけた。","en":"We called out to him from behind.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r438","rowIndex":438,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうらしいな」","en":"“Apparently so.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"田中紺太","displayName":"Konta Tanaka","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r439","rowIndex":439,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「やったのは<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>？」","en":"“Was it <tips=7>YS</tips>?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r440","rowIndex":440,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちの問いに、<tips=66>田中紺太</tips>は頷きを返した。","en":"<tips=66>Konta Tanaka</tips> nodded in answer.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r441","rowIndex":441,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　だとすると、ちょっと面倒だ。<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>は『<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>』のことをどれくらい知っているのか――もしかしたら、<tips=21>八龍会</tips>よりも詳しいかもしれない。","en":"If so, that complicated matters. How much did <tips=7>YS</tips> know about ‘<tips=20>Koschei</tips>’? Perhaps even more than the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips> did.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r442","rowIndex":442,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>は<tips=41>グランドタワー</tips>を襲ったり、<tips=55>汐松子</tips>を襲ったりしている。<tips=1>菅原亮</tips>は徹底的に調べ上げただろう。<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>は警察と繋がりがあるし、そういった面からも情報は入りやすいはずだ。","en":"<tips=20>Koschei</tips> had attacked both <tips=41>Grand Tower</tips> and <tips=55>Matsuko Shio</tips>. <tips=1>Ryo Sugawara</tips> would have investigated him exhaustively. And with <tips=7>YS’s</tips> connections to the police, information from that quarter would have been easy to come by.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r443","rowIndex":443,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しかも、<tips=1>菅原亮</tips>は<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>のような『不死身』の人間については誰よりも詳しいだろう。<tips=55>汐松子</tips>とずっと一緒にいたんだから。","en":"Moreover, <tips=1>Ryo Sugawara</tips> probably knew more than anyone about ‘immortal’ people like <tips=20>Koschei</tips>. After all, he had been with <tips=55>Matsuko Shio</tips> all that time.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r444","rowIndex":444,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「状況はわかったわ。じゃあね、<tips=66>田中紺太</tips>」","en":"“All right, we understand. Goodbye, <tips=66>Konta Tanaka</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r445","rowIndex":445,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ちょ、ちょっと待ってくれ」","en":"“W-wait, hold on.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"田中紺太","displayName":"Konta Tanaka","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r446","rowIndex":446,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その場をあとにしようとする私たちを、彼は引きとめた。","en":"When we began to leave, he called us back.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r447","rowIndex":447,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「灰上、お前はこれからどうするんだ？　復讐をするのか？」","en":"“Haigami, what are you going to do now? Are you going to take revenge?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"田中紺太","displayName":"Konta Tanaka","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r448","rowIndex":448,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「復讐はしないわ。死んだ人間はもういないのよ。そのために何かをするなんてばかみたいでしょ。……それに、<tips=10>見土道夫</tips>は死んだって聞いた」","en":"“We’re not taking revenge. The dead are gone. It would be stupid to do anything for their sake, wouldn’t it? ...Besides, we heard <tips=10>Michio Mido</tips> was dead.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r449","rowIndex":449,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ああ……」","en":"“Oh...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"田中紺太","displayName":"Konta Tanaka","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r450","rowIndex":450,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=66>田中紺太</tips>は暗い顔で俯く。","en":"<tips=66>Konta Tanaka</tips> lowered his head, his expression dark.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r451","rowIndex":451,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「私たちは、お爺ちゃんを連れ戻したいだけだよ」","en":"“We only want to bring the old man back.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r452","rowIndex":452,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちがそう言うと、彼は顔をあげ、","en":"At that, he raised his head and—","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r453","rowIndex":453,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なあ、どうしてそんなに<tips=65>ヘス</tips>のことを気にしてるんだ？　おれも<tips=10>道夫</tips>君もどうしてもわからなかったんだよ。なんでお前が<tips=65>ヘス</tips>と一緒にいたのか……」","en":"“Tell me, why do you care so much about <tips=65>Hess</tips>? Neither <tips=10>Michio</tips> nor I could ever figure it out. Why you were with <tips=65>Hess</tips> in the first place...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"田中紺太","displayName":"Konta Tanaka","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r454","rowIndex":454,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「理由なんかないわ。なんだかとっても気になるんだよ。……じゃあね」","en":"“There’s no reason. We just can’t stop thinking about him. ...Goodbye.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r455","rowIndex":455,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そしてもう一度歩きかけて、私たちはふと思い出して振り返った。","en":"We started away again, then suddenly remembered something and looked back.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r456","rowIndex":456,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>と戦うのはやめなよ。あなたたち<tips=21>八龍会</tips>は絶対勝てないから。リーダーも<tips=65>ヘス</tips>の薬も失った以上、あなたたちは無力な存在に逆戻りなんだからね」","en":"“Stop fighting <tips=7>YS</tips>. You people in the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips> can never win. Now that you have lost both your leader and <tips=65>Hess’s</tips> drug, you are right back to being powerless.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r457","rowIndex":457,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「え、えらそうに！　お前こそ、あの<tips=65>爺さん</tips>を連れ戻すって言ったって出来ることなんかないだろう？　<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>に捕まったんだぞ？」","en":"“D-don’t get so high and mighty! You say you’re going to bring that <tips=65>old man</tips> back, but there’s nothing you can do either! <tips=7>YS</tips> has him, remember?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"田中紺太","displayName":"Konta Tanaka","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r458","rowIndex":458,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼はむきになって言い返す。","en":"He shot back, taking the bait.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r459","rowIndex":459,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「心配はいらない。きっと、連れ戻せるわ。それにこれは、一石二鳥かもしれない」","en":"“There is no need to worry. I am sure we can bring him back. Besides, this might let us kill two birds with one stone.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r460","rowIndex":460,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「一石二鳥？」","en":"“Two birds with one stone?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"田中紺太","displayName":"Konta Tanaka","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:F5:r461","rowIndex":461,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=66>田中紺太</tips>の言葉にはもう答えない。あとはもう、うしろを振り返らずに小走りで家を出た。","en":"We gave <tips=66>Konta Tanaka</tips> no answer. Without another glance back, we broke into a trot and left the house.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}}]},{"position":58,"code":"x12","unitId":"x12","rows":[{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r1","rowIndex":1,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その頃は今よりもはっきりとした四季があった。","en":"In those days, the four seasons were more distinct than they are now.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r2","rowIndex":2,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　六月も終わりになればすっかり蒸し暑くなって、<tips=9>Y地区</tips>の裏通りはどこもかしこも用水路のヘドロから漂う腐敗臭がにおいはじめる。","en":"By the end of June, the weather would turn thoroughly hot and humid, and every back street in <tips=9>Y District</tips> would begin to reek of decay rising from the sludge in the drainage channels.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r3","rowIndex":3,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　七月になり、本格的な夏が訪れると、貧しい家の子供たちはほとんど半裸で、裾や襟の伸びきったTシャツを埃だらけにし、白い歯を剥き出しにしてサッカーやら喧嘩やらに明け暮れた。","en":"When July brought summer in earnest, the children from poor families went about half-naked in T-shirts stretched loose at the collars and hems and caked with dust, baring their white teeth as they spent their days playing soccer and fighting.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r4","rowIndex":4,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　豊かな家の子供たちは洗いたてのきれいな服を着て、はじめは日陰からそのサッカーを眺めているが、いつのまにか彼らと混じって埃だらけになり、汗で濡れたシャツを脱ぎ捨て、最終的にはどちらがどちらだったかわからなくなり、同じような顔で笑うのだった。","en":"The children of wealthy families wore clean, freshly washed clothes and at first watched the soccer from the shade. Before long, however, they mingled with the others and got covered in dust, threw off their sweat-soaked shirts, and ultimately became impossible to tell apart, all laughing with the same look on their faces.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r5","rowIndex":5,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　いつの時代でもどの場所でも子供たちはグループを作るものだが、その頃の<tips=9>Y地区</tips>の子供たちは地域や人種ごとにチームを作り、大人さながらに街の覇権をかけて争いあっていた。いやむしろ、<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>が街を支配するようになってからギャング同士の抗争はめっきり減少していたため、大人以上の熾烈な争いだったと言えるかもしれない。","en":"Children form groups in every age and every place, but in <tips=9>Y District</tips> at the time, they divided into teams by neighborhood and race and fought like adults for supremacy over the city. In fact, gang warfare had declined sharply after <tips=7>YS</tips> took control, so one might even say the children's struggles were fiercer than the adults'.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r6","rowIndex":6,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　子供たちの勢力争いは数年で大人になってゆくため世代交代が早い。今はギャングとなった<tips=26>劉建志</tips>が<tips=59>暗闇通り</tips>の不良少年を束ねて一大グループを築いていたのが第一世代だとしたら、彼らの世代は第三世代と言えるだろう。","en":"Because children grow into adults within a matter of years, the generations turned over quickly in these struggles for power. If the First Generation was the era in which <tips=26>Ryu Kenshi</tips>—now a gangster—united the delinquents of <tips=59>Darkness Street</tips> into one great faction, then theirs could be called the Third Generation.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r7","rowIndex":7,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして、彼ら以降こうした少年同士のグループ争いはほとんどなくなるから、最後の世代といっていいかもしれない。","en":"And since such conflicts between groups of boys virtually disappeared after them, they might also be called the final generation.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r8","rowIndex":8,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ここで『彼ら』というのは、後に<tips=21>八龍会</tips>の代表となる<tips=10>見土道夫</tips>や、<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>の第三代<tips=81>龍頭</tips>となる<tips=1>菅原亮</tips>たちのことである。","en":"Here, “they” means the likes of <tips=10>Michio Mido</tips>, who would later become the representative of the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips>, and <tips=1>Ryo Sugawara</tips>, who would become the third <tips=81>Longtou</tips> of <tips=7>YS</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r9","rowIndex":9,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=26>劉建志</tips>が<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>の一員となって自分のチームを解散した時点までが第一世代で、その後小さなグループがいくつも乱立していたのが第二世代だった。この第二世代の多くはギャングと結びつき、いかに有力なバックをつけるかをお互いに競い合った。","en":"The First Generation lasted until <tips=26>Ryu Kenshi</tips> joined <tips=7>YS</tips> and disbanded his own team; the period that followed, when numerous small groups sprang up side by side, was the Second Generation. Many of this Second Generation formed ties with gangs and competed to secure the most powerful backers.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r10","rowIndex":10,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　この頃は丁度『<tips=45>ローズ</tips>』のレシピが公開され、世界中で流行しはじめた時期で、後には悪魔の薬と呼ばれることになるこの薬は、<tips=17>タイプB</tips>には奇跡の薬として、その他の若者たちにはイージーなドラッグとして流行の兆しを見せ始めていた。","en":"This was just when the formula for <tips=45>Rose</tips> was made public and the drug began sweeping the world. It would later come to be called the devil's drug, but for <tips=17>Type Bs</tips> it promised a miracle cure, while among other young people it was beginning to catch on as an easy recreational high.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r11","rowIndex":11,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　第二世代の不良少年たちはこの『<tips=45>ローズ</tips>』と最も深く関わった少年たちだろう。ギャングたちとのつき合いのなかで、これを仲間に売って小銭稼ぎをしていた。買う方としても深く関わり、中毒者となってしまったものも多い。その結果、大人たちにていよく労働力や性を搾取され、命を落とすものも少なくなかった。","en":"The delinquents of the Second Generation were likely the children most deeply entangled with <tips=45>Rose</tips>. Through their dealings with gangs, they sold it to their friends for pocket money; many also became deeply involved as buyers and ended up addicted themselves. As a result, adults found them easy to exploit for their labor or for sex, and more than a few lost their lives.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r12","rowIndex":12,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　第三世代はそうした状況のなか、近所の子供が集まった遊び仲間の輪から生まれた。","en":"Amid those conditions, the Third Generation grew out of circles of neighborhood children who had first gathered simply to play.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r13","rowIndex":13,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼らは第二世代とは対照的に、仲間同士での団結力が強く、親や大人との繋がりが薄かった。そして、この結束の力で街にドラッグを流行らせた元凶と言っても良い第二世代の少年たちを駆逐していったのだ。ここで中心的な役割を果たしたのが、わずか十四才で<tips=59>暗闇通り</tips>の子供たちのリーダーとなった<tips=10>見土道夫</tips>だった。","en":"In contrast to the Second Generation, they had strong bonds with one another and few ties to parents or other adults. Through the strength of that solidarity, they drove out the boys of the Second Generation, who could fairly be called the cause of drugs spreading through the city. At the center of that effort stood <tips=10>Michio Mido</tips>, who became leader of the children of <tips=59>Darkness Street</tips> at only fourteen.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r14","rowIndex":14,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=10>見土道夫</tips>は<tips=17>タイプB</tips>の身体能力と<tips=16>タイプA</tips>の超能力を兼ね揃えており、勇気に満ちあふれ、リーダーになるべくしてなった少年だった。","en":"<tips=10>Michio Mido</tips> possessed both the physical abilities of a <tips=17>Type B</tips> and the psychic powers of a <tips=16>Type A</tips>. Brimming with courage, he was a boy born to lead.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r15","rowIndex":15,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼は孤児であった。幼い頃に親を失い、<tips=21>八龍会</tips>の<tips=22>老人たち</tips>に引きとられ、肉親の愛情を知らぬまま育った。その頃は近所の日本人大工の家に預けられ、普段はその現場で手伝いをしていた。","en":"He was an orphan. He lost his parents when he was young and was taken in by the <tips=22>Elders</tips> of the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips>, growing up without ever knowing a blood relative’s love. In those days, he was placed with the family of a Japanese carpenter in the neighborhood and usually helped out at the man’s job sites.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r16","rowIndex":16,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　荒くれ者の肉体労働者たちのなかで暮らした彼は喧嘩が滅法強く、同年代はもとより、大人と戦っても一歩もひけをとらなかった。彼はそうして自ら力を示すことによって仲間を増やし、自分のグループを築き上げたのである。","en":"Growing up among rough manual laborers made him exceptionally strong in a fight. Not only boys his own age, but even adults could not force him to give ground. By demonstrating his strength in this way, he won more followers and built a group of his own.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r17","rowIndex":17,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　また、<tips=10>見土</tips>は正義感も強かった。","en":"What was more, <tips=10>Mido</tips> had a strong sense of justice.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r18","rowIndex":18,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　当時<tips=59>暗闇通り</tips>はヤンという十八才の少年が率いるグループが仕切っていた。第二世代にあたる彼らはギャングと組んで売春組織を作っており、近くの少女たちを騙したり脅したりして不当に働かせていた。","en":"At the time, <tips=59>Darkness Street</tips> was controlled by a group led by an eighteen-year-old named Yang. They belonged to the Second Generation and had joined forces with a gang to run a prostitution ring, deceiving and threatening local girls into working for them.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r19","rowIndex":19,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　この被害にあった少女が幼なじみに相談した。これが<tips=10>見土道夫</tips>少年であり、彼は当然憤慨した。","en":"One of the girls they victimized confided in a childhood friend. That friend was <tips=10>Michio Mido</tips>, and the boy was naturally outraged.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r20","rowIndex":20,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　仲間たちと徒党を組んで<tips=59>暗闇通り</tips>に乗り込むと、ヤンの仲間を見かけるたびに襲って叩きのめした。その結果ヤンたちは<tips=10>道夫</tips>の姿を見かけると逃げ回るようになり、その姿は子供たちの物笑いの種となる。","en":"He banded together with his friends and marched into <tips=59>Darkness Street</tips>, attacking and thrashing Yang’s companions whenever he spotted them. Eventually, Yang and his gang fled whenever they saw <tips=10>Michio</tips>, becoming a laughingstock among the other children.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r21","rowIndex":21,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　すっかり評判の落ちたヤンたちを恐れるものはなく、少女を集められなくなった。ヤンは起死回生を狙って空き地に<tips=10>道夫</tips>たちを呼び出し決闘をするも、そこでも散々な目にあって敗北し、結果、ヤンのグループは消滅することになる。","en":"With their reputation in tatters, no one feared Yang's gang anymore, and they could no longer gather girls for the ring. In a desperate bid to turn things around, Yang summoned <tips=10>Michio</tips> and his friends to a vacant lot for a showdown, only to take another savage beating and lose. That defeat finished Yang's group for good.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r22","rowIndex":22,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その後ヤンは一時<tips=10>道夫</tips>の子分のような立場でチームに混じっていたが、やがてチームを抜けて飲食店に就職、そこで心を入れ替えてコツコツと働き、今はタイ人の妻と結婚して四人もの子を持つ親になっているがそれはずっと後の話である。","en":"For a time afterward, Yang served as a subordinate in <tips=10>Michio’s</tips> team. He eventually left and found work at a restaurant. There, he changed his ways and worked steadily. Today he is married to a Thai woman and has become the father of four children—but all that lay far in the future.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r23","rowIndex":23,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　とにかく、この結果<tips=10>道夫</tips>はヤンに変わって<tips=59>暗闇通り</tips>を支配下に置いた。そうすると<tips=10>道夫</tips>のグループは<tips=9>Y地区</tips>のなかでも有力なチームの一つという立場になる。このときから、第二世代が陰りを見せ始め、第三世代の時代が始まったいうことになるのだろう。","en":"In any event, as a result <tips=10>Michio</tips> took control of <tips=59>Darkness Street</tips> in Yang’s place. That made <tips=10>Michio’s</tips> group one of the more powerful teams in <tips=9>Y District</tips>. From that point on, one might say, the Second Generation began to wane and the age of the Third Generation began.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r24","rowIndex":24,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ねえ帰ろうよ<tips=10>道夫</tips>君。たった二人で、見つかったらどうすんのさ」","en":"“Come on, <tips=10>Michio</tips>. Let’s go home. There are only two of us. What are we going to do if they find us?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"紺太（少年時代）","displayName":"Konta (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r25","rowIndex":25,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　地元の住民が夕食の材料を買い求めて行き来する<tips=58>パラシュート通り</tips>。人の間をすり抜けて歩いている<tips=66>田中紺太</tips>は不安げにキョロキョロと辺りを見回しながら先を行く背の高い少年にそう呼びかけた。","en":"Local residents moved along <tips=58>Parachute Street</tips> in search of ingredients for dinner. Weaving between them, <tips=66>Konta Tanaka</tips> looked nervously in every direction and called to the tall boy walking ahead.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r26","rowIndex":26,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「帰るなら一人で帰ってもいいんだぜ？」","en":"“If you want to go home, you can go by yourself.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫（少年時代）","displayName":"Michio Mido (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r27","rowIndex":27,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その少年――<tips=10>見土道夫</tips>は不敵に笑ってそう応える。","en":"The boy—<tips=10>Michio Mido</tips>—answered with a defiant grin.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r28","rowIndex":28,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　染めたての金色の髪の毛は赤みがかった太陽の光を反射してキラキラと光っていた。","en":"His freshly dyed golden hair reflected the reddish sunlight and glittered brightly.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r29","rowIndex":29,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そういうわけにはいかないよ……。ここを歩くなら、せめて、みんなを呼ぼうよ」","en":"“I can’t do that... If we’re going to walk around here, we should at least call everyone else.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"紺太（少年時代）","displayName":"Konta (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r30","rowIndex":30,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　この<tips=58>パラシュート通り</tips>は彼らの縄張りではなく、別の少年グループのものだった。","en":"This <tips=58>Parachute Street</tips> was not their territory; it belonged to another group of boys.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r31","rowIndex":31,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そのグループとは現在緊張関係にあるというわけでもなかったが、この頃の<tips=9>Y地区</tips>の不良少年の社会ではよそのグループの縄張りには勝手に足を踏み入れないことが不文律のようになっており、それを破ったことがきっかけとなって、抗争に発展することも少なくない。","en":"They were not currently on tense terms with that group, but among the young delinquents of <tips=9>Y District</tips>, entering another group’s territory without permission had become an unwritten taboo. Violating it often became the spark for a full-fledged feud.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r32","rowIndex":32,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=66>紺太</tips>は口は達者だが、喧嘩には自信がなかった。彼も一応<tips=17>タイプＢ</tips>ではあるが、<tips=72>傾向値</tips>が低く興奮してもほとんど<tips=95>金眼</tips>にならない上に、なっても身体能力はさほど変わらない。どれくらい弱いかというと、平均的なノーマル相手でもこてんぱんに負かされるくらいの弱さだ。","en":"<tips=66>Konta</tips> was quick with words but had little confidence in a fight. He was technically a <tips=17>Type B</tips>, but his <tips=72>tendency value</tips> was low: even when excited, he almost never became <tips=95>golden-eyed</tips>, and when he did, his physical abilities changed very little. To give an idea of how weak he was, even an average Normal could beat him to a pulp.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r33","rowIndex":33,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　さらに今日は新しい黒いシャツをおろしたばかりで、汚したくないという事情もある。","en":"Moreover, he was wearing a brand-new black shirt for the first time that day and did not want it dirtied.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r34","rowIndex":34,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　売春する母親に客を引いて手伝っている彼は歩合で小遣いを貰っており、他の<tips=59>暗闇通り</tips>の子供に比べればずっと裕福ではあったが、好きなものを好きなだけ買えるほどの金を持っているわけではなかった。","en":"He helped his mother with her prostitution by bringing in customers, and she paid him a cut as pocket money. That left him much better off than the other children of <tips=59>Darkness Street</tips>, but not rich enough to buy anything he pleased whenever he pleased.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r35","rowIndex":35,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いいんだよ。これは偵察なんだ。殴り込みじゃない」","en":"“It’ll be fine. This is reconnaissance, not a raid.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫（少年時代）","displayName":"Michio Mido (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r36","rowIndex":36,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=10>道夫</tips>は<tips=66>紺太</tips>の不安を意に介そうともしない。","en":"<tips=10>Michio</tips> paid no heed whatsoever to <tips=66>Konta’s</tips> anxiety.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r37","rowIndex":37,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「こんなに目立つ偵察ってないよ」","en":"“This has to be the least discreet reconnaissance ever.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"紺太（少年時代）","displayName":"Konta (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r38","rowIndex":38,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それに関しては、<tips=66>紺太</tips>が呆れる通りだった。","en":"On that point, <tips=66>Konta</tips> had every reason to be exasperated.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r39","rowIndex":39,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=10>道夫</tips>はTシャツの半袖を肩までまくり上げ、その年の少年にしては逞しい両腕を露出しているが、右の方は肘から先が真っ黒に染まっている。","en":"<tips=10>Michio</tips> had rolled the short sleeves of his T-shirt up to his shoulders, exposing arms unusually robust for a boy his age. The right one, however, was stained pitch-black from the elbow down.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r40","rowIndex":40,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それは何かの塗料を使ったような普通の黒さではなく、何かまるきり別の物質のような、なんの光も反射しない完全な黒だった。","en":"It was not the ordinary black produced by pigment. The arm reflected no light whatsoever. Its perfect black made it appear to be made of an entirely different substance.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r41","rowIndex":41,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　これを見れば誰でも彼がその身に異形の呪いをうけた<tips=16>タイプA</tips>であることを一目で理解し、そして少しこの地域の事情に詳しければ彼が最近少年たちの間でよく話題になる<tips=10>見土道夫</tips>だと気がつくだろう。","en":"One look was enough for anyone to know that he was a <tips=16>Type A</tips>, bearing an unnatural curse upon his body. And anyone who knew even a little about the neighborhood would recognize him as <tips=10>Michio Mido</tips>, the boy who had lately become the talk of the local children.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r42","rowIndex":42,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　すぐ先日も、北街のブロイアーという喧嘩の強いことで知られる年上の少年に決闘を挑んで勝ちを収め、その縄張りを手に入れている。","en":"Only days before, he had challenged and defeated Breuer, an older boy from North Town famed for his strength in fights, and taken his territory.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r43","rowIndex":43,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その時に出来た青あざが彼の頬にはあり、切れた唇の端にはかさぶたが出来ていた。","en":"A bruise from the fight remained upon his cheek, and a scab had formed at the corner of his split lip.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r44","rowIndex":44,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「だって、どんなやつか見てみたいじゃないか。その<tips=1>菅原亮</tips>ってやつはおれたちと同い年なんだろ？」","en":"“I want to see what he’s like. This <tips=1>Ryo Sugawara</tips> is our age, isn’t he?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫（少年時代）","displayName":"Michio Mido (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r45","rowIndex":45,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そう、彼が今日この場所へ足を踏み入れたのは、<tips=58>パラシュート通り</tips>を縄張りにする少年グループのリーダー、<tips=1>菅原亮</tips>に会うためであった。","en":"That was why Michio had entered this neighborhood today: to meet <tips=1>Ryo Sugawara</tips>, leader of the boys whose territory was <tips=58>Parachute Street</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r46","rowIndex":46,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　このとき<tips=57>滑走路通り</tips>に周という少年のグループがあった。彼は引退した<tips=26>劉建志</tips>の弟分で、そのグループは<tips=57>滑走路通り</tips>で最大の勢力を誇っていた。<tips=26>劉</tips>のツテもあって<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>との関係も良好で、彼らの下請けとして飲食店のボディーガードを手伝うなどというようなこともしている。少年でありながら、なかば大人のようなことをしているのは、第二世代らしいところだ。","en":"At the time, a group led by a boy named Zhou operated on <tips=57>Runway Street</tips>. He was a junior associate of the retired <tips=26>Ryu Kenshi</tips>, and his group boasted the greatest power on <tips=57>Runway Street</tips>. Thanks to <tips=26>Ryu’s</tips> connections, they were also on good terms with <tips=7>YS</tips> and even worked as its subcontractors, helping to guard restaurants and the like. Though they were still boys, the fact that they carried on almost like adults was typical of the Second Generation.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r47","rowIndex":47,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=57>滑走路通り</tips>は<tips=9>Y地区</tips>のメインストリートであるから、そこで最大の勢力を持つということは、街で最も勢いのある組織と言っていいだろう。","en":"Since <tips=57>Runway Street</tips> was the main thoroughfare of <tips=9>Y District</tips>, wielding the greatest power there made them arguably the most powerful organization in the city.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r48","rowIndex":48,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　実際、周のグループの威勢の良さというのは相当なもので、揃いの色のハンカチを腕に巻き付け、<tips=57>滑走路通り</tips>を我が物顔で練り歩いた。","en":"Zhou’s group did indeed cut an imposing figure: they tied handkerchiefs of matching colors around their arms and strutted down <tips=57>Runway Street</tips> as though they owned it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r49","rowIndex":49,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして、<tips=57>滑走路通り</tips>のすぐそばには<tips=58>パラシュート通り</tips>があり、周の仲間たちはちょくちょくそちらへもやって来た。","en":"<tips=58>Parachute Street</tips> lay directly beside <tips=57>Runway Street</tips>, and Zhou's boys frequently wandered over there as well.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r50","rowIndex":50,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=58>パラシュート通り</tips>も、<tips=57>滑走路通り</tips>ほどではないが賑やかで人の多い地域である。住民の人種も多様で、少し歩いただけで雰囲気がコロコロと変わり、いくつもの国を渡り歩いているような気持ちになる。","en":"Though not as busy as <tips=57>Runway Street</tips>, <tips=58>Parachute Street</tips> was still a lively, crowded neighborhood. Its residents came from a wide variety of ethnic backgrounds, and the atmosphere changed again and again within a short walk, making one feel as though one had traveled through several countries.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r51","rowIndex":51,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　このように多様性のある通りのため、なかなかグループというものが出来にくかった。そのため、<tips=57>滑走路通り</tips>の連中が何人かでちょっかいを出しに来ると、このあたりの少年はどこかに隠れるしかなかった。捕まれば、その時持っている小遣いは全て巻き上げられることになる。","en":"That very diversity made it difficult for any sort of group to coalesce. Consequently, whenever several boys from <tips=57>Runway Street</tips> came over looking for trouble, the local boys had no choice but to hide. If caught, they would be shaken down for every bit of pocket money they had on them.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r52","rowIndex":52,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　こうした状況を変えたのが、<tips=1>菅原亮</tips>という少年らしい。","en":"The one who changed this state of affairs was apparently a boy named <tips=1>Ryo Sugawara</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r53","rowIndex":53,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>菅原亮</tips>は<tips=58>パラシュート通り</tips>に店を開く定食屋の息子で、彼の仲間も同じように何らかの商売をしている家の子ばかりである。彼らは比較的裕福で、身体は大きいが勇気がなく、喧嘩が弱いというのが暗闇通りの少年たちの評価だったが、それが<tips=59>暗闇通り</tips>の少年たちでもちょっと手が出せない周たちに勝ったというのだ。しかも、この<tips=1>菅原亮</tips>は<tips=10>道夫</tips>と同い年だという。","en":"<tips=1>Ryo Sugawara</tips> was the son of a set-meal restaurant proprietor on <tips=58>Parachute Street</tips>, and his friends likewise all came from families that ran businesses of one kind or another. The boys of <tips=59>Darkness Street</tips> regarded them as relatively well-off and big for their age, but cowardly and weak in a fight—yet these same boys had defeated Zhou’s gang, whom even the boys of Darkness Street were reluctant to challenge. What was more, this <tips=1>Ryo Sugawara</tips> was the same age as <tips=10>Michio</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r54","rowIndex":54,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　となれば、<tips=10>道夫</tips>が興味を持つのも当然のことだろう。","en":"Given all that, it was only natural that <tips=10>Michio</tips> would take an interest.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r55","rowIndex":55,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なあに、心配することはない。最悪でも、お前だけは逃がしてやるから大丈夫だ。……もし相手が危険な武器を持ってきたら、おれも、この妖刀ムラサメの封印を解くことになるかもしれないが……」","en":"“Don't worry. Even if the worst happens, I'll make sure you get away. ...Of course, if they come at us with dangerous weapons, I may have no choice but to break the seal on the cursed blade Murasame...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫（少年時代）","displayName":"Michio Mido (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r56","rowIndex":56,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=10>道夫</tips>は格好つけた口ぶりでそう言いながら、うしろを歩く<tips=66>紺太</tips>に真っ黒な腕を見せつける。","en":"Putting on his most impressive voice, <tips=10>Michio</tips> held up his pitch-black arm for <tips=66>Konta</tips>, who was walking behind him, to admire.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r57","rowIndex":57,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「こないだは、魔剣フェンなんとかって言ってなかったっけ？」","en":"“Didn’t you call it the Demon Sword Fen-something the other day?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"紺太（少年時代）","displayName":"Konta (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r58","rowIndex":58,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=66>紺太</tips>は溜息をつく。","en":"<tips=66>Konta</tips> sighed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r59","rowIndex":59,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「こっちの名前の方がカッコいいと思わないか？」","en":"“Don’t you think this name sounds cooler?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫（少年時代）","displayName":"Michio Mido (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r60","rowIndex":60,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=10>道夫</tips>が同意を求めたが、<tips=66>紺太</tips>は冷たい視線を返すだけだ。","en":"<tips=10>Michio</tips> sought <tips=66>Konta’s</tips> agreement, but Konta merely returned a cold stare.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r61","rowIndex":61,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=10>道夫</tips>君はさあ、自信があるっていうか、自信過剰だよね。そんな、いつだって勝てるとはかぎらないじゃん」","en":"“You know, <tips=10>Michio</tips>, it’s not so much that you’re confident as that you’re overconfident. You can’t expect to win every single time.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"紺太（少年時代）","displayName":"Konta (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r62","rowIndex":62,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「おれを信用してないのか？」","en":"“You don’t trust me?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫（少年時代）","displayName":"Michio Mido (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r63","rowIndex":63,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「だって、周のやつらを追い返すなんて普通じゃないよ。周のところにはさ、馬鹿みたいに怪力の<tips=17>タイプＢ</tips>も結構いたはずだぜ？　<tips=1>菅原</tips>ってやつはサイキックなんじゃないかなあ。もしわけのわからない力を持ってたら、<tips=10>道夫</tips>君でも勝てるかどうか……」","en":"“There's no way a normal kid could have driven Zhou's people off. Zhou had a bunch of insanely strong <tips=17>Type Bs</tips> with him, remember? Maybe this <tips=1>Sugawara</tips> guy is a psychic. If he's got some power we don't know anything about, even you might not be able to beat him, <tips=10>Michio</tips>...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"紺太（少年時代）","displayName":"Konta (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r64","rowIndex":64,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「フ、それならそれで面白い」","en":"“Heh. That would make things interesting.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫（少年時代）","displayName":"Michio Mido (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r65","rowIndex":65,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=10>道夫</tips>は目をつむり、ぐっと手を握りしめ、","en":"<tips=10>Michio</tips> closed his eyes and clenched his fist.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r66","rowIndex":66,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「相手が恐ろしいサイキックなら、おれもこのおそろしい力を使うことが出来るだろう」","en":"“If he’s a terrifying psychic, then I’ll be able to use this terrifying power of mine too.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫（少年時代）","displayName":"Michio Mido (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r67","rowIndex":67,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「えっ、そしたら殺し合いになっちゃうじゃん」","en":"“What? But then you’ll end up killing each other!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"紺太（少年時代）","displayName":"Konta (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r68","rowIndex":68,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「サイキックが相手なら仕方ないだろう？　おれは、全然こわくないぜ。だって、やっと本気を出せるんだ。いままで、いつだって力を抑えながら戦っていたんだ。それでも連戦連勝してしまうのが、おれの罪深さなんだが……。まあ、正直なところ最近勝つことに飽きてしまってね。楽しめるなら、これより嬉しいことはない。やっぱり男は、全力を出さなくちゃ」","en":"“If I’m facing a psychic, it can’t be helped, can it? I’m not scared in the least. After all, I’ll finally be able to fight in earnest. Until now, I’ve always fought while holding back. And yet I win battle after battle—that’s the sinful burden I bear... Well, to be honest, I’ve gotten bored with winning lately. Nothing could make me happier than a fight I can enjoy. A man has to go all out, after all.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫（少年時代）","displayName":"Michio Mido (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r69","rowIndex":69,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そ、そう……」","en":"“I-I see...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"紺太（少年時代）","displayName":"Konta (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r70","rowIndex":70,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=66>紺太</tips>は眉間にしわを寄せて複雑な表情で相槌を打つ。<tips=10>道夫</tips>のこういったセンスにはついていけないところがあるのだが、はっきりとそうは言えない。しかし、かといって表情を器用に取り繕って笑ってもやれない。","en":"<tips=66>Konta</tips> furrowed his brow, his expression conflicted as he managed a vague reply. This particular side of <tips=10>Michio's</tips> tastes was beyond him, but he could not quite say so to his face. On the other hand, he was not deft enough to hide what he thought behind an obliging smile.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r71","rowIndex":71,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「でも、喧嘩となったら、本当にひどいことになっちゃうかもしれないんだよなあ。だって、<tips=1>菅原</tips>は残酷なやつらしいからね。おれの知り合いの話じゃ、<tips=1>菅原</tips>ってやつはね、目の前で敵の足とか腕をボキボキに折らせて、その様子を笑いながら見てたんだってさ」","en":"“But if this turns into a fight, it could get really bad. They say <tips=1>Sugawara</tips> is cruel. Someone I know told me this <tips=1>Sugawara</tips> guy had his men break an enemy's arms and legs right in front of him—snap, snap—and just sat there laughing as he watched.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"紺太（少年時代）","displayName":"Konta (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r72","rowIndex":72,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そう言われると<tips=10>道夫</tips>もさすがに顔をしかめたが、","en":"Even <tips=10>Michio</tips> frowned at that.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r73","rowIndex":73,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そんなひどいやつなら、やっぱり少しでも早くやっつけないといけないな」","en":"“If he’s that horrible, then all the more reason to defeat him as soon as possible.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫（少年時代）","displayName":"Michio Mido (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r74","rowIndex":74,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　消沈するどころかなおさら彼の情熱をかき立ててしまったようだった。","en":"Rather than discouraging him, the story seemed only to kindle his enthusiasm further.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r75","rowIndex":75,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=58>パラシュート通り</tips>の端の方に「菅原食堂」と、ペンキ文字の看板が掛かったこぢんまりとした中華料理店がある。","en":"Near the end of <tips=58>Parachute Street</tips> stood a small Chinese restaurant with a hand-painted sign reading SUGAWARA DINER.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r76","rowIndex":76,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=10>道夫</tips>と<tips=66>紺太</tips>はその前に立ち、あまりにも堂々と路面に晒されている敵リーダーの名前をあんぐりと口を開けて眺めた。","en":"<tips=10>Michio</tips> and <tips=66>Konta</tips> stood before it, mouths hanging open as they stared at the enemy leader’s name displayed so boldly to the street.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r77","rowIndex":77,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　今は営業時間の筈だが、昼食と夕食の間の時間帯の暇な時間帯のせいか、入り口の傷だらけのアルミサッシの脇には「準備中」の札が下がっている。","en":"It should have been open, but perhaps because this was the lull between lunch and dinner, a CLOSED sign hung beside the scratched aluminum doorframe at the entrance.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r78","rowIndex":78,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　かといって誰もいないというわけでもないらしく、磨りガラスの向こうで何者かが動いている気配があった。","en":"The diner did not seem empty. They could sense someone moving beyond the frosted glass.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r79","rowIndex":79,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なかにはいろうぜ」","en":"“Let’s go inside.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫（少年時代）","displayName":"Michio Mido (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r80","rowIndex":80,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=10>道夫</tips>は磨りガラスを見通そうでもするかのように目をこらしつつ、隣の<tips=66>紺太</tips>に囁く。","en":"Peering intently as though he could see through the frosted glass, <tips=10>Michio</tips> whispered to <tips=66>Konta</tips> beside him.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r81","rowIndex":81,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「正面から、堂々と？　いくらなんでも無茶だよ。今日は偵察って話じゃないか」","en":"“Through the front door? Just stroll right in? That’s reckless even for you. I thought we were only scouting today.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"紺太（少年時代）","displayName":"Konta (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r82","rowIndex":82,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=66>紺太</tips>が慌てる一方、<tips=10>道夫</tips>は平然とした表情で、","en":"<tips=66>Konta</tips> grew alarmed, while <tips=10>Michio</tips> remained perfectly calm.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r83","rowIndex":83,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ここで看板を眺めていてもなんの偵察にもならない。……それに、ここまで来たら血が騒いで来たのさ」","en":"“Standing out here staring at the sign isn't much of a reconnaissance mission. ...Besides, now that we've come this far, I can feel my blood starting to stir.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫（少年時代）","displayName":"Michio Mido (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r84","rowIndex":84,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　唇の端を歪めてニヤリと笑った。","en":"One corner of his mouth curled into a grin.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r85","rowIndex":85,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　また<tips=10>道夫</tips>の病気が出たのかと<tips=66>紺太</tips>は思った。","en":"<tips=66>Konta</tips> wondered whether <tips=10>Michio’s</tips> sickness was acting up again.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r86","rowIndex":86,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=1>菅原亮</tips>ってやつに挨拶をしてやるぞ」","en":"“We’re going to introduce ourselves to <tips=1>Ryo Sugawara</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫（少年時代）","displayName":"Michio Mido (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r87","rowIndex":87,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　もうすっかり偵察であることなど頭にないのであろうと思われる台詞を吐きながらドアに近づいてゆく<tips=10>道夫</tips>。<tips=66>紺太</tips>は仕方なくその後を追った。","en":"With a declaration that suggested he had completely forgotten they were supposed to be scouting, <tips=10>Michio</tips> strode toward the door. Having little choice, <tips=66>Konta</tips> hurried after him.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r88","rowIndex":88,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして<tips=10>道夫</tips>は勇ましく胸を張ってガラリと入り口の戸を開ける。","en":"<tips=10>Michio</tips> thrust out his chest and boldly flung the sliding door open with a clatter.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r89","rowIndex":89,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　店内はカウンター席といくつかのテーブル席がある、どこにでもあるようなごく普通の定食屋だった。建物や家具は古く所々に染みついた汚れや黄ばみがあったが掃除自体は行き届いている。","en":"Inside was an utterly ordinary diner, with counter seats and several tables. The building and furniture were old, stained and yellowed in places, but the room itself had been cleaned thoroughly.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r90","rowIndex":90,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　従業員らしきものはおらず、カウンターの向こうの調理場にも人はいない。けれど客席のテーブルに、少年と少女が向かい合っていた。少女の目の前には透明なガラスの器に盛られたバニラアイスがあり、手前の少年はこちらに背を向けながら少女の食べるところを見守っているようだった。","en":"There was no employee in sight, nor anyone in the kitchen beyond the counter. A boy and girl, however, sat facing each other at one of the tables. Before the girl was a transparent glass dish of vanilla ice cream. The boy sat nearer the entrance with his back to them, apparently watching her eat.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r91","rowIndex":91,"pageCtrl":"","jp":" 　<tips=10>道夫</tips>がドアを開けた音で、彼らは二人ともこちらを見る。","en":"At the sound of <tips=10>Michio</tips> opening the door, they both looked their way.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r92","rowIndex":92,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"（あ、美人）","en":"Oh. She’s beautiful.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r93","rowIndex":93,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　こういう場合やはり異性の方に先に視線がゆくもので、少女の顔を見た<tips=10>道夫</tips>と<tips=66>紺太</tips>はほとんど同時に同じ言葉を心のなかで呟いた。","en":"In such situations, the gaze naturally went first to the opposite sex. <tips=10>Michio</tips> and <tips=66>Konta</tips> thought precisely the same words at almost precisely the same moment.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r94","rowIndex":94,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　少女は事実整った顔立ちであった。西洋人形のようにまったく表情のない冷たい顔をしていたが、それがますます美貌を引き立てており、うぶな少年ならぞくりと背中に冷たいものを感じながらたちまち恋に落ちてしまいそうな容姿である。ただ、その目は金色に輝いており、否が応でも<tips=10>道夫</tips>たちの警戒心を呼び起こした。","en":"The girl was every bit as beautiful as they had thought. Her face was cold and utterly expressionless, like a porcelain doll's, yet that only made her beauty more striking. She was the sort of girl who could send a chill down an innocent boy's spine and make him fall in love on the spot. Her eyes, however, shone gold, and the sight instantly put <tips=10>Michio</tips> and Konta on their guard.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r95","rowIndex":95,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　振り返った少年も、少女に負けず劣らずの美しい容貌を持っていた。彼はその切れ長の目でこちらを見ると怪訝な表情をした。","en":"The boy who turned around was no less beautiful than the girl. He studied them through narrow eyes, his expression puzzled.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r96","rowIndex":96,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「お前が<tips=1>菅原亮</tips>だな」","en":"“You’re <tips=1>Ryo Sugawara</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r97","rowIndex":97,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　目的の人物にすぐ会えた興奮を抑えつつ<tips=10>道夫</tips>は低い声で問うと、相手は頷く。","en":"Suppressing his excitement at having found the person he sought so quickly, <tips=10>Michio</tips> put the question in a low voice. The other boy nodded.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r98","rowIndex":98,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　やはりこの少年が噂の<tips=1>菅原亮</tips>なのか。見た感じ相手に<tips=77>特質変異</tips>は見えず、サイキックかどうかは確認出来ない。華奢というほどではないが細身で、強そうにも見えない。","en":"So this really was the <tips=1>Ryo Sugawara</tips> they had heard about. Michio could see no <tips=77>trait mutation</tips>, and therefore could not tell whether Ryo was a psychic. He was slender without quite being frail and did not look particularly strong.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r99","rowIndex":99,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しかし<tips=10>道夫</tips>にとってはどこかで見覚えがある顔だった。","en":"Yet <tips=10>Michio</tips> felt that he had seen Ryo’s face somewhere before.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r100","rowIndex":100,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「おれが誰かわかるか」","en":"“Do you know who I am?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r101","rowIndex":101,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=10>道夫</tips>はそう言って黒い右腕を出して見せる。","en":"<tips=10>Michio</tips> held out his black right arm for Ryo to see.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r102","rowIndex":102,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=10>見土道夫</tips>だね」","en":"“<tips=10>Michio Mido</tips>, right?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r103","rowIndex":103,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>はこともなげに言い、","en":"<tips=1>Ryo</tips> answered as though it were nothing remarkable.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r104","rowIndex":104,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「お前のことは知ってる。たしか、燕町三丁目の大工の居候だっけ？　<tips=59>暗闇通り</tips>のガキどものリーダーだね。……ハイブリッドで、超能力は<tips=77>特質変異</tips>のある右腕による切断。趣味はTVアニメで、その時影響された技の名前をしょっちゅう自分の能力に借用する。隣の家に住む二つ年上の盲目の女性に片思いをしていて……」","en":"“I know about you. Let's see—you live with a carpenter in Tsubamecho 3-chome, don't you? You're the leader of the brats on <tips=59>Darkness Street</tips>. ...A hybrid. Your psychic power lets you sever things with your right arm, which bears a <tips=77>trait mutation</tips>. You like TV anime, and you're forever naming your power after whichever move has caught your fancy lately. You're secretly in love with the blind woman next door who's two years older than you...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r105","rowIndex":105,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「しっ、知りすぎだろ！」","en":"“Y-you know too much!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r106","rowIndex":106,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=10>道夫</tips>は慌てて遮る。そのうしろでは<tips=66>紺太</tips>が驚きを浮かべている。","en":"<tips=10>Michio</tips> cut him off in a panic. Behind him, <tips=66>Konta</tips> stared in surprise.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r107","rowIndex":107,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=10>道夫</tips>君って、ルーシーさんに片思いを……」","en":"“<tips=10>Michio</tips>, you’re in love with Lucy...?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r108","rowIndex":108,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=66>紺太</tips>のつぶやきを<tips=10>道夫</tips>は無視しながら、","en":"Ignoring <tips=66>Konta’s</tips> murmur, <tips=10>Michio</tips> said,","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r109","rowIndex":109,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ふん、おれのことを調べたというわけか。やっぱりお前もライバルのことが気になっていたんだな」","en":"“Hmph. So you’ve been investigating me. I knew you were interested in your rival too.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r110","rowIndex":110,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ただの風の噂だよ。……そっちの彼の噂も知ってるよ。<tips=66>田中紺太</tips>、あんたは……」","en":"“They’re only rumors I happened to hear. ...I’ve heard about your friend too. <tips=66>Konta Tanaka</tips>. You—”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r111","rowIndex":111,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「お、おれのことはどうでもいい」","en":"“N-never mind me.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r112","rowIndex":112,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうか」","en":"“All right.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r113","rowIndex":113,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼は興味なさそうに素っ気なく答えるとまた少女の方を振り返り、","en":"He answered curtly, with no sign of interest, then turned back toward the girl.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r114","rowIndex":114,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=55>松子</tips>は気にしないで食べなよ」","en":"“Don’t mind them, <tips=55>Matsuko</tips>. Keep eating.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r115","rowIndex":115,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その言葉に<tips=55>松子</tips>と呼ばれた少女は頷き、小さなスプーンでアイスを掬って口に入れる。甘いものを目の前にした女の子にしては無表情で、その動作もまるで機械仕掛けのようだった。","en":"The girl he had called <tips=55>Matsuko</tips> nodded, lifted a small spoonful of ice cream to her mouth, and ate it. She showed none of the delight one might expect from a girl presented with something sweet; even the movement of her hand seemed mechanical.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r116","rowIndex":116,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どんな味がする？」","en":"“What does it taste like?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r117","rowIndex":117,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「甘くて、冷たい」","en":"“Sweet and cold.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r118","rowIndex":118,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　少女は表情を変化させずにそう応える。","en":"The girl’s expression did not change as she answered.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r119","rowIndex":119,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「美味しい？」","en":"“Is it delicious?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r120","rowIndex":120,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……美味しいってどんな味？」","en":"“...What does ‘delicious’ taste like?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r121","rowIndex":121,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=55>松子</tips>は困ったように首をかたむける。<tips=1>亮</tips>は残念そうに溜息をつく。","en":"<tips=55>Matsuko</tips> tilted her head in apparent uncertainty. <tips=1>Ryo</tips> sighed, looking disappointed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r122","rowIndex":122,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「おい」","en":"“Hey.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r123","rowIndex":123,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　奇妙な二人のやりとりに、思わず見入っていた<tips=10>道夫</tips>は、そこで我に返って呼びかける。","en":"Having found himself absorbed in the strange exchange between them, <tips=10>Michio</tips> came to his senses and called out.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r124","rowIndex":124,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「準備中の札がかかってたろ？　今はなんの料理も出せないよ。店主が昼寝をしているんだ」","en":"“You saw the CLOSED sign, didn’t you? We can’t serve you anything right now. The owner is taking a nap.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r125","rowIndex":125,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>は背中を向けたままそう告げる。","en":"<tips=1>Ryo</tips> told him this without turning around.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r126","rowIndex":126,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「おれは客として来たんじゃない。お前に用があって来たんだ」","en":"“I didn’t come as a customer. I came because I have business with you.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r127","rowIndex":127,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=10>道夫</tips>の言葉に、<tips=1>亮</tips>は眉間にしわを寄せ、いかにも面倒だという態度を露わにしながら振り向いた。","en":"At <tips=10>Michio’s</tips> words, <tips=1>Ryo</tips> turned around with a furrowed brow and made no effort to hide what a nuisance he found this.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r128","rowIndex":128,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=1>菅原亮</tips>。お前は<tips=58>パラシュート通り</tips>の悪餓鬼どものボスだ。そしておれは<tips=59>暗闇通り</tips>を仕切っている。これから二人でどっちが強いか決着をつけよう。そして勝った方が相手のチームを奪うんだ」","en":"“<tips=1>Ryo Sugawara</tips>. You’re the boss of the little hellions on <tips=58>Parachute Street</tips>, and I run <tips=59>Darkness Street</tips>. You and I are going to settle which of us is stronger. The winner takes the loser’s team.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r129","rowIndex":129,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>は眉の片方をつり上げて怪訝な表情をする。しかし、驚いたのは彼だけではない。","en":"<tips=1>Ryo</tips> raised one eyebrow, looking perplexed. But he was not the only one taken by surprise.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r130","rowIndex":130,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「み、<tips=10>道夫</tips>君、そんなの聞いてないよ。どうして偵察のはずが挨拶になって、決闘になるのさ」","en":"“M-<tips=10>Michio</tips>, you never said anything about this! How did reconnaissance turn into an introduction and then into a duel?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r131","rowIndex":131,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=10>道夫</tips>は無情にも<tips=66>紺太</tips>の言葉を無視する。","en":"<tips=10>Michio</tips> heartlessly ignored <tips=66>Konta’s</tips> protest.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r132","rowIndex":132,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なあ<tips=1>菅原</tips>よ。お前はギャングが好きか？」","en":"“Hey, <tips=1>Sugawara</tips>. Do you like gangs?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r133","rowIndex":133,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ギャングは嫌いだ。それで？」","en":"“I hate gangs. So?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r134","rowIndex":134,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>は即答し、冷たい視線で<tips=10>道夫</tips>の顔を見つめる。","en":"<tips=1>Ryo</tips> answered at once and stared coldly into <tips=10>Michio’s</tips> face.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r135","rowIndex":135,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「じゃあ、わかるだろ？　今この街は、お前がやっつけた周みたいな、ギャングとつるんだアホが餓鬼の世界を仕切ってる。そのせいで、ろくでもないことが沢山起きてるだろ？　おれは、この状況が納得出来ないんだ。それを変えたいと思っている。だが、そのためには戦力が必要なんだよ。だからおれは今、仲間と一緒にあちこちに出向いて、いろんなボスと決闘をしたり、戦争をして仲間を増やしているところなのさ」","en":"“Then you get it, don't you? Right now, idiots mixed up with gangs—like that Zhou you beat—are running the kids' world in this town. That's why all this rotten stuff keeps happening. I can't accept things the way they are. I want to change them. But I need more people behind me if I'm going to do that. So my friends and I have been going all over the place, challenging different bosses to duels and fighting wars to bring their people over to our side.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r136","rowIndex":136,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「戦争とは大げさだな」","en":"“Calling it war is a little grandiose.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r137","rowIndex":137,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>は溜息をつく。","en":"<tips=1>Ryo</tips> sighed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r138","rowIndex":138,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「実際戦争だよ。命がけなんだ」","en":"“It really is a war. Our lives are on the line.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r139","rowIndex":139,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まあ、なんでもいいさ。とにかく、お前は僕に決闘を挑んで<tips=58>パラシュート通り</tips>を縄張りにしようってわけだね？」","en":"“Call it whatever you want. In any case, you’re challenging me to a duel so you can make <tips=58>Parachute Street</tips> your territory, right?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r140","rowIndex":140,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうだ。おれとお前、一対一で戦うんだ。そして勝った方が負けた方のチームを吸収する。おれはこの虎の目の力も、超能力も使わない。この身体だけで戦ってやる。だからお前も素手で立ち向かってこい。男同士のプライドをかけた決闘だぜ。さあ、わかったなら今すぐ表に出ろ！」","en":"“Exactly. You and me, one on one. The winner absorbs the loser’s team. I won’t use the power of my Tiger’s Eye or any psychic ability. I’ll fight you with this body alone, so you come at me bare-handed too. This is a duel with our pride as men on the line. Now that you understand, get outside!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r141","rowIndex":141,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=10>道夫</tips>は興奮して高らかに宣言をするが、<tips=1>亮</tips>は対照的にさも億劫そうに頭をかいてから、","en":"Thrumming with excitement, <tips=10>Michio</tips> delivered this declaration at the top of his voice. <tips=1>Ryo</tips>, by contrast, scratched his head as though the whole business were an intolerable bother, then said:","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r142","rowIndex":142,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「断る。だから……」","en":"“I refuse. So—”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r143","rowIndex":143,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　言おうとしたその言葉を<tips=10>道夫</tips>はむきになって遮った。","en":"Suddenly indignant, <tips=10>Michio</tips> cut him off before he could finish.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r144","rowIndex":144,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「おい、逃げる気か？　よく考えろ。お前が拒否すればチーム同士の戦争になる。そしたら、けが人が沢山出てやつらにつけこまれる隙を作ることに……」","en":"“Are you planning to run? Think carefully. If you refuse, our teams go to war. A lot of people will get hurt, and that’ll give those gangs the opening they need to—”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r145","rowIndex":145,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうじゃない。話をきけよ」","en":"“That’s not what I mean. Listen to me.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r146","rowIndex":146,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>は溜息をつくと、","en":"<tips=1>Ryo</tips> sighed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r147","rowIndex":147,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「決闘なんかしない。僕の負けでいい。お前にチームは譲るから帰ってもらおうか」","en":"“I’m not going to duel you. You win. I’ll give you the team, so will you please go home?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r148","rowIndex":148,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「はあ？」","en":"“What?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r149","rowIndex":149,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=10>道夫</tips>は口をあんぐりと開いて問い返す。","en":"<tips=10>Michio</tips> gaped at him and asked again.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r150","rowIndex":150,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いいかい？　僕は別にリーダーでもなんでもないんだ。このあたりを<tips=57>滑走路通り</tips>の馬鹿がうろついてムカついたから、別の馬鹿を集めて追い払っただけさ。そうしたら、馬鹿たちがおかしな感じにまつりあげてきて迷惑してる。挙げ句の果てにはお前らみたいな馬鹿の総大将が家まで押しかけてきやがった。一体この馬鹿騒ぎはなんだ？　ほっといてくれ」","en":"“Listen. I’m not anybody’s leader. Some idiots from <tips=57>Runway Street</tips> kept wandering around here and pissing me off, so I gathered some other idiots and chased them away. Then those idiots started holding me up as something special, and it’s been nothing but trouble. And now, to top it all off, the chief idiot of the whole lot—you—has barged into my house. What is this whole idiotic circus? Leave me alone.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r151","rowIndex":151,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　――この<tips=1>菅原亮</tips>という人間がどういった人物なのかまだはっきりとは掴めないが、仲間も敵もひっくるめて「馬鹿」と連呼するところをみると、性格が相当悪いのは間違いない。","en":"—It was still difficult to say exactly what sort of person <tips=1>Ryo Sugawara</tips> might be, but the way he indiscriminately called friend and foe alike “idiots” left no doubt that he had a thoroughly unpleasant personality.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r152","rowIndex":152,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=10>道夫</tips>も<tips=66>紺太</tips>も同時にそう理解した。","en":"<tips=10>Michio</tips> and <tips=66>Konta</tips> reached that conclusion at the same moment.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r153","rowIndex":153,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ねえ、僕は暴力は嫌いなんだ。最低最悪の解決方法だからね。ガキとギャングは程度が低いからすぐこの原始的な解決方法に頼ろうとする。もううんざりだ」","en":"“I hate violence. It's the lowest, most wretched way to solve anything. Brats and gangsters are too base to know better, so they reach for that primitive solution at the first opportunity. I've had enough of it.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r154","rowIndex":154,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「お前もガキじゃないか」","en":"“You’re a kid too.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r155","rowIndex":155,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=10>道夫</tips>はそう呟くが、<tips=1>亮</tips>は気にせず、すまし顔で続ける。","en":"<tips=10>Michio</tips> muttered the objection, but <tips=1>Ryo</tips> ignored him and continued with perfect composure.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r156","rowIndex":156,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「だから、お前がみんなのリーダーを引き受けてくれるならこれほど嬉しいことはない。よろこんで譲るから、それで<tips=9>Y地区</tips>の統一をするなり、日本の大番長になるなり、好きにやってくれ」","en":"“So if you’re willing to be everyone’s leader, nothing could make me happier. I’ll gladly hand it over. Go unite <tips=9>Y District</tips>, become Japan’s Supreme Delinquent Boss, or do whatever you like.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r157","rowIndex":157,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「な、なんて卑怯なやつだ！」","en":"“Y-you coward!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r158","rowIndex":158,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=10>道夫</tips>は言って、どんと拳で傍らの壁を叩く。すると、上の方に画鋲で貼りつけられた品書きのボール紙が揺れる。","en":"<tips=10>Michio</tips> slammed his fist against the wall beside him. A cardboard menu pinned higher up with thumbtacks shook from the impact.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r159","rowIndex":159,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「見損なったぞ<tips=1>菅原亮</tips>！　お前には情熱がないのか！」","en":"“You’ve disappointed me, <tips=1>Ryo Sugawara</tips>! Don’t you have any passion?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r160","rowIndex":160,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ない」","en":"“No.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r161","rowIndex":161,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>は苦々しい表情で荒ぶる<tips=10>道夫</tips>を眺めながら、","en":"<tips=1>Ryo</tips> regarded the raging <tips=10>Michio</tips> with a sour expression.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r162","rowIndex":162,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「お前は暴力のことを一種のスポーツみたいに考えているようだけど、僕はそんなふうには解釈できない。くだらない殴り合いなんかしたくないんだよ。僕は一人で好きなことについて考えていたり、この子と遊んでいた方がずっと楽しい。……そろそろ美味しいって感覚がわかってきた？」","en":"“You seem to think of violence as a kind of sport, but I can’t see it that way. I don’t want any part of some pointless fistfight. I have much more fun sitting by myself and thinking about things I like, or playing with her. ...Have you started to understand what ‘delicious’ feels like yet?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r163","rowIndex":163,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ううん」","en":"“No.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r164","rowIndex":164,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>の問いかけに、少女は首を左右に振る。","en":"The girl shook her head in answer to <tips=1>Ryo’s</tips> question.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r165","rowIndex":165,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=10>道夫</tips>は言い返したいが、すぐに言葉が浮かんで来ずに、二人のやりとりを睨み付けている。","en":"<tips=10>Michio</tips> wanted to argue back, but no ready retort came to mind. All he could do was glare as the two of them resumed their exchange.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r166","rowIndex":166,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そっか。お腹がすいていてもダメか。まだ<tips=55>松子</tips>には早かったかな……」","en":"“I see. So even being hungry wasn't enough. Maybe <tips=55>Matsuko</tips> still wasn't ready for this...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r167","rowIndex":167,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>は残念そうに言うと、空になった少女の食器を持って立ち上がった。","en":"Looking disappointed, <tips=1>Ryo</tips> took the girl’s empty dish and rose.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r168","rowIndex":168,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「お、おい、どこへ行く気だ！」","en":"“H-Hey! Where do you think you’re going?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r169","rowIndex":169,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=10>道夫</tips>は慌てて呼び止めた。","en":"<tips=10>Michio</tips> hurriedly called him back.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r170","rowIndex":170,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「食器の片付けと、それから食事の用意をしようと思ってね。僕らはまだ昼食をとっていないんだ」","en":"“To put the dishes away, then get lunch started. We haven’t eaten yet.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r171","rowIndex":171,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「こっちの話はまだ終わっていない」","en":"“We’re not finished talking.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r172","rowIndex":172,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=10>道夫</tips>が食い下がると、<tips=1>亮</tips>は苛立ちを浮かべてきっと睨み、","en":"When <tips=10>Michio</tips> persisted, <tips=1>Ryo’s</tips> face hardened with irritation, and he glared sharply at him.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r173","rowIndex":173,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それはお前の都合だろ？　こっちにはこっちの都合がある。静かに午後を過ごしているところに土足で入ってきたお前らにここまでつき合ってやったんだから少しは譲れよ。それとも、<tips=10>見土道夫</tips>というやつは、偉そうな口をきくわりに最低限の礼儀も知らないのか？」","en":"“That’s your business, isn’t it? We have plans of our own. You barged in on our quiet afternoon, and I’ve humored you this far, so learn to compromise a little. Or is <tips=10>Michio Mido</tips> the sort of person who talks big without knowing even the bare minimum of manners?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r174","rowIndex":174,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　これまで穏やかな口調で対応していた<tips=1>亮</tips>の突然の怒りに、<tips=10>道夫</tips>は思わず気圧され、","en":"<tips=1>Ryo</tips> had answered calmly until then. The sudden anger in his voice took <tips=10>Michio</tips> aback.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r175","rowIndex":175,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「お、おう。飯くらい好きに食えよ。その子も腹が空いているだろう」","en":"“O-okay. Go ahead and eat, then. She must be hungry too.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r176","rowIndex":176,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　不覚にもそう返事をしてしまった。","en":"Before he quite realized what he was doing, Michio had agreed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r177","rowIndex":177,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ありがとう」","en":"“Thank you.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r178","rowIndex":178,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　すると<tips=1>亮</tips>は微笑を残し、空の食器をカウンターに上げるとその場を去ってゆく。","en":"<tips=1>Ryo</tips> gave him a faint smile, placed the empty dish upon the counter, and disappeared into the back.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r179","rowIndex":179,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=10>道夫</tips>は想像していたのとは大分違う<tips=1>菅原亮</tips>という人間に戸惑い、苦い顔をする。","en":"<tips=1>Ryo Sugawara</tips> was nothing like the person <tips=10>Michio</tips> had imagined, and Michio could only grimace in bewilderment.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r180","rowIndex":180,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どうする？　出直す？」","en":"“What do we do? Come back another time?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"紺太（少年時代）","displayName":"Konta (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r181","rowIndex":181,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=66>紺太</tips>が困って訊ねても、","en":"<tips=66>Konta</tips> asked uncertainly.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r182","rowIndex":182,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いや……」","en":"“No...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫（少年時代）","displayName":"Michio Mido (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r183","rowIndex":183,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　と困惑しつつ、生返事をするのが精一杯だった。","en":"Still bewildered, Michio could only muster a noncommittal reply.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r184","rowIndex":184,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「チームをくれるって本当かな？　そんな話って本当にあると思う？」","en":"“Do you think he really means it about giving us his team? Can something like that actually happen?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"紺太（少年時代）","displayName":"Konta (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r185","rowIndex":185,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=66>紺太</tips>はひそひそ声で<tips=10>道夫</tips>にそう尋ねる。","en":"<tips=66>Konta</tips> asked <tips=10>Michio</tips> in a whisper.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r186","rowIndex":186,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「嘘をついているようには思えないけれど……」","en":"“He didn’t seem to be lying, but...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫（少年時代）","displayName":"Michio Mido (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r187","rowIndex":187,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=10>道夫</tips>が顎に手を当てて考えていると、目の前にいる<tips=55>松子</tips>と目が合ってしまう。","en":"As <tips=10>Michio</tips> stood thinking with a hand to his chin, he happened to meet the eyes of <tips=55>Matsuko</tips>, who sat directly before him.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r188","rowIndex":188,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　アイスクリームがなくなって手持ち無沙汰になった彼女は、そこに座ったままじっと<tips=10>道夫</tips>たちを見つめていた。相変わらず無表情で、クスリともしない。目が金色だが雰囲気からすると発症しているわけでもなさそうだ。","en":"Now that the ice cream was gone and she had nothing to occupy her, she remained seated, staring fixedly at <tips=10>Michio</tips> and Konta. Her face was as blank as ever, without the slightest hint of a smile. Her eyes were gold, yet nothing in her demeanor suggested that she was in the midst of an episode.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r189","rowIndex":189,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　かといって、さっきの<tips=1>亮</tips>とのやりとりは表情を見る限り普通の少女にも見えない。","en":"Yet judging by her responses to <tips=1>Ryo</tips> during their earlier exchange, she did not seem like an ordinary girl either.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r190","rowIndex":190,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「お前はいったい<tips=1>菅原</tips>の……」","en":"“What exactly are you to <tips=1>Sugawara</tips>...?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫（少年時代）","displayName":"Michio Mido (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r191","rowIndex":191,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　聞こうとしたところで、奥の戸がガラガラと開いて<tips=1>亮</tips>が帰って来た。","en":"Michio was about to ask when a door in the back rattled open and <tips=1>Ryo</tips> returned.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r192","rowIndex":192,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼はその手に首を落とされ羽をむしられた一羽の鶏を掴んでいる。","en":"In one hand, he carried a chicken whose head had been removed and feathers plucked.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r193","rowIndex":193,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まだいたんだ」","en":"“You’re still here.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮（少年時代）","displayName":"Tse Leung (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r194","rowIndex":194,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　入り口の方で佇んでいる二人に一瞬だけ視線をやってからそう言うと、そのままカウンターの内側の調理場の方に足を踏み入れて、白く大きなまな板の上にその鶏をドサリと置いた。","en":"After casting a single glance at the two boys standing by the entrance and saying this, Ryo stepped behind the counter into the kitchen and set the chicken down with a heavy thump upon a large white cutting board.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r195","rowIndex":195,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まるごとかよ」","en":"“The whole bird?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫（少年時代）","displayName":"Michio Mido (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r196","rowIndex":196,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=10>道夫</tips>が思わず言うと、","en":"When <tips=10>Michio</tips> blurted that out,","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r197","rowIndex":197,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「昨日裏でしめたんだ」","en":"“I slaughtered it out back yesterday,”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮（少年時代）","displayName":"Tse Leung (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r198","rowIndex":198,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>は白いエプロンを着けながらそう返した。","en":"<tips=1>Ryo</tips> replied as he put on a white apron.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r199","rowIndex":199,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「お前が料理するのか？」","en":"“You’re going to cook?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫（少年時代）","displayName":"Michio Mido (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r200","rowIndex":200,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうだよ。大量に出来ちゃうからどうしようかと思ってたんだけど、お前らも食べる？　そんなに時間はかからないけど」","en":"“That's right. One whole bird makes more than I know what to do with, anyway. Do you two want some? It shouldn't take long.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮（少年時代）","displayName":"Tse Leung (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r201","rowIndex":201,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>は手にハンドソープをつけ入念に洗いながら訊ねる。","en":"<tips=1>Ryo</tips> asked while meticulously washing his hands with soap.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r202","rowIndex":202,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あ、うん」","en":"“Uh, sure.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫（少年時代）","displayName":"Michio Mido (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r203","rowIndex":203,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「じゃあそこのテーブルに座ってなよ」","en":"“Then sit at that table.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮（少年時代）","displayName":"Tse Leung (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r204","rowIndex":204,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「す、すまん」","en":"“Th-thanks.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫（少年時代）","displayName":"Michio Mido (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r205","rowIndex":205,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　言われたとおり<tips=10>道夫</tips>と<tips=66>紺太</tips>は<tips=55>松子</tips>の正面に腰掛けた。","en":"As directed, <tips=10>Michio</tips> and <tips=66>Konta</tips> took seats across from <tips=55>Matsuko</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r206","rowIndex":206,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>は業務用の巨大なコンロに火をつけると、中華鍋の揚げ油を温め、その間に鶏にとりかかる。彼の包丁を扱う手つきは慣れたもので、鶏の形をしていたものはあっというまに解体され、肉の塊に切り分けられる。","en":"<tips=1>Ryo</tips> lit one of the enormous commercial burners and set a wok of frying oil over it to heat, then turned his attention to the chicken. His knife work was practiced and sure. In moments, what had once been recognizably a bird was dismantled into neat pieces of meat.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r207","rowIndex":207,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まるでプロみたいだ。すごいなあ」","en":"“You’re like a professional. That’s amazing.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"紺太（少年時代）","displayName":"Konta (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r208","rowIndex":208,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=66>紺太</tips>が背筋を伸ばして<tips=1>亮</tips>の手さばきに見惚れている。","en":"<tips=66>Konta</tips> straightened his back and watched <tips=1>Ryo’s</tips> hands in fascination.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r209","rowIndex":209,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　一方隣の<tips=10>道夫</tips>は仏頂面である。","en":"<tips=10>Michio</tips>, sitting beside him, wore a sullen expression.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r210","rowIndex":210,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「おい、なんでおれたちはここで<tips=1>菅原亮</tips>の料理を待っているんだ？　おれはやつと戦いに来たんだぞ？」","en":"“Hey. Why are we sitting here waiting for <tips=1>Ryo Sugawara</tips> to cook for us? I came here to fight him.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫（少年時代）","displayName":"Michio Mido (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r211","rowIndex":211,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そんなのおれに言われたって困るよ。<tips=10>道夫</tips>君がうんって言って座ったんだろ。……あ、良い匂いがしてきた。そういえばおれも昼食べてないんだよなあ」","en":"“What do you expect me to say? You’re the one who said yes and sat down, <tips=10>Michio</tips>. ...Oh, it’s starting to smell good. Come to think of it, I haven’t eaten lunch either.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"紺太（少年時代）","displayName":"Konta (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r212","rowIndex":212,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=66>紺太</tips>はもう<tips=10>道夫</tips>が語る話よりも、これからどんな料理が出来上がるかの方に完全に興味がうつっているようだ。","en":"<tips=66>Konta</tips> now seemed far more interested in what sort of food was about to emerge than in anything <tips=10>Michio</tips> had to say.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r213","rowIndex":213,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=10>道夫</tips>は腕組みをして今の状況を考える。","en":"<tips=10>Michio</tips> folded his arms and considered his present situation.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r214","rowIndex":214,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　こちらは決闘を申し込み、相手はそれを拒否して、こちらの条件をのんだ。つまり、チームをくれるというのだ。ということは、もう争う理由はないということになる。対立関係ではないとすれば、ここで食事をご馳走になるのもなにもおかしくはない。","en":"They had challenged Ryo to a duel; he had refused and accepted their terms. In other words, he would give them the team. That meant there was no reason left to fight. If they were no longer adversaries, there was nothing strange about accepting a meal from him.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r215","rowIndex":215,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そのはずなのだけれども、どうも感情が納得出来ない。こんな簡単でいいのだろうか？　自分が、そして街のちょっと悪い子供たちが青春を賭けているこの戦いが、こんなにあっさり決着していいのだろうか？","en":"That was how it ought to be, yet Michio could not make his feelings accept it. Could it really be this easy? Could the struggle on which he—and every slightly wayward child in the city—had staked his youth truly be settled so unceremoniously?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r216","rowIndex":216,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　いや、もめ事なく決着付けばそれはそれでいい。そのはずなのだが、なんだろうこの心の収まりのつかない感じは。もしかして自分の心が求めているのは、自分が頭で考えているものとは違うのか？","en":"No, an end without conflict ought to be welcome. He knew that. So what was this feeling that refused to settle within him? Could what his heart desired differ from what he thought he wanted?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r217","rowIndex":217,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「うーん……」","en":"“Hmm...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫（少年時代）","displayName":"Michio Mido (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r218","rowIndex":218,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　考え込んでいると、また<tips=55>松子</tips>と目が合った。","en":"As he brooded, he met <tips=55>Matsuko’s</tips> eyes once again.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r219","rowIndex":219,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「何か用か？」","en":"“Do you need something?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫（少年時代）","displayName":"Michio Mido (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r220","rowIndex":220,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「頭でも痛いのか？　鎮痛剤あるぞ」","en":"“Does your head hurt? We have painkillers.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐松子（少女）","displayName":"Matsuko Shio (Girl)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r221","rowIndex":221,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=55>松子</tips>は無表情だが心配してくれているようだ。","en":"<tips=55>Matsuko</tips> remained expressionless, but she appeared to be concerned for him.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r222","rowIndex":222,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いや、違うんだ……今ちょっと自分というものを探求していたんだ」","en":"“No, that’s not it... I was just exploring the nature of my own existence.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫（少年時代）","displayName":"Michio Mido (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r223","rowIndex":223,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そう」","en":"“I see.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐松子（少女）","displayName":"Matsuko Shio (Girl)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r224","rowIndex":224,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=55>松子</tips>は素っ気なく言い、そしてあくびをした。","en":"<tips=55>Matsuko</tips> answered curtly, then yawned.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r225","rowIndex":225,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「お待たせ。大皿で悪いね」","en":"“Sorry to keep you waiting. And sorry it’s all on one platter.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮（少年時代）","displayName":"Tse Leung (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r226","rowIndex":226,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>は出来上がった料理を食卓の上に置く。","en":"<tips=1>Ryo</tips> placed the finished dishes upon the table.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r227","rowIndex":227,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　一番大きな皿に盛られているのは、色良く揚がった鶏に、長葱のたっぷり入ったあんがかかったものだ。","en":"The largest platter held beautifully browned fried chicken smothered in a thick sauce laden with sliced scallions.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r228","rowIndex":228,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その隣の中くらいの皿にはキュウリと茄子の漬物が盛られている。そして、一人一人にわかめと卵の入った透明なスープと白米の椀が配られた。","en":"Beside it, a medium-sized plate held pickled cucumbers and eggplant. Each person also received a bowl of clear soup with wakame and egg, and another of white rice.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r229","rowIndex":229,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「これ、から揚げか？」","en":"“Is this karaage?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"紺太（少年時代）","displayName":"Konta (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r230","rowIndex":230,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　もうすっかりここに来た理由を忘れた<tips=66>紺太</tips>が目を輝かせて訊ねる。","en":"Having completely forgotten why he had come, <tips=66>Konta</tips> asked with shining eyes.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r231","rowIndex":231,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「油淋鶏。まあ似たようなもんだけど」","en":"“Yurinchi. It’s fairly similar.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮（少年時代）","displayName":"Tse Leung (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r232","rowIndex":232,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「へえ、良い匂いがするな。……食っていいのか？」","en":"“Oh, it smells great. ...We can really eat it?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"紺太（少年時代）","displayName":"Konta (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r233","rowIndex":233,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ああ、冷めないうちに食ってくれ」","en":"“Of course. Eat before it gets cold.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮（少年時代）","displayName":"Tse Leung (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r234","rowIndex":234,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いただきまーす！」","en":"“Let’s eat!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"紺太（少年時代）","displayName":"Konta (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r235","rowIndex":235,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=66>紺太</tips>は箸を右手に、白米のよそわれた茶碗を左手に取り、真っ先に大皿の鶏に手をつける。","en":"<tips=66>Konta</tips> took his chopsticks in his right hand and the bowl of white rice in his left, then helped himself to the chicken before anything else.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r236","rowIndex":236,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いただきます」","en":"“Thank you for the food.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐松子（少女）","displayName":"Matsuko Shio (Girl)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r237","rowIndex":237,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=55>松子</tips>も丁寧に手を合わせてそう言ってから、食事をはじめる。","en":"<tips=55>Matsuko</tips> carefully placed her hands together as she spoke, then began to eat.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r238","rowIndex":238,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……食べないのか？」","en":"“...Aren’t you eating?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮（少年時代）","displayName":"Tse Leung (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r239","rowIndex":239,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして自分も食べ始めようとした<tips=1>亮</tips>だったが、箸を目の前に置いたまま動かない<tips=10>道夫</tips>に気づくと、そう尋ねた。","en":"<tips=1>Ryo</tips> was about to begin his own meal when he noticed <tips=10>Michio</tips> sitting motionless with his chopsticks before him.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r240","rowIndex":240,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いや、もらうよ。いただきます」","en":"“No, I’ll eat. Thank you for the food.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫（少年時代）","displayName":"Michio Mido (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r241","rowIndex":241,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=10>道夫</tips>は複雑な表情で箸を手に取ると、小さめの油淋鶏をひとつつまみ、いつもの食卓での癖で白米の上にちょんと一度触れさせてから口に運ぶ。","en":"With a conflicted look, <tips=10>Michio</tips> picked up his chopsticks. Out of habit, he selected one of the smaller pieces of yurinchi, dabbed it once against his rice, and put it in his mouth.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r242","rowIndex":242,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　多めの長葱が入った甘酸っぱいタレが、サクサクと食感良くあがった鶏と馴染んでおり、しかも少し濃い目の味付けが白米とよくあった。","en":"The sweet-and-sour sauce, full of scallions, married perfectly with the crisp, beautifully fried chicken, while its slightly stronger seasoning made it an ideal accompaniment to rice.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r243","rowIndex":243,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「旨い。旨いなあ」","en":"“Man, this is good. Really good.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"紺太（少年時代）","displayName":"Konta (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r244","rowIndex":244,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　隣の<tips=66>紺太</tips>は無邪気に褒めているが、<tips=10>道夫</tips>はそんな風に率直に感想を口にする気にはなれない。","en":"<tips=66>Konta</tips> praised it with innocent delight, but <tips=10>Michio</tips> could not bring himself to say how he felt so openly.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r245","rowIndex":245,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なあ<tips=1>菅原</tips>」","en":"“Listen, <tips=1>Sugawara</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫（少年時代）","displayName":"Michio Mido (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r246","rowIndex":246,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　相変わらず<tips=55>松子</tips>の食べる様子ばかり気にしながら食事をしている<tips=1>亮</tips>にそう声をかけた。","en":"He called to <tips=1>Ryo</tips>, who, as ever, was eating with nearly all his attention fixed on <tips=55>Matsuko</tips> and the way she ate.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r247","rowIndex":247,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「さっきの話本当か？」","en":"“Did you mean what you said earlier?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫（少年時代）","displayName":"Michio Mido (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r248","rowIndex":248,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「何？」","en":"“What part?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮（少年時代）","displayName":"Tse Leung (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r249","rowIndex":249,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「チームを譲るって話だよ」","en":"“About giving me the team.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫（少年時代）","displayName":"Michio Mido (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r250","rowIndex":250,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「もちろんだ。僕はそういうくだらない嘘はつかない」","en":"“Of course. I don’t tell petty lies like that.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮（少年時代）","displayName":"Tse Leung (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r251","rowIndex":251,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「だって、そんな簡単なものじゃないだろ？」","en":"“But it can’t be that simple, can it?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫（少年時代）","displayName":"Michio Mido (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r252","rowIndex":252,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「大丈夫。混乱せずにちゃんとお前が引き継げるように、うまくみんなに伝えておく。心配しなくていいよ。チョロいもんなんだからさ」","en":"“It’ll be fine. I’ll explain it properly to everyone so you can take over without any confusion. Don’t worry. It’ll be a cinch.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮（少年時代）","displayName":"Tse Leung (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r253","rowIndex":253,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>はにこりともせずに説明をする。","en":"<tips=1>Ryo</tips> explained this without the slightest smile.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r254","rowIndex":254,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その冷淡な態度が<tips=10>道夫</tips>には理解が出来ない。","en":"<tips=10>Michio</tips> could not understand that cold attitude.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r255","rowIndex":255,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「おれが簡単じゃないって言ってるのは、そういう意味じゃない。みんなをおびやかしていた周をやっつけて、みんなに認められてリーダーになったんだろ？　それを、こんな、裏切りじゃないか？」","en":"“That’s not what I meant when I said it wasn’t so simple. You beat Zhou, the man who’d been terrorizing everyone, and they recognized you as their leader, didn’t they? You can’t just hand them over like this. Isn’t that betraying them?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫（少年時代）","displayName":"Michio Mido (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r256","rowIndex":256,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「説教をしたいのか？」","en":"“Are you trying to lecture me?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮（少年時代）","displayName":"Tse Leung (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r257","rowIndex":257,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>は眉間にしわをよせ、","en":"Furrowing his brow, <tips=1>Ryo</tips> said:","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r258","rowIndex":258,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「だって、興味がないんだから仕方がないだろ。それとも、ガキどもを空き地に並べて集会でもして、ああこいつらが自分の子分なんだなあってニヤニヤすればいいのか？　それとも、立場を利用して人に威張り散らかしたらいいのか？　世間にはそういうのが好きな人間がいるのは知っているけれど、僕はゴメンだね」","en":"“I mean, I can’t help it if I’m not interested. Or am I supposed to line a bunch of brats up in a vacant lot for a meeting, then grin to myself, ‘Ah, so these are all my underlings’? Or use my position to lord it over people? I know some people enjoy that sort of thing, but count me out.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮（少年時代）","displayName":"Tse Leung (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r259","rowIndex":259,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「アイツ変わってるな。威張ったら楽しいと思うけどな……」","en":"“That guy’s weird. I think bossing people around would be fun...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"紺太（少年時代）","displayName":"Konta (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r260","rowIndex":260,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　横で呟く<tips=66>紺太</tips>。<tips=10>道夫</tips>はそれを無視して、","en":"<tips=66>Konta</tips> muttered beside him. Ignoring him, <tips=10>Michio</tips> said:","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r261","rowIndex":261,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そういう話をしてるんじゃない。お前は、おれたちの街を良くしようとは思わないのか？　このままじゃダメだろう？」","en":"“That’s not what we’re talking about. Don’t you want to make our city better? It can’t go on this way.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫（少年時代）","displayName":"Michio Mido (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r262","rowIndex":262,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「悪いけれど、世の中をよくするためとか、社会を変えるためとか、そういう気色の悪いお題目は全然好みじゃないんだ。まさかこの街でそんな夢みたいなことを言うやつが現れるとは思わなかったけどね」","en":"“Sorry, but repulsive slogans like ‘make the world a better place’ and ‘change society’ are not to my taste at all. I never expected anyone in this town to start spouting such pie-in-the-sky nonsense.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮（少年時代）","displayName":"Tse Leung (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r263","rowIndex":263,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「誰も言わないから、おれが言うしかなかったんだよ」","en":"“No one else would say it, so I had to.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫（少年時代）","displayName":"Michio Mido (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r264","rowIndex":264,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=10>道夫</tips>の言葉に、<tips=1>亮</tips>は溜息をついて、","en":"At <tips=10>Michio’s</tips> words, <tips=1>Ryo</tips> sighed, then said:","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r265","rowIndex":265,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そもそもさ、街を良くするってどういうことだ？　周みたいなやつらを一人残らず叩きのめしたって何も変わらないぞ。それとも、バックのギャングたちも相手にする気か？　ギャングを一人のこらず潰すなんて現実的じゃないし、そもそもこの街はそんなことを望んでいない。結局、世の中なんてのは、自分が望む形に勝手に変化してゆくものだ。<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>が英雄扱いされてるけど、あれだって本人の能力というより、街の空気にのっかっただけの凧みたいなもんだよ」","en":"“To begin with, what do you mean by making the city better? You could beat every last person like Zhou and nothing would change. Or do you plan to take on the gangs behind them too? Wiping out every gangster isn’t realistic, and this city doesn’t want that in the first place. In the end, the world changes of its own accord into the form it desires. <tips=3>Chris Tse</tips> may be treated like a hero, but that has less to do with his abilities than with his being a kite that simply caught the city’s prevailing wind.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮（少年時代）","displayName":"Tse Leung (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r266","rowIndex":266,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「お前の言いたいことがよくわからないが……とにかくおれは、自分に納得出来ないものは見過ごせないし、変えられるものは変えたいんだよ。それがそんなにおかしなことか？」","en":"“I don’t really understand what you’re trying to say... But I can’t overlook things I find unacceptable, and I want to change whatever I can. Is that so strange?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫（少年時代）","displayName":"Michio Mido (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r267","rowIndex":267,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「おかしいとは言わないよ。お前がそれで満足ならそうすればいい。でも僕は違うってだけだ」","en":"“I wouldn’t call it strange. If that’s what will satisfy you, go ahead. I’m only saying I’m not like that.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮（少年時代）","displayName":"Tse Leung (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r268","rowIndex":268,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>は苛立ちを抑えるようにこめかみの辺りを人差し指でおさえると、","en":"As if to rein in his irritation, <tips=1>Ryo</tips> pressed his index finger to his temple, then said:","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r269","rowIndex":269,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そもそも、何が不満なのさ。僕はお前が欲しいものをタダでくれてやると言っているんだぜ？　もうその話は終わりのはずだろう？」","en":"“What are you dissatisfied with, anyway? I’m telling you I’ll give you what you want for free, aren’t I? This discussion should be over already.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮（少年時代）","displayName":"Tse Leung (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r270","rowIndex":270,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それは、確かにそうなんだけれど……」","en":"“Well, you’re right about that, but...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫（少年時代）","displayName":"Michio Mido (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r271","rowIndex":271,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「じゃあこの話はやめよう。飯がまずくなる」","en":"“Then let’s stop talking about it. You’re making the food taste bad.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮（少年時代）","displayName":"Tse Leung (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r272","rowIndex":272,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そう言って<tips=1>亮</tips>が食事を再開したのを見て、<tips=10>道夫</tips>も黙って食べ始める。","en":"<tips=1>Ryo</tips> resumed his meal. Watching him, <tips=10>Michio</tips> also fell silent and began eating.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r273","rowIndex":273,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　全員が食べ終わる頃には<tips=1>亮</tips>が「父さん」と呼ぶこの店の主人が起きてきて、無言で調理場に入り道具の準備を始めた。","en":"By the time everyone had finished, the owner of the diner—the man <tips=1>Ryo</tips> called “Dad”—had gotten up. Without a word, he went into the kitchen and began preparing his tools.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r274","rowIndex":274,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　もうすぐ店を開けるというので、<tips=10>道夫</tips>と<tips=66>紺太</tips>は食器の片付けをして、店を出る。","en":"The diner was about to open. <tips=10>Michio</tips> and <tips=66>Konta</tips> cleared their dishes, then went outside.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r275","rowIndex":275,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　外は大分日が傾き、オレンジ色が町並みを染めていた。","en":"The sun now hung much lower, staining the cityscape orange.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r276","rowIndex":276,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なあ、おれ本当にお前のチームもらったのか？」","en":"“Hey. Is your team really mine now?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫（少年時代）","displayName":"Michio Mido (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r277","rowIndex":277,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=10>道夫</tips>がそう訊ねると、","en":"<tips=10>Michio</tips> asked.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r278","rowIndex":278,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうだよ。じゃあね」","en":"“That’s right. See you.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮（少年時代）","displayName":"Tse Leung (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r279","rowIndex":279,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>はそっけなく言い、","en":"<tips=1>Ryo</tips> answered curtly.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r280","rowIndex":280,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「さよなら」","en":"“Goodbye.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐松子（少女）","displayName":"Matsuko Shio (Girl)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r281","rowIndex":281,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その隣で<tips=55>松子</tips>も無表情に手を振る。","en":"Beside him, <tips=55>Matsuko</tips> also waved without changing her expression.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r282","rowIndex":282,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=10>道夫</tips>はやはりまだ納得がいっていなかったが、","en":"<tips=10>Michio</tips> was still far from satisfied.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r283","rowIndex":283,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ごちそうさま！」","en":"“Thanks for the meal!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"紺太（少年時代）","displayName":"Konta (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r284","rowIndex":284,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=66>紺太</tips>が満足げにそう挨拶をすると、","en":"<tips=66>Konta</tips> called out with satisfaction.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r285","rowIndex":285,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どうも、ごちそうさまでした……」","en":"“Uh, thank you very much for the meal...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫（少年時代）","displayName":"Michio Mido (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r286","rowIndex":286,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　つられてそう言ってしまった。","en":"Before he knew it, Michio had followed Konta’s example.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r287","rowIndex":287,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「良かったね。喧嘩しないで済んで」","en":"“Good thing we didn’t have to fight.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"紺太（少年時代）","displayName":"Konta (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r288","rowIndex":288,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　二人で並んで<tips=59>暗闇通り</tips>への道を歩いていると、<tips=66>紺太</tips>がそう話しかけてくる。","en":"As they walked side by side toward <tips=59>Darkness Street</tips>, <tips=66>Konta</tips> spoke to him.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r289","rowIndex":289,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「やっぱ、納得出来ない！」","en":"“I still can’t accept it!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫（少年時代）","displayName":"Michio Mido (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r290","rowIndex":290,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=10>道夫</tips>が思わず大きな声を出してしまうと、すぐそばで娼婦に交渉していた紳士が怪訝な顔で振り返る。","en":"<tips=10>Michio</tips> cried out before he could stop himself. A gentleman negotiating with a prostitute nearby turned and gave him a puzzled look.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r291","rowIndex":291,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　この辺りは、<tips=59>暗闇通り</tips>のような大きな通りでは商売が出来ない、個人経営の女や、わけありの女が路上に立って直接客と交渉をしている場所だった。","en":"The neighborhood catered to independent sex workers and women whose circumstances kept them from doing business on major thoroughfares such as <tips=59>Darkness Street</tips>. They stood along the road and negotiated directly with customers.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r292","rowIndex":292,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どうしてあいつはあんな素っ気ないんだ？　情熱がないのか？」","en":"“Why does he act so indifferent about everything? Doesn’t he have any passion?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫（少年時代）","displayName":"Michio Mido (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r293","rowIndex":293,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　さまざまな肌の色をした女が立つこの狭い路地は観光客にとっては刺激的なものだろうが、小さな時から見慣れた<tips=10>道夫</tips>たちにとっては当たり前の光景で、肌の露出が多い女たちに目もくれずに<tips=10>道夫</tips>はそう嘆く。","en":"To a tourist, this narrow alley lined with women of every complexion might have been a titillating sight. To <tips=10>Michio</tips> and the others, who had known it since childhood, it was simply part of the scenery. Without so much as glancing at the scantily clad women, <tips=10>Michio</tips> went on lamenting.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r294","rowIndex":294,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……まあ人は色々だよ。いいじゃない。あいつのことは忘れて次行こう。次。<tips=10>道夫</tips>君には、大きな夢があるんだからさ……」","en":"“...People are different. There’s nothing wrong with that. Forget about him and move on to the next one. The next one. You’ve got a big dream, <tips=10>Michio</tips>...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"紺太（少年時代）","displayName":"Konta (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r295","rowIndex":295,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=66>紺太</tips>はそうなだめるが、","en":"<tips=66>Konta</tips> tried to soothe him.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r296","rowIndex":296,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いーや、納得出来ないね！」","en":"“No! I can’t accept it!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫（少年時代）","displayName":"Michio Mido (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r297","rowIndex":297,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　やはり<tips=10>道夫</tips>は大きな声で否定する。","en":"<tips=10>Michio</tips> rejected the suggestion just as loudly as before.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r298","rowIndex":298,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ああ、<tips=10>道夫</tips>じゃないか。こんなところを歩いているなんて珍しいねえ。どうだい、遊んでいかないかい？」","en":"“Oh, if it isn’t <tips=10>Michio</tips>. It’s rare to see you walking around here. What do you say—want to have some fun?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r299","rowIndex":299,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　顔見知りの女が声をかけるが、興奮する<tips=10>道夫</tips>の耳には届かない。","en":"A woman he knew called to him, but <tips=10>Michio</tips> was too worked up to hear her.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r300","rowIndex":300,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どうして決闘を挑んだ相手にあんな対応が出来るんだ！　そしてチキンまでご馳走するなんてどういうことだ！　おれは食ってしまった！」","en":"“How can anyone act that way toward a person who challenged him to a duel? And then he even treated us to chicken! What was that supposed to mean? I ate it!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫（少年時代）","displayName":"Michio Mido (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r301","rowIndex":301,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「おれなんか、お母さんの分まで包んでもらっちゃったよ」","en":"“He even wrapped up some for me to take home to my mother.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"紺太（少年時代）","displayName":"Konta (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r302","rowIndex":302,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=66>紺太</tips>は言って苦笑する。げっぷをすると、まだあのタレのにおいがした。","en":"<tips=66>Konta</tips> spoke with a wry smile. When he burped, he could still smell the sauce.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r303","rowIndex":303,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まったく、なんて丁寧におもてなしをされちまったんだろう！　こちらも丁寧に、ごちそうさまでしたと言ってしまった！」","en":"“Honestly, what impeccable hospitality he showed us! And then I went and politely thanked him for the meal!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫（少年時代）","displayName":"Michio Mido (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r304","rowIndex":304,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=10>道夫</tips>は恋に悩むウェルテルのように大げさな仕草で頭をかかえた。","en":"<tips=10>Michio</tips> clutched his head in the extravagant manner of Werther tormented by love.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r305","rowIndex":305,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=10>道夫</tips>君は悪ぶってるけど意外と礼儀正しいからね」","en":"“You act tough, but <tips=10>you’re</tips> surprisingly well mannered.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"紺太（少年時代）","displayName":"Konta (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r306","rowIndex":306,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　満腹になりすっかり幸福になってしまった<tips=66>紺太</tips>は穏やかに言う。","en":"Full and thoroughly contented, <tips=66>Konta</tips> said placidly.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r307","rowIndex":307,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「しかも旨かった！　つまりこれは、やつに負けてしまったということだ！」","en":"“And it was good! Which means I lost to him!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫（少年時代）","displayName":"Michio Mido (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r308","rowIndex":308,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どうしてそうなるのさ」","en":"“How does that follow?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"紺太（少年時代）","displayName":"Konta (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r309","rowIndex":309,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　思わず笑ってしまう<tips=66>紺太</tips>の顔を、<tips=10>道夫</tips>は立ち止まってじっと見つめ、","en":"<tips=66>Konta</tips> could not help laughing. <tips=10>Michio</tips> stopped and stared intently at him.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r310","rowIndex":310,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=66>コンタ</tips>、おれはこのままじゃ引き下がれない。次こそちゃんとやつと決着をつける！」","en":"“<tips=66>Konta</tips>, I can’t back down like this. Next time, I’ll settle matters with him properly!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫（少年時代）","displayName":"Michio Mido (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r311","rowIndex":311,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「次って？　チームは譲ってくれるって言ったんだから決着をつける理由がないじゃないか」","en":"“Next time? He said he’d give you the team, so there’s nothing left to settle.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"紺太（少年時代）","displayName":"Konta (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r312","rowIndex":312,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「これじゃすっきりしない。ただで譲られるなんておれのプライドが許さないんだよ」","en":"“This doesn’t sit right with me. My pride won’t allow me to have it handed to me for nothing.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫（少年時代）","displayName":"Michio Mido (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r313","rowIndex":313,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=10>道夫</tips>は舌打ちをすると、また歩きはじめる。","en":"<tips=10>Michio</tips> clicked his tongue and began walking again.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r314","rowIndex":314,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……でも、美味しい料理ご馳走になっちゃったんだよ？」","en":"“...But he treated us to that delicious meal.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"紺太（少年時代）","displayName":"Konta (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r315","rowIndex":315,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=66>紺太</tips>は慌てて追いかける。","en":"<tips=66>Konta</tips> hurried after him.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r316","rowIndex":316,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あ、<tips=66>コンタ</tips>じゃないか。今日お前の母さんは仕事しないのか？」","en":"“Oh, if it isn’t <tips=66>Konta</tips>. Isn’t your mother working today?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r317","rowIndex":317,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そこに、すれ違おうとした中年男がそう声をかけて来る。","en":"A middle-aged man passing in the other direction called out to them.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r318","rowIndex":318,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あ、今日は休みなんで」","en":"“Oh, she’s off today,”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"紺太（少年時代）","displayName":"Konta (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r319","rowIndex":319,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　と<tips=66>紺太</tips>はそう答えてから、","en":"<tips=66>Konta</tips> replied, then—","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r320","rowIndex":320,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あんな親切にしてもらったのに、どうして喧嘩したいのさ」","en":"“After he was so kind to us, why do you still want to fight him?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"紺太（少年時代）","displayName":"Konta (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r321","rowIndex":321,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それとこれとは別だ」","en":"“That’s a separate matter.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫（少年時代）","displayName":"Michio Mido (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r322","rowIndex":322,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=10>道夫</tips>は仏頂面のまま首を振る。","en":"<tips=10>Michio</tips> shook his head, still sullen.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r323","rowIndex":323,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「おれ、<tips=1>菅原亮</tips>ってそんなに悪い奴じゃないような気がするな……」","en":"“I’m starting to think <tips=1>Ryo Sugawara</tips> might not be such a bad guy...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"紺太（少年時代）","displayName":"Konta (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r324","rowIndex":324,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なんだよ。お前、すっかりヤツに手懐けられてるじゃんか。安上がりなやつだな」","en":"“What? He’s already got you eating out of his hand. You’re easy to buy.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫（少年時代）","displayName":"Michio Mido (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r325","rowIndex":325,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「い、いや、それは……」","en":"“N-no, that’s not...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"紺太（少年時代）","displayName":"Konta (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r326","rowIndex":326,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しどろもどろになる<tips=66>紺太</tips>を横目でチラと見てから、<tips=10>道夫</tips>は親指の爪を忌々しげに噛み、","en":"<tips=10>Michio</tips> glanced sidelong at the stammering <tips=66>Konta</tips>, then bit his thumbnail in frustration.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r327","rowIndex":327,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=1>菅原亮</tips>……本当にむかつくヤツだぜ。くそ、新しい作戦を考えなきゃな」","en":"“<tips=1>Ryo Sugawara</tips>... He really gets on my nerves. Damn it. I’ll have to come up with a new scheme.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫（少年時代）","displayName":"Michio Mido (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:x12:r328","rowIndex":328,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そう呟き、さらに足を早めたのである。","en":"With that mutter, he quickened his pace still further.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}}]},{"position":59,"code":"X13","unitId":"X13","rows":[{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r1","rowIndex":1,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　燕町三丁目の大きな松がある屋敷と言えば、木村修吾の家として近所のものにはよく知られていた。","en":"The estate with the great pine in Tsubamecho 3-chome was well known throughout the neighborhood as the home of Shugo Kimura.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r2","rowIndex":2,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　木村は酒癖が悪いところを除けば他に欠点もない優れた大工で、彼に頼めばまず間違いがないと付近では評判だった。ひっきりなしに仕事が舞い込んでいたが、しかし生活振りはさほど派手とは言えなかった。","en":"Apart from being a bad drunk, Kimura was an excellent carpenter with scarcely a fault to his name. His neighbors said you could not go wrong hiring him. Work came pouring in, yet he lived with remarkably little extravagance.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r3","rowIndex":3,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　というのは金がないものからは金をとらず、かわりに安酒の一杯でもかまわないというような性質の人間であったため、ほとんど一銭にもならない仕事ともいえぬ雑用ばかりに追われていたからだ。","en":"The reason was that he was the sort of man who charged nothing to those without money and would just as happily accept a glass of cheap liquor instead. Consequently, most of his time went to odd jobs that hardly deserved the name and earned scarcely a penny.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r4","rowIndex":4,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼は連絡を受けるといつでも道具を持ってひょいひょいと一人で出かけてスラム街のボロ家にあがりこみ、雨漏りを直したり、外れたドアを取り付けたりして、そしてその報酬として臭い密造酒を浴びるほど飲んで真っ赤な顔で帰って来る。一週間のうち大体四日くらいはこのような調子であるのだから、金が貯まるはずもない。","en":"Whenever word reached him, he would pick up his tools and jauntily set off alone. He entered ramshackle homes in the slums, repaired leaking roofs and rehung fallen doors, then accepted stinking bootleg liquor as payment, drank it by the bucketful, and returned with his face bright red. He spent roughly four days out of every week this way, so naturally he never saved any money.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r5","rowIndex":5,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　酒の上での失敗も多く、暴力沙汰なども数えきれぬほど起こしていたが、憎めない人柄のせいか人々に愛されていた。ただ、いつもその後始末をする細君には、豪放磊落で知られた木村も終生頭が上がらなかったと言う。","en":"He made no end of drunken mistakes and started more violent altercations than anyone could count. Yet perhaps because it was impossible to dislike the man himself, people loved him. It was said that even Kimura, famous for his freewheeling, openhearted nature, never could stand up to the wife who always cleaned up his messes.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r6","rowIndex":6,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　こうした木村の性格は、当時彼の家で居候をしていた<tips=10>見土道夫</tips>にも大きな影響を与えたのは間違いがない。乱暴であるところや、弱いものに対する愛情、それから愛嬌のある人柄など、彼の性格の基礎となる部分が木村譲りのものであるのは間違いないだろう。当時二人で一緒にいると仕草や話し癖などもまるでそっくり同じだったという話だから、実の親子よりも親密だったというその関係性が目に浮かぶようだ。","en":"There can be no doubt that Kimura’s character greatly influenced <tips=10>Michio Mido</tips>, who was then boarding at his home. Michio’s rough streak, his affection for the weak, and his easy charm—the foundations of his personality—were unmistakably inherited from Kimura. It was also said that when the two were together, even their gestures and habits of speech looked exactly alike. Their relationship was reportedly closer than that of a biological father and son, and the resemblance makes that intimacy easy to picture.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r7","rowIndex":7,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　幼い頃に母親を殴っていた孤児だったというエピソードから、<tips=10>道夫</tips>のことを愛情に恵まれなかった情緒欠落の人物としてイメージし、だから成長したのちに<tips=47>八龍解放軍</tips>のような組織のリーダーになって過激な事件を起こして道を誤らせたという評価もあるが、それは彼の人間像を正しく捉えたものではないように思う。","en":"From the episode in which the orphaned <tips=10>Michio</tips> struck his mother as a young child, some have imagined him as emotionally deficient and starved of affection. They argue that this was why he later lost his way, becoming the leader of an organization like the <tips=47>Hachiryu Liberation Army</tips> and causing violent incidents. That judgment does not appear to capture the man correctly.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r8","rowIndex":8,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　確かに幼少期こそ殺伐とした環境にいたかもしれないが、少なくとも木村家に引き取られてから、彼が酒による内臓疾患で病死するまでは、愛情に恵まれた生活を送っていたのだ。","en":"Certainly, his earliest childhood may have been spent in a brutal environment. But from the time the Kimura family took him in until Kimura died of alcohol-related organ disease, Michio lived surrounded by affection.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r9","rowIndex":9,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　事実、その時期<tips=10>道夫</tips>はかなり真剣に大工になることを考えていた。","en":"Indeed, during this period, <tips=10>Michio</tips> quite seriously considered becoming a carpenter.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r10","rowIndex":10,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=10>道夫</tips>は<tips=21>八龍会</tips>の<tips=22>老人たち</tips>によってこの時既に<tips=21>八龍会</tips>幹部になることが約束されており、その養育費も組織から出ている。だから木村も特別彼に技術を教えるようなことはなかったのだが、<tips=10>道夫</tips>は自発的に大工になるための修業を行っていた。","en":"By then, the <tips=22>elders</tips> of the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips> had already designated <tips=10>Michio</tips> as a future <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips> officer, and the organization was paying for his upbringing. Kimura therefore made no special effort to teach him the trade, but <tips=10>Michio</tips> undertook a carpenter’s training of his own accord.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r11","rowIndex":11,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その日も、朝晴れているとみるや庭に出て、その辺りに転がっていた材木の切れ端を使って工作に精を出していた。彼の真っ黒な右手に秘められた能力は、熟練した職人の木村もうらやむほどの優れたもので、手を当てて念じるだけですっぱりとあらかじめ引いたライン通りに切断される。どんな柔らかい材料でも、固い材料でも、ひとつまみの木くずを出すこともなく、そして断面はまるでかんなをかけたようになめらかだった。","en":"That day, too, the morning sky was clear, so Michio went into the garden and devoted himself to making something from scraps of lumber lying nearby. The power hidden within his pitch-black right hand was enough to make even a seasoned craftsman like Kimura envious. Michio needed only to place his hand upon the material and will it so, and it parted cleanly along the line he had drawn. However soft or hard the material, the cut produced not a speck of sawdust, and the exposed surface was as smooth as though it had been planed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r12","rowIndex":12,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　もし<tips=10>道夫</tips>が本当に職人への道を歩んでいたら、他に誰も真似の出来ない仕事を成し遂げていただろう。","en":"Had <tips=10>Michio</tips> truly followed the craftsman’s path, he would surely have produced work no one else could replicate.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r13","rowIndex":13,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そうして彼は設計図を確認しながら、材木を道具もなくスパスパと細かく切り分けていた。そしてそれを見守るのは、そっくり同じ姿をした二人の少女だった。","en":"Consulting his plans, he continued slicing the lumber into small pieces without tools. Two girls identical in appearance watched him work.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r14","rowIndex":14,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=10>見土道夫</tips>、それつまんないからもうやめなよ」","en":"“<tips=10>Michio Mido</tips>, that’s boring. Stop already.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"灰上璃映子（少女）","displayName":"Rieko Haigami (Girl)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r15","rowIndex":15,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=57>滑走路通り</tips>に遊びに行こう？」","en":"“Come play on <tips=57>Runway Street</tips> with us.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"灰上江梨子（少女）","displayName":"Eriko Haigami (Girl)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r16","rowIndex":16,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　縁側に座って足をブラブラさせながら、しきりに文句を言っているのは<tips=11>灰上璃映子</tips>と<tips=12>灰上江梨子</tips>。<tips=13>ヘドロ団地</tips>に住むこの双子は<tips=10>道夫</tips>よりも三つ年下だった。","en":"The girls sitting on the veranda, swinging their legs and complaining incessantly, were <tips=11>Rieko Haigami</tips> and <tips=12>Eriko Haigami</tips>. The twins lived in the <tips=13>Sludge Housing Complex</tips> and were three years younger than <tips=10>Michio</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r17","rowIndex":17,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=10>道夫</tips>もはじめは無視して黙々と作業をしていたが、あまりにもしつこいのでとうとう音を上げた。","en":"At first, <tips=10>Michio</tips> ignored them and worked in silence. At last, their persistence wore him down.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r18","rowIndex":18,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「何でおまえら、おれの邪魔してるんだよ。遊びに行きたいなら二人で行けばいいだろ。それか、団地の子なんだから、団地の誰かを誘えばいいじゃないか」","en":"“Why do you two have to get in my way? If you want to go play, go by yourselves. Or you live in the complex—why don’t you invite somebody from there?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫（少年時代）","displayName":"Michio Mido (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r19","rowIndex":19,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=10>道夫</tips>は睨み付けて抗議をしたが、<tips=86>双子</tips>はやっと自分たちへ注意が向いたという点しか見ず、その言葉は完全に無視をした。","en":"<tips=10>Michio</tips> glared as he protested. <tips=86>The twins</tips> noticed only that they had finally won his attention and ignored every word he said.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r20","rowIndex":20,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ねえ見てよ<tips=10>見土道夫</tips>。このブローチかわいいでしょ？」","en":"“Hey, look, <tips=10>Michio Mido</tips>. Isn’t this brooch pretty?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"灰上璃映子（少女）","displayName":"Rieko Haigami (Girl)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r21","rowIndex":21,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「私たちの大好きな薔薇の形しているの。お兄ちゃんが送ってくれたんだよ？」","en":"“It’s shaped like our favorite flower, a rose. Our big brother sent it to us, you know.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"灰上江梨子（少女）","displayName":"Eriko Haigami (Girl)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r22","rowIndex":22,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=86>双子</tips>はそうはしゃいで、自分たちの胸で太陽を照り返して真っ赤に輝く花をかたどったおそろいのブローチを見せる。","en":"Chattering excitedly, <tips=86>the twins</tips> displayed the matching brooches upon their chests: flowers that reflected the sun and shone a brilliant red.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r23","rowIndex":23,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「うん、よく似合ってるよ」","en":"“Yeah. They look good on you.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫（少年時代）","displayName":"Michio Mido (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r24","rowIndex":24,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　不満げな表情ながらもそう応えてしまうのが<tips=10>道夫</tips>であった。","en":"For all his displeasure, <tips=10>Michio</tips> was the sort who could not help giving them an answer like that.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r25","rowIndex":25,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　姉は<tips=16>タイプA</tips>、妹は<tips=17>タイプB</tips>の<tips=86>双子</tips>は能力を使って度を過ぎた悪戯を繰り返し、孤児ながらも後見人が悪名高い<tips=13>ヘドロ団地</tips>の大物だということで、こんなに幼いながらも有名な悪童として周囲の人間に疎まれていた。","en":"The elder twin was a <tips=16>Type A</tips> and the younger a <tips=17>Type B</tips>. They repeatedly used their abilities for pranks that went much too far. Although they were orphans, their guardian was a notorious power in the <tips=13>Sludge Housing Complex</tips>. Thus, despite their youth, <tips=86>the twins</tips> were widely disliked as infamous little terrors.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r26","rowIndex":26,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　他の子供にちょっとでもいやなことをされると、容赦なくやり返し、時に度をこえてしまうのだが、一度、それを通りかかった<tips=10>道夫</tips>に窘められたことがある。","en":"Whenever another child did even the slightest thing they disliked, they retaliated without mercy and sometimes went too far. Once, however, <tips=10>Michio</tips> happened by and reprimanded them for it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r27","rowIndex":27,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　いつでも自分たちが正しいと信じている<tips=86>双子</tips>は注意をした<tips=10>道夫</tips>に反発して攻撃を加えたが、<tips=16>タイプA</tips>と<tips=17>タイプB</tips>両方の性質を持ち合わせた上に、基礎となる身体能力も遥かに高い<tips=10>道夫</tips>には二人がかりでも敵わなかった。こてんぱんに叩きのめされ、能力者が能力を使ってノーマルをいじめることがいかに悪いことか、卑怯なことか、正座をさせてこんこんと説教をしたのである。","en":"The <tips=86>twins</tips>, always convinced they were right, resented <tips=10>Michio’s</tips> warning and attacked him. But <tips=10>Michio</tips> combined the traits of both <tips=16>Type A</tips> and <tips=17>Type B</tips>, and his basic physical abilities far surpassed theirs. Even together, they were no match for him. He thrashed them soundly, made them kneel formally, and lectured them at length on how wrong and cowardly it was for people with abilities to use their powers to bully Normals.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r28","rowIndex":28,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　やりたい放題やって来た<tips=86>双子</tips>が他人に怒られるのは、実の親が死んで以来はじめてのことであった。","en":"The <tips=86>twins</tips> had done as they pleased, unchecked. This was the first time anyone had scolded them since their own parents died.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r29","rowIndex":29,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　結局二人で大泣きして謝り、子分となることを誓ったのだが、なぜかそれ以来<tips=10>道夫</tips>になついて、用事もなく遊びに来ては彼をからかっている。もちろん、二人で泣いて子分にされたことなど完全に忘れた様子である。","en":"In the end, both girls bawled, apologized, and swore to become his henchmen. For some reason, they had taken to <tips=10>Michio</tips> ever since, dropping by without any business and teasing him. Naturally, they appeared to have completely forgotten the part where they cried and were made his henchmen.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r30","rowIndex":30,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　何だかんだで甘くしてしまうのが悪いのだ、と<tips=10>道夫</tips>もわかっているが、自分と同じように両親がなく、能力者である<tips=86>双子</tips>の心情には共感出来る部分もあり、むげに扱うことも出来ない。","en":"<tips=10>Michio</tips> knew that indulging them despite everything was part of the problem. But the <tips=86>twins</tips> had lost their parents as he had, and they too possessed abilities. He could relate to some of what they felt and could not treat them coldly.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r31","rowIndex":31,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「私たちには、こうやって大事にしてくれるお兄ちゃんがいるんだからねー」","en":"“We’ve got a big brother who takes good care of us like this, you know.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"灰上璃映子（少女）","displayName":"Rieko Haigami (Girl)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r32","rowIndex":32,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「頭のおかしいお母さんが死んじゃって、本当に誰も家族がいない<tips=10>見土道夫</tips>とは違うんだからねー」","en":"“We’re not like <tips=10>Michio Mido</tips>, whose crazy mother died and who has absolutely no family at all.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"灰上江梨子（少女）","displayName":"Eriko Haigami (Girl)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r33","rowIndex":33,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しかし、<tips=86>双子</tips>の方がこのように容赦のない言葉を投げかけてくると、さすがの<tips=10>道夫</tips>も、もういっぺん殴ってやろうかと思わぬでもない。","en":"But when the <tips=86>twins</tips> hurled merciless remarks like these at him, even <tips=10>Michio</tips> could not entirely keep himself from considering whether to hit them one more time.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r34","rowIndex":34,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「お兄ちゃんはすごいんだよ。立派なところで働いていてね、いつもおもちゃとかお小遣いを送ってくれるんだ」","en":"“Our brother is amazing. He works someplace important, and he’s always sending us toys and spending money.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"灰上璃映子（少女）","displayName":"Rieko Haigami (Girl)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r35","rowIndex":35,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「今度はゲーム機買ってくれるんだよ。<tips=10>見土道夫</tips>はゲーム機買ってくれるようなひといる？」","en":"“He’s buying us a game console next. Is there anyone who’ll buy a game console for you, <tips=10>Michio Mido</tips>?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"灰上江梨子（少女）","displayName":"Eriko Haigami (Girl)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r36","rowIndex":36,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いいんだよ。ゲームなんかやらないから」","en":"“I don’t care. I don’t play games.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫（少年時代）","displayName":"Michio Mido (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r37","rowIndex":37,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=10>道夫</tips>は言って口を尖らせる。","en":"<tips=10>Michio</tips> says, pouting.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r38","rowIndex":38,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　実際のところは、友だちから最新のゲームを買ったなどという話を聞くと、真っ先に駆けつける程度には好きである。","en":"In truth, Michio liked games well enough to race to a friend’s house the moment he heard they had bought the newest one.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r39","rowIndex":39,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まあでも良かったな。届いたら、ちゃんとお兄さんに丁寧なお礼しなきゃだめだぞ」","en":"“Well, that’s good, anyway. When it arrives, make sure you give your brother a proper thank-you.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫（少年時代）","displayName":"Michio Mido (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r40","rowIndex":40,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「わかってるよそんなの」","en":"“We already know that.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"灰上璃映子（少女）","displayName":"Rieko Haigami (Girl)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r41","rowIndex":41,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「大きなお世話だわ」","en":"“Mind your own business.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"灰上江梨子（少女）","displayName":"Eriko Haigami (Girl)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r42","rowIndex":42,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=86>双子</tips>は喜怒哀楽が激しく、<tips=10>道夫</tips>のちょっとした意見を指図にでも感じたのか、急に頬を膨らましてむくれてしまう。","en":"The <tips=86>twins</tips>’ emotions ran hot, and perhaps they mistook even this little bit of advice from <tips=10>Michio</tips> for an order. In an instant, they puffed out their cheeks and began to sulk.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r43","rowIndex":43,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　全く相手にしていられないということで、<tips=10>道夫</tips>は溜息をついて作業を再開しようとしたのだが、","en":"Deciding they were impossible to deal with, <tips=10>Michio</tips> sighed and was about to resume his work when—","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r44","rowIndex":44,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ねえ<tips=10>見土道夫</tips>、<tips=1>菅原亮</tips>と決闘するってほんと？」","en":"“Hey, <tips=10>Michio Mido</tips>. Is it true you’re going to duel <tips=1>Ryo Sugawara</tips>?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"灰上江梨子（少女）","displayName":"Eriko Haigami (Girl)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r45","rowIndex":45,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「一対一でやるんでしょ？」","en":"“You’re fighting him one on one, aren’t you?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"灰上璃映子（少女）","displayName":"Rieko Haigami (Girl)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r46","rowIndex":46,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　意外なことを聞いてきたのでまた手を止める。","en":"The unexpected question made him stop working again.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r47","rowIndex":47,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どこで聞いたんだ？」","en":"“Where did you hear that?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫（少年時代）","displayName":"Michio Mido (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r48","rowIndex":48,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=66>田中紺太</tips>が言ってた」","en":"“<tips=66>Konta Tanaka</tips> told us.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"灰上江梨子（少女）","displayName":"Eriko Haigami (Girl)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r49","rowIndex":49,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「明日って話だけれど」","en":"“He said it’s tomorrow.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"灰上璃映子（少女）","displayName":"Rieko Haigami (Girl)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r50","rowIndex":50,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=86>双子</tips>たちの言う通り、<tips=10>道夫</tips>はこの翌日<tips=1>菅原亮</tips>と決闘することになっていた。","en":"The <tips=86>twins</tips> were correct. <tips=10>Michio</tips> was scheduled to duel <tips=1>Ryo Sugawara</tips> the following day.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r51","rowIndex":51,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　先日チームを譲り受けるという話をしたものの、やはり<tips=10>道夫</tips>はどうしても納得がいかない。リーダー同士皆の前で決着をつけた上でなければすっきりしないと、<tips=1>亮</tips>にしつこく粘ったのである。","en":"Although they had discussed <tips=10>Michio</tips> taking over the team the other day, he still could not accept the arrangement. He kept badgering <tips=1>Ryo</tips>, insisting he would not be satisfied unless the two leaders settled matters in front of everyone.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r52","rowIndex":52,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>とすれば別に<tips=10>道夫</tips>の縄張りが欲しいわけでもなく、負けて縄張りを失うことにもこだわりがなく、全く戦う理由がないと断り続けていた。しかし、業を煮やした<tips=10>道夫</tips>が腰抜けだなんだと罵倒し続けていたら、意外と短気なようで、腹を立てて挑発に乗ってきた。","en":"From <tips=1>Ryo’s</tips> perspective, he had no particular desire for <tips=10>Michio’s</tips> territory and did not care if defeat cost him his own, so he kept refusing because there was simply no reason to fight. But <tips=10>Michio</tips>, fed up, kept calling him a coward and worse. Ryo turned out to have a surprisingly short fuse: he got angry and rose to the bait.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r53","rowIndex":53,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「僕が勝ってもお前の縄張りはいらない。そのかわりに裸になって逆立ちで<tips=57>滑走路通り</tips>を往復してもらう」","en":"“Even if I win, I don’t want your territory. Instead, you’ll strip naked and walk the length of <tips=57>Runway Street</tips> and back on your hands.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r54","rowIndex":54,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>が提案した条件はこのようなものだった。彼が勝ったとしても何かを手に入れるわけではなく、ただ<tips=10>道夫</tips>が恥をかくだけの条件に、やっぱりこいつは性格が悪いと確信しながら、<tips=10>道夫</tips>は了承した。","en":"The terms <tips=1>Ryo</tips> proposed were as follows: even if he won, he would gain nothing, while <tips=10>Michio</tips> would merely be humiliated. Convinced once again that Ryo had a rotten personality, <tips=10>Michio</tips> nevertheless agreed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r55","rowIndex":55,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ということで、明日の十三時に<tips=58>パラシュート通り</tips>裏の空き地でお互い武器も能力も一切使わずに一対一で戦うということが決まったのである。","en":"The duel was thus set for one o’clock the next afternoon, in a vacant lot behind <tips=58>Parachute Street</tips>. They would fight one on one, using neither weapons nor abilities of any kind.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r56","rowIndex":56,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「思えば悪いことをしたかもしれないな。あいつは見るからに腕よりも頭を使うタイプなんだろう。それはわかっていたんだけど、やっぱり決闘なしに縄張りを受け取ることなんか出来なかったんだ」","en":"“Thinking about it, maybe I treated him unfairly. He looks like the brains-over-brawn type. I knew that, but I still couldn’t take his territory without a duel.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫（少年時代）","displayName":"Michio Mido (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r57","rowIndex":57,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=10>道夫</tips>は頭に血が上って挑んでしまったことを少々後悔していた。","en":"<tips=10>Michio</tips> had begun to regret issuing the challenge in the heat of the moment.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r58","rowIndex":58,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それにきっと、あの仲間も何にも要らないって態度が、なんだか気にいらなかったんだ。おれとしたことが大人げない……」","en":"“And I guess I didn’t like that attitude of his, acting as if he didn’t need friends or anything. Pretty childish of me...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫（少年時代）","displayName":"Michio Mido (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r59","rowIndex":59,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=10>道夫</tips>が溜息をつくと、<tips=86>双子</tips>はクスクスと笑った。","en":"<tips=10>Michio</tips> sighed. <tips=86>The twins</tips> giggled.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r60","rowIndex":60,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「何がおかしいんだ？」","en":"“What’s so funny?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫（少年時代）","displayName":"Michio Mido (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r61","rowIndex":61,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　怪訝な顔で問い返すと、","en":"When he asked again with a puzzled frown,","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r62","rowIndex":62,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「油断してると、<tips=10>道夫</tips>負けるよ」","en":"“If you’re not careful, <tips=10>Michio</tips>, you’ll lose.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"灰上江梨子（少女）","displayName":"Eriko Haigami (Girl)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r63","rowIndex":63,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あいつ、見かけによらず結構強いんだって」","en":"“They say he’s a lot stronger than he looks.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"灰上璃映子（少女）","displayName":"Rieko Haigami (Girl)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r64","rowIndex":64,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=86>双子</tips>は予想外に詳しそうなことを言う。","en":"The <tips=86>twins</tips> sounded surprisingly well informed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r65","rowIndex":65,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「何か知ってるのか？」","en":"“Do you know something?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫（少年時代）","displayName":"Michio Mido (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r66","rowIndex":66,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あいつ、周との喧嘩の時、強かったそうだよ」","en":"“They say he was strong when he fought Zhou.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"灰上江梨子（少女）","displayName":"Eriko Haigami (Girl)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r67","rowIndex":67,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それに、あの<tips=25>馬世傑</tips>と仲が良いみたい。同じのを習ってるんじゃない？」","en":"“And he seems to be friends with <tips=25>Ma Sai-kit</tips>. Maybe they train in the same thing?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"灰上璃映子（少女）","displayName":"Rieko Haigami (Girl)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r68","rowIndex":68,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=25>馬世傑</tips>と言えば<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>の幹部にして武術の達人である<tips=4>馬明</tips>の息子として拳法の英才教育を受け、街の空手大会では何度も優勝していた。","en":"Speaking of <tips=25>Ma Sai-kit</tips>, he was the son of <tips=4>Ma Ming</tips>, a <tips=7>YS</tips> executive and martial-arts master. He had received an elite martial education and won the city’s karate tournaments several times.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r69","rowIndex":69,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=25>世傑</tips>は偉いギャングの息子であるから、街の不良少年に混じって行動することがなかったが、もし街に出たら自分の勢力をもっていただろう。","en":"Because <tips=25>Sai-kit</tips> was the son of a high-ranking gangster, he never ran with the city’s delinquent boys. Had he entered their world, however, he would surely have commanded a faction of his own.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r70","rowIndex":70,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=10>道夫</tips>もその姿を大会で見たことがある。<tips=10>道夫</tips>は自分でそういったものに参加することはなかったが、街にどんな強い人間がいるのか見てやるつもりで見学に行ったことがある。そのとき優勝したのが<tips=25>馬世傑</tips>だった。","en":"<tips=10>Michio</tips> had also seen him compete in a tournament. <tips=10>Michio</tips> never entered such events himself, but once attended to see for himself what strong people the city had to offer. The winner that day was <tips=25>Ma Sai-kit</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r71","rowIndex":71,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=25>世傑</tips>は<tips=17>タイプB</tips>ではなく、体格も細身であったにもかかわらず恐ろしい強さで他の選手をなぎ倒し、おそらくサイキックだろうという感想を持ったものだ。","en":"Although <tips=25>Sai-kit</tips> was not <tips=17>Type B</tips> and had a slender build, he demolished the other contestants with terrifying strength. Michio came away convinced that he was probably a psychic.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r72","rowIndex":72,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その<tips=25>世傑</tips>と親しげに話しているのを見たのだという。","en":"Apparently, Ryo had been seen talking with <tips=25>Sai-kit</tips> on friendly terms.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r73","rowIndex":73,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ケンポーやってる団地の子がさ、<tips=9>Y地区</tips>の大会で見かけたんだって」","en":"“A kid from the housing complex who practices kenpo said he saw him at a tournament in <tips=9>Y District</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"灰上江梨子（少女）","displayName":"Eriko Haigami (Girl)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r74","rowIndex":74,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=1>菅原亮</tips>が<tips=25>世傑</tips>の応援に来てたみたいだよ」","en":"“It looks like <tips=1>Ryo Sugawara</tips> had come to cheer for <tips=25>Sai-kit</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"灰上璃映子（少女）","displayName":"Rieko Haigami (Girl)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r75","rowIndex":75,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ちょっとはやるのかもしれないが、<tips=25>馬世傑</tips>と知り合いってだけで、同じくらい強いとは限らないさ……」","en":"“He might be pretty good, but just knowing <tips=25>Ma Sai-kit</tips> doesn’t necessarily make him just as strong...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫（少年時代）","displayName":"Michio Mido (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r76","rowIndex":76,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=10>道夫</tips>は腕組みをして強がってみせるが、動揺を隠しきれず<tips=86>双子</tips>に笑われてしまう。","en":"<tips=10>Michio</tips> folded his arms and tried to sound confident, but failed to conceal his unease. <tips=86>The twins</tips> laughed at him.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r77","rowIndex":77,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「能力つかっちゃえばー？」","en":"“Why don’t you just use your powers?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"灰上江梨子（少女）","displayName":"Eriko Haigami (Girl)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r78","rowIndex":78,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「金色の目を使う？　それとも、右手の力でスパっと首を切り落としちゃう？」","en":"“How about the golden eyes? Or you could use your right hand to slice his head clean off.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"灰上璃映子（少女）","displayName":"Rieko Haigami (Girl)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r79","rowIndex":79,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ばか。そんなこと出来るわけないだろ」","en":"“Idiots. Of course I can’t do that.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫（少年時代）","displayName":"Michio Mido (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r80","rowIndex":80,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=10>道夫</tips>は苦い顔で否定してから、","en":"<tips=10>Michio</tips> rejected the idea with a grimace, then continued.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r81","rowIndex":81,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「でも、腕が立つようならかえって良かったよ。勝つにしろ負けるにしろ、相手が強い方がいい。その方がすっきり戦えるからな」","en":"“If he knows how to fight, so much the better. Win or lose, I’d rather face somebody strong. That way, we can have a clean fight.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫（少年時代）","displayName":"Michio Mido (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r82","rowIndex":82,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それは強がりではないようで、さわやかな表情をしている。","en":"He did not seem to be putting on a brave front. His expression was open and untroubled.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r83","rowIndex":83,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「アハハ、へんなやつー」","en":"“Ahaha! You’re so weird.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"灰上江梨子（少女）","displayName":"Eriko Haigami (Girl)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r84","rowIndex":84,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「気持ちわるっ」","en":"“Gross.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"灰上璃映子（少女）","displayName":"Rieko Haigami (Girl)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r85","rowIndex":85,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「おれは真剣だぞ。おまえらはガキだし女だから、こういう気持ちがわからないんだ」","en":"“I’m serious. You’re little kids and girls besides, so you can’t understand how this feels.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫（少年時代）","displayName":"Michio Mido (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r86","rowIndex":86,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=10>道夫</tips>は顔を顰めた。","en":"<tips=10>Michio</tips> frowned.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r87","rowIndex":87,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まあ、なんでもいいよ」","en":"“Whatever.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"灰上江梨子（少女）","displayName":"Eriko Haigami (Girl)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r88","rowIndex":88,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「私たちも明日見に行くからね！」","en":"“We’re coming to watch tomorrow!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"灰上璃映子（少女）","displayName":"Rieko Haigami (Girl)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r89","rowIndex":89,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「くんなよ。男の真剣勝負なんだ」","en":"“Don’t come. This is a serious contest between men.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫（少年時代）","displayName":"Michio Mido (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r90","rowIndex":90,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いやだよ。<tips=10>見土道夫</tips>が負けるところ見るんだから」","en":"“No. We’re coming to watch <tips=10>Michio Mido</tips> lose.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"灰上江梨子（少女）","displayName":"Eriko Haigami (Girl)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r91","rowIndex":91,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それで、裸で逆立ち歩きしてるところを写真に撮ってあげるね」","en":"“And we’ll take pictures of you walking on your hands naked.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"灰上璃映子（少女）","displayName":"Rieko Haigami (Girl)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r92","rowIndex":92,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=86>双子</tips>はおかしそうに笑い、<tips=10>道夫</tips>は深く深く溜息をつくと、木片を一つ手に取ってようやく作業を再開した。","en":"<tips=86>The twins</tips> laughed in amusement. <tips=10>Michio</tips> heaved a deep, deep sigh, picked up a piece of wood, and finally returned to work.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r93","rowIndex":93,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　翌日<tips=86>双子</tips>は朝から団地を出て、<tips=10>道夫</tips>と<tips=1>亮</tips>の決闘時間までを<tips=57>滑走路通り</tips>で遊んで過ごした。","en":"The next morning, <tips=86>the twins</tips> left the housing complex early and passed the time playing on <tips=57>Runway Street</tips> until it was time for <tips=10>Michio</tips> and <tips=1>Ryo’s</tips> duel.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r94","rowIndex":94,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=13>ヘドロ団地</tips>には彼女たちと同年代の子供も多く住んでおり、彼らと遊ぶこともあったが、最近は<tips=9>Y地区</tips>にやって来ることの方が多かった。","en":"Many children their age lived in the <tips=13>Sludge Housing Complex</tips>, and the twins sometimes played with them. Lately, however, they had come to <tips=9>Y District</tips> more often than not.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r95","rowIndex":95,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　とにかく二人は毎日違うことをして、その日が少しでも変化のある、他の日とは違う一日になることを求めていたのだ。","en":"More than anything, they wanted every day to bring something new, to become a day unlike all the others.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r96","rowIndex":96,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=86>双子</tips>は一応小学生であったが、学校には一度か二度顔を出したきりで全く行っていない。ただこれに関して言えば、二人が特別だったわけではなく、団地や<tips=9>Y地区</tips>の子供にはよくあることだ。","en":"The <tips=86>twins</tips> were nominally elementary-school pupils, but after showing up once or twice, they had stopped attending altogether. In this respect, however, they were not unusual. It was common among children in the housing complex and <tips=9>Y District</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r97","rowIndex":97,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　犯罪者や不法滞在者の子供が、まともに教育を受けることは難しい。物好きな大人が子供を集めて読み書きなどを教えていて、そこである程度知識を身につけることも出来たが、文字も読めない子供も多かった。","en":"For the children of criminals and undocumented immigrants, receiving a proper education was difficult. A few eccentric adults gathered children and taught them reading, writing, and similar subjects. A child could acquire some knowledge there, but many remained unable even to read.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r98","rowIndex":98,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　とにかく、そういうわけで<tips=86>双子</tips>はよく平日の真っ昼間から街をうろついていた。子供自体は珍しくないが、まったく同じ顔をした二人が並んで歩くと目立つ。","en":"At any rate, that was why the <tips=86>twins</tips> often wandered the city in broad daylight on weekdays. Children themselves were nothing unusual, but two girls with perfectly identical faces drew attention when they walked side by side.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r99","rowIndex":99,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして、彼女たちに痛い目にあわされた経験がある路上の物売り者たちは、その姿を見るとしかめっ面になって売り物に覆いを掛けたり、目が合わぬように顔を背けたりするのだった。","en":"Street vendors who had suffered at their hands grimaced when they saw them. Some covered their wares; others turned their faces away to avoid meeting the twins’ eyes.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r100","rowIndex":100,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=86>双子</tips>はそういう反応をニヤニヤと眺めながら、スカートをひらめかせて通り過ぎてゆく。","en":"<tips=86>The twins</tips> watched these reactions with grins, then passed by with their skirts fluttering.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r101","rowIndex":101,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=57>滑走路通り</tips>には<tips=1>亮</tips>と揉めた周のグループも含めていくつかの不良少年のグループがあったが、そうした不良少年たちも<tips=86>双子</tips>には手を出さない。","en":"Several groups of delinquent boys operated on <tips=57>Runway Street</tips>, including Zhou’s group, which had clashed with <tips=1>Ryo</tips>. Even those delinquents left the <tips=86>twins</tips> alone.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r102","rowIndex":102,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=10>道夫</tips>ほどの能力があれば別だが、そうでなければ、能力を使うことにまったく躊躇いのない<tips=86>双子</tips>に散々に弄ばれて恥をかくだけの結果に終わってしまうのはわかりきっている。そして実際そうしたことは何度もあった。","en":"Unless someone had abilities on <tips=10>Michio’s</tips> level, it was obvious how things would end: the <tips=86>twins</tips>, who never hesitated to use their powers, would toy with them mercilessly and leave them humiliated. And that was exactly what had happened, time and again.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r103","rowIndex":103,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　今では、不良少年の方がこそこそ姿を隠すような状況である。","en":"By then, the delinquent boys were the ones sneaking out of sight.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r104","rowIndex":104,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あのクソ生意気なイカレたガキが……」","en":"“Those fucking obnoxious little psychos...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r105","rowIndex":105,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　と周少年などはよく口に出したが、彼もやはり実際に遭遇すると目をそらし、気づかぬふりをする。","en":"Young Zhou often said this aloud. Yet when he actually encountered them, he too averted his eyes and pretended not to notice.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r106","rowIndex":106,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　これは<tips=86>双子</tips>にとってはまったく退屈な状況で、","en":"<tips=86>The twins</tips> found this situation unbearably dull.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r107","rowIndex":107,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ねえ、今日はあそばないの？」","en":"“Hey, aren’t you going to play with us today?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"灰上江梨子（少女）","displayName":"Eriko Haigami (Girl)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r108","rowIndex":108,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「遊ぼうよ？」","en":"“Come play with us.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"灰上璃映子（少女）","displayName":"Rieko Haigami (Girl)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r109","rowIndex":109,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　周を見つけるたび、その目の前に回り込んで挑発的に笑う。","en":"Whenever they spotted Zhou, they would circle around in front of him and grin provocatively.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r110","rowIndex":110,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　だが、周は無言で視線をそらし、相手をしないで去ってゆく。","en":"But Zhou silently averted his eyes and walked away without engaging them.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r111","rowIndex":111,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「つまんないー！」","en":"“Boring!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"灰上江梨子（少女）","displayName":"Eriko Haigami (Girl)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r112","rowIndex":112,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ばかー！」","en":"“Idiot!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"灰上璃映子（少女）","displayName":"Rieko Haigami (Girl)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r113","rowIndex":113,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=86>双子</tips>は頬を膨らまし、その背中に小石を投げるのだった。","en":"<tips=86>The twins</tips> would puff out their cheeks and pelt his back with pebbles.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r114","rowIndex":114,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　このような調子で、<tips=57>滑走路通り</tips>ですっかり腫れ物扱いをされている<tips=86>双子</tips>だが、優しく接するものはいた。","en":"And so, everyone on <tips=57>Runway Street</tips> kept the <tips=86>twins</tips> at arm’s length. Even so, there were people who treated them kindly.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r115","rowIndex":115,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=10>道夫</tips>もその一人ではあるが、<tips=57>滑走路通り</tips>の端でソフトクリームを売るメリッサというフィリピン人の若い女も、<tips=86>双子</tips>を見かけるたびに好きなソフトクリームを選ばせて二人を可愛がった。","en":"<tips=10>Michio</tips> was one of them. So was Melissa, a young Filipino woman who sold soft-serve ice cream at the end of <tips=57>Runway Street</tips>. Whenever she saw <tips=86>the twins</tips>, she let each choose her favorite flavor and doted on them.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r116","rowIndex":116,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　今は立派な店舗を構え十人もの従業員を抱える繁盛店のオーナーとなっているメリッサだが、この頃は小さな販売車を一人で切り盛りしていた。","en":"Today, Melissa owns a thriving shop with a proper storefront and ten employees. In those days, however, she ran a small ice-cream truck all by herself.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r117","rowIndex":117,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あの二人のことはねえ、本当に大好きだったんですよ」","en":"“You know, I really did love those two.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"メリッサ","displayName":"Melissa","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r118","rowIndex":118,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　つい先日、筆者は取材のために彼女を訪ねた。","en":"Only the other day, the author visited her for an interview.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r119","rowIndex":119,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　メリッサは目のまわりに深い笑いジワが出来た優しげな表情の女性で、筆者が<tips=86>灰上姉妹</tips>のことを尋ねると、懐かしそうに語ってくれた。","en":"Melissa was a gentle-looking woman with deep smile lines around her eyes. When the author asked about the <tips=86>Haigami sisters</tips>, she spoke of them with evident nostalgia.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r120","rowIndex":120,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いつも強がっていたのは、あれは、ご両親が亡くなって、暗い顔をしていたくないという気持ちが強かったからでしょうね。人に心配されたり、同情されると、とっても申し訳なくなるからいやだと言っていました。ああ見えて、優しい子たちだったんですよ」","en":"“They were always putting on a brave face. I think that was because, after their parents died, they felt so strongly that they didn’t want to look unhappy. They told me they hated having people worry about them or feel sorry for them, because it made them feel terribly guilty. Despite appearances, they were kind girls.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"メリッサ","displayName":"Melissa","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r121","rowIndex":121,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　メリッサは寂しさの入り交じった遠い笑顔を浮かべてそう語った。","en":"Melissa said this with a distant smile tinged with sadness.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r122","rowIndex":122,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　話が<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>のことに及ぶと顔を僅かに暗くしたが、それでも<tips=86>双子</tips>のことを一言も悪くは言わなかった。","en":"When the subject turned to <tips=20>Koschei</tips>, a slight shadow crossed her face. Even then, however, she did not say a single unkind word about <tips=86>the twins</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r123","rowIndex":123,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「とにかく、どんな相手にも公平で平等なんです。偏見がないというか……だから、そのような恐ろしい人間が相手でも、何かひとつでも興味が持てるところがあれば、仲良くなってしまうんでしょうねえ。そんな人と関わればどうなるかというのは本人たちもよくわかっていたんでしょうけれど、そういう打算で行動するのを何よりも嫌う子たちでしたから……」","en":"“They were fair to everyone, no matter who it was. They treated everyone as equals, without prejudice... That was why, I suppose, even with someone as frightening as that, if they found so much as one thing about them that interested them, they would become friends. They must have known perfectly well what getting involved with someone like that could lead to. But those girls hated letting self-interest dictate what they did more than anything...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"メリッサ","displayName":"Melissa","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r124","rowIndex":124,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女はそう言って深い溜息をついた。","en":"At that, Melissa let out a deep sigh.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r125","rowIndex":125,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　さて、そこで話はまた在りし日の幼かった<tips=86>灰上姉妹</tips>に戻る。","en":"Now our story returns to the <tips=86>Haigami sisters</tips> as young girls, back in the days when they were still alive.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r126","rowIndex":126,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その日も<tips=86>双子</tips>はメリッサのワンボックスを改造した販売車の前で、客用に並べられた丸椅子に腰掛け、メリッサから貰ったソフトクリームをなめて、<tips=10>見土道夫</tips>と<tips=1>菅原亮</tips>の決闘までの時間を過ごしていた。","en":"That day, the <tips=86>twins</tips> again sat on the round stools arranged for customers before Melissa’s converted van, licking the soft-serve ice cream she had given them and passing the time until the duel between <tips=10>Michio Mido</tips> and <tips=1>Ryo Sugawara</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r127","rowIndex":127,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　メリッサが<tips=86>双子</tips>を可愛がっていたように、<tips=86>双子</tips>もメリッサには懐いており、その近くでは商売の邪魔になるような振る舞いをしない。悪いことをしなければ非常に愛くるしい容貌を持つ子供である。<tips=86>双子</tips>のことをよく知らない通行人などは話しかけることもあり、<tips=86>双子</tips>はそのたびにメリッサの店で何か買うよう薦めた。","en":"Just as Melissa doted on the <tips=86>twins</tips>, the <tips=86>twins</tips> had grown attached to her and never did anything around her that might interfere with business. When they were not misbehaving, they were exceptionally adorable children. Passersby who did not know the <tips=86>twins</tips> sometimes stopped to talk to them, and every time, the <tips=86>twins</tips> would urge them to buy something from Melissa’s shop.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r128","rowIndex":128,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして時間が近づくと、二人はメリッサに礼を言って、決闘の場所へと向かう。","en":"When the time drew near, the two thanked Melissa and headed for the site of the duel.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r129","rowIndex":129,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どっちが勝つかなー？」","en":"“Who do you think will win?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"灰上江梨子（少女）","displayName":"Eriko Haigami (Girl)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r130","rowIndex":130,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「わからないけど、どっちかが負けそうになったら邪魔する？」","en":"“I don’t know. Should we interfere if one of them starts losing?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"灰上璃映子（少女）","displayName":"Rieko Haigami (Girl)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r131","rowIndex":131,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「おもしろそう。遠くから足とか引っ張って、転ばせちゃおっか？」","en":"“That sounds fun. We could tug on their legs from far away and make them trip.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"灰上江梨子（少女）","displayName":"Eriko Haigami (Girl)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r132","rowIndex":132,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=10>見土道夫</tips>はきっと真っ赤になって怒るよー」","en":"“<tips=10>Michio Mido’s</tips> gonna turn bright red and get mad.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"灰上璃映子（少女）","displayName":"Rieko Haigami (Girl)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r133","rowIndex":133,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　二人がクスクスと笑い合いながら通行しているのは普通の路上ではなく、塀の上だった。彼女たちはあまり道を使わず、片方はサイキックの能力を借りて、もう片方は<tips=17>タイプB</tips>の脚力で、民家の屋根の上などを伝い、ぴょんぴょんと飛び跳ねて、猫でも使わないようなルートで移動する。","en":"The twins traveled along, giggling together—not down an ordinary street, but atop a wall. They seldom used roads at all. One would use her psychic powers, the other the leg strength of a <tips=17>Type B</tips>, bounding from rooftop to rooftop along routes even cats would never take.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r134","rowIndex":134,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そのため、どこにでも神出鬼没で現れ、そしていたずらをするのだ。街の人々にとっては厄介にもほどがあるだろう。","en":"That was how they could turn up anywhere and everywhere to play their pranks. To the people of the city, they were a nuisance beyond belief.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r135","rowIndex":135,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ただ、ここは他でもない<tips=9>Y地区</tips>である。そんな場所をふらふらとしていると、見てはならないものを見てしまって危険なことに巻き込まれることもある。実際<tips=86>双子</tips>もこれまで何度かそういう目には遭っているのだが、しかしこの日彼女たちが遭遇したものは、今までのものとは全く性質が違った。","en":"But this was <tips=9>Y District</tips>, of all places. Wander around there and sooner or later you might see something you were never meant to see and get dragged into danger. The <tips=86>twins</tips> had found themselves in that sort of trouble several times before. What they encountered that day, however, was something else entirely.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r136","rowIndex":136,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=17>タイプB</tips>の発作で叫び声がするボロ屋のトタン屋根を踏み越え、素人の手によって板を張り付けただけの雑な補修が目立つ古い木造アパートの裏にトンと着地をし、細い路地を並んで歩いているときだった。","en":"They stepped across the corrugated roof of a shack where someone was screaming through a <tips=17>Type B</tips> episode, dropped lightly behind an old wooden apartment building whose crude repairs—boards simply slapped into place by amateur hands—were plain to see, and were walking side by side down a narrow alley when it happened.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r137","rowIndex":137,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　二人の頭上を何か大きなものがかすめ飛んで、その黒い髪をふわりと舞わせる。","en":"Something large swept just over their heads, tossing their black hair into the air.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r138","rowIndex":138,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　びっくりして足を止めた二人の目の前に、ストンと着地したのは見たことのない怪物だった。","en":"The startled girls stopped dead. The thing that dropped lightly to the ground before them was a monster unlike anything they had ever seen.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r139","rowIndex":139,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　奇妙な姿をしたものが多数存在するこの街でも、これほどおかしな生き物を二人は見たことがない。","en":"Even in a city inhabited by so many strange-looking beings, the twins had never seen a creature this bizarre.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r140","rowIndex":140,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　一見すると、巨大なクモやタカアシガニのようだった。くの字に折れ曲がる四本の足は長く細く、小さな二人が顎を上げて見上げるほどだ。そしてその足に、吊り下げられるように胴体が付いている。全身は茶色く短い毛に覆われ、頭には大きな複眼がひとつ、その下に窮屈に押し込められたように小さな口と鼻がついている。","en":"At first glance, it resembled a gigantic spider or Japanese spider crab. Its four long, slender legs bent at sharp angles, towering so high that the small girls had to tip their heads back to look up at it. Its body hung from those legs as though suspended. Short brown fur covered it all over. Its head bore a single enormous compound eye, with a tiny mouth and nose crammed beneath it as though there had been no room left for them.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r141","rowIndex":141,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ズタボロになった白いシャツと、黒いズボン、そして胴体に斜めがけになっているのは革の黒カバンだ。まったく怪物と言う他ない醜い姿だが、このようなものを身につけているということは、おそらくこれでも人間なのだろう。","en":"It wore a tattered white shirt and black trousers, with a black leather bag slung diagonally across its torso. Its hideous form could only be called monstrous, but the fact that it wore such things meant it was presumably human.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r142","rowIndex":142,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しかし、こんなにひどい<tips=77>特質変異</tips>を<tips=86>双子</tips>は見たことがなかった。","en":"The <tips=86>twins</tips> had never seen such an extreme <tips=77>trait mutation</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r143","rowIndex":143,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=9>Y地区</tips>の外れの<tips=15>ボーダーエリア</tips>には醜く変わり果てた姿の<tips=16>タイプA</tips>たちがかたまって住んでいるが、そこにもこれほど人間離れしたものはいない。","en":"In the <tips=15>border area</tips> on the outskirts of <tips=9>Y District</tips>, <tips=16>Type As</tips> whose mutations had left them hideously transformed lived clustered together. But not even there was there anyone so far removed from human form.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r144","rowIndex":144,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　さらに、その怪物の大きな複眼は金色に輝いている。","en":"What was more, its enormous compound eye gleamed gold.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r145","rowIndex":145,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　つまりこいつは、ただの<tips=16>タイプA</tips>ではなく、<tips=17>タイプB</tips>の要素もかねあわせたハイブリッドなのだ。どこからか二人の頭の上を飛び越えてきたこの跳躍力も、その<tips=17>タイプＢ</tips>ならではのものなのかもしれない。","en":"In other words, this was no ordinary <tips=16>Type A</tips>, but a hybrid with <tips=17>Type B</tips> traits as well. Perhaps the tremendous leap that had carried it over the girls’ heads was another product of its <tips=17>Type B</tips> nature.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r146","rowIndex":146,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　怪物はその金色の目で二人を見定めると、口を動かす。その拍子に、牙の生えた口元から唾液が糸を引いて垂れ落ちた。","en":"The monster fixed its golden eye on the twins and moved its mouth. As it did, a string of saliva dripped from between its fangs.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r147","rowIndex":147,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ちょ、ちょっと、あなた何者？」","en":"“W-wait—what are you?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"灰上江梨子（少女）","displayName":"Eriko Haigami (Girl)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r148","rowIndex":148,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あっち行きなよ」","en":"“Go away.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"灰上璃映子（少女）","displayName":"Rieko Haigami (Girl)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r149","rowIndex":149,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　二人は口では強がっているが、さすがに顔は蒼白だった。","en":"For all their brave talk, the twins’ faces had gone deathly pale.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r150","rowIndex":150,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ほらっ！　石ぶつけるよ！」","en":"“Look! I’ll throw this rock at you!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"灰上江梨子（少女）","displayName":"Eriko Haigami (Girl)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r151","rowIndex":151,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「近づかないで！」","en":"“Don’t come any closer!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"灰上璃映子（少女）","displayName":"Rieko Haigami (Girl)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r152","rowIndex":152,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=86>双子</tips>の片方は金色の目を光らせて石を握りしめ、もう片方は見えない力で浮かせる。","en":"One of the <tips=86>twins</tips> gripped a stone as her eyes shone gold. The other raised a stone into the air with an invisible force.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r153","rowIndex":153,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しかし怪物は言葉が理解出来ないのか、それとも聞くつもりがないのか、口元でしゅるしゅると空気の抜ける音を立てながら近づいて来る。その長い手足の先には、土で茶色く汚れたかぎ爪がついていた。一本一本がちょっとした果物ナイフほどの大きさを持っている。","en":"Whether it could not understand them or simply had no intention of listening, the monster came closer, a wheezing hiss issuing from its mouth. Hooked claws stained brown with dirt tipped its long arms and legs, each one as large as a small paring knife.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r154","rowIndex":154,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　怪物が進む分だけ二人は後ずさる。威嚇のために手のなかに準備した石は、相手の感情を逆なでしてしまうことを考えると、簡単には投げつけることが出来ない。","en":"The twins retreated with every step it took. They had readied the stones as a threat, but dared not throw them when doing so might only inflame the creature further.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r155","rowIndex":155,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「逃げよう！」","en":"“Let’s run!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"灰上江梨子（少女）","displayName":"Eriko Haigami (Girl)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r156","rowIndex":156,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「うんっ」","en":"“Yeah!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"灰上璃映子（少女）","displayName":"Rieko Haigami (Girl)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r157","rowIndex":157,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　二人で頷きあうと、くるりと身体を反転してうしろに駆け出した。まっすぐアパートの横を通って行けば、その先はゴミゴミした狭い裏路地になる。素早く小さい二人がここに逃げ込めば相手も姿を見失うはずだ。","en":"They nodded to each other, turned on their heels, and ran back the way they had come. Straight past the side of the apartment building lay a cramped, cluttered back alley. If the two quick, small girls could make it in there, the creature was sure to lose sight of them.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r158","rowIndex":158,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しかし、数歩も進まないうちに、頭上でびゅんと何かが飛ぶ音がする。","en":"Before they had taken more than a few steps, something sliced through the air above them.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r159","rowIndex":159,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「「きゃっ！」」","en":"“Eek!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r160","rowIndex":160,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　二人は足を止め首をすくめる。","en":"The twins stopped and ducked their heads.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r161","rowIndex":161,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その目の前に、ひとっ飛びで二人の頭を飛び越した怪物が土埃をあげて着地をした。","en":"The monster sailed over both girls in a single bound and landed before them in a cloud of dust.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r162","rowIndex":162,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　あまりにも俊敏である。どうやら、簡単に逃げられるような相手ではないようだ。","en":"It was far too agile. Evidently, this was not an opponent they could easily escape from.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r163","rowIndex":163,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　二人はあまり難しく考える方ではなく、すぐに覚悟を決めた。","en":"The girls were not ones to overthink things. They made up their minds at once.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r164","rowIndex":164,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どうしても逃がしてくれないなら、痛い思いをしてもらうよ」","en":"“If you won’t let us get away, then we’re gonna have to hurt you.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"灰上江梨子（少女）","displayName":"Eriko Haigami (Girl)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r165","rowIndex":165,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「後悔しても遅いんだからね」","en":"“It’ll be too late to regret it.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"灰上璃映子（少女）","displayName":"Rieko Haigami (Girl)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r166","rowIndex":166,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　緊張と恐怖で汗だくになりながら、二人は攻撃を開始する。","en":"Drenched in sweat from tension and fear, the twins began their attack.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r167","rowIndex":167,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　まず一人がその念動力で石を飛ばす。空中で不規則に動きながら近づく石に、怪物の視線は釘付けになる。その隙に、もう一人が<tips=17>タイプB</tips>特有の大人顔負けの腕力で、石つぶてを素早く強く投げつけるのだ。","en":"First, one twin sent a stone darting through the air with her psychokinesis. The monster’s gaze locked onto it as it came weaving unpredictably toward it. While it was distracted, the other twin used the strength of a <tips=17>Type B</tips>—enough to put an adult to shame—to whip another stone at it, hard and fast.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r168","rowIndex":168,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　相手からすれば変化球と剛速球が同時に飛んでくることになる。これがこの二人の喧嘩の必勝パターンで、街の不良少年たちは二種類の投石になすすべもない。","en":"To their opponent, it was like facing a breaking ball and a blazing fastball at the same time. This was the twins’ surefire fighting strategy, and the city’s delinquent boys had no defense against the two-pronged barrage of stones.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r169","rowIndex":169,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　投石というのは危険なもので、当たり所や石の大きさや力の加減によって簡単に人が死ぬ。この幼い二人は見かけによらず冷静で、普段はそれを心得て急所をわざと外していたが、今回はそれをしなかった。","en":"A thrown stone is a dangerous thing. Depending on where it hits, how large it is, and how hard it was thrown, it can easily kill someone. For all their youth, the two girls were levelheaded enough to know that, and normally took care to miss vital spots on purpose. This time, they did not.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r170","rowIndex":170,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　全力で投げた石が、風を切り裂きながら飛んで行くのは怪物の顔面だった。変化する石の方に気をとられている相手は、それに気づかない。","en":"The stone she had thrown with all her strength screamed through the air toward the monster’s face. With its attention fixed on the curving stone, the creature never saw it coming.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r171","rowIndex":171,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ゴツッと鈍い音がする。","en":"A dull thud followed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r172","rowIndex":172,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「当たった？」","en":"“Did it hit?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"灰上璃映子（少女）","displayName":"Rieko Haigami (Girl)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r173","rowIndex":173,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いや、ダメだ！」","en":"“No! It’s no good!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"灰上江梨子（少女）","displayName":"Eriko Haigami (Girl)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r174","rowIndex":174,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　頭部を狙って投げつけた筈だが、緊張が力みを生んだのか、僅かに外れて肩の辺りにぶつかってしまったらしい。怪物は痛みで顔をしわだらけにして細かく震えたが、そうやって怯んでいるのも一瞬で、すぐに<tips=86>双子</tips>に向かって動き始める。","en":"She had meant to hit the monster’s head, but perhaps her nerves made her tense up: the stone went just wide and struck somewhere around its shoulder. The creature’s face crumpled with pain, and it shuddered. But it faltered for only an instant before advancing on the <tips=86>twins</tips> again.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r175","rowIndex":175,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　四本の足をカサカサと動かして走ると、巨体であるにもかかわらず異様に素早い。","en":"Scuttling on four legs, it was freakishly fast despite its enormous body.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r176","rowIndex":176,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　あっという間に<tips=86>双子</tips>の目の前に迫り、そのかぎ爪のついた前足を伸ばす。","en":"In an instant, it closed the distance to the <tips=86>twins</tips> and thrust out a clawed foreleg.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r177","rowIndex":177,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「痛っ！」","en":"“Ow!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"灰上璃映子（少女）","displayName":"Rieko Haigami (Girl)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r178","rowIndex":178,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　左側の一人が肩を押さえ、血が空中に舞った。","en":"Blood sprayed through the air as the girl on the left clutched her shoulder.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r179","rowIndex":179,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「くそっ！」","en":"“Damn it!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"灰上江梨子（少女）","displayName":"Eriko Haigami (Girl)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r180","rowIndex":180,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　右側のもう一人が、傷付いた少女にしがみついた。","en":"The other girl, on the right, threw her arms around the wounded girl.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r181","rowIndex":181,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そこに怪物の二振り目のかぎ爪が襲い掛かり、しがみついた少女の腕を切り裂く。","en":"The monster’s hooked claw came at them in a second swipe, slashing the arm of the girl clinging to her sister.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r182","rowIndex":182,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「うっ」","en":"“Ngh!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"灰上江梨子（少女）","displayName":"Eriko Haigami (Girl)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r183","rowIndex":183,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=78>金目</tips>の少女は傷つけられても手を離さず、抱きかかえたまま地面を蹴ったが、三振り目がぴしりと足を横に払って、地面に尻餅をついてしまう。","en":"The <tips=78>golden-eyed</tips> girl refused to let go even after being wounded. Still clutching her sister, she kicked off from the ground, but a third swipe swept her legs out from under her and sent her crashing onto her backside.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r184","rowIndex":184,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　この距離でこの体勢では、もう逃げることは出来ない。","en":"This close, sprawled as they were, there was no longer any way to escape.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r185","rowIndex":185,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　二人は全身が凍り付くような恐怖と共に、引きつった顔で相手を見たが、怪物はそこに立ち止まったまま動かない。","en":"Frozen to the core with terror, the girls stared at the creature through rigid, contorted faces. But the monster had stopped where it stood and made no further move.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r186","rowIndex":186,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　金色の目でこちらをみつめ、しゅるしゅると相変わらず口元で音を立てている。","en":"Its golden eye watched them as the same hiss continued to issue from its mouth.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r187","rowIndex":187,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「早くっ！　石をっ！」","en":"“Quick! A rock!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r188","rowIndex":188,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　もう一人の指示で、<tips=78>金目</tips>の方が慌ててそのあたりに落ちているうちで一番大きそうな石をつかみ取ると、尻餅の姿勢のまま思い切り相手に投げつけた。","en":"At the other girl’s command, the <tips=78>golden-eyed</tips> twin snatched up what looked like the largest stone lying nearby and, still sitting where she had fallen, hurled it with all her strength.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r189","rowIndex":189,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　鈍い音と共に、怪物の頭の辺りで血がはじける。","en":"With a dull thud, blood burst from the monster’s head.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r190","rowIndex":190,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　今度は無事狙った場所に命中してくれた。怪物は空気を切り裂くような甲高い悲鳴を上げて、全身を震わせる。","en":"This time, the stone hit exactly where she had aimed. The monster let out a high-pitched shriek that split the air, its whole body convulsing.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r191","rowIndex":191,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして<tips=86>双子</tips>はその間に立ち上がると、恐怖に急かされ不十分な体勢のまま駆け出し、泳ぐようによろけながらその場を離れた。","en":"In that moment, <tips=86>the twins</tips> struggled to their feet and took off before they had fully regained their balance, driven on by fear. They staggered away in a flailing motion, almost as if they were swimming.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r192","rowIndex":192,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1><tips=1>亮</tips></tips>と<tips=10>道夫</tips>は空き地の中央で向かい合っていた。","en":"<tips=1><tips=1>Ryo</tips></tips> and <tips=10>Michio</tips> stood facing each other in the center of a vacant lot.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r193","rowIndex":193,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その周囲をそれそれぞれの仲間が取り囲んでいる。これからこの二人の少年が彼らを代表して戦いをはじめるのだ。取り囲む少年たちにとって、二人は自分たちの運命を握るリーダーであると共に、闘鶏の鶏や闘犬の犬と同じ、見世物として戦う宿命を負った存在でもあった。","en":"Their respective friends formed a ring around them. The two boys were about to begin fighting as their representatives. To the boys watching, they were leaders who held everyone’s fate in their hands. Yet they were also like roosters in a cockfight or dogs in a dogfight—creatures condemned to fight as a spectacle.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r194","rowIndex":194,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　観衆の興奮と緊張が張り詰めたそのど真ん中で、二人はそれぞれ涼しい顔をしてお互いを見つめ合っている。こうして立つと<tips=10>道夫</tips>の方が頭半分くらい背が高かったが、<tips=1>亮</tips>は特に怯む様子もない。","en":"At the very center of all that taut excitement and tension, the two boys faced each other, both looking perfectly calm. Standing face-to-face, <tips=10>Michio</tips> was about half a head taller, but <tips=1>Ryo</tips> showed no sign of being intimidated.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r195","rowIndex":195,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　二人の間に立っているのは、どちらのグループにも属さない西町のチャイという少年で、<tips=1>亮</tips>たちより二つ年上のタイ人だ。体格が良く腕っ節が強い上に、温厚で人格も認められているため、立会人として引っ張り出された。","en":"Standing between them was Chai, a boy from West Town who belonged to neither group. A Thai two years older than <tips=1>Ryo</tips> and the others, he was big and strong but also mild-mannered and widely respected, so they had dragged him in as referee.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r196","rowIndex":196,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いいか、武器やミュータント能力は使おうとした時点で失格だ。気絶をしたらそれ以上攻撃をしてはいけない……」","en":"“Listen carefully. The moment either of you attempts to use a weapon or mutant ability, you’re disqualified. If one of you loses consciousness, the other must not attack him again...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r197","rowIndex":197,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　チャイはぎょろりとした丸い目で二人の顔を交互に見ながら説明を続ける。","en":"Chai went on explaining, his big, round, staring eyes shifting from one boy’s face to the other.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r198","rowIndex":198,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「決着がついたら、勝者と敗者は取り決め通りのものを交換する。<tips=10>道夫</tips>が勝った場合は縄張りを得て、<tips=1>亮</tips>が勝った場合は<tips=10>道夫</tips>の罰ゲームだ。いいな？」","en":"“Once the fight is settled, the stakes will be handed over exactly as agreed. If <tips=10>Michio</tips> wins, he gets the territory. If <tips=1>Ryo</tips> wins, <tips=10>Michio</tips> submits to the punishment. Understood?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r199","rowIndex":199,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ああ」","en":"“Yeah.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫（少年時代）","displayName":"Michio Mido (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r200","rowIndex":200,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　と返事をしたのは<tips=10>道夫</tips>。","en":"<tips=10>Michio</tips> was the one who answered.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r201","rowIndex":201,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>は無言でこくりと頷く。","en":"<tips=1>Ryo</tips> silently gave a small nod.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r202","rowIndex":202,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「よし、じゃあ……」","en":"“All right. Then—”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r203","rowIndex":203,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そしてチャイが戦いの開始を告げようとしたときだった。","en":"It was just as Chai was about to signal the start of the fight.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r204","rowIndex":204,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　うしろの方にいた少年たちがざわめきはじめる。これから戦おうとしている二人も、怪訝な顔で振り返った。","en":"The boys toward the rear began to murmur. The two who had been about to fight turned with puzzled expressions.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r205","rowIndex":205,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　すると、二人の少女が真っ青な顔で空き地に入って来るのが見えた。","en":"Then they saw two girls entering the vacant lot, their faces drained of color.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r206","rowIndex":206,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　普段勝ち気な<tips=86>双子</tips>がそんな顔をしているのも、それぞれ傷付いて腕からポタポタと血を流しているのも異常だ。","en":"It was strange enough to see the ordinarily headstrong <tips=86>twins</tips> wearing such expressions. Stranger still, each was wounded and blood dripped steadily from their arms.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r207","rowIndex":207,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「待っていてくれ」","en":"“Wait a moment.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫（少年時代）","displayName":"Michio Mido (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r208","rowIndex":208,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=10>道夫</tips>は<tips=1>亮</tips>にそう告げると、<tips=86>双子</tips>の近くに駆け寄った。","en":"With that, <tips=10>Michio</tips> left <tips=1>Ryo</tips> and ran over to the <tips=86>twins</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r209","rowIndex":209,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「おい、どうしたんだ。その怪我は……」","en":"“Hey. What happened? Those injuries...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫（少年時代）","displayName":"Michio Mido (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r210","rowIndex":210,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「化け物が……」","en":"“A monster...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"灰上璃映子（少女）","displayName":"Rieko Haigami (Girl)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r211","rowIndex":211,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「クモみたいなやつに襲われて……」","en":"“Something like a spider attacked us...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"灰上江梨子（少女）","displayName":"Eriko Haigami (Girl)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r212","rowIndex":212,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=86>双子</tips>は今にも泣き出しそうに顔をしかめてそう言った。","en":"<tips=86>The twins</tips> said it with their faces screwed up, on the verge of tears.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r213","rowIndex":213,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ごめん、決闘の邪魔をして……」","en":"“Sorry we interrupted the duel.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"灰上璃映子（少女）","displayName":"Rieko Haigami (Girl)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r214","rowIndex":214,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「でも、<tips=10>見土道夫</tips>に頼るしかなかったんだ……」","en":"“But we had no one to turn to except <tips=10>Michio Mido</tips>...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"灰上江梨子（少女）","displayName":"Eriko Haigami (Girl)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r215","rowIndex":215,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「気にするな。それより、傷を見せてみろ」","en":"“Don’t worry about that. Let me see your wounds.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫（少年時代）","displayName":"Michio Mido (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r216","rowIndex":216,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=10>道夫</tips>は<tips=86>双子</tips>の腕を掴むと、服ごと引き裂かれ、鮮血をしたたらせるその傷口を見た。","en":"<tips=10>Michio</tips> took hold of <tips=86>the twins</tips>’ arms and examined the wounds that had torn right through their clothes and were still dripping fresh blood.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r217","rowIndex":217,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「安心しろ。切れているのはほんの表面だけだ。大した傷じゃない。だけれど、消毒はしたほうがいいな……おい、<tips=66>コンタ</tips>」","en":"“Don’t worry. The cuts are only superficial. They’re nothing serious. We should disinfect them, though... Hey, <tips=66>Konta</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫（少年時代）","displayName":"Michio Mido (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r218","rowIndex":218,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=10>道夫</tips>は傍らで見ていた<tips=66>紺太</tips>を呼ぶと、決闘後のために用意していた消毒薬やガーゼで<tips=86>双子</tips>の傷の手当てをはじめる。","en":"<tips=10>Michio</tips> called to <tips=66>Konta</tips>, who stood nearby, and began treating <tips=86>the twins</tips> with the disinfectant and gauze they had prepared for after the duel.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r219","rowIndex":219,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「化け物ってどういうことだ？」","en":"“What do you mean, a monster?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮（少年時代）","displayName":"Tse Leung (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r220","rowIndex":220,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　いつの間にかそばまで来ていた<tips=1>亮</tips>が、腕を差し出し<tips=10>道夫</tips>に手当てをさせている<tips=86>双子</tips>にそう訊ねる。","en":"<tips=1>Ryo</tips> had approached without their noticing. He put the question to the <tips=86>twins</tips> as they held out their arms for <tips=10>Michio</tips> to treat.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r221","rowIndex":221,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして<tips=86>双子</tips>は、悔しそうな顔で今さっきそこで起きたことを説明した。","en":"The <tips=86>twins</tips>, looking bitterly frustrated, explained what had happened there only moments before.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r222","rowIndex":222,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　正体不明の凶悪な怪物の話に、その場の少年たちはざわめき出す。","en":"The boys gathered there began murmuring at this story of a vicious, unidentified monster.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r223","rowIndex":223,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「クモみたいなやつか……聞いたことがないな。外からやって来たんだろうか？」","en":"“Something like a spider... I’ve never heard of anything like that. Could it have come from outside...?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮（少年時代）","displayName":"Tse Leung (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r224","rowIndex":224,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>は難しい顔で首を捻った。","en":"<tips=1>Ryo</tips> frowned and cocked his head in thought.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r225","rowIndex":225,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「もしかして、<tips=15>ボーダー</tips>から来たんじゃないか？」","en":"“Could it have come from the <tips=15>border</tips>?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫（少年時代）","displayName":"Michio Mido (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r226","rowIndex":226,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　手当てを終えた<tips=10>道夫</tips>はそう言った。その顔には憤りを浮かべている。<tips=86>双子</tips>が傷つけられたことに怒っているのだ。","en":"<tips=10>Michio</tips> said this after finishing the treatment. His face was tight with anger: he was furious that the <tips=86>twins</tips> had been hurt.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r227","rowIndex":227,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いやどうだろう。そんなやつはいないはずだけど」","en":"“I don’t know about that. There shouldn’t be anything like it there.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮（少年時代）","displayName":"Tse Leung (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r228","rowIndex":228,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>は首をひねる。","en":"<tips=1>Ryo</tips> cocked his head.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r229","rowIndex":229,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=15>ボーダー</tips>にはわけのわからないやつが沢山隠れてるぜ。まあ何にしろ、危険なやつには違いない。……悪いが、決闘はまた今度にしてくれないか？」","en":"“There are all kinds of things no one understands hiding in the <tips=15>border</tips>. Whatever it is, there’s no question it’s dangerous. ...Sorry, but can we put the duel off till another time?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫（少年時代）","displayName":"Michio Mido (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r230","rowIndex":230,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ああ。もちろんだ」","en":"“Yeah. Of course.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮（少年時代）","displayName":"Tse Leung (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r231","rowIndex":231,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「すまないな」","en":"“Sorry.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫（少年時代）","displayName":"Michio Mido (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r232","rowIndex":232,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=10>道夫</tips>は<tips=1>亮</tips>にそう謝り、また<tips=86>双子</tips>に向かった。","en":"<tips=10>Michio</tips> apologized to <tips=1>Ryo</tips>, then turned back to <tips=86>the twins</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r233","rowIndex":233,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「とりあえず、今日はおまえたちは団地に戻るんだ。送ってやる。その化け物のことはおれたちに任せて休んだ方が良い」","en":"“For now, you two are going back to the housing complex. I’ll escort you. Leave the monster to us and get some rest.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫（少年時代）","displayName":"Michio Mido (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r234","rowIndex":234,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「でも……」","en":"“But...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"灰上璃映子（少女）","displayName":"Rieko Haigami (Girl)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r235","rowIndex":235,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「私たちだけ逃げられない」","en":"“We can’t be the only ones who run away.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"灰上江梨子（少女）","displayName":"Eriko Haigami (Girl)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r236","rowIndex":236,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=86>双子</tips>は目を涙ぐませてはいるが、唇をぐっと噛み、負けん気をあらわにして言った。","en":"Tears stood in <tips=86>the twins</tips>’ eyes, but they bit down hard on their lips and spoke with fierce determination.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r237","rowIndex":237,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「怪我してるじゃないか」","en":"“But you’re hurt.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫（少年時代）","displayName":"Michio Mido (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r238","rowIndex":238,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=10>道夫</tips>が言うが、<tips=86>双子</tips>は首を横にぶんぶんと振る。","en":"<tips=10>Michio</tips> protested, but the <tips=86>twins</tips> shook their heads hard from side to side.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r239","rowIndex":239,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=10>見土</tips>、そいつらは好きにさせよう。今はとにかく、その怪物と遭遇したって現場に行った方がいいんじゃないか？　頭を怪我してるなら、今がチャンスかもしれない」","en":"“<tips=10>Mido</tips>, let them make their own choice. Right now, shouldn’t we head to where they ran into the monster? If it injured its head, now may be our chance.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮（少年時代）","displayName":"Tse Leung (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r240","rowIndex":240,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>が横から割り込む。","en":"<tips=1>Ryo</tips> interjected from beside him.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r241","rowIndex":241,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=10>道夫</tips>は<tips=1>亮</tips>の顔と<tips=86>双子</tips>の顔を交互に見てから、無言で頷いた。","en":"<tips=10>Michio</tips> looked from <tips=1>Ryo</tips> to the <tips=86>twins</tips>, then nodded silently.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r242","rowIndex":242,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ね、ねえ<tips=10>道夫</tips>君、そんな怪物と戦うつもりかい？」","en":"“H-hey, <tips=10>Michio</tips>, are you planning to fight a monster like that?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"紺太（少年時代）","displayName":"Konta (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r243","rowIndex":243,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=66>紺太</tips>が驚いて言う。","en":"<tips=66>Konta</tips> asked in astonishment.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r244","rowIndex":244,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「当たり前だろ。縄張りでそんな怪物に好き勝手されてたまるか。なあ、そうだろ！」","en":"“Of course. I’m not gonna let some monster do whatever it wants in my turf. Am I right?!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫（少年時代）","displayName":"Michio Mido (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r245","rowIndex":245,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=10>道夫</tips>は仲間たちに言うと、彼らも「おう」と返事をした。","en":"<tips=10>Michio</tips> called to his companions, and they answered, “Yeah!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r246","rowIndex":246,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あんたも来るのかい？」","en":"“Are you coming too?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"紺太（少年時代）","displayName":"Konta (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r247","rowIndex":247,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　困った<tips=66>紺太</tips>は次に<tips=1>亮</tips>の方に尋ねる。","en":"At a loss, <tips=66>Konta</tips> next turned to <tips=1>Ryo</tips> and asked.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r248","rowIndex":248,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ああ。どんなやつなのか興味がある」","en":"“Yeah. I’m interested in seeing what kind of creature it is.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮（少年時代）","displayName":"Tse Leung (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r249","rowIndex":249,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>も静かに頷いた。","en":"<tips=1>Ryo</tips> also nodded calmly.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r250","rowIndex":250,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして、結局その場にいた少年たちはみな、<tips=86>双子</tips>が襲われたという場所へ急行した。","en":"In the end, every boy there hurried to the place where the <tips=86>twins</tips> had been attacked.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r251","rowIndex":251,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「だ、誰もいないね」","en":"“Th-there’s nobody here.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"紺太（少年時代）","displayName":"Konta (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r252","rowIndex":252,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　両手に握った棒きれを構えている<tips=66>紺太</tips>は、恐怖と緊張で、こめかみに汗をかいている。","en":"<tips=66>Konta</tips> stood ready with a stick in each hand, sweat beading at his temples from fear and tension.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r253","rowIndex":253,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　一同が駆けつけたとき既にそこには誰の姿もなく、ただ土の上に血痕だけが残されているだけだった。","en":"By the time they arrived, there was no one in sight. Only bloodstains remained on the dirt.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r254","rowIndex":254,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どこへ行ったんだろうな？　人混みの方へ行ったんなら、騒ぎになっているはずだが」","en":"“Where could it have gone? If it headed somewhere crowded, there ought to be an uproar.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫（少年時代）","displayName":"Michio Mido (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r255","rowIndex":255,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=10>道夫</tips>は周囲を見回すが、その化け物が逃げた方向の手がかりになりそうなものは見つからなかった。","en":"<tips=10>Michio</tips> searched the area, but found nothing to tell him which way the monster had fled.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r256","rowIndex":256,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　一方<tips=1>亮</tips>は連れてきた<tips=55>松子</tips>と共に血痕を取り囲んでしゃがみ込んでいる。","en":"Meanwhile, <tips=1>Ryo</tips> and <tips=55>Matsuko</tips>, whom he had brought with him, were crouched around the bloodstains.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r257","rowIndex":257,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「何か、においはするかい？」","en":"“Can you smell anything?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮（少年時代）","displayName":"Tse Leung (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r258","rowIndex":258,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　言われて<tips=55>松子</tips>は鼻をくんくんとさせてから、眉間に小さくしわを寄せて、首を横に振る。","en":"At his request, <tips=55>Matsuko</tips> sniffed several times, knit her brow slightly, and shook her head.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r259","rowIndex":259,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうか」","en":"“I see.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮（少年時代）","displayName":"Tse Leung (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r260","rowIndex":260,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>は顎に手を当てて考え込み、すると彼を見ている<tips=10>道夫</tips>と目が合った。","en":"<tips=1>Ryo</tips> rested a hand on his chin and sank into thought. Then he met the gaze of <tips=10>Michio</tips>, who was watching him.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r261","rowIndex":261,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「この子は<tips=17>タイプB</tips>の特性がとても強く出ていてね。嗅覚も犬並みとは言わないが、とても優れているんだ」","en":"“Her <tips=17>Type B</tips> traits are especially pronounced. I wouldn’t say her nose is as good as a dog’s, but she has an excellent sense of smell.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮（少年時代）","displayName":"Tse Leung (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r262","rowIndex":262,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>は聞かれる前に説明をする。","en":"<tips=1>Ryo</tips> explained before anyone could ask.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r263","rowIndex":263,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「じゃあ、発症しているのか？」","en":"“Then has she developed symptoms?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫（少年時代）","displayName":"Michio Mido (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r264","rowIndex":264,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いや、そうじゃない。ちょっと変わってるんだ……」","en":"“No, nothing like that. She’s simply a little unusual...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮（少年時代）","displayName":"Tse Leung (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r265","rowIndex":265,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>は立ち上がると、","en":"<tips=1>Ryo</tips> rose.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r266","rowIndex":266,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まあ、これだけの傷を負ってるなら、探せばどこかに血が落ちているのを見つけられるだろう。分散した方が効率はいいが……<tips=10>見土</tips>、僕たちと別れてもお前らだけで倒す自信はあるか？」","en":"“Well, with a wound that bad, there should be a trail of blood somewhere if we look. We’d cover more ground if we split up, but... <tips=10>Mido</tips>, are you sure you and your people can take it down without us?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮（少年時代）","displayName":"Tse Leung (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r267","rowIndex":267,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=1>菅原</tips>」","en":"“<tips=1>Sugawara</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫（少年時代）","displayName":"Michio Mido (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r268","rowIndex":268,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=10>道夫</tips>は不本意そうに唇をとがらせ、黒い腕を突き出すと、","en":"<tips=10>Michio</tips> pursed his lips in displeasure and thrust out his black arm.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r269","rowIndex":269,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「おれを侮ってもらっちゃ困る。お前らこそ大丈夫か？」","en":"“You’d better not underestimate me. What about you—are you sure you’ll be all right?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫（少年時代）","displayName":"Michio Mido (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r270","rowIndex":270,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「僕らは負けやしない」","en":"“We won’t lose.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮（少年時代）","displayName":"Tse Leung (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r271","rowIndex":271,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ふん、じゃあどちらが先に見つけてやっつけるか、勝負だな」","en":"“Hmph. Then let’s see which of us can find it and take it down first.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫（少年時代）","displayName":"Michio Mido (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r272","rowIndex":272,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして少年たちはそれぞれのグループに分かれて近くを探すことになった。","en":"The boys then split into their respective groups to search nearby.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r273","rowIndex":273,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼らは手に棒きれやバット、それからナイフなどを持っている。通りがかった人は顔を顰めてそそくさと離れようとしたが、少年たちは気にしない。こちらから積極的に声をかけて、この辺りで怪物を見なかったかと尋ねたりもした。","en":"They carried sticks, bats, knives, and similar weapons. Passersby frowned and hurried to put distance between them, but the boys paid no attention. Indeed, they actively approached people and asked whether they had seen a monster nearby.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r274","rowIndex":274,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そうしてしばらく付近を調べたが、しかし、怪物は見つからず、追跡の手がかりになりそうなものも見つからなかった。","en":"They searched the vicinity for some time, but found neither the monster nor any clue that might allow them to pursue it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r275","rowIndex":275,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「すぐ血が止まっちゃったのかな。何にしろ、もう近くにはいないだろう。一旦空き地に戻って作戦を練ろう」","en":"“Maybe the bleeding stopped right away. Either way, it probably isn’t nearby anymore. Let’s return to the vacant lot for now and work out a plan.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮（少年時代）","displayName":"Tse Leung (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r276","rowIndex":276,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>はそう言って溜息をつく。そして自分の仲間をまとめて引き返そうとすると、","en":"<tips=1>Ryo</tips> let out a sigh, then gathered his companions and started to head back, when—","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r277","rowIndex":277,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「お、おい」","en":"“H-hey.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫（少年時代）","displayName":"Michio Mido (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r278","rowIndex":278,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そこで納得がいかないのは<tips=10>道夫</tips>だった。","en":"<tips=10>Michio</tips> was not satisfied.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r279","rowIndex":279,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「さっきからなんでお前が全部指示出してるんだよ？」","en":"“How come you’ve been the one giving all the orders this whole time?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫（少年時代）","displayName":"Michio Mido (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r280","rowIndex":280,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……何か他の提案があるのか？　それなら聞くけど」","en":"“...Have you got another idea? If you do, let’s hear it.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮（少年時代）","displayName":"Tse Leung (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r281","rowIndex":281,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>が冷たい視線を浴びせかけると、<tips=10>道夫</tips>は肩をすくめ、","en":"When <tips=1>Ryo</tips> shot him a cold look, <tips=10>Michio</tips> shrugged.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r282","rowIndex":282,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「い、いや、そういうわけじゃないけどさ……」","en":"“N-no, I don’t mean that exactly.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫（少年時代）","displayName":"Michio Mido (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r283","rowIndex":283,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「じゃあ行くぞ。時間がもったいない」","en":"“Then let’s go. We’re wasting time.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮（少年時代）","displayName":"Tse Leung (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r284","rowIndex":284,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>が無愛想に歩き出すと、<tips=10>道夫</tips>は渋いお茶でも飲んでしまったような顔をする。","en":"When <tips=1>Ryo</tips> turned and walked off without a word, <tips=10>Michio</tips> made a face as if he'd swallowed a mouthful of bitter tea.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r285","rowIndex":285,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あいつ生意気だな。あとでシメちゃおうよ？」","en":"“He’s got some nerve. Want to rough him up later?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"紺太（少年時代）","displayName":"Konta (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r286","rowIndex":286,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=66>紺太</tips>が隣で耳打ちするも、<tips=10>道夫</tips>は複雑な表情をするだけで何も答えず、","en":"<tips=66>Konta</tips> whispered in his ear, but <tips=10>Michio</tips> only looked conflicted and said nothing.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r287","rowIndex":287,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「おれたちも戻るぞ！」","en":"“We’re going back too!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫（少年時代）","displayName":"Michio Mido (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r288","rowIndex":288,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　仲間にそう呼びかけた。","en":"He called out to his companions.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r289","rowIndex":289,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　空き地に戻ると、<tips=86>双子</tips>が何気なく携帯を取り出して、顔色を変える。","en":"When they returned to the vacant lot, the <tips=86>twins</tips> casually pulled out a phone, then went pale.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r290","rowIndex":290,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どうした？」","en":"“What’s wrong?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫（少年時代）","displayName":"Michio Mido (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r291","rowIndex":291,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=10>道夫</tips>の呼びかけで<tips=86>双子</tips>は顔を上げる。","en":"At <tips=10>Michio’s</tips> call, the <tips=86>twins</tips> looked up.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r292","rowIndex":292,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「団地の友だちから、メールが来てたみたい……」","en":"“It looks like we got an email from a friend in the housing complex...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"灰上璃映子（少女）","displayName":"Rieko Haigami (Girl)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r293","rowIndex":293,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「私の部屋から、怪物が出て来たのを見たんだって……」","en":"“They said they saw a monster coming out of my room...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"灰上江梨子（少女）","displayName":"Eriko Haigami (Girl)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r294","rowIndex":294,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　団地の友人が遊びに誘おうと部屋の近くまで来たとき、開いたドアから手足の長い毛むくじゃらの怪物が飛び出してくるのを目撃したらしい。友人は怯えて腰を抜かしてしまい、怪物は確かにその姿を見たはずだが、一瞥するだけで去っていったと言う。","en":"Their friend had come by their room to ask them to play when a long-limbed, shaggy monster burst through the open door. Their legs gave out in terror. The monster had clearly seen them, but apparently left after no more than a glance.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r295","rowIndex":295,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「きっと、襲ってきたあいつだよ！　私たちの部屋も知ってるんだ」","en":"“It must be the thing that attacked us! It knows where our room is, too.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"灰上璃映子（少女）","displayName":"Rieko Haigami (Girl)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r296","rowIndex":296,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どうして……」","en":"“But how...?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"灰上江梨子（少女）","displayName":"Eriko Haigami (Girl)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r297","rowIndex":297,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「メールが送信されたのはいつだ？」","en":"“When was the email sent?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮（少年時代）","displayName":"Tse Leung (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r298","rowIndex":298,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>が<tips=10>道夫</tips>の後からそう訊ねる。","en":"<tips=1>Ryo</tips> asked from behind <tips=10>Michio</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r299","rowIndex":299,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「大分前だよ」","en":"“Quite a while ago.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"灰上璃映子（少女）","displayName":"Rieko Haigami (Girl)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r300","rowIndex":300,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「私たちが怪物と遭う前。きっと、団地を出た直後くらいだと思う」","en":"“Before we ran into the monster. I think it was probably just after we left the housing complex.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"灰上江梨子（少女）","displayName":"Eriko Haigami (Girl)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r301","rowIndex":301,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=86>双子</tips>は<tips=1>亮</tips>にその画面を見せる。","en":"<tips=86>The twins</tips> showed <tips=1>Ryo</tips> the screen.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r302","rowIndex":302,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「じゃあ、出るのが遅れていたら、自分の部屋で対面することになってたわけか」","en":"“So if you’d left a little later, you’d have come face-to-face with it in your own room.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫（少年時代）","displayName":"Michio Mido (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r303","rowIndex":303,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=10>道夫</tips>は腕組みをしてそう呟く。","en":"<tips=10>Michio</tips> murmured, folding his arms.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r304","rowIndex":304,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「しかし、これはまずいことになったね」","en":"“Still, this is bad.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮（少年時代）","displayName":"Tse Leung (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r305","rowIndex":305,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>は眉間にしわを寄せて言う。","en":"<tips=1>Ryo</tips> furrowed his brow.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r306","rowIndex":306,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「時系列的には、怪物はまず団地に行ってきみらの部屋を訪ね、それから<tips=9>Y地区</tips>に移動してきみらを襲ったわけだ。きみらを追いかけてきたのかな」","en":"“Going by the timeline, the monster went to the housing complex and checked your room first. Then it came to <tips=9>Y District</tips> and attacked you. Maybe it followed you?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮（少年時代）","displayName":"Tse Leung (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r307","rowIndex":307,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その言葉に、<tips=86>双子</tips>は顔を真っ青にしてうつむく。","en":"At those words, the <tips=86>twins</tips> went deathly pale and lowered their heads.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r308","rowIndex":308,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうだとすれば、ただごとじゃないな。それに、思ってるより厄介な相手かもしれない。声をかけた通行人は誰も怪物の話なんか知らなかったじゃないか。大通りを避けて、裏通りを追ってきたんだろう。そういうことをする程度の知性はあるんだ」","en":"“If that’s what happened, we’re dealing with something serious. And it may be more trouble than we thought. None of the people we stopped had heard anything about a monster, remember? It must have avoided the main roads and followed you through the backstreets. So it’s at least smart enough to do that.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮（少年時代）","displayName":"Tse Leung (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r309","rowIndex":309,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「狙われる心当たりはあるか？」","en":"“Can you think of any reason it would target you?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫（少年時代）","displayName":"Michio Mido (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r310","rowIndex":310,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=10>道夫</tips>が訊ねると、<tips=86>双子</tips>は完全に動きを同調させて、首を横にぶんぶんと振る。","en":"At <tips=10>Michio’s</tips> question, the <tips=86>twins</tips> shook their heads vigorously, every movement perfectly synchronized.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r311","rowIndex":311,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「よく思い出せ。何かあるはずだ」","en":"“Think hard. There has to be something.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫（少年時代）","displayName":"Michio Mido (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r312","rowIndex":312,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=10>道夫</tips>はさらに訊ねるが、<tips=86>双子</tips>は唇をわなわなと震わせて否定する。","en":"<tips=10>Michio</tips> pressed them again, but the <tips=86>twins</tips>, their lips trembling, insisted they had no idea.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r313","rowIndex":313,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「わ、わからないよっ！」","en":"“I-I don’t know!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"灰上璃映子（少女）","displayName":"Rieko Haigami (Girl)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r314","rowIndex":314,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あんなの、絶対に見たことないわっ！」","en":"“I’ve never seen anything like that in my life!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"灰上江梨子（少女）","displayName":"Eriko Haigami (Girl)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r315","rowIndex":315,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まあ、別に知らなくてもおかしくないよ」","en":"“Well, it’s perfectly possible you wouldn’t know.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮（少年時代）","displayName":"Tse Leung (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r316","rowIndex":316,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>は考えながら言葉を口にする。","en":"<tips=1>Ryo</tips> thought aloud.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r317","rowIndex":317,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「怪物はきっと発症したハイブリッドのなれの果てなんだろうけど、だとしたら、<tips=17>タイプＢ</tips>特有の妄想に取り憑かれて、一方的な理由でこの<tips=86>双子</tips>につきまとっているのかもしれない。……ただ、妄想にしても全く接触がないとは考えにくい。どこかでちょっと見かけたとか、何かで写真を見たとか、そういうきっかけはあるかもしれない。近くに住んでるとか……知人の知人だとか……」","en":"“That monster is probably what became of a hybrid after onset. If so, it may be in the grip of the delusions unique to <tips=17>Type B</tips>, and stalking the <tips=86>twins</tips> for reasons that make sense only to it. ...Still, even a delusion usually needs some point of contact. Maybe it caught a glimpse of them somewhere, or saw them in a photograph. Something small like that could have set it off. Maybe it lives nearby... or knows someone they know...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮（少年時代）","displayName":"Tse Leung (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r318","rowIndex":318,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それでも、全然思い当たらないよ」","en":"“I still can’t think of anything.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"灰上璃映子（少女）","displayName":"Rieko Haigami (Girl)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r319","rowIndex":319,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あんな姿だったらもっとみんな知ってるはずなのに、聞いたことないってことは、遠い人だよきっと」","en":"“If it looked like that, more people would have to know about it. Since no one’s heard of it, it must be from somewhere far away.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"灰上江梨子（少女）","displayName":"Eriko Haigami (Girl)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r320","rowIndex":320,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=86>双子</tips>は交互に否定する。","en":"The <tips=86>twins</tips> took turns insisting they had no idea.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r321","rowIndex":321,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうか。……まあとにかく、住まいが知られているのならこのまま団地に帰るのは危険だな。しかし、荒らされた部屋の様子は確認しておきたいところだ」","en":"“I see. ...Anyway, if it knows where you live, going straight back to the housing complex would be dangerous. Still, we need to see what it did to your room.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮（少年時代）","displayName":"Tse Leung (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r322","rowIndex":322,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>が考え込むと、周囲は自然と黙って彼の答えを待つ格好になる。普段から彼をリーダーと認める<tips=58>パラシュート通り</tips>の仲間たちはもとより、さっきまで文句を言っていた<tips=10>道夫</tips>をはじめとする<tips=59>暗闇通り</tips>の子供たちも自然と<tips=1>亮</tips>に注目している。","en":"When <tips=1>Ryo</tips> fell into thought, everyone around him went quiet and waited for his answer. His friends from <tips=58>Parachute Street</tips> already regarded him as their leader, but even <tips=10>Michio</tips> and the other children from <tips=59>Darkness Street</tips>, who had been complaining only moments ago, now found themselves watching <tips=1>Ryo</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r323","rowIndex":323,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「よし、<tips=86>双子</tips>は<tips=57>滑走路通り</tips>に行って、喫茶店かどこかに入って待っていてくれ。人が大勢居るところの方が安全かもしれない。まあ怪物が本当に人目を避けているっていう保証はないけどね。でもそうだとしても、あれだけごちゃごちゃしたところならそう簡単には見つからない。……<tips=55>松子</tips>も一緒に行ってやってくれるかい？」","en":"“All right. <tips=86>You two</tips> should go to <tips=57>Runway Street</tips> and wait in a cafe or somewhere. You might be safer around lots of people. There’s no guarantee the monster really is avoiding crowds, of course. But even if it isn’t, it won’t find you easily in a place that busy. ...<tips=55>Matsuko</tips>, would you go with them?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮（少年時代）","displayName":"Tse Leung (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r324","rowIndex":324,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=55>松子</tips>は黙ったまま頷くと、<tips=86>双子</tips>のそばに移動する。","en":"<tips=55>Matsuko</tips> nodded without a word and moved beside <tips=86>the twins</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r325","rowIndex":325,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「団地には僕と<tips=10>見土</tips>の二人だけで行く。残りの連中は解散だ。もし何かしたいなら、ネットで街の噂を調べたりして、怪物の目撃情報をあさっていてくれ。そして何かあったら僕に報告するんだ。間違っても自分たちで探そうとしたらいけない」","en":"“<tips=10>Mido</tips> and I will go to the housing complex, just the two of us. The rest of you can go home. If you want to help, look up rumors about the city online and see if anyone’s reported the monster. Let me know if you find anything. Whatever you do, don’t go looking for it yourselves.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮（少年時代）","displayName":"Tse Leung (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r326","rowIndex":326,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「解散ってさ、おれたちだって手伝うよ」","en":"“Go home? We can help too!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"紺太（少年時代）","displayName":"Konta (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r327","rowIndex":327,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　と声をあげたのは<tips=66>紺太</tips>だ。彼は顔を蒼白にして怯えてはいるが、ここで帰されるのは気にいらないらしい。","en":"<tips=66>Konta</tips> was the one who protested. His face had gone pale with fear, but the idea of being sent home clearly didn’t sit well with him.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r328","rowIndex":328,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それはだめだ。街の不良少年が徒党を組んで団地に行ったりしたら、ややこしいトラブルが増えるだけだ」","en":"“No. If a whole gang of delinquents from town marches into the housing complex, it’ll only make things more complicated.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮（少年時代）","displayName":"Tse Leung (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r329","rowIndex":329,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>は即座にそう答える。","en":"<tips=1>Ryo</tips> answered at once.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r330","rowIndex":330,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「じゃ、じゃあさ<tips=86>双子</tips>を守るよ。その<tips=55>松子</tips>って子を一緒に行かせたって意味がないだろ」","en":"“Th-then we’ll protect the <tips=86>twins</tips>. There’s no point sending that <tips=55>Matsuko</tips> girl with them, is there?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"紺太（少年時代）","displayName":"Konta (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r331","rowIndex":331,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=66>紺太</tips>はそう食い下がる。","en":"<tips=66>Konta</tips> refused to let it go.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r332","rowIndex":332,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「全員で行動したら目立ちすぎる。それに、ボディーガードは<tips=55>松子</tips>だけで十分だ。その子は見た目と違って、とんでもなく強いからね。かえって足手まといになる」","en":"“We’d stand out too much if we all went around together. Besides, <tips=55>Matsuko</tips> is all the bodyguard they need. She may not look it, but she’s unbelievably strong. You’d only get in her way.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮（少年時代）","displayName":"Tse Leung (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r333","rowIndex":333,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうは見えないけど……」","en":"“She doesn’t look it...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"紺太（少年時代）","displayName":"Konta (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r334","rowIndex":334,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=66>紺太</tips>は無表情に立つ<tips=55>松子</tips>の顔を見てから、","en":"<tips=66>Konta</tips> looked at <tips=55>Matsuko’s</tips> expressionless face, then—","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r335","rowIndex":335,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=10>道夫</tips>君、どう思う？」","en":"“What do you think, <tips=10>Michio</tips>?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"紺太（少年時代）","displayName":"Konta (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r336","rowIndex":336,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=17>タイプB</tips>ならそういうことはありえる。それに、<tips=1>菅原</tips>はこんなときに嘘をついたりはしないだろう」","en":"“If she’s <tips=17>Type B</tips>, it’s possible. Besides, <tips=1>Sugawara</tips> wouldn’t lie about something like this.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫（少年時代）","displayName":"Michio Mido (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r337","rowIndex":337,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=10>道夫</tips>はそう言ってから、<tips=1>亮</tips>の方を向き、","en":"<tips=10>Michio</tips> then turned to <tips=1>Ryo</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r338","rowIndex":338,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そのプランで行こう」","en":"“We’ll go with your plan.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫（少年時代）","displayName":"Michio Mido (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r339","rowIndex":339,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ありがとう」","en":"“Thanks.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮（少年時代）","displayName":"Tse Leung (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r340","rowIndex":340,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>はうっすら笑うと、","en":"<tips=1>Ryo</tips> gave him a faint smile, then—","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r341","rowIndex":341,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「じゃあ、先に団地の方に行っていてくれないか。僕はちょっと家で物をとって来たらすぐに向かう」","en":"“Then could you head to the housing complex first? I just need to grab something from home, and I’ll be right behind you.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮（少年時代）","displayName":"Tse Leung (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r342","rowIndex":342,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そしてすぐに<tips=55>松子</tips>と<tips=86>双子</tips>は<tips=57>滑走路通り</tips>の方へ向かい、<tips=10>道夫</tips>は<tips=13>ヘドロ団地</tips>へ行くことになった。","en":"Then <tips=55>Matsuko</tips> and the <tips=86>twins</tips> immediately headed toward <tips=57>Runway Street</tips>, while <tips=10>Michio</tips> set out for the <tips=13>Sludge Housing Complex</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r343","rowIndex":343,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>は一旦家に帰ると、すぐに<tips=10>道夫</tips>のあとを追いかけて団地の手前で合流する。","en":"<tips=1>Ryo</tips> made a quick trip home, then hurried after <tips=10>Michio</tips> and caught up with him just outside the complex.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r344","rowIndex":344,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　目の前に広がる巨大な団地の群れの、壁の高い方はひび割れ蔦が生い茂り、手の届く部分にはペンキで卑猥な言葉や、妙に手慣れたイラストなど、好き放題落書きがされている。","en":"A vast mass of apartment blocks spread out before them. High overhead, the walls were cracked and thick with ivy; down within reach, every surface had been freely scrawled with obscene words, strangely accomplished drawings, and whatever else people pleased.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r345","rowIndex":345,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ここから先は<tips=9>Y地区</tips>の市街とはまた違ったルールに支配されている場所であることを、この二人の少年はよく理解していた。","en":"Both boys knew perfectly well that beyond this point, a different set of rules held sway than on the streets of <tips=9>Y District</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r346","rowIndex":346,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「おい、敷地に入ったらおれのそばを離れるなよ」","en":"“Hey. Once we’re inside, don’t wander away from me.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫（少年時代）","displayName":"Michio Mido (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r347","rowIndex":347,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　いよいよ団地に踏み入れる段になって、<tips=10>道夫</tips>は真顔でそう呟いた。","en":"As they stood on the verge of entering the complex, <tips=10>Michio</tips> muttered with a dead-serious look.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r348","rowIndex":348,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そばを？」","en":"“By your side?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮（少年時代）","displayName":"Tse Leung (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r349","rowIndex":349,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「お前だってここのヤバさは知ってるだろ。お前みたいな男だか女だかわからないようなよそ者のガキは、いい獲物だ。おれがこの金の目と腕の力で守ってやる」","en":"“You know how bad this place is. An outsider kid like you, who no one can even tell is a boy or a girl, is easy prey. I’ll protect you with these golden eyes and my mighty arm.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫（少年時代）","displayName":"Michio Mido (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r350","rowIndex":350,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「随分親切だな。だけど、その必要はないよ」","en":"“How kind. But that won’t be necessary.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮（少年時代）","displayName":"Tse Leung (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r351","rowIndex":351,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>は無表情に言って、上着の胸元に手を突っ込むと、黒い物をチラリと<tips=10>道夫</tips>に見せる。","en":"Without changing expression, <tips=1>Ryo</tips> slipped a hand inside his jacket and flashed <tips=10>Michio</tips> a glimpse of something black.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r352","rowIndex":352,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　見間違うはずもない。それはオートマチックピストルであった。彼が家から持って来たのは、こんな恐ろしいものであったのか。","en":"There could be no mistake. It was an automatic pistol. So this was the terrifying thing he had brought from home.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r353","rowIndex":353,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……暴力は嫌いだと言ってた割には、随分好戦的じゃないか」","en":"“For someone who claims to hate violence, you’re remarkably eager for a fight.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫（少年時代）","displayName":"Michio Mido (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r354","rowIndex":354,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「暴力は嫌いだよ。争いはくだらない。目一杯長生きしたって百年も生きないような寿命の短い生物同士が、さらにその寿命を削り合うんだから、そんなのジョークとしか言いようがないと思わないか？　だから僕は、そのくだらないことに使う労力を減らすために、争いの時はなるべく効率的に、手短に済ませるようにしてるのさ」","en":"“I do hate violence. Fighting is stupid. Even if we live as long as we possibly can, creatures like us don’t last a hundred years—yet we spend our time cutting one another’s lives shorter still. Don’t you think that’s a joke? So when I do have to fight, I try to finish it as efficiently and quickly as possible, to waste as little effort as I can on something so stupid.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮（少年時代）","displayName":"Tse Leung (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r355","rowIndex":355,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いい性格してやがる。だが、おれは全く正反対の考え方だな。どうせ人生短いんだから、ちょっとばかり引き延ばそうなんてセコいことは考えず、情熱全部をこの瞬間にかけるぜっ」","en":"“You’re a real piece of work. But I’m the exact opposite. Life’s short anyway, so I’m not gonna waste time on some stingy little scheme to stretch it out. I’ll throw every bit of passion I’ve got into this moment!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫（少年時代）","displayName":"Michio Mido (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r356","rowIndex":356,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうか。でもお前の考え方は僕にとってはどうでもいい」","en":"“I see. But I really don’t care what you think.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮（少年時代）","displayName":"Tse Leung (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r357","rowIndex":357,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　平然と言う<tips=1>亮</tips>に、<tips=10>道夫</tips>はさすがに苦い表情をしつつ、","en":"<tips=1>Ryo</tips> said it without batting an eye. Even <tips=10>Michio</tips> grimaced at that, but—","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r358","rowIndex":358,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「しかし、そんなに暴力がいやなら、おれと決闘するときはどうするつもりだったんだ？　なにか手短に済ませるインチキを考えていたのか？」","en":"“But if you hate violence that much, what were you planning to do when we dueled? Did you have some cheap trick to get it over with quickly?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫（少年時代）","displayName":"Michio Mido (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r359","rowIndex":359,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「話してもいいけれど、それを聞くんなら永久にお前と決闘はしないよ」","en":"“I don’t mind telling you, but if I do, I’ll never duel you.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮（少年時代）","displayName":"Tse Leung (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r360","rowIndex":360,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「言えよ。もうそんな気分じゃない。こんなやつ相手に男の真剣勝負なんか出来るか」","en":"“Tell me. I don’t feel like it anymore anyway. How could I have a serious man-to-man duel with someone like you?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫（少年時代）","displayName":"Michio Mido (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r361","rowIndex":361,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「適当に怪我をしないように殴られて、適当に負けるつもりだったよ。少し考えればわかるだろ？　僕には勝ちに行く理由がない。それとも本当に僕がお前の裸が見たいとでも思ったかい？」","en":"“I was going to let you hit me without getting seriously hurt, then lose when the time seemed right. You could’ve figured that out if you’d thought about it. I had no reason to win. Or did you really think I wanted to see you naked?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮（少年時代）","displayName":"Tse Leung (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r362","rowIndex":362,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……いやなやつだ」","en":"“...You’re a real jerk.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫（少年時代）","displayName":"Michio Mido (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r363","rowIndex":363,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=10>道夫</tips>は舌打ちをして、<tips=1>亮</tips>はおかしそうに笑う。","en":"<tips=10>Michio</tips> clicked his tongue, and <tips=1>Ryo</tips> laughed, amused.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r364","rowIndex":364,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして二人は団地の敷地に足を踏み入れた。","en":"Then the two boys stepped onto the grounds of the housing complex.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r365","rowIndex":365,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=86>双子</tips>の部屋がどこにあるかは聞いてある。そこに向かって歩く途中、何人かの住民とすれ違った。","en":"They had been told where <tips=86>the twins</tips> lived. On the way there, they passed several residents.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r366","rowIndex":366,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　明らかに薬物依存症としか思えない濃いくまを目の下に作った二人の男女。ボディビルダーのように黒光りする逞しい体躯をして、松葉杖を突く義足の男。玩具をもって走り回る子供たち。","en":"A man and woman passed with such heavy shadows under their eyes that they could only be drug addicts; then a powerfully built man, his body gleaming darkly like a bodybuilder’s, walking on crutches with a prosthetic leg; then children running around with toys.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r367","rowIndex":367,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ジロジロと露骨に視線を送ってくるものもいれば、目の前に存在しないかのようにチラとも見ずに通り過ぎて行くものもいる。","en":"Some stared at the boys openly. Others passed without so much as a glance, as though the visitors did not exist.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r368","rowIndex":368,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「聞いているほど大した場所じゃないな。これなら<tips=59>暗闇通り</tips>のほうがよっぽどヤバイぜ」","en":"“This place isn’t nearly as bad as I’d heard. <tips=59>Darkness Street</tips> is way worse than this.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r369","rowIndex":369,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=10>道夫</tips>はそう強がったが、団地のあちこちからこちらを観察する視線を感じていた。","en":"<tips=10>Michio</tips> put on a brave front, but he could feel eyes watching them from all over the complex.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r370","rowIndex":370,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>もそれを察していて何も言わない。ただいつ何が起きてもいいように、上に着ているパーカーのファスナーは下ろし、懐の銃はいつでも取り出せるようにしていた。その格好を見ればすぐに彼が銃を持っていることを悟られてしまうだろうが、それは本人も理解していた。","en":"<tips=1>Ryo</tips> sensed the watching eyes too, but said nothing. He had left his hoodie unzipped so he could draw the pistol inside at the first sign of trouble. Anyone who saw him dressed that way would immediately realize he had a gun, but Ryo knew that perfectly well.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r371","rowIndex":371,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　さて、口の中がカラカラに乾くほど緊張しながらも、二人は目的の建物に足を踏み入れ、ひんやりとする階段をのぼり、どうにか目的の部屋の前に辿り着いた。","en":"Their mouths dry with tension, the boys entered the building they were looking for, climbed the chilly stairs, and finally managed to reach the room.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r372","rowIndex":372,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　聞いたとおりドアは破壊され外れており、真っ二つにされたそれが入り口の脇の壁に立てかけられている。","en":"As they had been told, the door had been broken off. Split cleanly in two, it now leaned against the wall beside the entrance.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r373","rowIndex":373,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　怪物のすさまじい腕力を感じさせるその痕跡の前に二人は無言のまま佇んでしまい、","en":"The evidence of the monster’s tremendous strength left both boys standing speechless.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r374","rowIndex":374,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「入ろう」","en":"“Let’s go inside.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫（少年時代）","displayName":"Michio Mido (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r375","rowIndex":375,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　と、<tips=10>見土</tips>が声をかけるまで彫像のようにかたまっていた。","en":"Until <tips=10>Mido</tips> spoke, they had remained frozen like statues.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r376","rowIndex":376,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　部屋のなかはまるで暴風が通り過ぎたようだった。玄関を入ると、まず天井から垂れ下がった少女の部屋らしいピンク色ののれんが切り裂かれたのが目に入り、そして、ドアというドアが全部開け放たれていずれも痛々しい爪痕で傷ついている。","en":"The apartment looked as though a storm had torn through it. The first thing they saw beyond the entrance was a pink curtain—the sort one might expect in a young girl’s room—hanging from the ceiling in tatters. Every door stood wide open, each one scarred with ugly claw marks.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r377","rowIndex":377,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　靴を脱ごうとする<tips=10>道夫</tips>の隣で<tips=1>亮</tips>は土足のまま無言で部屋にあがると、一番手前の部屋に顔を突っ込む。<tips=10>道夫</tips>も慌てて靴のまま上がり、同じように部屋を見た。そこは少女たちの寝室で、クローゼットのドアが開かれている。","en":"While <tips=10>Michio</tips> stopped to take off his shoes, <tips=1>Ryo</tips> stepped wordlessly into the apartment with his own still on and stuck his head into the nearest room. <tips=10>Michio</tips> hurried after him without removing his shoes and looked inside. It was the girls’ bedroom, and the closet door stood open.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r378","rowIndex":378,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それを見て<tips=1>亮</tips>は眉間にしわをよせ、すぐに次の部屋を確認しに向かう。","en":"<tips=1>Ryo</tips> frowned at the sight, then immediately went to inspect the next room.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r379","rowIndex":379,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=10>道夫</tips>はそのあとを追いながら、どうもピンとこないでいる。","en":"Following behind, <tips=10>Michio</tips> still couldn’t see what Ryo was getting at.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r380","rowIndex":380,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>が言うまま危険をおかしてこの団地にやって来て、確かに怪物のしでかしたものを見ているが、何か重要な意味があるのかよくわからない。","en":"He had followed <tips=1>Ryo’s</tips> lead and risked coming into this complex. He could certainly see what the monster had done, but he still couldn’t tell why any of it mattered.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r381","rowIndex":381,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　部屋は怪物によって散らかされている。しかし、これがなんなのか。何を見ればあの<tips=86>双子</tips>をおびやかした怪物に対処するヒントが得られるのか。<tips=10>道夫</tips>にはこれを見てどう考えればいいのかよくわからないのだが、<tips=1>亮</tips>は興味深そうに部屋のなかを観察している。何かわかったか、と、彼に聞けばいいのだが、それはプライドが邪魔して聞けない。","en":"The room had been ransacked by the monster. But what did that mean? What could they look for that might help them deal with the creature threatening the <tips=86>twins</tips>? <tips=10>Michio</tips> had no idea how to interpret what he saw, while <tips=1>Ryo</tips> examined the room with evident interest. He could simply ask whether Ryo had discovered anything, but his pride would not allow it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r382","rowIndex":382,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　こういうのには向いていないと、自分の適性を再確認させられるだけだった。","en":"All it did was reconfirm that he had no aptitude for this sort of thing.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r383","rowIndex":383,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=10>道夫</tips>が居心地悪いまま、二人でひとつひとつの部屋を確認し、一番奥のリビングに足を踏み入れた時だ。","en":"With <tips=10>Michio</tips> still ill at ease, the two checked each room in turn. Then, as they stepped into the living room at the very back—","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r384","rowIndex":384,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ここもか……」","en":"“Here too...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮（少年時代）","displayName":"Tse Leung (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r385","rowIndex":385,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>は理解したようにそう呟くのだけれど、<tips=10>道夫</tips>には何が「ここも」なのかわからない。","en":"<tips=1>Ryo</tips> murmured as if something had clicked, but <tips=10>Michio</tips> had no idea what he meant by “here too.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r386","rowIndex":386,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あのさ<tips=1>菅原</tips>、さっきからお前は何を確認してるんだ……？」","en":"“Hey, <tips=1>Sugawara</tips>... What have you been looking for this whole time?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫（少年時代）","displayName":"Michio Mido (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r387","rowIndex":387,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　恥を忍んでついにそう声をかけたとき、<tips=1>亮</tips>はふと何かに気がついて、キッチンの方に歩いて行った。","en":"When Michio finally swallowed his pride and asked, <tips=1>Ryo</tips> suddenly noticed something and headed toward the kitchen.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r388","rowIndex":388,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その先にあった物には、さすがに<tips=10>道夫</tips>も驚いた。","en":"Even <tips=10>Michio</tips> was taken aback by what they found there.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r389","rowIndex":389,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　キッチンも棚が開け放たれ、割れた食器が散乱した床の上に鼠の死体が落ちている。鼠は首の辺りに大きな傷が付き、そこから夥しい血液が流れ出しているのだが、普通ではあり得ない現象がそこに起きていた。","en":"The kitchen cupboards also stood wide open, and broken dishes littered the floor. Among them lay a dead mouse. A large wound gaped near its neck, and a vast amount of blood had poured from it. But something impossible had happened there.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r390","rowIndex":390,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　血液の水たまりというものは通常楕円に似た形になるはずなのだが、その血液はどういうわけか、直線や矩形を組み合わせた複雑な形をしているのである。","en":"A pool of blood would ordinarily form something like an oval. For some reason, however, this blood had taken a complex shape composed of straight lines and rectangles.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r391","rowIndex":391,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「地図……か？」","en":"“A map...?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫（少年時代）","displayName":"Michio Mido (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r392","rowIndex":392,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=10>道夫</tips>が思わず口にした通り、それは道路や建物を真上から見下ろしたようなかたちに見えた。","en":"Just as <tips=10>Michio</tips> had blurted out, it resembled roads and buildings viewed from directly above.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r393","rowIndex":393,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「これもしかして、ここが<tips=57>滑走路通り</tips>でさ……」","en":"“Could this be <tips=57>Runway Street</tips> here...?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫（少年時代）","displayName":"Michio Mido (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r394","rowIndex":394,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　言いながらふと見た<tips=1>亮</tips>の顔が、さきほどまでとはうって変わって青ざめている。","en":"As he spoke, Michio happened to glance at <tips=1>Ryo</tips>. The boy’s face had changed completely from a moment before: he had gone pale.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r395","rowIndex":395,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼は急いで携帯電話を取り出すと、どこかへ電話をかけた。","en":"Ryo hurriedly pulled out his phone and made a call.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r396","rowIndex":396,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「怪物の狙いはほかの誰でもなく<tips=86>双子</tips>だ。すぐ二人を連れてそこを出てくれ。あいつは追跡能力を持っているから、出来るだけ移動し続けるんだ。僕もある程度そっちへ向かったらもう一度連絡するから、あとで合流しよう」","en":"“The monster is after <tips=86>the twins</tips>. No one else. Get them out of there now. It can track them, so keep moving as much as you can. I’ll call again once we’ve made some progress toward you, and then we’ll meet up.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮（少年時代）","displayName":"Tse Leung (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r397","rowIndex":397,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>は早口でそれだけ言うと、電話を切った。","en":"<tips=1>Ryo</tips> rattled off the warning, then hung up.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r398","rowIndex":398,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=10>見土</tips>、すぐに団地を出てあいつらと合流しよう。<tips=55>松子</tips>がいるから大丈夫だと思うけど、油断は出来ない」","en":"“<tips=10>Mido</tips>, we need to get out of the complex and meet up with them now. <tips=55>Matsuko</tips> is there, so I think they’ll be all right, but we can’t afford to let our guard down.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮（少年時代）","displayName":"Tse Leung (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r399","rowIndex":399,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして部屋を飛び出そうとした<tips=1>亮</tips>の服を、<tips=10>道夫</tips>は掴んだ。","en":"As <tips=1>Ryo</tips> tried to bolt from the room, <tips=10>Michio</tips> caught him by the clothes.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r400","rowIndex":400,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「すまないが、わからないんだ。どういうことか説明してくれよ」","en":"“Sorry, but I don’t get it. Tell me what’s going on.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫（少年時代）","displayName":"Michio Mido (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r401","rowIndex":401,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「この部屋はあらゆるドアが開かれているが、棚なんかの引き出しはまったく手を付けられておらず、部屋を物色した様子はない。つまり怪物は何か<tips=86>双子</tips>の持っているモノが欲しいんじゃなくて、<tips=86>双子</tips>自身に用があるんだ。そしてあの地図は怪物のサイキック能力だろう。あの裏路地で<tips=86>灰上たち</tips>と遭遇したのは、たまたま追いかけた方向が合致しただけだと思っていたんだけれど、そうじゃなくてこれは……」","en":"“Every door in this apartment was opened, but none of the drawers or cabinets were touched. It wasn’t searching the place. That means the monster isn’t after something the <tips=86>twins</tips> own—it’s after the <tips=86>twins</tips> themselves. And that map must be part of its psychic ability. I thought it only ran into the <tips=86>Haigamis</tips> in that alley because it happened to chase them in the right direction. But no. This means...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮（少年時代）","displayName":"Tse Leung (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r402","rowIndex":402,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼がそこまで説明したところで口をつぐんだ。入り口の方で、物音がしたのである。","en":"Ryo broke off. There had been a noise at the entrance.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r403","rowIndex":403,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　あの怪物がここへ戻って来たのかと<tips=10>道夫</tips>は身を固くしたが、そうではなかった。","en":"<tips=10>Michio</tips> tensed, thinking the monster had come back. But it hadn’t.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r404","rowIndex":404,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「うわー、こりゃひでえなあ」","en":"“Whoa, what a mess.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r405","rowIndex":405,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　入り口の方から聞こえて来たのは、男の声である。","en":"A man’s voice came from the entrance.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r406","rowIndex":406,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　向こうは複数いて、入り口のそばで何か言葉を交わしている。はっきり言葉が聞き取れたわけではないが、切れ切れに聞こえる声のトーンや言葉の断片からすると、ボスが一人いて、比較的若い二人が何か報告しているようだった。","en":"There were several people outside, talking near the doorway. The boys couldn’t make out exactly what they were saying, but from the fragments they caught and the tone of each voice, it sounded like there was one boss and two younger men reporting to him.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r407","rowIndex":407,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「団地のやつらだぜ。どう対応するか？」","en":"“They’re from the complex. What do we do?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫（少年時代）","displayName":"Michio Mido (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r408","rowIndex":408,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=10>道夫</tips>が小声で訊ねるが、<tips=1>亮</tips>は入り口の方を見たまま何か考えている。","en":"<tips=10>Michio</tips> whispered, but <tips=1>Ryo</tips> kept staring toward the entrance, lost in thought.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r409","rowIndex":409,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　――これはどうしたもんか。","en":"What do we do now?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r410","rowIndex":410,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=10>道夫</tips>は内心で焦るが答えが出ない。","en":"<tips=10>Michio</tips> panicked inwardly, but couldn’t come up with an answer.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r411","rowIndex":411,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　やがてドアの外の連中は部屋のなかに足を踏み入れ、そしてリビングに立って様子をうかがっていた二人と対面するのであった。","en":"At last, the people outside stepped into the apartment. They came face to face with the two boys watching from the living room.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r412","rowIndex":412,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「おい、なんだおまえたち」","en":"“Hey! Who are you kids?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"深沢聡","displayName":"Satoshi Fukazawa","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r413","rowIndex":413,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　入って来たのは三人組の男で、そのうち最も年長に見える小太りの男が言った。","en":"Three men had entered. The speaker was a somewhat plump man who looked the oldest of them.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r414","rowIndex":414,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「お、おれたちは怪しいものじゃない」","en":"“W-we’re not here to cause trouble.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫（少年時代）","displayName":"Michio Mido (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r415","rowIndex":415,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そう答えたのは<tips=10>道夫</tips>だった。","en":"<tips=10>Michio</tips> answered first.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r416","rowIndex":416,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=86>双子</tips>の友だちだ。おまえらこそ<tips=86>双子</tips>と何か関係あるのか？」","en":"“We’re friends with the <tips=86>twins</tips>. What about you—what do you have to do with the <tips=86>twins</tips>?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫（少年時代）","displayName":"Michio Mido (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r417","rowIndex":417,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「おれは<tips=86>灰上姉妹</tips>の後見人の<tips=14>深沢</tips>だ。ドアが壊れていると話を聞いて慌ててここにやってきたんだが、どうなってるんだ？　そこに二人はいるのか？」","en":"“I’m <tips=14>Fukazawa</tips>, the <tips=86>Haigami sisters’</tips> guardian. I heard their door had been smashed in and came running. What happened here? Are they inside?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"深沢聡","displayName":"Satoshi Fukazawa","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r418","rowIndex":418,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ここにはいないが……」","en":"“They’re not here, but...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫（少年時代）","displayName":"Michio Mido (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r419","rowIndex":419,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=10>道夫</tips>は言いかけて、迷った。ここでなんと言うべきなのだろう？","en":"<tips=10>Michio</tips> started to answer, then hesitated. What was he supposed to say?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r420","rowIndex":420,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　相手は後見人と名乗っている。ということは、正直に状況を話して協力を要請すべきなのか？　それとも、警戒が必要な相手なのか。","en":"The man said he was their guardian. Should they tell him everything and ask for his help? Or was he someone they needed to be wary of?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r421","rowIndex":421,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　迷った挙げ句、<tips=1>亮</tips>を見た。","en":"After a moment of indecision, Michio looked at <tips=1>Ryo</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r422","rowIndex":422,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　この状況で男たちと言葉で渡り合うのに自信がない。自分よりもきっと<tips=1>亮</tips>の方がうまくやるだろうと思ってのことである。","en":"He wasn’t confident he could talk his way through this with three grown men. <tips=1>Ryo</tips> would probably handle them better than he could.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r423","rowIndex":423,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その空気を察して<tips=1>亮</tips>は口を開く。","en":"<tips=1>Ryo</tips> caught the hint and spoke up.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r424","rowIndex":424,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「僕たちは、本当に何にも知らないんです」","en":"“We really don’t know anything.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮（少年時代）","displayName":"Tse Leung (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r425","rowIndex":425,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>は静かにそう言った。","en":"<tips=1>Ryo</tips> answered quietly.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r426","rowIndex":426,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あの二人がサイキックに追われて家に帰れないって言うから、家の方を確認しに来ただけで……」","en":"“They said a psychic was after them and they couldn’t go home, so we just came to check the place for them...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮（少年時代）","displayName":"Tse Leung (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r427","rowIndex":427,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼は事実と違うことを言っている。どういうつもりなのかな、と思いながら<tips=10>道夫</tips>は成り行きを見守っていた。","en":"That wasn’t what had happened. <tips=10>Michio</tips> watched, wondering what Ryo was up to.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r428","rowIndex":428,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「サイキックに追われている？　あいつらがか？」","en":"“A psychic is after them? Those two?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"深沢聡","displayName":"Satoshi Fukazawa","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r429","rowIndex":429,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=14>深沢</tips>は目を丸くする。","en":"<tips=14>Fukazawa’s</tips> eyes widened.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r430","rowIndex":430,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうなんです。クモみたいな怪物が相手だって……。地図を作るサイキック能力で自分を追跡してくるから、かわりに見てくれって……」","en":"“That’s right. They said it was some kind of spider monster... and that it tracks them with a psychic ability that makes maps. They asked us to check the apartment for them...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮（少年時代）","displayName":"Tse Leung (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r431","rowIndex":431,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「えっ、そう言ったのか？　なんで<tips=86>双子</tips>が『地図』のことを知っていたんだ？」","en":"“What? They told you that? How did the <tips=86>twins</tips> know about the ‘map’?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"深沢聡","displayName":"Satoshi Fukazawa","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r432","rowIndex":432,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=14>深沢</tips>は怪訝な顔をして繰り返す。すると、<tips=1>亮</tips>はすっと目を細め、","en":"<tips=14>Fukazawa</tips> repeated the question with a puzzled expression. <tips=1>Ryo’s</tips> eyes suddenly narrowed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r433","rowIndex":433,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あ、やっぱり知ってるんだ」","en":"“Ah, so you do know about it.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮（少年時代）","displayName":"Tse Leung (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r434","rowIndex":434,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして、冷たい表情で<tips=14>深沢</tips>を見つめた。","en":"Then he fixed <tips=14>Fukazawa</tips> with a cold stare.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r435","rowIndex":435,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「その言い方だと、あんた、怪物の能力を知ってたみたいだね」","en":"“From the way you said that, it sounds like you already knew about the monster’s ability.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮（少年時代）","displayName":"Tse Leung (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r436","rowIndex":436,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>の言葉に、<tips=14>深沢</tips>は苦い顔をして沈黙している。","en":"At <tips=1>Ryo’s</tips> accusation, <tips=14>Fukazawa</tips> grimaced and fell silent.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r437","rowIndex":437,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「じゃあ、知っていることを全部喋って貰おうか」","en":"“Then I think you’d better tell us everything you know.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮（少年時代）","displayName":"Tse Leung (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r438","rowIndex":438,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>は懐から取り出した銃を、<tips=14>深沢</tips>に向かって構えた。","en":"<tips=1>Ryo</tips> drew the gun from inside his jacket and leveled it at <tips=14>Fukazawa</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r439","rowIndex":439,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「おい！」","en":"“Hey!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r440","rowIndex":440,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「何をするんだ！」","en":"“What do you think you’re doing?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r441","rowIndex":441,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=14>深沢</tips>の左右にいるラフな格好をした若い男たちがそう叫ぶ。そして隣で見ていた<tips=10>道夫</tips>も驚いていた。","en":"The casually dressed young men on either side of <tips=14>Fukazawa</tips> shouted. <tips=10>Michio</tips>, watching nearby, was startled too.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r442","rowIndex":442,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「黙って。時間がないんだ」","en":"“Be quiet. We don’t have time.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮（少年時代）","displayName":"Tse Leung (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r443","rowIndex":443,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>は冷たく言い放つ。","en":"<tips=1>Ryo</tips> said it coldly.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r444","rowIndex":444,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「おいおい、どういうつもりだ」","en":"“Whoa, hold on. What do you think you’re doing?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"深沢聡","displayName":"Satoshi Fukazawa","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r445","rowIndex":445,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=14>深沢</tips>は驚きつつも、さすが<tips=13>ヘドロ団地</tips>の大物だけあって口辺に笑みを浮かべたままそう答える。","en":"<tips=14>Fukazawa</tips> was surprised, but being one of the big shots in the <tips=13>Sludge Housing Complex</tips>, he kept the smile on his face as he answered.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r446","rowIndex":446,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「クモの怪物は、こうしている間にも<tips=86>双子</tips>を追いかけているかもしれない。僕は彼女たちを守りたい。だから知っていることを全て話してくれ」","en":"“The spider monster may be chasing <tips=86>the twins</tips> even now. I want to protect them. So tell me everything you know.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮（少年時代）","displayName":"Tse Leung (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r447","rowIndex":447,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「おい、どういうつもりだ」","en":"“Hey, what do you think you’re doing?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫（少年時代）","displayName":"Michio Mido (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r448","rowIndex":448,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　と訊ねたのは<tips=10>道夫</tips>だった。彼とても、<tips=1>亮</tips>がこんな暴挙に出るとは思ってもみなかった。","en":"This time it was <tips=10>Michio</tips> who asked. Even he had never dreamed <tips=1>Ryo</tips> would do something this outrageous.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r449","rowIndex":449,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「この人、今外から来たのに蜘蛛の能力を知ってたんだ。知ってるのは能力だけじゃないかもしれない。話を聞いてから向かおう」","en":"“He’d only just come in from outside, but he knew what the spider could do. That might not be all he knows. Let’s hear him out before we leave.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮（少年時代）","displayName":"Tse Leung (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r450","rowIndex":450,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうじゃなくて、そんなふうに銃で脅すのは……」","en":"“That’s not what I mean. Threatening him with a gun like that...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫（少年時代）","displayName":"Michio Mido (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r451","rowIndex":451,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ただの時間の短縮だ」","en":"“I’m just saving time.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮（少年時代）","displayName":"Tse Leung (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r452","rowIndex":452,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>は短く答える。","en":"<tips=1>Ryo</tips> answered briefly.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r453","rowIndex":453,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=10>道夫</tips>としては呆れる他ないやりかただが、こうなった以上は呆れてばかりもいられない。","en":"<tips=10>Michio</tips> found the method appalling, but now that things had gone this far, he couldn’t afford to dwell on it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r454","rowIndex":454,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>に乗るしかないとすぐに判断すると、服の腕まくりをして黒い手を剥き出しにし、目をギラッと金色に輝かせて臨戦態勢を整える。","en":"He quickly decided he had no choice but to back <tips=1>Ryo</tips>. Rolling up his sleeve to bare his black hand, he let his eyes flash gold and readied himself for a fight.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r455","rowIndex":455,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=14>深沢</tips>さん、さっさと喋りなよ。脅されてるからって恥じることはないよ。いまここで起きたことは誰にも喋らないと約束するから」","en":"“Mr. <tips=14>Fukazawa</tips>, start talking. There’s no shame in giving in when you’re being threatened. I promise I won’t tell anyone what happened here.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮（少年時代）","displayName":"Tse Leung (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r456","rowIndex":456,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>は静かに促す。","en":"<tips=1>Ryo</tips> quietly prompted him.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r457","rowIndex":457,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そんなことをしなくたって、知りたけりゃ話してやるさ。おれだって姉妹に危険があったら困るんだからな。さあ、そんな物騒なものはしまえよ。この泣く子も黙る<tips=13>ヘドロ団地</tips>のど真ん中で銃を振り回すお前さんの勇気に免じて、今すぐ謝ればなかったことにしてやる」","en":"“You don’t have to do this. If you want to know, I’ll tell you. I don’t want anything happening to the sisters either. Now put that thing away. You’ve got guts, waving a gun around in the very heart of the <tips=13>Sludge Housing Complex</tips>—a place so notorious it could silence a crying child. Apologize right now, and in honor of that courage, I’ll pretend this never happened.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"深沢聡","displayName":"Satoshi Fukazawa","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r458","rowIndex":458,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「謝るつもりはないし、銃を下げるつもりもない。僕がして欲しいのは手短な説明だけだ」","en":"“I’m not apologizing, and I’m not lowering the gun. All I want is a quick explanation.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮（少年時代）","displayName":"Tse Leung (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r459","rowIndex":459,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>が挑発的に言うと、それまで余裕見せていた<tips=14>深沢</tips>の顔にはじめて鋭いものがあらわれる。","en":"<tips=1>Ryo</tips> spoke provocatively. For the first time, <tips=14>Fukazawa’s</tips> composure gave way to a hard edge.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r460","rowIndex":460,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「おいガキ。優しくしている間に言うことを聞いたほうが身のためだぞ？」","en":"“Listen, brat. For your own good, you’d better do as I say while I’m still being kind.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"深沢聡","displayName":"Satoshi Fukazawa","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r461","rowIndex":461,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ドスをきかせたその声に、しかし<tips=1>亮</tips>は怯まない。","en":"The menace in Fukazawa’s low voice failed to intimidate <tips=1>Ryo</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r462","rowIndex":462,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「文句があるならあとで言ってくれ。僕は<tips=58>パラシュート通り</tips>の<tips=1>菅原亮</tips>だ。逃げも隠れもしない。それでわからないか？」","en":"“If you have a problem with me, take it up with me later. I’m <tips=1>Ryo Sugawara</tips> of <tips=58>Parachute Street</tips>. I won’t run, and I won’t hide. Doesn’t that tell you enough?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮（少年時代）","displayName":"Tse Leung (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r463","rowIndex":463,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その言葉で<tips=14>深沢</tips>は顔色を変えた。","en":"At those words, <tips=14>Fukazawa’s</tips> face changed color.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r464","rowIndex":464,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　これは<tips=1>亮</tips>が自分の名前を明らかにすることで、相手が自分の素性――<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>の<tips=81>龍頭</tips><tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>の息子であることを相手が知っているかどうか試し、そして<tips=14>深沢</tips>は実際知っていて顔色を変えたということなのだが、もちろん<tips=10>道夫</tips>はそんな事情を知らないし、<tips=14>深沢</tips>の表情の変化の意味もわからない。","en":"By giving his name, <tips=1>Ryo</tips> was testing whether the man knew who he really was—the son of <tips=3>Chris Tse</tips>, <tips=81>Longtou</tips> of <tips=7>YS</tips>. <tips=14>Fukazawa</tips> did know; his face had given him away. <tips=10>Michio</tips>, of course, knew none of this and had no idea what <tips=14>Fukazawa’s</tips> reaction meant.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r465","rowIndex":465,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　こんなところで名乗るとはとんでもないやつだと、ただ内心で冷や汗をかくのであった。","en":"Michio could only feel a cold sweat coming on at the sheer nerve of giving his name in a place like this.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r466","rowIndex":466,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「私たちは<tips=13>ヘドロ団地</tips>の<tips=86>灰上姉妹</tips>なのよ？」","en":"“We’re the <tips=86>Haigami sisters</tips> from the <tips=13>Sludge Housing Complex</tips>, you know?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"灰上璃映子（少女）","displayName":"Rieko Haigami (Girl)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r467","rowIndex":467,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「こんなところでコソコソ隠れているなんてみっともない」","en":"“It’s pathetic, sneaking around and hiding in a place like this.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"灰上江梨子（少女）","displayName":"Eriko Haigami (Girl)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r468","rowIndex":468,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=10>道夫</tips>たちの場面より数分前。","en":"Several minutes before the scene with <tips=10>Michio</tips> and the others.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r469","rowIndex":469,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　場所は変わって<tips=57>滑走路通り</tips>の喫茶店の一席である。","en":"The scene shifts to a table in a cafe on <tips=57>Runway Street</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r470","rowIndex":470,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「退避してるんだから、名前は言わないほうがいいと思う」","en":"“We’re supposed to be lying low, so I don’t think you should give out your names.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐松子（少女）","displayName":"Matsuko Shio (Girl)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r471","rowIndex":471,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=55>松子</tips>は表情のないすまし顔でそう言った。","en":"<tips=55>Matsuko</tips> said it with a composed, expressionless face.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r472","rowIndex":472,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いいんだよ別に」","en":"“Who cares?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"灰上璃映子（少女）","displayName":"Rieko Haigami (Girl)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r473","rowIndex":473,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=10>見土道夫</tips>と<tips=1>菅原亮</tips>に好き勝手やらせるんじゃなかった！」","en":"“We never should have let <tips=10>Michio Mido</tips> and <tips=1>Ryo Sugawara</tips> do whatever they wanted!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"灰上江梨子（少女）","displayName":"Eriko Haigami (Girl)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r474","rowIndex":474,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「本当に情けない」","en":"“This is really pathetic.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"灰上璃映子（少女）","displayName":"Rieko Haigami (Girl)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r475","rowIndex":475,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「情けないわ」","en":"“Pathetic.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"灰上江梨子（少女）","displayName":"Eriko Haigami (Girl)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r476","rowIndex":476,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=86>双子</tips>は交互に溜息をつく。","en":"<tips=86>The twins</tips> took turns sighing.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r477","rowIndex":477,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「真ん中に鏡があるみたいでおもしろいね」","en":"“It’s funny. It’s like there’s a mirror between you.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐松子（少女）","displayName":"Matsuko Shio (Girl)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r478","rowIndex":478,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=55>松子</tips>はそう言ってから、自分の前に置かれたオレンジジュースをストローで飲んだ。","en":"<tips=55>Matsuko</tips> said, then sipped her orange juice through the straw.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r479","rowIndex":479,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その態度に<tips=86>双子</tips>は苛立ちを露わにして、","en":"<tips=86>The twins</tips> openly bristled at her attitude.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r480","rowIndex":480,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「面白いなら楽しそうな顔しな？」","en":"“If it’s so funny, try looking like you’re enjoying yourself.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"灰上璃映子（少女）","displayName":"Rieko Haigami (Girl)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r481","rowIndex":481,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「お面みたいな無表情なやつとにらめっこしてると、気が滅入っちゃう」","en":"“It’s depressing, having a staring contest with someone as expressionless as a mask.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"灰上江梨子（少女）","displayName":"Eriko Haigami (Girl)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r482","rowIndex":482,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「面白いってどういう顔？」","en":"“What does a face look like when you’re having fun?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐松子（少女）","displayName":"Matsuko Shio (Girl)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r483","rowIndex":483,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=55>松子</tips>は首をかしげる。","en":"<tips=55>Matsuko</tips> tilted her head.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r484","rowIndex":484,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「こう！」","en":"“Like this!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"灰上璃映子（少女）","displayName":"Rieko Haigami (Girl)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r485","rowIndex":485,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「こうよ！」","en":"“Like this!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"灰上江梨子（少女）","displayName":"Eriko Haigami (Girl)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r486","rowIndex":486,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=86>双子</tips>は二人そろって自分の頬の肉を両手で持ち上げるようにしながら、わざとらしい笑顔を作って見せた。","en":"Together, <tips=86>the twins</tips> pushed their cheeks up with both hands and put on exaggerated smiles for her.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r487","rowIndex":487,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「こう？」","en":"“Like this?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐松子（少女）","displayName":"Matsuko Shio (Girl)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r488","rowIndex":488,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　言われて微笑んでみる<tips=55>松子</tips>を見て、<tips=86>双子</tips>は溜息をつく。","en":"<tips=55>Matsuko</tips> tried the smile they had shown her. <tips=86>The twins</tips> took one look and sighed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r489","rowIndex":489,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なんだか気持ち悪い」","en":"“That’s kind of creepy.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"灰上璃映子（少女）","displayName":"Rieko Haigami (Girl)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r490","rowIndex":490,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「もうやめなよ」","en":"“Just stop.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"灰上江梨子（少女）","displayName":"Eriko Haigami (Girl)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r491","rowIndex":491,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そう……」","en":"“I see...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐松子（少女）","displayName":"Matsuko Shio (Girl)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r492","rowIndex":492,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=55>松子</tips>は少し残念そうに顔を戻す。","en":"Looking a little disappointed, <tips=55>Matsuko</tips> let her face go blank again.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r493","rowIndex":493,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「大体、あんたが残ってなんの意味があるわけ？」","en":"“What good is having you stay with us, anyway?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"灰上璃映子（少女）","displayName":"Rieko Haigami (Girl)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r494","rowIndex":494,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=86>双子</tips>の一人がそう訊ねる。","en":"One of <tips=86>the twins</tips> asked.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r495","rowIndex":495,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「何かあったら守るよう<tips=1>リョウ</tips>から言われた」","en":"“<tips=1>Ryo</tips> told me to protect you if anything happened.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐松子（少女）","displayName":"Matsuko Shio (Girl)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r496","rowIndex":496,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「目がキンキラしてるけど、そんなに凄い<tips=17>タイプＢ</tips>なの？」","en":"“Your eyes are all glittery and gold, but are you really such an amazing <tips=17>Type B</tips>?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"灰上江梨子（少女）","displayName":"Eriko Haigami (Girl)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r497","rowIndex":497,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　もう一人がさらに訊ねる。","en":"The other twin followed up.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r498","rowIndex":498,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「私は動きが速くて、力が強くて、怪我がすぐ治る」","en":"“I’m fast, I’m strong, and I heal quickly.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐松子（少女）","displayName":"Matsuko Shio (Girl)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r499","rowIndex":499,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「たいした自信だね」","en":"“You’re pretty confident.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"灰上璃映子（少女）","displayName":"Rieko Haigami (Girl)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r500","rowIndex":500,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「じゃあ、ちょっと私と腕相撲をしようよ」","en":"“Then let’s arm-wrestle.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"灰上江梨子（少女）","displayName":"Eriko Haigami (Girl)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r501","rowIndex":501,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして<tips=86>双子</tips>の片方が腕まくりをして、その白くて細い肘を乗せた。","en":"One of <tips=86>the twins</tips> rolled up her sleeve and planted one slender, pale elbow on the table.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r502","rowIndex":502,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「さあ、<tips=55>汐松子</tips>も手を出して」","en":"“Come on, <tips=55>Matsuko Shio</tips>. Give me your hand.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"灰上江梨子（少女）","displayName":"Eriko Haigami (Girl)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r503","rowIndex":503,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そう挑発したその目は金色に色が変わる。それによって初めて、全く違いのない<tips=86>双子</tips>に違いが生まれた。","en":"As she taunted Matsuko, her eyes turned gold. For the first time, something distinguished the otherwise identical <tips=86>twins</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r504","rowIndex":504,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=55>松子</tips>はオレンジジュースのグラスを脇によせ、同じように腕を乗せると相手の手を握る。すると、もう一人の<tips=86>双子</tips>がその握り合わさった手の上に自分の手のひらを乗せ、","en":"<tips=55>Matsuko</tips> moved her orange juice aside, set her elbow on the table to match, and took the other girl’s hand. The other <tips=86>twin</tips> laid her palm over their clasped hands.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r505","rowIndex":505,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「手を離したらスタートよ」","en":"“We start when I let go.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"灰上璃映子（少女）","displayName":"Rieko Haigami (Girl)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r506","rowIndex":506,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　と宣言し、二人が頷いたのを確認してから手を離す。","en":"She made the declaration, waited until they had both nodded, then lifted her hand.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r507","rowIndex":507,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その直後だった。","en":"The very next instant—","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r508","rowIndex":508,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　天然木の分厚いテーブルが、ばんっ、と大きな音を立てて店内の人々の視線を集めてしまう。","en":"The thick solid-wood table resounded with a tremendous bang, drawing every eye in the cafe.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r509","rowIndex":509,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　電光石火の早業で、<tips=55>松子</tips>が相手の手の甲をテーブルに叩きつけたのだった。","en":"With lightning speed, <tips=55>Matsuko</tips> had slammed the back of her opponent’s hand against the table.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r510","rowIndex":510,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　一瞬のことで、<tips=86>双子</tips>は凍り付いたまま動けない。","en":"It was over in an instant. <tips=86>The twins</tips> sat frozen, unable to move.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r511","rowIndex":511,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あ、ごめん」","en":"“Oh, sorry.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐松子（少女）","displayName":"Matsuko Shio (Girl)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r512","rowIndex":512,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　と<tips=55>松子</tips>が軽く言って手を離すと、","en":"<tips=55>Matsuko</tips> said lightly as she let go.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r513","rowIndex":513,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いったあああああああい！」","en":"“Owwwwww!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"灰上江梨子（少女）","displayName":"Eriko Haigami (Girl)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r514","rowIndex":514,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=86>双子</tips>の片方は真っ赤に腫れ上がった腕を押さえて飛び上がる。","en":"One of <tips=86>the twins</tips> leaped to her feet, clutching her arm, now swollen bright red.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r515","rowIndex":515,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あ、あんた、ゴリラ並の腕力なんだね……」","en":"“Y-you have the strength of a gorilla...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"灰上璃映子（少女）","displayName":"Rieko Haigami (Girl)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r516","rowIndex":516,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=86>双子</tips>のもう片方は冷や汗をにじませながらそう言った。","en":"The other <tips=86>twin</tips> said it with cold sweat beading on her brow.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r517","rowIndex":517,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いたあああい！　いたああああああいよう！」","en":"“It huuurts! It really huuuuurts!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"灰上江梨子（少女）","displayName":"Eriko Haigami (Girl)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r518","rowIndex":518,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=86>双子</tips>の片方が泣きじゃくりながらソファーの上を転げ回っている。もう片方はそれをなだめつつ、","en":"One of <tips=86>the twins</tips> rolled around on the sofa, sobbing. The other tried to calm her down, saying,","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r519","rowIndex":519,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ああもう、なんでこんなことに。こんな時にお兄ちゃんがいれば……」","en":"“Oh, honestly, how did it come to this? If only our brother were here...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"灰上璃映子（少女）","displayName":"Rieko Haigami (Girl)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r520","rowIndex":520,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　と嘆きの溜息をついた。","en":"She sighed in despair.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r521","rowIndex":521,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「お兄さんはそんなにすごいひとなの？」","en":"“Is your brother really that amazing?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐松子（少女）","displayName":"Matsuko Shio (Girl)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r522","rowIndex":522,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=55>松子</tips>が何気なく訊ねると、<tips=86>双子</tips>は鼻息あらく胸を張って、","en":"At <tips=55>Matsuko’s</tips> casual question, <tips=86>the twins</tips> puffed out their chests, nostrils flaring:","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r523","rowIndex":523,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「すごいんだよ！　国の特別な仕事をしてるんだから！」","en":"“He’s amazing! He has a special job for the government!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"灰上江梨子（少女）","displayName":"Eriko Haigami (Girl)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r524","rowIndex":524,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　先ほどまで痛がっていたのが嘘のように<tips=86>双子</tips>の片方が目を輝かせて言う。","en":"One of <tips=86>the twins</tips> said it with shining eyes, as though she hadn’t been in pain moments earlier.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r525","rowIndex":525,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そう。……どんな人なの？」","en":"“I see... What’s he like?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐松子（少女）","displayName":"Matsuko Shio (Girl)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r526","rowIndex":526,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「背が高くて、きれいな黒髪で、眼鏡をかけてて……」","en":"“He’s tall, with beautiful black hair, and he wears glasses...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"灰上江梨子（少女）","displayName":"Eriko Haigami (Girl)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r527","rowIndex":527,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=86>双子</tips>の片方がうっとりとした口調で語り出すと、","en":"One <tips=86>twin</tips> began describing him dreamily.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r528","rowIndex":528,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「違うって言ってるでしょ？　ちょっと天然パーマで、色白で、眼鏡なんかしてないわ」","en":"“I keep telling you, that’s wrong. His hair has a slight natural curl, he’s pale, and he doesn’t wear glasses.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"灰上璃映子（少女）","displayName":"Rieko Haigami (Girl)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r529","rowIndex":529,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　もう片方が否定する。","en":"The other twin objected.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r530","rowIndex":530,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どういうこと？」","en":"“What do you mean?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐松子（少女）","displayName":"Matsuko Shio (Girl)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r531","rowIndex":531,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　話の食い違いに、<tips=55>松子</tips>は驚き目を丸くする。","en":"At the contradiction, <tips=55>Matsuko’s</tips> eyes widened in surprise.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r532","rowIndex":532,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　すると二人はばつが悪そうに俯き、","en":"The twins looked down sheepishly.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r533","rowIndex":533,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……私たち、見たことないの」","en":"“...We’ve never seen him.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"灰上江梨子（少女）","displayName":"Eriko Haigami (Girl)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r534","rowIndex":534,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……ちっちゃいときから、お兄ちゃんはずっと別のところで暮らしてたから……」","en":"“...Our brother has always lived somewhere else, ever since we were little...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"灰上璃映子（少女）","displayName":"Rieko Haigami (Girl)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r535","rowIndex":535,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「で、でも、遠くにいてもいつも私たちのこと大事にしてくれてるんだからっ！」","en":"“B-but even though he’s far away, he’s always cared about us!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"灰上江梨子（少女）","displayName":"Eriko Haigami (Girl)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r536","rowIndex":536,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「心が繋がってるんだからねっ！」","en":"“Our hearts are connected!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"灰上璃映子（少女）","displayName":"Rieko Haigami (Girl)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r537","rowIndex":537,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=86>双子</tips>は大きな声で力説する。するとまた店内の客がこちらをふりかえる。","en":"<tips=86>The twins</tips> insisted at the tops of their voices, making the other customers turn around to stare again.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r538","rowIndex":538,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そ、そうなのか」","en":"“I-I see.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐松子（少女）","displayName":"Matsuko Shio (Girl)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r539","rowIndex":539,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=55>松子</tips>が面食らいながらそう答えると、すぐに店員がやって来て静かにするよう注意される。","en":"<tips=55>Matsuko</tips> answered, taken aback. A member of staff came over at once and told them to keep their voices down.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r540","rowIndex":540,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして誰も一言も喋らなくなったところで、テーブルの上に置いてあった<tips=55>松子</tips>の電話が鳴った。","en":"Once no one was saying a word, <tips=55>Matsuko’s</tips> phone, lying on the table, began to ring.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r541","rowIndex":541,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それが、<tips=1>亮</tips>からの危険を伝えるものだった。","en":"It was <tips=1>Ryo</tips>, calling to warn them of danger.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r542","rowIndex":542,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　電話を切ると、感情の薄い<tips=55>松子</tips>の表情にもわずかに緊張の色が浮かぶ。","en":"When <tips=55>Matsuko</tips> ended the call, a trace of tension appeared even on her usually unreadable face.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r543","rowIndex":543,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どうしたの？」","en":"“What’s wrong?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"灰上江梨子（少女）","displayName":"Eriko Haigami (Girl)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r544","rowIndex":544,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=1>リョウ</tips>から。危険だからここをすぐ離れろって」","en":"“It was <tips=1>Ryo</tips>. He says we’re in danger and have to leave immediately.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐松子（少女）","displayName":"Matsuko Shio (Girl)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r545","rowIndex":545,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「えっどういうこと？」","en":"“Huh? What do you mean?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"灰上江梨子（少女）","displayName":"Eriko Haigami (Girl)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r546","rowIndex":546,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「危険って」","en":"“What danger?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"灰上璃映子（少女）","displayName":"Rieko Haigami (Girl)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r547","rowIndex":547,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「わからないけど、あの怪物がおまえたちを追いかけているのは間違いないって。そして、これからやって来るかもしれないって」","en":"“I don’t know, but he says there’s no doubt that monster is after you. And it might be heading here now.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐松子（少女）","displayName":"Matsuko Shio (Girl)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r548","rowIndex":548,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「えっ」","en":"“What?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"灰上江梨子（少女）","displayName":"Eriko Haigami (Girl)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r549","rowIndex":549,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「やっぱり？」","en":"“So we were right...?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"灰上璃映子（少女）","displayName":"Rieko Haigami (Girl)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r550","rowIndex":550,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　露骨に青ざめる<tips=86>双子</tips>の目の前で、<tips=55>松子</tips>は伝票を手に取り立ち上がる。","en":"As <tips=86>the twins</tips> visibly paled, <tips=55>Matsuko</tips> picked up the check and rose from her seat.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r551","rowIndex":551,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして、レジで会計を行っているときだった。","en":"It happened while she was paying at the register.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r552","rowIndex":552,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　表の<tips=57>滑走路通り</tips>でいくつかの悲鳴が聞こえた次の瞬間、背後でバシャンと大きな音がした。","en":"Several screams rang out on <tips=57>Runway Street</tips> outside. The next instant, a tremendous crash sounded behind her.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r553","rowIndex":553,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　振り返ると、喫茶店の大きなガラスを突き破って、茶色く長細い足をもった何かが店内に突入したところだった。","en":"When she turned, something with long, spindly brown legs had just smashed through the cafe’s large window and burst inside.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r554","rowIndex":554,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あいつだ……」","en":"“It’s that thing...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"灰上江梨子（少女）","displayName":"Eriko Haigami (Girl)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r555","rowIndex":555,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あれ、さっきのやつだよ……」","en":"“That’s the one from before...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"灰上璃映子（少女）","displayName":"Rieko Haigami (Girl)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r556","rowIndex":556,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=86>双子</tips>が<tips=55>松子</tips>の袖を引き、彼女は小さく頷く。","en":"<tips=86>The twins</tips> tugged at <tips=55>Matsuko’s</tips> sleeve. She gave a small nod.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r557","rowIndex":557,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その怪物は先ほど<tips=86>双子</tips>がつけた傷によって頭が赤く血に塗れている。その下の大きな金色の複眼を動かして、店内をゆっくりと見回す。客や店員はあるいは悲鳴を上げ、あるいは恐怖で動けない。","en":"Its head was red with blood from the wound <tips=86>the twins</tips> had given it earlier. Below, its huge golden compound eye shifted as the creature slowly surveyed the cafe. Some customers and staff screamed; others were too terrified to move.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r558","rowIndex":558,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　――どうするか。このままじゃ他の客も危険かもしれない。","en":"What should I do? At this rate, the other customers could be in danger too.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r559","rowIndex":559,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=55>松子</tips>はレジの前に財布ごと置いてから、怪物の様子を観察した。","en":"<tips=55>Matsuko</tips> left her wallet on the counter and studied the monster.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r560","rowIndex":560,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　怪物はテーブルの上を身軽に飛び跳ねながら何かを探している。<tips=1>亮</tips>の言葉が確かなら<tips=86>双子</tips>を探しているのだろうか。そして、怪物と視線があった赤ん坊が声をあげて泣く。","en":"The monster bounded from table to table, searching for something. If <tips=1>Ryo</tips> was right, was it looking for <tips=86>the twins</tips>? A baby met the creature’s gaze and began to cry.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r561","rowIndex":561,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女が指示を受けているのは<tips=86>双子</tips>を守るということだけだ。そして、出会ってから僅かの間であるが、彼女自身もこの生意気だが愛嬌のある<tips=86>双子</tips>に好意を持っていた。<tips=1>亮</tips>と出歩くようになってから色々な人と出会ったが、この<tips=86>双子</tips>のような子供を見たことがない。<tips=55>松子</tips>の気持ちとしても、この<tips=86>双子</tips>を誰にも傷つけさせたくはなかった。","en":"The only order she had received was to protect the <tips=86>twins</tips>. She had known them only a short time, but had already grown fond of the cheeky, endearing <tips=86>twins</tips>. Since she started going around with <tips=1>Ryo</tips>, she had met all kinds of people, yet never children like the <tips=86>twins</tips>. And for her own part, <tips=55>Matsuko</tips> did not want anyone to hurt the <tips=86>twins</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r562","rowIndex":562,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それを考えると今のうちに<tips=86>双子</tips>を連れて店の外に出るべきなのだが、ここで他の人間を見捨てていいものだろうか？","en":"Thinking it through, she ought to take <tips=86>the twins</tips> and get them outside while she still could. But was it right to abandon everyone else here?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r563","rowIndex":563,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"――きっと、<tips=1>リョウ</tips>だったらみんなを守れって言うな……。","en":"<tips=1>Ryo</tips> would surely tell me to protect everyone...","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r564","rowIndex":564,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そう思って怪物に一歩前に足を進めたが、","en":"With that thought, Matsuko took a step toward the monster, but—","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r565","rowIndex":565,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「やめなさーい！」","en":"“Stop right there!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r566","rowIndex":566,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「私たちはこっちだよ！」","en":"“We’re over here!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r567","rowIndex":567,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=86>双子</tips>がそれよりも先に前に出る。","en":"<tips=86>The twins</tips> stepped forward before she could.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r568","rowIndex":568,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ちょ、ちょっとおまえたち……」","en":"“W-wait, you two...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r569","rowIndex":569,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=55>松子</tips>は引き留めようとするが二人は先ほどまでの怯えが嘘のように怪物の前に堂々と立ちはだかる。","en":"<tips=55>Matsuko</tips> tried to stop them, but they boldly planted themselves in the monster’s path as though their earlier fear had never existed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r570","rowIndex":570,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そんなに遊びたいならもう一回遊んだげるわ！」","en":"“If you want to play that badly, we’ll play with you again!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r571","rowIndex":571,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=55>汐松子</tips>は、まわりのひとを守ってて！」","en":"“<tips=55>Matsuko Shio</tips>, you protect everyone else!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r572","rowIndex":572,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　すっかりおかしなスイッチが入ってしまったようで、そう告げると、二人はらんらんと目を輝かせて怪物を睨み付けた。","en":"Some strange switch had clearly flipped inside them. After telling her that, both girls fixed the monster with blazing eyes.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r573","rowIndex":573,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　こうなっては選択の余地はない。<tips=55>松子</tips>も腹をくくって観念するしかなかった。","en":"There was no choice now. <tips=55>Matsuko</tips> could only accept the situation and steel herself.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r574","rowIndex":574,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　床に散らばったガラスの破片がじゃらじゃらと音を立てて空中に舞い上がると、あられのように怪物に吹き付ける。怪物は顔を覆う様に腕を折り曲げた。その隙に、<tips=86>双子</tips>の片方が手元の花瓶などを投げつけている。","en":"The glass scattered across the floor rose into the air with a clatter and pelted the monster like hail. It folded its arms over its face, and in that opening one <tips=86>twin</tips> hurled a vase and anything else within reach.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r575","rowIndex":575,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そうやって<tips=86>双子</tips>がモノをぶつけて怪物を飛び退かせている間に、<tips=55>松子</tips>は素早く走って行って、床の上で腰を抜かしていた泣きじゃくる子とそれを抱きかかえる母に手助けすると、","en":"While <tips=86>the twins’</tips> barrage drove the monster back, <tips=55>Matsuko</tips> raced over to help a sobbing child sitting helplessly on the floor and the mother holding the child in her arms.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r576","rowIndex":576,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「立って！　店を出て！」","en":"“Get up! Get out of the cafe!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r577","rowIndex":577,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　大きな声で近くで怯える人々にそう指示する。","en":"She shouted the instructions to the frightened people nearby.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r578","rowIndex":578,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　恐怖に怯えて思考も身体も凍り付いてしまっている人間も、単純な指示を与えられると案外動けるものだ。","en":"Even people frozen in mind and body by terror can move surprisingly well once someone gives them a simple order.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r579","rowIndex":579,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その声が引き金になって、何人かの客たちはバタバタと店を出て行った。","en":"Her shout broke the spell, and several customers scrambled out of the cafe.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r580","rowIndex":580,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　路上には<tips=57>滑走路通り</tips>の人混みが混乱を作っていたが、","en":"Outside, the crowd on <tips=57>Runway Street</tips> had descended into confusion.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r581","rowIndex":581,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「怪物だ！　化け物だ！」","en":"“A monster! There’s a monster!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r582","rowIndex":582,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　と、店から駆け出した客たちが叫ぶと、その大部分はクモの子を散らすように視界から離れて行く。その拍子に路上で物を売る者たちの商品を乗せた台がひっくり返り、ガチャガチャという騒音や、「ふざけんなよ！」というような怒号が聞こえる。","en":"As the customers came running out shouting, most of the crowd scattered like spiderlings and vanished from sight. In the scramble, street vendors’ display tables toppled over, adding crashes and clatters to furious shouts of ‘What the hell do you think you’re doing?’","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r583","rowIndex":583,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　親子を退避させた<tips=55>松子</tips>がすぐに店内に戻ると、ほんの僅か離れていただけで、テーブルやら何やらがひっくり返ったりコーヒーカップやピッチャーの破片や氷の入ったドリンクがぶちまけられたりして、まるでミキサーか何かで攪拌した後のような状態になっていた。","en":"After getting the mother and child clear, <tips=55>Matsuko</tips> immediately returned to the cafe. Though she had been gone only moments, tables and furniture were overturned, coffee cups and pitchers lay shattered, and iced drinks had been flung everywhere. The room looked as if someone had run it through an enormous blender.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r584","rowIndex":584,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=86>双子</tips>は遠くからひたすら物を浴びせかけている。怪物はそれを長い腕で受け、また横に飛んで躱し、そして<tips=86>双子</tips>に近づくと、そのかぎ爪を伸ばす。<tips=86>双子</tips>は危うくそれを避けてはいるが、どう見ても優勢とは言えない状況だった。","en":"The <tips=86>twins</tips> kept pelting the monster with anything they could find. It batted the missiles aside with its long arms or leaped sideways to avoid them; whenever it closed on the <tips=86>twins</tips>, it lashed out with its hooked claws. The <tips=86>twins</tips> barely dodged each attack and were clearly getting the worse of the fight.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r585","rowIndex":585,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　二人の顔は蒼白になっていて、極度の緊張が見て取れた。腕や、スカートから剥き出しになったふくらはぎなどに細かい切り傷が増えている。致命的な怪我はしていないが、彼女たちが相手にぶつけた物も決定的なダメージを与えてはおらず、結局、怪物の爪から逃げ回るので精一杯といった状況のようだ。","en":"The girls’ faces had gone pale, their extreme tension plain to see. Small cuts were multiplying across their arms and the calves bared by their skirts. None of their wounds were fatal, but nothing they threw had done decisive damage either. In the end, all they could do was keep dodging the monster’s claws.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r586","rowIndex":586,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=55>松子</tips>が近づこうとすると、<tips=86>双子</tips>がまき散らすガラスの破片などが壁や天井ではじけて、彼女の行く手を阻む。","en":"When <tips=55>Matsuko</tips> tried to approach, glass shards and other debris sent flying by <tips=86>the twins</tips> struck the walls and ceiling, barring her way.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r587","rowIndex":587,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「もう大丈夫だから逃げて！　あとは私に任せて！」","en":"“I’ve got this now, so run! Leave the rest to me!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r588","rowIndex":588,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=55>松子</tips>はたまらず叫んだ。","en":"<tips=55>Matsuko</tips> could bear it no longer and shouted.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r589","rowIndex":589,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「でも！」","en":"“But!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r590","rowIndex":590,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「私たちだって……」","en":"“We can still—”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r591","rowIndex":591,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「邪魔なの！」","en":"“You’re in the way!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r592","rowIndex":592,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=55>松子</tips>が表情を変えずに言うと、<tips=86>双子</tips>は下唇を噛み、涙をにじませながら後退して割れたガラスを踏み越え路上に退避した。","en":"<tips=55>Matsuko</tips> spoke without changing her expression. <tips=86>The twins</tips> bit their lower lips and retreated with tears in their eyes, stepping across the broken glass and out into the street.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r593","rowIndex":593,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それを追って路上に飛び出した怪物の前に<tips=55>松子</tips>が立ち塞がる。","en":"The monster pursued them outside. <tips=55>Matsuko</tips> stepped into its path.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r594","rowIndex":594,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　滑走路通りの物見高い通行人達は、飛び出して来た怪物と少女達に戸惑いつつも、関わりを恐れて遠巻きに眺めている。","en":"The curious passersby on Runway Street stared in bewilderment as the monster and girls burst outside, but, afraid to get involved, they merely watched from a distance.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r595","rowIndex":595,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　逃げようとしないでこの奇妙な戦いの見物をしているのは、やはりこの街の住人ならではか。","en":"Perhaps only residents of this city would stay to watch such a bizarre battle instead of fleeing.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r596","rowIndex":596,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　怪物は一瞬身を伏せると、跳躍してその頭上を飛び越そうとした。","en":"The monster crouched for an instant, then sprang, trying to vault over her head.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r597","rowIndex":597,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しかし、それより早く<tips=55>松子</tips>が足の一本にしがみつくと、体勢を崩してアスファルトの上に土埃を上げて落ちる。","en":"But before it could, <tips=55>Matsuko</tips> latched onto one of its legs. It lost its balance and crashed onto the asphalt in a cloud of dust.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r598","rowIndex":598,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その衝撃で<tips=55>松子</tips>の手も離れ、お互いはそれぞれの場所で倒れたが、それぞれが素早く立ち上がる。","en":"The impact tore <tips=55>Matsuko’s</tips> hands loose, and the two landed apart, but both were back on their feet at once.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r599","rowIndex":599,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　怪物はそこで<tips=55>松子</tips>を睨み付ける。苛立たしげに四本の手足をばたつかせ、まるで犬のように吼えた。","en":"The monster glared at <tips=55>Matsuko</tips>, flailed its four limbs in frustration, and let out a doglike howl.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r600","rowIndex":600,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その咆哮は鼓膜をつんざくほどに大きく空気を震わせ、全身がビリビリとするようなその感覚に<tips=55>松子</tips>は顔を顰める。","en":"The roar was loud enough to tear at her eardrums, shaking the air and setting her whole body buzzing. <tips=55>Matsuko</tips> grimaced.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r601","rowIndex":601,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そこで怪物は<tips=55>松子</tips>をはっきり敵と認めた。","en":"The monster now recognized <tips=55>Matsuko</tips> as an enemy.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r602","rowIndex":602,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　風を巻きながら突進し、右のかぎ爪を斜めに振り下ろす。","en":"It charged with the air swirling around it and brought its right claw down in a diagonal slash.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r603","rowIndex":603,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それは目にもとまらぬ素早さであった。<tips=55>松子</tips>の想像を超えたもので、咄嗟には反応出来ない。全身を横に逃がしたが、それでは避けきれない。喉を切り裂かれる間一髪のところで右手を振り、どうにかかぎ爪を払いのけた。","en":"It moved too fast for the eye to follow—faster than <tips=55>Matsuko</tips> had imagined possible. She could not react in time. She threw her whole body sideways, but it was not enough. An instant before the claw tore open her throat, she flung up her right hand and somehow knocked it aside.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r604","rowIndex":604,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　飛び退いてから<tips=55>松子</tips>は痛みを感じて右手を見ると、振り払った人差し指と中指と薬指の三本が切断されて断面から血がほとばしっていた。","en":"After leaping back, <tips=55>Matsuko</tips> felt a stab of pain and looked at her right hand. The three fingers she had used to knock the claw aside—index, middle, and ring—had been severed, blood spurting from the cut ends.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r605","rowIndex":605,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　――思ったより早い。","en":"It’s faster than I thought.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r606","rowIndex":606,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=55>松子</tips>は顔色一つ変えずに指が減った自分の手を確認してから、また視線を正面の怪物に戻す。","en":"Without the slightest change of expression, <tips=55>Matsuko</tips> examined her hand, now three fingers short, then looked back at the monster.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r607","rowIndex":607,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　先ほど<tips=86>双子</tips>と対峙していたときより、怪物の動きは明らかに早く、その攻撃にも殺意があふれている。","en":"The monster was clearly moving faster than when it faced <tips=86>the twins</tips>, and now every attack was meant to kill.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r608","rowIndex":608,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　――なんか変だ。さっきは手を抜いていた？　……いや、違う。","en":"Something’s strange. Was it holding back before? ...No, that’s not it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r609","rowIndex":609,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　怪物はまた地面すれすれを飛ぶように突進してくると、横薙ぎにかぎ爪を払った。","en":"The monster charged again as though skimming the ground and swept its claw sideways.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r610","rowIndex":610,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=55>松子</tips>は上体をそらしてそれをかわすが、避けきれずシャツの腹の辺りが切れ、うっすら血がにじむ。","en":"<tips=55>Matsuko</tips> leaned her upper body back, but not far enough. The claw sliced through her shirt at the stomach, and a thin line of blood welled beneath it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r611","rowIndex":611,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　――この人、<tips=86>双子</tips>とは戦う気がなかったんだ！","en":"This person wasn’t trying to fight <tips=86>the twins</tips>!","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r612","rowIndex":612,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そうとしか考えられない。","en":"Matsuko could find no other explanation.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r613","rowIndex":613,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　思えば、<tips=86>双子</tips>を傷つけてしまったのは、もしかしたらその爪の付いた手で触れようとしただけのようにも思える。とても、今<tips=55>松子</tips>を切り裂こうとしているような鋭い動きではなかった。実際、<tips=86>双子</tips>の傷は血液こそ流れているが表面の皮膚が少しひっかかれた程度のものでしかない。","en":"Thinking back, perhaps when it hurt the <tips=86>twins</tips>, it had only been trying to touch them with its clawed hand. Its movements then had been nothing like the sharp slashes now trying to tear <tips=55>Matsuko</tips> apart. And though the <tips=86>twins</tips> had bled, their wounds were no more than skin-deep scratches.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r614","rowIndex":614,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　――この人は何をしたいんだろう？","en":"What is this person trying to do?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r615","rowIndex":615,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そう考えながら見つめていると、相手はグルグルと低いうなり声を上げながら、また<tips=55>松子</tips>へと飛びかかる。","en":"As <tips=55>Matsuko</tips> watched and considered the question, the monster growled low in its throat and leaped at her again.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r616","rowIndex":616,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　右、左と交互に繰り出されるかぎ爪を、今度は傷つくことなく回避が出来た。","en":"This time, Matsuko dodged the alternating right-and-left swipes without another scratch.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r617","rowIndex":617,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　――さて、どうしようか。","en":"Now, what should I do?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r618","rowIndex":618,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　動きにはなんとかついていけているが、いかんせん腕の長さが違いすぎる。振り回す手足を掴もうとすれば早すぎて、先ほどのように指を失うだけだろう。素手のままでは相手に近づくことが出来ない。とすれば、<tips=86>双子</tips>がやっていたように何かを投げつけるか。","en":"She could just barely keep up, but its reach was far greater than hers. Its flailing limbs were too fast to grab; if she tried, she would only lose more fingers. She could not close in barehanded. So should she throw something, as <tips=86>the twins</tips> had?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r619","rowIndex":619,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=55>松子</tips>は迷っていた。そもそも、そんなにむきになって攻撃すべき相手ではないのではないかという気もしている。もしかしたら、<tips=86>双子</tips>に対してなにか事情があるのかもしれない。","en":"<tips=55>Matsuko</tips> hesitated. Was this really an opponent she ought to be attacking so fiercely? Perhaps the monster had some reason of its own for pursuing the <tips=86>twins</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r620","rowIndex":620,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　――私にはわからないな。<tips=1>リョウ</tips>がいれば……。","en":"I don’t know. If <tips=1>Ryo</tips> were here...","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r621","rowIndex":621,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　手がジンジンと痛んで、切断面から血液が止めどもなく流れている。<tips=55>松子</tips>はそれを感じることが出来るが、自分の痛みに対して感情が動くことはない。目の前の怪物に対する恐怖もない。","en":"Her hand throbbed, blood streaming ceaselessly from the severed ends. <tips=55>Matsuko</tips> felt the pain, but it stirred no emotion in her. Nor was she afraid of the monster before her.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r622","rowIndex":622,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして、ただ困っている。何かを決定するのは得意ではなく、相手に何か事情がありそうなことを想像は出来たものの、それをどんな風に行動に結びつければいいのかわからない。","en":"She was simply at a loss. She had never been good at deciding things. She could imagine that the creature might have reasons of its own, but had no idea how to turn that possibility into action.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r623","rowIndex":623,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　――普通の人ならこういうとき、心で決めるのかな？","en":"Is this when ordinary people decide with their hearts?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r624","rowIndex":624,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=55>松子</tips>は、<tips=1>亮</tips>に連れて行かれた空き地でアリを棒で潰して殺した時のことを思い出し、背筋が冷たくなった。","en":"<tips=55>Matsuko</tips> remembered crushing ants with a stick in the vacant lot <tips=1>Ryo</tips> had taken her to. A chill ran down her spine.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r625","rowIndex":625,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　心と言えば、目の前のこの不可解な生き物も死なせたくはないというのが彼女の心だった。","en":"And what her heart told her was that she did not want this incomprehensible creature to die either.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r626","rowIndex":626,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　なんとか生かしたまま制圧する方法はないか。","en":"Was there a way to subdue it without killing it?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r627","rowIndex":627,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=55>汐松子</tips>っ、下がって！」","en":"“<tips=55>Matsuko Shio</tips>, get back!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r628","rowIndex":628,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　考えていると、背後から<tips=86>双子</tips>の叫ぶ声がする。","en":"While she was still thinking, <tips=86>the twins</tips> shouted from behind her.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r629","rowIndex":629,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「えっ」","en":"“Huh?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r630","rowIndex":630,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　わけがわからないままも、<tips=55>松子</tips>は言われたとおり後ずさる。","en":"Still confused, <tips=55>Matsuko</tips> backed away as they had told her.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r631","rowIndex":631,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　すると、視界の上の方、怪物の頭上辺りで何かが動いたのが見えた。","en":"Then, high in her field of vision, she saw something move above the monster’s head.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r632","rowIndex":632,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=86>双子</tips>たちは怪物がその場所に来るのを待っていた。怪物が立っているのは、喫茶店の破れたガラス窓の前である。喫茶店は雑居ビルの一階部分を使って営業されていて、二階から上には様々なテナントが入っている。そして、それらのための看板がかかっていた。","en":"The <tips=86>twins</tips> had been waiting for the monster to reach that place. It stood before the cafe’s shattered glass window. The cafe occupied the ground floor of a mixed-use building, with various tenants on the floors above and signs advertising their businesses.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r633","rowIndex":633,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=86>双子</tips>は三階部分の消費者金融の看板に目をつけた。それは、ベランダの手すりにロープでくくりつけられている。<tips=86>双子</tips>は念動力でガラスの破片をそこまで動かし、ロープの一端を切った。そして怪物が下までやって来たところで、もう一端に切り目を入れたのだった。","en":"The <tips=86>twins</tips> had selected the sign of a consumer lender on the third floor. It had been tied to the balcony railing with rope. Using psychokinesis, the <tips=86>twins</tips> moved a shard of glass up to the sign and cut one end of the rope. When the monster reached the ground below, they cut partway through the other end.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r634","rowIndex":634,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　消費者金融『あおぞらローン』の『ロ』が書かれた正方形の看板が、手裏剣のように回転しながら落下する。","en":"The square sign panel bearing the katakana RO from the consumer lender ‘Aozora Loans’ fell, spinning like a shuriken.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r635","rowIndex":635,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　軌道は僅かにずれていたが、空中で見えない力によって修正され、怪物の背中に向かって舞い落ちた。","en":"Its path was slightly off target, but an invisible force corrected it in midair, and it sailed toward the monster’s back.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r636","rowIndex":636,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　怪物は直前に風を切る落下音に気がついてわずかに首を傾けたが、そのままの姿勢で、背中に看板の直撃を受けた。","en":"At the last moment, the monster heard the sign slicing through the air and tilted its head slightly, but before it could move, the sign struck it squarely in the back.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r637","rowIndex":637,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　看板によって地面に胴体をはりつけにされる。グルルルルとうなり声を上げ、体をよじり、四肢を動かそうとするがかぎ爪は地面を捉えるほどの力がなく、胴体は持ち上がらない。","en":"The sign pinned the monster’s torso to the ground. It growled, twisted its body, and tried to move its limbs, but the claws could not find enough purchase to lift it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r638","rowIndex":638,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ガラスが散らばるアスファルトの上に、真っ赤な血液が水たまりを広げて行く。","en":"A pool of brilliant red blood spread across the glass-strewn asphalt.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r639","rowIndex":639,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「大丈夫っ！」","en":"“Are you all right?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"灰上璃映子（少女）","displayName":"Rieko Haigami (Girl)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r640","rowIndex":640,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=55>汐松子</tips>、手が……」","en":"“<tips=55>Matsuko Shio</tips>, your hand...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"灰上江梨子（少女）","displayName":"Eriko Haigami (Girl)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r641","rowIndex":641,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=86>双子</tips>は<tips=55>松子</tips>のそばに駆けつけ、その指を失った手を二人でいたわるように持ち上げた。","en":"<tips=86>The twins</tips> rushed to <tips=55>Matsuko’s</tips> side and gently supported her mutilated hand between them.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r642","rowIndex":642,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「私は大丈夫」","en":"“I’m all right.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐松子（少女）","displayName":"Matsuko Shio (Girl)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r643","rowIndex":643,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=55>松子</tips>は言いながら、怪物の方を見ている。","en":"<tips=55>Matsuko</tips> kept her eyes upon the monster as she spoke.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r644","rowIndex":644,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　怪物はまだ死んではいない。荒い息を吐きながら、その手足を震わせている。そして首を何度もかしげるような仕草をしながら、こちらに視線を送っていた。","en":"It was not yet dead. Its limbs trembled as it breathed harshly. Again and again, it seemed to cock its head, turning its gaze toward them.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r645","rowIndex":645,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「しぶといわね」","en":"“It just won’t die.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"灰上璃映子（少女）","displayName":"Rieko Haigami (Girl)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r646","rowIndex":646,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「トドメをさそう」","en":"“Let’s finish it.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"灰上江梨子（少女）","displayName":"Eriko Haigami (Girl)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r647","rowIndex":647,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　視線に気がついた<tips=86>双子</tips>が、怒りを露わにして怪物を睨み付けた。","en":"Noticing the monster’s gaze, <tips=86>the twins</tips> glared back with open anger.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r648","rowIndex":648,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ほっといても死ぬよ。それより……」","en":"“It will die even if we leave it alone. More importantly...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐松子（少女）","displayName":"Matsuko Shio (Girl)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r649","rowIndex":649,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=55>松子</tips>は<tips=86>双子</tips>を押しとどめて怪物に近づく。","en":"<tips=55>Matsuko</tips> held the <tips=86>twins</tips> back and approached the monster.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r650","rowIndex":650,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　すると、そのぜえぜえと粘液がどこかでからまっているような呼吸音が耳に入る。看板が突き刺さった真っ赤な血の海のなかに、ぐちゃぐちゃになった肉と、脊椎の白が見える。","en":"As she drew closer, she heard a wet, rasping wheeze, as though mucus were lodged somewhere inside it. In the vivid pool of blood beneath the impaling sign, she could see mangled flesh and the white of its spine.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r651","rowIndex":651,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=55>松子</tips>の接近に、怪物は口元を噛みしめ敵意を剥き出しにしながら、また手足を地面に突き立てようとする。","en":"At <tips=55>Matsuko’s</tips> approach, the monster set its jaw and showed open hostility, trying again to drive its limbs into the ground.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r652","rowIndex":652,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　すると、その傍らに転がっていた握りこぶしほどの壁材のかけらがふわりと浮いた。","en":"A fist-sized chunk of wall lying beside it floated into the air.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r653","rowIndex":653,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=55>松子</tips>は手を上げて背後の<tips=86>双子</tips>に合図をし、攻撃をやめさせる。","en":"<tips=55>Matsuko</tips> raised one hand, signaling the <tips=86>twins</tips> behind her to stop their attack.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r654","rowIndex":654,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「もう終わった。私は何もしない。あなたが何者なのか知りたいだけ」","en":"“It’s over. I won’t do anything. I only want to know who you are.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐松子（少女）","displayName":"Matsuko Shio (Girl)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r655","rowIndex":655,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=55>松子</tips>は怪物の目をじっと見つめながらそう話しかけた。","en":"<tips=55>Matsuko</tips> addressed the monster while looking steadily into its eye.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r656","rowIndex":656,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あの子たちに用があるんだね？　ちょっと、荷物を見せて貰うから」","en":"“You came because of those girls, didn’t you? I’m going to look through your belongings.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐松子（少女）","displayName":"Matsuko Shio (Girl)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r657","rowIndex":657,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=55>松子</tips>は怪物が胴体に斜めにかけた革のショルダーバッグにまだ指がある左手を伸ばす。","en":"<tips=55>Matsuko</tips> reached toward the leather shoulder bag slung diagonally across the monster’s torso with her left hand—the one that still had fingers.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r658","rowIndex":658,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　目を見つめながらゆっくり動くと、怪物は低いうなり声を上げ続けてはいたがそれ以上は何もしなかった。","en":"Keeping her eyes fixed on its own, she moved slowly. The monster continued to growl low in its throat but made no further move.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r659","rowIndex":659,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　掛け紐のフックを外して手元にたぐり寄せて膝の上に抱え込むと、そのフラップを開く。","en":"Matsuko unhooked the strap, drew the bag toward herself, cradled it upon her lap, and opened the flap.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r660","rowIndex":660,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　開けた瞬間、ふわっと甘い腐臭が漂った。","en":"The moment she opened it, a sweet stench of decay wafted out.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r661","rowIndex":661,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　カバンのなかから出て来たのはピンク色の包装紙で包まれ、赤いリボンのついた弁当箱ほどの箱だった。<tips=55>松子</tips>はそれを取り出して脇に置く。カバンには同じ箱が二つ入っていた。","en":"Inside she found a lunchbox-sized package wrapped in pink paper and tied with a red ribbon. <tips=55>Matsuko</tips> took it out and set it beside her. There were two identical packages in the bag.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r662","rowIndex":662,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして箱がなくなると、なにか茶色いものがカバンの側面に張り付くように折りたたまれている。<tips=55>松子</tips>はそれに触れる。","en":"Once the boxes were out, she saw something brown folded flat against the side of the bag. <tips=55>Matsuko</tips> reached out and touched it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r663","rowIndex":663,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ねちゃねちゃとしたものが指先に付着し、そして何か尖ったものがチクリと手に触れたので、思わず彼女は手を引っ込める。","en":"Something sticky clung to her fingertip, and a sharp point pricked her. She instinctively pulled her hand back.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r664","rowIndex":664,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　見ると指先に小さな赤い血の点が出来ていた。トゲのようなものに触れたのだ。次はより慎重に手を入れて、取り出す。","en":"A tiny red bead of blood had formed on her finger. She had touched something like a thorn. Matsuko reached inside more carefully and removed the object.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r665","rowIndex":665,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それは、一本の野バラだった。花の部分は完全に腐って持ち上げるとグズグズに壊れてしまったが、茎は比較的元の形を保っている。花の近くのトゲは少し残っていたが、下の方は綺麗に切り取られたあとがある。花屋で買ったのか、怪物がそうしたものなのか。","en":"It was a single wild rose. The blossom had rotted through and crumbled when lifted, but the stem had kept most of its shape. A few thorns remained near the flower; farther down, they had been neatly cut away. Had it come from a florist, or had the monster removed them itself?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r666","rowIndex":666,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=55>松子</tips>はそれも脇に置き、そして再度カバンのなかに手を入れて、別のポケットからパスケースのようなものを見つけて取り出した。","en":"<tips=55>Matsuko</tips> set that aside as well, reached into the bag again, and pulled something like a pass holder from another pocket.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r667","rowIndex":667,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　黒光りする使い込まれた表紙をめくると、怪物の顔写真がはりつけられた身分証のようなものがあらわれる。<tips=55>松子</tips>は知らなかったが、それは業務などでサイキック能力を使う者のために特別に発行されるライセンスであった。","en":"She opened the well-worn black cover, its surface gleaming from use, and found what looked like an identity card bearing the monster’s photograph. <tips=55>Matsuko</tips> did not know it, but this was a special license issued to people who used psychic abilities professionally.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r668","rowIndex":668,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=55>松子</tips>はその名前の部分を読んで、絶句する。","en":"<tips=55>Matsuko</tips> read the name and was struck speechless.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r669","rowIndex":669,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「えっ、何これ……」","en":"“Huh? What is this...?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"灰上璃映子（少女）","displayName":"Rieko Haigami (Girl)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r670","rowIndex":670,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=55>松子</tips>が振り返るといつのまにか<tips=86>双子</tips>がうしろに立って、肩越しに<tips=55>松子</tips>の手の中のものを見ていた。","en":"When <tips=55>Matsuko</tips> turned, the <tips=86>twins</tips> were somehow standing right behind her, peering over <tips=55>Matsuko’s</tips> shoulder at what she held.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r671","rowIndex":671,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そのライセンスには『灰上彰』という名前がはっきりと書かれていた。","en":"The license plainly bore the name ‘Akira Haigami.’","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r672","rowIndex":672,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「うそっ、嘘だよ！」","en":"“No! That’s a lie!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"灰上江梨子（少女）","displayName":"Eriko Haigami (Girl)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r673","rowIndex":673,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=86>双子</tips>の片方が、カバンの脇に置かれていたリボンで飾られた箱の前にかがみ込み、震える手で包装紙を破る。","en":"One of the <tips=86>twins</tips> crouched before a ribbon-decorated box lying beside the bag and tore the wrapping paper with trembling hands.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r674","rowIndex":674,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「これ、お兄ちゃんが私たちにプレゼントしてくれるって言ってたゲームだ……」　","en":"“This is the game our brother promised to give us...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"灰上璃映子（少女）","displayName":"Rieko Haigami (Girl)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r675","rowIndex":675,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「こっちにあるのは、私たちの好きな薔薇の花……」","en":"“And this is a rose... our favorite flower...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"灰上江梨子（少女）","displayName":"Eriko Haigami (Girl)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r676","rowIndex":676,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「嘘だよっ！　こんなの嘘だわっ！」","en":"“It’s a lie! All of this is a lie!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"灰上璃映子（少女）","displayName":"Rieko Haigami (Girl)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r677","rowIndex":677,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「こいつが、どこかでお兄ちゃんのカバンを盗んだんだよっ！　こいつっ！」","en":"“This thing must have stolen our brother’s bag! This thing!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"灰上江梨子（少女）","displayName":"Eriko Haigami (Girl)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r678","rowIndex":678,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=86>双子</tips>の片方が、目を金色に輝かせて傍らの瓦礫を持ち上げ怪物の頭に振り落とそうとするのを、<tips=55>松子</tips>が腕を掴んで押しとどめた。","en":"One <tips=86>twin’s</tips> eyes shone gold as she raised a piece of rubble beside her and prepared to bring it down upon the monster’s head. <tips=55>Matsuko</tips> caught her arm and stopped her.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r679","rowIndex":679,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　すると遠くからエンジン音が聞こえてきて三人はそちらを振り向く。","en":"Then the sound of an engine came from the distance, and all three girls turned toward it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r680","rowIndex":680,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　向こうからバイクに乗ってこちらへ近づいて来るのが見えた。","en":"A motorcycle was approaching them from farther down the street.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r681","rowIndex":681,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「おいっ！　お前らっ！　そこにいるのか！」","en":"“Hey! You three! Are you there?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r682","rowIndex":682,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　運転している<tips=10>道夫</tips>がそう叫ぶ。そのうしろには<tips=1>亮</tips>が座っている。","en":"<tips=10>Michio</tips> shouted from the handlebars, with <tips=1>Ryo</tips> riding behind him.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r683","rowIndex":683,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼らは少女たちの目の前でバイクを止め、そしてこの光景で全てを悟った。","en":"They stopped the motorcycle before the girls, took one look at the scene, and understood everything.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r684","rowIndex":684,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>と<tips=10>道夫</tips>は<tips=14>深沢</tips>から全てを聞いていた。","en":"<tips=1>Ryo</tips> and <tips=10>Michio</tips> had heard everything from <tips=14>Fukazawa</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r685","rowIndex":685,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=86>灰上姉妹</tips>の兄である灰上彰は、生まれた時から重度の<tips=77>特質変異</tips>と強力なサイキック能力を持ち、とても社会で生活を営めないということで専用の施設で育てられた。","en":"According to that account, Akira Haigami, elder brother of the <tips=86>Haigami sisters</tips>, had possessed a severe <tips=77>trait mutation</tips> and powerful psychic ability from birth. Because he was considered unable to live within society, he had been raised in a specialized facility.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r686","rowIndex":686,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして成人したあとは政府に採用され、そのサイキック能力を使った特殊な任務を請け負うことになる。","en":"Upon reaching adulthood, he was reportedly employed by the government and assigned special missions that made use of his psychic ability.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r687","rowIndex":687,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その能力は『配達』と呼ばれていたそうだ。","en":"His ability was said to be called ‘Delivery.’","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r688","rowIndex":688,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　誰かに宛てて書かれた手紙やプレゼントを、確実に相手に届ける能力である。その手紙なりプレゼントなりを手に取り、そして血液を床や地面にしたたらせると、相手の居場所を示す地図が浮かび上がるというものだ。<tips=86>双子</tips>の部屋に見たあの血の地図は、そうして彼の能力によって作られたのだろう。","en":"According to the account, the ability ensured that any letter or gift addressed to someone would reach its intended recipient. If he took the item in hand and let his blood drip onto a floor or the ground, a map revealing the recipient’s location would appear. That must have been how his ability produced the blood map found in the <tips=86>twins</tips>’ room.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r689","rowIndex":689,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼の能力は例えば爆弾を目的の相手に送り届けたり、単なる人探しだったり、使い方によっては様々な応用が出来るもので、大層重宝されたという。","en":"The ability could reportedly be applied in many ways, from delivering a bomb to a particular target to locating an ordinary missing person, and was highly prized.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r690","rowIndex":690,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　また、その人柄も評価されていた。","en":"He was reportedly highly regarded for his character as well.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r691","rowIndex":691,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　灰上彰は見かけこそ化け物のようだがひねくれたところがなく、性格は優しく真面目で、いつも周囲にきめこまやかな気配りの出来る青年だった。","en":"Monstrous though Akira Haigami looked, the account described him as utterly unembittered: a kind, earnest young man, unfailingly considerate of those around him.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r692","rowIndex":692,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=17>タイプB</tips>ではあったが、精神に何か症状が出ているとは誰も思わなかった。","en":"The account said that although he was a <tips=17>Type B</tips>, no one had believed he showed any psychological symptoms.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r693","rowIndex":693,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　大抵は兆候があるものだ。しかし、彼の場合はそれがなかった。あるいは、本人が上手く隠していたのかもしれない。","en":"Ordinarily, there were signs. According to the account, he had shown none—or perhaps he had simply concealed them well.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r694","rowIndex":694,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして、その日がやって来た。――非番の日、妹たちに贈るプレゼントを購入したあとに彼は『発症』し、行方不明になったのである。","en":"Then the day came. On his day off, after buying gifts for his sisters, he experienced the ‘onset’ of his symptoms and disappeared.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r695","rowIndex":695,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　この失踪は世間には隠されたが、<tips=86>双子</tips>の保護者である<tips=14>深沢</tips>には連絡があった。","en":"The disappearance was concealed from the public, but <tips=14>Fukazawa</tips> was informed because he was <tips=86>the twins</tips>’ guardian.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r696","rowIndex":696,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=14>深沢</tips>は、灰上彰の正体を知らぬ<tips=86>双子</tips>にはこのことを伝えなかった。","en":"<tips=14>Fukazawa</tips> did not tell <tips=86>the twins</tips>, who knew nothing of Akira’s real identity.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r697","rowIndex":697,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彰が失踪したのは遠く離れた場所であり、狂った頭でこんな場所までやって来ることは考えられなかったし、仮にそう思いついたとしても、どこかで警察の網に引っかかるだろうと考えていたからである。","en":"Akira had disappeared far away. Fukazawa had assumed that, with his mind gone, he could never make it this far—and that even if he thought to try, the police would catch him somewhere along the way.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r698","rowIndex":698,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして彰が死んでから、当たり障りのないかたちで<tips=86>双子</tips>にその死を伝えようと<tips=14>深沢</tips>は考えていた。","en":"<tips=14>Fukazawa</tips> had intended to wait until Akira died, then tell the <tips=86>twins</tips> of his death in terms unlikely to disturb them.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r699","rowIndex":699,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それがまさか、本当にここまでやって来るとは。","en":"He had never imagined, he said, that Akira would truly come this far.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r700","rowIndex":700,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その道のりの困難さは、彰のボロボロになった服にもあらわれている。彼はこんな姿だが、いや、このような姿だからこそ、いつも身だしなみには気を遣い、新品と見間違うようなものを身につけていたのだ。","en":"Akira’s tattered clothes testified to the hardship of the journey. Despite his appearance—or rather, because of it—he had always taken pains over his grooming and dressed in clothes one might mistake for brand-new.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r701","rowIndex":701,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼がどうしても渡したかったプレゼントは、今こうして最愛の妹たちのもとに届いた。妹たちが大好きな薔薇はもう腐ってはいるが、ここに来る途中で彼が正気を喪いながらも手折ったものだ。――この様な状態でも届けることが出来たのだから、彼の『配達』の能力と、その仕事の熱心さはやはり評判通り優れていたのだろう。","en":"The gifts he had been determined to deliver had now reached his beloved sisters. Their favorite rose had rotted, but the account said that he had picked it along the way even as his sanity deserted him. That he had completed the delivery even in such a state suggested that both his ‘Delivery’ ability and his devotion to his work were every bit as remarkable as people said.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r702","rowIndex":702,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しかし、彼自身はその妹たちの手によって今まさに命を失おうとしていた。","en":"Akira himself, however, was now about to lose his life by his sisters’ hands.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r703","rowIndex":703,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　高い知性というものは、他人にとっても本人にとっても残酷な働きをする。<tips=86>双子</tips>は二人とも聰明で、感情がいくら否定したくても、その知性があまりにも理不尽な事実を彼女たちに突きつけた。<tips=86>双子</tips>は目をそらすことが出来ない。自分たちが兄を殺したのだ。","en":"Great intelligence can work cruelly upon its possessor as well as upon others. Both <tips=86>twins</tips> were gifted; however desperately their hearts tried to deny it, their intelligence forced an unbearably unjust truth upon them. The <tips=86>twins</tips> could not look away. They had killed their own brother.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r704","rowIndex":704,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　顔を涙でぐしょぐしょにし、声をあげて泣いている。","en":"Their faces were drenched in tears, and they wept aloud.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r705","rowIndex":705,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　二人に出来ることはもはや、自分たちによって兄に訪れようとしている死を待つしかないように思われた。","en":"It seemed that all they could do now was wait for the death they had brought upon him.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r706","rowIndex":706,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そこで、<tips=1>亮</tips>が仲間たちの一歩前に出た。","en":"Then <tips=1>Ryo</tips> stepped out in front of the others.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r707","rowIndex":707,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　何をするつもりかと皆に見守られるなか、彼はすらりと拳銃を引き抜き、彰のこめかみに当てる。","en":"Everyone watched to see what he intended. Ryo smoothly drew the pistol and pressed it to Akira’s temple.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r708","rowIndex":708,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして、躊躇なく引き金をひいた。","en":"Then, without hesitation, he pulled the trigger.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r709","rowIndex":709,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彰は全身をビクリと震わせたが、そのあとはぐったりとしてもう二度と動かない。","en":"Akira’s whole body convulsed once, then went limp. He never moved again.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r710","rowIndex":710,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>は<tips=86>双子</tips>を振り返り、","en":"<tips=1>Ryo</tips> turned toward <tips=86>the twins</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r711","rowIndex":711,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「こいつを殺したのは僕だ。お前たちは何もしていない」","en":"“I killed him. You did nothing.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮（少年時代）","displayName":"Tse Leung (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r712","rowIndex":712,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　と言った。","en":"That was what he told them.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X13:r713","rowIndex":713,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　これが<tips=1>菅原亮</tips>こと<tips=1>謝亮</tips>にとって生涯初めての殺人だった。","en":"This was the first time in his life that <tips=1>Ryo Sugawara</tips>—<tips=1>Tse Leung</tips>—had killed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}}]},{"position":60,"code":"X16","unitId":"X16","rows":[{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r1","rowIndex":1,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=54>汐健慈朗</tips>の家を出たあと、私たちは狭い裏路地を伝いながら移動する。","en":"After leaving <tips=54>Kenjiro Shio’s</tips> house, we made our way through narrow back alleys.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r2","rowIndex":2,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　背中の<tips=63>サーシェンカ</tips>は人形のようにぐったりとしていて、毛布からはみ出た手足がぶらぶらと揺れている。","en":"<tips=63>Sashenka</tips> hung limp as a doll upon our back, his arms and legs dangling from the blanket and swinging with every step.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r3","rowIndex":3,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　この状態で人目につく行動は避けたい。変に騒がれたら、その相手を殺さなくてはいけなくなる。","en":"We wanted to avoid being seen in this condition. If anyone made a fuss, we would have to kill that person.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r4","rowIndex":4,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　どこか休む場所が必要だ。<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>を連れている以上、この間まで隠れ家にしていたあの洋館には戻れない。ほかにどこか人気のない建物か、安く借りられる宿泊所がないかと考えたが、心あたりがない。","en":"We needed somewhere to rest. As long as we had <tips=20>Koschei</tips> with us, we could not return to the Western-style mansion we had used as a hideout until recently. We tried to think of some other deserted building, or a cheap place to stay, but nothing came to mind.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r5","rowIndex":5,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　落ち着く場所を求めて<tips=58>パラシュート通り</tips>裏の路地を彷徨っていると、また耳元で羽虫の音が聞こえてきた。この間よりもはっきりと。ぶううううん、ぶうううううううん。","en":"As we wandered the alleys behind <tips=58>Parachute Street</tips> in search of somewhere to settle, we once again heard an insect buzzing beside our ear, clearer now than before. Bzzzzzz. Bzzzzzzzzzz.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r6","rowIndex":6,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　発症の兆候だ。このまま何もしなければ、私たちの心は壊れるに違いない。","en":"It was a sign of onset. If we did nothing, our mind would surely break.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r7","rowIndex":7,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　でも、<tips=46>ネオ・ローズ</tips>で治療をすれば再生の力がなくなってしまう。<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>や警察の追求をすり抜けて逃げなくてはいけないことを考えると、今薬を使うべきかどうかは難しい。でも、この症状は耐えがたい。","en":"But treatment with <tips=46>Neo Rose</tips> would take away our power of regeneration. Since we had to evade <tips=7>YS</tips> and the police, it was difficult to decide whether to use the drug now. Yet the symptoms were unbearable.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r8","rowIndex":8,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　だんだん脂汗が出て来て、どこかで休もうかと探していると、「売り出し中」の札がかかった、人気のない建物を見つけたので、侵入した。","en":"A clammy sweat gradually broke across our skin. As we searched for somewhere to rest, we found an unoccupied building with a FOR SALE sign and broke in.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r9","rowIndex":9,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　喉が渇いている。水道の蛇口を捻ると水が出たので、それを直接口をつけて飲んだら顔がびしゃびしゃに濡れてしまった。","en":"We were thirsty. Water came out when we turned the tap, so we put our mouth directly to it and drank, soaking our face.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r10","rowIndex":10,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=63>サーシェンカ</tips>のところへ戻る。","en":"We returned to <tips=63>Sashenka</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r11","rowIndex":11,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼はうっすら目を開いている。","en":"His eyes were slightly open.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r12","rowIndex":12,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「水を飲む？」","en":"“Do you want some water?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r13","rowIndex":13,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼は朦朧としていて、ぼんやりと目の前の空間を眺めながら微かに頷く。","en":"He gazed blearily into the empty space before him and gave the slightest nod.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r14","rowIndex":14,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「立てる？」","en":"“Can you stand?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r15","rowIndex":15,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼はゆっくり首を横に振る。","en":"Slowly, he shook his head.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r16","rowIndex":16,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「じゃあどうやるか……」","en":"“Then how are we supposed to do this...?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r17","rowIndex":17,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　コップのようなものはない。","en":"There was nothing resembling a cup.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r18","rowIndex":18,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちはもう一度蛇口に唇をつけると水を口の中に含む。","en":"We put our lips to the tap again and filled our mouth with water.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r19","rowIndex":19,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それを飲み込まないようにしながら<tips=63>サーシェンカ</tips>のそばにしゃがみ込むと、その顎を上げ、唇をつけた。","en":"Holding the water without swallowing, we crouched beside <tips=63>Sashenka</tips>, raised his chin, and pressed our lips to his.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r20","rowIndex":20,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そしてゆっくりと彼の口に流し込む。喉がこくりと鳴る。","en":"Then we slowly let the water flow into his mouth. His throat worked with a gulp.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r21","rowIndex":21,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「もっと飲む？」","en":"“Do you want more?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r22","rowIndex":22,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=63>サーシェンカ</tips>は頷く。","en":"<tips=63>Sashenka</tips> nodded.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r23","rowIndex":23,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちはもう一度同じことをする。","en":"We did the same thing once more.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r24","rowIndex":24,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……ありがとう」","en":"“...Thank you.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"サーシェンカ白シャツ","displayName":"Sashenka (White Shirt)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r25","rowIndex":25,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=63>サーシェンカ</tips>は少し笑って、また眠りにつく。","en":"<tips=63>Sashenka</tips> smiled a little, then went back to sleep.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r26","rowIndex":26,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちも眠かった。そこで彼に寄り添うようにしながら横になると、すぐに眠りに落ちた。","en":"We were sleepy too. We lay down close beside him and fell asleep at once.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r27","rowIndex":27,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　多分三時間くらいしか寝ていないのに、目が覚めた。身体に疲れが残っているけれど、頭が緊張してもう一度眠りにつくことは出来そうになかった。","en":"We woke after perhaps three hours at most. Our body was still tired, but our mind was too keyed up to fall asleep again.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r28","rowIndex":28,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　耳鳴りはやんでいる。一時的なものかもしれないが、私たちはほっとして立ち上がった。","en":"The ringing in our ears had stopped. It might only have been temporary, but we rose in relief.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r29","rowIndex":29,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　食べるものも何もない。私たちはトイレに行ってから必要なものを調達するために家を出た。<tips=63>サーシェンカ</tips>を置いていくのは心配だったけれど、買い物に彼を連れて行くわけにはいかない。","en":"There was nothing to eat. After using the bathroom, we left the house to pick up some supplies. We worried about leaving <tips=63>Sashenka</tips> behind, but could hardly take him shopping with us.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r30","rowIndex":30,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　このあたりは顔見知りも多い。私たちは髪で顔を隠すように俯いて歩き、日用品店で食糧と、身体拭きと、さらに<tips=63>サーシェンカ</tips>のために変身しても着られるようなゆったりとした衣服を買った。","en":"A lot of people around here knew our face. We kept our head down as we walked, letting our hair hide it, then bought food, body wipes, and loose clothing that <tips=63>Sashenka</tips> could wear in any of his forms.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r31","rowIndex":31,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして建物に戻ってくると、<tips=63>サーシェンカ</tips>はその姿を消し、かわりに金髪の少女に変わっていた。瞬間移動の能力を持つ少女『<tips=62>マリア</tips>』だ。<tips=65>エフゲニ・イリイーチ・ヘス</tips>のお爺ちゃんの話によると、信心深い少女で、お爺ちゃんの指示の声を神の声だと信じ、それに従順に従っている。感情的になりやすいのが欠点だが、戦闘向きの能力と、その従順性から戦いの場面で呼び出されることが多い。殺人のための奴隷だ。","en":"When we returned to the building, <tips=63>Sashenka</tips> was gone. In his place stood a blond girl: <tips=62>Maria</tips>, who possessed the power of teleportation. According to old <tips=65>Yevgeny Ilyich Hess</tips>, she was deeply religious. She believed the voice giving her his orders was the voice of God and obeyed it without question. Her tendency to become emotional was a drawback, but her combat-oriented ability and obedience meant she was often summoned whenever there was fighting to be done. A slave for killing.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r32","rowIndex":32,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　人を殺しすぎて情緒がおかしくなっているとのことだった。","en":"Hess had said that killing too many people had left her emotionally disturbed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r33","rowIndex":33,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=62>マリア</tips>はいま全裸のまま毛布の上に立ち、うつろな表情をしている。その身体にはまだ傷跡が残っている。変身能力が戻っても、まだかつてのような再生能力は戻りきっていないんだろう。","en":"<tips=62>Maria</tips> now stood naked on the blanket, her expression vacant. Her body still bore scars. Her power of transformation might have returned, but her old regenerative ability had apparently not yet come back in full.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r34","rowIndex":34,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どうしたの？」","en":"“What’s wrong?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r35","rowIndex":35,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あなたダレ？」","en":"“Who ARE you?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"マリア","displayName":"Maria","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r36","rowIndex":36,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=62>マリア</tips>はうろんな顔を向ける。","en":"<tips=62>Maria</tips> gave us a suspicious look.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r37","rowIndex":37,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「会ったことあると思うけど」","en":"“I think we’ve met before.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r38","rowIndex":38,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「しらない……」","en":"“I don’t know you...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"マリア","displayName":"Maria","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r39","rowIndex":39,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　言って、<tips=62>マリア</tips>はぴょんとジャンプする。そして着地すると、悲しそうに顔をしかめた。","en":"With that, <tips=62>Maria</tips> sprang into the air. When she landed, her face twisted with sorrow.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r40","rowIndex":40,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「チカラがなくなっちゃった。かみさまがきえちゃった……」","en":"“My POWER is gone. God is gone...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"マリア","displayName":"Maria","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r41","rowIndex":41,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「薬によってサイキックの力が奪われてるだけ。昨日までカプセルに入れられてたでしょ。その時、そういう薬を使ってたんだって」","en":"“The drugs only took your psychic power away. You were kept in a capsule until yesterday, remember? They used that kind of drug on you in there.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r42","rowIndex":42,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ちがう」","en":"“No.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"マリア","displayName":"Maria","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r43","rowIndex":43,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=62>マリア</tips>は顔を横にぶんぶんと振る。","en":"<tips=62>Maria</tips> shook her head violently from side to side.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r44","rowIndex":44,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いいつけをまもれなかった、かみさまにすてられちゃったの……」","en":"“I didn’t do what He told me. God threw me away...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"マリア","displayName":"Maria","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r45","rowIndex":45,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=62>マリア</tips>は涙をボロボロと流す。","en":"Tears streamed down <tips=62>Maria’s</tips> face.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r46","rowIndex":46,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どうしよう。……<tips=62>マリア</tips>シぬんだ。シんでジゴクにおちるんだ……。うう……」","en":"“What do I do? ...<tips=62>Maria’s</tips> going to DIE. She’s going to DIE and go to HELL... Uuuh...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"マリア","displayName":"Maria","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r47","rowIndex":47,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「力は何日かで戻るって」","en":"“They said your power would come back in a few days.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r48","rowIndex":48,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちの言葉に<tips=62>マリア</tips>は反応せず、泣き続ける。","en":"<tips=62>Maria</tips> gave no sign of hearing us and continued to cry.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r49","rowIndex":49,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「こわい、こわいよう……」","en":"“I’m scared. I’m so scared...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"マリア","displayName":"Maria","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r50","rowIndex":50,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして蹲ったところで、その姿が変化し、むくむくと大きくなる。それは黒い髪をした妙齢の美人で、私たちの知らない姿だった。","en":"As she crouched down, her form changed and swelled rapidly in size. She became a beautiful young woman with black hair, a form we did not know.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r51","rowIndex":51,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その見知らぬ女は私を見ると、","en":"The strange woman saw me—","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r52","rowIndex":52,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ああああっ」","en":"“Aaaah!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r53","rowIndex":53,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　と、つかみかかろうとする。私はびっくりして後ずさる。","en":"—and lunged at me, trying to grab hold. Startled, I backed away.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r54","rowIndex":54,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女は口元から唾液をたらし、ゆらゆらと歩いている。どうみても正気じゃない。こんなにおかしいから、普段は出てこないんだろうか？","en":"She drooled as she swayed on her feet. There was no mistaking it: she was out of her mind. Was that why she normally never came out?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r55","rowIndex":55,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　どうしたらいいか戸惑っていると、その姿はまた変身し、そして現れたのは、","en":"While we hesitated, unsure what to do, the body transformed again. The person who appeared this time was—","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r56","rowIndex":56,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「よう」","en":"“Yo.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アレクセイ","displayName":"Alexei","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r57","rowIndex":57,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=64>アレクセイ</tips>だった。彼は前も隠さずこちらを見ている。","en":"<tips=64>Alexei</tips>. He looked at us without bothering to cover himself.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r58","rowIndex":58,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちはそれに衣服を手渡し、","en":"We handed him the clothes.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r59","rowIndex":59,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「コロコロと変身して、忙しいものね」","en":"“One change after another. You certainly keep busy.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r60","rowIndex":60,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「やりたくてやってるわけじゃあない。<tips=65>ヘス</tips>の爺さんはもうだめだね。管理出来なくなって、しっちゃかめっちゃかだよ」","en":"“It’s not as if I’m doing this because I want to. Old <tips=65>Hess</tips> is no use anymore. He’s lost control of us, and now everything’s a total mess.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アレクセイ","displayName":"Alexei","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r61","rowIndex":61,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　Tシャツとズボンを身につけた<tips=64>アレクセイ</tips>は肩をすくめて笑った。","en":"Now dressed in a T-shirt and trousers, <tips=64>Alexei</tips> shrugged and laughed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r62","rowIndex":62,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「色んな姿になるからわかりにくいかもしれないが、この身体もそろそろ古くなってる。もうボロボロなんだろうな。あ、リンゴも買ったのか。一つ貰えるかい？」","en":"“It may be hard to tell when we take so many different forms, but this body is getting old too. It must be pretty worn out by now. Oh, you bought apples. Can I have one?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アレクセイ","displayName":"Alexei","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r63","rowIndex":63,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちは袋のなかからそれを渡す。彼はそれを服でこすってから、かじりつく。","en":"We took one from the bag and passed it to him. He polished it against his shirt, then bit into it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r64","rowIndex":64,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「お前一人か？　もう一人はどこへ行った？　というか、今はどういう状況なんだ？　前に目が覚めたときは、変な水のなかに入れられていたような気がしたが……」","en":"“Are you alone? Where’s the other one? For that matter, what’s going on right now? The last time I woke up, I think I was submerged in some strange water...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アレクセイ","displayName":"Alexei","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r65","rowIndex":65,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「知らないの？」","en":"“You don’t know?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r66","rowIndex":66,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「おれは爺さんみたいに覗き見出来ないからな」","en":"“I can’t peek in on things the way the old man can.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アレクセイ","displayName":"Alexei","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r67","rowIndex":67,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=64>アレクセイ</tips>は肩をすくめる。","en":"<tips=64>Alexei</tips> shrugged.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r68","rowIndex":68,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちは手短に説明をした。<tips=21>八龍会</tips>の罠にはまって、私たち三人が倉庫で撃たれたこと。そのあと彼は<tips=21>八龍会</tips>に引き取られて<tips=46>ネオ・ローズ</tips>の製造工場で監禁されていたが、そこが<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>の襲撃を受け身柄は<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>のものとなった。","en":"We gave him a brief explanation: how the three of us had fallen into a trap set by the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips> and been shot in a warehouse; how he was subsequently taken away by the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips> and held prisoner in a <tips=46>Neo Rose</tips> production facility; and how, when <tips=7>YS</tips> attacked the facility, he fell into <tips=7>YS</tips> custody.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r69","rowIndex":69,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なるほど。そして、今はその<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>のところから逃げ出してきたってことか」","en":"“I see. And now you’ve escaped from <tips=7>YS</tips>?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アレクセイ","displayName":"Alexei","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r70","rowIndex":70,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そう」","en":"“Yes.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r71","rowIndex":71,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……お前の片割れは？」","en":"“...What happened to your other half?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アレクセイ","displayName":"Alexei","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r72","rowIndex":72,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「私たちはあなたと一緒に撃たれた。でも、あなたの血で起き上がったのは片方だけ。もう片方はその場に置いてきたから、<tips=21>八龍会</tips>に処分されたと思う」","en":"“We were both shot alongside you. But only one of us got back up with your blood. We left the other one there, so I think the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips> disposed of her.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r73","rowIndex":73,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ああ、なんてこった……」","en":"“Oh. Oh, God...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アレクセイ","displayName":"Alexei","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r74","rowIndex":74,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼は囓る手を止めると、悲痛な顔をして、","en":"He stopped mid-bite, his face stricken.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r75","rowIndex":75,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それは、何と言ったら良いか……くそっ……」","en":"“I don’t know what to say... Damn it...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アレクセイ","displayName":"Alexei","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r76","rowIndex":76,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あなたも、人が死んで、そんな風に悲しむことがあるのね」","en":"“So even you can grieve when someone dies.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r77","rowIndex":77,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そりゃそうさ。当たり前だろ。知ってる人間が死ぬってのは、いつだって悲しいことさ。……しかし、よく<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>のところから救出できたな。どうやったんだ？」","en":"“Of course I can. What do you take me for? It’s always sad when someone you know dies. …Still, I’m surprised you managed to rescue me from <tips=7>YS</tips>. How did you do it?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アレクセイ","displayName":"Alexei","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r78","rowIndex":78,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「私たちは何もしてない。<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>の<tips=81>龍頭</tips>があなたたちを捕まえていたんだけど、返してくれって話をしたら、出してくれた」","en":"“We didn’t do anything. The <tips=81>Longtou</tips> of <tips=7>YS</tips> was holding all of you, but when we asked him to give you back, he let you go.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r79","rowIndex":79,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「は？　<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>の息子のことだろ？　あいつが、話しただけでおれを解放してくれたって？　そうか、おれたちが昔この街でやったことに気がついていないんだな。いやそれにしても、理由もなく解放するのはおかしいぞ」","en":"“What? You mean <tips=3>Chris Tse’s</tips> son? You’re saying he set me free merely because you asked? I see. He must not have realized what we did in this city years ago. No—even then, it makes no sense for him to release me without a reason.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アレクセイ","displayName":"Alexei","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r80","rowIndex":80,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=64>アレクセイ</tips>は驚いて目を剥く。","en":"<tips=64>Alexei’s</tips> eyes widened in astonishment.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r81","rowIndex":81,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あいつは全部知ってるよ。知ってる上で、解放してくれたの。幼なじみなんだよ」","en":"“He knows all of it. He let you go anyway. He’s our childhood friend.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r82","rowIndex":82,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そんな馬鹿な」","en":"“That’s impossible.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アレクセイ","displayName":"Alexei","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r83","rowIndex":83,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「本当だよ。だから、もうこの街でおかしなことをして、<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>に手を出すのをやめなよ。そして逃げた方が良い。<tips=81>龍頭</tips>が解放してくれたと言っても、それは個人的なことで、警察はまだ追ってるし、<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>はそれと組んでる。かなうわけないわ」","en":"“It’s true. So stop causing trouble in this city and attacking <tips=7>YS</tips>. You should run. Even though the <tips=81>Longtou</tips> released you, that was a personal decision. The police are still after you, and <tips=7>YS</tips> is working with them. You can’t possibly win.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r84","rowIndex":84,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ふん……」","en":"“Hmph...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アレクセイ","displayName":"Alexei","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r85","rowIndex":85,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=64>アレクセイ</tips>は壁に手を突くと、少し考え、","en":"<tips=64>Alexei</tips> put one hand against the wall and thought for a moment.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r86","rowIndex":86,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「おれはもともとどっちでもいいのさ。<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>を憎んでるのは爺さんと、女くらいだが、あいつらもそれどころじゃない。今さら何か大それたことをしようとは思わないだろうし、やろうとしたってもう何も出来やしないさ……。自由の身にしてくれたのは有り難いが、もう長くはない。ついに不死身の<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>もその命の炎が尽きるときが来たってわけさ……」","en":"“I never cared either way to begin with. The old man and the woman are about the only ones who hate <tips=7>YS</tips>, and they have more immediate problems now. I doubt they’ll try anything grand at this point, and even if they did, they couldn’t do a thing in their condition.… I’m grateful to be free, but I don’t have much time left. At last, the hour has come for the flame of the immortal <tips=20>Koschei’s</tips> life to gutter out…”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アレクセイ","displayName":"Alexei","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r87","rowIndex":87,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　凄惨な笑みを浮かべる。","en":"A ghastly smile spread across his face.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r88","rowIndex":88,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ここまでつき合ってくれて申し訳ないが、もうおれたちは無理だ。お前は一人で逃げろ。<tips=12>江梨子</tips>、<tips=11>璃映子</tips>、どっちだ？　どっちにしろ、一人なら大丈夫だろう」","en":"“I’m sorry you’ve stuck with us this far, but we can’t go on. Get away on your own. <tips=12>Eriko</tips> or <tips=11>Rieko</tips>—which are you? Either way, there’s only one of you now. You should be all right alone.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アレクセイ","displayName":"Alexei","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r89","rowIndex":89,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いやだよ」","en":"“I don’t want to.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r90","rowIndex":90,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちは即座に断った。","en":"We refused without a moment’s hesitation.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r91","rowIndex":91,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「共犯者なのよ。最後まで一緒だわ」","en":"“We’re partners in crime. We’re staying together to the end.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r92","rowIndex":92,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「馬鹿野郎。お前は……」","en":"“You idiot. You—”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アレクセイ","displayName":"Alexei","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r93","rowIndex":93,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「待って」","en":"“Wait.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r94","rowIndex":94,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちの聴覚が、不自然な物音を聞きつけた。","en":"Our ears picked up an unnatural sound.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r95","rowIndex":95,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　建物の周りに、何か物音を隠すように行動しているものがいる。","en":"Someone was moving around outside the building, trying not to make a sound.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r96","rowIndex":96,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「買い物に行った時、見られたみたい。銃をもっているかも。相手は警察かもしれない……」","en":"“Someone must have seen us while we were shopping. They may have guns. It could be the police...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r97","rowIndex":97,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は声を落としてそう囁いた。","en":"I whispered, lowering my voice.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r98","rowIndex":98,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どうする？　おれは武器も持ってないし、この有様じゃ役に立たないぞ」","en":"“What do we do? I don’t have a weapon, and the way I am now, I won’t be any help.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アレクセイ","displayName":"Alexei","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r99","rowIndex":99,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=64>アレクセイ</tips>は苦笑する。","en":"<tips=64>Alexei</tips> gave a bitter smile.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r100","rowIndex":100,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「もっと使えるやつにかわりたいが、さっき言った通りもう誰も交代を管理出来ない。<tips=12>江梨子</tips>だか<tips=11>璃映子</tips>だかわからないが、足手まといを抱えたまま一人じゃ無理だろう？　一人で逃げなよ」","en":"“I’d like to change into someone more useful, but as I said, no one can manage the switching anymore. I don’t know whether you’re <tips=12>Eriko</tips> or <tips=11>Rieko</tips>, but you can’t manage alone while carrying dead weight, can you? Leave me and run.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アレクセイ","displayName":"Alexei","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r101","rowIndex":101,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「大丈夫、私たちが守るわ」","en":"“Don’t worry. We’ll protect you.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r102","rowIndex":102,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちは<tips=64>アレクセイ</tips>の顔を見て言った。","en":"We looked <tips=64>Alexei</tips> in the face as we spoke.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r103","rowIndex":103,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「今、昔の二人分よりもっと強い力を持ってるの」","en":"“We’re stronger now than the two of us ever were put together.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r104","rowIndex":104,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　目を閉じ、聴覚に集中して建物の外の物音を聞き取る。取り囲んでいるのは五人。","en":"We closed our eyes, concentrated on our hearing, and listened to the sounds outside the building. Five people had surrounded us.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r105","rowIndex":105,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　警察だとすれば、サイキックの力を抑制するガスを持っている可能性がある。それを使われる前に、先手を打たなくてはいけない。","en":"If they were police officers, they might have gas that suppressed psychic power. We had to strike before they used it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r106","rowIndex":106,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちは全ての人間の位置を把握すると立ち上がる。","en":"Once we knew the position of every person outside, we rose.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r107","rowIndex":107,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どうする？」","en":"“What do we do?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アレクセイ","displayName":"Alexei","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r108","rowIndex":108,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「玄関に行こう。正面から出る」","en":"“Let’s go to the entrance. We’re walking out the front.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r109","rowIndex":109,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「お、おう」","en":"“R-right.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アレクセイ","displayName":"Alexei","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r110","rowIndex":110,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ごく一般的な日本風住宅であるこの建物は、玄関もありきたりな広さだ。相手は建物の表と裏に、少し距離を置いて全ての入り口を見られるようにしながら待機している。おそらく増援を待っているんだと思う。","en":"The building was an ordinary Japanese house, with an ordinary-sized front entrance. The people outside waited at a slight distance from the front and rear, positioned to watch every way out. They were probably waiting for reinforcements.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r111","rowIndex":111,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　五人だったら、たとえ相手が全員優れた<tips=17>タイプB</tips>だったとしても負ける気はしない。特殊な能力を持ったサイキックだったら相手の能力次第だが、その時はその時だ。","en":"There were only five of them. Even if every one was an exceptional <tips=17>Type B</tips>, we could not imagine losing. If they were psychics with unusual powers, it would depend on what those powers were—but we would cross that bridge when we came to it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r112","rowIndex":112,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「先に出て片付けるから、死角に移動して。合図をしたら出て来て」","en":"“I’ll go out first and take care of them. Move somewhere they can’t see you. Come out when I give the signal.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r113","rowIndex":113,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=64>アレクセイ</tips>が玄関ドアを開けても見つからない場所に移動してから、そのドアを開けた。手ではなく、能力を使って。","en":"After <tips=64>Alexei</tips> moved somewhere he would not be seen when the front door opened, we opened it—not with our hand, but with our power.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r114","rowIndex":114,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　どこから出ても良かった。","en":"Any exit would have done.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r115","rowIndex":115,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　相手はたった五人で建物を囲んでいるから、包囲網に厚みはない。一度に相手にする人数は、たかが知れている。","en":"With only five people surrounding the building, their cordon had no depth. At most, we would face a few at a time.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r116","rowIndex":116,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　全員一度にかかって来てくれてもいいくらいだ。","en":"They could all come at us at once, for all we cared.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r117","rowIndex":117,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　開けた瞬間に見えたのは一人。制服を着てはいないけれど、その服装や髪型の雰囲気はこの街の住人とは違うような気がする。やっぱり私服の警官だろう。","en":"The moment the door opened, we saw one man. He was not in uniform, but something about his clothes and hairstyle set him apart from the people of this city. A plainclothes officer after all, most likely.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r118","rowIndex":118,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「くっ」","en":"“Ngh—”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r119","rowIndex":119,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　咄嗟に銃を取り出そうとしたが、<tips=95>金眼</tips>を発動しっぱなしの私の目にはスローモーションのように見える。その腕を肘のあたりで捻って折り、続けざまに首をねじる。","en":"He reached instinctively for his gun, but with my <tips=95>Golden Eyes</tips> still active, his movements seemed slow to me. I twisted his arm at the elbow until it broke, then wrenched his neck.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r120","rowIndex":120,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　骨が砕ける音が鳴る。","en":"Bones cracked and splintered.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r121","rowIndex":121,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　目覚める前だったらこんなに強い力を出すことは出来ない。単に出力があがっただけだけれど、前とは全く違う使い方が出来るようになったんだ。","en":"Before awakening, I could never have produced such tremendous force. It was merely an increase in output, yet it allowed me to use my power in ways altogether different from before.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r122","rowIndex":122,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は彼が崩れ落ちる前に、玄関を飛び出している。","en":"I was through the entrance before he collapsed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r123","rowIndex":123,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　左の方の植え込みのあたりにもう一人いるはずだ。","en":"Another man should have been among the shrubs to the left.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r124","rowIndex":124,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そちらを見ると、確かにベージュのコートを着た男が銃を抜いて立っている。耳にイヤフォンがついている。あれで本部と連絡をとっているのかな。","en":"I looked and found a man in a beige coat standing there with his pistol drawn. An earphone sat in one ear. Was he using it to communicate with headquarters?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r125","rowIndex":125,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼は玄関から飛び出した私の姿を目で追えていない。その首を、コーラのペットボトルを開けるみたいに、透明人間の見えない腕を想像して、それでぐるっと捻る。","en":"His eyes could not follow me as I burst through the entrance. I imagined an invisible person’s unseen arm gripping his neck and twisting as though unscrewing the cap from a plastic bottle of cola.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r126","rowIndex":126,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　あっけなく二人目が倒れる。私たちは動かないのを確認する時間も惜しく、ゆらっと倒れようとしたときには地面を蹴って近くの電柱のてっぺんの上に立つ。","en":"The second man went down almost too easily. We could not spare even the time to make sure he had stopped moving. As he began to sway and topple, we kicked off the ground and landed atop a nearby utility pole.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r127","rowIndex":127,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ここから見えるのは建物の左、勝手口の方を見張っている二人。物音に気がついて緊張しているその表情が見える。その目は地の上を探しているが、視線のはるか上にいる私たちには気がついていない。","en":"From there, we could see two people watching the side entrance on the building’s left. They had heard something and looked tense. Their eyes searched the ground, never noticing us far above their line of sight.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r128","rowIndex":128,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　いまの私たちの『ちから』ならば、これだけ離れていても、充分な力を発揮出来る。電柱の上から一歩も動かず、その二人を順番に片付けた。","en":"With our power as it was now, we could bring more than enough force to bear even from this distance. Without taking a single step from the top of the utility pole, we disposed of the two of them in turn.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r129","rowIndex":129,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　最後にあと一人。私たちはもう一度ジャンプして、二階建てのその建物の屋根の上に移動する。","en":"Finally, one remained. We jumped again and moved to the roof of the two-story building.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r130","rowIndex":130,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　建物の裏側の、窓などを確認出来る場所に最後の一人が隠れている。少し聞きたい事がある。","en":"The last man was hiding behind the building, where he could watch the windows and other possible exits. We wanted to ask him a few questions.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r131","rowIndex":131,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちはジャンプして、それから先は自分の身体にサイキックの力を使って空中を移動しながら、その男のすぐ脇に着地する。","en":"We jumped, then used our psychic power on our own body to move through the air, landing immediately beside him.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r132","rowIndex":132,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あっ」","en":"“Ah!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r133","rowIndex":133,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　驚いて振り返ろうとするが私の方が早い。","en":"He turned in surprise, but I was faster.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r134","rowIndex":134,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　銃を構える手首を掴んで捻りあげ、もう片方の手で男の耳にあるイヤフォンを取り外し、握りつぶす。","en":"I caught the wrist of his gun hand and twisted it upward. With my other hand, I plucked the earphone from his ear and crushed it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r135","rowIndex":135,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「くそっ」","en":"“Damn it!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r136","rowIndex":136,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　男は抵抗するが、彼はノーマルだろうか？　その力は幼児が暴れるほどにも感じない。","en":"The man struggled. Was he a Normal? His strength felt feebler than that of a thrashing toddler.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r137","rowIndex":137,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　掴んだ手首を軽く引っ張ると、彼が踏ん張ろうとした両足も役に立たず、地面に顔から倒れる。","en":"When I tugged lightly upon the wrist in my grasp, he braced both legs, but they did him no good. He fell face-first to the ground.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r138","rowIndex":138,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちはその首元を上から押さえつけた。そして懐に手を突っ込んで、ポケットに入っていた薄いものを取り出す。案の定、それは警察手帳だった。","en":"We pinned him by the back of the neck, reached inside his coat, and removed the slim object in his pocket. As expected, it was police identification.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r139","rowIndex":139,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「は、はいがみ……」","en":"“H-Haigami...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r140","rowIndex":140,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　男はそう唸る。","en":"The man groaned the name.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r141","rowIndex":141,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「抵抗しても無駄だよ。叫んでも無駄。仲間たちはもう全員死んだ」","en":"“There’s no point resisting. No point screaming, either. All your people are already dead.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r142","rowIndex":142,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「きさま……」","en":"“You...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r143","rowIndex":143,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どうやってこの場所がわかったの？」","en":"“How did you find this place?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r144","rowIndex":144,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちはそう訊ねる。男は歯を食いしばったまま応えようとしない。","en":"We asked the question. The man clenched his teeth and refused to answer.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r145","rowIndex":145,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　時間はかけられない。私は彼の手の指を一本折る。鉛筆を折るよりずっと簡単だ。","en":"We had no time to waste. I broke one of his fingers. It was much easier than snapping a pencil.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r146","rowIndex":146,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ぐうっ」","en":"“Guh!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r147","rowIndex":147,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　男は悲鳴を上げる。","en":"The man screamed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r148","rowIndex":148,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「言えない？　それなら次は続けて二カ所」","en":"“Can’t speak? Then I’ll break you in two more places.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r149","rowIndex":149,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　次は同じ腕を手首でねじり折る。","en":"Next, I twisted the wrist of that same arm until it broke.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r150","rowIndex":150,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そしてその次は手首と肘の間の太い部分を掴んで折る。","en":"Then I gripped the thick part of his forearm, between wrist and elbow, and broke it there.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r151","rowIndex":151,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　関節以外の場所は少し固くて、掴んだ肉の方がずるっと剥けてしまった。","en":"Away from the joint, the bone was a little harder to break. Instead, the flesh under my grip peeled away with a wet slip.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r152","rowIndex":152,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　男は声にならない悲鳴を上げて悶絶する。私たちは苦しんで身をよじる動作すら与えない。","en":"The man convulsed in agony, screaming without a sound. We did not give him so much as the freedom to writhe.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r153","rowIndex":153,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「話せないなら、少しずつ折りたたんでいくよ」","en":"“If you can’t talk, I’ll keep folding you up a little at a time.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r154","rowIndex":154,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「わ、わかった。話す……」","en":"“A-all right. I’ll talk...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r155","rowIndex":155,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ありがとう。ただし嘘はつかないでね。本郷圭一さん。嘘とわかったらあなたの家族を一人ずつ苦しませながらバラバラにするから」","en":"“Thank you. But don’t lie to us, Keiichi Hongo. If we find out you have, we’ll tear your family apart one by one, making every last one of them suffer.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r156","rowIndex":156,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちは手帳に書かれた名前で彼を呼んだ。","en":"We called him by the name written in his identification.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r157","rowIndex":157,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼は苦痛に歪んだ顔にものすごい憎悪を浮かべて私たちを睨み付ける。","en":"His face contorted with pain, and he glared at us with ferocious hatred.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r158","rowIndex":158,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「じゃあもう一回聞くわ。どうやってこの場所がわかったの？」","en":"“Then I’ll ask you again. How did you find this place?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r159","rowIndex":159,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「捜査をしていて、偶然見つけて尾行していた……」","en":"“We were investigating. We happened to spot you and followed you here...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r160","rowIndex":160,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　やっぱり思った通りだ。","en":"It was just as we had thought.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r161","rowIndex":161,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「捜査員は何人くらい街に入っているの？」","en":"“Approximately how many investigators have entered the city?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r162","rowIndex":162,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「百二十人ほどだ」","en":"“About a hundred and twenty.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r163","rowIndex":163,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それが、こんな風に五人くらいのチームに分かれて捜査しているわけ？」","en":"“And you’ve divided into teams of about five to search like this?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r164","rowIndex":164,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうだ……」","en":"“That’s right…”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r165","rowIndex":165,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ふーん、そう。普通三人一組だって聞いたことあるけどな。もう一人はどこか応援を呼びにでも行ってるのかな……。まあいいや、あなたの所属は？」","en":"“Hmm. I see. I’ve heard you normally work in teams of three. Did the other one go to call for backup or something?… Never mind. What unit are you with?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r166","rowIndex":166,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「本庁の、<tips=16>タイプA</tips>対策班が出動している」","en":"“Headquarters has deployed its <tips=16>Type A</tips> Countermeasures Unit.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r167","rowIndex":167,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「目的は？」","en":"“Your objective?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r168","rowIndex":168,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>こと<tips=98>アレクサンドル・ヤコヴレヴィチ・チェルヌイフ</tips>及び、その協力者の逮捕だ」","en":"“To arrest the man known as <tips=20>Koschei</tips>, <tips=98>Aleksandr Yakovlevich Chernykh</tips>, and his accomplice.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r169","rowIndex":169,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=63>サーシェンカ</tips>の本当の名前を知っている。<tips=1>菅原亮</tips>が言ったとおり、もうその素性などはあらかた知られているんだ。","en":"They knew <tips=63>Sashenka’s</tips> real name. <tips=1>Ryo Sugawara</tips> had been right: the police already knew nearly everything about him.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r170","rowIndex":170,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ありがとう。あなたの協力のお陰で、あなたの愛する家族たちは幸福に暮らし続けることが出来るわ。あなたも助けてあげたいけれど、すぐに仲間を呼ぶでしょう？　そしたら、もっとたくさん殺さなきゃいけなくなるから」","en":"“Thank you. Thanks to your cooperation, your beloved family can go on living happily. I’d like to spare you too, but you’d call the others right away, wouldn’t you? Then we’d only have to kill even more people.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r171","rowIndex":171,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「やめっ……」","en":"“St—”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r172","rowIndex":172,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちは彼の髪の毛を掴み、言いかける彼の首をごきりと捻った。","en":"We caught him by the hair and snapped his neck as he began to speak.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r173","rowIndex":173,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ビクッと身体が痙攣し、そして動かなくなる。","en":"His body jerked, then went still.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r174","rowIndex":174,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちは立ち上がり、溜息をついた。","en":"We stood and sighed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r175","rowIndex":175,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いくよ」","en":"“Let’s go.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r176","rowIndex":176,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　玄関のところへ戻ると、<tips=64>アレクセイ</tips>にそう呼びかけた。","en":"We returned to the entrance and called to <tips=64>Alexei</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r177","rowIndex":177,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「早いな。うまくいったか？」","en":"“That was fast. Everything go all right?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アレクセイ","displayName":"Alexei","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r178","rowIndex":178,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼は玄関の脇に倒れている二人の警官を見下ろすとそう言った。","en":"He looked down at the two police officers lying beside the entrance as he spoke.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r179","rowIndex":179,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まあまあね。全員片付けた。でも、仲間を呼んでいるかもしれないから、すぐに移動しなきゃ」","en":"“Not bad. I took care of all of them. But they may have called for backup, so we need to move now.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r180","rowIndex":180,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「鮮やかなもんだ。<tips=62>マリア</tips>でもこう手際よくはいかない。あいつはパワーはあっても頭が悪すぎる。もうちょっとおれたちが早く出会っていたら、無敵のコンビだったろうよ」","en":"“Nicely done. Even <tips=62>Maria</tips> couldn’t have handled them that cleanly. She may have the power, but she’s far too stupid. If we’d met a little sooner, you and I could have made an unbeatable team.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アレクセイ","displayName":"Alexei","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r181","rowIndex":181,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=64>アレクセイ</tips>はそう言ってから、倒れている警官のそばに跪き、その握った銃を手に取る。","en":"After speaking, <tips=64>Alexei</tips> knelt beside one fallen officer and took the gun from his hand.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r182","rowIndex":182,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「二人とも<tips=43>APTG</tips>だな。コレしか持ってないのか？」","en":"“They’re both <tips=43>APTGs</tips>. Is that all they’re carrying?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アレクセイ","displayName":"Alexei","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r183","rowIndex":183,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼は舌打ちをするとその銃を投げ捨て、警官の上着の下に手を突っ込む。","en":"He clicked his tongue, threw the weapon aside, and reached beneath the officer’s jacket.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r184","rowIndex":184,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=43>APTG</tips>？」","en":"“<tips=43>APTG</tips>?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r185","rowIndex":185,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「サイキック用の銃だよ。ほら、いつだったかアパートでツノのおっさんが持ってたろ。サイキック相手には良いが、それ以外には使えない。殺傷力がないからな。……お、あった」","en":"“A gun for use against psychics. Remember that horned old guy who had one at the apartment? It works well on psychics, but it’s useless against anyone else. It can’t kill. ...Oh, found one.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アレクセイ","displayName":"Alexei","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r186","rowIndex":186,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　引き抜いた<tips=64>アレクセイ</tips>の手には拳銃が握られている。","en":"<tips=64>Alexei</tips> pulled out a handgun.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r187","rowIndex":187,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「お守りにしかならないが、ないよりはマシだな。じゃあ、さっさと行こうか」","en":"“It won’t amount to more than a good-luck charm, but it’s better than nothing. All right, let’s get moving.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アレクセイ","displayName":"Alexei","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r188","rowIndex":188,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちは頷き、そしてその場を離れた。","en":"We nodded and left the place behind.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r189","rowIndex":189,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　捜査員が街中にばらまかれているなか、どこへ行けばいいんだろう？","en":"With investigators scattered throughout the city, where were we supposed to go?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r190","rowIndex":190,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　このまま街の外へ逃げる？　難しいな。外はここよりも<tips=42>サイキック探知機</tips>が多いし、鳴ればすぐに警察が駆けつけて来る。私たちの力が使えなければ、<tips=64>アレクセイ</tips>を守り切るのは難しい。","en":"Should we flee beyond the city limits? That would be difficult. There were more <tips=42>psychic detectors</tips> outside, and the police would come immediately if one sounded. If we could not use our power, protecting <tips=64>Alexei</tips> all the way would be difficult.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r191","rowIndex":191,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　もうすでに不死身の力が彼の身体に戻っているとは限らないのだし。","en":"There was no guarantee the power of immortality had already returned to his body.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r192","rowIndex":192,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　いや、そもそも、もうその力は過信しない方がいいのかもしれない。<tips=1>菅原亮</tips>はその弱点を知っていた。『<tips=45>ローズ</tips>』と『<tips=46>ネオ・ローズ</tips>』を使えば復活は出来ない。<tips=55>松子</tips>のあの現場で『<tips=46>ネオ・ローズ</tips>』のついた容器を拾ったことで判明したと言っていたから、警察が知らないとは考えない方が良いだろう。","en":"No—perhaps we should not put too much faith in that power anymore. <tips=1>Ryo Sugawara</tips> knew its weakness. Using <tips=45>Rose</tips> and <tips=46>Neo Rose</tips> would make resurrection impossible. He said he had discovered that after picking up a container stained with <tips=46>Neo Rose</tips> at the scene of <tips=55>Matsuko’s</tips> death, so we had better not assume the police are unaware of it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r193","rowIndex":193,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=13>ヘドロ団地</tips>へ匿う？","en":"Could we hide him in the <tips=13>Sludge Housing Complex</tips>?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r194","rowIndex":194,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　いや、それはやめよう。あそこは<tips=14>深沢</tips>をトップにして組織めいた活動をすることはあるけれど、厳密には組織じゃない。一枚岩で行動することは出来ない。私たちはともかく、<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>という利用価値のある存在がそこにいるとなれば、誰がどう動くか計算が出来ない。そして何より、団地のみんなを巻き込むことは出来ない。","en":"No. We should not. The residents sometimes acted like an organization under <tips=14>Fukazawa’s</tips> leadership, but strictly speaking, they were not one. They could not act as a single body. Never mind us: if someone as potentially useful as <tips=20>Koschei</tips> were among them, we could not predict what any particular person might do. Above all, we could not involve everyone in the housing complex.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r195","rowIndex":195,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　結局、この<tips=9>Y地区</tips>にいるしかないんだろうか？　ここなら私たちは土地勘があるし、ちからを使って戦うことも出来る。けれど、警察が多数潜入しているようだし、衰えたとは言え<tips=47>八龍解放軍</tips>も<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>を恨んでいるだろう。そして２４時間が過ぎればさらに<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>が加わる。","en":"Did that leave us no choice but to remain in <tips=9>Y District</tips>? We knew the ground here and could use our power in a fight. But large numbers of police officers seemed to have infiltrated the city, and despite its decline, the <tips=47>Hachiryu Liberation Army</tips> must still hate <tips=20>Koschei</tips>. Once twenty-four hours passed, <tips=7>YS</tips> would join them.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r196","rowIndex":196,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　敵だらけだ。","en":"Enemies everywhere.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r197","rowIndex":197,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ああ、どうしたらいいのかわからない。おまけに耳鳴りが思考を邪魔する。","en":"God, we had no idea what to do. And the ringing in our ears kept getting in the way of our thoughts.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r198","rowIndex":198,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　結局、<tips=1>菅原亮</tips>のアドバイスがベストなんだろうな。滅多に表に出てこないレアな姿になっていれば、それだけで人の目を誤魔化せる<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>が街の外へ逃げて、私たちは<tips=13>ヘドロ団地</tips>に戻る。それがいいんだ。","en":"In the end, <tips=1>Ryo Sugawara’s</tips> advice was probably our best option. <tips=20>Koschei</tips> could fool anyone watching simply by staying in one of the rare forms that almost never surfaced. He would escape the city, and we would return to the <tips=13>Sludge Housing Complex</tips>. That was what we should do.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r199","rowIndex":199,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「おい、顔が真っ白だぞ。とりあえず、そこで休まないか？」","en":"“Hey, you’ve gone white. Why don’t we rest over there for now?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アレクセイ","displayName":"Alexei","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r200","rowIndex":200,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=64>アレクセイ</tips>が指さしたのは、街の大人たちが『連れ込み宿』と言っている施設だった。今風に言えばラブホテルとかブティックホテルと言った方がいいのかもしれないが、とてもそういった言葉の似合わない旅館のような木造建築は連れ込み宿という言葉の方が相応しかった。","en":"<tips=64>Alexei</tips> pointed to what the adults of the city called a ‘rendezvous inn.’ Nowadays, it might be described as a love hotel or a boutique hotel, but neither term suited the ryokan-like wooden building. ‘Rendezvous inn’ fit it far better.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r201","rowIndex":201,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　受付しなくちゃいけないし、なかがごちゃごちゃしていそうだし、秘密を保てなさそうだったのであまり気が進まなかったけれど、確かに私たちの体調は良くなく、そうした方がいいのかもしれない。","en":"The prospect did not appeal to us. We would have to speak with the staff, the interior looked cluttered, and privacy seemed doubtful. But we truly were unwell, and perhaps resting there was the right decision.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r202","rowIndex":202,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　こくりと頷くと、<tips=64>アレクセイ</tips>は私たちの手を引いてくれた。","en":"When we gave a small nod, <tips=64>Alexei</tips> took us by the hand.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r203","rowIndex":203,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"『部屋を、借りられますか？』","en":"“Could we have a room?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アレクセイ","displayName":"Alexei","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r204","rowIndex":204,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　入ってすぐのところに小さな受付があり、黒人の男が座っている。<tips=64>アレクセイ</tips>が作り笑いを浮かべてなまりのある英語で伝えると、","en":"A small reception desk stood just inside the entrance, with a Black man seated behind it. When <tips=64>Alexei</tips> gave him a false smile and spoke in accented English,","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r205","rowIndex":205,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「休憩なら一時間三千円。泊まりなら八千円」","en":"“Three thousand yen for an hour. Eight thousand for the night.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r206","rowIndex":206,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　日本語で返事が返ってくる。","en":"The man replied in Japanese.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r207","rowIndex":207,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「じゃあ、泊まりでお願いします」","en":"“Then we’ll stay the night, please.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アレクセイ","displayName":"Alexei","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r208","rowIndex":208,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=64>アレクセイ</tips>は愛想良く日本語でそう言った。","en":"<tips=64>Alexei</tips> replied amiably in Japanese.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r209","rowIndex":209,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちはその間、俯いて顔を見せなかった。姿が変えられる<tips=64>アレクセイ</tips>と違って、あまり顔を印象に残したくない。","en":"We kept our head lowered throughout the exchange, never showing our face. Unlike <tips=64>Alexei</tips>, we could not change our appearance, and did not want anyone to remember it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r210","rowIndex":210,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　建物は旅館風だが、システムは旅館とは違うらしい。部屋番号の入った鍵を貰って、私たちは玄関に靴を預け、ギシギシと音の鳴る廊下を歩く。","en":"The building resembled a ryokan, but apparently did not operate like one. We received a key bearing a room number, left our shoes at the entrance, and walked down a creaking corridor.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r211","rowIndex":211,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「こういう場所は懐かしいね。よく趣味に使わせてもらったよ。京都の旅館に泊まったときは、血が下に漏れちゃって、大変だったなあ」","en":"“Places like this take me back. I often used them for my hobby. Once, when I stayed at a ryokan in Kyoto, the blood leaked through to the floor below. What a mess that was.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アレクセイ","displayName":"Alexei","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r212","rowIndex":212,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=64>アレクセイ</tips>は状況にそぐわないウキウキとした調子で言った。","en":"<tips=64>Alexei</tips> spoke with a buoyancy utterly unsuited to the circumstances.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r213","rowIndex":213,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なあ<tips=12>江梨子</tips>。おれはやっぱり、世界に神はいると思うね」","en":"“You know, <tips=12>Eriko</tips>, I do think there’s a God in this world.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アレクセイ","displayName":"Alexei","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r214","rowIndex":214,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「急に、何を言ってるの？」","en":"“Where did that come from?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r215","rowIndex":215,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちは耳鳴りのうるささに顔を顰めながら言う。","en":"We spoke with a grimace, the ringing in our ears painfully loud.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r216","rowIndex":216,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「おれたちのような変わった趣味の人間がいるから、他の連中はおれたちと自分は違うからまともだ、正常だって、勘違い出来るのさ。真実を見つめずに、幸福に暮らすことができる。おれたちの存在にも価値があるんだよ。世界は良く出来てるな。これが神の配剤というやつだろう」","en":"“People with unusual tastes like ours let everyone else fool themselves into believing they’re decent and normal because they’re different from us. They can live happily without looking at the truth. That gives our existence value too. The world is beautifully made. This must be what they call divine providence.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アレクセイ","displayName":"Alexei","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r217","rowIndex":217,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ばかばかしい。それにしても、やけに上機嫌だね」","en":"“What nonsense. You certainly seem cheerful, though.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r218","rowIndex":218,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なんだか知らないが、目覚めてからずっと気分がいいんだよ。風景がキラキラと輝いて見える。素敵な気分さ」","en":"“I don’t know why, but I’ve felt great ever since I woke up. The whole world seems to sparkle. It’s a wonderful feeling.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アレクセイ","displayName":"Alexei","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r219","rowIndex":219,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　外装は和風だが、部屋のなかはベッドと椅子がある洋風の作りだった。こうしたごちゃ混ぜなあたりがこの街らしい。","en":"The exterior was Japanese, but the room was Western in design, furnished with a bed and chairs. The jumble of styles was characteristic of the city.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r220","rowIndex":220,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちはまずいざというとき逃げ道となる窓をチェックし、その外の様子を確認した。","en":"We first checked the window that would serve as an escape route in an emergency, then examined the view outside.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r221","rowIndex":221,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=64>アレクセイ</tips>、あなたたちはどうするつもりなの？」","en":"“<tips=64>Alexei</tips>, what are all of you going to do?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r222","rowIndex":222,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　部屋の設備を調べ終わると、私たちは小さな机に向かい合って座った。","en":"Once we had finished inspecting the room, we sat opposite one another at a small table.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r223","rowIndex":223,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どうするつもりって？」","en":"“What do you mean, what are we going to do?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アレクセイ","displayName":"Alexei","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r224","rowIndex":224,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「逃げる先とか考えてある？　ずっとここにいるつもりじゃないでしょう？」","en":"“Have you thought of somewhere to run? You don’t intend to stay here forever, do you?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r225","rowIndex":225,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「おれは何も考えちゃいないよ。そういうのはもともと爺さんの仕事だったんだ。今の状況じゃ、爺さんも指示を出せやしないがね。もし何かしたいとおれが決めたって、他の誰かに変身すればそいつの勝手で行動するんだろう」","en":"“I haven’t thought of anything. That was always the old man’s job. In our present condition, he can’t give us orders. And even if I decide I want to do something, the moment the body turns into someone else, that person will act however they please.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アレクセイ","displayName":"Alexei","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r226","rowIndex":226,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「呆れるわ。それじゃ、この危機的状況に何も手を打てないじゃない」","en":"“Unbelievable. Then you can’t do a thing about the situation you’re in.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r227","rowIndex":227,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まあ、それも仕方ない。あ、そう言えばポットのあたりに紅茶のティーバッグがあったな。淹れてきていいかい？」","en":"“It can’t be helped. Oh, come to think of it, I saw some tea bags near the kettle. Mind if I make some?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アレクセイ","displayName":"Alexei","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r228","rowIndex":228,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「好きにすれば」","en":"“Do whatever you like.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r229","rowIndex":229,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「冷たいなあ」","en":"“That’s cold.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アレクセイ","displayName":"Alexei","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r230","rowIndex":230,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=64>アレクセイ</tips>は苦笑して席を立つと、頼んでもいないのに私たちの分まで紅茶を淹れて運んできた。","en":"<tips=64>Alexei</tips> gave a wry smile and rose. Although we had not asked, he made tea for us as well and carried it over.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r231","rowIndex":231,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いやあ、落ち着くね。こんな安物の紅茶でも、美味いもんだ。実験室にいた頃もこんなティーバッグで飲まされたが、幸せだった」","en":"“Ah, that’s soothing. Even cheap tea like this tastes good. They used to give us tea bags like these in the laboratory. Those were happy times.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アレクセイ","displayName":"Alexei","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r232","rowIndex":232,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=64>アレクセイ</tips>は一口飲んで、大げさに溜息をつく。","en":"<tips=64>Alexei</tips> took a sip and heaved an exaggerated sigh.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r233","rowIndex":233,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まあそんな、むっつりするなよ。思うにね、この<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>という存在は野生生物のようなものなんだよ」","en":"“Don’t sit there brooding. The way I see it, this being called <tips=20>Koschei</tips> is a kind of wild animal.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アレクセイ","displayName":"Alexei","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r234","rowIndex":234,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どういうこと？」","en":"“What do you mean?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r235","rowIndex":235,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「この身体に住んでいるとね、先のことは考えても意味がないから考えないし、過去のことは記憶がない。その時だけの生き物なんだ。ただ、生まれた時に自分に与えられたものに従ってるだけ。もしおれたちの存在が社会にとって害悪というなら、本来は　”製造責任者”　の神も逮捕すべきなんだ。おれたちはきわめてナチュラルに生きているんだからね」","en":"“When you live in this body, there’s no point thinking about the future, so you don’t. And you have no memories of the past. You’re a creature of the present moment, merely obeying whatever you were given at birth. If our existence is harmful to society, then they ought to arrest God, the ‘manufacturer,’ as well. We live in an exceedingly natural fashion.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アレクセイ","displayName":"Alexei","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r236","rowIndex":236,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あなたのその理屈は聞き飽きたわ」","en":"“I’ve heard enough of that argument.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r237","rowIndex":237,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ふん」","en":"“Hmph.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アレクセイ","displayName":"Alexei","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r238","rowIndex":238,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=64>アレクセイ</tips>は鼻で笑って、","en":"<tips=64>Alexei</tips> snorted.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r239","rowIndex":239,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……<tips=65>ヘス</tips>の爺さんは何かを築きたいって欲望にかられて、<tips=18>ローズ・クラブ</tips>のようなことをやったがね、あんなのは本当は我々のすることじゃない。本能に従って好きなように生き、野垂れ死ぬべきだった。生物っていうのは、本質的にそれだけでいいとは思わないかい？　おれみたいな場所に住む人間からすると、社会の連中は、どうして、無理矢理なにかのふりをして生きようとしているのか、理解に苦しむね。しかも、結局誰も何にもなりきれもせずに中途半端に本性を出すんだ」","en":"“...Old <tips=65>Hess</tips> was consumed by the urge to build something, and that was why he created things like the <tips=18>Rose Club</tips>. But none of that was ever ours to do. We should have followed our instincts, lived however we pleased, and died in the gutter. Isn’t that all a living creature really needs? To a person living in a place like me, the people in society are baffling. I can’t understand why they force themselves to go on living while pretending to be something. In the end, not one of them ever becomes that something completely, yet they let their true nature show in half measures.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アレクセイ","displayName":"Alexei","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r240","rowIndex":240,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ねえ、今はそんなことはどうでもいいよ。これからをどうするのか考えなくちゃ。意見がないなんて、そんなこと言ってたってはじまらない」","en":"“Listen, none of that matters right now. We need to decide what comes next. Saying you have no opinion won’t get us anywhere.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r241","rowIndex":241,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちはそう言ったけれど、<tips=64>アレクセイ</tips>は聞かず、自分の感情をとりとめもなく語り続ける。","en":"We said this, but <tips=64>Alexei</tips> did not listen. He continued rambling about his feelings.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r242","rowIndex":242,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　まるで酒にでも酔っているようだった。私は地下室で投与された薬の影響を考えたけれど、聞いているうちにそうではないと判断した。<tips=64>アレクセイ</tips>はもう諦めきってしまっている。絶望が彼を追い立て、こうして熱に浮かされたように喋らせているのだ。","en":"He sounded almost drunk. I considered whether the drugs administered in the basement might be affecting him, but as I listened, I decided that was not it. <tips=64>Alexei</tips> had given up completely. Despair was driving him on and making him speak as though delirious with fever.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r243","rowIndex":243,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私にはちょっとわからない。この何人もの人間が住み着く<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>というマンションに、何か危機が訪れているのは確かなのだろう。前から<tips=65>エフゲニ・イリイーチ・ヘス</tips>老人もそれを口にしていた。","en":"I did not quite understand. Some crisis really did seem to be approaching the apartment building called <tips=20>Koschei</tips>, in which so many people had taken up residence. Old <tips=65>Yevgeny Ilyich Hess</tips> had spoken of it before.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r244","rowIndex":244,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しかし、一体何が訪れているというんだろう？　こうしてみる限り、確かに精神面では不安定なのかもしれないが、肉体的には健康そのもののように見えた。","en":"But what exactly was coming for them? As far as I could see, he might certainly have been mentally unstable, but physically he looked the very picture of health.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r245","rowIndex":245,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あなたの話はわかったわ」","en":"“I understand what you’re saying.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r246","rowIndex":246,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちは喋り続ける<tips=64>アレクセイ</tips>の言葉を遮った。","en":"We cut <tips=64>Alexei</tips> off mid-ramble.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r247","rowIndex":247,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あなたやお爺ちゃんがもう人格をコントロール出来なくなるのはわかった。でも、それが進行すると最終的にどうなるの？　ただコントロール出来なくて次々と変身してしまうとか、好き勝手に行動してしまうだけなら、何か私たちが協力すれば埋め合わせることが出来るかもしれない」","en":"“I understand that you and the old man are losing control of the other personalities. But what happens in the end if it keeps progressing? If all it means is losing control, changing from one person to the next, and each of you doing whatever you please, maybe we can help make up for it somehow.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r248","rowIndex":248,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　話の腰をおられた<tips=64>アレクセイ</tips>は興ざめしたように眉をへの字につり上げ、それから口を開いた。","en":"Deprived of his momentum, <tips=64>Alexei</tips> knitted his brows in disappointment before answering.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r249","rowIndex":249,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「わからない」","en":"“I don’t know.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アレクセイ","displayName":"Alexei","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r250","rowIndex":250,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「わからないって……」","en":"“You don’t know...?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r251","rowIndex":251,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「本当にわからないんだ」","en":"“I truly don’t.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アレクセイ","displayName":"Alexei","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r252","rowIndex":252,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=64>アレクセイ</tips>は溜息をつく。","en":"<tips=64>Alexei</tips> sighed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r253","rowIndex":253,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=65>ヘス</tips>の爺さんがまとめ役になるまで、おれたちには時間の感覚がなかった。こうして身体を乗っ取っているときはいつも前後の記憶がなくて、奥にひっこんで脈絡のない夢を見ているときと区別をするのも難しかったんだ。そして爺さんが現れると、お互いに意思の疎通が出来るようになったのさ。そうして、混乱極まりなかったおれたちのなかに秩序がうまれて、協力してこの身体をつかってうまくやろうって話になり、多少人間らしく行動出来るようになったんだよ。……で、今はまたそれが出来なくなりつつあって、最初の頃に戻ろうとしているのさ」","en":"“Until old <tips=65>Hess</tips> became our leader, we had no sense of time. Whenever we took control of this body, we had no memory of anything before or afterward, and it was difficult to distinguish that from withdrawing deep inside and dreaming disconnected dreams. Then the old man appeared, and we became able to communicate with one another. Order arose among us where there had been nothing but chaos, and we agreed to cooperate and make this body work. We became able to behave somewhat like human beings. …And now we’re losing that ability again and returning to the way we were at the beginning.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アレクセイ","displayName":"Alexei","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r254","rowIndex":254,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「その、最初のころのことは、何もわからないの？」","en":"“And you don’t know anything about those early days?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r255","rowIndex":255,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「おれたちが覚えているのは実験室の風景だけだ。そこでおれたちが生まれたのかどうかはわからんが、まあ、病院に閉じ込められている重度の<tips=17>タイプB</tips>みたいに、繰り返し変身しながらわけのわからないことを叫んでいたんだろうよ」","en":"“All we remember is the laboratory. I don’t know whether we were born there, but we were probably like the severely affected <tips=17>Type Bs</tips> confined in hospitals—transforming again and again while shouting incomprehensible things.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アレクセイ","displayName":"Alexei","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r256","rowIndex":256,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=64>アレクセイ</tips>は肩をすくめて自嘲の笑みを浮かべる。","en":"<tips=64>Alexei</tips> shrugged with a self-mocking smile.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r257","rowIndex":257,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「その頃に戻ろうとしてるってこと？」","en":"“You mean you’re returning to that?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r258","rowIndex":258,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうかもしれない。そうじゃないかもしれない。死んでなくなってしまうのかもしれない」","en":"“Perhaps. Perhaps not. Perhaps I’ll die and disappear.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アレクセイ","displayName":"Alexei","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r259","rowIndex":259,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「頼りないことを言わないで」","en":"“Don’t be so vague.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r260","rowIndex":260,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「だってそうなんだよ」","en":"“But that’s the truth.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アレクセイ","displayName":"Alexei","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r261","rowIndex":261,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=64>アレクセイ</tips>は空になった紅茶のカップを両手で弄びながら、","en":"<tips=64>Alexei</tips> turned the empty teacup between his hands.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r262","rowIndex":262,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=12>江梨子</tips>は、おれたちは何が理由でこんな風になってるんだと思う？」","en":"“<tips=12>Eriko</tips>, what do you think made us this way?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アレクセイ","displayName":"Alexei","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r263","rowIndex":263,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「何が理由って……<tips=16>タイプA</tips>のサイキック能力か何かじゃないの？」","en":"“What made you...? Some <tips=16>Type A</tips> psychic power, I suppose.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r264","rowIndex":264,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「おそらくそうだろう。だとしたら、この身体は元々誰かオリジナルが一人いて、他の人間はみんなそいつの能力で生み出されたまぼろしってことになるんじゃないか？」","en":"“Probably. If so, perhaps this body originally belonged to a single person, while all the others are phantoms that person created with their power.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アレクセイ","displayName":"Alexei","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r265","rowIndex":265,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=64>アレクセイ</tips>はその青みがかった瞳で私たちを見る。","en":"<tips=64>Alexei</tips> watched us with blue-tinged eyes.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r266","rowIndex":266,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その憂いがかった表情に、私たちはこたえられるものを持っていない。","en":"We had no answer for the sorrow in his expression.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r267","rowIndex":267,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「おれには子どもの頃の思い出がない。気がついた時にはこの姿で、この性格だった。そして何十年も変わらない。とすれば、きっとおれはオリジナルじゃないんだろう。もし、この混乱が<tips=16>タイプA</tips>能力の衰えによるもので、最終的に能力が失われてしまうんだとしたら、このおれもそれと同時に消えてなくなってしまう筈だ。この推測は間違ってるかい？」","en":"“I have no memories of childhood. By the time I became conscious of myself, I already had this appearance and this personality. Neither has changed in decades. That surely means I’m not the original. If this confusion is caused by the decline of a <tips=16>Type A</tips> ability, and that ability is ultimately lost, then I should disappear along with it. Is there something wrong with that theory?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アレクセイ","displayName":"Alexei","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r268","rowIndex":268,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……そう、かもしれないね」","en":"“...Maybe you’re right.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r269","rowIndex":269,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちの返事に、<tips=64>アレクセイ</tips>は無理矢理唇の端をつり上げるようにして笑い、","en":"At our answer, <tips=64>Alexei</tips> forced the corner of his mouth upward in a smile.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r270","rowIndex":270,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「だとしたら、今のおれの自我というものはなんなんだろうな。生命でもなく、誰かの能力によって生み出されたまぼろしなのか。……いや、まあ、それはいい。いくつもの命を奪ってきた殺人者が、自分のアイデンティティの喪失に悩んだって誰も同情はしないさ」","en":"“Then what exactly is this self of mine? Not a living thing, but a phantom produced by someone else’s ability? …No, well, it hardly matters. No one is going to sympathize with a murderer who’s taken countless lives merely because he’s worried about losing his own identity.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アレクセイ","displayName":"Alexei","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r271","rowIndex":271,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=64>アレクセイ</tips>は肩をすくめ、","en":"<tips=64>Alexei</tips> shrugged.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r272","rowIndex":272,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「とにかくね、このまま混乱をし続けるのか、それとも能力自体失ってオリジナルだけになってしまうのか、それはわからないんだよ。もしかしたら一時的なもので、元のようにうまくコントロール出来るようになるのかもしれないが、望み薄だね」","en":"“In any case, we don’t know whether we’ll remain in chaos or lose the ability itself until only the original remains. It may even be temporary, and we may regain control as before, but I wouldn’t place much hope in that.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アレクセイ","displayName":"Alexei","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r273","rowIndex":273,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……こわいの？」","en":"“...Are you afraid?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r274","rowIndex":274,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうかもしれない。でも、これでいいような気もする。率直に言えばおれのような存在は社会にとって悪でしかないし、滅ぶべきなんだろう。……それなら、なぜここに生んだのだという神に対する怒りはあるが、それはもう今までの長い人生で憎悪し尽くしたよ。あとはただのんびり好きなことをして暮らしたい」","en":"“Maybe. But part of me feels this is for the best. To be honest, a being like me is nothing but an evil to society and probably ought to perish. ...I was angry at God—if that was so, then why create me here at all? But over the course of this long life, I’ve exhausted that hatred. Now I only want to take it easy and do as I please.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アレクセイ","displayName":"Alexei","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r275","rowIndex":275,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「好きなことって、なに？　また人殺しでもしたいの？」","en":"“What do you like doing? Do you want to kill people again?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r276","rowIndex":276,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちの言葉に、彼は肩をすくめて、","en":"Alexei shrugged at our words.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r277","rowIndex":277,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「わからない。でも、今から街に繰り出して誰かをバラバラにしたいとは思わないな」","en":"“I don’t know. But I don’t feel like heading into town right now and tearing someone apart.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アレクセイ","displayName":"Alexei","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r278","rowIndex":278,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「街に行かなくても、たとえば目の前にいる女に対しては？」","en":"“Even without going into the city—what about, say, the woman sitting in front of you?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r279","rowIndex":279,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「おいおい、きみは自殺志願者なのかい？」","en":"“Come on. Do you have a death wish?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アレクセイ","displayName":"Alexei","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r280","rowIndex":280,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ただ好奇心で聞いてるだけ」","en":"“I’m merely curious.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r281","rowIndex":281,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼はふうと溜息をついて、","en":"He released a long breath.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r282","rowIndex":282,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「きみに対してそんな気持ちは起きない。……大切な人だからな。殺した相手だってみんな大切だったが、それとは違うんだ。きっと、オリジナルがあんたを好きなんだろう。……だとすると、これは、おれの気持ちじゃないのかもしれないな」","en":"“I don’t feel that way toward you. …You’re important to me. Everyone I killed was important to me too, but this is different. I suppose the original must like you. …If so, perhaps these feelings aren’t really mine.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アレクセイ","displayName":"Alexei","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r283","rowIndex":283,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼は寂しそうに言う。私たちはなんと答えたらいいのかわからず、黙ってしまう。","en":"He said it sadly. We did not know how to answer and fell silent.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r284","rowIndex":284,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　沈黙のあと、私は別のことを尋ねた。","en":"After the silence, I asked something else.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r285","rowIndex":285,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「一つ聞きたいんだけど」","en":"“There’s one thing I want to ask.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r286","rowIndex":286,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なんだい」","en":"“What is it?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アレクセイ","displayName":"Alexei","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r287","rowIndex":287,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あなたはどうして<tips=55>汐松子</tips>を……自分の娘をわざわざ殺しに行ったの？　あんな施設まで出向いて」","en":"“Why did you go out of your way to kill <tips=55>Matsuko Shio</tips>... your own daughter? Why travel all the way to a place like that just to do it?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r288","rowIndex":288,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「おれの娘じゃない。この身体のなかにいる別の女が母親だよ。おれは無関係だ」","en":"“She isn’t my daughter. Another woman inside this body is her mother. I have nothing to do with her.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アレクセイ","displayName":"Alexei","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r289","rowIndex":289,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼は肩をすくめてから、","en":"He shrugged, then said,","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r290","rowIndex":290,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「殺しに行ったのはね、あの少女が危険だからさ」","en":"“I went to kill her because that girl was dangerous.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アレクセイ","displayName":"Alexei","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r291","rowIndex":291,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「何が危険なの？　警察に捜されてるんだから、あんな事件を起こしに行く方が危険じゃない。<tips=55>汐松子</tips>はひっそりと暮らしていただけだよ。お爺ちゃんの指示？　そうだとしても、理屈にあわない。実際そのせいで、いろんな情報を敵に与えてしまった」","en":"“How was she dangerous? With the police looking for you, going out and causing an incident like that was the dangerous thing to do. <tips=55>Matsuko Shio</tips> was only living quietly. Was it Grandpa’s order? Even if it was, it doesn’t make sense. That incident ended up giving our enemies all kinds of information.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r292","rowIndex":292,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼は黙ってじっと私を見つめる。","en":"He stared at me in silence.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r293","rowIndex":293,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして首を横に振ると、","en":"Then he shook his head.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r294","rowIndex":294,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あの娘のことを考えると、おれたちは何故だか気持ちがざわざわとして落ち着かなくなるんだ。母親になったあの女だけじゃなく、おれも、<tips=65>ヘス</tips>の爺さんも、ガキも、みんなが……。だから、殺さなくちゃいけなかった」","en":"“For some reason, whenever we think of that girl, our feelings turn restless and we can’t calm down. Not just the woman who became her mother. Me, old <tips=65>Hess</tips>, the brat—everybody... That’s why we had to kill her.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アレクセイ","displayName":"Alexei","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r295","rowIndex":295,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その顏には動揺と苦悩に似た感情が浮かんでいる。彼が殺人について語るときの恍惚の表情とはまったく別の顔がそこにある。この苦悩も、彼自身の感情ではなく、オリジナルのものなのだろうか。","en":"Something like agitation and anguish crossed his face. It was altogether different from the rapture he ordinarily showed when speaking of murder. Was this anguish not his own feeling either, but the original’s?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r296","rowIndex":296,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それは、あなたたちが娘のことを愛しているからじゃないの？」","en":"“Doesn’t that mean all of you love your daughter?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r297","rowIndex":297,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「違うね」","en":"“No.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アレクセイ","displayName":"Alexei","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r298","rowIndex":298,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　予想と違って、彼の返答は明瞭だった。","en":"Contrary to expectation, his answer was unequivocal.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r299","rowIndex":299,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「血のつながりというのはただのリスクだ。心にずけずけと入り込んで、冷静な行動を妨害する。だから存在してはいけないんだ」","en":"“A blood relationship is merely a liability. It barges into your heart and interferes with rational action. That’s why it must not be allowed to exist.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アレクセイ","displayName":"Alexei","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r300","rowIndex":300,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それが愛というものではないだろうか？","en":"Was that not what love meant?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r301","rowIndex":301,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちのことを素直に大切だと言ったのに、なぜ<tips=55>汐松子</tips>のことはそう言えないのか。もっと強い感情があるからだろう。","en":"He had candidly said that we mattered to him, so why could he not say the same of <tips=55>Matsuko Shio</tips>? Perhaps because his feelings for her were stronger.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r302","rowIndex":302,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちはそう思ったけれど何も言わなかった。彼はその感情の正体に気づいていないのかもしれない。けれど、私たちもまた人に偉そうに説教出来るほど詳しくはない。","en":"That was what we thought, but we said nothing. Perhaps he did not recognize the feeling for what it was. Then again, we knew too little ourselves to presume to lecture anyone.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r303","rowIndex":303,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちはふと兄のことを思い出し、心が渇いてゆくのを感じた。","en":"We suddenly remembered our brother and felt our heart go dry.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r304","rowIndex":304,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「一つだけ頼みがあるんだ」","en":"“I have just one request.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アレクセイ","displayName":"Alexei","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r305","rowIndex":305,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　二人とも黙りこくってしまって生まれた長い長い静寂を破ったのは彼の言葉だった。","en":"His words broke the long, long silence that had settled between us.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r306","rowIndex":306,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「キスをさせてくれないか？」","en":"“Could I kiss you?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アレクセイ","displayName":"Alexei","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r307","rowIndex":307,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「急にどうして？」","en":"“Why, all of a sudden?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r308","rowIndex":308,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「わからない。そうしたくなったんだ」","en":"“I don’t know. I just found myself wanting to.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アレクセイ","displayName":"Alexei","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r309","rowIndex":309,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「わかったわ」","en":"“All right.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r310","rowIndex":310,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちは頷いた。","en":"We nodded.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r311","rowIndex":311,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「でも、私たちはあなたのことを愛していないよ？」","en":"“But we don’t love you, you know?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r312","rowIndex":312,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それでもかまわない」","en":"“That’s all right.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アレクセイ","displayName":"Alexei","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r313","rowIndex":313,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=64>アレクセイ</tips>は立ち上がると、手を伸ばして私たちの唇に触れた。","en":"<tips=64>Alexei</tips> rose, reached out, and touched our lips.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r314","rowIndex":314,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いくよ」","en":"“Here goes.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アレクセイ","displayName":"Alexei","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r315","rowIndex":315,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちが返事をしないうちに、彼は顔を近づけ、唇を重ね合わせる。","en":"Before we could answer, he brought his face close and pressed his lips to ours.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r316","rowIndex":316,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　少し乾燥した彼の唇のやわらかい感触が伝わって来る。","en":"We felt the soft touch of his slightly dry lips.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r317","rowIndex":317,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼は顔を離し、じっと私たちの目を見つめた。それから、両手で私たちの両肩に触れ、抱きしめた。身体が痛くなるほどだ。","en":"He drew his face away and stared into our eyes. Then he placed both hands upon our shoulders and embraced us, hard enough to hurt.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r318","rowIndex":318,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼の腕は震えている。やはり、恐ろしいのだろう。","en":"His arms were trembling. He must have been afraid after all.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r319","rowIndex":319,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　口を開きかけて、私はすぐに閉じた。――ああ、ダメだ。また耳鳴りがする。しかも、今までとはちょっと違う。キーンとする音のなかに、何か細く高い声がきこえる。私たちに話しかけているんだろうか？","en":"I started to open my mouth, then immediately closed it. —Ah, no. The ringing was back. And this time it was a little different. Somewhere inside the piercing tone, we could hear a thin, high-pitched voice. Was it talking to us?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r320","rowIndex":320,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=17>タイプB</tips>の症状が出ているんだ。嘘の声だとわかっているけど、心がぞわぞわとかき乱される。言葉の内容はわからないけれど、私たちを呪っているに違いない。","en":"It was a symptom of <tips=17>Type B</tips>. We knew the voice was false, yet it set a crawling unease loose in our heart. We could not understand its words, but it had to be cursing us.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r321","rowIndex":321,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちが顔を歪めたのを、<tips=64>アレクセイ</tips>は何か誤解したのかもしれない。さらに力強く、私を抱きしめる。","en":"Perhaps <tips=64>Alexei</tips> misunderstood when we grimaced. He embraced me even more tightly.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r322","rowIndex":322,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　こんなに密着して、近くにいるのに、私たちのなかで今起こっていることに気がつかないのだ。私のいまの気持ちもまったく伝わっていないのだろう。私たちか彼にテレパシー能力があればよかったのに。いや、なかったからよかったのか。","en":"We were pressed so close together, yet he noticed nothing happening inside us. He probably had no idea what I was feeling now either. If only he—or we—had telepathy. No—perhaps it was better that neither of us did.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r323","rowIndex":323,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ぎゅっと目を閉じる。","en":"We squeezed our eyes shut.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r324","rowIndex":324,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　心が寒々しい。半分になって、とっても孤独だ。夜の海に浮かぶ小さな岩のように、冷たい波がなんども打ち付けて全て奪い取られてしまいそうだ。声が私たちを批判している。目を閉じるとよりいっそうはっきり聞こえるようだ。","en":"Our heart was cold and desolate. We had been cut in half, and we were terribly lonely. Like a tiny rock in a nighttime sea, we felt as though cold waves would strike again and again until they carried everything away. The voice was condemning us. Closing our eyes only made it clearer.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r325","rowIndex":325,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　つらくてたまらない。なんて無意味な人生だったんだろう。何か心を温めるものはないかと、真っ暗な記憶のなかをさがすと、ぼんやり光景が思い浮かんだ。","en":"The pain was unbearable. What a meaningless life we had lived. Searching our dark memories for something that might warm our heart, we found a hazy scene rising into view.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r326","rowIndex":326,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　つぎはぎだらけのアスファルトで覆われた細い路地。ベトナム人がやっていた時計屋は、みんなの腕時計をただ同然で直してくれる親切な人で、主に盗品の売買で暮らしていた。そのとなりのクリーニング店はいつもシャッターが下りていて、裏口から入って来る人に麻薬を売っていた。それから、おかみさんが残飯を煮直して貧しい人に無償で提供している定食屋さんや、新しい種類のお酒が出来ると路上に出したソファーで朝から飲み出す気の良い密造酒屋さんがいた。","en":"A narrow alley paved with asphalt that had been patched countless times. A Vietnamese watchmaker kindly repaired everyone’s watches for almost nothing and supported himself chiefly by trading stolen goods. The laundry next door always kept its shutter closed and sold drugs to people who entered through the back. There was a diner whose proprietress reheated leftovers and gave them free to the poor, and a good-natured bootlegger who, whenever he made a new kind of liquor, would set a sofa in the street and start drinking in the morning.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r327","rowIndex":327,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちの家があったのはそういう路地だった。","en":"Our home had stood in an alley like that.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r328","rowIndex":328,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　暖かい季節は戸を全部開けているので、家の近くまで来ると革のにおいがした。","en":"In warm weather, all the doors remained open, and the smell of leather greeted us as we approached the house.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r329","rowIndex":329,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　父さんは腕の良い靴職人で、母さんはその手伝いをしていた。どこかちゃんとしたところで修業して働いていたけれど、母さんとつき合い、結婚するときに辞めなくてはならなくなって、<tips=9>Y地区</tips>に来たんだと言う。何か複雑な事情があったらしいけれど聞いたことはなかった。","en":"Father was a skilled shoemaker, and Mother helped him with his work. We were told that he had trained and worked somewhere respectable, but when he began seeing Mother and decided to marry her, he was forced to leave. That was how they came to <tips=9>Y District</tips>. Apparently there was some complicated story behind it, but we never heard what it was.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r330","rowIndex":330,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　靴を直すだけでは食べていけなかったので鞄や服も直した。とても上手に直すので、近くの人だけでなく、<tips=57>滑走路通り</tips>に大きな店を構えるお金持ちや、目つきの悪い部下を引き連れたギャングまでお客としてやって来た。そして常連客はよく私たちにお菓子をくれた。","en":"Repairing shoes alone could not feed the family, so he mended bags and clothes as well. His work was so fine that his customers included not only people from the neighborhood, but rich men with large shops on <tips=57>Runway Street</tips> and gangsters accompanied by hard-eyed subordinates. The regulars often brought us sweets.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r331","rowIndex":331,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　外でいたずらばかりする私たちに両親は優しかった。そして、遠くの学校に通っていたお兄ちゃんからはいつもプレゼントと手紙が届き、私たち二人はそのたびに肩をくっつけて真剣に返事を書いた。そして、いつか会う時を楽しみにしていた。","en":"Our parents were kind to us despite all the mischief we caused outside. Our brother, who attended a distant school, always sent gifts and letters. Each time, the two of us pressed our shoulders together and composed a serious reply. We looked forward to the day when we would finally meet him.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r332","rowIndex":332,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その夢は実現するのだけれど、私たちはその兄を殺してしまった。","en":"That wish came true, and we killed him.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r333","rowIndex":333,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そう、あれは私たちが殺したんだ。","en":"Yes. We were the ones who killed him.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r334","rowIndex":334,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちに会おうとしてくれたお兄ちゃんを化け物だと言って、殺したんだ。","en":"Our brother tried to come and see us. We called him a monster and killed him.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r335","rowIndex":335,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>菅原亮</tips>が最後に銃で撃って、殺したのは私たちじゃないと言ってくれたけど、でも本当のことはちゃんとわかっている。あんな茶番をしたって何の意味もない。でも嬉しかった。本当に嬉しかった。だから私たちは<tips=1>菅原亮</tips>のことを好きになったんだろう。","en":"<tips=1>Ryo Sugawara</tips> fired the final shot and told us that we were not the ones who had killed him. But we know the truth. That charade did not mean a thing. Still, we were happy. We were truly happy. Perhaps that was why we came to love <tips=1>Ryo Sugawara</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r336","rowIndex":336,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　だから気持ちが悪かった。","en":"And that sickened us.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r337","rowIndex":337,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　自分を何よりも大事にしてくれて、自分たちも大好きだった相手を殺してしまった。そんな人間は誰にも愛される資格はないし、誰かを愛する資格もない。","en":"We had killed someone who treasured us above everything, someone whom we loved in return. A person who did that deserved neither to be loved nor to love anyone.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r338","rowIndex":338,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ただ借りだけはいつか返したかった。<tips=55>汐松子</tips>を届けたから、それでもう返せたろうか？　いや、あれじゃ足りないかもしれない。そもそも私たちなら止めることも出来たんだ。私たちは<tips=55>汐松子</tips>のことも好きだったんだから。","en":"We only wanted to repay our debt someday. We delivered <tips=55>Matsuko Shio</tips>. Was that enough to repay it? No. Perhaps not. We could have stopped it in the first place. We had loved <tips=55>Matsuko Shio</tips> too.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r339","rowIndex":339,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=55>汐松子</tips>をうまく生き返らせてくれればいい。そうして二人で仲良く暮らせばいいんだ。そうすれば私たちは借りを返したことになるだろう。","en":"We hoped they would succeed in bringing <tips=55>Matsuko Shio</tips> back. Then the two of them could live happily together. If they did, perhaps our debt would be repaid.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r340","rowIndex":340,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちはこれからどこへゆくのか？　<tips=64>アレクセイ</tips>はもう自暴自棄になっていて生き延びる道を考えない。私たちがそれについていけば、彼と同じ運命をたどるだろう。かといって、私たちはどこへいけばいいのか？　<tips=13>ヘドロ団地</tips>に行けばみなは守ってくれるだろう。でもそうしたら警察や<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>との本格的な衝突になりそうだ。それはめんどうくさい。","en":"Where would we go now? <tips=64>Alexei</tips> had given himself over to despair and would not search for a path to survival. If we followed him, we would share his fate. But where else could we go? Everyone would protect us if we returned to the <tips=13>Sludge Housing Complex</tips>. That, however, would probably cause an all-out confrontation with the police and <tips=7>YS</tips>. It sounded tiresome.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r341","rowIndex":341,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=64>アレクセイ</tips>……」","en":"“<tips=64>Alexei</tips>…”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r342","rowIndex":342,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちは彼に抱きしめられながらそう言った。","en":"We said it while he held us.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r343","rowIndex":343,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あなたがしたいのは、これだけ？」","en":"“Is this all you want to do?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r344","rowIndex":344,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ああ……」","en":"“Yeah...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r345","rowIndex":345,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼はかすれる声で、小さく呟いた。","en":"He murmured in a small, hoarse voice.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r346","rowIndex":346,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「これだけで充分だ……」","en":"“This is all I need...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r347","rowIndex":347,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そう」","en":"“I see.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r348","rowIndex":348,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ここで殺したいと言ってくれればな、と自分が思っていることに驚いた。","en":"I was startled to find myself wishing he would tell me he wanted to kill me right here.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r349","rowIndex":349,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=64>アレクセイ</tips>は子供のように私にしがみついている。彼にはずっと優しくしてきたつもりだけれど、かえって残酷なことをしたかもしれない。","en":"<tips=64>Alexei</tips> clung to me like a child. I had always meant to be kind to him, but perhaps in doing so I had only been cruel.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r350","rowIndex":350,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　優しさと残酷さは似ているんだろうか？","en":"Were kindness and cruelty alike?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r351","rowIndex":351,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私はそんなことを考えながら、しみだらけの古い壁を見つめていた。","en":"As I thought about these things, I stared at the stained old wall.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r352","rowIndex":352,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　翌朝は頭痛と共に目が覚めた。","en":"The next morning, we woke with a headache.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r353","rowIndex":353,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　相変わらずの古ぼけた部屋。私たちはあのまま眠ってしまっていた。","en":"The same old, decrepit room. We had fallen asleep just as we were.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r354","rowIndex":354,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　もう<tips=1>菅原亮</tips>が予告していた時間が過ぎている。ということは、警察に加えて<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>もこの街で私たちを追うことになったということだ。","en":"The time <tips=1>Ryo Sugawara</tips> had warned us about had already passed. That meant <tips=7>YS</tips> had now joined the police in hunting us throughout the city.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r355","rowIndex":355,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私の力は前よりも大分強くなったけれども、本格的に対サイキック装備で固めた警察と、この街の裏路地まで知り尽くした<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>の両方を相手にまわすのは難しい。","en":"My power had grown considerably stronger, but taking on both a police force fully equipped to fight psychics and <tips=7>YS</tips>, which knew every back alley in the city, would be difficult.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r356","rowIndex":356,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　昨夜は結局具体的な方針を何も考えられなかった。いまも、なんだか面倒くさい。かつて全身にあった活力が消えてしまっている。","en":"In the end, we had decided upon no concrete plan the night before. Even now, thinking about it felt tiresome. The vitality that once filled our whole body had disappeared.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r357","rowIndex":357,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=17>タイプB</tips>としての病が進むと意欲がなくなり無為になったりもするというが、そのせいだろうか。","en":"We had heard that as the <tips=17>Type B</tips> illness progressed, a person could lose all motivation and lapse into inactivity. Was that what was happening?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r358","rowIndex":358,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　とにかく、<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>の意見を聞こう。","en":"In any case, we would ask <tips=20>Koschei’s</tips> opinion.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r359","rowIndex":359,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　隣に体温を感じている。これが<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>だろう。一晩明けて、誰の姿になっていることやら。","en":"We could feel the warmth of a body beside us. That had to be <tips=20>Koschei</tips>. Whose form would we find after a night had passed?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r360","rowIndex":360,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　身体を動かして、そちらを見る。相手は背中を向けていて、若い男の白い背中が見える。<tips=64>アレクセイ</tips>じゃない。","en":"We shifted and looked that way. The other person had his back to us: the pale, bare back of a young man. It was not <tips=64>Alexei</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r361","rowIndex":361,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=63>サーシェンカ</tips>……」","en":"“<tips=63>Sashenka</tips>...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r362","rowIndex":362,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私はその名前を呼んで、裸の肩に触れた。","en":"I called his name and touched his naked shoulder.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r363","rowIndex":363,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「んっ……」","en":"“Nnh...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"サーシェンカ白シャツ","displayName":"Sashenka (White Shirt)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r364","rowIndex":364,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼は小さく声をあげて、そして寝返りを打ってこちらを振り返ると、すぐ目の前にいる私を見て目を丸くした。","en":"He let out a small sound and rolled over to face me. When he saw me right there before him, his eyes widened.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r365","rowIndex":365,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「きみは……ああ……」","en":"“You’re... Oh...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"サーシェンカ白シャツ","displayName":"Sashenka (White Shirt)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r366","rowIndex":366,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼は嬉しそうに手を伸ばし、私の顎のあたりに触れようとした。","en":"With a look of delight, he reached out as if to touch me near the chin.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r367","rowIndex":367,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しかし、その手が直前で止まると、私の方ではなく、彼自身の頭を抱え込んだ。","en":"But his hand stopped just short of me, then went instead to clutch his own head.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r368","rowIndex":368,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ああっ……」","en":"“Aah...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"サーシェンカ白シャツ","displayName":"Sashenka (White Shirt)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r369","rowIndex":369,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼は苦悶の表情を浮かべて身をよじらせる。","en":"His face twisted in anguish as his body writhed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r370","rowIndex":370,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=63>サーシェンカ</tips>！」","en":"“<tips=63>Sashenka</tips>!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r371","rowIndex":371,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は起き上がり、彼の肩に手をかけてこちらを向かせた。","en":"I sat up, caught him by the shoulder, and turned him toward me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r372","rowIndex":372,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼は苦しみながら私の顔を見た。澄んだ淡い色の瞳が私をとらえたと思った瞬間、みるみるうちにそのまわりに皮膚に深いしわが生まれていった。","en":"Even through the pain, he looked into my face. His clear, pale eyes met mine, and in that instant, deep wrinkles began to spread across the skin around them.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r373","rowIndex":373,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼は白磁のようなつややかでみずみずしい少年の肌を持っていた。それがあっという間に潤いを失ってひび割れのようなしわが生まれ、茶色く変化し、ところどころしみが浮かび上がる。","en":"His skin had been that of a boy, lustrous and fresh as white porcelain. In the blink of an eye it dried out, wrinkles spreading across it like cracks. It turned brown, and age spots surfaced here and there.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r374","rowIndex":374,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　こんな姿あっただろうか？　初めて見た姿だ。","en":"Had he ever taken this form before? We had never seen it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r375","rowIndex":375,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ああ、どうなっているんだ。ここは……？」","en":"“Ah... What's going on? Where am I...?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r376","rowIndex":376,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼はうめきながら私を見る。","en":"He groaned as he looked at me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r377","rowIndex":377,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その仕草と口調で気がついた。","en":"We recognized him from the gesture and his manner of speaking.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r378","rowIndex":378,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　これは、他の誰でもない。<tips=63>サーシェンカ</tips>だ。<tips=63>サーシェンカ</tips>が、年をとったんだ。","en":"This could be no one else. It was <tips=63>Sashenka</tips>. <tips=63>Sashenka</tips> had grown old.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r379","rowIndex":379,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あなた、<tips=63>サーシェンカ</tips>なの？」","en":"“Are you <tips=63>Sashenka</tips>?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r380","rowIndex":380,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「う、うん……」","en":"“Y-yes...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r381","rowIndex":381,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　驚きはしたけれど、それ以上に、何か納得したような腑に落ちる感覚があった。","en":"We were surprised, but stronger still was the feeling that something had clicked into place.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r382","rowIndex":382,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>がはじめて世間に知られたのはもう何十年も前のことだ。その時<tips=63>サーシェンカ</tips>が少年だったとすれば、これくらい年をとるのがあたりまえだ。もしかしたら、これが本来の姿なのかもしれない。全ての魔法が解けたのだ。","en":"<tips=20>Koschei</tips> had first become known to the world decades ago. If <tips=63>Sashenka</tips> had been a boy then, it was only natural that he would now be this old. Perhaps this was his true form. All the magic had come undone.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r383","rowIndex":383,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ねえ、やっぱりあなたがオリジナルなの？」","en":"“Then are you the original after all?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r384","rowIndex":384,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼の身体に住む他の人々の口ぶりだとそんな感じがあった。けれど、年をとらない少年の姿だったから今一つ信じ切ることが出来なかった。","en":"The way the others inhabiting his body spoke had always suggested as much. But because he remained a boy who never aged, we could never quite believe it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r385","rowIndex":385,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　でも、今の姿ならそれを自然に認めることが出来る。","en":"In this form, though, I could readily accept it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r386","rowIndex":386,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それにしても、こんな訊き方はなかったろう。これじゃ、<tips=63>サーシェンカ</tips>も意味がわからないに違いない。だって、彼はオリジナルもなにも、自分が変身していることなんか知らないんだ。","en":"But what a foolish way to ask him. <tips=63>Sashenka</tips> could not possibly understand. He knew nothing about any ‘original,’ or even that he transformed at all.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r387","rowIndex":387,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そのはずなのに彼は、私をぼうっと見つめると、","en":"That should have been true. Yet he stared blankly at me, then—","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r388","rowIndex":388,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「うん……」","en":"“Yes...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r389","rowIndex":389,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　少年の仕草で頷いた。","en":"He nodded with a boyish gesture.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r390","rowIndex":390,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ねえ、あなた……」","en":"“Listen, you—”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r391","rowIndex":391,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私が声をかけようとしたら、彼は上体を起こしてベッドの上に起き上がった。そしてぐるりと見回してドアを見つけ、ベッドの上でしわくちゃになっている自分の衣服に目をとめる。","en":"As I was about to speak, he pushed himself upright in bed. He looked around until he found the door, then noticed his clothes lying rumpled beside him.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r392","rowIndex":392,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「行かなきゃ」","en":"“I have to go.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r393","rowIndex":393,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼は立ち上がり、衣服に手を伸ばした。","en":"He stood and reached for the clothes.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r394","rowIndex":394,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どこへ？」","en":"“Where?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r395","rowIndex":395,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　訊ねると、彼は首をわずかにねじってこちらを振り返り、","en":"At our question, he turned his head slightly and looked back.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r396","rowIndex":396,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=8>グレートホール</tips>に行かなきゃいけない。みんなが僕を待ってるんだ」","en":"“I have to go to the <tips=8>Great Hole</tips>. Everyone is waiting for me.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r397","rowIndex":397,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しわがれ声でそう呟いた。","en":"He murmured hoarsely.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r398","rowIndex":398,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「随分と派手にやらかしたもんだな」","en":"“You certainly made a spectacle of yourselves.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r399","rowIndex":399,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は警察のオフィスでコーヒーを飲みながら、昨日発見された警官の死体の写真を見ていた。","en":"In an office at the police station, I drank coffee and examined photographs of the officers whose bodies had been discovered the day before.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r400","rowIndex":400,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　どれも首がねじれ、口から血を吐いている。","en":"Every neck had been twisted, and blood had run from every mouth.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r401","rowIndex":401,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「よくそんな画像を見ながらコーヒーが飲めますね」","en":"“I don’t know how you can drink coffee while looking at pictures like those.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"三芳","displayName":"Miyoshi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r402","rowIndex":402,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=49>三芳</tips>ははす向かいの席に座ってげんなりした調子で言う。","en":"<tips=49>Miyoshi</tips> sat diagonally across from me and spoke in a weary tone.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r403","rowIndex":403,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「このコーヒー、美味いよ」","en":"“This coffee is good.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r404","rowIndex":404,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私はおどけてみせる。","en":"I answered playfully.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r405","rowIndex":405,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「寝てないんでしょう？　すごい顔をしていますよ」","en":"“You haven’t slept, have you? You look terrible.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"三芳","displayName":"Miyoshi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r406","rowIndex":406,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「大丈夫だよ。気分は爽快だ。なにしろおれは不死身の男だからな。……しかし、こいつら一応本庁から来たサイキック対策チームだろう？　こんな一方的にやられるもんかね。何か予想外の出来事があったのかな」","en":"“I'm fine. I feel fantastic. I'm an immortal man, after all. ...Still, these were a psychic countermeasures team from headquarters, weren't they? Could they really have been taken out this one-sidedly? I wonder if something happened that they hadn't anticipated.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r407","rowIndex":407,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　殺害された警官たちは、<tips=86>灰上の双子</tips>の片割れと、<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>らしき人物を発見し、彼らのいる建物を包囲しながら応援を待っていた。その間に、殺害されてしまったのである。","en":"The slain officers had discovered one of the Haigami <tips=86>twins</tips> with someone believed to be <tips=20>Koschei</tips>. They surrounded the building where the two were hiding and waited for reinforcements. Before those reinforcements arrived, they were killed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r408","rowIndex":408,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうかもしれません。……いくつかの遺体のまわりには、足跡など、第三者が近づいた痕跡がありませんでした。つまり、遠隔から首をねじられて殺害されたんですよ。考えられるのは<tips=11>灰上璃映子</tips>のサイキック能力ですが、以前はこれほどの力はなかったはずなので」","en":"“Perhaps. ...Around some of the bodies, there were no footprints or other signs that anyone else had approached. In other words, they were killed by having their necks twisted from a distance. The obvious possibility is <tips=11>Rieko Haigami's</tips> psychic power, but she shouldn't have possessed anything like this much power before.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"三芳","displayName":"Miyoshi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r409","rowIndex":409,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なんらかの理由で強化されたのか。それとも、<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>の未知の能力か……」","en":"“Was it enhanced for some reason? Or could this be another unknown <tips=20>Koschei</tips> ability...?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r410","rowIndex":410,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「これが灰上の念動力によるものなら、彼女の危険度はAランクには上がりますね」","en":"“If this was done with Haigami's telekinesis, her threat rating would rise to A rank.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"三芳","displayName":"Miyoshi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r411","rowIndex":411,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なんだいそのランクってのは？」","en":"“What’s this rating?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r412","rowIndex":412,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=50>路地</tips>さんでも知らないことがあるんですか？」","en":"“There are things even <tips=50>Roji</tips> doesn’t know?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"三芳","displayName":"Miyoshi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r413","rowIndex":413,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「おれだって、外からアクセス出来ないところに隠された情報は知らないよ」","en":"“Even I don't know anything that's hidden somewhere I can't access from the outside.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r414","rowIndex":414,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……警察の方ではサイキック能力の社会に対する危険度を評価し、ランク分けしています。以前の<tips=11>灰上璃映子</tips>はBマイナスでしたから、これが<tips=11>璃映子</tips>の能力なら４ランクのアップということになります」","en":"“...The police assess psychic abilities by the danger they pose to society and sort them into ranks. <tips=11>Rieko Haigami</tips> was previously rated B-minus, so if this is <tips=11>Rieko's</tips> power, that would be a jump of four ranks.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"三芳","displayName":"Miyoshi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r415","rowIndex":415,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そんなものがあったのか。ちなみにおれは？」","en":"“I didn't know there was such a thing. What rank am I, incidentally?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r416","rowIndex":416,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=50>路地</tips>さんはSマイナスです。Sランク以上はありませんから、現在存在するサイキックのなかでは最高ランクということになりますね」","en":"“You're S-minus, <tips=50>Roji</tips>. There are no psychics at S rank or above, so that makes you the highest-ranked psychic currently in existence.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"三芳","displayName":"Miyoshi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r417","rowIndex":417,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「随分買いかぶってくれたもんだな」","en":"“They’ve seriously overestimated me.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r418","rowIndex":418,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は笑って、もう一口コーヒーを飲んだ。寝不足の頭にカフェインの刺激がよく沁みる。","en":"I laughed and took another sip of coffee. The caffeine soaked pleasantly into my sleep-starved brain.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r419","rowIndex":419,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「使い方によっては簡単に社会全体を揺るがす能力ですからね。捜査のためとは言え、能力を解放するのは本来ありえないことなんです」","en":"“Depending on how it was used, your ability could easily shake society as a whole. Even for an investigation, lifting the restrictions on it would ordinarily be unthinkable.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"三芳","displayName":"Miyoshi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r420","rowIndex":420,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ふむ、しかし、大した能力だなこれは。粘土細工みたいにひねり潰されている」","en":"“Hmm. Still, this is quite an ability. They've been twisted and crushed like figures made of clay.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r421","rowIndex":421,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は手に取った写真を机の上に放り投げると溜息をつく。","en":"I tossed the photograph in my hand onto the desk and sighed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r422","rowIndex":422,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「しかし、どうして気づかれたんだ？　マニュアルどおり静かに包囲してたんだろう？　一人残らず見つかって、殺されるなんて、ありえるものなのか？　なあ、生き残ったのは<tips=17>タイプB</tips>の方じゃないか？　あいつはたしか、感覚が鋭敏だったよな？」","en":"“But how did they notice? The officers quietly surrounded the place by the book, didn’t they? Could every last one of them really have been found and killed? Listen, what if the survivor was the <tips=17>Type B</tips>? That one’s senses were unusually sharp, weren’t they?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r423","rowIndex":423,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうだとすると、この捜査員の死に方に説明が……」","en":"“If so, that would explain how these investigators died…”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"三芳","displayName":"Miyoshi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r424","rowIndex":424,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それは、<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>の新しい能力で……いや、でもそれだったら念動力よりもテレポートの餓鬼の力を使った方が確実だな。それを使えない理由が何かあったのか……。まあ、可能性としてはいくらでも考えられるから、ここでああだこうだ言っていても仕方がないか」","en":"“Then maybe this was some new ability of <tips=20>Koschei's</tips>... No, but in that case, using the teleporting brat's power would have been more reliable than telekinesis. Was there some reason they couldn't use it...? Well, we could imagine any number of possibilities. There's no point sitting here speculating.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r425","rowIndex":425,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は溜息をついた。<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>が全く別の姿に変身出来るという能力を持っている以上、想像をめぐらしたところであまり意味がない。","en":"I sighed. When <tips=20>Koschei</tips> possessed the ability to transform into completely different forms, there was little point in trying to imagine every possibility.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r426","rowIndex":426,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「包囲を突破したあとの足取りは？」","en":"“What do we know of their movements after they broke through the cordon?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r427","rowIndex":427,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「今のところ手がかりがありません」","en":"“At present, we have no leads.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"三芳","displayName":"Miyoshi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r428","rowIndex":428,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうか……」","en":"“I see...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r429","rowIndex":429,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は腕組みをして考えた。","en":"I folded my arms and thought.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r430","rowIndex":430,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　大体二週間ほど前に<tips=21>八龍会</tips>内部での争いがあって、<tips=47>解放軍</tips>が<tips=86>双子</tips>と<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>を射殺したという情報は、<tips=21>八龍会</tips>の内部情報を探っていた警察が掴んでいた。","en":"The police had been gathering intelligence from within the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips>, and had learned that some two weeks earlier, a conflict inside the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips> had ended with the <tips=47>Liberation Army</tips> shooting the <tips=86>twins</tips> and <tips=20>Koschei</tips> to death.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r431","rowIndex":431,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>の遺体は<tips=47>解放軍</tips>が持ち去り、<tips=86>双子</tips>の遺体は片方が消えたそうだ。","en":"The <tips=47>Liberation Army</tips> carried off <tips=20>Koschei's</tips> body. Of the <tips=86>twins</tips>' bodies, one had reportedly disappeared.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r432","rowIndex":432,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　この遺体は誰かが持ち去ったのではなく、自力で脱出したのだ。殺害現場となった近くのスーパーマーケットでは、サイキックを使う少女が目撃されている。","en":"No one had carried that body away; it had escaped under its own power. At a nearby supermarket that had become the scene of a killing, a girl using psychic power had been sighted.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r433","rowIndex":433,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　これは警察の店主への事情聴取によって<tips=86>双子</tips>のどちらかだと確認済みで、サイキックを使ったことから、<tips=11>璃映子</tips>だと推測されている。","en":"Police questioning of the shopkeeper had already confirmed that she was one of the <tips=86>twins</tips>, and because she used psychic power, they inferred that she was <tips=11>Rieko</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r434","rowIndex":434,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>は銃で撃たれたくらいで死ぬはずがなく、<tips=47>解放軍</tips>もそれを承知していたから、動かなくなった彼を連れ去っていったのだろう。","en":"<tips=20>Koschei</tips> could not possibly die from being shot, and the <tips=47>Liberation Army</tips> knew it, so they had presumably carried him away after he stopped moving.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r435","rowIndex":435,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=86>双子</tips>の方は遺体としてその場に置いていった。迂闊にも見張りを残さず。","en":"The <tips=86>twins</tips>, meanwhile, had been left there as corpses—and, carelessly, with no guard posted.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r436","rowIndex":436,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　片方は死亡したが、もう片方は襲撃を受けた際になんらかの形で<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>の血を受けて不死身になっていた。","en":"One twin died, but the other had somehow received <tips=20>Koschei’s</tips> blood during the attack and become immortal.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r437","rowIndex":437,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そいつは遺体処理業者がやって来る前に息を吹き返し、シャッターを破壊して倉庫を抜け出す。","en":"She revived before the body-disposal crew arrived, smashed through the shutter, and escaped the warehouse.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r438","rowIndex":438,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　——これが、得られた情報から捜査班が推測したその日のいきさつだ。","en":"—That was the investigative team’s reconstruction of the day’s events from the information available.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r439","rowIndex":439,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　警察はスーパーマーケットを出た後の灰上の足取りと、<tips=47>解放軍</tips>が連れ去った<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>の行き先を探していた。","en":"The police were trying to trace Haigami's movements after she left the supermarket and determine the whereabouts of <tips=20>Koschei</tips> after the <tips=47>Liberation Army</tips> carried him away.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r440","rowIndex":440,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そのさなか、街中でこのターゲットの両方が一緒にいるところを捜査チームが発見し、空き家に入ってゆくところまで追跡したのちに起きたのがこの事件である。","en":"In the midst of the search, an investigative team spotted the two targets together in the city and followed them until they entered an abandoned house. What happened next was the incident before us.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r441","rowIndex":441,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>の方は何か掴んでいないか？」","en":"“Has <tips=7>YS</tips> learned anything?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r442","rowIndex":442,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「今のところ連絡はないですね……」","en":"“They haven’t contacted us...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"三芳","displayName":"Miyoshi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r443","rowIndex":443,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうか。隠しているのか、本当にまだ何も知らないのか……いまから聞いてみるか」","en":"“I see. Are they hiding something, or do they truly know nothing yet...? Maybe I'll ask them now.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r444","rowIndex":444,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私が携帯電話を手に取ると、<tips=49>三芳</tips>は慌てて、","en":"When I picked up my phone, <tips=49>Miyoshi</tips> hurriedly protested.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r445","rowIndex":445,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>に接触するときは、上司に許可を得ないと……」","en":"“We need a superior’s permission before contacting <tips=7>YS</tips>...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"三芳","displayName":"Miyoshi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r446","rowIndex":446,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それは警察の捜査のルールだろう？　おれ個人の個人的な電話には関係がないさ。あんたは見て見ぬふりをすればいい」","en":"“That’s a rule for police investigations, isn’t it? It has nothing to do with a personal phone call of my own. You can simply look the other way.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r447","rowIndex":447,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おれは無理矢理押し切って、<tips=41>グランドタワー</tips>に通じる番号をダイアルした。","en":"I forced the issue and dialed the number for the <tips=41>Grand Tower</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r448","rowIndex":448,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　秘書のような女の声がして、名前と用件を伝えると待たされた後に<tips=81>龍頭</tips>である<tips=1>謝亮</tips>本人が出た。","en":"A woman who sounded like a secretary answered. I gave my name and business and was put on hold. After a wait, <tips=1>Tse Leung</tips> himself, the <tips=81>Longtou</tips>, came on the line.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r449","rowIndex":449,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=50>路地</tips>だ。昨日、<tips=11>灰上璃映子</tips>と<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>を監視していた警官たちが皆殺しにされた」","en":"“This is <tips=50>Roji</tips>. Yesterday, every officer monitoring <tips=11>Rieko Haigami</tips> and <tips=20>Koschei</tips> was killed.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r450","rowIndex":450,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は事件の状況を簡単に説明して、","en":"I gave him a brief explanation of the circumstances.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r451","rowIndex":451,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>は何か知らないか？」","en":"“Does <tips=7>YS</tips> know anything?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r452","rowIndex":452,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"『何も知らないですね』","en":"‘We don’t know anything.’","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r453","rowIndex":453,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　電話の向こうの<tips=1>謝亮</tips>の声は静かにこたえた。","en":"On the other end of the phone, <tips=1>Tse Leung</tips> replied quietly.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r454","rowIndex":454,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"『我々は捜査機関じゃない。協力するとは言いましたが、別に毎日<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>を探し回っているわけじゃありません。そういうのは警察の方が得意でしょう？』","en":"‘We aren't an investigative agency. We said we would cooperate, but that doesn't mean we spend every day searching for <tips=20>Koschei</tips>. The police are better at that sort of thing, aren't they?’","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r455","rowIndex":455,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……じゃあ質問を変えよう。<tips=21>八龍会</tips>について訊きたい。抗争相手の彼らのことなら、あんたの仕事柄、よく知ってるだろう？」","en":"“…Then let me change the question. I want to ask about the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips>. Given your line of work, you know your enemy well, don’t you?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r456","rowIndex":456,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"『当然ですが、言えることと、言えないことがありますよ』","en":"‘Naturally, there are things I can tell you and things I cannot.’","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r457","rowIndex":457,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>は<tips=21>八龍会</tips>と組んで『<tips=46>ネオ・ローズ</tips>』を作ってたんだろう？　そして<tips=47>解放軍</tips>に襲撃され、姿を消したという話だった。それが街で灰上と一緒にウロウロしていたってのは不審だ。<tips=47>解放軍</tips>は<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>をどこに隠していた？　どうやって脱出した？」","en":"“<tips=20>Koschei</tips> joined forces with the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips> to make ‘<tips=46>Neo Rose</tips>,’ didn't he? Then the <tips=47>Liberation Army</tips> attacked, and the story was that he disappeared. So it's suspicious to find him wandering around the city with Haigami. Where was the <tips=47>Liberation Army</tips> hiding <tips=20>Koschei</tips>? How did he escape?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r458","rowIndex":458,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"『知りませんね。でもまあ、街中で見つかったのなら、自力で脱出したんじゃないですか？　やつにはあの瞬間移動の能力があるじゃないですか』","en":"‘I don't know. But if he was found in the city, wouldn't that mean he escaped on his own? He does have that teleportation ability, after all.’","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r459","rowIndex":459,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ふむ、可能性はそれだけかな」","en":"“Hmm. Is that the only possibility?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r460","rowIndex":460,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"『可能性だけならいくらでもあるでしょう。しかしいずれにしろ、私の感知するところじゃない。ご自分で<tips=21>八龍会</tips>の誰かを捕まえて聞いたらどうですか？　話がそれだけなら……』","en":"‘There are any number of possibilities. In any event, the matter doesn’t fall within my purview. Why not capture someone from the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips> and ask them yourself? If that is all you wished to discuss…’","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r461","rowIndex":461,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「随分とあっさりしているな」","en":"“You’re remarkably indifferent.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r462","rowIndex":462,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"『何がですか？』","en":"‘What is?’","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r463","rowIndex":463,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あんた、あの<tips=55>汐松子</tips>さんと親しかったんだろう。遺体を見て涙を流すほどに。それなら、にっくき<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>のことがもっと気になるんじゃないのか？　悔しくないのか？」","en":"“You were close to <tips=55>Matsuko Shio</tips>, weren't you? Close enough to weep over her body. Then shouldn't you care more about that damned <tips=20>Koschei</tips>? Doesn't it gall you?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r464","rowIndex":464,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"『……探偵さん。<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>は今忙しいんですよ。他にやるべきことがたくさんあるんです』","en":"‘…Detective, <tips=7>YS</tips> is busy right now. We have many other things to do.’","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r465","rowIndex":465,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>謝亮</tips>は冷たく言い放つ。","en":"<tips=1>Tse Leung</tips> answered coldly.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r466","rowIndex":466,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「情けないもんだな。<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>ってのは、かつて<tips=41>グランドタワー</tips>を襲撃し、<tips=39>ジェフリー・ウォン</tips>や何人もの部下を殺した相手じゃないか。さらにだぞ。父親の<tips=3>クリス</tips>から続く因縁の相手でもある。こいつをのさばらせてどうする？」","en":"“How pathetic. <tips=20>Koschei</tips> once attacked the <tips=41>Grand Tower</tips> and killed <tips=39>Jeffrey Wong</tips> and many of your men. More than that, your feud with him goes all the way back to your father, <tips=3>Chris</tips>. How can you let him run free?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r467","rowIndex":467,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"『困った人ですね。確かに<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>は我々にとって因縁のある相手です。だから私たちはこうしてあなたたちに協力をしているんじゃないですか？　今電話のお相手をしているだけでも感謝して欲しいくらいです。情報提供だけじゃご不満ですか？　捜査は警察の仕事でしょう？』","en":"‘You really are a nuisance. <tips=20>Koschei</tips> certainly has a history with us. That's why we're cooperating with you, isn't it? You should be grateful I'm even taking your call. Isn't providing information enough for you? The investigation is the police's job, isn't it?’","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r468","rowIndex":468,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それはそうだが……」","en":"“That may be true, but...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r469","rowIndex":469,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"『今回は随分大がかりな捜査をしているようじゃないですか。そこら中で捜査員の姿を見かけますよ。これですぐ決着をつけられないほど無能ではないでしょう？　次はこんな電話ではなく、朗報を聞きたいですね。それでは』","en":"‘You seem to be mounting quite an extensive investigation this time. I see investigators everywhere. Surely you aren't so incompetent that you can't bring this to a swift conclusion with all that? Next time, I'd like to hear good news instead of receiving another call like this. Good day.’","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r470","rowIndex":470,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼はそれだけ言うと一方的に通話を切った。","en":"With that, he hung up on me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r471","rowIndex":471,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ふん、薄情なもんだぜ」","en":"“Hmph. That's coldhearted of him.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r472","rowIndex":472,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は吐き捨て、携帯電話をジャケットの内ポケットにしまうと立ち上がった。","en":"I spat out the words, slipped the phone into the inside pocket of my jacket, and stood.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r473","rowIndex":473,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どこへ行くんですか？」","en":"“Where are you going?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"三芳","displayName":"Miyoshi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r474","rowIndex":474,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「これからおれは警察とは別行動で捜査をする。これでも一応元探偵なんでね。警察の人海戦術とは別のやりかたがあるのさ」","en":"“From here on, I'm investigating separately from the police. I was a detective once, you know. I have ways of doing things that don't rely on police manpower.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r475","rowIndex":475,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「私も行きます」","en":"“I’m coming too.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"三芳","displayName":"Miyoshi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r476","rowIndex":476,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=49>三芳</tips>も慌てて立ち上がる。","en":"<tips=49>Miyoshi</tips> hurriedly rose as well.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r477","rowIndex":477,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あんたは自分の仕事があるだろう」","en":"“You have your own work to do.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r478","rowIndex":478,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「今は本庁のチームが主導で動いていますから、私のやることは少ないんです。<tips=50>路地</tips>さんのやりかたを勉強させてください」","en":"“The team from headquarters is leading the operation now, so there isn’t much for me to do. Please let me study the way you work, Mr. <tips=50>Roji</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"三芳","displayName":"Miyoshi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r479","rowIndex":479,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「警察の役に立つようなことはないよ。おれについて来るより、<tips=48>堂島</tips>の旦那の捜査記録でも見た方がいいんじゃないか？」","en":"“Nothing I do will help the police. You’d learn more from reading Mr. <tips=48>Dojima’s</tips> case records than following me.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r480","rowIndex":480,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いいんです。それに……」","en":"“I don’t mind. And...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"三芳","displayName":"Miyoshi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r481","rowIndex":481,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=49>三芳</tips>は一瞬言いよどんでから、","en":"<tips=49>Miyoshi</tips> faltered for an instant.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r482","rowIndex":482,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=50>路地</tips>さんを一人にさせるわけにはいきません。能力が使える状態なら、監視が必要ですし、あと……」","en":"“I can’t leave <tips=50>Roji</tips> alone. While your ability is available, you need supervision. And…”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"三芳","displayName":"Miyoshi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r483","rowIndex":483,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そう言って、私の目を見つめる。","en":"She looked directly into my eyes.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r484","rowIndex":484,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「心配なんです。なんだか、自暴自棄になってる気がします」","en":"“I'm worried. I can't shake the feeling that you're getting reckless—that you've stopped caring what happens to you.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"三芳","displayName":"Miyoshi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r485","rowIndex":485,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ふん、好きにしろ。でもおれは、あんたが監視してようが好きにさせて貰うぜ」","en":"“Hmph. Do as you like. But whether you supervise me or not, I’ll do as I please.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r486","rowIndex":486,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私はそう言ってドアの方へ歩き出した。","en":"With that, I walked toward the door.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r487","rowIndex":487,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　まず私は街のあちこちにいる『情報屋』をまわることにした。","en":"First, I decided to make the rounds of the ‘informants’ scattered throughout the city.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r488","rowIndex":488,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　といっても、実際にそういう商売があるわけではない。有りようを言えば、路上で暮らすホームレスたちのことだ。","en":"Not that ‘informant’ was an actual profession. In reality, I meant the homeless people living on the streets.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r489","rowIndex":489,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　普段からホームレスたちとは知り合いになり、幾ばくかの小遣いを与えている。そして情報をいつでも聞き出せるようにしておくのだ。昔探偵のころによく使っていた手法である。","en":"I made a habit of getting to know the homeless and giving them a little pocket money, so that whenever I needed information, I could go and get it from them. It was a method I had often used in my detective days.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r490","rowIndex":490,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　警察に逮捕され、探偵をやめてからはしばらく使っていなかったが、少し前からまた彼らを手懐けている。","en":"I had stopped for a time after my arrest and the end of my detective career, but recently I had begun cultivating them again.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r491","rowIndex":491,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　昔ほどではないにしろ、この街にはまだ日雇い労働の仕事が多い。私の知っているホームレスたちは主にそこで日銭を稼いでいる。","en":"The city still had plenty of day labor, though not as much as it once had. The homeless people I knew mostly earned their daily bread that way.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r492","rowIndex":492,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　だからホームレスと言っても、路上で寝起きするわけではなく、安宿などに宿泊していることがほとんどだ。","en":"Thus, although I called them homeless, they did not sleep on the streets; most actually stayed in cheap lodging houses or similar places.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r493","rowIndex":493,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼らには横の繋がりがあり、日雇いの仕事は労働現場などの一般的なものから、ギャングの下働きまでさまざまだ。安く、正規の手続きの要らない労働力は様々な場所で使われる。だから、思わぬ情報を知っていることがある。","en":"They had a network of their own, and their day labor ranged from ordinary work on construction sites to odd jobs for gangs. Cheap labor that required no formal hiring process found its way into all sorts of places. As a result, they sometimes knew things one would never expect them to know.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r494","rowIndex":494,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　数日前から彼らには<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>と<tips=86>灰上姉妹</tips>の写真を渡していた。","en":"Several days earlier, I had given them photographs of <tips=20>Koschei</tips> and the <tips=86>Haigami sisters</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r495","rowIndex":495,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その顔を見かけたら連絡するように伝えてはいたが、彼らの多くは電話を持たず、持っていたとしてもそもそも怠惰であるために即座に連絡してくれるとは限らない。だから、確実な情報を手に入れるためには私の方から一々聞き出しに行く必要があった。","en":"I told them to contact me if they saw either face. But many had no phones, and even those who did were lazy to begin with, so they would not necessarily report a sighting at once. To obtain reliable information, I had to visit and question them individually.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r496","rowIndex":496,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そのような情報屋を私は多く持っていたが、今日は昨日の事件があった付近に住むものたちを訪れることにした。","en":"I had many such informants, but today, I visited those living near the site of yesterday’s incident.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r497","rowIndex":497,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼らはもしかしたら既に警察から事情聴取をされているかもしれないが、警察に喋らなかったことでも、私には話してくれる。","en":"The police might already have questioned some of them. Even so, they would tell me things they had withheld from the police.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r498","rowIndex":498,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は今回彼らの足取りを追うことに、かなりの自信があった。彼らは仕事のない日はよく路上に座り込み、行き交う人のことを観察している。近くで異変があればすぐに気が付くし、誰か一人が気づけばそれは噂話として共有される。かつて、私はよく彼らのお陰で重要な情報を手に入れたものだ。","en":"I was quite confident that this time, they could help me trace my targets. On days when they had no work, these people often sat out on the streets watching everyone who passed. They noticed at once when anything unusual happened nearby, and whatever one of them saw soon spread through the network as gossip. In my detective days, they had often led me to vital information.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r499","rowIndex":499,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　今回の件は、情報屋たちに金を配るようになってから、はじめて<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>が起こした事件である。私はこれを待っていた。もっと前にこのシステムを復活させていれば、<tips=55>汐松子</tips>の事件が起きたときや、<tips=5>太刀川</tips>の事件のときにも役立たせることが出来たのではないかと思う。","en":"This was the first incident <tips=20>Koschei</tips> had caused since I resumed paying the informants. I had been waiting for it. Had I restored the system sooner, I thought it might have proved useful during the <tips=55>Matsuko Shio</tips> incident or the <tips=5>Tachikawa</tips> case.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r500","rowIndex":500,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　古い事件についても一応聞き込みは行ってはいたが、どう聞いても、不確かであやしげな回答しか出てこなかった。彼らは良く観察してはいるが、記憶力の方はあまり期待出来ない。今回はあらかじめ写真を渡している上に、つい昨日のことだから、もう少しマシな回答が得られるだろう。何しろ事件があったのは昨日なのだから、まだ情報屋たちの記憶も鮮明であり、その情報も新鮮だ。","en":"I had questioned people about the older cases too, but however I asked, I received nothing but uncertain, dubious answers. They observed well, but their memories could not be relied upon. This time I had given them photographs in advance, and the events had occurred only yesterday, so I could expect somewhat better answers. The incident had happened only yesterday, after all: the informants’ memories would still be vivid, and their information fresh.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r501","rowIndex":501,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　果たして、私はその情報を手に入れることが出来た。","en":"And indeed, I obtained the information I wanted.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r502","rowIndex":502,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ああ、<tips=50>路地</tips>さん！　ちょうど連絡しようと思ってたんだよ！」","en":"“<tips=50>Mr. Roji</tips>! I was just about to contact you!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r503","rowIndex":503,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　五人目に出会ったその男は、会うなり目を輝かせてそう言った。","en":"The fifth man’s eyes lit up the instant he saw me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r504","rowIndex":504,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「昨日、この娘を見つけてね、どこかで見た顔だと思って、<tips=50>路地</tips>さんからもらった写真を思い出したんだ。それでどこへ行くか見ていたんだがね、そっちの通りに入っていったんだよ」","en":"“I spotted this girl yesterday. I knew I’d seen her somewhere, then I remembered the picture <tips=50>Roji</tips> gave me. I watched to see where she went, and she turned into that street over there.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r505","rowIndex":505,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　男はつばを飛ばしながらそう話す。身体からは酸っぱいような異臭がし、<tips=49>三芳</tips>が微かに顔を顰めたのが見えた。","en":"The man sprayed saliva as he spoke. A sour stench rose from his body, and I saw <tips=49>Miyoshi</tips> grimace faintly.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r506","rowIndex":506,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「本当か？　一緒に誰かいただろう。どんなやつか覚えていないか？」","en":"“Are you certain? Someone was with her. Do you remember what they looked like?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r507","rowIndex":507,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうそう、若い男前と一緒だった。ええと、そうそう、相手はこいつだ」","en":"“That’s right, she was with a handsome young man. Let’s see… Yes, this one.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r508","rowIndex":508,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　何枚か渡してある写真から、『<tips=64>アレクセイ</tips>』の写真を選ぶ。","en":"From the several photographs I had given him, he selected <tips=64>Alexei</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r509","rowIndex":509,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「へっへっへ、どうだい、すごい情報だろう？　すぐに連絡しようとおもったんだけどね、何しろ電話代もなくてさ。ギャラははずんでくれよ。なんたって、電話代もないなんてあまりにも惨めだと、<tips=50>路地</tips>さんだって思うだろう？　同じ人間なのにさ、かたや高級車を乗り回すやつもいれば、電話代もなくこの寒空の下で暮らすおれみたいなやつもいるなんて、いくらなんでも不公平だと思わないかい？　世の中ってのはさあ……」","en":"“Heh-heh. What do you say? That’s some information, isn’t it? I wanted to contact you right away, but I didn’t even have the money for a phone call. Be generous with my fee, will you? Even you, Mr. <tips=50>Roji</tips>, must think it’s downright miserable not to have the price of a phone call. We’re all human, but some people drive around in luxury cars, while people like me live under this cold sky without even the money for a phone call. Don’t you think that’s terribly unfair? You know, the world...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r510","rowIndex":510,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうだな。これでいいか？」","en":"“Indeed. Will this do?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r511","rowIndex":511,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　語ろうとする男に約束の倍の金を渡すと、私はすぐに彼らが向かったという通りに足を踏み入れた。","en":"As the man launched into his speech, I gave him twice the promised amount and immediately entered the street where he said they had gone.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r512","rowIndex":512,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　薄汚れた簡易宿泊所がいくつか並ぶ、うらぶれた路地である。","en":"It was a run-down alley lined with several filthy budget lodging houses.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r513","rowIndex":513,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「バックパッカーとかが、こういうところを利用するんですかね？」","en":"“Do backpackers use places like this?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"三芳","displayName":"Miyoshi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r514","rowIndex":514,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=49>三芳</tips>が小声でそう訊ねる。","en":"<tips=49>Miyoshi</tips> asked quietly.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r515","rowIndex":515,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「バックパッカーも使うだろうが、主にカップルや女を買って入る場所だ」","en":"“Some probably do, but it’s mainly for couples or men who hire women.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r516","rowIndex":516,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　こういうところでは宿自体が売春を斡旋してくれるのだが、それは言わず、簡単にそう説明した。私は掴んだ情報にとにかく気が急いて、それどころではなかったのだ。","en":"Places like this would even arrange prostitutes for their guests, but I left that part out and gave her the simple explanation. The lead I had found had me in such a hurry that I had no attention to spare for anything else.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r517","rowIndex":517,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私はその通りにある宿を、かたっぱしから調べることにした。","en":"I decided to investigate every lodging house on the street.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r518","rowIndex":518,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そうしたら、二件目で反応があった。","en":"At the second place, I got a promising response.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r519","rowIndex":519,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「来たとも来なかったとも言えない。いくら<tips=50>路地</tips>さんとは言え、お客さんの情報だからね」","en":"“I can't tell you whether they were here or not. Even to you, <tips=50>Mr. Roji</tips>. That's customer information.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r520","rowIndex":520,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　フロントに居た男に写真を見せて質問をすると、そう言って渋った。来なければはっきりそう言うはずだから、彼は何か知っているのだ。","en":"The man at the front desk balked when I showed him the photograph and asked. If she had never come, he would have said so plainly. He knew something.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r521","rowIndex":521,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=49>三芳</tips>が警察手帳を出そうとしたが、私はそれを押しとどめる。そんなものを出して言うことを聞かせようとしても逆効果だ。彼は交渉がしたいのである。","en":"<tips=49>Miyoshi</tips> moved to produce her police identification, but I stopped her. Trying to force his cooperation with that would only backfire. He wanted to negotiate.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r522","rowIndex":522,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　金を渡せば話が早いのだろうが、私は別の手を使った。","en":"Giving him money would probably settle matters quickly, but I used another approach.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r523","rowIndex":523,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「店主、正直に喋った方がいいぜ。こいつは<tips=53>ミユキ</tips>を殺した犯人だ。他にもたくさんの女を殺してバラバラにしたサイコパス野郎だ。もしかしたら、どこかに角切りの女の死体が転がってるかもしれないぜ。天井裏や床下まで調べちゃいないんだろう？」","en":"“Owner, you’d better tell us the truth. This man murdered <tips=53>Miyuki</tips>. He’s a psychopath who killed plenty of other women and cut them apart. There may be a woman’s diced corpse lying around somewhere. You haven’t searched the attic and beneath the floorboards, have you?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r524","rowIndex":524,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私の言葉に、店主は動揺を見せる。","en":"My words visibly unsettled the owner.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r525","rowIndex":525,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そんなものが見つかったら、警察がごっそりやって来て大変なことになる。何しろ、この犯人は警察のお気に入りだから、他の事件とは違うんだ。しばらく営業も出来なくなるだろう。だが、おれに協力してくれれば、全部うまいことやってやる」","en":"“If something like that turns up, the police will descend on this place in force, and you'll have a serious problem. This killer's a special favorite of theirs, so it won't be like any ordinary case. You probably won't be able to do business for a while. But cooperate with me, and I'll make sure everything works out.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r526","rowIndex":526,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いや、しかし、<tips=50>路地</tips>さん……」","en":"“But, Mr. <tips=50>Roji</tips>...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r527","rowIndex":527,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「信用してくれ。こっちのお嬢さんは、こう見えて警察のお偉いさんなんだ。ほら、手帳を見せてやんな」","en":"“Trust me. This young lady may not look it, but she’s a big shot with the police. Go on, show him your identification.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r528","rowIndex":528,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私に促され、そこで彼女は警察手帳を示す。","en":"At my prompting, she showed him her police identification.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r529","rowIndex":529,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「な、おれは警察に顔が利くんだよ。何か起こる前におれを通した方が絶対にいい」","en":"“See? I have pull with the police. Whatever happens, you’re definitely better off going through me first.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r530","rowIndex":530,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　すると、さすがに店長も顔に動揺の色を浮かべる。厄介ごとには慣れているとは言え、警察が出入りするような事態は避けたいはずだ。この店だって後ろ暗いところがないわけではないのだろうし。","en":"At that, even the proprietor’s face betrayed his alarm. Accustomed to trouble though he was, he had to want to avoid a situation that brought the police through his doors. His establishment probably had its own guilty secrets.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r531","rowIndex":531,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なあ、頼むぜ。この犯人は、街の人間をたくさん殺したクソ野郎だ。おれは絶対に許さない。だから教えてくれよ。あんたの情報が必要なんだ」","en":"“Come on, help me out. This bastard killed a lot of people in this city. I’ll never forgive him. So tell me what you know. I need your information.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r532","rowIndex":532,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　最後は、感情をそのままぶつけることにした。","en":"In the end, I stopped maneuvering and simply laid my feelings bare.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r533","rowIndex":533,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=50>路地</tips>さん……」","en":"“Mr. <tips=50>Roji</tips>...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r534","rowIndex":534,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして店主は話をしてくれた。","en":"Then the proprietor told us what he knew.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r535","rowIndex":535,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　二人の顔写真を見せると、まさしくこの二人だと言い、チェックインの時間も情報屋の証言とぴったり一致する。そして、彼らは今日の午前中にチェックアウトをして出ていったということだ。","en":"When we showed him the two photographs, he said they were unquestionably the pair. Their check-in time also matched the informant’s testimony perfectly. They had checked out and left that morning.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r536","rowIndex":536,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「何かおかしな様子はなかったかい？」","en":"“Did anything about them seem unusual?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r537","rowIndex":537,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私の質問に、店主は首をひねりながら、","en":"At my question, the owner tilted his head.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r538","rowIndex":538,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そう言えば、ツレの男の方がちょっと変だったな」","en":"“Come to think of it, the man with her was acting a little strange.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r539","rowIndex":539,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「変って？」","en":"“Strange how?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r540","rowIndex":540,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「来る時は堂々としていたのに、帰るときは上着みたいなものを頭からかぶって、コソコソと顔を隠してやがったんだ」","en":"“He came in bold as brass, but when he left, he pulled something like a jacket over his head and slunk out with his face hidden.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r541","rowIndex":541,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それが<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>ならば、おそらく、変身して別の姿になっていたのを見られたくなかったのだろう。","en":"If that man was <tips=20>Koschei</tips>, he had probably transformed into a different form and did not want anyone to see it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r542","rowIndex":542,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「他には？」","en":"“Anything else?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r543","rowIndex":543,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「何かブツブツと独り言で、<tips=8>グレートホール</tips>がどうのと呟いていたような……。ありゃあ、発症してるんじゃないかね」","en":"“He was muttering to himself. Something about the <tips=8>Great Hole</tips>... Maybe he’s developed symptoms.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r544","rowIndex":544,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なんで<tips=8>グレートホール</tips>のことなんか話してたんですかね？」","en":"“Why was he talking about the <tips=8>Great Hole</tips>?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"三芳","displayName":"Miyoshi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r545","rowIndex":545,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　部屋を調べてから宿泊所を出ると、<tips=49>三芳</tips>がそう訊ねて来る。","en":"After we had inspected the room and left the lodging house, <tips=49>Miyoshi</tips> asked me that question.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r546","rowIndex":546,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「知らないか？　店主も言っていたが、<tips=17>タイプB</tips>が発症したら、そういう妄想に取り憑かれることが多いんだ。いなくなった患者が<tips=8>グレートホール</tips>の側で発見されたりもする。他の街ではないのかい？」","en":"“You haven’t heard? The owner mentioned it too. When <tips=17>Type Bs</tips> develop symptoms, they’re often consumed by that kind of delusion. Missing patients are sometimes found near the <tips=8>Great Hole</tips>. Does that not happen in other cities?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r547","rowIndex":547,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「聞いたことがないですね……」","en":"“I’ve never heard of it...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"三芳","displayName":"Miyoshi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r548","rowIndex":548,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「この街だけかもしれないな。確か<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>も、元々はどこかの<tips=8>グレートホール</tips>の近くの街に住んでいたんだろ？」","en":"“Maybe it only happens in this city. But <tips=20>Koschei</tips> originally lived in some city near a <tips=8>Great Hole</tips>, didn't he?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r549","rowIndex":549,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「資料にはそうあります」","en":"“That is what the records state.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"三芳","displayName":"Miyoshi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r550","rowIndex":550,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「その街でも同じような妄想が出やすいのかもしれないな。しかし、だとしたら本当に発症したのかもしれない。ふん、最悪の殺人鬼も、最後は正気をなくして幻聴の命じるまま街を彷徨うのか。……なあ、あいつの場合、変身した姿一つが発症したらそいつだけで済むのかね？　それとも、どれに変身しても全部がおかしくなるのか？」","en":"“Maybe the same delusions are common in that city too. If so, perhaps he really has developed symptoms. Hmph. So even the vilest murderer ends up losing his mind and wandering the city wherever the voices command. ...Tell me, in his case, if one of his transformed forms develops symptoms, is that form alone affected? Or does he go mad no matter what he transforms into?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r551","rowIndex":551,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どうなんでしょうね……」","en":"“I don’t know...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"三芳","displayName":"Miyoshi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r552","rowIndex":552,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まあ何にしろ、発症してるならこちらにとって都合がいい。ろくでもない事件を起こして、すぐに見つかるだろうよ」","en":"“In any event, if he has developed symptoms, that suits us. He’ll cause some appalling incident and be found in no time.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r553","rowIndex":553,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして私は歩きはじめた。方向は、<tips=8>グレートホール</tips>の方角だ。","en":"I began walking in the direction of the <tips=8>Great Hole</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r554","rowIndex":554,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　もちろん、そちらへ彼らが向かっているとは限らない。店主の話では灰上の方が主導権を握っているようだし、妄想のままふらふら<tips=8>グレートホール</tips>へ向かう<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>を、彼女が別の場所へ誘導している可能性もある。","en":"Naturally, there was no guarantee they had gone that way. According to the owner, Haigami seemed to be taking the lead. She might have guided <tips=20>Koschei</tips> somewhere else rather than let him wander toward the <tips=8>Great Hole</tips> in the grip of his delusion.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r555","rowIndex":555,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しかし、街から外へ脱出する道や、他の大通りは警察の捜査員がしっかり固めている。ならば我々は別の可能性を潰すべきだろう。","en":"But police investigators had every route out of the city and the other major thoroughfares securely covered. That meant we should be the ones to rule out a different possibility.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r556","rowIndex":556,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それに、私の勘が、彼らは<tips=8>グレートホール</tips>へ向かったと言っているのだ。","en":"Besides, my instincts told me they had headed for the <tips=8>Great Hole</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r557","rowIndex":557,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「灰上は<tips=86>双子</tips>の片割れがやられた。<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>はもう正気じゃない。行き詰まった二人がどこへ行くかと考えたら、<tips=8>グレートホール</tips>が相応しいような気がするんだよ」","en":"“Haigami lost the other <tips=86>twin</tips>. <tips=20>Koschei</tips> is no longer sane. If you ask where two people at the end of their rope would go, the <tips=8>Great Hole</tips> somehow seems fitting.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r558","rowIndex":558,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　歩きながらその説明をしていると、","en":"As I was explaining this while we walked—","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r559","rowIndex":559,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あっ、すみません」","en":"“Oh, sorry.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"三芳","displayName":"Miyoshi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r560","rowIndex":560,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=49>三芳</tips>が携帯電話を取り出した。","en":"<tips=49>Miyoshi</tips> took out her phone.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r561","rowIndex":561,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どこへかけるつもりだ？」","en":"“Who are you calling?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r562","rowIndex":562,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「一応、本部に連絡して、応援を<tips=8>グレートホール</tips>に向かわせようかと……」","en":"“I thought I should contact headquarters, just in case, and have backup sent to the <tips=8>Great Hole</tips>…”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"三芳","displayName":"Miyoshi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r563","rowIndex":563,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「やめてくれ」","en":"“Don’t.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r564","rowIndex":564,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どうしてですか？」","en":"“Why?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"三芳","displayName":"Miyoshi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r565","rowIndex":565,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「おれは自分で見つけ出したいんだよ」","en":"“I want to find him myself.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r566","rowIndex":566,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そして、殺そうというのですね……？」","en":"“And then you intend to kill him...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"三芳","displayName":"Miyoshi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r567","rowIndex":567,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女が隣でそう言うのを無視して、私は歩くスピードを上げる。彼女は小走りでそれに追いついて、","en":"I ignored her and quickened my pace. She broke into a trot and caught up.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r568","rowIndex":568,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「もう一度考え直してください。いくら<tips=53>ミユキ</tips>さんの復讐とは言え、殺人は犯罪です」","en":"“Please reconsider. However much you want revenge for <tips=53>Miyuki</tips>, murder is a crime.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"三芳","displayName":"Miyoshi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r569","rowIndex":569,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「殺人？　あいつは人間なのかい？」","en":"“Murder? Is that thing human?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r570","rowIndex":570,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は苦笑しながらそうこたえた。","en":"I answered with a bitter smile.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r571","rowIndex":571,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=50>路地</tips>さんっ」","en":"“<tips=50>Mr. Roji</tips>!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"三芳","displayName":"Miyoshi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r572","rowIndex":572,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「おれの邪魔をするつもりなら帰ってくれ。それともここで逮捕するかい？」","en":"“If you mean to interfere, go home. Or would you rather arrest me here?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r573","rowIndex":573,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=50>路地</tips>さんっ、そんなことをして、あなたが犯罪者になったら、<tips=53>ミユキ</tips>さんはきっと悲しんで……」","en":"“Mr. <tips=50>Roji</tips>! If you do this—if you become a criminal—<tips=53>Miyuki</tips> would surely be heartbroken...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"三芳","displayName":"Miyoshi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r574","rowIndex":574,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=49>三芳</tips>は私の前を塞ぐように立ち、そう言った。","en":"<tips=49>Miyoshi</tips> stepped into my path as she spoke.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r575","rowIndex":575,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「何も知らないくせに、わかったようなことを言うなよ」","en":"“You don’t know anything, so don’t pretend you understand.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r576","rowIndex":576,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私が睨み付けると、彼女は立ち止まる。その横を擦り抜けてさらに進む。","en":"When I glared at her, she stopped. I slipped past her and continued onward.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r577","rowIndex":577,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女はまた小走りになって私の横に追いつき、そして真剣な眼差しでこちらの顔を見てくる。","en":"She broke into a trot again, caught up alongside me, and looked earnestly into my face.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r578","rowIndex":578,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なあ<tips=49>三芳</tips>さんよ、あんたには世話になったが、今回ばかりは意見を聞くつもりはない。もしおれを逮捕したいのなら、させてやるさ。だが、やつを殺してからだ。その前に逮捕しようとするならば、おれも大人しくはしちゃいないぜ」","en":"“Listen, <tips=49>Miyoshi</tips>. I owe you, but this time I have no intention of taking your advice. If you want to arrest me, I'll let you—but only after I've killed him. Try to arrest me before then, and I won't come quietly.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r579","rowIndex":579,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=50>路地</tips>さん……」","en":"“<tips=50>Mr. Roji</tips>...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"三芳","displayName":"Miyoshi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r580","rowIndex":580,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=49>三芳</tips>は呟いて足を止める。これで帰ってゆくのかと思ったが、少し経つとまた駆け足で私に追いついて、そのまますぐ後をついて来る。そしてもう、意見はしないようだ。","en":"<tips=49>Miyoshi</tips> murmured and came to a stop. I thought she meant to turn back, but after a moment she hurried after me again and followed close behind. She did not object again.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r581","rowIndex":581,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は道を行きながら、通りかかる露天商や、窓を開けてゆったりしている住民に、灰上と<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>の写真を見せ、見覚えがないか訊ねた。","en":"As we walked, I showed the photographs of Haigami and <tips=20>Koschei</tips> to street vendors and residents relaxing at open windows, asking whether the faces looked familiar.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r582","rowIndex":582,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　なかなか反応がなく、やはり<tips=8>グレートホール</tips>に向かっているのではないのだろうかと疑いかけたが、","en":"For some time, no one recognized them, and I began to doubt that they were heading for the <tips=8>Great Hole</tips> after all. Then—","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r583","rowIndex":583,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ああ、この人たちなら、さっきそちらのレストランに入ってゆきましたよ」","en":"“Those people went into that restaurant just a little while ago.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r584","rowIndex":584,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　と、路上に三脚を立てている似顔絵描きの学生が教えてくれた。","en":"The tip came from a student portrait artist who had set up his easel in the street.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r585","rowIndex":585,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　時間を聞くと、まだそれほど過ぎてはいなかった。チェックアウトの時間と重ね合わせると遅すぎるから、他に違う場所に寄っていたのか、それとも人違いか。","en":"When I asked when, he said it had not been long. But that was far too late compared with the check-out time. Perhaps they had stopped somewhere else, or perhaps the student had mistaken someone else for them.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r586","rowIndex":586,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「レストランから出たところは見たか？」","en":"“Did you see them leave the restaurant?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r587","rowIndex":587,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「さあ。ずっと入り口を見てたわけじゃないから……」","en":"“I don’t know. I wasn’t watching the entrance the whole time…”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r588","rowIndex":588,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　学生が入るのを見たのは一時間以上も前のことだが、出るところを見ていないのならば、もしかしたら、まだ店の中で食事をしているのかもしれない。","en":"The student had seen them enter more than an hour earlier, but if he had not seen them leave, they might still be eating inside.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r589","rowIndex":589,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　出来れば混雑した街中で遭遇したくはなかった。鉢合わせとなれば、その場ですぐに仕留めなくてはならない。相手は二人。しかもサイキックだ。余計な被害が出ないとも限らない。しかし、だからといって都合の良い場所に彼らが移動するまで待つつもりはない。","en":"I would have preferred not to encounter them in the crowded city. If we came face-to-face, I would have to kill him on the spot. There were two of them, and both were psychics. Other people might be harmed. But I had no intention of waiting for them to move somewhere more convenient.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r590","rowIndex":590,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　レストランの扉の前で、私は肩から掛けていたショルダーバッグに手を突っ込み、なかの銃を握った。","en":"Before the restaurant door, I reached into the bag slung over my shoulder and gripped the gun inside.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r591","rowIndex":591,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　重さが２キロもあるその巨大な銃は、最近仕入れたばかりの『デザートイーグル　.５０AE』だ。拳銃としては最大級の弾丸を撃ち出すその破壊力は、頭に当てれば熊でも一撃で殺すだろう。","en":"The enormous pistol, weighing fully two kilograms, was a Desert Eagle .50 AE I had only recently acquired. It fired one of the largest handgun cartridges in existence. A hit to the head could probably kill even a bear with a single shot.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r592","rowIndex":592,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　威力の分だけ反動が強い銃だが、私の元々の筋力にさらに<tips=17>タイプB</tips>としての向上分を乗せれば充分に扱えることは試射によってわかっている。","en":"Its power came with heavy recoil, but test-firing had shown that my natural strength, further enhanced by <tips=17>Type B</tips>, was more than sufficient to handle it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r593","rowIndex":593,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>を撃つのにこれほどの威力が必要かというとそうでもないだろうが、今の私の筋力なら口径を小さくしても扱いやすさにさほど差がなかったのでこちらを選んだ。","en":"<tips=20>Koschei</tips> probably did not require such tremendous power. But with my present strength, a smaller caliber would make little difference in handling, so I had chosen this one.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r594","rowIndex":594,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　レストランのなかで気軽に撃つようなしろものではない。けれど、迷いはなかった。もし目の前に<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>がいて、その後ろに無関係な市民が食事をしていたとしても、即座に引き金を引いてやる。","en":"This was not the sort of weapon one fired casually inside a restaurant. Yet I had no hesitation. If <tips=20>Koschei</tips> stood before me with innocent civilians eating behind him, I would pull the trigger at once.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r595","rowIndex":595,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は店の裏に回り、客が出入りする正面口ではなく、従業員用のドアをそっと開いた。","en":"I went around to the back of the restaurant and quietly opened the staff door instead of the front entrance used by customers.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r596","rowIndex":596,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　すぐ目の前に居た白衣の従業員が驚くのに、<tips=49>三芳</tips>がさっと警察手帳を見せて黙らせる。私は重い銃を手にぶら下げたまま、キッチンの中から客席の方を観察する。","en":"A white-clad employee just inside started in surprise, but <tips=49>Miyoshi</tips> swiftly showed her police identification and silenced him. With the heavy gun dangling from my hand, I surveyed the dining room from the kitchen.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r597","rowIndex":597,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　どの席にも、<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>の姿も灰上の姿もない。","en":"Neither <tips=20>Koschei</tips> nor Haigami was at any table.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r598","rowIndex":598,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は銃をバッグにしまい、ホールスタッフから事情聴取をする。それによると、確かに灰上の方の姿は見かけたそうだ。彼女はその時白人の老人といたということで、<tips=65>ヘス</tips>かと思ったが、写真を見せると全くの別人だと言う。未知の姿に変身しているのかもしれない。","en":"I put the gun back in my bag and questioned a member of the dining-room staff. They had indeed seen Haigami. She had been with an elderly white man, and I thought it might be <tips=65>Hess</tips>, but when shown his photograph, the employee said it was someone entirely different. Koschei might have transformed into an unknown form.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r599","rowIndex":599,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　二人は十五分か二十分ほど前に食事を終えて会計を済ませていったそうだ。","en":"The pair had apparently finished eating, paid, and left fifteen or twenty minutes earlier.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r600","rowIndex":600,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ついさっきじゃないか！　間違いなく彼らとの距離が近づいている。","en":"Only fifteen or twenty minutes ago! There could be no doubt we were closing the distance.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r601","rowIndex":601,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たちはすぐにその店を出て、<tips=8>グレートホール</tips>に向かった。","en":"We immediately left the restaurant and headed toward the <tips=8>Great Hole</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r602","rowIndex":602,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼らはきっと大通りを避け、裏の細い道を使うことだろう。そうだとすれば、道は一つしかない。ここから<tips=8>グレートホール</tips>を取り囲む廃墟の森林まではごく僅かの距離しかないのだ。","en":"They would surely avoid the main thoroughfare and use the narrow back roads. If so, there was only one route they could have taken. Only a short distance separated us from the forest of ruins surrounding the <tips=8>Great Hole</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r603","rowIndex":603,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>の方がどんな姿をしていても、灰上の方は変装もしていないようだから見ればわかる。ならば話は簡単だ。どんな姿の人間であろうと、彼女と一緒に歩いているやつを撃てばいい。","en":"No matter what <tips=20>Koschei</tips> looked like, Haigami had apparently made no effort to disguise herself, so I would recognize her on sight. That made matters simple. All I had to do was shoot whoever was walking beside her.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r604","rowIndex":604,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あんたはこの辺りで待っていろ」","en":"“Wait somewhere around here.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r605","rowIndex":605,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「でも……」","en":"“But...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"三芳","displayName":"Miyoshi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r606","rowIndex":606,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=49>三芳</tips>が緊張で蒼白になった顔で言う。","en":"<tips=49>Miyoshi’s</tips> face had gone white with tension.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r607","rowIndex":607,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「足手まといなんだ。あんたは、<tips=17>タイプB</tips>の身体能力をもち、おまけに不死身のおれを手助け出来ると思ってるのか？」","en":"“You'd only be dead weight. Do you really think you can be any help to me, with the physical abilities of a <tips=17>Type B</tips> and immortality besides?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r608","rowIndex":608,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女はぐっと下唇を噛み、そして、","en":"She bit hard on her lower lip before asking the question.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r609","rowIndex":609,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「その銃だけで倒せると思いますか？」","en":"“Do you think you can defeat him with that gun alone?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"三芳","displayName":"Miyoshi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r610","rowIndex":610,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「出来るさ」","en":"“I can.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r611","rowIndex":611,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「何か策は？　相手はサイキックなんですよ？」","en":"“Do you have a plan? Your opponents are psychics.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"三芳","displayName":"Miyoshi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r612","rowIndex":612,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「策なんかいらん。あいつらの戦い方は前に見ている。なんとかなるさ」","en":"“I don’t need a plan. I’ve seen them fight before. I’ll manage.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r613","rowIndex":613,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そんな……」","en":"“But...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"三芳","displayName":"Miyoshi","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r614","rowIndex":614,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「話している暇はない。じゃあな。今まで世話になった。心から感謝してるよ。一時間経ったら警察の方に連絡してくれていいが、それまではどうか誰にも言わないでくれ」","en":"“We have no time to discuss it. Goodbye. Thank you sincerely for everything you’ve done. You may contact the police after an hour, but until then, please tell no one.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r615","rowIndex":615,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私はそう言い残し、彼女を置いて道を行った。","en":"With that, I left her behind and continued down the road.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r616","rowIndex":616,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　胸の鼓動が早くなる。バッグのなかに突っ込んだ手に汗がにじむ。","en":"My heart beat faster. The hand I had thrust into the bag grew slick with sweat.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r617","rowIndex":617,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　緊張しながら進んだが、それらしい姿を見かけることが出来ないまま廃墟の端に辿り着いてしまった。","en":"I advanced with tension mounting at every step, yet reached the edge of the ruins without seeing anyone who resembled my targets.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r618","rowIndex":618,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　近くに<tips=15>ボーダーエリア</tips>の住民らしい、頭からすっぽりとかぶって全身を隠す服を着た人物が畑の草むしりをしているのに気がつく。","en":"Nearby, I noticed someone weeding a field, wrapped from head to toe in the concealing clothing worn by residents of the <tips=15>Border Area</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r619","rowIndex":619,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「すまないが、ここを二人組が通らなかったか教えてくれないか？」","en":"“Excuse me. Could you tell me whether a pair of people passed this way?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r620","rowIndex":620,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ふたりぐみ？」","en":"“A pair?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r621","rowIndex":621,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　顔を上げてそう言った声は、服装では性別の区別がつかなかったが、若い女のものだった。","en":"The clothes concealed the person’s sex, but the voice that answered when they raised their head belonged to a young woman.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r622","rowIndex":622,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「若い女の子と、白人の老人なんだが……」","en":"“A young girl and an elderly white man…”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r623","rowIndex":623,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　画像を見せるのももどかしく、返答を急かした。","en":"Too impatient even to show her the image, I pressed her for an answer.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r624","rowIndex":624,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ああ……」","en":"“Oh...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r625","rowIndex":625,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女は頷くと、奥の方を指さした。","en":"She nodded and pointed farther in.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r626","rowIndex":626,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いまさっき、そちらへ。あんまり奥に行くと汚染されてますよって教えてあげたんですけれど、大丈夫ですって女の子がこたえて……」","en":"“They went that way just a moment ago. I told them it was contaminated farther in, but the girl said they would be all right...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r627","rowIndex":627,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いまさっきって、具体的にどれくらい？」","en":"“How long is ‘just a moment’ exactly?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r628","rowIndex":628,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「はっきりわからないですけど、五分くらいかな……」","en":"“I’m not certain. Perhaps five minutes...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r629","rowIndex":629,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ありがとう」","en":"“Thank you.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r630","rowIndex":630,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　やっと、追いついたぞ。","en":"At last. I had caught up.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r631","rowIndex":631,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=8>グレートホール</tips>に向かうその道は使うものがすくなく、廃墟の間に低い雑草がまばらに生い茂っている。入ってすぐに立ち入り禁止のロープがあったが、杭の金具が錆びて地面に落ちていた。この先を少し行くと一応汚染区域ということになっているが、子どもなどはよく遊び場にしているし、ゴミの不法投棄なども行われている。","en":"Few people used the path toward the <tips=8>Great Hole</tips>, and sparse, low weeds grew between the ruins. A no-entry rope hung just inside, but the metal fitting on its post had rusted through and fallen to the ground. The area a short distance ahead was officially contaminated, yet children often used it as a playground, and people dumped refuse there illegally.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r632","rowIndex":632,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私はそのロープを踏み越え、辺りに人影がないのを確認してから、銃を取り出した。","en":"I stepped over the rope, confirmed that no one else was in sight, and drew the pistol.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r633","rowIndex":633,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ギロギロと辺りを睨むようにして二人の姿を探しながら、道を進む。","en":"I stalked down the path, glaring this way and that as I searched for the pair.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r634","rowIndex":634,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　謝罪も言い訳も必要ない。相手にこれから死ぬ理由を教える気もない。だから言葉を交わすつもりはない。見つけたら、すぐにその背中を撃つ。幸い風は前から吹いている。相手の感覚も私と同じように研ぎ澄まされているかもしれないが、この条件なら先に私が見つけるだろう。見つければ、あとはなんとかして拳銃の射程まで近づき、<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>を撃つ。","en":"There would be no apologies or excuses. I had no intention of telling him why he was about to die. I had no intention of speaking at all. Once I found him, I would immediately shoot him in the back. Fortunately, the wind blew toward me. His senses might be sharpened like mine, but under these conditions, I should see him first. Then I merely had to get within handgun range somehow and shoot <tips=20>Koschei</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r635","rowIndex":635,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　灰上の方は無視をする。狙いは<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>ただ一人。","en":"I would ignore Haigami. <tips=20>Koschei</tips> alone was my target.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r636","rowIndex":636,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>は私と同様不死身の身体を持っているが、その効力を失わせる方法は知っている。死んだ<tips=55>汐松子</tips>の身体に、犯人から『<tips=46>ネオ・ローズ</tips>』を注射されたと思われる形跡があった。警察はなぜこんなものが被害者に注射されたのかわからないようだったが、私にはその理由がわかる。","en":"<tips=20>Koschei</tips> possessed an immortal body like mine, but I knew how to take that power away. Marks on <tips=55>Matsuko Shio’s</tips> body suggested that her killer had injected her with <tips=46>Neo Rose</tips>. The police did not understand why a victim would be given such a drug. I knew the reason.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r637","rowIndex":637,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　警察は知らなかったが、<tips=55>汐松子</tips>は不死身の身体を持っている。彼女が殺されるというのは本来ありえないことだ。不死身の身体に詳しい<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>が、なぜ<tips=55>汐松子</tips>にわざわざ『<tips=46>ネオ・ローズ</tips>』を使ったのか。つまりそれが不死の能力を消す方法なのだろう。","en":"The police had not known that <tips=55>Matsuko Shio</tips> possessed an immortal body. Ordinarily, killing her should have been impossible. Why had <tips=20>Koschei</tips>, who understood immortality intimately, gone out of his way to use ‘<tips=46>Neo Rose</tips>’ on <tips=55>Matsuko Shio</tips>? The drug was presumably the means of eliminating immortality.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r638","rowIndex":638,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私の銃には『<tips=46>ネオ・ローズ</tips>』が弾頭に仕込まれた特製の弾丸が装填されている。そして、『<tips=46>ネオ・ローズ</tips>』の注射も用意している。","en":"My pistol was loaded with custom rounds whose tips had been packed with ‘<tips=46>Neo Rose</tips>.’ I had also prepared an injection of ‘<tips=46>Neo Rose</tips>.’","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r639","rowIndex":639,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　無論、相手の能力を考えれば銃だけで仕留めなくてはならないが、もし弾丸を撃ち尽くしてしまった場合は、こんなものでも持っていた方がマシだろう。","en":"Of course, given my opponent’s abilities, I would have to finish him with the gun alone. But if I used up every bullet, even something like this would be better than nothing.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r640","rowIndex":640,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　とにかく、あとちょっとだ！","en":"In any event, only a little farther!","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r641","rowIndex":641,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　気持ちがはやり、駆け出したくなるが、物音はなるべく抑えなくてはいけない。私は銃を両手で構えたまま競歩選手のように早足で道を進む。","en":"Impatience drove me onward and made me want to break into a run, but I had to keep my movements as quiet as possible. Holding the gun in both hands, I hurried down the path with the short, rapid steps of a racewalker.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r642","rowIndex":642,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　もし二人が道を逸れて廃墟の中へ入ってしまっていたら見つけられない。また、さっきの<tips=15>ボーダーエリア</tips>の女の情報が人違いだったら、やっぱり遭遇は難しいだろう。","en":"If the two of them had left the path and entered the ruins, I would never find them. And if the information from the woman in the <tips=15>Border Area</tips> concerned the wrong people, I was unlikely to encounter them either.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r643","rowIndex":643,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　確実というわけじゃない。それでも、今はこの道を進むしかない。他に選択肢はないのだ。","en":"Nothing was certain. Even so, all I could do now was follow this road. There was no other choice.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r644","rowIndex":644,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　――そして、その瞬間は不意に訪れた。","en":"—And then, without warning, the moment came.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r645","rowIndex":645,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　幸運に、思わず声が出そうになる。","en":"I nearly cried out at my good fortune.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r646","rowIndex":646,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　道の向こうに二人が歩いている後ろ姿を発見したのだ。声は聞こえないが、彼らは何か喋っているらしく、時折顔を向かい合わせている。","en":"Ahead on the road, I caught sight of the two of them walking with their backs to me. I could not hear their voices, but they seemed to be talking, occasionally turning to look at one another.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r647","rowIndex":647,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その歩みは遅い。","en":"They walked slowly.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r648","rowIndex":648,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして、まだこちらには気がついていない。","en":"And they had not yet noticed me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r649","rowIndex":649,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　このまままっすぐ道を行くか、脇の茂みに隠れて回り込むようにして近づくか、選択を迫られた。","en":"I had to choose between continuing straight down the path and hiding in the undergrowth to circle closer.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r650","rowIndex":650,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　茂みに隠れれば、姿を隠すことが出来るが音が出る。このまま背後から近づけば、音はさほどではないが、何かの拍子でどちらかが振り返ったら身を隠す方法がない。","en":"The undergrowth would conceal me, but it would make noise. If I kept approaching directly from behind, I would make far less noise—but if either of them happened to look back, I would have nowhere to hide.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r651","rowIndex":651,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私はまっすぐ進むことを選んだ。大した計算があったわけじゃない。目の前のターゲットに近づくための最短距離を反射的に選んでいたというだけのことだ。","en":"I chose to continue straight ahead. There was no elaborate calculation behind it. I had simply taken, by reflex, the shortest route to the target in front of me. That was all.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r652","rowIndex":652,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　銃自体の有効射程は八十メートルほどあるらしいが、私の技術ではその距離で命中させるのは難しい。<tips=17>タイプＢ</tips>能力によって以前よりそうした動作は精密になっているはずだが、それでも五十から六十メートルでやっと人型のどこかを捉えられるといったところだ。ある程度の確実性を得るためには、最低四十メートルの距離までは近づきたい。","en":"The gun itself apparently had an effective range of about eighty meters, but with my skill it would be difficult to hit anything at that distance. My <tips=17>Type B</tips> abilities should have made such movements more precise than before, yet even at fifty or sixty meters, I could only hope to hit some part of a human silhouette. To have any reasonable degree of certainty, I wanted to get within forty meters.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r653","rowIndex":653,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は相手のどちらも振り返らぬよう祈りつつ、早足で背中を追う。","en":"Praying neither of them would turn around, I hurried after their retreating backs.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r654","rowIndex":654,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　二人は話に夢中になっているのか、私の存在に気がつかない。近づくにつれて風に乗って小さくその話し声が聞こえてきたが、その内容まではわからない。","en":"Perhaps they were absorbed in conversation, because neither noticed me. As I drew closer, their quiet voices came to me on the wind, but I still could not make out what they were saying.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r655","rowIndex":655,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　とにかく、私は彼らを射程におさめることが出来た。","en":"At last, I had them within range.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r656","rowIndex":656,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は銃を持ち上げ、照準を灰上の隣にいる小柄な老人にあわせた。あれは<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>が変身したものだとは思うが、見たことのない姿だ。可能性としては人違いということもありうる。","en":"I raised the gun and trained the sights on the small old man beside Haigami. I assumed he was <tips=20>Koschei</tips> transformed, but I had never seen this guise before. It was still possible I had the wrong man.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r657","rowIndex":657,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しかし、悠長に確認していれば、せっかくのチャンスを逃してしまう。","en":"But if I took the time to make certain, I would lose this chance.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r658","rowIndex":658,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　まあいい。人違いなら、そのときはそのときだ。","en":"Fine. If I had the wrong man, so be it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r659","rowIndex":659,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　呼吸を整え、静かに引き金にかけた指に力を入れる。","en":"I steadied my breathing and slowly tightened my finger on the trigger.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r660","rowIndex":660,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　まさに弾が発射されようとする瞬間——。","en":"At the very instant the bullet was about to leave the barrel—","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r661","rowIndex":661,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「やめて」","en":"“Don’t.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r662","rowIndex":662,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　と、すぐ耳元で声が囁いた。","en":"A voice whispered right beside my ear.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r663","rowIndex":663,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それは<tips=53>ミユキ</tips>の声だ。","en":"It was <tips=53>Miyuki’s</tips> voice.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r664","rowIndex":664,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ああ、こんなときに発作が！","en":"Of all the times for an episode!","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r665","rowIndex":665,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しかし、私はこれが幻聴なのはわかっている。乱れた呼吸をすぐに整え直す。","en":"But I knew it was a hallucination. I quickly forced my ragged breathing back under control.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r666","rowIndex":666,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　この僅かな時間の遅れが運命を分けた。","en":"That tiny delay made all the difference.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r667","rowIndex":667,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　先ほどまでそんなそぶりも見せなかった灰上が、不意にこちらを振り向いたのである。","en":"Haigami, who until then had shown no sign that she knew I was there, suddenly turned to look at me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r668","rowIndex":668,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　まずい！","en":"Damn!","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r669","rowIndex":669,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私はすぐに引き金を引いたが、遅かった。両腕に見えない力が加わる。","en":"I pulled the trigger at once, but I was too late. An invisible force bore down on both my arms.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r670","rowIndex":670,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　銃口が火を吹き、爆音がしたものの、照準は完全に逸れていて、目標は微動だにしない。","en":"The gun roared and spat flame, but my aim had been thrown completely off, and my target did not so much as flinch.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r671","rowIndex":671,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　再度狙いをつけようとするが、見えない力は強力で、私は照準をあわせることが出来ない。","en":"I tried to take aim again, but the invisible force was too powerful; I could not line up the sights.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r672","rowIndex":672,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ぶれたまま引き金を引いてみたが、彼らの足元の土が跳ねただけで、とても命中には至らない。","en":"I tried pulling the trigger while my aim still wavered, but all it did was kick up dirt at their feet. The shot came nowhere close to hitting them.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r673","rowIndex":673,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　今の人間離れをしているはずの私の腕力でも、対抗することが出来ないとは。","en":"Even my strength, which should now have been beyond human, was no match for it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r674","rowIndex":674,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　おそらくこれが、警官の首をねじって殺した力の正体なのだ。","en":"This was probably the true nature of the force that had twisted the police officers’ necks and killed them.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r675","rowIndex":675,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「くそっ！」","en":"“Damn it!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r676","rowIndex":676,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　叫ぶ私を、少女がらんらんと光る金色の目で見つめている。","en":"As I shouted, the girl stared at me, her golden eyes blazing.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r677","rowIndex":677,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　やはりやつも、ハイブリッドなのか。","en":"Was she a hybrid too, after all?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r678","rowIndex":678,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　奇襲に失敗した以上、逃走を図るべきなのはわかっていたが、私は前に駆け出した。ここまで来て逃げられるものか。","en":"Now that my surprise attack had failed, I knew I should run, but instead I charged forward. I had come too far to flee now.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r679","rowIndex":679,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　無理矢理近づけば、ぶれる銃口でも標的を捉えることが出来る。","en":"If I forced my way closer, even a wavering muzzle could find its target.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r680","rowIndex":680,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「来ないで……」","en":"“Don’t come any closer...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r681","rowIndex":681,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　灰上の言葉と共に、見えない力が私を押し返す。それに対抗するためにぐっと足腰に力を入れると、足元の土がえぐれた。","en":"At Haigami's words, an invisible force pushed me back. I planted my feet and braced my entire lower body against it, gouging the earth beneath me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r682","rowIndex":682,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　かまうものか。","en":"As if I cared.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r683","rowIndex":683,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　全身の力を込めて、もう一歩踏み込む。","en":"Putting the strength of my whole body behind it, I forced myself one more step forward.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r684","rowIndex":684,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「うおおおおっ」","en":"“Raaaaah!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r685","rowIndex":685,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僅かに私の力が上回るようだ。私の身体はじりじりと前に進む。","en":"My strength seemed to hold a slight advantage. Inch by inch, I advanced.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r686","rowIndex":686,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その時には、灰上の隣の老人も振り返っている。","en":"By then, the old man beside Haigami had turned around as well.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r687","rowIndex":687,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それは<tips=65>ヘス</tips>でもない、やはり私の知らない人物だ。","en":"He was not <tips=65>Hess</tips>. As I had thought, he was someone I did not recognize.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r688","rowIndex":688,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しかし、あれが<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>なのだ。","en":"Yet this was <tips=20>Koschei</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r689","rowIndex":689,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　もしあれが、あのテレポート少女にでも変身して襲ってくれば絶体絶命だ。","en":"If he transformed into the teleporting girl and attacked, I would be finished.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r690","rowIndex":690,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そうでなくとも、あの<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>本体にも何か特別な力があるかもしれない。灰上の見えない力と全力で押し相撲をしている私は、何をされても簡単に殺されるだろう。勝算はほとんどない。","en":"Even if that was not the case, <tips=20>Koschei</tips> himself might possess some special power of his own. Locked in a full-strength shoving match with Haigami’s invisible force, I would be easy prey for anything he might do. I had almost no chance of winning.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r691","rowIndex":691,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　やはり、相手に気づかれた時点で逃げるしかなかったのだ。今からでもくるりと後ろを向いて走り出すべきなのだ。","en":"I should have fled the moment they noticed me, after all. Even now, I should turn around and run.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r692","rowIndex":692,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それは理解していたが、激情が理性的な行動を私に許さなかった。","en":"I understood that, but my rage would not permit me to act rationally.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r693","rowIndex":693,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>は変身しなかった。かといって逃げようとするわけでもない。","en":"<tips=20>Koschei</tips> did not transform. Nor did he try to flee.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r694","rowIndex":694,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私に向かって一歩、近づいた。","en":"He took one step toward me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r695","rowIndex":695,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=63>サーシェンカ</tips>！」","en":"“<tips=63>Sashenka</tips>!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r696","rowIndex":696,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　灰上が声をあげる。","en":"Haigami cried out.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r697","rowIndex":697,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>はその声が聞こえないかのように、ただ私を見つめ、そして近づいてくる。","en":"<tips=20>Koschei</tips> merely stared at me as though he could not hear her and kept coming closer.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r698","rowIndex":698,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その時私は歯を食いしばって、前に進もうとしていた。","en":"At that moment, I was gritting my teeth and struggling to move forward.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r699","rowIndex":699,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　体中の肌が充血で真っ赤に染まり、頭の角もあいまって、文字通り鬼のような形相になっていただろう。","en":"The skin all over my body was flushed bright red, and with the horns on my head, I must literally have looked like an ogre.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r700","rowIndex":700,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「アナタは……」","en":"“You ARE...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r701","rowIndex":701,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>はそう呼びかけた。","en":"<tips=20>Koschei</tips> addressed me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r702","rowIndex":702,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私はなんとか両手を持ち上げて銃を構え、彼に狙いを定める。","en":"Somehow I raised both hands and leveled the gun, taking aim at him.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r703","rowIndex":703,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　大分距離が縮まっており、この距離ならある程度ぶれても外れないはずだ。","en":"The distance between us had narrowed considerably. From this close, even if my aim wavered somewhat, I should not miss.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r704","rowIndex":704,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しかし、顔面に狙いをつけた瞬間、それまで私の全身にかかっていた圧力が、全て両手へと移動した。","en":"But the instant I aimed at his face, all the pressure that had been bearing down on my whole body shifted to my hands.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r705","rowIndex":705,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その結果、照準は大きく上にずれて私は白い雲を撃つ。","en":"As a result, my aim jerked high, and I fired into the white clouds.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r706","rowIndex":706,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「貴様っ！　くそっ！」","en":"“You bastard! Damn you!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r707","rowIndex":707,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　灰上の圧力と戦う私を、<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>は静かな目でじっと見つめている。","en":"As I fought against Haigami's pressure, <tips=20>Koschei</tips> watched me with calm, unwavering eyes.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r708","rowIndex":708,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「探偵さんっ！」","en":"“Detective!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r709","rowIndex":709,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　灰上が声をあげる。","en":"Haigami cried out.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r710","rowIndex":710,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「もう帰って！　今私はあなたを殺そうと思えば簡単に殺せるんだよっ！」","en":"“Go home! I could kill you easily right now if I wanted to!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r711","rowIndex":711,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私はその声を無視して、もう一度銃を構えようとするが、どうやっても銃口は暴れてしまって<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>をとらえることが出来ない。","en":"I ignored her and tried once more to level the gun, but no matter what I did, the muzzle bucked wildly and I could not get <tips=20>Koschei</tips> in my sights.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r712","rowIndex":712,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ああ、そうか。アナタは、やっぱりあの時の……」","en":"“Ah, I see. You really are the one from back then...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r713","rowIndex":713,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>はそう呟く。","en":"<tips=20>Koschei</tips> murmured the words.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r714","rowIndex":714,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ぼくがあなたの大事な人を奪ってしまったんデスね……」","en":"“I took someone precious from you, DIDN’T I...?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r715","rowIndex":715,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼はそう言って、しわだらけの目を細めた。","en":"He narrowed his wrinkled eyes.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r716","rowIndex":716,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その表情は悲しそうに見える。これは、どういう人格なのだろう？","en":"His expression looked sorrowful. What sort of personality was this?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r717","rowIndex":717,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　どう見ても演技には見えない。もしかしたら、この人格は殺人にはまったく関わっていないのかもしれない。","en":"It did not look like an act at all. Perhaps this personality had had nothing whatsoever to do with any murder.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r718","rowIndex":718,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しかし、それは私には関係のないことだ。身体に力を込める。","en":"But none of that mattered to me. I tensed every muscle in my body.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r719","rowIndex":719,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「くっ……」","en":"“Ngh...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r720","rowIndex":720,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　向こうで灰上が顔をしかめた。彼女ほど強力な能力者がこれくらいで疲労するとは思えないが、体力が落ちているのかもしれない。","en":"Haigami grimaced in the distance. I could hardly believe a psychic as powerful as she was would tire from this alone, but perhaps her stamina had declined.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r721","rowIndex":721,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「取り返しがつかないことをしました。ゴメンなさい」","en":"“I did something that can never be undone. I’m SORRY.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r722","rowIndex":722,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>はそう言って、目に涙を浮かべる。","en":"Tears gathered in <tips=20>Koschei’s</tips> eyes as he spoke.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r723","rowIndex":723,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　謝ったところで、許すつもりなどない。","en":"He could apologize all he liked. I had no intention of forgiving him.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r724","rowIndex":724,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　むしろその態度が私の感情を逆なでする。","en":"If anything, his attitude only inflamed me further.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r725","rowIndex":725,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　全身にさらなる力を込めるために歯を噛みしめると、奥歯が砕け、口の中に血液があふれた。","en":"I clenched my teeth to summon still more strength. One of my molars shattered, and blood flooded my mouth.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r726","rowIndex":726,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　血管が切れそうだ。筋肉がちぎれそうだ。だが、私の力がやや上回っている。","en":"My blood vessels felt ready to burst. My muscles felt ready to tear. But my strength had a slight edge.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r727","rowIndex":727,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女は手加減しているのだろうか？　それとも、やはり弱っているのか？","en":"Was she holding back? Or was she weakened after all?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r728","rowIndex":728,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　何でも良い。","en":"It did not matter which.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r729","rowIndex":729,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　とにかく、なんとか照準を合わせることが出来そうだ——と、思った瞬間、また力の向きが変わって、私のからだ全体が下から上へと持ち上げられた。","en":"In any case, I was just thinking I might finally be able to line up the sights—when the direction of the force changed again, lifting my whole body from below.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r730","rowIndex":730,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　前や横からの力なら大地に踏ん張ることが出来るが、上空へと飛ばされてはそれも出来ない。","en":"I could brace against force from the front or side by planting myself against the earth, but not if I was hurled into the air.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r731","rowIndex":731,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　身体がふわっと持ち上げられる瞬間、咄嗟に地面に手を伸ばして草を掴んだが、もちろんそれで繋ぎ止められるはずもなく、ブチブチと千切れる。","en":"As my body drifted upward, I instinctively reached for the ground and grabbed the grass. Naturally it could not hold me; the blades ripped apart with a series of snaps.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r732","rowIndex":732,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして私のからだは空中に舞うこととなった。","en":"And so my body went sailing into the air.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r733","rowIndex":733,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しかも、ただ浮かばせられるだけでなく、くるくると回されている。","en":"Worse, the force did not merely suspend me; it spun me round and round.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r734","rowIndex":734,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　こうなっては何も出来ない。両手に構えた銃を相手に向かって何発か撃ってみたが、まぐれでも命中してくれない。","en":"There was nothing I could do like this. Still gripping the gun in both hands, I fired several shots at them, but not even one found its mark by chance.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r735","rowIndex":735,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　目が回り吐き気がする頃、","en":"By the time my head was spinning and nausea had set in—","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r736","rowIndex":736,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「エリコ、やめてっ！」","en":"“Eriko, stop!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r737","rowIndex":737,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そう声をあげたのは<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>だった。","en":"<tips=20>Koschei</tips> raised his voice.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r738","rowIndex":738,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いいんだ。大丈夫だから……もうやめて……」","en":"“It’s all right. I’ll be fine... Please, stop...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r739","rowIndex":739,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　灰上は私に聞こえないような小さな声で何か反論をしたらしいが、<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>はなだめた。すると、私の身体を弄んでいた暴風のような力がぱっとやんだ。","en":"Haigami apparently protested in a voice too low for me to hear, but <tips=20>Koschei</tips> soothed her. At once, the storm-like force that had been toying with my body vanished.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r740","rowIndex":740,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　浮力を失った私は土の上にぐしゃりと落ちる。立ち上がろうとするが、すっかり目が回ってしまって世界がぐらぐらとし、しかも銃を取り落としてしまう。","en":"With nothing left to hold me up, I crashed into the earth. I tried to stand, but the world swayed with dizziness, and I had dropped the gun.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r741","rowIndex":741,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ぼくが原因なんだ。だから、ぼくがなんとかしてあげないと……」","en":"“I’m the cause. I have to do something for him...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"サーシェンカ（老化後）","displayName":"Sashenka (Aged)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r742","rowIndex":742,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は跪いて落とした銃を掴む。目の前に<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>がいて、私の視界にはちょうどその手が映った。","en":"I dropped to my knees and seized the gun I had let fall. <tips=20>Koschei</tips> was directly before me, and his hand came squarely into view.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r743","rowIndex":743,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　老人の乾いてしわだらけの手は、みるみるうちにうるおいを取り戻し、しわが消えてゆく。","en":"Before my eyes, the old man's dry, deeply wrinkled hand grew supple again, its wrinkles fading away.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r744","rowIndex":744,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　あのテレポート女に変身するつもりだ。そして、自らトドメをさそうとしている！","en":"He meant to transform into that teleporting woman—and then finish me off himself!","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r745","rowIndex":745,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そう察した私は、相変わらずグルグルとする目を細め、どうにか銃を構える。","en":"Realizing this, I narrowed my eyes against the continuing whirl and somehow raised the gun.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r746","rowIndex":746,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　跪いて照準を合わせる私を見下ろしているのは、さっきまでの老人ではなかった。","en":"The one looking down at me as I knelt and took aim was no longer the old man from moments before.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r747","rowIndex":747,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しかし、想像していた少女の姿でもない。","en":"Nor was it the girl I had imagined.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r748","rowIndex":748,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私の銃口はピタリとその顔の前で止まっていた。相手は動かない。いま撃てばその顔は石榴のようにはじけ飛んでいだろうが、私は引き金にかけた指に力を込めることが出来なかった。","en":"My muzzle stopped dead before that face. My opponent did not move. If I fired now, that face would burst apart like a pomegranate, yet I could not make my finger tighten on the trigger.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r749","rowIndex":749,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=53>ミユキ</tips>……」","en":"“<tips=53>Miyuki</tips>...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r750","rowIndex":750,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そう、そこに立っていたのは、他の誰でもない、あの<tips=53>ミユキ</tips>そのものだった。","en":"Yes. The person standing there was <tips=53>Miyuki</tips> herself. It could be no one else.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r751","rowIndex":751,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「こんなことが……こんなことまでっ、出来るのかっ……」","en":"“You can... You can even do this...?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r752","rowIndex":752,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>がその変身能力で、<tips=53>ミユキ</tips>に化けたのである。","en":"<tips=20>Koschei</tips> had used his power of transformation to take on <tips=53>Miyuki’s</tips> appearance.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r753","rowIndex":753,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そこにいるのは<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>だ。<tips=53>ミユキ</tips>じゃない。","en":"The person before me was <tips=20>Koschei</tips>, not <tips=53>Miyuki</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r754","rowIndex":754,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そうはわかっていたが、私は引き金をひくことが出来ない。","en":"I knew that, yet I could not pull the trigger.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r755","rowIndex":755,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「こんなことで、あなたの傷ついた心が癒やせるのかはわかりませんが……」","en":"“I don’t know whether something like this can heal your wounded heart...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r756","rowIndex":756,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　相手が口にする、その声までもが<tips=53>ミユキ</tips>そのものだった。","en":"Even the voice that came from his mouth was perfectly <tips=53>Miyuki’s</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r757","rowIndex":757,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そっくりなのは声だけじゃない。首元の小さなほくろ。右の方が少し浅い二重の形。唇のしわ。どれをとっても、私の記憶にある<tips=53>ミユキ</tips>と寸分違わない。毎日見て、毎日触れたそのかたちを、忘れることなど出来るだろうか。私は世界で一番、もしかしたら本人よりも<tips=53>ミユキ</tips>の身体の形に詳しいだろう。","en":"And it was not only the voice that was identical. The small mole at her throat. The crease of her right eyelid, a little shallower than the left. The lines of her lips. In every detail, she was indistinguishable from the <tips=53>Miyuki</tips> in my memory. Could I ever forget that form I had seen and touched every day? I probably knew the shape of <tips=53>Miyuki’s</tips> body better than anyone in the world—perhaps better than she did herself.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r758","rowIndex":758,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　一つでも間違いがあれば、すぐに引き金を引けた。","en":"If even one detail had been wrong, I could have pulled the trigger at once.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r759","rowIndex":759,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しかし、これだけ詳しい私でさえも、まったく違いを見つけることが出来ないのだ！","en":"Yet even I, who knew her this well, could not find a single difference!","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r760","rowIndex":760,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　これは<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>だ。<tips=53>ミユキ</tips>ではなく、彼女を殺し、そして<tips=48>堂島</tips>を殺した殺人鬼だ。見せかけだけ似せた化け物なんだ。どんなにそっくりでも、撃たなくてはいけない。","en":"This was <tips=20>Koschei</tips>. Not <tips=53>Miyuki</tips>, but the murderer who had killed her and then <tips=48>Dojima</tips>. A monster that only looked like her. No matter how perfect the resemblance, I had to shoot.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r761","rowIndex":761,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は自分に言いきかせ、下がりかけていた銃口をまた持ち上げ、相手の顔面に向ける。","en":"I told myself that, raised the muzzle I had begun to lower, and once more aimed it at my opponent's face.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r762","rowIndex":762,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　相手は戸惑いも見せず、まっすぐ私を見ている。","en":"My opponent showed no sign of confusion, but simply looked straight at me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r763","rowIndex":763,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=53>ミユキ</tips>の顔で私を見ている。","en":"He was looking at me with <tips=53>Miyuki’s</tips> face.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r764","rowIndex":764,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あ……あ……」","en":"“Ah... Ah...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r765","rowIndex":765,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私の口から声が漏れた。","en":"A sound escaped my lips.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r766","rowIndex":766,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　殺さなくては。見てくれに誤魔化されてはいけない。私はそのためにここまで来たのだから。","en":"I had to kill him. I could not let his appearance deceive me. That was why I had come this far.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r767","rowIndex":767,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　なのに、わかっているのに、引き金にかけた指は動かない。まるで、頭と身体を繋げる神経が全て断裂してしまったように、脳の命令が届かない。","en":"And yet—even though I knew all this—the finger on the trigger would not move. It was as if every nerve connecting my mind to my body had been severed; my brain’s commands could not get through.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r768","rowIndex":768,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして全身から全ての力が抜けた。","en":"All strength left my body.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r769","rowIndex":769,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　たとえ形だけの偽物だとしても、私に<tips=53>ミユキ</tips>を撃つことなど出来るだろうか？　今自分を動かしている全ての感情は、<tips=53>ミユキ</tips>によって生まれたものなのだ。<tips=53>ミユキ</tips>を壊させてしまった、後悔から生まれたものなのだ。","en":"Even if it was only a false likeness, could I really shoot <tips=53>Miyuki</tips>? Every emotion driving me now had been born from <tips=53>Miyuki</tips>—born of my regret that I had allowed <tips=53>Miyuki</tips> to be destroyed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r770","rowIndex":770,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　全てを投げうってでも、もう一度この目で見たいと思っていたものが、まさに目の前にある。偽物だとわかっていても、これを、自分の手で、もう一度壊すなんて。","en":"What I had wanted to see again with my own eyes, even at the cost of everything, now stood right before me. Even knowing it was a fake, to destroy it again with my own hands...","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r771","rowIndex":771,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　うなだれたまま、どうしても身体に力が入らない。ピクリとも動けない。目からとめどもなくあふれる涙も、ぬぐうことが出来ず、ただ落ちてゆくのを見守ることしか出来なかった。","en":"Head hanging, I could not summon the slightest strength in my body. I could not move a muscle. Tears poured endlessly from my eyes. Unable even to wipe them away, I could only watch them fall.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r772","rowIndex":772,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ごめんなさい」","en":"“I’m sorry.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r773","rowIndex":773,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　目の前で<tips=53>ミユキ</tips>の姿をしたその人物は、くるりと踵を返して目の前を去っていった。","en":"The person in <tips=53>Miyuki’s</tips> form turned upon her heel before me and walked away.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r774","rowIndex":774,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私はそれでも動けず、誰もいなくなったあともしばらくそこで泣き続けた。","en":"Still unable to move, I continued to cry there for some time after everyone had gone.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r775","rowIndex":775,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　とても眩しくて、光がきらきらと輝いて、目を大きく開けているのもつらいくらい。","en":"So dazzling, light glittering everywhere—almost too bright to keep our eyes wide open.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r776","rowIndex":776,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　でも、おかしいな。空を見ると雲があって、晴れてなんかない。いつも通りの<tips=9>Y地区</tips>の灰色の景色が、どうしてか眩しく感じられるということなの？","en":"But how strange. Clouds covered the sky, and the weather was hardly clear. Did the ordinary gray landscape of <tips=9>Y District</tips> somehow look dazzling to us?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r777","rowIndex":777,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　感覚がおかしくなってしまったんだろうか？　これも病気のせいなんだろうか？","en":"Had something gone wrong with our senses? Was this another effect of the disease?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r778","rowIndex":778,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　わからないけれど、いやな気分じゃない。街を歩くと発症した<tips=17>タイプB</tips>が独り言を言って笑ったり、幻覚と戯れているけれど、こんな明るい気分だったんだろうか？　こんな晴れやかな気持ち、生まれてから一度も体験したことがない。","en":"We did not know, but it did not feel unpleasant. We had seen symptomatic <tips=17>Type Bs</tips> around the city, muttering and laughing to themselves or playing with hallucinations. Had they felt this bright inside? Never in our lives had we experienced such a clear, radiant feeling.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r779","rowIndex":779,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ほら見て。あそこに白い鳥がいる。あれなんて鳥かな？」","en":"“Look. There’s a white bird over there. What kind is it?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"サーシェンカ白シャツ","displayName":"Sashenka (White Shirt)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r780","rowIndex":780,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　さっき女の姿になっていた<tips=63>サーシェンカ</tips>は、再び変身すると、老人のあの姿ではなく、初めて会ったころの少年の姿に戻っていた。","en":"<tips=63>Sashenka</tips>, who had taken a woman’s form earlier, had transformed once more. Rather than returning to the old man, he now wore the boyish form in which we had first met him.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r781","rowIndex":781,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして左右の景色を落ち着きなくキョロキョロと見回しながら、ふわふわとした口調でこちらが何もこたえなくても一方的におしゃべりを続けている。","en":"He looked restlessly from side to side, chattering in a dreamy voice without waiting for us to answer.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r782","rowIndex":782,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　このあたりは昔は住宅街だったんだろう。ひび割れたアスファルト、ごく普通の一戸建てやアパート。<tips=8>グレートホール</tips>が出来て汚染された街は放棄されてからもう何十年もたち、朽ちて緑色の蔦が巻きついている。玄関先の三輪車も、庭先の小さなブランコも、錆びついた上に蔦植物に絡めとられている。","en":"The area must once have been residential. Cracked asphalt ran between ordinary detached houses and apartment buildings. Decades had passed since the neighborhood, contaminated when the <tips=8>Great Hole</tips> appeared, was abandoned. Everything had decayed beneath coils of green ivy. A tricycle at one entrance and a small swing in one yard stood rusted and strangled by vines.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r783","rowIndex":783,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ねえ、さっきはヨボヨボのお爺ちゃんだったのに、今は子供の姿に戻ってる。どっちが本当のあなたのかたちなの？」","en":"“You were a decrepit old man just a moment ago, but now you’re a child again. Which one is your true form?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r784","rowIndex":784,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そういえば、さっきと違うね」","en":"“Now that you mention it, I do look different.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"サーシェンカ白シャツ","displayName":"Sashenka (White Shirt)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r785","rowIndex":785,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼は自分のすべすべとした頬に触れて、","en":"He touched his smooth cheek and said,","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r786","rowIndex":786,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「でも、大した意味なんかない。僕には本当のかたちなんかないんだと思う」","en":"“But it doesn’t mean very much. I don’t think I have a true form.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"サーシェンカ白シャツ","displayName":"Sashenka (White Shirt)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r787","rowIndex":787,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「てっきりさっきのお爺ちゃんが、あなたが年齢通り年をとった本当の姿だと思ったんだけど」","en":"“I thought that old man was your true form, aged naturally over the years.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r788","rowIndex":788,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それはないよ。だって切っても焼いてもすぐ治る僕が、年をとるはずがない」","en":"“That can't be. Someone like me, who heals at once no matter how badly he's cut or burned, could never grow old.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"サーシェンカ白シャツ","displayName":"Sashenka (White Shirt)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r789","rowIndex":789,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そりゃ理屈だとそうかもしれないけど……」","en":"“Maybe that makes sense in theory, but...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r790","rowIndex":790,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「もしかしたらそれは、僕が望んだ姿だったのかもしれない。普通の人みたいに年をとって……なんでそんな気持ちになったんだかわからないけど……不思議だね」","en":"“Perhaps it was a form I wanted. Growing old like an ordinary person... I don’t know why I would have wanted that... Isn’t it strange?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"サーシェンカ白シャツ","displayName":"Sashenka (White Shirt)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r791","rowIndex":791,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=63>サーシェンカ</tips>はくすりと笑う。","en":"<tips=63>Sashenka</tips> gave a soft laugh.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r792","rowIndex":792,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「じゃあ……これから<tips=8>グレートホール</tips>に行って、何をするつもりなの？」","en":"“Then... what do you intend to do at the <tips=8>Great Hole</tips>?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r793","rowIndex":793,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　この質問には、むしろ彼の方が驚いた様子だ。","en":"If anything, he seemed surprised by the question.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r794","rowIndex":794,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「え……。きみは、声が聞こえないの？」","en":"“Huh...? You can’t hear the voice?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"サーシェンカ白シャツ","displayName":"Sashenka (White Shirt)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r795","rowIndex":795,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「こえ？」","en":"“Voice?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r796","rowIndex":796,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=8>グレートホール</tips>が呼んでいるんだ。帰って来いって。だって、僕らは<tips=8>グレートホール</tips>から生まれたんだからね。そこへ帰らなくちゃいけない」","en":"“The <tips=8>Great Hole</tips> is calling us. It's telling us to come back. We were born from the <tips=8>Great Hole</tips>, you see, so we have to return to it.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"サーシェンカ白シャツ","displayName":"Sashenka (White Shirt)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r797","rowIndex":797,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「聞こえない」","en":"“We can’t hear anything.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r798","rowIndex":798,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そう、そうか。でも、そのうち聞こえるようになる。そしたら気がつくよ。僕らは<tips=8>グレートホール</tips>からやって来たんだって」","en":"“Oh. I see. But eventually you’ll be able to hear it. Then you’ll realize that we came from the <tips=8>Great Hole</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"サーシェンカ白シャツ","displayName":"Sashenka (White Shirt)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r799","rowIndex":799,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=8>グレートホール</tips>はただの穴だよ。世界中で何回も調査されたけれど何もないってわかってる」","en":"“The <tips=8>Great Hole</tips> is just a hole. It’s been investigated again and again all over the world, and we know there’s nothing there.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r800","rowIndex":800,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そんなわけないじゃないか？　ただの穴が、世界中にこんなにたくさん生まれるわけがない。測定出来ないだけで、意味はちゃんとあるんだよ」","en":"“That can’t be true, can it? Ordinary holes couldn’t simply appear in such numbers all over the world. There is a meaning to them; we simply can’t measure it.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"サーシェンカ白シャツ","displayName":"Sashenka (White Shirt)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r801","rowIndex":801,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　にこやかに笑う<tips=63>サーシェンカ</tips>は正気とは思われない。","en":"<tips=63>Sashenka</tips> smiled pleasantly. To us, he did not appear sane.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r802","rowIndex":802,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「もしそうだったら、<tips=8>グレートホール</tips>で生まれたって言うのなら、前に話してくれた、小さい時にあなたを『<tips=63>サーシェンカ</tips>』と呼んでくれた人たちはなんなの？　家族なんでしょう？　あなたを生んだ人たちなんでしょう？」","en":"“If that’s true—if you were born in the <tips=8>Great Hole</tips>—then what about the people you told us of, the ones who called you <tips=63>‘Sashenka’</tips> when you were little? They were your family, weren’t they? They were the people who gave birth to you, weren’t they?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r803","rowIndex":803,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ああ、そうだね。確かに家族みたいな人たちだったけど……あれはきっとまやかしだったんだよ。嘘の家族だったんだ」","en":"“Oh. Yes. They certainly seemed like family... But that must have been an illusion. They were a false family.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"サーシェンカ白シャツ","displayName":"Sashenka (White Shirt)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r804","rowIndex":804,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=63>サーシェンカ</tips>は顔を曇らせる。","en":"<tips=63>Sashenka’s</tips> face clouded.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r805","rowIndex":805,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「だって本当の家族だったら、僕を助けてくれたはずでしょう？　でも、誰も来てくれなくて、ずっとつらかったんだ。ずっと一人で。……だから僕はひとりぼっちじゃなくなるために、色んな人を呼んだんだ。映画の登場人物や、本のなかから」","en":"“If they had truly been my family, they would have helped me, wouldn’t they? But nobody came, and I suffered for such a long time, always alone. So I called all kinds of people to me, people from films and books, so that I wouldn’t be alone anymore.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"サーシェンカ白シャツ","displayName":"Sashenka (White Shirt)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r806","rowIndex":806,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それが、あなたの『変身』？」","en":"“Is that your ‘transformation’?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r807","rowIndex":807,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「人はそう言うけど、その言い方は好きじゃないな。もっといいものなんだよ。……よその子がよくやるように、友だちの家のドアをあけて『おいで、ここで一緒に遊ぼう！』って言うんだ。それだけなんだよ」","en":"“That’s what people call it, but I don’t like the word. It’s something better. ...I open the door to a friend’s house, the way other children often do, and say, ‘Come on in! Let’s play together here!’ That’s all.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"サーシェンカ白シャツ","displayName":"Sashenka (White Shirt)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r808","rowIndex":808,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=63>サーシェンカ</tips>は肩をすくめた。","en":"<tips=63>Sashenka</tips> shrugged.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r809","rowIndex":809,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「僕はずうっとね、つらかったんだ。どこだかわからない白い場所で、痛い目に一杯あって、友だちもいなかった。本当に辛かったんだ。だからドアを開けたんだよ。そうしたら彼らは僕を居心地のいい部屋に入れてくれて……ああ、思い出した。みんな、僕のためにそうしてくれたんだ。もう何にも見たくなかったから、僕のかわりに外に出てくれて……わけのわからない所を連れ回されているような気がしていたけど、全部僕のためだったんだ」","en":"“I had been miserable for so long. In a white place—I didn’t know where—I was hurt over and over, and I had no friends. It was so painful. That was why I opened the door. Then they let me into a comfortable room... Oh, I remember. They did all of it for me. I didn’t want to see anything anymore, so they went outside in my place... I felt as though I were being taken around to places I didn’t understand, but it was all for me.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"サーシェンカ白シャツ","displayName":"Sashenka (White Shirt)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r810","rowIndex":810,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「白い場所って、研究所かなにか？」","en":"“Was that white place a laboratory or something?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r811","rowIndex":811,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうなのかな。すごくいやな場所だった……だから、助けに来てくれない人たちを恨んで……でも、その恨みは、たんに僕が勘違いしていだけなのかもしれないんだけど……」","en":"“Maybe. It was a horrible place... So I resented the people who never came to help me... but maybe I resented them only because I had misunderstood...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"サーシェンカ白シャツ","displayName":"Sashenka (White Shirt)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r812","rowIndex":812,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「だけど？」","en":"“But?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r813","rowIndex":813,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=63>サーシェンカ</tips>は困ったままこたえない。","en":"<tips=63>Sashenka</tips> looked troubled and did not answer.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r814","rowIndex":814,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「わかった。あなた、研究所を脱出したあと、殺したでしょ？　その家族を？」","en":"“I understand. After you escaped the laboratory, you killed them, didn’t you? Your family?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r815","rowIndex":815,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうだけど……でも、あれは家族じゃない。本当の家族じゃないんだ！」","en":"“Yes, but... But they weren’t my family. They weren’t my real family!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"サーシェンカ白シャツ","displayName":"Sashenka (White Shirt)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r816","rowIndex":816,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　怯えたような表情で、彼は否定する。","en":"He protested, looking frightened.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r817","rowIndex":817,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼も家族を殺したんだ。","en":"He too had killed his family.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r818","rowIndex":818,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そのときはじめて、なんで初めて会ったときから彼のことが気になって仕方なかったのか、理由がわかった。","en":"For the first time, we understood why we had been unable to stop thinking about him from the moment we met.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r819","rowIndex":819,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そう。でもきっとそれはあなたの本当の家族だよ。あなたは本当の家族を殺したんだよ」","en":"“Yes. But I'm sure they were your real family. You killed your real family.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r820","rowIndex":820,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……きみがそう言うのなら、そうかもしれない」","en":"“...If you say so, perhaps that’s true.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"サーシェンカ白シャツ","displayName":"Sashenka (White Shirt)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r821","rowIndex":821,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=63>サーシェンカ</tips>は溜息をつき、","en":"<tips=63>Sashenka</tips> sighed and said,","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r822","rowIndex":822,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「でもいいんだ。そうだとしても、<tips=8>グレートホール</tips>に帰ればそれで終わりなんだ。許してくれるんだ」","en":"“But that’s all right. Even if that’s true, once I go home to the <tips=8>Great Hole</tips>, it will all be over. It will forgive me.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"サーシェンカ白シャツ","displayName":"Sashenka (White Shirt)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r823","rowIndex":823,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「許してくれる？」","en":"“Forgive you?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r824","rowIndex":824,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうだよ。もう誰かにひどいことをしなくてもいいし、されなくてもいいんだ。そんな幸せなことがあるだろうか」","en":"“Yes. I won’t have to do terrible things to anyone anymore, and no one will do terrible things to me. Could anything be happier than that?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"サーシェンカ白シャツ","displayName":"Sashenka (White Shirt)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r825","rowIndex":825,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼はまた顔を輝かせて言う。","en":"His face brightened again as he spoke.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r826","rowIndex":826,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そう……」","en":"“I see...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r827","rowIndex":827,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「元気なさそうだね。元気を出して欲しいな。僕、みんなに明るい顔をしてほしいんだ。特に、きみのことは一番好きだから。きみが僕のことを好きじゃなくても、でも好きなんだ」","en":"“You don't look very cheerful. I wish you'd cheer up. I want everyone to smile. Especially you, because I like you best. Even if you don't like me, I still like you.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"サーシェンカ白シャツ","displayName":"Sashenka (White Shirt)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r828","rowIndex":828,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=64>アレクセイ</tips>とのやりとりも覚えているようなことを言う。","en":"He said something that made it seem he remembered the exchange with <tips=64>Alexei</tips> as well.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r829","rowIndex":829,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼は変わった。さっきも自分の意志で探偵の前で変身して見せたし、前とは別人みたいだ。でも彼はそんな自分の変化に気がついていない。","en":"He had changed. Earlier, he had even transformed before the detective of his own volition, and now he seemed like a different person. Yet he himself was unaware of the change.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r830","rowIndex":830,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あっ、待ってて。ちょっとおしっこ行ってくる」","en":"“Oh, wait here. I need to pee.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"サーシェンカ白シャツ","displayName":"Sashenka (White Shirt)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r831","rowIndex":831,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼はそう言うと、脇の茂みをかき分けていった。","en":"With that, he pushed his way into the undergrowth beside the road.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r832","rowIndex":832,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ぼんやり路上で待つ。うつむくと、朽ちたアスファルトの上に曇り空がつくる自分の薄い影が落ちている。","en":"We waited in a daze. When we lowered our gaze, the cloudy sky cast our pale shadow upon the decaying asphalt.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r833","rowIndex":833,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　少し肌寒い。","en":"It felt a little chilly.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r834","rowIndex":834,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　こんなところで一体、何をしているんだろう？","en":"What exactly were we doing in a place like this?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r835","rowIndex":835,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　気づいたら先ほどの明るい気持ちが失われ、得体のしれない不安が心を支配している。","en":"Before we knew it, that bright feeling had faded, and an unease we could not identify had taken possession of our heart.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r836","rowIndex":836,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ねえ見てっ！」","en":"“Look what I found!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"サーシェンカ白シャツ","displayName":"Sashenka (White Shirt)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r837","rowIndex":837,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　帰って来た<tips=63>サーシェンカ</tips>は、右手に何か持っている。","en":"<tips=63>Sashenka</tips> returned holding something in his right hand.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r838","rowIndex":838,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「これ、ブローチなんだ。ほらっ」","en":"“It’s a brooch. See?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"サーシェンカ白シャツ","displayName":"Sashenka (White Shirt)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r839","rowIndex":839,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　嬉しそうに差し出したのは、確かにブローチで、花のかたちをしていた。","en":"He held it out happily. It was indeed a brooch, shaped like a flower.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r840","rowIndex":840,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ちょっと汚れてるけど、錆びてないんだ。だからこう、よく拭けば……」","en":"“It’s a little dirty, but it hasn’t rusted. If I give it a good wipe...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"サーシェンカ白シャツ","displayName":"Sashenka (White Shirt)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r841","rowIndex":841,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼は服の裾でごしごしと土汚れを落とすと、こちらにそれを差し出す。","en":"He scrubbed away the dirt with the hem of his clothes, then offered it to us.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r842","rowIndex":842,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ほら、綺麗になった。つけてみてよ。似合うと思うよ」","en":"“There, it's clean now. Try it on. I think it'll look good on you.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"サーシェンカ白シャツ","displayName":"Sashenka (White Shirt)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r843","rowIndex":843,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「これ、薔薇だね」","en":"“It’s a rose.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r844","rowIndex":844,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうだね。僕、薔薇が世界で一番好きで……あっ、そういえばきみは薔薇が大嫌いなんだっけ？」","en":"“It is. I love roses more than anything in the world... Oh, that’s right. You hate roses, don’t you?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"サーシェンカ白シャツ","displayName":"Sashenka (White Shirt)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r845","rowIndex":845,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　慌てて手を引っ込めようとする彼に、手を差し出す。","en":"As he hurriedly started to pull his hand back, we extended ours.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r846","rowIndex":846,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ううん、平気。もう好きになったみたい」","en":"“No. It’s all right. I think I like them now.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r847","rowIndex":847,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そうして彼から受け取った薔薇のブローチを、服をつまんで心臓の上辺りにつけた。","en":"We accepted the rose brooch from him, pinched the fabric of our clothes, and fastened it over our heart.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r848","rowIndex":848,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「うん、とても似合うよ」","en":"“Yes. It looks wonderful on you.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"サーシェンカ白シャツ","displayName":"Sashenka (White Shirt)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r849","rowIndex":849,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=63>サーシェンカ</tips>は朗らかに笑った。","en":"<tips=63>Sashenka</tips> smiled brightly.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r850","rowIndex":850,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　兄の鞄のなかで腐っていた薔薇を思い出す。あの時兄も、私たちにこんな風に薔薇を渡したかったんだろう。","en":"We remembered the rose that had rotted inside our brother’s bag. He too must have wanted to give it to us like this.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r851","rowIndex":851,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　狂った頭で私たちへのプレゼントと薔薇の花を大事に抱え、ただ喜ばせたくて追いかけて来てくれたんだ。","en":"Even with his mind in disarray, he had carefully carried the presents he had brought for us and the rose, following after us simply because he wanted to make us happy.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r852","rowIndex":852,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　あの時どうして私たちは兄のことを気がつかなかったんだろう？　ほんのちょっと見た目が思っていたのと違うくらいで、どうしてその愛に気づいてあげられなかったんだろう？　ちっちゃいときから家族と引き離されて特別なところに預けられても、ちっとも私たち家族を恨んだりしないで、いつも私たちを楽しませるためにいろんなものを送ってくれたのに。","en":"Why hadn't we realized it was our brother back then? Just because he looked a little different from what we had imagined, why couldn't we see how much he loved us? He had been taken from his family when he was tiny and placed somewhere special, yet he had never resented us. He had always sent us all sorts of things just to make us happy.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r853","rowIndex":853,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　お兄ちゃんの手から、あの薔薇を受け取りたかった。そしたらきっと、みんなの人生が全然違う素敵なものになっていたはずだ。","en":"We had wanted to take that rose from our brother's own hand. If only we had, all our lives would surely have turned out completely different—something wonderful.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r854","rowIndex":854,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「大丈夫？」","en":"“Are you all right?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"サーシェンカ白シャツ","displayName":"Sashenka (White Shirt)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r855","rowIndex":855,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=63>サーシェンカ</tips>が私を心配そうに見ている。","en":"<tips=63>Sashenka</tips> watched me with concern.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r856","rowIndex":856,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なにが……」","en":"“What do you...?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r857","rowIndex":857,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　言いかけた時に風が吹いて、私は気がついた。","en":"As I began to speak, a gust of wind touched my face, and I realized what was happening.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r858","rowIndex":858,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　空気がなでるとひんやりと頬が冷え、触れると指の先が濡れる。私の目からは静かに涙が流れ、顔中を濡らしていた。","en":"The breeze chilled my cheeks as it brushed them. When I touched my face, my fingertips came away wet. Tears were streaming silently from my eyes, soaking my face.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r859","rowIndex":859,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なんでもない……」","en":"“It’s nothing...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r860","rowIndex":860,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　言った言葉はその後すぐに嘘になってしまう。","en":"The words became a lie almost as soon as I spoke them.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r861","rowIndex":861,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は自分をどうすることもできなかった。","en":"I could do nothing to control myself.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r862","rowIndex":862,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　肩が震え、嗚咽が漏れる。顔もきっとしわくちゃになっている。","en":"My shoulders shook, and sobs escaped me. My face must have been all crumpled up.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r863","rowIndex":863,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　見せたくなくて、両手で顔を隠した。でもそうするとますます子供っぽい泣き姿になってしまう。","en":"I hid my face in both hands, not wanting him to see. But that only made me look even more like a crying child.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r864","rowIndex":864,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私はそこでしばらく泣き、そうすると少し気持ちが軽くなったので、また歩きはじめた。","en":"I cried there for some time. Once the tears had made me feel a little lighter, I began walking again.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r865","rowIndex":865,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　歩きながら、ちらりと胸の上で揺れる薔薇のブローチを見る。もういやな気持ちはしないし、悲しくもない。私が本当に見たくなくて、目をそらしたかったものは、薔薇ではなかったのだともうわかっている。","en":"As I walked, I glanced at the rose brooch swaying on my chest. It no longer made me feel disgust or sorrow. I understood now that the thing I truly could not bear to see, the thing from which I had wanted to turn away, had never been the rose.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r866","rowIndex":866,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼はそれからとめどもなく喋り続け、そして私たちの前にそれは姿を現した。","en":"He continued talking without end. Then it appeared before us.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r867","rowIndex":867,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=8>グレートホール</tips>、と、どこで誰が最初に呼び始めたのか知らない。その正体不明の巨大な穴は学校の運動場よりも広く、そして覗き込むと底が真っ暗で何も見えないほど深い。","en":"We did not know who had first called it the <tips=8>Great Hole</tips>, or where. The enormous pit of unknown nature was wider than a school athletic field and so deep that looking inside revealed only darkness, never the bottom.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r868","rowIndex":868,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼がその縁に立つと、前から風が吹いてその金色の髪の毛と服をそよがせた。","en":"When Sashenka stood at its edge, a wind from ahead stirred his golden hair and clothes.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r869","rowIndex":869,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　汚染がひどくて防護服なしにはくることなど許されないような場所だけれど、こうしていても何も感じない。","en":"The contamination was supposedly so severe that no one could come here without protective clothing. Yet standing there, we felt nothing.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r870","rowIndex":870,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ああ、きこえる……きみはまだ聞こえないのかい？　そんなはずはないよね。この、優しくて美しい声を……」","en":"“Ah, I can hear it... Can you still not hear it? That can’t be. This gentle, beautiful voice...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r871","rowIndex":871,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=63>サーシェンカ</tips>はうっとりとした声で呟く。","en":"<tips=63>Sashenka</tips> murmured in rapture.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r872","rowIndex":872,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「何も聞こえない。少し頭が痛くて、耳鳴りがするだけ……。ねえ<tips=63>サーシェンカ</tips>、やっぱり、やめよう？」","en":"“I can't hear anything. My head just hurts a little, and my ears are ringing... <tips=63>Sashenka</tips>, let's not do this after all. Please?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r873","rowIndex":873,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私の言葉に彼は振り向き、怪訝な顔をする。","en":"At my words, he turned with a puzzled expression.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r874","rowIndex":874,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そのへんてこな穴には何もない。私たちにはどこにも戻る場所なんかないの。全てを許してくれる場所なんかない。私たちは何もないところからやって来て、何もないところに行くんだよ。だから私たちは優しい場所なんてものは求めないで生き延びて、動けなくなるまで歩かなきゃいけないの」","en":"“There's nothing in that strange hole. We have nowhere to return to. There is no place that will forgive us for everything. We came from nothing, and we're going into nothing. So we have to survive without searching for some gentle place. We have to keep walking until we can't move anymore.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r875","rowIndex":875,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私はそして胸のブローチをぎゅっと握った。","en":"I clutched the brooch on my chest.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r876","rowIndex":876,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=63>サーシェンカ</tips>、あなたのことは私が許すわ。おかしくなっても、私が守ってあげる。だから一緒に戻ろう。……街へ」","en":"“<tips=63>Sashenka</tips>, I forgive you. Even if you lose your mind, I’ll protect you. So let’s go back together. ...To the city.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r877","rowIndex":877,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「街へ……」","en":"“The city...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"サーシェンカ白シャツ","displayName":"Sashenka (White Shirt)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r878","rowIndex":878,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼は顔をかすかに歪め、","en":"His face contorted slightly as he said,","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r879","rowIndex":879,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「もう街はいやなんだ。どこの街も……」","en":"“I've had enough of cities. Every last one of them...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"サーシェンカ白シャツ","displayName":"Sashenka (White Shirt)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r880","rowIndex":880,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「街じゃなくてもいい。どこか人気のない山のなかでも……」","en":"“It doesn’t have to be a city. We can go somewhere deserted in the mountains...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r881","rowIndex":881,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「もういいんだ。疲れちゃったんだよ」","en":"“That's enough. I'm tired of it all.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"サーシェンカ白シャツ","displayName":"Sashenka (White Shirt)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r882","rowIndex":882,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼は微笑する。","en":"He smiled.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r883","rowIndex":883,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「みんな僕のことを悪魔のようにひどいやつだと思うだろうし、その通りではあるんだけど、でもこれでも頑張ったんだ。僕の力があれば、本当は世の中にとってもっと恐ろしいことや、危険なことだって出来たんだよ。僕には、全部滅茶苦茶にしたいって気持ちだってあったんだ。それを、なんとかこの程度で抑えたんだ。この世界には好きなものもあったから」","en":"“Everyone must think I’m as terrible as a devil, and they’re right. But even so, I tried very hard. With my power, I could have done far more terrible and dangerous things to the world. Part of me wanted to ruin everything. The only reason I managed to restrain myself as much as I did was that there were things in this world I loved.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"サーシェンカ白シャツ","displayName":"Sashenka (White Shirt)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r884","rowIndex":884,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=63>サーシェンカ</tips>、あなた……」","en":"“<tips=63>Sashenka</tips>, you...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r885","rowIndex":885,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「でもありがとう。世界中で、僕のことを全部知って、それでも許してくれたのはきみと……あともう一人だけだな。彼ももうずっと昔に死んじゃったけど……でもとっても素敵な人だったんだ。彼がしようとしたことは、間違っていたのかなあ」","en":"“But thank you. In the whole world, only you and one other person knew everything about me and forgave me anyway. He died a very long time ago... but he was a truly wonderful person. I wonder whether what he tried to do was wrong.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"サーシェンカ白シャツ","displayName":"Sashenka (White Shirt)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r886","rowIndex":886,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼はまた<tips=8>グレートホール</tips>のほうを向いて、私には背を見せる。","en":"He turned toward the <tips=8>Great Hole</tips> again, showing me his back.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r887","rowIndex":887,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「僕は帰るよ。きみはひとりで残るといい」","en":"“I’m going home. You should stay here by yourself.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"サーシェンカ白シャツ","displayName":"Sashenka (White Shirt)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r888","rowIndex":888,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして穴に向かって歩きはじめた彼の服の裾を、私は手を伸ばしてぎゅっと掴んだ。","en":"He began walking toward the pit. I reached out and clutched the hem of his clothes.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r889","rowIndex":889,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「待って！」","en":"“Wait!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r890","rowIndex":890,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私の声は涙声になっている。","en":"My voice broke with tears.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r891","rowIndex":891,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼は振り返らない。どんな表情をしているのかわからない。","en":"He did not look back. I could not see his expression.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r892","rowIndex":892,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼の前に行こうとする力が緩んだ。足を止めて、考え直してくれたんじゃないかと思って彼を見る。","en":"The pull against my hand weakened. I looked at him, hoping he had stopped to reconsider.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r893","rowIndex":893,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼は動かない。","en":"He stood motionless.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r894","rowIndex":894,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そしてみるみるうちにそのうなじが、金色の髪の毛が、茶色く固まってゆき、その表面がポロポロと剥がれ落ちる。","en":"Before my eyes, the nape of his neck and his golden hair hardened and turned brown, their surfaces crumbling away in fragments.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r895","rowIndex":895,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　土だ。","en":"It was earth.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r896","rowIndex":896,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　全身が、髪の毛も、産毛の一本一本まで、土に変化していって、崩れてしまっているんだ。","en":"His entire body—his hair, even every fine hair on his skin—was turning to earth and collapsing.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r897","rowIndex":897,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=63>サーシェンカ</tips>！」","en":"“<tips=63>Sashenka</tips>!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r898","rowIndex":898,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼は呼びかけにこたえない。","en":"He did not answer.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r899","rowIndex":899,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして私に考える時間も与えずに、彼の全ては土塊になって崩れ落ち、その場にうずたかい山となって遺された。","en":"Before I had time to think, his entire body had become clods of earth and collapsed into a great mound where he had stood.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r900","rowIndex":900,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は彼の服を握ったままだった。","en":"I still gripped his clothes.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r901","rowIndex":901,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　埃で汚れた服の中身はもうすでに地面の上に流れてしまってなくなっている。","en":"The dust-stained clothes were already empty. What had been inside them had spilled out over the ground, leaving nothing behind.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r902","rowIndex":902,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どうして……」","en":"“Why...?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r903","rowIndex":903,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　何が起こったのか理解が出来ない。","en":"I could not understand what had happened.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r904","rowIndex":904,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　混乱したまま服を握る自分の手を見ると、その指先からだんだん茶色くかわってゆくのが見て取れた。","en":"Still confused, I looked at the hand clutching his clothes and saw it slowly turning brown from the fingertips upward.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r905","rowIndex":905,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして茶色い土になって、指が崩れ去ると、もう掴めなくなった彼の服がひらりと宙に舞う。","en":"Then my fingers turned to brown earth and crumbled away, and the clothes I could no longer hold fluttered into the air.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r906","rowIndex":906,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私の目の前で、手のひらが崩れ落ち、手首が崩れる。痛みは何も感じない。なんの感覚もない。","en":"Before my eyes, my palm crumbled, then my wrist. I felt no pain. I felt nothing at all.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r907","rowIndex":907,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　このまま<tips=63>サーシェンカ</tips>のように全身が崩れてゆくのかと思ったけれど、肘の下辺りでそれは止まった。穴に向かって伸ばした部分だけが崩れ落ちたんだ。","en":"I thought my whole body would crumble like <tips=63>Sashenka’s</tips>, but the change stopped just below the elbow. Only the part I had stretched toward the hole had crumbled away.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r908","rowIndex":908,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　何が起きているのかわからないけど、とにかく、このままここにいたら危険だ。","en":"I did not understand what was happening, but in any case, it was dangerous to remain there.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r909","rowIndex":909,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私はそこを立ち去る間際、そっと<tips=8>グレートホール</tips>の方を振り返る。","en":"As I was about to leave, I cast one last glance back at the <tips=8>Great Hole</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r910","rowIndex":910,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　すると、服がゆっくりと舞いながら闇の奥底へ落ちてゆくのが見えた。","en":"Then I saw his clothes drifting slowly through the air and falling into the depths of the darkness.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r911","rowIndex":911,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　日が暮れる頃、<tips=50>路地邦昭</tips>から報告があった。","en":"Around nightfall, I received a report from <tips=50>Kuniaki Roji</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r912","rowIndex":912,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=8>グレートホール</tips>のすぐ側に、土にまみれた<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>の靴やズボンが見つかったとのこと。","en":"Right beside the <tips=8>Great Hole</tips>, <tips=20>Koschei’s</tips> shoes and trousers were reportedly found caked with earth.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r913","rowIndex":913,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その現場近くの足跡などから、同行していたと思われる<tips=86>灰上姉妹</tips>の片割れは、そこから引き返し別の場所へ逃走したと思われる。","en":"Footprints and other traces near the site suggested that one of the <tips=86>Haigami sisters</tips> had accompanied him, then turned back and fled elsewhere.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r914","rowIndex":914,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"『捜査網を広げているが、今のところ灰上が見つかったという報告はない』","en":"‘The search has been expanded, but so far, no one has reported finding Haigami.’","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r915","rowIndex":915,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　仇敵を自分の手で始末出来なかったわりには電話口の<tips=50>路地</tips>の声は思いのほかに落ち着いている。","en":"For a man who had failed to dispose of his enemy with his own hands, <tips=50>Roji’s</tips> voice over the phone was surprisingly calm.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r916","rowIndex":916,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>はどこへ行ったと警察は考えていますか？」","en":"“Where do the police believe <tips=20>Koschei</tips> went?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r917","rowIndex":917,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"『可能性はいくつか考えている。服を脱いで<tips=8>グレートホール</tips>に身を投げたか。それとも、足跡が一つしかないのは何かのカモフラージュで、灰上とまだ同行しているか。いずれにしろ、服を脱いで土まみれにして残していった理由はわからん』","en":"‘They’re considering several possibilities. Perhaps he took off his clothes and threw himself into the <tips=8>Great Hole</tips>. Or perhaps the single set of footprints is some kind of deception, and he’s still traveling with Haigami. Either way, no one understands why he would strip, cover the clothes in earth, and leave them behind.’","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r918","rowIndex":918,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうですか。じゃあ、まだ捜査は継続というわけですか」","en":"“I see. So the investigation is still ongoing?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r919","rowIndex":919,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"『そのようだ。土と衣服の解析をこれから行うそうだが、意味のあるデータがとれるかどうか……』","en":"‘Apparently. They’re going to analyze the earth and clothing, but whether that will produce anything meaningful...’","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r920","rowIndex":920,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ふふ、警察ってのも大変な仕事ですね。あんな、得体の知れないサイキックを追跡して逮捕しなくちゃいけないなんて」","en":"“Heh. The police have it rough, don't they? Having to hunt down and arrest a psychic no one can make head or tail of.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r921","rowIndex":921,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"『ずいぶん余裕があるじゃないか。<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>が姿を消して、命を狙いに来るとは考えないのか？　因縁のある相手だろう？』","en":"‘You sound remarkably relaxed. Have you considered that <tips=20>Koschei</tips> may have vanished so he can come for your life? The two of you have a history.’","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r922","rowIndex":922,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「望むところです。この<tips=81>龍頭</tips>の首が取れると思うなら、やってみればいい」","en":"“I would welcome the attempt. If he believes he can take the <tips=81>Longtou’s</tips> head, let him try.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r923","rowIndex":923,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"『ふん、自信がありそうだな。あんたがそう言うなら、策があるんだろう。なんといっても宿敵<tips=21>八龍会</tips>の爺さんたちを傘下に収め、父親以上の勢力を築こうとしている<tips=81>龍頭</tips>さまだからな。実際大したもんだよ。<tips=27>廖志明</tips>を追放し、<tips=76>旧義勝</tips>の反対勢力を黙らせ、<tips=35>ジョゼ・フェルナンデス</tips>の離脱もものともせず、ここまでやって来たんだ』","en":"‘Hmph. You sound confident. If you say so, you must have a plan. You are the great <tips=81>Longtou</tips> who has brought the old men of your archenemy, the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips>, under your command and is building power beyond even your father’s, after all. It truly is impressive. You drove out <tips=27>Liao Chi-ming</tips>, silenced the opposition within the former <tips=76>Yisheng</tips>, and made it this far undeterred even by <tips=35>José Fernandes’s</tips> departure.’","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r924","rowIndex":924,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「大変な賛辞をいただいて光栄ですが、かつて孤高の探偵と呼ばれ、けしてギャングに従うことがなかった<tips=50>路地邦昭</tips>の言葉とは思えませんね」","en":"“I’m honored by such high praise, but those hardly sound like the words of <tips=50>Kuniaki Roji</tips>, once called the lone detective, who never submitted to any gang.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r925","rowIndex":925,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"『素直に褒めているのさ。あんたとはもうこうして話すことはないだろうからね。少し遠くへ行くのさ』","en":"‘I mean every word. You and I probably won’t speak like this again. I’m going somewhere far away.’","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r926","rowIndex":926,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「遠くへ？」","en":"“Far away?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r927","rowIndex":927,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"『ああ、捜査に本庁が乗り出してきたし、おれの仕事はないからね。それに、もう疲れたのさ。このゴミゴミとした街で暮らすのは』","en":"‘Yes. Headquarters has taken over the investigation, so there's no work left for me. Besides, I'm tired of living in this cramped, cluttered city.’","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r928","rowIndex":928,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして<tips=50>路地</tips>は溜息をつく。","en":"<tips=50>Roji</tips> sighed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r929","rowIndex":929,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それは残念だ。あなたをスカウトしたかったんですがね」","en":"“That is unfortunate. I had hoped to recruit you.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r930","rowIndex":930,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕が言うと、<tips=50>路地</tips>は電話の向こうでおかしそうに笑う。","en":"When I said this, <tips=50>Roji</tips> laughed at the other end of the call.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r931","rowIndex":931,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「本気ですよ。あなたほどのサイキックは他にいない。それに、今は落ちぶれたと言え、かつて街のために働いた少年探偵は、まだ多くの住民に愛されている。あなたはさっき<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>の地位は盤石と言いましたが、この先もまだまだ血なまぐさいことは起きるでしょう。そのときあなたがいれば色んな事が簡単に解決出来る。……いまから考えてみてくれませんか？　十分な条件を用意します」","en":"“I'm serious. There is no other psychic like you. You may have fallen on hard times, but the boy detective who once served this city is still loved by many of its people. You said <tips=7>YS's</tips> position was secure, but there will be plenty more bloodshed ahead. With you here, all sorts of problems could be resolved with ease. ...Won't you give it some thought? I'll make it worth your while.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r932","rowIndex":932,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"『やめておこう。ギャングは嫌いなんでね』","en":"‘I’ll pass. I don’t like gangs.’","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r933","rowIndex":933,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「嫌いでも、やってみたら案外悪くないかもしれません」","en":"“You may dislike them, but if you tried it, you might find it wasn’t so bad.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r934","rowIndex":934,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"『ふふ、そんなことは有り得ないな』","en":"‘Heh. There’s no chance of that.’","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r935","rowIndex":935,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「サイキックがこの街の外に出てもいいことはありませんよ」","en":"“There's nothing good waiting for a psychic outside this city.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r936","rowIndex":936,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"『わかってるさ。……じゃ、そういうことで』","en":"‘I know. ...Well, that’s all, then.’","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r937","rowIndex":937,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして通話は切れた。","en":"The call ended.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r938","rowIndex":938,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　電話越しだが、<tips=50>路地</tips>の印象が以前と少し違っているように思えた。","en":"Even over the phone, <tips=50>Roji</tips> seemed slightly different from before.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r939","rowIndex":939,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　前にここで会った時はもっと暗く、怒りや憎悪が言葉の端々に表れていた。でも今はなにも感じなかった。<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>の生死が定かでないこの段階で、街を離れると決めているのも以前だったら考えにくい。","en":"When we last met here, he had seemed much darker, with anger and hatred showing in every word. But now I sensed none of it. The man he had been before could scarcely have decided to leave the city while it remained uncertain whether <tips=20>Koschei</tips> was alive or dead.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r940","rowIndex":940,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　何かあったのかもしれない。","en":"Something might have happened.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r941","rowIndex":941,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　でも、それは今の僕には関係がないことだ。","en":"But that no longer concerned me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r942","rowIndex":942,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=12>灰上江梨子</tips>は逃げたそうです」","en":"“I hear <tips=12>Eriko Haigami</tips> escaped.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r943","rowIndex":943,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　目の前でじっと僕を見ている男にそう言った。","en":"I said this to the man standing before me, staring intently at me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r944","rowIndex":944,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ブラシのかかった埃一つ付着していないスーツを着て、顔にはそれと不釣り合いな無精髭をはやしたその男は<tips=13>ヘドロ団地</tips>のリーダー、<tips=14>深沢</tips>であった。","en":"He wore a meticulously kept suit without a speck of dust, while an incongruous growth of stubble covered his face. This was <tips=14>Fukazawa</tips>, leader of the <tips=13>Sludge Housing Complex</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r945","rowIndex":945,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それは良かった」","en":"“That’s good.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"深沢聡","displayName":"Satoshi Fukazawa","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r946","rowIndex":946,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼はほっと安堵の溜息をつく。","en":"He let out a sigh of relief.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r947","rowIndex":947,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「もしあの子が死んでいたら、我々は警察を許さなかったろう」","en":"“If that girl had died, we would never have forgiven the police.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"深沢聡","displayName":"Satoshi Fukazawa","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r948","rowIndex":948,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　不死身の身体を得た<tips=12>江梨子</tips>が簡単に死ぬとは思えないが、そのことは言わなかった。","en":"I doubted that <tips=12>Eriko</tips>, having gained an immortal body, would die easily. I did not say so.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r949","rowIndex":949,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=13>ヘドロ団地</tips>と街のギャングは長年お互いには干渉しないという立場をとっていた。","en":"For many years, the <tips=13>Sludge Housing Complex</tips> and the city’s gangs had maintained a position of mutual noninterference.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r950","rowIndex":950,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それが、こうしてリーダー自らこの<tips=41>グランドタワー</tips>を訪ねるというのはよっぽどのことだ。","en":"For its leader to visit the <tips=41>Grand Tower</tips> in person, as he had today, required extraordinary circumstances.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r951","rowIndex":951,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その理由が、たった一人の少女について話をするためというのは、ほとんど考えられない事態といっていい。","en":"That he had come merely to discuss one girl could almost be called inconceivable.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r952","rowIndex":952,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そう、彼は<tips=12>灰上江梨子</tips>の保護を求めるために単身ここに訪れたのだ。","en":"Yet that was exactly why he had arrived alone: to request protection for <tips=12>Eriko Haigami</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r953","rowIndex":953,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それじゃあ、約束通り、この先<tips=12>江梨子</tips>を見つけたらこちらに連絡して貰おう。相応の謝礼は払う」","en":"“Then, as promised, if you find <tips=12>Eriko</tips>, let us know. You'll be suitably rewarded.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"深沢聡","displayName":"Satoshi Fukazawa","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r954","rowIndex":954,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「わかりました。手配しておきましょう」","en":"“Understood. We’ll make the arrangements.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r955","rowIndex":955,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「死んだ<tips=11>璃映子</tips>の遺体の行き先も、可能ならば調べてくれ。<tips=47>解放軍</tips>の残党を排除するならば、私たちも協力する」","en":"“If possible, find out where the body of <tips=11>Rieko</tips> was taken as well. If you intend to eliminate the remnants of the <tips=47>Liberation Army</tips>, we will help.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"深沢聡","displayName":"Satoshi Fukazawa","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r956","rowIndex":956,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……団地の<tips=14>深沢</tips>と言えば豺狼のごとく冷酷で利害にこだわるという評判ですが、意外ですね」","en":"“...<tips=14>Fukazawa</tips> of the housing complex is said to be as ruthless as a jackal and concerned with nothing but his own interests. This is unexpected.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r957","rowIndex":957,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　なぜそこまで<tips=86>双子</tips>にこだわるのか。彼にしてみれば、拾って育てた知人の娘たちというだけじゃないか。","en":"Why did he care so deeply about the <tips=86>twins</tips>? To him, they were merely an acquaintance’s daughters whom he had taken in and raised.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r958","rowIndex":958,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　確かに、<tips=86>双子</tips>に対してこの<tips=14>深沢</tips>が甘いというのは子供の頃から聞いてはいたが。","en":"Admittedly, I had heard since childhood that <tips=14>Fukazawa</tips> was soft on the <tips=86>twins</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r959","rowIndex":959,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=12>江梨子</tips>のことで協力するだけで、彼らの協力が得られるというのは僕としては大いに結構な話だけれど、しかしにわかには信じられないという思いもあった。","en":"The prospect of securing their cooperation merely by helping with <tips=12>Eriko</tips> suited me perfectly, but part of me still found it difficult to believe.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r960","rowIndex":960,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=14>深沢</tips>は片頬だけつり上げて笑い、","en":"<tips=14>Fukazawa</tips> raised one corner of his mouth in a smile and said,","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r961","rowIndex":961,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「豺狼だって群れの仲間は大切にするさ。あの<tips=86>双子</tips>は仲間だ。しかも特別なんだよ。……これは私の独断ではなく、団地全員の一致した見解だ。だから、安心してくれて構わない。みな、<tips=47>解放軍</tips>の最後の一人が息絶えるまで戦うだろう」","en":"“Even jackals cherish the members of their pack. Those <tips=86>twins</tips> are members of our pack, and they’re special. ...This isn’t my decision alone; everyone in the housing complex shares this view. So you can rest easy. They’ll all fight until the last member of the <tips=47>Liberation Army</tips> draws their final breath.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"深沢聡","displayName":"Satoshi Fukazawa","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r962","rowIndex":962,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……そうですか」","en":"“...I see.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r963","rowIndex":963,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「信用出来ないか？　そうだろうな。理屈にはあわない。が、事実なんだ」","en":"“You don’t trust me? Naturally. It makes no logical sense, but it’s the truth.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"深沢聡","displayName":"Satoshi Fukazawa","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r964","rowIndex":964,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いや、信じますよ。世の中にはそういう感情で物事が動くこともあると、最近は私も知りましてね」","en":"“No, I believe you. I've learned recently that feelings like that can set things in motion.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r965","rowIndex":965,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「むしろ、世の中が大きく動くときは、いつだって人の心がからんでいるものさ」","en":"“If anything, whenever the world undergoes a great change, the human heart is always involved.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"深沢聡","displayName":"Satoshi Fukazawa","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r966","rowIndex":966,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうかもしれませんね」","en":"“Perhaps so.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r967","rowIndex":967,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「理屈にあうあわないじゃない。これが我々の人間としての誇りなんだよ」","en":"“It isn’t a matter of whether it makes sense. This is our pride as human beings.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"深沢聡","displayName":"Satoshi Fukazawa","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r968","rowIndex":968,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=14>深沢</tips>は胸を張って薄笑いを浮かべると、そのまま部屋を去っていった。","en":"<tips=14>Fukazawa</tips> puffed out his chest and smiled thinly, then left the room.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r969","rowIndex":969,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「アイツ、信用出来るものなんですかね？　何か裏があるんじゃないですか？」","en":"“Can we trust that man? Isn’t he planning something?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"壬生屋タカシ","displayName":"Takashi Mibuya","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r970","rowIndex":970,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　完全に<tips=14>深沢</tips>が立てる物音が聞こえなくなってから、ずっと黙っていた<tips=33>壬生屋タカシ</tips>がしかめっつらで呟いた。","en":"Only after every sound of <tips=14>Fukazawa</tips> had faded did <tips=33>Takashi Mibuya</tips>, silent until then, mutter with a scowl.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r971","rowIndex":971,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「団地の<tips=14>深沢</tips>は一度口にした言葉は守ると評判だ。たとえ本心じゃなかったとしても、<tips=47>解放軍</tips>を根絶やしにするまで付き合ってくれるというのは間違いないだろう。その後のことは知らないがね」","en":"“<tips=14>Fukazawa</tips> of the housing complex has a reputation for keeping his word once he gives it. Even if he didn't mean what he said, we can count on his cooperation until the <tips=47>Liberation Army</tips> has been eradicated. What happens after that, I couldn't say.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r972","rowIndex":972,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なんだか気持ち悪い連中ですな。私には理解出来ない」","en":"“There’s something disturbing about those people. I can’t understand them.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"壬生屋タカシ","displayName":"Takashi Mibuya","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r973","rowIndex":973,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=33>壬生屋</tips>は肩をすくめて溜息をつく。僕が肯定も否定もせず黙っていると、彼は居心地が悪くなったようで、何か仕事を思い出したなどと言い訳を口にしてその場を辞した。","en":"<tips=33>Mibuya</tips> shrugged and sighed. When I remained silent, neither agreeing nor disagreeing, he appeared uncomfortable, made an excuse about remembering some work, and withdrew.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r974","rowIndex":974,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=30>レイレイ</tips>と<tips=40>黄姉妹</tips>にも下がらせ、一人になると僕は自分の携帯電話を見た。","en":"I sent <tips=30>Leilei</tips> and the <tips=40>Wong sisters</tips> away as well. Alone, I looked at my phone.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r975","rowIndex":975,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=54>汐健慈朗</tips>からのメールが来ている。","en":"An email had arrived from <tips=54>Kenjiro Shio</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r976","rowIndex":976,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そこには、<tips=12>灰上江梨子</tips>から受け取った<tips=55>汐松子</tips>の細胞が、順調に再生をはじめていることが具体的な数字のデータ付きで説明されていた。文章は<tips=54>汐さん</tips>特有の簡素で素っ気ないものだ。","en":"In it, he explained—with precise numerical data—that the <tips=55>Matsuko Shio</tips> cells he had received from <tips=12>Eriko Haigami</tips> had begun regenerating successfully. The prose was characteristically terse and curt for <tips=54>Mr. Shio</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r977","rowIndex":977,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=12>江梨子</tips>が帰った後、僕自身の手でその細胞が<tips=55>汐松子</tips>本人のものであることを確認し、あとの処理を<tips=54>汐さん</tips>に任せて引き上げた。","en":"After <tips=12>Eriko</tips> left, I had personally confirmed that the cells belonged to <tips=55>Matsuko Shio</tips>, entrusted the remaining work to <tips=54>Mr. Shio</tips>, and departed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r978","rowIndex":978,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=54>汐さん</tips>は驚いていたが、事情を細かく聞き出そうとはせず、作業を引き受けてくれると約束した。","en":"<tips=54>Mr. Shio</tips> had been surprised, but did not press me for the circumstances. He promised to undertake the work.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r979","rowIndex":979,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　もしかつて<tips=18>ローズ・クラブ</tips>のゴミ捨て場から拾って来た時と同じように推移するならば、<tips=55>松子</tips>は半年もしないで人の体を取り戻し、培養ケースから出ることが出来るだろう。","en":"If things followed the same course as when we brought her back from the <tips=18>Rose Club's</tips> dumping ground, <tips=55>Matsuko</tips> would regain a human body and emerge from the culture vessel in less than six months.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r980","rowIndex":980,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕はそのために必要な費用を全て受け持つことを約束するメールを<tips=54>汐さん</tips>に送った。","en":"I sent <tips=54>Mr. Shio</tips> an email promising to cover all the necessary expenses.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r981","rowIndex":981,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それから少し考えて、新しく成長してゆく<tips=55>松子</tips>には過去のことを何も教えないよう伝えるメールを書いた。","en":"After thinking for a while, I wrote another message instructing him to tell <tips=55>Matsuko</tips> nothing of her past as she grew anew.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r982","rowIndex":982,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　きっと今の<tips=55>松子</tips>は記憶の全てを失っている。それならば、かつて体験したおぞましいさまざまな出来事を知らせる必要はない。","en":"The present <tips=55>Matsuko</tips> had surely lost all her memories. If so, there was no need to tell her about the many horrors she had once experienced.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r983","rowIndex":983,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　もちろん、僕という人間とかかわったという事実も知る必要がない。","en":"Naturally, she had no need to know that she had ever been involved with a person like me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r984","rowIndex":984,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　もう一度出会って、新しく知り合うつもりもない。","en":"I had no intention of meeting her again and getting to know her anew.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r985","rowIndex":985,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　どうせ僕も、そう長くは生きられない運命なのだ。","en":"In any event, I was fated not to live much longer.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r986","rowIndex":986,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そのメールを送ると、すぐに<tips=54>汐さん</tips>から電話がかかって来た。","en":"Immediately after I sent the message, <tips=54>Mr. Shio</tips> called.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r987","rowIndex":987,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"『本当に、それでいいのか？』","en":"‘Are you sure that's really what you want?’","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r988","rowIndex":988,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「もちろんだよ。彼女は生まれ変わるんだ。僕のことなんか知らない、まっさらな新しい人間としてね。成長したらこの街の外で、ちゃんとした教育を受けさせて欲しい。書類は絶対ばれないやつをこちらでいくらでも用意するし、教師の費用も僕が払うから……」","en":"“Of course. She'll be born again, completely new—a blank slate who knows nothing about me. Once she's grown, I want you to make sure she receives a proper education outside this city. I'll provide all the documents she could ever need, ones no one will ever see through, and I'll pay for her teachers as well...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r989","rowIndex":989,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"『いや、そのことではなく……』","en":"‘No. That isn’t what I meant...’","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r990","rowIndex":990,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「大丈夫」","en":"“It's all right.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r991","rowIndex":991,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　僕は<tips=54>汐さん</tips>にその続きを言わせなかった。","en":"I did not allow <tips=54>Mr. Shio</tips> to continue.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r992","rowIndex":992,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=54>汐さん</tips>は、彼女が普通の人間として幸せに過ごせることだけを考えてください」","en":"“<tips=54>Mr. Shio</tips>, please think only of ensuring that she can live happily as an ordinary person.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r993","rowIndex":993,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして僕は通話を切った。","en":"Then I ended the call.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r994","rowIndex":994,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　椅子の背もたれにもたれかかり、ふうと溜息をつく。","en":"I leaned against the back of my chair and sighed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r995","rowIndex":995,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　これで僕は、これから先の人生を、<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips><tips=81>龍頭</tips><tips=1>謝亮</tips>として使い切ればいいだけだ。余計なことを考える必要も、感じる必要もない。","en":"Now I had only to spend the rest of my life as <tips=1>Tse Leung</tips>, <tips=81>Longtou</tips> of <tips=7>YS</tips>. I no longer needed to think or feel anything extraneous.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r996","rowIndex":996,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>が消息を絶ってから二日後、<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>は<tips=57>滑走路通り</tips>にモニターを引き出し、五分ほどの短い映像を映し出した。","en":"Two days after <tips=20>Koschei</tips> vanished, <tips=7>YS</tips> set up monitors along <tips=57>Runway Street</tips> and screened a short video approximately five minutes long.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r997","rowIndex":997,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それは街を追放されたはずの、<tips=21>八龍会</tips>の三人の老いた指導者が登場し、<tips=67>カミラ・ノーサム</tips>率いる<tips=47>八龍解放軍</tips>の不正を訴え、街の<tips=17>タイプB</tips>たちに<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>への協力を要請するという驚くべき内容だった。","en":"Its contents were astonishing. The three elderly leaders of the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips>, supposedly exiled from the city, appeared on screen to denounce wrongdoing by <tips=67>Camilla Northam’s</tips> <tips=47>Hachiryu Liberation Army</tips> and call on the city’s <tips=17>Type Bs</tips> to cooperate with <tips=7>YS</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r998","rowIndex":998,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　この映像はその日の夜にインターネット上でも拡散された。","en":"That night, the video also spread across the internet.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r999","rowIndex":999,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　これに対抗してすぐ翌日に<tips=47>解放軍</tips>も自分たちの正当性を訴え、<tips=22>老人たち</tips>を批判する動画をネットで流したが、彼らに同調するものは僅かだった。","en":"The <tips=47>Liberation Army</tips> responded the following day with an online video asserting its own legitimacy and condemning <tips=22>the old men</tips>. Few people supported them.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r1000","rowIndex":1000,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=21>八龍会</tips>のネットワークを使うことが出来ず、孤立した状態で<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>と対決することになった<tips=47>解放軍</tips>は街に潜伏したが、彼らの多くは<tips=46>ネオ・ローズ</tips>によって症状を抑えられた発症者であった。","en":"Cut off from the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips> network and forced to confront <tips=7>YS</tips> in isolation, the <tips=47>Liberation Army</tips> went into hiding in the city. Many of its members, however, had developed symptoms that were being suppressed by <tips=46>Neo Rose</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r1001","rowIndex":1001,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　薬の供給が途絶えるとメンバーに症状が出はじめ、組織だった行動がとれなくなり、ついに、<tips=9>Y地区</tips>を脱出しようとした<tips=67>カミラ</tips>とその部下二人が、南岡町のガソリンスタンドで捕らえられた。","en":"When the drug supply was cut off, members began displaying symptoms, making coordinated action impossible. At last, <tips=67>Camilla</tips> and two of her subordinates were captured at a gas station in Minamiokacho while attempting to escape <tips=9>Y District</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r1002","rowIndex":1002,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　この時、彼らを捕縛したのは<tips=13>溝平B団地</tips>の<tips=14>深沢</tips>の手のものだったと言われている。","en":"The men who captured them were reportedly acting for <tips=14>Fukazawa</tips> of <tips=13>Mizohira B Housing Complex</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r1003","rowIndex":1003,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女たち三人は、<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips><tips=81>龍頭</tips><tips=1>謝亮</tips>の命によって処刑され、遺体は通例通り<tips=59>暗闇通り</tips>の裏路地に放置された。","en":"The three women were executed on the orders of <tips=1>Tse Leung</tips>, <tips=81>Longtou</tips> of <tips=7>YS</tips>, and their bodies were left, as customary, in a back alley on <tips=59>Darkness Street</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r1004","rowIndex":1004,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=22>老人たち</tips>に刃向かった時点で彼女たちは裏切り者である。","en":"They were traitors from the moment they defied the <tips=22>old men</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r1005","rowIndex":1005,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　内臓を引きずり出された胴体の上に切断した首を置くというむごたらしい姿で、腐敗するまで晒された。","en":"They were put on display in a gruesome tableau, their severed heads set atop torsos with the organs pulled out, and left there until they decayed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r1006","rowIndex":1006,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=67>カミラ</tips>亡き後、たった四名になった<tips=47>解放軍</tips>は<tips=9>Y地区</tips>を脱出した。","en":"After <tips=67>Camilla’s</tips> death, the <tips=47>Liberation Army</tips>, reduced to only four members, escaped <tips=9>Y District</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r1007","rowIndex":1007,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　一説ではその後日本を脱出し、<tips=17>タイプB</tips>によるテロ組織『ブラッド』に合流したと言われている。","en":"According to one account, they later left Japan and joined Blood, a <tips=17>Type B</tips> terrorist organization.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r1008","rowIndex":1008,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>と<tips=14>深沢</tips>の厳重な警戒網を突破するのは非常に困難であったはずだが、この四人の中には初代<tips=47>解放軍</tips>リーダー<tips=10>見土道夫</tips>の盟友にして<tips=1>謝亮</tips>の旧友である<tips=66>田中紺太</tips>も含まれており、何らかの取引があったと見られているがその詳細はあきらかにされていない。","en":"Breaking through the strict security cordon maintained by <tips=7>YS</tips> and <tips=14>Fukazawa</tips> should have been exceedingly difficult. But the four included <tips=66>Konta Tanaka</tips>, close ally of the first <tips=47>Liberation Army</tips> leader, <tips=10>Michio Mido</tips>, and an old friend of <tips=1>Tse Leung</tips>. It is believed that some form of transaction occurred, though its details have never been disclosed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r1009","rowIndex":1009,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　とまれ、<tips=47>解放軍</tips>の消滅、そして<tips=21>八龍会</tips>の吸収により<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>のこの街における支配力はかつてないほどに高まることになる。","en":"At any rate, with the <tips=47>Liberation Army</tips> eliminated and the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips> absorbed, <tips=7>YS's</tips> control over the city would reach unprecedented heights.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X16:r1010","rowIndex":1010,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　地区内の細かい組織を吸収、あるいは壊滅させ、絶対的な存在となった<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>は<tips=9>Y地区</tips>外の組織や警察との緊張をはらみながらも、それから十年間、<tips=81>龍頭</tips><tips=1>謝亮</tips>が兇弾に斃れるまで街を支配し続けるのだった。","en":"<tips=7>YS</tips> absorbed or destroyed the district’s smaller organizations and became its absolute power. Despite continuing tension with organizations and police outside <tips=9>Y District</tips>, it ruled the city for the next ten years, until <tips=81>Longtou</tips> <tips=1>Tse Leung</tips> fell to an assassin’s bullet.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}}]},{"position":61,"code":"X18","unitId":"X18","rows":[{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r1","rowIndex":1,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=9>Y地区</tips>には特定の人種、組織、国籍の者が集まって住む場所がいくつもあり、彼らはそれぞれのお国柄を思わせるものを軒先に飾ったりしている。そのため、うっかり路地一つ間違えると、全くの異世界に足を踏み入れてしまったかのような感覚を抱くことになる。","en":"<tips=9>Y District</tips> contains a number of enclaves where people of a particular race, organization, or nationality live in clusters, decorating the fronts of their homes with things evocative of their respective homelands. As a result, one wrong turn down an alley can leave you feeling as though you have stepped into another world entirely.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r2","rowIndex":2,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　北東部のタイ人地域や、フェルナンデス家の周囲のブラジル人街が有名だが、他にもいくつもの小さな集まりがある。","en":"The Thai quarter in the northeast and the Brazilian neighborhood around the Fernandes family are well known, but there are many other smaller enclaves.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r3","rowIndex":3,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=10>見土道夫</tips>がその日足を踏み入れたのは、<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>の前身である『<tips=69>義勝</tips>』の旧幹部たちが集まって暮らす地域であった。","en":"The neighborhood <tips=10>Michio Mido</tips> entered that day was home to former officers of <tips=69>Yisheng</tips>, the organization that preceded <tips=7>YS</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r4","rowIndex":4,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　普段は静かな住宅街だが、春節の頃になるとあちこちのドアに赤い垂れ幕が飾り付けられたり、爆竹が打ち鳴らされたりして、この地域が日本とは違う文化を持つ者たちに支配されていることを知らされる。","en":"Ordinarily, it was a quiet residential area. Around Lunar New Year, however, red banners adorned doors throughout the neighborhood and firecrackers exploded in the streets, making it clear that the area was dominated by people with a culture different from Japan’s.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r5","rowIndex":5,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　この地の顔役は<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>がまだ駆け出しだった頃の<tips=69>義勝</tips>を支えていたものたちとその家族である。若い頃に香港から移住してきた彼らは、すでに年老いて一線を離れており、<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>内で名のある役職があるわけでもなかったが、英雄<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>の先輩筋ということで裏社会では一定の敬意を集めていた。","en":"The leading figures in the neighborhood were the men who had supported <tips=69>Yisheng</tips> when <tips=3>Chris Tse</tips> was still making his name, along with their families. Having immigrated from Hong Kong in their youth, they were now old and retired from the front lines. They held no prominent posts within <tips=7>YS</tips>, but as men senior even to the heroic <tips=3>Chris Tse</tips>, they still commanded a certain respect in the underworld.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r6","rowIndex":6,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　かれらはかつて『<tips=69>義勝</tips>』がそうであったように、きわめて排他的で、かつてはこの地域に足を踏み入れたよそ者は生きて帰ることが出来ないと言われていた。もちろん今はそんなことはないが、それでも昔の事情を知るものは滅多に足を踏み入れない。","en":"Like <tips=69>Yisheng</tips> itself in earlier days, they were fiercely insular. It was once said that outsiders who set foot in the neighborhood never came back alive. Of course, that was no longer true, but people who knew its history still rarely ventured inside.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r7","rowIndex":7,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=21>八龍会</tips>に養われた<tips=10>道夫</tips>も幼い頃から近づかないよう言い聞かされており、彼が遊び場とする<tips=59>暗闇通り</tips>とほんの目と鼻の先にある場所ながら、そこに足を踏み入れたのはこの時が初めてだった。<tips=1>亮</tips>に誘われなければ来ることはなかったろう。","en":"Raised under the protection of the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips>, <tips=10>Michio</tips> had been warned away from the place since childhood. Although it lay barely a stone’s throw from <tips=59>Darkness Street</tips>, one of his regular playgrounds, this was the first time he had ever set foot there. Had <tips=1>Leung</tips> not invited him, he would never have come.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r8","rowIndex":8,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　内心には緊張と動揺があったが<tips=10>道夫</tips>は表情に出さず、目の前を歩く<tips=1>亮</tips>のあとをついていった。","en":"Tense and shaken inwardly, <tips=10>Michio</tips> allowed none of it to reach his face as he followed <tips=1>Leung</tips> through the streets.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r9","rowIndex":9,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　この頃<tips=1>亮</tips>は少し髪の毛を伸ばしていて、その整った中性的な顔立ちのせいで黙っているとほとんど少女か少年かわからない。しかし、この顔に似つかぬきつい性格のため、不良少年たちの間ではリーダーの<tips=10>道夫</tips>よりも恐れられているのだった。","en":"At the time, <tips=1>Leung</tips> wore his hair a little long. So fine and androgynous were his features that, while he kept silent, one could scarcely tell whether he was a girl or a boy. Yet the fierce temperament so at odds with that face made the delinquent boys fear him even more than their leader, <tips=10>Michio</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r10","rowIndex":10,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　今はその顔に不機嫌そうな表情を浮かべて、うしろの<tips=10>道夫</tips>を振り返ることもなくスタスタと歩いて行く。","en":"Now he strode briskly onward with a sullen look on his face, without once looking back at <tips=10>Michio</tips> behind him.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r11","rowIndex":11,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=9>Y地区</tips>特有のぐずついた天気で、霧のように細かい雨が降っている。","en":"<tips=9>Y District</tips> was under one of its characteristic spells of unsettled weather, and a fine rain was falling like mist.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r12","rowIndex":12,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>は<tips=57>滑走路通り</tips>で買った女物の水色の傘を持っていた。傘で手が塞がるのが嫌いな<tips=10>道夫</tips>は黒いレインコートを着ていた。","en":"<tips=1>Leung</tips> carried a pale-blue women’s umbrella he had bought on <tips=57>Runway Street</tips>. <tips=10>Michio</tips>, who hated surrendering one hand to an umbrella, wore a black raincoat instead.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r13","rowIndex":13,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ここだよ」","en":"“Here.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r14","rowIndex":14,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>がそう言って立ち止まったのは、一つの門の前だった。門の左右には高くて長い塀が続いてる。この辺りは住んでいる住民層のわりにはごちゃごちゃとした民家が多く建ち並んでいたが、抜きんでて立派な門構えの屋敷であった。","en":"<tips=1>Leung</tips> stopped before a gate, from either side of which high walls ran into the distance. Despite the standing of its residents, this neighborhood was largely a jumble of ordinary houses; the magnificence of this estate’s entrance set it conspicuously apart.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r15","rowIndex":15,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　表札はなく、","en":"There was no nameplate.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r16","rowIndex":16,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ここって……」","en":"“This place...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫","displayName":"Michio Mido","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r17","rowIndex":17,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　冗談でも言ってるのかと<tips=10>道夫</tips>は訝しんだが、<tips=1>亮</tips>はすまし顔だ。どうやら本気でこの豪邸が今日の目的地らしい。","en":"<tips=10>Michio</tips> wondered whether this was some kind of joke, but <tips=1>Leung</tips> wore an impassive face. Apparently he was serious: this mansion truly was their destination for the day.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r18","rowIndex":18,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>は傘を折りたたんだ。それによって、<tips=10>道夫</tips>も、いつの間にかほとんど雨が止んでいることに気がついた。","en":"<tips=1>Leung</tips> folded his umbrella. Only then did <tips=10>Michio</tips> notice that at some point the rain had all but stopped.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r19","rowIndex":19,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ここが僕の本当の母さんの家だ」","en":"“This is my real mother’s house.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r20","rowIndex":20,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>はさらりと言った。","en":"<tips=1>Leung</tips> delivered the revelation as casually as that.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r21","rowIndex":21,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　なぜ<tips=10>道夫</tips>がこんな場所に案内されることになったのか。","en":"Why had <tips=10>Michio</tips> been brought to a place like this?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r22","rowIndex":22,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それには少々事情があった。","en":"There was a little history behind it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r23","rowIndex":23,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　当時<tips=10>道夫</tips>と<tips=1>亮</tips>のグループはこの地区の最大勢力となっており、二人はこのあたりの不良少年では押しも押されもせぬ存在となっていた。","en":"At the time, <tips=10>Michio</tips> and <tips=1>Leung’s</tips> group had become the strongest force in the district, and the two boys were undisputed powers among the local delinquents.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r24","rowIndex":24,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　大人も子供もない<tips=13>ヘドロ団地</tips>や、外部との交流を嫌うミュータントたちが暮らす<tips=15>ボーダーエリア</tips>は別としても、<tips=9>Y地区</tips>の中心街にはもはや彼らに逆らう不良少年はいない。","en":"Setting aside the <tips=13>Sludge Housing Complex</tips>, where there was no distinction between adults and children, and the <tips=15>Border Area</tips>, whose mutants wanted nothing to do with outsiders, no delinquent boy in central <tips=9>Y District</tips> dared oppose them anymore.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r25","rowIndex":25,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　もう縄張りを拡張する必要がなくなったわけだが、かといってリーダーの<tips=10>道夫</tips>は暇になったわけではなく、リーダーを目指す他の少年の果敢な挑戦を受けたり、グループ内での派閥争いがあったり、<tips=8>グレートホール</tips>付近の廃墟に落ちている電化製品を拾って修理して売り払って小遣いにするという試みをはじめたりで、濃密な時間を過ごしていた。","en":"Now that there was no need to expand their territory, their leader, <tips=10>Michio</tips>, was hardly idle. Between accepting bold challenges from other boys who aspired to lead, handling factional struggles within the group, and starting an enterprise that scavenged discarded appliances from the ruins near the <tips=8>Great Hole</tips>, repaired them, and sold them for spending money, his days were packed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r26","rowIndex":26,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その一方で、彼の相棒を務めるべき<tips=1>亮</tips>は、<tips=10>道夫</tips>の負担を軽減するどころか、最近グループの集まりにとんと顔を出さなくなっていた。","en":"Meanwhile, <tips=1>Leung</tips>, who ought to have served as <tips=10>Michio’s</tips> right-hand man, had not lightened his burden in the least. Recently he had ceased appearing at the group’s gatherings altogether.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r27","rowIndex":27,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　直接携帯に連絡をしてもつながらない。だからといって、家を訪ねたりするのも気が引けた。この<tips=9>Y地区</tips>というのは複雑な街であるから、少年同士は仲間でも、彼らの親はそれぞれ思いも寄らない集団に属していたりするので、基本的には家庭や親を巻き込まないのが不良少年達の暗黙の了解だったのだ。だから、<tips=10>道夫</tips>は<tips=55>汐松子</tips>に話をした。<tips=55>松子</tips>は<tips=1>亮</tips>の親しい友人であり、本人に連絡が取れなくとも、彼女を使えば伝わるだろう。","en":"Direct calls to his phone went unanswered, yet he hesitated to visit his home. <tips=9>Y District</tips> was a complicated city: boys might be comrades even while their parents belonged to organizations no one would ever have imagined, so the delinquents shared an unspoken rule against involving homes or parents in their affairs. Instead, <tips=10>Michio</tips> approached <tips=55>Matsuko Shio</tips>. <tips=55>Matsuko</tips> was a close friend of <tips=1>Leung’s</tips>; even if Michio himself could not make contact, a message sent through her ought to reach him.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r28","rowIndex":28,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その頃、<tips=55>松子</tips>は<tips=9>Y地区</tips>の外にある高校に通い始めており、おまけにバイトまでしていたのでグループと疎遠になりつつあったのだけれども、それでも時間があるときはグループ内の少女たちと遊んでいたので、顔も出さない上に連絡も返さない<tips=1>亮</tips>よりはまだ連絡がとりやすかった。","en":"Around then, <tips=55>Matsuko</tips> had begun attending a high school outside <tips=9>Y District</tips> and had even taken a part-time job, so she too was drifting away from the group. Even so, whenever she had time she still spent it with the girls in the gang, making her easier to reach than <tips=1>Leung</tips>, who neither showed his face nor returned anyone’s messages.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r29","rowIndex":29,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「一応伝えておきますが、<tips=1>リョウ</tips>さんから返事が来るかどうかは私にもちょっとわからなくて……」","en":"“I’ll make sure he gets the message, but I honestly don’t know whether <tips=1>Leung</tips> will reply...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐松子","displayName":"Matsuko Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r30","rowIndex":30,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=55>松子</tips>がそう言葉を濁したので、何かよほど大変な事情があるのだろうとなかば諦めていた。","en":"Because <tips=55>Matsuko</tips> had hedged her words that way, he had half resigned himself, assuming there must be some very serious circumstances behind it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r31","rowIndex":31,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しかし、その三日後に、<tips=1>亮</tips>と出会うことが出来た。いつもたまり場となっている喫茶店で<tips=10>道夫</tips>が仲間と喋っていると、ふらりと<tips=1>亮</tips>本人が現れたのである。","en":"Three days later, however, <tips=10>Michio</tips> did manage to see <tips=1>Leung</tips>. He was talking with his friends in the café that served as their usual haunt when <tips=1>Leung</tips> himself came drifting in.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r32","rowIndex":32,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=10>道夫</tips>、時間あるか？」","en":"“<tips=10>Michio</tips>, do you have time?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r33","rowIndex":33,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>は、久しぶりに会った仲間たちにはろくに挨拶もせず、まっすぐ<tips=10>道夫</tips>だけに向かってそう言った。","en":"<tips=1>Leung</tips> scarcely greeted the comrades he had not seen in so long. He walked straight up to <tips=10>Michio</tips> and addressed him alone.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r34","rowIndex":34,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　これはただごとではないと直感した<tips=10>道夫</tips>は、うんと頷いた。","en":"Sensing at once that something serious was happening, <tips=10>Michio</tips> nodded yes.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r35","rowIndex":35,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして実際、歩きはじめるとすぐに<tips=1>亮</tips>は重大な告白をした。","en":"And indeed, no sooner had they begun walking than <tips=1>Leung</tips> made a momentous confession.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r36","rowIndex":36,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「世間では両親ってことになってるけど、本当はあの定食屋の夫婦は親じゃないんだ。彼らは、僕の母親の親戚なんだ」","en":"“To the outside world, the couple who run that diner are supposed to be my parents, but they really aren’t. They’re relatives of my mother’s.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r37","rowIndex":37,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　水色の傘を肩に担ぐようにして前を歩く<tips=1>亮</tips>は、まるで今日の天気の話でもするような平坦な口調で言った。","en":"Walking ahead with the pale-blue umbrella resting against his shoulder, <tips=1>Leung</tips> spoke in a flat tone, as though discussing the day’s weather.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r38","rowIndex":38,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「みんなが知ってる菅原っていう名字も本当の名前じゃない。<ruby=ツェー>謝</ruby>っていうんだ。感謝の謝って書く」","en":"“Even Sugawara—the surname everyone knows me by—isn’t my real name. It’s Tse, written with 謝, the same character used in 感謝, ‘gratitude.’”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r39","rowIndex":39,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「へえそうか。じゃあ中国人なのか？」","en":"“Huh. So you’re Chinese?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫","displayName":"Michio Mido","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r40","rowIndex":40,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　聞き返す<tips=10>道夫</tips>もまた驚きの態度は見せない。","en":"<tips=10>Michio</tips> showed no surprise as he asked.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r41","rowIndex":41,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　これくらいの隠しごとは、この街ではよくあることで、<tips=10>道夫</tips>もこういう告白には驚かない。そもそも彼は、仲間の打ち明け話には驚きを見せない。仲間の少女が妊娠したときも、仲間が人を殺したことがあると泣きながら告白したときも、皆が顔色を変えるなかで普段通りのにこやかな笑顔で「そうか」と一言口にするだけだった。","en":"Secrets on this scale were common in the city, and <tips=10>Michio</tips> was not surprised by confessions like this. In fact, he never showed surprise when a friend confided in him. When a girl in the group became pregnant, and when another friend tearfully confessed to having killed someone, everyone else went pale; he merely wore his usual genial smile and said, “I see.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r42","rowIndex":42,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　もちろん何も感じないわけじゃない。今だって、<tips=1>亮</tips>がさりげない口ぶりとは裏腹に、相当の覚悟を持って自分に真実を語ってくれたことを理解している。そして今自分を連れて行こうとしている場所にも深刻な意味があるのだろうと察している。だが、そう言った細々とした思いは感情のひだの内側に隠して、人には見せずに振る舞うのが<tips=10>見土道夫</tips>だった。","en":"Naturally, that did not mean he felt nothing. Even now, he understood that beneath <tips=1>Leung’s</tips> casual manner lay tremendous resolve: he had chosen to tell Michio the truth. Michio sensed as well that the place his friend was taking him must possess some grave significance. But <tips=10>Michio Mido</tips> kept all those delicate stirrings hidden deep within the folds of his heart and conducted himself without revealing them to anyone.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r43","rowIndex":43,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　これは彼の長所というべきで、彼に何か秘密を告白したり、相談するものは、みな彼の変わらない態度に安心感を得るのだった。","en":"This was one of his strengths: anyone who confessed a secret or came to him for advice found reassurance in his unchanging manner.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r44","rowIndex":44,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ほんの数年前は子供っぽく軽さが目に付くところもあったが、この頃は随分と老成し、重みのある人物になっている。リーダーとして振る舞ううち、度量の広さのようなものが身についてきたのだろう。内面だけでなく、身体的にも身長が伸びて、もう大人と並んでも見劣りしなくなっている。","en":"Only a few years before, his childishness and frivolity had often been conspicuous. By now, however, he had grown remarkably mature for his age, a person of real weight. Perhaps the repeated act of leading had cultivated in him something resembling largeness of spirit. Nor was the change merely inward: he had grown tall enough to stand beside an adult without being overshadowed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r45","rowIndex":45,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「半分ね。父親だけ中国人なんだ。母親は日本人で……それで、今日はその母親に会って貰おうと思ってさ」","en":"“Half. Only my father is Chinese. My mother is Japanese... and today, I thought I’d have you meet her.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r46","rowIndex":46,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「へえ、それは嬉しいなあ。でも、それならもっときれいな服着て来れば良かったよ。朝作業したまんま来たから、適当な服を着てる」","en":"“Huh. I’m honored. I wish I’d worn something cleaner, though. I came straight from work this morning, so I just threw on whatever I had.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫","displayName":"Michio Mido","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r47","rowIndex":47,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=10>道夫</tips>はそう言って苦い顔をする。","en":"<tips=10>Michio</tips> grimaced at his clothes.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r48","rowIndex":48,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なんだっていいさ。どうせわかりゃしないんだから」","en":"“It doesn’t matter. She won’t understand anyway.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r49","rowIndex":49,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そりゃ、おれなんかが何着てたって大差ないだろうけどさ。あんまり汚い格好だと、こんなやつが友人なのかってお前が恥をかくんだぞ？」","en":"“Sure, it hardly matters what a guy like me wears. But if I look too filthy, you’ll be embarrassed to have someone like me for a friend, won’t you?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫","displayName":"Michio Mido","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r50","rowIndex":50,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=10>道夫</tips>はわざとおどけた態度で言う。","en":"<tips=10>Michio</tips> put on a deliberately clownish manner.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r51","rowIndex":51,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>は肩をすくめて、","en":"<tips=1>Leung</tips> gave a shrug.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r52","rowIndex":52,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうじゃない。うちの母はね、目の前の誰がどんな服を着てたって理解出来るような状況じゃないってことさ」","en":"“That’s not what I mean. My mother isn’t in any condition to understand who’s standing in front of her or what they’re wearing.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r53","rowIndex":53,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　と、ほんの少しだけ笑って見せた。","en":"He showed the faintest hint of a smile.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r54","rowIndex":54,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　さて、そうして何を見せられるのかと戦々恐々としながらついてきた<tips=10>道夫</tips>が案内されたのが<tips=69>義勝</tips>の本拠地で、そして到着したのがそのあたりでもひときわ大きな豪邸なのである。<tips=10>道夫</tips>でなくともこれはどういうことかと心配になるだろう。","en":"Thus <tips=10>Michio</tips>, following in fearful suspense as he wondered what on earth he was about to be shown, found himself led into <tips=69>Yisheng’s</tips> old stronghold—and brought to a mansion exceptionally large even by the standards of that neighborhood. Anyone in <tips=10>Michio’s</tips> place would have begun to worry about what it all meant.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r55","rowIndex":55,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その大きな屋敷には表札はないがインターフォンがあり、その下には鍵を差し込む穴と、生体認証用のパネルがある。","en":"The great estate had no nameplate, but it did have an intercom. Beneath it were a keyhole and a biometric panel.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r56","rowIndex":56,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　傘を折りたたんだ<tips=1>亮</tips>はパネルに人差し指をあて、上部のカメラを覗き込む。すると指紋と網膜のダブルチェックをパスしたサインとしてピーと電子音が鳴り、門が自動的に開いた。","en":"After folding his umbrella, <tips=1>Leung</tips> placed his index finger against the panel and peered into the camera above. An electronic beep signaled that the double check of fingerprint and retina had cleared, and the gate opened automatically.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r57","rowIndex":57,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>が先にくぐったあとを、レインコートを脱ごうとしていた<tips=10>道夫</tips>もあわてて追いかける。","en":"<tips=1>Leung</tips> passed through first, and <tips=10>Michio</tips>, caught in the act of removing his raincoat, hurried after him.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r58","rowIndex":58,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　門の内側は外から見た以上に広く感じられた。車五台は止められそうな駐車場と、花や樹木で飾られた中庭が、今さっきまで降っていた雨で濡れている。","en":"The grounds inside felt even larger than they had appeared from outside. A parking area large enough for five cars and a courtyard decorated with flowers and trees were wet from the rain that had stopped only moments before.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r59","rowIndex":59,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　こんなに広い敷地なのに、なんだかがらんとして人の気配が感じられない。広い駐車場にも一台の黒塗りのセダンがあるだけだ。邸内全体がひっそりと静まり返っている。","en":"Despite the size of the grounds, the place felt strangely empty, with no sign of anyone around. Only one black sedan stood in the broad parking area. The entire estate lay hushed and still.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r60","rowIndex":60,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"（こんな家なら、ボディーガードとか居そうなもんだが）","en":"(A house like this ought to have bodyguards or something.)","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r61","rowIndex":61,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>は自分の本当の名前を言ったきり他に具体的な話をしていないが、この時にはもう<tips=10>道夫</tips>はおおよその察しが付いていた。","en":"Beyond revealing his true name, <tips=1>Leung</tips> had offered no concrete explanation. By now, however, <tips=10>Michio</tips> had largely guessed the truth.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r62","rowIndex":62,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　謝という名字を名乗り、この地域にこれだけの屋敷を構えている――となれば、<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>の<tips=81>龍頭</tips>謝大輝こと<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>と血の繋がるものであるのはほぼ間違いないだろう。親戚か、隠し子か――広いだけでさほど厳重な警備が敷かれていない様子を見ると、それほど重要な家ではないのだろうか？","en":"The surname Tse, an estate of this size in this particular neighborhood—there could be little doubt that its occupants were blood relations of Tse Tai-fai, <tips=3>Chris Tse</tips>, the <tips=81>Longtou</tips> of <tips=7>YS</tips>. Relatives, perhaps, or the home of a secret child... Yet for all its size, the estate appeared to have no especially rigorous security. Could the household be less important than it seemed?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r63","rowIndex":63,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　例えば<tips=59>暗闇通り</tips>にある<tips=34>ダリオ・ボネット</tips>の邸宅のまわりにはいつも武器を懐に隠し持った黒服がうろついているし、<tips=27>廖志明</tips>などはその付近には部下を住まわせ、その区画に足を踏み入れた瞬間からその一挙一動を監視されているという。８番道路の金という小さなギャンググループのボスの家でさえ、門の近くには目つきの悪い男がいつもしゃがみ込んであたりを威嚇している。","en":"Men in black with weapons concealed in their coats were always prowling around <tips=34>Dario Bonetto’s</tips> mansion on <tips=59>Darkness Street</tips>. <tips=27>Liao Chi-ming</tips>, meanwhile, was said to lodge his subordinates throughout the surrounding neighborhood, so that every movement was watched from the instant one entered the block. Even the home of Kim, boss of a minor gang on Route 8, always had some hard-eyed man squatting by the gate and glaring threats at the world.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r64","rowIndex":64,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=21>八龍会</tips>の場合は<tips=22>老人たち</tips>の住む一般住宅が本部で、ろくな警備もないが、あれは近所の<tips=17>タイプB</tips>が気軽に出入りするからギャングの家とは趣が違う。","en":"In the case of the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips>, its headquarters was an ordinary house inhabited by the <tips=22>old men</tips>, with scarcely any security. But local <tips=17>Type Bs</tips> came and went freely, giving it a character altogether unlike a gangster’s home.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r65","rowIndex":65,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　とにかく、<tips=10>道夫</tips>には<tips=9>Y地区</tips>のギャングというものはやたらといかめしいところに住んでいるというイメージがあった。","en":"In short, <tips=10>Michio</tips> pictured <tips=9>Y District’s</tips> gangsters as people who invariably lived behind a forbidding show of force.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r66","rowIndex":66,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そういった感覚からすると、この建物は豪華ではあったが無防備過ぎる。","en":"By that measure, this building was luxurious but far too defenseless.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r67","rowIndex":67,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"（<tips=1>亮</tips>のお母さんってどういう人なのかな……）","en":"(I wonder what <tips=1>Leung’s</tips> mother is like...)","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r68","rowIndex":68,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しかしどんな身分であろうとも、これは<tips=1>亮</tips>にとって重大な秘密であることは間違いない。もし不良仲間に知られれば、子供の世界のなかだけの話では済まなくなるだろう。","en":"Whatever his mother’s station might be, there was no question that this was a momentous secret for <tips=1>Leung</tips>. If the rest of their delinquent companions learned it, the matter would no longer end within the self-contained world of children.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r69","rowIndex":69,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"（嬉しいことだな）","en":"(I’m glad.)","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r70","rowIndex":70,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　普段素っ気ない親友が、自分にこの場所を紹介してくれた。<tips=10>道夫</tips>にとっては、その喜びが、好奇心や緊張よりも勝っていた。","en":"His ordinarily distant best friend had shown him this place. For <tips=10>Michio</tips>, the delight of that gesture outweighed both curiosity and tension.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r71","rowIndex":71,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「何ニヤニヤしているんだ？」","en":"“What are you grinning about?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r72","rowIndex":72,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ドアの前までやって来た<tips=1>亮</tips>は、<tips=10>道夫</tips>の顔を見て怪訝そうに首を捻る。","en":"Upon reaching the door, <tips=1>Leung</tips> studied <tips=10>Michio’s</tips> face and tilted his head in puzzlement.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r73","rowIndex":73,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「大事な肉親を紹介してくれるなんて光栄だな。ということは、つまりおれも肉親同様の存在だって認めてくれたってことなんだよな？」","en":"“I’m honored you’d introduce me to someone so important—your own flesh and blood. That means you’ve acknowledged me as family too, right?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫","displayName":"Michio Mido","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r74","rowIndex":74,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「気持ち悪いことを言うなあ」","en":"“Don’t say such creepy things.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r75","rowIndex":75,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>は苦い顔をして<tips=10>道夫</tips>から目をそらしドアの方を振り返ると、","en":"<tips=1>Leung</tips> pulled a face, averted his eyes from <tips=10>Michio</tips>, and turned back toward the door.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r76","rowIndex":76,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そんなの、とっくに認めてるよ」","en":"“I’ve thought of you that way for ages.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r77","rowIndex":77,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　と小さい声で呟いた。","en":"He murmured the words very quietly.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r78","rowIndex":78,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　建物のなかもひっそりと静まりかえっていた。廊下の電灯なども消えており、昼と言えども薄暗かった。<tips=1>亮</tips>は照明のスイッチを押しながら進んでゆく。","en":"Inside, too, the building lay utterly still. The corridor lights were off, leaving the house dim even in the middle of the day. <tips=1>Leung</tips> proceeded through it, turning on the lights as he went.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r79","rowIndex":79,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「こんな広いのに、人がいないな」","en":"“It’s so big, but there’s nobody here.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r80","rowIndex":80,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まあね」","en":"“Pretty much.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r81","rowIndex":81,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>は頷き、","en":"<tips=1>Leung</tips> nodded.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r82","rowIndex":82,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ここに住んでいるのは母さんと、妹と、あとホームキーパーが一人だけ。通いで来てる看護師と、もう一人ホームキーパーがいるけど、二人とも今日は休みだ」","en":"“Only Mother, my younger sister, and one housekeeper live here. A nurse and another housekeeper come during the day, but they’re both off today.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r83","rowIndex":83,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　妹がいるというのは初耳だったし、看護師という言葉にも引っかかったが<tips=10>道夫</tips>はそれについては何も訊ねなかった。","en":"The sister was news to <tips=10>Michio</tips>, and the word nurse also caught his attention, but he asked about neither.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r84","rowIndex":84,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「こんなに部屋があるのにもったいないな。良かったらおれを住まわせてくれよ。修吾さんのいびきが最近特にうるさくてさあ」","en":"“What a waste, with all these rooms. Why don’t you let me move in? Shugo’s snoring has been especially bad lately.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r85","rowIndex":85,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　かわりにそう冗談を言ったが<tips=1>亮</tips>はのってこない。仕方ないので<tips=10>道夫</tips>は自分で笑った。","en":"He made the joke instead, but <tips=1>Leung</tips> refused to rise to it. With no help forthcoming, <tips=10>Michio</tips> laughed at his own joke.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r86","rowIndex":86,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして<tips=1>亮</tips>は奥まった場所にある一つの部屋に<tips=10>道夫</tips>を案内した。","en":"<tips=1>Leung</tips> then led <tips=10>Michio</tips> to a room secluded in the depths of the house.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r87","rowIndex":87,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「入ってくれ。母さんだ」","en":"“Come in. This is my mother.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r88","rowIndex":88,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ドアを開けた<tips=1>亮</tips>に従い、<tips=10>道夫</tips>は足を踏み入れる。","en":"When <tips=1>Leung</tips> opened the door, <tips=10>Michio</tips> followed him into the room.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r89","rowIndex":89,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　広い部屋に、女性の寝室らしく化粧台などが置かれている。家具はいずれも古びてはいたがアンティークというわけでもない。どこにでもある普通の家具なのだが、使い古されているわりには傷や汚れなどが少なく、使用者が物を大事にする性格であることを教えてくれた。","en":"The spacious room contained a dressing table and other furnishings befitting a woman’s bedroom. None of the furniture was antique, though all of it had grown old. The pieces were ordinary enough to be found in any home, yet bore remarkably few scratches or stains for their years of use, revealing an owner who treated her possessions with care.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r90","rowIndex":90,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しかし、そのなかでベッドだけは新しく頑丈なものだった。","en":"Only the bed among them was new and sturdily built.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r91","rowIndex":91,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>の母はそのベッドの上に横たわっていた。その四肢は、特別なベルトでベッドに繋がれていた。","en":"<tips=1>Leung’s</tips> mother lay upon that bed, each of her four limbs fastened to it by a special restraint.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r92","rowIndex":92,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=10>道夫</tips>はこれがどういうものか知っている。ベッドは<tips=17>タイプＢ</tips>発症者専用のもので、ベルトはその附属の拘束用ベルトだ。病院や施設で使われている本格的なものである。これなら、<tips=17>タイプB</tips>がそのおそるべき筋力で引っ張ってもちぎれることはない。","en":"<tips=10>Michio</tips> knew what this equipment was. The bed was designed specifically for people after <tips=17>Type B</tips> onset, and the straps were the restraints supplied with it. It was professional-grade equipment of the kind used in hospitals and residential facilities. Even a <tips=17>Type B</tips> pulling with that terrifying strength could not tear it apart.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r93","rowIndex":93,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>の母――<tips=56>菅原和美</tips>は入って来た二人の方に一瞥もしないで、何もない場所に視線を向けて薄く笑っていた。その瞳は金色に輝いている。","en":"<tips=1>Leung’s</tips> mother, <tips=56>Kazumi Sugawara</tips>, did not spare a glance for the two boys who entered. She gazed at a place where nothing stood and wore a faint smile. Her eyes shone gold.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r94","rowIndex":94,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「母さん、こいつが僕の遊び仲間の<tips=10>見土道夫</tips>だ」","en":"“Mother, this is <tips=10>Michio Mido</tips>, one of my friends.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r95","rowIndex":95,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どうもはじめまして、<tips=10>見土</tips>です」","en":"“Pleased to meet you. I’m <tips=10>Mido</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫","displayName":"Michio Mido","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r96","rowIndex":96,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=10>道夫</tips>は、薄々この状況を想像してはいた。","en":"<tips=10>Michio</tips> had already half expected to find something like this.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r97","rowIndex":97,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　友人の発症した親と会う、という経験は<tips=10>道夫</tips>もこれまでに何度かしている。もちろんまったく驚かないわけではないが、それを態度に出さない程度の自制心が彼にはある。","en":"<tips=10>Michio</tips> had several times before met the parent of a friend after that parent developed symptoms. Of course, that did not mean he felt no surprise at all, but he possessed enough self-control not to show it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r98","rowIndex":98,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「随分綺麗なお母さんだね。お前と少し似ている」","en":"“Your mother’s very beautiful. She looks a little like you.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫","displayName":"Michio Mido","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r99","rowIndex":99,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=10>道夫</tips>は驚くどころか、微笑さえ浮かべて言った。","en":"Far from showing surprise, <tips=10>Michio</tips> even smiled as he spoke.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r100","rowIndex":100,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=56>和美</tips>は唇を動かしてぶつぶつと口の中でなにかをつぶやいている。道夫にも<tips=1>亮</tips>にも見えない誰かと会話をしているのだろう。<tips=10>道夫</tips>はそういう人間をよく見てきているし、幼い頃は一緒に暮らしてもいた。","en":"<tips=56>Kazumi</tips> moved her lips, muttering something deep in her mouth. Perhaps she was conversing with someone invisible to both Michio and <tips=1>Leung</tips>. <tips=10>Michio</tips> had seen many people in this condition; as a small child, he had even lived with one.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r101","rowIndex":101,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「駄目だな。今はまるきり言葉が入らないみたいだ」","en":"“No good. It looks like no words are getting through to her at all right now.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r102","rowIndex":102,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>は溜息をつく。","en":"<tips=1>Leung</tips> let out a sigh.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r103","rowIndex":103,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「薬は飲んでいるのか？」","en":"“Is she taking medication?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫","displayName":"Michio Mido","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r104","rowIndex":104,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「医者が処方してくれたやつを飲ませてる。たまにこっちの世界に帰って来るけど、一日のほとんどはこうやってあっちの世界に行ったきりだ。これでも少しマシになったんだ。あう薬が見つかるまでは、暴れて仕方がなかった。……そこに座りなよ」","en":"“I give her what the doctor prescribed. Sometimes she comes back to this world, but she spends most of every day away in the other one like this. She’s a little better now, believe it or not. Until we found a drug that suited her, she was constantly violent. ...Sit down.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r105","rowIndex":105,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　言われたとおり部屋の中央の小さな丸いテーブルを囲む椅子の一つに座ると、<tips=1>亮</tips>は冷蔵庫からコーラの缶を二本取り出してテーブルの上に置き、<tips=10>道夫</tips>の正面に座った。","en":"As instructed, <tips=10>Michio</tips> sat in one of the chairs around the small circular table at the center of the room. <tips=1>Leung</tips> took two cans of cola from the refrigerator, placed them on the table, and seated himself opposite.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r106","rowIndex":106,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「たすかる。喉が渇いていたんだ」","en":"“That helps. I was thirsty.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫","displayName":"Michio Mido","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r107","rowIndex":107,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=10>道夫</tips>はさっそくその缶に手を伸ばす。","en":"<tips=10>Michio</tips> immediately reached for one of the cans.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r108","rowIndex":108,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「発症したのは大分前なんだけれど、二ヶ月前にこの状態になっちゃってね。ずっと拘束したままなんだ。それでいろいろバタバタしていて、今は僕もここに住んでいる。連絡も返さないで悪かったね」","en":"“She first developed symptoms quite a while ago, but she became like this two months ago. She’s been restrained ever since. That’s made everything chaotic, and now I’m living here too. I’m sorry I never answered you.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r109","rowIndex":109,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　まだ二ヶ月ってことは、状況には慣れていないんだろうな――<tips=10>道夫</tips>はそう思いつつ、","en":"Only two months. He could hardly have grown accustomed to the situation yet, <tips=10>Michio</tips> thought. Aloud, however, he said,","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r110","rowIndex":110,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いいさ。仕方ない。しかし、お前がこんないいところのお坊ちゃんだったとは」","en":"“That’s all right. It couldn’t be helped. Still, I never imagined you were the young master of a grand household like this.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫","displayName":"Michio Mido","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r111","rowIndex":111,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いいところってのとは、ちょっと違う。お前も想像はついているだろうけれど」","en":"“It isn’t quite what you’d call a respectable family. I’m sure you have some idea why.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r112","rowIndex":112,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「少しはね」","en":"“A little.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫","displayName":"Michio Mido","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r113","rowIndex":113,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips><tips=81>龍頭</tips><tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>。それが僕の父親の名だ」","en":"“<tips=3>Chris Tse</tips>, <tips=81>Longtou</tips> of <tips=7>YS</tips>. That is my father’s name.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r114","rowIndex":114,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>はうわごとを呟く母親の方を見ながらそう言った。","en":"<tips=1>Leung</tips> spoke while looking toward his mother as she muttered to herself.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r115","rowIndex":115,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうか」","en":"“I see.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫","displayName":"Michio Mido","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r116","rowIndex":116,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　返事をしてから、<tips=10>道夫</tips>は喉を鳴らしてコーラを飲む。","en":"After answering, <tips=10>Michio</tips> swallowed a mouthful of cola.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r117","rowIndex":117,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それだけか？　もっと驚かれると思ってたんだけど」","en":"“That’s all? I expected you to be more surprised.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r118","rowIndex":118,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>はあきれたように<tips=10>道夫</tips>を見る。","en":"<tips=1>Leung</tips> stared at <tips=10>Michio</tips> with an exasperated look.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r119","rowIndex":119,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まあね。そりゃまったくの予想外だけれど、言われて納得だよ。お前はちょっと違うもんな」","en":"“Well, that was completely unexpected, but hearing it makes sense. You are a little different.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫","displayName":"Michio Mido","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r120","rowIndex":120,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「違うって、ロクな意味じゃなさそうだな」","en":"“I doubt you mean that entirely as a compliment.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r121","rowIndex":121,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ロクでもない意味もあるが、いい意味もある。……でも、<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>の現役の幹部の家族って<tips=41>グランドタワー</tips>に住んでると思ってたよ。だから、ここに連れて来られたとき、親戚か何かかなって想像してた。警備もいないしさ。それとも、お前の母さんは正式な妻じゃないってことか？」","en":"“Some of it isn’t. Some of it is. ...But I thought the families of active <tips=7>YS</tips> officers lived in the <tips=41>Grand Tower</tips>. That’s why I guessed this might be the home of some relative when you brought me here. There aren’t any guards, either. Or is your mother not his legal wife?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫","displayName":"Michio Mido","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r122","rowIndex":122,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=10>道夫</tips>の遠慮のない質問に<tips=1>亮</tips>は苦笑しつつ、","en":"<tips=1>Leung</tips> gave a wry smile at <tips=10>Michio’s</tips> uninhibited question.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r123","rowIndex":123,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「一応この人が<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>の正妻だよ。<tips=41>グランドタワー</tips>に住んでいないのはね、親戚の爺さんたちがどうしてもそうしろって言うからさ」","en":"“Technically, she is <tips=3>Chris Tse’s</tips> lawful wife. She does not live in the <tips=41>Grand Tower</tips> because the old men in the family absolutely insisted upon it.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r124","rowIndex":124,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どうして？」","en":"“Why?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫","displayName":"Michio Mido","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r125","rowIndex":125,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=17>タイプB</tips>はうつるって迷信を信じてる。それに、母さんが日本人なのもあるかな。<tips=41>グランドタワー</tips>に住んで他のメンバーと接触したり、<tips=81>龍頭</tips>の日本人妻として勢力を持つのを恐れてるのかもしれない。……僕があんな街中の定食屋で暮らしているのも爺さんたちの要望だろうよ。<tips=17>タイプB</tips>がうつらないようにってのと、あと、半分日本人だってことでね。<tips=69>義勝</tips>はもともと古い組織で、年寄りの力が強いから<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>もなかなか逆らえない。<tips=81>龍頭</tips>さまだなんて言われて普段偉そうにしてるけど情けない話さ」","en":"“They believe the superstition that <tips=17>Type B</tips> is contagious. Mother being Japanese probably has something to do with it as well. Perhaps they fear that if she lived in the <tips=41>Grand Tower</tips> and mixed with the other members, she would acquire influence as the <tips=81>Longtou’s</tips> Japanese wife. ...I imagine the old men are also the reason I live in that diner in the middle of town: partly to keep <tips=17>Type B</tips> from ‘spreading,’ and partly because I’m half Japanese. <tips=69>Yisheng</tips> is an old organization, and its elders wield so much power that even <tips=3>Chris Tse</tips> has difficulty defying them. Everyone calls him ‘Lord <tips=81>Longtou</tips>,’ and ordinarily he puts on such airs. It’s pathetic, really.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r126","rowIndex":126,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>は苦笑をする。<tips=10>道夫</tips>は黙ってコーラの缶を咥えている。","en":"<tips=1>Leung</tips> smiled bitterly. <tips=10>Michio</tips> remained silent, the can of cola caught between his lips.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r127","rowIndex":127,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まあ、僕にとっては有り難いことだけれどね。<tips=41>グランドタワー</tips>で暮らすだなんて想像したくもない。あんなバベルの塔みたいな建物に住んで、毎日毎日坊っちゃん坊っちゃんと言われてごらんよ。頭がおかしくなるに決まってる」","en":"“Though I’m grateful for it myself. I don’t even want to imagine living in the <tips=41>Grand Tower</tips>. Living in a building like the Tower of Babel and hearing ‘young master’ day after day would drive me insane.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r128","rowIndex":128,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>は溜息をつく。","en":"<tips=1>Leung</tips> heaved a sigh.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r129","rowIndex":129,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　この説明で、<tips=10>道夫</tips>はこの屋敷にボディーガードらしきものがいないことの理由がわかったような気がした。","en":"The explanation made <tips=10>Michio</tips> feel that he now understood why the estate appeared to have no bodyguards.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r130","rowIndex":130,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「年寄りってのは下らない迷信を信じるものさ。でも、<tips=81>龍頭</tips>の息子なのに、まったく組織と無関係なんだな」","en":"“Old people do believe the most ridiculous superstitions. Still, for the <tips=81>Longtou’s</tips> son, you have remarkably little to do with the organization.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫","displayName":"Michio Mido","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r131","rowIndex":131,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「無関係ってわけでもないよ。定期的にね、会合とかに連れて行かれて、幹部と挨拶したり、その子供らとつき合ったりもしてる。いわば定食屋の息子との二重生活だよ。馬鹿馬鹿しい」","en":"“I’m not completely uninvolved. From time to time they take me to meetings, make me exchange greetings with the officers, and have me socialize with their children. In effect, I lead a double life: heir to all this, and son of the neighborhood diner. It’s absurd.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r132","rowIndex":132,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>は顔を顰めて言うと、","en":"<tips=1>Leung</tips> said it with a grimace, then continued,","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r133","rowIndex":133,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まあ、身の上話はこんなものかな。話が長くなったが、今日<tips=10>道夫</tips>に来て貰ったのは、こんな、自分のクソみたいな境遇を話すのが目的ってわけじゃないんだ」","en":"“Well, that about covers my life story. I’ve gone on for a while, but the reason I asked you here today, <tips=10>Michio</tips>, wasn’t to tell you all about my shitty circumstances.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r134","rowIndex":134,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「じゃあなにが本題なんだい？」","en":"“Then what’s the real subject?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫","displayName":"Michio Mido","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r135","rowIndex":135,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=10>道夫</tips>は終始イライラとしている<tips=1>亮</tips>に苦笑しながら問い返す。","en":"With a wry smile at <tips=1>Leung</tips>, who had been irritable from the beginning, <tips=10>Michio</tips> asked the obvious question.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r136","rowIndex":136,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それは……」","en":"“That...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r137","rowIndex":137,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>は珍しく口ごもり、人に会うたび聰明そうだと言われる機敏に動く目で<tips=10>道夫</tips>の顔をじっと見つめてから、","en":"For once, <tips=1>Leung</tips> faltered. His alert eyes—eyes that made nearly everyone he met remark upon his intelligence—searched <tips=10>Michio’s</tips> face for a long moment, and then he said,","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r138","rowIndex":138,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=10>道夫</tips>に訊きたいことがあるんだよ」","en":"“There’s something I want to ask you, <tips=10>Michio</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r139","rowIndex":139,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いいよ。何でも答えてやろうじゃないか」","en":"“Go ahead. I’ll answer anything.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫","displayName":"Michio Mido","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r140","rowIndex":140,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=10>道夫</tips>が相手を安心させるような微笑みを浮かべてそう返事をすると、<tips=1>亮</tips>は立ち上がる。そして、横たわる母親の側に立って、その独り言を続ける顔を見下ろした。","en":"<tips=10>Michio</tips> answered with a smile meant to reassure him. <tips=1>Leung</tips> rose, took his place beside his reclining mother, and looked down upon her face as she continued muttering to herself.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r141","rowIndex":141,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「さっき言った通り、<tips=69>義勝</tips>の爺さんたちは冷淡だ。発症してからはさらに露骨になった。治療やケアにも積極的じゃなくてね、父さんが看護師を雇ってくれたけど、通いではなかなか手が回らない。それで僕は、ここのところ毎日母さんの面倒を見ているんだ。食事を食べさせたり、身体を拭いたり、おむつを取り替えたり……」","en":"“As I said, the old men of <tips=69>Yisheng</tips> are cold. They became even more blatant after her onset. They have little interest in treatment or care. Father hired a nurse, but someone who only visits can’t manage everything. So lately, I’ve been caring for Mother every day—feeding her, wiping her body, changing her diapers...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r142","rowIndex":142,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「すごいな。なかなか出来ることじゃない」","en":"“That’s remarkable. Not many people could do it.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫","displayName":"Michio Mido","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r143","rowIndex":143,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=10>道夫</tips>が今日一番の驚きを見せてそう言うが、<tips=1>亮</tips>は首を横に振る。","en":"For the first time that day, <tips=10>Michio</tips> showed genuine astonishment as he spoke. <tips=1>Leung</tips>, however, shook his head.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r144","rowIndex":144,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どうってことないよ。今はもう暴れるわけじゃないからね」","en":"“It’s nothing. She doesn’t become violent anymore.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r145","rowIndex":145,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>は<tips=56>和美</tips>の手首を拘束する白いベルトの間に指を差し入れた。ベルトがきつ過ぎれば<ruby=うっけつ>鬱血</ruby>してしまうし、ゆる過ぎれば外れて事故に繋がる。その具合を、指を差し入れて確認するのだ。","en":"<tips=1>Leung</tips> slipped a finger between the white restraint and <tips=56>Kazumi’s</tips> wrist. Too tight, and it would cause blood to pool; too loose, and she might slip free and bring about an accident. He tested the space beneath it with his finger to make certain the fit was right.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r146","rowIndex":146,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>は介護生活で、この動作は癖になっているのだろう。頭では言葉の続きを考えながら、ほとんど無意識のままその動作をしているように見えた。","en":"The gesture had evidently become habitual to <tips=1>Leung</tips> in the course of caring for her. His mind searched for the words to continue while his hand performed the check almost unconsciously.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r147","rowIndex":147,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=10>道夫</tips>は、この母を大事に慈しむ<tips=1>亮</tips>の後ろ姿を見て、寂しげに目を細める。","en":"Watching <tips=1>Leung’s</tips> back as he cherished and tended his mother, <tips=10>Michio</tips> narrowed his eyes sadly.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r148","rowIndex":148,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「本当に、どうってことないんだ。でも普通なら色々と考えちゃうのかな？　でも、僕にとってはずっとこの人は遠い存在だったからね。僕は定食屋、母さんはこの屋敷で、ほとんど会う機会がなかった。父さんは昔はよくここに来ていたそうだから、僕以外の三人はよく家族らしいことしてたらしいけど、僕はそうじゃない」","en":"“It really doesn’t bother me. But maybe most people would have all kinds of feelings about it. Mother was always a distant figure in my life. I lived at the diner, and she lived in this mansion, so I scarcely had any chance to see her. I hear Father used to visit often, and apparently the other three did things together as a family. I never did.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r149","rowIndex":149,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　今日はよく自分のことを話す。<tips=1>亮</tips>がこのように自分の心境を話すのは本当にまれなことだ。","en":"Today he spoke of himself with unusual freedom. It was exceedingly rare for <tips=1>Leung</tips> to put his inner state into words this way.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r150","rowIndex":150,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　顔には出さないが、とてつもなく疲れ果てている、と<tips=10>道夫</tips>は思った。","en":"He refused to show it on his face, but <tips=10>Michio</tips> thought Leung must be exhausted beyond measure.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r151","rowIndex":151,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「妹とも、こうなってから初めてまともに話したくらいだ。その妹は、母さんがおむつのなかに粗相をしたり、誰か別人の名前で妹を呼んだり、よくある<tips=17>タイプＢ</tips>の症状を見せるたびに泣きじゃくっていた。そして、今は変わり果てた母さんを見ることが恐ろしくて、ここに入れなくなってる。でも、それじゃいけないっていう気持ちはあるらしいね。まだちっちゃいのに、自分を責めてるらしくて、よくドアの外で震えて泣いているよ。そんなに気にすることはないのにね。妹はまともなときの母さんの印象が強いから、ボロボロになった姿が見てられないんだ。本当に親しいってのはそういうことなんだろう。僕にはそんな感情はない。飼い主がペットの糞をスコップで拾って処分するのと大差ないような、単なる作業だよ。……で、訊きたいことってのはさ」","en":"“I only had my first real conversation with my sister after Mother became like this. Whenever Mother soils her diaper, calls my sister by somebody else’s name, or shows some other common <tips=17>Type B</tips> symptom, she bursts into tears. Now she’s so afraid of seeing what Mother has become that she can’t enter this room. But apparently she does feel that she shouldn’t keep away. She’s still so little, yet she blames herself and often stands trembling and crying outside the door. She doesn’t have to take it so hard. Her memories of Mother when she was well are too strong, so she can’t bear to see her reduced to this. I suppose that is what it means to be truly close. I have none of those feelings. For me, it’s simple work, no different from a pet owner scooping up an animal’s feces and throwing it away. ...Anyway, what I wanted to ask was...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r152","rowIndex":152,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>は立ったまま<tips=10>道夫</tips>を振り返る。","en":"Still standing beside the bed, <tips=1>Leung</tips> turned to face <tips=10>Michio</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r153","rowIndex":153,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「何の感情のゆらぎもないはずなのに、なんだか胸がぽっかりと空虚な感じがするんだよ。こんなの初めてなんだ。これ、なんなんだろう？」","en":"“I shouldn’t feel the slightest emotional disturbance, yet for some reason, there is this hollow emptiness in my chest. I’ve never felt anything like it. What is it?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r154","rowIndex":154,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　端正な顔に不安げな影が浮かんでいる。道ばたで突然対抗チームの不良少年に取り囲まれても、傍観者のようにせせら笑っている見栄っ張りでプライドの高い<tips=1>亮</tips>が、こうした弱気の表情を顔に出すのを見たのは初めてだった。","en":"An anxious shadow lay across his finely formed face. Vain and fiercely proud, <tips=1>Leung</tips> could stand surrounded in the street by a rival gang and still sneer as though the confrontation had nothing to do with him. Never before had Michio seen him permit such a timid expression to reach his face.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r155","rowIndex":155,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=10>道夫</tips>は眉を片方しかめて怪訝な自分を見つめる相手の顔をじろじろと見ていたが、徐々にその唇がわなわなと震え、","en":"Furrowing one eyebrow, <tips=10>Michio</tips> stared at the face of the other boy, who was looking at him in puzzlement, but gradually Michio’s lips began to tremble,","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r156","rowIndex":156,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あははっ」","en":"“Ah-ha-ha!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫","displayName":"Michio Mido","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r157","rowIndex":157,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ついに堪えきれずに笑ってしまった。","en":"At last, he could contain himself no longer and burst out laughing.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r158","rowIndex":158,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まったく、お前は本当に馬鹿だなあ……」","en":"“Honestly, you really are an idiot.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫","displayName":"Michio Mido","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r159","rowIndex":159,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　笑顔のまましみじみと言う。","en":"He said it with feeling, still smiling.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r160","rowIndex":160,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どっ、どういう意味だよ」","en":"“Wh-what do you mean?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r161","rowIndex":161,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>は顔を赤らめてそう返す。","en":"<tips=1>Leung</tips> flushed as he shot back,","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r162","rowIndex":162,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そんなの、わかりきったことだろうに」","en":"“That ought to be obvious.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫","displayName":"Michio Mido","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r163","rowIndex":163,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「わ、わかりきったって……」","en":"“O-obvious...?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r164","rowIndex":164,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「悲しいってだけだろ。お前はとっても悲しんでるんだ。それだけだよ」","en":"“You’re sad. You’re terribly sad. That’s all.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫","displayName":"Michio Mido","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r165","rowIndex":165,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「な、なんで悲しむ必要があるんだよっ」","en":"“Wh-why would I need to be sad?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r166","rowIndex":166,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そりゃお前がお母さんのこと好きだからだろ」","en":"“Because you love your mother, obviously.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫","displayName":"Michio Mido","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r167","rowIndex":167,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=10>道夫</tips>は呆れたように笑う。<tips=1>亮</tips>は反論したいが、いつものようにすらすらと言葉が出て来ずに口ごもっている。","en":"<tips=10>Michio</tips> laughed as though the answer exasperated him. <tips=1>Leung</tips> wanted to argue, but for once the words would not stream fluently from his mouth; he could only stammer.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r168","rowIndex":168,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=10>道夫</tips>は椅子から立ち上がり、顔を<tips=1>亮</tips>に近づけるとまくしたてた。","en":"<tips=10>Michio</tips> rose from his chair, thrust his face close to <tips=1>Leung’s</tips>, and let him have it in a rapid torrent.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r169","rowIndex":169,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なあ、一度言おうと思ってたことを言わせて貰うぜ！　お前さ、よく<tips=55>松坊</tips>のこと情緒欠落人間とか言ってからかってるよな？","en":"“Listen, there’s something I’ve been meaning to say! You’re always teasing <tips=55>Matsu</tips>, calling her emotionally deficient, aren’t you?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫","displayName":"Michio Mido","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r170","rowIndex":170,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あ、ああ……」","en":"“Y-yeah...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r171","rowIndex":171,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「お前は欠落してるわけじゃないんだろうが、幼い」","en":"“You might not be deficient, but you’re immature.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫","displayName":"Michio Mido","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r172","rowIndex":172,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「お、幼いだと？」","en":"“I-immature?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r173","rowIndex":173,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうだ。頭良さげなことをくっちゃべるからみんな誤解しがちだが、お前は口が達者なだけで心はベイビーちゃんなんだよ。だから思い通りにいかないとすーぐ腹を立ててむずがるし、空気を読まずに無茶苦茶なことをする」","en":"“That’s right. You talk as though you’re so clever, and that fools everyone, but the only thing mature about you is your mouth. At heart, you’re a little baby. That’s why you get angry and throw a fit the instant things don’t go your way, and do outrageous things without reading the room.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫","displayName":"Michio Mido","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r174","rowIndex":174,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「お、お前な……」","en":"“Y-you...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r175","rowIndex":175,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>は移動しようとしたようだが、よほど慌てていたのか、ベッドが太ももに当たってよろける。","en":"<tips=1>Leung</tips> tried to retreat, but in his confusion he struck his thigh against the bed and staggered.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r176","rowIndex":176,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「これからな、お前は心でものごとを受け止めるんだ。じゃないと、もっとひどいことになっちゃうぜ」","en":"“From now on, you need to take things to heart. Otherwise, it’ll get even worse.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫","displayName":"Michio Mido","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r177","rowIndex":177,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ひどいって、どういう意味だよ？」","en":"“What do you mean, ‘worse’?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r178","rowIndex":178,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>は顔を真っ赤にして<tips=10>道夫</tips>を睨み付ける。","en":"His face blazing scarlet, <tips=1>Leung</tips> glared at <tips=10>Michio</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r179","rowIndex":179,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「お前はな、なんでも頭使って理屈だけで解決して来たから、心が全然成長しなかったんだ。人の感情や心を読み取るのはうまいくせに、自分の悲しみがわからないなんて重症だぜ？　妹さんみたいに泣けばいいんだよ。だって、こんな悲しいことって世の中にそうそうないぜ？　引き裂かれ、恋い焦がれたお母さんとやっと一緒にいられると思ったら、夢と戯れてこっちを見てくれないんだ。号泣したっていいくらいだろう。少なくとも、すまし顔で『何にも感じない』なんてくだらないことを言ってる場合じゃない。それとも、もう泣いたのか？」","en":"“You’ve solved everything with your head and reasoned your way through it, so your heart never grew at all. You’re so good at reading other people’s minds and feelings, yet you can’t recognize your own sadness? You’ve got it bad. Cry like your sister. There aren’t many things in this world sadder than this, are there? After being torn away from the mother you longed for, you finally think you can be together, only for her to play among dreams and never look your way. You’d have every right to sob your heart out. At the very least, this isn’t the time to stand there looking composed and saying something idiotic like ‘I don’t feel anything.’ Or have you cried already?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫","displayName":"Michio Mido","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r180","rowIndex":180,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「い、いや、全然泣いてないけど……」","en":"“N-no. I haven’t cried at all...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r181","rowIndex":181,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「じゃあ泣け。いまここで泣け。赤ん坊のように声を立てて泣け。おれはむこう向いててやるから」","en":"“Then cry. Cry right here and now. Wail like a baby. I’ll turn around for you.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫","displayName":"Michio Mido","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r182","rowIndex":182,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして<tips=10>道夫</tips>は言葉通りくるりと背を向ける。","en":"True to his word, <tips=10>Michio</tips> turned his back.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r183","rowIndex":183,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「む、無理に決まってるだろ」","en":"“O-of course I can’t force myself to do that.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r184","rowIndex":184,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>は動揺で顔を引きつらせながら部屋のなかを移動し、<tips=10>道夫</tips>と離れた場所にある窓枠に手を掛けた。","en":"His face twitching with agitation, <tips=1>Leung</tips> moved across the room and took hold of a window frame as far from <tips=10>Michio</tips> as he could get.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r185","rowIndex":185,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうか。まあそうだな」","en":"“I see. Well, I suppose not.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫","displayName":"Michio Mido","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r186","rowIndex":186,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=10>道夫</tips>はあっさりと撤回し、またこちらを向く。いつの間にか遠くに逃げている<tips=1>亮</tips>を見て怪訝そうな顔をしてから、","en":"<tips=10>Michio</tips> withdrew the demand without protest and turned around again. Finding <tips=1>Leung</tips> somehow fled to the far side of the room, he looked puzzled for a moment, then said,","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r187","rowIndex":187,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「でも、お前のお母さんは幸せだな」","en":"“Still, your mother is fortunate.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫","displayName":"Michio Mido","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r188","rowIndex":188,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そう言って<tips=56>和美</tips>の顔を見た。","en":"He looked at <tips=56>Kazumi</tips> as he spoke.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r189","rowIndex":189,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女は目の前の騒ぎには無関心で、相変わらず彼女だけにしか見えない誰かと小声で話し、笑っている。","en":"She paid no attention to the commotion before her. As ever, she spoke softly and smiled at someone only she could see.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r190","rowIndex":190,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「お母さんの世話の仕方とかさ、しっかり看護師の人に教わったのか？」","en":"“Did the nurse properly teach you how to care for your mother?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫","displayName":"Michio Mido","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r191","rowIndex":191,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……ああ。あと、自分でも調べて、そっくりそのままマネしてるはずだけど……何かおかしなところあるか？」","en":"“...Yes. I looked it up myself too. I should be copying everything exactly... Am I doing something wrong?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r192","rowIndex":192,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いや。……とても清潔にしてるなと思ってさ。いやな臭いが全然しない。こんな発症者はなかなかいないよ」","en":"“No. ...I was just thinking how clean you keep her. There isn’t any unpleasant smell at all. You rarely see someone after onset cared for this well.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫","displayName":"Michio Mido","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r193","rowIndex":193,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その時<tips=10>道夫</tips>の目に寂しそうな色が浮かんだのを<tips=1>亮</tips>は見逃さなかったが、どういう意味なのかまではわからなかった。","en":"<tips=1>Leung</tips> did not miss the lonely cast that entered <tips=10>Michio’s</tips> eyes, though he could not understand its meaning.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r194","rowIndex":194,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=10>道夫</tips>は母親が発症したあと死んだということは伝えていたものの、その詳しい状況などは何も話していない。それは<tips=1>亮</tips>にということでなく、母が死に、住んでいたアパートを出てから、誰にも一言も話したことがない。","en":"<tips=10>Michio</tips> had said that his mother died after suffering onset, but he had revealed nothing of the circumstances. Nor was <tips=1>Leung</tips> alone in that ignorance. From the day his mother died and he left the apartment they had shared, Michio had never spoken a single word of it to anyone.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r195","rowIndex":195,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「これだけ一生懸命世話をして、何にも思ってないなんてこと、あるわけないさ」","en":"“There’s no possible way you could care for her this devotedly and feel nothing.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫","displayName":"Michio Mido","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r196","rowIndex":196,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=56>和美</tips>の顔を見ながら<tips=10>道夫</tips>は微笑むが、いつものように自然に笑うことが出来ず、少しひきつっていた。","en":"<tips=10>Michio</tips> smiled as he looked at <tips=56>Kazumi</tips>, but he could not smile as naturally as usual, and the expression came out slightly strained.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r197","rowIndex":197,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どうした？」","en":"“What’s wrong?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r198","rowIndex":198,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>が訊ねると<tips=10>道夫</tips>は首を横に振り、","en":"When <tips=1>Leung</tips> asked, <tips=10>Michio</tips> shook his head and answered,","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r199","rowIndex":199,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いや、なんでもない。おれ、今日はもう帰るよ。……おばさん、今度おれメロン持って来てやるよ。マスクメロン食べると、症状がよくなるって最近話題なんだぜ」","en":"“Nothing. I’m going home for today. ...Ma’am, next time I’ll bring you a melon. People have been saying lately that muskmelons improve the symptoms.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫","displayName":"Michio Mido","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r200","rowIndex":200,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そんなのよくあるデマさ」","en":"“That’s one of those common rumors.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r201","rowIndex":201,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「デマでもなんでもいいだろうよ。効果がなかったとしても、毒になるわけでもない」","en":"“Who cares if it’s a rumor? Even if it doesn’t work, it isn’t going to poison her.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫","displayName":"Michio Mido","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r202","rowIndex":202,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=10>道夫</tips>はベッドの側を離れ、<tips=1>亮</tips>に近づいた。","en":"<tips=10>Michio</tips> left the bedside and walked toward <tips=1>Leung</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r203","rowIndex":203,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=1>亮</tips>、そんなに悲しむことばかりじゃないんだぜ。お前みたいな意地っ張りが母親に優しくするなんて、こんなチャンスでもないと出来ないだろ？　逆に考えるんだよ。今まで離れていて寂しかったのに、今は思う存分かまってあげられて嬉しいなって」","en":"“<tips=1>Leung</tips>, this isn’t cause for sorrow alone. A stubborn bastard like you would never have let himself be kind to his mother without an opportunity like this, would he? Turn it around. You spent all those years apart and lonely; now you can lavish all the attention you want upon her. Be glad of that.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"見土道夫","displayName":"Michio Mido","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r204","rowIndex":204,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ば、ばかやろうっ！」","en":"“Y-you idiot!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r205","rowIndex":205,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>が顔を真っ赤にして飛び退くと、<tips=10>道夫</tips>は声をたてて笑った。","en":"His face scarlet, <tips=1>Leung</tips> sprang backward, and <tips=10>Michio</tips> burst into audible laughter.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r206","rowIndex":206,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=56>和美</tips>に食事を食べさせるところを見届けると、<tips=10>道夫</tips>は帰っていった。","en":"<tips=10>Michio</tips> stayed to watch <tips=56>Kazumi</tips> being fed, then departed for home.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r207","rowIndex":207,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>は<tips=10>道夫</tips>を門まで見送って、そして母親のそばに戻ると溜息をついた。","en":"<tips=1>Leung</tips> escorted <tips=10>Michio</tips> as far as the gate. When he returned to his mother’s side, he sighed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r208","rowIndex":208,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「騒がしくしてごめんね。あいつは僕の友だちなんだ。この間連れてきた<tips=55>松子</tips>の次に仲良くしてるやつだよ。どうしてもお母さんに会って欲しくてね」","en":"“Sorry about the noise. He’s my friend—the person I’m closest to after <tips=55>Matsuko</tips>, whom I brought here the other day. I wanted Mother to meet him too.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r209","rowIndex":209,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>の声は普段友人たちには見せたことがないくらい穏やかで優しかった。しかし、<tips=56>和美</tips>はその語りかけには反応を示さず、口のなかで何かを呟いている。","en":"<tips=1>Leung’s</tips> voice was calmer and gentler than any his friends had ever heard from him. <tips=56>Kazumi</tips> made no response to his address; she continued muttering something deep in her mouth.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r210","rowIndex":210,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「こういう姿を見られるのはいやかもしれないけど、会って欲しかったんだ。僕らはあまりにもずっと離れていて、お互いのことを全然知らないからね。少しでも普段の僕の生活がわかるかと思って。……二人とも面白いやつでしょ？　定食屋で暮らせて、よかったよ。だから僕は誰のこともちっとも恨んでいないんだ」","en":"“You may not want anyone to see you like this, but I wanted you to meet them. We’ve been apart so long that we know nothing about each other. I thought they might show you a little of what my ordinary life is like. ...They’re both interesting, aren’t they? I’m glad I got to live at the diner. That is why I don’t resent anyone at all.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r211","rowIndex":211,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>は、こんな状態でもきっと言葉は<tips=56>和美</tips>の心のどこかに染み込んでくれるのではないかと思って、二人きりのときはよく話しかける。けれども母からは何も返っては来ない。","en":"Whenever they were alone, <tips=1>Leung</tips> often spoke to her in the hope that, even in this condition, his words might seep into some hidden corner of <tips=56>Kazumi’s</tips> heart. Nothing ever came back from his mother.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r212","rowIndex":212,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　今の処方になる前は暴れたりもしたが、外部の変化に対する反応はもう少しあった。薬が効いて大人しくなってからは、自分の世界からほとんど帰って来なくなってしまっている。","en":"Before her current prescription, she sometimes became violent, but she had also reacted somewhat more to changes around her. Once the medication took effect and quieted her, she almost entirely stopped returning from her own world.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r213","rowIndex":213,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　発症した<tips=17>タイプB</tips>を完全に治す薬はない。だから、今処方されている薬も治すためのものではなく、症状を抑えるだけのものだ。飲み続けている間だけ、<tips=56>和美</tips>の乱暴な気持ちが抑えられる。確かに暴れていれば事故が起こりやすいけれど、しかしこれは本人のためでなく、まわりが扱いやすくするために飲ませているだけじゃないだろうかと、<tips=1>亮</tips>は疑問に思うこともある。","en":"No medicine could completely cure a <tips=17>Type B</tips> who had suffered onset. The present prescription therefore did not cure <tips=56>Kazumi</tips>; it merely suppressed her symptoms, restraining her violent agitation only for as long as she continued to take it. Certainly, allowing her to rampage would make an accident more likely. Even so, <tips=1>Leung</tips> sometimes wondered whether they administered the drug not for her sake, but simply to make her easier for everyone around her to handle.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r214","rowIndex":214,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=9>Y地区</tips>ではよく行われているが、このように家庭のベッドに縛り付けるのは本当は違法だ。資格を持った医師や看護師が見守れる環境でないと患者の拘束を行ってはいけない。患者本人の人権の問題でもあるし、事故が起こってしまうこともある。","en":"The practice was common in <tips=9>Y District</tips>, but strictly speaking, restraining someone to a bed at home this way was illegal. A patient could be restrained only in an environment supervised by qualified doctors or nurses. It was a matter of the patient’s human rights, and accidents could occur as well.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r215","rowIndex":215,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　だから本当はどこかの病院に入れるのがよいのだろうけれど、親戚たちは反対している。謝家の恥だと言うのだ。","en":"She should probably have been admitted to a hospital, but the relatives opposed it. They called her a disgrace to the Tse family.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r216","rowIndex":216,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>もあまり乗り気ではない。<tips=17>タイプB</tips>専用の施設は病院とは名ばかりで、牢獄のような場所も多い。それに、まともな病院を探そうとすれば<tips=9>Y地区</tips>の外になってしまうが、<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>の影響の及ばない地域では病気以外の脅威を防ぐのが難しかった。","en":"<tips=3>Chris Tse</tips> was reluctant as well. Many institutions dedicated to <tips=17>Type Bs</tips> were hospitals in name alone—places more nearly resembling prisons. A search for a decent hospital, however, would lead outside <tips=9>Y District</tips>; in territory beyond <tips=7>YS’s</tips> influence, protecting Kazumi from threats other than her illness would become difficult.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r217","rowIndex":217,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　平和な時ならばそれでもいいが、現在、<tips=3>クリス</tips>の身のまわりはあまり落ち着いているとは言えない。そのことは、<tips=1>亮</tips>もある程度は把握している。","en":"In peaceful times, perhaps even that risk could have been accepted. At present, however, circumstances around <tips=3>Chris</tips> were anything but calm, and <tips=1>Leung</tips> understood at least the broad outline of the trouble.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r218","rowIndex":218,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=3>クリス</tips>としては、介護のためのヘルパーを増員したいらしかった。しかしそれに関しては<tips=1>亮</tips>が反対していた。彼にしては珍しくはっきりとした理由の言えない反発だった。今いるヘルパーにあまりいい印象がないというのもあるだろうが、これ以上知らない人間が家に入ってくるのが、とにかくいやなのだ。それに、人を増やして手が足りたら、父はまた自分を母から遠ざけようとするかもしれない。","en":"<tips=3>Chris</tips>, for his part, apparently wanted to increase the number of care workers. <tips=1>Leung</tips> opposed him, though with an aversion for which, unusually, he could offer no clear reason. His dislike of the present housekeeper may have played a part, but above all he could not bear the thought of more strangers entering the home. And if additional hands made his own care unnecessary, his father might try once again to distance him from his mother.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r219","rowIndex":219,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　かといって、いつまでもこのままじゃいられないだろうと大人たちに言われれば、返す言葉はないのだが。","en":"Yet when the adults told him they could not continue this way forever, he had no answer.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r220","rowIndex":220,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>は母の言葉にそっと耳を傾ける。ヨウコちゃん、ヨウコちゃんとしきりに同じ人名を呼んでいる。","en":"<tips=1>Leung</tips> gently bent his ear to his mother’s words. She kept calling the same person’s name over and over: Yoko. Yoko.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r221","rowIndex":221,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=56>和美</tips>の言葉のなかでよく登場する名前だ。どんな人物なのだろう？　母の話のはいつも飛び回って支離滅裂でその光景を把握するのは難しいが、仲良く遊んだり、語らっているようだ。子供の時の遊び仲間か、友人だろうか？","en":"The name appeared often in <tips=56>Kazumi’s</tips> speech. Who was she? His mother’s stories leaped about in such incoherent fragments that it was difficult to grasp any scene, but she seemed to play and talk happily with Yoko. A childhood playmate, perhaps, or a friend?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r222","rowIndex":222,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>は<tips=10>道夫</tips>が飲み干したコーラの缶を捨て、結局手をつけなかった自分のためのコーラを冷蔵庫に戻した。","en":"<tips=1>Leung</tips> discarded the cola can <tips=10>Michio</tips> had emptied, then returned his own untouched can to the refrigerator.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r223","rowIndex":223,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　自分はいつまで母の面倒を見るのか、ということについて考える。何やらどうも、このままずっと、このような生活でもいいような気がする。","en":"He considered how long he meant to go on caring for his mother. Somehow, he felt that he might be content to live this way forever.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r224","rowIndex":224,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　学者になりたいとか、とにかく街を出たいとか、そんなことばかり考えていたのに自分でも不思議な心境の変化だった。","en":"He had thought constantly about becoming a scholar and, above all, leaving the city. The change in his own outlook struck even him as strange.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r225","rowIndex":225,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　泣いてばかりいる妹と暮らし、話の通じない母の世話をしているだけなのに、なぜか心は穏やかなのだ。大人たちは大変だねえと同情してくれるが、本人からすればむしろ前よりも居心地がいい。いつも感じていた、あの焦りのような、無性に胸がそわそわしてベッドのなかで眠れなくなる、あの未来へかき立てる渇望がなぜか眠ってしまった。","en":"His life amounted only to living with a sister who did nothing but cry and caring for a mother beyond the reach of his words. Yet somehow his heart was at peace. The adults pitied him for the hardship, while Leung himself found this life more comfortable than the life before. The old impatience—the causeless restlessness in his chest that kept him awake in bed, the hunger that forever drove him toward the future—had somehow fallen asleep.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r226","rowIndex":226,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　これが施設でアルバイトをはじめた<tips=55>松子</tips>がよく言う、人のために何かをするということの安らぎなんだろうか？　それとは違うような気もするが。例えばここに寝ているのが自分の母親でない赤の他人だったらと想像してみると、けして同じ気持ちではいられないような気がする。","en":"Was this the peace <tips=55>Matsuko</tips> often described since beginning her part-time work at the facility, the peace of doing something for another person? It also seemed somehow different. If he imagined that the person in the bed was a complete stranger rather than his mother, he did not think he would feel the same.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r227","rowIndex":227,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=55>松子</tips>のように、とにかく他人に手助けできればいいというわけではなく、母親であることが大事なんだろう。","en":"It was not enough simply to help another person, as it was for <tips=55>Matsuko</tips>. The fact that this was his mother must matter.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r228","rowIndex":228,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして<tips=10>道夫</tips>がさっき自分に対して行った分析を思い出し、<tips=1>亮</tips>は顔を顰めた。","en":"Remembering the analysis <tips=10>Michio</tips> had just inflicted upon him, <tips=1>Leung</tips> grimaced.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r229","rowIndex":229,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"（泣けばいいって言ったけれど、そんなこと出来るもんか）","en":"(He told me to cry, but how could I possibly do that?)","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r230","rowIndex":230,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=10>道夫</tips>はいつも、思いつきでいい加減なことを言う。","en":"<tips=10>Michio</tips> was always saying careless things on a whim.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r231","rowIndex":231,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　母のうわごとを聞きながらしばらくぼんやり考えごとをしていた。そして、時間になると彼は立ち上がり、ベッドの足元にぶら下がる導尿バッグの中身を確認する。","en":"He sat listening to his mother’s delirious muttering and thinking vaguely for a while. When the time came, he rose and checked the contents of the catheter bag hanging at the foot of the bed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r232","rowIndex":232,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=56>和美</tips>の尿道に差し込まれたチューブはパジャマの内側を通ってこのビニール製のバッグに繋がれており、尿が落ちる仕組みになっている。バッグの黒いカバーをずらすと中に黄色い尿がたぷんと揺れた。","en":"A tube inserted into <tips=56>Kazumi’s</tips> urethra passed beneath her pajamas and connected to the plastic bag, into which the urine drained. Leung shifted the bag’s black cover aside; yellow urine sloshed visibly within.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r233","rowIndex":233,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>はベッド脇の棚の上に置かれた紙箱から使い捨てのビニール製の手袋を装着する。そしてベッドの下に置いてあったプラスチック製の尿器を取り出すと、バッグのそばに設置する。","en":"From a cardboard dispenser on the shelf beside the bed, <tips=1>Leung</tips> drew on a pair of disposable plastic gloves. He then retrieved a plastic urine measure from beneath the bed and positioned it beside the bag.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r234","rowIndex":234,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　バッグには注ぎ口が付いていて、それをつまむと尿が勢いよく飛び出して、尿器に注ぎ込まれる。バッグが空になって全ての尿が移動すると、尿器の目盛りを見て、その数値をベッドにぶら下がっているメモ帳に現在の時刻と一緒に記録する。","en":"The bag had a spout; when he pinched it, urine gushed out into the urinal. Once the bag was empty and all the urine had transferred, he read the graduations on the urinal and recorded the amount and current time in a notepad hanging from the bed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r235","rowIndex":235,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　次に彼はおむつのなかの確認に取りかかった。","en":"Next, he began checking inside her diaper.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r236","rowIndex":236,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「失礼するよ」","en":"“Pardon me.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r237","rowIndex":237,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　全く無関心な和美にそう声をかけると身体にかかっていた毛布をめくる。拘束されたきりだがベッドの上でやたらと身体を動かすのでそこまで筋肉は落ちきっていない。<tips=56>和美</tips>は毛布をめくられたことにも気づかぬようだった。","en":"He addressed the utterly indifferent <tips=56>Kazumi</tips> and pulled back the blanket covering her body. Although she remained restrained, she moved around so much in bed that her muscles had not wasted away completely. She did not seem to notice the removal of the blanket.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r238","rowIndex":238,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　拘束は手足と体幹の五カ所で行われている。<tips=1>亮</tips>は腰の上辺りで固定された体幹の拘束を緩め、ズボンを引き降ろす。","en":"Five separate restraints secured her four limbs and torso. <tips=1>Leung</tips> loosened the torso restraint fastened above her hips, then drew down her pajama trousers.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r239","rowIndex":239,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして水色のおむつがあらわれると慣れた仕草でバリッと音を立てて両サイドの面ファスナーを剥がしてめくる。","en":"When the pale-blue diaper appeared, he tore open the hook-and-loop fasteners on both sides with practiced movements and folded it back.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r240","rowIndex":240,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そうして<tips=56>和美</tips>の下半身は丸裸になり、チューブの差し込まれた陰部があらわになった。","en":"<tips=56>Kazumi’s</tips> lower body now lay entirely naked, exposing her genitals and the tube inserted into them.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r241","rowIndex":241,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　看護師によるとそろそろ生理が来ると言う話だったので心配していたが汚れておらず、便もなかった。それを確認すると<tips=1>亮</tips>は外したときとおなじように手際よくおむつを装着し、ズボンを引き上げた。","en":"The nurse had warned him that her period was due soon, so he had been concerned, but there was no blood and no stool. Once he had confirmed this, <tips=1>Leung</tips> refastened the diaper with the same practiced efficiency with which he had opened it, then drew her trousers back up.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r242","rowIndex":242,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　体幹の拘束を緩めたついでに、背中の裏にあてがっているマットの位置を変えて、身体が少し斜めになるように寝る姿勢を整えた。高価なマットを使ってはいるが、あまり長い時間寝かせていると床ずれが出来、場合によってはそこから感染症になって最悪命取りになることもあるということなので、おりを見てはこのように身体の向きを変えてやっている。","en":"While the restraint around her torso was loose, he adjusted the mat beneath her back and settled her at a slight angle. The mat was expensive, but remaining in one position too long could cause pressure sores, which might become infected and, in the worst case, prove fatal. Whenever an opportunity arose, he turned her this way.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r243","rowIndex":243,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　一通り作業を終えた<tips=1>亮</tips>は尿を捨てるために尿器を持って立ち上がった。","en":"Having completed the immediate round of care, <tips=1>Leung</tips> rose with the urine measure in hand and went to empty it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r244","rowIndex":244,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ドアを開けると、丁度部屋に入ろうとしていた<tips=44>筱喬</tips>と出くわす。","en":"When he opened the door, he found <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> just about to enter.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r245","rowIndex":245,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　頭ひとつ分背の低い<tips=44>筱喬</tips>の顔が<tips=1>亮</tips>の胸にぶつかりそうになった。","en":"A full head shorter than <tips=1>Leung</tips>, <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> nearly planted her face in the middle of his chest.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r246","rowIndex":246,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「おっと」","en":"“Whoa.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r247","rowIndex":247,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　急に立ち止まると尿器のなかで尿が揺れる。","en":"He stopped abruptly, making the urine sway inside the vessel.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r248","rowIndex":248,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あっ、ごめんなさい」","en":"“Oh! I’m sorry.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r249","rowIndex":249,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=44>筱喬</tips>は慌てて謝ると<tips=1>亮</tips>の手元を見て、","en":"<tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> apologized in a fluster, then lowered her eyes to what <tips=1>Leung</tips> held in his hands and asked,","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r250","rowIndex":250,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それ、捨てるの？」","en":"“Are you going to empty that?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r251","rowIndex":251,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「うん」","en":"“Yes.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r252","rowIndex":252,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「私がやるよ」","en":"“I’ll do it.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r253","rowIndex":253,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　と言って、尿器に手を伸ばす。","en":"She reached for the urinal.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r254","rowIndex":254,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いいよ。僕は手袋してるから」","en":"“It’s all right. I’m already wearing gloves.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r255","rowIndex":255,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ちょっと待ってて」","en":"“Wait a moment.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r256","rowIndex":256,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=44>筱喬</tips>は言うと、すぐ右手のドアを開ける。その小さな空間は床がタイル敷きで、掃除用の流しが設置されていた。ここは<tips=56>和美</tips>がベッドから起き上がれなくなってから<tips=3>クリス</tips>が金を出して作ってくれたもので、排泄物を流したり汚れものを洗うのに便利だ。","en":"<tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> said this and opened the door immediately to her right. The floor of the little room beyond was tiled, and a utility sink had been installed for cleaning. <tips=3>Chris</tips> had paid to have it built after <tips=56>Kazumi</tips> became unable to rise from bed, and it was convenient for disposing of waste and washing soiled items.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r257","rowIndex":257,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そこの棚にも手袋の箱があって、<tips=44>筱喬</tips>はそれをいそいそと両手に装着する。尿を流して洗うだけの簡単な作業だから、こうしている時間に終えてしまえるのにと<tips=1>亮</tips>は思ったが、幼い妹の善意を無駄にしないために言わなかった。","en":"Another box of gloves stood on a shelf inside. <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> eagerly pulled a pair over both hands. Emptying and rinsing the vessel was so simple that <tips=1>Leung</tips> could have finished it in the time she spent putting them on, but he said nothing; he would not rebuff his little sister’s goodwill.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r258","rowIndex":258,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=44>筱喬</tips>は手袋をはめた手で尿器を受け取る。","en":"With her gloves on, <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> accepted the urinal.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r259","rowIndex":259,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「やりかたはわかるかい？」","en":"“Do you know how?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r260","rowIndex":260,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「うん。お兄ちゃんや看護師さんのやるところ見てたから」","en":"“Yes. I’ve watched you and the nurse do it.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r261","rowIndex":261,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=44>筱喬</tips>は言うと、その黄色い液体を洗い場のシンクに流し、そして蛇口からの流水を当てて柄付きブラシで擦った。","en":"<tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> poured the yellow liquid into the washroom sink, ran water over the vessel, and scrubbed it with a long-handled brush.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r262","rowIndex":262,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それくらいで大丈夫だよ」","en":"“That’s enough.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r263","rowIndex":263,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「う、うん」","en":"“O-okay.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r264","rowIndex":264,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=44>筱喬</tips>はそれで手を止め、蛇口をしめる。","en":"<tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> stopped and turned off the tap.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r265","rowIndex":265,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ありがとう。助かるよ」","en":"“Thank you. That helps.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r266","rowIndex":266,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>が微笑み、尿器を受け取ろうと手を伸ばしたが、","en":"<tips=1>Leung</tips> smiled and reached out to take the vessel from her, but","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r267","rowIndex":267,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「私が持っていくよ」","en":"“I’ll carry it in.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r268","rowIndex":268,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=44>筱喬</tips>は言って、<tips=1>亮</tips>の目の前を通り過ぎて<tips=56>和美</tips>の部屋のドアを開けた。","en":"With that, <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> marched past <tips=1>Leung</tips> and opened the door to <tips=56>Kazumi’s</tips> room.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r269","rowIndex":269,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　珍しいこともあるものだ。","en":"Well, this was unexpected.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r270","rowIndex":270,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　家族のことが全くわからなくなって言葉も入らない母を見るのを、あんなにおそれていたのに。","en":"She had been so afraid to see a mother who no longer recognized her family or took in their words.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r271","rowIndex":271,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=44>筱喬</tips>は部屋に入ってすぐのところで独り言をぶつぶつ呟く母の姿に怯んだが、すぐに気を取り直してスタスタと歩き出す。","en":"Just inside the room, <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> faltered at the sight of her mother muttering to herself, but soon collected herself and resumed walking briskly.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r272","rowIndex":272,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「その、ベッドの下に敷いてあるビニールシートの上に置いて」","en":"“Put it on the plastic sheet beneath the bed.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r273","rowIndex":273,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「わかった。……他に、何か私が手伝えることある？」","en":"“All right. ...Is there anything else I can help with?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r274","rowIndex":274,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そう言って<tips=44>筱喬</tips>は強い意志の宿った瞳で兄を見る。","en":"<tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> looked at her brother with determination in her eyes.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r275","rowIndex":275,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「特にないかな。もう一通りのことは終わったから」","en":"“Nothing in particular. I’ve already finished everything for now.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r276","rowIndex":276,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　急に積極的になった妹を不思議に思いながら<tips=1>亮</tips>は答える。","en":"Puzzled by his sister’s sudden initiative, <tips=1>Leung</tips> answered,","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r277","rowIndex":277,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「もっと早く来ればよかった。ごめんなさい、いつもお兄ちゃんにばっかりやらせちゃって」","en":"“I should have come sooner. I’m sorry I always made you do everything.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r278","rowIndex":278,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それはいいよ。でも、大丈夫なのかい？」","en":"“That’s all right. But are you sure you’re okay?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r279","rowIndex":279,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「もう大丈夫。いままで何にもしないでごめんなさい……。ずっと、こんなのじゃお母さんにもお兄ちゃんにも悪いって、<tips=44>シウ</tips>がいやな子だってわかってたんだけど、こわくてしかたなくて……」","en":"“I’m all right now. I’m sorry I never helped before... I knew it was wrong to treat Mother and you this way. I knew <tips=44>Siu</tips> was being a bad girl, but I was so frightened I couldn’t help it...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r280","rowIndex":280,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして<tips=44>筱喬</tips>の大きな瞳にじんわり涙が浮かぶ。","en":"Tears welled slowly in <tips=44>Siu-kiu’s</tips> great dark eyes.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r281","rowIndex":281,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=44>シウ</tips>、自分を責める必要はないよ。お前は僕より母さんのことを大切に思ってるから、耐えられなかったというだけのことだよ」","en":"“<tips=44>Siu</tips>, you don’t need to blame yourself. You care about Mother more than I do. That is why you couldn’t bear it.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r282","rowIndex":282,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>は言いながら<tips=44>筱喬</tips>の手にはめたままの手袋を脱がしてやり、自分のものと纏めてまるめて部屋の隅にあるふた付きゴミ箱のペダルを踏んでその中に捨てた。","en":"As he spoke, <tips=1>Leung</tips> peeled the gloves from <tips=44>Siu-kiu’s</tips> hands, rolled them into a bundle with his own, stepped on the pedal of the lidded waste bin in the corner, and dropped the bundle inside.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r283","rowIndex":283,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まだ小さいんだし、僕や看護師さんと同じことはやらなくていい。かわりに、母さんのために泣いたり喜んだりしてあげてほしい。僕の分までね。それだけでいいんだ」","en":"“You’re still young. You don’t need to do what the nurse and I do. Instead, I want you to cry and be happy for Mother. Do that for me as well. That is enough.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r284","rowIndex":284,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「お兄ちゃん……」","en":"“Brother...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r285","rowIndex":285,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「僕は平気なんだよ。汚れたおむつを見たって、症状がひどいのを見たって、そんなにつらくはない。だからやってるだけだよ。子供が二人いて、両方とも僕みたいだったらお母さんが可哀想だろう？　だからこれは役割分担だ。僕はこういう世話をするから、お前は一杯お母さんのことを考えてあげてくれ」","en":"“I’m fine. Seeing a dirty diaper or watching the symptoms worsen does not cause me much pain. That is why I handle those things. Mother would be pitiful if both her children were like me, wouldn’t she? So this is a division of roles. I will perform this kind of care. You think about Mother as much as you can.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r286","rowIndex":286,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「でも、私何かしたい」","en":"“But I want to do something.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r287","rowIndex":287,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それなら、料理とか掃除とか、他のことでもいい。僕が教えるから」","en":"“Then it can be something else, like cooking or cleaning. I’ll teach you.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r288","rowIndex":288,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「う、うん……」","en":"“O-okay...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r289","rowIndex":289,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=44>筱喬</tips>は<tips=44>筱喬</tips>で複雑な思いがあるらしく、頷きはしたものの兄の提案を素直に受け入れられないようだった。","en":"<tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips>, for her part, appeared to be struggling with complicated feelings of her own. Although she nodded, <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> could not seem to accept her brother’s proposal without reservation.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r290","rowIndex":290,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どうしてもって言うなら、介助も教えるよ。でも<tips=44>シウ</tips>に出来る範囲のことでいい」","en":"“If you insist, I’ll teach you how to assist with her care too. But only as much as <tips=44>Siu</tips> can manage.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r291","rowIndex":291,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　兄の優しい言葉に<tips=44>筱喬</tips>はうつむき、","en":"At her brother’s gentle words, <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> lowered her head.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r292","rowIndex":292,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「本当にごめんなさい。ずっと一人で暮らしてたお兄ちゃんに、こんなときばっかり……」","en":"“I’m truly sorry. You always lived all by yourself, and only at a time like this do I...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r293","rowIndex":293,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ほとんど泣きそうになって言う妹を見て、<tips=1>亮</tips>は苦笑する。","en":"Seeing his sister speak on the verge of tears, <tips=1>Leung</tips> gave a rueful smile.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r294","rowIndex":294,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「別に一人ってわけじゃない。むしろすごく賑やかに……」","en":"“I wasn’t exactly alone. If anything, it was extremely lively...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r295","rowIndex":295,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　言いかけたところで、ポケットのなかの携帯電話が振動する。","en":"Just as he began to speak, the mobile phone in his pocket vibrated.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r296","rowIndex":296,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　取り出してみると、<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>からのメールを着信したという通知が表示されていた。","en":"When he took it out, a notification showed that an email had arrived from <tips=3>Chris Tse</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r297","rowIndex":297,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　すぐにポケットにしまい、","en":"He immediately put it away again.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r298","rowIndex":298,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なんでもない」","en":"“It’s nothing.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r299","rowIndex":299,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その動作を見つめていた<tips=44>筱喬</tips>にそう言うと、","en":"He said it to <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips>, who had watched the movement.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r300","rowIndex":300,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「とにかく、僕は本当に大丈夫なんだ。だけど、<tips=44>シウ</tips>が手助けしたいって言ってくれたのは嬉しい。ねえ<tips=44>シウ</tips>、何かしなくちゃいけないと心から思ってくれたなら、したのと同じことなんだよ」","en":"“In any case, I truly am fine. But I’m glad you said you wanted to help, <tips=44>Siu</tips>. Listen, <tips=44>Siu</tips>: if you sincerely felt that you had to do something, that is the same as having done it.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r301","rowIndex":301,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「お兄ちゃん。<tips=44>シウ</tips>は悪い子だったけど、もう頑張るからきらいにならないでね。お兄ちゃんにきらわれたら、<tips=44>シウ</tips>……」","en":"“Brother, <tips=44>Siu</tips> was a bad girl, but I’ll try hard now, so please don’t hate me. If you hated me, <tips=44>Siu</tips> would...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"筱喬","displayName":"Siu-kiu","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r302","rowIndex":302,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=44>筱喬</tips>の目から涙がこぼれ落ちる。それを見て、<tips=1>亮</tips>は不覚にも胸がつまった。","en":"Tears spilled from <tips=44>Siu-kiu’s</tips> eyes. The sight caught <tips=1>Leung</tips> unprepared, filling his chest until he could hardly breathe.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r303","rowIndex":303,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「大丈夫。安心して。絶対にきらいになることなんかないよ」","en":"“It’s all right. Don’t worry. I could never, ever hate you.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r304","rowIndex":304,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>は<tips=44>筱喬</tips>の頭をくしゃりとなでた。","en":"<tips=1>Leung</tips> laid a hand on <tips=44>Siu-kiu’s</tips> head and tousled her hair.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r305","rowIndex":305,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　夕食を取り、入浴を済ませると<tips=1>亮</tips>はまた<tips=56>和美</tips>の部屋に戻ってきた。","en":"Once dinner and his bath were finished, <tips=1>Leung</tips> returned to <tips=56>Kazumi’s</tips> room.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r306","rowIndex":306,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして和美のおむつのなかを確認すると便が出ていたのでそれを処理する。その作業の間に、空腹が満たされたせいか、<tips=56>和美</tips>は目を閉じてすやすやと寝息を立てはじめた。","en":"He checked inside her diaper, found that she had passed stool, and cleaned her. Perhaps because her hunger had been satisfied, <tips=56>Kazumi</tips> closed her eyes and began breathing softly in sleep while he worked.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r307","rowIndex":307,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　まるで赤ん坊のようだな。","en":"She was just like a baby.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r308","rowIndex":308,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>はそう心の中で呟いてから、そう言えば、自分が赤ん坊のときはまだ母親の側に居て、彼女がおむつを替えてくれたりしていたんだなあと思い出す。自分は母とは縁がなかったような気がしたけれど、まだ物心つく前、記憶にもない時代、確かに彼女には世話をかけていたのだ。","en":"After murmuring the thought inwardly, <tips=1>Leung</tips> remembered that as an infant he had still lived at his mother’s side, and she must have changed his diapers just as he now changed hers. He had imagined himself to have no bond with his mother, yet before awareness—during an age his memory could never reach—he had unquestionably depended upon her care.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r309","rowIndex":309,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　結局、昔にして貰ったことをしてるだけのことなんだな。何にも特別なことじゃない、借りたものを返してるだけの当たり前のことなんだ。","en":"In the end, he was merely doing for her what she had once done for him. There was nothing exceptional about it. He was simply returning what he had borrowed, as anyone naturally would.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r310","rowIndex":310,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そう思うと、妙に納得が出来た。","en":"Strangely, once he thought of it that way, it made sense.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r311","rowIndex":311,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　一通り作業が終わると、もう今日はしてやることがない。寝息を立てる母を見ながら<tips=1>亮</tips>は椅子に腰掛け、先ほど父から来たメールの存在を思い出して携帯電話を取り出した。","en":"Once the round of work was complete, there was nothing more he could do for her that day. <tips=1>Leung</tips> sat down and watched his mother breathe in sleep. Then he remembered the email that had arrived from his father and took out his phone.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r312","rowIndex":312,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=3>クリス</tips>は明日この屋敷を訪ねることになっていたのだが、急遽それが出来なくなったと書いてあった。","en":"<tips=3>Chris</tips> had been scheduled to visit the house the following day, but wrote that something had come up and he could no longer do so.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r313","rowIndex":313,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"『いつも母さんの面倒をみさせてすまない』","en":"‘I’m sorry I always leave Mother’s care to you.’","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r314","rowIndex":314,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　と最後に謝っていたので驚いた。","en":"The apology at the end surprised Leung.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r315","rowIndex":315,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=3>クリス</tips>にこんな言葉を投げかけられるなんて、これまで一度もなかったからだ。","en":"<tips=3>Chris</tips> had never addressed words like those to him before.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r316","rowIndex":316,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"（でも、別に謝ることなんかないのにな）","en":"(But he has nothing to apologize for.)","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r317","rowIndex":317,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　と<tips=1>亮</tips>は思う。","en":"So thought <tips=1>Leung</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r318","rowIndex":318,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そのころは『<tips=45>ローズ</tips>』の副作用が知れ渡ることによって濫用者は大分減ったが、その爪痕はまだ街に残り、街には中毒者が溢れていた。","en":"By then, widespread knowledge of <tips=45>Rose’s</tips> side effects had greatly reduced the number of people abusing the drug. Its wounds remained upon the city, however, and addicts still overflowed its streets.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r319","rowIndex":319,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼らは頻繁に事件を起こし、または彼ら自体が事件の被害者となり、裏通りを歩けば一日一人くらいはジャンキーの死体を発見出来る。","en":"They frequently caused incidents or became victims of them themselves, and a walk through the back alleys would uncover roughly one junkie’s corpse every day.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r320","rowIndex":320,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　この荒れた状況のなか、<tips=45>ローズ</tips>を売って組織と小金を作った連中が、そのままギャングになって自分のチームを作った。彼らは街の外のヤクザなどと組んで別の薬を路上で売り始めている。","en":"Amid this turmoil, the people who had made organizations and small fortunes by selling <tips=45>Rose</tips> went on to become gangsters and form teams of their own. They allied themselves with yakuza outside the city and began selling other drugs on the streets.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r321","rowIndex":321,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ＹＳはその対応をしなくてはいけないが、<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>自体も<tips=45>ローズ</tips>中毒に蝕まれており、<tips=81>龍頭</tips>である<tips=3>クリス</tips>は寝る時間がないほど忙しい。","en":"YS had to deal with it, but <tips=7>YS</tips> itself was being eaten away by <tips=45>Rose</tips> addiction, and <tips=3>Chris</tips>, its <tips=81>Longtou</tips>, was so busy he barely had time to sleep.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r322","rowIndex":322,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>はそうした状況を理解していた。","en":"<tips=1>Leung</tips> understood the situation in which his father was caught.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r323","rowIndex":323,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"（僕でもきっと父さんと同じように仕事を優先するだろう）","en":"(In his place, I would probably put the work first too.)","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r324","rowIndex":324,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　自分に置き換えてみれば父の行動には責めるべき点はなにもない。","en":"When Leung placed himself in his father’s position, he could find nothing in the man’s conduct that deserved reproach.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r325","rowIndex":325,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>は<tips=81>龍頭</tips>の判断なしにはこの時期を乗り越えることが出来ないが、発症した<tips=17>タイプB</tips>に対してはいかに<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>といえどもなすすべがない。仕事を捨てて帰って来て、たとえば<tips=56>和美</tips>に優しい言葉を投げかけたところで病に対してはなんの意味もないのだ。この症状はそうした行為で何かかが改善するようなものではない。","en":"<tips=7>YS</tips> could not weather this period without the judgment of its <tips=81>Longtou</tips>. Yet confronted with a <tips=17>Type B</tips> who had suffered onset, even <tips=3>Chris Tse</tips> was powerless. He might abandon his work, return home, and offer <tips=56>Kazumi</tips> gentle words, but those words would mean nothing to the disease. This was not a condition that tenderness could improve.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r326","rowIndex":326,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それに実際のところ、<tips=3>クリス</tips>が帰って来て、例えば一緒に食卓を囲むようなことになったらどんな顔をしたらいいのかわからない。","en":"In truth, if <tips=3>Chris</tips> came home and they were made to sit around the same table, Leung would have no idea what sort of face he ought to wear.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r327","rowIndex":327,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そうした意味では<tips=1>亮</tips>にとってはむしろ、<tips=3>クリス</tips>が来ないという情報はむしろ安堵をもたらした。","en":"In that respect, the news that <tips=3>Chris</tips> would not come was, if anything, a relief to <tips=1>Leung</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r328","rowIndex":328,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"（でも、母さんは会いたいのかな）","en":"(But perhaps Mother wants to see him.)","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r329","rowIndex":329,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そうしてふと<tips=56>和美</tips>の方を見ると、いつのまにか母が目を開けているのに気がついた。","en":"When he happened to glance toward <tips=56>Kazumi</tips>, he noticed that at some point, she had opened her eyes.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r330","rowIndex":330,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「母さん、眠れないのかい？」","en":"“Mother, can’t you sleep?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r331","rowIndex":331,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>の言葉に<tips=56>和美</tips>は反応を示さず、ぼんやり視線がさまよっている。それは<tips=1>亮</tips>の顔を見ているようにも見えたし、何も見ていないようにも見えた。","en":"<tips=56>Kazumi</tips> showed no response to <tips=1>Leung’s</tips> words. Her vacant gaze wandered. It might have been resting upon <tips=1>Leung’s</tips> face, or it might have been seeing nothing whatsoever.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r332","rowIndex":332,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「明日、父さん来れないんだってさ。寂しい？」","en":"“Father says he can’t come tomorrow. Will you miss him?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r333","rowIndex":333,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そう訊ねても、母親はやはりなにも語ろうとはしない。","en":"Even when he asked, his mother still made no attempt to speak.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r334","rowIndex":334,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「僕はほっとしてる。会うと緊張するからね」","en":"“I’m relieved. He makes me nervous.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r335","rowIndex":335,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>は立ち上がって、<tips=56>和美</tips>の布団の裾がめくれあがっているのを直した。","en":"<tips=1>Leung</tips> rose and smoothed down the foot of <tips=56>Kazumi’s</tips> blanket, which had become turned up.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r336","rowIndex":336,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ひとの繋がりっていうのはなんなんだろうね。僕らはみんな血で繋がっている。……でも、そんなに打ち解け合ってるわけじゃないでしょう？　僕だったら、<tips=55>松子</tips>とか<tips=10>道夫</tips>とか、他の仲間の方がずっと親しい。なのに、彼らとの約束や時間を捨てて、ここに来てずっと母さんの面倒を見ているんだ。不思議なものだと思う。<tips=10>道夫</tips>が言うように、僕の感情はどこか幼稚な部分があるのかもしれない。だから、どこかちょっと、無条件に親に従ってしまうんだ。赤ん坊とか、そうだろう？」","en":"“What is it that binds people together? We are all connected by blood. ...But we aren’t especially close, are we? I am much closer to <tips=55>Matsuko</tips>, <tips=10>Michio</tips>, and the others. Yet I have set aside my commitments and my time with them to come here and care for Mother every day. It is strange. Perhaps <tips=10>Michio</tips> is right, and there is something immature in my feelings. Perhaps that is why some small part of me obeys my parents unconditionally. Babies are like that, aren’t they?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r337","rowIndex":337,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>はまた椅子に腰掛けた。","en":"<tips=1>Leung</tips> lowered himself into the chair once more.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r338","rowIndex":338,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「正直、ずっと母さんや父さんを恨んでたんだ」","en":"“To be honest, I resented you and Father for a very long time.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r339","rowIndex":339,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　母親の心にはもうどんな言葉も届かないのかもしれない。しかし<tips=1>亮</tips>は何か言わずにはいられなかった。","en":"Perhaps no words could reach his mother’s heart any longer. Even so, <tips=1>Leung</tips> found it impossible to remain silent.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r340","rowIndex":340,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それとも、届かないから言えるのだろうか？　もし母が正気であったなら、あるいはこんな話は一生口にせずに終わっていたかもしれない。","en":"Or could he say these things precisely because they would not reach her? Had his mother been lucid, he might have gone his entire life without voicing them.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r341","rowIndex":341,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それは、この世の中自体が好きじゃなかったからだ。世界自体があんまり好きじゃない。悲しいことばっかりで、どんなに頑張ったって報われないことの方が多い。色んな事を知れば意見が変わるかと思ったけれど、何を見たってがっかりさせられるばかりだ。僕らは苦しむためだけにこんな場所に生まれたんだと思ってた。……でもいまはそう思わない」","en":"“It was because I didn’t like the world itself. I still don’t much like it. It’s full of sadness, and no matter how hard people try, more often than not they go unrewarded. I thought learning about all kinds of things might change my mind, but everything I saw only disappointed me. I used to think we were born into this place solely to suffer. ...But I don’t think that way now.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r342","rowIndex":342,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　本当に何も届いていないのだろうか？","en":"Was it really true that none of his words reached her?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r343","rowIndex":343,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　母が黙っているその顔を見ていると、とてもそうは思われない。何か理由があって、発症したふりをしているのか――そんなふうにも考えたくなる。","en":"Looking at his mother’s silent face, he found it very difficult to believe. He even wanted to imagine that she had some reason to pretend she had developed symptoms.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r344","rowIndex":344,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　何しろ、この母は若い頃は研究者として<tips=8>グレートホール</tips>の研究に携わっていたくらい賢い人間だったのだ。昔は<tips=8>グレートホール</tips>に対して大がかりな調査が行われており、そこには<tips=54>汐健慈朗</tips>もいた。","en":"After all, his mother had been intelligent enough to work as a researcher studying the <tips=8>Great Hole</tips> when she was young. Large-scale investigations of the <tips=8>Great Hole</tips> had been conducted in those days, and <tips=54>Kenjiro Shio</tips> had taken part as well.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r345","rowIndex":345,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=54>汐健慈朗</tips>は同僚だった<tips=56>和美</tips>のことを殆ど語らない。調査に関わった人間は多く、同僚としてのつき合いはあったにしろ、そこまで親しいわけではなかったのだろうと<tips=1>亮</tips>は考えている。","en":"<tips=54>Kenjiro Shio</tips> said almost nothing about his former colleague <tips=56>Kazumi</tips>. So many people had participated in the investigation that <tips=1>Leung</tips> assumed the two had known each other as colleagues but had never been particularly close.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r346","rowIndex":346,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　とにかくそんな聡明な人間が、このように何もわからなくなるとは、まあそういうものなのだとは知識では知っているが、感情の面からすると納得出来ない部分があった。","en":"That such an intelligent person could end up understanding nothing at all was something he knew intellectually could happen, yet some part of him still could not accept it emotionally.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r347","rowIndex":347,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いまはね、わりと素直に楽しめるんだ。まわりの連中は馬鹿だけどいいやつらだし、いつだって僕を信じてくれる。世の中は不思議に満ちていて、新しい発見がたくさんある。悪いことのなかにもいいことがある。こうなるまで、妹がこんなに可愛いってことも気がつかなかった。ねえ、人生は短いかもしれないし、この先ひどいことも沢山あるかもしれないけど、今のこの楽しいっていう感情は永遠に消えないものだろう？　……それに、そもそも母さんたちだって苦しめるために僕らを産んだわけじゃないからね。親を恨むのは最初から筋違いなんだ。母さんたちだって素敵な将来を夢見て結婚して、子供を産んだわけでしょう？」","en":"“Now, I can let myself enjoy things. The people around me are idiots, but they’re good people, and they always believe in me. The world is full of mysteries and new discoveries. Even bad things have some good in them. Before all this, I never realized how adorable my sister was. Life may be short, and there may be plenty of awful things ahead, but this happiness I feel right now will never disappear, will it? ...Besides, you and Father didn’t have us just to make us suffer. Resenting one’s parents was wrong from the beginning. You married and had children because you dreamed of a wonderful future too, didn’t you?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r348","rowIndex":348,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　やはり母の反応はないが、<tips=1>亮</tips>は続ける。","en":"Still his mother offered no response. <tips=1>Leung</tips> continued nonetheless.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r349","rowIndex":349,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まあとにかく、僕はいろいろと学んだんだよ。この街は、人間について学ぶには良い場所だと思う。世間の大半の連中は<tips=9>Y地区</tips>にはクソみたいな人しかいないと思ってて……まあそれは確かにそうなんだけど、でも、じゃあそれを言っている人間はそんなに立派なのかなって思うよ。僕は誰だってそこまで変わらないと思うんだ。根っから悪い奴なんかそこまでいないし、間違いを犯した奴が特別愚かだったわけでも、イカレてるわけでもない。ただちょっと、うまくいかないだけなんだ」","en":"“In any event, I’ve learned a great deal. This city is a good place to learn about people. Most of the world thinks <tips=9>Y District</tips> contains nothing but human garbage... and admittedly, that is true. But then I wonder whether the people saying so are really so admirable themselves. I don’t think anyone is all that different. There aren’t many people who are evil to the root, and the people who make mistakes aren’t exceptionally foolish or insane. Things simply don’t go quite right for them.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r350","rowIndex":350,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>の言葉は幾分熱を帯びはじめている。","en":"A quiet heat had begun to enter <tips=1>Leung’s</tips> words.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r351","rowIndex":351,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「その、ボタンの掛け違いみたいなところで、この街の人間は本当にくだらなくて馬鹿馬鹿しい死に方をするし、何だかいつもうるさく喚き合ってる。そういうのは好きじゃないけど、でも、おかげで色々学んだ。充分すぎるくらい学んだよ。……いつかこの街を出たいんだ。ずっとここにいたら僕もこの街にいる得体の知れない何かに振り回されてしまいそうだから。まあ、もしかしたら、どこへ行っても同じようなものかもしれないけれど」","en":"“Like fastening a button in the wrong hole. People in this city die for reasons so stupid and absurd, and they always seem to be shouting at one another. I don’t like that, but it has taught me a great deal. More than enough. ...One day, I want to leave this city. If I stay here forever, I feel as though some unknowable thing in it will begin throwing me around as it pleases. Though perhaps things are the same wherever you go.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r352","rowIndex":352,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　時計はもうずいぶんと遅い時間を指し示している。<tips=44>筱喬</tips>はもう寝ただろう。<tips=1>亮</tips>も明日のためにそろそろ寝る支度をしなくてはいけない。","en":"The clock already pointed to a very late hour. <tips=44>Siu-kiu</tips> had probably gone to sleep, and <tips=1>Leung</tips> too would soon have to prepare for bed and the day ahead.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r353","rowIndex":353,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「僕は何でもやってみるつもりだよ。たとえ短い命だとしても、生きるだけの価値は充分にあると、今は感じてるんだ」","en":"“I intend to try everything. Even if life is short, I feel now that it is more than worth living.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r354","rowIndex":354,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>は立ち上がり、そして母に向かってこの日最後の言葉を口にした。","en":"<tips=1>Leung</tips> rose, then spoke his final words of the day to his mother.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X18:r355","rowIndex":355,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「母さん、こんな素敵な場所に、僕を産んでくれてありがとう」","en":"“Mother, thank you for giving birth to me in such a wonderful place.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}}]},{"position":62,"code":"X17","unitId":"X17","rows":[{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r1","rowIndex":1,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=9>Y地区</tips>のメインストリートである<tips=57>滑走路通り</tips>を歩くと、シャッターを下ろしている店が目に付く。","en":"Walking along <tips=9>Y District’s</tips> main thoroughfare, <tips=57>Runway Street</tips>, I notice a conspicuous number of shuttered storefronts.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r2","rowIndex":2,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　以前は時間を問わず人であふれていたこの繁華街は、今は見る影もなく閑散としている。目つきの悪い男が酒のにおいをぷんぷんさせて歩き、向こうでは壁を背にボロをまとった子供がうずくまっている。","en":"Once crowded at all hours, this entertainment district is now a desolate shadow of its former self. A hard-eyed man walks by reeking of alcohol, while farther on, a child in rags crouches with their back against a wall.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r3","rowIndex":3,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　筆者は三年前にもこの街を訪れている。","en":"The author also visited this city three years ago.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r4","rowIndex":4,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その時は今よりもずっと栄えてはいたが、しかしそれでも、最盛期と比べるとすっかり寂しくなってしまったと感じさせられた。","en":"At the time, the city was far more prosperous than it is now; even so, compared with its heyday, it already felt utterly forlorn.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r5","rowIndex":5,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　この通りがもっとも賑やかだったのは十年ほど前、高名な<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>の最晩年の時期になるのだろう。","en":"This street was probably at its liveliest around ten years ago, during the final years of the renowned <tips=3>Chris Tse</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r6","rowIndex":6,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　当時は<tips=9>Y地区</tips>と言えば日本で最も猥雑で、危険で、雑多なもののあふれた地域であり、訪れる客の他にも、目をギラギラとさせたストリートチルドレンや、あてもなくふらつく未治療の<tips=17>タイプB</tips>発症者の姿があちこちに見られたが、三年前のその頃にはほとんど見られなくなっていた。","en":"Back then, <tips=9>Y District</tips> was the most sordid, dangerous, and chaotically diverse neighborhood in Japan. Alongside the visitors, one saw street children with hungry, glittering eyes and untreated sufferers of <tips=17>Type B</tips> wandering aimlessly everywhere. By three years ago, however, they had all but vanished.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r7","rowIndex":7,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　街並みは清潔に整えられ、ハンバーガーショップやコンビニエンスストアが進出し、かつて路上に響き渡る大きな売り声を上げていた異形の<tips=16>タイプA</tips>たちは、チェーン店の制服で<tips=77>特質変異</tips>を隠してノーマルの作る社会に溶け込んでいた。","en":"The streets had been cleaned up and put in order, hamburger restaurants and convenience stores had moved in, and the misshapen <tips=16>Type As</tips> whose loud hawking cries once rang through the streets now hid their <tips=77>trait mutations</tips> beneath chain-store uniforms and blended into the society built by Normals.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r8","rowIndex":8,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　治安は向上し、置き引きや<ruby=すり>掏摸</ruby>に出会うこともなかった。誰でも安心してその繁栄を享受できる、豊かな街になっていた。そして、かつてそこにあった猥雑さや混沌は完全に影を潜めてしまった。","en":"Public safety had improved. I encountered neither thieves preying on unattended belongings nor pickpockets. It had become a prosperous city whose abundance anyone could enjoy without fear. And the seediness and chaos that had once existed there had disappeared completely.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r9","rowIndex":9,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それはこの街らしさを失ったということでもある反面、平和と秩序がもたらされたということであり、長い間、様々な理不尽に怯えてきた住人の多くが望んでいた姿でもあったろう。","en":"This meant that the city had lost something of its character, but it also meant that peace and order had come to it. It was probably the city that many residents, long frightened by all manner of injustice, had wanted.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r10","rowIndex":10,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　これらはすべて、<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>にかわって<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>の<tips=81>龍頭</tips>となった<tips=1>謝亮</tips>の働きによるものだ。彼は<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>の圧倒的な組織力を背景に全ての敵対勢力を勢力下に置き、街に安定をもたらした。","en":"All this was the work of <tips=1>Tse Leung</tips>, who succeeded <tips=3>Chris Tse</tips> as <tips=81>Longtou</tips> of <tips=7>YS</tips>. Backed by <tips=7>YS's</tips> overwhelming organizational strength, he brought every hostile power under his control and imposed stability on the city.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r11","rowIndex":11,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　隣接区域に根を張る<tips=68>木下組</tips>などとの緊張関係はあったが、かつてないほどの強固な組織となった<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>は、彼らの侵入を許すことはない。こうした<tips=1>謝亮</tips>の方針に対し、警察は介入することなく静観の姿勢をとり、事実上黙認した。","en":"Tensions remained with the <tips=68>Kinoshita-gumi</tips> and other groups entrenched in neighboring areas, but <tips=7>YS</tips>, now stronger than ever, allowed them no incursion. The police did not intervene in <tips=1>Tse Leung’s</tips> policies, instead standing by and effectively condoning them.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r12","rowIndex":12,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　この頃、<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>の影響力は街の隅々にまで及んでいた。","en":"By then, <tips=7>YS’s</tips> influence reached into every corner of the city.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r13","rowIndex":13,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=9>Y地区</tips>でもっとも危険な地域と言えば<tips=59>暗闇通り</tips>とそこに隣接する貧民街のあたりが有名で、昔から細かい勢力が入り組んでいたが、<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>はこれも一掃した。結果として路上で春をひさぐ女は姿を完全に消し、しかるべき店の管理下で営業をするようになった。","en":"<tips=59>Darkness Street</tips> and the adjoining slums had long been notorious as the most dangerous part of <tips=9>Y District</tips>, a bewildering tangle of minor powers, but <tips=7>YS</tips> swept those away as well. As a result, women selling themselves vanished completely from the streets and began plying their trade under the management of proper establishments.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r14","rowIndex":14,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして、朝気がつくと正体不明の死体が路地に落ちているということもなくなった。ただ、理由のはっきりとした死体の数は増えた。","en":"And unidentified corpses no longer appeared in alleys overnight. The number of corpses with perfectly clear explanations, however, increased.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r15","rowIndex":15,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　人種や宗教の違う人々が住む<tips=9>Y地区</tips>で、治安を維持するには結局のところ金と暴力しかない。<tips=1>謝亮</tips>はこれを巧妙に使い、密告社会を作り上げた。","en":"In <tips=9>Y District</tips>, home to people of different races and religions, the only means of maintaining order were ultimately money and violence. <tips=1>Tse Leung</tips> wielded both with skill and built a society of informants.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r16","rowIndex":16,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　例えば裏帳簿を作って<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>への上納金を拒否するもの。例えば外部のギャング組織に通じて私利をむさぼるもの。例えば空き地で遊ぶ子供を捕まえて売り飛ばすもの。<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>の方針に逆らう全てのものは密告によって告発され、処刑された。そしてその死体は見せしめのために路上に放置されるのである。","en":"Those who kept secret books and refused to pay tribute to <tips=7>YS</tips>. Those who dealt with outside gangs for private gain. Those who seized children playing in vacant lots and sold them. Anyone who defied <tips=7>YS</tips> policy was denounced by informers and executed. The corpses were then left in the street as a warning.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r17","rowIndex":17,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　街は清潔になったが、一方で<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>への恐怖は高まっていた。","en":"The city grew cleaner, but fear of <tips=7>YS</tips> grew with it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r18","rowIndex":18,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　筆者が訪れた三年前の<tips=9>Y地区</tips>は、まさにそういった状況であった。街が清潔で健全になったかわりに、<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>の行き過ぎた支配力が空気を息苦しいものにしていた。","en":"That was precisely the state of <tips=9>Y District</tips> when the author visited three years ago. The city had become clean and respectable, but in return, <tips=7>YS's</tips> excessive control made the very air oppressive.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r19","rowIndex":19,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そのとき私は<tips=58>パラシュート通り</tips>に昔から住む商店主の家を訪ねた。そして、そのリビングルームに<tips=1>謝亮</tips>の肖像が掲げられているのを見つけた。","en":"At the time, I visited the home of a shopkeeper who had long lived on <tips=58>Parachute Street</tips>. There, in his living room, I discovered a portrait of <tips=1>Tse Leung</tips> on display.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r20","rowIndex":20,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　こんな趣味の悪いものをどうして飾っているのかと尋ねると、ここだけの秘密だと断ってから、これは魔除けなのだと教えてくれた。","en":"When I asked why he displayed something in such dreadful taste, the shopkeeper prefaced his answer by saying it was a secret between us, then explained that the portrait was a charm against evil.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r21","rowIndex":21,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　嘘の密告や疑惑をかけられたときのために、日頃からこのようなかたちで<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>への忠誠心をアピールしているのだという。","en":"He said he kept the portrait up as a standing display of loyalty to <tips=7>YS</tips>, in case anyone ever made a false report against him or cast suspicion on him.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r22","rowIndex":22,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　実際にそのような子供だましが何かの役に立つとも思えなかったし、<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>の処刑は入念な裏付けのもとに行われていた筈だから、杞憂のようにも思えるが、つまりそれ程に<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>が恐れられているということの証左だった。","en":"In fact, it hardly seemed likely that such a childish trick would do any good. Since <tips=7>YS</tips> executions were supposed to be carried out only after meticulous corroboration, the fear seemed needless. Yet the fear itself was evidence of just how deeply <tips=7>YS</tips> was dreaded.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r23","rowIndex":23,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ただ、その頃は<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>が恐れられたとは言え、この街は今のように寂れてはいなかったのである。","en":"Still, although <tips=7>YS</tips> was feared in those days, the city had not yet fallen into the decline it suffers now.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r24","rowIndex":24,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　かつてのようなエキゾチックな刺激がなくとも、清潔な、日本のどこにでもある繁華街のように街は栄えていた。","en":"Even without the exotic thrills of old, the city prospered as a clean entertainment district like any other in Japan.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r25","rowIndex":25,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しかし、それは<tips=1>謝亮</tips>の死と共に崩れた。","en":"But it all collapsed with <tips=1>Tse Leung’s</tips> death.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r26","rowIndex":26,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　二十一才の時にボスとなった彼は父と同じ難病を患い、まだ若い三十才で一線を退き、そしてその後すぐに死んだ。後継者となったのは<tips=28>トーマス・リャオ</tips>であった。この交代劇が、全てを変えたのだろう。","en":"He became boss at twenty-one, developed the same intractable disease as his father, withdrew from the front lines at the still-young age of thirty, and died soon afterward. His successor was <tips=28>Thomas Liao</tips>. That change of leadership was perhaps what changed everything.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r27","rowIndex":27,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=28>トーマス</tips>は人望もあり、けして無能なリーダーというわけではなかったが、怜悧で知られた先代ほどには人々に恐れられていなかった。","en":"<tips=28>Thomas</tips> was well liked and by no means an incompetent leader, but he inspired less fear than his famously sharp-minded predecessor.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r28","rowIndex":28,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そこでどういうことが起きたかというと、<tips=1>謝亮</tips>によって押さえつけられていた不穏分子が、彼がリーダーになったのをきっかけに、再び動き始めたのである。","en":"What happened then was that the malcontents <tips=1>Tse Leung</tips> had kept suppressed began to stir again when Thomas became leader.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r29","rowIndex":29,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　まず最初に動いたのは<tips=21>八龍会</tips>だった。","en":"The first to move was the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r30","rowIndex":30,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　驚くべきことに、十年前の<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>死亡時にすでに老人であった三人の指導者の全員が存命していた。実権を<tips=1>謝亮</tips>に奪われて、ながらく表舞台からは遠ざかっていたが、<tips=1>謝亮</tips>の死後声明を出すと、またたくまに<tips=17>タイプB</tips>たちの支配者の座に返り咲いた。","en":"Astonishingly, all three of its leaders—already old men when <tips=3>Chris Tse</tips> died ten years earlier—were still alive. <tips=1>Tse Leung</tips> had stripped them of real power, and they had remained out of the public eye for years; but when they issued a declaration after <tips=1>Tse Leung’s</tips> death, they swiftly reclaimed their position as rulers of the <tips=17>Type Bs</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r31","rowIndex":31,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　何の準備もなしに急にそんなことが出来るはずもなく、抜け目のない<tips=22>老人たち</tips>は<tips=1>謝亮</tips>の存命中から工作をしていたのだろう。","en":"They could hardly have acted so suddenly without preparation; the shrewd <tips=22>old men</tips> had probably been laying the groundwork while <tips=1>Tse Leung</tips> was still alive.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r32","rowIndex":32,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　とは言え、この時点ではまだ<tips=21>八龍会</tips>は<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>に対し明確に反旗を翻したわけではない。","en":"Even so, at this point the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips> had not yet openly rebelled against <tips=7>YS</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r33","rowIndex":33,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　あくまでも<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>の一員としての立場を保持したままで、独自の活動を開始したのであった。","en":"It began operating independently while still maintaining its position as a member of <tips=7>YS</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r34","rowIndex":34,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして、<tips=21>八龍会</tips>の動きのすぐあとに、もっと重大な事件が起きた。","en":"Soon after the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips> made its move, an even more momentous event occurred.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r35","rowIndex":35,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>のなかから『新義勝』という組織が独立したのだ。","en":"An organization called “New Yisheng” broke away from <tips=7>YS</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r36","rowIndex":36,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　かつてこの街に存在したギャング組織の名をそのまま受け継いだその組織は、かつて<tips=1>謝亮</tips>から疎外された香港人の師弟が中核をなしている。","en":"The organization took its name wholesale from a gang that had once existed in the city. At its core were Hong Kong masters and protégés whom <tips=1>Tse Leung</tips> had excluded.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r37","rowIndex":37,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そのリーダーは<tips=88>アンドリュー・マオ</tips>という二十四歳の青年で、風を操るサイキックであることから『暴風のマオ』と呼ばれていた。","en":"Its leader was a twenty-four-year-old man named <tips=88>Andrew Mao</tips>. A psychic able to control wind, he was known as “Mao the Tempest.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r38","rowIndex":38,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼は額に第三の目を書き込み、かつての英雄<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>の再来を気取っている。","en":"He painted a third eye upon his forehead and posed as the second coming of the old hero <tips=3>Chris Tse</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r39","rowIndex":39,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼らの主張はシンプルで、<tips=1>謝亮</tips>の指導によって変化したものを拒否し、彼らが崇拝する<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>初代<tips=81>龍頭</tips>にして未だに語り継がれる英雄<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>の時代に巻き戻そうというものだった。","en":"Their demand was simple: reject every change made under <tips=1>Tse Leung</tips> and turn the clock back to the age of their idol, <tips=3>Chris Tse</tips>, first <tips=81>Longtou</tips> of <tips=7>YS</tips> and a hero whose legend still endured.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r40","rowIndex":40,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　この組織が打ち出した思想は、瞬く間に街中に広がり、多くの賛同者を得た。","en":"The ideology proclaimed by the organization rapidly spread throughout the city and won a great many adherents.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r41","rowIndex":41,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その背景には<tips=88>マオ</tips>を飼い慣らしたい<tips=21>八龍会</tips>の陰謀があったとも、<tips=9>Y地区</tips>内の混乱をもくろむ<tips=68>木下組</tips>の支援があったとも言われているが、それだけでは説明がつかない。やはり、長年抑圧されていた街の人々の心に響いたのだろう。","en":"Some said that a conspiracy by the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips>, which hoped to tame <tips=88>Mao</tips>, lay behind it; others said it had support from the <tips=68>Kinoshita-gumi</tips>, which hoped to throw <tips=9>Y District</tips> into chaos. But neither explanation was sufficient. Its message must have resonated with people who had endured years of repression.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r42","rowIndex":42,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　オリジナルの<tips=69>義勝</tips>は香港人以外を受け付けない排他的なものだったが、<tips=88>マオ</tips>が作った新義勝にはそういったこだわりはなく、<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>に反発するものなら出身地や肌の色にかかわらず、全てを受け容れた。","en":"The original <tips=69>Yisheng</tips> had been an exclusionary organization that accepted no one but Hong Kongers. The New Yisheng created by <tips=88>Mao</tips> had no such fixation: it welcomed anyone opposed to <tips=7>YS</tips>, regardless of birthplace or skin color.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r43","rowIndex":43,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そもそも、古い<tips=69>義勝</tips>の時代にあったような、人種的な差別意識というものは、現在のギャング達の間では薄れている。","en":"In the first place, the sort of racial prejudice seen in the days of the old <tips=69>Yisheng</tips> has faded among the gangsters of the present day.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r44","rowIndex":44,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それは、<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>が率先して推し進めた人種・民族の融和方針の結果によるもので、皮肉にもこの方針が敵対組織を強大にしたということになる。","en":"This was the result of the policy of racial and ethnic integration that <tips=7>YS</tips> itself had championed. Ironically, that policy had strengthened an enemy organization.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r45","rowIndex":45,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ともあれ、数を得た<tips=88>マオ</tips>たちは<tips=28>トーマス</tips>の<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>に敢然と反旗を翻した。","en":"In any event, once <tips=88>Mao</tips> and his followers had gained sufficient numbers, they boldly rebelled against <tips=28>Thomas’s</tips> <tips=7>YS</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r46","rowIndex":46,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして、<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>と結びつきの強い店舗を襲撃したり、密告者として利益を得ていた人々を誅殺してまわった。","en":"They attacked businesses with close ties to <tips=7>YS</tips> and went about executing people who had profited as informers.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r47","rowIndex":47,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　この<tips=57>滑走路通り</tips>でも何度も暴力事件を起こした。","en":"They repeatedly committed acts of violence even here on <tips=57>Runway Street</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r48","rowIndex":48,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そうして治安が悪化すると、<tips=1>謝亮</tips>の代にこの地域に店を出した有名チェーンの店舗などは軒並み閉店し、残ったのは昔からこの街で商売をする、『昔ながらの』ものたちばかりだった。","en":"As public safety deteriorated, the famous chains that had opened stores in the district during <tips=1>Tse Leung’s</tips> reign closed one after another. All that remained were the “old-fashioned” merchants who had done business in the city since long ago.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r49","rowIndex":49,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　新義勝の、街を古くからの住人の手に取り戻すという目的は、一応達成されたというわけだ。","en":"New Yisheng had, after a fashion, achieved its goal of returning the city to its longtime residents.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r50","rowIndex":50,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　街が本来の住民の手に戻り、以前のような刺激的な雰囲気を復活させれば、十年前の最盛期のような賑わいが戻るだろう。多少治安が悪くなっても問題はない。実際、かつてはあれだけ危険な場所だったのに人が来ていたのだから。","en":"If the city were returned to its original inhabitants and its old, exciting atmosphere restored, the crowds of its heyday ten years ago would return as well. A little deterioration in public safety would be no problem. After all, people had flocked here even when it was every bit as dangerous in the old days.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r51","rowIndex":51,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　――というのが<tips=88>アンドリュー・マオ</tips>の理屈だった。","en":"—Such was <tips=88>Andrew Mao’s</tips> reasoning.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r52","rowIndex":52,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その答え合わせは、すぐに現実的な形で突きつけられることになるのだが。","en":"Reality would soon provide a concrete verdict on that prediction.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r53","rowIndex":53,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ともあれ、長年街を支配して来た<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>が、得体の知れぬ若者の率いる組織に敗北したというのは衝撃的な事件だった。","en":"In any event, it was shocking that <tips=7>YS</tips>, which had ruled the city for years, had been defeated by an organization led by an unknown young man.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r54","rowIndex":54,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　これをきっかけとして、いくつもの組織が反<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>を表明する。その多くは<tips=1>謝亮</tips>時代には、当時の<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>の圧倒的な勢力に屈し、不本意ながら従っていた——つまりもともと友好的とは言えない組織だが、反目したのはそうした元々忠誠心の低い外部組織だけではない。","en":"That defeat prompted numerous organizations to declare themselves against <tips=7>YS</tips>. Most had submitted reluctantly to <tips=7>YS’s</tips> overwhelming power under <tips=1>Tse Leung</tips>—organizations that had never been particularly friendly in the first place. But the opposition was not confined to such outside groups, whose loyalty had always been weak.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r55","rowIndex":55,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>内部からも、いくつもの対立組織が生まれた。<tips=28>トーマス・リャオ</tips>のやり方に疑問を持った有力者たちが、次々と独立したのである。","en":"Several rival organizations also emerged within <tips=7>YS</tips>. Powerful figures who questioned <tips=28>Thomas Liao’s</tips> methods broke away one after another.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r56","rowIndex":56,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　なかでも一番街の人々を驚かせたのは、<tips=85>二路元帥</tips><tips=25>馬世傑</tips>の離反だった。","en":"What astonished the people of the city most of all was the defection of <tips=85>Second Route Marshal</tips> <tips=25>Ma Sai-kit</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r57","rowIndex":57,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>を築いた立役者の一人である<tips=4>馬明</tips>の息子にして、<tips=1>謝亮</tips>の懐刀でもあった彼は、争いの場では常に積極的に指揮を執っていた。<tips=81>龍頭</tips>の無二の親友であり、最良の部下であると、誰もが認めていた彼の独立は誰にも予期が出来なかった。","en":"The son of <tips=4>Ma Ming</tips>, one of the chief architects of <tips=7>YS</tips>, and <tips=1>Tse Leung's</tips> right-hand man, he had always taken an active command role whenever conflict arose. Everyone regarded him as the <tips=81>Longtou's</tips> closest friend and finest subordinate. No one could have anticipated that he would break away.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r58","rowIndex":58,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=25>馬世傑</tips>を支えたのは父<tips=4>馬明</tips>のかつての部下だけでない。穏健派の<tips=28>トーマス・リャオ</tips>の平和的なやり方にどうしても賛同出来ないものたちも、彼の下に集った。","en":"It was not only his father <tips=4>Ma Ming's</tips> former subordinates who supported <tips=25>Sai-kit</tips>. Those who could not bring themselves to accept the peaceful methods of the moderate <tips=28>Thomas Liao</tips> also rallied to him.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r59","rowIndex":59,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その数は<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>全体の規模からすればさほど多いとは言えなかったが、優秀な<tips=17>タイプB</tips>やサイキックなど若手の実力者ばかりだっため、すぐに無視が出来ない勢力となった。","en":"Their numbers were not especially large compared with <tips=7>YS</tips> as a whole, but they were all formidable young figures—gifted <tips=17>Type Bs</tips>, psychics, and the like—and they quickly became a power no one could ignore.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r60","rowIndex":60,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　名誉や富に何の関心も持っていないと思われていた<tips=25>馬世傑</tips>が、このように独立した理由は、今一つはっきりしない。","en":"Why <tips=25>Ma Sai-kit</tips>, who had seemed indifferent to honor and wealth, chose to break away remained unclear.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r61","rowIndex":61,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　素直に組織に居座っていたほうが、もっと大きな権力を手に入れられたはずなのだ。かつて父を<tips=1>謝亮</tips>に殺されたことを恨みに思っているという説もあるが、噂の域を出ない。","en":"He could surely have acquired greater power by simply remaining inside the organization. One theory held that he resented <tips=1>Tse Leung</tips> for killing his father, but it had never risen above rumor.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r62","rowIndex":62,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼はどうやらサイキックであるらしいが、その能力の詳細は明らかにされてはいなかった。","en":"He was apparently a psychic, but the details of his ability had never been disclosed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r63","rowIndex":63,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　何もかもが謎に包まれている。","en":"Everything about him was shrouded in mystery.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r64","rowIndex":64,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しかし、その正体がどうあれ、彼の独立が<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>の力を削ぎ、この街に群雄割拠の時代をもたらしたことは確かだ。","en":"But whatever his true nature, his secession indisputably weakened <tips=7>YS</tips> and ushered in an age of rival warlords within the city.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r65","rowIndex":65,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=25>馬世傑</tips>のグループは、独立はしたものの、いまのところはまだ<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>とあからさまに敵対しているわけではない。","en":"Although <tips=25>Ma Sai-kit’s</tips> group had become independent, for now it was not yet openly hostile toward <tips=7>YS</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r66","rowIndex":66,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=88>マオ</tips>の新義勝とも距離を置き、沈黙を保っている。しかし、彼らと同じ道を行くつもりはなさそうだ。","en":"It also kept its distance from <tips=88>Mao’s</tips> New Yisheng and remained silent. It did not, however, appear inclined to follow the same path.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r67","rowIndex":67,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=25>馬世傑</tips>が何を考えているのか、その組織が今後どういった方針をとるのかは不明だが、その動向は他の全ての組織にとって重要なものとなるだろう。","en":"What <tips=25>Ma Sai-kit</tips> was thinking and what course his organization would take remained unknown, but its movements would matter to every other organization.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r68","rowIndex":68,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　さて、そうして重要な人員を、まるで櫛の歯を引くように失っていった<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>は、当然のことながら、その運営は困難を極めている。","en":"With key personnel disappearing one after another, leaving gaps like missing teeth in a comb, <tips=7>YS</tips> naturally found itself extraordinarily difficult to run.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r69","rowIndex":69,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　先代<tips=1>謝亮</tips>と同じように、就任直後に難しい状況に立たされた新<tips=81>龍頭</tips><tips=28>トーマス</tips>は、彼の穏健な性格どおり当初は平和的な交渉で解決を試みたのだが、これはかえって敵対者を調子づかせ、<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>からの離反をさらに作り出すきっかけとなった。","en":"Like <tips=1>Tse Leung</tips> before him, the new <tips=81>Longtou</tips> <tips=28>Thomas</tips> inherited a difficult situation the moment he took office. True to his moderate nature, he initially tried to resolve it through peaceful negotiation. That only emboldened his enemies and prompted still more defections from <tips=7>YS</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r70","rowIndex":70,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=28>トーマス</tips>は穏健派ではあったが、事態がこうまで収拾のつかないものになってしまうと、そうも言っていられない。結局、暴力を用いるほかなくなる。","en":"<tips=28>Thomas</tips> was a moderate, but with the situation this far beyond control, moderation was no longer an option. In the end, he had no choice but to resort to violence.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r71","rowIndex":71,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　まず、<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>内の大規模な粛清を行った。","en":"First, he conducted a large-scale purge within <tips=7>YS</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r72","rowIndex":72,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　新義勝やら<tips=68>木下組</tips>やらと通じてスパイとなったものが、この混乱に乗じて大量に発生していたため、一掃しなければまともに組織が動かない状況にまで陥っていたのだ。","en":"So many people had taken advantage of the confusion to become spies for New Yisheng, the <tips=68>Kinoshita-gumi</tips>, and other groups that the organization could no longer function properly unless they were swept away.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r73","rowIndex":73,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ただ、このスパイの検出はあまり精度の高いものではなかった。結果として何の罪もないメンバーが殺害されることになり、事態は凄惨を極めた。この粛清事件は組織の内外から大きな反発を呼び、<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>への非難の声明を出す組織が次々と現れ、この街での武力闘争はますます本格化してゆくのである。","en":"The methods used to identify these spies were not particularly accurate, however. Innocent members were killed as a result, and the situation became ghastly. The purge provoked fierce opposition both inside and outside the organization. Group after group issued statements condemning <tips=7>YS</tips>, and the armed struggle within the city grew ever more intense.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r74","rowIndex":74,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　このあたりの経緯は、<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>死後の抗争と似ている。","en":"The course of events resembled the conflict that followed <tips=3>Chris Tse’s</tips> death.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r75","rowIndex":75,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　歴史は繰り返すと言うとおり、これも避け得ない運命だったのだろう。","en":"History repeats itself, as the saying goes, and perhaps this too was an inescapable fate.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r76","rowIndex":76,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　当時混乱を巻き起こすきっかけとなったのが<tips=81>龍頭</tips>の地位を狙う<tips=27>廖志明</tips>の野望だったことを思うと、その息子の<tips=28>トーマス</tips>が逆に<tips=81>龍頭</tips>として組織を守る立場になったのは皮肉なものだ。","en":"When one considers that the earlier chaos was triggered by <tips=27>Liao Chi-ming’s</tips> ambition to claim the position of <tips=81>Longtou</tips>, there was a certain irony in his son <tips=28>Thomas</tips> now defending the organization as its <tips=81>Longtou</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r77","rowIndex":77,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ちなみに、この<tips=27>廖志明</tips>は<tips=1>謝亮</tips>の死後は街に戻って、<tips=28>トーマス</tips>の補佐をしている。彼自身も、今度は<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>を守る立場で反逆者たちと戦うことになったというわけだ。","en":"Incidentally, <tips=27>Liao Chi-ming</tips> returned to the city after <tips=1>Tse Leung's</tips> death and is now assisting <tips=28>Thomas</tips>. This time, he too has found himself fighting rebels from the position of defending <tips=7>YS</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r78","rowIndex":78,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　さて、現在は<tips=1>謝亮</tips>が死んで一年がすぎている。","en":"Now, one year has passed since <tips=1>Tse Leung’s</tips> death.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r79","rowIndex":79,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ギャングたちの抗争は、まだ終わってはいない。どころか、ますます過激さを増している。","en":"The gang war is not yet over. Far from it: it is growing ever more violent.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r80","rowIndex":80,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　先日も<tips=88>マオ</tips>の新義勝と、<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>の大規模な激突があり、多くの死者が出たばかりだ。","en":"Only the other day, <tips=88>Mao’s</tips> New Yisheng and <tips=7>YS</tips> clashed on a massive scale, leaving many dead.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r81","rowIndex":81,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして、この一年の間に<tips=57>滑走路通り</tips>はこんなにも変化してしまった。<tips=88>マオ</tips>の目論んだような、最盛期の繁栄は戻っては来なかった。<tips=1>謝亮</tips>の統治下で一時期姿を消していた浮浪者たちはまた路上に姿をあらわし、出店したチェーン店は全て撤退し、このような時間でも人気の少ない寂れた街になってしまったのである。","en":"And in the space of this one year, <tips=57>Runway Street</tips> had changed beyond recognition. The prosperity of its heyday—the prosperity <tips=88>Mao</tips> had envisioned—never returned. Vagrants who had briefly vanished under <tips=1>Tse Leung’s</tips> rule reappeared on the streets, every chain store that had opened pulled out, and the district became a desolate place with few people about even at this hour.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r82","rowIndex":82,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　もちろん、こうなれば警察も黙ってはいなかった。","en":"Of course, once matters reached this point, the police did not sit idle.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r83","rowIndex":83,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しかし、事態はあまりにも混沌としている。警察は介入の手段を見つけ出すため、まず徹底した調査を行うこととした。その結果として、以前<tips=9>Y地区</tips>でのゴタゴタのなかで、警察と関わりを持ったことがある筆者のもとにも、街の情勢を調査してくれないかという依頼が届いたのである。","en":"The situation was far too chaotic, however. To find some means of intervening, the police first decided to conduct a thorough investigation. As a result, a request to investigate conditions in the city reached the author as well, since he had dealt with the police during an earlier disturbance in <tips=9>Y District</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r84","rowIndex":84,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　というわけで、筆者がいまこの街を歩いているのは、警察からの依頼によるものだった。","en":"That, then, was why the author was now walking through the city: he was here at the request of the police.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r85","rowIndex":85,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　先月から<tips=9>Y地区</tips>に滞在し、主に新義勝についての調査活動を行っている。","en":"The author has been staying in <tips=9>Y District</tips> since last month, chiefly to investigate New Yisheng.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r86","rowIndex":86,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しかし、街に来てすぐに後悔した。筆者はこの街で生まれ育ったが、十年前に個人的な事情があって街を捨てている。ひさしぶりに戻って滞在をし、街の風景を眺めていると、いやなことばかり思い出して仕方ない。","en":"But the author regretted coming almost at once. He had been born and raised in this city, but abandoned it ten years ago for personal reasons. Returning after so long and spending his days among its streets, he found unpleasant memories surfacing one after another, whether he wanted them to or not.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r87","rowIndex":87,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　さっさと仕事を片付けて街を出るつもりだったのだが、調査を始めて半月ほど過ぎたころ、その仕事への取り組み方を変えさせる出来事があった。","en":"I had intended to finish the work quickly and leave the city, but about half a month into the investigation, something happened that changed how I approached the job.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r88","rowIndex":88,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　街は全体に寂れているが、<tips=57>滑走路通り</tips>の北の方だけは今も少し栄えている。そこには酒を飲ませる古い店が立ちならび、かつて私がよく通った飲食店も健在だった。","en":"The city as a whole had declined, but the northern end of <tips=57>Runway Street</tips> still retained some prosperity. Old establishments serving alcohol stood in a row there, and one restaurant I had often frequented remained in business.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r89","rowIndex":89,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　——そこで酒を飲んだ帰りである。","en":"—I was on my way back from drinking there.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r90","rowIndex":90,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「おい、おまえ！」","en":"“Hey, you!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r91","rowIndex":91,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　背後から女の声がしたが、振り向いても誰もいない。","en":"A woman’s voice came from behind me, but when I turned, no one was there.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r92","rowIndex":92,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「こっちだ、こっち」","en":"“Up here. Up here.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r93","rowIndex":93,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　声は上の方からきこえた。","en":"The voice came from above.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r94","rowIndex":94,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　顎をあげてそちらを見ると、この街特有の雲で覆われた真っ暗な夜空を背景に、女が浮かんでいる。","en":"I raised my chin and looked. A woman floated against the utterly black night sky, blanketed by the clouds peculiar to this city.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r95","rowIndex":95,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その女は、黒い服を着て、そして両手には物騒なものを抱えていた。","en":"The woman was dressed in black and cradled something dangerous in both hands.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r96","rowIndex":96,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　闇の中に黒くくすんだそれを、目を細めて識別する。","en":"Squinting, I made out its dark, dull shape against the night.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r97","rowIndex":97,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　確かこれは『AN-94』。ロシア製のアサルトライフルで、最近<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>がよく用いているものだ。","en":"An AN-94, if I remembered correctly—a Russian-made assault rifle recently favored by <tips=7>YS</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r98","rowIndex":98,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「お前、最近この街をこそこそと調べ回っているそうじゃないか」","en":"“I hear you’ve been sneaking around this city investigating things lately.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r99","rowIndex":99,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　女の顔は、電灯の光で鈍く光っている。何か表面が濡れているらしい。","en":"The woman's face glistened dully in the streetlight. Some wet substance appeared to be clinging to its surface.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r100","rowIndex":100,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　汗と言うよりも、もっと粘土のあるものが肌に張り付いている。年齢は二十代後半といったところか。","en":"It was not sweat, but something more viscous clinging to her skin. She looked to be in her late twenties.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r101","rowIndex":101,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　筆者はこの人物とは面識こそないものの、心当たりがあった。","en":"The author had never met this woman, but he had a good idea who she might be.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r102","rowIndex":102,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>には空を自由に飛び回る女のサイキックがいるという。新義勝との抗争にもしばしば姿を現し、その飛行能力と優れた銃の腕前で恐れられているそうだ。","en":"The author had heard that <tips=7>YS</tips> had a female psychic who could fly freely through the air. She was said to appear often in its clashes with New Yisheng and to be feared for both her power of flight and her superb marksmanship.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r103","rowIndex":103,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「『<tips=51>サクラ</tips>』か」","en":"“<tips=51>Sakura</tips>?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r104","rowIndex":104,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　筆者が名を呼んでも、相手は顔色一つ変えない。","en":"The woman showed no reaction when the author spoke her name.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r105","rowIndex":105,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「その気持ち悪い覆面をとれ。顔を見せろ」","en":"“Take off that revolting mask. Show me your face.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r106","rowIndex":106,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女は銃口をこちらに向けている。引き金に指をかけ、今にも撃ちそうな剣幕だ。","en":"She had the muzzle trained on me, her finger on the trigger, and looked ready to fire at any moment.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r107","rowIndex":107,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　筆者は特殊な体質があり、もし撃たれたところで大したことはないのだが、騒ぎを起こしたくなかったので、大人しくその言葉に従った。","en":"The author possessed an unusual constitution, so being shot would have done him little harm. He did not want to cause a disturbance, however, and quietly complied.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r108","rowIndex":108,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「名前を言え」","en":"“Tell me your name.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r109","rowIndex":109,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　覆面をとって素顔になった筆者に彼女は命令をする。","en":"She issued the command once the author had removed his mask and exposed his face.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r110","rowIndex":110,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=50>路地邦昭</tips>……元探偵だ」","en":"“<tips=50>Kuniaki Roji</tips>... Former detective.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r111","rowIndex":111,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　と、私は言った。","en":"I answered.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r112","rowIndex":112,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「探偵の<tips=50>路地</tips>？　知ってるぞ。でも、そいつはとっくに街から消えたと聞いている。それに、<tips=50>路地</tips>と言えば角が生えた鬼のような男として有名だったはずじゃないか。角はどこにある？　隠しているようには見えないぞ」","en":"“<tips=50>Roji</tips> the detective? I’ve heard of him. But I heard he left the city long ago. And wasn’t <tips=50>Roji</tips> famous as a demon of a man with horns? Where are your horns? You don’t seem to be hiding any.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r113","rowIndex":113,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「今は街の外でノーマルに混じって暮らしているから、目立ちたくないのさ」","en":"“I live outside the city now, among the Normals, and I don’t want to draw attention.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r114","rowIndex":114,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は前髪をめくって、角を切断した痕を見せる。","en":"I swept back my bangs and showed her the scars where my horns had been cut away.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r115","rowIndex":115,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「毎日削らなきゃすぐに伸びてくる。面倒なものだ」","en":"“They grow back almost at once unless I file them down every day. A tiresome business.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r116","rowIndex":116,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……その元探偵が、今ここで何をしている？」","en":"“...And what is a former detective doing here now?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r117","rowIndex":117,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　少し迷ったが、私は正直に言うことにした。","en":"After a moment’s hesitation, I decided to tell her the truth.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r118","rowIndex":118,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「警察に依頼されて調査しているんだよ。銃を下げた方がいい。ここでお前がおれを撃てばややこしくなる」","en":"“The police hired me to investigate. You should lower the gun. If you shoot me here, matters will become complicated.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r119","rowIndex":119,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私の言葉に<tips=51>サクラ</tips>は露骨に迷いを見せた。","en":"<tips=51>Sakura</tips> showed open hesitation at my words.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r120","rowIndex":120,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　警察と<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>は表面上はまだ協力関係にある。<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>に所属する彼女が、警察の依頼を受けて活動をしている私に危害を加えれば面倒なことになるのは理解しているだろうが、私の言葉を信じ切れないのだ。","en":"The police and <tips=7>YS</tips> still maintained an outwardly cooperative relationship. She probably understood that if she, a member of <tips=7>YS</tips>, harmed me while I was working at the police’s request, it would cause trouble. Yet she could not bring herself to trust what I said completely.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r121","rowIndex":121,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「証拠を見せてやる。……撃つなよ」","en":"“I’ll show you proof. ...Don’t shoot.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r122","rowIndex":122,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私はそう警告してからジャケットの内側に手を突っ込み、一枚のカードを取り出して彼女に見せた。","en":"After giving that warning, I slipped a hand inside my jacket, withdrew a card, and held it out for her to see.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r123","rowIndex":123,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それは、公的機関に協力するサイキックに与えられる身分証で、本来ならば禁止されているサイキック能力を限定的に使用出来る許可証でもある。この国に暮らすサイキックなら誰でも喉から手が出るほど欲しいしろもので、当然<tips=51>サクラ</tips>もそのデザインに見覚えがあるだろう。","en":"It was identification issued to psychics who assisted public institutions, and also a special permit authorizing limited use of psychic abilities that were ordinarily forbidden. Any psychic living in this country would have killed for one, and <tips=51>Sakura</tips> was bound to recognize the design.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r124","rowIndex":124,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……わかった」","en":"“...All right.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r125","rowIndex":125,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=51>サクラ</tips>は銃を下ろす。そしてそのまま飛び去ろうとしたのだが、","en":"<tips=51>Sakura</tips> lowered the rifle and was about to fly off, but—","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r126","rowIndex":126,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「おい」","en":"“Hey.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r127","rowIndex":127,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私はそれを呼び止めた。","en":"I called after her.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r128","rowIndex":128,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ちょっと話を聞かせてくれ。知りたいことがあるんだ。話してくれたら、私が新義勝について調べたいくつかの事実を、特別に教えてやろう」","en":"“Talk to me for a moment. There’s something I want to know. If you tell me, I’ll let you in on a few things I uncovered about New Yisheng.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r129","rowIndex":129,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……組織のことは何も話す事が出来ない」","en":"“...I can’t tell you anything about the organization.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r130","rowIndex":130,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>のことは聞かない。私が知りたいのは、<tips=31>エリー・ホワイト</tips>のことだ」","en":"“I won’t ask about <tips=7>YS</tips>. I want to know about <tips=31>Ellie White</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r131","rowIndex":131,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私の言葉に迷いを見せてから、","en":"She hesitated at my words.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r132","rowIndex":132,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「わかった」","en":"“All right.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r133","rowIndex":133,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=51>サクラ</tips>はそう頷いた。","en":"<tips=51>Sakura</tips> nodded.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r134","rowIndex":134,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして私はさっきまで飲んでいた店に<tips=51>サクラ</tips>を連れて戻り、彼女から話を聞き出した。","en":"I took <tips=51>Sakura</tips> back to the bar where I had been drinking and got her to tell me her story.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r135","rowIndex":135,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　闇商人<tips=31>エリー・ホワイト</tips>は初代<tips=3>クリス</tips>が<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>を結成した時からの幹部である。そして、<tips=3>クリス</tips>から<tips=1>謝亮</tips>へ時代が変わり、多くの古い幹部が排除されてゆくなか、なお立場を維持し続けた数少ない人物の一人でもある。","en":"The black-market merchant <tips=31>Ellie White</tips> had been a senior member of <tips=7>YS</tips> ever since its founding under the first <tips=3>Chris</tips>. She was also one of the few members of the old guard to retain her position through the transition from <tips=3>Chris</tips> to <tips=1>Tse Leung</tips>, even as many others were purged.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r136","rowIndex":136,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　かつては<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>の愛人だと噂され、子の<tips=1>謝亮</tips>ともそのような関係が囁かれたほど親しかった。","en":"She had once been rumored to be <tips=3>Chris Tse’s</tips> lover. She was so close to his son <tips=1>Tse Leung</tips> that people whispered the same thing about the two of them.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r137","rowIndex":137,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その<tips=31>エリー・ホワイト</tips>が、<tips=1>謝亮</tips>の死と共に<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>を離れ、そのまま消息を絶っている。","en":"But when <tips=1>Tse Leung</tips> died, <tips=31>Ellie White</tips> left <tips=7>YS</tips> and disappeared.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r138","rowIndex":138,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「警察が<tips=31>エリー</tips>さんのことを知りたがっているのか？」","en":"“Is it <tips=31>Ellie</tips> the police want to know about?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"熨田さくら10年後","displayName":"Sakura Noshida (10 Years Later)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r139","rowIndex":139,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「警察は関係ない。これはおれの趣味だ」","en":"“The police have nothing to do with it. This is a hobby of mine.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r140","rowIndex":140,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「趣味のために、あんたはその特別なサイキック能力で調査した結果を<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>の人間である私に流してくれるというのか？　私にとっては組織を離れた人間の情報を渡すことはなんでもないが、あんたにとって割の良い交換条件だとは思えないな」","en":"“For the sake of a hobby, you’re willing to share what you uncovered with that special psychic ability of yours—with me, a member of <tips=7>YS</tips>? It costs me nothing to give you information about someone who has already left the organization, but I can’t see how that makes this a good deal for you.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"熨田さくら10年後","displayName":"Sakura Noshida (10 Years Later)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r141","rowIndex":141,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=51>サクラ</tips>は疑いの視線を私に向ける。","en":"<tips=51>Sakura</tips> regarded me suspiciously.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r142","rowIndex":142,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ただ知りたいだけだよ。損得じゃない。割の良いことを選ぶだけじゃ人生はつまらなすぎる。……そう思わないか？」","en":"“I simply want to know. It isn’t about profit or loss. Life would be far too dull if all we ever chose was the advantageous course. ...Don’t you think?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r143","rowIndex":143,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あんたは信用出来ない。だが、その言葉は嫌いじゃない」","en":"“I don’t trust you. But I like what you just said.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"熨田さくら10年後","displayName":"Sakura Noshida (10 Years Later)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r144","rowIndex":144,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=31>エリー</tips>が今どこで何をしているかまでは<tips=51>サクラ</tips>でも知らなかった。だが、<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>を離れるまでの経緯は知っていた。","en":"Even <tips=51>Sakura</tips> did not know where <tips=31>Ellie</tips> now lived or what she was doing. She did, however, know the circumstances leading up to her departure from <tips=7>YS</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r145","rowIndex":145,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=31>エリー</tips>が組織を離れると宣言したのは、前述のとおり<tips=1>謝亮</tips>が死んだ直後のことである。ただ、それとは直接の関係がないと、本人は語ったらしい。","en":"As noted above, <tips=31>Ellie</tips> announced that she was leaving immediately after <tips=1>Tse Leung’s</tips> death. She herself reportedly said, however, that the two events were not directly connected.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r146","rowIndex":146,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=51>サクラ</tips>が<tips=31>エリー</tips>の口から直接聞いた理由は三つあった。","en":"<tips=51>Sakura</tips> had heard three reasons directly from <tips=31>Ellie</tips> herself.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r147","rowIndex":147,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　まず第一に、昔から彼女の仕事をサポートをしている老執事が死に、後任者が見つからず、自分一人で商売を切り回すのが困難になってきたこと。そして次に、<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>が独自の流通ルートを開拓したために、闇商人としての彼女の組織内での役割が終わったこと。","en":"First, the elderly butler who had supported her work for years had died, and no successor could be found, making the business increasingly difficult for her to manage alone. Second, <tips=7>YS</tips> had developed distribution routes of its own, bringing her role within the organization as a black-market merchant to an end.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r148","rowIndex":148,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　最後に、<tips=31>エリー</tips>自身、他の生き方をしてみたいという願望があったということだ。","en":"Finally, <tips=31>Ellie</tips> herself had wanted to try another way of life.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r149","rowIndex":149,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　このことは、生前から<tips=1>謝亮</tips>には相談していたのだという。組織にとって最重要人物の一人であるため、ずっと引き留められていたが、<tips=1>謝亮</tips>の死後実行に移したというわけだ。","en":"She said she had discussed the matter with <tips=1>Tse Leung</tips> before his death. As one of the organization’s most important figures, she had long been persuaded to stay; after <tips=1>Tse Leung</tips> died, she finally carried out the plan.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r150","rowIndex":150,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　商売人である<tips=31>エリー・ホワイト</tips>の言葉をまるきり鵜呑みにすることは出来なかったが、<tips=51>サクラ</tips>個人の印象としては、嘘だとは感じなかったと言う。","en":"One could hardly take the words of a businesswoman like <tips=31>Ellie White</tips> entirely at face value. <tips=51>Sakura’s</tips> personal impression, however, was that Ellie had not been lying.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r151","rowIndex":151,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして実際<tips=31>エリー・ホワイト</tips>は組織を抜けると邸宅を引き払い、商売をやめてしまった。他の生き方というものがどういうものなのかはわからないが、あれだけ大きくなった商売を手放すのは簡単なことではない。女の情念だ、と<tips=51>サクラ</tips>は言った。","en":"And in fact, after leaving the organization, <tips=31>Ellie White</tips> vacated her mansion and abandoned her trade. No one knew what “another way of life” might mean, but relinquishing a business of that size could not have been easy. “A woman’s passion,” <tips=51>Sakura</tips> called it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r152","rowIndex":152,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　こうした<tips=31>エリー</tips>の行動は、私は<tips=51>サクラ</tips>とは別の形で理解をした。","en":"I interpreted <tips=31>Ellie’s</tips> actions differently from <tips=51>Sakura</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r153","rowIndex":153,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=31>エリー・ホワイト</tips>は私と同じ、ほとんど不死と言って差し支えがないほどの生命力を持っている。そして、我々は年を取らない。いや、実際には老化をしているのかもしれないが、少なくとも外見的な変化をしない。事実私は十年前からまったく年を取っていないのだから、<tips=31>エリー</tips>も同様だろう。","en":"<tips=31>Ellie White</tips> possessed the same extraordinary vitality as I did—enough that one could fairly call us nearly immortal. And we did not age. No, perhaps we did age in reality, but at the very least our appearances did not change. I had not aged at all in ten years, so the same was probably true of <tips=31>Ellie</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r154","rowIndex":154,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　何十年経っても年を取らずに若々しいままでいたら、いかに顔をヴェールで隠している<tips=31>エリー・ホワイト</tips>でも不審に思われるのは間違いない。","en":"However thoroughly <tips=31>Ellie White</tips> hid her face behind a veil, people were certain to grow suspicious if decades passed and she remained young.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r155","rowIndex":155,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　他人に不老不死を知られるのは、好ましいことではない。他人のどういう感情を刺激するか全くわからないし、知られたせいでややこしいことに巻き込まれる可能性がぐっと増える。これは私自身経験のあることだ。","en":"Allowing others to learn that one did not age or die was undesirable. There was no telling what feelings it might stir in them, and discovery greatly increased the chance of becoming entangled in complications. I knew that from personal experience.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r156","rowIndex":156,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　これが、多くの人間に注目される立場の人間ならばなおさらだろう。","en":"All the more so for someone in a position that drew widespread attention.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r157","rowIndex":157,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=31>エリー</tips>に本当に「他にやりたいこと」があったのかどうかはわからない。だが、いずれにしても環境を変え、付き合う相手を変える必要があったのではないか。","en":"I did not know whether <tips=31>Ellie</tips> truly had “other things she wanted to do.” Either way, perhaps she had needed to change both her surroundings and the people with whom she associated.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r158","rowIndex":158,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「じゃあ、この街を出たのだろうかね」","en":"“Then do you suppose she left the city?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r159","rowIndex":159,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いやそれは……わかりません」","en":"“I... don’t know.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"熨田さくら10年後","displayName":"Sakura Noshida (10 Years Later)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r160","rowIndex":160,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　いつの間にか酒を注文していた<tips=51>サクラ</tips>は、頬を赤く染めていた。","en":"At some point, <tips=51>Sakura</tips> had ordered herself a drink, and now her cheeks were flushed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r161","rowIndex":161,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どうしてそう思う？」","en":"“Why do you think that?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r162","rowIndex":162,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あの人はきっと、この街が好きだと思うから……」","en":"“Because I think she must love this city...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"熨田さくら10年後","displayName":"Sakura Noshida (10 Years Later)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r163","rowIndex":163,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=51>サクラ</tips>はそう言ったが、この言葉には特別根拠があるようではなさそうだった。","en":"So <tips=51>Sakura</tips> said, though she did not appear to have any particular reason for believing it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r164","rowIndex":164,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それから私たちは情報交換をし、そしていつしか昔の<tips=9>Y地区</tips>の話になった。","en":"We went on exchanging information, and before long, we began talking about the <tips=9>Y District</tips> of the past.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r165","rowIndex":165,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>が<tips=18>ローズ・クラブ</tips>と争っていた時代の思い出話をした。<tips=51>サクラ</tips>は<tips=1>謝亮</tips>の妹<tips=44>謝筱喬</tips>と親しかったらしく、彼女のことや、兄としての<tips=1>謝亮</tips>のことを話した。そして裏切り者の<tips=25>馬世傑</tips>を激しく罵っていた。","en":"I shared memories of the era when <tips=3>Chris Tse</tips> fought the <tips=18>Rose Club</tips>. <tips=51>Sakura</tips> had apparently been close to <tips=1>Tse Leung’s</tips> sister, <tips=44>Siu-kiu Tse</tips>, and spoke about her and about what <tips=1>Tse Leung</tips> had been like as an older brother. She cursed the traitor <tips=25>Ma Sai-kit</tips> with particular venom.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r166","rowIndex":166,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　話題はやがて<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>の話になり、彼女は<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>に足を奪われたと義足を叩いて笑い、私は<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>に殺された恋人と、犬の頭をした刑事の話をした。","en":"Eventually, the conversation turned to <tips=20>Koschei</tips>. She laughed and slapped her prosthetic legs, saying <tips=20>Koschei</tips> had taken her real ones. I told her about the lover <tips=20>Koschei</tips> had killed, and about the dog-headed detective.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r167","rowIndex":167,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=51>サクラ</tips>は私の知らないことを知っており、私とは違う感じ方をしていた。同じ時代、こんなに近い場所にいながら、それぞれの立場で見えているものが違う。感じているものも違う。当たり前のことだがそれが面白く、そして既に遠い過去の出来事になったせいか全てが愛おしく思えた。","en":"<tips=51>Sakura</tips> knew things I did not, and felt differently about the things we both knew. We had lived through the same era, so near to one another, yet our different positions had allowed us to see different things and feel them differently. It was only natural, but I found it fascinating—and perhaps because it had all receded into the distant past, I found all of it dear.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r168","rowIndex":168,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しかし、このまま誰もが記録に残さなければ、この愛おしい全ては忘れ去られてしまうだろう。","en":"Yet if no one committed any of it to record, all those precious things would be forgotten.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r169","rowIndex":169,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　この<tips=51>サクラ</tips>との会話時に、ふとそう思ったのが、長い間放り出していたこの原稿を再開するきっかけとなった。","en":"The thought came to me during that conversation with <tips=51>Sakura</tips>, and prompted me to resume this manuscript after abandoning it for so long.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r170","rowIndex":170,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして次の日から、警察からの依頼をこなすかたわら、こちらの原稿のための取材も行うことになる。私の能力と人脈をつかえば他の誰にも知り得ない情報を知ることが出来た。","en":"Beginning the next day, I began gathering material for this manuscript alongside the work the police had commissioned. My ability and my connections gave me access to information no one else could have obtained.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r171","rowIndex":171,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　取材の結果はその日のうちにノートパソコンで文章にし、データはクラウドストレージと外部USBメモリの両方に保存した。メモリは<tips=57>滑走路通り</tips>で買った黒いやつで、いまもポケットに入っている。――もし私に何かがあって、パソコンが破壊され、クラウドストレージ内のデータが消去されたとしても、これがあればいつでも再生が出来る。私が古い人間であるせいか、これだけ世の中が便利になっても、どうも、物として自分が管理しないと安心が出来ないのだ。","en":"I wrote up each day’s findings on my laptop before the day was out, saving the data both to the cloud and to an external USB flash drive. It was a black one I had bought on <tips=57>Runway Street</tips>, and it is still in my pocket now. —Even if something were to happen to me, my computer were destroyed, and the data in the cloud erased, that drive would make it possible to recover the manuscript at any time. Perhaps because I am a man of an earlier age, no matter how convenient the world becomes, I cannot feel at ease unless I keep something tangible under my own control.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r172","rowIndex":172,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　実際に執筆をはじめると、何度も胸が締め付けられるような息苦しさを覚えた。","en":"When I actually began to write, my chest tightened again and again until it was difficult to breathe.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r173","rowIndex":173,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　この作品には私自身も登場人物としてあらわれる。となると、もう二度と思い出したくない、いくつかの事柄も思い出さなくてはいけなかった。――もうやめよう。諦めそうになるときはいつも、私の文筆家としての成功を願い続けてくれた、今は亡き恋人の顔が思い浮かんだ。","en":"I myself appeared in this work as a character. That meant I also had to remember several things I never wanted to recall again. —I should stop. Whenever I came close to giving up, the face of my dead lover, who had always wished for my success as a writer, came to mind.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r174","rowIndex":174,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　この恋人の面影が、この長いマラソンを私に完走させる原動力となったのである。","en":"The memory of that lover became the force that drove me to finish this long marathon.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r175","rowIndex":175,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　はじめの予定では、この稿は<tips=1>謝亮</tips>と殺人鬼<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>の因縁を中心に据えた物語にする予定だった。しかし、調べてゆくうちに<tips=86>灰上姉妹</tips>と<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>の関係が気になり、<tips=10>見土道夫</tips>や<tips=5>太刀川</tips>医師のことも書きたくなり、思いのまま筆を進めてゆくうちになんだか焦点のぼやけたものになってしまったかもしれない。","en":"My original plan was to center this manuscript on the tangled history between <tips=1>Tse Leung</tips> and the murderer <tips=20>Koschei</tips>. As I researched, however, I found myself drawn to the relationship between the <tips=86>Haigami sisters</tips> and <tips=20>Koschei</tips>. I wanted to write about <tips=10>Michio Mido</tips> and <tips=5>Doctor Tachikawa</tips> as well. By following my pen wherever it led, I may have allowed the manuscript’s focus to blur.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r176","rowIndex":176,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　書いている間はずっとそのことが気になったが、しかし物語が結末に近づいた今、これで良かったのだと確信している。","en":"That troubled me throughout the writing. Now that the story approaches its conclusion, however, I am certain this was the right form.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r177","rowIndex":177,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　この稿で取り上げた時代の前にも、そして後にも、人が生きているかぎり、そこには膨大なドラマが存在する。","en":"Before the period covered by this manuscript and after it, wherever people are living, there are countless stories unfolding.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r178","rowIndex":178,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そもそも、<tips=1>謝亮</tips>のドラマを生み出したのは父の<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>のドラマであるし、そして<tips=1>謝亮</tips>の死もまた次のドラマのはじまりとなった。","en":"After all, <tips=1>Tse Leung’s</tips> story was born from that of his father, <tips=3>Chris Tse</tips>, and <tips=1>Tse Leung’s</tips> death in turn became the beginning of the next.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r179","rowIndex":179,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>謝亮</tips>の死んだ後のドラマはこの稿には収めることが出来なかったが、実に興味深いものである。","en":"I was unable to include the story that followed <tips=1>Tse Leung’s</tips> death in this manuscript, but it is a fascinating one.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r180","rowIndex":180,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=28>トーマス・リャオ</tips>と『暴風のマオ』と<tips=25>馬世傑</tips>が、三つ巴となって残酷でスリリングな戦いを繰り広げている。<tips=21>八龍会</tips>の動きも目を離せない。","en":"<tips=28>Thomas Liao</tips>, Mao the Tempest, and <tips=25>Ma Sai-kit</tips> are locked in a brutal, thrilling three-way struggle. The <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips> bears watching as well.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r181","rowIndex":181,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それに、<tips=15>ボーダーエリア</tips>で最近不気味な広がりを見せている新興宗教も気になる。この新興宗教は、どうもギャングの争いに関わっているらしいのだが、まったく実態が掴めない。しかし、確実に勢力を拡大している。","en":"Then there is the new religious movement that has lately begun to spread ominously through the <tips=15>Border Area</tips>. It appears to have some connection to the gang war, but I have been unable to grasp its true nature at all. Its influence, however, is unquestionably growing.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r182","rowIndex":182,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　この勢力の調査については、私も心底困っていて——ほら、あの片隅で祈っている白い布をかぶったやつがその信者だぞ。","en":"I myself am at my wits’ end trying to investigate this group—and look, that figure in white praying in the corner is one of its believers.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r183","rowIndex":183,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　こんな具合に街のそこらじゅうに信者がいるのだが、彼らは絶対に組織について語らないし、そもそもまともな会話にならず、誰かに調査を頼んでも消息不明になってしまい、どうしてもその実体を探ることが出来ないのだ。","en":"Believers like that are everywhere in the city, but they never speak about their organization. It is impossible even to hold a sensible conversation with them, and anyone hired to investigate them disappears. I have found no way to uncover the organization’s true nature.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r184","rowIndex":184,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　さらに、<tips=13>ヘドロ団地</tips>もどうもきなくさいようだ。団地のリーダーである<tips=14>深沢</tips>は、<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>の弱体化を見て長年続いた同盟関係を破棄し、街の覇権争いに参加しようという動きを見せている。彼らが参入すれば、街にはさらなる混乱がもたらされるだろう。","en":"The <tips=13>Sludge Housing Complex</tips> also appears to be up to something ominous. Its leader, <tips=14>Fukazawa</tips>, has seen <tips=7>YS</tips> weaken and is moving to end their long alliance and join the struggle for supremacy over the city. If his people enter the conflict, the city will be plunged into still greater chaos.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r185","rowIndex":185,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=14>深沢</tips>は<tips=88>マオ</tips>とは犬猿の仲であるため、新義勝が苦しい立場に追いやられる可能性がある。そうしたら、<tips=25>馬世傑</tips>も動くのだろうか。","en":"<tips=14>Fukazawa</tips> and <tips=88>Mao</tips> are bitterly at odds, so New Yisheng may find itself in a difficult position. If that happens, will <tips=25>Ma Sai-kit</tips> make a move as well?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r186","rowIndex":186,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　――そう言えば、余談の余談になってしまうが、半年ほど前に<tips=88>マオ</tips>たちと<tips=13>ヘドロ団地</tips>が小競り合いを起こした時、団地側に目を金色に光らせた少女が現れて、念動力で<tips=88>マオ</tips>が巻き起こす暴風に対抗したという噂が流れた。","en":"—This is becoming an aside within an aside, but when <tips=88>Mao</tips> and the <tips=13>Sludge Housing Complex</tips> skirmished about six months ago, a rumor spread that a girl with shining golden eyes appeared on the complex’s side and used telekinesis to oppose the tempest <tips=88>Mao</tips> had unleashed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r187","rowIndex":187,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　もしこれが本当なら<tips=12>灰上江梨子</tips>が生きていたということになるが、その真偽は定かではない。","en":"If true, it would mean that <tips=12>Eriko Haigami</tips> was still alive, but the truth of the story remains uncertain.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r188","rowIndex":188,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それも、時間が全て明らかにするだろう。","en":"Time will probably reveal that as well.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r189","rowIndex":189,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=28>トーマス</tips>の<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>が持ちこたえるのか、それとも別の組織がとってかわるのか。","en":"Will <tips=28>Thomas’s</tips> <tips=7>YS</tips> hold out, or will another organization take its place?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r190","rowIndex":190,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　いつかこの物語が終わっても、また次の物語がはじまる。そこに街があり、人が生きている限り、物語は複雑に絡み合いながらめぐりつづける。","en":"Even when this story ends one day, another will begin. So long as the city remains and people live within it, their stories will continue to circle and intertwine.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r191","rowIndex":191,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それを、稿の起承転結のために、きっぱり区切ってしまうのは、一種の欺瞞ではないだろうか。","en":"To cut those stories cleanly apart merely to give a manuscript its neat beginning, development, turn, and conclusion—is that not a kind of dishonesty?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r192","rowIndex":192,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そう開き直ることで、多くの脇道を収録することになってしまった言い訳は出来た。しかし、それならラストシーンをどうするか？　この世界では物語が永遠に続いてゆくのだとしても、原稿というものはどこかで区切りをつけて終わらせなくてはならない。","en":"By taking that defiant position, I had found my excuse for including so many digressions. But then, what was I to do for a final scene? Even if stories continued forever in this world, a manuscript had to draw a line somewhere and come to an end.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r193","rowIndex":193,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　この物語は<tips=1>謝亮</tips>を中心にしている。だから、単純に、彼の死の場面を書き、それで終わりにすればいいのかもしれないが、私はなにか納得がいかなかった。","en":"This story centers upon <tips=1>Tse Leung</tips>. Perhaps I should simply describe his death and end there. But I could not accept that.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r194","rowIndex":194,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　実はこの章の文章は、原稿を一度最後まで書いて完成させたあとに付け足したものだ。","en":"In fact, I added the text of this chapter after completing the manuscript once from beginning to end.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r195","rowIndex":195,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　最初は、ここで言っているように、<tips=1>謝亮</tips>の死をラストシーンにして原稿をしめくくったのだが、どうにもしっくりこなかった。このまま発表していいのか、それとも別の終わり方にするべきか、悩んでいる時に、その人物から連絡があった。","en":"At first, as I suggested here, I had made <tips=1>Tse Leung’s</tips> death the final scene and ended the manuscript there, but it did not feel right. As I agonized over whether to publish it as it was or find another ending, that person contacted me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r196","rowIndex":196,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　一応その人物には、こちらから連絡を送りつけてはいた。しかし、まさか折り返してくるとは思わなかった。","en":"I had sent that person a message of my own, more or less out of the blue. But I never imagined they would get back to me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r197","rowIndex":197,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　――今、私がこの寂れた<tips=57>滑走路通り</tips>を歩いているのは、その人物に会うためだ。","en":"—And now, I am walking down desolate <tips=57>Runway Street</tips> to meet that person.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r198","rowIndex":198,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=57>滑走路通り</tips>を通り抜けたところで、一台の車が停まっているのが目に入る。黒光りする高級車。この地域ではギャングくらいしか乗り付けないような上等のシロモノである。","en":"At the far end of <tips=57>Runway Street</tips>, I notice a car parked ahead. A gleaming black luxury car—the sort of high-end vehicle that no one but a gangster would drive into this neighborhood.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r199","rowIndex":199,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私か近づくと、ドアが開いて一人の女性が降りた。","en":"When I approached, the door opened and a woman stepped out.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r200","rowIndex":200,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どうも」","en":"“Hello.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐松子","displayName":"Matsuko Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r201","rowIndex":201,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　と私が軽く挨拶をすると、相手は深々と頭を下げ、","en":"When I offered that casual greeting, she bowed deeply.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r202","rowIndex":202,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「お久しぶりです。<tips=50>路地</tips>さん」","en":"“It’s been a long time, <tips=50>Mr. Roji</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐松子","displayName":"Matsuko Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r203","rowIndex":203,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そう笑ったのは、かつて<tips=55>汐松子</tips>と呼ばれていた人物であった。","en":"The woman who smiled at me had once been known as <tips=55>Matsuko Shio</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r204","rowIndex":204,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ボディーガードは連れてこなくていいのかい？」","en":"“You don’t need your bodyguard?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r205","rowIndex":205,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　車に残されたままでいる彼女の連れを振り返りながら私はそう尋ねた。","en":"I looked back toward the companion she had left inside the car as I asked.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r206","rowIndex":206,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いいんです。……私たちにボディーガードは必要ありますか？」","en":"“It’s fine. ...Do we really need bodyguards?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐松子","displayName":"Matsuko Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r207","rowIndex":207,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　並んで歩く彼女は、そう言って少し笑った。","en":"She smiled a little as she walked beside me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r208","rowIndex":208,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「過信しちゃいけないよ。私たちだって無敵というわけじゃない」","en":"“Don’t get overconfident. Even people like us aren’t invincible.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r209","rowIndex":209,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうですけど。大丈夫ですよ。フフ……」","en":"“That’s true, but we’ll be all right. Hee-hee...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐松子","displayName":"Matsuko Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r210","rowIndex":210,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女は何が楽しいのか弾む声で言う。","en":"I could not tell what she found so amusing, but there was a buoyant note in her voice.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r211","rowIndex":211,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「でも、<tips=50>路地</tips>さんは本当にその格好なんですね。聞いてはいましたが、実際に見ると、なんというか、すごく不思議な気分です。……今日これから会う人のために、用意したんですか？」","en":"“So you really do dress like that, <tips=50>Roji</tips>. I’d heard about it, but actually seeing you this way feels... well, very strange. ...Did you put that outfit together for the person we’re about to meet?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐松子","displayName":"Matsuko Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r212","rowIndex":212,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=55>松子</tips>は私の服装を上から下まで眺めてから言った。","en":"<tips=55>Matsuko</tips> looked me up and down as she asked.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r213","rowIndex":213,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いや、今日が特別ってわけじゃない。この街の調査をはじめてからずっとこれを着ている。この格好でいると、こんな私でも、自分以外のもののために行動出来るような気がしてね。けっして、感傷のつもりではないんだ。……いや、感傷なのかな」","en":"“No, today isn’t special. I’ve worn this ever since I began investigating the city. Dressed this way, I feel that even a man like me can act for the sake of something beyond himself. It isn’t sentimentality. ...Or perhaps it is.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r214","rowIndex":214,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どちらにしても、いいことだと思います」","en":"“Either way, I think it’s a good thing.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐松子","displayName":"Matsuko Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r215","rowIndex":215,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私に不死の血を分け与えた彼女はそう笑った。","en":"The woman who had shared her immortal blood with me smiled.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r216","rowIndex":216,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その笑顔は、もう十年も経つのにあの時とまったくかわらない。比喩ではなく、年をとっていないのだ。","en":"Ten years have passed, yet that smile has not changed at all since the last time I saw it. I do not mean that figuratively: she has not aged.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r217","rowIndex":217,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　不死の者特有の、老化の遅さだとか、そういった話ではない。むしろ若くなっているのではないだろうか？","en":"Nor was this merely the slow aging peculiar to the immortal. Might she, in fact, have grown younger?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r218","rowIndex":218,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女は今、義理の父である<tips=54>汐健慈朗</tips>の事業を引継いで、経営者となっている。表向きには死んだことになっている『<tips=55>汐松子</tips>』とは別人ということになっていて、名前も違う。","en":"She has now inherited the business of her adoptive father, <tips=54>Kenjiro Shio</tips>, and become its proprietor. Officially, she is someone entirely separate from ‘<tips=55>Matsuko Shio</tips>,’ who is considered dead, and even goes by a different name.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r219","rowIndex":219,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「妹ってことになってるんですよ。バカみたいでしょう？」","en":"“The story is that I’m her younger sister. Ridiculous, isn’t it?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐松子","displayName":"Matsuko Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r220","rowIndex":220,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=55>松子</tips>はそう言って笑った。","en":"<tips=55>Matsuko</tips> laughed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r221","rowIndex":221,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　十年前、あの無惨な死体となっていた光景がまだ焼き付いている私からすると、同じ顔がこんなふうに元気そうに笑っているのは不思議な気分だった。","en":"The sight of her mutilated corpse ten years earlier remained seared into my mind. Seeing the same face laugh so brightly gave me a strange feeling.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r222","rowIndex":222,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　あの夜地下室で<tips=1>謝亮</tips>が<tips=12>灰上江梨子</tips>から受け取った小指が、<tips=54>汐健慈朗</tips>の実験室で再生されて、これほど完全な形で蘇るとは。","en":"To think that the little finger <tips=1>Tse Leung</tips> received from <tips=12>Eriko Haigami</tips> in the basement that night could be regenerated in <tips=54>Kenjiro Shio’s</tips> laboratory and restored to life in such perfect form.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r223","rowIndex":223,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　当時はもちろんそんな事情は全く知らなかったが、数々の取材を終えた今、私はほぼ全ての真相を知っている。","en":"At the time, of course, I knew nothing of those circumstances. Now that I have completed my extensive research, however, I know nearly the whole truth.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r224","rowIndex":224,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=50>路地</tips>さんのことも、<tips=5>太刀川</tips>先生のことも、良く知ってますよ」","en":"“I know all about you, <tips=50>Roji</tips>, and about <tips=5>Doctor Tachikawa</tips> too.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐松子","displayName":"Matsuko Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r225","rowIndex":225,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>謝亮</tips>は<tips=54>健慈朗</tips>に彼女の小指を渡すとき、『<tips=55>汐松子</tips>』時代の記憶を与えず、まったくの別人として育てるよう指示したと聞いているが、<tips=54>汐</tips>はその約束を守らなかったようである。","en":"I had heard that when <tips=1>Tse Leung</tips> gave <tips=54>Kenjiro</tips> her little finger, he instructed him to give her none of her memories from the time when she was <tips=55>Matsuko Shio</tips>, but to raise her as an entirely different person. <tips=54>Shio</tips>, it seems, did not keep that promise.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r226","rowIndex":226,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「でも、父にしても、仕方なかったんですよ」","en":"“But Father really had no choice.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐松子","displayName":"Matsuko Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r227","rowIndex":227,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女はそう言って、生物学的には何の繋がりもない父を擁護した。","en":"With those words, she defended the father to whom she had no biological relation whatsoever.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r228","rowIndex":228,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　再生された<tips=55>松子</tips>は、おぼろげながら以前の記憶を引き継いでいた。それはあまりにも断片的で、自分でもただの夢なのか、本当のことなのかもわからないようなものだった。","en":"The regenerated <tips=55>Matsuko</tips> had inherited faint memories of her earlier life. They were so fragmentary that even she could not tell whether they were real or merely dreams.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r229","rowIndex":229,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その記憶は彼女の感情をかき乱し、不安定にした。それを見守る<tips=54>健慈朗</tips>は、事実を伝えないわけにはいかなかったのだと言う。そしていくつかの事実を与えると、記憶は少しずつ鮮明になり、最終的にはほとんど元通りになった。","en":"Those memories threw her emotions into turmoil and left her unstable. Watching her suffer, <tips=54>Kenjiro</tips> felt he had no choice but to tell her the truth. Once he gave her some of the facts, her memories gradually grew clearer, until they had ultimately returned almost in full.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r230","rowIndex":230,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　とすると、脳ってのは物事を記憶する場所ではないってことか？　それとも、彼女の特殊な血にはサイキックの能力に似た別の仕組みがあるのか。あるいは、あとから学習しただけのことを、自分の本当の記憶と思い込んでいるのか。","en":"Did that mean the brain was not where memories were stored? Or did her extraordinary blood possess some other mechanism akin to a psychic ability? Or had she merely learned these things later, then mistaken them for her own true memories?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r231","rowIndex":231,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　――何にしろ、ここにいるのは<tips=55>汐松子</tips>だということには変わりない。","en":"Whatever the answer, it did not change the fact that the person here was <tips=55>Matsuko Shio</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r232","rowIndex":232,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どれだけ、<tips=1>亮</tips>さんに会いたかったことか……」","en":"“I wanted to see <tips=1>Ryo</tips> so desperately...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐松子","displayName":"Matsuko Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r233","rowIndex":233,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=55>松子</tips>は寂しげに唇を噛む。","en":"<tips=55>Matsuko</tips> bit her lip, looking lonely.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r234","rowIndex":234,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　記憶を取り戻したとは言え、かつての恋人に会うことも、連絡をすることも出来なかった。","en":"Despite recovering those memories, she could neither meet her former lover nor contact him.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r235","rowIndex":235,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　少なくとも、その切ない感情は本物には違いない。","en":"At the very least, there could be no doubt that the ache in her heart was genuine.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r236","rowIndex":236,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　汐家の地下室で再生された彼女はごく幼いうちに<tips=9>Y地区</tips>から連れ出され、過去の彼女を知る者がいない場所でごく当たり前の生活をしている。――言い忘れたが、今ではもう<tips=17>タイプB</tips>はかつてのように差別を受ける対象ではなくなりつつあった。","en":"Regenerated in the basement of the Shio home, she was taken out of <tips=9>Y District</tips> while still very young and lived an entirely ordinary life in a place where no one knew the person she had once been. I should mention that <tips=17>Type Bs</tips> were by then gradually ceasing to face the discrimination of earlier years.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r237","rowIndex":237,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　八年ほど前に、以前『<tips=45>ローズ</tips>』がそうであったように、『<tips=46>ネオ・ローズ</tips>』のレシピが何者かによってネット上に流された。おそらく<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>内部の誰かの差し金だろうが、事実は未だ明らかになっていない。","en":"About eight years ago, the formula for <tips=46>Neo Rose</tips> was leaked online by an unknown party, just as the formula for <tips=45>Rose</tips> had been before it. Someone inside <tips=7>YS</tips> was probably responsible, but the truth has never come to light.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r238","rowIndex":238,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　この驚くべき特効薬の製法が全ての人々に公開されると、<tips=17>タイプB</tips>治療に革命が起きた。『<tips=46>ネオ・ローズ</tips>』も触れ込みほどに完璧な薬というわけではなく、問題の多い薬品であったが、その薬を研究することで、さまざまな種類の薬が生まれ、今では症状にあわせて適切な薬を投与すれば、ノーマルとほとんど変わらずに生活が出来るようになっている。","en":"When the formula for this astonishing remedy was made public, it revolutionized <tips=17>Type B</tips> treatment. <tips=46>Neo Rose</tips> was not the flawless drug its publicity had promised, but a substance fraught with problems. Research into it nevertheless produced medications of many kinds. Today, administering the appropriate medicine for a patient’s symptoms allows a Type B to live in almost the same way as a Normal.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r239","rowIndex":239,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ただその場合でも<tips=95>金眼現象</tips>だけは残るため、<tips=17>タイプＢ</tips>であることを完全に隠すことは出来ない。","en":"Even then, the <tips=95>golden-eye phenomenon</tips> remained, so a person could not completely conceal that they were a <tips=17>Type B</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r240","rowIndex":240,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　これは、私や<tips=55>松子</tips>にとっては都合が良かった。","en":"For <tips=55>Matsuko</tips> and me, that was convenient.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r241","rowIndex":241,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私たち<tips=97>特殊なタイプＢ</tips>は<tips=78>金色の目</tips>を消すことが出来ない。もし<tips=46>ネオ・ローズ</tips>による治療で、一般的な<tips=17>タイプＢ</tips>の<tips=95>金眼現象</tips>が消失するのだったら、私たちばかりが目立ってしまうだろう。","en":"We <tips=97>special Type Bs</tips> cannot make our <tips=78>golden eyes</tips> disappear. If treatment with <tips=46>Neo Rose</tips> were to eliminate the <tips=95>golden-eye phenomenon</tips> in ordinary <tips=17>Type Bs</tips>, people like us would be the only ones left standing out.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r242","rowIndex":242,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　とにかく、こういった環境の変化があったため、<tips=55>松子</tips>は<tips=95>金眼</tips>を隠すことなく普通に友だちを作り、普通に授業を受け、何の変哲もない平和な人生を送ることが出来たのである。","en":"In any event, because the world had changed in this way, <tips=55>Matsuko</tips> was able to make friends without hiding her <tips=95>golden eyes</tips>, attend ordinary classes, and live an uneventful, peaceful life.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r243","rowIndex":243,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　この平和な生活こそ<tips=1>謝亮</tips>の望みであり、<tips=54>健慈朗</tips>も同じ気持ちであることを<tips=55>松子</tips>は知っている。だから、<tips=9>Y地区</tips>で<tips=81>龍頭</tips>として活躍する<tips=1>謝亮</tips>と連絡をとれなかった。","en":"<tips=55>Matsuko</tips> knew that this peaceful life was precisely what <tips=1>Tse Leung</tips> wanted for her, and that <tips=54>Kenjiro</tips> felt the same. That was why she could not contact <tips=1>Tse Leung</tips> while he was active as <tips=81>Longtou</tips> in <tips=9>Y District</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r244","rowIndex":244,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　もし彼と接点を持てば、彼女の平和な生活は間違いなく変化してしまうだろう。あるいは、<tips=1>謝亮</tips>に迷惑をかけてしまうかもしれない。もし彼が望むなら、向こうから連絡をしてくるはずだ。彼は自分が<tips=54>健慈朗</tips>のところにいるのを知っているはずなのだから。彼から何か来るのを待つしかないのだと、<tips=55>松子</tips>は考えた。","en":"If she established any connection with him, her peaceful life would undoubtedly change. She might cause trouble for <tips=1>Tse Leung</tips> as well. If he wanted contact, he would reach out to her himself; he must know that she was with <tips=54>Kenjiro</tips>. <tips=55>Matsuko</tips> decided that all she could do was wait for some word from him.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r245","rowIndex":245,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そうして、これが<tips=1>謝亮</tips>のためなのだと自分に言いきかせながら生活をしていた。しかし、欲求を完全に殺してしまうことは出来ない。<tips=9>Y地区</tips>で<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>がらみの事件があればニュースになることもあり、そんなときは<tips=55>松子</tips>もパソコンにかじりついてその詳細に目を通した。しかし、そのほとんどは都合良く歪められていたり、極端な情報不足だったりで、かえって彼女をもどかしくさせるだけだった。","en":"And so she lived on, telling herself that she was doing it for <tips=1>Tse Leung</tips>. Yet she could not kill the desire completely. Incidents involving <tips=7>YS</tips> in <tips=9>Y District</tips> sometimes reached the news, and when they did, <tips=55>Matsuko</tips> glued herself to her computer and devoured every detail. Almost every report, however, was either distorted for someone’s convenience or desperately short on information. They only compounded her frustration.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r246","rowIndex":246,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「一度だけ、病気が進行して包帯でグルグルになった<tips=1>亮</tips>さんの姿が公開されたことがあったでしょう？　あの時は、もう本当にいてもたってもいられなくて、家から飛び出そうとしてしまって。父が力ずくで止めてくれなければ、この街まで来ていたと思います」","en":"“Once, they released an image of <tips=1>Ryo</tips> after his illness had progressed and he was wrapped from head to toe in bandages, remember? I truly couldn’t bear it. I nearly ran out of the house. If Father hadn’t stopped me by force, I think I would have come all the way to this city.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐松子","displayName":"Matsuko Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r247","rowIndex":247,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　並んで歩きながら、彼女はそう笑った。","en":"She laughed as we walked side by side.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r248","rowIndex":248,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　この力ずくで止めてくれた<tips=54>汐健慈朗</tips>も、去年肝臓を患って死亡している。","en":"<tips=54>Kenjiro Shio</tips>, who had stopped her by force, had himself died of liver disease the previous year.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r249","rowIndex":249,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　アルコールの影響なのは間違いない。<tips=55>松子</tips>は彼に不死の血を分け与えることを提案したが、本人は最後までかたくなに拒否したと言う。","en":"Alcohol was unquestionably responsible. <tips=55>Matsuko</tips> said that she offered him her immortal blood, but he stubbornly refused until the end.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r250","rowIndex":250,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「急に引き継がされた仕事のせいで毎日目が回るほど忙しくて、やっと<tips=1>亮</tips>さんのことを考えないで済む日も増えたかと思ったら、お父さんが亡くなったわけでしょう？　……そしてその直後に<tips=1>亮</tips>さんが亡くなったというニュースを見た時は、ショックのあまり心臓が止まるかと思いました。まあ、もし止まっても、私の心臓はしばらくすればすぐにまた動き出すのでしょうけど」","en":"“The work dropped into my lap so suddenly that every day left my head spinning. Just when there were finally more days when I was too busy to think about <tips=1>Ryo</tips>, Father died. ...Then, immediately afterward, I saw the news that <tips=1>Ryo</tips> had died too, and I thought the shock might stop my heart. Though even if it did, mine would probably start beating again before very long.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐松子","displayName":"Matsuko Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r251","rowIndex":251,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=55>松子</tips>は苦笑する。","en":"<tips=55>Matsuko</tips> smiled wryly.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r252","rowIndex":252,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　朗らかに振る舞ってはいるが、彼女が緊張を誤魔化すためにそうしているというのが、声色と表情でわかった。","en":"She carried herself brightly, but I could hear in her voice and see in her expression that she was trying to hide her nervousness.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r253","rowIndex":253,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　これから私たちはとある人物と会う。<tips=55>汐松子</tips>はその時、どんな感情を抱くのか。それは私にもわからない。","en":"We are about to meet a certain person. What <tips=55>Matsuko Shio</tips> will feel when that happens, even I cannot say.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r254","rowIndex":254,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その前に、<tips=1>謝亮</tips>の死について書こう。","en":"Before that, let me write about <tips=1>Tse Leung’s</tips> death.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r255","rowIndex":255,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その日、彼は<tips=28>トーマス・リャオ</tips>の結婚披露宴に参加していた。","en":"That day, he attended <tips=28>Thomas Liao’s</tips> wedding reception.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r256","rowIndex":256,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=9>Y地区</tips>特有のすっきりしない曇り空の下、教会の屋根にかかげられた十字架がくすんでいた。","en":"Beneath <tips=9>Y District’s</tips> characteristically dismal overcast sky, the cross raised upon the church roof looked tarnished.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r257","rowIndex":257,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そこはかつて<tips=28>トーマス</tips>と<tips=1>亮</tips>の共通の幼なじみであり、今は亡き<tips=4>馬明</tips>の娘が披露宴をあげた場所だった。縁起が悪いという意見もあったが、<tips=28>トーマス</tips>は亡き友人の思い出の場所であるこの場所にこだわった。そうした感傷的なところが、<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>のリーダーとしては相応しくないという意見もあり、また逆に新鮮なものを生み出すのでないかという意見もあった。","en":"This was the church where the daughter of the late <tips=4>Ma Ming</tips>, a childhood friend shared by <tips=28>Thomas</tips> and <tips=1>Ryo</tips>, had held her wedding reception. Some considered it inauspicious, but <tips=28>Thomas</tips> insisted on returning to a place filled with memories of his departed friend. Some said that such sentimentality made him ill-suited to lead <tips=7>YS</tips>; others thought, conversely, that it might allow him to create something new.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r258","rowIndex":258,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=28>トーマス</tips>はこの三日前に、<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>のトップの地位を<tips=1>亮</tips>から引き継いでいた。","en":"<tips=28>Thomas</tips> had inherited the highest position in <tips=7>YS</tips> from <tips=1>Ryo</tips> three days earlier.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r259","rowIndex":259,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　肩書きとしては社長と呼んだ方が正しいのだが、みなは<tips=81>龍頭</tips>とこれまでどおりの呼称で彼を呼んだ。他の役職についても、古い呼び方が使われている。","en":"Strictly speaking, his proper title was company president, but everyone continued to call him <tips=81>Longtou</tips>, as before. The old names remained in use for the other ranks as well.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r260","rowIndex":260,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　例えば<tips=85>二路元帥</tips>を部長と呼んだり、<tips=80>紅棍</tips>を営業課と呼ぶのは、どうもしっくり来ない。","en":"Calling the <tips=85>Second Route Marshal</tips> a department head, for example, or a <tips=80>Red Pole</tips> the Sales Department simply did not feel right.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r261","rowIndex":261,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=28>トーマス</tips>は新郎らしく、白いスーツに身を包んでいる。いつもの柔らかな微笑を口元にたたえ、祝福の言葉に丁寧に対応していた。","en":"<tips=28>Thomas</tips>, every inch the bridegroom, was dressed in a white suit. His usual gentle smile on his lips, he graciously acknowledged each guest’s congratulations.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r262","rowIndex":262,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　新婦は李小玉。かつては<tips=29>アイス</tips>という偽の名で<tips=28>トーマス</tips>のボディーガードを務めていた彼女は、今でも親しいものにはその名で呼ばれている。","en":"The bride was Li Xiaoyu. Once <tips=28>Thomas’s</tips> bodyguard under the alias <tips=29>Ice</tips>, she was still called by that name among her close friends.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r263","rowIndex":263,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　普段は前髪をたらして顔の反面を覆うやけどを隠しているのだが、その日は花嫁らしく髪の毛をあげて、堂々とありのままの顔を出して微笑んでいた。","en":"She ordinarily wore her bangs down to conceal the burns covering half her face. For her wedding, she had swept up her hair and smiled proudly with her face wholly exposed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r264","rowIndex":264,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　夫婦は二人並んで、来客たちに挨拶をしていた。","en":"Husband and wife stood together greeting their guests.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r265","rowIndex":265,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>は披露宴が始まってから車椅子で現れた。","en":"<tips=1>Ryo</tips> arrived in a wheelchair after the reception had begun.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r266","rowIndex":266,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　父と同じ病に蝕まれている彼は、すっかり症状が進行して皮膚組織が崩れ、痛み止めなしでは生活が出来なくなっている。","en":"The same illness that had consumed his father had advanced until the tissues of his skin were breaking down, leaving him unable to live without painkillers.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r267","rowIndex":267,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　外に出るときは晩年の父がそうであったように体中に包帯を巻き付け、かつて街の女どもを騒がせた美貌は見る影もない。","en":"When he went outside, he wound bandages around his entire body as his father had in his final years. Nothing remained of the beauty that had once set the women of the city aflutter.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r268","rowIndex":268,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　会場に来るまで彼の車椅子を押していたのは<tips=30>レイレイ</tips>だったが、<tips=25>馬世傑</tips>がさっと近寄って彼女にかわった。","en":"<tips=30>Leilei</tips> had pushed his wheelchair to the venue, but <tips=25>Ma Sai-kit</tips> stepped swiftly forward and took her place.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r269","rowIndex":269,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=85>二路元帥</tips>様に押して貰うなんて申し訳ないな」","en":"“I feel terrible making the <tips=85>Second Route Marshal</tips> push me.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r270","rowIndex":270,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>がわざとらしく言うと、","en":"When <tips=1>Ryo</tips> said this with deliberate affectation,","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r271","rowIndex":271,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうでしょう？　でも、遠慮しなくていいのよ。病人には分け隔てなく優しくすることにしてるの」","en":"“Isn’t that right? But there’s no need to be shy. I make a point of treating all sick people with equal kindness.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r272","rowIndex":272,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=25>世傑</tips>は素知らぬ顔でそう返す。","en":"<tips=25>Sai-kit</tips> replied with an air of perfect innocence.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r273","rowIndex":273,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>はかすれた声で笑い、そしてコホコホと乾いた咳をした。","en":"<tips=1>Ryo</tips> laughed hoarsely, then gave several dry coughs.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r274","rowIndex":274,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　笑うだけでも今の彼には負担となってしまうのだ。咳のあとぜえぜえと荒い呼吸をする<tips=1>亮</tips>の姿は、その場にいた者全てに忍び寄る死の影を感じさせるのに充分だった。","en":"Even laughter had become a burden. After the coughing, <tips=1>Ryo</tips> struggled for breath with an audible rasp. The sight was more than enough to make everyone present feel the shadow of death creeping closer.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r275","rowIndex":275,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そこへ<tips=28>トーマス</tips>が駆け足でやって来る。","en":"<tips=28>Thomas</tips> came hurrying over.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r276","rowIndex":276,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ああっ！　<tips=2>阿亮</tips>！　来てくれたんだ！」","en":"“Ah! <tips=2>Ah Leung</tips>! You made it!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ10年後","displayName":"Thomas Liao (10 Years Later)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r277","rowIndex":277,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ボスが簡単に駆け足なんかしたらいけない。あなどられる」","en":"“A boss shouldn’t break into a run so easily. People will look down on you.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r278","rowIndex":278,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>が苦々しく言うと、","en":"<tips=1>Ryo</tips> sounded bitter.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r279","rowIndex":279,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ああ、ごめん。でもしょうがないんだ。きみの姿を見かけたら、とても嬉しくなっちゃって」","en":"“Oh, sorry. But I couldn’t help it. I was just so happy when I saw you.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ10年後","displayName":"Thomas Liao (10 Years Later)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r280","rowIndex":280,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=28>トーマス</tips>は照れくさそうに頭をかき、","en":"<tips=28>Thomas</tips> scratched his head in embarrassment.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r281","rowIndex":281,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=2>阿亮</tips>、よく来てくれたね。ありがとう」","en":"“<tips=2>Ah Leung</tips>, I’m so glad you came. Thank you.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ10年後","displayName":"Thomas Liao (10 Years Later)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r282","rowIndex":282,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　子供時代からのその呼び方は、<tips=1>亮</tips>が何度注意しても結局直らなかった。","en":"No matter how many times <tips=1>Ryo</tips> corrected him, Thomas had never managed to break the habit of using the name from their childhood.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r283","rowIndex":283,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ありがとうございます」","en":"“Thank you very much.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アイス11年後","displayName":"Ice (11 Years Later)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r284","rowIndex":284,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　遅れてやって来た<tips=29>アイス</tips>が、丁寧にお辞儀をする。","en":"<tips=29>Ice</tips> arrived a moment later and bowed politely.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r285","rowIndex":285,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>は包帯の奥の目を細めて、","en":"<tips=1>Ryo’s</tips> eyes narrowed beyond the bandages.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r286","rowIndex":286,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「きれいだ。いつものやつより、今の髪型の方が良い」","en":"“You look beautiful. This hairstyle suits you better than your usual one.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r287","rowIndex":287,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうでしょうか？　やっぱり恥ずかしくて……」","en":"“Do you think so? I still feel embarrassed...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アイス11年後","displayName":"Ice (11 Years Later)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r288","rowIndex":288,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「本当だとも。まるでどこかのお姫様みたいだ」","en":"“I mean it. You look just like a princess.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r289","rowIndex":289,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まあ、そんな年じゃありませんよ。<tips=1>謝亮</tips>様はいつからそんなにお世辞がお上手になったのかしら」","en":"“Oh, I’m much too old for that. Since when have you been so skilled at flattery, Mr. <tips=1>Tse Leung</tips>?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"アイス11年後","displayName":"Ice (11 Years Later)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r290","rowIndex":290,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=81>龍頭</tips>をやめて、やっと正直な言葉を言えるようになっただけだよ。本当に美しい」","en":"“It took stepping down as <tips=81>Longtou</tips> for me to finally learn to speak honestly. You truly are beautiful.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r291","rowIndex":291,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=29>アイス</tips>が照れて、<tips=1>亮</tips>は笑う。","en":"<tips=29>Ice</tips> blushed, and <tips=1>Ryo</tips> laughed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r292","rowIndex":292,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「良いの？　新婦が口説かれてるわよ？」","en":"“You’re fine with this? Someone’s hitting on your bride.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r293","rowIndex":293,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=25>世傑</tips>は<tips=28>トーマス</tips>を肘でつついてからかう。","en":"<tips=25>Sai-kit</tips> teased <tips=28>Thomas</tips>, giving him a nudge with her elbow.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r294","rowIndex":294,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「大丈夫だよ。僕も<tips=2>阿亮</tips>のことは大好きだから」","en":"“It’s all right. I love <tips=2>Ah Leung</tips> too.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ10年後","displayName":"Thomas Liao (10 Years Later)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r295","rowIndex":295,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=28>トーマス</tips>は笑顔のままそうこたえてから、","en":"Still smiling, <tips=28>Thomas</tips> replied, then","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r296","rowIndex":296,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「就任式の途中でいなくなったから心配してたんだ。体の具合は大丈夫なのかい？」","en":"“I was worried when you disappeared in the middle of the succession ceremony. Are you feeling all right?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ10年後","displayName":"Thomas Liao (10 Years Later)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r297","rowIndex":297,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>の身体を気遣った。","en":"expressed concern for <tips=1>Ryo’s</tips> health.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r298","rowIndex":298,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「平気だよ。それに、たとえ平気じゃなくったってね。<tips=28>トミー</tips>の新郎姿をからかわないまま死ねない。這ってでも来るさ。まったく、きみってやつは七五三みたいに素敵な格好をしているな」","en":"“I’m fine. And even if I weren’t, I couldn’t die without mocking the sight of <tips=28>Tommy</tips> as a groom. I’d crawl here if I had to. Just look at you—all splendidly dressed up like a little boy for Shichi-Go-San.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r299","rowIndex":299,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=29>アイス</tips>はお姫様で、僕は七五三か！　ひどいな！」","en":"“<tips=29>Ice</tips> gets to be a princess, and I’m a little boy at Shichi-Go-San? That’s awful!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ10年後","displayName":"Thomas Liao (10 Years Later)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r300","rowIndex":300,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「でも、今日は本当にお元気なんですよ。朝食も全部召し上がって、そのあとにコーヒーを二杯もお飲みになって……」","en":"“But he truly is doing very well today. He ate all his breakfast and afterward drank two entire cups of coffee...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r301","rowIndex":301,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　車椅子を<tips=25>世傑</tips>にとられた<tips=30>レイレイ</tips>が、手持ち無沙汰になった両手を落ち着きなく動かしながらそう言った。","en":"With <tips=25>Sai-kit</tips> now pushing the wheelchair, <tips=30>Leilei</tips> had nothing to do with her hands. She fidgeted with them as she spoke.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r302","rowIndex":302,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「コーヒーを二杯も！　それはすごい！」","en":"“Two entire cups of coffee! That’s wonderful!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ10年後","displayName":"Thomas Liao (10 Years Later)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r303","rowIndex":303,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「たまにはそういう日もある」","en":"“I have days like that now and then.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r304","rowIndex":304,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いや、きっと本当に体調が良くなってるんだよ。でもそうじゃなくっちゃ困る。これからも、相談役として僕の手助けをしてもらわなくちゃいけないんだから」","en":"“No, you truly must be getting better. You have to be. I need you helping me as my adviser for a long time yet.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ10年後","displayName":"Thomas Liao (10 Years Later)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r305","rowIndex":305,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「手助けなんか必要ないよ。もう私は頭もろくに回らなくなってる。それに、<tips=28>トミー</tips>はきっと私よりも優秀なリーダーになるから……」","en":"“You don’t need my help. My mind scarcely works anymore. Besides, <tips=28>Tommy</tips>, I’m sure you’ll become a better leader than I ever was...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r306","rowIndex":306,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>は小さく咳込み、<tips=30>レイレイ</tips>がさっとハンカチを差し出し、口元から垂れた唾液を拭う。","en":"<tips=1>Ryo</tips> gave a small cough. <tips=30>Leilei</tips> immediately produced a handkerchief and wiped away the saliva running from the corner of his mouth.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r307","rowIndex":307,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ありがとう……まあ、しばらくきみは私の尻拭いに追われるだろうが、きっとうまくいく。保証するよ」","en":"“Thank you... You’ll be busy cleaning up my mess for a while, but it’ll all work out. I guarantee it.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r308","rowIndex":308,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「うれしいな。<tips=2>阿亮</tips>がそう言ってくれると何よりも自信になる」","en":"“I’m glad. Hearing you say that gives me more confidence than anything, <tips=2>Ah Leung</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ10年後","displayName":"Thomas Liao (10 Years Later)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r309","rowIndex":309,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうさ、自信を持ってくれないと困る。大勢の優秀な連中のなかから、この私が選んだ後継者なんだから」","en":"“Exactly. I need you to have confidence. Of all the talented people available, you are the successor I chose.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r310","rowIndex":310,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうだね。まったくその通りだ。僕はもっと誇らしく振る舞わないといけない」","en":"“You’re right. Completely right. I need to carry myself with greater pride.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ10年後","displayName":"Thomas Liao (10 Years Later)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r311","rowIndex":311,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして<tips=28>トーマス</tips>は新しく妻となった相手と微笑みあった。","en":"<tips=28>Thomas</tips> and his new wife smiled at one another.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r312","rowIndex":312,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうだ、他にも、<tips=2>阿亮</tips>と会いたがっていた人がいるんだよ」","en":"“Oh, there are some other people who wanted to see <tips=2>Ah Leung</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ10年後","displayName":"Thomas Liao (10 Years Later)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r313","rowIndex":313,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=28>トーマス</tips>はぐるりと辺りを見回し、会場の隅の方で並んで立っていた<tips=40>黄姉妹</tips>を見つけると、","en":"<tips=28>Thomas</tips> looked all around the room until he spotted the <tips=40>Wong sisters</tips> standing side by side in one corner.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r314","rowIndex":314,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「二人ともおいでよ！」","en":"“Both of you, come here!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ10年後","displayName":"Thomas Liao (10 Years Later)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r315","rowIndex":315,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そう呼びかけて手招きをする。","en":"He called to them and beckoned.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r316","rowIndex":316,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　いつも通り、パーティには参加せずに優位を警戒する役目についていた二人は、戸惑いつつも、新しい<tips=81>龍頭</tips>の指示に従ってやって来る。","en":"As always, the sisters had not joined the party but were standing guard. Though bewildered, they obeyed the new <tips=81>Longtou</tips> and approached.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r317","rowIndex":317,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「一杯飲んでくれ」","en":"“Have a drink.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r318","rowIndex":318,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「で、でも……」","en":"“B-but...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"黄天祥","displayName":"Wong Tin-cheung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r319","rowIndex":319,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「私たちは……」","en":"“We...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"黄天明","displayName":"Wong Tin-ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r320","rowIndex":320,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　視力を持たない姉妹はその手に無理矢理シャンパンの入ったグラスを押しつけられ、戸惑いを見せる。","en":"The sightless sisters looked bewildered as Thomas pressed glasses of champagne into their hands.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r321","rowIndex":321,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「私からもお願いするよ。<tips=28>トミー</tips>の結婚を祝ってやってほしいんだ」","en":"“Let me ask you as well. I want you to help celebrate <tips=28>Tommy’s</tips> marriage.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r322","rowIndex":322,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　すっかり困り果てた二人を見かねて<tips=1>亮</tips>が言うと、","en":"Seeing that the two were utterly at a loss, <tips=1>Ryo</tips> intervened.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r323","rowIndex":323,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「わ、わかりました……」","en":"“V-very well...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"黄天祥","displayName":"Wong Tin-cheung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r324","rowIndex":324,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=40>黄姉妹</tips>はようやくグラスに口をつける。","en":"At last, the <tips=40>Wong sisters</tips> brought their glasses to their lips.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r325","rowIndex":325,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ちぇ、やっぱり僕より<tips=2>阿亮</tips>の言うことを聞くんだな」","en":"“Hmph. You still listen to <tips=2>Ah Leung</tips> more readily than you listen to me.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ10年後","displayName":"Thomas Liao (10 Years Later)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r326","rowIndex":326,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=28>トーマス</tips>はそうおどけ、無意識の行動を指摘されてしまった姉妹はゴホゴホとむせる。","en":"<tips=28>Thomas</tips> made a joke of it. The sisters, suddenly conscious of what they had done without thinking, choked on their champagne and began to cough.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r327","rowIndex":327,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうだ、<tips=28>トミー</tips>、いいかい？」","en":"“Oh, <tips=28>Tommy</tips>, may I ask something?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r328","rowIndex":328,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>はふと顔を上げて言った。","en":"<tips=1>Ryo</tips> suddenly raised his face.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r329","rowIndex":329,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なんだい？」","en":"“What is it?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ10年後","displayName":"Thomas Liao (10 Years Later)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r330","rowIndex":330,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「この二人は長く尽くしてくれたのに、私は何もねぎらうことが出来なかった。せめて今日は休日をプレゼントしたいんだ。かまわないね？」","en":"“These two served me for years, and I never did anything to reward them. Today, at least, I want to give them a day off as a gift. You don’t mind, do you?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r331","rowIndex":331,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ああ、もちろんだとも！　二人とも、今日はもう仕事は終わりだ。好きなだけ料理と酒を楽しんでくれ」","en":"“Of course not! You’re both finished with work for today. Eat and drink as much as you like.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ10年後","displayName":"Thomas Liao (10 Years Later)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r332","rowIndex":332,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「しかし……」","en":"“But...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"黄天祥","displayName":"Wong Tin-cheung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r333","rowIndex":333,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「こんな日に、それは……」","en":"“On a day like this, we couldn’t...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"黄天明","displayName":"Wong Tin-ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r334","rowIndex":334,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=81>龍頭</tips>からの命令だよ？　それとも、やっぱり<tips=2>阿亮</tips>があらためて言わないときいてくれない？」","en":"“That’s an order from the <tips=81>Longtou</tips>. Or will you refuse unless <tips=2>Ah Leung</tips> tells you all over again?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"トーマス・リャオ10年後","displayName":"Thomas Liao (10 Years Later)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r335","rowIndex":335,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=28>トーマス</tips>の言葉に、二人は一瞬黙ってから、","en":"The sisters fell silent for a moment at <tips=28>Thomas’s</tips> words.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r336","rowIndex":336,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「わ、わかりました」","en":"“V-very well.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"黄天祥","displayName":"Wong Tin-cheung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r337","rowIndex":337,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ありがとうございます！」","en":"“Thank you very much!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"黄天明","displayName":"Wong Tin-ming","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r338","rowIndex":338,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　新しい<tips=81>龍頭</tips>に頭を下げて礼をした。","en":"They bowed their thanks to the new <tips=81>Longtou</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r339","rowIndex":339,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それに満足した<tips=28>トーマス</tips>は他の来賓への挨拶に向かい、<tips=1>亮</tips>も彼の望む相手と会話を見つけては交わす。一通り話し終わったときには、疲労の色が浮かんでいる。","en":"Satisfied, <tips=28>Thomas</tips> went to greet his other guests. <tips=1>Ryo</tips>, meanwhile, sought out each person he wished to speak with. By the time he had finished making the rounds, exhaustion showed plainly on his face.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r340","rowIndex":340,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それほど長い時間会話をしたというわけでもないのだ。病はまだ若い彼の身体から根こそぎ体力を奪い去り、老人のように衰えさせている。","en":"He had not been talking particularly long. The disease had robbed his still-young body of every scrap of strength and left him frail as an old man.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r341","rowIndex":341,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「大丈夫ですか？」","en":"“Are you all right?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エリー・ホワイト","displayName":"Ellie White","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r342","rowIndex":342,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>を見つけてやって来た<tips=31>エリー・ホワイト</tips>が、心配して声をかける。","en":"Spotting <tips=1>Ryo</tips>, <tips=31>Ellie White</tips> came over and asked after him with concern.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r343","rowIndex":343,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「平気さ。久しぶりだね」","en":"“I’m fine. It’s been a while.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r344","rowIndex":344,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>での地位を譲り渡した<tips=31>エリー</tips>はすっかり<tips=41>グランドタワー</tips>に来る機会が減っている。そして、病み衰えた<tips=1>亮</tips>も自室にこもってすっかり他人との接触を断っている。","en":"Since relinquishing her position within <tips=7>YS</tips>, <tips=31>Ellie</tips> has had far fewer occasions to visit <tips=41>Grand Tower</tips>. <tips=1>Ryo</tips>, weakened by illness, has also secluded himself in his room and cut off virtually all contact with others.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r345","rowIndex":345,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　お互い人と会わなくなった二人がこうして顔を合わせるのは、およそ一ヶ月ぶりだった。","en":"With both of them avoiding company, this was the first time they had met face-to-face in about a month.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r346","rowIndex":346,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「君は僕が子どもの頃に見た姿とちっとも変わらない。若いままだ。これが君に流れる血の力か」","en":"“You look exactly as you did when I saw you as a child. Still young. Is that the power of the blood running through you?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r347","rowIndex":347,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=31>エリー</tips>はかすれ声で放った<tips=1>亮</tips>の冗談には何も返さず、じっと相手の顔を見ている。","en":"<tips=31>Ellie</tips> gave no response to <tips=1>Ryo’s</tips> hoarse joke, but stared intently into his face.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r348","rowIndex":348,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>は目を細めた。この距離だと、ヴェールの下の真剣な表情が見て取れる。","en":"<tips=1>Ryo</tips> narrowed his eyes. At this distance, he could make out the grave expression beneath her veil.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r349","rowIndex":349,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「今日はあなたがおいでになると聞いたので、参りました。……お考えは変わりませんか？」","en":"“I came today because I heard that you would attend. Have you reconsidered?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エリー・ホワイト","displayName":"Ellie White","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r350","rowIndex":350,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「その話はよしてくれと言ったじゃないか」","en":"“I told you to stop talking about that.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r351","rowIndex":351,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>は苦笑する。","en":"<tips=1>Ryo</tips> smiled wryly.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r352","rowIndex":352,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「もし不死化に失敗して、発症したとしても<tips=46>ネオ・ローズ</tips>がある今なら症状を抑えられます」","en":"“Even if the attempt to make you immortal failed and you developed symptoms, now that we have <tips=46>Neo Rose</tips>, those symptoms could be suppressed.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エリー・ホワイト","displayName":"Ellie White","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r353","rowIndex":353,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そんな話にはのらないよ。僕を誤魔化そうったって無駄なんだ」","en":"“I’m not falling for that. There’s no use trying to deceive me.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r354","rowIndex":354,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=31>エリー</tips>は微笑していたが、その目は鋭い。この街の様々な人々を震え上がらせた冷徹な光はまだそのままである。","en":"<tips=31>Ellie</tips> smiled, but her eyes were keen. The cold light that had once made people throughout the city tremble remained undimmed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r355","rowIndex":355,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「君は言ってたじゃないか。昔の<tips=18>ローズ・クラブ</tips>では、不死の儀式に失敗した女は殺していたんだろう？　当時クラブには『<tips=45>ローズ</tips>』がやまほどあったのに、それを使わないで貴重な従業員を殺すなんておかしな話だ。これはつまり、特殊化に失敗した場合は『<tips=45>ローズ</tips>』でもコントロール出来ない状態になってしまうってことなんだよ。……きみだってわかってるんだろう？　もし僕がきみの血を受けて、そして不死化出来なかった場合、僕はもう僕でなくなってしまって、元に戻す方法もないんだ。そしてきみは、<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>や<tips=55>松子</tips>よりもずっと<tips=72>傾向値</tips>が低い。ということは、きみから血を貰っても、<tips=18>ローズ・クラブ</tips>の時よりもずっと成功率が低い。数字にしたらどれくらいだ？　三割もないと思うね」","en":"“You told me yourself. At the old <tips=18>Rose Club</tips>, women for whom the rite of immortality failed were killed, weren’t they? The club had mountains of <tips=45>Rose</tips> at the time. It would make no sense to kill valuable employees without using it. That means a failed specialization leaves the subject in a state that even <tips=45>Rose</tips> cannot control. ...You understand that too, don’t you? If I received your blood and failed to become immortal, I would cease to be myself, with no way to return to normal. And your <tips=72>tendency value</tips> is far lower than <tips=20>Koschei’s</tips> or <tips=55>Matsuko’s</tips>. So receiving blood from you would offer a much lower chance of success than the old <tips=18>Rose Club</tips> rites. What would the number be? I doubt it would reach even thirty percent.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r356","rowIndex":356,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「でも、『<tips=45>ローズ</tips>』じゃなくて『<tips=46>ネオ・ローズ</tips>』なら、もし失敗しても……」","en":"“But if we used <tips=46>Neo Rose</tips> instead of <tips=45>Rose</tips>, then even if it failed...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エリー・ホワイト","displayName":"Ellie White","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r357","rowIndex":357,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そんな話は信じないよ。『<tips=45>ローズ</tips>』と『<tips=46>ネオ・ローズ</tips>』の作用機序は大して変わらないんだ」","en":"“I don’t believe that. The mechanisms of action for <tips=45>Rose</tips> and <tips=46>Neo Rose</tips> are not very different.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r358","rowIndex":358,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……うまくいかなかった、その時は、私が責任を持って処理します」","en":"“...If it did not work, then I would take responsibility and dispose of you.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エリー・ホワイト","displayName":"Ellie White","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r359","rowIndex":359,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=31>エリー</tips>はさらに食い下がる。","en":"<tips=31>Ellie</tips> continued to press him.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r360","rowIndex":360,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>は驚いたふりをして、","en":"<tips=1>Ryo</tips> feigned surprise.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r361","rowIndex":361,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「処理って？　つまり、発症したらちゃんと僕を殺してくれるってことかい？　それとも、どこかに幽閉でもしてくれるのかな？　どっちにしろごめんだね。最後まで自分のまま死なせてくれ」","en":"“Dispose of me? You mean you’ll be sure to kill me if I develop symptoms? Or would you lock me away somewhere? I want neither. Let me remain myself until I die.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r362","rowIndex":362,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「しかし、うまくいけば病も癒え、丈夫な肉体を手に入れられるんですよ」","en":"“But if it succeeds, your disease will be cured, and you will have a strong body.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エリー・ホワイト","displayName":"Ellie White","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r363","rowIndex":363,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「珍しいな。今日はずいぶんとしつこい」","en":"“This is unusual. You’re remarkably persistent today.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r364","rowIndex":364,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「今回は、後悔をしたくないんです」","en":"“This time, I don’t want any regrets.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エリー・ホワイト","displayName":"Ellie White","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r365","rowIndex":365,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「今回ってことは、前回があるんだ。それは、父さんのことになるのかな？」","en":"“If you’re saying ‘this time,’ that means there was a last time. You mean my father, don’t you?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r366","rowIndex":366,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……」","en":"“...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エリー・ホワイト","displayName":"Ellie White","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r367","rowIndex":367,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=31>エリー</tips>は無言のまま、ヴェールの下に童女のような無垢な困惑を浮かべてじっと<tips=1>亮</tips>の顔を見つめている。","en":"<tips=31>Ellie</tips> remained silent. Beneath the veil, her face showed the innocent confusion of a little girl as she stared at <tips=1>Ryo</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r368","rowIndex":368,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「きみはきっと、<tips=3>父さん</tips>にも申し出たんだね。自分の血液を使って不死の力を与えることを。そして、その時<tips=3>父さん</tips>は断った」","en":"“You must have made the same offer to <tips=3>Father</tips>—to give him immortal power through your blood. And <tips=3>Father</tips> refused you.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r369","rowIndex":369,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=31>エリー</tips>は沈黙を保ったが、否定しないということは、<tips=1>亮</tips>の言う通りだったのだろう。","en":"<tips=31>Ellie</tips> maintained her silence, but her failure to deny it probably meant that <tips=1>Ryo</tips> was right.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r370","rowIndex":370,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「僕は、たとえ成功率が百パーセントだったとしても、きみの血は飲まない」","en":"“I wouldn’t drink your blood even if the chance of success were one hundred percent.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r371","rowIndex":371,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>の言葉に、<tips=31>エリー</tips>は悲しそうに顔を歪める。","en":"At <tips=1>Ryo’s</tips> words, <tips=31>Ellie’s</tips> face twisted with sorrow.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r372","rowIndex":372,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「僕もあの日、きみと同じことを<tips=3>父さん</tips>に提案した。だが断られた。当時僕には、あの貪欲な人間が断るのは不思議だという思いもあったけれど、今は<tips=3>父さん</tips>の気持ちがわかるような気がする」","en":"“That day, I made <tips=3>Father</tips> the same proposal you are making now. He refused. At the time, I found it strange that such a greedy man would refuse, but now I think I understand how <tips=3>Father</tips> felt.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r373","rowIndex":373,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>はじっと<tips=31>エリー</tips>の目を見つめる。","en":"<tips=1>Ryo</tips> stared steadily into <tips=31>Ellie’s</tips> eyes.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r374","rowIndex":374,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「この病気は時間をかけて人を殺す。自分の死について考える時間はたくさんあった。……そして考えすぎたのかもしれない。死も、僕の一部のような気がするんだ。冷酷な血みどろの犯罪者はここで退場する。それでいいじゃないか」","en":"“This disease kills slowly. I had plenty of time to think about my own death. ...Perhaps I thought about it too much. Death feels like a part of me now. A cold-blooded, blood-soaked criminal exits the stage here. What’s wrong with that?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r375","rowIndex":375,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=31>エリー</tips>は黙ったままだ。","en":"<tips=31>Ellie</tips> remained silent.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r376","rowIndex":376,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「わからないかな。きみはちょっと私欲にまみれすぎているからね。羨ましいよ」","en":"“You don’t understand? I suppose you’re a little too consumed by your own desires. I envy you.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r377","rowIndex":377,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>は目を細めて微笑む。","en":"<tips=1>Ryo</tips> narrowed his eyes and smiled.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r378","rowIndex":378,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=31>エリー</tips>はやはり、黙っている。","en":"<tips=31>Ellie</tips> still said nothing.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r379","rowIndex":379,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　衰弱が甚だしい彼はパーティが終わるのを待たず一足先に会場を去ることにした。","en":"Severely weakened, he decided to leave the venue before the reception ended.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r380","rowIndex":380,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　会場の裏側にある駐車場に、<tips=30>レイレイ</tips>が車椅子を押してゆく。","en":"<tips=30>Leilei</tips> pushed his wheelchair into the parking lot behind the venue.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r381","rowIndex":381,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その周りには屈強なボディーガードが二人。<tips=81>龍頭</tips>の身のまわりには、<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>のなかでも特に屈強で信用出来るものたちが選ばれている。","en":"Two burly bodyguards flanked the wheelchair. The men assigned to a <tips=81>Longtou’s</tips> personal security were chosen from among the strongest and most trustworthy members of <tips=7>YS</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r382","rowIndex":382,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ボディーガードの一人が運転手として先に運転席に乗り、もう一人がドアを開けた。","en":"One bodyguard got into the driver’s seat first, while the other opened the door.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r383","rowIndex":383,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>は自力では移動が出来ない。","en":"<tips=1>Ryo</tips> could no longer move by himself.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r384","rowIndex":384,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　もう一人のボディーガードが抱えようとしたところで、ふとそれを止めた。","en":"As the other bodyguard moved to lift him, Ryo suddenly stopped him.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r385","rowIndex":385,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼は駐車場の端にあった木の方に視線をやっている。","en":"He was looking toward a tree at the edge of the parking lot.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r386","rowIndex":386,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あの近くまで移動してくれないか」","en":"“Would you take me over there?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r387","rowIndex":387,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　言われて<tips=30>レイレイ</tips>がそこまで車椅子を押してゆく。彼の見上げた先、木の枝の上には子猫が蹲ってじっとしている。","en":"At his request, <tips=30>Leilei</tips> pushed the wheelchair over to the tree. Following his gaze upward, she saw a kitten crouched motionless on one of its branches.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r388","rowIndex":388,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「のぼったまま、降りられなくなったんですかね」","en":"“Do you think it climbed up there and couldn’t get back down?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r389","rowIndex":389,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=30>レイレイ</tips>はのんびりとした声で言う。","en":"<tips=30>Leilei</tips> said it in her usual easygoing tone.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r390","rowIndex":390,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「悪いが、ボディーガードのどちらかに言って、あの猫を降ろしてやるよう伝えてくれないか」","en":"“I’m sorry, but would you ask one of the bodyguards to bring that kitten down?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r391","rowIndex":391,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=30>レイレイ</tips>は頷き、その用件を伝えるために車椅子を離れる。","en":"<tips=30>Leilei</tips> nodded and stepped away from the wheelchair to convey the request.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r392","rowIndex":392,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　男たちは二つ返事で了承をすると、","en":"The men readily agreed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r393","rowIndex":393,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あの<tips=1>謝亮</tips>様がそんなお情けをかけられるなんて、想像もできませんな」","en":"“I never would have imagined Lord <tips=1>Tse Leung</tips> showing such compassion.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r394","rowIndex":394,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　と苦笑するのを、<tips=30>レイレイ</tips>は窘めるように、","en":"When one of them said this with a wry smile, <tips=30>Leilei</tips> gently chided him:","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r395","rowIndex":395,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あの方は、昔からああいう方ですよ」","en":"“He has always been that kind of man,”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r396","rowIndex":396,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　と言った。","en":"she said.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r397","rowIndex":397,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして、彼女は男たちと共に主人のもとへ戻ってくる。","en":"Then she returned to her master with the men.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r398","rowIndex":398,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>は車椅子の上でうなだれている。","en":"<tips=1>Ryo</tips> sat slumped in his wheelchair.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r399","rowIndex":399,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　眠っているのだろうと<tips=30>レイレイ</tips>は考えた。この主人は最近ちょっとした隙に薄い睡眠をとることが、最近は珍しくなかったからだ。","en":"<tips=30>Leilei</tips> assumed he was asleep. Lately, it was not unusual for her master to take light naps whenever a brief opportunity arose.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r400","rowIndex":400,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女はボディーガードたちを振り返ると、人差し指を唇にあて、主人を起こさないよう伝えた。","en":"She turned to the bodyguards and pressed an index finger to her lips, warning them not to wake her master.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r401","rowIndex":401,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして男の一人がそっと木に近づくと、ジャケットを脱いで白いＹシャツ姿になる。","en":"Then one of the men approached the tree quietly, removed his jacket, and stood there in his white dress shirt.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r402","rowIndex":402,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ネクタイの先を胸ポケットに突っ込んで邪魔にならないようにすると、その毛むくじゃらの太い腕で枝を掴んだ。","en":"He tucked the end of his tie into his breast pocket to keep it out of the way, then gripped a branch with one thick, hairy arm.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r403","rowIndex":403,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そしてぐっと腕に力を入れる。","en":"Then he put his weight on that arm and hauled himself upward.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r404","rowIndex":404,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　見かけによらず彼は敏捷で、するすると木を上っていった。","en":"Despite his appearance, he was agile, and swiftly climbed the tree.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r405","rowIndex":405,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　巨漢が近づくと子猫は怯え、フーと唸りながら、さらに枝の先端の方まで逃げてしまう。","en":"As the hulking man approached, the frightened kitten hissed and retreated farther toward the tip of the branch.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r406","rowIndex":406,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「おい、こらっ。助けようとしてやってるんだぞ」","en":"“Hey, now. I’m trying to rescue you.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r407","rowIndex":407,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　男が主人の睡眠を気遣ったトーンを抑えた声をかけ、指を伸ばすと、子猫は前足を振り上げてそれをひっかこうとする。","en":"Mindful of his master’s sleep, the man called to the kitten in a subdued voice. When he extended a finger, the kitten raised one front paw and tried to scratch him.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r408","rowIndex":408,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「困ったやつだな……」","en":"“You’re a difficult little thing...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r409","rowIndex":409,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　手を引っ込めると、子猫はさらに奥へ逃げてしまった。","en":"When he drew back his hand, the kitten retreated still farther.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r410","rowIndex":410,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　これ以上近づくために男が身を乗り出せば、枝はたちまち折れてしまうだろう。","en":"If the man leaned out any farther to approach it, the branch would break at once.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r411","rowIndex":411,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　男がどうすることも出来ずに木によじ登ったまま往生していると、","en":"He remained stuck in the tree, completely at a loss.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r412","rowIndex":412,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あ」","en":"“Ah!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r413","rowIndex":413,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=30>レイレイ</tips>が小さく叫ぶ。","en":"<tips=30>Leilei</tips> gave a little cry.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r414","rowIndex":414,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　子猫が、足をすべらせて落ちてしまったのだ。","en":"The kitten had slipped and fallen.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r415","rowIndex":415,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しかし、小さいともいえどもそこは身軽な獣である。ひらりと空中で身をよじって体勢を整えると、そのまま綺麗に着地し、一目散に逃げていってしまった。","en":"Small though it was, the kitten was a nimble creature. It twisted gracefully in midair, righted itself, landed cleanly, and tore off at full speed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r416","rowIndex":416,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　一方、落下した猫をキャッチしようと手を伸ばした男は体勢を崩し、無様に落下して、地面でひどく腰を打つ。","en":"Meanwhile, the man reached out to catch the falling kitten, lost his balance, tumbled gracelessly from the tree, and struck his lower back hard upon the ground.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r417","rowIndex":417,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……大丈夫ですか？」","en":"“...Are you all right?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r418","rowIndex":418,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いや平気です。しかし、無様なところをお見せしてしまいました」","en":"“Yes, I’m fine. But I’m afraid I’ve made a sorry spectacle of myself.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r419","rowIndex":419,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　男が顔を顰めながら立ち上がり、腰をさするのを見て、<tips=30>レイレイ</tips>はくすくすと笑う。","en":"<tips=30>Leilei</tips> giggled as she watched him stand, grimace, and rub his back.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r420","rowIndex":420,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=1>亮</tips>さま、心配する必要なんかなかったみたいですよ」","en":"“Master <tips=1>Ryo</tips>, it seems there was no reason to worry after all.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r421","rowIndex":421,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　少女時代から歴代の<tips=81>龍頭</tips>に仕え、今ではもうすっかり立派な大人になった<tips=30>レイレイ</tips>であったが、うっかりしているところは子どもの頃とあまり変わらず、主人が居眠りしていることを忘れてそう振り返った。","en":"<tips=30>Leilei</tips> had served successive <tips=81>Longtous</tips> since girlhood and was now a thoroughly capable adult, yet she remained almost as absentminded as she had been as a child. Forgetting that her master was asleep, she turned toward him as she spoke.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r422","rowIndex":422,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　もちろん、主人は動かない。","en":"Of course, her master did not move.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r423","rowIndex":423,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あっ、お休みでしたね……」","en":"“Oh, you were sleeping...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r424","rowIndex":424,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　とすぐに気がついたものの、不審だった。","en":"She caught herself at once, yet something seemed wrong.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r425","rowIndex":425,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　本当に眠っているのだろうか？　目の前で、こんなどすんと音がしたのに、まったく反応しないだなんて。","en":"Was he truly asleep? There had been a heavy thud directly in front of him, yet he had not reacted at all.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r426","rowIndex":426,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そこで<tips=30>レイレイ</tips>はにわかに不安になって、主人の顔を覗き込んだ。","en":"Suddenly anxious, <tips=30>Leilei</tips> peered into her master’s face.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r427","rowIndex":427,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして彼女はようやく気がついた。","en":"And at last she realized.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r428","rowIndex":428,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　主人の胸には穴が二つあき、そこから流れ出した血液が車椅子のパイプを伝い、いつのまにかその車輪のそばにどす黒い水たまりを作っていることに。","en":"There were two holes in her master’s chest, and the blood flowing from them had run down the wheelchair’s tubing to form a dark, nearly black pool beside one of the wheels.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r429","rowIndex":429,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>ＹＳ三代目龍頭謝亮</tips>は暗殺された。","en":"<tips=1>Tse Leung</tips>, third Longtou of YS, had been assassinated.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r430","rowIndex":430,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ボディガードが離れた隙を狙い、比較的近い距離から、高性能の消音装置の付いた拳銃で撃たれたと思われる。","en":"It is believed that the killer waited until the bodyguards had stepped away, then shot him from relatively close range with a handgun fitted with a high-performance suppressor.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r431","rowIndex":431,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　犯人ははっきりとしない。","en":"No one knew who had done it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r432","rowIndex":432,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>謝亮</tips>に恨みを持つものは数多く、その命を狙うものは<tips=9>Y地区</tips>じゅうに存在したからだ。","en":"<tips=1>Tse Leung</tips> had countless enemies. People who wanted his life could be found throughout <tips=9>Y District</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r433","rowIndex":433,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　多くの名前が暗殺者として噂されたが、なかでも「ボニー＆クライド」の名を挙げるものが多かった。","en":"Many possible assassins were named in the ensuing rumors, but none so often as “Bonnie and Clyde.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r434","rowIndex":434,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ボニー＆クライド」というのは、近年街で話題になっているアジア系の若い女と金髪の男のコンビのニックネームだ。","en":"“Bonnie and Clyde” was the nickname of a young Asian woman and a blond man whose exploits had become the talk of the city in recent years.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r435","rowIndex":435,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼らは二人で<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>系列の店を襲撃しては、奪った金を街の児童施設や老人施設にばらまくという行為を繰り返しており、痛快な義賊として街の噂になっていた。","en":"The pair repeatedly raided businesses affiliated with <tips=7>YS</tips>, then distributed the stolen money among the city’s orphanages and homes for the elderly. They had become the talk of the city as a pair of dashing outlaw heroes.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r436","rowIndex":436,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その手口はプロのもので、元軍人か、それに準じた訓練を受けたものだと見なされていた。","en":"Their methods were those of professionals, and they were assumed to be former soldiers or to have undergone comparable training.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r437","rowIndex":437,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　暗殺の鮮やかな手口から、この計画を遂行出来るのはこの二人しかいないのではないかと推測されたのである。","en":"Given how masterfully the assassination had been carried out, it was speculated that only the two of them could have executed the plan.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r438","rowIndex":438,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しかしその一方で、相手が<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>とはいえ、殺人を犯すというのは、彼らの普段のやり口とは違うのではないかと、否定的な声もあった。","en":"At the same time, however, some doubted it was really them: even if the target was <tips=7>YS</tips>, committing murder was not their usual way of doing things.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r439","rowIndex":439,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　はっきり彼らの犯行とわかる事件で、これまで人死にが出たことはなかったのである。","en":"In every case that could definitively be identified as their work, no one had ever been killed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r440","rowIndex":440,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　結局、噂は噂のままで、今日に至るまでその実行者は特定されていない。","en":"In the end, rumor remained rumor. To this day, the person responsible has never been identified.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r441","rowIndex":441,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして、今となってはその特定をしようとする者もいない。","en":"And now, no one even tries to determine who did it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r442","rowIndex":442,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　死んでしまった人間はその時点で過去になる。","en":"The moment a person dies, they become part of the past.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r443","rowIndex":443,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　既に死を待つだけだった無力な人間が誰に殺されたのだろうか、なんて、この街の誰にとってもどうでもいいことだ。","en":"To everyone in this city, the identity of whoever killed a powerless man already awaiting death was a matter of complete indifference.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r444","rowIndex":444,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それよりも、<tips=88>アンドリュー・マオ</tips>が露店でキャラメルのかかったアイスクリームを注文した、というような話題の方が、よほどみなの興味を惹くだろう。","en":"People would be far more interested in hearing that <tips=88>Andrew Mao</tips> had ordered caramel-topped ice cream from a street stall.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r445","rowIndex":445,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=30>レイレイ</tips>が連絡をして、最初に現場に駆けつけた幹部が<tips=31>エリー・ホワイト</tips>だったんだよ。そこから葬儀まで、彼女が全て仕切った。まあ、それ自体は不自然なことじゃない。<tips=31>エリー</tips>は昔から<tips=25>馬世傑</tips>と並ぶ<tips=1>亮</tips>の腹心だったからね。……で、その時に彼女はやったんだろう。確証はないが、この想像はいい線をついていると思うんだがね」","en":"“<tips=30>Leilei</tips> sent word, and the first senior officer to rush to the scene was <tips=31>Ellie White</tips>. From then until the funeral, she handled everything. Well, there was nothing strange about that in itself. <tips=31>Ellie</tips> had always been one of <tips=1>Tse Leung’s</tips> closest lieutenants, alongside <tips=25>Ma Sai-kit</tips>. ...That must have been when she did it. I have no proof, but I think this theory is pretty close to the mark.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r446","rowIndex":446,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「でも、そんなこと出来るんですかね？　撃たれてから時間が経っていたでしょうに」","en":"“But could she really have done that? He must have been lying there for quite some time after he was shot.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐松子","displayName":"Matsuko Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r447","rowIndex":447,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=55>松子</tips>は首をかしげて言う。","en":"<tips=55>Matsuko</tips> tilted her head.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r448","rowIndex":448,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　期待が強すぎるため、同時に不安も強くわき起こっているその心情が、表情にあらわれている。","en":"Her expression betrayed an anxiety every bit as powerful as the hope that had given rise to it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r449","rowIndex":449,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どうなんだろうな。必ず口から飲み込まないと特殊化は起きないのかな？　たとえば傷口に<tips=31>エリー</tips>の血液を流し込んだらどうだろう？　心臓が止まったって、体組織はすぐには死なないわけだからね。あるいは、<tips=1>亮</tips>の死体からすぐに指の一本でも切り取って、<tips=31>エリー</tips>の新鮮な血に浸すというやりかたもあるかも知れない。そしてその肉片から再生させるんだ。おれはこの線が強いんじゃないかと思っている。……<tips=31>エリー</tips>はあんたの再生の時、資材調達やらなんやらで関わっているからね。そういうことが出来るのを知っている」","en":"“I wonder. Does the transformation only happen if the blood is swallowed? What if, say, <tips=31>Ellie’s</tips> blood were poured into the wound? Even after the heart stops, the body’s tissues do not die immediately. Or perhaps she cut off one of <tips=1>Tse Leung’s</tips> fingers right away and immersed it in <tips=31>Ellie’s</tips> fresh blood, then regenerated him from that piece of flesh. I think that is the likeliest possibility. ...<tips=31>Ellie</tips> was involved in your regeneration—procuring supplies and so on. She knows it can be done.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r450","rowIndex":450,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……確かに、可能性としてはあるのかもしれません。でも、もしそれを試したとしても、本当に成功するとは限らないですよね……」","en":"“...It’s true that it might be possible. But even if she tried it, there’s no guarantee it would succeed...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐松子","displayName":"Matsuko Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r451","rowIndex":451,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それは確かにその通りだ。<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>やあんたみたいな、生まれながらに特殊化しているのを第一世代だとしたら、おれや<tips=31>エリー</tips>は第二世代にあたり、<tips=72>傾向値</tips>も低い。特殊化に<tips=72>傾向値</tips>が影響しているのなら、<tips=31>エリー</tips>の血液では成功率は低いだろう。でも、現実的に起こりえないというほど低いかな？　……たしか、<tips=1>謝亮</tips>は特殊化した虎で実験しているだろう？　あの虎はショーのなかで、<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>の血を受けた第二世代の女を食ってああなったのだから、第三世代ということになる。成功例はあるんだよ。しかも、その第三世代である虎の肉でも、何匹かの鼠が特殊化したんだ。彼が復活した可能性が全くないとは言えないだろう。精神がまともかどうかはわからないがね」","en":"“That is certainly true. If <tips=20>Koschei</tips> and you, who were born already specialized, are first generation, then <tips=31>Ellie</tips> and I would be second generation, and our <tips=72>tendency values</tips> are low. If <tips=72>tendency value</tips> affects specialization, the odds of success with <tips=31>Ellie’s</tips> blood would probably be low. But would they really be so low as to make it realistically impossible? ...<tips=1>Tse Leung</tips> experimented on a specialized tiger, didn’t he? During the show, that tiger became what it was after eating a second-generation woman who had received <tips=20>Koschei’s</tips> blood, which would make it third generation. There is a successful case. What’s more, even the flesh of that third-generation tiger caused several rats to become specialized. We cannot say there is no possibility at all that he came back to life—though I cannot say whether he would be sane.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r452","rowIndex":452,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=55>松子</tips>は表情を曇らせたままだ。もし<tips=1>謝亮</tips>が蘇っていたとしても、彼が正気を喪っていたとしたら、彼女はそれをどう受け止めるのだろう。","en":"<tips=55>Matsuko’s</tips> expression remained clouded. Even if <tips=1>Tse Leung</tips> had come back to life, how would she take it if he had lost his sanity?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r453","rowIndex":453,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　気になったが、私は続ける。","en":"I found myself wondering about that, but continued.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r454","rowIndex":454,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それに傍証もある。調べたところによるとね、<tips=31>エリー・ホワイト</tips>は<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>をやめたあと、児童施設を作って子供たちの面倒を見ているらしいんだよ。闇商人のセカンドライフとしちゃあまりに突拍子もないが、子供として生まれ変わった<tips=1>謝亮</tips>をこっそり育てるには、良い商売だと思わないか？　あの<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>の大幹部が仕事をやめて一人の子供を育て始めたとなればただごとではない何かを想像させるが、ボランティアをはじめたとなればまだ説明がつく」","en":"“And there is circumstantial evidence. From what I found, <tips=31>Ellie White</tips> apparently established a children’s home after leaving <tips=7>YS</tips> and now cares for the children there. It is an absurd second life for a black-market merchant—but don’t you think it would provide the perfect cover for secretly raising <tips=1>Tse Leung</tips>, reborn as a child? If a top <tips=7>YS</tips> executive quit her work and suddenly began raising one particular child, people would know something extraordinary was going on. Say she had taken up charitable work, though, and at least there would be an explanation.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r455","rowIndex":455,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……でも、本当に、ただ子供の世話がしたかっただけかもしれません」","en":"“...But maybe she really did just want to take care of children.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐松子","displayName":"Matsuko Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r456","rowIndex":456,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「心配性だな」","en":"“You worry too much.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r457","rowIndex":457,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は苦笑して、","en":"I smiled wryly.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r458","rowIndex":458,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それを今から確認しに行こうっていうんじゃないか」","en":"“We’re on our way to find out, aren’t we?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r459","rowIndex":459,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私が言っても<tips=55>松子</tips>の表情は明るくならない。","en":"Even after I said that, <tips=55>Matsuko’s</tips> expression did not brighten.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r460","rowIndex":460,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ま、不安になる気持ちはわかるよ。復活しているかどうかわからないし、復活していてもまともかどうかわからない。まともだとしても、きみのことを覚えていないかもしれない。いくらでも悪い方に考えられるものな。でも、きっと大丈夫だよ。根拠はないが、そんな気がするんだ」","en":"“Well, I understand why you’re worried. We don’t know whether he has come back to life, and even if he has, we don’t know whether he is sane. Even if he is, he may not remember you. There are any number of ways this could go wrong. But I’m sure it will be all right. I have no grounds for saying so—I just have a feeling.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r461","rowIndex":461,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=55>松子</tips>は私の顔をじっと見て、","en":"<tips=55>Matsuko</tips> stared intently at my face and said,","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r462","rowIndex":462,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どうして<tips=50>路地</tips>さんは私を<tips=1>亮</tips>さんに会わせようとしてくれるんですか？　私を待たないで、一人で<tips=31>エリー</tips>さんのところに確認しに行っても良かったはずなのに」","en":"“Why are you going out of your way to help me see <tips=1>Ryo</tips>, <tips=50>Mr. Roji</tips>? You could have gone to <tips=31>Ellie</tips> by yourself to find out instead of waiting for me.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐松子","displayName":"Matsuko Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r463","rowIndex":463,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「おれが一人で見に行ったら、<tips=1>謝亮</tips>は死んでいるよきっと。でも、誰よりも彼と会いたいと願っているあんたと一緒なら、一番良い形で生きているような気がするんだ」","en":"“If I went to see by myself, <tips=1>Tse Leung</tips> would definitely be dead. But if I go with you, the person who wants more than anyone to see him, I feel as though he will be alive in the best possible way.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r464","rowIndex":464,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そんな……」","en":"“But...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐松子","displayName":"Matsuko Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r465","rowIndex":465,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「もちろん科学的には間違っている。でも、今のこの世界だったら、そんなこともあると思わないか？　ミュータントが現れてから、人間ってのは念じただけで物を動かしたり、触っただけで鍵を開けることが出来るようになったんだぜ。あんたの強い意志が、現実を塗り替えることだってあるかもしれない」","en":"“Of course, scientifically speaking, it makes no sense. But in the world as it is now, don’t you think such a thing might be possible? Ever since mutants appeared, human beings have been able to move objects with thought alone and unlock doors merely by touching them. Perhaps your powerful will might rewrite reality itself.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r466","rowIndex":466,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……そんなちから、私にはないですよ」","en":"“...I don’t have that kind of power.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐松子","displayName":"Matsuko Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r467","rowIndex":467,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私にからかわれているとでも思ったのか、<tips=55>松子</tips>は童女のように唇をとがらせる。","en":"Perhaps thinking I was making fun of her, <tips=55>Matsuko</tips> pursed her lips like a little girl.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r468","rowIndex":468,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ま、そういうわけで、どうしてもあんたと一緒に確認したかったのさ。気を悪くしないでくれよ」","en":"“Anyway, that’s why I was determined to confirm the truth together with you. Don’t hold it against me.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r469","rowIndex":469,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「別に気を悪くしてはいませんが……」","en":"“I’m not offended, but...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐松子","displayName":"Matsuko Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r470","rowIndex":470,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「おれもね、あんたと<tips=1>亮</tips>が再会するところを見たいのさ。生き別れた恋人が、お互い一度死んで、生まれ変わって再会するんだ。その感動の場面こそが、ラストシーンに相応しいからね」","en":"“I want to see you and <tips=1>Tse Leung</tips> reunited, too. Two lovers torn apart in life, each of whom died once, reborn and reunited. That moving reunion is precisely the scene worthy of a finale.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r471","rowIndex":471,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ラストシーン？」","en":"“Final scene?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐松子","displayName":"Matsuko Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r472","rowIndex":472,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「こっちの話だ。……おっと、少し雨が降ってきたようだな」","en":"“Never mind. ...Oh, it looks like it’s starting to rain a little.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r473","rowIndex":473,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しとしとと細い雨が降り始めてきた。私は黒い傘を広げて、彼女にも入るよう促す。","en":"A fine rain began to fall steadily. I opened a black umbrella and invited her beneath it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r474","rowIndex":474,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……<tips=50>路地</tips>さんは、とても親切な方ですね」","en":"“...You are a very kind man, <tips=50>Mr. Roji</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐松子","displayName":"Matsuko Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r475","rowIndex":475,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ただの物好きなのさ。そのせいで散々ひどい目に遭ってきたはずだが、どうも人間ってのは変わらないものらしい。……さて、目的の場所が近づいて来たぞ。一応連絡はとってあるがね、彼女がどんな顔で出迎えてくれるか、楽しみにしようじゃないか」","en":"“I’m simply too curious for my own good. You would think I’d have learned after all the misery it has caused me, but people do not seem to change. ...Now then, we’re almost there. I have contacted her in advance, but let’s look forward to seeing how she receives us.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r476","rowIndex":476,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　まっとうな児童施設を経営しているという話だったが、門には表札もなく、広い洋館の佇まいは裕福な西洋人の私邸のようでもあり、一見するとそういった施設には見えない。","en":"I had been told she ran a proper children’s home, but there was no sign on the gate, and the spacious Western-style mansion looked like the private residence of a wealthy Westerner. At first glance, it did not look like such a facility at all.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r477","rowIndex":477,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　インターフォンを押すと、<tips=31>エリー</tips>自らが出て扉を開けてくれた。","en":"When I pressed the intercom, <tips=31>Ellie</tips> herself came out and opened the door.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r478","rowIndex":478,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「お久しぶりです。<tips=50>路地</tips>さん……ですよね？」","en":"“It’s been a long time. You are <tips=50>Mr. Roji</tips>... aren’t you?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エリー・ホワイト（ベル―）","displayName":"Ellie White (Belukha)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r479","rowIndex":479,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女は以前とは違ってヴェールで顔を覆っていない。","en":"She no longer concealed her face beneath the veil she had worn in the past.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r480","rowIndex":480,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　わかってはいたが、こうして面と向かうとハッとするほど若い。","en":"I had known what to expect, yet face-to-face, her youth was startling.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r481","rowIndex":481,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　唇の血色は良く、肌はみずみずしく、二十代前半といっても誰も疑わないだろう。下手すればもう五十に届こうかという実年齢にもかかわらず、ほんの小娘にしか見えないのだ。","en":"Her lips were rosy and her skin fresh; no one would have questioned an age in the early twenties. Yet for all anyone knew, she was nearly fifty, and still looked like little more than a girl.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r482","rowIndex":482,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうです。お久しぶりですな」","en":"“That’s right. It’s been a long time.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r483","rowIndex":483,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして私はそこで仮面を脱いだ。","en":"I removed my mask.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r484","rowIndex":484,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私がかぶっていたのは、鳥のような嘴のついたペストドクターの仮面で、そして私が身につけているのは黒い帽子と黒いマントだ。","en":"I had been wearing a plague doctor’s mask with a birdlike beak, together with a black hat and cape.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r485","rowIndex":485,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そう、<tips=5>太刀川良馬</tips>がかつて『ドクター』として<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>とコンビを組んでいたころの姿である。","en":"It was the appearance <tips=5>Ryoma Tachikawa</tips> had once worn as ‘the Doctor,’ when he and <tips=3>Chris Tse</tips> operated as a pair.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r486","rowIndex":486,"pageCtrl":"","jp":" 　私たちは建物の中の応接室と思しき部屋に案内された。","en":"We were led into what appeared to be a reception room inside the building.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r487","rowIndex":487,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　以前<tips=31>エリー・ホワイト</tips>が根城にしていた、アンティーク家具や高級絨毯のある部屋とはうって変わって、実用的で安価な部屋だ。","en":"It was nothing like the rooms from which <tips=31>Ellie White</tips> had once operated, with their antique furniture and expensive carpets. This room was plain, inexpensive, and practical.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r488","rowIndex":488,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　床は汚れにくい塩化ビニール。壁にはクレヨンか何かの汚れが拭っても落ちきれないままこびりついている。子供が悪戯書きでもしたのだろう。","en":"The floor was stain-resistant vinyl. Smears of crayon or something like it clung to the walls despite attempts to wipe them away, perhaps the remains of a child’s scribbling.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r489","rowIndex":489,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　額に入れて飾られているのは、子供が描いたらしい<tips=31>エリー</tips>の肖像画だ。","en":"A framed portrait of <tips=31>Ellie</tips>, apparently drawn by a child, hung on the wall.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r490","rowIndex":490,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なんだか懐かしい雰囲気ですね。思い出しませんか？」","en":"“This atmosphere is strangely nostalgic. Doesn’t it remind you of anything?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐松子","displayName":"Matsuko Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r491","rowIndex":491,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=55>松子</tips>が小さく囁く。","en":"<tips=55>Matsuko</tips> whispered.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r492","rowIndex":492,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「私は懐かしくないね。最近も顔を出したばかりだ」","en":"“Not me. I visited again only recently.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r493","rowIndex":493,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「私も、一度行きたいなあ……」","en":"“I’d like to go back once too...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐松子","displayName":"Matsuko Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r494","rowIndex":494,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「やめたほうがいい。あの頃の職員もまだいるし、死んだ筈の<tips=55>汐さん</tips>が現れたらびっくりするだろう」","en":"“Better not. Some of the old staff are still there. Imagine their surprise if <tips=55>Ms. Shio</tips>, who is supposed to be dead, appeared before them.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r495","rowIndex":495,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうですよね」","en":"“You’re right.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐松子","displayName":"Matsuko Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r496","rowIndex":496,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=55>松子</tips>は寂しそうに笑う。","en":"<tips=55>Matsuko</tips> smiled sadly.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r497","rowIndex":497,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ティーバッグしかないのですがよろしいですか？」","en":"“I only have tea bags. Will that be all right?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r498","rowIndex":498,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　給湯室の方から<tips=31>エリー</tips>の声がする。","en":"<tips=31>Ellie’s</tips> voice came from the kitchenette.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r499","rowIndex":499,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いや、おかまいなく」","en":"“No, please don’t trouble yourself.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r500","rowIndex":500,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は断ったつもりだったが、<tips=31>エリー</tips>は紅茶を作って持って来てくれた。","en":"I intended to decline, but <tips=31>Ellie</tips> prepared tea and brought it to us.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r501","rowIndex":501,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ミス･ホワイト自ら淹れて頂くとは恐縮ですな」","en":"“What an honor to have Miss White herself make my tea.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r502","rowIndex":502,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「今はその名は使っていないんです。<tips=31>エリー・ホワイト</tips>というのは屋号のようなものでしたから」","en":"“I no longer use that name. <tips=31>Ellie White</tips> was something like a trade name.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エリー・ホワイト（ベル―）","displayName":"Ellie White (Belukha)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r503","rowIndex":503,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうでしたな。ええと、確か……」","en":"“Of course. Let me see, it was...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r504","rowIndex":504,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=87>ベルーハ</tips>です。親のように大事な方から頂いた名前です」","en":"“<tips=87>Belukha</tips>. It is a name I received from someone as dear to me as a parent.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エリー・ホワイト（ベル―）","displayName":"Ellie White (Belukha)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r505","rowIndex":505,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうですか」","en":"“I see.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r506","rowIndex":506,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は原稿のために様々な調査をしていて、彼女の素性もほぼ洗い出している。彼女の本来の名は<tips=32>アサヒ</tips>と言ったはずだ。<tips=9>Y地区</tips>の貧しい家庭に生まれ、『<tips=18>ローズ･クラブ</tips>』に売られた。そこで後に<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>を作る<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>と、『ドクター』として暗躍する前の<tips=5>太刀川良馬</tips>に救出されるのだ。","en":"In the course of researching this manuscript, I have uncovered nearly all of her background. Her original name, I believe, was <tips=32>Asahi</tips>. Born to a poor household in <tips=9>Y District</tips>, she was sold to the “<tips=18>Rose Club</tips>.” There, she was rescued by <tips=3>Chris Tse</tips>, who would later establish <tips=7>YS</tips>, and <tips=5>Ryoma Tachikawa</tips>, before he began his covert work as the “Doctor.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r507","rowIndex":507,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　思えば、そこで三人が出会った日から全てがはじまったのかもしれないな。","en":"Come to think of it, perhaps everything began the day those three met there.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r508","rowIndex":508,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私はそんなことをぼんやりと考えた。","en":"The thought drifted idly through my mind.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r509","rowIndex":509,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　かつて<tips=32>アサヒ</tips>と呼ばれる不幸な少女だった彼女は、私がかたわらに置いたマスクをじっと見つめている。","en":"The woman who had once been an unhappy girl called <tips=32>Asahi</tips> stared at the mask I had placed beside me.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r510","rowIndex":510,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「気になりますか？」","en":"“Does it interest you?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r511","rowIndex":511,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私が言うと彼女は頷き、","en":"When I said that, she nodded and said,","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r512","rowIndex":512,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それ、本物ですか？　そっくり同じで……」","en":"“Is that the real thing? It looks exactly the same...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エリー・ホワイト（ベル―）","displayName":"Ellie White (Belukha)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r513","rowIndex":513,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=5>太刀川</tips>先生の遺品ですよ。駄目になったパーツは新しくかえましたがね」","en":"“It was one of Dr. <tips=5>Tachikawa’s</tips> personal effects. I replaced the parts that had deteriorated, though.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r514","rowIndex":514,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女は目を丸くして驚きの顔を浮かべる。","en":"Her eyes widened in astonishment.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r515","rowIndex":515,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「警察の保管庫に死蔵していたのを引っ張り出して来たんですよ。もう一回この街の景色を見せてやりたくて」","en":"“It was gathering dust in a police storeroom, so I dragged it back out. I wanted to show it the city one more time.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r516","rowIndex":516,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まあ……」","en":"“Oh...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エリー・ホワイト（ベル―）","displayName":"Ellie White (Belukha)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r517","rowIndex":517,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どうぞ」","en":"“Here.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r518","rowIndex":518,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私がマスクを手渡すと、<tips=87>ベルーハ</tips>はおそるおそるそれを受け取った。","en":"When I offered the mask, <tips=87>Belukha</tips> accepted it gingerly.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r519","rowIndex":519,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「懐かしい……。色んなことが、思い出されますわ」","en":"“How nostalgic... So many things are coming back to me.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エリー・ホワイト（ベル―）","displayName":"Ellie White (Belukha)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r520","rowIndex":520,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=87>ベルーハ</tips>はしみじみと眺めたあとにそれを一旦かぶって、そして外すと恥ずかしげに笑った。その仕草はまるで少女のようだ。","en":"<tips=87>Belukha</tips> gazed at it for a long moment, put it on, and then removed it again with an embarrassed smile. The gesture made her look just like a girl.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r521","rowIndex":521,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「私、<tips=3>クリス</tips>様のことは兄のように、<tips=5>太刀川</tips>先生のことは父のように思っています。そして、<tips=31>エリー・ホワイト</tips>は母のように……。でも、みんな死んでしまった」","en":"“I think of Lord <tips=3>Chris</tips> as an older brother, <tips=5>Doctor Tachikawa</tips> as a father, and <tips=31>Ellie White</tips> as a mother... But every one of them has died.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エリー・ホワイト（ベル―）","displayName":"Ellie White (Belukha)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r522","rowIndex":522,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　膝の上に置いたマスクを見つめながら<tips=87>ベルーハ</tips>は言う。","en":"<tips=87>Belukha</tips> spoke while looking down at the mask upon her lap.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r523","rowIndex":523,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「人は死ぬものです。普通はね」","en":"“People die. Ordinarily.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r524","rowIndex":524,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私が言うと、","en":"When I said that,","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r525","rowIndex":525,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それだと、ここにいる私たちは普通じゃないってことですか」","en":"“Does that mean those of us here aren’t normal?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐松子","displayName":"Matsuko Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r526","rowIndex":526,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　紅茶を飲みながら<tips=55>松子</tips>が笑う。","en":"<tips=55>Matsuko</tips> laughed as she drank her tea.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r527","rowIndex":527,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうですとも。この三人は不死の世界に片足を踏み入れた、妖怪のようなものです。だからこうやってね、真夜中にこそこそ集まって秘密の会合をしている」","en":"“Indeed. The three of us are a bit like specters with one foot in the realm of immortality. That’s why we sneak together at midnight for secret meetings like this.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r528","rowIndex":528,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私がおどけると、<tips=55>松子</tips>は肩をすくめ、<tips=87>ベルーハ</tips>は苦笑する。","en":"<tips=55>Matsuko</tips> shrugged at my clowning, while <tips=87>Belukha</tips> smiled wryly.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r529","rowIndex":529,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私はその<tips=87>ベルーハ</tips>の顔を見ながら、","en":"Watching <tips=87>Belukha’s</tips> face, I said,","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r530","rowIndex":530,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いや、三人ではなく、四人かな」","en":"“Or perhaps there are four of us, not three.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r531","rowIndex":531,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　言ったが、想像と違って<tips=87>ベルーハ</tips>は表情を変えず穏やかに笑ったままだ。","en":"Contrary to my expectation, <tips=87>Belukha’s</tips> expression did not change. Her gentle smile remained in place.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r532","rowIndex":532,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=87>ベルーハ</tips>さん、今日は<tips=55>汐さん</tips>とあんたを引き合わせるのが目的だと言ったけれど、それだけじゃない。他にもう一つ大事な目的がある」","en":"“<tips=87>Belukha</tips>, I told you I came today to introduce you to <tips=55>Ms. Shio</tips>. But that isn’t the whole reason. There’s something else important I came to do.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r533","rowIndex":533,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なんでしょう？」","en":"“What might that be?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エリー・ホワイト（ベル―）","displayName":"Ellie White (Belukha)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r534","rowIndex":534,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=1>謝亮</tips>に会わせてもらいたい」","en":"“I want you to arrange for me to meet <tips=1>Tse Leung</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r535","rowIndex":535,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その名を口にした瞬間、部屋の空気が変わる。","en":"The atmosphere in the room changed the instant I spoke the name.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r536","rowIndex":536,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　隣で<tips=55>松子</tips>が息をのみ、<tips=87>ベルーハ</tips>は穏やかな表情のままではあったが、それまでの和やかな印象が消えて、警戒が見えた。","en":"<tips=55>Matsuko</tips> caught her breath beside me. <tips=87>Belukha</tips> maintained her gentle expression, but all its earlier warmth vanished, leaving visible caution.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r537","rowIndex":537,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「その方は、とっくに亡くなりましたよ」","en":"“That person died long ago.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エリー・ホワイト（ベル―）","displayName":"Ellie White (Belukha)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r538","rowIndex":538,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　溜息と共に<tips=87>ベルーハ</tips>はそう吐き出す。","en":"<tips=87>Belukha</tips> said it with a sigh.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r539","rowIndex":539,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「わかってるんだ。あんたは自分の血を使って<tips=1>謝亮</tips>を蘇らせた。再生した彼は、おそらくまだ子供の姿で、ここで孤児たちにまぎれて暮らしているんですよ。それがしたくて、あなたはこんな施設をはじめたんだ」","en":"“I know. You used your blood to bring <tips=1>Tse Leung</tips> back to life. Regenerated, he is probably still a child in appearance, living here hidden among the orphans. You started a facility like this so you could do exactly that.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r540","rowIndex":540,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ただの空想です。私はただ、かつての自分のような子供を救ってやりたくて、この施設を作ったんです。これは子供の頃からの夢で、<tips=31>エリー・ホワイト</tips>にだって、語ったことがあるんですよ。彼女は笑って何もこたえてはくれませんでしたが」","en":"“That is only fantasy. I established this facility because I simply wanted to save children like the child I once was. This was my dream from childhood. I even told <tips=31>Ellie White</tips> about it once. She only laughed and never gave me an answer.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エリー・ホワイト（ベル―）","displayName":"Ellie White (Belukha)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r541","rowIndex":541,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まあ、長年の夢だったのは本当なんでしょう。だが、それだけではないはずだ。絶対に」","en":"“Well, I’m sure it really was a lifelong dream. But that can’t be the whole reason. I’m certain of that.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r542","rowIndex":542,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「探偵さん」","en":"“Detective.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エリー・ホワイト（ベル―）","displayName":"Ellie White (Belukha)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r543","rowIndex":543,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=87>ベルーハ</tips>は私の目を見つめ、","en":"<tips=87>Belukha</tips> looked into my eyes.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r544","rowIndex":544,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「疑うならお調べになったらいかがかしら？　名探偵<tips=50>路地邦昭</tips>の超能力で、見つけ出せない真実はないはずです」","en":"“If you have doubts, why not investigate? Surely no truth lies beyond the psychic ability of the great detective <tips=50>Kuniaki Roji</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エリー・ホワイト（ベル―）","displayName":"Ellie White (Belukha)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r545","rowIndex":545,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それじゃ意味がないんだよ」","en":"“That would defeat the purpose.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r546","rowIndex":546,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「どういうことですか？」","en":"“What do you mean?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エリー・ホワイト（ベル―）","displayName":"Ellie White (Belukha)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r547","rowIndex":547,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は怪訝な表情を浮かべる<tips=87>ベルーハ</tips>の膝に手を伸ばし、その上にあったマスクを手に取ると、顔にかぶる。","en":"I reached toward the puzzled <tips=87>Belukha</tips>, took the mask from her lap, and put it over my face.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r548","rowIndex":548,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「な、なにを……」","en":"“Wh-what are you...?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エリー・ホワイト（ベル―）","displayName":"Ellie White (Belukha)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r549","rowIndex":549,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　顔を背けようとする彼女に、","en":"She tried to turn her face away.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r550","rowIndex":550,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=87>ベルーハ</tips>さん、目をそらさないで聞いてください」","en":"“Ms. <tips=87>Belukha</tips>, please don’t look away. Listen to me.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r551","rowIndex":551,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そ、その仮面をつけて言うのは卑怯です……」","en":"“I-it is unfair to say that while wearing his mask...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エリー・ホワイト（ベル―）","displayName":"Ellie White (Belukha)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r552","rowIndex":552,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=87>ベルーハ</tips>はそれでも言葉に逆らえず私を見る。その表情は、ここに来てからはじめて歪んでいる。","en":"Even so, <tips=87>Belukha</tips> could not bring herself to disobey me, and looked my way. For the first time since we arrived, her expression contorted.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r553","rowIndex":553,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「私はあんたにしっかり聞いてほしいんですよ。………なあ<tips=87>ベルーハ</tips>さん、あんたは<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>の息子とその恋人を引き合わせなければいけない。そして、その場面に立ちあうんだ」","en":"“I need you to listen carefully. ...<tips=87>Belukha</tips>, you have to bring <tips=3>Chris Tse’s</tips> son and his lover together—and you have to be there to witness it.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r554","rowIndex":554,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なぜ私がそんなことを……」","en":"“Why should I do any such thing...?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エリー・ホワイト（ベル―）","displayName":"Ellie White (Belukha)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r555","rowIndex":555,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=87>ベルーハ</tips>の青い目にうっすら涙が浮かぶ。この仮面の効果は思った以上に絶大のようだ。","en":"A film of tears gathered in <tips=87>Belukha’s</tips> blue eyes. The effect of this mask seemed even greater than I had expected.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r556","rowIndex":556,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あんたに彼らの邪魔をする権利はない」","en":"“You have no right to stand in their way.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r557","rowIndex":557,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=87>ベルーハ</tips>は歯を食いしばる。","en":"<tips=87>Belukha</tips> clenched her teeth.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r558","rowIndex":558,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ここで欲望のまま<tips=1>謝亮</tips>をペットみたいに飼っていたって、きみは自分の胸に空いた穴を何も埋めることが出来ない。そんなことはわかっているはずだ。彼は<tips=3>クリス・ツェー</tips>ではない。あんたの大事な人はとっくに死んだんです」","en":"“Even if you keep <tips=1>Tse Leung</tips> here like a pet to satisfy your own desires, it will do nothing to fill the hole in your heart. You must know that. He is not <tips=3>Chris Tse</tips>. The person you loved died long ago.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r559","rowIndex":559,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「本物の先生なら、そんな残酷なことは言いませんっ」","en":"“The real Doctor would never say anything so cruel!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エリー・ホワイト（ベル―）","displayName":"Ellie White (Belukha)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r560","rowIndex":560,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=87>ベルーハ</tips>はさっと立ち上がると、私たちに背を向けた。","en":"<tips=87>Belukha</tips> shot to her feet and turned her back upon us.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r561","rowIndex":561,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ついて来てください」","en":"“Come with me.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r562","rowIndex":562,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=87>ベルーハ</tips>」","en":"“<tips=87>Belukha</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r563","rowIndex":563,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……彼はまだ起きています」","en":"“...He is still awake.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r564","rowIndex":564,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　震える声で言うと、彼女は顔の辺りに一旦手をやり、そしてドアの方へ歩いて行った。","en":"After speaking in a trembling voice, she briefly raised a hand toward her face and then walked to the door.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r565","rowIndex":565,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=55>汐</tips>さん」","en":"“Ms. <tips=55>Shio</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r566","rowIndex":566,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は立ち上がって<tips=55>松子</tips>を振り返る。","en":"I stood and turned toward <tips=55>Matsuko</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r567","rowIndex":567,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「は、はい」","en":"“Y-yes.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐松子","displayName":"Matsuko Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r568","rowIndex":568,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女はこわばった顔で立ち上がると、そしてふらりとよろける。私は彼女の腕を掴んでそれを支える。","en":"She rose with her face rigid, then swayed. I caught her by the arm and held her upright.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r569","rowIndex":569,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「す、すみません。緊張して……」","en":"“S-sorry. I’m nervous...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐松子","displayName":"Matsuko Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r570","rowIndex":570,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　言葉通り、<tips=55>松子</tips>の顔は血の気が引いて真っ青になっていた。","en":"Just as she said, all color had drained from <tips=55>Matsuko’s</tips> face.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r571","rowIndex":571,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「彼は今、<tips=1>謝亮</tips>ではなく<tips=1>菅原亮</tips>という名で生活しています」","en":"“He now lives under the name <tips=1>Ryo Sugawara</tips>, not <tips=1>Tse Leung</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r572","rowIndex":572,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　廊下は暗く静かだった。前を行く<tips=87>ベルーハ</tips>の歩くカツカツという足音が反響している。","en":"The corridor was dark and silent. The sharp clicks of <tips=87>Belukha’s</tips> footsteps echoed ahead of us.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r573","rowIndex":573,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「記憶は？」","en":"“And his memories?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r574","rowIndex":574,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　尋ねたのは私だ。","en":"I asked the question.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r575","rowIndex":575,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　隣を歩く<tips=55>松子</tips>は引きつった顔で、胸をおさえている。きっと、心臓がバクバクと飛び出しそうな程高鳴っているのだろう。","en":"Walking beside me, <tips=55>Matsuko</tips> clutched her chest, her expression strained. Her heart must have been pounding hard enough to burst free.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r576","rowIndex":576,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「最初は曖昧でしたが、今はほとんど取り戻しています」","en":"“They were hazy at first, but now he has recovered almost all of them.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r577","rowIndex":577,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「発症はしていないのか？」","en":"“He hasn’t developed any symptoms?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r578","rowIndex":578,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「はい」","en":"“That’s right.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r579","rowIndex":579,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=87>ベルーハ</tips>の返答を聞くと、私は<tips=55>松子</tips>の方を見る。懸念事項の一つが取り除かれたはずだが、緊張の面持ちに変化を見せない。","en":"When <tips=87>Belukha</tips> answered, I looked over at <tips=55>Matsuko</tips>. One of her concerns should have been laid to rest, but her tense expression did not change.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r580","rowIndex":580,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ほかの子供たちと離れて、個室で暮らしているのかい？」","en":"“Does he live in a private room, apart from the other children?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r581","rowIndex":581,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ここは小さい子以外はみな個室です」","en":"“Everyone here except the very young has a room of their own.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r582","rowIndex":582,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「贅沢なもんだ」","en":"“That’s quite a luxury.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r583","rowIndex":583,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　廊下にはいくつもの扉が並んでいるが、どの扉の向こうからも物音一つしない。子供たちはもう眠りについているのだろう。","en":"Doors lined the corridor, but not a sound came from behind any of them. The children were probably already asleep.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r584","rowIndex":584,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「彼は起きているのかい？」","en":"“Is he awake?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r585","rowIndex":585,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「はい。昼は目立たないよう大人しくしているかわり、夜に自分のことをなさっています」","en":"“Yes. He keeps quiet during the day so as not to draw attention, then spends the nights pursuing his own interests.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r586","rowIndex":586,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「自分のこと？」","en":"“His own affairs?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r587","rowIndex":587,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「資料を取り寄せて、色んな勉強をなさっています。もともと科学者を志望されていましたから。<tips=3>クリス</tips>様に呼ばれて街に戻って来るまでは」","en":"“He has reference materials brought in and studies all sorts of things. He originally hoped to become a scientist—before Lord <tips=3>Chris</tips> called him back to the city.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r588","rowIndex":588,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「その続きをしようってわけか。いまこの街で起きていることに関わるつもりはないのか？」","en":"“So he means to pick up where he left off. Does he have no intention of getting involved in what is happening in this city now?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r589","rowIndex":589,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「関わることはないでしょう。『<tips=1>謝亮</tips>』という人間は死んだ。……それは、ご本人がお決めになったことです。そもそも、こうして再生がなされること自体、私が勝手にしでかしたことで、ご本意ではありませんから……」","en":"“I doubt he will. ‘<tips=1>Tse Leung</tips>’ is dead. ...That is what he himself decided. For that matter, the very fact that he was regenerated at all was something I took it upon myself to do, against his wishes...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r590","rowIndex":590,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「今は納得しているのか？」","en":"“Has he accepted it now?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r591","rowIndex":591,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ええ、仕方ないと……。ただ、将来的に自分が発症するかもしれないと、それを心配しておられます」","en":"“Yes. He says there’s nothing to be done about it... But he worries that he may develop symptoms someday.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r592","rowIndex":592,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうか」","en":"“I see.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r593","rowIndex":593,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　街で大暴れをした例の虎も、長年平穏な日々を送った後、突如発症して凶暴化したという。彼はそれに自分のこれからの運命を重ね合わせているのかもしれない。","en":"The tiger that rampaged through the city had likewise lived peacefully for years before suddenly developing symptoms and turning savage. Perhaps he saw his own fate reflected in its story.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r594","rowIndex":594,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　血が薄ければ薄いほどその危険性は高まる。オリジナルから、<tips=87>ベルーハ</tips>を経て、<tips=1>謝亮</tips>の血は大分薄まっている。杞憂というわけでもないのだろう。","en":"The thinner the blood, the greater the danger. Passed down from the original through <tips=87>Belukha</tips> to <tips=1>Tse Leung</tips>, it has now been diluted considerably. His fear is probably not unfounded.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r595","rowIndex":595,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「危険があるのを知りながら、本人が嫌がっているのもわかっていて、私はそうしました。おぞましいものです」","en":"“I knew the danger. I knew he didn’t want it. And I did it anyway. What I did was monstrous.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r596","rowIndex":596,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女は振り向きもせず、冷たい声でそう言った。","en":"She said it coldly, without turning around.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r597","rowIndex":597,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「何がおぞましいものか」","en":"“What is loathsome about it?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r598","rowIndex":598,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私はきっぱりと否定をした。","en":"I rejected the notion flatly.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r599","rowIndex":599,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「欲望が世界を美しく価値のあるものにするんだ。ヤツだってこの街の住人だ。わかってる」","en":"“Desire is what makes the world beautiful and worth living in. He’s a resident of this city too. He understands.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r600","rowIndex":600,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その言葉に、彼女は反応をしない。","en":"She gave no response.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r601","rowIndex":601,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=1>謝亮</tips>はこの先ずっとここで暮らすのかい？」","en":"“Will <tips=1>Tse Leung</tips> go on living here forever?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r602","rowIndex":602,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は話を変えた。","en":"I changed the subject.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r603","rowIndex":603,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いえ、現在はお体が急激に成長なさっているためこうして隠れていますが、それが落ち着いたらこの街を出て遠くでひっそり暮らしたいとおっしゃっています」","en":"“No. He is hiding here now because his body is growing rapidly, but he says that once it settles down, he would like to leave this city and live quietly somewhere far away.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r604","rowIndex":604,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ふむ、<tips=55>汐</tips>さんのことは何か言っていたか？」","en":"“Hmm. Has he said anything about Ms. <tips=55>Shio</tips>?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r605","rowIndex":605,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いえ……」","en":"“No...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r606","rowIndex":606,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうか」","en":"“I see.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r607","rowIndex":607,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ここです」","en":"“Here.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エリー・ホワイト（ベル―）","displayName":"Ellie White (Belukha)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r608","rowIndex":608,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　廊下に並んだドアのなかでただ一つ、隙間から明かりの漏れるドアの前に立ち、<tips=87>ベルーハ</tips>は振り返った。","en":"Of all the doors lining the corridor, only one had light leaking through its cracks. <tips=87>Belukha</tips> stopped before it and turned to us.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r609","rowIndex":609,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「心の準備はどうだ？」","en":"“Are you ready?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r610","rowIndex":610,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私は<tips=55>松子</tips>に尋ねる。","en":"I asked <tips=55>Matsuko</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r611","rowIndex":611,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「はい、大丈夫です」","en":"“Yes. I’m all right.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"汐松子","displayName":"Matsuko Shio","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r612","rowIndex":612,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　うわずった声だが、はっきりとした意志と覚悟が感じられる。もう怯えてはいないようだ。","en":"Her voice was pitched high with tension, yet it carried unmistakable determination and resolve. She no longer seemed afraid.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r613","rowIndex":613,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いい子だ」","en":"“Good girl.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r614","rowIndex":614,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして私は<tips=87>ベルーハ</tips>に目で合図する。","en":"Then I signaled <tips=87>Belukha</tips> with a glance.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r615","rowIndex":615,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それでは」","en":"“Then...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エリー・ホワイト（ベル―）","displayName":"Ellie White (Belukha)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r616","rowIndex":616,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=87>ベルーハ</tips>は言うと、ガチャリと音を立ててドアを開いた。","en":"<tips=87>Belukha</tips> opened the door with a click.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r617","rowIndex":617,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　真っ暗な廊下で漏れた光を見たときに想像していたほど部屋のなかは明るくなく、むしろ薄暗い。","en":"The room was not as bright as the light leaking into the dark corridor had led me to imagine. If anything, it was dim.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r618","rowIndex":618,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　天井の照明がついておらず、壁際に置かれた机の上のライトと、パソコンのモニターの光だけがこの部屋の明かりだった。","en":"The ceiling light was off. The room was lit only by a lamp on the desk against the wall and the glow of a computer monitor.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r619","rowIndex":619,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そしてその机では、少年が一人椅子に座ってパソコンで何か作業をしている。ヘッドフォンをしていて、すぐには我々が入ったことに気がつかない。","en":"A boy sat at the desk, working at the computer. He wore headphones and did not immediately notice our entrance.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r620","rowIndex":620,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「お客様です」","en":"“You have visitors.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r621","rowIndex":621,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=87>ベルーハ</tips>が静かに声をかける。","en":"<tips=87>Belukha</tips> spoke quietly.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r622","rowIndex":622,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　すると彼はヘッドフォンを外し、くるりと椅子を回して振り返った。","en":"The boy removed his headphones, swiveled his chair around, and turned to face us.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r623","rowIndex":623,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　年齢は十歳を少し過ぎたくらいに見える。","en":"He appeared a little over ten.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r624","rowIndex":624,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　艶やかな黒い髪。","en":"Glossy black hair.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r625","rowIndex":625,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　青磁のようにきめこまやかな白い肌。","en":"Smooth, finely textured white skin like celadon porcelain.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r626","rowIndex":626,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　冷たく澄んだ切れ長の目。","en":"Long, narrow eyes, cold and clear.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r627","rowIndex":627,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その美しい顔立ちは、この街の人々が知っているあの人物の顔を、そのまま幼くしたものだった。","en":"His beautiful face was exactly that of the man everyone in this city knew, only made young.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r628","rowIndex":628,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「りょ、<tips=1>亮</tips>さん……」","en":"“R-<tips=1>Ryo</tips>...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r629","rowIndex":629,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=55>松子</tips>が声を震わせている。","en":"<tips=55>Matsuko’s</tips> voice trembled.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r630","rowIndex":630,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「やあ、久しぶり」","en":"“Hello. It’s been a long time.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮（少年時代）","displayName":"Tse Leung (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r631","rowIndex":631,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼は恥ずかしそうに頭をかきつつ、","en":"Scratching his head sheepishly, he said,","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r632","rowIndex":632,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「実にみっともない話だけれど、僕はまだ、生きているようだ」","en":"“This is terribly embarrassing, but it seems I’m still alive.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮（少年時代）","displayName":"Tse Leung (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r633","rowIndex":633,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして溜息をつく。","en":"Then he sighed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r634","rowIndex":634,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=55>松子</tips>は目を見開き、その少年の顔を食い入るように見つめている。","en":"<tips=55>Matsuko’s</tips> eyes widened as she stared intently at the boy’s face.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r635","rowIndex":635,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「思ったようにはならなかったが、しかし生きるしかない。そもそも、我々は全員、生まれてきたから、生きているというだけなんだからね」","en":"“It did not turn out as I had hoped, but I have no choice but to live. After all, every one of us is alive simply because we were born.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮（少年時代）","displayName":"Tse Leung (Boyhood)","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r636","rowIndex":636,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そう言った瞬間、<tips=55>松子</tips>は膝を折って泣き崩れた。","en":"The moment he said it, <tips=55>Matsuko’s</tips> knees buckled and she collapsed in tears.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r637","rowIndex":637,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　少年は立ち上がる。","en":"The boy rose.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r638","rowIndex":638,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それにあわせて、横方向から照らす光が作る影が、彼の顔の上で生き物のように動いた。","en":"As he moved, the shadows cast by the light to one side crawled over his face like living things.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r639","rowIndex":639,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼は号泣する<tips=55>松子</tips>に近づき、その震える肩にぽんと手を置く。","en":"He approached the sobbing <tips=55>Matsuko</tips> and gave her trembling shoulder a gentle pat.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r640","rowIndex":640,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=55>松子</tips>は微かに顔を上げ、その潤んだ瞳で、すぐ目の前で自分を見つめている少年を見る。","en":"<tips=55>Matsuko</tips> lifted her face slightly and, through tear-filled eyes, looked at the boy gazing back at her from just inches away.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r641","rowIndex":641,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　少年は溜息をつき、唇を開いた。","en":"The boy sighed and parted his lips.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X17:r642","rowIndex":642,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「長い間ごめん。でも、もう全部終わったんだ」","en":"“I’m sorry it took me so long. But it’s all over now.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}}]},{"position":63,"code":"X19","unitId":"X19","rows":[{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X19:r1","rowIndex":1,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=47>八龍解放軍</tips>は病院襲撃以後も活発に活動していた。","en":"The <tips=47>Hachiryu Liberation Army</tips> remained active after the hospital raid.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X19:r2","rowIndex":2,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=17>タイプＢ</tips>の解放と言えば聞こえが良いが、その価値判断は一方的なもので、住民と数多くのトラブルを引き起こした。","en":"The ‘liberation of <tips=17>Type Bs</tips>’ sounded noble enough, but the standards by which the army dispensed justice were entirely one-sided, bringing it into frequent conflict with the city’s residents.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X19:r3","rowIndex":3,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　アルバイトを不当に扱ったと言っては飲食店に乗り込んで設備を打ち壊し、使用人を差別したと言っては富裕者のいる邸宅に押し入って家人に暴力を振るった。","en":"Claiming that part-time workers had been treated unfairly, its members would storm restaurants and smash the equipment. Claiming that servants had suffered discrimination, they would break into the homes of the wealthy and assault the residents.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X19:r4","rowIndex":4,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　街の住民の多くはこの<tips=47>解放軍</tips>の動きに拒絶反応を示したが、<tips=17>タイプＢ</tips>に限れば支持する者も多く、公の場で賞賛する有力者などもいた。これによって、<tips=9>Y地区</tips>のような街でも、<tips=17>タイプＢ</tips>の人々は不当な差別をされていると感じていることが明らかになった。","en":"Most of the city’s residents recoiled from the <tips=47>Liberation Army’s</tips> activities. Among <tips=17>Type Bs</tips>, however, many supported them, and some prominent figures even offered public praise. This made it clear that even in a city like <tips=9>Y District</tips>, <tips=17>Type Bs</tips> felt that they were subjected to unjust discrimination.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X19:r5","rowIndex":5,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　このような<tips=21>八龍会</tips>の動きを街のギャングたちも黙って見過ごしているはずがない。","en":"The city’s gangs were hardly going to stand by and ignore the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society’s</tips> activities.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X19:r6","rowIndex":6,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　明日にでも<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>との衝突が起こるのではないかと思われているなか、はじめにトラブルを引き起こしたのは<tips=75>フェルナンデス・ファミリー</tips>だった。","en":"With a clash against <tips=7>YS</tips> expected at any time, it was the <tips=75>Fernandes Family</tips> that first caused trouble.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X19:r7","rowIndex":7,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　襲撃によって<tips=35>ジョゼ・フェルナンデス</tips>と二人の娘が殺されるという悲劇を乗り越えてきた<tips=75>フェルナンデス・ファミリー</tips>は<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>を脱退したとは言え街では最も有力なギャングの一つである。","en":"Even after weathering the tragedy of an attack that killed <tips=35>José Fernandes</tips> and two of his daughters, the <tips=75>Fernandes Family</tips> remained one of the most powerful gangs in the city despite its withdrawal from <tips=7>YS</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X19:r8","rowIndex":8,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　長らく出身国ごとに分かれて争っていた南米人たちを一つにまとめた<tips=75>フェルナンデス・ファミリー</tips>はそれ自体がラテン・アメリカ連合とでも言うべき組織であった。","en":"The <tips=75>Fernandes Family</tips> had united the South Americans who had long been divided by country of origin and fought among themselves; the organization was itself something of a Latin American federation.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X19:r9","rowIndex":9,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　この<tips=75>フェルナンデス・ファミリー</tips>内では<tips=17>タイプＢ</tips>とそれ以外を差別するということはなかった。ラテン・アメリカ出身ならば誰でも平等に扱うという方針で、組織内の風通しは悪くはなかったのだが、前述の襲撃事件以後多少風向きが変化している。","en":"Within the <tips=75>Fernandes Family</tips>, there had been no discrimination between <tips=17>Type Bs</tips> and anyone else. Its policy was to treat all Latin Americans equally, and the organization had been relatively open. Since the aforementioned attack, however, the climate had shifted somewhat.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X19:r10","rowIndex":10,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　襲撃者が<tips=17>タイプＢ</tips>であったことから、<tips=21>八龍会</tips>は彼らを擁護した。これにより、ファミリーのなかには<tips=17>タイプＢ</tips>――および<tips=21>八龍会</tips>に対する反発心のようなものが生まれた。","en":"Because the assailants had been <tips=17>Type Bs</tips>, the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips> defended them. As a result, something like resentment toward <tips=17>Type Bs</tips>—and toward the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips>—began to take root within the Family.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X19:r11","rowIndex":11,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　こうした状況を踏まえると、彼らがまずどの組織よりも先に<tips=47>八龍解放軍</tips>を非難することになったのは当然の成り行きと言えるだろう。","en":"Given the circumstances, it was only natural that the Family should become the first organization to condemn the <tips=47>Hachiryu Liberation Army</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X19:r12","rowIndex":12,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　きっかけは、<tips=75>ファミリー</tips>のとある幹部が使用人を解雇処分にしたことだった。","en":"The immediate cause was a decision by one <tips=75>Family</tips> officer to fire a servant.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X19:r13","rowIndex":13,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　処分されたのは<tips=17>タイプＢ</tips>の少年である。手癖が悪く、主人の財布からしばしば現金をくすねてしまうというのがその理由だった。","en":"The servant was a <tips=17>Type B</tips> boy. The stated reason was that he had a habit of pilfering cash from his master’s wallet.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X19:r14","rowIndex":14,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　少年が<tips=21>八龍会</tips>に訴えると、<tips=21>八龍会</tips>はこの処分は不当であると正式に表明した。これに対して幹部本人をかばって<tips=75>フェルナンデス・ファミリー</tips>そのものが反論したのである。","en":"When the boy appealed to the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips>, the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips> formally declared the dismissal unjust. The <tips=75>Fernandes Family</tips> itself countered in defense of the officer.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X19:r15","rowIndex":15,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　お互いに自説を証明する証拠がなく、結局はとったとらないの水掛け論にしかならない。こうした緊張感のなか、<tips=75>フェルナンデス・ファミリー</tips>の若い者が<tips=57>滑走路通り</tips>で<tips=47>八龍解放軍</tips>と揉め、<tips=47>解放軍</tips>側の一人が死亡するという事件が起きてしまった。","en":"With neither side possessing evidence to prove its claim, the dispute ultimately became an endless argument over whether the boy had stolen anything. Amid this tension, young men from the <tips=75>Fernandes Family</tips> got into a fight on <tips=57>Runway Street</tips> with the <tips=47>Hachiryu Liberation Army</tips>, and one member of the <tips=47>Liberation Army</tips> was killed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X19:r16","rowIndex":16,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　これに対し<tips=21>八龍会</tips>は猛然と非難し、実行犯の引き渡しを<tips=75>ファミリー</tips>に要求する。しかし、<tips=75>ファミリー</tips>のボスである<tips=38>リタ・フェルナンデス</tips>は喧嘩自体はお互いに責任があるもので死はその結果に過ぎないと拒否をした。","en":"The <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips> furiously denounced the killing and demanded that the <tips=75>Family</tips> surrender the perpetrator. But the boss of the <tips=75>Family</tips>, <tips=38>Rita Fernandes</tips>, refused, saying that both sides were responsible for the fight and the death was merely its result.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X19:r17","rowIndex":17,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　この結果、その事件が発生した。","en":"That refusal led to the incident in question.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X19:r18","rowIndex":18,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　どうやら<tips=47>解放軍</tips>がフェルナンデス家を襲撃するらしい、という情報を<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>が掴んだのはそれが行われる朝のことだった。","en":"<tips=7>YS</tips> learned that the <tips=47>Liberation Army</tips> apparently meant to attack the Fernandes residence only on the morning the attack was to take place.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X19:r19","rowIndex":19,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その日、<tips=25>馬世傑</tips>はいつもより早く<tips=41>グランドタワー</tips>に姿を現した。","en":"That day, <tips=25>Ma Sai-kit</tips> arrived at the <tips=41>Grand Tower</tips> earlier than usual.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X19:r20","rowIndex":20,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　一時は不祥事により<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>を離れ、そして呼び戻されると<tips=1>謝亮</tips>の片腕として重用されて来た彼は、その若さと以前の素行の悪さのために組織内では何かと風当たりが強かったが、父の<tips=4>馬明</tips>が死んでから身のまわりの空気が変化してきている。","en":"He had once left <tips=7>YS</tips> in disgrace, only to be recalled and entrusted with important work as <tips=1>Tse Leung’s</tips> right hand. His youth and his former misconduct had made him the object of constant hostility within the organization, but the atmosphere around him had changed since his father <tips=4>Ma Ming’s</tips> death.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X19:r21","rowIndex":21,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　馬家の長男として父の残した部下や事業をそのまま引き継ぎ、<tips=1>謝亮</tips>の腹心として重要な任務を成功させたことにより、名実ともに<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>内で押しも押されもせぬ存在となっていた。死んだ父のように<tips=85>二路元帥</tips>となり、<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>の最高幹部の一人となるのも時間の問題と目されている。","en":"As the Ma family’s eldest son, he had inherited his father’s men and businesses intact. His success on important assignments as <tips=1>Tse Leung’s</tips> confidant had made his position within <tips=7>YS</tips> unassailable in every respect. It was now considered only a matter of time before he followed his late father in becoming a <tips=85>Second Route Marshal</tips> and joined the highest ranks of <tips=7>YS</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X19:r22","rowIndex":22,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼の他にも<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>の組織図は順々に若返りはじめており、時代が変わった、というのを皆素直な気持ちで受け入れはじめているのであろう。","en":"Elsewhere as well, the ranks of <tips=7>YS</tips> were gradually growing younger. Everyone seemed to be accepting in all sincerity that the times had changed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X19:r23","rowIndex":23,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ただ<tips=25>世傑</tips>本人はこうした自分への評価をちっとも面白いことだとは思っていないようで、人になんやかやと言われても、冗談を言ってかわすのであった。","en":"<tips=25>Sai-kit</tips> himself appeared to find none of this attention remotely amusing. Whatever anyone said to him, he laughed it off with a joke.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X19:r24","rowIndex":24,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=41>グランドタワー</tips>に到着した彼は、左右の部下に下品な軽口を叩きながら執務室への道を歩く。その口辺にはいつも通りの微笑が漂っているが、以前より少し頬はこけ、目のまわりにはうっすらとくまが浮かんでいる。食事も睡眠も、充分にはとれていない様子であった。","en":"After reaching the <tips=41>Grand Tower</tips>, he made his way toward the executive office, trading vulgar banter with the men flanking him. His customary smile still played at his lips, but his cheeks had grown slightly hollow and faint shadows ringed his eyes. Plainly, he had not been eating or sleeping enough.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X19:r25","rowIndex":25,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼が今日早めに訪れたのは、主の<tips=1>謝亮</tips>を心配してのことだった。","en":"He had come early that day out of concern for his superior, <tips=1>Tse Leung</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X19:r26","rowIndex":26,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　昨夜、協力関係となった警察から『<tips=20>コシチェイ</tips>』が新たな事件を起こしたと連絡が入った。地区内の児童養護施設で、職員を一人殺したのだ。その職員は<tips=70>シオクリーン</tips>社長の娘だそうで、地域の有力者の身内が殺害されたことで新たな波紋を投げかけることになると予測された。","en":"Last night, the police, now working in cooperation with YS, reported that <tips=20>Koschei</tips> had caused another incident. At a children’s home in the district, one member of staff had been killed. The victim was reportedly the daughter of the president of <tips=70>Shio Clean</tips>, and the murder of a local notable’s relative was expected to cause fresh ripples through the community.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X19:r27","rowIndex":27,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その報を受けると、<tips=1>亮</tips>はすっかり動揺してしまった。顔色が蒼白になり、ほとんど口がきけない。<tips=26>世傑</tips>はこんな彼を見たのは初めてだった。共に銃を持って<tips=26>劉建志</tips>を襲った時でも、<tips=41>グランドタワー</tips>がサイキックに襲われた時でも、<tips=27>廖志明</tips>のマンションに乗り込んだ時でも、<tips=25>世傑</tips>が溜息をつきたくなるくらい平然としていたのである。","en":"The news left <tips=1>Leung</tips> utterly shaken. His face turned deathly pale, and he could scarcely speak. <tips=26>Sai-kit</tips> had never seen him like this. When the two of them had taken up guns against <tips=26>Ryu Kenshi</tips>, when a psychic attacked the <tips=41>Grand Tower</tips>, and when they stormed <tips=27>Liao Chi-ming’s</tips> apartment, Leung had remained so imperturbable it was enough to make <tips=25>Sai-kit</tips> sigh.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X19:r28","rowIndex":28,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>はすぐにその時部屋にいた全員を退室させた。そして昨夜はそのまま執務室に一人でこもり、今もそこに居るのだと言う。","en":"<tips=1>Leung</tips> had immediately ordered everyone then in the room to leave. He had remained alone in the executive office all night and, Sai-kit was told, was still there now.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X19:r29","rowIndex":29,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「おはよう。早いじゃないか」","en":"“Good morning. You’re early.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X19:r30","rowIndex":30,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　執務室を訪ねると、<tips=1>亮</tips>はそう言って薄く笑った。","en":"When Sai-kit entered the office, <tips=1>Leung</tips> greeted him with those words and a faint smile.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X19:r31","rowIndex":31,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　髪の毛は整えられ、無精髭も生えてはいなかったが、目のまわりにはくまが浮かんでおり、声も少し枯れている。","en":"His hair was neat and he had no stubble, but dark circles surrounded his eyes and his voice was slightly hoarse.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X19:r32","rowIndex":32,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「昨日はどうしたんですか？」","en":"“What happened yesterday?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬世傑","displayName":"Ma Sai-kit","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X19:r33","rowIndex":33,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なんでもないよ。心配をかけてすまなかったね。ちょっと疲れていたんだ」","en":"“Nothing. Sorry I worried you. I was just a little tired.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X19:r34","rowIndex":34,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>は肩をすくめて苦笑すると、","en":"<tips=1>Leung</tips> shrugged and gave a rueful smile.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X19:r35","rowIndex":35,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「今はもう大丈夫。気持ちを切り換えて、今日の仕事の話をしよう。きみには仕事があるんだ」","en":"“I’m fine now. Let’s put that behind us and discuss today’s work. I have a job for you.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X19:r36","rowIndex":36,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そう言って、<tips=25>世傑</tips>にこれ以上の質問をする余地を与えなかった。","en":"He allowed <tips=25>Sai-kit</tips> no opening for another question.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X19:r37","rowIndex":37,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「今日の早朝に諜報部から連絡があって、<tips=47>八龍解放軍</tips>が襲撃の準備をしていることが発覚した」","en":"“The intelligence division contacted us early this morning. We’ve learned that the <tips=47>Hachiryu Liberation Army</tips> is preparing an attack.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X19:r38","rowIndex":38,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「まあ、物騒なこと。どこを襲うんですか？」","en":"“My. How alarming. Where are they going to attack?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬世傑","displayName":"Ma Sai-kit","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X19:r39","rowIndex":39,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「フェルナンデス家の邸宅だよ。仲間を殺された報復だね」","en":"“The Fernandes residence. Retaliation for their dead comrade.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X19:r40","rowIndex":40,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なるほどね。じゃあ私はフェルナンデス家に出張というわけですか」","en":"“I see. So I’m off on a business trip to the Fernandes place.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬世傑","displayName":"Ma Sai-kit","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X19:r41","rowIndex":41,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「その通り。だけれど、戦いに参加する必要はない。どこか安全なところで<tips=47>解放軍</tips>の戦い振りを撮影してくれ。彼らの練度や、武器を確認したいんだ」","en":"“Exactly. You don’t need to join the fighting. Film the <tips=47>Liberation Army</tips> from somewhere safe. I want to see how well trained they are and what weapons they carry.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X19:r42","rowIndex":42,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「人の殺し合いを高見の見物とはなかなか洒落た仕事ですね。しかし、一度は求婚した<tips=38>リタ</tips>ちゃんを見殺しにするだなんてさすが冷徹な<tips=1>謝亮</tips>さまだこと」","en":"“Watching people kill one another from a safe perch—what a refined assignment. And leaving little <tips=38>Rita</tips>, whom you once proposed to, to die! Just what I’d expect of the coldhearted Lord <tips=1>Tse Leung</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬世傑","displayName":"Ma Sai-kit","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X19:r43","rowIndex":43,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=96>エンゾ・アラーニャ</tips>に手を貸してやろうかと言ったんだが断られたのさ。そもそも、襲撃されるっていう僕の話を信じちゃいない様子だった。せっかく機密情報を流してやったのにね」","en":"“I offered to lend <tips=96>Enzo Aranha</tips> a hand, but he refused. In fact, he didn’t seem to believe me at all when I told him he was going to be attacked. After I went to all the trouble of passing him classified intelligence, too.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X19:r44","rowIndex":44,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そりゃ、<tips=81>龍頭</tips>の日頃の行いが悪いんですよ。何かの策略じゃないかと疑ってるんだわ」","en":"“That’s because our <tips=81>Longtou</tips> behaves so badly. No wonder he suspects you of some scheme.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬世傑","displayName":"Ma Sai-kit","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X19:r45","rowIndex":45,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=25>世傑</tips>がからかうと<tips=1>亮</tips>は溜息をつき、","en":"After <tips=25>Sai-kit</tips> teased him, <tips=1>Leung</tips> sighed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X19:r46","rowIndex":46,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ま、武闘派で知られた誇り高き<tips=75>フェルナンデス・ファミリー</tips>が、自分から出ていった組織の世話になるわけにはいかないんだろう。せいぜいその勇敢さを見せつけて欲しいものだね」","en":"“Well, the proud <tips=75>Fernandes Family</tips>, famed for its fighting spirit, can hardly accept help from an organization it left of its own accord. Let us hope they give us a grand display of their courage.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X19:r47","rowIndex":47,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=81>龍頭</tips>は<tips=47>解放軍</tips>が勝つと思ってるんですね」","en":"“You think the <tips=47>Liberation Army</tips> will win, <tips=81>Longtou</tips>?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬世傑","displayName":"Ma Sai-kit","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X19:r48","rowIndex":48,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「とんでもない。僕は親愛なる<tips=75>フェルナンデス・ファミリー</tips>の勝利を信じているよ」","en":"“Certainly not. I have every faith in the victory of our dear <tips=75>Fernandes Family</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"謝亮","displayName":"Tse Leung","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X19:r49","rowIndex":49,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして、おおげさに肩をすくめた。","en":"Then he gave an exaggerated shrug.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X19:r50","rowIndex":50,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=25>世傑</tips>はフェルナンデス家の近くにある背の高い民家の主に交渉して、その一室から戦いの様子を見守ることにした。","en":"<tips=25>Sai-kit</tips> made arrangements with the owner of a tall house near the Fernandes residence, then settled in one of its rooms to observe the battle.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X19:r51","rowIndex":51,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　こうした<tips=1>亮</tips>からの仕事は馬家の直属の部下ではなく、執行部に所属する人員が割り振られることになっているのだが、今回彼に与えられた部下は五人。サイキックはいないが、優秀な<tips=17>タイプB</tips>が三人ほど含まれており、それぞれ銃で武装している。","en":"For assignments of this kind from <tips=1>Leung</tips>, Sai-kit was given personnel from the executive division rather than men directly subordinate to the Ma family. This time he had been assigned five. None was psychic, but three were highly capable <tips=17>Type Bs</tips>, and every one of them was armed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X19:r52","rowIndex":52,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　この日が襲撃だということはわかっていたが、何時になるかははっきりしていない。朝から待機して襲撃を待つことになる。","en":"They knew the attack would come that day, but not precisely when. They had been standing by since morning, waiting for it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X19:r53","rowIndex":53,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　フェルナンデス家はさすがに普段よりも警戒した様子で、邸内にはアサルトライフルを肩に担いだ者たちがうろつきまわっていた。<tips=25>世傑</tips>は彼らの様子を双眼鏡で眺めたり、カメラで撮影したりしている。","en":"The Fernandes residence was plainly on higher alert than usual. Men with assault rifles slung over their shoulders prowled the grounds. <tips=25>Sai-kit</tips> watched them through binoculars and took photographs with his camera.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X19:r54","rowIndex":54,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「もしこの様子を<tips=47>解放軍</tips>が見ていたら、作戦を取りやめるんじゃないかしら」","en":"“If the <tips=47>Liberation Army</tips> can see all this, won’t they call the operation off?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬世傑","displayName":"Ma Sai-kit","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X19:r55","rowIndex":55,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　待ちくたびれた<tips=25>世傑</tips>はそう溜息をついた。","en":"Weary of waiting, <tips=25>Sai-kit</tips> let out a sigh.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X19:r56","rowIndex":56,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=1>亮</tips>の忠告をまるきり信じなかったわけではないらしく、フェルナンデス家の装備はこれから戦争でもしようかというくらい物騒なものだ。","en":"It seemed they had not dismissed <tips=1>Leung’s</tips> warning entirely. The Fernandes household had armed itself as though it were about to go to war.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X19:r57","rowIndex":57,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼らの所持している銃器は<tips=31>エリー・ホワイト</tips>経由で買い集めたものだ。<tips=47>解放軍</tips>は別ルートで武器を調達しているが、数と質で<tips=75>フェルナンデス・ファミリー</tips>に張り合えるとは思えない。","en":"Its firearms had been amassed through <tips=31>Ellie White</tips>. The <tips=47>Liberation Army</tips> obtained its weapons by another route, but it seemed unlikely to rival the <tips=75>Fernandes Family</tips> in either quantity or quality.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X19:r58","rowIndex":58,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　この状況を見れば、襲撃の情報が流れていることはすぐにわかる。となると、通常ならば作戦実行とはならないはずだ。したところで、予期された襲撃では失敗が目に見えているだろう。","en":"One look at the situation was enough to tell them that word of the attack had leaked. Under ordinary circumstances, that should have kept them from carrying out the operation. Even if they proceeded, an expected attack was plainly doomed to fail.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X19:r59","rowIndex":59,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しかし夕暮れ時が近づき、見張っている<tips=25>世傑</tips>たちがすっかり油断しはじめた頃、それは唐突に始まった。","en":"But as dusk drew near and <tips=25>Sai-kit</tips> and his men began to let down their guard, the assault began without warning.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X19:r60","rowIndex":60,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　フェルナンデス邸の門に一台の軽トラックが近づいてくる。荷台には青いビニールシートが掛かっており、風でバタバタとはためいている。","en":"A small truck approached the gate of the Fernandes estate. A blue plastic tarp covered the bed, snapping and flapping in the wind.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X19:r61","rowIndex":61,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それが門のすぐ近くに停車すると、電動式の門はゆっくりと開いていった。そしてトラックはそこから敷地内に侵入する。","en":"The truck stopped immediately beside the gate. The powered gate slowly opened, and the truck drove onto the grounds.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X19:r62","rowIndex":62,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=25>世傑</tips>たちはこの様子を見ていたが、あまりにも自然だったので、業者かなにか予定されたものがなかに招かれたのだろうと思っていた。","en":"<tips=25>Sai-kit</tips> and the others watched, but the arrival looked so natural that they assumed some expected contractor had been admitted.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X19:r63","rowIndex":63,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しかし、実際はそうではなかった。","en":"They were wrong.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X19:r64","rowIndex":64,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　門はファミリー内の内通者が勝手に操作したものであり、トラックは<tips=47>解放軍</tips>の襲撃グループを乗せたものだった。","en":"A collaborator inside the Family had opened the gate without authorization. The truck carried the <tips=47>Liberation Army’s</tips> assault team.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X19:r65","rowIndex":65,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　中庭に入ると、荷台のシートが内側からはねのけられる。その下から現れたのは、武装し軍服のようなものを着た六人の<tips=47>解放軍</tips>メンバーと、三脚のようなものに乗せられた大きな機関銃だった。","en":"Once it reached the courtyard, the tarp was flung aside from below. Underneath were six armed <tips=47>Liberation Army</tips> members dressed in something resembling military fatigues—and a large machine gun mounted upon what looked like a tripod.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X19:r66","rowIndex":66,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それが現れた瞬間フェルナンデス側の部下が銃口をそちらに向けるが、金色の目をした<tips=47>解放軍</tips>メンバーが操作する機関銃が鉛の弾を浴びせると、瞬く間に肉片になる。そうして機関銃が制圧射撃をしている間に荷台からメンバーが次々と降りて、銃を片手に邸内へと侵入してゆく。","en":"The instant it appeared, the Fernandes men turned their weapons toward it. The golden-eyed <tips=47>Liberation Army</tips> member at the controls raked them with lead, reducing them to chunks of flesh in moments. While the machine gun laid down suppressing fire, the other members leaped from the truck one after another and pushed into the residence with guns in hand.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X19:r67","rowIndex":67,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「はじまったわね」","en":"“It’s started.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬世傑","displayName":"Ma Sai-kit","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X19:r68","rowIndex":68,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=25>世傑</tips>は緊張の面持ちで、すっかり乾ききった唇をなめた。","en":"Tense, <tips=25>Sai-kit</tips> licked his bone-dry lips.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X19:r69","rowIndex":69,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あれは<tips=10>見土道夫</tips>かしら？」","en":"“Is that <tips=10>Michio Mido</tips>?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬世傑","displayName":"Ma Sai-kit","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X19:r70","rowIndex":70,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼がそう言った通り、拳銃を片手に助手席から降りたのは、<tips=47>解放軍</tips>リーダー<tips=10>見土道夫</tips>その人だった。","en":"Just as he said, the man emerging from the passenger seat with pistol in hand was none other than <tips=47>Liberation Army</tips> leader <tips=10>Michio Mido</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X19:r71","rowIndex":71,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=75>フェルナンデス・ファミリー</tips>はアサルトライフルを装備している。","en":"The <tips=75>Fernandes Family</tips> was equipped with assault rifles.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X19:r72","rowIndex":72,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=47>解放軍</tips>は病院襲撃の際に弾薬を使いすぎてしまったためにトラックの機関銃以外はみな拳銃主体の構成だ。","en":"The <tips=47>Liberation Army</tips> had used up too much ammunition in the hospital attack, so aside from the machine gun mounted on its truck, it was armed chiefly with pistols.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X19:r73","rowIndex":73,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　両陣営の装備にはかなりの差があったが戦闘結果はそれを覆した。","en":"The two sides’ equipment differed considerably, but the outcome of the battle belied that disparity.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X19:r74","rowIndex":74,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=46>ネオ・ローズ</tips>によって発症の不安から解放された<tips=17>タイプＢ</tips>たちは、目を金色に輝かせている。","en":"The <tips=17>Type Bs</tips>, freed by <tips=46>Neo Rose</tips> from any fear of onset, fought with their eyes blazing gold.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X19:r75","rowIndex":75,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ヨーロッパでは勇猛な狂戦士に例えられ『ベルセルク』、中国ではその強靱な肉体を『龍』と呼ばれた、ノーマルの畏怖をそのまま体現したような人間離れをした素早さでファミリーのものたちを殺害してゆく。","en":"In Europe, their ferocity had seen them likened to frenzied warriors and named “berserkers”; in China, the strength of their bodies had earned them the name “dragons.” Now, moving with an inhuman speed that seemed to embody every Normal fear of their kind, they slaughtered the Family’s men.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X19:r76","rowIndex":76,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　なかでも<tips=10>見土道夫</tips>の動きは際立っていた。","en":"<tips=10>Michio Mido’s</tips> movements stood out even among them.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X19:r77","rowIndex":77,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼は幼い頃から拳法などの手ほどきを受けており、最近では本格的な軍事訓練にも参加している。そして<tips=17>タイプＢ</tips>としての身体能力も高かった。","en":"He had been instructed in martial arts since childhood and had recently begun taking part in full-fledged military training. His physical abilities as a <tips=17>Type B</tips> were also impressive.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X19:r78","rowIndex":78,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　専門の訓練を積んだ<tips=17>タイプＢ</tips>戦闘員というものは、ノーマルの戦闘員では対抗することが出来ないと言われている。","en":"It was said that a trained <tips=17>Type B</tips> combatant was more than any Normal fighter could handle.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X19:r79","rowIndex":79,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　私事になるが、先日筆者はある人物を取材した。","en":"On a personal note, the author recently interviewed a certain man.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X19:r80","rowIndex":80,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その人物はかつて軍の特殊部隊に所属し、実戦経験も豊富であった。彼の敵は主に<tips=17>タイプB</tips>のテロリストであり、彼自身もまた<tips=17>タイプB</tips>であったことから、<tips=17>タイプB</tips>による戦闘というものについて詳しかった。","en":"The man had once served in a military special-forces unit and had extensive combat experience. His enemies had chiefly been <tips=17>Type B</tips> terrorists. As a <tips=17>Type B</tips> himself, he knew a great deal about <tips=17>Type B</tips> combat.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X19:r81","rowIndex":81,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼によると、感覚が優れた<tips=17>タイプB</tips>であれば小銃の弾丸を肉眼で識別することは可能らしい。","en":"According to him, a <tips=17>Type B</tips> with sufficiently acute senses could apparently discern rifle bullets with the naked eye.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X19:r82","rowIndex":82,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ただし、見えるからといって銃口から発射されてからそれを避けるというのはほぼ不可能に近く、射撃者の身体の動きや銃口の位置を見ながら予測を交えて回避するとのことだ。","en":"But being able to see them did not mean one could dodge them after they left the muzzle; that was all but impossible. Instead, they evaded fire partly by prediction, watching the shooter’s movements and the position of the muzzle.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X19:r83","rowIndex":83,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=17>タイプB</tips>なら誰でも出来るというわけではないが、才能あるものが充分な訓練を受ければある程度は出来るようになるそうで、たとえば連発式の自動小銃を持った<tips=17>タイプB</tips>同士が戦った時、ノーマルに置き換えて例えると長い棒を振り回し合って殴りあうような感覚になるらしい。","en":"Not every <tips=17>Type B</tips> could do this, he said, but a talented one with sufficient training could learn to manage it to some degree. When two <tips=17>Type Bs</tips> armed with automatic rifles fought, the closest Normal analogy was two people swinging long poles at one another.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X19:r84","rowIndex":84,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　だから、熟練した<tips=17>タイプB</tips>兵士の戦闘は、お互いがばらまく銃弾をお互いが回避しあい、そして命中させるためにフェイントを交えた駆け引きが行われたりもするのだという。その光景はノーマルの目からすると、まさしく超人同士の異次元の戦いだろう。","en":"Thus, when seasoned <tips=17>Type B</tips> soldiers fought, each dodged the bullets the other poured out while maneuvering and feinting for a clean hit. To Normal eyes, it would look like a battle between superhumans waged on an entirely different plane.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X19:r85","rowIndex":85,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そのような<tips=17>タイプB</tips>からすれば、動きの遅いノーマルがサブマシンガンを構えたとて、子供が物干し竿を振り回す程度の脅威にしかならない。","en":"To such a <tips=17>Type B</tips>, a slow-moving Normal with a submachine gun posed no more danger than a child swinging a laundry pole.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X19:r86","rowIndex":86,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　つまり<tips=10>道夫</tips>にしてみれば、完全武装したギャングが自分を取り囲んでいるというノーマルならば絶体絶命の状況でも、まったく恐れるには値しなかったのである。","en":"For <tips=10>Michio</tips>, then, being surrounded by fully armed gangsters—a desperate situation for any Normal—was no cause for fear at all.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X19:r87","rowIndex":87,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　それだけの能力の裏打ちがあった<tips=10>道夫</tips>は、仲間を待たず単身で邸内に侵入していった。","en":"Confident in those abilities, <tips=10>Michio</tips> entered the residence alone without waiting for his comrades.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X19:r88","rowIndex":88,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　真っ黒な右手を剥き出しにして、いつでもサイキック能力を使える構えだった。はじめは拳銃を主に使っていたが、建物のなかに入り込むと今度はサイキック能力を併用することになった。","en":"He left his pitch-black right hand bare, ready to use his psychic power at any moment. At first he relied mainly upon his pistol, but once inside the building, he began using his psychic ability as well.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X19:r89","rowIndex":89,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　鍵がかかっていても難なく切断し、角などで思わぬ近距離で敵と遭遇した時には、軽く触れただけで相手が真っ二つになる。何より彼の切断能力はなんの音も立てないので、例えば人一人殺しても隣の部屋にいる他の敵は気がつかない。","en":"A locked door gave him no trouble: he simply cut through it. When an enemy surprised him at close range around a corner, the slightest touch split the man in two. Above all, his cutting power made no sound. He could kill one person without alerting another enemy in the next room.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X19:r90","rowIndex":90,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=10>道夫</tips>は夥しい返り血を全身に浴び、出会う相手を一方的に殺害しながら邸内を進んでゆく。","en":"Drenched from head to toe in an appalling quantity of spattered blood, <tips=10>Michio</tips> advanced through the house, killing everyone he encountered in a one-sided slaughter.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X19:r91","rowIndex":91,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼らの今日の目標は、<tips=75>フェルナンデス・ファミリー</tips>のボスである<tips=38>リタ・フェルナンデス</tips>の殺害であった。","en":"Their objective that day was to kill <tips=38>Rita Fernandes</tips>, head of the <tips=75>Fernandes Family</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X19:r92","rowIndex":92,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その目的を達成するだけならば、狙撃や暗殺などでもよかったが、こうして本拠地を真っ正面から蹂躙するという行為自体が彼らにとって重要だった。","en":"If merely accomplishing that objective had been the point, sniping or assassination would have sufficed, but the very act of overrunning the Family’s headquarters head-on was important to them.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X19:r93","rowIndex":93,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　街で恐れられる<tips=75>フェルナンデス・ファミリー</tips>が白昼堂々現れた襲撃者によって壊滅させられ、リーダーを殺されたとなれば<tips=47>解放軍</tips>に逆らうものがいなくなるだろう。","en":"If attackers could appear in broad daylight, annihilate the feared <tips=75>Fernandes Family</tips>, and kill its leader, no one in the city would dare resist the <tips=47>Liberation Army</tips> again.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X19:r94","rowIndex":94,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=10>道夫</tips>は邸内に屍山血河を作り上げながら目標を探す。","en":"<tips=10>Michio</tips> searched for his target, leaving mountains of corpses and rivers of blood throughout the mansion.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X19:r95","rowIndex":95,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼には迷いはなかった。途中、怯える女性の使用人などと遭遇しても、唇を噛みながら即死させた。","en":"He did not hesitate. Even when he came upon terrified female servants along the way, he bit his lip and killed them instantly.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X19:r96","rowIndex":96,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ここで彼が殺さなくとも、メンバーの誰かが見つければ、死ぬよりも恐ろしい苦しみを与えていただろう。","en":"Even if he had not killed them there, had another member found them, they would probably have been subjected to suffering worse than death.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X19:r97","rowIndex":97,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　侵入チームの合流点であるリビングルームに最初に飛び込んだのは<tips=10>道夫</tips>だった。","en":"<tips=10>Michio</tips> was the first to burst into the living room designated as the assault team’s rendezvous point.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X19:r98","rowIndex":98,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そこには五人の男がいて、銃を乱射したが<tips=10>道夫</tips>はその銃弾の雨をかいくぐって男たちのまんなかに突っ込むと、彼らの同士討ちを誘発しながら拳銃と右手の力で瞬く間に全員を打ち倒した。殺してから、そのうちの一人に<tips=96>エンゾ・アラーニャ・エ・シウバ</tips>がいることを確認した。","en":"There were five men inside, and they sprayed the room with gunfire, but <tips=10>Michio</tips> slipped through the hail of bullets and charged into their midst. Provoking them into shooting one another, he felled all five in moments with his pistol and the power of his right hand. Only after killing them did he discover that one of them was <tips=96>Enzo Aranha e Silva</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X19:r99","rowIndex":99,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=38>リタ</tips>の補佐官であり、実質上の司令官である彼がここにいたということは、ここが本部だったのだろう。","en":"As <tips=38>Rita’s</tips> aide and the Family’s effective commander, Enzo’s presence suggested that this room had served as their command post.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X19:r100","rowIndex":100,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　他のルートから侵入して来たものたちが次々とリビングに集まって来るが、いずれも<tips=38>リタ</tips>の姿を見たものはいないようだった。","en":"Attackers arrived in the living room one after another from other routes, but none appeared to have seen <tips=38>Rita</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X19:r101","rowIndex":101,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その時<tips=38>リタ</tips>は奇跡的に包囲網をかいくぐって裏口から脱出を図ろうとしていた。","en":"At that moment, <tips=38>Rita</tips> had miraculously slipped through the encirclement and was attempting to escape through the rear entrance.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X19:r102","rowIndex":102,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　庭での戦闘が終わった段階で、<tips=96>エンゾ</tips>は敗北を悟り彼女に脱出するよう指示していた。","en":"Once the fighting in the garden had ended, <tips=96>Enzo</tips> realized they had lost and ordered her to escape.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X19:r103","rowIndex":103,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「私はリーダーです！　ここに留まります！」","en":"“I am the leader! I will remain here!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"リタ・フェルナンデス","displayName":"Rita Fernandes","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X19:r104","rowIndex":104,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=38>リタ</tips>はそう言って拒否をした。","en":"<tips=38>Rita</tips> refused.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X19:r105","rowIndex":105,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しかし<tips=96>エンゾ</tips>はそれを許さず、沈鬱な表情で女主人の顔に銃口を向け、","en":"But <tips=96>Enzo</tips> would not allow it. His expression somber, he leveled his gun at the face of the woman he served.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X19:r106","rowIndex":106,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「逃げなければどうせ死ぬのです。それならば私が殺します」","en":"“You will die either way if you refuse to run. In that case, I will kill you myself.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エンゾ・アラーニャ・エ・シウバ","displayName":"Enzo Aranha e Silva","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X19:r107","rowIndex":107,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　と言い放ち、続いて、","en":"Having pronounced that threat, he continued:","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X19:r108","rowIndex":108,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あなたが生き残らなければフェルナンデス家は地上から消えてしまう。先代のためにも、恥を忍んで逃げるのです！」","en":"“If you do not survive, the Fernandes family will vanish from the face of the earth. For the sake of your predecessor, swallow your shame and run!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"エンゾ・アラーニャ・エ・シウバ","displayName":"Enzo Aranha e Silva","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X19:r109","rowIndex":109,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　と怒鳴った。","en":"He shouted the final command.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X19:r110","rowIndex":110,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　これで<tips=38>リタ</tips>は泣く泣く決断してその場を離れたという。","en":"We are told that <tips=38>Rita</tips> finally made the decision in tears and left him there.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X19:r111","rowIndex":111,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　この<tips=96>エンゾ</tips>の素早い判断が<tips=38>リタ</tips>の生命を、ギリギリのタイミングで最悪の包囲の外まで運び出した。","en":"<tips=96>Enzo’s</tips> swift judgment saved <tips=38>Rita’s</tips> life, getting her beyond the worst of the encirclement with almost no time to spare.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X19:r112","rowIndex":112,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しかし、彼女はまだ完全に危機を脱したわけではない。","en":"But she was not yet completely out of danger.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X19:r113","rowIndex":113,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　裏口を開けて外に出て、車に乗り込んだところで外を見張っていた<tips=47>解放軍</tips>のメンバーに見つかってしまう。","en":"She opened the rear door, ran outside, and had just climbed into a car when <tips=47>Liberation Army</tips> members posted outside spotted her.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X19:r114","rowIndex":114,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　見張り組は突入チームに比べれば腕が劣るがそれでも<tips=17>タイプB</tips>の戦闘員は優秀だった。","en":"The sentries were less capable than the assault team, but they were still highly skilled <tips=17>Type B</tips> fighters.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X19:r115","rowIndex":115,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　数発銃声を鳴らすと、運転席で車を発車させようとしていた部下がガクリと俯いて動かなくなった。<tips=38>リタ</tips>が顔を覗き込むと、額に開いた穴から血液がダラダラと流れ落ちている。","en":"Several shots rang out. The subordinate trying to start the car from the driver’s seat slumped forward and stopped moving. When <tips=38>Rita</tips> leaned over to look, blood streamed from a hole in his forehead.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X19:r116","rowIndex":116,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「伏せて下さい！」","en":"“Get down!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X19:r117","rowIndex":117,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　隣にいた女のメンバーが<tips=38>リタ</tips>の服を掴んで無理矢理頭を下げさせる。","en":"The woman beside <tips=38>Rita</tips> seized her clothing and forced her head down.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X19:r118","rowIndex":118,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼女はラーラと呼ばれている孤児上がりの人物で、<tips=38>リタ</tips>と寝食を共にしその身を守るボディーガードであった。家族を亡くした悲しみや、ファミリーを背負うことになった重責についても語り相手になってくれる、<tips=38>リタ</tips>にとっては親友と言える人物だ。","en":"Her name was Lara. An orphan taken in from the streets, she shared <tips=38>Rita’s</tips> daily life and guarded her as a bodyguard. She also listened when Rita needed to speak of her grief at losing her family or the crushing burden of carrying the Family upon her shoulders. To <tips=38>Rita</tips>, Lara was as much a closest friend as a protector.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X19:r119","rowIndex":119,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ラーラはブーツを履いた足をあげてルームミラーを蹴りつけ、それをもぎ取ると、身を低くしてそれを頭上に掲げる。","en":"Lara raised one booted foot and kicked the rearview mirror, wrenching it free, then crouched low and held it above her head.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X19:r120","rowIndex":120,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　こうすることで、車のドアで身を隠しながら、ミラーで周囲の状況を確認することが出来た。","en":"That allowed her to survey the surroundings in the mirror while keeping herself hidden behind the car door.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X19:r121","rowIndex":121,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「相手は三人ですね……」","en":"“Three of them...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X19:r122","rowIndex":122,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　緊張でじっとりと汗を掻いたラーラがそう呟くと、鏡は銃弾によって打ち壊され、彼女の手の中ではじけた。","en":"Lara murmured through a film of nervous sweat. A bullet shattered the mirror, which burst apart in her hand.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X19:r123","rowIndex":123,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　狙撃銃に狙われている状況で運転席に移動するのは難しかったが、かといってこのままじっとしていても安全を確保することは出来ない。取り囲んだ三人の敵が、攻撃を開始する前に先手をとって何か手を打たなくてはいけない。","en":"Moving into the driver’s seat with a sniper rifle trained on them would be difficult, but staying where they were would not keep them safe. They had to act first, before the three enemies surrounding the car began their attack.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X19:r124","rowIndex":124,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ラーラは迷いつつ、主人をかばうように身体を動かした。","en":"Still uncertain, Lara shifted her body to shield Rita.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X19:r125","rowIndex":125,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　しかし、その行動が失敗だった。","en":"But that move was a mistake.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X19:r126","rowIndex":126,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　ラーラは敵の位置を読み間違えていた。身体を動かすことで、別の角度からやって来ていた敵に見つかり、顔面を正確に撃ち抜かれ、結局一発も撃つことが出来ずにその場に崩れ落ちる。","en":"Lara had misjudged the enemy’s position. By moving, she exposed herself to an enemy approaching from another angle, who shot her squarely in the face; without firing a single shot, she crumpled on the spot.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X19:r127","rowIndex":127,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=38>リタ</tips>の目の前に、目の上が砕かれだらりと眼球が垂れ下がったラーラがもたれ掛かってくる。","en":"Lara’s body collapsed against <tips=38>Rita</tips> before her very eyes, the bone above one eye shattered and the eyeball hanging loose.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X19:r128","rowIndex":128,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ラーラ……」","en":"“Lara...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"リタ・フェルナンデス","displayName":"Rita Fernandes","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X19:r129","rowIndex":129,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=38>リタ</tips>は泣きじゃくりそうになりつつもぐっと下唇を噛んでこらえ、そしてぐったりと力が抜けたラーラの身体を抱きしめた。","en":"<tips=38>Rita</tips> bit hard upon her lower lip to keep from breaking into sobs, then embraced Lara’s limp body.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X19:r130","rowIndex":130,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　最後の護衛を失えば彼女は無力な少女に過ぎなかった。","en":"Without her last protector, she was nothing more than a powerless girl.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X19:r131","rowIndex":131,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　やがて<tips=47>解放軍</tips>の三人は<tips=38>リタ</tips>を車から引きずり出す。","en":"Before long, the three members of the <tips=47>Liberation Army</tips> dragged <tips=38>Rita</tips> from the car.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X19:r132","rowIndex":132,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼らはあらかじめ逃げ出すものはみな射殺するよう指示を受けていた。","en":"They had been instructed in advance to shoot anyone who tried to flee.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X19:r133","rowIndex":133,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=38>リタ・フェルナンデス</tips>を殺すのに誰かの許可を得る必要はない。この場で即座に処刑となる。","en":"They needed no one’s permission to kill <tips=38>Rita Fernandes</tips>. She would be executed on the spot.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X19:r134","rowIndex":134,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　覚悟を決めて唇を噛む<tips=38>リタ</tips>は、彼らの手によって乱暴にアスファルトの上に倒される。","en":"They threw <tips=38>Rita</tips> roughly onto the asphalt as she steeled herself and bit her lip.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X19:r135","rowIndex":135,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その背中をブーツを履いた足で押さえつけると、後頭部に銃口を押し当てる。","en":"They pinned her back beneath a booted foot and pressed a gun barrel to the back of her head.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X19:r136","rowIndex":136,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして次の瞬間轟いた銃声は――<tips=47>解放軍</tips>の三人が握るどの銃でもなかった。","en":"But the shot that thundered a moment later came from none of the three guns held by the <tips=47>Liberation Army</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X19:r137","rowIndex":137,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=38>リタ</tips>の背中を踏んでいたひげ面の男がゆっくりと倒れる。","en":"The bearded man whose boot was planted on <tips=38>Rita’s</tips> back slowly toppled to the ground.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X19:r138","rowIndex":138,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　残り二人が襲撃者を探して辺りを見回す間に、さらに二発銃声が鳴って一人が倒れる。","en":"As the other two searched the area for their assailant, two more shots rang out and one of them fell.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X19:r139","rowIndex":139,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして最後に生き残った一人が見つけたのは、拳銃をこちらに構えた美青年であった。","en":"The last survivor finally spotted a beautiful young man pointing a pistol in his direction.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X19:r140","rowIndex":140,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<ruby=ジョイギン>再見</ruby>」","en":"“Joi gin.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X19:r141","rowIndex":141,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼はニヤリと笑うと、最後の一人の額を拳銃で撃ち抜いた。","en":"The young man grinned and put a bullet through the last fighter’s forehead.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X19:r142","rowIndex":142,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ちょっと大丈夫<tips=38>リタ</tips>ちゃん？　せっかく助けたのに、死んじゃってないでしょうね？」","en":"“Are you all right, <tips=38>Rita</tips>? Don’t tell me I went to all this trouble to save you only for you to die.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬世傑","displayName":"Ma Sai-kit","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X19:r143","rowIndex":143,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　彼はそう言いながら<tips=38>リタ</tips>の腕を掴んで立ち上がらせる。","en":"As he spoke, he caught <tips=38>Rita</tips> by the arm and pulled her to her feet.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X19:r144","rowIndex":144,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「さ、<tips=25>世傑</tips>さん？」","en":"“Sh-<tips=25>Sai-kit</tips>?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"リタ・フェルナンデス","displayName":"Rita Fernandes","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X19:r145","rowIndex":145,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　涙に土埃がはりついてぐちゃぐちゃになった顔に驚きが浮かぶ。","en":"Surprise appeared on her face, now a tear- and dust-streaked mess.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X19:r146","rowIndex":146,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そう、この土壇場で現れた男は<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>の若き<tips=80>双花紅棍</tips><tips=25>馬世傑</tips>であった。","en":"Yes—the man who had appeared at the eleventh hour was <tips=25>Ma Sai-kit</tips>, the young <tips=80>Double Flower Red Pole</tips> of <tips=7>YS</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X19:r147","rowIndex":147,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　民家から双眼鏡で覗いていた彼は、早い段階で<tips=38>リタ</tips>が動き出し脱出を図るのを確認すると、すぐに建物を出てこの裏口に移動していたのである。","en":"Watching through his binoculars from the house, he had noticed early on that <tips=38>Rita</tips> was moving and attempting to escape. He immediately left the building and repositioned himself at the rear entrance.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X19:r148","rowIndex":148,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「間に合って良かったわ。さあ、さっさとずらかりましょう」","en":"“Thank goodness I made it. Now let’s make ourselves scarce.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬世傑","displayName":"Ma Sai-kit","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X19:r149","rowIndex":149,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=25>世傑</tips>は事態を把握し切れていない<tips=38>リタ</tips>の手を引いて、その場を離れた。","en":"<tips=25>Sai-kit</tips> took <tips=38>Rita</tips> by the hand and led her away before she had fully grasped the situation.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X19:r150","rowIndex":150,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「コーヒーと紅茶があるけど、どっちがいい？　ミルクをあっためてあげてもいいわよ？」","en":"“I have coffee and tea. Which would you like? I could warm up some milk for you, if you prefer.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬世傑","displayName":"Ma Sai-kit","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X19:r151","rowIndex":151,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　マンションの自室に<tips=38>リタ</tips>を招いた<tips=25>世傑</tips>はリビングへ先導しながらそう訊ねた。","en":"<tips=25>Sai-kit</tips> had brought <tips=38>Rita</tips> to his apartment. He asked the question as he led her into the living room.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X19:r152","rowIndex":152,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「いえ、私は何も……」","en":"“No, I don’t need anything...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"リタ・フェルナンデス","displayName":"Rita Fernandes","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X19:r153","rowIndex":153,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=38>リタ</tips>は暗い顔で俯いている。","en":"<tips=38>Rita</tips> hung her head, her expression dark.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X19:r154","rowIndex":154,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「こっちよ。そこに座って」","en":"“This way. Sit over there.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬世傑","displayName":"Ma Sai-kit","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X19:r155","rowIndex":155,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=25>世傑</tips>はリビングに入るとテーブルを指し示すが、<tips=38>リタ</tips>はそちらには行かずに部屋の端にある小さな祭壇と壁に貼られた大量の殺害現場の写真を見上げた。","en":"Once they entered the living room, <tips=25>Sai-kit</tips> indicated the table. <tips=38>Rita</tips> did not approach it. Instead, she looked up at a small altar in one corner and the great number of murder-scene photographs covering the wall.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X19:r156","rowIndex":156,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あっ、人が来ると思ってなかったから片付けるの忘れちゃったわ」","en":"“Oh. I wasn’t expecting company, so I forgot to put all that away.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬世傑","displayName":"Ma Sai-kit","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X19:r157","rowIndex":157,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=25>世傑</tips>はばつが悪そうに笑う。","en":"<tips=25>Sai-kit</tips> smiled awkwardly.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X19:r158","rowIndex":158,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「これは？」","en":"“What is this?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"リタ・フェルナンデス","displayName":"Rita Fernandes","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X19:r159","rowIndex":159,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「こうやって祈りを捧げないと、アタシ眠れないのよ。情けないでしょう？　ほら、こっちに来なさいよ。ここに座ればその気持ち悪い写真見ないですむから」","en":"“I can’t sleep unless I offer prayers like this. Pathetic, isn’t it? Come over here. If you sit down, you won’t have to look at those disgusting photographs.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬世傑","displayName":"Ma Sai-kit","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X19:r160","rowIndex":160,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「でも……」","en":"“But...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"リタ・フェルナンデス","displayName":"Rita Fernandes","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X19:r161","rowIndex":161,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=38>リタ</tips>は写真の前から離れがたいようだったが、<tips=25>世傑</tips>が何度も椅子を勧めるとようやく座った。","en":"<tips=38>Rita</tips> seemed unable to tear herself away from the photographs, but after <tips=25>Sai-kit</tips> urged her several times to take a chair, she finally sat down.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X19:r162","rowIndex":162,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=25>世傑</tips>さんって、どういう方なんですか？」","en":"“<tips=25>Sai-kit</tips>, what kind of person are you?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"リタ・フェルナンデス","displayName":"Rita Fernandes","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X19:r163","rowIndex":163,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=38>リタ</tips>はキッチンでごそごそとやっている<tips=25>世傑</tips>に、カウンター越しにそう尋ねる。","en":"<tips=38>Rita</tips> asked across the counter as <tips=25>Sai-kit</tips> rummaged about in the kitchen.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X19:r164","rowIndex":164,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「みんな不思議に思ってます。昔から自由に生きてて……」","en":"“Everyone wonders about you. You’ve always lived however you pleased...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"リタ・フェルナンデス","displayName":"Rita Fernandes","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X19:r165","rowIndex":165,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あら、生きたいように生きるのが不思議だなんて、そんな発想のほうが不思議よ。……紅茶でいい？　あなたってとっても紅茶が好きそうな顔をしているし」","en":"“Oh, you think living however one pleases is strange? I find that way of thinking stranger. ...Tea will do, won’t it? You have such a tea-loving face.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬世傑","displayName":"Ma Sai-kit","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X19:r166","rowIndex":166,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　冗談めかして言ったが、<tips=38>リタ</tips>の表情は晴れない。","en":"It was meant as a joke, but <tips=38>Rita’s</tips> expression did not brighten.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X19:r167","rowIndex":167,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それに、どうしてそんな強いんですか？　ノーマルなのに<tips=17>タイプＢ</tips>よりも強いそうじゃないですか。そんな人いませんよ。やっぱり、ただのノーマルじゃなくて何か隠している能力が……」","en":"“And why are you so strong? I hear that even though you’re a Normal, you’re stronger than a <tips=17>Type B</tips>. No one else is like that. You must have some hidden ability—something that means you aren’t just an ordinary Normal...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"リタ・フェルナンデス","displayName":"Rita Fernandes","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X19:r168","rowIndex":168,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「別に何もないわ」","en":"“There’s nothing to hide.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬世傑","displayName":"Ma Sai-kit","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X19:r169","rowIndex":169,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=25>世傑</tips>は苦笑して、","en":"<tips=25>Sai-kit</tips> gave a wry smile,","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X19:r170","rowIndex":170,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「すべては功夫の力よ。みんな身体と心を鍛えればこれくらい強くなれるのよ。あなたも修業したら？」","en":"“It’s all thanks to kung fu. Anyone can get this strong by training body and mind. Why don’t you train too?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬世傑","displayName":"Ma Sai-kit","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X19:r171","rowIndex":171,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　あくまでも誤魔化そうとするその言葉に<tips=38>リタ</tips>は眉をひそめ、","en":"Frowning at this persistent attempt to evade the question, <tips=38>Rita</tips> said,","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X19:r172","rowIndex":172,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「本当に強くなれるならなりたいです。部下を見捨てて、一人逃げ出して、本当に情けないです」","en":"“If I really can get stronger, I want to. I left my subordinates behind and fled alone. I’m truly pathetic.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"リタ・フェルナンデス","displayName":"Rita Fernandes","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X19:r173","rowIndex":173,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　そして溜息をついた。","en":"Then she sighed.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X19:r174","rowIndex":174,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……<tips=25>世傑</tips>さん、わざわざ助けて頂いてありがとうございます。これは<tips=81>龍頭</tips>さまの指示ですか？」","en":"“...<tips=25>Sai-kit</tips>, thank you for going out of your way to save me. Was this the <tips=81>Longtou’s</tips> order?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"リタ・フェルナンデス","displayName":"Rita Fernandes","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X19:r175","rowIndex":175,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「違うわ。……<tips=2>阿亮</tips>は手を出すなと」","en":"“No. ...<tips=2>Ah Leung</tips> told me not to interfere.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬世傑","displayName":"Ma Sai-kit","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X19:r176","rowIndex":176,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その答えに<tips=38>リタ</tips>は失望をあらわにしつつ、","en":"At that answer, <tips=38>Rita</tips> made no attempt to hide her disappointment.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X19:r177","rowIndex":177,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「じゃあ、どうして私を？」","en":"“Then why did you save me?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"リタ・フェルナンデス","displayName":"Rita Fernandes","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X19:r178","rowIndex":178,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あなたは<tips=24>美美</tips>の友だちだったでしょ？　それだけよ」","en":"“You were <tips=24>Meimei’s</tips> friend. That’s all.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬世傑","displayName":"Ma Sai-kit","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X19:r179","rowIndex":179,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ああ……」","en":"“Oh...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"リタ・フェルナンデス","displayName":"Rita Fernandes","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X19:r180","rowIndex":180,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=38>リタ</tips>は暗い顔をしてうなだれた。","en":"<tips=38>Rita</tips> bowed her head, her expression dark.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X19:r181","rowIndex":181,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「彼女のことは、私はなんと言ったらいいのか……」","en":"“I don’t know what I could possibly say about her...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"リタ・フェルナンデス","displayName":"Rita Fernandes","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X19:r182","rowIndex":182,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なんにも言わなくていいわ。あの子が馬鹿だったのよ。母親になるっていう自覚が全然なかったんだからあきれちゃうわ」","en":"“You don’t have to say anything. She was a fool. She had absolutely no sense that she was about to become a mother. It was unbelievable.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬世傑","displayName":"Ma Sai-kit","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X19:r183","rowIndex":183,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=25>世傑</tips>は茶葉とお湯を入れたポットと、二人分のティーカップを、花の模様がついた盆に乗せてテーブルまで運んで来ると、<tips=38>リタ</tips>の正面の椅子に座った。","en":"<tips=25>Sai-kit</tips> arranged a teapot filled with tea leaves and hot water and two teacups upon a flower-patterned tray. He carried it to the table and sat across from <tips=38>Rita</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X19:r184","rowIndex":184,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あなた、これからどうしようと考えてる？」","en":"“What are you planning to do now?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬世傑","displayName":"Ma Sai-kit","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X19:r185","rowIndex":185,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「教会通りの近くに親戚の家があるので、そこから立て直しを図ろうと思っています。部下たちに連絡をとって、<tips=47>解放軍</tips>との戦いのための準備をはじめて……」","en":"“I have relatives living near Church Street. I mean to rebuild the Family from their home. I will contact my subordinates and begin preparing to fight the <tips=47>Liberation Army</tips>...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"リタ・フェルナンデス","displayName":"Rita Fernandes","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X19:r186","rowIndex":186,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「だめよ。死にに行くのと同じだわ」","en":"“No. That would be suicide.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬世傑","displayName":"Ma Sai-kit","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X19:r187","rowIndex":187,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=25>世傑</tips>は<tips=38>リタ</tips>の目をじっと見つめた。","en":"<tips=25>Sai-kit</tips> looked <tips=38>Rita</tips> steadily in the eyes.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X19:r188","rowIndex":188,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=38>リタ</tips>ちゃん聞いて。この街では負け犬に味方する人間なんかいないの。このまま戻っても、今のあなたたちでは<tips=21>八龍会</tips>と戦うことは出来ない。<tips=21>八龍会</tips>のネットワークは簡単にあなたを見つけ出すだろうし、きっとひと月も生きていられない」","en":"“Listen to me, <tips=38>Rita</tips>. No one in this city backs a loser. Even if you return now, what remains of your Family is in no condition to fight the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips>. The <tips=21>Society’s</tips> network will find you without difficulty, and you won’t survive a month.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬世傑","displayName":"Ma Sai-kit","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X19:r189","rowIndex":189,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「でも、それでも私は……！」","en":"“Even so, I...!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"リタ・フェルナンデス","displayName":"Rita Fernandes","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X19:r190","rowIndex":190,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「気持ちはわかるわ。でも落ち着いて聞きなさい」","en":"“I understand how you feel. But calm down and listen.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬世傑","displayName":"Ma Sai-kit","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X19:r191","rowIndex":191,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=25>世傑</tips>は言うと、<tips=38>リタ</tips>の興奮が収まるのを待つために時間をとるかのように、真っ白なポットをとって少しゆすり、そしてそれぞれのカップに赤みがかった液体を注いだ。湯気がたちのぼり、花に似た甘い香りがあたりに漂う。","en":"<tips=25>Sai-kit</tips> paused, as though deliberately allowing <tips=38>Rita’s</tips> agitation time to subside. He lifted the spotless white teapot, swirled it gently, and poured the reddish tea into their cups. Steam curled upward, carrying a sweet fragrance reminiscent of flowers through the room.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X19:r192","rowIndex":192,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=2>阿亮</tips>は全然お父さんと似てないし、お父さんのやりかたをどんどん変えていっちゃってるんだけれど、いくつかの方針はそっくりそのまま受け継いでいるの。なんだと思う？」","en":"“<tips=2>Ah Leung</tips> is nothing like his father, and he’s overturning one old way of doing things after another. But there are a few policies he inherited unchanged. Can you guess what they are?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬世傑","displayName":"Ma Sai-kit","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X19:r193","rowIndex":193,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=25>世傑</tips>は言いながら、カップの一つを<tips=38>リタ</tips>の前へ、もう一つは自分の前へと置く。","en":"As he spoke, <tips=25>Sai-kit</tips> placed one cup before <tips=38>Rita</tips> and the other before himself.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X19:r194","rowIndex":194,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「なんですか？」","en":"“What are they?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"リタ・フェルナンデス","displayName":"Rita Fernandes","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X19:r195","rowIndex":195,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ひとつは、敵対するものには絶対に容赦しないこと。もうひとつは、頼ってきたものは誰であろうと受け入れるってこと。……意外かもしれないけど、彼って素直に謝るような相手には寛容なのよ。その方が合理的だと思ってやってるんだろうけど」","en":"“One is that he shows absolutely no mercy to anyone who opposes him. The other is that he accepts anyone who comes to him for help. ...It may surprise you, but he’s forgiving toward anyone who apologizes sincerely. He probably does it because he thinks that’s the rational course.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬世傑","displayName":"Ma Sai-kit","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X19:r196","rowIndex":196,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……それが？」","en":"“And your point is?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"リタ・フェルナンデス","displayName":"Rita Fernandes","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X19:r197","rowIndex":197,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=38>リタ</tips>ちゃん。あなたのファミリーを<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>に戻しなさい。そして<tips=2>阿亮</tips>を頼るの」","en":"“<tips=38>Rita</tips>. Bring your Family back to <tips=7>YS</tips>. Then turn to <tips=2>Ah Leung</tips> for help.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬世傑","displayName":"Ma Sai-kit","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X19:r198","rowIndex":198,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そんなこと、出来ません。ファミリーを守るために、みんな死んでいったのに……」","en":"“I can’t do that. Everyone died trying to protect the Family...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"リタ・フェルナンデス","displayName":"Rita Fernandes","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X19:r199","rowIndex":199,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=38>リタ</tips>はうつむき、唇を噛んだ。","en":"<tips=38>Rita</tips> lowered her head and bit her lip.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X19:r200","rowIndex":200,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「でもやるのよ。それ以外に、フェルナンデスの名前を残す方法はないわ。彼はノーとは言わない。むしろ本心ではあなたを助けたがってる。アタシにはわかるの」","en":"“You have to. There is no other way to preserve the Fernandes name. He will not say no. Deep down, he wants to help you. I know he does.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬世傑","displayName":"Ma Sai-kit","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X19:r201","rowIndex":201,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そんなことはないです……」","en":"“That isn’t true...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"リタ・フェルナンデス","displayName":"Rita Fernandes","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X19:r202","rowIndex":202,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「彼がアタシに加勢するよう指示しなかったのは、あなたを見捨てたからじゃないわ。だから彼を怒らないで」","en":"“He didn’t order me to intervene, but that doesn’t mean he abandoned you. So please don’t blame him.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬世傑","displayName":"Ma Sai-kit","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X19:r203","rowIndex":203,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そ、それは関係ありません。そうじゃなくて……」","en":"“Th-that has nothing to do with this. That isn’t why...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"リタ・フェルナンデス","displayName":"Rita Fernandes","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X19:r204","rowIndex":204,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=38>リタ</tips>は顔を上げると視線を合わせて<tips=25>世傑</tips>のまなざしに応え、","en":"<tips=38>Rita</tips> raised her face and met <tips=25>Sai-kit’s</tips> gaze.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X19:r205","rowIndex":205,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「これは誇りの問題です。部下を殺され、家を荒らし尽くされて、自力で戦うことも出来ずに<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>に頼るなんてフェルナンデス家の名折れです。そのような情けのないことをしたら、あの世で父に合わせる顔がありません。私たちの勢力が衰えたからという理由で離れるものがいるのならば、勝手に離れさせればいいのです。残ったもので戦います」","en":"“This is a matter of pride. My subordinates have been killed, my home has been ravaged, and I am incapable of fighting by myself. To turn to <tips=7>YS</tips> now would disgrace the Fernandes name. If I behaved so shamefully, how could I face my father in the next world? If people wish to leave because our power has diminished, let them leave. Those who remain will fight.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"リタ・フェルナンデス","displayName":"Rita Fernandes","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X19:r206","rowIndex":206,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「死ぬ気？」","en":"“Are you planning to die?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬世傑","displayName":"Ma Sai-kit","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X19:r207","rowIndex":207,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「フェルナンデス家は、今までもこうした危機を乗り切って来ました。負けるつもりはありません」","en":"“The Fernandes Family has survived crises like this before. I do not intend to lose.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"リタ・フェルナンデス","displayName":"Rita Fernandes","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X19:r208","rowIndex":208,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そう……」","en":"“I see...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":{"id":"馬世傑","displayName":"Ma Sai-kit","confidence":"verified","status":"direct_runtime_cue","lineKind":"dialogue","evidence":"","counterevidence":"","note":""},"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X19:r209","rowIndex":209,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=25>世傑</tips>は目を伏せ、自分のティーカップに手をつける。","en":"<tips=25>Sai-kit</tips> lowered his eyes and picked up his teacup.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X19:r210","rowIndex":210,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　結局<tips=38>リタ</tips>は一晩だけ彼のマンションで過ごし、翌朝すぐに親戚の家に向かうと決まった。","en":"In the end, they agreed that <tips=38>Rita</tips> would spend only one night in his apartment and leave for her relatives’ home first thing the following morning.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X19:r211","rowIndex":211,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　深夜、ソファーで横になっていた<tips=25>世傑</tips>がトイレのために部屋を出ると、<tips=38>リタ</tips>に貸し与えた寝室から物音がする。","en":"Late that night, <tips=25>Sai-kit</tips> rose from the sofa to use the bathroom. As he left the living room, he heard a sound from the bedroom he had lent <tips=38>Rita</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X19:r212","rowIndex":212,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　やはりまだ眠れないのだろう。彼女だって、この状況でなんの保護もなく帰ることの危険性は理解している。","en":"She was probably still unable to sleep. She, too, had to understand the danger of returning without any protection under the circumstances.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X19:r213","rowIndex":213,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　恐ろしくないはずがない。しかも、彼女は今でこそ<tips=75>フェルナンデス・ファミリー</tips>を背負っているが、ついこの間までは三人娘の末っ子という、家族のなかでは最もこのような役割から遠い位置にいたのだ。補佐があったとは言え、ギャングの女ボスとして仲間を率いてゆくのは並大抵のことではなかったに違いない。","en":"She could hardly be unafraid. Though the <tips=75>Fernandes Family</tips> now rested on her shoulders, until very recently she had been merely the youngest of three daughters—the person in her family farthest removed from such a role. Even with advisers to assist her, leading her people as a female gang boss could not have been easy.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X19:r214","rowIndex":214,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その結果、こうして仲間を殺してしまったことが彼女を追い詰めているのだろうか？","en":"Had the deaths of her comrades, the result of her leadership, now driven her into a corner?","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X19:r215","rowIndex":215,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=25>世傑</tips>はノックをしてドアを開けた。照明の落ちた部屋のなか、<tips=38>リタ</tips>は横にならずにベッドに腰掛けたまま何か考え事をしている。","en":"<tips=25>Sai-kit</tips> knocked and opened the door. In the darkened room, <tips=38>Rita</tips> sat on the edge of the bed rather than lying down, lost in thought.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X19:r216","rowIndex":216,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「暗いところで考えても、前向きな考えは出ないわよ」","en":"“Brooding in the dark won’t lead you to any hopeful conclusions.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X19:r217","rowIndex":217,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=25>世傑</tips>はそう言って部屋の照明をつけた。","en":"<tips=25>Sai-kit</tips> switched on the light.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X19:r218","rowIndex":218,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=38>リタ</tips>は寝間着代わりに<tips=25>世傑</tips>が与えたぶかぶかの黒いトレーナーを着ている。彼を見上げる彼女の顔には泣いたあとがあり、目のまわりが赤く腫れ上がっていた。","en":"<tips=38>Rita</tips> wore the oversized black sweatshirt <tips=25>Sai-kit</tips> had given her as pajamas. When she looked up at him, her face bore traces of tears, and her eyes were red and swollen.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X19:r219","rowIndex":219,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=25>世傑</tips>はそのことには触れず、<tips=38>リタ</tips>も言い訳はしなかった。","en":"<tips=25>Sai-kit</tips> did not mention it. <tips=38>Rita</tips> offered no excuse.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X19:r220","rowIndex":220,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「お邪魔するわね」","en":"“I’m coming in.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X19:r221","rowIndex":221,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=25>世傑</tips>はそう断って<tips=38>リタ</tips>の隣に座ると、その手を握った。","en":"After announcing himself, <tips=25>Sai-kit</tips> sat beside <tips=38>Rita</tips> and took her hand.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X19:r222","rowIndex":222,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「こうすると、体温を感じるでしょう？」","en":"“You can feel my body heat when I do this, can’t you?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X19:r223","rowIndex":223,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　驚く<tips=38>リタ</tips>に<tips=25>世傑</tips>は微笑みかけた。","en":"<tips=25>Sai-kit</tips> smiled at the startled <tips=38>Rita</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X19:r224","rowIndex":224,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「確かに、今アタシたちの身体は温かいわ。触れ合ってるところがぽかぽかとして春の日の日向みたい。それに、こうやって会話をして、意思の疎通も出来る。それは二人とも生きていて、心臓が動いていて、そしてその温かい身体のなかに心があるからなのよ」","en":"“Right now, our bodies are warm. Where they touch, the warmth is like sunlight on a spring day. We can speak to each other like this, too, and make ourselves understood. That’s because we’re both alive—because our hearts are beating, and within each warm body there is still a mind.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X19:r225","rowIndex":225,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=38>リタ</tips>は相手がどういう話をしようとしているのかわからず、怪訝な表情をする。","en":"Unable to tell what he was trying to say, <tips=38>Rita</tips> looked at him doubtfully.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X19:r226","rowIndex":226,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=25>世傑</tips>はかまわず続ける。","en":"<tips=25>Sai-kit</tips> continued regardless.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X19:r227","rowIndex":227,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「でも死んだら冷たくなって、もう会話も出来ない。今アタシを見ているあなたのキラキラした目も、灰色に濁ってしまう。市場で売ってる魚の目を見たことある？　人間も死んだらあんな目になっちゃうんだから。死んだ人間は悪臭がして、そうして少しずつ腐ってゆく……」","en":"“But when you die, you grow cold, and you can’t speak anymore. Those bright eyes looking at me now will turn dull and gray. Have you ever seen the eyes of the fish at the market? Human eyes look like that when we die. Dead people stink, and then, little by little, they rot...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X19:r228","rowIndex":228,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=25>世傑</tips>は鼻をつまんで、おどけてみせる。","en":"<tips=25>Sai-kit</tips> pinched his nose and made a comic face.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X19:r229","rowIndex":229,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「あなたは誇りのためなんて言うけれど、この世界には格好のいい死なんかないわ。色んな人の死を見てきたからわかる。誇り高く戦いに臨んだギャングだって、負けて殺されれば衣服を剥ぎ取られ自分の逸物を口に突っ込まれる。美少女も美少年もナイフで一皮剥いただけでB級ホラーの怪物になるわ。とっても賑やかだった部屋が、みんな死んでしまって静かになるというのはとても寂しいものよ。あの寂しさを感じたら、死というものがどれだけ価値がなく、くだらないものかわかるわ」","en":"“You talk about pride, but there is no such thing as a glorious death in this world. I know because I’ve seen all kinds of people die. A gangster may go proudly into battle, but if he loses and is killed, they strip off his clothes and shove his own cock into his mouth. A beautiful girl or boy becomes a B-movie horror monster after just one layer of skin is peeled away with a knife. It is terribly lonely when a room that was once so lively falls silent because everyone in it has died. Once you’ve felt that loneliness, you understand just how worthless and stupid death is.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X19:r230","rowIndex":230,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……そこまで言うあなたは、なぜこの仕事を続けているんですか？」","en":"“...If that is what you believe, why do you continue doing this work?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X19:r231","rowIndex":231,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=25>世傑</tips>がどういう方向に話を持っていこうとしているのか理解した<tips=38>リタ</tips>は、流されまいと意志を表情に出してそう訊ねた。","en":"<tips=38>Rita</tips> had understood where <tips=25>Sai-kit</tips> meant to lead the conversation. Her expression hardened with her determination not to be swept along as she asked the question.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X19:r232","rowIndex":232,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「きっと、どこか狂ってるのね」","en":"“...I suppose I’m mad in some way.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X19:r233","rowIndex":233,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=25>世傑</tips>は肩をすくめる。","en":"<tips=25>Sai-kit</tips> shrugged.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X19:r234","rowIndex":234,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「逃れようとしても逃れられない。生まれつきまともじゃなかった。アタシだけじゃないわ。<tips=2>阿亮</tips>だってそう。あなたのお父さんだってきっとそうだったはず。この世界で、殺したり殺されたりする人間はみんな狂ってるのよ。だからそういう人間は最後はどこかで辻褄があうようになってる。それがここのルール。でも、まだあなたはこの世界のルールに従う必要はないはずよ」","en":"“There’s no escaping it, however hard you try. I was born wrong in the head. And it isn’t only me. <tips=2>Ah Leung</tips> is the same. I’m sure your father was, too. Everyone in this world of killing and being killed is mad. In the end, people like us always meet with some fate that makes the accounts balance. That’s the rule here. But you shouldn’t have to submit to this world’s rules just yet.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X19:r235","rowIndex":235,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「私だって、後戻りなんか出来ません」","en":"“It is too late for me to turn back, too.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X19:r236","rowIndex":236,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうかしら。死ぬのはこわいでしょう？」","en":"“Are you sure? You’re afraid to die, aren’t you?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X19:r237","rowIndex":237,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……」","en":"“...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X19:r238","rowIndex":238,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=38>リタ</tips>は何か言いかけるが、それは言葉にならず、俯く。","en":"<tips=38>Rita</tips> began to say something, but no words emerged. She lowered her head.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X19:r239","rowIndex":239,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その様子を見て<tips=25>世傑</tips>は苦笑し、","en":"<tips=25>Sai-kit</tips> watched her and gave a rueful smile.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X19:r240","rowIndex":240,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「ねえあなた、<tips=2>阿亮</tips>のことが好きだったんでしょ？」","en":"“Tell me. You were in love with <tips=2>Ah Leung</tips>, weren’t you?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X19:r241","rowIndex":241,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　唐突にそう訊ねた。","en":"The question came without warning.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X19:r242","rowIndex":242,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そ、そんな……」","en":"“Th-that’s not...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X19:r243","rowIndex":243,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=38>リタ</tips>は慌てて否定したが、その言葉とは裏腹に顔はみるみるうちに赤くなる。","en":"<tips=38>Rita</tips> hurried to deny it, but even as she spoke, her face flushed deeper and deeper.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X19:r244","rowIndex":244,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「だったら、<tips=2>阿亮</tips>と今度こそ本当に結婚しなさいよ。アタシが仲介するわ」","en":"“Then marry <tips=2>Ah Leung</tips> for real this time. I’ll arrange it.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X19:r245","rowIndex":245,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「む、無理です。それは……」","en":"“I-I can’t. That would...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X19:r246","rowIndex":246,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「それはあなたのためじゃなくて、<tips=2>阿亮</tips>のためにも。今の彼には支えが必要なの」","en":"“And not just for your sake—for <tips=2>Ah Leung’s</tips> as well. He needs someone to support him now.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X19:r247","rowIndex":247,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「……大丈夫ですよ。あの人は強い人です」","en":"“...He will be all right. He is a strong man.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X19:r248","rowIndex":248,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=38>リタ</tips>は首を横に振る。","en":"<tips=38>Rita</tips> shook her head.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X19:r249","rowIndex":249,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「アタシは色んな人を見たけど、本当に強い人なんか世界には一人もいないわ。みんなやせ我慢をしてるだけよ」","en":"“I have seen all kinds of people, and there isn’t one truly strong person in this world. Everyone is only putting up a brave front.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X19:r250","rowIndex":250,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「そうかもしれませんが、私には無理です」","en":"“Perhaps. But I cannot do this.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X19:r251","rowIndex":251,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「死んだお姉さんたちが反対していたから？」","en":"“Because your dead sisters opposed it?”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X19:r252","rowIndex":252,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「違います！」","en":"“No!”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X19:r253","rowIndex":253,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=38>リタ</tips>は突然顔を上げて抗議をしたが、すぐに大声を恥じて元のように俯き、","en":"<tips=38>Rita</tips> suddenly raised her head in protest. Almost at once, embarrassed by her own loud voice, she looked down again.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X19:r254","rowIndex":254,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「確かに昔は好きだったかもしれません。でも、いまは違います。……私はあの人に認められたいんです。一人前の人間として。だから、もうこの話は終わりです」","en":"“Perhaps I did like him once. But I don’t anymore. ...I want that man to acknowledge me—as an adult in my own right. So this conversation is over.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X19:r255","rowIndex":255,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=38>リタ</tips>ちゃん。それはね……」","en":"“<tips=38>Rita</tips>. That is...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X19:r256","rowIndex":256,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　言いかけた<tips=25>世傑</tips>の言葉を遮って、","en":"Rita cut off whatever <tips=25>Sai-kit</tips> had been about to say.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X19:r257","rowIndex":257,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「すみませんが、出て行ってください」","en":"“I’m sorry, but please leave.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X19:r258","rowIndex":258,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「わかったわ」","en":"“All right.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X19:r259","rowIndex":259,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=25>世傑</tips>はなおも何か言いたそうだったが、<tips=38>リタ</tips>の固い横顔を見て諦めたようだった。","en":"<tips=25>Sai-kit</tips> still looked as though he wanted to say more, but the resolve in <tips=38>Rita’s</tips> profile made him think better of it.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X19:r260","rowIndex":260,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　相手の手を離し、立ち上がる。","en":"He released her hand and rose.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X19:r261","rowIndex":261,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「じゃあ、おやすみ」","en":"“Good night, then.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X19:r262","rowIndex":262,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　パチリと照明を落として、ドアを閉めようとしたその時、","en":"He switched off the light with a click and had begun closing the door when—","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X19:r263","rowIndex":263,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「<tips=25>世傑</tips>さん」","en":"“<tips=25>Sai-kit</tips>.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X19:r264","rowIndex":264,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　と<tips=38>リタ</tips>が呼びかけた。","en":"<tips=38>Rita</tips> called out to him.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X19:r265","rowIndex":265,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「私、死ぬつもりなんかありません。絶対に相手をやっつけて、生き延びるんですから。そうしたら、次のことを考えます。だからその時は、私に協力してくださいね」","en":"“I have no intention of dying. I will defeat them, and I will survive. Then I will decide what comes next. So when that time comes, please help me.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X19:r266","rowIndex":266,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その声は、最後は泣き声になっていた。","en":"By the end, her voice had broken into a sob.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X19:r267","rowIndex":267,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「わかったわ。その時は、なんだってしてあげちゃうんだから……」","en":"“All right. When the time comes, I’ll do absolutely anything for you...”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X19:r268","rowIndex":268,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　言った<tips=25>世傑</tips>の声も震えている。","en":"<tips=25>Sai-kit’s</tips> voice was trembling now, too.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X19:r269","rowIndex":269,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"「おやすみ」","en":"“Good night.”","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X19:r270","rowIndex":270,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=25>世傑</tips>は自分の表情を見せまいと、ドアを閉めた。そしてそのドアを背に目元を抑えた時、背後から<tips=38>リタ</tips>のすすり泣く嗚咽が聞こえた。","en":"<tips=25>Sai-kit</tips> closed the door to keep her from seeing his expression. Then, with his back to the door, he pressed a hand to his eyes and heard <tips=38>Rita</tips> sobbing behind him.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X19:r271","rowIndex":271,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　翌朝すぐに<tips=38>リタ・フェルナンデス</tips>はマンションを出て行った。","en":"<tips=38>Rita Fernandes</tips> left the apartment early the next morning.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X19:r272","rowIndex":272,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　親戚の家に到着した<tips=38>リタ</tips>はその日のうちに自分の生存をインターネット上に表明し、そして<tips=21>八龍会</tips>を非難した。","en":"After reaching her relatives’ home, <tips=38>Rita</tips> announced online that same day that she was alive, and denounced the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X19:r273","rowIndex":273,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　これによって<tips=75>フェルナンデス・ファミリー</tips>と<tips=21>八龍会</tips>が完全に対立するかたちとなったわけだが、しかし抗争が本格化する前に<tips=17>タイプB</tips>の青年二人の裏切りによって<tips=38>リタ</tips>とその親戚は殺害される。","en":"The <tips=75>Fernandes Family</tips> and the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips> were thereby placed in open opposition. Before the conflict could escalate in earnest, however, <tips=38>Rita</tips> and her relatives were murdered after two young <tips=17>Type B</tips> men betrayed them.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X19:r274","rowIndex":274,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　裏切り者たちは<tips=38>リタ</tips>の首を切り取り、それを手土産に<tips=47>解放軍</tips>に駆け込むと、<tips=47>解放軍</tips>はその加入を快く受け入れた。","en":"The traitors cut off <tips=38>Rita’s</tips> head and carried it as an offering when they sought refuge with the <tips=47>Liberation Army</tips>. The <tips=47>Liberation Army</tips> welcomed them gladly into its ranks.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X19:r275","rowIndex":275,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　その後、かつてフェルナンデス家を襲撃した若者たちがされたように、<tips=38>リタ</tips>と彼女を匿った人々の遺体は<tips=59>暗闇通り</tips>の路地に放置された。","en":"Afterward, the bodies of <tips=38>Rita</tips> and the people who had sheltered her were abandoned in an alley off <tips=59>Darkness Street</tips>—the same treatment once given to the young men who had attacked the Fernandes family.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X19:r276","rowIndex":276,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　衣服を剥がれたそのいたましい遺体は通行人に撮影され、<tips=9>Y地区</tips>の暗部を示す一シーンとして週刊誌の一面を飾ることになる。","en":"Passersby photographed the tragic, naked bodies, and one such image later filled the front page of a weekly magazine as a tableau of <tips=9>Y District’s</tips> dark underbelly.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X19:r277","rowIndex":277,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　このとき<tips=38>リタ・フェルナンデス</tips>はわずか１９才だった。","en":"<tips=38>Rita Fernandes</tips> was only nineteen years old.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X19:r278","rowIndex":278,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>の<tips=81>龍頭</tips><tips=1>謝亮</tips>は報告を受けるとすぐに部下をその現場に派遣し、かつては盟友であった少女とその親族の遺体を回収すると、先に死んだ家族たちのそばに埋葬した。","en":"Upon receiving the report, <tips=7>YS’s</tips> <tips=81>Longtou</tips>, <tips=1>Tse Leung</tips>, immediately sent subordinates to the site. They recovered the bodies of the girl who had once been his ally and of her relatives, then buried them beside the members of her family who had died before them.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}},{"ref":"bst-steam-13300478-compiled:X19:r279","rowIndex":279,"pageCtrl":"","jp":"　こうして、<tips=9>Y地区</tips>で有数の勢力を持っていた<tips=75>フェルナンデス・ファミリー</tips>を完全な壊滅状態においやったことで、<tips=21>八龍会</tips>は名実ともに<tips=7>ＹＳ</tips>に対抗しうる存在として周知されることになった。","en":"By bringing the <tips=75>Fernandes Family</tips>—once one of the dominant powers in <tips=9>Y District</tips>—to total ruin, the <tips=21>Eight Dragons Society</tips> established itself beyond dispute as an organization capable of challenging <tips=7>YS</tips>.","disposition":"translated","speaker":null,"markup":{"jpRuby":[],"enRuby":[]}}]}],"tipCount":211,"tipGroupCount":98,"tipGroups":{"1":[{"id":1,"needFiles":["A1"],"andFlag":true,"priority":0,"ja":{"title":"謝亮","text":"ＹＳの龍頭であるクリス・ツェーと、日本人である母親の間に生まれた。\n謝亮が本名。父との関係を隠すため、母の名字を使って菅原亮と名乗ることもある。\n子供の頃はクリスの息子であることを隠すため、親戚の菅原家で育った。父に対してわだかまりがあり、その職業であるギャングを嫌っている。遠く離れた街で学生生活を送っていたが、馬美美の結婚式のために戻って来たのをきっかけに、本人の意図にかかわらず死期が近づく父の後継者争いに関わることとなり、Ｙ地区の重要人物となる。"},"en":{"title":"Tse Leung","text":"Born to Chris Tse, the Longtou of YS, and a Japanese mother.\nHis real name is Tse Leung. To conceal his relationship with his father, he sometimes uses his mother’s surname and calls himself Ryo Sugawara.\nAs a child, he was raised by relatives in the Sugawara family to hide the fact that he was Chris’s son. He resents his father and despises his profession as a gangster. He had been attending school in a distant city, but returned for Ma Meimei’s wedding. From that point on, regardless of his own wishes, he became involved in the struggle to succeed his dying father and emerged as a key figure in Y District."}},{"id":2,"needFiles":["A3","E3"],"andFlag":false,"priority":1,"ja":{"title":"謝亮","text":"ＹＳの初代龍頭クリス・ツェーの長男。\n謝亮が本名。父との関係を隠すため、母の名字を使って菅原亮と名乗ることもある。\n長らく父に反発していたが、死を前にした父からの要請と、妹のためにＹＳに加入する。現在は第二代龍頭マイケル・ツェーの下についているが、将来は第三代龍頭になると見なされている。"},"en":{"title":"Tse Leung","text":"Eldest son of Chris Tse, the first Longtou of YS.\nHis real name is Tse Leung. To conceal his relationship with his father, he sometimes uses his mother’s surname and calls himself Ryo Sugawara.\nAfter opposing his father for many years, he joins YS at his dying father’s request and for his sister’s sake. He currently serves under Michael Tse, the second Longtou, but is expected to become the third Longtou in the future."}},{"id":3,"needFiles":["X3-2"],"andFlag":false,"priority":2,"ja":{"title":"謝亮","text":"ＹＳの初代龍頭クリス・ツェーの長男にして、第三代龍頭。\n少年時代は不良少年のリーダー格として、地域で知らぬものがなかった。龍頭になったあと、当時と同じような才能を発揮出来るのか注目されている。\n偉大なカリスマであった父の死後の混乱状況において、街の命運を左右する立場である。\n彼の決断によって、Ｙ地区の命運は大きく変わって行くのだろう。"},"en":{"title":"Tse Leung","text":"Eldest son of Chris Tse, the first Longtou of YS, and the organization’s third Longtou.\nAs a boy, he was so well known as the leader of a local delinquent gang that virtually no one in the area had not heard of him. Now that he is Longtou, all eyes are on whether he can display the same talent.\nAmid the turmoil following the death of his charismatic father, he holds a position capable of determining the city’s fate.\nHis decisions will likely transform the destiny of Y District."}},{"id":4,"needFiles":["A6"],"andFlag":false,"priority":3,"ja":{"title":"謝亮","text":"ＹＳの初代龍頭クリス・ツェーの長男にして、第三代龍頭。\n父のような特別なサイキック能力などのないノーマルであり、まだ若いが辣腕を発揮している。\n組織の規則にそぐわないものは次々と排除し、その結果も今のところ良好のようだ。\n街の一部では、父のクリス・ツェー以上の才覚であると評価される一方、彼を批判するものも多い。\nいずれにせよ、Ｙ地区で今最も恐れられている人物である。"},"en":{"title":"Tse Leung","text":"Eldest son of Chris Tse, the first Longtou of YS, and the organization’s third Longtou.\nHe is a Normal without any extraordinary psychic ability like his father’s. Though still young, he has already demonstrated exceptional skill.\nHe has systematically eliminated those who fail to conform to the organization’s rules, with favorable results thus far.\nSome in the city consider him even more capable than his father, Chris Tse, while many others condemn him.\nIn any case, he is presently the most feared person in Y District."}},{"id":5,"needFiles":["X17"],"andFlag":false,"priority":4,"ja":{"title":"謝亮","text":"ＹＳの初代龍頭クリス・ツェーの長男。\n強力なサイキックであった父と違ってノーマルであったが、ＹＳ第三代龍頭となり、英雄クリス死亡後の混乱も乗り越え辣腕をふるった。\n父と同じ病に罹り、若くして龍頭の座を降りる。その後襲撃を受け、死亡したかに思われていたが、ベルーハ（元エリー・ホワイト）から血液を与えられ、再生される。\n現在の肉体年齢は１３～１５才ほど。\nもはやギャングの争いには興味がないようだが、もし彼の気が変われば、今後のＹ地区での抗争に重大な影響を及ぼすことになるだろう。\n現在争っているどの勢力も、彼の父親であるクリス・ツェーと、彼自身の多大なる影響を受けているのである。"},"en":{"title":"Tse Leung","text":"Eldest son of Chris Tse, the first Longtou of YS.\nUnlike his father, a powerful psychic, he was a Normal. Nevertheless, he became YS’s third Longtou, weathered the turmoil following the hero Chris’s death, and governed with exceptional skill.\nAfter contracting the same illness as his father, he relinquished the position of Longtou at a young age. He was subsequently attacked and presumed dead, but was regenerated after receiving blood from Belukha, formerly Ellie White.\nHis body is now approximately thirteen to fifteen years old.\nHe no longer appears interested in gang conflicts, but a change of heart could profoundly affect the future struggle for Y District.\nEvery faction now fighting for power has been deeply influenced by both his father, Chris Tse, and Tse Leung himself."}}],"2":[{"id":6,"needFiles":["x1"],"andFlag":false,"priority":0,"ja":{"title":"阿亮","text":"謝亮のニックネーム。広東語で「亮ちゃん」というほどの意味。\n香港出身である父のクリス・ツェーやその仲間たちが呼んでいたものが、ＹＳにかかわる他の人間たちにも使われるようになった。"},"en":{"title":"Ah Leung","text":"A nickname for Tse Leung, roughly meaning ‘little Leung’ in Cantonese.\nHis Hong Kong-born father, Chris Tse, and his associates originally used it. The nickname later spread to others connected with YS."}}],"3":[{"id":7,"needFiles":["x1"],"andFlag":false,"priority":0,"ja":{"title":"クリス・ツェー","text":"Ｙ地区最大のギャング組織『ＹＳ』の龍頭。香港出身ではあるが、生まれてすぐ日本に来たため、日本のことしか知らない。\n中国名は謝大輝。\n強力なサイキック能力を持つタイプＡであり、特質変異として額に第三の目を持って生まれた。\n十代の頃から香港系マフィア組織『義勝』のリーダーであり、後に『ＹＳ』を創設する。\n木下組によるＹ地区への侵略を排除したため、英雄視されている。\nＹ地区の実質的な支配者であるが、不治の病によって衰弱し、死期が近づいている。"},"en":{"title":"Chris Tse","text":"Longtou of YS, the largest gang organization in Y District. Though born in Hong Kong, he came to Japan as an infant and knows no other country.\nHis Chinese name is Tse Tai-fai.\nHe is a Type A with powerful psychic abilities and was born with a third eye on his forehead as a trait mutation.\nHe led the Hong Kong mafia organization Yisheng from his teens and later founded YS.\nHe is regarded as a hero for repelling the Kinoshita-gumi’s invasion of Y District.\nAlthough the city’s de facto ruler, he is wasting away from an incurable illness and nearing death."}},{"id":8,"needFiles":["A3","E3"],"andFlag":false,"priority":1,"ja":{"title":"クリス・ツェー","text":"Ｙ地区最大のギャング組織『ＹＳ』の創設者にして初代龍頭。香港出身ではあるが、生まれてすぐ日本に来たため、日本のことしか知らない。\n中国名は謝大輝。\n強力なサイキック能力を持つタイプＡであり、特質変異として額に第三の目を持って生まれた。１０代の頃から香港系マフィア組織『義勝』のリーダーであり、後に『ＹＳ』を創設する。\n木下組によるＹ地区への侵略を排除したため、英雄視されていた。\nＹ地区の実質的な支配者であったが、病没。\n享年４５才。"},"en":{"title":"Chris Tse","text":"Founder and first Longtou of YS, the largest gang organization in Y District. Though born in Hong Kong, he came to Japan as an infant and knew no other country.\nHis Chinese name was Tse Tai-fai.\nHe was a Type A with powerful psychic abilities and was born with a third eye on his forehead as a trait mutation. He led the Hong Kong mafia organization Yisheng from his teens and later founded YS.\nHe was regarded as a hero for repelling the Kinoshita-gumi’s invasion of Y District.\nOnce the city’s de facto ruler, he died of illness.\nAge at death: 45."}}],"4":[{"id":9,"needFiles":["x1"],"andFlag":false,"priority":0,"ja":{"title":"馬明","text":"Ｙ地区最大のギャング組織『ＹＳ』の二路元帥。\n生まれは広東省だが、２才の頃に香港に移動し、そのあと親と共にＹ地区へとやって来た。クリス・ツェー、ジェフリー・ウォンとは幼い頃からの知り合いで、義兄弟の仲。武闘派で知られ、若い頃からＹ地区でその勇名を轟かせている。抗争が少なくなった今は、Ｙ地区内にいくつかの飲食店を持つオーナーでもある。"},"en":{"title":"Ma Ming","text":"Second Route Marshal of YS, the largest gang organization in Y District.\nHe was born in Guangdong Province, moved to Hong Kong at age two, and later came to Y District with his parents. He has known Chris Tse and Jeffrey Wong since childhood, and the three are sworn brothers. Renowned as a fighter, he has been famous for his martial prowess throughout Y District since his youth. Now that gang conflicts have diminished, he also owns several restaurants in the district."}},{"id":10,"needFiles":["A6"],"andFlag":false,"priority":1,"ja":{"title":"馬明","text":"Ｙ地区最大のギャング組織『ＹＳ』の二路元帥であった。\n生まれは広東省だが、２才の頃に香港に移動し、そのあと親と共にＹ地区へとやって来た。クリス・ツェー、ジェフリー・ウォンとは幼い頃からの知り合いで、義兄弟の仲。武闘派で知られ、若い頃からＹ地区でその勇名を轟かせている。初代クリス・ツェー死後、組織の金を私的流用し、第三代龍頭謝亮によって処刑される。\n享年４４才。"},"en":{"title":"Ma Ming","text":"Former Second Route Marshal of YS, the largest gang organization in Y District.\nHe was born in Guangdong Province, moved to Hong Kong at age two, and later came to Y District with his parents. He had known Chris Tse and Jeffrey Wong since childhood, and the three were sworn brothers. Renowned as a fighter, he had been famous for his martial prowess throughout Y District since his youth. After the death of the first Longtou, Chris Tse, Ma Ming misappropriated the organization’s funds and was executed by its third Longtou, Tse Leung.\nAge at death: 44."}}],"5":[{"id":11,"needFiles":["C1","X2-2"],"andFlag":true,"priority":0,"ja":{"title":"太刀川良馬","text":"国立巻河原病院に勤務する精神科医。\nタイプＡであり、特質変異として左目に瞳が二つある。強力なサイキックであり、視線を合わせた相手の感情が自分のなかに流れ込んでくる。\nクリス・ツェーとはお互いを友人と呼び合う仲。今はまったく疎遠で、交流はない。\n病院で勤務する傍ら、夜は近くの児童施設などを訪ね、無料診療を行っている。"},"en":{"title":"Ryoma Tachikawa","text":"A psychiatrist at National Makigawara Hospital.\nHe is a Type A whose left eye has two pupils as a trait mutation. A powerful psychic, he absorbs the emotions of anyone who meets his gaze.\nHe and Chris Tse regard each other as friends, but they are now completely estranged and have no contact.\nAlongside his hospital duties, he visits nearby children’s homes and similar facilities at night to provide free medical care."}},{"id":12,"needFiles":["X6-2"],"andFlag":false,"priority":1,"ja":{"title":"太刀川良馬","text":"国立巻河原病院に勤務する精神科医。\nタイプＡであり、特質変異として左目に瞳が二つある。強力なサイキックであり、視線を合わせた相手の感情が自分のなかに流れ込んでくる。\nクリス・ツェーとは盟友であり、かつてはともに協力してローズ・クラブを滅ぼし、ＹＳの設立にも大きく関わった。当時は身分を隠すため、顔にはペスト医のマスクをかぶり、ギャングたちの間では『ドクター』として有名であった。\n現在は完全に裏社会を離れ、彼らとの関わりも避け、医師として暮らしている。"},"en":{"title":"Ryoma Tachikawa","text":"A psychiatrist at National Makigawara Hospital.\nHe is a Type A whose left eye has two pupils as a trait mutation. A powerful psychic, he absorbs the emotions of anyone who meets his gaze.\nHe is a close ally of Chris Tse. They once worked together to destroy the Rose Club, and Tachikawa played a major role in founding YS. To conceal his identity at the time, he wore a plague doctor’s mask and became famous among the gangs as ‘the Doctor.’\nHe has now withdrawn completely from the underworld, avoids all involvement with its inhabitants, and lives as a physician."}},{"id":13,"needFiles":["C4","E6"],"andFlag":false,"priority":2,"ja":{"title":"太刀川良馬","text":"国立巻河原病院に勤務する精神科医。\nかつて裏社会で『ドクター』と呼ばれたタイプA。\n特質変異として左目に瞳が二つある。強力なサイキックであり、視線を合わせた相手の感情が自分のなかに流れ込んでくる。\nクリス・ツェーとは盟友であり、彼に協力してローズ・クラブを滅ぼし、ＹＳの設立にも大きく関わった。彼の勤める国立巻河原病院を襲撃した八龍会を調査しようとしたところ、コシチェイと遭遇し、殺害される。\n享年４７才。"},"en":{"title":"Ryoma Tachikawa","text":"A psychiatrist at National Makigawara Hospital.\nA Type A once known as ‘the Doctor’ in the underworld.\nHis left eye has two pupils as a trait mutation. A powerful psychic, he absorbs the emotions of anyone who meets his gaze.\nHe was a close ally of Chris Tse, helping him destroy the Rose Club and playing a major role in founding YS. While attempting to investigate the Eight Dragons Society members who attacked his hospital, he encountered Koschei and was killed.\nAge at death: 47."}}],"6":[{"id":14,"needFiles":["X2-1"],"andFlag":false,"priority":0,"ja":{"title":"国立巻河原病院","text":"Ｙ地区の外れにある国立病院。正式名称は国立巻河原病院だが、世間では『タイプＢ収容所』と言われている。\nその名の通り、タイプＢ患者を専門に扱う病院で、鍵の掛けられた敷地内では日本中からやってきた重度の患者たちが生活している。歴史は古く、建設されてから６０年ほどが過ぎているため、建物などは大分老朽化している。\n発症したタイプＢに対して現状は効果的な治療法がなく、患者は長期の入院を余儀なくされる。病院の地下室では患者に対して人体実験が行われているという噂がまことしやかに流れているが、確認されたことはない。"},"en":{"title":"National Makigawara Hospital","text":"A national hospital on the outskirts of Y District. Its official name is National Makigawara Hospital, though the public calls it the ‘Type B Detention Center.’\nAs the nickname suggests, it specializes in Type B patients. Severely affected patients from across Japan live within its locked grounds. The hospital has a long history, and approximately sixty years after its construction, its buildings have deteriorated considerably.\nThere is currently no effective treatment for Type Bs whose symptoms have manifested, forcing patients into prolonged hospitalization. Persistent rumors claim that human experiments are conducted on patients in the hospital basement, but this has never been confirmed."}},{"id":15,"needFiles":["X11","E6"],"andFlag":false,"priority":1,"ja":{"title":"国立巻河原病院","text":"Ｙ地区の外れに存在した国立病院。正式名称は国立巻河原病院だが、世間では『タイプＢ収容所』と呼ばれていた。タイプＢ患者を専門に扱う病院であったが、見土道夫率いる八龍解放軍の襲撃によって多数の職員が殺害され、患者は逃亡してしまった。"},"en":{"title":"National Makigawara Hospital","text":"A former national hospital on the outskirts of Y District. Its official name was National Makigawara Hospital, though the public called it the ‘Type B Detention Center.’ It specialized in Type B patients, but an attack by the Hachiryu Liberation Army under Michio Mido killed numerous staff members and allowed the patients to escape."}}],"7":[{"id":16,"needFiles":["x1"],"andFlag":false,"priority":0,"ja":{"title":"ＹＳ","text":"Ｙ地区内最大のギャング組織。街で最も高い建造物であるグランドタワーを本拠地にしている。\n単一の組織の名というよりも、複数のギャング組織による同盟の名と言った方が実態に近い。\n加盟組織はいずれも地区で最大級の勢力を持っているため、ＹＳの勢力は地域では比類のないものとなっている。\n創設者はクリス・ツェー。"},"en":{"title":"YS","text":"The largest gang organization in Y District. Its headquarters occupy Grand Tower, the tallest structure in the city.\nIn practice, YS is less a single organization than an alliance of several gangs.\nEvery member organization ranks among the district’s most powerful, giving YS unrivaled influence throughout the area.\nIts founder is Chris Tse."}},{"id":17,"needFiles":["A5"],"andFlag":false,"priority":1,"ja":{"title":"ＹＳ","text":"Ｙ地区内最大のギャング組織。街で最も高い建造物であるグランドタワーを本拠地にしている。\n単一の組織の名というよりも、複数のギャング組織による同盟の名と言った方が実態に近い。\n加盟組織はいずれも地区で最大級の勢力を持っているため、ＹＳの勢力は地域では比類のないものとなっている。\n創設者はクリス・ツェー。彼は初代龍頭でもあった。\nクリス・ツェー死後、その叔父であるマイケル・ツェーを経て、現在はクリスの息子である謝亮が三代目龍頭となっている。"},"en":{"title":"YS","text":"The largest gang organization in Y District. Its headquarters occupy Grand Tower, the tallest structure in the city.\nIn practice, YS is less a single organization than an alliance of several gangs.\nEvery member organization ranks among the district’s most powerful, giving YS unrivaled influence throughout the area.\nIts founder, Chris Tse, was also its first Longtou.\nAfter Chris Tse’s death, his uncle Michael Tse succeeded him. The current and third Longtou is Chris’s son, Tse Leung."}},{"id":18,"needFiles":["X17"],"andFlag":false,"priority":2,"ja":{"title":"ＹＳ","text":"Ｙ地区内最大のギャング組織。街で最も高い建造物であるグランドタワーを本拠地にしている。\n単一の組織の名というよりも、複数のギャング組織による同盟の名と言った方が実態に近い。\nかつての加盟組織はいずれも地区で最大級の勢力を持っており、ＹＳの勢力は地域では比類のないものだったが、長い間に有力組織の離脱や消滅、分裂騒動などが起こり、勢いを落としている。\n創設者はクリス・ツェー。彼は初代龍頭でもあった。\nクリス・ツェー以来、歴代龍頭は全て義勝出身の香港派グループから出ていたが、現在の四代目龍頭は廖ファミリー出身のトーマス・リャオとなっている。"},"en":{"title":"YS","text":"The largest gang organization in Y District. Its headquarters occupy Grand Tower, the tallest structure in the city.\nIn practice, YS is less a single organization than an alliance of several gangs.\nIts former member organizations were all among the district’s most powerful, making YS unrivaled in the region. Over the years, however, leading organizations have withdrawn or disappeared, while internal schisms have further diminished its strength.\nIts founder, Chris Tse, was also its first Longtou.\nEvery Longtou since Chris Tse had come from the Hong Kong Faction, whose members originated in Yisheng. The current and fourth Longtou, however, is Thomas Liao of the Liao Family."}}],"8":[{"id":19,"needFiles":["x1"],"andFlag":false,"priority":0,"ja":{"title":"グレートホール","text":"正体不明の巨大な穴。最初のものは今から８６年ほど前にボツワナに発生し、そのあと世界の各地に同様のものが生まれ、現在では７つ存在する。Ｙ地区のグレートホールは世界で５番目に誕生した、比較的新しいものである。\nグレートホールは前触れもなく突然生まれ、地上にあったものは消滅し、どこへ行ったのかは誰も知る由がない。穴の周辺は、正体不明の何かで汚染されており、穴に近づいたものは放射線障害に似た症状を発症する。そのため、世界中のグレートホールの周辺はみな立ち入り禁止区域に指定されており、街があった場合は廃墟となる。\n穴自体は地面に穿たれた、ただのくぼみでしかなく、これまでの調査では特別なものは何も見つかっていない。穴の深さや直径はグレートホールごとにまちまちである。\nグレートホールが現れた後、タイプＡやタイプＢなどのミュータントが発生したため、何か関連性があるのではないかと言われているが、それを証明するものは見つかっていない。"},"en":{"title":"Great Hole","text":"An enormous hole of unknown origin. The first appeared in Botswana approximately eighty-six years ago. Similar holes subsequently emerged around the world, and seven now exist. The Great Hole in Y District was the fifth to appear and is relatively recent.\nGreat Holes appear without warning. Everything previously occupying the site vanishes, and no one knows where it goes. The area surrounding each hole is contaminated by something unknown, and those who approach develop symptoms resembling radiation sickness. The surroundings of every Great Hole in the world have therefore been designated exclusion zones, reducing any cities within them to ruins.\nThe hole itself is merely a depression bored into the ground, and investigations have found nothing extraordinary inside it. Depth and diameter vary between Great Holes.\nBecause mutants such as Type As and Type Bs began appearing after the Great Holes, a connection is widely suspected, but no evidence has been found."}}],"9":[{"id":20,"needFiles":["x1"],"andFlag":false,"priority":0,"ja":{"title":"Ｙ地区","text":"日本にある繁華街。かつてこの場所には基地があり、その閉鎖後の跡地に都市が建設されることとなった。地域の中心都市となるべく、行政主導で大規模な再開発が行われたが、その矢先に近隣にグレートホールが出来てしまったため、この地域も立ち入り禁止となり、都市計画は白紙となる。\nその後立ち入り禁止区域が縮小して居住可能になると、建設途中だった建物に移民やミュータントたちが住み着きはじめる。\nその後街は独自の発展を遂げ、現在は国内でも有数の歓楽街として国際的に知られている。"},"en":{"title":"Y District","text":"An entertainment district in Japan. A military base once occupied the site, and plans were made to build a city there after the base closed. The government led a massive redevelopment project intended to create a regional center, but a Great Hole appeared nearby just as work began. The area was declared off-limits, and the development plan was abandoned.\nWhen the exclusion zone was later reduced and the area became habitable, immigrants and mutants began settling in its unfinished buildings.\nThe city subsequently developed along its own path and is now internationally renowned as one of Japan’s foremost entertainment districts."}},{"id":21,"needFiles":["X17"],"andFlag":false,"priority":1,"ja":{"title":"Ｙ地区","text":"日本にある繁華街。かつてこの場所には基地があり、その閉鎖後の跡地に都市が建設されることとなった。地域の中心都市となるべく、行政主導で大規模な再開発が行われたが、その矢先に近隣にグレートホールが出来てしまったため、この地域も立ち入り禁止となり、都市計画は白紙となる。\nその後立ち入り禁止区域が縮小して居住可能になると、建設途中だった建物に移民やミュータントたちが住み着きはじめる。\nその後街は独自の発展を遂げ、一時は国内でも有数の歓楽街として国際的に知られていたが、ギャングたちの抗争が長く続いた結果、当時の繁栄は失われてしまっている。"},"en":{"title":"Y District","text":"An entertainment district in Japan. A military base once occupied the site, and plans were made to build a city there after the base closed. The government led a massive redevelopment project intended to create a regional center, but a Great Hole appeared nearby just as work began. The area was declared off-limits, and the development plan was abandoned.\nWhen the exclusion zone was later reduced and the area became habitable, immigrants and mutants began settling in its unfinished buildings.\nThe city subsequently developed along its own path and was once internationally renowned as one of Japan’s foremost entertainment districts. Prolonged gang warfare, however, has stripped it of its former prosperity."}}],"10":[{"id":22,"needFiles":["B1"],"andFlag":false,"priority":0,"ja":{"title":"見土道夫","text":"Ｙ地区に住む若者。\n数年前は不良少年グループのリーダーであり、謝亮とは当時からの親友。現在は手作りの菓子『グレートホール饅頭』の製造と販売を行っている。\nタイプＡであり、タイプＢ。いわゆるハイブリッド。タイプＡとしてはサイキック能力を持ち、右てのひらに触れたものを全て切断することが出来る。特質変異として、その右手は肘まで真っ黒に染まっている。タイプＢとしても、訓練によってその能力を自らコントロールすることが出来る。"},"en":{"title":"Michio Mido","text":"A young man who lives in Y District.\nSeveral years ago, he led a delinquent gang and was already a close friend of Tse Leung. He now makes and sells a handmade confection called the Great Hole Bun.\nHe is both Type A and Type B—a so-called hybrid. As a Type A psychic, he can sever anything that touches his right palm. His right arm is stained pitch-black up to the elbow as a trait mutation. Through training, he can also consciously control his Type B abilities."}},{"id":23,"needFiles":["B2"],"andFlag":false,"priority":1,"ja":{"title":"見土道夫","text":"Ｙ地区に住む若者。\n幼い頃に両親を亡くし、『老人たち』に育てられた。将来は八龍会の幹部になることを期待されている。\n数年前は不良少年グループのリーダーであり、謝亮とは当時からの親友。現在は手作りの菓子『グレートホール饅頭』の製造と販売を行っている。\nタイプＡであり、タイプＢ。いわゆるハイブリッド。タイプＡとしてはサイキック能力を持ち、右てのひらに触れたものを全て切断することが出来る。特質変異として、その右手は肘まで真っ黒に染まっている。タイプＢとしても、訓練によってその能力を自らコントロールすることが出来る。"},"en":{"title":"Michio Mido","text":"A young man who lives in Y District.\nOrphaned at an early age, he was raised by ‘the Elders’ and is expected to become an executive of the Eight Dragons Society.\nSeveral years ago, he led a delinquent gang and was already a close friend of Tse Leung. He now makes and sells a handmade confection called the Great Hole Bun.\nHe is both Type A and Type B—a so-called hybrid. As a Type A psychic, he can sever anything that touches his right palm. His right arm is stained pitch-black up to the elbow as a trait mutation. Through training, he can also consciously control his Type B abilities."}},{"id":24,"needFiles":["B4-1"],"andFlag":false,"priority":2,"ja":{"title":"見土道夫","text":"八龍会解放軍リーダー。\n幼い頃に両親を亡くし、『老人たち』に育てられた。現在は八龍会の実戦部隊『八龍解放軍』のリーダーを務めている。\nライバル組織となるＹＳの謝亮とは少年時代からの親友だった。\nタイプＡであり、タイプＢ。いわゆるハイブリッド。タイプＡとしてはサイキック能力を持ち、右てのひらに触れたものを全て切断することが出来る。特質変異として、その右手は肘まで真っ黒に染まっている。タイプＢとしても、訓練によってその能力を自らコントロールすることが出来る。"},"en":{"title":"Michio Mido","text":"Leader of the Hachiryu Liberation Army.\nOrphaned at an early age, he was raised by ‘the Elders.’ He now leads the Eight Dragons Society’s combat unit, the Hachiryu Liberation Army.\nTse Leung of the rival organization YS had been his close friend since boyhood.\nHe is both Type A and Type B—a so-called hybrid. As a Type A psychic, he can sever anything that touches his right palm. His right arm is stained pitch-black up to the elbow as a trait mutation. Through training, he can also consciously control his Type B abilities."}},{"id":25,"needFiles":["B6"],"andFlag":false,"priority":3,"ja":{"title":"見土道夫","text":"元八龍会リーダー。\n高い戦闘能力を持つハイブリッド。\n幼い頃に両親を亡くし、『老人たち』に育てられた。\nライバル組織となるＹＳの謝亮とは少年時代からの親友だった。\n成人後は友人らと共に事業を始めたが、老人たちの要請により八龍解放軍リーダーとなり、八龍会による数々の暴力事件に関わり、巻河原病院襲撃事件などを起こす。\nその後、クーデターを起こし老人たちを八龍会から追放し、自らリーダーとなるも、その就任パーティにて暗殺される。\n享年２２才。"},"en":{"title":"Michio Mido","text":"Former leader of the Eight Dragons Society.\nA hybrid with formidable combat abilities.\nOrphaned at an early age, he was raised by ‘the Elders.’\nTse Leung of the rival organization YS had been his close friend since boyhood.\nAs an adult, he started a business with his friends. At the Elders’ request, however, he became leader of the Hachiryu Liberation Army and took part in numerous acts of violence committed by the Eight Dragons Society, including the attack on Makigawara Hospital.\nHe later staged a coup, expelled the Elders from the Society, and took command himself, only to be assassinated at his inauguration party.\nAge at death: 22."}}],"11":[{"id":26,"needFiles":["B2","E4"],"andFlag":false,"priority":0,"ja":{"title":"灰上璃映子","text":"ヘドロ団地に住む高校生。\n特質変異を持たないタイプＡで、触れずにものを動かすサイキック能力を持つ。\n双子の妹である江梨子とそっくりの容貌を持ち、区別をすることは難しい。\n学校にはほとんど顔を出さず、Ｙ地区の繁華街をいつもうろついている。\n見土道夫や謝亮とは子供の頃からの知り合い。"},"en":{"title":"Rieko Haigami","text":"A high school student living in the Sludge Complex.\nShe is a Type A without a trait mutation and possesses the psychic ability to move objects without touching them.\nShe looks nearly identical to her younger twin sister, Eriko, making the two difficult to distinguish.\nShe rarely attends school and is usually found roaming Y District’s entertainment quarter.\nShe has known Michio Mido and Tse Leung since childhood."}},{"id":27,"needFiles":["F1"],"andFlag":false,"priority":1,"ja":{"title":"灰上璃映子","text":"ヘドロ団地に住む双子の片割れ。妹の江梨子がタイプBであるのに対し、彼女はタイプA。\n触れずにものを動かすサイキック能力を持つ。\n現在は、サーシェンカことコシチェイと行動を共にしている。"},"en":{"title":"Rieko Haigami","text":"One of the twins living in the Sludge Complex. While her younger sister Eriko is Type B, Rieko is Type A.\nShe possesses the psychic ability to move objects without touching them.\nShe is currently traveling with Koschei, also known as Sashenka."}},{"id":28,"needFiles":["B6"],"andFlag":false,"priority":2,"ja":{"title":"灰上璃映子","text":"ヘドロ団地に住む双子の片割れ。妹の江梨子がタイプBであるのに対し、彼女はタイプA。\n触れずにものを動かすサイキック能力を持つ。\nコシチェイと行動を共にしていたところ、八龍会を乗っ取った見土道夫の罠にかかり、二人とも射殺される。\nその後、片方の遺体が消えていたが、璃映子と江梨子、どちらの遺体が消えたのかは定かではない。"},"en":{"title":"Rieko Haigami","text":"One of the twins living in the Sludge Complex. While her younger sister Eriko is Type B, Rieko is Type A.\nShe possesses the psychic ability to move objects without touching them.\nWhile traveling with Koschei, she fell into a trap set by Michio Mido after he seized control of the Eight Dragons Society. Both were shot dead.\nOne of the bodies later disappeared, but it is unclear whether the missing body was Rieko’s or Eriko’s."}},{"id":29,"needFiles":["a8"],"andFlag":false,"priority":3,"ja":{"title":"灰上璃映子","text":"ヘドロ団地に住む双子の片割れ。妹の江梨子がタイプBであるのに対し、彼女はタイプA。\n触れずにものを動かすサイキック能力を持つ。\nコシチェイと行動を共にしていたところ、八龍会を乗っ取った見土道夫の罠にかかり、射殺される。\n享年１８才。"},"en":{"title":"Rieko Haigami","text":"One of the twins living in the Sludge Complex. While her younger sister Eriko is Type B, Rieko is Type A.\nShe possesses the psychic ability to move objects without touching them.\nWhile traveling with Koschei, she fell into a trap set by Michio Mido after he seized control of the Eight Dragons Society and was shot dead.\nAge at death: 18."}}],"12":[{"id":30,"needFiles":["B2","E4"],"andFlag":false,"priority":0,"ja":{"title":"灰上江梨子","text":"ヘドロ団地に住む高校生。\nタイプＢで、金眼時には優れた身体能力を発揮する。\n双子の姉である璃映子とそっくりの容貌を持ち、区別をすることは難しい。\n学校にはほとんど顔を出さず、Ｙ地区の繁華街をいつもうろついている。\n見土道夫や謝亮とは子供の頃からの知り合い。"},"en":{"title":"Eriko Haigami","text":"A high school student living in the Sludge Complex.\nShe is a Type B and displays exceptional physical abilities when her eyes turn gold.\nShe looks nearly identical to her older twin sister, Rieko, making the two difficult to distinguish.\nShe rarely attends school and is usually found roaming Y District’s entertainment quarter.\nShe has known Michio Mido and Tse Leung since childhood."}},{"id":31,"needFiles":["F1"],"andFlag":false,"priority":1,"ja":{"title":"灰上江梨子","text":"ヘドロ団地に住む双子の片割れ。姉の璃映子がタイプＡのサイキックであるのに対し、彼女はタイプＢ。\n金眼時には、常人ばなれした身体能力を発揮する。\n現在は、サーシェンカことコシチェイと行動を共にしている。"},"en":{"title":"Eriko Haigami","text":"One of the twins living in the Sludge Complex. While her older sister Rieko is a Type A psychic, Eriko is Type B.\nWhen her eyes turn gold, she displays physical abilities far beyond those of an ordinary person.\nShe is currently traveling with Koschei, also known as Sashenka."}},{"id":32,"needFiles":["B6"],"andFlag":false,"priority":2,"ja":{"title":"灰上江梨子","text":"ヘドロ団地に住む双子の片割れ。姉の璃映子がタイプＡのサイキックであるのに対し、彼女はタイプＢ。\n金眼時には、常人ばなれした身体能力を発揮する。\nコシチェイと行動を共にしていたところ、八龍会を乗っ取った見土道夫の罠にかかり、二人とも射殺される。\nその後、片方の遺体が消えていたが、璃映子と江梨子、どちらの遺体が消えたのかは定かではない。"},"en":{"title":"Eriko Haigami","text":"One of the twins living in the Sludge Complex. While her older sister Rieko is a Type A psychic, Eriko is Type B.\nWhen her eyes turn gold, she displays physical abilities far beyond those of an ordinary person.\nWhile traveling with Koschei, she fell into a trap set by Michio Mido after he seized control of the Eight Dragons Society. Both twins were shot dead.\nOne of the bodies later disappeared, but it is unclear whether the missing body was Rieko’s or Eriko’s."}},{"id":33,"needFiles":["a8"],"andFlag":false,"priority":3,"ja":{"title":"灰上江梨子","text":"ヘドロ団地に住む双子の片割れ。姉の璃映子がタイプＡのサイキックであるのに対し、彼女はタイプＢ。\n金眼時には、常人ばなれした身体能力を発揮する。\nコシチェイと行動を共にしていたところ、八龍会を乗っ取った見土道夫の罠にかかり、二人とも銃弾を受ける。\nその後、璃映子は死亡したが、江梨子はコシチェイの血液により復活し、再び行動を開始する。"},"en":{"title":"Eriko Haigami","text":"One of the twins living in the Sludge Complex. While her older sister Rieko is a Type A psychic, Eriko is Type B.\nWhen her eyes turn gold, she displays physical abilities far beyond those of an ordinary person.\nWhile traveling with Koschei, she fell into a trap set by Michio Mido after he seized control of the Eight Dragons Society. Both twins were struck by gunfire.\nRieko subsequently died, but Eriko was revived by Koschei’s blood and resumed her activities."}},{"id":34,"needFiles":["X16"],"andFlag":false,"priority":4,"ja":{"title":"灰上江梨子","text":"ヘドロ団地に住む双子の片割れ。姉の璃映子がタイプＡのサイキックであるのに対し、彼女はタイプＢ。\n金眼時には、常人ばなれした身体能力を発揮する。\nコシチェイと行動を共にしていたところ、八龍会を乗っ取った見土道夫の罠にかかり、二人とも銃弾を受ける。\n璃映子は死亡したが、江梨子はコシチェイの血液により復活。\nその後コシチェイと行動を共にするが、グレートホール付近で彼と共に消息を絶つ。"},"en":{"title":"Eriko Haigami","text":"One of the twins living in the Sludge Complex. While her older sister Rieko is a Type A psychic, Eriko is Type B.\nWhen her eyes turn gold, she displays physical abilities far beyond those of an ordinary person.\nWhile traveling with Koschei, she fell into a trap set by Michio Mido after he seized control of the Eight Dragons Society. Both twins were struck by gunfire.\nRieko died, but Eriko was revived by Koschei’s blood.\nShe continued traveling with Koschei, but the two later disappeared near the Great Hole."}}],"13":[{"id":35,"needFiles":["A4","F1","E4"],"andFlag":false,"priority":0,"ja":{"title":"溝平Ｂ団地","text":"元々は市が管理する公営集合住宅であったが、ならずものたちが住み着き、現在は無法地帯となっている。そのため、本来の『溝平Ｂ団地』という名ではなく『ヘドロ団地』と呼ばれるようになった。\n敷地内では各種ドラッグの取引や製造、銃器の売買など、さまざまな犯罪行為が行われていると思われるが、非常に治安が悪く、また住人たちはリーダーの深沢聡を中心に結束しており、警察の捜査もおよばず、実態は明らかにされていない。\nＹ地区の一地域と思われていることも多いが、いわゆるＹ地区と呼ばれている地域とは国道を隔てて外側にあり、また団地自体に独自の閉鎖性があることから、住民や地域の関係者はY地区とは別の地域だと認識している。"},"en":{"title":"Mizohira B Housing Complex","text":"Originally a municipal public housing development, it became a lawless enclave after criminals moved in. It is consequently known as the ‘Sludge Complex’ rather than by its official name, Mizohira B Housing Complex.\nVarious crimes are believed to take place on the grounds, including the manufacture and sale of drugs and the trafficking of firearms. Public safety is extremely poor, however, and the residents remain united under their leader, Satoshi Fukazawa. Police investigations have made no headway, leaving the true conditions unknown.\nThe complex is often regarded as part of Y District, but it lies across a national highway from the area commonly called Y District. Its insular character also leads both residents and local parties to regard it as a separate community."}}],"14":[{"id":36,"needFiles":["F2","E4"],"andFlag":false,"priority":0,"ja":{"title":"深沢聡","text":"Ｙ地区の住民からも恐れられるほどの危険地域「ヘドロ団地」のリーダー。\nヘドロ団地で生まれ、ヘドロ団地で育った。ミュータントではないノーマルだが、優れた頭脳を持ち、ヘドロ団地の荒くれ者たちのリーダーとなる。面倒見のよい性格で、弱い者には優しく、仲間を守るためには手段を選ばない冷徹さも持ち、人望は厚い。恩義のある灰上の娘である双子を我が子のように見守っている。"},"en":{"title":"Satoshi Fukazawa","text":"Leader of the Sludge Complex, an area so dangerous that even Y District residents fear it.\nBorn and raised in the complex, he is a Normal rather than a mutant. His exceptional intelligence nevertheless made him the leader of its ruffians. Attentive and kind to the weak, he also possesses the ruthlessness to use any means necessary to protect his companions. He commands profound loyalty. He watches over the twin daughters of Haigami, to whom he owes a debt, as though they were his own children."}},{"id":184,"needFiles":["X17"],"andFlag":false,"priority":1,"ja":{"title":"深沢聡","text":"Ｙ地区の住民からも恐れられるほどの危険地域「ヘドロ団地」のリーダー。\nヘドロ団地で生まれ、ヘドロ団地で育った。ミュータントではないノーマルだが、優れた頭脳を持ち、ヘドロ団地の荒くれ者たちのリーダーとなる。アンドリュー・マオの登場によりＹ地区の大抗争が始まると、ＹＳとの友好関係を破棄し、Ｙ地区への介入をはじめる。面倒見のよい性格で、弱い者には優しく、仲間を守るためには手段を選ばない冷徹さも持ち、人望は厚い。恩義のある灰上の娘である双子を我が子のように愛しており、行方不明になった灰上江梨子の行方を探している。"},"en":{"title":"Satoshi Fukazawa","text":"Leader of the Sludge Complex, an area so dangerous that even Y District residents fear it.\nBorn and raised in the complex, he is a Normal rather than a mutant. His exceptional intelligence nevertheless made him the leader of its ruffians. When Andrew Mao’s appearance ignited a major conflict throughout Y District, Fukazawa severed his friendly relations with YS and began intervening in the district. Attentive and kind to the weak, he also possesses the ruthlessness to use any means necessary to protect his companions. He commands profound loyalty. He loves the twin daughters of Haigami, to whom he owes a debt, as though they were his own children and is searching for the missing Eriko Haigami."}}],"15":[{"id":37,"needFiles":["x1"],"andFlag":false,"priority":0,"ja":{"title":"ボーダーエリア","text":"Ｙ地区とグレートホールの境界線上の区域の通称。タイプＡが集まって暮らしている。彼らはおしなべて強い特質変異を持ち、異形である。サイキック能力を持つ者も多数存在すると思われるが、実態は把握出来ない。彼らは閉鎖的な独自の社会を作り、外部の者を寄せ付けない生活をしているが、Ｙ地区の街角に姿を現すこともある。その時はいつも、フード付きの特有の衣装で異形を隠している。\nボーダーエリアの実態は謎に包まれており、ヘドロ団地と並んで、強い警戒が必要な危険地域とされている。"},"en":{"title":"Border Area","text":"The common name for the area along the boundary between Y District and the Great Hole. Type As live there in concentrated numbers. They uniformly possess pronounced trait mutations and visibly abnormal bodies. Many are believed to have psychic abilities, but the area’s true conditions remain unknown. Its residents have formed their own insular society and shun outsiders, though they occasionally appear on the streets of Y District. When they do, they conceal their forms beneath distinctive hooded clothing.\nThe Border Area remains shrouded in mystery and, like the Sludge Complex, is considered a dangerous region requiring extreme caution."}}],"16":[{"id":38,"needFiles":["A1"],"andFlag":false,"priority":0,"ja":{"title":"タイプＡ","text":"いつ頃からか地上に現れ始めた突然変異の人類。\nその様式は様々であり、特質変異と呼ばれる身体的特徴を持つものもいれば、持たないものもいる。\nこれまでの科学では説明が出来ない現象を引き起こす能力を有するものもいる。その能力は、ほんのささやかな無害なものから、たった一人で世界を変えてしまうような重大なものまで様々である。\nかつては差別を受けることもあったが、現在はその優れた能力を活かして社会で重要な地位につくタイプＡも増えている。"},"en":{"title":"Type A","text":"A form of mutated humanity that began appearing on Earth at an unknown point in time.\nType As vary widely. Some possess physical features known as trait mutations, while others do not.\nSome can cause phenomena inexplicable to existing science. Their abilities range from trivial, harmless effects to powers with which a single person could change the world.\nThough once subjected to discrimination, increasing numbers of Type As now use their extraordinary abilities to occupy important positions in society."}}],"17":[{"id":39,"needFiles":["A1"],"andFlag":false,"priority":0,"ja":{"title":"タイプＢ","text":"いつ頃からか地上に現れ始めた突然変異の人類。\n興奮すると目が金色に変わり、常人ばなれした身体能力を発揮する。その引き換えとして、精神に異常をきたし、幻覚や妄想にとらわれることもある。\n一般的に、年齢が進行するにしたがってタイプＢ的特徴は強調されてゆく。生まれた時はノーマルでも、成長後にタイプＢとなることもある。\nかつてはタイプＡとタイプＢの区別はなく、上記の身体的特徴も、サイキック能力の一種と考えられていた。\n近年は研究が進んでおり、タイプＡとはまったく別の存在だと判明していて、タイプＡ、タイプＢという呼称を改めることも提案されている。"},"en":{"title":"Type B","text":"A form of mutated humanity that began appearing on Earth at an unknown point in time.\nWhen excited, Type Bs’ eyes turn gold and they display physical abilities far beyond those of ordinary people. In exchange, they may suffer mental disturbances and become gripped by hallucinations or delusions.\nType B characteristics generally become more pronounced with age. A person born Normal may become Type B later in life.\nType As and Type Bs were once treated as a single category, and the physical traits described above were considered a form of psychic ability.\nRecent research has established that Type Bs are entirely distinct from Type As, prompting proposals to replace both designations."}}],"18":[{"id":40,"needFiles":["A2-2"],"andFlag":false,"priority":0,"ja":{"title":"ローズ・クラブ","text":"かつてＹ地区の郊外に存在した巨大娯楽施設。\nＹ地区内ではグランド・タワーの次に大きいビルが、丸ごと施設となっており、人々のあらゆる欲望を満たす場所と呼ばれていた。\n完全会員制であり、社会的地位の高い政治家や起業家が多く名を連ねていたという。\nそこで提供されていたサービスの全ては現在でも明らかになっていないが、生きた人間を虎に食わせるショーを行うなど、非人道的な行為が日常的に行われていたようである。\nＹ地区内の戸籍を持たぬような若い男女が、様々な事情で働かされ、その多くは生きて施設を出ることが出来なかったという。\n有力政治家と広域暴力団木下組の力を背景に、その活動は単なる秘密クラブの域をこえており、香港系マフィア「義勝」の若きリーダークリス・ツェーは、このクラブと戦うためにＹ地区内の有力組織に呼びかけ、ＹＳを結成した。\nそのＹＳの働きにより、ローズ・クラブは壊滅する。\nそこで行われていたサービスのあまりのおぞましさと、金のためにそこに子供や家族を売ってしまった後ろめたさから、Ｙ地区ではもはや語る者が少なくなっているが、街はその存在を未だ忘れてはいない。"},"en":{"title":"Rose Club","text":"A vast entertainment facility that once stood on the outskirts of Y District.\nThe entire building—the district’s second largest after Grand Tower—formed a venue said to satisfy every human desire.\nMembership was exclusive, and its rolls reportedly included many prominent politicians and entrepreneurs.\nThe full range of services provided there remains unknown, but inhumane acts were apparently routine, including spectacles in which living people were fed to tigers.\nYoung men and women without official family registrations in Y District were forced to work there for various reasons, and many never left the facility alive.\nBacked by powerful politicians and the nationwide Kinoshita-gumi crime syndicate, the club’s activities went far beyond those of a mere secret club. To oppose it, Chris Tse, the young leader of the Hong Kong mafia organization Yisheng, rallied Y District’s leading organizations and formed YS.\nYS’s efforts ultimately destroyed the Rose Club.\nFew in Y District now speak of it, both because of the appalling services it provided and from guilt over having sold children or relatives to the club for money. The city, however, has not forgotten its existence."}}],"19":[{"id":41,"needFiles":["F4"],"andFlag":false,"priority":0,"ja":{"title":"フセスラフ計画","text":"かつてロシアで施行された極秘プロジェクトの名前。\n世界に先駆けてミュータントの謎を解き明かし、よりすぐれた人類を作り出すことを目標としていた。\n実験材料として、すぐれた再生能力をもつタイプBが選ばれ、様々な人体実験が行われた。\nその結果、不死身の殺人鬼『コシチェイ』が誕生したと言われている。"},"en":{"title":"Vseslav Project","text":"The name of a top-secret project once conducted in Russia.\nIts goal was to solve the mystery of mutants before any other country and create a superior form of humanity.\nType Bs with exceptional regenerative abilities were chosen as experimental subjects and subjected to numerous human experiments.\nThese experiments are said to have created the immortal killer Koschei."}}],"20":[{"id":42,"needFiles":["E1"],"andFlag":false,"priority":0,"ja":{"title":"コシチェイ","text":"世界をまたにかける殺人鬼。\nタイプＡのサイキックだが、その能力の具体的な内容は判明していない。どこに拘束されてもすぐに脱出する脱獄の名人。\n女性ばかりを狙い、バラバラにした遺体を綺麗に整頓するという特殊な手口から、Ｙ地区で発生した連続殺人事件の容疑者として警察に追われている。"},"en":{"title":"Koschei","text":"A serial killer active around the world.\nKoschei is a Type A psychic, though the precise nature of the ability remains unknown, and a master escape artist who swiftly breaks free from any confinement.\nThe killer exclusively targets women and meticulously arranges their dismembered remains. This distinctive method has made Koschei a suspect in the Y District serial murders and the target of a police manhunt."}},{"id":43,"needFiles":["E3"],"andFlag":false,"priority":1,"ja":{"title":"コシチェイ","text":"世界をまたにかける殺人鬼。\nタイプＡのサイキック。不死身の肉体をもつ。\n女性ばかりを狙い、バラバラにした遺体を綺麗に整頓するという特殊な手口から、Ｙ地区で発生した連続殺人事件の容疑者。\n路地邦昭のアパートを襲撃し、彼の恋人であるミユキと堂島刑事を殺害して逃亡中。\n灰上姉妹と行動を共にしていると思われる。"},"en":{"title":"Koschei","text":"A serial killer active around the world.\nKoschei is a Type A psychic with an immortal body.\nThe killer exclusively targets women and meticulously arranges their dismembered remains, making Koschei a suspect in the Y District serial murders.\nAfter attacking Kuniaki Roji’s apartment and killing both his lover Miyuki and Detective Dojima, Koschei remains at large.\nThe killer is believed to be traveling with the Haigami sisters."}},{"id":44,"needFiles":["F4"],"andFlag":false,"priority":2,"ja":{"title":"コシチェイ","text":"かつてロシアで施行された極秘プロジェクト『フセスラフ計画』によって生み出されたミュータント。\n不死身の肉体と変身能力を持っている。\nその変身能力は完全な別人になってしまうという完璧なもので、性別、年齢、人種、人格まで入れ替わる。その総数は１２０人にも及ぶ。\n複数の人格に指示を出し、この一つの肉体を制御しているのは、ヘスという人格であるが、彼も全てを完全に管理することは出来ない。\n現在、ヘスの管理能力はさらに低下し、コシチェイの崩壊が近づいている。"},"en":{"title":"Koschei","text":"A mutant created by the top-secret Vseslav Project once conducted in Russia.\nKoschei possesses an immortal body and the power to transform.\nThe transformations are perfect, producing entirely different people with changes in sex, age, race, and personality. They number as many as 120.\nA personality named Hess directs the others and controls their single shared body, but even he cannot manage them all completely.\nHess’s control is now deteriorating further, and Koschei is approaching collapse."}},{"id":45,"needFiles":["X16"],"andFlag":false,"priority":3,"ja":{"title":"コシチェイ","text":"かつてロシアで施行された極秘プロジェクト『フセスラフ計画』によって生み出されたミュータント。\n本名はアレクサンドル・ヤコヴレヴィチ・チェルヌイフ。\n不死身の肉体と変身能力を持っている。\nその変身能力は完全な別人になってしまうという完璧なもので、性別、年齢、人種、人格まで入れ替わる。その総数は１２０人にも及ぶ。\n複数の人格に指示を出し、この一つの肉体を制御しているのは、ヘスという人格であったが、ついに彼の管理能力が崩壊し、本来のアレクサンドル・ヤコヴレヴィチ・チェルヌイフに戻る。\nその後、灰上江梨子と共にグレートホールに行き、そこで消息を絶つ。"},"en":{"title":"Koschei","text":"A mutant created by the top-secret Vseslav Project once conducted in Russia.\nHis real name is Aleksandr Yakovlevich Chernykh.\nHe possesses an immortal body and the power to transform.\nThe transformations are perfect, producing entirely different people with changes in sex, age, race, and personality. They number as many as 120.\nA personality named Hess once directed the others and controlled their single shared body. His control finally collapsed, restoring the original Aleksandr Yakovlevich Chernykh.\nAleksandr subsequently went to the Great Hole with Eriko Haigami, where they disappeared."}}],"21":[{"id":46,"needFiles":["A4","E2"],"andFlag":false,"priority":0,"ja":{"title":"八龍会","text":"Ｙ地区内のタイプＢたちの秘密結社。大陸風にバーロンフゥイ、日本語ではちりゅうかい、英語でドラゴン・クラブとも。\nギャングや市民といった立場の垣根を越えて、多くのタイプＢが所属している。基本的には、立場の弱いタイプＢたちがお互い助け合うための組織であり、ギャングのような表立った戦闘力などは持たないが、結束力が非常に強く、社会のあちこちに潜んでいるため、最大組織ＹＳであっても容易に手を出すことが出来ない。\nＹ地区で唯一組織として麻薬を扱うことを許され、その利益を独占している。\n住宅地に住む三人の老人がリーダーを務めている。彼らは非常に老獪で、ギャングの多くはこの組織を八龍会とは言わずに『老人たち』と顔を顰めて口にする。"},"en":{"title":"Eight Dragons Society","text":"A secret society for Type Bs in Y District. It is also called Ba Long Hui in mainland usage, Hachiryukai in Japanese, and the Dragon Club in English.\nMany Type Bs belong to it regardless of whether they are gangsters or ordinary citizens. It is fundamentally an organization through which vulnerable Type Bs help one another. Though it possesses no overt combat strength comparable to a gang, its members are fiercely united and embedded throughout society, making intervention difficult even for YS.\nIt is the only organization in Y District permitted to deal narcotics and holds a monopoly on the resulting profits.\nIts leaders are three old men living in a residential neighborhood. Their remarkable cunning has led many gangsters to refer to the organization not as the Eight Dragons Society but, with a grimace, as ‘the Elders.’"}},{"id":47,"needFiles":["B6"],"andFlag":false,"priority":1,"ja":{"title":"八龍会","text":"Ｙ地区内のタイプＢたちの秘密結社。大陸風にバーロンフゥイ、日本語ではちりゅうかい、英語でドラゴン・クラブとも。\nギャングや市民といった立場の垣根を越えて、多くのタイプＢが所属している。基本的には、立場の弱いタイプＢたちがお互い助け合うための組織であり、ギャングのような表立った戦闘力などは持たないが、結束力が非常に強く、社会のあちこちに潜んでいるため、最大組織ＹＳであっても容易に手を出すことが出来ない。\nＹ地区で唯一組織として麻薬を扱うことを許され、その利益を独占している。\n住宅地に住む三人の老人がリーダーを務めていたが、見土道夫のクーデターにより、失脚した。"},"en":{"title":"Eight Dragons Society","text":"A secret society for Type Bs in Y District. It is also called Ba Long Hui in mainland usage, Hachiryukai in Japanese, and the Dragon Club in English.\nMany Type Bs belong to it regardless of whether they are gangsters or ordinary citizens. It is fundamentally an organization through which vulnerable Type Bs help one another. Though it possesses no overt combat strength comparable to a gang, its members are fiercely united and embedded throughout society, making intervention difficult even for YS.\nIt is the only organization in Y District permitted to deal narcotics and holds a monopoly on the resulting profits.\nIts former leaders were three old men living in a residential neighborhood, but Michio Mido’s coup removed them from power."}}],"22":[{"id":48,"needFiles":["A2-1","E2"],"andFlag":false,"priority":0,"ja":{"title":"老人たち","text":"八龍会の組織そのもの、あるいはそのリーダーである三人の老人を指す時に使われる言葉。ここでは後者について記す。\n三人はそれぞれミスター・チェン、ミスター・スミス、ミスター・アーノルドと呼ばれており、フルネームは明らかにされておらず、これが本名かどうかも非常に疑わしいようである。外見は、肌の色や顔の特徴から、モンゴロイド、コーカソイド、ネグロイドのように見えるが、その出身地などは一切不明である。\nＹ地区がまだ発展する前から街に住んで困窮するタイプＢのために慈善活動を行っており、やがて仲間が増えて、それが八龍会になったと言われている。つまり、この三人が八龍会の創始者である。\n現在もタイプＢの人々のために働いており、見土道夫も親を亡くしたあと彼らの世話になった。\n多くのタイプＢから慕われており、タイプＢの多いこの街では、あるいはＹＳの龍頭以上の力があるのではないかと囁かれている。"},"en":{"title":"The Elders","text":"A term used for either the Eight Dragons Society itself or the three old men who lead it. This entry concerns the latter.\nThe men are known individually as Mr. Chen, Mr. Smith, and Mr. Arnold. Their full names have never been revealed, and even these names are highly unlikely to be genuine. Their skin color and facial features make them appear respectively Mongoloid, Caucasoid, and Negroid, but nothing is known of their origins.\nBefore Y District began to develop, they performed charitable work for impoverished Type Bs in the city. Their circle of associates eventually grew into the Eight Dragons Society, making the three men its founders.\nThey continue to work on behalf of Type Bs, and cared for Michio Mido after he lost his parents.\nThey are beloved by many Type Bs. In a city with such a large Type B population, some whisper that they may wield even greater power than the Longtou of YS."}},{"id":49,"needFiles":["B6"],"andFlag":false,"priority":1,"ja":{"title":"老人たち","text":"八龍会の組織そのもの、あるいはそのリーダーである三人の老人を指す時に使われる言葉。ここでは後者について記す。\n三人はそれぞれミスター・チェン、ミスター・スミス、ミスター・アーノルドと呼ばれており、フルネームは明らかにされておらず、これが本名かどうかも非常に疑わしいようである。外見は、肌の色や顔の特徴から、モンゴロイド、コーカソイド、ネグロイドのように見えるが、その出身地などは一切不明である。\nＹ地区がまだ発展する前から街に住んで困窮するタイプＢのために慈善活動を行っており、やがて仲間が増えて、それが八龍会になったと言われている。つまり、この三人が八龍会の創始者である。\nしかし、実は彼らはタイプＢではなくノーマルであった。その事実を見土道夫に突きつけられ、八龍会の指導者の地位を彼に奪われる。"},"en":{"title":"The Elders","text":"A term used for either the Eight Dragons Society itself or the three old men who lead it. This entry concerns the latter.\nThe men are known individually as Mr. Chen, Mr. Smith, and Mr. Arnold. Their full names have never been revealed, and even these names are highly unlikely to be genuine. Their skin color and facial features make them appear respectively Mongoloid, Caucasoid, and Negroid, but nothing is known of their origins.\nBefore Y District began to develop, they performed charitable work for impoverished Type Bs in the city. Their circle of associates eventually grew into the Eight Dragons Society, making the three men its founders.\nIn truth, however, they were Normals rather than Type Bs. Michio Mido confronted them with this fact and seized their positions as leaders of the Eight Dragons Society."}},{"id":50,"needFiles":["X16"],"andFlag":false,"priority":2,"ja":{"title":"老人たち","text":"八龍会の組織そのもの、あるいはそのリーダーである三人の老人を指す時に使われる言葉。ここでは後者について記す。\n三人はそれぞれミスター・チェン、ミスター・スミス、ミスター・アーノルドと呼ばれており、フルネームは明らかにされておらず、これが本名かどうかも非常に疑わしいようである。外見は、肌の色や顔の特徴から、モンゴロイド、コーカソイド、ネグロイドのように見えるが、その出身地などは一切不明である。\nＹ地区がまだ発展する前から街に住んで困窮するタイプＢのために慈善活動を行っており、やがて仲間が増えて、それが八龍会になったと言われている。つまり、この三人が八龍会の創始者である。\n一時は見土道夫の八龍解放軍により指導者の座を追われたが、後にＹＳ三代目龍頭謝亮と手を組み、地位を回復する。"},"en":{"title":"The Elders","text":"A term used for either the Eight Dragons Society itself or the three old men who lead it. This entry concerns the latter.\nThe men are known individually as Mr. Chen, Mr. Smith, and Mr. Arnold. Their full names have never been revealed, and even these names are highly unlikely to be genuine. Their skin color and facial features make them appear respectively Mongoloid, Caucasoid, and Negroid, but nothing is known of their origins.\nBefore Y District began to develop, they performed charitable work for impoverished Type Bs in the city. Their circle of associates eventually grew into the Eight Dragons Society, making the three men its founders.\nMichio Mido’s Hachiryu Liberation Army temporarily removed them from power, but they later allied with Tse Leung, YS’s third Longtou, and regained their positions."}}],"23":[{"id":51,"needFiles":["x1"],"andFlag":false,"priority":0,"ja":{"title":"エリオット","text":"廖志明のボディーガード。\n白人のように見えるが、詳細は不明。\nＹ地区で最も銃の扱いに長けたタイプＢとして知られている。\nその経歴は謎に包まれている。"},"en":{"title":"Elliott","text":"Liao Chi-ming’s bodyguard.\nHe appears to be white, but no details are known.\nHe is reputed to be the most skilled Type B gunman in Y District.\nHis background is shrouded in mystery."}},{"id":52,"needFiles":["B4-1"],"andFlag":false,"priority":1,"ja":{"title":"エリオット","text":"かつてはアメリカ海兵隊に所属しており、その後はタイプＢの解放を訴える過激派組織『ブラッド』にて軍事教官を務めていた。\nＹ地区に来てからは廖志明のボディーガードをしていたが、彼の失脚後は誰にも仕えず自由に暮らしており、街の酒場でよくその姿を目撃されている。\nＹ地区で最も銃の扱いに長けたタイプＢとして知られている。"},"en":{"title":"Elliott","text":"Formerly a member of the United States Marine Corps, he later served as a military instructor for Blood, an extremist organization advocating the liberation of Type Bs.\nAfter coming to Y District, he worked as Liao Chi-ming’s bodyguard. Following Liao’s fall from power, he chose to serve no one and now lives freely. He is often seen in the city’s bars.\nHe is reputed to be the most skilled Type B gunman in Y District."}},{"id":53,"needFiles":["X15-2"],"andFlag":false,"priority":2,"ja":{"title":"エリオット","text":"かつてはアメリカ海兵隊に所属しており、その後はタイプＢの解放を訴える過激派組織『ブラッド』にて軍事教官を務めていた。\nＹ地区に来てからは廖志明のボディーガードをしていたが、彼の失脚後は誰にも仕えず自由に暮らしていた。\n内田広美に請われ、彼女の復讐計画に協力。\n広美が見土道夫暗殺を果たしたあと、彼女と共に姿を消す。"},"en":{"title":"Elliott","text":"Formerly a member of the United States Marine Corps, he later served as a military instructor for Blood, an extremist organization advocating the liberation of Type Bs.\nAfter coming to Y District, he worked as Liao Chi-ming’s bodyguard. Following Liao’s fall from power, he chose to serve no one and lived freely.\nAt Hiromi Uchida’s request, he assisted with her plan for revenge.\nAfter Hiromi assassinated Michio Mido, the two disappeared together."}}],"24":[{"id":54,"needFiles":["x1"],"andFlag":false,"priority":0,"ja":{"title":"馬美美","text":"ＹＳ幹部である馬明の娘。馬世傑は兄。\n両親同士が義兄弟ということで、同い年の謝亮とは幼い頃から家族同然に育った。高校を卒業した後、街を出て普通の生活を望むも、結局街に戻ってくる。\nその後、父が所有する飲食店の手伝いを行っていたが、そこで知り合った一般人と結婚する。"},"en":{"title":"Ma Meimei","text":"Daughter of YS executive Ma Ming and younger sister of Ma Sai-kit.\nBecause their fathers were sworn brothers, she and Tse Leung, who is the same age, grew up together like family. After graduating from high school, she left the city in search of an ordinary life, but ultimately returned.\nShe later helped at one of her father’s restaurants, where she met and married an ordinary civilian."}},{"id":55,"needFiles":["A6"],"andFlag":false,"priority":1,"ja":{"title":"馬美美","text":"ＹＳ幹部である馬明の娘。馬世傑は兄。\n両親同士が義兄弟ということで、同い年の謝亮とは幼い頃から家族同然に育った。\n馬明がＹＳ三代目龍頭謝亮と、兄世傑によって処刑されたと聞き、彼らに対する呪いの言葉を残して自殺する。\n享年２１才。"},"en":{"title":"Ma Meimei","text":"Daughter of YS executive Ma Ming and younger sister of Ma Sai-kit.\nBecause their fathers were sworn brothers, she and Tse Leung, who was the same age, grew up together like family.\nAfter learning that Ma Ming had been executed by YS’s third Longtou, Tse Leung, and by her brother Sai-kit, she cursed them and took her own life.\nAge at death: 21."}}],"25":[{"id":56,"needFiles":["x1"],"andFlag":false,"priority":0,"ja":{"title":"馬世傑","text":"ＹＳ幹部馬明の長男。\n少年時代から空手や格闘技の大会で活躍をし、武術の才能を示す。\n父の馬明とは折り合いが悪い。\nＹＳでは若き紅棍として活躍をしていたが、現在は女性トラブルを起こして街から出ている。"},"en":{"title":"Ma Sai-kit","text":"Eldest son of YS executive Ma Ming.\nHe demonstrated a talent for martial arts from boyhood, excelling in karate and combat-sport tournaments.\nHe has a poor relationship with his father.\nHe was an active young Red Pole in YS, but currently lives outside the city after becoming involved in a dispute over a woman."}},{"id":57,"needFiles":["A4"],"andFlag":false,"priority":1,"ja":{"title":"馬世傑","text":"ＹＳ幹部馬明の長男。\n少年時代から空手や格闘技の大会で活躍をし、武術の才能を示す。\n父の馬明とは折り合いが悪い。\n女性トラブルによって街の外で生活をしていたが、その能力を評価する謝亮に呼び戻され、ＹＳに復帰。\n双花紅棍となり、彼の活動をサポートする。"},"en":{"title":"Ma Sai-kit","text":"Eldest son of YS executive Ma Ming.\nHe demonstrated a talent for martial arts from boyhood, excelling in karate and combat-sport tournaments.\nHe has a poor relationship with his father.\nHe had been living outside the city following a dispute over a woman, but Tse Leung recognized his ability, summoned him back, and restored him to YS.\nAs a Double Flower Red Pole, he supports Tse Leung’s activities."}},{"id":58,"needFiles":["X17"],"andFlag":false,"priority":2,"ja":{"title":"馬世傑","text":"ＹＳ幹部馬明の長男。\n少年時代から空手や格闘技の大会で活躍をし、武術の才能を示す。\n父の馬明とは折り合いが悪い。\n女性トラブルによって街の外で生活をしていたが、その能力を評価する謝亮に呼び戻され、ＹＳに復帰。\n双花紅棍となり、彼の活動をサポートする。\n長らく謝亮の片腕として忠実に働いていたが、彼の死後、多数の部下を引き連れてＹＳから離脱する。\nＹＳ最大級の功労者として充分な待遇を受けていた彼がなぜそのようなことをしたのか、一切が謎に包まれている。\n現在のＹ地区は、この馬世傑の勢力、トーマス・リャオ率いるＹＳ、アンドリュー・マオの新義勝、これらが三つ巴となり、熾烈な争いを繰り広げている。"},"en":{"title":"Ma Sai-kit","text":"Eldest son of YS executive Ma Ming.\nHe demonstrated a talent for martial arts from boyhood, excelling in karate and combat-sport tournaments.\nHe has a poor relationship with his father.\nHe had been living outside the city following a dispute over a woman, but Tse Leung recognized his ability, summoned him back, and restored him to YS.\nAs a Double Flower Red Pole, he supported Tse Leung’s activities.\nAfter serving loyally as Tse Leung’s right-hand man for many years, he left YS with numerous subordinates following Leung’s death.\nWhy a man who had received ample rewards as one of YS’s greatest contributors would act in this way remains entirely unknown.\nY District is now the site of a fierce three-way struggle between Ma Sai-kit’s forces, YS under Thomas Liao, and Andrew Mao’s New Yisheng."}}],"26":[{"id":59,"needFiles":["A2-1"],"andFlag":false,"priority":0,"ja":{"title":"劉建志","text":"ＹＳの幹部。\nこの辺りで最も危険な地域と言われている溝平B団地出身。日本で生まれ育ったため、大陸風の名前だが日本語読みしかしない。\nタイプＡであり、特質変異を隠すためにいつも仮面をしている。銃や火薬を触れずとも任意に暴発させるという強力なサイキック能力を持っている。\n少年時代から殺人や暴力などの犯罪に明け暮れていたが、ＹＳに入りクリス・ツェーに出会うと、その忠実な部下となり、ＹＳ香港派の切り込み隊長として幾多の暴力事件で活躍する。\nクリス・ツェー個人に対して、崇拝に近い敬意を寄せている。\n不良少年時代は「Ｙ地区の狂犬」と呼ばれ、ＹＳに入ってからは「龍頭の猟犬」という異名で知られている。\n十代の時に生ませた一人娘がいる。"},"en":{"title":"Ryu Kenshi","text":"A YS executive.\nHe comes from Mizohira B Housing Complex, said to be the most dangerous area nearby. Though his name has a continental Chinese form, he was born and raised in Japan and uses only its Japanese reading.\nHe is a Type A and always wears a mask to conceal his trait mutation. His powerful psychic ability allows him to make guns and explosives go off at will without touching them.\nHe spent his boyhood immersed in murder, violence, and other crimes. After joining YS and meeting Chris Tse, he became Chris’s loyal subordinate and served as the Hong Kong Faction’s spearhead in numerous violent incidents.\nHis respect for Chris Tse personally borders on worship.\nAs a delinquent, he was called the ‘Mad Dog of Y District.’ After joining YS, he became known as the ‘Longtou’s Hound.’\nHe has one daughter, born while he was in his teens."}},{"id":60,"needFiles":["A4"],"andFlag":false,"priority":1,"ja":{"title":"劉建志","text":"ＹＳの幹部。\nこの辺りで最も危険な地域と言われている溝平B団地出身。日本で生まれ育ったため、大陸風の名前だが日本語読みしかしない。\nタイプＡであり、特質変異を隠すためにいつも仮面をしている。銃や火薬を触れずとも任意に暴発させるという強力なサイキック能力を持っている。\n少年時代から殺人や暴力などの犯罪に明け暮れていたが、ＹＳに入りクリス・ツェーに出会うと、その忠実な部下となり、ＹＳ香港派の切り込み隊長として幾多の暴力事件で活躍する。\nクリス・ツェー個人に対して、崇拝に近い敬意を寄せており、クリスの死後、素行が荒れ、あちこちで問題を引き起こしている。\nそして、「義勝の掟を破った」かどでYＳ執行部によって処刑される。実行者は劉が崇拝していたクリス・ツェーの息子である謝亮だった。\nその時一緒に居た一人娘も殺害され、劉家は途絶える。\n享年３２才。"},"en":{"title":"Ryu Kenshi","text":"A YS executive.\nHe came from Mizohira B Housing Complex, said to be the most dangerous area nearby. Though his name had a continental Chinese form, he was born and raised in Japan and used only its Japanese reading.\nHe was a Type A and always wore a mask to conceal his trait mutation. His powerful psychic ability allowed him to make guns and explosives go off at will without touching them.\nHe spent his boyhood immersed in murder, violence, and other crimes. After joining YS and meeting Chris Tse, he became Chris’s loyal subordinate and served as the Hong Kong Faction’s spearhead in numerous violent incidents.\nHis respect for Chris Tse personally bordered on worship. After Chris’s death, his behavior deteriorated and he caused trouble throughout the city.\nThe YS leadership eventually executed him for ‘breaking the laws of Yisheng.’ The executioner was Tse Leung, son of the man Kenshi had worshiped.\nHis only daughter, who was with him at the time, was also killed, ending the Ryu family line.\nAge at death: 32."}}],"27":[{"id":61,"needFiles":["A2-1"],"andFlag":false,"priority":0,"ja":{"title":"廖志明","text":"ＹＳ発足時からの最高幹部にして、廖ファミリーのボス。\nかつてはアメリカ人女性と結婚をしていたが、離婚をして現在は独身。前妻との間に生まれた息子はトーマス・リャオ。\n廖ファミリーはＹＳのなかでも最大級の勢力を持つファミリーであり、特に経済力が高い。\n彼自身も統率力と智力に優れた優秀なリーダーとして内外から評価されている。\n龍頭のクリス・ツェーより年上ということもあり、組織内でも彼の発言力は強い。"},"en":{"title":"Liao Chi-ming","text":"A senior executive of YS since its founding and boss of the Liao Family.\nHe was once married to an American woman but is now divorced and single. Their son is Thomas Liao.\nThe Liao Family is one of YS’s largest factions and possesses exceptional financial power.\nLiao himself is widely regarded within and outside the organization as an excellent leader with outstanding intelligence and command ability.\nBecause he is older than Longtou Chris Tse, his voice carries considerable weight within the organization."}},{"id":62,"needFiles":["X3-2"],"andFlag":false,"priority":1,"ja":{"title":"廖志明","text":"ＹＳ発足時からの最高幹部にして、廖ファミリーのボス。\nかつてはアメリカ人女性と結婚をしていたが、離婚をして現在は独身。前妻との間に生まれた息子はトーマス・リャオ。\n廖ファミリーはＹＳのなかでも最大級の勢力を持つファミリーであり、特に経済力が高い。\n彼自身も統率力と智力に優れた優秀なリーダーとして内外から評価されている。\nクリス・ツェーの死後、謀略を巡らしＹＳのリーダーになろうと画策するが、謝亮に阻まれる。\nその後、謝亮によって隠居という形をとらされ、組織をトーマスに譲り、本人はＹ地区外に追放される。"},"en":{"title":"Liao Chi-ming","text":"A senior executive of YS since its founding and boss of the Liao Family.\nHe was once married to an American woman but is now divorced and single. Their son is Thomas Liao.\nThe Liao Family is one of YS’s largest factions and possesses exceptional financial power.\nLiao himself is widely regarded within and outside the organization as an excellent leader with outstanding intelligence and command ability.\nAfter Chris Tse’s death, he employed a series of schemes in an attempt to take control of YS, but Tse Leung thwarted him.\nLeung subsequently forced him into retirement. Liao ceded control of the Liao Family to Thomas and was banished from Y District."}},{"id":63,"needFiles":["X17"],"andFlag":false,"priority":2,"ja":{"title":"廖志明","text":"ＹＳ発足時からの最高幹部にして、廖ファミリーのボス。\nかつてはアメリカ人女性と結婚をしていたが、離婚をして現在は独身。前妻との間に生まれた息子はトーマス・リャオ。\n廖ファミリーはＹＳのなかでも最大級の勢力を持つファミリーであり、特に経済力が高い。\n彼自身も統率力と智力に優れた優秀なリーダーとして内外から評価されている。\nクリス・ツェーの死後、謀略を巡らしＹＳのリーダーになろうと画策するが、謝亮に阻まれる。\nその後、謝亮によって隠居という形をとらされ、組織をトーマスに譲り、本人はＹ地区外に追放されていたが、現在は街に戻り、積極的に息子のサポートをしている。老いてなお盛んで、往年と変わらぬ辣腕をふるっている。\n精力も衰えていないようで、復帰時には新しい息子と娘を伴っていた。"},"en":{"title":"Liao Chi-ming","text":"A senior executive of YS since its founding and boss of the Liao Family.\nHe was once married to an American woman but is now divorced and single. Their son is Thomas Liao.\nThe Liao Family is one of YS’s largest factions and possesses exceptional financial power.\nLiao himself is widely regarded within and outside the organization as an excellent leader with outstanding intelligence and command ability.\nAfter Chris Tse’s death, he employed a series of schemes in an attempt to take control of YS, but Tse Leung thwarted him.\nLeung subsequently forced him into retirement. Liao ceded control of the Liao Family to Thomas and was banished from Y District. He has now returned to the city and actively supports his son. Despite his age, he remains vigorous and exercises the same formidable skill as ever.\nHis vitality likewise appears undiminished: when he returned, he brought a new son and daughter with him."}}],"28":[{"id":64,"needFiles":["A2-1"],"andFlag":false,"priority":0,"ja":{"title":"トーマス・リャオ","text":"ＹＳ幹部である廖志明の一人息子。\n母親は白人であり、生まれながらに明るい髪と瞳を持った、少しぽっちゃりとした青年。\n両親の離婚の際に一旦アメリカに行ったが、その後廖志明に呼び出されてY地区に戻ってきた。\n両親に溺愛されて何不自由なく育っており、おっとりとした性格。\n謝亮やフェルナンデス家の娘たちのようなＹＳ幹部の子息たちと同年代で、交流があり、彼らからはトミーと呼ばれている。\nボディガードのアイスを常に伴い、彼女を信頼している。"},"en":{"title":"Thomas Liao","text":"The only son of YS executive Liao Chi-ming.\nHis mother is white, and he is a slightly plump young man with naturally light hair and eyes.\nHe moved to the United States when his parents divorced, but later returned to Y District at Liao Chi-ming’s summons.\nIndulged by both parents and raised without hardship, he has a gentle, easygoing personality.\nHe is the same age as other children of YS executives, including Tse Leung and the Fernandes sisters, and has socialized with them since childhood. They call him Tommy.\nHe is always accompanied by his bodyguard, Ice, whom he trusts."}},{"id":65,"needFiles":["X3-2"],"andFlag":false,"priority":1,"ja":{"title":"トーマス・リャオ","text":"ＹＳ幹部。\n母親は白人であり、生まれながらに明るい髪と瞳を持った、少しぽっちゃりとした青年。\n両親の離婚の際に一旦アメリカに行ったが、その後父の廖志明に呼び出されてY地区に戻ってきた。\n両親に溺愛されて何不自由なく育っており、おっとりとした性格。\n謝亮やフェルナンデス家の娘たちのようなＹＳ幹部の子息たちと同年代で、交流があり、彼らからはトミーと呼ばれている。\n父の廖志明失脚後、ＹＳ執行部の下に組み込まれた廖ファミリーのリーダーになる。"},"en":{"title":"Thomas Liao","text":"A YS executive.\nHis mother is white, and he is a slightly plump young man with naturally light hair and eyes.\nHe moved to the United States when his parents divorced, but later returned to Y District at the summons of his father, Liao Chi-ming.\nIndulged by both parents and raised without hardship, he has a gentle, easygoing personality.\nHe is the same age as other children of YS executives, including Tse Leung and the Fernandes sisters, and has socialized with them since childhood. They call him Tommy.\nAfter Liao Chi-ming’s fall, Thomas became leader of the Liao Family under the authority of YS’s central leadership."}},{"id":66,"needFiles":["X17"],"andFlag":false,"priority":2,"ja":{"title":"トーマス・リャオ","text":"ＹＳ幹部。\n母親は白人であり、生まれながらに明るい髪と瞳を持った、少しぽっちゃりとした青年。\n両親の離婚の際に一旦アメリカに行ったが、その後父の廖志明に呼び出されてY地区に戻ってきた。\n両親に溺愛されて何不自由なく育っており、おっとりとした性格。\n謝亮やフェルナンデス家の娘たちのようなＹＳ幹部の子息たちと同年代で、交流があり、彼らからはトミーと呼ばれている。\n謝亮からの信頼が厚く、彼の指名によって四代龍頭となる。\n現在は、馬世傑、アンドリュー・マオといったかつてＹＳに所属していた実力派のリーダーたちを相手に、弱体化した組織で苦しい戦いを強いられている。"},"en":{"title":"Thomas Liao","text":"A YS executive.\nHis mother is white, and he is a slightly plump young man with naturally light hair and eyes.\nHe moved to the United States when his parents divorced, but later returned to Y District at the summons of his father, Liao Chi-ming.\nIndulged by both parents and raised without hardship, he has a gentle, easygoing personality.\nHe is the same age as other children of YS executives, including Tse Leung and the Fernandes sisters, and has socialized with them since childhood. They call him Tommy.\nTse Leung trusted him deeply and personally designated him the fourth Longtou.\nHe now faces a difficult war with a weakened organization against powerful former YS leaders such as Ma Sai-kit and Andrew Mao."}}],"29":[{"id":67,"needFiles":["A2-2"],"andFlag":false,"priority":0,"ja":{"title":"アイス","text":"トーマス・リャオのボディガード。\nアジア人と思われるが、本名も国籍も不明。\nタイプAのサイキック能力者で、顔には火傷の跡がある。\nほとんど喋らず、常にトーマスのそばに居る。"},"en":{"title":"Ice","text":"Thomas Liao’s bodyguard.\nShe appears to be Asian, but her real name and nationality are unknown.\nShe is a Type A psychic and has burn scars on her face.\nShe rarely speaks and remains constantly at Thomas’s side."}},{"id":68,"needFiles":["X3-2"],"andFlag":false,"priority":1,"ja":{"title":"アイス","text":"トーマス・リャオのボディガード。\n本名は李小玉。Y地区のボーダーエリア出身。\n顔には火傷の跡がある。タイプAのサイキック能力者で、自分の姿を人の目から消すことが出来る。\nその能力を使って窃盗を繰り返していたが、廖ファミリー傘下の貸金業者事務所に盗みに入ったところで捕まってしまう。\nそこで拷問を受け、殺されようとしていたところを、トーマスに救助され、以後彼のボディーガードとなる。\n顔の火傷はその時の拷問時に出来たもの。"},"en":{"title":"Ice","text":"Thomas Liao’s bodyguard.\nHer real name is Li Xiaoyu, and she comes from Y District’s Border Area.\nShe has burn scars on her face. A Type A psychic, she can conceal herself from human sight.\nShe repeatedly used this ability to commit theft, but was caught after breaking into the office of a moneylender under the Liao Family.\nShe was tortured and about to be killed when Thomas rescued her. She has served as his bodyguard ever since.\nThe torture left the burns on her face."}},{"id":69,"needFiles":["X17"],"andFlag":false,"priority":2,"ja":{"title":"アイス","text":"トーマス・リャオのボディガード。\n本名は李小玉。Y地区のボーダーエリア出身。\n顔には火傷の跡がある。タイプAのサイキック能力者で、自分の姿を人の目から消すことが出来る。\nその能力を使って窃盗を繰り返していたが、廖ファミリー傘下の貸金業者事務所に盗みに入ったところで捕まってしまう。\nそこで拷問を受け、殺されようとしていたところを、トーマスに救助され、以後彼のボディーガードとなる。\n顔の火傷はその時の拷問時に出来たもの。\n現在はＹＳ四代龍頭となったトーマス・リャオの夫人となり、彼を公私にわたってサポートしている。"},"en":{"title":"Ice","text":"Thomas Liao’s bodyguard.\nHer real name is Li Xiaoyu, and she comes from Y District’s Border Area.\nShe has burn scars on her face. A Type A psychic, she can conceal herself from human sight.\nShe repeatedly used this ability to commit theft, but was caught after breaking into the office of a moneylender under the Liao Family.\nShe was tortured and about to be killed when Thomas rescued her. She has served as his bodyguard ever since.\nThe torture left the burns on her face.\nShe is now the wife of Thomas Liao, YS’s fourth Longtou, and supports him in both his public and private life."}}],"30":[{"id":70,"needFiles":["A3"],"andFlag":false,"priority":0,"ja":{"title":"レイレイ","text":"病気で弱ったクリス・ツェーの身のまわりの世話をするアジア系の少女。\n暗闇通りで餓死しかけていたところを、クリスに拾われてグランドタワーで働くようになったようだ。"},"en":{"title":"Leilei","text":"A young Asian girl who attends to the ailing Chris Tse.\nChris apparently found her near starvation on Darkness Street and gave her work in Grand Tower."}},{"id":71,"needFiles":["X3-2"],"andFlag":false,"priority":1,"ja":{"title":"レイレイ","text":"グランドタワーで龍頭の身のまわりの世話をするアジア系の少女。\n暗闇通りで餓死しかけていたところを、クリス・ツェーに拾われてグランドタワーで働くようになったようだ。\nクリスが死亡した後も引き続きＹＳで働き、現在は謝亮に仕えている。"},"en":{"title":"Leilei","text":"A young Asian girl who attends to the Longtou in Grand Tower.\nChris Tse apparently found her near starvation on Darkness Street and gave her work in Grand Tower.\nShe remained with YS after Chris’s death and now serves Tse Leung."}},{"id":72,"needFiles":["X17"],"andFlag":false,"priority":2,"ja":{"title":"レイレイ","text":"グランドタワーで龍頭の身のまわりの世話をするアジア系の少女。\n暗闇通りで餓死しかけていたところを、クリス・ツェーに拾われてグランドタワーで働くようになったようだ。\nクリスが死亡した後も引き続きＹＳで働き、現在は謝亮に仕えている。\n謝亮死亡後は、Ｙ地区内の飲食店で働いているらしい。"},"en":{"title":"Leilei","text":"A young Asian girl who attends to the Longtou in Grand Tower.\nChris Tse apparently found her near starvation on Darkness Street and gave her work in Grand Tower.\nShe remained with YS after Chris’s death and served Tse Leung.\nFollowing Leung’s death, she apparently found work at a restaurant in Y District."}}],"31":[{"id":73,"needFiles":["A2-1"],"andFlag":false,"priority":0,"ja":{"title":"エリー・ホワイト","text":"ＹＳ発足時からの幹部。\nＹＳの幹部たちは元々自分のファミリーを持つギャングばかりであったが、彼女は武器商人である。\n独自のルートで様々な物品を調達し、販売している。\nＹＳに協力してはいるが、顧客はＹＳのみならず、様々な相手に様々な物品を販売している。\n常にヴェールで顔を隠した正体不明の女性である。"},"en":{"title":"Ellie White","text":"A YS executive since the organization’s founding.\nWhile the other executives were gangsters who already commanded families of their own, she is an arms dealer.\nShe obtains and sells a wide variety of goods through independent channels.\nThough she cooperates with YS, her clientele is not limited to the organization, and she sells many kinds of goods to many different parties.\nHer identity is unknown, and she always conceals her face behind a veil."}},{"id":74,"needFiles":["X7"],"andFlag":false,"priority":1,"ja":{"title":"エリー・ホワイト","text":"ＹＳ発足時からの幹部にして武器商人。\nその正体は、ローズ・クラブで働いていた少女アサヒ。\n太刀川に救出された後、先代エリー・ホワイトのもとに預けられベルーハと名付けられる。その後、先代が死亡するとそのあとを継ぎ、『エリー・ホワイト』として稼業を取り仕切る。\nローズ・クラブ時代にタイプＢ化させられ、不死の肉体となる。"},"en":{"title":"Ellie White","text":"An arms dealer and YS executive since the organization’s founding.\nHer true identity is Asahi, a girl who worked at the Rose Club.\nAfter Tachikawa rescued her, she was entrusted to the previous Ellie White, who named her Belukha. When her predecessor died, she inherited the business and began managing it as ‘Ellie White.’\nShe was turned into a Type B during her time at the Rose Club, acquiring an immortal body."}},{"id":75,"needFiles":["X17"],"andFlag":false,"priority":2,"ja":{"title":"エリー・ホワイト","text":"ＹＳ発足時からの幹部にして武器商人。\nその正体は、ローズ・クラブで働いていた少女アサヒ。\n太刀川に救出された後、先代エリー・ホワイトのもとに預けられベルーハと名付けられる。その後、先代が死亡するとそのあとを継ぎ、『エリー・ホワイト』として稼業を取り仕切る。\nローズ・クラブ時代にタイプＢ化させられ、不死の肉体となる。\n謝亮暗殺事件の後はＹＳを脱退し、稼業である武器商人もやめ、ベルーハに名を戻して児童施設の経営を始める。\nその施設では、職員に混じって彼女自身が子供の世話をする姿がよく見られる。"},"en":{"title":"Ellie White","text":"An arms dealer and YS executive since the organization’s founding.\nHer true identity is Asahi, a girl who worked at the Rose Club.\nAfter Tachikawa rescued her, she was entrusted to the previous Ellie White, who named her Belukha. When her predecessor died, she inherited the business and began managing it as ‘Ellie White.’\nShe was turned into a Type B during her time at the Rose Club, acquiring an immortal body.\nAfter the attack intended to assassinate Tse Leung, she left YS, abandoned the arms trade, reclaimed the name Belukha, and began operating a children’s home.\nShe is often seen caring for the children alongside the facility’s staff."}}],"32":[{"id":76,"needFiles":["C2"],"andFlag":false,"priority":0,"ja":{"title":"アサヒ","text":"ローズ・クラブで働く娼婦の少女。\n客から逃げようとしていたところを太刀川良馬と遭遇し、彼に救出される。"},"en":{"title":"Asahi","text":"A young prostitute working at the Rose Club.\nShe encountered Ryoma Tachikawa while trying to escape from a client, and he rescued her."}},{"id":183,"needFiles":["X17"],"andFlag":false,"priority":1,"ja":{"title":"アサヒ","text":"客から逃げようとしていたところを太刀川良馬と遭遇し、彼に救出される。その後数奇な運命を辿り、現在は「ベルーハ」として、かつての彼女自身のような身寄りのない子供たちの世話をしている。"},"en":{"title":"Asahi","text":"She encountered Ryoma Tachikawa while trying to escape from a client, and he rescued her. After a strange turn of fate, she now lives as Belukha and cares for children without families, much like the girl she once was."}}],"33":[{"id":77,"needFiles":["A2-1"],"andFlag":false,"priority":0,"ja":{"title":"壬生屋タカシ","text":"ＹＳの幹部。\n暗闇通りを支配する『売春王』壬生屋家の二代目。\n壬生屋家は元々売春宿を経営する商売人でしかなかったが、彼の代になってギャングとなり、暗闇通りの一角を支配している。\n軽薄そうな見た目に関わらず、商売のやりかたはまっとうで、娼婦の労働環境を改善したり、客に対して不当な高額請求をする経営者を追放した。\n強引なやり口で非常に評判が悪かった先代の頃に比べて、暗闇通りの関係者の間での評価は高い。\n同じ暗闇通りを根城とするダリオ・ボネットと先代太一は犬猿のなかであったが、彼は関係を改善した。"},"en":{"title":"Takashi Mibuya","text":"A YS executive.\nHe is the second-generation head of the Mibuya family, the ‘Kings of Prostitution’ who control Darkness Street.\nThe Mibuya family originally consisted of ordinary businessmen operating brothels. Under his leadership, it became a gang and took control of part of Darkness Street.\nDespite his frivolous appearance, he conducts business honestly. He has improved prostitutes’ working conditions and expelled operators who subjected customers to unjustified exorbitant charges.\nHis reputation among those working on Darkness Street is far better than that of his heavy-handed and widely disliked predecessor.\nDario Bonetto and the previous head, Taichi, were bitter enemies despite sharing Darkness Street as their base, but Takashi improved their relationship."}},{"id":78,"needFiles":["X17"],"andFlag":false,"priority":1,"ja":{"title":"壬生屋タカシ","text":"ＹＳの幹部。\n暗闇通りを支配する『売春王』壬生屋家の二代目。\n壬生屋家は元々売春宿を経営する商売人でしかなかったが、彼の代になってギャングとなり、暗闇通りの一角を支配している。\n軽薄そうな見た目に関わらず、商売のやりかたはまっとうで、娼婦の労働環境を改善したり、客に対して不当な高額請求をする経営者を追放した。\n強引なやり口で非常に評判が悪かった先代の頃に比べて、暗闇通りの関係者の間での評価は高い。\n度重なるＹＳの分裂騒動の際も組織に残り、その後も敵対組織との抗争で意外な能力を発揮し、活躍している。\n現在は龍頭であるトーマス・リャオに最も信頼される幹部の一人となっている。"},"en":{"title":"Takashi Mibuya","text":"A YS executive.\nHe is the second-generation head of the Mibuya family, the ‘Kings of Prostitution’ who control Darkness Street.\nThe Mibuya family originally consisted of ordinary businessmen operating brothels. Under his leadership, it became a gang and took control of part of Darkness Street.\nDespite his frivolous appearance, he conducts business honestly. He has improved prostitutes’ working conditions and expelled operators who subjected customers to unjustified exorbitant charges.\nHis reputation among those working on Darkness Street is far better than that of his heavy-handed and widely disliked predecessor.\nHe remained with YS throughout its repeated schisms and subsequently displayed unexpected ability in conflicts with rival organizations.\nHe is now one of the executives most trusted by Longtou Thomas Liao."}}],"34":[{"id":79,"needFiles":["A2-1"],"andFlag":false,"priority":0,"ja":{"title":"ダリオ・ボネット","text":"ＹＳ幹部。\nＹ地区内に多数のカジノを経営し、『カジノ王』あるいは『賭博王』と呼ばれている。\n温厚そうな見た目に反し、数多くの暗殺事件や襲撃事件に関わっていると言われている。\nこのような街でカジノを経営し、負けたものから金を取り立てるためには相応の暴力が必要なのであろう。\n"},"en":{"title":"Dario Bonetto","text":"A YS executive.\nHe operates numerous casinos throughout Y District and is known as the ‘Casino King’ or ‘King of Gambling.’\nDespite his mild appearance, he is rumored to have been involved in numerous assassinations and attacks.\nA certain degree of violence is presumably necessary to operate casinos in a city like this and collect money from those who lose."}},{"id":80,"needFiles":["a8"],"andFlag":false,"priority":1,"ja":{"title":"ダリオ・ボネット","text":"ＹＳ幹部。\nＹ地区内に多数のカジノを経営し、『カジノ王』あるいは『賭博王』と呼ばれている。\n温厚そうな見た目に反し、数多くの暗殺事件や襲撃事件に関わっていると言われている。\nこのような街でカジノを経営し、負けたものから金を取り立てるためには相応の暴力が必要なのであろう。\n三代目龍頭である謝亮に対する暗殺計画が露見し、処刑前に自ら命を絶った。\n享年４８才。"},"en":{"title":"Dario Bonetto","text":"A YS executive.\nHe operated numerous casinos throughout Y District and was known as the ‘Casino King’ or ‘King of Gambling.’\nDespite his mild appearance, he was rumored to have been involved in numerous assassinations and attacks.\nA certain degree of violence was presumably necessary to operate casinos in a city like this and collect money from those who lost.\nAfter his plot to assassinate the third Longtou, Tse Leung, was exposed, he took his own life before he could be executed.\nAge at death: 48."}}],"35":[{"id":81,"needFiles":["A2-1"],"andFlag":false,"priority":0,"ja":{"title":"ジョゼ・フェルナンデス","text":"ＹＳ発足時からの幹部。\n南米人による組織、フェルナンデスファミリーのボス。\nＹ地区が今のように栄える前からの有名なボスである。\n寡黙であまり感情を出さない冷静沈着な男だが、同じくＹＳの有力幹部である廖志明とは相性が悪く、意見の相違が多い。\n三人の娘はいずれも美女であり、フェルナンデス家の三姉妹として有名である。"},"en":{"title":"José Fernandes","text":"A YS executive since the organization’s founding.\nHe is the boss of the Fernandes Family, an organization composed of South Americans.\nHe was already a prominent boss before Y District achieved its present prosperity.\nA quiet and composed man who rarely displays emotion, he has poor chemistry with fellow senior YS executive Liao Chi-ming, and the two frequently disagree.\nHis three daughters are all renowned beauties, famous as the three Fernandes sisters."}},{"id":82,"needFiles":["X8"],"andFlag":false,"priority":1,"ja":{"title":"ジョゼ・フェルナンデス","text":"ＹＳ発足時からの幹部。\n南米人による組織、フェルナンデスファミリーのボス。\nＹ地区が今のように栄える前からの有名なボスである。\n寡黙であまり感情を出さない冷静沈着な男だが、同じくＹＳの有力幹部である廖志明とは相性が悪く、意見の相違が多い。\n三人の娘はいずれも美女であり、フェルナンデス家の三姉妹として有名である。\n盟主クリス・ツェーの死によって、ギャングたちの同盟組織であるＹＳの役割は終わったと考え、ＹＳを離脱する。\nその後、何者かの襲撃により、アウロラ、アナ・クララの二人の娘と共に自宅で殺害される。\n享年５２才。"},"en":{"title":"José Fernandes","text":"A YS executive since the organization’s founding.\nHe was the boss of the Fernandes Family, an organization composed of South Americans.\nHe was already a prominent boss before Y District achieved its present prosperity.\nA quiet and composed man who rarely displayed emotion, he had poor chemistry with fellow senior YS executive Liao Chi-ming, and the two frequently disagreed.\nHis three daughters were all renowned beauties, famous as the three Fernandes sisters.\nAfter the death of their alliance leader, Chris Tse, José concluded that YS had fulfilled its purpose as an alliance of gangs and withdrew from the organization.\nHe and two of his daughters, Aurora and Ana Clara, were later murdered in their home by an unknown attacker.\nAge at death: 52."}}],"36":[{"id":83,"needFiles":["x1"],"andFlag":false,"priority":0,"ja":{"title":"アウロラ・フェルナンデス","text":"ジョゼ・フェルナンデスの娘。\n美女姉妹として有名なフェルナンデス三姉妹の長女。\n派手な性格の社交家であり、数々の浮名を流した。\nヴァイオリン演奏が趣味で、コンクールに出場したこともある。\n遊び人の印象が強い彼女だが、長女らしく親や妹たちといった家族への思いやりは強い。\n謝亮やトーマス・リャオとは子供の頃から交流があり、親しく付き合っている。"},"en":{"title":"Aurora Fernandes","text":"A daughter of José Fernandes.\nShe is the eldest of the three Fernandes sisters, renowned for their beauty.\nA flamboyant socialite, she has been involved in numerous romances.\nShe enjoys playing the violin and has even entered competitions.\nDespite her strong reputation as a pleasure seeker, she displays an eldest daughter’s deep concern for her parents and younger sisters.\nShe has known Tse Leung and Thomas Liao since childhood and remains close to them."}},{"id":84,"needFiles":["X8"],"andFlag":false,"priority":1,"ja":{"title":"アウロラ・フェルナンデス","text":"ジョゼ・フェルナンデスの娘。\n美女姉妹として有名なフェルナンデス三姉妹の長女。\n派手な性格の社交家であり、数々の浮名を流した。\nヴァイオリン演奏が趣味で、コンクールに出場したこともある。\n遊び人の印象が強い彼女だが、長女らしく親や妹たちといった家族への思いやりは強い。\n自宅で襲撃を受け、父ジョゼ、妹アナ・クララと共にむごたらしく殺害される。\n享年２４才。"},"en":{"title":"Aurora Fernandes","text":"A daughter of José Fernandes.\nShe was the eldest of the three Fernandes sisters, renowned for their beauty.\nA flamboyant socialite, she had been involved in numerous romances.\nShe enjoyed playing the violin and had even entered competitions.\nDespite her strong reputation as a pleasure seeker, she displayed an eldest daughter’s deep concern for her parents and younger sisters.\nShe was brutally murdered at home alongside her father José and her younger sister Ana Clara.\nAge at death: 24."}}],"37":[{"id":85,"needFiles":["x1"],"andFlag":false,"priority":0,"ja":{"title":"アナ・クララ・フェルナンデス","text":"ジョゼ・フェルナンデスの娘。\n美女姉妹として有名なフェルナンデス三姉妹の次女。\n聡明な皮肉家。姉と違って異性の噂はほとんどなく、それよりも詩作や小説執筆などの創作活動を好んでいる。\nただし、子供の頃に描いて友人たちに見せた少女漫画のことは彼女のなかではなかったことになっているようだ。"},"en":{"title":"Ana Clara Fernandes","text":"A daughter of José Fernandes.\nShe is the second of the three Fernandes sisters, renowned for their beauty.\nIntelligent and sardonic, she has attracted almost none of the romantic gossip surrounding her elder sister. She prefers creative pursuits such as poetry and fiction.\nThe girls’ manga she drew and showed her friends as a child, however, appears to be something she has chosen to erase from her own history."}},{"id":86,"needFiles":["X8"],"andFlag":false,"priority":1,"ja":{"title":"アナ・クララ・フェルナンデス","text":"ジョゼ・フェルナンデスの娘。\n美女姉妹として有名なフェルナンデス三姉妹の次女。\n聡明な皮肉家。姉と違って異性の噂はほとんどなく、それよりも詩作や小説執筆などの創作活動を好んでいる。\nただし、子供の頃に描いて友人たちに見せた少女漫画のことは彼女のなかではなかったことになっているようだ。\n自宅で襲撃を受け、父ジョゼ、姉アウロラと共にむごたらしく殺害される。\n享年２３才。"},"en":{"title":"Ana Clara Fernandes","text":"A daughter of José Fernandes.\nShe was the second of the three Fernandes sisters, renowned for their beauty.\nIntelligent and sardonic, she had attracted almost none of the romantic gossip surrounding her elder sister. She preferred creative pursuits such as poetry and fiction.\nThe girls’ manga she drew and showed her friends as a child, however, appeared to be something she had chosen to erase from her own history.\nShe was brutally murdered at home alongside her father José and her elder sister Aurora.\nAge at death: 23."}}],"38":[{"id":87,"needFiles":["x1"],"andFlag":false,"priority":0,"ja":{"title":"リタ・フェルナンデス","text":"ジョゼ・フェルナンデスの娘。\n美女姉妹として有名なフェルナンデス三姉妹の三女。\n我の強い二人の姉に比べて、控えめでおっとりした性格である。\nフェルナンデス三姉妹のなかでは最も異性に人気があるが、誰の誘いを受けてもそっけなく、強く想う相手がいるらしいと噂されている。"},"en":{"title":"Rita Fernandes","text":"A daughter of José Fernandes.\nShe is the youngest of the three Fernandes sisters, renowned for their beauty.\nCompared with her two strong-willed sisters, she is reserved and gentle.\nShe is the most popular with men of the three, but coldly rejects every invitation. Rumor holds that she already has deep feelings for someone."}},{"id":88,"needFiles":["X9"],"andFlag":false,"priority":1,"ja":{"title":"リタ・フェルナンデス","text":"ジョゼ・フェルナンデスの娘。\n美女姉妹として有名なフェルナンデス三姉妹の三女。\n我の強い二人の姉に比べて、控えめでおっとりした性格である。\nフェルナンデス三姉妹のなかでは最も異性に人気があるが、誰の誘いを受けてもそっけなく、強く想う相手がいるらしいと噂されている。\n元使用人によって父と二人の姉が殺害された後、フェルナンデスファミリーのボスとなる。"},"en":{"title":"Rita Fernandes","text":"A daughter of José Fernandes.\nShe is the youngest of the three Fernandes sisters, renowned for their beauty.\nCompared with her two strong-willed sisters, she is reserved and gentle.\nShe is the most popular with men of the three, but coldly rejects every invitation. Rumor holds that she already has deep feelings for someone.\nAfter a former servant murdered her father and two sisters, she became boss of the Fernandes Family."}},{"id":89,"needFiles":["X19"],"andFlag":false,"priority":2,"ja":{"title":"リタ・フェルナンデス","text":"ジョゼ・フェルナンデスの娘。\n美女姉妹として有名なフェルナンデス三姉妹の三女。\n我の強い二人の姉に比べて、控えめでおっとりした性格である。\n元使用人によって父と二人の姉が殺害された後、フェルナンデスファミリーのボスとなる。\n八龍会との抗争の結果、彼女は殺害され、無惨な亡骸を路上に晒されることになる。結局、彼女は幼い頃からの想いを相手に伝えることなく死んだ。\n享年１９才。"},"en":{"title":"Rita Fernandes","text":"A daughter of José Fernandes.\nShe was the youngest of the three Fernandes sisters, renowned for their beauty.\nCompared with her two strong-willed sisters, she was reserved and gentle.\nAfter a former servant murdered her father and two sisters, she became boss of the Fernandes Family.\nShe was ultimately killed in the conflict with the Eight Dragons Society, and her mutilated remains were displayed in the street. She died without ever expressing the feelings she had harbored since childhood.\nAge at death: 19."}}],"39":[{"id":90,"needFiles":["x1"],"andFlag":false,"priority":0,"ja":{"title":"ジェフリー・ウォン","text":"ＹＳの幹部。\n中国名は黄樹人。\nクリス・ツェー、馬明とは義兄弟。義勝時代から組織を支える香港派の最重要人物の一人。\n天明と天祥というタイプAの二人娘を持つ。"},"en":{"title":"Jeffrey Wong","text":"A YS executive.\nHis Chinese name is Wong Shu-yan.\nHe is a sworn brother of Chris Tse and Ma Ming, and one of the most important figures in the Hong Kong Faction supporting the organization since its Yisheng days.\nHe has two Type A daughters, Tin-ming and Tin-cheung."}},{"id":91,"needFiles":["A5"],"andFlag":false,"priority":1,"ja":{"title":"ジェフリー・ウォン","text":"ＹＳの幹部\n中国名は黄樹人。\nクリス・ツェー、馬明とは義兄弟。義勝時代から組織を支える香港派の最重要人物の一人。\n天明と天祥というタイプAの二人娘を持つ。\nクリス死亡後も、二代目龍頭マイケル・ツェーの補佐として辣腕をふるったが、グランドタワーがサイキックの襲撃を受けた際、命を落とす。\n享年４３才。"},"en":{"title":"Jeffrey Wong","text":"A YS executive.\nHis Chinese name was Wong Shu-yan.\nHe was a sworn brother of Chris Tse and Ma Ming, and one of the most important figures in the Hong Kong Faction supporting the organization since its Yisheng days.\nHe had two Type A daughters, Tin-ming and Tin-cheung.\nAfter Chris’s death, he continued displaying exceptional skill as an adviser to the second Longtou, Michael Tse. He was killed when psychics attacked Grand Tower.\nAge at death: 43."}}],"40":[{"id":92,"needFiles":["A4"],"andFlag":false,"priority":0,"ja":{"title":"黄姉妹","text":"ジェフリー・ウォンの娘。\n姉が黄天明。妹が黄天祥。そっくりな外見をしているが、双子ではなく姉妹。\n二人ともタイプAであり、特質変異として体毛と両目を持たない。目隠しのようなものをしているが、その下は他の部分と変わらぬ皮膚しかない。\nその異形と引き換えに、近くの空間の一定サイズ以上の生命体を感知するという力をもっている。\nそれはレーダーのように機能し、相手がいかに隠れようともその存在を発見する。\nこの能力はＹＳ内のあらゆる場面で活用されている。"},"en":{"title":"Wong Sisters","text":"The daughters of Jeffrey Wong: elder sister Wong Tin-ming and younger sister Wong Tin-cheung. Though nearly identical in appearance, they are sisters rather than twins.\nBoth are Type As whose trait mutation left them without body hair or eyes. They wear what appear to be blindfolds, but beneath them is only unbroken skin like that covering the rest of their bodies.\nIn exchange for this abnormality, they can detect living organisms above a certain size within the surrounding area.\nTheir ability functions like radar, locating others no matter how thoroughly they conceal themselves.\nYS makes use of this power in a wide variety of situations."}}],"41":[{"id":93,"needFiles":["A1"],"andFlag":false,"priority":0,"ja":{"title":"グランドタワー","text":"Ｙ地区で最も大きな建造物。\n地上三十五階という数字はそれほど大したものではないが、他に大きな建物のないＹ地区ではずば抜けた高さを誇り、どこからでもその姿を見ることが出来る。\n元々はタワーマンション兼巨大商業施設として建設されたのだが、都市計画が頓挫したあとは廃墟となり、地域で最大のギャング組織ＹＳが住み着いてそこを本拠地とした。\n現在は周辺に塀などが設けられ、要塞のようになっている。\n最上階はＹＳ最高指導者である龍頭の執務室となっており、まさしく街の支配者として周囲を睥睨している。"},"en":{"title":"Grand Tower","text":"The largest structure in Y District.\nThirty-five stories is not remarkable in itself, but Grand Tower rises far above every other building in the district and is visible from anywhere in the city.\nOriginally constructed as both a residential tower and a vast commercial complex, it became a ruin after the urban development project collapsed. YS, the region’s largest gang organization, occupied the building and made it its headquarters.\nWalls and other defenses now surround it, transforming it into a fortress.\nThe top floor contains the office of YS’s supreme leader, the Longtou, who quite literally looks down upon the surroundings as the city’s ruler."}}],"42":[{"id":94,"needFiles":["A1"],"andFlag":false,"priority":0,"ja":{"title":"タキノ式UB波感知器","text":"別名「サイキック探知機」。最近世界の主要都市で見かけるようになった、消火栓に似た奇妙な機械は、タキノ研究所で開発された超能力発見装置である。\nタイプＡとその恐るべき能力が発見されて以来、社会は常に未知の脅威への不安に晒されていた。\nこの装置はその超自然的な力が行使されたときに発生する微弱な波長を拾い、警報を鳴らすというものだ。\n装置が発明されてすぐに世界中に急速に普及したのは、人類の不安を反映してのものだろう。\nたとえ警報が鳴ったところで、超能力者の悪意に対抗出来るわけでもないのだが、お守りくらいの安心にはなるのだ。"},"en":{"title":"Takino-Model UB-Wave Detector","text":"Also known as a ‘psychic detector.’ The strange fire-hydrant-like machines recently appearing in the world’s major cities are psychic-detection devices developed by the Takino Research Institute.\nEver since Type As and their terrifying abilities were discovered, society has lived under the constant anxiety of an unknown threat.\nThe device detects faint wavelengths produced when supernatural powers are used and sounds an alarm.\nIts rapid worldwide adoption immediately after its invention presumably reflects humanity’s fear.\nAn alarm offers no protection against a malicious psychic, but the device at least provides the reassurance of a talisman."}}],"43":[{"id":95,"needFiles":["E3"],"andFlag":false,"priority":0,"ja":{"title":"Anti-Psychic Tranquilizer Gun、APTG","text":"最近世界中の警察や軍隊で採用された奇妙な形状の銃器は、タキノ研究所が開発した対サイキック用兵器である。\n特殊な薬剤を対象の肉体に注入することで、タイプAの恐るべきサイキック能力を封じるというものだ。その効果は相手の体質によって効いたり効かなかったりするようで、完全な信頼性はない。\nそのため、実際の運用上では、サイキックの頭を吹き飛ばすよりは人道的だが、かわりに確実性でも即効性でも通常の銃器に劣る。しかし、現代社会において人道的であるということは何よりも重要な価値基準の一つであるため、その活躍の場は多い。"},"en":{"title":"Anti-Psychic Tranquilizer Gun (APTG)","text":"The strangely shaped firearm recently adopted by police and armed forces around the world is an anti-psychic weapon developed by the Takino Research Institute.\nIt injects a special drug into the target’s body to suppress the terrifying psychic abilities of a Type A. Its effectiveness varies with the target’s constitution, making it less than completely reliable.\nIn practice, it is more humane than blowing off a psychic’s head, but inferior to conventional firearms in both certainty and speed. Humane treatment is one of modern society’s highest priorities, however, so the weapon sees extensive use."}}],"44":[{"id":96,"needFiles":["A1"],"andFlag":false,"priority":0,"ja":{"title":"謝筱喬","text":"ＹＳの創設者クリス・ツェーの娘。兄は謝亮。\n生まれつきタイプＢであり、心は繊細で、身体が弱い。そのため、父からは大事に育てられていた。\n現在はグランドタワーの高層に住んでおり、滅多に外に出ることはない。\n若くして亡くなった母に続き、父も死病におかされた。身内が次々と死んで行くことに、思い悩んでいる。"},"en":{"title":"Tse Siu-kiu","text":"Daughter of YS founder Chris Tse and younger sister of Tse Leung.\nBorn a Type B, she is sensitive and physically frail. Her father has consequently raised her with great care.\nShe currently lives on an upper floor of Grand Tower and rarely ventures outside.\nFollowing the early death of her mother, her father also contracted a fatal illness. She is deeply troubled by the prospect of losing one family member after another."}},{"id":97,"needFiles":["D3"],"andFlag":false,"priority":1,"ja":{"title":"謝筱喬","text":"ＹＳの創設者クリス・ツェーの娘。兄は謝亮。\n生まれつきタイプＢであり、心は繊細で、身体が弱い。そのため、父からは大事に育てられていた。\n長らく症状が出なかったが、ついに発症してしまう。\nグランドタワーの高層に住んでいたが、熨田さくらと共謀して脱出。\n八龍会の見土道夫の元へ逃れる。"},"en":{"title":"Tse Siu-kiu","text":"Daughter of YS founder Chris Tse and younger sister of Tse Leung.\nBorn a Type B, she is sensitive and physically frail. Her father consequently raised her with great care.\nAfter remaining asymptomatic for many years, her condition finally manifested.\nShe lived on an upper floor of Grand Tower but conspired with Sakura Noshida to escape.\nShe fled to Michio Mido of the Eight Dragons Society."}},{"id":98,"needFiles":["D5"],"andFlag":false,"priority":2,"ja":{"title":"謝筱喬","text":"ＹＳの創設者クリス・ツェーの娘。兄は謝亮。\n生まれつきタイプＢであり、心は繊細で、身体が弱い。そのため、父からは大事に育てられていた。\n長らく症状が出なかったが、ついに発症してしまう。\n長年グランドタワーの高層に住んでいたが、八龍会の見土道夫の元へ逃れる。\n見土の死後は、騒乱に巻き込まれることを避けるという目的で、謝亮の指示により街を出て熨田さくらの実家に避難する。"},"en":{"title":"Tse Siu-kiu","text":"Daughter of YS founder Chris Tse and younger sister of Tse Leung.\nBorn a Type B, she is sensitive and physically frail. Her father consequently raised her with great care.\nAfter remaining asymptomatic for many years, her condition finally manifested.\nShe had lived on an upper floor of Grand Tower for years before fleeing to Michio Mido of the Eight Dragons Society.\nAfter Mido’s death, Tse Leung ordered her to leave the city and take refuge with Sakura Noshida’s family to avoid becoming embroiled in the unrest."}},{"id":99,"needFiles":["X17"],"andFlag":false,"priority":3,"ja":{"title":"謝筱喬","text":"ＹＳの創設者クリス・ツェーの娘。兄は謝亮。\n生まれつきタイプＢであり、心は繊細で、身体が弱い。そのため、父からは大事に育てられていた。\n長らく症状が出なかったが、ついに発症してしまう。\n長年グランドタワーの高層に住んでいたが、八龍会の見土道夫の元へ逃れる。\n見土の死後は、騒乱に巻き込まれることを避けるという目的で、謝亮の指示により街を出て熨田さくらの実家に避難する。\n現在は、家にほとんど戻ってこないさくらの代わりに、彼女の両親に実の娘のように愛されており、近々店を継ぐという話も出ているようだ。"},"en":{"title":"Tse Siu-kiu","text":"Daughter of YS founder Chris Tse and younger sister of Tse Leung.\nBorn a Type B, she is sensitive and physically frail. Her father consequently raised her with great care.\nAfter remaining asymptomatic for many years, her condition finally manifested.\nShe had lived on an upper floor of Grand Tower for years before fleeing to Michio Mido of the Eight Dragons Society.\nAfter Mido’s death, Tse Leung ordered her to leave the city and take refuge with Sakura Noshida’s family to avoid becoming embroiled in the unrest.\nSakura rarely returns home, and her parents now love Siu-kiu like their own daughter. There is even talk that she may soon inherit their shop."}}],"45":[{"id":100,"needFiles":["B2","X2-2","E4"],"andFlag":false,"priority":0,"ja":{"title":"ローズ","text":"タイプBに対する治療効果があるという触れ込みで、かつて世界中で大流行した薬。\n何者かによってネットにレシピが公開されたこの薬は、家庭の製剤機で作成出来るという手軽さと、タイプB特有の症状を完全に打ち消すという夢のような薬であったが、実際には重篤な副作用と依存性があり、いともたやすく人を廃人にしてしまう。\nしかも、作用のなかには覚醒剤に似た多幸感などを与えるというものもあり、タイプBではない者たちも多数手を出し、そのほとんどが廃人になってしまうという、夢は夢でも悪夢のような薬であった。\n現在、治療目的で使用する場合でも非常に厳重な注意が必要とされ、一般的な治療現場で用いられることはほとんどなくなっているが、手軽に快楽を求めようとする濫用者はいまだに絶えず、世界中で薬物中毒者を生み出している。"},"en":{"title":"Rose","text":"A drug once popular worldwide on the claim that it could treat Type Bs.\nAn unknown person published its formula online. Rose could easily be made with a household pharmaceutical synthesizer and seemed like a miracle drug capable of completely eliminating Type B symptoms. In reality, it causes severe side effects and dependency, readily reducing users to a vegetative state.\nIts effects also include methamphetamine-like euphoria, attracting many users who are not Type B. Most suffer the same ruinous fate, making Rose less a dream drug than a nightmare.\nEven therapeutic use now requires extreme caution, and Rose has largely disappeared from ordinary clinical practice. Abusers seeking easy pleasure remain numerous, however, and the drug continues creating addicts around the world."}},{"id":208,"needFiles":["F4"],"andFlag":false,"priority":0,"ja":{"title":"ローズ","text":"タイプBに対する治療効果があるという触れ込みで、かつて世界中で大流行した薬。コシチェイの故郷に伝わる「不死者を死なせる力を持つ」と言われる『薔薇泥』の成分を模して作られたということだが、その真偽は定かではない。\n何者かによってネットにレシピが公開されたこの薬は、家庭の製剤機で作成出来るという手軽さと、タイプB特有の症状を完全に打ち消すという夢のような薬であったが、実際には重篤な副作用と依存性があり、いともたやすく人を廃人にしてしまう。\nしかも、作用のなかには覚醒剤に似た多幸感などを与えるというものもあり、タイプBではない者たちも多数手を出し、そのほとんどが廃人になってしまうという、夢は夢でも悪夢のような薬であった。\n現在、治療目的で使用する場合でも非常に厳重な注意が必要とされ、一般的な治療現場で用いられることはほとんどなくなっているが、手軽に快楽を求めようとする濫用者はいまだに絶えず、世界中で薬物中毒者を生み出している。"},"en":{"title":"Rose","text":"A drug once popular worldwide on the claim that it could treat Type Bs. It is said to imitate the components of ‘Rose Mud,’ a substance from Koschei’s homeland reputed to possess the power to kill immortals, though the truth of this account is uncertain.\nAn unknown person published its formula online. Rose could easily be made with a household pharmaceutical synthesizer and seemed like a miracle drug capable of completely eliminating Type B symptoms. In reality, it causes severe side effects and dependency, readily reducing users to a vegetative state.\nIts effects also include methamphetamine-like euphoria, attracting many users who are not Type B. Most suffer the same ruinous fate, making Rose less a dream drug than a nightmare.\nEven therapeutic use now requires extreme caution, and Rose has largely disappeared from ordinary clinical practice. Abusers seeking easy pleasure remain numerous, however, and the drug continues creating addicts around the world."}}],"46":[{"id":101,"needFiles":["B2"],"andFlag":false,"priority":0,"ja":{"title":"ネオ・ローズ","text":"ローズから副作用や、覚醒剤のような作用を取り除き、よりタイプBの諸症状の治療に特化した新薬。\nタイプBにとってはまさに夢のような薬だが、実物は確認されておらず、幻の薬となっている。\nたびたび、これが本物のネオ・ローズだと言ってレシピが公開されたりもするが、ほとんどはローズにほんの少し手を加えただけの粗悪品である。"},"en":{"title":"Neo Rose","text":"A new drug that removes Rose’s side effects and stimulant-like properties, specializing more narrowly in treating Type B symptoms.\nIt would be a genuine miracle drug for Type Bs, but no authentic sample has ever been confirmed, making it effectively mythical.\nFormulas are periodically released with claims that they produce genuine Neo Rose, but most are inferior products containing only minor modifications to Rose."}},{"id":209,"needFiles":["F4"],"andFlag":false,"priority":0,"ja":{"title":"ネオ・ローズ","text":"ローズから副作用や、覚醒剤のような作用を取り除き、よりタイプBの諸症状の治療に特化した新薬。コシチェイの故郷に伝わる「不死者を死なせる力を持つ」と言われる『薔薇泥』の成分を模して作られたということだが、その真偽は定かではない。\nタイプBにとってはまさに夢のような薬だが、実物は確認されておらず、幻の薬となっている。\nたびたび、これが本物のネオ・ローズだと言ってレシピが公開されたりもするが、ほとんどはローズにほんの少し手を加えただけの粗悪品である。"},"en":{"title":"Neo Rose","text":"A new drug that removes Rose’s side effects and stimulant-like properties, specializing more narrowly in treating Type B symptoms. It is said to imitate the components of ‘Rose Mud,’ a substance from Koschei’s homeland reputed to possess the power to kill immortals, though the truth of this account is uncertain.\nIt would be a genuine miracle drug for Type Bs, but no authentic sample has ever been confirmed, making it effectively mythical.\nFormulas are periodically released with claims that they produce genuine Neo Rose, but most are inferior products containing only minor modifications to Rose."}}],"47":[{"id":102,"needFiles":["B4-1"],"andFlag":false,"priority":0,"ja":{"title":"八龍解放軍","text":"八龍会が創設した過激派武装組織。\n街で苦しむタイプBたちを解放し、虐げるものたちに罰を与える、というのがその目的である。\nこれまで表立った武力行為を避けていた八龍会が、初めて手にした軍事力ということもあり、その動きはＹ地区の全ての市民やギャング組織から注目されている。\n老人たちの後継者と目されている見土道夫がリーダーに就任する。"},"en":{"title":"Hachiryu Liberation Army","text":"An extremist armed organization founded by the Eight Dragons Society.\nIts stated purpose is to liberate the Type Bs suffering in the city and punish those who oppress them.\nAs the first military force ever controlled by the Society, which previously avoided overt violence, its movements have attracted the attention of every citizen and gang organization in Y District.\nMichio Mido, regarded as the Elders’ likely successor, serves as its leader."}},{"id":103,"needFiles":["B6"],"andFlag":false,"priority":1,"ja":{"title":"八龍解放軍","text":"八龍会が創設した過激派武装組織。\n街で苦しむタイプBたちを解放し、虐げるものたちに罰を与える、というのがその目的である。\nこれまで表立った武力行為を避けていた八龍会が、初めて手にした軍事力。\nこれによって老人たちの勢力が拡大されるかと思われていたが、解放軍リーダーの見土道夫は、この部隊を使ってクーデターを起こし、老人たちを追放してしまう。\nその見土道夫もその後すぐに暗殺され、カミラ・ノーサムが隊長に就任。"},"en":{"title":"Hachiryu Liberation Army","text":"An extremist armed organization founded by the Eight Dragons Society.\nIts stated purpose is to liberate the Type Bs suffering in the city and punish those who oppress them.\nIt was the first military force ever controlled by the Society, which had previously avoided overt violence.\nIt was expected to expand the Elders’ power, but Liberation Army leader Michio Mido instead used the unit to stage a coup and expel them.\nMido was assassinated shortly afterward, and Camilla Northam assumed command."}},{"id":104,"needFiles":["X17"],"andFlag":false,"priority":2,"ja":{"title":"八龍解放軍","text":"八龍会が創設した過激派武装組織。\n街で苦しむタイプBたちを解放し、虐げるものたちに罰を与える、というのがその目的である。\nこれまで表立った武力行為を避けていた八龍会が、初めて手にした軍事力。\n当初は設立時の目論見通りの活躍をしていたが、その後クーデターを起こし、母体である八龍会の指導者であった老人たちを追放する。\nＹＳの支援によって老人たちが政局に復帰すると、解放軍は孤立し、壊滅する。\n初代隊長は見土道夫。二代隊長はカミラ・ノーサムであった。"},"en":{"title":"Hachiryu Liberation Army","text":"An extremist armed organization founded by the Eight Dragons Society.\nIts stated purpose was to liberate the Type Bs suffering in the city and punish those who oppressed them.\nIt was the first military force ever controlled by the Society, which had previously avoided overt violence.\nThe army initially performed as its founders intended, but later staged a coup and expelled the Elders who led its parent organization.\nWhen YS helped the Elders return to power, the Liberation Army became isolated and was destroyed.\nIts first commander was Michio Mido; its second was Camilla Northam."}}],"48":[{"id":105,"needFiles":["E1"],"andFlag":false,"priority":0,"ja":{"title":"堂島謙一","text":"タイプＡによるサイキック犯罪を専門に扱う警察官。\n彼自身が優れたサイキック能力の持ち主であり、並の犬よりも優れた嗅覚と、成分分析さえ出来そうな鋭敏な味覚を持ち、わずかな犯人の痕跡も見逃さない。\n特質変異として、頭部が犬になってしまっている。\n執念深い捜査には定評があり、Ｙ地区のタイプＡ犯罪者たちにその名を知られている。\n何より、長年この街で危険な職務にありながら、今日まで生きながらえて来たという事実が彼の優秀さを物語っているだろう。"},"en":{"title":"Kenichi Dojima","text":"A police officer specializing in psychic crimes committed by Type As.\nHe is himself a gifted psychic, possessing a sense of smell superior to that of an ordinary dog and a sense of taste so acute that it could seemingly perform chemical analysis. No trace of a perpetrator escapes him.\nHis trait mutation has transformed his head into that of a dog.\nHe is renowned for his relentless investigations, and Type A criminals throughout Y District know his name.\nAbove all, his survival after years of dangerous work in this city speaks eloquently to his ability."}},{"id":106,"needFiles":["E3","F2"],"andFlag":false,"priority":1,"ja":{"title":"堂島謙一","text":"タイプＡによるサイキック犯罪を専門に扱う警察官。\n彼自身が優れたサイキック能力の持ち主であり、並の犬よりも優れた嗅覚と、成分分析さえ出来そうな鋭敏な味覚を持ち、わずかな犯人の痕跡も見逃さない。\n特質変異として、頭部が犬になってしまっている。\n執念深い捜査には定評があり、Ｙ地区のタイプＡ犯罪者たちにその名を知られている。\nこの危険な街で、長きにわたり治安を守り続けて来たが、ついに殉職してしまった。\n享年４２才。"},"en":{"title":"Kenichi Dojima","text":"A police officer specializing in psychic crimes committed by Type As.\nHe was himself a gifted psychic, possessing a sense of smell superior to that of an ordinary dog and a sense of taste so acute that it could seemingly perform chemical analysis. No trace of a perpetrator escaped him.\nHis trait mutation had transformed his head into that of a dog.\nHe was renowned for his relentless investigations, and Type A criminals throughout Y District knew his name.\nAfter protecting public safety in this dangerous city for many years, he was finally killed in the line of duty.\nAge at death: 42."}}],"49":[{"id":107,"needFiles":["E4"],"andFlag":false,"priority":0,"ja":{"title":"三芳星","text":"タイプＡ犯罪を扱う警察官。\n堂島の後任として、路地邦昭の前に部下と共に現れた。\n国家公務員資格を持つ、いわゆるキャリア組であり、本来は現場での捜査に参加する立場ではないはずだが、積極的に捜査を行っている。\n経験はないが正義感が強く、路地の新しい捜査パートナーとして行動している。"},"en":{"title":"Hikari Miyoshi","text":"A police officer who handles Type A crime.\nAccompanied by subordinates, she approached Kuniaki Roji as Detective Dojima’s successor.\nShe is an elite career-track officer with national civil-service qualifications and would not ordinarily be expected to participate in field investigations, yet she pursues them actively.\nThough inexperienced, she has a strong sense of justice and now works as Roji’s new investigative partner."}},{"id":108,"needFiles":["X17"],"andFlag":false,"priority":1,"ja":{"title":"三芳星","text":"タイプＡ犯罪を扱う警察官。\n堂島の後任として、路地邦昭の前に部下と共に現れた。\n国家公務員資格を持つ、いわゆるキャリア組であり、本来は現場での捜査に参加する立場ではないはずだが、積極的に捜査を行っている。\n経験はないが正義感が強い。\n捜査上の失態や問題行動が多く、完全に出世コースから外され、いまだにＹ地区でタイプＡ犯罪の捜査をしているが、本人はまんざらでもないようだ。"},"en":{"title":"Hikari Miyoshi","text":"A police officer who handles Type A crime.\nAccompanied by subordinates, she approached Kuniaki Roji as Detective Dojima’s successor.\nShe is an elite career-track officer with national civil-service qualifications and would not ordinarily be expected to participate in field investigations, yet she pursues them actively.\nThough inexperienced, she has a strong sense of justice.\nHer many investigative failures and instances of misconduct have removed her completely from the promotion track. She still investigates Type A crime in Y District, but seems far from unhappy with the situation."}}],"50":[{"id":109,"needFiles":["E1"],"andFlag":false,"priority":0,"ja":{"title":"路地邦昭","text":"Ｙ地区に暮らすフリージャーナリスト。\n優れたタイプＡであり、鍵という鍵を、物理的なものも、電子的なものも、全て解除することが出来る。特質変異として頭に鬼の角のようなものが生えている。\n少年の頃から私立探偵として、このＹ地区の人々の間で起こった事件を解決してきたが、その際に能力を濫用したために逮捕され、薬剤の投与によって能力を封じられる。\nそのあとフリージャーナリストに転向し、過去の経験や人脈を利用して、Ｙ地区のアンダーグラウンドな情報やゴシップを記事にまとめ、週刊誌などに売って生計を立てている。\nそんなある日、かつて自分を逮捕した堂島刑事に連続殺人事件への捜査協力を求められる。"},"en":{"title":"Kuniaki Roji","text":"A freelance journalist living in Y District.\nA gifted Type A, he can open every kind of lock, whether physical or electronic. His trait mutation has given him demonlike horns.\nBeginning in boyhood, he worked as a private detective and solved incidents affecting the people of Y District. His abuse of his ability led to his arrest, however, and drugs were administered to suppress his power.\nHe subsequently became a freelance journalist. Using his past experience and contacts, he compiles articles on Y District’s underground affairs and gossip, then sells them to weekly magazines to earn a living.\nOne day, Detective Dojima—the man who once arrested him—asks for his help investigating a series of murders."}},{"id":110,"needFiles":["E3"],"andFlag":false,"priority":1,"ja":{"title":"路地邦昭","text":"Ｙ地区に暮らすフリージャーナリスト。\n優れたタイプＡであり、鍵という鍵を、物理的なものも、電子的なものも、全て解除することが出来る。特質変異として頭に鬼の角のようなものが生えている。\n少年の頃から私立探偵として、このＹ地区の人々の間で起こった事件を解決してきたが、その際に能力を濫用したために逮捕され、薬剤の投与によって能力を封じられる。\nそのあとフリージャーナリストに転向し、過去の経験や人脈を利用して、Ｙ地区のアンダーグラウンドな情報やゴシップを記事にまとめ、週刊誌などに売って生計を立てている。\nそんなある日、かつて自分を逮捕した堂島刑事に連続殺人事件への捜査協力を求められ、共に捜査を行うが、容疑者のコシチェイによって恋人のミユキが惨殺され、堂島も殉職してしまう。"},"en":{"title":"Kuniaki Roji","text":"A freelance journalist living in Y District.\nA gifted Type A, he can open every kind of lock, whether physical or electronic. His trait mutation has given him demonlike horns.\nBeginning in boyhood, he worked as a private detective and solved incidents affecting the people of Y District. His abuse of his ability led to his arrest, however, and drugs were administered to suppress his power.\nHe subsequently became a freelance journalist. Using his past experience and contacts, he compiles articles on Y District’s underground affairs and gossip, then sells them to weekly magazines to earn a living.\nDetective Dojima—the man who once arrested him—asked for his help investigating a series of murders. During their investigation, the suspect Koschei brutally murdered Roji’s lover Miyuki, and Dojima was killed in the line of duty."}},{"id":111,"needFiles":["C3"],"andFlag":false,"priority":2,"ja":{"title":"路地邦昭","text":"Ｙ地区に暮らすフリージャーナリスト。\n優れたタイプＡであり、鍵という鍵を、物理的なものも、電子的なものも、全て解除することが出来る。特質変異として頭に鬼の角のようなものが生えている。\n少年の頃から私立探偵として、このＹ地区の人々の間で起こった事件を解決してきたが、その際に能力を濫用したために逮捕され、薬剤の投与によって能力を封じられる。\nそのあとフリージャーナリストに転向し、過去の経験や人脈を利用して、Ｙ地区のアンダーグラウンドな情報やゴシップを記事にまとめ、週刊誌などに売って生計を立てている。\n殺人鬼コシチェイと灰上姉妹によって恋人のミユキを堂島刑事を殺害される。\nコシチェイへの復讐のため捜査を続けるが、その過程で彼自身も灰上姉妹の襲撃により致命傷を受ける。その後、汐松子の血液によってタイプＢ化し、不死身の肉体を手に入れる。"},"en":{"title":"Kuniaki Roji","text":"A freelance journalist living in Y District.\nA gifted Type A, he can open every kind of lock, whether physical or electronic. His trait mutation has given him demonlike horns.\nBeginning in boyhood, he worked as a private detective and solved incidents affecting the people of Y District. His abuse of his ability led to his arrest, however, and drugs were administered to suppress his power.\nHe subsequently became a freelance journalist. Using his past experience and contacts, he compiles articles on Y District’s underground affairs and gossip, then sells them to weekly magazines to earn a living.\nThe killer Koschei and the Haigami sisters murdered his lover Miyuki and Detective Dojima.\nHe continued investigating to avenge himself on Koschei, but the Haigami sisters inflicted a fatal wound during the process. Matsuko Shio’s blood subsequently transformed him into a Type B and gave him an immortal body."}},{"id":112,"needFiles":["X17"],"andFlag":false,"priority":3,"ja":{"title":"路地邦昭","text":"Ｙ地区に暮らすフリージャーナリスト。\n優れたタイプＡであり、鍵という鍵を、物理的なものも、電子的なものも、全て解除することが出来る。特質変異として頭に鬼の角のようなものが生えている。\n少年の頃から私立探偵として、このＹ地区の人々の間で起こった事件を解決してきたが、その際に能力を濫用したために逮捕され、薬剤の投与によって能力を封じられる。\nそのあとフリージャーナリストに転向し、過去の経験や人脈を利用して、Ｙ地区のアンダーグラウンドな情報やゴシップを記事にまとめ、週刊誌などに売って生計を立てている。\n殺人鬼コシチェイと灰上姉妹によって恋人のミユキと堂島刑事を殺害される。\nコシチェイへの復讐のため捜査を続けるが、その過程で彼自身も灰上姉妹の襲撃により致命傷を受ける。その後、汐松子の血液によってタイプＢ化し、不死身の肉体を手に入れる。\nコシチェイの失踪後、しばらく街の外で暮らしていたんだが、結局この街に舞い戻ってしまった。別に危険が恋しくなったわけではないんだがね。結局、馬鹿は死ぬまで直らないってやつだ。"},"en":{"title":"Kuniaki Roji","text":"A freelance journalist living in Y District.\nA gifted Type A, he can open every kind of lock, whether physical or electronic. His trait mutation has given him demonlike horns.\nBeginning in boyhood, he worked as a private detective and solved incidents affecting the people of Y District. His abuse of his ability led to his arrest, however, and drugs were administered to suppress his power.\nHe subsequently became a freelance journalist. Using his past experience and contacts, he compiles articles on Y District’s underground affairs and gossip, then sells them to weekly magazines to earn a living.\nThe killer Koschei and the Haigami sisters murdered his lover Miyuki and Detective Dojima.\nHe continued investigating to avenge himself on Koschei, but the Haigami sisters inflicted a fatal wound during the process. Matsuko Shio’s blood subsequently transformed him into a Type B and gave him an immortal body.\nAfter Koschei disappeared, I lived outside the city for a while, but in the end I came right back. It isn’t as though I missed the danger. I suppose some fools never learn, even if you kill them."}}],"51":[{"id":113,"needFiles":["D1"],"andFlag":false,"priority":0,"ja":{"title":"熨田さくら","text":"Ｙ地区に隣接する街に住む蕎麦屋の娘。\nタイプＡ。空を飛ぶ能力を持つが、代償の特質変異で、常に全身から粘液を流す。\n普段はその自分の体質を恥じ、家に引き籠もってゲームばかりしている。\n日課であるＹ地区の空中散歩の途中、筱喬に出会うことで彼女の人生が変わってゆく。"},"en":{"title":"Sakura Noshida","text":"The daughter of a soba restaurant owner in a city adjacent to Y District.\nShe is a Type A with the ability to fly. As the price of this power, her trait mutation causes mucus to flow constantly from her entire body.\nAshamed of her condition, she ordinarily shuts herself inside and spends all her time playing games.\nHer life begins to change when she meets Siu-kiu during her daily flight over Y District."}},{"id":210,"needFiles":["D2"],"andFlag":false,"priority":1,"ja":{"title":"熨田さくら","text":"Ｙ地区に隣接する街に住む蕎麦屋の娘。\nタイプＡ。空を飛ぶ能力を持つが、代償の特質変異で、常に全身から粘液を流す。\n普段はその自分の体質を恥じ、家に引き籠もってゲームばかりしている。\n日課であるＹ地区の空中散歩の途中、筱喬に出会うことで彼女の人生が変わってゆく。"},"en":{"title":"Sakura Noshida","text":"The daughter of a soba restaurant owner in a city adjacent to Y District.\nShe is a Type A with the ability to fly. As the price of this power, her trait mutation causes mucus to flow constantly from her entire body.\nAshamed of her condition, she ordinarily shuts herself inside and spends all her time playing games.\nHer life begins to change when she meets Siu-kiu during her daily flight over Y District."}},{"id":114,"needFiles":["X17"],"andFlag":false,"priority":2,"ja":{"title":"熨田さくら","text":"Ｙ地区に隣接する街に住む蕎麦屋の娘。\nタイプＡ。空を飛ぶ能力を持つが、代償の特質変異で、常に全身から粘液を流す。\n普段はその自分の体質を恥じ、家に引き籠もってゲームばかりしていた。\n謝家の令嬢である謝筱喬と出会うことでＹＳと繋がりを持ち、そのまま組織に入会した。\n現在はサイキック能力と持ち前の度胸で数々の抗争をくぐり抜け、Ｙ地区のなかではちょっとした有名人となっているようだ。"},"en":{"title":"Sakura Noshida","text":"The daughter of a soba restaurant owner in a city adjacent to Y District.\nShe is a Type A with the ability to fly. As the price of this power, her trait mutation causes mucus to flow constantly from her entire body.\nAshamed of her condition, she once shut herself inside and spent all her time playing games.\nMeeting Tse Siu-kiu, the young lady of the Tse family, brought her into contact with YS, which she subsequently joined.\nHer psychic power and natural courage have now carried her through numerous gang conflicts, making her a minor celebrity in Y District."}}],"52":[{"id":115,"needFiles":["C2"],"andFlag":false,"priority":0,"ja":{"title":"ミアオ","text":"太刀川医師が学生時代にY地区で出会った娼婦。\n出会った頃は街の小さな売春宿で働いていたが、後にローズ・クラブに移籍し、そこで肉体解体ショーで解体される役などを行う。\n太刀川にとっては運命を変えた特別な女であるが、このY地区において、彼女のような不幸な人生を歩んだ者は、数えきれぬほどいるだろう。\nそれは、今も昔も変わることはない。"},"en":{"title":"Miao","text":"A prostitute whom Dr. Tachikawa met in Y District while he was a student.\nShe worked at a small local brothel when they met, but later transferred to the Rose Club, where she appeared in shows in which her body was dismembered.\nShe was a special woman who changed Tachikawa’s destiny, but countless others in Y District have likely lived lives as tragic as hers.\nThat remains as true now as it was then."}}],"53":[{"id":116,"needFiles":["E1"],"andFlag":false,"priority":0,"ja":{"title":"ミユキ","text":"路地と共に暮らす暗闇通りの娼婦。\n路地に対し心身共に尽くしているが、見返りは少ないようである。"},"en":{"title":"Miyuki","text":"A Darkness Street prostitute who lives with Roji.\nShe devotes herself to him in both body and heart, but appears to receive little in return."}},{"id":211,"needFiles":["E2"],"andFlag":false,"priority":1,"ja":{"title":"ミユキ","text":"路地と共に暮らす暗闇通りの娼婦。\n路地に対し心身共に尽くしているが、見返りは少ないようである。"},"en":{"title":"Miyuki","text":"A Darkness Street prostitute who lives with Roji.\nShe devotes herself to him in both body and heart, but appears to receive little in return."}},{"id":117,"needFiles":["E3"],"andFlag":false,"priority":2,"ja":{"title":"ミユキ","text":"路地と共に暮らす暗闇通りの娼婦。\nアパートにいるところを殺人鬼コシチェイに襲撃され、殺害される。遺体は無惨なバラバラ死体になった。\n路地に対し心身共に尽くし、結局報われることがないまま死んでしまった。\n彼女はなぜ自分が殺されなければならなかったのか理解が出来ないまま死んでいったろう。\nもっとも、人の死というものについて納得の行く説明が出来るものなど、この世界のどこにも存在しないのだが。"},"en":{"title":"Miyuki","text":"A Darkness Street prostitute who lived with Roji.\nThe killer Koschei attacked and murdered her in their apartment, leaving her body brutally dismembered.\nShe devoted herself to Roji in both body and heart, but died without ever receiving anything in return.\nShe likely died unable to understand why she had to be killed.\nThen again, nowhere in this world can anyone offer a satisfying explanation for death."}}],"54":[{"id":118,"needFiles":["B1"],"andFlag":false,"priority":0,"ja":{"title":"汐健慈朗","text":"Ｙ地区有数の大企業シオクリーンの社長。汐松子の父。\n元々はグレートホールの研究のためにＹ地区を訪れた研究者だった。\n菅原和美と面識があり、その縁で幼い謝亮と知り合い、彼が科学に興味を持つきっかけとなった人物。\n今でも自宅の地下室に独自の研究施設を持っており、謝亮も幼い頃からそこに出入りしている。\n無類の酒好きで、用事がない時はつねに安物のウイスキー瓶を傍らに置いている。"},"en":{"title":"Kenjiro Shio","text":"President of Shio Clean, one of Y District’s largest companies, and father of Matsuko Shio.\nHe originally came to Y District as a scientist researching the Great Hole.\nHis acquaintance with Kazumi Sugawara led him to meet Tse Leung as a child, and he first inspired the boy’s interest in science.\nHe still maintains a private research facility in his basement, which Leung has visited since childhood.\nAn inveterate drinker, he keeps a bottle of cheap whiskey close at hand whenever he has no pressing business."}},{"id":119,"needFiles":["G2"],"andFlag":false,"priority":1,"ja":{"title":"汐健慈朗","text":"Ｙ地区有数の大企業シオクリーンの社長。\n元々はグレートホールの研究のためにＹ地区を訪れた研究者だった。\n菅原和美と面識があり、その縁で幼い謝亮と知り合い、彼が科学に興味を持つきっかけとなった人物。\n今でも自宅の地下室に独自の研究施設を持っており、謝亮も幼い頃からそこに出入りしている。\nシオクリーンを立ち上げたばかりの頃、ローズ・クラブと取引をしており、そこで廃棄された動く肉片を持ち帰り、自宅の研究室で謝亮と共に培養した。\n培養された肉片は少女の姿になり、彼らはそれに『松子』と名付け、汐家の娘ということにして育て上げた。\n無類の酒好きで、用事がない時はつねに安物のウイスキー瓶を傍らに置いている。"},"en":{"title":"Kenjiro Shio","text":"President of Shio Clean, one of Y District’s largest companies.\nHe originally came to Y District as a scientist researching the Great Hole.\nHis acquaintance with Kazumi Sugawara led him to meet Tse Leung as a child, and he first inspired the boy’s interest in science.\nHe still maintains a private research facility in his basement, which Leung has visited since childhood.\nWhen Shio Clean had only recently been founded, Kenjiro did business with the Rose Club. He brought a discarded piece of living flesh home from the club and cultured it in his laboratory with Tse Leung.\nThe cultured flesh assumed the form of a girl. They named her Matsuko and raised her as a daughter of the Shio family.\nAn inveterate drinker, he keeps a bottle of cheap whiskey close at hand whenever he has no pressing business."}},{"id":120,"needFiles":["X17"],"andFlag":false,"priority":2,"ja":{"title":"汐健慈朗","text":"Ｙ地区有数の大企業シオクリーンの社長。\n元々はグレートホールの研究のためにＹ地区を訪れた研究者だった。\n菅原和美と面識があり、その縁で幼い謝亮と知り合い、彼が科学に興味を持つきっかけとなった人物。\n今でも自宅の地下室に独自の研究施設を持っており、謝亮も幼い頃からそこに出入りしている。\nシオクリーンを立ち上げたばかりの頃、ローズ・クラブと取引をしており、そこで廃棄された動く肉片を持ち帰り、自宅の研究室で謝亮と共に培養した。\n培養された肉片は少女の姿になり、彼らはそれに『松子』と名付け、汐家の娘ということにして育て上げた。\n長年にわたる過度の飲酒がたたり肝硬変で死亡。会社は松子が継いだ。享年５８才。"},"en":{"title":"Kenjiro Shio","text":"President of Shio Clean, one of Y District’s largest companies.\nHe originally came to Y District as a scientist researching the Great Hole.\nHis acquaintance with Kazumi Sugawara led him to meet Tse Leung as a child, and he first inspired the boy’s interest in science.\nHe still maintained a private research facility in his basement, which Leung had visited since childhood.\nWhen Shio Clean had only recently been founded, Kenjiro did business with the Rose Club. He brought a discarded piece of living flesh home from the club and cultured it in his laboratory with Tse Leung.\nThe cultured flesh assumed the form of a girl. They named her Matsuko and raised her as a daughter of the Shio family.\nYears of excessive drinking ultimately caused fatal cirrhosis. Matsuko inherited the company.\nAge at death: 58."}}],"55":[{"id":121,"needFiles":["A2-2"],"andFlag":false,"priority":0,"ja":{"title":"汐松子","text":"汐健慈朗の娘。謝亮の幼なじみであり、恋人。\n現在はＹ地区内の児童養護施設で働いている。\nタイプＢで、強い再生力を持つ。"},"en":{"title":"Matsuko Shio","text":"Daughter of Kenjiro Shio, and Tse Leung’s childhood friend and lover.\nShe currently works at a children’s home in Y District.\nShe is a Type B with powerful regenerative abilities."}},{"id":122,"needFiles":["G2"],"andFlag":false,"priority":1,"ja":{"title":"汐松子","text":"汐健慈朗がローズ・クラブで拾った肉片から培養されて生まれた少女。\n健慈朗の娘として育てられた。\nかつては感情の薄い性質だったが、謝亮などの教育により、現在は人並みの感情表現を身につけた。\n傾向値の異常に高いタイプＢであり、不死身に近い再生能力と、優れた身体能力を持っている。興奮時でなくともつねに金眼現象があらわれており、コンタクトレンズが欠かせない。\n現在はＹ地区内の児童養護施設で働いている。"},"en":{"title":"Matsuko Shio","text":"A girl grown from a piece of flesh Kenjiro Shio recovered from the Rose Club.\nShe was raised as Kenjiro’s daughter.\nOnce largely devoid of emotion, she learned to express ordinary human feelings through the guidance of Tse Leung and others.\nShe is a Type B with an extraordinarily high tendency value, near-immortal regenerative abilities, and exceptional physical strength. The golden-eye phenomenon is always present even when she is not excited, making contact lenses indispensable.\nShe currently works at a children’s home in Y District."}},{"id":123,"needFiles":["X14"],"andFlag":false,"priority":2,"ja":{"title":"汐松子","text":"ローズ・クラブのオーナーであるロジャー・アダムスと、コシチェイの変身の一人であるヒトミとの間に生まれた。その時の名はミシェル。\n幼いうちに、コシチェイの別な変身先であるアレクセイに細かく切断され、ゴミとして廃棄される。\nそれを回収したゴミ処理業者の汐健慈朗がたまたま科学者であり、彼と謝亮によって培養され、人の姿を取り戻す。\nそれ以後は松子という新しい名を与えられ、健慈朗の娘として生活している。\nかつては感情の薄い性質だったが、謝亮などの教育により、現在は人並みの感情表現を身につけた。\n傾向値の異常に高いタイプＢであり、不死身に近い再生能力と、優れた身体能力を持っている。興奮時でなくともつねに金眼現象があらわれており、コンタクトレンズが欠かせない。\n勤め先の児童養護施設で夜勤をしているところ、コシチェイの襲撃を受け、再生阻止のための『ローズ』を投与された上でバラバラにされる。"},"en":{"title":"Matsuko Shio","text":"Born to Rose Club owner Roger Adams and Hitomi, one of Koschei’s transformations. Her name at the time was Michelle.\nWhile still very young, she was cut into small pieces by Alexei, another of Koschei’s transformations, and discarded as garbage.\nThe waste collector who recovered her, Kenjiro Shio, happened to be a scientist. He and Tse Leung cultured her remains until she regained human form.\nShe was then given the new name Matsuko and lived as Kenjiro’s daughter.\nOnce largely devoid of emotion, she learned to express ordinary human feelings through the guidance of Tse Leung and others.\nShe is a Type B with an extraordinarily high tendency value, near-immortal regenerative abilities, and exceptional physical strength. The golden-eye phenomenon is always present even when she is not excited, making contact lenses indispensable.\nKoschei attacked her during a night shift at the children’s home where she worked. After injecting her with Rose to prevent regeneration, the killer dismembered her."}},{"id":124,"needFiles":["a8"],"andFlag":false,"priority":3,"ja":{"title":"汐松子","text":"ローズ・クラブのオーナーであるロジャー・アダムスと、コシチェイの変身の一人であるヒトミとの間に生まれた。その時の名はミシェル。\n幼いうちに、コシチェイの別な変身先であるアレクセイに細かく切断され、ゴミとして廃棄される。\nそれを回収したゴミ処理業者の汐健慈朗がたまたま科学者であり、彼と謝亮によって培養され、人の姿を取り戻す。\nそれ以後は松子という新しい名を与えられ、健慈朗の娘として生活している。\nかつては感情の薄い性質だったが、謝亮などの教育により、現在は人並みの感情表現を身につけた。\n傾向値の異常に高いタイプＢであり、不死身に近い再生能力と、優れた身体能力を持っている。興奮時でなくともつねに金眼現象があらわれており、コンタクトレンズが欠かせない。\nコシチェイの襲撃を受けて死亡したと思われていたが、小さな生きた肉片を残しており、灰上江梨子の手から謝亮へと手渡される。"},"en":{"title":"Matsuko Shio","text":"Born to Rose Club owner Roger Adams and Hitomi, one of Koschei’s transformations. Her name at the time was Michelle.\nWhile still very young, she was cut into small pieces by Alexei, another of Koschei’s transformations, and discarded as garbage.\nThe waste collector who recovered her, Kenjiro Shio, happened to be a scientist. He and Tse Leung cultured her remains until she regained human form.\nShe was then given the new name Matsuko and lived as Kenjiro’s daughter.\nOnce largely devoid of emotion, she learned to express ordinary human feelings through the guidance of Tse Leung and others.\nShe is a Type B with an extraordinarily high tendency value, near-immortal regenerative abilities, and exceptional physical strength. The golden-eye phenomenon is always present even when she is not excited, making contact lenses indispensable.\nThough presumed dead after Koschei’s attack, she left behind a small piece of living flesh. Eriko Haigami later delivered it to Tse Leung."}},{"id":125,"needFiles":["X17"],"andFlag":false,"priority":4,"ja":{"title":"汐松子","text":"ローズ・クラブのオーナーであるロジャー・アダムスと、コシチェイの変身の一人であるヒトミとの間に生まれた。その時の名はミシェル。\n幼いうちに、コシチェイの別な変身先であるアレクセイに細かく切断され、ゴミとして廃棄される。\nそれを回収したゴミ処理業者の汐健慈朗がたまたま科学者であり、彼と謝亮によって培養され、人の姿を取り戻す。\nそれ以後は松子という新しい名を与えられ、健慈朗の娘として生活している。\nかつては感情の薄い性質だったが、謝亮などの教育により、現在は人並みの感情表現を身につけた。\n傾向値の異常に高いタイプＢであり、不死身に近い再生能力と、優れた身体能力を持っている。興奮時でなくともつねに金眼現象があらわれており、コンタクトレンズが欠かせない。\nコシチェイ事件の際にまた肉体を破壊されるが、その後に再度再生される。\n死んだ汐松子の生き別れの妹という設定で、汐健慈朗のかわりにシオクリーンの経営に携わっている。\n謝亮とも再会を果たしたが、これから彼女たちはどうしてゆくのだろうか。\n彼らの動き次第では、Ｙ地区の情勢にまた変化が生まれるだろう。"},"en":{"title":"Matsuko Shio","text":"Born to Rose Club owner Roger Adams and Hitomi, one of Koschei’s transformations. Her name at the time was Michelle.\nWhile still very young, she was cut into small pieces by Alexei, another of Koschei’s transformations, and discarded as garbage.\nThe waste collector who recovered her, Kenjiro Shio, happened to be a scientist. He and Tse Leung cultured her remains until she regained human form.\nShe was then given the new name Matsuko and lived as Kenjiro’s daughter.\nOnce largely devoid of emotion, she learned to express ordinary human feelings through the guidance of Tse Leung and others.\nShe is a Type B with an extraordinarily high tendency value, near-immortal regenerative abilities, and exceptional physical strength. The golden-eye phenomenon is always present even when she is not excited, making contact lenses indispensable.\nHer body was destroyed again during the Koschei incident, but she subsequently regenerated once more.\nPosing as the long-lost younger sister of the deceased Matsuko Shio, she now participates in managing Shio Clean in Kenjiro Shio’s place.\nShe has also reunited with Tse Leung, but what will the two of them do now?\nTheir actions may once again alter the situation in Y District."}}],"56":[{"id":126,"needFiles":["X4"],"andFlag":false,"priority":0,"ja":{"title":"菅原和美","text":"クリス・ツェーの妻。息子は謝亮。娘は謝筱喬。\n故人。\n病弱なタイプBであり、若くして死亡している。\n健康だった頃は汐健慈朗の同僚であり、彼に幼い謝亮を紹介した。"},"en":{"title":"Kazumi Sugawara","text":"Wife of Chris Tse, mother of Tse Leung, and mother of Tse Siu-kiu.\nDeceased.\nA frail Type B, she died at a young age.\nWhile still healthy, she worked with Kenjiro Shio and introduced him to the young Tse Leung."}},{"id":127,"needFiles":["X18"],"andFlag":false,"priority":1,"ja":{"title":"菅原和美","text":"クリス・ツェーの妻。息子は謝亮。娘は謝筱喬。\n故人。\n病弱なタイプBであり、若くして死亡。晩年はタイプB特有の精神疾患を患い、息子の謝亮が介護していた。\n健康だった頃は汐健慈朗の同僚であり、彼に幼い謝亮を紹介した。"},"en":{"title":"Kazumi Sugawara","text":"Wife of Chris Tse, mother of Tse Leung, and mother of Tse Siu-kiu.\nDeceased.\nA frail Type B, she died at a young age. In her final years, she suffered from the mental illness characteristic of Type Bs, and her son Tse Leung cared for her.\nWhile still healthy, she worked with Kenjiro Shio and introduced him to the young Tse Leung."}}],"57":[{"id":128,"needFiles":["A1"],"andFlag":false,"priority":0,"ja":{"title":"滑走路通り","text":"Ｙ地区を代表するメインストリート。\nかつて滑走路の舗装を道路として使用していたころにつけられた通称が、何度も改修されて当時のアスファルトがなくなった現在でも残っている。\n元が軍用滑走路だっただけに道幅が広く、多くの屋台が所狭しと並んでいる。\nＹ地区自体が移民の街であるため、さまざまな国の出身者がこの通り沿いで営業をしており、頭上の看板には世界中の言語が集まっているのではないかと思わせるほど、多様な文字が並んでいる。\n繁華街として発展した現在、大手チェーン店なども出店しはじめており、その個性的な異国情緒は幾分薄れつつあるが、それでも国内でも類を見ないスポットであることは間違いがない。"},"en":{"title":"Runway Street","text":"Y District’s principal thoroughfare.\nIts common name dates from the period when a paved runway was used as a road. Though repeated reconstruction has removed all of the original asphalt, the name remains.\nAs befits a former military runway, the road is exceptionally broad, with countless stalls crowded along its sides.\nY District is a city of immigrants, and people from many countries operate businesses along the street. Signs overhead display such a variety of writing that they seem to contain every language in the world.\nNow that the area has developed into a major entertainment district, national chains have begun opening branches, somewhat diminishing its distinctive international atmosphere. Even so, it remains a place unlike any other in Japan."}}],"58":[{"id":129,"needFiles":["B1"],"andFlag":false,"priority":0,"ja":{"title":"パラシュート通り","text":"こぢんまりとした食料品店などが並ぶ庶民的な通りで、主にアジア系の住民が暮らしている。\nメインストリートである滑走路通りに比べると、観光客などもほとんど足を踏み入れない地味な地域だが、今をときめくＹＳの前身とも言うべき義勝の勢力地であった。\nまた、地域最大の企業であるシオクリーンの本社もこの通り沿いに存在する。"},"en":{"title":"Parachute Street","text":"A working-class street lined with small grocery stores and similar shops, inhabited primarily by Asian residents.\nCompared with the main thoroughfare, Runway Street, it is an unassuming area rarely visited by tourists. It was once the territory of Yisheng, the organization that could be called YS’s predecessor.\nShio Clean, the region’s largest company, also has its headquarters along this street."}}],"59":[{"id":130,"needFiles":["A2-1","X2-1","E2"],"andFlag":false,"priority":0,"ja":{"title":"暗闇通り","text":"Ｙ地区のメインストリートが滑走路通りならば、この暗闇通りは裏のメインストリートとでも称すべきだろう。\nこの昼でも薄暗い道の左右には非合法カジノ、バー、娼館などが立ち並び、街灯ごとにさまざまな肌の色をした、さまざまな年齢の街娼が立っている。\n近年ではこの辺りは『裏Ｙ地区』と呼ばれ、体験出来ぬ快楽のないナイトスポットとして高名になりつつあるが、訪れたものは意外な狭さに驚くことだろう。\n治安の悪さもＹ地区有数で、ありとあらゆる犯罪の絶えない場所ではあるが、それでも訪れる人の足が絶えることはない。"},"en":{"title":"Darkness Street","text":"If Runway Street is Y District’s main thoroughfare, Darkness Street might be called its shadow counterpart.\nIllegal casinos, bars, and brothels line both sides of this road, which remains dim even by day. Streetwalkers of every age and skin color stand beneath its lamps.\nIn recent years the area has become known as ‘Underground Y District’ and is gaining fame as a nightlife destination offering every imaginable pleasure, though visitors may be surprised by how narrow it is.\nIt is also one of the most dangerous areas in Y District, where every kind of crime is commonplace. Even so, visitors never cease to come."}}],"60":[{"id":131,"needFiles":["C2"],"andFlag":false,"priority":0,"ja":{"title":"ロジャー・アダムス","text":"金髪碧眼の白人男性。\n若い頃は世界を飛び回り、発展途上国で臓器を買い付け、先進国へ売るという臓器売買の仲買人をしていた。\nその時に得た資金や人脈を使い、ローズ・クラブを設立する。\nほとんどの場合アメリカ人と自称しているが、違う説明をすることもあり、本来の国籍も氏名も不明。"},"en":{"title":"Roger Adams","text":"A white man with blond hair and blue eyes.\nAs a young man, he traveled the world as an organ-trafficking broker, purchasing organs in developing countries and selling them in developed nations.\nHe used the money and connections acquired through this work to establish the Rose Club.\nHe usually claims to be American but occasionally offers a different account, leaving his true name and nationality unknown."}},{"id":132,"needFiles":["X7"],"andFlag":false,"priority":1,"ja":{"title":"ロジャー・アダムス","text":"金髪碧眼の白人男性。\n若い頃は世界を飛び回り、発展途上国で臓器を買い付け、先進国へ売るという臓器売買の仲買人をしていた。\nその時に得た資金や人脈を使い、ローズ・クラブを設立する。\nほとんどの場合アメリカ人と自称しているが、違う説明をすることもあり、本来の国籍も氏名も不明。\nＹＳによるローズ・クラブ襲撃時に死亡。"},"en":{"title":"Roger Adams","text":"A white man with blond hair and blue eyes.\nAs a young man, he traveled the world as an organ-trafficking broker, purchasing organs in developing countries and selling them in developed nations.\nHe used the money and connections acquired through this work to establish the Rose Club.\nHe usually claimed to be American but occasionally offered a different account, leaving his true name and nationality unknown.\nHe died during YS’s assault on the Rose Club."}},{"id":133,"needFiles":["X14"],"andFlag":false,"priority":2,"ja":{"title":"ロジャー・アダムス","text":"金髪碧眼の白人男性。\n若い頃は世界を飛び回り、発展途上国で臓器を買い付け、先進国へ売るという臓器売買の仲買人をしていた。\nその時に得た資金や人脈を使い、ローズ・クラブを設立する。\nほとんどの場合アメリカ人と自称しているが、違う説明をすることもあり、本来の国籍も氏名も不明。\nＹＳによるローズ・クラブ襲撃時に死亡。\n汐松子の実父。"},"en":{"title":"Roger Adams","text":"A white man with blond hair and blue eyes.\nAs a young man, he traveled the world as an organ-trafficking broker, purchasing organs in developing countries and selling them in developed nations.\nHe used the money and connections acquired through this work to establish the Rose Club.\nHe usually claimed to be American but occasionally offered a different account, leaving his true name and nationality unknown.\nHe died during YS’s assault on the Rose Club.\nHe was Matsuko Shio’s biological father."}}],"61":[{"id":134,"needFiles":["E2"],"andFlag":false,"priority":0,"ja":{"title":"ヒトミ","text":"路地が訪れたバーでピアノを演奏していた日本人らしき女性。\n路地と一夜を共にした後、彼の財布と共に姿を消す。"},"en":{"title":"Hitomi","text":"An apparently Japanese woman who was playing piano in a bar visited by Roji.\nAfter spending the night with him, she disappeared along with his wallet."}},{"id":135,"needFiles":["E5"],"andFlag":false,"priority":1,"ja":{"title":"ヒトミ","text":"路地が訪れたバーでピアノを演奏していた日本人らしき女性。\n路地と一夜を共にした後、彼の財布と共に姿を消す。\nかつて、ローズ・クラブで娼婦たちに不死の儀式を行っていた。\nコシチェイの変身した姿の一つだと思われる。"},"en":{"title":"Hitomi","text":"An apparently Japanese woman who was playing piano in a bar visited by Roji.\nAfter spending the night with him, she disappeared along with his wallet.\nShe once performed rituals of immortality on prostitutes at the Rose Club.\nShe is believed to be one of Koschei’s transformations."}},{"id":136,"needFiles":["X14"],"andFlag":false,"priority":2,"ja":{"title":"ヒトミ","text":"路地が訪れたバーでピアノを演奏していた日本人らしき女性。\n路地と一夜を共にした後、彼の財布と共に姿を消す。\nかつて、ローズ・クラブで娼婦たちに不死の儀式を行っていた。\nコシチェイの変身した姿の一つだと思われる。\nロジャー・アダムスの愛人であり、汐松子の実母。"},"en":{"title":"Hitomi","text":"An apparently Japanese woman who was playing piano in a bar visited by Roji.\nAfter spending the night with him, she disappeared along with his wallet.\nShe once performed rituals of immortality on prostitutes at the Rose Club.\nShe is believed to be one of Koschei’s transformations.\nShe was Roger Adams’s lover and Matsuko Shio’s biological mother."}}],"62":[{"id":137,"needFiles":["X3-1","A5"],"andFlag":true,"priority":0,"ja":{"title":"マリア","text":"タイプＡ。自分を中心とした一定の範囲の空間を、別の空間に転移させる能力を持つ。\n体型に合わない大きな黒いレインコートを身につけた、金髪碧眼の少女。\n神出鬼没で、廖志明の邸宅に侵入したり、グランドタワーを襲撃してジェフリー・ウォンと彼の部下たちを死亡させる。"},"en":{"title":"Maria","text":"A Type A with the ability to transfer a defined area of space centered on herself to another location.\nShe is a blond, blue-eyed girl who wears a large black raincoat ill-suited to her build.\nAppearing and disappearing unpredictably, she has broken into Liao Chi-ming’s mansion and attacked Grand Tower, killing Jeffrey Wong and his subordinates."}},{"id":138,"needFiles":["X14","C4"],"andFlag":false,"priority":1,"ja":{"title":"マリア","text":"タイプＡ。自分を中心とした一定の範囲の空間を、別の空間に転移させる能力を持つ。\n体型に合わない大きな黒いレインコートを身につけた、金髪碧眼の少女。\n殺人鬼コシチェイの変身後の姿のひとつ。\n強力な能力を持ち、精神の幼さゆえのコントロールしやすい人格のため、コシチェイの数多くのアバターのなかで戦闘を担当させられている。\nヘスの指示によって多くの殺人事件にたずさわって来たが、精神の成長のない彼女は自分の犯した罪の意味に、永久に気がつくことはないだろう。"},"en":{"title":"Maria","text":"A Type A with the ability to transfer a defined area of space centered on herself to another location.\nShe is a blond, blue-eyed girl who wears a large black raincoat ill-suited to her build.\nShe is one of the killer Koschei’s transformed identities.\nHer formidable ability and mentally immature, easily controlled personality have made her Koschei’s combat avatar.\nShe has participated in numerous murders at Hess’s direction. Because her mind never matures, she may remain forever incapable of understanding the meaning of her crimes."}}],"63":[{"id":139,"needFiles":["F1"],"andFlag":false,"priority":0,"ja":{"title":"サーシェンカ","text":"灰上姉妹と出会った白人少年。\n記憶がさだかでなく、発言が不明瞭。\n殺人鬼コシチェイが変身した姿。"},"en":{"title":"Sashenka","text":"A white boy encountered by the Haigami sisters.\nHis memory is uncertain, and his statements are unclear.\nHe is one of the killer Koschei’s transformed identities."}},{"id":140,"needFiles":["F4"],"andFlag":false,"priority":1,"ja":{"title":"サーシェンカ","text":"本名はアレクサンドル・ヤコヴレヴィチ・チェルヌイフ。\n白人少年の姿をしている。\n不死の力を持つ吸血鬼の家系とされるチェルヌイフ家の一人。\n先祖代々続くタイプＢであり、「フセスラフ計画」の実験材料にされた結果、変身能力を身につける。\nしかし彼はこの自分の能力のことを知らない。変身は彼の意志とは無関係に行われ、彼が変身する数多くの人間は、それぞれ固有の人格を持っている。\n彼自身は自分が変身して居る間は意識を失っているため、その間に自分が何をしているのか把握しておらず、自身がコシチェイと呼ばれる殺人鬼として、Ｙ地区で発生する様々な事件の中心人物となっていることも知らない。"},"en":{"title":"Sashenka","text":"His real name is Aleksandr Yakovlevich Chernykh.\nHe has the appearance of a white boy.\nHe is a member of the Chernykh family, a lineage of vampires said to possess immortality.\nA hereditary Type B, he acquired the power to transform after being used as a subject in the Vseslav Project.\nHe does not know that he possesses this power. The transformations occur independently of his will, and each of the many people he becomes has a distinct personality.\nBecause he loses consciousness while transformed, he does not know what he does during those periods. He is therefore unaware that he is the killer called Koschei and the central figure in numerous incidents throughout Y District."}},{"id":141,"needFiles":["X16"],"andFlag":false,"priority":2,"ja":{"title":"サーシェンカ","text":"本名、アレクサンドル・ヤコヴレヴィチ・チェルヌイフ。\nコシチェイの正体。\n不死の力を持つ吸血鬼の家系とされるチェルヌイフ家の一人。\n先祖代々続くタイプＢであり、「フセスラフ計画」の実験材料にされた結果、変身能力を身につける。そうして、殺人鬼コシチェイとなる。\nその後、能力の崩壊とともに自分の変身後の人格がしてきたことを全て理解する。正気を失いつつある彼は導かれるままグレートホールへと向かい、灰上江梨子と共に消息を絶った。\n彼がその場所へ向かったのは、タイプＢ特有の妄想症状によるものなのか、それとも何か彼自身の心に明確な理由があったのか、一切は不明である。"},"en":{"title":"Sashenka","text":"His real name is Aleksandr Yakovlevich Chernykh.\nHe is Koschei’s true identity.\nHe belongs to the Chernykh family, a lineage of vampires said to possess immortality.\nA hereditary Type B, he acquired the power to transform after being used as a subject in the Vseslav Project, thus becoming the killer Koschei.\nAs his ability collapsed, he finally understood everything his transformed personalities had done. With his sanity deteriorating, he followed an unknown impulse to the Great Hole and disappeared alongside Eriko Haigami.\nWhether he went there because of the delusions characteristic of Type Bs or for some definite reason of his own remains entirely unknown."}}],"64":[{"id":180,"needFiles":["G2"],"andFlag":false,"priority":0,"ja":{"title":"アレクセイ","text":"リュウカ殺害の犯人。汐松子がリュウカの家を訪ねた際に遭遇した。松子同様異常な再生力を持つ。"},"en":{"title":"Alexei","text":"Ryuka’s killer, encountered when Matsuko Shio visited Ryuka’s home. Like Matsuko, he possesses extraordinary regenerative abilities."}},{"id":142,"needFiles":["E3"],"andFlag":false,"priority":1,"ja":{"title":"アレクセイ","text":"黒髪の青年。Y地区の連続殺人容疑者であるコシチェイの正体と思われている。"},"en":{"title":"Alexei","text":"A young man with black hair. He is believed to be Koschei, the suspect in Y District’s serial murders."}},{"id":143,"needFiles":["F1"],"andFlag":false,"priority":2,"ja":{"title":"アレクセイ","text":"黒髪の青年。\nY地区の連続殺人容疑者であるコシチェイの正体。\n女性を殺害し、その死体を遺体を切り分け棚に並べることを好む。\n灰上姉妹の前で、サーシェンカという全く別の白人少年に変身して見せる。"},"en":{"title":"Alexei","text":"A young man with black hair.\nHe is Koschei, the suspect in Y District’s serial murders.\nHe enjoys murdering women, dismembering their bodies, and arranging the pieces on shelves.\nBefore the Haigami sisters, he transformed into an entirely different person: a white boy named Sashenka."}},{"id":144,"needFiles":["F4"],"andFlag":false,"priority":3,"ja":{"title":"アレクセイ","text":"黒髪の青年。\nコシチェイの変身した姿の一つ。\n女性を殺害し、その死体を遺体を切り分け棚に並べることを好む。\n容姿端麗で、人当たりがよく、ヘスなどの他の人格と交信する能力があるため、コシチェイは彼の姿でいることが多い。"},"en":{"title":"Alexei","text":"A young man with black hair.\nHe is one of Koschei’s transformed identities.\nHe enjoys murdering women, dismembering their bodies, and arranging the pieces on shelves.\nHandsome and personable, he can communicate with Hess and the other personalities. Koschei therefore assumes his form frequently."}}],"65":[{"id":145,"needFiles":["B2"],"andFlag":false,"priority":0,"ja":{"title":"エフゲニ・ヘス","text":"八龍会に『ネオ・ローズ』の製造と販売を持ちかけた、謎の老人。"},"en":{"title":"Yevgeny Hess","text":"A mysterious old man who approached the Eight Dragons Society with a proposal to manufacture and sell Neo Rose."}},{"id":146,"needFiles":["F4"],"andFlag":false,"priority":1,"ja":{"title":"エフゲニ・ヘス","text":"フルネームはエフゲニ・イリイーチ・ヘス。普段はミドルネームを省略してエフゲニ・ヘス。あるいは単にヘスと呼ばれる。\nコシチェイの変身後の姿の一つ。\nコシチェイが持つ全ての人格のなかで、リーダー的な存在。\nコシチェイの行動は、彼が決定しており、『ローズ』や『ネオ・ローズ』を用いたＹ地区における暗躍は、ほとんど彼の欲望から生まれたものである。\nある意味、その肉体のオリジナルであるサーシェンカよりも、コシチェイという存在への影響が強い人物である。\nしかし、現在は他の人格に対する支配力が低下しているようである。"},"en":{"title":"Yevgeny Hess","text":"His full name is Yevgeny Ilyich Hess. He ordinarily omits his patronymic and is called Yevgeny Hess, or simply Hess.\nHe is one of Koschei’s transformed identities.\nAmong all of Koschei’s personalities, he serves as their leader.\nHe determines Koschei’s actions, and most of the schemes involving Rose and Neo Rose in Y District originated in his desires.\nIn some respects, he exerts greater influence over Koschei than Sashenka, the body’s original personality.\nHis control over the other personalities now appears to be declining."}}],"66":[{"id":147,"needFiles":["B1"],"andFlag":false,"priority":0,"ja":{"title":"田中紺太","text":"少年時代からの見土道夫の友人で、当時の不良少年グループの一員でもある。\n娼婦の息子で、一時は破滅的な行動を繰り返していたが、現在は道夫と共にグレートホール饅頭の販売を行っている。"},"en":{"title":"Konta Tanaka","text":"A friend of Michio Mido since boyhood and a member of the delinquent gang Mido led at the time.\nThe son of a prostitute, he engaged in repeated self-destructive behavior for a time. He now sells Great Hole Buns with Mido."}},{"id":148,"needFiles":["B4-2"],"andFlag":false,"priority":1,"ja":{"title":"田中紺太","text":"少年時代からの見土道夫の友人で、当時の不良少年グループの一員でもある。\n娼婦の息子で、一時は破滅的な行動を繰り返していたが、道夫によって更生する。\n道夫と共に八龍解放軍に入り、副隊長となる。"},"en":{"title":"Konta Tanaka","text":"A friend of Michio Mido since boyhood and a member of the delinquent gang Mido led at the time.\nThe son of a prostitute, he engaged in repeated self-destructive behavior for a time, but Mido reformed him.\nHe joined the Hachiryu Liberation Army alongside Mido and became its deputy commander."}},{"id":149,"needFiles":["X17"],"andFlag":false,"priority":2,"ja":{"title":"田中紺太","text":"少年時代からの見土道夫の友人で、当時の不良少年グループの一員でもある。\n娼婦の息子で、一時は破滅的な行動を繰り返していたが、道夫によって更生する。\n道夫と共に八龍解放軍に入り、副隊長となる。\n道夫の死後の混乱のなかも生き残り、街を脱出する。\nしかし、脱出後に合流したテロ組織『ブラッド』に馴染めず、Y地区に戻る。元解放軍の彼をかつての仲間が受け入れたのは、その人柄ゆえだろう。\n現在はグレートホール饅頭を売るために立ち上げた会社が軌道にのり、順調に業績を伸ばしている。"},"en":{"title":"Konta Tanaka","text":"A friend of Michio Mido since boyhood and a member of the delinquent gang Mido led at the time.\nThe son of a prostitute, he engaged in repeated self-destructive behavior for a time, but Mido reformed him.\nHe joined the Hachiryu Liberation Army alongside Mido and became its deputy commander.\nHe survived the turmoil following Mido’s death and escaped the city.\nUnable to fit in with the terrorist organization Blood after joining it outside the city, he returned to Y District. His former companions presumably accepted an ex-Liberation Army soldier because of his character.\nThe company he founded to sell Great Hole Buns is now firmly established and continues to grow."}}],"67":[{"id":150,"needFiles":["B4-2"],"andFlag":false,"priority":0,"ja":{"title":"カミラ・ノーサム","text":"八龍解放軍副隊長。\n自分の意志で自在にタイプBの能力を引き出せるため、八龍会のなかで若くして頭角を現す。解放軍のなかではタカ派。タイプBの地位向上に対し、強い情熱を持っており、そのためならノーマルやタイプＡに危害を加えることも厭わない。"},"en":{"title":"Camilla Northam","text":"Deputy commander of the Hachiryu Liberation Army.\nHer ability to summon her Type B powers at will allowed her to rise rapidly through the Eight Dragons Society despite her youth. A hawk within the Liberation Army, she is fiercely committed to improving the status of Type Bs and will not hesitate to harm Normals or Type As in pursuit of that goal."}},{"id":151,"needFiles":["B6"],"andFlag":false,"priority":1,"ja":{"title":"カミラ・ノーサム","text":"八龍解放軍隊長。\n自分の意志で自在にタイプBの能力を引き出せるため、八龍会のなかで若くして頭角を現す。前任者見土道夫の死後、隊長となる。\nタイプBの地位向上に対し、強い情熱を持っており、そのためならノーマルやタイプＡに危害を加えることも厭わない。"},"en":{"title":"Camilla Northam","text":"Commander of the Hachiryu Liberation Army.\nHer ability to summon her Type B powers at will allowed her to rise rapidly through the Eight Dragons Society despite her youth. She assumed command after the death of her predecessor, Michio Mido.\nShe is fiercely committed to improving the status of Type Bs and will not hesitate to harm Normals or Type As in pursuit of that goal."}},{"id":152,"needFiles":["X16"],"andFlag":false,"priority":2,"ja":{"title":"カミラ・ノーサム","text":"元八龍解放軍隊長。\n自分の意志で自在にタイプBの能力を引き出せるため、八龍会のなかで若くして頭角を現す。見土道夫死亡後に八龍解放軍隊長となって活動を続けていたが、老人たちがＹＳ側についたため、街のタイプBの支持を失い孤立する。\nネオ・ローズの入手が困難になり、解放軍は崩壊、彼女はＹＳによって捕縛される。\nその後ＹＳ龍頭謝亮の指示により、八龍会に対する裏切り者として処刑。頭部を切断された遺体は路上に晒される。\n享年２１才。"},"en":{"title":"Camilla Northam","text":"Former commander of the Hachiryu Liberation Army.\nHer ability to summon her Type B powers at will allowed her to rise rapidly through the Eight Dragons Society despite her youth. She continued the Liberation Army’s activities as commander after Michio Mido’s death, but lost the support of the city’s Type Bs and became isolated when the Elders sided with YS.\nAs Neo Rose became difficult to obtain, the Liberation Army collapsed and YS captured her.\nOn the orders of YS Longtou Tse Leung, she was executed as a traitor to the Eight Dragons Society. Her decapitated body was displayed in the street.\nAge at death: 21."}}],"68":[{"id":153,"needFiles":["A5"],"andFlag":false,"priority":0,"ja":{"title":"木下組","text":"日本の指定暴力団。\n日本最大の指定暴力団Ｕ会系の二次団体。\nＹ地区近隣に本拠地を置いており、かつてＹ地区への大がかりな進出を図り、Ｙ地区内のギャングたちが分断される事態に陥ったが、クリス・ツェー率いるＹＳによって撃退されている。\nその後もＹ地区内で何かあるたびに干渉し、Ｙ地区への野心を隠そうとはしていない。"},"en":{"title":"Kinoshita-gumi","text":"A Japanese designated organized crime group.\nIt is a second-tier affiliate of the U-kai, Japan’s largest designated crime syndicate.\nHeadquartered near Y District, it once attempted a major incursion into the area and divided the local gangs, but YS under Chris Tse ultimately drove it back.\nIt has continued interfering whenever events occur in Y District and makes no effort to conceal its ambitions there."}}],"69":[{"id":154,"needFiles":["x1"],"andFlag":false,"priority":0,"ja":{"title":"義勝","text":"かつてＹ地区に存在したギャング組織（黒社会）。\n元々は香港で誕生した組織で、香港返還時にＹ地区へやって来たと伝えられている。\nただし、事実かどうかは不明である。\n当時香港に義勝という組織があったのは確かだが、Ｙ地区で活動した義勝との直接的な繋がりを証明するものは存在しない。\n構成員は香港や中国広東省出身の移民で、組織の規模はさほどではないが、苛烈な武闘派組織として恐れられていた。\n若くして指導者になったクリス・ツェーが、ＹＳを結成した際に吸収され、その時「義勝」という名の組織は消滅したが、現在もＹＳ内の派閥としてかたちを残している。"},"en":{"title":"Yisheng","text":"A gang organization that once existed in Y District.\nIt is said to have originated in Hong Kong and moved to Y District during Hong Kong’s handover.\nThe truth of this account is uncertain.\nAn organization called Yisheng unquestionably existed in Hong Kong at the time, but no evidence proves a direct connection with the group active in Y District.\nIts members were immigrants from Hong Kong and China’s Guangdong Province. Though not especially large, it was feared as an exceptionally violent militant organization.\nIts young leader, Chris Tse, absorbed it into YS when he founded that organization. Yisheng then ceased to exist as a separate group, but survives today as a faction within YS."}}],"70":[{"id":155,"needFiles":["A2-1","B1"],"andFlag":false,"priority":0,"ja":{"title":"シオクリーン","text":"Ｙ地区内のパラシュート通りに本社を置く企業。主にゴミ処理を行う。\n創業者は汐健慈朗で、現在も社長を務めている。\nＹ地区が今よりも治安が悪かった時代、公共のゴミ収集車が街に入れなかったため、その代わりとして地域内のゴミ処理を一手に請け負うことで急成長した。\n現在は当時ほど危険な地域ではなくなっているが、公共のゴミ収集車では収集不可能な廃棄物でも回収し、処理するため、相変わらず需要は高い。"},"en":{"title":"Shio Clean","text":"A company headquartered on Parachute Street in Y District, primarily engaged in waste disposal.\nIts founder, Kenjiro Shio, remains its president.\nWhen Y District was even more dangerous than it is today, municipal garbage trucks could not enter. Shio Clean grew rapidly by assuming sole responsibility for local waste collection.\nThough the area is now less dangerous, demand remains high because the company collects and processes waste that municipal services cannot handle."}}],"71":[{"id":156,"needFiles":["A1"],"andFlag":false,"priority":0,"ja":{"title":"グレートホール饅頭","text":"黒い餡を白いもっちりとした生地で包み、全体に白ゴマをまぶした菓子。\n製法は、小豆のこしあんをベースに、干し柿、ゴマ油、卵黄などを混ぜたものを餡とし、白玉粉と自然薯を擦ったものを混ぜて皮として被せ、全体に白ゴマをまぶしたのちに蒸し上げる。\n開発者は見土道夫。彼はこれをＹ地区の名産品として開発したが、原材料に地域の特産品を使っているわけでもなく、当地の要素はグレートホールという名称だけである。"},"en":{"title":"Great Hole Bun","text":"A confection consisting of dark filling wrapped in soft white dough and coated with white sesame seeds.\nThe filling combines strained red-bean paste with dried persimmon, sesame oil, egg yolk, and other ingredients. The wrapper is made from glutinous rice flour mixed with grated Japanese yam. The bun is then coated in white sesame and steamed.\nIts creator, Michio Mido, developed it as a specialty of Y District. None of its ingredients are local products, however, and its name is the only connection it has to the Great Hole."}}],"72":[{"id":157,"needFiles":["A2-2"],"andFlag":false,"priority":0,"ja":{"title":"タイプＢ傾向値","text":"ながらくミュータントの発生条件は全くの不明であったが、現在はタイプBはこの傾向値の測定方法が確立したことによって、一定の手がかりを得ている。\nテオドール・シュタイナー博士によって、タイプBの血液中には特殊なアミノ酸が含まれることが発見された。このアミノ酸は自然界の植物に含まれ、その生態ピラミッドに、食物連鎖による生体濃縮のような現象が見られることから、このアミノ酸生成に関わる安定した化学物質が存在すると推測されているが、まだ特定されていない。\nこのアミノ酸の血中濃度は数値で表され、一般的にはこれを「傾向値」あるいは「タイプB傾向値」と呼ぶ。\nこの傾向値が高いほど、タイプBとしての特性が強くあらわれ、発症しやすくなることがわかっている。"},"en":{"title":"Type B Tendency Value","text":"The conditions that produce mutants remained entirely unknown for many years, but the establishment of a method for measuring the Type B tendency value has now provided some clues.\nDr. Theodor Steiner discovered that Type B blood contains a special amino acid. This amino acid occurs in plants and appears to become concentrated up the ecological pyramid through a process resembling biomagnification along the food chain. Researchers therefore suspect that a stable chemical compound responsible for producing the amino acid exists, but it has not yet been identified.\nThe blood concentration of this amino acid is expressed numerically and is generally called the ‘tendency value’ or ‘Type B tendency value.’\nA higher index corresponds to more pronounced Type B characteristics and a greater likelihood that symptoms will manifest."}}],"73":[{"id":158,"needFiles":["E2","G2"],"andFlag":false,"priority":0,"ja":{"title":"リュウカ","text":"Y地区で起きた殺人事件の被害者。\n肉体をバラバラにされた。\nY地区の暗闇通りで生まれ、そのまま娼婦として働いていたが、その後児童施設の職員に転職する。\n向上心が強く、周りの人間から信頼されていたという。\n享年２７才。"},"en":{"title":"Ryuka","text":"A victim of a murder in Y District.\nHer body was dismembered.\nBorn on Darkness Street, she initially worked there as a prostitute before finding employment at a children’s home.\nShe was reportedly highly ambitious and trusted by those around her.\nAge at death: 27."}}],"74":[{"id":159,"needFiles":["A2-1"],"andFlag":false,"priority":0,"ja":{"title":"廖ファミリー","text":"Y地区に古くから存在するギャング組織。ＹＳ加盟組織の一つ。\n創設者である廖家は元々はシンガポールの華僑であり、そのルーツは客家に繋がるとされている。\nそのため、以前は組織の主要人物は客家系華僑でしめられていたが、廖志明が父の跡を継いでリーダーになると人種や国籍にかかわらず積極的に人材を取り入れたため、現在はほとんど偏りがみられなくなった。\nＹ地区の組織の多くが出身地や文化を同じくするものたちの集まりであるのと比べ、非常に能力主義的な組織であると言える。\n地域で最大の経済力を持つ組織であり、ＹＳに加盟後も順調に勢力を拡大している。"},"en":{"title":"Liao Family","text":"A longstanding gang organization in Y District and a member of YS.\nThe founding Liao family originally belonged to Singapore’s overseas Chinese community and is said to have Hakka roots.\nIts leading members were therefore once predominantly Hakka Chinese. After Liao Chi-ming succeeded his father as leader, however, he actively recruited talent regardless of race or nationality, leaving the organization with little discernible bias today.\nUnlike most Y District organizations, whose members share a common place of origin or culture, the Liao Family is exceptionally meritocratic.\nIt possesses the region’s greatest economic power and has continued expanding steadily since joining YS."}},{"id":160,"needFiles":["X3-2"],"andFlag":false,"priority":1,"ja":{"title":"廖ファミリー","text":"Y地区に存在していたギャング組織。\n創設者である廖家は元々はシンガポールの華僑であり、そのルーツは客家に繋がるとされている。\nそのため、以前は組織の主要人物は客家系華僑でしめられていたが、廖志明が父の跡を継いでリーダーになると人種や国籍にかかわらず積極的に人材を取り入れたため、現在はほとんど偏りがみられなくなった。\nＹ地区の組織の多くが出身地や文化を同じくするものたちの集まりであるのと比べ、非常に能力主義的な組織であると言える。\n地域で最大の経済力を持つ組織であり、ＹＳに加盟後も順調に勢力を拡大していた。\n廖志明の失脚により、ＹＳに正式に吸収されることになる。これにより、廖ファミリーという組織は形式的には消滅した。"},"en":{"title":"Liao Family","text":"A former gang organization in Y District.\nThe founding Liao family originally belonged to Singapore’s overseas Chinese community and is said to have Hakka roots.\nIts leading members were therefore once predominantly Hakka Chinese. After Liao Chi-ming succeeded his father as leader, however, he actively recruited talent regardless of race or nationality, leaving the organization with little discernible bias.\nUnlike most Y District organizations, whose members share a common place of origin or culture, the Liao Family was exceptionally meritocratic.\nIt possessed the region’s greatest economic power and continued expanding steadily after joining YS.\nFollowing Liao Chi-ming’s fall, YS formally absorbed the organization. The Liao Family thereby ceased to exist in an official capacity."}},{"id":161,"needFiles":["X17"],"andFlag":false,"priority":2,"ja":{"title":"廖ファミリー","text":"Y地区に存在していたギャング組織。\n創設者である廖家は元々はシンガポールの華僑であり、そのルーツは客家に繋がるとされている。\nそのため、以前は組織の主要人物は客家系華僑でしめられていたが、廖志明が父の跡を継いでリーダーになると人種や国籍にかかわらず積極的に人材を取り入れたため、現在はほとんど偏りがみられなくなった。\nＹ地区の組織の多くが出身地や文化を同じくするものたちの集まりであるのと比べ、非常に能力主義的な組織であると言える。\n地域で最大の経済力を持つ組織であり、ＹＳに加盟後も順調に勢力を拡大していた。\n廖志明の失脚により、ＹＳに正式に吸収され、ここで廖ファミリーという組織は形式的には消滅したが、トーマス・リャオがＹＳ龍頭になったため、実質的にはＹＳの主流派閥として存続している。"},"en":{"title":"Liao Family","text":"A former gang organization in Y District.\nThe founding Liao family originally belonged to Singapore’s overseas Chinese community and is said to have Hakka roots.\nIts leading members were therefore once predominantly Hakka Chinese. After Liao Chi-ming succeeded his father as leader, however, he actively recruited talent regardless of race or nationality, leaving the organization with little discernible bias.\nUnlike most Y District organizations, whose members share a common place of origin or culture, the Liao Family was exceptionally meritocratic.\nIt possessed the region’s greatest economic power and continued expanding steadily after joining YS.\nFollowing Liao Chi-ming’s fall, YS formally absorbed the organization. The Liao Family thereby ceased to exist in an official capacity, but Thomas Liao’s elevation to Longtou has allowed it to survive in practice as YS’s dominant faction."}}],"75":[{"id":162,"needFiles":["A2-1"],"andFlag":false,"priority":0,"ja":{"title":"フェルナンデスファミリー","text":"Y地区に古くから存在するギャング組織。ＹＳ加盟組織の一つ。\nジョゼ・フェルナンデスが同郷人たちを集めて創設した、南米人のためのファミリー。\n結束力が強く、冷酷であり、その戦闘力はＹ地区で最も恐れられていた。\nＹ地区自体が経済的発展を遂げるなか、その変化についていけずに若干勢いが落ちつつあるが、依然として街で恐れられる組織であることは間違いない。"},"en":{"title":"Fernandes Family","text":"A longstanding gang organization in Y District and a member of YS.\nJosé Fernandes founded the family for fellow immigrants from South America.\nFiercely united and ruthless, it once possessed the most feared combat force in Y District.\nIts strength has declined somewhat as Y District’s economy developed and left it behind, but it unquestionably remains one of the city’s most feared organizations."}},{"id":163,"needFiles":["X19"],"andFlag":false,"priority":1,"ja":{"title":"フェルナンデスファミリー","text":"Y地区に存在していたギャング組織。かつてはＹＳに加盟していた。\nジョゼ・フェルナンデスが同郷人たちを集めて創設した、南米人のためのファミリー。\n結束力が強く、冷酷であり、その戦闘力はＹ地区で最も恐れられていた。\nＹＳ創設者のクリス・ツェー死亡後にＹＳを離脱。\nその後、ジョゼ・フェルナンデスと、二人の娘がタイプＢの襲撃者によって殺害される。\n三女のリタ・フェルナンデスがリーダーとなるが、襲撃者を支持する八龍会との戦いのなかで組織を維持することが出来ず、彼女も殺害され、組織は壊滅する。"},"en":{"title":"Fernandes Family","text":"A former gang organization in Y District and former member of YS.\nJosé Fernandes founded the family for fellow immigrants from South America.\nFiercely united and ruthless, it once possessed the most feared combat force in Y District.\nIt withdrew from YS after the death of YS founder Chris Tse.\nJosé Fernandes and two of his daughters were subsequently murdered by a Type B attacker.\nHis youngest daughter, Rita Fernandes, assumed command. Unable to maintain the organization during its war with the Eight Dragons Society, which supported the attacker, she too was killed and the family was destroyed."}}],"76":[{"id":164,"needFiles":["A1"],"andFlag":false,"priority":0,"ja":{"title":"香港派","text":"ＹＳ全体の指揮・統括を行う首脳部のこと。\nその多くが、香港の義勝出身であるため、香港派、あるいは、旧義勝とも呼ばれる。"},"en":{"title":"Hong Kong Faction","text":"YS’s central leadership, responsible for directing and administering the organization as a whole.\nBecause most of its members came from Hong Kong’s Yisheng, it is also known as the Hong Kong Faction or Old Yisheng."}}],"77":[{"id":165,"needFiles":["A1"],"andFlag":false,"priority":0,"ja":{"title":"特質変異","text":"タイプＡ特有の肉体的特徴のこと。\nタイプＡはサイキックのあるなしに関わらず、肉体に変化があらわれる。これを特質変異と呼ぶ。\n特質変異は全てのタイプＡにあらわれるわけではないが、全体の八割ほどはなんらかの症状を持っていると言われている。\nそれは、ほんの小さな変化から、ほとんど人間と思えぬほど大がかりな変化まで、人それぞれで、規則性は発見されていない。\n時に差別や迫害の原因となり、異形を気に病んで自ら命を絶つものもいる。\nタイプBでは精神的な症状が深刻な問題とされているが、タイプＡではこの肉体の変化が深刻な問題となっている。"},"en":{"title":"Trait Mutation","text":"A physical characteristic unique to Type As.\nWhether or not they possess psychic abilities, Type As may undergo bodily changes known as trait mutations.\nThese mutations do not appear in every Type A, but approximately eighty percent are said to exhibit some form of symptom.\nThe changes vary between individuals, from the barely perceptible to alterations so extensive that the affected person hardly appears human. No governing pattern has been discovered.\nThey sometimes lead to discrimination and persecution, and some victims take their own lives in despair over their abnormal appearance.\nWhile mental symptoms are the gravest problem facing Type Bs, these bodily changes constitute a comparably serious problem for Type As."}}],"78":[{"id":166,"needFiles":["B1"],"andFlag":false,"priority":0,"ja":{"title":"金目","text":"タイプＢの蔑称。特有の金眼現象からそう呼ばれる。\nしばしば魚のキンメダイと混同され、トラブルが相次いだことから、国内の飲食店ではキンメダイの略称として「キンメ」を使うことはなくなった。"},"en":{"title":"Gold-Eye","text":"A slur for Type Bs, derived from their characteristic golden-eye phenomenon.\nThe Japanese term kinme was frequently confused with kinmedai, the splendid alfonsino, causing repeated misunderstandings. Restaurants in Japan consequently stopped using kinme as an abbreviation for the fish."}}],"79":[{"id":167,"needFiles":["A1"],"andFlag":false,"priority":0,"ja":{"title":"タキノ研究所","text":"日本に存在する私立研究所。\n主にミュータントの研究を行う。\n国立の研究機関で働いていた滝野正太郎博士がスポンサーの援助を得て設立した個人の研究施設。\n小規模ながら、多くの優秀な科学者が所属し、優れた業績を多数残している。\nタキノ式UB波感知器やAPTGは彼らの研究成果から生まれた製品であり、世界各国に普及している。\n滝野博士はタイプＡであると認識されているが、本人がそのことについて言及したことはない。"},"en":{"title":"Takino Research Institute","text":"A private research institute in Japan.\nIts primary field is mutant research.\nDr. Shotaro Takino, formerly employed at a national research institution, established this private facility with financial support from sponsors.\nDespite its modest size, it employs many gifted scientists and has produced numerous outstanding achievements.\nProducts derived from its research, including the Takino-Model UB-Wave Detector and APTG, have spread throughout the world.\nDr. Takino is widely believed to be Type A, but has never commented on the matter."}}],"80":[{"id":168,"needFiles":["A3"],"andFlag":false,"priority":0,"ja":{"title":"紅棍","text":"ＹＳの構成員のなかで、主に戦闘に携わる役職。\n数名の部下を与えられ、現場指揮官として働く。\n元々は義勝で用いられた言葉だが、ＹＳに引き継がれた。\n紅棍のなかでもっとも優れた者は双花紅棍と呼ばれる。"},"en":{"title":"Red Pole","text":"A YS position primarily assigned to members engaged in combat.\nA Red Pole commands several subordinates and serves as a field officer.\nThe term originated in Yisheng and was inherited by YS.\nThe finest among the Red Poles is known as the Double Flower Red Pole."}}],"81":[{"id":169,"needFiles":["x1"],"andFlag":false,"priority":0,"ja":{"title":"龍頭","text":"ＹＳの最高指導者の呼称。\n元々は義勝で用いられた言葉だが、ＹＳに引き継がれた。\n同じ意味の言葉として、山主という呼称もあるが、ＹＳではあまり使われない。"},"en":{"title":"Longtou","text":"The title of YS’s supreme leader.\nThe term originated in Yisheng and was inherited by YS.\nThe equivalent title ‘Mountain Master’ also exists, but is rarely used within YS."}}],"82":[{"id":170,"needFiles":["X11"],"andFlag":false,"priority":0,"ja":{"title":"内田広美","text":"国立巻河原病院に長期入院中の患者。\nまだ十代だが、症状の重いタイプB。妄想や幻覚が強い。\n保護室に出たり入ったりしている。\n担当看護師は能見美紗。"},"en":{"title":"Hiromi Uchida","text":"A long-term patient at National Makigawara Hospital.\nThough still in her teens, she is a Type B with severe symptoms, including pronounced delusions and hallucinations.\nShe is repeatedly admitted to and released from a seclusion room.\nHer assigned nurse is Misa Nomi."}},{"id":171,"needFiles":["X11"],"andFlag":false,"priority":1,"ja":{"title":"内田広美","text":"十代のタイプB。\n若くして症状が重く、国立巻河原病院に長期入院していたが、八龍解放軍によって病院から連れ出され、『ネオ・ローズ』を投与される。\nそれによって現在は症状が改善し、理性を取り戻している。\n職員たちを虐殺した八龍解放軍に対し、不信感を抱いている。"},"en":{"title":"Hiromi Uchida","text":"A Type B in her teens.\nHer condition became severe at a young age, resulting in prolonged hospitalization at National Makigawara Hospital. The Hachiryu Liberation Army removed her from the hospital and administered Neo Rose.\nHer symptoms have now improved, restoring her reason.\nShe distrusts the Liberation Army because it massacred the hospital staff."}},{"id":172,"needFiles":["X15-2"],"andFlag":false,"priority":2,"ja":{"title":"内田広美","text":"十代のタイプB。\n若くして症状が重く、国立巻河原病院に長期入院していたが、八龍解放軍によって病院から連れ出され、『ネオ・ローズ』を投与される。\nそれによって現在は症状が改善し、理性を取り戻している。\n職員たちを虐殺した八龍解放軍に対し不信感を抱いているため、彼らと合流せず、数年ぶりに実家に帰る。\nしかし、そこで目にしたのは、自分がぐちゃぐちゃにした家族が、幸せそうに暮らしている場面だった。\nY地区に戻り、自分に優しくしてくれた職員たちを殺害した八龍解放軍への復讐を計画する。\n見土道夫を殺害した後は、エリオットと共に姿を消す。"},"en":{"title":"Hiromi Uchida","text":"A Type B in her teens.\nHer condition became severe at a young age, resulting in prolonged hospitalization at National Makigawara Hospital. The Hachiryu Liberation Army removed her from the hospital and administered Neo Rose.\nHer symptoms improved, restoring her reason.\nDistrustful of the Liberation Army for massacring the hospital staff, she refused to join them and returned to her family home for the first time in years.\nThere she found the family she had mutilated living together in apparent happiness.\nShe returned to Y District and plotted revenge against the Liberation Army for murdering the staff members who had treated her kindly.\nAfter killing Michio Mido, she disappeared with Elliott."}}],"83":[{"id":173,"needFiles":["X2-1"],"andFlag":false,"priority":0,"ja":{"title":"能見美紗","text":"国立巻河原病院の若い看護師。\n患者にも職員にも評判が良い。内田広美の担当をしている。\nタイプB病棟に勤務することを、家族から反対されている。"},"en":{"title":"Misa Nomi","text":"A young nurse at National Makigawara Hospital.\nShe is well regarded by patients and staff alike, and is assigned to Hiromi Uchida.\nHer family opposes her work in the Type B ward."}},{"id":174,"needFiles":["X11"],"andFlag":false,"priority":1,"ja":{"title":"能見美紗","text":"国立巻河原病院の若い看護師。\n患者にも職員にも評判が良い。\nタイプB病棟に勤務することを、家族から反対されている。\n病院が見土道夫率いる八龍解放軍の襲撃を受けた際に殺害される。\n享年２６才。"},"en":{"title":"Misa Nomi","text":"A young nurse at National Makigawara Hospital.\nShe was well regarded by patients and staff alike.\nHer family opposed her work in the Type B ward.\nShe was killed when Michio Mido’s Hachiryu Liberation Army attacked the hospital.\nAge at death: 26."}}],"84":[{"id":175,"needFiles":["A2-1"],"andFlag":false,"priority":0,"ja":{"title":"マイケル・ツェー","text":"ＹＳの幹部の一人。香港派。クリス・ツェーの叔父。\n特別目立った能力などはないため、クリスとの血縁だけでその地位を築き上げたと思われがちだが、温厚で堅実な人柄は周囲の信頼を得ている。"},"en":{"title":"Michael Tse","text":"A YS executive, member of the Hong Kong Faction, and uncle of Chris Tse.\nBecause he possesses no especially conspicuous talents, he is often assumed to owe his position solely to his relationship with Chris. His mild, dependable character has nevertheless earned the trust of those around him."}},{"id":176,"needFiles":["A3","E3"],"andFlag":false,"priority":1,"ja":{"title":"マイケル・ツェー","text":"ＹＳ二代目龍頭。香港派。クリス・ツェーの叔父。\nクリスの要請に従い、彼の後継者として龍頭の地位につく。\nクリスの嫡子謝亮が龍頭につくまでの繋ぎとしての龍頭だが、本人はその立場に不満はないようだ。\n目立った能力はないが、温厚で堅実な人柄は周囲の信頼を得ている。"},"en":{"title":"Michael Tse","text":"The second Longtou of YS, a member of the Hong Kong Faction, and uncle of Chris Tse.\nAt Chris’s request, he succeeded his nephew as Longtou.\nHe serves as an interim leader until Chris’s legitimate son, Tse Leung, can assume the position, but appears entirely content with this role.\nThough he possesses no conspicuous talents, his mild, dependable character has earned the trust of those around him."}},{"id":177,"needFiles":["X3-2"],"andFlag":false,"priority":2,"ja":{"title":"マイケル・ツェー","text":"ＹＳの幹部の一人。香港派。\n龍頭の座を謝亮に譲ったあとは、第一線を離れた。\n龍頭時代に目立った功績はないが、混乱期のリーダーを無難に勤め上げた。\n今後は、その温厚で堅実な人柄に相応しく、穏やかに日々を過ごしてゆくのだろう。"},"en":{"title":"Michael Tse","text":"A YS executive and member of the Hong Kong Faction.\nAfter ceding the position of Longtou to Tse Leung, he withdrew from the front lines.\nThough he accomplished nothing especially conspicuous during his tenure, he capably led the organization through a period of turmoil.\nHis mild, dependable nature suggests that he will spend his remaining days in peace."}}],"85":[{"id":178,"needFiles":["x1"],"andFlag":false,"priority":0,"ja":{"title":"二路元帥","text":"ＹＳの役職の名前。\n龍頭に次ぐ地位であるが、龍頭の補佐官という意味合いが強く、廖家やフェルナンデス家などの他派閥のボスよりも立場が上というわけではない。\nＹＳは義勝時代の組織制度をそのまま引き継いでいるが、この役職名も当時から使われているものである。"},"en":{"title":"Second Route Marshal","text":"The name of a position within YS.\nThough second in rank only to the Longtou, the Second Route Marshal primarily serves as the Longtou’s aide and does not necessarily outrank the bosses of other factions, such as the Liao and Fernandes families.\nYS inherited its organizational system intact from Yisheng, including this title."}}],"86":[{"id":179,"needFiles":["B2","E3"],"andFlag":false,"priority":0,"ja":{"title":"灰上姉妹","text":"『ヘドロ団地』に暮らす高校生の双子姉妹。うり二つの外見で、他者が見分けることは困難。姉の璃映子はタイプAのサイキックで、妹の江梨子はタイプBで高い身体能力を持つ。謝亮や見土道夫らとは幼い頃からのつき合い。"},"en":{"title":"Haigami Sisters","text":"Twin high school students living in the Sludge Complex. Their appearances are identical, making it difficult for others to distinguish them. The elder sister, Rieko, is a Type A psychic; the younger, Eriko, is a Type B with exceptional physical abilities. They have known Tse Leung, Michio Mido, and the others since childhood."}}],"87":[{"id":181,"needFiles":["X6-1"],"andFlag":false,"priority":0,"ja":{"title":"ベルーハ","text":"元の名はアサヒ。ローズ・クラブで働いていたところ、太刀川良馬とクリス・ツェーによって救出され、先代エリー・ホワイトの元に預けられる。そのときエリーから「ベルーハ」という名を与えられる。老いたエリーの身のまわりの世話をしつつ、彼女の人生哲学を学んでいる。"},"en":{"title":"Belukha","text":"Originally named Asahi. While working at the Rose Club, she was rescued by Ryoma Tachikawa and Chris Tse and entrusted to the previous Ellie White. Ellie gave her the name Belukha. While caring for the aging Ellie, she studies her mentor’s philosophy of life."}},{"id":182,"needFiles":["X17"],"andFlag":false,"priority":1,"ja":{"title":"ベルーハ","text":"元々はローズ・クラブで働いていた少女アサヒ。その後、数奇な運命によって二代目エリー・ホワイトとなり、ＹＳの幹部にまで上り詰めた。現在は全ての立場を捨て、児童施設の経営を行っている。「ベルーハ」という名は、先代エリー・ホワイトから譲り受けた名前であり、また先代エリーの昔の名前でもあった。長きにわたり過去に囚われ続けているベルーハは、いつ前を向くことが出来るのだろうか。"},"en":{"title":"Belukha","text":"Originally Asahi, a girl who worked at the Rose Club. A strange turn of fate later made her the second Ellie White and carried her as far as YS’s leadership. She has now abandoned every former position and operates a children’s home. The name Belukha was given to her by the previous Ellie White and had once been Ellie’s own name. Belukha has remained trapped by her past for many years. When will she finally be able to face the future?"}}],"88":[{"id":185,"needFiles":["X17"],"andFlag":false,"priority":0,"ja":{"title":"アンドリュー・マオ","text":"ギャング組織「新義勝」の若きリーダー。風を巻き起こすサイキック能力があり、通称は「暴風のマオ」。Ｙ地区全体を巻き込んだ大抗争を引き起こした張本人。クリス・ツェーを崇拝し、Ｙ地区にクリス時代の繁栄を取り戻すことを目標にしている。気さくな人柄で、街の住人には非常に人気が高く、彼の願い通りクリス・ツェーの再来と言われはじめている。ヘドロ団地の深沢とは犬猿のなかだが、どうして彼らがそのような関係になったのかは明らかにされていない。現在Ｙ地区で最も注目されている人物。"},"en":{"title":"Andrew Mao","text":"The young leader of the gang organization New Yisheng. A psychic who can summon powerful winds, he is known as ‘Storm Mao.’ He instigated the great conflict engulfing all of Y District. He worships Chris Tse and aims to restore the prosperity the district enjoyed during Chris’s era. His friendly nature has made him exceptionally popular among the city’s residents, and people have begun calling him the second coming of Chris Tse, just as he desired. He and Satoshi Fukazawa of the Sludge Complex are bitter enemies, though the reason for their hostility has not been revealed. He is currently the most closely watched figure in Y District."}}],"89":[{"id":186,"needFiles":["B2"],"andFlag":false,"priority":0,"ja":{"title":"ミスター・アーノルド","text":"八龍会の創設者である三人の老人のうちの一人。白い肌を持っている。国籍や、Ｙ地区に来るまでの経歴の一切が謎に包まれている。厳格な雰囲気を漂わせる紳士。普段は自宅で他の老人たちと麻雀やゲームを楽しんでいる。好きな麻雀の役は『立直』。"},"en":{"title":"Mr. Arnold","text":"One of the three Elders who founded the Eight Dragons Society. He has white skin. His nationality and everything he did before coming to Y District remain shrouded in mystery. He is a gentleman with a stern bearing. He ordinarily spends his time at home playing mahjong and other games with the other Elders. His favorite mahjong hand is Riichi."}},{"id":187,"needFiles":["B6"],"andFlag":false,"priority":1,"ja":{"title":"ミスター・アーノルド","text":"八龍会の創設者である三人の老人のうちの一人。白い肌を持っている。国籍や、Ｙ地区に来るまでの経歴の一切が謎に包まれている。厳格な雰囲気を漂わせる紳士。タイプＢではないという事実を八龍解放軍リーダーの見土道夫に暴かれ、八龍会を追放される。好きな麻雀の役は『立直』。"},"en":{"title":"Mr. Arnold","text":"One of the three Elders who founded the Eight Dragons Society. He has white skin. His nationality and everything he did before coming to Y District remain shrouded in mystery. He is a gentleman with a stern bearing. Michio Mido, leader of the Hachiryu Liberation Army, exposed the fact that he was not Type B, and he was expelled from the Society. His favorite mahjong hand is Riichi."}},{"id":189,"needFiles":["X16"],"andFlag":false,"priority":2,"ja":{"title":"ミスター・アーノルド","text":"八龍会の創設者である三人の老人のうちの一人。白い肌を持っている。国籍や、Ｙ地区に来るまでの経歴の一切が謎に包まれている。厳格な雰囲気を漂わせる紳士。タイプＢではないという事実を八龍解放軍リーダーの見土道夫に暴かれ、一時は八龍会を追放されていたが、再び権力の座に返り咲き、自分たちを追い出した解放軍を壊滅させる。好きな麻雀の役は『立直』。"},"en":{"title":"Mr. Arnold","text":"One of the three Elders who founded the Eight Dragons Society. He has white skin. His nationality and everything he did before coming to Y District remain shrouded in mystery. He is a gentleman with a stern bearing. Michio Mido, leader of the Hachiryu Liberation Army, exposed the fact that he was not Type B, and he was temporarily expelled from the Society. He later returned to power and destroyed the Liberation Army that had ousted him. His favorite mahjong hand is Riichi."}}],"90":[{"id":190,"needFiles":["B2"],"andFlag":false,"priority":0,"ja":{"title":"ミスター・チェン","text":"八龍会の創設者である三人の老人のうちの一人。東洋人風の容貌を持っている。国籍や、Ｙ地区に来るまでの経歴の一切が謎に包まれている。わざとらしい片言の日本語をあやつる。普段は自宅で他の老人たちと麻雀やゲームを楽しんでいる。好きな麻雀の役は『断么九』。"},"en":{"title":"Mr. Chen","text":"One of the three Elders who founded the Eight Dragons Society. He has East Asian features. His nationality and everything he did before coming to Y District remain shrouded in mystery. He speaks deliberately affected, broken Japanese. He ordinarily spends his time at home playing mahjong and other games with the other Elders. His favorite mahjong hand is All Simples."}},{"id":191,"needFiles":["B6"],"andFlag":false,"priority":1,"ja":{"title":"ミスター・チェン","text":"八龍会の創設者である三人の老人のうちの一人。東洋人風の容貌を持っている。国籍や、Ｙ地区に来るまでの経歴の一切が謎に包まれている。わざとらしい片言の日本語をあやつる。タイプＢではないという事実を八龍解放軍リーダーの見土道夫に暴かれ、八龍会を追放される。好きな麻雀の役は『断么九』。"},"en":{"title":"Mr. Chen","text":"One of the three Elders who founded the Eight Dragons Society. He has East Asian features. His nationality and everything he did before coming to Y District remain shrouded in mystery. He speaks deliberately affected, broken Japanese. Michio Mido, leader of the Hachiryu Liberation Army, exposed the fact that he was not Type B, and he was expelled from the Society. His favorite mahjong hand is All Simples."}},{"id":192,"needFiles":["X16"],"andFlag":false,"priority":2,"ja":{"title":"ミスター・チェン","text":"八龍会の創設者である三人の老人のうちの一人。東洋人風の容貌を持っている。国籍や、Ｙ地区に来るまでの経歴の一切が謎に包まれている。わざとらしい片言の日本語をあやつる。タイプＢではないという事実を八龍解放軍リーダーの見土道夫に暴かれ、一時は八龍会を追放されていたが、再び権力の座に返り咲き、自分たちを追い出した解放軍を壊滅させる。好きな麻雀の役は『断么九』。"},"en":{"title":"Mr. Chen","text":"One of the three Elders who founded the Eight Dragons Society. He has East Asian features. His nationality and everything he did before coming to Y District remain shrouded in mystery. He speaks deliberately affected, broken Japanese. Michio Mido, leader of the Hachiryu Liberation Army, exposed the fact that he was not Type B, and he was temporarily expelled from the Society. He later returned to power and destroyed the Liberation Army that had ousted him. His favorite mahjong hand is All Simples."}}],"91":[{"id":193,"needFiles":["B2"],"andFlag":false,"priority":0,"ja":{"title":"ミスター・スミス","text":"八龍会の創設者である三人の老人のうちの一人。黒い肌を持っている。国籍や、Ｙ地区に来るまでの経歴の一切が謎に包まれている。寡黙で必要な時しか口を開かない。普段は自宅で他の老人たちと麻雀やゲームを楽しんでいる。好きな麻雀の役は『国士無双』。"},"en":{"title":"Mr. Smith","text":"One of the three Elders who founded the Eight Dragons Society. He has black skin. His nationality and everything he did before coming to Y District remain shrouded in mystery. Taciturn, he speaks only when necessary. He ordinarily spends his time at home playing mahjong and other games with the other Elders. His favorite mahjong hand is Thirteen Orphans."}},{"id":194,"needFiles":["B6"],"andFlag":false,"priority":1,"ja":{"title":"ミスター・スミス","text":"八龍会の創設者である三人の老人のうちの一人。黒い肌を持っている。国籍や、Ｙ地区に来るまでの経歴の一切が謎に包まれている。寡黙で必要な時しか口を開かない。タイプＢではないという事実を八龍解放軍リーダーの見土道夫に暴かれ、八龍会を追放される。好きな麻雀の役は『国士無双』。"},"en":{"title":"Mr. Smith","text":"One of the three Elders who founded the Eight Dragons Society. He has black skin. His nationality and everything he did before coming to Y District remain shrouded in mystery. Taciturn, he speaks only when necessary. Michio Mido, leader of the Hachiryu Liberation Army, exposed the fact that he was not Type B, and he was expelled from the Society. His favorite mahjong hand is Thirteen Orphans."}},{"id":195,"needFiles":["X16"],"andFlag":false,"priority":2,"ja":{"title":"ミスター・スミス","text":"八龍会の創設者である三人の老人のうちの一人。黒い肌を持っている。国籍や、Ｙ地区に来るまでの経歴の一切が謎に包まれている。寡黙で必要な時しか口を開かない。タイプＢではないという事実を八龍解放軍リーダーの見土道夫に暴かれ、一時は八龍会を追放されていたが、再び権力の座に返り咲き、自分たちを追い出した解放軍を壊滅させる。好きな麻雀の役は『国士無双』。"},"en":{"title":"Mr. Smith","text":"One of the three Elders who founded the Eight Dragons Society. He has black skin. His nationality and everything he did before coming to Y District remain shrouded in mystery. Taciturn, he speaks only when necessary. Michio Mido, leader of the Hachiryu Liberation Army, exposed the fact that he was not Type B, and he was temporarily expelled from the Society. He later returned to power and destroyed the Liberation Army that had ousted him. His favorite mahjong hand is Thirteen Orphans."}}],"92":[{"id":196,"needFiles":["X2-1"],"andFlag":false,"priority":0,"ja":{"title":"水村舞子","text":"国立巻河原病院B病棟三階の看護師。能見美紗の同僚。職場の看護師のなかでは最年少の部類で、年の近い美紗とは親しくしている。タイプＢ病棟での勤務に不満があり、常に愚痴っているが、患者への対応は適切できめ細かく、周囲の評価は高い。少女時代は看護師が希望の職業だったわけではなく、アイドルを目指していたようだ。"},"en":{"title":"Maiko Mizumura","text":"A nurse on the third floor of Ward B at National Makigawara Hospital and a colleague of Misa Nomi. One of the youngest nurses on staff, she is close to Misa, who is near her own age. She dislikes working in the Type B ward and complains constantly, but her treatment of patients is appropriate and attentive, earning her an excellent reputation. Nursing was apparently not her childhood ambition; she once hoped to become an idol."}},{"id":197,"needFiles":["C4"],"andFlag":false,"priority":1,"ja":{"title":"水村舞子","text":"国立巻河原病院B病棟三階の看護師。能見美紗の同僚。職場の看護師のなかでは最年少の部類で、年の近い美紗とは親しくしている。タイプＢ病棟での勤務に不満があり、常に愚痴っているが、患者への対応は適切できめ細かく、周囲の評価は高い。少女時代は看護師が希望の職業だったわけではなく、アイドルを目指していたようだ。八龍会解放軍の襲撃により死亡。殺害される最後の瞬間まで患者の世話をしていたらしい。享年２４才。"},"en":{"title":"Maiko Mizumura","text":"A nurse on the third floor of Ward B at National Makigawara Hospital and a colleague of Misa Nomi. One of the youngest nurses on staff, she was close to Misa, who was near her own age. She disliked working in the Type B ward and complained constantly, but her treatment of patients was appropriate and attentive, earning her an excellent reputation. Nursing was apparently not her childhood ambition; she once hoped to become an idol. She died during the Hachiryu Liberation Army’s attack, reportedly caring for patients until the final moment before she was killed.\nAge at death: 24."}}],"93":[{"id":198,"needFiles":["X2-1"],"andFlag":false,"priority":0,"ja":{"title":"林田雄一","text":"国立巻河原病院B病棟三階の看護助手。能見美紗の同僚。スポーツマンでさわやかな人柄。患者の扱いが上手く、興奮状態でも、彼の言うことなら聞くという患者も多い。看護助手という立場だが、看護師のみならず、医師からも信頼されている。病院に来る前はマリンスポーツグッズを売る店で働くサーファーだったようだ。"},"en":{"title":"Yuichi Hayashida","text":"A nursing assistant on the third floor of Ward B at National Makigawara Hospital and a colleague of Misa Nomi. Athletic and personable, he handles patients well. Many obey him even when agitated. Though only a nursing assistant, he is trusted by both nurses and physicians. Before joining the hospital, he was apparently a surfer employed at a marine-sports shop."}},{"id":199,"needFiles":["C4"],"andFlag":false,"priority":1,"ja":{"title":"林田雄一","text":"国立巻河原病院B病棟三階の看護助手。能見美紗の同僚。スポーツマンでさわやかな人柄。患者の扱いが上手く、興奮状態でも、彼の言うことなら聞くという患者も多い。看護助手という立場だが、看護師のみならず、医師からも信頼されている。病院に来る前はマリンスポーツグッズを売る店で働くサーファーだったようだ。八龍解放軍の襲撃により死亡。享年３０才。"},"en":{"title":"Yuichi Hayashida","text":"A nursing assistant on the third floor of Ward B at National Makigawara Hospital and a colleague of Misa Nomi. Athletic and personable, he handled patients well. Many obeyed him even when agitated. Though only a nursing assistant, he was trusted by both nurses and physicians. Before joining the hospital, he was apparently a surfer employed at a marine-sports shop. He died during the Hachiryu Liberation Army’s attack.\nAge at death: 30."}}],"94":[{"id":200,"needFiles":["X2-1"],"andFlag":false,"priority":0,"ja":{"title":"吉田主任","text":"国立巻河原病院B病棟三階の看護師。主任を務めている。彼女より年長の看護師が多い病棟だが、リーダーシップを発揮し、うまく病棟をまとめている。"},"en":{"title":"Chief Yoshida","text":"The charge nurse on the third floor of Ward B at National Makigawara Hospital. Though many nurses in the ward are older than she is, her leadership keeps the unit functioning smoothly."}},{"id":201,"needFiles":["X11"],"andFlag":false,"priority":1,"ja":{"title":"吉田主任","text":"国立巻河原病院B病棟三階の看護師。主任を務めている。彼女より年長の看護師が多い病棟だが、リーダーシップを発揮し、うまく病棟をまとめている。解放軍の襲撃により死亡。享年４１才。"},"en":{"title":"Chief Yoshida","text":"The charge nurse on the third floor of Ward B at National Makigawara Hospital. Though many nurses in the ward were older than she was, her leadership kept the unit functioning smoothly. She died during the Liberation Army’s attack.\nAge at death: 41."}}],"95":[{"id":202,"needFiles":["X2-1"],"andFlag":false,"priority":0,"ja":{"title":"金眼現象","text":"単に『金眼（きんがん）』とも。タイプBを象徴づける現象である。タイプBは平常時はノーマルと全く区別がつかないが、時折瞳が金色に変化する。特に、本人の感情が著しく興奮した時や、幻覚などの精神症状があらわれた際に発現しやすい。金眼現象が現れたタイプBは、通常時より身体能力が高まる。（人によってその上昇幅は様々で、ほとんど通常時と変わらない者もいるが）このような特徴をもつ現象であるため、世間一般では、目が金色になったタイプBは大変危険な状態であるとされ、長い間差別や恐怖の対象となり、「金目（きんめ）」と蔑まれて来た。"},"en":{"title":"Golden-Eye Phenomenon","text":"Also called simply ‘golden eyes.’ This phenomenon is the defining symbol of Type Bs. Under ordinary conditions, a Type B is indistinguishable from a Normal, but the irises occasionally turn gold. The change occurs especially readily during intense emotional excitement or the onset of mental symptoms such as hallucinations.\nA Type B displaying the golden-eye phenomenon possesses greater physical ability than usual, though the degree varies between individuals and is negligible in some cases. Because of these characteristics, the public considers a Type B with golden eyes extremely dangerous. Type Bs were consequently subjected to fear and discrimination for many years and derided with the slur ‘Gold-Eye.’"}}],"96":[{"id":203,"needFiles":["X8"],"andFlag":false,"priority":0,"ja":{"title":"エンゾ・アラーニャ・エ・シウバ","text":"フェルナンデス・ファミリーの古参幹部。ジョゼ・フェルナンデスの右腕として、ファミリーの様々な決定に関与している。組織が活動を開始した頃から家族ぐるみのつき合いをしており、フェルナンデス家の三姉妹にとっても親戚のような存在。ジョゼ・フェルナンデスの死後は、リタ・フェルナンデスの補佐役をつとめている。"},"en":{"title":"Enzo Aranha e Silva","text":"A veteran executive of the Fernandes Family. As José Fernandes’s right-hand man, he participates in the family’s major decisions. His own family has associated closely with the Fernandes household since the organization began operating, and the three Fernandes sisters regard him almost as a relative. After José Fernandes’s death, he serves as Rita Fernandes’s adviser."}},{"id":204,"needFiles":["X19"],"andFlag":false,"priority":1,"ja":{"title":"エンゾ・アラーニャ・エ・シウバ","text":"フェルナンデス・ファミリーの古参幹部。ジョゼ・フェルナンデスの右腕として、ファミリーの様々な決定に関与している。組織が活動を開始した頃から家族ぐるみのつき合いをしており、フェルナンデス家の三姉妹にとっても親戚のような存在。ジョゼ・フェルナンデスの死後は、リタ・フェルナンデスの補佐役となった。八龍解放軍の襲撃時、リタを逃がした後に殺害される。享年４９才。"},"en":{"title":"Enzo Aranha e Silva","text":"A veteran executive of the Fernandes Family. As José Fernandes’s right-hand man, he participated in the family’s major decisions. His own family had associated closely with the Fernandes household since the organization began operating, and the three Fernandes sisters regarded him almost as a relative. After José Fernandes’s death, he became Rita Fernandes’s adviser. During the Hachiryu Liberation Army’s attack, he helped Rita escape and was then killed.\nAge at death: 49."}}],"97":[{"id":205,"needFiles":["A2-2"],"andFlag":false,"priority":0,"ja":{"title":"特殊タイプB","text":"非常に高い傾向値を持ったタイプB。その特徴も強化されている。特に回復力はほとんど通常のタイプBと別物と言えるほど強化されており、身体を引き裂かれても、ほんの僅かな細胞から肉体を再生することが出来る。その様子は、ほぼ「不死身」と呼んでも差し支えないだろう。"},"en":{"title":"Special Type B","text":"A Type B with an exceptionally high tendency value and correspondingly intensified characteristics. Regenerative ability is especially enhanced, to the point of being almost wholly different from that of an ordinary Type B. Even after the body is torn apart, it can regenerate from only a few surviving cells. Such a being can fairly be described as nearly ‘immortal.’"}},{"id":206,"needFiles":["F4"],"andFlag":false,"priority":1,"ja":{"title":"特殊タイプB","text":"非常に高い傾向値を持ったタイプB。その特徴も強化されている。特に回復力はほとんど非常に高い傾向値を持ったタイプB。その特徴も強化されている。特に回復力はほとんど通常のタイプBと別物と言えるほど強化されており、身体を引き裂かれても、ほんの僅かな細胞から肉体を再生することが出来る。その様子は、ほぼ「不死身」と呼んでも差し支えないだろう。ただし、完全な不死身というわけではなく、「ローズ」または「ネオ・ローズ」を投与することによって、その再生を阻害出来る。特殊タイプBの血液を摂取した者は、特殊タイプBになる可能性があることがわかっている。"},"en":{"title":"Special Type B","text":"A Type B with an exceptionally high tendency value and correspondingly intensified characteristics. Regenerative ability is especially enhanced, to the point of being almost wholly different from that of an ordinary Type B. Even after the body is torn apart, it can regenerate from only a few surviving cells. Such a being can fairly be described as nearly ‘immortal.’\nThis immortality is not absolute: administering Rose or Neo Rose can inhibit regeneration. It is also known that someone who ingests the blood of a Special Type B may become one in turn."}},{"id":207,"needFiles":["X17"],"andFlag":false,"priority":2,"ja":{"title":"特殊タイプB","text":"非常に高い傾向値を持ったタイプB。その特徴も強化されている。特に回復力はほとんど通常のタイプBと別物と言えるほど強化されており、身体を引き裂かれても、ほんの僅かな細胞から肉体を再生することが出来る。その様子は、ほぼ「不死身」と呼んでも差し支えないだろう。ただし、完全な不死身というわけではなく、「ローズ」または「ネオ・ローズ」を投与することによって、その再生を阻害出来る。特殊タイプBの血液を摂取した者は、特殊タイプBになる可能性があることがわかっている。現在Y地区には数人の特殊タイプBがいるが、その血液の元を辿れば全員がコシチェイに辿り着く。"},"en":{"title":"Special Type B","text":"A Type B with an exceptionally high tendency value and correspondingly intensified characteristics. Regenerative ability is especially enhanced, to the point of being almost wholly different from that of an ordinary Type B. Even after the body is torn apart, it can regenerate from only a few surviving cells. Such a being can fairly be described as nearly ‘immortal.’\nThis immortality is not absolute: administering Rose or Neo Rose can inhibit regeneration. It is also known that someone who ingests the blood of a Special Type B may become one in turn.\nSeveral Special Type Bs currently live in Y District, but tracing the source of their blood leads back to Koschei in every case."}}],"98":[{"id":212,"needFiles":["F4"],"andFlag":false,"priority":0,"ja":{"title":"アレクサンドル","text":"アレクサンドル・ヤコヴレヴィチ・チェルヌイフ。大量殺人鬼『コシチェイ』の正体であるサーシェンカの本名。"},"en":{"title":"Aleksandr","text":"Aleksandr Yakovlevich Chernykh. The real name of Sashenka, the true identity of the mass murderer Koschei."}}]}};
